INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3652,3652,'en','Red cabbage & blood orange tabbouleh','Enjoy this vibrant tabbouleh salad with your favourite grills. With red cabbage, dried cranberries and pomegranate seeds, it’s perfect at Christmas','["200g bulgur wheat","50g dried cranberries","1 lemon , zested and juiced","1 shallot , finely sliced","½ red cabbage , finely sliced","small handful of parsley , finely chopped","small handful of mint sprigs , leaves picked and finely chopped","2 blood oranges , peel and pith removed and cut into thin slices","75g pomegranate seeds","75g walnuts , roughly chopped","¼ tsp ground cinnamon","¼ tsp ground cumin","1 blood orange , juiced","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses","½ tsp caster sugar","50ml olive oil"]','["Put the bulgur and cranberries in a heatproof bowl and pour over enough boiling water to cover by about 2cm. Cover the bowl and soak for 15 mins. Drain and transfer to a serving bowl. Add the lemon zest, shallots and cabbage. Toss well.","Pour the lemon juice into a small bowl with the dressing ingredients, except the oil. Stir well, then pour in the oil slowly, whisking continuously until combined. Season to taste.","Add the parsley, mint and blood oranges to the bulgur mixture with most of the pomegranate seeds and walnuts. Toss everything together with the dressing and season to taste again. Serve in a big bowl with the remaining pomegranate seeds and walnuts scattered over the top."]','2026-01-10 12:12:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3654,3654,'en','Miso-glazed carrots with whipped ricotta dip','Try these moreish miso-glazed carrots with creamy ricotta dip and crushed pistachios topping. It will make a great addition to a Christmas party platter','["1kg carrots , halved or quartered if thick","½ tbsp olive oil","75g butter","1 tbsp sesame oil","3 garlic cloves , crushed","½ tbsp red miso","½ tsp chilli flakes","2 tbsp honey","250g ricotta","½ lemon , zested and juiced","1 tbsp olive oil","25g pistachios , roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the carrots into a roasting tray with some seasoning and the olive oil. Toss together and roast for 15 mins until very lightly browned.","Meanwhile, heat the butter and sesame oil in a saucepan over a medium heat. Once melted and foaming, whisk in the garlic, miso, chilli flakes and honey. Cook for 2-3 mins until reduced and slightly thickened. Pour this over the roasted carrots and stir well so they are well coated. Return to the oven and roast for a further 30 mins.","To make the dip, stir together the ricotta, lemon zest and olive oil until smooth. Season to taste with salt, pepper and lemon juice. Spread over a serving platter and top with the warm carrots, drizzling any roasting juices over the top. Scatter over the pistachios to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3656,3656,'en','Angela Hartnett’s queen of puddings','I love a queen of puddings. Breadcrumbs, soaked in milk, vanilla flavoured egg, jam on top and then meringue. And when made well, it’s delicious. It’s also a great way to use up old bread or leftover jams, so it’s basically a store cupboard essential. Don’t use a sugary jam as the whole thing will then become overpoweringly sweet.','["25g unsalted butter , plus extra for greasing","570ml whole milk","100g caster sugar","3 eggs , separated","finely grated zest of 1 unwaxed lemon","5 tbsp raspberry jam","single cream , to serve"]','["Preheat the oven to 170°C/150°C fan/Gas 3 and grease a 24cm oval oven-proof serving dish with a little butter.","Heat the milk a saucepan over a low heat until gently warmed. Put the breadcrumbs into a bowl, pour over the milk and leave the breadcrumbs to soak for 30 minutes until all the liquid has been absorbed.","Beat the egg yolks lightly with a fork, then add them to the soaked breadcrumbs along with 50g of the caster sugar, the 25g of butter and the lemon zest. Stir to combine thoroughly then transfer to the serving dish and bake for 20-25 minutes, until golden brown and set. Remove from the oven and leave to cool.","Reduce the oven temperature to 140°C/120°C fan/Gas 1.","Gently warm the jam in a small pan to loosen it and spread evenly over the set breadcrumbs.","Tip the egg whites into a clean bowl and, using a handheld electric whisk, whisk to soft peaks. Add the remaining 175g of caster sugar a little at a time, whisking between each addition, until you have a lovely, glossy meringue that holds soft peaks. Spoon the meringue over the top of the jam, using the spoon to make little peaks - like the peaks of the queen''s crown - or you can put the meringue into a piping bag and pipe it over the top.","Bake the pudding for a further 30 minutes, until the meringue is golden brown. Serve with cream while still warm."]','2026-01-10 12:12:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3658,3658,'en','Smashed potato, dill, feta & pickled red onion salad','Look for Morrisons Market Street baby potatoes to make this salad with tangy feta – it works well as a side with grilled meat or fish','["1 red onion , finely sliced","3 tbsp red or white wine vinegar","1 tsp caster sugar","750g Morrisons Market Street baby potatoes","4 tbsp olive oil , plus a little extra for the baking tray","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 tsp Dijon mustard","½ small bunch of dill , finely chopped","100g feta , crumbled"]','["Put the onion in a small, non-metallic bowl, and add the vinegar, sugar, a pinch of salt and 2 tbsp boiling water from the kettle. Cover and leave to pickle for at least 30 mins.","Cook the potatoes in a pan of boiling salted water for 15-20 mins until tender – a cutlery knife should be able to pierce them easily. Drain well. Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Tip the potatoes into a roasting tray and press down using the oiled base of a glass, ramekin or spatula until the potatoes are squashed. Ensure the potatoes are in a single layer on the tray, then drizzle over the 4 tbsp olive oil and season. Roast for 20-25 mins until golden and crisp at the edges.","Drain the pickled onions, reserving the pickling liquid. Whisk the extra virgin olive oil, Dijon mustard and most of the dill into the reserved liquid. Tip the smashed potatoes onto a serving platter. Crumble over the feta and pour over the dressing. Scatter over the remaining dill and the pickled onions."]','2026-01-10 12:12:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3660,3660,'en','Lemon orzo','Make this orzo to use as a base. Put aside time at the weekend to make it, then serve it later in the week using our recipe ideas below','["50g butter","500g orzo","2 chicken stock cubes","1 lemon , zested","large handful of finely chopped soft herbs , such as chives, dill and basil","good squeeze of lemon juice"]','["Heat the butter in a frying pan on a medium heat. Tip in the orzo and stir well to combine. Toast for 4-5 mins until golden, then crumble over the chicken stock cubes.","Increase the heat to high and pour over 1.3 litres of boiling water and cook for 10 mins until tender, adding a splash more water if needed.","Set aside to cool to room temperature, then stir in the lemon zest and finely chopped soft herbs. Season to taste and add a good squeeze of the lemon juice. Leave to cool, then transfer to airtight containers and set aside in the fridge until needed. Will keep chilled for up to four days.Use this to make our lemon orzo with trout, or marinated chicken with orzo & feta."]','2026-01-10 12:12:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3662,3662,'en','Olive bread','Bake a loaf studded with green and black olives to enjoy simply spread with butter, or for dunking into soup or a Mediterranean-style stew','["7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","550g strong white bread flour , plus extra for dusting","1½ tsp fine sea salt","1 tbsp dried oregano","100g pitted green olives , roughly chopped, plus 1 tbsp brine","100g pitted black olives , roughly chopped","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","semolina , for dusting"]','["Tip the yeast, flour, salt, dried oregano, olives, olive brine and olive oil into a stand mixer fitted with a dough hook, along with 300ml warm water. Mix on low speed for 8-10 mins until you have a smooth, elastic dough. Line a bowl with a clean tea towel. Form the dough into a ball, then transfer to the bowl, seam-side up. Cover and chill for at least a few hours until doubled in size, or up to 24 hrs (the longer it proves, the deeper the flavour will be).","When ready to bake, heat the oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 9 with a large, lidded casserole dish inside for 30 mins. Take the lid off the casserole dish and sprinkle some semolina over a large sheet of baking parchment. Carefully transfer the dough, seam-side down, to the baking parchment. Remove the casserole dish from the oven and put the dough in it, then cover with the lid. Bake for 40 mins, then remove the lid and bake for a further 10 mins until the loaf is golden brown and the base is hollow when tapped. Will keep covered at room temperature for up to three days or chilled for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:12:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3664,3664,'en','Ginger & cardamom poached nectarines','Showcase seasonal nectarines with a touch of spice in a fragrant rose syrup. Enjoy with ice cream, cream or mascarpone','["12 green cardamom pods","200g granulated sugar","30g fresh ginger , cut into 2cm thick slices and bashed","4 large firm, just-ripe nectarines , washed, halved, and pitted",", whipped cream, clotted cream, or mascarpone (or vegan alternative), to serve"]','["Crush the cardamom using a pestle and mortar. Once the seeds have been released, reserve the pods and bash the seeds to a coarse powder.","In a wide saucepan (large enough to accommodate the halved nectarines in a single layer), combine 625ml water, the sugar, half of the ginger, half of the cardamom pods and crushed seeds, and a pinch of salt. Bring to the boil over a medium-high heat, stirring occasionally, until the sugar dissolves, around 8-10 mins.","Reduce the heat to medium-low, and, using a slotted spoon, carefully add the nectarines, cut-side down, to the syrup. Poach for about 3 mins, then gently turn over with the slotted spoon – the syrup will begin to change colour, turning light pink. Continue poaching for 3-4 mins, or until just soft – a sharp knife in the centre should slip in easily with only a touch of resistance. The skins may also begin to slip off. The cooking time will vary depending on the size and ripeness of the fruit.","Using a slotted spoon, transfer the nectarines to a container large enough for both the fruit and the syrup. Leave until cool enough to handle and, if you like, gently remove the skins and discard.","Bring the syrup to the boil over a medium-high heat until reduced and somewhat syrupy, about 10 mins. Turn off the heat and stir in the remaining ginger, cardamom seeds and pods. Cover and leave to cool to room temperature.","Strain the syrup through a fine-mesh strainer into the container with the nectarines. Cover and chill for at least 30 mins. Will keep chilled for up to three days. Serve the nectarines with syrup either warm, at room temperature, or chilled with your choice of ice cream, cream or mascarpone."]','2026-01-10 12:12:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3666,3666,'en','Sweet melon, curry leaf & burrata salad','Make this salad once and you’ll be making it all summer. Melon, curry leaf and burrata may be an unlikely combo, but it’s sweet, spicy, creamy and aromatic','["1 ripe melon , or a mixture of honeydew and cantaloupe works well (about 700g in total, prepared weight)","1 banana shallot , finely sliced","2 burrata balls (125g each)","5 tbsp olive oil","10 fresh curry leaves","2 tsp nigella seeds","1 green chilli , deseeded and finely chopped","3 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 tsp honey"]','["For the dressing, heat the oil in a small frying pan over a medium heat. Add the curry leaves and sizzle for 1-2 mins until aromatic (be careful as they will splutter). Add the nigella seeds for the final 30 seconds. Pour the hot oil, curry leaves and seeds into a bowl and leave to cool.","Mix the remaining ingredients for the dressing into the curry leaf oil and season well.","Arrange the melon and shallots on a platter, drizzle with most of the dressing and lightly toss together with your hands. Leave to macerate for 20-30 mins at room temperature.","Nestle the burrata into the salad, gently tear each ball open and season with a little flaky sea salt. Spoon over the remaining dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:12:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3668,3668,'en','Crispy mushroom tacos with pickled chillies','Serve these tacos with creamy avocado and zingy pickled chillies. Roast a variety of mushrooms to introduce a meaty texture to the dish','["600g mushrooms , torn (we used a mix of chestnut, king oyster, oyster, enoki and button)","1 red onion , sliced into thin wedges","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp dried coriander","2 tsp dried mint","150g Greek-style yogurt","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","10g chives , finely sliced","12 corn tortillas","1 avocado , sliced, to serve","2 red chillies , finely sliced","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","1 lime , juiced","1 tsp caster sugar"]','["Start by making the pickled chillies. Put the chillies in a small bowl, pour over the white wine vinegar, lime juice and caster sugar, along with a pinch of salt. Set aside for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, heat the oven to 220C/200C/gas 7. Scatter the mushrooms and red onion in a roasting tin, drizzle with oil, then sprinkle with the coriander, mint and salt and pepper. Roast for 20-25 mins until golden, crisp and shrunken, stirring halfway.","Mix the yogurt with the white wine vinegar and chives and season with salt, pepper and a pinch of sugar.","Warm the tortillas in the oven for a few minutes, then pile on the mushrooms, some herby yogurt and avocado, and scatter over the pickled chillies."]','2026-01-10 12:12:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3670,3670,'en','Smoky new potatoes with charred spring onions','Serve this new potatoes side as part of a barbecue spread. It pairs perfectly with our maple & mustard glazed spatchcock chicken recipe','["1.2kg new potatoes , halved, large  ones quartered","6 spring onions , trimmed","2 tbsp olive oil","50g unsalted butter","wood chips (optional)"]','["Tip the potatoes into a pan, cover with cold salted water, bring to the boil, then simmer for 10-12 mins until just tender. Drain well and leave to cool. Will keep chilled for 24 hours.","When your barbecue is hot, toss the spring onions in the olive oil and season. Place directly on the barbecue over a high heat and cook for 2-3 mins, turning until softened and charred. Leave until cool enough to handle, then finely chop and set aside. Heat a large barbecue-proof frying pan or roasting tin over direct heat. Add the butter until foaming, then toss in the potatoes, season well and cook for 10 mins, shaking the pan occasionally.","To give the potatoes a smoky flavour, add some wood chips to the embers and close the lid of the barbecue as the potatoes cook. Stir through the charred spring onions and cook for a final 5 mins. Tip into a large bowl and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3672,3672,'en','Easy carrot cake pancakes','Combine a classic cake with the simplicity of a pancake to create a special pudding, breakfast or brunch. Serve with yogurt, pecans and a drizzle of maple syrup or honey','["225g self-raising flour","½ tsp ground cinnamon","½ tsp ground nutmeg","3 tbsp golden caster or light brown soft sugar","400ml milk","2 tbsp soft cheese , plus 100g for serving","1 egg","1 medium carrot (around 115g), grated","1 orange , zested","50g pecans , chopped, plus extra to serve (optional)","150ml natural yogurt","vegetable or sunflower oil , for frying","maple syrup or honey, to serve"]','["Sift together the flour, cinnamon, nutmeg and sugar in a large bowl. Combine the milk, 2 tbsp soft cheese and egg in a large jug or bowl, then pour into the dry mix while whisking until you have a smooth batter. Stir in the grated carrot, orange zest and pecans, if using. Leave to rest for a few minutes.","Meanwhile combine 100g soft cheese and the natural yogurt, plus a drizzle of the juice from the zested orange, if you like. Leave in the fridge until needed.","Heat a teaspoon of oil in a frying pan over a medium-low heat, then add a ladleful of batter and cook until the pancake looks firm around the edges and the surface begins to bubble. If your pan is large enough, you can cook more than one at a time. Flip the pancake over and cook for 1-2 mins until cooked through. Repeat with the remaining batter, adding a little oil in between each pancake if necessary.","Serve the pancakes with spoonfuls of the yogurt mix, a scattering of pecans and a drizzle of maple syrup or honey, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3674,3674,'en','Greek-style beans','Rustle up a butter bean, tomato and feta stew for a quick and healthy midweek meal. Enjoy with toasted sourdough on the side to mop up all the sauce','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 large red onion , finely chopped","3 garlic cloves , finely chopped","1½ tsp dried oregano","2 tbsp tomato purée","400g can chopped tomatoes","300ml low-salt vegetable stock","½ tsp caster sugar","2 x 400g can butter beans , drained and rinsed","½ lemon , juiced","50g feta , crumbled","small handful of dill , finely chopped","toasted sourdough , to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a deep frying pan over a medium-high heat. Add the onions with a pinch of salt and cook for 5 mins, until beginning to soften and the edges are turning golden. Mix in the garlic, oregano and tomato purée. Reduce the heat to medium and cook for 3-4 mins, stirring, until the purée turns dark red.","Mix in the tomatoes, stock and sugar. Swill the can out with a splash of water, then pour into the pan as well. Leave it simmer away for 10-12 mins over a low-medium heat, then mix in the beans. Stir well, then leave to simmer for 2-3 mins before seasoning to taste with salt, pepper and a little lemon juice. Serve with the feta and dill scattered over the top, with toasted sourdough on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:12:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3676,3676,'en','Coconut, curry leaf & turmeric saucy lentils','Raid your spice cupboard to make our lentil dish which can be used as a base to make three other meals – use puy or green lentils as they hold their shape','["3 tbsp ghee , or coconut oil to make it vegan","2 large onions , finely chopped","1 tsp black mustard seeds","8 fresh curry leaves","6 garlic cloves , finely chopped","40g ginger , grated","1 green chilli , deseeded if you like","2 tsp ground turmeric","1½ tsp ground coriander","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp nigella seeds","1.2 litres vegetable stock (ensure vegan, if needed)","400ml can coconut milk","600g dried puy or green lentils , rinsed"]','["Heat the ghee or oil in a large, deep saucepan over a medium-high heat. Stir in the onions, mustard seeds and curry leaves with a pinch of salt and cook for 8-10 mins, stirring frequently, until the onions are caramelised a little around the edges, and the mustard seeds have popped. Mix in the garlic, ginger, chilli, turmeric, coriander, cumin and nigella seeds. Lower the heat to medium and cook for 3-4 mins, until fragrant.","Pour in the vegetable stock, coconut milk and lentils. Rinse out the can of coconut milk with water and add to the pan. Bring to the boil, then stir in the lentils. Cook for 30-40 mins until the lentils are tender and it has reduced. Season to taste and divide into three batches. Will keep chilled for five days in an airtight container, or frozen for up to three months."]','2026-01-10 12:12:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3678,3678,'en','Garam masala prawn & corn soup','Make a light yet flavourful supper with this garam masala, prawn, new potato and sweetcorn soup. Serve with lime wedges to squeeze over and crusty bread','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","3 spring onions , finely sliced","2 garlic cloves , crushed","15g ginger , grated","2 tsp garam masala","1½ tsp medium curry powder","600ml low-salt chicken stock","500g new potatoes , cut into bite-size pieces","200g frozen sweetcorn","300g prawns , defrosted if frozen","200ml milk","small handful of coriander , finely chopped","1 lime , cut into wedges","crusty bread"]','["Heat the oil in a saucepan over a medium heat. Tip in the spring onions, garlic and ginger and cook for 2-3 mins until sizzling and fragrant. Mix in all the spices and cook for a further minute until aromatic. Splash in the stock and new potatoes. Bring to the boil and simmer for 12-14 mins, until the potatoes are almost tender.","Stir in the sweetcorn, prawns and milk, and cook for a further 2-4 mins until the prawns are cooked through. Season to taste, sprinkle with coriander and serve with lime wedges to squeeze over and some crusty bread on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:12:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3680,3680,'en','Dhal with cumin-roasted cauliflower','Use up the whole cauliflower and roast the leaves too to make this moreish dhal dish. You could swap the cauli for roasted broccoli, if you prefer','["200g red lentils","1 cauliflower , broken into florets, large leaves roughly chopped","2 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tsp turmeric","2 tsp black mustard seeds","2 tsp cumin seeds","1 onion , finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , grated","25g ginger , most finely chopped, some cut into matchsticks","1 tsp Kashmiri chilli","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp tomato purée","1 x 400g can of chopped tomatoes","small bunch of coriander , roughly chopped (save a small handful of whole leaves to serve)","4 tbsp natural yogurt , to serve (optional)"]','["Boil the kettle, tip the lentils into a large heatproof bowl, and pour over the boiled water. Leave to soak while you roast the cauliflower.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4. Spread the cauliflower and its leaves out on a large, lined baking tray. Drizzle over 1 tbsp vegetable oil, then scatter over the turmeric, mustard and cumin seeds and some salt and pepper, and massage in well. Bake for 30 mins. Once the cauliflower is golden and softened, drain the lentils.","Meanwhile, heat a large saucepan on a medium heat. Pour in the remaining 1 tbsp oil, then scatter in the onion. Cook for 10-12 mins or until softened, add the garlic and finely chopped ginger and cook for a further 2-3 mins.","Scatter in the chilli and ground coriander, and add the tomato purée, stirring well to prevent burning. Pour in the tomatoes, then 2 canfuls of water. Tip in the lentils, mixing well. Cook for 15-20 mins until the lentils are tender and the sauce has thickened. You may need to add a bit more water as it cooks, depending on the consistency you prefer.","Stir in the chopped coriander and some salt and pepper, then divide between bowls. Top with a dollop of yogurt, the cauliflower and any mustard and cumin seeds left in the tray, the ginger matchsticks and coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:12:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3682,3682,'en','Mushroom & kale spaghetti','Blend a can of butter beans into this mushroom and kale sauce for a creamy base that adds fibre, nutrients and an additional portion of your five-a-day','["250g spaghetti","2 tbsp olive oil","4 garlic cloves , thinly sliced","1 red chilli , thinly sliced","400g chestnut mushrooms , thinly sliced","150g kale , stalks removed and roughly chopped","400g can butter beans , drained","2 tbsp white miso paste","1 lemon , juiced","125ml crème fraîche (optional)"]','["Cook the spaghetti in salted boiling water according to pack instructions, until al dente. Reserve a cup of pasta water, then drain.","While the pasta cooks, heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat. Fry the garlic and chilli for 1-2 mins until the garlic starts to turn golden. Add the mushrooms and cook for 4-5 mins until softened. Add the kale, cooking until it wilts, about 3-4 mins.","Tip the beans, miso and 150ml of the pasta water into a blender and blitz until smooth, adding more pasta water if needed.","Add the bean sauce to the kale and mushrooms and cook for another 2-3 mins, adding more pasta water if the sauce is too thick. Season with salt, black pepper and lemon juice to taste. Stir in crème fraîche if using. Toss the drained spaghetti into the sauce and serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:12:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3684,3684,'en','Smoked mackerel on toasted crumpets','Try our easy starter – the filling can be made well in advance and chilled. Once your guests arrive, toast the crumpets and pile the filling on top','["2 ready-to-eat smoked mackerel fillets","90g crème fraîche","½ lemon , juiced","2 dill sprigs , finely chopped","2 parsley sprigs , finely chopped","1 Granny Smith apple , cored and cut into matchsticks (optional)","4 crumpets","butter , for spreading","4 slices of cucumber","1-2 radishes , sliced","small handful of finely chopped chives"]','["Remove the skin from the mackerel and flake the flesh into a bowl. Add the crème fraîche, lemon juice, dill and parsley, and gently mix until well combined. Season to taste, then fold in the apple matchsticks, if using.","Toast the crumpets in a toaster or heat your air fryer to 180C for 2 mins before adding your crumpets for 3-4 mins. Remove and generously butter them. Spread the mackerel mixture over the crumpets. Garnish with the sliced cucumber, radishes, and a sprinkle of chives, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3686,3686,'en','Air-fryer fried egg','Yes, you can use your air-fryer to make fried eggs – and cook the yolk to your liking. With some models, you may just need to turn the tray halfway through','["2 tsp vegetable or sunflower oil","2 eggs"]','["Drizzle the oil into a heatproof dish or tin that will fit into your air-fryer – a cake tin works well, or you can use individual ramekins. Put the tin or dish in the air-fryer and cook at 180C for 2 mins to heat the oil.","Crack the eggs into the tin or dish and cook at 180C for 4-8 mins, or until the yolk is cooked to your liking. Some air-fryers don’t cook evenly – to ensure your egg does, turn the tin or dish around halfway through cooking."]','2026-01-10 12:12:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3688,3688,'en','Chai-spiced apple & sultana porridge topper','Power up your morning porridge with chai-soaked apple chunks and sultanas. Add a drizzle of double cream, if you like too, for extra indulgence','["100g sultanas","2 apples , cored and roughly chopped","½ lemon , juiced","2 tbsp light brown soft sugar","¾ tsp ground ginger","¾ tsp ground cinnamon","¼ tsp ground nutmeg","5 cardamom pods , bashed","2 cloves","200g porridge oats","400ml milk","drizzle of double cream , to serve (optional)"]','["Put the sultanas, apples, lemon juice, sugar, ground and whole spices and a crack of black pepper in a saucepan. Pour in 75ml water, then bring to a simmer over a medium heat. Cook gently for 10-15 mins until the fruit has softened and the liquid has reduced. Remove from the heat and set aside. Once cool, will keep chilled in an airtight container for up to five days.","To make the porridge, tip the oats, milk and 800ml water into a saucepan along with a pinch of salt. Cook, stirring often, over a medium heat for 8-10 mins until thickened and creamy – cook for slightly longer if you prefer a thicker porridge, or add a splash of water if you prefer it thinner.","Serve the porridge in bowls topped with the chai-spiced apple and sultana mixture and a drizzle of double cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3690,3690,'en','Honey, sesame & halloumi skewers','Bored of the same old veggie skewers? With a honey-sesame glaze, these halloumi versions pack in flavour','["2 x 250g blocks halloumi","1 tbsp neutral oil","1 tbsp sesame oil","1 tbsp neutral oil","2 tsp sesame seeds","2 tsp garlic granules","1 tbsp chilli flakes","100ml honey","1 tbsp apple cider vinegar"]','["Begin by making the honey glaze. Mix all the ingredients in a bowl and season with salt and pepper. Cut each block of halloumi into thirds, parallel with the fold, then break in half at the fold. You should end up with 12 pieces in total. Carefully thread these onto metal skewers.","Brush the neutral oil over the bars of the barbecue, then brush the halloumi with the honey glaze. Grill, brushing every now and then and turning carefully every 2-3 mins, until golden all over. You can also cook these on the hob in a griddle pan over a high heat if you prefer. Serve with the remaining glaze in a bowl on the side for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:12:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3692,3692,'en','Charred cabbage skewers with harissa butter','Reimagine veggie skewers with these charred spring cabbage versions served with a moreish harissa butter, Greek yogurt and crispy onions','["100g salted butter","2 tbsp harissa (we used rose harissa)","1 lemon , zested and juiced","2 garlic cloves , crushed","small handful of parsley , finely chopped","1 pointed spring cabbage","1 tbsp neutral oil","200g thick Greek yogurt","50g crispy onions"]','["Melt the butter in a saucepan, then add the harissa, lemon zest, lemon juice and garlic, and cook for 2-3 mins, until sizzling. Season with pepper and stir in most of the parsley, reserving a little to garnish.","Wash and discard any damaged or blemished outer leaves of the cabbage. Cut in half, keeping the root intact, then cut each half into 2 wedges, keeping the root attached to each end. Carefully thread onto metal skewers, brush each wedge with the harissa butter, then set aside on a baking tray.","Brush the neutral oil over the bars of the barbecue and grill the cabbage, brushing with the butter occasionally, turning carefully every 3-5 mins, until soft and charred all over. Alternatively, you can cook these under a hot grill.","Spread the yogurt out on a serving platter and top with the skewers, drizzling over any remaining butter, then scatter with the crispy onions and reserved parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:12:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3694,3694,'en','Slow cooker coconut chicken curry','Get your slow cooker to do the hard work for this Indian-style curry. We’ve added chicken and sweet potato, then served with naans and rice','["1 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil (optional)","1 red onion , finely chopped or sliced","8 skinless and boneless chicken thighs , chopped into chunks","4 garlic cloves , crushed or finely grated","thumb-sized piece of ginger , finely grated","6 tbsp curry paste","400ml can coconut milk","400g can chopped tomatoes","500g sweet potato or butternut squash, roughly chopped","handful of fresh coriander , roughly chopped, to serve","1 red chilli , sliced, to serve (optional)"]','["For a deeper flavour, if you have time, heat the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onion for 6-8 mins until softened. Add the chicken and fry for a few minutes until seared all over (but not cooked through), then add the garlic and ginger and cook for 2 mins until fragrant. Stir in the curry paste and cook for 1 min.","Tip into your slow cooker along with the coconut milk, tomatoes and sweet potato or butternut squash. Alternatively, put everything but the oil, coriander and chilli in your slow cooker and stir to combine. Cook on high for 5 hrs or low for 8 hrs, until the chicken is tender and cooked through. Remove the lid for the final 1 hr to thicken the sauce. Serve over rice or with naan bread with a scattering of coriander and red chilli, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3696,3696,'en','Summer runner bean stew','Enjoy this summer stew with chunks of bread for dunking. It’s also perfect alongside lamb cutlets or white fish','["50ml olive oil","1 large onion , thinly sliced","280g runner beans","4 garlic cloves , thinly sliced","4 anchovies , plus a drizzle of oil from the can (optional)","2 pinches of chilli flakes (optional)","400g large vine tomatoes , chopped","4 oregano sprigs , leaves picked, or 1 tsp dried oregano","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 tsp caster sugar","400g can cannellini or butter beans , drained","handful of basil , leaves picked","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a low-medium heat. Add the onion with a pinch of salt and cook slowly until caramelised, about 15 mins.","Meanwhile, prep the runner beans. If the runner beans are young and small, simply slice on the diagonal.If they are older, they will have a tough string running along each side. To remove, trim the stalk end andpull away the fibrous strings, then slice on the diagonal.","Add the garlic, anchovies and chilli flakes, if using, to the onion. Cook for a few minutes, stirring often, untilthe anchovies have dissolved, and the garlic is cooked but not browned.","Add the runner beans, tomatoes, oregano, vinegar, sugar and a good pinch of salt. Cover and cook for 15 mins over a low heat, stirring often, until the tomatoes have broken down and the beans are soft.","Add the cannellini or butter beans to the pan, fill the can halfway with water and add this, too. Cook foranother 10 mins uncovered, until the liquid has reduced a little. Check the seasoning and stir in the basil leaves. Serve with a generous drizzle of extra virgin olive oil and an extra pinch of chilli flakes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3698,3698,'en','Veg peel fritters','Make veg peelings the star of the show with these easy fritters. They’re perfect the day after a big family dinner, such as at Christmas time','["500ml vegetable oil , for frying","1 egg","100g gram (chickpea) flour","½ tsp baking powder","½ tsp chilli powder","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp nigella seeds","½ tsp turmeric","150g vegetable peelings , we used a mix of potato, carrot and parsnip","½ small onion , finely sliced","lime pickle , mango chutney and raita, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a deepsaucepanover a medium-low heat, ensuring it is no more than two thirds full. Pour 100ml of water in a bowl and mix with the egg. Tip in the gram flour, baking powder, spices and 1 tsp fine sea salt, then stir until a thickish paste forms. Stir in the vegetable peelings and onion. Add another splash of water to loosen if needed.","To check if the oil is hot enough, drop in a tiny speck of batter. If it rises to the surface surrounded by bubbles and starts to brown, the oil is hot enough for frying. If not, increase the heat to medium-high. Once hot enough, carefully lower heaped tablespoons of the mixture into the oil, a few at a time, then flatten with the back of the spoon. Cook for a few minutes, turning once, until evenly browned and crisp, about 3-4 mins. Drain on kitchen paper and sprinkle with a little salt. Serve warm with lime pickle, mango chutney and raita."]','2026-01-10 12:12:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3700,3700,'en','Air-fryer lemon drizzle cake','Ever tried your air-fryer for baking? While it’s not ideal for perfectly even cakes, it’s great for a fuss-free loaf cake, like this lemon drizzle','["250g butter , at room temperature","250g caster sugar","4 eggs","250g self-raising flour","3 lemons , zested and juiced","100g icing sugar"]','["Line a loaf tin with baking parchment. Tip the butter, sugar, eggs, flour, a pinch of salt and two-thirds of the lemon zest into a bowl, then beat with an electric whisk for 4-5 mins until pale and fluffy.","Heat theair-fryerto 160C. Spoon the cake mixture into the prepared tin, smoothing the surface. Cook for 1 hr-1 hr 10 mins until a skewer inserted in the centre comes out clean (you can cover the surface with foil if it starts to get too dark). Leave to cool in the tin for 5 mins.","Meanwhile, combine the icing sugar, remaining lemon zest and just enough juice to make a smooth, pourable icing. Carefully lift the warm cake out onto awire rackset over a tray and poke deep holes all over the top using a skewer. Slowly drizzle over the icing, letting it drip off the edges. Leave to set before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:12:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3702,3702,'en','Turmeric chicken with butter bean hummus & roasted peppers','Try this healthy meze-style turmeric chicken with butter bean hummus, roasted peppers and broccoli. Barbecue the chicken and peppers, if you like','["1 large red pepper, halved and deseeded","1 tsp vegetable oil","160g long-stem broccoli","handful of mint leaves, to serve","2 large skinless chicken breast fillets (about 125g each)","120g natural yogurt","3 tbsp finely grated turmeric","½ tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp ground coriander","1 garlic clove, finely grated","1 tbsp lemon juice","1 tsp honey","1 tsp extra virgin olive oil","400g can butter beans, drained, liquid reserved","1 tbsp lemon zest, plus 1 tbsp lemon juice","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil, plus a drizzle","1 garlic clove, roughly chopped","½ tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp ground coriander"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Line a baking sheet with foil. Make a few small cuts around the edges of the pepper halves using asharp knife, then flatten them as much as you can with your palm. Rub with the veg oil and roast on the lined baking sheet for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, cut the chicken breasts in half lengthways at an angle so you end up with four thin fillets. Mix the yogurt, turmeric, cumin seeds, ground coriander, garlic, lemon juice, honey and olive oil with some black pepper and 1 tsp salt in a bowl. Add the chicken and turn to coat in the marinade. When the peppers have had 10 mins, turn them over, add the chicken fillets to the sheet, spacing them apart slightly, and spoon any remaining marinade over them. Roast for 20 mins, turning the chicken fillets halfway, until cooked through.","For the hummus, use ahand blenderto blitz together the beans, lemon zest and juice, olive oil, garlic, cumin seeds and coriander with 6 tbsp liquid from the can, ¾ tsp salt and plenty of black pepper. It should be completely smooth.","When the chicken has been cooking for 10 mins, steam the broccoli for 6 mins until tender. Spoon the hummus over two plates, then top with the roasted peppers and chicken. Scatter with the mint, drizzle with olive oil and serve with the broccoli on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:12:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3704,3704,'en','Ginger chicken udon noodles','Serve up these fragrant and light noodles with chicken, beansprouts and cabbage in 30 minutes. With fiery ginger and red chilli, it’s full of flavour','["1 tsp sunflower oil","3 boneless, skinless chicken thighs, diced","¼ white cabbage, finely sliced","25g ginger, peeled and finely grated","1 red chilli (deseeded if you like), finely chopped","1 tbsp low-salt soy sauce","2 tsp rice vinegar","2 tsp mirin","100g ready-to-eat beansprouts","3 spring onions, finely sliced","300g straight-to-wok udon noodles","small handful of coriander, finely chopped","1 tbsp pickled ginger (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large, deepfrying panover a medium-high heat and, once hot, stir-fry the chicken and cabbage for 5-7 mins until browned and almost cooked through. Add the ginger and chilli, and cook for a few minutes more until fragrant.","Add the remaining ingredients, except the coriander and pickled ginger, and fry until the chicken is cooked and the noodles are tender, about 1-2 mins more. Season, adding more soy, vinegar or mirin, if you like. Top with the coriander and pickled ginger, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:12:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3706,3706,'en','Tomato soup & hummus crispbreads','Get organised for the week ahead and make this soup on a Sunday – it keeps well in the fridge. We’ve packed in the veg, along with red lentils to add protein','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 large onions (325g), chopped","320g carrots , sliced","4 garlic cloves , chopped","1 tbsp smoked paprika","100g dried red lentils","690g bottle passata","1l vegetable stock made with 1 tbsp bouillon powder","4 multigrain crispbreads","100g reduced-fat hummus","¼ cucumber , sliced","6 pitted Nocellara olives , sliced","pinch of thyme leaves","sprinkle of smoked paprika"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan and fry the onions and carrots for about 10 mins, stirring occasionally, until softened.","Stir in the garlic and smoked paprika along with the lentils, and cook for about a minute more.","Pour in the passata and stock, bring to the boil, then cover and simmer over a medium heat for 30 mins, stirring occasionally until the vegetables are tender. Remove from the heat and whizz until smooth using ahand blender. Eat half now and chill the rest.Will keep chilled for up to three days.To reheat, cook portions in a pan over a low heat with a dash of water until piping hot.","To serve alongside the soup, spread 2 crispbreads per person with half the hummus. Top with half the cucumber and scatter over half the olives, thyme and smoked paprika."]','2026-01-10 12:12:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3708,3708,'en','Speedy lentil coconut curry','This quick and easy curry has such great depth of flavour – it tastes like it’s been cooked for hours. It’s healthy too, as well as being low in fat and calories','["1 onion, roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","1 red or green chilli, roughly chopped","1 carrot, roughly chopped","10g piece of ginger , peeled and chopped","1 tsp vegetable oil","1 ½ tbsp tikka masala curry paste","400g can cooked green lentils","220ml light coconut milk","200g frozen peas","10g coriander, roughly chopped","200g cooked brown rice","4 tbsp light coconut or natural yogurt, to serve"]','["Put the onion, garlic, chilli, carrot and ginger in afood processorand blitz to a smooth paste.","Heat the oil in a mediumsaucepanover a medium heat and cook the veg paste for 4-5 mins until fragrant and starting to soften. Add the curry paste and cook for 1 min more, then add the lentils and stir to combine.","Pour in the coconut milk and 150ml water, and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 10 mins until thickened and creamy. Add the peas in the final 5 mins, and season well.","Stir in most of the coriander, then divide the curry between four bowls along with the rice. Sprinkle over the remaining coriander and top with the yogurt to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3710,3710,'en','Waldorf salad','Chop apples, celery and walnuts to make this classic American salad, full of freshness and crunch. You can make the dressing up to two days in advance','["50g walnuts , toasted and roughly chopped","2 apples (we used Granny Smith), roughly chopped","1 lemon , juiced","100g mayonnaise","2 tbsp Greek-style yogurt","½ tbsp Dijon mustard","150g red grapes , halved","3 celery sticks, finely sliced","1 romaine or Little Gem lettuce , leaves separated and torn if large"]','["Heat a dry frying pan over a medium-high heat and toast the walnuts for 3-4 mins until lightly golden and aromatic. Tip into a bowl and leave to cool.","Toss the apples with a splash of the lemon juice to prevent them discolouring. Combine the mayonnaise, yogurt, mustard and remaining lemon juice in a large bowl and season well.The dressing will keep chilled for up to two days.Mix the apples, grapes and celery with the dressing and toss well in a large bowl to ensure everything is evenly coated. Arrange the lettuce leaves on a serving platter and spoon over the apple mixture and any remaining dressing from the bowl. Scatter over the toasted walnuts before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:12:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3712,3712,'en','Courgette, chilli & mint with pearl couscous','Rustle up our simple weeknight supper in 25 minutes. The courgettes and couscous require minimal prep, and mint, chilli, garlic and lemon combine to create a punchy dressing','["100g pearl couscous","1 tbsp olive oil","400g courgettes, roughly chopped","½ red onion, sliced","1 red chilli (deseeded if you prefer less heat), finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely sliced","10g mint, leaves picked and finely chopped, plus a few whole to serve","½ lemon, juiced","1 tbsp honey","50g light Greek-style salad cheese"]','["Cook the couscous following pack instructions, then drain and set aside. Meanwhile, heat the oil in afrying panover a medium-high heat. Tip in the courgettes and onion and fry, stirring occasionally, until browned and softened, about 8-10 mins. Stir in the chilli and garlic and cook for a further 2-3 mins until fragrant.","Remove from the heat and stir through the chopped mint, lemon juice, honey and seasoning. Divide the couscous between plates, top with the courgette mix, crumble over the cheese and scatter with the whole mint leaves to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3714,3714,'en','Miso lentil & cabbage soup','Make a filling soup with the help of green lentils, pancetta, white cabbage and mushrooms, along with miso flavours. It packs in three of your 5-a-day','["1 tbsp olive oil","150g pancetta or chopped bacon","300g sliced mushrooms","1 tbsp olive oil","1 chopped onion","4 chopped garlic cloves","4 unpeeled sliced carrots","3 sliced sticks of celery","2 tbsp miso","500ml vegetable stock","200g washed and drained dried green lentils","½ head of chopped white cabbage","spoonful of thick yogurt"]','["Heat the olive oil in a deep pan over a medium-high heat. You can make this completely veggie, but if you have around 150g pancetta or chopped bacon to use, tip this in and brown all over before removing with a slotted spoon. Stir in the sliced mushrooms and brown all over before transferring to a bowl.","Pour in the olive oil, then tip in the chopped onion, the garlic cloves, sliced carrots and sticks of celery, leaves and all. Cook gently for 10 mins, until lightly softened. Stir in the miso, preferably red or brown, vegetable stock and 1 litre water and bring to a simmer.","Finally, stir in the washed and drained dried green lentils and head of chopped white cabbage. Tip the bacon and mushrooms back in. Cover and simmer gently for 30-35 mins until the lentils are tender. Season well and serve with a spoonful of thick yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:12:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3716,3716,'en','Croissant bread sauce','Don’t waste stale croissants from Christmas morning – use them to make a rich bread sauce. For total indulgence, finish with a knob of butter to melt over the top','["50g butter , plus extra to serve (optional)","1 small onion , sliced","400ml whole milk","large pinch of ground cloves","2 stale croissants , roughly sliced (about 80g)"]','["Melt the butter in a pan over a low-medium heat, then stir in the onion and cook, covered, for 10 mins until softened but not coloured. Add the milk and ground cloves. Simmer gently, uncovered, for 15 mins, stirring occasionally. Add the croissant pieces and stir to help them absorb all the liquid.","Tip everything into afood processorand blitz until smooth.Will keep covered and chilled for two days.Tip the sauce into a pan and simmer over a low-medium heat until thickened and heated through – add a splash of milk to loosen, if needed. Season and serve hot alongside the turkey and trimmings with a knob of butter on top, if you like, and a grinding of black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:12:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3718,3718,'en','Fajita chicken rice bowl with burnt lime','Make crowd-pleasing fajitas the easy way with this one-tray recipe that’s full of nutrients and low in fat and calories. It makes a speedy midweek meal','["2 large chicken breasts","2 peppers, sliced","2 red onions, sliced","200g baby corn","3 tsp chipotle chilli paste","1 lime, zested, then halved","2 tsp vegetable oil","400g can black beans, drained","15g coriander, roughly chopped","400g cooked brown rice","4 tbsp salsa, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and line a largebaking traywith baking parchment. Arrange the chicken, peppers, red onions and baby corn on the tray, and spoon over the chipotle paste. Season, then toss to combine. Put the lime halves on the tray, cut-side down, then drizzle the oil over the chicken and veg. Roast for 20 mins, or until everything is cooked through.","Meanwhile, warm the beans in a small pan over a low heat, and season. Mix the beans with half the coriander and the lime zest, then squeeze over the juice of the roasted lime. Slice the chicken thinly on the diagonal and divide between four bowls along with the veg and brown rice. Sprinkle over the remaining coriander and serve with the salsa."]','2026-01-10 12:12:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3720,3720,'en','Apple, cardamom & stem ginger granola','Gift this granola at Christmas for a thoughtful present. Packed with dried fruit, nuts and stem ginger, it will keep in an airtight container for up to a month','["100g mixed nuts (we used whole hazelnuts, pistachios, almonds and pecans)","15 cardamom pods , or ½ tsp ground cardamom","50ml vegetable oil","100ml maple syrup","75ml honey","3 balls of stem ginger , chopped, plus 2 tbsp syrup","2 tsp vanilla extract","300g rolled oats","50g mixed seeds (we used sunflower, pumpkin and linseed)","1 tsp cinnamon","50g soft dried apple rings , roughly chopped","50g raisins or dried cranberries"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3 and line a large baking tray with baking parchment. Roughly chop the nuts, leaving plenty of chunky pieces. Crack open the cardamom pods and lightly grind the seeds using apestle and mortarto release their aroma.","Mix the oil, maple syrup, honey, ginger syrup and vanilla in a large bowl. Add the chopped stem ginger, oats, seeds, cinnamon, chopped nuts, cardamom and ½ tsp sea salt. Mix everything together until well coated in the syrup mixture.","Tip onto the baking tray and spread out evenly. Bake for 20 mins, then stir and return to the oven for a further 10 mins. For chunky granola, leave to cool without stirring, then break up into pieces. If you prefer a finer texture, stir from time to time as the granola cools. Mix in the dried fruit.Will keep in an airtight container for up to a month."]','2026-01-10 12:12:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3722,3722,'en','Cinnamon porridge with baked bananas','Add fibre-rich bananas and bio yogurt to your breakfast porridge. Including live yogurt in your diet may support the digestive system and aid immune defences','["80g porridge oats","150ml semi-skimmed milk","½ tsp ground cinnamon","1 large ripe banana (120g), halved lengthways and cut in half","½ orange , zested and juiced","200g plain bio yogurt","2 tsp toasted three-seed mix"]','["Put the oats, milk, 450ml water and cinnamon in a pan. Bring to the boil, then turn the heat to low, stirring often, for 5 mins until thickened.","Meanwhile, put the bananas in a dish with the orange zest and juice. Cover andmicrowaveon high for 1½-2 mins until softened. Tip the porridge into bowls and top with the yogurt, banana and seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:12:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3724,3724,'en','Teriyaki tofu','Marinade tofu with teriyaki sauce and serve with broccoli and noodles or rice to make this easy veggie midweek meal. It takes under 30 minutes to make','["1 tbsp olive oil","400g firm tofu , cut into bite-sized cubes","1 large head of broccoli , cut into florets, stalks peeled and thinly sliced","1 bunch of spring onions , separated into white and green parts and thinly sliced","8-10 tbsp teriyaki sauce","cooked rice or noodles, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a pan over a medium heat and fry the tofu for about 8 mins until crisp and golden. Remove from the pan and set aside.","In the same pan, add the broccoli florets and white parts of the spring onions and cook for around 4 mins until tender, but not completely cooked through. Stir in the teriyaki sauce and season well.","Add the cooked tofu back to the pan with the broccoli and stir well to coat. Cook for an additional 1-2 mins for the flavours to meld together. Sprinkle over the reserved green parts of the spring onions, remove from the heat and serve with cooked rice or noodles."]','2026-01-10 12:12:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3726,3726,'en','Cowboy caviar','Get the kids excited about veg with this salsa that can be easily adapted. If you’re taking it to a picnic, add the avocado and coriander at the last moment','["400g can black beans, drained and rinsed","200g can sweetcorn, drained, or use frozen (defrosted if frozen)","2 large tomatoes, quartered, deseeded and finely chopped","1 small red onion, finely chopped","1 pepper (any colour), deseeded and finely chopped","1 large avocado, halved, peeled, stoned and finely chopped (optional)","small bunch of coriander, chopped (optional)","3 tbsp olive oil","1 lime, juiced, or 2 tbsp red wine vinegar","tortilla chips, to serve (gluten-free, if needed)"]','["Tip the beans, corn, tomatoes, onion, pepper, avocado and coriander, if using, into a large bowl. (If not serving straightaway, add the avocado and coriander just before.)","Drizzle over the olive oil and lime juice or vinegar and gently stir to combine. Season to taste.Will keep at room temperature for two hours, or chilled overnight, without the avocado and coriander.Serve with tortilla chips for scooping up."]','2026-01-10 12:12:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3728,3728,'en','Firework apples','Light up little faces on Bonfire Night with these colourful candy apples – kids will love helping to decorate them, too','["250g marshmallows","50g butter","8 red apples","multi-coloured sprinkles","freeze-dried raspberries","pink meringues, crushed","strawberry lace sweets"]','["Gently heat the marshmallows and butter in a medium sized saucepan over a low heat, stirring until melted.","Remove the stalks from the apples and push a wooden lolly stick deeply into them, making sure not to go all the way through. Tip the toppings into separate small bowls.","Working one at a time, dip the apples into the melted marshmallow, swirling until evenly coated. Quickly decorate by rolling in sprinkles, freeze-dried raspberries, or wrapping with one or two strawberry laces. Place on baking parchment and chill until set."]','2026-01-10 12:12:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3730,3730,'en','Slow cooker pea & ham soup','Make the most of leftover Christmas ham with this simple pea and ham soup made in the slow cooker that uses just six ingredients. Enjoy with crusty bread','["1 onion, chopped","250g leeks, sliced","2 bay leaves","450g cooked ham (for best results, keep as a joint)","1½ l hot low-salt vegetable stock (or use water)","750g fresh or frozen peas (defrosted if frozen)"]','["Tip the onion, leeks, bay leaves and ham into aslow cooker. Pour over the hot vegetable stock and cook on high for 2 hrs or low for 6 hrs. If you have an uncooked gammon joint, you can use this, but you’ll need to cook the soup for an additional 45 mins on high or 2 hrs on low.","Remove the ham and set aside. Pour the peas into the slow cooker and cook on high for 30 mins more until the peas are cooked through. Meanwhile, shred the ham. If it has cooled enough, you can do this with your hands, or use two forks.","Remove the bay leaves from the soup and discard, then transfer the soup to ablenderand blitz.Once completely cool, the pea soup (without the ham) can be frozen for up to three months. Defrost completely in the fridge overnight, then reheat in a pan until piping hot to serve.Season to taste, then divide between bowls and scatter some of the shredded ham over each bowl before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:12:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3732,3732,'en','Healthy homemade granola','Sweeten homemade granola with prunes for a healthier take on this breakfast favourite. Prunes are also full of fibre, which supports gut health','["290g can pitted prunes in natural juice, drained","1 orange, zested and juiced","2 tbsp tahini","350g oats","25g flaked almonds","25g sunflower seeds","25g pumpkin seeds","2 x 400g pots fortified soya or plain bio yogurt"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a largebaking traywith baking parchment. Put the prunes, orange zest and juice in a small bowl, add the tahini and mash it all together to make a paste. Tip the oats into a large bowl, then add the prune mixture and knead it all together using your hands, as though you’re making a crumble topping, until all the oats are coated and sticky. Spread out on the prepared tray and bake for 20 mins, turning the oats every 5 mins to help them cook evenly and drive off as much steam as possible.","Remove from the oven and stir the almonds and seeds onto the tray, then cool quickly by tossing the mixture.Once completely cooled, the granola will keep for two weeks in an airtight container.","Measure 50g granola per serving and enjoy with 100g soya yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:12:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3734,3734,'en','Caramel macchiato','Save bread by making your favourite coffee-shop drink at home – you don’t need expensive equipment for professional results either','["250ml whole or semi-skimmed milk","60-70ml espresso (a double shot)","1 tsp vanilla extract","1-2 tbsp caramel sauce"]','["Heat the milk using amilk frotheror steam wand. Alternatively, warm on the hob until just steaming (don''t boil) and use a hand frother – you want to aim for a temperature between 60C-70C.","Pour the espresso into a coffee cup or mug, then stir through the vanilla and up to 1 tbsp caramel sauce, depending on your tastes. Pour over the milk, then drizzle over caramel sauce in a criss-cross pattern before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:12:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3736,3736,'en','Vegan spinach omelette','Try an omelette made with chickpea flour – it’s high in protein and gluten-free. The quantities here are for one, but the recipe is easily doubled','["30g gram (chickpea) flour","¼ tsp dried oregano","1 tbsp nutritional yeast","2 tsp rapeseed oil","80g baby spinach"]','["Whisk the gram flour, oregano and nutritional yeast in a bowl with 80ml water.","Heat the oil in a 19cm non-stick frying pan. Pour in the omelette batter and swirl the pan around to cover the base. Pile the fresh spinach over the top, then cover the pan and cook over a low heat for 5-6 mins until the spinach has wilted and the base of the omelette is cooked but still moist. Roll the omelette over in the pan to enclose the spinach, then slide onto a plate and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3738,3738,'en','Apple pie bars','Make the most of seasonal Bramley apples in British summertime and make these gorgeous apple pie bars. They’re perfect served with a cuppa for elevenses','["250g cold butter, cut into cubes","350g plain flour","150g light brown soft sugar, plus 3 tbsp","1 tbsp vanilla extract","4 medium Bramley apples (around 900g), peeled, cored and cut into chunks","1¼ tsp ground cinnamon (optional)","½ lemon, juiced","75g icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a 18 x 28cm baking tin with baking parchment. Put the butter, flour, 150g of the brown sugar and the vanilla extract into afood processorwith 1 tsp salt, and blitz until the mixture comes together. Press two-thirds of the dough into the tin in an even layer, then bake for 12-15 mins until golden. Keep the remaining dough chilled while you prepare the apples.","Tip the apples into a pan with 3 tbsp of the brown sugar, 1 tsp of the cinnamon (if using) and the lemon juice. Cook over a medium heat for 15-20 mins until the apples have softened but not broken down.","Tip the apples over the pastry base, then break up the remaining dough and dot it over the top. Bake for 15-20 mins until the topping is cooked and golden. Remove from the oven and leave to cool in the tin.","Combine the icing sugar and remaining ¼ tsp cinnamon with enough water to create a thick icing (you need around 2 tsp). Drizzle the icing over the apple pie bars, then slice into 12-16 squares.Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:12:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3740,3740,'en','Barbecue beef burger','A classic beef burger is a must-have at a barbecue. Pack blue cheese in the centre to make it a little more special and serve with your favourite sides','["400g beef mince","1 banana shallot, finely chopped","1 tbsp strong horseradish sauce","1 tsp dried mixed herbs","1 large garlic clove, finely grated","40g blue cheese (optional)","2 tsp vegetable oil","4 burger buns, split","iceberg lettuce leaves, tomato slices and relish, to serve"]','["Tip the beef mince, shallot, horseradish sauce, herbs and garlic into a bowl, and season well with salt and black pepper. Combine everything well using your hands, squeezing the mixture through your fingers repeatedly to help it bind together.","Divide the mixture into four portions and shape each into a 3cm-thick patty. Press a small 50p-sized piece of blue cheese into the middle of each patty, if using, and pack the meat around it to enclose the cheese – this will melt during cooking.","Put the burgers on a plate, cover and chill for at least 30 mins or overnight. Light thebarbecueand wait for the coals to turn ashen. Or, heat a gas barbecue to medium.","Lightly oil the burger patties all over and cook for 5 mins until just starting to char. Carefully flip over and cook for a further 4-5 mins (for medium) or longer if you prefer well done. Remove the burgers to a board and leave to rest for a few minutes before serving. Alternatively, fry the burgers over a medium heat for 4-5 mins on each side until cooked through (a probe thermometer should read 70C).","Serve the burgers in the buns with lettuce, tomato slices and relish (see recipe, below), or any other accompaniments of your choice."]','2026-01-10 12:12:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3742,3742,'en','Sweet chilli salmon lettuce wraps','Light, simple and three of your five-a-day, these clever lettuce cups are the perfect carrier for flaked sweet chilli salmon and thin slices of radish and carrot','["2 tbsp reduced-sugar sweet chilli sauce sauce (see tip, below)","1 lime, juiced","2 tsp reduced-salt soy sauce or wheat-free tamari","2 salmon fillets","1 carrot, finely sliced","½ daikon radish, halved and finely sliced","100g radishes, finely sliced","small handful of coriander, finely chopped","1 Little Gem lettuce, leaves separated"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Combine the sweet chilli sauce with half the lime juice and half the soy sauce or tamari. Pat the salmon fillets dry using kitchen paper, sit on abaking trayand spoon over the chilli sauce mixture. Bake for 10 mins, then heat the grill to high and slide the salmon under the hot grill for the final 2-5 mins until cooked through and caramelised. Gently flake the salmon flesh by pressing down on it using the back of a fork.","Toss the carrot, daikon, radishes and coriander together with the remaining soy sauce and lime juice. Season. Fill the lettuce leaves with the salad and flaked salmon to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3744,3744,'en','Spicy tuna, courgette & chickpea salad','Throw together this speedy salad with canned tuna, courgette and chickpeas, dressed with capers, chilli and garlic. It works as a standalone dish or a side','["1 lemon , zested and juiced","15g parsley , finely chopped","10g basil , finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , crushed","1 tbsp capers , rinsed and finely chopped","1 red chilli (deseeded, if you prefer less heat), finely chopped","160g can tuna in olive oil","2 courgettes , thinly sliced","2 x 400g cans chickpeas , drained and rinsed"]','["Put the lemon zest and juice in a bowl and mix with the parsley, basil, garlic, capers, chilli and some seasoning. Strain in the oil from the can of tuna (about 2 tbsp), then mix in the courgettes. Toss well to completely coat in the dressing, then set aside to soften for 15 mins.","Stir in the chickpeas and toss to combine everything before flaking in the tuna and tossing again. Serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:12:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3746,3746,'en','Healthy baked beans','Try our speedy, healthy recipe for homemade baked beans. It wins hands down when it comes to taste and texture, and delivers three of your five-a-day','["1 tsp rapeseed oil","1 large onion (185g), finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","500g passata","3 pitted dates (about 15g), roughly chopped","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","2 tsp bouillon powder","1 bay leaf","3 x 400g haricot beans, drained","4 medium cooked jacket potatoes"]','["Heat the oil in a non-sticksaucepanover a low heat and fry the onion for 5 mins until golden. Add a drop of water if it looks like it’s starting to burn.","Stir in the garlic, then tip in the passata, dates, vinegar, bouillon and bay leaf. Grind in plenty of black pepper and simmer for 5 mins.","Tip in the beans and 400ml water, then simmer for 10 mins, stirring every now and then until thick. To freeze, leave to cool completely, then divide between freezer bags and freeze for up to three months. Defrost thoroughly in the fridge overnight and reheat in a pan until piping hot. Serve over jacket potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:12:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3748,3748,'en','Turmeric cod with chickpea traybake','Bulk out a simple cod dinner with filling chickpeas flavoured with ginger, garlic and turmeric. It makes a healthy dinner that’s low in fat and calories','["400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","2 tsp sunflower oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 shallots, finely chopped","15g ginger, peeled and grated","2 tbsp tomato purée","200ml hot chicken stock, made up with 1⁄2 stock cube","1 tsp ground turmeric","1⁄4 - 1⁄2 tsp chilli flakes","2 x 125g cod","200g frozen spinach","10g coriander, roughly chopped, or a few whole leaves, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the chickpeas, oil, garlic, shallots, ginger, tomato purée, stock and most of the turmeric and chilli flakes into a 20 x 30cmroasting tin. Stir and season well, then bake for 20-25 mins until the mixture is bubbling and the liquid has reduced.","Meanwhile, pat the cod dry. Tip the remaining turmeric and chilli flakes, as well as a large pinch each of salt and freshly ground black pepper, onto a shallow plate and press the cod into the mixture to coat. Remove the roasting tin from the oven and nestle the cod and frozen spinach into the chickpeas. Cook for 10 mins, then carefully stir the spinach into the chickpeas. Return to the oven for 5 mins more until the cod is cooked through and opaque. Spoon into bowls and scatter over the coriander to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3750,3750,'en','Refried beans','Try this recipe for homemade refried beans. They work equally well as a party dip served with nachos, or as an accompaniment to a larger Tex-Mex-style meal.','["400g can black, pinto or kidney beans","1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 green chilli, chopped (optional)","1 tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp dried oregano","½ tsp smoked paprika","chopped coriander, to serve (optional)"]','["Lightly drain the beans, reserving the juice from the tin, but do not rinse (you want the beans in about half the liquid from the can). Depending on the texture you prefer, either mash them roughly in a bowl or blitz them using ablenderuntil smooth. Set aside.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan or casserole and cook the onions for 8-10 mins until soft and golden. Scatter in the garlic, chilli and cumin seeds, and sizzle everything for 2 mins more. Tip in the beans, oregano, paprika and a pinch of salt. Cook everything together for 5 mins until the beans have heated through adding more reserved bean juice if it’s too thick. Serve straightaway with a sprinkling of coriander, if you like, or leave to cool and keep chilled.Will keep chilled for up to three days or frozen for a month.Reheat with a splash of water mixed in."]','2026-01-10 12:12:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3752,3752,'en','Sweetcorn fritters','Make the most of sweetcorn with these crisp fritters. Enjoy them for brunch, lunch or as a side dish','["150g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp smoked paprika","160ml whole milk","1 egg","550g sweetcorn","2 spring onions, chopped, plus a little extra cut into thin strips to serve (optional)","10g sliced chives","handful of parsley, chopped","rapeseed oil, for frying"]','["Mix the flour, baking powder, paprika and milk together in a large bowl. Mix in the egg, followed by the sweetcorn, chopped spring onions, chives, parsley, 1 tsp salt and some freshly ground black pepper.","Heat a 1cm depth of oil in a frying pan over a medium heat until a small amount of the fritter mixture sizzles when dropped in. For larger fritters, drop 2 heaped tablespoons of the mixture into the pan at a time in a clockwise direction (this will help you remember the order they were added to the pan, so you can flip them at the right stage). For smaller fritters, do the same, but with 1 heaped tablespoon of mixture at a time.","After 2 mins, flip the fritters over in the same order they were added to the pan. Cook for another 2 mins, continuing to turn every now and then to ensure both sides are evenly golden brown. When ready, the fritters should be darker brown with crispy pieces of corn at the edges – be careful, as some of the kernels may burst during the cooking process. Remove to awire rackand pat away any excess oil using kitchen paper. Serve straightaway with a few strips of spring onion scattered over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3754,3754,'en','Khichdi','Enjoy this classic Indian dhal. Known for its Ayurvedic properties, our version is easy to prepare and full of flavour','["1½ tbsp cumin seeds","250g moong dhal","250g medium or short grain rice (basmati is also fine)","1½ tsp ground turmeric","1 medium-sized tomato , cut into 1cm cubes","150g frozen peas","½ tsp asafoetida","1 tsp sugar","2½ tbsp ghee","1 bay leaf","1 dried red chilli","3 cardamom pods , seeds removed and crushed, husks discarded","1 tbsp grated ginger"]','["Toast 1 tbsp of the cumin seeds in a small frying pan over a medium heat until the aromas are released. Allow to cool and then put in a coffee orspice grinderand grind to a fine powder. This will make about 4 tsp of ground cumin, of which ½ tsp will be used at the end of the dish.The remainder will keep in an airtight container for up to a week for use in another dish.","Dry toast the moong dhal in afrying panover a medium heat for about 5 mins. Keep tossing the pan so the dhal does not burn. Take off the heat and allow to cool.","Gently wash the rice under cold water two to three times to remove the starch. Add the dry-roasted moong dhal to the rice and wash once again. Put both in a large ovenproof pan and fill with enough water to come 1½ inches above the rice mixture. Bring to a simmer over a medium heat. Spoon off any scum that forms on top of the water and discard it.","Stir in the ground turmeric and tomato, return to a simmer, then pour in 500ml water. Return to a rolling simmer, reduce the heat and simmer for a further 20 mins with the lid on. Check the dhal and rice are cooked – they should have merged together to form a porridge-like consistency. Add more water if necessary and simmer for longer. Once cooked, keep on a low heat and add the frozen peas, asafoetida, 1 tsp salt and sugar. Stir in well and keep on a gentle simmer.","Meanwhile, put a small frying pan over a medium heat. Add 2 tbsp of the ghee, the remaining cumin seeds, bay leaf, dried chilli and crushed cardamom seeds, and allow the aromas to release, taking care not to burn the spices, around 2-3 mins. Add the ginger and cook for 2 mins on a medium heat, stirring constantly so it doesn''t stick to the bottom of the pan. Stir the ginger and cumin mixture into the khichdi and simmer for a final 2 mins before removing from the heat. Drop the last ½ tbsp ghee over the top and sprinkle with ½ tsp of the toasted and ground cumin seeds (also known as bhaja moshla). Close the lid until ready to serve. Just before serving, stir well one more time and the khichdi is ready to be served hot. Serve with poppadoms and mango chutney, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3756,3756,'en','Halloumi pasta','Add the punchy flavours of halloumi to pasta along with olives, courgette and tomato. Halloumi has more salt than cheddar, so a little goes a long way','["250g wholemeal penne","1 tsp rapeseed oil","120g halloumi, halved through the seam and cut into cubes","325g baby plum tomatoes on the vine, halved","320g courgettes, cut into cubes","3 garlic cloves, finely grated","400g can chopped tomatoes","6 pitted Kalamata olives, quartered","1 tsp dried oregano","10g parsley, chopped"]','["Boil the pasta following pack instructions. Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large, deep, non-stick pan over a medium heat and fry the halloumi, stirring occasionally for 3 mins until browned. Tip onto a plate, then cook the tomatoes in the pan for 1-2 mins until softened. Tip into the bowl of halloumi.","Tip the courgettes and garlic into the pan, stir-fry briefly, then pour in the canned tomatoes and stir in the olives and oregano. Cover and simmer for 10 mins.","Drain the pasta and toss in the sauce along with the parsley, halloumi and baby plum tomatoes. Serve half straightaway, then leave the remainder for another day.Will keep covered and chilled for up to three days. Reheat in a pan with a dash of water over a medium heat until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:12:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3758,3758,'en','Savoury muffins','Make a batch of these easy savoury muffins for your next picnic or an easy lunch. These cheesy bites with seasonal veg are great for lunchboxes','["1 courgette (about 175g grated weight)","4 spring onions, finely chopped","225g self-raising flour","1 roasted red pepper from a jar, drained and finely chopped","100g parmesan, finely grated","few rosemary sprigs, needles picked and finely chopped","2 eggs, beaten","90ml sunflower oil","50-100ml whole milk"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a eight-hole muffin tin with muffin cases. Coarsely grate the courgette into a fine sieve and use clean hands to squeeze out as much liquid as possible over the sink. Tip into a bowl with the spring onions, flour, roasted red pepper, most of the cheese and the rosemary, along with lots of black pepper and a pinch of salt.","Crack the eggs into a jug, pour in the oil and top up with enough milk to make 300ml. Beat together, then pour into the courgette mixture and mix to a smooth batter. Divide between the cases, top with the remaining cheese and bake for 25-30 mins until risen, firm and golden brown on top. Leave to cool completely on a wire rack.Will keep for up to three days in an airtight container in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3760,3760,'en','Tomato & black bean taco salad','Enjoy this refreshing taco salad on a warm evening when you’re craving something quick, fresh and crunchy, or as a side for a Mexican-style feast','["1 lime , juiced","12g coriander , finely chopped","½ tsp ground cumin","1 jalapeño pepper (deseeded if you prefer less heat), finely chopped","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","400g can black beans , drained and rinsed","200g cherry tomatoes , halved","1 romaine lettuce , chopped","198g can sweetcorn , drained","1 red pepper , finely chopped","4 crunchy taco shells","25g pumpkin seeds"]','["Combine the lime juice, coriander, cumin, jalapeño and oil in a bowl. Season well.","Tip in the beans, tomatoes, lettuce, corn and red pepper. Toss to combine. Crumble in the taco shells and mix to coat everything in the dressing. Scatter over the pumpkin seeds and serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3762,3762,'en','Courgette & sausage timballo','Enjoy this sausage, mozzarella and courgette timballo hot or cold. It’s a great way to use up a glut of courgettes if you’ve grown a crop in the garden','["knob of butter, for the tin","6 courgettes","2-3 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, finely chopped","4 sausages of your choice","2-3 tbsp nduja paste (depending on your preference for chilli heat)","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp dried mixed herbs","300g penne","125g ball mozzarella, drained and torn into pieces"]','["Butter a 20cm springform cake tin and set aside. Thinly slice 5 of the courgettes lengthways using a sharp knife ormandoline– you should get 6-8 slices from each courgette. Heat 2 tsp of the oil in a large frying pan over a medium-low heat and fry the courgette slices for 1-2 mins on each side until golden (you’ll need to do this in batches, adding a splash of oil between each batch). Remove to a sheet of kitchen paper or clean tea towel to drain. Leave to cool, then use to line the tin, leaving the ends overhanging the rim. You should have some slices left over; set these aside to use for the top later. Put the tin on a baking tray. Set aside.","Finely chopthe remaining courgette. Heat 2 tsp oil in the same frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onion for 5 mins until beginning to soften. Squeeze the sausagemeat from the skins into the pan and continue to fry for a few minutes more, squashing the sausage with the back of the spoon until beginning to brown. Stir in the chopped courgette and cook for 5-8 mins until golden. Add the nduja paste and fry for another 2 mins, then tip in the tomatoes and herbs and fry for 4-5 mins more until everything is combined and hot through. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Cook the penne in a large pan of boiling water following pack instructions, drain, return to the pan and stir in the courgette and tomato sauce along with the mozzarella pieces. Spoon the pasta into the courgette-lined tin, packing it down so it fits snugly. Fold the overhanging courgettes over the pasta, then arrange the remaining courgette slices on top, tucking them down the sides if possible. Bake for 35-45 mins until piping hot and the courgette slices are golden brown. Leave to cool in the tin for 20 mins, then invert onto a large serving plate, lift off the tin and cut into wedges to serve.Will keep chilled for up to three days and can be eaten hot or cold."]','2026-01-10 12:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3764,3764,'en','Cod & cherry tomato bake','Try this nutritious cod, tomato, bean and potato bake that’s effortless to make and counts as two of your five-a-day. It can be ready in under 30 minutes','["200g vine cherry tomatoes, halved","3 tbsp finely chopped basil leaves","6 Kalamata olives, halved","1 garlic clove, finely grated","1 tbsp olive oil","2 cod loins, about 130g each","300g new potatoes, halved","180g fine green beans, ends trimmed","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the cherry tomatoes with 2 tbsp of the basil, the olives, garlic and oil, in a small non-stickroasting tinor shallow ovenproof dish. Add the cod loins, then bake in the oven for 15-18 mins until the cod is cooked through.","Meanwhile, boil the potatoes in a pan with a steamer set over the top to cook the beans, both for 15 mins, until tender.","Arrange the beans in the centre of two dinner plates and place the cod on top. Tip the tomatoes and all their juices into a bowl and mix with the remaining basil, the extra virgin olive oil and the balsamic vinegar. Spoon over the cod and serve the potatoes on the side. Sprinkle over some cracked black pepper, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3766,3766,'en','Summer veg tostadas','Whip up these colourful veggie tostadas in just 30 minutes. Packed with summer veg, they make a flavourful, healthy and low-calorie midweek meal','["4 mini tortillas","4 tsp vegetable oil","1 courgette, halved lengthways, quartered then cut into 3cm chunks","198g can sweetcorn, drained","½ tsp smoked paprika","80g cherry tomatoes, halved","2 spring onions, trimmed and finely sliced","250g frozen peas, defrosted","1 garlic clove, peeled","2 mint sprigs, leaves picked and roughly chopped, plus extra to serve","small handful of coriander, roughly chopped","2 limes, 1 juiced, 1 cut into wedges to serve","80g natural yogurt"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Brush the tortillas with 2 tsp of the oil and arrange on twobaking trays. Lightly season. Bake for 5 mins, then turn over, rotate the trays and cook for a further 3 mins until crisp and golden. Remove from the oven and set aside to cool.","Meanwhile, heat 1 tsp of the oil in a largefrying panover a medium- high heat. Add the courgette and sweetcorn and cook, stirring a couple of times until they start to colour at the edges, about 6-8 mins. Add the smoked paprika and cook for a further minute. Set aside to cool slightly before tossing in the tomatoes and spring onions, then some seasoning to taste.","Put the peas, garlic, mint, most of the coriander, the lime juice and remaining oil in amini food processorwith some seasoning and pulse until you have a guacamole-like consistency. Add a splash of water if it’s too thick.","To serve, spread each tortilla with the pea dip and top with the veg. Garnish with the remaining coriander and a dollop of yogurt. Serve with lime wedges on the side for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3768,3768,'en','Sweetcorn chowder','Combine different alliums to give a layered onion flavour to this vegetarian sweetcorn chowder. The sweetness of the corn pairs with onions beautifully','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 small onion, chopped","8 spring onions, sliced","400g new potatoes, peeled and halved","1l vegetable stock","500g sweetcorn kernels","200ml milk","small bunch of chives, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in asaucepanover a medium heat. Tip in the small chopped onions and most of the sliced spring onions (reserving around 2 tbsp) and fry for 6-8 mins, until soft but not golden. Scatter in the potatoes and fry for 4 mins, to soften a little, then pour in the stock and bring to a boil. Reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer for 15 mins. Season to taste, then tip in the sweetcorn and pour in the milk. Cook for 3-4 mins until the corn is tender. At this point, you can serve it chunky or blitz using ahand blenderto break it up a little. Divide between bowls, then scatter over the chives before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:12:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3770,3770,'en','Smoothie bowl','Make a colourful berry smoothie bowl for breakfast. You could swap in mango, pineapple and kiwi and substitute coconut water for the oat milk for a tropical version','["200g frozen mixed berries","1 ripe banana","75ml oat milk","1 tsp maple syrup","½ tbsp vanilla protein powder, vegan version if needed","sliced kiwis, bananas and fresh berries","25g granola","1 tbsp mixed nuts and seeds","1 tbsp almond butter"]','["Put the berries, banana, oat milk, maple syrup and protein powder in a powerfulblenderand blend until smooth. Add a splash more milk if needed, but remember it needs to be quite thick.","Spoon the smoothie into a bowl and dot over the fresh fruit, granola and mixed nuts and seeds. Drizzle over the almond butter to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3772,3772,'en','NYC-style hot dogs with street-cart onions','Try these NYC-inspired hot dogs: frankfurters topped with classic caramelised onions, ketchup, American mustard and a little sauerkraut','["4 large frankfurters","4 hot dog buns, split","sauerkraut, to serve","1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 large onions, halved and sliced","1⁄4 tsp ground cinnamon","large pinch of chilli powder","2 tbsp honey","2 tsp American-style mustard, plus extra to serve","2 tsp ketchup, plus extra to serve","2 tsp tomato purée","2 tsp cider or white wine vinegar","1 tsp Worcestershire sauce"]','["First, make the onions. Heat the oil in afrying panover a low-medium heat and cook the onions for 10-12 mins until golden and slightly charred in spots.","Stir in the cinnamon, chilli powder, honey, mustard, ketchup, tomato purée, vinegar, Worcestershire sauce, 2-3 tbsp water and a pinch of salt. Simmer for 1-2 mins until the onions are saucy, adding a splash more water if they seem dry. Taste and add a little more chilli powder, mustard or a pinch of sugar, if you like. Keep the onions warm if you’re serving straightaway or cool and chill.Will keep in an airtight container in the fridge for up to five days. Reheat over a low heat before serving, adding a splash of water to loosen as needed.","Light abarbecueand wait until the coals are ashen, set a gas barbecue to medium or heat a griddle pan over a medium heat. Alternatively, bring a pan of water to a simmer. Cook the frankfurters for 15 mins on the barbecue or in a griddle pan until charred, or for 8 mins in a pan of simmering water. If using a barbecue, warm the buns over the coals, if you like. Spoon a little sauerkraut into each bun, top with a frankfurter and spoon over the onions. Drizzle over some extra mustard and ketchup."]','2026-01-10 12:12:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3774,3774,'en','Prawn, pepper & chickpea filo pie','Try a lighter version of a traditional pastry-topped pie, with a prawn, pepper & chickpea filling. The filo pastry also gives it an excellent crunch','["1 tbsp olive oil, plus 1 tsp","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1-2 tsp harissa, to taste","2 tbsp tomato purée","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","300g raw king prawns","3 roasted red peppers from a jar, finely sliced","300ml vegetable stock","1 lemon, cut into wedges","small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","6 sheets of filo pastry"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the 1 tsp of oil in an ovenproof pan over medium heat and add the onion and garlic. Cook gently for a few minutes until slightly softened. Stir in the harissa and tomato purée, and cook for 3 mins more. Tip in the chickpeas, prawns, peppers and stock.","Bring to a gentle simmer, then season, stir through a squeeze of lemon juice and the parsley. Ruffle the pastry sheets on top and brush over the remaining olive oil. Bake for 15 mins until golden and bubbling. Serve with lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:12:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3776,3776,'en','Crispy tofu summer rolls with cashew dipping sauce','Make these vibrant, veg-packed tofu summer rolls vegan by simply swapping out the fish sauce for a vegan variety','["2 tbsp sesame oil","200g smoked tofu, cut into 1cm cubes","200g vermicelli rice noodles","2 tbsp rice wine vinegar","1 tbsp light brown soft sugar","1 tbsp vegetarian fish sauce","14 rice-paper wraps","½ small bunch of mint, leaves picked","½ small bunch of coriander, leaves picked","1 large carrot, cut into thin matchsticks","½ cucumber, cut into thin matchsticks","1 tbsp sesame seeds","100g smooth cashew butter","1 tbsp light soy sauce","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 small garlic clove, crushed"]','["Heat 1 tbsp sesame oil in a large, non-stick frying pan over a medium heat. Pat the tofu dry, then fry for 5 mins until golden and crisp. Remove to a bowl and set aside.","Tip the rice noodles into a deep heatproof bowl and cover with boiling water from the kettle. Leave to soak for 15 mins, then drain and rinse under cold running water to halt the cooking process. Whisk together the remaining sesame oil, the rice vinegar, brown sugar and fish sauce, then tip in the noodles and toss to coat.","For the dipping sauce, combine the cashew butter, soy sauce, vinegar and garlic, then slowly whisk in 50ml boiling water from the kettle to loosen.","To assemble the rolls, dip one of the rice paper wrappers into a bowl of hot water, swishing it around until the wrapper is soft, about 10-15 seconds. Transfer to a clean tea towel to drain. Transfer the wrapper to a board and arrange a few mint and coriander leaves along one edge, followed by some of the carrot and cucumber matchsticks, some fried tofu and a few of the dressed noodles. Lift the edge of the wrapper up and over the filling and, holding the filling in position with your fingers, start rolling up tightly. When you’re about halfway, fold the ends of the wrapper to enclose the filling, then continue to roll to seal. Repeat with the remaining wrappers and filling.","To serve, cut the rolls in half on the diagonal. Sprinkle the sesame seeds over the sauce and serve it alongside for dunking into."]','2026-01-10 12:12:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3778,3778,'en','Scottish shortbread','Make some simple Scottish shortbread squares for the biscuit tin using just four ingredients. They’re perfect enjoyed with a mid-morning cuppa','["250g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","350g plain flour","50g rice flour","100g caster sugar, plus 1 tbsp"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 28 x 18cm tin. In afood processor,pulse together the butter, both flours, ½ tsp salt and the 100g of sugar until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs. Pulse a few more times until it comes together into a rough ball. Alternatively, put all the ingredients in a bowl and rub together using your fingertips until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs. Bring together into a pliable dough and press down into the prepared tin. Using asharp knife, mark the dough into 16 bars.","Sprinkle over the remaining sugar and bake for 25-30 mins until golden and set. Remove and prick the dough all over. Leave to cool in the tin for 5 mins before transferring to awire rackto cool completely. Using a sharp knife, cut through your earlier scores to separate completely."]','2026-01-10 12:12:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3780,3780,'en','Caprese salad','Make this classic Italian tricolore salad for a starter or side. It’s incredibly simple but, when made with perfectly ripe tomatoes, is a real delight','["8 ripe plum tomatoes, sliced","2 balls of mozzarella (or vegetarian alternative), sliced","handful of basil leaves","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 tbsp balsamic vinegar"]','["Arrange the slices of tomato and mozzarella on a platter, alternating between slices of each, and sprinkle over the basil leaves. Season generously with salt and black pepper, then drizzle over the olive oil and vinegar. Serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:12:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3782,3782,'en','Courgette fries','Ditch the potatoes and try these moreish courgette fries as a snack or side dish. Scatter with parmesan before serving','["2 tbsp plain flour","2 courgettes, cut into 1cm batons","oil, for deep frying","15g parmesan, grated"]','["Tip the flour into a bowl, drizzle in 2 tbsp water and mix to form a thick batter. Season with plenty of salt and freshly ground black pepper, then mix in the courgettes.","Pour oil into a pan until it is about 4cm deep, ensuring the pan is no more than two thirds full. Set over a medium heat until 180C or a flick of batter dropped in sizzles and turns brown within 30 seconds. Lower half the battered courgettes into the hot oil and fry, turning after 1 min using a slotted spoon, for 5-6 mins until golden. If they begin to stick together, gently coax them apart with tongs. Remove from the hot oil and drain on a plate lined with a sheet of kitchen paper. Repeat with the remaining half, then scatter with the parmesan before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:12:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3784,3784,'en','Pork stroganoff','Enjoy our stroganoff for a casual dinner party main. A great go-to dish, we’ve made it with pork and added Dijon mustard and extra mushrooms for more oomph','["3 tbsp sunflower oil","500g chestnut mushrooms, sliced","400g pork fillet, cut into 1cm pieces","2 onions, sliced into half moons","1 tbsp smoked paprika","2tsp Dijon mustard","200ml pork or chicken stock","284ml or 300ml pot soured cream","2 tbsp chopped parsley","cooked rice, potatoes or tagliatelle, to serve"]','["Heat 2 tsp of the oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat and fry half the mushrooms for a few minutes until their liquid is released and evaporates. Remove from the pan and set aside, then repeat with the remaining mushrooms and another 2 tsp oil. Set aside. In the same pan, fry the pork for 5-8 mins in 2 tsp oil until browned. Set aside.","Fry the onions in the remaining 1 tbsp oil over a low-medium heat until beginning to caramelise, around 10-12 mins, then tip the mushrooms back in along with the pork. Sprinkle over the paprika and spoon in the Dijon mustard. Give everything a good mix to combine. Pour in the stock, season well with salt and pepper, then mix again. At this point, you can remove from the heat, leave to cool, then cover and chill.Will keep chilled for three days or frozen for up to three months.When ready to serve, defrost fully before bringing to a simmer and continuing with the recipe.","Stir through the soured cream. Cook for about 2 mins more to ensure the meat is piping hot, then scatter over the chopped parsley. Serve with rice, potatoes or tagliatelle, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3785,3786,'en','Celeriac soup','Let this hearty celeriac soup warm you up on cold days. Top with our hazelnut crumble for added crunch and serve for lunch or as a starter to a winter menu','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, sliced","2 celery sticks, diced","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 small celeriac (about 800g), peeled and diced","500ml vegetable stock","¼ tsp ground nutmeg","50ml low-fat crème fraîche","2 tbsp hazelnuts, roughly chopped","2 tbsp panko breadcrumbs","small handful of chives, finely chopped"]','["Heat half the oil in a large saucepan over a medium-low heat. Sweat the onion, celery and garlic with the pan partially covered by the lid for 15 mins, until softened. Tip in the celeriac and pour over the stock. Bring to a simmer, cover, and cook for 15-20 mins, until the celeriac is tender. Remove from the heat, stir in the nutmeg, crème fraîche and some seasoning. Blitz with ahand blenderuntil smooth.","Meanwhile, heat the remaining oil in a frying pan over a medium heat. Fry the hazelnuts and breadcrumbs gently for a few minutes, until toasted. Put in a bowl, stir in the chives and season. Ladle the soup into bowls and spoon over the hazelnut crumble to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3787,3787,'en','Apple flapjacks','These flapjacks add a fruity twist to the classic oat bakes with a mixture of fresh and dried apple, and they’re a winning snack for the whole family when you’re on the go or out on a picnic.','["175g butter, plus extra for the tin","2-3 apples (about 350g), peeled, cored and chopped into small pieces","200g golden syrup","150g light brown soft sugar","300g porridge oats","50g dried apples, chopped","1/2 tsp ground cinnamon (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Butter the base of a 20 x 20cm square tin and line with baking parchment. Tip the chopped apples into a smallsaucepanwith 2 tsp water and cook over a medium heat for 3-4 mins until the apples are just soft enough to crush, but there’s still a little water left in the pan. If needed, add a little more water and cook the apples for slightly longer. Remove from the heat and crush the apples using a potato masher or a fork to break up slightly, then tip into a bowl and set aside.","Tip the butter, golden syrup and sugar into the pan and warm through over a low heat until the butter has melted and the sugar has dissolved. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Combine the oats, dried apple and cinnamon, if using, in a large bowl. Tip in the buttery syrup mix and cooked apples, then stir to combine. Tip the flapjack mixture into the prepared tin and press down firmly. Level the surface using a spatula, then bake for 25-30 mins until golden and bubbling at the sides. Leave to cool. Cut into 16 pieces.Will keep in an airtight container for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:12:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3789,3789,'en','Tiramisu meringue roulade','Combine tiramisu and meringue roulade to make an impressive dessert. The crisp meringue contrasts beautifully with the silky coffee cream in this recipe','["4 large egg whites at room temperature","200g caster sugar","icing sugar and cocoa powder, for dusting","200ml double cream","50g dark brown soft sugar","150g mascarpone","3 tbsp masala coffee liqueur or normal coffee liqueur (optional)","4 tbsp instant coffee, dissolved in 50ml boiling water and left to cool slightly","100g dark chocolate, melted and left to cool slightly"]','["First, make the ganache. Whisk the coffee and melted chocolate together until you have a smooth, glossy mixture. Leave to cool and thicken, stirring occasionally.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a 23 x 32cm baking tray with baking parchment. For the meringue, beat the egg whites and a pinch of salt with an electric whisk until stiffened slightly.","Add 1 tbsp of the caster sugar to the egg whites, then whisk again to stiff peaks. Repeat with the rest of the sugar, a spoonful at a time, until the mixture is thick and shiny. Spread evenly into the tray, then bake for 15-20 mins, or until crisp to the touch and lightly golden in places. Leave to cool completely.","For the mascarpone cream filling, put the cream, sugar, mascarpone and liqueur, if using, in a medium bowl and whisk until thickened.","To assemble, sift some icing sugar over a large sheet of baking parchment, then carefully flip the cooled meringue onto it. Lift off the tin and peel away the baking parchment. With a short end facing you, score a line 2cm into the edge of the meringue. Spread the ganache evenly over the meringue, then top with the cream, smoothing it with a palette knife, then carefully roll into a roulade, starting from the scored end and using the parchment to help. Transfer to a serving plate and dust with cocoa powder."]','2026-01-10 12:12:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3791,3791,'en','Keto bread','Try this keto almond bread for a healthy bread replacement that’s made with nuts and seeds. The loaf will be slightly wet but you can dry the slices in an oven or toast them','["60g coconut oil, melted, plus extra for the tin","100g almond flour","12g psyllium husk","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp baking soda","100g milled seeds (we used 50g sunflower seeds and 50g pumpkin seeds)","20g coconut flour","12g milled flaxseed","3g salt","3 eggs, beaten","1 medium courgette, grated","1 tbsp apple cider vinegar"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Oil and line a 900g loaf tin with baking parchment. Set aside.","Put all the dry ingredients in a largemixing bowl, stir together and set aside.","Put the coconut oil, eggs, courgette and 115ml hot water in a separate large mixing bowl, then tip into the bowl with the dry ingredients and combine. Stir in the apple cider vinegar, mixing gently – try not to overmix the dough.","Transfer the mix to the loaf tin. Wet your fingers to smooth the top of the bread, or use the back of a spoon. Bake for 20 mins, then reduce the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2 and bake for 30 mins more. Remove from the oven and leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then transfer to acooling rack. Slice the bread and toast the slices in a pan or oven."]','2026-01-10 12:12:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3793,3793,'en','Apple & feta salad','Combine apples, mixed leaves and feta to make this versatile salad with lemon, olive oil and honey dressing – you could also sprinkle over some pul biber, if you like','["3 small red apples (such as Braeburn or Gala), cored, quartered and cut into 4 slices per quarter","100g mixed leaves","200g feta, broken into small chunks","1 lemon, zested and juiced","2 tbsp olive oil","2 heaped tbsp clear honey","a couple of pinches of pul biber (optional)"]','["Toss the apples and leaves together and arrange on a platter. Dot with the feta, then scatter over the lemon zest.","Combine the lemon juice, olive oil, honey, a generous grinding of freshly ground black pepper and a good pinch of salt. Drizzle the dressing over the salad and sprinkle with some pul biber, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:12:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3795,3795,'en','Air fryer halloumi','Cooking halloumi in an air fryer instead of a grill or frying pan helps lower the fat content. Season with smoked paprika or mixed herbs, if you like, for an added burst of flavour','["225g halloumi, cut into 6cm x 1cm thick slices","1 tsp olive oil","1 tsp smoked paprika, mixed herbs, or other flavourings (optional)"]','["Heat yourair fryeron 200C for 2 mins. Carefully pat the halloumi dry using kitchen paper or a clean cloth, then brush or rub with oil. Season with salt and pepper and any flavourings, if using.","Put the halloumi in the air fryer basket and cook for 8 mins until beginning to brown. Flip over and cook for a further 2-5 mins until crisp and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:12:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3797,3797,'en','Classic waffles','Make savoury or sweet waffles using this all-in-one batter mix. For even lighter waffles, whisk the egg white until fluffy, then fold through the batter','["1 egg","225g self-raising flour","1 tbsp golden caster sugar (optional)","250ml milk","50g butter, melted and cooled","½ tsp vanilla extract (optional)","1 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","maple syrup and icing sugar, to serve (optional)"]','["Crack the egg (for fluffier waffles, use only the yolk at this stage) into a large bowl, then tip in the flour and a generous pinch of salt. Add the sugar, if using, then gradually whisk in the milk followed by the melted butter until smooth. Whisk in the vanilla, if using. If you''ve chosen to make fluffier waffles, whisk the egg white to soft peaks, then gently fold this into the batter. Alternatively, make the batter by blitzing all the ingredients together using ablenderorhand blender.Can be made 1-2 hrs ahead and chilled.","Heat awaffle makerfollowing the manufacturer''s instructions, brush with a little of the oil, then ladle in enough batter to just cover the surface. Cook following the manufacturer''s instructions (usually 5-6 mins) until the waffles are golden brown and crisp. Serve immediately or keep warm in a low oven while you make the rest. Drizzle with maple syrup or sprinkle with icing sugar, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3799,3799,'en','Vegetable & bean chilli','This healthy veggie chilli makes for a quick and satisfying supper, crammed with pulses and colourful fresh vegetables','["1tbsp olive oil","1 clove garlic , finely chopped","ginger , finely chopped","1 large onion , chopped","2 courgettes , diced","1 red pepper , deseeded and chopped","1 yellow pepper , deseeded and chopped","1tbsp chilli powder","100g red lentils , washed and drained","1tbsp tomato purée","2x cans chopped tomatoes","195g can sweetcorn , drained","420g can butter beans , drained","400g can kidney beans in water, drained"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Cook the garlic, ginger, onion, courgettes and peppers for about 5 mins until starting to soften. Add the chilli powder and cook for 1 min more.","Stir in the lentils, tomato purée, tomatoes and 250ml water. Bring to the boil and cook for 15-20 mins.","Add the sweetcorn and beans, and cook for a further 10 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:12:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3801,3801,'en','Sugar-free banana bread','This recipe is naturally sweetened with fruit and an optional drizzle of agave syrup meaning less added sugar is required in this banana bread','["125g self-raising wholemeal flour","½ tsp baking powder","2 tsp ground cinnamon","75g sultana","50g butter, melted","2 tsp vanilla essence","1 egg","1 tbsp milk","3 ripe bananas, mashed","drizzle agave syrup, to serve (optional)"]','["Grown ups:Preheat the oven to 180C/ 160C fan/ gas mark 4. Grease and line a 450g loaf/1lb tin with baking parchment.","Children:Weigh the flour, baking powder, cinnamon and sultanas into a bowl and mix with a wooden spoon. Then weigh the butter, vanilla essence, egg, milk and mashed bananas and put into another bowl or jug and mix with a small balloon whisk or fork. Pour the ‘wet’ banana mixture into the ‘dry’ flour mixture and combine thoroughly with a wooden spoon. Weighing needs to be very accurate when baking so help older children to measure carefully. Younger children can also get involved by spooning or pouring into the scales with adult supervision. Younger children can also beat the egg with a fork and mash the banana with a potato masher.","Grown ups:Pour the cake mixture into the prepared tin and bake for 30 - 40 mins or until a skewer inserted in the middle comes out clean. Remove from the oven, allow to cool in the tin for 10 mins then turn out.","Children:Drizzle with agave syrup if using."]','2026-01-10 12:12:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3803,3803,'en','Chocolate Christmas biscuits','These easy chocolate biscuits are the perfect Christmas treat that both kids and adults will love. Get the whole family involved with decoration','["270g plain flour","50g cocoa powder","120g icing sugar","150g butter","2 eggs","melted chocolate or piping icing, sugar pearls, sprinkles"]','["Mix the flour, cocoa, icing sugar and a pinch of salt in a bowl. Rub in the butter and then mix in eggs. Knead quickly with your hands to a smooth dough. Wrap in foil, press into a flat disc and chill for 30 minutes.","Heat the oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Line a couple of baking sheets with baking parchment. Roll out the pastry on a lightly floured worksurface to about 3mm thin. Cut out shapes from the dough. Put the biscuits on the baking sheets – it’s best to put similarly sized cookies together. Bake for 7-10 minutes, depending on the size of the biscuits.","Knead the off-cuts of the dough together and chill again for 15 minutes. Roll, cut and bake as before. Cool completely.","When cooled, the cookies can be decorated with chocolate or icing and sugar pearls and sprinkles."]','2026-01-10 12:12:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3805,3805,'en','Strawberry crumble buns','Celebrate strawberry season with these moreish crumble buns. These eye-catching desserts are perfect for summer and make an impressive sweet treat','["120g butter, 70g at room temperature and 50g chilled and cubed","370g plain flour","2 eggs","135g caster sugar","7g dried fast action yeast","100ml milk, lukewarm","250g strawberries, halved"]','["Melt the 70g butter and let it cool. Sift 300g flour into a bowl, add the eggs, 75g sugar and the yeast and mix everything with a spoon. Slowly add the lukewarm milk and cooled butter. Mix until all ingredients are well combined into a very soft, sticky dough. Cover the bowl with a clean cloth and put in a warm place to rise for 40–60 mins until doubled in volume.","To make the crumble, combine the remaining flour with the remaining sugar and chilled butter. Rub the butter into the flour until you have a breadcrumb-like texture. Chill.","When the dough has risen, divide it into six portions, squashing it down slightly and then shape each into a ball on a floured worksurface – the dough may still be sticky, so dust it with flour and work quickly. Flatten the balls gently with your hand so that they look like buns. Put on a baking tray lined with baking parchment.","Divide the strawberries between the buns, putting them in the centre of each and sprinkle with crumble. Heat the oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Bake the buns for 25 mins until puffed and cooked. Cool and then dust with icing sugar, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3807,3807,'en','Milk-free cake','Try this simple chocolate and vanilla sponge cake for an easy, milk-free weekend bake. It uses an all-in-one method to save time in the kitchen','["250g butter","4 eggs","250g sugar","250g plain flour","80g vanilla pudding (or cornflour plus 1 tsp vanilla extract)","5g baking powder","5ml vanilla extract","20g cocoa","icing sugar for dusting"]','["Start by melting the butter and cooling it down. Heat the oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Beat the eggs with the sugar in a mixer until pale and fluffy, then fold in the flour, vanilla pudding, baking powder, vanilla and cooled butter to make a smooth batter.","Pour ¾ of the prepared dough into a 950g loaf tin or 20cm round lined cake tin, and add the cocoa to the remaining batter. Pour the chocolate mixture down the centre of the pale batter. Bake for 40 mins. After baking, cool the cake and sprinkle it with icing sugar or cover it with chocolate glaze, if you prefer."]','2026-01-10 12:12:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3809,3809,'en','Gingery broccoli-fry with cashews','Try our gingery broccoli-fry for a healthy veggie dinner. It’s a bit like fried rice but with antioxidant-rich broccoli instead','["320g head of broccoli, stalks and florets separated","40g cashews, roughly chopped","1 tbsp sesame oil","15g ginger, finely sliced","1 small red onion, finely chopped","1 red pepper, deseeded and cut into thin strips","1 large carrot (160g), cut into thin strips","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped, plus extra sliced, to serve","1 tbsp tamari","1 lime, juiced and zested","7g chopped coriander, plus extra to serve","2 eggs, beaten"]','["Blitz the broccoli stalks in afood processoruntil finely chopped. Add the florets and pulse again to achieve a rice-like texture.","Lightly toast the cashews in awokor frying pan, then tip onto a plate and set aside. Heat the oil in a pan over a high heat and add the ginger, onion, pepper, carrot, garlic and chilli. Stir-fry for 2-3 mins until starting to brown, then put a lid on and cook for another 2 mins.","Add the broccoli and 3 tbsp water and stir-fry for 3 mins until all the veg is tender. Pour in the tamari, lime juice and zest and coriander, stir well, then pour in the eggs and stir-fry very briefly to just set. Serve with the cashews, extra coriander and extra sliced chilli scattered over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3811,3811,'en','Quinoa salad with shredded greens & raisins','Showcase quinoa in this wonderful salad, with greens, avocado, feta and raisins. Rather than a grain, quinoa is a seed and is a great source of protein','["150g quinoa","3 tbsp balsamic vinegar","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","200g cavolo nero, shredded","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 green pepper, deseeded and chopped into small pieces","30g raisins","2 small avocados, chopped","40g vegetarian feta"]','["Rinse the quinoa in asieveunder running water until the water runs clear, then cook for 20 mins following pack instructions. Leave to rest for 5 mins. Rinse again and drain well by pressing in the sieve.","Meanwhile, put the vinegar and oil in a large bowl, add the cavolo nero and massage in the dressing with your hands to soften it.","Add the quinoa, onion, pepper and raisins, then toss well. Spoon half onto plates, scatter over 1 chopped avocado, crumble in half the feta and toss.The remainder will keep chilled for up to three days.Top with the remaining avocado and feta, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3813,3813,'en','Polish chocolate & walnut cake','This deliciously delicate chocolate layer cake is a true showstopping bake. Stack up chocolate sponge, chocolate glaze and crunchy walnuts','["150g plain flour, plus 1 tbsp","50g cocoa","8 eggs, separated","200g caster sugar","5 eggs, separated (keep the yolks for the custard)","200g caster sugar","250g walnuts, a couple of handfuls saved for decoration and the rest chopped","1 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp potato starch","100g double cream","100g chocolate, chopped"]','["Before making the cake, take the eggs and butter out of the fridge to let them warm to room temperature.","Heat the oven to 170C/fan 150C/gas 3½. Sift the flour and mix it with cocoa. Beat the egg whites until stiff, then add the sugar to them in small batches. Then add the egg yolks one by one, whisking constantly. Sift the flour mixed with cocoa on the egg mixture and gently fold everything together with a spatula. Pour the prepared batter into a 30cm x 22cm shallow baking tin lined with baking parchment and bake it for 35 mins. Cool for 5 mins, remove from the tin and re-line the tin.","To make the meringue,whisk the whites until stiff, gradually adding the sugar, one tablespoon at a time. When you have a stiff and shiny meringue, fold in the finely chopped walnuts, flour and potato flour. Spread the mixture into the tin and cook for 40 mins. Carefully remove from the oven and leave to cool.","For the chocolate glaze, heat the cream over low heat, then remove from the heat, pour the chopped chocolate into it and mix it until it dissolves and the glaze becomes shiny and uniform.","Cut the cooled chocolate sponge cake into two layers. Put the nut meringue on top of the bottom layer of sponge and sprinkle on some of the reserved walnuts. Add another layer of meringue and then the upper layer of chocolate sponge cake and cover the top with chocolate glaze. Decorate with walnuts. Put the finished cake in the fridge for 1-2 hours before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:12:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3815,3815,'en','Spicy microwave popcorn','Enjoy a snack that’s healthier than crisps. Sesame oil adds flavour and helps the spices stick to the popcorn, but you can use olive or rapeseed oil instead','["50g corn kernels","1 tbsp sesame oil","1 tsp garlic granules","2-3 tsp smoked paprika"]','["Tip the corn kernels into a large heatproof bowl, cover andmicrowavefor 5-8 mins, or until the popping stops.","Stir in the oil and spices, and toss well to coat.Will keep in an airtight container for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:12:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3817,3817,'en','Blackberry Victoria sponge','Master Victoria sponge cake with this recipe for younger cooks, which features an easy-to-follow method. Kids can adapt it with different jams and fruits','["200g butter, softened, plus a little for greasing","200g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","4 medium eggs","200g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","250ml double cream","1 tbsp icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","250g blackberries","pastry brush","2 x 20cm round loose-bottom cake tins","cloth","large mixing bowl","weighing scales","measuring spoons","electric hand whisk","small bowl","spatula","oven gloves","skewer","cooling rack","measuring jug","small sieve or icing shaker"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Use a pastry brush to brush two 20cm round cake tins with a little butter, then line them with baking parchment (see How to Line a Cake Tin).","Place a clean cloth under a large bowl – this will keep it steady as you mix. Weigh the butter, caster sugar and vanilla extract into the bowl.","Make sure the whisk attachments are fitted securely in your hand whisk, then plug it in. Turn the whisk on to a medium speed and use it to whisk the ingredients together for 2 mins, or until they look smooth and creamy. Make sure you keep your fingers away from the whisk while it’s turned on.","Crack the eggs into a small bowl. Continue whisking the butter and sugar and use your other hand to tip in the eggs, one at a time. Mix for 1 min more or until smooth.","Weigh the flour and add it to the bowl. Use aspatulato fold the ingredients together until there are no pockets of flour and the cake mixture is smooth.","Use yourspatulato divide the cake mixture evenly between the cake tins, then spread the mixture to the edges and smooth the surface.","Useoven glovesto place the tins on the middle shelf of the oven and set a timer for 22 mins. When the timer beeps, use your oven gloves to pull the oven rack out of the oven slightly but leave the cakes inside, they should be risen and golden brown. Insert a skewer into the centre of the cakes to check if they’re cooked: if the skewer comes out dry, they’re cooked; if there is any wet cake mixture on the skewer, the cakes need a little longer in the oven. If this is the case, return them to the oven and bake for another 5 mins, then check again.","Use your oven gloves to carefully remove the cakes from the oven, place them on a cooling rack and allow to cool for 15 mins in the tin. When cool enough to handle, turn the cakes out onto the rack and remove the baking parchment, then leave until completely cool.","Measure the double cream in a jug and pour it into a largemixing bowl. Measure the icing sugar in a measuring spoon and add it to the cream. Use your electric hand whisk to whip the cream until it is softly whipped, like clouds.","Place one of the cakes on a plate or cake stand, then use a spatula or palette knife to spread the cream over the cake in an even layer. Put the blackberries on top of the cream, then put the other cake on top. Use a sieve or icing shaker to dust the cake with a little icing sugar. This is best served straight away but will keep in the fridge for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:12:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3818,3818,'en','Smoothie cubes','A great idea for a quick, cooling and healthy drink, especially for breakfast','["blackberries, strawberries, raspberries, passion fruit, mango, any other fruits you like"]','["Purée a fruit (try blackberries, strawberries, raspberries, passion fruit and mango, in a food processor, leave pips in or sieve.","Freeze in ice trays ready to whizz up (3 per serving) with a banana, 150ml pot plain yogurt, and milk and honey to taste."]','2026-01-10 12:12:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3819,3819,'en','Microwave scrambled eggs','Rustle up a delicious breakfast of scrambled eggs in no time – this protein-rich dish takes just four minutes in the microwave','["2 eggs","2 tbsp whole milk","toast, to serve"]','["Use a fork to beat together the eggs, milk and a pinch of salt in a microwave-safe jug. Cook in themicrowaveon High for 30 seconds, then beat again and return to the microwave for another 30 seconds.","Beat again, breaking up any lumps of egg. Microwave for another 15 seconds, then beat again; the eggs will be loose at this stage so serve them straightaway if this is how you like them. If you prefer your eggs a little firmer, microwave for a further 15 seconds, beat, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3821,3821,'en','Taramasalata','Whip up homemade taramasalata instead of using shop-bought. It’s easier than you might think and is a great addition to a grazing platter','["100g crustless stale white bread (about 5-6 slices)","250g smoked cod''s roe","½ red onion, chopped","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 lemon, juiced","75ml olive oil, plus a drizzle to serve","75ml sunflower oil","toasted pittas, to serve"]','["Soak the bread in a bowl of cold water, then squeeze out the excess and tip into afood processoror blender. Cut through the thick skin of the roe lobes, scrape out the soft roe underneath and tip into the food processor with the bread. Add the onion, garlic, lemon juice and a good grind of black pepper, then whizz to a paste.","With the motor running, gradually drizzle in the olive oil, then the sunflower oil, until everything is incorporated and you have a slightly thicker paste. Scrape the taramasalata into a serving bowl, drizzle with a little more olive oil and serve with toasted pittas for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:12:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3823,3823,'en','Air fryer sausages','Cook sausages quickly and easily using an air fryer and without the need for additional oil','["6 sausages of your choice"]','["Pierce the sausages a few times all over using a sharpknife(this is optional, but will help release more fat). Arrange the sausages in a single layer in an air fryer basket.","Set theair fryerto 180C and cook for 10-15 mins, turning every 5 mins, until the sausages are cooked through. If you have a meat thermometer, check they have reached 75C in the middle. Serve as a side for breakfast or in buns."]','2026-01-10 12:12:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3825,3825,'en','Air fryer chicken breasts','Use an air fryer to create this tempting dish of tender chicken breasts coated in garlic, sweet paprika and herbs. Mix up the spices for interest or keep it plain if you prefer','["4 chicken breasts","½ tbsp rapeseed oil","1 tsp salt","1 ½ tsp garlic granules","1 tsp smoked sweet paprika","2 tsp mixed herbs","½ tsp pepper","steamed rice and greens such as broccoli or green beans or a green salad, to serve (optional)"]','["Coat the chicken in the oil and set aside. In a bowl, combine the salt, garlic, paprika and mixed herbs with a good grinding of black pepper, then scatter onto a plate.","Roll each oiled chicken breast in the seasoning and put in yourair fryerbasket. Cook at 180C for 18-20 mins, turning after 10 mins. To check it is cooked, pierce the chicken with a knife at the thickest part to see if the juices run clear. Or insert a temperature thermometer and it should read 70C. Serve with rice and greens or a salad."]','2026-01-10 12:12:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3827,3827,'en','Air fryer salmon','Salmon fillets cook beautifully in an air fryer and make a delicious meal when coated in a herb seasoning and served with greens and grains','["1 tsp salt","1 tsp pepper","1 tsp mixed herbs","1 tsp garlic granules (optional)","4 salmon fillets (we used 4 x 130g fillets), skin on or removed","½ tbsp olive oil","cooked seasonal greens and grains such as quinoa or brown rice, to serve (optional)"]','["Combine the salt, pepper, mixed herbs and garlic granules, if using, in a bowl, then scatter onto a plate. Rub each salmon fillet with a little olive oil and roll in the seasoning to coat.","Put in theair fryerbasket in one layer and cook at 180C for 8-10 mins, until cooked through. If you have larger salmon fillets they will need to be cooked for longer – keep checking after 10 mins and cook in 1-2 min blasts, until ready. Serve with greens and quinoa or rice, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3829,3829,'en','Air fryer chicken thighs','Cooking chicken thighs in an air fryer is a speedy way to achieve succulent meat with a delicious crispy skin. A spicy coating makes the perfect finishing touch','["1 tsp paprika","½ tsp mixed herbs","½ tsp garlic granules (optional)","4 chicken thighs, bone in","1 tsp olive oil"]','["Combine the paprika in a bowl with the herbs and garlic granules, if using, together with ½ tsp salt and ½ tsp ground black pepper. Scatter onto a plate. Rub the chicken thighs with the oil, then coat in the spice mix.","Put in the basket of yourair fryerand cook, skin-side down, for 10 mins. Turn over and cook for a further 10-15 mins until cooked through and the skin is crispy. To check they are cooked, pierce the thickest part of the thigh with a knife to see if the juices run clear. Remove from the air fryer immediately to stop the skin from softening."]','2026-01-10 12:12:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3831,3831,'en','Easy pesto','Blend together pine nuts or cashews, basil, parmesan, garlic and olive oil to make your own pesto. It’s perfect for pizzas, pasta and sandwiches','["50g pine nuts or cashews","large bunch of basil, leaves picked","50g parmesan or vegetarian alternative","1 garlic clove, chopped","100ml olive oil"]','["Toast the nuts in a pan over a low heat. Tip into a mini chopper with the remaining ingredients, or use a largepestle and mortar, then blitz or pound into a rough sauce. Will keep for three days in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:12:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3833,3833,'en','Classic white loaf','Begin your bread-baking journey with this simple white loaf – once you’ve conquered this, you’ll be able to move on to more advanced recipes','["500g strong white flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","sunflower oil, for proving"]','["Tip the flour, yeast and 1 tsp salt into a large bowl and make a well in the middle. Pour in just under 350ml lukewarm water and use your fingers or a wooden spoon to mix the flour mixture and water together – you should have a slightly wet, pillowy, workable dough, so add a splash more water if needed.","Tip the dough onto a lightly floured surface and knead for at least 10 mins, or until smooth and elastic. Or, do this in a stand mixer fitted with the dough hook for 3-5 mins. Put the dough in a clean oiled bowl, cover and leave to prove until doubled in size, about 1-2 hrs.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Knock back the dough by tipping it back onto the floured surface and pushing the air out with the palms of your hands. Form the dough into a ball, transfer to a baking sheet, cover with a clean tea towel and leave to prove again for 40-45 mins, or until roughly doubled in size again.","Dust the top of the loaf with a little flour and slash a cross into the top with asharp knife, if you like. Bake for 15 mins, then reduce the heat to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and bake for 30 mins more until the loaf sounds hollow when tapped on the underside. Transfer to awire rackand leave to cool completely.Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days or frozen for a month."]','2026-01-10 12:12:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3835,3835,'en','Vanilla pavlova with pineapple & passion fruit','Prep all the elements for these pavlovas and let the kids build them. Pineapple and passion fruit is a great springtime combination, or try berries in the summer','["3 egg whites","115g caster sugar","2 tsp cornflour","1 tsp lemon juice","200g crème fraîche","25g icing sugar","¼ tsp vanilla extract","200g pineapple, chopped into small chunks","2 passion fruit, seeds scooped out","mint leaves, shredded (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 130C/110C fan/gas 1. Line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Draw four circles, 8-10cm in diameter, on the baking parchment, then flip over.Whiskthe egg whites in a large bowl using an electric whisk until stiff peaks form. Gradually whisk in the sugar until thick and glossy, then the cornflour and lemon juice. Pile the meringue in swirls onto the marked circles, making a dip in the middle, then bake on the lowest shelf for 55 mins-1 hr until crisp on the outside and dry underneath. Turn the oven off, leave the door ajar and leave the meringues to cool completely.Can be made a day ahead and kept in an airtight container.","Whisk the crème fraîche in a bowl with the icing sugar and vanilla extract until thick and pillowy. Mix the pineapple and passion fruit together in a separate bowl. To assemble, spoon a quarter of the crème fraîche mixture onto each meringue, top with pineapple and passion fruit and drizzle with the passion fruit juice. Finish with mint leaves to serve, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3837,3837,'en','Banoffee pie pancakes','This Pancake Day try a new take on banoffee pie. Sticky dulce de leche and sweet bananas make an irresistible topping for fluffy pancakes','["3 eggs","2 tbsp caster sugar","100g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","80ml milk","1 tbsp butter","1 tbsp sunflower oil","5 tbsp dulce de leche","2 bananas, sliced","1 digestive biscuit, crumbled","grated chocolate, to serve"]','["Separate the eggs, putting the whites in one bowl and 2 of the yolks in another bowl (use the third yolk in another recipe). Mix the yolks with the sugar, flour, baking powder and milk to make a smooth paste.","Beat the egg whites and a pinch of salt with an electric whisk (or by hand) until fluffy and holding their shape. Gently fold into the yolk mixture, being careful not to knock any of the air out.","Heat the butter and oil in a non-stick frying pan over a medium heat. Dollop a quarter (or half if making two larger pancakes) of the mixture into the pan and cook on each side for 1-2 mins or until golden brown. Repeat with the remaining mixture to make a total of 4 (or 2) pancakes. Keep them covered.","Gently warm the dulce de leche in a small saucepan until loosened. Serve the pancakes on two plates and top with the sliced banana, dulce de leche, crumbled biscuit and grated chocolate."]','2026-01-10 12:12:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3839,3839,'en','Spicy sweet potato hummus','Avoid waste and enjoy a filling snack by using leftover sweet potatoes in this hummus recipe – it has a spicy kick thanks to smoked paprika and chilli flakes','["2 medium sweet potatoes (about 400g), peeled and cut into 2cm cubes","3 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","1⁄2 tsp chilli flakes, plus extra to serve (optional)","1 tsp smoked paprika","3 garlic cloves, unpeeled","2 tbsp tahini","1 lemon, juiced","vegetable crudités, breadsticks or crackers and pitted olives, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the sweet potatoes onto abaking trayand drizzle over 1 tbsp olive oil. Sprinkle over the chilli flakes, if using, and the paprika, then toss to coat in the spiced oil. Spread out to a single layer. Trim away the root of the garlic cloves, then nestle these among the sweet potatoes. Roast for 30-35 mins until the potatoes have softened, tossing halfway through.","Remove the tray from the oven and leave to cool completely. Tip the sweet potatoes into afood processorand squeeze in the garlic from its skin. Add the tahini and lemon juice, then blitz for 1 min until the potatoes have broken down.","With the motor running, gradually pour in the remaining olive oil. Continue to blitz for up to 4 mins, or until you have a smooth paste. Pour in 50-60ml cold water to loosen, blitz again to combine, then season to taste. Spoon the hummus into a bowl and swirl with the back of a teaspoon, then drizzle over a little more olive oil and scatter with extra chili flakes, if you like. Serve with your choice of veg crudités, breadsticks or crackers and olives for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:12:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3841,3841,'en','Smashed cannellini bean crostini','Add a little more oil to this smashed cannellini bean dip, if you prefer – the more you add, the silkier it becomes','["4 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling (optional)","12 sage leaves (optional)","1 onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1⁄2 tsp cracked black pepper","400g can cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","1⁄2 lemon, juiced","12 crostini or breadsticks, to serve (see tip, below)"]','["Heat half the oil in a shallow saucepan over a low-medium heat and scatter in the sage leaves, if using. Fry for 2 mins until crisp, lift onto a plate using a slotted spoon. Tip the onion into the pan and cook for 3 mins until soft, then add the garlic and cook for 1 min more. Sprinkle in the pepper and toast for 1 min, then stir in the beans. Turn off the heat. Stir in the lemon juice.","Season the mixture with salt, then tip into afood processoror mini chopper with the remaining oil. Blitz everything together to your desired consistency – it can be a smooth or a rough paste.Will keep covered in the fridge for two days. Bring to room temperature 1 hour before serving.","Serve the dip as is with crostini or breadsticks, or drizzle with a little extra olive oil and top with the crispy sage leaves, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:12:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3843,3843,'en','Shaved fennel & rocket salad','Serve our fennel and rocket salad as a side – raw fennel can be fibrous, but finely slicing it before lightly pickling it in lemon juice breaks it down','["1 fennel bulb","1⁄2 tsp fennel seeds (optional)","1⁄2 lemon, juiced","2 tbsp olive oil","50g rocket"]','["Remove the fronds from the fennel bulb and set aside. Cut away any tough stalks, then thinly slice the bulb using a sharp knife or ideally amandoline. Tip the fennel slices into a bowl and, using your hands, scrunch through a large pinch of salt, the fennel seeds, if using, and the lemon juice. Cover and leave to stand at room temperature for at least 10 mins, or chill for up to a few hours.","To serve, drizzle the pickled fennel with the olive oil, then toss through the rocket and reserved fennel fronds. Serve directly from the bowl or pile onto plates."]','2026-01-10 12:12:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3845,3845,'en','Lemon & blueberry cheesecake tart','Combine the classic flavours of lemon and blueberries with a creamy cheesecake-inspired filling for this tart. It only takes 20 minutes to bake','["320g sheet ready-rolled puff pastry","1 egg, beaten","225g full-fat soft cheese","2 lemons, zested and 1 juiced","4 tbsp icing sugar, sieved","3 tbsp lemon curd","100g blueberries"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C/gas 6 with abaking trayinside to heat up. Unravel the puff pastry on its baking parchment and lightly score a border about 2cm from the edge all the way around the pastry. Brush a little of the beaten egg around the border, then set aside.","Whiskthe soft cheese, most of the lemon zest and all of the juice, 3 tbsp icing sugar and the rest of the beaten egg together in a medium bowl for 1 min until smooth and slightly thickened.","Spoon the cheesecake mixture over the middle of the tart base, spreading it to the edge of the border using a palette knife or the back of the spoon. Dot teaspoonfuls of the lemon curd on top and, using a cutlery or palette knife, gently swirl the curd into the cheesecake mixture to created a marbled effect. Sprinkle the blueberries over evenly, then carefully slide the tart onto the hot baking tray inside the oven and bake for 20-25 mins until the pastry is golden brown and crisp at the edges.","Leave the tart to cool completely or until just warm. Dust over the remaining icing sugar and sprinkle with the rest of the lemon zest, then cut into rectangles and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3847,3847,'en','Spring green salad with parsley & blue cheese','Serve this vibrant salad with blue cheese as a light supper or side dish. Kale or chard will also work in place of the spring greens','["300g baby leaf spring greens, any tough stalks removed, leaves finely sliced","½ large bunch of parsley, chopped","250g ready-cooked quinoa","1 small red onion, finely sliced","100g blue cheese, crumbled (ensure vegetarian if needed)","1 lemon, zested and juiced","1 tsp Dijon mustard","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","35g walnuts, roughly chopped (optional)"]','["Put thekettleon to boil. Tip the spring greens into a large heatproof bowl and cover with boiling water from the kettle, then leave to stand for 2 mins to soften slightly. Drain well, then tip onto a plate lined with kitchen paper. Spread the greens out in a single layer so the paper can absorb as much of the excess water as possible. Leave to cool for 2 mins.","Meanwhile, toss the parsley, quinoa and red onions together. Mix in the spring greens, then scatter over the cheese and toss gently with your hands to combine.","Whiskthe lemon zest and juice, the mustard and rapeseed oil together in a jug to make a dressing. Pour this over the spring green salad and toss gently to combine. Tip the salad onto a large serving platter or spoon into individual bowls and scatter over the walnuts, if using. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:12:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3849,3849,'en','Sweet & sour prawns','Transform prawns into a takeaway treat – sweet & sour prawns – in less time than it would take to have it delivered. Alternatively, try with chicken if you prefer','["300g raw king prawns","2 tbsp soy sauce","40g cornflour","sunflower oil, for deep-frying","handful of coriander leaves, roughly chopped","cooked rice, to serve","1 red onion, roughly chopped","2 red peppers, deseeded and roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","thumb-sized piece of ginger, finely grated","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","100ml malt vinegar","2 tbsp soy sauce","2 tbsp tomato ketchup"]','["Tip the prawns in a bowl and mix with the soy, then set aside for a few minutes. Stir in the cornflour.","Heat the oil in awokover a high heat to a depth of 3-4cm. When it’s shimmering or a cooking thermometer reads 170C, fry the prawns in batches for about 2 mins until crisp and golden, turning them with a slotted spoon halfway through. Carefully lift onto a plate using the slotted spoon. Turn off the heat. Leave the pan for a few minutes to cool down.","Carefully pour all but 1 tbsp oil from the wok – keep the remainder for use in another recipe or discard.","Put the wok back on a high heat. When the oil is shimmering, carefully add the onion and peppers, and stir-fry for 1 min. Add the garlic and ginger, and continue to cook for 30 seconds, then scatter over the sugar and pour in the vinegar. Turn up the heat and boil for 2 mins. Stir in the soy and ketchup to make a thick, glossy sauce. When you’re ready to serve, tip the prawns back into the pan and stir to coat in the sauce. Scatter over the chopped coriander and serve with cooked rice on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:12:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3851,3851,'en','Kale & kimchi fried rice','Bring fried rice to life in this speedy supper with punchy, fermented kimchi. If you don’t have kale, you can use pak choi or whatever greens you prefer','["100g kale","2 tbsp sesame oil","3 spring onions, sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","100g cooked basmati rice","120g kimchi","2 large eggs","a few coriander leaves, to serve","shichimi togarashi and chilli oil, to serve (optional)"]','["Bring a pan of salted water to the boil, add the kale and cook for 1 min. Drain and leave to steam-dry.","Heat half the oil in anon-stick frying panover a medium heat. Add the spring onions and garlic, and cook for 1 min. Turn the heat to high, stir in the rice and cook for 3 mins. Add the kimchi and kale, and stir until everything is warmed through.","Heat the remaining oil in separate pan set over a high heat. Crack in the eggs and cook undisturbed for several minutes or until crispy and golden around the edges and the yolks are still a little runny.","Divide the rice between two shallow bowls, top with the fried eggs, coriander, then the shichimi togarashi and chilli oil, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3853,3853,'en','Potato & celeriac kugel','Lighten the carb-load by replacing half the potato with celeriac in this potato kugel. Potato kugel is a traditional Jewish Sabbath side dish','["6 tbsp rapeseed oil, plus extra for the dish","2 medium onions, chopped","450g starchy potatoes, grated","450g celeriac, trimmed, peeled and grated","1 egg, lightly beaten","2 tbsp finely chopped parsley, plus a little extra to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and lightly oil a 25 x 20cm baking dish or roasting tin.","Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat. Fry the onions until lightly golden and soft, about 10 mins. Remove from the pan and set aside.","Put the grated potato and celeriac in a large microwaveable bowl. Add a tablespoon of water and cook on high for 1 min (or steam in a tiered steamer for 2-3 mins).","Drain off any moisture from the veg and add the fried onions, 3 tbsp rapeseed oil, the beaten egg and parsley. Season with 1 tsp salt and some black pepper. Stir well to combine and spoon into the prepared dish. Press down lightly to compact the vegetables and brush the remaining tablespoon of oil over the top.","Bake for 45 mins-1 hr until the top is golden brown and crisp and the centre soft. Scatter over a little more parsley to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3855,3855,'en','Fried prawns with garlicky hot pepper sauce','Try this classic Korean-Chinese dish; a twist on sweet and sour prawns. The prawns are battered, fried and enrobed in a spicy, garlicky sauce','["vegetable oil, for frying","700g large prawns, peeled, deveined and patted dry","65g cornflour","95g potato starch","50g plain flour","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 egg white","1 tsp vegetable oil","3 tbsp caster sugar","4½ tsp tomato purée","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp rice vinegar","1 tsp gochujang","1-2 tsp sriracha, chilli sauce or chilli-garlic sauce, depending on how hot you like it","1 tsp toasted sesame oil","1 tsp cornflour","1 tbsp vegetable oil","3 tbsp diced onion","6 garlic cloves, grated or finely chopped","1 fresh Korean red chilli, or fresno chilli, diced","1 fresh Korean green chilli or jalapeño, diced","handful of spring onions, sliced on an angle","cooked white rice"]','["In a large, wide, heavy-based pan at least 13cm deep, heat 5cm of vegetable oil over a medium-high heat (make sure the pan is no more than two-thirds full) until it reaches 190C. While the oil is heating, make the batter.Whisktogether the cornflour, potato starch, flour and bicarbonate of soda in a bowl with a pinch of salt. Add the egg white, vegetable oil and 120ml water and whisk to form a thick batter.","Working in batches, coat the prawns in the batter, letting any excess drip back into the bowl. Carefully lower the prawns into the hot oil, one at a time, and fry, stirring occasionally, until golden brown, about 1½ mins. Transfer to awire rackor paper-lined plate to drain. Repeat with the remaining prawns, letting the oil return to 190C between batches.","Let the oil return to 190C, then carefully return the prawns to the oil and fry a second time for 1½-2 mins until very crisp. Transfer to a wire rack or paper-lined plate to drain. Set aside.","To make the sauce, whisk together the sugar, tomato purée, soy sauce, vinegar, gochujang, sriracha and sesame oil in a bowl with the remaining cornflour and 60ml water until the sugar has dissolved. Set aside.","Heat the vegetable oil in a large frying pan over a medium-high heat and add the onion, garlic, red and green chillies. Cook for about 30 seconds, stirring, until just fragrant. Add the sauce mixture and cook for about 45 seconds, stirring, until the sauce thickens and becomes glossy. Add the fried prawns, toss quickly to coat and transfer to a platter. Scatter over the spring onions and serve immediately with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:12:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3858,3858,'en','Kalakand','Make this aromatic Indian sweetmeat for a treat. It has a soft and grainy texture and is infused with cardamom and rosewater','["6 cardamom pods, seeds removed","1 tsp caster sugar","250g homemade paneer, roughly crumbled (see related recipes, below)","397g tin condensed milk","few drops of rosewater","3 tbsp chopped pistachios"]','["Pound the cardamom seeds to a powder with the sugar using apestle and mortar.","Heat the paneer, condensed milk and cardamom mixture in awokor karahi over a medium heat, stirring often to prevent sticking. Once it comes to a boil, turn the heat to low and cook, stirring continuously, for 5-7 mins, until the mixture thickens and leaves the sides of the pan. Aim for a soft, dropping consistency with a grainy texture.","Turn the heat off and add enough rosewater to lend a subtle flavour. Leave to cool and thicken in the pan for 10 mins.","Line abaking traywith baking parchment. Spread the kalakand out to a 2cm-thick rectangle. Press the pistachios onto the surface and leave to cool before chilling in the fridge.","Once the kalakand is firm, cut it into 3cm squares and serve at room temperature.Will keep for up to four days in an airtight container in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:12:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3860,3860,'en','Aloo chaat','Enjoy a popular Indian festival snack. These lemony fried potatoes are seasoned with cumin and chaat masala, with green chilli, red onion and pomegranate','["750g potatoes (Maris Piper or King Edward)","1 small red onion, finely diced","30g ginger, peeled and finely grated","2 green chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","1 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp chaat masala","½ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","½ tsp coarsely ground black peppercorns","1 lemon, juiced","1 litre sunflower oil, for deep frying","2 tbsp coriander relish (see ''goes well with'' below)","4 tbsp date and tamarind sauce (see ''goes well with'' below)","2 tbsp roughly chopped coriander","3 tbsp pomegranate seeds"]','["Peel the potatoes, cut them into 3cm chunks, and rinse under cold running water for 2 mins. Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil, add the potatoes and simmer, uncovered, until tender. Drain and tip the potatoes onto a cooling rack. Leave to cool, then chill them for 30 mins - this will dry the surface.","Mix the onion with the ginger, green chillies, cumin, chaat masala, chilli powder and black pepper. Add the lemon juice and set aside.","Heat the oil in awokor karahi to 180C, or when a cube of bread browns in 30 seconds. Deep-fry the potatoes in batches until golden, drain on kitchen paper, and season with salt.","Mix the warm potatoes with the onion and chilli mixture. Drizzle with date and tamarind sauce, spoon over the coriander relish, and sprinkle with coriander and pomegranate seeds. Serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:12:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3862,3862,'en','Freaky fruit platter','Tuck into ghoulish grape snakes, apple fangs, lychee eyeballs and more with this freaky fruit platter, sure to tickle and terrify Halloween guests!','["70g white chocolate, plus extra for sticking on the eyeballs","3 small bananas, peeled and cut in half crosswise","eyeball cake decorations or black writing icing or edible ink pen","small piece of celery","6 small tangerines, peeled","1 red apple, cored and cut into 6 wedges","2 tbsp nut butter (we used almond)","25g yogurt-coated raisins","425g can lychees in juice, drained","150g blueberries","eyeball cake decorations or skewers","250g black and green grapes","short wooden skewers","black writing icing or edible ink pen, or eyeball cake decorations"]','["For the mummy bananas, melt the chocolate in a heatproof bowl set over a small pan of simmering water or in themicrowavein 20-second bursts. Cool to room temperature. Put the bananas on a tray lined with baking parchment and drizzle over the chocolate in a criss-cross pattern to make ‘bandages’. Stick on the eyeball decorations or use black icing or an edible ink pen to draw the eyes on the bananas, then chill until set, about 30 mins (they will start to discolour after about 2 hrs).","For the tangerine pumpkins, cut tiny ‘stalks’ from the celery piece and push these into the tops of the tangerines where the segments come together.","For the apple fangs, cut a small wedge from the peel side of the apple wedges to make lips, then fill the ‘mouth’ with the nut butter. Push the raisins into the mouth to look like wonky teeth.","For the lychee eyeballs, stuff each lychee with a blueberry. Stick the eyeball decorations onto the blueberry using some of the melted white chocolate from step 1, or skewer the fruit together. If you like, drop these into a punch bowl.","For the grape snakes, thread alternating green and red grapes onto skewers, then stick on eyeball decorations with white chocolate as in step four.","Arrange the freaky fruits on a large serving platter. Fill gaps with any leftover blueberries and decorate with spooky Halloween figures and decorations, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3864,3864,'en','Healthy roast dinner','Cook a healthy, low-fat version of roast beef for two, made with lean, juicy steak and roasted veg, plus gravy on the side','["285g medium potatoes, thickly sliced","4 small carrots (160g), halved lengthways","2 x 80g red onions, cut into quarters","170g large Brussels sprouts (about 8-10), trimmed","2½ tsp rapeseed oil","2 tsp thyme leaves","2 tsp balsamic vinegar","1 large garlic clove, finely grated","2 pinches of English mustard powder","170g thick, lean fillet steak","½ tsp vegetable bouillon powder"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bring a large pan of water to the boil and cook the potatoes for 5 mins. Drain, reserving the water.","Toss the potatoes, carrots, onions and sprouts with 2 tsp of the oil to coat. Arrange on a non-stick baking sheet, spaced apart. Scatter with 1 tsp of the thyme, grind over some black pepper, then roast for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, mix 1 tsp of the vinegar with the garlic, remaining thyme and oil, the mustard and plenty of black pepper. Rub this over the steak, put in a shallow dish and set aside. Mix the rest of the vinegar with the bouillon and 125ml of the reserved water from step 1, then set aside. After 30 mins, turn the veg over and roast for 15 mins more.","Meanwhile, heat a smallnon-stick frying panover a medium-high heat. Lift the steak out of the marinade, shake off the excess and fry for 2-3 mins on each side until cooked to your liking. Remove to a board and leave to rest. Pour the leftover marinade into the frying pan and bubble until thickened slightly to make a gravy. Slice the steak and serve with the roast veg and gravy on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:12:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3866,3866,'en','Curry prawns','Enjoy these Jamaican-inspired curry prawns made with coconut milk, tomatoes, chilli and plenty of spices for a flavour-packed dinner. Serve with rice','["1 tbsp vegetable or coconut oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1-inch piece of ginger, grated","2 tomatoes, chopped","½ scotch bonnet chilli (optional)","24-36 whole king prawns, or buy them peeled","1½ tsp turmeric powder","1 tsp ground cumin","½ tsp ground coriander","5 cloves, ground","½ tsp ground fenugreek","1 tsp paprika","½ tsp ground allspice","1 tsp tamarind paste","400ml coconut milk","cooked rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in afrying panover a low-medium heat. Add the onion and cook for 15 mins until soft and starting to caramelise, stirring regularly. Add the garlic, ginger, tomatoes and the chilli, if using. Turn the heat up to medium and cook for another 10 mins.","Meanwhile, if you’re using shell-on prawns, prepare them now. Remove the head and, using a pair ofscissors, cut down the back of the shell until you reach the last segment of shell that’s attached to the tail. Cut through the top layer of flesh on the back of each prawn so it’s easy to remove the vein – loosen it from the body, then with your fingers as close to the tail as possible, pull gently to remove the vein completely. You can keep the heads and shells to make a stock.","Mix the ground spices and tamarind paste with 2 tbsp water, then add to the onion mix. Cook for 5 mins until the spices are fragrant and most of the water has evaporated.","Stir in the coconut milk and cook for 5-10 mins until reduced to a thick gravy, then tip in the prawns. Cook for 5 mins until they are just pink, then remove from the heat. Serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:12:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3868,3868,'en','Mexican hot chocolate','Be sure to add a frothy finish to this Mexican hot chocolate, which is warming and spiced with cinnamon, vanilla and chilli','["500ml whole milk","2 cinnamon sticks (use Mexican cinnamon sticks for a distinctly floral, sweeter taste), plus extra to serve","2 tbsp dark cocoa powder (see tip, below)","½ tsp vanilla extract","¼ tsp chilli powder","2 tbsp brown sugar"]','["Pour the milk into a mediumsaucepan, add the cinnamon sticks and stir frequently over a medium heat (don’t let it boil) until the milk is fragrant, about 5 mins.","Remove and discard the cinnamon sticks, then add the cocoa, vanilla, chilli powder and sugar. Remove from the heat andwhiskuntil the mixture is smooth and frothy – this will only take a couple of minutes. Divide between two mugs and garnish with fresh cinnamon sticks."]','2026-01-10 12:12:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3870,3870,'en','Chewy almond macaroon biscuits','Rustle up these easy almond cookies. Popular for Passover, they’re dairy and gluten free. You can also add a little cinnamon to turn them into cinnamon balls, if you like','["225g ground almonds","120g caster sugar","2 egg whites","20 blanched almonds (optional)","1 tbsp ground cinnamon","4 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a large baking sheet with baking parchment. Put the ground almonds and sugar in a largemixing bowland mix to combine.","In a separate bowl, beat the egg whites until foamy, then add to the almond and sugar mixture. Stir well – it will form a slightly sticky mixture but should hold its shape.","Wet your hands lightly and roll a heaped teaspoon of the mixture into a ball between your palms – it should be about 4cm in diameter. Put on the tray and flatten slightly with wet fingers to a thick disc, leaving at least 3cm between each biscuit. Press a blanched almond into each one, if you like.","Bake for 18-20 mins until just starting to turn golden around the edges, then remove from the oven and leave to cool on awire rack. You want them to have a chewy, soft centre and the darker they get the harder the middle will be.","To make cinnamon balls, add the cinnamon to the almonds and sugar before you add the egg white. When shaping, leave them as balls. Bake for 18-20 mins – you want them to stay soft in the centre. While they are still warm, put them gently in a bowl of icing sugar and turn to coat. Leave until completely cooled."]','2026-01-10 12:12:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3872,3872,'en','Chocolate Swiss roll','This nostalgic dessert can be made a day ahead. Fill with a vanilla cream, dust with icing sugar to finish and serve in slices','["60g self-raising flour","3 tbsp cocoa powder","3 eggs","75g golden caster sugar, plus extra for scattering","200ml double cream","½ tsp vanilla extract","50g icing sugar, sifted, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Line a 22 x 32cm swiss roll tin (if it’s 20 x 30cm that’s still fine) with baking parchment. Sift the flour and cocoa powder together into a bowl and set aside.","Crack the eggs into another bowl or the bowl of astand mixerand tip in the sugar. Use an electric whisk or the whisk attachment to beat the eggs and sugar together for 5 mins until pale and very thick. Use a spoon or spatula to gently fold in the flour mixture until completely incorporated and everything’s the same colour with no streaks.","Gently scrape the mix into the tin and spread to the corners. Bake for 9-10 mins until puffed up and springy to touch. While the cake is baking, get another piece of parchment a little larger than the tin and scatter it with sugar. When the sponge is cooked, use oven gloves to carefully invert it onto the sugar-coated paper. Lift off the tin and peel away the top layer of parchment. Score a line 2cm from one of the shorter edges, then use the parchment to roll the sponge into a spiral with the parchment running through it. Leave the rolled sponge to cool completely.","While the cake is cooling, make the filling by whisking all the ingredients together until the cream stiffens. Unroll the sponge and spread over the filling, leaving the scored edge clear. Starting from the scored edge, use the parchment to roll the sponge up around the filling. Lift onto a board or serving platter and dust with icing sugar.Can be served straight away or chilled for up to 24 hrs.Serve in slices."]','2026-01-10 12:12:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3874,3874,'en','Apple jam','Make up jars of homemade apple jam and gift to friends and family. It’s delicious spread simply on toast, or as a filling in your favourite cakes and bakes','["1kg Bramley apples, peeled, cored and chopped","250g caster sugar","½ lemon, juiced","1 cinnamon stick"]','["Put a small plate in the freezer. Tip the chopped apple and caster sugar into a largesaucepanalong with 350ml of water and bring to a simmer, stirring to dissolve the sugar.","Cook gently, stirring regularly, for 30 mins until the apples have collapsed.","Stir in the lemon juice, add the cinnamon stick and simmer gently for another 2-3 mins until the mixture is thick and glossy.","Remove the small plate from the freezer and drop a little of the mix onto it. Leave for a few seconds – it should be fairly firm. If it’s still a little runny, put the pan back of the heat and simmer for another 10-15 mins. Put the plate back in the freezer and test again, it should now be ready.","Divide between clean, sterilised jars and seal.Will keep for three months in a cool, dry place.Once opened, chill and use within one month."]','2026-01-10 12:12:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3876,3876,'en','Oven-roasted sweet potato & courgette tortilla','Enjoy a baked rather than fried tortilla, making it healthier and easier to throw together. If you don’t have manchego, you can use cheddar or crumbled feta','["2 medium sweet potatoes (500g), peeled and thinly sliced","1 onion, thinly sliced","1 courgette, thinly sliced","2 tbsp olive oil","6 eggs","50g crème fraîche","30g manchego or vegetarian alternative, grated","1 tbsp chopped chives","green salad, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Tip the sweet potato slices, onion and courgette into a medium non-stick baking dish (ours was 18cm x 30cm x 4cm), drizzle with the olive oil, season and mix everything together. Bake for 30 mins, tossing the veg halfway. The sweet potatoes should be tender, the courgette a little charred and the onion softened.","Meanwhile,whiskthe eggs and the crème fraîche together along with a pinch of seasoning. Pour the beaten egg mixture over the sweet potato, onion and courgette. Sprinkle over the manchego and put back in the oven for 25-30 mins until the tortilla is just set. Sprinkle over the chives and eat hot or cold with salad."]','2026-01-10 12:12:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3878,3878,'en','Pineapple smoothie','Blend fresh pineapple and banana with lime juice to make this tangy pineapple smoothie. It’s great for breakfast and kids will love it too','["150g pineapple, trimmed, peeled and chopped","1 small banana, peeled and sliced","1 lime, juiced","ice (optional)"]','["Blitz the pineapple in ablenderwith the banana, lime juice and 50ml cold water until smooth.","Fill a tall glass with ice, if you like, pour over the smoothie and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:12:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3880,3880,'en','Watermelon smoothie','Enjoy a watermelon smoothie on a warm summer’s day. Blended with banana and apple juice, this drink is packed with vitamin C','["150g watermelon, peeled and chopped","1 small banana, peeled and sliced","100ml cold apple juice"]','["Blitz the watermelon in ablenderwith the banana and apple juice until smooth.","Pour the smoothie into a tall glass and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:12:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3882,3882,'en','How to cut a mango','Mangos are delicious, yet notoriously tricky to prepare. Find out how to peel the skin, remove the stone and cut the flesh into bite-sized chunks.','["1 mango"]','["Position the mango so one of the pointed ends is facing you, with the cheeks at either side.","Slice downwards using a serrated knife to remove one of the cheeks, guiding the knife around the stone in the middle. Turn the mango around and repeat on the other side.","Score the mango flesh in a diagonal pattern along the length of the cheek using the tip of the knife. Turn 90 degrees and score again to make a criss-cross pattern.","Turn the scored mango cheek over and push on the skin with your fingers so the fleshy side pops out – it will look a bit like a hedgehog, with the scored mango chunks poking out. Cut the chunks of flesh away from the skin with a knife.","Cut away the flesh on both sides, following the curve of the stone. Score along the pieces with a knife as before, then run the knife along the skin to release the pieces. Add these to the rest of the mango pieces."]','2026-01-10 12:12:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3884,3884,'en','Nunor bora','Enjoy these moreish savoury rice flour snacks with curry or a chilli sauce. Nunor bora are a popular snack in Bangladesh and are often served for Eid','["2 large or 4 small onions, chopped","1 thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled","1½ tsp turmeric","½ tsp panch puran, ground (optional)","300g rice flour, plus extra for rolling","120g ground rice","3 tbsp chopped coriander (optional)","vegetable oil, for frying","ketchup or chilli sauce, to serve (optional)"]','["Bring 570ml water to the boil in a large saucepan. Blend the onion and ginger in a smallfood processorto form a paste, adding a splash of water if needed. Alternatively, finely grate the onion and ginger.","Add the onion and ginger to the boiling water along with 2 tsp salt, the turmeric and panch puran, if using. Simmer for 10 mins until the onions are translucent and cooked through.","Reduce the heat to low and add the rice flour, followed by the ground rice – they will be absorbed into the liquid immediately. Stir thoroughly to ensure there are no dry patches. Add the chopped coriander, if you like. Mix well, cover (ideally with a glass lid) and cook for a further 15-20 mins until aromatic and water droplets form on the lid. To check the dough is fully cooked, roll a little of it back and forth between your fingers, it should come together quite easily. If it feels too sticky, add some more rice flour to absorb the moisture; if it feels too dry, sprinkle a little water over and allow to steam for a few more minutes.","Take around a seventh of the mixture out of the pan and allow to cool slightly on a work surface dusted with a little rice flour. Knead the mixture with the base of your palm to form a dough. Keep kneading until you have several balls of dough.","Rollthe dough out to a 3-4mm thickness, then cut out rounds using a fluted or round pastry cutter about 7cm wide, starting at the edge of the dough and working in. Decorate with a cookie stamper, if you like. Repeat with the remaining dough.The nunor bora can now be frozen – lay them on plastic chopping boards and freeze until hard, then transfer to freezer bags or containers and freeze completely. Defrost for 1-2 minutes before frying.","To cook the nuna bora, heat the oil in a largewokor deep saucepan. Fry in batches for 2 mins on each side, or until puffed up and crisp. Move to a plate lined with kitchen paper while you cook the rest. Serve with ketchup, chilli sauce or your favourite curry."]','2026-01-10 12:12:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3886,3886,'en','Bengali roast chicken','Serve this spiced chicken in an aromatic masala for a starter at a family feast. Packed with flavour, it’s a popular Bengali dish – one you’re sure to cook time and time again','["4-6 bone-in chicken thighs or drumsticks, flesh scored","1 tsp mild curry powder","1 tsp turmeric","1 tsp ground coriander","2 tbsp Greek yogurt","5 tbsp ghee or oil","3 bay leaves","2 large cinnamon sticks","3 cardamom pods","2 large onions, finely sliced","6 garlic cloves, finely sliced","1 tsp grated ginger","2 tsp mild curry powder","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp turmeric","½ tsp chilli powder","5 green chillies, sliced, to serve","chopped coriander, to serve"]','["Put the chicken in a bowl, add the marinade spices and yogurt with ½ tsp salt and mix well. The chicken can be left to marinate for a few hours, or cooked straight away – leaving it to marinate will make it more tender.","Melt the ghee in anon-stick frying pan. Fry the chicken for 5 mins on each side until golden. Remove from the pan and transfer to the bowl, leaving the ghee in the pan.","Keep the pan on the heat and scrape it to release any caramelised bits stuck to the bottom. Add the bay leaves, cinnamon and cardamom pods and fry until they start to smell aromatic. Add the onions and garlic, followed by the ginger and 1-1½ tsp salt. Stir, cover and cook until soft and translucent, about 8-10 mins.","Stir in the rest of the spices and fry over a low heat for 5-8 mins. Add 200ml water, cover and cook for a further 3-4 mins, or until the ghee separates from the masala (it should be bubbling around the edges of the pan).","Add the chicken back to the pan, including any meat juices. Spoon some of the masala over the chicken and cover. Cook for a futher 10-15 mins or until the chicken is cooked through. Stir through the sliced green chillies and chopped coriander and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:12:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3888,3888,'en','Handesh','Make a batch of sweet, golden-brown handesh, a Bengali deep-fried snack made from flour and date molasses. Delicious with a cup of tea or eaten with warm milk like cereal','["320g rice flour","145g plain flour","320g date molasses (morsa gur)","50g white granulated sugar","vegetable oil, for frying"]','["Mix together both the flours, the molasses and sugar in a largemixing bowluntil well combined.","Gradually add up to 150ml tepid water to make a very thick batter, mixing in with clean hands. Crumble up any large bits of flour, molasses or sugar with your fingers. Add up to another 250ml water, a little at a time, until you have a batter that pours in a constant stream without breaking – the amount of water will vary depending on the consistency of the molasses. If the batter still seems too thick, add a little more water until you get the right consistency. If you add too much water, add more flour until you have the right consistency. Cover the bowl and leave to rest at room temperature for 4-5 hrs or overnight.","Heat a generous amount of oil in a large wok over a high heat (around 200C if using a thermometer). When it''s very hot, reduce the heat to medium – this will ensure the oil is hot enough for the handesh to puff up immediately without burning. Pour a little of the batter directly into the centre of the wok with a jug or ladle and wait a few seconds for it to puff up slowly and rise to the surface of the oil. Move it away from the centre of the pan with a spoon and cook for 25-30 seconds on each side until brown all over and cooked inside – you can tear one open to check that it''s cooked through. Remove from the wok using a slotted spoon and place on a plate lined with kitchen paper. Repeat with the remaining batter. Enjoy hot with a cup of tea or tear into small pieces and cover in warm milk to eat like cereal."]','2026-01-10 12:12:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3890,3890,'en','Easy naan bread','Rustle up soft, fluffy naan bread topped with herby garlic butter. A perfect side dish for dunking into curries, it’s super easy to make','["570g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp sugar","1½ tsp baking powder","½-1 tsp strongly-flavoured seeds, such as nigella or cumin seeds (optional)","2 tbsp melted butter","8 tbsp natural yogurt","oil, for the bowl","2 garlic cloves, crushed","small handful of coriander, finely chopped, plus extra to serve"]','["Put the flour in a large bowl, then add the sugar, baking powder and 1½ tsp salt. Add the seeds, if you like. Lightlywhiskto disperse the ingredients evenly throughout the flour.","Add 1 tbsp of the melted butter, followed by the natural yogurt. Mix together with your hands. Once the yogurt and butter have been absorbed, gradually add 180-200ml water, 50ml at a time. Mix between additions, until it begins to come together into a dough. The water amount will depend on the consistency of the yogurt and butter – stop adding when you have a ball of dough.","Tip the dough onto a lightly floured work surface and knead thoroughly for 5 mins until smooth and elastic. Put in an oiled mixing bowl, cover with a tea towel and leave to rest for at least 1 hr. The dough will not rise but it is important to let it rest as this helps to make the naans less chewy and more fluffy.","If making the garlic butter, mix the garlic with the remaining 1 tbsp melted butter and the coriander. Set aside.","Divide the dough into eight, 10 or 12 even-sized pieces, depending on how big you want the naans. Roll into round balls, then return to the bowl, covered with a tea towel.","Roll one of the dough balls out on a lightly floured surface into a round, oval or teardrop shape – roll with a diagonal motion to get an oval. Flip the dough over and repeat on the other side.","Heat a frying pan. Dry fry the dough over a medium high heat until it begins to puff up and the underside browns in places. Flip and repeat on the other side. Remove the cooked naan from the pan. Spoon a little of the garlic butter over the naan, if using. Sprinkle over some coriander, if you like. Cover with a tea towel while you repeat the process with the remaining balls of dough."]','2026-01-10 12:12:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3892,3892,'en','Feta cakes with Greek salad','Bring a little summer sunshine to your kitchen with these potato feta cakes served with a Greek salad. The herbs add plenty of flavour and valuable nutrients, like vitamin C and iron','["a drop of rapeseed oil, for the baking sheet","700g potatoes, peeled and cut into chunks","1 lemon, zested, half juiced","6 spring onions, very finely chopped","2 tbsp chopped mint","3 tbsp chopped parsley","100g feta, crumbled","1 large egg","6 tbsp wholemeal flour","½ tsp smoked paprika","320g tomatoes, cut into wedges","1 cucumber (about 320g), diced","1 red onion finely chopped","12 Kalamata olives, quartered","1-2 tbsp finely chopped mint","2 tsp lemon juice","2 tsp extra virgin olive oil"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and oil a non-stick baking sheet. Bring a pan of water to the boil, add the potatoes and cook for 15-20 mins until tender. Drain very well, then return to the pan and mash with lots of black pepper, the lemon zest and juice, the spring onions, mint and 2 tbsp of the parsley. Stir through the feta.","Beat the egg in a shallow bowl, then mix the flour, paprika and remaining 1 tbsp parsley in another. Shape the potato mixture into eight cakes, then carefully coat all over in the egg, then the flour mix, reshaping them if you need to. Arrange the cakes on the baking sheet and bake for 15 mins until starting to turn golden. Use a palette knife to carefully turn each one over and bake for another 10-15 mins until golden.","Meanwhile, toss half the salad with half the lemon and oil. Serve with four cakes and chill the remainder for another day, tossing the remaining salad with the rest of the lemon and oil just before serving.Will keep, covered, for up to two days in the fridge. To reheat the cakes, cook on a baking tray at 200C/180C fan/gas 6 for 15-20 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:12:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3894,3894,'en','Smashed roasted new potatoes','Combine roast potatoes, rösti and mash with this simple recipe. You can enhance it by smashing in pitted olives, capers, herbs, spring onions or garlic','["1kg new potatoes","3 tbsp olive oil"]','["Cook the potatoes in a pan of boiling salted water for 15 mins, or until cooked through but not falling apart. Drain well. Drizzle 1½ tbsp oil into a shallowroasting tinorbaking tray(about 30 x 20cm – a Swiss roll tin works well). Tip the potatoes into the tin and toss in the oil. Squash the potatoes down using a potato masher or fork – the smashed potatoes should fill the tray and be joined at the edges like jigsaw pieces.Will keep chilled for up to a day.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/ gas 5. Drizzle the potatoes with the remaining oil and season with sea salt. Bake for 40 mins until deeply golden and crunchy."]','2026-01-10 12:12:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3896,3896,'en','Cabbage with fennel, chilli & garlic','Enjoy this fiery, flavourful side dish with a tender meat roast. The cabbage can be roasted or cooked on the hob if you’re lacking oven space','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp fennel seeds","1 garlic clove, finely sliced","½ red chilli, finely sliced","1 pointed or hispi cabbage, cut into 6 wedges"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan orwokand sizzle the fennel seeds, garlic and chilli for 1-2 mins until the seeds start to crackle and the garlic turns golden. Add the cabbage – don’t worry if it seems too much for the pan, it will soon start to wilt.","Cook for 3-4 mins until the cabbage starts to colour at the edges, then turn up the heat and add about 50ml water to the pan. Steam-fry the cabbage for a few minutes until all the water has evaporated and the cabbage has wilted but is still holding its shape. Transfer to a serving dish."]','2026-01-10 12:12:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3898,3898,'en','Vegan beetroot & quinoa burgers','Enjoy these vegan beetroot and quinoa burgers with rocket salad for a healthy yet hearty midweek meal','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 tbsp cumin seeds","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","200g quinoa, cooked","2 large cooked beetroot (150g), finely grated and liquid reserved","50g plain flour","2 tbsp milled flaxseed","½ small bunch of coriander, plus a few leaves to serve","25ml beetroot preserving liquid","½ lemon, juiced","100g low-fat soy yogurt","50ml extra virgin olive oil","200g rocket"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Put 1 tbsp of the rapeseed oil in a small frying pan and tip in the onion, cumin and garlic, then fry over a medium heat for 8 mins until softened and golden. Tip into a bowl. Add the cooked quinoa, beetroot, flour, flaxseed and coriander, and mix until combined. Season lightly. Leave to sit for 5 mins to bind.","Divide the mixture into four – it will be quite loose – then, using wet hands, shape them into patties. Put the burgers on a linedbaking trayand put in the oven for 15 mins. Turn them over and cook for another 10 mins.","Meanwhile, make the salad dressing.Whisktogether the beetroot liquid, lemon juice, yogurt and oil, and season.","To serve, pile the rocket onto plates and place a burger on top. Drizzle over the dressing and scatter over the extra coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:12:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3900,3900,'en','Mini chorizo, pea & potato frittatas','Heading to the park for a picnic with the family? Kids and adults will love these mini frittatas','["4 new potatoes (about 150g)","6 eggs, beaten","60g chorizo diced","75g frozen peas, defrosted","few sprigs of parsley, finely chopped","50g cheddar, grated"]','["Cook the potatoes in a small pan of boiling water for 10-15 mins until tender. Drain, then leave to steam-dry and cool.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a six-hole muffin tin with paper or silicone cases. Tip the eggs, chorizo, peas, parsley and some seasoning into a large bowl. Slice the cooled potatoes into rounds that are the thickness of a £1 coin, and add these to the bowl. Mix gently.","Spoon the mixture into the cases, ensuring each has some of the potato, chorizo and peas. Sprinkle the cheese on top and bake for 15-20 mins until golden and set in the middle. Check the frittatas are set by shaking the tin gently – there should be no wobble. Leave to cool slightly and eat warm, or cool completely and chill for up to 24 hrs."]','2026-01-10 12:12:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3902,3902,'en','Spiced prawn cocktail subs','Forget boring sandwiches at a picnic – pack these prawn cocktail subs instead. If you’re travelling, assemble them when you get there so they’re super-fresh (see tip below)','["3 tbsp mayonnaise","1 tbsp mango chutney","¼ tsp mild curry powder","squeeze of lemon or lime juice","150g cooked North Atlantic prawns","6 small sub rolls","1 small Little Gem lettuce, leaves picked","small chunk of cucumber, thinly sliced"]','["Mix the mayonnaise, mango chutney and curry powder with a squeeze of lemon or lime juice in a bowl. Stir in the prawns, then chill until you’re ready to assemble.","To serve, split the sub rolls across the top, line each one with a lettuce leaf and a few slices of cucumber, then spoon in the prawn filling."]','2026-01-10 12:12:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3904,3904,'en','Sticky lime & coconut chicken drumsticks','These sticky chicken drumsticks are perfect for a picnic or party. You could serve them warm or leave to cool before packing into a container','["400g can coconut cream","1-2 tbsp Thai green curry paste (depending on how hot you like it)","1 lime, zested and juiced","3 tbsp honey","6 chicken drumsticks"]','["Mix the coconut cream, curry paste, lime zest and juice and 1 tbsp honey together in a large bowl, then spoon a quarter of the marinade into a second smaller bowl and set aside. Add the chicken to the large bowl and leave to marinate for at least 2 hrs, or chill for up to 24 hrs.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line abaking traywith foil. Arrange the chicken on the tray, and bake for 30 mins, turning the chicken over halfway through.","Mix the remaining honey into the reserved small bowl of marinade. Brush half of this over the chicken, then return to the oven for 10 mins more. Turn the chicken over and brush with the rest of the marinade, then bake for another 10 mins. Serve warm or leave to cool completely before packing into acontainerfor a picnic."]','2026-01-10 12:12:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3906,3906,'en','Classic homemade coleslaw','Forget shop-bought versions and make a homemade slaw. It’s an ideal side dish for barbecues or to serve with burgers, salads, sandwiches and more','["1 small white cabbage or ½ large","4 carrots, peeled","1 large red onion","½ small bunch dill, chives, parsley or coriander, finely chopped (optional)","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","50g mayonnaise","50g yogurt, soured cream or more mayo","1-2 tbsp white wine vinegar","a few pinches of paprika"]','["Remove any bruised or damaged outer cabbage leaves. Halve through the stem, and remove the dense core with a sharp knife and discard. Put cut side down onto a chopping board, and slice as finely as you can into thin shreds. You can also do this on amandoline(you might want to quarter before slicing) or in a food processor with the shredding attachment. Tip into a bowl.","Grate the carrots on a boxgraterto coarsely shred, or cut into thin strips using a julienne peeled or the grater attachment on the food processor. Tip into the bowl. Finely slice the onion, and thin as you can, and add to the bowl with the other veg. Add the herbs if using. A mixture is nice if you have some to use up.","In a jug,whiskthe mustard, mayo, yogurt and vinegar. Season well, and taste for sharpness and creamy. Add more vinegar if you like.","Tip the dressing into the veg bowl, and mix everything together well with a large spoon. Stir so all the veg gets coated lightly in the dressing. Sprinkle with a few pinches of paprika, and serve straight away.Can be covered and chilled for up to 3 days.Mix well before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:12:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3908,3908,'en','Kimchi','Make a vegan version of kimchi (or kimchee) from this simple Korean recipe. Enjoy the umami flavours of the seaweed, whether you follow a plant-based diet or not','["2-3 Chinese leaf (2kg prepared weight)","40-60g sea salt (3% of the cabbage weight)","1 tbsp seaweed (I use wakame), lightly rinsed","1 carrot","½ leek","2 spring onions","40g onion, chopped","40g garlic (10 cloves), peeled","5g ginger, chopped","1 small pear, cored and chopped","40g Korean chilli flakes (use less if you prefer it milder)","a 2-litre sterilised jar"]','["Chopthe Chinese leaf into bite-size pieces, weighing it until you have 2kg, then wash under running water. Mix the Chinese leaf with the salt and the seaweed in a large bowl. Set aside.","Every now and then, over the course of 3-4 hrs, mix the salted Chinese leaf and seaweed with your hands. (You will start to see liquid being released.) You want to be able to bend the Chinese leaf without breaking the pieces.","Meanwhile, shred the carrot and leek, and chop the spring onions. Set aside. Make the chilli paste by blitzing the onion, garlic, ginger and pear in afood processoruntil puréed. Add the chilli flakes, then blitz again to combine. Drain the Chinese leaf mixture, removing as much water as you can. This may take about 10 mins.","Toss the Chinese leaf mixture with the other vegetables, then mix in the chilli paste to coat everything. Tip into a 2-litre sterilised jar. Try not to have too many air pockets and leave a 1-inch space under the lid. Put a fermentation weight on top, or if you don’t have one, try using some baking beans in a bag. Keep a plate under the jar in case of overflow. After 24-48 hrs you will begin to see bubbles appearing. That means fermentation is underway.","At any point during the fermentation, you can taste the kimchi to see how you like the flavour. I prefer to keep mine in the fridge after day 3 to slow down the process and start enjoying it. You can transfer the kimchi into smaller jars for easy access from the fridge. It also makes a great present for family and friends."]','2026-01-10 12:12:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3910,3910,'en','Raspberry & white chocolate muffins','Indulge in these raspberry and white choc chip muffins for a sweet treat. Made with fresh or frozen raspberries, they’re perfect served with a cuppa','["100g unsalted butter, softened","65g caster sugar","65g light brown sugar","2 large eggs, room temperature","125g Greek yogurt","1 tsp vanilla paste","5 tbsp milk","250g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","200g raspberries (fresh or frozen)","75g white chocolate chips"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper cases.","Beat the butter and sugar together for 5 mins until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs gradually and beat in until combined. Stir in the yogurt, vanilla and milk. Fold in the flour, baking powder and a pinch of fine salt until you have a smooth batter. Finally, fold in 150g raspberries and white chocolate chips and fill the muffin cases three-quarters full.","Push 2 raspberries into the top of each muffin so they''re sticking out slightly. Bake for 8 mins, then reduce the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and bake for 20-25 mins more until risen and golden, and a cocktail stick inserted into the centre comes out clean."]','2026-01-10 12:12:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3912,3912,'en','Slow-cooked vine tomatoes with garlic','Enjoy slow-cooked vine tomatoes with garlic as a summer side dish. Woody herbs like thyme, rosemary or bay can also be added to flavour the oil','["300g cherry vine tomatoes","1 or 2 small garlic bulbs, cut in half to expose the flesh","150ml olive oil","crusty bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2. Put the tomatoes and garlic in a baking dish that provides a snug fit. Season well. Pour over the olive oil and cover with foil. Bake for 1¼ hrs, then squash the garlic and stir into the oil. Eat warm with crusty bread.Will keep in an airtight container in the fridge for up to two weeks. Leave to cool first."]','2026-01-10 12:12:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3914,3914,'en','Giant couscous & tomato salad with zhoug-style dressing','Make this giant couscous and tomato salad as a summer side. Zhoug is a spicy, bright green Middle Eastern sauce that brings this dish alive','["4 large vine tomatoes, diced","½ red onion, finely chopped","150g giant couscous or fregola","½ small bunch of coriander, roughly chopped","handful of parsley leaves, roughly chopped","1 lemon, juiced","2 green chillies, chopped","1 garlic clove, roughly chopped","½ tsp ground cumin","½ tsp caster sugar","3 tbsp olive oil"]','["Put the tomatoes and onion in a large bowl with ½ tsp sea salt. Toss and leave to sit.","Cook the couscous in a pan of boiling salted water for 8-10 mins until tender (don’t overcook it – you want it a bit under so it can soak up the juices from the tomato), then drain really well. Cool for 10 mins then toss with the tomato and onion mixture.","Blend all the dressing ingredients with 1 tbsp water and ½ tsp sea salt until smooth. Drizzle some over the couscous, then serve the rest on the side for people to help themselves."]','2026-01-10 12:12:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3916,3916,'en','Spinach filo spiral pie','These impressive-looking spinach filo spirals are deceptively easy to make. A take on Greek spanakopita, serve with a side salad for a weekend lunch','["300g baby spinach","50g salted butter, melted, plus a knob for frying","1 large onion, finely chopped","200g feta, crumbled","7 shop-bought filo sheets","1 tbsp nigella seeds"]','["Heat a large non-stick pan over a medium heat. Tip in the spinach and cook, stirring, until wilted (you won’t need any oil or water as it will steam in its own moisture). Leave to cool a little, then tip into a clean tea towel and squeeze out as much water as possible. Chop and put in a bowl.","Heat the knob of butter in a non-stick frying pan. Add the onion and cook for about 10 mins until softened. Tip into the bowl with the spinach, then stir in the feta using a fork until fully combined. Taste for seasoning.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Brush a 24 x 4cm deep metal pie dish with some of the butter.","Lay a filo sheet on your work surface. Brush with some of the melted butter, then spread about 2 tbsp of the filling in a line along the longest edge of the pastry. Roll loosely into a long sausage (don’t roll it too tight as this might cause the pastry to split), then coil the pastry and put in the centre of the tin.","Repeat with the rest of the pastry and filling, arranging the coils around the central one. Brush the tops with more butter, then sprinkle with the nigella seeds. Bake for 25-30 mins until golden and crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:12:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3918,3918,'en','Spinach with chickpeas, pine nuts & raisins','Enjoy this simple spinach side dish with Spanish-style chicken dishes. Toasted almonds work well, too','["2 tbsp olive oil, plus a drizzle","1 large long shallot, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","½ tsp ground cumin","½ tsp smoked paprika","400g can chickpeas, drained","4 tbsp golden or flame raisins","200g spinach","2 tbsp toasted pine nuts"]','["Heat the olive oil in a large non-stick pan. Add the shallot and garlic, and cook until softened. Add the spices, chickpeas and raisins, and cook for 2 mins.","Tip in the spinach and cook until just wilted. Stir in the pine nuts and serve with an extra drizzle of oil."]','2026-01-10 12:12:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3920,3920,'en','Courgette & cheddar cornbread','Enjoy this cheesy cornbread with a spicy chilli, or toasted and topped with poached eggs and grilled tomatoes for breakfast','["75g butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","75g strong white bread flour","150g instant polenta","1 tbsp baking powder","3 eggs","350ml whole milk","100g mature cheddar, grated","2 small or 1 medium courgette (about 200g), trimmed and roughly grated"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Butter a 900g loaf tin and line with a wide strip of baking parchment. Mix the flour, polenta and baking powder in a bowl with 1 tsp of salt.","Whiskthe eggs, milk and melted butter in a jug. Pour into the dry ingredients and mix together. Stir in the cheese and courgettes. It will be quite runny at this stage but don’t worry, as the polenta gradually swells and soaks up the liquid in the oven.","Pour into the prepared loaf tin and bake for 15 mins, then turn the oven down to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and cook for another 25-30 mins or until a skewer inserted in the middle of the loaf comes out clean (you can cover the top loosely with foil if starts to get dark too quickly).","Leave to cool completely in the tin, then turn out and slice."]','2026-01-10 12:12:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3922,3922,'en','Grilled courgette & halloumi salad with caper & lemon dressing','Dress this courgette and halloumi salad while everything is still fairly warm, then the courgettes will soak up the flavours of the caper and lemon dressing','["10-12 baby courgettes, halved lengthways","1 tbsp olive oil","225g block halloumi, thinly sliced (about 16 slices)","1 long shallot, finely chopped","1 red chilli, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 lemon, zested and juiced","2 tbsp capers","3 tbsp olive oil"]','["Put all the dressing ingredients in a bowl with 1 tbsp cold water and season with a pinch of salt. Mix together and set aside.","Put the courgettes in a large bowl and drizzle with the oil. Add a pinch of salt, then toss.","Heat agriddle panto high and add the courgettes, cut-side down (it’s best to do this in batches). Cook for 4-5 mins until char marks appear and the flesh softens, then flip over and cook for another 3 mins. Remove to a shallow bowl and cover with foil to keep warm.","Meanwhile, heat a separate largenon-stick frying panand add the halloumi. Cook for a few minutes until golden on both sides.","Arrange the courgettes and halloumi on a large plate or platter, then spoon over the dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:12:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3924,3924,'en','Malfatti','Make our take on Tuscan malfatti – spinach and ricotta dumplings that look a bit like large, roughly formed gnocchi. Serve coated in an aromatic sage butter and plenty of cheese','["1 tbsp olive oil","500g fresh or frozen spinach (see tip, below)","250g ricotta","50g fresh breadcrumbs","50g finely grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative, plus extra to serve","2 large eggs, beaten","1 tbsp semolina or plain flour, plus extra for dusting","nutmeg, for grating","60g butter","25g sage leaves"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a high heat and wilt the spinach, about 2-3 mins. Tip the spinach into acolanderand press out any excess liquid using the back of a spoon. Leave to cool completely. Squeeze out any remaining liquid with your hands, then finely chop the spinach.","Tip the chopped spinach into a bowl with the ricotta, breadcrumbs and parmesan. Add the egg and semolina or flour. Season and grate over some nutmeg. Stir to form an evenly combined, sticky mixture.","Put a couple tablespoons of flour on a large tray and shake gently to spread the flour out. Spoon around ½ tbsp of the spinach mixture onto the floured tray and roll into a ball. Repeat with the rest of the spinach mixture, transferring the balls to a second cleanbaking trayas you go.","Heat the oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil. Drop in the malfatti (you may need to do this in batches) and simmer for 2 mins, or until they float to the surface. Scoop the malfatti out with a slotted spoon and drain well. Transfer to an ovenproof serving dish and keep warm in the oven.","Make the sage butter by melting the butter in a small pan. Add the sage leaves and fry gently, stirring often until crisp. Pour the sage butter over the malfatti and top with more grated cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:12:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3926,3926,'en','Tomato & coconut curry','Celebrate tomatoes – even better if they’re homegrown – with this juicy coconut curry, that brings plenty of colour and flavour to your plate','["1 heaped tsp cumin seeds","1 heaped tsp coriander seeds","1 heaped tsp fennel seeds","2 tbsp sunflower or rapeseed oil","10 curry leaves","3 large onions, thinly sliced","1 heaped tsp black mustard seeds","½ tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp sea salt flakes","4 garlic cloves, crushed","1 green chilli, finely chopped","1kg large ripe tomatoes, cut into quarters","250g cherry or baby plum tomatoes","400ml can coconut milk","2 heaped tsp tamarind paste","2 heaped tsp brown or palm sugar","cooked rice, to serve"]','["Tip the cumin, coriander and fennel seeds into a large, dry frying pan set over a medium-high heat and toast until fragrant and lightly browned. Immediately remove from the heat, then roughly grind using apestle and mortaror spice grinder.","Drizzle the oil into the pan. Add the curry leaves and sizzle for a minute, then add the onions. Fry for around 5 mins until lightly golden. Add the mustard seeds, ground spice mixture, turmeric, salt, garlic and chilli, and fry for another couple of minutes. Tip in all of the tomatoes and fry for a further minute before adding the coconut milk, tamarind and sugar.","Simmer the curry for 25 mins until the tomatoes are really soft and the liquid has thickened a little. Taste for seasoning, and add a little more salt or sugar if needed. Serve hot with the rice."]','2026-01-10 12:12:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3928,3928,'en','Easy blondies','Whip up these easy blondies with moreish chunks of white chocolate dotted throughout. These gooey, golden squares are the perfect accompaniment to a cup of tea or coffee','["175g butter, cut into cubes, plus extra for the tin","200g light brown soft sugar","100g caster sugar","3 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract or bean paste","200g plain flour","½ tsp baking powder","200g white chocolate, chopped, or use white chocolate chips","175g butter, cut into cubes, plus extra for the tin","200g light brown soft sugar","100g caster sugar","3 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract or bean paste","200g plain flour","½ tsp baking powder","200g white chocolate, chopped, or use white chocolate chips"]','["Melt the butter and both sugars in apanover a low heat, adding a pinch of salt if the butter is unsalted. Remove from the heat and leave to cool for 10 mins – this will stop the eggs from curdling when added. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 23cm square tin or 25 x 20cm baking tin and line with baking parchment.","Beat the eggs and vanilla into the cooled butter and sugar mixture until well-combined. Sieve in the flour and baking powder, then gently fold until you have a smooth batter. Fold in the white chocolate, then scrape into the prepared tin. Smooth the top and bake for 40-45 mins until the edges are coming away from the sides of the tin, the top has a papery crust and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out with a few crumbs, but no liquid batter. The blondies will firm up as they cool.","Leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.The blondies will keep in an airtight container for three days.","Melt the butter and both sugars in apanover a low heat, adding a pinch of salt if the butter is unsalted. Remove from the heat and leave to cool for 10 mins – this will stop the eggs from curdling when added. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 23cm square tin or 25 x 20cm baking tin and line with baking parchment.","Beat the eggs and vanilla into the cooled butter and sugar mixture until well-combined. Sieve in the flour and baking powder, then gently fold until you have a smooth batter. Fold in the white chocolate, then scrape into the prepared tin. Smooth the top and bake for 40-45 mins until the edges are coming away from the sides of the tin, the top has a papery crust and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out with a few crumbs, but no liquid batter. The blondies will firm up as they cool.","Leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.The blondies will keep in an airtight container for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:12:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3930,3930,'en','Classic minestrone soup','Whip up this classic Italian vegetable soup with a rich tomato base and pasta. It’s low in calories and packed with fibre and vitamin C','["3 tbsp olive oil, plus extra to serve","1 onion, finely chopped","1 celery stick, finely chopped","1 carrot, peeled and finely chopped","1 courgette, finely chopped","70g diced smoked pancetta","1 large garlic clove, crushed","½ tsp dried oregano","1 x 400g can cannellini beans","1 x 400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","1.2 litre vegetable stock","1 bay leaf","70g small pasta","100g greens - kale, chard or cavolo nero work well","handful of basil","finely grated parmesan, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan orcasserolepot over a low-medium heat and gently fry the onion, celery, carrot, courgette and pancetta for 10 mins. Add the garlic and oregano, and cook for 1 min. Tip in the beans, chopped tomatoes, purée, stock and bay leaf. Season to taste. Bring to the simmer and cook for 30 mins.","Add the pasta and greens, and cook for a further 10 mins. Ladle into bowls and scatter with the basil and some parmesan."]','2026-01-10 12:12:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3932,3932,'en','Glamorgan sausages','Get the family involved and your own Glamorgan sausages, a traditional Welsh vegetarian sausage featuring cheese, leeks and breadcrumbs. Make a batch of 12 and freeze any you don’t eat','["50g butter","2 large leeks, sliced","400g fresh soft white fine breadcrumbs","2 tsp thyme leaves","4 large eggs, separated","400g Caerphilly or strong mature cheddar, finely grated","1 heaped tbsp wholegrain or Dijon mustard or 2 tsp English mustard","50g plain flour, for dusting","100ml vegetable oil for frying, plus a little extra if required"]','["Melt the butter in a frying pan over a medium heat until foaming, then fry the leeks with a pinch of salt for 5-10 mins until soft. Leave to cool slightly.","Put 200g soft breadcrumbs, the thyme, egg yolks, cheese, mustard and a generous grinding of pepper in a bowl and mix to combine. Stir in the fried leeks, and any butter left in the pan. Season with salt and mix well using your hands.","Mould the mixture into 12 sausages (divide and weigh for accuracy if you like). You may find damp hands help, cleaning your hands every so often to stop them sticking. Transfer to a baking tray lined with baking parchment and freeze for 10 mins until firm, or chill for 30 mins in the fridge.","While the sausages are firming up,whiskthe egg whites in a shallow bowl with a pinch of salt until lightly foamy. Put the flour and some of the remaining breadcrumbs onto separate plates.","Dust the chilled and firm sausages in the flour, then dunk in the egg white, and roll in the breadcrumbs. Top up the plate of breadcrumbs as required. Chill for at least 1 hr and up to 24hrs before frying.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Heat the oil in anon-stick frying panover a medium high heat. Fry the sausages in batches, turning them gently every minute, for 4-6 mins, until golden and crisp all over. Add a little more oil between batches if you need to. Transfer to a baking tray, and bake for 10 mins. If you are freezing the sausages, once they''re golden brown transfer to a tray and leave to cool for a few minutes, then open-freeze (uncovered) until solid and transfer to freezer-proof containers.Will keep frozen for up to three months.Cook from frozen in the oven for 25 mins until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:12:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3934,3934,'en','French fries','Perfect French fries with our easy recipe – you’ll end up with lightly golden, crisp fries. They’re great as a snack or side dish to a Friday night feast','["1kg Maris Piper or King Edward potatoes","vegetable oil, for deep frying"]','["Peelthe potatoes and cut into 1cm-thick batons. Put into a bowl of cold water and leave to soak for at least 2 hrs to remove the starch from the potatoes – this will help them crisp while frying.","Drain the potatoes well and pat dry with kitchen paper. Fill a deep pan no more than a third full with oil and heat to 140C, or until a cube of bread dropped in browns in 60 seconds. Fry the French fries in batches for 6 mins per batch until golden straw-coloured, cooked through and lightly crisp. Drain well on kitchen paper.","Turn the heat up until the oil reaches 180C, or a cube of bread browns in 30 seconds. Fry the French fries again for 2-3 mins per batch until lightly golden and really crisp. Drain on kitchen paper and immediately season with sea salt."]','2026-01-10 12:12:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3936,3936,'en','Lentil dumplings in yogurt (dahi bhalla)','Make these soft lentil dumplings as a snack or side dish. They’re coated with yogurt and served with coriander relish, plus our tamarind & date sauce','["65g skinned white urad dal (dhuli urad), soaked overnight","65g yellow mung dal, soaked overnight","¾ tsp ground cumin","¼ tsp coarsely ground black peppercorns","40g ginger, peeled and roughly chopped","2 green chillies, deseeded and roughly chopped","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","vegetable or sunflower oil for deep-frying","1 x 268ml carton buttermilk","300ml Greek or natural yogurt","1 tsp caster sugar","3-4 tbsp milk","1 tsp ground cumin","¼ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","2 tbsp coriander relish","4 tbsp date & tamarind sauce","a few coriander leaves"]','["Drain both lots of lentils using a sieve and discard the soaking water. Tip into afood processorand add the ground cumin, peppercorns, ginger and green chillies. Blitz to a soft paste, adding 1-2 tbsp water as required.","Spoon the lentil mixture into a bowl and beat vigorously for 5-7 mins, or until the mixture becomes light and fluffy. It’s easier to do this in afood mixerfitted with a beater.","Heat the oil in awokor karahi over a medium heat, ensuring it is no more than two-thirds full. Stir the bicarbonate of soda into the lentil mixture, then use two dessert spoons to gently scoop and shape dumplings about the size of a small walnut. Working in batches, lower the dumplings into the oil using a slotted spoon.","Fry the dumplings for 3-4 mins on each side, turning with a slotted spoon, until golden. Lift out and drain on kitchen paper. You should have 22-24 dumplings when all the batter is used up. Set aside.","Whiskthe buttermilk with an equal quantity of cold water in a large shallow baking dish. Coat the dumplings in the buttermilk mixture and leave overnight in the fridge (they will soften as they soak).","The next day, gently press the dumplings to remove any excess buttermilk and arrange on a serving plate.","To serve, whisk the yogurt with the sugar and enough milk to create a consistency that is just thick enough to coat the dumplings. Coat the dumplings with the yogurt and sprinkle with the ground cumin and chilli powder. Drizzle over somecoriander relishanddate & tamarind sauce, then sprinkle with the coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:12:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3938,3938,'en','Cumin-roasted broccoli with preserved lemon yogurt','Enjoy this cumin-roasted broccoli with preserved lemon yogurt as a vibrant side dish. It’s a beautiful combination of spices, textures and colours','["500g purple sprouting broccoli, trimmed","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 tbsp ground cumin","2 small slices of stale white bread","1 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 tsp sweet smoked paprika","1⁄2 tsp ground cumin","1⁄2 tsp cayenne pepper","1 preserved lemon, finely chopped, seeds discarded","100g full-fat yogurt","1 tbsp finely chopped coriander leaves","1 tbsp finely chopped parsley leaves","1⁄2 garlic clove, finely grated"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Check the stalks of the broccoli are roughly the same thickness, if not, halve the bigger stems of broccoli lengthways. Rub the broccoli with the oil, then sprinkle over the cumin and some seasoning. Tip onto a baking sheet in a single layer, and roast for about 15-20 mins, or until tender with just a little light charring, turning halfway through.","For the breadcrumbs, heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tear the bread into small pieces and bake for 5 to 10 mins, or until crunchy, then tip into afood processorand blitz into breadcrumbs.","Heat the oil in a frying pan over a low heat, then add the garlic, spices, the breadcrumbs and some seasoning. Fry, stirring regularly, for about 5 mins until golden. Transfer to a plate lined with kitchen paper to absorb any excess oil.","For the yogurt, mix together all the ingredients and season to taste. Serve the broccoli with the breadcrumbs scattered over and the yogurt on the side for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:12:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3940,3940,'en','Freezable herby falafel','Make these delicious falafels using dried chickpeas, as opposed to canned, for the very best falafels. Stuff into pittas or flatbread, or pop into a lunchbox','["250g dried chickpeas","2 tsp coriander seeds, crushed","3 tsp ground cumin","½ tsp chilli flakes (optional)","pinch of allspice","2 large garlic cloves, crushed","small bunch of parsley, leaves picked and roughly chopped","small bunch of coriander, leaves picked and roughly chopped","¾ tsp baking powder","30g sesame seeds (optional)","sunflower oil, for frying","warmed flatbreads, hummus, pickles, sliced radishes, mint, coriander, tahini, za’atar or chilli flakes and chilli sauce, to serve"]','["Put the chickpeas in a bowl, cover with cold water and leave to soak for at least 12 hrs.","The next day, drain the chickpeas and pat dry with kitchen paper. Tip into afood processorand pulse until they begin to break down. Toast all of the spices in a small dry pan for 1-2 mins. Tip these into the food processor with the garlic, herbs and 1½ tsp sea salt. Blitz until smooth and pliable (check this by squeezing a clump in your hand; when ready, it should stay together). Tip the mix into a bowl, stir in the baking powder, cover and chill for 30 mins.","Form into 12 small discs, then coat each lightly in the sesame seeds, if using. Chill for 15 mins more.The falafel can now be frozen for up to three months (see below).","Heat a 1cm depth of oil in a largenon-stick frying panover a medium heat until small bubbles form on the surface. Fry the falafel in batches for 6 mins until deeply golden, turning over halfway through using a spatula or slotted spoon. Transfer to a plate lined with kitchen paper. Leave to drain.Once cooled, the falafel can be frozen for up to three months (see below). Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Put the falafel on a lightly oiled baking sheet and brush with some oil. Bake for 15-20 mins until crisp. Serve in the flatbreads with the fillings of your choice."]','2026-01-10 12:12:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3942,3942,'en','Chocolate & peanut butter pancake cake','Perfect for Pancake Day, everyone can help to make this chocolate and peanut butter pancake ‘cake’. As you cook the pancakes, let the kids spread and stack','["200g peanut butter","200g chocolate spread","icing sugar and squirty cream, to serve","5 eggs","750ml milk","250g plain flour","50g butter"]','["First, make the pancake batter. Tip the eggs, milk, flour and a pinch of salt into ablenderand blitz until smooth. Alternatively,whiskthe eggs and flour together until smooth, then slowly whisk in the milk and a pinch of salt, then tip into a large jug.","Heat a roughly 20cm frying or crêpe pan over a medium heat, and, using kitchen paper, carefully wipe a little of the butter around the pan. Pour in enough batter to make a thin pancake, and cook for about 1 min on each side until golden. Slide the pancake onto a serving plate, then immediately spread with some of the peanut butter, then chocolate spread. Repeat with a second pancake, then stack this on top of the first. Continue cooking, spreading and stacking until all the batter, peanut butter and chocolate spread is used.","When all the pancakes are stacked into a ‘cake’, dust the top with some icing sugar. Cut into wedges and serve topped with some squirty cream.Will keep at room temperature for up to a day."]','2026-01-10 12:12:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3944,3944,'en','Scotch broth','Tuck into a hearty bowl of Scotch broth soup for a healthy lunch or supper. Packed with veg and grains, serve with a hunk of crusty bread','["250g broth mix (or a mixture of 75g pearl barley, 75g yellow split peas, 50g red split lentils and 50g green split or marrowfat peas)","1 tbsp vegetable or olive oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","1 leek, washed and sliced","1 medium turnip, peeled and finely chopped","3 carrots, finely chopped","3 celery sticks, trimmed and finely chopped","3 litres lamb stock","200g kale chopped"]','["Rinse the soup mix and soak in cold water for 8 hrs or overnight, covered in a cool place. Drain and rinse well.","Heat the oil in a largepanand fry the onion, leek, turnip, carrots and celery for 10 mins, covered with a lid, until soft but not golden. Add a generous pinch of salt and a good grinding of pepper.","Pour the stock into the pan and bring to a simmer. Add the drained soup mix, and gently simmer for 1 hr part-covered, until the barley and split peas are tender. Season again if needed. Stir in the kale, and cook for 10-15 mins until tender, then ladle into bowls to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3946,3946,'en','Chia pudding','Rustle up this simple ‘pudding’ for breakfast or dessert. Chia seeds are rich in protein, antioxidants and omega 3, as well as many other nutrients','["2 tbsp chia seeds","125ml oat milk, or substitute for any nut milk, rice milk or dairy milk","2 tsp maple syrup, plus a drizzle to serve","fruit, such as berries, banana, kiwis or mango, to serve"]','["Combine the chia seeds, milk and 2 tsp maple syrup in a jar or bowl. Cover and chill overnight or for at least 8 hrs.","When ready to serve, top with fruit and a drizzle of maple syrup."]','2026-01-10 12:12:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3948,3948,'en','Celery juice','Make this simple celery juice your own by adding green chilli for a bit of heat, turmeric, or a little maple syrup to sweeten, if you like','["1 head of celery (about 500g)","1 green apple (about 120g), peeled, quartered and cored","½-1 lemon, juiced","20g ginger, finely grated"]','["Separate the celery stalks and wash well. Trim the root ends androughly chop, keeping one of the tender, young stems whole to serve.","Put the chopped celery, apple, half the lemon juice and ginger in afood processororblenderand pulse to finely chop. With the motor running, add 50-100ml cold water and blend until smooth.","Strain the juice through a fine mesh sieve into a jug, pressing down with the back of a spoon to extract all the juice. Cover and chill or serve straight away. Stir the juice well, add a squeeze more lemon if you like, and serve in glasses with a piece of the reserved celery stalk."]','2026-01-10 12:12:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3950,3950,'en','Vegan peanut butter cookies','Make some moreish vegan peanut butter cookies for a welcome mid-morning treat. Made with dairy-free ingredients, they’re sure to be loved by all','["100g dairy-free margarine","100g caster sugar","2 tbsp vanilla paste","100g crunchy peanut butter","225g plain flour","3 tbsp roasted peanuts, split in half"]','["Beat the margarine, sugar and vanilla using an electricwhiskfor 1 min until pale and smooth, then mix in the peanut butter and flour until fully incorporated. Bring together into a smooth dough with your hands.","Roll outthe dough between two sheets of baking parchment until it’s about 1cm thick. If the dough is very soft (this will depend on the margarine used), chill for 45 mins until firmed slightly. Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3 and line one large or two medium baking trays with baking parchment.","Cut circles out of the dough using an 8cm cookie cutter, placing the rounds on the lined baking trays. Press a few peanut halves, cut side-up, firmly into the tops of the biscuits. Bake for 12-15 mins until turning lightly golden around the edges. Leave to cool on the trays for 5 mins, then lift onto awire rackto cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:12:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3952,3952,'en','Chocolate fairy cakes','Conjure smiles from family and friends with easy chocolate fairy cakes – they have a lovely light sponge and buttery icing','["100g caster sugar","100g unsalted butter, softened","2 large eggs","1 tsp vanilla paste","80g self-raising flour","2 tbsp cocoa powder","½ tsp baking powder","2 tbsp milk","75g softened butter","150g icing sugar","40g cocoa powder","2-3 tbsp milk"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a 12-hole bun tin with paper cases. Put the sugar and butter in abowland beat together until light and fluffy. Gradually mix in the eggs and vanilla until combined.","Add the flour, cocoa powder and baking powder to the bowl and mix to make a smooth batter. Fold the milk through to loosen. Divide the mixture between the cases using a spoon. Bake for 20 mins, or until a cocktail stick poked into the centre of one of the cakes in the middle row comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 5-10 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely","While the cakes are cooling, make the icing. Beat together the butter, icing sugar and cocoa powder in a bowl for 5-10 mins, until you have a smooth, creamy consistency. Add the milk to loosen if needed.Pipeor spread on top of the cooled cupcakes."]','2026-01-10 12:12:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3954,3954,'en','Mulligatawny soup','Cook a batch of mulligatawny soup, packed with veg and rice and gently spiced with curry powder and spices. Top with coriander and yogurt','["20g butter","2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 celery sticks, chopped","3 carrots, peeled and chopped","1 parsnip, peeled and chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","1 thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and grated","1 eating apple, cored and chopped","1½-2 tbsp medium curry powder","1 tsp ground cumin","¼ tsp sweet smoked paprika","1.2l hot chicken stock","1 tbsp tomato purée","100g basmati rice","1 tbsp mango chutney","½ lemon, juiced","½ small bunch of coriander, shredded","yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat the butter and olive oil in acasserole dishand fry the onion and celery with a pinch of salt for 10-12 mins, or until softened and translucent. Stir in the carrots, parsnip, garlic, ginger and apple and cook for 1 min more. Stir through the curry powder, cumin and paprika. Add the stock and tomato purée and season to taste. Reduce to a low simmer, cover and cook for 40 mins.","Rinse the rice and cook for 10 mins in boiling water.Blitzthe soup until smooth with a blender. Drain the rice and stir through the soup with the mango chutney, lemon juice and half the coriander. Check for seasoning, then ladle into bowls and top with the remaining coriander and yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:12:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3956,3956,'en','Chickpea, spinach & almond butter bowl','Combine chickpeas and spinach with almond butter and spices to make this veg-packed family supper. Ready in just 25 minutes, serve with rice','["vegetable oil, for frying","1 large onion, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed","2½cm piece of ginger, peeled and grated","1 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp fenugreek","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","300ml vegetable stock","2 tbsp unsalted almond butter","200g spinach, roughly chopped","cooked rice, to serve"]','["Heat some oil in a pan over a medium heat and fry the onions for 5 mins. Add 50ml water and cook for 7 mins more until just brown. Add the garlic and ginger.","Combine the coriander, cumin, turmeric, fenugreek and some pepper with 2 tbsp water, and tip into the pan. Cook for 5 mins more, then stir in the chickpeas.","Stir in the stock and almond butter, then add the spinach and cook for 3-5 mins more until the spinach has wilted. Serve over rice."]','2026-01-10 12:12:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3958,3958,'en','Carrot pakoras','Forget food waste and use up bits of limp veg to make these sensational pakoras. Broccoli, cauliflower, green beans, courgettes and cabbage also work well.','["3 medium carrots, coarsely grated lengthways","2 shallots or 1 onion, finely sliced","25g coriander, roughly chopped","1 tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp cumin seeds","pinch of hot chilli powder (optional)","1 egg, beaten","100g cornflour","sunflower oil, for deep-frying","100g natural yogurt","2 tbsp lime pickle (roughly chop if it’s too chunky)","small handful of mint leaves, roughly chopped"]','["Tip the carrots and shallots or onion into acolanderset over a sink, and toss with 1 tsp sea salt. Leave to wilt for 10 mins. Meanwhile, for the dip, combine the yogurt, pickle and mint. Chill until ready to use.","When the vegetables have wilted, wrap in a clean tea towel and squeeze out any excess water. Tip into a bowl along with the coriander, spices and egg, and mix well. Add the cornflour and stir until all the veg is evenly coated in thick batter – it’s important that all the cornflour is mixed in properly.","Fill a deep, wide pan no more than two-thirds full of oil and heat to 180C, or until a cube of bread dropped in browns in 20 seconds. Working in batches, carefully lower in two spoonfuls of the pakora mix at a time, well spaced apart, and fry for 2 mins on one side, then 1-2 mins more on the other side until golden and crisp. Transfer to kitchen paper using a slotted spoon to drain. Serve hot with the dip."]','2026-01-10 12:12:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3960,3960,'en','Winter tabbouleh','Combine cauliflower, fennel, bulgur wheat, nuts and pomegranate seeds to make this winter version of tabbouleh. It’s delicious served as a side dish','["60g raisins","200g medium bulgur wheat","175g cauliflower florets, finely chopped","1 small fennel bulb, trimmed, coarse outer leaves removed, chopped","1 lemon, juiced","25g chopped parsley","20g mint leaves, chopped","3 spring onions, finely chopped","50g chopped walnuts, toasted","15g dried barberries","100g pomegranate seeds","1 small garlic clove, finely chopped","¼ tsp ground cumin","¼ tsp ground cinnamon","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses","1 tsp honey","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil"]','["Put the raisins in a heatproof bowl and cover with boiling water from the kettle. Leave to soak for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, put the bulgur in a second heatproof bowl and pour over enough boiling water from thekettleto cover by about 2cm. Cover the bowl and soak for 15 mins. Drain and transfer to a serving bowl. Add the cauliflower, fennel and lemon juice, and stir to combine.","To make the dressing, put the garlic, cumin, cinnamon, pomegranate molasses and honey in a bowl and stir together. Gradually pour in the oil,whiskingcontinuously until combined. Taste for seasoning.","Drain the raisins, and add to the bulgur mixture with the parsley, mint, spring onions, walnuts and barberries. Toss everything together with the dressing. Taste for seasoning again, then stir in the pomegranate seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:12:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3962,3962,'en','Noodles with crispy chilli oil eggs','Make your own crispy chilli oil and use it to season noodles and pak choi. Top with fried eggs for the ultimate comfort food.','["1 tsp vegetable oil","2 heads pak choi, each halved through the core","2 tsp Chinese black vinegar","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tsp sesame oil","pinch of sugar","200g cooked noodles (I use straight-to-wok noodles, egg, udon or ramen noodles)","2 large eggs","4 small shallots, halved and thinly sliced","1 head of garlic (about 8-10 cloves) thinly sliced","1 x 10cm cinnamon stick","4 star anise","500ml vegetable oil","2 tbsp sesame seeds","2 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp Szechuan peppercorns","1 thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled, finely chopped","30g crushed red chilli flakes","2 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp caster sugar"]','["To make the chilli oil, tip the shallots, garlic, cinnamon stick, star anise and oil into a wide pan (a deep frying pan is good), then bring to a gentle sizzle. Cook for 15-20 mins over a low-medium heat, stirring now and again, until the shallots and garlic are crisp and golden brown. They will burn easily if the heat is too high, so watch the pan.","Meanwhile, toast the sesame seeds in a dry pan until golden, then tip into a bowl and set aside. Put the cumin seeds and Szechuan peppercorns in the pan and toast for 1-2 mins until aromatic. Tip into apestle and mortaror spice grinder, and grind to a powder. Mix with the toasted sesame seeds.","Add the ginger, chilli flakes, soy and sugar to the bowl with the toasted, ground spices. When the shallots and garlic are crisp, strain the oil over the bowl using a sieve. Leave the crispy bits of garlic and shallot in the sieve to cool and become even more crisp. Discard the cinnamon and star anise.","Stir the cooled shallots and garlic through the spiced oil mixture.Will keep chilled for up to two weeks in an airtight, sterilised jar.","When ready to make the noodles, heat the veg oil in awok. Add the pak choi and stir-fry for a minute with a splash of water and a pinch of salt. Cover with a lid (or a baking tray if you don’t have one). Steam for a minute, then lift the veg from the wok, letting any liquid drip off. Set aside on a plate. Put the vinegar, soy sauce, sesame oil and sugar in the pan along with 2 tsp of the crispy chilli oil. Bring to a bubble, then add the noodles and toss for a few minutes over a high heat until the sauce is clinging to the noodles and they’re soft and slippery. Divide the noodles between two bowls and put the pak choi on top.","Wipe out the pan. Add another drizzle of the crispy chilli oil along with about 2 tsp of sediment from the jar. When sizzling, crack in the eggs and fry until crispy around the edge, spooning over the oil as they cook. Slide the fried eggs over the noodles, adding more crispy bits from the jar, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3964,3964,'en','Apple & custard rose tart','Impress dinner guests with our apple and custard tart. With a homemade pastry base and pretty ‘roses’ topping made from apple, it’s an eye-catching dessert','["1 lemon, juiced","6-8 apples","2 tbsp caster sugar","200g plain flour","100g unsalted butter, cold and cubed, plus extra for the tin","65g icing sugar","1 large egg yolk","800ml whole milk","2 tsp vanilla paste","5 large egg yolks","100g caster sugar","50g custard powder"]','["Put the plain flour and butter in a bowl and rub together with your fingertips until they resembles breadcrumbs. Mix in the icing sugar and a pinch of salt, followed by the egg yolk. If the pastry feels too dry to form a dough, add 1-2 tbsp water.","Rollthe dough out between two sheets of baking parchment until it forms an approximately 28cm circle. Put in the fridge for 20 mins to firm up, then rest over a buttered 23cm tart tin. Push down into the corners and trim the top so there’s a 1-2cm overhang of pastry. Don’t worry if it breaks slightly, just patch up any tears with the offcuts. Prick the base several times with a fork, then chill in the fridge for 45 mins. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Lay a sheet of baking parchment over the chilled tart case and fill to the top with baking beans. Blind bake for 15 mins. Remove the baking beans and parchment and bake for another 10-15 mins until golden brown. Leave to cool in the tin, then trim off the excess pastry around the top with a smallknife.","Meanwhile, bring the milk and vanilla to the boil in asaucepanover a medium heat. Beat together the egg yolks, caster sugar and custard powder until well combined.","Pour the hot milk over the egg and sugar mixture,whiskingcontinuously, until the mixture is smooth and well combined. Return the mixture to the pan over a medium-low heat. Stir continuously for 2-3 mins until the mixture is very thick. Leave to cool slightly, giving a whisk occasionally so it doesn’t go lumpy.","Pour the custard mixture into the cooked pastry case, spreading to level it out. Put it in the fridge for 2 hrs to set completely.","Pour half the lemon juice into a medium bowl of water, then finely slice the apples into the bowl, using a mandolin if you like. Sprinkle with the caster sugar andmicrowavefor 3-4 mins on high, then transfer into a bowl of cold water with the remaining lemon juice.","Wrap 3-4 slices of apple around each other to form a rose shape – rolling up the first one, then wrapping the other slices around it. Press the apple flowers into the custard, working your way around until the whole tart is covered."]','2026-01-10 12:12:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3966,3966,'en','Air-fried chicken wings','Use an air fryer to make these easy chicken wings, and add the seasoning or sauce of your choice. They’re perfect for a buffet or just a movie night snack','["1kg chicken wings","1 tbsp sunflower or olive oil","seasoning of your choice (use salt and pepper, or ½-1 tsp of either smoky BBQ, ras-el-hanout, garlic granules, celery salt or garam masala)","dipping sauce, to serve (optional)"]','["Separate each chicken wing in two at the joint, removing the wing tips if you like using sharp kitchen scissors. Toss the chicken wings in the oil and seasoning, then tip into anair fryer(you can either use one with a paddle, or arrange them on the tray of your air fryer if it doesn’t have a paddle).","Program the air fryer to cook for 35 mins. Check the wings are tender and cooked through – they should be almost falling off the bone – and cook for a further 5 mins if needed. The skin should have bubbled and crisped up, and any excess fat from the chicken will have dripped off into base of the fryer (discard this). Don’t leave the chicken in the fryer, or the steam will make the skin soft again. Immediately tip into a bowl and serve with sauce for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:12:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3968,3968,'en','Broccoli caesar salad','Make this broccoli caesar salad for an easy, sophisticated starter. Ready in just 10 minutes, it’s ideal for a dinner party or Christmas lunch','["1 small garlic clove","2 anchovies in oil","4 tbsp olive oil, plus extra to serve","1 tbsp mayonnaise","½ lemon, juiced","10g finely grated parmesan, plus extra to serve","1 tsp Dijon mustard","300g long-stemmed broccoli","2 shop-bought crostini, crushed"]','["Crush the garlic with the anchovies. Tip into a small bowl and mix with the  oil, mayonnaise, lemon juice, parmesan and Dijon mustard.","Cook the broccoli in apanof boiling salted water for 3-4 mins until just tender. Drain. Arrange the broccoli over four plates, then drizzle with the dressing. Crush the crostini and scatter over the salad, then drizzle with a little more olive oil and sprinkle with extra grated parmesan."]','2026-01-10 12:12:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3970,3970,'en','Griddled pears with goat’s cheese & hazelnut dressing','Impress guests with this deceptively simple starter, made with pears, goat’s cheese, watercress and hazelnuts. It’s ready in just 15 minutes, and perfect at Christmas','["40g toasted hazelnuts, finely chopped or crushed","3 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp balsamic or red wine vinegar","2 pears, cored","handful of watercress, to serve","100g goat''s cheese, crumbled"]','["Combine the hazelnuts with the oil, vinegar and a pinch of sea salt flakes. Slice each pear into six wedges.","Heat agriddle panover a high heat and griddle the pear wedges until slightly charred. Arrange three in a line on each plate. Tuck some watercress around the pears, then crumble over the goat’s cheese. Dot over the hazelnut dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:12:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3972,3972,'en','Sage & onion devils on horseback','Make a fun little play on pigs in blankets for your Christmas dinner, with the addition of a flavourful sausage stuffing. They make the perfect festive side','["25g butter","1 onion, chopped","4 pork sausages","1⁄2 tsp dried sage","grating of nutmeg","12 soft pitted prunes","12 smoked streaky bacon rashers","1 tbsp sunflower oil"]','["Melt the butter in a small pan over a low heat, and fry the onion for 10 mins until softened and golden. Remove from the heat and leave to cool.","Squeeze the sausagemeat from the skins into a bowl, and tip in the fried onions and sage, grate over some nutmeg and season with plenty of black pepper. Use your hands to mix until the ingredients are combined, then divide into 12 portions and roll into balls. Split each prune down the middle lengthways so it can be opened out like a book. Press a sausage ball into the middle of each prune, carefully wrapping the prune around it to encase the stuffing. Wrap a bacon rasher around each stuffed prune, then thread a cocktail stick through the loose ends to secure the bacon. Place the devils on horseback on abaking sheetlined with baking parchment. Will keep, covered in the fridge, for up to 24 hrs.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 7. Brush the devils on horseback with the oil and bake for 15-20 mins until the bacon is crisp and golden, and the stuffing is cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:12:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3974,3974,'en','Thyme & chestnut roast potatoes','Add the festive flavours of chestnut and thyme to take standard roast potatoes up a Christmassy notch or two','["1.5-2kg floury potatoes, such as King Edward or Maris Piper, cut into equal chunks","150ml vegetable oil","bunch of thyme, roughly chopped","180g pouch cooked chestnuts, roughly crumbled"]','["Put the potatoes in a large pan and cover with cold salted water. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 5 mins until just tender. Drain.","Put the oil in a largeroasting tin, then transfer the tin to the oven with the turkey for 10 mins. Remove the tin from the oven and carefully tip in the potatoes and thyme, turning to coat in the hot oil. When the turkey is cooked through, turn the oven up to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and roast the potatoes for 40 mins. Turn the potatoes over and roast for 10-15 mins more until golden all over. Sprinkle over the chestnuts and roast for a final 10 mins until the chestnuts are heated through."]','2026-01-10 12:12:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3976,3976,'en','Salmon scramble flatbreads','Try a healthier alternative to smoked salmon and scrambled eggs that’s just as delicious, but made with fresh spinach and served on homemade flatbreads','["1 tsp rapeseed oil","90g wholemeal flour, plus extra for dusting","160g baby spinach","3 large eggs","1 tbsp chopped dill, plus extra to serve","1 tsp rapeseed oil","1½ tsp capers, drained and chopped","100g skinless wild salmon, cut into small pieces"]','["To make the flatbreads, rub the oil into the flour using your fingers. Stir in 60ml warm water with a cutlery knife, then knead briefly on a lightly floured surface until the dough is smooth and elastic. Cut in half.","Roll out each half of dough using a flouredrolling pinuntil very thin (about 21cm in diameter). Heat anon-stick frying panover a high heat, and cook one of the flatbreads for 1 min. Flip and cook on the other side for 30 seconds, pressing it down with a spatula until slightly browned in places and fairly dry without being crisp. Repeat with the second flatbread. Cover both with a tea towel and keep warm.","Put the spinach in the pan and cook over a medium heat for 1-2 mins until wilted. Tip into a sieve over a bowl and press out the excess liquid using using the back of a spoon, then roughly chop.","Beat the eggs with the dill and plenty of black pepper, then set aside. Rinse the pan and set over a medium heat. Add the capers, then the salmon and stir until the fish just starts to turn opaque at the edges. Pour in the egg mixture, and stir to scramble the eggs. When the salmon is almost cooked through and the egg is almost set, stir in the spinach to heat through. Serve on the warmed flatbreads with the extra dill scattered over and a good grinding of black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:12:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3978,3978,'en','Jessica’s magical Christmas cake','Dazzle guests with this fab cake. Designed by eight-year-old Jessica Whitlow in our magical Christmas cake competition, it features three flavoured sponges','["500g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tins","700g light muscovado sugar","10 medium eggs","400g dark chocolate, melted and cooled","1 tbsp vanilla extract","340g plain flour","2 tbsp smooth apricot jam","750g sky blue sugar paste or fondant icing","200g unsalted butter, softened","200g golden caster sugar","4 medium eggs","200g self-raising flour, sifted","½ tsp baking powder","5 lemons, zested, 4 juiced","1 tbsp raspberry jam","pink and red food colourings","100g unsalted butter, softened","100g golden caster sugar","2 medium eggs","100g self-raising flour, sifted","¼ tsp baking powder","2 tbsp milk","120g blueberries, tossed in a little plain flour","1-2 tbsp lemon curd","dark and light blue food colourings","200g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids), chopped","100g double cream","800g unsalted butter, softened","1.6kg icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","2 tbsp vanilla extract","2 rice crispy squares","150g white sugar paste, plus extra for the clouds","black, green, brown, orange and other coloured sugar pastes","black edible writing pen","edible glue","150g yellow sugar paste, plus extra for the stars","edible silver balls (optional)","2 chocolate-coated biscuit sticks","26cm, 18cm and 10cm cake drums","cocktail sticks","8-10 cake dowels","cloud-shaped cutters and star-shaped cutters in different sizes"]','["Heat the oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3. To make the brownie tier, butter three 26cm loose-bottomed cake tins and line with baking parchment. Beat the butter, sugar and a pinch of salt for 7 mins until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well after each. Fold in the chocolate and vanilla, then the flour. Spoon into the tins and bake for 40 mins until the outside is slightly flaky with a brownie crust, and the centre is set with no wet crumbs when a skewer is inserted into the middle. Leave to cool completely in the tins. Turn the oven up to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","To make the middle tier, butter and line two 18cm loose-bottomed cake tins. Beat the butter, sugar and a pinch of salt for 7 mins until light and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well after each. Fold in the flour, baking powder, the zest of 2 lemons and a quarter of the lemon juice. Spoon into the tins and bake for 25-30 mins until lightly golden and firm to the touch. Leave to cool in the tins for 5 mins, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.","To make the blueberry tier, butter and line two 10cm round cake tins. Beat the butter, sugar and a pinch of salt for 7 mins until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well after each. Fold in the flour, baking powder, milk and blueberries. Spoon into the tins and bake for 20-25 mins until light golden and firm to the touch. Leave in the tins for 5 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","For the ganache, put the chocolate in a heatproof bowl. Bring the cream to the boil over a medium heat, then pour it over the chocolate,whiskingcontinuously until melted and smooth. Leave to cool slightly.","To make the buttercream, beat the butter, icing sugar and vanilla for 10-12 mins until pale and fluffy. Put 850g buttercream in a bowl and beat in the ganache. Spread a small blob of chocolate buttercream over the middle of the 26cm cake drum and top with a brownie sponge. Spread the top of the sponge with 2-3 tbsp chocolate buttercream, then sandwich with a second brownie sponge. Repeat with 2-3 tbsp chocolate buttercream and the last sponge. Spread the rest of the chocolate buttercream over the top and side in a thick layer using a palette knife. Chill for at least 1 hr.","Stir the rest of the lemon zest and juice into the remaining plain buttercream. Spread a small blob of lemon buttercream over the middle of the 18cm cake drum and top with a lemon sponge. Spread the top of the sponge with 2 tbsp lemon buttercream and the raspberry jam, then top with the second sponge. Spread 400g lemon buttercream over the top and side. Chill for 1 hr.","Spread a small blob of lemon buttercream over the middle of the 10cm cake drum and top with a blueberry sponge. Spread the top of the sponge with the lemon curd and 1 tbsp lemon buttercream, then top with the second sponge. Spread 200g lemon buttercream over the top and side. Chill for 1 hr. Dye 250g of the remaining buttercream deep grey/blue using the blue food colourings. Spread this over the blueberry cake tier. Chill for 1 hr.","Dye any remaining buttercream deep red with the pink and red food colourings. Spread this over the lemon cake tier. Chill for 1 hr.","Remove the brownie tier from the fridge. Warm the apricot jam in a pan to loosen, cool slightly, then brush over the top and side of the cake. Roll the sky blue sugar paste out on a sheet of baking parchment lightly dusted with icing sugar to 40cm (5mm thickness). Use this to cover the brownie tier, smoothing it down the sides. Chill overnight.","For the decorations, start with the snowman. Roll 1 rice crispy square into a large ball. Roll two-thirds of the second square into a medium ball, and what’s left into a small ball. Roll out the white sugar paste. Use this to cover the balls, then roll them in your hands to smooth. Create a hat from the black and green sugar pastes. Use two cocktail sticks and mould brown sugar paste around each to make arms with twig fingers. Leave to set at room temperature for 1 hr. Draw eyes and a mouth on the smallest ball with a black writing pen, and make a small carrot nose from orange sugar paste. Assemble the snowman, push the arms into the sides, and stick on the hat and nose using a little edible glue. Draw buttons down the middle of the snowman using the writing pen.","To stack the cake tiers, first measure about five dowels against the side of the bottom tier, and three or four against the side of the middle tier. Cut the dowels to the same height as the tiers. Insert the dowels in a circle into the middle of the tiers – this will support the tier above. Carefully stack the cake tiers from largest to smallest.","Cut small stars from different coloured sugar pastes. Roll out some white sugar paste and stamp out some clouds. Stick the stars to the bottom tier in a rainbow pattern (use a little edible glue, if needed), then affix the clouds to the side. Roll out the yellow sugar paste and stamp out different sized stars, then stick them to the middle tier. Roll out a little green sugar paste and cut out a tree shape using a smallknife, then create a brown tree stand from sugar paste. Decorate the tree with sugar paste off-cuts and edible silver balls, if you like. Roll out a little more sugar paste, cut out two small flags and wrap these around the biscuit sticks. Write messages on the flags using a writing pen, and stick into the middle tier. Top the cake with the snowman, securing it into the top tier using a cocktail stick. Best eaten within a day of decorating.Will keep for up to five days.BOTTOM TIER(15) 1,332 kcals • fat 69g • saturates 41g • carbs 164g • sugars 141g • fibre 5g • protein 11g •salt 0.2gMIDDLE TIER(10) 856 kcals • fat 46g • saturates 28g • carbs 104g • sugars 88g • fibre 1g • protein 5g •salt 0.4gTOP TIER(with decoration) (6) 953 kcals • fat 42g • saturates 26g • carbs 137g • sugars 113g • fibre 1g • protein 6g • salt 0.5g"]','2026-01-10 12:12:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3980,3980,'en','Spiced pomegranate & orange glazed ham','Serve our glazed ham warm in thin slices alongside the Christmas turkey. This one has a sticky sweet-and-sour glaze made with pomegranate molasses and orange','["1.5-2kg unsmoked boneless tied gammon joint","2 bay leaves, plus extra to serve (optional)","3 star anise","4 whole cloves, plus extra for studding the ham","8 allspice berries","10 whole peppercorns","1 litre pomegranate juice","2 small oranges, 1 halved, 1 sliced, plus 1 tsp juice","1 tbsp pomegranate molasses","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","2 tbsp brown sugar","1 tbsp honey","80g pomegranate seeds to serve (optional)","Chop into chunks and stir through mac ‘n’ cheese, along with leeks and mustard.","Cut into thick slices and fry until crisp and golden, then serve with a runny fried egg and some bubble and squeak.","Shred into large pieces and add to a pie with turkey.","Shred and toss with some sprout slaw. Add croutons or extra seeds, if you like.","Mix into a Welsh rarebit topping, and pile onto crusty bread. Grill until golden."]','["Put the gammon in a large pan with the bay leaves, star anise, cloves, 6 allspice berries and 8 peppercorns. Pour over the pomegranate juice to cover the gammon (you may need to top up with water). Add one of the orange halves, then bring to a simmer and partially cover with a lid. Cook for 2 hrs 30 mins, topping up with water as needed to keep the gammon covered. Leave to cool in the liquid for 20 mins, then lift out and place on a baking tray lined with baking parchment.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.Cutthe skin off the gammon, leaving a 1cm layer of fat. Score lines into the fat at ½cm intervals using knife. Bake for 15 mins until the fat is starting to crisp.","Meanwhile, crush the remaining allspice berries and peppercorns with apestle and mortar. Combine the crushed spices with the molasses, mustard, sugar and 1 tsp orange juice. Remove the gammon from the oven and brush over the molasses mixture. Arrange the orange slices over the gammon, securing them with some cloves.","Turn the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and return the gammon to the oven for another 20 mins. Brush the honey over the orange slices and bake for another 5-10 mins, or until the glaze is bubbling. Leave to rest for at least 20 mins, then serve with bay leaves and pomegranate seeds scattered over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3982,3982,'en','Mustardy sausage & sprout gnocchi','Left-over sprouts in your fridge? Make the most of them with our mustardy sausage gnocchi for supper. It takes just 25 minutes to make','["250g gnocchi","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, thinly sliced","3 pork sausages (200g)","250g sprouts, shredded","100ml chicken stock","2 tsp wholegrain mustard","2 tbsp half-fat crème fraîche","½ small bunch of parsley, chopped, plus extra to serve","parmesan, grated (optional)"]','["Cook the gnocchi in a pan of salted water following pack instructions. Drain and set aside.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large frying pan and fry the onion over a medium heat for 8 mins, or until softened and turning golden brown. Squeeze the sausagemeat out of the skins and into the pan, breaking it up with a wooden spoon. Cook for 5 mins until golden brown. Stir through the sprouts and cook for a further 5 mins until softened. Add the stock and mustard, and bring to the boil. Stir through the crème fraîche and parsley. Season. Tip in the gnocchi, tossing with 100ml water to loosen the sauce, and bring to a simmer for 3 mins. To serve, sprinkle with the extra parsley and parmesan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3984,3984,'en','Spicy cauliflower & halloumi rice','Make this spicy cauliflower, spinach and halloumi rice for a speedy, simple supper. Nourishing and balanced, it’s ideal for busy weeknights','["1 small head cauliflower (500g), broken into medium florets","150g baby spinach","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 red onion, sliced","120g halloumi, cut into cubes","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 thumb-sized piece ginger, finely grated","1 tsp ground turmeric","1 tbsp medium curry powder","2 x 250g pouches brown basmati rice","1 red chilli, finely sliced"]','["Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil and cook the cauliflower for 5 mins over a high heat, adding the spinach for the final 2 mins. Drain and set aside.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan or shallowcasserole dishand fry the onion over a medium heat for 5 mins. Turn up the heat, add the halloumi, cook for a further 5 mins, then add the garlic, ginger, turmeric and curry powder, and cook for 1 min more. Stir through the rice, cauliflower and spinach to warm everything through, adding 1 tbsp water if it looks a little dry. Season and scatter over the chilli."]','2026-01-10 12:12:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3986,3986,'en','Pastrami-cured salmon','Serve this gravadlax-style salmon on Christmas morning with bagels, or for festive canapés. It’s inspired by a New York deli breakfast','["800g side of salmon (the freshest you can get)","250g coarse sea salt","100g light brown soft sugar","2 tbsp coriander seeds","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tbsp caraway seeds","1 tbsp black peppercorns","1 bay leaf","1 tsp sweet smoked paprika","½ tsp cayenne pepper","2 tbsp black treacle","soft cheese, rye bread or bagels, dill pickles and chopped dill"]','["Three days before you want to serve the salmon, put it, skin-side down, in a rimmed dish. Combine the salt and sugar, then set aside.","Fry the coriander seeds, ground coriander, caraway seeds and peppercorns in a small dry frying pan set over a medium heat for 2-3 mins. Tip into a spice grinder or smallfood processoralong with the bay, and blitz until finely ground. Stir the spice mixture into the salt and sugar mix. Pat the spiced salt mixture all over and around the salmon so it’s well packed onto the flesh. Wrap tightly in cling film, then set a plate or board and something heavy (such as a couple of cans) on top to weigh the fish down. Chill for 48 hrs.","Heat the paprika, cayenne and black treacle in a pan until loosened, then remove from the heat and leave to cool slightly until just warm. Brush the excess salt off the salmon and rinse the fish under cold running water. Pat dry with kitchen paper, then transfer to a clean dish. Brush with the warm treacle mixture until well coated (you may need to generously brush the fish several times before the coating covers the fish well), then wrap in a fresh sheet of cling film. Chill for another 24 hrs.","When you’re ready to serve, set the salmon on a board and thinly slice with a sharp knife, avoiding the layer of skin at the bottom. Serve with soft cheese, rye bread or bagels, pickles and some chopped dill for everyone to help themselves."]','2026-01-10 12:12:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3988,3988,'en','Singapore-style nyonya curry','GF member Suzanne Bloor shares her go-to Friday night dish: a simplified chicken curry with South East Asian influences. Ideal for a family of four','["80g nyonya curry paste (available online and at Waitrose & Partners, or see tip, below)","500g bone-in chicken thighs, skin removed","200g potatoes, cut into 3cm cubes","150g carrots, cut into 3cm cubes","1 large onion, roughly chopped","100ml coconut milk","cooked rice and naan breads (optional), to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put 200ml water and the curry paste in a large ovenproof saucepan. Stir and bring to a gentle simmer over a low heat until the mixture is fragrant.","Add the chicken, potatoes, carrots and onion, season and stir well to combine. Turn up the heat to medium and bring to the boil, stir in the coconut milk, then bring back to the boil. Remove from the heat, cover the pan and transfer to the oven to cook for 1 hr 15 mins, removing the lid after 45 mins, or until the veg is tender but not quite falling apart, and the chicken is cooked through. The curry should have a broth-like consistency. Check for seasoning.","Serve in shallow bowls over rice, with some naan breads on the side, if you like.Will keep covered in the fridge for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:12:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3990,3990,'en','Gluten-free sausage roll wreath','Create this gluten-free sausage roll wonder by arranging sausage and chutney pinwheels into a festive wreath shape. It’s perfect for a Christmas buffet','["6 gluten-free pork sausages","½ tsp mixed spice","280g ASDA Free From Ready Rolled Puff Pastry","2 tbsp red onion chutney, plus more to serve","1 egg, beaten to glaze"]','["Squeeze the sausagemeat from their skins into a bowl. Season with salt and pepper and sprinkle over the mixed spice. Mix well by hand.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Unravel the ASDA Free From Ready Rolled Puff Pastry onto a work surface, keeping it on the baking parchment. Spread the chutney in a thin layer all over the pastry. Spread the sausagemeat on top, covering the whole surface. Pat and press the meat into the pastry with your palms to make a thin, even layer.","Working with the long side closest to you, roll the pastry up, leaving the parchment sheet behind, to create a long, thin sausage spiral.Cutinto 3cm sections, you should have about 10. Press the ends into the edges to neaten if you like. Transfer to a parchment-lined baking sheet, cut-side up, to form a wreath shape, leaving a 5mm gap between the rolls to allow for them to puff up.","Brush the beaten egg over the tops and sides of the rolls, then cook for 25-30 mins until the pastry is golden and crisp and the sausage is cooked through. Leave to cool slightly and transfer to a board or serving plate with more red onion chutney, or mustard and pickles."]','2026-01-10 12:12:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3992,3992,'en','Chorizo croquetas with aïoli','Try a new way to use chorizo, with these fabulous croquetas served with garlic mayonnaise. They require a little effort, but make a great starter or party snack','["50g butter","½ medium onion, finely chopped","70g plain flour","435ml whole milk","135g chorizo, cut into small chunks","50g grated manchego","2 tbsp finely chopped parsley","3 eggs, lightly beaten","150g dry breadcrumbs","groundnut oil, for frying","4 garlic cloves, crushed","2 large egg yolks (freeze the whites for another recipe)","250-300ml extra virgin olive oil","squeeze of lemon juice"]','["Heat the butter in a pan over a medium-low heat, and fry the onion for 8 mins until softened but not coloured. Stir in the flour until it’s incorporated into the fat and onions. Reduce the heat to low and cook for 4 mins, stirring – don’t let it brown. Warm the milk in a medium pan over a low heat until steaming.","Remove the onion mixture from the heat and add the milk, a little at a time, stirring after each addition until smooth. When all the milk has been added, return the pan to medium-low heat and bring to the boil, stirring constantly. Reduce the heat to low and cook for 6 mins, stirring often to prevent it from catching. Set aside.","Cook the chorizo in afrying panover a medium heat for 3 mins – you don’t need any fat, as fat will be released from the chorizo as it cooks. Stir the fried chorizo into the sauce along with the cheese, parsley and seasoning. Pour the sauce into a dish and leave to cool completely, then cover and chill for at least 3 hrs, or overnight.","Next, make the aïoli. Put the garlic and the egg yolks in a bowl and beat with an electricwhiskwhile slowly adding the oil, a drop at a time. As the mixture starts to thicken, you can add the oil more quickly, in greater amounts. Squeeze in some lemon juice and season, tasting as you go to ensure the flavour is balanced (you can also add a drop of white wine vinegar as well as lemon juice, if you like). Cover and chill until ready to serve.","Using wet hands, roll the chilled chorizo mixture into walnut-sized balls. Put the egg in a shallow bowl and the breadcrumbs on a shallow plate. Roll the croquetas in the egg, then crumbs, making sure each is well coated. Put the croquetas on abaking tray, then cover loosely and chill for a few hours to firm up, so they don’t break up when you fry them.","Pour the groundnut oil into a pan until it is no more than a third full, and heat to 180C, or until a cube of bread dropped in turns golden within 30 seconds. Deep-fry the croquetas in batches for 2-3 mins per batch, keeping an eye on the temperature. If the oil is too hot, the croquetas will darken on the outside before the inside is hot – they should be golden. Use a slotted spoon to transfer the croquetas to a plate lined with kitchen paper, leave to drain for a few minutes, then serve with the aïoli."]','2026-01-10 12:12:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3994,3994,'en','Vegan Christmas pudding brownies','Make brownies fabulously festive by adding Christmas pudding into the mix. They’re dairy-free, so they’re perfect for vegans, too','["1 x 150g Asda free-from Christmas pudding","2 tbsp ground flaxseed or linseed","200g dairy-free dark chocolate, chopped","100g dairy-free spread","100ml plant-based milk, such as oat or almond","vegetable oil, for the tin","125g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","50g cocoa powder","150g golden caster sugar","100g light brown soft sugar","¼ tsp fine sea salt","1 tsp vanilla bean paste or extract","a little icing sugar mixed with a pinch of ground cinnamon, for dusting"]','["Cut or crumble the Asda free-from Christmas pudding into small chunks or pieces, and set aside. Mix the ground flaxseed or linseed with 4 tbsp water in a small bowl, and leave to thicken and become gel-like.","Melt 150g of the chocolate, the spread and milk together in a heatproof bowl set over a small pan of just-simmering water (ensure the bottom of the bowl does not touch the water). Stir until the chocolate has melted and the mixture is smooth. Remove from the heat.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil a 20cm brownie or square cake tin and line with baking parchment. Brieflywhiskthe flour, ground almonds, cocoa, sugars and salt together in a large bowl with an electric whisk to break up any lumps of sugar. Make a well in the centre, then whisk in the chocolate mixture, along with the flaxseed mixture and vanilla. Beat until smooth and all the flour is incorporated – the batter should be thick.","Fold in the Christmas pudding pieces and the remaining chocolate chunks until just incorporated, then scrape into the prepared tin. Smooth the surface with a spatula and bake for 40-50 mins until the top has a light crust and there''s a slight wobble in the centre. A skewer inserted into the middle should have moist crumbs clinging to it, but no raw batter. Leave to cool completely in the tin.","Cut the brownies into squares and serve at room temperature, or chill for a more fudgy texture.Will keep in an airtight container at room temperature or chilled for up to three days, or frozen for up to three months. Dust with the cinnamon icing sugar just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:12:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3996,3996,'en','Herby roast potatoes','Cook these best ever roast potatoes on a baking tray with low sides to get golden, crisp results. Serve with a Sunday roast.','["4 tbsp rapeseed oil","1½ kg Maris Piper potatoes, cut into quarters, peel reserved","50g butter","½ bunch of woody herbs (thyme, rosemary or bay)","6 garlic cloves, lightly bashed"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Add the oil to a large flameproofbaking trayand put in the oven to heat up.","Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil, tip in the potatoes and their peel (for extra flavour), and simmer for 8-10 mins. Drain the potatoes and discard the peel. Leave to steam-dry for 15 mins, then return the potatoes to the pan, put the lid on and gently shake to lightly rough up the edges.","Remove the tray from the oven and put directly on the hob over a medium heat. Add the butter to the hot oil and, using tongs, add the potatoes to the tray, one by one, turning them in the fat, leaving a little space between each. Reduce the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Nestle the herbs around the potatoes, along with the garlic. Sprinkle over 1 tbsp sea salt and return to the oven for 1 hr, turning every once in a while, until golden and crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:12:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(3998,3998,'en','Curried kale & chickpea soup','Rustle up this budget-friendly, healthy soup for a nourishing, easy midweek meal. It’s packed with kale, chickpeas, sweet potato and plenty of flavour','["1 tsp rapeseed or coconut oil","1 onion, chopped","1 tbsp grated ginger","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 sweet potato (about 200g), peeled and cut into 2cm cubes","1 tsp turmeric","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tbsp medium or hot curry powder","400g can chickpeas, rinsed","150ml low-fat coconut milk","500ml vegetable stock (see tip, below)","160g kale, chopped","1 lime, juiced","1 red chilli, finely chopped (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and fry the onion for 5 mins. Add the ginger and garlic, fry for 1 min more, then stir in the sweet potato, spices and chickpeas. Cook for another 5 mins, adding a little water if the spices stick to the pan.","Pour in the coconut milk and 400ml of the stock, then bring to a simmer and cook for 8 mins. Season, then transfer a quarter of the soup to ablenderand whizz until smooth. Pour in the reserved stock to loosen, if needed, then add back to the pan with the remaining soup. Stir in the kale and cook for 5 mins. Add the lime juice, then ladle into bowls and scatter over the chilli, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:12:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4000,4000,'en','Speedy butternut squash barley ‘risotto’','Swap rice for barley to make this easy squash ‘risotto’ with spinach and sage. It’s healthy and low in calories and fat – perfect for a quick supper','["2 tsp olive oil","1 large shallot or small onion, finely chopped","300g squash or pumpkin, cut into 1cm cubes","2 garlic cloves, crushed","small handful of sage leaves, finely chopped","½ tsp ground mace or a good grating of nutmeg","160g spinach leaves","2 x 400g cans barley in water, drained","300ml hot vegetable stock","40g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, finely grated","2 tsp olive oil","1 large shallot or small onion, finely chopped","300g squash or pumpkin, cut into 1cm cubes","2 garlic cloves, crushed","small handful of sage leaves, finely chopped","½ tsp ground mace or a good grating of nutmeg","160g spinach leaves","2 x 400g cans barley in water, drained","300ml hot vegetable stock","40g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, finely grated"]','["Heat the oil in a deepfrying panover a medium heat, and fry the shallot with a pinch of salt for 5 mins until soft. Add the squash, garlic, sage and mace, and fry, stirring continually, for another 6-8 mins until the squash is starting to soften and the garlic is fragrant.","Tip in the spinach and barley with some seasoning and the stock. Bring to a simmer and cook for 4-5 mins until the spinach has wilted. Add a splash more stock or water, if you like. When the ‘risotto’ is thick and creamy, taste to see if it needs a little more mace or nutmeg and seasoning. Stir in most of the parmesan, then top with the remaining parmesan and grind over some black pepper to serve.","Heat the oil in a deepfrying panover a medium heat, and fry the shallot with a pinch of salt for 5 mins until soft. Add the squash, garlic, sage and mace, and fry, stirring continually, for another 6-8 mins until the squash is starting to soften and the garlic is fragrant.","Tip in the spinach and barley with some seasoning and the stock. Bring to a simmer and cook for 4-5 mins until the spinach has wilted. Add a splash more stock or water, if you like. When the ‘risotto’ is thick and creamy, taste to see if it needs a little more mace or nutmeg and seasoning. Stir in most of the parmesan, then top with the remaining parmesan and grind over some black pepper to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4002,4002,'en','Non-alcoholic eggnog','Kick-start your Christmas with eggnog, a classic creamy cocktail. This version is alcohol-free, but still has all the indulgence of the original','["1 vanilla pod, split and seeds scraped out","4 egg yolks","100ml sugar syrup","100ml double cream","500ml whole milk","ice"]','["Put the vanilla seeds in a large bowl. Add the egg yolks and sugar syrup, and beat with an electric whisk until pale, about 2-3 mins. Add the cream and milk, and beat again until just combined.","Fill a large jug with ice, then strain in the eggnog mixture. Stir gently until the outside of the jug feels cold, then pour the eggnog into tumblers to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:12:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4004,4004,'en','Easy biscotti','Make these easy biscotti to serve with coffee, or dip into chocolate and present in a tin to give to family and friends','["300g plain flour","100g caster sugar","50g light brown soft sugar","1½ tsp baking powder","80g vegetable oil","1 large egg","2 tsp vanilla extract","milk or dark chocolate , melted, to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4, and line a baking tray with baking parchment. Put the flour, sugars, baking powder and a large pinch of salt in a large bowl and stir together.","In a separate bowl,whisktogether the oil, egg, vanilla and 3 tbsp hot water. Gradually mix the wet ingredients into the dry until the mixture comes together into a dough. Gently knead the dough until smooth – it will be quite dry, so add another 1 tbsp water if it’s too difficult to knead after a few minutes. Divide the dough into two equal pieces, shaping each into a 25 x 8cm log. Put the logs on the preparedbaking trayand bake for 25-30 mins. Remove from the oven and leave to cool on the tray for around 15 mins.","Using a sharp knife, cut the slightly cooled logs into 1-2cm-thick slices crosswise. Return the biscotti to the lined baking tray and bake for 15-20 mins more (the oven should still be at 180C/160C fan/gas 4), turning the tray around halfway through. Leave to cool slightly on the tray, then transfer the biscotti to awire rackand leave to cool completely. If you like, dip one end of each biscotti into some melted chocolate, then leave to set on a baking tray lined with baking parchment.Will keep in an airtight container for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:12:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4006,4006,'en','Pistachio barfi','Enjoy this traditional Indian sweet treat at special occasions such as Diwali. With the texture of soft marzipan, it’s richly indulgent and beautifully spiced','["75g shelled pistachio nuts","6 green cardamom pods","1 litre Jersey full cream milk","75g caster sugar","silver leaf or extra chopped pistachio nuts, to decorate (optional)"]','["Blitz the pistachio nuts in a smallfood processoruntil finely chopped. Take care not to overwork them or they will become oily. Set aside.","Split the cardamom pods and remove the seeds. Pound the seeds to a powder in apestle and mortarwith 1 tsp of the sugar.","Heat the milk in a largewokor karahi over a medium heat and boil, stirring all the time with a metal spoon, until it reduces to a thick cream – you want the milk to reduce rapidly so it retains its creamy colour without browning, about 20-30 mins. Keep scraping down the sides of the pan to prevent scorching. The milk should have left the sides of the pan and have the consistency of scrambled eggs.","Spoon this thick paste into a bowl and leave to cool before chilling for 2-3 hrs. You should now have 225-250g of reduced milk solids, known as ‘khoya’.","Coarsely grate the khoya on a box grater and put it in a sturdy casserole or wok. Add the cardamom powder and remaining caster sugar and cook over a gentle heat, stirring all the time, until the sugar has dissolved and the mixture has thickened, about 10 mins.","Take the pan off the heat, add the chopped nuts and mix well. Line a baking tray with baking parchment and transfer the warm barfi mixture onto the paper, patting it out to a rectangle. Cover with another sheet of parchment, and gently roll the barfi into a 16 x 19cm rectangle about ½cm thick with a rolling pin. Leave to set for 3-4 hrs. If your kitchen is very warm, put the tray in the fridge for 30 mins.","Remove the top sheet of paper. Rest a sheet of the silver leaf, if using, on the barfi, silver side facing downwards. Gently rub the back of the paper with your fingers, the silver leaf should transfer onto the mixture – try not to touch the silver leaf with your fingers as it will stick to them. Or, press chopped pistachios onto the mixture while still warm, if you like.","Cut the firm barfi into 3 x 4cm diamond shapes.Will keep at room temperature in an airtight box for 3-4 days."]','2026-01-10 12:12:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4008,4008,'en','Spiced gram flour ladoo (besan ladoo)','Try this classic Indian sweet at Diwali. Besan ladoo is made with nutty fried gram flour enriched with fragrant saffron, chopped cashews and homemade ghee','["6 green cardamom pods","100g icing sugar, sieved","50g unsalted cashews","125g ghee (see tip, below)","200g gram flour, sieved","¼ tsp saffron, soaked in 1 tbsp warm milk","1 tbsp chopped pistachios"]','["Split the cardamom pods and remove the seeds. Grind the seeds to a powder with 1 tsp of the icing sugar using apestle and mortar. Set aside.","Heat a sturdy, small pan and roast the cashews over a medium heat, stirring all the time, until they pick up flecks of colour. Transfer to achopping board, and once cooled, finely chop.","Melt the ghee in awokor karahi over a low heat, add the sieved gram flour and fry, stirring all the time, until it darkens and releases a toasted aroma, about 15-20 mins. Stir in the toasted cashews and transfer to a mixing bowl. Leave until warm enough to handle.","Add the remaining sugar, ground cardamom and saffron with its soaking liquid. Knead the paste until smooth, then leave to cool to room temperature.","Shape the gram flour mixture into small balls (ladoos) with your hands, about 3 cm in diameter. Put them on a baking tray lined with baking parchment. If the ladoos are a little soft, chill for 10 mins to firm up. To serve, press a few chopped pistachios into the top of each one.Will keep in an airtight container at room temperature for 7-10 days."]','2026-01-10 12:12:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4010,4010,'en','Green bean casserole','Make this easy green bean and mushroom casserole as a veggie side to accompany a main course. You could add cheese to the white sauce if you fancy','["50g butter","2 tbsp olive oil","250g chestnut or button mushrooms, sliced","500g green beans, trimmed","50g flour","500ml milk","100g crispy onions"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the butter and the oil in a largepanand fry the mushrooms for 10-15 mins until golden. Stir in the green beans and cook for another 3-4 mins until the beans turn bright green. Scoop out the veg onto a plate.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Melt the remaining butter in the pan until foaming. Remove from the heat briefly and sprinkle over the flour, stirring into the butter to make a golden brown paste. Return to the heat and add the milk, a splash at a time, continually stirring until all the milk has been added and you get a smooth, thick white sauce. Season well. Stir the beans and mushrooms into the white sauce, and spoon into a medium ovenproof dish.","Scatter over the crispy onions, then bake for 20-30 mins until bubbling and golden, covering if the onions brown too quickly."]','2026-01-10 12:12:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4012,4012,'en','Mac ‘n’ cheese bites','Catering for guests with different diets or tastes? These mac ‘n’ cheese bites are ideal party food. From mushrooms to olives, top with whatever you like','["25g butter, plus extra for the tin","25g plain flour","400ml milk","200g macaroni or other short pasta","200g mature cheddar, grated","1 tbsp olive oil","100g baby button mushrooms, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp finely chopped parsley","20g dried breadcrumbs","8 black olives pitted and sliced","4 sundried tomatoes, sliced","100g grated mozzarella or cheddar"]','["To make the toppings, heat half the oil in afrying panover a high heat, and cook the mushrooms for 10 mins until golden. Stir in half the garlic and the parsley, and fry for 1 min more. Season and scrape into a bowl. Heat the rest of the oil in the pan and fry the remaining garlic and the breadcrumbs for 3-5 mins, stirring until crisp. Scrape into a second bowl.","Melt the butter in a saucepan over a medium heat, then stir in the flour to make a thick paste. Gradually add the milk, a splash at a time,whiskinguntil it’s all incorporated. Cook for 2-3 mins more until thickened. Meanwhile, cook the macaroni in a pan of boiling salted water for 5-6 mins. Stir the cheddar into the white sauce until all the cheese has melted, then fold in the macaroni.","Butter a 12-hole muffin tin and divide the mac ‘n’ cheese between the holes, packing it in with the back of a spoon. Top with the mushroom mixture, olives or sundried tomato slices, then scatter over the grated cheese and garlic breadcrumbs.Will keep, covered in the fridge, for up to 24 hrs.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Bake for 15 mins until golden and piping hot. Leave to cool for 10-15 mins in the tin, then loosen by running a spoon around the edges. Transfer to a plate."]','2026-01-10 12:12:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4014,4014,'en','Mozzarella sticks with chilli tomato sauce','Make these moreish mozzarella sticks in advance for fuss-free party food. Just pop them in the oven as guests arrive and serve with our chilli tomato sauce','["30g plain flour","1 egg, beaten","100g dried breadcrumbs","pinch of dried oregano","pinch of garlic granules","250g block firm mozzarella (not in water), cut into 1cm-thick finger-length strips","about 500ml vegetable oil, for frying","1 tbsp olive oil","1-2 red chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, sliced","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp red wine vinegar","1 tsp sugar"]','["Put the flour, egg and breadcrumbs into three separate bowls, seasoning each. Stir the dried oregano and garlic granules into the breadcrumbs.","Coat the mozzarella sticks in the flour, dust off any excess, then dip into the beaten egg. Gently shake to remove the excess egg, then turn in the breadcrumbs until well-coated. Transfer to a baking sheet lined with baking parchment and arrange in a single layer, then freeze for 1 hr until completely solid.","To make the dipping sauce, heat the oil in asaucepan, and fry the chillies and garlic for 2-3 mins until fragrant. Tip in the tomatoes, vinegar, sugar and some seasoning. Reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 12-15 mins until thick and saucy. If you prefer a smooth sauce, blitz with astick blender. Season to taste – you may need to add a little more sugar, vinegar or salt. Leave to cool.Will keep, covered in the fridge, for up to three days, or the freezer for up to three months.","Fill a heavy-based saucepan no more than a third full of oil and heat to 180C, or until a cube of bread sizzles when dropped into the oil, and browns in about 30 seconds. Gently lower in the frozen mozzarella sticks – you’ll need to do this in two batches to ensure the temperature remains high – and fry for 2-3 mins until the cheesy middle is melted and the outside is crisp and golden. Drain on kitchen paper. Serve straightaway, or leave to cool.Will keep, covered in the fridge, for up to three days, or the freezer for up to three months.","To reheat, heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and bake on a tray for 8-10 mins until heated through. Season and serve with warm dipping sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:12:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4016,4016,'en','Pain au chocolat tear-and-share loaf','Kick-start your weekend with this pain au chocolat tear-and-share loaf for brunch. Serve with raspberries or simply on its own with a mug of hot chocolate','["275g pack Jus-Rol™ Pains Au Chocolat Dough","6 tsp raspberry jam, marmalade or raisins","25g dark chocolate, chopped","icing sugar and raspberries to serve"]','["Line a loaf tin (approx 900g volume) with a strip of baking parchment overhanging the sides. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Open the Jus-Rol™ Pains Au Chocolat Dough pack, twisting the can to remove the dough. Unravel on a work surface and separate each perforated piece, then cut each piece in half down the middle to get 12 squares. Add a chocolate strip to each of the squares, and add ½ tsp of jam, marmalade or a few raisins to each (or leave plain if you prefer) and wrap them up in the dough, like a sausage roll.","Place the chocolate rolls into the tin on their ends so the chocolate is exposed at the top, and put the rolls evenly spaced apart so there’s lots of room to expand. Bake for 25-30 mins until golden brown and well risen.","Melt the chocolate in a bowl over a pan of simmering water until melted, or melt in short blasts in themicrowave. Leave the pastries for 10 mins in the tin, then use the parchment to remove from the tin. Transfer to a serving plate. Drizzle over the melted chocolate and sprinkle with a little icing sugar, if you like. Serve warm or at room temperature with raspberries, or simply on its own with a mug of hot chocolate. Best eaten the same day."]','2026-01-10 12:13:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4018,4018,'en','Rocky road clusters','Treat family and friends to these moreish rocky road clusters. They make a great gift at Christmas, or a sweet treat to serve with a cuppa','["100g salted butter, chopped","200g dark chocolate, chopped","2 tbsp golden syrup","150g digestive biscuits","100g mini marshmallows","50g pecans, roughly chopped","50g sultanas","edible gold lustre, for dusting (optional)"]','["Melt the butter, chocolate and golden syrup in a heatproof bowl over a pan of just simmering water, stirring occasionally.","Break the biscuits into pieces into another bowl, then add the marshmallows, pecans and sultanas. Pour in the melted chocolate and gently stir everything together until well-coated. Drop spoonfuls of the mixture onto abaking traylined with baking parchment, then dust each with some edible gold lustre, if using. Chill for 1 hr before packaging.Will keep in the fridge for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4020,4020,'en','Sugar cookies','Decorate our buttery, melt-in-the-mouth sugar cookies with piped icing and sprinkles for extra special festive biscuits. They make lovely Christmas gifts','["100g unsalted butter, softened","100g caster sugar","2 large eggs","1tsp vanilla extract","25g cornflour","250g plain flour"]','["Beat the butter and sugar with an electricwhiskfor 4 mins until light and fluffy. Beat in the eggs, one at a time, then add the vanilla. Whisk in the cornflour and plain flour until the mixture comes together into a dough. Put the dough between two pieces of baking parchment, and roll out to a 6mm thickness using arolling pin. Chill for 30 mins.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Peel the top layer of parchment off the dough and stamp out circles using a 6cm round cutter (or the shape of your choice). Re-roll any offcuts and continue stamping out rounds until all the dough is used. Transfer the cookies to a second large baking sheet lined with baking parchment, spacing them 2cm apart (you may need two sheets). Bake for 7-10 mins. Leave to cool on the sheet for 15 mins, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.Will keep in an airtight container for one week."]','2026-01-10 12:13:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4022,4022,'en','Dried orange & lemon slices','Dry orange and lemon slices to use as decorations at Christmas time. They make lovely tree, table or wreath decorations, or pop in a jar as a gift','["1 orange and 1 lemon, both unpeeled and thinly sliced into 2mm-thick rounds","cinnamon sticks, bay leaves, rosemary sprigs or cardamom pods, to garnish (optional)"]','["Arrange the citrus slices over twobaking trayslined with baking parchment so they’re in a single layer. Heat the oven to 110C/90C fan/gas ¼. Bake for 2 hrs until firm and dry, turning the trays around halfway through. Check after 1 hr 15 mins, removing any orange slices that are drying out too quickly, then continue to cook the rest.","Leave to cool completely on the tray, then package with the garnishes of your choice."]','2026-01-10 12:13:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4024,4024,'en','Challah','Make challah bread, a sweet, enriched loaf traditionally eaten on Friday nights by Jewish families to celebrate the Sabbath. The leftovers make lovely French toast','["500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","70g caster sugar","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","2 eggs, beaten","70ml sunflower oil, plus extra for the bowl","1 tbsp poppy seeds or sesame seeds (optional)"]','["Combine the yeast, a pinch of the sugar and a couple tablespoons of lukewarm water in a small bowl. Stir to dissolve the yeast, then leave for 10 mins until foamy.","Meanwhile, combine the flour, the remaining sugar and 3 tsp fine salt in a large bowl. Make a well in the centre, then add half the beaten egg, the yeast mixture and the oil. Pour in 200ml lukewarm water (it should feel slightly warm to the touch) and stir with a spoon, then mix using one hand, keeping the other clean while you bring the dough together. If there are a lot of very dry bits, gradually add a little water to just bring it together – you don''t want it to get too wet and sticky. The dough should be moist, but not soggy.","Once the dough has come together, turn it out onto a lightly floured surface. Knead using both hands for 10 mins until smooth and a bit springy. If it gets very sticky, add a very small amount of flour – as little as possible. A dough scraper is useful if the dough is sticking to the work surface. Stretch the sides of the dough down and pull together to form a ball. Lightly oil a bowl, then lightly roll the dough ball around the bowl so it''s coated in the oil. Cover with a clean tea towel and leave in a warm place for 1 hr, or until dough has doubled in size.","Line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Turn the dough out onto a clean work surface and divide into three equal pieces, weighing for accuracy, if you like.Rolleach piece into a long sausage shape about 25cm long, tapering them slightly at both ends. Lay the pieces out in front of you, parallel to one another with a couple centimetres between each. Bring the sausages together at the top end, then plait them down the length, tucking in the ends when you reach the bottom. Carefully transfer the loaf to the prepared baking sheet and loosely cover with a clean tea towel. Leave to rise until puffy and billowy, about 40 mins.","Meanwhile, heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Gently brush the rest of the beaten egg all over the challah, getting it into all the crevices, and sprinkle with the poppy or sesame seeds, if using. Bake on a middle shelf of the oven for 25-30 mins, until the loaf is golden brown underneath and sounds hollow when tapped. Check after about 15 mins – if the top of the loaf has started to get too dark, cover it with foil. Leave to cool on awire rack, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4026,4026,'en','Goat water','Make our version of goat water, a stew made with goat meat that’s the national dish of Montserrat. It’s a direct reflection of the island’s African and Irish ancestries','["1 lemon, juiced","1kg goat meat, cut into 5cm chunks","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tbsp brown sugar or molasses","2 tsp cloves","2 tsp allspice","2 tsp ground mace","few thyme sprigs","½ garlic bulb, cloves peeled and crushed","1 Scotch bonnet chilli, chopped","1 celery stick, chopped","½ green pepper, chopped into 1½cm chunks","1 onion, chopped","1 tsp gravy browning","2-4 bay leaves","1 tsp cornflour","1 tbsp rum (optional)","bread, to serve"]','["Mix the lemon juice into a large bowl of water. Rinse the goat meat in the lemon water, then drain. Pat the goat meat dry with kitchen paper. Set aside.","Heat the oil in a largesaucepanorcasserole dishset over a medium-high heat, then stir in the sugar and cook for a few minutes until golden and caramelised. Add the goat meat and cook, turning, until browned all over. Add the spices, thyme, garlic, chilli, celery, pepper, onion, gravy browning, bay and 1 litre water. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat, cover and simmer for about 2-2½ hrs until the meat is very tender.","Combine the cornflour with 50ml water, then add to the pan. Simmer for another 10 mins, uncovered, until the sauce has thickened slightly – it will be the consistency of single cream. Stir in the rum, then serve with bread on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:13:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4028,4028,'en','Ultimate vegan gravy','Finish your Christmas morning efforts by reheating this make-ahead gravy. It’s the perfect partner to all your favourite trimmings at the festive table','["6 large portobello mushrooms","3 onions, unpeeled, quartered","4 carrots, unpeeled, roughly chopped","3 celery sticks, roughly chopped","1 garlic bulb, halved","2 tbsp sunflower oil","2 tbsp agave syrup","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp soy sauce","100g plain flour","25g dried mushrooms","150ml ruby port","2 litres vegetable stock","3 bay leaves","small bunch of thyme"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Tip the portobello mushrooms, onions, carrots, celery and garlic into aroasting tin, toss in the sunflower oil, then spread out into a single layer. Roast for 40 mins, undisturbed – the veg should be very slightly charred.","Drizzle over the agave, vinegar, tomato purée, soy and 2 tbsp water. Toss together until completely coated, then return to the oven for 5 mins until sticky and caramelised. Stir in the flour and dried mushrooms, and return to the oven for a final 10 mins.","If the tin is flameproof, put on the hob over a low heat, stir in the port and cook until you have a thick paste mixed in with all the ingredients. Pour over two-thirds of the stock, add the herbs, bring to a boil and cook for 10 mins. If the tin isn’t flameproof, drizzle over the port, stir to loosen all the burnt bits, then tip everything into a pan and continue with the stock and herbs.","Turn off the heat and mash everything with a potato masher to extract as much flavour as possible. Carefully pass the contents through a sieve set over anothersaucepan, pushing down to release all the liquid. Add the rest of the stock and simmer until the gravy is thickened and rich. Leave to cool. To serve, simply reheat.Will keep, chilled and covered for up to three days or frozen for up to two months."]','2026-01-10 12:13:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4030,4030,'en','Vegan custard','Make our vegan coconut custard to pour over your favourite desserts. Made with coconut milk, it pairs beautifully with our carrot, coconut & date pudding','["4 tbsp custard powder","4 tbsp golden caster sugar","2 x 400ml cans low-fat coconut milk","200ml water"]','["Combine the custard powder with the sugar. Add 2-4 tbsp coconut milk from a 400ml can and mix to a smooth paste. Heat the rest of the coconut milk from the can in apanwith another 400ml can coconut milk and the water until almost boiling.Whisksome of the coconut milk mixture into the custard powder mixture until it looks like a smooth custard sauce, then tip this into the pan with the rest of the hot coconut milk. Return to the boil over a low heat, stirring continuously, until you have a thick, smooth custard."]','2026-01-10 12:13:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4032,4032,'en','Toasted bread sauce','Make a vegan version of bread sauce for the Christmas dinner table. Make it ahead, if you like, to save on time – store in the fridge for up to two days','["6 slices white bread (ensure it’s vegan)","2 tbsp butter-flavoured rapeseed oil, plus extra to serve","1 onion, finely chopped","1 bay leaf","1 thyme sprig","600ml almond milk","pinch of ground cloves","pinch of ground nutmeg","100ml soya cream"]','["Toast the bread until dark brown, then leave to cool. Blitz in afood processorto rough crumbs.","Heat half the oil in asaucepanand cook the onion for 10 mins until just brown and sticky. Add the bay, thyme and milk, then season with the spices and salt and pepper. Bring to the boil and simmer for 5 mins.","Remove the herbs, then stir in all but a handful of the breadcrumbs. Cook over a low heat until thick. If you like, blitz until smooth. Will keep, chilled, for two days.","Meanwhile, fry the rest of the crumbs in the remaining oil until golden.","Add the cream to the sauce and heat through, then tip into a dish and spoon over the fried crumbs and a drizzle more oil.Will keep, covered, in the fridge for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4034,4034,'en','Buffalo cauliflower','Make ‘buffalo cauliflower’ for a veggie take on the spicy American classic. Served with a ranch dip, it makes an excellent Friday night sharing treat','["1 tbsp sweet smoked paprika","1⁄2 tbsp ground cumin","1 tsp garlic powder","100g plain flour","200ml buttermilk or kefir","1 head of cauliflower (500g), broken into florets","80g hot sauce","1½ tbsp maple syrup","1 tbsp butter","celery sticks, to serve","100g Greek yogurt","3 tbsp mayonnaise","2 tbsp chopped chives","1-2 tbsp milk"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and line abaking traywith baking parchment. Mix together the paprika, cumin, garlic powder, flour and ½ tsp salt in a large bowl. Make a well in the centre and whisk in the buttermilk. Tip in the cauliflower and toss to coat. Spread out the cauliflower on the baking tray and cook for 20-25 mins, turning halfway through, until crisp at the edges.","Warm the hot sauce, maple syrup and butter in a small pan set over low heat, for 2-3 mins. Liberally brush over the cauliflower and put back in the oven for 8-10 mins.","For the ranch dip,whisktogether the yogurt, mayo, chives, milk and a pinch of salt in a bowl. Serve the with the cauliflower alongside some celery sticks for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:13:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4036,4036,'en','Jalebi','Make these sweet Indian treats by frying batter into crispy swirls, then dipping them in a sugary syrup made with cardamom and saffron','["1 litre vegetable oil, for deep-frying","flaked almonds or finely chopped pistachios, to serve","200g caster sugar","small pinch of saffron","1⁄4 tsp green cardamom powder, or use regular ground cardamom","1 tsp lemon juice","125g plain flour","2 tbsp cornflour","1⁄2 tsp lemon juice","2 tsp natural yogurt","1⁄2 tsp turmeric, or a few drops of natural yellow food colouring","1 tbsp ghee","1⁄4 tsp baking powder","1⁄4 tsp bicarbonate of soda"]','["First, make the syrup. Put the sugar and 100ml water in apanset over a medium heat. When the sugar has dissolved, add the saffron and bring to the boil. Continue to boil for 5-6 mins until thickened and syrupy – the consistency should be like honey. Remove from the heat and add the cardamom and lemon juice – the lemon juice prevents the sugar crystallising. Set aside.","For the batter, put all the ingredients except the baking powder and bicarb, in a large bowl. Slowly add 150ml water andwhiskfor a few minutes until smooth, then add the baking powder and bicarb and stir well – it should be as thick as pancake batter. Pour into a squeeze bottle with a narrow tip, or spoon into apiping bagand snip off the tip so you have a small opening. Pour the oil into a large heavy-bottomed saucepan until it’s no more than two-thirds full and heat to 170-180C, or until a drop of the batter sizzles when added.","Carefully squeeze or pipe swirls of the batter directly into the hot oil – do this in batches (you should be able to fry four or five at once). Fry for 1-2 mins on each side until golden. Remove the jalebi with a slotted spoon to a plate lined with kitchen paper to drain, then, while still warm, dip in the syrup using tongs or a fork, turning to coat. Sprinkle over the flaked almonds or chopped pistachios. Serve straightaway or leave to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:13:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4038,4038,'en','Cumin-roasted carrot & cauliflower with green tahini dressing','Ideal for a picnic or barbecue, this hearty salad works as a vegetarian main or side dish. You could use tender whole new season carrots – just take the first 15 mins off the cooking time and roast with the cauliflower','["1kg carrots, scrubbed, trimmed and chopped into 3cm chunks","3 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp honey (or use light brown sugar to make it vegan)","1 tbsp cumin seeds","2 tsp fennel seeds","tsp chilli flakes (optional)","1 cauliflower, chopped into florets (approx. 500g), leaves kept and chopped into bite-size pieces","60g rocket leaves","100g tahini","3 tbsp olive oil","1 lemon , juiced","1 garlic clove","2 handfuls of coriander leaves"]','["First make the dressing. Tip the ingredients into a blender or mini chopper with a large pinch of salt and 6 tbsp cold water. Blitz to make a smooth (or as smooth as possible) dressing, taste for seasoning and set aside.Will keep chilled for up to two days.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Tip the carrots into a bowl with 2 tbsp of the olive oil, the honey, cumin and fennel seeds, some seasoning and chilli, if using. Line 2 shallow roasting trays with baking parchment and divide the carrots between both. Roast for 15 mins until starting to caramelise. Remove from the oven and add the cauliflower florets and leaves in amongst the carrots making sure all the veg is coated in the glaze, then drizzling over the remaining olive oil. Roast for 30 mins, tossing once, until the everything is tender and sticky. Leave to cool to room temperature.Will keep covered for a day.","If you’re taking this outdoors, scrape the veg into a container and take the rocket leaves and dressing in separate containers. Just before you''re ready to eat, toss the rocket through the root veg, then drizzle over the dressing, leaving some to serve on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:13:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4040,4040,'en','Pressure cooker pulled pork','Did you know you can cook pulled pork in a pressure cooker in just a quarter of the time? It’s one clever solution for cutting back on your winter fuel costs!','["3 tbsp cider vinegar","2 tbsp light brown soft sugar","1 tbsp smoked paprika","½ tsp ground cumin","2 tsp garlic granules","2 tsp onion granules","100g tomato ketchup","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","1kg pork shoulder, skinless and boneless","300ml apple juice","fluffy white baps, or jacket potatoes and coleslaw, to serve"]','["Combine the vinegar, sugar, spices, garlic and onion granules, ketchup and mustard with a pinch of salt in a bowl and submerge the pork in it. Cover and chill for at least 1 hr – overnight is better, if you have time.","Tip the pork and marinade into thepressure cooker, then pour in the apple juice. Give everything a good stir. Close the lid and bring the pressure up to high pressure over a medium-high heat and cook for 50 mins. Leave the pressure to drop naturally. The meat should be pull-apart tender. If it’s still a bit tough, put the lid back on, return to high pressure and cook for a further 10-20 mins.","When the meat is ready, remove to a board and leave it covered, to rest. Meanwhile, reduce the sauce in the pressure cooker. Adjust the seasoning, then simmer and stir with the lid off for around 20 mins until thickened and a little gloopy.","Just before the sauce is ready, shred the meat, pulling it apart between two forks. Put the meat back in the pan and toss to coat in the sauce.The pulled pork can be kept chilled for up to three days or frozen for up to one month. Defrost and reheat thoroughly before serving.","Serve the pulled pork stuffed into fluffy baps with coleslaw on the side, if you like, or as a filling for jacket potatoes, tacos or tortillas."]','2026-01-10 12:13:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4042,4042,'en','Tofu omelettes with soy dressing','Enjoy a tofu omelette for a balanced and low-calorie dinner. Serve with rice, broccoli and a drizzle of chilli dressing for an easy, flavourful midweek meal','["100ml low-salt soy sauce","1 lime, juiced","4 garlic cloves","280g extra-firm tofu, drained","300g frozen broccoli","5g piece of ginger, peeled","½ red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 tbsp honey","3 eggs","2 tsp vegetable oil","2 x 250g pouches brown basmati rice"]','["Put 50ml of the soy sauce and half the lime juice in a shallow dish. Crush in 2 garlic cloves. Slice the tofu into four equal squares and add to the marinade. Cover and leave to marinate in the fridge for at least 20 mins, turning halfway through.","Meanwhile, fill a mediumsaucepana quarter full with water, then put on a medium heat until it starts to simmer. Sit a colander over the pan, add the broccoli, cover and steam for 10 mins, or until tender. Meanwhile, grate the remaining garlic and the ginger into a small bowl. Stir in the remaining soy sauce and lime juice, the red chilli and honey. Set aside.","Drain the tofu and thoroughly pat dry.Whiskthe eggs in a bowl with a pinch of salt.","Heat ½ tsp oil in a frying pan over a medium-high heat. Once hot, add a piece of the tofu to the pan and pour a quarter of the egg over it. Use a fish slice to push the egg towards the tofu – you should end up with a little eggy tofu square. Cook for 2-3 mins on each side until golden, carefully turning. Set aside, cover to keep warm and repeat with the remaining oil, tofu and egg.","Cook the rice following pack instructions. Serve the tofu omelettes with the rice, broccoli and a drizzle of thechilli dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:13:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4044,4044,'en','Polish doughnuts','Make a batch of fluffy glazed doughnuts, topped with crunchy chopped almonds for a special occasion. The dough includes jam for a subtle sweetness','["7g yeast","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tbsp flour","125ml milk, warmed","7 egg yolks","15g sugar","5g vanilla sugar (or 5g caster sugar plus 1 tsp vanilla extract)","500g flour","200ml double cream, warmed","15g butter, very soft","125ml rosehip jam (or other jam)","5g ground almonds","lard or oil, for frying","75g icing sugar","½ lemon, juiced","a few drops almond essence","50g chopped almonds"]','["To make the leaven, mix the yeast with the sugar and flour, and stir in the warm milk. Set aside in a warm place for 30 minutes.","For the dough, put egg yolks into a heatproof bowl and add the sugar and vanilla sugar. Set the bowl over a pan of simmering water and whisk until smooth and thick.","Sift the flour into the bowl of a stand mixer, add the beaten yolks and the warm cream, mix thoroughly, then add a pinch of salt and the leaven. Bring together to make a dough and knead for 10 minutes (or 15-20 if doing this by hand).","When the dough stops sticking to your hands, pour in the cooled melted butter and knead for a few more minutes. Cover with a cloth and leave in a warm place to rise for at least 1 hr-1 hr 30 mins.","Mix the jam with the ground almonds and spoon into a piping bag or jam syringe. Divide the dough into 16 pieces and shape them into doughnuts. Cover and leave to rise for 30 mins.","Fill a deep pan or a deep fat fryer one third full of oil or melted lard and heat it until it is 180C – if you don’t have a thermometer, drop in a small chunk of bread. The oil is ready when it browns in about 30 secs. Add the doughnuts and fry, turning them once for about 1-2 mins on each side (a thin lighter ring should form in the middle). After removing, drain the doughnuts of excess fat on some kitchen paper.","Mix the icing sugar, lemon juice and almond essence, adding some water if you need to thin the icing. When the doughnuts have cooled a little, pipe in the jam mixture and glaze them in the icing and sprinkle with the chopped almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:13:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4046,4046,'en','Spring onion, pea & pancetta tart','Try our savoury take on a puff pastry tart, made with peas, eggs, herbs and pancetta. Quick and easy, it’s sure to become a favourite with the whole family','["320g sheet all-butter ready-rolled puff pastry","8 spring onions","1 tsp olive oil","100g smoked pancetta, cut into cubes","200g soft cheese","handful of mint, basil, parsley or chives (or use a mixture), chopped, plus extra whole leaves to serve","1 egg yolk","25g parmesan, finely grated","1 heaped tsp Dijon mustard","100g frozen peas, defrosted"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Unravel the sheet of puff pastry on its baking parchment and slide onto a largebaking tray. Score a border about 1cm from the edge all the way around the pastry, being careful not to cut all the way through. Prick the middle all over with a fork, then bake for 15 mins until puffed up and golden. Tip the spring onions onto a small baking tray, drizzle with the oil and season. Roast these alongside the pastry for the final 5 mins of cooking time.","Meanwhile, cook the pancetta in a small frying pan set over a medium heat until golden. Remove from the heat and set aside to cool.","Mix the soft cheese, chopped herbs, egg yolk, half the parmesan and the mustard together and season well. Gently squash the middle of the tart base down using the back of a spoon, then spread over the soft cheese mixture. Scatter the defrosted peas and pancetta over the soft cheese mixture, then arrange the roasted spring onions on top. Sprinkle over the remaining parmesan and return to the oven for 10 mins. Scatter with the remaining whole-leaf herbs, then slice and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4048,4048,'en','Chilli-butter smashed radishes','Combine the mellowed flavour of cooked radishes with chilli butter for a sumptuous side dish. Not a radish fan? You’ll change your mind after trying this recipe','["100g unsalted butter","1 tbsp chilli flakes","500g radishes, leaves removed, smashed with the flat edge of a knife (or halved/quartered if you find this hard to do)","1⁄2 lemon, juiced"]','["Heat the butter in a smallfrying panwith the chilli flakes until it begins to foam and turn golden brown. Add the radishes and coat well in the butter, turning often until softened, about 10-15 mins.","Turn up the heat, add the lemon juice, let it sizzle, then season to taste and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4050,4050,'en','Spicy nduja arancini','Make these moreish rice balls with spicy nduja sausage, gooey mozzarella filling and crunchy breadcrumb coating for a Valentine’s Day nibble','["2 tbsp olive oil","1⁄2 onion, finely chopped","1 large garlic clove, crushed","1⁄2 tsp fennel seeds, crushed","300g risotto rice","400g can chopped tomatoes","800ml hot chicken stock","80g parmesan, finely grated","50g nduja sausage, finely chopped","150g mozzarella, cut into cubes","100g plain flour","3 medium eggs, beaten","200g panko breadcrumbs","vegetable oil, for deep- frying"]','["Heat the olive oil in acasseroledish over a low heat, and fry the onion with a pinch of salt for 10-12 mins, or until softened. Add the garlic and fennel seeds, and cook for 1 min more. Stir in the rice and cook for a further minute.","Pour in the tomatoes and half the stock, and turn the heat to medium-high. Cook, stirring continuously, until the stock is almost completely evaporated. Add the remaining stock, a ladle at a time, adding more when the previous addition is absorbed by the rice. Cook until the rice is al dente, about 15-20 mins.","Stir in the parmesan and nduja, then spread the risotto out over abaking trayand leave to cool to room temperature.","Scoop the cooled risotto into 20 even portions, slightly larger than a golf ball. Flatten one of the balls into a disc in your hand, put a piece of mozzarella in the centre, then enclose with the rice. Roll into a ball. Repeat with the remaining risotto and mozzarella.","Tip the flour, eggs and panko breadcrumbs into three separate shallow bowls. Roll each risotto ball in the flour, then the egg, and finally the breadcrumbs. Transfer the balls to a baking tray. Half-fill a large, heavy-based saucepan with vegetable oil and heat over a medium-low heat to 170C, or until a piece of bread turns golden in the oil within 45 seconds. Carefully lower the risotto balls into the oil in batches, and fry each batch for 8-10 mins, or until golden brown and gooey in the centre. Drain on a plate lined with kitchen paper."]','2026-01-10 12:13:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4052,4052,'en','Sweet potato balls','Make a Taiwanese snack favourite, sweet potato balls. They’re made with sweet potato and tapioca starch, rolled into balls and deep-fried until golden brown','["175g sweet potato peeled and roughly chopped (prepared weight)","35g caster sugar","125g tapioca starch","vegetable oil, for deep-frying"]','["Steam the sweet potato in asteamerover a medium heat for 15-20 mins until soft enough to insert a cutlery knife into. Mash the sweet potato using a potato masher or a fork until smooth. Add the sugar, tapioca starch and a good pinch of seasoning, then mix well with your hands. Gradually pour in 1-2 tbsp water, then mix well until a pliable dough forms.","Divide the dough into four and roll each piece into a long sausage shape around 2cm in diameter.Cuteach length of dough into 2cm pieces and roll them into balls in the palm of your hand. Don’t worry if they crumble, just keep squishing them until they form a ball.","Half-fill a large, heavy-based saucepan with the oil. Heat over a medium temperature until a cooking thermometer reads 120C. Lower batches of the balls into the oil (you may need to cook them in two or three batches) and fry for 2 mins until they begin to float. When they are floating, turn down the heat slightly. Turn the balls in the oil using a slotted spoon until they expand in size, doing so every minute, for around 3-4 mins. Turn the heat back up and continue to deep-fry until golden brown.","Transfer the balls onto kitchen paper using a slotted spoon. Leave to drain and cool a little, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4054,4054,'en','Beef & Boston baked beans','Enjoy these Boston baked beans with a jacket potato or crusty bread. Time works its magic on this dish, but there’s very little hands-on work to do','["300g dried cannellini beans","1 fresh bay leaf","1 tbsp vegetable oil","500g beef shin, cut into 4cm chunks","120g smoked lardons","1 large onion, cut into wedges","2 large garlic cloves, thinly sliced","100g treacle","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp mustard powder","pinch of ground cloves","jacket potatoes or bread and coleslaw, to serve"]','["Tip the beans into a large pan, then pour in enough water to cover the beans by 5cm. Add the bay and leave to soak overnight. The next day, drain the beans, return to the pan and pour in enough fresh water to cover the beans by 3cm. Bring to the boil, reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 20 mins until the beans are tender (you may need to top up the water slightly as they cook).","Heat the oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 2. Heat the oil in a largecasseroleor ovenproof saucepan, and fry the beef for 5 mins over a high heat until evenly browned (you’ll need to do this in batches). Transfer to a plate using a slotted spoon. Add the lardons and onion to the pan, and cook over a medium- high heat for 5-7 mins until the onions are turning golden and the lardons are starting to crisp.","Stir the beef back into the pan. Add the beans along with the cooking liquid, and stir in the garlic, treacle, tomato purée, mustard powder and cloves. Season, then top up with some water so the beans are covered by 2-3cm. Cover and bring to a simmer, then transfer to the oven for 2 hrs 30 mins. Remove the lid, stir and return to the oven for 1 hr 30 mins until the meat is tender and the sauce rich.Once cooled, the beans can be frozen for up to three months (see below).Serve with jacket potatoes or bread and coleslaw."]','2026-01-10 12:13:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4056,4056,'en','Vegan Welsh cakes','Make a vegan version of Welsh cakes, with all the flavour of the traditional recipe but free from dairy. Sprinkle with sugar to finish and serve warm or cold','["225g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","¼ tsp fine sea salt","½ tsp nutmeg, grated","100g dairy-free butter","50g caster sugar, plus extra to sprinkle","50g currants","3-4 tbsp dairy-free milk"]','["Tip the flour into a largebowland stir through the salt and nutmeg. Add the butter and rub it in with your fingertips to make a fine, breadcrumb consistency. Add the sugar and currants and stir in 3 tbsp milk until it just comes together, add a further 1 tbsp if the dough is a little dry. Bring together into a ball, try not to overwork the dough as this will make it tough.","Roll outthe dough on a lightly floured surface to a 5mm thickness and cut out rounds using a 6 or 7cm cutter. Re-roll any scraps and cut out more until you have used up all the dough.","Place a cast iron pan or heavy based frying pan over a medium heat to get really hot. Cook for 3-4 mins on each side or until lightly golden, you will need to turn the heat down slightly if they begin to catch. Immediately toss in the sugar and set aside on awire rackto cool down for 15 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:13:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4058,4058,'en','Soda farls','Celebrate St Patrick’s Day with soda farls – an Irish soda bread flattened into a circle and divided into four ‘farls’. Eat warm with butter','["250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","½ tsp salt","1 tsp sugar","1 heaped tsp bicarbonate of soda","225ml buttermilk"]','["Tip the flour into a largebowland stir through the salt, sugar and bicarb. Make a well in the centre and pour in the buttermilk, then swiftly stir to combine. Tip onto a lightly floured surface and knead briefly.Rollinto a roughly 20cm circle and cut into quarters.","Heat a skillet or heavy-based frying pan over a low-medium heat. Add the farls and cook for 8-10 mins on each side, or until golden brown and cooked through. Remove from the heat and leave the farls to cool in the pan for 10 mins. Split open and eat warm with butter."]','2026-01-10 12:13:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4060,4060,'en','Coconut pastries (gujiya)','Make this version of a popular Indian sweet filled with gently spiced coconut, almonds and raisins. They’re usually made to celebrate the festival of Holi','["275g flour","35g ghee, melted and cooled","sunflower oil, for kneading and deep-frying","1 litre whole milk (we used Jersey milk)","125g caster sugar","200g frozen grated coconut, defrosted","50g blanched almonds, finely chopped","50g raisins","½ tsp ground cardamom","¼ tsp grated nutmeg"]','["First, make the filling. Pour the milk into a pan set over a medium heat and boil for about 25-30 mins until reduced to a thick cream. (It’s best to use awok, karahi or sturdy casserole for this, because you want the milk to reduce quickly without burning and browning.) Stir continuously, scraping down the sides of the pan as it cooks. When it is the consistency of softly set scrambled eggs and coming away from the side of the pan, turn off the heat.","Transfer the reduced milk to a clean pan, add the sugar and cook over a low heat for 3-4 mins, stirring all the time, until the sugar has dissolved. Add the coconut, almonds, raisins, cardamom and nutmeg, and turn the heat to medium. Continue cooking for 3-4 mins until the mixture thickens. Turn off the heat and set aside to cool.","Meanwhile, make the pastry. Sieve the flour and ¼ tsp fine salt into a mixing bowl, then add the cooled melted ghee. Using your fingertips, rub the ghee into the flour until the mixture resembles coarse breadcrumbs. Add just enough cold water to bind the mixture into a very firm dough and knead well until smooth. Cover and leave at room temperature for at least 30 mins.","Divide and shape the dough into 17-18 balls about 20g each and roughly 3cm in diameter. Keep the dough covered to stop it drying out.","Roll outeach ball on a lightly oiled surface to a circle about 10cm in diameter (the pastry will be thinner if the balls are rolled out individually). Don’t worry if you don''t have perfect circles.","Heat the oil in a wok or karahi over a medium heat to 130°C or until a cube of bread dropped in browns in 1 min. Fry the gujiyas in batches for 6-8 mins until the pastry is golden on both sides. Drain on kitchen paper and leave to cool before serving at room temperature.Will keep in an airtight tin for 3-4 days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4062,4062,'en','Air-fried chicken','Use an air fryer to make these easy chicken thighs, and add the seasoning or sauce of your choice. It’s an easy way to cook chicken when you’re busy','["4 large or 8 small chicken thighs, skin on","1 tbsp sunflower or olive oil","1 tbsp plain flour","seasoning of choice (use salt and pepper, or ½-1 tsp of either smoky BBQ, ras-el-hanout, garlic granules, celery salt or garam masala)"]','["Toss the chicken thighs in the oil, making sure they are all well-coated.","Mix the flour with the seasoning, then toss with the chicken thighs – it will be a very light coating, but you can double the flour and seasoning if you prefer a thicker coating.","Arrange the chicken in one layer on the tray of anair fryerwithout a paddle, and program to cook for 35 mins. Check the thighs are cooked by pulling the flesh on the underside of one away from the bone – it should come away easily and there should be no pink remaining. Cook for another 5-10 mins if needed. The skin should have bubbled and crisped up, and any excess fat from the chicken will have dripped into the base of the fryer (you can discard this). Don’t leave the chicken in the fryer, or the steam will make the skin soft again."]','2026-01-10 12:13:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4064,4064,'en','Jumbo pigs in blankets','Make super-sized pigs in blankets for an extra-special Christmas side dish. Brush with maple syrup at the end of cooking for even more indulgence','["6 pork sausages","6 small rosemary sprigs","6 smoked streaky bacon rashers","1 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Working with one sausage at a time, lay a rosemary sprig on top and wrap a bacon rasher around it.","Put the wrapped sausages on a baking sheet and drizzle with the oil. Roast for 25-30 mins, until golden brown and cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:13:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4066,4066,'en','Chocolate crunch','Indulge in these chocolate crunch squares whenever you need a sweet treat. They’re lovely with a cup of tea or coffee','["170g unsalted butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","1 tsp vanilla extract","170g caster sugar","225g self-raising flour","25g cocoa powder","1 large egg, beaten","2 tbsp granulated sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 20cm square tin and line with baking parchment. Stir the melted butter and vanilla together in a bowl. Mix the caster sugar, flour and cocoa together in another bowl.","Pour the bowl of wet ingredients into the dry and beat together, then add the egg and beat again until combined. Press into the prepared tin. Brush the top with water and sprinkle over the granulated sugar.","Bake for 30-35 mins. Leave to cool slightly in the tin for 5 mins before slicing into squares and transferring to awire rackto cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:13:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4068,4068,'en','Ghee','Make some homemade ghee to use in your favourite dishes. Ghee lends a richness and buttery flavour, and can be heated to a high temperature without burning','["250g unsalted butter"]','["Heat the butter in a small, sturdypanand cook over a low heat without stirring for 15-20 mins, or until the milk solids start to brown and the butter is golden. Turn the heat off and leave the pan undisturbed for a few minutes.","Line a metal sieve with muslin or strong kitchen paper, and place over a heatproof bowl. Pour in the melted butter, taking care to leave the browned milk solids in the pan. Leave for a few minutes to drip into the bowl, then transfer to a jar.Because ghee has no moisture or milk solids, it will keep for up to three months at room temperature, but can also be stored in the fridge for extra longevity."]','2026-01-10 12:13:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4070,4070,'en','Devilled eggs','Make devilled eggs to serve at a Boxing Day buffet. They’re filled with mustard, spring onions, mayo, yogurt and a pinch of cayenne. Top with chives, if you like','["6 large eggs","2 tbsp mayonnaise","2 tbsp full-fat Greek yogurt","1 tsp Dijon mustard","2 spring onions, finely chopped","¼ tsp celery salt","pinch of cayenne pepper","chopped chives"]','["Put the eggs in a pan of just simmering water and cook for 10 mins. Turn off the heat, and leave the eggs to rest in the hot water for 2 mins. Drain, then transfer the eggs to a bowl of ice-cold water and leave to cool. Peel the eggs and slice in half, then scoop the yolks out into a bowl with the mayonnaise, yogurt, mustard, spring onions, celery salt and cayenne pepper. Mash everything together until smooth, then spoon into a piping bag fitted with a plain round nozzle.","Pipethe mixture into the hollowed-out eggs, or carefully spoon into the middles using a small spoon. Sprinkle over some chives, if using, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4072,4072,'en','Date & tamarind sauce (sonth)','Serve this tangy date and tamarind sauce with everything from samosas and pakoras to crunchy street snacks and salads','["150g wet tamarind, preferably seedless","125g pitted dates","175g jaggery, date palm sugar or light muscovado sugar","1 tsp ginger powder","½ tsp garam masala","1 tsp ground cumin"]','["Break up the tamarind and dates and put them in a pan with the jaggery and enough water to cover them, about 500ml. Bring to a simmer and cook for 20 mins or until the tamarind is really soft.","Remove thepanfrom the heat and push the pulp through a sieve to remove any fibres. The sauce should be a coating consistency – add a little water if it is too thick.","Stir in the ginger powder, garam masala and ground cumin. The sauce should taste sweet and tart – stir in a little more jaggery if it doesn’t taste sweet enough. Chill before serving.Will keep in the fridge for three to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4074,4074,'en','Mini hasselbacks with soured cream, dill & pink pickled onions','Top these mini hasselbacks with soured cream, pink pickled onions and dill for easy finger food. They’re ideal for parties and buffets','["1.5kg new potatoes","3 tbsp olive oil","4 large garlic cloves, bashed","8 tbsp soured cream","½ small bunch of dill, chopped","50g sugar","100ml cider or white wine vinegar","1 tsp sea salt flakes","1 medium red onion, finely sliced"]','["Make the pickled onions at least 4 hrs before serving. Combine the sugar and 100ml boiling water in a non-metallic heatproof bowl. Stir in the vinegar and salt. Add the onions and press down with a spoon to submerge. Cover and leave to pickle for at least 4 hours, or chill overnight.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Finely slice the potatoes at regular intervals along their length without cutting through. Transfer to abaking tray, drizzle with the oil, season, add the garlic and roast for 1 hr-1 hr 20 mins, tossing occasionally, until tender and golden.","Whiskthe soured cream with most of the dill, then season. Transfer the potatoes to a serving plate and dollop a teaspoon of the soured cream mixture over each. Drain the pickled onions (use the pickling liquid for salad dressings, if you like) and add a few pieces to each potato. Scatter with the remaining dill."]','2026-01-10 12:13:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4076,4076,'en','Parsnip, spinach, artichoke & wild rice salad','Enjoy this veggie wild rice salad with spinach, artichokes and parsnips as part of a Boxing Day buffet','["350g wild rice (use a mixture, or black rice works well)","200g parsnips (about 2 medium), peeled and cut into thin ribbons using a vegetable peeler","8 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp cumin seeds, crushed","2 lemons, juiced","2 tbsp Dijon mustard","1 tsp dried oregano","200g baby spinach, chopped","300g chargrilled artichokes in oil, drained and sliced","small bunch of mint, leaves picked and finely chopped"]','["Cook the rice following pack instructions, then drain. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the parsnips with 2 tbsp oil and arrange on a large baking sheet lined with baking parchment in a single layer. Sprinkle with some seasoning and half the cumin seeds. Roast for 25-30 mins, stirring halfway through, until golden and crisp.","Whiskthe lemon juice, mustard, remaining cumin seeds and the oregano together in a large bowl, then add the remaining oil, whisking continuously, until thick. Season well. Stir into the cooked rice.","Fold the spinach, artichokes and mint into the rice mixture, and season to taste. Scatter with the parsnip crisps to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4078,4078,'en','Mint chocolate chip cookies','Enjoy these cookies during the Christmas season, and share with loved ones. They’re made with little pieces of peppermint candy canes for an extra-festive flourish','["125g salted butter","125g light brown soft sugar","100g caster sugar","1 large egg","225g plain flour","½ tsp baking powder","2 drops peppermint extract","100g dark chocolate chips","100g dark chocolate, roughly chopped","3 peppermint candy canes, finely chopped or crushed"]','["Melt the butter in apan, leave to cool for a few minutes, then pour into a large bowl.Whiskin both sugars and the egg until combined.","Use a wooden spoon to mix in the flour and baking powder until the mixture comes together into a dough. Beat in the peppermint extract, then fold in the chocolate chips. Wrap well and chill for 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Divide the cookie dough into 16 pieces (about 45g each), and roll each piece into a ball using your hands. Arrange the dough balls on twobaking trayslined with baking parchment, well spaced apart, and press them down slightly. Bake for 10 mins, then remove the trays from the oven and tap sharply on a work surface to flatten the cookies. Return to the oven and repeat this after 2 mins, then again after another 2 mins (they should bake for 14 mins in total). Leave to cool completely on the trays.","Melt the chopped chocolate in a heatproof bowl over a pan of simmering water, or in 15-second bursts in the microwave, stirring between each burst. Line a baking tray with baking parchment. Dip one half of each cookie into the melted chocolate, place on the lined tray and sprinkle with candy cane pieces. Transfer the tray to the fridge and chill for 30 mins to set."]','2026-01-10 12:13:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4080,4080,'en','Siu mai (dim sum)','Make one of the most popular types of dim sum, siu mai. They’re traditionally topped with fish roe, but we’ve opted for goji berries for a pop of colour','["40g water chestnuts, drained and finely chopped","1 tbsp ginger, grated","1 spring onion, finely chopped","1½ tbsp Lee Kum Kee Premium Light Soy Sauce","¾ tbsp Shaoxing rice wine or dry sherry","1 tsp Lee Kum Kee Pure Sesame Oil","120g prawns, finely chopped","200g minced pork","1 egg white","1 tbsp potato flour or cornflour","20 wonton wrappers, about 8cm in diameter","20 goji berries, for the top (optional)","Lee Kum Kee Sweet Soy Sauce mixed with a little grated ginger and Lee Kum Kee Chiu Chow Chilli Oil (optional), for dipping"]','["Put the water chestnuts, ginger, spring onion, Premium Light Soy Sauce, rice wine, Pure Sesame Oil, prawns, pork, egg white and potato flour in a bowl and mix throughly with your hands to combine. Leave to marinate for 20-30 mins for the flavours to mingle.","Stack the wrappers on a work surface covered with a damp cloth and line a baking tray with non-stick baking parchment. Put a wrapper in the palm of your hand and add 1 tbsp of the filling into the centre. Bring up the sides of the wrapper around the filling to make a basket shape, but don’t squeeze the top together – you should still be able to see the filling.","Add more filling if needed until it’s reached the top of the gap, pressing down gently with a damp finger until flat. Tap the dumpling on the bench to flatten the base and put on the prepared tray. Add a goji berry, if you like. Repeat with the remaining wrappers and filling until you have about 20 dumplings.","Put a disc of non-stick parchment into a steamer and fill with some of the dumplings, leaving a little space between each. Cover and steam over awokof simmering water for 8-10 mins, or use an electric steamer. Repeat with the remaining dumplings. Serve with the dipping sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:13:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4082,4082,'en','Snow globe cookies','Make these edible snow globes as pretty decorations for your Christmas tree – your fairy lights will shine through the middles, making them look magical!','["175g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","100g cold butter, cubed","50g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","1tbsp milk","vegetable oil, for the parchment","30 (about 160g) glacier mints, or other clear mint-flavoured boiled sweets","200g royal icing sugar","6tbsp sprinkles"]','["Blitz the flour, butter and caster sugar together in afood processoruntil the mix looks like breadcrumbs. Add the vanilla and milk, and pulse to larger crumbs. Briefly knead on a lightly floured surface into a smooth ball, then wrap and chill for at least 30 mins. Line two large baking sheets with baking parchment, then lightly oil the parchment.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.Roll the chilled dough outon a floured work surface to the thickness of a £1 coin. Stamp out rounds using an 8cm cutter, then cut holes from the middles using a 5cm cutter. Cut small holes in the tops of the biscuits using the tip of a round piping nozzle or a straw – this is where you’ll thread the ribbon for hanging. Re-roll the offcuts and continue to stamp out biscuits until all the dough is used – you’ll need an even amount, as you’ll be sandwiching the biscuits together (you should get about 20). Carefully transfer to the prepared sheets.","Bake for 6 mins until just golden at the edges. Meanwhile, put the mints or sweets in a food processor or pestle and mortar, and blitz or crush until finely broken up. After 6 mins, remove the biscuits from the oven and spoon the crushed mints into the cut-out middles (use about 1 heaped tsp per biscuit). Bake for 5 mins more until the mints have just melted, but haven’t started to colour (they will turn golden if left too long). The middles will look bubbly, but will settle as they cool. If the melted mints haven’t reached the edges, use a metal skewer to carefully ease the molten middles to the sides. Leave on the sheets to harden, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","To make the icing, mix the icing sugar with 5-6 tsp water until you have a thick, pipeable icing. Spoon into a piping bag fitted with a small round nozzle. Decorate the bottoms of the biscuits (the melted mints will be flush with the bottoms, so this will leave more room for the sprinkles) by flooding them with icing, or piping on patterns or snowflakes. Leave to dry completely, setting aside the leftover icing in thepiping bag.","Once the biscuits are dry, carefully flip one over onto a clean tea towel so you won’t damage the icing. Pipe a little of the reserved icing around the biscuit, being careful not to get too close to the middle or edges – the icing will spread when you sandwich the biscuits together. Spoon a teaspoon of sprinkles into the clear middle, making sure not to touch the icing, then sandwich with another biscuit, matching up the ribbon holes. Leave to dry completely before shaking, as the sprinkles will stick to any wet icing. Repeat with the remaining biscuits, icing and sprinkles.Thread ribbons through the holes and hang for decorations, or store in an airtight container for up to one week."]','2026-01-10 12:13:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4084,4084,'en','Spiced cranberry sauce','Make this spiced cranberry sauce to serve at your festive dinner table. It’s thick and chunky like chutney – for a thinner consistency, just add 100ml water','["250g fresh or frozen cranberries","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses or balsamic vinegar","½ orange, finely zested and juiced","2 tbsp golden caster sugar, plus extra if needed","pinch of ground allspice"]','["Tip all the ingredients into asaucepanand bring to a gentle simmer over a low heat. Cook for 10 mins, or until the cranberries have burst and the sauce is thick, glossy and sticky.","If you prefer a sweeter sauce, add a bit more sugar. Leave to cool.Will keep, covered, in the fridge for up to one week or frozen for two months."]','2026-01-10 12:13:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4086,4086,'en','Smoky tomato, chipotle & charred corn soup','Dig out the chipotle paste and make this punchy smoky tomato, chipotle and charred sweetcorn soup. An easy midweek meal, you can freeze any leftovers','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","2 tsp ground coriander","small bunch of coriander, stalks chopped and leaves left whole","400g can chopped tomatoes","600ml vegetable stock","1-1½  tbsp chipotle chilli paste","2 corn on the cobs","50g feta, crumbled","4 tbsp fat-free Greek yogurt"]','["Heat the oil in a casserole dish and fry the onion for 10 mins until beginning to soften. Add the garlic, ground coriander and coriander stalks, and cook for 1 min. Stir though the tomatoes, stock and chipotle and bring to a simmer. Cook, covered, over a low heat for 20 mins, stirring occasionally.","Meanwhile, bring a pan of water to the boil and cook the corn for 4 mins. Drain and leave to cool a little. Cut the kernels off the cob with a sharp knife. Heat a non-stick frying pan over a high heat. Add the corn and fry for 5-7 mins or until charred, stirring now and again.","Ladle the soup into bowls. Top with the feta, yogurt, charred corn and coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4088,4088,'en','Roasted pumpkin seeds','Don’t throw away the seeds if you’re cooking a pumpkin – try roasting them with this easy recipe. They make a tasty snack with a little seasoning, or an eye-catching garnish','["fresh pumpkin seeds, scooped from the pumpkin","2 tsp olive oil"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Wash the seeds thoroughly and remove any stringy bits of pumpkin flesh. Dry well using kitchen paper.","Put the seeds on a baking tray and toss with the olive oil. Roast for 10 mins. Serve with a little seasoning for a snack, if you like, or use as a garnish for salads or soups."]','2026-01-10 12:13:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4090,4090,'en','Vegan pumpkin soup','Make the most of pumpkin season in early autumn with this healthy vegan pumpkin soup. Toast the pumpkin seeds and use as a garnish to add texture','["1 medium pumpkin or large squash (about 1½kg)","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","½ tsp ground allspice","1 large onion, finely chopped","1 tbsp chopped ginger","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1-1.2 litres vegan stock","1 tbsp vegan white miso","3 tbsp soya cream or coconut yogurt","3 tbsp coconut flakes","3 tbsp pumpkin seeds","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","½ small bunch of coriander, chopped","1 lime, zested and juiced"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Peel, deseed and chop the pumpkin into 3cm chunks (reserve the seeds for the relish – see tip). Tip the pumpkin onto a baking tray, drizzle over half the oil, scatter with the allspice and toss well. Season and roast for 30 mins until golden and tender. Meanwhile, toast the coconut flakes for the relish in a dry frying pan over a low heat for a few minutes until lightly golden. Remove from the pan and leave to cool, then stir in the pumpkin seeds, chilli, coriander and lime zest.","Heat the remaining oil in a large saucepan over a medium heat, and fry the onion for 5 mins until tender but not golden. Add the ginger and garlic and fry for another minute, then tip in 1 litre stock and the miso. Put the roasted pumpkin in the pan, then bring to a simmer. Remove from the heat and blend the soup with a stick blender until smooth. If you prefer a thinner soup, add the remaining stock. Return the soup to a gentle simmer, then season well and stir in the lime juice. Ladle into bowls, and serve topped with a swirl of the soya cream and a sprinkle of the relish."]','2026-01-10 12:13:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4092,4092,'en','Little crab cakes & herby tartare','Use crab to take your fishcakes to the next level. These are ideal for sharing and dunking in our tangy tartare sauce. If you can, use fresh crabmeat','["2 large potatoes (about 600g)","1 tbsp sunflower oil, plus extra for frying","100g brown crabmeat","200g white crabmeat","1 lemon, zested","pinch of cayenne pepper","pinch of mustard powder","50g plain flour","2 eggs, lightly beaten","100g panko breadcrumbs, or fresh breadcrumbs","lemon wedges, to serve","120g mayonnaise","1 tsp Dijon mustard","1 tsp capers, drained and roughly chopped","½ small bunch of dill, finely chopped","¼ small bunch of tarragon, finely chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Prick the potatoes all over with a fork, rub with the oil, put on a baking sheet and bake for 1 hr 30 mins, or until a knife can be easily inserted. Leave to cool a little.","Put all the crabmeat, the lemon zest, cayenne and mustard powder into a bowl with a large pinch of salt. Halve the potatoes and scoop the flesh into the bowl. Gently fold everything together, then form into 12 small patties using your hands.","Tip the flour into a shallow bowl, pour the egg into a second, and the breadcrumbs in a third. Dip each patty into the flour, then the egg, and finally, roll in the breadcrumbs. Put the fishcakes on a plate and chill for 10 mins.","For the tartare sauce, combine all the ingredients in a bowl. Set aside.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Heat a good glug of oil in a non-stick frying pan over a medium heat, and fry half the crab cakes for 3 mins on each side, or until golden and crisp. Transfer to a baking sheet and bake for 8-10 mins, or until cooked through.","Serve the crab cakes on a platter with a bowl of the tartare sauce on the side for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:13:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4094,4094,'en','Cabbage & chilli slaw','Serve this cabbage and chilli slaw with doner kebabs. Chill for a day or two, and it will soften and transform into a lighter, kimchi-style slaw','["½  white cabbage, finely sliced","½ quantity smoky chilli sauce (see recipe in ''Goes well with'', below)","½  lemon, juiced","8 spring onions, trimmed and finely sliced on an angle"]','["Toss the cabbage in a bowl with ½ tsp salt. Set aside for 30 mins, then rinse under cold running water. Leave to dry in a colander.","Return the cabbage to the bowl and toss with the chilli sauce, lemon juice and spring onions. Will keep in the fridge for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4096,4096,'en','Smoky chilli sauce','Make this smoky chilli sauce to go with homemade doner kebabs, burgers or hotdogs. Packed with garlic and spicy heat, it promises to add punch to your dishes','["12 red chillies","10 garlic cloves","1 tbsp olive oil, plus a drizzle extra","pinch of caster sugar"]','["Remove the stems from the chillies, then tip onto a sheet of foil with the garlic cloves, a drizzle of olive oil, caster sugar and some salt. Lift the sides of the foil up and scrunch to close.","Grill on the barbecue (or roast at 160C/140C fan/gas 3) for 30 mins until the garlic is soft. Tip into a large pestle and mortar or food processor with 1 tbsp olive oil, and crush or blitz to a chunky sauce. Will keep in the fridge for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4098,4098,'en','Banana, tahini & salted caramel pavlova','Wow guests with this pavlova, featuring a fabulous banana, tahini and salted caramel topping. It’s a deliciously decadent dessert for a summer feast','["½  lemon, juiced (reserve the other half)","6 large egg whites","350g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","400ml double cream","2 tbsp tahini","2 tbsp icing sugar","3 bananas, sliced","3 tbsp salted caramel","2 sesame snaps"]','["Line a large baking sheet with baking parchment. Using an 18cm round cake tin or plate as a guide, draw a circle on the parchment, then flip it over. Heat the oven to 130C/110C fan/gas ½.","Rub the reserved lemon half around the inside of a large bowl or stand mixer, then wipe with kitchen paper to remove any butter or oil. Tip in the egg whites and whisk with an electric whisk or the mixer on a low speed until the whites form small, foamy bubbles, about 1-2 mins. Keep going until the mix looks like shaving foam, then add the sugar, 1 tbsp at a time, until it’s a thick, glossy meringue. Rub some between your fingers – if you can feel any grains of sugar, keep whisking for a few minutes. Add the cornflour, lemon juice and vanilla, and whisk for another 30 seconds.","Spoon the meringue onto the prepared baking parchment, into the centre of the circle, and spread it out to the edges with a palette knife. Swipe the knife around the edge, then smooth the top.","Bake for 15 mins, then turn the oven down to 100C/80C fan/gas ¼ and bake for 1 hr. Turn the oven off and leave the pavlova inside to cool for at least 2 hrs, or overnight.","When ready to serve, carefully invert the pavlova and peel away the parchment. Don’t worry if it cracks a little – it will be covered by the topping.","To make the topping, whisk the double cream, tahini and icing sugar to soft peaks. Spoon onto the pavlova and top with the sliced bananas, then drizzle over salted caramel and crumble over the sesame snaps. Best served straightaway but leftovers will keep in the fridge for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4100,4100,'en','Watermelon, lime and mint sugar pavlova','Try a twist on pavlova with a watermelon, lime and mint topping. With crunchy meringue and a marshmallowy centre, this is a dessert that’s sure to impress','["½  lemon, juiced (reserve the other half)","6 large egg whites","350g caster sugar","2 tsp cornflour","1 tsp vanilla extract","handful of mint leaves, plus extra to serve","50g caster sugar","400ml double cream","200g natural yogurt","1 lime, zested","small watermelon, cut into wedges and rind removed"]','["Line a large baking sheet with baking parchment. Using an 18cm round cake tin or plate as a guide, draw a circle on the parchment, then flip it over. Heat the oven to 130C/110C fan/gas ½.","Rub the reserved lemon half around the inside of a large bowl or stand mixer, then wipe with kitchen paper to remove any butter or oil. Tip in the egg whites and whisk with an electric whisk or the mixer on a low speed until the whites form small, foamy bubbles, about 1-2 mins. Keep going until the mix looks like shaving foam, then add the sugar, 1 tbsp at a time, until it’s a thick, glossy meringue. Rub some between your fingers – if you can feel any grains of sugar, keep whisking for a few minutes. Add the cornflour, lemon juice and vanilla, and whisk for another 30 seconds.","Spoon the meringue onto the prepared baking sheet, into the centre of the circle, and spread it out to the edges with a palette knife. Swipe the knife around the edge, then smooth the top.","Bake for 15 mins, then turn the oven down to 100C/80C fan/gas ¼ and bake for 1 hr. Turn the oven off and leave the pavlova inside to cool for at least 2 hrs, or overnight.","Carefully invert the pavlova and peel away the parchment. Don’t worry if it cracks a little – it will be covered by the topping.","To make the topping, blitz the mint with the caster sugar. Whisk the double cream and natural yogurt with an electric whisk until just holding its shape. Sprinkle over the lime zest and mint sugar, then fold into the cream mix with a large metal spoon to ripple. Spoon over the pavlova. Top with the rest of the mint sugar, the watermelon and more mint. Serve with lime wedges to squeeze over. Best served straightaway but leftovers will keep in the fridge for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4102,4102,'en','Strawberry cupcakes','Treat family and friends to these beautiful strawberry cupcakes. They’re made with fresh strawberry pieces in the sponge, and a vibrant pink buttercream icing','["175g self-raising flour","115g caster sugar","2 eggs","100g Greek yogurt","115g butter, melted and cooled slightly","100g strawberries, hulled and finely chopped","300g icing sugar, sifted","150g butter, softened","2 tbsp milk","1 tsp vanilla extract","few drops of pink food colouring","6 strawberries, halved, or 12 small whole strawberries"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with cupcake cases. Mix the flour and sugar together in a large bowl. In a large jug, whisk together the eggs, yogurt and melted butter. Gradually mix the wet ingredients into the dry until you have a smooth batter, then fold in the strawberries.","Fill the prepared cases so they are about three-fourths full. Bake for 25-30 mins, or until golden and a skewer inserted into the middles comes out clean. Leave to cool.","Meanwhile, make the icing. Beat the sugar and butter together until smooth and pale, then add the milk, vanilla and a little pink food colouring and beat until the icing is an even pale pink shade. Spoon the icing into a piping bag fitted with a star nozzle, then pipe in swirls onto the cooled cupcakes. Decorate each with a strawberry half or small strawberry, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4104,4104,'en','Prawn & aubergine curry','Enjoy this vibrant prawn and aubergine curry with flatbreads for a quick and easy midweek meal for two. It’s ideal on busy nights when you’re short on time','["1 tsp vegetable oil","1 aubergine, cut into 1cm chunks","1-2 red or green chilli, sliced","thumb-sized piece of ginger, grated","1 tsp turmeric","2 tsp ground cumin","400g can cherry tomatoes or chopped tomatoes","150g raw prawns","2 tbsp dairy-free coconut yogurt","1 lime, juiced","½  small bunch of coriander, chopped","2 rotis or flatbreads, warmed"]','["Heat the oil in a deep frying pan over a medium-high heat, and fry the aubergine with a pinch of salt for 5 mins until lightly golden. Stir in the chilli, ginger, turmeric and cumin, cook for another minute, then pour in the cherry tomatoes. Simmer for 10 mins until thickened.","Stir in the prawns and simmer for 2-4 mins until pink. Remove from the heat, stir in the coconut yogurt, lime juice and coriander, then serve with the warmed rotis."]','2026-01-10 12:13:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4106,4106,'en','Chicken piccata with garlicky greens & new potatoes','Make more time midweek with our tasty chicken piccata with capers, greens and new potatoes. Ready in 20 minutes, it’s healthy and low in calories too','["200g new potatoes, halved or quartered","300g green beans, trimmed","200g spring greens, shredded","2 skinless chicken breasts","3 tsp olive oil","100ml chicken stock or water","1 tbsp drained capers","1 lemon, zested and juiced","2 small garlic cloves, sliced","1 tbsp grated parmesan"]','["Cook the new potatoes in a large pan of boiling salted water for 8-10 mins until tender. Add the green beans and spring greens for the last 3 mins. Drain, then separate the greens from the potatoes.","While the potatoes are cooking, cut the chicken breasts through the centre lengthways, leaving one side attached so it opens out like a book. Brush each one with 1 tsp of the olive oil, then season.","Heat a large frying pan over a medium-high heat and cook the chicken for 4 mins on each side until golden. Pour over the stock, capers, lemon juice and zest, then simmer gently for a few minutes to reduce. Add the cooked potatoes and simmer for another minute.","Heat the remaining 1 tsp oil in another frying pan and fry the garlic for 1 min until lightly golden and fragrant. Tip in the drained greens, and toss in the garlicky oil. Season, then scatter over the parmesan and serve with the chicken and potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:13:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4107,4107,'en','Rainbow fruit lollies','Pack in the fruit with these fun rainbow lollies, made with mango, banana, kiwi and berries. If you want a more vivid colour, add food colouring to the fruity mixes','["100g mango, peeled, stoned and chopped","2 bananas","400g yogurt","2 kiwi fruit, peeled and roughly chopped","100g frozen raspberries","100g frozen blackberries"]','["Blitz the mango with ½ banana and 100g yogurt in a blender until smooth. Divide between six ice lolly moulds and insert a stick into each. Hold each stick upright in the mould, and secure on both sides with tape. Freeze for 1 hr until set.","Repeat with another ½ banana, 100g more yogurt and the kiwi fruit, and pour that over the banana layer. Freeze for another 1 hr until set. Repeat with the raspberries, then the blackberries, freezing each layer before topping with the next. Cover and freeze the lollies overnight. Run under warm water to remove from the moulds. Will keep in the freezer for up to two months."]','2026-01-10 12:13:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4109,4109,'en','Rainbow spaghetti','Try making this rainbow spaghetti as a sensory activity for babies and toddlers, or serve as a fun lunch – just top with their favourite dressing, and enjoy with a salad','["200g spaghetti","a mix of food colourings (we used red, yellow, green and blue)","salad dressing or melted butter","50g cheddar, grated","mixed salad leaves and veg"]','["Cook the spaghetti following pack instructions. Drain, then divide between bowls, based on the number of colours you’d like to use (we made five colours). Add a drop of food colouring to each bowl, or combine two colours (such as red and yellow to make orange). Mix well, adding a splash of water to help the colour disperse, if needed. Leave for 5 mins, then rinse the spaghetti under cold running water to set the colour.","If you want to use the spaghetti as a sensory activity only, tip it into a large tray or plastic bowl and let your little ones dive in. If you like, add ice cubes, or give older toddlers (aged two to four) safety scissors to practise their cutting skills.","If you’re serving the spaghetti, toss with some salad dressing or melted butter, then top with a little grated cheese and a salad of mixed leaves and vegetables."]','2026-01-10 12:13:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4111,4111,'en','Apple ‘doughnuts’','Make these doughnut-style apple rings for a picnic with the kids. Children will love helping to make, decorate and eat these fruity treats, and there’s no cooking required','["150g soft cheese","2 tsp honey","3 apples (use a crunchy eating variety)","3-4 tbsp almond or peanut butter (optional)","coloured sprinkles, to decorate"]','["Mix the soft cheese with the honey and set aside. Peel the apples, then slice each through the core into five or six rings, about 1cm thick. Use an apple corer or small round biscuit cutter to stamp out a circle from the middle of each slice, removing the core and creating ‘doughnut’ shapes. Pat the slices dry using kitchen paper – they should be as dry as possible to help the toppings stick.","Spread some nut butter over the slices, if using, then top with the sweetened soft cheese. Decorate with the sprinkles and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4113,4113,'en','Crumpet pizzas','Help younger children make these easy crumpet pizzas for lunch, or let older kids put them together themselves. Use whatever veg you have in the fridge for the toppings','["6 crumpets","4 tbsp passata","4 tbsp ketchup","½ tsp dried oregano","toppings of your choice (peppers, cherry tomatoes, red onion, sweetcorn, olives, ham and basil all work well)","75g cheddar cheese, grated"]','["Heat the grill to high. Lightly toast the crumpets in a toaster or under the grill. Meanwhile, mix the passata, ketchup and oregano together in a bowl. Season. Chop your chosen toppings into small pieces – young children can tear basil, or chop soft veg in a cup using safety scissors.","Line a baking tray with foil. Spread the sauce over the crumpets, then top with the veg and cheese. Arrange on the tray and grill for 3-4 mins, until the cheese is golden and bubbling. Leave to cool slightly before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:13:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4115,4115,'en','Roasted beetroot & raw honey salad','Serve up a fibre-rich lunch or side dish with this beetroot, feta and green lentil salad. Bursting with colour, it’s full of flavour and nutrients','["3 large beetroot, cut into wedges","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","5 thyme sprigs","25g feta, crumbled","1 tbsp honey","200g canned green lentils, drained","50g rocket","30g mixed seeds","small handful of dill, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Toss the beetroot, ½ tbsp oil and the thyme in a roasting tin. Season. Roast for 30-35 mins or until tender, adding the feta for the last 10 mins. Leave to cool slightly.","Whisk the remaining oil with the honey, a splash of cold water to loosen and some seasoning. Warm the lentils in a pan or microwave, then season. Toss the beetroot and feta with the rocket and dressing, then serve on top of the lentils with the seeds and dill scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:13:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4117,4117,'en','Easy lemon muffins','Bake a batch of these easy muffins, drizzled with a tangy lemon icing, using an all-in-one method. They’re great for elevenses or whenever you need a sweet treat','["100g unsalted butter, softened","100g caster sugar","2 eggs, beaten","115g self-raising flour","¼ tsp baking powder","2 lemons, zested and juiced","100g yogurt","150g icing sugar","1 lemon, juiced"]','["Line a muffin tin with large muffin cases. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tip all the ingredients in a large bowl and mix until smooth using a wooden spoon or an electric whisk. Spoon tablespoons of the batter into the muffin cases until they’re three-quarters full (you can make up to 8, depending on the case size). Bake for 30 mins or until a skewer comes out clean. Leave on a cooling rack to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the icing. Sieve the icing sugar into a bowl and gradually add lemon juice until you have a thick but pourable icing – you may not need all of the juice. Drizzle over the cooled muffins and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4119,4119,'en','Watermelon pops','Try a new, fun way to serve watermelon to kids. You could also push green and black grapes onto kebab sticks and finish with a strawberry','["1 large watermelon"]','["Cut the watermelon into 2cm-thick slices. Cut each slice into a triangular wedge.","Make a small incision into the middle of the skin on each piece, large enough to push in a lolly stick."]','2026-01-10 12:13:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4121,4121,'en','Mango sorbet','Make the most of sweet mangoes with this refreshing mango sorbet. Low in fat, it’s the perfect dessert for warm, balmy days','["3 large, ripe mangoes","200g caster sugar","1 lime, juiced"]','["Peel the mangoes with a vegetable peeler, cut as much of the flesh away from the stone as you can, put it in a food processor or blender.","Add the sugar, lime juice and 200ml water. Blend for a few minutes, until the mango is very smooth and the sugar has dissolved – rub a little of the mixture between your fingers, if it still feels gritty, blend for a little longer. Pour into a container and put in the freezer for a few hours.","Scrape the sorbet back into the blender (if it’s very solid, leave at room temperature for 5-10 mins first). Whizz until you have a slushy mixture, then pour back into the tin and freeze for another hour or so.","Repeat step 3. Freeze until solid (another hour or two). Will keep covered in the freezer for three months."]','2026-01-10 12:13:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4123,4123,'en','Easy honey flapjacks','Treat yourself to these easy honey flapjacks for elevenses or the afternoon slump. Perfect for picnics, packed lunches and bake sales','["225g butter, plus extra for the tin","75g caster sugar","4 tbsp honey","350g porridge oats"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 30 x 15cm rectangle tin with baking parchment. Melt the butter, sugar and honey in a pan over a medium heat, stirring frequently until the butter has melted and the mixture is smooth.","Put the oats in a mixing bowl, then pour over the butter and honey mixture. Stir until all the oats are coated. Tip into the prepared tin, and use a spatula or the back of a spoon to evenly spread out the mixture. Cook for 10-15 mins until lightly golden. Leave to cool in the tin, then remove before cutting into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:13:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4125,4125,'en','Kimchi scrambled eggs','Make a gut-friendly brunch with scrambled eggs and kimchi served on toasted wholemeal bread. Sprinkle with spring onions and a pinch of togarashi to finish','["2 medium eggs","1 tbsp milk","40g kimchi","1 slice of wholemeal bread, toasted","1 spring onion, finely sliced","pinch of togarashi, to serve (optional)"]','["Beat the eggs and milk together with a pinch of salt. Pour into a non-stick pan over a low heat. Leave untouched for 30 seconds, then lift the pan a little and swirl the eggs around. Cook for 2 mins more, then fold through the kimchi, breaking up the eggs to scramble them.","Serve the kimchi scrambled eggs on the toast, and top with the spring onion and tograshi, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:13:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4127,4127,'en','Sesame, halloumi & courgette fritters with chilli honey drizzle','Make the most of a glut of courgettes with these easy, speedy fritters made with halloumi and sesame seeds. Serve with a delicious chilli honey drizzle','["2 medium courgettes, grated","½ tsp sea salt, plus extra to serve","30g self-raising flour","20g rice or cornflour","2 tbsp toasted sesame seeds","¼ tsp ground white pepper","2 tsp mint leaves, finely chopped","80g halloumi, grated","2 large eggs","2 spring onions, finely sliced","vegetable oil, for frying","2 tbsp honey","½ tsp pul biber or other chilli flakes","2 lemons, zested"]','["To make the chilli honey drizzle, warm the honey, 2 tbsp water, chilli flakes and lemon zest in a small pan until bubbling and syrupy, about 3 mins. Put the courgettes in a sieve and sprinkle over the salt. Allow to drain for 30 mins, then use your hands to squeeze out the liquid – you want them as dry as possible.","Combine the flours, sesame seeds and pepper in a bowl. Add the mint, halloumi and courgette, and toss lightly to combine. Crack in the eggs and use a fork to stir them into the mixture along with the spring onions. Stir until you have a thick batter.","Heat 1 tbsp oil in a large, heavy-bottomed non-stick frying pan and swirl to coat the base. Add 2 heaped tbsp of the batter for each fritter, flattening them down with a spatula, and fry for a couple of minutes until golden. Flip them over and press down with the spatula, then fry for another few minutes until golden and cooked all the way through. Drain on kitchen paper and season with a few flakes of sea salt. Drizzle with the chilli honey to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4129,4129,'en','Baked feta with sesame & honey','Combine the flavours of salty cheese and sweet honey to create a dish that’s so much more than the sum of its parts. Rich and decadent, serve with warm pitta','["1 tbsp sesame seeds, toasted","200g block feta","2 tbsp honey, plus extra to serve","1 tsp roughly chopped oregano","olive oil, for drizzling","warmed pitta breads, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the sesame seeds in a shallow dish and brush the block of feta all over with the honey. Carefully press the honey-coated feta into the sesame seeds, turning so that it’s well crusted with seeds.","Put the feta in a baking dish (it should fit snugly), then sprinkle over the oregano and a pinch of sea salt. Drizzle with some olive oil. Bake for 15-20 mins until the feta is soft, then drizzle with a little extra honey and serve with the pitta breads on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:13:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4131,4131,'en','Greek bouyiourdi','Enjoy this baked feta with tomatoes, garlic and chilli as part of a meze lunch. It’s perfect for scooping up with warm pitta breads alongside a Greek salad','["3 large ripe tomatoes","1 garlic clove, crushed","200g block feta","1 large mild green chilli, or 1 green pepper, sliced","1 tsp roughly chopped oregano leaves","4 tbsp olive oil","warmed pitta breads, to serve"]','["Cut 1 tomato through the middle, then cut two slices from the centre and set aside. Scoop the seeds from the rest of the tomato, then grate the flesh, discarding the skin. Deseed and grate the rest of the tomatoes in the same way, then mix the grated flesh with the garlic. Season and spoon into a 16cm baking dish.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Nestle the feta block in the garlicky tomatoes, then top with the sliced tomatoes, the chilli, oregano, olive oil and a pinch of sea salt. Cover the dish and bake for 15 mins, then uncover and bake for a further 15 mins. Serve warm with the pitta breads on the side for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:13:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4133,4133,'en','Puff pastry pizzas','Have fun preparing these puff pastry pizzas with kids. Chop up any veg you have into small pieces and let everyone choose their own toppings','["320g sheet ready-rolled light puff pastry","6 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp tomato ketchup","1 tsp dried oregano","75g mozzarella or cheddar","sweetcorn, olives, peppers, red onion, cherry tomatoes, spinach, basil"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Unroll the pastry, cut into six squares and arrange over two baking trays lined with baking parchment. Use a cutlery knife to score a 1cm border around the edge of each pastry square. Bake for 15 mins, until puffed up but not cooked through.","While the pastry cooks, make the sauce and prepare your toppings. Mix the tomato purée, tomato ketchup, oregano and 1 tbsp water. Grate the cheese and chop any veg or herbs you want to put on top into small pieces. Set aside.","Remove the pastry from the oven and squash down the middles with the back of a spoon. Divide the sauce between the pastry squares and spread it out to the puffed-up edges. Sprinkle with the cheese, then add your toppings. Bake for another 5-8 mins and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4135,4135,'en','Cheese, Marmite & spinach pinwheels','Make these easy pinwheels with cheddar, Marmite and spinach flavours to serve with soup or as part of a family picnic. Freeze before baking, if you prefer','["320g sheet ready-rolled light puff pastry","1 tbsp Marmite","2-3 large handfuls of spinach","80g cheddar"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Unroll the pastry with the longer side directly in front of you. Spread the Marmite over the surface. Tear the spinach over the Marmite and scatter with the cheese, making sure it’s evenly spread.","Tightly roll the pastry away from you (starting from the longer side) to create a long sausage shape, then cut into 12 pieces. Arrange over two baking trays lined with baking parchment, spiral side up, and squash down a little with your hand. Will keep covered and frozen at this stage. Bake for 15-20 mins (or 25 mins if cooking from frozen), until puffed and golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:13:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4137,4137,'en','5-veg creamy tomato soup','Enjoy this vegetable-packed soup for a lovely light family meal, with leftovers for the next day. Serve with bread or our Cheese, Marmite & spinach pinwheels','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, chopped","2 carrots, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 red peppers, chopped","1 large sweet potato, peeled and chopped","2 x 400g cans tomatoes","1 low-salt veg or chicken stock cube","1 tsp dried oregano","3 rosemary sprigs, leaves picked and chopped","70ml double cream"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and cook the onion for 8-10 mins until softened and starting to take on a little colour. Add the carrots, garlic, peppers and sweet potato. Cook for a further 10 mins, stirring often and taking care not to burn the garlic. Add the tomatoes, stock, herbs and 1 litre of water. Bring to a simmer. Cover and cook for 20 mins until the sweet potato is soft.","Use a hand blender to whizz the soup until smooth. Stir in the cream and season to taste. Can be chilled for three days or frozen for up to three months."]','2026-01-10 12:13:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4139,4139,'en','Sesame, edamame & chicken noodle salad','Pack a picnic for the family with this healthy wholewheat noodle lunch with chicken, edamame, broccoli and sesame seeds. Make it in just 20 minutes','["2 chicken legs, cooked","1½ tbsp sesame seeds","4 wholewheat noodle nests","160g frozen edamame beans","160g long-stemmed broccoli, cut into small florets","1 tbsp tahini","2 tbsp sesame oil","2 tsp honey","1½ tbsp low-sodium soy sauce","1 tbsp rice wine vinegar"]','["Boil the kettle. Remove the chicken skin, then shred the meat and discard the bones. Set aside. In a large pan, toast the sesame seeds for 1 min until golden, then tip into a large bowl (big enough to hold the noodles).","Fill the pan with water from the kettle and bring back to the boil. Add the noodles and cook following pack instructions. Tip in the beans and broccoli for the last 2 mins.","Meanwhile, mix the tahini, sesame oil, honey, soy sauce and vinegar into the sesame seeds. Drain the noodles, reserving a cup of the cooking water, and run under cold water to cool. Drain again and toss through the sauce along with the chicken. Add a splash of the cooking water to make the sauce thin enough to coat the noodles (it will thicken as it cools). Transfer to containers and chill until ready to eat, if not eating straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:13:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4141,4141,'en','Smoky beans & baked eggs','Pack in the nutrients with smoky beans and baked eggs. Great for a veggie family lunch or supper, serve with flatbreads or toast for extra sustenance','["2 tbsp oil","1 onion, chopped","1 red pepper, sliced","3 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp smoked paprika","1 tbsp ketchup","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 x 400g cans black or pinto beans, drained","4-6 eggs, depending on how hungry you are (adults may want 2 eggs each)","handful of coriander, leaves picked"]','["Heat the oil in a wide, shallow pan and cook the onion for 8-10 mins until softened. Add the pepper and cook for another 5 mins, stirring regularly, until softened. Stir in the garlic, paprika and ketchup, then tip in the tomatoes, cover and leave to simmer gently for 10 mins. Remove the lid and cook for a few more minutes to thicken, then add the beans. Can be cooled and frozen in portions at this stage.","Use a spoon to make 4-6 spaces in the mixture for the eggs – you should be able to see some of the bottom of the pan. Crack the eggs one by one into a cup or bowl and gently drop one into each hole. Cover the pan and reduce the heat to low. Cook for 3-5 mins until the egg whites are cooked through but the yolks are still runny. Scatter over the coriander to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4143,4143,'en','Raspberry, almond & oat breakfast cookies','Grab a few of these energy-boosting cookies for a quick breakfast, or offer as snacks to bridge the hunger gap before dinner. Enjoy with yogurt and fruit','["2 ripe bananas, mashed","150g porridge oats","2 tbsp ground almonds","1⁄2 tsp cinnamon","100g raspberries (fresh or frozen)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4 and line two baking trays with baking parchment. Mix the banana, oats, almonds, cinnamon and a pinch of salt in a bowl to make a sticky dough. Gently stir through the raspberries, trying not to break them up. Scoop up tablespoons of the mixture and roll into balls, then place on a baking tray and flatten with your hand.","Bake for 15 mins until the cookies feel firm around the edges and are golden brown. Leave to cool. Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4145,4145,'en','Deli-style stuffed falafel wrap','Make this deli-style falafel wrap stuffed with spinach, gherkin, cucumber and red cabbage in just 10 minutes for a quick and easy supper for one','["½ small garlic clove","2 tbsp fat-free yogurt","¼ lemon, juiced","1 flatbread or wrap","large handful of spinach or lettuce, shredded","2-3 ready-to-eat falafel","¼ small cucumber, halved down the length, deseeded and sliced","1 tomato, halved, deseeded and sliced","1 gherkin or pickled chilli, halved","1 tbsp pickled red cabbage, drained chilli sauce, to serve (optional)"]','["Mix the garlic, yogurt and lemon juice together in a bowl. Season, then loosen with 1 tbsp cold water if it seems too thick. Warm the flatbread in the toaster, if you like.","Put the flatbread on a piece of baking parchment and top with the spinach or lettuce. Arrange the falafel in a line down the centre, then top with the cucumber and tomato slices. Add the gherkin, cabbage and a drizzle of chilli sauce, if using. Spoon over the yogurt mix.","Use the baking parchment to help you fold in both ends of the wrap, then roll tightly into a burrito shape. Cut in half through the baking parchment using a bread knife, and tear it away to eat."]','2026-01-10 12:13:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4147,4147,'en','Ginger chicken & green bean noodles','Try this speedy one-pan ginger chicken with noodles and green beans as a quick and easy midweek meal. It’s healthy, low in fat and calories, too','["½ tbsp vegetable oil","2 skinless chicken breasts, sliced","200g green beans, trimmed and halved crosswise","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and cut into matchsticks","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 ball stem ginger, finely sliced, plus 1 tsp syrup from the jar","1 tsp cornflour, mixed with 1 tbsp water","1 tsp dark soy sauce, plus extra to serve (optional)","2 tsp rice vinegar","200g cooked egg noodles"]','["Heat the oil in a wok over a high heat and stir-fry the chicken for 5 mins. Add the green beans and stir-fry for 4-5 mins more until the green beans are just tender, and the chicken is just cooked through.","Stir in the fresh ginger and garlic, and stir-fry for 2 mins, then add the stem ginger and syrup, the cornflour mix, soy sauce and vinegar. Stir-fry for 1 min, then toss in the noodles. Cook until everything is hot and the sauce coats the noodles. Drizzle with more soy, if you like, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4149,4149,'en','Beetroot burger','Looking for a vegan burger with bite and bags of flavour? Look no further – we’re confident that meat-eaters, veggies and vegans alike will love this beetroot burger recipe','["1 onion, quartered","3 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for brushing","2 garlic cloves, crushed","200g chestnut mushrooms","250g smoked or regular tofu","2 (about 100g) cooked beetroot (not in vinegar)","400g can black beans, drained","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp vegan mayonnaise","1 tbsp miso paste","100g oat flour","2 tbsp ground flaxseed","50g pecans","200g pouch microwave brown rice, cooked","8 cheese slices, vegan if needed (optional)","8 burger buns, split (check the label, if catering for vegans)","tomato chilli jam (see recipe, below)","a few crunchy lettuce leaves","1 avocado, stoned, peeled and roughly mashed","½ lime, juiced"]','["Put the onion in a food processor and pulse until it resembles rice. Heat 1 tbsp oil in a large frying pan, tip in the onion and fry for 10 mins until soft and just golden. Stir in the garlic and fry for 1 min more. Tip the mixture into a large bowl.","Put the mushrooms in the food processor and pulse until they also resemble rice. Heat the remaining oil in the pan, add the mushrooms and fry for 10-15 mins, until any liquid that’s released has evaporated and the mushrooms are tender. Tip into the bowl with the onions.","Put the tofu, beetroot, beans, tomato purée, mayonnaise, miso, flour and flaxseed in the food processor with some seasoning and blitz until smooth. Scrape into the bowl with the veg. Add the pecans and half the rice to the food processor and pulse until finely chopped, or a little chunkier, if you prefer. Tip into the bowl with the veg and tofu mixture, along with the rest of the rice.","Use your hands to shape the mixture into patties roughly the same size as your burger buns. The patties will be delicate, so chill for at least 30 mins before cooking. If you want to barbecue them, freeze for 30-45 mins first until firm.","Heat a frying pan over a medium heat or light the barbecue, and brush both sides of the patties with a little oil. Cook for 5-8 mins on each side, turning once after a crust has formed, until charred and hot through to the centre. Avoid moving or turning too often, as they will be more delicate than meat patties. Top with the cheese, if using, for the final minute or so (see tip, below). Toast the buns on the barbecue or in the pan, then spread each with a little chilli jam. Fill with a few lettuce leaves, the patties and some smashed avocado mixed with a squeeze of lime."]','2026-01-10 12:13:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4151,4151,'en','Leftover lamb curry','Make the most of leftover roast lamb with this flavour-packed leftover lamb curry. Serve with naan bread and basmati rice for an Indian feast','["2 onions, roughly chopped","1 large garlic clove, chopped","1 thumb sized piece ginger, peeled and chopped","2 tbsp oil","4 tbsp medium curry paste","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 red chilli, halved and seeds removed","1 cinnamon stick","200ml lamb stock","500-700g leftover roast lamb, chopped into large chunks","1 small bunch of coriander, roughly chopped","cooked basmati rice, naan bread and natural yogurt, to serve"]','["Whizz the onion, garlic, ginger and 200ml water in a food processor until you have a smooth paste.","Heat the oil in a casserole dish and fry the onion mixture for 10-15 mins or until all the liquid has been absorbed and the onion begin to turn golden brown. Add the curry paste and fry for 1 min more. Stir through the tomatoes, cinnamon and chilli. Pour in the stock and bring to a simmer. Add the lamb and cook, covered for 1 hr.","Remove the lid and simmer uncovered for 15 mins to reduce slightly. Season to taste and stir through the coriander. Serve with fluffy basmati rice, naan bread and yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:13:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4153,4153,'en','Chicken & sweetcorn tacos','Serve up these healthy chicken and sweetcorn tacos for an easy midweek meal that''s full of flavour. You''ll also have leftovers to make chicken and sweetcorn wraps for lunch tomorrow','["250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 tbsp taco or fajita seasoning (see tip, below)","5-6 skinless chicken breasts, sliced","¼ red cabbage, finely shredded","3 limes, 1 juiced, 2 cut into wedges","small bunch of coriander, chopped","4 sweetcorn cob, kernels sliced off, or 400g frozen sweetcorn","400g can black beans, drained and rinsed","2 garlic cloves, crushed","4 tbsp fat-free yogurt, to serve","chilli sauce, to serve"]','["Combine the flour with half the oil and a small pinch of salt in a bowl. Pour over 125-150ml warm water, then bring together into a soft dough with your hands. Cut into six equal pieces, then cut four of the pieces in half again, so you have eight small pieces and two large. Roll all the pieces out on a floured work surface until they’re as thin as you can get them.","Heat a dry frying pan over a medium-high heat and cook the small and large tortillas for 2-3 mins on each side until golden and toasted (do this one at a time). Leave the large tortillas to cool, then cover and reserve for use in the lunchboxes (see tip below). Keep the small tortillas warm in foil.","Sprinkle the taco seasoning over the chicken in a bowl, and toss to combine. Toss the cabbage with the lime juice, half the coriander and some seasoning in another bowl, then leave to pickle.","Meanwhile, heat two frying pans over a high heat. Divide the remaining oil between the pans and fry the sweetcorn and a pinch of salt until sizzling and turning golden, stirring occasionally – you want the sweetcorn to char slightly, as this adds flavour, so you may need to leave it to cook undisturbed for a bit. While the sweetcorn cooks and chars, fry the chicken in the larger pan until cooked through and golden (you may need to do this in batches).","Tip the black beans and garlic into the sweetcorn and stir to warm through. Squeeze over two of the lime wedges.","Reserve two spoonfuls each of the chicken (about 1 chicken breast) and sweetcorn mix for use in the lunchboxes (see tip, below), then serve the rest in bowls alongside the cabbage, yogurt, lime wedges, remaining coriander, chilli sauce and tortillas for everyone to dig into."]','2026-01-10 12:13:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4155,4155,'en','Pork & aubergine noodle stir-fry','Enjoy this quick and healthy pork and aubergine stir-fry on busy weeknights. This recipe for two also gives you leftovers to make pork & aubergine lettuce cups for lunch the next day','["½  tbsp groundnut oil","100g lean pork mince","1 aubergine, cut into small cubes","2 nests medium egg noodles (about 100g)","1 tbsp low-salt soy sauce","3 tbsp rice vinegar","½  tbsp cornflour","large piece of ginger, peeled and ½  grated, ½  cut into matchsticks","3 garlic cloves, crushed","½ -1 red chilli, finely chopped","bunch of spring onions, finely sliced","2 pak choi, leaves separated or sliced"]','["Heat the oil in a wok or high-sided frying pan and fry the mince for 5-8 mins, until brown and starting to crisp at the edges. Add the aubergine and stir-fry for another 15 mins until soft and translucent.","Meanwhile, cook the noodles following pack instructions, then drain. Mix the soy sauce, vinegar, cornflour and 2 tbsp water together in a small bowl and set aside.","Add the grated ginger and ginger matchsticks, the garlic and chilli to the mince and stir-fry for a minute before adding the spring onion and pak choi. Stir-fry for another few minutes before adding the sauce. Bring to a bubble and cook until the sauce has thickened slightly and coats the aubergine. Scoop half the stir-fry into a bowl and leave to cool for your leftover pork & aubergine lettuce cups. (See tip, below.)","Toss the drained noodles with the remaining stir-fry in the wok until the noodles are coated in the sauce. Divide between warmed bowls."]','2026-01-10 12:13:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4157,4157,'en','Ricotta, broccoli, & new potato frittata','Make this quick and healthy frittata with a bean salad in 30 minutes flat. Flavoured with broccoli and ricotta, you''ll also have leftovers you can enjoy the next day','["100g new potatoes","200g long-stem broccoli","200g green beans, trimmed and halved","400g can mixed beans, drained","3 tsp rapeseed oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","pinch of chilli flakes, cumin seeds or fennel seeds","4 large eggs","50g ricotta","1 tsp sherry vinegar","½  small bunch of basil, roughly chopped (optional)"]','["Boil the potatoes for 10-15 mins until tender. Add the broccoli for the last 2 mins of cooking. Drain and thickly slice the potatoes.","Meanwhile, put the green beans and mixed beans in a pan and cover with water. Bring to a simmer and cook for 3-4 mins, or until the green beans are tender. Drain and leave to steam-dry in the pan.","Heat the grill to high. Heat 2 tsp of the oil in a medium non-stick frying pan and fry the garlic for 1 min, then add the chilli flakes or cumin or fennel seeds and cook for 1 min more. Add the potatoes, broccoli and seasoning, and toss to coat in the flavoured oil.","Beat the eggs in a jug, season and pour over the potato mix. Cook over a medium heat for 2 mins, or until the base is set. Dollop teaspoons of the ricotta on top, then grill for 4-5 mins until cooked through.","Meanwhile, drizzle another 1 tsp oil over the bean mixture with the vinegar. Stir in the basil, if using, and season. Slice the frittata into four wedges, and serve two with half the bean salad on the side. Chill the remaining wedges and bean salad to use in the lunchboxes below."]','2026-01-10 12:13:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4159,4159,'en','Prawn, pancetta & watercress risotto','Rustle up our prawn, pancetta and watercress risotto on busy weeknights when you need something speedy. You’ll also have leftovers for lunch the next day','["1 tbsp olive oil, plus 1 tsp","3 slices pancetta","1 large onion, finely chopped","200g risotto rice","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1l hot vegetable stock","200g watercress, stalks chopped","25g parmesan, finely grated, plus extra to serve","½  lemon, zested and juiced","180g raw king prawns, peeled and deveined"]','["Heat 1 tbsp oil in a wide pan and fry the pancetta for 2 mins on each side. Drain on kitchen paper, then crumble. Fry the onion in the same pan for 5 mins until soft.","Stir in the rice and garlic for 2 mins to coat in the oil. Add half the stock, bring to the boil and simmer for 5 mins until absorbed. Add the remaining stock, a ladleful at a time, constantly stirring until the rice is tender, about 20 mins.","Stir in most of the watercress and the parmesan. Season well. Add the lemon zest and a squeeze of juice.","Spoon half the risotto onto a plate (use for lunch the next day, see tip below). Add the prawns to the pan and cook for 2 mins until pink. Toss the rest of the watercress with 1 tsp oil and lemon juice. Serve over the risotto with some pancetta and parmesan."]','2026-01-10 12:13:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4161,4161,'en','Greek feta traybake','Make this Greek-inspired traybake with feta, olives, pitta bread and tomatoes for an easy midweek meal, then use the leftovers for lunch the next day','["2 pitta breads","3 tsp olive oil","1 tsp dried oregano","1 red onion, cut into thin wedges","400g can butter beans, drained and rinsed","2 courgettes, halved lengthways and sliced on an angle","100g cherry tomatoes on the vine","20g Kalamata olives, pitted and halved","100g feta, cut into bite-sized chunks","1 lemon, cut into wedges"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Cut or tear the pitta breads into chunks or triangles and put on a large baking tray. Drizzle over 1 tsp oil and scatter over half the oregano and some black pepper, then toss to combine. Arrange the pitta pieces in a single layer and bake for 10 mins until golden and crunchy.","Remove the pitta chips from the tray, then add the onion wedges, beans and courgettes. Coat with the remaining oil and oregano, season and roast for 10 mins.","Toss in the tomatoes and olives, then scatter the feta over the top. Roast for another 10 mins, until the veg is soft and the feta is starting to turn golden. Scatter the pitta chips over the top or around the side of the tray, and squeeze over the lemon wedges before serving half the traybake. Leave the rest of the traybake to cool for use in the lunchboxes, see tip below."]','2026-01-10 12:13:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4163,4163,'en','Charred cauliflower, lemon & caper orzo','Make this easy orzo and cauliflower dish in just 25 minutes. It serves one for a main meal, plus there''s leftovers to enjoy for lunch the next day','["½  cauliflower, broken into florets, stalk chopped into cubes","2 tsp olive oil","100g orzo","2 tsp capers, drained and rinsed","1 small garlic clove, sliced","½  lemon, zested and juiced","100ml low-salt vegetable stock (check it’s vegan, if required)","handful of rocket leaves, to serve"]','["Heat the grill to high. Toss the cauliflower with half the oil and some seasoning. Tip onto a baking tray and grill for 15-20 mins until golden, charred, and tender all the way through.","Meanwhile, cook the orzo in a pan of boiling salted water for 8 mins, or until al dente. Drain.","Heat the remaining oil in a frying pan and sizzle the capers and garlic until golden. Stir in the orzo, cauliflower, lemon zest and juice and the stock. Bubble for 1 min, then spoon half into a bowl and top with the rocket. Leave the leftovers to cool for the lunchbox, see tip below."]','2026-01-10 12:13:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4165,4165,'en','Crispy chicken strips','Serve these family-friendly crunchy chicken bites with carrot salad, tomato sauce and a baked potato. Use panko breadcrumbs if you can, as they''re larger and crisper','["150ml buttermilk, or skimmed milk mixed with 2 tsp lemon juice then left for 5 mins","2 large skinless chicken breasts or 4 small pieces pork escalope","50g panko breadcrumbs","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 tbsp ketchup","1 tsp soy sauce","½  tsp white wine vinegar","2 large or 4 small carrots (about 300g), peeled and grated","½ lemon, juiced","1 tbsp olive oil","baked potatoes, to serve"]','["Pour the buttermilk into a wide, shallow bowl. Cut each chicken breast in half horizontally and pat dry with kitchen paper. Turn them over in the buttermilk, leave in the dish and chill for 1 hr. Meanwhile, for the salad, mix the carrot with the lemon juice and olive oil. Mix the sauce ingredients together in another bowl and set both aside.","Heat a large, non-stick frying pan, tip in the breadcrumbs and toast in the dry pan for 2-3 mins until pale brown, stirring regularly so they don’t burn. Tip into a bowl and break up any large clumps.","Heat oven to 230C/210C fan/gas 8. Tip the crumbs onto a large plate, then lift the chicken breasts from the buttermilk, and roll them in the crumbs, making sure they are coated evenly.","Heat ½ tbsp of oil in a non-stick frying pan. Fry the chicken for 1-2 mins over a medium-high heat, then turn it over, adding the rest of the oil and fry for 1 min more.","Transfer the chicken to a baking sheet and bake for 5 mins, then rest for 5 mins and cut into strips. Serve the chicken and the carrot salad with the sauce and baked potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:13:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4167,4167,'en','Easy ratatouille','A bowlful of this warming, healthy veggie ratatouille provides all of your five a day and packs in plenty of flavour. Serve with pasta or fresh bread','["2 aubergines","3 medium courgettes","2 red peppers","2 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, finely diced","3 garlic cloves, crushed","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 tsp dried oregano, basil or Italian mixed herbs","small bunch basil, chopped, plus a few leaves to serve","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","1-2 tbsp sugar"]','["Dice the aubergine, courgette and pepper into 3cm chunks. Heat the olive oil in a large casserole or deep frying pan over a medium heat. Fry the onion for 10 mins until soft and translucent. Add the chopped veg, turn the heat to high and fry for another 10 mins until softened.","Stir the garlic into the pan, and toss everything together, frying for 1 min more. Tip in the chopped tomatoes, plus half a can of water (200ml), the dried herbs and the chopped basil. Simmer for 20 minutes on a medium heat, stirring occasionally, until the veg is tender and the tomatoes are thick and coating the veg. Season and add the vinegar and sugar to balance the sweet and acidity of the tomatoes. Scatter with the basil leaves, and serve with rustic bread, or pasta."]','2026-01-10 12:13:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4169,4169,'en','Tortilla pizza','Need a quick supper for two that''s ready in a flash? Use all your favourite toppings on this easy tortilla pizza, with plenty of melted mozzarella','["4 tbsp passata","1 garlic clove, crushed","½  tbsp olive oil","½  tsp dried herbs (mixed herbs, basil or oregano work well)","2 plain tortillas","50g grated mozzarella","6-8 slices pepperoni","6-8 pickled jalapeño slices"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Mix the passata, garlic, olive oil, herbs and season well. Put the tortillas onto one large baking sheet, or two smaller ones. Spread over the tomato sauce leaving a 1cm border around the edges. Scatter with the mozzarella, add the pepperoni and jalapeños. Bake for 6-8 minutes until the edges of the tortillas are crisp and golden, and the cheese has melted and is bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:13:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4171,4171,'en','Bombay potato frittata','Pack in the flavour with this Indian-inspired frittata. Perfect for a healthy lunch, it''s low in calories and fat and full of nutrients','["4 new potatoes, sliced into 5mm rounds","100g baby spinach, chopped","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 onion, halved and sliced","1 large garlic clove, finely grated","½ tsp ground coriander","½ tsp ground cumin","¼ tsp black mustard seeds","¼ tsp turmeric","3 tomatoes, roughly chopped","2 large eggs","½ green chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 small bunch of coriander, finely chopped","1 tbsp mango chutney","3 tbsp fat-free Greek yogurt"]','["Cook the potatoes in a pan of boiling water for 6 mins, or until tender. Drain and leave to steam-dry. Meanwhile, put the spinach in a heatproof bowl with 1 tbsp water. Cover and microwave for 3 mins on high, or until wilted.","Heat the rapeseed oil in a medium non-stick frying pan. Add the onion and cook over a medium heat for 10 mins until golden and sticky. Stir in the garlic, ground coriander, ground cumin, mustard seeds and turmeric, and cook for 1 min more. Add the tomatoes and wilted spinach and cook for another 3 mins, then add the potatoes.","Heat the grill to medium. Lightly beat the eggs with the chilli and most of the fresh coriander and pour over the potato mixture. Grill for 4-5 mins, or until golden and just set, with a very slight wobble in the middle.","Leave to cool, then slice into wedges. Mix the mango chutney, yogurt and remaining fresh coriander together. Serve with the frittata wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:13:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4173,4173,'en','Miso mushroom & tofu noodle soup','Rustle up this miso, mushroom and tofu noodle soup with just six simple ingredients. Healthy and low in calories, it makes a tasty light lunch or supper','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","70g mixed mushrooms, sliced","50g smoked tofu, cut into small cubes","½ tbsp brown rice miso paste","50g dried buckwheat or egg noodles","2 spring onions, shredded"]','["Heat half the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat. Add the mushrooms and fry for 5-6 mins, or until golden. Transfer to a bowl using a slotted spoon and set aside. Add the remaining oil to the pan and fry the tofu for 3-4 mins, or until evenly golden.","Mix the miso paste with 325ml boiling water in a jug. Cook the noodles following pack instructions, then drain and transfer to a bowl. Top with the mushrooms and tofu, then pour over the miso broth. Scatter over the spring onions just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4175,4175,'en','Saucy bean baked eggs','Make these five-ingredient baked eggs with tomatoes and beans using storecupboard staples. It''s a quick, easy, tasty and healthy dish','["2 x 400g cans cherry tomatoes","400g can mixed bean salad, drained","200g baby spinach","4 medium eggs","50g thinly sliced smoked ham, torn","wholemeal rye bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Tip the tomatoes and bean salad into an ovenproof frying pan or shallow flameproof casserole dish. Simmer for 10 mins, or until reduced. Stir in the spinach and cook for 5 mins more until wilted.","Heat the grill to medium. Make four indentations in the mixture using the back of a spoon, then crack one egg in each. Nestle the ham in the mixture, then grill for 4-5 mins, or until the whites are set and the yolks runny. Serve with rye bread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4177,4177,'en','Meatball marinara fries','Top oven-cooked fries with meatball marinara for a crowd-pleasing sharing platter. Ideal for an evening in with friends','["300g frozen French fries","½  tbsp olive oil","½  finely chopped onion","1 garlic clove, crushed","½  tsp chilli flakes","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp dried oregano","½  tbsp sugar","150g beef meatballs","40g grated mozzarella","40g grated cheddar"]','["Cook the French fries following pack instructions. Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in a frying pan and fry the onion for 10 mins. Add the garlic and chilli flakes, and fry for 5 mins more. Tip in the tomatoes, oregano and sugar, then simmer for 10 mins.","In another pan, fry the beef meatballs for 5 mins until browned, then add to the sauce and bubble for 5 mins, or until cooked through. Put the fries in a heatproof dish and top with the meatballs and sauce. Scatter over the mozzarella and cheddar. Grill for 2-3 mins until the cheese has melted. Season and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4179,4179,'en','Easy Singapore noodles','Cater for the whole family with our Singapore noodles. They''re healthy and vegan, making an ideal accompaniment to a Chinese meal or just on their own','["200g vermicelli rice noodles","1 tbsp mild curry powder","¼ tsp turmeric","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tbsp sesame oil","2½ tbsp low-salt soy sauce","1 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","1 onion, sliced","1 pepper, sliced (we used ½ green and ½ orange)","200g beansprouts","1 red chilli, sliced (optional)"]','["Boil the kettle and put the noodles in a large pan or bowl. Pour over enough boiled water to cover, pushing the noodles under the water to help them soften evenly. Set aside for 5-10 mins, until the noodles are completely soft. Mix the curry powder, turmeric, sugar, sesame oil, soy sauce and 1 tbsp water in a bowl.","Heat the wok until very hot. Add the sunflower oil, onion and pepper. Stir-fry for 3-4 mins until softened and starting to brown in places. Drain the noodles and add to the pan, along with the sauce mixture and beansprouts. Stir-fry for a further 3-4 mins, tossing everything through the sauce, until hot. Adjust the seasoning with a little more soy or sugar, if you like, and scatter over the chilli, if you like more spice."]','2026-01-10 12:13:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4181,4181,'en','Turkey cobb salad','Enjoy this turkey cobb salad as a healthy party platter to use up Christmas leftovers. It’s full of vibrant flavours like pancetta, avocado, eggs, chicory and tomatoes','["6 large eggs","50g (about 7) thin slices pancetta","50ml rapeseed oil","3 tbsp cider vinegar","1⁄2 tbsp Dijon mustard","1 tbsp finely chopped parsley","1 small garlic clove, finely grated","500g cooked turkey breast, sliced","3 heads of mixed chicory, leaves separated","2 medium avocados, peeled, stoned and sliced","4 medium tomatoes, quartered","2 tbsp mixed seeds"]','["Cook the eggs in a large pan of boiling water for 8 mins. Drain, transfer to a bowl of cold water and leave to cool.","Heat the grill to high. Put the pancetta on a baking sheet lined with foil and grill for 3-4 mins, or until crisp. Pat with kitchen paper to remove any excess oil and leave to cool.","Whisk the oil, vinegar, mustard, parsley and garlic together. Peel and halve the eggs.","Arrange the turkey, chicory, avocado, tomatoes, pancetta and eggs on a large platter. Drizzle over the dressing, season and serve with the seeds on the side for sprinkling over."]','2026-01-10 12:13:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4183,4183,'en','Creamy chicken stew','Cook this creamy, comforting stew to serve with our smashed mini jacket potatoes. This warming one-pot with chicken, peas and leeks is perfect for a special family meal','["3 leeks, halved and finely sliced","2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra if needed","1 tbsp butter","8 small chicken thighs","500ml chicken stock","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","75g crème fraîche","200g frozen peas","3 tbsp dried or fresh breadcrumbs","small bunch of parsley, finely chopped"]','["Tip the leeks and oil into a flameproof casserole dish on a low heat, add the butter and cook everything very gently for 10 mins or until the leeks are soft.","Put the chicken, skin-side down, in a large non-stick frying pan on a medium heat, cook until the skin browns, then turn and brown the other side. You shouldn’t need any oil but if the skin starts to stick, add a little. Add the chicken to the leeks, leaving behind any fat in the pan.","Add the stock to the dish and bring to a simmer, season well, cover and cook for 30 mins on low. Stir in the mustard, crème fraîche and peas and bring to a simmer. You should have quite a bit of sauce.","When you’re ready to serve, put the grill on. Mix the breadcrumbs and parsley, sprinkle them over the chicken and grill until browned."]','2026-01-10 12:13:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4185,4185,'en','Slow cooker turkey pho','Reduce food waste by using your leftover Christmas turkey to make stock – it’s great in our Asian-inspired pho noodle soup, full of fresh flavours','["50g ginger, thickly sliced","2 onions, halved","3 star anise","2 cinnamon sticks","½  tbsp coriander seeds","2 cloves","1 turkey or chicken carcass, all meat removed","2-3 tbsp fish sauce","2 tbsp sugar","200g flat rice noodles","400g cooked and sliced turkey or chicken","100g beansprouts, blanched, or shredded carrots, mooli or sprouts","handful of Thai basil, mint and coriander leaves","2 red chillies, finely sliced","1 lime, cut into wedges","hoisin sauce and sriracha sauce, to serve"]','["Fry the ginger and onion in a dry frying pan over a high heat until deeply coloured. Transfer to the slow cooker and heat to low. Fry the whole spices for a few mins until fragrant, then tip into the slow cooker. If pressed for time, simply put in the slow cooker without frying.","Add the carcass, then pour 3-4 litres boiling water into the cooker so the bones are covered, ensuring you don’t overfill it. Cover and cook for 8-10 hrs, depending on how long you can leave it.","Strain the stock, discarding the bones and spices. Season with the fish sauce and sugar. To freeze for later, leave to cool completely and freeze in an airtight container for up to three months. Keep warm in the slow cooker if serving immediately.","Cook the noodles following pack instructions, drain and divide between bowls. Top with the turkey and beansprouts or veg, then transfer the stock to a jug and pour over enough to fill the bowls (you will have extra, which you can freeze as above). Scatter over the herbs and chilli, then serve with the lime wedges and sauces."]','2026-01-10 12:13:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4187,4187,'en','Spinach & barley risotto','This creamy dish uses a can of barley to cut the cooking time to just 25 minutes. It''s a healthy, low calorie dinner option that provides three of your 5-a-day','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 large leek (315g), thinly sliced","2 garlic cloves, chopped","2 x 400g can barley, undrained","1 tbsp vegetable bouillon powder","1 tsp finely chopped sage","1 tbsp thyme leaves","160g cherry tomatoes, halved","160g spinach","50g finely grated vegetarian Italian-style hard cheese"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick pan and fry the leek and garlic for 5-10 mins, stirring frequently, until softened, adding a splash of water if it sticks.","Tip in the cans of barley and their liquid, then stir in the bouillon powder, sage and thyme. Simmer, stirring frequently, for 4-5 mins. Add the tomatoes and spinach and cook for 2-3 mins more until the spinach is wilted, adding a splash more water if needed. Stir in most of the cheese, then serve with the remaining cheese scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:13:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4189,4189,'en','Black bean tortilla with salsa','Make this frittata for a quick, easy and healthy lunch option, making the most of storecupboard ingredients and packing in three of your 5-a-day','["400g can chopped tomatoes","1 onion, finely chopped","1 red chilli, halved, deseeded and finely chopped","2 tsp smoked paprika","15g (½  pack) coriander, finely chopped","6 Kalamata olives, thinly sliced","½  lemon or lime, juiced","2 x 400g can black beans, drained","3 garlic cloves, finely grated","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","6 large eggs","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","4 generous handfuls of rocket"]','["Tip the tomatoes into a pan and stir in the onion, ½ the chilli and the smoked paprika. Cook over a low heat for 10 mins. Tip ¾ into a bowl, then stir in 2 tbsp of the coriander and the olives and lemon juice.","Meanwhile, heat the grill. Tip the beans into a bowl and stir in the remaining chilli, the garlic, cumin and coriander. Beat in the eggs, then add the reserved ¼ of the salsa and the remaining fresh coriander with a little salt to taste. Blitz a little using a hand blender or mash some of the beans with a potato masher.","Heat a 24cm non-stick pan with the oil. Pour in the bean mixture and leave to cook gently for 5-7 mins until the base is set, then grill for 5 mins. Tip out and cut into 4 wedges. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, serve two wedges with half of the remaining salsa and the rocket. Chill the rest for the following day."]','2026-01-10 12:13:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4191,4191,'en','Corn & split pea chowder','Cook this healthy vegan soup and pack in four of your 5-a-day along with bags of flavour from ginger, chillies, garlic, thyme and coconut yogurt','["200g dried yellow split peas","3 celery sticks (about 160g), sliced","1 thyme sprig, plus 1 tbsp thyme leaves","2 onions, halved and sliced (350g)","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","50g ginger, finely grated","2 red chillies, deseeded and sliced","3 large garlic cloves, chopped","1 large green pepper, chopped into small pieces","1 large potato (about 215g), unpeeled, cut into 1-2cm pieces","2 tbsp vegetable bouillon powder","320g frozen sweetcorn","150g dairy-free coconut yogurt"]','["Tip the split peas, celery and thyme sprig into a medium pan with 1 litre of boiling water, bring back to the boil and simmer, covered, for 25 mins.","Meanwhile, fry the onion in the oil in a large pan for 10 mins. Stir in the ginger, chilli and garlic. Tip in the pepper and potato, and pour in ½ litre boiling water with the bouillon and remaining thyme. Tip in the split pea mixture and corn, bring to the boil, then cover and simmer for 30-35 mins until the veg is tender.","Take out a third of the veg, then purée the rest in the pan with a hand blender. Return the veg to the pan with the yogurt, and stir well. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, eat two portions now, and cool then chill the rest for another day. Will keep in the fridge for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4193,4193,'en','Feta, beetroot & pomegranate salad','Enjoy something lighter for lunch with this bright salad. It''s low-calorie and full of flavour thanks to mint, parsley, cinnamon and cumin','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 tbsp pomegranate molasses","pinch of ground cinnamon","1 tsp cumin seeds, toasted","squeeze of lemon juice","handful of parsley, finely chopped","handful of mint leaves, torn","2 cooked beetroot, cut into thin wedges","30g feta, crumbled","handful of rocket leaves","½ romaine lettuce, torn into bite-sized pieces","20g pomegranate seeds"]','["Whisk the oil, pomegranate molasses, cinnamon, cumin seeds and lemon juice together in a bowl. Add 1 tbsp water to loosen, and season.","Toss in the herbs, beetroot, feta, rocket and lettuce, and toss to coat in the dressing. Sprinkle over the pomegranate seeds to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4195,4195,'en','Chipotle chicken tinga','Serve this chilli chicken with our tomato salsa, tortilla chips, guacamole and coriander for an easy midweek meal','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, sliced","2 large garlic cloves, crushed","2-3 tbsp chipotle chilli paste","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp light brown soft sugar","6 boneless, skinless chicken thighs","1 small red onion, finely chopped","3 ripe tomatoes, finely chopped","1 lime, zested and juiced","1 small bunch coriander, leaves and stalks finely chopped, plus extra leaves to serve","tortilla chips and guacamole, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick flameproof casserole dish or saucepan. Fry the onions with a pinch of salt for 10 mins, or until softened. Add the garlic and fry for 1 min more. Tip in the chipotle paste, tomatoes and sugar with half a can of water. Sit the chicken thighs in the sauce. Bring to a low simmer and cook, covered, for 20-25 mins, stirring often, until the liquid has reduced slightly and the chicken is cooked through.","Using two forks, shred the chicken and stir it back through the sauce. Season to taste. If the sauce is too thin, return to the heat and simmer for 5 mins until the sauce has reduced more. To freeze, leave to cool completely and transfer to large freezerproof bags.","To make the salsa, combine the red onion, tomatoes, lime zest and juice, coriander leaves and stalks. Season to taste. Serve the chicken with the tomato salsa, tortilla chips, guacamole and a scattering of coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4197,4197,'en','Chickpea tagine soup','Discover the rustic flavours of tagine in a soup. Packed with chickpeas, peppers and kale plus apricots for sweetness, this satisfying soup is super-healthy','["2 red peppers","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 red onion, thinly sliced","2 large garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground cumin","2 tbsp rose harissa paste","2 x 400g cans chickpeas, drained and rinsed","1½ l low-salt veg stock","150g kale, chopped","1 lemon, zested and juiced","50g dried apricots, finely chopped","1⁄2 small bunch parsley, finely chopped","fat-free natural yogurt, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the grill to its highest setting. Halve and deseed the peppers, then lay cut-side down on a baking sheet lined with foil. Grill for 10-15 mins, or until blistered and softened. Leave until cool enough to handle, then remove and discard the skins. Slice the roasted peppers into thin strips.","Heat the oil in a large saucepan over a low heat. Fry the onion for 8-10 mins until softened. Stir through the garlic, coriander, cumin and harissa paste and cook for 1 min more. Add the chickpeas and stock, bring to the boil and simmer for 15 mins, covered.","Stir the peppers through the soup with the kale, lemon zest and juice, and apricots and cook, covered, for another 5 mins. Ladle the soup into bowls and serve with the chopped parsley scattered over and a dollop of yogurt, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4199,4199,'en','Veggie okonomiyaki','Supercharge your diet with this vegetarian okonomiyaki with eggs, cabbage, pak choi and spring onions. It makes a healthy, low calorie lunch option','["3 large eggs","50g plain flour","50ml milk","4 spring onions, trimmed and sliced","1 pak choi, sliced","200g Savoy cabbage, shredded","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped, plus extra to serve","½ tbsp low-salt soy sauce","½ tbsp rapeseed oil","1 heaped tbsp low-fat mayonnaise","½ lime, juiced","sushi ginger, to serve (optional)","wasabi, to serve (optional)"]','["Whisk together the eggs, flour and milk until smooth. Add half the spring onions, the pak choi, cabbage, chilli and soy sauce. Heat the oil in a small frying pan and pour in the batter. Cook, covered, over a medium heat for 7-8 mins. Flip the okonomiyaki into a second frying pan, then return it to the heat and cook for a further 7-8 mins until a skewer inserted into it comes out clean.","Mix the mayonnaise and lime juice together in a small bowl. Transfer the okonomiyaki to a plate, then drizzle over the lime mayo and top with the extra chilli and spring onion and the sushi ginger, if using. Serve with the wasabi on the side, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4201,4201,'en','Beetroot latkes','Make beetroot the star ingredient with these healthy latkes which provide three of your 5-a-day. The purple root is packed full of vitamin C and folate','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","4 tbsp fat-free Greek yogurt","½  small bunch mint leaves, finely chopped","150g mixed rocket salad leaves","130g cherry tomatoes, halved","400g raw beetroot, peeled, trimmed and coarsely grated","1 large egg, beaten","1 tbsp plain flour","1 large garlic clove, grated","1 tsp caraway seeds","½  tsp ground cumin","1 lemon, zested"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Make the latkes by combining all of the ingredients.","Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan. Spoon in the mixture to make six round latkes. Fry for 4-5 mins on each side, then transfer to a baking sheet and bake for 10 mins.","Combine the yogurt and mint in a small bowl. Toss the salad leaves and tomatoes together, then serve the latkes with the mint yogurt and salad."]','2026-01-10 12:13:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4203,4203,'en','Harissa & lamb sausage rolls','Spice up your sausage rolls with the flavours of harissa, herbs and spices. They’re perfect picnic food for summer and a winner when you’re feeding a crowd','["600g lamb mince","2 tbsp shop-bought harissa, or use homemade (seeour recipe)","¼ tsp ground ginger","1⁄2 tsp ground cinnamon","1⁄2 tsp ground cumin","2 tbsp chopped coriander","1 garlic clove, grated","1 preserved lemon, rind finely chopped (discard the flesh)","plain flour, for dusting","325g ready rolled puff pastry","1 large egg, lightly beaten","2 tsp black sesame seeds (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Mix together the lamb, harissa (see our recipe), spices, coriander, garlic, preserved lemon and seasoning in a bowl. Pummel it with your hands to make sure it’s well combined.","Lightly dust your work surface with flour and lay the puff pastry on top. Cut it down the middle lengthways, then roll each piece with a rolling pin so each piece measures about 14 x 42cm.","Divide the lamb mixture into four and roll each one into a sausage shape using your hands. Lay two of them, end to end, on one of the pieces of pastry. Brush some egg along one of the long sides of the pastry, just by the edge. Pull up the other side to encase the sausage shapes and press the sides together. Do the same with the rest of the meat and pastry.","Cut each pastry parcel into four. Transfer these to a baking sheet, then brush each sausage roll with the egg and sprinkle over the sesame seeds, if using. Bake for 20-25 mins, or until the pastry is puffed up and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:13:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4205,4205,'en','Tomato, pepper & bean one pot','Make a batch of this stew at the weekend, then chill or freeze it in portions for easy midweek lunches. See our different toppings to keep it interesting','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","2 celery sticks, finely chopped","3 carrots, finely chopped","3 red peppers, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tbsp tomato purée","400g can cannellini beans, rinsed and drained","400g pinto beans, rinsed and drained","400g borlotti beans, rinsed and drained","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 vegetable stock cube (check the label if you’re vegan)","2 bay leaves","1 tbsp brown sugar","½  tbsp red wine vinegar"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan or casserole on a medium heat. Fry the onion, celery and carrots for 10 mins until soft and golden, then add the peppers and fry for another 5 mins.","Stir in the garlic for a minute, then add the tomato purée, all the beans and chopped tomatoes, then swirl out the tomato cans with a splash of water and add to the pan with the stock cube, bay leaves, sugar and vinegar. Season and simmer, uncovered, for 25 mins until the sauce reduces to coat the beans and the peppers are soft. Leave to cool before storing in transportable containers. Will keep in the fridge for 3 - 4 days or freeze in portions and defrost in the fridge overnight.Choose your toppingsSweet & spicyAdd diced dried apricots and 1 tbsp harissa. Top with yogurt swirled with more harissa, and toasted flaked almonds.Tex-MexStir in ½ - 1 tbsp chipotle paste, shredded leftover roast chicken if you have any, and top with diced avocado, grated cheddar and coriander.Smoky BBQ beansStir in 1 tbsp smoky BBQ sauce and crumble over shop-bought crispy bacon, a dollop of soured cream or yogurt, and some chopped herbs.Added greensStir in some spinach and top with a sliced boiled egg.Beans on toastServe the beans on toast or bread, add a dash of Tabasco or chilli flakes, crumble over feta and drizzle with olive oil.Italian-inspiredTop with toasted croutons, chopped rosemary, lemon zest and parmesan."]','2026-01-10 12:13:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4207,4207,'en','Miso broccoli, egg & quinoa salad','Pack a lunch that will power you through the afternoon with this healthy miso and lime-dressed salad with broccoli, peas, boiled egg and radishes. It''s tasty and full of goodness','["100g thin-stemmed broccoli spears","1 medium egg","2 tsp white miso paste","1 lime, juiced","125g cooked quinoa","70g frozen peas, defrosted","3 radishes, thinly sliced","½  tbsp sesame seeds"]','["Bring a pan of water to the boil. Add the broccoli and cook for 3 mins, then lift out with a slotted spoon and leave to cool. Lower the egg into the water and gently simmer for 6 mins. Drain and set in a bowl of cold water to cool.","Whisk the miso and lime juice in a small bowl, then toss with the quinoa, peas, radishes and cooked broccoli. Tip the salad into your lunchbox or an airtight container. Peel the egg, slice in half and arrange on top of the quinoa, then sprinkle with the sesame seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:13:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4209,4209,'en','Curried mango & chickpea pot','Make this spiced mango, red cabbage, spinach and chickpea salad as a speedy packed lunch for one. It''s not only tasty, but healthy too, delivering three of your 5-a-day','["200g chickpeas, drained and rinsed","2 tbsp fat-free Greek yogurt","½ lemon, juiced","1 heaped tbsp korma curry paste","½ carrot, julienned or grated","70g red cabbage, shredded","50g baby spinach, shredded","40g mango, finely diced","½  tsp nigella seeds","½ small red chilli, finely sliced (deseeded if you want less heat)"]','["Combine the chickpeas, yogurt, lemon and korma paste in a bowl, then toss with the carrot, cabbage, spinach and mango. Tip into your lunchbox or an airtight container and scatter with the nigella seeds and red chilli."]','2026-01-10 12:13:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4211,4211,'en','Easy beef in black bean sauce','Try this simple stir-fry using tender rump steak, peppers, ginger, chilli and garlic. Opt for a good quality black bean sauce  – it will make all the difference','["2 x 250g rump steaks","1 tbsp cornflour","2 tbsp sesame oil","1 large white onion, cut into thin wedges","1 red pepper, deseeded and sliced","1 green pepper, deseeded and sliced","2 fat garlic cloves, crushed","1 thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and grated","1-2 red chillies, finely chopped","5 tbsp black bean sauce","1 tbsp rice wine vinegar","2 tsp sugar","sticky rice, to serve","coriander leaves, to serve (optional)"]','["Remove the thick layer of fat running down the side of the steaks and discard. Slice the steak into 1cm-thick, long strips and toss with the cornflour and some seasoning.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan or wok over a high heat then add the steak, frying for 3-5 mins or until golden brown on the outside. Remove with a slotted spoon and transfer to a plate.","Add the onion and peppers to the pan and fry for 6-7 mins or until beginning to soften. Stir through the garlic, ginger and chilli and cook for a further min. Return the beef to the pan and stir through the black bean sauce, rice wine vinegar, sugar and 2 tbsp water to loosen a little. Bring to a simmer and then remove from the heat.","Serve the stir-fry in deep bowls with mounds of sticky rice and top with coriander, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4213,4213,'en','Baked piri-piri tilapia with crushed potatoes','A healthy low-fat, low-calorie fish dish that''s bursting with flavour as well as being rich in fibre, folate, iron and vitamin C','["600g small new potatoes","2 red peppers, cut into chunky pieces","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","drizzle of extra virgin olive oil","4 large pieces tilapia or cod","green salad, to serve","6 hot pickled peppers (I used Peppadew)","1 tsp chilli flakes","2 garlic cloves","juice and zest 1 lemon","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 tbsp smoked paprika"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Boil the potatoes until knife-tender, then drain. Spread out on a large baking tray and gently crush with the back of a spatula. Add the peppers, drizzle with the vinegar and oil, season well and roast for 25 mins.","Put the piri-piri ingredients in a food processor with some salt. Purée until fine, then pour into a bowl. Put the fish on a baking tray and spoon over some of the piri-piri sauce. Season and bake for the final 10 mins of the potatoes’ cooking time. Serve everything with the extra sauce and a green salad on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:13:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4215,4215,'en','Smoked mackerel maki rolls','Make your own sushi for a low-calorie lunch you can bring to work. Be the envy of the office with these mackerel and veg rolls, don''t forget the soy sauce!','["150g sushi rice","2 tsp rice wine vinegar","4 nori sheets","1 red chilli, deseeded and cut into matchsticks","½  carrot, peeled and cut into matchsticks","¼ cucumber, cut into matchsticks","100g smoked mackerel, skin removed, torn into small pieces","soy sauce, for dipping"]','["Put the rice in a small bowl, cover with cold water and massage the grains with your hands to remove the starch. Drain and repeat the process until the water runs clear.","Put the rice in a small saucepan with a tight-fitting lid. Cover with 2.5cm of cold water, put the lid on and simmer over a medium heat for 10 mins. Take off the heat and leave with the lid on for a further 15 mins. Stir through the vinegar, then leave to cool completely.","Fill a small bowl with cold water and lay out a sushi mat (about £1 from any large supermarket). Place a nori sheet, shiny-side down, on top of the sushi mat. Spread a quarter of the rice onto the nori, leaving a 1cm border at the top.","Put a quarter of the chilli and carrot in a line at the bottom of the rice. Place a quarter of the cucumber and mackerel in a strip along the centre.","Dampen the top border with a little water to help seal the roll. Fold the bottom edge of the seaweed over the first line of the filling, then use the sushi mat to roll up the maki. Repeat to make four rolls. Using a serrated knife, cut each roll into eight rounds. Serve with soy sauce for dipping. Want a little help with this recipe? Watch our how to make sushi video."]','2026-01-10 12:13:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4217,4217,'en','Asparagus & new potato frittata','A simple, low-calorie spring main that uses the season''s finest ingredients and is ready in just 20 minutes','["200g new potatoes, quartered","100g asparagus tips","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","6 eggs, beaten","40g cheddar, grated","rocket or mixed leaves, to serve"]','["Heat the grill to high. Put the potatoes in a pan of cold salted water and bring to the boil. Once boiling, cook for 4-5 mins until nearly tender, then add the asparagus for a final 1 min. Drain.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in an ovenproof frying pan and add the onion. Cook for about 8 mins until softened.","Mix the eggs with half the cheese in a jug and season well. Pour over the onion in the pan, then scatter over the asparagus and potatoes. Top with the remaining cheese and put under the grill for 5 mins or until golden and cooked through. Cut into wedges and serve from the pan with salad."]','2026-01-10 12:13:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4219,4219,'en','Miso aubergines','A really easy low-fat, low-calorie aubergine recipe with delicious umami flavours. This dish is so rich and meaty, it''s hard to believe it''s vegan!','["2 small aubergines, halved","vegetable oil, for roasting and frying","50g brown miso","100g giant couscous","1 red chilli, thinly sliced","½  small pack coriander, leaves chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. With a sharp knife, criss-cross the flesh of the aubergines in a diagonal pattern, then place on a baking tray. Brush the flesh with 1 tbsp vegetable oil.","Mix the miso with 25ml water to make a thick paste. Spread the paste over the aubergines, then cover the tray with foil and roast in the centre of the oven for 30 mins.","Remove the foil and roast the aubergines for a further 15-20 mins, depending on their size, until tender.","Meanwhile, bring a saucepan of salted water to the boil and heat 1 /2 tbsp vegetable oil over a medium-high heat in a frying pan. Add the couscous to the frying pan, toast for 2 mins until golden brown, then tip into the pan of boiling water and cook for 8-10 mins until tender (or following pack instructions). Drain well. Serve the aubergines with the couscous, topped with the chilli and a scattering of coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4221,4221,'en','Chipotle chicken tacos with pineapple salsa','A spicy, smoky chicken filling in soft tortillas, this moreish, low-calorie dinner is on the table in just 20 minutes','["500g skinless boneless chicken thighs","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 medium onion, chopped","2 tsp sweet smoked paprika","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tbsp cider vinegar","1 tbsp chipotle paste","200ml passata","2 tbsp soft brown sugar","½  small pineapple, cored, peeled and chopped","½  small pack coriander, chopped","corn or flour tortillas","hot sauce (I like Tabasco Chipotle), to serve"]','["In a food processor, roughly blitz the chicken thighs into chunky mince. Alternatively, chop into bite-sized pieces.","Heat the oil in a large saucepan. Add half the onion and the chicken mince. Season well and cook for about 5 mins on a high heat to brown, breaking up the meat with a spoon. Add the spices, vinegar, chipotle paste, passata and sugar. Cook for another 5 mins, then remove from the heat.","In a small bowl, mix the remaining onion, the pineapple and coriander. Serve the chicken and the pineapple salsa with warm tortillas and hot sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:13:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4223,4223,'en','Simple fish stew','This quick and healthy one-pot is packed with white fish fillets, king prawns, a rich tomato sauce and enough veg for 3 of your 5 a day','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp fennel seeds","2 carrots, diced","2 celery sticks, diced","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 leeks, thinly sliced","400g can chopped tomatoes","500ml hot fish stock","2 skinless pollock fillets (about 200g), thawed if frozen, and cut into chunks","85g raw shelled king prawns"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the fennel seeds, carrots, celery and garlic, and cook for 5 mins until starting to soften. Tip in the leeks, tomatoes and stock, season and bring to the boil, then cover and simmer for 15-20 mins until the vegetables are tender and the sauce has thickened and reduced slightly.","Add the fish, scatter over the prawns and cook for 2 mins more until lightly cooked. Ladle into bowls and serve with a spoon."]','2026-01-10 12:13:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4225,4225,'en','Greek-style roast fish','Oven-bake white fish fillets with potatoes, tomatoes and herbs for a healthy and gluten-free weeknight dinner','["5 small potatoes (about 400g), scrubbed and cut into wedges","1 onion, halved and sliced","2 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","½  tsp dried oregano or ½  tbsp chopped fresh oregano","2 tbsp olive oil","½  lemon, cut into wedges","2 large tomatoes, cut into wedges","2 fresh skinless pollock fillets (about 200g)","small handful parsley, roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the potatoes, onion, garlic, oregano and olive oil into a roasting tin, season, then mix together with your hands to coat everything in the oil. Roast for 15 mins, turn everything over and bake for 15 mins more.","Add the lemon and tomatoes, and roast for 10 mins, then top with the fish fillets and cook for 10 mins more. Serve with parsley scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:13:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4227,4227,'en','Warm chorizo & chickpea salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyFull of bold flavours like chorizo, dried tomatoes and red onion, this salad is bulked out with chickpeas to give 3 of your 5 a day','["280g pack cooking chorizo, sliced","1 large red onion, finely sliced","2 red peppers, deseeded and cut into strips","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","12 semi-dried tomatoes","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","100g bag rocket, to serve"]','["In a large frying pan, dry-fry the chorizo until golden for about 10 mins, then use a slotted spoon to scoop it from the pan and set aside.","Add the onion and peppers to the pan and soften in the chorizo fat for 10 mins. Stir in the chickpeas and tomatoes, warming through.","Pour in the red wine vinegar and season. Serve in bowls with handfuls of rocket on top."]','2026-01-10 12:13:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4229,4229,'en','Asian pulled chicken salad','Pull apart a ready-roasted chicken to whip up this healthy, vibrant, low-calorie dish in just 20 minutes','["1 small roasted chicken, about 1kg","½  red cabbage, cored and finely sliced","3 carrots, coarsley grated or finely shredded","5 spring onions, finely sliced on the diagonal","2 red chillies, halved and thinly sliced","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped, including stalks","2 heaped tbsp roasted salted peanuts, roughly crushed","3½  tbsp hoisin sauce","1½  tbsp toasted sesame oil"]','["Combine the dressing ingredients in a small bowl and set aside.","Remove all the meat from the chicken, shred into large chunks and pop in a large bowl. Add the cabbage, carrots, spring onions, chillies and half the coriander. Toss together with the dressing and pile onto a serving plate, then scatter over the remaining coriander and peanuts."]','2026-01-10 12:13:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4231,4231,'en','Lighter chicken cacciatore','The classic Italian ‘hunter’s stew’ gets a healthy makeover, with low-fat chicken breasts, prosciutto and a rich herby tomato sauce','["1 tbsp olive oil","3 slices prosciutto, fat removed, chopped","1 medium onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 sage sprigs","2 rosemary sprigs","4 skinless chicken breasts (550g total weight), preferably organic","150ml dry white wine","400g can plum tomatoes in natural juice","1 tbsp tomato purée","225g chestnut mushrooms, quartered or halved if large","small handful chopped flat-leaf parsley, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying pan. Tip in the prosciutto and fry for about 2 mins until crisp. Remove with a slotted spoon, letting any fat drain back into the pan, and set aside. Put the onion, garlic and herbs in the pan and fry for 3-4 mins.","Spread the onion out in the pan, then lay the chicken breasts on top. Season with pepper and fry for 5 mins over a medium heat, turning the chicken once, until starting to brown on both sides and the onion is caramelising on the bottom of the pan. Remove the chicken and set aside on a plate. Raise the heat, give it a quick stir and, when sizzling, pour in the wine and let it bubble for 2 mins to reduce slightly.","Lower the heat to medium, return the prosciutto to the pan, then stir in the tomatoes (breaking them up with your spoon), tomato purée and mushrooms. Spoon 4 tbsp of water into the empty tomato can, swirl it around, then pour it into the pan. Cover and simmer for 15-20 mins or until the sauce has thickened and reduced slightly, then return the chicken to the pan and cook, uncovered, for about 15 mins or until the chicken is cooked through. Season and scatter over the parsley to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4233,4233,'en','Courgetti Bolognese','Spiralized courgettes make a healthier alternative to pasta in the classic spaghetti Bolognese – use turkey mince for a low-calorie sauce','["2 tbsp olive oil","500g turkey mince (thigh or breast)","1 large onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 large carrots, peeled and diced","150g pack button mushrooms, roughly chopped","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","2 chicken stock cubes","1 tbsp soy sauce","4 large courgettes","grated pecorino or Parmesan, to serve","handful basil leaves"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the olive oil in a large saucepan and add the turkey mince. Fry until browned, then scoop into a bowl and set aside.","Add the onion to the pan and cook on a low heat for 8-10 mins until tender. Then add the garlic, stirring for 1 min or so, followed by the carrot and the mushrooms, stirring for about 3 mins, until softened. Tip the turkey mince back into the pan, add the tomato purée, give everything a quick stir and tip in the chopped tomatoes. Fill 1 can with water and pour into the pan. Crumble over the chicken stock cubes and bring to the boil. Once boiling, lower the heat and simmer for about 1 hr, until the sauce has thickened and the veg is tender.","When the Bolognese is nearly ready, stir through the soy sauce and some seasoning. Spiralize your courgettes on the large noodle attachment. Heat a large frying pan with the remaining 1 tbsp olive oil and add your courgetti. Cook until slightly softened, for 2-3 mins. Season with salt and serve topped with the turkey Bolognese, grated pecorino and basil leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4235,4235,'en','Spiralized Singapore noodles','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyVegetable noodles not only bring this dish up to 4 of your 5 a day, they also slash the calories and boost the nutrition of this spicy supper','["1 large mooli (daikon radish), 2 courgettes or 3 carrots","2 tsp coconut oil, or vegetable oil","thumb-sized piece ginger, chopped","1 fat red chilli, ½  finely chopped, ½  thinly sliced into rings","2 fat garlic cloves, crushed","6 spring onions, finely sliced","1½  tbsp curry powder","2 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp teriyaki sauce","150g pack raw prawns, roughly chopped","100g cooked ham, shredded","2 large handfuls beansprouts","coriander, to serve","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Use a spiralizer or julienne peeler to create vegetable noodles – use the large noodle attachment. Set aside.","Heat the oil in a wok over a high heat. When hot add the ginger, chopped chilli, garlic and spring onions, stir-fry for 30 secs-1 min until just softened. Add the curry powder, soy sauce, teriyaki, prawns and ham and cook for another 2 mins, until the prawns turn pink.","Add the vegetable noodles and beansprouts, stir around the pan for 1 min more until the noodles have softened a little but still have a nice bite – don’t cook for too long or they will turn watery. Serve scattered with coriander and the sliced chilli, with lime wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:13:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4237,4237,'en','Prawn, fennel & rocket risotto','This prawn and fennel risotto gets a little extra kick from lemon zest and and rocket – perfect for a dinner party','["1.2l vegetable stock","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","1 large garlic clove, finely chopped","1 small fennel bulb, cored and finely chopped","300g risotto rice","300g peeled raw king prawns","1 lemon, ½  zested and 1 tbsp juice","70g bag rocket"]','["Put the stock in a large saucepan, bring to the boil, then lower to a simmer. Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large saucepan. Add the onion, garlic and fennel, and cook on a low heat for 10 mins until the vegetables have softened but not coloured. Add the rice and stir for 2 mins until the grains are hot and making crackling sounds. Increase the heat to medium and start adding the stock, a ladleful at a time, stirring constantly and making sure the stock has absorbed into the rice before adding the next ladleful.","When the rice is almost cooked, add the prawns, lemon zest and some seasoning. Continue adding stock and cooking for another 3-4 mins until the prawns are pink and the rice is cooked. Remove from the heat and stir through the rocket and lemon juice. Check the seasoning, leave the risotto to sit in the pan for 2 mins, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4239,4239,'en','Egg & rocket pizzas','Use seeded tortillas as pizza bases for a quick and healthy lunch – crack an egg in the centre and bake to boost protein intake','["2 seeded wraps","a little olive oil, for brushing","1 roasted red pepper, from a jar","2 tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp chopped dill","2 tbsp chopped parsley","2 eggs","65g pack rocket","½  red onion, very thinly sliced"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Lay the tortillas on two baking sheets, brush sparingly with the oil then bake for 3 mins. Meanwhile chop the pepper and tomatoes and mix with the tomato purée, seasoning and herbs. Turn the tortillas over and spread with the tomato mixture, leaving the centre free from any large pieces of pepper or tomato.","Break an egg into the centre then return to the oven for 10 mins or until the egg is just set and the tortilla is crispy round the edges. Serve scattered with the rocket and onion."]','2026-01-10 12:13:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4241,4241,'en','Red lentil & carrot soup','This warming and budget-friendly vegetarian soup is perfect packed in a flask for lunch. It''s also easy to double the quantities and freeze half for later','["1 white onion, finely sliced","2 tsp olive oil","3 garlic cloves, sliced","2 carrots, scrubbed and diced","85g red lentils","1 vegetable stock cube, crumbled","generous sprigs parsley, chopped (about 2 tbsp) plus a few extra leaves"]','["Put the kettle on to boil while you finely slice the onion. Heat the oil in a medium pan, add the onion and fry for 2 mins while you slice the garlic and dice the carrots. Add them to the pan, and cook briefly over the heat.","Pour in 1 litre of the boiling water from the kettle, stir in the lentils and stock cube, then cover the pan and cook over a medium heat for 15 mins until the lentils are tender. Take off the heat and stir in the parsley. Ladle into bowls, and scatter with extra parsley leaves, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4243,4243,'en','Seafood paella','This impressive Spanish one pot, with monkfish, king prawns and mussels, is perfect for feeding a crowd at a dinner party','["20-24 raw shell-on king prawns","2 tbsp olive oil","500g monkfish, cut into chunks","1 large onion, finely chopped","500g paella rice","4 garlic cloves, sliced","2 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp cayenne pepper (optional)","pinch of saffron","½  x 400g can chopped tomatoes (save the rest for the stock, below)","500g mussels, cleaned","100g frozen peas","100g frozen baby broad beans","handful parsley leaves, roughly chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, roughly chopped","½  x 400g can chopped tomatoes","6 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","1 chicken stock cube","1 star anise"]','["Peel and de-vein the prawns, reserving the heads and shells. Return the prawns\r\nto the fridge.","To make the stock, heat the oil in a large pan over a medium-high heat and add the onion, tomatoes, garlic, and reserved prawn shells and heads. Cook for 3-4 mins, then pour in 2 litres of water and add the stock cube and star anise. Bring to a boil, then simmer for 30 mins. Leave to cool slightly, then whizz in batches in a blender or food processor. Strain through a fine sieve.","Heat the oil in a large paella pan or an extra-large frying pan. Brown the monkfish for a few mins each side, then remove and set aside. Add the onion and fry for 4-5 mins until softened.","Stir in the rice and cook for 30 secs to toast. Add the garlic, paprika, cayenne (if using) and saffron, cook for another 30 secs, then stir in the tomatoes and 1.5 litres of the fish stock. Bring to the boil, then turn down to a simmer and cook, stirring, for about 10 mins (the rice should still be al dente). Return the monkfish to the pan with the prawns, mussels, peas and broad beans.","Cover the pan with a large baking tray, or foil, and cook on a low heat for another 10-15 mins until the mussels are open and the prawns are cooked through. Scatter over the parsley before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4245,4245,'en','Chicken, broccoli & beetroot salad with avocado pesto','This superfood supper is packed with ingredients to give your body a boost, such as red onion, nigella seeds, walnuts, rapeseed oil and lemon','["250g thin-stemmed broccoli","2 tsp rapeseed oil","3 skinless chicken breasts","1 red onion, thinly sliced","100g bag watercress","2 raw beetroots (about 175g), peeled and julienned or grated","1 tsp nigella seeds","small pack basil","1 avocado","½  garlic cloves, crushed","25g walnut halves, crumbled","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","juice and zest 1 lemon"]','["Bring a large pan of water to the boil, add the broccoli and cook for 2 mins. Drain, then refresh under cold water. Heat a griddle pan, toss the broccoli in 1?2 tsp of the rapeseed oil and griddle for 2-3 mins, turning, until a little charred. Set aside to cool. Brush the chicken with the remaining oil and season. Griddle for 3-4 mins each side or until cooked through. Leave to cool, then slice or shred into chunky pieces.","Next, make the pesto. Pick the leaves from the basil and set aside a handful to top the salad. Put the rest in the small bowl of a food processor. Scoop the flesh from the avocado and add to the food processor with the garlic, walnuts, oil, 1 tbsp lemon juice, 2-3 tbsp cold water and some seasoning. Blitz until smooth, then transfer to a small serving dish. Pour the remaining lemon juice over the sliced onions and leave for a few mins.","Pile the watercress onto a large platter. Toss through the broccoli and onion, along with the lemon juice they were soaked in. Top with the beetroot, but don’t mix it in, and the chicken. Scatter over the reserved basil leaves, the lemon zest and nigella seeds, then serve with the avocado pesto."]','2026-01-10 12:13:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4247,4247,'en','Paillard of chicken with lemon & herbs','Pounding meat until thin and flat is a great technique for barbecued chicken breast, as it ensures it won’t dry out. Try this version with lemon and herbs.','["6 skinless chicken breasts","2 tbsp olive oil","1?2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","140g bag rocket","25g Parmesan","lemon wedges","2 garlic cloves","3 rosemary sprigs, leaves finely chopped","6 sage leaves, finely shredded","zest 1 lemon and juice of ½","3 tbsp olive oil"]','["Place each chicken breast between 2 sheets of cling film or baking parchment. Use a meat mallet or rolling pin to\r\nbash each piece of chicken – flatten out to an even layer about 0.5cm thick. Transfer to a dish.","To make the marinade, crush the garlic with a good pinch of salt using a pestle and mortar. Add the rosemary and sage, and give everything a good pounding. Stir through the lemon zest and juice, olive oil and some ground black pepper. Pour the marinade over the chicken, ensuring that it’s well coated. Cover and chill for at least 2 hrs.","Heat the barbecue. Once the flames have died down, spread the coals out to an even layer. Cook the chicken for 1-2 mins each side. Transfer to a board and leave to rest for a few mins.","Meanwhile, pour the oil and balsamic vinegar into a large bowl. Add the rocket and some seasoning. Toss together, then shave over the Parmesan. Serve the salad with the chicken, with lemon wedges to squeeze over."]','2026-01-10 12:13:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4249,4249,'en','Chinese poached chicken & rice','A healthy Asian-inspired dish ideal for an easy dinner. Use the leftovers to make our cold chicken noodle salad for the next day.','["large piece of ginger, 1 tbsp finely grated, the rest sliced","3 garlic cloves","1 tsp black peppercorns","1 tbsp soy sauce, plus 2-3 tsp (optional)","8 chicken legs","3 tbsp sesame oil","2 bunches spring onions, chopped","4 pak choi, halved","cooked long-grain rice, to serve"]','["Put the sliced ginger, the garlic, peppercorns and half the soy in a large pan with the chicken legs. Add enough water to cover, and season with a little salt. Bring to the boil, then reduce to a low simmer, put on the lid and poach for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, heat a pan and add the sesame oil and spring onions. Soften for 1 min, then remove from the heat and stir in the grated ginger and remaining soy sauce to make a relish.","When the chicken is ready, remove from the pan, set aside 4 of the legs and chill for tomorrow. Add the pak choi to the poaching liquid and cook for 3-4 mins. Strain the poaching liquid to remove the ginger, garlic and peppercorns, reserving the liquid. Pull the skin from the remaining 4 chicken legs and discard. Tear the meat into thick pieces. Serve in bowls with rice, the pak choi, a ladle of the hot chicken broth, the spring onion relish and extra soy sauce, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4251,4251,'en','Creamy tomato risotto','A budget rice dish flavoured with rosemary, basil and sweet cherry tomatoes. An ideal midweek supper','["400g can chopped tomatoes","1l vegetable stock","knob of butter","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 rosemary sprig, finely chopped","250g risotto rice","300g cherry tomatoes, halved","small pack basil, roughly torn","4 tbsp grated Parmesan"]','["Tip the chopped tomatoes and half the stock into a food processor and pulse until smooth. Pour into a saucepan with the remaining stock, bring to a gentle simmer and keep over a low heat.","Meanwhile, place the butter and oil in the base of a large saucepan and heat gently until the butter has melted. Add the onion and gently cook for 6-8 mins until softened. Stir in the garlic and rosemary, then cook for 1 min more. Add the rice and cook, stirring, for 1 min.","Start adding the hot stock and tomato mixture about a quarter at a time. Let the risotto cook, stirring often, adding more stock as it is absorbed. After you have added half the stock, add the cherry tomatoes. After 20-25 mins, the rice should be creamy and tender, the cherry tomatoes softened and all of the stock should be used up.","Cover and leave for 1 min, then stir in the basil. Serve sprinkled with Parmesan and a good grinding of black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:13:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4253,4253,'en','Roast sea bass & vegetable traybake','Apply a no-fuss touch to fish in this all-in-one Italian-inspired bake with crispy potatoes, roasted peppers and olives','["300g red-skinned potatoes, thinly sliced into rounds","1 red pepper, cut into strips","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 rosemary sprig, leaves removed and very finely chopped","2 sea bass fillets","25g pitted black olives, halved","½  lemon, sliced thinly into rounds","handful basil leaves"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Arrange the potato and pepper slices on a large non-stick baking tray. Drizzle over 1 tbsp oil and scatter with the rosemary, a pinch of salt and a good grinding of pepper. Toss everything together well and roast for 25 mins, turning over halfway through, until the potatoes are golden and crisp at the edges.","Arrange the fish fillets on top and scatter over the olives. Place a couple of lemon slices on top of the fish and drizzle with the remaining oil. Roast for further 7-8 mins until the fish is cooked through. Serve scattered with basil leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4255,4255,'en','Chilli-stuffed peppers with feta topping','A satisfying vegetarian supper that packs in 4 of your 5-a-day. Stuff peppers with cream cheese, beans, aubergine and feta','["2 large peppers, halved, deseeded but stalks left on","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 red onion, halved and sliced","1 garlic clove, finely grated","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 small aubergine, cut into small cubes","220g can kidney beans (don''t drain them)","small bunch coriander, chopped","1 large egg","25g low-fat feta cheese, finely grated","50g low-fat fromage frais","2 handfuls rocket","lime wedges, for squeezing over"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Place the pepper halves in a shallow baking dish, skin-side up, and roast for 15-20 mins.","Meanwhile, tip the spices into a pan and warm briefly to release their flavour. Tip in the tomatoes and stir in the onion, garlic, chilli, aubergine and kidney beans with their juice. Cover the pan and cook for 20 mins, stirring occasionally. Try not to add any extra liquid; the mixture should be quite dry. Stir in the coriander.","Meanwhile, beat the egg with the feta and fromage frais. Turn the peppers over and pile the aubergine mixture into each one, packing it down as much as you can. Top with the feta mixture and return to the oven for 10 mins more until the topping has lightly set. Don’t worry if some of it flows off, as it will just set in the dish. Serve the peppers on the rocket with lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:13:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4257,4257,'en','Sesame chicken salad','A fresh and healthy Asian-style salad with Thai basil and coriander, soya beans, carrots and tomatoes','["2 skinless chicken breasts","85g frozen soya beans","1 large carrot, finely cut into thin matchsticks","4 spring onions, finely sliced","140g cherry tomatoes, halved","small bunch coriander, chopped","small handful Thai or ordinary basil leaves, chopped if large","85g herb or baby salad leaves","1 tsp toasted sesame seeds","grated zest and juice 1 small lime","1 tsp fish sauce","1 tsp sesame oil","2 tsp sweet chilli sauce"]','["Put the chicken in a pan and pour over cold water to cover. Tip the soya beans into a steamer. Bring the pan to a gentle simmer, then cook the chicken for 8 mins with the beans above.","Meanwhile, mix the dressing ingredients in a large bowl. When the chicken is cooked, slice and toss in the dressing along with the beans, carrot, onions, tomatoes, coriander and basil. Mix really well, pile onto the salad leaves and sprinkle with the sesame seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:13:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4259,4259,'en','Puy lentils with smoked tofu','Benefit from the slow-release energy of lentils and wholegrains combined with the rich flavour of smoked tofu, paprika and sweet peppers','["1-cal oil spray","1 large courgette, finely diced","100g smoked tofu, finely diced","½  tsp smoked paprika","1½  tbsp balsamic vinegar","250g sachet cooked puy lentils","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 medium roasted red pepper from a jar (not in oil), about 85g, sliced","good handful pea shoots or rocket"]','["Spray a non-stick pan with 3 sprays of oil and add the courgettes, tofu and smoked paprika. Cook for a few mins to soften the courgettes. Stir in the balsamic vinegar and allow to sizzle and reduce.","Meanwhile, tip the lentils, onion and pepper into a bowl and toss gently to break up any clumps of lentils. Add the tofu and courgettes, and toss again. Will keep for 2 days in the fridge. Scatter over the pea shoots just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4261,4261,'en','Chunky butternut mulligatawny','This spicy soup with basmati rice and apples is chunky, warming and wholesome – plus its low in fat and calories to boot.','["2 tbsp olive or rapeseed oil","2 onions, finely chopped","2 dessert apples, peeled and finely chopped","3 celery sticks, finely chopped","½  small butternut squash, peeled, seeds removed, chopped into small pieces","2-3 heaped tbsp gluten-free curry powder (depending on how spicy you like it)","1 tbsp ground cinnamon","1 tbsp nigella seeds (also called black onion or kalonji seeds)","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1½ l gluten-free chicken or vegetable stock","140g basmati rice","small pack parsley, chopped","3 tbsp mango chutney, plus a little to serve, if you like (optional)","natural yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in your largest saucepan. Add the onions, apples and celery with a pinch of salt. Cook for 10 mins, stirring now and then, until softened. Add the butternut squash, curry powder, cinnamon, nigella seeds and a grind of black pepper. Cook for 2 mins more, then stir in the tomatoes and stock. Cover with a lid and simmer for 15 mins.","By now the vegetables should be tender but not mushy. Stir in the rice, pop the lid back on and simmer for another 12 mins until the rice is cooked through. Taste and add more seasoning if needed. Stir through the parsley and mango chutney, then serve in bowls with yogurt and extra mango chutney on top, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4263,4263,'en','Spiced Singapore noodles with cauliflower, chicken & prawns','A lean Asian-style rice noodle stir-fry flavoured with soy, chilli and coriander and packed with vegetable goodness','["juice ½ lemon","2 tbsp medium curry powder","300g cauliflower florets","100g skinless chicken breasts, diced","100g spring onions, whites and greens separately sliced","200g white cabbages, cut into chunks","25g fresh red chillies, finely chopped","100g straight-to-wok fine rice noodles (we used Amoy)","50g raw peeled prawns, chopped","1 tbsp soy sauce","½  tsp golden caster sugar","5g coriander leaves"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLine a baking tray with baking\r\nparchment. Mix the lemon juice with\r\n½ tbsp of the curry powder and toss\r\nwith the cauliflower on the baking\r\ntray. Roast for 25-30 mins until tender\r\nand slightly golden.","Heat a non-stick wok or frying pan\r\nand add the chicken, spring onion whites,\r\ncabbage, red chilli, remaining curry\r\npowder and a splash of water. Fry,\r\nadding splashes of water if it starts\r\nsticking or looking dry, until the chicken\r\nis cooked through and the cabbage is\r\nsoftening. Add the noodles, prawns,\r\nsoy sauce and sugar, and fry for another\r\nfew mins until piping hot and the prawns\r\nare cooked. Scatter over the spring\r\nonion greens, roasted cauliflower and\r\ncoriander leaves, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4265,4265,'en','Superhealthy salmon burgers','If you''re after something a bit lighter than potato-packed fishcakes, try these simple oriental-style burgers','["4 boneless, skinless salmon fillets, about 550g/1lb 4oz in total, cut into chunks","2 tbsp Thai red curry paste","thumb-size piece fresh root ginger, grated","1 tsp soy sauce","1 bunch coriander, half chopped, half leaves picked","1 tsp vegetable oil","lemon wedges, to serve","2 carrots","half large or 1 small cucumber","2 tbsp white wine vinegar","1 tsp golden caster sugar"]','["Tip the salmon into a food processor with\r\nthe paste, ginger, soy and chopped coriander.\r\nPulse until roughly minced. Tip out the mix\r\nand shape into 4 burgers. Heat the oil in a\r\nnon-stick frying pan, then fry the burgers for\r\n4-5 mins on each side, turning until crisp\r\nand cooked through.","Meanwhile, use a swivel peeler to peel\r\nstrips of carrot and cucumber into a bowl.\r\nToss with the vinegar and sugar until the\r\nsugar has dissolved, then toss through the\r\ncoriander leaves. Divide the salad between\r\n4 plates. Serve with the burgers and rice."]','2026-01-10 12:13:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4267,4267,'en','Quinoa tabbouleh','Enjoy this nutrient-packed salad, with juicy tomatoes and cucumber, as a delicious and healthy lunch','["200g quinoa","juice 1-2 lemons","4 tbsp olive oil","small bunch mint, chopped","small bunch flat-leaf parsley, chopped","bunch spring onions, sliced","½ cucumber, deseeded and diced","handful walnuts, chopped"]','["Rinse the quinoa well and place in a\r\npan with about double the volume of\r\nwater. Bring to the boil, cover, reduce\r\nthe heat and gently simmer for 10 mins\r\nor until the grain unwraps itself. Turn\r\noff the heat and leave to cool slightly,\r\nthen drain any remaining water.","Season the quinoa, stir in the lemon\r\njuice and oil and leave to cool fully. Stir\r\nin the other ingredients, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4269,4269,'en','Spicy chicken salad with broccoli','This chicken salad recipe is perfect with a fluffy jacket potato or some egg noodles and low-fat too','["2 broccoli heads, cut into florets","2 tbsp olive oil","5 shallots, finely sliced","handful pitted black olives","4 roast chicken breasts, sliced","4 tbsp soy sauce","2 red chillies, deseeded and sliced","2 garlic cloves, sliced"]','["Steam the broccoli for 4 mins until just\r\ntender, tip into a large bowl, then season.\r\nMeanwhile, heat the oil in a pan, then fry the\r\nshallots for 2 mins. Add the chillies and garlic,\r\nthen cook for a further 4 mins until softened.","Remove the shallots, chilli and garlic with\r\na slotted spoon, then mix with the broccoli,\r\nolives and chicken. Add the soy sauce to the\r\npan, warm over a medium heat, then pour\r\nover the salad. Eat warm or cold."]','2026-01-10 12:13:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4271,4271,'en','Superhealthy salmon salad','Superhealthy by name, superhealthy by nature: this salad is high in omega-3, iron and calcium and counts as 2 of your 5-a-day','["100g couscous","1 tbsp olive oil","2 salmon fillets","200g sprouting broccoli, roughly shredded, larger stalks removed","juice 1 lemon","seeds from half a pomegranate","small handful pumpkin seeds","2 handfuls watercress","olive oil and extra lemon wedges, to serve"]','["Heat water in a tier steamer. Season the \r\ncouscous, then toss with 1 tsp oil. Pour boiling \r\nwater over the couscous so it covers it by \r\n1cm, then set aside. When the water in the \r\nsteamer comes to the boil, tip the broccoli \r\ninto the water, then lay the salmon in the tier \r\nabove. Cook for 3 mins until the salmon is \r\ncooked and the broccoli tender. Drain the \r\nbroccoli and run it under cold water to cool.","Mix together the remaining oil and lemon \r\njuice. Toss the broccoli, pomegranate seeds \r\nand pumpkin seeds through the couscous \r\nwith the lemon dressing. At the last moment, \r\nroughly chop the watercress and toss through \r\nthe couscous. Serve with the salmon, lemon \r\nwedges for squeezing over and extra olive oil \r\nfor drizzling, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4273,4273,'en','Healthy fish & chips with tartare sauce','A perfectly healthy Friday night special meal for two, fish and chips','["450g potatoes, peeled and cut into chips","1 tbsp olive oil, plus a little extra for brushing","2 white fish fillets about 140g/5oz each","grated zest and juice 1 lemon","small handful of parsley leaves, chopped","1 tbsp capers, chopped","2 heaped tbsp 0% Greek yogurt","lemon wedge, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.\r\nToss chips in oil. Spread over a baking sheet in\r\nan even layer, bake for 40 mins until browned\r\nand crisp. Put the fish in a shallow dish, brush\r\nlightly with oil, salt and pepper. Sprinkle with\r\nhalf the lemon juice, bake for 12-15 mins. After\r\n10 mins sprinkle over a little parsley and lemon\r\nzest to finish cooking.","Meanwhile, mix the capers, yogurt, remaining parsley and lemon juice together, set aside and season if you\r\nwish. To serve, divide the chips between plates, lift the fish onto the plates and serve with a\r\nspoonful of yogurt mix."]','2026-01-10 12:13:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4275,4275,'en','Salmon & spinach with tartare cream','Ever-versatile salmon is as popular on our shopping lists as chicken. Make the most of it with this impressive recipe','["1 tsp sunflower or vegetable oil","2 skinless salmon fillets","250g bag spinach","2 tbsp reduced-fat crème fraîche","juice ½ lemon","1 tsp caper, drained","2 tbsp flat-leaf parsley, chopped","lemon wedges, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a pan, season the salmon\r\non both sides, then fry for 4 mins each side\r\nuntil golden and the flesh flakes easily. Leave\r\nto rest on a plate while you cook the spinach.","Tip the leaves into the hot pan, season\r\nwell, then cover and leave to wilt for 1 min,\r\nstirring once or twice. Spoon the spinach\r\nonto plates, then top with the salmon. Gently\r\nheat the crème fraîche in the pan with a\r\nsqueeze of the lemon juice, the capers and\r\nparsley, then season to taste. Be careful not\r\nto let it boil. Spoon the sauce over the fish,\r\nthen serve with lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:13:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4277,4277,'en','Spicy root & lentil casserole','The potatoes in this recipe take on the spicy flavours beautifully – our idea of the perfect veggie supper','["2 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","700g potatoes, peeled and cut into chunks","4 carrots, thickly sliced","2 parsnips, thickly sliced","2 tbsp curry paste or powder","1 litre/1¾ pints vegetable stock","100g red lentils","a small bunch of fresh coriander, roughly chopped","low-fat yogurt and naan bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and\r\ncook the onion and garlic over a\r\nmedium heat for 3-4 minutes until\r\nsoftened, stirring occasionally.\r\nTip in the potatoes, carrots and\r\nparsnips, turn up the heat and cook\r\nfor 6-7 minutes, stirring, until the\r\nvegetables are golden.","Stir in the curry paste or powder,\r\npour in the stock and then bring to\r\nthe boil. Reduce the heat, add the\r\nlentils, cover and simmer for 15-20\r\nminutes until the lentils and\r\nvegetables are tender and the\r\nsauce has thickened.","Stir in most of the coriander,\r\nseason and heat for a minute or\r\nso.Top with yogurt and the rest of\r\nthe coriander. Serve with naan bread."]','2026-01-10 12:13:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4279,4279,'en','Healthy egg & chips','One that dads will love! This any-time meal is perfect with a helping of baked beans','["500g potatoes, diced","2 shallots, sliced","1 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp dried crushed oregano or 1 tsp fresh leaves","200g small mushrooms","4 eggs"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Tip the\r\npotatoes and shallots into a large, non-stick\r\nroasting tin, drizzle with the oil, sprinkle over\r\nthe oregano, then mix everything together\r\nwell. Bake for 15 mins, add the mushrooms,\r\nthen cook for a further 10 mins until the\r\npotatoes are browned and tender.","Make four gaps in the vegetables and crack\r\nan egg into each space. Return to the oven\r\nfor 3-4 mins or until the eggs are cooked to\r\nyour liking."]','2026-01-10 12:13:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4281,4281,'en','The ultimate makeover: Salmon en croûte','Angela Nilsen makes a super healthy version of the classic pastry wrapped fish parcel without losing the wow factor','["3 tbsp olive oil","2 large shallots, finely chopped","140g chestnut mushrooms, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","juice ½ lemon","100g packet watercress, chopped","2 tbsp snipped dill","1 tbsp snipped chive","2½  tbsp half fat crème fraîche","6 sheets filo pastry each about 38 x 30cm (125g total weight)","2 x 350g skinned salmon fillets"]','["Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in a large non-stick frying pan. Tip in the shallots and fry for 2-3 mins to soften, then add the mushrooms and garlic, and stir-fry over a high heat for another 3-4 mins, or until the mushrooms and shallots are golden and any liquid from the mushrooms has evaporated. Pour in the lemon juice – after a few seconds, that should have evaporated too. Remove from the heat, then stir in the watercress so it wilts in the warmth from the pan (see step 1). Stir in the dill and chives, and season with a little salt and pepper. Leave to cool.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line a baking sheet with baking parchment. When the mushroom mix is cool, stir in the crème fraîche. Lay one of the filo sheets on the worktop with the short end facing you. Brush all over with a little of the remaining oil. Layer up 4 more of the filo sheets in the same way, brushing each with a little of the oil.","Lay one of the salmon fillets, skin-side up, across the width of the filo, positioning it about one-third of the way up. Season it with pepper. Spoon and spread the cooled mushroom mix over the top of the fillet (see step 2). Lay the other salmon fillet on top, skin-side down. Season again. Fold the short end of pastry nearest to you over the salmon, then bring the other end over to completely enclose the salmon (see step 3), lifting it so the join can tuck under it. Fold both pastry ends over as neatly as you can.","Brush the outside with a bit more of the remaining oil. Scrunch up the last sheet of filo, pressing it lightly on top in big folds (see step 4), then carefully brush with the last of the oil. Can be prepared 3-4 hrs ahead up to this point and chilled. Transfer the salmon parcel to the baking sheet. Bake for 25 mins until the pastry is crisp and golden. Check while it cooks and if the top starts to brown too quickly, lay a sheet of foil very loosely over it. Remove from the oven and let the salmon sit for 2-3 mins before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:13:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4283,4283,'en','Prawn & tomato stew with gremolata topping','A fish casserole with healthy prawns, topped with an Italian garnish of parsley and lemon zest – it’s low in fat and calories too','["500g new potatoes","2 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, sliced","4 celery sticks, cut into pieces","2 garlic cloves, chopped","2 anchovy fillets, chopped","pinch chilli flakes","400g can chopped tomatoes","250ml white wine","200ml vegetable stock","400g raw king prawns, peeled","zest and juice 1 lemon","1 tsp salted baby caper, rinsed","large handful parsley, chopped","toasted bread, to serve"]','["Put the potatoes in a saucepan of\r\ncold salted water and bring to the boil.\r\nReduce the heat to medium and simmer\r\nfor 15-20 mins or until cooked but still\r\nfirm. Drain and, when cool enough to\r\nhandle, thickly slice.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large\r\nsaucepan over a low-medium heat.\r\nAdd the onion, celery, garlic, anchovy\r\nand chilli, season and cook for 8 mins\r\nor until softened. Increase the heat\r\nto medium-high, add the tomatoes,\r\nwine and stock, and cook for 15 mins.\r\nAdd the prawns, lemon juice, capers\r\nand potatoes. Cook for 5 mins more,\r\nor until the prawns turn pink and are\r\njust cooked. Mix together the parsley and\r\nlemon zest, then scatter over the stew,\r\nthen serve with toasted bread, for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:13:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4285,4285,'en','Veggie spaghetti puttanesca','Sneak in an extra portion of veg in the form of the courgettes in this veggie version of puttanesca. Taking 35 minutes, it’s a low-fat and low-calorie lunch','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 onions (320g), finely chopped","320g courgettes, coarsely grated","3 large garlic cloves, crushed","¼-½ tsp chilli flakes (optional)","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp balsamic vinegar","1 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","8 Kalamata olives, stoned and halved lengthways","2 tbsp capers, drained","300g wholemeal spaghetti","15g flat-leaf parsley, finely chopped","40g vegetarian Italian hard cheese, finely grated"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan over a medium heat. Add the onions and fry for 5-8 mins until starting to colour. Add the courgette, garlic and chilli flakes, if using, and cook for a further 3-5 mins until the courgette starts to go very soft.","Stir in the tomatoes, a can full of water, tomato purée, the vinegar, bouillon, olives and capers, bring to a gentle simmer and cook, uncovered, for 15 mins.","Meanwhile, bring a large pan of salted water to the boil. Cook the spaghetti following pack instructions, then drain and toss with the sauce and parsley. If you''re following the Healthy Diet Plan, serve two portions with half the cheese scattered on top, and chill the rest for another day.Will keep chilled for up to three days. Reheat portions in themicrowaveuntil piping hot, or on the hob, covered, over a medium heat with a splash of water to loosen."]','2026-01-10 12:13:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4287,4287,'en','Salsa verde baked eggs','Dunk flatbreads into these salsa verde baked eggs to soak up the lovely juices. Healthy and low in calories, it takes just 15 minutes to make','["5 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp cumin seeds","400g can cherry tomatoes","200g fresh cherry tomatoes","2 garlic cloves","1 small bunch of parsley","1 small bunch of basil","½ small bunch of mint, leaves picked","2 tbsp capers","1 tsp Dijon mustard","2 tbsp white wine vinegar","200g baby spinach, washed","4 eggs","½ tsp chilli flakes (optional)","flatbreads, to serve (optional)"]','["Drizzle 1 tbsp of the olive oil in afrying panor skillet, and fry the paprika and cumin for 30 seconds over a medium heat. Add the canned tomatoes and fresh tomatoes, bring to the boil, then simmer with a lid on over a medium heat for 5-6 mins until the tomatoes have softened.","Meanwhile, put the garlic, most of the parsley, the basil, mint, capers, mustard, white wine vinegar, 4 tbsp oil and 3 tbsp cold water in amini food processorand blitz to a smooth paste. Season.","Stir the spinach into the pan with the tomatoes until wilted (put the lid back on for a few minutes, then stir again to help it wilt). Make four dips in the mixture and gently crack an egg into each one. Cover with a lid and cook over a medium heat for 6-8 mins, or until the eggs are just set. Uncover the pan, then drizzle over the herby sauce. Scatter over the reserved parsley and chilli flakes, if using. Serve with flatbreads, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4289,4289,'en','Miso steak with noodle salad','Looking for a quick, nutritious dish for busy days? Try our speedy, easy miso steak with a noodle and veg salad – it’s healthy, low in calories and tastes great','["2 garlic cloves, crushed","1tsp ginger","2 sirloin steaks (about 375g), trimmed of all visible fat, then cut into strips","1 1/2 tbsp brown miso paste","320g broccoli, stems thickly sliced, florets left whole","3 wholemeal noodles (132g dry weight)","1 1/2 tbsp brown miso paste","2tbsp lemon juice","3tbsp cider vinegar","2 tbsp ginger finely chopped","1 1/2 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, finely chopped","2 carrots (150g), cut into matchsticks","4 tomatoes, cut into wedges","1tbsp sesame seeds"]','["For the salad, simmer the broccoli in a large pan of boiling water for 3-4 mins. Meanwhile, cook the noodles following pack instructions, then drain both and set aside.","For the dressing,whiskthe miso paste in a large bowl with the lemon juice, vinegar, ginger and oil. Toss with the cooked broccoli, noodles, red onion, carrots, tomatoes and sesame seeds.","For the steak, heat awokor frying pan over a medium heat and briefly stir-fry the garlic and ginger until they begin to colour. Add the steak and stir-fry for a few minutes until brown. Pile half on top of the noodle salad. Add the miso to the wok with 2 tbsp water to lift the ginger and garlic from the pan, then spoon over the meat. Serve half and chill the rest for another day. You can enjoy the leftovers chilled or reheat in the microwave or oven until warmed through.Will keep chilled for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4291,4291,'en','Beetroot & feta pasta','Bring colour to your dinner table with our creamy beetroot and feta pasta. Packed with nutrients, it’s a satisfying veggie lunch or supper for the family','["2 large beetroots, peeled and roughly chopped into chunks","1 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, finely chopped","4 celery sticks, finely chopped, celery tops kept separate","4 carrots, peeled and finely chopped","1 small bunch of basil","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","400g wholemeal pasta","75g low-fat crème fraîche","100g feta"]','["Put a large pan of salted water on a high heat, bring to the boil and add the beetroot chunks. Boil for 5 mins, then transfer the beetroot to a plate using a slotted spoon. Set the pan of cooking water aside.","Meanwhile, put the olive oil in a large frying pan set over a medium heat, then add the onions, celery and carrots, and cook for 8 mins until softened.Finely chopthe basil stalks and celery tops, then add to the pan along with the garlic, and fry for another 30 seconds.","Tip the pasta into the pan of beetroot water and simmer for 13-15 mins (depending on what pasta you’re using) until just cooked but retaining a little bite. Drain, reserving 200ml of the pasta water and tip the pasta back into the pan.","Meanwhile, put the beetroot with half of the fried veg into the bowl of afood processorwith most of the basil leaves and the crème fraîche, then blitz until smooth. Gradually add the reserved pasta water to loosen until you have a thick mixture.","Stir this sauce through the pasta along with the remaining fried veg and some seasoning. Divide between bowls, crumble over the feta, then scatter with the remaining basil leaves. Grind over some black pepper, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4293,4293,'en','Spinach falafel & hummus bowl','Make this easy vegan salad bowl, with homemade spinach falafels and hummus served alongside pitta and salad. It’s packed with nutrients for a healthy supper','["150g baby spinach","1⁄2 cucumber, sliced","1 red onion, finely sliced","4 wholemeal pittas, toasted, to serve","150g baby spinach","400g can chickpeas, drained","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 tsp ground cumin","1⁄2 small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","2 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for rolling","400g chickpeas, drained","40ml olive oil, plus extra to serve","1 garlic clove, roughly chopped","1 lemon, juiced, plus extra to serve (optional)","2 tbsp tahini"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Line a baking sheet with non-stick parchment. Put all the falafel ingredients, except for the oil, in afood processorand season lightly. Pulse until you have a rough mix.","Oil your hands lightly, then take tablespoons of the falafel mix, roll into around 16 balls and put on the baking sheet. Press each one down slightly with the palm of your hand. Brush using the 1 tbsp oil and bake for 20-25 mins until firm and golden, turning halfway through.","While the falafel is cooking, make the hummus. Put all of the hummus ingredients into a food processor with 50ml of water and blitz until smooth and silky.","Put the spinach, cucumber, red onion and falafel in different sections of each bowl, alongside some hummus, then drizzle with the extra olive oil. Grind over some black pepper. Serve with the pittas on the side and more lemon for squeezing over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4295,4295,'en','Roasted teriyaki veg bowl','Enjoy a balanced vegan veg bowl featuring brown rice topped with colourful veg and chickpeas cooked in a teriyaki sauce. It delivers four of your 5-a-day','["300g long-stemmed broccoli","2 baby pak choi, quartered","2 red onions, cut into 3cm wedges","1 red pepper, deseeded and sliced","4 carrots, chopped into wedges","400g can chickpeas, drained","2 tbsp sesame or olive oil","4 tbsp teriyaki sauce","1 large thumb-size piece of ginger, grated","400g cooked brown rice","4 spring onions, finely sliced","1 tbsp toasted black and white sesame seeds"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Chop the broccoli stalks, leaving the florets whole, and put all of it in a large bowl. Add the pak choi, red onions, peppers, carrots, chickpeas (patted dry with kitchen paper), oil, 3 tbsp of the teriyaki sauce and the ginger. Toss until everything is coated and season lightly. Tip onto a large non-stick baking sheet in a single even layer, using two trays if needed.","Bake the veg for 35-40 mins, tossing halfway through until starting to brown. When there is 5 mins of cooking time left, heat up the rice. Divide the rice between the bowls and top with the roasted veg. Drizzle over the reserved teriyaki sauce and scatter with the spring onions and sesame seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:13:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4297,4297,'en','One-pan coconut dhal','Rustle up a versatile coconut dhal. It’s the most comforting vegan meal, all made in one pan, and it can also be used as a base to make other curries.','["300g red lentils","2 tbsp sunflower oil, plus extra for drizzling","2 onions, finely sliced","4 garlic cloves, crushed or finely chopped","thumb-sized piece of ginger, finely chopped","5 curry leaves (optional)","1 tsp mustard seeds","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp coriander powder","1 tsp turmeric","1 dried red chilli, left whole","1 tbsp tomato purée","400g can coconut milk","coriander leaves, sliced ginger and sliced green chilli, to serve"]','["Rinse the lentils until the water runs clear, then drain. Heat the oil in a large, shallow pan and cook the onions over a low heat for 10 mins until starting to brown, adding more oil if the pan looks dry. Add the garlic and ginger, and cook for another 30 seconds. Scatter in the curry leaves, if using, and all the spices and cook for a few minutes more, then stir in the tomato purée and cook for a minute longer.","Stir in the lentils, ensuring they’re well coated in the spices, then pour over the coconut milk and 850ml water. Bring to the boil, stirring occasionally, then simmer for about 30 mins until the lentils are soft and soupy. Scoop out the whole chilli and discard, then season generously with salt. The dhal can now be left to cool, then frozen in portions, or as one batch in a largeplastic container. Defrost completely before reheating in a pan over a low heat, adding more water to loosen if needed.","Serve with a sprinkling of the coriander, sliced ginger and chilli, and drizzle with a bit more oil."]','2026-01-10 12:13:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4299,4299,'en','Fridge-raid soup','Make this soup recipe your own using up any bits and bobs you have. Make a tomatoey soup with leftover veg, then finish it with flavourful toppings','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 carrots, finely chopped","2 sticks of celery, finely chopped","4 garlic cloves, crushed","1 thyme sprig","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 litre vegetable or chicken stock","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 x 400g cans cannelini beans, drained","a large handful of green veg (about 150g, use any seasonal veg you have – courgette, green beans, chard, spinach etc), roughly chopped","1 large potato, peeled and cut into 2cm cubes","chopped parsley, crumbled feta, torn olives, chilli flakes (optional), extra virgin olive oil, crusty bread"]','["Heat the oil in a largepanon a medium heat and cook the onion, carrot and celery until soft, about 10 mins, then add the garlic, thyme and tomato purée. Pour in the stock along with the tomatoes, reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 mins.","Add the cannelini beans, the green veg and potato pieces, along with a generous pinch of seasoning. Cover and simmer for another 15-20 mins or so until the veg is tender and the soup has thickened. Top with some parsley, crumbled feta, olives, chilli flakes (for those who like spice) and a drizzle of extra virgin olive oil. Serve with crusty bread on the side for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:13:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4301,4301,'en','Chorizo & chickpea summer stew','Combine tomatoes, chickpeas, red peppers and spinach with chorizo and smoked paprika to make this nutrient-packed family stew, rich in vitamin C and fibre','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 thyme sprigs","1 tbsp smoked paprika","200g chorizo ring, sliced into thin coins","1 tbsp sherry vinegar","600g cherry tomatoes, halved","450g jar roasted red peppers, drained and cut into large strips","100g spinach","2 x 400g cans chickpeas, drained","drizzle of extra virgin olive oil and crusty bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a largefrying panover a medium heat, add the garlic, thyme and smoked paprika, and stir for a few minutes, then tip in the chorizo and stir for another couple of minutes until its oil is released. Splash in the sherry vinegar and let it bubble for a minute or so.","Add the tomatoes, peppers, spinach and chickpeas along with 100ml water and a pinch of seasoning. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer and cook until the tomatoes have softened and there is a thickened sauce, about 15 mins. Adjust the seasoning and finish with a drizzle of extra virgin olive oil. Serve with crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:13:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4303,4303,'en','Pulled BBQ aubergine & black bean burgers','Get the kids to help you prep the veg for these family-friendly burgers. These veggie buns have all the comforting textures of meat but are completely vegan','["2 large aubergines, pricked all over with a fork","1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, thinly sliced","1 heaped tsp garlic granules","2 tsp smoked paprika","1 tbsp demerara sugar","1 tsp dried oregano","5 tbsp barbecue sauce","400g can black beans, drained","4 burger buns, toasted and lightly buttered","red onion or pink pickled onion, shredded lettuce, coleslaw and corn on the cob, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the grill to high and grill the aubergine, turning occasionally, until blackened and soft all over, about 20-30 mins. Set aside to cool.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large ovenproof pan over a medium heat, add the onion and fry until softened and golden, about 10 mins. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Peel the skin from the cooled aubergine and discard it, or scoop out the flesh using a spoon, then put in the pan with the onion. Add the garlic granules, paprika, sugar, oregano, 1 tsp sea salt and 1 tsp black pepper. Stir until aromatic, then mix in the barbecue sauce along with the black beans. Season and bake until the sauce is rich and thick, and the aubergine resembles pulled pork – about 10-15 mins.","Pile into the burger buns with the red onion or pink pickled onion and any other burger fillings you like. Enjoy with coleslaw and corn on the cob on the side, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4305,4305,'en','Meatball minestrone with pesto','Combine meatballs with minestrone soup to make this easy, filling one pot. It takes just 25 minutes from prep to plate so makes an ideal midweek meal','["1 tbsp olive oil","12 beef meatballs","1 carrot, chopped","1 celery stick, chopped","1 onion, chopped","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","1⁄2 tsp dried oregano","1 bay leaf","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can cannellini beans, rinsed and drained","100g pasta shapes or rice","800ml low-salt vegetable or chicken stock","dash of vinegar or pinch of sugar (optional)","4 tbsp pesto","1⁄2 small bunch of basil, leaves picked (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a largesaucepanand fry the meatballs all over until browned. Remove and set aside on a plate. Add the carrot, celery and onion to the pan, and fry for 10 mins until soft. Stir in the garlic, oregano and bay. Tip in the tomatoes, beans, pasta and stock. Bring to a simmer.","Add the meatballs back to the pan and cook until the pasta is tender and the meatballs are cooked through. Season, and add a dash of vinegar or a pinch of sugar to balance the acidity of the tomatoes, if you like. Ladle into four bowls, then swirl a spoon of pesto into each. Top with the basil to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4307,4307,'en','Barbecued broccoli, cauliflower & halloumi','Fire up the barbecue to make our broccoli, cauliflower and halloumi and couscous dish. It’s an easy summertime supper suitable for the whole family','["2 tomatoes, finely chopped","½ red onion, finely chopped","1 lemon, juiced","1 tsp cider vinegar","2 tsp dried oregano","1 cauliflower, cut into florets, stalks cut into 5cm pieces","1 broccoli, cut into florets, stalks cut into 5cm pieces","3 tsp olive oil","1 tsp smoked paprika","450g halloumi, cut into 2.5cm cubes","cooked couscous, to serve (optional)"]','["Mix the tomatoes, onion, lemon juice, cider vinegar, half the dried oregano and ½ tsp black pepper together in a bowl.","Light thebarbecue. Bring a pan of water to the boil and cook the cauliflower florets along with the stalk and broccoli stalk pieces for 3 mins. In the final minute, tip in the broccoli florets. Drain the veg, then toss with 2 tsp of the olive oil, the rest of the oregano and the paprika.","When the coals are ashen, arrange the veg pieces on the grill, cook for 2 mins, then move to a cooler part of the grill. Keep moving the veg around so it doesn’t burn.","Put the halloumi on the grill and cook for 1 min, then turn. Repeat until all sides are brown.","Tip all the veg and the halloumi into a serving bowl, drizzle with the remaining olive oil, season and serve immediately with couscous."]','2026-01-10 12:13:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4309,4309,'en','Coriander salmon with curried quinoa & pomegranate','You should aim to eat oily fish at least once a week, as the beneficial omega-3 fatty acids that support heart health can’t be made by your body','["120g quinoa, rinsed","320g fine green beans, trimmed and cut into thirds","15g pack coriander","15g fresh ginger, peeled and chopped","1 lemon, juiced","½ tsp ground cumin","1 green or red chilli, seeds removed and chopped","1 tsp ground coriander","4 wild skinless salmon steaks (460g)","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2-3 courgettes (320g), halved and sliced","2 red onions, finely chopped","2 tsp garam masala","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","400g can chickpeas, drained","150g pomegranate seeds"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Boil a saucepan of water, add the quinoa and cook for 5 mins. Add the beans, bring back to the boil, then simmer for 10 mins. Remove from the heat and leave to stand for 5 mins, then drain, rinse and drain again.","Meanwhile, blitz the fresh coriander, ginger, lemon juice, cumin, chilli and ground coriander in a small bowl using a hand blender. Arrange the salmon steaks on the baking sheet, then spread a teaspoon of the coriander mix on each one, saving the rest for later. Bake for 8-10 mins, depending on the thickness of the salmon.","Heat the oil in a non-stick pan and stir-fry the courgettes and onions for 8-10 mins over a medium heat until softened and starting to colour. Stir in the garam masala, bouillon powder and remaining coriander mixture, then add the chickpeas and cook for a minute. Tip into a serving bowl and stir through the cooled quinoa, green beans and pomegranate seeds. Spoon half onto two plates and flake over 2 of the salmon fillets.","Reserve the remaining two portions of quinoa salad and salmon to eat cold for lunch the next day, if you like.Will keep chilled for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4311,4311,'en','Chicken enchilada wraps','Use homemade wholemeal flatbreads instead of shop-bought tortillas in this recipe – perfect for wrapping up our lean spicy chicken. It counts as 3 of your 5-a-day, too','["90g wholemeal flour, plus extra for dusting","3 tsp rapeseed oil","120g bio yogurt","2 tsp mild chilli powder","1 garlic clove, finely grated","1 lime, zested and half juiced","1 red onion, halved and sliced","1 red pepper, deseeded and sliced","2 skinless chicken breasts, sliced (300g)","1 small avocado","15g fresh coriander, chopped"]','["Tip the flour into a small bowl. Mix 1 tsp of the oil with 60ml water, add to the flour and stir with the blade of a cutlery knife until the mixture starts to come together. Use your hands to bring the mixture into a ball, then halve and cover with a tea towel.","Mix 2 tbsp of the yogurt with the chilli powder, garlic and lime zest, then tip in the onion, pepper and chicken and stir well to coat. Heat the remaining oil in a large non-stick pan over a medium heat, add the chicken mixture and cook, stirring every now and then, for about 10 mins.","Meanwhile, lightly flour the work surface and heat a very large non-stick frying pan over a medium heat, but don’t add any oil. Roll out one of the balls of dough to a rough circle about 25cm across until it is paper thin, then carefully peel off the work surface and slap into the frying pan. The dough will cook within a minute, then flip over and cook for a few seconds more. Lift onto a plate and cook the other ball of dough in the same way.","Roughly mash the avocado with the lime juice and spread over the flatbreads, top with the chicken mixture and remaining yogurt and scatter over the coriander. Roll up the enchiladas and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4313,4313,'en','Pasta salad with tuna mayo','This is quick to throw together and perfect as a lunchbox feast whether you’re on a picnic or at your desk.','["250g wholemeal penne","240g bio yogurt","2 tsp English mustard powder","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","4tsp apple cider vinegar","1 red onion, finely chopped","handful of basil leaves, finely chopped","320g tuna in spring water","2 red peppers, deseeded and diced","340g can sweetcorn, drained"]','["Boil the pasta for 10 mins until al dente, then drain and rinse under cold running water. Drain again. Meanwhile, mix the yogurt, mustard, olive oil, vinegar, onion and basil together in a large bowl, then stir in the tuna, red peppers and sweetcorn.","Stir through the pasta and serve in bowls or pack into containers for work or a picnic.Will keep, covered, in the fridge to eat the next day."]','2026-01-10 12:13:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4314,4314,'en','Porridge plus','Start off the day with a warm tummy – this porridge is packed with energy-giving oats and fat-free Greek yogurt','["enough porridge oats for 1","semi-skimmed milk","fat-free Greek yogurt","banana, sliced","hazelnuts, roughly chopped","honey"]','["Make porridge with semi-skimmed milk according to the packet instructions.","Top with fat-free Greek yogurt, sliced banana and roughly chopped hazelnuts, and drizzle with honey."]','2026-01-10 12:13:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4315,4315,'en','Quinoa salad with eggs & dill','Quinoa is a complete protein that contains all eight essential amino acids. Enjoy it here as part of a salad','["120g quinoa, rinsed","6 eggs","320g asparagus, woody ends trimmed and halved if too long","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 tsp apple cider vinegar","6 spring onions, finely chopped","2 tbsp chopped dill","2 tbsp chopped basil, plus a few leaves to serve","15g capers, rinsed","320g cherry tomatoes, halved"]','["Boil the quinoa in plenty of water for 20 mins. Leave for 5 mins, then rinse and drain well. Meanwhile, boil the eggs for 7 mins in another pan with the asparagus above in a steamer. If the eggs are ready and the asparagus isn''t quite tender, remove the eggs from the pan and put in cold water while continuing to cook the asparagus for a few more minutes. Peel the eggs.","To make the dressing, mix the extra virgin olive oil and apple cider vinegar with the chopped spring onions, herbs and capers.","Tip the quinoa into a bowl and toss through three-quarters of the dressing and the tomatoes. Spoon half onto plates and the rest into two containers. Arrange the asparagus on top of the salads with three egg halves on each one, then spoon over the remaining dressing and scatter with the basil leaves. Seal and chill the packed salads.Will keep in an airtight container in the fridge for up to a day."]','2026-01-10 12:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4316,4316,'en','Scrambled egg muffin','Healthy scrambled eggs don’t have to be bland, try this simple vegetarian recipe – ideal for Boxing Day','["2 eggs","few sundried tomatoes","fresh basil, torn","English muffins"]','["Scramble eggs without butter or cream, stir in chopped sundried tomato and torn fresh basil, and pile on toasted English muffin halves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4317,4317,'en','Spinach & cheese pide','Make our version of Turkish pide with spinach and goat’s cheese, ideal for a light lunch or picnic. Pide are boat-shaped flatbreads that are filled and baked','["300g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp caster sugar","2 tbsp olive oil","1 egg, beaten","1 tsp olive oil","1 white onion, finely chopped","1 tsp whole cumin seeds","240g spinach","50g firm goat''s cheese, crumbled","2 tbsp chopped dill"]','["Put the flour, yeast, sugar and 1 tsp sea salt in a large bowl and stir to combine. Stir in 80ml water and the oil to bring everything together into a firm, smooth dough (you may need to add a little more water). Tip the dough out onto a lightly floured work surface and knead for 5 mins until the dough is smooth and elastic. Return to the bowl, cover and leave in a warm place to prove until it has doubled in size, about 1 hr.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Heat the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onion for about 5 mins until translucent. Add the cumin and spinach, and continue to cook until the spinach has wilted and any liquid has evaporated – this will take about 5 mins. Remove from the heat and leave to cool.","When the dough has risen, heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Turn the dough out onto a lightly floured work surface and divide into four. Roll each piece into a ball, then each ball out into a rough oval, around 3-4mm thick. Transfer the dough ovals to a roughly 30 x 20cm non-stickbaking tray.","Spoon the cooled spinach filling into the centre of each dough oval, leaving a 2cm border around the edge. Sprinkle the goat’s cheese and dill over the filling. Carefully fold the sides of the dough in by about 1cm so they slightly overlap the filling, and bring the ends together to form a point. The ends may need to be slightly twisted and pressed down to fix them in place.","When all four pide are assembled, brush the dough with beaten egg. Bake for 10-15 mins until the dough is golden brown and the filling is bubbling. Serve warm (any leftovers can also be eaten cold)."]','2026-01-10 12:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4319,4319,'en','Homemade croutons','Learn how to make croutons at home with our simple recipe, method and top tips. These will make crunchy toppings for soups, salads and warming pasta bakes','["1 garlic clove","2 thick slices sourdough bread","½ tbsp oil","1 tbsp mixed seeds","1 tbsp parsley"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Rub the whole garlic clove over both sides of the sourdough. Tear it into rough chunks and toss with the oil, a good pinch of salt and the seeds.","Spread out on a baking sheet and bake for 8-10 mins until golden and crisp. Mix with the chopped parsley. Sprinkle on soup or a salad for added crunch."]','2026-01-10 12:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4321,4321,'en','Duchess potatoes','Impress dinner guests with a serving of Duchess potatoes. Made with eggs, butter and Grana Padano and piped into swirls, they make an indulgent side dish','["500g floury potatoes, chopped","1 large egg, separated","30g soft butter","30g Grana Padano, finely grated","grating of nutmeg","vegetable oil, for the tray"]','["Cook the potatoes in a pan of boiling salted water for 15 mins until really tender when pressed into the side of the pan. Drain well and leave to steam-dry in the pan for 2 mins. Mash the potatoes until very smooth – use a ricer if you have one, or use a masher, then press the potatoes through a metal sieve to ensure they''re completely lump-free.","Mix the egg yolk, butter and cheese in a large bowl, then add the mash, nutmeg and some seasoning. Mix well with aspatulauntil the butter has melted and is well incorporated. It will come away from the sides of the bowl, similar to choux pastry.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Spoon the mash into apiping bagwith a wide star nozzle. Line a baking sheet with baking parchment and brush over a little vegetable oil. Pipe 20 walnut-sized peaked mounds onto the prepared tray, as if you were icing a cupcake. Beat the egg white with a pinch of salt and brush the potato mounds gently, to keep the fluting.","Bake the potatoes for 15-20 mins until golden-brown and crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4323,4323,'en','Butter-fried sprouts with crispy shallots & almonds','Serve up a feast on Christmas Day and add these buttery sprouts with crispy shallots and almonds to your festive dinner table','["50ml sunflower oil","4 small shallots, peeled and sliced into thin rings","2 garlic cloves, finely sliced","50g slivered almonds","50g cold butter, cut into cubes","500g Brussels sprouts, halved"]','["Heat the oil in afrying panover a low heat. Fry the shallots, stirring for 10 mins until golden and brown at the edges. Add the garlic and almonds. Fry for 5 mins more until the garlic is golden. Tip into a bowl.","Melt the butter, and stir-fry the sprouts for 10 mins until softened and starting to brown, adding a splash of water if they start to catch. Season. Toss with half the shallot and almond mix, tip into a dish, then scatter over the other half."]','2026-01-10 12:13:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4325,4325,'en','Vanilla milkshake bar','What could be more exciting than a milkshake bar for kids (and big kids)? Perfect for a party or celebration, let guests choose their own toppings','["200g vanilla ice cream","500ml semi-skimmed or whole milk","2 tsp vanilla extract","melted white chocolate (optional)","mini cookies, sprinkles, marshmallows, pretzels, popcorn, chocolates and a variety of sweets","maraschino cherries","squirty cream","4 milkshake or dessert glasses","coloured paper straws"]','["Tip the mini cookies, sprinkles, marshmallows and other sweets of your choice into separate serving bowls, and set on the table alongside the squirty cream.","Blitz the ice cream, milk and vanilla in ablenderuntil combined and creamy. Pour into a large jug.","If you like, dip the rims of the glasses into the melted chocolate, then some sprinkles. Leave to set slightly, then divide the milkshake between glasses. Let everyone customise their shake with the toppings and squirty cream, and serve with the paper straws."]','2026-01-10 12:13:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4327,4327,'en','Espresso & dark chocolate biscotti','Treat yourself to these moreish biscotti or box up as a gift. This twist adds espresso to the mix, enhancing the creamy richness of the chocolate','["300g plain flour","100g caster sugar","50g light brown soft sugar","1½ tsp baking powder","80g vegetable oil","1 large egg","2 tsp vanilla extract","2½ tbsp instant coffee granules, dissolved in 3 tbsp hot water and cooled","250g dark chocolate chips"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4, and line a baking tray with baking parchment. Set aside. Put the flour, sugars, baking powder and a good pinch of salt into a large bowl, then stir to combine.","Whiskthe oil, egg, vanilla extract and coffee together in a separate small bowl. Slowly pour the wet ingredients into the dry, mixing until you have a dry dough. Fold in 100g of the chocolate chips. Knead the dough until smooth – it will be quite dry, but if it’s too difficult to knead, add another 1 tbsp water. Divide the dough in half, shaping each piece into a 25 x 8cm log, and transfer both to the prepared tray. Bake for 25-30 mins, then leave to cool on the tray for 15 mins.","Reduce the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Slice the biscotti logs into 1-2cm-thick slices crosswise using asharp knife, you should have about 16. Return to the tray and bake for 15-20 mins more, turning the tray around halfway through. Leave to cool slightly on the tray, then transfer to awire rackand leave to cool completely. Melt the remaining chocolate chips in the microwave in 20-second bursts until smooth, or in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of barely simmering water, then dip one end of the cooled biscotti into the melted chocolate. Transfer to a sheet of baking parchment and leave to set.Will keep in an airtight container for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4328,4328,'en','Low-sugar marmalade','A healthy version of the classic breakfast preserve with an intense fruit flavour','["900g Seville oranges","600ml pure, unsweetened apple juice","900g jam sugar (available in all large supermarkets)"]','["Cut the oranges into thin slices. Remove the pips and tie them in a muslin bag. Place the orange slices in a preserving pan with the apple juice and the pips. Bring to the boil then simmer very gently for 30-40 minutes, or until the orange peel can be pierced easily with a fork. The mixture will be very thick, with little liquid.","Add the jam sugar and stir over a low heat until it has completely dissolved, about 5 minutes. Bring to a good rolling boil then bubble for 4 minutes. Take the pan off the heat and skim any scum from the surface. (To dissolve any excess scum, drop a small knob of butter on to the surface, and gently stir.)","Remove the muslin bag and leave the marmalade to stand in the pan for 15 minutes to cool a little, and to allow the peel to settle; pot in sterilised jars, seal and label."]','2026-01-10 12:13:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4329,4329,'en','Kimchi, cheese & spring onion pinwheels','Pair the acidity of kimchi with mature cheddar in these fabulous pinwheels. They make great canapés for celebrations such as New Year’s Eve','["150g mature cheddar, grated","2 spring onions, thinly sliced","70g kimchi, roughly chopped","320g sheet ready-rolled puff pastry","1 egg, lightly beaten","togarashi, for sprinkling (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, and line two baking sheets with baking parchment. Combine the cheese, spring onions and kimchi in a small bowl.","Unroll the pastry, spread with the cheese and kimchi mixture, then roll up into a tight coil from one of the long sides. Slice into 14 pieces.","Arrange the pastry pinwheels, spiral-side up on the baking sheets, well spaced apart. Brush with a little of the beaten egg and bake for 30-35 mins, or until golden brown and puffed up. Sprinkle with some togarashi, if using, and leave to cool for 5 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4331,4331,'en','Alcohol-free amaretto sour','Treat yourself to an amaretto sour mocktail, with all the sweet, sharp and nutty flavours of the classic cocktail, without the booze','["100ml pineapple juice","50ml lemon juice","½ egg white","10ml syrup from cocktail cherries (or more if you prefer), plus cherries to serve","a few drops almond extract"]','["Put the pineapple juice, lemon juice, egg white, cherry syrup and almond extract into ablender. Whizz the mixture a few times at a high speed, until the mixture is pale and starting to increase in volume. If your blender is suitable for use with ice, add a few handfuls and pulse twice more to chill the mixture. Alternatively, stir in the ice until the outside of the jug feels cold. Pour into glasses and garnish with the cherries to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4333,4333,'en','Pork & squash goulash cobbler','Combine pork with squash and mushrooms in this hearty low-calorie meal for two. If you add the cabbage to serve, it counts as five of your 5-a-day','["1 tsp olive oil","250g lean pork fillet, trimmed of any visible fat and cut into chunks","3 celery sticks, chopped (160g)","160g butternut squash, peeled and cut into cubes","1 green pepper, deseeded and diced","100g button mushrooms, stalks pulled out, and large ones halved","½ tsp caraway seeds, plus a pinch for sprinkling","2 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","160g cooked cabbage, to serve","100g spelt wholemeal flour","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp olive oil","100g pot natural yogurt","drop of milk, to glaze (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in an ovenproof non-stick pan, then stir-fry the pork for 5-7 mins until it starts to brown. Tip in the celery, squash, pepper and mushrooms with their stalks, then cook for a few minutes more.","Stir in the caraway and paprika, then pour in 350ml boiling water, the bouillon, tomato purée and garlic. Cover the pan and simmer for 20 mins until the veg is tender, then remove the lid and simmer for another 5 mins to reduce a little.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. For the cobbler topping, put the flour in a bowl and stir in the baking powder. Combine the oil and yogurt, then stir that into the flour. Bring the mix together into a dough using a cutlery knife. Knead very lightly on a clean work surface, then form into a sausage shape about the width of a large cucumber. Slice evenly into six rounds and arrange on top of the goulash. Brush with a little milk to glaze, if you like, and scatter over a pinch of caraway seeds. Bake for 15-20 mins until golden and cooked – you can tell by lifting one to see if the mixture has set beneath. Serve with the cooked cabbage on the side, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4335,4335,'en','Classic fudge','Indulge in some melt-in-the-mouth fudge. The perfect year-round treat, it’s also great wrapped up as a gift for family and friends','["125g salted butter, plus extra for the tin","397g can condensed milk","460g light muscovado sugar","150ml whole milk","2 tsp vanilla bean paste"]','["Butter and line a 20cm square cake tin with baking parchment. Put the butter, condensed milk, sugar and milk in a largesaucepanover a low heat. Stir continuously until the sugar dissolves.","Increase the heat and bring to the boil. Bubble for 10 mins, stirring all the time until the mixture reaches 115C on a sugar or probe thermometer. Remove from the heat and leave to cool to 110C. Add the vanilla, then beat in a stand mixer or with an electric handwhiskuntil it cools to 60C. This will help break up any large sugar crystals. The fudge should be thick and matte-looking.","Spoon the fudge into the prepared tin and press down with a spoon to smooth the surface. Leave to set, then cut into squares.Will keep for up to three weeks in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:13:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4337,4337,'en','Autumn vegetable salad with saffron dressing','Enjoy this stunning autumn salad as a side dish at a dinner party. It features carrots, courgette, broccoli, tomatoes and olives in a lovely saffron dressing','["12 rainbow carrots, tops left on, washed and peeled","1 medium courgette, sliced","8 stalks long-stem broccoli, any thick stalks halved lengthways","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","100g mixed cherry tomatoes, halved","4 spring onions, thinly sliced at an angle","3 plum tomatoes, scored, blanched, peeled, deseeded and cut into small pieces","handful black olives, stoned and sliced","½ cucumber, cut lengthways, seeds removed and sliced at the angle","3 tbsp roughly chopped basil","20ml cider vinegar","½  tsp Dijon mustard","pinch saffron strands","1 tsp caster sugar","50ml extra virgin rapeseed oil","1 small shallot, finely chopped"]','["Heat a griddle pan over a medium-high heat. Tip the carrots, courgettes and broccoli into a large mixing bowl, lightly season and toss together with the rapeseed oil. Once the griddle is hot, add the vegetables in batches and leave to slightly char for around 3-4 mins, then transfer back to the bowl. When all the veg is charred, add the remaining salad ingredients, toss together and set aside.","To make the saffron dressing, whisk the vinegar, mustard, saffron and sugar together in a bowl with a pinch of salt until the sugar has dissolved. Whisk in the oil gradually, then stir in the shallots. Dress the salad and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4339,4339,'en','Tomato & tamarind fish curry','Use a sustainable white fish like hake and serve up this healthy, Indian spice-pot with green beans and coriander','["6 garlic cloves","1 red chilli, roughly chopped (deseeded if you don''t like it too hot)","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and roughly chopped","1 tsp turmeric","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp fennel seed","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","200g green beans, trimmed and halved","1 tbsp tamarind paste","4 firm white fish fillets (we used hake)","handful coriander leaves, roughly chopped","cooked basmati rice, to serve"]','["Blitz together the garlic, chilli, ginger,\r\nturmeric and ground coriander with\r\n3 tbsp water. Heat the oil in a large pan\r\nand toast the cumin and fennel seeds,\r\nletting them sizzle until aromatic. Add\r\nthe ginger paste and fry for 3 mins.","Empty the tomatoes into the spice\r\npan, plus a can of water. Add the beans,\r\nbring to the boil, then turn down the\r\nheat and simmer for 5 mins. Stir in\r\nthe tamarind paste. Add the fish fillets,\r\ngenerously season with ground black\r\npepper, cover and simmer for 10 mins.\r\nTake off the lid, carefully turn the fillets,\r\nthen bubble the sauce until the fish is\r\ncooked through and the sauce is thick.\r\nSprinkle over the coriander leaves and\r\nserve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:13:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4341,4341,'en','Toasted quinoa, lentil & poached salmon salad','Great if you’re following a low-cholesterol diet, this fresh plate of greens contains nutty, toasted supergrains and flavoursome lemon and herbs','["140g quinoa","1 tsp olive oil","400ml light vegetable stock (we used bouillon)","250g asparagus, trimmed","100g frozen soya beans","140g broccoli, florets trimmed and halved (we used Tenderstem)","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 salmon fillets (about 150g each)","½ garlic clove, crushed","250g pack ready-cooked puy lentils","6 spring onions, sliced on the diagonal","large handful mint and parsley, roughly chopped","85g baby spinach leaves","25g flaked almonds, toasted"]','["Rinse the quinoa and tip into a large\r\nnon-stick frying pan. Turn the heat to\r\nmedium and dry out the grains, stirring\r\nto move them about the pan. Once all\r\nthe liquid has evaporated, stir in the oil.\r\nContinue cooking the quinoa until it has\r\nturned a nutty brown and starts to ‘pop’\r\n– this will take 10-15 mins. Stir every so\r\noften to stop the quinoa burning. Pour\r\nover the stock and simmer for 15-20 mins\r\nuntil all the liquid has been absorbed.\r\nTip into a bowl and allow to cool.","Meanwhile, bring a large pan of water\r\nto the boil. Drop in the soya beans,\r\nasparagus and broccoli, and simmer for\r\n2 mins. Remove using a slotted spoon\r\nand plunge into a bowl of ice-cold water.\r\nDrain the vegetables.","Add 1 tsp of the lemon juice to the\r\npan with the vegetable water, then\r\nturn the heat down to a gentle simmer.\r\nSeason the salmon fillets and submerge\r\nfully in the water. Poach for 6-8 mins\r\nuntil just cooked. Remove, allow to\r\ncool, then take off the skin and flake\r\ninto large chunks.","Make a dressing by mixing together\r\nthe garlic, most of the lemon zest and\r\nremaining lemon juice. Mix the quinoa,\r\nlentils, drained vegetables, spring onions,\r\nherbs, spinach and dressing together in\r\na large bowl, then season. Pile onto a\r\nserving plate, top with the salmon, then\r\nscatter over the almonds and remaining\r\nlemon zest."]','2026-01-10 12:13:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4343,4343,'en','Italian-style beef stew','An easy, superhealthy stew full of vitamin C','["1 onion, sliced","1 garlic clove, sliced","2 tbsp olive oil","300g pack beef stir-fry strips, or use beef steak, thinly sliced","1 yellow pepper, deseeded and thinly sliced","400g can chopped tomatoes","sprig rosemary, chopped","handful pitted olives"]','["In a large saucepan, cook onion and garlic in olive oil for 5 mins until softened and turning golden. Tip in the beef strips, pepper, tomatoes and rosemary, then bring to the boil. Simmer for 15 mins until the meat is cooked through, adding some boiling water if needed. Stir through the olives and serve with mash or polenta."]','2026-01-10 12:13:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4345,4345,'en','Creamy curried carrot & butter bean soup','A smooth blended vegetable soup with Indian spice to leave simmering for hours – perfect for feeding a crowd','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","2 onions, chopped","1 tsp turmeric","1 tsp ground ginger","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tbsp medium curry powder","1¼kg carrots, 1kg/2lb 4oz roughly sliced, rest coarsely grated","3 x 400g cans butter beans, drained and rinsed","1.2l vegetable stock","400ml whole milk","snipped chives, if you like, to serve, plus 2 crusty loaves"]','["Put the oil and onions in the biggest\r\nsaucepan or casserole you have and\r\nsoften for 10 mins. Stir in the spices and\r\ncook for 2 mins, then add the sliced\r\ncarrots with half the beans and the\r\nvegetable stock. Bring to a simmer,\r\nthen cover and cook for 15-20 mins\r\nuntil the carrots are tender.","Whizz the soup to a purée with a hand\r\nblender, or purée in batches in a blender\r\nor food processor. Tip it back into the pan\r\n(pour it through a sieve or a colander if\r\nyou like), and stir in the remaining beans\r\nand grated carrot with 500ml hot water.\r\nBring back to a simmer, then cover and\r\ncook gently for 10 mins.","Stir in the milk and season to taste,\r\nthen keep on a very gentle heat until\r\nneeded. If you like, snip a few chives\r\nover and serve with crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:13:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4347,4347,'en','Fruitburst muffins','Get started in the morning with a low-fat breakfast muffin crammed full of blueberries, cranberries, raisins and apricots','["225g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","2 large eggs","50g butter, melted","175ml skimmed milk","100ml clear honey","140g fresh blueberries","85g dried cranberries","140g seedless raisins","140g dried apricots, chopped","1 tsp grated orange zest","1 tsp ground cinnamon"]','["Preheat the oven to 200C/gas 6/\r\nfan 180C and very lightly butter a\r\n12-hole muffin tin. Sift the flour and\r\nbaking powder into a bowl. In\r\nanother bowl, lightly beat the eggs,\r\nthen stir in the melted butter, milk\r\nand honey. Add to the flour with the\r\nremaining ingredients. Combine\r\nquickly without overworking (it’s\r\nfine if there are some lumps left –\r\nyou want it gloopy rather than fluid).\r\nSpoon the mixture into the muffin\r\ntin. Bake for 20-25 minutes until\r\nwell risen and pale golden on top.","Leave in the tin for a few minutes\r\nbefore turning out. When cool, they’ll\r\nkeep in an airtight tin for two days.\r\n(Can be frozen for up to 1 month.)"]','2026-01-10 12:13:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4349,4349,'en','Mushroom & thyme risotto','Using a mixture of quinoa and rice gives a light texture and lovely nutty flavour to this dish','["1 tbsp olive oil","350g chestnut mushrooms, sliced","100g quinoa","1l hot vegetable stock","175g risotto rice","handful thyme leaves","handful grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative","50g bag rocket, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a medium pan, sauté the\r\nmushrooms for 2-3 mins, then stir in the\r\nquinoa. Keeping the vegetable stock\r\nwarm in a separate pan on a low heat,\r\nadd a ladle of the stock and stir until\r\nabsorbed. Stir in the rice and repeat\r\nagain with the stock, until all the stock\r\nhas been used up and the rice and\r\nquinoa are tender and cooked.","Stir in the thyme leaves, then divide\r\nbetween 4 plates or bowls. Serve topped\r\nwith grated Parmesan and rocket leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4351,4351,'en','Chicken, fennel & tomato ragout','This chunky ragout can be teamed with anything you like, couscous, pasta, rice or a nice jacket, or just a nice chunk of bread','["1 large fennel bulb","1 tbsp olive oil","2 boneless skinless chicken, cut into chunks","1 garlic clove, chopped","200g new potatoes, cut into chunks","400g can chopped tomatoes","150ml chicken or vegetable stock","3 roasted red peppers in brine, from a jar or deli counter, chopped"]','["Trim the green tops off the fennel and reserve. Halve, then quarter \r\nthe fennel, cut out the core, then cut lengthways into slices. Heat the \r\noil in a pan, add the chicken, then fry quickly until lightly coloured. \r\nAdd the fennel and garlic, then stir briefly until the fennel is glistening.","Tip in the potatoes, tomatoes, stock and a little seasoning, and \r\nbring to the boil. Cover and simmer for 20 mins until the potatoes \r\nare tender. Stir in the peppers and heat through. Roughly chop \r\nthe reserved fennel fronds, then sprinkle over the ragout. Serve \r\nwith crusty bread for mopping up the juices."]','2026-01-10 12:13:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4353,4353,'en','Vegetable tagine with chickpeas & raisins','We’ve made getting your five of day simple with this healthy tagine','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, chopped","½  tsp each ground cinnamon, coriander and cumin","2 large courgettes, cut into chunks","2 chopped tomatoes","400g can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","4 tbsp raisins","425ml vegetable stock","300g frozen peas","chopped coriander, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a pan, then fry the onions for 5 mins until soft. Stir  \r\nin the spices. Add the courgettes, tomatoes, chickpeas, raisins and \r\nstock, then bring to the boil. Cover and simmer for 10 mins. Stir in \r\nthe peas and cook for 5 mins more. Sprinkle with coriander, to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4355,4355,'en','Quick tomato risotto','Making risotto doesn’t have to involve hours of stirring over the stove, as this easy tomato recipe proves','["250g risotto rice","1 onion, finely chopped","50g butter","250ml vegetable stock","500ml carton passata","500g punnet cherry tomatoes","100g ball mozzarella, drained and cut into large chunks","grated parmesan (or vegetarian alternative) and shredded basil, to serve"]','["Tip the rice, onion and half the butter into a large microwave-proof bowl. Cover and cook in the microwave on High for 3 mins. Stir in the stock and passata, then continue to cook, uncovered, for 10 mins. Give it a good stir and mix in the tomatoes and mozzarella. Microwave on High for a further 8 mins until the rice is cooked and the tomatoes have softened.","Leave the risotto to relax for a few mins, then stir in the remaining butter, parmesan and basil. Season to taste and serve straight from the bowl."]','2026-01-10 12:13:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4357,4357,'en','Turkey steaks with citrus & ginger sauce','Use quick-cook turkey steaks for this recipe as they cook in a few minutes, and make a change from chicken','["2 tsp cornflour","4 quick-cook turkey breast steaks, weighing about 300g/10oz total","1 tbsp sunflower oil","3 oranges, juice of 2 and one peeled and cut into segments","1 tsp grated fresh ginger","1 tsp clear honey","1 pink grapefruit, peeled and cut into segments","1 tbsp fresh snipped chives or chopped parsley","wild or long grain rice and steamed broccoli, to serve"]','["Sprinkle a teaspoon\r\ncornflour onto a plate, then\r\npress the turkey steaks into\r\nthe cornflour to dust them\r\nlightly. Heat the oil in a large\r\nnon-stick frying pan, until it is\r\nreally hot. Add the turkey and\r\nfry for 3-4 minutes, turning\r\nonce until golden on both\r\nsides – cook in batches if\r\nneed be. Transfer to a plate.","Add the orange juice, ginger\r\nand honey to the pan. Gently\r\nbring to the boil. Mix the\r\nremaining cornflour with 1\r\ntbsp cold water and stir into\r\nthe sauce. Keep stirring on a\r\ngentle heat until thickened and\r\nsyrupy, like a sweet and sour\r\nsauce. Season.","Return the turkey to the pan.\r\nAdd the orange and grapefruit\r\nsegments and heat through\r\ngently. Scatter over chives or\r\nparsley and serve straight\r\naway with rice and broccoli."]','2026-01-10 12:13:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4359,4359,'en','Pea & new potato curry','A low-fat and low-calorie vegetable curry that''s made with Madras spice and yogurt','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 onions, sliced","3 red chillies, deseeded and finely sliced","thumb-sized piece ginger, roughly chopped","2 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp Madras curry powder","½  tsp turmeric","750g new potatoes, halved","juice 1 lime","500ml pot natural yogurt","small bunch coriander, stalks and leaves finely chopped","200-300ml vegetable stock, or pea stock (see tip, below)","300g podded fresh peas (or use frozen)","lime wedges, to serve","2 naan bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large, deep frying pan.\r\nAdd the onions and cook over a low heat\r\nfor 10-15 mins until soft. Throw in the chillies, ginger and spices, and cook for\r\na few mins. Stir in the potatoes and lime\r\njuice, coating in the spice mix.","Add the yogurt, coriander stalks and\r\nthe stock. Simmer slowly for 35-40 mins\r\nuntil the potatoes are soft and the sauce\r\nhas reduced. Stir through the peas and\r\ncook for another 5 mins. Sprinkle over\r\nthe coriander leaves, and serve with lime\r\nwedges and warm naan bread."]','2026-01-10 12:13:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4361,4361,'en','Cajun chicken gumbo','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyAn authentic Louisiana casserole with Creole spices, veggies, ham and a rich sauce – a one pot-with bite','["4 tbsp olive oil","5 skinless chicken breasts, cut into chunky pieces","1 onion, chopped","2 celery sticks, sliced","3 bay leaves","5 tbsp plain flour","4 tsp Cajun spice mix (or 1 each paprika, ground cumin, ground chilli and dried basil)","600ml chicken stock (made with 2 stock cubes)","2 green peppers, deseeded and cut into chunks","300g thickly sliced ham, trimmed of any fat and diced","3 spring onions, sliced","2 tbsp very roughly chopped parsley"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a wide casserole or big frying pan and fry the chicken for a few mins to brown. Tip out onto a plate. Add the onion to the pan with 1 tbsp more oil and fry for 5 mins until almost softened. Add the celery and fry for another 2 mins, then tip out to join the chicken. Add the remaining oil, bay leaves and flour to the pan and cook into a paste. Carry on cooking, stirring constantly (with a splash of water if you need), until golden brown, then stir in the spices for 2 mins.","Gradually stir in the stock until smooth and saucy. Return the chicken and veg to the pan, along with the peppers, cover and simmer gently for 15 mins. Stir in the ham, cover and simmer gently for 10 mins more. Check for seasoning, then serve, sprinkled with the spring onions mixed with the chopped parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:13:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4363,4363,'en','Jerk sweet potato & black bean curry','Serve your vegetable curry Caribbean style, flavoured with thyme, jerk seasoning and red peppers – great with rice and peas','["2 onions, 1 diced, 1 roughly chopped","2 tbsp sunflower oil","50g ginger, roughly chopped","small bunch coriander, leaves and stalks separated","3 tbsp jerk seasoning","2 thyme sprigs","400g can chopped tomatoes","4 tbsp red wine vinegar","3 tbsp demerara sugar","2 vegetable stock cubes, crumbled","1kg sweet potatoes, peeled and cut into chunks","2 x 400g cans black beans, rinsed and drained","450g jar roasted red peppers, cut into thick slices"]','["Gently soften the diced onion in the\r\nsunflower oil in a big pan or casserole.","Meanwhile, whizz together the roughly\r\nchopped onion, ginger, coriander stalks\r\nand jerk seasoning with a hand-held\r\nblender. Add to the softened onion and fry\r\nuntil fragrant. Stir in the thyme, chopped\r\ntomatoes, vinegar, sugar and stock cubes\r\nwith 600ml water and bring to a simmer.\r\nSimmer for 10 mins, then drop in the\r\nsweet potatoes and simmer for 10 mins\r\nmore. Stir in the beans, peppers and some\r\nseasoning, and simmer for another 5 mins\r\nuntil the potatoes are almost tender. Cool\r\nand chill for up to 2 days.","To serve, gently heat through on the\r\nhob. Roughly chop most of the coriander\r\nleaves and stir in, then serve scattered\r\nwith the remaining leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4365,4365,'en','Porridge with blueberry compote','Top high-fibre porridge oats with creamy Greek yogurt and healthy blueberries – buy frozen to help cut the cost of this filling breakfast','["6 tbsp porridge oats","just under ½  x 200ml tub 0% fat Greek-style yogurt","½  x 350g pack frozen blueberries","1 tsp honey (optional)"]','["Put the oats in a non-stick pan with 400ml water and cook over the heat, stirring occasionally for about 2 minutes until thickened. Remove from the heat and add a third of the yogurt.","Meanwhile, tip the blueberries into a pan with 1 tbsp water and the honey if using and gently poach until the blueberries have thawed and they are tender, but still holding their shape.","Spoon the porridge into bowls, top with the remaining yogurt and spoon over the blueberries."]','2026-01-10 12:13:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4367,4367,'en','Broccoli and kale green soup','This super healthy soup combines broccoli and kale with ginger, coriander and turmeric for a nutrient dense and low-fat lunch','["500ml stock, made by mixing 1 tbsp bouillon powder and boiling water in a jug","1 tbsp sunflower oil","2 garlic cloves, sliced","thumb-sized piece ginger, sliced","½  tsp ground coriander","3cm/1in piece fresh turmeric root, peeled and grated, or ½  tsp ground turmeric","pinch of pink Himalayan salt","200g courgettes, roughly sliced","85g broccoli","100g kale, chopped","1 lime, zested and juiced","small pack parsley, roughly chopped, reserving a few whole leaves to serve"]','["Put the oil in a deep pan, add the garlic, ginger, coriander, turmeric and salt,\r\nfry on a medium heat for 2 mins, then add 3 tbsp water to give a bit more moisture to the spices.","Add the courgettes, making sure you mix well to coat the slices in all the spices, and continue cooking for 3 mins. Add 400ml stock and leave to simmer for 3 mins.","Add the broccoli, kale and lime juice with the rest of the stock. Leave to cook again for another 3-4 mins until all the vegetables are soft.","Take off the heat and add the chopped parsley. Pour everything into a blender and blend on high speed until smooth. It will be a beautiful green with bits of dark speckled through (which is the kale). Garnish with lime zest and parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:13:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4369,4369,'en','Acquacotta','This traditional Tuscan soup, which means ‘cooked water’, is served with a poached egg for extra richness – a perfect starter or light lunch','["3 tbsp olive oil","3 celery sticks, chopped","2 small carrots, chopped","1 red onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tsp thyme leaves, plus extra to serve","50g dried porcini mushrooms","225g plum tomatoes, deseeded and chopped","850ml chicken stock","2 tbsp chopped parsley","3 slices good crusty bread, toasted and torn into chunks","6 eggs"]','["Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan and gently fry the celery, carrots, onion, garlic and thyme for 10-15 mins until softened. Meanwhile, cover the porcini with hot water and soak for 15 mins until softened and swollen. Drain the mushrooms, reserving the soaking liquid, and roughly chop. Add to the softened vegetables along with the soaking liquid and cook for another 5 mins.","Stir in the tomatoes and cook for 10 mins until they begin to break down, then pour in the stock and bring to a gentle simmer.","Poach the 6 eggs in a separate large saucepan of simmering water for 3-4 mins until set, then remove with a slotted spoon. Add the parsley and a little seasoning to the soup, and mix in the torn-up toasted bread. Divide the soup between 6 bowls and place an egg on top of each. Serve scattered with extra thyme."]','2026-01-10 12:13:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4371,4371,'en','Spiced chicken & pineapple salad','This colourful salad is packed with contrasting flavours and textures – dress with sweet chilli and coriander','["227g can pineapple in juice","about 140g pack cooked, sliced chicken breast (sweet chilli, hot and spice or BBQ work well)","1 small red onion, halved and thinly sliced","90g bag mixed leaves","small bunch coriander, leaves picked","handful cherry tomatoes, halved","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","2 tbsp white wine vinegar","1 tbsp sweet chilli sauce"]','["Drain the pineapple, reserving the juice. If in rings, chop into chunks. Mix with the chicken, onion, leaves, coriander and tomatoes, and divide between 2 containers if taking as lunch.","For the dressing, whisk 2 tbsp of the pineapple juice, the red chilli, vinegar and sweet chilli sauce with some seasoning in a small jam jar or lidded container, and toss this through the salad before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4373,4373,'en','Thai prawns with pineapple & green beans','This midweek stir-fry is packed with goodness from the crunchy veggies. It’s flavoured with lime, Thai basil and ginger','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 lemongrass stalks, tough outer leaves removed, the rest finely chopped","thumb-sized piece ginger, shredded","100g fresh pineapple chunks","100g green beans","100g whole cherry tomatoes","200g raw king prawns","small pack Thai basil leaves or regular basil leaves","4 tbsp lime juice, plus wedges to serve","2 tbsp liquid chicken stock","1 tbsp fish sauce","1 tbsp soft brown sugar"]','["Mix the sauce ingredients together in a small bowl. Set aside.","Heat the oil in a large wok. Sauté the lemongrass and ginger until golden. Add the pineapple, beans and cherry tomatoes, and stir-fry for 3-5 mins until the beans are just cooked. Add the prawns and the sauce. Stir-fry for another 3-5 mins until the prawns are cooked, then throw in most of the basil leaves. Serve with lime wedges and the remaining basil leaves scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:13:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4375,4375,'en','Spinach & pepper frittata','A balanced, omelette-like dish of protein-rich eggs baked with cheese, garlic, tomatoes, peppers and spinach','["5 large eggs","300g tub low-fat natural cottage cheese","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","15g finely grated Parmesan (or vegetarian alternative)","225g frozen leaf spinach, thawed, squeezed and finely chopped","2 roasted red peppers (not in oil), torn into strips","generous grating of nutmeg","100g whole cherry tomatoes"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Line a 20cm sandwich tin with a single sheet of baking parchment if your tin has a loose bottom.","Beat the eggs in a large bowl with the cottage cheese, garlic, half the Parmesan, the spinach, peppers, nutmeg and some black pepper. Tip into the tin, top with the tomatoes and sprinkle with the remaining Parmesan. Bake for 40 mins until set all the way through and starting to puff up. Cut into wedges and serve hot or cold. Will keep for 3-4 days in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:13:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4377,4377,'en','Chunky Mediterranean tomato soup','Use roasted vegetables in this speedy, low calorie soup – we used peppers, aubergines, onions and courgettes. Serve with herby ricotta-topped rye bread','["400g frozen grilled vegetable mix (peppers, aubergine, onions, courgettes)","2 tbsp chopped garlic","handful basil leaves","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 reduced-salt vegetable stock cube","50g ricotta per person, beaten with snipped chives and basil, spread on a slice of rye bread"]','["Heat a large non-stick pan, tip in half the vegetables and the garlic, and cook, stirring, over a high heat until they start to soften – about 5 mins. Tip in the basil, tomatoes, stock cube and 2 cans of water, then blitz with a hand blender to get the mixture as smooth as you can.","Add the remaining frozen veg, cover the pan and cook for 15-20 mins more until the veg is tender. Ladle into bowls. Serve with the herby ricotta on rye bread."]','2026-01-10 12:13:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4379,4379,'en','Griddled vegetable & feta tart','Crispy filo pastry makes a light base for a vegetarian tart filled with Mediterranean veg and feta','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 aubergine, sliced","2 courgettes, sliced","2 red onions, cut into chunky wedges","3 large sheets filo pastry","10-12 cherry tomatoes, halved","drizzle of balsamic vinegar","85g feta cheese, crumbled","1 tsp dried oregano","large bag mixed salad leaves and low-fat dressing, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Pop 33 x 23cm baking tray in the oven to heat up. Brush a griddle pan with about 1 tsp of the oil and griddle the aubergines until nicely charred, then remove. Repeat with the courgettes and onions, using a little more oil if you need to.","Remove the tray from the oven and brush with a little oil. Brush a large sheet of filo with oil, top with another sheet, add a little more oil and repeat with the final sheet. Transfer the pastry to the hot tray, pushing it into the edges a little.","Arrange the griddled veg on top, then season. Add the tomatoes, cut-side up, then drizzle on the vinegar and any remaining oil. Crumble on the feta and sprinkle with oregano. Cook for about 20 mins until crispy and golden. Serve with the dressed mixed salad leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4381,4381,'en','Mustardy beetroot & lentil salad','A rustic, healthy accompaniment to serve alongside main courses like sausages, roast chicken or lamb','["200g puy lentils (or use 2 x 250g packs pre-cooked lentils)","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard (or gluten-free alternative)","1½  tbsp extra virgin olive oil","300g pack cooked beetroot (not in vinegar), sliced","large handful tarragon, roughly chopped"]','["If not using pre-cooked lentils, cook the\r\nlentils following pack instructions, drain\r\nand leave to cool. Meanwhile, combine\r\nthe mustard, oil and some seasoning to\r\nmake a dressing.","Tip the lentils into a bowl, pour over the\r\ndressing and mix well. Stir through the\r\nbeetroot, tarragon and some seasoning,\r\nthen serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4383,4383,'en','Creamy pumpkin & lentil soup','Whether you''re carving a Halloween pumpkin or have picked up a cheap squash, use the plentiful flesh and seeds in this soup','["1 tbsp olive oil, plus 1 tsp","2 onions, chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","approx 800g chopped pumpkin flesh, plus the seeds","100g split red lentils","½  small pack thyme, leaves picked, plus extra to serve","1l hot vegetable stock","pinch of salt and sugar","50g crème fraîche, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Fry the\r\nonions until softened and starting to turn\r\ngolden. Stir in the garlic, pumpkin flesh,\r\nlentils and thyme, then pour in the hot\r\nstock. Season, cover and simmer for\r\n20-25 mins until the lentils and\r\nvegetables are tender.","Meanwhile, wash the pumpkin seeds.\r\nRemove any flesh still clinging to them,\r\nthen dry them with kitchen paper.\r\nHeat the 1 tsp oil in a non-stick pan\r\nand fry the seeds until they start to\r\njump and pop. Stir frequently, but cover\r\nthe pan in between to keep them in it.\r\nWhen the seeds look nutty and toasted,\r\nadd a sprinkling of salt and a pinch of\r\nsugar, and stir well.","Whizz the cooked pumpkin mixture\r\nwith a hand blender or in a food\r\nprocessor until smooth, then add\r\nthe crème fraîche and whizz again.\r\nTaste for seasoning.","Serve with a spoonful of crème fraîche,\r\na few thyme leaves and the toasted\r\nseeds scattered on top."]','2026-01-10 12:13:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4385,4385,'en','Spicy bean tostadas with pickled onions & radish salad','Tex-Mex goes healthy with these corn tortillas topped with chipotle kidney beans, pickled red onions, coriander and lime','["2 red onions, 1 thinly sliced, 1 finely chopped","2 limes, juice of 1 and 1 cut into wedges","1½  tbsp sunflower oil","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp chipotle paste","400g can kidney beans, drained and rinsed","4 corn tortillas","140g radishes, thinly sliced","large handful coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nPut the sliced onion, lime juice and\r\nseasoning in a bowl, and set aside.","Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a pan and fry\r\nthe chopped onion and garlic until tender.\r\nStir in the cumin and fry for 1 min more.\r\nAdd the tomato purée, chipotle paste and\r\nbeans, stir, then tip in half a can of water.\r\nSimmer for 5 mins, season, then roughly\r\nmash to a purée. (You can cook for a few\r\nmins more if it is a bit runny, or add a few\r\nsplashes of water to thin.)","Meanwhile, brush the tortillas with\r\nthe remaining oil and place on a baking\r\nsheet. Bake for 8 mins until crisp. Spread\r\nthe tortillas with the bean mixture.\r\nMix the radishes and coriander with\r\nthe pickled onions, then spoon on top.\r\nServe with lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:13:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4387,4387,'en','Baked salmon & eggs','Do something different with your eggs and smoked salmon by baking into a bread roll for an extra special brunch','["6 crusty white rolls (poppy seed ones look lovely)","25g butter, melted","6 slices smoked salmon or gravadlax","6 medium eggs","a few snipped chives"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nSlice off the top of each roll, then gently\r\nremove the bread inside until there is\r\na hole large enough to accommodate\r\na slice of salmon and an egg. Arrange\r\nthe rolls on a baking sheet, reserving the\r\ntops. (If you like, whizz the middles into\r\ncrumbs and keep in the freezer for\r\nanother recipe.)","Brush the inside and edges of the rolls\r\nwith a little melted butter, then arrange\r\na slice of salmon inside each one. Crack\r\nan egg into each and season. Bake for\r\n10-15 mins or until the eggs are cooked to\r\nyour liking. Scatter with snipped chives.\r\nToast the tops, brush with the remaining\r\nbutter, then cut into soldiers and use\r\nto dip into eggs."]','2026-01-10 12:13:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4389,4389,'en','Lemony mushroom pilaf','If you’re after a lighter alternative to risotto, this low-fat mushroom pilaf is just the ticket','["500ml vegetable stock","1 onion, sliced","300g mixed mushrooms, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","200g mixed basmati rice and wild rice","zest and juice 1 lemon","small bunch snipped chives","6 tbsp light soft cheese with garlic and herbs"]','["Put 2 tbsp of the stock in a non-stick pan,\r\nthen cook the onion for 5 mins until\r\nsoftened – add a splash more stock if it\r\nstarts to dry out. Add mushrooms and\r\ngarlic and cook for 2 mins more. Add the\r\nrice and lemon zest and juice, mixing well.\r\nPour in remaining stock and seasoning\r\nand bring to the boil. Turn down, cover\r\nand simmer for 25-30 mins until rice is\r\ntender. Stir through half each of the chives\r\nand soft cheese, then serve topped with\r\nthe remaining chives and soft cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:13:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4391,4391,'en','Prawn & pink grapefruit noodle salad','Take a healthy Vietnamese approach to salads by using cold vermicelli noodles with a sweet dressing, shellfish, coriander and mint','["200g thin rice noodles (vermicelli)","12 cherry tomatoes, halved","1 tbsp fish sauce","juice 1 lime","2 tsp palm sugar or soft brown sugar","1 large red chilli, ½ diced, ½ sliced","2 pink grapefruits, segmented","½ cucumber, peeled, deseeded and thinly sliced","2 carrots, cut into matchsticks","3 spring onions, thinly sliced","400g cooked large prawns","large handful mint, leaves picked","large handful coriander, leaves picked"]','["Put the noodles in a bowl, breaking\r\nthem up a little, and cover with boiling\r\nwater from the kettle. Leave to soak for\r\n10 mins until tender. Drain, rinse under\r\ncold running water, then leave the\r\nnoodles to drain thoroughly.","In the same bowl, lightly squash the\r\ncherry tomatoes – we used the end of\r\na rolling pin. Stir in the fish sauce, lime\r\njuice, sugar and diced chilli. Taste for the\r\nright balance of sweet, sour and spicy\r\n– adjust if necessary (see tip, below).","Toss through the noodles, then add\r\nall the remaining ingredients, except the\r\nsliced chilli. Season and give everything\r\na good stir, then divide the noodle salad\r\nbetween 6 serving dishes and sprinkle\r\nover the chilli before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4393,4393,'en','Cranberry chicken salad','Use up leftover cranberry sauce in this healthy salad. Add a can of cannellini beans if you want to bulk it up','["2 skinless chicken breasts","4 tsp olive oil","2 red onions, thinly sliced","200g mixed leaves","½ cucumber, deseeded and sliced","25g dried cranberries","85g/3oz cranberry sauce","juice 1 lime"]','["Slice each chicken breast in half\r\nhorizontally to give 4 thin breasts,\r\nthen rub with half the oil and\r\nseason. Heat a non-stick frying\r\npan and fry the chicken for 3 mins\r\non each side until cooked through.\r\nSet aside on a plate.","Heat the remaining oil in the\r\npan and fry the onions for 5 mins.\r\nSlice the chicken, collecting any\r\njuices, and layer up with the\r\nonions, leaves, cucumber and\r\ndried cranberries. Mix the\r\ncranberry sauce, lime juice, 2 tbsp\r\nwater and any chicken resting\r\njuices, and drizzle over the salad."]','2026-01-10 12:13:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4395,4395,'en','Mushroom, spinach & potato pie','A low fat, superhealthy, vegetarian midweek meal – you can even freeze any leftovers for later','["400g baby spinach","1 tbsp olive oil","500g mushrooms, such as chestnut, shiitake and button","2 garlic cloves, crushed","250ml vegetable stock (made from half a low sodium vegetable stock cube)","300g cooked new potatoes, cut into bite-sized pieces","1 tbsp grain mustard","1 tsp freshly grated nutmeg","2 heaped tbsp light crème fraîche","3 sheets filo pastry","300g each green beans and broccoli, steamed"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Wilt spinach in a colander by pouring a kettleful of hot water over it.","Heat half the oil in a large non-stick pan and fry mushrooms on a high heat until golden. Add garlic and cook for 1 min, then tip in stock, mustard, nutmeg and potatoes. Bubble for a few mins until reduced. Season, then remove from the heat; add crème fraîche and spinach. Pour into a pie dish and allow to cool\r\nfor a few mins.","Brush filo with remaining oil, quarter sheets then loosely scrunch up and lay on top of pie filling. Bake for 20-25 mins until golden. Serve with vegetables."]','2026-01-10 12:13:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4397,4397,'en','Mediterranean sardine salad','A superhealthy salad that’s full of intense flavours with oily fish, olives and capers','["90g bag salad leaves","handful black olives, roughly chopped","1 tbsp caper, drained","2 x 120g cans sardines in tomato sauce, drained and sauce reserved","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp red wine vinegar"]','["Divide the salad leaves between 4 plates,\r\nthen sprinkle over the olives and capers.\r\nRoughly break up the sardines and add to\r\nthe salad. Mix the tomato sauce with the\r\noil and vinegar and drizzle over the salad."]','2026-01-10 12:13:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4399,4399,'en','Cacciatore chicken','Jazz up chicken breasts with an Italian tomato sauce with rosemary and garlic, baked like a casserole – it''s a healthy choice, too','["1 onion, sliced","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 tsp olive oil","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp chopped rosemary leaves","4 chicken breasts","small handful basil leaves","favourite seasonal vegetables, to serve (optional)"]','["Fry the onion and garlic in the oil\r\nuntil softened. Add the tomatoes,\r\nrosemary and seasoning, and cook\r\nfor 10-15 mins until thickened.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nPut the chicken on a baking tray, top\r\nwith the sauce and bake for 15-20 mins\r\nuntil cooked through. Serve scattered\r\nwith basil, with your favourite veg,\r\nif you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4401,4401,'en','Baked eggs with spinach & tomato','A rustic dish with a delicious combination of flavours and just four ingredients, try whipping it up for brunch','["100g bag spinach","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp chilli flakes","4 eggs"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put\r\nthe spinach into a colander, then pour\r\nover a kettle of boiling water to wilt the\r\nleaves. Squeeze out excess water and\r\ndivide between 4 small ovenproof dishes.","Mix the tomatoes with the chilli flakes\r\nand some seasoning, then add to the\r\ndishes with the spinach. Make a small\r\nwell in the centre of each and crack in\r\nan egg. Bake for 12-15 mins or more\r\ndepending on how you like your eggs.\r\nServe with crusty bread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4403,4403,'en','Turkish one-pan eggs & peppers (Menemen)','This gutsy dish is genuine street food and a brilliantfamily dish for brunch, lunch or supper.','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, sliced","1 red or green pepper, halved deseeded and sliced","1-2 red chillies, deseeded and sliced","400g can chopped tomatoes","1-2 tsp caster sugar","4 eggs","small bunch parsley, roughly chopped","6 tbsp thick, creamy yogurt","2 garlic cloves, crushed"]','["Heat the oil in a heavy-based frying\r\npan. Stir in the onions, pepper and\r\nchillies. Cook until they begin to soften.\r\nAdd the tomatoes and sugar, mixing well.\r\nCook until the liquid has reduced, season.","Using a wooden spoon, create 4 pockets\r\nin the tomato mixture and crack the eggs\r\ninto them. Cover the pan and cook the\r\neggs over a low heat until just set.","Beat the yogurt with the garlic and\r\nseason. Sprinkle the menemen with\r\nparsley and serve from the frying pan\r\nwith a dollop of the garlic-flavoured yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:13:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4405,4405,'en','Spanish stuffed marrow','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyLike its smaller cousin courgette, chunky marrows are great roasted with a strong-flavoured filling like paprika and chorizo','["1 marrow","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, diced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","100g chorizo, chopped","1 tsp smoked paprika","½  tsp cayenne pepper","½  tsp each dried oregano and dried thyme","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","140g roasted red peppers from a jar, sliced","handful parsley, chopped","85g fresh breadcrumbs","100g Manchego, grated"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Cut\r\nthe marrow in half lengthways and scoop\r\nout the middle. Put the halves, cut-side\r\nup, in a large roasting tin and season.","Heat the oil in a saucepan, add the\r\nonion and sweat on a low heat for\r\n10 mins until soft. Add the garlic,\r\nchorizo, spices and dried herbs. Cook\r\nfor a few mins, then add the tomatoes\r\nand peppers. Turn down to a low\r\nsimmer and cook for 10 mins, then\r\nstir through the parsley.","Spoon the tomato mixture into the\r\nmarrow halves, cover with foil and\r\nbake for 30 mins. Sprinkle over the\r\nbreadcrumbs and Manchego, and\r\nreturn to the oven for 10 mins until\r\nthe crumbs are golden and crisp,\r\nand the marrow is tender."]','2026-01-10 12:13:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4407,4407,'en','Griddled courgette & seafood lasagne','Superhealthy and lower in fat than a traditional lasagne, this version is also a lot quicker to assemble','["1 tsp oil","4 courgettes, sliced lengthways","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","½ x 680ml jar passata with onion and garlic","400g bag seafood mix, defrosted if frozen","4 fresh lasagne sheets, halved","3 tbsp grated parmesan","3 tbsp dried breadcrumbs","350g green beans, to serve"]','["Heat a griddle and brush a little oil\r\non the courgettes. Cook in batches\r\nuntil lightly charred. Season and\r\nscatter on the chilli, then set aside.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPour a little passata in a medium-sized\r\novenproof dish. Place half the\r\nseafood over it, then season and\r\ntop with a third of the courgettes.","Top with 2 sheets of pasta, then\r\nmore tomato sauce, seafood,\r\ncourgettes, another layer of pasta,\r\nmore tomato sauce and finish with\r\nthe rest of the courgettes. Mix the\r\nParmesan and breadcrumbs,\r\nthen scatter on top and cook for\r\n25-30 mins until golden. Steam\r\nor boil the green beans and serve\r\nwith the lasagne."]','2026-01-10 12:13:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4409,4409,'en','Ricotta, tomato & spinach frittata','Healthy veggie bites that are packed with flavour – a midweek must','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, finely sliced","300g cherry tomatoes","100g spinach leaves","small handful basil leaves","100g ricotta","6 eggs, beaten","salad, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nHeat oil in a large non-stick frying pan\r\nand cook the onion for 5-6 mins until\r\nsoftened and lightly golden. Add the\r\ntomatoes and toss for 1 min to soften.","Remove from the heat, add the spinach\r\nleaves and basil, and toss together to wilt\r\na little. Transfer all the ingredients to a\r\ngreased 30cm x 20cm rectangular baking\r\ntin. Take small scoops of the ricotta and\r\ndot over the vegetables.","Season the eggs and beat well, then\r\npour over the vegetables and cheese.\r\nCook in the oven for 20-25 mins until\r\npale golden and set. Serve with salad."]','2026-01-10 12:13:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4411,4411,'en','Jacket potatoes with home-baked beans','Cold nights require comfort food, and there''s no better than jacket potatoes – give yours a health boost with home-baked beans','["4 baking potatoes","1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 carrot, diced","1 celery stalk, diced","400g can haricot beans, drained","2 tomatoes, chopped","1 tsp paprika - choose sweet or hot depending on taste","1 tsp Worcestershire sauce","2 tbsp chopped chives, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nScrub the potatoes and dry well, then\r\nprick in several places with a fork. Bake\r\ndirectly on the oven shelf for 1-1½ hrs,\r\nuntil they feel soft when squeezed.","After 30 mins, heat the oil in a pan and\r\ngently cook the carrot and celery for\r\n10 mins until softened. Add the beans,\r\ntomatoes and paprika and cook gently\r\nfor a further 5 mins until the tomatoes\r\nare softened and pulpy. Stir in 100ml\r\nwater and the Worcestershire sauce,\r\ncook for a further 5 mins then cover and\r\nkeep warm.","Split open the potatoes and spoon in\r\nthe beans. Scatter with chives and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4413,4413,'en','Asian chicken salad','This easy-to-prepare salad is filled with zingy flavours – the simplified version is great for kids’ lunchboxes too','["1 boneless, skinless chicken breast","1 tbsp fish sauce","zest and juice ½ lime (about 1 tbsp)","1 tsp caster sugar","100g bag mixed salad leaves","large handful coriander, roughly chopped","¼ red onion, thinly sliced","½ chilli, deseeded and thinly sliced","¼ cucumber, halved lengthways, sliced"]','["Cover the chicken with cold water,\r\nbring to the boil, then cook for 10 mins.\r\nRemove from the pan and tear into\r\nshreds. Stir together the fish sauce, lime\r\nzest, juice and sugar until sugar dissolves.","Place the leaves and coriander in a\r\ncontainer, then top with the chicken,\r\nonion, chilli and cucumber. Place the\r\ndressing in a separate container and toss\r\nthrough the salad when ready to eat."]','2026-01-10 12:13:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4415,4415,'en','Spiced pepper pilafs','This colourful vegetarian supper is superhealthy and freezable in individual portions, so you can defrost as many as you need','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1cm piece ginger, finely chopped","1 tsp tomato purée","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp garam masala","200g basmati rice","850ml vegetable stock","140g red lentils, washed and drained","200g bag spinach leaves, chopped","handful mint leaves, chopped","8 peppers"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan with\r\na lid. Add the onion, garlic and ginger,\r\nthen gently cook for 5 mins until softened.\r\nStir in the tomato purée and spices, and\r\ncook for 1 min more. Add the rice, stir\r\nto coat, then pour in the stock. Bring to\r\nthe boil, tip in the lentils, cover with the\r\nlid and leave to cook over a low heat for\r\n15 mins, until the lentils and rice are\r\ncooked. Stir through the spinach and mint(see tip below, if freezing).","Use a sharp knife to slice the top off\r\neach pepper. Cut out the middle stalk\r\nand scoop out any seeds. Carefully\r\ntrim the bottoms slightly so they stand\r\nupright, but the filling won''t fall out.\r\nFill each pepper with the rice mix and\r\nplace the lid on top. Bake or wrap tightly in cling film or freezer bags and freeze.","To cook, defrost peppers completely if\r\nfrozen. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPlace the peppers on a lightly greased\r\nbaking tray and cook for 25-30 mins or\r\nuntil the peppers have softened. Serve\r\nwith a green salad tossed with cucumber,\r\nherbs and a dollop of yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:13:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4417,4417,'en','Kale tabbouleh','Use bulgur wheat as the base for this Middle Eastern salad of superhealthy greens, feta cheese and spices','["100g bulgar wheat","100g kale","large bunch mint, roughly chopped","bunch spring onion, sliced","½ cucumber, diced","4 tomatoes, deseeded and chopped","pinch of ground cinnamon","pinch of ground allspice","6 tbsp olive oil","juice and zest ½ lemon","100g feta cheese, crumbled","4 Baby Gem lettuces, leaves separated, to serve"]','["Tip the bulghar wheat into a\r\nheatproof bowl and just cover with\r\nboiling water, then cover with cling\r\nfilm and set aside for 10-15 mins or\r\nuntil tender. Put the kale in a food\r\nprocessor and pulse to finely chop.","Stir the kale, mint, spring onions,\r\ncucumber and tomatoes through\r\nthe bulghar wheat. Season with the\r\ncinnamon and allspice, then dress with\r\nthe olive oil and lemon juice to taste.\r\nScatter over the lemon zest and feta.\r\nTo serve, let everyone scoop the salad\r\nonto leaves of Baby Gem lettuce."]','2026-01-10 12:13:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4419,4419,'en','Potato & paprika tortilla','This thick, traditional Spanish omelette is bulked out with new potatoes and flavoured with herbs','["3 tbsp olive oil","250g new potatoes, ends trimmed, thickly sliced","1 small onion, halved and sliced","2 garlic cloves, chopped","½  tsp smoked paprika","½  tsp dried oregano or 3 tbsp chopped parsley, plus a few extra leaves to garnish (optional)","6 large eggs"]','["Heat the oil in a deep 20cm non-stick\r\nfrying pan. Fry the potatoes, onion and\r\ngarlic for 10 mins until tender. Stir in the\r\npaprika and fry for 1 min more.","Beat the dried or fresh herbs into the\r\neggs with seasoning, then pour into\r\nthe pan. Stir a couple of times as the egg\r\nstarts to set on the bottom of the pan,\r\nthen leave alone to cook slowly over a\r\nvery low heat for 10 mins until set, except\r\nfor the very top.","Carefully slide the tortilla onto a\r\nplate. Slide back into the pan, with the\r\nuncooked top now on the bottom, and\r\ncook for 1-2 mins more. Garnish with\r\nparsley, if using, wrap in foil and serve\r\nwarm or chilled."]','2026-01-10 12:13:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4421,4421,'en','Creamy baked cauliflower with almond crumbs','Try our whole baked cauliflower with almonds crumbs for a great veggie centrepiece in a family feast. Crusty garlic bread works nicely alongside','["1 large cauliflower, outer leaves trimmed","4 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions, very finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed","½ tsp ground mace","4 thyme sprigs, leaves picked from 2, 2 left whole","4 tbsp plain flour","750ml unsweetened almond milk","150ml soya cream","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard","25g dried breadcrumbs (ensure vegan-friendly, if needed)","2 tbsp flaked almonds","vegan garlic bread and a green salad with a lemony dressing, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cut off enough of the cauliflower stalk so it sits flat, then cut a deep cross in the base of the stalk. Sit the cauliflower on a piece of foil, then rub over 1 tbsp oil. Sprinkle over 2 tbsp water, season well, then cover tightly with the foil, sealing the water and cauliflower inside the package. Put in a baking dish and cook for 1 hr 30 mins.","Meanwhile, cook the onions with a pinch of salt and 2 tbsp oil in a pan until soft and translucent. Stir in the garlic, mace, thyme leaves and flour and stir for 2 mins, then add the almond milk. Bring to a simmer, stirring, then season. When slightly thickened, remove from the heat and stir in the soya cream and mustard.","Rub the breadcrumbs with the remaining oil. Stir in the almonds.","Uncover the cauliflower and return to the dish. Pour the sauce all over the cauliflower and into the dish. Scatter the crumbs on top, and tear over the two whole thyme sprigs. Turn the oven up to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Bake for 15-20 mins more, until the sauce is bubbling and thickened slightly, and the crumbs and cauliflower are golden. Cut into wedges and serve with a green salad and some garlic bread."]','2026-01-10 12:13:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4423,4423,'en','Apple, cheese & potato pie','Put a savoury twist on apple pie with potato, cheese and onion, as well as mustard and thyme. The sweet and savoury flavours create a stunning pie','["30g salted butter","1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 large onions, halved and finely sliced","½ bunch of thyme, leaves picked","30g plain flour","500ml vegetable stock","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","450g potatoes (we used Maris Piper), cut into 2-3cm chunks","3 apples, peeled, cored and chopped into 1-2cm chunks","150g mature cheddar, grated","300g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","70g cheddar, grated","150g cold butter, cut into cubes","1 egg, beaten"]','["First, make the pastry. Tip the flour, cheese and a pinch of salt into a largebowland mix. Add the butter and rub it in using your fingertips until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Mix in 4-5 tbsp cold water, and bring together into a dough. Wrap and chill for 30 mins.","To make the filling, melt the butter in a mediumsaucepanover a medium heat, then add the oil and onions and cook for 10-15 mins until caramelised. Add the thyme and fry for 1 min more. Tip in the flour, and stir to combine. Gradually stir in the stock, adding it in small amounts to prevent lumps forming. Bring to a simmer and cook for 10 mins, stirring occasionally. Stir in the mustard and vinegar towards the end of the cooking time.","Meanwhile, put the potatoes in a large pan of cold water, bring to the boil and cook for 4-5 mins until just cooked and still holding their shape. Drain well, then stir into the sauce. Add the apples, cheddar and some seasoning, and stir again. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Pour the filling into a 28cm oval baking dish (ours was 28 x 18.5 x 6.5cm). While it cools,roll outthe pastry on a surface lightly dusted with flour to the thickness of a £1 coin. Cut into strips roughly 1cm wide. Lay half the strips across the dish horizontally, leaving gaps of a few millimetres in-between, then, one by one, weave in the remaining strips vertically, using an over and under technique, also spacing them apart by a few millimetres. Re-roll any trimmings and cut into flowers, leaves, or other shapes to decorate, if you like (see tip, below). Arrange any pastry shapes on top, then brush with the beaten egg.","Bake for 50 mins, keeping an eye on it – you may need to cover the top with foil if it’s starting to brown too quickly. Leave to cool for at least 10 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4425,4425,'en','Cherry smoothie','Try using frozen cherries for ease to make this vibrant smoothie. Serve on its own or with brunch. Kids will love it, too','["300g frozen or fresh cherries, pitted","150g natural yogurt","1 large banana, sliced","½ tsp vanilla extract"]','["Tip all the ingredients into a blender and blitz until smooth. Adjust the thickness to your liking with 50-100ml cold water. Serve in four glasses or chill for up to 24 hrs, giving a good stir before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4427,4427,'en','Blueberry & banana power smoothie','Add protein-packed tofu to this blueberry and banana smoothie to make it really creamy and keep you full until lunchtime. Serve with toast or some cereal','["2 ripe bananas, peeled","125g blueberries (fresh or frozen)","300g pack silken tofu, drained","2 tbsp porridge oats"]','["Whizz all of the ingredients together in a blender with 300ml water. Drink straight away or transfer to a bottle for later, shaking well before drinking."]','2026-01-10 12:13:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4429,4429,'en','Air-fryer pork & potato kofte','Kofte make for an easy midweek meal, and if you prep the mix ahead of time, dinner can be ready in just 15 mins – we use potato to make the meat go further','["500g pork mince","1 large red potato , about 250g, scrubbed and coarsely grated","1 red onion , coarsely grated","2 large garlic cloves , finely grated","1 tsp cumin seeds","2 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp chilli flakes","25g fresh parsley , finely chopped","olive oil spray , for the air-fryer","150g bulgur wheat or couscous","1 tbsp olive oil","1 lemon , cut into six wedges","½ cucumber , diced","4 tomatoes , chopped","2 tbsp fresh mint or coriander , leaves picked and roughly chopped","200g tub of whipped feta, tzatziki or hummus , to serve"]','["To make the salad, put the bulgur wheat or couscous in a heatproof bowl and pour over 300ml just-boiled water. Cover with a plate and set aside until softened.","Heat the air-fryer to 190C. Put the pork mince in a large bowl and add the grated potato, onion and garlic, cumin seeds, smoked paprika, chilli, parsley and some salt and pepper. Mix well to combine, then divide into eight evenly-sized balls.","Firmly squeeze each meatball into a sausage shape, don’t worry if they aren’t perfectly regular. Put in the air-fryer basket, spray with oil and cook for 15-18 mins, turning halfway until browned and completely cooked through.","To make the salad dressing, stir the olive oil and the juice from two of the lemon wedges into the bulgur wheat along with some salt and pepper. Mix in the cucumber, tomatoes and herbs, and divide between serving plates. Top with the kofte and serve with a spoonful of whipped feta or hummus and the remaining lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:13:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4431,4431,'en','Baked courgette & tomato gratin','Make the most of courgette and tomatoes in this gratin, with melted mozzarella, fresh basil and a crunchy breadcrumb topping. It’s a great freezing dish','["2 medium courgettes, sliced lengthways about ½cm thick","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for the dish and for drizzling","400g can chopped tomatoes, blitzed in a food processor","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","handful of fresh basil (optional)","50g polenta or semolina flour","50g plain flour","1 large egg, beaten","1 ball of mozzarella, sliced (225g)","10g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated","50g breadcrumbs"]','["Sprinkle the courgettes with a pinch of sea salt flakes and lay them on a plate with another plate on top. Put a weight or tin on top to help push out the liquid.","Heat 1 tbsp olive oil in a non-stick frying pan and add the tomatoes and garlic. Cook over a medium heat, stirring, for 5 mins until thickened. Tear in the basil, if using, and season.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and oil a roasting dish. Combine the flours in a bowl. Pour away the water from the courgette. Dip the courgette slices into the egg, then into the flour, and arrange in a layer over the bottom of the dish. Top with a few slices of mozzarella, followed by a layer of the tomato sauce, and repeat with another layer of courgette, mozzarella and sauce. Toss the cheese and breadcrumbs together, then scatter over the top.","Drizzle with a little more olive oil, and bake for 40-45 mins until golden and bubbling. Serve with a herby red onion salad and some bread to mop it up, if you like. Can be frozen for up to two months."]','2026-01-10 12:13:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4433,4433,'en','Edamame falafel wraps','Make falafels with edamame beans and chickpeas to make these tasty wraps. If you’re short on time, you can use shop-bought hummus and falafels','["100g frozen edamame beans","400g can chickpeas, drained","1 small garlic clove, chopped","1 tsp ground cumin","small handful of parsley, roughly chopped, plus extra to serve (optional)","1 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for rolling and brushing","¼ red cabbage, finely shredded","½ lemon, juiced","4 flatbreads or wraps","4 tbsp hummus","¼ cucumber, chopped","1 red chilli, thinly sliced (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Line a baking tray with baking parchment. Put all the falafel ingredients, except the oil, in a blender and season lightly. Blend until you have a smooth mixture – a few chunks of edamame are fine.","With oiled hands, scoop up tablespoon-sized portions of the mixture, roll into balls (you should get 16) and put on the baking tray. Gently press down each falafel with the palm of your hand. Brush each falafel with a little oil, then bake for 20 mins until firm and golden.","Mix the cabbage with a pinch of salt and the lemon juice, and set aside for 5 mins to pickle. Warm the wraps and spread with hummus. Top with the cabbage, falafel (5 each for adults, 3 for children), cucumber, extra parsley, if using, and chilli for those who don’t mind spicy food."]','2026-01-10 12:13:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4435,4435,'en','Carrot cake porridge','Try a twist on porridge with our carrot cake version, with carrots, raisins, cinnamon and nutmeg flavours. Full of energy, it will set you up for the day','["2 small carrots, peeled and grated","180g porridge oats","1 tsp cinnamon","grating of fresh nutmeg","75g raisins","850ml milk (cow’s or plant milk work well)","1 tbsp nut butter, such as almond (optional)","honey, to serve (optional)"]','["Put all the ingredients apart from the honey in a pan and cook over a medium heat for 10-15 mins, stirring often, until the oats and carrots are soft and the porridge is creamy.","Add a little more milk as it cooks if it’s too thick. Serve with a splash more milk and a drizzle of honey, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4437,4437,'en','Pesto chicken salad','Serve this pesto chicken and couscous salad in lettuce leaves for a healthy supper. With added sundried tomatoes and pine nuts, it has lots of texture','["50g couscous","2 tbsp pesto","2 tbsp fat-free yogurt","2 cooked skinless chicken breasts, shredded, or 200g leftover roast chicken, shredded","½ small bunch of basil, leaves picked and torn, plus a few small leaves to serve","½ cucumber, chopped","2 sundried tomatoes in oil, drained and sliced","2 Little Gem lettuces, leaves separated","2 tsp toasted pine nuts"]','["Put the couscous in a large heatproof bowl and cover with 100ml boiling water. Stir in 1 tbsp pesto. Cover and leave for 8 mins.","Fluff the couscous with a fork, then stir in the rest of the pesto, the yogurt and some seasoning. Toss in the chicken, basil, cucumber and tomatoes.","Spoon the couscous mix into the lettuce leaves and eat with your fingers, or serve over the lettuce like a salad. Scatter over the pine nuts and more basil before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4439,4439,'en','Smoky hake, beans & greens','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyGrill white fish fillets and serve on top of chorizo, cannellini beans and spinach for a quick dinner that packs in 3 of your 5 a day','["mild olive oil","½  x 200g pack raw cooking chorizo (we used Unearthed Alfresco Smoked)","1 onion, finely chopped","260g bag spinach","2 x 140g skinless hake fillets","½  tsp sweet smoked paprika","1 red chilli, deseeded and shredded","400g can cannellini beans, drained","juice ½  lemon","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","Quick garlic mayonnaise (optional) - see recipe in tip"]','["Boil a full kettle of water and heat the grill to high. Heat 1 tsp oil in a large frying pan. Squeeze the meat from the chorizo directly into the pan. Add the onion and fry for 5 mins, crushing the meat with a spatula until broken up, golden and surrounded by its juices. The onion will also be soft and golden.","Meanwhile, put the spinach in a colander, slowly pour over the boiled water to wilt it, then run under the cold tap. Squeeze out the excess water using your hands, then set aside. Line a baking tray with foil, rub with a little oil and place the fish on top. Season, sprinkle over the smoked paprika and drizzle with a little more oil.","Tip the chilli into the pan with the sausages, fry for 1 min more, then add the beans, spinach, lemon juice and extra virgin olive oil. Let it warm through gently, then season to taste.","Grill the fish for 5 mins or until flaky but not dry – you won’t need to turn it. Spoon the bean mixture onto plates, then carefully top with the fish and any juices from the tray. Serve with a dollop of Quick garlic mayonnaise (see recipe, right), if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4441,4441,'en','Minty roast veg & hummus salad','Combine roasted vegetables with chickpeas and feta cheese in this Greek-inspired salad which provides an impressive 4 of your 5-a-day','["4 parsnips, peeled and cut into wedges","4 carrots, cut into wedges","2 tsp cumin seeds","400g can chickpeas, drained","2 tbsp vegetable oil","500g pack cooked beetroot (not in vinegar), drained and cut into wedges","2 tbsp clear honey","200g pot houmous","2 tbsp white wine vinegar","small bunch mint, leaves picked","200g block Greek-style salad cheese or feta"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the parsnips, carrots, cumin seeds and chickpeas with the oil and some seasoning in a large roasting tin. Cook for 30 mins, tossing halfway through cooking.","Add the beetroot to the tin and drizzle over the honey, then return to the oven for 10 mins. Spread the houmous thinly over a large platter, or divide between 4 dinner plates. When the veg is ready, drizzle with the vinegar and toss together in the tin. Tip the roasted vegetables on top of the houmous, scatter over the mint and cheese, drizzle with any juices from the tin and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4443,4443,'en','Spicy roast veg & lentils','Pack in an impressive 3 of your 5-a-day with this spicy vegetarian lentil dish filled with roast butternut squash, peppers and onions','["1 small-medium butternut squash (about 950g/2lb 2oz)","1 red onion, halved and thickly sliced","3 peppers (a mix of red, orange and yellow from a pack), deseeded and cut into 1cm or ½ in-wide strips","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","3 tbsp olive oil","3 tbsp curry paste","2 x 400g cans puy lentils, drained and rinsed","150ml hot vegetable stock","large handful coriander, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Using a sharp knife, peel the butternut squash. Cut it in half lengthways, scoop out the seeds, then cut into 1cm-thick slices widthways across the squash.","Put the squash slices in a large roasting tin with the onion, peppers and garlic. Mix the oil with the curry paste and drizzle over the vegetables. Toss well to coat in the curry mix and season.","Roast for 30 mins until the vegetables are beginning to soften. Add the lentils and stock to the roasting tin and mix. Return to the oven for a further 5-10 mins until the vegetables are tender. Stir in the coriander and serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:13:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4445,4445,'en','Marathon burritos','If you''re a keen runner, eat nutritious meals to fit in with your training programme. These energy-boosting Mexican wraps are perfect fitness fodder','["300g brown rice","½  small pack coriander, chopped","juice 1 lime","1 tsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp chipotle paste","2 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp brown sugar","1 tbsp cider vinegar","2 x 400g cans black beans, drained and rinsed","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 large tomatoes, chopped","1 red onion, finely chopped","½  small pack coriander, chopped","juice 2 limes","2 avocados, stoned and peeled","large wholemeal tortilla wraps, natural yogurt, lime halves to squeeze over and grated cheddar (optional)"]','["Put the rice in a medium saucepan with 600ml cold water and a pinch of salt if you like. Bring to the boil, then turn the heat down low, cover and gently simmer for about 20 mins until all the water has been absorbed. Turn off the heat and leave for another 10 mins undisturbed. Stir the rice and add the coriander and lime juice.","For the black beans, heat the oil in a large frying pan and add the garlic, chipotle, cumin, sugar and vinegar, and cook everything for 1 min. Tip in the beans and tomatoes, give everything a stir and simmer, uncovered, for 20 mins until thickened.","For the salsa and guacamole, mix the tomatoes with the onion, coriander, lime juice and seasoning. Tip half the salsa into another bowl and mash the avocados into it to make guacamole. Wrap everything up together in warmed wholemeal tortillas topped with natural yogurt, lime juice and grated cheese, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4447,4447,'en','Lamb & chickpea fritter wraps','Spiced lamb and chickpea patties with yogurt, coriander and salad make the perfect filling for flatbread','["1 x 400g and 1 x 210g can chickpea, drained and rinsed","1 egg","250g pack lean lamb mince","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","¼ tsp ground cinnamon","3 garlic cloves, crushed","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","¼ small pack coriander, roughly chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","4 large tortilla wraps","1 romaine lettuce, shredded","4 tomatoes, sliced","1 small red onion, thinly sliced","150g pot 0% fat Greek yogurt","oven chips, to serve (optional)"]','["In a food processor, whizz the chickpeas with the egg for a few mins until almost a purée, but some bits remain. Spoon into a bowl and stir in the mince, spices, two-thirds of the garlic, the chilli and coriander. Season well and form into 12 small fritters.","Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan and cook the fritters in batches for 4 mins on each side, until crisp on the outside and cooked through.","Top each wrap with a good handful of shredded lettuce, tomato, red onion and 3 fritters. Mix the yogurt with the remaining garlic and spoon a little over the fritters. Wrap up and tuck in, with chips on the side, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4449,4449,'en','Mushroom fajitas with avocado hummus','Get four of your 5-a-day in one hit thanks to these tortilla wraps with spicy mushrooms, avocado hummus and griddled onions','["1 large avocado, stoned, peeled and chopped","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","1 garlic clove, crushed","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 tomatoes, deseeded and diced","1 red onion, cut into thick rounds","2 large flat mushrooms thickly sliced","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp fajita spice mix","4 tortillas","shredded Little Gem lettuce and Tabasco sauce, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the avocado, chickpeas, garlic, lemon zest and juice in a food processor and whizz together until it forms a chunky consistency. Spoon into a bowl, season and stir in the tomatoes.","Drizzle the onion and mushroom with the oil and sprinkle over the fajita seasoning. Heat a griddle pan over a high heat and cook the onion for 2 mins on each side, then remove from the pan and keep warm. Cook the mushrooms for 2 mins on each side or until softened and turning golden in places.","Spread some of the avocado houmous down the middle of each wrap and top with the mushrooms and onions. Add shredded lettuce and a dash of Tabasco, if you like, and wrap up."]','2026-01-10 12:13:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4451,4451,'en','Lighter nachos','Slash the fat of this Mexican sharing platter with some simple swaps. Our tortilla chips are topped with beans and salsa','["5 soft corn tortillas","1½  tsp rapeseed oil","1 jalapeno chilli, deseeded, cut into thin strips","100g mozzarella, grated","2 tbsp half-fat crème fraîche","½  small pack coriander leaves, chopped","2 medium, ripe avocados, halved, stoned, peeled and roughly chopped","1 tbsp lime juice","2 spring onions, ends trimmed, finely chopped","2 tbsp chopped coriander","few drops Tabasco sauce","400g can red kidney beans, drained and rinsed","1 garlic clove, crushed","¼ tsp mild or medium chilli powder","¼ tsp ground cumin","4 tomatoes, seeds removed, finely chopped","¼ small red onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 tbsp lime juice","1 tsp rapeseed oil"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. For each tortilla, brush both sides with some of the oil, and cut into 12 wedges. Repeat. Put all the wedges on 2 large baking sheets and bake for about 10 mins or until golden and crisp. Remove and set aside. Turn up the oven to 200C/180C/gas 6.","For the guacamole, put the chopped avocados in a bowl and roughly mash with a fork, keeping some texture. Stir in the lime juice, spring onions, coriander and season with the Tabasco and seasoning. Set aside.","For the beans, tip them into a bowl, stir in the garlic, chilli and cumin powders, roughly mash with a fork, then mix in about 2 tbsp of water, or enough to make a rough mash. Season and set aside.","For the salsa, combine the tomatoes, onion, garlic, lime juice and oil. Season and set aside.","Ten minutes before you’re ready to serve, scatter the tortilla chips over a large baking tray or ovenproof platter. Spoon the beans in little mounds over the chips, then spoon over the salsa (if the salsa has been made ahead, use a slotted spoon so you leave any tomato liquid behind that could soften the chips). Scatter over the jalapeño chilli and mozzarella.","Bake for 4-5 mins, just long enough to melt the cheese and warm things through, but not over-brown the tortilla chips. Remove and spoon over the crème fraîche and scatter with coriander, and put the guacamole in 1 or 2 small dishes on the side. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:13:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4453,4453,'en','Winter vegetable curry with fruity raita','Use hardy root veg in this Asian-inspired spice pot. We used pumpkin, carrots and parsnips, teamed with tomatoes','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","2 onions, thinly sliced","½  pumpkin, winter squash or butternut squash, cut into cubes","4 carrots, cut into batons","2 parsnips, cut into batons","3 tbsp curry paste (or gluten-free alternative)","8 large ripe tomatoes, 2 cut into wedges","6 garlic cloves, peeled","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and chopped","small pack coriander, chopped","200g brown basmati rice","6 tbsp low-fat natural yogurt","100g mangoes, cut into cubes","1 tbsp mango chutney","small pack toasted flaked almond"]','["Heat the oil in a large lidded pan. Tip in the onions and cook for 10 mins until soft. Stir in the pumpkin, carrots and parsnips, and cook for 5 mins until they begin to soften. Add the curry paste and cook for another 3 mins.","In a bowl, whizz together the whole tomatoes, garlic and ginger until smooth, then pour over the vegetables, adding 200ml water. Save a handful of coriander to serve, and stir in the rest. Pop on the lid and simmer for 40 mins or until the vegetables are tender. Uncover, stir through the tomato wedges and reduce to the thicken the sauce.","Meanwhile, cook the rice following pack instructions. Mix the yogurt, mango and chutney in a small bowl. Fork the rice into a serving dish and scatter the curry with remaining coriander and the almonds. Season, then serve alongside the rice and fruity yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:13:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4455,4455,'en','Spinach, ricotta & chicken traybake','This healthy chicken dinner comes with roasted peppers, courgettes, onions and tomatoes – four of your recommended 5-a-day','["3 x bags baby spinach","4 tbsp ricotta","zest and juice 1 lemon","a few grinds of nutmeg","4 skinless chicken breasts","2 tbsp olive oil","50g fresh breadcrumbs, seasoned","3 courgettes, cut into batons","2 peppers, sliced","2 red onions, cut into wedges, roots intact","250g vine cherry tomatoes","4 garlic cloves"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the spinach in a large colander and pour over 1-2 kettles of boiling water to wilt. Allow to drain for a few mins, then squeeze out as much excess water as possible. Chop, put in a bowl and beat in the ricotta, lemon zest, nutmeg and plenty of seasoning.","Using a sharp knife, cut a slit into the side of each chicken breast and use your fingers to make a little pocket. Spoon the mixture into the 4 breasts. Rub with 2 tsp of the oil and press the breadcrumbs on top, then arrange the chicken in a roasting tin.","Put the vegetables on another tray and drizzle with the remaining oil, and season well. Bake the chicken and veg for around 30 mins, stirring the veg once. Remove when the chicken is cooked through and the breadcrumbs are golden.","Remove the softened garlic from the vegetables and mash it with the lemon juice, then stir this with the roasted veg and serve with the chicken."]','2026-01-10 12:13:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4457,4457,'en','Egg & veggie pittas','Cram wholemeal bread pockets with healthy aubergine, beetroot and carrot, then add a garlic and dill yogurt and eggs','["1 aubergine, cut into thick rounds","1½  tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp harissa","2 eggs","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 tsp agave nectar or golden caster sugar","1 raw beetroot, grated","1 large carrot, peeled and julienned","½  small red onion, very finely sliced","4 tbsp 0% fat Greek yogurt","1 tbsp chopped dill","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 wholemeal pitta breads"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Put the aubergine slices on a baking sheet, season, brush with oil and bake for 15 mins. Turn, spread with the harissa, and bake for another 5 mins.","Meanwhile, carefully lower the eggs into a pan of boiling water, turn down the heat and simmer for 10 mins. Run under cold water to cool, peel and put to one side.","In a bowl, mix the vinegar and agave or sugar with some seasoning, then tip in the beetroot, carrot and onion. In another bowl, mix together the yogurt, dill, garlic and seasoning. Toast the pittas and split them in half. Slice the eggs and put them inside the pittas with the spicy aubergine rounds and some of the beetroot salad. Spoon in the yogurt and serve with any of the remaining aubergine, salad and yogurt on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:13:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4459,4459,'en','Mushrooms paprikash','This vegetarian sauce is flavoured with caraway, paprika and parsley. Serve on pasta or jacket potatoes','["½  tsp caraway seed","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, halved and sliced","300g cup mushrooms, quartered","1 large green pepper, deseeded and cut into chunks","2 tsp sweet smoked paprika","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 vegetable stock cube (or gluten-free alternative)","4 tbsp soured cream","chopped parsley (optional)","pasta, microwave jacket potato or crusty garlic bread, to serve"]','["Heat a large saute? pan or wok, add the caraway seeds and lightly toast over the heat for a few seconds. Add the oil, then tip in the onion, mushrooms and pepper, and season well (salt will help draw the moisture from the mushrooms). Cook, stirring frequently, for about 6-8 mins until the vegetables are softened and the onion is starting to turn golden.","Stir the paprika into the vegetables, tip in the tomatoes, stock and half a can of water, and leave to cook for 5 mins. Top portions with the soured cream and parsley, if using, and serve with pasta, jacket potatoes, or garlic bread."]','2026-01-10 12:13:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4461,4461,'en','Quinoa, squash & broccoli salad','Combine this healthy grain with vegetarian ingredients. Feta cheese, pumpkin seeds, cranberries, parsley and butternut squash work together a treat','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 red onion, halved and sliced","2 garlic cloves, sliced","175g frozen butternut squash chunks","140g broccoli, stalks sliced, top cut into small florets","1 tbsp fresh thyme leaf","250g pack ready-to-eat red & white quinoa","2 tbsp chopped parsley","25g dried cranberries","handful pumpkin seeds (optional)","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","50g feta cheese, crumbled"]','["Heat the oil in a wok with a lid, add the onion and garlic, and fry for 5 mins until softened, then lift from the wok with a slotted spoon. Add the squash, stir round the wok until it starts to colour, then add the broccoli. Sprinkle in 3 tbsp water and the thyme, cover the pan and steam for about 5 mins until the veg is tender.","Meanwhile, tip quinoa into a bowl and fluff it up. Add the parsley, cranberries, seeds (if using), cooked onion and garlic, and balsamic vinegar, and mix well. Toss through the vegetables with the feta. Will keep in the fridge for 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:13:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4463,4463,'en','Chickpea patties with carrot & raisin salad','These harissa-spiked vegetarian patties are served with a crunchy salad of watercress, courgette and radishes in a light dressing','["400g can chickpeas, drained","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 large egg","1 tbsp ground almond","2 tsp harissa","1 tsp ground cumin","3 tbsp chopped parsley","2 tsp rapeseed oil, for frying","1 tbsp raisins","1 carrot, shaved into ribbons with a peeler","1 courgette, shaved into ribbons with a peeler","5 radishes, thinly sliced","2 handfuls from a bag of watercress, rocket & spinach","1 tsp each hemp or rapeseed oil and white wine vinegar, or lemon wedges (optional)"]','["Tip the chickpeas, garlic, egg, almonds, harissa and cumin into a bowl and blitz with a hand blender until smooth. Stir in the parsley. Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan and dollop in the mixture in 8 big spoonfuls, spaced apart. Cook for 5 mins on each side.","For the salad, toss the raisins and all the veg together, but don’t dress with the oil and vinegar until you are about to eat. If taking to work, add a wedge of lemon to squeeze over instead of the dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:13:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4465,4465,'en','Moroccan pomegranate & roast veg salad','Packed with vegetable goodness, this low-fat rainbow salad with sweet potato, red onion, parsnip and carrots is a feast for the eyes','["2 small sweet potatoes, cut into chunks","2 red onions, roots kept intact, cut into wedges","1 large parsnip, peeled and chopped into chunks","2 large carrots, peeled and chopped into chunks","1 tbsp ras-el-hanout","1 tbsp olive oil","100g bag baby spinach","110g pack pomegranate seeds","50g light feta cheese, crumbled","4 tbsp balsamic vinegar"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, line a large baking tray with baking parchment. In a large bowl, toss together all the veg with the ras el hanout, olive oil, salt and pepper. Arrange in a single layer on the baking tray. roast, turning once, for 40 mins until tender and starting to char.","Once cooked, allow to cool for 10 mins then toss with the spinach leaves, pomegranate seeds, feta and vinegar."]','2026-01-10 12:13:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4467,4467,'en','Beef & bean chilli bowl with chipotle yogurt','Chilli con carne is padded out with healthy mixed beans flavoured with smoky chilli paste','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","250g pack extra-lean minced beef","1 tbsp chipotle paste, plus a little extra to serve","1 tbsp Cajun seasoning mix","2 x 400g cans mixed bean salad, drained","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 low-sodium beef stock cube","2 squares 70% cocoa dark chocolate","small pack coriander, chopped","cooked brown rice and low-fat Greek yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan and cook the onion on a medium heat until softened. Add the beef with some black pepper and a little salt, breaking up any lumps with a wooden spoon, and cook until browned. Add the chipotle and Cajun seasoning. Give it a good stir and cook for 1 min more.","Tip in the beans and tomatoes, then crumble over the stock cube. Add a can of water and simmer for about 20-30 mins, until thickened. Add the chocolate, and stir until melted, then add most of the coriander.","Serve the chilli in bowls on top of the rice sprinkled with the rest of the coriander, with a dollop of low-fat yogurt, and an extra drizzle of chipotle paste on top."]','2026-01-10 12:13:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4469,4469,'en','For-the-freezer ratatouille','Make a batch of our healthy veg mix, then serve three ways- with feta, as pictured, with jacket potatoes, or in stuffed peppers','["250g red onions, cut into 3cm chunks","250g white onions, cut into 3cm chunks","600g red and yellow peppers - after deseeding and removing stalks, cut into chunks","1kg courgette, cut into 3cm chunks","1kg aubergine","20g garlic cloves, crushed","800g cherry tomatoes","3 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp sugar","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 tsp dried thyme or oregano, plus a pinch extra","1 tbsp wholemeal breadcrumb","25g light feta cheese","30g Little Gem lettuce leaves","25g sliced spring onions","50g sliced cucumbers","squeeze of lemon juice","1 small baking potato weighing 100g","1 tsp cumin seed","1 tsp mild chilli powder","2 tbsp chopped coriander","25g fat-free Greek yogurt","10g rocket leaves","squeeze of lemon juice","2 small peppers of any colour","25g lighter mature cheddar","200g cooked broccoli","20g baby spinach leaves","1 tsp balsamic vinegar"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nScatter the onions in a roasting tin,\r\nseason and roast for 25 mins, stirring\r\noccasionally, until charred and softened.\r\nRepeat with the peppers for 20 mins,\r\nthen the courgette for just 15 mins.","Heat a non-stick frying pan. Slice the\r\naubergines into 2-3cm thick rounds and\r\narrange in the pan (only cut what you\r\ncan fit in your pan at a time – cooking\r\nfreshly cut slices in batches should\r\nprevent them going brown). Cook over\r\na high heat until charred on both sides,\r\nthen remove to a microwave-proof plate.\r\nRepeat in batches until all are nicely\r\ncrisped and browned. Cover the plate\r\nwith cling film, poke in a couple of holes,\r\nthen microwave the aubergines on High\r\nfor about 5 mins until soft. You may need\r\nto do this in batches. Quarter the slices,\r\nor cut into chunks. (Because you’re\r\nfrying without oil, they’ll burn before\r\nthey’re cooked through, so finishing in\r\na microwave is ideal. If you don’t have\r\none, just add to the sauce for the final\r\n10-15 mins simmering, but they may\r\nbreak up a bit.)","While roasting the veg, put the garlic\r\nin the non-stick frying pan or a large pan\r\nwith a small glass of water. Simmer until\r\nthe water is nearly gone, then tip in the\r\ncherry and chopped tomatoes, sugar,\r\nvinegar and plenty of seasoning. Simmer\r\nfor 20 mins until thickened and saucy.\r\nTaste for seasoning, then turn off and\r\ncombine with the veg. Cool, divide into\r\n10 portions and freeze.","To serve as Greek veg bake with feta (serves 1, prep 10 mins, cook 15 mins):Stir herbs through 1 serving defrosted\r\nratatouille and tip into a small dish.\r\nSprinkle with breadcrumbs, then add\r\nfeta with a pinch\r\nmore herbs. Bake at\r\n200C/180C fan/gas 6 for 15 mins if\r\ndefrosted, or 25-30 mins from frozen.\r\nToss Baby Gem leaves\r\nwith spring onion,\r\ncucumber and lemon juice. Serve with the bake.Per serving: 236 kcals, protein 13g, carbs 34g, fat 5g, sat fat 3g, fibre 10g, sugar 20g, salt 1.0g","To serve as veggie chilli jackets (serves 1, prep 5 mins, cook about 1hr):Bake potato in the oven. Add a few\r\ntbsp water to a pan with cumin seeds and chilli powder.\r\nSimmer, and just before the water\r\nevaporates, stir in 1 serving of defrosted\r\nratatouille. Heat through, then stir in coriander.\r\nHalve the potato, top with veggie chilli\r\nand Greek yogurt. Serve with rocket leaves dressed\r\nwith lemon juice.Per serving: 270kcals, protein 14g, carbs 50g, fat 3g, sat fat 0g, fibrew 12g, sugar 20g, salt 0.4g","To serve as cheesy stuffed peppers (serves 2, prep 15 mins, cook 20 mins):Halve peppers down the stalks and scrape out\r\nany seeds. Divide 1 serving of\r\ndefrosted ratatouille between\r\nthe pepper halves. Grate over cheddar, then bake for 15-20 mins at\r\n200C/180C fan/gas 6. Serve with\r\nbroccoli and spinach tossed\r\nwith balsamic vinegar.Per serving: 173 kcals, protein 12g, carbs 21g, fat 4g, sat fat 2g, fibre 10g, sugar 20g, salt 0.4g"]','2026-01-10 12:13:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4471,4471,'en','Prawn, avocado & soya bean salad','The combination of shellfish, coriander, sweet chilli sauce and cucumber is a winner in this green salad packed with goodness','["85g frozen soya beans","85g cooked and peeled king prawns","2 tsp sweet chilli sauce","zest and juice 1 lime","1 tsp extra-virgin olive oil","½  small ripe avocado, stoned, peeled and chopped into small pieces","¼ cucumber, chopped into small pieces","small pack coriander leaves","small pack baby salad leaves"]','["Cook the soya beans in a pan\r\nof boiling water for 2-3 mins until\r\ntender, then drain and cool under\r\ncold water. Toss the prawns with\r\nthe sweet chilli and lime zest.\r\nWhisk together the oil, lime\r\njuice and some seasoning\r\nto make a dressing.","Mix the soya beans, avocado,\r\ncucumber and coriander. Pour\r\nover the dressing and toss to\r\ncoat. Top with the prawns and\r\nsalad leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:13:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4473,4473,'en','5-a-day couscous','Rebecca Roberts serves roasted courgette, carrots, red onion, tomatoes and mushrooms with couscous and chicken in this recipe for one','["1 medium courgette, cut into small chunks","1 medium carrot, cut into small chunks","1 medium red onion, cut into wedges","85g mushrooms, quartered","handful cherry tomatoes (about 8)","2 garlic cloves, peeled","1 tbsp olive oil","½  tsp paprika","½  tsp dried chilli flakes","2 bone-in chicken thighs, skin on","50g couscous","½  small pack parsley or mint, roughly chopped","drizzle sweet chilli sauce (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPut the vegetables and garlic on a baking\r\ntray. Season well, drizzle with 1 tbsp olive\r\noil and mix until everything is coated.","Sprinkle the spices and some\r\nseasoning over the chicken thighs,\r\nthen rub into the skin and flesh. Drizzle\r\na little oil over the skin and nestle the\r\nthighs among the veg. Roast in the\r\noven for 25-30 mins until the vegetables\r\nare starting to crisp and the chicken is\r\ncooked through.","About 10 mins before the chicken\r\nand vegetables are done, put the\r\ncouscous in a bowl and just cover\r\nwith boiling water, cover with cling\r\nfilm and set aside for 5 mins.","Fork through the couscous to separate\r\nthe grains. Toss the vegetables and\r\nparsley or mint through the couscous, season, then transfer to a serving plate.\r\nTop with the chicken and drizzle over the\r\nsweet chilli sauce, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4475,4475,'en','Fattoush','This classic Middle Eastern salad makes a crunchy light side dish or lunchbox filler- it’s sprinkled with sumac, mint and parsley','["2 tomatoes, chopped into chunks","¼ cucumber, deseeded and sliced","½  red onion, sliced","1 small head romaine lettuce, shredded","handful mint leaves, roughly chopped","handful parsley leaves, roughly chopped","2 pitta breads","1 tsp sumac","½  garlic clove, crushed","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","juice ½ lemon"]','["The night before, toss together all the salad\r\ningredients except for the pitta bread and sumac.\r\nMake up the dressing and season to taste. Leave\r\nthese separate until the morning.","The next morning, toast the pitta breads until\r\nlightly golden. When cool, tear into pieces and\r\ncombine with the salad and dressing. Spoon into\r\n2 plastic boxes and sprinkle over the sumac."]','2026-01-10 12:13:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4477,4477,'en','Moroccan chickpea soup','This low-fat soup is packed with storecupboard pulses, healthy grains and North African spice- use cumin, ras el hanout, ginger and cinnamon','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 red chilli, deseeded and roughly chopped","1 tbsp grated fresh ginger","1 tsp cumin","1 tsp ras-el-hanout","¼ tsp cinnamon","200g roasted red peppers, from a jar","2 x 400g cans chopped tomato","400ml vegetable stock","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","2 preserved lemons, rind chopped (discard the pulp and seeds)","1 tbsp clear honey","50g wholewheat couscous"]','["Heat the oil in a large lidded pan. Add the\r\nonion and garlic, put on the lid and cook for\r\n5 mins, stirring halfway through. Stir the chilli,\r\nginger, cumin, ras el hanout and cinnamon into\r\nthe pan and cook for 1 min. Add the peppers,\r\ntomatoes and stock. Bring to the boil, turn down\r\nto a simmer, put on the lid and cook for 10 mins.","Blitz the soup with a stick blender, or in a food\r\nprocessor until smooth. Return to the pan and\r\nadd more liquid to thin the soup, if you like. Stir\r\nin the chickpeas, preserved lemons, honey and\r\nsome seasoning. If eating straight away, add the\r\ncouscous and heat through for 5 mins. (If taking\r\nto work, add the couscous just before reheating)."]','2026-01-10 12:13:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4479,4479,'en','Black bean chimichurri salad','This simple lunchbox-friendly salad of storecupboard pulses is dressed with chimichurri- a South American parsley, coriander and chilli sauce','["400g can black beans, drained and rinsed","1 tomato, roughly chopped","¼ red onion, roughly chopped","½  avocado, chopped","50g feta cheese, crumbled into chunks","large handful coriander","large handful parsley","2 tbsp sherry vinegar","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","½  garlic clove, roughly chopped","¼ tsp chilli powder","¼ tsp ground cumin"]','["Whizz all the chimichurri ingredients together in\r\na blender or the small bowl of a food processor,\r\nuntil combined. Season to taste and set aside.","In a bowl or plastic container toss together all\r\nthe salad ingredients. Drizzle over the dressing,\r\nor keep it separate in a small jar to stir through\r\nthe salad just before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:13:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4481,4481,'en','Lebanese poussin with spiced aubergine pilaf','This Middle Eastern-style meal makes a decadent supper for two- serve your young chickens with a spicy and aromatic rice accompaniment','["1 aubergine, roughly diced","1 tbsp olive oil, plus a bit extra","2 small poussin","¼ tsp allspice, plus 2 good pinches","2 bay leaves","1 onion, halved and thinly sliced","100g basmati rice","2 tbsp pine nuts","½  tsp ground cinnamon","good pinch of ground cloves","200ml hot chicken stock (or gluten-free alternative)","2 tbsp currants","1 large tomato, chopped","1 tbsp chopped mint, plus a few leaves and sprigs to serve","1 tbsp chopped dill, plus a few leaves and sprigs to serve","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses","sumac, for sprinkling (optional- we used Bart)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4. Toss\r\nthe aubergine in 1 tbsp of the oil until well\r\ncoated. Pour into a large roasting tin, then\r\npush to the sides of the tin to make a\r\nspace for the poussins. Rub some oil onto\r\nthe skin of the poussins, sprinkle with the\r\npinches of allspice, salt and lots of black\r\npepper, pop a bay leaf inside each bird,\r\nthen roast for 35 mins. (Leave to cook for\r\nabout 10 mins before you start the pilaf\r\nso they are ready at the same time.)","To make the pilaf, heat the\r\nremaining 1 tbsp oil in a medium pan\r\nand fry the onion for 5-8 mins until\r\ngolden. Tip in the rice and pine nuts,\r\nstir for about 1 min, then add the spices,\r\nincluding the ¼ tsp allspice. Pour in the\r\nstock, stir in the currants, then cover\r\nthe pan and cook for 7 mins.","Take the lid off the pan, add the\r\ntomato, mint and dill, then cover and\r\ncook 2-3 mins more until the stock has\r\nbeen absorbed and the rice is tender.\r\nSet aside, covered, to keep warm.","Meanwhile, once the poussins\r\nhave had their 35 mins, drizzle the\r\npomegranate molasses over them and\r\nreturn them to the oven for 10 mins more\r\nuntil they and the aubergines are tender.","Set the poussins aside to rest for a few\r\nmins while you toss the aubergine into\r\nthe pilaf. Serve the poussins whole, or\r\nportion and serve on top of the pilaf.\r\nScatter with the dill and mint leaves, and\r\nsprinkle with a little sumac, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4483,4483,'en','Baked marrow amatriciana','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyMarrow has a mild flavour, so pep it up with a punchy Italian tomato sauce with bacon, chilli and thyme','["1 marrow, cut into 6cm thick slices","125g ball mozzarella, grated","2 tbsp olive oil","125g pack pancetta cubetti","1 large onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","large sprig thyme","1 bay leaf","sprinkle golden caster sugar","2-3 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 x 400g cans chopped tomato","large glass red wine","pinch dried chilli flakes"]','["For the sauce, heat half the oil in a pan\r\nand sizzle the pancetta for 5 mins, until\r\njust starting to crisp. Then add the onion,\r\ngarlic, thyme, bay and sugar, and cook\r\nuntil the onions are golden. Splash in the\r\nvinegar, sizzle for a moment then tip in\r\nthe tomatoes. Swoosh the wine around\r\nthe tomato tins to wash out every last\r\nbit and tip into the sauce. Season with\r\nchilli and a pinch of salt and simmer\r\nfor 30 mins until rich and thick.","Meanwhile, heat the oven to\r\n200C/180C fan/gas 6. Scoop out the\r\nmiddle of the marrow, leaving a little\r\nin the bottom to form a base. Drizzle a baking dish with a\r\nlittle oil, arrange the marrow in the\r\ndish and roast for 30 mins.","Spoon the sauce into the middle of\r\neach marrow slice, cover with foil and\r\nbake for 30 mins. Remove the foil, scatter\r\nover the mozzarella and return to the\r\noven for 10 mins until the cheese has\r\nmelted and the marrow is tender."]','2026-01-10 12:13:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4485,4485,'en','Harissa roasted tomatoes with couscous','Flavour versatile couscous with mint, parsley and almonds, then serve with chilli-spiced roasted tomatoes and a garlic yogurt sauce','["12 big plum tomatoes, halved","1 tbsp harissa","3 tbsp olive oil","3 onions, very thinly sliced","4 tbsp Greek-style yogurt","1 tbsp tahini paste","1 garlic clove, crushed","200g couscous","½  small pack mint, roughly chopped","½  small pack parsley, roughly chopped","50g toasted flaked almonds","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss\r\nthe tomatoes in harissa and 2 tbsp of the\r\noil. Season and spread in a roasting tin,\r\ncut-side up, and bake for 40-45 mins.","Heat the remaining oil in a large frying\r\npan. Tip in the onions and sizzle for a\r\ncouple of mins. Turn down the heat,\r\nseason and cook for 15 mins or until\r\ngolden and caramelised. In a bowl, mix\r\nthe yogurt, tahini and garlic with some\r\nseasoning. Set aside.","Tip the couscous into a large bowl.\r\nPour over 400ml boiling water. Cover\r\nwith cling film and leave to stand for\r\n10 mins or until all the water has been\r\nabsorbed. Fork though the herbs,\r\nalmonds, chickpeas and half the onions.\r\nTop with the tomatoes and the remaining\r\nonions, and serve with a dollop of the\r\nyogurt sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4487,4487,'en','Layered aubergine & lentil bake','Puy lentils bulk out this low-calorie vegetarian bake with mozzarella cheese, tomato and basil sauce and roasted aubergines','["2 aubergines, cut into ½ cm slices lengthways","3 tbsp olive oil","140g puy lentils","2 onions, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","300g cooked butternut squash","400g can chopped tomatoes","½  small pack basil leaves","125g ball of mozzarella, torn"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nBrush both sides of the aubergine slices\r\nwith 2 tbsp of the oil, lay on baking\r\nsheets, season and bake for 15-20 mins\r\nuntil tender, turning once. Cook the\r\nlentils following pack instructions.","Heat the remaining oil in a large frying\r\npan. Tip in the onions and garlic and cook\r\nuntil soft. Stir though the squash and the\r\ntomatoes, plus ½ can of water. Simmer for\r\n10-15 mins until the sauce has thickened.\r\nStir in the lentils, basil and seasoning.","Spoon a layer of lentils into a small\r\nbaking dish. Top with aubergine slices\r\nand repeat, finishing with a layer of\r\naubergine. Scatter with mozzarella and\r\nbake for a further 15 mins until the\r\ncheese is golden and bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4489,4489,'en','Chicken & sweet potato curry','This Indian spice pot flavoured with korma paste is mild enough for kids- the sweet potato stretches it a little further','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 onion, chopped","450g boneless, skinless chicken thighs, cut into bite-sized pieces","165g jar Korma paste","2 garlic cloves, crushed","500g sweet potatoes, cut into small chunks","400g can chopped tomatoes","100g baby spinach","basmati rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a pan, add the onion and\r\ncook over a low heat for about 5 mins\r\nuntil softened. Increase the heat slightly,\r\nadd the chicken pieces and brown.","Stir in the curry paste and garlic,\r\ncooking for 2 mins before adding\r\n100ml water, the sweet potatoes\r\nand chopped tomatoes. Simmer for\r\n20-30 mins until the chicken is cooked\r\nthrough and the sweet potato is tender\r\n– add a splash more water if it starts to\r\nlook dry. Season to taste and add the\r\nspinach, removing the pan from the heat\r\nand stirring until the spinach has wilted.\r\nServe with basmati rice."]','2026-01-10 12:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4491,4491,'en','Oven-baked sweet potato fajitas','Vegetarians needn''t miss out on the joy of tortilla wraps- we use peppers, onions and sweet potato topped with feta and soured cream','["2 large sweet potatoes","1 onion","2 red onions","1 large red pepper, deseeded","1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tbsp cider or white wine vinegar","30g sachet fajita seasoning","8 small tortilla wraps","½  small pack coriander, chopped","½  small pot low-fat soured cream","small iceberg lettuce, shredded","100g reduced-fat feta cheese, crumbled"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nChop the veg into chunky wedges and\r\ntoss in a large bowl with the oil, vinegar\r\nand fajita seasoning. Arrange in a single\r\nlayer on a large baking tray and cook\r\nfor 40 mins, turning halfway through.","Meanwhile, warm the wraps following\r\npack instructions. Once the veg is\r\ncooked, sprinkle with coriander, then roll\r\nup in the wraps with a dollop of soured\r\ncream, some lettuce and crumbled\r\nfeta on top."]','2026-01-10 12:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4493,4493,'en','Orchard crumble','Got a glut? Use this season’s bounty to bake this gorgeous pud- we chose plums, figs, apples and blackberries','["400g apples, peeled, cored and cut into small pieces","400g stoned plums, cut into chunky wedges","2 tbsp sugar, any type","300g figs, woody stalks trimmed, quartered","300g blackberries or brambles, washed well","cream, custard or ice cream, to serve","140g plain flour","140g wholemeal flour","175g butter, cut into small pieces","100g soft brown sugar"]','["First make the topping. Put the\r\nflours in a bowl with a pinch of salt,\r\nthen rub in the butter with your\r\nfingertips to form crumbs. Stir\r\nin the sugar with a fork, and\r\nchill until needed.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/\r\ngas 4. Tip the apples, plums\r\nand sugar into a big\r\nsaucepan with 50ml water\r\nand cook, stirring, for\r\nabout 5 mins, until the\r\napples are soft and\r\njuicy. Stir in the figs\r\nand blackberries, and\r\ntip into a baking dish.\r\nScatter over the\r\ncrumble and bake\r\nfor 45-55 mins\r\nuntil the topping\r\nis golden and the\r\nfruit is bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4495,4495,'en','Italian-style stuffed aubergines','Forget stuffed peppers and serve your veggie guests this sophisticated stuffed aubergine dish instead','["2 aubergines","2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","1 large onion, finely chopped","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","12 cherry tomatoes, halved","50g pitted green olives, chopped","handful basil leaves, chopped","125g ball vegetarian mozzarella, torn into bite-size pieces","handful fresh white breadcrumbs"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nSlice the aubergines in half lengthways,\r\nleaving the stem intact. Using a small\r\nknife, cut a border inside each aubergine\r\nabout ½-1cm thick. Using a teaspoon,\r\nscoop out the aubergine flesh, so\r\nthat you have 4 shells. Brush these\r\nwith a little of the oil, season and place\r\nin a baking dish. Cover with foil and\r\nbake for 20 mins. Chop the flesh and\r\nplace to one side.","Meanwhile, add the remaining oil\r\nto a non-stick frying pan. Tip in the onion\r\nand cook until soft. Add the chopped\r\naubergine flesh and cook through. Tip\r\nin the garlic and tomatoes and cook\r\nfor 3 mins more. Stir in olives, basil,\r\nmozzarella and seasoning.","When the aubergine shells are tender,\r\nremove from the oven and reduce heat\r\nto 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Pile stuffing\r\ninto shells, sprinkle with breadcrumbs\r\nand drizzle with a little more oil. Bake\r\nfor 15-20 mins, until the cheese is\r\ngooey and the breadcrumbs are golden.\r\nServe with a green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:13:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4497,4497,'en','Tomato & nduja bruschetta','Use ripe tomatoes to make these sweet and spicy bruschetta bites. They’re ideal for a garden party, when it doesn’t matter if you make a bit of a mess','["1 large baguette, trimmed and cut into 16 slices","300g ripe tomatoes, roughly chopped","400g can cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","small handful of parsley, chopped","2 tsp red wine vinegar","2 tsp extra virgin olive oil","8-10 nduja"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Arrange the baguette slices on a largebaking trayand bake for 8-10 mins until crisp and lightly golden. (You may need to do this in two batches.) Remove from the oven and leave to cool.","Combine the tomatoes, beans, parsley, vinegar and oil in a bowl, season well and set aside.","Spread about ½ tsp of nduja over each baguette slice and arrange on a serving platter. Spoon over the tomato and bean mixture over the baguette slices and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4499,4499,'en','Coconut & corn curry','Enjoy this warming coconut and corn curry for an easy meat-free meal for two. Full of warming spices, it’s a quick and comforting vegan dinner','["150g red lentils","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, finely sliced","thumb-sized piece of ginger, finely sliced, plus extra to serve","1 tbsp turmeric","1 tbsp curry powder (check it’s gluten free if needed)","250g baby corn, halved diagonally","110g coconut yogurt, plus extra to serve","½ small bunch of coriander, leaves picked"]','["Put the lentils in a sieve and rinse until the water runs clean. Put the oil in asaucepanover a medium heat, tip in the onion and cook for 8 mins until softened. Add the ginger, turmeric and curry powder, and cook for another minute until fragrant. Stir in the lentils.","Tip in 400ml hot water and bring to the boil. Turn the heat down to medium and simmer for 15 mins until most of the water has been absorbed. Add the baby corn and 100ml water, cover and continue to simmer for 5-10 mins until the lentils are soft and the corn still has a little bite. Stir in the coconut yogurt to warm up, but don’t let it boil. Serve topped with more coconut yogurt, if you like, and coriander leaves sprinkled over."]','2026-01-10 12:13:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4501,4501,'en','Banana overnight oats','Rustle up these easy overnight oats made with bananas, nut butter and almonds for a tasty breakfast. Prepped the night before, they’re ideal for busy mornings','["2 bananas, peeled","100g porridge oats","¼ tsp ground cinnamon, plus a pinch to serve","1 tbsp maple syrup","300ml milk of your choice, plus a splash","2 tbsp peanut or almond butter, plus extra to serve","2 tbsp flaked or chopped almonds","2-4 tbsp natural yogurt, to serve (optional)"]','["Mash 1 banana in a bowl with a fork until smooth. Stir in the oats, cinnamon, maple syrup, milk and peanut butter. Mix well, then cover and chill overnight.","The next morning, stir the porridge, adding another splash of milk if the mixture is quite stiff. Divide between two bowls. Slice the remaining banana and scatter this over the porridge, drizzle with more nut butter and sprinkle over the almonds. Top with spoonfuls of yogurt, if using, and sprinkle with a pinch more cinnamon before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4503,4503,'en','Zingy clementine, turkey & peanut salad','Use up Christmas leftovers in a clever way with this healthy, zingy salad, which makes the most of leftover turkey, surplus clementines and peanuts','["200g frozen edamame beans","2 limes, zested and juiced","2 tbsp peanut butter","2 tsp light soy sauce","2 tsp honey","¼ red cabbage (about 220g), finely shredded","1 red pepper, thinly sliced","200g leftover cooked turkey or chicken, shredded","small bunch of coriander (or use mint or a mixture), leaves picked","4 clementines, peeled and sliced into rounds","50g peanuts, toasted and roughly chopped"]','["Cook the edamame in a small pan of boiling water for 2-3 mins. Drain, then rinse under cold running water and drain again.","Combine the lime zest and juice, the peanut butter, soy sauce, honey and some seasoning in a large bowl to make a dressing, adding a splash of water if needed to loosen. Add the edamame, shredded cabbage, sliced pepper and shredded turkey to the bowl and toss everything together until well-coated.","Tip the salad onto a platter, then scatter with the coriander and clementine slices. Gently mix these into the salad with salad servers, being careful not to break the fruit up too much. Scatter over the peanuts just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4505,4505,'en','Gory guts pizza tear ‘n’ share bread','Throw a Halloween party to remember with this gory tear ‘n’ share bread. Make a tomato sauce base and use the pizza fillings of your choice','["500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","2 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","½ tsp dried oregano","250g grated mozzarella or cheddar, or use a mixture","pizza fillings of your choice (we used olives and ham)","2 tbsp herby garlic butter"]','["Tip the flour into a large bowl. Add the yeast to one side of the bowl and 2 tsp salt to the other. Pour in 300ml warm water and mix with a wooden spoon or in a stand mixer fitted with a dough hook until you have a soft dough (you may need to add up to 25ml more water if the dough seems dry). Knead on a lightly floured work surface for 10 mins or in the mixer for 5 mins until you have a soft, stretchy dough. Rub a little of the oil over the ball of dough, then put it in a clean bowl and cover with a tea towel. Leave to prove in a warm place for 2 hrs, or chill overnight (or for up to 24 hrs).","Heat the remaining oil in a pan over a medium heat and sizzle the garlic for 30 seconds – don’t let it brown. Add the tomatoes, oregano and 2 tsp sugar. Season well. Reduce the heat to low-medium and bubble for 20-30 mins until the sauce is thick and rich. Use a potato masher to squash any remaining lumps of tomato into the sauce. Leave to cool until ready to use.Once completely cool, will keep in the fridge in an airtight container for up to three days or the freezer for six months.","When you’re ready to assemble, spread the sauce over the base of a largeroasting tinor baking dish (ours was 40 x 30cm). Roll the dough out on a floured surface into a 60 x 30cm rectangle. Cut the rectangle in half lengthways so you have two smaller rectangles measuring 15 x 30cm. Pile the cheese along the centre of each rectangle and add any pizza toppings you like. Pinch the long sides of the rectangles together to enclose the fillings – do this carefully so you don’t break the dough. Squeeze along the length of each long sausage to make sure they are well-sealed, and gently stretch them out to make them slightly longer. Arrange the dough sausages over the sauce seam-side down, wiggling them into the shape of intestines but leaving a little space between for the bread to expand as it bakes. Cover and leave to prove at room temp for 30 mins or chill for up to 8 hrs. Heat the oven to 200C/180C/gas 6.","Bake for 45 mins until the bread is golden brown. Brush with the herby garlic butter, then leave to cool for at least 10 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:13:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4507,4507,'en','Miso & butternut soup','Make lunch more exciting with this silky and deeply savoury miso and butternut soup. Delivering all of your five-a-day, it’s also bursting with goodness','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 large onion, chopped","400g butternut squash, skin-on, cut into chunks","2 garlic cloves, chopped","210g can butter beans, drained","2 tsp vegetable bouillon","80g shredded kale, finely chopped","2 tsp sesame oil","2 tsp toasted sesame seeds","2 tsp finely grated ginger","1 tbsp brown rice miso"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and fry the onion for 5 mins to soften. Add the squash and garlic, and stir for a minute. Add the beans and bouillon along with a litre of water, then cover and simmer for 20 mins until the squash is tender.","Meanwhile, steam the kale for 10 mins, then toss together with the sesame oil, seeds and ginger.","Add the miso to the soup, then blitz until smooth using ahand blender. Pour into bowls and top with the sesame kale mix to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4509,4509,'en','Pesto egg muffin bites','Prepare these pesto egg and feta muffin bites for breakfast, an afternoon snack, or as part of a picnic hamper. Simple to make, kids will love them!','["low-cal cooking spray, for the tin","18 cherry tomatoes, quartered","80g feta or goat’s cheese, crumbled","6 medium eggs","30ml milk","2 tbsp pesto (check the label if you’re vegetarian)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Spray a 12-hole muffin tin with the oil spray. Evenly divide the tomatoes among the holes, and top each one with around 2 tsp of the feta or goat’s cheese.","Crack the eggs into a large bowl, then add the milk, pesto and seasoning and whisk to combine. Pour the mixture evenly into each hole.","Bake for 20 mins or until the egg is set. Cool for 2-3 mins in the tin, then remove and leave to cool on awire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:13:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4511,4511,'en','Harira','Make a warming bowl of harira, the Moroccan soup full of pulses, tomato, beef and spices. It’s hearty, satisfying and full of flavour – perfect for cold days','["1 tbsp olive oil","300g braising beef or boneless beef, trimmed of excess fat, cut into 3cm pieces","1 small onion, finely chopped","1 tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp ground black pepper","¼ tsp ground ginger","1 tbsp chopped fresh parsley","1 tbsp tomato purée","pinch of saffron","70g dried chickpeas, soaked overnight and drained (or 140g canned chickpeas, drained)","6 large tomatoes, grated or blitzed in a food processor","100g celery (2 stalks), finely chopped","80g dried green lentils","3 tbsp cornflour or plain flour","2 tbsp chopped fresh coriander and lemon wedges, to serve"]','["Heat the olive oil in a large flameproofcasseroleover a medium heat. Add the meat, onion and spices with 1½ tsp salt. Leave for 5-10 mins to lightly brown the meat, stirring occasionally. Add the rest of the ingredients except the lentils, cornflour, coriander and lemon wedges. Add 1 litre of boiling water, bring to the boil, cover with a lid and reduce the heat to low. Leave to simmer for 1 hr.","Add the lentils to the casserole, cover with a lid and cook for a further 20 mins. When the chickpeas, meat and lentils are cooked, mix the cornflour in a small bowl with 3 tbsp water, and stir until smooth. Stir the cornflour mixture into the casserole. Simmer for 5 mins until the harira thickens and takes on a velvety texture.","Scatter over the coriander, then serve hot with lemon wedges on the side for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:13:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4513,4513,'en','One-pot chicken & curry rice','Rustle up this easy family one pot dinner, with chicken, cauliflower, beans and peas in mild curry flavours. Serve with yogurt and mango chutney on the side','["2 tbsp vegetable oil or ghee","2 large onions, finely sliced","4 large garlic cloves, crushed","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely chopped","4 heaped tbsp mild curry paste","1 tsp turmeric","4 cardamom pods, bashed","1 cinnamon stick","4 small skinless chicken breasts or 8 skinless and boneless chicken thighs (about 600g), cut into bite-sized chunks","250g basmati rice, rinsed","600ml chicken stock","200ml coconut milk","75g frozen peas","150g green beans, rimmed and halved","½ cauliflower (about 225g) broken into small florets","50g raisins or sultanas","coriander leaves, flaked almonds, plain yogurt and mango chutney, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a a largecasserole dish(that has a lid) over a medium heat, then fry the onion, garlic and ginger until brown and fragrant, about 10 mins. Stir in the curry paste, turmeric, cardamom and cinnamon, and stir for a few minutes. Add the chicken and cook for another couple of minutes, stirring to colour on all sides.","Add the rice, stir well, then stir in the stock, coconut milk, a generous pinch of seasoning, the veg and raisins. Bring to the boil, then reduce to a simmer, pop the lid on and cook for about 25-30 mins until the water has been absorbed, the chicken and rice are cooked through, and the veg is tender. Season to taste. Remove the cardamom and cinnamon stick, then scatter over the almonds and coriander. Serve with yogurt and mango chutney on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:13:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4515,4515,'en','Next level beef burgers','This summer treat yourself to our ultimate beef burgers and buns made from scratch. They’re well worth the effort and perfect for a weekend entertaining treat','["250g plain white flour, plus extra for dusting","20g golden caster sugar","5g fast-action dried yeast","150ml milk","1 egg, beaten","50g butter, softened","sesame seeds, for sprinkling (optional)","600g dry-aged chuck steak, cut into large chunks","toppings of your choice, such as cheese, onions, tomatoes or lettuce","3 tbsp mayonnaise","2 tbsp ketchup or sriracha (or use 1 tbsp of each)","1 tbsp American mustard","1 small gherkin, finely chopped, plus extra to serve","large pinch of garlic granules"]','["To make your own buns, tip the flour, sugar, yeast and 1 tsp salt into the bowl of astand mixerfitted with a paddle attachment. With the motor running on medium speed, gradually add the milk, then half the egg. Leave to mix for a few minutes, then add the butter, a little at a time, until the dough is elastic and shiny – about 5 mins. Alternatively, do this in a bowl using an electricwhisk.","Divide the dough into four and roll each piece into a round on a lightly floured surface. Arrange well spaced apart on abaking traylined with baking parchment. Press down gently to spread them out a little and leave in a warm place for 2 hrs, or in the fridge overnight, until doubled in size.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Brush the remaining egg over the buns and scatter with the sesame seeds, if using. Bake for 13-15 mins until risen and golden. Leave to cool.Can be made up to a day ahead.","For the sauce, stir together all the ingredients and set aside.Can be made up to a day ahead and kept chilled.","To make the burgers, chill the chuck steak in the freezer alongside the blade and, if it fits, bowl of a food processor for 30 mins until the meat is firm but not frozen solid. Working quickly, tip half the chilled beef into thefood processorand pulse eight to 10 times until the meat is minced, being careful not to overwork it. Tip the mince onto a tray and repeat with the remaining steak, then mix both lots together with ½ tsp salt. Divide into four portions and gently form each into a loose patty a bit wider than the buns. Don’t overwork it.","Cook the burgers as soon as possible after forming. Set a large, heavy frying pan over a medium heat. Split the buns and toast, cut-side down, in the pan (you may need to do this in batches). Remove to a plate, then sear the burgers, pressing them down with a spatula as they cook, for 4-5 mins on each side for medium rare or 6-7 mins for medium. Top with cheese, if you like, after flipping them. When the burgers are cooked, assemble as preferred with the buns, toppings of your choice and the burger sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:13:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4517,4517,'en','Roast peppers with ‘jammy’ eggs & almond & parsley dressing','Cook up a speedy lunch of roast peppers with soft eggs, served with an almond and parsley dressing. Enjoy with crusty bread','["20g blanched almonds, chopped","1 small bunch of flat-leaf parsley, chopped","1 large garlic clove, finely chopped","1 tbsp white balsamic vinegar or sherry vinegar","7 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","8 medium eggs","250g roasted red peppers from a jar, drained and sliced into strips crusty bread, to serve"]','["Make the dressing by bashing the almonds, parsley, garlic and some seasoning together using apestle and mortar. You want to create a slightly chunky mixture. Stir in the vinegar and the olive oil, bashing gently as you go. Taste for seasoning, bearing in mind that the dressing can be quite strong as you are pouring it over eggs.","Boil a pan of water, add the eggs and cook for 7-8 mins. This will give you what some people call ‘jammy’ eggs – they are only just firm enough to be considered hard-boiled, and the very centre is still a little soft. Put the eggs in cold water, then peel them as soon as they’re warm enough to handle. Halve the eggs and arrange them on a serving plate. Season, then drape the peppers around the eggs and spoon the dressing over the top. Eat with some good crusty bread, while the eggs are still warm."]','2026-01-10 12:13:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4519,4519,'en','Easy kedgeree','A pared-back take on kedgeree, this simple yet delicious five-ingredient recipe is also low in fat and calories','["2 tbsp curry powder of your choice (we used madras)","300g basmati rice","600ml chicken stock","400g skinless smoked haddock","100g frozen peas"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Heat an ovenproof saucepan or flameproofcasseroleover a medium heat and toast the curry powder for 1 min. Stir in the rice to coat it in the curry powder, then pour over the stock. Bring to the boil, then lay the haddock on top. Cover. Cook in the oven for 30 mins.","Carefully remove from the oven. Leave to rest for a minute, then stir through the peas while breaking up the haddock and fluffing the rice. Season to taste, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:13:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4521,4521,'en','Lemon & herb chicken traybake with butter beans & potato wedges','Make this versatile traybake for a hearty family meal. Filling and full of fuss-free, flavourful ingredients, this is budget-friendly food at its best','["800g potatoes","3 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, finely sliced","4 garlic cloves, chopped","400g can tomatoes","2 x 400g cans butter beans, drained","2 tsp mixed dried herbs","1kg skin-on, bone-in chicken thighs","1 lemon, cut into slices"]','["Cut the potatoes into large wedges, then toss well in a large bowl with 2 tbsp of the olive oil and some salt. Spread the wedges out on abaking tray.","Fry the onion and garlic in the remaining olive oil over a low heat until soft and translucent. Add the tomatoes, butter beans, and some seasoning. Simmer for a few minutes, then pour into a baking tin or dish.","Mix a pinch of salt with the herbs. Stuff equal amounts under the skin of each chicken thigh. Put a slice of lemon on top of each thigh, then arrange on top of the tomato and bean mixture in the baking tin.","Bake the wedges and chicken traybake in the oven at 180C/160C fan/gas 4 for 45 mins until the chicken is cooked through. Check the potatoes after about 30 mins, shaking them around in the tray – depending on the size of the wedges, they may already be cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:13:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4523,4523,'en','Salsa verde salmon with smashed chickpea salad','Serve up this healthy salsa verde salmon with smashed chickpea, kale and roasted red pepper salad for a quick and nutritious midweek meal','["3 tsp olive oil","zest and juice of 1 orange","2 skin-on salmon fillets","small bunch of parsley","1/2 tbsp Dijon mustard","1 shallot, finely chopped","1/2 tbsp red wine vinegar","400g can chickpeas, drained","2 roasted red peppers from a jar, chopped","50g kale"]','["Heat the grill to high.Whisk1 tsp olive oil with the orange zest, a splash of the juice and some seasoning. Put the salmon fillets skin-side down on a non-stick baking tray and pour over the marinade. Leave to marinate at room temperature.","Put the parsley, Dijon mustard, 1/2 the chopped shallot, red wine vinegar, 1 tsp olive oil, and the remaining orange juice in a smallfood processorand blitz to a thick sauce, adding a splash of water to loosen if needed.","Heat 1 tsp olive oil in a frying pan and fry the rest of the chopped shallot for 5 mins. Stir in the chickpeas and season. Turn up the heat and stir until the chickpeas are just crisp. Mash roughly and stir in the roasted red peppers and kale. Add a splash of water and cover until the kale is wilted. Keep warm. Grill the salmon for 4-6 mins until cooked to your liking. Divide the mash between plates, and top with the salmon and salsa."]','2026-01-10 12:13:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4525,4525,'en','Carrot & parsnip soup','Create a batch of creamy parsnip and carrot soup for a warming lunch or supper. Serve with crusty bread and freeze any leftovers you have for busy days','["½ tbsp olive oil","2 onions, finely chopped","2 celery sticks, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","½ small bunch thyme, leaves picked","3 large carrots, peeled and roughly chopped","2 large parsnips, peeled and roughly chopped","1 litre vegetable stock","100ml double cream","¼ bunch parsley, finely chopped (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a largesaucepanand fry the onion and celery for 10 mins, stirring occasionally until softened. If they start to catch, add a small splash of water. Add the garlic, thyme and ½ tsp black pepper and cook for 2 mins. Add the carrots, parsnips and stock and bring to the boil. Reduce to a simmer and cook for 20 mins until the vegetables are soft, stirring occasionally.","Blend using a stickblenderuntil smooth. Add the cream and blitz again until combined, then taste for seasoning. To serve, ladle into bowls and scatter over a little chopped parsley, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:13:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4527,4527,'en','Fridge-raid fried rice','Pack in the veg with this healthy chicken fried rice, which uses everyday foods you’ll find in the fridge for a quick and easy family supper','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 white onion, finely chopped","1 carrot, finely chopped","100g green beans, chopped","1 red or yellow pepper, finely chopped","½ medium broccoli, chopped into small florets","150g cooked chicken (or any other meat), roughly chopped","300g cold cooked rice","2 eggs, beaten","1 tbsp sesame oil","1 tbsp oyster sauce","1 spring onion, finely sliced","1 tsp toasted sesame seeds"]','["Heat half the vegetable oil in awokor a frying pan over a medium-high heat, and stir-fry the onions, carrots and green beans for 5 mins. Add the peppers, broccoli and chicken, and stir-fry for 3 mins more.","Tip in the rice and stir-fry for another 4 mins until all the grains of rice have separated. Push the rice and vegetables to the side, then add the remaining vegetable oil to the other. Crack in the egg and scramble briefly before stirring into the veg and chicken mixture.","Stir in the sesame oil and oyster sauce to coat, then garnish with the spring onions and sesame seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:13:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4529,4529,'en','White bean hummus with pickled beetroot & kale','Make some homemade hummus and top with pickled beetroot and kale to make it extra special. It’s ideal for a buffet or as a starter or side dish with crudités','["600g cooked beetroot, cut into small cubes","200ml olive oil, plus 2 tbsp and extra for drizzling","100ml red wine vinegar","2 shallots, peeled and finely chopped","2 bay leaves","1 lemon, zest peeled into strips, juiced","2 x 400g cans butterbeans or cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","140g natural yogurt","3 garlic cloves, 2 crushed, 1 sliced","150g shredded kale"]','["Mix the beetroot, 100ml oil, the vinegar, shallots, bay and lemon zest. Season, cover and chill overnight.","Tip the beans into afood processorwith the lemon juice, yogurt, crushed garlic, 100ml oil, and some seasoning. Blitz until smooth, adding a splash of water to loosen if needed.","Heat the 2 tbsp oil in a largefrying pan, and fry the sliced garlic for 1-2 mins. Add the kale and a splash of water, then stir and fry for 8-10 mins more until the kale is dark green and the stalks are tender. Add a splash more water if needed to wilt the kale. Drain the beetroot mixture and stir into the kale until just warmed through. Remove from the heat.","Spoon the bean dip onto a large bowl, then spoon over the beetroot and kale mixture. Drizzle over a little more olive oil and serve the hummus at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:14:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4531,4531,'en','Puris with potato masala (alu puri)','Try making this traditional Indian dish – a popular lunch during the Holi festivities in spring','["500g potatoes, Maris Piper or King Edwards, quartered","2 tomatoes, blanched, roughly chopped","2 onions, diced","4 garlic cloves","4 tbsp sunflower oil, plus extra for rolling","1½ tsp cumin seeds","3 Indian bay leaves (tez patta) or 4cm cinnamon stick","½ tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","1 tsp ground coriander","2 tbsp fresh chopped coriander","125g chapati flour (chapati atta) or wholemeal flour","125g plain flour","½ tsp fine salt","2 tbsp sunflower oil, plus extra for deep-frying"]','["To make the alu masala, put the potatoes in a pan with the chopped tomatoes, onion and garlic. Pour over enough cold water to cover the potatoes by 3cm and boil until the potatoes are tender.","Scoop out the potatoes and lightly crush them with a fork – aim to keep the texture rough and chunky. Strain the cooking liquid into a jug, reserving both the liquid and the onion mixture left in the sieve.","Heat the oil in awokor karahi over a medium heat and fry the cumin seeds and Indian bay leaves or cinnamon for a few seconds, until the cumin releases its aroma.","Add the reserved onion mixture and continue frying for 8-10 mins until the onions have browned. Turn down the heat and add the turmeric, chilli powder and ground coriander and cook for 1 min more, stirring all the time.","Add the potatoes along with the reserved cooking liquid. Simmer for 5 mins, then turn off the heat and stir in the chopped coriander. Cover and leave the flavours to infuse while you make the puris.","To make the puris, sift the flours and salt into a bowl. Work the oil into the flour with your fingers, then add enough cold water to make a very firm dough. Knead for about 5 mins until smooth, then shape into a ball. Put into a lightly oiled bowl, cover, and set aside for at least 30 mins.","Knead the dough again for 1 min, then divide it equally into 20-22 balls, each about 2.5cm in diameter. Slightly flatten the top of each ball androll outon an oiled surface to 11cm-diameter discs about the thickness of a £1 coin. You can flip the dough over once or twice while you roll.","Fill a karahi or wok with oil until it is no more than two-thirds full and heat to 180C, or until a cube of bread dropped in browns in 30 seconds. Lower a puri gently into the oil. It will sizzle and rise up to the top within a few seconds. Lightly press on the top of it with a fish slice so that it puffs up as it cooks. Fry for 1 min, then flip it over and fry on the other side for 1 min more. Drain on kitchen paper and repeat with the remaining dough balls.","To serve, warm the potato masala through and eat it with the puris alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:14:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4533,4533,'en','Chole with cumin rice & raita','Make a chickpea curry served with raita for a brilliant budget-friendly family meal. As well as being quick and easy, it’s healthy too','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 red onion, finely chopped","4 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp finely grated ginger","4 garlic cloves, finely grated","2 tsp curry powder","2 x 400g cans chickpeas","100g tomato purée","30g fresh coriander, chopped","300g basmati rice","¼ cucumber","200g Greek-style yogurt","½ tsp cumin seeds, toasted and crushed","small handful fresh mint, chopped","handful of pomegranate seeds, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and fry the onions over a low heat for 10 mins until starting to brown. Add 3 tsp of the cumin, the ginger, garlic and curry powder. Stir for a minute to keep the spices from burning.","Tip in the chickpeas and the liquid from the can, along with the tomato purée, 20g of the coriander and some seasoning. Simmer over a low heat for about 10 mins. Add a splash of water if it looks too dry.","Meanwhile, rinse and drain the rice, add the remaining 1 tsp cumin seeds, 2 litres of boiling water and seasoning. Cook for about 10 mins, or until the rice is tender. Drain.","For the raita, grate the cucumber and stir it into the yogurt with the cumin, mint and the remaining coriander. Season, scatter over the pomegranate seeds, then serve alongside the chole and rice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4535,4535,'en','Creamy edamame pesto pasta with rocket salad','Make a budget-friendly family meal with our quick and easy edamame pesto pasta. Use wholemeal spaghetti for added fibre if you prefer','["300g spaghetti","350g frozen edamame beans, shelled","50ml extra virgin olive oil","50g cashew nuts","2 garlic cloves","50g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, plus extra to serve","90g rocket leaves"]','["Cook the pasta following pack instructions. Meanwhile, put the frozen edamame in a bowl, pour over 2 tbsp of water and cook in themicrowaveon high for about 5 mins. Leave in the water, covered, for 2 mins more. Alternatively, simmer the edamame in a pan of boiling water for 2-3 mins.","To make the pesto, put 150g of the edamame, the oil, cashews, garlic, parmesan and some seasoning in ablenderand whizz to a smooth paste. You can add up to 6 tbsp water to help it blend if the mixture is too thick.","Once the pasta is cooked, stir in the pesto and the remaining edamame, then serve with the rocket on the side and an extra grating of cheese, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4537,4537,'en','Chorizo, rocket & preserved lemon calzones','Fill these flavour-packed calzone ahead, then bake straight from the freezer when you’re busy. The combo of spicy chorizo and smoky paprika pastry is divine','["500g strong bread flour, plus extra for dusting","2 tbsp paprika","1½ tsp fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for the bowl","semolina, for dusting","100g cooking chorizo, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","350ml passata","1 tbsp brown sugar","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 small preserved lemons, quartered, pith removed and zest finely chopped","½ small bunch of basil, roughly chopped","50g rocket, roughly chopped","75g mozzarella, torn into chunks","25g grated parmesan"]','["For the dough, put the flour, paprika, yeast, oil, 300ml lukewarm water and a large pinch of salt in a bowl. Mix into a soft, slightly wet dough. Knead in astand mixerfitted with a dough hook or by hand for 10 mins until smooth (it will still be quite soft). Tip into an oiled bowl, cover and leave to rise for 2 hrs.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Fry the chorizo in a largesaucepanover a medium heat for 2 mins until some of its oils have been released. Add the garlic and continue to fry for 30 seconds. Add the passata, sugar, vinegar and preserved lemons, and simmer for 5 mins until thick. Stir in the basil and rocket. Leave to cool.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 with a baking sheet inside. Divide the dough into four pieces, then roll each out on a lightly dusted surface to a thin 30cm circle. Lay each circle on a square of baking parchment dusted with semolina. Spread the cooled filling over half of each circle, leaving a border, then top with some of the mozzarella. Brush around the edge of each circle with a little water. Working with one circle at a time, fold one half over the other so the filling is enclosed, then crimp the edge to seal.The calzones can now be frozen for up to three months (see below).Lift the calzones on the parchment squares onto the hot baking sheet in the oven, sprinkle the parmesan on top, and bake for 15-20 mins until puffed up and golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:14:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4539,4539,'en','Sabich','Dress this sandwich with tahini and amba sauces for a taste of Israel. It’s full of flavour, with aubergine, hummus, eggs, pickles and more','["2 tomatoes, diced","½  small cucumber, diced","2 spring onions, chopped","1½  tbsp olive oil, plus extra for frying","squeeze of lemon juice","2 aubergines, trimmed and sliced into 1cm rounds","4 pitta breads","4 medium hard-boiled eggs, peeled and sliced","200g hummus","150g radishes, trimmed and halved if large","250g carrots, cut into slices on the diagonal","4 shallots, finely sliced","250g small cauliflower florets","500ml white wine or cider vinegar","3½  tbsp granulated sugar","¾  tbsp sea salt flakes","1 tsp yellow mustard seeds","2 tsp caraway seeds","1 tsp black peppercorns, bruised","½  tbsp coriander seeds, bruised","1 tbsp olive oil","3 garlic cloves, chopped","1 red chilli, halved, deseeded and chopped","1 tsp black mustard seeds","1 tsp turmeric","½  tsp fenugreek seeds","pinch cayenne pepper","2 firm mangoes, peeled and flesh chopped (about 375g)","50ml white wine vinegar","1 tbsp light brown soft sugar","squeeze of lime juice","100g tahini"]','["To make the pickles, put all the veg in a sterilised 1-litre jar. Put the vinegar, sugar, salt and spices in a pan with 400ml water and bring to the boil. Leave to cool, then pour over the veg. Seal and leave to pickle at room temperature for 48 hrs. Will keep in the fridge for up to four weeks.","To make the amba sauce, heat the oil in a pan set over a medium heat, then cook the garlic and chilli until just soft. Tip in the spices and cook for 1 min, add the mango and stir to coat, then add the vinegar, sugar and 100ml water. Cover and simmer for 10-15 mins until the mango is soft. Season to taste and squeeze over the lime juice. Will keep in the fridge for up to one week.","For the tahini sauce, combine the ingredients with 80ml water and season to taste. It should be the consistency of double cream.","Toss the tomatoes, cucumber and spring onions with the oil, season and squeeze over the lemon juice.","Heat some olive oil in a frying pan over a medium-high heat and cook the aubergines in batches for 5-8 mins on each side until just golden. Season, then reduce the heat and continue to cook until soft.","Toast and split open the pittas, then stuff with the aubergine slices, eggs, hummus, salad, pickles and amba sauce. Drizzle over the tahini sauce to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4541,4541,'en','Quinoa, goat’s cheese & peach salad','Make this tabbouleh-inspired quinoa, chard, goat’s cheese and grilled peach salad as something different for lunch. It’s full of textures and fresh flavours','["200g quinoa","100g chard, finely shredded","4 peaches or nectarines, stoned, 2 quartered and 2 finely sliced","1-2 lemons, juiced","4-5 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","50g hazelnuts, roughly chopped","25g parsley, leaves picked and finely chopped","25g mint, leaves picked and finely chopped, plus extra mint leaves to serve","4 tbsp capers, drained","2 tbsp sumac (optional)","1-2 tbsp red wine vinegar","100g soft goat’s cheese, crumbled","2-3 tbsp sesame seeds, toasted"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and cook the quinoa following pack instructions. Drain, mix with the chard, then set aside to cool and wilt.","Put the sliced peaches in a bowl, drizzle over the lemon juice and set aside. Put the quartered peaches on a baking tray. Toss with 1 tbsp olive oil. Roast for 10-15 mins until soft. Scatter the hazelnuts over a second baking tray and toast in the oven for the last 5 mins until golden.","Combine the quinoa mix, herbs, sliced peaches and any juice from the bowl, the capers, sumac (if using), vinegar and remaining oil. Season. Put on a large serving plate, and top with the roasted peaches, goat’s cheese, hazelnuts, sesame seeds and extra mint leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:14:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4543,4543,'en','Kidney bean curry','A rescue recipe for when there''s nothing in the fridge, or when you fancy something cheap, delicious and filling','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely chopped","1 small pack coriander, stalks finely chopped, leaves roughly shredded","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground paprika","2 tsp garam masala","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can kidney beans, in water","cooked basmati rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a low-medium heat. Add the onion and a pinch of salt and cook slowly, stirring occasionally, until softened and just starting to colour. Add the garlic, ginger and coriander stalks and cook for a further 2 mins, until fragrant.","Add the spices to the pan and cook for another 1 min, by which point everything should smell aromatic. Tip in the chopped tomatoes and kidney beans in their water, then bring to the boil.","Turn down the heat and simmer for 15 mins until the curry is nice and thick. Season to taste, then serve with the basmati rice and the coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:14:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4545,4545,'en','Pea falafels with minty couscous salad','Give falafel a makeover by using a mix of chickpeas and frozen peas, serve with couscous and a dollop of yogurt for a cheap but tasty meal','["400g frozen peas","400g chickpeas, drained","3 tbsp flour, plus a little for dusting","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp cumin seeds","2 tbsp smooth peanut butter or tahini","small bunch parsley, chopped","small bunch mint, chopped","zest and juice 1 lemon","200g couscous","3 tbsp olive oil","4 large tomatoes, chopped","100ml natural yogurt"]','["Put the peas in a colander and run under the hot tap to defrost. Drain well, then\r\nput half into a food processor. Add the chickpeas, flour, garlic, cumin seeds, peanut butter or tahini, parsley, lemon zest and plenty of seasoning. Whizz the ingredients\r\nto a paste, adding a splash of water if it looks too crumbly. Using wet hands, shape the mixture into 8 patties, dust with flour, then place on a plate and chill for 10 mins, or longer if you have time. Boil the kettle.","Place the couscous in a large bowl, season, then pour over enough boiling water to just cover. Set aside for 5 mins.","Heat 2 tbsp oil in a large pan. Cook the falafels for 2-3 mins on each side, until crisp and golden – you may have to do this in batches, so keep them warm in a low oven while you do. Add the remaining oil, lemon juice, mint, tomatoes and peas to the couscous. Serve the salad and falafels with a dollop of yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:14:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4547,4547,'en','Cauliflower, paneer & pea curry','Ready in less than an hour, this easy, vegetarian curry recipe made with pan-fried Indian cheese and vegetables is also cheap to prepare','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","225g pack paneer, cut into cubes","1 head of cauliflower, broken into small florets","2 onions, thickly sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 heaped tbsp tikka masala paste","500g carton passata","200g frozen peas","small pack coriander, roughly chopped","basmati rice or naan breads, to serve","raita or your favourite chutney, to serve"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of oil in a large non-stick frying pan, add the paneer and fry gently until crisp. Remove with a slotted spoon and set aside. Add the remaining oil and the cauliflower to the pan, and cook for 10 mins until browned. Add the onions, and a little more oil if needed, and cook for a further 5 mins until softened. Stir in the garlic and curry paste, then pour in the passata and 250ml water, and season. Bring to a simmer, then cover and cook for 18-20 mins or until the cauliflower is just tender.","Add the frozen peas and crispy paneer to the pan and cook for a further 5 mins. Stir through most of the coriander and garnish with the rest. Serve with basmati rice or naan bread, raita or your favourite chutney."]','2026-01-10 12:14:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4549,4549,'en','Indian sweet potato & dhal pies','Spiced red lentil dhal is topped with creamy sweet potato mash in these individual vegetarian pies – a cheap weeknight dinner option','["650g sweet potatoes, peeled and cut into small chunks","1 onion, halved and thinly sliced","2 carrots, scrubbed, halved and sliced lengthways","15g ginger, finely grated","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","2 tsp oil","1 tbsp curry powder","1 vegetable stock cube","2 tbsp tomato purée","85g red lentils","good handful coriander, chopped, plus sprigs to serve","generous spoonful 0% fat Greek-style yogurt","broccoli, to serve (optional)"]','["Place the sweet potato in a pan of boiling water and cook for 15 mins, or until tender.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a pan and fry the onion and carrot, for 2 minutes, then add the garlic and ginger and cook, stirring for 1 min more. Tip in the curry powder, stir round the pan then add 750ml of the boiling water with the stock cube, tomato purée and lentils. Cover the pan and boil for 20 mins until the vegetables are tender and the liquid has been absorbed. Stir in the chopped coriander.","When the sweet potatoes are cooked, drain and mash them with the yogurt and seasoning.","Spoon the lentil mix into one big or two individual dishes then top with the sweet potato mixture, scatter with the coriander and serve with broccoli, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4551,4551,'en','Fruit & nut breakfast bowl','Top cheap and healthy porridge oats with chopped fresh oranges, Greek yogurt and a sprinkling of dried fruit, nuts and seeds','["6 tbsp porridge oats","2 oranges","just under ½  x 200ml tub 0% fat Greek-style yogurt","60g pot raisins, nuts, goji berries and seeds"]','["Put the oats in a non-stick pan with 400ml water and cook over the heat, stirring occasionally for about 4 mins until thickened.","Meanwhile, cut the peel and pith from the oranges then slice them in half, cutting down either side, as closely as you can, to where the stalk would be as this will remove quite a tough section of the membrane. Now just chop the oranges.","Pour the porridge into bowls, spoon on the yogurt then pile on the oranges and the fruit, nut and seed mixture."]','2026-01-10 12:14:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4553,4553,'en','Egg & tomato baps','Fill wholewheat bread rolls with juicy tomatoes and a herby omelette for a filling yet cheap breakfast or brunch','["2 tomatoes, halved","2 tsp olive oil","4 eggs","couple sprigs parsley, chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","2 wholewheat baps"]','["Brush the cut side of the tomatoes with a little of the oil then cook them on a low heat, cut-side down in a small, non-stick frying pan. While they cook, beat the eggs with seasoning and the chopped parsley in a small bowl. Turn the tomatoes over to briefly heat on the other side and then set aside.","Wipe the pan, then add the remaining oil and cook the garlic on a medium heat for a few seconds, stirring all the time until softened. Pour in the egg mixture and cook, stirring occasionally over the heat. Once it’s almost set flip over to cook the other side for a few seconds more.","Halve the baps and squash on the tomatoes, quarter the omelette and serve, 2 pieces inside each bap."]','2026-01-10 12:14:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4555,4555,'en','Chicken, edamame & ginger pilaf','Make this healthy rice pot for a mid-week supper – crammed with fibre and vitamin C','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, thinly sliced","thumb-sized piece ginger, grated","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely sliced","3 skinless chicken breasts, cut into bite-sized pieces","250g basmati rice","600ml vegetable stock","100g frozen edamame / soya beans","coriander leaves and fat-free Greek yoghurt (optional), to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a medium saucepan,\r\nthen add the onion, ginger and chilli,\r\nalong with some seasoning. Cook for\r\n5 mins, then add the chicken and rice.\r\nCook for 2 mins more, then add the\r\nstock and bring to the boil. Turn the\r\nheat to low, cover and cook for\r\n8-10 mins until the rice is just cooked.\r\nDuring the final 3 mins of cooking,\r\nadd the edamame beans. Sprinkle\r\nsome coriander leaves on top and\r\nserve with a dollop of Greek yogurt,\r\nif you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4557,4557,'en','Red lentil, chickpea & chilli soup','Come home to a warming bowlful of this filling, low-fat soup','["2 tsp cumin seeds","large pinch chilli flakes","1 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, chopped","140g red split lentils","850ml vegetable stock or water","400g can tomatoes, whole or chopped","200g carton chickpeas or ½ a can, rinsed and drained (freeze leftovers)","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped (save a few leaves, to serve)","4 tbsp 0% Greek yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat a large saucepan and dry-fry the\r\ncumin seeds and chilli flakes for 1 min,\r\nor until they start to jump around the pan\r\nand release their aromas. Add the oil and\r\nonion, and cook for 5 mins. Stir in the\r\nlentils, stock and tomatoes, then bring\r\nto the boil. Simmer for 15 mins until the\r\nlentils have softened.","Whizz the soup with a stick blender\r\nor in a food processor until it is a rough\r\npurée, pour back into the pan and add\r\nthe chickpeas. Heat gently, season well\r\nand stir in the coriander. Finish with\r\na dollop of yogurt and coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:14:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4559,4559,'en','Low-fat moussaka','A rich and comforting Greek classic without the calories, what’s not to love?','["200g frozen sliced peppers","3 garlic cloves, crushed","200g extra-lean minced beef","100g red lentils","2 tsp dried oregano, plus extra for sprinkling","500ml carton passata","1 aubergine, sliced into 1½ cm rounds","4 tomatoes, sliced into 1cm rounds","2 tsp olive oil","25g parmesan, finely grated","170g pot 0% fat Greek yogurt","freshly grated nutmeg"]','["Cook the peppers gently in a large\r\nnon-stick pan for about 5 mins – the water\r\nfrom them should stop them sticking. Add\r\nthe garlic and cook for 1 min more, then\r\nadd the beef, breaking up with a fork, and\r\ncook until brown. Tip in the lentils, half the\r\noregano, the passata and a splash of water.\r\nSimmer for 15-20 mins until the lentils are\r\ntender, adding more water if you need to.","Meanwhile, heat the grill to Medium.\r\nArrange the aubergine and tomato slices\r\non a non-stick baking tray and brush with\r\nthe oil. Sprinkle with the remaining oregano\r\nand some seasoning, then grill for 1-2 mins\r\neach side until lightly charred – you may\r\nneed to do this in batches.","Mix half the Parmesan with the yogurt and\r\nsome seasoning. Divide the beef mixture\r\nbetween 4 small ovenproof dishes and top\r\nwith the sliced aubergine and tomato.\r\nSpoon over the yogurt topping and sprinkle\r\nwith the extra oregano, Parmesan and\r\nnutmeg. Grill for 3-4 mins until bubbling.\r\nServe with a salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4561,4561,'en','Watercress mashed potato','Creamy mash laced with good-for-you greens makes for a simple, low-fat side that’s budget friendly too','["650g floury potatoes, cut into chunks","100ml milk","25g butter","170g bag watercress"]','["Cook the potatoes in a large pan of\r\nsalted water for 15 mins or until tender.\r\nDrain well, then return to the pan to\r\nsteam-dry for a few mins before mashing.","Push the potatoes to one side and\r\nadd the milk and butter to the other side\r\nof the pan. Heat gently until the butter\r\nmelts, then stir into the potatoes with\r\nthe watercress and some seasoning."]','2026-01-10 12:14:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4563,4563,'en','Crab & sweetcorn chowder','This low-fat soup is packed with flavour and so simple to cook','["1 onion, finely chopped","1 leek, green and white parts separated and sliced","2 carrots, chopped","850ml-1 litre/1½  pints - 1¾  pints low-sodium chicken or vegetable stock","1 large potato, diced","175g/ 6oz frozen sweetcorn","170g can white crabmeat, drained","4 tbsp light crème fraîche","1 tsp chopped chives"]','["Put the onion, white part of the leek\r\nand carrots in a large pan and pour on\r\na few tbsp of the stock. Cook over a\r\nmedium heat for about 10 mins, stirring\r\nregularly until soft. Add a splash more\r\nstock if the vegetables start to stick.","Add the potato, green leek and most\r\nof the stock, and simmer for 10-15 mins,\r\nuntil the potato is tender. Tip in the\r\nsweetcorn and crab meat, then cook\r\nfor a further 1-2 mins. Remove from the\r\nheat and stir in the crème fraîche and\r\nsome seasoning. Add the rest of the\r\nstock if the soup is too thick. Sprinkle\r\nwith the chives and serve with brown\r\nbread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4565,4565,'en','Baked sweet potatoes & beans','A superhealthy supper that’s perfect for a busy weeknight, try making double the beans and freezing for next time','["4 small sweet potatoes","1 tbsp smoked paprika, plus extra to serve","1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp brown sugar","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","splash of Worcestershire sauce (Lancashire sauce is a veggie option)","2 x 400g cans mixed beans in water, drained","400g chopped tomatoes","4 tbsp light soured cream, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPierce the sweet potatoes a few times\r\nwith a fork, then cook them in the\r\nmicrowave on High for 8 mins or until\r\nsoft. Rub with 1 tsp of the paprika, 1 tsp\r\nof the oil and some seasoning. Transfer\r\nto a baking tray, put in the oven and cook\r\nfor 10-15 mins until crispy.","Meanwhile, make the beans. Cook\r\nthe onion in the remaining oil until\r\nsoft. Add the garlic, sugar, vinegar,\r\nWorcestershire sauce and the remaining\r\npaprika, and cook for a further 1-2 mins\r\nuntil sticky. Tip in the beans, tomatoes\r\nand a splash of water, and simmer until\r\nthe sweet potatoes are ready.","Serve the sweet potatoes with the\r\nbeans on top, a dollop of soured cream\r\nand a pinch of paprika, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4567,4567,'en','Moroccan spiced cauliflower & almond soup','Satisfying and comforting soup is the ultimate meal in a bowl, like this smooth and spicy North African blend','["1 large cauliflower","2 tbsp olive oil","½  tsp each ground cinnamon, cumin and coriander","2 tbsp harissa paste, plus extra drizzle","1l hot vegetable or chicken stock","50g toasted flaked almonds, plus extra to serve"]','["Cut the cauliflower into small florets.\r\nFry olive oil, ground cinnamon, cumin and coriander\r\nand harissa paste for 2 mins in\r\na large pan. Add the cauliflower, stock and almonds. Cover and cook for 20 mins until\r\nthe cauliflower is tender. Blend soup\r\nuntil smooth, then serve with an extra\r\ndrizzle of harissa and a sprinkle of\r\ntoasted almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:14:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4569,4569,'en','Black bean tostadas with avocado salsa','For a quick veggie health-boost make this speedy supper using flavourful corn tortillas, which make a really nice change from flour tortillas','["8 corn tortillas (look for them near the other wraps or by the Mexican food)","2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","3 garlic cloves, chopped","1 tbsp smoked paprika","1 tbsp ground cumin","5 tbsp cider vinegar","3 tbsp clear honey","3 x 400g cans black beans, rinsed and drained","choose a few toppings- chopped tomatoes, sliced red onion, diced avocado, sliced jalapeño peppers, coriander sprigs","crème fraîche or Tabasco chipotle sauce, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nBrush the tortillas with a little of the oil\r\nand place in a single layer on baking\r\nsheets. Cook for 8 mins until crisp.","In a large frying pan, heat the remaining\r\noil. Add the onion and garlic, and cook\r\nfor 5 mins. Add the spices, vinegar and\r\nhoney. Cook for 2 mins more. Add the\r\nbeans and seasoning, and heat through.","Remove from the heat and mash the\r\nbeans gently with the back of your spoon\r\nto a chunky purée. Spread some beans\r\nover the crispy corn tortillas, scatter\r\nwith your choice of toppings and add a\r\nspoonful of crème fraîche to cool down, or\r\na splash of chipotle Tabasco to spice it up."]','2026-01-10 12:14:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4571,4571,'en','Yellow lentil & coconut curry with cauliflower','This healthy veggie curry is diet-friendly and a great source of iron and fibre','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, thinly sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","thumb-sized piece ginger, finely chopped","3 tbsp curry paste (we used Bart Veeraswamy Gujurat Masala curry paste)","200g yellow lentils, rinsed","1½ l vegetable stock","3 tbsp unsweetened desiccated coconut, plus extra to sprinkle if you like","1 cauliflower, broken into little florets","cooked basmati rice and coriander leaves, plus mango chutney and naan bread (optional), to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan, then\r\nadd the onion, garlic and ginger. Cook\r\nfor 5 mins, add the curry paste, then\r\nstir-fry for 1 min before adding the lentils,\r\nstock and coconut. Bring the mixture\r\nto the boil and simmer for 40 mins or\r\nuntil the lentils are soft.","During the final 10 mins of cooking, stir\r\nin the cauliflower to cook. Spoon rice into\r\n4 bowls, top with the curry and sprinkle\r\nwith coriander leaves, and coconut if you\r\nlike. Serve with mango chutney and naan\r\nbread (optional)."]','2026-01-10 12:14:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4573,4573,'en','Caramelised onion & barley soup with cheese croutons','Nutty and nutritious barley adds real substance to this twist on classic French onion soup','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 medium onions, thinly sliced","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","6 thyme sprigs, chopped","good pinch sugar","500ml vegetable stock","60g barley","60g cavolo nero or kale, thick stalks discarded and leaves sliced","4 slices baguette, toasted","4 tbsp grated Gruyère cheese"]','["Heat the oil in a saucepan, then add\r\nthe onions, garlic, thyme, sugar and a\r\ngood pinch of salt. Cook on a medium-low\r\nheat for 15-20 mins or until golden\r\ncoloured. Add the stock and simmer for\r\na further 10 mins.","In a separate large saucepan of salted\r\nboiling water, cook the barley for 15 mins,\r\nadding the cavolo nero or kale for the\r\nfinal 3 mins of cooking. Drain and rinse\r\nunder cold water, then add to the soup\r\nand warm through.","Heat the grill. Top the toasted bread\r\nwith cheese and place under the grill until\r\nit’s bubbly and melted. Serve in 2 large\r\nbowls with the cheesy croutons on top."]','2026-01-10 12:14:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4575,4575,'en','Cinnamon porridge with banana & berries','Start the day in a superhealthy way with energy-boosting oats and fresh fruit','["100g porridge oats","½  tsp cinnamon, plus extra to serve","4 tsp demerara sugar","450ml skimmed milk","3 bananas, sliced","400g punnet strawberries, hulled and halved","150g pot fat-free natural yogurt"]','["In a medium-sized saucepan,\r\nmix the oats, cinnamon, sugar, milk\r\nand half the sliced bananas. Bring\r\nto the boil, stirring occasionally.\r\nTurn down the heat and cook\r\nfor 4-5 mins, stirring all the time.","Remove and divide between\r\n4 bowls, top with the remaining\r\nbanana, strawberries, a dollop of\r\nyogurt and a sprinkle of cinnamon."]','2026-01-10 12:14:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4577,4577,'en','Spring cabbage with mustard seeds','Give your greens a fresh new look by tossing them with mustard, ginger, onion and garlic','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp mustard seed","1 small onion, finely sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp grated ginger","500g/1lb 2oz spring cabbage, shredded"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan, then cook the\r\nmustard seeds until they are fragrant and\r\nstarting to pop. Add the onion, garlic and\r\nginger, then fry until golden. Tip in the\r\ncabbage and stir to coat in the spices,\r\nthen cook for 5 mins until tender. Season\r\nand serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:14:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4579,4579,'en','Creamy pasta with asparagus & peas','Take five ingredients and whip up this simple green vegetable fusilli supper for two, plus hit 3 of your 5-a-day','["250g fusilli or your favourite pasta shape","300g asparagus spears, woody ends removed, cut into lengths","175g frozen peas","zest and juice ½ lemon","100g soft cheese with chives"]','["Cook the pasta following the pack\r\ninstructions. Two minutes before the end\r\nof the cooking time, add the asparagus\r\nand peas. Boil everything together for the\r\nfinal 2 mins, then scoop out and reserve\r\na cup of the cooking liquid from the pan\r\nbefore draining the pasta and veg.","Return the pasta and veg to the pan\r\nand add the lemon zest, soft cheese and\r\nseasoning. Add a squeeze of lemon juice\r\nto taste and stir in 2-3 tbsp of the cooking\r\nliquid to loosen the sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:14:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4581,4581,'en','Lemon spaghetti with tuna & broccoli','15 minutes is all you need to whip up this fresh, light and healthy fish pasta with olives, capers and greens','["350g spaghetti","250g broccoli, cut into small florets","2 shallots, finely chopped","85g pitted green olives, halved","2 tbsp capers, drained","198g can tuna in oil","zest and juice 1 lemon","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling"]','["Boil the spaghetti in salted water\r\nfor 6 mins. Add the broccoli and\r\nboil for 4 mins more or until both\r\nare just tender.","Meanwhile, mix the shallots, olives,\r\ncapers, tuna and lemon zest and juice\r\nin a roomy serving bowl. Drain the pasta\r\nand broccoli, add to the bowl and toss\r\nreally well with the olive oil and lots of\r\nblack pepper. Serve with a little extra\r\nolive oil drizzled over."]','2026-01-10 12:14:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4583,4583,'en','The ultimate makeover: Blueberry muffins','We’ve created a deliciously light version of this classic muffin that contains virtually no saturated fat','["5 tbsp rapeseed oil","225g self-raising flour","115g wholemeal flour","2 tsp baking powder","zest ½ lemon and 1 tsp juice","85g golden caster sugar","50g light muscovado sugar","1 small very ripe banana with black skin (about 85g peeled weight)","1 egg","284ml pot buttermilk","225g fresh blueberries"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nUse 1 tsp oil to lightly oil a 12-hole muffin\r\ntin (or use paper cases). Mix both flours\r\nwith the baking powder and lemon zest.\r\nReserve 1 tbsp caster sugar, then stir the\r\nrest into the flour with the muscovado.","Mash the banana well. In another bowl\r\nbeat the egg, then stir in the banana,\r\nbuttermilk and oil. Using a large metal\r\nspoon, very lightly stir into the flour mix,\r\njust to combine. Over-mixing will make\r\nthe muffins tough. Toss in the blueberries\r\nand give just a few turns of the spoon to\r\ncarefully stir them in without crushing.","Spoon the mixture into the tin –\r\neach hole should be very full. Bake for\r\n20-25 mins until risen and golden.","Mix the reserved caster sugar with\r\nthe lemon juice. When the muffins are\r\ndone, remove from the oven, then brush\r\nwith the sugar and lemon mixture while\r\nthey are still hot. Gently loosen the edges\r\nof each muffin with a knife, then leave\r\nin the tin for 15 mins to cool a little as\r\nthey’re very delicate while hot. Remove\r\nto a wire rack. Best eaten the day of\r\nmaking, but will keep for up to 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:14:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4585,4585,'en','Smoked salmon & avocado sushi','Fancy making sushi at home? This simple recipe makes 32 healthy little bites, ideal for lunch or served as canapés','["300g sushi rice","2 tbsp rice or white wine vinegar","1 tsp caster sugar","1 large avocado","juice ½ lemon","4 sheets nori seaweed","4 large slices smoked salmon","1 bunch chives","sweet soy sauce (kecap manis), to serve"]','["Put the rice in a small pan with 600ml water. Bring to the boil and cook for 10 mins until the water is absorbed and the rice is tender. Stir through the vinegar and sugar, cover and cool.","Skin, stone and slice the avocado. Put in a bowl and squeeze over the lemon juice, turning the avocado to ensure the pieces are covered.","Divide the rice between the nori sheets and spread it out evenly, leaving a 1cm border at the top and bottom. Lay the salmon over the rice, followed by the chives and finally position the avocado across the centre.","Fold the bottom edge of the seaweed over the filling, then roll it up firmly. Dampen the top border with a little water to help it seal the roll. Repeat to make 4 rolls. At this stage, the rolls can be wrapped individually in cling film and chilled until ready to serve.","Using a serrated knife, cut each roll into 8 rounds. Serve with sweet soy sauce for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:14:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4587,4587,'en','Turkey & spring onion wraps','Give yourself a low-fat treat with these super-quick sandwich tortillas – a fab way of using up leftover turkey','["2 tbsp reduced-fat mayonnaise","2 tbsp pesto","4 curly lettuce leaves","250g cooked turkey, shredded","6 spring onions, shredded","12cm chunk cucumber,shredded","4 flour tortillas"]','["Mix together the mayonnaise and pesto. Divide the lettuce leaves, turkey, spring onions and cucumber between the tortillas. Drizzle over the pesto dressing, roll up and eat."]','2026-01-10 12:14:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4589,4589,'en','Chicken katsu','Katsu is a Japanese method of breadcrumbing chicken- this version is served with a rich curry sauce','["4 skinless chicken breasts","1 large egg, beaten","8 tbsp finely crushed cornflakes or panko crumbs","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1-2 tbsp Korma paste","1 tbsp soy sauce","4 tbsp ketchup","2 tbsp honey","2 tbsp cornflour"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Dip\r\nthe chicken in the egg, then coat in the\r\ncornflakes or crumbs. Space the chicken\r\nout on a non-stick baking tray and cook\r\nfor 15-20 mins or until cooked through.","Put the remaining ingredients in a pan.\r\nPour in 500ml water and heat, stirring,\r\nuntil boiling and thickened. Cover and\r\nleave to simmer for 5 mins.","Spoon some sauce onto 4 plates, slice\r\nthe chicken breasts and place on top.\r\nGreat served with some rice and soya\r\nbeans with finely sliced red chilli."]','2026-01-10 12:14:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4591,4591,'en','Full English frittata with smoky beans','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis healthy baked omelette with classic fry up ingredients is versatile enough for brunch or supper','["2 low-fat sausages, sliced","4 rashers extra lean bacon, all fat removed, chopped","150g pack button mushrooms, halved, or larger ones quartered","8 egg whites, or use 350ml liquid egg whites from a carton","3 tbsp milk","140g cherry tomatoes, halved","2 x 400g cans reduced salt and sugar baked beans","1½  tsp smoked paprika","small bunch chives, snipped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line\r\na roasting tin about the size of A4 paper\r\nwith enough baking parchment to cover\r\nthe base and sides. Fry the sausages and\r\nbacon in a non-stick pan until golden,\r\nstirring them often to stop them sticking.\r\nScoop into the tin.","Place the pan back on the heat and fry\r\nthe mushrooms for about 5 mins until\r\ngolden, then add these to the tray, too.\r\nWhisk the egg whites with the milk and\r\nlots of seasoning. Pour into the tin, then\r\ndot the tomatoes on top.","Bake in the oven for 20-25 mins, until\r\nset. Meanwhile, tip the beans into a pan\r\nwith the paprika and heat through.\r\nScatter the frittata with the chives and\r\nserve with the beans on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:14:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4593,4593,'en','Baked turkey meatballs with broccoli & crispy potatoes','Turkey mince is the leanest of its kind and is great rolled up into balls and served with tomato sauce and veg','["1 onion, grated","1 large carrot, grated","3 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp rosemary leaves, chopped","350g pack turkey mince","4 large potatoes, skin on and cut into small cubes","1 tbsp olive oil","400g can cherry tomatoes","2 tbsp grated parmesan","350g thin-stemmed broccoli","bunch basil leaves, shredded"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nIn a large bowl, combine the onion,\r\ncarrot, half the garlic and half the\r\nrosemary with the turkey and some\r\nseasoning. Shape into 16 meatballs\r\nand put in a small baking tray. Toss\r\nthe potatoes with the remaining garlic,\r\nrosemary and the oil, place in a baking\r\ntray, then cook both for 20 mins, with\r\nthe potatoes on top shelf.","After 20 mins, drain juices off the\r\nmeatballs, pour cherry tomatoes over,\r\nsprinkle with the Parmesan and season.\r\nToss the potatoes, and swap to bottom\r\nshelf with the potatoes on top. Cook for\r\nanother 20 mins until the potatoes are\r\ncrisp and the meatball sauce is bubbling.","When the potatoes and meatballs are\r\nalmost done, cook the broccoli for 3-4\r\nmins, until tender. Sprinkle the basil on\r\ntop of the meatballs and serve with the\r\ncrispy potatoes and broccoli."]','2026-01-10 12:14:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4595,4595,'en','Tagliatelle with vegetable ragu','This veggie Bolognese-style sauce is great served with pasta and crams in three of your five-a-day','["1 onion, finely chopped","2 celery sticks, finely chopped","2 carrots, diced","4 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp each tomato purée and balsamic vinegar","250g diced vegetables, such as courgettes, peppers and mushrooms","50g red lentils","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes with basil","250g tagliatelle (or your favourite pasta)","2 tbsp shaved parmesan (optional)"]','["Tip the onion, celery and carrots into\r\na large non-stick saucepan and add\r\n2-3 tbsp water or stock, if you have\r\nsome. Cook gently, stirring often, until\r\nthe vegetables are soft.","Add the garlic, tomato purée and\r\nbalsamic vinegar, cook on a high heat for\r\n1 min more, add the diced veg, lentils,\r\ntomatoes, then bring up to the boil.","Turn to a simmer, then cook for about\r\n20 mins. Meanwhile, cook the pasta\r\nfollowing pack instructions, then drain.\r\nSeason the ragu and serve with pasta\r\nand Parmesan on top, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4597,4597,'en','Miso brown rice & chicken salad','Low in fat and a great source of iron, this Japanese-inspired meal gets the ‘superhealthy’ tag','["120g brown basmati rice","2 skinless chicken breasts","140g sprouting broccoli","4 spring onions, cut into diagonal slices","1 tbsp toasted sesame seeds","2 tsp miso paste","1 tbsp rice vinegar","1 tbsp mirin","1 tsp grated ginger"]','["Cook the rice following the pack\r\ninstructions, then drain and keep warm.\r\nWhile it’s cooking, place the chicken\r\nbreasts into a pan of boiling water so\r\nthey are completely covered. Boil for\r\n1 min, then turn off the heat, place\r\na lid on and let sit for 15 mins. When\r\ncooked through, cut into slices.","Boil the broccoli until tender. Drain,\r\nrinse under cold water and drain again.","For the dressing, mix the miso, rice\r\nvinegar, mirin and ginger together.","Divide the rice between two plates\r\nand scatter over the spring onions and\r\nsesame seeds. Place the broccoli and\r\nchicken slices on top. To finish, drizzle\r\nover the dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:14:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4599,4599,'en','Pea & soya bean salad with fresh dill','A light, spring-like salad which goes wonderfully with fish or chargrilled meats','["200g each frozen peas and soya beans","small handful dill, leaves chopped, plus extra sprigs to serve","1½ tbsp oil","1 tbsp sherry vinegar","1 tsp wholegrain mustard","1 tsp clear honey"]','["Cook the peas and soya beans in\r\nboiling salted water for 3-4 mins until\r\njust tender. Drain, then run under cold\r\nwater until completely cooled.","Meanwhile, make the dressing. Mix\r\nall the ingredients together, season, then\r\nstir until well combined. Toss the beans\r\nand peas in the dressing with the chopped\r\ndill and scatter over the sprigs to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4600,4601,'en','Garlic & herb bulgur wheat','This summer salad makes a hearty side dish for a picnic or barbecue, and it’s low fat too','["200g bulgur wheat","175g frozen peas","6 tbsp garlic oil","juice 1 lemon","handful of herbs, such as (mint, parsley, chives), roughly chopped"]','["Cook the bulgur wheat in boiling salted\r\nwater for 15 mins or until tender, adding\r\nthe peas for the final 3 mins of cooking.","Make the dressing by combining the oil,\r\nlemon juice and seasoning. Stir the herbs\r\nthrough the drained bulgur wheat and\r\npeas with the dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:14:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4603,4602,'en','Sweet potato falafels with coleslaw','Pittas bursting with homemade falafels and salad make a low-fat lunch or light supper for less than a pound per serving','["1 large or 2 small sweet potatoes, about 700g/1lb 9oz in total","1 tsp ground cumin","2 garlic cloves, chopped","2 tsp ground coriander","handful coriander leaves, chopped","juice ½ lemon","100g plain or gram flour","1 tbsp olive oil","4 wholemeal pitta breads","4 tbsp reduced-fat houmous","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 small onion, finely sliced","1 medium carrot, grated","¼ each white and red cabbage, shredded"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nMicrowave sweet potato whole for\r\n8-10 mins until tender. Leave to cool\r\na little, then peel. Put the potato, cumin,\r\ngarlic, ground and fresh coriander, lemon\r\njuice and flour into a large bowl. Season,\r\nthen mash until smooth. Using a\r\ntablespoon, shape mix and into 20 balls.\r\nPut on an oiled baking sheet, bake for\r\naround 15 mins until the bases are\r\ngolden brown, then flip over and bake for\r\n15 mins more until brown all over.","Meanwhile, stir the vinegar and sugar\r\ntogether in a large bowl until the sugar\r\nhas dissolved, toss through the onion,\r\ncarrot and cabbage, then leave to\r\nmarinate for 15 mins. To serve, toast the\r\npittas, then split. Fill with salad, a dollop\r\nof houmous and the falafels."]','2026-01-10 12:14:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4605,4605,'en','Chargrilled turkey with quinoa tabbouleh & tahini dressing','This superhealthy supper is packed full of vibrant and fresh ingredients','["200g quinoa","½ cucumber, cut into 1cm chunks","175g cherry tomatoes, halved","3 spring onions, finely sliced","handful parsley, roughly chopped","handful coriander, roughly chopped","1 tbsp olive oil, plus 1 tsp","juice 1 lemon","4 turkey steaks","1½ tbsp tahini paste","1½ tbsp low-fat yogurt","juice ½ lemon","½ garlic clove, crushed","½ tsp clear honey"]','["Tip the quinoa into a saucepan and\r\npour over 600ml water. Cover with a\r\nlid and bring to the boil. Turn down and\r\nsimmer until the water has evaporated\r\n(just as you’d cook rice) – about 20 mins.\r\nTake off the lid and leave to cool while\r\nyou prepare the turkey and salad.","Tip the cucumber, tomatoes, spring\r\nonions and herbs into a large mixing bowl.\r\nPour over 1 tbsp olive oil and lemon juice,\r\nseason well and mix everything together.","Heat a griddle pan and, when smoking\r\nhot, rub the turkey steaks with 1 tsp olive\r\noil. Cook for about 5 mins on each side,\r\ndepending on thickness. Stir together\r\nall the dressing ingredients along with\r\n3 tbsp water. Toss the quinoa together\r\nwith the salad and arrange on plates.\r\nCut the turkey into thick slices, pile up on\r\nthe quinoa and drizzle over the dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:14:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4607,4607,'en','Squash & barley salad with balsamic vinaigrette','A flavour-packed, unusual salad that’s delicious warm or cold – works really well as part of a buffet','["1 butternut squash, peeled and cut into long pieces","1 tbsp olive oil","250g pearl barley","300g Tenderstem broccoli, cut into medium-size pieces","100g SunBlush tomatoes, sliced","1 small red onion, diced","2 tbsp pumpkin seeds","1 tbsp small capers, rinsed","15 black olives, pitted","20g pack basil, chopped","5 tbsp balsamic vinegar","6 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","1 garlic clove, finely chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Place\r\nthe squash on a baking tray and toss with\r\nolive oil. Roast for 20 mins. Meanwhile,\r\nboil the barley for about 25 mins in salted\r\nwater until tender, but al dente. While this is\r\nhappening, whisk the dressing ingredients in\r\na small bowl, then season with salt and pepper.\r\nDrain the barley, then tip it into a bowl and\r\npour over the dressing. Mix well and let it cool.","Boil the broccoli in salted water until just\r\ntender, then drain and rinse in cold water.\r\nDrain and pat dry. Add the broccoli and\r\nremaining ingredients to the barley and mix\r\nwell. This will keep for 3 days in the fridge\r\nand is delicious warm or cold."]','2026-01-10 12:14:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4609,4609,'en','Savoy cabbage with almonds','A superhealthy side dish with lightly toasted almonds to give your cabbage some crunch','["1 Savoy cabbage, finely sliced","25g butter","1 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, sliced","1 rosemary sprig, leaves finely chopped","100g blanched almonds"]','["Steam or microwave the cabbage until\r\njust cooked. Melt the butter with the oil\r\nin a large frying pan or wok, then add the\r\ngarlic, rosemary and almonds. Cook,\r\nstirring the almonds for about 2 mins or\r\nuntil they start to brown. Tip onto a plate.\r\nAdd the cabbage to the pan, stir in the\r\nleftover buttery juices, then return\r\nthe almond mixture to the pan. Season\r\nwell and tip into a serving dish."]','2026-01-10 12:14:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4611,4611,'en','Spaghetti with sardines','This storecupboard supper is super quick and superhealthy to boot','["400g spaghetti","1 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","pinch chilli flakes","227g can chopped tomatoes","2 x 95g cans skinless and boneless sardines in tomato sauce","100g pitted black olives, roughly chopped","1 tbsp capers, drained","small handful parsley, chopped"]','["Cook the spaghetti in a large pan of\r\nboiling salted water according to pack\r\ninstructions. Meanwhile, make the sauce.\r\nHeat the oil in a medium pan and cook\r\nthe garlic for 1 min. Add the chilli flakes,\r\ntomatoes and sardines, breaking up\r\nroughly with a wooden spoon. Heat for\r\n2-3 mins, then stir in the olives, capers\r\nand most of the parsley. Mix well to\r\ncombine.","Drain the pasta, reserving a couple of\r\ntbsp of the water. Add the pasta to the\r\nsauce and mix well, adding the reserved\r\nwater if the sauce is a little thick. Divide\r\nbetween 4 bowls and sprinkle with the\r\nremaining parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:14:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4613,4613,'en','Zingy salmon & brown rice salad','This summery recipe has the ideal combination of slow-releasing carbs, lean protein and heart-friendly fats','["200g brown basmati rice","200g frozen soya beans, defrosted","2 salmon fillets","1 cucumber, diced","small bunch spring onions, sliced","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped","zest and juice 1 lime","1 red chilli, diced, deseeded if you like","4 tsp light soy sauce"]','["Cook the rice following pack instructions and 3 mins before it’s done, add the soya beans. Drain and cool under cold running water.","Meanwhile, put the salmon on a plate, then microwave on High for 3 mins or until cooked through. Allow to cool slightly, remove the skin with a fork, then flake.","Gently fold the cucumber, spring onions, coriander and salmon into the rice and beans. In a separate bowl, mix the lime zest and juice, chilli and soy, then pour over the rice before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4615,4615,'en','Spiced quinoa with almonds & feta','Use quinoa instead of couscous to make a delicious gluten-free salad','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp ground coriander","½ tsp turmeric","300g quinoa, rinsed","50g toasted flaked almonds","100g feta cheese, crumbled","handful parsley, roughly chopped","juice ½ lemon"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Add the spices,\r\nthen fry for a min or so until fragrant.\r\nAdd the quinoa, then fry for a further\r\nmin until you can hear gentle popping\r\nsounds. Stir in 600ml boiling water, then\r\ngently simmer for 10-15 mins until the\r\nwater has evaporated and the quinoa\r\ngrains have a white ‘halo’ around them.\r\nAllow to cool slightly, then stir through the\r\nother ingredients. Serve warm or cold."]','2026-01-10 12:14:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4617,4617,'en','Seeded oatcakes','These quick biscuits make a great addition to a cheeseboard or gourmet homemade gift hamper','["50g butter","100g medium oatmeal","100g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 tsp poppy seeds","2 tbsp sesame seeds"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nMelt the butter in a small pan, then allow\r\nto cool slightly. Tip all the dry ingredients\r\ninto a bowl, with ½ tsp salt, then pour in\r\nthe butter. Add 5-6 tbsp boiling water\r\nand combine to make a firm dough.","Turn out the dough onto a lightly\r\nfloured surface, then roll out until about\r\n0.5cm thick. Cut into small squares, then\r\nbake for 12-15 mins until golden. Leave\r\nto cool for a few mins, then transfer to\r\na wire rack and cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:14:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4619,4619,'en','Salmon & soya bean salad','Packed with the kind of fat that is good for you, this makes a light yet still satisfying meal','["1 large omega-3 rich egg (See TRY section at the bottom of the recipe)","200g frozen soya beans, defrosted","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp flax seed oil (we used granoVita)","250g pouch Puy lentils","small bunch spring onions, sliced","2 poached salmon fillets, skin removed"]','["Put the egg in a pan, cover with cold water and bring to the boil. Cook for 4 mins (or 8 for hard-boiled), adding soya beans to the pan for the final min, then drain and run under cold water to cool. Shell and cut egg into 6 wedges, then set aside.","Mix the lemon juice and zest with the oil, season, then stir through the soya beans, lentils and spring onions.","Divide between 2 plates, then gently break the salmon into large flakes and put on top of the lentils along with the egg. Try it with seeded brown bread."]','2026-01-10 12:14:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4621,4621,'en','Lemon cod with basil bean mash','A heart-healthy supper that makes the perfect midweek meal for two','["2 small bunches cherry tomatoes, on the vine","1 tbsp olive oil","chunks skinless cod or other white fish fillet","zest 1 lemon, plus juice of ½","240g pack frozen soya beans","1 garlic clove","bunch basil, leaves and stalks separated","100ml chicken or vegetable stock"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Put \r\nthe tomatoes onto a baking tray, rub with \r\na little oil and some seasoning, then roast \r\nfor 5 mins until the skins are starting to split. \r\nAdd the fish to the tray, top with most of  \r\nthe lemon zest and some more seasoning, \r\nthen drizzle with a little more oil. Roast for  \r\n8-10 mins until the fish flakes easily.","Meanwhile, cook the beans in a pan of \r\nboiling water for 3 mins until just tender. \r\nDrain, then tip into a food processor with the \r\nrest of the oil, garlic, basil stalks, lemon juice \r\nand stock, then pulse to a thick, slightly \r\nrough purée. Season to taste.","Divide the tomatoes and mash between \r\ntwo plates, top with the cod, then scatter \r\nwith basil leaves and the remaining lemon \r\nzest to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4623,4623,'en','Summer vegetable curry','Give your Friday night curry a healthy makeover with this low-fat, superhealthy, vegetarian dish','["1-2 tbsp red Thai curry paste (depending on taste)","500ml low-sodium vegetable stock","2 onions, chopped","1 aubergine, diced","75g red lentils","200ml can reduced-fat coconut milk","2 red or yellow peppers, deseeded and cut into wedges","140g frozen peas","100g bag baby spinach, roughly chopped","brown basmati rice and mango chutney, to serve"]','["Heat the curry paste in a large\r\nnon-stick saucepan with a splash\r\nof the stock. Add the onions and fry\r\nfor 5 mins until starting to soften.\r\nStir in the aubergine and cook for\r\na further 5 mins – add a little more\r\nstock if starting to stick.","Add the lentils, coconut milk and\r\nthe rest of the stock, and simmer\r\nfor 15 mins or until the lentils are\r\ntender. Add the peppers and cook\r\nfor 5-10 mins more. Stir through the\r\npeas and spinach and cook until\r\nspinach has just wilted. Serve the\r\ncurry with rice and mango chutney."]','2026-01-10 12:14:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4625,4625,'en','Noodles with turkey, green beans & hoisin','Long day at work? Whip up this substantial yet low-fat supper and enjoy on the sofa','["100g ramen noodles","100g green beans, halved","3 tbsp hoisin sauce","juice 1 lime","1 tbsp chilli sauce","1 tbsp vegetable oil","250g turkey mince","2 garlic cloves, chopped","6 spring onions, sliced diagonally"]','["Boil the noodles following pack\r\ninstructions, adding the green beans\r\nfor the final 2 mins. Drain and set aside.","In a small bowl, mix together the hoisin,\r\nlime juice and chilli sauce. In a wok or\r\nfrying pan, heat the oil, then fry the\r\nmince until nicely browned. Add the\r\ngarlic and fry for 1 min more. Stir in the\r\nhoisin mixture and cook for a few mins\r\nmore until sticky. Finally, stir in the\r\nnoodles, beans and half the spring\r\nonions to heat through. Scatter over\r\nthe remaining spring onions to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4627,4627,'en','Edamame & chilli dip with crudités','Party food doesn’t have to be fattening. Dip in to this fresh, healthy snack as many times as you like','["300g frozen soya beans","150g low-fat natural yogurt","1 red chilli, chopped","juice 1 lime","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 red onion, finely chopped","handful coriander, chopped","halved radishes, sticks of carrots, celery and peppers, to serve"]','["Cook the soya beans in boiling\r\nsalted water for 4 mins. Drain and cool\r\nunder cold running water. Blitz with the yogurt, chopped red\r\nchilli, lime juice and crushed garlic\r\nclove until smooth. Fold in the finely chopped\r\nred onion and a handful chopped\r\ncoriander. Serve with halved radishes\r\nand sticks of carrots, celery and\r\npeppers.The dip will keep covered in\r\nthe fridge for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:14:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4629,4629,'en','Indian winter soup','This warming winter soup is high in fibre, low in fat and can be frozen for ultimate convenience','["100g pearl barley","2 tbsp vegetable oil","½  tsp brown mustard seeds","1 tsp cumin seeds","2 green chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","1 bay leaf","2 cloves","1 small cinnamon stick","½  tsp ground turmeric","1 large onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 parsnip, cut into chunks","200g butternut squash, cut into chunks","200g sweet potatoes, cut into chunks","1 tsp paprika","1 tsp ground coriander","225g red lentils","2 tomatoes, chopped","small bunch coriander, chopped","1 tsp grated ginger","1 tsp lemon juice"]','["Rinse the pearl barley and cook\r\nfollowing pack instructions. When it is\r\ntender, drain and set aside. Meanwhile,\r\nheat the oil in a deep, heavy-bottomed\r\npan. Fry the mustard seeds, cumin\r\nseeds, chillies, bay leaf, cloves, cinnamon\r\nand turmeric until fragrant and the seeds\r\nstart to crackle. Tip in the onion and\r\ngarlic, then cook for 5-8 mins until soft.\r\nStir in the parsnip, butternut and sweet\r\npotato and mix thoroughly, making sure\r\nthe vegetables are fully coated with the\r\noil and spices. Sprinkle in the paprika,\r\nground coriander and seasoning, and\r\nstir again.","Add the lentils, pearl barley, tomatoes\r\nand 1.7 litres water. Bring to the boil\r\nthen turn down and simmer until the\r\nvegetables are tender. When the lentils\r\nare almost cooked, stir in the chopped\r\ncoriander, ginger and lemon juice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4631,4631,'en','Devilled tofu kebabs','A low fat vegetarian kebab to bring out the devil in you','["8 shallots or button onions","8 small new potatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp light soy sauce","1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 tbsp clear honey","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard","300g firm smoked tofu, cubed","1 courgette, peeled and sliced","1 red pepper, deseeded and diced"]','["Put the shallots or button onions in a bowl, cover with boiling water and set aside for 5 mins. Cook the potatoes in a pan of boiling water for 7 mins until tender. Drain and pat dry. Put tomato purée, soy \r\nsauce, oil, honey, mustard and seasoning in a bowl, then mix well. Toss the tofu in the marinade. Set \r\naside for at least 10 mins.","Heat the grill. Drain and peel shallots or onions, then cook in boiling water for 3 mins. Drain well. Thread the tofu, shallots, potatoes, courgette and pepper on to 8 x 20cm skewers. Grill for 10 mins, turning frequently and brushing with remaining marinade before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4633,4633,'en','Crab linguine with chilli & parsley','Keep it simple with this restaurant-style dish that takes a few good-quality ingredients and lets them shine','["400g linguine","4 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 whole cooked crab, picked, or about 100g/4oz brown crabmeat and 200g/7oz fresh white crabmeat","small splash, about 5 tbsp, white wine","small squeeze of lemon (optional)","large handful flat-leaf parsley leaves, very finely chopped"]','["Bring a large pan of salted water to\r\nthe boil and add the linguine. Give it\r\na good stir and boil for 1 min less than\r\nthe pack says. Stir well occasionally\r\nso it doesn’t stick.","While the pasta cooks, gently heat\r\n3 tbsp of olive oil with the chilli and garlic\r\nin a pan large enough to hold all the\r\npasta comfortably. Cook the chilli and\r\ngarlic very gently until they start to sizzle,\r\nthen turn up the heat and add the white\r\nwine. Simmer everything until the wine\r\nand olive oil come together. Then take\r\noff the heat and add the brown crabmeat,\r\nusing a wooden spatula or spoon to\r\nmash it into the olive oil to make a\r\nthick sauce.","When the pasta has had its cooking\r\ntime, taste a strand – it should have a\r\nvery slight bite. When it’s ready, turn off\r\nthe heat. Place the sauce on a very low\r\nheat and use a pair of kitchen tongs to lift\r\nthe pasta from the water into the sauce.","Off the heat, add the white crabmeat\r\nand parsley to the pasta with a sprinkling\r\nof sea salt. Stir everything together really\r\nwell, adding a drop of pasta water\r\nif it’s starting to get claggy. Taste for\r\nseasoning and, if it needs a slight lift,\r\nadd a small squeeze of lemon. Serve\r\nimmediately twirled into pasta bowls\r\nand drizzled with the remaining oil."]','2026-01-10 12:14:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4635,4635,'en','The ultimate makeover: Fish pie','This traditionally high-fat comfort food favourite has been transformed into a heart-healthy dish','["500ml semi-skimmed milk","3 tbsp cornflour","100g cooked prawns in their shells","several thyme sprigs, preferably lemon thyme","2 bay leaves","1 garlic clove, thinly sliced","750g new potatoes, such as Charlotte (no need to peel)","1 medium leek, thinly sliced (175g prepared weight)","400g skinned haddock fillet","350g skinned salmon fillet","175g skinned smoked haddock fillet","125g tub low-fat soft cheese with garlic & herbs","2 tbsp finely chopped parsley","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp snipped chives"]','["Mix 3 tbsp of the milk into the cornflour\r\nand set aside. Pour the rest of the milk\r\ninto a saucepan. Shell the prawns,\r\nreserve the meat, then drop the shells\r\nand heads (wash them first if necessary)\r\ninto the milk along with the thyme sprigs,\r\nbay leaves, garlic and a grind of pepper.\r\nBring to a boil, then remove from the heat\r\nand leave to infuse for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, put the potatoes into a\r\nlarge pan of water, bring to the boil and\r\nsimmer for 20 mins until tender. Drain.\r\nSteam the sliced leek for 3 mins, then\r\nremove from the heat and set aside.","Strain the infused milk through a sieve\r\ninto a large shallow sauté pan. Lay all the\r\nfish fillets (not the prawns) in the milk.\r\nBring to a boil, then lower the heat and\r\nsimmer gently for 3 mins. Remove from\r\nthe heat and leave, covered, for 5 mins.\r\nUse a slotted spoon to transfer all the fish\r\nto a dish and leave to cool slightly. Heat\r\noven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Stir the slackened cornflour, then stir\r\nit into the hot milk in the sauté pan.\r\nReturn the pan to the heat and stir until\r\nthickened. Briefly stir in the soft cheese,\r\nremove from the heat, then add the\r\nparsley and season with black pepper.\r\nStir in any liquid that has drained from\r\nthe fish. Break the fish into big pieces as\r\nyou lay them in a 2-litre ovenproof dish\r\nso that the different varieties are evenly\r\ndistributed. Scatter over the prawns and\r\nleek, then season with pepper. Pour the\r\nsauce over and give a few gentle stirs to\r\nevenly distribute the sauce and combine\r\neverything without breaking up the fish.","Using a large fork, crush the potatoes\r\nby breaking them up (not mashing them)\r\ninto chunky pieces. Mix in the oil, chives\r\nand a grind of black pepper. Spoon the\r\npotato crush over the fish. Sit the dish on\r\na baking sheet and bake for 25-30 mins,\r\nor until the sauce is bubbling and the\r\npotatoes golden. Alternatively, make\r\nthe dish completely, refrigerate it for\r\nseveral hrs or overnight, then bake at the\r\nsame temperature as above for 45 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:14:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4637,4637,'en','Ribboned courgette salad','This salad takes just 10 minutes to create and is full of chickpeas, courgette, sweetcorn and feta. It’s substantial enough to enjoy on its own, or serve it as a summery side','["10g parsley, finely chopped","1 lemon, zested and juiced","1 tbsp olive oil","½ tbsp honey","2 courgettes","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","½ x 198g can sweetcorn, drained","80g feta (check it’s vegetarian, if needed)","2 tsp mixed seeds","2 spring onions, finely chopped"]','["Put most of the parsley, the lemon zest and juice, olive oil and honey in a bowl andwhisktogether along with some seasoning to taste.","Using avegetable peeler, peel the courgettes into ribbons, discarding the seedy centre. Tip into a large bowl with the chickpeas and sweetcorn. Pour over the dressing, toss together and leave to marinate for 5 mins. Crumble in the feta and give it a final light toss. Season with a grinding of black pepper.","Divide the salad between four plates. Scatter over the remaining parsley and sprinkle over along with the mixed seeds and spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:14:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4639,4639,'en','Vegan salad bowl','Whip up an easy vegan salad, with beans, radish, pickled cabbage and couscous. Bursting with flavour, it makes a satisfying dinner or lunch on the go','["200g couscous","400g can mixed beans","1 tsp olive oil","1⁄2 tsp chilli flakes","3⁄4 small bunch of dill, torn into sprigs","2 watermelon radishes or 6 small ones, sliced","1⁄2 cucumber, peeled into ribbons","1 large red onion, finely sliced","1⁄4 small red cabbage, finely sliced","2 tbsp white wine vinegar or apple cider vinegar","1 tbsp caster sugar","1⁄4 small bunch of dill, leaves picked"]','["First, make the pickle. Mix all the ingredients together in a large bowl with 1 tsp flaky sea salt, then cover and set aside until needed.","Mix the couscous with 280ml boiling water in a bowl, cover and leave for 4 mins, then fluff up with a fork. Set aside to cool slightly.","Meanwhile, drain and rinse the beans, tip into a bowl, then stir in the olive oil and chilli flakes along with a little seasoning.","Mix most of the dill through the couscous and season. To assemble, spoon the quick pickle, couscous, radishes, beans and cucumber into separate parts of each bowl. Top the pickle with the reserved dill and grind over some black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:14:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4641,4641,'en','Big barbecue chicken kebab','Barbecuing for more than four people? Prepare a large chicken kebab to carve, then the cooking is done in one go – and you can enjoy the party','["12 boneless, skinless chicken thighs","500g Greek yogurt","2 lemons, juiced, ½ lemon zested","100ml olive oil","4 garlic cloves, very finely grated or crushed","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp sweet paprika","1 tsp dried oregano","1 tsp dried thyme","1 tsp cayenne pepper","1 tsp crushed black pepper","½ tsp ground cinnamon","2 red onions, halved and finely sliced","4 tomatoes (plum work well) halved and sliced"]','["First, whisk all the marinade ingredients together with 1 tsp salt in a large bowl or, better still, a large plastic container that has a lid. Open out each chicken thigh, cover with a piece of baking parchment and flatten it with your hand, then lift off the paper and cut the thigh in half. Tip into the marinade and mix so it’s completely coated. Cover, chill and marinate for at least 1 hr or up to 24 hrs – the longer, the better.","Thread all the chicken onto two skewers so that both skewers go through each piece of meat, packing down tightly as you go to make a compact kebab (see tip, below).","Light a liddedbarbecue, and let the flames die down. Once the coals have turned ashen, pile them up on one side with a single layer of coals scattered around the other side. Lay the chicken kebab on the side of the barbecue with only a few coals underneath. Put the lid down and cook for 45 mins, turning every 15 mins. To finish, lift the lid and roll the kebab over to the hotter side to char the meat, turning it every few minutes until well browned and cooked through. Prise the chicken pieces apart in the centre to check they’re cooked, or use a digital cookingthermometer– it should read 70C or more. Leave to rest for 5-10 mins while you cook the pittas (see recipe, opposite). Bring the kebab to the table and carve into thin slices with a serrated knife. Pile the carved meat into the warm pittas, then the sliced red onions and tomatoes, chips and tzatziki (see our recipes, below)."]','2026-01-10 12:14:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4643,4643,'en','Quinoa-coated salmon & sweet potato fishcakes','Make some quick and easy salmon fishcakes with a lovely quinoa coating. Perfect served with peas and vegetables or a side salad','["750g sweet potatoes (about 4 medium sized)","65g quinoa (red and black mix, if possible)","1 tbsp oil, plus a little extra for brushing","240g skinless and boneless salmon fillets","small bunch of chives, chopped","90g watercress","200g frozen peas, cooked"]','["Wash the sweet potatoes, prick each of them a few times with a fork and cook them in themicrowavefor around 10 mins – the time varies depending on the size. Alternatively, bake in the oven at 180C/160C fan/gas 4 for about 45 mins. Scoop the flesh into a bowl. Reserve the skins to make crisps, if you like (see tip, below).","Tip the quinoa into asaucepanand pour over 150ml boiling water, cover with a lid and simmer for about 15 mins until the water has been absorbed. Drain well, spread out on a plate and set aside.","Drizzle a little oil in a frying pan over a medium heat, then fry the salmon fillets for a few minutes on each side. Tip into the bowl with the sweet potato, then add the chives. Mix well to break up the fish, and season to taste.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Form the mixture into eight equal-sized fishcakes. Dip each fishcake into the plate of quinoa and coat fully, pressing to help it stick. Brush with a little olive oil and place on abaking traylined with baking parchment. Bake for about 15-20 mins until golden. Serve with the watercress and peas, and sweet potato crisps, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4645,4645,'en','Vitamin booster smoothie','Up your vitamin quota with help from this bright and fresh smoothie. Orange, carrot, celery and mango pack a nutritious punch','["1 orange, peeled and roughly chopped","1 large carrot, peeled and roughly chopped","2 sticks celery, roughly chopped","50g mangoes, roughly chopped","200ml water"]','["Put all the orange, carrot, celery and mango in the blender, top up with water, then blitz until smooth."]','2026-01-10 12:14:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4647,4647,'en','Heart helper smoothie','Blend beetroot, apple, blueberries and ginger to create a smooth and nutritious drink with depth and zing','["2 small raw beetroots, peeled and roughly chopped","1 small apple peeled, quartered and cored","50g blueberries","1 tbsp grated ginger","300ml water"]','["Put the beetroot, apple, blueberries and ginger in a blender, top up with water then blitz until smooth."]','2026-01-10 12:14:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4649,4649,'en','Orange, chickpea & prosciutto salad','Look for a buffalo mozzarella to use in this salad, if you can. With chickpeas, prosciutto and hazelnuts, it’s a riot of colour and texture','["50ml extra virgin olive oil","1 lemon, juiced","1 tsp honey","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","½ small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","1 tsp coriander seeds, crushed","2-3 small oranges, peeled and sliced","50g rocket","2 x 125g balls buffalo mozzarella","80g prosciutto","30g hazelnuts, toasted and chopped","crusty bread, to serve"]','["Whiskthe oil, lemon juice and honey together in a bowl, then season. Toss with the chickpeas, parsley and coriander seeds, followed by the orange slices and rocket. Spread the salad out on a large sharing plate.","Tear the mozzarella over the salad, then scatter with the prosciutto and hazelnuts. Serve with crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:14:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4651,4651,'en','Broccoli pasta shells','Kids will love this healthier take on pesto and pasta, with broccoli upping their veg intake. It takes just 20 minutes to make and is low in calories','["1 head of broccoli, chopped into florets","1 garlic clove, unpeeled","2 tbsp olive oil","250g pasta shells","½ small pack parsley","½ small pack basil","30g toasted pine nuts","½  lemon, zested and juiced","30g parmesan(or vegetarian alternative), plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the broccoli and garlic in 1 tbsp of the olive oil on a roasting tray and roast in the oven for 10-12 mins, until softened.","Tip the pasta shells into a pan of boiling, salted water. Cook according to packet instructions and drain. Tip the parsley, basil, pine nuts, lemon juice and parmesan into a blender. Once the broccoli is done, set aside a few of the smaller pieces. Squeeze the garlic from its skin, add to the blender along with the rest of the broccoli, pulse to a pesto and season well.","Toss the pasta with the pesto. Add the reserved broccoli florets, split between two bowls and top with a little extra parmesan, the lemon zest and a good grinding of black pepper, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4653,4653,'en','Wild salmon with corn & pepper salsa salad','Marinate heart-healthy fish with spices and serve with colourful sweetcorn and avocado – vegetarians can use halloumi instead','["1 garlic clove","½  tsp mild chilli powder","½  tsp ground coriander","¼ tsp ground cumin","1 lime, grated zest and juice, plus wedges to serve (optional)","2 tsp rapeseed oil","2 wild salmon fillets","1 corn on the cob, husk removed if attached","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 avocado, stoned, peeled and finely chopped","1 red pepper, deseeded and finely chopped","1 red chilli, halved, deseeded and chopped","½  pack coriander, finely chopped"]','["Finely grate the garlic into a bowl for the spice rub. Boil the corn for the salsa salad for 6-8 mins until tender, then drain and cut off the kernels with a sharp knife.","Stir the spices, 1 tbsp lime juice and the oil into the garlic to make a spice rub, then use to coat the salmon.","Mix the remaining lime zest and juice into the corn and stir in all the remaining ingredients. Heat a frying pan and cook the salmon for 2 mins each side so that it is still a little pink in the centre. Serve with the salsa salad with extra lime wedges, if you like, for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:14:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4655,4655,'en','Lemon pollock with sweet potato chips & broccoli mash','Fish and chips get a healthy makeover with a zesty caper dressing and minty mushy peas – replace with aubergine for a veggie option','["2 garlic cloves","2 sweet potatoes (175g/6oz), scrubbed and cut into chips","2 tsp rapeseed oil, plus extra for the fish","½  tsp smoked paprika","2 pollock fillets (about 100g/4oz each)","½  unwaxed lemon","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1½  tsp capers, rinsed and chopped","1 tbsp chopped dill","1 leek, chopped","4 broccoli spears (about 200g/7oz)","85g frozen peas","handful mint"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Finely chop the garlic, put half in a bowl for the dressing and set the rest aside for the chips. Toss the sweet potatoes with the oil and spread out on a large baking sheet. Bake for 25 mins, turning halfway through.","Put the fish on a sheet of baking parchment on a baking sheet, brush with a little oil, then grate over the lemon zest and season with black pepper. Set aside.","Boil the leek for 5 mins, then add the broccoli and cook for 5 mins more. Tip in the peas for a further 2 mins. Drain, return to the pan and blitz with a stick blender to make a thick purée. Add the mint, then blitz again.","Meanwhile, toss the garlic and paprika with the chips and return to the oven with the fish for 10 mins. Add the olive oil to the garlic, with the capers and dill and 1 tbsp water. Serve everything together with the caper dressing spooned over the fish."]','2026-01-10 12:14:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4657,4657,'en','Chicken & avocado salad with blueberry balsamic dressing','A healthy, gluten-free dinner or lunch, perfect for using up leftover roast chicken. Make it veggie by swapping the meat for a handful of pumpkin seeds.','["1 garlic clove","85g blueberries","1 tbsp extra virgin rapeseed oil","2 tsp balsamic vinegar","125g fresh or frozen baby broad beans","1 large cooked beetroot, finely chopped","1 avocado, stoned, peeled and sliced","85g bag mixed baby leaf salad","175g cooked chicken"]','["Finely chop the garlic. Mash half the blueberries with the oil, vinegar and some black pepper in a large salad bowl.","Boil the broad beans for 5 mins until just tender. Drain, leaving them unskinned.","Stir the garlic into the dressing, then pile in the warm beans and remaining blueberries with the beetroot, avocado, salad and chicken. Toss to mix, but don’t go overboard or the juice from the beetroot will turn everything pink. Pile onto plates or into shallow bowls to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4659,4659,'en','Veggie meatballs with tomato courgetti','Spiralize courgettes to make this healthier, gluten-free ''pasta'' dish. The vegetarian meatballs use ground almonds instead of breadcrumbs to increase the protein','["3 garlic cloves","2 tsp rapeseed oil, plus extra for greasing","1 small onion, very finely chopped","2 tsp balsamic vinegar","100g canned red kidney beans","1 tbsp beaten egg","1 tsp tomato purée","1 heaped tsp chilli powder","½  tsp ground coriander","15g ground almonds","40g cooked sweetcorn","2 tsp chopped thyme leaves","2 large or 3 normal tomatoes, chopped","1 tsp tomato purée","1 tsp balsamic vinegar","2 courgettes cut into ''noodles'' with a spiralizer, julienne peeler, or by hand"]','["Finely chop the garlic. Heat the oil in a large pan and fry the onion, stirring frequently, for 8 mins. Stir in the balsamic vinegar and cook for 2 mins more. Meanwhile, put the beans in a bowl with the egg, tomato purée and spices, and mash until smooth. Stir in the almonds and sweetcorn with the thyme, a third of the chopped garlic and the balsamic onions. Mix well and shape into about 8 balls the size of a walnut, and place on a baking tray lined with oiled baking parchment.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and bake the veggie meatballs for 15 mins until firm. Meanwhile, put the tomatoes, tomato purée and balsamic vinegar in a pan and cook with 2-3 tbsp water until pulpy, then stir in the remaining garlic and courgetti. Turn off the heat as you want to warm the noodles rather than cook them. Serve with the veggie meatballs."]','2026-01-10 12:14:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4661,4661,'en','Roast chicken with sweet potato gremolata salad','Roast a whole chicken for this low-calorie lunch or dinner and save the leftovers for later – swap the chicken with hard-boiled eggs for a vegetarian version.','["1 lemon","1½ kg whole chicken (free-range or organic), fat from inside the neck cavity removed","3 tbsp finely chopped parsley leaves (reserve the stalks)","2 sweet potatoes (175g/6oz each)","2 red onions, cut into wedges","1 tsp fennel seeds","7 whole garlic cloves","2 tsp extra virgin rapeseed oil","125g bag baby spinach, washed","4 heaped tbsp pomegranate seeds"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Grate the zest and squeeze the juice from the lemon into 2 bowls, then push the wedges inside the cavity of the chicken with the parsley stalks. Put the chicken in a roasting tin and roast for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, scrub the sweet potatoes (no need to peel) and cut into chunks. Put in another roasting tin with the onions, fennel, and 6 whole garlic cloves, then toss with the oil. When the chicken has had its 30 mins, put the potatoes in the oven and roast for 30-40 mins more.","Meanwhile, finely chop the remaining garlic clove for the gremolata, then mix with the lemon zest and parsley. Mix the lemon juice, oil and some black pepper in a bowl.","Remove the chicken and potatoes from the oven. Cover the chicken and leave to rest. Stir half the gremolata mix into the lemon juice and oil. Stir the spinach through the potato mix and return to the oven for 2 mins to wilt. Tip into the lemon dressing and toss well. Carve a chunk of breast meat from the chicken (you need about 140g), remove the skin, then cut into pieces. Toss into the salad with the pomegranate seeds, then serve scattered with the remaining gremolata."]','2026-01-10 12:14:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4663,4663,'en','Spicy vegetable pilau with cucumber raita','Replace rice with freekeh for a deliciously different, low-calorie one-pot with red pepper and sweet sultanas','["2 garlic cloves","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 large onion, quartered and sliced","thumb-sized piece ginger, chopped","1 cinnamon stick","½  tsp cumin seeds","seeds from 8 cardamom pods","1 tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp ground coriander","1 red chilli, halved, deseeded and sliced","1 large red pepper, deseeded and diced","50g freekeh","350ml vegetable stock (made with 2 tsp reduced-salt bouillon powder)","25g sultanas","½  pack coriander, chopped","40g cashew nuts","1 garlic clove","150ml pot bio-yogurt","¼ cucumber, grated","2 tbsp chopped mint"]','["Chop the garlic for the pilau and set aside. Finely grate the garlic for the raita and put in a bowl. Heat the oil for the pilau in a large open pan, and fry the onion and ginger for 5 mins until softened. Stir in the whole and ground spices, and cook for a few secs to release their aromas. Add the chilli, red pepper and freekeh, stir briefly, then tip in the stock and sultanas. Simmer for 15 mins until the freekeh is tender but still nutty, adding the chopped garlic for the final 2 mins. The stock should have reduced and absorbed into the freekeh now.","Meanwhile, finish the raita by stirring the yogurt, cucumber and mint into the grated garlic.","When the pilau is cooked, stir in the coriander and cashews, and serve with the raita."]','2026-01-10 12:14:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4665,4665,'en','Herby lamb fillet with caponata','Tick off all 5 of your 5 a day with this super-healthy Sunday roast. To make it vegetarian, omit the lamb and add chickpeas to the caponata.','["3 garlic cloves","2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 red onion, cut into wedges","1 aubergine, sliced and quartered","500g carton passata","1 green pepper, quartered, deseeded and sliced","6 pitted Kalamata olives, halved and rinsed","2 tsp capers, rinsed","1 tsp chopped rosemary","1 tsp balsamic vinegar","4 baby new potatoes, halved","1 tsp chopped rosemary","1 tsp rapeseed oil","250g lean lamb loin fillet, all visible fat removed","240g bag baby spinach","finely chopped parsley (optional)"]','["Slice 2 of the garlic cloves for the caponata, finely grate the other for the lamb and set aside. Heat the oil for the caponata in a wide pan, add the onion and fry for 5 mins to soften. Tip in the aubergine and cook, stirring, for 5 mins more. Add the passata and pepper with the olives, capers, rosemary and balsamic vinegar, then cover and cook for 15 mins, stirring frequently.","Meanwhile, heat oven to 190C/170C fan/ gas 5. Boil the potatoes for 10 mins, then drain. Mix the grated garlic with the rosemary and some black pepper, then rub all over the lamb. Toss the potatoes in the oil with some more black pepper, place in a small roasting tin with the lamb and roast for 15-20 mins. Meanwhile, wilt the spinach in the microwave or in a pan, and squeeze to drain any excess liquid.","Stir the garlic into the caponata and serve with the lamb, either whole or sliced, rolled in parsley if you like, with the potatoes and spinach."]','2026-01-10 12:14:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4667,4667,'en','Peanut hummus with fruit & veg sticks','This healthy, nutty dip, with tahini and smoked paprika, is perfect for spreading – eat with apple slices and vegetables for a quick lunch or snack','["380g carton chickpeas","zest and juice ½  lemon (use the other ½  to squeeze over the apple to stop it browning, if you like)","1 tbsp tahini","½ -1 tsp smoked paprika","2 tbsp roasted unsalted peanuts","1 tsp rapeseed oil","2 crisp red apples, cored and cut into slices","2 carrots, cut into sticks","4 celery sticks, cut into batons lengthways"]','["Drain the chickpeas, reserving the liquid. Tip three-quarters of the chickpeas into a food processor and add the lemon zest and juice, tahini, paprika, peanuts and oil with 3 tbsp chickpea liquid. Blitz in a food processor until smooth, then stir in the reserved chickpeas. Serve with the fruit and veg sticks."]','2026-01-10 12:14:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4669,4669,'en','Asparagus & lentil salad with cranberries & crumbled feta','Asparagus tips take the leading role in this healthy, seasonal salad with spring onions, cherry tomatoes and salty crumbled cheese','["1 garlic clove","125g puy lentils","100g pack fine asparagus tips","3 spring onions, finely sliced","25g dried cranberries","1 tbsp extra virgin rapeseed oil, plus a little extra (optional)","2 tsp organic apple cider vinegar","140g cherry tomatoes, halved","50g feta (read back of pack for vegetarian option)"]','["Finely grate the garlic and put in a bowl. Boil the lentils for 25 mins, and put the asparagus in a steamer over them for the last 5 mins until just tender.","Meanwhile, put the onions, cranberries, oil and vinegar in the bowl with the garlic and stir well. When the lentils are ready, drain and toss them into the dressing with the tomatoes. Tip into plastic containers (for a packed lunch), or onto plates, then top with the asparagus and crumble over the feta. Drizzle with a little extra oil, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4671,4671,'en','Herb pancake wraps with goat’s cheese','Replace flour tortillas with thin omelettes, then pile high with tasty vegetarian toppings for a low-calorie lunch – enjoy warm or cold','["1½  tsp rapeseed oil","2 spring onions, finely chopped","1 large courgette, coarsely grated and squeezed dry","2 large eggs","2 tbsp chopped basil","2 tsp thyme leaves","50g soft goat''s cheese","2 medium tomatoes, chopped","6 Kalamata olives, rinsed and halved","2 handfuls baby kale or watercress","radishes, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat 1 tsp oil in a frying pan and add the spring onions and courgette. Cook, stirring frequently, to soften the courgette and drive off any excess moisture. Tip the veg into a bowl and wash the pan.","Beat an egg with 1 tbsp water, half the herbs and some black pepper. Heat the remaining oil in the frying pan, pour in the egg mixture and swirl the pan to set it thinly on the base. Cook for a couple of mins, tip onto a plate and repeat with the other egg, 1 tbsp water and remaining herbs.","Spread the goat’s cheese down the centre of each pancake and top with the courgette mix, scatter over the tomatoes, olives and baby kale, then roll up and cut in half. Alternatively, spread the goat’s cheese over the pancakes, top with the filling and serve open. Eat with some radishes on the side, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4673,4673,'en','Barley couscous & prawn tabbouleh','Crunchy cucumber and juicy nectarines add a freshness to this high-fibre, healthy lunch – for a veggie version, swap the prawns for cashews or pecans.','["125g barley couscous","zest 1 lemon, juice of ½","1 tbsp extra virgin rapeseed oil","½  small pack dill, finely chopped","good handful mint leaf, chopped","½  cucumber, chopped","2 nectarines, chopped","125g peeled prawns, or a handful of cashews or pecans for a vegetarian version."]','["Tip the couscous into a bowl and pour over just enough boiling water to cover, following pack instructions. Leave for no more than 5 mins, drain thoroughly, then fluff up with a fork and tip into a bowl. Stir in the lemon zest and juice with the oil, dill and mint, then add the cucumber and nectarines.","Toss through the prawns or nuts and serve on plates or pack into lunch containers."]','2026-01-10 12:14:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4675,4675,'en','Summer pistou','A cross between a soup and a stew, this healthy French dish is packed with vegetables and beans – perfect as a light lunch. If making ahead it will keep in the fridge for a couple of days.','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 leeks, finely sliced","1 large courgette, finely diced","1l boiling vegetable stock (made from scratch or with reduced-salt bouillon)","400g can cannellini or haricot beans, drained","200g green beans, chopped","3 tomatoes, chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","small pack basil","40g freshly grated Parmesan"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and fry the leeks and courgette for 5 mins to soften. Pour in the stock, add three-quarters of the haricot beans with the green beans, half the tomatoes, and simmer for 5-8 mins until the vegetables are tender.","Meanwhile, blitz the remaining beans and tomatoes, the garlic and basil in a food processor (or in a bowl with a stick blender) until smooth, then stir in the Parmesan. Stir the sauce into the soup, cook for 1 min, then ladle half into bowls or pour into a flask for a packed lunch. Chill the remainder. Will keep for a couple of days."]','2026-01-10 12:14:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4677,4677,'en','Date & buckwheat granola with pecans & seeds','This all-natural granola is sweetened with date purée to make crunchy clusters of nutrient-rich oats, grains seeds and nuts','["85g buckwheat","4 Medjool dates, stoned","1 tsp ground cinnamon","100g traditional oats","2 tsp rapeseed oil","25g sunflower seeds","25g pumpkin seeds","25g flaked almonds","50g pecans nuts, roughly broken into halves","50g sultanas (without added oil)","2 x 150ml pots low-fat bio natural yogurt","2 ripe nectarines or peaches, stoned and sliced"]','["Soak the buckwheat overnight in cold water. The next day, drain and rinse the buckwheat. Put the dates in a pan with 300ml water and the cinnamon, and blitz with a stick blender until completely smooth. Add the buckwheat, bring to the boil and cook, uncovered, for 5 mins until pulpy. Meanwhile, heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2 and line two large baking trays with baking parchment.","Stir the oats and oil into the date and buckwheat mixture, then spoon small clusters of the mixture onto the baking trays. Bake for 15 mins, then carefully scrape the clusters from the parchment if they have stuck and turn before spreading out again. Return to the oven for another 15 mins, turning frequently, until firm and golden.","When the mix is dry enough, tip into a bowl, mix in the seeds and nuts with the sultanas and toss well. When cool, serve each person a generous handful with yogurt and fruit, and pack the excess into an airtight container. Will keep for a week. On other days you can vary the fruit or serve with milk or a dairy-free alternative instead of the yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:14:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4679,4679,'en','Quinoa porridge','Supercharge your morning with high-protein quinoa and omega-3 rich chia seeds for a creamy breakfast bowl topped with seasonal fruit','["175g quinoa","½  vanilla pod, split and seeds scraped out, or ½  tsp vanilla extract","15g creamed coconut","4 tbsp chia seeds","125g coconut yogurt","125g pot coconut yogurt","280g mixed summer berries, such as strawberries, raspberries and blueberries","2 tbsp flaked almonds (optional)"]','["Activate the quinoa by soaking overnight in cold water. The next day, drain and rinse the quinoa through a fine sieve (the grains are so small that they will wash through a coarse one).","Tip the quinoa into a pan and add the vanilla, creamed coconut and 600ml water. Cover the pan and simmer for 20 mins. Stir in the chia with another 300ml water and cook gently for 3 mins more. Stir in the pot of coconut yogurt. Spoon half the porridge into a bowl for another day. Will keep for 2 days covered in the fridge. Serve the remaining porridge topped with another pot of yogurt, the berries and almonds, if you like.","To have the porridge another day, tip into a pan and reheat gently, with milk or water. Top with fruit - for instance, orange slices and pomegranate seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:14:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4681,4681,'en','Wholewheat flatbreads with beans & poached egg','This wholesome, flavourful dish makes for a really substantial brunch – if you’re eating earlier for breakfast you could serve half the beans.','["2 eggs","500g carton passata","2 small onions, quartered","1 Medjool date, stoned","3 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp balsamic vinegar","400g can haricot beans, drained","100g wholewheat flour","½  tsp baking powder","100g natural yogurt"]','["Tip the passata into a food processor with the onions, date and paprika, and blitz until completely smooth. Heat in a medium pan, cover and simmer for 10 mins, stirring frequently, to make a thick pulpy sauce. Taste to make sure the onion is fully cooked. If not, add a splash of water and cook a little longer. Stir in the vinegar and beans, then remove from the heat.","To make the flatbreads, tip the flour and baking powder into a bowl, then stir in the yogurt to make a soft dough. Tip out onto a lightly floured surface and lightly knead, fully incorporating any flour left in the bowl. Halve the mixture and flatten each piece to a rough oval, using your hands or a rolling pin, to a thickness of two £1 coins. Cut slashes through the centre of the ovals a couple of times with a sharp knife, being careful not to cut through an edge.","Heat a large, non-stick pan, add a flatbread and cook for 1 min each side until firm and slightly puffed, then repeat with the other. Meanwhile, heat a large pan of water and poach the eggs to your liking.","Warm the beans and serve on top of each flatbread with a poached egg and some black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:14:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4683,4683,'en','Fennel, pomegranate & broad bean salad','This bulgur wheat and chopped herb salad makes a scrumptious side to take to a picnic – drizzle the dressing over before serving','["200g bulghar wheat","small bunch mint, finely chopped","small bunch parsley, finely chopped","small bunch dill, finely chopped","1 fennel bulb, quartered, core removed and thinly sliced","200g pomegranate seeds","350g (weight before skinning) fresh or frozen broad beans","2 tbsp pumpkin seeds","large handful rocket or watercress","zest and juice 1 lemon","5 tbsp extra virgin rapeseed or olive oil","2 tbsp cider vinegar","1 tbsp Dijon mustard"]','["Boil the kettle and put the bulghar wheat in a bowl with a good pinch of salt. Pour over enough boiling water to just cover the bulghar, cover with cling film and set aside for 10 mins.","Put the ingredients for the dressing in a jam jar or small bottle with some seasoning, screw on the lid and shake well. Uncover the bulghar wheat and, if there is any water left in the bowl, drain the bulghar, then tip into a large container for transporting. Add the herbs, fennel, pomegranate seeds, broad beans and pumpkin seeds, and toss everything together. Top with the salad leaves and pack the jam jar of salad dressing separately.","Before serving, drizzle over the dressing and toss everything together."]','2026-01-10 12:14:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4685,4685,'en','Chicken & new potato traybake','Pop chicken thighs and potatoes in one pot and roast with olives, lemon, garlic and bay leaves for a lazy weekend lunch or dinner','["3 tbsp olive oil","500g new potatoes","140g large pitted green olives","1 lemon, quartered","8 fresh bay leaves","6 garlic cloves, unpeeled","4 large chicken thighs","bag watercress or salad leaves, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Pour the olive oil into a large roasting tin and add the potatoes, olives, lemon quarters, bay leaves and garlic. Toss everything together so it’s coated in oil and evenly distributed. Add the chicken thighs, skin-side up, and season.","Put the roasting tin in the oven and roast for 1 hr, basting with the pan juices halfway through cooking. After 1 hr, check that the potatoes are soft and the chicken is cooked through, then return to the oven for a final 15 mins to crisp the chicken skin.","Remove the roasting tin from the oven. Press down on the roasted garlic cloves with the back of a spoon, discard the skins, and mix the mashed garlic with the meat juices. Serve with watercress or your favourite salad leaves on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:14:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4686,4686,'en','Veggie yaki udon','Pack in the veg with our flavour-packed Japanese-inspired yaki udon. It’s healthy, takes just 25 minutes to make, and is low in fat and calories','[]','[]','2026-01-10 12:14:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4687,4687,'en','Courgette ribbon salad','Use a spiralizer to create this fresh, zingy, raw salad – perfect with grilled chicken or fish and topped with crumbled feta or goat''s cheese','["juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp olive oil","½  small pack chives, chopped","½  small pack mint, chopped","300g courgettes"]','["In a large bowl pour in the lemon juice and season well with salt and pepper. Whisk in the olive oil then add the chopped herbs.","Put your courgette through your spiralizer on its large noodle attachment and tip the ribbons into the bowl with the dressing. Toss everything together and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:14:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4689,4689,'en','Fruity Caribbean curry','Kidney beans and veg make chicken drumsticks go further with this sweet and hot curry – pack in 4 of your 5 a day in a filling family meal','["2 tsp vegetable or sunflower oil","4 chicken drumsticks, skin removed","2 large red onions, chopped","2 peppers (any colours will do), chopped","3-4 tbsp mild curry powder","425g can pineapples chunks in unsweetened juice","400g can coconut milk","400g can kidney beans, drained","2-4 tbsp hot pepper sauce (depending on how hot you like it)","small bunch coriander, chopped","cooked rice, to serve (we used Tilda coconut rice)"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan. Add the chicken and brown well on all sides, then transfer to a plate. Add the onions and peppers to the pan, and cook for 5 mins until the veg starts to soften. Return the chicken to the pan and sprinkle in the curry powder, then add the pineapple with its juice, and the coconut milk. Season and simmer, uncovered, for 40 mins until the chicken is tender and the sauce has reduced and thickened a little.","Add the beans and pepper sauce to the pan. Simmer for another 2-3 mins until the beans are warmed through, then scatter with coriander and serve with cooked rice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4691,4691,'en','Easy chicken gumbo','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA warming Cajun-inspired casserole with smoked bacon, peppers and okra – perfect served over rice and beans','["2 tbsp olive oil","200g smoked bacon lardons","1 onion, sliced","130g pack Padrón peppers, stalks removed, sliced (or 1 green chilli and 100g green pepper)","4 skinless chicken breasts, cut into bite-sized pieces","3 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp Cajun spice mix","3 garlic cloves, crushed","500ml chicken stock","175g pack okra, sliced (or 2 courgettes, sliced)","500g carton passata","2 spring onions, sliced","cooked rice and black beans, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the lardons and onion, and fry for 5 mins until the bacon is starting to crisp and the onion is soft. Add the peppers, chicken and flour, and fry for a further 5 mins or until the chicken is golden brown and the flour is starting to take on a a biscuty colour.","Stir in the Cajun spice mix and garlic, then slowly add the chicken stock, stirring all the time. Add the okra, passata and some seasoning and simmer for 20 mins, uncovered, over a medium heat. Stir frequently during cooking to loosen the flour from the base of the pan.","Sprinkle over the spring onions and serve with rice and black beans."]','2026-01-10 12:14:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4693,4693,'en','Honey & orange roast sea bass with lentils','Liven up your midweek meals with this low-calorie, gluten-free fish supper – ready in under half an hour','["2 large skin-on sea bass fillets (or other white fish - see tip)","zest and juice ½  orange","2 tsp clear honey","2 tsp wholegrain mustard","2 tbsp olive oil","250g pouch ready-to-eat puy lentils","100g watercress","small bunch parsley, chopped","small bunch dill, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Place each sea bass fillet, skin-side down,\r\non individual squares of foil. Mix together the orange zest, honey, mustard, 1 tbsp olive oil and some seasoning, and drizzle it over the fillets. Pull the sides of the foil up and twist the edges together to make individual parcels. Place the parcels on a baking tray and bake in the oven for 10 mins until the fish is just cooked and flakes easily when pressed with a knife.","Warm the lentils following pack instructions, then mix with the orange juice, remaining oil, the watercress, herbs and seasoning. Divide the lentils between 2 plates and top each with a sea bass fillet. Drizzle over any roasting juices that are caught in the foil and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:14:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4695,4695,'en','Spiced black bean & chicken soup with kale','Use up leftover roast or ready-cooked chicken in this healthy and warming South-American style soup, spiced up with cumin and chilli','["2 tbsp mild olive oil","2 fat garlic cloves, crushed","small bunch coriander stalks finely chopped, leaves picked","zest 1 lime, then cut into wedges","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp chilli flakes","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can black beans, rinsed and drained","600ml chicken stock","175g kale, thick stalks removed, leaves shredded","250g leftover roast or ready-cooked chicken","50g feta, crumbled, to serve","flour & corn tortillas, toasted, to serve (see tip)"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan, add the garlic, coriander stalks and lime zest, then fry for 2 mins until fragrant. Stir in the cumin and chilli flakes, fry for 1 min more, then tip in the tomatoes, beans and stock. Bring to the boil, then crush the beans against the bottom of the pan a few times using a potato masher. This will thicken the soup a little.","Stir the kale into the soup, simmer for 5 mins or until tender, then tear in the chicken and let it heat through. Season to taste with salt, pepper and juice from half the lime, then serve in shallow bowls, scattered with the feta and a few coriander leaves. Serve the remaining lime in wedges for the table, with the toasted tortillas on the side. The longer you leave the chicken in the pan, the thicker the soup will become, so add a splash more stock if you can’t serve the soup straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:14:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4697,4697,'en','Coconut crêpes with raspberry sauce','Flecked with desiccated coconut for added texture, these pancakes drizzled in a fruity sauce make a delicious low sugar brunch or dessert','["200g raspberries","2 tsp cornflour","2 tsp maple syrup","140g plain flour","2 large eggs","300ml coconut milk","2 tbsp toasted desiccated coconut","a little sunflower oil, for frying"]','["Set aside 6 of the raspberries. Mix the cornflour with 1 tbsp water until smooth. Measure 300ml water in a pan, and stir in the cornflour paste. Heat, stirring, until thickened. Add the remaining raspberries and cook gently, mashing the berries to a pulp. Strain the mixture through a sieve into a bowl to remove the seeds, pushing through as much of the mixture as you can. Quarter the reserved raspberries and add to the sauce, along with the maple syrup.","To make the crêpes, tip the flour and a pinch of salt into a large jug, then beat in the eggs, coconut milk, 200ml water and 11/2 tbsp toasted coconut to make a batter the consistency of double cream. Thin with a little more water if it is too thick. Heat a small frying pan with a dash of oil, then pour in a little batter, swirling the pan so that it completely covers the base. Leave to set over the heat for 1 min, then carefully flip it over and cook the other side for a few secs more. Transfer to a plate and repeat with the remaining batter until you have at least 12. Stir the batter to redistribute the coconut as you use it. Serve 2 crêpes per person with a drizzle of the sauce and a little of the remaining toasted coconut."]','2026-01-10 12:14:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4699,4699,'en','Kale & apple soup with walnuts','Make the most of seasonal kale and give this soup added depth with sweet apple and a crunchy walnut topping – perfect as a healthy lunch','["8 walnut halves, broken into pieces","1 onion, finely chopped","2 carrots, coarsely grated","2 red apples, unpeeled and finely chopped","1 tbsp cider vinegar","500ml reduced-salt vegetable stock","200g kale, roughly chopped","20g pack of dried apple crisps (optional)"]','["In a dry, non-stick frying pan, cook the walnut pieces for 2-3 mins until toasted, turning frequently so they don’t burn. Take off the heat and allow to cool.","Put the onion, carrots, apples, vinegar and stock in a large saucepan and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat and simmer for 10 mins, stirring occasionally.","Once the onion is translucent and the apples start to soften, add the kale and simmer for an additional 2 mins. Carefully transfer to a blender or liquidiser and blend until very smooth. Pour into bowls and serve topped with the toasted walnuts, and a sprinkling of apple crisps, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4701,4701,'en','Winter apple & squash panzanella','Give the classic Italian tomato and stale bread salad a seasonal twist with hazelnuts, cranberries, squash and apple','["½  large butternut squash, cut into chunks","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","6 sage leaves, chopped","2 apples, cored and sliced into slim wedges","3 tbsp clear honey","4 tbsp red wine vinegar","200g leftover crusty bread (we used ciabatta), torn into chunks","100g hazelnuts, roughly chopped","200g bag chopped kale","100g dried cranberries"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the squash on a baking tray, drizzle with 1 tbsp oil and scatter over the sage and some seasoning. Toss together, then bake for 30 mins.","Add the apple slices to the tray, drizzle over the honey and toss with the squash. Put the bread on a separate tray and return both trays to the oven. Bake for another 10-15 mins until the squash and apple are tender and starting to caramelise, and the bread is crisp. Meanwhile, toast the hazelnuts in a small pan until golden. Remove the trays from the oven and set aside to cool a little.","Whisk the remaining oil, the honey and vinegar in a large bowl with some seasoning. Add the kale, cranberries, hazelnuts, squash apples and toasted bread. Toss everything together, then transfer to a platter or plates to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4704,4703,'en','Brazilian prawn & coconut stew','Give king prawns a Brazilian twist in this spicy coconut, prawn and green bean stew topped with salted peanuts and served with rice','["300g long-grain rice","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1-2 red chillies (deseeded if you don’t like it too hot), finely chopped","200ml coconut milk","400g tomatoes, diced","200g green beans, topped and sliced in half","300g peeled raw king prawns","juice 1 lime","small pack coriander, chopped","50g roasted unsalted peanuts, roughly chopped"]','["Bring a pan of water to boil and cook the rice following pack instructions.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large frying pan, add the onion, garlic and chillies, and cook for 10 mins on a low heat until soft. Add the coconut milk and bubble for another 4 mins.","Add the tomatoes and beans, and cook for 5 mins until the tomatoes start to collapse. Add the prawns and cook for 3 mins until pink and cooked through.","Stir in the lime juice, sprinkle over the coriander and nuts, and serve with the rice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4706,4706,'en','Spicy chicken & avocado wraps','Pan-fry lean chicken breast with lime, chilli and garlic, then pile onto seeded tortilla wraps. Cool before assembling if packing for lunch','["1 chicken breast (approx 180g), thinly sliced at an angle","generous squeeze juice ½  lime","½  tsp mild chilli powder","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 tsp olive oil","2 seeded wraps","1 avocado, halved and stoned","1 roasted red pepper from a jar, sliced","a few sprigs coriander, chopped"]','["Mix the chicken with the lime juice, chilli powder and garlic.","Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan then fry the chicken for a couple of mins – it will cook very quickly so keep an eye on it. Meanwhile, warm the wraps following the pack instructions or, if you have a gas hob, heat them over the flame to slightly char them. Do not let them dry out or they are difficult to roll.","Squash half an avocado onto each wrap, add the peppers to the pan to warm them through then pile onto the wraps with the chicken, and sprinkle over the coriander. Roll up, cut in half and eat with your fingers."]','2026-01-10 12:14:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4708,4708,'en','Green fritters','Enjoy a healthy breakfast that will keep you satisfied for longer, with eggs and vibrant green broccoli and courgettes for protein, vitamins and minerals','["140g courgettes, grated","3 medium eggs","85g broccoli florets, finely chopped","small pack dill, roughly chopped","3 tbsp gluten-free flour or rice flour","2 tbsp sunflower oil, for frying"]','["Squeeze the courgettes between your hands to remove any excess moisture, or tip onto a clean tea towel and twist it to squeeze out the moisture.","Beat the eggs in a bowl, add the broccoli, courgettes and most of the dill, and mix together. Add the flour, mix again and season.","Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan. Put a large serving spoon of the mixture in the pan, then add 2 more spoonfuls so you have 3 fritters. Leave for 3-4 mins on a medium heat until golden brown on one side and solid enough for you to flip over, then flip over and leave to go golden on the other side. Repeat to make 3 more fritters (there is no need to add any more oil to the pan after the first batch). Scatter with the remaining dill to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4710,4710,'en','Miso-roasted aubergine steaks with sweet potato','Roast thick slices of aubergine with miso, garlic and ginger, then serve with chunky sweet potato wedges for a filling, vegetarian dinner','["1 large aubergine (about 375g)","2 tbsp brown miso paste (we used Clearspring)","350g sweet potatoes, unpeeled and cut into chunky wedges","1 tbsp sunflower oil","thumb-sized piece ginger, grated","1 garlic clove, grated","pinch of pink Himalayan salt","8 spring onions, sliced diagonally","small pack parsley, leaves chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Peel the aubergine with a potato peeler and roughly spread the miso paste all over it – the best way to do this is with the back of a spoon.","Put it in a roasting tin along with the sweet potato wedges. Pour 225ml boiling water into the base of the tin, then add the oil, ginger and garlic. Sprinkle a pinch of salt over the wedges and place in the oven.","After 30 mins, pour another 125ml boiling water into the base of the tin and roast for another 20 mins. Repeat, adding 50ml boiling water and the spring onions, and roast for 10 mins more. Check the aubergine is cooked by inserting a knife in the centre – if it is ready it will easily slide in and out, and the aubergine will be soft on the inside.","Sprinkle the chopped parsley over the potato wedges, slice the aubergine into 2cm thick ‘steaks’ and serve on top of the potatoes. If there is no sauce in the bottom of the tin, add 3 tbsp water to loosen up the miso, then pour the miso gravy over the aubergine steaks and sprinkle with cracked black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:14:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4712,4712,'en','Butternut soup with crispy sage & apple croutons','The apple and sage contrast beautifully with naturally sweet butternut squash in this low-fat, gluten-free festive dinner party starter','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 butternut squash, about 1kg, peeled, deseeded and chopped","3 tbsp Madeira or dry Sherry","500ml gluten-free vegetable stock, plus a little extra if necessary","1 tsp chopped sage, plus 20 small leaves, cleaned and dried","sunflower oil, for frying","1 tbsp olive oil","1 large eating apple, peeled, cored and diced","a few pinches of golden caster sugar"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the onion and fry for 5 mins. Add the garlic and squash, and cook for 5 mins more. Pour in the Madeira and stock, stir in the chopped sage, then cover and simmer for 20 mins until the squash is tender.","Blitz with a hand blender or in a food processor until completely smooth. Allow to cool in the pan, then chill until ready to serve. Will keep for 2 days or freeze for 3 months. To make the crispy sage, heat some oil (a depth of about 2cm) in a small pan, then drop in the sage leaves until they are crisp – you will need to do this in batches. Drain on kitchen paper. Will keep for several hours.","Just before serving, reheat the soup in a pan. The texture should be quite thick and velvety, but thin it with a little stock if it is too thick.","For the apple croutons, heat the oil in a large pan, add the apple and fry until starting to soften. Sprinkle with the sugar and stir until lightly caramelised.","To serve, ladle the soup into small bowls and top with the apple, sage and a grinding of black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:14:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4714,4714,'en','Spiced sweet potato wedges','Toss sweet potato in cumin, chilli and sumac, then oven bake with lemon and garlic for chunky chips which are crispy yet fluffy','["2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp chilli flakes","2 tsp sumac","2 tbsp thyme leaves, roughly chopped","2 tbsp rosemary leaves, roughly chopped","3 garlic cloves","zest and juice 1 lemon","3 tbsp olive oil","1¼kg sweet potatoes, cut into wedges"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Using a pestle and mortar, bash together the spices, herbs, garlic and some seasoning.","Spoon into a large bowl and stir in the lemon zest and juice, and the oil. Add the potatoes and toss together. Arrange, skin-side down, on 2 baking trays and bake for 30–40 mins until soft inside and crisp on the outside."]','2026-01-10 12:14:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4716,4716,'en','Spiced oatmeal fritters with coconut caramel pears','These dense, nutty-tasting griddle cakes are dairy free, with almond milk, nutmeg and cinnamon – perfect for a lazy weekend brunch or treat','["250ml almond milk","½  tsp ground cloves","1 tsp ground nutmeg","4 tsp ground cinnamon","100g rolled oats","3 large eggs","2 tbsp golden caster sugar","75g coconut butter","2 firm Williams pears, peeled, cored and thinly sliced","200g coconut yogurt, to serve"]','["In a large saucepan, combine the almond milk, cloves, nutmeg and 3 tsp of the cinnamon. Bring to a simmer. Tip in the oats and cook for 6 mins over a low heat, stirring constantly, until thick and creamy, like porridge. Scrape into a mixing bowl, cover, and cool for 20 mins.","While you wait, make the caramel pears. Sprinkle the sugar evenly over a frying pan set on a low heat. Don’t stir it, but wait until it starts to melt, turning dark golden here and there. When most of the sugar is melted, gently swirl to incorporate any dry patches. Stir in 25g of the coconut butter. Toss the pear slices in the remaining cinnamon, then add to the caramel and cook for 5 mins until softened. Set aside.","Return to the oats now, beating in the eggs and ½ tsp salt to make a loose pancake-like batter. Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1 and put plates in to warm.","Melt a little of the remaining coconut butter in a frying pan. When hot, add half-ladlefuls of the batter spaced apart and cook for 4 mins each side, or until golden brown. Remove to a plate and keep warm in the oven. Continue frying the fritters, adding more coconut butter as needed. Serve the fritters topped with a spoonful of coconut yogurt followed by the warm pears."]','2026-01-10 12:14:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4718,4718,'en','Papaya, beansprout & mangetout salad','Pair crunchy vegetables and nuts with sweet papaya fruit in this interesting side dish – perfect with Asian flavoured main courses','["175g mangetout","175g beansprouts","1 papaya, peeled, deseeded and cut into cubes","juice 1 lime","25g unsalted peanuts","small handful basil leaves, torn","small handful mint leaf, chopped"]','["Heat a large frying pan over a high heat. Add the mangetout, beansprouts and 1 tbsp water, and cook for 2-3 mins. Remove from the heat and toss in the papaya and lime juice. Serve scattered with the peanuts and herbs."]','2026-01-10 12:14:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4720,4720,'en','Spinach & sweet potato tortilla','Sweet potato adds a different flavour to this healthy Spanish-inspired tortilla. It’s perfect to prepare ahead of a tapas night.','["300g bag baby spinach leaves","8 tbsp light olive oil","2 large onions, thinly sliced","4 medium sweet potatoes (800g/ 1lb 12oz), peeled, cut into thin slices","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","8 large eggs"]','["Put the spinach in a large colander and pour over a kettleful of boiling water. Drain well and, when cooled a little, squeeze dry, trying not to mush up the spinach too much.","Heat 3 tbsp oil in a 25cm non-stick pan with a lid, then sweat the onions for 15 mins until really soft but not coloured. Add another 3 tbsp oil and add the potatoes and garlic. Mix in with the onions, season well, cover and cook over a gentle heat for another 15 mins or so until the potatoes are very tender. Stir occasionally to stop them catching.","Whisk the eggs in a large bowl, tip in the cooked potato and onion, and mix together. Separate the spinach clumps, add to the mix and fold through, trying not to break up the potato too much.","Add 2 tbsp more oil to the pan and pour in the sweet potato and egg mix. Cover and cook over a low-medium heat for 20 mins until the base and sides are golden brown and the centre has mostly set. Run a palette knife around the sides to stop it from sticking.\r\n5 To turn the tortilla over, put a plate face down onto the pan, then flip it over. Slide the tortilla back into the pan and cook for a further 5-10 mins until just set and golden all over. (Don’t worry if it breaks up a little on the edges as you’re turning it – it will look perfect when it’s cooked through and set.) Continue cooking on the other side until just set and golden all over. Again use a palette knife to release the tortilla from the sides. Allow to rest for 5 mins, then tip onto a board before cutting into wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:14:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4722,4722,'en','Green gazpacho','Try this dazzling take on the classic chilled Spanish soup – this version is made with green veg, herbs and yogurt. Add edible flower ice cubes for extra special presentation','["100g bag baby spinach","2 garlic cloves","1 large cucumber, deseeded and chopped","½  green chilli, deseeded","½  small pack parsley","½  small pack basil","½  small pack mint","1 ripe avocado, stoned and peeled","4 spring onions, topped and tailed","200g natural yogurt","2 tbsp sherry vinegar","drizzle of extra virgin olive oil or rapeseed oil","handful pea shoots","edible flowers ice cubes, to serve (see tip, below)"]','["Put all the ingredients, except the oil, pea shoots and ice cubes, into a food processor with a good pinch of salt and pepper and blitz, adding enough water to get a soupy consistency. Taste, and add a little more vinegar and seasoning if necessary. Chill for up to 24 hrs, or at least 2 hrs.","To serve, divide between shallow soup bowls, float a few ice cubes in each bowl (see tip, below) and add\r\na scattering of pea shoots and a drizzle of oil before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4724,4724,'en','Barbecued squid salad','Marinating squid before sizzling it on the barbecue or griddle gives it a flavour boost. Accompany with a salad of mango, avocado and black beans','["800g fresh prepared squid","zest 3 limes (reserve the juice for the salad, and wedges, to serve)","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","3 garlic cloves, smashed flat","1½  tsp mixed peppercorns, crushed","1 large red onion, finely sliced","1 large mango, cut into small chunks","1 large red chilli, finely shredded (deseeded if you don''t like it too hot)","400g can black beans, well rinsed then patted dry","3 ripe avocados","small pack coriander, leaves only, torn","extra virgin olive oil, for drizzling"]','["Heat the barbecue. Meanwhile, marinate the squid for at least 30 mins, or up to 4 hrs. First, slash the squid tubes all over at 5mm-1cm intervals on each side, cutting through most of the flesh but leaving the sides intact. If there are any particularly large tubes, cut them in half width-ways. Put into a non-metallic bowl with the other squid ingredients and leave to marinate.","For the salad, toss the onion, mango and chilli with the lime juice (from the limes used for the squid) and a pinch of\r\nsalt and leave for at least 10 mins, or until the onion turns pink. Add the beans to one side of the bowl.","Halve, stone and scoop the avocado into the salad bowl, then add plenty of seasoning and season the squid with sea salt.","When the barbecue is ready, barbecue the squid tubes and tentacles for no more than 11?2 mins in total – the flesh should just change from greyish to opaque and shrink up into a spiral shape where you’ve made your cuts. Toss the salad ingredients together very roughly, pile onto a platter and top with the\r\nhot squid and coriander. Drizzle with extra virgin olive oil and serve with\r\nlime wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4726,4726,'en','Berry omelette','A one-egg omelette makes a high protein breakfast. If the brain-boosting berries aren’t sweet enough, add 1 tsp honey','["1 large egg","1 tbsp skimmed milk","3 pinches of cinnamon","½  tsp rapeseed oil","100g cottage cheese","175g chopped strawberries, blueberries and raspberries"]','["Beat egg with milk and cinnamon. Heat oil in a 20cm non-stick frying pan and pour in the egg mixture, swirling to evenly cover the base. Cook for a few mins until set and golden underneath. There’s no need to flip it over.","Place on a plate, spread over cheese, then scatter with berries. Roll up and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4728,4728,'en','Spiced cod with quinoa salad & mint chutney','Filling yet low-fat, sustainable white fish is a healthy choice. Serve with an Indian-inspired coriander yogurt marinade and grain salad','["40g quinoa (or 85g pre-cooked quinoa)","3 tbsp chopped mint","3 tbsp chopped coriander","150g pot 0% natural yogurt","1 garlic clove","¼ tsp turmeric","pinch of cumin seeds","2 x 150g chunky fillets skinless white fish, such as sustainable cod","¼ cucumber, finely diced","1 small red onion, finely chopped","4 tomatoes, chopped","good squeeze of lemon juice"]','["Tip the quinoa (if not pre-cooked) into a pan, cover with water and boil, covered, for 25 mins, checking the water level to make sure it doesn’t boil dry. Drain well.","Meanwhile, put 2 tbsp each of the mint and coriander in a bowl. Add the yogurt and garlic, and blitz with a hand blender until smooth. Stir 2 tbsp of the herby yogurt with the turmeric and cumin, then add the fish and turn in the mixture to completely coat.","Turn the grill to High. Arrange the fish in a shallow heatproof dish and grill for 8-10 mins, depending on thickness, until it flakes. Toss the quinoa with the cucumber, onion, tomatoes, lemon juice and remaining herbs. Spoon onto a plate, add the fish and spoon round the mint chutney, or add it at the table."]','2026-01-10 12:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4730,4730,'en','Pepper & walnut hummus with veggie dippers','Pack in the vegetables with this quick-to-make dip blitzed with sweet roasted red peppers and served with courgette, celery and carrot batons','["400g can chickpeas, drained","1 garlic clove","1 large roasted red pepper from a jar (not in oil), about 100g","1 tbsp tahini paste","juice ½ lemon","4 walnut halves, chopped","2 courgettes, cut into batons","2 carrots, cut into batons","2 celery sticks, cut into batons"]','["Put the chickpeas, garlic, pepper, tahini and lemon juice in a bowl. Blitz with a hand blender or in a food processor to make a thick purée. Stir in the walnuts. Pack into pots, if you like, and serve with the veggie sticks. Will keep in the fridge for 2 days, although the vegetables are best prepared fresh to preserve their vitamins."]','2026-01-10 12:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4732,4732,'en','Avocado & strawberry smoothie','A creamy breakfast-friendly blend that''s high in calcium and low in calories','["½  avocado, stoned, peeled and cut into chunks","150g strawberries, halved","4 tbsp low-fat natural yogurt","200ml semi-skimmed milk","lemon or lime juice, to taste","honey, to taste"]','["Put all the ingredients in a blender and whizz until smooth. If the consistency is too thick, add a little water."]','2026-01-10 12:14:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4734,4734,'en','Chana masala (chickpea curry) with spinach','A superhealthy vegetable-packed curry with chickpeas, spinach and tomatoes. Serve this delicious Indian dish with filling brown basmati rice','["75g quick-cook brown basmati rice","1 tsp cumin seed","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 medium onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1cm piece ginger, peeled and finely chopped or grated","½  red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp turmeric","1 tsp paprika","1 tsp garam masala","400g can whole plum tomatoes","400g can chickpeas, drained","juice ½ lemon","220g bag baby spinach"]','["Cook the rice following pack instructions. Meanwhile, heat a large non-stick pan or wok and dry-fry the cumin seeds for 1 min, stirring often, while they pop. Remove and set aside.","Using the same pan, heat the oil, add the onion, garlic, ginger and chilli, and sauté over a medium heat for about 3 mins. Reduce the heat, add all the spices, stir well and cook for a further 2 mins. Add the tomatoes, stirring, and use the side of a spoon to break them up into smaller bite-sized chunks. Add the chickpeas and 200ml water.","Bring to the boil, then simmer for 10 mins before stirring in the lemon juice and spinach. Let the spinach wilt, then remove the pan from the heat.","Divide the rice between 2 bowls, and serve the curry. (The flavours intensify as it cools, so for a fuller flavour, make earlier in the day and reheat slowly prior to serving.)"]','2026-01-10 12:14:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4736,4736,'en','Cajun grilled chicken with lime black-eyed bean salad & guacamole','Spice your chicken with cayenne, oregano, paprika and thyme then serve on a salsa-like storecupboard salad and avocado dip – this recipe makes enough for lunch the next day','["1 tsp rapeseed oil","½  tsp dried oregano","½  tsp dried thyme","1 tsp smoked or regular paprika","¼ tsp cayenne pepper","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","4 skinless, boneless chicken breasts (each weighing 140g)","200g black-eyed beans from a can, drained (or butter or cannellini beans)","2 tomatoes, deseeded and diced","85g sweetcorn from a can, drained","2 spring onions, trimmed and finely chopped","25g semi-dried tomatoes in oil from a jar, roughly chopped","zest and juice 1 lime","small handful coriander, finely chopped","1 avocado, stoned and peeled","¼ red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","½  tbsp olive oil","juice 1 lime","small handful coriander, finely chopped"]','["Mix together the oil, herbs, spices and garlic in a large sealable bag. Put the chicken breasts in the bag and mix thoroughly to cover. Bash the chicken with a rolling pin to flatten it a little, then set aside to marinate for at least 15 mins.","In a large bowl, mix all the ingredients for the bean salad. Stir well and set aside.","For the guacamole, scoop the flesh from the avocado and put it in a medium bowl, chopping it roughly with the side of the spoon. Add the rest of the ingredients and mix well. If you prefer your guacamole to be smoother, mash the avocado well with the olive oil and lime juice until it’s at your preferred consistency before stirring in the other ingredients.","Heat the grill. Line a grill pan with foil, place the chicken breasts on it and grill for 5 mins, checking occasionally. Once golden brown, turn and grill for a further 5-7 mins. Check the middle of the breasts after 5 mins and, if cooked through, remove from the heat.","Set aside 2 chicken breasts and 2 tbsp guacamole for Open rye sandwich (see ''goes well with'', right). Place 1 warm chicken breast on each plate, with some bean salad and a dollop of guacamole on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:14:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4738,4738,'en','Minty pineapple smoothie','There''s more to smoothies than fruit – this green blend contains spinach, oats, linseeds and cashew nuts too','["200g pineapple, peeled, cored and cut into chunks","a few mint leaves","50g baby spinach leaves","25g oats","2 tbsp linseeds","handful unsalted, unroasted cashew nuts","fresh lime juice, to taste"]','["Put all the ingredients in a blender with 200ml water and process until smooth. If it’s too thick, add more water (up to 400ml) until you get the right mix."]','2026-01-10 12:14:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4740,4740,'en','Falafels with hummus & tabbouleh','Make your own chickpea and butter bean fritters and serve with a herby couscous salad – the recipe makes enough for two meals','["1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp coriander seeds","400g can chickpeas, drained","400g can butter beans, drained","juice ½ lemon","small pack coriander, including stalks","¼ red chilli, deseeded, and chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 egg yolk, beaten","small pack parsley","4 tbsp wholemeal flour","400g can chickpeas, drained","1 tbsp tahini paste","pinch of ground cumin","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","juice ½ lemon","50g barley couscous","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","juice 1 lemon","small pack parsley, finely chopped","small pack mint, finely chopped","small pack coriander, finely chopped","2 spring onions, white parts only, finely sliced","½  cucumber, deseeded and cut into small pieces","3 tomatoes, quartered, deseeded and cut into small pieces"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and put a non-stick baking tray inside. For the falafels, heat a large non-stick frying pan, add the cumin and coriander seeds and dry-fry until fragrant (1-2 mins), stirring occasionally to prevent burning. Remove from the pan.","Put the seeds, the remaining falafel ingredients and some seasoning into a food processor and blitz until you have a chunky paste. If it seems too dry, add 1 tsp water and blitz again until you have the consistency of damp sand. Using your hands, divide the mixture into 12 falafel balls and chill for 30 mins.","Heat a non-stick frying pan. When hot, add the falafel balls, pressing down into the pan to make patties. Leave to cook, without turning, for 2-3 mins, then check to make sure they’re brown and crisp. Turn and cook the other side for 2 mins more. Remove from the pan, transfer to the baking tray in the oven and cook for a further 10 mins. Meanwhile, prepare the barley couscous following pack instructions.","For the houmous, put all the ingredients, except the lemon, into a food processor and blitz to form a stiff paste. With the motor running, slowly add the lemon juice and up to 3 tbsp water to get it to the consistency of your choice.","For the tabbouleh, mix the olive oil, lemon juice and some black pepper in a small bowl. In a larger bowl, combine the rest of the tabbouleh ingredients, along with the cooked couscous, and add the dressing. Mix well.","Put aside 4 falafels and 4 tbsp houmous in the fridge for Stuffed Moroccan pittas (see ''goes well with'', right). Serve the remaining falafels with the remaining houmous and the tabbouleh."]','2026-01-10 12:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4741,4741,'en','Lunchbox mains','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlySatisfying and nutritious lunchbox fillers which take minutes to make','["chicken guacamole wrap","very easy pasta salad","mini ham rolls","cheese ploughman''s lunch","sweet potato & chickpea soup (all recipe ingredients below)"]','["Chicken\r\nguacamole\r\nwrapTake 1 tortilla\r\nwrap and spread 2 tbsp shop-bought\r\nguacamole down the middle. Lay ½\r\nshredded chicken breast and ½ sliced\r\nred pepper on top. Sprinkle with 30g\r\ngrated cheddar and roll up tightly. Wrap\r\nin baking parchment and tie with string,\r\nor roll tightly in cling film (serves 1).","Very easy\r\npasta saladCook 85g pasta\r\nshapes, adding 3 tbsp each frozen\r\npeas and frozen sweetcorn for the\r\nfinal min. Drain; rinse in cold water.\r\nMix 1 tbsp each natural yogurt and\r\nshop-bought balsamic dressing,\r\nwith 1 tsp mayo. Pour onto the\r\npasta, then stir in 1 tbsp chopped\r\nbasil and 3 halved cherry tomatoes (serves 1).","Mini ham rollsMix 1 tbsp mayo\r\nwith 1 tsp each\r\nwholegrain\r\nmustard and honey. Split 2 small\r\nwholemeal rolls in half and spread\r\neach side with the mayo mix. Stuff\r\neach roll with 2-3 slices cucumber,\r\n1 Baby Gem leaf and 1 slice ham (serves 1).","Ploughman''s lunchboxCut a chunk of\r\ncheddar and 1 apple\r\ninto wedges (squeeze over some lemon juice to stop them going brown). Place 2 Baby Gem leaves\r\nin a container, then spoon 2 tbsp\r\nchutney into one leaf and use the other\r\nleaf to hold a salad made of 1 small\r\ngrated carrot, 3 cherry tomatoes and\r\n1 tbsp cress. Serve with a selection of\r\ncrackers, if you like (serves 1).","Sweet potato\r\n& chickpea\r\nsoupHeat 1 tbsp olive oil in a pan; soften\r\n1 finely diced onion for 3 mins. Add\r\n2 sliced garlic cloves, cook for 3 mins\r\nmore. Add 1 tsp each ground cumin\r\nand ground coriander, cook for 1 min.\r\nAdd 1 sweet potato, cut into 1cm\r\ncubes. Fry for 2 mins, then pour over\r\n600ml hot vegetable stock. Boil for\r\n10 mins until potato is tender. Add\r\n220g can drained chickpeas. Heat\r\nthrough before whizzing until smooth.\r\nStir in 1 tbsp soured cream and 50ml\r\nmilk. Pour into a thermos when hot (serves 2)."]','2026-01-10 12:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4742,4742,'en','Asparagus salad with a runny poached egg','A simple, balanced bistro-style salad that''s low in calories but high in flavour, texture and nutrition','["1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","200g peeled cooked beetroot (not in vinegar), cut into bite-sized pieces","2 handfuls mixed leaves","¼ cucumber, cut into batons","8 asparagus spears, trimmed","2 large eggs"]','["Pour the olive oil and vinegar into a small bowl, mix well and add the beetroot. Divide the mixed leaves and cucumber between 2 plates.","Blanch the asparagus in a pan of simmering water for 2 mins, then remove and set aside. Crack the eggs into the pan and simmer gently for 3 mins until the whites are cooked and the yolks are just beginning to set, but still runny. Remove with a slotted spoon and drain on kitchen paper.","Meanwhile, add the beetroot to the salad plates, pour over the dressing and lightly toss together. Top each plate with asparagus and a poached egg to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4743,4743,'en','Chicken soba noodles','Quick and easy to prepare, whether you’re packing them up for work or grabbing a bite at home','["85g bundle soba or buckwheat noodles","drizzle of sesame oil","8 mangetout","1 small carrot","½ red chilli","1 tbsp toasted sesame seeds","handful shredded cooked chicken","soy sauce"]','["Cook the noodles, drain well, then\r\ntoss with a drizzle sesame oil.","Finely\r\nslice the mangetout, cut the carrot\r\ninto matchsticks and deseed and slice\r\nthe red chilli.","Add to the noodles with\r\nthe toasted sesame seeds and some\r\nshredded cooked chicken, if you have\r\nit. Pack with a small portion of soy sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4744,4744,'en','Cinnamon crêpes with nut butter, sliced banana & raspberries','Use gluten-free flour in these thin breakfast pancakes served with almond butter, fruit and lemon','["75g gluten-free brown bread flour","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 medium egg","225ml semi-skimmed milk","1 tsp rapeseed oil, for frying","2 tbsp almond nut butter","1 banana, sliced","140g raspberries","lemon wedges"]','["Tip the flour into a large mixing bowl with the cinnamon. Add the egg and milk, and whisk vigorously until you have a smooth pouring consistency.","Place a non-stick frying pan over a medium heat and add a little of the oil. When the oil starts to heat, wipe most of it away with kitchen paper. Once the pan is hot, pour a small amount of the batter into the centre of the pan and swirl it to the sides of the pan in a thin layer. Leave to cook, untouched, for about 2 mins. When it is brown underneath, turn over and cook for 1 min more.","Transfer to a warm plate and cover with foil to keep warm. Repeat with the remaining batter. Divide the warm pancakes between 2 plates and serve with the nut butter, banana, raspberries and lemon to assemble at the table."]','2026-01-10 12:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4746,4746,'en','Baked eggs brunch','This low-calorie vegetarian breakfast with sundried tomatoes, spinach, leeks and cheese is the perfect way to start a weekend','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 leeks, thinly sliced","2 onions, thinly sliced","2 x 100g bags baby spinach leaves","handful fresh wholemeal breadcrumbs","25g Parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), finely grated","4 sundried tomatoes, chopped","4 medium eggs"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the oil in a pan and add the leeks, onions and seasoning. Cook for 15-20 mins until soft and beginning to caramelise.","Meanwhile, put the spinach in a colander and pour over a kettle of boiling water. When cool enough to handle, squeeze out as much liquid as possible. Mix the breadcrumbs and cheese together.","Arrange the leek and onion mixture between 4 ovenproof dishes, then scatter with the spinach and pieces of sundried tomato. Make a well in the middle of each dish and crack an egg in it. Season and sprinkle with cheese crumbs. Put the dishes on a baking tray and cook for 12-15 mins, until the whites are set and yolks are cooked to your liking."]','2026-01-10 12:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4748,4748,'en','Tasty turkey meatballs','Swap beef mince and breadcrumbs with lean turkey and oats. Serve in a tomato sauce with pasta or potatoes. See the tip to make a vegetarian version – Penne with fennel & Parmesan.','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 carrots, finely diced","2 celery sticks, finely diced","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","1 fennel bulb, halved and thinly sliced, fronds reserved","500g carton tomato passata","500ml reduced-salt chicken stock","2 tbsp chopped parsley","broccoli and potatoes or pasta and salad, to serve","400g pack lean turkey breast mince","4 tbsp porridge oats","1 tsp fennel seed, crushed","1 garlic clove, crushed","spray of oil"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying pan with a lid, then tip in the onion, carrots, celery, garlic and fennel, and stir well. Cover the pan and cook over a medium heat for 8 mins, stirring every now and then. Pour in the passata and stock, cover and leave to simmer for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, tip the mince into a large bowl. Add the oats, fennel seeds and leaves, the garlic and plenty of black pepper, and mix in with your hands. Lightly shape into 25 meatballs about the size of a walnut. Spray or rub a non-stick pan with a little oil and gently cook the meatballs until they take on a little colour. Give the sauce a stir, then add the meatballs and parsley. Cover and cook for 10 mins until they are cooked through and the veg in the sauce is tender. Serve with broccoli and baby potatoes in their skins, or pasta and salad."]','2026-01-10 12:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4750,4750,'en','Spicy Moroccan eggs','This quick, spicy brunch dish is packed with healthy courgettes, chickpeas, tomatos and spinach. Flavour your sauce with rose harissa','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 large onion, halved and thinly sliced","3 garlic cloves, sliced","1 tbsp rose harissa","1 tsp ground coriander","150ml vegetable stock","400g can chickpeas","2 x 400g cans cherry tomatoes","2 courgettes, finely diced","200g bag baby spinach","4 tbsp chopped coriander","4 large eggs"]','["Heat the oil in a large, deep frying pan, and fry the onion and garlic for about 8 mins, stirring every now and then, until starting to turn golden. Add the harissa and ground coriander, stir well, then pour in the stock and chickpeas with their liquid. Cover and simmer for 5 mins, then mash about one-third of the chickpeas to thicken the stock a little.","Tip the tomatoes and courgettes into the pan, and cook gently for 10 mins until the courgettes are tender. Fold in the spinach so that it wilts into the pan.","Stir in the chopped coriander, then make 4 hollows in the mixture and break in the eggs. Cover and cook for 2 mins, then take off the heat and allow to settle for 2 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4751,4751,'en','Lunchbox snacks','Keep hunger pangs at bay with these healthy, yummy lunchbox nibbles','["bean dip with veggie sticks","raspberry banana smoothie","cinnamon custard plums","apricot yogurt granola pots","carrot & pineapple muffins (all ingredients for recipes below)"]','["Bean dip with\r\nveggie sticks5 of 5-a-day, low fat.\r\nWhizz 215g can\r\ndrained butterbeans, squeeze lemon\r\njuice, 1 small crushed garlic clove,\r\n1 tbsp each chopped parsley and mint,\r\n2 tsp olive oil and 1 tbsp water. Serve\r\nwith vegetable dippers made from 1\r\ncelery stick, 1 carrot and ½ red pepper - wrap in a damp piece of kitchen paper to stop them drying out\r\n(serves 1).","Raspberry banana smoothieWhizz 85g raspberries together with\r\n1 chopped banana and 150ml orange\r\njuice until smooth (serves 1).","Cinnamon\r\ncustard plumsPut 1 tbsp honey,\r\n1 tsp butter, 2 quartered plums, few\r\ndrops vanilla extract, pinch ground\r\ncinnamon and 2 tsp water in a dish.\r\nCover with cling film, pierce, microwave\r\nfor 3 mins on High. Once cooled, put\r\nfruit in a container and spoon 2-3 tbsp custard on top. Seal and refrigerate\r\n(serves 1).","Apricot yogurt\r\ngranola potsMix 200g oats, 2 tbsp honey and\r\n1 tbsp sunflower oil in a baking tray.\r\nSpread out and bake at 200C/180C fan/\r\ngas 6 for 7 mins. Stir, bake for 7 mins\r\nmore. Cool. Mix with 150g dried fruits (enough for 8 servings).\r\nFor one serving, mix 100ml natural\r\nyogurt with 1 tbsp sugar-free apricot\r\njam in a container. Store granola in an\r\nairtight container and portion into a\r\nsmall bag when packing lunchbox.","Carrot &\r\npineapple muffinsSift together 140g self-raising flour,\r\n85g wholemeal flour (reserving about\r\n2 tbsp of the bran), ½ tsp bicarbonate\r\nof soda, 2 tsp ground cinnamon and a\r\npinch salt. In another bowl, beat 150ml\r\nsunflower oil with 100g golden caster\r\nsugar. Add 200g mashed cooked\r\ncarrots, 3 canned pineapple slices, cut\r\ninto cubes, 2 tbsp pineapple juice from\r\nthe can, 1 egg and 1 tsp vanilla extract.\r\nMix in 50g sunflower seeds. Fold dry\r\nmix into the wet one. Cut out a dozen\r\n10cm squares of baking parchment and\r\nplace in the holes of a muffin tin. Spoon\r\nmixture into tin, sprinkle with bran and\r\na few sunflower seeds. Bake at 200C/\r\n180C fan/gas 6 for 20-25 mins or until a\r\nskewer comes out clean. Leave to cool (makes 12)."]','2026-01-10 12:14:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4752,4752,'en','Summer fruit quinoa salad','Jazz up this good-for-you grain with some stone fruits like apricots, peaches and nectarines- add a little mint and parsley for colour and flavour','["100g quinoa","3 peaches or nectarines, or 6 apricots, diced","50g toasted hazelnuts, roughly chopped","handful mint, roughly chopped","handful parsley, roughly chopped","2 tbsp olive oil","zest and juice 1 lemon"]','["Put the quinoa in a medium saucepan\r\nand cover with 300ml water. Bring to the\r\nboil and simmer for 20 mins or until the\r\nquinoa is tender. Drain off any excess\r\nliquid and set aside to cool.","Add the fruit, hazelnuts, herbs and\r\nseasoning to the cooled quinoa.","Whisk together the olive oil, lemon\r\nzest and juice. Pour over the salad\r\nand mix thoroughly."]','2026-01-10 12:14:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4754,4754,'en','Tomato & courgette stew','Serve up a simple healthy side of slow-cooked vegetables with basil, garlic and Parmesan cheese','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","3 courgettes, quartered lengthways and cut into chunks","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","small bunch basil, torn","25g Parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), finely grated"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a\r\nmedium heat. Add the onion and cook for\r\nabout 10 mins until softened and starting\r\nto go golden brown. Add the garlic and\r\ncook for 5 mins more.","Add the courgettes and cook for\r\nabout 5 mins until starting to soften. Tip\r\nin the tomatoes and give everything a\r\ngood stir. Simmer for 35-40 mins or until\r\ntomatoes are reduced and courgettes\r\nsoft, then stir in the basil and Parmesan."]','2026-01-10 12:14:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4756,4756,'en','Vegan tomato & mushroom pancakes','You can''t beat pancakes for brunch. Try making this delicious dairy and egg-free recipe with a creamy tomato and button mushroom topping','["140g white self-raising flour","1 tsp soya flour","400ml soya milk","vegetable oil, for frying","2 tbsp vegetable oil","250g button mushrooms","250g cherry tomatoes, halved","2 tbsp soya cream or soya milk","large handful pine nuts","snipped chives, to serve"]','["Sift the flours and a pinch of salt into\r\na blender. Add the soya milk and blend\r\nto make a smooth batter.","Heat a little oil in a medium non-stick\r\nfrying pan until very hot. Pour about\r\n3 tbsp of the batter into the pan and cook\r\nover a medium heat until bubbles appear\r\non the surface of the pancake. Flip the\r\npancake over with a palette knife and\r\ncook the other side until golden brown.\r\nRepeat with the remaining batter,\r\nkeeping the cooked pancakes warm\r\nas you go. You will make about 8.","For the topping, heat the oil in a frying\r\npan. Cook the mushrooms until tender,\r\nadd the tomatoes and cook for a couple\r\nof mins. Pour in the soya cream or milk\r\nand pine nuts, then gently cook until\r\ncombined. Divide the pancakes between\r\n2 plates, then spoon over the tomatoes\r\nand mushrooms. Scatter with chives."]','2026-01-10 12:14:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4758,4758,'en','Cherry tomato, thyme & bacon flan','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA filling and savoury dish especially suited to those on a dairy-free diet','["50g wholemeal flour","85g vegetable baking margarine","100g plain flour","1 large egg, beaten","150g natural Yofu (a 100% dairy-free yogurt)","1 small onion, diced","1 tbsp vegetable oil","4 tbsp soya milk","leaves from 2 sprigs thyme, plus a few extra sprigs","150g cherry tomatoes, halved","2 thick-cut rashers unsmoked bacon, chopped"]','["Preheat the oven to 220C/gas 7/\r\nfan 200C. Put the flours in a bowl\r\nand rub in the margarine until it\r\nresembles breadcrumbs. Mix in\r\n4-5 tsp water to make a soft\r\ndough. Turn on to a lightly floured\r\nsurface, roll out and use to line a 20cm flan tin. Line with baking\r\nparchment, cover with baking\r\nbeans and bake for 5 minutes.\r\nRemove the paper and beans and\r\nbake for 5 minutes more. Allow to\r\ncool on a rack. Reduce the oven\r\nto 160C/gas 3/fan oven 140C.","Heat the oil in a pan and cook\r\nthe bacon and onion until crispy.\r\nRemove from the heat.","Mix the soya milk, Yofu,\r\neggs and thyme leaves. Season\r\nwell. Put the onion, bacon and\r\ntomatoes in the flan case. Add\r\nthe milk mixture and top with\r\nextra thyme sprigs on top. Bake\r\nfor 30 minutes until set."]','2026-01-10 12:14:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4760,4760,'en','Panna cotta with apricot compote','A dairy-free panna cotta using soya milk. Perfect texture and a blend of flavours make this dish hard to fault','["3 level tsp gelatine (or agar agar)","500ml soya milk (we used So Good)","zest 1 lemon","1 vanilla pod, split","splash of rum brandy","25g golden caster sugar","350g ripe apricots","50g caster sugar"]','["Sprinkle the gelatine onto 3 tbsp water and soak for 5 mins. Put the soya milk, zest, vanilla pod, sugar and rum into a pan. Heat until the liquid just comes to the boil, then remove from the heat and stir in the gelatine. Cool for 10 mins. Strain the milk mixture, then divide between 4 ramekins. Cover and refrigerate until set (approximately 1½ hrs).","Halve and stone the apricots. Put the sugar and 150ml water into a pan, then heat until the sugar has dissolved. Add the apricots and cook over a gentle heat for 12-15 mins or until the apricots are soft, then leave to cool. Serve in a dish alongside the panna cotta."]','2026-01-10 12:14:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4762,4762,'en','Hot BBQ beef, horseradish & pasta salad','A allergy friendly pasta dish that everyone will enjoy. Perfect for guests with food intolerances','["450g lean rump steaks","2 tbsp dairy and wheat-free Worcestershire sauce dairy and wheat-free","2 tsp coarsely ground black pepper","250g ''Free From'' fusilli pasta (we used Sainsbury''s)","1 bunch spring onion, thinly sliced","3 red peppers, grilled to remove the skins, deseeded and thickly sliced","small bunch basil, torn","4 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","2 tbsp sherry vinegar","2-3 tbsp freshly grated horseradish, to taste"]','["Marinate the steak in the Worcester sauce for 10 mins and sprinkle over the black pepper.","Cook the pasta according to pack instructions, drain, then toss with the spring onions, peppers and basil. Mix the dressing\r\ningredients together, season, then set aside.","Heat the barbecue or a griddle pan until very hot. Cook the steak for 3 mins on each side, or until cooked to your liking. Cut into thick slices, then toss into the pasta with the dressing. Adjust seasoning to taste and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4764,4764,'en','Creamy rice with double apricots','Proof that you can make a simple dairy-free pudding for all the family to enjoy!','["50g pudding rice","500ml carton long-life vanilla-flavoured sweetened soya milk alternative (we used UHT Provamel organic vanilla)","50g ready-to-eat dried apricots, chopped into small pieces","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","250ml carton soya single cream alternative (we used UHT Provamel Soya Dream)","8 tbsp apricot compote or 4 tbsp apricot conserve","1 tbsp shelled pistachio nuts, chopped"]','["Put the rice and soya milk into a medium-sized saucepan, stir and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat immediately or the soya will bubble up and can easily boil over. Half cover the pan with a lid then cook gently for 40-45 minutes over a very low heat, stirring occasionally until the rice has swollen and is very tender. The mixture should be thick and creamy.","While the rice is cooking, mix\r\ntogether the apricots, sugar\r\nand single cream alternative.","Remove the rice from the\r\nheat, leave to cool for 15\r\nminutes, then stir in the apricot\r\nmixture. Spoon into 4 small\r\ntumblers or glass dishes.\r\nCover and chill in the fridge for\r\n30 minutes (or longer if you\r\nhave the time).","To serve, spoon two tbsp of\r\napricot compote or 1 tbsp of\r\nconserve on top of each\r\ndessert and scatter the\r\npistachios on top."]','2026-01-10 12:14:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4766,4766,'en','Blueberry & coconut cake','This dairy-free dessert is a guaranteed crowd-pleaser and is even freezer-friendly','["250ml rice bran oil, plus extra for the tin","3 eggs","225g caster sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","300g self-raising flour","50g desiccated coconut","175ml soya milk","140g fresh or frozen blueberries, plus extra to serve","icing sugar, to dust"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4\r\nand grease a 22cm Bundt or ring tin.\r\nWhisk the oil, eggs, sugar and vanilla in\r\na large bowl. Combine the flour and\r\ncoconut. Alternately, fold the flour mix\r\nand soya milk into the wet ingredients,\r\nstarting and ending with the flour.","Spoon a quarter into the tin. Fold the\r\nblueberries into the remaining batter, then\r\nspoon into the tin. Bake for 1-1¼ hrs, or\r\nuntil a skewer comes out clean. Cover\r\nthe cake with foil if it browns too quickly.","Cool in tin for 10 mins, then turn out\r\nonto a wire rack and cool completely. Fill\r\ncentre of the cake with extra blueberries\r\nand dust with icing sugar to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4768,4768,'en','Chicken fricassée with new potatoes & asparagus','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyDelicious dairy-free casserole with a creamy cider sauce','["1 tbsp groundnut oil","4 lean smoked back bacon rashers, chopped and rind removed","6 skinless chicken breast fillets","700g new potatoes, thickly sliced","250g asparagus spears, trimmed and diagonally sliced (keep tips whole)","225ml dry fruity cider (or ½ a can)","1 tbsp cornflour, blended with a little water","250ml carton Soya Dream","2 tbsp chopped flatleaf parsley"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan, then fry the bacon for 5 mins on a medium heat until golden. Remove with a slotted spoon and set aside. Add the chicken to the pan, then lightly fry for 4-5 mins to brown on both sides (you may need to brown the chicken in two batches if your pan is not large enough).","Meanwhile, cook the potatoes in a pan of salted boiling water for 10 mins or until tender. Cook the asparagus in a steamer over the potatoes for 6-8 mins or microwave in a covered dish with 2 tbsp water for 4-5 mins.","Pour the cider over the chicken, bring to the boil then reduce heat. Put the bacon back in the pan and simmer for 10-15 mins until the chicken is cooked through. Stir in the cornflour paste until lightly thickened, then add the Soya Dream and season. Stir in the drained vegetables and sprinkle with chopped parsley before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4770,4770,'en','Creamy tarragon chicken bake','Gluten, egg and dairy free – this is the perfect dinner party dish for those with intolerances','["2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 tbsp rice flour (we used Doves Farm)","300ml soya milk (we used So Good)","4 chicken breasts, skin removed","2 red onions, cut into wedges","250g punnet cherry tomatoes, halved","250g asparagus spears, blanched","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","150ml vegetable stock (we used Kallo yeast-free vegetable stock)","3 tbsp chopped tarragon","4 tbsp gluten-free breadcrumbs (we used Sainsbury''s ''Free From'' English muffins)","1 tbsp grated dairy and lactose-free cheese (we used Cheezly)"]','["Mix half the oil and flour in a saucepan (off\r\nthe heat), then blend in the soya milk (it must\r\nbe well blended before heating). Bring the\r\nsauce slowly to the boil, whisking constantly,\r\nthen simmer for 1 min. Remove from the heat,\r\ncover with greaseproof paper and set aside.","Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Heat\r\nremaining oil in a frying pan, add the chicken,\r\nthen fry for 2-3 mins or until brown (it won’t\r\nbe cooked through). Transfer to an ovenproof\r\ngratin dish. Add the onions to the pan and fry\r\nfor 2-3 mins. Spoon over the chicken, then\r\ntop with the tomatoes and asparagus. Set\r\naside while you prepare the sauce.","Put the sugar and vinegar into the pan.\r\nStir over medium heat until the sugar is a dark\r\ncaramel colour, then add the stock. Bring to\r\nthe boil and simmer for 1 min. Whisk into the\r\nmilky sauce until blended, season, then add\r\nthe tarragon. Spoon sauce over the chicken\r\nand veg, sprinkle with crumbs and cheese,\r\nthen bake for 20 mins or until cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:14:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4772,4772,'en','Butter bean & tomato salad','This quick and easy vegan French salad combines delicious flavours – perfect summer dish','["420g can butter beans, drained and rinsed","500g cherry tomatoes, quartered","2 small green or yellow courgettes (about 300g/10oz in total), chopped into small dice","1 small red onion, chopped","15-20g pack fresh coriander, chopped","2 tbsp lemon juice","3 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp ground cumin"]','["Tip all the ingredients into a bowl with some salt and pepper and mix well. Cover and leave at room temperature until ready to serve. This salad can happily be made the day before and chilled.","On the day, bring the salad to room temperature and give it a good stir before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4774,4774,'en','Chocolate crunch & raspberry pots','You''d never guess this was an allergy free dessert – no nuts, dairy, gluten or eggs. The perfect solution to those tricky menus','["250g punnet raspberries","2 tbsp Cointreau (or Grand Marnier)","zest and juice from 1 small orange","100g pack dairy, gluten and wheat-free, ‘Free From'' chocolate (we used Kinnerton Luxury Dark Chocolate Bar)","3 tbsp soya milk","50g caster sugar","6 tbsp gluten, wheat and nut-free muesli muesli (we used The Food Doctor Cereal, nut-free)"]','["Divide the raspberries between 4 glasses.\r\nSprinkle ½ tbsp of Cointreau and a little\r\norange zest and juice over each, then set aside.","Melt the chocolate and stir into the soya\r\nmilk, then set aside. Tip the sugar into a pan\r\nalong with 3 tbsp water. Over a gentle heat,\r\ncook without stirring for about 7 mins until\r\nthe sugar melts and starts to turn golden\r\nbrown. Tip in the muesli, stir, then pour\r\nonto a tray lined with baking parchment.\r\nLeave to cool, then shatter into thin shards.","Divide the chocolate mixture between the glasses and allow to cool, but don’t refrigerate.\r\nScatter over the caramel crunch to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4775,4776,'en','Dairy-free pancakes','Skip regular milk and replace it with coconut or hemp milk in these light pancakes suitable for people with dairy or lactose intolerance','["125g plain flour","1 egg","300ml hemp or coconut milk (see tip)","sunflower or rice bran oil , for frying"]','["Put the flour in a bowl and make a well in the centre. Crack the egg in the middle and pour in a quarter of the milk. Use an electric or balloon whisk to thoroughly combine the mixture. Once you have a paste, mix in another quarter and once lump free, mix in the remaining milk. Leave to rest for 20 mins. Stir again before using.","Heat a small, non-stick frying pan with a splash of oil. When hot, pour a small amount of the mixture into the pan and swirl around to coat the base – you want a thin layer. Cook for a few mins until golden brown on the bottom, then turn over and cook until golden on the other side. Repeat until you have used all the mixture, stirring the mixture in between pancakes and adding more oil for frying as necessary. Pile the pancakes up between sheets of baking parchment or cook to order. Serve with the pancake filling of choice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4777,4777,'en','Citrus marmalade','Have some citrus fruits threatening to go soft in your fruit bowl? Make a zingy marmalade – as well as spreading it on your toast, it makes a lovely gift','["1kg unwaxed citrus fruit (we used a mixture of grapefruit, lemons and limes)","2.25kg granulated sugar"]','["Chill a saucer in the freezer, ready for checking the setting point of your jam later. Wash the citrus fruits and remove the top parts that were attached to the stalks.","Put the whole citrus fruits in a largesaucepanwith 2½ litres of cold water. Bring to the boil, then cover the pan and simmer for 2 hrs 30 mins, or until the skins can be pierced easily with a small knife.","Use a slotted spoon to scoop the fruits out of the liquid and set aside to cool for at least 10-15 mins. Measure out 1.5 litres of the liquor and pour it back into the pan. If you don’t have enough, top up with water.","Halve the citrus fruits, remove the pips and set aside. Cut the peel and flesh into thin 0.2 cm strips (depending on how thick-cut you would like it to be). Tip all of the flesh and skin, along with any juices, back into the pan with the liquid. Put the pips in a small piece of muslin and tie up with string. Add this to the pan as well, which will help the setting process.","Tip in the sugar and bring to the boil, stirring frequently. Continue to boil rapidly for 45-50 mins – it should reach 105C. Test the setting point by dropping a little marmalade onto the chilled saucer, allowing it to cool for 1 min, then push gently with your finger. If it crinkles, it has reached the setting point. If it doesn’t, continue to boil and check again after 5-10 mins.","Leave the marmalade to cool in the pan for 10-15 mins, then carefully scoop out the muslin bag using a slotted spoon. Gently stir the marmalade in one direction to disperse any air bubbles, then pour into sterilised jars and seal with a lid. Find outhow to sterilise jars. Will keep for up to a year."]','2026-01-10 12:14:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4779,4779,'en','Blueberry smoothie recipe','Make a quick and simple blueberry smoothie with yogurt, banana and apple juice for busy mornings. You can easily make it vegan by using coconut yogurt','["175g blueberries","1 small banana, sliced","1 tbsp natural or Greek yogurt","100ml apple juice, chilled","3-4 mint leaves (optional), plus extra to garnish"]','["Put the blueberries, banana, yogurt, apple juice and mint, if using, in ablenderand blitz until smooth. Add a splash of water if it seems too thick.","Pour the smoothie into a tall glass with a glass straw to serve. Garnish with a sprig of mint, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4781,4781,'en','Baked oats','Enjoy baked oats for breakfast with bananas, mixed spice and your choice of chocolate chips, blueberries or raspberries. Serve warm with more fruit to make it extra-special','["100g porridge oats","1 tsp baking powder","1 banana, peeled and chopped","1 tbsp maple syrup or honey","2 eggs","pinch of mixed spice or ground cinnamon","100g chocolate chips, blueberries or raspberries, plus extra to serve","flavourless oil, for the ramekins"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the oats in ablenderand pulse a few times until they start to resemble flour. Add the baking powder, chopped banana, maple syrup or honey, eggs and mixed spice or cinnamon, and whizz until smooth. Stir in the chocolate chips or berries.","Lightly oil four heatproof ramekins, then divide the batter between them. Bake for 20-25 mins, or until well-risen and the baked oats spring back when lightly pressed. Scatter with more chocolate chips or berries before serving, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4783,4783,'en','Air fryer bacon','Cook bacon in an air fryer to achieve a crispy texture with less fat. The perfect bacon sandwich starts here','["6 rashers streaky bacon, or 3 rashers back bacon"]','["Lay the bacon in a single layer in the base of anair fryer– be sure the layers aren''t overlapping. The size of the air fryer basket will determine how many rashers you can cook at one time.","Set the air fryer to 200C and cook streaky bacon rashers for 6-10 mins – just-cooked bacon will take 6 mins, but crispier bacon will take 9-10 mins. Cook back bacon rashers for 4-8 mins, depending on your preference. If you are cooking in batches, remember that the second batch will usually be quicker as the air fryer has heated up.","Remove the bacon using tongs and put on kitchen paper to drain before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4785,4785,'en','Pancetta & pepper piperade','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyEggs are cracked into a rich tomato and pancetta sauce in this traditional Basque-inspired dish – perfect for brunch or a midweek meal','["2 x 70g packs pancetta pieces","1 red onion, finely chopped","3 peppers, 1 each of green, red and yellow, deseeded and finely diced","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","4 medium eggs","small handful basil leaves, shredded","crusty bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the pancetta and onion in a large, deep frying pan. Cook for 7 mins until the onion is beginning to soften.","Add the peppers, tomatoes and tomato purée to the pan and mix well. Season, cover and cook for 10-15 mins.","Make 4 small wells in the mixture. Crack an egg into each well and cook for a further 5-6 mins or until the eggs have set. Scatter with basil and serve straight away, with crusty bread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4787,4787,'en','Better-than-baked beans with spicy wedges','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyStudents'' cuisine may be the butt of many a joke, but with these nutrient-packed, low-fat and cheap beans, they get the last laugh','["1 tsp oil","1 onion, halved and thinly sliced","2 rashers streaky bacon, cut into large-ish pieces","1 tsp sugar, brown if you have it","400g can chopped tomatoes","200ml stock from a cube","410g can cannellini beans, butter or haricot beans in water","1 tbsp white flour (plain or self-raising)","½  tsp cayenne pepper, paprika or mild chilli powder","1 tsp dried mixed herb (optional)","2 baking potatoes, each cut into 8 wedges","2 tsp oil"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. For the\r\nwedges, mix the flour, cayenne and herbs (if\r\nusing), add some salt and pepper, then toss\r\nwith the potatoes and oil until well coated.\r\nTip into a roasting tin, then bake for about\r\n35 mins until crisp and cooked through.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a non-stick pan,\r\nthen gently fry the onion and bacon together\r\nfor 5-10 mins until the onions are softened and\r\njust starting to turn golden. Stir in the sugar,\r\ntomatoes, stock and seasoning to taste, then\r\nsimmer the sauce for 5 mins. Add the beans,\r\nthen simmer for another 5 mins until the sauce\r\nhas thickened. Serve with the wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:14:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4789,4789,'en','Parsnip hash browns','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThese crispy hash browns can be made ahead and reheated from frozen – ideal for unexpected Christmas visitors','["450g waxy potatoes (such as Charlotte)","350g parsnips or other root veg","1 small onion, halved and thinly sliced","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 egg, beaten","4-5 tbsp sunflower oil","6 rashers of streaky bacon or slices of prosciutto","6 stems of cherry tomatoes on the vine","6 eggs"]','["Peel and coarsely grate the potatoes and parsnips – if you’re using a food processor, attach the medium grater. Squeeze out as much liquid as possible with your hands and put them in a bowl.","Stir in the onion, garlic, egg and season if you like. Divide the mixture into six and roughly shape into flat cakes. Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in a large non-stick frying pan and fry three of the cakes on a low heat for 4-5 mins on each side until golden and tender. Transfer to kitchen paper with a slotted spoon and leave to cool while frying the remainder, adding remaining oil as necessary. Meanwhile grill the bacon and tomatoes, poach the eggs and serve alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:14:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4791,4791,'en','All-in-one-baked mushrooms','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA great midweek meal or weekend breakfast baked in one tray to save the washing up','["2 tbsp olive oil","4 very large field mushrooms","4 slices good-quality cooked ham","4 eggs"]','["Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Drizzle \r\na little olive oil over the base of a ceramic \r\nbaking dish, then pop in the mushrooms.","Drizzle with the remaining oil and seasoning. \r\nBake for 15 mins until soft, then remove \r\nfrom the oven.","Tuck the ham slices around the mushrooms \r\nto create little pockets. Crack the eggs into the \r\npockets, then return to the oven for 10 mins \r\nuntil the egg white is set and the yolk is still \r\na little runny. Serve scooped straight from the \r\ndish. Great with baked beans and chips."]','2026-01-10 12:14:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4793,4793,'en','Grapefruit, agave & pistachio salad','Fruit salads are quick to whip up and one of the healthiest ways to start the day – sweeten with a sugar alternative','["1 pink grapefruit","1 white grapefruit","1 tbsp agave nectar","1 tsp chopped pistachio"]','["Segment grapefruits, removing as much of the pith as possible. Divide the segments between two bowls and top with with agave and pistachios."]','2026-01-10 12:14:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4795,4795,'en','Soft-boiled egg, bacon & watercress salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyCrispy bacon and a perfectly cooked egg with oozing yellow yolk is a brunch staple – this version teams it with watercress','["2 large eggs, at room temperature","1 shallot, very finely chopped","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 heaped tsp wholegrain mustard","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","handful chives, snipped (optional)","4 thick rashers streaky smoked dry-cured bacon","2 slices good white crusty bread (ideally sourdough)","2 good handfuls British watercress, thick stems removed"]','["Put the eggs in a pan of cold water\r\nand bring to the boil. Boil for 3 mins,\r\nthen lift into a bowl of iced water and\r\ncool completely. Very carefully peel\r\naway the shells. Leave the eggs in the\r\niced water until you finish the recipe,\r\nor for up to 1 hr ahead.","Mix the shallot with the vinegar and\r\na pinch of salt, then set aside for a few minutes to soften. Whisk in the\r\nmustard, oil and chives, if using,\r\nto make a dressing.","Heat the grill to low-medium and\r\ncook the bacon until crisp right through.\r\nRemove the bacon, then brush the\r\nbacon juice and fat all over the bread.\r\nGrill the bread for about 1 min on each\r\nside until crisp, then cut into soldiers\r\nand keep warm.","Just before serving, bring the pan\r\nof water back to the boil and add the\r\neggs. Boil for 1 min to reheat. Toss\r\nthe dressing with the watercress and\r\ndivide between 2 plates. Top with an\r\negg and 2 rashers of bacon, with the\r\ntoast to the side. The egg yolks will\r\nstill be runny inside."]','2026-01-10 12:14:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4797,4797,'en','Grapefruit, orange & apricot salad','A super-simple fruit salad for breakfast and beyond, sweetened with honey and packed with nutrients','["2 grapefruit, peel and pith cut away","4 oranges, peel and pith cut away","4 apricots, stoned and sliced","1 tbsp clear honey"]','["Segment the grapefruits and oranges\r\ninto a large bowl to catch the juices. Stir\r\nin the apricots and honey, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4799,4799,'en','Shakshuka','Vary this popular brunch dish by flavouring the simple tomato sauce with whatever you have to hand – curry powder, pesto or fresh herbs','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 red onions, chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 garlic clove, sliced","small bunch coriander, stalks and leaves chopped separately","2 400g cans cherry tomatoes","1 tsp caster sugar","4 eggs"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan that has a\r\nlid, then soften the onions, chilli, garlic and\r\ncoriander stalks for 5 mins until soft. Stir\r\nin the tomatoes and sugar, then bubble\r\nfor 8-10 mins until thick. Can be frozen for\r\n1 month.","Using the back of a large spoon, make\r\n4 dips in the sauce, then crack an egg into\r\neach one. Put a lid on the pan, then cook\r\nover a low heat for 6-8 mins, until the eggs\r\nare done to your liking. Scatter with the\r\ncoriander leaves and serve with crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:14:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4801,4801,'en','Orange & mint salad','Good Food reader Hannah Measures shares her recipe for a fresh and healthy breakfast fruit salad','["4 oranges","12 soft dates, stoned, sliced lengthways","small bunch mint, leaves finely chopped, plus a few left whole","1 tbsp rose syrup or rosewater"]','["Peel then segment the oranges,\r\nremoving the white pith. Place in a bowl\r\nalong with any juices, then add the dates,\r\nchopped mint and rose syrup and toss\r\ngently. Divide between 4 dessert bowls,\r\nscatter on the mint leaves and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4803,4803,'en','Veggie breakfast bakes','Hit 3 of your 5-a-day with this alternative fry-up – it''s packed with vegetables and oven-baked','["4 large field mushrooms","8 tomatoes, halved","1 garlic clove, thinly sliced","2 tsp olive oil","200g bag spinach","4 eggs"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPut the mushrooms and tomatoes into\r\n4 ovenproof dishes. Divide garlic between\r\nthe dishes, drizzle over the oil and some\r\nseasoning, then bake for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, put the spinach into a large\r\ncolander, then pour over a kettle of\r\nboiling water to wilt it. Squeeze out any\r\nexcess water, then add the spinach to\r\nthe dishes. Make a little gap between the\r\nvegetables and crack an egg into each\r\ndish. Return to the oven and cook for a\r\nfurther 8-10 mins or until the egg is\r\ncooked to your liking."]','2026-01-10 12:14:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4805,4805,'en','Baked eggs with ham & spinach','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyServe this adaptable Mexican-style dish for brunch, breakfast or dinner with spicy tomato sauce','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 small onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 small green chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","100g ready-roasted peppers from a jar, drained and sliced","180g pack ham, torn, or shredded ham hock","50g baby spinach","2 medium eggs","pinch cayenne pepper","crusty bread, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nHeat the oil in a small ovenproof sauté\r\npan. Add the onion and cook for 6 mins\r\nuntil softened. Stir in the garlic and chilli,\r\nand cook for a couple mins more. Add\r\nthe tomatoes and 100ml water. Season\r\nwell and stir through the peppers and\r\nham. Bring to a simmer and cook for\r\n10 mins until the sauce has started\r\nto thicken. Add the spinach, stirring\r\nthrough to wilt.","Make 2 hollows in the sauce and\r\ncrack your eggs into them. Add a pinch\r\nof cayenne, transfer to the oven and\r\nbake for 10 mins until the whites of\r\nthe eggs have set. Serve straight away\r\nwith crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:14:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4807,4807,'en','Peanut butter & banana on toast','Keep mid-morning hunger pangs at bay with this nutritionally balanced breakfast toastie','["2 slices granary bread","1 small banana","½  tsp cinnamon","1 tbsp crunchy peanut butter"]','["Toast bread and slice\r\nbanana. Layer banana on one\r\nslice of toast and dust with\r\ncinnamon. Spread the second slice\r\nwith peanut butter,\r\nthen sandwich the two together and\r\neat straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:14:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4809,4809,'en','Seville orange marmalade','Seize the short Seville orange season and boil up homemade marmalade to put on your toast and use in Jane’s recipes','["1kg Seville oranges, well scrubbed and halved","1 unwaxed lemon","2kg granulated sugar"]','["Squeeze the oranges and keep their\r\njuice. Scrape out the pith and pips with\r\na metal spoon, again keeping everything.\r\nJuice the lemon, too, then put the lemon\r\nshells, orange pith and seeds into a\r\nsquare of muslin about 30 x 30cm, and\r\ntie it with string. Leave the string long –\r\nthat way you can tie it to your wooden\r\nspoon, which will make it easier to lift\r\nout later.","Cut each orange shell into 3 petals,\r\nthen finely shred with a large, sharp\r\nknife. Put the peel into a preserving pan,\r\ntip in the juices, then sit the bag in the\r\njuice. Pour in 2.4 litres/4 pints cold water\r\nand leave to steep overnight.","Next day, leaving the bag in the pan,\r\nbring the liquid to the boil, then simmer\r\nfor about 1 hr, or until the peel is soft and\r\ntranslucent and the liquid has reduced by\r\none third. Turn off the heat and lift the\r\nmuslin bag into a large bowl. Leave the\r\nbag until it’s cool enough to handle.","While you wait, get your jars ready.\r\nWash 8 x 450g/1lb jars (or the equivalent\r\nvolume larger or smaller jars) in hot,\r\nsoapy water, then leave in a low oven\r\nto dry completely. Keep them warm.\r\nAlternatively, if you’ve got a dishwasher\r\nyou can run the jars and lids though\r\na hot cycle, then let them dry. Put a\r\nsaucer in the freezer at this point, too.","Now for the messy bit – I like to don a\r\npair of rubber gloves at this point. Hold\r\nthe bag over its bowl, and squeeze and\r\npummel it until you’ve extracted every\r\nlast drop of juice and gunge through the\r\nmuslin. This stuff contains the pectin –\r\nthe crucial ingredient to the perfect set.\r\nYou can now throw away what’s left in\r\nthe bag and wash the muslin, ready to\r\nre-use.","Stir the contents of the bowl, plus all\r\nthe sugar, into the pan. Stir every so\r\noften over a very gentle heat until the\r\nsugar has completely dissolved. Don’t\r\nboil before all the sugar has melted.","Slowly bring the pan to the boil. After\r\n10 mins boiling, spoon a small blob of\r\nmarmalade onto the cold saucer. Leave\r\nfor a few secs, then push the marmalade\r\nwith your finger. If it wrinkles, it’s ready.\r\nIf not, boil for 10 mins more then try again.\r\nEven if you have a sugar thermometer\r\n(look for 105C or where it says ‘jam’), I’d\r\nstill recommend the saucer test. If yours\r\nseems to be taking a while don’t worry,\r\nit can take anything from 10 mins to\r\n45 mins for marmalade to reach setting\r\npoint, depending on your oranges. Skim\r\noff any scum that comes to the surface\r\nin the meantime.","Once you’ve reached setting point,\r\nladle the marmalade into the warm jars\r\nand seal. A funnel is really handy if you\r\nhave one. The marmalade will keep for up\r\nto 1 year in a cool, dark place, and for\r\nup to a month in the fridge once opened."]','2026-01-10 12:14:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4811,4811,'en','Spicy fry-up rice','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyGive your full English a spicy twist with this indulgent brunch recipe – the chilli paste can be frozen ahead','["2 medium onions","2 tbsp vegetable oil, plus extra to fry the eggs","400g basmati rice, well rinsed","12 cocktail sausages, or 6 chipolatas twisted, then snipped in half","6 rashers dry-cured streaky bacon, cut into bite-size pieces","140g chestnut mushrooms, halved","2 red or green chillies, deseeded","3 garlic cloves, bashed flat to remove the skin","6 eggs","20g pack coriander","soy sauce and chilli sauce, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nThinly slice half an onion, toss with 1 tsp\r\noil on a baking tray, then cook in the oven\r\nfor 15 mins, turning once, until golden\r\nand starting to crisp. Meanwhile, put the\r\nrice into a large pan with enough water\r\nto cover by a fingertip. Bring to the boil,\r\nstir once, then cover and simmer for 10\r\nmins. Take off the heat, leave covered for\r\n10 mins, then fluff up with a fork.","While the rice and onion cook, add 1 tsp\r\noil to a frying pan. Fry the sausages for\r\na couple of mins. Now tip in the bacon\r\nand sizzle for another 5-7 mins until the\r\nbacon is golden and sausages cooked.\r\nTip into a big dish. Fry the mushrooms for\r\n3 mins until golden, then tip in with the\r\nbacon and sausage. Wipe out the pan.","Put the chillies, garlic, remaining onions\r\nand 1 tbsp oil into a small food processor,\r\nthen whizz to a paste. The paste can be\r\nmade up to 1 month ahead and frozen.\r\nGently fry the paste for about 3 mins\r\nuntil fragrant, stirring. Tip in the rice,\r\nstir well, then fold in the meat and the\r\nmushrooms. Add a splash of water and\r\nstir everything together. Tip into the dish,\r\ncover, then keep warm in the oven while\r\nyou fry the eggs.","Wipe the pan, then heat a thin layer of\r\noil over a low heat and crack in however\r\nmany eggs the pan can hold. Gently fry,\r\nspooning over some of the hot oil now\r\nand again, until cooked to your liking.\r\nTake the dish out of the oven. Roughly\r\nchop the coriander and fork it through\r\nthe rice with a splash of soy, then spoon\r\nonto plates. Top each with an egg, then\r\nsplash with more soy and chilli sauce to\r\ntaste. Scatter over the crisp onions"]','2026-01-10 12:14:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4813,4813,'en','Tropical breakfast smoothie','Start your day with this fruity blend of passion fruits, mango, orange and banana. It''s a good source of vitamin C and provides 1 of your 5-a-day, too','["3 passion fruits","1 banana, chopped","1 small mango, peeled, stoned and chopped","300ml orange juice","ice cubes"]','["Scoop the pulp of the passion fruits into a blender and add the banana, mango and orange juice. Purée until smooth and drink immediately, topped with ice cubes."]','2026-01-10 12:14:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4815,4815,'en','Cuddly egg men','A decoration and breakfast treat in one – please hungry kids with these baked eggs and homemade bread men, they’ll enjoy making them too!','["400g strong white flour","½  tsp salt","pinch of sugar","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","2 tbsp olive oil","4 large eggs, at room temperature"]','["Put the flour into a large bowl and stir in the salt, sugar and yeast. Pour in 250ml water and the oil and mix to a soft dough. Add a little extra water if necessary.","Knead the dough for a few minutes until smooth and then put into a bowl, cover and leave in a warm place for about 1 hour or until doubled in size.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Turn the dough out onto a board, knead briefly and then cut into four. Take one piece and cut off a quarter and shape into a ball for the head. Shape the other piece into a sausage. Attach the head to the body using a little cold water.","Place the dough onto a non-stick baking sheet. Using a sharp knife cut the bottom half of the sausage to make two legs, then cut into the sides up to the shoulders to make two arms. Using scissors, snip at intervals around the top of the head to make hair and make one snip for the mouth. Use a wooden skewer to make two eyes.","Take one egg and place on the dough man’s tummy. Fold the arms over the egg and secure with a little cold water. Make three more egg men with the remaining dough. Leave to prove for about 10 mins.","Bake in the oven for 20 mins until well risen and golden. Cool on a wire rack for a few mins before peeling the egg and eating with the warm bread."]','2026-01-10 12:14:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4817,4817,'en','Malted walnut seed loaf','With a proper bready texture and good crust, this gluten-free loaf slices well and was a hit in our test kitchen','["500g strong wholemeal flour (we used Doves Farm mixed grain malthouse bread flour)","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp salt","up to 350ml warm water","100g mixed seeds (we used a mix of linseeds, hemp seeds, pumpkin seeds and sesame seeds)","50g walnut pieces","a little sunflower oil, for greasing"]','["Make the dough with the flour, yeast, salt\r\nand water as stated in the ''Goes well with'' recipe (see right), adding\r\nmost of the seeds and all the walnuts as you\r\nknead the dough. Leave to rise in a clean bowl\r\nas stated, then knock back and shape into a\r\nlarge round. Roll the round in the remaining\r\nseeds, then lift the bread onto a tray to prove\r\nfor about 30 mins until doubled in size.","Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7.\r\nBake the bread for 15 mins, then reduce\r\nthe heat to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5 and\r\ncontinue to bake for 30 mins until the loaf\r\nsounds hollow when tapped on the base.\r\nLeave the bread on a cooling rack to cool\r\ncompletely. The loaf will stay fresh in an\r\nairtight container for 3 days or can be\r\nfrozen for 1 month."]','2026-01-10 12:14:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4821,4821,'en','Chicken & ham casserole with mustardy dumplings','Serve mustardy dumplings with our chicken and ham casserole for a comforting and filling family feast. You can freeze any leftovers, too – if there are any!','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 tbsp butter","1 onion, chopped","2 leeks, thickly sliced","2 carrots, peeled and chopped","6 boneless, skinless chicken thighs, cut into chunky pieces","200ml cider","800ml hot chicken stock","½ bunch of thyme, tied","1 tbsp cornflour","150g ham hock or cooked gammon, shredded into chunky pieces","100g frozen peas","1 tbsp English or Dijon mustard","200g self-raising flour","¼ tsp baking powder","2 tbsp English mustard powder","100g suet or cold butter, grated","½ small bunch of parsley, finely chopped"]','["Heat the oil and butter in an ovenproofcasseroleover a medium heat. Add the onion, leeks and carrots and a pinch of salt, and fry gently for 10 mins until softened and translucent. Add the chicken, turn up the heat and fry for 5 mins. Pour in the cider, cook for 3 mins, then pour in the chicken stock and add the bunch of thyme. Bring to a simmer, season to taste, then reduce to a low heat and cover the pan. Cook for 30 mins.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan gas 4. Make the dumplings by mixing together the flour, baking powder, mustard powder, the suet or butter, parsley and ½ tsp salt. Swiftly mix in 8-10 tbsp of water and bring together with your hands. The dough should be firm and pliable. Divide into eight equal-sized pieces, weighing for accuracy if you like.","Remove the bunch of thyme from the stew and discard. Spoon a little of the liquid into a bowl and mix with the cornflour, then stir the mixture into the casserole. Add the ham hock, peas and mustard. Arrange the dumplings on top of the stew, then put in the oven, covered, for 30 mins. Remove the lid and cook for a further 10 mins until the dumplings are puffed up and golden brown. Serve in bowls.To freeze the stew, leave to cool completely, then transfer to a freezerproof container. Will keep for up to three months. Defrost thoroughly, then reheat until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:14:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4823,4823,'en','Zesty lamb chops with crushed kidney beans','Perk up lamb chops with lemon zest, then serve with mashed red beans with chilli and garlic for a speedy weeknight supper','["8 lamb chops","2 tbsp olive oil","juice and zest 1 lemon","1-2 red chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 x 400g cans red kidney beans, drained","small pack mint, leaves picked and finely chopped","mixed green leaves such as rocket and watercress, to serve"]','["Heat a griddle pan over a high heat. Brush the lamb chops with 1 tbsp oil, then rub all over with the lemon zest and some seasoning. Griddle for 3-4 mins each side for slightly pink meat, or a little longer for well done. You may need to do this in 2 batches. Remove from the pan, wrap in foil and leave to rest for 10 mins.","Gently fry the remaining oil, the chillies and garlic in a saucepan for 2-3 mins. Add the kidney beans and gently crush them with a potato masher, then continue to cook for 3 mins until the beans are warm. Stir in the lemon juice, mint and seasoning, and serve with the chops and mixed leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:14:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4825,4825,'en','Florentine dairy-free pizza','Hit your 5-a-day target in one go with this crisp pizza piled high with veg, suitable for the lactose-intolerant','["2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","2 garlic cloves, sliced","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g frozen spinach, defrosted","toppings of your choice- anchovies, olives, capers, pepperoni, artichoke hearts, grilled peppers","2 eggs","small handful basil leaves","2 handfuls rocket","juice ½ lemon","350g strong white flour","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp coarse or fine semolina"]','["To make the base, tip the flour into\r\nthe bowl of a table-top mixer (or food\r\nprocessor with a dough attachment). Add\r\n1 tsp salt to one side of the bowl and the\r\nyeast to the other. Add 275ml lukewarm\r\nwater and mix on slow until a sticky dough\r\nforms. Turn up the mixer for 5-6 mins until\r\nan indent pushed into the dough pops\r\nout quickly. Put the dough in a lightly\r\noiled bowl, then cover and leave in a\r\nwarm place to prove until doubled in size.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a frying pan\r\nand sizzle the garlic for a few secs, then\r\ntip in the tomatoes, season and simmer\r\nfor 5 mins until the sauce has thickened.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nKnead the dough for a few mins, then\r\nhalve and roll each half as thinly as\r\npossible. Lay each base on a baking\r\nsheet dusted with the semolina. Divide\r\nthe tomato sauce between the pizzas,\r\nspreading almost to the edge. Dot over\r\nthe spinach, add your toppings and drizzle\r\nwith a little oil. Cook for 5 mins, then crack\r\nan egg onto each pizza. Swap the baking\r\nsheets, then cook for 10 mins more or until\r\nbases are cooked through. Drizzle the basil\r\nand rocket with a drop of oil and the lemon\r\njuice. Scatter over the pizza before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:14:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4827,4827,'en','Soba noodle & edamame salad with grilled tofu','This low-fat, superhealthy supper will have you feeling virtuous all week. If you can''t get edamame beans, use broad beans instead','["140g soba noodles","300g fresh or frozen podded edamame (soy) beans","4 spring onions, shredded","300g bag beansprouts","1 cucumber, peeled, halved lengthways, deseeded with a teaspoon and sliced","250g block firm tofu, patted dry and thickly sliced","1 tsp oil","handful coriander leaves, to serve","3 tbsp mirin","2 tsp tamari","2 tbsp orange juice","1 red chilli, deseeded, if you like, and finely chopped"]','["Heat dressing ingredients in your\r\nsmallest saucepan, simmer for 30 secs,\r\nthen set aside.","Boil noodles following the pack\r\ninstructions, adding the edamame beans\r\nfor the final 2 mins cooking time. Rinse\r\nunder very cold water, drain thoroughly\r\nand tip into a large bowl with the spring\r\nonions, beansprouts, cucumber, sesame\r\noil and warm dressing. Season if you like.","Brush tofu with the veg oil, season and\r\ngriddle or grill for 2-3 mins each side –\r\nthe tofu is very delicate so turn carefully.\r\nTop the salad with the tofu, scatter with\r\ncoriander and serve"]','2026-01-10 12:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4829,4829,'en','Veggie Thai red curry','This fragrant Thai dish is sure to get your taste buds into action, and is ready in under an hour','["200g firm tofu, cubed","4-5 tbsp soy sauce","juice 3 limes","2 red chillies, 1 finely chopped, 1 sliced into rounds","2 tbsp vegetable oil","400ml can reduced-fat coconut milk","1 courgette, chopped into chunks","1 small aubergine, chopped into chunks","½ red pepper, deseeded and chopped into chunks","140g mushrooms, halved","140g sugar snap peas","20g pack basil, leaves picked","1 tsp brown sugar","jasmine rice, to serve","3 red chillies","1 lemongrass, roughly chopped","3 shallots, roughly chopped","½ red pepper, deseeded and roughly chopped","zest 1 lime","stalks from 20g pack coriander","thumb-size piece ginger, grated","2 garlic cloves","1 tsp freshly ground pepper","1 tsp ground coriander"]','["Whizz the paste ingredients in a food\r\nprocessor. Marinate the tofu in 2 tbsp soy\r\nsauce, juice 1 lime and the chopped chilli.","Heat half the oil in a large pan. Add\r\n3-4 tbsp paste and fry for 2 mins. Stir in\r\nthe coconut milk with 100ml water, the\r\ncourgette, aubergine and pepper and\r\ncook for 10 mins until almost tender.","Drain the tofu, pat dry, then fry in the\r\nremaining oil in a small pan until golden.","Add the mushrooms, sugar snaps\r\nand most of the basil to the curry, then\r\nseason with the sugar, remaining lime\r\njuice and soy sauce. Cook for 4 mins until\r\nthe mushrooms are tender, then add the\r\ntofu and heat through. Scatter with sliced\r\nchilli and basil and serve with jasmine rice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4831,4831,'en','Rosemary chicken with oven-roasted ratatouille','You can’t beat this low-fat, one-pot recipe for an easy meal, bursting with summer colour and flavour','["1 aubergine, cut into chunky pieces","2 courgettes, sliced into half-moons","3 mixed peppers, deseeded and roughly chopped","2 tsp finely chopped rosemary, plus 4 small sprigs","2 large garlic cloves, crushed","3 tbsp olive oil","4 skinless, boneless chicken breasts","250g cherry or baby plum tomatoes, halved"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nIn a large roasting tin, toss together the\r\naubergine, courgettes and peppers with\r\nhalf the chopped rosemary, half the garlic,\r\n2 tbsp oil and some seasoning. Spread\r\nout the vegetables in an even layer, then\r\nroast in the oven for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, mix remaining rosemary,\r\ngarlic and oil together. Slash each of the\r\nchicken breasts 4-5 times with a sharp\r\nknife, brush over the flavoured oil, season\r\nand chill for 15 mins.","After veg have cooked for 20 mins,\r\nstir in the tomatoes. Make spaces in\r\nthe roasting tin and nestle the chicken\r\nbreasts amongst the vegetables. Place\r\na rosemary sprig on top of each chicken\r\nbreast. Return the tin to the oven for\r\n18-20 mins, until the chicken is cooked\r\nthrough and the vegetables are lightly\r\ncaramelised. Serve with some new\r\npotatoes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4833,4833,'en','Spanish seafood rice','This quick version of paella is superhealthy, plus it’s all cooked in one pan so there’s minimal washing-up','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","1 red and 1 yellow pepper, deseeded and sliced","2 garlic cloves, sliced","250g paella rice","850ml hot vegetable stock (we used Kallo very low salt stock)","pinch saffron","400g seafood mix (we used a bag of frozen mixed seafood, defrosted before use)","juice ½ small lemon","small handful flat-leaf parsley, roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan and\r\nsoften the onion for 6-7 mins. Add the\r\npepper and garlic, cook for 2 mins\r\nmore, then stir in the paella rice and\r\ncook for 1 min, stirring to coat.","Pour in the stock, add the saffron and\r\nbring to the boil. Cook, uncovered, at\r\na gentle bubble, for 20 mins, stirring\r\noccasionally until the rice is tender.","Stir in the seafood and lemon juice and\r\ncook for 2 mins or until piping hot and\r\ncompletely cooked through. Serve in\r\nwarm bowls scattered with the parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4835,4835,'en','Spinach & chickpea curry','A low fat, low calorie Indian vegan one-pot that’s full of delicious sunshine flavours and hot spice','["2 tbsp mild curry paste","1 onion, chopped","400g can cherry tomatoes","2 x 400g cans chickpeas, drained and rinsed","250g bag baby leaf spinach","squeeze lemon juice","basmati rice, to serve"]','["Heat the curry paste in a large\r\nnon-stick frying pan. Once it starts\r\nto split, add the onion and cook for\r\n2 mins to soften. Tip in the tomatoes\r\nand bubble for 5 mins or until the\r\nsauce has reduced.","Add the chickpeas and some\r\nseasoning, then cook for 1 min more.\r\nTake off the heat, then tip in the spinach\r\nand allow the heat of the pan to wilt the\r\nleaves. Season, add the lemon juice, and\r\nserve with basmati rice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4837,4837,'en','Mexican chicken stew','Bring a touch of Mexican flavour to your midweek meal with this low-fat, one-pan supper','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 medium onion, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","½ tsp dark brown sugar","1 tsp chipotle paste (we used Discovery)","400g can chopped tomatoes","4 skinless, boneless chicken breasts","1 small red onion, sliced into rings","a few coriander leaves","corn tortillas, or rice to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a medium saucepan. Add\r\nthe onion and cook for 5 mins or until\r\nsoftened and starting to turn golden,\r\nadding the garlic for the final min. Stir in\r\nthe sugar, chipotle paste and tomatoes.\r\nPut the chicken into the pan, spoon over\r\nthe sauce, and simmer gently for 20 mins\r\nuntil the chicken has cooked (add a\r\nsplash of water if the sauce gets too dry).","Remove the chicken from the pan and\r\nshred with 2 forks, then stir back into the\r\nsauce. Scatter with a little red onion, the\r\ncoriander, and serve with remaining red\r\nonion, tortillas or rice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4839,4839,'en','Bean & pepper chilli','Use your choice of storecupboard pulses in this healthy vegetarian one-pot','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","350g peppers, deseeded and sliced","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp chilli powder","1 tbsp sweet smoked paprika","400g can kidney beans in chilli sauce","400g can mixed beans, drained","400g can chopped tomatoes","rice, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Add the\r\nonion and peppers, and cook for 8 mins\r\nuntil softened. Tip in the spices and\r\ncook for 1 min.","Tip in the beans and tomatoes, bring\r\nto the boil and simmer for 15 mins or\r\nuntil the chilli is thickened. Season and\r\nserve with rice, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4841,4841,'en','Harissa lamb & pepper kebabs','Jazz up lamb with Moroccan spices for a special after-work supper – it’s low-fat too','["2 tbsp harissa paste","400g lamb steak, trimmed of any fat and chopped into chunks","2 red peppers, chopped into large chunks","2 red onions, each cut into 8 wedges through the root so the wedges don''t fall apart","250g couscous, flavoured or plain","PLUS 1 tbsp olive oil"]','["Heat the grill. In a large bowl, mix\r\nthe harissa with the oil, then tip in the\r\nlamb, peppers and onions. Add some\r\nsalt and pepper and toss everything\r\ntogether to coat well.","Thread the lamb, peppers and\r\nonions evenly onto 8 skewers and\r\nplace on a baking tray. Scrape over\r\nany leftover marinade.","Grill for 8-10 mins, turning frequently\r\nand basting with any of the juices that\r\nrun off. Meanwhile, prepare the\r\ncouscous following pack instructions.\r\nDivide the couscous between 4 plates,\r\ntop with a couple of skewers each and\r\ndrizzle over any pan juices."]','2026-01-10 12:14:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4843,4843,'en','Quinoa stew with squash, prunes & pomegranate','Get a dose of iron and protein from this healthy, squash casserole that’s full of texture and flavour','["1 small butternut squash, deseeded and cubed","2 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, thinly sliced","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 tbsp finely chopped ginger","1 tsp ras-el-hanout or Middle Eastern spice mix","200g quinoa","5 prunes, roughly chopped","juice 1 lemon","600ml vegetable stock","seeds from 1 pomegranate","small handful mint leaves"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPut the squash on a baking tray and\r\ntoss with 1 tbsp of the oil. Season well\r\nand roast for 30-35 mins or until soft.","Meanwhile, heat the remaining oil in\r\na big saucepan. Add the onion, garlic\r\nand ginger, season and cook for 10 mins.\r\nAdd the spice and quinoa, and cook for\r\nanother couple of mins. Add the prunes,\r\nlemon juice and stock, bring to the boil,\r\nthen cover and simmer for 25 mins.","When everything is tender, stir the\r\nsquash through the stew. Spoon into\r\nbowls and scatter with pomegranate\r\nseeds and mint to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4845,4845,'en','Chilli pepper pumpkin with Asian veg','This five-spice roasted squash dish is healthy and simple – the perfect midweek supper','["1 small pumpkin or ½ butternut squash, cut into chunks (seeds removed), no need to peel","2 tsp sunflower or vegetable oil","1 tsp each mild chilli powder and five spice powder","175g thin-stemmed broccoli","175g bok choi, quartered","2 tbsp low-sodium soy sauce","2 tbsp rice wine vinegar","1 tbsp honey","1 lime, ½ juice, ½ cut into wedges","few coriander leaves"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Toss\r\nthe pumpkin in the oil, then sprinkle on the\r\nchilli powder, five-spice, 1 tsp black pepper\r\nand a pinch of salt, and mix well. Tip into a\r\nroasting tray in a single layer and cook for\r\n25-30 mins until tender and starting to\r\ncaramelise around the edges.","About 5 mins before the pumpkin\r\nis cooked, heat a wok or large frying pan\r\nand add the broccoli plus 1-2 tbsp water.\r\nCook for 2-3 mins, then add\r\nthe bok choi, soy, vinegar and honey, and\r\ncook for a further 2-3 mins until the veg is\r\ntender. Add the lime juice, then divide\r\nbetween 2 plates with the pumpkin,\r\ncoriander leaves and lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:14:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4847,4847,'en','Healthier chicken balti','A lighter version of the Indian takeaway classic from Angela Nilsen, this tomato-based curry is packed with extra spinach and peppers','["450g skinless, boneless chicken breasts, cut into bite-sized pieces","1 tbsp lime juice","1 tsp paprika","¼ tsp hot chilli powder","1½  tbsp sunflower or groundnut oil","1 cinnamon stick","3 cardamom pods, split","1 small to medium green chilli","½  tsp cumin seed","1 medium onion, coarsely grated","2 garlic cloves, very finely chopped","2½ cm-piece ginger, grated","½  tsp turmeric","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp garam masala","250ml organic passata","1 red pepper, deseeded, cut into small chunks","1 medium tomato, chopped","85g baby spinach leaves","handful fresh coriander, chopped","chapatis or basmati rice, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the chicken in a medium bowl. Mix\r\nin the lime juice, paprika, chilli powder\r\nand a grinding of black pepper (step 1), then\r\nleave to marinate for at least 15 mins,\r\npreferably a bit longer.","Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large\r\nnon-stick wok or sauté pan. Tip in\r\nthe cinnamon stick, cardamom pods,\r\nwhole chilli and cumin seeds, and\r\nstir-fry briefly just to colour and release\r\ntheir fragrance (step 2). Stir in the onion,\r\ngarlic and ginger and fry over a\r\nmedium-high heat for 3-4 mins until\r\nthe onion starts to turn brown. Add the\r\nremaining oil, then drop in the chicken\r\nand stir-fry for 2-3 mins or until it no\r\nlonger looks raw. Mix the turmeric, cumin, ground coriander and garam\r\nmasala together. Tip into the pan, lower\r\nthe heat to medium and cook for 2 mins\r\n(step 3). Pour in the passata and 150ml\r\nwater, then drop in the chunks of\r\npepper. When starting to bubble, lower\r\nthe heat and simmer for 15-20 mins or\r\nuntil the chicken is tender.","Stir in the tomato, simmer for 2-3\r\nmins, then add the spinach and turn\r\nit over in the pan to just wilt. Season\r\nwith a little salt. If you want to thin\r\ndown the sauce, splash in a little more\r\nwater. Remove the cinnamon stick, chilli\r\nand cardamom pods, if you wish, before\r\nserving. Scatter with fresh coriander\r\nand serve with warm chapatis or\r\nbasmati rice, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4849,4849,'en','Curry coconut fish parcels','Steam sustainable fish like tilapia in foil parcels with curry paste, coconut and lime then serve with rice for a healthy supper','["2 large tilapia fillets, about 125g/4½oz each","2 tsp yellow or red curry paste","2 tsp desiccated coconut","zest and juice 1 lime, plus wedges to serve","1 tsp soy sauce","140g basmati rice","2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","1 red chilli, sliced","200g cooked thin-stemmed broccoli, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nTear off 4 large pieces of foil, double\r\nthem up, then place a fish fillet in the\r\nmiddle of each. Spread over the curry\r\npaste. Divide the coconut, lime zest\r\nand juice, and soy between each\r\nfillet. Bring up the sides of the foil,\r\nthen scrunch the edges and sides\r\ntogether to make 2 sealed parcels.","Put the parcels on a baking tray and\r\nbake for 10-15 mins. Tip the rice into\r\na pan with plenty of water, and boil for\r\n12-15 mins or until cooked. Drain well.\r\nServe the fish on the rice, drizzle over the\r\nchilli sauce and scatter with sliced chilli.\r\nServe with broccoli and lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:14:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4851,4851,'en','Sea bass & seafood Italian one-pot','A one-pot fish stew with shellfish and all the fresh flavours of the Mediterranean – serve with plenty of bread for dipping','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 fennel bulb, halved and sliced, fronds kept separate to garnish","2 garlic cloves, sliced","½ red chilli, chopped","250g cleaned squid, sliced into rings","bunch basil, leaves and stalks separated, stalks tied together, leaves roughly chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","150ml white wine","2 large handfuls of mussels or clams","8 large raw prawns (whole look nicest)","4 sea bass fillets (about 140g/5oz each)","crusty bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan with a\r\ntight-fitting lid, then add the fennel, garlic\r\nand chilli. Fry until softened, then add the\r\nsquid, basil stalks, tomatoes and wine.\r\nSimmer over a low heat for 35 mins until\r\nthe squid is tender and the sauce has\r\nthickened slightly, then season.","Scatter the mussels and prawns over\r\nthe sauce, lay the sea bass fillets on\r\ntop, cover, turn up the heat and cook\r\nhard for 5 mins. Serve scattered with\r\nthe basil leaves and fennel fronds,\r\nwith crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:14:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4853,4853,'en','Vegan leek & potato soup','Try this dairy-free, plant-based twist on the classic leek and potato soup. Ideal for lunch or a starter, top with chopped chives and enjoy with crusty bread','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil, plus a drizzle to serve (optional)","2 large garlic cloves, chopped","500g leeks, thinly sliced","500g potatoes, cut into cubes","500ml vegan vegetable stock, made with 1½ tsp bouillon powder","500ml unsweetened almond milk","chopped chives and bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the garlic and leeks, stirring, until the veg has started to soften. Add the potatoes and stock, then cover and simmer for 15 mins until the leeks and potatoes are soft.","Pour in the almond milk, then remove from the heat and blitz using ahand blenderuntil almost smooth, with a slightly chunky texture. Or, if you prefer, blitz until completely smooth. Reheat over a low heat if needed, then ladle into bowls and scatter with chives, drizzle with a little oil and serve with bread, if you like.Can be frozen for up to three months."]','2026-01-10 12:14:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4855,4855,'en','Vegan kebabs','Stuffed with marinated tempeh patties and pickled cabbage, these vegan kebabs are ready in just 16 minutes. They’re healthy, full of fibre and one of your five-a-day','["100g tempeh","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp smoked paprika","1 tbsp dried oregano","2 tbsp vegan mayonnaise","½ small garlic clove, crushed","2 flatbreads","4 tbsp pickled red cabbage, drained","150g salad leaves"]','["Slicethe tempeh into 1⁄2cm thick slices. Mix 1 tbsp of the olive oil in a bowl with the paprika, oregano, a pinch of salt, crack of black pepper and 1 tbsp water. Add the tempeh, tossing to coat. Cover and leave in the fridge overnight if you can, or set aside at room temperature while you continue the recipe.","Beat the mayonnaise with 1⁄2 tbsp water and the crushed garlic in a small bowl. Heat the flatbreads in a dry pan over a medium heat for 30 seconds on each side. Slather the garlic mayonnaise over both flatbreads and top with the pickled cabbage and half the salad leaves.","Heat the remaining 1 tbsp oil in a large frying pan over a high heat. Fry the marinated tempeh for 2-3 mins on each side over a medium heat until crispy and browned. Pile on top of the flatbreads, fold over and serve alongside the remaining salad."]','2026-01-10 12:14:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4857,4857,'en','Monday night burgers & slaw','Sit down to an easy weeknight dinner of grilled vegan burgers served with a carrot and cabbage slaw. We’ve used Tesco Plant Chef Meat-Free Burgers for a speedy meal, ready in just 20 minutes','["2 Tesco Plant Chef Meat-Free Burgers","2 burger buns, split","1 large vine tomato, sliced","small handful of rocket or spinach","¼ cabbage (white, red, sweetheart or spring greens), finely sliced","1 carrot, grated","½ red onion, finely sliced","4 tbsp vegan mayonnaise, plus extra to serve","squeeze of lemon juice","1 tsp Dijon mustard","small handful of chives, parsley or coriander, finely chopped"]','["Heat the grill to medium-high. Put the Tesco Plant Chef Meat-Free Burgers on a baking tray and grill for 4-5 mins each side until golden and crisp. Toast the buns cut-side up alongside the burgers on the tray for the last 2-3 mins.","Meanwhile, toss the slaw ingredients with some seasoning. Taste, and add a little more lemon or mustard, if you like.","Spread a little mayo on the burger bun bases, add a tomato slice and a burger. Add a spoonful of the slaw. Top with some rocket or spinach, and add the burger lids. Serve with the remaining slaw on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:14:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4859,4859,'en','Vietnamese prawn salad','Inspired by the Vietnamese dish, Bun xao, this fresh-tasting salad has very little fat but is so satisfying','["1 small garlic clove, finely chopped","1 small red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","juice 2 limes","250g thin rice noodles","150g pack cooked tiger prawns, halved along their spine","½ cucumber, peeled, deseeded and cut into matchsticks","1 carrot, cut into matchsticks or grated","6 spring onions, shredded","handful coriander and/or mint leaves","1 tbsp roasted peanuts, chopped"]','["To make the dressing, mash the garlic,\r\nchilli and sugar using a pestle and mortar.\r\nAdd the lime juice and 3 tbsp water and\r\nstir together. Set aside.","Get the kettle on, put the noodles into\r\na bowl, then cover with boiling water.\r\nLeave to stand for 10 mins until tender,\r\nthen drain and divide between 2 bowls.\r\n3 Mix the prawns and veg together and\r\ndivide between the bowls, too. Finish by\r\ntopping each salad with the herbs and\r\npeanuts, then pour over the dressing\r\nto serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4861,4861,'en','Miso prawn skewers with veggie rice salad','For a new way with prawns, marinade in soya, serve as kebabs and team with healthy basmati','["200g brown basmati rice","175g mange tout","200g frozen soy beans","1½  tbsp sesame oil","4 spring onions, finely sliced","large handful coriander, roughly chopped","1 green chilli, finely diced","400g raw large peeled prawns","3 tbsp sweet miso paste (You''ll find this with the Japanese ingredients. We used Clearspring white miso)","2 tsp soy sauce","2 tsp Japanese rice vinegar","2 tsp soft brown sugar"]','["Place the brown rice in a pan with lots\r\nof cold water. Bring to the boil and simmer\r\nfor 20-25 mins or until tender. Meanwhile,\r\nsoak wooden skewers in some cold\r\nwater (to prevent them burning). Add the\r\nmangetout and soy beans to the rice for\r\nthe final 5 mins of cooking. Rinse under\r\ncold water, draining thoroughly.","Toss the rice with the sesame oil and\r\nmix in a large bowl with the spring\r\nonions, coriander, chilli and seasoning.","Heat a grill. Place the skewer\r\ningredients in a bowl with a few grinds of\r\nblack pepper. Give everything a good stir,\r\nmaking sure the prawns are well coated.\r\nThread prawns onto the skewers and lay\r\non a baking sheet. Grill for a couple of\r\nmins each side, turning, until prawns are\r\ncooked through. Serve with the rice salad\r\nand drizzle over any of the cooking juices."]','2026-01-10 12:14:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4863,4863,'en','Barbecued fennel with black olive dressing','Slice fennel and chargrill it as the base to a salad dressed with Kalamata olives, parsley, basil and garlic','["2 fennel bulbs, sliced lengthways into 1cm-thick pieces","1½  tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp finely chopped black Kalamata olives","1 garlic clove, crushed","juice 1 lemon","small handful each parsley and basil, finely chopped"]','["Heat a BBQ or griddle pan. Toss the\r\nfennel in 1 tbsp of the oil, coating well.\r\nCook for 5 mins on each side until\r\ngolden brown and charred.","To make the dressing, put the olives,\r\ngarlic, lemon juice and remaining oil\r\nin a bowl. Add the chopped herbs and\r\ncombine. Lay the fennel on a platter\r\nand pour over the dressing. Eat warm\r\nor at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:14:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4865,4865,'en','Mediterranean potato salad','Skip the mayo and go for an Italian-style olive oil dressing for warm new potatoes. Jazz them up with basil, Parmesan and sundried tomatoes','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 small onion, thinly sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tsp oregano, fresh or dried","½ x 400g can cherry tomatoes","100g roasted red peppers, from a jar, sliced","300g new potatoes, halved if large","25g black olives, sliced","handful basil leaves, torn"]','["Heat the oil in a saucepan, add the onion\r\nand cook for 5-10 mins until soft. Add the\r\ngarlic and oregano and cook for 1 min. Add\r\nthe tomatoes and peppers, season well\r\nand simmer gently for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, cook the potatoes in a pan\r\nof boiling salted water for 10-15 mins until\r\ntender. Drain well, mix with the sauce and\r\nserve warm, sprinkled with olives and basil."]','2026-01-10 12:14:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4867,4867,'en','Watermelon, prawn & avocado salad','Too hot to cook? This superhealthy salad makes a refreshing light lunch or starter','["1 small red onion, finely chopped","1 fat garlic clove, crushed","1 small red chilli, finely chopped","juice 1 lime","1 tbsp rice or white wine vinegar","1 tsp caster sugar","watermelon wedge, deseeded and diced","1 avocado, diced","small bunch coriander leaves, chopped","200g cooked tiger prawns, defrosted if frozen"]','["Put the onion in a medium bowl with\r\nthe garlic, chilli, lime juice, vinegar, sugar\r\nand some seasoning. Leave to marinate\r\nfor 10 mins.","Add the watermelon,\r\navocado, coriander and prawns, then\r\ntoss gently to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4870,4869,'en','5-a-day tagine','Get your day''s vegetable quota all in one go. Great for feeding a group, or freeze portions','["4 carrots, cut into chunks","4 small parsnips, or 3 large, cut into chunks","3 red onions, cut into wedges","2 red peppers, deseeded and cut into chunks","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp each ground cumin, paprika, cinnamon and mild chilli powder","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 small handfuls soft dried apricots","2 tsp honey"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Scatter\r\nthe veg over a couple of baking trays, drizzle\r\nwith half the oil, season, then rub the oil over\r\nthe veg with your hands to coat. Roast for\r\n30 mins until tender and beginning to brown.","Meanwhile, fry the spices in the remaining oil\r\nfor 1 min – they should sizzle and start to smell\r\naromatic. Tip in the tomatoes, apricots, honey\r\nand a can of water. Simmer for 5 mins until\r\nthe sauce is slightly reduced and the apricots\r\nplump, then stir in the veg and some seasoning.\r\nServe with couscous or jacket potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:14:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4872,4872,'en','Spiced vegetable pilaf','Get four of your five-a-day in one colourful bowl. Vary the veg according to what’s in season','["6 carrots, cut lengthways into 6-8 wedges","3 red onions, cut into wedges","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp cumin seeds","4 cardamom pods","1 cinnamon stick","200g brown basmati rice, rinsed","400ml vegetable stock","400g can brown lentils, rinsed and drained","200g baby spinach","handful toasted flaked almonds, or a few whole almonds (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nIn boiling water, cook carrots for 4 mins,\r\ntipping in onions for the last min of\r\ncooking. Drain and mix in a roasting tin\r\nwith 4 tsp oil, the cumin and seasoning.\r\nRoast for 30 mins, while you cook the rice.","Heat remaining 2 tsp oil in a large pan.\r\nAdd cardamom and cinnamon for 30 secs,\r\nthen add rice and toast for 1 min. Pour\r\nover stock and 100ml water, then simmer,\r\ncovered, for 25-30 mins, until rice is\r\ntender and the water absorbed. Remove\r\ncinnamon and cardamom.","Tip in lentils and fork through before\r\ntopping with spinach. Put lid back on and\r\ncook over a low heat, stirring once, until\r\nspinach has wilted and lentils heated\r\nthrough. Fork through again before\r\ntipping the cumin roasted veg onto the\r\ntop and sprinkling with almonds, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:14:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4874,4874,'en','Chunky minestrone soup','The perfect solution to a cold night in? A warming bowl of this home-made chunky soup.','["3 large carrots, roughly chopped","1 large onion, roughly chopped","4 celery sticks, roughly chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 large potatoes, cut into small dice","2 tbsp tomato purée","2l vegetable stock","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can butter or cannellini beans","140g spaghetti, snapped into short lengths","1?2 head Savoy cabbage, shredded","crusty bread, to serve"]','["In a food processor, whizz the carrots,\r\nonion and celery into small pieces. Heat the\r\noil in a pan, add the processed vegetables,\r\ngarlic and potatoes, then cook over a high\r\nheat for 5 mins until softened.","Stir in the tomato purée, stock and\r\ntomatoes. Bring to the boil, then turn down\r\nthe heat and simmer, covered, for 10 mins.","Tip in the beans and pasta, then cook for\r\na further 10 mins, adding the cabbage for\r\nthe final 2 mins. Season to taste and serve\r\nwith crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:14:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4876,4876,'en','Warm cauliflower salad','Cauliflower is often overlooked, but try it roasted in this winter salad for a plateful of crunchy goodness','["1 cauliflower, broken into florets","2 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, thinly sliced","3 tbsp sherry vinegar","1½  tbsp honey","3 tbsp raisins","small bunch dill, snipped","3 tbsp toasted, flaked almonds","50g baby spinach"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nToss the cauliflower with the olive oil,\r\nseason and roast for 15 mins. Stir in\r\nthe red onion and carry on roasting\r\nfor 15-20 mins more until tender.","While the cauliflower is roasting,\r\nmix the vinegar, honey and raisins\r\nwith some seasoning.","When the cauliflower is done, stir\r\nin the dressing, dill, almonds and\r\nspinach, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4878,4878,'en','Mixed bean & wild rice salad','Reach into your storecupboard for pulses and sweetcorn to form the base for this simple side with hot, sweet dressing','["375g rice mix, we used brown basmati & wild rice","2 x 400g cans mixed beans, drained and rinsed","340g can sweetcorn, drained","1 small red onion, finely sliced","2 red peppers, deseeded and diced","zest and juice 1 lime","2 tsp honey","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely sliced","small bunch coriander, leaves picked"]','["Cook rice following pack instructions.\r\nOnce cooked, rinse under cold water\r\nto cool down. Once cold combine in a\r\nbowl with the beans, sweetcorn, onion\r\nand red peppers.","Mix the lime zest and juice, honey and\r\nchilli. Pour over the rice mixture and mix\r\nwell, then season to taste. Stir through\r\nthe coriander leaves just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4880,4880,'en','Jewelled couscous','Serve your grain with cucumber, apricot, peppers, olives and tomatoes then drizzle with lemon-infused oil for a mellow finish','["400g couscous","2 tbsp lemon-infused oil","500g soft dried apricots, chopped","1 cucumber, deseeded and chopped","1 large yellow pepper, deseeded and chopped","140g pitted black olives, chopped","140g sundried tomatoes, chopped","small bunch parsley, chopped","12 cherry tomatoes, halved"]','["Place the couscous in a bowl and cover\r\nwith 700ml boiling water. Cover with cling\r\nfilm and leave for 10 mins, until all the\r\nliquid has been absorbed.","Pour over the oil and some seasoning,\r\nmix and fluff up the couscous with a fork.","Gently stir through the remaining\r\ningredients and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4882,4882,'en','Herby celery & bulgur salad','This speedy salad will keep in the fridge for a few days – a great healthy lunch or snack to have on hand','["200g bulgar wheat","1 bunch celery","1 dessert apple","juice 1 lemon","4 tbsp olive oil","handful toasted hazelnuts, roughly chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","large handful pomegranate seeds","small bunch parsley, chopped","small bunch mint, chopped","small bunch tarragon, chopped"]','["Put the bulghar wheat in a large\r\nbowl and just cover with boiling water.\r\nCover the bowl with cling film and leave\r\nfor 30 mins to absorb all the water.","Meanwhile, separate the sticks of\r\ncelery and set the leaves aside. Very\r\nfinely slice the celery and roughly chop\r\nthe leaves. Cut the apple into fine\r\nmatchsticks and toss in a little lemon\r\njuice. In a bowl, mix the remaining\r\nlemon juice with the oil and some\r\nseasoning to make a dressing.","Gently fluff up the bulghar with a fork.\r\nMix the sliced celery and apple through\r\nthe bulghar, followed by the nuts, chilli,\r\npomegranate seeds and herbs. Drizzle\r\nover the dressing and toss everything\r\ntogether gently. Scatter with the celery\r\nleaves and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4884,4884,'en','Miso steak','Steak doesn’t have to be a heavy meal – give it a Japanese-style marinade for a low-fat supper','["2 tbsp brown miso paste","1 tbsp dry sherry or sake","1 tbsp caster sugar","2 crushed garlic cloves","300g/11oz lean steak","baby spinach, sliced cucumber, celery, radish and toasted sesame seeds, to serve"]','["Tip the miso paste, Sherry or sake,\r\nsugar and garlic into a sealable food bag.\r\nSeason with a generous grinding of black\r\npepper, then squash it all together until\r\ncompletely mixed. Add the steak, gently\r\nmassage the marinade into the steak\r\nuntil completely coated, then seal the\r\nbag. Pop the bag into the fridge and leave\r\nfor at least 1 hr, but up to 2 days is fine.","To cook, heat a heavy-based frying pan,\r\ngriddle pan or barbecue until very hot.\r\nWipe the excess marinade off the steak,\r\nthen sear for 3 mins on each side for\r\nmedium-rare or a few mins longer if you\r\nprefer the meat more cooked. Set aside\r\nfor 1 min to rest. Carve the beef into\r\nthick slices and serve with a crunchy\r\nsalad made with the spinach, cucumber,\r\ncelery, radish and sesame seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:14:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4886,4886,'en','Moroccan turkey salad','Use up abundant roast meat in a healthy salad with aubergine, tomatoes, pomegranate and mint','["2 pitta breads","2 tbsp olive oil","1 diced aubergine","1 tbsp harissa","250g halved cherry tomatoes","500g shredded leftover turkey breast","100g rocket","seeds 1 pomegranate or 110g tub pomegranate seeds","a few mint leaves"]','["Tear the pitta into pieces and fry in the olive oil until crisp. Tip into a bowl, then fry the aubergine for 10 mins until soft. Add to the pitta with the harissa, tomatoes, turkey and rocket. Toss well. Scatter over pomegranate seeds and mint leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:14:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4888,4888,'en','Crunchy prawn & noodle salad','A vibrant Vietnamese-style seafood salad with coriander, carrots and spring onions','["100g rice noodles","2 small carrots, cut into thin matchsticks","2 spring onions, thinly sliced","small handful each coriander and mint, chopped","140g cooked prawns in chilli, lime and coriander (we used Waitrose)","2 tsp reduced-salt soy sauce","1 tsp fish sauce","2 tsp light soft brown sugar","zest and juice 1 lime"]','["Soak the noodles in boiling water\r\nfollowing the pack instructions. Drain\r\nand run under cold water until cool, then\r\ndrain well again. Mix the noodles with\r\nthe carrots, spring onions, coriander,\r\nmint and prawns.","In a small bowl, whisk the remaining\r\ningredients together, pour over the\r\nnoodle salad and toss well to coat.\r\nStore in containers until ready to eat."]','2026-01-10 12:14:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4890,4890,'en','Prawn, pomegranate & grapefruit salad','Bypass bread croutons and a heavy cream dressing and instead serve up a crispy, fruity salad with shellfish','["2 pink grapefruits, zest and juice from 1, segments cut from the other","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 tsp caster sugar","2 tbsp chopped dill","300g cooked, peeled prawns","½ cucumber, halved lengthways, seeds scooped out with a teaspoon, diced","2 shallots, finely chopped","2 handfuls frisée, torn","2 handfuls rocket","100g pack pomegranate seeds"]','["Whisk together the grapefruit zest\r\nand juice, oil, vinegar, sugar and dill\r\nto make a dressing. Mix half with the\r\nprawns and allow to marinate for 10 mins.","Just before serving, gently toss the\r\ncucumber, shallots, frisée and rocket\r\nwith the remaining dressing. Add a pile\r\nto each of 6 starter plates, along with the\r\nprawns and grapefruit segments. Scatter\r\nover the pomegranate seeds and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4892,4892,'en','Curried squash, lentil & coconut soup','Flavour up butternut squash with Indian spices for this warming and healthy vegetarian soup','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 butternut squash, peeled, deseeded and diced","200g carrots, diced","1 tbsp curry powder containing turmeric","100g red lentils","700ml vegetable stock","1 can reduced-fat coconut milk","coriander and naan bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan, add\r\nthe squash and carrots, sizzle for 1 min,\r\nthen stir in the curry powder and cook\r\nfor 1 min more. Tip in the lentils, the\r\nvegetable stock and coconut milk\r\nand give everything a good stir. Bring\r\nto the boil, then turn the heat down\r\nand simmer for 15-18 mins until\r\neverything is tender.","Using a hand blender or in a food\r\nprocessor, blitz until as smooth as you\r\nlike. Season and serve scattered with\r\nroughly chopped coriander and some\r\nnaan bread alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:14:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4894,4894,'en','Pasta salad with tuna, capers & balsamic dressing','Update tuna pasta salad by skipping the mayo and adding balsamic vinegar, olive oil, colourful tomatoes and celery','["350g orecchiette pasta","225g jar MSC approved tuna in spring water, drained","1 tbsp caper, drained","15 peppadew peppers from a jar, chopped","1 celery heart, sliced","140g yellow, red or a mixture of cherry tomatoes, halved","75ml balsamic vinegar","3 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","100g bag rocket leaves","good handful basil leaves"]','["Cook the pasta following pack\r\ninstructions, then drain and rinse in cold\r\nwater. After draining again, transfer to a\r\nlarge bowl. Add the remaining ingredients\r\nexcept the basil, season well, and toss to\r\ncombine. Scatter with basil and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4896,4896,'en','Spiced carrot & lentil soup','A delicious, spicy blend, packed full of iron and low fat to boot. It''s ready in under half an hour or can be made in a slow cooker','["2 tsp cumin seeds","pinch chilli flakes","2 tbsp olive oil","600g carrots, washed and coarsely grated (no need to peel)","140g split red lentils","1l hot vegetable stock (from a cube is fine)","125ml milk","plain yogurt and naan bread, to serve"]','["Heat a large saucepan and dry-fry the cumin seeds and chilli flakes for 1 min, or until they\r\nstart to jump around the pan and release their aromas. Scoop out about half of the seeds with\r\na spoon and set aside. Add the oil, carrot, lentils, stock and milk to the pan and bring to the boil. Simmer for 15 mins until the lentils have swollen and softened.","Whizz the soup with a stick blender or in a food processor until smooth (or leave it chunky if you prefer). Season to taste and finish with a dollop of yogurt and a sprinkling of the reserved toasted spices. Serve with warmed naan breads."]','2026-01-10 12:14:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4898,4898,'en','Fruity flapjack cookies','Toast oats before mixing them into the dough to make these fruity cookies, a delicious hybrid of syrupy flapjacks and coconut macaroons','["125g jumbo oats","150g softened butter","100g light muscovado sugar","1 egg","1 tbsp golden syrup","½ tsp vanilla extract","100g self-raising flour","100g mixed dried fruit or raisins","75g dried apricots, finely chopped","50g desiccated coconut","½ tsp ground cinnamon (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Scatter the oats over abaking trayand bake for 20 mins, turning once until lightly browned. Remove from the oven and set aside to cool. Tip the butter and sugar into a bowl and beat with an electric whisk for 2 mins until fluffy. Crack in the egg and add the golden syrup and vanilla, then beat until completely combined. Scatter in the flour, all the dried fruit, the coconut, cinnamon (if using), the toasted oats and a pinch of salt. Beat again until everything is combined and you have a thick dough. Use the dough straightaway or cover and chill for up to two days.","Line two baking sheets with baking parchment and arrange six large spoonfuls of dough on each, well- spaced apart. Bake for 15 mins (or 18-20 mins if the dough is fridge-cold) until the cookies have spread and are brown at the edges but soft in the middle. Leave to cool on the baking sheet for 5 mins, then transfer to awire rackand leave to cool completely.Will keep in an airtight container or tin for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:14:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4899,4899,'en','Chestnut hummus','Make some festive hummus, using chestnuts in place of the usual chickpeas. Serve with crudités for an easy Christmas starter, snack or buffet addition','["180g vacuum-packed cooked chestnuts","1 lemon, juiced","1 garlic clove","4 tbsp olive oil","pitta crisps and vegetable crudités, to serve"]','["Take one chestnut from the pack and set aside. Tip the rest of the chestnuts into ablenderor smoothie maker with the lemon juice, garlic, oil and a little freshly boiled water from the kettle. Season. Blitz to a smooth purée, then spoon into a bowl or spread over four plates.","Finely grate over the reserved chestnut, then serve with pitta crisps and vegetable crudités."]','2026-01-10 12:14:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4901,4901,'en','Vegan truffles','Make these gorgeous vegan truffles as a snack or an edible gift for family and friends. They’re made with dairy-free chocolate and plant-based milk','["200g dairy-free dark chocolate, finely chopped","100ml plant-based milk (we used oat)","1 tbsp caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp cocoa powder"]','["Put the chocolate in a medium heatproof bowl. Tip the milk, sugar and vanilla into a small saucepan, then bring to the boil over a medium heat, stirring occasionally.","Pour the hot milk mixture over the chocolate, leave to sit for 1 min, then stir until the chocolate has melted and the mix is smooth. Cover and chill for 4 hrs until set.","Roll teaspoons of the mixture into balls using your hands, then transfer to a small baking tray or plate – you may like to wear gloves. You should have about 20 balls.","Put the cocoa powder on a shallow plate, and roll the chilled truffles in it until well-coated, tapping off any excess, if needed. Chill until you’re ready to gift.Will keep in the fridge for up to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:14:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4903,4903,'en','Spiced Indian crackers (mathri)','Make a batch of these crisp Indian snacks seasoned with cumin, then enjoy with a spoonful of your favourite Indian pickle and a cup of masala chai','["100g plain flour","½ tsp fine salt","¾ tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp cracked black peppercorns","15g ghee, melted and cooled","vegetable or sunflower oil for rolling and deep-frying","Indian pickle, to serve"]','["Sieve the flour and salt into a bowl, then stir in the cumin seeds and peppercorns.","Add the cooled (but still liquid) ghee to the dry ingredients and mix in using your fingertips until the mixture resembles coarse breadcrumbs.","Mix in about 2-3 tbsp cold water to make a firm dough, then knead for 3-4 mins until smooth. Cover and leave for 20 mins at room temperature.","Knead the rested dough for 1 min, then divide into 15 portions (weigh for accuracy, if you like – each portion should be about 10g). Roll each portion into a ball about the size of a marble and cover with a cloth as you work to stop them drying out.","Roll each ball out on a lightly oiled surface into a 4cm disc that is roughly the thickness of a 20p coin. Prick all over using a fork to stop the mathri puffing as they cook.","Heat the oil in awokor karahi over a medium heat, ensuring it is no more than two-thirds full, to 130°C, or until a cube of bread browns in 1 min. Working in batches, lower the mathri into the oil using a flat slotted spoon. Turn the heat to low and cook the mathri for 2-3 mins on each side until pale golden. Drain on kitchen paper and leave to cool.Will keep in an airtight container for up to two weeks.Top the mathri with Indian pickle and serve at room temperature with masala chai."]','2026-01-10 12:14:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4905,4905,'en','Sugar-free carrot cake','This dairy-free and sugar-free carrot cake uses natural xylitol to sweeten it and is very simple to make','["100g pecans","140g self-raising flour, sieved","2 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","140g xylitol (see tip below)","2 large eggs (at room temperature)","140ml rapeseed oil","175g grated carrots","100g sultanas","drizzle of agave syrup (optional)"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/ 160C fan/ Gas mark 4. Grease and line an 18cm round cake tin with baking parchment. Set aside 12 pecans and roughly chop the rest.","In a large bowl, mix together the flour, cinnamon, bicarbonate of soda, xylitol and chopped pecans.","In a separate bowl or jug, beat the eggs and rapeseed oil together. Pour into the flour mixture and stir until combined. Stir through the carrot and sultanas. Spoon into the lined tin, smooth the surface and press whole pecans to form a circle around the edge.","Cook for 1 hour  - 1 hour 10 mins until the top feels springy to the touch and a skewer inserted into the cake comes out clean. Check after 50 mins, if the cake is becoming too dark, cover loosely with foil. Cool on a wire rack for 10 minutes, then turn out and allow to cool. Serve slightly warm or cold. This cake keeps for up to five days in a tin. Before serving, drizzle with agave syrup if you have a sweet tooth."]','2026-01-10 12:14:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4907,4907,'en','Sweet potato dip with chorizo & chicory dippers','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyCater for everyone at your party with this healthy canapé of paprika dip and Spanish sausage – it’s gluten and dairy-free','["2 large sweet potatoes","4 tbsp olive oil","½  tsp sweet smoked paprika","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","small handful coriander or parsley, chopped, plus extra to serve","250g mini cooking chorizo sausages (for special diets, see tip below)","few heads red and white chicory, leaves separated"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put\r\nthe potatoes on a baking tray and bake\r\nfor 50 mins until really soft. Leave to cool.","Scoop the potato flesh into a food\r\nprocessor, discarding the skins. Add\r\nthe oil, paprika, vinegar, coriander or\r\nparsley and some seasoning and whizz to\r\na smooth paste. Transfer to a bowl, cover\r\nwith cling film and chill until needed. The\r\ndip will keep for 2 days in the fridge – just\r\nbring to room temperature before serving.","Cook the chorizo in a small frying pan\r\nfor 10 mins until cooked through. Drain\r\non kitchen paper. Scatter extra coriander\r\nor parsley over the dip and serve with the\r\nchorizo and chicory leaves for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:14:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4909,4909,'en','Dried fruit energy nuggets','Give your energy levels a real boost with these nutritionally-balanced healthy fruit bites','["50g soft dried apricots","100g soft dried dates","50g dried cherries","2 tsp coconut oil","1 tbsp toasted sesame seed"]','["Whizz apricots with\r\ndates and\r\ncherries in a food processor until very\r\nfinely chopped. Tip into a bowl and use\r\nyour hands to work in coconut oil.\r\nShape the mix into walnut-sized balls,\r\nthen roll in sesame\r\nseeds. Store in an airtight container\r\nuntil you need a quick energy fix."]','2026-01-10 12:14:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4911,4911,'en','Sweet & spicy nuts','Roast almonds, Brazil nuts and cashews with spiced flavours then pack up into bags as a homemade gift','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 tsp ground cinnamon","½  tsp mixed spice","400g mixed nuts, try almonds, Brazil nuts and cashews","2 tbsp honey"]','["Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Mix the oil with the spices, then stir in the nuts and drizzle over half the honey. Spread over a baking sheet and cook for 10 mins.","Remove from the oven and drizzle over the remaining honey, then return to the oven and cook for a further 10 mins. Allow to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:14:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4913,4913,'en','Spicy bean & corn dip','Turn the storecupboard staples of tinned sweetcorn, kidney beans and mixed beans into something special','["395g can kidney beans in chilli sauce","400g can mixed beans, drained","326g can sweetcorn, drained","small red onion, chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","small bunch coriander, chopped","350g vegetable sticks and tortilla chips, to serve"]','["In a food processor, whizz threequarters\r\nof the kidney beans and\r\nhalf the mixed beans until smooth.\r\nTip into a bowl and add the remaining\r\ningredients with some seasoning.\r\nServe with crunchy vegetable sticks\r\nand tortilla chips for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:14:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4915,4915,'en','Great guacamole','Chunky avocado, a bit of chilli and a zesty kick of lime cannot fail to make a fantastic guacamole','["small bunch coriander, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp jalapeño peppers from a jar, drained and finely chopped","juice 2 limes, or to taste","4 avocados"]','["In a medium bowl, mix the coriander, garlic and jalapeños with the lime juice. Peel, stone and roughly mash the avocados with a potato masher, add them to the bowl with the other ingredients and some seasoning, and serve with the fajitas or with some tortilla chips to start."]','2026-01-10 12:14:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4917,4917,'en','Spanish sardines on toast','Enjoy the taste of the Med with this fresh, wholesome supper using an oily fish that''s packed with omega-3 and a good, cheap storecupboard staple','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","1 lemon, zest and juice","2 x 120g cans sardines in sunflower oil, drained","4 slices brown bread","half small bunch parsley, chopped"]','["Heat the olive oil in a\r\nfrying pan, then sizzle\r\nthe garlic clove and red chilli. Add the lemon zest.","Add the\r\nsardines and heat\r\nthrough for a few mins until warm.","Toast the brown bread. Stir the parsley into the\r\nsardines, add a squeeze of lemon juice,\r\nthen divide between the toast and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4919,4919,'en','Chinese-spiced seed mix','Snack on these moreish sunflower and pumpkin nibbles, a healthier choice for a night in front of the television','["1 egg white","2 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","½  tsp salt","85g each sunflower and pumpkin seeds"]','["Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2. Lightly\r\nwhisk egg white, then add\r\nChinese five spice and salt. Add sunflower and pumpkin\r\nseeds, and coat well. Spread out in a\r\nsingle layer on a lightly oiled baking sheet\r\nand bake for 12 mins. Cool before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:14:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4921,4921,'en','Chargrilled veg hummus with dippers','Hit 3 of your 5-a-day with this chickpea dip and crudités – perfect for a quick lunch or snack','["350g frozen chargrilled vegetables, defrosted","400g can chickpeas, drained","1 garlic clove, chopped","juice ½ lemon","1 tsp olive oil","2 wholemeal pitta breads, toasted and sliced","100g radishes, scrubbed","2 carrots, cut into batons","3 celery sticks, cut into batons"]','["Tip the vegetables, most of the\r\nchickpeas, garlic and lemon juice into\r\nthe bowl of a food processor with some\r\nseasoning, then whizz until smooth.","Put the houmous into a serving bowl.\r\nScatter over the reserved chickpeas and\r\nthe olive oil. Serve with toasted pitta\r\nslices and the vegetables to dip in."]','2026-01-10 12:14:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4923,4923,'en','Red lentil & sweet potato pâté','Rosie Clewlow''s vegetarian dip is a healthy alternative to hummus and great with crudités in a lunchbox','["1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","½ onion, finely chopped","1 tsp smoked paprika, plus a little extra","1 small sweet potato, peeled and diced","140g red lentils","3 thyme sprigs, leaves chopped, plus a little extra to decorate (optional)","500ml low-sodium vegetable stock","1 tsp red wine vinegar","pitta bread and vegetable sticks, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the\r\nonion and cook slowly until soft and\r\ngolden. Tip in the paprika and cook for\r\na further 2 mins, then add the sweet\r\npotato, lentils, thyme and stock. Bring\r\nto a simmer, then cook for 20 mins or\r\nuntil the potato and lentils are tender.","Add the vinegar and some seasoning,\r\nand roughly mash the mixture until\r\nyou get a texture you like. Chill for 1 hr,\r\nthen drizzle with olive oil, dust with the\r\nextra paprika and sprinkle with thyme\r\nsprigs, if you like. Serve with pitta bread\r\nand vegetable sticks."]','2026-01-10 12:14:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4925,4925,'en','Baked skinny fries','A simple side dish of homemade chips isn’t always unhealthy – this version coats the potatoes in spices too','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tsp fine cornmeal or polenta","½  tsp paprika","¼ tsp garlic powder","2 large potatoes, cut into 1cm-thick chips"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPour the oil onto a baking tray and put\r\nin the oven for 3 mins. Mix the cornmeal\r\nor polenta, paprika and garlic powder\r\ntogether and season. Toss the chips\r\nin the mix, then tip onto the tray. Shake\r\nwell, then cook for 40 mins, shaking\r\nhalfway through, until crisp and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:14:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4927,4927,'en','Crispy garlic & rosemary slices','These herby Mediterranean-style potatoes taste so good it’s hard to believe they’re low in fat','["4 large potatoes, thinly sliced","3 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 tbsp rosemary needles"]','["Heat grill to medium and simmer the\r\npotatoes in salted water for 3 mins.\r\nDrain well, tip into a shallow baking\r\ntray, then gently toss with the oil, garlic,\r\nrosemary and seasoning. Spread out\r\nin one layer and grill for 10-15 mins or\r\nuntil crisp and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:14:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4929,4929,'en','Beetroot & apple salad pots','A little like a Waldorf salad, these individual green pots with walnuts, celery and parsley are great on a party spread','["250g cooked beetroot, diced into 1cm cubes","2 apples, diced into 1cm cubes","2 celery sticks, finely sliced","50g walnuts, roughly chopped","handful parsley, chopped","3 tbsp walnut oil","1 tbsp red wine vinegar"]','["Put the beetroot, apples, celery, walnuts\r\nand parsley in a bowl. Whisk together the\r\nwalnut oil, vinegar and some seasoning,\r\npour over the beetroot salad and mix\r\nwell. Divide between small glasses or\r\nteacups and chill until ready to serve.Can be made up to 3 hrs ahead."]','2026-01-10 12:14:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4931,4931,'en','Lychee & ginger sorbet','This refreshing make-ahead dessert is a cooling way to finish off a Chinese-themed dinner party','["2 x 400g cans lychees in syrup","2 tsp caster sugar","thumb-size piece ginger, sliced","1 egg white","2 pieces stem ginger in syrup, shredded plus some syrup to serve"]','["Drain the syrup from two cans of\r\nlychees into a small pan. Add the sugar\r\nand dissolve over a gentle heat. Bring\r\nto the boil for 1 min. Blitz the drained\r\nlychees, fresh ginger slices and lychee\r\nsyrup in a blender until very finely\r\nchopped. Pour through a sieve. Tip into\r\na 1-litre container and freeze for at least\r\n6 hrs until solid.","Break up the frozen mix, then put in a\r\nfood processor. Tip in the egg white and\r\nwhizz until thick, pale and smooth. Return\r\nto the container and freeze again, ideally\r\novernight. Serve in scoops with slices of\r\nstem ginger and syrup poured over, with Chinese fortune cookies or thin butter or almond biscuits."]','2026-01-10 12:14:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4933,4933,'en','Butternut & harissa hummus','Roast pumpkin with plenty of garlic then blitz into a Moroccan-style dip with spicy harissa and sesame paste','["½ butternut squash (about 400g), peeled and cut into 2cm pieces","3 garlic cloves, unpeeled","2 tbsp olive oil","3 tbsp tahini paste","1 tbsp harissa, plus a little extra for drizzling","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPut the butternut squash and garlic\r\ncloves in a roasting tin, season well\r\nand add 100ml water. Cover the tin\r\nwith foil and bake for 45 mins, until the\r\nsquash is really tender. Leave to cool.","Tip the squash into a food processor\r\nwith any juices from the tin. Add the\r\ngarlic cloves, squeezed out of their\r\nskins. Add the remaining ingredients,\r\nseason with salt and blend to a paste.","Scrape the houmous into a bowl.\r\nDrizzle with extra harissa before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4935,4935,'en','Potato wedges with curry sauce','This creamy curry sauce makes a perfect dipping partner for crispy potato wedges','["6 large baking potatoes","1 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp tikka masala curry paste","1 tbsp tomato purée","400g can reduced-fat coconut milk","handful coriander leaves, chopped (optional)","juice ½  lemon"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Cut the potatoes into wedges. Pour the oil into a large roasting pan (no need to peel), toss in the wedges until coated all over, then season with pepper. Bake for 35-40 mins until crisp and golden.","Put the curry paste and tomato purée in a saucepan, stir well and fry for 1 min. Add the coconut milk, bring to the boil, then gently simmer for 10 mins. Can be frozen or made up to a day ahead. Season to taste and finish with a squeeze of lemon juice and a scattering of coriander, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:14:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4937,4937,'en','Sweet & spicy popcorn','Ready in under 10 minutes, this snack is great eaten warm or stored as a snack to stave off hunger between meals','["100g bag salted microwave popcorn","¼ tsp chilli powder","½  tsp cinnamon","1 tbsp agave syrup"]','["Cook the microwave popcorn according to the packet instructions. Tip into a large bowl. Sprinkle over the spices, then pour over the agave syrup. Stir and serve warm or pour into a bag and take to work as an afternoon snack."]','2026-01-10 12:14:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4939,4939,'en','Spiced apple crisps','Keep hunger pangs at bay by snacking on healthy dried fruit – this version bakes Granny Smiths with cinnamon','["2 Granny Smiths","cinnamon, for sprinkling"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/ 140C fan/ gas mark 3. Core the apple and slice through the equator into very thin slices 1 - 2mm thick. Dust with cinnamon and lay flat on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.","Cook for 45 mins – 1 hour, turning halfway through and removing any crisps that have turned brown. Continue cooking until the apples have dried out and are light golden. Cool, store in an airtight container and enjoy as a snack."]','2026-01-10 12:14:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4941,4941,'en','Seeded flatbreads','Moroccan-style breads with nigella and sesame seeds, great for wrapping and dipping','["7g sachet dried yeast","1 tsp caster sugar","400g strong white bread flour","200g wholemeal bread flour","oil, for greasing","1 tbsp kalonji seeds (also called black onion seeds or nigella seeds)","2 tbsp sesame seeds"]','["Mix the yeast with 2 tbsp warm water\r\nand sugar, and leave for a few mins. Tip\r\nthe flours into a large bowl with 1 tsp salt\r\nand make a well in the centre. Pour in the\r\nyeast mixture and 500ml warm water. Mix\r\nwith a wooden spoon until it comes\r\ntogether as a dough, then tip onto a work\r\nsurface and knead for 5-10 mins until\r\nsmooth and elastic – add a little extra\r\nflour if the dough is too sticky. Put the\r\ndough in an oiled bowl, cover with a tea\r\ntowel and leave in a warm place to rise\r\nfor 1 hr until doubled in size.","Tip the dough onto your work surface\r\nand knock out all the air. Knead the seeds\r\ninto the dough until well distributed. Divide\r\nthe dough into 12 pieces, then roll out each\r\nas thinly as you can. Heat a large frying pan,\r\ncook the flatbreads for 2 mins or until\r\nbubbles appear on the surface, then flip\r\nover and cook for 2 mins more. Once all\r\nare cooked, wrap in foil and keep for up\r\nto a day. Pop in a warm oven to reheat."]','2026-01-10 12:14:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4943,4943,'en','Lactose-free pizza','Make an easy family pizza and top with passata, Grana Padano and your favourite ingredients. Delicious for all, it’s ideal for anyone intolerant to lactose','["100ml passata","1 garlic clove, crushed","½ tsp dried oregano","50g Grana Padano, 40g finely grated, 10g shaved with a veg peeler","small handful of capers, pitted olives, sliced pepperoni or pickled jalapenos (optional)","handful of rocket","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","300g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast action yeast","1 tsp fine sea salt","2 tbsp olive oil, plus more for the bowl"]','["To make the pizza dough, tip the flour into a bowl, put the yeast on one side and the salt on the other. Make a well in the centre and pour in 200ml warm water and the olive oil. Mix together with your hands to form a rough dough, then tip onto a lightly floured work surface and knead for 8-10 mins until smooth and springy. Put into an oiled bowl, cover with a tea towel and leave to rise until doubled in size, about 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 9 and put a baking sheet inside to heat up. Knock the dough back into the bowl, then divide into two balls. Press the dough balls into flat rounds on a floured work surface, then roll into 5mm thick pizza bases, about 25cm wide. Transfer to two sheets of baking parchment.","Mix the passata, garlic and oregano in a small bowl with some seasoning. Spoon the sauce over the bases, leaving a 1cm border. Scatter with the finely grated Grana Padano and any of the toppings, if you like. Transfer the pizzas, cooking one at a time, onto the preheated tray with the baking parchment. Bake for 10 mins until the crusts are golden and crisp. Repeat with the remaining pizza.","Top the pizzas with the rocket and the Grana Padano shavings, then drizzle over the oil to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4945,4945,'en','Crab apple jelly','Treat family and friends to homemade crab apple jelly – make up jars and enjoy with meat and game, or in cake fillings','["1½ kg crab apples","1 lemon, zest pared and half juiced","around 450g white caster or granulated sugar","Jelly bag"]','["Wash and drain the fruit, then cut the apples in half and add to a large, heavy-basedsaucepanwith an equal quantity of water and the pared lemon zest. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for 20-25 mins until the apples are pulpy. Stir occasionally using the back of a wooden spoon to help break down the fruit.","Remove from the heat and allow to cool a little. Place the fruit pulp in a jelly bag and allow the juice to drip through into a large bowl (this will take several hours, so doing this overnight is ideal). If you force the fruit through, this will create a cloudy jelly.","Put two small, sterilised saucers in the freezer – you will use these to test the setting point of the jam. You can sterilise the saucers by washing them in hot soapy liquid, rinsing and placing in an oven at 180C/160C fan/gas 4 for 5 mins. Remove carefully and allow to cool.","Weigh the fruity liquid and return to a large saucepan. Weigh three quarters of sugar to your total liquid amount (for example, if you have 400g of liquid, add 300g of sugar).","Add the sugar to the juice with the lemon juice, and stir over a medium heat until completely dissolved. Turn up the heat and bring the fruit to the boil. Stir occasionally and allow to boil hard for about 8 mins, removing any scum with a spoon. If using a thermometer, you’re looking to reach 105c. If not, check the setting point of the liquid after 8 mins by removing a saucer from the freezer and adding a teaspoon of the liquid to the plate. Allow to sit for a minute, then push your finger through the liquid. If it starts to wrinkle, the jelly is ready. If not, return to the boil and try again after another minute.","Pour into sterilised jars and allow to cool completely. Store in a cool, dark place."]','2026-01-10 12:14:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4947,4947,'en','Turkey stock','Get the most out of your turkey by using the bones to make a stock. It can kept in the freezer to be used in soups, risottos and more','["1 turkey carcass, meat removed","2 onions, chopped","2 carrots, chopped","2 celery stalks, chopped","1 tsp black peppercorns","3 sprigs thyme","1 bay leaf"]','["Put all the ingredients into a large stock pot or your biggestsaucepan, and top up with 2 litres water. Add more water to cover all the ingredients if needed.","Bring to a simmer over a high heat, skimming off any foam that appears on top of the liquid with a spoon. Reduce to a medium heat, then simmer, half covered, for 3 hrs – the stock will have reduced and concentrated its flavours. Or, if you prefer a lighter stock, cover fully while simmering.","Turn off the heat and leave to cool for a few minutes, then carefully strain into a container or bowl to cool completely.Will keep in the fridge for a week and for three months in the freezer."]','2026-01-10 12:14:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4949,4949,'en','Gluten-free Christmas cake','Make this dairy-, gluten-, nut- and egg-free Christmas cake. This is a festive cake for everyone, and the best part is, no one will ever guess it’s free-from!','["150g raisins","100g sultanas","125g currants","200g mixed candied peel","100g glacé cherries, halved","2 oranges, zested and juiced","100ml brandy or black tea, plus 4 tbsp","175g dairy-free margarine, plus extra for the tin","175g dark brown soft sugar","50g treacle","200ml soya milk","2 tbsp cider vinegar","400g gluten-free flour","2 tsp xanthan gum","¾ tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 tsp mixed spice","2 tsp ground cinnamon"]','["The day before you want to bake the cake, combine the raisins, sultanas, currants, mixed candied peel, glacé cherries, orange juice and 100ml brandy in a largebowl. Cover and leave to soak overnight.","Butter a deep 20cm round cake tin, and line the base and side with baking parchment. Beat the margarine, sugar, treacle and orange zest together in a large bowl using an electricwhiskuntil smooth and fluffy. Gradually whisk in the milk and vinegar (the mixture will split at this point, but will come back together when the dry ingredients are added, so don’t worry). Mix the flour, xanthan gum, bicarbonate of soda, mixed spice and cinnamon together in a second large bowl. Gradually mix the wet ingredients into the dry until smooth. Heat the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2.","Fold the soaked fruit into the cake mixture until combined, then spoon into the tin and level the top with the back of a spoon. Bake for 45 mins, then reduce the heat to 140C/120C fan/gas 1 and bake for a further 2-3 hrs until the cake is deeply golden and firm to the touch (cover the top of the cake with foil if it starts to darken too much). The cake is ready when a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean.","Poke holes all over the top of the warm cake using a skewer, then spoon over 4 tbsp brandy and leave to cool in the tin for 1 hr. Transfer to a wire rack, remove the parchment and leave to cool completely. When the cake is cold, wrap in a layer of baking parchment, then a layer of foil before storing.Will keep in a dry, cool cupboard for up to three months, or in the freezer for up to six months."]','2026-01-10 12:14:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4951,4951,'en','Vegan sausages in blankets','Wrap vegan sausages in dairy-free puff pastry to make these easy pigs in blankets. A great side dish at Christmas, they’re also perfect for parties and buffets','["½ tbsp vegetable oil","½ sheet ready-rolled dairy-free puff pastry","16 chipolata-style vegan sausages","1 tbsp dried sage","1 tbsp soy milk","1 tbsp vegetable oil","¼ nutmeg, grated","½ garlic clove, grated"]','["Use the oil to coat a largebaking tray. Unroll the puff pastry on a work surface so it’s flat, then cut it into 16 x 10cm-long strips.","Wind a strip of pastry around each sausage, so it looks like a corkscrew. Transfer to the prepared tray and chill for 15 mins.Will keep in the fridge overnight, or the freezer for up to two weeks.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. To make the glaze, combine the soy milk, oil, nutmeg, garlic, a pinch of salt and plenty of black pepper in a bowl. Brush the glaze over the pastry spirals using a pastry brush, then sprinkle with the sage. Bake for 25-30 mins, or until the pastry is puffed up and golden, and the sausages are cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:14:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4953,4953,'en','Baked sea bass with lemon caper dressing','This elegant, gluten-free main is special enough for a dinner party, yet simple and quick to make for no fuss entertaining','["4 x 100g/4oz sea bass fillets","olive oil, for brushing","3 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","grated zest 1 lemon, plus 2 tbsp juice","2 tbsp small capers","2 tsp gluten-free Dijon mustard","2 tbsp chopped flat-leaf parsley, plus a few extra leaves (optional)"]','["To make the dressing, mix the oil with the lemon zest and juice, capers, mustard, some seasoning and 1 tbsp water. Don''t add the parsley yet (unless serving straight away) as the acid in the lemon will fade the colour if they are left together for too long.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Line a baking tray with baking parchment and put the fish, skin-side up, on top. Brush the skin with oil and sprinkle with some flaky salt. Bake for 7 mins or until the flesh flakes when tested with a knife. Arrange the fish on warm serving plates, spoon over the dressing and scatter with extra parsley leaves, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4955,4955,'en','Vegetable vegan biriyani with carrot salad','A meat and dairy-free, Indian-inspired basmati rice dish with cauliflower, French beans, peas, potatoes, homemade curry paste and carrot salad','["400g basmati rice","pinch saffron threads (optional)","2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 cauliflower, cut into florets","2 potatoes, cut into chunks","100g red lentils","100g French beans, trimmed and cut in half","handful curry leaves","2 handfuls frozen peas","small bunch coriander","50g roasted cashew nuts, roughly chopped","poppadoms and naan bread, to serve","1 large onion, roughly chopped","large piece ginger, roughly chopped","5 garlic cloves","2 tsp curry powder","1 tsp ground cumin","2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 small green chilli","4 carrots","pinch of golden caster sugar","squeeze lemon juice","handful cashew nuts, roughly chopped","handful coriander leaves, roughly chopped","thumb-sized piece ginger, shredded into matchsticks","1 tsp cumin seed, toasted"]','["Soak the rice for 30 mins, then rinse in\r\nseveral changes of water until it runs\r\nclear. Cover with about 1 cm water, add\r\nthe saffron (if using), cover the pan, bring\r\nto the boil, stir once, then turn off the\r\nheat. Leave for 10 mins, covered, then\r\nstir again and leave to stand, covered.","To make the paste, blitz all the\r\ningredients together in a food processor.\r\nHeat the oil in a saucepan. Tip in the\r\npaste, then add the cauliflower and\r\npotatoes. Cook in the paste to colour,\r\nthen add the lentils and green beans, and\r\ncover with about 400ml water. Add the\r\ncurry leaves, season with salt, cover with\r\na lid and simmer for 20 mins until the\r\nlentils and vegetables are tender Add the\r\npeas for the last 2 mins to defrost. Stir\r\nthe rice through the curry until completely\r\nmixed and hot, then spoon onto a platter\r\nand scatter with coriander and cashews.","For the carrot salad, use a peeler to shave\r\nthe carrots into ribbons. Sprinkle with the\r\nsugar and dress with the lemon juice, then\r\ntoss with the other ingredients. Serve the\r\nbiryani on a large platter for everyone to\r\nhelp themselves, with the carrot salad on\r\nthe side, poppadoms for any vegans and\r\nnaan bread for the vegetarians."]','2026-01-10 12:14:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4957,4957,'en','Bulgur wheat, date & clementine salad','A meat-free, dairy-free Middle Eastern-style mix of citrus, healthy grains and nutritional pulses – great for lunchboxes','["140g bulgar wheat","1 tsp ground allspice","1 tsp ground cumin","6 stoned dates, chopped","small handful parsley, chopped","400g can chickpeas, drained","2 tbsp flaked toasted almonds","100g bag baby spinach","2 clementines, peel removed, sliced","juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp sherry vinegar","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil"]','["Put the bulghar wheat and spices in\r\na large bowl, season with salt and pour\r\nover 140ml boiling water. Cover with cling\r\nfilm and leave to sit for 10 mins. Fluff with\r\na fork, then add the chopped dates,\r\nparsley, chickpeas and most of the\r\nalmonds. Pour the dressing ingredients\r\ninto a glass jar with a fitted lid and add\r\nsome seasoning. Shake well and pour\r\nover the salad.","Just before eating, mix the spinach\r\nthrough, top with the clementine slices\r\nand scatter with the remaining almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:14:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4959,4959,'en','Avocado, prawn & fennel cocktails','A modern, lighter version of the retro starter, prawn cocktail','["4 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 segmented orange, plus the juice from the trimmings","juice 1 lemon","1 fennel bulb, trimmed, halved and finely sliced","1 avocado, quartered, peeled and sliced","200g cooked king prawns","3 spring onions, sliced","55g bag wild rocket"]','["Make the dressing by mixing the oil and\r\ncitrus juices together in a small bowl with\r\nsome salt and pepper, then set aside.","In a bowl, toss all the other ingredients,\r\nexcept the rocket, together with the orange\r\nsegments and half of the dressing. Scatter\r\nthe rocket leaves into 4 Martini glasses or\r\nsmall bowls, pile the salad into the centre,\r\nthen drizzle with the remaining dressing\r\njust before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:14:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4961,4961,'en','Yummy scrummy carrot cake recipe','Delight friends with an afternoon tea that includes this easy carrot cake. You can bake the cake, freeze it and just drizzle over the icing on the day','["175g light muscovado sugar","175ml sunflower oil","3 large eggs, lightly beaten","140g grated carrots (about 3 medium)","100g raisins","grated zest of 1 large orange","175g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp ground cinnamon","½  tsp grated nutmeg (freshly grated will give you the best flavour)","175g icing sugar","1½-2 tbsp orange juice"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/Gas 4/fan 160C. Oil and line the base and sides of an 18cm square cake tin with baking parchment. The easiest way to do this is to cut two long strips the width of the tin and put each strip crossways,\r\ncovering the base and sides of the tin, with a double layer in the base.","Tip the sugar into a large mixing bowl, pour in the oil and add the eggs. Lightly mix with a wooden spoon. Stir in the grated carrots, raisins and orange rind.","Mix the flour, bicarbonate of\r\nsoda and spices, then sift into the\r\nbowl. Lightly mix all the\r\ningredients – when everything\r\nis evenly amalgamated stop\r\nmixing.\r\nThe mixture will be fairly soft\r\nand almost runny.","Pour the mixture into the\r\nprepared tin and bake for 40-\r\n45 minutes, until it feels firm\r\nand springy when you press it in\r\nthe centre. Cool in the tin for 5\r\nminutes, then turn it out, peel\r\noff the paper and cool on a wire\r\nrack. (You can freeze the cake at\r\nthis point.)","Beat together the frosting\r\ningredients in a small bowl until\r\nsmooth – you want the icing\r\nabout as runny as single cream.\r\nSet the cake on a serving plate\r\nand boldly drizzle the icing back\r\nand forth in diagonal lines over\r\nthe top, letting it drip down the sides."]','2026-01-10 12:14:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4963,4963,'en','Baby spinach & bacon bistro salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis simple French-style salad makes a wonderful light lunch','["140g fine green beans","4 tbsp olive oil","6 rashers smoked streaky bacon, chopped into small pieces","2 thick slices crustless white bread, cut into cubes","200g mushrooms, sliced","1 avocado, halved and sliced","250g baby spinach","1 small garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","3 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil"]','["Mix the dressing ingredients together\r\nwith 1 tbsp water and season with salt\r\nand pepper. Boil the beans for 3 mins\r\nuntil just cooked, drain in cold water,\r\nthen drain again.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan, then\r\nsizzle the bacon for 4 mins until crisp.\r\nUse a slotted spoon to scoop the bacon\r\ninto a large salad bowl. Use the fat in the\r\npan to fry the bread cubes until crisp,\r\nthen tip them in with the bacon. Tip a\r\nsplash more oil into the pan, very briefly\r\nfry the mushrooms just to rid them of\r\ntheir rawness, then turn off the heat.\r\nWhen the mushrooms have cooled\r\nslightly, tip them into the salad bowl\r\nalong with the beans and avocado.\r\nMoments before serving, add the spinach\r\nand dressing, then toss really well so\r\neverything is coated."]','2026-01-10 12:14:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4965,4965,'en','Lemon & rosemary crusted fish fillets','Use up leftover bread in this crispy topping to liven up white fish','["4 white fish fillets (hake is sustainable)","2 rosemary sprigs, leaves chopped, or 1 tsp dried","50g bread (about 2 slices), torn into pieces","zest 2 lemons, plus wedges to serve","1 tbsp olive oil"]','["Heat the grill to medium. Place the fish\r\nfillets, skin-side up, on a baking tray, then\r\ngrill for 4 mins. Meanwhile, place the\r\nrosemary, bread, lemon zest and some\r\nseasoning in a food processor, then blitz\r\nto make fine crumbs.","Turn the fish over, then press a quarter\r\nof the crumbs over the top of each fillet.\r\nDrizzle with olive oil, then grill for 4 mins\r\nuntil the crust is golden and the fish is\r\ncooked through and just flaking. Serve\r\nwith buttered new potatoes and lemon\r\nwedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:14:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4967,4967,'en','Roasted pepper & goat’s cheese stuffed tomatoes','Enjoy a dairy-free dish','["25g pine nuts, plus 2 tbsp extra for sprinkling","225g pack baby leaf spinach","200g roasted red peppers, drained and diced","125g rindless Welsh goat''s cheese with garlic and herbs, plus 50g/2oz for crumbling","6 large beef tomatoes"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Cut the tops off the tomatoes and discard. Scoop out the seeds and discard. Place the tomatoes on a lightly oiled, shallow baking dish.","Brown all the pine nuts in a dry frying pan or under the grill until golden. Wilt the spinach in a hot pan for a min. Drain thoroughly in a sieve, squeezing out the excess liquid, then roughly chop.","Combine the spinach, peppers, 25g/1oz toasted nuts and 125g/41?2oz crumbled cheese in a bowl, then season to taste. Divide the mixture between the tomato shells. Top each tomato with more crumbled goat’s cheese and the rest of the pine nuts, then bake for 20 mins until the filling is hot and the tomato skins are beginning to wrinkle and split. Serve warm."]','2026-01-10 12:14:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4969,4969,'en','Vegan smoothie','A dairy-free vegan smoothie with fruit juice, tofu and oats to power you up at breakfast or provide sustenance for exercise','["100ml (¼ tall glass) cherry juice (we used Cherrygood)","200ml (½ tall glass) unsweetened soya milk","1 cherry soya yogurt","3 tbsp or 50g firm silken tofu","75g (1 empty yogurt pot) frozen cherries","2 tbsp porridge oats"]','["Measure all the ingredients exactly or use a tall glass and your empty yogurt pot for speed – they don’t have to be exact. Put them into a blender and blitz until smooth. Pour into 1 tall glass (you’ll have enough for a top up) or two short tumblers."]','2026-01-10 12:14:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4971,4971,'en','Lasagne','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyLittle is more satisfying than cooking a classic to perfection – Sarah Cook gives us a lesson in how to make lasagne','["3 tbsp olive oil","2 celery sticks, finely chopped","1 onion, finely chopped","1 carrot (about 100g/4oz) finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed","140g pack cubetti di pancetta","500g pack beef mince (we used 10% fat)","500g pack pork mince or British veal mince","200ml milk","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","2 bay leaf","1 rosemary sprig","2 thyme sprigs","2 tsp dried oregano","2 beef stock cubes","500ml red wine","about 400g dried pasta sheets","50g Parmesan, finely grated","1½ l milk","1 onion, thickly sliced","3 bay leaf","3 cloves","100g butter","100g plain flour","good grating of nutmeg"]','["First infuse the milk for the béchamel sauce. Put the milk, onion, bay and cloves into a large saucepan and bring very gently just up to the boil. Turn off the heat and set aside for 1 hr to infuse.","For the meat sauce, put the oil, celery, onion, carrot, garlic and pancetta in another large saucepan. Gently cook together until the veg are soft but not coloured. Tip in all the mince, the milk and tomatoes. Using a wooden spoon, stir together and break up and mash the lumps of mince against the sides of the pan. When the mince is mostly broken down, stir in all the herbs, the stock cubes and wine, and bring to a simmer. Cover and cook for 1 hr, stirring occasionally to stop the bottom catching. Uncover and gently simmer for another 30 mins-1 hr until the meat is tender and saucy. Taste and season.","To finish the béchamel, strain the milk through a fine sieve into one or two jugs. Melt the butter in the same pan then, using a wooden spoon, mix in the flour and cook for 2 mins. Stir in the strained milk, a little at a time – the mix will thicken at first to a doughy paste, but keep going, adding milk gradually to avoid lumps. When all the milk is in, bring to a gentle simmer, stirring constantly (if you have lumps, give it a quick whisk). Gently bubble for a few mins until thickened. Season with salt, pepper and nutmeg.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Spread a spoonful of the meat sauce over the base of a roughly 3.5 litre baking dish. Cover with a single layer of pasta sheets, snapping them to fit if needed, then top with a quarter of the béchamel. Spoon over a third of the meat sauce and scatter over a little Parmesan. Repeat the layers – pasta, béchamel, meat and Parmesan – two more times to use all the meat sauce. Add a final layer of pasta, the last of the béchamel and remaining Parmesan. Sit the dish on a baking tray to catch spills and bake for 1 hr until bubbling, browned and crisp on top."]','2026-01-10 12:14:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4973,4973,'en','Chocolate brownie cake','The perfect cake for brownie lovers, try a big slice warm with some ice cream','["175g unsalted butter, plus extra for greasing","225g dark chocolate, broken into pieces","200g caster sugar","3 medium eggs, separated","65g plain flour","50g chopped pecan nuts"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter a 20-25cm cake tin and line with greaseproof paper.","Place 175g/6oz of the chocolate, plus the butter and sugar in a heavy-based pan and heat gently until melted, stirring occasionally. Leave to cool.","Whisk the egg yolks into the chocolate mixture, then add the flour, nuts and the remaining chocolate.","Whisk the egg whites until they form soft peaks, then gently, but thoroughly, fold into the chocolate mixture.","Pour into the prepared tin and bake in the centre of the oven for about 35-40 mins until crusty on top. Leave to cool, then run a knife around the sides and remove from the tin. Dust with icing sugar and serve warm with custard or ice cream or cold with cream."]','2026-01-10 12:14:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4975,4975,'en','Rhubarb crumble muffins','The flavours of a rhubarb crumble in the form of a  lovely moist muffin.','["175g caster sugar","175g rhubarb, halved lengthways then diced","2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 egg","1 tsp vanilla extract","125ml buttermilk","200g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","50g light muscovado sugar","50g plain flour","25g porridge oats","1 tsp ground cinnamon","50g butter"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nLine a 12-hole muffin tin with paper\r\nmuffin cases. Stir the sugar and rhubarb\r\ntogether and set aside while you make\r\nthe crumble topping. Mix together the\r\nmuscovado sugar with the flour, oats\r\nand cinnamon, then rub in the butter\r\nuntil clumpy with your fingertips.","Stir the oil and egg, vanilla and\r\nbuttermilk into the sugary rhubarb\r\n(don’t worry if it’s a little bit juicy).\r\nNow, add the flour, baking powder\r\nand bicarbonate of soda and stir well.","Quickly spoon into the cases, then\r\nscatter each with a thick layer of the\r\ncrumble mixture. Bake for 15-18 mins\r\nuntil golden and a cocktail stick poked\r\ninto the centre of a muffin comes\r\nout clean. Cool on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:14:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4977,4977,'en','Bobotie','Pronounced ba-boor-tea, the national dish of South Africa is a delicious mixture of curried meat and fruit with a creamy golden topping, not dissimilar to moussaka','["2 slices white bread","2 onions, chopped","25g butter","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1kg packet lean minced beef","2 tbsp madras curry paste","1 tsp dried mixed herbs","3 cloves","5 allspice berries","2 tbsp peach or mango chutney","3 tbsp sultanas","6 bay leaves","300ml full-cream milk","2 large eggs"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Pour cold water over the bread and set aside to soak.","Meanwhile, fry the onions in the butter, stirring regularly for 10 mins until they are soft and starting to colour. Add the garlic and beef and stir well, crushing the mince into fine grains until it changes colour. Stir in the curry paste, herbs, spices, chutney, sultanas and 2 of the bay leaves with 1 tsp salt and plenty of ground black pepper.","Cover and simmer for 10 mins. Squeeze the water from the bread, then beat into the meat mixture until well blended. Tip into an oval ovenproof dish (23 x 33cm and about 5-6cm deep). Press the mixture down well and smooth the top. You can make this and chill 1 day ahead.","For the topping, beat the milk and eggs with seasoning, then pour over the meat. Top with the remaining bay leaves and bake for 35-40 mins until the topping is set and starting to turn golden."]','2026-01-10 12:14:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4979,4979,'en','Thai prawn, ginger & spring onion stir-fry','This stir-fry has a welcome spicy kick. Once you''ve made the paste, it takes only 10 minutes to cook','["200g raw, peeled tiger prawns from a sustainable source","1 green Thai chilli, chopped","3 garlic cloves, 1 crushed and 2 finely sliced","1 bunch coriander, leaves and stalks separated","1 tbsp caster sugar","juice 1 lime","3 tbsp fish sauce","2 tbsp groundnut oil","3cm piece ginger, finely sliced, then shredded","8 spring onions, finely sliced","1 red pepper, thinly sliced","85g water chestnuts, sliced","100g beansprouts","1 tbsp soy sauce","egg or rice noodles, to serve","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Put the prawns in a bowl. Put the chilli,\r\ncrushed garlic, coriander stalks (snip\r\nthese up using scissors first) and caster\r\nsugar in a spice grinder or small food\r\nprocessor and whizz together. Add half\r\nof the lime juice and the fish sauce, then\r\npour this over the prawns.","Heat 1 tbsp oil in a wok, add the ginger\r\nand spring onions and fry for 1 min. Add\r\nthe red pepper and fry for 1 min, until the\r\npepper starts to soften. Add the water\r\nchestnuts and bean sprouts, and toss\r\ntogether until the bean sprouts start to\r\nwilt. Add the soy sauce and a really good\r\ngrind of black pepper, then tip the lot into\r\na serving dish.","Heat the remaining oil in the wok and\r\nadd the prawns, lifting them out of their\r\njuices. Toss for 1-2 mins until they turn\r\npink, add the marinade and swirl the wok\r\nquickly, then tip the lot onto the veg. Snip\r\nover the coriander leaves and sprinkle on\r\nthe remaining lime. Serves over noodles\r\nwith extra lime for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:14:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4981,4981,'en','10-minute couscous salad','This makes a great lunchbox filler for a day out and is equally good at home from the fridge','["100g couscous","200ml hot low salt vegetable stock (from a cube is fine)","2 spring onions","1 red pepper","½ cucumber","50g feta cheese, cubed","2 tbsp pesto","2 tbsp toasted pine nuts"]','["Tip couscous into a large bowl, pour over\r\nstock. Cover, then leave for 10 mins, until\r\nfluffy and all the stock has been absorbed.\r\nMeanwhile, slice the onions and pepper\r\nand dice the cucumber. Add these to the\r\ncouscous, fork through pesto, crumble in\r\nfeta, then sprinkle over pine nuts to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4983,4983,'en','Butternut squash soup with chilli & crème fraîche','Come in from the cold to a warming bowlful of autumn','["1 butternut squash, about 1kg, peeled and deseeded","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp butter","2 onions, diced","1 garlic clove, thinly sliced","2 mild red chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","850ml hot vegetable stock","4 tbsp crème fraîche, plus more to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nCut the squash into large cubes, about\r\n4cm/1½in across, then toss in a large\r\nroasting tin with half the olive oil. Roast\r\nfor 30 mins, turning once during cooking,\r\nuntil golden and soft.","While the squash cooks, melt the\r\nbutter with the remaining oil in a large\r\nsaucepan, then add the onions, garlic and\r\n¾ of the chilli. Cover and cook on a very\r\nlow heat for 15-20 mins until the onions\r\nare completely soft.","Tip the squash into the pan, add the\r\nstock and the crème fraîche, then whizz\r\nwith a stick blender until smooth. For\r\na really silky soup, put the soup into a\r\nliquidiser and blitz it in batches. Return\r\nto the pan, gently reheat, then season to\r\ntaste. Serve the soup in bowls with swirls\r\nof crème fraîche and a scattering of the\r\nremaining chopped chilli."]','2026-01-10 12:14:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4985,4985,'en','Chicken roll-ups','Introduce young children to cooking by letting them make their own lunch, with this safe and simple recipe','["1 wrap or tortilla","1-2 tbsp houmous","3 fat slices cooked chicken breast","¼ avocado, taken out of its skin","3 cherry tomatoes","cheddar, grated to make about 1 tbsp"]','["Put a wrap on\r\na board or plate.\r\nSpread the houmous\r\nonto the middle of\r\nit using a spoon or\r\nbutter knife.","Tear up the\r\nchicken (orask a\r\ngrown-up helperto\r\ndo this) and put it in a\r\nline down the middle\r\nof the wrap. Chop\r\nthe avocado with a\r\nbutter knife (orask\r\nyour helper) and put\r\nit next to the chicken.","Squish the\r\ntomatoes\r\nonto the wrap by\r\nsqueezing them and\r\ntearing them in half\r\n(they might squirt,\r\nso mind your\r\nclothes). Sprinkle\r\non some cheese.","Roll up the wrap\r\nand press it\r\ndown firmly.Ask\r\nyour grown-up\r\nhelperto cut it in\r\nhalf for you."]','2026-01-10 12:14:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4987,4987,'en','Feta & semi-dried tomato omelette','Cooking up eggs with cheese and tomato makes for a super-quick meal for one that’s ready in 10 minutes','["1 tsp olive oil","2 eggs, lightly beaten","4 semi-dried tomatoes, roughly chopped","25g feta cheese, crumbled","mixed salad leaves, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a small frying pan, add\r\nthe eggs and cook, swirling the eggs\r\nwith a fork as they set. When the eggs\r\nare still slightly runny in the middle,\r\nscatter over the tomatoes and feta,\r\nthen fold the omelette in half. Cook for\r\n1 min more before sliding onto a plate.\r\nServe alongside a mixed leaf salad."]','2026-01-10 12:14:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4989,4989,'en','Chilli con carne recipe','This great chilli recipe has to be one of the best dishes to serve to friends for a casual get-together. An easy sharing favourite that uses up storecupboard ingredients.','["1 tbsp oil","1 large onion","1 red pepper","2 garlic cloves, peeled","1 heaped tsp hot chilli powder (or 1 level tbsp if you only have mild)","1 tsp paprika","1 tsp ground cumin","500g lean minced beef","1 beef stock cube","400g can chopped tomatoes","½  tsp dried marjoram","1 tsp sugar","2 tbsp tomato purée","410g can red kidney beans","plain boiled long grain rice, to serve","soured cream, to serve"]','["Prepare your vegetables. Chop1 large onioninto small dice,\r\nabout 5mm square. The easiest\r\nway to do this is to cut the onion\r\nin half from root to tip, peel it\r\nand slice each half into thick\r\nmatchsticks lengthways, not\r\nquite cutting all the way to the\r\nroot end so they are still held\r\ntogether. Slice across the\r\nmatchsticks into neat dice. Cut1 red pepperin half\r\nlengthways, remove stalk and\r\nwash the seeds away, then chop. Peel and finely chop2 garlic cloves.","Start cooking. Put your pan on\r\nthe hob over a medium heat. Add\r\nthe oil and leave it for 1-2\r\nminutes until hot (a little\r\nlonger for an electric hob). Add\r\nthe onions and cook, stirring\r\nfairly frequently, for about\r\n5 minutes, or until the onions\r\nare soft, squidgy and slightly\r\ntranslucent. Tip in the garlic, red pepper,1 heaped tsp hot chilli powder or 1 level tbsp mild chilli powder, 1 tsp paprikaand1 tsp ground cumin. Give it a good stir, then\r\nleave it to cook for another 5\r\nminutes, stirring occasionally.","Brown the500g lean minced beef.Turn the heat\r\nup a bit, add the meat to the pan\r\nand break it up with your spoon\r\nor spatula. The mix should\r\nsizzle a bit when you add the\r\nmince. Keep stirring and\r\nprodding for at least 5 minutes,\r\nuntil all the mince is in\r\nuniform, mince-sized lumps\r\nand there are no more pink bits.\r\nMake sure you keep the heat hot\r\nenough for the meat to fry and\r\nbecome brown, rather than just\r\nstew.","Making the sauce. Crumble1 beef stock cubeinto300ml hot water. Pour this into the pan with the mince mixture. Open1 can of chopped tomatoes (400g can)and add these as well. Tip in½ tsp dried marjoramand1 tsp sugar, if using (see tip at the bottom), and add a good shake of salt and pepper. Squirt inabout 2 tbsp tomato\r\npuréeand stir the sauce well.","Simmer it gently. Bring the\r\nwhole thing to the boil, give it a\r\ngood stir and put a lid on the pan.\r\nTurn down the heat until it is\r\ngently bubbling and leave it for\r\n20 minutes. You should check\r\non the pan occasionally to stir it\r\nand make sure the sauce doesn’t\r\ncatch on the bottom of the pan or\r\nisn’t drying out. If it is, add a\r\ncouple of tablespoons of water\r\nand make sure that the heat\r\nreally is low enough. After\r\nsimmering gently, the saucy\r\nmince mixture should look\r\nthick, moist and juicy.","Bring on the beans. Drain and\r\nrinse1 can of red kidney beans (410g can)in a sieve and\r\nstir them into the chilli pot.\r\nBring to the boil again, and\r\ngently bubble without the lid for\r\nanother 10 minutes, adding a\r\nlittle more water if it looks too\r\ndry. Taste a bit of the chilli and\r\nseason. It will probably take a\r\nlot more seasoning than you\r\nthink. Now replace the lid, turn\r\noff the heat and leave your chilli\r\nto stand for 10 minutes before\r\nserving, and relax. Leaving\r\nyour chilli to stand is really\r\nimportant as it allows the\r\nflavours to mingle and the meat.","Serve withsoured creamandplain boiled long grain rice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4991,4991,'en','Cheeseburger & chips','Homemade burgers and chips beat shop-bought every time. Why not make double and freeze a batch?','["1¼kg lean beef mince","1 onion, finely chopped","140g breadcrumbs","100g mature cheddar, grated","small bunch parsley, chopped","1 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","1 egg, lightly beaten with a fork","1 tsp mild chilli powder","2½ kg bag of potatoes, cut into chunky chips","3 tbsp plain flour","10 tsp olive or sunflower oil","burger buns, lettuce, sliced red onion, tomatoes, gherkins, and sauces or relishes, to serve"]','["Tip the mince into a large bowl with\r\nthe onion, breadcrumbs, cheese, parsley,\r\nWorcestershire sauce, egg, chilli powder,\r\n½ tsp salt and some pepper. Mix together\r\nwell with your hands, then divide the\r\nmixture into 10 and shape into burgers.","Bring 2 large saucepans of water to\r\nthe boil (or prepare the chips in batches\r\nif you don’t have enough big pans). Add\r\nthe chips, bring the water back to the\r\nboil and set your timer for 3 mins. After\r\n3 mins, drain the potatoes well and tip\r\nonto one or two large kitchen-papercovered\r\ntrays. Scatter with the flour and some seasoning and gently toss to coat.","Freeze the burgers and chips (see\r\nfreezing tips, below) or, to cook straight\r\naway, heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nIn a baking tray, toss the chips in a little\r\noil, then roast for 35-40 mins until crisp\r\nand golden. Meanwhile, heat a griddle\r\npan, grill or barbecue until hot, then\r\ncook the burgers for about 5-8 mins\r\non each side, or until cooked to your\r\nliking. Sandwich the burgers in toasted\r\nbuns with salad and sauces, then serve\r\nwith the chips."]','2026-01-10 12:14:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4993,4993,'en','Tuna sweet potato jackets','If your standby supper is baked potatoes with tuna, switch to sweet potatoes and a fresh, spicy topping – budget-friendly and low-fat too','["4 small sweet potatoes (about 200g each)","185g can tuna in spring water, drained","½ red onion, finely sliced","1 small red chilli, deseeded and chopped","juice 1 lime","6 tbsp Greek yogurt","handful coriander leaves"]','["Scrub the sweet potatoes and prick all\r\nover with a fork. Place on a microwaveable\r\nplate and cook on High for 18-20 mins, or\r\nuntil tender. Split in half and place each\r\none, cut-side up, on a serving plate.","Flake the drained tuna with a fork\r\nand divide between the sweet potatoes.\r\nTop with the red onion and chilli, then\r\nsqueeze over the lime juice. Top with\r\na dollop of yogurt and scatter over the\r\ncoriander, to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4995,4995,'en','Tuna, asparagus & white bean salad','A nourishing spring salad, ready in minutes','["1 large bunch asparagus","2 x 200g cans yellowfin tuna steaks in water, drained","2 x 400g cans cannellini beans in water, drained","1 red onion, very finely chopped","2 tbsp capers","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 tbsp tarragon, finely chopped"]','["Cook the asparagus in a large pan of\r\nboiling water for 4-5 mins until tender.\r\nDrain well, cool under running water,\r\nthen cut into finger-length pieces. Toss\r\ntogether the tuna, beans, onion, capers\r\nand asparagus in a large serving bowl.","Mix the oil, vinegar and tarragon\r\ntogether, then pour over the salad.\r\nChill until ready to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4997,4997,'en','Warm chicken salad','This chicken salad recipe makes a lovely main meal for a hot day, or take some to work and be the envy of your colleagues','["2 chicken breasts, cut into bite-size pieces","½ small baguette, cut into bite-size pieces","4 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","150g bag mixed salad leaves","1 x 250g pack cooked beetroot, cut into bite-size pieces","100g goat''s cheese"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Spread the chunks of chicken and baguette over a shallow roasting tray. Drizzle with\r\n2 tbsp olive oil and toss to coat. Season, then put in the oven for 15 mins until the chicken is cooked through and the bread is golden and crisp.","Whisk together the remaining olive oil and balsamic vinegar to make a dressing. Split the bag of leaves between two serving\r\nplates, add the beetroot, then scatter the cheese over. Toss with the warm chicken and bread, drizzle with the dressing, then serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:14:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(4999,4999,'en','Honey muesli with raspberries & hazelnuts','Make your own muesli and boost it with fresh fruit for a wholly satisfying and healthy breakfast to keep you going through the day','["225g porridge oats, jumbo ones give a good texture","125ml freshly squeezed orange juice","225ml natural yogurt, can be low fat","3 tbsp clear honey","finely grated zest of 1 lemon","2 red or pink dessert apples","2x 125g punnets raspberries","50g hazelnuts in their skins, lightly toasted and coarsely chopped","single cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Mix oats, orange juice and 300ml/½ pint\r\ncold water in a bowl. Cover with cling film\r\nand leave in the fridge overnight.","The next morning, stir in the yogurt,\r\nhoney and lemon zest. Quarter and core\r\nthe apples, grate them in and stir well.\r\nSpoon into bowls and top with raspberries and toasted hazelnuts. Pour on a little\r\nsingle cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5001,5001,'en','Crisp baked potatoes','Crisp-skinned, fluffy-fleshed jackets are a cheap and cheerful way to feed a crowd – great with beans and sausages','["2 tsp vegetable oil","8 large baking potatoes","300ml pot soured cream"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Rub\r\na little oil over each potato and put on\r\nthe top shelf of the oven. Bake for 20 mins,\r\nthen turn down the oven to 190C/170C fan/\r\ngas 5 and bake for 45 mins-1 hr more\r\nuntil the skin is crisp and the flesh soft.\r\nRemove from the oven. Make a cross\r\nin the centre of each potato, dollop over\r\nthe soured cream and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5003,5003,'en','Sticky malt loaves','There’s something very satisfying about a cup of tea with a slice of buttered malt loaf – this simple, good-for-you version makes two and improves on keeping','["sunflower oil, for greasing","150ml hot black tea","175g malt extract, plus extra for glazing (see tip)","85g dark muscovado sugar","300g mixed dried fruits","2 large eggs, beaten","250g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","½  tsp bicarbonate of soda"]','["Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2. Line the base and ends of two greased 450g/1lb non-stick loaf tins with strips of baking parchment.","Pour the hot tea into a mixing bowl with the malt, sugar and dried fruit. Stir well, then add the eggs.","Tip in the flour, then quickly stir in the baking powder and bicarbonate of soda and pour into the prepared tins. Bake for 50 mins until firm and well risen. While still warm, brush with a little more malt to glaze and leave to cool.","Remove from the tins. If you can bear not to eat it straight away, it gets more sticky after wrapping and keeping for 2-5 days. Serve sliced and buttered, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5005,5005,'en','Antipasti peach platter','An easy, no-cook summer platter that’s brilliant for entertaining','["4 of the ripest peaches, stoned and cut into eighths","12 slices prosciutto","50g chunk parmesan, shaved with a peeler","1 red chilli, deseeded and very finely chopped","2 handfuls rocket","very good-quality olive oil","grissini stick, to serve"]','["Arrange the peaches, prosciutto and\r\nParmesan on a large platter, sprinkle\r\nover the chilli and scatter the rocket\r\nto finish. Just before serving, drizzle\r\nwith a little oil. Serve with breadsticks\r\nto add crunch."]','2026-01-10 12:14:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5007,5007,'en','Mocha milkshake','A decadent iced coffee for a sunny afternoon. Serve in tall glasses for a retro treat','["85g plain chocolate, 70% or 80%","1 tbsp coffee granules","700ml milk","4 scoops vanilla ice cream, plus extra to serve (optional)"]','["Roughly chop 75g of the chocolate and\r\nput into a large jug with the coffee. Bring\r\n300ml of the milk just to the boil, then\r\npour over the chocolate and coffee mix,\r\nstirring to melt. Once melted, cool.","Tip the cooled mocha milk into the\r\nblender with the ice cream and remaining\r\nmilk. Blitz until blended, then pour into\r\n4 tall glasses. Add an extra scoop of ice\r\ncream to each, if you like, then grate a\r\nlittle of the remaining chocolate on top."]','2026-01-10 12:14:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5009,5009,'en','Ultimate vanilla ice cream','Is Angela Nilsen’s vanilla ice cream the smoothest, creamiest homemade ice cream in history?','["284ml carton double cream","300ml full fat milk","115g golden caster sugar","1 vanilla pod","3 large free-range egg yolks","have lots of ice cubes at the ready"]','["Put the canister from the machine into the freezer a day before you want to make the ice cream. Next day, pour the cream and milk into a medium heavy-based pan, then tip in half the sugar. Slit the vanilla pod down its length with a small sharp knife and scoop out as many of the tiny black seeds as you can into the cream mixture. Cut the pod into three and drop it into the pan.","Heat the cream and milk over a low heat, stirring occasionally, until it almost boils – you’ll see a few bubbles at the edge. Take off the heat and set aside for 30 minutes so the vanilla can infuse.","Put the egg yolks into a bowl with the rest of the sugar and beat with an electric hand beater for about 2 minutes until the mixture has thickened, is paler in colour and falls in thick ribbons when you lift the beaters. Using a measuring jug, scoop out about 125ml/4fl oz of the cream mixture and beat into the egg yolks to slacken them. Reheat the cream until it just comes to the boil, take off the heat and stir in the egg yolk mixture.","Return the pan to a low heat and cook, stirring all the time with a wooden spoon, for 8-10 minutes, until the custard is thick enough to coat the back of the spoon. Watch that it doesn’t boil – as soon as you see any bubbles about to burst to the surface, it should be thick enough, so take the pan off the heat so the mixture doesn’t curdle.","Pour the custard into a heatproof bowl, then sit it in a bigger bowl one third full of iced water to cool (this takes about 20 minutes). Stir occasionally to stop a skin forming. Put the bowl of custard in the fridge for 3-4 hours, preferably overnight, so it gets really cold.","Get the ice cream machine running, scoop out the vanilla pod pieces, then slowly pour in the cold custard. Leave it to churn for 10-30 minutes (depending on your machine). When it stops, it is probably too soft to eat, so spoon into a plastic container, cover with cling film, then a lid, and freeze for a minimum of 3 hours. (It will keep in the freezer for 3 months but don’t take it out, then refreeze.) Remove from the freezer 15 minutes before serving.","To make it by hand: in step 1, heat the milk, vanilla, and half the\r\nsugar without the cream (the custard will be slightly thicker). At\r\nthe start of step 6, whip the cream so it’s light and floppy, not too\r\nstiff, and fold it into the cold custard. Freeze for 3-4 hours, stirring\r\nonce an hour until almost frozen, then freeze as above."]','2026-01-10 12:14:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5011,5011,'en','Perfect porridge','Perfect porridge for a healthy way to start the day','["50g porridge oats","350ml milk or water, or a mixture of the two","Greek yogurt, thinned with a little milk and clear honey, to serve"]','["Put the oats in a\r\nsaucepan, pour in the milk or water and\r\nsprinkle in a pinch of salt. Bring to the boil\r\nand simmer for 4-5 minutes, stirring from\r\ntime to time and watching carefully that it\r\ndoesn’t stick to the bottom of the pan. Or you can try this in a microwave. Mix the oats, milk or water\r\nand a pinch of salt in a large microwaveproof\r\nbowl, then microwave on High for 5\r\nminutes, stirring halfway through. Leave\r\nto stand for 2 minutes before eating.","To serve. Pour into bowls, spoon yogurt\r\non top and drizzle with honey."]','2026-01-10 12:14:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5013,5013,'en','Easy ratatouille with poached eggs','This gutsy one-pot can mostly be prepared in advance – just crack in the eggs at the end','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","1 red or orange pepper, deseeded and thinly sliced","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tbsp chopped rosemary","1 aubergine, diced","2 courgettes, diced","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp balsamic vinegar","4 large eggs","handful basil leaves"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan. Add\r\nthe onion, pepper, garlic and rosemary,\r\nthen cook for 5 mins, stirring frequently,\r\nuntil the onion has softened. Add the\r\naubergine and courgettes, then cook\r\nfor 2 mins more.","Add the tomatoes, then fill the can with\r\nwater, swirl it around and tip into the pan.\r\nBring to the boil, cover, then simmer for\r\n40 mins, uncovering after 20 mins, until\r\nreduced and pulpy.","Stir the vinegar into the ratatouille, then\r\nmake 4 spaces for the eggs. Crack an egg\r\ninto each hole and season with black\r\npepper. Cover, then cook for 2-5 mins\r\nuntil set as softly or firmly as you like.\r\nScatter over the basil and serve with\r\nsome crusty bread to mop up the juices."]','2026-01-10 12:14:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5015,5015,'en','Breakfast smoothie','Make the most of the berry season with a glass of fruity goodness','["1 small ripe banana","about 140g blackberries, blueberries, raspberries or strawberries (or use a mix), plus extra to serve","apple juice or mineral water, optional","runny honey, to serve"]','["Slice the banana into your blender or food processor and add the berries of your choice. Whizz until smooth. With the blades whirring, pour in juice or water to make the consistency you like. Toss a few extra fruits on top, drizzle with honey and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5017,5017,'en','Summer fruit compote','Add summer raspberries, blueberries and juicy plums to orange juice for a nutritious breakfast mix','["4 large plums, stoned and cut into wedges","200g punnet blueberries","zest and juice 1 orange","25g soft light brown sugar","150g punnet raspberries","thick yogurt and honey, to serve (optional)"]','["Cook the plums and blueberries in a\r\nsmall pan with the orange zest and juice,\r\nsugar and 4 tbsp water until slightly\r\nsoftened but not mushy. Gently stir in the\r\nraspberries and cook for 1 min more.","Remove from the heat and allow to\r\ncool to room temperature. Serve with\r\nyogurt and a drizzle of honey, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5019,5019,'en','Minty salmon & broccoli frittata','Filling and fast, and just as good the next day in your lunchbox','["500g new potatoes","1 small head broccoli, cut into florets","2 skinless salmon fillets","1 tbsp olive oil","small handful mint, finely chopped","8 eggs, beaten"]','["Boil potatoes in a large pan for 10-12 mins,\r\nadding the broccoli pieces for the final\r\n4 mins until everything is tender. Drain well.\r\nMeanwhile, place the salmon fillets in a\r\nmicrowaveable dish, splash with a little\r\nwater, then cover in cling film and microwave\r\non High for 2½ mins until the fish flakes.","Heat the grill. Heat the oil in a deep frying\r\npan. Cut the potatoes into chunky slices,\r\nthen quickly cook in the pan over a high heat\r\nuntil golden on the edges. Flake the salmon\r\ninto large chunks and poke amongst the\r\npotatoes with the broccoli. Stir the mint and\r\nsome seasoning into the eggs, then pour\r\ninto the pan. Leave for 6 mins over a low\r\nheat until the sides are set and just the\r\ncentre is a little wobbly, then flash under the\r\ngrill to set completely and brown. Serve in\r\nwedges with a big green salad on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:14:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5021,5021,'en','Oven-baked egg & chips','This deliciously simple meal can all be prepared in one pan for minimum washing-up','["2 medium baking potatoes, cut into chunky wedges","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp smoked paprika","2 tomatoes, halved","2 eggs"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nTip the potato wedges into a roasting tin.\r\nDrizzle over the oil and sprinkle over the\r\npaprika. Season and mix well to coat\r\nthe potatoes. Roast for 25 mins, turning\r\nhalfway through, until almost tender.","Nestle the tomatoes, cut-side up,\r\namongst the potatoes. Make 2 spaces\r\nin the tin and crack an egg into each\r\none. Return to the oven for 6-8 mins\r\nuntil the eggs are just set."]','2026-01-10 12:14:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5023,5023,'en','Anytime eggs','Fantastic one-pan egg dish, why not use whatever you have in the fridge to make it your own?','["1 tbsp olive oil","2-3 cooked potatoes, sliced","handful cherry tomatoes, sliced","2 spring onions, sliced","1 egg","few basil leaves"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan, then add the\r\npotato slices and fry on both sides until\r\nbrown. Add the tomatoes and spring onions\r\nand fry for about 1 min until softened.\r\nSeason with salt and pepper, then make a\r\nspace in the pan. Gently break the egg into\r\nthe space and fry until cooked to your liking.\r\nScatter over the basil leaves and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5025,5025,'en','Gluten-free pancakes','Use specialist flour in these quick and easy crepes and safely cater for those on a gluten-free diet','["125g gluten-free plain flour (we used Doves Farm)","1 egg","250ml milk","butter, for frying"]','["Put the flour in a bowl and make a well in the centre. Crack the egg in the middle and pour in a quarter of the milk. Use an electric or balloon whisk to thoroughly combine the mixture. Once you have a paste, mix in another quarter and once lump free, mix in the remaining milk. Leave to rest for 20 mins. Stir again before using.","Heat a small non-stick frying pan with a knob of butter. When the butter starts to foam, pour a small amount of the mixture into the pan and swirl around to coat the base – you want a thin layer. Cook for a few mins until golden brown on the bottom, then turn over and cook until golden on the the other side. Repeat until you have used all the mixture, stirring the mixture between pancakes and adding more butter for frying as necessary.","Serve with agave syrup and a squeeze of orange juice or your pancake filling of choice."]','2026-01-10 12:14:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5027,5027,'en','Roasted stone fruits with vanilla','This compote is delicious served warm with ice cream, or cold for breakfast with yogurt','["175g golden caster sugar","1 vanilla pod, split in two","5 cardamom pods","zest and juice 1 lime","6 apricots, halved and stoned","3 peaches, quartered and stoned","3 nectarines, quartered and stoned"]','["Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 8.  Tip the sugar, vanilla pod, cardamom, lime \r\nzest and juice into a food processor, then  blitz until blended, or mash together using a \r\npestle and mortar. Tip the fruit into a shallow baking dish, then toss in the sludgy sugar.","Roast for 20 mins until the fruits have softened, but not collapsed and the sugar \r\nand fruit juices have made a sticky sauce. Any leftovers will keep in the fridge  \r\nfor up to 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:14:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5029,5029,'en','Banana, clementine & mango smoothie','Kick-start your day with this deliciously refreshing drink, made with fresh fruit and yogurt. It''s rich in vitamin C and counts as one of your 5-a-day','["about 24 juicy clementines, plus an extra one for decoration","2 small, very ripe and juicy mangoes","2 ripe bananas","500g tub whole milk or low-fat yogurt","handful of ice cubes (optional)"]','["Halve clementines and squeeze out the\r\njuice – you should have about 600ml/1 pint.\r\n(This can be done the night before.) Peel\r\nmangoes, slice fruit away from the stone in\r\nthe centre, then chop the flesh into rough\r\npieces. Peel and slice the bananas.","Put the clementine juice, mango flesh,\r\nbananas, yogurt and ice cubes into a\r\nliquidiser and blend until smooth. Pour into\r\nsix glasses and serve. (You might need to\r\nmake this in two batches, depending on the\r\nsize of your liquidiser.) If you don’t add ice\r\ncubes, chill in the fridge until ready to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:14:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5031,5031,'en','Perfect scrambled eggs recipe','Learn how to make perfect scrambled eggs with this easy recipe. A quick breakfast packed with protein, courtesy of Bill Granger.','["2 large free range eggs","6 tbsp single cream or full cream milk","a knob of butter"]','["Lightly whisk the eggs, cream\r\nand a pinch of salt together\r\nuntil all the ingredients are just\r\ncombined and the mixture has\r\none consistency.","Heat a small non-stick frying\r\npan for a minute or so, then add\r\nthe butter and let it melt. Don’t\r\nallow the butter to brown or it\r\nwill discolour the eggs. Pour in\r\nthe egg mixture and let it sit,\r\nwithout stirring, for 20 seconds.\r\nStir with a wooden spoon, lifting\r\nand folding it over from the\r\nbottom of the pan. Let it sit for\r\nanother 10 seconds then stir\r\nand fold again.","Repeat until the eggs are\r\nsoftly set and slightly runny in\r\nplaces, then remove from the\r\nheat and leave for a few\r\nseconds to finish cooking.\r\nGive a final stir and serve the\r\nvelvety scramble without delay."]','2026-01-10 12:14:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5033,5033,'en','Creamy polenta','Pile pepperonata onto this soft, creamy polenta, or serve alongside your favourite stews. It’s naturally gluten-free','["250g polenta","30g salted butter","40g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated"]','["Pour 1 litre water into a large, deep pan and bring to the boil. Add the polenta, a handful at a time, whisking continuously (adding it slowly helps prevent lumps forming) for 1-2 mins until it starts to thicken slightly. Reduce the heat and continue to cook for about 25-30 mins, stirring often to prevent it from sticking, until the polenta has thickened and is coming away from the side of the pan.","Add the butter, cheese, a generous grinding of black pepper and 1 tbsp salt. Whisk to combine. Serve immediately – the polenta will thicken as it cools."]','2026-01-10 12:14:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5035,5035,'en','Chilli cornbread pie','Use gram flour to make the cornbread crust on this chilli pie for a gluten-free dinner. Gram flour also contains more vitamins and minerals than wheat flour','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","2 red onions (320g), finely chopped","2 celery sticks (about 150g), sliced","1 tbsp hot chilli powder","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground cumin","3 garlic cloves, finely grated","500g carton passata","2 x 400g cans three bean salad in water","2 tsp gluten-free vegetable bouillon powder","20g coriander, leaves picked and chopped","50g fine cornmeal","100g gram (chickpea) flour","1 tsp gluten-free baking powder","1 tsp hot chilli powder","1 egg","150ml bio yogurt","50ml milk","50g mature cheddar, coarsely grated","1 small red onion (about 80g), finely chopped","12 pitted Kalamata olives, roughly chopped","4 tsp balsamic vinegar","2 x 198g cans sweetcorn , drained","1 bag mixed leaf salad"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick pan over a medium heat and fry the onions and celery for 8 mins, stirring often. Stir in the spices and garlic, then pour in the passata, bean salad (along with the liquid from the cans) and bouillon. Cover and simmer for 10 mins, then stir in the coriander. Tip into a shallow ovenproof dish and cool slightly.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/ gas 5. Tip the cornmeal, gram flour, baking powder and chilli powder into a bowl and mix well. Beat the egg, yogurt and milk together in a separate bowl, then pour into the dry ingredients and mix to make a batter. Stir in the cheese, then pour this over the bean chilli and bake for 30-35 mins until the cornbread is puffed up and golden. Combine half the ingredients for the corn salad and serve with half the chilli, reserving the rest for another day.The pie will keep covered and chilled for four days. Reheat in themicrowaveuntil piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:14:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5037,5037,'en','One-pot vegan rice and beans','Gluten free and low in fat, this vibrant vegan rice dish is packed with kidney beans, green olives and peppers','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions (320g), finely chopped","1 orange pepper, halved, deseeded and cut into 4-5 chunky pieces","1 red pepper, halved, deseeded and cut into 4-5 chunky pieces","3 large garlic cloves, sliced","300g easy-cook brown rice","1 tbsp thyme leaves","2 tbsp smoked paprika","650ml hot vegetable stock, made with 2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","10 pitted green olives","400g can red kidney beans, drained","½ lemon, cut into wedges"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan over a medium heat and fry the onions for 5 mins, stirring frequently until softened. Add the peppers and garlic and cook for 5 mins more, stirring every now and then.","Tip in the rice, thyme and paprika, then pour in the stock and stir in the olives. Cover and leave to cook over a low heat for 15 mins. Stir in the kidney beans, then cover and cook for 20-30 mins more until the rice is tender. Top with the lemon wedges, then cover and leave for 5 mins. Spoon two portions into bowls and serve. Cool and chill the remainder to eat another day.Will keep chilled for one day. To serve, reheat in a pan or in themicrowaveuntil piping hot (remove the lemon wedges before heating).This recipe is part of our free 7-day healthy diet plan. To access the full meal plan,click here."]','2026-01-10 12:14:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5039,5039,'en','Gluten-free salmon pasta','Use gluten-free pasta to make this creamy salmon and green bean pasta from GF reader Aimee Vivian. It’s ideal for coeliacs or those intolerant to gluten.','["1 gluten-free vegetable stock cube","200g gluten-free pasta, such as penne or fusilli","100g green beans, trimmed","100g smoked salmon, roughly chopped","50g baby spinach","1 spring onion, finely sliced","50g soft cheese (ensure it’s gluten-free)","½-1 lemon, juiced","1 tbsp grated parmesan"]','["Bring a largepanof salted water to the boil, crumble in the stock cube and stir to dissolve. Tip in the pasta and cook following pack instructions, about 8-10 mins. Add the green beans 1 min before the end of the cooking time.","Drain the pasta and green beans, reserving a little of the cooking water. Tip the pasta and beans back into the pan, then stir in the smoked salmon, spinach, spring onion and soft cheese. Add a little of the pasta water to loosen the cheese and create a sauce, then season with salt and freshly ground black pepper. Squeeze in the lemon juice to taste, and stir well. Serve topped with the parmesan."]','2026-01-10 12:14:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5041,5041,'en','Fennel-roasted cauliflower with quinoa','Pile this colourful vegetable quinoa salad onto a plate, top with roasted cauliflower and drizzle over the garlic yogurt for a healthy, gluten-free dinner','["1 large cauliflower, or 2 small ones, separated into florets","1 tbsp fennel seeds","1 tsp coriander seeds","1 tsp smoked paprika","2 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, chopped","2 peppers (mix of red, yellow or orange), chopped","1 courgette, halved lengthways, cored and chopped","1 small garlic clove, crushed","1 lemon, juiced and zested","4 tbsp yogurt","250g quinoa, cooked"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil and cook the cauliflower for 5 mins. Drain and spread out on a surface so any excess water evaporates.","Crush the fennel and coriander seeds using apestle and mortarand mix with the paprika and a pinch of seasoning Put the cauliflower in a large bowl, drizzle with half the olive oil and sprinkle over the spice mix. Toss the florets to fully coat them.","Tip the florets onto abaking trayand space them apart. Put the red onions, peppers and courgettes on a separate baking tray, drizzle with the remaining oil, and cook both for 30-35 mins, turning halfway through so they brown all over and turn slightly crisp in places.","Mix the garlic with lemon juice and stir through the yogurt, adding a little extra water to loosen if needed. Stir the roasted onions, peppers and courgettes into the cooked quinoa along with the lemon zest and a pinch of salt.","Pile the quinoa salad onto a plate, then top with the cauliflower florets. Drizzle over the garlic yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:14:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5043,5043,'en','Spanish meatball & butter bean stew','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis hearty one-pot is full of Mediterranean flavour, with pork, red onion, peppers and smoked paprika – an impressive 4 of your 5 a day','["350g lean pork mince","2 tsp olive oil","1 large red onion, chopped","2 peppers, sliced, any colour will do","3 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp sweet smoked paprika","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","400g can butter beans, drained","2 tsp golden caster sugar","small bunch parsley, chopped","crusty bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Season the pork, working the seasoning in with your hands, then shape into small meatballs. Heat the oil in a large pan, add the meatballs and cook for 5 mins, until golden brown all over. Push to one side of the pan and add the onion and peppers. Cook for a further 5 mins, stirring now and then, until the veg has softened, then stir in the garlic and paprika. Stir everything around in the pan for 1 min, then add the tomatoes. Cover with a lid and simmer for 10 mins.","Uncover, stir in the beans, the sugar and some seasoning, then simmer for a further 10 mins, uncovered. Just before serving, stir in the parsley. Serve with crusty bread for dunking, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:14:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5045,5045,'en','Roasted squash with sour cherries, spiced seeds & feta','Serve this squash or pumpkin dish as a smart vegetarian main or dinner party side, packed with contrasting flavours such as sweet honey, sour cherries and salty crumbled cheese','["1 large or 2 small squash or pumpkins, seeds scooped out and reserved, then cut into chunks or wedges (leave the skin on if it’s not too tough)","2 tbsp olive or rapeseed oil","100ml red wine vinegar","2 tbsp clear honey","100g dried sour cherries","2 tbsp toasted sesame oil","bunch mint, leaves picked","100g feta, crumbled","100g pumpkin seeds (if you don’t have enough from your pumpkin, add seeds from a packet)","1 tbsp sesame seeds","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp coriander","good pinch of ground allspice","2 tsp olive or rapeseed oil"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a large baking tray with baking parchment. Arrange the squash or pumpkin wedges on the tray and drizzle with oil. Season well, put in the oven and roast for 35-45 mins or until tender (different varieties will take varying amounts of time, so check by pressing the flesh with a knife – it should be very tender when cooked).","Meanwhile, prepare the spiced seeds. Wash and dry the seeds from your squash, removing any stringy bits. Mix the seeds, spices and oil on another baking tray lined with baking parchment, season well and toss together. Put on the shelf below the squash and roast together for the final 10 mins, stirring now and then, until toasted.","Put the vinegar, honey and cherries in a small pan. Simmer gently for 2-3 mins until the cherries are plump and the dressing has reduced by half. Stir in a pinch of salt and the sesame oil, remove from the heat and leave to cool for 10 mins.","To serve, arrange a layer of warm wedges on a platter. Drizzle over the syrupy dressing and cherries, the seeds and mint leaves. Finally, scatter with feta."]','2026-01-10 12:14:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5047,5047,'en','Persian lamb tagine','This warming stew is spiced with cinnamon and cumin, and sweetened with apricots and dates – perfect with fluffy couscous','["2kg lamb neck fillets","5 tbsp mild olive oil or sunflower oil","3 medium onions, cut into thin wedges","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","4 tsp ground cumin","4 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp hot chilli powder","1 tsp ground turmeric","large pinch of saffron","2 cinnamon sticks","2 preserved lemons (from a jar), drained and cut into thin wedges","300g ready-to-eat dried apricots","250g ready-to-eat dried pitted dates","100g shelled pistachios","2 tsp rosewater","25g cornflour","small bunch coriander, leaves roughly chopped","cooked couscous or basmati rice, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Trim the lamb of any hard fat, cut into chunks and season all over. Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large flameproof casserole dish and brown the lamb in 3-4 batches over a high heat for 1-2 mins until lightly coloured. Add 1 tbsp more oil between each batch and transfer to a bowl each time a batch is browned.","Heat the remaining oil in the same dish over a medium heat and fry the onions for 5 mins or until softened and lightly coloured. Stir in the garlic, cumin, coriander, chilli powder, turmeric, 1 tsp ground black pepper and 1 tsp flaked sea salt. Cook for 1 min, stirring. Return the lamb to the dish and add 1.5 litres of water, the saffron, cinnamon and lemons. Bring to a simmer, stirring a few times. Cover with a lid and transfer to the oven. Cook for 1 hr.","Carefully remove the dish from the oven and stir in the apricots, dates and half the pistachios, then cover once more and return to the oven. Cook for a further 30 mins or until the lamb is very tender.","Transfer the dish to the hob and adjust the seasoning to taste. Mix the cornflour with the rosewater and 3 tbsp cold water, then stir into the tagine. Cook over a medium heat for 1-2 mins or until the sauce thickens. (Thickening the sauce with cornflour isn’t traditional but helps the tagine to freeze more successfully.) When ready to serve, roughly chop the remaining nuts and sprinkle over the top. Garnish with coriander and serve with couscous or rice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5049,5049,'en','Salmon with new potato & corn salad & basil dressing','A no-fuss fish supper made with healthy yet satisfying ingredients, to help you eat well all week','["400g baby new potatoes","2 sweetcorn cobs","4 skinless salmon fillets","2 very large tomatoes, like beefsteak","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 shallot, finely chopped","1 tbsp capers, finely chopped","handful basil leaves"]','["Cook potatoes in boiling water until\r\ntender, adding corn for final 5 mins,\r\nthen drain and allow to cool a little.","For the dressing, mix the vinegar, oil,\r\nshallot, capers, basil and some seasoning.","Heat grill to high. Rub a little dressing\r\non the salmon and cook, skinned-side\r\ndown, for 7-8 mins. Slice tomatoes and\r\nplace on a serving plate. Slice the potatoes,\r\ncut the corn from the cobs and arrange\r\nover the tomatoes. Top with the salmon,\r\nthen drizzle over the remaining dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:15:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5051,5051,'en','Fresh topped pizza','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis gluten-free pizza is sure to become a family favourite','["200g gluten-free flour","½ salt","2 tbsp olive oil","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp chopped rosemary","1 tsp ground black pepper","125-150ml warm water","210g jar tomatoes bruschetta topping (we used Napolina)","140g mozzarella, thickly sliced","½ avocado, thickly sliced","70g pack rocket","cherry tomato, halved","4 slices Parma ham","4 slices ham","olive oil","balsamic vinegar"]','["Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Put the flour, salt, olive oil, yeast, rosemary and pepper into a food processor. Pulse until well mixed. With the motor running, add enough water to bring the flour to a soft, but not sticky dough. Tip onto a work surface and knead until it comes together.","Halve the dough. If you only have one shelf in your oven and are cooking in batches, wrap one half in cling film. Roll out each half directly onto lightly oiled baking sheets into very thin 25cm/10in rounds. Do not form a rim at the edge. Spread the tomato topping over each piece of dough, almost to the edge. Leave to stand for 15 mins. Bake in the hot oven for 12-15 mins or until the dough is crisp.","Lift each round onto a plate and serve warm. Pass the toppings around and let each diner assemble their own pizza."]','2026-01-10 12:15:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5052,5052,'en','Zingy radish salad','Fiery radishes add crunch to this zesty smoked salmon salad','["2 oranges","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","½ small red onion, thinly sliced","200g bag radishes, thinly sliced","200g smoked salmon","75g bag watercress","brown bread, to serve"]','["Segment the oranges over a salad\r\nbowl, allowing the segments and any\r\njuice to fall into the bowl. Stir in the\r\nvinegar, onion and radishes, add some\r\nseasoning and allow to stand for 5 mins.","Divide the smoked salmon between 4\r\nplates. Toss the watercress through the\r\nradish mix, then put a handful on top of\r\nthe salmon, making sure you have a\r\nbit of everything on each plate. Serve\r\nwith any juices from the bowl poured\r\nover, and some brown bread if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5053,5053,'en','Mushroom-stuffed chicken with lemon thyme risotto','Ever tried risotto as a side dish? It’s perfect with these chicken breasts with a rich porcini stuffing','["25g dried porcini mushrooms, soaked in 250ml water for 30 mins, soaking liquid reserved","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","150g pack baby button mushrooms, finely chopped","2 thyme sprigs or lemon thyme sprigs, leaves removed and chopped","175ml white wine","4 skin-on chicken breasts","1 tbsp butter","1 tbsp olive oil","2 celery sticks, finely chopped","1 small onion, finely chopped","140g risotto rice","600ml hot chicken stock","2 thyme sprigs or lemon thyme sprigs, leaves removed and chopped","juice and zest ½ lemon","50g parmesan, grated, plus 1 tbsp extra to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.\r\nFirst, make the stuffing. Finely chop the\r\nsoaked porcini and set aside. Heat the oil\r\nin a shallow pan, then gently cook the\r\nonion for 5 mins, stirring occasionally.\r\nAdd the porcini, button mushrooms and\r\nthyme leaves, season, turn the heat up,\r\nthen cook for another 5 mins until the\r\nmushrooms have softened.","Add the wine to the pan, then reduce\r\nfiercely until nearly dry. Add 50ml of the\r\nporcini soaking liquid, then continue to\r\nreduce for a couple of mins until you\r\nhave a syrupy sauce. Allow to cool for\r\na couple of mins, then carefully spoon\r\nbetween the skin and the flesh of the\r\nchicken breasts. Can be made a day\r\nahead and chilled, or frozen for 1 month.\r\nDefrost in fridge before cooking. Season,\r\nplace on a baking tray, skin-side up, then\r\ncook in the oven for 20 mins, until the\r\nchicken is cooked through and golden.","While the chicken is cooking, make\r\nthe risotto. Heat the butter and olive oil\r\nin a saucepan. Add the celery and onion,\r\nthen cook over a medium heat for 5 mins\r\nuntil softened. Add the rice, coat it well\r\nin the oil, then cook for 1 min. Gradually\r\nadd the stock a ladleful at a time, stirring\r\nwith each addition until absorbed.\r\nContinue adding the stock and stirring\r\nuntil the risotto is oozing and thick –\r\nabout 20 mins. Stir in the thyme, lemon\r\njuice, zest and Parmesan.","When the chicken is cooked through\r\nand golden, remove from the oven.\r\nSpoon the risotto onto serving plates,\r\nsprinkle with the extra Parmesan and\r\ntop with a chicken breast. Spoon over\r\nthe juices from the chicken pan, then\r\nserve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:15:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5055,5055,'en','Rump steak with quick mushroom and red wine sauce','Make a restaurant-style sauce for your steak in 15 minutes – perfect with creamy mash','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","2 rump steaks (about 200g/8oz each)","140g mushrooms, quartered","2 thyme sprigs, leaves removed","150ml red wine","1 tbsp butter"]','["Heat the oil in a pan. Season the steaks,\r\nthen fry for 2-3 mins each side for medium\r\nrare, or cook more to your liking. Remove\r\nfrom the pan, then set aside to rest.","Add the mushrooms and thyme leaves\r\nto the pan, then cook for a couple of mins\r\nuntil softened and golden. Pour in the\r\nwine and bubble until syrupy, then turn\r\noff the heat and stir in the butter. Season.","Serve the steaks with the mushroom\r\nsauce poured over, along with creamy\r\nmash and some crunchy spring greens."]','2026-01-10 12:15:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5057,5057,'en','Moroccan spiced fish with ginger mash','Spice up white fish fillets with a flavoured butter and serve with fluffy sweet potato mash','["2 large sweet potatoes, peeled and cut into chunks","2 tsp butter, softened","1 garlic clove, crushed","½ -1 tsp harissa (Belazu is good)","zest 1 lemon","small handful coriander, most chopped, rest left whole","fingertip-size piece fresh root ginger, finely grated","2 skinless white fish fillets (look for sustainably caught)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.\r\nCook the sweet potatoes in boiling, salted\r\nwater for about 10 mins or until just tender\r\nwhen pierced with a knife. Meanwhile, mix\r\ntogether the butter with the garlic, harissa,\r\nlemon zest, chopped coriander and some\r\nseasoning. When the potatoes are ready,\r\ndrain thoroughly, mash with the ginger and\r\nseasoning, then keep warm.","Place the fish in a roasting tin, season,\r\nthen spread half the flavoured butter over\r\neach fillet. Roast for about 8 mins until just\r\ncooked through. Serve with the ginger mash\r\nand some green veg."]','2026-01-10 12:15:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5059,5059,'en','Rosemary chicken with tomato sauce','This Italian-style casserole will warm you up, and it’s great value too','["1 tbsp olive oil","8 boneless, skinless chicken thighs","1 rosemary sprig, leaves finely chopped","1 red onion, finely sliced","3 garlic cloves, sliced","2 anchovy fillets, chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp capers, drained","capers with 75ml water"]','["Heat half the oil in a non-stick pan, then\r\nbrown the chicken all over. Add half the\r\nchopped rosemary, stir to coat, then\r\nset aside on a plate.","In the same pan, heat the rest of the oil,\r\nthen gently cook the onion for about 5 mins\r\nuntil soft. Add the garlic, anchovies and\r\nremaining rosemary, then fry for a few mins\r\nmore until fragrant. Pour in the tomatoes\r\nand capers with the wine, if using, or 75ml\r\nwater if not. Bring to the boil, then return the\r\nchicken pieces to the pan. Cover, then cook\r\nfor 20 mins until the chicken is cooked\r\nthrough. Season and serve with a crisp green\r\nsalad and crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:15:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5061,5061,'en','Courgette & quinoa-stuffed peppers','Take just 5 ingredients and create this healthy Mediterranean-style vegetarian bake for a low-calorie, low-fat supper','["4 red peppers","1 courgette, quartered lengthways and thinly sliced","2 x 250g packs ready-to-eat quinoa","85g feta cheese, finely crumbled","handful parsley, roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nCut each pepper in half through the\r\nstem, and remove the seeds. Put the\r\npeppers, cut-side up, on a baking sheet,\r\ndrizzle with 1 tbsp olive oil and season\r\nwell. Roast for 15 mins.","Meanwhile, heat 1 tsp olive oil in\r\na small frying pan, add the courgette\r\nand cook until soft. Remove from the\r\nheat, then stir through the quinoa,\r\nfeta and parsley. Season with pepper.","Divide the quinoa mixture between\r\nthe pepper halves, then return to the\r\noven for 5 mins to heat through. Serve\r\nwith a green salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5063,5063,'en','Stem ginger & squash steamed pudding','The secret of Jodie Montgomery-Cranny’s delicious gluten-free dessert is grated butternut squash','["butter, for greasing","3 balls stem ginger from a jar, finely chopped, plus 4-6 tbsp syrup from the jar","3 large eggs","200g golden caster sugar","200g peeled and finely grated butternut squash","zest 1 large lemon","175g rice flour","50g ground almonds","2 tsp ground ginger","2 tsp baking powder"]','["Lightly butter a 1.5-litre pudding basin.\r\nPut one-third of the stem ginger and all\r\nthe ginger syrup in the bottom. Set aside.","In a bowl, beat the eggs and sugar with\r\nan electric whisk until pale and fluffy.\r\nFold in the butternut squash, lemon zest\r\nand the remaining stem ginger. Fold the\r\ndry ingredients into the egg mixture with\r\na large metal spoon until well combined.","Fill the basin with the sponge mixture.\r\nCover with a layer of buttered baking\r\nparchment and foil, making a pleat in\r\nthe centre to allow the pudding to rise.\r\nTie on securely with string, then put in\r\na steamer or large pan with an upturned\r\nbowl in the bottom. Add boiling water to come halfway up the sides of the basin,\r\ncover with a lid and simmer for 1½ hrs.\r\nCheck the water level every now and\r\nthen, and top up if you need to.","To test when the sponge is ready, insert\r\na skewer into the centre. It should come\r\nout clean with no trace of raw mixture.\r\nUnwrap and serve hot."]','2026-01-10 12:15:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5065,5065,'en','Baked polenta with spinach & goat’s cheese','This Italian vegetarian recipe is smart enough for a dinner party, but has just six ingredients','["3 garlic cloves, chopped","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","300g fresh spinach","500g pack ready-made polenta","1 tbsp olive oil","100g goat''s cheese with rind, broken into chunks"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and\r\nboil the kettle. In a bowl, mix the garlic\r\nand tomatoes with seasoning, then pour\r\ninto a large baking dish. Place the spinach\r\nin a large colander and pour boiling water\r\nover until wilted. Rinse in cold water and\r\nsqueeze out all the excess water you can\r\nwith your hands. Roughly chop, season,\r\nand scatter on top of the tomatoes.","Slice the polenta, then overlap on top\r\nof the spinach. Drizzle with the oil and\r\nbake in the oven for 10-15 mins. Scatter\r\nover the cheese and return to the oven\r\nfor 5 mins more, or until the cheese is\r\ngolden and bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:15:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5067,5067,'en','Quinoa salad with grilled halloumi','Try this easy veggie salad for a great source of iron and enjoy as a light lunch or supper. It uses gluten-free quinoa for an extra dose of protein','["3 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 small red onion, sliced","1 large roasted pepper from a jar, thickly sliced, or a handful of ready-roasted sliced peppers","200g quinoa","500ml vegetable stock","small bunch flat-leaf parsley, roughly chopped","zest and juice 1 lemon","large pinch sugar","250g pack halloumi cheese, cut into 6 sliced"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a medium\r\nsaucepan. Cook the onion and pepper for\r\na few mins, then add the quinoa\r\nand cook for a further 3 mins. Add the\r\nstock, cover and turn the heat down\r\nto a simmer. Cook for 15 mins or until\r\nsoft, then stir through half the parsley.\r\nHeat the grill.","Meanwhile, mix the lemon zest and\r\njuice with the remaining parsley and\r\noil, and a large pinch of sugar and salt.\r\nGrill the halloumi until both sides are\r\ngolden and crisp. Serve the salad with\r\nthe grilled halloumi and the dressing\r\npoured over everything."]','2026-01-10 12:15:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5069,5069,'en','Pulled lamb shoulder with sticky pomegranate glaze','Cooking the meat really slowly in fruit juice makes it meltingly tender, and the juices double up as a sweet glaze','["4 garlic cloves, chopped","2 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tbsp dried oregano","1 lemon, quartered, pips removed","1½ kg bone-in lamb shoulder joint","2 red onions, cut into wedges","1l carton pomegranate juice","2 tbsp clear honey","250g natural yogurt","100g tub pomegranate seeds, or seeds from 1 fresh pomegranate","small handful mint leaves, chopped"]','["Put the garlic, cinnamon, cumin,\r\noregano and lemon in a blender with\r\n1 tsp salt and 2 tsp black pepper. Blend\r\nuntil smooth. Put the lamb in a large\r\nroasting tin and tip the marinade over the\r\ntop. Massage all over the lamb and leave\r\nfor 24 hrs in the fridge, or up to 2 days.","Remove lamb from the fridge 1 hr before\r\ncooking. Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/\r\ngas 3. Scatter the onions around the\r\nlamb, tucking some underneath, then\r\npour over the pomegranate juice. Cover\r\nthe lamb with foil and cook for 4 hrs.","Remove the foil, carefully pour the\r\nmeaty pomegranate juices from the tin\r\ninto a large saucepan and add the honey.\r\nIncrease oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7,\r\nre-cover the lamb and continue cooking for\r\n30 mins. Meanwhile, bubble the cooking\r\nliquid over a high heat until reduced, thick\r\nand syrupy – this may take up to 30 mins.","Pour the sticky pomegranate glaze over\r\nthe lamb and onions and return to the\r\noven for another 30 mins, uncovered,\r\nuntil the glaze is bubbling and just\r\nstarting to char, and the lamb is really\r\ntender. Mix the yogurt, most of the\r\npomegranate seeds and mint leaves in\r\na small bowl. Shred the lamb at the table\r\nand serve with the sticky onions and the\r\nminty pomegranate yogurt. Scatter over\r\nthe remaining pomegranate seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:15:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5071,5071,'en','Garlicky green beans','A simple sauté of fresh beans with lightly fried garlic and a touch of olive oil makes a healthy, versatile side','["300g green beans, trimmed","2 garlic cloves, sliced","2 tbsp olive oil"]','["Cook the green beans in boiling water\r\nfor 2-3 mins until just tender, then drain\r\nwell and steam-dry for a min.","Meanwhile, gently fry the garlic in the\r\noil until pale golden – no further. Toss\r\nwith the beans, season and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5073,5073,'en','Herby fondant potatoes','Trim your spuds, fry whole, then simmer with stock, rosemary, thyme and lemon to create a perfectly tender side dish','["1½ kg small floury potatoes, like Desirée or Maris Piper, peeled","4 tbsp olive oil","3 garlic cloves, bashed","3 thyme sprigs","3 lemon thyme sprigs","2 rosemary sprigs","3 bay leaves","pared zest 1 lemon, peeled with a vegetable peeler","about 600ml gluten- and wheat-free chicken or vegetable stock (check the label)"]','["Trim the top and bottom of each potato\r\nso that they lie flat on both sides. Heat\r\nthe oil in a large frying pan or flameproof\r\ncasserole and fry the potatoes on both\r\nsides until dark golden, 10-15 mins.","Poke in the garlic, thyme, rosemary,\r\nbay leaves and zest, then pour in enough\r\nstock to go halfway up the side of the\r\npotatoes. Simmer for 20-30 mins, then\r\nturn the potatoes and cook the other side\r\nfor a further 20-30 mins, topping up with\r\nmore stock if it evaporates. Continue\r\ncooking until the potatoes are really\r\ntender and most of the stock has gone.\r\nSeason well and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5075,5075,'en','Rosemary roast lamb chops','This one-pan lamb chops supper only requires some quick assembling – pack in the Mediterranean flavours then let the oven do the work','["3 tbsp olive oil","8 lamb chops","1kg potatoes, chopped into small chunks","4 rosemary sprigs","4 garlic cloves, left whole","250g cherry tomatoes","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar"]','["Turn the oven to fan 200C/\r\nconventional 220C/gas 7. Heat half\r\nthe oil in a flameproof roasting tin or\r\novenproof sauté pan. Brown the lamb\r\nfor 2 minutes on each side, then lift out\r\nof the pan and set aside. Add the rest\r\nof the oil to the pan, add the potatoes,\r\nthen fry for 4-5 minutes, until starting\r\nto brown. Add the rosemary and garlic,\r\nthen return the lamb to the pan, too.","Roast in the oven for 20 minutes,\r\nthen scatter over the tomatoes and\r\ndrizzle with the balsamic vinegar. Place\r\nback in the oven for 5 minutes, until the\r\ntomatoes just begin to split. Remove\r\nfrom the oven and serve straight\r\nfrom the dish."]','2026-01-10 12:15:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5077,5077,'en','Sticky chicken with sherry, almonds & dates','Tender roasted chicken legs coated in a lip-smacking glaze – ideal for feeding a crowd','["3 tbsp olive oil","8 chicken legs","2 medium onions, chopped","15 garlic cloves, left whole in skin","1 tsp ground cumin","250ml sherry, such as Oloroso or Manzanilla","zest and juice 1 lemon, plus extra zest to serve","50g whole blanched almonds (we used Marcona), roughly chopped","12 large soft dates, chopped","20g pack flat-leaf parsley, roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.\r\nHeat 1 tbsp of the olive oil in a large frying\r\npan. Season the chicken, then brown on\r\nall sides. Remove the chicken, place it in\r\na large baking dish, then set aside. Add the\r\nremaining oil, the onions and garlic to the\r\npan, then season. Fry for 10 mins until\r\ngolden. Stir in the cumin, sherry and lemon\r\nzest and juice. Bring to the boil, then add\r\nthe almonds, dates and half the parsley.","Pour the sauce over the chicken. Cover\r\nwith foil, then roast for 1 hr until tender,\r\ntaking the foil off after 15 mins. Spoon the\r\nliquid over the chicken a couple of times\r\nduring roasting. Serve piled up on a large\r\nplatter with the sauce poured over, the\r\ngarlic cloves, remaining parsley and some\r\nextra lemon zest."]','2026-01-10 12:15:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5079,5079,'en','Whole roast bream with potatoes & olives','Roasting the fish along with the potatoes means all the lovely flavours mingle','["400g new or small potatoes","large handful small black olives","1 garlic clove, chopped","large bunch flat-leaf parsley, leaves roughly chopped, stalks reserved","2 tbsp olive oil","zest half a lemon","1 whole sea bream, about 450g/1lb, gutted, head on","small glass white wine"]','["Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7.\r\nCook the potatoes in boiling water for about\r\n10 mins, cut into thick slices, then cool. In a\r\nbowl, toss the potatoes with the olives, garlic,\r\nhalf the chopped parsley, half the olive oil,\r\nthe lemon zest and salt and pepper. Tip this\r\nmix over the bottom of a medium gratin dish.","Season the fish and place the parsley stalks\r\nin the cavity. Lay the fish on top of the potatoes\r\nand drizzle with the rest of the olive oil. Bake\r\nfor 15 mins until the potatoes start to crisp up\r\naround the edges. Pour the wine over, then\r\nreturn to the oven for 10 mins more until the\r\npotatoes have browned and the fish is cooked.","Remove the dish from the oven, scatter over\r\nthe rest of the parsley and bring the dish to the\r\ntable. When you serve up, don’t forget the\r\nlovely white wine juices in the bottom of the\r\ndish. Delicious with a simple bowl of spinach."]','2026-01-10 12:15:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5081,5081,'en','Skinny chicken Caesar salad','Makeover the typically heavy Caesar dressing by swapping mayonnaise for Greek yogurt – low in fat and calories, but still deliciously creamy','["4 skinless chicken breasts","2 tsp olive oil","juice 1 lemon","1 large Romaine or Cos lettuce, chopped into large pieces","1 punnet salad cress","4 hard-boiled eggs, peeled and quartered","25g Parmesan, finely grated","50g anchovies fillets, half chopped, half left whole","170g pot fat-free Greek yogurt"]','["Put the chicken breasts in a large bowl with the olive oil and 1 tbsp lemon juice, then season. Heat the grill to high. Put the chicken breasts on a foil-lined tray and cook under the grill for 10-12 mins until golden and cooked through, turning once during cooking. Transfer to a plate or board and slice.","Arrange the lettuce, cress and eggs on a platter or serving plates and top with the cooked chicken. Mix together the Parmesan, chopped anchovies, yogurt and remaining lemon juice, season to taste and pour over the salad. Arrange the whole anchovy fillets on top of each salad."]','2026-01-10 12:15:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5083,5083,'en','Kale & goat’s cheese frittata','This filled omelette, with red onions, curly kale and goat’s cheese, is vegetarian, gluten-free and quick enough to make midweek','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 red onions, thinly sliced","200g chopped curly kale","2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","8 large eggs, lightly beaten with a little seasoning","100g firm goat''s cheese, broken into chunks"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Heat the oil in a 25cm ovenproof frying pan. Add the onions and cook for 10-15 mins until soft and caramelised. Add the kale and 1 tbsp water, and cook for 5 mins until the kale has wilted. Pour in the balsamic vinegar and bubble for 1 min, then add the eggs. Give everything a quick stir, then leave undisturbed to cook over a low-medium heat for 5 mins until the egg is nearly set and the frittata is turning golden brown on the bottom.","Scatter the goat’s cheese over the top of the frittata. Cook in the oven for 10-15 mins until the cheese is bubbling and the frittata is set in the centre."]','2026-01-10 12:15:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5085,5085,'en','Potato salad with anchovy & quail’s eggs','This healthy, satisfying salad makes a tasty packed lunch or light supper with green beans, parsley, chives and lemon','["4 quail''s eggs","100g green beans","100g new potatoes, halved or quartered if very large","1 anchovy, finely chopped","1 tbsp chopped parsley","1 tbsp chopped chives","juice ½  lemon"]','["Bring a medium pan of water to a simmer. Lower the quail’s eggs into the water and cook for 2 mins. Lift out the eggs with a slotted spoon and put into a bowl of cold water. Add the beans to the pan, simmer for 4 mins until tender, then remove from the pan with a slotted spoon and plunge into the bowl of cold water.","Put the potatoes in the pan and boil for 10-15 mins until tender. Drain the potatoes in a colander and leave them to cool. While the potatoes are cooling, peel the eggs and cut them in half. Toss the potatoes and beans with the chopped anchovy, herbs and lemon juice. Top with the quail’s eggs to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5087,5087,'en','Super-green mackerel salad','Green beans, spinach and broccoli make a great base for a healthy lunchbox treat with oily fish and yogurt dressing','["85g green beans","85g thin-stemmed broccoli","large handful baby spinach leaves","2 hot-smoked mackerel fillets (about 75g), skinned and flaked","2 tsp sunflower seeds, toasted","75ml low-fat natural yogurt","1 tsp lemon juice","1 tsp wholegrain mustard","2 tsp dill, chopped, plus extra to serve"]','["Boil a pan of water. Add the green\r\nbeans and cook for 2 mins, then add\r\nthe broccoli and cook for 4 mins more.\r\nDrain, run under cold water until cool,\r\nthen drain well.","To make the dressing, combine all\r\nthe ingredients in a small jam jar with\r\na twist of black pepper, put the lid on\r\nand give it a good shake.","To serve, mix together the cooked\r\nveg with the spinach and mackerel and\r\npack into a lunchbox. Just before eating,\r\npour over the dressing, scatter over the\r\nsunflower seeds and add a grind of black\r\npepper and extra dill."]','2026-01-10 12:15:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5089,5089,'en','Goat’s cheese & watercress quiche','A goat’s cheese and watercress quiche that’s gluten-free and truly flavoursome','["225g gluten-free flour, plus extra for rolling","100g butter","1 large egg, beaten, plus extra beaten egg for brushing","1 medium onion, finely chopped","1 tbsp oil","100g watercress, roughly chopped","2 large eggs","150ml milk","150ml log soft rindless goat''s cheese, in rough chunks","freshly grated nutmeg, optional"]','["Put the flour and a pinch of salt in a large bowl. Rub in the butter until the mixture looks like breadcrumbs. Stir in the egg and about 1-2 tbsp water to form a soft dough. Knead well then wrap and chill for at least 30 minutes.","Preheat the oven to 200C/gas 6/fan 180C. Knead the pastry again and roll it out to line a 20cm loose-bottomed flan tin (the pastry won’t shrink, so no need to chill). Patch holes with spare pastry and brush the base and sides with egg.","For the filling, fry the onion in the oil until just soft, add the watercress and cook until just wilted. Beat the eggs and milk and stir in the watercress mixture and goat''s cheese.","Season and if you like, add a pinch of nutmeg. Put the flan tin on a bakingsheet and bake the pastry blind for 5 minutes. Add the filling and bake for 15 minutes. Reduce heat to 180C/gas 4/ fan 160C and cook for 25-30 minutes or until lightly set."]','2026-01-10 12:15:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5091,5091,'en','Lentil, carrot & ham salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyUse pulses as the base for your sweet mustard-dressed salad to create a healthy lunch that’s full of fibre and vitamin C','["250g ham, shredded","400g can lentils, drained","2 carrots, finely diced","4 celery sticks, finely diced","handful parsley, finely chopped","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","good pinch sugar","1 tsp wholegrain mustard"]','["Combine the salad ingredients in a\r\nlarge mixing bowl. To make the dressing,\r\nwhisk together the ingredients with\r\n1 tbsp water and some seasoning.\r\nPour the dressing over the salad and\r\nstir well to combine."]','2026-01-10 12:15:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5093,5093,'en','Mediterranean feta salad with pomegranate dressing','Middle Eastern pomegranate molasses gives this salad a delicious tang','["2 red peppers","3 medium aubergines, cut into chunks, or 15 small, halved","6 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","tsp cinnamon","200g green beans, blanched (use frozen if you can)","1 small red onion, sliced into half moons","200g feta cheese, drained and crumbled","seeds 1 pomegranate","handful parsley, roughly chopped","1 small garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp lemon juice","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses","5 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Heat\r\nthe grill to its highest setting. Cut the peppers\r\ninto quarters, then place them, skin-side up,\r\non a baking sheet. Grill until blackened.\r\nPlace in a plastic bag, seal, then leave for\r\n5 mins. When cool enough to handle, scrape\r\nskins off, discard, then set the peppers aside.","Place the aubergines on a baking tray,\r\ndrizzle with olive oil and cinnamon, then\r\nseason with salt and pepper. Roast until\r\ngolden and softened – about 25 mins.","Meanwhile, combine all the dressing\r\ningredients and mix well. To serve, place the\r\naubergines, green beans, onion and peppers\r\non a large serving plate. Scatter with the feta\r\nand pomegranate seeds. Pour the dressing\r\nover, then finish with the parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:15:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5095,5095,'en','Warm artichoke & asparagus summer salad','This dish is all about vegetables at the peak of their season','["4 artichokes, trimmed","2 lemons, halved","3 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp coriander seeds","1 star anise","large thyme sprig","4 tbsp white wine vinegar","large bunch (about 30) asparagus spears","4 handfuls small salad leaves such as micro-leaves","5 tbsp olive oil","1 small red onion, finely chopped","2 spring onions, finely sliced","small bunch chives, finely snipped","2 tbsp balsamic vinegar (I like to use white balsamic vinegar)"]','["When the artichokes are trimmed,\r\nfind a pan wide enough to hold\r\nthem in a single layer. Squeeze in\r\njuice from a lemon half and half-fill with\r\ncold water. Add 2 tbsp olive oil, the\r\nspices, thyme, vinegar, artichokes and a\r\ngenerous pinch of salt. Bring to the boil,\r\nthen lower the heat and simmer for\r\nabout 15 mins until soft. Turn off the heat\r\nand allow to cool (see tips, below).","Prepare the asparagus. First,\r\ncut off the woody ends, then\r\nuse a swivel blade peeler to trim\r\nthe ends, rotating them as you go so they\r\nend up the same thickness as the tips.","Bring a large pan of salted\r\nwater to a rolling boil. Cook the\r\nasparagus for 2 mins, then drain\r\nand tip straight into heavily iced water.\r\nLeave until completely cool, drain again,\r\nthen set aside.","To make the dressing, heat\r\n2 tbsp olive oil in a frying pan ,\r\nthen gently cook the red onion\r\nfor 5 mins until soft. Turn off the heat\r\nstir in the spring onion and chives, then\r\ntip into a jug. Drizzle the rest of the oil\r\nand the vinegar into the dressing, then\r\nseason to taste.","Get the vegetables ready. Drain\r\nthe artichokes, then cut each into\r\n6 wedges. Slice each asparagus\r\non the angle into 3 pieces.","Wipe out the dressing pan\r\nand heat the remaining olive\r\noil. Fry the asparagus with some\r\nseasoning until shiny and starting to\r\ncolour, then scoop onto a plate. Place\r\nthe pan back on the heat, then cook\r\nthe artichoke wedges until they start\r\nto brown. Turn off the heat and you\r\nare ready to plate up.","Spoon a puddle of dressing into\r\nthe centre of each plate. Balance the pieces of asparagus\r\nup against each other to circle\r\nthe dressing. Arrange the artichokes among\r\nthe asparagus so they’re evenly\r\ndistributed over the plate. Scatter over the salad leaves and\r\ndrizzle over the remaining dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:15:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5097,5097,'en','Spicy tuna & cottage cheese jacket','For a low-fat energy lunch try a carbohydrate-heavy baked potato with a light and nutritious filling','["225g can tuna, drained","½ red chilli, chopped","1 spring onion, sliced","handful halved cherry tomatoes","½ small bunch coriander, chopped","1 medium-sized jacket potato","150g low-fat cottage cheese"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/Gas 4/fan oven 160C. Prick the potato several times with a fork and put it straight onto a shelf in the hottest part of the oven. Bake for approximately 1 hour, or until it is soft inside.","Mix tuna with chilli, spring onion, cherry\r\ntomatoes and coriander. Split jacket\r\npotato and fill with the tuna mix and\r\ncottage cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:15:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5099,5099,'en','Toasted cumin flatbreads','A gluten-free bread recipe, ideal as a lunchtime snack with some dips','["400g gluten-free self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting (we used Doves)","1 tbsp cumin seeds, toasted","300ml natural yogurt"]','["Heat the grill to medium and dust\r\na baking sheet with a little flour. Mix the\r\nflour and cumin seeds in a bowl, then\r\nseason. Stir in the yogurt and 100ml\r\nwater, then mix well to form a soft dough.","Divide the dough into 8 equal pieces,\r\nthen shape into circles or ovals about\r\n½cm thick. Dust lightly with a little flour.\r\nGrill on the baking sheet for 3-5 mins\r\non each side until golden and puffed.\r\nServe warm."]','2026-01-10 12:15:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5101,5101,'en','Gluten-free sundried tomato bread','A quick, gluten-free bread recipe – no need for yeast, ready in under an hour','["200g gluten-free white flour (Doves Farm is available at most supermarkets)","1 tsp salt","3 tsp gluten-free baking powder","284ml buttermilk (or same amount of whole milk with a squeeze of lemon juice)","3 eggs","1 tsp tomato purée","2 tbsp olive oil","50g sundried tomatoes in oil (about 6-8), coarsely chopped","25g parmesan (or vegetarian parmazano), grated"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Mix the flour, salt and baking powder in a large bowl. In\r\na separate bowl, whisk together the buttermilk, eggs, tomato purée and oil. Fold the wet ingredients into the dry, then add the sundried tomatoes and half the Parmesan.","Grease a 900g loaf tin and pour in the mixture. Sprinkle the remaining Parmesan on top and bake for 50-60 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Turn out onto a wire rack to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:15:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5103,5103,'en','Rice noodles with sundried tomatoes, Parmesan & basil','A great gluten-free alternative to pasta. Look out for wheat-free soba noodles too','["250g medium rice noodles","85g sundried tomatoes plus 2 tbsp of their oil","3 garlic cloves","25g parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), shaved or grated","large handful basil leaves, torn"]','["Prepare the noodles according to pack\r\ninstructions, then drain. Heat the oil, then\r\nfry the tomatoes and garlic for 3 mins.\r\nToss the noodles and most of the cheese\r\nand basil into the pan, season, then scatter\r\nover the remaining cheese and basil."]','2026-01-10 12:15:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5105,5105,'en','Spicy tuna quinoa salad','Ready-to-eat pouches of grain mean you can have a healthy lunch in minutes – mix with veg and sustainable fish','["1 onion, sliced","350g peppers, sliced","1 tbsp olive oil","1 red chilli, finely chopped","225g pouch ready-to-eat quinoa","350g cherry tomatoes, halved","handful black olives, chopped","225g jar albacore tuna in olive oil, flaked"]','["Fry the onion and peppers in the oil\r\nuntil soft. Add the chilli and cool slightly.","Mix the quinoa, onion mixture, cherry\r\ntomatoes, olives and tuna together. Divide\r\nbetween 4 plates, pour over a little of the\r\noil from the tuna jar, season and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5107,5107,'en','Mackerel & potato salad with lemon caraway dressing','Pack your lunchbox with omega-3 rich smoked fish, new potatoes, beetroot and a light citrus dressing','["175g small new potatoes","200g smoked mackerel fillets, skin removed","4 spring onions, finely sliced","140g small cooked beetroot, sliced into wedges","small bunch dill, finely chopped","2 tbsp olive oil","juice 1 lemon, zest of half","¼ tsp caraway seeds"]','["Place the potatoes in a small\r\nsaucepan of boiling water and simmer\r\nfor 15 mins or until fork-tender. Cool\r\nand cut into thick slices.","Flake the mackerel into a bowl\r\nand add the cooled potatoes, spring\r\nonions, beetroot and dill.","In a separate bowl, whisk together the\r\nolive oil, lemon juice, caraway seeds and\r\nsome seasoning. Pour over the salad\r\nand toss everything well to coat. Scatter\r\nover the lemon zest. Pack into plastic\r\ncontainers and chill, or eat straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:15:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5109,5109,'en','Griddled chicken with quinoa Greek salad','A light dish of grilled chicken fillets and authentic salad with Kalamata olives, feta cheese, tomato and mint','["225g quinoa","25g butter","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","400g chicken mini fillets","1½  tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","300g vine tomatoes, roughly chopped","handful pitted black kalamata olives","1 red onion, finely sliced","100g feta cheese, crumbled","small bunch mint leaves, chopped","juice and zest ½ lemon"]','["Cook the quinoa following the\r\npack instructions, then rinse in\r\ncold water and drain thoroughly.","Meanwhile, mix the butter,\r\nchilli and garlic into a paste. Toss\r\nthe chicken fillets in 2 tsp of the\r\nolive oil with some seasoning.\r\nLay in a hot griddle pan and cook\r\nfor 3-4 mins each side or until\r\ncooked through. Transfer to a plate, dot with the spicy butter\r\nand set aside to melt.","Next, tip the tomatoes, olives,\r\nonion, feta and mint into a bowl.\r\nToss in the cooked quinoa. Stir\r\nthrough the remaining olive oil,\r\nlemon juice and zest, and season\r\nwell. Serve with the chicken\r\nfillets on top, drizzled with any\r\nbuttery chicken juices."]','2026-01-10 12:15:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5111,5111,'en','Tomato, watermelon & feta salad with mint dressing','This red and white delight is one summery side that goes with everything','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","¼ tsp chilli flakes","2 tbsp chopped mint","4 tomatoes, chopped","500g/1lb 2oz watermelon, cut into chunks","200g pack feta cheese, crumbled"]','["Make the dressing by mixing the oil, vinegar, chilli flakes and mint with some seasoning.","Put the tomatoes and watermelon in a bowl. Pour over the dressing and leave to stand for 10 mins to allow the fruit to get really juicy. Gently stir through the feta, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5113,5113,'en','Mini prosciutto & asparagus frittatas','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThese simple savouries are a great addition to your first picnicof the year – or as a light lunch treat, whatever the weather','["12 slices prosciutto","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","125g pack asparagus tips","6 eggs","100ml milk","85g parmesan, grated"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease a 12-hole muffin tin and line\r\neach hole with a slice of prosciutto to\r\ncover the base and sides. Heat oil in a\r\nsmall frying pan and cook onion for\r\n5 mins, until soft. Meanwhile, snap the\r\ntip ends off the asparagus and set aside.\r\nFinely slice the stalks and add to the onions when soft. Cook for 2-3 mins\r\nmore, then remove and cool.","Beat the eggs, milk and ¾ of the\r\nParmesan together. Add some onion\r\nmix to each muffin hole. Divide over\r\nthe egg mix, then top with the asparagus\r\ntip ends. Sprinkle over the remaining\r\nParmesan and cook for 18-20 mins or\r\nuntil set.","Allow to cool for a few mins then\r\nremove from tin and eat warm or\r\ncold."]','2026-01-10 12:15:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5115,5115,'en','Butternut squash salad','Get a whopping 4 of your 5-a-day with this superhealthy salad, why not make extra for your lunchbox too','["1 butternut squash, peeled, deseeded and diced","2 tsp olive oil","50g wild and brown rice","50g Puy lentils","1 head broccoli, cut into florets","50g dried cranberries","25g pumpkin seeds","juice 1 lemon"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nSpread the squash over a large baking\r\nsheet, drizzle over the oil and bake\r\nfor 30 mins or until tender.","Meanwhile, cook the rice and lentils\r\nin boiling salted water for 20 mins,\r\nadding the broccoli for the final 4 mins\r\nof cooking. Drain well, then stir in the\r\ncranberries and pumpkin seeds with\r\nsome seasoning. Add the squash, pour\r\nover the lemon juice and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5117,5117,'en','Herby quinoa, feta & pomegranate salad','A Middle Eastern-style meze bowl with healthy grains, parsley, mint and coriander','["300g quinoa","1 red onion, finely chopped","85g raisins or sultanas","100g feta cheese, crumbled","200g pomegranates seeds from tub or fruit","85g toasted pine nuts or toasted flaked almonds","small pack each coriander, flat leaf parsley and mint, roughly chopped","juice 3 lemon","1 tsp sugar"]','["Cook the quinoa following pack instructions – it should be tender but with a little bite. Drain well and spread over a platter or wide, shallow bowl to cool quickly and steam dry.","When the quinoa is just about cool stir through all of the remaining ingredients with plenty of seasoning."]','2026-01-10 12:15:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5119,5119,'en','Minty carrot, pistachio & feta salad','A vegetarian side salad with cumin-roasted carrots, chickpeas, mint, nuts, spinach and salty cheese – great with Moroccan food','["2 tbsp olive oil, plus a little extra for drizzling","500g carrots, halved and cut into chunks","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","2 tsp ground cumin","juice ½ lemon","1 tbsp clear honey","small bunch mint, chopped","2 big handfuls spinach","100g bag shelled pistachios, roughly chopped","200g pack feta cheese, crumbled"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nTip 1 tbsp of the oil, the carrots,\r\nchickpeas and cumin onto a baking\r\ntray, season and toss to coat. Roast\r\nfor 30 mins or until the carrots are tender.","Mix together the lemon juice, honey\r\nand remaining oil, then pour all over the\r\nroasted carrots and chickpeas. Leave to\r\ncool.You can chill the salad at this stage,\r\nfor up to 1 day; just bring it out of the\r\nfridge 1 hr before serving.","Mix through the mint, spinach leaves\r\nand pistachios, and check the seasoning.\r\nScatter the feta over and drizzle with a\r\nlittle extra oil."]','2026-01-10 12:15:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5121,5121,'en','Quinoa & feta salad with roasted vegetables','Quinoa is a fine, protein-packed grain that helps to keep you satisfied until your next meal, making this veggie salad a great lunchbox filler','["200g quinoa","3 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, peeled but left whole, then cut into 1cm thick round slices","2 peppers, red, yellow or mixture, deseeded and cut into chunky long wedges","200g baby courgettes, halved lengthways","3 garlic cloves, unpeeled","zest and juice 1 lemon","pinch of sugar","small pack flat-leaf parsley, roughly chopped","200g pack feta cheese"]','["Cook the quinoa following pack instructions, then drain really well and set aside.","Meanwhile heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the onion and peppers with 1 tbsp of the oil and seasoning on a roasting tray, then roast for 15 mins.","Toss the courgettes and garlic with the rest of the veg and roast for another 15 mins.","Squeeze the roasted garlic cloves out of their skins and mash with some seasoning. Stir in the remaining oil, lemon juice and zest and season with sugar to taste. Drizzle over the quinoa and toss together with the roasted vegetables and parsley. Crumble over the feta, toss gently again and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5123,5123,'en','Flourless chocolate & almond cake','This dense, squidgy chocolate and almond cake is perfect for dessert. It’s gluten-free – just ensure your cocoa powder and chocolate are, too','["200g dark cooking chocolate, chopped into small pieces","200g butter, chopped into small pieces","3 eggs","175g golden caster sugar","100g mascarpone or soft cheese","¼ tsp vanilla extract","100g ground almonds","30g cocoa powder, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4 and line the base of a 20cm springform tin with baking parchment. Melt the chocolate and butter in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of just-simmering water, or in themicrowavein 20-second bursts. Stir, then leave to cool slightly.","Meanwhile, tip the eggs and sugar into a second bowl and beat with an electricwhiskfor 4-5 mins, or until thick and creamy. Add the mascarpone or soft cheese and vanilla, and continue to beat until everything is combined. Lightly fold in the cooled melted chocolate mixture until everything is one even colour, then fold in the almonds. Sift over the cocoa powder and a small pinch of salt, and fold in to combine.","Scrape the cake batter into the prepared tin. Put the tin on a baking tray and bake for 35-40 mins until the cake is puffed up and has cracked on top. Remove from the oven and leave to cool in the tin for 30-40 mins – it will deflate as it cools. Serve warm as a chocolate pudding, or leave to cool completely and enjoy as a fudgy brownie cake. Dust with extra cocoa powder before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:15:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5125,5125,'en','Gluten-free chocolate cake','Make a dense, rich chocolate cake for a special occasion or anytime treat. While suitable for those following a gluten-free diet, it will prove a hit with everyone','["150ml vegetable oil, plus extra for the tins","175g gluten-free flour","1 tsp xanthan gum","50g cocoa powder","1 tbsp baking powder","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","75g dark brown soft sugar","75g caster sugar","2 tbsp golden syrup","2 eggs","100g Greek yogurt","100ml milk","2 tbsp instant coffee, dissolved in 4 tbsp hot water","300g icing sugar","25g cocoa powder","150g soft salted butter","3 tbsp milk","65g dark chocolate, melted"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil the base of two 18cm sandwich tins and line with baking parchment. Mix the flour, xanthan gum, cocoa, baking powder, bicarbonate of soda, a large pinch of salt and both sugars together in a large bowl.","Whiskthe golden syrup, eggs, oil, yogurt, milk and coffee together in a jug. Gradually whisk the wet ingredients into the dry until you have a smooth mixture.","Pour the mixture into the prepared tins and bake for 30-35 mins until risen and firm to the touch. Remove from the oven and leave to cool for 10 mins in the tins before turning out onto acooling rack.","While the cakes are cooling, make the icing. Beat the icing sugar, cocoa powder, butter and milk together for 5 mins until smooth and fluffy. Gradually pour in the melted chocolate while beating, scraping down the sides of the bowl to make sure everything’s included.","Spread half the icing over the middle of one sponge using a small palette knife. Sandwich the other sponge on top, with the flat bottom-side facing up. Spread the remaining icing around the top and sides of the cake, smoothing over with a palette knife. If you have any icing left, you can pipe some rosettes on top of the cake."]','2026-01-10 12:15:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5127,5127,'en','Dukkah-crusted squash wedges','Coat chunky wedges of squash in a crispy, spicy coating of hazelnuts, coriander seeds, sesame seeds and cumin and oven bake until tender','["50g blanched hazelnuts","1 tbsp coriander seeds","2 tbsp sesame seeds","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 large butternut squash","1 tbsp olive oil"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toast the hazelnuts in a frying pan over a medium heat until golden. Add the coriander and sesame seeds, and toast for 1 min more. Set aside and leave to cool, then add the ground cumin and bash together using a pestle and mortar.","Peel the butternut squash, remove the seeds and slice into wedges. Toss the wedges with the oil, then mix in the dukkah coating. Spread in a single layer on a baking tray and cook for 30-40 mins, turning halfway through, until tender."]','2026-01-10 12:15:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5129,5129,'en','Apple crisps','This healthy baked snack has just one ingredient – perfect for garnishing desserts, fruity hot drinks, or eaten as a pick-me-up','["1 apple"]','["Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Thinly slice the apple through the core – use a mandolin, if you have one, to get thin slices. Arrange the slices on a baking tray lined with parchment and bake for 40 mins. Cool until crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:15:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5131,5131,'en','Glamorgan cheese sausage rolls','These melt in the mouth festive party nibbles provide a tasty alternative for your vegetarian guests – they’re also gluten-free','["175g gluten-free flour (we used Doves Farm, widely available)","85g butter","pinch cayenne pepper","1 egg yolk mixed with 3 tbsp cold water","100g gluten-free breadcrumbs (we used Dietary Specials Gluten-Free bread)","100g Caerphilly cheese, grated","1 small leek, finely chopped","1 tsp mustard seeds, crushed","3 egg yolks","handful tarragon or thyme leaves (optional)"]','["To make the pastry, put the flour, butter\r\nand cayenne pepper into a food processor,\r\nthen whizz into fine breadcrumbs. sprinkle\r\nthe egg and water mixture onto the flour and\r\npulse again until the mixture begins to come\r\ntogether. Tip the mixture onto a board, then\r\ngently squeeze the pastry until it begins to\r\ncome together in a ball, adding more water\r\nif it feels dry. Divide the mixture in half, roll\r\neach piece into a 12 x 30cm rectangle and\r\nslip onto a baking sheet. Do not chill.","Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.\r\nMix the filling ingredients together, except\r\none egg yolk, which you need for glazing,\r\nin a food processor. Divide in two and roll\r\neach into a 30cm-long sausage shape. Lay\r\na cheese sausage on one side of the pastry.\r\nBrush the sausage and pastry with egg yolk\r\nand fold the pastry over the top to encase the\r\nsausage. Seal the two edges, trim the ends,\r\nthen cut into 2cm pieces. Arrange on a\r\nbaking sheet and chill for 30 mins.","Brush the rolls with a little more egg yolk,\r\nplace herbs on top, if you like, then bake for\r\n12-15 mins until golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:15:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5133,5133,'en','Mini jacket potatoes','Bake up some new potatoes and top with soured cream and chives for a bite-sized, simple canapé','["500g bag new potatoes","1 tbsp olive oil","sea salt","75ml half-fat soured cream","small bunch chives, snipped"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Prick the potatoes with a fork, rub with the oil, then toss with sea salt. Arrange on a baking sheet and bake for 1 hr. Let the potatoes cool for 10-15 mins, then cut a small cross in the top of each and pinch the bases to open a little. Add a teaspoon of soured cream to each, a little freshly ground black pepper, and a sprinkling of chives. Serve straightway."]','2026-01-10 12:15:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5135,5135,'en','Gluten-free carrot cake','Junior cook Emily shares her simple, no-fuss recipe for gluten-free carrot cake','["140g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","200g caster sugar","250g carrots, grated","140g sultanas","2 eggs, lightly beaten","200g gluten-free self-raising flour","1 tsp cinnamon","1 tsp gluten-free baking powder","50g mixed nuts, chopped","75g butter, softened","175g icing sugar","3 tsp cinnamon, plus extra for dusting"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line a 900g/2lb loaf tin\r\nwith baking parchment.","Beat the butter and sugar until soft\r\nand creamy, then stir in the grated\r\ncarrot and sultanas. Pour the eggs into\r\nthe mix a little at a time.","Add the flour, cinnamon, baking\r\npowder and most of the chopped nuts\r\nand mix well. Tip the mix into the loaf\r\ntin, then bake for 50-55 mins or until a\r\nskewer poked in the middle comes out\r\nclean. Allow to cool in the tin for 15 mins,\r\nthen remove from the tin and cool\r\ncompletely on a wire rack.","Meanwhile, make the icing. Beat the\r\nbutter in a large bowl until it is really soft,\r\nadd the icing sugar and cinnamon, then\r\nbeat until thick and creamy. When the\r\ncake is cool, spread the icing on top, then\r\nsprinkle with a little more cinnamon and\r\nthe remaining chopped nuts."]','2026-01-10 12:15:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5137,5137,'en','Lemon & orange cake','This citrus centrepiece has a secret ingredient that gives the cake a lovely texture, yet makes it gluten- and wheat-free','["250g pack butter, softened","250g golden caster sugar","4 eggs","250g gluten-free self-raising flour (we used Doves Farm, which is also wheat-free)","2 tsp gluten-free baking powder","250g mashed potatoes, forked through so it doesn''t go in as one lump","2 lemons, zest and juice","1 orange, zest and juice","175g icing sugar","squeeze lemon juice (save a little from the cake quantity)","chocolate eggs, to decorate, if you like (check they''re gluten-free)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line a deep, 20cm round cake\r\ntin. Beat the butter and sugar together\r\nuntil pale and fluffy, then gradually beat\r\nin the eggs, one by one. Fold in the flour,\r\nbaking powder, mashed potato, zests and\r\njuices. Scrape into the tin and level the top.\r\nBake for 45 mins until golden and a skewer\r\npoked in comes out clean. Cool in the tin\r\nfor 10 mins, then move to a wire rack.","Sift the icing sugar, then mix in enough\r\nof the lemon juice to make a stiff, but still\r\nrunny icing. Spread over the cake so it\r\ndribbles down the sides a little. Add\r\nsome chocolate eggs, if using. Leave until\r\nthe icing has set, then slice and serve.\r\nDelicious with a dollop of natural yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:15:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5139,5139,'en','Sesame & chilli pancakes with tzatziki','A tempting and tasty gluten-free option for your party guests. These are a little like small blinis','["100g gluten-free flour (we used Doves Farm, widely available)","1 egg","150ml soya yogurt","1 green and 1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 bunch spring onions, finely sliced, plus extra to serve","2 tbsp chopped coriander","1 tbsp sesame seeds","a little oil for frying","150g Greek yogurt","13cm/5in cucumber, deseeded and grated","2 tbsp chopped mint"]','["Whizz the flour, egg, yogurt and 2 tbsp\r\nwater together in a food processor to form\r\na smooth batter. tip into a bowl, then stir in\r\nthe chillies, spring onions, coriander and\r\nsesame seeds. Cover and chill until required.","To make the tzatziki, mix the yogurt,\r\ncucumber and mint together, season to taste,\r\nthen chill.","Heat a small frying pan with a splash\r\nof oil, wiping out excess oil with kitchen paper.\r\nfry the pancake mixture a dessertspoonful at\r\na time, for 1 min on each side, until lightly\r\nbrowned. tip onto a plate and keep warm.\r\npile onto a large platter, top with a dollop of\r\ntzatziki and some extra sliced spring onions\r\nand serve warm."]','2026-01-10 12:15:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5141,5141,'en','Gluten-free lemon drizzle cake','With a special surprise ingredient, this gluten free cake stays beautifully moist. To everyone’s amazement it''s mash potato!','["200g butter, softened","200g golden caster sugar","4 eggs","175g ground almonds (to make it nut free see below)","250g mashed potatoes","zest 3 lemons","2 tsp gluten-free baking powder (Supercook does one)","4 tbsp granulated sugar","juice 1 lemon"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter and line a deep, 20cm round cake tin. Beat the sugar and butter together until light and fluffy, then gradually add the egg,\r\nbeating after each addition. Fold in the almonds, cold mashed potato, lemon zest\r\nand baking powder.","Tip into the tin, level the top, then bake for 40-45 mins or until golden and a skewer inserted into the middle of the cake comes out clean. Turn out onto a wire rack after 10 mins cooling. Mix the granulated sugar and the lemon juice together, then spoon over the top of the cake, letting it drip down the sides. Let the cake cool\r\ncompletely before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:15:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5143,5143,'en','Gluten-free hot cross buns','Paul Hollywood’s fruity bakes are just as delicious when you make some simple swaps to make them wheat-free','["300ml full-fat milk, plus 2 tbsp more","50g butter","500g gluten and wheat-free white bread flour (we used Doves Farm gluten & wheat free white bread flour)","1 tsp salt","75g caster sugar","1 tbsp sunflower oil","2 tsp quick or fast-action yeast","1 large egg, beaten","1 tsp olive oil","75g sultanas","50g mixed peel","zest 1 orange","1 apple, peeled, cored and finely chopped","1 tsp ground cinnamon","30g gluten and wheat-free plain flour, plus extra for dusting","3 tbsp apricot jam"]','["Bring the milk to the boil, then remove from the heat and add the butter. Leave to cool until it reaches hand temperature. Mix the flour, salt, sugar and yeast with the warm milk and egg in a mixer with a dough attachment, or with a wooden spoon, then bring together the dough with your hands.Don''t knead.","Put the dough in a lightly oiled bowl. Cover with oiled cling film and leave to rise in a warm place for 1 hr or until doubled in size and a finger pressed into it leaves a dent.","Tip in the olive oil, sultanas, mixed peel, orange zest, apple and cinnamon and mix into the dough. Shape into buns by lightly oiling your hands and dividing the dough into 100g pieces before rolling into balls. Leave to rise for another hour.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Mix the flour with about 3 tbsp water to make the paste for the cross – add the water 1 tbsp at a time, so you add just enough for a thick paste. Spoon into a piping bag with a small nozzle. Pipe a line along each row of buns, then repeat in the other direction to create crosses. Bake for 20 mins on the middle shelf of the oven, until golden brown.","Gently heat the apricot jam to melt, then sieve to get rid of any chunks. While the jam is still warm, brush over the top of the warm buns and leave to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:15:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5145,5145,'en','Griddled asparagus with flaked almonds & butter','A perfect snack, starter or side dish of nutty, crisp asparagus spears with a buttery glaze','["200g asparagus spears","a little olive oil","knob of butter","1 tsp toasted flaked almond"]','["Cook asparagus in boiling\r\nsalted water for 2 mins. Drain, then toss\r\nwith a little olive oil. Heat a griddle pan\r\nto very hot, place the spears on the\r\ngriddle and cook for a few mins, turning\r\nto get a nice charred effect all over.\r\nMeanwhile, melt a knob of butter in\r\na pan. Divide the asparagus between\r\n2 plates, season and top each pile with\r\na drizzle of melted butter and toasted flaked almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:15:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5147,5147,'en','Bombay popcorn mix','A great thrifty homemade snack of salted popcorn with chickpeas, raisins, nuts and Indian spices','["400g can chickpeas, drained and dried","1 tsp vegetable oil","50g butter","2 tsp garam masala","1 tsp curry powder","70g bag salted popcorn","85g peanuts","100g sultanas"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nTip the chickpeas onto a baking tray with the oil. Season, shake\r\nwell to coat, then bake for 25 mins.","Meanwhile, melt the butter in\r\na microwave. Mix in the garam\r\nmasala, curry power and\r\nsome salt and pepper. Tip the popcorn, peanuts and sultanas into a bowl, add the\r\nbaked chickpeas and pour over the\r\nspiced butter. Stir everything well to coat."]','2026-01-10 12:15:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5149,5149,'en','Salmon & lemon mini fish cakes','These fish cakes provide a tasty gluten-free alternative to your festive spread','["2 large baking potatoes","2 tbsp olive oil","grated zest and juice ½ lemon","1 egg yolk","140g smoked salmon trimmings, plus extra to serve","1 tbsp chopped parsley, plust extra","2 tbsp gluten-free flour mixed with 1 tsp coarsely ground pepper","a little oil, for frying"]','["Microwave potatoes on high for 10 mins until tender. Leave to cool for 5 mins, scoop the flesh in a bowl, then mash and leave to cool. Season with olive oil, lemon zest and juice to taste, then mix in the egg, salmon and parsley. Shape into small rounds 3cm wide and 1cm deep. Chill for 15 mins.","Dust each cake with the peppered flour, then fry over a low heat in a little oil for 2-3 mins on each side. Drain on kitchen paper and serve garnished with salmon and parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:15:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5151,5151,'en','Spicy chickpeas','Get the whole family snacking on this low-fat alternative to peanuts','["400g can chickpeas, drained and dried","1 tsp vegetable oil","1 tbsp chilli powder"]','["Tip the chickpeas into a bowl with the vegetable\r\noil and chilli powder and mix\r\nuntil the chickpeas are coated with chilli.\r\nTransfer to a baking sheet, spread out\r\nthe chickpeas, then cook for 25 mins.\r\nRemove from the oven and allow to cool.\r\nSprinkle with sea salt before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:15:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5153,5153,'en','Courgette & halloumi skewers','Marinade cheese with mint, lemon and olive oil, thread onto kebab skewers with veg and chargrill','["½  tsp chilli powder","small handful mint, chopped","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","2 courgettes, cut into 1cm rounds","225g pack halloumi cheese, cubed"]','["Mix the chilli, half the mint, lemon zest\r\nand juice, oil, courgettes and halloumi.\r\nLeave to marinate for 30 mins. Soak\r\n8 wooden skewers for 20 mins.","Thread the courgettes and halloumi\r\nonto the skewers. Cook on the BBQ, or\r\nunder a grill, for 7-8 mins, turning halfway\r\nthrough and basting with the remaining\r\nmarinade. Scatter over remaining mint."]','2026-01-10 12:15:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5155,5155,'en','Mexican corn on the cob','Spice up barbecued sweetcorn with chilli, lime and lashings of melted butter','["4 corn cobs","100g butter, softened","zest 1 lime","2 tsp chopped fresh chilli or 1 tsp chilli powder, mild or hot, depending how spicy you like it","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Soak corn in cold water for 15 mins.\r\nHeat a griddle pan or barbecue and,\r\nwhen hot, place the corn directly on\r\nthe bars. Cook for 30-40 mins, turning\r\nregularly, until the corn is tender and\r\ncharred in spots.","Meanwhile, mash the butter with the\r\nlime zest and chili. When the cobs are\r\ndone, top each with a knob of flavoured\r\nbutter and serve with lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:15:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5157,5157,'en','Parmesan, poppy seed & caraway twists','These vegetarian and gluten-free twists are perfect to serve with festive drinks','["175g gluten-free flour (we used Doves Farm, widely available)","85g butter","pinch cayenne pepper","1 egg yolk mixed with 3 tbsp cold water","1 egg, beaten","3 tbsp freshly grated parmesan (or vegetarian alternative)","1 tbsp each poppy seeds and caraway seeds"]','["To make the pastry, put the flour, butter\r\nand cayenne pepper into a food processor,\r\nthen whizz into fine breadcrumbs. sprinkle\r\nthe egg and water mixture onto the flour, then\r\npulse again until the mixture begins to come\r\ntogether. tip the mixture onto a board and\r\ngently squeeze the pastry until it begins to\r\ncome together in a ball, adding more water\r\nif it feels dry.","Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. roll\r\nthe pastry into a large a4-sized rectangle,\r\nroughly 20 x 30cm. Brush the sheet with\r\nthe beaten egg and cut in half widthways.\r\nSprinkle one half with the Parmesan and the\r\nsecond half with poppy and caraway seeds.\r\nlightly run the rolling pin across the top to\r\npress the cheese and the seeds into the\r\npastry. Cut each half into 12-15 sticks. arrange\r\non a baking sheet and chill for 10 mins.","Bake for 8-10 mins until golden brown,\r\nthen cool for 5 mins before lifting onto a\r\nwire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:15:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5159,5159,'en','Funky feta skewers','Cheese and pineapple on a stick gets a totally tropical transformation – use watermelon and mango and sprinkle with poppyseeds','["1 large mango, peeled and chunkily diced into 10","about 300g watermelon flesh, diced into 10","200g pack feta cheese, cut into 20 cubes","1 tsp poppy seed, toasted","20 mini skewers, to serve","1 citrus fruit, to serve (optional)","1 lime"]','["Put the mango on one plate, melon on\r\nanother and feta on a third. Scatter some\r\npoppy seeds over each, and gently toss\r\nso the seeds stick. Assemble 10 skewers\r\nwith cubes of mango and feta, and\r\n10 skewers with cubes of melon and\r\nfeta. Stick into citrus fruit, if you like,\r\nor arrange on a platter, and squeeze\r\nover the lime. Cover and chill until about\r\n20 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:15:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5161,5161,'en','Crisp orange shortbread','Coeliac sufferers need not miss out on sweet treats with this gluten-free melt-in-the-mouth shortbread recipe','["100g butter, softened","50g golden caster sugar","grated zest ½ orange","175g gluten-free flour (try Doves Farm)","½ tsp gluten-free baking powder (we used Supercook)"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Lightly oil a baking sheet. Beat the butter, then cream it with the sugar and orange zest until light. Stir in the flour and baking powder and mix together to form a dough.","Divide the mixture into 10 balls, arrange on a baking sheet. Press each ball fl at with the tip of a round-bladed knife. Chill for 15 mins, then bake for 12-15 mins until light golden. Leave on the baking sheet for 2 mins before releasing with a palette knife. Slide onto a rack to cool. Will keep stored in an airtight container for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:15:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5163,5163,'en','Gluten-free victoria sponge','Soft, light and every bit as celebratory as the classic British bake, this will go down well with everyone at a special occasion','["200g butter , softened, plus extra for the tins","200g golden caster sugar","4 medium eggs","200g gluten-free self-raising flour with xanthan gum (see tip)","1 tsp gluten-free baking powder","2 tbsp milk","1 tsp vanilla extract","200ml double cream","2 tbsp icing sugar , plus extra for dusting","100g strawberry or raspberry jam"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter two 20cm sandwich tins and line with baking parchment. Beat the butter and caster sugar together in a large bowl using an electric whisk for 5-6 mins, or until pale and fluffy.","Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well between each addition and adding a spoonful of the flour with each egg to prevent the mixture from curdling.","Fold in the remaining flour and baking powder using a spatula, then stir in the milk and vanilla. Divide the mixture between the tins and level the surfaces. Bake for 20-25 mins until golden, springy to the touch and a skewer inserted into their centres comes out clean (if any wet cake mixture clings to the skewer, return the sponges to the oven for another 5 mins, then check again). Leave to cool in the tins for 5 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack, remove the baking parchment and leave to cool completely. Once completely cool, the sponges can be wrapped and frozen for up to a month. Defrost at room temperature before assembling.","Whisk the cream and icing sugar together using an electric whisk until the cream just holds its shape. To assemble, put one sponge on a plate or cake stand. Spread over the jam, then spoon over the whipped cream. Sandwich with the second sponge, then dust with icing sugar. Best enjoyed the day it’s assembled."]','2026-01-10 12:15:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5165,5165,'en','Air fryer almond choc chunk Passover cookies','Whip up these easy gluten-free bakes for Passover. If you use a dairy-free chocolate they will be parev (a Jewish dietary law excluding milk or meat products)','["60g light brown soft sugar","60g caster sugar","½ tsp vanilla essence","1 egg , beaten","180g almond flour or ground almonds (or half of each)","80g potato flour","½ tsp kosher baking powder","¼ tsp kosher bicarbonate of soda","100-150g dairy-free dark chocolate chunks or chips"]','["In a medium-sized bowl, mix the sugars, vanilla and beaten egg. In a separate bowl mix the almonds and potato flour. Add the baking powder, bicarbonate of soda and a pinch of salt. Whisk to combine.","Add the wet ingredients to the dry and stir until combined. Mix in the chocolate chunks until they are evenly distributed.","Heat your air fryer to 170C and take a piece of baking parchment that fits into your air fryer basket. Pierce a few small holes in the parchment with the tip of a knife to allow the air to circulate better.","While the air fryer is heating, scoop heaped tablespoons of the mixture (approximately 40g) and place them on the baking parchment, pressing them down a little to flatten them.","Bake at 170C for 12-15 mins, checking after 12 mins, until the cookies are golden brown and light gold underneath, then transfer to a wire rack to cool (using the parchment to help as they will be soft). Allow at least 10 mins for them to cool and firm up. Repeat with the remaining mixture. Will keep in an airtight container for three to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:15:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5167,5167,'en','Gluten-free shortbread','Bake a gluten-free version of shortbread to serve with tea, or to accompany a dessert pot','["45g cornflour","155g gluten-free plain flour , plus extra for dusting","¼ tsp xanthan gum","75g golden caster sugar","125g cold unsalted butter , cut into cubes"]','["Line a 20cm x 20cm baking tin with baking parchment and set aside. Tip the flours, xanthan gum and sugar into a food processor and pulse to combine.","Add the butter and pulse until the mixture reaches a breadcrumb-like texture. Tip out onto your work surface and bring the dough together with your hands. Press into the prepared tin in an even layer and chill for at least 20 mins.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bake the shortbread for 18-22 mins until lightly golden. Remove from the oven and score along the cooked dough to make 12 rectangles. Leave to cool for 10 mins before cutting through the scored lines completely. Leave to cool completely before serving. Will keep in a biscuit tin for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:15:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5169,5169,'en','Gluten-free chocolate & pear pudding cake','Impress guests with this squidgy flourless chocolate cake topped with juicy pears – it’s perfect as a dessert or an afternoon sweet treat','["200g butter , chopped into small pieces, plus extra for the tin","200g dark cooking chocolate , chopped into small pieces","3 eggs","175g golden caster sugar","100g mascarpone or soft cheese","¼ tsp vanilla extract","100g ground almonds","30g cocoa powder , plus extra to serve","4 very ripe Morrisons Market Street pears , peeled, halved and cored","icing sugar , for dusting"]','["Butter and line a 25cm round cake tin. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Melt the chocolate and butter in a bowl over a pan of hot water, or do this in short bursts in the microwave, then leave to cool. Beat the eggs and sugar with an electric whisk for 4-5 mins, or until thickened and the whisk leaves a trail in the mixture. Add the mascarpone or soft cheese and vanilla and beat until combined. Lightly fold in the cooled melted chocolate until incorporated, then fold in the almonds. Sift over the cocoa powder and a small pinch of salt, and fold in to combine.","Scrape the cake mix into the prepared tin. Arrange the Morrisons pears over the top, cut-side down, and press down gently. Bake for 45-50 mins, until the cake has risen around the pears and cracked on top. Leave to cool in the tin for 30-40 mins – it will deflate as it cools. Dust with icing sugar and cocoa, and serve warm, or leave to cool completely for a more brownie-like consistency."]','2026-01-10 12:15:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5171,5171,'en','Chicken & cashew noodles','Rustle up this speedy noodle dish with chicken, cashews, carrots and red peppers in under 25 minutes – it’s gluten-free and high in protein','["250g dried flat rice noodles","1 tbsp garlic-infused oil","2 red peppers , chopped into thin strips","2 medium carrots , thinly sliced on the diagonal","2 chicken breasts , chopped into thin strips","150g cashews","½ tsp dried chilli flakes (optional)","sliced spring onions and chopped coriander, to serve","4½ tbsp gluten-free soy sauce","1½ tsp gluten-free white or red miso paste","1 tsp ginger paste","1½ tbsp dark brown sugar","1 tsp gluten-free plain flour"]','["Mix together all the ingredients for the sauce with 1 tbsp water in a small bowl and set aside.","Cook the dried noodles following pack instructions, then set aside.","Place a largewokover a high heat and add the oil. Tip in the peppers and carrots and fry for a few minutes until lightly browned. Mix in the chicken and stir-fry until slightly golden, around 2 mins. Add the cooked rice noodles and toss to combine. Pour in the sauce and add the cashews, then continue to stir-fry until everything is well coated and a little sticky. Finish with a sprinkling of chilli flakes, if using, spring onions and the chopped coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:15:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5173,5173,'en','Gluten-free apple crumble','Make a free-from apple crumble using porridge oats. It’s the perfect pud for colder months, served with custard, ice cream or cream','["600g Bramley apples , cut into 2cm dice","1 tsp ground mixed spice or cinnamon","2 tbsp caster sugar","cream or vanilla ice cream, to serve","100g butter , diced","150g gluten-free plain flour","75g light muscovado sugar","3 tbsp gluten-free porridge oats"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Put the apple, spice and caster sugar in asaucepanwith 2 tbsp water. Cover and cook gently for 5 mins until the apples have started to soften, then transfer to an ovenproof dish.","Meanwhile, rub the butter into the flour, then stir in the light muscovado sugar, oats and a pinch of salt. Sprinkle the mixture evenly over the apples.","Put the dish on abaking trayand bake for 35-40 mins until the top is golden and the apples are tender. Leave to cool for 5 mins before serving with cream, ice cream or custard."]','2026-01-10 12:15:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5175,5175,'en','Gluten-free sticky toffee pudding','Enjoy a gluten-free version of sticky toffee pudding. Soaking the dates in coffee adds a gorgeous deep, roasted caramel flavour to the sponge','["125g salted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","225g pitted medjool dates, finely chopped","200ml coffee, made with 1 tbsp instant espresso powder","150ml whole milk","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","225g light brown soft sugar","250g gluten-free self-raising flour","1 tsp ground mixed spice","¼ tsp xanthan gum (optional)","3 medium eggs, beaten","ice cream, cream or custard, to serve","300ml double cream","50g salted butter","100g light brown soft sugar","75g dark muscovado sugar","1 tsp espresso powder"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a deep 23cm square cake tin (or use a roughly 20 x 28cm rectangular tin) and line with baking parchment. Put the dates in a medium pan with the coffee, milk and bicarb, and simmer over a medium-low heat for 5-7 mins until the dates have mostly broken down.","Beat the butter and sugar together in astand mixeror using an electric whisk. Sift in the flour, spice and xanthan gum (if using), then add the eggs. Beat until just combined, then add the date mixture and mix again. Pour the batter into the tin and bake for 40 mins until risen, firm and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean.","While the sponge bakes, make the sauce. Tip 150ml of the cream into a saucepan with the remaining ingredients, and warm over a low-medium heat until the butter has melted. Simmer for 4-5 mins to thicken. Remove from the heat, then stir in the remaining cream. Cut the sponge into squares or rectangles, and serve warm topped with the sauce and ice cream or cream.Once cool, the sponge will keep in an airtight tin for three days or frozen for three months (without the sauce). The sauce will keep chilled for a week or frozen for three months. Defrost the sauce in the fridge overnight, and the sponge at room temp. To reheat, cover the sponge with foil and bake for 20-30 mins at 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Warm the sauce gently in a pan. Or, microwave individual servings in heatproof bowls on high for 1 min until the sauce has melted and the sponge is hot through."]','2026-01-10 12:15:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5177,5177,'en','Gluten-free white chocolate & raspberry cheesecake','Make a gluten-free version of cheesecake using free-from digestive biscuits for the base. Top with a silky white chocolate and raspberry filling','["200g white chocolate, plus extra to decorate (optional)","275g gluten-free digestive biscuits","100g unsalted butter, melted","500g full-fat soft cheese","1 tsp vanilla extract","300ml double cream","300g fresh raspberries"]','["An hour before you begin, remove all the ingredients from the fridge and bring to room temperature. Line the base of a 20cm springform cake tin with baking parchment. Melt the white chocolate in a heatproof bowl in themicrowavefor 1 min, stirring halfway through. If necessary, put back in for further 10-second bursts until the chocolate is melted. Alternatively, melt the chocolate in a heatproof bowl over a pan of just simmering water, ensuring the bottom of the bowl doesn’t meet the water. Leave to cool while you make the base.","Blitz the digestives in afood processor, then tip into a bowl or crush in the bowl using the end of a rolling pin. Pour in the melted butter and mix until the texture resembles damp sand. Tip into the prepared tin and press down to form an even layer. Keep chilled while you make the filling.","Beat together the soft cheese, vanilla extract and double cream in a bowl using an electric whisk until thick and creamy. Fold through the melted white chocolate – if it seizes, you can pop the bowl in the microwave for 10 seconds before whisking to bring it back together. Stir through 250g of the raspberries, ensuring some break up to give you a bit of a ripple.","Spoon the cheesecake mix over the biscuit base and smooth to an even layer. Put in the fridge to chill for at least 6 hrs, or overnight.Will keep chilled for two days.To serve, carefully remove from the tin and scatter over the remaining raspberries, then grate over some white chocolate, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5179,5179,'en','Gluten-free gingerbread','Enjoy our gluten-free version of gingerbread. We’ve shaped it into stars for a Christmas treat that can be given as gifts, or used to decorate your tree','["100g salted butter","3 tbsp golden syrup","100g dark muscovado sugar","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1½ tbsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cinnamon","225g gluten-free plain flour","50g icing sugar"]','["In a small pan heat the butter, syrup and sugar together until melted, stirring occasionally. Set to one side to cool slightly. In a large bowl mix together the bicarb, ginger, cinnamon and flour. Pour in the melted butter mixture and stir to combine and using your hands, bring together to form a dough. This will be soft but will set up in the fridge.","Take 2 sheets of greaseproof paper, lay the dough down on one, shape it into a rectangle and place the other sheet on top of it.Roll the dough outto 1/2 cm thick and put flat in the fridge for 1 hour to set and firm up.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and line a large baking tray with non-stick greaseproof paper. Take the rolled dough out of the fridge and cut out shapes from it. We did 9cm stars, but you can also choose any shape, depending on the size it will need a few mins less/more in the oven. We also did some with, smaller stars cut out the centre of them.","Meanwhile make the icing, combine the icing sugar with 1 – 2 tbsp water, until it’s thick and pipeable but not thin enough that it will run. Decorate the cooled biscuits with whatever designs"]','2026-01-10 12:15:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5181,5181,'en','Flourless chocolate cake','Treat someone to this flourless chocolate cake. It’s ideal for anyone following a gluten-free diet, and makes an irresistable dessert with fresh berries','["225g salted butter, cubed, plus more for the tin","300g dark chocolate, roughly chopped","1 tbsp coffee powder","6 large eggs, whites and yolks separated","100g soft light brown sugar","200g caster sugar","2 tsp vanilla paste","30g cocoa powder","berries, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Butter a 23cm springform cake tin and line the base with baking parchment.","Melt the butter and chocolate in a medium heatproof bowl in the microwave or over a pan of gently simmering water. Mix the coffee powder with 2 tbsp hot water until dissolved. Stir the coffee into the chocolate and set aside to cool slightly.","Whisk the egg whites in a large bowl for 2 mins with an electric whisk until soft peaks form. In another large bowl, whisk both the sugars, the vanilla and egg yolks for 5-8 mins, or until pale and fluffy. Sift the cocoa powder into the egg yolk mixture and mix gently to combine.","Stir the cooled chocolate into the egg yolk mixture, then gently fold through the egg whites until smooth. Transfer to the tin and bake for 1hr-1hr 20 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the middle of the cake comes out clean. Allow to cool, remove from the tin and serve with fresh berries, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5183,5183,'en','Mini polenta pizza bites','Get little ones to help out making these gluten-free pizza bites. They’re ideal for a kid’s party where some children may be coealiac, or have a gluten intolerance','["2 vegetable stock pots or cubes","500g instant polenta","olive oil, for drizzling, plus extra for the tray","250g pizza sauce","200g vegan cheese, finely chopped","1 tsp dried oregano","optional toppings (for example, chopped pepper, sweetcorn, olives or mushrooms)"]','["Bring 1½ litres water to the boil and add the stock pots and ½ tsp salt. Pour in the polenta, whisking continuously, bring to the boil and reduce the heat to low, then stir every minute to keep it from sticking, for about 8 mins (or according to pack instructions).","Meanwhile, oil a non-stick baking tray (ours was 30 x 40cm). Spoon the cooked polenta into the tray and level with a spoon to make a large, flat slab that fills the whole tray (about 1cm thick). You can use wet palms to press it down firmly after a few minutes. Leave to cool and set firm for at least 1 hr.","Turn out the polenta onto your work surface and cut into strips. Halve the strips on the diagonal to make little wedges and put back on the tray. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Top each polenta base with 1 tsp pizza sauce, a little vegan cheese and a sprinkle of oregano. Add extra toppings, if you like. Drizzle with olive oil and bake for 20-25 mins. Serve warm or cold."]','2026-01-10 12:15:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5185,5185,'en','Gluten-free banana bread','Use up overripe bananas and make banana bread with ground almonds and gluten-free flour. This recipe is ideal for anyone following a gluten-free diet','["5 small ripe bananas (4 mashed, 1 sliced down the middle to decorate the top)","150g gluten-free self-raising flour","100g gluten-free oats","50g ground almonds","1 tsp gluten-free baking powder","1 tsp cinnamon","90g dark brown sugar","90g caster sugar","100g butter, melted","2 large eggs, beaten","1 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 900g loaf tin with parchment paper (our tin was 19 x 9 x 6cm). Put all the ingredients, except the sliced banana, 1 tbsp caster sugar and the icing sugar, into a large bowl and stir until smooth and combined.","Pour into the tin and put the two remaining banana halves cut-side up across the top of the batter, pressing down slightly. Sprinkle over the caster sugar. Bake for 1hr-1hr 15 mins until a skewer comes out clean, covering with foil towards the end of cooking if it browns too much.","Dust with icing sugar and leave to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:15:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5187,5187,'en','Gluten-free scones','Cater for guests intolerant to gluten with these easy scones. Add sultanas if you like and serve with oodles of jam and clotted cream','["250g gluten free self-raising flour","½ tsp fine salt","1 tsp xanthan gum","1 tsp gluten-free baking powder","50g caster sugar","40g cold butter, cubed","75ml whole milk","1 large egg and 1 egg yolk","50g sultanas (optional)"]','["Mix the flour, salt, xanthan gum, baking powder and sugar together in a bowl. Rub in the butter with your fingertips until you have fine breadcrumbs. You can also do this by gradually pulsing the mixture in a food processor until it resembles breadcrumbs.","Whisk together the milk and whole egg and gradually mix into the flour mixture with your hands until you have a smooth dough. Mix in the sultanas, if using. Knead briefly to come together into a ball.","Gently roll out the scone dough until 2cm thick. Transfer to a baking tray lined with parchment and chill for 30 mins to firm up the dough – this makes them easier to cut out.","Remove the dough from the fridge and, using a 5cm cutter, cut out 6-8 scones (press the offcuts together and re-roll when you need to). Put the scones upside down (this will mean you get a neater top when baked) onto another baking tray lined with baking parchment, spread 2cm apart.","Whisk the egg yolk and evenly brush the tops of the scones, making sure that the egg wash doesn’t run down the sides of the scones otherwise they will rise unevenly. Put the scones on a tray and transfer to the freezer for 15 mins. Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Remove the scones from the freezer and brush the tops with the beaten egg again, then bake for 12-15 mins until golden brown. Eat just warm or cold, generously topped with jam and cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5189,5189,'en','Gluten-free pizza','Make our gluten-free version of a classic pizza. The base is easy, spread over rich homemade tomato sauce, then finish with buffalo mozzarella and fresh basil','["400g gluten-free bread flour","2 heaped tsp golden caster sugar","2 tsp gluten-free baking powder","1 tsp fine salt","1 heaped tsp xanthan gum","5 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp olive oil","1 small onion, finely chopped","1 x 400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp caster sugar","½ small bunch basil, leaves shredded","2 x 125g balls buffalo mozzarella"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200 fan/gas 7 and put two baking sheets inside.","Make the sauce: heat the oil in a small saucepan and cook the onion with a generous pinch of salt for 10 mins over a low heat until softened. Add the chopped tomatoes, purée and sugar and bring to a gentle simmer. Cook, uncovered, for 25 - 30 mins or until reduced and thick, stirring regularly. Blitz the sauce with a hand blender until smooth. Season to taste and stir through the basil. Allow to cool a little.","Make the dough: mix the flour, sugar, baking powder, salt and xanthan gum in a large mixing bowl. Make a well in the centre and pour in 250ml warm water and the olive oil. Combine quickly with your hands, to create a thick, wet, paste-like texture, adding an extra 20ml warm water if the dough feels a little dry. Store in an airtight container or covered bowl in the fridge for up to 24 hours before using.  Lightly flour two more baking sheets. Split the dough into two and flatten with your fingers into 20 - 25cm rounds on the sheets.","Finish the bases with a thin layer of the sauce and torn up mozzarella. Place the baking sheets on top of the hot baking sheets in the oven and cook for 8 -10 mins or until crisp around the edges."]','2026-01-10 12:15:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5191,5191,'en','Gluten-free pizza dough','Don''t miss out on your favourite Italian treats, make this simple, speedy gluten-free pizza dough, ready to turn into individual pizzas or dough balls','["400g gluten-free bread flour","2 heaped tsp golden caster sugar","2 tsp gluten-free baking powder","1 tsp fine salt","1 heaped tsp xanthan gum","5 tbsp olive oil"]','["Mix the flour, sugar, baking powder, salt and xanthan gum in a large mixing bowl. Make a well in the centre and pour in 250ml warm water and the olive oil. Combine quickly with your hands, to create a thick, wet, paste-like texture, adding an extra 20ml warm water if the dough feels a little dry. Store in an airtight container or covered bowl in the fridge for up to 24 hours before using. Using the dough to make pizza? See the full recipe for gluten-free pizza."]','2026-01-10 12:15:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5193,5193,'en','Spiced salmon with beetroot, feta & wild rice','A gluten-free fish salad that''s rich in omega-3, folate and fibre. Seasoned with cumin and caraway, the salmon pairs well with vibrant, sweet beetroot and salty feta','["120g pack single salmon fillet","¼ tsp ground cumin","¼ tsp caraway seeds","1 tsp extra virgin olive oil plus extra to serve","60g wild rice","100g ready-cooked beetroot, cut any way you like","2 spring onions, sliced on a diagonal","juice ½  lemon","25g feta, roughly crumbled"]','["Before you prep the veg, coat the salmon fillet in the spices and oil then set aside to marinate. In a small saucepan with a tight-fitting lid simmer the rice over a medium heat for 25 mins.","After 15 mins, season the salmon, then place the fish, skin-side down, in a cold non-stick frying pan (this will ensure you get an evenly crispy skin). Place over a medium-high heat and cook the salmon for 5 mins, then flip it over and cook on the other side for 1-2 mins more, depending on how you like it.","Drain the rice, then return it to the saucepan and toss with the beetroot, spring onions, lemon juice and seasoning to taste. Serve the rice alongside the spiced salmon with the crumbled feta and a drizzle of olive oil on top."]','2026-01-10 12:15:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5195,5195,'en','Spice-crusted aubergines & peppers with pilaf','This recipe is laden with tasty goodness, it''s low fat, low calorie, rich in folate, fibre, vitamin C and iron, plus it''s a delicious meat-free main course that''s 3 of your 5-a-day – what''s not to love?','["2 large aubergines, halved","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 red peppers, quartered","2 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tsp chilli flakes","2 tsp za''atar","4 tbsp pomegranate molasses","140g Puy lentils","140g basmati rice","seeds from 1 pomegranate","small pack flat-leaf parsley, roughly chopped","Greek or coconut yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Using a sharp knife, score a diamond pattern into the aubergines. Brush with 1 tbsp of the oil, season well and place on a baking tray, cut-side down. Cook in the oven for 15 mins. Add the peppers to the tray, turn the aubergines over and drizzle everything with the remaining oil. Sprinkle over the spices, 1 tbsp of the pomegranate molasses and a little salt. Roast in the oven for 15 mins more.","Boil the lentils in plenty of water until al dente. After they’ve been boiling for 5 mins, add the rice. Cook for 10 mins or until cooked through but with a bit of bite. Drain and return to the pan, covered with a lid to keep warm.","Stir the pomegranate seeds and parsley through the lentil rice. Divide between four plates or tip onto a large platter. Top with the roasted veg, a dollop of yogurt and the remaining pomegranate molasses drizzled over."]','2026-01-10 12:15:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5197,5197,'en','Balsamic shallots & carrots with goat’s cheese','Sweet shallots and tangy balsamic vinegar make a perfect pairing in this delectable side dish. Crumble over a handful of soft goat''s cheese and parsley to serve','["2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","3 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp clear honey","4 thyme sprigs, leaves picked","300g baby carrots, unpeeled and scrubbed","300g banana shallots, halved lengthways, root left intact","50g soft goat’s cheese","½  small bunch parsley, roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Mix together the balsamic, oil, honey, thyme and some seasoning. Toss the veg in the dressing and spread out on a large baking tray. Roast for 45 mins until tender and beginning to caramelise. Crumble over the goat’s cheese and parsley to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5199,5199,'en','Smoked haddock & cheat’s chips','A straightforward fish supper that''s speedy to make and cheap to prepare. Enjoy this smoked haddock in a creamy, satisfying sauce with tenderstem broccoli and easy chips','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","300g Maris Piper potatoes","2 boneless, skinless undyed smoked haddock fillets (approx 300g/11oz)","140g Tenderstem broccoli","100ml double cream"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6 and heat the oil in a large frying pan. Add the potatoes and fry for 10 mins until they begin to crisp. Transfer to a baking tray and bake in the oven while you cook the haddock.","Put the haddock, broccoli and cream in the frying pan you used for the potatoes and bring to a simmer. Cover with a lid and cook for 8-10 mins, basting the haddock every now and again until it is cooked and the broccoli is tender. Serve with the chips."]','2026-01-10 12:15:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5201,5201,'en','Sri Lankan fried chicken & hoppers','Our twist on a Sri Lankan staple. Lightly-spiced, succulent chicken makes the perfect partner to hoppers – rice pancakes – served with a silky smooth coconut onion gravy','["250ml coconut milk","1 garlic clove, crushed","pinch of ground ginger","2 cardamom pods, crushed","pinch of white pepper","500g skinless chicken breasts, each cut into 3 pieces","250g rice flour","1 ½  tsp fast-action dried yeast","1 ½  tsp golden caster sugar","500ml coconut milk","rapeseed oil, for brushing","4-6 eggs","1l sunflower oil or rapeseed oil","75g gram flour","25g cornflour","100g quick-cook polenta","25g desiccated coconut","pinch of smoked paprika","pinch of cayenne pepper","1 onion, thinly sliced","1 small green chilli, halved lengthways","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","½  tsp ground turmeric","½  tsp ground fenugreek seeds","1 tsp fish sauce","2 tsp cane or light brown sugar","400ml full-fat coconut milk","125g bag baby leaf spinach, chopped","juice of 1 lime","2 onions, finely chopped","2 red chillies, finely chopped","1 tsp smoked paprika","1 tbsp lime juice"]','["To prepare the chicken, tip the coconut milk into a jug and stir in the garlic, spices and 1 tsp salt. Put the chicken in a plastic container or roasting tin and pour over the brine mix to cover. Cover with cling film and chill for 24 hrs.","For the hoppers, put the rice flour in a large bowl. In a jug, combine 125ml water with the yeast and sugar, and leave for about 8 mins until you see some foaming. Pour in the coconut milk and whisk the wet ingredients into the rice flour to make a smooth batter, slightly thinner than pancake batter. Season, cover and allow to ferment overnight in the fridge.","To make the kiri hodi, put all the ingredients (except the coconut milk, lime juice and spinach) in a heavy-based saucepan. Add 1 tbsp water and simmer over a low heat for 5 mins or until the onion softens. Pour in the coconut milk and cook for a further 1-2 mins (do not boil). Tip in the spinach, stir until wilted, then remove from the heat. Season to taste with salt and add the lime juice.","To make the sambol, use a pestle and mortar or mini processor to grind the onions with the chillies, a big pinch of salt and smoked paprika, to form a coarse paste. Season with lime juice and more salt, if needed.","To cook, remove the chicken and hoppers mix from the fridge for about 1 hr so they come to room temperature. To cook the chicken, heat the oil in a deep-fat fryer or saucepan until it reaches 180C on a cooking thermometer. To make the fried chicken coating, combine all the ingredients with 1/4 tsp salt in a bowl. Piece by piece, remove the chicken from its brine, allow the excess to drip off, then dredge it in the coating. Shake off the excess and fry in the oil for 6-8 mins until cooked through. Drain on kitchen paper, then rest in a low oven while you make the hoppers.","Make the hoppers. Whisk your hoppers base to remove any lumps. Add a splash more water to thin it if needed. Heat a non-stick frying pan, a hopper pan or small high-sided wok and brush on some rapeseed oil with kitchen paper. Add a ladle of mix to the pan and immediately swirl it around and up the edges to create a bowl-shaped pancake. Cook for 1 min, then add an egg and cover with a lid. Cook for 2-3 mins more until the egg is cooked and the edges are starting to brown. Repeat with the remaining batter and eggs. Serve the hoppers with the chicken, sambol and kiri hodi."]','2026-01-10 12:15:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5203,5203,'en','Confit chicken legs with potato hash & poached egg','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA tasty chicken dish complemented perfectly by pan-fried potato, bacon and kale, then indulgently topped with a runny egg','["4 thyme sprigs, plus 1 tbsp picked thyme leaves","25g sea salt","zest 1 lemon","2 chicken legs","1 shallot","1 garlic bulb, split in half","1 tarragon sprig","600ml olive oil","400g potatoes, diced","50g streaky bacon, cut into lardons","1 leek, cleaned and sliced","1 green chilli, chopped","50g spinach","25g kale, shredded","½  small flat-leaf parsley, a handful reserved to serve","½  tbsp Sherry or vermouth vinegar","2 eggs"]','["Mix the thyme leaves with the salt and lemon zest. Rub over the chicken legs, then chill for 1 hr. Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1.","Pat the chicken dry with kitchen paper. Place in a small roasting tin with the remaining confit ingredients. Bake in the oven for 2-2 1/2 hrs until tender, then remove from the oil and drain on a wire rack. Reserve and strain the oil – this is great for roasting veg or making more confit. Reserve the shallot and garlic.","To make the hash, heat 1 tbsp of the infused oil in a heavy-bottomed frying pan. Add the potatoes and cook for about 10 mins until they start to soften. Add the bacon and cook, stirring, until it’s crisping. Add the leeks, chilli, confit shallot and garlic (squeezed out of its skin). Cook for another 5 mins until the leeks have softened and the potatoes are cooked through. Season, then add the spinach, kale and parsley. Stir until the leaves have wilted. Add a splash of vinegar.","Poach the eggs in barely simmering water for 3 mins, then drain on kitchen paper. Serve the chicken with the hash, eggs and a sprinkling of parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:15:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5205,5205,'en','Gluten-free Yorkshire puddings','The perfect vehicle for gravy and roasted goodies: the Yorkshire pudding – this version is gluten-free but never fear, you still get that characteristic puff and golden colour','["140g gluten-free plain flour","50g cornflour","3 eggs","175ml semi-skimmed milk","sunflower oil, for drizzling"]','["Make up the batter mix. Tip the flours into a bowl with 1/2 tsp salt, make a well in the middle and crack the eggs into it. Whisk it together, then slowly add the milk, whisking all the time until lump-free. Leave to stand until you are ready to cook.","Heat oven to 230C/210C fan/gas 8. Drizzle a little oil evenly into two 12-hole non-stick muffin tins and put into the oven to heat through.","Pour the batter into a jug, then remove the hot tins from the oven. Carefully and evenly pour the batter into the holes. Put the tins back in the oven and leave undisturbed for 20-25 mins until the puddings have puffed up and browned. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:15:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5207,5207,'en','Griddled leeks & goat’s cheese','A simple but attractive way to serve leeks, in long lengths with crumbled goat''s cheese and a drizzle of balsamic, increase the quantities for a great dinner party side dish','["4-5 thin leeks, trimmed and cut in half lengthways","2 tbsp olive oil","25g pine nuts, toasted","25g goat''s cheese, crumbled","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar"]','["Brush the cut side of the leeks with 1 tbsp of the oil and season with sea salt and black pepper. Heat a griddle pan over a medium heat and place the leeks, cut-side down, in the pan. Griddle for 5 mins until the leeks have distinctive char marks and are tender.","Use the remaining oil to brush the top of the leeks, then turn over and cook for 5 mins more. Scatter over the pine nuts and goat’s cheese. Drizzle with balsamic vinegar to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5209,5209,'en','Aubergine pilau with garlicky yogurt','This wholesome and earthy pilau dish, packed with spinach and aubergine, uses ready-cooked wholegrain rice for a super quick meal','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 fat garlic cloves, 1 finely chopped, the other finely grated","1 tbsp finely chopped ginger","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","1 tbsp cumin seeds","1 aubergine (about 350g), diced","150g pot plain bio-yogurt","250g pouch cooked wholegrain pilau rice","2 large handfuls baby spinach (about 75g)","1 tbsp chopped mint, plus a few extra leaves"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick wok or deep sauté pan and add the chopped garlic, ginger, chilli and cumin seeds. Cook, stirring, until the garlic has softened. Add the aubergine and stir-fry for about 1 min more, then cover the pan and let it steam-fry for about 7 mins, stirring every now and then until the aubergine is tender, but still holds its shape. While it cooks, mix the yogurt with the grated garlic and some seasoning.","Add the rice and spinach to the pan and cook briefly to heat the rice and wilt the spinach. Stir in the mint and serve with the garlicky yogurt scattered with a few extra mint leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:15:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5211,5211,'en','Serrano-wrapped pear with goat’s cheese','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThese canapés look fancy, but are incredibly easy to assemble, and look lovely as part of a sharing platter or party nibble','["6 slices of serrano ham","1 pear","a small log (125g) of goat''s cheese (you won''t use it all)","½  a packet of rocket leaf"]','["Tear 6 slices of Serrano ham in half. Core a pear and cut into 12 slices. Place a piece of pear at the bottom of the ham slice. Add a 3cm piece of goat''s cheese and a few rocket leaves. Roll up and secure with a cocktail stick."]','2026-01-10 12:15:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5213,5213,'en','Pineapple & ginger Pavlova','Pile whipped cream and charred pineapple on a meringue base to create a stunning dinner party dessert which you can make ahead','["4 large egg whites","225g white caster sugar","1 tsp ground ginger","1 tsp cornflour","1 tsp white wine vinegar","½  large pineapple, peeled, cored and cut into 4-5 wedges","3 tbsp ginger syrup from the jar (see below), plus extra to drizzle","6 balls stem ginger in syrup, roughly chopped","500ml double cream","1 tbsp icing sugar, plus extra for dusting handful mint leaves, shredded"]','["Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2. Place the egg whites in a large very clean bowl, and whisk to stiff peaks with an electric hand whisk. Continue to whisk while you add the sugar, 1 tbsp at a time, until the mixture is thick and glossy. Continue to whisk as you add the ginger, cornflour and vinegar.","Draw a 23cm circle on a piece of baking parchment, then turn it over and place on a large baking tray. Spread out the meringue mixture to fill the circle, creating a dip in the middle and higher sides. Run a palette knife up the edges at regular intervals if you want to create ridges. Bake for 1 hr, then leave in the oven with the door shut for 8 hrs until the Pavlova is completely cool.","While the Pavlova bakes, heat a clean griddle pan over a medium-high heat until hot. Brush the pineapple wedges with the ginger syrup and griddle for 2 mins until char lines appear and the pineapple is slightly softened. Leave to cool completely, then cut into chunks. (The pineapple can be griddled the day before and chilled. Let it come to room temperature before you assemble the Pavlova. The Pavlova base can be made up to 2 days before serving, stored in an airtight container, then topped with cream and pineapple just before serving).","When you’re ready to serve, whizz the stem ginger and 2 tbsp of the syrup in the small bowl of a food processor to a chunky paste. Add the cream and icing sugar and whip to soft peaks, then spoon into the crater of the meringue. Top with the pineapple, drizzle with a little extra ginger syrup, scatter over the mint and dust with icing sugar."]','2026-01-10 12:15:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5215,5215,'en','Fruit-filled clementine cake','A beautiful, moist gluten-free cake packed with zingy citrus flavours, wonderful for Christmas','["4 small clementines","200g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","140g raisins","140g sultanas","140g currants","100g glacé cherries, quartered","2 tbsp brandy","200g dark brown sugar","3 eggs, beaten","½  tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp mixed spice","pinch ground cloves","140g polenta","1 tsp baking powder (we used Fiddes Payne, which is gluten-free)","icing sugar, to decorate (most are gluten-free, but check the packaging)","100g ground almonds","4 clementines","140g caster sugar"]','["To make the cake, place the clementines in a small pan, cover with water and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 1 hr or until tender. Drain and cool.","Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter a 20cm springform cake tin and line the base with a disc of buttered baking parchment. Cut the cooked clementines in half and remove any pips. Place in the bowl of a food processor and pulse until finely chopped but not puréed.","Combine the raisins, sultanas, currants, cherries and brandy in a bowl. Add the clementine pulp and mix well. Cream the\r\nbutter and sugar together until pale. Add the beaten eggs, a little at a time, mixing well between each addition. In another\r\nbowl, combine the spices, ground almonds, polenta and baking powder. Fold into the creamed mixture along with the dried fruit and clementine pulp.","Spoon into the prepared tin and smooth the top. Bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 30 mins. Reduce the oven  temperature to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3 and continue to cook for a further 40 mins. You may need to loosely cover the top of the cake with a sheet of baking parchment for the final 20 mins to prevent it browning too quickly. Cool in the tin for 30 mins before turning out onto a cooling rack.","To make the topping, slice the clementines to a 5mm thickness. Tip the sugar into a saucepan with 140ml water and cook over a low heat, stirring often, until the sugar has dissolved. Put the clementine slices in the pan and stir through. To keep the clementines submerged in the syrup, cut out a circle of greaseproof paper to fit into the pan and place over the fruit. Cook over a low heat for 1 hr until glossy and translucent. Remove and spread out over greaseproof paper to cool.","To serve, dust the whole cake with icing sugar, then arrange the clementine slices, overlapping, over the top of the cake."]','2026-01-10 12:15:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5217,5217,'en','Crumble-topped mince pies','Gluten and egg-free diets are catered for with these crunchy mince pies. The perfect addition to a cup of tea or glass of mulled wine','["125g unsalted butter, chilled and diced","200g gluten-free flour (we used Doves Farm), plus a little extra for rolling","1 tbsp icing sugar","grated zest 1 orange","200g gluten-free mincemeat (we used Sainsbury''s luxury mincemeat)","25g ground almonds","25g flaked almonds","pinch ground cinnamon","25g unsalted butter, melted","25g soft light brown sugar"]','["To make the pastry, rub the butter into the flour until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs. Add the icing sugar and\r\norange zest. Spoon in 4 tbsp water, mixing with a knife until the dough starts to come together. Knead lightly, flatten into a disc, wrap in cling film and chill for at least 30 mins.","Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. On a lightly floured work surface, roll the pastry out to a 2-3mm thickness. Using\r\na 9-10cm fluted cutter, stamp out discs from the pastry. Re-roll any trimmings and stamp out more discs until the pastry is used up. Line two 8-hole muffin tins with the pastry discs, then fill each pastry shell with 1 heaped tsp mincemeat and spread out to smooth. Can be frozen, uncooked, in trays for up to 1 month.","Combine the crumble ingredients in a small bowl, then sprinkle a little over the top of each mince pie. Bake on the middle shelf of the oven for about 20 mins until the pastry is cooked and golden brown. Cool in the tins for 5 mins, then serve with brandy butter or crème fraîche."]','2026-01-10 12:15:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5219,5219,'en','Chicken & leek pie','A hearty gluten- and wheat-free pie to warm up those winter evenings','["175g gluten-free flour","85g chilled butter, coarsely grated","50g mature cheddar, grated","1 tsp coarse grain mustard","500g skinless boneless chicken breasts, cut in chunks","25g butter","2 tbsp sunflower oil","2 leeks, thickly sliced","350ml hot chicken stock","1 tbsp gluten-free flour","85g watercress, chopped","4 tbsp crème fraîche","1 tbsp milk for glazing"]','["Mix the flour, a pinch of salt\r\nand the butter in a bowl, then\r\nstir in the cheese. Blend 2 tbsp\r\ncold water with the mustard\r\nand stir in. Form into a dough.\r\nWrap and chill for 30 minutes.","Fry the chicken in the hot\r\nbutter and oil for 5 minutes\r\nuntil golden. Add the leeks\r\nand fry for 2 -3 minutes until\r\nsoftened. Add the stock, bring\r\nto the boil then cover and\r\nsimmer gently for 15 minutes.","Preheat the oven to 200C/gas 6/fan 180C.Transfer the chicken and leeks to a 1.2 litre pie dish with a slotted spoon – leave the stock in the pan. Make a paste with the flour and 1 tbsp cold water. Thin with 2 tbsp stock then add to the pan and stir on the heat non-stop until thickened. Take off the heat, stir in the watercress and crème fraîche, season and pour over the chicken and leeks. Cool.","Roll out the pastry between 2 pieces of cling film until just larger than the dish. Remove the top piece of film and lift the pastry onto a rolling pin with the cling film underneath. Lay pastry-side down over the filling. Peel away the film, then trim around the rim. Make a small hole in the centre. Brush the pastry with milk. Bake for 25-30 minutes until golden."]','2026-01-10 12:15:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5221,5221,'en','Self-saucing chocolate pudding','Those on a gluten-free diet need not miss out on indulgent sponge desserts thanks to some clever swaps','["100g butter, melted, plus a little extra for greasing","200g gluten-free plain flour","50g buckwheat flour","140g golden caster sugar","50g cocoa","1 tbsp gluten-free baking powder","2 tsp xanthan gum","4 tbsp milky coffee, made in a mug as if you''re going to drink it","3 large eggs","150ml milk","100g milk chocolate, broken into chunks","vanilla ice cream or single cream, to serve","200g light muscovado sugar","25g cocoa"]','["Grease a 2-litre baking dish and heat\r\noven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Boil the\r\nkettle. Put the flours, caster sugar,\r\ncocoa, baking powder, xanthan gum\r\nand a pinch of salt in a large mixing bowl.\r\nWhisk together the coffee, eggs, melted\r\nbutter and milk, then pour onto the dry\r\ningredients and mix together until\r\nsmooth. Stir in the chocolate chunks and\r\nscrape everything into the baking dish.","Mix 300ml boiling water from the kettle\r\nwith the sugar and cocoa for the sauce,\r\nthen pour this all over the pudding batter\r\n– don’t worry if it looks unmixed at this\r\nstage! Bake on the middle shelf of the\r\noven for 30 mins until the surface looks\r\nfirm, risen and crisp. As you scoop\r\nspoonfuls into serving bowls, you should\r\nfind a glossy, rich chocolate sauce\r\nunderneath the sponge. Eat immediately\r\nwith vanilla ice cream or single cream."]','2026-01-10 12:15:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5223,5223,'en','Crumbled top mince pies','Shortcrust pastry mincemeat pies with a twist – an extra crunchy and nutty crumble on top','["225g mincemeat","225g plain flour","100g butter, chilled and cubed roughly","3 tbsp light muscovado sugar","satsuma, grated zest and juice of","2 tbsp flaked almonds","1 tbsp stem ginger syrup","icing sugar for dusting"]','["To make the pastry tip the flour into a large bowl and rub in the chilled butter using your fingertips until the mixture resembles coarse breadcrumbs. Stir in the sugar and the satsuma zest.","Spoon out 4 tbsp of the pastry mixture and set aside. Add approximately 4 tbsp of the juice from the satsumas to the main pastry mix to make a fairly soft dough, kneading gently until smooth. Wrap in cling film and chill for 30 mins.","Lightly flour a surface and roll out the pastry to a £1 coin thickness. Using a 9cm fluted cutter, stamp out 12 circles of pastry. Gently press these into individual tartlet tins, the pastry should just protrude above the tins to allow for shrinkage when cooked. Spoon the mincemeat into the pastry cases being careful not to overfill.","Sprinkle the pastry crumble mix over the mincemeat to cover lightly, top with the flaked almonds and drizzle over the stem ginger syrup. At this stage you can cover them with cling film and freeze the whole tray ready for baking.","When you''re ready to bake the mince pies, heat the over to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Remove the cling film from the tray and bake the mince pies straight from the freezer for 25 mins until golden and cooked through. Cool on a wire rack and serve dusted with icing sugar. Bake unfrozen pies for 18-20 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:15:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5225,5225,'en','Mango & passion fruit meringue roulade','Throwing a dinner party? How about making this deliciously rich and creamy meringue roulade? The best part is it''s low in fat and gluten-free','["3 large egg whites","175g caster sugar","1 level tsp cornflour","1 tsp malt vinegar","1 tsp vanilla extract","icing sugar, to dust","200g fat-free Greek yogurt","1 large ripe mango, peeled, stoned and diced","4 passion fruits, pulp only","icing sugar (optional) and a few physalis, to decorate","raspberry sauce, to serve (see ''Try'' below)"]','["Preheat the oven to 150C/\r\ngas 2/fan 130C. Line a 33x23cm\r\nswiss roll tin with non-stick baking\r\nparchment. Beat the egg whites\r\nwith an electric whisk until frothy\r\nand doubled in bulk. Slowly whisk\r\nin the caster sugar until thick and\r\nshiny. Mix the cornflour, vinegar\r\nand vanilla extract, then whisk into\r\nthe egg whites.","Spoon into the tin and level the\r\nsurface carefully, so you don’t push\r\nout the air. Bake for 30 minutes until\r\nthe meringue surface is just firm.","Remove from the oven and cover with damp greaseproof paper for\r\n10 minutes. Dust another sheet of\r\ngreaseproof paper with icing sugar.\r\nDiscard the damp paper and turn\r\nthe meringue out on to the sugarcoated\r\npaper. Peel off the lining\r\npaper, then spread yogurt over the\r\nmeringue and scatter with mango\r\nand passion fruit. Use the paper to\r\nroll up the roulade from one short\r\nend. Keep the join underneath. Sift\r\na little icing sugar on top if you like,\r\ndecorate with physalis and serve\r\nwith raspberry sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:15:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5227,5227,'en','Forest fruits clafoutis','A delicious dessert, made with gluten-free flour','["500ml frozen Black Forest fruits, thawed","5-6 tbsp golden caster sugar","15g Pure dairy-free spread","85g Doves Farm gluten-free plain flour","½ tsp ground cinnamon","4 eggs","400ml can coconut milk","3 tbsp blackcurrant or red fruit squash","½ tsp arrowroot, blended with a little water","icing sugar, to dust"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Drain the fruit reserving the juice. Toss berries with 1 tbsp sugar, then spread in an even layer in a 24cm round ovenproof dish, greased with vegetable spread.","Sift the flour and cinnamon into a large bowl and stir in the remaining sugar. In a jug, beat the eggs and coconut milk together, then whisk into the flour mixture to make a smooth batter. Pour the batter slowly over the fruit then bake for 40-45 mins.","Heat the squash and reserved juice in a pan. Stir in the arrowroot until thickened. Dust the clafoutis with icing sugar and serve drizzled with the coulis."]','2026-01-10 12:15:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5229,5229,'en','Harissa chicken traybake','Everyone loves an easy traybake, this chicken dish with spicy harissa paste is roasted to perfection with garlic, potatoes and cherry tomatoes','["3 tbsp harissa","½ x 500g pot low-fat natural yogurt","4 skinless chicken breasts, slashed","1 small butternut squash, peeled, deseeded and cut into long wedges","2 red onions, cut into wedges"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/\r\ngas 6. Mix 2 tbsp of the harissa\r\nwith 3 tbsp of the yogurt. Rub\r\nall over the chicken breasts and\r\nset aside to marinate while\r\nyou start the veg.","Toss the squash and the\r\nonions with remaining harissa,\r\nmixed with 2 tbsp oil (sunflower,\r\nvegetable or olive is fine), and some\r\nseasoning in a large roasting tin.\r\nRoast for 10 mins.","Remove veg from the oven, add\r\nthe chicken to the tin, then roast for\r\na further 20-25 mins until the chicken\r\nand veg are cooked through. Serve with\r\nthe remaining yogurt on the side, and\r\na big bowl of couscous or rice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5231,5231,'en','Polenta bruschetta with tapenade','Ideal for those on wheat-free or gluten-free diets','["700ml vegetable stock (Marigold Swiss vegetable bouillon is gluten and dairy-free)","140g instant polenta","2 tbsp chopped fresh basil","2 tbsp olive oil","9 tsp (about half a 190g jar) olive tapenade","9 SunBlush or semi-dried tomatoes, halved","100g mixed salad leaves"]','["Bring the stock to the boil in a saucepan, then reduce to a simmer. Stirring continuously, pour in the polenta in a steady steam and cook for 5 mins until thickened. Stir in the basil and season with black pepper and salt, if you like. Spread on an oiled shallow tin measuring 24 x 18cm. Leave to set for 1 hr.","Cut the polenta into 9 rectangles, each 8 x 6cm, then cut in half diagonally to make triangle shapes. Heat a griddle until hot, brush each triangle with oil and grill for 4-5 mins each side, until crisp and golden.","Top each triangle with 1?2 tsp tapenade and half a tomato. Serve warm on salad leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:15:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5233,5233,'en','Halloumi & bacon rolls','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyImpress your friends with these tasty gluten-free nibbles – ideal finger food for a buffet','["250g block halloumi cheese","10 rashers pancetta or smoked streaky bacon","1 tbsp chopped chives"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Cut\r\nthe halloumi into 20 sticks. stretch each\r\nrasher of pancetta with the back of a knife,\r\nthen cut in half. season the pancetta with\r\njust black pepper, then sprinkle with the\r\nchopped chives.","Roll the pancetta around the halloumi in\r\na spiral and arrange on a baking sheet. Bake\r\nfor 10-12 mins or until the pancetta is brown\r\nand beginning to crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:15:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5235,5235,'en','Flourless chocolate & pear cake','A light, but luscious cake made with hazelnuts – serve a slice for dessert with a dollop of crème fraîche','["85g butter, plus 1 tbsp extra for tin","85g golden caster sugar, plus extra for tin","85g gluten-free dark chocolate, broken into pieces","1 tbsp brandy","3 eggs, separated","85g hazelnuts, toasted and ground in a food processor","4 very ripe pears, peeled, halved and cored","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Cut a circle of baking parchment to fit the\r\nbase of a 25cm loose-bottomed tin. Melt\r\n1 tbsp butter and brush the inside of the tin,\r\nthen line the base with the parchment and\r\nbrush again with more butter. Spoon in\r\n2 tbsp caster sugar, swirl it around to coat\r\nthe base and sides, then tip out any excess.","Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Melt the\r\nchocolate and butter in a bowl over a pan of\r\nhot water, remove from the heat, stir in the\r\nbrandy and leave to cool. Whisk the egg yolks\r\nwith the sugar in a large bowl until pale and\r\nthick; fold into the chocolate with the hazelnuts.","In a separate bowl, with a clean whisk,\r\nbeat the whites until they reach a soft peak\r\n(try not to whisk them too stiffly or you’ll have\r\ntrouble folding them in). Stir a spoonful of\r\nthe whites into the chocolate mix,\r\nthen carefully fold in the rest of them\r\nin 2 additions. Spoon into the prepared\r\ntin. Level, then arrange the pears over the\r\nmixture, cut-side down. Bake for 40 mins\r\nuntil the pears are soft and the cake is\r\ncooked all the way through. Leave to cool\r\nin the tin slightly before releasing it, then\r\nplace on a rack to cool completely. Dust with\r\nicing sugar and serve with crème fraîche."]','2026-01-10 12:15:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5237,5237,'en','Date, banana & rum loaf','A tasty cake with no added fat or sugar – try it to believe it. Plus it’s easily made gluten-free','["250g pack stoned, ready-to-eat dates","2 small or 1 large bananas (140g/5oz in weight)","100g pecans, 85g/3oz roughly chopped, rest left whole","200g raisins","200g sultanas","100g fine polenta","2 tsp mixed spice","2 tsp baking powder (use gluten-free if needed)","3 tbsp dark rum","2 egg whites","a few banana chips and 1 tsp sugar (optional), to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Line\r\na 900g/2lb loaf tin with non-stick baking\r\npaper, using a little oil to make it stick. Put\r\nthe dates into a small pan with 200ml\r\nboiling water and simmer for 5 mins. Drain\r\nthe liquid into a jug, then put the dates into a\r\nfood processor. Add the bananas and 100ml\r\nof the date liquid and whizz until smooth.\r\nMix the nuts, dried fruit, polenta, spice and\r\nbaking powder in a bowl, then add the date\r\npurée and rum, and stir until combined.","Whisk the egg whites to soft peaks and\r\nfold into the cake mix. Tip into the tin (it will\r\nbe quite full), then top with the remaining\r\npecans and the banana chips and sugar,\r\nif using. Bake for 1 hr until golden and\r\ncrusty and a skewer comes out clean.\r\nCool completely before cutting into slices."]','2026-01-10 12:15:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5239,5239,'en','Healthy pesto eggs on toast','Try a speedy, low-fat pesto as a delicious alternative to oil for frying eggs – it adds great flavour to the dish, too, to make a perfect brunch or lunch','["2-4 thin slices rye sourdough (about 70g total, depending on the size of the loaf)","2 eggs","170g tomatoes on-the-vine","160g baby spinach","pinch of chilli flakes (optional)","1 garlic clove","10g basil","1 tbsp pine nuts","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 tbsp finely grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative"]','["To make the pesto, peel the garlic clove and put in a small food processor along with the basil, pine nuts, oil and 2 tbsp water. Blitz until smooth, then stir in the cheese. Or, blitz using ahand blender.","Toastthe bread and divide between two plates. Cook the pesto in a frying pan over a medium heat for 30 seconds, stirring. Crack the eggs into one side of the pan, put the tomatoes in the other, and fry in the pesto until the eggs are cooked to your liking.","Lift out the eggs and put each one on a slice of toast. Add the spinach to the pan with the tomatoes, turn the heat up to high and cook until wilted, about 2-3 mins. The tomatoes should be soft. Spoon the veg onto the other toast slice and sprinkle with the chilli flakes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5241,5241,'en','Tofu scramble','Try our vegan spiced tofu with cherry tomatoes for an egg-free take on scramble on toast. Perfect for breakfast, served on rye bread','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 small onion , finely sliced","1 large garlic clove , crushed","½ tsp turmeric","1 tsp ground cumin","½ tsp sweet smoked paprika","280g extra firm tofu","100g cherry tomatoes , halved","½ small bunch parsley , chopped","rye bread , to serve, (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in afrying panover a medium heat and gently fry the onion for 8 -10 mins or until golden brown and sticky. Stir in the garlic, turmeric, cumin and paprika and cook for 1 min.","Roughly mash the tofu in a bowl using a fork, keeping some pieces chunky. Add to the pan and fry for 3 mins. Raise the heat, then tip in the tomatoes, cooking for 5 mins more or until they begin to soften. Fold the parsley through the mixture. Serve on its own or with toasted rye bread (not gluten-free), if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5243,5243,'en','Matzo granola with coconut, cashew & cranberry','Enjoy this granola at breakfast during the Jewish festival of Passover, when many breads are off the menu. Try it sprinkled over a bowl of Greek yogurt and fruit','["5 sheets matzo (any type: wholemeal, rye, spelt, gluten-free)","150g cashews, coarsely chopped","150g blanched or regular almonds, coarsely chopped","6 tbsp sunflower oil","80ml maple syrup","½ tsp ground cinnamon","75g coconut flakes","100g dried cranberries"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Crumble the matzo into bite-sized pieces in a large bowl and mix with the chopped nuts.","Mix the sunflower oil, maple syrup, cinnamon and ½ tsp salt in a separate bowl, then pour this over the mixed dry ingredients. Mix well to coat and tip onto the baking sheet.","Bake for 10-15 mins, turning a couple of times so the granola browns evenly. After 10 mins, mix in the coconut flakes to cook for the final 5 mins. Keep an eye on it as it can quickly turn too dark. When it is golden-brown, remove from the oven and leave to cool on the baking sheet. It will crisp up as it cools. Stir in the cranberries, then transfer to a clean container when completely cool.","Serve with milk or Greek yogurt and chopped fruit. If you can stop snacking on it, there should be enough to get you through Passover."]','2026-01-10 12:15:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5245,5245,'en','Baked eggs with spinach, tomatoes, ricotta & basil','Serve this Italian-inspired take on a shakshuka for an easy brunch. If you’re not vegetarian, you could also add chorizo','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","pinch of chilli flakes","3 x 400g cans finely chopped tomatoes (or blitz regular canned chopped tomatoes using a food processor or hand blender)","3 tbsp sundried tomato pesto (ensure vegetarian, if needed)","200g spinach, roughly chopped","8 eggs","100g ricotta","40g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, finely grated","handful of basil leaves","crusty bread or focaccia, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large, shallow, flameproof casserole or frying pan over a low-medium heat and fry the onion with a pinch of salt for 10 mins until soft and translucent. Add the garlic and chilli flakes, and fry for 1 min more. Tip in the tomatoes, 1 tsp sugar and pesto. Season and simmer, uncovered, for 10 mins, stirring often. Tip in the spinach and cook for another 5 mins until wilted.","Heat the grill to high. Make eight gaps in the sauce with the back of a spoon and crack an egg into each. Dot over the ricotta and scatter with the parmesan. Cover and cook for 5 mins, then slide under the hot grill for a few minutes until the egg whites are set and the yolks runny. Scatter with the basil and serve with crusty bread for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:15:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5247,5247,'en','Spinach pancakes','Enjoy these spinach-based pancakes with berries and maple syrup, or remove the sugar from the batter and serve them savoury with bacon and a poached egg','["125g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","½ tbsp sugar (any kind)","2 eggs","1 tbsp melted butter, plus extra for frying","100ml milk","50g baby spinach leaves, washed and chopped","berries and maple syrup, to serve"]','["Put the flour, baking powder, sugar, eggs, butter, milk and spinach in ablenderand whizz until you get a smooth, bright green batter.","Heat a little more butter in anon-stick frying panover a medium heat and add small dollops to the pan, 2-3 at a time. Cook for 2 mins until the edges are set, and bubbles are rising to the surface, then flip and cook for 1-2 mins more. Keep warm while you cook the remaining batches.","Serve with berries and a drizzle of syrup to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5249,5249,'en','American buckwheat pancakes','Make these American pancakes made with buckwheat flour for a lazy weekend breakfast or brunch. Enjoy with blueberries or chocolate chips and maple syrup','["150g plain flour","150g buckwheat flour","2 tbsp caster sugar","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","50g butter, melted","2 large eggs","400ml buttermilk","vegetable oil, for frying","blueberries","maple syrup"]','["Combine the plain flour, buckwheat flour, sugar, ½ tsp salt, baking powder and bicarbonate of soda in a large bowl. Combine the melted butter, eggs and buttermilk in a jug andwhiskto combine. Stir the wet ingredients slowly into the dry ingredients until combined, to make a thick batter.","Heat a large non-stick pan orskilletover medium heat and brush with a light layer of vegetable oil. Add a few heaped tablespoons of the mixture into the pan and form into a circle. If your pan is large enough you can do 2-3 at a time, just don’t overcrowd the pan too. Once the edges are set and bubbles appear on the surface (around 2-3 mins) flip and cook for a further 2 mins. The pancakes should be a deep golden brown on both sides. Transfer to a warm oven on low and repeat the process until the batter is all used.","Serve stacked with fresh blueberries and maple syrup drizzled generously over the top."]','2026-01-10 12:15:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5251,5251,'en','Vanilla & cinnamon breakfast rice','Fancy a change from porridge? This healthy rice-based vanilla and cinnamon breakfast is topped with apricots and walnuts, and will fill you up for the morning','["200g wholemeal basmati rice","200ml whole milk","2 tsp vanilla extract","3 bay leaves","1 cinnamon stick","12 dried apricots split in half widthways (so they still look whole)","4 x 100ml pots bio yogurt","12 walnut halves, broken into pieces"]','["Tip the rice into a large, deep non-stick pan with 600ml water, the milk, vanilla, bay leaves and cinnamon stick. Bring to the boil, then cover with a lid and simmer for 25-30 mins until the rice is tender. Keep an eye on it to ensure it doesn’t boil dry towards the end of its cooking time.","Meanwhile, tip the apricots into a smallpanwith 300ml water and cook over a low-medium heat until tender, about 10-15 mins. Set aside.","Remove the bay leaves and cinnamon stick from the rice, then stir in half the yogurt. Both the rice and the apricots will keep chilled, separately, for up to 24 hrs. Spoon the rice into bowls and top with the remaining yogurt, the apricots and their juices and the walnuts.If you’ve prepared the rice and apricots the day before, eat cold or reheat until warm, adding a splash of milk to the rice to loosen."]','2026-01-10 12:15:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5253,5253,'en','Simit poğaçaa','Make breakfast bun simit poğaça, filled with olives, cheese and herbs for all the flavours of a Turkish breakfast. They’re delicious served with a cup of tea','["350ml whole milk","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","2 tsp caster sugar","2 egg yolks (freeze the whites for another recipe)","500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","115g unsalted butter, at room temperature, cut into pieces","1 egg, beaten","1 tsp sesame seeds","1 tsp nigella seeds","125g marinated black olives, pitted and chopped (see tip, below)","125g feta, crumbled","125g cheddar, grated","½ small bunch of parsley, chopped","75g Turkish pepper paste"]','["Heat the milk in a heatproof bowl in themicrowaveor in a pan over a low heat until lukewarm. Add the yeast and sugar, then leave to stand for 15 mins until frothy. Tip the egg yolks, flour, butter and ½ tsp salt into the bowl of a stand mixer fitted with a dough hook, and add the warm milk mixture. Knead for 10 mins – the dough should be tacky. Or, knead by hand for about 15 mins.","Cover and leave to prove for at least 1-2 hrs until doubled in size, or chill overnight. If you’re proving at room temperature, chill the dough for 30 mins after it has doubled to make it easier to work with.","Meanwhile, prepare the filling. Combine the olives, both the cheeses and the parsley, then set aside.Rollthe dough out on a lightly floured work surface into a large rectangle (about 46 x 30cm).","Spread the pepper paste all over the dough. With a long side facing you, scatter half the filling over the half of the rectangle that’s closest to you, then fold the other half over that to enclose the filling. Gently roll out the dough again to help the filling stick to the dough, then cut the rectangle vertically into 20 x 2½cm strips. Working with one strip at a time, fold the strip loosely in half, then holding it at both ends, twist, then gently pull the loose ends through the loop.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8 and line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Lay the simit on the sheet and brush with the beaten egg. Sprinkle over the sesame and nigella seeds, then leave to rest on the baking sheet for about 20 mins.","Bake for 25-30 mins, or until golden brown. Leave to cool slightly on the sheet before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:15:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5255,5255,'en','Easy protein pancakes','Up your protein with these pancakes made with eggs, oats, milk and protein powder. A great breakfast after a workout, enjoy with nut butter or fruit','["1 banana","75g oats","3 large eggs","2 tbsp milk (dairy, soya, oat or nut milks all work)","1 tbsp baking powder","pinch of cinnamon","2 tbsp protein powder (whey, pea or whatever your preference)","coconut oil, or a flavourless oil, for frying","nut butter, maple syrup and berries or sliced banana to serve"]','["Whizz the banana, oats, eggs, milk, baking powder, cinnamon and protein powder in ablenderfor 1-2 mins until smooth. Check the oats have broken down, if not, blend for another minute.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a pan. Pour or ladle in 2-3 rounds of batter, leaving a little space between each to spread. Cook for 1-2 minutes, until bubbles start to appear on the surface and the underside is golden. Flip over and cook for another minute until cooked through. Transfer to a warmed oven and repeat with the remaining batter. Serve in stacks with nut butter, maple syrup and fruit."]','2026-01-10 12:15:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5257,5257,'en','Soufflé pancakes','Try these soufflé-style pancakes for the lightest, fluffiest, dreamiest pancakes. Serve with butter, a dusting of icing sugar and a little maple syrup','["2 large eggs, separated","2 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp milk","2 tbsp self-raising flour","1 tsp vegetable oil","butter, icing sugar and maple syrup, to serve"]','["Whisk the egg whites in a clean bowl with 1 tbsp sugar using an electric whisk or astand mixerto form stiff peaks.","Beat the egg yolks, 1 tbsp sugar and vanilla together in a separate bowl until pale and foamy, and a ribbon trail is left on the surface when the beaters are removed. Gently fold in the milk and flour until just incorporated.","Fold the egg whites into the egg yolk mixture and gently turn the batter over to mix, using the side of a metal spoon orspatulato keep all the air in the mixture.","Working fairly quickly, heat a largenon-stick frying panwith a lid over a very low heat. Drizzle a little oil into the pan, then wipe it with a piece of kitchen paper – you only want a small film on the base of the pan. Make three tall pancakes by piling three spoonfuls of the batter into the pan, using about two thirds of the mixture. Keep them piled quite high, don’t tip the pan or spread them out like you would normal pancakes. Cover with a lid and cook for 2-4 mins, the steam will help them set. Remove the lid and add another dollop of batter to each pancake, this will create the classic height and thickness. Return the lid and cook for another 4-6 mins until the top feels slightly set.","Very gently, and carefully, turn the pancakes over in the pan with a fish slice or spatula. The bases should be a light golden brown. Add the lid back on and cook for another 4-6 mins until both sides are golden brown and they have a slight wobble, but are not collapsing or sticky. Serve with a pat of butter, a dusting of icing sugar and a little maple syrup."]','2026-01-10 12:15:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5259,5259,'en','Mincemeat banana bread','Start Christmas Day with a delicious breakfast you can make ahead of time. Banana bread is a family favourite, and mincemeat takes it up a notch','["150g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","90g caster sugar","2 large eggs, beaten","150g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp mixed spice","2 ripe bananas (200g), peeled and mashed","150g mincemeat (ensure it’s vegetarian, if needed)","100g salted butter, softened","2 tbsp honey","2 tsp ground cinnamon"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 900g loaf tin and line the base and sides with baking parchment. Set aside.","Beat the butter and sugar with an electricwhiskuntil light and fluffy, then slowly whisk in the beaten egg, followed by half the flour. Fold in the remaining flour, the baking powder, mixed spice, mashed bananas and mincemeat.","Pour into the tin and bake for 1 hr until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean (cover with foil if it darkens too quickly). Leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then transfer to awire rackand leave to cool completely.","To make the whipped butter, beat the butter, honey and cinnamon using an electric whisk until pale and fluffy. If you like, toast slices of the bread and spread with the butter while warm.The bread will keep in an airtight container for three days, and the butter chilled for up to five."]','2026-01-10 12:15:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5261,5261,'en','Vegan almond berry baked oats','Try our almond and mixed berry baked oats for breakfast or as a lovely, light pudding. Frozen berries are an economical choice, even in summer','["150g porridge oats","2 tsp vanilla extract","225ml unsweetened almond milk, plus extra to serve (optional)","1 large, very ripe banana, peeled","185g frozen mixed berries (ours had a combination of strawberries, blackberries and currants)","1 tsp maple syrup (optional)","1-2 tbsp toasted flaked almonds"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/ gas 5. Tip the oats into a heatproof bowl, then pour over 450ml boiling water from thekettle. Stir well, then stir in the vanilla and almond milk.","Mash the banana, then spread over the base of a medium baking dish (ours was a 20 x 28cm oval) and stir in the frozen fruit to fully combine. You want the banana to sweeten the berries, but you can add 1 tsp maple syrup, if you like. Pour over the oat mixture and scatter with the almonds. Bake for30-40 mins until set and the fruit juices are bubbling at the edges of the dish. Scoop into bowls and serve with a little extra milk, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5263,5263,'en','Saffron flatbread filled with lentils & jaggery (puran poli)','Fill Indian flatbreads with sweetened, spiced lentils for a snack often served during India’s Holi festival','["100g split yellow lentils (bengal gram or chana dhal)","125g jaggery or light muscovado sugar","2 tsp fennel seeds","¼ tsp grated nutmeg","½ tsp ground cardamom","250g plain flour","½ tsp fine salt","1 tbsp melted ghee, plus extra for rolling and cooking","¼ tsp saffron strands, soaked in 2 tbsp warm water"]','["Wash the lentils and cover with cold water in a bowl. Leave to soak overnight.","Drain the lentils and put them in apressure cooker. Pour over enough water to cover them by about 3cm. Cook for 20-30 mins, until completely soft. Alternatively, cook them in a medium pan for about 1-1½ hrs until tender, adding extra water as needed to prevent them catching. Drain and leave to cool.","Tip the cooled lentils into afood processorand whizz to a paste. Transfer the paste to a heavy-bottomed frying pan and add the jaggery, fennel seeds, nutmeg and cardamom. Cook over a medium heat for 5-7 mins, stirring all the time, until the paste has thickened. Set aside to cool.","To make the dough, sieve the flour and salt into a mixing bowl. Rub the ghee into the flour with your fingertips, then add the saffron and its soaking water followed by enough cold water (about 100-125ml) to make a soft, but not sticky, dough. Knead in the bowl until smooth, then cover and leave to rest for 30 mins.","Knead the dough for 1 min, then divide into nine 40g portions. Shape each into a 4cm diameter ball with your hands. Shape the lentil paste into slightly smaller 3cm balls in the same way.","Make an indentation in the middle of one of the dough balls with your fingers, pressing it into a bowl-like shape. Put one of the lentil balls in the cavity and pull the dough around it, pinching the edges together so the lentil ball is completely enclosed. Flatten it to a 2cm-thick disc androll it outon a lightly oiled surface to a circle 17cm in diameter. Aim for the thickness of a £1 coin.","Heat agriddleor heavy frying pan over a medium heat and carefully lift the disc onto the griddle. Drizzle 1 tsp of melted ghee around the edges and cook on one side for 2-3 mins, until it starts to colour. Flip over using a fish slice and spoon another 1-2 tsp melted ghee around the edges. Cook  for a further 2-3 mins until golden. Repeat this process with the remaining dough balls. Serve straightaway with a glass of chilled milk or masala chai."]','2026-01-10 12:15:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5265,5265,'en','Chia & oat breakfast scones with yogurt and berries','These healthy breakfast scones have a slightly bouncier texture than traditional ones, but make a lovely start to the day and provide folate, vitamin C and fibre.','["2 tsp cold pressed rapeseed oil, plus a little for the ramekins","50ml milk","1 tbsp lemon juice","2 tsp vanilla extract","160g plain wholemeal spelt flour","2 tbsp chia seeds","25g oats","2 tsp baking powder","2 x 120g pots bio Greek yogurt","400g strawberries, hulled and sliced"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line the base of 4 x 185ml ramekins with a disc of baking parchment and oil the sides with the rapeseed oil. Measure the milk in a jug and make up to 300ml with water. Stir in the lemon juice, vanilla and the 2 tsp oil. Mix the flour, seeds and oats then blitz in a food processor to make the mix as fine as you can. Stir in the baking powder.","Pour in the liquid, then stir in with the blade of a knife until you have a very wet batter like dough. Spoon evenly into the ramekins then bake on a baking sheet for 20 mins until risen – they don’t have to be golden but should feel firm. Cool for a few mins then run a knife round the inside of the ramekins to loosen the scones then carefully ease out.","The scones can be eaten immediately or cooled and stored for later. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, this recipe can be used for two people over two meals, use two scones straight away split in half and served topped with half the yogurt and two portions of the berries. Cool and pack the remainder to eat on another day on the plan."]','2026-01-10 12:15:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5267,5267,'en','Healthy porridge bowl','Start your day right with this filling bowl of oats, berries, banana and seeds. It''s healthy and packed with nutrients to fuel body and mind','["100g frozen raspberries","1 orange, ½  sliced and ½  juiced","150g porridge oats","100ml milk","½ banana, sliced","2 tbsp smooth almond butter","1 tbsp goji berries","1 tbsp chia seeds"]','["Tip half the raspberries and all of the orange juice in a pan. Simmer until the raspberries soften, about 5 mins.","Meanwhile stir the oats, milk and 450ml water in a pan over a low heat until creamy. Top with the raspberry compote, remaining raspberries, orange slices, banana, almond butter, goji berries and chia seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:15:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5269,5269,'en','Healthy shakshuka','Start the day on a lighter note with this satisfying shakshuka, a wonderful pan full of tomatoes, pepper, spinach and eggs. It packs in four of your 5-a-day','["1 tbsp cold pressed rapeseed oil","1 red onion, cut into thin wedges","1 red pepper, finely sliced","1 yellow pepper, finely sliced","3 large garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp coriander seeds, crushed","1 heaped tsp sweet smoked paprika","400g can cherry tomatoes","115g baby spinach","4 medium eggs","½ small bunch coriander, roughly chopped","½ small bunch dill, roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large, non-stick frying pan. Add the onion and peppers and fry over a medium heat for 8-10 mins until the veg is beginning to soften. Add the garlic, cumin, coriander and paprika and fry for 1 min more. Tip in the tomatoes, spinach and 100ml water and bubble until the spinach has wilted, then lower to a simmer and cook, uncovered, for 10 mins. Season to taste.","Make four indentations in the tomato mixture and gently crack an egg into each one. Cover with a lid or foil and cook over a gentle heat for 8-10 mins, or until the eggs are just set. Uncover, scatter with the fresh herbs and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5271,5271,'en','Avocado & black bean eggs','Set yourself up for the day with this healthy veggie breakfast with eggs, avocado and black beans. It takes just 10 minutes to throw together and makes a great lunch, too','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 red chilli, deseeded and thinly sliced","1 large garlic clove, sliced","2 large eggs","400g can black beans","½  x 400g can cherry tomatoes","¼ tsp cumin seeds","1 small avocado, halved and sliced","handful fresh, chopped coriander","1 lime, cut into wedges"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying pan. Add the chilli and garlic and cook until softened and starting to colour. Break in the eggs on either side of the pan. Once they start to set, spoon the beans (with their juice) and the tomatoes around the pan and sprinkle over the cumin seeds. You’re aiming to warm the beans and tomatoes rather than cook them.","Remove the pan from the heat and scatter over the avocado and coriander. Squeeze over half of the lime wedges. Serve with the remaining wedges on the side for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:15:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5273,5273,'en','Breakfast burrito','Make a nutritious cocoon for breakfast ingredients with a wholemeal wrap – we’ve included protein-rich eggs and avocado to add good fats to this burrito','["1 tsp chipotle paste","1 egg","1 tsp rapeseed oil","50g kale","7 cherry tomatoes, halved","½  small avocado, sliced","1 wholemeal tortilla wrap, warmed"]','["Whisk the chipotle paste with the egg and some seasoning in a jug. Heat the oil in a large frying pan, add the kale and tomatoes.","Cook until the kale is wilted and the tomatoes have softened, then push everything to the side of the pan. Pour the beaten egg into the cleared half of the pan and scramble. Layer everything into the centre of your wrap, topping with the avocado, then wrap up and eat immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:15:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5275,5275,'en','Overnight oats','Adapt this recipe for easy overnight oats to suit your tastes. You can add dried fruit, seeds and nuts, grated apple or pear, or chopped tropical fruits','["¼ tsp ground cinnamon","50g rolled porridge oats","2 tbsp natural yogurt","50g mixed berries","drizzle of honey","½ tbsp nut butter(we used almond)"]','["The night before serving, stir the cinnamon and 100ml water (or milk) into your oats with a pinch of salt.","The next day, loosen with a little more water (or milk) if needed. Top with the yogurt, berries, a drizzle of honey and the nut butter."]','2026-01-10 12:15:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5277,5277,'en','Banana & oat pancakes','Make our healthier pancakes using rolled oats and banana for natural sweetness. Serve with a dollop of creamy yogurt and fresh fruit','["125ml oat milk","2 eggs, separated","1 small banana","100g rolled oats","2 tsp baking powder","few drops vanilla extract","oil spray","low fat yogurt and fruit to top"]','["Put the oat milk, egg yolks, banana, oats, baking powder and vanilla in a blender and process to as smooth a mixture as you can get. Whisk the eggs whites until they hold stiff peaks. Whisk 1-2 tbsp of the whites into the batter, then fold in the rest.","Heat a non-stick pan over a medium heat and spray with a whisper of oil, pour about 2 tbsp of batter into the pan and cook for 1-2 mins, until the base sets and bubbles appear all over the top. Flip and cook the other side for a minute. Repeat in batches, making sure the top looks dryish before attempting the flip, or the centre will collapse."]','2026-01-10 12:15:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5279,5279,'en','Herb omelette with fried tomatoes','Make a perfect, protein-rich brunch or breakfast for two people. This healthy omelette can be on the table in just 10 minutes, served with juicy tomatoes','["1 tsp rapeseed oil","3 tomatoes, halved","4 large eggs","1 tbsp chopped parsley","1 tbsp chopped basil"]','["Heat the oil in a small non-stick frying pan, then cook the tomatoes cut-side down until starting to soften and colour. Meanwhile, beat the eggs with the herbs and plenty of freshly ground black pepper in a small bowl.","Scoop the tomatoes from the pan and put them on two serving plates. Pour the egg mixture into the pan and stir gently with a wooden spoon so the egg that sets on the base of the pan moves to enable uncooked egg to flow into the space. Stop stirring when it’s nearly cooked to allow it to set into an omelette. Cut into four and serve with the tomatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:15:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5281,5281,'en','Three-grain porridge','This healthy breakfast, made from toasted oatmeal, spelt and barley, is super simple to make and can be kept for up to six months','["300g oatmeal","300g spelt flakes","300g barley flakes","agave nectar and sliced strawberries, to serve (optional)"]','["Working in batches, toast the oatmeal, spelt flakes and barley in a large, dry frying pan for 5 mins until golden, then leave to cool and store in an airtight container.","When you want to eat it, simply combine 50g of the porridge mixture in a saucepan with 300ml milk or water. Cook for 5 mins, stirring occasionally, then top with a drizzle of honey and strawberries, if you like (optional). Will keep for 6 months."]','2026-01-10 12:15:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5283,5283,'en','Summer porridge','A healthy, summery vegan porridge with jumbo oats and bright pink pomegranate seeds','["300ml almond milk","200g blueberries","½  tbsp maple syrup","2 tbsp chia seeds","100g jumbo oats","1 kiwi fruit, cut into slices","50g pomegranate seeds","2 tsp mixed seeds"]','["In a blender, blitz the milk, blueberries and maple syrup until the milk turns purple. Put the chia and oats in a mixing bowl, pour in the blueberry milk and stir very well. Leave to soak for 5 mins, stirring occasionally, until the liquid has absorbed, and the oats and chia thicken and swell.","Stir again, then divide between two bowls. Arrange the fruit on top, then sprinkle over the mixed seeds. Will keep in the fridge for 1 day. Add the toppings just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:15:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5285,5285,'en','Cardamom & peach quinoa porridge','A healthy breakfast of oats and quinoa with fresh ripe peach. Almond milk makes its suitable for dairy-free and vegan diets','["75g quinoa","25g porridge oats","4 cardamom pods","250ml unsweetened almond milk","2 ripe peaches, cut into slices","1 tsp maple syrup"]','["Put the quinoa, oats and cardamom pods in a small saucepan with 250ml water and 100ml of the almond milk. Bring to the boil, then simmer gently for 15 mins, stirring occasionally.","Pour in the remaining almond milk and cook for 5 mins more until creamy.","Remove the cardamom pods, spoon into bowls or jars, and top with the peaches and maple syrup."]','2026-01-10 12:15:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5287,5287,'en','Orange & blueberry Bircher','Soaking oats and seeds overnight makes them easily digestible. Add in the fruit and you''ve got a nutritious start to the day with the right kind of fats, fibre, vitamins and minerals','["70g porridge oats","2 tbsp golden linseeds","zest of ½  an orange","¾  of a 175g tub yogurt","2 peeled and chopped oranges","4 handfuls blueberries from a 150g pack"]','["Mix 70g oats and 2 tbsp golden linseeds with the zest of 1 /2 an orange. Pour over 300ml boiling water and leave overnight. The next day, stir in three-quarters of a 175g tub of yogurt, spoon into glasses or bowls, top with 2 peeled and chopped oranges, the remaining yogurt and 4 handfuls blueberries from a 150g pack."]','2026-01-10 12:15:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5289,5289,'en','Scrambled eggs with basil, spinach & tomatoes','Forget toast and serve your scrambled eggs with fresh tomatoes and spinach for a speedy supercharged breakfast','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil, plus 1 tsp","3 tomatoes, halved","4 large eggs","4 tbsp natural bio yogurt","? small pack basil, chopped","175g baby spinach, dried well (if it needs washing)"]','["Heat 1 tsp oil in a large non-stick frying pan, add the tomatoes and cook, cut-side down, over a medium heat. While they are cooking, beat the eggs in a jug with the yogurt, 2 tbsp water, plenty of black pepper and the basil.","Transfer the tomatoes to serving plates. Add the spinach to the pan and wilt, stirring a few times while you cook the eggs.","Heat the rest of the oil in a non-stick pan over a medium heat, pour in the egg mixture and stir every now and then until scrambled and just set. Spoon the spinach onto the plates and top with the scrambled eggs."]','2026-01-10 12:15:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5291,5291,'en','Bircher muesli with apple & banana','Soaking oats and seeds overnight makes them easier to digest, and the muesli will be extra creamy. Great for a quick breakfast straight from the fridge','["1 eating apple, coarsely grated","50g jumbo porridge oats","25g mixed seeds (such as sunflower, pumpkin, sesame and linseed)","25g mixed nuts (such as Brazils, hazelnuts, almonds, pecans and walnuts), roughly chopped","¼ tsp ground cinnamon","100g full-fat natural bio-yogurt","1 medium banana, sliced","25g organic sultanas"]','["Put the grated apple in a bowl and add the oats, seeds, half the nuts and the cinnamon. Toss together well. Stir in the yogurt and 100ml cold water, cover and chill for several hours or overnight. Spoon the muesli into two bowls and top with the sliced banana, sultanas and remaining nuts."]','2026-01-10 12:15:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5293,5293,'en','Poached eggs with broccoli, tomatoes & wholemeal flatbread','Protein-packed eggs with antioxidant-rich broccoli make this a healthy and satisfying breakfast choice','["100g thin-stemmed broccoli, trimmed and halved","200g cherry tomatoes on the vine","4 medium free-range eggs (fridge cold)","2 wholemeal flatbreads (see Goes well with for recipe)","2 tsp mixed seeds (such as sunflower, pumpkin, sesame and linseed)","1 tsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","good pinch of chilli flakes"]','["Boil the kettle. Heat oven to 120C/100C fan/gas 1/2 and put an ovenproof plate inside to warm up. Fill a wide-based saucepan one-third full of water from the kettle and bring to the boil. Add the broccoli and cook for 2 mins. Add the tomatoes, return to the boil and cook for 30 secs. Lift out with tongs or a slotted spoon and place on the warm plate in the oven while you poach the eggs.","Return the water to a gentle simmer. Break the eggs into the pan, one at a time, and cook for 2 1/2 - 3 mins or until the whites are set and the yolks are runny.","Divide the flatbreads between the two plates and top with the broccoli and tomatoes. Use a slotted spoon to drain the eggs, then place on top. Sprinkle with the seeds and drizzle with the oil. Season with a little black pepper and the chilli flakes, and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:15:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5295,5295,'en','Orange & raspberry granola','Make your own oat milk in this recipe for no-added-sugar granola, or serve with organic cow’s milk or yogurt','["400g jumbo oats","juice 2 oranges (150ml), plus zest of ½","1 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tbsp freeze-dried raspberries or strawberries (see tip)","25g flaked almonds, toasted","25g mixed seeds (such as sunflower, pumpkin, sesame and linseed)","2 large oranges, peeled and segmented","mint leaves (optional)"]','["Put 200g oats and 500ml water in a food processor and blitz for 1 min. Line a sieve with clean muslin and pour in the oat mixture. Leave to drip through for 5 mins, then twist the ends of the muslin and squeeze well to capture as much of the oat milk as possible – it should be the consistency of single cream. Best chilled at least 1 hr before serving. Can be kept in a sealed or covered jug in the fridge for up to 3 days.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a baking tray with baking parchment. Put the orange juice in a medium saucepan and bring to the boil. Boil rapidly for 5 mins or until the liquid has reduced by half, stirring occasionally. Mix the remaining 200g oats with the orange zest and cinnamon. Remove the pan from the heat and stir the oat mixture into the juice. Spread over the lined tray in a thin layer and bake for 10-15 mins or until lightly browned and crisp, turning the oats every few mins. Leave to cool on the tray.","Once cool, mix the oats with the raspberries, flaked almonds and seeds. Can be kept in a sealed jar for up to one week. To serve, spoon the granola into bowls, pour over the oat milk and top with the orange segments and mint leaves, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5297,5297,'en','Smoky beans on toast','Forget shop-bought cans of baked beans, this homemade version is tastier and healthier, with an impressive 4 of your 5 a day','["½  tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","½  small onion, sliced","½  small red pepper, thinly sliced into strips","1 garlic clove, halved","227g can chopped tomatoes","½  tsp smoked paprika","2 tsp red wine vinegar","210g can butter beans or chickpeas, drained","¼ tsp sugar","1 slice seeded bread","a few parsley sprigs, finely chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a small pan, add the onion and pepper, and fry gently until soft, about 10-15 mins. Crush half the garlic and add this to the pan, along with the tomatoes, paprika, vinegar, beans, sugar and some seasoning. Bring to a simmer and cook for 10-15 mins or until slightly reduced and thickened.","Toast the bread, rub with the remaining garlic and drizzle with a little oil. Spoon the beans over the toast, drizzle with a little more oil and scatter over the parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:15:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5299,5299,'en','Creamy mustard mushrooms on toast with a glass of juice','A quick and healthy vegetarian breakfast with a light cream cheese sauce','["1 slice wholemeal bread","1½  tbsp light cream cheese","1 tsp rapeseed oil","3 handfuls sliced, small flat mushrooms","2 tbsp skimmed milk","¼ tsp wholegrain mustard","1 tbsp snipped chives","150ml orange juice freshly squeezed or from a carton"]','["Toast the bread, then spread with a little of the cheese (don’t use butter).","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a non-stick pan and cook the mushrooms, stirring frequently, until softened. Spoon in the milk, remaining cheese and the mustard. Stir well until coated. Tip onto the toast, top with chives and serve with the juice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5301,5301,'en','Mushroom & basil omelette with smashed tomato','A vegetarian breakfast with bite, try this egg dish with cream cheese, herbs and grilled tomatoes','["2 tomatoes, halved","3 medium eggs","1 tbsp snipped chive","300g chestnut mushrooms, sliced","1 tsp unsalted butter","2 tbsp low-fat cream cheese","1 tbsp finely chopped basil leaves"]','["Heat the grill to its highest setting and place the tomatoes on a square of foil underneath, turning occasionally to prevent burning. When the tomatoes are slightly scorched, remove from the grill, squashing them slightly to release the juices.","Break the eggs into a bowl and mix with a fork. Add a small splash of water and mix. Add the chives and some black pepper, and beat some more. Set aside while you prepare the mushrooms.","In a non-stick frying pan, heat the butter over a medium heat until foaming. Add the mushrooms and cook for 5-8 mins until tender, stirring every few mins. Remove and set aside.","Briskly stir the egg mixture, then add to the hot pan (tilting it so that the mixture covers the entire base) and leave for 10 secs or so until it begins to set. With a fork, gently stir the egg here and there so that any unset mixture gets cooked.","While the egg mixture is still slightly loose, spoon the mushroom mix onto one side of the omelette, and top with the cream cheese and basil leaves. Flip the other side of the omelette over to cover, if you like. Leave to cook for 1 min more, then cut in half and slide each half onto a plate. Serve immediately with the tomatoes on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:15:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5303,5303,'en','Kedgeree with poached egg','This curried fish and rice dish is suitable for brunch, breakfast or a main course at dinnertime. Replace traditional boiled eggs with poached','["300g long grain rice","2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","390g pack fish pie mix, defrosted if frozen","1 heaped tbsp mild or medium curry powder","juice 1 lemon","¼ small pack parsley, chopped","4 eggs"]','["Cook the rice following pack instructions, then drain and set aside. Meanwhile, heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a non-stick frying pan and cook the onion and garlic for 5 mins. Toss the fish pieces with the curry powder and remaining oil. Add to the pan. Cook for another 5 mins, stirring carefully and turning the fish.","Add the rice to the pan and turn up the heat, then stir well (the fish will break up a little). Cook for 1-2 mins, then stir in the lemon and parsley. Turn the heat down as low as it will go, and put on a lid.","Bring a pan of water to the boil, turn down the heat and poach the eggs. Season the kedgeree and divide between plates, topping each with a poached egg."]','2026-01-10 12:15:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5305,5305,'en','Clementine & honey couscous','Pistachios, clementines, honey and cinnamon make couscous a perfect breakfast dish. Serve with fruit and yogurt','["100g pistachios or other nuts","300g couscous","¼ tsp ground cinnamon, plus more to serve","8 clementines (seedless are best)","1 tsp butter","2 tbsp runny honey, plus more to serve","1 tsp orange flower water (optional)","300g fresh or frozen raspberries","500g pot reduced-fat Greek-style yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Spread the nuts over a baking sheet and toast for 5-8 mins until pale golden. Meanwhile, put the couscous and cinnamon into a large bowl. Finely grate the zest from 2 clementines, then squeeze their juice into a pan with the zest. Add the butter, honey and 200ml water and bring to the boil. Pour this over the couscous, cover with cling film, then leave to absorb for 10 mins.","Using a serrated knife, peel, then thinly slice the remaining clementines. Sprinkle with the orange flower water, if using. Roughly chop the nuts.","Fluff up the couscous with a fork, then mix in most of the nuts. Serve the couscous in bowls, topped with the clementines and raspberries. Eat with a spoonful of yogurt, an extra sprinkle of cinnamon and squeeze of honey."]','2026-01-10 12:15:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5307,5307,'en','Fig, nut & seed bread with ricotta & fruit','Start the day well with this fruit and nut breakfast loaf, spread with cream cheese and topped with orange or apple. It keeps for a month, too','["400ml hot strong black tea","100g dried figs, hard stalks removed, thinly sliced","140g sultanas","50g porridge oats","200g self-raising wholemeal flour","1 tsp baking powder","100g mixed nuts (almonds, walnuts, Brazils, hazelnuts), plus 50g for the topping","1 tbsp golden linseed","1 tbsp sesame seed, plus 2 tsp to sprinkle","25g pumpkin seeds","1 large egg","25g ricotta per person","1 orange or green apple, thickly sliced, per person"]','["Heat oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3½. Pour the tea into a large bowl and stir in the figs, sultanas and oats. Set aside to soak.","Meanwhile, line the base and sides of a 1kg loaf tin with baking parchment. Mix together the flour, baking powder, nuts and seeds. Beat the egg into the cooled fruit mixture, then stir the dry ingredients into the wet. Pour into the tin, then level the top and scatter with the extra nuts and sesame seeds.","Bake for 1 hr, then cover the top with foil and bake for 15 mins more until a skewer inserted into the centre of the loaf comes out clean. Remove from the tin to cool, but leave the parchment on until cold. Cut into slices, spread with ricotta and serve with fruit.Will keep in the fridge for 1 month, or freeze in slices."]','2026-01-10 12:15:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5309,5309,'en','Breakfast muffins','Make muffins healthier with mashed banana and apple sauce for natural sweetness, plus blueberries and seeds for an extra nutritious hit','["2 large eggs","150ml pot natural low-fat yogurt","50ml rapeseed oil","100g apple sauce or pureed apples (find with the baby food)","1 ripe banana, mashed","4 tbsp clear honey","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g wholemeal flour","50g rolled oats, plus extra for sprinkling","1½  tsp baking powder","1½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","1½  tsp cinnamon","100g blueberries","2 tbsp mixed seeds (we used pumpkin, sunflower and flaxseed)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line\r\na 12-hole muffin tin with 12 large muffin\r\ncases. In a jug, mix the eggs, yogurt, oil,\r\napple sauce, banana, honey and vanilla.\r\nTip the remaining ingredients, except the\r\nseeds, into a large bowl, add a pinch of\r\nsalt and mix to combine.","Pour the wet ingredients into the dry\r\nand mix briefly until you have a smooth\r\nbatter – don’t overmix as this will make\r\nthe muffins heavy. Divide the batter\r\nbetween the cases. Sprinkle the muffins\r\nwith the extra oats and the seeds. Bake\r\nfor 25-30 mins until golden and well risen,\r\nand a skewer inserted into the centre of\r\na muffin comes out clean. Remove from\r\nthe oven, transfer to a wire rack and\r\nleave to cool.Can be stored in a sealed\r\ncontainer for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:15:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5311,5311,'en','Dippy eggs with Marmite soldiers','Start the day the right way, with this quick, easy and nutritious breakfast','["2 eggs","4 slices wholemeal bread","a knob of butter","Marmite","mixed seeds"]','["Bring a pan of water to a simmer. Add\r\n2 eggs, simmer for 2 mins if room temp,\r\n3 mins if fridge-cold, then turn off heat.\r\nCover the pan and leave for 2 mins more.","Meanwhile, toast 4 slices wholemeal\r\nbread and spread thinly with butter, then\r\nMarmite. To serve, cut into soldiers and\r\ndip into the egg, then a few mixed seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:15:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5313,5313,'en','Good-for-you granola','Try this energy-boosting granola breakfast to start your day – it’s good for you!','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","125ml maple syrup","2 tbsp honey","1 tsp vanilla extract","300g rolled oats","50g sunflower seeds","4 tbsp sesame seeds","50g pumpkin seeds","100g flaked almonds","100g dried berries (find them in the baking aisle)","50g coconuts flakes or desiccated coconut"]','["Heat oven to 150C/fan 130C/gas 2. Mix the oil, maple syrup, honey and vanilla in a large bowl. Tip in all the remaining ingredients, except the dried fruit and coconut, and mix well.","Tip the granola onto two baking sheets and spread evenly. Bake for 15 mins, then mix in the coconut and dried fruit, and bake for 10-15 mins more. Remove and scrape onto a flat tray to cool. Serve with cold milk or yogurt. The granola can be stored in an airtight container for up to a month."]','2026-01-10 12:15:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5319,5319,'en','Blueberry & lemon pancakes','Get kids to help prepare a batch of American-style cakes – the zesty-berry topping makes these a healthy brunch option','["200g plain flour","1 tsp cream of tartar","½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp golden syrup","75g blueberries","zest 1 lemon","200ml milk","1 large egg","butter, for cooking"]','["First, put the flour, cream\r\nof tartar and bicarbonate of\r\nsoda in the bowl. Mix them\r\nwell with the fork. Drop the golden\r\nsyrup into the dry ingredients\r\nalong with the blueberries and\r\nlemon zest.","Pour the milk into a\r\nmeasuring jug. Now break\r\nin the egg and mix well\r\nwith a fork. Pour most of the milk\r\nmixture into the bowl and mix\r\nwell with a rubber spatula. Keep\r\nadding more milk until you get a\r\nsmooth, thick, pouring batter.","Heat the frying pan and\r\nbrush with a little butter.\r\nThen spoon in the batter,\r\n1 tbsp at a time, in heaps. Bubbles\r\nwill appear on top as the pancakes\r\ncook – turn them at this stage,\r\nusing the metal spatula to help\r\nyou. Cook until brown on the\r\nsecond side, then keep warm on\r\na plate, covered with foil. Repeat\r\nuntil all the mixture is used up."]','2026-01-10 12:15:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5321,5321,'en','Dried fruit compote','A healthy fruit compote with fat-free yoghurt for breakfast will keep your energy up until lunchtime','["140g dried fruits (we used apricots, cherries and sultanas)","½  tsp cinnamon","300ml apple juice","200g tub fat-free Greek yogurt","100g granola"]','["Put the dried fruit into a small pan\r\nwith the cinnamon and apple juice, give\r\neverything a stir then simmer for 5 mins\r\nuntil the apple juice is syrupy. Remove\r\nfrom the heat and allow to cool.","Divide the yogurt between 4 bowls\r\nthen top with the compote and granola."]','2026-01-10 12:15:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5323,5323,'en','Skinny pepper, tomato & ham omelette','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyIf you’re in need of a protein boost try making this healthy omelette for breakfast, using fewer yolks lowers the cholesterol','["2 whole eggs and 3 egg whites","1 tsp olive oil","1 red pepper, deseeded and finely chopped","2 spring onions, white and green parts kept separate and finely chopped","few slices wafer-thin extra-lean ham, shredded","25g reduced-fat mature cheddar","wholemeal toast, to serve"]','["Mix the eggs and egg whites\r\nwith some seasoning and set aside.\r\nHeat the oil in a medium non-stick\r\nfrying pan and cook the pepper for\r\n3-4 mins. Throw in the white parts\r\nof the spring onions and cook for\r\n1 min more. Pour in the eggs and\r\ncook over a medium heat until\r\nalmost completely set.","Sprinkle on the ham and cheese\r\nand continue cooking until just set\r\nin the centre, or flash it under a hot\r\ngrill if you like it more well done.\r\nServe straight from the pan with\r\nthe green part of the spring onion\r\nsprinkled on top and some\r\nwholemeal toast."]','2026-01-10 12:15:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5325,5325,'en','Melon & crunchy bran pots','Not just for breakfast, this healthy pot of yoghurt, fruit and seeds is a real mid-afternoon hunger booster and ready in 10 minutes','["½ x 200g pack melon medley","150g pot fat-free yogurt","2 tbsp fruit & fibre cereal","1 tbsp mixed seed","1 tsp clear honey"]','["Top melon medley with\r\nyogurt, then sprinkle\r\nover cereal mixed\r\nwith seeds. Drizzle over honey and eat immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:15:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5327,5327,'en','Grilled pesto tomatoes on toast','It’s colourful, full of flavour and low in fat – it could be the perfect quick snack','["2 medium tomatoes","1 tbsp pesto sauce","a slice country-style bread"]','["Halve the tomatoes. Thin the pesto sauce with a little water and brush half on the tomatoes. Cook under a hot grill for 5-7 mins until softened. At the same time, toast the slice of bread, then spread with the remaining pesto mix. Top with the hot tomatoes, squashing them slightly."]','2026-01-10 12:15:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5331,5331,'en','Get up and go breakfast muffins','With apple, blueberry, banana and seeds, this breakfast-on-the-go tastes great, is low in calories and uses honey instead of sugar','["2 large eggs","150ml pot natural low-fat yogurt","50ml rapeseed oil","100g apple sauce or puréed apples","1 ripe banana, mashed","4 tbsp honey","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g wholemeal flour","50g rolled oats, plus extra for sprinkling","1½  tsp baking powder","1½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","1½  tsp cinnamon","100g blueberries","2 tbsp mixed seeds, we used pumpkin, sunflower and flaxseed"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a 12-hole muffin tray with 12 large muffin cases. In a jug, mix the eggs, yogurt, oil, apple sauce, banana, honey and vanilla. Tip the remaining ingredients, except the seeds, into a large bowl, add a pinch of salt and mix to combine.","Pour the wet ingredients into the dry, mix briefly until you have a smooth batter, don’t over mix as this will make the muffins heavy. Spoon the batter between the cases. Sprinkle the muffins with the extra oats and the seeds. Bake for 25-30 mins until golden and well risen, and a skewer inserted to the centre of a muffin comes out clean. Remove from the oven, transfer to a wire rack and leave to cool. Store in a sealed container for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:15:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5333,5333,'en','Crunchy granola with berries & cherries','Make your breakfast a fruity feast – this recipe is full of crunchy goodness','["175g mixed nuts (pecan halves and peanuts in their red skins)","450g rolled oats","50g sesame seeds","50g sunflower seeds","125ml sunflower oil","100ml runny honey (try one of the lightly flavoured flower ones)","half a 170g packet dried berries and cherry"]','["Preheat the oven to 190C/Gas 5/fan\r\noven 170C. Halve some of the pecans, leave\r\nsome whole. Mix with peanuts, oats, sesame\r\nseeds, sunflower seeds and a pinch of salt in\r\na large bowl. In a jug, measure the oil and\r\npour into the mixture, then measure the\r\nhoney – it will slide out easily. Stir together\r\nwith a fork to break up any big clumps of oats.","Pour on to a large baking tray with\r\nsides, preferably non-stick, in a thin layer.\r\nBake for 20-25 minutes, stirring well at\r\nleast twice and bringing the mixture\r\nin from the edges, until it is golden.\r\nTransfer to a large bowl and leave to cool.","Mix in the berries and cherries\r\nand serve with plenty of chilled milk.","Store for up to 1 month in airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:15:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5335,5335,'en','Healthy banana bread','Have your cake and eat it with this low-fat, healthy banana loaf – perfect for breakfast and beyond','["low-fat spread, for the tin, plus extra to serve","140g wholemeal flour","100g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp baking powder","300g mashed bananas from overripe black bananas","4 tbsp agave syrup","3 large eggs, beaten with a fork","150ml pot low-fat natural yogurt","25g chopped pecans or walnuts (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line a 2lb loaf tin with baking\r\nparchment (allow it to come 2cm above\r\ntop of tin). Mix the flours, bicarb, baking\r\npowder and a pinch of salt in a large bowl.","Mix the bananas, syrup, eggs and yogurt.\r\nQuickly stir into dry ingredients, then gently\r\nscrape into the tin and scatter with nuts,\r\nif using. Bake for 1 hr 10 mins-1 hr 15 mins\r\nor until a skewer comes out clean.","Cool in tin on a wire rack. Eat warm or\r\nat room temperature, with low-fat spread."]','2026-01-10 12:15:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5337,5337,'en','High-fibre muesli','Make your own muesli packed with fibre and great flavour using jumbo oats for slow-release energy, linseed and apricots. An easy, healthy breakfast','["300g jumbo oats","100g Allbran","25g wheatgerm","100g dark raisins","140g ready-to-eat apricots, snipped into chunks","50g golden linseeds"]','["Mix everything in a large bowl.","Pour lots of chilled milk\r\nover and let it soak while you make\r\ntea. If you want to sweeten it, grate\r\nover some unpeeled apple and\r\nsprinkle with dark muscovado sugar.","Store for up to 2 months, airtight."]','2026-01-10 12:15:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5339,5339,'en','Tomato baked eggs','Whip up these easy baked eggs with a garlicky tomato sauce and serve with crusty bread for a lazy weekend brunch, or light lunch, that''s sure to satisfy','["900g ripe vine tomatoes","3 garlic cloves","3 tbsp olive oil","4 large free range eggs","2 tbsp chopped parsley and/or chives"]','["Preheat the oven to fan 180C/\r\nconventional 200C/gas 6. Cut the\r\ntomatoes into quarters or thick\r\nwedges, depending on their size,\r\nthen spread them over a fairly\r\nshallow 1.5 litre ovenproof dish.\r\nPeel the garlic, slice thinly and\r\nsprinkle over the tomatoes.\r\nDrizzle with the olive oil, season\r\nwell with salt and pepper and stir\r\neverything together until the\r\ntomatoes are glistening.","Slide the dish into the oven and\r\nbake for 40 minutes until the\r\ntomatoes have softened and are\r\ntinged with brown.","Make four gaps among the tomatoes, break an egg into each gap and cover the dish with a sheet of foil. Return it to the oven for 5-10 minutes until the eggs are set to your liking. Scatter over the herbs and serve piping hot with thick slices of toast or warm ciabatta and a green salad on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5341,5341,'en','One-pot chicken & rice','Make a wholesome chicken dinner for all the family in under an hour. Plus, you only need one pan, so there’s less washing-up','["1 tbsp smoked paprika","1 tbsp ground coriander","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","2 tsp rapeseed oil","600g boneless, skinless chicken thighs, halved","700ml hot vegetable bouillon, made with 2 tsp powder","250g easy-cook brown rice","320g leeks, washed and sliced","1 tsp dried oregano or 1 tbsp fresh thyme","2 bay leaves (optional)","320g mixed frozen vegetables (we used sliced carrots, broccoli florets and sweetcorn)"]','["Put the spices, garlic and oil in a large bowl and mix well. Add the chicken and turn in the mixture until well coated. Heat a large non-stick pan that has a lid, then fry the chicken, uncovered (without extra oil) over a medium-high heat for 5 mins until browned, turning the chicken halfway to brown on both sides. Remove from the pan and set aside on a plate.","Pour the bouillon into the pan, stirring well to incorporate any garlicky bits that may have stuck to the base of the pan, then stir in the rice, leeks, oregano or thyme and bay, if using. Lay the chicken on top, then cover the pan and bring to the boil. Turn down the heat and simmer for 20 mins.","Stir in the frozen vegetables, then cover and simmer for about 5 mins to heat through. Leave to stand for about 5-10 mins, then lightly mix and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5343,5343,'en','Healthy chicken stir-fry','Make this nutritious, veg-packed stir-fry when you need dinner fast – and if you like a hit of spice, add some chilli to the rich peanut dressing','["65g brown basmati rice","2 tsp rapeseed oil","15g ginger, peeled and cut into thin matchsticks","2 small red onions (160g), cut into wedges","160g broccoli, broken into florets, stem finely chopped","2 carrots (160g), halved lengthways, then cut into diagonal slices","1 red chilli, finely chopped (optional)","200g chicken breast, cut into thin strips","½ tsp ground cumin","1 tbsp crunchy peanut butter","1 tbsp wheat-free tamari","1 tbsp brown rice vinegar"]','["Cook the rice following pack instructions, then drain. Heat the oil in a non-stickwokover a high heat and fry the ginger and red onions for 2 mins. Add the broccoli stem, carrots and chilli, if using, and cook for 1 min.","Tip in the chicken and cumin, stir-fry briefly, then add the broccoli florets and 3 tbsp water. Cover and leave to steam for 3-4 mins, or until the broccoli florets are just tender and the chicken is cooked through.","Meanwhile, mix the peanut butter with the tamari and vinegar. Stir the sauce into the veg and chicken, then serve over the cooked rice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5345,5345,'en','Spiced chicken hotpot','Add gentle spicing and apricots to elevate this chicken casserole to a dish reminiscent of a Moroccan tagine. It’s healthy too, with four of your 5-a-day','["2 tsp olive oil","2 onions (400g), halved and thickly sliced","2 aubergines, halved and thickly sliced","40g ginger, cut into fine slices","1 garlic clove, crushed","40g fresh turmeric, grated or 1 tsp ground","¼ tsp allspice","2 tsp cumin seeds","2 tsp ground coriander","400g can chickpeas","2 red peppers, deseeded and diced","2 tsp bouillon powder","50g dried apricots, halved","600g pack skinless chicken thigh fillets, all visible fat trimmed off, cut into large chunks","20g pack coriander, chopped","560g large potatoes, very thinly sliced (no need to peel)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4, then heat 1 tsp of the olive oil in a large, deep flameproofcasserolewith a heavy base and a lid. Add the onions and a splash of water, then cover and leave to cook over a medium heat for 5 mins, until softened a little. Stir well, then add the sliced aubergines and cook, covered, for 5 mins to soften.","Add the ginger, garlic, turmeric, and dry spices. Stir well and tip in the chickpeas along with their water, then the peppers, bouillon, apricots, chicken and a can full of water (400ml). Stir in the coriander, then layer the potatoes on top, slightly overlapping in a spiral pattern. Gently press to compact them and brush with the remaining 1 tsp oil. Bake for 1-1 ½ hrs with the lid on. Remove the cover halfway through and continue cooking until the potatoes are tender and the juices bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5347,5347,'en','Chicken seasoning','Try this simple blend of black pepper, paprika, garlic, onion, thyme and oregano to season chicken before baking, roasting or frying','["1 tsp sea salt flakes","1 tsp black pepper, freshly ground","1 tsp paprika","1 tsp garlic granules","1 tsp onion granules","1 tsp dried thyme","1 tsp dried oregano"]','["Measure out all the ingredients in a bowl and stir together well. They can also be lightly combined in a blender or crushed together using apestle and mortarto create a finer powder, if you prefer. Sprinkle over chicken before baking, roasting or frying."]','2026-01-10 12:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5349,5349,'en','Sticky ginger & honey chicken skewers with noodle salad','These ginger and honey chicken skewers are perfect as a summertime dinner, served on a bed of marinated noodles','["6 skinless, boneless chicken thighs, cut into large chunks","5 garlic cloves, crushed","1 thumb-sized piece of ginger, grated","6 tbsp sesame oil","3 tbsp honey","6 tbsp soy sauce","3 limes, juiced, plus extra wedges to serve","100g mangetout","275g cooked egg noodles","1 large carrot, peeled and cut into thin strips or coarsely grated","½ bunch of coriander, chopped","1 tbsp sesame seeds, (optional)"]','["Put the chicken in a bowl. In a separate bowl, whisk together the garlic, ginger, sesame oil, honey, soy sauce and lime juice. Add a third of this to the chicken and save the rest for the noodles. Mix everything together and chill overnight or for a few hours.","Bring a saucepan of water to a simmer. Add the mangetout and cook for 1 min, then drain and rinse under cold water. Toss the cooked noodles with the mangetout, carrot, remaining marinade, coriander and sesame seeds.","Heat the grill to medium. Thread the chicken onto three or four long skewers, put on a flat baking tray and grill for 12 mins, turning the skewers halfway, until cooked. Serve the skewers on top of a platter of the noodles with extra lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:15:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5351,5351,'en','Chicken pesto orzo salad','Elevate standard pasta salad by using orzo and pesto. The dish also offers a good way to make the most of asparagus while it’s in season in the spring, too','["2 boneless, skinless chicken breasts","1 lemon, zested and juiced","3 garlic cloves, 2 crushed, 1 left whole","1 tbsp olive oil","25g flaked almonds","large bunch of flat-leaf parsley","small bunch of basil","small bunch of mint, leaves picked","25g parmesan, grated, plus extra shaved parmesan to serve","100ml extra virgin olive oil, plus a drizzle to serve","250g orzo","16 asparagus spears"]','["Put the chicken breasts on a board and cover with a sheet of baking parchment. Use a rolling pin or meat mallet to bash to an even thickness of about 2cm, being careful not to break the chicken into pieces.","Combine the lemon zest, crushed garlic, olive oil and some seasoning in a medium bowl, then add the chicken and turn in the marinade to coat. Transfer to the fridge while you make the pesto.","Toast the flaked almonds in a dry frying pan over a medium heat for 2-3 mins, shaking the pan often until the almonds are golden brown. Tip into a smallfood processoror blender. Peel the whole garlic clove and tip this into the food processor along with the parsley, basil, most of the mint leaves, the parmesan, extra virgin olive oil and lemon juice. Season, then blitz to a fine texture.","Cook the orzo in a large pan of boiling salted water following the pack instructions, or until al dente. Heat a griddle pan over a medium-high heat and cook the marinated chicken for 4-5 mins on each side until cooked through with char lines. Drain the orzo and transfer the chicken to a plate to rest.","Drizzle the asparagus spears with a little extra virgin olive oil and season with salt, thengriddlefor 3 mins until just softened. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Toss most of the pesto through the cooked orzo along with any resting juices from the chicken.The remaining pesto will keep covered in the fridge for up to five days.Slice the chicken breasts. Tip the orzo onto a large serving platter and pile the asparagus and chicken on top, then scatter with the remaining mint leaves, some parmesan shavings and a grinding of black pepper. Drizzle with a little extra virgin olive oil and serve warm."]','2026-01-10 12:15:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5353,5353,'en','Healthy chicken pasta bake','Try this healthy chicken pasta bake with peppers, courgette and ricotta for a nutritious midweek dinner. It’s sure to be a hit with everyone','["300g wholemeal penne","2 tsp olive oil","2 peppers (we used 1 yellow and 1 orange), deseeded and chopped","1 large courgette (160g), coarsely grated","3 large garlic cloves, finely grated","500g carton passata","1 tbsp smoked paprika","1½ tsp vegetable bouillon powder","1 tsp chilli powder (optional)","25g Kalamata olives (about 8), sliced","400g chicken breasts (2 large), cut into pieces","large handful of basil, chopped, plus extra to serve","100g ricotta","20g finely grated mature cheddar"]','["Cook the pasta following pack instructions. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the peppers for 8 mins, stirring until they start to soften. Add the courgette and garlic, stir for a few minutes more, then tip in the passata and stir in the smoked paprika, bouillon, chilli, if using, and olives. Simmer for 3-4 mins.","Drain the pasta, reserving the pasta water. Tip the pasta into the passata mixture along with the chicken, half a mug of the pasta water and the basil. Stir together well, then tip into baking dish.","Mix the ricotta in a bowl with 5 tbsp of the pasta water and spread across the top of the pasta. Sprinkle over the cheddar, then bake for 35 mins. Scatter with a few extra basil leaves, if you like, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5355,5355,'en','Chicken drumsticks with cashew & turmeric (kalmi kebab)','Make this North Indian favourite: chicken legs marinated in garlicky yogurt, cream and cashew nut paste and spiced with turmeric and ginger','["75g cashew nuts","1 lemon, juiced, plus extra wedges to serve","150g strained Greek yogurt (use regular Greek yogurt if you can''t find strained)","50g ginger, peeled and finely grated","8 garlic cloves, crushed","½ tsp turmeric powder","1 tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","½ tsp carom seeds (ajwain), optional","1 tsp garam masala","1 tsp ground cumin","¾ tsp cracked black peppercorns","50ml double cream","12 chicken drumsticks, skinned","50g ghee or 75ml sunflower oil","1 small red onion, cut into rings"]','["Put the cashew nuts in a bowl and cover with enough boiling water from the kettle to cover. Set aside for at least 2 hrs to soften. Drain the nuts, then blend until smooth in a smallfood processorwith the lemon juice.","Mix the nut paste with the yogurt in a large bowl, and add the lemon, ginger, garlic, turmeric, chilli powder, carom seeds (if using), garam masala, cumin, black pepper, and cream.","Using a sharpknife, make 2-3 slashes on each chicken drumstick and coat them with the spiced yogurt. Cover the bowl and leave the chicken to marinate in the fridge for 1-2 hrs, or overnight if you have the time.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Put the ghee or oil in a largeroasting tinand heat it in the oven until it is really hot.","Arrange the chicken in a single layer in the roasting tin. Spoon half the marinade over the legs and return the tin to the oven.","After 15 mins, turn the legs over and spread over the remaining marinade. Put in the oven for a further 15 mins, until the chicken juices run clear when pierced with a knife.","Preheat the grill to its hottest setting and grill the chicken for 3-4 mins until browned. Transfer to a serving dish, scatter with red onion rings, and serve with lemon wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:15:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5357,5357,'en','Cajun chicken traybake with sweet potato wedges & chive dip','Sweet potatoes are never as crispy as regular potatoes, but they do add to your 5-a-day. We’ve used kefir in this recipe for its rich contribution of beneficial gut bacteria','["1 tsp each of ground cumin and smoked paprika","1 tsp dried oregano","1 tbsp fresh thyme leaves or 1 tsp dried","8 skinless, boneless chicken thighs (900g)","1 red and 1 yellow pepper, deseeded and chopped","3 red onions, sliced into 1cm-thin wedges","2 celery sticks (125g) , finely chopped","1 tbsp rapeseed oil , plus 1 tsp","2 sweet potatoes (375g peeled weight), cut into 16 wedges","150g Kefir or bio yogurt","2 tbsp snipped chives"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Mix the cumin, paprika, oregano and thyme together in a bowl, with a good grinding of black pepper. Set aside 1 tbsp for the potatoes. Use the rest to rub all over the chicken thighs.","Tip the peppers, onions and celery into a large roasting tin and toss with 1 tbsp oil. Spread out the veg so it cooks evenly, then nestle in the chicken. Cover with foil and roast for 40 mins.","Meanwhile, coat the potato wedges in the 1 tsp oil and remaining spices, and arrange well-spaced apart on a non-stick baking tray. Put in the oven, on a higher shelf, when you have 35 mins left for the chicken. Stir the kefir and chives together to make a dip, adding up to 1 tbsp water to loosen, if needed. Set aside.","Remove the roasting tin and potatoes from the oven and turn up the heat to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Remove the chicken to a warm plate and leave to rest for 5 mins. Return the veg to the oven, uncovered, for 5-10 mins to colour a little. Serve half the wedges on plates with half of the chive dip and half the veg and chicken. Cover and chill the remaining portions.Will keep chilled for up to three days. To reheat, gently warm the potatoes in a non-stick frying pan, taking care they don’t burn. Heat the chicken until piping hot in a microwave or pan set over a medium heat. If freezing, leave to defrost fully before reheating in a pan over a medium heat until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:15:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5359,5359,'en','Pulled chicken & black bean chilli','Make a batch of Mexican-inspired pulled chicken and black bean chilli, which can be easily doubled and kept in the freezer. Serve with rice or tortilla wraps','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","2 onions, sliced","4 boneless, skinless chicken thighs","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tbsp oregano","1 tsp cumin seeds","3 tbsp chipotle in adobo or 1 tsp chipotle paste","350g passata","1⁄2 chicken stock shot or cube","400g can black beans, drained but not rinsed","1⁄2 lime, juiced","cooked rice or tortillas, coriander, feta, lime wedges and chopped red onion, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a shallowsaucepanorcasserole dishwith a lid. Tip in the onions and cook over a medium-low heat for 5 mins until softened. Add the chicken and turn up the heat to medium. Stir in the garlic, a small pinch of sugar, the oregano, cumin seeds and some seasoning. Cook for a couple of minutes, then add the chipotle and cook for a few minutes more. Pour in the passata, 100ml water and add the stock. Season and bring to a simmer.","Cover with a lid and cook for 40-50 mins, stirring occasionally until the chicken is tender. Shred the chicken into the sauce using two forks, then stir through the beans. Simmer for 5 mins more, then turn off the heat. Squeeze in the lime juice.Can be kept chilled for three days and frozen for up to two months. Defrost thoroughly and reheat. Serve with rice or tortilla wraps, and some coriander, feta, lime wedges and red onion on the side, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5361,5361,'en','Kale pesto & chicken gnocchi','Go green with our kale pesto and chicken gnocchi, full of nutritious ingredients. A balanced, easy dish, it’s ideal for busy days and takes just 20 minutes','["65g kale, washed and roughly chopped","100g spinach","1 small garlic clove, roughly chopped","1 lemon, zested and juiced","½ small bunch of basil, plus extra leaves to serve","15g pine nuts","1 tbsp parmesan, plus extra to serve","25ml olive oil","250g cooked chicken breast, shredded","200g frozen peas","50g light crème fraîche","150ml vegetable stock","300g gnocchi"]','["Bring a mediumsaucepanof water to the boil and set aside a bowl of ice-cold water. Put the kale and spinach in the boiling water and cook for 2-3 mins until softened. Remove with a slotted spoon and lower into the cold water. Drain, then squeeze out the excess water.","Tip the greens into afood processorwith the garlic, lemon juice and zest, basil, pine nuts, parmesan and olive oil, then blitz until smooth. Season lightly.","Tip the pesto into a saucepan with the chicken, peas, crème fraîche and stock, and bring to the boil. Tip in the gnocchi and cook for 3-4 mins until cooked through. Scatter over the extra basil leaves and grate over some parmesan to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5363,5363,'en','Chicken, lemon & ricotta meatballs with linguine','Flavour-packed, easy to make and nutritious – our zesty chicken meatballs tick all the boxes for a family meal','["2 chicken breasts","2 lemons, zested","200g ricotta","3 tbsp parsley, chopped","150g fresh breadcrumbs","100ml milk, plus 2 tbsp","1 medium egg, beaten","25g plain flour, for dusting","1 tbsp olive oil","300g linguine","320g green beans, trimmed and halved"]','["Cut the chicken into very small pieces using a sharp knife. You can use afood processor, but pulse so it doesn’t turn into a paste. Put in a bowl and add half the lemon zest, half the ricotta, half the parsley, the breadcrumbs and mix together. Add the 2 tbsp milk, the egg and a good pinch of seasoning. Mix again.","Dust a plate lightly with flour. Wet your hands, take a golf ball-sized piece of the meatball mixture and roll into a ball. Set on the floured plate and repeat until all the mixture has been used up.","Heat a heavy-based frying pan over a medium heat, add the oil, then the meatballs, ensuring they don’t touch each other. Cook for 10-15 mins, turning so they brown on all sides. Transfer to a plate.","Meanwhile, heat a large pan of salted water and add the linguine. Cook following pack instructions, and 3 mins before the end of the cooking time, add the green beans. Drain, saving the pasta water. Rinse the linguine and beans under cool water to stop them cooking further.","Add the remaining ricotta to the frying pan, breaking it up as much as possible. Pour in the 100ml milk and 2 tbsp of reserved pasta water, then cook down to thicken slightly for a couple of minutes. Add the pasta, beans and remaining lemon zest and parsley. Season to taste, mix in the meatballs and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5365,5365,'en','Coconut & turmeric baked chicken thighs','Enjoy these coconut and turmeric baked chicken thighs with spring greens and rice for a nutritionally balanced family meal that’s big on flavour','["6-8 chicken thighs, skin on","1 tsp turmeric","1 tsp cumin","2 garlic cloves, grated","thumb-sized piece of ginger, grated","200ml coconut milk","1 onion, finely sliced","250g spring greens or spinach, roughly chopped","1 tsp maple syrup or honey","400g cooked rice, to serve"]','["Put the chicken thighs in a bowl and add the turmeric, cumin, garlic, ginger and 3 tbsp of the coconut milk. Rub the marinade in and leave for at least 15 mins, or longer if you have time.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Scatter the onion and spring greens in abaking tray, add the rest of the coconut milk, the maple syrup and 150ml water. Cook in the oven for 10 mins, stirring regularly to wilt the greens. Place the chicken thighs on top, then return to the oven for 20 mins, stirring the greens underneath occasionally.","Heat the grill and cook for a further 8-10 mins until the skin is crispy. Serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5367,5367,'en','Sweet & sour chicken balls','Try making these sweet & sour chicken balls at home with this easy recipe. These satisfying chicken bites paired with a tangy dipping sauce are irresistible','["125g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","2 eggs","160ml semi-skimmed milk","1 tbsp groundnut oil, plus extra for deep-frying","4 chicken breast fillets, cut into 3cm cubes","240ml orange juice","3 tbsp caster sugar","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp tomato ketchup","3 tbsp white wine vinegar","3 tbsp cornflour, mixed with 6 tbsp water"]','["First, make the sauce. Put the orange juice, sugar, tomato purée, ketchup and vinegar in a large saucepan over a medium heat. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for 5 mins. Slowly pour in the cornflour mixture, a little at a time, stirring continuously until you have the desired consistency. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Mix the flour, baking powder and 1 tsp salt together in a large bowl. Beat the eggs, milk and 1 tbsp oil together in a separate bowl. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry and mix well to create a smooth paste. Add the chicken pieces and mix, making sure each piece is thoroughly coated.","Fill a deep saucepan or wok no more than a third full with oil and heat to 170C, or until a cube of bread dropped in browns within 30 seconds. Carefully lower the coated chicken pieces into the oil, one piece at a time, and fry in batches of five for about 5-6 mins each batch until golden brown and cooked through. If you have a food probe thermometer, the internal temperature should reach 78C. If you don''t have a thermometer, cut a chicken piece in half to ensure the juices run clear.","Drain the fried chicken on a wire rack set over a baking tray lined with kitchen paper, or on a plate lined with kitchen paper. Serve with the sweet & sour sauce for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:15:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5369,5369,'en','Christmas dinner pie with roasted veg','Cook a special Christmas Day meal for one with this pie. It’s filled with chicken, sausage and cranberry sauce, and is an easy way to enjoy festive flavours without making a huge dinner','["200g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","2 sage leaves, finely chopped","grating of nutmeg","110g cold butter, cut into cubes","1 egg yolk","gravy, to serve","1 skinless chicken breast","1 pork sausage","1 tbsp fresh breadcrumbs","2 tbsp cranberry sauce, plus extra to serve","1 large floury potato, such as Maris Piper or King Edward, cut into 4-6 chunks","3 tbsp vegetable or rapeseed oil","80g Brussels sprouts, trimmed, outer leaves removed, halved","2 baby carrots","3 small parsnips, peeled"]','["To make the pastry, put the flour, sage, a pinch of salt and grating of nutmeg in a bowl. Rub in the butter using your fingers until sandy. Beat the egg yolk with 1-2 tbsp water. Add most to the pastry, reserving 1 tsp. Mix, then bring together into a dough with your hands. Flatten into a disc. Wrap. Chill for 30 mins.","For the filling, lay the chicken on a board, and with the palm of your hand pressing down on top, cut through the middle lengthways from the side without going all the way through. Open out like a book and cut into six strips. Squeeze the sausagemeat from the skin.","Cut a third of the pastry off and set aside.Roll outthe rest of the pastry on a lightly floured surface to the thickness of a 10p coin. Line a 10cm pie dish (about 3cm deep), leaving any excess overhanging. Scatter the breadcrumbs in the base, then top with half the chicken. Season. Spoon in half the cranberry sauce, the sausagemeat, the remaining cranberry sauce, and the rest of the chicken. Season.","Roll the reserved pastry out so it’s large enough to cover the dish. Brush a little of the reserved egg around the edge of the pie, then top with the pastry lid, pressing the edge to seal. Trim away any excess. Brush with the rest of the egg and cut a small steam hole in the centre.Will keep chilled for up to 24 hrs, or frozen for two months.","Cook the potatoes in a pan of boiling water for 5-8 mins until fluffy but still holding their shape. Drain and leave to steam-dry. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the potatoes in half the oil on a largebaking tray. Season. Bake with the pie for 30 mins.","Push the potatoes to one end of the tray, then add the rest of the veg to the other end. Toss with the rest of the oil and season. Bake for 20 mins more, covering the pie with foil if it darkens too quickly. Remove the pie from the oven and roast the veg for 10-15 mins more until tender and the potatoes crisp. Serve with the gravy and extra cranberry sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:15:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5371,5371,'en','Garlic & nduja rice-stuffed chicken','Do something different with roast chicken by serving it with a rice-based stuffing packed with garlic and nduja flavours. It’s great with green veg and gravy, too','["4 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, finely diced","5 garlic cloves, crushed","1½ tsp cumin","1 tsp red pepper flakes","½ tsp smoked paprika","30-40g nduja (or 50g chorizo), depending on how hot you like it","130g white or wholemeal long-grain rice, rinsed","60g unsalted butter","1 lemon, zested","1 whole chicken (approx 1.5kg)"]','["Heat half the oil in a largesaucepanover a medium heat and cook the onion until soft and starting to brown, about 10 mins. Stir in 3 crushed garlic cloves, 1 tsp of the cumin, the red pepper flakes, smoked paprika, ½ tsp black pepper and the nduja, breaking it up as you mix it in. Cook for a further 5 mins until the nduja has released its oils.","Stir in the rice until fully coated in the oil, then pour in 250ml water. Cook the rice, uncovered, following pack instructions until almost cooked but retaining some bite, then remove from the heat. Set aside.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Mix the butter with the remaining garlic, lemon zest, remaining cumin and a small pinch of salt. Loosen the skin of the chicken breast using your hands, carefully, so as not to tear the skin. Work from the widest part of the bird and get close to the neck but not all the way through, and try to loosen the skin above the legs as well. Gently push the garlic butter under the skin as far as it will go. Stuff the cavity with the rice mixture, then tie the legs together to stop it from spilling out.","Rub the skin with the remaining oil and sprinkle with some salt. Roast the chicken for between 1 hr-1 hr 15 mins until cooked through and the juices run clear. Remove from the oven and set aside to rest for 10 mins before carving. Serve with green vegetables and a gravy made from the juices, if you like. Try one of ourgravy recipes here."]','2026-01-10 12:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5373,5373,'en','Jamaican jerk chicken','Make your own jerk seasoning to use as a marinade for chicken. Scotch bonnet peppers and spices bring heat and plenty of flavour','["2 chicken thighs","2 chicken legs","2-3 tsp crushed/powered allspice (pimento)","1 tsp fine salt","4 spring onions, trimmed","1 medium white onion","1- 2 Scotch bonnet peppers","6-8 garlic cloves","2-3 tbsp picked thyme leaves","240ml lime juice or orange or pineapple juice","60ml white or malt vinegar","½ tsp mixed spice","1-2 tbsp dark sugar"]','["Whizz all the ingredients for the marinade in ablenderto form a thick paste. It shouldn''t be too runny, similar to the consistency of sweet chilli sauce. Taste and adjust seasoning if needed.Will keep in an airtight container in the fridge for up to three weeks.","Slit the chicken skin with a sharp knife, then put into a container. Pour over the jerk marinade, making sure the chicken is completely covered. You may not need all the marinade. Cover the chicken and place in the fridge for at least 4 hrs, but ideally 24 hrs.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Put the chicken in an ovenproof dish, cover with foil and cook for 30-45 mins. Remove the foil and baste the chicken with the juices from the dish, then cook for a further 10 mins. The skin should start to crisp up. Check the meat is cooked by cutting into the deepest part of the chicken. If the juices run out red, return to the oven for 10 mins more, or until the juices run clear. Serve with rice & peas or any of your favourite side dishes."]','2026-01-10 12:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5375,5375,'en','Lighter chicken tacos','The same tasty Mexican dish with half the fat of standard tacos. Pile on the chicken, salsa and guacamole, and build yourself a delicious meal','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp smoked paprika","450g skinless chicken breasts, preferably organic","4 medium tomatoes, preferably on the vine, halved","1 red pepper, quartered","1 small red onion, cut into 8 wedges","¼ tsp rapeseed oil","2 tsp lime juice","¼ tsp ground cumin","good pinch of chilli flakes","2 medium-sized ripe avocados, stoned, peeled and roughly chopped","4 tsp lime juice","2 spring onions, ends trimmed, finely chopped","3 tbsp chopped coriander","good pinch of chilli flakes","8 corn taco shells","8 tsp 0% Greek yogurt","2 Little Gem lettuces, shredded","chopped coriander","lime wedges, for squeezing over"]','["Mix the oil with the cumin and paprika on a large plate. Sit the chicken on the plate and rub the spiced oil all over it. Season with pepper and a pinch of salt, then cover and set aside while you prepare the salsa.","Heat the grill to high for 10 mins. Meanwhile, line a large baking tray with foil and lay the tomatoes (cut-side up) on it, along with the pepper and red onion. Brush the oil over the onion, and season the tomatoes and onion with pepper. Grill for 12-15 mins, turning the tomatoes and onion halfway through, until well charred. Remove (leaving the grill on) and set aside to cool – put the pepper in a bowl and cover with cling film so that it’s easier to skin later.","For the guacamole, put the avocado in a bowl and briefly mash with a fork, leaving some chunky pieces for texture. Gently mix in the lime juice, spring onions, coriander and chilli flakes. Season with pepper and a pinch of salt.","Re-line the baking tray with foil and lay the chicken on it, plump-side up. Grill for about 10 mins until cooked – there is no need to turn it. Meanwhile, scoop out and discard as much of the seeds and juice from the tomatoes as you can (so the salsa isn’t too wet), leaving the pulp and charred skin. When the pepper is cool enough to handle, peel off and discard the skin. Chop the tomatoes and onion, and dice the pepper. Combine in a bowl with the lime juice, cumin, chilli flakes, some pepper and a pinch of salt.","When the chicken is cooked, remove from the grill, cover loosely with foil and set aside for 5 mins.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cut the chicken into chunky slices and spoon over the juices. When ready to serve, lay the taco shells on a baking sheet and warm through for 2-3 mins. Serve the chicken, taco shells, yogurt, lettuce, coriander and lime wedges in separate bowls, so that everyone can build their own tacos."]','2026-01-10 12:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5377,5377,'en','Spiced chicken, spinach & sweet potato stew','A healthy one-pot with warming spices that''s low fat, low calorie, 3 of your 5-a-day and also full of fibre!','["3 sweet potatoes, cut into chunks","190g bag spinach","1 tbsp sunflower oil","8 chicken thighs, skinless and boneless","500ml chicken stock","2 onions, chopped","1 red chilli, chopped","1 tsp paprika","thumb-sized piece ginger, grated","400g can tomatoes","2 preserved lemons, deseeded and chopped","pumpkin seeds, toasted","2-3 preserved lemons, deseeded and chopped","4 naan bread, warmed"]','["Put the sweet potato in a large, deep saucepan over a high heat. Cover with boiling water and boil for 10 mins. Meanwhile, put all the paste ingredients in a food processor and blend until very finely chopped. Set aside until needed.","Put the spinach in a large colander in the sink and pour the sweet potatoes and their cooking water over it to drain the potatoes and wilt the spinach at the same time. Leave to steam-dry.","Return the saucepan to the heat (no need to wash it first), then add the oil, followed by the spice paste. Fry the paste for about 5 mins until thickened, then add the chicken. Fry for 8-10 mins until the chicken starts to colour. Pour over the stock, bring to the boil and leave to simmer for 10 mins, stirring occasionally.","Check the chicken is cooked by cutting into one of the thighs and making sure it’s white throughout with no signs of pink. Season with black pepper, then add the sweet potato. Leave to simmer for a further 5 mins. Meanwhile, roughly chop the spinach and add to the stew. At this point you can leave the stew to cool and freeze for up to 3 months, if you like.","Scatter over the pumpkin seeds and preserved lemons, and serve with warm naan bread on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5379,5379,'en','Pulled chicken','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyRemake a street-food favourite, pulled pork, with juicy chicken thighs to cut the calories for a healthy taco filling','["8 bone-in chicken thighs, skin removed and discarded and trimmed of any big bits of fat","2 tbsp chipotle paste","250ml passata","75g barbecue sauce","1 onion, chopped","juice 3 limes, plus extra wedges to serve (optional)","2 x 400g cans black beans, drained and rinsed","215g can refried beans","1 small, ripe avocado, diced","½  small pack coriander, leaves only","3 Baby Gem lettuces, shredded","8-12 tacos, or cooked rice, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Rub the chicken thighs with 1 tbsp of the chipotle paste and some seasoning. Mix the remaining chipotle paste with the passata, barbecue sauce, 100ml water and half the onion. Spoon the sauce into a roasting tin that will fit the chicken snugly in a single layer and add the chicken thighs. Cover tightly with foil and bake for 1 hr, then uncover, increase the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and bake for another 20 mins.","Meanwhile, mix the remaining onion with the lime juice and some salt, and set aside while the chicken cooks. Mix all the beans in a saucepan with 100ml water, ready to heat to serve.","When the chicken is really tender, use two forks to shred the meat into the sauce (discard the bones). Keep covered with the foil while you heat the beans for 5-10 mins until piping hot and not too wet, and warm the tacos following pack instructions. Stir the avocado and coriander leaves into the lime-onion mixture.","Serve the pulled chicken and beans with shredded lettuce and tacos, or rice and lime wedges to squeeze over, if you like. Top with a spoonful of the avocado salsa."]','2026-01-10 12:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5381,5381,'en','Chicken & pearl barley risotto','Tender chicken and wholesome pearl barley with a light herby dressing make this a great low-calorie, low-fat weeknight dinner','["1 tsp sunflower oil","2 chicken thighs, skinless, bone in","2 carrots, chopped","2 celery sticks, chopped","1 onion, chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","140g pearl barley","½  x 60g bag fresh rocket leaves","small handful mint, leaves only","small handful flat-leaf parsley","juice 1 lemon","1 tsp capers"]','["Heat a large saucepan over a medium-high heat and add the oil. Add the chicken and fry for 5 mins or until well-browned on all sides. Tip in the vegetables and cook for a further 5 mins until starting to soften. Add the garlic and pearl barley, then pour over 500ml water. Cover and leave to simmer for 25-30 mins, stirring occasionally.","Meanwhile, put all the dressing ingredients in the small bowl of a food processor and blitz until very finely chopped. Transfer to a bowl and set aside until serving.","When the pearl barley is soft, but still with a little bite, and most of the liquid has been absorbed, it’s ready to serve. Season to taste and divide the risotto between two plates, adding spoonfuls of the dressing, to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5383,5383,'en','Peruvian chicken, avocado & quinoa salad','Fed up with pasta salad? This gluten-free alternative is packed with lean protein from the chicken, and healthy, heart-friendly fats from the avocado','["50g uncooked quinoa","100g frozen sweetcorn","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","75g cherry tomatoes, quartered","small pack coriander, leaves roughly chopped","2 spring onions, trimmed and finely sliced","zest and juice 1 lime","½  long red chilli, finely chopped (deseeded if you don’t like it too hot)","1 ripe but firm avocado","200g skinless, cold, cooked roast chicken, cut into chunky pieces"]','["Half-fill a medium pan with water and bring to the boil. Rinse the quinoa in a fine sieve, then add to the water, stir well and simmer for 12 mins or until just tender.","While the quinoa is cooking, put the sweetcorn in a dry frying pan over a medium-high heat. Cook for 5 mins, turning every now and then, until defrosted and lightly toasted. Set aside.","Rinse the cooked quinoa in a sieve under cold water, then press hard with a serving spoon to remove excess water.","Tip the quinoa into a bowl and toss with the olive oil, sweetcorn, tomatoes, coriander, spring onions, lime zest and chilli. Season well with black pepper.","Halve and stone the avocado. Scoop out the flesh with a large metal spoon, cut into slices and combine with the lime juice. Add the chicken pieces and avocado to the salad and toss gently together before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:15:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5385,5385,'en','Roast chicken & roots','This one-tray, vibrant and veg-heavy roast chicken dish provides four of your five-a-day','["1.6kg whole chicken","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","4-5 thyme sprigs, leaves roughly chopped","500g butternut squash, cut into chunks","300g carrots, cut into chunks","300g parsnips, peeled and cut into long batons","1 medium red onion, cut into thin wedges","1 garlic bulb, cloves separated","100g baby spinach leaves"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the chicken in a large roasting tin. Remove any trussing elastic and re-tie the chicken’s legs with string, if you like. Rub the lemon juice into the chicken, then rub in 1 tbsp of the oil and sprinkle with the thyme and plenty of seasoning. Roast for 25 mins.","Mix the squash, carrots, parnsips and onion in a bowl with the remaining oil, lemon zest and plenty of ground black pepper, and toss together well.","Take the chicken out of the oven and put on a plate. Scatter the vegetables into the tin, nestling the garlic cloves underneath, then put the chicken on top. Return to the oven for a further 45 mins, turning the veg after 20 mins until the chicken is cooked and the vegetables are tender and lightly browned.","Take the chicken out and place on a warmed platter. Cover with foil and leave to rest for 10 mins. Cook the spinach in a saucepan with a drizzle of water, and season with black pepper. Scatter the vegetables around the chicken and serve with the spinach. Squeeze the garlic out of the skins and smear over the chicken, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5387,5387,'en','Stir-fried chicken with broccoli & brown rice','Combine lean chicken with super-healthy broccoli, ginger and garlic for a quick and cheap, weeknight dinner','["200g trimmed broccoli florets (about 6), halved","1 chicken breast (approx 180g), diced","15g ginger, cut into shreds","2 garlic cloves, cut into shreds","1 red onion, sliced","1 roasted red pepper, from a jar, cut into cubes","2 tsp olive oil","1 tsp mild chilli powder","1 tbsp reduced-salt soy sauce","1 tbsp honey","250g pack cooked brown rice"]','["Put the kettle on to boil and tip the broccoli into a medium pan ready to go on the heat. Pour the water over the broccoli then boil for 4 mins.","Heat the olive oil in a non-stick wok and stir-fry the ginger, garlic and onion for 2 mins, add the mild chilli powder and stir briefly. Add the chicken and stir-fry for 2 mins more. Drain the broccoli and reserve the water. Tip the broccoli into the wok with the soy, honey, red pepper and 4 tbsp broccoli water then cook until heated through. Meanwhile, heat the rice following the pack instructions and serve with the stir-fry."]','2026-01-10 12:15:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5389,5389,'en','Pomegranate chicken with almond couscous','Jazz up chicken breasts in this fruity, sweetly spiced sauce with pomegranate seeds, toasted almonds and tagine paste','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","200g couscous","1 chicken stock cube","1 large red onion, halved and thinly sliced","600g chicken mini fillets","4 tbsp tagine spice paste (available from Tesco or Marks & Spencer), or 2 tbsp harissa","190ml bottle pomegranate juice (not sweetened; we used Pom Wonderful)","100g pack pomegranate seeds","100g pack toasted flaked almonds","small pack mint, chopped"]','["Boil the kettle and heat the oil in a large frying pan. Put the couscous in a bowl with some seasoning and crumble in half the stock cube. Add the onion to the pan and fry for a few mins to soften. Pour boiling water over the couscous to just cover, then cover the bowl with a tea towel and set aside.","Push the onion to one side of the pan, add the chicken fillets and brown on all sides. Stir in the tagine paste or harissa and the pomegranate juice, then crumble in the rest of the stock cube and season well. Simmer, uncovered, for 10 mins until the sauce has thickened and the chicken is cooked through. Stir through the pomegranate seeds, saving a few to scatter over before serving.","After 5 mins, fluff up the couscous with a fork and stir through the almonds and mint. Serve the chicken on the couscous with the sauce spooned over."]','2026-01-10 12:15:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5391,5391,'en','Barbecued chicken fajita skewers','Get the kids in the kitchen to prepare this easy BBQ chicken recipe, then assemble together with creamy guacamole on tortilla wraps','["2 limes, plus wedges to serve","1 tsp dried oregano","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed or finely grated","4 chicken breasts","3 mixed coloured peppers","1 red onion","2 ripe avocados","1 lime","6 cherry tomatoes, halved","warmed tortillas, chopped coriander, soured cream or yogurt, plus chilli sauce for the grown-ups, to serve"]','["Make the marinade. In a large bowl, juice both the limes. Add the oregano, spices, olive oil and garlic, and mix together. Dice the chicken, then get your child to stir it through the marinade, and set aside.","Prepare the vegetables. Deseeding the peppers and halving the onion is tricky, so do this yourself. Children aged from about seven or above can cut them into chunks using a child-friendly knife.","Make your skewers. Carefully thread alternate pieces of chicken, peppers and onion onto your skewers. Smaller children might find this a little hard, so the best way is to stab the ingredients and push them up the skewers. When you''ve used up all the ingredients, set aside. Can be made several hours ahead and chilled until ready to cook.","Prepare the guacamole. Stone and peel the avocados, then tip into a bowl with the other ingredients. Get your child to use a potato masher to mash everything together and tip into a serving dish.","Cook the skewers. Heat a barbecue or griddle pan. Cook the skewers for 10-12 mins, turning, until they are cooked all the way through. A child from the age of eight can watch over a griddle and turn the skewers with a pair of tongs. Serve the skewers on heated tortillas with the guacamole, soured cream, chopped coriander, lime wedges on the side and chilli sauce for those who like a touch of spice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5393,5393,'en','Jerk chicken salad with papaya','Give chicken salad a Caribbean twist with jerk spice, creamy avocado and exotic papaya.','["3-4 (depending on size) red chicory","4 skinless boneless chicken thighs, all visible fat removed","3 tsp rapeseed oil","1 lime, juice of ½ , the rest cut into 2 wedges","1 tsp jerk spice mix","2 tsp fresh oregano","2 tsp redcurrant jelly","2 tsp red wine vinegar","1 papaya, halved, deseeded, peeled and chopped","1 avocado, stoned, peeled and chopped","new potatoes, to serve (optional)"]','["Chicory is made up of leaves attached to quite a solid base, so feel where the leaves start and slice them off. Thickly slice the base and set aside.","Open out the chicken thighs and put them in a bowl with 1 tsp of the oil, the lime juice, jerk seasoning and oregano. Stir well, then griddle the chicken for 10 mins, turning once. Take off the griddle, cover with a plate and leave to rest while you quickly griddle the chicory slices.","Meanwhile, put the redcurrant jelly, vinegar and remaining oil in a big bowl and mix well. Add the papaya and avocado, then the chicory leaves, but don’t mix yet. Chop the chicken, add to the salad with the griddled chicory, then toss well. Pile on plates, squeeze over the remaining lime and serve while still warm, with new potatoes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5395,5395,'en','Chicken garden salad with elderflower dressing','A British green salad with plenty of bite from crisp radishes, sugar snap peas, asparagus and Little Gem lettuce','["bunch of asparagus (about 8 spears), woody ends removed and discarded (or save to make soup), cut in half lengthways","200g pack sugar snap peas","140g fresh or frozen peas","1 small cooked chicken, skin and bones discarded, meat shredded","250g radishes (use mixed colours and shapes if you can), sliced","1 red onion, halved and thinly sliced","1 large curly round lettuce or 2 Little Gems, torn","handful pea shoots (optional)","2 tbsp elderflower cordial","2 tbsp white wine vinegar","zest and juice 1 large lemon","3 tbsp extra virgin rapeseed oil"]','["Bring a medium pan of water to the boil and fill a large bowl with ice-cold water. Drop the asparagus into the pan. After 1 min, add the sugar snaps. After another 30 secs, tip in the peas. Cook for 30 secs more, then drain and tip the vegetables into the icy water – this will cool them quickly, helping to keep their bite and vibrant colour. After 1-2 mins, drain and set aside in the colander while you prepare the other ingredients.","Dry your bowl, pour in the dressing ingredients with plenty of seasoning and whisk together. Add the chicken, radishes, onion, cooled and drained vegetables, and the lettuce, and gently toss everything together until well coated in the dressing – the easiest way is to use your hands. Pile the salad onto a large platter and scatter over the pea shoots, if using. Serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:15:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5397,5397,'en','Fragrant spiced chicken with banana sambal','This spicy Asian-inspired dish is flavoured with coriander, cumin, turmeric, almonds and cardamom. Serve with a cooling chopped salad','["2 large onions, quartered","4 garlic cloves","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and roughly chopped","600ml reduced-salt chicken stock","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground cumin","½  tsp ground turmeric","4 green cardamom pods","1 large red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","2 tbsp ground almonds","2 tbsp tomato purée","500g skinless chicken breasts, cubed","small pack coriander, chopped","1 small red onion, finely chopped","¼ cucumber, peeled, deseeded and diced","1 small banana, diced","zest and juice ½ lime","250g pack ready-cooked brown basmati rice"]','["Put the onions in a food processor with the garlic and ginger. Blitz until it is as smooth as possible, then pour in half the stock and blitz again.","Heat a large non-stick pan, sprinkle in the spices and toast for 1 min. Pour in the onion mixture, the remaining stock and all but ½ tsp of the chopped chilli. Add the almonds and tomato purée, and stir well. Simmer for 35 mins until completely soft, stirring every now and then and adding a little water if the mixture starts to catch on the bottom of the pan.","Add the chicken and half the fresh coriander. Heat very gently for 10 mins to cook the chicken through. Mix all the sambal ingredients with the remaining coriander and chilli, and heat the rice following pack instructions. Serve the chicken and sambal with the brown rice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5399,5399,'en','Jerk chicken burger','Flavour lean chicken with Jamaican-inspired spicy seasoning, griddle then and serve in a bread roll with mango, tomato, lettuce and sauce','["2 skinless chicken breasts","few thyme sprigs, leaves picked","1 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp jerk seasoning","juice 1 lime","2 large bread rolls","½  small mango, stoned, peeled and sliced","1 tomato, sliced","1 Little Gem lettuce heart, shredded","2 tbsp mayonnaise and ketchup, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the chicken breasts in between\r\npieces of cling film and bash with\r\na rolling pin to flatten. Mix together the\r\nthyme, oil, jerk seasoning and half the\r\nlime juice in a bowl. Add the chicken and\r\nleave to marinate for 5 mins.","Heat a griddle pan until hot and cook\r\nthe chicken for 4-5 mins each side\r\nor until cooked through. Remove from\r\nthe heat. Meanwhile, toast the cut sides\r\nof the buns for 1-2 mins.","Put the chicken on the buns and top\r\nwith the mango, tomato and a handful of\r\nlettuce. Squeeze over the rest of the lime\r\nand top with mayo and ketchup, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5401,5401,'en','Chicken, sweetcorn & noodle soup','This superhealthy bowl can be made ahead and frozen, ready to be defrosted and used when you need it most','["2 large carrots, chopped","2 large leeks, trimmed and finely sliced","2 corn on the cobs, corn kernels cut off","200g vermicelli noodles","small bunch parsley, finely chopped","2 onions, quartered","1 leek, cut into chunks","2 carrots, thickly sliced","2 bay leaves","6 black peppercorns","parsley stalks","4 celery sticks, roughly chopped","2 tbsp vegetable bouillon or 1 vegetable stock cube","1.3kg chicken"]','["Put all the stock ingredients and the chicken in a very large saucepan, then cover everything with about 3 litres cold water. Bring to the boil, then lower to a simmer and cook for 1 hr-1½ hrs, until the chicken is cooked through. Skim off any froth every 20 mins or so. Remove the chicken to a plate to cool. Strain the stock through a sieve, skimming off as much fat as you can.","Rinse out the pan and put the stock back in, then simmer on a high heat until reduced a little – you need about 2 litres in total. Add the carrots and leeks, then simmer for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, shred the meat from the chicken, discarding the skin and bones. Add to the pan with the sweetcorn. Add the vermicelli noodles, unless you want to freeze the soup, and simmer for about 7 mins more, until the corn and pasta is cooked. Ladle into bowls, sprinkled with the parsley. To freeze, allow the soup to cool completely before freezing (see tip), and when you’re ready to eat, allow the soup to defrost before bringing it back to a gentle simmer in a pan. Add the noodles and simmer until cooked."]','2026-01-10 12:15:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5403,5403,'en','Crispy chicken & apple slaw','Breaded chicken needn’t be greasy – this oven-baked version with vegetable accompaniments is diet-friendly','["½ white cabbage, shredded","½ small onion, finely sliced","4 celery sticks, sliced","2 Granny Smith apples, quartered, cored and thinly sliced","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","200g pot fat-free Greek yogurt","2 cooked chicken breasts, thinly sliced","2 tbsp plain flour","1 egg, beaten","100g garlic and herb dried breadcrumbs","4 frozen corn cobs","barbecue sauce, to serve"]','["Mix the slaw ingredients together with\r\nsome seasoning, then set aside. This\r\ncan be done up to a day in advance and\r\nchilled. Bring a large pan of water to the\r\nboil, then cook the corn cobs for 8-10\r\nmins until tender and cooked through.","Heat the grill to high. Pour the flour,\r\negg and breadcrumbs out onto\r\nseparate plates. Dip the chicken into\r\nthe flour, then the egg, then coat in the\r\nbreadcrumbs. Lay the chicken onto a\r\nbaking sheet and grill for 2 mins on each\r\nside or until crispy and cooked through.\r\nServe the crispy chicken with the slaw\r\nand corn cobs, and a bowl of barbecue\r\nsauce to dunk on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:15:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5405,5405,'en','Tandoori chicken','This low-fat curried chicken is packed full of flavour. It’s quick to cook and the marinade does all the work – who needs takeaways?','["juice 2 lemons","4 tsp paprika","2 red onions, finely chopped","16 skinless chicken thighs","vegetable oil, for brushing","300ml Greek yogurt","large piece ginger, grated","4 garlic cloves, crushed","¾  tsp garam masala","¾  tsp ground cumin","½  tsp chilli powder","¼ tsp turmeric"]','["Mix the lemon juice with the paprika\r\nand red onions in a large shallow dish.\r\nSlash each chicken thigh three times,\r\nthen turn them in the juice and set\r\naside for 10 mins.","Mix all of the marinade ingredients\r\ntogether and pour over the chicken.\r\nGive everything a good mix, then cover\r\nand chill for at least 1 hr. This can be\r\ndone up to a day in advance.","Heat the grill. Lift the chicken pieces\r\nonto a rack over a baking tray. Brush\r\nover a little oil and grill for 8 mins on\r\neach side or until lightly charred and\r\ncompletely cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:15:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5407,5407,'en','The ultimate makeover: Chicken pie','Angela Nilsen reinvents a classic recipe to make chicken pie a healthy choice for you','["450ml chicken stock, from a cube (I use Kallo, organic)","100ml white wine","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","3 thyme sprigs","1 tarragon sprig, plus 1 tbsp chopped tarragon leaves","225g carrots, cut into batons","4 skinless chicken breasts, 500g/1lb 2oz total weight","225g leeks, sliced","2 tbsp cornflour, mixed with 2 tbsp water","3 tbsp crème fraîche","1 heaped tsp Dijon mustard","1 heaped tbsp chopped flat-leaf or curly parsley","70g filo pastry (I used three 39 x 30cm sheets)","1 tbsp rapeseed oil"]','["Pour the stock and wine into a large,\r\nwide frying pan. Add the garlic, thyme,\r\ntarragon sprig and carrots, bring to the\r\nboil then lower the heat and simmer for\r\n3 mins. Lay the chicken in the stock, grind\r\nover some pepper, cover and simmer for\r\n5 mins. Scatter the leek slices over the\r\nchicken, cover again then gently simmer\r\nfor 10 more mins, so the leeks can steam\r\nwhile the chicken cooks. Remove from\r\nthe heat and let the chicken sit in the\r\nstock for about 15 mins, so it keeps\r\nmoist while cooling slightly.","Strain the stock into a jug – you should\r\nhave 500ml (if not, make up with water).\r\nTip the chicken and veg into a 1.5 litre\r\npie dish and discard the herb sprigs. Pour\r\nthe stock back into the sauté pan, then\r\nslowly pour in the cornflour mix. Return\r\nthe pan to the heat and bring to the\r\nboil, stirring constantly, until thickened.\r\nRemove from the heat and stir in the\r\ncrème fraîche, mustard, chopped\r\ntarragon and parsley. Season with pepper.\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Tear or cut the chicken into chunky\r\nshreds. Pour the sauce over the chicken\r\nmixture, then stir everything together.","Cut each sheet of filo into 4 squares\r\nor rectangles. Layer them on top of\r\nthe filling, brushing each sheet with\r\nsome of the oil as you go. Lightly\r\nscrunch up the filo so it doesn’t lie\r\ncompletely flat and tuck the edges into\r\nthe sides of the dish, or lay them on the\r\nedges if the dish has a rim. Grind over a\r\nlittle pepper, place the dish on a baking\r\nsheet, then bake for 20-25 mins until\r\nthe pastry is golden and the sauce is\r\nbubbling. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:15:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5409,5409,'en','Inside-out chicken Kiev','A quick, easy low fat recipe with just 3 ingredients','["4 skinless, boneless chicken breasts","25g garlic butter, softened","25g crispy breadcrumbs"]','["Place the chicken on a baking tray, rub with a little of the butter, season and cook under the grill for 15 mins, turning once until cooked through.","Mix together the remaining garlic butter and breadcrumbs. Remove the chicken from the grill and top each breast with a smear of the breadcrumbed butter. Return to the grill and cook 3-5 mins until the breadcrumbs are golden and the butter melted. Serve any buttery juices, alongside new potatoes and peas or broad beans."]','2026-01-10 12:15:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5411,5411,'en','Chipotle chicken','Keep a jar of smoky chipotle chilli paste in your cupboard, to add a kick to a healthy chicken stew','["1 onion, chopped","1 garlic clove, sliced","2 tbsp sunflower oil","1-2 tbsp chipotle paste (see tip, below)","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp cider vinegar","8 skinless chicken thigh fillets","small bunch coriander, chopped","soured cream and rice, to serve"]','["Fry the onion and garlic in the oil in a\r\ndeep, wide frying pan until soft. Add the\r\nchipotle paste (use 1 tbsp for a mild\r\nflavour and 2 tbsp for a hotter, stronger\r\none). Stir and cook for 1 min, then add\r\nthe tomatoes and cider vinegar. Bring to\r\na simmer and cook for 10 mins with the\r\nlid half on. Stir to make sure it doesn’t get\r\ntoo dry.","Add the chicken and cook for\r\n10 mins or until cooked through, turning\r\nonce. Scatter with coriander and serve\r\nwith rice and soured cream."]','2026-01-10 12:15:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5413,5413,'en','Chicken & chorizo jambalaya','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA Cajun-inspired rice pot recipe with spicy Spanish sausage, sweet peppers and tomatoes','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 chicken breasts, chopped","1 onion, diced","1 red pepper, thinly sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","75g chorizo, sliced","1 tbsp Cajun seasoning","250g long grain rice","400g can plum tomatoes","350ml chicken stock"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan with\r\na lid and brown the chicken for 5-8 mins\r\nuntil golden. Remove and set aside.\r\nTip in the onion and cook for 3-4 mins\r\nuntil soft. Then add the pepper, garlic,\r\nchorizo and Cajun seasoning, and cook\r\nfor 5 mins more.","Stir the chicken back in with the rice, add\r\nthe tomatoes and stock. Cover and simmer\r\nfor 20-25 mins until the rice is tender."]','2026-01-10 12:15:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5415,5415,'en','Spicy chicken & bean stew','This hearty, satisfying one-pot is low fat and easy on the washing up','["1¼kg chicken thighs and drumsticks (approx. weight, we used a 1.23kg mixed pack)","1 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 red chillies, deseeded and chopped","250g frozen peppers, defrosted","400g can chopped tomatoes","420g can kidney beans in chilli sauce","2 x 400g cans butter beans, drained","400ml hot chicken stock","small bunch coriander, chopped","150ml pot soured cream and crusty bread, to serve"]','["Pull the skin off the chicken\r\nand discard. Heat the oil in a large\r\ncasserole dish, brown the chicken\r\nall over, then remove with a slotted\r\nspoon. Tip in the onions, garlic and\r\nchillies, then fry for 5 mins until\r\nstarting to soften and turn golden.","Add the peppers, tomatoes,\r\nbeans and hot stock. Put the\r\nchicken back on top, half-cover\r\nwith a pan lid and cook for 50 mins,\r\nuntil the chicken is cooked\r\nthrough and tender.","Stir through the coriander and\r\nserve with soured cream and\r\ncrusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:15:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5417,5417,'en','Mexican chicken & wild rice soup','A dish with added feelgood factor – this vitamin C filled soup is the ideal after-work pick-me-up','["1 tsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","1 green pepper, diced","200g sweetcorn, frozen or from a can","1-2 tbsp chipotle paste (we used Discovery)","250g Pouch ready-cooked long-grain and wild rice mix (we used Uncle Ben''s)","400g can black beans in water, rinsed and drained","1.3l low-sodium chicken stock","2 cooked skinless chicken breasts, shredded","small bunch coriander, chopped","low-fat soured cream and reduced fat guacamole, to serve, if you like"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying pan and cook the onion for 5 mins. Throw in the pepper and cook for 2 mins more, then add the sweetcorn, chipotle paste and rice. Stir well and cook for 1-2 mins.","Add the black beans and the stock. Bring to the boil, turn down to a simmer, then add half the chicken and coriander. Cool for 2-3 mins, then ladle into bowls.","Scatter over the rest of the chicken and coriander. Serve with a dollop each of guacamole and soured cream on top if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5419,5419,'en','Harissa chicken with chickpea salad','A low-fat, fibre-filled supper with a superhealthy side – just the thing for midweek','["250g punnet cherry tomatoes, halved","½ small red onion, chopped","400g can chickpeas, drained","small bunch parsley, roughly chopped","juice 1 lemon","2 skinless chicken breasts, halved lengthways through the middle","1 tbsp harissa","fat-free natural yogurt and wholemeal pitta bread, to serve"]','["Mix the tomatoes, onion and chickpeas together, stir through the parsley and lemon juice and season.","Coat the chicken with the harissa. Heat a griddle or frying pan or barbecue. Cook the chicken for 3-4 mins each side until lightly charred and cooked through.","Divide the salad between 2 plates, top with the harissa chicken and serve with a dollop of yogurt and warmed pitta bread."]','2026-01-10 12:15:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5421,5421,'en','Turkey chilli','Achieve all five of your five-a-day with this turkey chilli. Full of healthy ingredients and gut-friendly spices, you can’t go wrong with a bowl for dinner','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","500g turkey thigh mince (7% fat)","2 large garlic cloves, finely grated","1 chilli, deseeded and chopped","½ tsp dried oregano","2 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tbsp smoked paprika","500g carton passata","2 x 400g cans red kidney beans drained (liquid reserved)","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 red peppers, deseeded and diced","4 small sweet potatoes (about 140g each)","2 avocados","1 lime, juiced"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat, then tip in the mince and break it up using a wooden spoon. Stir in the garlic and chilli, and cook for 10 mins until the mince is cooked through. Add the herbs and spices, and cook for a minute more.","Pour in the passata, the reserved liquid from the beans, the bouillon powder and peppers. Cover and cook for 15-20 mins until slightly thickened. Tip in the beans and cook for 3-5 mins more.","Meanwhile, prick two of the sweet potatoes all over using a fork, then microwave on high for 7-10 mins until tender. Mash one of the avocados with half the lime juice in a small bowl.","To serve, halve the potatoes and spoon over half the chilli, then finish with the mashed avocado. Chill the remainder for another day.The chilli will keep covered and chilled for four days or frozen for three months. Reheat in amicrowaveor pan over low heat until piping hot. Serve with the remaining sweet potatoes and mashed avocado and lime juice, as described above."]','2026-01-10 12:15:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5423,5423,'en','Jerk-seasoned pork & pineapple skewers with black beans & rice','Pop these healthy kebabs on a griddle or the BBQ – they’re packed with Creole spices and are a lean treat','["400g pork fillet , cut into 4cm chunks","2 tbsp jerk or Creole seasoning","1 tsp ground allspice","1 tbsp hot chilli sauce , plus extra to serve (optional)","3 limes , zest and juice 1, other 2 cut into wedges to serve","½ small pineapple , peeled , cored and cut into 4cm chunks","1 tbsp vegetable oil","200g basmati rice","400g can  black bean , drained and rinsed"]','["Mix together the pork, jerk seasoning, allspice, chilli sauce, if using, lime zest and juice, and some seasoning. Thread the pork and pineapple onto metal skewers (or pre-soaked wooden skewers) and brush with the oil.","Cook rice following pack instructions. Drain well, then put back in the saucepan with the beans, stir and keep warm.","Meanwhile, heat agriddle panuntil very hot. Cook the skewers for 3 mins on each side until nicely charred and the pork is cooked through. Serve skewers with the beans and rice, extra chilli sauce, if you like, and lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:15:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5425,5425,'en','Fragrant biryani with coriander cod','Try this delicious biryani served with cod fillets. White fish is a great lean protein, making this a healthy dish that’s low in calories and fat','["2 large onions (320g), halved and sliced","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","25g ginger, peeled and cut into thin matchsticks","1-2 red chillies, deseeded and sliced","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","250g brown basmati rice","1½ tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp ground cinnamon or half a cinnamon stick","3 cardamom pods, seeds removed and ground","320g baby spinach","120g pot plain bio yogurt","150g frozen peas","15g coriander, plus extra to serve","1 tbsp lemon juice","4 chunky cod loins (560g)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the onions, oil and ginger in a frying pan over a medium heat. Add 100ml water then cover, bring to a simmer and cook for 10 mins. Take off the lid, add the chillies and 1 tsp bouillon, then cook for 10 mins more – the water should evaporate.","Meanwhile, tip the rice into asaucepan, cover with 500ml cold water and stir in 1 tsp of the cumin seeds, the cinnamon, ground cardamom and the remaining 1 tsp bouillon. Bring to the boil, cover and simmer for 20-25 mins until the rice is cooked and the water absorbed.","Tip the onion mixture into a bowl and set aside. Put the spinach in thefrying panwith the remaining ½ tsp cumin seeds and cook until the spinach has just wilted. Tip 1 tbsp of the onion mixture into a bowl with 1 tbsp of the yogurt and set aside. Tip half the cooked rice into an ovenproof pan that has a lid. Top with the wilted spinach, then half the remaining onion mixture. Next, stir the peas into the remaining rice, then spread this over in a layer, followed by the rest of the onion mixture, then the rest of the yogurt. Cover and bake for 15 mins.","Meanwhile, stir the coriander into the onion and yogurt mixture that was set aside in step 3 along with the lemon juice and 1 tbsp water. Blitz until smooth with ahand blender, then use this to coat the cod. After the biryani has been cooking for 15 mins, lay the cod on top along with the marinade. Cover and bake for another 15-18 mins until the fish flakes. Serve half topped with more coriander and chill the rest for another day.Will keep chilled for up to two days. Reheat in the microwave until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:15:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5427,5427,'en','Healthy lasagne','Enjoy our lighter version of the family classic – lasagne. It has bags of flavour, but comes in at under 500 calories a portion, as well as packing in four of your five-a-day','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion (250g), finely chopped","320g carrots, finely chopped","2 celery sticks (140g), finely chopped","2 bay leaves","500g 5% beef mince","3 large garlic cloves, finely grated","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","1½ tsp vegetable bouillon powder","400ml semi-skimmed milk","30g wholemeal flour","generous pinch of nutmeg","6 sheets wholemeal lasagne (125g)","25g finely grated parmesan"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Heat the oil in a largefrying panover a medium heat and fry the onion, carrots, celery and one of the bay leaves for 8-10 mins until the veg softens and is starting to turn golden. Add the mince and garlic, and stir-fry until the beef browns, about 5 mins. Tip in the tomatoes and a canful of water, the tomato purée and bouillon, bring to the boil, then cover and simmer for 20 mins, removing the lid after 10 mins to reduce the mixture slightly.","Meanwhile, pour the milk into a medium pan with the flour andwhiskover a low heat until the mixture is lump-free. Add the second bay leaf and a good pinch of nutmeg, and continue to cook, whisking, for 8-10 mins until thick.","Remove the bay from the mince and white sauce, and discard. Spoon a third of the mince into the base of a 19 x 24cm baking dish and top with two lasagne sheets. Spoon over half of the remaining mince, then top with two more lasagne sheets, the rest of the mince and the remaining lasagne sheets. Spoon over the white sauce and sprinkle with the cheese. Bake for 40 mins until bubbling and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:15:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5429,5429,'en','One-pan piri piri chicken dinner','Try this one-pan piri piri chicken for a family dinner and adjust the chilli levels to suit your family’s tolerance. You can use a whole chicken instead, if you like','["1kg bone-in chicken thighs and drumsticks (equal quantities of each saves any arguments)","500g baby potatoes, thickly sliced","2 peppers (1 red, 1 yellow), thickly sliced","200g cherry tomatoes","handful of coriander leaves, chopped","buttered corn on the cob, to serve","1½ tsp smoked paprika","25g light brown soft sugar","1 lime, zested and juiced","1 tsp dried chilli flakes (use less if you prefer less heat)","2 garlic cloves, chopped","4 tbsp olive oil","½ bunch of fresh oregano, leaves picked or 1 tbsp dried oregano","1 red chilli (optional), deseeded and chopped","1 tbsp red wine or port (optional)"]','["Pound all the marinade ingredients together with 1 tsp salt using a largepestle and mortar, or blitz in a mini chopper to create a loose paste. Slash each chicken piece a few times, then tip into a bowl and coat in the marinade. Cover and chill for at least 1 hr or up to 24 hrs.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Tip the chicken along with the marinade and potatoes into a roasting tin. Toss together, then arrange the chicken on top of the potatoes, thighs skin-side up. Roast for 35-40 mins until the chicken has browned.","Remove the tin from the oven and mix the peppers in with the potatoes, baste the chicken in some of the juices in the tin and turn the drumsticks. Nestle the cherry tomatoes in among the chicken and roast for another 20-25 mins until the chicken is cooked through, the skin is crisp and the vegetables are nicely roasted. Scatter with the coriander and some flaky sea salt, if you like, and serve straight from the tin with the buttered corn on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:15:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5431,5431,'en','Sweet potato gnocchi with tomato sauce','Try this tasty gnocchi made with both sweet potatoes and white potatoes. The sweet potatoes count towards your five-a-day, as does the accompanying tomato sauce','["350g sweet potatoes","4 baking potatoes (950g)","200g wholemeal spelt flour, plus extra if needed","1 tbsp olive oil","4 garlic cloves, finely grated","1-2 fresh chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","600g large vine-ripened tomatoes, finely chopped","15g basil, half chopped","50g finely grated Italian-style vegetarian hard cheese"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put both types of potato on abaking tray, prick all over with a fork, then bake for 50-60 mins until a knife easily slides into them. Cut all the potatoes in half to allow excess steam to escape as they cool.","Meanwhile, make the sauce. Heat the oil in a pan over a medium heat and fry the garlic and chillies until softened. Tip in the tomatoes, stir in half the chopped basil, then cover and leave to cook over a low heat for 20-30 mins to make a thick sauce.","When the baked potatoes are cool enough to handle, carefully peel and discard the skins, then mash well until smooth. Stir in the flour, then knead briefly with your hands to create a dough, adding a little extra flour if the mixture is sticky.","Halve the dough, then wrap one half and put it in the fridge for another day.Will keep chilled for up to three days.Quarter the remaining dough, then roll each piece into a sausage about 28cm long and cut into even bite-sized chunks. Lightly press using the back of a fork to create ridges, if you like, then set aside, spaced apart.","Bring a large pan of water to the boil, then drop in the gnocchi and cook for 2-4 mins until they rise to the surface, then scoop them out using a slotted spoon. Don’t let them overcook or they’ll fall apart. Toss with half the tomato sauce, tear in half the remaining basil, and scatter over half the cheese.The remainder will keep chilled for up to three days.Make the rest of the gnocchi as described in step 4, then reheat in the sauce and serve as above with the remaining basil and cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:15:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5433,5433,'en','Cauliflower & curried mayo burgers','Try these veggie burgers at your next barbecue – they pack in two of your five a day and a kick of curry heat','["1 small cauliflower","3 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp medium curry powder","2 large tomatoes, finely chopped","1 red onion, finely chopped","½ bunch of coriander, finely chopped","2 tbsp mayonnaise","3 tbsp Greek yogurt","2 tbsp curry paste","4 burger buns","2 handfuls of bombay mix, (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Pull the leaves off the cauliflower and cut off the base, then slice into 2cm-thick steaks. Mix the oil with the curry powder. Lay the cauliflower steaks on a flat baking tray lined with foil. Brush each one generously with the curry oil on both sides, and sprinkle with salt before roasting for 25-30 mins until tender.","In a bowl, mix together the tomatoes, onion, coriander and a pinch of salt. In a second bowl mix together the mayonnaise, yogurt and curry paste.","Toast the buns cut-side down in a dry frying pan. Top each bun with a dollop of curried mayo, the cauliflower steak, some more curried mayo, the tomato and onion mix and some bombay mix, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5435,5435,'en','Oven-roasted sweet potatoes','Make perfectly roasted sweet potatoes that are fluffy on the inside and lightly browned at the edges for a colourful side dish. Add a few sliced red onions to the roasting tin, if you like','["4 sweet potatoes (about 1.2kg), peeled","2 tbsp olive oil","sliced red onions, unpeeled garlic cloves, thyme sprigs or other veg or herbs of your choice (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 230C/210C fan/gas 8.Chopthe sweet potatoes into 2-3cm cubes.","Tip into a large, shallow roasting tin, drizzle with the oil and season with salt and pepper. If you''re adding additional veg or herbs, such as sliced red onions, garlic cloves and thyme, tip these in as well. Toss everything together to coat in the oil, then roast for 20 mins. Toss again to ensure the potatoes cook evenly, and roast for another 15-20 mins until the potatoes are lightly browned on the outside and tender when pierced with a fork or knife."]','2026-01-10 12:15:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5437,5437,'en','Creamy mushroom & spinach pasta','Toss together tagliatelle, mushrooms and spinach in a parmesan and crème fraîche sauce to make a quick and low calorie dinner that takes just 25 minutes','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 small onion, finely chopped","150g baby mushrooms, halved","150g tagliatelle","2 garlic cloves, crushed","200g low-fat crème fraîche","15g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated","120g baby spinach","½ tsp chilli flakes (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a mediumsaucepanover a medium heat and fry the onion and mushrooms for 10 mins, or until softened and browned slightly. Meanwhile, cook the pasta following pack instructions.","Add the garlic to the pan with the mushrooms and cook for 2 mins more. Tip in the crème fraîche and parmesan, stir to combine, then add the baby spinach. Set aside.","Remove the pasta from the heat and drain, reserving 25ml of the water. Toss the pasta in the creamy mushroom sauce, put back on the heat and cook over a low heat until the spinach wilts, about 5 mins. Pour in enough of the reserved water to loosen slightly. Season with black pepper and finish with a sprinkle of chilli flakes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5439,5439,'en','Herby paneer baked rice','Throw together basmati rice, paneer, mangetout and peas to make this quick and easy veggie dinner for two. It’s a great choice for busy weeknights','["150g basmati rice","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","400ml hot vegetable stock","½ small pack of parsley, finely chopped","1 lemon, zested and juiced","65g paneer, cut into 1½ cm cubes","100g mangetout, halved lengthways","100g frozen peas"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the rice and rapeseed oil into a mediumcasserole dish(around 25 x 20cm), season and mix to coat the rice in the oil. Add the stock, most of the parsley, most of the lemon zest and all the juice, stir together and season.","Dot the paneer cubes all over the top of the rice and bake for 20 mins until the rice is very nearly cooked and the paneer is beginning to turn golden on top. Mix through the mangetout and peas, then put back in the oven for 5-7 mins until the veg is cooked but still bright in colour. Sprinkle over the reserved parsley and lemon zest."]','2026-01-10 12:15:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5441,5441,'en','Asparagus, feta & dill quiche','Make the most of eggs in this versatile veggie quiche. Baked with feta and asparagus, it’s encased in a cheesy pastry and makes a perfect addition for a picnic','["½ tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","500g asparagus (about two bunches), woody stalks removed","100ml double cream","300ml crème fraîche","1 tbsp natural yogurt","3 eggs","¼ tsp white pepper","¼ tsp smoked paprika","small handful of dill","200g feta, cut into 1cm cubes","250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","50g vegetarian Italian-style hard cheese, grated","130g cold salted butter, cut into cubes"]','["Heat the oil in a pan over a medium heat and fry the onion for 5 mins. Add the garlic and cook for 5 mins more until the onion is soft but not golden. Remove from the heat and leave to cool.","Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil and cook the asparagus for 3 mins. Drain, then plunge into a bowl of cold water to stop the cooking process. Drain again. Set eight spears aside, then chop the rest into 3cm lengths.","For the pastry, combine the flour and cheese in a bowl, then rub in the butter using your fingers until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Add 1 tbsp cold water at a time until the mixture comes together into a dough – you may need 3-6 tbsp water. Wrap and chill in the freezer for 5 mins to firm up slightly.","Roll the pastry outon a lightly floured surface until it’s large enough to line a deep 23cm flan tin with a slight overlap. Using the rolling pin to help you, unravel the pastry over the tin and gently push the pastry into the edge. Trim the overhanging pastry so it comes up 2cm past the rim of the tin. Gently prick the pastry base all over using a fork, then return to the freezer to chill for 15 mins. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Scrunch up a square of baking parchment, then use it to line the chilled pastry case. Fill with baking beans and bake for 15 mins. Remove the baking beans and parchment and bake for 5 mins more. Leave to cool. Meanwhile, combine the cream, crème fraîche, yogurt and eggs in a bowl, but don’t stir too hard – avoid creating bubbles. Stir in the fried onion mixture, the pepper and paprika, then fold in the dill, most of the feta and the cooked asparagus.","Put the pastry case on a baking tray. Pour in the filling, ensuring the feta and chopped asparagus are evenly distributed, then add the whole asparagus spears and remaining feta.","Put in the oven and immediately reduce the temperature to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bake for 35-40 mins until set with a slight wobble in the middle. Leave to cool before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:15:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5443,5443,'en','Radishes with herby whipped feta','Serve this creamy whipped feta dip as a sharing dish. Drizzle over a little olive oil and serve with radishes for dunking along with carrots and cucumber','["130g feta, crumbled","150g thick Greek-style yogurt","½ lemon, zested","¼ bunch of dill","¼ bunch of basil","3 tbsp extra virgin olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","1 tsp coriander seeds","1 tsp za’atar or chilli flakes","1 bunch of radishes (see tip below)"]','["Put the feta, yogurt, lemon zest, herbs and oil in afood processoror high-speed blender and pulse until the mixture is a creamy, smooth texture. Spoon into a shallow serving bowl and set aside.","Gently toast the coriander seeds in a dry frying pan over a low- medium heat for a few minutes until fragrant. Scatter the seeds over the dip, along with the za’atar or chilli flakes. Drizzle over a little olive oil and serve with the radishes for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:15:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5445,5445,'en','Healthy beef chow mein','Swap your weekly takeaway for this healthy beef chow mein – it’s quick to cook and low in fat and calories','["2 wholemeal noodle nests (85g)","2 tsp rapeseed or sesame oil","200g lean fillet steak, fat removed and cut into strips","1 small red onion (100g), finely chopped","15g piece of ginger, peeled and finely chopped","160g chestnut mushrooms, thickly sliced","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","160g ready-to-eat beansprouts","1½ tsp tamari","1 tbsp brown rice vinegar","4 spring onions (65g), cut into diagonal lengths"]','["Cook the noodles following pack instructions. Meanwhile, heat half the oil in awokand stir-fry the beef over a high heat for 30 seconds until browned. Tip onto a plate, set aside, then add the remaining oil to the wok. Stir-fry the onion and ginger until softened. Add a drop of water to prevent burning, if needed and cook covered for 2-3 mins.","Stir in the mushrooms and garlic, and fry until they start to soften (around 3 mins), then add the beansprouts and cook for a minute or two more until piping hot.","Mix the tamari and vinegar together in a small bowl with 2 tbsp water. Add the drained noodles to the wok, toss well, then add the tamari mixture, spring onions and the beef. Stir-fry for a few minutes until heated through. Season with plenty of black pepper and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5447,5447,'en','Pan-fried salmon with braised Little Gem','If you’re looking for a quick and wholesome fish dinner, try this pan-fried salmon with greens and a light creamy sauce. It takes less than 15 minutes to make','["2 tsp olive oil","4 Little Gem lettuces, halved lengthways","200ml vegetable stock","4 x 130g salmon fillets","200g fresh or frozen peas (defrosted if frozen)","½ small bunch of dill, chopped","1 tbsp half-fat crème fraîche","1 tsp Dijon mustard"]','["Heat 1 tsp oil in a large lidded frying pan over a medium heat. Arrange the lettuce halves in the pan, cut-side down, and fry for 2 mins until beginning to brown. Pour in the stock, cover with the lid and cook for 6 mins.","Meanwhile, season the salmon with a good pinch each of salt and pepper on both sides of the fillets. Heat the remaining oil in a second pan over a medium heat and fry the salmon, skin-side down, for 3 mins. Carefully flip using a fish slice and cook for 3 mins more until cooked through and the flesh easily flakes.","Tip the peas and dill into the pan with the lettuce and cook for 2 mins, covered, until the lettuce is tender but still retains its structure. Arrange the salmon fillets and lettuce halves on serving plates.","Stir the crème fraîche and mustard into the lettuce pan and cook over a low heat to warm through. Pour the sauce and peas over the lettuce and salmon."]','2026-01-10 12:15:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5449,5449,'en','One-pan roast rack of lamb & green olive potatoes','Serve an easy, romantic meal for two with our roast rack of lamb. We’ve added olives and anchovies, but leave them out if you want to keep it even simpler','["1 rack of lamb (6 bones is ideal)","25g butter","1 onion, finely sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 anchovy, crushed using a pestle and mortar (optional)","small handful of rosemary springs, roughly chopped","500g Maris Piper or King Edward potatoes, finely sliced (use a mandoline if you have one)","10 pitted green olives, chopped","100ml chicken or lamb stock"]','["Heat the oven to 210C/190C fan/gas 7. Generously season the lamb all over and heat the butter in a large ovenproof frying pan over a medium heat. Brown the lamb all over for 10-15 mins, especially the fat side. Remove and set aside on a plate.","Put the pan back on the heat and fry the onion for 5-7 mins until softened, then add the garlic, anchovy (if using) and rosemary, and fry for 2 mins more. Carefully arrange the potatoes in the pan with the olives, season, then turn them over so they’re fully coated in the mixture, then spread out in an even layer. Pour over the stock, then put in the oven for 30 mins until the potatoes start to crisp at the edges.","Sit the lamb on top of the potatoes, fat-side up, and drizzle over any of the juices from the plate. Put the pan back in the oven for 20 mins for lamb that’s rare, 25 mins for lamb that’s pink but cooked through, and 30 mins for well done. When the lamb is done to your liking, lift onto a carving board and leave to rest for 10 mins. During this time, put the potatoes back in the oven to make them extra crisp. Cut the lamb into chops and serve with the potatoes, the cavolo nero and parsley & caper dressing (see ''goes well with'', below)."]','2026-01-10 12:15:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5451,5451,'en','Squash with orzo & roasted garlic & feta sauce','Enjoy roasted squash wedges served with orzo and a roasted garlic, lemon and feta sauce. Packed with flavour, it’s a great veggie dinner for two','["1 garlic bulb","4 tbsp olive oil","1 medium squash (about 800g), peeled, halved and cut into 2-3cm wedges","1 tsp smoked paprika","200g orzo","1 large leek, halved lengthways and finely sliced","½ tbsp unsalted butter","1 preserved lemon, finely chopped","150ml chicken or vegetable stock","1 small bunch of flat-leaf parsley, finely chopped","200g feta","3½ tbsp yogurt","½ lemon, juiced"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Remove the outer layers of the garlic bulb and slice off the root end, being careful to not cut too deep into the cloves. Put on a small sheet of foil, drizzle with 1 tbsp of the olive oil and sprinkle over a pinch of salt. Scrunch to enclose the garlic in the foil and bake for 45 mins. Remove from the oven and leave to cool still wrapped in the foil.","Meanwhile, toss the squash with 2 tbsp of the oil, the paprika and some seasoning. Tip onto a baking sheet and roast for 30-40 mins, turning halfway, until the squash is tender and has some colour.","For the sauce, combine the feta, yogurt, lemon juice and 4 of the roasted garlic cloves (squeezing the flesh out of the skins) to create a smooth paste. It should be thick but pourable – add up to 2 tbsp water to loosen if needed. Set aside.","Cook the orzo in a pan of salted water over a medium heat for 4-5 mins until it’s cooked but still has bite. Drain, reserving a cupful of the orzo water and cool in asieveunder cold running water.","Cook the leek with 1 tbsp oil and the butter over a medium heat in a large pan, stirring regularly, for 5 mins. Add the preserved lemon and the flesh of 3 roasted garlic cloves, then mash together well. Once the leeks are translucent, tip in the cooked orzo, stock and a splash of the pasta cooking water. Stir for a minute to warm through the orzo. Mix in half of the parsley.","Spoon the orzo and leeks onto plates, top with the squash and drizzle over the feta sauce. Sprinkle with remaining parsley and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5453,5453,'en','Roasted red cabbage with pomegranate molasses','Serve this caramelised roasted red cabbage with ruby pomegranate seeds as a special veggie side this Christmas','["½ red cabbage, any damaged outer leaves removed","1 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses","50g pomegranate seeds"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Cut the cabbage into four wedges, leaving the core intact (this will hold the pieces together). Arrange on abaking tray, rub the oil all over the cabbage wedges and season well. Roast for 20 mins.","Drizzle over the pomegranate molasses and return to the oven for another 8-10 mins until the molasses caramelises. Scatter with pomegranate seeds before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:15:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5455,5455,'en','Muhammara (red pepper & walnut dip)','Serve a Syrian-inspired red pepper and walnut dip as a side dish in a Middle Eastern feast. Top with whole walnuts and coriander and enjoy with flatbreads','["3 red peppers","70g walnut halves","1 tbsp pomegranate molasses","½ tsp hot chilli flakes","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp tomato paste","1 small garlic clove, crushed","handful of breadcrumbs","¾ tsp fine sea salt","olive oil, to serve","handful of coriander leaves, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Roast the peppers for 25-30 mins, turning halfway, until tender and starting to blister (if they don’t blister, grill them for a few minutes). Cool a bit, then peel and discard the skins. Discard the seeds and finely chop the flesh. Toast the walnuts for 5 mins until lightly browned.","Grind all but four of the walnut halves in aspice grinderuntil they are quite fine but still have some texture. Mix the ground walnuts with the peppers, then add the molasses, spices, tomato paste, garlic, breadcrumbs and sea salt, mix well and season.","Serve the muhammara on a small plate, drizzling with some olive oil. Add the whole walnuts to the centre and some coriander around the edge."]','2026-01-10 12:15:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5457,5457,'en','Creamy pumpkin pasta','Make the most of pumpkins this autumn. When puréed and combined with mascarpone and parmesan, their flesh transforms into a silky, delicious pasta sauce','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","500g pumpkin or squash, peeled and cut into roughly 3cm cubes","50-100ml whole milk","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp mascarpone","350g short pasta (rigatoni or penne work well)","40g grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large, shallow, flameproofcasseroleor frying pan over a low-medium heat and fry the onion with a pinch of salt for 10-15 mins until softened and translucent. Add the garlic and fry for 1 min more. Remove from the heat and leave to cool slightly.","Meanwhile, cook the pumpkin in a pan of boiling salted water for 10-15 mins until tender when pierced with a cutlery knife. Drain and tip into ablender(or use ahand blender). Blitz with 50ml milk and the onions until completely smooth, gradually adding more milk until the mixture is thick enough to just coat the back of a spoon (you may not need all the milk). Tip into a large frying pan with the tomato purée and mascarpone, and bring to a simmer over a low heat.","Cook the pasta in a large pan of boiling, salted water following pack instructions. Drain, reserving a cupful of the cooking water. Toss the pasta with the pumpkin sauce, parmesan and 50-100ml of the reserved water to loosen. Season and scatter with extra parmesan."]','2026-01-10 12:15:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5459,5459,'en','Pomegranate brisket','Add the sour-sweet notes of pomegranate molasses to bring amazing depth of flavour to this slow-cooked beef dish. This is a popular dish at Jewish festivals','["beef brisket (if rolled, unroll it)","red onions, finely sliced","½ pomegranate, seeds only","cooked giant couscous tossed through with 10g coriander leaves, a little urfa chilli, sliced cucumber and lemon zest (optional), to serve","120ml pomegranate molasses","60ml olive oil","2 tsp ras el hanout","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tsp urfa chilli flakes"]','["Mix the marinade ingredients in a small bowl with ¾ tsp fine salt. Put the beef in a large, ovenproof dish. Pour half the marinade over the beef and spread evenly, then turn it over and pour the rest over the meat over the meat to coat. Cover and chill overnight.","Remove the meat from the fridge up to 1 hr before cooking to come up to room temperature. If it’s a hot day, you can reduce that to 30 mins. Heat the oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 9.","Turn the meat in the marinade to make sure it is well coated, leaving the fatty layer on the top. Put half the sliced onions underneath the meat and spread the rest over the top. Cover the dish loosely with foil, making sure it is properly covered.","Roast for 15 mins, then turn the oven down to 170C/150C fan/gas 3 and cook for a further 2 hrs 30 mins-3 hrs. Check it to see how tender it is – a fork should go in and come out easily and the meat should flake well, if not, put back in the oven for another 30 mins.","Rest the brisket for 15 mins, still covered with foil, then transfer to a board. Decorate with the pomegranate seeds. Serve with the giant couscous, if you like, or shred with two forks, then spoon over some of the pomegranate sauce, then serve with pitta bread and dips of your choice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5461,5461,'en','Mushroom tart','Create an eye-catching mushroom tart for an easy but impressive vegetarian main course. Try a tasty pairing of earthy mushrooms, cream cheese and nutty pastry','["175g Flora 100% Natural Ingredients plus 2 tbsp","300g wholemeal flour","A small handful of thyme, leaves picked","600g mixed mushrooms, cleaned and sliced","1 small onion, finely choped","125g soft cheese","1/2 small bunch chives, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 egg, beaten to glaze"]','["Put 175g Flora 100% Natural Ingredients, wholemeal flour, half the thyme and a pinch of salt in a food processor and pulse until it starts to clump together. Add 2-3 tbsp cold water and pulse again until it forms a ball. Wrap and chill for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, heat the remaining 2 tbsp spread in a frying pan, and fry the mushrooms and onions for 10 mins until soft and lightly golden. Season well and remove from the heat.","Heat the oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Add a large flat baking sheet to the oven to heat up. Whisk the soft cheese with half the chives, remaining thyme and all the garlic. Season well.","Roll the pastry out in between two sheets of parchment to a rough rectangle shape, the thickness of a £1 coin, about 30x40cm. Remove the top layer of parchment and smooth over the soft cheese mixture, leaving a 5cm border. Spoon over the mushrooms, in an even layer over the soft cheese, then fold over the 4 sides of the border to overlap the filling slightly. Trim the sides before you fold over if you need to, but will look lovely when baked either way. Glaze the pastry with egg.","Using the parchment to help you, slide the tart onto the hot tray with the paper. Bake for 35-40 mins until the pasty is cooked though, and crisp. Scatter with the remaining chives to serve, along with a green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:15:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5463,5463,'en','Summer bean & bulgur soup','Here’s a serving of five of your 5-a-day in one delicious and quick-to-make soup. If you make this ahead, the bulgur soaks up quite a lot of the liquid, so add a splash of water to loosen a little (or just eat as a summery stew).','["400g can borlotti beans","1 tbsp olive oil","160g butternut squash, diced (prepared weight)","1 leek (about 160g), thinly sliced","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","1 tsp fresh thyme leaves","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","1 courgette (170g), halved and sliced","80g whole cherry tomatoes","40g bulgur wheat","20g basil leaves, chopped","25g parmesan or Italian-style vegetarian hard cheese, finely grated"]','["Drain the beans and set aside. Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan, add the squash and fry for a few minutes over a high heat to soften. Add the leek and garlic and cook a few minutes more. Pour in 2 cans of water (using the bean can). Stir in the thyme, tomato purée and bouillon along with the sliced courgette and whole cherry tomatoes, the bulgur and beans. Bring to the boil, then add half the basil. Cover the pan and simmer for 10 mins until the veg is tender.","Stir in the remaining basil and three-quarters of the cheese. Ladle into bowls and serve with the remaining cheese scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:15:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5465,5465,'en','Pork meatballs with bulgur salad, feta & mint','Meatballs with a low fat content can often be dry, but adding grated carrot and onion not only moistens them, it adds flavour and texture','["100g carrot, grated","2 white onions, (280g), 130g coarsely grated, the rest finely chopped","500g 5% fat pork mince","1tsp dried oregano","½ tbsp rapeseed oil","2 large garlic cloves, finely grated","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","125g bulgur wheat","1 lemon, zested and juiced","1 red onion, finely chopped","160g cucumber, finely diced","100g cherry tomatoes, quartered","6 Kalamata olives, sliced","15g mint leaves, a few small ones reserved for scattering, the rest roughly chopped","75g feta, crumbled"]','["Mix the grated carrot and onion with the pork, half of the oregano and plenty of black pepper. Shape into 16 large meatballs. Heat theoil in a large deep non-stickfrying panand fry the meatballs for about 5-8 mins, turning occasionally until firm and starting to colour. Remove from the pan and set aside.","Tip the chopped onion into the pan and fry over a medium heat until starting to soften, about 5 mins. Stir in the garlic, then add the tomatoes along with the tomato purée, a can of water, the bouillon powder and remaining oregano. Cook over a low heat, covered, for 15 mins, then add the meatballs. Cover and simmer for a further 10 mins","Meanwhile, boil the bulgur for 15-20 mins until tender, then drain. Tip into a bowl and stir in the lemon zest and 2-3 tbsp juice, the red onion, cucumber, tomatoes, olives and chopped mint. Pile half onto two plates and top with half the meatballs and sauce. Scatter over the mint leaves and half the feta. Chill the rest for another night.Will keep chilled for up to three days. Reheat the meatballs over a low heat until piping hot, then serve with the salad.If frozen, leave to defrost fully and reheat gently until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:15:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5467,5467,'en','Ratatouille & ricotta macaroni','This is a deconstructed twist on macaroni cheese with a layer of Mediterranean veg using Italian ricotta, so you don’t have to make a traditional sauce','["400g chopped tomatoes","3 tbsp tomato purée","4 large garlic cloves, finely grated","12 Kalamata olives, quartered","1 tsp bouillon powder","1 large aubergine (350g), diced","2 courgettes (325g), halved and sliced","200g ricotta","20g pack basil, small leaves reserved to garnish, the rest chopped","400g wholemeal penne","20g finely grated parmesan"]','["Tip the tomatoes into a pan with a can of water, the tomato purée, garlic, olives and bouillon. Add the aubergine and courgettes, then cover and simmer for 30 mins until the veg are tender.","Meanwhile, mix the ricotta and basil together in a small bowl with plenty of black pepper.","Boil half of the pasta following pack instructions, then drain, reserving some of the cooking water. Tip into a bowl and toss with half the ricotta mixture and a couple of spoonful of pasta water, adding more to loosen if needed. Spoon half the ratatouille and the penne into two pasta bowls and sprinkle with half the parmesan and basil leaves. Cover and chill the remaining ratatouille, basil and ricotta for another night.Will keep chilled for up to three days.When ready to serve again, warm the ratatouille in a pan over a low heat and continue with the method from step 3."]','2026-01-10 12:15:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5469,5469,'en','Cod & anchovy bake','Get your weekly portion of white fish with this healthy all-in-one recipe made with anchovies, tomatoes, spinach and red pepper. It delivers four of your five-a-day','["1 large or 2 medium potatoes, sliced into 5mm-thick rounds (about 280g)","1 onion, thinly sliced (about 160g)","1 tbsp thyme leaves","10g anchovies, finely chopped","1 tbsp olive or rapeseed oil","1 red pepper, quartered, deseeded and sliced","2 large tomatoes, roughly chopped (about 250g)","1 tsp white wine vinegar","½ tsp vegetable bouillon powder","1 garlic clove, finely grated","2 skinless, boneless cod loins (280g)","25g cheddar, finely grated","250g baby spinach, wilted, to serve"]','["Cook the potatoes and onions in boiling water for 5-7 mins. Drain, then gently mix with the thyme, anchovies and some black pepper.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in apanand cook the pepper, covered, for 5 mins. Add the tomatoes, vinegar, bouillon and garlic, and cook for 8-10 mins more, uncovered, until the tomatoes have softened. You don’t want this to be too wet, so continue to cook until any excess liquid has evaporated, if necessary.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Lay the cod loins in a shallow ovenproof dish and spoon over the tomato mixture, then the potato and onion mixture, in even layers. Sprinkle over the cheese. Bake for 30 mins until the cheese is golden and the fish is flaking but moist. Serve with the spinach on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:15:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5471,5471,'en','Kimchi sesame udon noodles','Enjoy udon noodles with kimchi, radish and spring onion for a speedy midweek meal that delivers three of your 5-a-day. Top with a fried egg and chilli flakes','["200g straight-to-wok udon noodles","1½ tbsp sesame oil","1 onion, halved and finely sliced","thumb-sized piece of ginger, grated","200g long-stemmed broccoli, stalks sliced","75g kimchi, finely chopped","100g radishes, finely sliced","4 spring onions, sliced","½ tbsp low-salt soy sauce","2 large eggs","2 tsp black sesame seeds","1 tsp chilli flakes (optional)"]','["Put the noodles in a sieve over the sink and pour over akettleof boiling water. Toss to separate, then leave to drain.","Heat 1 tbsp of the sesame oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat. Add the onion and ginger, and fry for 5 mins until softened slightly. Add the broccoli, kimchi and radish, and continue to fry for 5 mins. Stir in the drained noodles, spring onions and soy sauce.","Meanwhile, put the remaining ½ tbsp oil in a smallfrying panand fry the eggs for 3 mins, or until cooked to your liking. Serve the noodles in bowls with an egg on top, and sprinkle with the sesame seeds and some chilli flakes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5473,5473,'en','Turmeric, ginger & coconut fish curry','Serve up this healthy fish curry, with vibrant turmeric, ginger and coconut flavours, for an easy midweek meal. It takes just 30 minutes from prep to plate','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, finely sliced","thumb-sized piece of ginger, grated","½ tbsp turmeric","1 tbsp garam masala","½ tsp cayenne","325ml light coconut milk","400g boneless and skinless cod loin, cut into chunks","300g frozen peas","300g sugar snap peas","400g brown basmati rice, cooked, to serve","1 red chilli, finely sliced","1 lime, cut into wedges, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a largesaucepanover a medium heat, then fry the onion for 8 mins until translucent. Stir in the ginger and spices, and cook for another minute. Pour in the coconut milk and 100ml water, stir, then simmer for 10 mins.","Add the cod, frozen peas and sugar snap peas, and simmer for 5 mins until the fish is flaky. Serve with the rice, sliced chilli, a good grinding of black pepper and some lime wedges on the side for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:15:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5475,5475,'en','Easy roast leg of lamb','Roast a leg of lamb for a family feast. It’s ideal served with roasties and your favourite spring vegetables','["2kg-2.5kg leg of lamb","small bunch rosemary, cut into 2cm short sprigs","4-5 garlic cloves, finely sliced","4-6 brown anchovy fillets, chopped (optional)","2 tbsp olive oil","2 large onions, thickly sliced"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Remove all packaging from the lamb and keep a note of the weight to calculate the roasting time. Make incisions into the lamb using a small sharpknife, at an angle, about 5cm into the meat. Making the holes at an angle will mean more of the meat is flavoured, and the flavourings will be less tempted to be pushed out when roasting.","Insert a short sprig of rosemary, a garlic slice and a small piece of anchovy (if using) into each of the holes, pressing in well with your finger. Season the meat all over with salt and pepper, then rub the lamb all over with the olive oil. Transfer to aroasting tin, sat on the onion slices. Roast for 20 mins.","Lower the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and cook for another 15-20 mins per 500g (1 hr – 1 hr 20 mins for 2kg leg) depending on how pink you like your lamb. You can also check the internal temperature of the lamb if you prefer pinker meat – it will be 55C for medium (pink) and 70C for well done.","Cover with foil and rest for 15 mins before carving. Save the tray juices and onion slices to make gravy."]','2026-01-10 12:15:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5477,5477,'en','Smoked trout & horseradish pâté','Whizz up this fish dip with hot tangy mustard notes, cream cheese, lemon and dill – great for a last minute party dish','["140g cream cheese","1 tsp creamed horseradish","zest and juice ½  lemon","1 tbsp finely chopped  dill , plus extra fronds to serve","2 smoked trout fillets","500g rye bread , sliced, to serve","1 Baby Gem lettuce , leaves separated, to serve"]','["Put the cream cheese, horseradish, and lemon zest and juice in a bowl, and mix together until smooth. Season.","Add the chopped dill and flake in the smoked trout, removing any bones or skin as you go. Stir well to combine and add more seasoning to taste.The pâté will keep in the fridge for up to 2 days.Serve garnished with dill fronds and sprinkled with cracked black pepper. Eat with rye bread and lettuce leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:15:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5479,5479,'en','Creamy leek, potato, cheddar & chive fish pie','Use fresh fish to make this creamy, pastry-topped pie. The prawn, haddock and salmon filling and crumbly topping make this pie extremely moreish','["400g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp fine salt","½ small bunch of thyme, leaves picked","½ tbsp English mustard powder","180g cold unsalted butter, cut into cubes","2 large eggs, beaten","steamed greens, to serve","1 potato (about 270g), chopped into 3cm chunks","1 tbsp olive oil","50g butter","2 leeks, finely sliced","3 tbsp plain flour","400ml whole milk","100ml double cream","100g mature cheddar, grated","3 tsp Dijon mustard","¼ bunch of chives, finely chopped","200g skinless salmon fillet, cut into chunks","200g skinless smoked haddock fillet, cut into chunks","100g raw king prawns, peeled"]','["Tip the flour, salt, thyme and mustard powder into afood processorand pulse briefly. Add the butter and pulse again to a fine breadcrumb texture. Add half the egg and 1 tbsp cold water and pulse until it comes together into a dough (you can add up to 1-2 tbsp more water if it’s dry). Tip the dough onto a work surface and knead briefly. Wrap and chill for 30 mins.","To make the filling, cook the potato in a pan of boiling water for 8-10 mins. Drain and leave to steam-dry. Heat the oil and butter in a large frying pan over a medium heat, and fry the leeks for 5 mins. Stir in the flour and cook for 2 mins, then add the milk, a little at a time, stirring between each addition to combine. Add the cream, cheese and mustard, and cook for 1-2 mins more until the cheese has melted. Stir in the chives and season. Remove from the heat and leave to cool for 15 mins.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/ gas 8. Gently fold the salmon, potato, haddock and prawns into the creamy leek mixture, then spoon into a 27cm round pie dish. Roll the pastry out on a lightly floured surface to the thickness of a £1 coin. Drape the pastry over the pie, then trim the excess. Crimp the edges, then shape the off-cuts to decorate the top, if you like. Brush with the remaining egg, then bake in the centre of the oven for 35-40 mins until golden. Serve with steamed greens."]','2026-01-10 12:15:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5481,5481,'en','Crispy coconut prawn & mango salad','Add some zing to your day with this fresh and fruity crispy coconut prawn and mango salad. Full of flavour and colour, it’s sure to brighten up lunch','["160g raw king prawns, peeled","200ml coconut milk","1 large lime, ½ juiced, ½ cut into wedges to serve","2 tsp sesame oil","½ tsp caster sugar or honey","2 large handfuls of watercress or baby spinach (or use a mixture)","½ mango, stoned, peeled and sliced or cut into chunks","1 small avocado, stoned, peeled and sliced","½ small red onion, halved and thinly sliced","½ small bunch of mint, leaves picked","1 large red chilli, deseeded and thinly sliced","vegetable oil, for frying","2 tbsp desiccated coconut","2 tbsp cornflour"]','["Run a sharpknifedown the back of each prawn and remove the grey line that runs from the head to the tail.Whiskthe coconut milk until smooth, then tip half into a bowl with the prawns. Add half the lime juice and a pinch of salt, mix well and set aside for 15 mins.","Meanwhile, mix the remaining coconut milk with the rest of the lime juice, the sesame oil, sugar or honey, and a pinch of salt.","Divide the watercress or spinach between two plates, then top with the mango, avocado and red onion slices, the mint and sliced chillies.","Pour a 1-2cm depth of oil into a largesaucepanover a medium heat. Combine the desiccated coconut with the cornflour and some seasoning. Drain the prawns and turn in the cornflour mixture to coat, shaking off any excess.","Drop one prawn into the oil; if it sizzles, add a few more, but don’t overcrowd the pan. Fry for 1-2 mins on each side until crisp and golden, then transfer to a plate lined with kitchen paper. When all the prawns are fried, scatter them over the salad and drizzle with the dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:15:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5483,5483,'en','Lamb chops with thyme, chilli & Greek htipiti','Serve lamb chops with htipiti for a lovely Greek-inspired dish with fabulous flavours. Olive oil-roasted baby potatoes make a great accompaniment','["12 lamb cutlets","3 thyme sprigs, leaves picked","1 tsp chilli flakes","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","235g roasted red peppers from a jar, drained","175g feta, crumbled","2 spring onions, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves very finely chopped","2 thyme sprigs, leaves picked","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","squeeze of lemon juice (optional)"]','["Put the lamb cutlets in a bowl with the thyme, chilli flakes and oil. Toss together to coat, then leave to marinate in the fridge for 30 mins-1 hr.","For the htipiti, cut the peppers into small pieces. Put in a bowl and add all the other ingredients. Leave for about 15 mins for the flavour to infuse.","Heat agriddle panor frying pan. When it’s really hot, lift the chops out of the marinade. Cook them, a few at a time, for 3 mins either side, seasoning as you go. Serve the chops with the sauce, and some baby potatoes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5485,5485,'en','One-pan roast duck legs with white beans & carrots','Make a minimalist version of cassoulet by slow-roasting duck legs with white beans and carrots. It’s a dish that’s big on flavour but with few ingredients','["4 duck legs","handful of thyme sprigs","sunflower oil, for drizzling","500g carrots, sliced","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 x 400g cans white beans, drained"]','["If you have time, lightly salt the duck legs a day or two before cooking, scatter with some of the thyme sprigs, then cover and chill until needed. (If you don’t have the time, this is not an essential step.) Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Heat a little oil in a shallow flameproofcasseroleorroasting tin. If the duck legs have been salted in advance, pat them dry with kitchen paper. Sizzle the legs in the tin or casserole, skin-side down, until golden brown and the fat has rendered out. Turn and cook for 10-15 mins to brown them all over.","Remove the duck legs to a plate and pour away half the fat from the casserole or tin (you can save this for roasties). Return it to the heat and fry the carrots, garlic and thyme along with some seasoning for 5 mins until the carrots are starting to soften. Sit the duck legs on top, skin-side up, then pour about 100ml water over the veg. Bring to a simmer, cover and transfer to the oven to cook for 1 hr 30 mins.","Remove the casserole from the oven and uncover. Turn the oven up to 200C/180C/gas 6. Lift the duck out onto a plate and stir the beans through the carrots and thyme. Sit the duck back on top, then return to the oven, uncovered, to cook for another 20-30 mins until the duck skin is crisp and the beans are simmering. Remove from the oven and leave to rest for 10 mins, then serve straight from the dish."]','2026-01-10 12:15:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5487,5487,'en','Pasta alla norma','Try this easy version of an alla norma, which uses roast aubergine instead of fried. It’s then tossed with spaghetti and a rich tomato and basil sauce','["2 aubergines, cut into 3cm chunks","1 heaped tsp salt","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 small onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","pinch chilli flakes","2 x 400g tins chopped tomatoes","1 tsp sugar","350g spaghetti (egg-free, if needed)","small bunch basil, shredded, plus a few leaves to serve","1 heaped tbsp capers","ricotta salata or parmesan, finely grated, to serve (optional)"]','["Toss the aubergines with the salt, then tip into acolanderset over a bowl for 30 mins, to extract any moisture.","Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in acasseroledish or saucepan. Tip in the onion and a pinch of salt, and cook over a low heat for 10 mins. Add the garlic and chilli, and cook for 1 min. Tip in the tomatoes and sugar, and bring to the simmer. Cook, uncovered, for 20 mins, stirring occasionally. Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.","Pat the aubergine dry with kitchen paper, then toss with the remaining oil. Spread out on a baking sheet and roast for 25-30 mins until softened and golden around the edges. Meanwhile, cook the pasta following pack instructions, reserving 100ml of the cooking water.","Stir the aubergine into the sauce with the basil and capers. Season to taste, then toss the spaghetti in the pan with the sauce and a splash of the pasta water. Divide between four bowls and top with the ricotta and extra basil, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:15:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5489,5489,'en','Baked cod','Tuck into baked cod with lemon and thyme for an easy midweek meal. Serve with your favourite veggies for a healthy, fuss-free family dinner','["3 tbsp plain flour","4 cod loin fillets","2 tbsp olive oil","1 lemon, sliced","½ small bunch of thyme"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Tip the flour into a bowl and add some seasoning. Turn each cod fillet in the flour until evenly coated.","Heat half the oil in anon-stick frying panover a medium-high heat. Add the cod and fry on each side for 2 mins or until golden brown.","Transfer the cod to aroasting tin. Arrange the lemon slices and thyme on and around the fish and drizzle with the remaining oil. Bake for 10 mins or until cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:15:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5491,5491,'en','Sticky tamarind tomato & spinach whirl','Try this riff on a Greek spanakopita. With a sticky-sweet, spiced and tangy twist, it’s a spectacular veggie centrepiece for any special occasion','["300g cherry tomatoes, halved","4 small garlic cloves, sliced","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","4 tbsp tamarind paste","1 tsp sugar","1 leek, halved and finely sliced","5 spring onions, finely sliced","300g spinach, wilted, excess water squeezed out and roughly chopped","400g feta, crumbled","3 large eggs, beaten","2 tbsp finely chopped coriander leaves, plus a few leaves to serve","1 tbsp smoked paprika","6 filo pastry sheets","100g unsalted butter, melted","1 tsp chilli flakes"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Mix the tomatoes, garlic, half the oil, tamarind and sugar together, along with a generous pinch of seasoning. Tip onto abaking trayand put in the oven for 25-30 mins or until sticky and roasted. Leave to cool a little.","Heat the remaining oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat, then add the leek and spring onions, stirring occasionally until softened, about 10 mins. Leave to cool completely, then tip into a bowl and mix with the spinach, feta, roasted tomatoes, eggs, coriander, smoked paprika and seasoning.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C/gas 6. Brush a sheet of filo with melted butter, then lay another sheet on top and brush with butter again, keeping the rest of the filo covered with a clean, damp tea towel to stop it drying out, Spoon a third of the filling along the long side of the rectangle and gently roll into a long tube. Repeat this two more times until you have used all the filo and filling. In a round pie dish, or round ovenproof pan, carefully coil the three filo rolls from the outside of the dish in towards the middle, so you end up with a large spiral. Don’t worry if it cracks a bit – you can layer the filo to cover any cracks. Brush the whole spiral with more butter, sprinkle over the chilli flakes and bake for 50-60 mins until deep, golden brown. Scatter over the extra coriander to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5493,5493,'en','Squash & halloumi flatbreads with sweet chilli beetroot jam','Do something different for a family dinner with squash and halloumi flatbreads with sweet chilli beetroot jam. Other squash or sweet potato work well, too','["1 butternut squash","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp smoked paprika","225g halloumi","100g baby spinach leaves","1 small cooked beetroot (about 125g)","3 tbsp brown sugar","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","1 tsp red chilli flakes","1 tsp cumin seeds","300g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","150-200g yogurt"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Prepare the squash by halving it, scooping out the seeds, then cutting into 1cm-thick slices. Put in a large bowl with the olive oil, smoked paprika and a pinch of salt. Toss well to coat the squash, then lay on abaking trayand bake at 180C/160C fan/gas 4 for about 40 mins until soft and starting to brown on the surface.","For the chilli jam, grate the beetroot (wear gloves to prevent staining your hands) and put in asaucepanwith the sugar, vinegar, chilli flakes, cumin seeds and salt to taste. Cook for a few minutes over medium heat until the sugar has dissolved. Remove from the heat and set aside.","To make the flatbreads, tip the flour into a bowl and add 150g yogurt, or up to 200g if the dough looks too dry, then mix using a cutlery knife until it comes together into a ball. Tip the dough onto a work surface and knead for 2 mins until smooth. Split into four balls, then dust the work surface with flour and roll each into a large flatbread (or make eight mini ones). Dry-fry the flatbreads in a frying pan on medium heat for a couple of minutes on each side.","Just before serving, cut the halloumi into 8 thin slices. Cook in a frying pan for a couple of minutes on each side. Layer the spinach, squash and halloumi on the flatbreads, then drizzle with the beetroot chilli jam to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5495,5495,'en','Chicken wing dippers','Serve these chicken wing dippers with sauces for easy buffet or party food. Try our moreish teriyaki and sweet curry sauces below, they work really well','["1 kg chicken wings, wing tips removed and wings split into two pieces","1 tsp cornflour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp sunflower oil"]','["Put the wings in a large bowl and toss with 1 tsp salt, the cornflour and baking powder – this will help the skin go crispy when baking. Chill, covered, for at least 1 hr, or ideally overnight.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Toss the wings with the oil, then arrange in a single layer on a wire rack set over abaking tray. Bake for 25-30 mins until golden, then turn the wings over and bake for 25-30 mins more until crisp. Transfer to a platter with sauces for dipping (see tips below), or put a large bowl on the table next to each sauce and toss the wings in the sauces."]','2026-01-10 12:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5497,5497,'en','Smoky cod, broccoli & orzo bake','Enjoy this easy, speedy cod, broccoli and orzo traybake on busy weeknights. It’s healthy and low in fat, and since it’s a traybake, there’s minimal washing-up!','["½ tbsp olive oil, plus a drizzle","1 onion, chopped","1 tsp smoked paprika, plus a pinch","½-1 tbsp chipotle paste","200g long-stem broccoli","400ml hot vegetable stock","150g orzo","½ small bunch of dill, chopped","½ small bunch of parsley, chopped","50g frozen peas","2 sustainable skinless cod fillets","4 tbsp fat-free yogurt"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the oil in a deep ovenprooffrying pan, and fry the onion for 5 mins until tender. Add the paprika, chipotle paste, broccoli and stock. Stir in the orzo, and transfer to the oven for 10 mins.","Stir in half the herbs and the peas, and nestle the fish into the orzo. Sprinkle over a pinch of paprika and drizzle with oil, then season. Cook for 8-10 mins until the fish is cooked and the orzo is tender. Mix the remaining herbs with the yogurt. Loosen with a little water if needed, then serve with the orzo and fish."]','2026-01-10 12:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5499,5499,'en','Coconut cashew & butternut squash curry','Batch cook this vegan squash and cashew nut curry and freeze for busy days when you need something quick and nutritious. It’s perfect for a family meal','["1 tbsp oil","1 onion, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, finley chopped","1cm piece of ginger, peeled and grated","2 tbsp mild curry powder","400g can coconut milk","200g can chopped tomatoes","75g cashew nuts, blitzed to a fine powder","4 tbsp raisins","400g can chickpeas, drained","1 large butternut squash, peeled and cut into chunks (about 750g prepared weight)","rice, naan breads and pickles, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a largesaucepanover a medium heat. Tip in the onion and cook, stirring regularly, until softened, about 10 mins. Add the garlic, ginger and curry powder, and cook for about 20 seconds, continuing to stir.","Tip in the coconut milk, tomatoes, cashew nuts, raisins, chickpeas and squash. Pour in 200ml water, then bring to the boil and immediately reduce the heat to low. Simmer uncovered until the squash is tender, about 20 mins, stirring occasionally to prevent it from sticking. Season to taste.If freezing, leave to cool completely first. Can be frozen for up to one month. Reheat from frozen at 200C/180C fan/gas 6 for 10-15 mins.Serve with rice, naan and pickles, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5501,5501,'en','Cheesy hot dogs with pickle mustard sauce & crispy onions','Use bratwurst-style sausages to make hot dogs at a barbecue and spice them up with our pickle mustard sauce. Crispy onions add texture','["8 large bratwurst-style sausages","80g grated mozzarella","8 brioche hot dog buns","50g crispy onions","ketchup, to serve (optional)","50g mayonnaise","2 tbsp American-style yellow mustard","5 cornichons, finely chopped"]','["Make the pickle mustard sauce by combining the mayonnaise, mustard and cornichons in a bowl. Chill until needed.","Heat the barbecue and wait until the coals turn ashen. Alternatively, heat a griddle pan over a high heat. Cook the sausages for 7-8 mins, turning regularly until evenly browned and cooked through, then push the sausages together on the grill or in the pan and scatter with the grated mozzarella. Cook undisturbed for 2 mins more, or until the cheese has melted.","Split the hot dog buns open and stuff each one with a cheese-topped sausage. Drizzle over the pickle mustard sauce and top with crispy onions and ketchup, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5503,5503,'en','Spring chicken stew','Make this comforting chicken stew with seasonal vegetables to feed the whole family','["1 tbsp olive oil","8 skinless, boneless chicken thighs, halved","60g unsalted butter","1 onion, finely chopped","2 large carrots, chopped","60g plain flour","1.2 litres chicken stock","2 tbsp Dijon mustard","2 tbsp white wine vinegar","300g frozen peas","150ml double cream","200g self-raising flour","¼ tsp baking powder","100g suet or cold unsalted butter, grated","small bunch of chives, finely sliced (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large flameproof casserole over a high heat and fry the chicken for 5-7 mins until golden all over. Remove to a plate and set aside.","Melt the butter in the same pan, then reduce the heat to medium and fry the onion and carrots for 5 mins until just starting to soften. Sprinkle in the flour and cook for 2 mins more. Slowly add the stock, stirring as you go. Add the mustard and vinegar and cook over a low-medium heat for 30 mins, stirring regularly. Season to taste, then add the peas and cook for 5 mins more. Stir in the cream.","Make the dumplings by mixing the flour with the baking powder, suet or butter, chives (if using) and ½ tsp salt. Swiftly stir in 8-10 tbsp water using a cutlery knife, then bring the dough together using your hands – it should be firm and pliable. Divide into eight equal-sized pieces, weighing for accuracy if you like. Nestle the dumplings on top of the stew, then cover with the lid and cook for 15 mins over a gentle simmer. Remove the lid and slide the pan under a hot grill for 5-10 mins until the dumplings are puffed up and golden brown. Ladle into bowls to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5505,5505,'en','Fragrant pork & lemongrass noodles','In just 20 minutes you can be enjoying a stir-fry heady with lemongrass, ginger and lime. If you prefer thicker noodles, they’ll also work instead of vermicelli','["2 nests of vermicelli rice noodles","3 garlic cloves, crushed","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and grated","4 tsp lemongrass paste","1 lime zested and juiced, plus extra wedges to serve (optional)","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely sliced","2 tsp olive oil","2 medium carrots, coarsely grated","8 spring onions, finely sliced","500g pork mince","200g swiss chard, finely sliced","2 tsp fish sauce","½ small bunch of coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Prepare the vermicelli noodles following pack instructions, then set aside. Meanwhile, mix together the garlic, ginger, lemongrass, lime zest and chilli. Heat the olive oil in a largefrying panover a medium-high heat and fry the mixture for 2 mins until beginning to soften. Scatter in the carrots and spring onions and fry for 2 mins more, stirring frequently. Tip in the pork mince and cook for another 3 mins, then mix in the swiss chard and cook for 2 mins more until the pork is cooked through.","Drizzle in the fish sauce and lime juice, then scatter in the coriander. Cook everything for 1 min, stirring to combine. Tip in the noodles, toss well and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:15:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5507,5507,'en','Melting middle onions','Impress dinner guests with these veggie cheese-stuffed onions. Packed with mozzarella, pine nuts, breadcrumbs and herbs, they’re full of flavour','["8 large brown onions","40g butter","70g pine nuts","150g soft white breadcrumbs","1 garlic clove, finely grated","5 thyme sprigs, leaves picked","½ small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","1 medium egg, beaten","100g scarmoza (smoked mozzarella) or regular mozzarella"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.Cuta small disc off the root bottom of each onion so they stand upright. Cut 1cm slices off the tops (these will be used as lids), then put back on top of the onions. Wrap each onion in foil, transfer to abaking tray, and bake for 1 hr until tender.","Melt the butter in a pan. Tip into a bowl. Add the pine nuts to the pan and toast over a low heat for 2 mins until golden. Add to the butter with the breadcrumbs, garlic, thyme, parsley and egg. Stir, then season.","Cut the cheese into 8 chunky cubes. When the onions are cool enough to handle, scoop out the soft centres, leaving a few layers of onion at the edge. Finely chop the scooped-out centres from 2 onions, and add to the breadcrumb mix (reserve the rest to use in another recipe, such as ragu). Spoon the breadcrumb mixture into the hollowed-out onions so they’re halfway full, then push a piece of cheese into the middle of each and top up with more breadcrumb mixture. Top each onion with its ‘lid’, then roast for 35-40 mins more until tender and the cheese is melted."]','2026-01-10 12:15:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5509,5509,'en','Healthy tikka masala','Enjoy the spicy, rich flavours of tikka masala with this family-friendly lighter version that''s both healthy and gluten-free. It''s a guaranteed crowd-pleaser','["1 large onion, chopped","4 large garlic cloves","thumb-sized piece of ginger","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","4 small skinless chicken breasts, cut into chunks","2 tbsp tikka spice powder","1 tsp cayenne pepper","400g can chopped tomatoes","40g ground almonds","200g spinach","3 tbsp fat-free natural yogurt","½ small bunch of coriander, chopped","brown basmati rice, to serve"]','["Put the onion, garlic and ginger in a food processor and whizz to a smooth paste.","Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a flameproof casserole dish over a medium heat. Add the onion mixture and fry for 15 mins. Tip into a bowl and wipe out the pan.","Add the remaining oil and the chicken and fry for 5-7 mins, or until lightly brown. Stir in the tikka spice and cayenne and fry for a further minute. Tip the onion mixture back into the pan, along with the tomatoes and 1 can full of water. Bring to the boil, then reduce to a simmer and cook, uncovered, for 15 mins. Stir in the almonds and spinach and cook for a further 10 mins. Season, then stir though the yogurt and coriander. Serve with brown rice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5511,5511,'en','Lighter Cassoulet','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis traditionally rich, slow-cooked, French casserole is made healthier with lean gammon steak and pork shoulder for a hearty, warming meal','["500g dried haricot beans","7 garlic cloves","5 thyme sprigs","3 rosemary sprigs","200g smoked gammon steak, rind and fat removed","1 bay leaf","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 medium onion, chopped","1 large carrot (200g total weight), chopped into 1cm pieces","2 tsp butter","500g pork shoulder, diced into 4-5cm pieces, any excess fat trimmed","125ml white wine","230g can plum tomatoes","3 Toulouse sausages","25g panko or coarse dried breadcrumbs","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 tsp finely grated lemon zest","2 tsp rapeseed oil"]','["Put the beans in a very large bowl. Pour over 3 times their volume of water so they are well covered, as they will soak up a lot. Cover with cling film and leave to soak overnight.","Tip the beans into a large colander to drain, discarding the water. Put them in a large, deep saucepan and cover with fresh cold water (about 2 litres), so it is about 3cm above the beans. Add 3 of the garlic cloves, 2 thyme sprigs and 1 rosemary sprig. Bring to the boil, half cover the pan with its lid and keep on a very gentle simmer for 1 ½ hrs, checking the water level occasionally. Cut the gammon into lardon-sized pieces. Put the lardons in with the beans, checking there is still enough water to cover everything. Simmer for a further 30 mins.","Wrap the remaining thyme and rosemary sprigs in the bay leaf and tie with string to make a bouquet garni. Heat the oil in a large, deep ovenproof sauté pan or flameproof casserole dish. Put the onion and carrot in the pan and fry gently on a medium heat for 5 mins, stirring occasionally. Finely chop the remaining 4 garlic cloves. Melt the butter in the pan, add the garlic and fry for 2 mins. Increase the heat, add the pork shoulder and fry for 2-3 mins until it is no longer pink. Pour in the wine and let it bubble for 1 min until slightly reduced. Stir in the tomatoes, tuck in the bouquet garni and simmer for 3 mins until saucy. Season well with pepper and 2 pinches of salt. Remove and set aside.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Drain the beans in a large colander set over a large bowl so you can reserve the cooking liquid (you should have about 850ml). Remove and discard the herb stems. Squash the softened garlic cloves with a spoon, then stir through the beans and lardons. Tip this mixture into the pan with the pork shoulder, then pour in 600ml of the reserved cooking liquid. Simmer gently, uncovered, for 30 mins until you have a moist, soupy consistency.","Meanwhile, lay the sausages on a small non-stick baking tray and roast for 20 mins, turning halfway through, until brown. Remove, cut into 1cm-thick diagonal slices and lower the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.","Tuck the sausage slices into the beans, transfer the cassoulet to the oven and bake for 11/2 hrs, uncovered. Meanwhile, mix together the panko crumbs, garlic, lemon zest, oil and some pepper. By now the meat should be almost tender and the cassoulet moist and juicy, not dry. (If necessary, pour in some of the reserved cooking liquid.) Scatter the crumb mix over and return to the oven for 20-25 mins until the topping is golden."]','2026-01-10 12:15:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5513,5514,'en','Lighter Sweet & sour pork','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis Chinese takeaway family favourite can be made much healthier – lower the sugar, fat and salt levels with this easy recipe','["225g pork tenderloin","1 carrot (140g), cut in approx 5cm long strips","1 tbsp rapeseed oil, plus 2 tsp","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tsp finely chopped ginger","3 spring onions, ends trimmed, cut into long diagonal slices","½  red pepper, deseeded, cut into long thin strips","200g long-grain rice, cooked","1 egg white","¼ tsp Chinese five-spice powder","1 tbsp cornflour","1½  tsp self-raising flour","1 tsp dark soy sauce","½  tsp sesame oil","1 tbsp Chinese white rice vinegar or cider vinegar","2 tsp golden caster sugar","1 tsp tomato purée","1 tsp cornflour, blended with 1 tsp water","175ml vegetable bouillon, made with 1?2 tsp powder (we used Marigold Swiss Vegetable Bouillon)"]','["Cut the pork into 2-3cm cubes. In a medium bowl, make the batter. Beat the egg white lightly with a fork until slightly frothy, then beat in the five-spice powder, cornflour, flour and a good grinding of pepper until thick and smooth. Stir in the pork so that each piece is evenly coated, then set aside.","Now make the sauce. In a small bowl, mix together the soy sauce, sesame oil, vinegar, sugar, tomato purée, cornflour blended with water, and the stock. Season with pepper and set aside. Blanch the carrot in a little boiling water for about 2 mins until tender but still crisp. Drain, then put under cold running water to stop the cooking. Drain again and set aside.","Pour the 1 tbsp rapeseed oil into a non-stick wok or large frying pan. When it’s very hot (test by dropping a piece of meat in – it should immediately sizzle), add the pork. Stir to separate all the pieces, then stir-fry for about 5 mins over a medium-high heat until the meat is no longer pink inside when cut, and the outside is golden and crispy. Remove with a slotted spoon and set aside.","Pour the remaining 2 tsp rapeseed oil into the wok and add the garlic, ginger, spring onions and pepper. Stir-fry for about 2 mins until starting to brown (still on quite a high heat). Pour in the sauce – it should immediately start to bubble rapidly – and stir in the carrot. As soon as the sauce has thickened slightly, about 30 secs-1 min, stir in the meat to quickly coat and heat through. Remove the pan from the heat, season with a pinch of salt and serve immediately, with the rice."]','2026-01-10 12:15:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5515,5515,'en','Herb roast pork with vegetable roasties & apple gravy','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis lean roast dinner uses pork leg topped with prosciutto. Serve with roast potatoes, carrots and celeriac, plus lots of herbs and an apple gravy','["1¼kg boneless pork leg roasting joint","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard","2 tbsp chopped parsley","2 tbsp chopped thyme, plus a few extra sprigs","1 tsp chopped sage","80g pack prosciutto","4 good sprays of oil","3 carrot, halved lengthways, then cut across","6 small potato (500g), halved","2 red onion, cut into wedges","12 garlic clove","1 small celeriac (650g), peeled and cut into 12 wedges","2 tbsp cornflour","600ml reduced-salt chicken stock","1 small Bramley apple, diced","Savoy cabbage and peas, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cut all the rind and fat off the pork and discard so that you are left with a lean chunk of meat. Spread with the mustard, scatter with the chopped herbs and season with black pepper. Place the prosciutto slices on top of the pork to protect the meat where the fat has been removed.","Spray a large roasting tin with oil and put the pork in the centre. Surround with all the vegetables, scatter with the thyme sprigs, then spray again and cover with foil. Roast for 1 hr, then turn the heat up to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Uncover, spray again and roast for 20 mins more.","Meanwhile, make the gravy. Mix the cornflour with a little water to make a wet paste, heat the stock in a pan, stir in the cornflour mixture and cook, stirring, until thickened. Add the apple and cook for 5 mins until it’s softened but still holds its shape.","Remove the meat from the tin and pour any juices from the tin into the gravy. Spray the veg with oil and roast for 20 mins more (while the meat rests) to brown them. Serve the pork with the roasted and fresh vegetables, and the apple gravy."]','2026-01-10 12:15:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5517,5517,'en','Lighter South Indian fish curry','Use reduced-fat coconut milk and white fish fillets to make a low-fat, low-calorie curry that''s still luxuriously creamy','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","½  tsp cumin seeds","1 medium onion, halved lengthways and thinly sliced into wedges","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tbsp finely chopped ginger (about a 2½ cm/1in piece)","12 dried curry leaves","1 tsp black mustard seeds","2 small green chillies, halved lengthways, deseeded (or leave a few seeds in if you want a bit of heat)","1 tsp ground coriander","½  tsp garam masala","¼ tsp turmeric","400g can reduced-fat coconut milk","¼ tsp ground black pepper","500g skinned, firm white fish fillets, such as cod or haddock","100g fine green beans, trimmed and halved lengthways","1 ripe mango","generous handful roughly chopped coriander, leaves only","200g basmati rice, cooked, to serve","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying or sauté pan. Add the cumin seeds and fry for 1 min, then tip in the onion, garlic and ginger, and fry for 1 min more. Stir in the curry leaves and mustard seeds, and fry about\r\n3-4 mins on a medium heat, stirring occasionally, until the onions are turning brown. Stir in the chillies, coriander, garam masala and turmeric, and fry for 30 secs.","Stir the coconut milk in the can, then pour half into the pan. It should start to bubble and thicken, so let it simmer until quite thick, about 3 mins, stirring occasionally. Pour in the rest of the coconut milk, add the pepper and a pinch of salt, and lower the heat.","Sit the fish in the coconut milk and press it down to half submerge it. Cover the pan and simmer gently for 4-5 mins (depending on the thickness of your fillets) until the fish is almost cooked. Do not stir or the fish will break up – just spoon some of the sauce over the top of the fish halfway through, then remove the pan from the heat and let the fish sit for another 3-4 mins to finish cooking slowly. When done, it should feel firm and no longer be opaque. If you want a thinner sauce, pour in a spoonful or two of water.","Meanwhile, steam the green beans for about 4 mins until just tender. De-stone the mango and slice the flesh into thin wedges (see tip below left), then scatter over the fish to warm through.","To serve, break the fish into big chunks by removing it to serving bowls with a slotted spoon, then pour the sauce over and around it. Serve with the beans, a scattering of coriander and the rice, with lime wedges on the side to squeeze over."]','2026-01-10 12:15:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5519,5519,'en','Wild garlic & nettle soup','Forage for some fresh spring greens and simmer with finely diced vegetables to make this vibrant, healthy, low-fat green soup','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil, plus extra for drizzling","25g butter","1 onion, finely diced","1 leek, finely diced","2 celery sticks, thinly sliced","1 carrot, finely diced","1 small potato, peeled and diced","1.2l good-quality vegetable stock","300g young nettle leaves","200g wild garlic leaves (keep any flowers if you have them)","3 tbsp milk"]','["Heat the oil and butter in a large saucepan. Add the onion, leek, celery, carrot, potato and a good pinch of salt, and stir until everything is well coated. Cover and sweat gently for 15-20 mins, stirring every so often to make sure that the vegetables don’t catch on the bottom of the pan.","Pour in the stock and simmer for 10 mins. Add the nettles in several batches, stirring, then add the wild garlic leaves and simmer for 2 mins.","Remove from the heat and blend using a stick blender or tip into a blender. Return to the heat and stir through the milk, then taste for seasoning. Ladle into bowls and drizzle over a little extra oil, then top with a few wild garlic flowers, if you have them."]','2026-01-10 12:15:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5521,5521,'en','Radish, lentil & mint salad','A combination of sweet, sour and nutty ingredients enhance the different varieties of beautiful radish in this recipe','["50g walnut pieces","3 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, sliced","1 tsp black treacle","2 tbsp sherry vinegar","small pack mint, leaves picked and half chopped","400g can green lentils, drained and rinsed","½  cucumber, chopped","300g radishes, some left whole, others sliced and chopped (try to use a mixture of varieties, such as mooli and red meat radishes – see tip)"]','["Toast the walnut pieces in a large frying pan over a medium heat until fragrant and just starting to char at the edges. Tip into a bowl and set aside.","In the same pan, turn the heat down to low and add 1 tbsp olive oil. Add the onion, fry gently for around 10 mins until soft, then take the pan off the heat. Add the black treacle, Sherry vinegar and the rest of the olive oil, then mix and leave to cool. Add the chopped mint to the pan, and season well.","In a large bowl, mix together the lentils, cucumber and half the radishes, then pour over the cooled onion and mint dressing. Toss everything together and pile onto a serving dish. Scatter over the walnut pieces and the rest of the mint and radishes, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:15:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5523,5523,'en','Thai red duck with sticky pineapple rice','Marinate duck breasts with red curry paste and lime, then serve with coconut rice, peas and beansprouts for a healthy weeknight dinner','["2 duck breasts, skin removed and discarded","1 tbsp Thai red curry paste","zest and juice 1 lime, plus extra wedges to serve","140g jasmine rice","125ml light coconut milk, from a can","140g frozen peas","50g beansprouts","½  red onion, diced","100g fresh pineapples, cubed","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","¼ small pack coriander, stalks finely chopped, leaves roughly chopped"]','["Sit a duck breast between 2 sheets of cling film on a chopping board. Use a rolling pin to bash the duck until it is 0.5cm thick. Repeat with the other breast, then put them both in a dish. Mix the curry paste with the lime zest and juice, and rub all over the duck. Leave to marinate at room temperature for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, tip the rice into a small saucepan with some salt. Pour over the coconut milk with 150ml water. Bring to a simmer, then cover the pan, turn the heat down low and cook for 5 more mins. Stir in the peas, then cover, turn the heat off and leave for another 10 mins. Check the rice - all the liquid should be absorbed and the rice cooked through. Boil the kettle, put the beansprouts and red onion in a colander and pour over a kettleful of boiling water. Stir the beansprouts and onion into the rice with the pineapple, chilli and coriander stalks, and some more salt if it needs it, and put the lid back on to keep warm.","Heat a griddle pan and cook the duck for 1-2 mins each side or until cooked to your liking. Slice the duck, stir most of the coriander leaves through the rice with a fork to fluff up, and serve alongside the duck, scattered with the remaining coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:15:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5525,5525,'en','Mediterranean fish gratins','These individual portions of fish in tomato sauce, topped with herby breadcrumbs, freeze beautifully – perfect for no-fuss entertaining','["3 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, thinly sliced","1 fennel bulb (about 250g/9oz), trimmed and thinly sliced","3 large garlic cloves, finely sliced","1 heaped tsp coriander seeds, lightly crushed","150ml white wine","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes with herbs","2 tbsp tomato purée","good pinch of saffron","1 bay leaf","1 tbsp fresh lemon juice","1 small bunch flat-leaf parsley, leaves roughly chopped","900g mixed skinless fish fillets, (anything you like) cut into chunks","350g raw peeled king prawns","75g finely grated Parmesan","50g panko or coarse dried breadcrumbs","green salad, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large, wide non-stick saucepan or sauté pan and gently fry the onion, fennel, garlic and coriander seeds for 15 mins, stirring regularly until the vegetables are softened and lightly coloured. Pour the wine into the pan and add the tomatoes, tomato purée, saffron and bay leaf. Season and bring to a gentle simmer. Cook for about 15 mins, stirring occasionally, until thick.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Stir the lemon juice and most of the parsley into the tomato mixture, pop the raw fish pieces and prawns on top and stir well. Cover tightly with a lid and simmer gently over a medium heat for 4-5 mins or until the fish is almost cooked. Stir a couple of times as the fish cooks, taking care not to let it break up.","Ladle the hot tomato and fish mixture into 6 individual pie dishes – they will each need to hold around 350ml. Mix the cheese, breadcrumbs, remaining parsley and a little ground black pepper together and sprinkle over the top. Bake on a baking tray for 20 mins or until the pies are golden brown and bubbling. Serve with green salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5527,5527,'en','Fish stew with roast garlic & saffron','Try this simpler, lighter version of bouillabaisse, a classic fish soup – serve with toasted slices of baguette to mop up the tomato based sauce','["3 whole heads garlic","150ml good olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","few good pinches of flaky sea salt","50ml Pernod","good pinch of saffron strands","1 fennel bulb","4 celery sticks","1 onion","1 red chilli, seeds left in","2 tbsp olive oil","4 garlic cloves","2 tbsp fennel seeds","pinch of saffron","2 bay leaves","50ml Pernod","200ml white wine","750ml passata","3 grey mullet fillets (about 500g in total), skin on, cut into large chunks","300g gurnard fillets, skin on, cut into large chunks","200g prepared squid and tentacles, cleaned and cut into rings","juice 1 lemon","4 tbsp chopped flat leaf parsley, plus extra to serve","toasted slices of baguette, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. To make the saffron and garlic paste, cut the whole heads of garlic in half horizontally. Place the garlic heads, cut-side up, on a small baking tray. Drizzle over a little olive oil and season with salt. Cover with foil and bake for 40-50 mins until softened. Remove the foil and return to the oven for a further 15-20 mins until the garlic has turned golden brown.","Meanwhile, make the soup base. Chop the fennel, celery and onion into small dice and thinly slice the red chilli. Heat the oil in a large saucepan and add the chopped vegetables. Grate the garlic into the pan and add the fennel seeds. Stir well, then cover and sweat for 10 mins. Add the saffron and bay leaves, and cook for a further 10 mins until the vegetables start to soften. Pour in the Pernod and wine, bring to the boil, then add the passata and 400ml water. Bring to the boil, then turn the heat down to a simmer. Cover and cook for 45 mins until all of the flavours have started to work together, then remove the pan from the heat and leave to cool a little.","Transfer the soup to a jug blender and blend until smooth, then pass through a fine sieve into a clean saucepan – you may need to do this in batches. If the soup needs thickening, reduce over a medium heat. When it is the consistency of pouring cream, remove from the heat and set aside, or leave to cool and chill in the fridge until needed. The base of the soup can be made 3 days ahead.","Meanwhile, for the paste, pour the Pernod into a small saucepan and add the saffron. Bring to the boil, add the olive oil and warm gently. Take off the heat and leave to cool.","When the garlic is golden brown, remove the tray from the oven and squeeze the cloves out into the bowl of a pestle and mortar. Add a large pinch of flaky sea salt and pound to a paste. Slowly add the saffron-infused olive oil, stirring constantly. Transfer to a clean container and chill until needed.","Bring the soup base to the boil in a large pan, then turn down to a light simmer and taste for seasoning. Add the chunks of prepared fish and squid, and gently poach the fish in the soup for 10 mins, or until it is just cooked. Remove from the heat and stir in the lemon juice and parsley. Ladle the soup into bowls, piling up the fish in the centre. Spoon on the saffron and garlic paste and sprinkle over some more parsley. Serve with toasted slices of baguette and the extra saffron and garlic paste on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:15:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5529,5529,'en','Prawn jalfrezi','Satisfy a curry craving the healthy way with this Indian prawn dish – blitz the onions and spices into an authentic, thick, yet low-fat sauce','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","2 medium onions, chopped","thumb-sized piece ginger, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","1 tsp ground coriander","½  tsp ground turmeric","½  tsp ground cumin","¼ tsp chilli flakes (or less if you don''t like it too spicy)","400g can chopped tomatoes","squeeze of clear honey","1 large green pepper, halved, deseeded and chopped","small bunch coriander, stalks and leaves separated, chopped","140g large cooked peeled tiger prawns","250g pouch cooked brown rice","minty yogurt or chutney, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick pan and fry the onions, ginger and garlic for 8-10 mins, stirring frequently, until softened and starting to colour. Add the spices and chilli flakes, stir briefly, then pour in the tomatoes with half a can of water and the honey. Blitz everything in the pan with a hand blender until almost smooth (or use a food processor). Stir in the pepper and coriander stalks, cover the pan and leave to simmer for 10 mins. (The mixture will be very thick and splutter a little, so stir frequently.)","Stir in the prawns and scatter over the coriander leaves. Heat the rice following pack instructions. Serve both with a minty yogurt or chutney, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:15:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5531,5531,'en','Whole stuffed roast fish with fennel','This roast fish dish was inspired by Sicily, where the aromatic spices and dried fruit of Arabian cuisine meet with the fresh fish and veg of the Med','["2 fennel bulbs, halved and finely sliced","1 large onion, halved and finely sliced","3 tbsp extra virgin olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","2 lemons, 1 zested then juiced, 1 cut into wedges","200g couscous","pinch of saffron threads","250ml chicken or vegetable stock","2 larger or 4 smaller whole fish, cleaned and scaled (we used Anglesey sea bass)","small pack dill, finely chopped","2 tbsp toasted pine nuts","250g baby plum tomatoes, halved","1 tbsp currants"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the fennel and onion in a large roasting tin and toss with 2 tbsp oil, 1 tbsp lemon juice and plenty of seasoning. Roast for 20 mins until almost tender and starting to caramelise. Meanwhile, put the couscous in a medium bowl. Mix the saffron and hot stock, pour over the couscous and cover with cling film.","Rinse the fish with cold water inside and out, then pat dry. Slash deeply on both sides and season with salt, pepper and a pinch of the lemon zest. After 10 mins soaking, fluff up the couscous with a fork and add 2 tbsp lemon juice, the remaining zest, the dill, 1 tbsp pine nuts and seasoning to taste. Stuff the couscous into the cavity of each fish, reserving any leftover couscous for later.","Stir the tomatoes and currants into the tin. Sit the fish on top and roast for about 30 mins, depending on its size. Look for juices running from the slashes in the flesh. Tug gently on the back fin – if it comes away easily, the fish is cooked.","4 Scatter with the rest of the pine nuts, then serve from the tin, with lemon wedges for squeezing over. Serve one stuffed fish per person, or if you have cooked large fish, gently lift the fillets from the top of the fish first, then turn over and repeat. Share out the couscous stuffing and leftover couscous."]','2026-01-10 12:15:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5533,5533,'en','Avocado panzanella','With just 20 minutes preparation and no cooking time you''ll be able to whip up this colourful avocado and bread salad in no time','["1 garlic clove, crushed","1½ tbsp capers, drained and rinsed","1 ripe avocado, stoned, peeled and chopped","1 small red onion, very thinly sliced","175g ciabatta or crusty loaf","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","small handful basil leaves"]','["Halve or roughly chop the tomatoes (depending on size) and put them in a bowl. Season well and add the garlic, capers, avocado and onion, and mix well. Set aside for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, tear or slice the ciabatta into 3cm chunks and place in a large serving bowl or on a platter. Drizzle with half the olive oil, half the vinegar and add some seasoning. When ready to serve, pour over the tomatoes and any juices. Scatter with the basil leaves and drizzle over the remaining oil and vinegar. Give it a final stir and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:16:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5535,5535,'en','Sea bass en papillote with Thai flavours','Make a parcel from baking parchment and let your fish steam to perfection while infusing with garlic, ginger, chilli and lime','["2 small seabass, scaled and gutted","12 new potatoes, cleaned","small knob salted butter","coriander leaves, to serve","2 lemongrass stalks","100g chunk fresh ginger","3 garlic cloves","3 small red chillies, finely chopped","zest and juice 1 lime, plus extra wedges to serve, if you like"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160 fan/gas 4. To\r\nprepare the stuffing mixture, bash the\r\nlemongrass with the blunt side of your\r\nknife to bruise it, then slice it into thin\r\nrings. Finely slice the ginger (across the\r\ngrain) – you can leave the peel on.\r\nSquash the unpeeled garlic cloves to\r\nrelease their aroma. Put all the stuffing\r\ningredients into a bowl and mix together.","Take a piece of baking parchment about\r\n50cm in length and place the 2 sea bass\r\nacross its width. Fill the stomach cavities\r\nwith ¾ of the stuffing mixture, scattering\r\nthe rest over the fish, then season. Fold\r\nthe sides of the parchment over the\r\nheads and tails of the fish, then roll it into\r\na parcel. This can now be stored in the\r\nfridge for a few hrs, if you like. When\r\nready to cook, place on a tray in the oven\r\nand bake for 20-25 mins, until the flesh\r\nflakes off the bone.","While the fish bakes, put the new\r\npotatoes in cold water and bring to the\r\nboil. Once cooked, drain well, slice in half\r\nand return to the pan with a knob of butter.","Arrange the new potatoes and sea bass\r\non the plate, still in the parcel, if you like,\r\nand sprinkled with the coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:16:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5537,5537,'en','Teriyaki steak with fennel slaw','This flavoursome Asian-style dish is low in fat and easy to make','["2 tbsp reduced-salt soy sauce","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 tsp clear honey","4 sirloin or rump steaks, trimmed of all visible fat, each about 125g","1 large carrot, coarsely grated","1 fennel bulb, halved and thinly sliced","1 red onion, halved and thinly sliced","handful coriander leaves","juice 1 lime"]','["Mix the soy, vinegar and honey, add\r\nthe steaks, then marinate for 10-15 mins.","Toss together the carrot, fennel, onion\r\nand coriander, then chill until ready to serve.","Cook the steaks in a griddle pan for a\r\nfew mins on each side, depending on the\r\nthickness and how well done you like\r\nthem. Set the meat aside to rest on a\r\nplate, then add the remaining marinade\r\nto the pan. Bubble the marinade until it\r\nreduces a little to make a sticky sauce.","Dress the salad with the lime juice,\r\nthen pile onto plates and serve with the\r\nsteaks. Spoon the sauce over the meat."]','2026-01-10 12:16:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5539,5539,'en','Apricot & raspberry tart','Delicious served hot or cold, this tart uses filo pastry to keep the calories down','["3 large sheets filo pastry (or 6 small)","2 tbsp butter, melted","3 tbsp apricot conserve","6 ripe apricots, stoned and roughly sliced","85g raspberries","2 tsp caster sugar"]','["Let the filo come to room temperature\r\nfor about 10 mins before use. Put a\r\nbaking tray into the oven and heat oven\r\nto 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Brush each large sheet of filo with\r\nmelted butter, layer on top of each other,\r\nthen fold in half so you have a smaller\r\nrectangle 6 layers thick. If using small\r\nsheets just stack on top of each other.\r\nFold in the edges of the pastry base to\r\nmake a 2cm border, then spread the\r\napricot conserve inside the border.\r\nCarefully slide the pastry base on to\r\nthe hot baking tray and bake for 5 mins.","Remove from oven, arrange apricots\r\nover the tart and brush with any leftover\r\nmelted butter. Bake for another 10 mins,\r\nthen scatter on raspberries and sprinkle\r\nwith sugar. Bake for a final 10 mins until\r\nthe pastry is golden brown and crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:16:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5541,5541,'en','Chocolate & berry mousse pots','Dessert doesn''t have to be devilish as this good-for-you pud proves','["75g dark chocolate 70% grated","4 tbsp low-fat yogurt","2 large egg whites","2 tsp caster sugar","350g berries (try blueberries, raspberries, cherries or a mix)"]','["Melt the chocolate in a heatproof\r\nbowl over a pan of simmering\r\nwater, making sure the bowl\r\ndoesn’t directly touch the water.\r\nOnce melted, allow it to cool for\r\n5-10 mins, then stir in the yogurt.","Whisk the egg whites until stiff,\r\nthen whisk in the sugar and beat\r\nuntil stiff again. Fold the whites into\r\nthe chocolate mix – loosen the\r\nmixture first with a spoonful of egg\r\nwhite, then carefully fold in the rest,\r\nkeeping as much air as possible.","Put berries into small glasses\r\nor ramekins, then divide mousse\r\non top. Chill in the fridge until set."]','2026-01-10 12:16:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5543,5543,'en','Fish pie with swede & potato topping','Making fish pie can be a palaver – not this one! Reassuringly simple, and ready in just over an hour','["500g floury potatoes, cut into chunks","1 medium swede (weighing about 600g/1lb 5oz), cut into chunks","200g tub low-fat soft cheese with garlic and herbs","150ml vegetable stock","4 tsp cornflour, blended with 2 tbsp cold water","650g skinless, boneless cod, cut into large chunks","100g cooked peeled prawns","1 tsp chopped fresh parsley"]','["Cook the potatoes and swede in boiling water until tender (about 20 minutes).","Preheat the oven to 190C/gas 5/fan 170C.While the potatoes and swede cook, put the soft cheese and stock into a large saucepan and heat gently, stirring with a wooden spoon, until blended and smooth. Now add the blended cornflour and cook until thick.","Stir the fish into the sauce with the prawns and parsley. Season with some pepper.","Tip the mixture into a 1.5 litre/2¾ pint baking dish. Drain the potatoes and swede, mash them well and season with black pepper. Spoon the mash over the fish to cover it completely. Bake for 25-30 minutes until piping hot, then transfer to a hot grill for a few minutes to brown the top. Serve with frozen peas or sweetcorn."]','2026-01-10 12:16:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5545,5545,'en','Minted green bean salad','Just 5 ingredients in this summery vegan salad – you can make it a day in advance too','["600g green beans, trimmed","3 tbsp olive oil","2 fat garlic cloves, thinly sliced","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","3 tbsp chopped fresh mint"]','["Cook the beans in boiling salted water for 5-6 minutes, until just tender, then drain and refresh under cold running water. Shake well to remove excess water, then pat dry with kitchen paper. You can do this the day before and keep the cooked beans in the fridge, in a bowl covered with cling film.","Heat 1 tablespoon of the oil in a small pan, add the garlic and fry quickly until crisp and lightly golden. Tip into a bowl with the oil from the pan and leave to cool. This can be done the day before and covered with cling film and chilled.","On the day, whisk together the remaining oil, vinegar, mint, salt and pepper. Pour over the beans and mix well. Tip into a serving bowl and scatter over the garlic in its oil."]','2026-01-10 12:16:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5547,5547,'en','Frozen strawberry yogurt','Sarah Cook''s gorgeous frozen yogurt is intensely fruity and really creamy… but totally fat-free!','["140g strawberries","½ x 405g can light condensed milk","500g tub 0%-fat Greek yogurt"]','["Roughly chop half the strawberries and whizz the rest in a food processor or with a stick blender to a purée.","In a big bowl, stir the condensed milk into the puréed strawberries then gently stir in the yogurt until well mixed. Fold through the chopped strawberries.","Scrape the mixture into a loaf tin or container, pop on the lid or wrap well in cling film and freeze overnight, until solid. Remove from the freezer about 10-15 mins before you want to serve the frozen yogurt. Can be frozen for up to 1 month."]','2026-01-10 12:16:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5549,5549,'en','The ultimate makeover: Potato Dauphinoise','Crème fraîche, stock and semi-skimmed milk replace traditional ingredients to make this the healthiest Dauphinoise yet','["1 tsp olive oil","150ml semi-skimmed milk","1 plump garlic clove, peeled and halved","4 thyme sprigs, plus extra for sprinkling","1 bay leaf","1 shallot, roughly chopped","good pinch freshly grated nutmeg","1kg waxy potatoes (try Desirée)","140g full-fat crème fraîche","75ml vegetable stock (Marigold bouillon)","1 tsp thyme leaves","25g Gruyère or vegetarian alternative, grated"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nBrush the oil over the bottom and sides\r\nof a 25 x 19 x 5cm ovenproof dish. Put\r\nthe milk, garlic, 4 thyme sprigs, bay\r\nleaf and shallot into a saucepan. Bring\r\njust to the boil, then remove from the\r\nheat and add the nutmeg and a little\r\npepper. Set aside to infuse.","Peel then slice the potatoes very thinly.\r\nPat them dry. Layer half the slices in the\r\ndish, overlapping slightly, then season.","Strain the infused milk into a jug. Put\r\nthe crème fraîche into a bowl, then\r\ngradually pour in the milk, whisking until\r\nsmooth. Add the stock and thyme leaves.\r\nReturn this liquid to the jug, then pour\r\nhalf of it over the potatoes in the dish.\r\nLayer up the rest of the potatoes, then\r\nadd remaining liquid, the cheese and a\r\ngrind of pepper. Sit the dish on a baking\r\nsheet and bake for 1¼-1½ hrs until golden\r\nand tender – test by inserting a sharp\r\nknife through the potatoes. Stand for 5 mins\r\nbefore serving, sprinkled with thyme sprigs."]','2026-01-10 12:16:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5551,5551,'en','Pea & mint soup','A superhealthy starter or snack that''s great hot or cold','["1 bunch spring onions, trimmed and roughly chopped","1 medium potato, peeled and diced","1 garlic clove, crushed","850ml vegetable or chicken stock","900g young peas in the pod (to give about 250g/9oz shelled peas)","4 tbsp chopped fresh mint","large pinch caster sugar","1 tbsp fresh lemon or lime juice","150ml buttermilk or soured cream"]','["Put the spring onions into a large pan with the potato, garlic and stock. Bring to the boil, turn down the heat and simmer for 15 minutes or until the potato is very soft. For the garnish, blanch 3 tbsp of\r\nthe shelled peas in boiling water for\r\n2-3 minutes, drain, put in a bowl of cold water and set aside. Add the remaining peas to the soup base and simmer for\r\n5 minutes – no longer, or you will lose the lovely fresh flavour of the peas.","Stir in the mint, sugar and lemon or lime juice, cool slightly then pour into a food processor or liquidiser and whizz until as smooth as you like. Stir in half the buttermilk or soured cream, taste and season with salt and pepper.","To serve the soup cold, cool quickly, then chill – you may need to add more stock to the soup before serving as it will thicken as it cools. To serve hot, return the soup to the rinsed-out pan and reheat without boiling (to prevent the buttermilk or soured cream from curdling).","Serve the soup in bowls, garnished with the remaining buttermilk and the drained peas."]','2026-01-10 12:16:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5553,5553,'en','Healthy tuna pasta','Try our quick and easy healthy tuna pasta. It’s comforting, but also packed with three of your five-a-day and can be doubled to feed a family','["150g wholemeal penne","1 large leek (200g), halved, and thinly sliced","1 tsp olive oil","160g cherry tomatoes, preferably on the vine","198g can sweetcorn, drained","75g ricotta","160g can tuna in spring water, drained","handful of basil, chopped, plus a few whole leaves to serve"]','["Boil the penne with the leek in a large pan of salted water following pack instructions, until al dente.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large pan over a medium-high heat and fry the tomatoes for a few minutes, until they start to burst and soften. Add the sweetcorn and cook for 2-3 mins to heat through. Drain the pasta and leeks, reserving a little of the pasta water. Tip the drained pasta and leeks into the pan with the tomatoes, then toss through the ricotta and tuna.","Season with plenty of black pepper. If you want to loosen the consistency, stir in some of the reserved pasta water along with the chopped basil. Serve scattered with the whole basil leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:16:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5555,5555,'en','Fish finger hot dogs','A twist on a classic fish finger sandwich the whole family will love. Try Paul AInsworth’s trick of lightly salting the cod to firm it up before cooking – it’s a game-changer','["300-400g skinless and boneless pollock or cod, cut into 4 chunky fish fingers","25g plain flour","1 egg, beaten","100g panko breadcrumbs","sunflower oil, for frying","1 gherkin, finely chopped","4 tbsp mayonnaise","1 tbsp lemon juice and lemon wedges, to serve","4 brioche hot dog buns","½ iceberg lettuce, shredded"]','["If you have time, lightly season the fish with sea salt flakes up to an hour before coating them, then cover and chill to firm it up. Put the flour mixed with some salt and pepper in a shallow bowl, then the beaten egg and breadcrumbs in another two bowls. Working in batches, coat the fish in the seasoned flour first, then shake off any excess and dip in the egg, followed by the breadcrumbs, then put the coated fish fingers on a plate.Can be done a day ahead and kept chilled overnight.","Pour enough oil into a large frying pan so that it covers the base. Heat the oil over a medium-high heat, then frythe fish fingers in batches until golden on each side and cooked through (approx 3-4 mins each side). Drain on kitchen paper, season with sea salt, then transfer to a low oven to keep warm while you make the sauce.","Put the gherkins in a bowl and mix with the mayonnaise and lemon juice. Split the hot dog buns, toast the cut-side under the grill, then spread each roll with 1 tbsp of the mayonnaise mixture, add a handful of lettuce, then a hot fish finger on top. Serve with the lemon wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:16:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5556,5556,'en','Mexican lime chicken','A recipe full of zingy flavours','["2 chicken breasts","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp crushed coriander seeds","1 tsp grated lime zest","½  tsp paprika","½  tsp muscovado sugar","1 lime","6 unpeeled garlic cloves","2 fresh red chillies"]','["Mix 2 tbsp olive oil with 1 tsp each crushed coriander seeds and grated lime zest and 1?2 tsp each paprika and light muscovado sugar.","Put 2 chicken breasts in a baking dish, spoon the marinade over, then squeeze over a little lime juice. Cover and marinate for 30 minutes.","Slip 1-2 lime slices under the skin of each breast and season. Tuck 6 unpeeled garlic cloves and 2 fresh red chillies around the chicken.","Roast the chicken breasts in a baking dish, uncovered, for 30-35 minutes in a preheated oven (190C/gas 5/fan oven 170C).  To check if they are done, prod the chicken with your finger - if it''s still a bit soft, give it a bit longer.","Serve with salad and salsa."]','2026-01-10 12:16:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5557,5557,'en','Seared tuna & asparagus niçoise','Source tuna from a good-quality fishmonger to make this stunning seared tuna & asparagus niçoise salad. It should be sashimi-grade so can be safely eaten raw','["300g small new potatoes, halved","250g asparagus","3 eggs","1 tbsp olive oil","200g thick-cut sashimi-grade tuna loin, or 2 tuna steaks","3 large tomatoes, quartered","50g pitted Kalamata olives, halved","10 caper berries","5 anchovy fillets","½ small garlic clove, crushed","70ml extra virgin olive oil","½ lemon, juiced"]','["Cook the potatoes in a pan of boiling salted water for 12 mins, or until a cutlery knife can be easily inserted. Transfer to a bowl using a slotted spoon and leave to steam-dry. Add the asparagus to the pan and boil for 2 mins, then put in a bowl of ice-cold water and set aside.","Bring another pan of water to the boil over a medium-high heat and cook the eggs for 7½ mins. Drain, then add the eggs to the bowl of water with the asparagus.","For the dressing, bash the anchovies and garlic together using apestle and mortaruntil you have a very smooth paste. Tip this into a bowl, then whisk in the extra virgin olive oil and lemon juice. Season.","To sear the tuna, heat the olive oil in a large,non-stick frying panover a medium-high heat and cook for 1-2 mins on each side, just until it has a slightly golden colour. Slice into thick pieces (it should still be pink in the middle), then peel and halve the eggs.","Toss the potatoes, asparagus, tomatoes, olives, caper berries and dressing together on a large serving platter. Top with the eggs and tuna slices, then season well and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5559,5559,'en','Golden new potato & pea curry','Adapt our potato and pea curry to your liking – for example, you could add prawns or chunks of monkfish for a few minutes towards the end of the cooking time','["3 banana shallots, peeled and chopped","5 large garlic cloves, chopped","4 Thai red chillies","5cm piece of galangal, peeled and chopped, or 1 tbsp galangal paste","5cm piece of ginger, peeled and finely chopped","1 lemongrass stalk, outer leaves removed and end trimmed","2 tsp medium curry powder","2 tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp ground cumin","2 tbsp coriander seeds","900g new potatoes, halved (see tip, below)","2 tbsp rapeseed or vegetable oil","2 tbsp fish sauce (optional)","2 x 400g cans full-fat coconut milk","3 lime leaves","200g fresh peas","2-3 limes, juiced","sticky jasmine rice, to serve"]','["Tip the shallots, garlic, half the chillies, the galangal, ginger, lemongrass and spices into afood processorwith 50ml water and blitz to a smooth paste. Cook the new potatoes in a pan of boiling salted water for 5 mins until just softened, then drain.","Heat the oil in a largesaucepanover a medium heat, then tip in the paste and fry for 10 mins, stirring regularly with a wooden spoon. Add the potatoes, fish sauce (if using), coconut milk and lime leaves. Halve the remaining chillies and add these along with 100ml water. Bring the mixture to a simmer, cover with a lid and cook for 15 mins, or until the potatoes are tender but still holding their shape. Add the peas and cook for another 5 mins.","Season to taste with salt, pepper and the lime juice, then serve the curry over a bowl of sticky rice."]','2026-01-10 12:16:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5561,5561,'en','Easy seafood chowder','Make this creamy seafood chowder for one using any leftovers you might have in the fridge or freezer. Garnish with parsley and serve with crusty bread','["1 small potato (about 150g), cut into 2cm cubes","½ tbsp vegetable oil","1 celery stick, finely chopped","1 shallot, peeled and finely chopped","1 garlic clove, grated","1 tbsp plain flour","200ml semi-skimmed or whole milk","100ml vegetable or fish stock","80g frozen prawns or smoked fish","75g fresh or frozen sweetcorn or peas (or use a mixture)","1 small lemon, zested and juiced","½ tbsp roughly chopped flat-leaf parsley, plus extra to serve (optional)","crusty bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Tip the potatoes into a smallsaucepanand cover with cold salted water. Bring to the boil over a medium heat , then reduce the heat and simmer for 5-6 mins until just softened. Drain and set aside.","Heat the oil in a medium saucepan over a medium heat and cook the celery and shallot for 3 mins until softened. Add the garlic and fry for another 30 seconds until fragrant.","Stir in the flour and cook for 1 min. Reduce the heat to low and slowly pour in the milk,whiskinguntil you have a thick sauce. Stir in the stock and simmer for 2 mins until the sauce has thickened slightly again.","Tip in the fish, vegetables and cooked potatoes, and simmer for 4-5 mins until the veg has defrosted (if frozen) and the fish is cooked through. When the mixture is creamy and coats the back of a spoon, add the lemon zest and juice and up to 50ml water if the chowder is too thick. Season with black pepper, salt and the parsley.","Pour the chowder into a bowl, top with more black pepper, the extra parsley and serve with crusty bread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5563,5563,'en','Smoked haddock dauphinoise','Add smoked haddock to dauphinoise to make an easier, freeze-ahead fish pie. It’s a great fuss-free dinner when you have family or friends over','["1kg Maris Piper or King Edward potatoes, peeled and sliced as thinly as possible","300ml double cream","1 tsp thyme leaves, plus extra to serve","25g parmesan, finely grated","300g skinless smoked haddock, cut into thin pieces","small knob of butter, for the dish","watercress, to serve"]','["Put the potatoes in a pan of cold, salted water and bring to the boil, then turn off the heat. Drain well. Tip the potatoes back into the pan and pour over the cream, then add the thyme, two-thirds of the parmesan and the haddock. Season and gently mix everything together.","Butter a medium-sized gratin dish, then tip in the potato mixture. Scatter with the remaining parmesan.Will keep covered and chilled for a day or frozen for three months. Defrost fully before cooking.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Bake for 30-35 mins until golden and bubbling around the edges. Leave to cool for at least 5 mins, then serve straight from the dish with a dressed watercress salad on the side, if you like. Scatter with some extra thyme and grind over some black pepper to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5565,5565,'en','Harissa fish pie','Add harissa to fish pie and top with sweet potato for a twist on a classic. Nutritionally balanced and filling, it’s ideal for a family meal','["700g sweet potatoes (3-4 small ones or 2 large ones)","3 tbsp rapeseed oil","pinch of cumin","pinch of smoked paprika","1 onion, finely chopped","1 red pepper, finely chopped","350ml semi-skimmed milk","350g fish pie mix (make sure it contains smoked haddock)","225g frozen king prawns, defrosted","2½ tbsp harissa paste","2 tbsp cornflour","30ml double cream","200g spinach, roughly chopped","steamed green beans, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Prick the sweet potatoes with a fork and cook for 50 mins-1 hr or until the flesh is soft (or in themicrowaveon high for 5-7 mins). Remove the skin and mash the flesh with 2 tbsp of the oil, the cumin and paprika. Set aside and keep warm.","Meanwhile, heat afrying panwith the remaining 1 tbsp oil, and cook the onions and peppers over a medium heat until soft, about 7 mins. Warm the milk in a pan over a low-medium heat and add the fish pie mix and the prawns. Cook for 4 mins until the prawns have just turned pink, then scoop out the fish and prawns. Reserve the milk.","Add the harissa paste to the onions and peppers and cook for 2 mins. Stir through the cornflour, then add the reserved milk bit by bit, stirring as you go, followed by the cream. Add the spinach and cook for 2 mins until it softens, then add the fish and prawns, stirring carefully to avoid breaking them up.","Pour the fish mixture into an ovenproof dish, approximately 25 x 18cm. Carefully spoon the sweet potato on top, going from end- to-end and meeting in the middle. Carefully spread out with a knife, then go over it with a fork to make ridges. Bake for 20 mins, then grill for 10 mins on the hottest setting. Serve with the green beans."]','2026-01-10 12:16:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5567,5567,'en','Baked cod with creamy mushroom & leek orzo','Rustle up our baked cod with orzo, creamy mushrooms and leeks in just 20 minutes. It’s a super speedy supper – a great option for busy work days','["3 tbsp plain flour","4 cod loin fillets","2 tbsp olive oil","1 lemon, zested and sliced","½ small bunch of thyme","2 leeks, sliced","200g mushrooms, sliced","300g orzo","500ml low-salt stock","2 tbsp crème fraîche"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Tip the flour into a bowl and season. Dip each cod fillet into the flour until evenly coated. Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in anon-stick frying panover a medium-high heat and fry the cod on each side for 2 mins, or until golden brown. Transfer to a roasting tin with the lemon slices on top and nestled in half the thyme. Bake for 10 mins.","Heat the remaining oil in a pan and fry the leeks and mushrooms for 5 mins over a medium-high heat. Add the orzo and stock, and cook for 10 mins over a high heat, stirring continuously until tender. Stir through the crème fraîche and lemon zest. Season. Serve the orzo with the cod on top, along with the roasted lemon slices."]','2026-01-10 12:16:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5569,5569,'en','Barbecued fish with lemon & rosemary','Invest in a fish cage if you’re a seafood lover, as this makes barbecuing a lot easier. If you don’t own one, salt the fish or cook it over lemon','["2 medium sea breams or sea bass (about 600g each), or 4 mackerel, scaled and gutted (remove the fins and heads, if you prefer)","handful of rosemary sprigs","2 lemons, 1 finely sliced, 1 halved","2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling"]','["Light thebarbecue– you want an even layer of ashen embers for medium heat. If you have a gas barbecue, set it to medium. Season the fish cavities with salt and pepper, then stuff with most of the rosemary sprigs and lemon slices. Brush or rub the fish skin with the olive oil and season well with sea salt flakes. If you have a fish cage, lay the fish inside with the remaining lemon slices and rosemary sprigs and place on the grill. Alternatively, scatter the lemon slices and rosemary sprigs directly over the grill and lay the fish on top (see tip below for cooking indoors).","Cook the fish for 8-10 mins on each side until the skin is lightly charred and blistered, and the fish is cooked through. While it is cooking, put the lemon halves cut-side down on the grill and cook until char marks appear. Serve the fish drizzled with extra oil with the charred lemons for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:16:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5571,5571,'en','Garden eggs stew with boiled green plantain','Try something different for dinner with this hearty African-inspired garden eggs (also known as white aubergine) stew with eggs and salted fish. Enjoy with green plantain','["1 whole dried and salted tilapia (koobi)","11 small white aubergines , trimmed and halved","2 Scotch bonnet chillies","2 Indian or small red onions, 1 chopped, 1 sliced","4-6 green plantains, peeled, each cut into 2-3 pieces","2 large eggs","2-4 tbsp peanut butter","½ shrimp cube (optional)","½ tsp aromat (optional)","30g fermented salted fish (momoni)","120ml red palm fruit & rapeseed oil (we used Carotino Mild & Light cooking oil, available in Morrisons and Tesco)","120g tin sardines in oil, drained","1 avocado , stoned, halved, peeled and sliced"]','["The day before, put the whole dried tilapia in a large bowl, cover with cold water and leave to soak overnight.","The next day, put the white aubergines and Scotch bonnet chillies in asaucepan, cover with cold water and the lid, then bring to the boil over a medium-high heat. Cook for 10-12 mins, then drain and set aside.","Meanwhile, put the chopped onion in an asanka pot and grind to a paste. If you don’t have an asanka pot, you can use afood processoror blender – if using a blender, drain away any water after blending.","Drain the water from the tilapia, then rinse the fish under cold running water to remove any excess salt.","In a separate pan over a medium-high heat, bring the green plantains, eggs and just enough water to cover to the boil. Once boiling, add the tilapia. Cook for 10-12 mins, then remove from the heat. Take the fish out of the pan using a slotted spoon and transfer to a plate. Leave to rest. Drain the plantains and eggs, then fill the pan with cold water and leave to stand for 5 mins.","Meanwhile, put the chillies in the asanka pot or food processor with the onion, and grind. When the mixture is smooth, add a 2-3 aubergines and grind again. Continue this process until all the aubergines have been added. Add the peanut butter, then season with half the shrimp cube, if using, and the aromat, if needed (taste for seasoning before adding the aromat).","Rinse the fermented salted fish under cold running water. Heat the red palm fruit & rapeseed oil in afrying panset over a medium heat, and fry the fermented salted fish for around 3-5 mins. Remove the fish from the pan using a slotted spoon or fish slice, and remove any visible bones. Add the fish to the asanka pot and grind into the aubergine mixture. Discard any fish bones.","Add the sliced onions to the frying pan and fry for 3-5 mins, then add the aubergine mixture and stir well. Reduce the heat to low and cook for 3-5 mins. Mix in the sardines. Cook over the lowest heat for around 2 mins more, and mix everything together well.","Transfer the mixture to an asanka pot or serving bowl. Drain the plantains and peel and halve the boiled eggs, then add these to the pot. Top with the avocado and tilapia, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5573,5573,'en','Coconut & kale fish curry','Batch-cook this easy kale, cod and king prawn curry and freeze in portions for busy weeknights. With a coconut milk base and spices, it’s full of flavour','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 onion, sliced","thumb-sized piece ginger, sliced into matchsticks","1 tsp turmeric","3-4 tbsp mild curry paste (Keralan works well)","150g cherry tomatoes, halved","150g kale, chopped","1 red chilli, halved","325ml low-fat coconut milk","300ml low-salt stock","250g brown rice","100g frozen king prawns","2 cod fillets, cut into chunks","2 limes, juiced","½ small bunch coriander, chopped","handful of toasted coconut flakes (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a casserole dish. Cook the onion with a pinch of salt for 10 mins until it starts to caramalise. Stir through the ginger, turmeric and curry paste, and cook for 2 mins.","Add the tomatoes, kale and chilli, and pour in the coconut milk and stock. Simmer for 10-15 mins or until the tomatoes begin to soften. Scoop out the chilli and discard.","Cook the rice following pack instructions. Gently stir the prawns and cod through the curry, then cook for another 3-5 mins. Squeeze over the lime and stir through half of the coriander. To serve, scatter over the remaining coriander and the coconut flakes, if you like. Serve with the rice."]','2026-01-10 12:16:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5575,5575,'en','Antipasti salmon','Turn a side of salmon into a gorgeous centrepiece with just a few Mediterranean antipasti ingredients. Bake in the oven or cook on the barbecue for a great summer dish','["100g sundried tomatoes in oil, drained and finely chopped","small handful of basil, finely chopped, plus a few whole basil leaves","small handful of dill, finely chopped, plus a few dill fronds to serve","2 tbsp capers, drained and rinsed","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 lemon, zested and sliced","150g butter, softened","600g side of salmon, descaled and pin bones removed","3 tbsp pitted black olives","100g griddled artichoke hearts, drained and roughly chopped"]','["Put the tomatoes, half the herbs, 1 tbsp capers, the garlic, lemon zest and butter in a bowl and mash together with a spoon. Alternatively, tip into a food processor and blitz until combined. The flavoured butter will keep, chilled, for up to two days.","Layer a sheet of baking parchment large enough to loosely wrap the salmon over an equally-sized sheet of foil. Place the salmon on top, then cut the fish into portions, without cutting all the way through to the skin, so the fillet remains intact. Make the portions as big or small as you like, depending on how many you’re feeding. Spread the flavoured butter over the salmon, then top with the remaining capers, the lemon slices, olives and artichokes. Wrap the foil and parchment over the salmon and scrunch the ends to seal, creating a loose parcel.","To bake the salmon, heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the parcel on a baking tray and cook for 30 mins, then leave to stand for a few minutes before unwrapping. Alternatively, light the barbecue, wait for the flames to die down, put the parcel directly on the grill and cook for 8-15 mins, or until the salmon is cooked through. Check the salmon is cooked by pushing the flesh with a fork – it should easily flake. Serve on a platter, scattered with the remaining herbs and the buttery juices poured over."]','2026-01-10 12:16:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5577,5577,'en','Amalfi lemon, chilli & anchovy spaghetti','Get a taste of Italy with this Amalfi Coast-inspired spaghetti dish flavoured with lemons, anchovies, chilli, garlic and parmesan','["120ml extra virgin olive oil","3 large garlic cloves","350g spaghetti, bucatini or linguine","1-2 red chillies (depending on how spicy you want it), deseeded and finely chopped","8 anchovy fillets, finely chopped","small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","1 large Amalfi or unwaxed lemon, zested and juiced","large handful (about 40g) of finely grated parmesan"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying pan over a low heat and fry the garlic for 2-3 mins, or until just turning golden at the edges. Remove from the heat and leave for 15 mins for the garlic to infuse in the oil.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta following pack instructions until al dente. Drain, reserving 150ml of the cooking water. Remove the garlic from the infused oil, then tip in the cooked spaghetti, the chillies, anchovies, parsley, lemon zest and juice, and the parmesan. Add 50ml of the reserved water and toss with tongs until combined. Add a little more water to loosen, if you like. Season. Divide between four shallow bowls."]','2026-01-10 12:16:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5579,5579,'en','Spiced salmon & tomato traybake','Enjoy this healthy spiced salmon and tomato traybake with a mild curry flavour for a quick and easy midweek meal. Serve with naan bread and lemon wedges','["1 red onion, sliced","200g cherry tomatoes","3 tbsp mild or madras curry paste","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","2 skinless salmon fillets","1 large or 2 small naan breads","2 tbsp fat-free yogurt","lemon wedges and a few coriander leaves, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the onion, tomatoes, 2 tbsp curry paste, the chickpeas and 200ml water together in a deep 20 x 25cm roasting tin. Roast for 15 mins until the onions are tender and the tomatoes are just bursting.","Stir everything, then season. Brush the remaining curry paste over the salmon fillets and season. Nestle the salmon into the veg in the tin and roast for another 8-10 mins, or until cooked to your liking.","Meanwhile, warm the naan breads – you can do this by putting them directly on the oven rack below the roasting tin. Cut the warmed naan breads into wedges. Swirl the yogurt into the veg in the tin, then serve with the naan wedges for dunking, a few coriander leaves sprinkled over, if you like, and the lemon wedges, if using, for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:16:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5581,5581,'en','Hake & seafood cataplana','Tuck into this Portuguese-inspired dish with mussels and prawns. It’s healthy, low in calories, and provides three of your 5-a-day, along with iron, folate, vitamin C and fibre','["2 tbsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","1 onion, halved and thinly sliced","250g salad potatoes, cut into chunks","1 large red pepper, deseeded and chopped","1 courgette (200g), thickly sliced","2 tomatoes, chopped (150g)","2 large garlic cloves, finely grated","1 tbsp cider vinegar (optional)","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 skinless hake fillets (pack size 240g)","150g pack ready-cooked mussels (not in shells)","60g peeled prawns","large handful of parsley, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a wide non-stick pan with a tight-fitting lid. Fry the onions and potatoes for about 5 mins, or until starting to soften. Add the peppers, courgettes, tomatoes and garlic, then stir in the vinegar, if using, the bouillon and 200ml water. Bring to a simmer, cover and cook for 25 mins, or until the peppers and courgettes are very tender (if your pan doesn’t have a tight fitting lid, wet a sheet of baking parchment and place over the stew before covering – this helps keep in the juices).","Add the hake fillets, mussels and prawns, then cover and cook for 5 mins more, or until the fish flakes easily when tested with a fork. Scatter over the parsley and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5583,5583,'en','Herby fish fingers with Chinese-style rice','This healthy, gluten-free lunch or dinner supplies a balance of carbs and protein, making it perfect for refuelling after exercise','["100g brown basmati rice","160g frozen peas","50g French beans","3 spring onions, finely chopped","½ tsp dried chilli flakes","good handful coriander, roughly chopped","2 tsp tamari","few drops sesame oil","1 tbsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","2 large eggs","280g pack skinless cod loins cut into chunky strips (cut into 4 strips per loin)"]','["Cook the rice in a pan of water for 25 mins, adding the peas and beans for the last 6 mins. Drain, then return to the pan and stir in the spring onions, chilli flakes, all but 1 tbsp chopped coriander, the tamari and sesame oil. Cover.","Meanwhile, heat a large non-stick pan with the rapeseed oil Beat the eggs with the remaining 1 tbsp coriander. Cut the fish into chunky strips, then coat them in the egg and fry in the oil for a couple of mins each side until golden. Remove the fish from the pan and tip in the rice with any remaining egg and stir. Serve in bowls, topped with the fish."]','2026-01-10 12:16:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5585,5585,'en','Curried fishcakes','Make a batch of these spiced cod fishcakes and freeze them for busy weeknights. Serve with salad and coleslaw for a tasty family meal','["500g Maris Piper potatoes, peeled and cut into 3cm chunks","2 tbsp olive oil","3 large garlic cloves, crushed","1 thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and grated","1 tsp black mustard seeds","2-3 heaped tbsp medium curry powder","4 skin-on cod fillets","400ml semi-skimmed milk","1 small lemon, zested and juiced","150g plain flour","2 medium eggs, beaten","150g panko breadcrumbs","salad leaves and slaw, to serve"]','["Put the potatoes in a large saucepan, cover with cold water and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 8-10 mins until tender. Drain and leave to steam-dry for 5 mins. Lightly crush the potatoes with a potato masher until slightly chunky.","Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat. Fry the garlic, ginger, mustard seeds and curry powder for 1 min. Stir the spices through the potatoes, season with salt and set aside.","Put the cod in a large saucepan over a medium heat, pour over the milk and bring to a simmer. Immediately remove from the heat, cover and set aside for 10 mins to poach. Lift the fish out with a slotted spoon, then remove and discard the skin. Flake the flesh into the potato mixture in large pieces, then fold in with the lemon zest and juice. Shape the mixture into eight fishcakes using your hands.","Put the flour, eggs and breadcrumbs in three separate shallow bowls. Dip each fishcake in the flour, then the eggs, then the breadcrumbs. Set aside on a baking sheet. To freeze, cover and freeze on the sheet until solid, then transfer to freezerproof containers.","Heat the remaining oil in a large non-stick frying pan over a medium heat and heat the oven to low. Fry the fishcakes in batches for 5-6 mins on each side until golden and crisp. Keep warm in the oven as you cook them. Serve with the salad leaves and slaw on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5587,5587,'en','Zesty salmon with roasted beets & spinach','This fresh and filling salmon supper is packed full of heart healthy ingredients, is rich in calcium, iron and vitamin C and makes up 4 of your 5 a day','["4 small fresh beetroots, about 200g","1½  tbsp cold pressed olive oil","1 tsp coriander seeds, lightly crushed","2 skinless salmon or trout fillets","2½  small oranges, zest of 1 and juice of half","3 tbsp pumpkin seeds","1 garlic clove","1 red onion, finely chopped","4 handfuls baby spinach leaves","1 avocado, thickly sliced"]','["Heat oven to 180C, 160C fan, gas 4. Trim the stems of the beetroot and reserve any tender leaves that are suitable for eating in the salad. Cut the beetroots into quarters then toss with 1/2 tbsp oil, the coriander seeds, and some seasoning then pile into the centre of a large sheet of foil and wrap up like a parcel. Bake for 45 mins or until the beetroots are tender then top with the salmon, scatter over half the orange zest and return to the oven for 15 mins. If you want to toast the pumpkin seeds, put them in the oven for 10 mins.","Meanwhile cut the peel and pith from 2 oranges then cut out the segments with a sharp knife working over a bowl to catch the juices. Finely grate the garlic and leave for 10 mins to allow the enzymes to activate. Stir the garlic into the orange juice and remaining olive oil with seasoning to make a dressing.","Remove the parcel from the oven and carefully lift off the fish. Tip the beetroot into a bowl with the red onion, remaining orange zest, pumpkin seeds and spinach leaves and toss well. Gently toss through the orange segments and avocado with any beet leaves then pile onto plates and top with the warm salmon. Drizzle over the dressing and serve while still warm."]','2026-01-10 12:16:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5589,5589,'en','Seafood tagine','Use a frozen mix of fish and shellfish to make this Moroccan stew, served over a zesty almond couscous','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, chopped","1 red pepper, deseeded and chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","2 tbsp harissa","2 x 400g cans chopped tomato","400g can chickpeas","350g bag frozen seafood selection","300g couscous","small pack coriander, leaves only, roughly chopped","25g toasted flaked almonds","zest and juice ½  lemon, reserving the other ½  to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and cook the onion and red pepper for about 5 mins until softened. Stir in the garlic, harissa and chopped tomatoes, and cook for about 10 mins until thickened. Add the frozen seafood and cook through, about 10 mins more.","Put the couscous in a serving bowl, pour over boiling water to cover, then cover with cling film. Leave to soak while the tagine cooks, then stir in most of the coriander, the almonds, lemon zest and juice, and seasoning. Serve the tagine with the couscous and cut the remaining lemon half into wedges to squeeze over. Sprinkle over the remaining coriander and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5591,5591,'en','Citrus & ginger steamed fish with stir-fry veg','Save time and serve up a healthy weeknight dinner with this quick Asian style white fish recipe with garlic, ginger, red pepper and beansprouts','["zest and juice 1 orange","1 tbsp reduced-salt soy sauce","2 tsp white wine vinegar or rice vinegar","300g pack of 2 white fish fillets or loins","1 tbsp very finely shredded ginger","2 tsp sesame oil","10 spring onions, halved and sliced lengthways","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","1 red pepper, deseeded and sliced","140g beansprouts","1-2 tsp sesame seeds, toasted"]','["Mix together the orange zest and juice, soy and vinegar. Line the top of a steamer with baking parchment and heat water in the base. Top the fish with a little of the ginger, add to the steamer and spoon over 2 tbsp of the dressing. Cover and steam for 5-6 mins until the fish flakes easily.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a non-stick wok and stir-fry the spring onions, garlic, pepper and remaining ginger for 2 mins. Add the beansprouts and cook for 2 mins more. Pour any juices from the fish into the veg. Stir through the dressing, then divide between bowls, top with the fish and scatter over the sesame seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:16:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5593,5593,'en','Fish parcels with romesco sauce & veg','Romesco sauce is made from peppers, almonds, chilli and garlic. Team with white fish and a cauliflower and spring onion mix','["2 firm white fish fillets (we used cod)","4 lemon slices","2 thyme sprigs","2 tbsp olive oil","½  cauliflower, cut into wedges","10 spring onions, ends trimmed, roots left intact","1 slice sourdough bread, torn into chunks","1 red chilli (deseeded if you don''t like it too hot)","2 garlic cloves, sliced","10 blanched almonds","2 ready-roasted red peppers, from a jar","1 tomato, peeled (see tip, below)","½  tsp sherry vinegar"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put each fish fillet on a large piece of baking parchment and top each with a few slices of lemon and a sprig of thyme. Drizzle with 1 tsp of the oil and season. Fold over the top edges of each piece of parchment to make a seal, then scrunch up the ends like a sweet wrapper. Put the parcels on a baking sheet and bake in oven for 15 mins.","Meanwhile, steam the cauliflower for 4 mins, then add the spring onions for 3 mins more or until tender. Pat dry, then toss the veg in 2 tsp olive oil and season. In a large frying pan, toast the bread pieces in the remaining oil, then add the chilli and garlic, and cook for 1 min. Tip into a food processor with the nuts, peppers, tomato and vinegar, and pulse until you have a rough paste. Season and put to one side.","Wipe then heat the frying pan. Add the cauliflower wedges and spring onions, and cook for a few mins each side to brown. Serve alongside the fish and sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:16:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5595,5595,'en','Baked fish with tomatoes, basil & crispy crumbs','A low-fat traybake supper that''s full of flavour. Combine lean white fish with cherry tomatoes, a pesto crumb, green beans and broccoli','["2 x 400g cans cherry tomatoes","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","3 tbsp basil pesto","2 tbsp breadcrumbs","4 skinless firm white fish fillets (about 140g each)","320g pack green beans","320g pack thin-stemmed broccoli"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the tomatoes into a roasting tin, and stir in the vinegar and 1 tbsp of the pesto. Season, mix, then bake in the oven for 10 mins.","Mix together the remaining pesto and the breadcrumbs, then press onto each fish fillet. Add to the roasting tin and return to the oven for 12-15 mins until the fish flakes easily and the topping is slightly crisp.","Meanwhile, boil the green beans and broccoli, then drain. Serve the bake scattered with the vegetables."]','2026-01-10 12:16:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5597,5597,'en','Lemon & pepper fish with roasted veg','A light supper of white fish with a breadcrumb coating and ratatouille-inspired roast vegetable mix of peppers, courgettes and onions','["3 mixed peppers, deseeded and sliced","2 red onions, cut into wedges","3 courgettes, cut into rounds","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tsp dried oregano","50g black olives","1 tbsp vegetable oil","4 tbsp dried breadcrumbs","zest ½ lemon, plus wedges to serve","1 tsp crushed black peppercorn","3 frozen white fish fillets (such as cod, haddock or pollack)","2 tbsp plain flour","1 medium egg, beaten"]','["Toss the vegetables with the garlic, herbs, olives and oil. Season and tip onto a tray lined with baking parchment. Open-freeze the veg until solid, then transfer to a large freezer bag and put in the freezer.","Whizz the breadcrumbs until fine, then toast for a few secs in a dry frying pan, shaking to prevent them burning. Tip into a bowl and mix with the lemon zest, pepper and a large pinch of salt. Tip into a small freezer bag and pop in the freezer.Both the vegetables and crumbs can be frozen for up to 3 months.","To cook from frozen, heat oven to 200C/220C fan/gas 7. Tip the vegetables into a roasting tin and cook for 15 mins. Meanwhile, dust the frozen fish in flour, brush lightly with the egg and cover with the frozen breadcrumbs. Pop the fish onto a grill rack and sit above the veg. Bake for 25 mins until the fish is cooked. Serve with lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:16:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5599,5599,'en','Sticky seeded salmon with satsuma salad','A multi-textured, multi-coloured fish dish with nutritious seeds and a vibrant citrus watercress salad','["2 skinless salmon fillets, about 140g each","2 tsp agave syrup or honey","2-3 tbsp mixed seed","4 satsumas","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","50g bag watercress","250g pack cooked beetroot (not in vinegar), drained and cut into thin wedges"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Brush each salmon fillet with half the agave syrup or honey, sprinkle on some black pepper, then press on the seeds. Transfer to a baking tray and bake for about 15 mins, depending on the thickness of the fish, until the fish is cooked through and the seeds crunchy.","Meanwhile, cut the peel from the satsumas and cut into segments, reserving all the juice that comes out for the dressing. Whisk the juice with the olive oil, vinegar and some seasoning in a small bowl.","Toss together the watercress, beetroot and satsuma segments with the dressing and divide between plates. Add a piece of salmon to each one."]','2026-01-10 12:16:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5601,5601,'en','Piri-piri fish & chips with spicy peas','Give a traditional staple a spicy kick with some chilli marinade and minty peas. Use any white fish- we used sea bass','["375g potatoes, cut into chips","1 tbsp olive oil","juice ½ lemon","2 tbsp piri-piri marinade","300g frozen peas","1 green chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","½  garlic clove, crushed","handful mint leaves, finely chopped","2 white fish fillets (we used sea bass)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nToss the chips with half the olive oil\r\nand half the lemon juice, arrange in\r\na layer on a baking tray, then season.\r\nCook for 25 mins. Stir the remaining\r\nlemon juice into the marinade.","Meanwhile, bring a pan of water to\r\nthe boil and cook the peas for 2-3 mins,\r\nthen drain. Return the peas to the empty\r\npan and crush with the chilli, garlic,\r\nmint and the remaining oil. Season\r\nand keep warm.","After 25 mins, turn the potatoes\r\nand move to the edges of the tray.\r\nAdd the fish, skin-side up, and spoon\r\nover the marinade. Cook for another\r\n10-12 mins until the fish is cooked\r\nthrough. Serve with the smashed peas."]','2026-01-10 12:16:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5603,5603,'en','Puffed salmon & spinach fish pie','Adding greens to your mashed potato topping boosts the health benefits of this classic comfort food bake','["1kg Maris Piper potatoes, cut into large chunks","2 large eggs, separated","400g frozen whole-leaf spinach (frozen weight), defrosted and squeezed dry","85g reduced-fat mature cheddar","whole nutmeg, for grating","500g fish - a mix of white and salmon is good (I used 2 frozen salmon fillets and 2 cod, defrosted)","1 onion, halved","a few whole cloves","1 fresh or dried bay leaf","300ml semi-skimmed milk","300ml fish stock (from a cube is fine)","25g butter","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","50g plain flour","1 tsp wholegrain mustard"]','["Boil the potatoes for 20 mins until\r\ntender. Meanwhile, put the fish in a frying\r\npan, skin-side down. Stud the onion with\r\nthe cloves and put into the pan with the\r\nbay, milk and stock. Bring to the boil, then\r\ncover and simmer for 2 mins. Remove\r\nthe cod, which should flake easily, then\r\nre-cover and cook for 3 mins more until\r\nthe salmon is just cooked through. Lift\r\nout the fish and set aside. Strain the\r\ncooking liquid.","In another pan, melt the butter with the\r\noil, stir in the flour and cook for 2 mins until\r\nit smells toasty. Take off the heat and\r\nslowly whisk in the fish cooking liquid.\r\nReturn to the heat, whisk until the sauce\r\nboils and thickens, then stir in the mustard.\r\nHeat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Drain and mash the potatoes until\r\nsmooth, then beat in the egg yolks,\r\nspinach and most of the cheese. Season\r\ngenerously with salt, pepper and nutmeg.\r\nWhisk the egg whites to soft peaks, then\r\nfold into the potato in 2 batches.","Flake the fish into a large baking dish,\r\npour over the sauce and top with the\r\nspinachy potato. Scatter with the rest\r\nof the cheese and bake for 35-40 mins\r\nuntil golden and risen."]','2026-01-10 12:16:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5605,5605,'en','Baked trout with fennel, radish & rocket salad','A stylish fish supper that’s light, fresh and packed full of omega-3, folic acid and vitamin C','["2 whole trout, scaled and gutted","½ bunch thyme","2 lemons, 1 sliced, 1 juiced","2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra to drizzle","1 large bulb fennel, finely sliced","100g radishes, finely sliced","1 tbsp capers, chopped","large handful of rocket"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nSlash the trout''s skin three times on both\r\nsides then stuff a thyme branch into each\r\ncut. Lay the fish on a baking sheet and fill\r\nthe cavity with the lemon slices and\r\nremaining thyme sprigs. Season the fish,\r\ndrizzle over some olive oil then bake it for\r\n15-20 mins until cooked through.","Meanwhile, mix lemon juice with olive\r\noil, then pour over the fennel and allow to\r\nstand for 10 mins. Stir in the radishes and\r\ncapers and season. Mix the rocket through\r\nthe fennel and radish salad just before\r\nserving with big bits of the flaked trout."]','2026-01-10 12:16:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5607,5607,'en','Classic chunky fish cakes','Fish cakes are a great freezer staple as they are ready portioned so you can defrost as many as you need','["1kg potatoes, peeled and chopped","1kg mix salmon and coley fillets","zest and juice 1 lemon","bunch each dill, chives, parsley and spring onions, chopped","4 tbsp tartar sauce, plus extra to serve if you like","3 eggs, beaten","100g plain flour","250g breadcrumbs","2 tbsp olive oil"]','["Cover the potatoes in cold, salted\r\nwater and bring to the boil. Turn down\r\nto a simmer and cook for 10-12 mins\r\nuntil tender. Drain and steam dry for a\r\nfew mins, then mash and set aside to\r\ncool a little. Meanwhile, cook the fish.\r\nCover in cold water and the lemon juice,\r\nbring to a gentle simmer, then poach for\r\n5 mins (depending on the thickness of\r\nthe fish) until just cooked through. Remove\r\nfrom the water, get rid of the skin and\r\nflake into large chunks.","Put the lemon zest, herbs, spring\r\nonions, tartar sauce and some seasoning\r\ninto a large bowl with the fish and the\r\npotatoes. Combine all the ingredients,\r\nthen divide into 12 and shape into cakes.","Put the eggs, flour and breadcrumbs\r\non three plates. Dip each of the fish cakes\r\nin flour, pat off any excess, then dip in the\r\negg. Finally, coat in the breadcrumbs and\r\ntransfer to a clean plate or baking tray\r\nlined with parchment paper. Repeat with\r\nthe remaining fish cakes. You can freeze\r\nthe fish cakes now for up to three months, or chill for 1-2 days.","To cook, heat the grill to medium.\r\nBrush the fish cakes with the oil and grill\r\nfor 4-5 mins each side until golden and\r\nhot through. Serve with extra tartar\r\nsauce and salad or green veg. Defrost\r\nfrozen fish cakes overnight in fridge and\r\ncook as above. Alternatively, to cook straight from\r\nfrozen, heat grill to medium, oil fish cakes as per recipe then grill 12-15 mins one side to brown, before flipping and grilling the other side for 5 mins more."]','2026-01-10 12:16:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5609,5609,'en','Crispy fish & chips with mushy peas','Make this take-away classic in your kitchen, healthier than your local chippy and just as tasty','["400g baking potatoes","2 tsp olive oil","2 slices white bread","2 white fish fillets, such as haddock, hoki, pollock","1 tbsp plain flour, seasoned","1 egg, beaten","140g frozen peas with mint","2 tbsp crème fraîche"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 4. Peel and chop the potatoes into thick chips, then coss with the olive oil and some salt. Arrange on a large non-stick baking tray and roast for 20 mins, turning halfway.","Lightly toast the bread, then pulse briefly in a food processor for coarse breadcrumbs. Dust the fish in flour, shaking off the excess, then dip into the egg, then breadcrumbs to coat thoroughly. Roast the fish with the chips for a further 20 mins, until both are golden.","Just before the fish and chips are ready, boil the peas for 3-4 mins, then drain and mash. Stir in the crème fraiche and season."]','2026-01-10 12:16:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5611,5611,'en','Baked salmon with fennel & tomatoes','Aniseedy fennel and juicy cherry tomatoes cut through the richness of salmon fillets','["2 medium fennel bulbs","2 tbsp chopped flat-leaf parsley","zest and juice 1 lemon","175g cherry tomatoes","1 tbsp olive oil","2 salmon fillets, about 175g each","few black olives (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Trim\r\nthe fronds from the fennel and set aside.\r\nCut the fennel bulbs in half, then cut each\r\nhalf into 3 wedges. Cook in boiling salted\r\nwater for 10 mins, then drain well. Chop\r\nthe fennel fronds roughly, then mix with\r\nthe parsley and lemon zest.","Spread the drained fennel over a shallow\r\novenproof dish, then add the tomatoes.\r\nDrizzle with olive oil, then bake for 10 mins.\r\nNestle the salmon among the veg, sprinkle\r\nwith lemon juice, then bake 15 mins more\r\nuntil the fish is just cooked. Scatter over the\r\nparsley and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5613,5613,'en','Lighter fish chowder','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA healthier version of the classic American soup that uses salmon and pollack, plus fat-trimmed prosciutto and half-fat crème fraîche','["1½  tbsp rapeseed oil","3 slices prosciutto, trimmed of fat, cut into strips","2-3 leeks, thinly sliced (about 320g trimmed weight)","2 plump garlic cloves, finely chopped","3 thyme sprigs (preferably lemon thyme), plus extra leaves to garnish","2 bay leaves","650g floury potatoes such as Desiree or Maris Piper, unpeeled, scrubbed, sliced 5mm thick","600ml hot vegetable stock from a good-quality cube or powder (we used Marigold bouillon)","good pinch of chilli flakes","250g skinless salmon fillets","250g skinless pollack or haddock fillets","3 tbsp half-fat crème fraîche","snipped chives, to garnish"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large, deep sauté\r\npan. Tip in the prosciutto and fry for 2 mins\r\nuntil crisp. Remove with a slotted spoon,\r\nletting any excess oil drain back into the\r\npan. Set aside. Add the rest of the oil and fry\r\nthe leeks, garlic, thyme and bay for 2-3 mins\r\nuntil the leeks are starting to soften but\r\nkeeping their colour. Add the potatoes and\r\nfry for 2 mins, turning occasionally. Pour in\r\nthe stock with an extra 100ml boiling water\r\nand gently press the potatoes down so that\r\nthey are just covered. Bring to the boil. Boil\r\nquite vigorously, uncovered, over a high\r\nheat for 10 mins until the potatoes are\r\nalmost cooked. The liquid should have\r\nthickened very slightly. Scatter in the chilli\r\nflakes, some pepper and a pinch of salt.","Lower the heat to medium and lay the\r\nwhole fish fillets on top of the potatoes.\r\nSeason the fish with pepper and gently\r\npress down into the broth so that the fillets\r\nare only just submerged. Cover and simmer\r\nfor about 5 mins or until the fish is almost\r\ncooked (timing will depend on the thickness\r\nof the fillets). Remove from the heat and sit\r\nfor another 5-10 mins, so that the fish can\r\ngently finish cooking. Remove the thyme\r\nand bay leaves. Still off the heat, spoon in\r\nthe crème fraîche and gently swirl around\r\nin the broth until it looks creamy.","To serve, gently and briefly reheat. Divide\r\nthe potatoes and fish (let the fish break into\r\nlarge pieces as you lift it out of the pan)\r\ninto wide, shallow bowls. Spoon the broth\r\naround and scatter with chives, a few\r\nthyme leaves and the crisp prosciutto."]','2026-01-10 12:16:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5615,5615,'en','Chicken & elote-style corn wrap','Do something different for lunch with a wrap packed with spiced chicken, rice and sweetcorn. With two of your five-a-day, carbs and protein, it will fuel your afternoon','["3 chicken breasts (around 550g), finely sliced","2 tsp Mexican-style, taco or fajita seasoning","2 tsp olive oil","8 large tortilla wraps","200g frozen sweetcorn , defrosted","4 spring onions , sliced","1 lime , juiced","3 tbsp mayonnaise","½ tsp chilli powder","250g pouch basmati and wild rice (or the same in cooked weight)","1 large ripe tomato , finely chopped","handful of parsley , finely chopped"]','["Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat and dry-fry the sweetcorn until beginning to char, around 4-5 mins. Tip into a bowl and mix in the spring onions, lime juice, mayo and chilli powder with a good pinch of salt and pepper. Stir well to coat the corn. Set aside.","Cook the rice following pack instructions, then combine with the tomato, parsley and a good pinch of salt and a grinding of black pepper.","Coat the chicken in the Mexican-style seasoning, then heat the oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat and cook the chicken until cooked through. Set aside.","Heat the tortilla wraps, then pile on the rice, sweetcorn and chicken."]','2026-01-10 12:16:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5617,5617,'en','Healthy pad Thai','Toss chicken with rice noodles and stir-fried veg to create a deliciously healthy dinner. There’s a vegan option, too, which uses peanut butter (see tip, below)','["100g brown rice flat noodles","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 skinless chicken thigh fillets , chopped","1 onion (160g) , roughly chopped","1 red pepper , deseeded and cut into thin slices","1 small carrot (60g), peeled into thick ribbons using a veg peeler","3 garlic cloves , sliced","1 red chilli , deseeded and thinly sliced","1 tbsp finely grated ginger","100g beansprouts","15g roasted unsalted peanuts","2 tbsp lime juice , plus 1 tsp zest","1 tbsp low-salt soy sauce","15g chopped coriander","handful of chopped basil"]','["Tip the noodles into a bowl and soak following pack instructions until tender but not soft – you don’t want them to become mushy. Drain.","Heat the oil in awokover a medium-high heat and stir-fry the chicken for 5 mins until cooked. Transfer the chicken to a bowl and set aside, keeping the oil in the wok. Stir-fry the onion, pepper and carrot for 5 mins to soften, then add the garlic, chilli and ginger, and cook for a few minutes more until fragrant.","Add the beansprouts, turn up the heat to high, and stir through the peanuts, lime juice and zest and the soy sauce. Return the chicken to the pan along with the noodles and herbs, and gently toss everything together until heated through.Best served straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:16:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5619,5619,'en','Gnocchi traybake with lemony ricotta','Rustle up this one-tray wonder with gnocchi, ricotta, artichokes, plum tomatoes and courgette. It can be adapted by using any veg you have in the fridge','["500g gnocchi","1 courgette , halved, then sliced into chunky pieces","100g baby plum tomatoes , halved","100g artichokes in oil , plus 2 tbsp of the oil","2 garlic cloves , unpeeled, lightly bashed","½ tsp chilli flakes","85g ricotta","1 lemon , zested, then sliced into wedges","10g basil , roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Tip the gnocchi, courgette and tomatoes into a large roasting tray. Add the artichokes and oil, the bashed garlic cloves and chilli flakes, and season well with salt and freshly ground black pepper. Mix all the ingredients together with your hands, then bake for 30-35 mins until the gnocchi are crisp at the edges and the veg is soft.","Meanwhile, mix the ricotta and lemon zest together in a small bowl, then season with salt and pepper to taste. Dot this over the gnocchi and sprinkle over the basil.","Divide the gnocchi between two bowls, mixing them well so the ricotta breaks down to make a creamy sauce. Serve with the lemon wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:16:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5621,5621,'en','Caramelised red onion & anchovy pasta with gremolata','After a luxurious dinner for two? Perfect for Valentine’s Day, this pasta needs a little prep, but the cooking is simple, so you can enjoy time together','["2 tbsp olive oil","3 red onions , thinly sliced","200g pappardelle (or any long pasta)","2 anchovy fillets in oil, drained","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 lemon , zested and juiced","15g parsley , roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves , finely chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large, heavy-based frying pan over a medium heat. Fry the red onions with a large pinch of salt. Cook for 30-35 mins over a medium-low heat, stirring often, until caramelised and golden.","Meanwhile, make the gremolata. Mix the lemon zest, juice, parsley and garlic with a pinch of salt, then set aside. Cook the pappardelle following pack instructions, reserving 120ml pasta water.","Add the anchovy fillets to the onions when they have caramelised and let them dissolve. Stir in the tomato purée along with 15 twists of black pepper (around ½ tsp) and cook for 4-5 mins until the mixture has darkened.","Add the cooked pasta to the sauce along with the 120ml reserved pasta water. Stir well to combine, then transfer to a serving platter. Spoon over the gremolata to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5623,5623,'en','Vegan squash stew','Serve this hearty, healthy vegan stew for a comforting winter dinner. It’s packed with vitamin C and contains all five of your five-a-day','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","320g large chestnut mushrooms , quartered","2 bay leaves","2 tbsp fresh rosemary","4 red onions , quartered","4 garlic cloves , thinly sliced","320g prepared butternut squash","600ml vegetable stock , made with 1 tbsp bouillon powder","2 x 400g cans chickpeas , drained","1 tbsp smoked paprika","4 tbsp tomato purée","broccoli and peas , to serve","700g swede , peeled and cut into chunks","850g potatoes , cut into chunks"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan over a medium heat and fry the mushrooms, bay and rosemary for about 5 mins. Tip in the onions and garlic, and cook for a few minutes more until softened.","Add the butternut squash, stock, chickpeas, smoked paprika and tomato purée. Cover and simmer for 40 minutes until the liquid has reduced to a thick gravy.","About 25 mins before the end of cooking time, make the mash. Bring a large pan of water to the boil and cook the swede for 5 mins, then add the potatoes and boil for 15-20 mins until tender. Drain and mash with plenty of black pepper.","Serve half the stew and mash now, then chill the rest to reheat and eat another day.Will keep chilled for up to three days. Reheat the stew in a pan until piping hot. The mash can be reheated in the microwave. Serve with broccoli and peas, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5625,5625,'en','Kale salad','Tuck into this vibrant salad packed with nutritious kale, root veg, nuts and cheese. It’s a satisfying lunch, but can also be served as a side','["200g kale , stalks removed and leaves torn","1 large shallot , finely sliced","100g cooked beetroot , roughly chopped","30g dried cranberries","250g carrots , grated","25g mixed nuts , roughly chopped","125g goat''s cheese , crumbled (optional)","1 lemon , juiced","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","1 small garlic clove , crushed","1 tbsp maple syrup","1 tbsp rice vinegar","3 tbsp olive oil"]','["Combine all the dressing ingredients in a large bowl, season well, then add the kale and shallot. Massage the dressing into the kale leaves until they soften and turn dark green, about 2-3 mins.","Add the beetroot, cranberries, carrots, nuts and goat cheese, if using. Toss together until everything is evenly coated, and season. Serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:16:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5627,5627,'en','Smoky chickpea salad','Enjoy the layers of flavour and contrast of textures in this vegan salad, with crisp, fried chickpeas, crunchy raw broccoli, and a smoked paprika dressing','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","2 x 400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","200g carrots, peeled into ribbons or grated","200g spinach","1 small head of broccoli, roughly chopped","2 tsp smoked paprika","2 tsp garlic granules","2 tsp dried mixed herbs","4 tsp maple syrup","2 tbsp low-sodium soy sauce","4 tsp rice vinegar","2 tsp sesame oil"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat. Tip in the chickpeas and fry gently for 3-4 mins until sizzling and slightly crispy.","Whisktogether the dressing ingredients in a bowl, then pour over the chickpeas along with 4 tbsp water and bring to a boil. Cook for 1-2 mins until reduced slightly, remove from the heat, season well and set aside.","Toss the carrots, spinach and raw broccoli together and divide between plates. Scatter over the chickpeas and a spoonful of the pan juices to dress."]','2026-01-10 12:16:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5629,5629,'en','Wedge salad with soy seeds & pickled dill cucumbers','Try the salty, umami-heavy crunch of soy seeds along with pickled cucumbers to dress this wedge salad – it beats a classic bacon garnish any day','["75ml white wine vinegar","1 tbsp caster sugar","¼ tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp finely chopped dill","1 large cucumber, thinly sliced into 1-2mm-thick rounds","1 iceberg lettuce, halved through the core, each half cut into wedges","75g mixed seeds","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tbsp light soy sauce","100ml buttermilk","3 tbsp Greek-style yogurt","½ tsp Dijon mustard","1 small garlic clove, finely grated","1 tbsp finely chopped dill","2 tbsp liquid from the quick-pickled cucumbers (see above)"]','["Combine the vinegar, sugar, turmeric, dill and ½ tsp sea salt in a medium non-reactive bowl,whiskingto dissolve the sugar and salt. Add the cucumber slices, mix well and leave to pickle for 10 mins. Check the cucumber slices are still submerged, and if not, weigh down with a plate. Leave to continue pickling for a further 30 mins.","Toast the seeds in a dry, heavy-based pan over a medium heat for 4-5 mins, shuffling the pan often until the seeds begin to colour and pop. Add the sugar, then stir, turn off the heat, pour in the soy sauce, mix well and pour out onto a large plate to cool. Break up any clumps using a fork and store in an airtight container until needed.Will keep for up to a week.Combine all the dressing ingredients in a bowl or jug, and season well.","Arrange the lettuce wedges in a serving bowl and spoon over half the dressing. Scatter over the pickled cucumbers, then spoon over the rest of the dressing and the seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:16:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5631,5631,'en','Healthy ragu','Use carrots, peas and passata to stretch a pack of mince in this wholesome and healthier sauce that provides three of your five-a-day. Enjoy with jacket potatoes','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 large onions (320g), halved or quartered, then sliced","3 large garlic cloves , finely grated","500g 5% fat steak mince","500g carton passata","3 carrots (320g), finely chopped","1 tbsp thyme leaves","1 tbsp vegetable bouillon powder","½ tsp ground white pepper","200g frozen peas","4 jacket potatoes , to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan over a medium-low heat and fry the onions for 10 mins, stirring occasionally until golden. Stir in the garlic, then add the mince and cook, breaking it up with a wooden spoon as you do, for a few minutes more until browned.","Add the passata, carrots, thyme, bouillon powder and pepper, then cover and cook over a low heat for 25-30 mins, stirring occasionally until the meat is cooked and veg is tender. Add a splash of water to loosen, if you like, then stir in the peas and cook for 5-7 mins more until tender. Serve hot over jacket potatoes.Once completely cool, the mince sauce will keep frozen for up to three months. Defrost in the fridge overnight and reheat until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:16:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5633,5633,'en','Spaghetti with tomatoes & walnuts','Serve up a bowl of spaghetti with aubergine, tomatoes, capers and walnuts for a fibre-rich, healthy and filling lunch that’s part of our Healthy Diet Plan','["350g wholemeal spaghetti","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 aubergines (about 550g), each sliced into 4 lengthways, then cut into cubes","4 large garlic cloves, finely chopped","3 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","250ml vegetable stock, made with 1 tbsp bouillon powder (vegan, if needed)","330g cherry tomatoes, halved","30g pack of basil, chopped","1 tbsp capers","50g walnut pieces, lightly toasted and chopped if large"]','["Cook the spaghetti following pack instructions, then drain, reserving 150ml of the cooking water. Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large non-stick pan over a medium heat. Add the aubergine and garlic, stir well, then cover and cook for 8-10 mins, stirring a few times.","Mix in the tomato purée and vinegar, and cook for 2-3 mins more. Pour in the stock, then cover and cook for a further 10-15 mins until the aubergine is tender when pierced with a knife.","Add the cherry tomatoes and cook for a few minutes more until softened but still holding their shape. Stir in the basil, capers and walnuts, then toss through the spaghetti, adding a little of the reserved pasta water if needed to loosen. Serve half straightaway. Keep the remainder for another day.Will keep covered and chilled for up to four days. Reheat in a pan over a low heat with a splash of water until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:16:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5635,5635,'en','Chicken koftas with hummus & salad','Enjoy chicken koftas with hummus and salad for a healthy lunch. The tahini in the hummus is made from sesame seeds, which are thought to have anti-inflammatory properties','["500g chicken mince (5% fat)","1 egg","3 tbsp oats","1 tsp dried oregano","1 lemon, zested","2 tsp ground coriander","½ tsp ground cumin","2 tbsp chopped parsley (taken from the 30g in the salad ingredients, below)","½ tsp rapeseed oil, for frying","2 x 400g cans chickpea, drained (liquid reserved)","2 tbsp tahini","1 lemon, juiced (about 3 tbsp)","1 garlic clove","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 large red onions, halved and thinly sliced","1 lemon, juiced","30g chopped parsley","200g cucumber, cut into chunks","4 tomatoes, cut into wedges"]','["Using your hands, combine all of the ingredients for the kofta, except the oil. Set aside.","Tip all the hummus ingredients into a bowl, along with 3 tbsp of the chickpea liquid, then blitz with ahand blenderuntil smooth. If you prefer a looser texture, add more of the chickpea liquid and blend again.","For the salad, tip the onions into a bowl with the lemon juice and scrunch using your hands to help soften them. Add the chopped parsley and set aside.","Shape the koftas into 16 balls. Heat the rapeseed oil in a largenon-stick frying panover a medium heat and fry the koftas for 5 mins on each side until browned and cooked through. To finish on a barbecue, cook until they just hold their shape, then thread onto skewers. Cook for 4 mins on each side on the barbecue.Uncooked koftas will keep chilled in an airtight container for a day.","Divide half of the hummus between two plates. Mix half the quick-pickled onions with half of the cucumbers and tomatoes, then serve the salad with the koftas and hummus. Chill the remaining portions for another day.Will keep covered and chilled for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:16:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5637,5637,'en','Black bean soup with chunky raita','Rustle up this spice-rich soup and hearty raita for a tasty and speedy lunch. It’s also healthy, delivering four of your 5-a-day','["1-1½ tsp cumin seeds","2 tsp smoked paprika","2 tsp ground coriander","4 x 400g cans black beans","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp vegetable bouillon powder","3 large garlic cloves, finely grated","2 small avocados, chopped","200g cherry tomatoes, quartered, smaller ones halved","2 spring onions, finely chopped","2 tbsp lemon juice","2 x 120g pots bio yogurt","15g coriander, chopped, plus extra to serve"]','["Toast the cumin seeds briefly in a largesaucepanover a medium heat. Spoon in the paprika and coriander, then tip in  2½ cans of beans along with their liquid, the tomatoes, tomato purée, bouillon, garlic and 500ml water. Cover and leave to simmer for 15 mins.","Meanwhile, stir the ingredients for the raita together in a bowl.","Blitz the cooked beans using ahand blenderuntil completely smooth, then stir in the remaining beans and return to the boil. Serve half and top with half the raita, a chopped avocado and some extra coriander. Leave the remaining soup to cool, then chill for another day.Will keep chilled for four days; the raita will keep for two days. Reheat the soup in a pan over a low-medium heat until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:16:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5639,5639,'en','Healthy meatloaf with spaghetti sauce','Achieve three of your five-a-day with this veg-packed meatloaf in a sauce inspired by classic Italian ragu. This will soon become a family favourite','["2 tsp rapeseed oil, plus extra for the dish","320g carrots, finely chopped","2 celery sticks (about 135g), finely chopped","1 onion (about 125g), finely chopped","500g lean 5% fat pork mince","1 egg","25g porridge oats","1 tbsp smoked paprika, plus 1 tsp","30g basil, leaves and stems separated","1½ tsp vegetable bouillon powder","3 large garlic cloves, finely grated","500ml passata","40g mature cheddar, grated","350g wholemeal spaghetti"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the oil in a large non-sticksaucepanover a medium heat and cook the carrots, celery and onion, covered, for 10 mins until soft and starting to caramelise. Stir halfway through to prevent burning.","Meanwhile, tip the pork into a bowl with the egg, oats and 1 tbsp smoked paprika. Chop the basil stems and most of the leaves, leaving a few whole. Add the chopped stems and half the chopped leaves to the mixture, along with ½ tsp bouillon. Season with black pepper, then mix with your hands to fully combine. Tip in half the cooked veg, cool for about a minute, then work the veg into the mixture. Shape into a loaf (about 21 x 7cm), then lift into a shallow, lightly oiled baking dish. Brush the top with a little oil as well. Bake for 25 mins until firm.","For the sauce, add the garlic to the remaining veg. Return to a medium heat and cook for 1 min. Stir in the rest of the paprika and bouillon, along with the passata and 100ml water. Cover and simmer for 10 mins. Stir in the remaining chopped basil.","Remove the loaf from the oven and pour over the sauce. Scatter over the cheese, then bake for 10 mins more. Meanwhile, cook the spaghetti following pack instructions. Serve the spaghetti in bowls, topped with the slices of the loaf, a few spoonfuls of sauce and the whole basil leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:16:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5641,5641,'en','Sardine tomato pasta with gremolata','Enjoy our crowd-pleasing pasta with sardines and gremolata. With added nutrients thanks to the sardines, it’s a healthy dish that’s low on calories and fat','["75g wholemeal spaghetti","1⁄2 x 120g can sardines in oil","½ tbsp capers, drained","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tomatoes, roughly chopped","30g rocket","½ lemon, zested","small handful of parsley, finely chopped"]','["Cook the pasta following pack instructions in a large pan of boiling salted water. Heat 1 tbsp oil from the can of sardines in a non-stick frying pan over a medium heat and sizzle the capers and half the garlic for 1-2 mins until fragrant. Tip in the tomatoes and fry for 4-5 mins more until softened and bursting. Stir in the sardines and rocket, tossing a few times to break up the fish and wilt the leaves. Season.","For the gremolata, combine the lemon zest, parsley and remaining garlic in a small bowl, and season. Drain the pasta and top with the sardine sauce and gremolata."]','2026-01-10 12:16:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5643,5643,'en','Ratatouille','Enjoy this super-healthy traditional ratatouille recipe for lunch or dinner, safe in the knowledge that it counts as four of your five-a-day','["2 large aubergines","4 small courgettes","2 red or yellow peppers","4 large ripe tomatoes","5 tbsp olive oil","supermarket pack or small bunch basil","1 medium onion, peeled and thinly sliced","3 garlic cloves, peeled and crushed","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 tsp sugar (any kind)"]','["Cut 2 large aubergines in half lengthways. Place them on theboard, cut side down,slice in halflengthways again and then across into 1.5cm chunks. Cut the ends off 4 small courgettes, then across into 1.5cm slices.","Peel2 red or yellow peppers from stalk to bottom. Hold upright, cut around the stalk, then cut into 3 pieces. Cut away any membrane, then chop into bite-size chunks.","Score a small cross on the base of each of 4 large ripe tomatoes, then put them into a heatproof bowl. Pourboiling waterover, leave for 20 secs, then remove. Pour the water away, replace the tomatoes and cover with cold water. Leave to cool, then peel the skin away.","Quarter the tomatoes, scrape away the seeds with a spoon, then roughly chop the flesh.","Set asauté panover medium heat and when hot, pour in 2 tbsp olive oil. Brown the aubergines for 5 mins on each side until the pieces are soft. Set them aside.","Fry the courgettes in another tbsp oil for 5 mins, until golden on both sides. Repeat with the peppers. Don’t overcook the vegetables at this stage.","Tear up the leaves from the bunch of basil and set aside. Cook 1 thinly sliced medium onion in the pan for 5 minutes. Add 3 crushedgarliccloves and fry for a further minute. Stir in 1 tbsp red wine vinegar and 1 tsp sugar, then tip in the tomatoes and half the basil.","Return the vegetables to the pan with some salt and pepper and cook for 5 mins. Serve with basil."]','2026-01-10 12:16:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5645,5645,'en','Lentil & tuna salad','Throw together this easy, no-cook lentil and tuna salad for a speedy and healthy lunch or supper. It takes just 15 minutes to make – ideal for busy days','["2 tbsp sherry vinegar","1 tsp Dijon mustard","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","50ml olive oil","2 x 250g pouches ready-cooked puy lentils","2 x 160g cans tuna steaks in spring water, drained and flaked","160g cherry tomatoes, halved (about 10)","2 ready-roasted peppers, chopped","handful of parsley, finely chopped","½ small bunch of chives, finely chopped, plus extra to garnish"]','["Whiskthe vinegar, mustard and garlic together in a small bowl. Slowly drizzle in the oil, whisking as you go, until emulsified, then season to taste.","Add the lentils, tuna, tomatoes, peppers and herbs to a large bowl and toss together. Pour over the dressing and toss again. Divide between four bowls and garnish with the remaining chives."]','2026-01-10 12:16:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5647,5647,'en','Hot smoked salmon grain bowl with dill yogurt','Enjoy this quick and easy smoked salmon grain bowl with beetroot, radish and cucumber. Pull it together in just 20 minutes and top with dill yogurt','["3 tbsp white wine vinegar","½ tsp caster sugar","80g cucumber, thinly sliced","4 radishes, thinly sliced","2 x 250g pouches ready-cooked quinoa","1 lemon, juiced","200g natural yogurt","1 tbsp dill, finely chopped, plus extra to garnish","4 hot smoked salmon fillets, skin removed","3 ready-cooked beetroot in natural juices, sliced into thin wedges"]','["Combine the vinegar and sugar with a pinch of salt in a bowl. Add the cucumber and radishes, toss to combine and set aside.","Add the quinoa to another large bowl. Reserve 1 tsp of the lemon juice and pour the rest over the quinoa. Season lightly and toss to combine. Add the yogurt and chopped dill to a small bowl along with the 1 tsp lemon juice and combine. Season.","Divide the quinoa between four shallow bowls and top with the salmon, beetroot and pickled vegetables. Drizzle over the yogurt and garnish with the remaining dill."]','2026-01-10 12:16:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5649,5649,'en','Open Greek-style salad sandwiches','Enjoy these open Greek-style salad sandwiches with feta, olives and tomatoes for lunch or a snack. They’re perfect for summertime al fresco dining','["125g feta","120g thick natural yogurt","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","2 medium tomatoes, seeds removed, finely chopped","200g cucumber, finely chopped","10 pitted black olives, roughly chopped","½ red onion, thinly sliced","1 tbsp finely chopped mint, plus extra leaves to garnish","½ lemon, juiced","8 thick sourdough slices"]','["Put the feta, yogurt and garlic in amini food processor. Blend until thick and smooth, then season with a grinding of black pepper.","Toss the tomatoes, cucumber, olives, red onion and mint in a large bowl with the lemon juice. Season to taste.","Spread the whipped feta onto the sourdough slices and pile each with the salad. Garnish with the remaining mint leaves and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5651,5651,'en','Sweet potato tacos','Shake up your midweek meals with these colourful veggie tacos. Omit the feta and soured cream to make them vegan, or use a plant-based alternative','["1 red onion, sliced","3 limes, juiced","4 sweet potatoes, peeled and cubed","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp hot smoked paprika","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","400g can of black beans, drained and rinsed","2 ripe avocados, mashed","2 large ripe tomatoes, deseeded and cubed","8 small flour tortillas","50g feta, crumbled (optional)","soured cream and torn coriander to serve (optional)"]','["Put the onion in a bowl with two thirds of the lime juice and a tsp of salt. Leave to pickle for an hour.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. On a large, flat baking tray toss together the sweet potatoes, oil, spices and some seasoning. Roast for 30-35 mins, turning halfway through, until golden and crispy. Once cooked, toss with the black beans.","Mix the avocado and tomatoes with the remaining lime juice and a pinch of salt. Warm up the tortillas and pile on the sweet potatoes and beans. Top with the avocado, tomatoes and pickled red onion, and crumbled feta, soured cream and coriander, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:16:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5653,5653,'en','Pizza beans on toast','Bring together two beloved dishes, beans on toast and pizza, in this hybrid lunchtime treat – the whole family will enjoy it','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tsp dried oregano","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp tomato purée","400g can cannellini beans, drained","4 large slices sourdough bread or any bread of your choice","125g mozzarella ball, torn","sliced pepperoni or ham, to serve (optional)","small handful of basil leaves, torn, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a small saucepan over a low heat and fry the onion with a pinch of salt for 10 mins, or until softened. Add the garlic and oregano and fry for 1 min more. Stir in the tomatoes, tomato purée and ½ tsp sugar, plus some seasoning. Bring to a simmer and cook, uncovered, for 10 mins, stirring often. After 10 mins, blitz everything together with a hand blender. Tip in the beans and simmer for 5 mins more.","Heat the grill to high. Arrange the bread slices in a single layer on a baking tray and grill on one side until lightly toasted. Flip over and top each piece of toast with the bean mixture, pieces of mozzarella and slices of pepperoni or ham, if using. Slide under the hot grill for 3 mins, or until the cheese has melted and is lightly golden in spots. Scatter with basil leaves before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:16:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5655,5655,'en','Spicy beef taco bowl','Get all five of your five-a-day in this Mexican-inspired spicy beef taco bowl. Full of textures and flavours, it can be partly prepped ahead','["1 tsp olive oil","1 large red pepper, deseeded and finely diced","500g 5% fat beef mince","1 tbsp chipotle paste","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","200g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","20g coriander, stalks chopped, leaves reserved","2 red onions, thinly sliced","2 limes, juiced","2 x 250g pouches cooked microwave wholemeal basmati rice","400g can black beans, drained","200g cherry tomatoes, halved","198g can sweetcorn (salt- and sugar-free)","2 small avocados, sliced"]','["Heat the oil in anon-stick panand fry the pepper for 5 mins until starting to soften. Add the beef, chipotle paste and spices, and cook, stirring, to break down the meat for a few minutes. Stir in the tomatoes, tomato purée, coriander stalks, 150ml water and some seasoning, then cover. Leave to simmer for 20 mins to cook through and reduce a little.Will keep chilled for up to three days, or frozen for up to three months. Defrost thoroughly and reheat until piping hot.","Meanwhile, toss the onions in the lime juice in a bowl and set aside to pickle.","When the mince is ready, warm the rice following pack instructions.","Tip the cooked rice into four serving bowls, then add the beef and top each one with a quarter of the black beans, cherry tomatoes and corn, half an avocado (fan out the slices, if you like), and the coriander leaves. Spoon the pickled onions on top along with any lime juice."]','2026-01-10 12:16:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5657,5657,'en','Panuozzo sandwich','Make your own baguettes and pesto to make these pizza-inspired sandwiches for the whole family. They’re surprisingly quick and easy to make and are great for lunch or a light dinner','["300g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","3g (about half a sachet) fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tomato, halved and sliced","4 slices cooked ham","150g mozzarella ball, sliced and seasoned","small handful of rocket (optional)","6 tbsp pesto (see below for the recipe)","1 tbsp olive oil"]','["Put the flour in a large bowl, then stir in the yeast and a large pinch of salt. Make a well in the centre, pour in 175ml warm water and the oil and bring together with a wooden spoon to make a soft, fairly wet dough. Turn out onto a lightly floured surface and knead for 5-8 mins until smooth. Divide the dough into four balls and arrange on a floured tray, well spaced apart. Cover with a tea towel and set aside for about 40 mins-1 hr until doubled in size.","Heat the oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 8 and put abaking trayin the oven to heat up. Roll the dough balls out on a floured surface into long baguette sticks about 22-25cm long, place on the hot tray and bake for 10-12 mins until puffed up and golden, then leave to cool. Can be made a few hours ahead of baking.","To assemble, split the bread down one side and neatly layer in the tomato, ham, mozzarella and rocket, if using. Mix thepestowith the olive oil, drizzle over, halve and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5659,5659,'en','Brussels sprouts grain bowl','Use up your leftover Brussels sprouts from the Christmas dinner table with this easy grain bowl, with squash, hummus and tahini flavours','["½ butternut squash (about 300g), peeled and chopped into 2cm cubes","1 tbsp olive oil","170g brussels sprouts, halved","1 tbsp tahini","2 tsp maple syrup","1 lemon, zested and juiced","50g pumpkin seeds","200g pouch cooked grains (we used quinoa)","2 tbsp hummus","handful of soft herbs (coriander, parsley, mint or dill, or a mixture), roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the squash in half the oil on one end of abaking tray. Season. Roast for 20 mins, stirring halfway. Add the sprouts to the other end of the tray, drizzle with the rest of the oil, season and roast for 15 mins more until the squash is tender and the sprouts crisp.","Mix the tahini, maple syrup, lemon juice and zest together in a small bowl to make a dressing, adding a drizzle of water to loosen if it’s too thick. Toast the pumpkin seeds in a dry frying pan over a low heat until they start to pop.","Heat the grains following pack instructions, then divide between two bowls. Top with the roasted veg, the hummus, pumpkin seeds and herbs. Drizzle with the dressing and toss everything together just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:16:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5661,5661,'en','Grilled paneer wraps (kathi paneer rolls)','Enjoy these omelette-coated chapati rolls as a snack or treat at Diwali. They’re spread with coriander relish and stuffed with paneer seasoned with mango','["300g paneer","150ml full-fat Greek yogurt","30g ginger, peeled and finely grated","6 garlic cloves, crushed","¼ tsp carom seeds (ajwain; optional)","¼ tsp ground turmeric","¾ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","1 tsp garam masala","1 tsp mango powder (amchoor)","1 lime, juiced","3-4 tbsp sunflower oil","1 small red onion, finely sliced","1 carrot, coarsely grated","1 green chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 lime, juiced","2 tsp caster sugar","1 tbsp shredded mint leaves","6-8 tbsp sunflower oil or melted ghee","8 chapatis","4 eggs, lightly beaten","coriander relish, to serve (see ''Goes well with'', below)"]','["Tip the paneer into a heatproof bowl, cover with boiling water from the kettle and leave to soak for 10 mins to soften it. Drain and discard the water, then cut the cheese into three 2cm rectangles.","Mix the yogurt with the ginger, garlic, carom seeds (if using), turmeric, chilli powder, garam masala, mango powder and lime juice. Gently mix the spiced yogurt with the paneer and leave to marinate at room temperature for 30 mins. For the salad, combine the sliced onion with the grated carrot, green chilli, lime juice, sugar and mint. Set aside.","Heat the oil in a heavy-based frying pan over a medium heat and fry the paneer for 3-4 mins until softened, turning the pieces over occasionally with a fish slice. Remove from the heat, cover with a lid and set aside.","For the bread, heat agriddleor heavy-based frying pan over a medium heat and add 1 tsp oil or ghee. Put a chapati on the griddle and spoon over 1-2 tbsp of the beaten egg. Drizzle another 1 tsp oil or ghee around the edge of the bread and, using a fish slice, quickly flip the chapati over so the eggy side is facing downwards. Some of the egg will spill out as you turn it and can be scraped back under the chapati as it cooks. Cook for a minute, then remove the chapati from the pan and cook the remaining chapatis in the same way. Stack the bread, omelette-side up, and loosely wrap in foil to keep warm.","Arrange the omelette-chapatis on the counter and spread some coriander relish generously over the egg. Arrange four or five pieces of paneer in a row down the centre of each chapati and top with 1 tbsp of the salad. Roll the ‘roti’ around the filling and serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:16:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5663,5663,'en','Sweet potato & corn cakes with tamarind bacon & avocado','Enjoy golden, Jamaican-inspired sweet potato and corn cakes with sticky, sweet bacon and crushed avocado with chilli','["2 sweet potatoes (500g)","1 potato (325g)","2 ripe avocados, peeled and stoned","4 spring onions, thinly sliced","¼-½ scotch bonnet chilli, finely chopped (optional)","1 lime, juiced","2 corn cobs (or 300g drained canned sweetcorn)","100g cassava flour","1 tsp tamarind extract","½ tsp honey","8 slices thick-cut bacon","100ml vegetable oil","8 tbsp soured cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Prick the sweet potatoes and potato with a knife and roast them until soft – about 45 mins-1 hr for the potato and 40-50 mins for the sweet potato, turning them halfway through. Remove from the oven, leave until cool enough to handle, then scoop the potato flesh out of the skins and lightly mash together but not so it’s smooth – keep it chunky.","While the potatoes are cooking, scoop the avocado into a bowl and mash lightly. Add half of the spring onions, the scotch bonnet, if using, the lime juice and a pinch each of salt and pepper. Keep chilled until ready to serve.","If using fresh corn, slice the kernels from the cob and boil in a pan of salted water for 3 mins. Rinse with cold water to cool. Add the sweetcorn to the potato mix, with the remaining spring onions and some salt and pepper. Gently mix, then take a handful the size of a tomato. Roll on your worktop, then flatten slightly until it is about 1-inch thick. Repeat until all the mixture is used up, you should have around 12-14 cakes. Put the cassava flour in a shallow bowl and gently drop the cakes in, one by one, then roll lightly to coat with the flour.","Mix the tamarind and honey with 1 tbsp warm water until fully dissolved. Warm afrying panover a medium heat and add the bacon. After 1 minute, brush the tamarind mixture over the top side and turn, brushing the other side with a little more of the mixture. At first it will look as though the bacon is boiling, but keep adding the mixture and turning two more times, and it will start to caramelise. Once nicely browned on both sides, remove from the pan and keep warm.","Put the oil in a non-stick frying pan, enough so the oil will come halfway up the cakes. Heat over a medium-high heat and fry the cakes for 3-4 mins each side until golden brown. Drain on kitchen paper and keep warm while you cook the remaining cakes. To serve, pile two or three cakes onto each plate alongside some mashed avocado and put two slices of bacon on top. Serve 2 tbsp each of the soured cream on the side, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5665,5665,'en','Chorizo & purple sprouting broccoli carbonara','Throw together this seasonal take on carbonara in 30 minutes for an easy midweek meal. This is comfort food at its best','["2 large garlic cloves","200g chorizo, chopped","3 large eggs, plus 2 egg yolks (freeze the whites for another recipe)","120g parmesan, finely grated","400g spaghetti","250g purple sprouting broccoli, cut into small pieces"]','["Heat a largefrying panover a medium heat. Peel the whole garlic cloves and fry them along with the chorizo for 5-7 mins, or until the chorizo turns crisp at the edges. (You won’t need any oil as the chorizo will release its own.) Scoop out the garlic with a slotted spoon and discard.","Whiskthe eggs and egg yolks in a bowl. Add the parmesan, a pinch of salt and some black pepper.","Cook the spaghetti in a large pan of boiling salted water for 5 mins, then add the broccoli and cook for a further 2 mins. Drain, reserving some of the pasta cooking water. Add the spaghetti and broccoli to the frying pan with the chorizo, then quickly pour over the egg mixture and toss quickly to coat. Add a splash or two of the reserved cooking water to loosen, if needed, then serve in four shallow bowls."]','2026-01-10 12:16:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5667,5667,'en','Chimichurri-style steak sarnies & cheat’s spicy fries','Elevate a steak sandwich with a punchy, zingy chimichurri sauce, chipotle mayo and spicy Cajun-style fries on the side.','["2 x 200g rump steaks, fat removed","2 long ciabatta rolls","2 handfuls of rocket","30ml sunflower oil","270g shop-bought frozen fries","Cajun spice mix","70g mayonnaise","1 tsp chipotle chilli paste","½ lime, zested and juiced","1 banana shallot, peeled and roughly chopped","1 red chilli, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","1½ tbsp sherry vinegar","small bunch of parsley","small bunch of coriander","50ml extra virgin olive oil"]','["Heat the oven to its highest setting. For the fries, pour the sunflower oil into abaking trayand put in the oven for 15 mins to get hot. Reduce the temperature to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Tip the fries into the oil, turn to coat, and cook for 20 mins. Add the Cajun spice mix and return to the oven for 15 mins until golden and crisp.","Meanwhile, make the mayo by mixing all the ingredients together in a bowl. Set aside.","For the chimichurri-style sauce,blitzall the ingredients together until you have a smooth sauce, then season to taste. Set aside.","Heat agriddle panover a high heat. Rub the steaks with salt only (pepper will catch and burn), put the steaks in the pan and cook for 3 mins on each side (for medium). Remove from the pan, cover with foil and leave to rest for 10 mins.","Halve the ciabatta rolls, toast in the same griddle pan that you cooked the steak in, cut-side down, and spread one half of each with the chipotle mayo. Slice the steak into strips, divide between the ciabattas, drizzle over the chimichurri and add a little rocket. Serve with the fries and any leftover mayo."]','2026-01-10 12:16:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5669,5669,'en','Orecchiette with purple sprouting broccoli & Calabrian pesto','Whip up some homemade pesto and serve with orecchiette and broccoli. This one isn’t just good with pasta – you can also serve it with chicken or fish, and spoon it onto warm focaccia','["400g purple sprouting broccoli","5 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","375g orecchiette or other pasta shapes","grated parmesan or pecorino (or vegetarian alternative), to serve","3 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","½ small red onion, chopped","1 plum tomato, chopped","75g aubergine, cut into small chunks","125g roasted peppers from a jar, drained","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 red chilli, halved, deseeded and chopped (leave the seeds in if you want a more fiery pesto)","40g blanched almonds, lightly toasted in a dry pan","60g ricotta","10g basil or parsley leaves"]','["First, make the base of the pesto. Heat 1 tbsp of the olive oil in a frying pan and add the onion, tomato and aubergine. Fry over a medium-low heat for 8-10 mins until the onion is pale gold and the tomatoes and aubergine are soft. Add the peppers and cook for a couple of minutes, then add the garlic and chilli, and cook for another 2 mins. Transfer to a plate and leave to cool.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Trim the broccoli at the base, then halve any large pieces lengthways. Put in aroasting tin, drizzle with the olive oil and season. Add the garlic and turn everything using your hands – make sure the garlic is under the broccoli so it will toast without burning. Cook in the oven for 15-20 mins (check on it during cooking for doneness).","Meanwhile, cook the pasta in boiling salted water until al dente. It usually takes a little less time than it says on the packet.","For the pesto, tip everything on the plate into afood processoralong with the almonds and the remaining 2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil. Season and pulse to blend everything together. Stir in the ricotta and taste for seasoning. Tear the basil and stir that in too.","Drain the pasta and toss it with the broccoli (including the garlicky juices from the roasting tin) then use as much of the pesto as it takes to coat the pasta and serve the rest on the side. Grind over some black pepper and serve immediately with the grated cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:16:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5671,5671,'en','Cacio e pepe','Whip up a simple cacio e pepe for a speedy lunch. With four simple ingredients – spaghetti, pepper, parmesan and butter – this is a storecupboard favourite','["200g bucatini or spaghetti","25g butter","2 tsp whole black peppercorns, ground, or 1 tsp freshly ground black pepper","50g pecorino or parmesan, finely grated"]','["Cook the pasta for 2 mins less than pack instructions state, in salted boiling water. Meanwhile, melt the butter in a mediumfrying panover a low heat, then add the ground black pepper and toast for a few minutes.","Drain the pasta, keeping 200ml of the pasta water. Tip the pasta and 100ml of the pasta water into the pan with the butter and pepper. Toss briefly, then scatter over the parmesan evenly, but don’t stir – wait for the cheese to melt for 30 seconds, then once melted, toss everything well, and stir together. This prevents the cheese from clumping or going stringy and makes a smooth, shiny sauce. Add a splash more pasta water if you need to, to loosen the sauce and coat the pasta. Serve immediately with a good grating of black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:16:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5673,5673,'en','Ackee & saltfish','Cook a traditional Jamaican dish, ackee and salted cod, for a hearty brunch. With peppers, tomato and garlic alongside the ackee fruit, it’s full of flavour','["600g boneless salted cod","2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 medium onion, finely chopped","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","3 spring onions, thinly sliced","1 scotch bonnet pepper, deseeded and finely chopped","1 tsp dried thyme","1 tsp ground pimento (allspice)","½ red pepper, deseeded and finely chopped","½ green pepper, deseeded and finely chopped","1 large tomato, chopped","2 x 540g cans ackee, drained"]','["Put the salt cod in apanand cover with cold water. Bring to the boil, then boil for 5 mins, drain and add fresh cold water to cover.","Repeat this process until you''re happy with the saltiness when tasted; we recommend to boil the fish three times in total for a perfect balance of salt in the fish. Drain and leave to cool. Use a fork to shred the salted cod into pieces and set aside.","Now you''ll need a large frying pan. Pour the vegetable oil into the frying pan and place over a high heat. Once the oil is sizzling hot, turn the heat down to low-medium. Add the onion, garlic, spring onions and scotch bonnet, then cook until soft, for around 5-7 mins.","Next, add in the red and green peppers, along with your tomato. Mix together and cook for 2-3 mins to soften the peppers a little. These ingredients help to bring a heat balance, so it''s not too spicy."]','2026-01-10 12:16:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5675,5675,'en','Creamy carrot soup','Make a comforting starter or lunch in no time with our creamy carrot soup, topped with garlicky seeded croutons. Quick and easy, it takes 30 minutes to make','["1½ tbsp oil","1 onion, sliced","1 celery stick, sliced","3 garlic cloves, 2 crushed and 1 left whole","1 kg carrots, thinly sliced","1.5 litre hot veg or chicken stock","½ small bunch of thyme","2 thick slices sourdough","1 tbsp mixed seeds","1 tbsp chopped parsley","1½ tbsp double cream, plus extra to serve (optional)"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large saucepan orcasserole pot. Fry the onion and celery gently for 5 mins. Add the crushed garlic and cook for 1 min more. Tip in the carrots, stock and thyme, then season and bring to the boil. Lower to a simmer and cook, covered, for 25 mins until the carrots are softened.","Meanwhile, heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Rub the whole garlic clove over both sides of the sourdough. Tear it into rough chunks and toss with the remaining oil, a good pinch of salt and the seeds. Spread out on a baking sheet and bake for 8-10 mins until golden and crisp. Mix with the chopped parsley and set aside.","Remove the thyme from the pan and discard. Blitz the soup with ahand blenderuntil smooth. Stir though the cream and season to taste. To serve, ladle the soup into four bowls, top with the croutons and drizzle over a little extra cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5677,5677,'en','Crab & cucumber crumpets','Spruce up crumpets with a creamy crab, cucumber and dill topping. It’s ready in 15 minutes, making it ideal for a Christmas starter or light lunch','["½ cucumber, peeled, halved, deseeded and cut into thin strips","150-200g picked crabmeat (all white meat, or a mix of white and brown, if you like)","1 tbsp crème fraîche","squeeze of lemon juice","1 tsp chopped dill","4 crumpets"]','["Tip the cucumber into acolander, sprinkle with salt and leave to drain for 10 mins.","Tip the crabmeat into a bowl with the crème fraîche and lemon juice. Season. Squeeze the strips of cucumber to remove any excess water, then mix with the dill. Toast the crumpets, then top with the crab mixture, a small tangle of cucumber strips and a few extra dill sprigs."]','2026-01-10 12:16:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5680,5680,'en','Turkey tikka masala','Crave spice after the traditional Christmas lunch? Want to turn your leftover turkey into a whole new dish? This tasty turkey tikka masala is for you','["sunflower oil","onion, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed or finely grated","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely grated","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp ground coriander","½ tsp paprika","½ tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp garam masala","1 tbsp tomato purée","400g can passata or chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp mango chutney","100ml double cream","2 tbsp natural yogurt (optional)","about 600g leftover roast turkey, cut into large chunks","chopped coriander, toasted flaked almonds, steamed rice and garlic naan breads, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in acasserole dishor shallow pan over a medium heat, and fry the onions for 10-12 mins until golden. Stir in the garlic, ginger, chilli and all the spices, and cook for 2 mins more until the mixture resembles a paste. Stir in the tomato purée, passata or chopped tomatoes and mango chutney, and bring to a simmer. Cook for a further 10 mins.","Stir in most of the cream and the yogurt, if using, and return the mixture to a simmer. Add the turkey and continue to simmer until the turkey is piping hot. Remove from the heat, drizzle over the remaining cream and stir through briefly. Scatter over some coriander and flaked almonds, and serve with the rice and naan breads on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5682,5682,'en','Smoky chickpea soup with herbs and yogurt','Add a flavoured stock pot to give a subtle kick to this smoky chickpea soup. Whether for lunch or supper, it’s a dish the whole family will enjoy','["2 tbsp olive oil","½ onion, finely chopped","1 carrot, finely chopped","½ red pepper, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 Knorr Smoked Chilli & Tomato Stock Pot","400g can chickpeas, drained","4 tbsp yogurt","small bunch of coriander or mint"]','["Heat the oil in asaucepanand fry the onion, carrot and pepper over a low heat for 5 mins or until softened, but not browned. Add the garlic and fry for 30 seconds more.","Tip in the tomatoes, then fill the can with water and pour into the pan, too. Add the Knorr Smoked Chilli & Tomato Stock Pot and 500ml more water. Bring to a simmer and cook for 10 mins. If you would like a less textured soup, blend the soup with astick blenderuntil smooth.","Stir in the chickpeas, crushing some of them with a potato masher, then cook for another 10 mins. To serve, ladle into four bowls, swirl through some yogurt and scatter the coriander or mint on top."]','2026-01-10 12:16:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5684,5684,'en','Bloody mary seafood salad','Serve this bloody mary seafood salad as a starter or light lunch. You can vary the seafood if you like. Scallops and prawns add sweetness, but you could use mussels, squid or even oysters.','["2 tbsp oil","1 garlic clove, peeled and crushed","180g small scallops, or large scallops, cut into slices","250g raw peeled prawns (see tip)","200ml fresh tomato juice","1-2 tbsp Lee Kum Kee Premium Oyster Sauce","1 tsp Lee Kum Kee Premium Light Soy Sauce","1 tsp Lee Kum Kee Seasoned Rice Vinegar","½ lemon, juiced","1 celery stick, finely chopped","1 small avocado, cut into cubes","handful of coriander, chopped"]','["Heat 1 tbsp oil in awok, then turn up the heat and add the garlic and scallops. Stir-fry for 30 seconds to 1 min until the scallops are just cooked. Tip onto a plate. Heat the remaining oil and stir-fry the prawns for 1-2 mins over a high heat until they turn pink, then season with some black pepper. Tip onto the plate with the scallops. Allow the seafood to cool completely.","To make the bloody mary sauce, mix the tomato juice with the Premium Oyster Sauce (use 2 tbsp for a stronger flavour), Premium Light Soy Sauce, Seasoned Rice Vinegar and lemon juice. Taste and adjust the flavour with more of the ingredients if you want an even stronger flavour.","When the seafood is cool, divide it between four glasses or small bowls, keeping 4 prawns for garnish. Add the celery and avocado to each glass and pour over the tomato mixture. Leave to marinade for 10 mins, or cover and chill for up to 4 hrs. Garnish each glass with the reserved prawns and some coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:16:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5686,5686,'en','Pork with cucumber & apricot couscous','Try this flavour-packed pork dish with couscous for dinner. It’s healthy, full of nutrients and contains four of your 5-a-day','["30g fresh coriander","4 small garlic cloves, chopped","2 tsp sumac","1 tbsp olive oil","400g pork fillet","1½ tsp smoked paprika","drop of olive oil, for roasting","2 red onions, halved and sliced","1 aubergine, cut into 1cm cubes","200g wholemeal giant couscous","small bunch of spring onions (about 100g), sliced","½ large cucumber (about 320g), chopped","1 lemon, zested plus 2 tbsp juice","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","15g mint, leaves chopped","8 fresh apricots (about 320g)","25g toasted flaked almonds"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Put the coriander in a small bowl with the garlic, sumac, oil and 2 tbsp water, then blitz using ahand blenderuntil smooth. Rub a quarter of it all over the pork, then put the pork on a large baking tray and sprinkle over the paprika.","For the couscous, rub a drop of oil over the red onions and aubergine, then scatter around the pork. (If your tray isn’t large enough, use two.) Roast for 25 mins. Check the pork and if it isn’t cooked but the vegetables are, take the vegetables out of the oven and cook the pork for another 10-15 mins until the juices run clear.","Meanwhile, cook the couscous following pack instructions, then drain and tip into a bowl with the remaining garlicky herb mixture. Add the spring onions, cucumber, lemon zest and juice, extra virgin olive oil and mint. Quarter and stone the apricots. If ripe, add the apricots to the salad bowl, but if a little firm, add them to the tray in the oven first to cook for 10 mins until softened.","Set the pork aside to rest. Add the roasted red onions, aubergine, apricots and almonds to the couscous and toss everything together. Slice the pork, serve half with half the couscous, and chill the rest for another day to eat cold.Will keep chilled for two to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:16:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5690,5690,'en','Balsamic beef stew with veggie mash','Get all five of your five-a-day in this tasty balsamic beef stew accompanied by the ideal comfort food – a veggie mash – perfect for chilly weather','["1 tbsp olive or rapeseed oil","2 large onions, (325g), halved and sliced","600g diced lean stewing beef","2 garlic cloves, chopped","10g dried porcini mushrooms","2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","1 tsp English mustard powder","320g carrots, finely chopped","200g large chestnut mushrooms, quartered","few fresh thyme sprigs","4 x 80g portions broccoli, cut into florets","750g swede, cut into chunks","500g potatoes, cut into small chunks"]','["Heat the oven to 170C/150C fan/ gas 3. Heat the oil in a heavy-based ovenproofcasserole, then fry the onions for about 8 mins, stirring, until golden. Add the beef and garlic, and stir-fry over a high heat until browned all over.","Pour 500ml boiling water over the dried mushrooms in a bowl to briefly hydrate, then pour into the casserole with the liquid, and stir in the balsamic vinegar, tomato purée, bouillon and mustard. Pile in the carrots, chestnut mushrooms, thyme and some seasoning. Cover, then put in the oven for 3 hrs until the meat is tender. Towards the end of cooking, add a splash of water if the stew is looking dry.","When the stew is nearly ready, make the mash. Boil the swede and potatoes together for 12-15 mins in a pan over a medium heat. Drain well, then mash with a grating of black pepper. Steam or boil half the broccoli for 5 mins until tender. 4 Serve half the stew with the cooked broccoli. The remaining stew will keep chilled for up to three days and frozen for up a month. Defrost thoroughly before reheating. Reheat the stew and mash in themicrowaveand steam or boil the remaining broccoli on the night to help preserve the vitamins."]','2026-01-10 12:16:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5692,5692,'en','Tuna, caper & chilli spaghetti','Throw together tuna, capers and rocket with garlic, chilli and spaghetti to make this easy and healthy supper. It takes just 25 minutes to make','["150g spaghetti or linguine","1 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped, plus extra to serve (optional)","1 tbsp drained capers","small bunch of parsley, finely chopped (stalks included)","145g tuna in spring water, drained","90g rocket or baby spinach leaves","½ lemon, juiced","150g spaghetti or linguine","1 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped, plus extra to serve (optional)","1 tbsp drained capers","small bunch of parsley, finely chopped (stalks included)","145g tuna in spring water, drained","90g rocket or baby spinach leaves","½ lemon, juiced"]','["Cook the spaghetti for 9-11 mins in a large pan of well-salted water until al dente.","Heat the oil in a widefrying panover a very low heat, and gently cook the garlic and chilli to infuse the oil. Remove from the heat if the garlic is turning past light golden, as this will make it bitter.","Drain the pasta, keeping a cupful of the cooking water, and tip the spaghetti into the frying pan. Toss the pasta in the oil over a low heat, adding a little of the pasta water to emulsify into a sauce that coats the pasta, then fold in the capers, parsley, tuna and some seasoning. Don’t stir too vigorously – you want to keep larger chunks of tuna. Toss the rocket and lemon juice through the spaghetti, and serve with extra chilli scattered over, if you like.","Cook the spaghetti for 9-11 mins in a large pan of well-salted water until al dente.","Heat the oil in a widefrying panover a very low heat, and gently cook the garlic and chilli to infuse the oil. Remove from the heat if the garlic is turning past light golden, as this will make it bitter.","Drain the pasta, keeping a cupful of the cooking water, and tip the spaghetti into the frying pan. Toss the pasta in the oil over a low heat, adding a little of the pasta water to emulsify into a sauce that coats the pasta, then fold in the capers, parsley, tuna and some seasoning. Don’t stir too vigorously – you want to keep larger chunks of tuna. Toss the rocket and lemon juice through the spaghetti, and serve with extra chilli scattered over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5694,5694,'en','Whole truffle roast celeriac with cheese sauce & hazelnuts','Try this sensational whole truffle roast celeriac with creamy cheese sauce and hazelnuts. It makes a fantastic alternative vegetarian Christmas lunch or Sunday roast','["1 large celeriac","2 tbsp truffle oil, plus extra for drizzling","3 garlic cloves, sliced","½ small bunch of sage, leaves picked","30g hazelnuts, toasted and chopped","40g butter","40g plain flour","350ml whole milk","100g vegetarian Italian-style hard cheese, grated","50ml double cream"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Layer a large sheet of baking parchment over a large sheet of foil, then put the celeriac in the centre. Rub all over with the truffle oil, then season well. Scatter over the garlic and sage leaves, then bring the edges of the parchment and foil up, scrunching together to seal make a parcel. Put in aroasting tinand roast for 2 hrs, or until tender and golden. Baste halfway through with an extra drizzle of truffle oil, if you like.","Meanwhile, make the sauce. Melt the butter in a saucepan until foaming, then add the flour and stir until smooth. Cook for 2 mins, then whisk in the milk, a little at a time, until fully incorporated and smooth and creamy.Whiskin the cheese and cream, then season to taste.","Cut the roasted celeriac into four wedges. Spoon over the cheese sauce and scatter with the hazelnuts."]','2026-01-10 12:16:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5696,5696,'en','Falafel lunchbox','Make this falafel salad fun with a bento-style lunchbox. It’s great for toddlers and young children who prefer lunches with lots of individual elements. Use shop-bought falafel or make our Edamame falafel','["250g pouch cooked grains or lentils (we used red & white quinoa)","handful of baby spinach","¼ cucumber, chopped","handful of cherry tomatoes, halved","2 carrots, grated","1 pomegranate, seeds only","10 olives (optional)","12 falafel","4 tbsp hummus","drizzle of olive oil (optional)","½ lemon, quartered"]','["Divide the grains between the lunchboxes. Top each one with the vegetables, falafel, a spoonful of hummus and a drizzle of oil, if using, or divide the ingredients between the compartments of a bento-style lunchbox. Put a lemon in each box for squeezing over just before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:16:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5698,5698,'en','Lime prawn cocktail pitta salad','Make this speedy lime prawn cocktail salad as a filling lunch that packs a flavour-punch. It''s tasty, healthy and low in calories','["½ wholemeal pitta","½ tbsp rapeseed oil","1 tsp Tabasco","1 tsp low-sugar, low-salt ketchup","1 tbsp low-fat mayonnaise","1 tbsp fat-free natural yogurt","½ lime, zested and juiced, plus wedges to serve","60g cooked king prawns","1 Little Gem lettuce, leaves separated","¼ small cucumber, peeled into ribbons","4 cherry tomatoes, halved"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Slice the pitta into triangles, put on a baking sheet and drizzle over the oil. Bake for 10-15 mins until golden and crisp.","Mix together the Tabasco, ketchup, mayo, yogurt and lime zest and juice. Toss the prawns in the dressing.","Layer the lettuce, cucumber, tomatoes and dressed prawns in a lunchbox or jar. Season, top with the pitta chips and serve with lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:16:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5700,5700,'en','Wasabi chicken rice salad','Use leftover chicken to make this easy rice bowl for lunch. With a punchy wasabi, lime and yogurt dressing, it''s full of flavour and healthy too','["70g frozen edamame","½ tsp wasabi paste","2 tbsp fat-free natural yogurt","1 lime, juiced","1 tbsp sesame oil","70g cooked rice","3 radishes, quartered","1 tsp sesame seeds","1 cooked boneless, skinless chicken breast, sliced","¼ sheet dried seaweed, sliced into strips"]','["Put the edamame in a heatproof bowl and cover with boiling water. Leave for 10 mins, then drain. Mix the wasabi paste with the yogurt, lime juice and sesame oil.","Toss the rice with the edamame and radishes. Top with the sesame seeds, chicken and seaweed, then drizzle over the dressing to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5702,5702,'en','Caesar pitta','Pack a pitta with chicken, salad and homemade Caesar dressing for an easy lunch. It takes just 10 minutes from prep to plate and it''s healthy too','["1 tsp lemon juice","½ small garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp fat-free Greek yogurt","1 tbsp lighter mayonnaise","¼ tsp mustard powder","1 brown anchovy, rinsed and finely chopped","½ tbsp grated parmesan","1 small skinless cooked chicken breast, or 80g cooked chicken, shredded","¼ small cucumber, cubed","3 cherry tomatoes, halved","4 Little Gem lettuce leaves, shredded","1 wholemeal pitta bread"]','["Whisk the lemon juice, garlic, yogurt, mayonnaise, mustard powder, anchovy, parmesan and 2-3 tbsp water together with a good grinding of black pepper. Toss in the chicken, cucumber, tomatoes and lettuce, until everything is well coated. Toast the pitta and split, then stuff with the salad and chicken mixture."]','2026-01-10 12:16:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5704,5704,'en','Charred veg & tuna niçoise with creamy kefir dressing','Serve this filling, low-calorie salad on days when you need a quick midday meal. It makes an ideal lunch, as it''s packed with protein to keep you going through the afternoon','["100g green beans, trimmed","6 spring onions, trimmed","2 tsp rapeseed oil","100g cherry tomatoes, halved","4 tsp kefir or fat-free natural yogurt","1 tsp mustard powder","1 tsp red wine vinegar","2 Little Gem lettuce, leaves separated","160g can tuna in spring water, drained","4 black olives, halved","2 medium eggs, softly boiled and halved"]','["Heat the grill to high. Bring a small pan of water to the boil and blanch the green beans and spring onions for 4 mins. Drain and dry well. Toss with 1 tsp oil, and transfer to a baking tray with the tomatoes, cut-side up. Season everything with black pepper, then grill for 10 mins until starting to soften and char. Leave to cool slightly.","Meanwhile, whisk the kefir, 1 tsp oil, mustard powder, vinegar and some seasoning together until smooth. Arrange the lettuce leaves, tuna, olives and eggs in shallow bowls or on plates. Pile on the onions, green beans and tomatoes, then drizzle over the dressing to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5706,5706,'en','Prawn & grain poke bowls','Quickly marinate prawns in a chilli & lime dressing, then serve with grains, mango, radish, avocado and spring onions. This poke bowl is the ultimate summer salad','["3 limes, juiced","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","2 tbsp sesame oil","150g cooked king prawns","250g pouch mixed grains (or 250g cooked mixed grains)","1 ripe avocado, stoned and cubed","6 radishes, sliced","100g mango, peeled and diced","3 spring onions, sliced","pinch sesame seeds, to serve (optional)"]','["Whisk the lime juice, chilli and oil together in a bowl. Season, add the prawns and leave to marinate for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, tip the grains into a sieve and pour over hot water from the kettle to slightly soften them. Drain well.","Divide the grains between two bowls. Top with the marinated prawns, avocado, radishes, mango and spring onions. Drizzle over any leftover marinade and serve the poke bowls with a sprinkle of sesame seeds, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5708,5708,'en','Chilled green soup with feta','Serve this chilled green soup as part of a summer menu. No cooking is required – simply whizz up the ingredients to make a refreshing, nutrient-packed meal','["70g vegetarian feta, crumbled","3 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp coriander seeds, crushed","1 large red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 lemon, zested and juiced","200g baby spinach","2 large ripe avocados, stoned and cubed","1 large cucumber, chopped","1 small garlic clove, crushed","250g natural yogurt","small bunch basil","2 tbsp toasted mixed seeds, to serve"]','["Put the feta in a bowl and pour over the olive oil, coriander seeds, chilli and lemon zest. Set aside.","Tip the remaining ingredients (except the seeds) into a food processor and blitz until smooth. Season. Add 50-100ml cold water and blitz again to loosen. Chill for up to 1 hr.","Pour into four bowls and top with the feta, marinating liquid and seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:16:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5710,5710,'en','Wholemeal wraps with minty pea hummus & beetroot','This quick lunch option contains 3 of your 5-a-day and makes great fuel for exercise. Homemade wraps are easy to make and are much tastier than shop-bought.','["85g wholemeal self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp rapeseed oil","160g frozen peas, defrosted","1 lemon, ½  juiced, the other ½  cut into wedges (optional)","4 tbsp bio yogurt","1 large garlic clove","handful mint leaves","2 handfuls baby leaf salad","1 small red onion, finely sliced","2 large ready-cooked beetroots (160g), sliced","30g feta, crumbled","20g walnuts, chopped"]','["For the wraps, tip the flour into a small bowl and roughly rub in the oil. Add 60ml warm water and bring together with your hands to make a soft dough. Cut in half, then roll out each piece on a floured surface as thinly as you can to make a round that will cover the base of a large frying pan. Heat the frying pan, then cook the wraps for about 2 mins each side – there''s no need for extra oil. Take care not to make them crisp as they need to remain pliable.","For the filling, blitz the peas, lemon juice, 2 tbsp yogurt, garlic and most of the mint using a food processor or hand blender to make a thick purée. Spread over the wraps, then pile on the salad leaves, onion and beetroot. Dollop on the remaining yogurt and scatter over the feta, walnuts and remaining mint. Serve with lemon wedges for squeezing over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5712,5712,'en','Scandi beetroot & salmon pasta','Eat well at work with this easy-to-prepare Scandinavian-inspired beetroot and salmon fusilli salad. It''ll keep you going through the afternoon','["50g wholemeal fusilli","1 cooked beetroot, cut into wedges","½ small ripe avocado, cubed","2 baby cucumbers, sliced","2 tbsp chopped dill","1 tbsp fat-free Greek yogurt mixed with 1 tbsp water","1 heaped tsp creamed horseradish","50g poached salmon, flaked","30g rocket"]','["Cook the fusilli following pack instructions, then drain and leave to cool. Toss the pasta with the beetroot, avocado, cucumber, dill, yogurt and horseradish, then season generously with black pepper.","Gently mix the salmon and rocket through the pasta, then tip into your lunchbox or an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:16:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5714,5714,'en','Kisir','Enjoy this bulgur wheat salad as a vegan main, or a side dish to serve with a leg of lamb, chops or roasted aubergine','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 small, sliced red onion","2 garlic cloves, very finely chopped","2 tsp ground cumin","1 red chilli, halved, deseeded and cut into fine shreds","1 green chilli, halved, deseeded and cut into fine shreds","1¾  tbsp tomato purée","250g bulgur wheat","4 plum tomatoes, chopped","15g walnuts, roughly chopped","pomegranate seeds from ½  pomegranate (about 60g)","30g bunch flat-leaf parsley, finely chopped","big handful mint leaves, torn","1 large lemon, juiced","85ml extra virgin olive oil","1¾  tbsp pomegranate molasses"]','["Heat the oil in a medium sized saucepan and sauté the onion to just take off the raw edge. Add the garlic and cook for another 30 secs or so. Add the cumin and chillies and cook for another 1 min. Stir in the tomato purée and 175ml boiling water. Add the bulgur, season, stir everything together, remove from the heat, cover and leave to sit for about 15 mins. The water should have been absorbed.","Fork the grains to separate and aerate them, then add the tomatoes, walnuts, pomegranate seeds and herbs and fork them through. Mix the lemon juice, extra virgin olive oil and pomegranate molasses in a small bowl. Add three quarters of this, then taste to see if it needs any more (if it seems well flavoured and moist enough, then leave it).","The kisir can sit at room temperature for a few hours, or covered in the fridge – but let it come to room temperature before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:16:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5716,5716,'en','Sweet potato & cauliflower lentil bowl','Whip up this zingy vegan bowl in advance and keep in the fridge for quick, satisfying lunches on demand. Each bowlful boasts four of your 5-a-day','["1 large sweet potato, skin left on, scrubbed and cut into medium chunks","1 cauliflower, cut into large florets, stalk diced","1 tbsp garam masala","3 tbsp groundnut oil","2 garlic cloves","200g Puy lentils","thumb-sized piece ginger, grated","1 tsp Dijon mustard","1½ limes, juiced","2 carrots","¼ red cabbage","½  small pack coriander"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the sweet potato and cauliflower with the garam masala, half the oil and some seasoning. Spread out on a large roasting tray. Add the garlic and roast for 30-35 mins until cooked.","Meanwhile, put the lentils in a saucepan with 400ml cold water. Bring to the boil, then simmer for 20-25 mins until the lentils are cooked but still have some bite. Drain.","Remove the garlic cloves from the tray and squish them with the blade of your knife. Put the garlic in a large bowl with the remaining oil, ginger, mustard, a pinch of sugar and one-third of the lime juice. Whisk, then tip in the warm lentils, stir and season to taste. Coarsely grate the carrots, shred the cabbage and roughly chop the coriander. Squeeze over the remaining lime juice and season to taste.","Divide the lentil mixture between four bowls (or four containers if saving and chilling). Top each serving with a quarter of the carrot slaw and a quarter of the sweet potato and cauliflower mix."]','2026-01-10 12:16:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5718,5718,'en','Linguine with avocado, tomato & lime','Use guacamole ingredients to make this low-calorie vegan linguine which can also be served cold as a pasta salad. It delivers on flavour and it''s healthy','["115g wholemeal linguine","1 lime, zested and juiced","1 avocado, stoned, peeled, and chopped","2 large ripe tomatoes, chopped","½  pack fresh coriander, chopped","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped (optional)"]','["Cook the pasta according to pack instructions – about 10 mins. Meanwhile, put the lime juice and zest in a medium bowl with the avocado, tomatoes, coriander, onion and chilli, if using, and mix well.","Drain the pasta, toss into the bowl and mix well. Serve straight away while still warm, or cold."]','2026-01-10 12:16:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5720,5720,'en','Artichoke & aubergine rice','As well as being tasty, this aubergine and artichoke is low fat, low calorie and cost effective. Make a large batch and eat it cold the next day','["60ml olive oil","2 aubergines, cut into chunks","1 large onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","small pack parsley, leaves picked, stalks finely chopped","2 tsp smoked paprika","2 tsp turmeric","400g paella rice","1½ l Kallo vegetable stock","2 x 175g packs chargrilled artichokes","2 lemons 1 juiced, 1 cut into wedges to serve"]','["Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in a large non-stick frying pan or paella pan. Fry the aubergines until nicely coloured on all sides (add another tbsp of oil if the aubergine begins catching too much), then remove and set aside. Add another tbsp of oil to the pan and lightly fry the onion for 2-3 mins or until softened. Add the garlic and parsley stalks, cook for a few mins more, then stir in the spices and rice until everything is well coated. Heat for 2 mins, add half the stock and cook, uncovered, over a medium heat for 20 mins, stirring occasionally to prevent it from sticking.","Nestle the aubergine and artichokes into the mixture, pour over the rest of the stock and cook for 20 mins more or until the rice is cooked through. Chop the parsley leaves, stir through with the lemon juice and season well. Bring the whole pan to the table and spoon into bowls, with the lemon wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5722,5722,'en','Cobb salad with buttermilk ranch dressing','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyGet three of your five-a-day from this chicken and bacon salad, which can be adapted to use leftover turkey and is packed with protein and vitamins','["2 Baby Gem lettuces, leaves separated","1 avocado, stoned and sliced","2 plum tomatoes, chopped","3 rashers cooked crispy bacon","140g/5oz cooked turkey breast or chicken, cut into bite-sized pieces","2 hard-boiled eggs, chopped into chunks","75ml buttermilk","2 tbsp light mayonnaise","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","1 tbsp chopped dill","½ garlic clove, crushed"]','["In a small bowl, whisk the dressing\r\ningredients together with some salt.\r\nArrange the salad ingredients separately\r\non 2 plates or a platter, and serve with\r\nthe dressing on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5724,5724,'en','Cannellini bean & egg salad with crispy crumbs','This healthy salad has lots of textures – soft beans, crunchy breadcrumbs, creamy egg and crispy Little Gem lettuce','["2 medium eggs","8 spring onions, trimmed (remove the root and half of the dark green part)","1½  tbsp olive oil","1 slice wholemeal bread, broken into chunky breadcrumbs","400g can cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","juice ½ lemon","1 tsp Dijon mustard","½ small red onion, finely chopped","handful parsley, roughly chopped","1 Little Gem lettuce, roughly chopped"]','["Cook the eggs in boiling water\r\nfor 6 mins, or longer if you prefer them\r\nhard-boiled. Add the spring onions for\r\nthe final 3 mins of cooking. Remove and\r\nrun both under cold water. When cool\r\nenough to handle, pat the spring onions\r\ndry and peel the eggs.","Meanwhile, heat ½ tbsp of the oil in a\r\nnon-stick frying pan. Tip in breadcrumbs\r\nand season. Fry for 3-4 mins until crisp\r\nand golden, then set aside.","Toss the spring onions with the beans,\r\nlemon juice, mustard, red onion, parsley,\r\nremaining oil and lettuce. Season and\r\narrange halved boiled eggs on top. Sprinkle\r\nwith the crumbs and eat straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:16:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5726,5726,'en','Vitality chicken salad with avocado dressing','A super-green, healthy mix of soya beans, cucumber, avocado and Little Gem lettuce – topped with lean shredded chicken breast','["handful frozen soya beans","1 skinless cooked chicken breast, shredded","¼ cucumber, peeled, deseeded and chopped","½ avocado, flesh scooped out","few drops Tabasco sauce","juice ½ lemon, plus a lemon wedge","2 tsp extra-virgin olive oil","5-6 Little Gem lettuce leaves","1 tsp mixed seed"]','["Blanch the soya beans for 3 mins. Rinse\r\nin cold water and drain thoroughly. Put the\r\nchicken, beans and cucumber in a bowl.","Blitz the avocado, Tabasco, lemon\r\njuice and oil in a food processor or\r\nwith a hand blender. Season, pour\r\ninto the bowl and mix well to coat.","Spoon the mixture into the lettuce\r\nleaves (or serve it alongside them)\r\nand sprinkle with the seeds. Chill until\r\nlunch, then serve with a lemon wedge."]','2026-01-10 12:16:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5728,5728,'en','Steak, roasted pepper & pearl barley salad','A vibrant salad packed with yellow and red peppers, colourful onion, beef cooked to your liking and healthy grains','["85g pearl barley, rinsed","1 red pepper, deseeded and cut into strips","1 yellow pepper, deseeded and cut into strips","1 red onion, cut into 8 wedges, leaving root intact","1 tbsp olive oil, plus a little extra","1 large lean steak, around 300g, trimmed of any excess fat","½ x 100g bag watercress, roughly chopped","juice ½ lemon, plus wedges to serve (optional)"]','["Put the pearl barley in a large pan\r\nof water. Bring to the boil and cook\r\nvigorously for 25-30 mins or until tender.\r\nDrain thoroughly and transfer to a bowl.","Meanwhile, heat oven to 200C/\r\n180C fan/gas 6. Put the peppers on\r\na baking tray with the onion wedges,\r\ntoss in 1 tbsp olive oil and roast for\r\nabout 20 mins until tender.","While the peppers are roasting, rub\r\nthe steak with a little bit of oil and\r\nseason. Cook in a non-stick frying pan\r\nfor 3-4 mins each side, or to your liking.\r\nSet aside to rest for a few mins. Mix the\r\ncooked peppers and onions into the\r\nbarley. Stir though the watercress, lemon\r\njuice and some seasoning. Thinly slice\r\nthe steaks, place on top of the salad and\r\nserve with lemon wedges, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5730,5730,'en','Spicy courgette pitta pockets','Treat yourself to a solo supper of grilled vegetables, served in bread pockets with tahini, hummus, broad beans and harissa','["1 courgette, trimmed and thinly sliced lengthways","2 tsp harissa paste","2 tsp olive oil","small handful broad beans (fresh or frozen)","2 tbsp houmous","1 spring onion, finely sliced","1 tsp tahini paste","small garlic clove, crushed","squeeze lemon juice","1 tbsp Greek-style yogurt","1 large wholemeal pitta bread"]','["Toss the courgette slices in the\r\nharissa and olive oil, and season.\r\nCook on a hot griddle pan for 2 mins\r\neach side or until tender. Transfer\r\nto a plate and set aside.","Cook the broad beans in boiling\r\nwater for 2 mins, drain under cold running water, then slip them out of\r\ntheir outer skins. Discard the skins.\r\nPut the broad beans, houmous and\r\nspring onion in a small bowl and\r\nmix to combine.","In another bowl, mix the tahini,\r\ngarlic, lemon juice and yogurt.\r\nToast the pitta and split it to create\r\n2 pockets. Spoon the houmous\r\nmix inside each pocket, followed\r\nby the spicy courgette slices and\r\na drizzle of the yogurt mixture."]','2026-01-10 12:16:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5732,5732,'en','Hot chickpeas with spinach & bacon','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyBored with the same old sandwich at lunchtime? Try this quick and easy low fat snack','["1 rasher lean back bacon","1 thinly sliced garlic clove","1 tbsp wine vinegar","2-3 tbsp canned chickpeas, drained and washed","½ bag baby leaf spinach"]','["Cut the bacon rasher into shreds and cook in a hot non-stick pan with the garlic clove. Stir in the wine vinegar and chickpeas. Toss in the baby leaf spinach, stirring until wilted. Season if you want to, then serve hot."]','2026-01-10 12:16:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5734,5734,'en','Minestrone in minutes','Whip up a hearty bowl of soup in next to no time, perfect for a quick lunch or warming supper','["1l hot vegetable stock","400g tin chopped tomatoes","100g thin spaghetti, broken into short lengths","350g frozen mixed vegetables","4 tbsp pesto","drizzle of olive oil","coarsely grated vegetarian parmesan-style cheese, to serve"]','["Bring the stock to the boil with the tomatoes, then add the spaghetti and cook for 6 mins or until done. A few minutes before the pasta is ready, add the vegetables and bring back to the boil. Simmer for 2 mins until everything is cooked.","Serve in bowls drizzled with pesto and oil,\r\nsprinkled with parmesan."]','2026-01-10 12:16:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5736,5736,'en','Butter bean & chilli tomato salad','Superhealthy, counts as 2 of 5-a-day','["540g jar large butter beans","500g tomatoes, peeled and cored","1 red chilli","bunch basil","1 garlic clove","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp red wine vinegar"]','["Drain and rinse the butter beans and place in a mixing bowl. Chop the tomatoes and add to the beans. Place the chilli, basil (reserving a few small leaves) garlic, olive oil and vinegar in the small bowl of a food processor then whizz until smooth. Add to the tomatoes and beans, season and mix. Serve scattered with a few small leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:16:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5738,5738,'en','Springtime minestrone','This simple soup makes the most of Spring veg and will become a favourite standby for a quick lunch or supper','["200g mixed green vegetables (we used asparagus, broad beans and spring onions)","700ml hot vegetable stock","140g cooked pasta (spaghetti works well, chopped into small pieces)","215g can butter beans, rinsed and drained","3 tbsp green pesto"]','["Place the green vegetables in a medium-size saucepan, then pour over the stock. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer until the vegetables are cooked through, about 3 mins. Stir in the cooked pasta, beans and 1 tbsp of pesto. Warm through, then ladle into bowls and top each with another drizzle of pesto."]','2026-01-10 12:16:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5740,5740,'en','Help-yourself tuna rice salad','Ideal for busy households, this hearty salad keeps well in the fridge for up to three days, ready to be spooned into a bowl whenever you''re peckish','["approx 900g/2lb cold cooked rice (about 400g/14oz uncooked rice)","400g tuna in springwater","200g frozen petits pois, defrosted under the hot tap","2 red peppers, peeled with a potato peeler, deseeded and diced","3 tomatoes, chopped into small chunks","5 spring onions, finely sliced","bunch flat-leaf parsley, chopped","large handful stoned green olives, roughly chopped (optional)","4 tbsp mayonnaise","juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil"]','["The cooked rice will have probably\r\nclumped together, so break it up in a\r\nlarge mixing bowl. Flake in the tuna,\r\nthen mix in the peas, peppers, tomatoes,\r\nspring onions, parsley and olives, if you’re\r\nusing them.","Stir through the mayonnaise, lemon\r\njuice and olive oil and season to taste.\r\nCover the bowl with cling film or place\r\nin a large plastic container and let your\r\nhousehold serve themselves whenever\r\nthey are hungry."]','2026-01-10 12:16:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5742,5742,'en','Green club sandwich','This healthy sandwich is packed full of goodness to keep you going until dinner','["3 slices wholegrain or rye toast","3 tbsp ready-made houmous","1 small avocado (100g), stoned and sliced","1 handful rocket leaves","8-12 cherry tomatoes, sliced"]','["Toast the bread and spread houmous\r\nevenly over one side of each slice. On\r\none slice of bread, lay half the avocado,\r\nrocket and tomato. Season with\r\npepper, then cover with another slice.","Pile on the rest of the avocado, rocket\r\nand tomato, season again and top with\r\nthe third slice."]','2026-01-10 12:16:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5748,5748,'en','Leek, cheese & potato pasties','Mini veggie pastry parcels with oozing cheese make a great value and comforting homemade snack','["2 small potatoes (about 300g/11oz), cut into 1cm cubes","knob of butter","2 small leeks, tough outer leaves removed, split in half lengthways and finely sliced","3 thyme sprigs, leaves chopped","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","2 tbsp cream","flour, for dusting","500g block shortcrust pastry","140g/ 5oz Welsh Caerphilly cheese, strong cheddar or vegetarian alternative, cut into small chunks","1 egg, beaten"]','["Cook the potatoes in boiling, salted\r\nwater for 5-8 mins until tender, but still\r\nholding their shape. Meanwhile, melt the\r\nbutter in a large saucepan. Add the leeks\r\nand thyme and soften for 10-12 mins.\r\nDrain potatoes and add to the leeks with\r\nthe mustard and plenty of seasoning. Stir\r\nin the cream and leave to cool a little.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nOn a floured surface, roll out the pastry\r\nto the thickness of a £1 coin. Use a side\r\nplate or a bowl as a template to cut\r\nout 6 x 15cm circles. Mix the cheese\r\nwith the leek mixture and pile a mound\r\nof the mix onto the centre of each pastry\r\ncircle. Brush around edges with a little\r\negg, then bring edges together and\r\ncrimp with your fingers to seal.","Place pasties on a baking tray\r\nlined with baking parchment, brush\r\nwith the remaining egg and bake\r\nfor 40-45 mins until golden brown.\r\nServe warm or leave to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:16:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5750,5750,'en','Courgette, potato & cheddar soup','This freezable soup is a delicious way to use up a glut of courgettes','["500g potatoes, unpeeled and roughly chopped","2 vegetable stock cubes","1kg courgettes, roughly chopped","bunch spring onion, sliced - save 1 for serving, if eating straight away","100g extra-mature cheddar or vegetarian alternative, grated, plus a little extra to serve","good grating fresh nutmeg, plus extra to serve"]','["Put the potatoes in a large pan with\r\njust enough water to cover them and\r\ncrumble in the stock cubes. Bring to the\r\nboil, then cover and cook for 5 mins. Add\r\nthe courgettes, put the lid back on and\r\ncook for 5 mins more. Throw in the spring\r\nonions, cover and cook for a final 5 mins.","Take off the heat, then stir in the\r\ncheese and season with the nutmeg, salt\r\nand pepper. Whizz to a thick soup, adding\r\nmore hot water until you get the\r\nconsistency you like. Serve scattered\r\nwith extra grated cheddar, spring onions\r\nand nutmeg or pepper. Or cool and\r\nfreeze in freezer bags or containers with\r\ngood lids for up to 3 months."]','2026-01-10 12:16:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5752,5752,'en','Prawn layered salad','Solo suppers can still be a treat with this fast but flavour-packed recipe','["1 egg","1 Baby Gem lettuce, shredded","195g can sweetcorn","1 carrot, coarsely grated","½ small cucumber, deseeded and diced","100g cooked prawns","2 tbsp extra-light mayonnaise","1 tbsp tomato ketchup","splash Tabasco sauce","lemon wedge, to serve (optional)"]','["Boil the egg in a small pan of boiling\r\nwater for 8 mins, drain and run under\r\ncold water until cool. Shell, then slice.","Layer the salad in a bowl starting with\r\nthe lettuce, then the sweetcorn, carrot,\r\ncucumber, egg and finish with the\r\nprawns. Mix the mayo and ketchup\r\nwith a dash of Tabasco, then pour\r\nover the top. Serve with a lemon\r\nwedge, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5756,5756,'en','Easy noodle soup','This quick and easy soup is the perfect lunchtime meal for kids – satisfying and healthy too','["500ml low salt vegetable stock (from a cube is fine)","small piece fresh root ginger, grated","1 garlic clove, grated","2 tsp soy sauce and 2 tsp sugar","85g leftover cooked chicken, shredded","handful mixed vegetables (try beansprouts, sweetcorn, sliced carrot and mangetout)","150g pack straight-to-wok noodles (or use 85g/3oz dried, cooked according to pack instructions)","2 spring onions, sliced, to serve","juice 1 lime"]','["Put stock, ginger, garlic, soy sauce and\r\nsugar in a saucepan, then heat. Simmer\r\nfor 5 mins. Take off the heat, pour into a\r\nmicrowave-safe bowl, then cool. Throw\r\nin chicken and veg, cover, then chill for\r\nup to a day.","When ready to eat, remove from\r\nfridge, then add the cooked noodles.\r\nMicrowave on High for 2 mins, stir,\r\nthen cook for 1 min more or until\r\npiping hot. Divide between two bowls\r\nor mugs, sprinkle with spring onions\r\nand add the lime juice."]','2026-01-10 12:16:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5758,5758,'en','Chorizo & tomato salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThe combination of sweet, acidic tomatoes with salty, spicy chorizo and tangy sherry vinegar is a match made in heaven','["3 ripe beef tomatoes, cut into wedges","½ red onion, thinly sliced","few thyme sprigs, leaves picked","1 tbsp sherry vinegar","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","100g chorizo, sliced on the diagonal"]','["Put the tomatoes in a bowl with the\r\nonion and thyme. Season, then drizzle\r\nwith the vinegar and oil. Let the flavours\r\nmingle while you cook the chorizo.","In a hot, dry pan, fry the chorizo slices\r\nuntil browned on both sides. Serve the\r\ntomatoes with the fried chorizo, drizzled\r\nwith a little oil from the pan."]','2026-01-10 12:16:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5760,5760,'en','Ham & beetroot salad bowl','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA great light lunchtime salad that uses everyday ingredients in a new and interesting way','["100g frozen peas","175g beetroot","2 spring onions, thinly sliced","2 tbsp Greek yogurt","2 tsp horseradish sauce","half iceberg lettuce, shredded","100g wafer-thin sliced ham"]','["Pour boiling water over the peas and\r\nleave for 2 mins, then drain well. Chop\r\nthe beetroot into cubes.","Tip the peas, beetroot and spring onions\r\ninto a bowl and mix well. Mix the yogurt and\r\nhorseradish, then add about 1 tbsp boiling\r\nwater to make a pouring sauce.","Pile the lettuce into bowls, then spoon\r\nover the beetroot mix. Thinly drizzle the\r\ndressing over the salad and top with ham."]','2026-01-10 12:16:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5762,5762,'en','Chipotle black bean soup with lime-pickled onions','Use storecupboard pulses in this healthy, Mexican-inspired soup – freshen it up with sweet onions, coriander and soured cream','["juice 2 limes","2 small red onions, thinly sliced","½  tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","½  tbsp ground cumin","½  tbsp smoked paprika","½  tbsp chipotle paste, or Tabasco, to taste","400g can black beans, drained and rinsed","400ml vegetable stock","half-fat soured cream, to serve","coriander leaves, to serve","crisp tortilla chips, to serve"]','["To make the lime-pickled onions,\r\ncombine ½ the lime juice and ½ the\r\nonions in a small bowl, and season.\r\nLeave to pickle for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in a\r\nsaucepan over a medium-high heat.\r\nAdd the garlic and remaining onions,\r\nand season. Cook for 8 mins or until the\r\nonions are translucent. Add the spices\r\nand chipotle purée, cook for 1 min, then\r\nadd the beans, stock and remaining\r\nlime juice. Simmer for 15 mins, then\r\npurée in a blender.","Pour the soup into a clean pan to\r\nreheat. Serve with a little of the drained\r\npickled onions, topped with a small\r\ndrizzle of soured cream and some\r\ncoriander, and the tortillas on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5764,5764,'en','Broad beans with tomatoes & anchovies','Gloriously colourful broad beans with tomatoes and anchovies, perfect with spring lamb','["1.3kg young broad beans in the pod (to give about 350g/12oz shelled beans)","3 tbsp olive oil","450g cherry tomatoes, halved","6 spring onions, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, sliced","4-6 anchovy fillets, chopped","2 tbsp chopped fresh marjoram or parsley"]','["Blanch the shelled beans in boiling water for 1 minute. Drain into a sieve and hold under running cold water to cool them down quickly. Drain again and peel off the outer hard skins – make a nick in the tops and pop the beans out.","Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan until very hot, add the tomatoes and sauté over a high heat until the juices begin to run and caramelise. Tip in the spring onions and garlic and cook over a medium heat for 1-2 minutes until the onions just begin to soften and the garlic begins to turn golden. Now add the beans and sauté for 1-2 minutes until heated through. Stir in the anchovies so they break up, season to taste with salt and freshly ground black pepper, then stir in the marjoram or parsley and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5766,5766,'en','Ready-to-go wraps','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyPerfect for kids and easy enough for them to make themselves, these handy wraps are great for the car journey','["4 tortillas wraps","8 small or 4 large slices ham","2 roasted peppers (from a jar is fine), roughly chopped","handful grated cheddar"]','["Lay out the tortillas on a flat surface. Place 1-2 slices of ham in the middle of each one. Sprinkle over some chopped pepper and cheese, leaving a 2cm edge at one end. Starting at the other end, roll up as tightly as you can. Wrap each tortilla in kitchen foil and twist the ends to seal. Will keep in the fridge for up to 3 days.","Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 3. Place the wraps in the oven (directly onto the oven rack is fine) and cook for 10-15 mins until the cheese starts to melt. Unwrap for the last 5 mins if you want the outside to be crisp. Peel off the foil before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:16:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5768,5768,'en','Spicy couscous salad','This can be made as a main-dish salad (great for lunchboxes) or as a side dish for roast lamb','["100g couscous","220g can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","100ml hot chicken stock","zest and juice 1 lemon","1 roasted red pepper, chopped","25g flaked toasted almonds","handful mint leaves, chopped","2 tbsp natural Greek yogurt","1 tsp harissa"]','["Tip the couscous and chickpeas into\r\na bowl and pour over the stock. Cover\r\nand leave for 5-10 mins until the\r\ncouscous has absorbed the stock. Allow\r\nto cool a little. Toss through the lemon\r\nzest and juice, pepper, almonds and mint.\r\nSpoon into a container, then top with\r\nthe yogurt and a drizzle of harissa."]','2026-01-10 12:16:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5770,5770,'en','Chargrilled vegetable salad','Serve these chargrilled vegetables with torn buffalo mozzarella, for a lovely starter or light supper','["2 red peppers","3 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 small garlic clove, crushed","1 red chilli, deseeded, finely chopped","1 aubergine, cut into 1cm rounds","2 red onions, sliced about 1½ cm thick but kept as whole slices","6 plump sundried tomatoes in oil, drained and torn into strips","handful black olives","large handful basil, roughly torn"]','["First, blacken the peppers all over –\r\ndo this directly over a flame, over hot\r\ncoals or under a hot grill. When completely blackened, put them in a bowl, cover\r\nwith a plate and leave to cool.","While the peppers are cooling, mix\r\nthe oil, vinegar, garlic and chilli in a large\r\nbowl. On a hot barbecue or griddle pan,\r\nchargrill the aubergine, courgette and\r\nonions in batches until they have defined\r\ngrill marks on both sides and are starting\r\nto soften. The time will depend on the\r\nintensity of your grill, so use your\r\njudgement – courgettes and red onions\r\nare fine still slightly crunchy but you want\r\nthe aubergine cooked all the way through.\r\nAs the vegetables are ready, put them\r\nstraight into the dressing to marinate,\r\nbreaking the onions up into rings.","When the peppers are cool enough\r\nto handle, peel, remove the stalk and\r\nscrape out the seeds. Cut into strips and\r\ntoss through the veg with any juice from\r\nthe bowl. Mix in the tomatoes, olives,\r\nbasil and seasoning. Drizzle with more\r\noil, if you like, and serve either on its\r\nown or with mozzarella or crumbled feta."]','2026-01-10 12:16:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5772,5772,'en','Storecupboard pasta salad','This pasta salad makes a quick and healthy lunch, or is perfect prepared ahead for a picnic or lunchbox','["2 tsp finely chopped red onion","1 tsp caper","1 tbsp pesto","2 tsp olive oil","185g can of tuna in spring water, drained","100g leftover pasta shapes","3 sundried tomatoes, chopped"]','["Mix the onion, capers, pesto and oil.\r\nFlake the tuna into a bowl with the pasta\r\nand tomatoes, then stir in the pesto mix."]','2026-01-10 12:16:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5774,5774,'en','Indian chickpea & vegetable soup','Healthy, flavour-packed and low-cost, this soup’s ideal for taking to work for lunch','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 large onion, chopped","1 tsp finely grated fresh root ginger","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 tbsp garam masala","850ml vegetable stock","2 large carrots, quartered lengthways and chopped","400g can chickpeas, drained","100g green beans, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a medium saucepan, then add\r\nthe onion, ginger and garlic. Fry for 2 mins,\r\nthen add the garam masala, give it 1 min\r\nmore, then add the stock and carrots. Simmer\r\nfor 10 mins, then add the chickpeas. Use a stick\r\nblender to whizz the soup a little. Stir in the\r\nbeans and simmer for 3 mins. Pack into a flask\r\nor, if you’ve got a microwave at work, chill and\r\nheat up for lunch. Great with naan bread."]','2026-01-10 12:16:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5776,5776,'en','Summer crunch salad','The crunchiness of green beans works particularly well in this salad','["200g pack small button mushrooms, finely sliced","juice 1 lemon","200g green beans, trimmed","handful soft green herbs, such as basil, chervil, parsley and tarragon","100g cherry tomatoes, quartered","3 tbsp olive oil","75g parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), shaved into large curls"]','["In a bowl, toss mushrooms with half  \r\nthe lemon juice and set aside – the lemon \r\njuice will soften the mushrooms. Blanch  \r\nthe beans in boiling salted water for 5-6 mins \r\nuntil they still have a crunch, but they are not \r\nsqueaky, then drain and cool in iced water.","Toss the beans and mushrooms together \r\nin a bowl with the herbs and season with \r\nsalt and pepper. Toss through the tomatoes, \r\nremaining lemon juice and the olive oil and \r\nscatter with Parmesan just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:16:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5778,5778,'en','Chicken bake with garlic croutons','Combine chicken, tomatoes, mozzarella and homemade garlic croutons to make this quick and easy one-pot. It’s ideal for busy days when you’re short on time','["4 skinless chicken breasts","2 tbsp olive oil","200g passata","250g cherry tomatoes","125g ball reduced-fat mozzarella, drained and sliced","3 thick slices of sourdough or bloomer, cut into 2cm cubes","2 garlic cloves, crushed","pinch of dried oregano","½ small bunch of basil, leaves picked","green salad, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Cut the chicken breasts in half, not going all the way through, and open them out like a book. Season well. Heat half the oil in an ovenproof frying pan or shallowcasserole(or a frying pan, then transfer to aroasting tin) and fry the chicken for 3 mins on each side until lightly golden.","Spoon the passata over the chicken, then nestle the cherry tomatoes in and around the dish. Lay the mozzarella slices over the top. Tip the cubes of bread into a bowl and toss with the remaining oil, the garlic and oregano. Scatter over the chicken and tomatoes. Transfer to the oven and bake for 15 mins until the cheese has melted and the chicken is cooked through. Scatter over the basil and serve with a green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:16:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5780,5780,'en','Sticky rib hot pot','Combine sticky ribs and a hot pot to make this fabulous family-sized casserole. It’s full of flavour, with pork ribs, sweet potato, red peppers and mangetout','["3 tbsp Lee Kum Kee Hoisin Sauce","2 tbsp Lee Kum Kee Premium Dark Soy Sauce","1tbsp Lee Kum Kee Seasoned Rice Vinegar","3 tbsp no-salt chicken stock or water (optional, see tip)","500-600g pork ribs, cut into individual ribs","2 tbsp cornflour","1 tbsp Lee Kum Kee Sesame Wok Oil","1 garlic clove, finely sliced","1 tbsp grated ginger","4 spring onions, cut into lengths, green tops finely sliced to serve","1 red pepper, cut into chunks","1 small sweet potato, cut into chunks","100g mangetout, cut into strips"]','["Combine the Hoisin Sauce, Premium Dark Soy Sauce, Seasoned Rice Vinegar and chicken stock or water in a bowl, then add the ribs. Leave to marinate for at least 30 mins – you can put the ribs in the fridge overnight, if you like.","Heat the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 3. Drain the ribs well (set aside any marinade) and toss in the cornflour. Heat the Sesame Wok Oil in awok, then add the ribs, garlic ginger and spring onion and fry until the ribs are golden, being careful not to burn the garlic. Season well. Add the remaining marinade along with 100ml water and bring to a boil. Tip the mixture into acasserole dish, then stir in the red pepper and sweet potato. Cover with a tight-fitting lid. Put a piece of parchment under the lid if it isn’t tight fitting – this will help seal in the steam.","Cook in the oven for 50 mins, then stir in the mangetout and cook for 10 mins more. Sprinkle over the remaining spring onion to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5782,5782,'en','Spicy meatballs with chilli black beans','Give your favourite meatballs a healthy makeover with this low fat, low calorie, low GI recipe with turkey mince, black beans and avocado','["1 red onion, halved and sliced","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 large yellow pepper, quartered, deseeded and diced","1 tsp ground cumin","2-3 tsp chipotle chilli paste","300ml reduced-salt chicken stock","400g can cherry tomatoes","400g can black beans or red kidney beans, drained","1 avocado, stoned, peeled and chopped","juice ½  lime","500g pack turkey breast mince","50g porridge oats","2 spring onions, finely chopped","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp coriander","small bunch coriander, chopped, stalks and leaves kept separate","1 tsp rapeseed oil"]','["First make the meatballs. Tip the mince into a bowl, add the oats, spring onions, spices and the coriander stalks, then lightly knead the ingredients together until well mixed. Shape into 12 ping-pong- sized balls. Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan, add the meatballs and cook, turning them frequently, until golden. Remove from the pan.","Tip the onion and garlic into the pan with the pepper and stir-fry until softened. Stir in the cumin and chilli paste, then pour in the stock. Return the meatballs to the pan and cook, covered, over a low heat for 10 mins. Stir in the tomatoes and beans, and cook, uncovered, for a few mins more. Toss the avocado chunks in the lime juice and serve the meatballs topped with the avocado and coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:16:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5784,5784,'en','Bombay lamb wraps','Spice up cheap frozen lamb mince with Indian flavours and pile onto flour wraps or chapatis for a healthy and filling dinner','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 large red onion, chopped","3 fat garlic cloves, crushed","200g frozen lamb mince","3 tbsp curry paste (we used tikka)","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 large potatoes, cut into 2cm/¾ in cubes","250g frozen peas","8 flour wraps or chapatis, warmed","140g natural yogurt"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the onion and cook for a few mins to soften. Add the garlic, stir for 1 min, then add the frozen mince. Cook until defrosted and nicely browned, then stir in the curry paste, tomatoes, potatoes and half a can of water. Season well, then cover with a lid and simmer for 20 mins or until the potatoes are nearly cooked.","Remove the lid and simmer for a further 10-15 mins until the liquid has reduced and the sauce clings to the potatoes and mince. Add the peas, stir through until defrosted, then serve with the warm wraps and yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:16:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5786,5786,'en','Creamy tomato, courgette & prawn pasta','This fast, fresh pasta sauce with cherry tomatoes, prawns and crème fraîche is ideal for a midweek supper, and it’s low-fat','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 fat garlic cloves, thinly sliced","2 large or 400g baby courgettes, sliced","400g orecchiette pasta, or any other small pasta shape","2 x 400g cans cherry tomatoes","good pinch of sugar","200g raw prawns, peeled","100g half-fat crème fraîche","small pack basil, leaves only, torn"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the garlic and sizzle for a few mins, then add the courgettes and cook for a few mins more until starting to soften. Cook the pasta following pack instructions.","Add the tomatoes, sugar and seasoning to the pan, stir and simmer, uncovered, for about 10 mins while the pasta cooks.","Add the prawns to the sauce and bubble until they just turn pink. Drain the pasta and add to the sauce with the crème fraîche. Simmer for another 1-2 mins, then add the basil and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5788,5788,'en','Spring chicken paella','Throw a new spin on the classic Spanish rice one-pot by adding fresh, green broad beans, dill, mint and parsley','["6 chicken thighs, skin-on","2 tbsp plain flour","3 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely sliced","400g paella rice","1 tsp sweet paprika","2 good pinches of saffron","zest and juice 2 lemons","1½ l chicken stock","200g fresh or frozen peas and broad beans (weight after podding and skinning)","½  small bunch dill, chopped","½  small bunch mint, chopped","½  small bunch parsley, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Season the chicken thighs well and then dust all over with the flour. Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a paella pan or large, deep frying pan. Fry the thighs until golden brown all over, then transfer to a shallow roasting tin and finish in the oven for 30-40 mins.","Add the remaining oil, onions and garlic, and fry very gently until soft, about 10-15 mins. Stir in the rice, paprika, saffron and lemon zest, then add the stock and simmer, stirring occasionally, for about 20 mins on a medium heat until the rice is nearly cooked.","Add the peas, broad beans and juice of 1 lemon until the rice is just cooked through, along with the veg. Stir through the herbs and as much of the remaining lemon juice as it needs, along with some seasoning. Tuck the chicken thighs back in and cover for 5 mins to let everything settle before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:16:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5790,5790,'en','Fruity lamb tagine','This succulent and superhealthy one-pot is guaranteed to satisfy a crowd – save time and make it up to two days ahead','["2 tbsp olive oil","500g lean diced lamb","1 large onion, roughly chopped","2 large carrots, quartered lengthways and cut into chunks","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tbsp ras-el-hanout spice mix (see tip, below)","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","200g dried apricots","600ml chicken stock","120g pack pomegranate seeds","2 large handfuls coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nHeat the oil in a casserole and brown\r\nthe lamb on all sides. Scoop the lamb\r\nout onto a plate, then add the onion\r\nand carrots and cook for 2-3 mins until\r\ngolden. Add the garlic and cook for 1 min\r\nmore. Stir in the spices and tomatoes,\r\nand season. Tip the lamb back in with\r\nthe chickpeas and apricots. Pour over the\r\nstock, stir and bring to a simmer. Cover\r\nthe dish and place in the oven for 1 hr.","If the lamb is still a little tough, give\r\nit 20 mins more until tender. When ready,\r\nleave it to rest so it’s not piping hot, then\r\nserve scattered with pomegranate and\r\nherbs, with couscous or rice alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:16:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5792,5792,'en','Honey mustard chicken pot with parsnips','For an easy, warming family casserole on a budget, this one-pot ticks all the boxes','["1 tbsp olive oil","8 bone-in chicken thighs, skin removed","2 onions, finely chopped","350g parsnips, cut into sticks","300ml vegetable stock","2 tbsp wholegrain mustard","2 tbsp clear honey","few thyme sprigs","flat-leaf parsley, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat half the oil in a large frying pan\r\nor shallow casserole with a lid. Brown\r\nthe chicken until golden, then set aside.\r\nHeat the remaining oil, then cook the\r\nonions for 5 mins until softened.","Nestle the thighs back amongst the\r\nonions and add the parnips. Mix the stock with the\r\nmustard and honey, then pour in. Scatter\r\nover the thyme, then bring to a simmer.\r\nCover, then cook for 30 mins (or longer,\r\nsee tip) until the chicken is tender, then\r\nseason. Serve with steamed greens."]','2026-01-10 12:16:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5794,5794,'en','Sardines with chickpeas, lemon & parsley','Sardines cooked on the barbie are a great summer treat – you can cook indoors too in a single pot','["50g plain flour","10 sardines, scaled and cleaned (8 if large)","zest 2 lemons","large bunch flat-leaf parsley, leaves only, roughly chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","3 tbsp olive oil","glass white wine (about 125ml)","2x 400g cans chickpeas or butterbeans, drained and rinsed","250g pack cherry tomatoes, halved"]','["Season the flour and scatter over a large plate.\r\nDip the sardines in the flour, one at a time.\r\nMix together the lemon zest, parsley and half\r\nof the chopped garlic and set aside.","Put a very large pan (a paella pan is\r\nideal or a large sturdy baking tray with\r\na lip) on top of the barbecue and heat\r\nuntil very hot. Add the oil, heat for a few\r\nseconds, then lay the floured sardines\r\nin the oil in one layer. Fry for 3 mins\r\nuntil the underside is golden, then turn\r\nover and fry for another 3 mins. Lift\r\nout of the pan and onto a plate.","Fry the remaining garlic (add another splash\r\nof oil if you need to) for 1 min until softened. Pour\r\nin the white wine, scrape any bits off the bottom\r\nof the pan with a wooden spoon and boil for\r\n1 min or until reduced by half.","Tip in the chickpeas or butter beans and\r\ntomatoes, then stir until heated through. Season\r\nwith plenty of pepper and salt to taste, then\r\nnestle the fish back into the pan. Take off the\r\nheat, sprinkle with the parsley mix and serve with\r\nplenty of crusty bread to mop up the juices."]','2026-01-10 12:16:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5796,5796,'en','Spanish rice & prawn one-pot','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA fast and easy meal filled with Mediterranean holiday flavours','["1 onion, sliced","1 red and 1 green pepper, deseeded and sliced","50g chorizo, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp olive oil","250g easy cook basmati rice (we used Tilda)","400g can chopped tomatoes","200g raw, peeled prawns, defrosted if frozen"]','["Boil the kettle. In a non-stick frying or\r\nshallow pan with a lid, fry the onion,\r\npeppers, chorizo and garlic in the oil over\r\na high heat for 3 mins. Stir in the rice and\r\nchopped tomatoes with 500ml boiling\r\nwater, cover, then cook over a high heat\r\nfor 12 mins.","Uncover, then stir – the rice should be\r\nalmost tender. Stir in the prawns, with a\r\nsplash more water if the rice is looking\r\ndry, then cook for another min until the\r\nprawns are just pink and rice tender."]','2026-01-10 12:16:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5798,5798,'en','Squash, chicken & couscous one-pot','Use up leftovers in this superhealthy one-pot, packed with vital nutrients','["2 tbsp harissa paste","1 tsp each ground cumin and ground coriander","2 red onions, halved and cut into thin wedges","2 skinless chicken breasts, cut into bite-sized chunks","1 small butternut squash, cut into 1cm chunks (no need to peel)","2 x 400g cans tomatoes","zest and juice 2 lemons","200g cherry tomatoes, halved","140g couscous","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Heat a large non-stick casserole\r\ndish or pan on the hob. Add the\r\nharissa, spices and onions, stir and\r\ncook gently for 10 mins until soft.\r\nAdd chicken and brown for 5-10 mins.\r\nAdd squash, stirring to combine,\r\nand a splash of water if it starts\r\nto stick. Cook for 5 mins more.","Tip canned tomatoes into the\r\npan with ½ can of water, cover\r\nand simmer for 20-30 mins. Add\r\nthe lemon zest and juice, cherry\r\ntomatoes, couscous and seasoning.\r\nCover and turn off the heat. Leave\r\non the hob for 10 mins, then stir\r\nthrough the coriander and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5800,5800,'en','Chicken & vegetable stew with wholemeal couscous','Make a superhealthy start to the week with this hearty and wholesome one-pot','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 skinless chicken breasts, cut into chunks","1 small onion, sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","pinch each paprika and saffron","50g baby sweetcorn, halved","50g asparagus tips","50g peas","50g cherry tomatoes, halved","150ml chicken stock","140g wholemeal couscous"]','["Heat the oil in a pan, cook the chicken\r\nfor 5-6 mins, then remove with a slotted\r\nspoon. Add onion and cook for 2-3 mins\r\nbefore adding the garlic, paprika, saffron,\r\nsweetcorn, asparagus, peas and tomatoes.\r\nCook for 2-3 mins more. Return the\r\nchicken to the pan, pour in the stock,\r\nthen cover and simmer for 15 mins.","Meanwhile, cook the couscous following\r\npack instructions. To serve, fluff the\r\ncouscous with a fork and divide between\r\n2 bowls before spooning over the stew."]','2026-01-10 12:16:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5802,5802,'en','One-pot chicken & chickpea pilau','A super-fast superhealthy meal – chicken and chickpea pilau made in just one pot','["1 tbsp olive oil","4 chicken thighs, skin removed and trimmed of fat","2 large leeks, thinly sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","400g can chickpeas in water, drained and rinsed","grated zest of 1 lemon","200g easy-cook brown rice","450ml chicken stock","1 head broccoli, broken into florets"]','["Heat a large, lidded frying pan or fl ameproof casserole and add the oil.\r\nFry the chicken thighs for 2 mins, turning halfway through cooking, until\r\nlightly coloured, then lift onto a plate. Add the leeks to the pan and stir-fry\r\nfor 3 mins, then add the garlic and tip in the chickpeas, most of the lemon\r\nzest and rice. Stir together until well mixed.","Nestle the chicken in the rice mix. Pour over the stock and season lightly.\r\nCover and cook on a low heat for 20 mins until the chicken is nearly cooked\r\nthrough and the rice has absorbed nearly all the liquid. Sit the broccoli on top\r\nof the rice, cover and continue to cook until the rice and broccoli are tender\r\nand the chicken cooked. Sprinkle with the remaining lemon zest to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5804,5804,'en','Korean rice pot','A one pot rice dish is a fab way to use up leftovers – this one combines healthy veg and turkey, topped with fried egg','["500ml/ 18 fl oz hot chicken stock","250g/ 9oz long grain rice","300g/ 11oz cooked turkey, diced","250g/ 9oz baby spinach","2 carrots, shredded","1 tsp toasted sesame oil","1 tsp toasted sesame seed","2 tbsp vegetable oil","4 eggs","2 tbsp thick chilli sauce"]','["Pour the chicken stock into a large pan and bring to the boil. Add the rice and turkey, bring back to the boil and simmer for 12-15 mins until the stock has been absorbed and rice is tender.","Meanwhile, put the spinach in a colander and pour over a kettle of hot water to lightly wilt. Keep the spinach and carrots separate, but dress both with the sesame oil and seeds.","Cover the cooked rice with a lid and leave to sit for a couple of mins. Meanwhile, heat vegetable oil in a non-stick pan set over a high heat. Fry eggs so the white crisps up nicely round the edges.","Spoon the rice into large bowls and arrange the spinach and carrots on top. Finish each with a fried egg and a dollop of chilli sauce. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:16:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5806,5806,'en','Chilli chicken curry','A healthy flavour-packed curry that counts as one of your 5 a day, and it’s low in fat','["1 medium onion, roughly chopped","3cm root ginger, roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp turmeric","¼ tsp hot chilli powder or ½ tsp cayenne pepper","230g can chopped tomatoes","350g potatoes, peeled and cut into rough chunks","500g boneless skinless chicken breasts, cut into 3cm chunks","½ tsp garam masala","2 tbsp chopped fresh coriander","natural yogurt, to serve"]','["Blitz the onion, ginger and\r\ngarlic in a food processor with\r\n1 tbsp water until smooth.","Fry the cumin seeds in oil\r\nfor a few seconds. Add the\r\nonion paste and brown over\r\na medium heat. Add a dash of\r\nwater if it starts to catch.","Sprinkle in the turmeric and\r\nchilli. Add the tomatoes and\r\nfry for 5 minutes. Stir in the\r\npotatoes and 250ml/9fl oz\r\nhot water. Cook covered for\r\n10 minutes.","Add the chicken and garam masala. Simmer for 15-20 minutes until cooked. Season with salt. Tip into a bowl, scatter over coriander and serve with flavoured rice and natural yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:16:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5808,5808,'en','One-pot lentil chicken','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis all-in-one meal makes a brilliant guilt-free supper, and if you are really hungry – just add potatoes','["1 tsp vegetable oil","2 rasher lean dry-cure back bacon, trimmed and chopped","2 large bone-in chicken thighs, skin removed","1 medium onion, thinly sliced","1 garlic clove, thinly sliced","2 tsp plain flour","2 tsp tomato purée","150ml dry white wine","200ml chicken stock","50g green lentils","½  tsp dried thyme","85g chestnut mushrooms, halved if large"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick wide, shallow pan, add bacon and fry briskly until lightly coloured, then lift on to a plate. Add the chicken and fry on each side until lightly brown. Set aside with the bacon. Tip onion and garlic into the pan and cook for 5 minutes. Stir in the flour and tomato purée, then stir over a low heat for 2-3 minutes. Add the wine, stock, lentils and thyme. Bring to the boil, reduce the heat, cover and simmer for 5 minutes.","Stir in the mushrooms. Add the bacon and chicken, pushing them under the liquid. Cover and simmer for 20-25 minutes, or until lentils are tender and the chicken cooked. Season with salt and pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:16:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5810,5810,'en','Quick beef & broccoli one-pot','Create a delicious beef and broccoli meal in one pot, fast! Contains 2 of your 5-a-day','["1 tbsp olive oil","50g unsalted cashews nuts","400g frying beef steak, cut into strips","1 large head broccoli, broken into florets","4 sticks celery, sliced","150ml beef stock (from a cube is fine)","2 tbsp horseradish sauce","2 tbsp low-fat fromage frais"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan, add the nuts and toss\r\nfor a few secs until lightly toasted. Set aside.","Season the steak strips with plenty of pepper and\r\nstir-fry over a high heat for 1-2 mins to brown. Set\r\naside with the nuts. Tip the broccoli and celery into\r\nthe pan and stir-fry for 2 mins. Pour the stock over,\r\ncover and simmer for 2 mins. Meanwhile, mix the\r\nhorseradish and fromage frais together.","Return the steak to the pan and toss with the\r\nveg, then sprinkle over the nuts and serve with the\r\ncreamy horseradish. Great with mashed potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:16:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5812,5812,'en','Pesto spinach penne','Combine pasta with spinach, pesto and tomatoes for an easy healthy meal. Tomatoes contain vitamin C, which will help your body absorb the iron in the spinach','["400g wholemeal penne","5 tbsp vegetarian basil pesto","500g baby spinach , roughly chopped","220g cherry tomatoes , halved"]','["Cook the penne following pack instructions. Meanwhile, heat 4 tbsp of the pesto in a non-stick pan over a medium-low heat. Add the spinach and 2 tbsp water, then cover to wilt.","Drain the pasta and toss with the spinach, the rest of the pesto and the tomatoes. Serve half. Cool and chill the rest.Will keep chilled for three days.Reheat with a splash of water."]','2026-01-10 12:16:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5814,5814,'en','One-pot green bean, potato & pesto pasta','For a speedy and nutritious midweek meal, combine pesto and greens with pasta and new potatoes – a light supper for long summer evenings','["350g baby new potatoes","400g penne or fusilli","1 litre hot vegetable stock","200g fresh pesto (ensure vegetarian, if needed)","120g green beans, trimmed","½ lemon, zested","grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative, to serve"]','["Tip the potatoes, pasta and stock into a flameproof casserole. Bring to the boil over a medium heat, then reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 15 mins uncovered and stirring occasionally. Stir in the pesto, green beans, lemon zest and some seasoning, and cook for 2 mins more.","Cover the pot with a lid, remove from the heat and leave to stand for 5 mins. Serve the pasta in bowls, topped with grated cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:16:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5816,5816,'en','Build your own pesto pasta salad','Rustle up this easy pesto pasta salad for the family. Customise it by adding your kid’s favourite veg','["400g farfalle pasta","3 tbsp olive oil","50g pine nuts","5 tbsp pesto (see recipe, right and below, if you want to make your own)","10 large basil leaves","½ lemon, juiced and zested","50g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, shaved","halved cherry tomatoes, drained sweetcorn, peas, rocket"]','["Cook the pasta following pack instructions, then drain and toss in 1 tbsp of the oil. Transfer to a large bowl and set aside to cool, tossing occasionally so it doesn’t stick.","Toast the pine nuts in a dry frying pan over a low heat, constantly moving them for 4-5 mins until browned. When the pasta has completely cooled, toss through thepesto, toasted pine nuts, remaining olive oil, basil, lemon zest and juice, and the tomatoes, sweetcorn, peas and rocket, if using. Season, then scatter over the parmesan and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5818,5818,'en','Orecchiette with butter beans, parsley, chilli & lemon','Make this simple pasta dish using whatever you’ve got to hand, including different pasta shapes, beans or chopped tomatoes. You can leave out the chilli if you prefer','["400g orecchiette","1 tbsp olive oil","2 red chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","400g can butter beans, drained and rinsed","400g can cherry tomatoes","1 lemon, zested and juiced","½ large bunch of parsley, finely chopped","25g grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative (optional)"]','["Cook the orecchiette following pack instructions until al dente, about 10 mins. Drain, reserving the cooking water.","Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat and fry the chillies and garlic for 2 mins until just softened. Mix in the butter beans, tomatoes, lemon zest and juice. Cook for 5 mins more, then scatter in the parsley and cook for another 2 mins. The tomatoes should have reduced slightly and the beans should be warmed through.","Tip the orecchiette into the frying pan with the butter bean mixture. Pour in a little of the reserved pasta cooking water if you prefer a looser sauce. Spoon into bowls and sprinkle with the cheese before serving, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5820,5820,'en','‘Meat’ball pasta bake','Serve up a bubbling vegan pasta bake made with Tesco Plant Chef Meat-Free Balls in a rich tomato sauce. This comforting, low-calorie dinner is sure to become a family favourite','["3 tbsp olive oil","12 Tesco Plant Chef Meat-Free Balls","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","pinch of chilli flakes","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tsp dried oregano","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","500ml passata","1 tsp sugar","small bunch of basil, leaves picked and torn, stalks finely chopped","350g pasta shapes of your choice","100g sourdough, blitzed to fine crumbs in a food processor","20g black olives, pitted and halved (optional)","green salad, to serve"]','["Heat 1 tbsp olive oil in a deep frying pan over a medium heat and fry the Tesco Plant Chef Meat-Free Balls for 10 mins until golden and crisp, turning often. Remove to a plate using a slotted spoon.","Heat another 1 tbsp oil in the same pan and fry the onion for 6-8 mins until soft and translucent. Stir in half the garlic and the chilli flakes and fry for 2 mins more, then stir in the tomato purée and half the dried oregano. Cook for another minute until the purée darkens slightly, then add the vinegar, passata, sugar, basil stalks and some of the basil leaves. Pour in 200ml water and simmer, uncovered, for 15-20 mins until the sauce has thickened slightly.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta in a pan of boiling salted water for 6-8 mins until just becoming tender, but still undercooked in the middle. Drain. Mix the sourdough breadcrumbs and the remaining garlic, oregano and oil together in a bowl and season. Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.","Tip the cooked pasta, the ‘meat’balls and olives (if using) into the pan with the sauce and gently stir to combine. Tip everything into a lasagne dish, then scatter over the garlic breadcrumbs and bake for 15-20 mins until the topping is golden and crisp and the pasta is al dente. Scatter with the remaining basil leaves and serve with a green salad on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5822,5822,'en','Vegan kale pesto pasta','Whizz up kale, pumpkin seeds, basil and garlic to make this easy kale pesto. It’s perfect stirred through wholemeal spaghetti for a healthy vegan meal','["150g kale","small bunch of basil","1 small garlic clove","3 tbsp pumpkin seeds","5 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","3 tbsp nutritional yeast","1 lemon, zested and juiced","350g wholemeal spaghetti"]','["Bring a pan of water to the boil. Cook the kale for 30 secs, drain and transfer to a bowl of ice-cold water for 5 mins. Drain again and pat dry with kitchen paper.","Put the basil, garlic, seeds, oil, nutritional yeast, lemon juice and zest, and drained kale in afood processor. Blitz until smooth, then season. Loosen with a splash of water, if it’s too thick.","Cook the pasta following pack instructions, then toss with the pesto and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5824,5824,'en','Pasta arrabbiata with aubergine','Choose this healthy pasta supper after a workout. Although it’s low in fat and calories, it’s packed with flavour, and also provides calcium and fibre','["1 tbsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","1 large onion, finely chopped (160g)","2 large garlic cloves, finely grated","1 tsp chilli flakes","1 tsp smoked paprika","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","1 aubergine, chopped","150g wholemeal penne or fusilli","large handful of basil, plus extra to serve","25g parmesan or vegetarian Italian-style hard cheese, finely grated"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan, add the onions, cover and cook for 5 mins. Remove the lid and cook for 5 mins more, stirring frequently until softened. Add the garlic, chilli flakes and paprika, stir briefly, then tip in the tomatoes and a can of water. Stir in the bouillon and aubergine, then bring to a simmer, cover and cook for 20 mins.","Cook the penne in a pan of boiling water for 12 mins until al dente. Drain, reserving 60ml of the cooking water. Add the cooked penne to the sauce, and toss well with the basil and a little of the reserved water, if needed. Spoon into two shallow bowls, and serve topped with the cheese and some extra basil, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5826,5826,'en','Jackfruit bolognese with vegan parmesan','Cutting back on meat? Try jackfruit as an alternative. This vegan bolognese not only tastes delicious, but it counts as a whopping five of your 5-a-day','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","320g carrots (3 medium), finely chopped","4 large celery sticks (320g), finely chopped","4 large garlic cloves, finely grated","410g can jackfruit in water, drained and finely chopped","100g red lentils","3 tbsp tomato purée","4 tsp vegetable bouillon powder (check it’s vegan)","1 tbsp chopped thyme","325g wholemeal spaghetti","chopped parsley, to serve (optional)","40g cashews","4 tsp nutritional yeast","1 tsp garlic granules"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan and fry the carrots, celery and garlic for 10 mins, stirring every now and then.","Meanwhile, make the vegan parmesan. Tip the cashews, nutritional yeast and garlic granules into a food processor and blitz to fine crumbs. Add a little salt, if needed, and set aside.","Tip the jackfruit into the veg mix with the lentils, 700ml water, the tomato purée, bouillon powder and thyme, then cover and cook for 25 mins. Add a little more water if needed – it should be pulpy.","Meanwhile, cook the spaghetti following pack instructions until al dente. Toss with the sauce, divide between bowls and sprinkle with the vegan parmesan and parsley, if using. The sauce will keep, covered, in the fridge for up to three days, or in the freezer for up to three months."]','2026-01-10 12:16:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5828,5828,'en','Super-green mac ‘n’ cheese','Revamp mac ‘n’ cheese with broccoli, spinach and peas, plus a crunchy nut and seed topping. It has all the flavour of the classic dish, but with added nutrients','["1l semi-skimmed milk","75g butter","75g plain flour","2 tsp Dijon mustard","175g mature or extra mature cheddar, grated","50g parmesan, grated","100g spinach, fresh or frozen","400g macaroni","1 broccoli (about 300g), broken into florets","100g frozen peas","3 slices white bread (about 125g)","1 small bunch of basil leaves","1 tsp olive oil","25g mixed nuts or seeds, such as pumpkin seeds, pine nuts and almonds, for the topping"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Tip the milk, butter and flour into a large saucepan and bring to a simmer, whisking continuously until you have a smooth, thick sauce, about 3-4 mins. Don’t worry if there are a few lumps – the sauce will be blended later. Season well, then add the mustard, both cheeses and spinach.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta in boiling salted water for 5 mins. Add the broccoli and continue cooking until the pasta is cooked through and the broccoli is soft. Drain.","Transfer half the cooked broccoli to the cheese sauce. Whizz the cheese sauce until smooth, creamy and bright green using a hand blender (or stand mixer). Loosen with a splash of milk, if needed. Stir in the pasta, remaining broccoli and the peas and tip into a large baking dish.","If making the topping, put the bread, basil, oil and half the nuts or seeds in a food processor and whizz to coarse, green crumbs. Scatter over the pasta along with the remaining nuts or seeds. Bake for 20-25 mins, until the topping is crunchy and the sauce is bubbling. Will keep in an airtight container in the freezer for up to three months."]','2026-01-10 12:16:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5830,5830,'en','Spaghetti with smoky tomato & seafood sauce','Chilli, fennel seeds and smoked paprika add warmth and flavour to a rich tomato sauce, served with seafood in this quick pasta dish','["4 tbsp olive oil","4 garlic cloves, crushed","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely sliced","1½  tsp fennel seeds","400g spaghetti","2 tsp smoked paprika","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","2 tsp sugar","400g pack frozen mixed cooked seafood, defrosted","small bunch parsley or basil, chopped"]','["Boil the kettle and heat the oil in a large, deep frying pan. Add the garlic, chilli and fennel seeds, and sizzle for a few mins. Pour the boiling water into a large pan and cook the pasta following pack instructions.","Add the paprika, tomatoes, sugar and seasoning to the pan and simmer for 8-10 mins while the pasta cooks.","Drain the pasta 1 min before the end of the cooking time, reserving a cup of the water. Add the pasta to the sauce with the seafood. Simmer for 1-2 mins, adding a splash of the reserved pasta water if it looks too thick. Toss the pasta through the sauce as it cooks. Add the herbs and black pepper, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5832,5832,'en','Butternut & bacon fusilli','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis easy pasta dish with pancetta, butternut squash and spinach makes a healthy weeknight dinner – fresh rosemary adds extra flavour','["½  x 160g pack pancetta di cubetti","1½  tbsp olive oil","750g butternut squash, deseeded and cut into 2cm cubes","2 rosemary sprigs, leaves finely chopped","¼ tsp chilli flakes","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","350g fusilli bucati (or fusilli)","100g young leaf spinach, roughly chopped","grated Parmesan, to serve"]','["Tip the pancetta into a large frying pan set over a medium heat and cook for 5-8 mins until really crisp. Remove using a slotted spoon, leaving the fat in the pan. Add the oil to the pan, along with the squash, rosemary, chilli and garlic. Cover and cook for 25 mins, stirring now and then, until the squash is tender. Season well, and gently crush some of the butternut squash with the back of a spoon.","Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil 15 mins before the squash is ready, and cook the pasta following pack instructions. Drain, reserving the cooking water. Add 1-2 ladles of pasta water to the squash and let it bubble for a few mins. Tip in the drained pasta and toss together. Stir through the spinach, then divide between plates. Sprinkle over the pancetta, some grated Parmesan and a good grinding of black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:16:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5834,5834,'en','Chilli prawn linguine','An elegant, low-fat seafood dish, perfect for mid-week entertaining – very light and stylish','["280g linguine pasta","200g sugar snap peas, trimmed","2 tbsp olive oil","2 large garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 large red chilli, seeded and finely chopped","24 raw king prawns, peeled","12 cherry tomatoes, halved","a handful of fresh basil leaves","mixed salad leaves and crusty white bread, to serve","2 tbsp virtually fat-free fromage frais","grated zest and juice of 2 limes","2 tsp golden caster sugar"]','["Mix the dressing ingredients in\r\na small bowl and season with\r\nsalt and pepper. Set aside.","Cook the pasta according to the\r\npacket instructions. Add the sugar\r\nsnap peas for the last minute or so\r\nof cooking time.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a wok or\r\nlarge frying pan, toss in the garlic\r\nand chilli and cook over a fairly\r\ngentle heat for about 30 seconds\r\nwithout letting the garlic brown. Tip\r\nin the prawns and cook over a high\r\nheat, stirring frequently, for about 3\r\nminutes until they turn pink.","Add the tomatoes and cook,\r\nstirring occasionally, for 3 minutes\r\nuntil they just start to soften. Drain\r\nthe pasta and sugar snaps well,\r\nthen toss into the prawn mixture.\r\nTear in the basil leaves, stir, and\r\nseason with salt and pepper.","Serve with salad leaves drizzled\r\nwith the lime dressing, and warm\r\ncrusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:16:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5836,5836,'en','Spaghetti omelette','This speedy spaghetti omelette is a great way of using up leftover pasta, and it’s bound to be a hit with kids','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 onion, chopped","2 courgettes, grated","2 tbsp chopped flat-leaf parsley","300g pot fresh cheese sauce","200g cooked spaghetti or other pasta","2 eggs"]','["Heat half the oil in a medium non-stick\r\nfrying pan and add the garlic and onion.\r\nCook for 2-3 mins, until softened. Using\r\nyour hands, squeeze out as much\r\nmoisture from the courgettes as\r\npossible. Add them to the pan and cook\r\nfor a further 3-4 mins, until tender. Spoon\r\nthe vegetables into a large bowl.","Stir in the parsley, cheese sauce and\r\nspaghetti and season. Beat the eggs\r\nand stir into the mixture.","Heat remaining oil in the frying pan and\r\ntip in the spaghetti mixture. Level it out with\r\nthe back of a spoon and cook over a medium\r\nheat for 3-5 mins, until almost set.","Transfer to a hot grill for 2-3 mins, until\r\ngolden. Leave to cool in the pan for\r\n5 mins, then cut into wedges and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5838,5838,'en','Vitality veggie pasta','Easy and quick veggie pasta','["250g pack pappardelle pasta","1 small butternut squash, peeled, seeded and chopped into chunks","2 tbsp olive oil","small handful pine nuts","1 plump garlic clove, finely chopped","4 large field mushrooms, sliced","250g bag washed spinach","grated parmesan and chilli flakes to serve, optional"]','["Pour boiling water\r\ninto a large saucepan, bring to the boil, then cook\r\nthe pasta according to pack instructions. When the\r\npasta has 5 mins left to cook, tip in the squash\r\nand cook with the pasta for the remaining time.","While the pasta is cooking,\r\nheat half the oil in a large frying pan. Sizzle the pine\r\nnuts in the oil until they start to colour, stir in the\r\ngarlic and cook for a moment just to soften. Add\r\nremaining oil, turn up the heat, add the mushroom\r\nand cook for 2-3 mins until they start to soften. Turn\r\nthe heat to maximum, add spinach to the pan and\r\ncook for 1-2 mins until completely wilted.","Drain the pasta and squash,\r\nthen mix in with the vegetables until everything’s\r\nnicely combined. Bring the pan to the table and let\r\neveryone help themselves. You could also pass round\r\ngrated parmesan and chilli flakes if people want it."]','2026-01-10 12:16:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5840,5840,'en','Spicy spaghetti with garlic mushrooms','A low fat, fail-safe pasta dish that will proves that it''s just as easy to whip up a meal as it is to turn on the microwave','["2 tbsp olive oil","250g pack chestnut mushrooms, thickly sliced","1 garlic clove, thinly sliced","small bunch parsley, leaves only","1 celery stick, finely chopped","1 onion, finely chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","1?2 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped, (or use drieds chilli flakes)","300g spaghetti"]','["Heat 1 tbsp oil in a pan, add the mushrooms,\r\nthen fry over a high heat for 3 mins until\r\ngolden and softened. Add the garlic, fry for\r\n1 min more, then tip into a bowl with the\r\nparsley. Add the onion and celery to the pan\r\nwith the rest of the oil, then fry for 5 mins\r\nuntil lightly coloured.","Stir in the tomatoes, chilli and a little salt,\r\nthen bring to the boil. Reduce the heat and\r\nsimmer, uncovered, for 10 mins until\r\nthickened. Meanwhile, boil the spaghetti,\r\nthen drain. Toss with the sauce, top with\r\nthe garlicky mushrooms, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5842,5842,'en','Lemony prawn & pea pasta','A simple and flavoursome storecupboard prawn pasta dish that combines fresh flavours with quick cooking','["350g linguine or other long pasta","140g large frozen prawns","100g frozen peas","1 egg yolk","zest and juice 1 lemon","handful grated parmesan","soured cream (optional)"]','["Boil the linguine for 8 mins. Three minutes before the time is up, tip in the prawns and peas. Reserve a cup\r\nof cooking water, then drain the pasta and return to the pan.","Add the egg yolk, lemon zest and juice, most of the Parmesan and some soured cream, if you like. Stir everything together, adding a little of the pasta cooking water to loosen the mixture.","Serve sprinkled with Parmesan."]','2026-01-10 12:16:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5844,5844,'en','Spinach & feta cannelloni','A low fat, high iron dish that makes a great mid-week meal for all the family','["4 large sheets no-pre-cook lasagne (we used Sainsbury''s fresh egg lasagne from a 250g pack)","1kg frozen spinach, defrosted","200g pack low-fat feta cheese","generous grating nutmeg","large handful olives, pitted and chopped","1 tbsp caper, rinsed","400g can chopped tomatoes","25g parmesan, grated"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Put the lasagne sheets in a large bowl and cover with boiling water. Soak for 5 mins or prepare according to pack instructions. Meanwhile, squeeze as much water as possible from the spinach, then mix with the feta, nutmeg and some seasoning. Drain the pasta, then cut each sheet in half vertically. Spoon 4 tbsp of the filling along the centre of each half, then roll up to enclose. Place in a lightly oiled baking dish.","Mix the olives, capers and tomatoes together in a bowl, season, then spoon over the cannelloni. Sprinkle with parmesan,\r\ncover with foil, then bake for 20 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:16:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5846,5846,'en','Tofu & spinach cannelloni','Tasty tofu is a vegetarian''s best friend and this cannelloni dish, packed with protein and iron, is sure to be a freezable favourite','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","50g pine nuts, roughly chopped","400g bag spinach","pinch grated nutmeg","349g pack silken tofu","300g pack fresh lasagne sheets","4 tbsp fresh breadcrumbs"]','["Heat half the oil in a pan, add onion and 1/3 of the garlic and fry for 4 mins until softened. Pour in tomatoes, season and bring to the boil. Reduce heat and cook for 10 mins until sauce thickens.","Heat half remaining oil in a frying pan and cook another 1/3 of garlic for 1 min, then add half the pine nuts and the spinach. Wilt spinach, then tip out excess liquid. Whizz tofu in a food processor or with a hand blender until smooth, then stir through the spinach with the nutmeg and some pepper. Remove from the heat; allow to cool slightly.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Pour half tomato sauce into a 20 x 30cm dish. Divide spinach mix between lasagne sheets, roll up and lay on top of sauce. Pour over remaining sauce. Bake for 30 mins.","Mix crumbs with remaining garlic and pine nuts. Sprinkle over top of dish, drizzle with remaining oil and bake for 10 mins until crumbs are golden."]','2026-01-10 12:16:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5848,5848,'en','Spaghetti Genovese','This vegetarian pasta dish is the perfect solution when you want something quick and tasty – and everything’s cooked in one pan','["300g new potatoes, sliced","300g spaghetti","200g trimmed green beans, cut in half","120g tub fresh pesto","olive oil, for drizzling"]','["Pour a kettle of boiling water into a very large pan until half full. Return to the boil, then add the potatoes and spaghetti, and a little salt. Cook for 10 minutes until the potatoes and pasta are almost tender. Tip in the green beans and cook for 5 minutes more.","Drain well, reserving 4 tbsp of the cooking liquid. Return the potatoes, pasta and beans to the pan, then stir in the fresh pesto and reserved cooking liquid. Season to taste, divide between four serving plates and drizzle with a little olive oil."]','2026-01-10 12:16:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5850,5850,'en','Hearty pasta soup','Do something different with a pack of tortellini. This filling soup is full of fibre, low fat and full of veg. The perfect lunch or supper','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 carrots, chopped","1 large onion, finely chopped","1l vegetable stock","400g can chopped tomatoes","200g frozen mixed peas and beans","250g pack fresh filled tortellini (we used spinach and ricotta)","handful of basil leaves (optional)","grated parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), to serve"]','["Heat oil in a pan. Fry the carrots and onion for\r\n5 mins until starting to soften. Add the stock\r\nand tomatoes, then simmer for 10 mins. Add\r\nthe peas and beans with 5 mins to go.","Once veg is tender, stir in the pasta. Return to the\r\nboil and simmer for 2 mins until the pasta is\r\njust cooked. Stir in the basil, if using. Season,\r\nthen serve in bowls topped with a sprinkling\r\nof Parmesan and slices of garlic bread."]','2026-01-10 12:16:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5852,5852,'en','Tuna arrabbiata pasta gratin','This wholesome and filling pasta bake makes the perfect winter comfort food with none of the guilt','["1 tsp olive oil","1 red and 1 yellow pepper, deseeded and sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","pinch crushed dried chillies","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","50g mixed pitted olives, whole or roughly chopped (optional)","pinch caster sugar","250g wholemeal pasta shapes","2 x 200g cans tuna steak in spring water, drained and flaked","25g fresh wholemeal breadcrumbs","2 tbsp grated parmesan"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan and\r\nfry the peppers for about 5 mins until\r\nstarting to caramelise. Add the garlic\r\nand chillies, cook for 30 secs, then tip\r\nin the tomatoes and olives (if using).\r\nSeason, add a pinch of sugar, bring to the\r\nboil, then simmer, uncovered, for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta according\r\nto pack instructions. Heat the grill. Drain\r\nthe pasta and mix into the tomato sauce,\r\nalong with the tuna. Tip into a large\r\novenproof dish. Mix the breadcrumbs\r\nand Parmesan together and scatter\r\nover the top. Grill for 3-4 mins or until\r\nthe topping is crisp and golden. Serve\r\nwith a green salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5854,5854,'en','Spaghetti with crab, cherry tomatoes & basil','Punchy fresh flavours in a good-for-you-dish are often what you need for a midweek boost. This pasta dish has it all','["1 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","2 garlic cloves, chopped","pinch chilli flakes","200g cherry tomatoes, halved","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 x 170g cans white crab meat, drained","200g spaghetti","1 tsp capers, drained and rinsed","handful basil leaves, roughly chopped"]','["In a large frying pan, heat the olive oil. Add the garlic and chilli flakes. Cook until just pale golden, then add the tomatoes. Cook 3 mins more on a high heat until the tomatoes start to break down a little. Add the lemon juice and cook for 1-2 mins. Remove from the heat and stir in the crab to warm through – not too much or it will break up.","Boil the pasta in a large pan of salted water following pack instructions then drain. Mix the pasta in the warm pot with the sauce, lemon zest and capers, and toss the basil through."]','2026-01-10 12:16:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5856,5856,'en','Summer veggie pasta','This makes a great vegetarian family supper, but it can easily be halved to serve two','["200g pasta bows","175g fresh or frozen broad beans (about 650g/1lb 7oz in their pods)","1 tbsp good quality olive oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","2 large courgettes, cut into sticks","6 ripe plum tomatoes, cut into wedges","a generous shot of Tabasco sauce","a handful of shredded basil"]','["Cook the pasta according to\r\npacket instructions, adding fresh\r\nbroad beans for the last 3 minutes\r\n(frozen for the last 2 minutes).","While the pasta is cooking, heat\r\nthe oil in a large frying pan, tip in the\r\nonion and cook over a medium\r\nheat for 1-2 minutes. Stir in the\r\ngarlic and courgettes, toss over a\r\nmedium heat for 2-3 minutes, then\r\nstir in the tomatoes and shake in\r\nthe Tabasco. Stir for 2-3 minutes\r\nto soften the tomatoes a little (not\r\ntoo much or they will go mushy).\r\nDrain the pasta and beans.","Toss the veggies and basil into\r\nthe pasta and season with salt\r\nand pepper. Serve hot (or cold as\r\na salad with a low-fat dressing)."]','2026-01-10 12:16:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5858,5858,'en','Pasta with tomato & hidden veg sauce','Get your family to eat more veg with this superhealthy pasta sauce recipe which counts as 5 of your 5-a-day. The sauce is freezable too','["1 tsp olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","2 celery sticks, chopped","2 carrots, chopped","1 leek, chopped","2 peppers, deseeded and chopped","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes with garlic","1 tbsp each caster sugar and balsamic vinegar","300g dried pasta shapes","parmesan, shaved, and rocket, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick\r\nsaucepan and gently cook the\r\nonion, celery, carrots and leek\r\nuntil soft, about 20 mins. Add the\r\npeppers and cook for 10 mins\r\nmore, then tip in the tomatoes,\r\nsugar and vinegar. Simmer for at\r\nleast 20 mins – the longer the better.","Cook the pasta following pack\r\ninstructions. Meanwhile, blitz the\r\nsauce with a hand blender until\r\nsmooth, season and return to the\r\nheat to keep warm while the pasta\r\ncooks. Drain the pasta and toss\r\nthrough the sauce. Serve in bowls\r\ntopped with shaved Parmesan and\r\nrocket leaves, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5860,5860,'en','Lamb meatballs with rosemary tomato sauce','This hearty dish makes a simple and speedy midweek meal but can also be frozen ahead for a last-minute dinner','["2 tsp olive oil","1 pack 12 ready-made lamb meatballs (approx 450g)","4 onions, finely sliced","4 garlic cloves, finely sliced","1 tbsp finely chopped rosemary leaves, plus extra to sprinkle","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","400g pasta, cooked, to serve"]','["Heat 1 tsp oil in a large frying pan. Add\r\nthe meatballs and cook, turning often,\r\nuntil browned. Remove from the pan.","Tip the onions into the pan with the\r\nremaining oil and a pinch of salt and cook\r\nuntil very soft, 10-15 mins. Add the garlic\r\nand rosemary and cook for 2 mins more.","Add the tomatoes and return meatballs\r\nto the pan. Simmer for 10 mins until the\r\nsauce has thickened and the meatballs\r\nare cooked through. Season and serve\r\nwith the pasta, sprinkle with rosemary."]','2026-01-10 12:16:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5862,5862,'en','Creamy ham, leek & mushroom spaghetti','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyCreamy pasta needn''t be off the menu when you''re watching your weight – this one''s low-fat','["2 tsp olive oil","2 medium leeks, thinly sliced","200g chestnut mushrooms, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","300g spaghetti","140g low-fat soft cheese (we used Philadelphia Light)","85g wafer-thin smoked ham, shredded","small pack basil","25g grated parmesan"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan. Stir\r\nin the leeks, 2 tbsp water and some\r\nseasoning, cover, then cook for 5 mins\r\nover a medium heat until softened. Add\r\nthe mushrooms and garlic, then cook for\r\n3 mins more. Meanwhile, cook the\r\nspaghetti according to pack instructions,\r\nthen drain, reserving a little of the\r\ncooking liquid.","Stir the soft cheese into the leek and\r\nmushroom mixture, adding enough of the\r\nreserved pasta liquid to give a sauce-like\r\nconsistency. Add the ham, basil leaves\r\nand Parmesan, then toss in the spaghetti."]','2026-01-10 12:16:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5864,5864,'en','Super-veg pasta','Get two of your five-a-day with this deliciously versatile sauce','["2 red peppers, quartered and deseeded","2 tbsp olive oil","1 fennel bulb, roughly chopped","1 onion, roughly chopped","1 large carrot, roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","¼ tsp crushed chillies","1 tsp fennel seeds","2 tbsp tomato purée","400g can chopped tomatoes","600ml vegetable stock","1 tsp caster sugar","small handful basil, leaves shredded","500g bag fresh egg pasta, cooked"]','["Heat the grill and pop the peppers,\r\nskin-side up, underneath for 10 mins\r\nor until beginning to char. Transfer to\r\na bowl, cover and set aside. When cool\r\nenough to handle, peel off the skin and\r\ncut the flesh into strips.","Heat the oil in a large saucepan and\r\ncook the fennel, onion and carrot for\r\n8-10 mins until softened. Stir in the garlic,\r\ncrushed chillies, fennel seeds and tomato\r\npurée, cook for 2 mins, then add the\r\ncanned tomatoes, stock and sugar.\r\nSimmer, uncovered, for 15 mins or until\r\nthe vegetables are completely soft.","Take out a couple of spoonfuls of the\r\nsauce (this will later add texture), then\r\nblend the rest in the saucepan until\r\nalmost smooth with a stick blender.\r\nSimmer for 5 mins to thicken, then stir in the reserved sauce, shredded basil\r\nand peppers. Serve with the pasta."]','2026-01-10 12:16:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5866,5866,'en','20-minute seafood pasta','Make a low-fat, satisfying dish in minutes – ideal for Friday nights','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 tsp paprika","400g can of chopped tomatoes","1l chicken stock (from a cube is fine)","300g spaghetti, roughly broken","240g pack frozen seafood mix, defrosted","handful of parsley leaves, chopped, and lemon wedges to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a wok or large frying pan, then cook the onion and garlic over a medium heat for 5 mins until soft. Add the paprika, tomatoes and stock, then bring to the boil.","Turn down the heat to a simmer, stir in the pasta and cook for 7 mins, stirring occasionally to stop the pasta from sticking. Stir in the seafood, cook for 3 mins more until it’s all heated through and the pasta is cooked, then season to taste. Sprinkle with parsley and serve with lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:16:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5868,5868,'en','Spicy pasta soup','Rustle up an Italian-style minestrone soup and individual tarts using ingredients from your storecupboard','["1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely sliced","800g can whole plum tomatoes","1l vegetable stock","100g broken spaghetti","4 tbsp chopped pitted black olives","2 tbsp chopped capers, drained and rinsed","large handful basil leaves, roughly torn, or 1 tbsp pesto"]','["Heat the oil in a large heavy-based\r\nsaucepan. Add the onion and chilli,\r\nthen cook for 10 mins until softened.\r\nStir in the tomatoes, breaking up with\r\na spoon as you go, then pour in the\r\nstock. Cover, bring to the boil, remove\r\nthe lid, then simmer for 5 mins.","Add the spaghetti, then simmer for\r\n6-8 mins until it is just cooked. Stir in\r\nthe olives, capers and basil or pesto,\r\nthen serve drizzled with olive oil."]','2026-01-10 12:16:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5870,5870,'en','Creamy cheese & tomato macaroni','Try pasta instead of potatoes as a quick side-dish with chicken or steak','["300g macaroni, or other small pasta shapes","25g sundried tomatoes in oil, drained and roughly chopped","2 tbsp crème fraîche","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp parmesan, grated"]','["Boil the pasta. Meanwhile, in a small food\r\nprocessor, blitz together the tomatoes, crème\r\nfraîche and tomato purée into a sauce. (If\r\nyou don’t have a small processor, finely chop\r\nthe tomatoes, then mix everything together.)","Drain the pasta, saving a little of the\r\ncooking water, then return to the pan with\r\nthe tomato sauce and half the cheese. Mix\r\ntogether until all the pasta is coated, then\r\nserve as a side dish, sprinkled with the remaining cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:16:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5872,5872,'en','Ham & olive lasagne','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyWhen all you really want is a plateful of comforting lasagne – this version is on the table in 30 minutes','["250g fresh lasagne sheets","1 tbsp oil","1 fat garlic clove, crushed","2 x 400g cans chopped tomato with herbs","8 slices ham","generous handful green olives","2 eggs","150g pot mild natural yogurt (bio works well)","50g cheddar, grated, plus a handful extra for the top"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Put the lasagne sheets into a large bowl and pour over just-boiled water. Leave to soak for 5 mins, then drain. Meanwhile, heat the oil in an ovenproof frying pan, then fry the garlic for 1 min. Add the tomatoes, then simmer for 5 mins until reduced a little. Season to taste, then tip into a bowl.","Layer the pasta sheets, ham (keep this in slices), tomato sauce and olives in the pan, making sure you have a few olives and some sauce on the top. Don’t be too neat about it, crumple the ham and let the pasta fold around the sauce and olives.","Beat the eggs, yogurt and most of the cheese together in a jug, season with salt and pepper, then pour over the pasta. Top\r\nwith extra cheese and black pepper, then bake for about 15 mins until the cheese is golden and the topping is set. Serve with a salad."]','2026-01-10 12:16:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5874,5874,'en','Creamy linguine with ham, lemon & basil','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyKeep the kids happy with this easy, low-fat recipe that’s ready in under half an hour','["400g linguine or spaghetti","90g pack prosciutto","1 tbsp olive oil","juice 1 lemon","2 egg yolks","3 tbsp crème fraîche","large handful basil leaves","large handful grated parmesan, plus extra to serve, if you like"]','["Cook the linguine. Meanwhile, tear the\r\nham into small pieces and fry in the olive\r\noil until golden and crisp.","Drain the pasta, reserving a little of the\r\ncooking water, then return to the pan.\r\nTip in the cooked ham. Mix together the\r\nlemon juice, egg yolks and crème fraîche,\r\nthen add this to the pan along with the\r\nbasil and Parmesan. Mix in with tongs,\r\nadding a little of the cooking water, if\r\nneeded, to make a creamy sauce that\r\ncoats the pasta. Serve with extra\r\nParmesan grated over the top, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5876,5876,'en','Minestrone pasta pot','A vegetarian favourite for under 5’s, minestrone pasta pot','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 small onion, finely chopped","2 tbsp tomato purée","300g frozen mixed vegetables (including peas, sweetcorn, carrots and broccoli, but not the chunky stewpacks)","700ml hot vegetable stock","175g small pasta shapes, such as conchigliette","220g can baked beans","grated cheddar, to serve"]','["Heat the olive oil in a\r\nsaucepan over a medium\r\nheat and gently fry the onion\r\nfor a few minutes until it starts\r\nto soften. Stir in the tomato\r\npurée, then tip in the frozen\r\nvegetables and pour in\r\nthe stock.","Bring to the boil, add the\r\npasta and stir. Cover and\r\nsimmer for 12-14 minutes\r\nor until the pasta is cooked.","Stir in the beans and heat\r\nthrough, then taste for\r\nseasoning. Serve hot, with\r\na bowl of grated cheddar\r\nfor sprinkling over the top."]','2026-01-10 12:16:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5878,5878,'en','Ten-minute pasta','This meal is quicker to get on the table than oven chips and it’s full of fresh vegetables – making it perfect for kids','["350g pasta","1 carrot, roughly chopped","½ small onion, roughly chopped","½ stick celery, roughly chopped","6-8 ripe plum tomato, roughly chopped","1 tsp dried oregano","1 tsp red pesto","2 tbsp raspberry vinegar","grated parmesan and basil leaves, to serve"]','["Cook the pasta according to the pack\r\ninstructions. Meanwhile, add everything\r\nelse apart from the parmesan and basil\r\nto a food processor and whizz together\r\nuntil you get a smooth paste.","Tip into a saucepan and bring\r\nto the boil, then reduce the\r\nheat to a simmer and\r\nleave to cook for 5 mins.","Drain the pasta, toss\r\ntogether with the\r\ntomato sauce, then\r\nserve with the\r\nparmesan and\r\nbasil leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:16:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5880,5880,'en','Green bean minestrone','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyUsing a selection of green vegetables gives this soup a summery feel and contrasting textures','["1 onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 carrot, finely chopped","1 celery stick, finely chopped","2 tbsp olive oil","70g pack cubetti di pancetta (optional)","1 bay leaf","1½ l vegetable or chicken stock","100g small pasta shapes, such as stelline or orzo","300g mixed runner, green and podded broad beans","100g/4oz spring cabbage, shredded","4 tbsp pesto","crusty bread, to serve"]','["Fry the onion, garlic, carrot and celery\r\nin the olive oil in a large saucepan until\r\ntender but not browned. Scoop out and\r\nset aside. Fry the pancetta, if using, you\r\nwon’t need to add any more oil but keep\r\nthe heat low until it starts to give off fat.\r\nFry until browned but not too crisp. Tip\r\ninto a sieve and drain off any excess fat.\r\nPut the carrot mixture back into the pan\r\nwith the pancetta and add the bay leaf,\r\nplenty of seasoning and the stock. Bring\r\nto a simmer, add the pasta and cook\r\nfor 5 mins.","Top and tail the green and runner\r\nbeans, slice both into lengths that will\r\neasily fit on a spoon and add to the pot\r\nwith the broad beans. Cook for 3 mins,\r\nthen add the cabbage. Bring back to a\r\nsimmer and cook for 2 mins. Spoon the\r\npesto onto the top of the soup just\r\nbefore serving and serve with the bread."]','2026-01-10 12:16:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5882,5882,'en','Herby mushroom pasta','A quick, low-fat idea for a midweek supper – good if you’re on a budget at around £1.15 a head','["250g field or portobello mushrooms, thickly sliced","2 tsp wholegrain mustard","3 garlic cloves, sliced or crushed","150ml vegetable stock (from a cube is fine)","250g penne pasta (or other tube shapes)","3 tbsp flat-leaf parsley, chopped","zest 1 lemon"]','["Put the mushrooms, mustard, garlic and\r\nvegetable stock into a frying pan, bring to\r\nthe boil and simmer for 5 mins or until the\r\nstock has nearly all evaporated and the\r\nmushrooms are soft.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta according\r\nto pack instructions. Drain and toss with the\r\nmushrooms, parsley and lemon zest. Season\r\nto taste and serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:16:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5884,5884,'en','Speedy tuna pasta salad','A quick pasta using leftovers from the night before. Makes a great packed lunch','["2 x 220g packs ready-cooked pasta (we used Dolmio Express), or 440g leftover cooked penne (about 200g dried)","100g can tuna in oil","400g can cannellini beans, (borlotti or butterbeans are also good)","1?2 red onion, finely chopped","zest and juice 1 lemon","large handful parsley"]','["Microwave the cooked penne according to pack instructions. Tip into a bowl. Mix through the remaining ingredients (the\r\nwarm pasta will really soak up the flavours). If using chilled leftover pasta, simply mix everything together – it will still taste\r\ngreat. Can be kept in the fridge for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:16:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5886,5886,'en','Veggie lasagne','A light but luscious veggie lasagne to tickle your taste buds – it contains just 13g of fat compared to the more usual 19g','["2 tbsp oil","1 onion, sliced","1 garlic clove, sliced","1 aubergine, cut into chunks","1 red pepper","8 plum tomatoes, halved","350ml passata","200g ready-cooked lasagne sheets","6 tbsp half-fat crème fraîche","2 tbsp grated parmesan (or vegetarian alternative)"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Toss oil and vegetables together and roast in a large, shallow tin for 35 mins until lightly charred. Spoon a layer of roasted veg over the bottom of a medium-size baking dish.","Pour over some passata and cover with a layer of lasagne sheets. Repeat layers to use up all the roasted veg and passata, finishing with a layer of lasagne. Use a spoon to dollop over the crème fraîche, then sprinkle with the Parmesan. Return to the oven for 25 mins, until the lasagne is heated through and the top is golden and bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:16:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5888,5888,'en','Favourite pasta salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA low-fat, zesty salad, perfect for a summer lunchbox – vary with your favourite ingredients','["250g pasta shapes","140g frozen peas","pack parsley, chopped","small pack chives, snipped","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp olive oil","extra ingredients (see ideas below)"]','["Cook the pasta, adding\r\nthe peas for final 2 mins\r\ncooking time. Drain, rinse\r\nwith cold water to cool,\r\nthen drain again. Tip into\r\na bowl with the chopped\r\nherbs, lemon zest and\r\njuice, olive oil and plenty\r\nof seasoning and mix well.\r\nCover and chill, spooning\r\nout portions as and when.\r\nIf you''re making this for one\r\nperson, by days 3 and 4 you''ll\r\nneed to stir in a little olive oil\r\nor something creamy to\r\nloosen the pasta."]','2026-01-10 12:16:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5890,5890,'en','Tortellini with ricotta, spinach & bacon','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis crunchy and creamy pasta is special enough for summer entertaining','["250g pack filled tortellini (we used ricotta & spinach)","2 rashers lean back bacon","25g walnuts pieces","zest ½ lemon, juice of 1","1 tbsp finely grated parmesan, plus extra for serving","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for serving","100g bag salad spinach","2 tbsp ricotta"]','["Heat the grill. Boil the pasta according to\r\npack instructions, then tip into a colander\r\nand cool under gently running water.\r\nMeanwhile, grill the bacon on a baking tray\r\nuntil golden and crisp at the edges. When\r\nalmost ready, tip the walnuts onto the tray\r\nto toast a little. Snip the bacon into strips.","Mix the lemon zest and juice, Parmesan\r\nand oil in a large bowl. Season with pepper,\r\nthen tip in the spinach, tortellini, bacon\r\nand walnuts. Toss well, add the ricotta in\r\nsmall blobs, then gently toss. Season to taste,\r\nthen serve with a drizzle more oil and more\r\nParmesan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5892,5892,'en','Whole roast chicken with braised roots & peas','Layer swede, potato and leeks to roast alongside a chicken for a healthy dinner. A whole chicken is budget-friendly as it can provide leftovers for the week','["800g medium potatoes, thinly sliced","1 large leek (about 350g), sliced","1 tbsp thyme leaves, plus the stalks","4 garlic cloves, chopped","500g swede, thinly sliced","450ml vegetable stock, made with 2 tsp bouillon powder","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1.3kg whole chicken","320g frozen peas"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Mix the potatoes, leeks, thyme, garlic and swede in a deep, non-stick roasting tin. Shake into an even layer. Pour in the stock and brush the veg with the oil. Roast for 20 mins.","Put the thyme stalks inside the chicken cavity. After 20 mins, sit the chicken on top of the veg and roast for 1 hr until cooked through. After 30 mins, check the potatoes – add 150ml water if they start to catch. Remove the chicken to a board to rest for 10 mins. Meanwhile, cook half the peas following pack instructions.","Carveoff the chicken legs and remove their skin, then serve with half the roast veg and the peas.Leave the remaining chicken and veg to cool, then keep chilled for up to three days. To prepare the leftovers, remove the skin from one of the breasts, and reheat it with the veg in the microwave until piping hot. Cook the remaining peas following pack instructions. Slice the breast and serve with the veg. Use the final breast for these spiced chicken egg wraps.This recipe is part of our free 7-day healthy diet plan. To access the full meal plan,click here."]','2026-01-10 12:16:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5894,5894,'en','Air-fried roast potatoes','Make roast potatoes in an air fryer to get crispy roasties with a fluffy centre with ease. They make the perfect side dish for a Sunday roast','["1kg Maris Piper potatoes","1 tbsp sunflower or olive oil"]','["Cut the potatoes into evenly sized pieces, ensuring they''re not too big. Steam for 5 mins in a steamer insert set over a pan of boiling water, or simmer gently for 5 mins. Drain well.","Tip the drained potatoes into the bottom of anair fryer. Add the oil and toss everything together to ensure the potatoes are well-coated. Set the fryer to cook for 30 mins using the paddle. Check the potatoes are cooked through, then cook for another 5-10 mins if they''re not tender or brown enough. Season well."]','2026-01-10 12:16:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5896,5896,'en','Hazelnut & sage crushed butternut squash','Add browned butter to crushed butternut squash for a wonderful nuttiness that works beautifully with hazelnuts. A versatile veggie side for roast dinners','["1 large butternut squash (about 1.2 kg), peeled, deseeded and cut into 3cm chunks","50g butter","1 tbsp finely chopped sage, plus a few whole leaves to serve","good grating of nutmeg","50g blanched hazelnuts, roughly chopped","1 large butternut squash (about 1.2 kg), peeled, deseeded and cut into 3cm chunks","50g butter","1 tbsp finely chopped sage, plus a few whole leaves to serve","good grating of nutmeg","50g blanched hazelnuts, roughly chopped"]','["Tip the squash into a large microwavable bowl with 4 tbsp water and season. Cover with a microwaveable plate or lid andmicrowavefor 12-15 mins or until very tender.","Meanwhile, tip the butter into afrying panand melt over a medium heat. Allow to cook for 2-3 mins until golden brown with a biscuity smell. Add the whole sage leaves for the last minute to crisp up. Remove and set aside.","Crush the cooked squash with a potato masher and stir though most of the brown butter, the chopped sage, the nutmeg and a generous pinch of salt. Drizzle over the remaining butter and scatter with the hazelnuts and crispy whole sage leaves.","Tip the squash into a large microwavable bowl with 4 tbsp water and season. Cover with a microwaveable plate or lid andmicrowavefor 12-15 mins or until very tender.","Meanwhile, tip the butter into afrying panand melt over a medium heat. Allow to cook for 2-3 mins until golden brown with a biscuity smell. Add the whole sage leaves for the last minute to crisp up. Remove and set aside.","Crush the cooked squash with a potato masher and stir though most of the brown butter, the chopped sage, the nutmeg and a generous pinch of salt. Drizzle over the remaining butter and scatter with the hazelnuts and crispy whole sage leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:16:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5898,5898,'en','Easy vegan nut roast','Enjoy this easy nut roast as a show-off veggie main course. With pomegranate, cranberries and chestnut mushrooms, it’s filled with winter flavours','["2 tbsp milled flaxseed","400g butternut squash peeled, deseeded and cut into 3cm chunks","3 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for the tin","2 tbsp za’atar","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tbsp ground coriander","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 celery stick, finely chopped","250g chestnut mushrooms, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tbsp miso paste","200g shelled pistachios roughly chopped, plus extra to serve","100g cooked chestnuts, finely chopped","100g fresh breadcrumbs","½ small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","200g fresh or frozen cranberries","4 tbsp light brown soft sugar","pomegranate seeds, to serve"]','["Combine the flaxseeds with 4 tbsp water in a small bowl, and leave to thicken. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the squash in aroasting tinwith 1 tbsp olive oil, the za’atar, cumin and coriander. Cover the tin with foil and roast for 30-35 mins, or until the squash is tender but still holding its shape. Oil a 900g loaf tin and line with baking parchment.","Heat the remaining oil in a frying pan, and fry the onion, celery and mushrooms for 10-15 mins, or until softened. Stir in the garlic and miso paste.","Tip the pistachios, chestnuts, breadcrumbs and parsley into a bowl, then stir in the flaxseed mixture, fried veg and roasted squash. Season well.","Put the cranberries in a pan with the sugar and cook for 3-4 mins, or until the sugar has dissolved and the cranberries are just starting to soften. Spoon into the base of the loaf tin, then leave to stand for 5 mins to set slightly. Top with the nut roast mixture, patting it down firmly and smoothing the top with the back of a spoon. Cover with foil and bake for 25 mins, then uncover and bake for 25 mins more. Leave to rest for 15 mins, then invert onto a serving plate, removing the parchment. Top with extra chopped pistachios and pomegranate seeds, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5900,5900,'en','Slow-roast squash & garlic lentils with harissa yogurt','Bring out the sweet flavour of butternut squash by slow-roasting it and serving it with gently spiced lentils for a delicious veggie main','["1 butternut squash, peeled, deseeded and cut into 2cm slices","8 garlic cloves, skin on","4 small shallots, skin on","3 bay leaves","a few sprigs of thyme","50ml rapeseed oil","handful of chopped coriander","150g green or puy lentils","1 bay leaf","1 garlic clove","drizzle of olive oil","6 tbsp thick Greek yogurt","1 tbsp tahini","1-2 tbsp rose harissa","2 tbsp pumpkin seeds","1 tsp cumin seeds","½  tsp rapeseed oil"]','["First, prepare the lentils. Soak for at least 2 hrs or overnight. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Mix the squash, garlic, shallots, bay, thyme, oil and a pinch of sea salt in a roasting tin, cover with foil and roast for 45 mins. Remove the foil and roast for 10 mins more, until the veg is tender and caramelised at the edges. Remove from the oven and turn the heat up to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Toss the pumpkin seeds with the cumin, oil and a pinch of salt, and roast until popped, about 5-6 mins.","Meanwhile, put the lentils in a pan with the bay, garlic and a pinch of salt. Cover with water, bring to the boil, then simmer for 20-25 mins. Drain and remove the bay and garlic. Toss with the oil and black pepper.","Combine the yogurt and tahini Add the harissa to taste, then mix with the lentils. Squeeze the roasted shallots and garlic out of their skins and stir through the lentils along with a drizzle of oil from the tin.","Serve the squash on the lentils, sprinkled with the coriander and seeds, and the yogurt on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5902,5902,'en','How to roast garlic','Keen to find out how to roast garlic? Once roasted, garlic becomes sweet and soft – perfect for soups, sauces and dips','["1 garlic bulb","1 tsp olive oil"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cut the top off the garlic bulb, exposing the tops of the garlic cloves. Put on a small square of foil, and rub with the olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Scrunch up the foil to seal in the bulb.","Roast for 25-30 mins until soft when pressed, and the papery casing is light golden. Leave to cool for a few minutes before squeezing the soft roasted garlic out of their shells. Alternatively, take off all the papery casing and remove the cloves individually."]','2026-01-10 12:16:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5904,5904,'en','Lemon-roasted new potatoes','A new way with potatoes that goes especially well with a seafood-based main','["450g new potatoes","zest 1 lemon","1 tbsp olive oil"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Tip the \r\npotatoes into a large pan of boiling water, \r\nwait for the water to boil again, then cook for  \r\n5 mins. Drain, tip back into the pan and shake \r\nwell to rough up the edges a little. Tip onto  \r\na baking tray, toss with the lemon zest, oil and \r\nsome flaky sea salt, then roast for 30 mins \r\nuntil golden and crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:16:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5906,5906,'en','Roast chicken with couscous & pine nut stuffing','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyDelicious hot or cold and perfect for a picnic, this stuffed chicken will be a real family favourite','["100g couscous","175ml boiling chicken stock","50g butter","1 onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","100g pine nuts","140g dried apricots, roughly chopped","large handful parsley, roughly chopped","2 tbsp mint leaves, roughly chopped","1 lemon","1 egg, beaten","6 skinless chicken breasts","16 rashers streaky bacon"]','["Put couscous in a large heatproof bowl, pour over stock, then cover with cling film for 5 mins until liquid is absorbed. Melt half the butter in a pan, then gently cook onion and garlic for 5-8 mins until soft. Set aside. Dry-fry pine nuts for a few mins until golden. Combine onions, pine nuts, apricots and herbs with couscous. Add a good squeeze of lemon\r\njuice, season, then stir in egg. Leave to cool.","Using the back of a knife, stretch rashers to 1½ times their original length. Lay, slightly overlapping, on a large sheet of foil to form a rectangle. Make a few slashes in the thickest part of each chicken breast and lay between 2 sheets of cling film. Use the base of a heavy pan to bash the chicken until about 1cm thick. Arrange chicken over the bacon, fitting\r\nso there are no gaps, but leave a border on longer sides. (This helps to roll up the chicken.)","Spoon stuffing over chicken in a strip along one of the longest sides. Using tin foil to help, roll bacon and chicken around stuffing like a log. Wrap tightly in foil, twisting the ends to secure, then chill for 2 hrs or up to 1 day.","Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Place chicken, join-side down, in a roasting tray. Cook for 30 mins, then unwrap foil and brush roast with remaining butter. Cook, uncovered, for 20-30 mins more until cooked through, and the stuffing is hot (a metal skewer inserted into the chicken’s centre should come out hot). Cool and wrap in fresh foil to transport."]','2026-01-10 12:16:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5908,5908,'en','All-in-one roast chicken & veg','Fancy the flavour of a roast, but not the fat? Try this simple, healthy one-pan recipe','["8 baby new potatoes, halved","2 tsp olive oil","2 carrots, sliced","1 courgette, sliced","1 leek, sliced","1 tsp each chopped thyme and rosemary, plus a sprig or two","2 small skinless chicken breasts","150ml low-sodium chicken stock"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. In a\r\nsmall roasting tray toss the potatoes with\r\nthe oil, carrots, courgette, leek, herbs\r\nand seasoning. Roast for 30 mins until\r\nstarting to brown. Remove from the\r\noven and give the veg a stir, nestle in\r\nthe chicken, then return to the oven\r\nfor 15 mins. Pour over the stock, then\r\ncook for 5 mins more or until the chicken\r\nand veg are cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:16:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5910,5910,'en','Spicy chicken with mango salad','A superhealthy spicy perk-up for chicken','["4 skinless boneless chicken breasts","drizzle olive oil","1 tbsp garam masala","1 large ripe mango","½ cucumber","½ small red onion","handful fresh coriander leaves","4 tbsp soured cream or natural yogurt","grated zest and juice ½ lime","warm naan bread, to serve"]','["Heat a griddle or frying pan until hot. Rub the chicken with oil, garam masala and a good pinch of salt. Cook for 6 minutes on each side or until slightly charred and cooked through.","Peel and slice the mango into slim wedges. Halve the cucumber lengthways and slice thickly at an angle. Thinly slice the onion. Toss the salad ingredients together with the coriander and pile onto plates.","Mix the soured cream or yogurt with the lime zest and juice, season and dollop beside the salad. Cut the chicken in half or into thirds diagonally, arrange next\r\nto the salad and serve with naan bread."]','2026-01-10 12:16:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5912,5912,'en','Roasted root vegetables','Root veg is a must with Sunday lunch and Christmas dinner, and this easy recipe is low-fat, superhealthy and high in fibre to boot','["5 carrots, peeled and quartered","5 parsnips, peeled and quartered","1 celeriac, peeled and cut into 2cm cubes","½ a swede, peeled, cut into 2cm cubes","2 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic bulb, halved","clear honey, to drizzle"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss\r\nall the veg with the oil and garlic in a large\r\nroasting tin, then roast for 40 mins until\r\nstarting to soften and turn golden.\r\nRemove the tin from the oven, drizzle\r\nthe veg with honey and return to the\r\noven for 10-20 mins more until golden."]','2026-01-10 12:16:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5914,5914,'en','Roast fish & chips with orange raita','A healthy treat to keep the whole family satisfied','["3 medium baking potatoes, scrubbed","2 medium sweet potatoes, scrubbed","2 tbsp chilli oil or olive oil","1 large orange","¼ cucumber, finely chopped","1 small red onion, finely chopped","1 tbsp chopped fresh mint","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","3 tbsp low-fat natural yogurt","4 white fish fillets, each weighing about 175g/6oz","½  tsp cumin seeds"]','["Preheat the oven to 200C/gas\r\n6/fan 180C. Cut each potato\r\nand sweet potato lengthways\r\ninto 6 or 8 wedges – no need to\r\npeel. Tip into a roasting pan\r\nand drizzle with the oil.\r\nSeason, toss well, then roast\r\nfor 40-45 minutes until tender,\r\nturning them halfway through.","Peel the orange with a sharp,\r\nserrated knife to remove the pith\r\n– do this over a bowl to catch\r\nthe juice, which you''ll need later.\r\nCut out the segments, removing\r\nany membrane, then chop\r\nthem. Mix with the cucumber,\r\nonion, mint, vinegar and yogurt.\r\nAdd a little salt and pepper, then\r\nset aside, covered.","Brush a baking sheet with oil\r\nand put the fish on top. Season,\r\nsprinkle with the orange juice\r\nand the cumin. Roast above\r\nthe chips for 12-15 minutes\r\nuntil the chips are cooked.\r\nServe with the orange raita."]','2026-01-10 12:16:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5916,5916,'en','Foil-poached salmon with herby mayo','Learn how to poach a salmon perfectly with our step-by-step recipe – then serve with homemade chive, basil and dill mayonnaise','["light olive oil, for greasing","3kg whole gutted and scaled salmon with the head removed","bunch of dill","1 shallot, halved and very thinly sliced","5 tbsp dry white wine, such as Sauvignon Blanc","2 tbsp snipped chives","2 tbsp chopped basil","500ml mayonnaise","watercress, cucumber, herbs and lemon wedges, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/\r\ngas 2. Place a large piece of\r\ndouble-width foil on top of\r\na large baking sheet and brush it\r\nwith oil, then put the salmon in the\r\ncentre. Tuck a few generous sprigs\r\nof dill and the shallots in the body\r\ncavity, then season.","Carefully bring up the sides of\r\nthe foil to surround the fish,\r\nseason well inside and out,\r\nthen pour over the wine.","Seal the foil all the way round,\r\nbut not too tightly on the fish\r\n– you need to give it a bit of\r\nspace within the parcel. Bake for\r\n1 hr 30 mins.","Once the salmon has cooked,\r\ncarefully unwrap the foil parcel\r\nand pull the dorsal fin on the\r\nspine of the fish. If the salmon is\r\nready, it should come away very\r\neasily. Reseal the parcel and leave to\r\ncool – it will carry on cooking a little\r\nmore as it cools. If you are not sure\r\nthat the salmon is cooked sufficiently,\r\nreturn it to the oven for 10 mins more.","When cold, carefully peel away\r\nthe skin from one side of the\r\nsalmon. You may need to use\r\na knife to get you started, but it\r\nshould peel away easily after that.\r\nLeave the cooked dill and shallot\r\nin place, as you may damage the\r\nflesh of the salmon if you try to\r\nremove them.","Use a knife to scrape off the\r\nbrown fatty flesh. It tastes\r\ndelicious but doesn’t look\r\nas attractive as the pink flesh\r\nunderneath. Carefully turn the\r\nsalmon over onto a platter and\r\nremove the skin and brown flesh\r\nfrom the other side.","To serve, carefully remove the\r\nfillets from one side of the fish,\r\nleaving behind the bones. You\r\nwill see that the fish has a natural\r\ndivide of 2 long fillets on each side.\r\nInsert your knife along the centre and\r\ncarefully ease off each fillet. Transfer\r\nthe fillets to a platter, bone-side up.","Lift up the central bone from\r\nthe remaining whole fish –\r\nit should come away in one\r\npiece – and remove the aromatics.\r\nEase the 2 remaining fillets apart and\r\nremove any pin bones. Reassemble\r\nthe salmon on the platter. Stir the\r\nherbs into your mayonnaise and\r\ngarnish the salmon with watercress,\r\ncucumber, herbs and lemon."]','2026-01-10 12:16:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5918,5918,'en','Pot-roast beef with French onion gravy','Silverside and topside are cheaper and leaner cuts of meat, well-suited to slow-cooking. The stock and juices make a great sauce when combined with caramelised onions','["1kg silverside or topside of beef, with no added fat (see tip, below)","2 tbsp olive oil","8 young carrots, tops trimmed (but leave a little, if you like)","1 celery stick, finely chopped","200ml white wine","600ml rich beef stock","2 bay leaves","500g onions","a few thyme sprigs","1 tsp butter","1 tsp light brown or light muscovado sugar","2 tsp plain flour"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nRub the meat with 1 tsp of the oil\r\nand plenty of seasoning. Heat a large\r\nflameproof casserole dish and brown\r\nthe meat all over for about 10 mins.\r\nMeanwhile, add 2 tsp oil to a frying\r\npan and fry the carrots and celery\r\nfor 10 mins until turning golden.","Lift the beef onto a plate, splash the\r\nwine into the hot casserole and boil for\r\n2 mins. Pour in the stock, return the\r\nbeef, then tuck in the carrots, celery\r\nand bay leaves, trying not to submerge\r\nthe carrots too much. Cover and cook\r\nin the oven for 2 hrs. (I like to turn the\r\nbeef halfway through cooking.)","Meanwhile, thinly slice the onions.\r\nHeat 1 tbsp oil in a pan and stir in the\r\nonions, thyme and some seasoning.\r\nCover and cook gently for 20 mins until\r\nthe onions are softened but not coloured.\r\nRemove the lid, turn up the heat, add\r\nthe butter and sugar, then let the onions\r\ncaramelise to a dark golden brown,\r\nstirring often. Remove the thyme sprigs,\r\nthen set aside.","When the beef is ready, it will be tender\r\nand easy to pull apart at the edges.\r\nRemove it from the casserole and snip\r\noff the strings. Reheat the onion pan, stir\r\nin the flour and cook for 1 min. Whisk the\r\nfloury onions into the beefy juices in the\r\ncasserole, to make a thick onion gravy.\r\nTaste for seasoning. Add the beef and\r\ncarrots back to the casserole, or slice the\r\nbeef and bring to the table on a platter,\r\nwith the carrots to the side and the\r\ngravy spooned over."]','2026-01-10 12:16:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5920,5920,'en','Spiced roast beef','Matt Tebbutt''s roast beef combines spices and meltingly tender meat. It''ll be just as good cold, too','["1 tbsp juniper berries","1 tbsp coriander seeds","1 tbsp black peppercorns","1 tbsp allspice berries","2 tbsp olive oil","2kg-3kg (4lb 8oz-6lb 8oz) topside joint of beef - depending on the amount of leftovers you want"]','["Combine all the spices and ½ tbsp salt together in a pestle and mortar. Give everything a good grind, keeping a little of its coarseness. Rub the oil and then the ground spices all over the beef and massage in well. Cover and chill overnight to marinate.","Next day, heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Weigh your joint and roast for 10 mins per 450g for rare meat and 15 mins per 450g for medium, plus an extra 20 mins. Cover and rest for 20 mins while you finish the salads, then slice and serve. Alternatively, roast the beef in the morning and serve at room temperature for dinner."]','2026-01-10 12:16:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5922,5922,'en','Seared beef with wild mushrooms & balsamic','A classy main course for two, inspired by the Italian region of Emiglia-Romagna','["400g piece beef fillet","2 tbsp olive oil","leaves from 1 rosemary sprig, bruised","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tbsp butter","200g mixed wild mushrooms","200ml good beef stock","1 tsp balsamic vinegar, to serve"]','["Rub the beef with 1 tbsp oil, rosemary and\r\ngarlic, then leave in the fridge for at least 1 hr,\r\nor up to 24 hrs. Make sure the beef returns to\r\nroom temperature before you cook it.","Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Heat\r\na non-stick, ovenproof frying pan or roasting\r\ntin until very hot. Rub most of the garlic and\r\nrosemary from the beef, season with black\r\npepper and flaky salt, then sear on all sides\r\nuntil dark brown and almost crusted – about\r\n5 mins in total. Transfer the pan to the oven,\r\nthen roast the beef for 10 mins for mediumrare.\r\nLeave to rest for a good 15 mins and\r\nkeep any juices.","While the meat rests, sauté the mushrooms.\r\nHeat 1 tbsp butter and the remaining oil in\r\na large frying pan, then tip in the mushrooms\r\nwith plenty of seasoning. Fry until golden\r\nand just softened, then tip into a bowl.","Add the stock to the mushroom pan, then\r\nreduce by two-thirds. Tip in the mushrooms\r\nand balsamic, then add the remaining butter\r\nand let it melt. Tip in any meat juices, then\r\nseason to taste and keep warm. Thickly slice\r\nthe beef and spoon over the sauce. Serve\r\nwith mash and spinach."]','2026-01-10 12:16:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5924,5924,'en','Crunchy roast potatoes','Crispy roast potatoes are an essential part of the perfect roast lunch. If you like parsnips, roast them in exactly the same way','["20 even-size potatoes, such as King Edwards, peeled and halved if large","200g jar goose fat","salt, to serve"]','["Boil the potatoes for 10 mins, then\r\ndrain. Rough up their surfaces with\r\na fork or by shaking them in the pan\r\nwith the lid on.","Melt the goose fat in a large, thickbottomed\r\nroasting tin on top of the\r\nstove. Tip in the potatoes carefully and\r\nturn them until they are evenly coated\r\nin the fat. Place on the top shelf of the\r\noven (move the turkey down a shelf if\r\nnecessary) and roast for 1-1¼ hrs,\r\nturning every now and then, until crisp\r\nand golden. Sprinkle with salt to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5926,5926,'en','Steak sarnies with sticky onions & blue cheese','Enjoy the classic combination of steak and blue cheese on delicious sourdough for a simple but special lunch','["2 tbsp unsalted butter","1 red onion, thinly sliced","2 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","½ tbsp light brown soft sugar","40g stilton, crumbled","2 tbsp mayonnaise","1 large sirloin or rump steak (about 350g)","4 slices sourdough bread","handful of rocket, to serve"]','["Melt the butter in a frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onion with a pinch of salt for 15 mins until golden brown. Add the Worcestershire sauce and sugar, and fry for a further 5 mins, or until the onions are sticky and caramelised. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Mix the stilton with the mayonnaise and season with freshly ground black pepper. Set aside.","Season the steak on both sides. Heat a griddle pan over a high heat and cook the steak for 2-3 mins on each side (2 mins for rare or 3 mins for medium). Remove to a board, cover and leave to rest for 10 mins. Thinly slice the steak.","Toast the sourdough slices, then spread with the blue cheese mixture. Top with the steak, caramelised onions, rocket and a grinding of black pepper, then serve two open-faced sandwiches per person."]','2026-01-10 12:16:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5928,5928,'en','Christmas leftover sandwich','Take your Boxing Day sarnie to the next level. Hollow out a loaf of bread and layer up all your Christmas leftovers inside it to make a lip-smacking sandwich','["400g white round crusty loaf","2 tbsp mayonnaise","2 tsp English mustard","3-4 tbsp cranberry sauce","handful of baby spinach","3-4 tbsp crispy onions","250g leftover roast turkey","6 leftover cooked pigs in blankets, halved lengthways","150g leftover cooked stuffing"]','["Slice a roughly 3cm lid off the top of the loaf. Scoop out most of the bread from the loaf and lid, leaving about a 1cm layer (you can use the scooped-out bread for croutons or in another recipe).","Combine the mayonnaise and mustard, then spread 2 tbsp over the inside of the loaf, and 1 tbsp inside the lid. Spoon most of the cranberry sauce into the lid, followed by half the spinach, the crispy onions, and half the turkey. Arrange the rest of the turkey in the base of the loaf, followed by the rest of the cranberry sauce, the pigs in blankets, stuffing and remaining spinach. Top the loaf with the stuffed lid, press down lightly, then tightly wrap and chill for at least 3 hrs.Sliceinto four or six wedges to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5930,5930,'en','Chicken & avocado sandwich topper','Lean chicken makes a great base for a sandwich. Combine with fresh salad ingredients and a little low-fat mayonnaise','["2 tsp low-fat mayonnaise","slices cooked chicken","½  small avocado, diced","squeeze of lemon","chopped red onion","coriander leaves","halved cherry tomatoes","slice wholemeal seeded bread or rye, or wholegrain pitta, to serve"]','["Top bread or fill pitta with mayonnaise and chicken then add avocado, lemon, red onion, coriander and cherry tomatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:16:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5932,5932,'en','Hummus & avocado sandwich topper','Spruce up hummus with coriander, red onion, tomatoes and lemon and stuff into pitta or serve piled on wholegrain or rye bread','["2 big spoonfuls houmous","½  small avocado, diced","squeeze of lemon","some chopped red onion","coriander leaves","some halved cherry tomatoes","slice wholegrain seeded bread or rye, or wholegrain pitta, to serve"]','["Top bread or fill pitta with houmous, then add avocado with lemon, red onion, coriander and cherry tomatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:16:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5934,5934,'en','Prawn cocktail sandwich topper','Make classic prawns in mayonnaise healthier – pile onto bread or stuff in a pitta and serve with a crunchy green salad and some dill for extra flavour','["50g prawns","1 tbsp low-fat mayonnaise","tiny squirt tomato purée","several Little Gem lettuce leaves","some chopped spring onion","slices of cucumber","sprinkling of dill","slice wholegrain seeded bread or rye, or wholegrain pitta, to serve"]','["Stir prawns with mayonnaise and tomato purée. Pile onto the bread or into pitta with lettuce, spring onion, cucumber and dill."]','2026-01-10 12:16:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5936,5936,'en','Curried egg mayo sandwich topper','Spice up traditional egg mayonnaise with a little curry paste. Serve piled on bread or stuffed in pitta alongside crunchy cucumber, lettuce and spring onion','["1 boiled egg, chopped","a little curry paste","1 tbsp low-fat mayonnaise","tiny squirt tomato purée","several Little Gem lettuce leaves","some chopped spring onion","slices of cucumber","slice wholegrain seeded bread or rye, or wholegrain pitta, to serve"]','["Stir boiled egg and curry paste into mayonnaise and tomato purée. Pile onto bread or into pitta with lettuce, spring onion and cucumber."]','2026-01-10 12:16:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5938,5938,'en','Prawn & avocado wrap','Wrap up something healthy for your lunchbox. This sandwich is flavoured with lime, spring onion and spicy sauce','["1 very ripe baby avocado, stoned, peeled and roughly chopped","juice ½ lime","few shakes Tabasco sauce","1 tomato, deseeded and chopped","1 spring onion, sliced","1 seeded flour tortilla (or gluten-free alternative)","handful mixed salad leaves","85g cooked and peeled prawns"]','["Put the avocado in a bowl with the lime juice, Tabasco and some seasoning. Roughly mash, then add the tomato, coriander (if using) and spring onion.","Warm the wrap in the microwave for a few seconds. Spread the avocado mixture down the middle, scatter on the salad leaves and finish with the prawns. Roll up, then eat."]','2026-01-10 12:16:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5940,5940,'en','Fish dogs with lemony fennel slaw','The humble fish finger sandwich gets a facelift – serve in hot dog buns with a fresh and crunchy coleslaw','["6 soft, floury subs or hot dog rolls","800g-900g skinless firm white fish fillets (halibut, gurnard, bream or MSC-approved cod are all good), cut into long thin fillets","6 tbsp plain flour","½  tsp paprika","a little vegetable oil","1 large fennel bulb","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp light salad cream","100g natural yogurt","2 carrots, cut into matchsticks or very coarsely grated","handful flatleaf parsley, roughly chopped","1 preserved lemon (find them in jars with the Moroccan ingredients), halved, seeds from the middle scooped out and discarded, and rind finely chopped"]','["For the slaw, pick the leafy fronds from\r\nthe fennel and set aside. Discard any\r\ngrubby outer layers, quarter the bulb and\r\nthen slice as finely as you can. Mix with\r\nthe lemon juice and leave to marinate for\r\n1 hr, stirring every now and then.","Drain the fennel. Mix the salad cream\r\nand yogurt in a big bowl, then add the\r\nfennel, remaining slaw ingredients,\r\nthe fennel fronds (chopped) and\r\nsome pepper, then mix well.","When ready to serve, split the rolls and\r\nwarm in a low oven. For the fish, mix the\r\nflour with the paprika and some salt on\r\na plate. Dip in the fish fillets and coat\r\nwell. Heat a splash of oil in a frying pan\r\n(non-stick if you have), and fry the fish\r\nfor a couple of mins on each side until\r\ncooked through and it flakes. Divide the\r\nfish between the rolls with the slaw and\r\neat straight away.Any leftover slaw will\r\nbe good for 2-3 days in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:16:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5942,5942,'en','Chicken, carrot & avocado rolls','Healthy, quick and simple tortilla wraps with shredded chicken, vegetables and salad – perfect for little lunchboxes','["75g low-fat soft cheese","3 flour tortillas","1 cooked skinless chicken breast, coarsely shredded","1 large carrot, grated or shredded","1 large avocado, stoned and sliced","handful rocket leaves"]','["Spread the cheese over the tortillas\r\nand top with the chicken, carrot,\r\navocado and rocket.","Tightly roll up each tortilla. Wrap tightly\r\nin cling film, twisting the ends firmly to\r\nseal, and chill until ready.","Unwrap and cut each roll into 4 chunks\r\nto add to your lunchboxes."]','2026-01-10 12:16:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5944,5944,'en','Open cottage cheese & pepper sandwich','Throw a healthy slant on bruschetta by topping your wholemeal toast with cottage cheese, basil and contrasting balsamic','["140g cottage cheese","½ red pepper, thinly sliced","few basil leaves, torn","2 slices sourdough bread or wholemeal bread","drizzle balsamic vinegar (optional)"]','["Layer the cottage cheese, red pepper\r\nand basil with some seasoning in a bowl\r\nor plastic container. Chill until lunchtime.","Toast the bread and cool for 1 min, then\r\ngive the cottage cheese mixture a quick\r\nmix and spoon on. Drizzle with balsamic\r\nvinegar, if you like, and eat straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:16:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5946,5946,'en','Carrot & hummus roll-ups','Roll-up, roll-up – snaffle something superhealthy in a flash with these vegetarian wraps','["200g tub houmous","4 seeded wraps","4 carrots","small handful rocket leaves"]','["Spread the houmous between wraps. Coarsely grate carrots and scatter on top of the houmous, finishing each wrap with a small handful rocket leaves and some seasoning. Roll up and eat."]','2026-01-10 12:16:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5948,5948,'en','Rainbow rolls','For a crunchy top and soft doughy middle, we devised scone-bread hybrid baps, which make use of leftover veg','["250g plain white flour, plus extra for dusting","250g white bread flour","500g seed and grain bread flour","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","100g porridge oats","100g mixed seeds, plus extra for sprinkling","50g walnuts, finely chopped","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","50g cold butter, diced","2 x 284ml pots buttermilk","100g grated courgettes","100g grated carrots","100g grated raw beetroot - wear gloves!","little milk or beaten egg, to glaze"]','["Dust your largest baking sheet or tray\r\nwith flour. Mix the flours, yeast, oats,\r\nseeds, nuts, bicarbonate and 2 tsp salt\r\nin a bowl, then rub in the butter with\r\nyour fingers until it almost disappears.","Pour in the buttermilk and 150-200ml\r\nwater and mix quickly with a wooden\r\nspoon, then your hands, to form a dough.\r\nDivide into 3 and knead a grated veg into\r\neach to make a courgette dough, a carrot\r\ndough and a beet dough. Form each into\r\n6 rounds with floured hands. Arrange,\r\nspaced apart, on the baking tray, cover\r\nloosely with oiled cling film, and leave to\r\nrise somewhere warm for 30 mins.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nBrush the tops with milk or egg, scatter\r\nwith extra seeds and bake for 30-35 mins\r\nuntil the bases are pale golden and sound\r\nhollow when tapped. Cover with a tea\r\ntowel and leave to cool a bit – this will\r\nkeep them soft."]','2026-01-10 12:16:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5950,5950,'en','Smoked trout & cucumber open sandwiches','This fresh and healthy lunchtime filler is ready in a flash','["125g pack skinless hot-smoked trout fillets","½ a 250g tub Quark","½-1 tsp horseradish sauce","squeeze lemon juice","2 thick slices granary bread","¼ cucumber, sliced","25g watercress","2 handfuls cherry tomatoes, to serve"]','["Flake the fish into a large bowl, then\r\nstir in the quark and horseradish sauce\r\nto taste. Season with black pepper and\r\na squeeze of lemon juice.","Toast the bread, then top each piece\r\nwith cucumber slices and watercress.\r\nSpoon half the trout pâté on top of each\r\nand serve with halved cherry tomatoes\r\non the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5952,5952,'en','Carrot & raisin sandwiches','A vegetarian sandwich with a difference, this light filling is simple and great for afternoon tea or lunch boxes','["1 large carrot, peeled and grated","2 tbsp raisins","1 tbsp olive oil","½  tbsp white wine vinegar","1 tbsp chopped mint","4-6 slices brown bread","3 tbsp houmous"]','["Mix the carrot with the raisins, olive oil and vinegar. Season and add the mint.","Spread 2-3 slices of the bread with houmous, top with the carrot mix and sandwich with 2-3 more slices. Cut into your desired shapes."]','2026-01-10 12:16:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5954,5954,'en','Tartines with roasted tomatoes & mint pesto','French open-faced cheese and tomato toasted sandwiches, drizzled with light mint and garlic pesto and spread with ricotta','["8 medium-sized vine-ripened tomatoes, halved","4 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","4 thick slices wholemeal bread","1 garlic clove, left whole","25g pine nuts, toasted","small bunch mint","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","100g ricotta","green salad, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nPut the tomato halves in a roasting\r\ntin in a single layer. Drizzle with\r\n1 tbsp of the oil, season well and\r\nroast for 20 mins. Set aside.","Toast the bread, then rub with\r\nthe garlic – save the clove for the\r\npesto. Brush a bit more oil over\r\nthe bread and put on 4 plates.","Using a food processor, whizz\r\ntogether the pine nuts, mint, garlic,\r\nremaining oil and vinegar. Thickly\r\nspread the ricotta on the bread,\r\nthen top with the roasted\r\ntomatoes and some mint pesto.\r\nServe with a salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5956,5956,'en','Empanada-style Sri Lankan fish patties with curry aïoli','Make these moreish Sri Lankan fish patties to feed a crowd. Served with a quick curry aïoli for dipping, they take a bit of effort but are well worth it','["300g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","½ tsp fine salt","100g unsalted butter, cold and cubed","1 egg yolk, beaten","80ml coconut milk","125g potatoes (1 medium-large potato)","500ml rapeseed oil, for deep-frying, plus 1 tbsp","½ red onion, finely chopped","1½ garlic cloves, finely chopped","½ thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely chopped","½ tsp turmeric","¼ tsp cumin","pinch of ground cinnamon","pinch of ground cloves","½ tsp ground black pepper","150g canned mackerel or tuna, drained","¼ small bunch of dill, finely chopped","½ tsp fine salt","¼ lime, juiced","1 egg white, beaten","1 small garlic clove, crushed","1 tsp lemon juice","½ tsp curry powder","4 tbsp mayonnaise"]','["For the pastry, mix the flour and salt together in a largemixing bowl. Add the butter and rub into the flour until it’s the texture of breadcrumbs. Mix the beaten egg yolk into the dough. Slowly pour in the coconut milk, kneading the dough until it just comes together. Add a little flour or water if needed. Wrap and chill for an hour.¼½","Meanwhile, make the filling. Put a pan of water on to boil.Peelthe potato and chop into 1cm cubes, then add to the pan and simmer over a medium heat for 10-12 mins until cooked through. Drain and leave to cool.","Heat the 1 tbsp oil in asaucepanand cook the onion, garlic and ginger for 8 mins until golden. Add the spices and black pepper, stir and cook for 1 min, then add the fish and dill, and cook for another 2-3 mins. Add the potato and salt, and mix well, cooking for 2 mins. Take the pan off the heat, add the lime juice and leave to cool.","Break the pastry in half and roll out each half, in turn, on a floured surface to a depth of 3mm. If you have one, use a 7cm pastry cutter to cut out eight circles from each sheet of pastry, re-rolling the pastry and cutting circles until it’s all used up. There will be about 26-28 in total.","Spoon 1 tsp of the fish mixture onto each of the pastry circles. Using a small pastry brush, brush some egg white along the edges of each of the pastry circles. Fold each one to make an empanada shape. Using a fork, press along the sides to ensure they are fully sealed.","Pour 500ml oil into a saucepan making sure it’s no more than two-thirds full, and heat to 180C, or until a little piece of pastry starts to sizzle. Carefully deep-fry the patties in small batches for 2-4 mins, turning halfway through until golden. Remove with a slotted spoon and place on kitchen paper to absorb excess oil.","Put all the ingredients for the aïoli in a mixing bowl, stir together and serve with the empanadas."]','2026-01-10 12:16:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5958,5958,'en','Mini cheese & onion pasties','Rustle up these little cheese and onion pasties for a family picnic. If you won’t eat all 12, they freeze well and can be cooked straight from frozen','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 onions, sliced","4 thyme sprigs, leaves picked","150g mature cheddar (or a mixture of strong hard cheeses), grated","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard","4 spring onions, sliced","250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","125g cold butter","large pinch of cayenne pepper","½ tsp English mustard powder","1 large egg, beaten"]','["First, make the pastry. Tip the flour into a bowl. Holding the block of butter in its wrapper, grate it directly into the flour (you may need to dip the end of the butter into the flour occasionally if it becomes sticky). Add the cayenne pepper, mustard powder and half the beaten egg, and season with a pinch of salt. Bring everything together with your hands until the mixture starts to clump together. Tip the pastry onto the work surface and knead very briefly into a smooth ball, adding up to 3 tbsp cold water if it’s too dry. Squash the pastry into a disc. Wrap and chill while you make the filling.","Heat the oil in afrying panand cook the onions and thyme leaves for 8-10 mins until the onions have softened and started to caramelise. Tip into a bowl and leave to cool. Once cool, mix in the grated cheese, mustard and spring onions.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a baking tray with baking parchment.Rollthe chilled pastry out on a lightly floured surface to the thickness of a £1 coin. Cut out as many 10-12cm circles as you can (you can use a cup or mug as a template), then re-roll any off-cuts and repeat. You should get about 10-12 circles in total.","Spoon a mound of the filling into the centre of each pastry circle, leaving the edges clear. Working with one circle at a time, brush a little of the remaining beaten egg around the edge, then bring two sides up to meet in the middle in a half-moon shape. Pinch the pastry together, crimping the edge to seal. Transfer to the baking tray and repeat with the remaining pastry circles and filling. Brush all the pasties with some beaten egg.Will keep frozen for two months.","Bake the pasties for 20-25 mins (or 40-45 mins from frozen) until the pastry is deep golden brown. Leave to cool for at least 10 mins before eating warm, or cool completely and pack intocontainersfor a picnic.Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:16:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5960,5960,'en','Siberian pelmeni dumplings','Challenge yourself in the kitchen with these fantastic Siberian pelmeni dumplings. With a mixture of lamb and veg fillings, enjoy with the accompanying broth','["350g ''00'' flour plus extra to dust","1 large egg","250g lamb mince","½ onion, finely chopped","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp smoked paprika","¼ chilli powder","small bunch of dill, finely chopped","1 tbsp sunflower oil","200g mixed mushrooms, finely chopped","½ onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","small bunch of flat leaf parsley, finely chopped","dash of soy sauce","75g pine nuts, finely chopped","2 bay leaves","1 vegetable stock cube","small bunch of dill, leaves picked","soured cream, to serve","butter, to serve (optional)"]','["To make the dough, sift the flour into a bowl. Make a well in the middle and add a pinch of salt, the egg and 100ml water, gradually mixing the flour into it with your hands to form a firm dough. Knead well for 5-7 mins. Cover and chill for 30 mins. In the meantime prepare your fillings.","Thoroughly mix the meat filling ingredients together in a large bowl with a pinch of salt.","To make the vegetable filling, heat the oil in a largefrying panand fry the mushrooms, onion, garlic and parsley with the soy sauce for 5 mins. Turn off the heat and stir through the pine nuts and some salt and pepper. Let the mixture cool before handling.","Rollthe dough out on a lightly floured work surface to 1.5mm-thick sheets. For the best results, use a pasta machine.","Cut out discs of the dough that are about 4-6cm in diameter using a shot glass or pastry cutter. Put a teaspoon of filling in the middle of each disc, then use a wet finger to brush lightly onto the dough around the filling. Fold each in half to make a half-moon shape, pressing down to seal. Fold the dumpling again so that the pointed edges of the moon are stuck together.The dumplings can be cooked immediately or frozen in flat layers in freezer bags to be cooked at a later date, using the same method as below but increasing the cooking time by a couple of minutes.","To cook, bring about 3 litres of water to the boil in a largesaucepan, adding the bay leaves and stock cube. Add the dumplings to the boiling broth in batches of around 10, then cook for 5 mins. They are ready when they float to the surface. The meat ones may take a few minutes more than the veg.","Ladle the pelmeni into soup bowls with the cooking broth, topping them with the dill, soured cream and black pepper. If you prefer to have them without the broth, use a slotted spoon to move them to a bowl, adding a generous dollop of butter with the dill, soured cream and black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:16:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5962,5962,'en','Tomato & halloumi slice','Top some puff pastry with cherry tomatoes, peppers and halloumi to make an easy family lunch or supper. Scatter over some basil leaves to serve','["400g cherry tomatoes, halved","1 yellow pepper, thinly sliced","2 tbsp olive oil","400g halloumi, cut into 5mm slices","500g block puff pastry","flour, for dusting","2 tbsp soft cheese","3 tsp milk","1 garlic clove, finely grated","1 egg yolk","handful of basil leaves, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Arrange the tomatoes and peppers on abaking trayin a single layer. Drizzle with half the oil, season with salt and roast for 25 mins.","Meanwhile, heat agriddle panover a medium heat. Lightly brush the halloumi slices with the remaining oil and griddle for 6 mins. Flip and cook for 3 mins more. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Roll the puff pastry out on a lightly dusted surface to roughly 32 x 22cm, and about 1cm thick. Transfer to a large baking tray lined with baking parchment and score a 2cm border around the edges. Combine the soft cheese, 2 tsp milk and the garlic, and spread inside the border.","Turn the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4. Tip away any liquid from the tray of tomatoes and peppers, then arrange the roasted veg over the soft cheese mix. Lay the halloumi on top. Combine the egg yolk and remaining milk, then brush this over the border. Bake for 25 mins until the pastry is golden and risen. Scatter over the basil and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:16:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5964,5964,'en','Cardamom biscuits (nan khatai)','Enjoy these traditional Indian cardamom biscuits with a mug of steamy masala chai. Nan khatai are notable for their crumbly texture and butter-rich flavour','["3 green cardamom pods","40g icing sugar","100g unsalted butter, at room temperature","70g self-raising white flour","25g gram flour","25g semolina","24 skin-on almonds or chopped pistachios"]','["Split the cardamom pods and remove the seeds. Pound the seeds to a powder in apestle and mortarwith 1 tsp of the sugar.","Beat the butter until soft, then gradually add the remaining icing sugar and the ground cardamom. Continue beating until light and creamy, about 10 mins.","Sieve the flour and gram flour into a bowl andwhiskin the semolina and a pinch of salt. Stir into the butter and sugar in two increments. Gently bring everything together into a soft dough.","Roll the dough into small, marble-sized balls with your hands and arrange, spaced out, on baking trays lined with baking parchment.","Slightly flatten the top of each ball and press a whole almond or some chopped pistachios in the middle of each one. Chill for 20 mins.","Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Bake the biscuits for about 20 mins or until golden. Leave to cool before storing in an airtight tin."]','2026-01-10 12:16:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5966,5966,'en','Pumpkin muffins','Try these easy-to-bake cinnamon spiced pumpkin muffins as a mid-morning snack. They’re ideal for Halloween and Bonfire Night, too','["225g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","1 tbsp ground cinnamon (or 2 tsp pumpkin spice)","100g caster sugar","50g soft light brown sugar","200g pumpkin purée (from a can or homemade – see ''goes well with'' below)","2 large eggs","125g slightly salted butter, melted"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line a 12-hole muffin tin with muffin cases. Mix the flour, baking powder, cinnamon and both sugars together in a largebowl. Break up any lumps of brown sugar by rubbing them between your fingers.","Whiskthe purée and eggs together in a jug, then add to the dry ingredients with the melted butter. Whisk for 1-2 mins with an electric hand whisk until just combined.","Bake for 15 mins until golden and risen and a skewer inserted comes out clean. Lift onto awire rackto cool completely.Will keep for three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:16:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5968,5968,'en','Eggy cheese crumpets','Swap your regular toast or sandwiches at lunch or breakfast time for these delicious eggy cheese crumpets. Enjoy with cherry tomatoes and sliced avocado','["3 eggs","50ml milk","6 crumpets","250g cherry tomatoes, halved","drizzle of vegetable oil","40g cheddar, grated","2 small ripe avocados, sliced"]','["Heat the grill. Beat the eggs and milk together in a wide dish. Submerge the crumpets in the egg mixture, turning them once, then set aside for a few minutes.","Arrange the tomatoes cut-side up on a baking tray and grill for a few minutes, then cover the tray with foil to keep the tomatoes warm.","Heat the oil in a frying pan and cook the crumpets for a few minutes on each side until the egg has set – you may have to do this in batches. Transfer them to a baking tray as you go. Once all the crumpets are cooked, top with the cheese and grill for 1-2 mins until the cheese is bubbling and golden. Serve with the tomatoes and avocado slices."]','2026-01-10 12:16:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5970,5970,'en','Crispy tofu','Fry tofu in a coating of smoked paprika, garlic and seasoning to make these crispy tofu bites. Eat as a snack or as a starter or side dish in a veggie feast','["400g block firm tofu","3 tbsp cornflour","½ tsp garlic granules","½ tsp smoked paprika","½ tsp fine sea salt","½ tsp ground black pepper","2 tbsp vegetable oil"]','["Drain the tofu, wrap in 4-5 sheets of kitchen paper, put on a plate and put something heavy over the top, like a wooden chopping board, or a tray with a few tins on it. Leave for 20 mins to drain the excess moisture from the tofu.","Mix the cornflour, garlic, paprika, salt and pepper in a small bowl. Unravel the tofu from the paper, cut in half through the centre, then cut into triangles, cubes or strips.","Toss the tofu pieces in the spiced cornflour to coat all over. Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying pan over a medium-high heat. Fry the tofu for 2-4 mins on each side until golden, crunchy and browned at the edges. Smaller cubes will take 2 mins each side, larger triangles will take 4 mins. Cook in batches if you need to, adding a little more oil if the pan gets dry.","Drain the cooked tofu on kitchen paper and season with a pinch more salt before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:16:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5972,5972,'en','Smashed cannellini bean tartine','A mix of garlic, chilli, parsley and smashed cannellini beans top these no-cook tartines along with feta and tomatoes. They''re quick and easy, and healthy, too','["400g can cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 large lemon, zested and juiced","1 small garlic clove, finely grated","1 small red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1⁄2 small bunch parsley, finely chopped","8 cherry tomatoes, halved","2 slices sourdough","15g feta, crumbled","50g rocket"]','["Put the beans, 1 tbsp of the oil, the lemon zest and juice and the garlic in a food processor and blitz to create a chunky texture. Transfer to a bowl and stir through the chilli, parsley and cherry tomatoes.","Lightly toast the bread and pile on the cannellini bean smash, scatter over the feta and drizzle with the remaining oil. Serve with the rocket on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5974,5974,'en','Roast aubergines with yogurt & harissa','Looking for a simple side or starter that delivers on taste? Look no further than roast aubergines with yogurt and harissa. It''s vegetarian and gluten free','["4 aubergines","2 tbsp olive oil","75g butter","1 tbsp shop-bought harissa, or homemade (seeour recipe)","6 tbsp Greek yogurt","1 small garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp chopped coriander","1 tsp sesame seeds"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/190C fan/gas 6. Pierce the aubergines a few times with the tip of a knife, then brush with olive oil and put them on a baking sheet. Roast for about 40-45 mins, or until the aubergines are completely tender.","Melt the butter in a pan, then stir through the harissa (see our recipe). Cut the aubergines in half, opening them up a bit like a baked potato. Put them on a warm platter and season the inside of each one, then mix the yogurt with the garlic. Spoon some of this into each aubergine, then drizzle over the spiced butter. Scatter over the coriander and sesame seeds to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5976,5976,'en','Lighter Scotch eggs','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThe picnic classic gets a healthy makeover – two thirds of the fat is knocked off by using lentils and lean pork and baking instead of frying','["5 tsp rapeseed oil","1 shallot, finely chopped","5 medium egg","85g green lentil (drained weight from a 400g can)","225g extra lean pork mince (less than 5% fat)","2 tsp finely chopped sage","3 tsp finely snipped chive","½  tsp dry mustard powder","good pinch of grated nutmeg","1 tbsp plain flour","25g panko crumbs (Japanese breadcrumbs)"]','["Heat 1 tsp of the oil in a small non-stick frying pan. Tip in the shallot and fry for a few mins until softened. Transfer to a plate and set aside to cool. (No need to wash the pan, you can use it later.)","Meanwhile, put 4 of the eggs in a medium pan, covering well with cold water. Bring to the boil – as the water starts to bubble, set the timer and boil for 5 mins. When cooked, pour off the boiling water and cool the eggs under cold water to stop them from cooking further. Mash the lentils well in a medium bowl with the back of a fork, then stir in the pork mince, sage, 2 tsp of the chives, the mustard, nutmeg, cooled shallots, a pinch of salt and a generous grating of black pepper. Peel the shells from the eggs and pat dry with kitchen paper.","Divide the meat mix evenly into 4. Tip the flour onto a plate and roll in each egg to coat, tapping off any excess. Pat down a quarter of the meat mix on the work surface to a 12-13 cm circle, using the rest of the flour to keep it from sticking. Cup the circle in your hand and place one of the eggs in the centre. With both hands, pat, press and ease the meat mix around the egg until it is completely and evenly covered. Seal really well so there is no join, then pat and roll it into a good shape on the floured surface. Repeat with the rest of the meat mix and cooked eggs.","Mix the panko crumbs on a large plate with the remaining chives. Beat the remaining egg on a plate, brush some all over each coated egg (you won’t use it all), then roll the eggs in the panko crumbs, patting them on to stick. Lay the eggs on a baking parchment-lined baking tray and chill for 20-25 mins (but not overnight). Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.","Heat 2 tsp of the remaining oil in the pan you used for the shallot. When quite hot (it is hot enough when a few panko crumbs dropped in sizzle immediately and start to brown), put in 2 of the Scotch eggs and roll in the oil to coat them well. Set the timer for 2 mins, then fry, turning often, to brown all over. You are just browning, not fully cooking the eggs at this stage, so don’t overcook or the coating may start to split. Transfer to the lined baking tray and repeat with the remaining eggs, lowering the heat slightly if the pan gets too hot.","Bake the Scotch eggs for 12 mins. Remove and lay them on kitchen paper to drain and leave to cool slightly. Halve the Scotch eggs using a sharp knife and serve slightly warm or cold. Best eaten the same day or, when cold, can be stored overnight in the fridge in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5978,5978,'en','Egg & soldiers','We love this spin on the traditional using asparagus soldiers for your dippy egg – a great low-fat, gluten-free snack or light lunch, just over 100 calories','["1 soft-boiled egg","7 spears of steamed asparagus"]','["Cut the soft-boiled egg in half and serve with the steamed asparagus for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5980,5980,'en','Pitta pocket','A low-fat, healthy snack with chicken, tomatoes and cucumber under 150 calories, and it takes just minutes to prepare','["½  wholemeal pitta bread","25g cooked skinless chicken breast","¼ cucumber, cut into chunks","4 cherry tomatoes, halved"]','["Fill the pitta half with the chicken breast, cucumber and cherry tomatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5982,5982,'en','Mini chicken fajitas','These Mexican inspired party nibbles are filled with spicy chipotle chicken and peppers – make ahead for fuss-free entertaining','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","2 skinless chicken breasts, cut into 1½ cm/½ in chunks","1 red pepper, deseeded and cut into 1½ cm/½ in chunks","1 yellow pepper, deseeded and cut into 1½ cm/½ in chunks","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","¼ tsp hot chilli powder","227g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp chipotle paste","4 spring onions, trimmed and thinly sliced","large pack coriander, leaves chopped","3 large flour tortillas","75g ready-grated mozzarella","1 ripe avocado, stoned and peeled","juice 1 large lime","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 heaped tbsp finely chopped coriander","36 cocktail sticks"]','["Heat the oil in a large, non-stick frying pan or wok and stir-fry the chicken and peppers for 2 mins. Sprinkle over the spices and cook for 30 secs more, stirring. Tip the tomatoes into the pan and stir in the chipotle paste. Simmer for 5 mins or until the sauce is thick and glossy, stirring regularly. Stir in the spring onions and coriander, cook for 1 min more, then remove from the heat and leave to cool.","Cut the tortillas into quarters, then cut each quarter into three pieces, so you have 36 triangles. Place 1 tsp of the chicken mixture and a little cheese at the widest end of a triangle. Roll the pointed end of the triangle around the filling and secure with a cocktail stick. Place on a baking tray lined with baking parchment. Fill and roll the other triangles. Cover with cling film and chill for up to 8 hrs until ready to reheat.","To make the dip, mash all the ingredients in a bowl until almost smooth. Cover the surface of the dip with cling film and chill for up to 24 hrs.","When ready to serve, heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Uncover the fajitas and bake for 6-8 mins or until hot throughout. Serve with the guacamole."]','2026-01-10 12:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5984,5984,'en','Indian oven chips','Spice up potato wedges with turmeric, ginger, garlic and fennel seeds for an Indian-inspired side dish – perfect to share with friends','["1kg floury potatoes such as Maris Piper, peeled and cut into chunky chips","½  tsp turmeric","3 tbsp sunflower oil","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and chopped, or finely grated into a paste","3 garlic cloves, peeled and chopped, or finely grated into a paste","1 tsp fennel seeds","generous pinch of cayenne pepper"]','["The day before you plan to eat them, tip the potatoes into a pan of cold water and add the turmeric and pinch of salt. Bring to the boil, and simmer gently for 2-3 mins until just cooked. Drain, leave to cool, then chill overnight if you can.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Drizzle 1 tbsp of the oil in a shallow roasting tin (preferably non-stick), and place in the oven. Pour the rest of the oil into a large bowl and add the ginger, garlic, fennel seeds and cayenne pepper. Tip the cold chips into the bowl and gently toss with your fingers until evenly coated. Remove the tray from the oven and scatter over the chips. Use a spatula to coat the chips in the hot oil, then lay them out in a single layer and roast for 30 mins. Use the spatula to turn, then return to the oven for 15 mins until crisp and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:16:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5986,5986,'en','Frozen fruit sticks with passion fruit & lime drizzle','On a hot day you''ll be glad of this fruity, frozen snack that is low-fat and a great source of vitamin C – perfect for kids','["100g strawberries, hulled and halved","8 seedless grapes","100g/4oz mango chunks","100g/4oz melon chunks","2 kiwi fruit, peeled and cut into chunks","100g/4oz pineapple chunks","juice 2 limes","4 passion fruits, halved and seeds scraped out","1 tsp icing sugar"]','["Mix the drizzle ingredients in a\r\nsmall bowl, stirring until the sugar\r\nhas dissolved. If you want the sauce\r\nto be smooth, pass it through a\r\nsieve to remove the seeds, or leave\r\nthem in if you prefer.","Skewer the fruits onto wooden\r\nskewers and drizzle the sauce on\r\ntop, reserving a little for dipping.\r\nPop the skewers in the freezer for\r\n45 mins, until just starting to freeze.\r\nServe with the leftover drizzle."]','2026-01-10 12:16:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5988,5988,'en','Spiced pea & potato rolls','A superhealthy vegetarian dish that makes the most of your storecupboard staples','["2 tbsp vegetable oil or sunflower oil","2 onions, finely sliced","300g potatoes, cut into small cubes","1 heaped tbsp curry paste","140g frozen or fresh peas","4 large sheets filo pastry, cut in half","tomatoes, onion and mango chutney, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nHeat half the oil in a non-stick frying\r\npan. Tip in the onions and cook until\r\nsoft and golden, about 8-10 mins.","Meanwhile, boil the potato cubes for\r\n5 mins, until just tender, then drain. Tip\r\ninto the softened onions and fry for\r\n2 mins more. Stir in the curry paste and\r\ncook for 2 mins. Pop in the peas, plus\r\n1 tbsp water. Cook for 1 min, give\r\neverything a good mix and season. Tip\r\ninto a bowl to allow to cool slightly.","Brush half the filo half-sheets with\r\nsome of the remaining oil, then lay the\r\nremaining sheets on top so you have\r\n4 x double layers. Spoon a ¼ of the\r\npotato mix along one edge of each,\r\nleaving a bit of space at each end. Fold\r\nin the ends then roll up to seal. Place\r\nseam-side down on a baking sheet,\r\nbrush with the remaining oil and bake\r\nfor 20 mins, or until crisp. Serve warm\r\nwith a dollop of mango chutney and a\r\ntomato & onion salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5990,5990,'en','Lemon & coriander hummus','Hummus is so easy to make and beats shop-bought varieties every time. Try it with vegetable crudités in your packed lunch','["2 x 400g cans chickpeas in water, drained","2 fat garlic cloves, roughly chopped","3 tbsp Greek yogurt","3 tbsp tahini paste","3 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil, plus extra","zest and juice 2 lemons","20g pack coriander"]','["Put everything but the coriander into\r\na food processor, then whizz to a fairly\r\nsmooth mix. Scrape down the sides of\r\nthe processor if you need to.","Season the houmous generously, then\r\nadd the coriander and pulse until roughly\r\nchopped. Spoon into a serving bowl,\r\ndrizzle with olive oil, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5992,5992,'en','Fruity coconut creams','A quick low-fat pud that''s easy to make and easy to adapt','["1 x 50g/2oz sachet coconut cream","500g 0% Greek yogurt or tub quark","85g icing sugar, sieved","few drops vanilla extract","2 kiwi fruit","400g can pineapples chunks"]','["Dissolve the coconut cream in 50ml boiling\r\nwater, then leave to cool. Spoon the quark or\r\nyogurt into a mixing bowl, then stir in the icing\r\nsugar and vanilla. Combine with the coconut\r\nmix, then spoon into individual glasses. Chill\r\nuntil ready to serve.","Peel and chop the kiwi fruit into small pieces.\r\nDrain the pineapple, then chop the chunks into\r\nsmall pieces. Mix the fruit together, then spoon\r\nover the top of the coconut creams to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5994,5994,'en','Smoky chipotle pepper salsa','Take a little pot of salsa in your lunchbox to enjoy with vegetable crudités, tortilla chips or pitta bread','["2 red peppers, halved lengthways","6 ripe tomatoes, halved","1 garlic clove, crushed","juice 1 lime","1 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","2 tsp chipotle paste","1 red onion, finely chopped","20g pack coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Heat grill to high. Put peppers onto a\r\nbaking sheet, skin-side up, grill until skins\r\nare black, then put into a bowl and cover.\r\nLeave until cool, then peel skins away.","Scoop out and discard tomato seeds.\r\nPut tomatoes into a food processor with\r\ngarlic, lime juice, oil and chipotle paste.\r\nAdd peppers, then pulse until chunky. Stir\r\nonion and coriander through, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5996,5996,'en','Harissa sweet potato wedges','Sweet potato chips make a healthy, high-fibre alternative to traditional chips, but taste just as good (if not better!)','["1kg sweet potatoes, scrubbed and cut into wedges","1 tbsp harissa paste","soured cream and chives, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. In a\r\nlarge bowl combine the wedges with the\r\nharissa. Transfer to a baking tray and cook\r\nfor 40-45 mins until the potatoes are tender\r\nand crispy at the edges. Serve with\r\nsoured cream mixed with snipped chives."]','2026-01-10 12:16:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(5998,5998,'en','Instant frozen berry yogurt','Three ingredients and two minutes is all you need to whip up this low-fat, low-calorie yogurt, which is ideal for eating after exercise or a long day of learning at school.','["250g frozen mixed berries","250g 0%-fat Greek yogurt","1 tbsp honey or agave syrup"]','["Blend berries, yogurt and honey or agave syrup in a food processor for 20 seconds, until it comes together to a smooth ice-cream texture. Scoop into bowls and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6000,6000,'en','Leafy greens soup with chilli-honey halloumi croutons','Make this vibrant green soup with any leafy greens or herbs you spot discounted at the supermarket for a budget-friendly and nutritious lunch','["3 tbsp olive oil","1 onion , or bunch of spring onions, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , finely chopped","3 floury potatoes , around 500g, unpeeled and cut into 2cm cubes","1 litre vegetable stock","100g crème fraîche","300g any past-their-best greens (spinach, salad leaves, kale or cavolo nero), roughly torn","200g frozen peas","small handful past-their-best soft herbs , roughly chopped","1 tbsp harissa paste","1 tbsp honey","250g block halloumi , cut into 2cm cubes, drained and patted dry","toasted buttered sourdough , to serve"]','["Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in a large, deep saucepan over medium-high heat. Stir in the onion and a pinch of salt and cook for 6-8 mins until softened around the edges. Stir in the garlic and potatoes and cook for 2-3 mins until fragrant. Pour over the stock and bring to a simmer. Let it bubble away for 10-15 mins until the potatoes are just tender then pour in the crème fraîche, greens and frozen peas. Bring back to a simmer and cook for 4-5 mins until the greens have all wilted and the crème fraîche has dissolved. Stir in the herbs and using a hand blender, blitz until smooth. Season.","Meanwhile, heat the remaining oil in a frying pan. Stir in the harissa and honey and let it melt. Pour into a bowl, then add the halloumi to the pan and brown all over, shuffling the pan occasionally for 4-5 mins. Return the harissa mixture to the pan and stir quickly to coat the halloumi. Scatter the halloumi croutons on top of the soup and serve the sourdough on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6002,6002,'en','Calming green soup','Pack in the veg with this healthy soup. Top with a drizzle of yogurt, some mint leaves and black pepper. It’s great reheated for lunch if you have leftovers','["1½ tbsp vegetable oil","2 red onions, chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","2 tsp cumin seeds","2 courgettes, roughly chopped","1 large potato, around 300g, peeled and roughly chopped","1.3 litres vegetable stock, made with a low-salt stock cube","250g frozen peas","400g baby spinach","20g mint, roughly chopped, a few leaves left whole (to serve)","150ml pot low-fat natural yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large, deep pan and cook the onions with a large pinch of salt for 10-12 mins until softened but not golden. Add the garlic, cumin seeds, courgettes and potatoes and cook for 5-6 mins, stirring often, until softened. Cover with the stock and season well.","Bring to the boil, reduce to a simmer and bubble for 15-20 mins until the potatoes are very soft.","Pour in the peas and wilt in the spinach in handfuls. Sprinkle in the chopped mint and cook for 3 mins more, then blend in a high-powered blender or using ahand blender. Season, then divide between four bowls and top with the yogurt, remaining whole mint leaves and a grinding of black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:16:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6004,6004,'en','Chunky vegetable soup','Make this vegetable soup for a healthy lunch. Cottage cheese is the secret ingredient in the gluten-free dumplings – a healthier option and adding in calcium','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 leeks (350g), sliced","3 garlic cloves, finely grated","300g baby potatoes, sliced","1l vegetable stock made with 2 tsp bouillon powder (gluten-free, if needed)","250g asparagus, stems cut into chunks, tips separated","160g baby frozen broad beans or soya beans","400g can borlotti beans, drained","4 tomatoes, chopped","30g pack of basil, stems and leaves separated and finely chopped","300g tub cottage cheese","75g gram (chickpea) flour, sifted","1 egg, beaten","3 tbsp basil stems and leaves (taken from the 30g in the soup ingredients above)"]','["First, make the dumplings. Tip the cottage cheese into a bowl and mash to smooth slightly. Mix in the flour, egg and basil, then set aside for about 10 mins for the flour to absorb the moisture.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the leeks, garlic and potatoes for 10-15 mins, or until softened. Pour over the bouillon, then add the asparagus stems, all of the beans, the tomatoes and and remaining basil stems. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer, cover and cook over a medium heat for 10 mins until the veg is tender. Stir in the asparagus tips and remaining basil leaves, and cook a few minutes more. Set aside.","Heat a deep frying pan filled with water to a gentle simmer, then use an ice-cream scoop to scoop eight dumplings into the simmering water. Cook for 5 mins, or until the dumplings rise to the surface.","To serve, divide two portions of soup between bowls and top each with two dumplings. Keep the rest for another day.Will keep chilled in an airtight container for four days. Reheat in a pan for 10 mins over a low heat until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:16:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6006,6006,'en','Leek & broccoli soup with cheesy scones','Support good gut health and digestion with brassica vegetables, like broccoli. Serve a bowl of broccoli goodness with cheesy scones using this recipe','["375g leeks, thinly sliced","400g potatoes, peeled and cut into medium chunks","2 garlic cloves, chopped","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","340g broccoli, roughly chopped","250ml milk","165g plain wholemeal flour","1 tsp baking powder","20g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, finely grated","1 tsp mustard powder","100ml milk","½ tbsp olive oil","65g soft goat''s cheese","4 tomatoes, sliced, to serve"]','["Tip the leeks, potatoes and garlic into a large pan with the bouillon. Pour over 800ml boiling water, stir well, cover and simmer for 15 mins.","Add the broccoli to the pan, then cover and cook for 5 mins more until just tender. Blitz with ahand blenderuntil smooth, then pour in the milk and blitz again. Add a little stock if the soup looks too thick.","To make the scones, heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and line a baking tray with baking parchment. Put the flour and baking powder in a bowl with the all but 1 tbsp of the parmesan and all the mustard powder. Gradually add the milk and oil, stirring with a cutlery knife until the mixture comes together. Shape into a log, about 16cm long and 6cm wide, and press the remaining parmesan on top. Cut in half along the length, then halve each of those pieces again to create four wedge-like scones. Arrange the scones on the tray and bake for 10-12 mins until golden.","If you''re following the Healthy Diet Plan, reserve two of the scones for another day.Will keep covered for up to three days. Halve the remaining two and top with half the goat’s cheese and half the tomato. Ladle half the soup into two bowls and serve with the scones.The remaining soup will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:16:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6008,6008,'en','Tomato & basil soup','Combine fruity sundried tomatoes with tinned tomatoes to make this rich tomato soup with a homemade basil pesto – perfect for the depths of winter.','["1 tbsp butter or olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","5 soft sundried or SunBlush tomatoes in oil, roughly chopped","3 x 400g cans plum tomatoes","500ml turkey or vegetable stock","1 tsp sugar, any type, or more to taste","142ml pot soured cream","125g pot fresh basil pesto","basil leaves, to serve"]','["Heat the butter or oil in a large pan, then add the garlic and soften for a few minutes over a low heat. Add the sundried or SunBlush tomatoes, canned tomatoes, stock, sugar and seasoning, then bring to a simmer. Let the soup bubble for 10 mins until the tomatoes have broken down a little.","Whizz with a stick blender, adding half the pot of soured cream as you go. Taste and adjust the seasoning – add more sugar if you need to. Serve in bowls with 1 tbsp or so of the pesto swirled on top, a little more soured cream and scatter with basil leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:16:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6010,6010,'en','Purple sprouting broccoli, buttermilk & blue cheese soup','Make the most of seasonal broccoli with this vibrant soup, ideal for lunch or a light supper served with warm crusty bread. Garnish with a sprinkling of mixed seeds and chives','["2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","1 onion, roughly chopped","1 celery stick, roughly chopped","1 large potato (about 300g), cut into 2cm cubes","250g purple sprouting broccoli (stalks, florets and leaves), roughly chopped","1.1 litres vegetable or chicken stock","100ml buttermilk","100g blue cheese, crumbled","3 tbsp double cream","½ lemon, juiced","30g mixed seeds","½ small bunch of chives, finely sliced"]','["Heat the oil in a flameproof casserole or saucepan over a medium heat and fry the onion and celery with a pinch of salt for 10 mins until beginning to soften. Add the potatoes, broccoli and stock, and bring to a simmer. Cover and cook for 20-25 mins, or until the thick broccoli stalks are tender enough to pierce with a cutlery knife. Remove from the heat and add half the buttermilk and 80g of the blue cheese. Blitz everything together using ahand blenderuntil smooth. Season to taste, then stir in the cream, remaining buttermilk and the lemon juice.","Ladle the soup into the bowls and top with the rest of the cheese, the seeds, chives and a drizzle of olive oil, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:16:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6012,6012,'en','Spicy pumpkin soup','Make the most of seasonal squash in the early autumn and try a spicy pumpkin soup. You can toast the seeds, too, and add as a topping','["1 pumpkin, about 1.5-2kg (save the seeds – toast them in a dry pan to serve)","1tbsp garam masala","2tsp ground coriander","2tsp ground cumin","½-1tsp chilli flakes or powder, plus a pinch","3tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","ginger, peeled and finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","900ml veg stock","100ml double cream or crème fraiche, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cut the pumpkin in half and remove the seeds with a spoon (see tip below).Cutinto wedges or chunks (keep the skin on) and tip into a bowl. Put the garam masala, and 1 tsp each of the coriander and cumin into a small bowl and mix with 2 tbsp of the oil and season. Drizzle over the pumpkin and toss well to coat in the spiced oil. Transfer to abaking tray, spread out evenly and roast for 40-45 mins, turning halfway through cooking, until the pumpkin is very soft when pierced with a fork. Leave to cool on the tray for a few minutes.","Heat the remaining 1 tbsp olive oil in a large saucepan and fry the onion with a pinch of salt for 10 mins until soft. Add the ginger, garlic and remaining spices and chilli flakes, and fry for a few more minutes until fragrant. Pour in the stock and bring to a gentle simmer.","When the pumpkin is cool enough to touch, use a spoon to scoop the soft flesh from the skins. Add the soft pumpkin to the stock pan, discarding the skins. Remove from the heat and blitz the soup with a hand blender until creamy and smooth. Season to taste, adding extra chilli or garam masala if you like. Put back over a low heat and stir in the cream. Bring to a gentle simmer, then serve in bowls with a drizzle more cream and a pinch of chilli to serve. Top with toasted pumpkin seeds, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6014,6014,'en','Turkey sausage & pesto soup','Cook up some turkey or chicken sausages and combine with cannellini beans, kale and pesto to make this filling soup. Serve with crusty bread, if you like','["6 turkey or chicken sausages","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling (optional)","1 onion, finely sliced","2 large garlic cloves, thinly sliced","800ml vegetable stock","400g can cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","100g kale leaves, woody stems removed","½ lemon, juiced","60g green pesto","crusty bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Squeeze the meat out of the sausage skins and break into small pieces. Discard the skins. Heat the oil in a wide saucepan over a medium-low heat. Once hot, add the sausagemeat and cook, squashing with aspatula, until browned and slightly crispy, about 6-7 mins. Remove from the pan, transfer to a bowl and cover.","Add the onion to the pan, with an extra splash of oil if the pan is looking dry, and cook for 4-5 mins until softened. Tip in the garlic and cook for 1 min. Pour in the stock, scraping to loosen any stuck-on bits at the bottom. Add the sausage back in along with the beans and bring to a gentle simmer. Cook for another 10 mins, stir in the kale in two batches and cook for a further 2-3 mins until slightly wilted. Stir in the lemon juiceand season lightly with salt and a good amount of black pepper.","Remove the soup from the heat, divide between bowls and top with a spoonful of the pesto. Drizzle over some oil and serve with crusty bread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6016,6016,'en','Broccoli & pea soup with minty ricotta','Make this broccoli and pea soup for lunch or to serve as a starter, and top it with minty ricotta and pine nuts. A healthy dish, it delivers three of your five-a-day','["1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","1 onion, finely chopped","2 celery sticks, chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","200g broccoli, broken into florets","150g fresh or frozen peas","500ml hot low-salt vegetable stock","1 lemon, zested and juiced","100g ricotta","1 tbsp finely chopped mint, plus a few whole leaves to serve","1 tbsp toasted pine nuts","2 slices bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a flameproof casserole pot and fry the onion and celery for 10 mins. Add the garlic and fry for 1 min more.","Add the broccoli, peas and stock, bring to a simmer and cook, covered, for 10-15 mins, or until the broccoli is tender. Tip the mix into a blender and blitz until smooth, or use a hand blender. Season. Stir in half the lemon zest and juice, then taste, and add the rest, if you like.","Mix the ricotta with the mint and a pinch of salt. Ladle the soup into bowls, then top with the minty ricotta and the pine nuts. Drizzle over the extra olive oil and scatter with mint leaves, then serve with sliced bread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6018,6018,'en','Slow cooker chicken soup','Pop the ingredients for this chicken soup into the slow cooker in the morning, and it will be ready by dinner time. Add noodles at the end, if you like','["1 onion, finely chopped","2 celery sticks, finely chopped","2 carrots, chopped into 1½ cm pieces","2 leeks, halved and sliced","1 bay leaf and 3 thyme sprigs, tied together","1 whole medium chicken (about 1.4kg)","2l chicken stock","1 lemon, juiced","½ small bunch of dill or parsley, finely chopped","crusty bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Set your slow cooker to low. Tip in the onion, celery, carrots and leeks and nestle in the bunch of herbs. Sit the chicken on top of the veg and pour over the stock. Cook for 6-8 hours.","Remove the chicken from the slow cooker and transfer to a board. Shred the meat from the bones using two forks, then return the meat to the slow cooker, discarding the bones. Season to taste and stir through the lemon juice.","Remove and discard the bunch of herbs. Ladle the soup into bowls and top with the dill or parsley. Serve with crusty bread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6020,6020,'en','Leek, kale & potato soup topped with shoestring fries','Make our healthy leek, kale and potato soup for an easy vegetarian lunch or supper. Top with shoestring fries for a bit of crunch','["4 large potatoes (around 500g), 3 peeled and cubed, 1 left whole with skin on","1 tbsp cold pressed rapeseed oil","15g butter","5 leeks (around 500g), washed and sliced into half moons","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1½ l vegetable stock (we used Bouillon)","200g kale","2 tbsp half-fat crème fraîche"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/ gas 7 and line a baking tray with parchment. Cut the whole potato into matchsticks using a julienne peeler, or shave thin slices using a vegetable peeler, then cut into matchsticks. Pat dry using kitchen paper, then toss with the oil and some seasoning. Spread out on the tray and roast for 15-18 mins.","Melt the butter in a large saucepan. Add the leeks, chopped potatoes and a pinch of salt, then cook gently for 10 mins until the leeks have softened. Stir in the garlic and cook for 1 min more, then pour in the stock. Simmer for 10-12 mins until the potatoes are soft, then add the kale and cook for 2-3 mins to wilt.","Stir in the crème fraîche, then blitz with a hand blender and season to taste. Divide the soup between bowls and top with the shoestring fries."]','2026-01-10 12:16:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6022,6022,'en','Curried lentil, parsnip & apple soup','This spicy soup combines red lentils, apples and parsnip for a smooth, warming soup – a low fat meal that you can make ahead and freeze','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","3 tbsp medium curry paste","2 medium onions, roughly chopped","500g parsnips (around 5 medium parsnips), peeled and cut into chunks","140g dried red lentils","2 Bramley apples (about 400g), peeled, cored and cut into chunks","1½ l vegetable or chicken stock, made with 1 stock cube","natural yogurt, to serve (optional)","chopped coriander, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan. Fry the curry paste and onions together over a medium heat for 3 mins, stirring. Add the parsnips, lentils and apple pieces. Pour over the stock and bring to a simmer. Reduce the heat slightly and cook for 30 mins, stirring occasionally, until the parsnips are very soft and the lentils mushy.","Remove from the heat and blitz with a stick blender until smooth. (Or leave to cool for a few minutes, then blend in a food processor.) Adjust the seasoning to taste. Heat through gently, then ladle into deep bowls. Serve with natural yogurt and garnish with fresh coriander, if you like. (For freezing instructions see below left.)"]','2026-01-10 12:16:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6024,6024,'en','Moroccan roasted vegetable soup','Roasted roots are perfect for making soup- we used parsnips, butternut squash and carrots, flavoured with ras el hanout spice mix','["1 red onion, cut into 8 wedges","300g carrots, cut into 2cm chunks","300g parsnips, cut into 2cm chunks","300g peeled butternut squash, cut into 2cm chunks","1 small potato, cut into 2cm chunks","2 garlic cloves","1 tbsp ras el hanout","1½  tbsp olive oil","1.3l hot vegetable stock","6 tbsp Greek-style yogurt and 1 tbsp finely chopped mint, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip all the vegetables and the garlic into a roasting tin. Sprinkle over the ras el hanout and some seasoning, drizzle over the oil and give everything a good stir. Roast for 30-35 mins, turning the vegetables over halfway, until they’re tender and starting to caramelise a little.","Transfer the roasted veg to a large saucepan, pour over the hot stock and simmer for 5 mins. Pure?e the soup in a food processor, or in the pan with a hand blender, until smooth, then ladle into a flask for work. If eating at home, serve with a dollop of yogurt, a scattering of mint and a grinding of black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:16:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6026,6026,'en','Cauliflower cheese soup','Throw a new spin on this comforting classic by blending into a smooth and creamy soup','["knob of butter","1 large onion, finely chopped","1 large cauliflower (about 900g/2lb), leaves trimmed and cut into florets","1 potato, peeled and cut into chunks","700ml vegetable stock (from a cube is fine)","400ml milk","100g mature cheddar, diced"]','["Heat the butter in a large saucepan. Tip in the onion and cook until softened, about 5 mins, stirring often. Add the cauliflower, potato, stock, milk and seasoning. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and leave to simmer for about 30 mins until the cauliflower is soft and the potato almost collapsing.","Whizz in a food processor or crush with a potato masher until you get a creamy, thick soup. Top up with more milk to thin a little if serving in mugs. You can make ahead up to 2 days in advance, cool, cover and leave in the fridge until needed, or freeze for up to 1 month. When ready to serve, warm through, ladle into mugs or bowls, top with the cheese pieces, then stir through before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:16:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6028,6028,'en','Creamy fish & mussel soup','A healthy fish stew which takes just 30 minutes','["500g pack mussels in creamy sauce (find these in the chilled aisle)","1l strong, hot fish stock (we used Knorr Touch of Taste concentrate)","500g floury potatoes, cut into sugarcube-size pieces","200g mixed fish","small bunch flatleaf parsley"]','["Drain the sauce from the mussels into a\r\nlarge saucepan and add the stock. Tip in the\r\npotatoes, cover and bring to the boil. Once\r\nboiling, take off the lid and simmer for about\r\n12 mins or until the potatoes are very tender.","Meanwhile, cut the fish into large chunks\r\nand roughly chop the parsley. Stir the fish\r\nand mussels into the soup, then bring\r\nback to a simmer for about 3 mins or\r\nuntil the fish has changed colour and\r\nflakes easily. Stir in most of the\r\nparsley, then serve scattered\r\nwith the rest of the parsley\r\nand eat with crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:16:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6030,6030,'en','Sherried squash soup','A good soup soon becomes a fail safe recipe for any occasion. You can always miss out the sherry if making for children','["1 large onion, halved","4 tbsp dry (fino) sherry","1kg butternut squash peeled, deseeded and chopped","600ml hot vegetable stock (we like Marigold)","seed bread croûtons and flat leaf parsley","2 tbsp olive oil"]','["Fry the onion in the oil for 5 mins until softened. Add the sherry and squash and sizzle for 1-2 mins. Pour in the stock, then cover and simmer for 20 mins until the squash is tender when pierced with a knife.","Whizz in a food processor until smooth. Will keep in the fridge for 2 days, or freeze for 6 weeks. When ready to eat, reheat until bubbling and serve in small portions topped with seed-bread croûtons (see above right) and a parsley sprig."]','2026-01-10 12:16:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6032,6032,'en','Tomato soup','To make the tastiest tomato soup you’ll ever experience wait until the tomatoes are at their most ripe and juicy, around September','["1-1¼kg/2lb 4oz-2lb 12oz ripe tomatoes","1 medium onion","1 small carrot","1 celery stick","2 tbsp olive oil","2 squirts of tomato purée (about 2 tsp)","a good pinch of sugar","2 bay leaves","1.2 litres/ 2 pints hot vegetable stock (made with boiling water and 4 rounded tsp bouillon powder or 2 stock cubes)"]','["Firstly, prepare your vegetables. You need1-1.25kg/2lb 4oz-2lb 12oz ripe tomatoes. If the tomatoes are on their vines, pull them off. The green stalky bits should come off at the same time, but if they don''t, just pull or twist them off afterwards. Throw the vines and green bits away and wash the tomatoes. Now cut each tomato into quarters and slice off any hard cores (they don''t soften during cooking and you''d get hard bits in the soup at the end). Peel1 medium onionand1 small carrotand chop them into small pieces. Chop1 celery stickroughly the same size.","Spoon2 tbsp olive oilinto a large heavy-based pan and heat it over a low heat. Hold your hand over the pan until you can feel the heat rising from the oil, then tip in the onion, carrot and celery and mix them together with a wooden spoon. Still with the heat low, cook the vegetables until they''re soft and faintly coloured. This should take about 10 minutes and you should stir them two or three times so they cook evenly and don’t stick to the bottom of the pan.","Holding the tube over the pan, squirt inabout 2 tsp of tomato purée, then stir it around so it turns the vegetables red. Shoot the tomatoes in off the chopping board, sprinkle ina good pinch of sugarand grind ina little black pepper. Tear2 bay leavesinto a few pieces and throw them into the pan. Stir to mix everything together, put the lid on the pan and let the tomatoes stew over a low heat for 10 minutes until they shrink down in the pan and their juices flow nicely. From time to time, give the pan a good shake – this will keep everything well mixed.","Slowly pour in the1.2 litres/ 2 pints of hot stock (made with boiling water and 4 rounded tsp bouillon powder or 2 stock cubes), stirring at the same time to mix it with the vegetables. Turn up the heat as high as it will go and wait until everything is bubbling, then turn the heat down to low again and put the lid back on the pan. Cook gently for 25 minutes, stirring a couple of times. At the end of cooking the tomatoes will have broken down and be very slushy looking.","Remove the pan from the heat, take the lid off and stand back for a few seconds or so while the steam escapes, then fish out the pieces of bay leaf and throw them away. Ladle the soup into your blender until it’s about three-quarters full, fit the lid on tightly and turn the machine on full. Blitz until the soup’s smooth (stop the machine and lift the lid to check after about 30 seconds), then pour the puréed soup into a large bowl. Repeat with the soup that’s left in the pan. (The soup may now be frozen for up to 3 months. Defrost before reheating.)","Pour the puréed soup back into the pan and reheat it over a medium heat for a few minutes, stirring occasionally until you can see bubbles breaking gently on the surface. Taste a spoonful and add a pinch or two of salt if you think the soup needs it, plus more pepper and sugar if you like. If the colour’s not a deep enough red for you, plop in another teaspoon of tomato purée and stir until it dissolves. Ladle into bowls and serve. Or sieve and serve chilled with some cream swirled in. For other serving suggestions, see opposite."]','2026-01-10 12:16:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6034,6034,'en','Honeyed carrot soup','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyKids love this rich, warming soup but it’s sophisticated enough for adults, too','["2 tbsp butter","2 small leeks, sliced","800g carrots, roughly chopped","2 tsp clear honey","small pinch dried chilli flakes (optional)","1 bay leaf","2½ l vegetable stock","soured cream or yogurt, to serve"]','["Melt the butter in a large saucepan over a medium heat. Add the leeks to the pan, then cook for 3 mins until starting to soften. Add the carrots, honey, chilli (if using) and bay leaf, then cook for 2 mins.","Pour in the stock, bring to the boil, then simmer for 30 mins. Blend the soup in batches, return to a clean pan, then season to taste. When ready to serve, bring back to a simmer, then ladle into mugs. Add a swirl of soured cream or yogurt and serve with garlic bread or bacon butties."]','2026-01-10 12:16:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6036,6036,'en','Baked tomatoes with feta & dukkah','Make your own dukkah spice mix to sprinkle over tomatoes and feta, or buy a ready-made version if you prefer. Serve with sesame flatbreads','["1kg mixture of medium and large ripe tomatoes","1 tsp caster sugar (optional)","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","150g feta, crumbled","4 tbsp dukkah (see below)","parsley and mint leaves, to serve","500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tsp fine sea salt","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp sesame seeds","25g pistachios, shelled and roughly chopped","25g hazelnuts, skinned and roughly chopped","4 tsp sesame seeds","1 tsp coriander seeds","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp caraway seeds"]','["First, make the dukkah, stir the ingredients together and set aside. For the flatbreads, stir the flour, yeast, sugar and salt together in a large bowl. Add 300ml lukewarm water and mix to form a soft, sticky dough. Tip the dough onto a lightly floured work surface and knead for 5 mins until the dough is smooth. Return the dough to the bowl, cover and leave in a warm place to prove until doubled in size, about 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Tip the risen dough out onto a lightly floured work surface and divide into four pieces. Roll each piece into a ball, then roll out each ball into a rough oval, around 4mm thick. Carefully transfer the dough ovals to two large non-stickbaking trays. Brush with the olive oil and sprinkle evenly with the sesame seeds. Bake for 15 mins until golden and firm to the touch. Transfer the baked flatbreads to awire rackand leave to cool.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Cut the tomatoes in half through the equator and arrange in a large ovenproof dish, cut-side up. Season with a pinch of sea salt, some black pepper and the sugar, if needed. Drizzle with the oil and sprinkle over the feta and dukkah.","Bake for 20-25 mins until the tomatoes are tender and juicy and the feta is golden, but not too dark. Leave to rest for 5 mins, then scatter over the fresh herbs. Serve warm with the flatbreads alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:16:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6038,6038,'en','Lemony tuna & asparagus salad box','A new take on the classic salad Niçoise. This lean salad is bulked out by storecupboard cannellini beans and flavoured with dill and lemon','["2 large eggs","200g asparagus, woody ends snapped off, spears halved","160g can tuna in spring water (no need to drain)","1 small red onion, very finely chopped","125g cannellini beans from a can, drained","zest and juice ½ lemon","1 tbsp fresh chopped dill","1 tsp extra virgin olive oil"]','["Put a pan of water on to boil with a steamer above. When boiling, lower the eggs into the water and steam the asparagus above for 8 mins.","Meanwhile, gently toss all the other ingredients together and arrange on plates or in rigid containers. Plunge the eggs into cold water to cool them a little, then peel and quarter. Add the eggs and asparagus to the tuna salad. Will keep in the fridge for 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:16:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6040,6040,'en','Bean, ham & egg salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis satisfying salad, crammed full of green vegetables, new potatoes and lean ham is low calorie and low fat','["2 eggs, hard-boiled","500g baby potatoes","200g green beans","200g frozen peas, defrosted","175g lean ham, shredded","juice ½ lemon","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard","1 tbsp honey","crusty bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Peel and quarter the eggs. Cook the\r\npotatoes in a large pan of boiling water for\r\n8-10 mins or until tender. Tip in the beans\r\nfor the final 3 mins, then add the peas for\r\nthe final min. Drain all the veg, cool under\r\ncold running water, then drain really well.","For the dressing, mix the juice, mustard\r\nand honey together. Season, then pour\r\nover the veg. Fold through the ham and top\r\nwith the eggs. Serve with bread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:16:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6042,6042,'en','Prawn spring roll wraps','These healthy bites make a great light lunch or snack with a little bowl of sweet chilli sauce','["1 bundle dried thread rice noodles (about 60g)","1 tbsp sunflower oil","300g pack fresh stir-fry vegetables - go for a leafy mix","half finger-length fresh root ginger, grated","small bunch coriander, stalks finely sliced, leaves roughly chopped","200g raw peeled prawns, halved","2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce, plus extra to serve","8 small sheets filo pastry","1 tbsp sesame seeds (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Cook\r\nthe noodles according to pack instructions.\r\nHeat 1 tsp oil in a large wok or non-stick frying\r\npan. Stir-fry the vegetables, ginger and\r\ncoriander stalks for 3-4 mins until almost\r\ncooked, but still with a little crunch. Throw in\r\nthe prawns for 1 min until pink, then stir in the\r\nsweet chilli sauce, coriander leaves and\r\nnoodles, then remove from the heat.","Brush 4 sheets of filo with a little of the oil,\r\nthen cover with the remaining sheets. Pile a\r\nquarter of the prawn mixture along the narrow\r\nedge of each sheet, fold over the edges, then\r\nroll up to give you 4 large spring rolls. These\r\ncan now be frozen for up to 1 month; defrost\r\nthoroughly before cooking as below. Brush\r\nwith the remaining oil, sprinkle with sesame\r\nseeds if using, then bake on a baking sheet,\r\nseam-side down, for 15 mins until golden and\r\ncrisp. Serve with a green salad, and a good\r\ndollop of extra chilli sauce on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:16:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6044,6044,'en','Rhubarb & strawberry meringue pots','A tasty, light and fluffy low-fat treat','["450g rhubarb, cut into 4cm/1½in chunks","100g golden caster sugar","grated zest of 1 orange","1 tbsp strawberry conserve","2 eggs, separated"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/\r\nGas 4/fan oven 160C. Put\r\nthe rhubarb in an\r\novenproof dish, sprinkle\r\nover 50g/2oz\r\nof the sugar and the orange\r\nzest and stir together. Cover\r\nand bake in the oven for\r\n35-40 minutes until\r\ntender. (Alternatively, you\r\ncan\r\ncook the rhubarb with the\r\nsugar and zest in the\r\nmicrowave for 10 minutes\r\non full power, stirring\r\nhalfway through the cooking\r\ntime,\r\nuntil just tender.)","Remove the rhubarb from\r\nthe oven and allow to cool\r\nslightly. Stir in the\r\nconserve then the egg yolks.\r\nDivide the rhubarb\r\nmixture between four\r\n175ml/6fl oz ramekins.\r\nPut on a baking sheet and\r\ncook in\r\nthe oven for 10 minutes\r\nuntil lightly thickened.","While the rhubarb is\r\ncooking, whisk the egg\r\nwhites until stiff. Sprinkle\r\nover half\r\nof the remaining sugar and\r\nwhisk again. Gently fold in\r\nthe rest of the sugar. Pile\r\nthe meringue on top of the\r\nrhubarb to cover it\r\ncompletely and swirl the top. Return to the oven for 10 minutes until the meringue is puffy and golden. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:17:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6046,6046,'en','Thai squash soup','Up your vegetable intake with this fragrant pumpkin soup spiced with Asian flavours','["1 onion, chopped","1 lemongrass stalk, bashed and shredded","1-2 red chillies, roughly chopped","1kg butternut squash, peeled and diced","juice 1 lime","125ml coconut milk","small bunch coriander, leaves picked"]','["Fry the onion, lemongrass and most of\r\nthe chilli in a large pan with a splash of\r\nwater for 2-3 mins until softened – add\r\nmore water if it starts to catch. Tip in the\r\nsquash and stir. Cover with 1 litre water,\r\nbring to the boil and simmer for 15 mins\r\nuntil the squash is tender. Add lime juice,\r\nremove from the heat and blitz with a\r\nhand blender until smooth.","Pour in the coconut milk, season, then\r\nreturn to the heat to gently warm through.\r\nLadle into bowls and serve with coriander\r\nand the remaining chilli."]','2026-01-10 12:17:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6048,6048,'en','Stuffed jacket potatoes','A simple baked potato recipe to get kids in the kitchen – this is easy to follow and great for teaching','["4 medium potatoes","100g strong cheddar, grated, plus extra for topping","100g sweetcorn","100g mixed peppers, diced","small handful fresh herbs, such as oregano, basil, coriander, dill or thyme"]','["Equipment you will need: medium\r\nmixing bowl, small mixing bowl,\r\ndessertspoon, fork, baking tray,\r\ngrater, oven gloves.","Get an adult to heat the oven\r\nto 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and bake the\r\npotatoes for about 1 hr until cooked\r\nand the skins are crispy. Leave to cool\r\ncompletely. This can be done up to\r\n2 days ahead.","To stuff the jacket potatoes, heat the\r\noven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Ask an\r\nadult to cut the potatoes in half. Using\r\na spoon, carefully scoop out the middle\r\nof the potato, leaving the skin unbroken\r\n(like a boat). Place the scooped potato\r\ninto a mixing bowl.","Using the fork, mash the potato until\r\nthere are no lumps. Add the cheese,\r\nsweetcorn and peppers and mix well.\r\nGently pick the leaves from the herbs.\r\nYou can rip the larger leaves into smaller\r\npieces. Stir the herbs into the cheesy\r\npotato mixture.","Using the spoon, carefully scoop the\r\nmixture back into the potato boats. Make\r\nsure that you use all the mixture up.\r\nSprinkle with a little extra grated cheese\r\nand place on a baking tray. Using oven\r\ngloves, place the tray in the oven and\r\nbake for 10-15 mins until golden."]','2026-01-10 12:17:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6050,6050,'en','Apple & sultana porridge','A low-fat breakfast of warm oats and fruit that starts the day in a nutritious and filling way','["100g porridge oats","500ml skimmed milk","4 apples, cored and diced","100g sultanas","1 tbsp brown sugar, to serve"]','["Put the oats and milk in a small pan and\r\ncook, stirring, for 3 mins until almost\r\ncreamy. Stir in the apples and sultanas,\r\nthen cook for 2 mins more or until the\r\nporridge is thick and creamy and the\r\napples just tender. Ladle into bowls,\r\nsprinkle with sugar and eat immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:17:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6052,6052,'en','One-pot Moroccan chicken','A North African chicken casserole that’s low in fat, packed with veg and flavoured with harissa','["4 skinless chicken breasts","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely sliced","400g can cherry tomatoes","2 tbsp harissa paste (we used Belazu Rose Harissa)","1 tbsp clear honey","2 medium courgettes, thickly sliced","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed"]','["Season the chicken breasts all over\r\nwith the cumin and lots of ground black\r\npepper. Heat the oil in a large non-stick\r\nfrying pan and cook the chicken with\r\nthe onion for 4 mins. Turn the chicken\r\nover and cook for a further 3 mins.\r\nStir the onions around the chicken\r\nregularly as they cook.","Tip the tomatoes and 250ml water\r\ninto the pan and stir in the harissa,\r\nhoney, courgettes and chickpeas.\r\nBring to a gentle simmer and cook\r\nfor 15 mins until the chicken is tender\r\nand the sauce has thickened slightly."]','2026-01-10 12:17:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6056,6056,'en','Pasta with chilli tomatoes & spinach','A low-fat supper of tasty tomato sauce and penne – wilt down a whole bag of spinach for extra nutrients','["2 tsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","½  tsp dried chilli flakes","200g wholemeal penne pasta","400g can chopped tomatoes","100ml red wine","½  tsp dried oregano","125g bag young spinach leaves","25g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan\r\nand gently fry the onion, garlic and chilli\r\nflakes, stirring regularly, for 5 mins (add\r\na little water if they begin to stick).","Cook pasta following pack instructions.\r\nAdd the tomatoes, wine and oregano\r\nto the frying pan and stir to combine.\r\nBring to a gentle simmer and cook,\r\nstirring occasionally, for 10 mins.","Shake the spinach into the pan\r\nand cook for 1-2 mins until\r\nwilted. Drain the pasta and tip\r\ninto the pan with the sauce.\r\nToss to combine, sprinkle\r\nwith cheese and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6058,6058,'en','Smoked trout salad with fennel, apple & beetroot','Delicate hot-smoked fish is perfectly complemented with crisp apple and aniseed flavours – a great light bite','["½ small fennel bulb, trimmed and thinly sliced","1 green-skinned apple, cored, quartered and sliced","4 spring onions, sliced on the diagonal","100g baby beetroot in mild vinegar, drained and quartered","140g skinless hot-smoked trout fillets","small bunch dill, fronds removed","2 tbsp low-fat natural yogurt","1 tsp horseradish sauce"]','["Put the fennel in a shallow serving\r\ndish and scatter over the apple, spring\r\nonions and beetroots. Flake the trout\r\ninto chunky pieces and arrange on top.\r\nSprinkle with half the dill fronds. Finely\r\nchop the remaining fronds and reserve.","Mix the yogurt and horseradish with\r\n1 tbsp cold water, then stir in the\r\nreserved dill. Pour half the dressing over\r\nthe salad and toss very lightly. Spoon\r\nover the remaining dressing and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6060,6060,'en','Turkey & avocado toast','Layer up creamy avocado with protein-rich, low-fat turkey for a great energy-boosting healthy snack','["1 avocado","juice ½ lime","2-3 small slices ciabatta bread","100g turkey slices"]','["Halve and stone the avocado then scrape out the flesh into a bowl. Squeeze in the lime, season, then mash roughly with a fork. Toast the ciabatta, spread with mashed avocado, top with turkey and finish with ground black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:17:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6062,6062,'en','Butternut squash & spinach filo pie','This crispy pastry-topped pie is crammed full of vegetables so it contains all 5 of your recommended daily intake','["1 butternut squash (about 1kg), peeled, deseeded and cut into 2cm dice","2 red onions, cut into wedges","1 tsp chilli flakes","400g bag spinach","100g feta cheese, crumbled","4 sheets filo pastry","1 tbsp olive oil","green salad, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nPut the squash, onions and chilli flakes\r\nin an ovenproof pie dish (or 4 individual\r\ndishes). Season and cook for 20 mins\r\nuntil the squash is tender and the onions\r\nare starting to char at the edges.","Meanwhile, put the spinach in a\r\ncolander and pour over a kettleful of\r\nboiling water. Squeeze out any excess\r\nliquid and stir into the squash mix. Dot\r\nover the feta, crumple up the pastry and\r\nplace on top, then brush with the oil.\r\nReturn to the oven and cook for a further\r\n15 mins until the pastry is golden and\r\ncrisp. Serve with a green salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6064,6064,'en','Stir-fried curly kale with chilli & garlic','A quick and easy way to give kale a kick – serve with steak, chicken and oriental meals','["1 tbsp olive oil","200g bag curly kale","2 garlic cloves, finely sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and sliced"]','["Heat the oil in a large wok, then add the\r\nkale and a couple tbsp water. Season,\r\nthen stir-fry for 5-8 mins, adding the garlic\r\nand chilli for the final 2 mins. When the\r\nkale is tender and a vibrant green,\r\nremove from the heat and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6066,6066,'en','Sag aloo','Nutritious spinach makes the base for this traditional, healthy Indian side dish, combined with potato and spices','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 tbsp chopped ginger","500g potatoes, cut into 2cm, ¾in chunks","1 large red chilli, halved, deseeded and finely sliced","½  tsp each black mustard seeds, cumin seeds, turmeric","250g spinach leaves"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the onion, garlic and ginger, and fry for about 3 mins. Stir in the potatoes, chilli, spices and half a tsp salt and continue cooking and stirring for 5 mins more. Add a splash of water, cover, and cook for 8-10 mins.","Check the potatoes are ready by spearing with the point of a knife, and if they are, add the spinach and let it wilt into the pan. Take off the heat and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6068,6068,'en','Steamed clams in saffron & spring green broth','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyUpgrade this simple starter to a dinner party main with a splash of dry sherry and a bed of spaghetti','["700ml hot, low-salt chicken stock","75g diced chorizo","1 clove garlic, thinly sliced","pinch of saffron strands","2 small heads of spring greens, finely shredded","1kg small live clams or cockles, washed well","2 tbsp fresh parsley, finely chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","lemon wedges, to serve"]','["Place the stock, chorizo, garlic and\r\nsaffron in a large pan and bring to the\r\nboil. Add the greens, cover and cook\r\nfor 2 mins until completely wilted.","Add the clams, cover and cook over\r\na high heat for 4-5 mins until every clam\r\nhas opened. Stir in the chopped parsley.","Using a slotted spoon, divide the greens\r\nand clams between large, shallow bowls\r\nthen ladle over the broth. Drizzle with oil\r\nand serve with the lemon to squeeze over."]','2026-01-10 12:17:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6070,6070,'en','Oaty fish & prawn gratins','Hit all 5 of your recommended fruit and veg intake with these delicious healthy fish and tomato bakes','["340g bag baby spinach, roughly chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes with garlic and herbs","225g sustainable white fish fillets, chopped into large chunks","small bunch basil, shredded","100g cooked and peeled prawns","2 tbsp finely grated parmesan","2 tbsp breadcrumbs","2 tbsp oats","170g broccoli, boiled or steamed, to serve"]','["Put the spinach in a large colander\r\nand pour over boiling water. Once cool\r\nenough to handle, squeeze out any\r\nexcess water, then season.","Tip the tomatoes into a frying pan with\r\nsome seasoning and simmer for 5 mins\r\nto thicken. Add the fish and heat for\r\n1-2 mins – it doesn’t need to be fully\r\ncooked at this point. Stir in the basil.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nDivide the spinach, fish, prawns and\r\ntomato sauce between 2 gratin dishes.\r\nMix the Parmesan, breadcrumbs and\r\noats together and sprinkle over the top.\r\nBake for 20 mins until golden and\r\nbubbling. Serve with cooked broccoli."]','2026-01-10 12:17:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6072,6072,'en','Shaved kohlrabi salad with pickled jalapeño dressing','Elevate your summer dinner parties with this kohlrabi salad that’s salty, briny and a little spicy. Beautiful on a platter, it can be assembled in minutes','["100g natural yogurt","35g pickled jalapeños , finely sliced, plus 2 tbsp brine from the jar","2 kohlrabi (about 900g), finely shaved using a mandoline","1 red chilli , finely sliced","10g dill , roughly chopped","30g salted peanuts , roughly crushed","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil (optional)"]','["Whisk the yogurt, jalapeño brine and some seasoning together in a large bowl.","Add the kohlrabi and toss well using your hands. Arrange over a serving platter, then scatter over the jalapeño and chilli slices, the dill and peanuts. Drizzle over the olive oil, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6073,6073,'en','Mini pork pies with piccalilli','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyHoel Levieil from London restaurant Frizzante shares this picnic-friendly pork pie recipe, which was voted our users’ favourite Jubilee recipe idea','["few dots of butter","600g shortcrust pastry, bought or homemade","little flour, for dusting","85g dried white breadcrumbs","400g good Cumberland sausages (about 6)","200g smoked bacon lardons","¼ tsp each ground mace, ground pepper and dried sage","1 egg, beaten with a fork","few pinches sesame seeds","piccalilli, homemade or bought, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line each hole of a 12-hole muffin tin with a thin strip of baking parchment across the middle that’s long enough so the ends stick out a centimetre or two – use a dab of butter to stick in place. Roll out two thirds of the pastry on a lightly floured surface and stamp out 12 x 10cm circles (you may need to re-roll trimmings). Press a circle into each hole to line.","Sprinkle 1 tsp of breadcrumbs into the base of each pie. Tip the rest of the crumbs into a mixing bowl. Squeeze in the sausage meat, discarding the skins, along with the bacon, mace, pepper, sage and just a little salt. Get your hands in and mash and squish everything together until the breadcrumbs have just about disappeared. Divide mixture between the holes, packing in firmly and shaping to a dome in the middle.","Roll out the remaining pastry and stamp out 12 x 7cm circles. Brush with a little egg and add a top to each pie, egg-side down to stick, carefully pressing pastry edges together to seal. Brush with more egg (don’t throw away leftovers) and sprinkle with sesame seeds. Bake for 30 mins until golden then carefully remove the pies from the tin, using the parchment ends to help you lift them out. Sit on a parchment lined baking tray, brush all round the sides with more egg and put back in the oven for 8 mins. Cool completely then eat with piccalilli, or your favourite pickle."]','2026-01-10 12:17:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6074,6074,'en','Fresh salmon niçoise','On a balmy summer evening, a warm salad is satisfying yet light. Traditionally, niçoise is made with canned tuna, but the omega-3 fatty acids in the fish don’t make it through the canning process, so we’ve used wild salmon instead','["1 red onion (about 130g), finely chopped","2 tbsp apple cider vinegar","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","12 pitted Kalamata olives, quartered","2 tbsp chopped dill","2 tsp chopped tarragon leaves","400g small baby potatoes","2 eggs","320g fine green beans, trimmed","4 wild salmon fillets (about 100-125g each), defrosted if frozen","2 x 160g Little Gem lettuces, 1 shredded","4 tomatoes, cut into wedges"]','["Combine the onion, vinegar, oil, olives and herbs in a medium bowl.","Boil the potatoes in the base of asteamerfor 10 mins. Add the eggs (top up with boiling water from the kettle if they’re not submerged). Tip the green beans into a pan and put the steamer on top, then cook for 8 mins more.","Remove the potatoes and eggs from thesteamer, but don’t drain. Add the salmon to the water and cook for 5 mins. Stir the warm potatoes into the dressing.","To serve, divide half the lettuce between two plates (or pile onto one platter) along with half the green beans and tomatoes, then spoon half the dressed potatoes on top. Remove and discard any skin from the salmon, then flake half the fish over the salad. Peel one egg, halve and serve one half over each salad. Chill the remaining ingredients for the next day to eat cold.Will keep covered and chilled for up to a day."]','2026-01-10 12:17:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6076,6076,'en','Cucumber soup','The refreshing cucumber soup is served cold, so it will go down well on a summer’s day. Ladle it into bowls for a smaller gathering, or pour into small cups for an amuse-bouche.','["2 cucumbers (about 675g)","150g Greek yogurt","1 to 2 limes, juiced, depending on taste","small handful of tarragon, chopped","3 mint sprigs, leaves picked","small bunch of chives, chopped","rapeseed oil, to serve"]','["Finely chop a third of one of the cucumbers and set aside for when you’re ready to serve later. Roughly chop the remaining cucumbers and tip into a blender orfood processoralong with the yogurt and the lime juice from one lime. Add the tarragon, most of the mint leaves and most of the chives. Blitz until the mixture is smooth. Taste the soup and add some or all of the lime juice from the second lime if you want more acidity.","Pour the soup into bowls or small cups, scatter over the finely chopped cucumber, remaining mint leaves and the rest of the chives. Drizzle with a little rapeseed oil just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6078,6078,'en','Veggie nuggets with summer slaw','Made from protein-rich quinoa and peanut butter, these flavoursome nuggets taste great served with our healthy slaw made with gut-friendly bio yoghurt','["100g quinoa","2 onions (320g), very finely chopped","2 tbsp olive oil","2 x 400g cans black beans, drained","2 tsp dried oregano","3½ tbsp crunchy peanut butter","3 tbsp parsley, chopped","1 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 eggs, beaten","90g pot bio yogurt","1 tsp English mustard powder","1 tsp apple cider vinegar","1 carrot (150g), coarsely grated","1 red pepper, deseeded and finely chopped","1 very small onion, finely chopped","320g white cabbage, finely shredded","4 tbsp chopped coriander"]','["Boil the quinoa for 20 mins following pack instructions, leave to stand for 5 mins, then drain well. Meanwhile, fry the onions in 1 tbsp oil over a medium-low heat for 5 mins with the lid on the pan, then uncover and fry for 5 mins more until soft and starting to colour. Take off the heat, stir in the black beans, oregano, peanut butter, parsley and bouillon, then mash everything together with a potato masher to crush the beans. Add the quinoa and eggs and mix well.","Heat the remaining 1 tbsp oil in a largenon-stick frying panthen, using a measuring tablespoon, scoop rounded spoonfuls of the mixture and add to the pan, spaced apart. Cook for about 2-3 mins each side until the nuggets are browned. Cook half the mixture and save the remainder for another day.Will keep chilled for up to three days.","To make the coleslaw, put the yogurt, mustard powder and vinegar in a bowl, stir together to make a dressing, then add the vegetables and coriander and toss well. Serve half the coleslaw with two portions of the nuggets.The remainder willkeep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:17:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6080,6080,'en','Crispy potato, pepper & chorizo skewers','The whole family will love these quick and easy skewers at the next summer barbecue. If the sun isn’t shining, we’ve given instructions on how to cook them indoors','["500g baby new potatoes","3 Romano or red peppers, cut into chunks","250g cooking chorizo, cut into chunks","2 tbsp olive oil","2 rosemary sprigs, leaves picked and roughly chopped","70g mayonnaise","1 small garlic clove, finely grated","½ lemon, juiced","small pinch of smoked paprika (optional)","few sprigs of parsley, leaves picked (optional)","salad, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat a barbecue or grill. Bring a pan of lightly salted water to the boil. Add the potatoes and cook for 12 mins until a skewer can easily be inserted. Drain and leave to steam-dry. Toss the potatoes with the peppers, chorizo, olive oil and rosemary in a large bowl. Take six to eight large metal skewers and thread the potatoes, peppers and chorizo alternately onto them. Barbecue for 10-15 mins or until lightly charred on the outside, or grill for 5-6mins on each side.","Mix the mayonnaise, garlic and lemon juice together in a small bowl. Sprinkle with some paprika, if you like. Serve the skewers with the parsley scattered over, if using, and the garlic mayo and salad on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:17:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6082,6082,'en','Crunchy chopped salad','Encourage kids to learn essential kitchen skills with this crunchy salad made with pomegranate seeds. The recipe is easy for children aged seven to 11 to follow','["1 lemon","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 tsp Dijon mustard","1 tsp honey","10 cherry tomatoes (use a mixture of different colours, if you like)","1⁄2 cucumber","2 Little Gem lettuces","1 punnet of cress","100g pomegranate seeds","25g mixed seeds (we used sunflower and pumpkin seeds; see tip below)","chopping board","tea towel or kitchen paper (optional)","sharp knife","citrus juicer","tablespoon","teaspoon","jam jar or small bowl","large salad bowl","kitchen scissors","measuring scales"]','["Before you get started take a look at ourchopping and knife skills guide. If yourchopping boarddoesn’t have anti-slip grips, lay a dampened tea towel or sheet of kitchen paper on the work surface, then place the board on top to stop it from slipping.","Holding the lemon with your hand in thebridge position, cut the lemon in half. Push one half onto a citrus juicer, twist and squeeze to release the juice. Repeat with the second lemon half. Pour the juice into a jam jar or small bowl along with the oil.","Add the mustard, honey and a good pinch each of salt and black pepper. Seal the jar and shake to combine, or whisk the ingredients together.Will keep covered in the fridge for up to a week.","Cut the tomatoes in half by pinching each one between your thumb and a finger and carefully slicing through the middle with a smallserrated knife. Cut each piece in half again to make quarters, then tip the tomatoes into a large bowl.","Wipe down the chopping board, then cut the cucumber in half lengthways. Put the two halves cut-side down on the board so they don’t roll around, then cut in half again along the length, so you have four chunky sticks of cucumber. Cut across the cucumber now to make little triangles, keeping your free hand in theclaw positionwith your fingers tucked away from the blade of the knife. Tip the cucumber into the bowl with the tomatoes.","Cut the hard stalk off the lettuces, then cut each lettuce in half and in half again to get four wedges. Working with one lettuce wedge at a time, hold the wedge with your hand in theclaw positionand chop it into small ribbons – the smaller, the better for this salad. Repeat with the remaining wedges and tip the lettuce into the bowl.","Snip the cress straight into the bowl usingkitchen scissors. Weigh out the pomegranate seeds using thescalesand add these to the bowl. Repeat with the mixed seeds. Drizzle over roughly half of the dressing over the salad (you will have some leftover) and toss everything together to coat."]','2026-01-10 12:17:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6084,6084,'en','Chipotle chickpeas with aubergine & pitta','Give chickpeas and aubergine a spicy kick with chipotle. Serve on top of pittas with tahini and crème fraîche and finish with lime wedges and coriander','["4 wholemeal pittas, cut into triangles","150g light light crème fraîche","3 tbsp tahini","2 limes zested and juiced, plus extra zest and wedges to serve","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 small aubergines, finely sliced","400g chickpeas, drained","1 tbsp chipotle paste","½ small bunch of coriander, roughly chopped, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Lay the pittas in a single layer on abaking trayand toast for 10 mins until crisp.","Meanwhile, make the topping. Heat the oil in a large frying pan and fry the onion and aubergine over a medium heat for 10 mins until softened. Add the chickpeas and chipotle paste, and cook for another 5 mins. Remove from the heat and stir in the coriander and some seasoning.","Whisktogether the crème fraîche, tahini, lime juice and zest, and garlic in a bowl, along with 50ml water to loosen.","To serve, top the toasted pittas with the tahini lime sauce, pile on the aubergine and chickpeas and finish with a sprinkling of coriander, the extra lime zest and lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:17:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6086,6086,'en','Baked jollof rice','Enjoy a version of the West African staple, jollof rice. It’s a great partner to chicken, fish or salad and you can use a ready-made sauce if you prefer','["400g basmati rice","3 red peppers, halved and deseeded","1 white onion, halved","2 garlic cloves","1 tbsp grated ginger, or ginger purée","1 Scotch bonnet chilli, deseeded if you prefer less heat (optional)","5 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","100g tomato purée","2 bay leaves","1 tbsp dried thyme","2tsp curry powder (we used hot madras)","½ tsp ground white pepper","600ml hot chicken stock, made with 2 stock cubes"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the rice in a sieve, rinse under cold water, drain and set aside. Put the peppers, onion, garlic, ginger and chilli, if using, in afood processorand blitz until chopped.","Heat the oil in an ovenproofcasseroleover a medium heat and fry the tomato purée for 2-3 mins, stirring often. Add the blitzed pepper mixture and fry for 5 mins more, then add the herbs, spices and 1 tsp salt. Fry for a further 1-2 mins, then stir in the rice to coat. Pour in the stock, stir, cover and bake for 45 mins until the rice is tender."]','2026-01-10 12:17:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6088,6088,'en','Mornay melting-middle fishcakes','Try making these indulgent fishcakes with crisp breadcrumbs on the outside and a cheesy, saucy surprise in the centre. They’re perfect for lunch or supper','["500g floury potatoes, such as Maris Piper or King Edwards, cut into small chunks","1 bay leaf","300g smoked haddock or cod","140g salmon","grating of nutmeg","small bunch of parsley, chopped","1 lemon, zested, then cut into wedges to serve","3 tbsp flour","2 eggs, beaten","100g fresh breadcrumbs","vegetable oil, for deep-frying, plus extra for the tin","mixed green salad, to serve","1 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp butter","300ml milk","50g mature cheddar, grated","1 tsp Dijon mustard"]','["First, make the mornay sauce at least a few hours before making the fishcakes. Put the flour and butter in a small pan over a low-medium heat and cook until the butter is melted, then stir to make a paste. Slowly whisk in the milk until you have a smooth sauce. Continue cooking until thickened, about 5 mins, then remove from the heat and stir in the cheese and mustard. Season. Oil a few small pieces of baking parchment, then use to line four holes of a muffin tin. Alternatively, use silicone cupcake cases. Divide the sauce between the cases and freeze for at least 2 hrs.","Put the potatoes and bay leaf in a large pan, cover with water and season with salt. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for 15-20 mins until tender. Remove the potatoes with a slotted spoon, put in a colander and leave to steam-dry.","Add all the fish to the water in the pan, reduce the heat to low and poach for 5 mins. The fish is cooked when it just starts to flake apart. Carefully transfer the fish to a board with a slotted spoon, and leave to cool for 5 mins.","Flake the fish, discarding any skin and bones. Tip the potatoes into a clean pan, season well and grate over some nutmeg. Mash until smooth, then fold through the fish, parsley and lemon zest. Leave to cool.","Divide the fishcake mixture into four portions. Working with one portion at a time, mould into a ball. Make a well in the centre, and push one of the frozen mornay sauce discs into it. Shape the fishcake around the sauce middle so you have a smooth hockey-puck shape. Repeat with the remaining portions and sauce, then freeze the fishcakes for at least 15 mins.","Put the flour in a shallow bowl, the egg in a second, and the fresh breadcrumbs in a third. Season the egg. Coat the fishcakes well in the flour, then the egg, and finally the breadcrumbs. If you have any egg or breadcrumbs left at the end, keep dipping and coating until everything is used up. Freeze the fishcakes until firm, about 1 hr. Will keep frozen for up to one month. Defrost in the fridge for 2 hrs before cooking.","Fill a large, deep pan no more than two-thirds full with oil, and heat it to 180C. Or, use a deep-fat fryer. Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Deep-fry the fishcakes for 7 mins, turning halfway, until crisp. Drain on a plate lined with kitchen paper, then transfer to a baking sheet and bake for 5 mins (or 15 mins from frozen) until the middles are hot. Serve with salad and lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:17:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6090,6090,'en','French onion tart with cheesy thyme pastry','Impress guests over for lunch with this French onion quiche with a gruyère and thyme pastry. Anchovies in the filling give an extra-special umami flavour','["200g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","100g cold butter, cubed, plus 25g","150g gruyère, comté or vegetarian Italian-style hard cheese, grated","small handful of thyme, leaves picked","1 tbsp olive oil","3 large onions, finely sliced","2 tbsp white wine or sherry vinegar","1 tbsp sugar","2 brown anchovies, finely chopped, or use 1 tsp olive tapenade or umami paste","2 large eggs","300ml double cream","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 tsp balsamic vinegar","2 sundried tomatoes, finely sliced","6-8 pitted black olives, thinly sliced","1 tsp capers","a few handfuls of rocket"]','["Put the flour in the bowl of a food processor with the 100g butter. Blitz until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs, then add 50g of the cheese, 1 tbsp of the thyme leaves, some freshly ground black pepper and 1 tsp salt. Blitz again briefly to combine. Add 2-3 tbsp cold water, and pulse again until it comes together into a dough. If you don’t have a food processor, do this in a bowl – rub the flour into the butter first, then stir in the remaining ingredients with a knife. Wrap and chill for at least 40 mins.","Meanwhile, heat the 25g butter and the olive oil in a large frying pan over a low-medium heat, and cook the onions with a pinch of salt for 40-50 mins, stirring often, until sticky, golden and very soft when pressed with the back of a spoon. If they start to catch, reduce the heat further and add a splash of water. Be patient, as they will take a while to caramelise, but keep your eye on the pan so they don’t burn.","Stir in the vinegar, sugar and the anchovies. Keep stirring until the vinegar has evaporated, and the anchovies have dissolved into the onions. Remove from the heat.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and roll the pastry out onto a lightly floured work surface to a 3mm thickness. Use the pastry to line a 23cm tart tin (use the rolling pin to help you do this). Trim the edges so they’re just overhanging the sides. Patch the pastry with the offcuts, if needed. Scrunch up a sheet of baking parchment, then open it out again to line the pastry, and fill with baking beans. Bake for 15 mins, remove the parchment and beans, then bake for a further 5-8 mins, or until the pastry looks dry, without any raw spots.","Meanwhile, whisk the eggs, cream, remaining thyme and the rest of the cheese together with a pinch each of salt and black pepper. Stir in the caramelised onions. Trim the sides of the pastry using a serrated knife to neaten the edges. Pour the filling into the pastry case and tap the tin gently on the work surface to release any bubbles.","Bake the quiche for 25-30 mins on the middle shelf of the oven until lightly golden and set in the middle, with a slight wobble. Leave to cool in the tin for at least 15-20 mins, then slice. To make the salad, whisk the olive oil and vinegar together in a bowl, then toss in the remaining ingredients. Pile the salad on top of the quiche, or serve alongside. If you like, leave the quiche to cool completely, then chill before serving. Will keep in the fridge for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:17:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6092,6092,'en','Shaved fennel & radish salad with pickled peaches','Celebrate fennel season in mid-summer with this delightful side salad. It''s made with radishes, shavings of lancashire cheese, basil, mint and pickled peaches','["50g whole skin-on almonds","1 tsp fennel seeds","2 tsp rapeseed oil","½ tsp smoked paprika","2 fennel bulbs","1 lemon, juiced","4 radishes, very finely sliced (preferably on a mandoline) and plunged into iced water","20g lancashire cheese, thinly shaved using a vegetable peeler","handful of basil","handful of mint leaves","2 tbsp olive oil","2 ripe peaches (flat or doughnut peaches work well), stoned and cut into thick slices","50g caster sugar","100ml white wine or rice vinegar","1 star anise"]','["First, make the pickled peaches. Put the peach slices in a bowl and set aside. Tip the remaining ingredients into a saucepan with 50ml water and bring to the boil, stirring until the sugar has dissolved. Remove from the heat and leave to cool for 10 mins. Pour the mixture over the peaches and leave to pickle for at least 30 mins, or up to a few hours.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the almonds and fennel seeds on a baking tray, drizzle with the rapeseed oil, and sprinkle over the smoked paprika and a little salt. Toss to coat. Bake for 8 mins, or until toasted and slightly crisp.","Pull away any tough outer leaves from the fennel bulbs (you can keep these to use for stock). Trim the bases, and remove the stems and fronds (again, reserving these for stock, if you like). Slice the bulbs in half along their cores, then lay them, cut-side down, on a chopping board. Very finely slice each half into half-moons, then tip into a bowl and drizzle with the lemon juice. Meanwhile, drain the pickled peach slices.","Drain the radishes and combine with the fennel and a large pinch of salt. Leave to sit for a few minutes, then stir in the peaches, most of the cheese and half the herbs. Drizzle with the olive oil and scatter over the toasted almonds and fennel seeds. Garnish with the rest of the herbs, and a bit more cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:17:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6094,6094,'en','Frozen yogurt','Whip up this frozen yogurt to enjoy on hot summer days – it’s low-calorie and packed with flavour. We used strawberries, but you could try it with other fruit','["200-300g strawberries (depending on how fruity you want it), hulled","300g Greek or Greek-style yogurt","3 tbsp condensed milk"]','["Use a food processor or blender to blitz the strawberries for a smoother end result, or crush them in a bowl using a fork to get chunkier pieces.","Tip the yogurt and condensed milk into the food processor or blender with the strawberries and blitz again to combine.","Pour into a freezer-proof container and put in the freezer, stirring every hour to break up the ice crystals, then leave to freeze again overnight. Remove from the freezer 10 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6096,6096,'en','Salade niçoise','Make salade niçoise your go-to salad for summer. With crunchy lettuce, ripe tomatoes, potatoes, tuna and soft-boiled eggs, it’s full of flavour and texture','["8 new potatoes","50g green beans (or a small handful), trimmed and halved","3 eggs","2 Little Gem lettuces, quartered","50g pitted black olives","2 medium tomatoes (plum are good), quartered","145g can tuna in olive oil, drained, oil reserved (see below)","½ garlic clove","1 anchovy fillet (optional)","1 tbsp Dijion mustard","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","4 tbsp reserved olive oil from the tuna can (topped up, if needed)"]','["To make the dressing, mash the garlic and anchovy, if using, with a small pinch of salt on a board using the blade of a large knife, or in a pestle and mortar. Combine the paste with the mustard and vinegar, then slowly stir in the tuna oil. Set aside.","Tip the new potatoes into a large pan of cold salted water, ensuring they’re well covered. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer. Add the beans and cook for 5 mins, then remove with a slotted spoon and immediately plunge into a bowl of iced water to cool. Cook the potatoes for another 5 mins until tender, then drain and leave to cool. When cool enough to handle, halve or quarter them, and toss in a large bowl with 1 tbsp of the dressing. Leave to cool completely.","Meanwhile, cook the eggs in a second pan of simmering water for 7½ mins, then transfer to a bowl of iced water to cool. Drain the beans and eggs, then peel and halve the eggs.","Tip the lettuce quarters, cooked beans and olives into the bowl with the potatoes. Add most of the remaining dressing and gently toss. Divide the salad between two bowls, and top with the tomatoes and eggs. Flake over the tuna, then drizzle with the rest of the dressing and season."]','2026-01-10 12:17:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6098,6098,'en','Tomato & mozzarella salad with tomato dressing','Enjoy this super-quick tomato and mozzarella salad as a side dish, or add some sliced avocado for a filling lunch. Top with basil leaves and crushed crostini for extra flavour and texture','["200g mixed heritage tomatoes, sliced","1 large shallot, sliced into thin rings","5 tbsp olive oil","3 drops of Tabasco","1 tbsp white wine vinegar (muscatel is good)","6 basil leaves, shredded, plus extra small leaves to serve","4 shop-bought crostini, roughly crushed","1 ball buffalo mozzarella, or burrata if you can find it (about 150g), halved"]','["Put the tomatoes in a bowl with the shallots and season with a large pinch of salt. Leave for 10 mins for the tomatoes to release their juices.","Lift the tomatoes and shallots out of the bowl using a slotted spoon, and reserve the juices. Arrange the tomatoes over two plates, then sprinkle over the shallots.","Whisk the olive oil, Tabasco and vinegar into the reserved tomato juices to make a dressing. Drizzle over the tomatoes and shallots, then scatter with the shredded basil and crushed crostini. Put one half of the mozzarella in the centre of each plate, and season with freshly ground black pepper. Top with the extra basil leaves, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6100,6100,'en','Easy salad dressing','Rustle up this easy vinaigrette with Dijon mustard, olive oil and white wine vinegar. This simple salad dressing will keep in a jar for up to a month','["1 tbsp Djion mustard","100ml olive oil","2 tbsp white wine vinegar","small pinch sugar"]','["Spoon the mustard into a bowl and slowly whisk in the oil with a small whisk. Gradually add the vinegar and 1 tsp of water to make a creamy looking dressing. Season with the sugar and a generous pinch of salt. Will keep in a sealed jar for up to a month, but must be whisked again before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6102,6102,'en','Fruit salad','Look for ripe, sweet-smelling fruit for this simple fruit salad with kiwi, mango, pineapple, grapes, orange and berries. It’s a lovely, light summer dessert','["2 kiwi","1 mango","150g pineapple","100g grapes","400g mixed berries, we used strawberries, raspberries and blackberries","1 large orange","2 tsp honey (optional)"]','["Prepare the fruit with a small serrated knife. Cut the top and bottom off the kiwi, stand it up on one of its flat surfaces and cut away the skin, keeping the knife as close to the skin as possible. Slice in half, following the core through the centre, then cut each half into slices. Put in a bowl and repeat with the other kiwi.","Carefully cut the skin off the mango and slice off each cheek, running your knife as close to the stone as you can. Cut each piece into slices. Remove any remaining fruit from the stone in long thin slices. Add the mango to the kiwi.","Top and tail the pineapple, then in a similar way to the kiwi, cut away the skin. Use your knife to go around the pineapple, taking out the divets or eyes, two to three at a time, you’ll be left with a spiral pattern weaving around the outside of the fruit. Take of a circular slice, roughly 150g, quarter, remove the core then cut into chunks. Add to the bowl.","Halve the grapes and add to the rest of the fruit along with the berries, you may want to slice or halve strawberries if they’re large. Remove the peel from the orange using the same method as the kiwi and pineapple. Holding the orange over the bowl of fruit, remove the orange segments by carefully cutting between the membrane and the fruit. The pieces should fall out into the bowl along with any juice. Squeeze the membrane over the fruit to extract the juice, add a drizzle of honey, if you like. Mix everything together and leave in the fridge to macerate for 30 mins, if you have time."]','2026-01-10 12:17:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6104,6104,'en','Squid & prawn skewers','Make our sizzling seafood skewers on a barbecue and add your favourite marinade. We have ideas for three flavour-packed glazes','["150g raw king prawns","250g cleaned squid","your chosen glaze (optional)"]','["Peel the king prawns and cut the cleaned squid into 3cm pieces, then thread onto three skewers. Light the barbecue. Brush the skewers with your chosen glaze, then, when the flames have died down, cook for 2 mins on each side (or, cook in a griddle pan set over a high heat). Brush with the rest of the glaze and cook for another 1 min on each side until charred and sticky."]','2026-01-10 12:17:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6106,6106,'en','Charred corn, chicken & tortilla salad with chipotle yogurt dressing','Try this vibrant salad with or without the chicken. If you’re serving it as a side to kebabs or sausages, swap it out for some crumbled feta, if you have it','["1 tbsp smoked paprika, plus ½ tsp","1 tsp dried oregano","1 tbsp chipotle paste, plus 1 tsp","½ tsp cinnamon","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 limes, 1 zested and juiced, 1 cut into wedges to serve","3 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for brushing and frying","6 boneless, skinless chicken thighs","150g natural yogurt","2 tsp honey","2 corns on the cob, husks removed if needed","2 Little Gem lettuces, halved through the core, leaves pulled apart and torn","400g can black beans, drained, rinsed and drained again","200g cherry tomatoes, halved","2 avocados, stoned, peeled, halved and cut into chunks","2 corn tortilla wraps","small bunch of coriander, leaves picked and roughly chopped"]','["Mix 1 tbsp paprika, the oregano, 1 tbsp chipotle, cinnamon, garlic, lime zest and 2 tbsp oil together in a bowl with some seasoning. Pour over the chicken thighs, turning to coat, then cover and chill for at least a few hours, or up to 24 hrs.","Light the barbecue and let the flames die down, or heat a griddle pan over a high heat. Mix the yogurt, lime juice, the remaining oil, ½ tsp paprika, 1 tsp chipotle and the honey with a pinch of salt. Set aside. Brush the corn cobs with a little oil, then cook it and the marinated chicken on the barbecue or in the griddle pan for about 10 mins, turning often until the chicken is cooked through (it should be charred and firm to the touch – check it’s done by cutting into one of the thickest pieces) and the corn is bright yellow and juicy.","Transfer the chicken and corn to a board or plate and cover to keep warm. Arrange the lettuce, beans, tomatoes and avocado on a large platter or in a serving bowl, but wait to toss together until just before serving – this helps keep the lettuce leaves from wilting.","Cut the wraps into strips or small pieces. Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan and fry the strips until crisp and golden, then drain on kitchen paper. Sprinkle with salt.","Slice the cooked chicken into 1cm strips and cut the charred corn from the cob. Add to the salad, then drizzle over the dressing and any juice from the chicken and toss. Scatter over the coriander and crispy tortilla strips, and serve with the lime wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:17:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6108,6108,'en','Zingy teriyaki beef skewers','If you''re looking for a light and healthy dinner then these kebabs are just the ticket – rich in folate, fibre, iron and vitamin C, plus 3 of your 5-a-day','["1 tbsp tamari or soy sauce","3 tbsp freshly squeezed orange juice","15g chunk ginger, peeled and very finely grated","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp honey (preferably raw)","¼ tsp chilli flakes","300g beef sirloin steak, trimmed of hard fat and cut into long, thin strips","100g long-grain brown rice","? cucumber, cut into small cubes","2 medium carrots, peeled and sliced into ribbons with a peeler","4 spring onions, trimmed and diagonally sliced","100g radishes, trimmed and sliced","20g coriander, leaves roughly chopped, plus extra to garnish","10g mint leaves, plus extra to garnish","1 tbsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","zest and juice 1 lime","25g unsalted cashew nuts, toasted and roughly chopped"]','["Put the tamari, orange juice, ginger, garlic, honey and chilli flakes in a small saucepan with 100ml cold water and bring to the boil. Cook for 3-5 mins, boiling hard until well reduced, glossy and slightly syrupy. Remove from the heat, pour into a shallow dish and leave to cool.","Thread the beef onto 4 soaked wooden or metal skewers. Place in the marinade, turn and brush until well coated. Cover with cling film and marinate for 30 mins.","While the beef is marinating, prepare the salad. Half-fill a medium pan with water and bring to the boil. Cook the rice for about 20 mins or following pack instructions until tender. Rinse in a sieve under running water until cold, then drain well. Tip into a large bowl.","Add the cucumber, carrots, spring onions, radishes, coriander, mint, oil, lime zest and juice, and toss well together well. Season with a little black pepper. Divide between two plates and top with a sprinkling of nuts and extra herbs to garnish.","Heat the grill to high. (You could also cook the skewers on a non-stick griddle pan.) Put the skewers on a rack above a foil-lined baking tray, reserving any excess marinade. Grill the skewers close to the heat for 3-5 mins each side or until done to your liking. Brush with more marinade when they are turned. They should look sticky and glossy when cooked. Serve hot or cold with the rice salad."]','2026-01-10 12:17:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6110,6110,'en','Chilli crab with shaved fennel & parsley salad','This no-cook salad is light, fresh and full of flavour. Use fresh crabmeat – it tastes so much better than canned. This can be prepped ahead so you can plate up at the last minute','["2 fennel bulb, fronds picked, very roughly chopped","finely grated zest and juice 1 lemon","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","300g fresh white crabmeat","1 chilli, deseeded and finely sliced","bunch flat-leaf parsley, leaves picked and chopped once or twice"]','["Trim the stalk away from the fennel and pull away the first layer of each bulb if it’s looking tired or bruised. Slice the fennel into rounds as thinly as possible using a sharp knife or, better still, on a mandolin if you have one. Tip the fennel into a bowl and season with a pinch of sea salt. Squeeze over half the lemon juice and drizzle with 2 tbsp of the olive oil, then set aside to marinate briefly.","Tip the crabmeat into another bowl, season lightly, then add the rest of the lemon juice and olive oil, and half the chilli, and mix well. The crab and fennel can be prepared up to 2 hrs ahead and kept in the fridge, but bring the fennel out again 20 mins before serving.","Mix the parsley and the rest of the chilli with the fennel. Divide between six plates, then top each one with a large spoonful of crabmeat in the middle. Scatter over the fennel fronds, lemon zest and a trickle of olive oil, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6112,6112,'en','Lemon & rosemary pork with chickpea salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyJazz up pork with lemon and rosemary for a feel-good supper that’s on the table in under half an hour','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp finely chopped rosemary","4 cloves garlic, crushed","juice and zest ½ lemon","4 boneless pork steaks, trimmed of fat","1 red onion, finely sliced","2 tbsp sherry vinegar","2 x 400g/14oz can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","110g bag mixed salad leaves"]','["Mix olive oil, rosemary, garlic, lemon juice and zest in a large bowl. Add pork, turn to coat and season well. If you have time marinate in the fridge for 30 mins.","Heat a large non-stick frying pan. Lift the pork out of the marinade, shaking off any excess and reserving the marinade for later. Cook the pork in the pan for 3-4 mins each side or until cooked through. Rest on a plate while you make the salad.","Pour the reserved marinade into the pan with the onion. Cook for 1 min over a high heat before adding the vinegar, plus 3 tbsp water. Bubble down for 1 min, until the onion has softened a little and the dressing thickened slightly. Stir through chickpeas, some salt and pepper and any of the resting juices from the pork. Put salad leaves into a bowl, tip in the pan contents and gently toss, before eating immediately with the pork."]','2026-01-10 12:17:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6114,6114,'en','Roasted cauliflower tabbouleh','A simple, low-calorie, grain-free meal with roasted cauliflower, punchy feta and sweet pomegranate seeds that can be prepared in advance – ideal for supper and packed lunch the next day','["1 large cauliflower (about 650g/1lb 7oz trimmed weight)","1 tsp allspice","1 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tbsp olive oil","25g flaked almonds, toasted","1 red onion, finely chopped","200g pack feta, crumbled","110g tub pomegranate seeds","juice 1 lemon","½  small pack parsley, finely chopped","½  small pack mint, finely chopped, plus a few leaves to garnish"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Remove the outer leaves from the cauliflower and the hard inner core, then roughly chop up the florets (don’t worry about how they look, they are going to be blitzed). Put the cauliflower in the large bowl of a food processor, blitz for 30 secs until it resembles couscous grains, then tip into a large bowl.","Mix the spices and olive oil into the cauliflower and season to taste. Spread the cauliflower ‘couscous’ out on a large baking tray in an even, thin layer. Roast for 12 mins, mixing halfway through so that it is evenly toasted, then set aside to cool slightly.","Once at room temperature, stir through the remaining ingredients and season to taste, then sprinkle over the mint leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:17:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6116,6116,'en','Roasted balsamic asparagus & cherry tomatoes','This simple vegetarian side dish can be served with meat, fish and veggie mains alike','["350g asparagus spears, woody ends discarded","330g pack cherry tomatoes, halved","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","50g feta cheese, crumbled"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the asparagus and cherry tomatoes on a baking sheet. Drizzle over the olive oil and balsamic vinegar. Season, then toss everything together. Bake for 15 mins until the asparagus is cooked through. Serve topped with the feta."]','2026-01-10 12:17:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6118,6118,'en','Falafel Scotch eggs','Combine two winning dishes in this picnic-friendly recipe of eggs coated in spiced, herbed chickpeas','["9 large eggs","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for rolling","2 large onions, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp ground coriander","400g can chickpeas, drained","½  small pack coriander, leaves only","200g wholemeal breadcrumbs","5 tbsp plain flour, plus extra for dusting","25g panko or dried breadcrumbs","3 tbsp sesame seeds","sunflower or vegetable oil, for frying"]','["Put 8 of the eggs in a pan of cold water. Bring to the boil, cook for 5 mins, then quickly lift out of the pan and plunge in a big bowl of cold water to cool. Once cool enough to handle, peel.","While the eggs cool, put the oil, onions and garlic in a frying pan. Fry very gently until really soft and just starting to turn golden. Add the spices and fry for a few mins more. Tip into a food processor and whizz to a paste, then add the chickpeas and coriander leaves, and pulse until finely chopped but not pasty. Stir in the wholemeal breadcrumbs, flour and final egg, beaten first with a fork, with a good amount of seasoning.","Divide the mixture into 8. Take a portion at a time and flatten between your hands (rub your hands with a little more oil if it’s sticking to your fingers too much). Roll 1 of your peeled eggs in a little flour, shake to remove the excess, then wrap the falafel mixture around it, moulding it to completely cover the egg and squishing it together at the joins to seal. Repeat to cover all the eggs. Tip the panko or dried breadcrumbs onto a plate and mix in the sesame seeds. Roll each egg in it to coat. Can be made 1 day ahead, loosely covered with cling film and chilled.","Get a large, deep saucepan and half-fill it with oil, or use a deep-fat fryer. Heat until a bit of bread browns in about 30 secs. Add a couple of eggs at a time and fry, turning, until really golden and crisp, about 2 mins. Lift onto kitchen paper to drain while you cook the rest of the eggs in batches. Season with a little more salt and eat warm or cold."]','2026-01-10 12:17:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6120,6120,'en','Citrus-spiked sea bass','Places oranges on your barbecue to stop your fish from sticking- serve with a lemony salad with capers, green olives and watercress','["2-3 large oranges","zest 1 lemon (use the juice below)","1 tbsp olive oil","4 x 300g whole small sea bass, scaled, gutted and slashed a few times down each side","2 oranges, segmented","juice 1 lemon","4 tbsp olive oil","2 bags watercress","handful small capers","handful pitted green olives, roughly chopped"]','["Finely grate the zest of 1 of the oranges\r\nand add to the lemon zest. Mix with the\r\nolive oil, then drizzle over the fish and\r\nseason. Cut the rest of the oranges into\r\nslices about 5mm thick. When the coals\r\nare ashen, arrange the orange slices\r\nover the barbecue in groups the length\r\nof each fish. Char the orange slices on\r\n1 side, then flip them over and lay the\r\nfish on top of them – this stops the fish\r\nsticking. Barbecue the fish for 5-8 mins\r\non each side (turning them carefully),\r\nor until the flesh flakes away easily\r\nwhen prodded.","While the fish is barbecuing (or\r\nbeforehand), make the salad. Put the\r\norange segments in a large bowl with\r\nthe squeezed juice from the rest of the\r\noranges and the lemon juice. Season\r\nand stir in the olive oil. When the fish\r\nis cooked, toss the watercress in the\r\norange dressing with the capers and\r\nolives. Serve the fish with the salad."]','2026-01-10 12:17:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6122,6122,'en','The ultimate makeover: Chicken Caesar salad','Angela Nilsen has been on a mission to make the not-so-innocent Caesar salad more honest. The result? A healthier and tastier version. So tuck in','["1½  tbsp lemon juice","1 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp fresh thyme leaves, plus a few sprigs","1 garlic clove, bashed to bruise","4 organic/free-range skinless boneless chicken breast fillets, about 140g/5oz each","100g rustic granary bread","2 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 tsp Dijon mustard","½  tsp Worcestershire sauce","1 tbsp lemon juice, plus extra for squeezing","good pinch chilli flakes","4 anchovies fillets, finely chopped","3 tbsp good-quality mayonnaise (we used Hellman''s)","4 tbsp fat-free yogurt","1 head romaine or Cos lettuce, leaves separated, washed and dried","100g bag rocket or watercress","25g piece parmesan, shaved with a potato peeler"]','["Marinate the chicken. Mix the lemon juice, oil, thyme and garlic in a shallow dish.\r\nAdd the chicken and turn it over in the\r\nmarinade to coat well. Season with freshly\r\nground pepper and leave for up to 2 hrs.","Heat the oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.\r\nSlice, then cut the bread into big, rough\r\ncubes for the croutons. Spread them in a\r\nsingle layer on a baking sheet, then brush\r\nall over with the 2 tbsp oil. Bake for about\r\n10 mins until golden and crisp.","Meanwhile, put the garlic into a mini blender with the mustard, Worcestershire\r\nsauce, lemon juice, chilli and anchovies.\r\nBlend until smooth, add the mayonnaise\r\nand yogurt, then blend again – it should\r\nbe the consistency of double cream. Adjust\r\nthe taste with lemon juice and pepper. If\r\nnecessary, thin with a couple of tsps of cold\r\nwater to get the consistency right so it will\r\ncoat the leaves.","Heat a griddle pan until very hot. Lay the\r\nchicken on the griddle, on the side that had\r\nthe skin on. Cook for 15-16 mins, turning\r\nonce or twice, until cooked through.\r\nRemove, then let the meat sit for 5 mins\r\nbefore slicing.","Keep any small inner lettuce leaves\r\nwhole, tear the larger outer leaves into 2-3\r\npieces, then put them all into a large bowl\r\nwith the rocket or watercress. Pour just\r\nunder half the dressing over the leaves and\r\ncarefully toss to coat – it’s gentler to use\r\nyour hands. Either assemble in the bowl,\r\nor pile the leaves onto individual plates,\r\ntucking in the croutons, chicken and\r\nParmesan. Drizzle the rest of the dressing\r\nover and around, then finish with an extra\r\nsqueeze of lemon."]','2026-01-10 12:17:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6124,6124,'en','Asian prawn & pineapple salad','This no-cook main course salad can just be tossed together and served on its own, or with steamed rice or boiled noodles','["1 small pineapple or 350g pineapple chunks","140g beansprouts","250g cooked king prawns","½ cucumber, peeled, deseeded and sliced on the angle","200g cherry tomatoes, halved","handful mint leaves, very roughly chopped","50g unsalted cashews, toasted if you like","½ red chilli, deseeded and sliced","1 garlic clove","1 tsp golden caster sugar","juice 2 limes","1½ tsp fish sauce"]','["Mash the chilli, garlic and sugar to\r\na paste using a pestle and mortar or\r\nsmall processor. Stir in the lime juice\r\nand fish sauce, then set aside.","Peel, quarter, core and slice the pineapple\r\nat an angle. Toss with beansprouts,\r\nprawns, cucumber and tomato and some\r\nof the dressing. Pile into bowls and scatter\r\nwith mint and cashews. Drizzle with the\r\nrest of the dressing and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6126,6126,'en','Harissa prawn skewers with carroty couscous','These vibrant, low-calorie prawn kebabs are served with delicious minty couscous, tahini and garlic yogurt','["1 tbsp olive oil","1½  tsp cumin seeds","3 carrots, coarsely grated","200g couscous","400g raw prawns","16 cherry tomatoes","1 onion, cut into 12 thin wedges, leaving root intact","1 tbsp harissa","2 tsp tahini paste","2 tbsp low-fat natural yogurt","1 small garlic clove, crushed","juice ½ lemon, plus wedges, to serve","handful mint leaves, roughly chopped"]','["Heat the olive oil in a pan with the\r\ncumin seeds and toast for a few mins\r\nuntil aromatic. Tip in the carrots, season,\r\nthen cook for 3 mins until tender. Transfer\r\nto a bowl, then pour over the couscous\r\nand 400ml hot water. Cover with cling\r\nfilm and leave for 10 mins, or until all the\r\nwater has been absorbed and the\r\ncouscous is tender.","Meanwhile, heat the grill to high. Put\r\nthe prawns, cherry tomatoes and onion\r\nwedges in another bowl, season, then\r\nstir in the harissa. Thread everything\r\nonto skewers (if using wooden skewers,\r\nsoak them in water first to prevent\r\nburning), then lay on a baking tray.\r\nGrill for 2-3 mins each side, or until\r\nthe prawns are cooked though.","Mix the tahini, yogurt, garlic, lemon\r\njuice and seasoning to make a sauce.\r\nFork the mint though the couscous,\r\ntransfer to a platter and place the\r\nskewers on top. Drizzle over any cooking\r\njuices, and serve with a dollop of sauce\r\nand lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:17:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6128,6128,'en','Grilled mackerel with orange, chilli & watercress salad','Packed with omega-3 and vitamin C, this salad couldn’t get much healthier – or tastier','["1 tsp black peppercorns","1 tsp coriander seeds","4 oranges","1 red chilli, deseeded, finely chopped","8 fresh mackerel fillets","1 tsp wholegrain mustard","1 tbsp clear honey","120g bag watercress, spinach and rocket salad mix","1 shallot, thinly sliced"]','["Finely crush the peppercorns and\r\ncoriander seeds together using a pestle\r\nand mortar. Grate the zest from half an\r\norange and mix into the pepper mixture\r\nwith half the chopped chilli. Lightly slash\r\nthe skin of the mackerel and press the\r\nzesty, peppery mixture onto the fish.\r\nHeat the grill.","For the salad, segment the oranges.\r\nFirst slice the top and bottom off each\r\norange, then cut away the peel and any\r\nwhite pith using a small, sharp knife.\r\nHolding each orange over a bowl to catch\r\nall the juice, cut down either side of each\r\nsegment to release it, then squeeze the\r\nshells to release any extra juice. Measure\r\n4 tbsp of this juice into a small bowl and mix with the mustard, honey and\r\nremaining chilli.","Grill the mackerel, skin-side up, for\r\n4 mins or until crisp and cooked through.\r\nMeanwhile, divide the salad leaves\r\nbetween 4 plates and scatter with the\r\norange segments and sliced shallot.\r\nDrizzle with the chilli orange dressing\r\nand top with the grilled mackerel."]','2026-01-10 12:17:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6130,6130,'en','Cucumber & fennel salad','This refreshing side salad is low-fat, superhealthy and full of summer flavour','["1 large cucumber, halved lengthways, deseeded and cut into thin half moons","1 tsp sugar","1 fennel bulb, finely sliced","150ml pot reduced-fat soured cream","juice 1 lemon","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","small bunch dill, roughly chopped"]','["Put cucumber in a sieve. Sprinkle with\r\n1 tsp salt and the sugar, then leave for\r\n10 mins. Add fennel.","Mix soured cream,\r\nlemon juice, vinegar and dill, then season\r\nwith black pepper and add to fennel mix."]','2026-01-10 12:17:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6132,6132,'en','Cod with lemon & parsley crust & summer greens','Never sure what to do with a fillet of fish? Make our posh (and healthy) take on a fish finger','["1 thick slice stale bread, crusts removed","large bunch parsley","zest and juice from 1 lemon","1 tbsp olive oil","2 cod fillets, about 175g/6oz each","260g pack prepared veg, such as peas & runner beans or a pea, leek & spinach medley","1 tsp wholegrain mustard"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Tear the bread into pieces and put in a food processor with the parsley and lemon zest.\r\nBlitz to make rough crumbs.","Lightly oil a shallow baking dish, then add the cod in one layer. Lightly brush the fish with oil, then press on the crumbs. Bake for 10-12 mins. Meanwhile, steam the vegetables until just tender, then toss in the remaining oil, mustard and lemon juice. Serve alongside the fish."]','2026-01-10 12:17:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6133,6134,'en','Cinnamon rubbed salmon with couscous & harissa yogurt','A superhealthy fish supper that’s on the table in under half an hour','["100g couscous","2 tbsp sultanas","small bunch coriander, chopped","1 tsp ground cinnamon, plus a large pinch","200ml hot vegetable stock","1 tbsp honey","1 tbsp olive oil","2 salmon fillets","1 heaped tbsp harissa paste","170g tub 0% fat Greek yogurt"]','["Heat the grill. Put the couscous,\r\nsultanas, most of the coriander, 1 tsp\r\ncinnamon and some seasoning in a bowl.\r\nPour over the hot vegetable stock and\r\nset aside for 5 mins to soak.","Mix together the pinch of cinnamon,\r\nhoney and oil. Sit the salmon in a baking\r\ntray, spread over the honey mixture and\r\nseason. Cook under a hot grill for about\r\n8 mins until the fish is cooked through.","Meanwhile, swirl together the harissa\r\nand yogurt. Fluff up the couscous with\r\na fork and serve with the fish and yogurt,\r\nsprinkled with the remaining coriander\r\nalongside some green beans, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6135,6135,'en','Zesty haddock with crushed potatoes & peas','Being pushed for time doesn’t mean you have to eat unhealthily, as this quick and low-fat fish supper proves','["600g floury potatoes, unpeeled, cut into chunks","140g frozen peas","2½  tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","juice and zest ½ lemon","1 tbsp capers, roughly chopped","2 tbsp snipped chives","4 haddock or other chunky white fish fillets, about 120g each (or use 2 small per person)","2 tbsp plain flour","broccoli, to serve"]','["Cover the potatoes in cold water, bring\r\nto the boil, then turn to a simmer. Cook\r\nfor 10 mins until tender, adding peas for\r\nthe final min of cooking. Drain and\r\nroughly crush together, adding plenty of\r\nseasoning and 1 tbsp oil. Keep warm.","Meanwhile, for the dressing, mix 1 tbsp\r\noil, the lemon juice and zest, capers and\r\nchives with some seasoning.","Dust the fish in the flour, tapping off\r\nany excess and season. Heat remaining\r\noil in a non-stick frying pan. Fry the fish\r\nfor 2-3 mins on each side until cooked,\r\nthen add the dressing and warm through.\r\nServe with the crush and broccoli."]','2026-01-10 12:17:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6137,6137,'en','Mushroom & chickpea burgers','High in fibre and low in fat, these veggie burgers with spiced yogurt are the healthy way to enjoy fast food','["1 tbsp olive oil","250g chestnut mushrooms, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 bunch spring onions, sliced","1 tbsp medium curry powder","zest and juice ½ lemon","400g can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","85g fresh wholemeal breadcrumbs","6 tbsp 0% Greek yogurt","pinch ground cumin","2 mixed-grain muffins or rolls, toasted and halved","2 plum tomatoes, sliced","handful rocket leaves"]','["Heat 1 tsp oil in a non-stick frying pan\r\nand cook the mushroom, garlic and\r\nspring onion for 5 mins. Mix in the curry\r\npowder, lemon zest and juice and cook\r\nfor 2 mins or until mixture looks quite dry.\r\nTip out onto a plate to cool slightly.","Use a potato masher or fork to mash\r\nthe chickpeas in a bowl, leaving a few\r\nchunky pieces. Add the mushroom mix\r\nand the crumbs, then shape into 4 patties.\r\nFry in the remaining oil for 3-4 mins\r\non each side until crisp and browned.","Mix the yogurt with the cumin. Place\r\nhalf a muffin on each plate, then spread\r\nwith the yogurt. Top with the burgers,\r\na few slices of tomato and a little rocket."]','2026-01-10 12:17:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6139,6139,'en','Quinoa, lentil & feta salad','Quinoa, a protein-rich seed, makes a great substitute for rice or couscous','["200g quinoa","1 tsp olive oil","1 shallot or ½ onion, finely chopped","2 tbsp tarragon, roughly chopped","14oz 400g can Puy or green lentils rinsed and drained","¼ cucumber, lightly peeled and diced","100g feta cheese, crumbled","6 spring onions, thinly sliced","zest and juice 1 orange","1 tbsp red or white wine vinegar"]','["Cook the quinoa in a large pan of\r\nboiling water for 10-15 mins until tender,\r\ndrain well, then set aside to cool.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a small pan,\r\nthen cook the shallot or onion for a few\r\nmins until softened. Add the tarragon,\r\nstir well, then remove from the heat.","Stir the softened shallot and tarragon\r\ninto the cooled quinoa along with the\r\nlentils, cucumber, feta, spring onions,\r\norange zest and juice and vinegar. Toss\r\nwell together and chill until ready to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6141,6141,'en','Summer courgette risotto','This fresh one-pot supper makes the most of the season’s fresh produce – plus it’s a great way to get kids to eat their veg','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion and 2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","3 ripe tomatoes, roughly chopped","350g carnaroli or other risotto rice","1 tsp chopped rosemary","1½ l hot vegetable stock","3 courgettes, finely diced","140g peas, fresh or frozen","large handful basil, lightly torn"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Cook the\r\nonion and garlic for 5 mins until the onion\r\nhas softened. Add the tomatoes and\r\ncook for 3-4 mins until softened and\r\npulpy, then add the rice and rosemary.","Pour in half the stock and leave to\r\ncook for 10 mins or until the liquid has\r\nevaporated, stirring from time to time.\r\nAdd the rest of the stock, then continue\r\nto cook for a further 5 mins.","Stir in the courgettes and peas, then\r\ncook for another 5 mins or so, stirring\r\nuntil the rice is tender, but the mixture\r\nis still a bit saucy. Can be frozen at this\r\nstage for up to 1 month. Season with\r\nplenty of black pepper, then add the basil and stir until wilted. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:17:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6143,6143,'en','Nutty atta laddoo','Make this lovely Indian dessert with chapatti flour, cashews and walnuts. Decorate them with a little edible gold leaf to make them extra special, if you like','["80g walnuts","80g cashews","150g chapatti flour","5 tbsp ghee","3 tbsp agave syrup","1 tsp ground cardamom","10 broken walnut pieces","edible gold leaf (optional)"]','["Heat a small, dry frying pan over a medium-low heat and toast the walnuts and cashews for 5 mins until they turn golden. Tip into a blender orfood processorand blitz to a paste – the nuts will start to release oil. Tip into a bowl.","In the same pan, toast the flour for 8-10 mins over a low heat until lightly golden and smelling toasted, stirring frequently to prevent it from burning. Add the ghee and mix well until the mixture looks crumbly. Scrape the mixture into the nut paste along with the agave syrup and cardamom. Leave to cool for a few minutes, then combine everything together well using your hands.","Working with one walnut-sized portion at a time, shape the piece into a ball in the palm of your hand to form a laddoo. Repeat with the remaining mixture until it’s all been used (you should get about 10). Decorate each laddoo with a piece of walnut while still warm and brush with a little edible gold leaf, if using.Will keep chilled for up to five days. Bring them to room temperature before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:17:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6144,6144,'en','Jerk spice mix','This combination of Caribbean spices creates a sweet and fiery flavour – you can add Scotch bonnet chilli to make it super spicy','["2 tbsp ground cinnamon or 2 cinnamon sticks","2 tbsp black peppercorns","1 tbsp dried thyme","2 tsp allspice berries","1½  tsp cayenne pepper","½ nutmeg"]','["Toast the whole spices in a small pan until they\r\nare aromatic and have turned a shade or\r\ntwo darker. Don’t be tempted to skip this\r\nstage, as it really enhances the flavours.","Tip into a spice grinder (or use a pestle\r\nand mortar), then add the ready-ground\r\nspices and dried herbs if required, and\r\ncrush to a fine powder. Store in a sealed\r\njar for up to six months."]','2026-01-10 12:17:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6145,6145,'en','Custard buns','Get clever with custard and make these gorgeous custard buns. Serve with fresh or roasted fruit if you like for a sweet breakfast or afternoon treat','["300g strong white flour, plus 1 tsp and extra for dusting","175ml double cream","45g caster sugar, plus 1 tsp","2 tsp fast-action dried yeast","1 egg plus 3 egg yolks and 1 egg white, at room temperature (freeze the extra whites to use in another recipe)","vegetable oil, for proving","1 tbsp whole milk","fresh or roasted fruit (such as plums or rhubarb), to serve (optional)","15g plain flour","15g icing sugar","15g cold unsalted butter","60g caster sugar","15g cornflour","1 egg","90ml whole milk","160ml double cream","1⁄2 tsp vanilla bean paste"]','["Tip 35g of the flour and the cream into a pan andwhiskover a low heat for 1-2 mins until smooth. Pour into a heatproof bowl and set aside to cool. Meanwhile, mix 1 tsp sugar, 1 tsp flour and the yeast with 1 tbsp warm water. Cover. Leave for 15 mins until bubbling.","Tip the egg and egg yolks into a large bowl orstand mixerwith the 45g sugar. Beat for 4-5 mins until pale and fluffy. Reduce the speed to low, add 1/4 tsp salt and the cream mixture, and beat to combine. Add the yeast mixture and sift in the remaining 265g flour, then mix on a low speed for 10 mins using the dough hook attachment. Or, knead by hand for 5 mins, rotating the bowl as you do. Cover and leave to prove in a warm place for 20 mins. Knead again for 3-5 mins until the dough is stretchy, then transfer to a lightly oiled bowl, cover and leave at room temperature for another 20 mins. Transfer to the fridge to prove for about 8-12 hrs, or until doubled in size.","For the streusel, mix the flour with the sugar and a pinch of salt, then rub in the butter until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs. Keep in the the freezer until ready to use.","For the custard, whisk the sugar, cornflour and ¼ tsp salt together in a small bowl. Add the egg and whisk to combine, then whisk in the milk and set aside. Bring the cream and vanilla to the boil in a saucepan. Remove from the heat and add the egg mixture slowly, whisking continuously. Cook over a low-medium heat for 7-10 mins, whisking all the time, until smooth and thick. Remove from the heat, cover and leave to cool for 30 mins.","Roll the dough out on a lightly floured surface until 2cm thick. Stamp out eight 6cm circles and use a tablespoon to press a dip into the middle of each. Using your hands, stretch each circle to about 8cm, keeping a raised border. Arrange on a large baking tray lined with baking parchment and fill each dip with 1 tbsp of the custard. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Leave to prove in a warm place for 30 mins until they slowly spring back when gently pressed. Mix the egg white with 1 tbsp milk and a pinch of salt and brush this over the sides of the buns. Sprinkle with the frozen streusel.","Bake for 10 mins, then reduce the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3 and bake for another 8-10 mins. Leave to cool for 30 mins, then serve with fresh or roasted fruit, if you like.Will keep chilled for up to two days. Serve at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:17:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6147,6147,'en','Pumpkin spice latte','Get cosy with a pumpkin spice latte, perfect for cold autumn and winter nights. With ginger, cinnamon, nutmeg and pumpkin flavours, it’s a real treat','["2 tsp pumpkin purée","pinch of ground cinnamon, plus extra to serve (or use pumpkin spice)","pinch of ground ginger","pinch of ground nutmeg","30ml espresso or strong coffee","250ml milk (any will work)"]','["Put the pumpkin purée in a large heatproof glass or mug. Stir in the spices and espresso or strong coffee.","Heat the milk in a saucepan over a low heat until steaming and frothy. Pour into the glass or mug, and spoon over any froth. Stir to combine, then dust with more cinnamon or some pumpkin spice before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6149,6149,'en','Apple turnovers','Treat family and friends to these moreish apple turnovers. With an apple and cinnamon filling encased in puff pastry, they’re delicious served with ice cream','["2 medium-large Bramley apples, peeled, cored and roughly chopped","50g golden caster sugar","½ tsp ground cinnamon","1 tbsp butter","1 Gala or sweet dessert apple, peeled, cored and cut into 1cm dice","320g pack Jus-Rol™ Puff Pastry Sheet","2 tbsp milk to glaze","2 tsp demerara sugar"]','["Put the Bramley apple, sugar and cinnamon in a smallpanwith 1 tbsp water. Cover with a lid and simmer over a low heat for 10-15 mins until the apple breaks down and turns into a compote.","Stir in the butter and the Gala apple and cook for a further 5 mins, uncovered, until the Gala apple is just soft but retaining its shape, and any excess water has evaporated to make a thick compote around the Gala chunks. Remove from the heat and leave to cool.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Unravel the Jus-Rol™ Puff Pastry Sheet out on a work surface, and cut into 4 even rectangles. Divide the apple filling to one side of each of the puff pastry rectangles, leaving a 1cm border. Brush the border with milk and fold over the empty side of pastry over the filling and crimp together. Brush with more milk and sprinkle over the sugar. Make a small steam hole in the middle of the turnovers.","Transfer to a parchment-lined baking sheet and bake for 20-25 mins until golden and puffed up. Leave to cool for 10 mins on awire rack(the filling will be molten when it first comes out the oven) before serving warm with a scoop of vanilla ice cream, or serve at room temperature. Keep for 2 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:17:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6151,6151,'en','Brookies','Combine two popular bakes, a chewy chocolate chip cookie and rich brownie, in this inventive treat. Fill the cake tin with these for the festive season, or give as gifts','["120g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","120g light brown soft sugar","100g dark muscovado sugar","1 large egg, plus 1 egg yolk","250g plain flour","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","50g milk chocolate chunks","185g unsalted butter","185g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids)","3 large eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","275g golden caster sugar","50g cocoa powder","130g plain flour","50g milk chocolate chunks"]','["Butter a 23cm square cake tin and line with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. First, make the cookie layer. Put the butter and both sugars in a bowl and beat with an electricwhiskuntil just combined. Alternatively, do this in a stand mixer. Add the whole egg and egg yolk, and beat again until combined. Mix in the flour, ¼ tsp salt, the bicarbonate of soda and chocolate chunks. Press the cookie dough into the base of the prepared tin using the back of a spoon, then chill for 30 mins.","For the brownie layer, melt the butter and chocolate in a heatproof bowl over a pan of just simmering water, stirring until smooth and combined. Leave to cool slightly, about 10 mins. Whisk the eggs, vanilla and sugar together in a large bowl with an electric whisk until slightly thickened, about 3 mins.","Fold the buttery chocolate mixture, cocoa and flour together to combine. Spoon the brownie mixture over the cookie dough layer, dot with the chocolate chunks, and sprinkle with sea salt flakes, if you like. Bake in the centre of the oven for 50 mins-1 hr, or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out with just a few crumbs clinging to it. Leave to cool completely in the tin before cutting into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:17:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6153,6153,'en','Baked banana cheesecake','Forget banana bread, use up over-ripe fruit in this low-sugar cheesecake with a chocolate and nut base and a ricotta and yogurt topping','["50g butter","75g oatcakes, finely crushed","50g cream crackers","1 tbsp cocoa, plus extra for dusting","1 tbsp salted peanuts, very finely chopped, plus 1 tbsp to scatter over (optional)","2 small ripe bananas","juice 1 lemon","2 x 250g tubs ricotta","200g tub Greek yogurt","4 large eggs","½  tsp sugar-free vanilla extract","2 tbsp cornflour","200ml double cream"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and lightly oil a non-stick loose-based 22cm cake tin. Melt the butter in a pan and stir in the oatcakes, crackers, cocoa and the chopped peanuts until well coated. Press into the base of the tin to make a firm layer, then bake for 10 mins. Remove from the oven and turn up the heat to 240C/220C fan/gas 9.","To make the topping, mash the bananas with the lemon juice in a large bowl, then beat in the ricotta, yogurt, eggs, vanilla and cornflour until everything is very well mixed. Pour onto the biscuit base and bake for 10 mins, then turn the oven right down to 110C/90C fan/gas 1/4 and cook for 25 mins more. Turn off the oven and leave the cheesecake inside to cool. When cold, chill for 3-4 hrs. (Cooling the cheesecake this way should prevent it from cracking.)","To serve, remove the cheesecake from the tin and slide onto a plate. Whip the cream until it just holds its shape, then smooth over the top of the cheesecake, lightly dust with cocoa and scatter over the peanuts."]','2026-01-10 12:17:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6155,6155,'en','Cinnamon apple pecan pudding','It may taste indulgent, but this low-sugar fruity bake is sweetened with xylitol and topped with crunchy pecans','["85g softened butter","85g xylitol (we used Total Sweet)","125g self-raising flour","25g oats","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 heaped tsp baking powder","2 large eggs","3 tbsp milk","1 Bramley apple (about 280g), peeled, cored, a quarter grated, the rest diced","25g pecans, roughly chopped or broken","Greek yogurt or cream, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and lightly grease a 1-litre (20 x 16cm) pie or oven dish. Tip the butter and xylitol into a bowl with the flour, oats, cinnamon and baking powder. Break in the eggs, add the milk, then beat with an electric hand whisk until evenly mixed and smooth. Stir in all the apple, then scrape into the dish, level the top and scatter with the pecans.","Bake for 35-45 mins until risen and golden and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Serve with Greek yogurt or cream."]','2026-01-10 12:17:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6157,6157,'en','Moroccan orange & cardamom cake','Replace sugar with xylitol and swap butter and oil for a puréed whole orange in this light and zesty cake, with ground almonds and polenta','["2 oranges, scrubbed","seeds of 6 green cardamom pods, crushed","225g pack xylitol (we used Total Sweet)","6 large eggs","200g pack ground almonds","50g polenta","25g self-raising flour","2 tsp baking powder","1 tbsp flaked almonds","Greek yogurt or cream, to serve"]','["Put the whole oranges in a pan, cover with water and boil, covered, for 1 hr until a knife easily pierces them. If the oranges won’t stay under the water, place a small saucepan lid directly on top to keep them submerged. Remove the oranges from the water and cool, then quarter and remove any seeds and obvious pith where the stalk was. Blitz the oranges to a rough purée with a hand blender or in a food processor and put in a large bowl.","Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3 and line the base and sides of a 21cm loose-bottomed cake tin with baking parchment. Beat the cardamom, xylitol and eggs into the orange purée, then mix the ground almonds with the polenta, flour and baking powder, and fold in until well blended. Scrape the mixture into the tin, level the top and bake for 40 mins.","After 40 minutes, scatter over the almonds, quickly return to the oven and bake 20-25 mins more until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Remove from the tin and leave to cool. Serve sliced as a cake, or with Greek yogurt or cream as a dessert."]','2026-01-10 12:17:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6159,6159,'en','Fruity sponge cake','Reader Sue McGann devised this delicious low-fat cake recipe','["butter or oil, for greasing","50g plain flour","3 tbsp cornflour","1 tsp baking powder","4 eggs, separated","175g caster sugar","295g can mandarin segments, drained","200g tub low-fat fromage frais","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.\r\nGrease then line the base and sides of 2 x\r\n20cm sandwich tins with greaseproof paper.\r\nSieve the flours and baking powder together.","Use electric hand beaters to whisk the\r\negg whites until stiff, then briefly whisk in the\r\nsugar. Beat the egg yolks quickly, then whisk\r\ninto the whites. Fold in the dry ingredients\r\nusing a large metal spoon, then spoon the\r\nmixture into the tins and level the tops. Bake\r\nfor 18-20 mins until risen, light golden and\r\na skewer inserted into the middle comes\r\nout clean. Cool in the tins for 10 mins, then\r\ngently remove and leave to cool completely.","Mix the mandarins and fromage frais\r\ntogether. Peel away the greaseproof paper,\r\nsandwich the cakes with the mandarin mix,\r\nthen dust with the icing sugar to serve.\r\nBest eaten on the day it’s made."]','2026-01-10 12:17:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6161,6161,'en','Lebkuchen','A German biscuit similar to gingerbread, lebkuchen is easy to make and a great Christmas treat','["250g plain flour","85g ground almonds","2 tsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cinnamon","½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","200ml clear honey","1 lemon, finely grated zest","85g butter","pinch each ground cloves, grated nutmeg and black pepper","1 tsp baking powder","100g icing sugar","1 egg white, beaten"]','["Tip the dry ingredients into a large bowl. Heat the honey and butter in a pan over a low heat until the butter melts, then pour into the flour mixture along with the lemon zest. Mix well until the dough is combined and fairly solid. Cover and leave to cool.","Heat oven to 180C/fan160C/gas 4. Using your hands, roll dough into about 30 balls, each 3cm wide, then flatten each one slightly into a disk. Divide the biscuits between two baking trays lined with baking parchment, leaving room for them to expand. Bake for 15 mins, then cool on a wire rack.","To ice the biscuits, mix together the icing sugar, egg white and 1-2 tbsp water to form a smooth, runny icing. Dip the top of each biscuit in the icing and spread with the back of a knife. Leave to dry out in a warm"]','2026-01-10 12:17:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6163,6163,'en','Sugar-free lemon drizzle cake','Sweetened with all-natural xylitol, this sponge has a dense, syrupy texture and keeps well for a few days','["225g self-raising flour, sifted","½  tsp baking powder","225g xylitol (see tip below)","2 lemons, zest only","2 large eggs, at room temperature","125ml sunflower oil","1 tbsp milk","200g 0% fat Greek yogurt","1 lemon, juice only","50g xylitol"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/ 160C fan/ Gas 4. Grease and line a 1.2 litre loaf tin (22cm x 13cm width, 7cm depth) with baking parchment. Mix together the flour, baking powder, xylitol and lemon zest in a large bowl.","Mix the eggs, sunflower oil, milk and yoghurt together in a separate bowl or jug and stir them into the flour mixture.","Spoon into a tin and smooth the surface. Transfer to the oven immediately, bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 1 hour – 1 hour 10 mins. Check after 50 mins, if the cake is becoming too dark, cover loosely with foil.","Just before the end of cooking time, make the drizzle by heating the lemon juice and xylitol. Stir over a low heat until the xylitol has dissolved. Once the cake is cooked, take it out of the oven and pour over the drizzle.","Cool in the tin before turning it out."]','2026-01-10 12:17:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6165,6165,'en','Bramble marshmallows','Good Food reader Natasha Lee gives marshmallows a seasonal twist by adding blackberries, for a sweet, homemade gift','["50g icing sugar","50g cornflour","9 sheets gelatine","450g granulated sugar","1 tbsp liquid glucose (find it in the baking aisle)","2 large egg whites","1 tsp vanilla extract","140g blackberries"]','["In a bowl, mix the icing sugar\r\nwith the cornflour and set aside.\r\nDissolve the gelatine in 150ml\r\nhot water in a heatproof jug. Line\r\na 20cm x 30cm tin with baking\r\nparchment and dust with some\r\nof the icing sugar mix. Put the\r\ngranulated sugar and liquid glucose\r\nin a heavy-bottomed pan with\r\n200ml water. Cook over a low heat\r\nuntil the sugar has dissolved\r\ncompletely, turn up the heat and\r\nboil until the mixture reaches firm\r\nball stage on a sugar thermometer\r\n(125C/256F) – around 10-15 mins.\r\nIf you don’t have a thermometer,\r\ndrop a little of the mix into a glass\r\nof very cold water – if it sets into\r\na squidgy ball, it’s ready. While the\r\nsugar is boiling, use an electric\r\nwhisk to beat the egg whites until\r\nstiff. When the syrup reaches the\r\nright stage, pour it into the jug with\r\nthe gelatine water; be careful as it\r\nwill be very hot and may bubble up.","Continue whisking the egg\r\nwhites while pouring on the syrup\r\nin a steady stream, then adding\r\nthe vanilla extract – the mixture\r\nwill go shiny and start to thicken.\r\nContinue whisking for about\r\n10 mins until very stiff. Pour half\r\nthe egg white mixture into the tin,\r\nthen scatter over the berries. Top\r\nwith the remaining mixture and\r\nleave somewhere cool and dry\r\nto set for at least 2 hrs until firm.","Lay a large sheet of baking\r\nparchment on a chopping board\r\nand sprinkle on the remaining icing\r\nsugar mix. Turn the marshmallows\r\nout and cut into squares, rolling them\r\nin the sugar mix. Keep in an airtight\r\ncontainer but best eaten on the day."]','2026-01-10 12:17:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6167,6167,'en','Fruity teacake','Perfect with a reviving cuppa, this cakeis a keeper and will happily sit in a tinfor a week or so','["300g mixture dried berries and cherries","225ml hot tea","juice 1 orange (about 75ml/2½fl oz) plus zest","50g butter","100g light brown sugar","1 egg","225g self-raising flour","4 tbsp demerara sugar"]','["Place the dried fruits in a bowl and\r\npour over the hot tea, orange juice and\r\nzest. Cover with cling film, then leave for\r\nat least 4 hrs or better still overnight.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line the base of a 2lb loaf tin.\r\nBeat together the butter and sugar until\r\ncreamy, then beat in the egg followed by\r\nthe flour. Carefully stir through the fruit\r\nmixture. Spoon the mixture into the tin,\r\nthen smooth over the surface with the\r\nback of a spoon. Sprinkle all over with a\r\nthick layer of demerara sugar.","Bake for 1 hr or until a skewer inserted\r\ninto the centre comes out clean. Leave to\r\ncool in the tin, then turn out, cut into\r\nslices and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6169,6169,'en','Banana & blueberry muffins','A low-fat muffin that tastes as good as it looks – they’ll keep in an airtight container for up to 3 days, or freeze for up to a month','["300g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","100g light muscovado sugar","50g porridge oats, plus 1 tbsp for topping","2 medium bananas, the riper the better","284ml carton buttermilk","5 tbsp light olive oil","2 egg whites","150g punnet blueberries"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper muffin cases. Tip the flour and bicarbonate of soda into a large bowl. Hold back 1 tbsp of the sugar, then mix the remainder with the flour and 50g oats. Make a well in the centre. In a separate bowl, mash the bananas until nearly smooth. Stir the buttermilk, oil and egg whites into the mashed banana until evenly combined.","Pour the liquid mixture into the well and stir quickly and sparingly with a wooden spoon. The mix will look lumpy and may have the odd fleck of flour still visible, but don’t be tempted to over-mix. Tip in the blueberries and give it just one more stir. Divide the mix between the muffin cases – they will be quite full – then sprinkle the tops with the final tbsp of the oats and the rest of he sugar. Bake for 18-20 mins until risen and dark golden. Cool for 5 mins in the tray before lifting out onto a rack to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:17:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6171,6171,'en','Peach & almond muffins','These delicious low fat treats are perfect for a summer treat and can be served warm or cold','["3 large eggs","100g golden caster sugar, plus a little extra for sprinkling","few drops of almond extract","25g butter, melted","100g self-raising flour","25g ground almonds","2 small peaches","2 tsp peach conserve or apricot jam","1 tbsp flaked almonds","half-fat crème fraîche, to serve"]','["Preheat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. In a large bowl, use a hand whisk to mix the eggs, sugar and almond extract together for a minute until foamy. Pour in the melted butter and continue to beat until combined. Gently fold in the flour, ground almonds and a pinch of salt.","Halve, stone and slice the peaches. Divide muffin mixture between 6 holes of a non-stick muffin tin. Top each with a blob of conserve or jam and arrange a few slices of peach on top. Scatter over the almonds and a little extra sugar, then bake for 20-25 mins until puffed up and golden. Serve warm with a spoonful of half-fat crème fraîche, or leave to cool. Best eaten the day they’re made or frozen whilst still slightly warm for up to 1 month."]','2026-01-10 12:17:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6173,6173,'en','Leek, pea & spinach orzo','Achieve three of your five-a-day in this bright orzo dish packed with gut-friendly prebiotic fibre. You can swap out the veg for any seasonal alternatives','["1 tbsp olive oil","4 large garlic cloves , finely sliced","320g leeks , finely sliced","250g orzo","320g frozen peas","10g tarragon sprigs , leaves picked","320g spinach","½ lemon , zested and juiced","2 tbsp crème fraîche"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the garlic for 3-4 mins until soft and golden. Add the leeks and a pinch of salt. Cook for 6-8 mins until soft and wilted.","Meanwhile, cook the orzo following pack instructions. Drain, reserving a little of the cooking water.","Stir the peas, tarragon and two large handfuls of the spinach into the leeks. Cook until the spinach is wilted before adding more, cooking in batches until all the spinach has been incorporated. Season well and stir in a splash of the reserved pasta cooking water. Stir in the lemon zest and juice, the orzo and crème fraîche, along with another splash of the cooking water to adjust the consistency as needed. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:17:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6175,6175,'en','Creamy cauli, brioche & bay bake','Create this creamy cauliflower cheese bake with added chunks of brioche for a comforting Christmas or Sunday roast side','["750ml whole milk","3 bay leaves","1 large cauliflower (about 750g), cut into pieces, leaves and all","75g butter","75g plain flour","75ml double cream","grating of nutmeg","2 tsp Dijon mustard","75g parmesan or vegetarian alternative","50g brioche, cut into 1cm cubes"]','["Warm the milk and bay in asaucepanover a low heat for a few minutes. Once steaming, turn off the heat. Leave to infuse for 10 mins. Meanwhile, put the cauli in another pan, cover with hot water and boil for 2-3 mins until tender. Drain and leave in the colander to steam-dry.","Melt the butter in the cauliflower pan (no need to wash it) over a medium heat. Stir in the flour and cook for a minute or two, stirring to make a sandy paste. Add a ladleful of the warm milk, stirring until smooth. Keep adding the milk, stirring well, until you have a smooth sauce. Add the cream, nutmeg, mustard and half the cheese. Season well.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 if cooking straightaway. Tip the cauliflower into a baking dish (ours was 20 x 30cm), arranging any leaves to poke out a little, so they’ll go nice and crispy. Pour over the sauce, making sure the cauliflower is fully coated. Scatter over the brioche and remaining cheese.Will keep chilled for two days.Bake for 25-30 mins until golden."]','2026-01-10 12:17:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6177,6177,'en','Slow cooker spiced parsnip soup','Have some leftover parsnips from your Sunday roast? They’ll go down a treat in this vegan spiced curry soup. The recipe is made in a slow cooker','["750g parsnips, peeled and chopped","400g carrots, chopped","1 onion, chopped","2 large garlic cloves, crushed or finely grated","1-2 tbsp curry powder (or to taste)","1l vegetable stock"]','["Tip the parsnips, carrots, onions, garlic and curry powder into aslow cooker, and mix well so all the vegetables are coated in the curry powder. Pour in the vegetable stock, then mix again and season well.","Cook on low for 8 hrs. Transfer to ablenderand blitz until smooth. If you prefer your soup a little looser, you can stir in a few splashes of boiled water from the kettle. Divide between bowls and season with ground black pepper before serving.Once completely cool, the soup will keep frozen up to three months.Defrost completely in the fridge overnight, then reheat in a pan until piping hot before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6179,6179,'en','One-pot five-spice rice','Start with ½ tsp of five-spice in this spiced rice as it’s quite a strong flavour, but you may want to add more. It makes a filling and healthy veggie main','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","25g ginger, peeled and finely shredded","½-1 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","1 fresh chilli, deseeded and sliced","2 red peppers, deseeded and diced","200g easy-cook brown rice","650ml vegetable stock, made with 2 tsp bouillon powder","420g frozen mixed beans (broad beans, peas and French beans)","½ pack spring onions, (about 8), trimmed and sliced","2 tsp sesame oil","75g roasted cashews"]','["Heat the rapeseed oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the garlic and ginger for 5 mins. Add the five-spice, chilli, peppers and rice, then pour in the stock, cover tightly and cook for 15 mins.","Stir in the frozen beans and spring onions, then cover and cook for 10 mins. Check the rice is tender; if not, leave for 5 mins more. Turn off the heat, stir in the sesame oil and leave to stand, covered, for 5 mins.","Divide the rice between two bowls and scatter over half the cashews. Leave the remainder to cool completely for another day.Will keep chilled in an airtight container for up to three days. Reheat in amicrowaveuntil piping hot, then add the cashews."]','2026-01-10 12:17:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6181,6181,'en','Spicy chickpea stew','Make a filling meal that encourages healthy gut bacteria with this chickpea and cauliflower stew. A valuable plant-based protein, chickpeas are full of fibre','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions (320g), roughly chopped","2 green peppers, deseeded and cut into cubes","2 tsp hot chilli powder","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground cumin","500ml carton passata","2 x 400g cans chickpeas","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","40g flame raisins","½ lemon, juiced, flesh scooped out and white pith removed, then zest finely chopped (you’ll need 2 tsp)","350g cauliflower florets","15g parsley, chopped","140g wholemeal couscous","40g toasted flaked almonds"]','["Heat the oil in a large lidded pan over a medium heat and fry the onions for 10 mins, stirring often until golden. Stir in the peppers and cook for 5 mins more.","Add the chilli powder, coriander and cumin, stir briefly, then tip in the passata and chickpeas along with the liquid from the cans.","Stir in the bouillon powder, raisins and lemon zest, then add the cauliflower. Cover tightly and simmer over a medium heat for 15-20 mins until the cauliflower is tender. Stir in half the parsley.","Meanwhile, put the couscous in a heatproof bowl and pour over 175ml boiling water from thekettle. Stir in the lemon juice, then cover and let stand for about 10 mins until the couscous has absorbed the liquid and is tender. Stir in the toasted flaked almonds and most of the remaining parsley.","Divide half the couscous between two plates and top with half the chickpea stew and the rest of the parsley. Leave the remainder to cool for another day.Will keep covered and chilled for up to three days. Reheat the stew in a pan over a low heat with a splash of water until piping hot. Reheat the couscous in themicrowave."]','2026-01-10 12:17:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6183,6183,'en','Corn, coconut & lentil chowder','Serve up our healthy corn, coconut & lentil chowder for lunch. Lentils, onions and sweetcorn give this dish valuable fibre for a healthy digestive system','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions, chopped (320g)","4 garlic cloves, chopped","2 red chillies, deseeded and chopped","2 tbsp medium curry powder","2 tsp cumin seeds","2 tsp ground turmeric","250g red lentils","2l vegetable stock, made with 3 tsp bouillon powder","600g frozen sweetcorn","600g potatoes, cut into small cubes","280g coconut yogurt","10g coriander, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the onions for 8 mins, stirring often until softened. Stir in the garlic, chillies, curry powder, cumin seeds, turmeric and lentils, and cook for a few minutes more, still stirring. Pour in the stock and sweetcorn. Bring to the boil, then cover, reduce the heat and simmer for 15-20 mins, or until the lentils are tender.","Remove from the heat and briefly blitz the soup using ahand blender– you don’t want it to be completely smooth. Add the potatoes, then cover and return to a medium heat for 10-15 mins more, or until the potatoes are tender. Remove from the heat and stir in the yogurt and coriander.","Serve two bowlfuls straightaway.Leave the rest of the soup to cool completely, then keep chilled for up to four days. Reheat in a pan over a low heat until piping hot.This recipe is part of our free 7-day healthy diet plan. To access the full meal plan,click here."]','2026-01-10 12:17:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6185,6185,'en','Alu tamatar masala','Try this vegan dish of potatoes cooked in tomato masala. It’s simple to make, but with tomatoes cooked in spices and curry leaves, it’s packed with flavour','["6 medium potatoes (about 1kg), roughly chopped","2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 tsp black mustard seeds","6-8 curry leaves","1 green chilli, thinly sliced","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2.5cm piece of ginger, peeled and finely chopped","5 medium tomatoes, finely chopped","1 tsp garam masala","½ tsp chilli powder","½ tsp ground turmeric","handful of coriander leaves"]','["Bring a large pan of water to the boil over a medium-high heat and cook the potatoes for 10-15 mins until just tender (a cutlery knife should just be able to cut through). Drain and set aside.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a low heat and add the mustard seeds. When they begin to pop, add the curry leaves, chilli, garlic and ginger, and cook for 1 min until the aromas start to release. Stir in the tomatoes, then cover and cook for 10 mins until soft and mushy","Add the garam masala, chilli powder, turmeric and 1 tsp salt. Mix well and cook for another minute before adding the cooked potatoes. Pour in 200ml water, cover and simmer for 10 mins until the potatoes are completely tender. Mash a few of the potatoes with a potato masher, keeping the rest whole. Sprinkle over the coriander leaves to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6187,6187,'en','Three bean salad with mozzarella','This substantial salad features a delicious mix of cannellini, kidney and green beans, and is ideal for a summer picnic','["320g fine beans, ends trimmed and halved if large","4 carrots (320g), cut into slim batons","2 red onions, halved and sliced","400g can cannellini beans, drained","400g can red kidney beans, drained","320g mixed colour baby tomatoes (ours were red, yellow and orange), halved","15g basil leaves, roughly torn","120g vegetarian mozzarella, cut into cubes","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1-2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","½-1 tsp dried oregano","1 tsp dried English mustard powder","15 pitted Kalamata olives (about 45g), sliced","½ tsp lemon zest and 2 tbsp juice"]','["Boil or steam the green beans and carrots for 8-10 mins until just tender. Put the sliced onions in a bowl and pour over boiling water until just covered.","Meanwhile, make the dressing. Mix all the ingredients together in a large bowl.","Tip the cooked beans and carrots into the dressing along with the drained onions, canned beans and tomatoes, toss well, then add the basil and toss again. Serve scattered with the mozzarella and a grinding of black pepper, if you like.Will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:17:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6189,6189,'en','Vegetarian pastitsio','In our veggie version of this Greek pasta dish, budget-friendly lentils replace the meat and we’ve used a little balsamic vinegar instead of grape','["2 large onions (330g), halved and sliced","1 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 bay leaves","2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","1 tsp dried oregano","1 tsp ground cinnamon","250g penne pasta","400g can chopped tomatoes","4 tbsp tomato purée","2 x 400g cans green lentils","salad of tomatoes, onion and dill tossed with lemon and olives, to serve","500ml milk or plant-based milk","50g wholemeal flour","1 egg, separated","40g vegetarian feta, crumbled","½ tsp oregano"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Put the onions and oil in a largesaucepanwith the bouillon, bay leaves, the vinegar, garlic, oregano and cinnamon. Add a mug of water (about 250ml), then cover and simmer for 10 mins until soft. Uncover and cook for 10 mins more, stirring frequently. The water should evaporate after this time and the onions should be soft.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta in a large pan of boiling water following pack instructions, or for 10 mins until al dente. Drain and set aside.","Stir the tomatoes, tomato purée and the lentils, along with their liquid, into the onions. Stir well, then cover and simmer for 5 mins. Remove the bay leaves.","To make the white sauce, pour the milk and 200ml water into a pan with the flour,whiskwell to stop lumps forming and keep stirring until thickened, for about 8-10 mins.","Stir the egg white into the pasta and spoon over the base of a baking dish. Top with the lentil mixture. Stir the egg yolk into the white sauce, then spoon on top of the lentils, scatter over the feta and oregano, then bake in the oven for 40 mins until bubbling.","Serve half with the tomato and onion salad, and chill the rest for another day.Will keep chilled for up to two days. Reheat in themicrowaveon plates until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:17:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6191,6191,'en','Chickpea, charred aubergine & feta salad','This sharing salad contains two of your 5-a-day and is packed with flavour. Ensure the feta is vegetarian if needed','["1 large or 2 medium aubergines","4 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp chilli flakes","1 lemon, juiced","2 x 400g cans chickpeas, drained","small handful of mint, finely chopped, plus some whole leaves to serve","2 tbsp toasted pine nuts","200g feta, crumbled"]','["Thinly slice the aubergine lengthways into 1cm-thick pieces, then slice each into three strips. Toss with 2 tbsp of the oil and some salt. Heat a griddle pan over a high heat or until almost smoking, then griddle the strips for 2-3 mins on each sideuntil tender. Transfer to a large bowl (you can also barbecue them if you prefer).","Mix the chilli flakes, lemon juice and remaining oil together with some seasoning. Tip the chickpeas into the bowl with the aubergine, add the dressing and mint, then toss everything together. Tip onto a serving platter, scatter over the pine nuts and feta, and scatter over some mint leaves to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6193,6193,'en','Parmentier potatoes','Serve parmentier potatoes instead of chips or roasties for a more elegant side. This is a classic dish flavoured with rosemary and garlic, and it’s easy to make','["1kg floury potatoes, peeled and cut into 2cm cubes","4 garlic cloves, bashed","2 rosemary sprigs, needles picked and finely chopped","4 tbsp vegetable oil"]','["Tip the potatoes into a large pan of cold water and season with a large pinch of salt. Bring to the boil over a high heat, then immediately drain and leave to steam-dry for a few minutes in acolander.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Tip the potatoes onto a large baking tray along with the garlic cloves, rosemary and oil. Season well, then mix everything thoroughly so each potato cube is coated in the oil. Shake the tray gently to spread the potatoes out into a rough single layer. Roast for 30-35 mins, turning halfway through, until the potatoes are golden and crisp on the outside and tender when pierced with a fork. Serve with roast lamb, fish or as an alternative to chips or roast potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:17:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6195,6195,'en','Air fryer baked potatoes','Try baking potatoes in an air fryer to achieve a crisp skin with a fluffy centre. The process is quicker and more energy-efficient than using the oven','["4 baking potatoes (about 250g each)","½ tbsp sunflower oil","toppings of your choice, such as butter, cheese, baked beans or tuna mayonnaise"]','["Scrub the potatoes, then pat dry with kitchen paper. Transfer to a plate, drizzle over the oil and rub it into the skins using your hands so the potatoes are well-coated. Season with salt and pepper – the salt will help the skins crisp up.","Arrange the potatoes in a single layer in anair fryerbasket. Set the air fryer to 200C and cook for 40-50 mins, or until a sharp knife goes through the potatoes easily. Check the potatoes after 20 mins – if they seem to be browning too quickly on one side, turn them over using tongs, then check again after another 20 mins to ensure they''re cooked through.  When ready, the skin should be crisp and the inside tender and fluffy. Split and serve immediately with the toppings of your choice."]','2026-01-10 12:17:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6197,6197,'en','Spiced spinach & potato pasty pies','Make a batch of these curried veggie pies to stash in the freezer for an easy lunch with salad, or warming starter. Eat like a pasty with mango chutney','["3 tbsp sunflower oil","1 tsp cumin seeds, plus a pinch for sprinkling","thumb-sized piece of ginger, finely grated","6 garlic cloves, finely grated","2 tbsp curry powder","500g potatoes, cut into small chunks","200g spinach, roughly chopped","1 tsp garam masala","1 egg","¼ tsp turmeric","500g block shortcrust pastry (see tip, below)","plain flour, for dusting","mango chutney or lime pickle, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a deep frying pan that has a lid or in a largesaucepanover a medium heat. Cook the cumin seeds in the oil for a few seconds until they start to crackle, then stir in the ginger and garlic, and cook for a minute more. Mix in the curry powder and cook for another minute. Stir through the potatoes until completely coated in the spice mix and cook for 4 mins.","Pour about 75ml water over the potatoes and season with salt. Put the lid on and cook over a medium-high heat for 6-8 mins, until the potatoes are just cooked and most of the water has been absorbed. Add the spinach, cover the pan and cook for a minute. Remove the lid and cook for another 5 mins until the spinach is completely wilted and there’s no liquid in the pan. Turn off the heat and season with the garam masala. Leave to cool. Will keep chilled for up to two days.","To assemble the pies, mix the egg with the turmeric and a pinch of salt in a bowl and set aside. Roll the pastry out on a lightly floured surface to the thickness of a pound coin and cut out four circles about 12cm wide, arranging them on abaking traylined with baking parchment. Put a quarter of the potato mixture into the middle of each pastry circle, leaving a border. Re-roll the pastry offcuts, then cut out four more circles, about 8cm wide. Brush the borders of the larger pastry circles with the spiced egg, then drape the smaller circles over the potato filling. Pinch the borders to seal. Brush the pies with more of the spiced egg and scatter over a pinch of cumin seeds. Will keep frozen for up to two months. Defrost fully before baking.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and bake the pies for 30-35 mins until deep golden. Leave to cool a little, then enjoy warm or leave to cool completely and eat like a pasty with mango chutney or lime pickle. Will keep chilled for two days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:17:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6199,6199,'en','Wild mushroom mac ‘n’ cheese','Give mac ’n’ cheese a mushroom makeover for a freeze-ahead family meal. Using dried wild mushrooms means you don’t have to wait until they’re in season','["25g dried mushrooms (mixed dried mushrooms or porcini are good)","75g butter","200g chestnut mushrooms, sliced","50g plain flour","500ml whole milk","1 tsp English mustard powder or English mustard","350g macaroni or other short pasta","grating of nutmeg","150g extra mature cheddar, grated","50g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated","25g panko breadcrumbs (optional)"]','["Tip the dried mushrooms into a heatproof bowl, pour over hot water from thekettleuntil just covered, then set aside to soak until cool. Meanwhile, heat about a third of the butter in a frying pan until sizzling and scatter in the chestnut mushrooms. Season and fry for 4-5 mins over a high heat until soft and cooked through. Set aside. When the dried mushrooms are cool, drain over a bowl to catch the soaking juices, pressing to squeeze out all the liquid, then roughly chop.","Heat all but about ½ tsp of the remaining butter in a largesaucepanover a high heat until sizzling, then add the rehydrated mushrooms and fry for 2-3 mins until well browned. Scatter over the flour and stir together to make a sandy paste. Cook for 2 mins, then gradually pour in the reserved mushroom soaking liquid, leaving any sediment in the bottom of the bowl. Simmer until thickened, then gradually stir orwhiskin the milk until completely incorporated into a sauce. Add the mustard powder or mustard and season to taste with a grating of nutmeg and some salt and pepper. Leave the sauce to cook gently on a low-medium heat. Meanwhile, cook the macaroni in a saucepan of boiling water for 2 mins less than stated on the packet.","When the macaroni is ready, drain well and tip back into the saucepan. Pour over the mushroom sauce, tip in the fried chestnut mushrooms, all the cheddar and half the parmesan, then vigorously stir everything together until fully combined. Use the last of the butter to butter acasserole dish, then scrape in the macaroni and mushroom mix. Scatter with the remaining parmesan and the breadcrumbs, if using.Will keep covered and chilled for up to two days or in the freezer for up to three months. Defrost fully in the fridge before baking.","When you’re ready to cook, heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Bake for 20-25 mins until golden and bubbling. Leave to stand for a few minutes, then bring to the table and serve straight from the dish."]','2026-01-10 12:17:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6201,6201,'en','Lahori chanay ki daal','Try this version of chanay ki daal for a taste of the street-food stalls of Lahore in Pakistan – black cardamom helps mimic a coal-smoked taste','["350g chana daal","4 tbsp sunflower oil","1 tbsp ghee (or unsalted butter)","1 tsp whole cumin seeds","1 black cardamom (optional)","1 red onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1⁄2in piece of ginger, peeled","4 tbsp tomato purée","1⁄2 tsp ground turmeric","1⁄2 red chilli powder or Kashmiri chilli powder","1 tbsp kasuri methi (dried fenugreek) (optional)","1 green chilli, finely chopped","small bunch of coriander leaves, chopped","1⁄2in piece of ginger, peeled and julienned","1 tsp chaat masala (optional)"]','["Wash and soak the chana daal for about 30 mins. Tip into a large pan, pour over 2 litres of water and boil over a medium heat for 20 mins, until soft but not falling apart or mushy. Add a little more water if it dries up. Drain any remaining water.","Warm the oil and ghee in asaucepanover a medium heat until melted. Add the cumin seeds and black cardamom, and cook briefly for about 15-20 seconds. Tip in the onion and cook until it turns golden, then lower the heat to low-medium and keep stirring for 5 mins.","Add the garlic and ginger, fry until for about 30 seconds, stirring constantly to avoid sticking.","Add the tomato purée, a splash of water, the turmeric, a good pinch of salt and the red chilli powder. Fry for about 2 mins, stirring, until the water has reduced completely.","Tip in the cooked lentils and pour in 150ml of water. Turn the heat down to low, cover and cook for 8-10 mins, stirring regularly to avoid burning the bottom.","Stir in the kasuri methi if using, then cover and cook for about 2-3 mins more. Serve with the chopped chilli, coriander, julienned ginger and chaat masala scattered over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6203,6203,'en','Garlic & black olive sharing bread','Gather friends round for a feast and serve this tear ‘n’ share bread flavoured with garlic and black olives. It can be made up to three days ahead','["300ml whole milk","140g unsalted butter, cut into cubes","2 tsp caster sugar","4 garlic cloves, crushed","500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp parsley, finely chopped","140g black olives, pitted and finely chopped (Kalamata work well)","vegetable oil, for proving"]','["Warm 80ml of the milk in a small pan over a low heat or in themicrowaveand add 1 tbsp sea salt. Stir to dissolve and set aside to cool.","Meanwhile, melt half the butter in 200ml of the milk in asaucepanset over a medium heat, along with the sugar and half the garlic. Leave to cool until lukewarm.","Tip the flour and yeast into the large bowl of astand mixerand mix together using the dough hook attachment. Gradually work in the melted butter and milk mixture. Once the dough begins to come together, add the salted milk, parsley and half the olives. Keep mixing for 6 mins using the dough hook, or turn out onto a lightly floured surface and knead by hand for 10 mins.","Oil the bowl, add the dough, then rub oil over the top. Cover with a tea towel and leave in a warm place for at least 1 hr or until doubled in size.","Meanwhile, heat the remaining butter in a smallsaucepanover a low heat, and add the remaining crushed garlic and remaining olives. Warm the garlic and olives through for a few minutes, then leave to cool.","Once the dough has risen, turn it out onto a lightly floured work surface and gently punch it back. Divide it into seven pieces, between 130-140g each, and roll them into tight balls, tucking the edges underneath so the balls are perfectly smooth with the seams on the underside. Arrange in a 20-23cm round cake tin lined with baking parchment, ensuring the dough balls are equally spaced around the edge with one in the middle. Cover with a tea towel and leave to rise until roughly doubled in size again, about 20-30 mins.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Brush the dough with the garlic butter, avoiding the olives. Bake in the oven for 30-35 mins until golden brown on top and cooked through. Pour over the remaining garlic butter along with the olives.Will keep for up to three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:17:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6205,6205,'en','Crunchy garlic & parmesan sprouts','Forget soggy Brussels sprouts! Spruce up a classic Christmas side with the help of a crispy, golden parmesan and breadcrumb topping','["600g Brussels sprouts, halved","50g butter, melted","2 garlic cloves, crushed","50g panko breadcrumbs","25g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, finely grated"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the sprouts into a bowl, drizzle over the melted butter, add the garlic and season. Toss the sprouts until they’re well coated in the butter, then add the breadcrumbs and parmesan, and toss again.","Tip the sprouts onto abaking tray, making sure they’re well-spaced apart in a single layer. (If they’re packed too closely they will steam instead of roasting.) Place as many as possible cut-side down for maximum crispiness. Press any excess crumbs onto the sprouts to help them stick.","Roast for 25-30 mins until crisp and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:17:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6207,6207,'en','Heritage carrots with hazelnut granola','Try these caramelised, nutty carrots as a stunning side dish. You can make the granola up to two days in advance and keep it in an airtight container','["400g baby carrots, scrubbed and trimmed","2 tbsp olive oil","2 thyme sprigs","½ tbsp butter","40g honey","50g oats","25g sunflower seeds","25g hazelnuts","100g butter","4 large carrots, sliced into thin rounds","80g mimolette or red leicester, finely grated"]','["First, make the granola. Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Melt the butter with the honey in the microwave for 40 seconds. Toast the oats, seeds and hazelnuts on a baking tray in the oven for 5 mins. Remove from the oven, mix with the melted butter mixture and return to the oven for another 8 mins. Stir well, then return to the oven for another 8 mins until the granola is golden and toasted. Season with salt and set aside to cool.Can be made up to two days ahead and kept in an airtight container.","Turn up the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the baby carrots in foil with a glug of olive oil, the thyme and a little seasoning. Wrap in an envelope and bake for 20 mins or until tender.","Meanwhile, make the purée by heating 80g butter in a pan and gently frying the carrot slices with 50ml water until they start to caramelise. Keep over a low heat for about 15 mins until deeply coloured and completely tender. Leave to cool a little, then put in ablender. Blend with 25ml water until smooth, then season.","Melt the remaining 20g butter and cook until just brown with a nutty smell. To serve, divide the purée between two plates. Cut the baby carrots into two to three pieces and sit on top of the purée. Drizzle with a little of the brown butter, sprinkle over generous amounts of the granola and finish with a grating of the cheese and a pinch of sea salt."]','2026-01-10 12:17:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6209,6209,'en','Whole baked cauliflower cheese','Why go to the trouble of chopping cauliflower? Roasting it whole is super-simple to prep and makes an impressive addition to a roast dinner','["1 large cauliflower (about 1kg)","50g unsalted butter","50g plain flour","large pinch of sweet smoked paprika","600ml whole milk","2 tsp English mustard","170g mature cheddar, gruyère, comté or a mixture","½ bunch of chives, finely chopped"]','["Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil. Pull any large leaves off the cauliflower, but leave any smaller ones attached. Carefully lower the cauliflower into the water and boil for 15 mins, then drain and set aside.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Melt the butter in a medium pan over a medium heat, then stir in the flour and paprika, and cook for 1-2 mins. Remove from the heat and slowlywhiskin the milk until smooth, then mix in the mustard. Return the pan to the heat and bring the mixture to the boil, whisking continuously. Add two-thirds of the cheese and whisk until the cheese has melted. Season to taste.","Put the cauliflower in the middle of a deep baking dish and pour over the cheese sauce. Sprinkle with the remaining cheese. Bake uncovered for 30-35 mins until golden brown and bubbling. Scatter with the chives before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6211,6211,'en','Cheese & onion pie','Put in the extra effort to make this cheese and onion pie and it’s sure to please. With homemade pastry, it’s as good to eat cold as it is warm','["250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","50g rye flour (or make up the weight with plain flour)","large pinch of cayenne pepper","1 tsp onion seeds","25g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, finely grated","125g cold butter, cubed","1 egg, beaten","40g butter","3 large onions, finely sliced","2 bay leaves","1 tbsp thyme leaves","1 medium potato (about 350g), halved lengthways and sliced","100ml double cream","150g extra mature cheddar, ½ grated, ½ chopped into small chunks"]','["First, make the pastry. Tip the flours into a medium bowl with the cayenne, onion seeds, parmesan and a generous pinch of salt. Rub in the butter until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs, then pour in half the egg and 2 tbsp cold water and bring everything together using your hands. Knead a couple of times until smooth. Flatten a third of the dough into a disc, then do the same with the remaining dough. Wrap both pastry discs and chill in the fridge for at least 30 mins.Will keep chilled for up to two days.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Heat the butter in asaucepanover a medium heat until sizzling, then scatter in the onions, bay, thyme, a large pinch of salt and good grinding of black pepper. Stir, then cook slowly for 10 mins until the onions have cooked down and started to caramelise. Stir in the sliced potatoes, cover and cook for 8-10 mins more, stirring occasionally until the potatoes are soft and starting to break down. Stir in the cream, remove the pan from the heat and leave to cool. Once cool, remove and discard the bay, then fold in the cheese.","Rollthe smaller pastry disc out on a lightly floured surface to the size of a dinner plate and lift onto a baking sheet lined with baking parchment. Roll out the remaining pastry disc along with any offcuts to a circle about 5cm wider than the first. Spoon the filling into the middle of the smaller circle on the baking sheet, leaving a 4cm border. Brush the exposed border with some of the remaining beaten egg, then drape over the larger pastry circle. Tuck the edge around the filling to enclose it, as if making a giant ravioli. Trim the edge to neaten, then crimp with a cutlery knife handle or fork to seal. Brush the pie all over with most of the remaining beaten egg, and use any trimmings to make decorations, if you like.","Heat the oven to 210C/190C fan/gas 7. Bake the pie for 35-40 mins until deeply golden, brushing with the rest of the beaten egg halfway through. Leave to cool on the baking sheet for at least 20 mins before cutting into wedges, or leave to cool completely and serve cold."]','2026-01-10 12:17:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6213,6213,'en','Vegan chai hot chocolate','Don’t compromise on flavour or creamy consistency with vegan hot chocolate; this spiced drink made with oat milk is the perfect winter warmer','["350ml oat milk (use barista-style for a creamy texture)","1 tsp organic cocoa powder","½ tsp ground cinnamon, plus extra to serve (optional)","½ tsp ground nutmeg, plus extra to serve (optional)","1 cardamom pod","½ tsp ground coffee","1 organic vanilla bean pod, split (or use 1 tbsp vanilla extract)","1 tbsp agave nectar","vegan whipped cream and shaved semi-sweet vegan dark chocolate, to serve (optional)"]','["Pour two-thirds of the oat milk into asaucepan. Add the cocoa, cinnamon, nutmeg, cardamom pod and coffee. Bring to the boil over a medium-high heat. Cook for 1-2 mins.","Reduce the heat to medium and stir in the vanilla and agave. Froth the remaining oat milk using an electric milk frother or the mini whisk attachment on a hand blender. Strain the hot chocolate into two mugs, discarding the cinnamon and cardamom pod, then gently pour in the frothed milk.","Top with whipped cream, chocolate shavings and a pinch each of cinnamon and nutmeg, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6215,6215,'en','Spicy rice burritos','Homemade wholemeal wraps stuffed with spicy tomato rice and avocado make the perfect finger food','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil, plus 2 tsp","2 onions (320g), finely chopped","150g brown basmati rice","2-3 tsp mild chilli powder","1 tsp each ground coriander and cumin","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","400g can black beans, drained","180g spelt wholemeal flour, plus extra for dusting and a little for sprinkling","2 avocados","1 lime, juiced","4 large iceberg lettuce leaves (about 120g)","198g can sweetcorn, drained","120g pot bio yogurt","15g coriander, finely chopped","12 Kalamata olives, halved"]','["Heat 1 tbsp oil in a non-stick pan, add the onions and cook for 10 mins over a medium heat. Stir in the rice and spices, tip in the tomatoes with a can of water and the tomato purée, then cover and simmer for 25 mins. Stir in the beans, take off the lid, bring back up to a simmer and cook for 5-10 mins more until the rice is tender. Leave to cool.","Meanwhile, tip the flour into a small bowl. Mix the 2 tsp of oil with 115ml cold water, then into the flour and stir with the blade of a cutlery knife until the mixture starts to come together into a soft dough. Use your hands to bring the mixture into a ball, then quarter and cover with a tea towel while you wait for the rice to cook and cool.","Lightly flour the work surface and heat a large non-stick frying pan over a medium heat, but don''t add any oil. Roll out one of the balls of dough to a rough circle about 25cm that is paper-thin. Carefully peel off the work surface and slap into the frying pan. The dough will cook within a minute, then flip over and cook for a few seconds more. Lift onto a plate and cook the remaining dough in the same way. Cover the wraps until you need them.","Roughly smash the avocados with the lime juice. Lay the whole lettuce leaves over the wraps, then add a layer of rice, scatter with sweetcorn, then top with the avocado, yogurt, coriander and olives. Carefully roll up into burritos. Wrap two of the burritos in baking parchment and store in the fridge overnight.Will keep chilled for up to a day. If putting in a lunchbox, use an ice pack to keep them cool."]','2026-01-10 12:17:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6217,6217,'en','Aubergine, halloumi & harissa skillet bake','Make this special vegetarian aubergine, halloumi, tomato and harissa skillet bake for a midweek meal for two. It’s an easy one-pan dinner to share','["2-4 tbsp olive oil, plus a drizzle","1 large aubergine, sliced into rounds about ½cm thick","2 large garlic cloves, crushed","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp harissa paste","½ tsp caster sugar","225g block halloumi, sliced into 8-9 pieces","pinch of dried mint","flatbreads, rice or couscous, to serve"]','["Heat 1 tbsp oil in a roughly 22cm ovenproof skillet orfrying pan, then add the aubergine slices in a single layer (you’ll need to do this in batches). Cook for 2-3 mins on each side until just golden and softened, adding another 1 tbsp oil between each batch. Transfer to a plate.","If the pan is dry, add another 1 tbsp oil. Fry the garlic until sizzling but not coloured. Stir in the tomatoes, harissa, sugar and a pinch of salt. Bubble for a minute, squashing the tomatoes. Remove from the heat and leave to cool slightly.","Meanwhile, halve each piece of halloumi (don’t worry if they fall apart). Arrange the aubergine and halloumi slices in overlapping concentric circles on top of the tomato mixture, ensuring there are one or two pieces of halloumi between each aubergine slice. Drizzle with a little more oil and sprinkle with the mint. Cover the pan with foil and bake for 20 mins at 180C/160C fan/gas 4, then remove the foil and bake for a further 5-10 mins until the halloumi has started to brown. Serve with warm flatbreads, rice or couscous."]','2026-01-10 12:17:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6219,6219,'en','Carrot pilaf with coriander chutney','Try this healthy pilaf filled for an easy midweek meal. With cashew nuts, veg and spices, it’s not only tasty but budget-friendly too. Top with coriander chutney','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 large onion, finely sliced","2 tbsp grated ginger","2 green chillies, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp coriander seeds, crushed","4 cardamom pods, bruised","½ cinnamon stick","1 tbsp garam masala","400g carrots, peeled and ½ coarsely grated, ½ sliced on an angle","300g basmati rice, rinsed well","600ml hot vegetable stock","large bunch of coriander, finely chopped (stalks included)","60g cashews, toasted and chopped","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 large onion, finely sliced","2 tbsp grated ginger","2 green chillies, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp coriander seeds, crushed","4 cardamom pods, bruised","½ cinnamon stick","1 tbsp garam masala","400g carrots, peeled and ½ coarsely grated, ½ sliced on an angle","300g basmati rice, rinsed well","600ml hot vegetable stock","large bunch of coriander, finely chopped (stalks included)","60g cashews, toasted and chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan that has a tight-fitting lid. Fry the onions with a pinch of salt over a medium heat for 10-15 mins until golden and crisp. Remove from the pan with a slotted spoon and drain on kitchen paper, leaving the oil in the pan.","Add half the ginger, half the chilli, all the garlic, spices, and both types of carrots to the pan, and fry for 6-8 mins until the carrot slices are starting to turn golden. Add the rice, stir briefly, then add the stock, a handful of the coriander, a good pinch of salt and grinding of black pepper. Bring to a simmer, and as soon as it starts to boil, turn the heat down to low, cover with a lid and leave to cook for 12-15 mins.","Meanwhile, put the remaining ginger and green chilli, most of the cashews and most of the remaining coriander in a smallblenderwith 50ml water. Blend until smooth, adding another 2-3 tbsp water, if needed, to make a spoonable sauce.","When all the liquid has been absorbed into the pilaf and the rice is tender, fluff up the grains with a fork. Spoon over the coriander chutney, and sprinkle with the fried onions, reserved coriander and remaining cashews to serve.","Heat the oil in a large pan that has a tight-fitting lid. Fry the onions with a pinch of salt over a medium heat for 10-15 mins until golden and crisp. Remove from the pan with a slotted spoon and drain on kitchen paper, leaving the oil in the pan.","Add half the ginger, half the chilli, all the garlic, spices, and both types of carrots to the pan, and fry for 6-8 mins until the carrot slices are starting to turn golden. Add the rice, stir briefly, then add the stock, a handful of the coriander, a good pinch of salt and grinding of black pepper. Bring to a simmer, and as soon as it starts to boil, turn the heat down to low, cover with a lid and leave to cook for 12-15 mins.","Meanwhile, put the remaining ginger and green chilli, most of the cashews and most of the remaining coriander in a smallblenderwith 50ml water. Blend until smooth, adding another 2-3 tbsp water, if needed, to make a spoonable sauce.","When all the liquid has been absorbed into the pilaf and the rice is tender, fluff up the grains with a fork. Spoon over the coriander chutney, and sprinkle with the fried onions, reserved coriander and remaining cashews to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6221,6221,'en','Cauliflower cheese steak & cannellini bean gratin with sage crumbs','Enjoy this cheesy cauliflower and cannellini bean gratin as a veggie centrepiece in a family feast, or try as a side dish to accompany a meat main course','["1 large or 2 small cauliflower (about 1kg)","50g butter","50g plain flour","500ml milk","2 bay leaves","200g mature cheddar, grated","1 tsp English mustard powder","small bunch of sage, leaves picked and finely chopped","2 x 400g cans cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","75g grated mozzarella","1 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, crushed","50g dried breadcrumbs","1 lemon, zested"]','["Remove the leaves from the cauliflower, discarding any that are very thick-stemmed or damaged, and reserving any smaller ones.Cutthe cauliflower into four to six steaks or wedges through the stem to help keep the florets attached. Cut any florets that fall off into even-sized pieces.","Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil, and cook the cauliflower steaks for 5-6 mins until just tender. Add the reserved leaves and loose florets for the final 2 mins of cooking time. Drain, then leave to steam-dry while you make the cheese sauce.","To make the cheese sauce, melt the butter in the same pan over a medium heat, then sprinkle in the flour.Whiskuntil you have a thick paste, then gradually add the milk, a splash at a time, whisking until it’s all incorporated. Add the bay leaves and cook for another 5-6 mins until thickened. Stir in the cheddar and mustard powder and season well.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip half the sage and all the beans into the sauce. Stir briefly. Fold in the loose cauliflower florets and leaves. Arrange the cauliflower steaks in a baking dish, then pour over the cheese sauce, making sure it coats the steaks well. Scatter with the mozzarella and bake for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, stir the oil, garlic, breadcrumbs, lemon zest and the remaining sage together in a bowl.","Remove the dish from the oven, and scatter over the breadcrumb mixture. Bake for 15 mins more until a cutlery knife goes through the cauliflower steaks easily, and the top is golden and bubbling. Leave to rest for 5 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6223,6223,'en','Potato, shredded sprout & chestnut gratin','Enjoy this vegetarian gratin with wintry greens, or as a creamy side dish in a family feast. With sprouts and chestnut, it’s a wonderfully festive dish','["3 garlic cloves","400ml double cream","400ml whole milk","1 onion, cut into four thick slices","1 bay leaf, scrunched up","a few knobs of butter, plus extra for the dish","1kg floury potatoes, very thinly sliced","250g whole cooked chestnuts, roughly chopped into chunks","250g Brussels sprouts, shredded","125g cheddar, grated","grating of nutmeg"]','["Squash the peeled garlic cloves with the blade of a knife, then put in a largesaucepanwith the cream, milk, onion slices, bay leaf and 2 tsp sea salt. Bring to the boil over a low heat. When the mixture is bubbling, remove from the heat and leave to infuse for 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3, and generously butter a large, deep baking dish. Sieve the infused milk over a bowl and discard the onion, bay leaf and garlic (you can reserve these to use in a bread sauce, if you like). Arrange a layer of the potatoes in the dish, then scatter over some of the chestnuts, sprouts, cheese and a little nutmeg. Drizzle over some of the infused milk mixture. Repeat until you’ve used all the ingredients, finishing with a layer of potatoes, then cover with the last of the infused milk mixture. Dot over a few small knobs of butter.","Bake the gratin for 1 hr 15 mins on the middle shelf of the oven until golden and crisp on top. A knife inserted into the middle should slide in easily. Leave the gratin to rest for 10 mins, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6225,6225,'en','Mushroom & sweet potato wellington','Wow family and friends with this mushroom and sweet potato wellington with cranberries. It makes an impressive centrepiece dish in a vegetarian Christmas','["90g dried porcini mushrooms","2 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","250g chestnut mushrooms, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","500g sweet potatoes (about 2 large), peeled and cut into 2cm chunks","1 tbsp finely chopped rosemary","1 tbsp finely chopped sage, plus 4 whole leaves","100g soft white breadcrumbs","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses (see tip below)","40g chopped walnuts or pecans","40g dried cranberries","grating of nutmeg","2 x 320g sheets dairy-free puff pastry","plain flour, to dust","3 tbsp plant-based milk","1 tbsp English mustard or Dijon mustard with a pinch of turmeric"]','["Put the dried mushrooms in a heatproof bowl and pour over 500ml boiling water from the kettle. Stir and press them down so they’re well covered, then leave to soak.","Heat the olive oil in a wide frying pan over a medium heat, and fry the onion and chestnut mushrooms until the veg is very soft and the mushrooms look wilted and reduced, about 20 mins.","Stir in the garlic and sweet potatoes, then the rehydrated mushrooms and their soaking liquid, leaving the last dregs of the liquid in the bowl (this may contain grit from the mushrooms). Cover and cook for 15 mins until the sweet potatoes are just softened, and most of the liquid has evaporated. Add a splash more water halfway through if the liquid evaporates too quickly.","Remove the lid and stir in the chopped herbs, breadcrumbs, molasses, nuts and cranberries. Season well and sprinkle in the nutmeg. The mixture should be stiff enough to resemble stuffing, but not dry – all the breadcrumbs should be coated and have absorbed some of the liquid. Remove from the heat and leave to cool in the pan.","Once cool, unroll one of the puff pastry sheets onto a lightly floured non-stick baking sheet orbaking traylined with baking parchment.Whiskthe milk and mustard together with a pinch of salt and set aside.","Spoon the cooled filling down the middle of the pastry sheet in a neat line, leaving a 5cm border around the edges. Use the mustard-milk mix to brush the borders, then top with the second pastry sheet. Press the pastry around the filling to remove any air pockets, then crimp to seal the sides. Trim off any excess pastry with asharp knifeand use a fork or your fingers to make a pattern around the edge of the wellington.","Cut a small steam hole in the top of the middle, then brush the top with the mustard-milk mix. Chill on the sheet or tray for 30 mins. Will keep in the fridge for up to two days.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Remove the wellington from the fridge and brush with more of the mustard-milk mix. Score a pattern into the top of the pastry with a cutlery knife or fork, if you like, then bake for 35-40 mins until golden, puffed up and crisp – cover with foil if it’s browning too quickly. Arrange the whole sage leaves on top of the wellington and stick them down with the mustard-milk mix, then return to the oven for 10 mins more.","Leave to rest on a board or platter for 10 mins before cutting into chunky slices to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6227,6227,'en','Stuffed baby squash with creamy mushrooms & tarragon','Delight dinner guests with these stuffed baby squash, made with mixed grains, mushrooms and tarragon. It makes an ideal veggie centrepiece at Christmas','["4 onion or acorn squash","4 tbsp olive oil","50g dried wild mushrooms","2 banana shallots, peeled and sliced","200g chestnut mushrooms, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","100ml vegetable stock","250g cooked mixed grains","4 tbsp crème fraîche","½ small bunch of tarragon, finely chopped","80g mature cheddar, finely grated"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Using a serratedknife, cut a small disc off the bottom of each squash so they stand upright on a baking tray. Slice off the tops (these will be used as lids), and scoop out and discard the seeded centre. Rub 2 tbsp oil on the inside and outside of the squashes, then season.","Tip the dried mushrooms into a heatproof bowl and cover with 100ml boiling water. Cover and leave to soak for 15 mins. Meanwhile, heat the remaining oil in anon-stick frying pan, and cook the shallots for 10 mins until softened and translucent. Drain the rehydrated mushrooms (reserving the soaking liquid) and roughly chop, then add to the pan along with the chestnut mushrooms. Fry for 10 mins more. Stir in the garlic and cook for another minute. Add the stock, most of the reserved soaking liquid (leave the last few drops in the bottom of the bowl, as this may contain grit) and the grains, and bring to the boil. Remove from the heat and stir in the crème fraîche, tarragon and cheese. Season.","Divide the filling between the hollowed-out squashes. Put the ‘lids’ on top and bake for 1 hr-1 hr 10 mins, depending on the size of the squash. When ready, the squash skins should be blistered and the flesh soft and cooked through. Leave to rest for 10 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6229,6229,'en','Parsnip, feta & butter bean pie','Looking for a showstopping veggie dish? Packed with parsnips, feta and butter beans, this pie makes the perfect Christmas centrepiece','["400g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","150g rye flour","300g cold butter, cut into cubes","1 tbsp thyme leaves","2 large eggs, plus 1 egg yolk to glaze","pinch of dried thyme or mixed herbs","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, sliced","600g parsnips, peeled and cut into 1cm cubes","2 large eggs","200g crème fraîche","200g feta, crumbled","1/2 small bunch of thyme, leaves picked","2 x 400g cans butter beans, drained and rinsed","½ tsp ground mace","1 lemon, zested"]','["To make the pastry, put both flours into the bowl of afood processorwith the butter, thyme leaves and ½ tsp fine sea salt. Pulse for a few seconds until the mixture resembles sandy rubble, then add the whole eggs and 2-3 tbsp cold water. Pulse again until it comes together into a ball, then transfer to a lightly dusted work surface and knead briefly until smooth. Wrap and chill for 30 mins.","To make the filling, heat the oil in a frying pan over a low-medium heat, and cook the onion for 30 mins until sticky, golden and caramelised. This will take some time, but it will add depth and sweetness to the pie. Add a splash of water if the onions start to darken too quickly or catch.","Add the parsnips and 250ml water. Cook for 15 mins, stirring often until the water has evaporated and the parsnips are tender and just starting to colour. Remove from the heat and leave to cool.","Mix the eggs and crème fraîche together in a large bowl until smooth, then fold in the feta, thyme, butter beans and the veg mixture. Add the mace, lemon zest, ½ tsp black pepper and a little salt.","Cut off two-thirds of the pastry androll it outon a lightly floured work surface to a thickness of 3-4mm. Use it to line a 23cmcake tinor round pie dish (it should be about 7cm deep), leaving some pastry overhanging. Spoon in the filling, levelling the top.","Roll out the remaining pastry until it’s large enough to cover the top of the pie. Brush a little of the egg yolk around the edge of the pie, then lift the pastry lid over the top and press the edge to seal. Trim any excess pastry with a sharp knife. Make a steam hole in the middle of the lid, then glaze with the rest of the egg yolk. Sprinkle over the dried herbs, then chill for 30 mins. Will keep in the fridge for up to 24 hours.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bake the pie for 50 mins until the pastry is golden, crisp and dry. Leave to rest for 15 mins before cutting and serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6231,6231,'en','Ratatouille tart with flaky cheddar & thyme pastry','Bake cheesy puff pastry topped with a smoky aubergine and tomato compote and roasted courgettes for this stunning tart. It’s ideal for lunch with friends','["5 medium tomatoes (a mixture of different colours looks nice)","1 aubergine","2tbsp olive oil","2 red onions, sliced","4 garlic cloves, crushed","1tbsp caster sugar","2 courgettes (we used 1 green and 1 yellow)","20g grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative","150g butter","300g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","4tbsp polenta","50g extra mature cheddar, coarsely grated","small bunch of thyme, leaves picked","1 egg yolk, beaten (freeze the white for another recipe)"]','["The night before making the tart, wrap the butter for the pastry in foil, and freeze until solid – this will make it easier to grate. To make the pastry, put the flour in a large bowl and mix in half the polenta, the cheese, thyme (reserving a few leaves to serve) and a good pinch of salt. Using a coarse cheesegrater, grate in the frozen butter – try to handle it as little as possible so it doesn’t get soft – and stir it in with aknifeas you go. Give the mixture one last stir to make sure all the butter is coated with flour, then quickly stir in 125ml very cold water. Gently bring together with your hands (splashing in a little more water if it looks dry), then wrap in baking parchmentand chill for 30 mins.","Slice the tomatoes to roughly the thickness of a £1 coin (use a mandoline, if you have one). Reserve about half of the tomato slices for the top of the tart, then roughly chop the rest into chunks.","Heat the grill to high (or you can use the flame of a gas hob). Pierce the aubergine four or five times with the tip of a knife and grill (or hold over the gas flame using tongs), turning often, for 8-10 mins, or until the skin is charred and the aubergine is soft and collapsing. Leave to cool a little.","Heat half the oil in a pan over a low-medium heat, and cook the onions with a pinch of salt for 10 mins until the onions start to caramelise. Meanwhile, scrape the skin off the aubergine (don’t worry if some pieces cling to the flesh – it will add a smoky flavour). Roughly chop the aubergine flesh.","Add the garlic and aubergine to the onions and cook for another 5 mins, or until any liquid released from the aubergine has evaporated. Add the chopped tomatoes and sugar, season, and continue to cook for 5-10 mins until thickened. Leave to cool, then chill until ready to use. Can be prepared up to a day ahead.","Slice the courgettes to roughly the thickness of a £1 coin. Put in a bowl and toss with a good pinch of salt. Leave for 10 mins.","Remove the pastry from the fridge. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 with a baking tray inside (or a 30cm shallow skillet pan, if you have one).Roll the pastry outon a large sheet of baking parchment dusted with a little flour, to a circle about 35cm wide. Trim the edge if you want a neat finish.","Drain any liquid from the courgettes, then tip onto a plate lined with kitchen paper. Pat dry to remove as much moisture as you can. Sprinkle the remaining polenta over the pastry, then top with the chilled tomato and aubergine mix. Spread it out using the back of a spoon, leaving a 3cm border around the edge.","Arrange the reserved tomato slices and the courgettes in overlapping concentric circles on top of the tart. Brush the vegetables with the remaining oil, season and sprinkle with the parmesan. Fold the pastry edge over the veg slightly, pressing gently to seal. Brush the pastry edge with the beaten yolk.","Carefully slide the tart, still on the baking parchment, onto the hot tray or into the skillet pan. Bake for 45 mins until golden, then scatter with the extra thyme leaves, if using. Leave to cool a little and serve just warm, or at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:17:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6233,6233,'en','Tomato, corn, ricotta & parmesan cobbler','Make this tomato and cheese cobbler to serve alongside roast chicken or enjoy on its own. It’s a revelation if you’ve never made a savoury cobbler before','["145g ricotta","235g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","235g fine cornmeal or polenta","1½ tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp caster sugar","115g cold butter, cut into small cubes","220ml buttermilk (or 120g yogurt mixed with 100ml milk if you can’t find buttermilk)","1kg cherry tomatoes, halved","2 corn cobs, kernels cut away from the cobs","1tbsp balsamic vinegar","2½ tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 large onions, roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves, grated","4 thyme sprigs, leaves picked","25g grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative"]','["Put the ricotta in a sieve lined with a piece of muslin, set over a bowl. Put in the fridge and leave to drain for a couple of hours – you want it to drain enough so it’s no longer ‘wet’.","Put the flour, cornmeal, ½ tsp salt, baking powder, bicarb and sugar in abowl. Add the butter and rub it into the dry ingredients, as if you were making pastry. Make a well in the centre, pour in the buttermilk and, using a knife, gradually mix together. You should end up with a soft dough. Crumble over the ricotta and mix into the dough.","Turn the dough out onto a lightly floured surface and, using your hands, shape it into a rectangle, about 20 x 15cm. Fold the top third into the middle, then do the same with the bottom third. Press the mixture into a 20 x 15 rectangle again, and repeat the process two more times. You should end up with a dough that’s about 2.5cm thick. Wrap and chill for 20 mins.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the tomatoes in a baking dish (about 20 x 30cm) with the corn kernels. Add the vinegar, some seasoning and 1½ tbsp oil, and toss to coat. Set aside.","Heat the remaining oil in a frying pan over a medium heat, and cook the onions until golden and soft, about 12 mins. Add the garlic and cook for a few minutes more, then add the thyme and some seasoning. Spoon the onion mixture over the tomatoes and corn.","Lay the dough on a lightly floured surface and cut into rough circles or squares using aknife. Arrange the dough shapes over the veg, leaving some space between them. Sprinkle with the parmesan and bake for 45 mins until golden and bubbling (you should be able to see the tomatoes bubbling up from underneath the cobbler topping). Leave to cool a little – the tomatoes will be very hot when they come out of the oven – then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6234,6234,'en','Stir-fried greens with oyster sauce','A great side dish for a DIY Chinese take-away, or an filling quick meal.','["100g vermicelli rice noodles","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tsp fish sauce","3 tbsp oyster sauce","2 tbsp sunflower oil","4 chopped spring onions","3 chopped garlic cloves","1 deseeded and chopped red chilli","100g thinly sliced shiitake or chestnut mushrooms","200g broccoli florets","2 roughly chopped heads of pak choi"]','["Soak the rice vermicelli in boiling water for 4 minutes. Drain, refresh under cold water, drain again and set aside.","Mix soy, fish sauce and oyster sauce in a bowl. Heat the sunflower oil in a large wok, add spring onions, chopped garlic cloves and the deseeded and chopped chilli.","Stir fry for 20 seconds before adding the thinly sliced shiitake or chestnut mushrooms and broccoli florets. Stir fry for 1 minute, then add the pak choi and the sauce mixture. Stir and cook for about 2 minutes over a high heat, adding a splash of water if the sauce becomes too thick.","Tip in the noodles, remove from the heat and toss to mix well. Serve in warmed bowls and tuck in with your chopsticks."]','2026-01-10 12:17:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6235,6235,'en','Soy-basted mushroom burgers','Make a change from meat with these marvellous mushroom burgers. The sweetness of the onion and courgette goes beautifully with the savoury oyster sauce','["1 red onion, finely sliced","½ tsp Lee Kum Kee Sesame Wok Oil","½ tbsp Lee Kum Kee Premium Dark Soy Sauce","½ tbsp butter","2 tbsp Lee Kum Kee Premium Oyster Sauce (see tip)","4 field mushrooms, peeled, if you like, and stalks removed","1 courgette, sliced lengthways into 4 slices","4 burger buns","2 tbsp mayonnaise","1 tsp Lee Kum Kee Chiu Chow Chilli Oil (use the chilli flakes from the bottom of the jar for a better flavour)","4 lettuce leaves"]','["Stir-fry the red onions in the Sesame Wok Oil until tender and cooked through, about 8 mins. Set aside and keep warm.","Meanwhile, put the Premium Dark Soy Sauce and butter in apanand melt together, then add the Premium Oyster Sauce and stir. Brush the mixture over the mushrooms, then leave for a minute so the mushrooms can absorb the sauce. Heat the grill to high.","Grill the mushrooms until tender, about 10 mins. When ready, you should be able to slip a knife through the thickest parts quite easily.","Grill the courgette slices until they start to blister, and are brown and tender. Warm the burger buns briefly under the grill, and mix the mayonnaise with the Chiu Chow Chilli Oil.","Brush the base of each burger bun with some chill mayo, then add a courgette slice, lettuce leaf and mushroom. Top with some stir-fried onions and the bun tops."]','2026-01-10 12:17:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6237,6237,'en','Halloumi fajitas','Try these halloumi tortilla wraps with avocado for a quick and easy after-school meal. Serve with chilli sauce or soured cream','["2 x 225g blocks light halloumi","2 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, halved and sliced","2 mixed peppers, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp ground coriander","1 lime, juiced","8 small or 4 large tortilla wraps (use corn or flour)","1 avocado, stoned, peeled and sliced","small handful of coriander leaves","chilli sauce or soured cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Split each halloumi block through the middle lengthways (they should have a natural seam). Cut each half into four strips. Heat half the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat, and fry the halloumi strips for a few minutes on each side until golden. Transfer to a plate and set aside.","Heat the remaining oil in the pan over a high heat, and fry the onion and peppers for 5 mins until just soft and starting to char. Add the garlic, paprika and coriander with some seasoning and cook for 1 min more. Pour in the lime juice and fried halloumi, and stir very gently so the halloumi doesn’t break up. Will keep at room temperature for a few hours. Reheat over a low heat with a little water.","Warm the wraps in a low oven wrapped in foil. Alternatively, warm two at a time for 10 seconds in the microwave (not wrapped in foil), or by holding them directly over a gas flame with a pair of tongs (this will give you flavourful charred edges).","Pile the halloumi filling into the warm wraps, with a few slices of avocado each, some coriander leaves, and spoonfuls of chilli sauce or soured cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6239,6239,'en','Herby orzo & lemon salad','Make this summery orzo salad packed with herbs and lemon for a seasonal side. Leftovers make a great lunch the next day','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp butter","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely grated","½ tbsp light brown soft sugar","350g orzo","50ml extra virgin olive oil","1 large lemon, juiced","1 small bunch of basil, finely chopped","1 small bunch parsley, finely chopped","2 tbsp capers, drained and rinsed","50g flaked almonds, lightly toasted"]','["Heat the olive oil and butter in a non-stick frying pan over a medium heat, and fry the onion for 10-15 mins, or until golden and caramelised. Add the garlic and sugar and cook for a further 3 mins. Season to taste.","Cook the orzo following pack instructions. Drain, then toss with a little of the extra virgin olive oil and leave to cool completely. Whisk the remaining oil with the lemon juice and set aside.","Toss the orzo with the sticky onion and garlic, the lemony dressing, herbs and capers, along with half the toasted almonds. Season. Spoon onto a sharing plate and top with the rest of the almonds. Will keep in the fridge for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:17:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6240,6240,'en','Oriental egg fried rice','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlySara Buenfeld’s fast and easy fried rice makes for a delicious Chinese supper','["a mugful of American long grain rice","a cupful of frozen peas","2 tbsp sunflower oil","2 back bacon rashers, roughly chopped","1 small red pepper, chopped","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","2 large eggs","1 heaped tsp Chinese five-spice powder"]','["Fill a roomy saucepan with water, bring to the boil and tip in a heaped teaspoon of salt - the water will bubble furiously. Pour in the rice, stir once and return to the boil, then turn the heat down a little so that the water is boiling steadily, but not vigorously.","Boil uncovered, without stirring (this makes for sticky rice) for 10 minutes.  After 8\r\nminutes, throw in the frozen\r\npeas, boil\r\nfor 2 minutes and drain (don’t rinse).","Heat the sunflower oil in a wok and stir\r\nfry the bacon  for 3-4 minutes until crisp. Tip in \r\nthe red pepper and the garlic cloves and stir fry for 2\r\nminutes.","Beat the eggs, pour into\r\nthe pan and stir fry until the egg just\r\nsets. Toss in the Chinese 5-spice"]','2026-01-10 12:17:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6241,6241,'en','Crispy grilled feta with saucy butter beans','Stuck in a food rut? Grab a can of butter beans, some feta and passata to make this super-speedy and super-tasty supper. Full of goodness, it’s healthy too','["500ml passata","2 x 400g cans butter beans, drained and rinsed","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp dried oregano, plus a pinch","200g spinach","2 roasted red peppers, sliced","1⁄2 lemon, zested and juiced","100g block of feta, cut into chunks","1⁄2 tsp olive oil","4 small pittas"]','["Put a large ovenproof frying pan over a medium-high heat, and tip in the passata, butter beans, garlic, oregano, spinach and peppers. Stir together and cook for 6-8 mins until the sauce is bubbling and the spinach has wilted. Season, then add the lemon juice.","Heat the grill to high. Scatter the feta over the sauce, so it’s still exposed, drizzle with the olive oil and sprinkle over the lemon zest plus a pinch of oregano, then grind over some black pepper. Grill for 5-8 mins until the feta is golden and crisp at the edges.","Meanwhile, toast the pittas under the grill or in the toaster, then serve with the beans and feta."]','2026-01-10 12:17:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6243,6243,'en','Roast fennel & bread gratin','Serve this roast fennel and sourdough gratin as a side dish alongside roast chicken, or with some salad leaves tossed in a mustardy dressing','["2 small fennel bulbs, bases trimmed, bulbs cut lengthways into 1cm-thick wedges","2 tbsp olive oil","2 large thyme sprigs, leaves picked","2 thick slices sourdough","100ml milk","50ml white wine","20g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated, plus extra to serve","150g crème fraîche or double cream","grating of nutmeg","handful of mixed soft herbs, roughly chopped (parsley and tarragon work well)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the fennel with the olive oil to coat it on a baking tray or in a gratin dish, adding a pinch of sea salt and the thyme leaves. Roast for 20 mins, tossing halfway through, until softened and caramelised.","Meanwhile, tear the sourdough into chunks, tip into a bowl and pour over the milk and wine. Set aside. Combine the parmesan with the crème fraîche and season with salt, pepper and a little grated nutmeg.","Once the fennel is roasted, remove from the oven and leave to cool slightly. Add the soaked bread to the fennel, and mix together. Pour over the crème fraîche mixture and half the herbs, and stir to coat the bread and fennel. Grate over a little extra cheese, then bake for another 25-30 mins, or until golden, bubbling and crisp at the edges. Top with the remaining herbs."]','2026-01-10 12:17:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6245,6245,'en','Sweet potato, spinach & feta tortilla','Make this tortilla the night before for a quick and easy picnic lunch for the family. With sweet potato, spinach and feta, it’s packed with flavour','["3 sweet potatoes","2 tbsp olive oil","100g baby spinach","6 large eggs","100g feta, crumbled"]','["Pierce the potatoes a few times on each side. Microwave on high for 5-8 mins until soft, then set aside to cool a little.","Heat the oil in a 20cm ovenproof frying pan and wilt the spinach for a minute or two (you might have to do this in batches). Cut each potato in half lengthways and use a spoon to scoop out the flesh, keeping it in big chunks. Whisk the eggs.","Add the sweet potato to the pan and stir to combine with the spinach – don’t break it up too much. Pour in the egg and swirl around so it fills any gaps in the pan. Scatter over the feta and cook for 4-5 mins over a low heat until the bottom and sides are set.","Place under the grill for 1-2 mins to cook the top – poke a knife into the centre to ensure it’s cooked through. Cool before slicing into wedges. Will keep chilled for up to a day."]','2026-01-10 12:17:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6247,6247,'en','Hummus rainbow wraps','Make these colourful rainbow wraps, with hummus, beetroot, carrot, feta and baby spinach for a quick and easy veggie lunch for the whole family','["3-4 wraps (½ a wrap will be enough for a smaller child)","6 tbsp hummus","2 carrots, grated","4 cooked beetroot, grated","large handful of baby spinach","100g feta, crumbled (optional)"]','["Spread the wraps with the hummus, then fill with the carrot, beetroot, spinach and feta, for those who want it. Wrap and save for lunchtime or eat straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:17:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6249,6249,'en','Salad of melon & tomatoes with mint & elderflower dressing','Make the most of summer’s best produce by using melons and tomatoes in this vibrant salad, drizzled with a mint and elderflower dressing. The secret to this salad is using the freshest ingredients','["400g tomatoes in a mixture of colours and sizes, if possible","½ Charentais or cantaloupe melon","½ Galia melon","200g tub cubed watermelon","1½ tbsp white wine vinegar","2 tbsp groundnut oil","4 tbsp olive oil","1 small bunch of mint, leaves picked","¼ tsp Dijon mustard","½ tsp caster sugar","1 tbsp elderflower cordial","4 tbsp double cream"]','["To make the dressing, put the vinegar, oils, half the mint, the mustard, sugar and cordial in a blender, then season and blitz to combine. Add the cream and check the seasoning – this is a sweet-sour dressing, so you need to get the balance right. You might want to make it a bit milder by adding a little more cream.","Halve the smaller tomatoes and cut any larger ones into wedges. Put in a shallow serving bowl.","Remove the seeds from the Charentais or cantaloupe and Galia melons, cut into wedges, peel and cut the flesh into chunks. Add to the bowl with the tomatoes, along with the watermelon. Drizzle over some of the dressing (you may not need all of it), scatter over the remaining mint leaves and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6251,6251,'en','Vegan banana cupcakes','Rustle up these easy banana cupcakes for an afternoon treat. Dairy- and egg-free, they’re perfect for anyone following a vegan diet','["2 large bananas (about 225g), blackened and peeled","50ml vegetable or sunflower oil","65g light brown sugar","150g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","2 tsp cinnamon","50g dried fruit and seed mix","2 tbsp oats","2 tbsp mixed seeds"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Mash the bananas in a medium bowl with a fork, then mix in the oil and sugar until combined.","Add the flour, baking powder, cinnamon and dried fruit and seed mix. Mix until well combined.","Line a cupcake tray with 10-12 cupcake cases (the amount you need will depend on how big the bananas are) and fill them ¾ full of the mixture. Sprinkle with the oats and mixed seeds.","Bake for 25 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the middle of a muffin comes out clean. Leave to cool on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:17:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6253,6253,'en','Vegan burger','Make this fantastic base recipe for a vegan burger and add whatever you fancy – chilli flakes, grated lemon zest or other herbs all work really well','["1 shallot or ½ onion, chopped","1 stick of celery, or ¼ red pepper, chopped","handful of parsley leaves","400g can chickpeas, drained and left to dry a little","1-2 tsp garam masala","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp polenta, couscous, or dried breadcrumbs","oil, for frying","burger buns or pitta bread, lettuce, tomato, and sauces to serve"]','["Whizz the shallot, celery, parsley and most of the chickpeas to a coarse paste. Don’t overdo this, you want a texture slightly rougher than hummus. Mash the remaining chickpeas and stir them into the paste with the garam masala, tomato purée, flour and polenta. Season well.","Shape the mixture into four patties. Let them rest for at least 30 mins – you can leave them overnight in the fridge if you like. The polenta needs time to absorb any extra liquid.","Heat a little oil in a non-stick frying pan and cook the patties until they’re brown and crisp on each side. Try not to handle them too much as they’ll be quite soft when warm. Slide into buns or pitta with the accompaniments that you’d like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6255,6255,'en','Halloumi skewers','Make our veggie cheese skewers on a barbecue or griddle pan and add your favourite marinade. We have ideas for three flavour-packed glazes','["500g halloumi","your chosen glaze (optional)"]','["Slice the halloumi into large chunks and thread onto three skewers. Light the barbecue. Brush the skewers with your chosen glaze and, when the flames have died down, cook for 1-2 mins on each side (or, cook in a griddle pan set over a high heat). Brush with the remaining glaze and cook for another 1 min on each side."]','2026-01-10 12:17:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6257,6257,'en','Vegan potato salad','Make a vegan version of a classic potato salad using vegan mayonnaise. It’s the perfect accompaniment to a barbecue, picnic or salads in the summer','["600g baby new potatoes, halve any larger ones","2 tsp white wine vinegar","2 tsp extra virgin olive oil","120g vegan mayonnaise","1½ tsp Dijon mustard","1 shallot, or ½ a red onion, finely chopped","2 tsp capers, chopped if large","small handful of parsley, chopped","small handful of chives, chopped"]','["Put the potatoes in a pan, season with salt and cover with cold water. Bring up to a boil and simmer for 15-20 mins, until they’re tender. Drain and leave to steam-dry in a colander for 5 mins. If the skins are papery and peeling away, you can rub them off, if you like.","Tip the potatoes into a bowl and add the vinegar, olive oil and some seasoning, toss well, then leave to cool.","Stir in the mayo, mustard, shallot, capers and herbs (saving a little to garnish). Check the seasoning and add a little more salt or vinegar, if you like. Scatter over the remaining herbs and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6259,6259,'en','Sweet potato mash','Swap regular mash for a sweet potato version, full of vitamin C and fibre. It’s great as a topping for shepherd’s pie or fish pie, or as a veggie side dish','["500g sweet potatoes, peeled and cubed","2 tbsp butter"]','["Boil the potatoes in salted water for 10 mins or until tender, how long they take will depend on the size of the cubes. Drain very well and leave to steam dry for a couple of minutes.","Tip the potatoes back into the pan and mash with 1 tbsp butter using a fork or masher, then season well. Serve with the extra butter and more seasoning on top."]','2026-01-10 12:17:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6261,6261,'en','Charred aubergines with white beans & salsa verde','Serve these charred aubergines with white beans and salsa verde topping as a veggie option at a barbecue. The aubergines char and blister beautifully','["2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for rubbing and drizzling","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","½ tsp chilli flakes","2 x 400g cans cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","2 thyme sprigs","200ml vegetable stock","3 tbsp crème fraîche or vegan alternative, if needed","lemon, zested, plus wedges to serve","4 medium aubergines","50g flaked almonds, toasted","small bunch of parsley, roughly chopped","40g skinless hazelnuts","½ small bunch of garlic clove","1 tbsp capers, drained","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","7 tbsp olive oil"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan set over a low heat and fry the onion with a pinch of salt for 10 mins. Add the garlic and chilli flakes, and fry for 2 mins more. Tip in the beans, thyme and stock, bring to a simmer and cook for 15 mins, or until the beans have broken down a little. Stir in the crème fraîche and lemon zest. Season to taste.","To make the salsa verde, put the parsley, hazelnuts, garlic, capers, vinegar and oil in a pestle and mortar and crush everything together – this will take about 5 mins. Alternatively, blitz in a food processor until combined but not smooth. Transfer to a bowl and season to taste.","Light the barbecue and wait for the flames to die down. Cut the aubergines in half lengthways and score the cut side in a diamond pattern using the tip of a knife. Rub with some oil, then put directly on the grill and cook for 7-10 mins on each side, or until charred and soft. Alternatively, cook under a grill (see tip, below). Top the cooked aubergines with the bean ragu and salsa verde, then scatter over the toasted almonds and serve with the lemon wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:17:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6262,6262,'en','Vanilla crème brûlée','Who better to teach us how to create this classic French dessert than Michel Roux Jr?','["250ml double cream","75ml full-fat milk","1 vanilla pod , scraped","4 egg yolks","3 tbsp caster sugar , plus 3-4 tbsp for the topping","1 tsp vanilla extract","sheet of puff pastry","½ egg, beaten","finely chopped almonds","icing sugar"]','["Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Put the cream, milk and vanilla pod into a pan and heat to boiling point. Cover and leave to infuse for 10 mins. Whisk the egg yolks and 3 tbsp of sugar together until pale and thick. Add the vanilla extract and pour the boiling cream onto the mixture. Stir well, then pour into two ramekins. Place the ramekins in a bain marie and cook in the oven for about 40 mins or until just set. Leave to cool.","Heat the grill. Sprinkle the cold brûlée with a thin, even layer of sugar, and caramelise under the very hot grill (or use a blowtorch). Repeat several times until you have a golden crackling topping. Leave to cool and serve within 2 hrs with warm almond puff pastry sticks (see below)."]','2026-01-10 12:17:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6263,6263,'en','Vegan three-bean chilli with potato jackets','This healthy baked potato filling provides four of your 5-a-day in each serving, plus iron, vitamin C and fibre, and plenty of flavour from storecupboard spices','["2 baking potatoes (about 180g each)","1 tbsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","1 yellow or orange pepper, deseeded and chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","1 tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp chilli flakes","1 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp dried oregano","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","400g can three bean salad (cannellini, flageolet and adzuki), drained","handful of coriander, chopped, plus extra leaves to serve","1 small avocado, stoned, halved and chopped or mashed","1 lime, cut into wedges"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and bake the potatoes for 50 mins-1 hr, or until tender.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan and fry the pepper and garlic for a few minutes. Stir in the cumin seeds, chilli flakes and spices, then tip in the tomatoes, bouillon powder and beans. Bring to a simmer, cover and cook for 15 mins, or until reduced to a thick sauce. Stir in the chopped coriander.","Cut a cross into the tops of the baked potatoes and gently press on the sides to open them out. Spoon over the chilli, then top with the avocado and squeeze over some of the lime wedges. Scatter over some coriander leaves and serve with the remaining lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:17:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6265,6265,'en','Vegan jambalaya','Enjoy a delicious plant-based dinner with this vegan rice and bean one-pot. It’s packed with all five of your 5-a-day, as well as iron, vitamin C and fibre','["2 tbsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","1 large onion (180g), finely chopped","4 celery sticks, finely chopped","1 yellow pepper, chopped","2 tsp smoked paprika","½ tsp chilli flakes","½ tsp dried oregano","115g brown basmati rice","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","400g butter beans, drained and rinsed","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","large handful of parsley, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan set over a high heat and fry the onion, celery and pepper, stirring occasionally, for 5 mins until starting to soften and colour.","Stir in the spices and rice, then tip in the tomatoes and a can of water. Stir in the garlic, beans and bouillon. Bring to a simmer, then cover and cook for 25 mins until the rice is tender and has absorbed most of the liquid. Keep an eye on the pan towards the end of the cooking time to make sure it doesn’t boil dry – if it starts to catch, add a little more water. Stir in the parsley and serve hot."]','2026-01-10 12:17:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6267,6267,'en','Paneer jalfrezi with cumin rice','Spice up your week with this satisfying, healthy, low-calorie veggie curry. It provides calcium, iron, vitamin C and fibre, along with three of your 5-a-day','["2 tsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","1 large and 1 medium onion, large one finely chopped and medium one cut into wedges","2 large garlic cloves, chopped","50g ginger, peeled and shredded","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp cumin seeds","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp vegetable bouillon powder","135g paneer, chopped","2 large peppers, seeded and chopped","1 red or green chilli, deseeded and sliced","25g coriander, chopped","260g brown basmati rice","1 tsp cumin seeds"]','["Heat 1 tsp oil a large non-stick frying pan and fry the chopped onions, garlic and half the ginger for 5 mins until softened. Add the ground coriander and cumin seeds and cook for 1 min more, then tip in the tomatoes, half a can of water and the bouillon. Blitz everything together with a stick blender until very smooth, then bring to a simmer. Cover and cook for 15 mins.","Meanwhile, cook the rice and cumin seeds in a pan of boiling water for 25 mins, or until tender.","Heat the remaining oil in a non-stick wok and fry the paneer until lightly coloured. Remove from the pan and set aside. Add the peppers, onion wedges and chilli to the pan and stir-fry until the veg is tender, but still retains some bite. Mix the stir-fried veg and paneer into the sauce with the chopped coriander, then serve with the rice. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, eat two portions of the curry and rice, then chill the rest for another day. Will keep for up to three days, covered, in the fridge. To serve on the second night, reheat the leftover portions in the microwave until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:17:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6269,6269,'en','Porcini loaf with summer greens','Make this mushroom, jackfruit and chestnut loaf for a vegetarian Sunday lunch. It’s super-healthy, and provides five of your 5-a-day in each serving','["450g salad potatoes, halved","2 tsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil, plus extra for the tin","1 lemon, zested and juiced (you''ll need 2 tbsp lemon juice)","1 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 leeks, cut into rings","350g asparagus (250g pack and 100g pack), ends trimmed, cut crosswise into quarters","320g frozen peas","260g bag young leaf spinach","2 tbsp bio Greek yogurt","1 tbsp chopped tarragon leaves","410g can jackfruit, drained","1 tbsp chopped tarragon leaves","1 garlic clove, finely grated","½ tsp smoked paprika","3 eggs","40g dried porcini mushrooms","200g pack chestnut purée","40g roasted unsalted cashews"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Oil and line a 500g loaf tin with two strips of baking parchment so it''s fully lined, with an overhang at the top that could be folded over. Toss the potatoes with the oil and put in a small roasting tin.","To make the loaf, weigh out 125g jackfruit, choosing the pieces that have the most ''open'' texture, then thinly slice. Tip into a bowl and stir in the tarragon, garlic and paprika.","Tip the rest of the jackfruit into a bowl with the eggs and dried mushrooms and blitz with a stick blender until very smooth. Add the chestnut purée, then blitz again until well mixed. Stir 150g of the mushroom mix with the sliced jackfruit. Spoon half of the remaining dried mushroom mix into the tin, then add the mushroom and sliced jackfruit mix, and cover with the rest of the dried mushroom mix. Press down and scatter over the cashews. Fold over the baking parchment and bake alongside the potatoes for 45 mins, or until firm.","Toss the lemon zest with the potatoes. Cover the loaf and leave it to rest while you cook the veg.","Tip 150ml water into a pan with the bouillon and leeks. Cover and cook over a medium heat for 2 mins. Add the asparagus and peas, then cover and cook for 2 mins more. Finally, add the spinach and stir to wilt. Add the lemon juice and the yogurt to the veg mix and stir well. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, serve half the veg with four slices of the loaf, reserving the remaining four slices and the rest of the veg for another night. Will keep for up to three days, covered, in the fridge. To serve on the second night, reheat the leftovers in the microwave until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:17:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6271,6271,'en','Chickpea soup with chunky gremolata','If you like hummus, you’ll love this low-calorie, gluten-free soup that provides an incredible four of your 5-a-day in each serving','["2 tbsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","3 onions, chopped (about 340g)","3 x 400g cans chickpeas, don''t drain off the liquid","3 large cloves garlic, finely grated","1 red chilli, seeded and chopped","2 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp cumin seeds","4 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","1 aubergine, finely cubed (350g)","2 tbsp tahini","210g can chickpeas, drained","100g cherry tomatoes, cut into quarters","1 lemon, zested and half juiced","15g parsley, finely chopped","3 tbsp chopped mint leaves","smoked paprika, for dusting"]','["Heat 1 tbsp oil in a large pan and fry the onions for 10 mins to soften. Tip the 3 cans of chickpeas into the pan and stir in 2 of the grated garlic cloves, the chilli, coriander and cumin along with the bouillon powder, aubergine and 1½ cans of water. Cover and simmer for 15-20 mins until the aubergine is tender, then remove from the heat, add the tahini and blitz with a hand blender until smooth.","Meanwhile, make the gremolata. Tip the small can of chickpeas into a bowl add the tomatoes, lemon zest and juice, parsley and mint with the remaining oil and garlic.","If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, spoon half the soup into two bowls or large flasks and top with or pack up half the gremolata and a sprinkling of paprika. Cool and chill the remaining soup for another day on the plan. Reheat the soup in a pan or microwave to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6273,6273,'en','Herbed broad bean & feta crostini with asparagus','Make the most of seasonal broad beans during the summer months and make this vibrant bean and feta crostini. Ideal as a starter, simply top with asparagus','["160g broad beans","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","50g crumbled feta","1 tsp honey","squeeze of lemon juice","large handful of dill fronds","4 baguette slices","1 garlic clove, halved","4 blanched asparagus spears"]','["Bring a large pot of salted water to the boil and cook the broad beans for 5-6 mins until tender. Immediately plunge into a bowl of ice-cold water. Squeeze the broad beans from their pods and transfer to the bowl of a food processor with the olive oil, feta, honey, lemon juice and dill fronds. Season with black pepper and blitz to a smooth purée.","Meanwhile, brush the baguette slices with some olive oil and toast or griddle until golden. Rub with the cut side of a halved garlic clove. Finely chop the blanched asparagus spears and toss in a little olive oil with a squeeze of lemon juice. Spread the purée over the crostini and top with the sliced asparagus and some extra dill. Leftover purée will keep in the fridge for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:17:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6275,6275,'en','Avocado & cannellini bean dip','Beat hunger pangs with this vegan avocado and cannellini bean dip. Serve with crudités and crackers as a snack, light lunch or as part of a picnic','["1 small avocado","400g can cannellini beans, drained","1 garlic clove, finely grated","½ tsp chilli flakes, plus extra to serve","½ tsp ground cumin","1 lemon, zested and juiced","3 tbsp avocado oil, plus extra for drizzling","mixed seeds, crackers or crudités, to serve (optional)"]','["Scoop the avocado flesh into a blender or small food processor. Add the beans, garlic, spices, lemon zest and juice and oil. Blitz until completely smooth, loosening with 50-100ml water, if needed. Season.","Spoon into a bowl and top with extra chilli flakes and avocado oil. Serve with the seeds scattered over, and crackers or crudités, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6277,6277,'en','Curried spinach, eggs & chickpeas','Pack in the nutrients with this veggie supper made from spinach, eggs and chickpeas. It’s healthy, low in calories, full of flavour and delivers four of your five-a-day','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 onion, thinly sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","3cm piece ginger, peeled and grated","1 tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp garam masala","1 tbsp ground cumin","450g tomatoes, chopped","400g can chickpeas, drained","1 tsp sugar","200g spinach","2 large eggs","3 tbsp natural yogurt","1 red chilli, finely sliced","½ small bunch of coriander, torn"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan or flameproof casserole pot over a medium heat, and fry the onion for 10 mins until golden and sticky. Add the garlic, ginger, turmeric, ground coriander, garam masala, cumin and tomatoes, and fry for 2 mins more. Add the chickpeas, 100ml water and the sugar and bring to a simmer. Stir in the spinach, then cover and cook for 20-25 mins. Season to taste.","Cook the eggs in a pan of boiling water for 7 mins, then rinse under cold running water to cool. Drain, peel and halve. Swirl the yogurt into the curry, then top with the eggs, chilli and coriander. Season."]','2026-01-10 12:17:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6279,6279,'en','Curried rice & egg salad','Enjoy this lightly spiced rice and egg salad as a side dish at a summer barbecue or picnic. Top with toasted almonds, grated carrots and sliced cucumbers','["1 tbsp olive or rapeseed oil","1 onion, chopped","2 tbsp mild curry paste (we used korma paste)","1 tsp ground turmeric","300g basmati rice","50g raisins","1 chicken or vegetable stock cube","3 eggs","small bunch of coriander, leaves picked","30g flaked almonds, toasted","2 carrots, grated or finely shredded","½ cucumber, sliced"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and cook the onion for 8-10 mins until soft and just turning golden. Boil the kettle. Stir the curry paste, ground turmeric, rice and raisins into the onions. Crumble over the stock cube and pour over enough boiled water from the kettle to cover the rice by ½cm (about 1 litre). Season with some salt. Bring to a gentle simmer, then cover the pan, reduce the heat to its lowest setting and cook for 2 mins more. Without taking off the lid, remove from the heat and leave to steam for 15 mins. This will give you perfect, fluffy rice.","Meanwhile, bring another pan of water to the boil and cook the eggs for 7 mins. Plunge into a bowl of cold water to stop them cooking and once cool, drain and halve.","Tip the rice into a container and chill for at least 1 hr, or up to two days. When you’re ready to serve, scatter over the coriander and almonds, and top with the grated carrot, cucumber slices and eggs."]','2026-01-10 12:17:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6280,6280,'en','Raymond Blanc’s cassoulet','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyRaymond Blanc’s rustic cassoulet is rich and warming – slow cooking at its best','["140g pork rind","140g smoked streaky bacon","300g garlic sausage","600g dried haricot bean, soaked overnight in 3 times their volume of water","1 celery stick","1 small onion, preferably a white skinned mild one","1 large carrot","6 garlic clove","2 ripe plum tomato","25g goose fat or 2 tbsp olive oil","1 bouquet garni","8 pinches of sea salt","2 pinches of freshly ground black pepper","1 clove, lightly crushed","2 tsp lemon juice","4 confit duck legs","60g goose fat or 2 tbsp olive oil","40g dried breadcrumb","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","a handful of fresh flatleaf parsley, coarsely chopped"]','["To cut the meats, roll up the pork rind like a Swiss roll. With the seam underneath, use a very sharp knife to cut the roll across into thin slices, then chop the rolled-up slices across into dice. Chop the bacon into small cubes (lardons). Cut the garlic sausage into 1cm thick slices.","Drain the soaked beans and discard the soaking water. Tip the beans into a large saucepan, add the diced pork rind and lardons and cover with fresh cold water. Bring to the boil and blanch for 15-20 minutes. Drain the beans, rind and lardons into a colander, and discard the cooking water.","Roughly chop the celery, onion and carrot. Peel the garlic cloves but leave them whole. Cut each tomato into eight wedges. (You never see tomatoes in a traditional cassoulet, but chef Raymond Blanc likes them for their colour and sweetness, so he puts a couple in.) Preheat the oven to 120C/fan 100C. (If cooking in a gas oven, use mark 2.)","Heat the goose fat or olive oil in a 26cm flameproof casserole or deep overproof sauté pan over a low heat and sweat the celery, onion, carrot and garlic for 5 minutes. Add the tomatoes and bouquet garni and cook slowly to get a sugary caramelisation (about 5 minutes). Add the sausage, beans, pork rind and lardons and pour in 1.2 litres/2 pints water. Bring to the boil, skim off the scum, then add the salt, pepper, clove and lemon juice.","Transfer the casserole to the oven and cook, uncovered, for 2 hours, stirring every hour. At the end of this time, the beans will be soft and creamy in texture and the juices should have thickened. You may need to cook it for longer than 2 hours (say up to 2½ hours) to get to this stage – it depends","Remove the cassoulet from the oven. Bury the duck legs in the beans and sprinkle over the goose fat or olive oil, breadcrumbs and garlic. Return to the oven and cook for a further 2 hours. Serve the cassoulet in bowls, sprinkled with chopped parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:17:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6281,6281,'en','Thai green tofu noodles','Whip up a bowl of Thai green noodles with tofu in just 30 minutes. It’s low in calories and contains a balance of nutrients to fill you up and do you good','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","280g pack firm tofu, cut into cubes","300g bag stir-fry veg","150g baby corn, halved lengthways","150g mangetout","2 tbsp Thai green curry paste","1-2 green chillies, thinly sliced","250ml light coconut milk","250g fresh egg noodles","4 spring onions, sliced","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan or wok. Add the tofu and fry, turning regularly, over a high heat for 6-7 mins or until golden. Remove with a slotted spoon and set aside.","Tip the stir-fry veg, corn and mangetout into the pan and cook for 5 mins. Stir through the curry paste, chilli, coconut milk and noodles, then bring to a simmer and cook for 5 mins. Return the tofu to the pan. Divide between bowls and top with the spring onion. Serve with the lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:17:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6283,6283,'en','Egg-less mayo sandwiches','Use tofu as a substitute for egg along with dairy-free mayo to make these vegan sandwiches. They’re ideal for a kids’ party where some children may have an intolerance or allergy','["400g block of medium-firm tofu in water","6 tbsp vegan mayo","½ tsp Dijon mustard","¼ tsp ground turmeric","1 tbsp nutritional yeast","2 tsp finely chopped chives","1 large white sandwich or wholemeal loaf (10-12 slices), or 12 mini rolls (use gluten-free bread if necessary)","1 punnet cress (optional)"]','["Remove the tofu from the pack and press out the excess water, either between sheets of kitchen paper or a clean tea towel, weighed down with a plate for about 30 mins.","Mix the mayo, mustard, turmeric and nutritional yeast together with a little salt and pepper.","Crumble the tofu into a bowl, leaving large chunks to create a chopped egg texture. Gently stir in the chives. If you want it looser you can add more mayo.","Spread the mixture on the bread to make four or five rounds of sandwiches (depending on how much filling you want), then add cress, if you like. Use a sharp knife to cut into triangles."]','2026-01-10 12:17:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6285,6285,'en','Vegan nuggets','Rustle up a batch of vegan nuggets, packed with cannellini beans, cauliflower and carrot. They make great kids’ party food that everyone can enjoy, or serve as an after-school snack','["300g cauliflower florets (or ¾ small cauliflower)","2 carrots, chopped (about 165g)","½ medium onion, chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tbsp nutritional yeast","2 tsp yeast extract","400g can cannellini beans, drained","50g gram (chickpea) flour","olive oil, for the baking tray","100g gram flour, plus a little extra","100g breadcrumbs (use gluten-free if necessary)"]','["Pulse the cauliflower, carrots and onion in a food processor until very finely chopped, like rice. Heat the oil in a large frying pan and gently fry the mix for 12-15 mins until softened. Add the garlic and fry for a further 1 min, then take off the heat and stir in the nutritional yeast and yeast extract. Set aside.","Blend the beans into a mushy purée in a food processor, then add to the veggie mix and combine well. Stir in the flour and season. Put in the fridge to firm up for 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Line a large baking tray with baking parchment and coat with a little olive oil. To make the coating, mix the gram flour with 150ml water using a fork so it resembles beaten egg, then season. Scatter the extra gram flour on a plate and fill a second with the breadcrumbs.","Roll the bean mixture into walnut-sized pieces, then flatten to form nugget shapes. Dip the pieces first in the gram flour, then in the gram batter, and finally roll in the breadcrumbs – handle carefully as they will be a little soft. When the nuggets are fully coated, lay them out on the prepared tray.","Bake for 20 mins, then use tongs to turn each nugget over and bake for a further 15 mins until they are dark golden and crisp. Leave to cool for 20 mins before serving with your choice of dipping sauces."]','2026-01-10 12:17:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6287,6287,'en','Asparagus with peas, mint & Jersey Royals in wild garlic butter','Coat asparagus, peas and Jersey Royals in a mint and wild garlic butter, then top with toasted almonds – the perfect partner to roast meat and savoury tarts','["300g Jersey Royal potatoes","handful slivered almonds","75g softened butter","small handful wild garlic leaves, very finely chopped (or 1 crushed garlic clove)","1 tbsp mint leaves","250g freshly podded peas","drizzle olive oil, for frying","½ lemon, zested and juiced"]','["Bring a large pan of water to the boil and cook the potatoes for 8-10 mins or until tender. Drain.","Toast the slivered almonds in a dry frying pan until golden. Set aside.","Mix together the butter, wild garlic leaves and mint (you can blitz in a food processor, if you like). Set aside.","Cover the peas with boiling water for 30 seconds, then drain and immediately plunge into cold water.","Heat the olive oil in a large lidded saucepan over a medium heat. Add the asparagus spears and a good pinch of sea salt and shake to coat in the oil. Put the lid on and cook the asparagus over a low to medium heat, shaking the pan to move the spears around, about 4 mins. Remove the spears from the pan and immediately plunge into iced water.","Melt the garlic butter in the pan and squeeze in the juice of the lemon. Stir the potatoes, asparagus and peas into the butter untiul warm. Tip everything onto a serving dish and grate over some lemon zest. Top with the toasted almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:17:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6289,6289,'en','Roast aubergines with almond tarator, feta, dill & green chilli','Roast a couple of aubergines and top with tarator – a nutty and garlicky sauce that pairs perfectly with aubergine. Enjoy as a starter or side dish','["4 aubergines","100ml extra virgin olive oil, plus extra for brushing and drizzling","125g feta, crumbled","175g Greek yogurt","1-2 green chillies (depending on how hot you like it), halved, deseeded and very finely sliced","small bunch of dill, roughly chopped","30g coarse white country bread, roughly torn","4 tbsp milk","50g blanched almonds","1 garlic clove, chopped","½ lemon, juiced"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Brush the aubergines with a little of the oil and put them on a baking sheet. Pierce each one a few times with a fork, then roast in the oven for 45 mins – 1 hr (it depends on the size of the aubergines), until completely tender.","Meanwhile, make the tarator. Put the bread in a bowl and leave to soak in the milk for about 30 mins. Tip into a food processor with the nuts, garlic and lemon juice, and blend, gradually adding 85ml of the extra virgin olive oil. Season and add a little water if you want the mixture to be thinner (it shouldn’t be thick but it shouldn’t be as thin as single cream, either).","Mash the feta very roughly with the yogurt in a bowl. Split the aubergines open along their length and season the insides. Put them on individual plates or a larger serving plate, and drizzle a little bit of the remaining oil inside each one. Spoon over the feta and yogurt mixture, then top with the tarator (the tarator can splash down over the sides of the aubergines), the sliced chillies and the dill.","Drizzle over a little extra virgin olive oil over each aubergine and serve with flatbreads if it’s a starter, or as they are if it’s a side dish."]','2026-01-10 12:17:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6291,6291,'en','Cheesy green veg gratin','Jazz up cauliflower cheese with green broccoli and spinach, and a cheddar and chive sauce. Be sure to use the cauliflower leaves, too, for extra flavour','["1 cauliflower (450g), broken into florets, leaves reserved","200g purple sprouting broccoli","200g spinach","70g unsalted butter","70g plain flour","900ml whole milk","2 tsp English mustard","150g mature cheddar","½ bunch of chives, finely chopped"]','["Bring a pan of lightly salted water to the boil and cook the cauliflower florets for 3 mins. Add the broccoli and cook for 2 mins more. Drain in a colander and leave to steam-dry.","Tip the spinach into a large saucepan, add 2 tbsp water and cook with the lid on over a low heat for 3-4 mins until wilted, then tip into a sieve and press the excess moisture out of it with the back of a wooden spoon. Set aside.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Melt the butter in a saucepan over a low heat until foaming, then stir in the flour to create a thick paste. Cook for 2 mins, remove the pan from the heat and whisk in the milk in several additions until lump-free. Return to the heat and whisk until thickened. Whisk in the mustard, most of the cheese and the chives. Season to taste.","Arrange the vegetables, including the cauliflower leaves, in a medium ovenproof dish. Pour over the sauce, then sprinkle with the remaining cheese. Bake for 25-30 mins or until golden and bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:17:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6293,6293,'en','Vegan moussaka','Make this mouth-watering and healthy moussaka with a simple plant-based ragu. It''s an easy dinner for the family that packs in all five of your 5-a-day','["30g bag dried porcini mushrooms","8 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 carrots, finely chopped","2 celery sticks, finely chopped","4 garlic cloves, sliced","few springs of thyme","1 tsp tomato purée","100ml vegan red wine (optional)","250g dried green lentils","2 x 400g cans whole plum tomatoes","250g pack chestnut mushrooms, chopped","250g pack portobello mushrooms, sliced","1 tsp soy sauce","1 tsp Marmite","1kg floury potato (such as Maris Piper), peeled and chopped","1 ½  tsp dried oregano","3 aubergines, sliced lengthways","150ml soya milk"]','["Pour 800ml boiling water over the dried porcini and leave for 10 mins until hydrated. Meanwhile, pour 1½ tbsp oil into a large saucepan. Add the onion, carrot, celery and a pinch of salt. Cook gently, stirring for 10 mins until soft. Remove the porcini from the liquid, keeping the mushroomy stock and roughly chop. Set both aside.","Add the garlic and thyme to the pan. Cook for 1 min, then stir in the tomato purée and cook for a minute more. Pour in the red wine, if using, cook until nearly reduced, then add the lentils, reserved mushroom stock and tomatoes. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and leave to simmer with the lid on.","Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan. Add 1½ tbsp oil and tip all of the mushrooms into the pan, including the rehydrated ones. Fry until all the water has evaporated and the mushrooms are deep golden brown. Pour in the soy sauce. Give everything a good mix, then scrape the mushrooms into the lentil saucepan.","Stir in the Marmite, then continue to cook the ragu, stirring occasionally, over a low-medium heat for 30-45 mins until the lentils are cooked and the sauce is thick and reduced, adding extra water if necessary. Remove the thyme sprigs and season to taste.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the potatoes into a pan of cold salted water. Bring to the boil, then cook until mashable.","Meanwhile, mix the remaining 5 tbsp oil with the oregano, then brush the aubergine slices with most of it and sprinkle with sea salt. Griddle for 3 mins on each side until soft.","Drain and mash the potatoes with the soya milk. Season to taste.","Spoon the ragu into a large lasagne dish (or two smaller ovenproof dishes), layer in ½ the aubergine, followed by the mash. Brush the remaining oregano oil across the mash, then finish by topping with the remaining aubergine slices. Bake in the oven for 25-35 mins until golden and bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:17:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6295,6295,'en','Supergreen soup with yogurt & pine nuts','A simple low-fat soup that''s a fresh new way to use a bag of mixed leaves – it''s rich in vitamin C, fibre, folate and calcium too','["2 tsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 potato (approx 250g), cut into small cubes","600ml vegetable stock","120g bag mixed watercress, rocket and spinach salad","150g pot natural yogurt","20g pine nuts, toasted","chilli oil, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a medium saucepan over a low-medium heat. Add the onion and a pinch of salt, then cook slowly, stirring occasionally, for 10 mins until softened but not coloured. Add the garlic and cook for 1 min more.","Tip in the potato followed by the veg stock. Simmer for 10-12 mins until the potato is soft enough that a cutlery knife will slide in easily. Add the bag of salad and let it wilt for 1 min, then blitz the soup in a blender until it’s completely smooth.","Serve with a dollop of yogurt, some toasted pine nuts and a drizzle of chilli oil, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6297,6297,'en','Pointed cabbage in white wine with fennel seeds','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyFor a quick version of sauerkraut, try cabbage simmered in white wine, with onion and herbs. The acidity of this side dish pairs beautifully with the unctuousness of roast pork','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp fennel seeds","1 large onion, sliced","1 large pointed cabbage, core removed, shredded","250ml dry white wine","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","½  small bunch coriander, roughly chopped"]','["In a large saucepan, heat the olive oil, add the fennel seeds and toast for 1 min to release the flavour. Stir in the onion and cook gently for 2 mins, then stir in the cabbage to coat in the oil and fennel.","Pour in the white wine and vinegar, allow to reduce by about half for 5 mins, then simmer on the hob for another 5 mins until the cabbage is cooked and the sauce has thickened slightly. Stir in the coriander and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6299,6299,'en','Whole roasted cauliflower with red wine, shallots & wheatberries','For vegetarians, cauliflower is veg patch royalty. This dish captures all that is right about the marriage of grains and vegetables','["1 large head of cauliflower, outer leaves removed","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp mustard seeds","3 large banana shallots, quartered","4 Portobello mushrooms, sliced","2 tsp thyme leaves","1 garlic clove, crushed","150ml red wine","100g young leaf spinach","350g wheatberries","1l hot vegetable stock","50g hazelnuts (skin on), roughly chopped","½  tsp crushed pink peppercorns","50g vegetarian Parmesan, finely grated"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Sit the cauliflower head upside down on a chopping board and cut the tough stem away. Leave some of the base so that the cauliflower remains intact.","Heat the oil in a large flameproof casserole dish on a low-medium heat. Add the mustard seeds and, once they begin to ‘pop’, add the shallots. Fry gently for 4-5 mins until starting to caramelise, then add the mushrooms, thyme and garlic, and cook for a further 4-5 mins, stirring every so often. Pour in the wine and reduce by half. Stir in the spinach and allow the leaves to wilt.","Next, add the wheatberries, season well and combine. Make a well in the centre and put the cauliflower in the middle. Pour the stock around – not over – the caulifower, then season.","Cover and transfer to the oven. Cook for 50 mins-1 hr until the cauliflower and wheatberries are tender. Remove from the oven and sprinkle the hazelnuts, peppercorns and Parmesan over the cauliflower. Return to the oven for a further 5 mins, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6301,6301,'en','Light Thai green curry','This light vegetarian version of your favourite Thai green curry is an unbelievable 5 of your 5-a-day! Warming chilli and creamy coconut smothered veggies make for a satisfying supper','["25g rolled oats, soaked in 200ml/7fl oz cold water for 20 mins","1 ½  tbsp creamed coconut, grated","1 tsp coconut oil or sunflower oil","2 carrots, sliced","1 parsnip, cut into small chunks","1 small sweet potato, chopped into small pieces","¼ tsp Marmite","2 kaffir lime leaves (dried or fresh)","6 spears purple sprouting broccoli, halved lengthways","50g frozen peas","1 lime, cut into 6 wedges","1 green pepper, chopped","½  small pack coriander","1 garlic clove, peeled","2cm/¾ in piece of ginger, peeled","zest and juice 1 lime","2 spring onions, roughly chopped","1 green chilli","brown rice","½  small pack coriander (optional)"]','["First, make the paste. Put all the ingredients in the small bowl of a food processor and blitz until finely chopped. Transfer to a small bowl and chill.","Put the oats and their soaking water in the food processor (no need to clean it first) and blend until it’s as smooth as you can get it. Strain it through a sieve to get rid of any remaining oats, then add the creamed coconut and set aside.","Put a large, non-stick frying pan or wok over a high heat. Add the coconut oil followed by the carrot, parsnip and sweet potato. Stir-fry for about 2-3 mins until the vegetables start to colour at the edges, then add the curry paste and cook until the curry no longer looks watery. Pour in the oat milk and coconut mixture, Marmite, lime leaves and 300ml water, and bring to a simmer. Cover and cook for 15 mins, then add the broccoli, along with 50ml water and cook for 5 mins more or until tender. Finally, add the frozen peas for 1 min more or until hot through. Take the pan off the heat, then squeeze over the juice from 2 of the lime wedges","Serve immediately with brown rice, the remaining lime wedges and a scattering of coriander leaves, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6303,6303,'en','Masala frittata with avocado salsa','A spicy twist on a simple frittata recipe, with Masala paste, coriander and plump cherry tomatoes. Pair it with our avocado salsa for a light and budget-friendly supper','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","3 onions, 2 ½  thinly sliced, ½  finely chopped","1 tbsp Madras curry paste","500g cherry tomatoes, halved","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","small pack coriander, roughly chopped","8 large eggs, beaten","1 avocado, stoned, peeled and cubed","juice 1 lemon"]','["Heat the oil in a medium non-stick, ovenproof frying pan. Tip in the sliced onions and cook over a medium heat for about 10 mins until soft and golden. Add the Madras paste and fry for 1 min more, then tip in half the tomatoes and half the chilli. Cook until the mixture is thick and the tomatoes have all burst.","Heat the grill to high. Add half the coriander to the eggs and season, then pour over the spicy onion mixture. Stir gently once or twice, then cook over a low heat for 8-10 mins until almost set. Transfer to the grill for 3-5 mins until set.","To make the salsa, mix the avocado, remaining chilli and tomatoes, chopped onion, remaining coriander and the lemon juice together, then season and serve with the frittata."]','2026-01-10 12:17:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6305,6305,'en','Lighter aubergine Parmigiana','We’ve baked the aubergines and used creamy ricotta in this healthy version of Parmigiana di melanzane – far lower in fat and calories than the original','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil, plus 1 tsp","2 tbsp lemon juice","3 aubergines (750g/1lb 10oz total weight), stalk ends trimmed, cut into 1cm/½ in lengthways slices","1 small onion, chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","400g can plum tomatoes","225g can plum tomatoes","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp chopped fresh oregano","100g ricotta","50g mozzarella, torn into small pieces","handful basil leaves, roughly torn","2 medium tomatoes, sliced","25g vegetarian-style Parmesan, grated"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Measure the 2 tbsp of oil into a small bowl. Brush just a little of it onto 2 large, non- stick baking sheets (if you only have 1 tray, bake the aubergines in batches). Mix the lemon juice into the measured oil. Lay the aubergine slices snugly in a single layer on the baking sheets, brush the tops with half the oil and lemon, season with pepper and bake for 20 mins. Turn the slices over, give the remaining oil and lemon mixture a good stir as it will have separated, and brush it over again. Season with pepper and bake for 10-15 mins more or until softened.","Meanwhile, heat the remaining 1 tsp oil in a medium saucepan. Add the onion and garlic and fry for 3-4 mins, stirring often, until the onion is softened and starting to brown. Tip in the cans of tomatoes, stir to break them up, then mix in the purée, pepper and a pinch of salt. Simmer uncovered for about 10-12 mins until thickened and saucy, then stir in the oregano.","Spread a little of the tomato sauce in the bottom of a shallow ovenproof dish (about 25 x 20 x 5cm). Start by laying a third of the aubergine slices widthways across the dish, spread over a third of the remaining sauce and put half the ricotta on top in small spoonfuls, then half the mozzarella. Scatter over half the torn basil and season well with pepper. Repeat the layering of aubergine slices, tomato sauce, ricotta, mozzarella and basil, and finish with the final aubergine slices, the sliced tomatoes and the last of the sauce. Season with pepper and scatter over the Parmesan. Bake for about 20 mins, or until the cheese is golden and the juices are bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:17:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6307,6307,'en','Spicy chilli bean soup','There’s minimal prep time to make this hearty vegetarian stew, which works just as well as an easy dinner or packed in a flask for lunch','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp mild chilli powder","½  tsp ground cumin","400g can chopped tomatoes","500ml vegetable stock","400g can mixed beans, drained and rinsed","1 red pepper, cut into chunky dice","tortilla chips, to serve","4 limes wedges, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a deep saucepan and fry the chopped onion over a medium heat until tender. Add the garlic and tomato purée, stirring for 1-2 mins until combined. Sprinkle in the spices and cook for another 1 min.","Tip in the chopped tomatoes, half fill the can with water, and add to the pan. Pour in the stock and simmer on a medium heat for 10-15 mins, uncovered. Season, then whizz using a hand blender until smooth. Add the beans and red pepper, and cook for another 15 mins until the pepper is tender.","Serve in bowls topped with a small pile of tortilla chips and a lime wedge."]','2026-01-10 12:17:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6309,6309,'en','Maple-roasted marrow on cavolo nero salad','Drizzle marrow with maple syrup and garlic, then top with crunchy hazelnuts and breadcrumbs for a comforting yet healthy vegetarian dish','["1 medium marrow","1 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp maple syrup","3 tbsp hazelnuts, halved","2 slices toasted sourdough bread, blitzed into crumbs","200g cavolo nero, stalks removed, shredded","10 radishes, quartered","16 shavings of vegetarian-style Parmesan","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 tbsp lemon juice","3 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 shallot, finely diced","1 tsp Dijon mustard","pinch golden caster sugar"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Slice the marrow open lengthways and scoop out the seeds. Cut the marrow into slices and place on a baking tray. Toss with the olive oil, garlic, maple syrup and some seasoning. Roast for 20 mins, then sprinkle the hazelnuts and breadcrumbs over. Roast for another 8 mins, then remove.","While the marrow is roasting, prepare the rest of the salad. Shred the cavolo nero leaves into bite-sized pieces. Put on a large platter or shallow bowl and top with the radishes.","Combine the dressing ingredients in a small bowl, adding some salt. Mix well.","Just before the marrow has finished cooking, drizzle the dressing over the cavolo nero. Use your hands to massage it into the cavolo nero for a few mins so that it softens it, then top with the marrow, breadcrumbs and hazelnuts. Sprinkle the Parmesan shavings over and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6311,6311,'en','Smoky aubergine tagine with lemon & apricots','A fragrant tagine is perfect for summer entertaining, lighter than stew but just as satisfying with meaty aubergines and aromatic spices','["2 aubergines, cut into large chunks","3 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, chopped","2 tbsp freshly grated ginger","1½  tsp ras el hanout","1½  tsp sweet smoked paprika","good pinch of saffron","300ml hot vegetable or chicken stock","2 preserved lemons, rind of both sliced, pulp from the centre of 1 roughly chopped","120g dried apricots, halved","200g tomatoes, roughly chopped","1 tbsp clear honey","zest 1 lemon, juice ½","2 tsp toasted sesame seeds","2 tbsp finely chopped flat-leaf parsley","2 tbsp finely chopped mint","Greek yogurt, to serve (optional)","wholemeal bulghar wheat, to serve (optional)"]','["Brown the aubergines in 2 tbsp of the oil so they’re golden on all sides, but not soft in the middle yet – this is best done in batches in a large, non-stick frying pan.","Heat a heavy-based shallow lidded pan or flameproof tagine with the remaining oil, then add the onions, ginger and spices, and fry gently until softened and golden.","Meanwhile, add the saffron to the stock to soak. Stir the preserved lemon rind and pulp, apricots, tomatoes, honey and lemon juice into the onions with the saffron stock. Snugly fit the aubergines in, cover with a lid and simmer for 30 mins until the aubergines are tender. Season to taste.","Mix together the lemon zest, sesame seeds and chopped herbs, and sprinkle over the tagine. Serve with Greek yogurt and wholemeal bulghar wheat, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6313,6313,'en','Pearl barley, parsnip & sage risotto','Pearl barley makes a great alternative to rice in this vegetarian risotto recipe flavoured with sage, garlic and Parmesan','["25g butter, plus an extra knob to stir through","1 onion, finely chopped","4 parsnips, about 500g, peeled and cut into chunks","1 garlic clove, crushed","10 sage leaves, shredded, plus extra to serve","400g pearl barley, rinsed","1.4l hot vegetable stock","25g Parmesan, grated, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the butter in a large saucepan. Add the onion and a pinch of salt, and cook gently for 5 mins. Tip in the parsnips, turn up the heat and cook for 8-10 mins, stirring every so often, until the parsnips are starting to brown and caramelise.","Add the garlic and sage, and mix through. Tip in the barley and stir to coat well. Pour in the stock, bring to the boil, then turn down to a simmer and cook for 35-40 mins, or until nearly all the liquid has been absorbed and the pearl barley is tender but still has a bite. You may need to add a little extra boiling water.","Take off the heat, top with the Parmesan and a knob of butter, then leave to melt. Give the risotto a good stir, then spoon into dishes. Top with more sage, Parmesan and some black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:17:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6315,6315,'en','Pan-cooked feta with beetroot salsa & bean mash','Whip up this budget vegetarian dinner in minutes – pile slices of light feta onto cannellini bean mash and top with tangy beetroot salsa','["about 100g vegetarian, light feta, thickly sliced","a little flour, for dusting","65g pack rocket","250g cooked beetroot, diced","½  red onion, finely chopped","grated zest and juice ½  lime","2 tbsp chopped dill, plus extra for sprinkling","1 tsp olive oil, plus a little extra for cooking","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","400g can cannellini beans"]','["Mix the beetroot and the onion in a bowl with the lime zest, a good squeeze of juice, seasoning and dill.","Heat the tsp oil in a non-stick pan and gently cook the garlic until softened then tip in the beans, and some of the juice from the can with seasoning. Mash the beans, keeping them quite chunky, then keep warm.","Toss the slices of feta in a little flour. Heat a non-stick frying pan, wipe with a little oil then cook the feta for a few minutes on each side until golden and warmed through, flipping over to make sure they''re cooked evenly. Spoon the bean mash onto plates, top with the feta and half the salsa then scatter with extra dill. Serve with the rocket on the side and the rest of the salsa in a bowl."]','2026-01-10 12:17:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6317,6317,'en','Spicy avocado wraps','Pan-fry vegetarian, chicken-style pieces with lime, chilli and garlic, then pile onto seeded tortilla wraps – cool before assembling if packing for lunch','["½  x 300g pack Quorn chicken-style pieces (or similar vegetarian product), sliced at an angle","generous squeeze juice ½  lime","½  tsp mild chilli powder","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 tsp olive oil","2 seeded wraps","1 avocado, halved and stoned","1 roasted red pepper, from a jar","few sprigs coriander, chopped"]','["Mix the vegetarian, chicken-style pieces with the lime juice, chilli powder and garlic.","Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan then fry the pieces for a couple of mins, while you warm the wraps following the pack instructions or if you have a gas hob, heat them over the flame to slightly char them. Do not let them dry out or they are difficult to roll.","Squash half an avocado onto each wrap, add the peppers to the pan to warm them through then pile onto the wraps with the chicken-style pieces, and sprinkle over the coriander. Roll up, cut in half and eat with your fingers."]','2026-01-10 12:17:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6319,6319,'en','Courgette, pea & pesto soup','Enjoy this super healthy soup when you want a comforting but low-calorie lunch – rich in fibre, vitamin C and folic acid','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, sliced","500g courgettes, quartered lengthways and chopped","200g frozen peas","400g can cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","1l hot vegetable stock","2 tbsp basil pesto, or vegetarian alternative"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan. Cook the garlic for a few seconds, then add the courgettes and cook for 3 mins until they start to soften. Stir in the peas and cannellini beans, pour on the hot stock and cook for a further 3 mins.","Stir the pesto through the soup with some seasoning, then ladle into bowls and serve with crusty brown bread, if you like. Or pop in a flask to take to work."]','2026-01-10 12:17:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6321,6321,'en','Tofu & asparagus pad Thai','A vegetarian, superhealthy alternative to the ever popular pad Thai','["200g flat rice noodles","2 limes, 1 juiced, one cut into wedges","1 tbsp tamarind paste, or extra lime juice","2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce, plus extra for serving","2 tbsp vegetable oil or sunflower oil","300g firm tofu, drained, patted dry and cut into cubes","10 asparagus spears, trimmed and sliced on the diagonal","6 spring onions halved and thinly sliced lengthways","300g bag beansprouts","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","handful each coriander leaves and salted peanuts, to serve"]','["Cook the noodles following packet\r\ninstructions. Mix the lime juice, tamarind\r\nand chilli sauce in a small bowl. Set aside.","Heat 1 tbsp oil in a non-stick frying pan\r\nor wok and fry the tofu for 5-8 mins, until\r\ngolden all over. Set aside.","Add the remaining oil and stir-fry the\r\nasparagus until tender. Tip in the spring\r\nonions, beansprouts and garlic. Cook for\r\n2 mins more. Stir in the drained noodles,\r\nsauce and some salt. Mix in the tofu and\r\nheat through. Serve with coriander,\r\nsalted peanuts and lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:17:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6323,6323,'en','Marinated aubergine & rocket salad','Juicy chunks of roasted aubergine add satisfaction to this sweet and superhealthy salad','["2 aubergines, cut into small chunks","3 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","small handful sultanas","50g bag rocket"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nToss the aubergine with 2 tbsp olive oil\r\nand seasoning in a large roasting tin and\r\nroast for 30 mins until golden and soft.","When cooked, toss with the vinegar,\r\nsultanas and remaining oil. Scatter over\r\nthe rocket just before serving. Can be\r\nserved warm or at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:17:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6325,6325,'en','Gujarati cabbage with coconut & potato','This superhealthy, stir-fried side makes a tasty vegetarian supper served with rice and dhal','["500g Charlotte or other new potatoes, unpeeled and halved","2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 pinch asafoetida (available from Bart or steenbergs.co.uk, see tip)","1 tsp black mustard seeds","1 tsp cumin seeds","2 dried red chillies","1 fresh red or green chilli, deseeded and thinly sliced","1 pointed (sweetheart) cabbage, finely shredded","juice ½ lemon","2 tbsp desiccated or shaved fresh coconut, toasted","bunch of coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Cook potatoes in a pan of salted boiling\r\nwater for 10 mins until tender. Drain well\r\nand return to pan. Lightly crush with the\r\nback of a fork, just to break, not to mash.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan and\r\nthen add the asafoetida, spices and dried\r\nchillies. Cook for a few mins until the\r\nspices pop and the chillies darken.","Add the fresh chilli, cabbage and some\r\nsalt and stir-fry for 3-4 mins. Add the warm\r\npotatoes to the pan and cook for 2-3 mins\r\nmore until the cabbage is tender, but still\r\nhas some bite. Stir in the lemon juice,\r\ncoconut and coriander, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6327,6327,'en','Lentil ragu','Struggle to get your five-a-day? This superhealthy ragu will get you four steps closer and can be frozen for extra convenience','["3 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, finely chopped","3 carrots, finely chopped","3 celery sticks, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed","500g bag dried red lentils","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 tsp each dried oregano and thyme","3 bay leaves","1l vegetable stock","500g spaghetti, plus Parmesan or vegetarian cheese, grated, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan and\r\nadd the onions, carrots, celery and\r\ngarlic. Cook gently for 15-20 mins\r\nuntil everything is softened. Stir in the\r\nlentils, chopped tomatoes, tomato purée,\r\nherbs and stock. Bring to a simmer, then\r\ncook for 40-50 mins until the lentils are\r\ntender and saucy – splash in water if\r\nyou need. Season.","If eating straight away, keep on a low\r\nheat while you cook the spaghetti,\r\nfollowing pack instructions. Drain well,\r\ndivide between pasta bowls or plates,\r\nspoon sauce over the top and grate over\r\nsome cheese. Alternatively, cool the\r\nsauce and chill for up to 3 days.Or freeze for up to 3 months. Simply\r\ndefrost portions overnight at room\r\ntemperature, then reheat gently to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6329,6329,'en','Winter mulligatawny','Use up leftover roast turkey in this hearty, low-fat soup with curry flavours. It’s rich in immune-supporting vitamin C, making it ideal for the winter months','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions (350g), chopped","1 tbsp finely chopped ginger","2 large garlic cloves , finely grated","1 red chilli , deseeded and chopped","2 tbsp medium curry powder","1 tsp cumin seeds","1½ litres hot vegetable stock , made with 1 tbsp bouillon powder","500ml passata","320g carrots , diced","2 celery sticks , chopped","180g dried red lentils","100g brown basmati rice","200g cooked turkey or chicken, chopped","15g coriander , chopped","½ lemon , juiced"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan over a medium heat and cook the onions for 10 mins, stirring frequently until softened and starting to turn golden.","Stir in the ginger, garlic and chilli, and cook for a minute more. Add the curry powder and cumin seeds, stir well, then pour in the hot vegetable stock and passata and stir again.","Tip in the carrots, celery, lentils and rice, mix well and bring to the boil. Once boiling, reduce the heat, cover and cook for a further 10 mins until the lentils, veg and rice are tender.","Remove from the heat, stir in the coriander and lemon juice, and ladle into bowls. Leftovers will keep chilled for up to three days, or freeze for up to three months. Reheat in a pan with a splash of water until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:17:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6331,6331,'en','Brussels sprouts winter salad with clementine dressing','Sprouts aren’t just for Christmas! Combined with zesty flavours, they bring freshness and a satisfying bite to this winter veggie salad','["350g brussels sprouts , shredded","150g kale , shredded","50ml extra virgin olive oil","3 clementines , 2 peeled and segmented, 1 zested and juiced","3 tbsp apple cider vinegar","1 tbsp honey or maple syrup","2 tsp Dijon mustard","50g pine nuts","50g pomegranate seeds , to serve (optional)"]','["Put the shredded sprouts and kale in a large bowl with a large pinch of salt. Pour the olive oil into a small bowl or jug, and mix in the clementine zest and juice, vinegar, honey and mustard, then pour this over the leaves. Scrunch with your hands until the dressing is well distributed, then leave to soften for 15 mins.","Fold through the pine nuts and clementine segments, then spoon the salad onto a platter or into bowls. Scatter over the pomegranate seeds, if using, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6333,6333,'en','Roast squash & hummus winter salad','Salads aren’t just for summer – this gorgeous winter salad is loaded with beta-carotene and vitamin C to help support immune defences','["4 small potatoes (about 320g), skin-on, cut into wedges","320g butternut squash, cut into long thin slices","2 red and yellow or green peppers, deseeded and cut into big chunks","3 red onions (about 320g), cut into thick slices","200g carrots, halved lengthways and cut into thick slices","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 tbsp fresh thyme leaves","30g rocket, to serve","2 x 400g cans butter beans","2 large garlic cloves, sliced","1 tsp smoked paprika","1 large lemon, zested and juiced","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","25g walnuts, chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Boil the potatoes for 5 mins, then drain and leave them to steam dry. Tip all of the vegetables, including the steam-dried potatoes, into a large shallowroasting tinwhere they can fit in one layer, and toss gently with the oil and thyme. Roast for 25 mins.","Meanwhile, make the hummus. Drain the butter beans, retaining the water. Weigh 300g of the beans and put in a bowl with the garlic, smoked paprika, 1 tbsp of the rapeseed oil, 3 tbsp lemon juice, 1 tsp lemon zest and 3 tbsp bean liquid andblitzuntil smooth. Add another 2 tbsp bean liquid for a smoother consistency, if you like. Stir in the walnuts. In a separate small bowl, mix 1 tbsp lemon juice with the remaining rapeseed oil.","Once the vegetables are soft, stir through the reserved beans and return the tray to the oven for 5 mins to warm through. To serve, spread half the hummus over two plates. Top with half the roasted vegetables then spoon over a little of the lemon and oil mixture, saving some for another meal. Scatter over the rocket and serve.Will keep chilled in an airtight container for up to three days. Reheat the vegetables in a microwave until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:17:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6335,6335,'en','Winter salad','Make the most of cauliflower in this wonderful winter salad with raisins, dill and walnuts, and a homemade butter bean and smoked paprika hummus','["320g cauliflower, broken into florets","1 red pepper, quartered, deseeded and sliced","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 red onion, halved and thinly sliced","1 large lemon, zested and juiced","15g raisins","35g walnuts, roughly chopped or broken into chunks","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","15g dill, chopped","400g can butter beans","1 garlic clove, sliced","½ tsp smoked paprika","½ tbsp rapeseed oil"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Rub the cauliflower and pepper all over with ½ tbsp of the oil, and roast in a medium roasting tin for 30 mins until tender.","Put the onion and all but 1 tbsp of the lemon juice in a non-reactive bowl, and scrunch together using your hands to start softening the onions. Add the raisins, walnuts and chilli, then set aside.","For the hummus, drain the beans, reserving the liquid from the can. Tip the beans into a food processor with the garlic, paprika, oil and the reserved lemon juice. Add 2 tbsp of the reserved bean liquid, and blitz until smooth.","Spread the hummus over two plates. Toss the roasted veg with the onions, remaining oil, half the lemon zest and the dill. Spoon over the hummus and scatter with the remaining zest.This recipe is part of our free 7-day healthy diet plan. To access the full meal plan,click here."]','2026-01-10 12:17:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6337,6337,'en','Chicken noodle soup','Mary Cadogan’s aromatic broth will warm you up on a winter’s evening – it contains ginger, which is particularly good for colds.','["900ml chicken or vegetable stock (or Miso soup mix)","1 boneless, skinless chicken breast (about 175g)","1 tsp chopped fresh ginger","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","50g rice or wheat noodles","2 tbsp sweetcorn, canned or frozen","2-3 mushrooms, thinly sliced","2 spring onions, shredded","2 tsp soy sauce, plus extra for serving","mint or basil leaves and a little shredded chilli (optional), to serve"]','["Pour the stock into apanand add the chicken breast, ginger andgarlic. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat, partly cover and simmer for 20 mins, until the chicken is tender.","Put the chicken on aboardand shred into bite-size pieces using a couple of forks. Return the chicken to the stock with the noodles, sweetcorn, mushrooms, spring onion and soy sauce. Simmer for 3-4 mins until the noodles are tender.","Ladle into two bowls and scatter over the remaining spring onion, mint or basil leaves and chilli, if using. Serve with extra soy sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:17:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6339,6339,'en','Easy chicken & leek pot pies','Make these creamy, cheesy chicken and leek pot pies ahead and freeze them, ready for those cold winter nights when you don’t feel like cooking','["25g butter","3 leeks, washed and sliced","350g tub fresh cheese sauce","½ bunch chives, snipped","200g cooked chicken, torn","3 tbsp milk","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","320g pack shortcrust pastry","plain flour, for dusting","1 large egg, beaten","green veg, to serve (optional)"]','["Melt the butter in a large pan, then add the leeks and cook, covered, for 10 mins until really soft. Remove from the heat and stir through the cheese sauce, chives, chicken, milk and mustard. Mix well and spoon into small dishes or ramekins.","Unroll the pastry on a lightly floured surface. Use a saucer to cut circles for the tops, put them on top, trim to fit, crimp the edges and glaze with egg.Will keep, covered and frozen, for up to two months.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and bake for 45 mins, or, to cook from frozen, heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Cover with foil and put on a baking tray. Bake for 15 mins. Reduce the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and bake for 45 mins, removing the foil for the final 30 mins. Serve with green veg, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6341,6341,'en','Pumpkin pickle','Make your own Christmas hamper and be sure to add this seasonal pumpkin pickle. It can be served with cold meats, cheese or a slice of warm savoury pie','["850g pumpkin or squash (600g prepared weight), peeled and chopped into 1cm pieces","1 large onion, chopped","2 eating apples, cored, peeled and chopped into 1cm pieces","2 tsp black mustard seeds","2 tsp coriander seeds","2 tsp nigella seeds","200g caster sugar","450ml cider vinegar","2 bay leaves","1½ tsp turmeric","2 tbsp plain flour","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and cut into thin slices","1 green or red chilli, finely chopped"]','["Put the prepared pumpkin in a bowl and sprinkle over 2 tbsp sea salt. Toss well, cover and leave at room temperature for 24 hrs.","Sterilise your jars before you start (see tip, below). Drain and rinse the pumpkin, then tip into a large pan. Add the onion, apple pieces, mustard, coriander and nigella seeds, the sugar, vinegar and bay leaves. Pour 200ml water over everything, then put on a medium heat and bring to a simmer. Put a lid on the pan, leaving a gap for steam to escape, turn the heat up to medium-high and cook for 8 mins.","Use a cup to scoop out some liquid from the pan and mix 50ml with the turmeric and flour in a small bowl to make a smooth paste. Add a little more of the liquid, mixing well to remove any lumps, until the paste becomes runny, then pour into the pan, and add the ginger and chilli. Simmer for another 5 mins, uncovered, stirring until thickened and the squash has softened but still retains some bite.","Carefully fill your sterilised jars with the pickle while it’s still hot, pressing the chunks of squash down into the liquid to expel air pockets, then pop on the lid.Will keep in a cool, dark place for up to a year. Once opened, store in the fridge and eat within a month. Best served after being left to mature for a month or more, but can be eaten straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:17:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6343,6343,'en','Bicerin','Expect a kick from this grown-up, layered hot chocolate which features a shot of espresso. This Italian hot chocolate is as traditional as hot chocolate gets','["125ml double cream","250ml whole milk or single cream","50g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids), finely chopped","demerara sugar, to taste","2 shots of freshly brewed espresso","10g hazelnuts, finely grated or chopped","pinch of cocoa powder"]','["Whiskthe double cream in a bowl until it holds its shape but is still pourable. Set aside.","Pour the milk or single cream into asaucepanwith the dark chocolate. Stir continuously over a low-medium heat using a whisk until the mixture comes to the boil. Reduce the heat to low and simmer while continuing to whisk. Add the demerara sugar to taste.","Warm two heatproof glasses by rinsing with hot water, then dry and pour in the espresso. Carefully pour over the chocolate mixture, then top with the whipped cream, hazelnuts and a pinch of cocoa powder."]','2026-01-10 12:17:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6345,6345,'en','Cod & tarragon fishcakes with minty peas','These mega-sized fishcakes are packed with high-protein white fish and served on top of a tasty mix of minty peas and leeks','["rapeseed oil, for the tin","900g potatoes (we used Maris Piper), peeled and cut into medium chunks","2 tsp English mustard powder","4 anchovies (10g), finely chopped","5 spring onions, very finely chopped","2tsp capers (10g)","1 ½ tbsp chopped tarragon","2 x 280g packs skinless cod loin, cut into cubes","8 tsp wholemeal flour","2 eggs","90g ground almonds","320g frozen peas","320g leeks, halved and finely sliced","2 tbsp finely chopped mint","4 rocket","2tsp lemon juice","2tsp extra virgin olive oil"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and oil a non-stick baking sheet. Bring a pan of water to the boil, then cook the potatoes for 15-20 mins until tender. Drain well, then return to the pan and mash with the mustard, anchovies, spring onions, capers and tarragon until combined. Stir through the raw cod.","Shape into 8 cakes, then coat lightly in the flour – about 1-2 tsp each. Beat the eggs in a shallow bowl. Coat the cakes in the egg, then sprinkle1/2 tbsp of the almonds over each one and place on the baking sheet. Bake for 20 mins, turning each over halfway through, until starting to turn golden.","Meanwhile, put the peas and leeks in a pan, submerge in water, then cover and boil for 10 mins. Drain and stir through the mint. Divide half of the pea and leek mixture between two plates with 2 fishcakes on top for each. Toss half the rocket with half the lemon juice and olive oil, then pile on top of the fishcakes. Chill 4fishcakes and half the pea and leek mixture, separately, to eat another day.Will keep chilled for up to two days.Reheat the fishcakes on a baking tray at 200C/180C fan/gas 6 for 15-20 mins. Reheat the peas and leeks in the microwave.Dress the remaining rocket just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6347,6347,'en','Lactose-free macaroni cheese','Enjoy a lactose-free version of macaroni cheese. The ultimate comfort food on cold winter nights, it’s sure to be a hit with the whole family','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp plain flour","500ml lactose-free milk","125g Grana Padano, finely grated","2 tsp Dijon mustard","250g elbow macaroni or short pasta","3 tbsp dried breadcrumbs","pinch of paprika or cayenne pepper"]','["Whiskthe olive oil and flour together in asaucepanuntil smooth, then warm over a medium heat until lightly golden and thickened slightly. Add the milk a splash at a time, whisking continually, until a smooth white sauce forms. Cook for 2 mins more until thick enough to coat the back of a spoon. Stir in 100g of the Grana Padano and the Dijon mustard, then cook for another 1-2 mins until melted. Season well.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta for 8-10 mins until al dente. Drain well and stir into the cheese sauce. Tip into a baking dish and heat the grill to medium. Toss together the breadcrumbs, paprika or cayenne and the remaining Grana Padano, then scatter over the top of the macaroni cheese. Grill for 5-8 mins until the top is crispy and golden. Serve with a sharply dressed green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:17:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6349,6349,'en','Smoky ham & lentil stew','Make the most of your Christmas ham and roasted veg leftovers in this smoky ham and lentil stew – perfect for feeding the family during the holidays','["1 tbsp rapeseed or olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","1 celery stick, chopped","2 tsp smoked paprika","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","2 low-salt chicken or vegetable stock cubes or bouillon","140g leftover cooked ham or gammon, cut into chunks","350g leftover roasted root vegetables (such as potatoes, carrots, parsnips, celeriac or swede), chopped into chunks","200g pouch cooked puy lentils","small bunch of parsley, chopped","crusty bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat and cook the onion and celery for 8-10 mins until tender. Add the paprika and mustard, cook for 30 seconds more, then crumble in the stock cubes and add the ham along with 1 litre water. Bring to a simmer, then bubble gently for 10 mins.","Tip in the root vegetables and lentils, then season to taste and continue to bubble everything for another 5-10 mins until the stew is piping hot. Just before serving, stir in the parsley, then ladle into bowls and serve with crusty bread on the side for mopping up the stew."]','2026-01-10 12:17:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6351,6351,'en','Pumpkin spice syrup','Add this versatile pumpkin spice syrup, made with cinnamon, cloves and ginger, to lattes and milkshakes. You can also drizzle it over bakes and desserts','["200g golden caster sugar","50g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tsp ground cinnamon","¼ tsp ground cloves","2 tsp ground ginger","grating of nutmeg","2 tbsp canned pumpkin purée"]','["Tip all the ingredients into a pan with 125ml water, and cook over a medium heat for 5-10 mins until the sugar has dissolved and you have a thin syrup.","Remove from the heat and leave to cool. Transfer the syrup to a sterilised bottle or jar.Will keep in the fridge for up to two weeks."]','2026-01-10 12:17:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6353,6353,'en','Beetroot & butternut stew','This vibrant vegetarian one-pot is packed with an impressive 4 of your 5-a-day, and makes a delicious low-fat and low-calorie dinner','["250g raw beetroot","350g butternut squash, unpeeled","1 garlic clove, grated","1 small onion, diced","¼ tsp cumin seeds","½  tsp ground coriander","4 cardamom pods, seeds removed and crushed","1 tbsp sunflower oil","½  tsp cinnamon","100g green beans, topped and cut in half","50g chard or spinach, stems removed and leaves roughly chopped","small pack flat-leaf parsley, roughly chopped","brown rice, to serve (optional)"]','["Peel the beetroot and chop into small pieces. Chop the butternut squash into small pieces. Put them in separate bowls until you need them.","In a large wide-topped saucepan, fry the garlic, onion, cumin seeds, coriander and cardamom pods in the oil for 2 mins on a medium heat. Add 125ml water along with the beetroot and leave for a further 5 mins until the water has simmered away.","Add 250ml water, the butternut squash and cinnamon, and leave to simmer on a medium heat for 10 mins. Add 250ml water and leave to simmer for another 10 mins.","Add 125ml water, the green beans and simmer for another 5 mins until the water has simmered away. Take off the heat and stir in the chard and parsley. Serve by itself or with brown rice for a fuller meal."]','2026-01-10 12:17:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6355,6355,'en','Spinach & squash salad with coconut dressing','Roasted butternut squash, lime-marinated onions and spinach leaves dressed with coconut cream make the perfect winter buffet salad','["1 large butternut squash or pumpkin, deseeded but skin left on","2 tbsp olive oil","1 large red onion, sliced into thin rings","2 limes, zest of 1, juice of both","½  x 160ml can coconut cream","2 tsp fish sauce","1 tsp golden caster sugar","2 x 100g bags baby leaf spinach"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Cut the squash into bite-sized pieces, toss with the oil and seasoning, then roast for 30-40 mins until golden and tender. Leave to cool.","Toss the onion rings with the juice of 1 lime and set aside while the squash roasts.","Make the dressing. Whisk together the remaining lime juice, the zest, coconut cream, fish sauce and sugar. Cover and leave to infuse in the fridge for 10-15 mins, or until ready to serve. When ready to eat, toss together the squash, spinach and onions, and serve with a generous drizzle of the dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:17:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6357,6357,'en','Pearl barley, bacon & leek casserole','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis storecupboard grain makes a great alternative to rice or couscous. Team with bacon and veggies in this risotto-like stew','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 leeks, thickly sliced","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","300g pearl barley","4 carrots, cubed","1 tbsp Dijon mustard, plus extra to serve","1l chicken stock","300g Savoy cabbages, shredded","200g lean bacon joint, cooked, chopped into small pieces"]','["Heat a large pan over a medium heat. Add the olive oil and cook the leeks for a few mins, then add the garlic and cook for just 1 min more.","Add the pearl barley, carrots and mustard, then pour over the chicken stock. Season with plenty of ground black pepper and simmer for 20 mins, stirring occasionally. Add the cabbage with\r\nthe bacon, and cook for 5-10 mins until cabbage is wilted and tender. Serve with extra Dijon mustard on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:17:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6359,6359,'en','Spiced braised venison with chilli & chocolate','This can be eaten as stew or used in a pastry or cottage pie. The chocolate adds an extra richness and glossiness to the finished sauce','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","1½ kg diced stewing venison","3 large carrots, roughly chopped","1 onion, roughly chopped","1 tbsp cumin seed","1 tsp ground coriander","large pinch of chilli powder","small cinnamon stick","1 red chilli, whole","1 heaped tbsp plain flour","500ml red wine","300ml beef stock","400g can chopped tomatoes","large thyme sprig","2 bay leaves","50g dark chocolate (more than 70% cocoa solids)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Heat the oil in a large flameproof casserole dish and brown the meat in batches. Add the vegetables in the dish and brown lightly, then stir in the spices, chilli and flour, and cook for a few mins. Pour in the wine, stock and tomatoes, then add the herbs. Bring to a simmer.","Cover with a lid and put in the oven  for 1 hr 30 mins, then remove the lid and cook for a further 1 hr until the meat is really tender. Remove from the oven and leave to cool slightly, then stir in the chocolate and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6361,6361,'en','Turkey curry','Go classic with your turkey leftovers and whip up this healthy spice-filled stew with peppers and tomatoes','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 large onion, thickly sliced","1 green pepper, deseeded and chopped","2 tbsp curry paste (or gluten-free alternative)","2 garlic cloves, crushed","400g can chopped tomatoes","300g leftover turkey, diced","300g leftover cooked potatoes (either boiled or roast), diced","2 tbsp mango chutney","small pack coriander, roughly chopped","rice or naan bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a fairly high heat. Cook the onion and pepper for 3-4 mins until starting to soften and brown slightly. Stir in the curry paste and garlic, then cook for another 1-2 mins. Add the chopped tomatoes and 150ml water. Bring to the boil and bubble for 5 mins.","Turn the heat down, stir in the turkey and potatoes, and cook for another 2-3 mins, then season and add the mango chutney. Scatter with coriander and serve with rice or naan."]','2026-01-10 12:17:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6363,6363,'en','Chicken, kale & sprout stir-fry','Brussels sprouts aren’t just for Christmas- add them to a healthy noodle pot for extra nutrition and crunch','["100g soba noodles","100g shredded curly kale","2 tsp sesame oil","2 lean chicken breasts, skin removed and sliced into thin strips","25g piece fresh ginger, peeled and sliced into matchsticks","1 red pepper, deseeded and thinly sliced","handful Brussels sprout, cut into quarters","1 tbsp low-sodium soy sauce","2 tbsp rice wine or white wine vinegar","zest and juice 1 lime"]','["Cook the noodles following pack instructions, then drain and set aside. meanwhile, heat a large wok or frying pan and add the kale along with a good splash of water and cook for 1-2 mins until wilted, with a little bite remaining, then cool under running water to keep the colour.","Add half the oil and cook the chicken strips until browned, then remove and set aside. Heat the remaining oil and fry the ginger, pepper and sprouts until softened a little. return the chicken and kale and add the noodles.","Tip in the soy, rice wine and lime zest and juice along with enough water to create a sauce that clings to the ingredients. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:17:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6365,6365,'en','Masala chicken pie','A Bombay potato-topped coconut curry bake that''s healthy and low-fat. Snuggle up with some nutritious comfort food','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","4 skinless chicken breasts","2 onions, chopped","finger-length piece ginger, grated","3 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tbsp medium curry powder","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp black or brown mustard seeds","2 tsp white or red wine vinegar","2 tsp sugar (white or brown)","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","150ml light coconut milk (buy a 400ml can- you''ll need more for the topping)","1 large red pepper, deseeded and cut into large chunks","1 large green pepper, deseeded and cut into large chunks","½ a small bunch coriander, leaves roughly chopped, stalks reserved (see below)","1½ kg floury potatoes, cut into very large chunks","150ml light coconut milk","1 tsp turmeric","juice 1 lemon","1 bunch spring onions, finely chopped","stalks from ½ a small bunch coriander, finely chopped","1 tsp kalonji seeds (also known as nigella or onion seeds )","naan bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat a deep frying pan or flameproof\r\ncasserole dish and add 2 tsp of the oil.\r\nBrown the chicken breasts quickly but\r\nwell on both sides, then remove to a\r\nplate. Turn down the heat and add the\r\nremaining oil, the onions, ginger and\r\ngarlic. Fry gently until soft. Add the spices\r\nand cook for a few mins, stirring.","Stir in the vinegar, sugar, tomatoes and\r\ncoconut milk. Bring to a simmer and\r\nbubble for 10 mins. Roughly chop the\r\nchicken breasts and stir into the pan with\r\nany chicken juices and the peppers.\r\nSimmer for another 20 mins until the\r\nchicken is cooked through and the sauce\r\nreduced a little. Take off the heat, stir in\r\nthe coriander leaves and season to taste\r\n– it will need a good seasoning.","To make the topping, put the potatoes\r\nin a big pan of water, bring to the boil,\r\nthen boil until cooked – 10-15 mins depending on how big your chunks are.\r\nDrain really well, then tip back into the\r\npan and steam-dry for a few mins.","Add the coconut milk and turmeric to\r\nthe pan, and mash really well. Season\r\nwith the lemon juice and some salt,\r\nthen stir through the spring onions and\r\ncoriander stalks.","Spoon the chicken masala into a\r\nbaking dish. Dollop on spoonfuls of\r\nmash to cover, then sprinkle over the\r\nkalonji seeds. Can be covered and\r\nchilled for up to 2 days (or frozen for\r\nup to a month).","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6\r\nand bake for 25-30 mins (or 45 mins\r\nfrom chilled) until hot through and\r\ncrisping on top. Serve with naan\r\nbread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6367,6367,'en','Moroccan chicken one-pot','You don''t need a clay pot to whip up a fragrant, North Africa tagine – throw it all in a casserole dish and top with feta, mint and lemon','["4 boneless, skinless chicken breasts","3 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, 1 roughly chopped, 1 sliced","100g tomatoes","100g ginger, roughly chopped","3 garlic cloves","1 tsp turmeric","1 tbsp each ground cumin, coriander and cinnamon","1 large butternut squash, deseeded and cut into big chunks","600ml chicken stock","2 tbsp brown sugar","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","100g dried cherries","1 small red onion, finely chopped","zest 1 lemon","handful mint leaves","100g feta cheese, crumbled","couscous and natural yogurt"]','["Season the chicken. Heat 2 tbsp of the\r\noil in a flameproof dish, then brown the\r\nchicken on all sides. Remove the chicken\r\nto a plate. Whizz the chopped onion,\r\ntomatoes, ginger and garlic into a rough\r\npaste. Fry the sliced onion in the\r\nremaining oil in the dish until softened,\r\nthen add the spices and fry for 1 min\r\nmore until fragrant. Add the paste and\r\nfry for another few mins to soften.","Return the chicken to the dish with the\r\nsquash, stock, sugar and vinegar. Bring\r\nto a simmer, then cook for 30 mins until\r\nthe chicken is cooked through. Lift the\r\nchicken out and stir in the cherries,\r\nthen continue simmering the sauce\r\nto thicken while you shred the chicken\r\ninto bite-sized chunks. Stir the chicken\r\nback into the sauce and season.","Mix the red onion, lemon zest, mint and\r\nfeta. Scatter over the dish, then serve\r\nwith some couscous and yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:17:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6369,6369,'en','Spicy baby aubergine stew with coriander & mint','Superhealthy and high in fibre too, this miraculous Middle Eastern one-pot is under 150 calories per serve and counts as 5 of your 5-a-day','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 red onions, sliced","4 garlic cloves, smashed","2 red chillies, deseeded and sliced, or 2-3 dried red chillies left whole","2 tsp coriander seeds, toasted and crushed","2 tsp cumin seeds, toasted and crushed","16 baby aubergines, left whole with stalk intact","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","2 tsp sugar","bunch mint leaves, roughly chopped","bunch coriander, roughly chopped","couscous and yogurt to serve"]','["Heat oil in a heavy-based saucepan,\r\nadd the onions and garlic and cook\r\nuntil they begin to colour. Add the\r\nchillies, coriander and cumin seeds.\r\nWhen the seeds give off a nutty\r\naroma, toss in the whole\r\naubergines, coating them\r\nin the onion and spices.","Tip in tomatoes and sugar,\r\ncover and gently cook for 40 mins,\r\nuntil aubergines are tender.","Season sauce and toss in half\r\nthe mint and coriander. Cover and\r\nsimmer for 2 mins. Sprinkle over\r\nremaining herbs and serve with\r\ncouscous and yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:17:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6371,6371,'en','Chicken & leek pies','Comfort food doesn’t have to mean calories, this superhealthy pie uses filo pastry to keep it low in saturated fat','["1 large sweet potato, cut into chunky chips","4 tsp olive oil","2 chicken breasts, chopped into bite-size chunks","1 leek, finely sliced","1 carrot, chopped","225ml low-sodium chicken stock","2 tsp wholegrain mustard","85g light soft cheese","2 tbsp chopped tarragon leaves","2 sheets filo pastry"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. In\r\na roasting tray toss the sweet potatoes\r\nwith 2 tsp of the oil and some seasoning.\r\nCook for 30-40 mins, until golden and\r\ncrisp. Heat 1 tsp oil in a medium frying\r\npan. Fry the chicken until browned,\r\nremove from the pan and set aside. Add\r\nthe leek and a splash of water, and gently\r\nfry until soft, about 7 mins. Add the\r\ncarrot and cook for 3 mins more. Pour in\r\nthe stock and boil until reduced by half,\r\nthen add the mustard and soft cheese,\r\nstirring well to combine. Return the\r\nchicken to the pan, add the tarragon and\r\nsome seasoning.","Divide the mixture between 2 small\r\novenproof dishes. Take the filo sheets\r\nand scrunch them up. Top each pie with\r\na sheet and brush with remaining 1 tsp oil.\r\nCook the pies in the oven with the chips\r\nfor 15 mins, until the pastry is golden."]','2026-01-10 12:17:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6373,6373,'en','Winter vegetable pie','One portion of this delicious vegetarian shepherd''s pie contains all 5 of your recommended 5-a-day intake','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, sliced","1 tbsp flour","300g (about 2 large) carrots, cut into small batons","½ cauliflower, broken into small florets","4 garlic cloves, finely sliced","1 rosemary sprig, leaves finely chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","200g frozen peas","900g potatoes, cut into chunks","up to 200ml/7fl oz milk"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a\r\nflameproof dish over a medium\r\nheat. Add the onions and cook for\r\n10 mins until softened, then stir in\r\nthe flour and cook for a further\r\n2 mins. Add the carrots, cauliflower,\r\ngarlic and rosemary, and cook for 5 mins, stirring regularly, until they\r\nbegin to soften.","Tip the tomatoes into the\r\nvegetables along with a can full\r\nof water. Cover with a lid and\r\nsimmer for 10 mins, then remove\r\nthe lid and cook for 10-15 mins\r\nmore, until the sauce has thickened\r\nand the vegetables are cooked.\r\nSeason, stir in the peas and cook\r\nfor 1 min more.","Meanwhile, boil the potatoes\r\nfor 10-15 mins until tender. Drain,\r\nthen place back in the saucepan\r\nand mash. Stir through enough milk\r\nto reach a fairly soft consistency,\r\nthen add the remaining olive oil\r\nand season.","Heat the grill. Spoon the hot\r\nvegetable mix into a pie dish, top\r\nwith the mash and drag a fork\r\nlightly over the surface. Place\r\nunder the grill for a few mins until\r\nthe top is crisp golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:17:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6375,6375,'en','Turkey chilli jacket potatoes','Turkey mince is cheap and lean – flavour Mexican-style with cumin and paprika and serve in crisp baked potatoes','["4 large baking potatoes","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","300g turkey mince","1 tbsp smoked paprika","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp cider vinegar","1 tbsp soft light brown sugar","350ml passata","reduced-fat Red Leicester, grated, to serve","4 spring onions, chopped, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nUse a fork to prick the potatoes all\r\nover. Rub with a little of the oil, and\r\nbake for 45 mins until tender.","Meanwhile, make the chilli. Heat the\r\nremaining oil in a large frying pan over a\r\nmedium heat. Add the onion, garlic and\r\nsome seasoning, and cook for 5 mins\r\nuntil soft. Add the turkey mince and\r\nseason again, then increase the heat and\r\nbreak up the mince with the back of your\r\nspoon. When it’s cooked through, add\r\nthe spices, vinegar, sugar and passata.\r\nReduce to a simmer and cook for 10 mins\r\nor until the liquid has reduced.","Cut a cross in the top of each potato\r\nand spoon in the chilli. Serve each potato\r\nsprinkled with cheese and spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:17:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6377,6377,'en','Harissa chicken with bulgur wheat','Bulgur is easy to cook and a great alternative to refined grains. It’s high in fibre and nutrient-rich, so good for your gut, digestion and heart health. Serve it with stews, or use it in salads or as a nutritious alternative to rice. This recipe is a favourite with my kids!','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves , thinly sliced","250g chicken mini fillets","2 tbsp rose harissa paste , to taste","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 red pepper , finely chopped","150g bulgur wheat , rinsed and drained","160g green beans , roughly chopped","1/2 lemon , juiced","Small handful of coriander , chopped, or leaves left whole","80g pomegranate seeds"]','["Heat the oil in a pan over a medium heat. Fry the garlic for 2-3 mins until golden, being careful not to burn it. Add the chicken and brown it for a few minutes. Stir in the harissa and tomato purée.","Add the chopped pepper and cook, stirring well, for a few minutes.","Stir in the drained bulgur wheat, a pinch of salt and 300ml boiling water. Bring to a simmer, put the lid on the pan and cook for 5 mins.","Lift the lid and lay the green beans on top, cover again, and cook for 5 mins. Remove from the heat and leave covered for another 5 mins.","Uncover, squeeze over the lemon juice and mix well. Garnish with the coriander and pomegranate seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:17:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6379,6379,'en','Super-green curry with quinoa rice','I’ve used chickpeas in this, but the curry base is adaptable; just add your choice of protein. A squeeze of lemon adds vitamin C to aid iron absorption and mixing quinoa with rice increases your intake of high-fibre wholegrains and protein.','["75g quinoa","75g rice","1 tsp oil","1/2 red onion , chopped","1/2 tsp cumin seeds","50g kale","150g baby spinach leaves","1/4 tsp turmeric","400g can chickpease , drained","squeeze lemon juice , to serve","1-2 tsp olive oil","5 garlic cloves , thinly sliced","1 red chilli , thinly sliced"]','["In a large microwave-safe bowl, combine the quinoa and rice. Wash and rinse three times. Add 320ml boiling water, cover and microwave on high for 10 mins. Leave to rest for 5 mins, then fluff with a fork.","While the rice cooks, heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat. Fry the onion for 5-7 mins until soft and lightly browned. Add the cumin and stir for 1 min to prevent burning.","Add the kale, spinach, turmeric, and a pinch of salt. Pour in 250ml boiling water. Cover and cook for 10-15 mins, stirring halfway.","Transfer to a blender, leave to cool for a few minutes, then blend until smooth. Return the mixture to the pan and stir in the chickpeas. Cook on low for 5 mins to heat through.","Heat the oil for the tadka in a pan over medium heat. Fry the garlic and chilies for 2-3 mins. Quickly pour over the curry. Serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:17:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6381,6381,'en','Spinach tagliatelle with garlic prawns','You’ll need a pasta machine to make Matty’s tagliatelle which contains spinach for a nutritious boost. A light sauce with tomatoes and prawns creates a vibrant dish','["100g spinach","2 large eggs","300g ''00'' pasta flour , plus extra to dust","250g cherry tomatoes","6 garlic cloves , 4 skin-on, 2 peeled","5 tbsp olive oil","1 lemon , zested and juiced","1 tsp chilli flakes","165g raw king prawns","small handful of parsley , finely chopped"]','["To make the pasta, add the spinach and eggs to a food processor and blitz until the spinach is finely chopped. Tip the flour onto a clean work surface and make a well in the centre. Pour the spinach and egg mixture into the well and use a fork to combine the ingredients. When a dough begins to form, use your hands to shape it into a ball and knead for 5-10 mins, or until the dough becomes smooth. Form into a neat ball, cover and set aside to rest for 30 mins.","To make the tomato sauce, heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Put the tomatoes in a small baking dish. Lightly bash the unpeeled garlic cloves using the back of your knife and add to the dish. Toss with 4 tbsp of the oil and some seasoning, then roast for 30 mins, until the tomatoes burst.","Meanwhile, crush the remaining peeled garlic cloves, mix in the lemon zest and half the juice, the chilli flakes and some seasoning. Mix in the prawns, then set aside to marinate in the fridge for 10-15 mins while you roll out the pasta.","Dust a clean work surface with flour. Divide the rested pasta dough into thirds and flatten slightly using the palm of your hand. Take one piece of dough and leave the other two covered. Start with the thickest setting on your pasta machine and roll the dough through. Work your way through the settings, reducing by one each time, and dusting the dough with extra flour as necessary to prevent any sticking, until you reach your desired thickness. Dust with a bit more flour, fold very loosely into a rectangle and cut into strips measuring 1cm thick. Toss each strip in a bit more flour, then set aside on a dusted baking tray. Repeat with the remaining pieces of dough.","Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil and add the pasta. Cook for 3 mins, until al dente, then drain thoroughly, reserving a mugful of pasta water. While the pasta is cooking, put a large frying pan over a medium heat. Drizzle 1 tbsp oil into the frying pan and, once hot, add the prawns. Fry for 3-4 mins, stirring well, until pink and cooked through. Mix in the roasted tomatoes, cooked pasta, half the parsley and a splash of the cooking water. Toss to combine and season to taste with salt, pepper and any remaining lemon juice. Garnish with the remaining parsley and a crack of black pepper to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6383,6383,'en','Super-green tofu curry','Going meat-free? Enjoy this delicious tofu and spinach curry that you can prep in minutes. Serve with wild rice and a scattering of coriander','["280g firm tofu , cut into small triangles","2 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tsp coriander seeds","2 tsp cumin seeds","2 cardamom pods , seeds bashed","10g ginger , peeled and roughly chopped","1 onion , finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , roughly chopped","400g spinach","10g coriander , roughly chopped, plus extra whole leaves to serve","2 x 250g pouches cooked brown & wild rice mix , to serve"]','["Pat the tofu dry with kitchen paper, then heat 1 tbsp oil in a large, deep frying pan over a medium heat. Fry the tofu for 3-4 mins, or until golden on each side. Remove from the pan using a fish slice and set aside to drain on kitchen paper.","Pour the remaining oil into the pan, then scatter in the coriander seeds, cumin seeds and cardamom and cook for 2-3 mins until popping.","Add the ginger, onion and garlic and cook for 10-12 mins more until golden at the edges. Turn the heat to low and add the spinach, a handful at a time and stir to wilt. Remove from the heat. Tip the spinach mix, the coriander and 300ml water into a high-powered blender and blitz until completely smooth. Pour the mixture back into the pan and season with salt. Bring to a simmer.","Tip in the fried tofu and cook for 4-5 mins, or until the tofu has warmed through. Season, then spoon over the wild rice and scatter over the coriander leaves to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6385,6385,'en','Healthier burritos','Add shredded cabbage, slaw or sweetcorn salsa for a more wholesome take on a Mexican favourite. Our method for making the beef chilli delivers the best results','["300g brown rice","4-6 wholemeal tortilla wraps, to serve","1 tsp olive oil","400g-500g beef mince","1 large onion , finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , crushed","2 tsp chipotle paste","1 tbsp Cajun or fajita seasoning","1 tbsp brown sugar","1 tbsp cider vinegar","400g can black beans , drained but not rinsed","400g can chopped tomato","1 tomato , chopped","1 red onion , finely chopped","½ small pack coriander , chopped","1 lime , juiced","2 avocados , stoned and peeled","natural yogurt , lime halves to squeeze over and grated cheddar (optional)"]','["First make the chilli. Heat the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat, crumble in the mince and fry for 15-20 mins. At first, it will release some liquid, but once that has bubbled away, the mince will sizzle in its own fat and start to brown and crisp. At this point, break it up using a wooden spoon so it browns and caramelises all over, then stir in the onion and cook for another 10 mins until the onion has softened. Add the garlic, chipotle paste, spice mix, sugar, and vinegar, and cook for 1 min. Tip in the beans and tomatoes, give everything a stir and simmer, uncovered, for 20 mins until thickened. Will keep chilled for two days or frozen for a month. Defrost throughly and reheat until piping hot.","Meanwhile, put the rice in a medium saucepan with 600ml cold water and a pinch of salt, if you like. Bring to the boil, then turn the heat down low, cover and gently simmer for about 20 mins until all the water has been absorbed. Turn off the heat and leave for another 10 mins undisturbed. Stir the rice and leave to stand.","For the guacamole, mix the tomatoes with the onion, coriander, lime juice and some seasoning, then mash to make a chunky guacamole. To serve, warm the tortillas, roughly spread over some of the guacamole, add a generous layer of rice, then the chilli, natural yogurt, lime juice and grated cheddar, if you like. Wrap everything up tight and halve through the middle and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6387,6387,'en','Warm chicken salad with avocado dressing','The avocados in this smoky, warm salad are highly nutritious, containing vitamin E, iron, potassium and niacin, along with heart-healthy monounsaturated fat','["3 tsp rapeseed oil","1 red pepper , deseeded and cut into thick strips","2 skinless chicken breast fillets , each cut into about six strips","2 garlic cloves , both peeled, one finely grated, one left whole","14 tsp dried oregano , plus a pinch","1 tsp smoked paprika","15g ground coriander","1 red onion , around 50g, thinly sliced","3 tbsp lime juice","1 avocado , halved and stoned, one half scooped out and sliced","400g can of black beans , drained","15g coriander , chopped","50g baby spinach"]','["Heat 2 tsp oil in a large non-stick pan over a low heat, add the peppers then cover and cook for 10 mins until softened. Shake the pan a couple of times to move them about, but try not to lift the lid. Remove from the pan and set aside.","Meanwhile, mix the chicken in a bowl with the remaining 1 tsp oil, grated garlic, ¼ tsp oregano, paprika and ½ tsp coriander. Toss the onion with 1 tbsp lime juice in a separate bowl and set aside.","To make the dressing, scoop the unsliced halved avocado into a bowl with the whole garlic clove, pinch of oregano, 2 tbsp lime juice and 3 tbsp water and blitz with a hand blender until completely smooth. Alternatively, you can use a food processor.","Return the pan of peppers to the heat and add the chicken, cover and cook for 5 mins until tender and cooked through. Tip the beans, quick-pickled onions and chopped coriander into the pan and mix well.","Pile the spinach onto two plates and top with the chicken mixture. Spoon on the avocado dressing and top with the avocado slices. Serve while still warm."]','2026-01-10 12:17:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6389,6389,'en','Healthy chicken burritos','Use storecupboard ingredients and leftovers to make this nutritious and easy Mexican-style lunch. The filling for the burritos can be made ahead','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 large red pepper, halved lengthways, deseeded and cut into thick strips","1 tsp cumin seeds","2-3 tsp mild chilli powder, to taste","400g can black beans","198g can sweetcorn, drained","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 large garlic clove, finely grated","220g pouch cooked wholegrain rice (or leftover cooked brown rice)","300g cooked chicken, sliced or shredded (or a combination of leg and breast meat left over from a roast)","15g coriander, chopped","2 small avocados, stoned and quartered","1 lime, juiced","4 large wholemeal tortilla wraps"]','["Heat the oil in a largenon-stick frying panand cook the pepper, covered, for 10 mins over a low heat until softened and lightly charred.","Meanwhile, in a dry frying pan, toast the spices gently over a low heat for 2-3 mins until fragrant, then tip in the beans, along with their liquid, the sweetcorn, tomato purée and garlic. Mix well and turn the heat up to medium so the mixture bubbles, then stir in the rice, chicken and coriander. Cook for 3-4 mins until piping hot.Will keep chilled for up to a day.Leave to cool completely first. Reheat in a pan or themicrowaveuntil piping hot.","Toss the avocado in a bowl with the lime juice. Lay the tortillas out on a work surface and pile the rice down the centre leaving a space at either side. Top with the peppers and avocado, then fold up the tortillas at each end to enclose the filling and tightly roll up the wrap. Put in the pan that you cooked the peppers in, seam-side down, and cook gently on each side over a low heat to lightly toast, about 2-3 mins. You may need to do this in batches."]','2026-01-10 12:17:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6391,6391,'en','Vegan lentils with soy & ginger tofu','Combine sweet, sticky, spicy fried tofu with puy lentils, coriander and chilli for a fibre-packed dish','["160g dried puy lentils or lentilles vertes","2 bay leaves","2 tbsp rapeseed oil , plus a drizzle","2 onions (350g), finely chopped","180g celery , thinly sliced","320g carrots , finely chopped","2 tbsp fresh thyme leaves","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard , plus 1 tsp","2 tbsp raw apple cider vinegar","1 tbsp chopped flat-leaf parsley","260g extra-firm tofu","2 garlic cloves , finely grated","2 tsp balsamic vinegar","2 tsp finely grated ginger","2 tsp low-salt soy sauce","4 tsp toasted three-seed mix","1 tbsp fresh coriander leaves","1 red chilli , chopped"]','["Put the lentils in a pan of water with the bay leaves, and bring to the boil. Boil for 10 mins, then turn the heat down to medium-low and cook for 20 mins more until the lentils are tender.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large non-stick pan over a high heat and fry the onion, stirring often until softened. Add the celery, carrots and thyme, cover with the lid, turn down the heat to medium and cook for 10 mins more, stirring occasionally until the vegetables are tender.","Drain the lentils and add these to the vegetables in the pan along with 1 tbsp of the mustard and the apple cider vinegar. Measure out half the lentil mixture and set aside – you can use these for lunches later in the week, like in ourpuy lentil salad with beetroot & walnuts. Toss the parsley through the remaining lentil mixture.","Cut the tofu into thick fingers. Combine the garlic, balsamic vinegar, ginger and soy sauce, then brush this over the tofu pieces.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a non-stick pan over a medium heat and fry the tofu on all sides until browned. Serve the tofu over half the lentils, topped with the mixed seeds, fresh coriander and chopped red chilli."]','2026-01-10 12:17:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6393,6393,'en','Orzo & chickpea soup','Rustle up this healthy, low-fat, low-calorie soup with orzo, chickpeas, veg and a can of chopped tomatoes. Top with grated parmesan to serve','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion , chopped","2 carrots , chopped","2 celery sticks , chopped","2 tbsp tomato purée","3 garlic cloves , chopped","3 rosemary or thyme sprigs","1 litre vegetable stock","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can chickpeas","parmesan rind or vegetarian alternative (optional)","150g orzo","extra virgin olive oil , to serve"]','["Heat the olive oil in a deep pan over a medium-high heat and cook the onion, carrots and celery, including any leaves for 15 mins until softened. Stir in the tomato purée, garlic cloves and rosemary or thyme sprigs. Cook for a few minutes until the purée is caramelised. Pour in the stock, chopped tomatoes, chickpeas (and the liquid from the can) and parmesan rind, if you have one. Simmer 15 mins.","Pour boiling water over the orzo in a heatproof bowl and set aside for 15 mins. Drain the orzo, add to the pan and cook for 5-8 mins until the orzo is tender. Fish out and discard the rosemary stalks and cheese rind, then season well. Drizzle over extra virgin olive oil and grated cheese to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6395,6395,'en','Winter breakfast hash','Showcase brussels sprouts in this flavourful hash. Cruciferous veg may help lower blood pressure and reduce the risk of heart-related diseases and cancer','["375g potatoes , cut into small chunks","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 onion (about 200g), chopped","½ tsp caraway seeds","2 garlic cloves , chopped","1 green pepper , deseeded and diced","200g large brussels sprouts , trimmed and sliced","2 eggs"]','["Boil the potatoes for 15 mins until tender. Meanwhile, heat the oil in a largenon-stick frying panover a medium heat and fry the onion for 8 mins, stirring frequently until it starts to colour. Add the caraway, garlic, pepper and sprouts and cook for 5 mins more with the lid on the pan so they steam at the same time.","Drain and lightly crush the cooked potatoes using amasher. Stir them into the vegetables and cook for 5-10 mins, turning occasionally so the mixture browns.","Meanwhile, poach the eggs for a few minutes for a runny yolk or until cooked to your liking. Remove from the pan using a slotted spoon. Serve each portion of hash topped with an egg."]','2026-01-10 12:17:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6397,6397,'en','Butter bean curry','The butter beans in this veggie curry create a satisfying texture. We’ve paired them with dark-skinned aubergine, which is packed with antioxidants','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions (320g), finely chopped","1 tbsp finely grated ginger","3 large garlic cloves , finely grated","1 red chilli , deseeded and sliced","2 x 400g cans butter beans","2 tsp vegan bouillon powder","1 tsp cumin seeds","2 tbsp medium curry powder","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 aubergine (320g), cut into cubes","15g coriander , chopped","250g pouch cooked wholegrain rice","2 small bananas , peeled and finely chopped","½ lime , juiced","¼ cucumber , finely chopped","1 small red onion (60g), finely chopped","1 red chilli , deseeded and sliced"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick pan over a medium heat and fry the onions for 8 mins until softened. Add the ginger, garlic and chilli, and cook for a few minutes more. Measure 300ml of the liquid from the cans of butter beans into a jug, and mix in the bouillon powder to make a stock (don’t worry if it’s thick or lumpy as it will dissolve in the pan as it cooks).","Stir the cumin seeds and curry powder into the onions, followed by the tomatoes, beans and aubergine. Add the stock. Bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to medium-low, cover and simmer for 30 mins until the veg is tender. Stir in half the coriander. Remove from the heat.","For the raita, toss the bananas in the lime juice. Add the cucumber, onion, chilli and remaining coriander. Warm the rice following pack instructions and serve with half the curry and raita. Cool and chill the rest of the curry and raita to make ourbutter bean curry wraps.The curry will keep chilled for up to three days. The raita keeps chilled for a day."]','2026-01-10 12:17:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6399,6399,'en','Spinach crespolini','Enjoy these healthy spelt pancakes filled with spinach, ricotta and tomato – they deliver all of your 5-a-day, plus spinach supports bone and eye health','["50g spelt wholemeal flour","1 egg","100ml milk","½ tsp rapeseed oil","250g baby spinach","generous grating of nutmeg","1 large garlic clove, finely grated","80g ricotta","2 tbsp vegetarian Italian-style hard cheese, finely grated","400g can chopped tomatoes","10g basil","½ tsp vegetable bouillon powder","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tsp balsamic vinegar","1 small red onion (about 80g), finely chopped","80g diced celery","3 handfuls of rocket","160g cherry tomatoes"]','["Whiskthe flour and egg together, then gradually whisk in the milk to create a smooth pancake-style batter. Pour into a jug.","Heat the oil in a 19cm non-stick pan over a medium heat, tip in a quarter of the batter, and swirl to cover the base. Cook briefly until just set, then flip over using a palette knife and cook the other side until just golden. Lift onto a plate, then repeat with the remaining batter to make four pancakes in total.","Meanwhile, heat a second large non-stick pan over a medium heat and cook the spinach, nutmeg and garlic for about 5 mins, stirring with a wooden spoon until the spinach has completely wilted. Remove from the heat and cool slightly, then beat in the ricotta. Spoon a quarter of the spinach filling down the centre of each pancake, then roll up into a sausage and arrange snugly in an ovenproof dish. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","To make the sauce, put the canned tomatoes, basil, bouillon and garlic in a bowl, and blitz using ahand blenderuntil completely smooth (or do this in a jug blender). Pour the sauce over the pancakes and scatter over the cheese. Bake for 30 mins until browned and bubbling at the edges. For the salad, combine the vinegar, onion and celery. Just before serving, toss the onion mixture with the rocket and tomatoes, and serve with the filled pancakes."]','2026-01-10 12:17:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6401,6401,'en','Herby warm cucumbers with lemon','Did you know that warming up cucumbers enhances their fresh flavour? To finish, all this summer side dish needs is a sprinkling of fresh dill and parsley, plus lemon','["2 tbsp olive oil","small handful of mint, chopped","2 cucumbers, cut into thin ribbons using a vegetable peeler","small handful of dill, chopped","small handful of parsley, chopped","½ lemon zested and juiced"]','["Heat the oil in a largesaucepanand cook the chopped mint for 1 min before gently stirring in the cucumber ribbons. Toss and cook for 2-3 mins more to warm them.","Remove from the heat and toss through the dill, parsley and a drizzle of the lemon juice. Tip out onto a platter, drizzle with more lemon juice, if you like, and sprinkle with the lemon zest."]','2026-01-10 12:17:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6403,6403,'en','Vegan burrito bowl','This nourishing rice bowl is topped with spicy black beans, sweetcorn, avocado and lime. It’s packed with fibre, counts as 4 of your 5-a-day and is low in saturated fat.','["250g easy-cook brown rice","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp hot chilli powder","1 tsp vegetable bouillon powder (gluten-free, if needed)","400g black beans, drained","4 tomatoes, chopped","1 small red onion, finely chopped, about 75g","20g fresh coriander, chopped","2 limes, juiced","2 avocados","2 x 198g cans sweetcorn"]','["Tip the rice and 600ml water into a pan, then stir in the tomato purée, cumin, chilli and bouillon powder. Cover and cook over a low heat for 20 mins until the rice is tender, and it has absorbed the liquid. Remove from the heat and stir in the black beans.","Meanwhile, mix the tomatoes with the red onion, coriander and the juice of 1 lime to make a salsa. Roughly mash the remaining lime juice with the avocados to create a chunky texture.","Spoon the rice into four bowls or rigid containers (cool the half you are saving for another day first). Top with the tomato salsa, avocado and corn.The rice will keep for up to two days – just make the toppings fresh on the day."]','2026-01-10 12:17:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6405,6405,'en','Olive, cauliflower & harissa pasta','Harissa adds colour and warmth to this vegan midweek pasta dish, with fried cauliflower, green olives and parsley. Add more harissa, if you like it spicy','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 small cauliflower, broken into small florets, stalks and leaves finely chopped","1 tbsp tomato purée","200g cherry tomatoes, halved","2 garlic cloves, crushed","25g pitted green olives, halved","2 tbsp rose harissa","150g dairy-free wholemeal pasta of your choice (such as pappardelle; gluten-free if needed)","small handful of parsley, finely chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a largefrying panover a medium-high heat and tip in the cauliflower florets, stalks and leaves. Season, cover and fry for 8-10 mins, shaking the pan now and then, until lightly browned and softened. Stir the tomato purée and tomatoes, cover and cook for 5 mins more until the tomatoes have burst. Add the garlic, olives and harissa, and cook for 2-3 mins until fragrant.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta following pack instructions. Drain, reserving a mugful of the water. Stir the pasta and a splash of the water into the tomato mixture. Season, scatter over the parsley and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6407,6407,'en','Air fryer roast dinner','Forget turning on the oven to cook the big Sunday meal – make the main elements in an air fryer. Use a microwave to heat the gravy rather than on the hob','["2-3 medium potatoes, peeled and cut into quarters","3 tsp vegetable, olive or rapeseed oil","1 large or 2 small chicken breasts, skin-on","3 medium carrots, peeled and cut into batons","100g frozen peas","gravy, to serve"]','["Soak the potatoes in water for 30 mins, then drain and rinse. Heat theair fryerfor 2 mins. Dry the potatoes thoroughly, then put in a bowl, drizzle over 1 tsp of the oil and season with salt and pepper. Using your hands or a spoon, coat the potatoes in the oil, then put into the air fryer basket, in one layer if possible. Cook for 10 mins at 190C.","Meanwhile, coat the chicken in another 1 tsp oil and season with salt and freshly ground black pepper. Once the potatoes have been in for 10 mins, move them to the sides and lay the chicken in the centre of the basket. Cook for 10 mins.","Coat the carrots in the remaining oil. After the chicken has cooked for 10 mins, remove it from the basket and add the carrots, mixed in with the potatoes, then move both to the sides and put the chicken back into the centre. Cook for 10-15 mins, still at 190C. At this point, the chicken should be cooked – check by inserting a knife into the thickest part and checking the juices run clear. Alternatively, ameat thermometershould read 70C. If it’s not quite done, cook for a further 5 mins. Remove the chicken and rest it under a piece of tented foil.","Put the peas in a small ovenproof dish or mug with 2 tbsp water and cover with foil to prevent any moisture escaping. Put in the air fryer basket where the chicken was and cook for a final 10 mins at 190C. The potatoes should be golden and crisp, the carrots tender and the peas warmed through. Slice the chicken breast and serve with the vegetables and gravy."]','2026-01-10 12:17:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6409,6409,'en','Vegan paella','Achieve four of your 5-a-day with this vegan paella – it makes a satisfying yet low-calorie supper. We’ve included broad beans, a valuable source of plant protein','["2 generous pinches of saffron","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions (320g), finely chopped","2 red peppers, deseeded and diced","3 garlic cloves, finely grated","2 tbsp soft thyme leaves","200g brown basmati rice","2 tsp smoked paprika","320g frozen broad beans","320g courgettes, halved and sliced","15g flat-leaf parsley, chopped","1 lemon, cut into wedges"]','["Put the kettle on to boil. Tip the saffron, tomato purée and bouillon powder into a large heatproof bowl, then pour over 1 litre boiling water and set aside.","Heat the oil in a largepaella panor frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onion for 5 mins, stirring often until starting to soften. Add the peppers, garlic and thyme, and cook for a few minutes more. Tip in the rice and paprika, and continue to cook, stirring for about a minute. Pour in the saffron stock, then cover and simmer for 10 mins.","Uncover and gently stir, then add the frozen beans and courgettes. Return to a simmer, then cover and cook for another 10 mins until the rice is tender and has absorbed the stock. Leave to stand for 5 mins, then stir in the parsley. Serve half the paella straightaway with lemon wedges for squeezing over.The other half will keep chilled for up to three days. To enjoy on another day, reheat in themicrowaveuntil piping hot throughout."]','2026-01-10 12:17:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6411,6411,'en','Creamy greens pot pie','Enjoy this healthy and low calorie vegetarian pie for an easy family dinner. It’s filled with butterbeans, kale, leeks and peas and topped with filo pastry','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 leeks, halved and finely chopped","300g kale or cabbage or a mixture, shredded","400g can butter beans, drained and rinsed","200g frozen peas","200ml low-fat vegetable stock","3 tbsp low-fat crème fraîche","3 tbsp fresh pesto (check the label to ensure it’s vegetarian if needed)","1 lemon, zested and juiced","250g filo pastry sheets","1 tsp nigella seeds (optional)"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a shallow, round flameproofcasserole dishor ovenproof pan (ours was 23 cm) over a medium heat. Add the leeks and cook for 5 mins, stirring, until starting to soften. Add the kale or cabbage and cook for another 5 mins until wilted.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C/gas 6. Tip in the butter beans, peas, stock, crème fraîche, pesto and the lemon juice and zest. Stir to combine, simmer for 3 mins and season well. Scrunch up the filo sheets and put them on top of the pie filling, brush over the remaining oil and sprinkle with nigella seeds, if using. Bake for 25-30 mins until golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:17:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6413,6413,'en','Chicken saag','Create a low-fat version of chicken saag. This dish is not only full of flavour, but packs in three of your 5-a-day and can be frozen too for busy days','["2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 onion (200g), finely chopped","10g ginger, peeled and finely chopped","2 large garlic cloves, finely chopped","½ tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp garam masala","½ tsp ground turmeric","2 skinless chicken breast fillets (300g), trimmed of any fat and cut into pieces","2 tomatoes, chopped","1 tbsp tomato purée","160g baby spinach, chopped","3 tbsp bio yogurt","120g brown basmati rice","¼ tsp ground turmeric","3 cardamom pods, crushed and seeds removed"]','["Put the rice, turmeric and cardamom seeds in a pan with a pinch of salt and enough water to generously cover the rice. Put the lid on and simmer for 20 mins. Turn off the heat and set aside.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large pan over a low-medium heat and tip in the onion, ginger and garlic. Cover and cook for 5 mins until starting to brown. Stir well, then add the spices and continue to cook briefly until toasted and fragrant.","Tip in the chicken and stir-fry for a few minutes. Add the chopped tomatoes, tomato purée and spinach. Cook, stirring for 5 mins until the spinach has wilted.At this stage, you can remove the curry from the heat, cool completely and freeze for up to three months. Defrost fully before reheating. Stir in the yogurt, then heat through for 1 min. Drain the rice, if required, and serve with the chicken."]','2026-01-10 12:17:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6415,6415,'en','Waldorf salad chicory bites','Pair these Waldorf salad chicory bites with a glass of fizz for a garden party. Quick nibbles like these will go down well and are super-simple to prep','["2 heads of chicory (we used red)","1 green apple, cored and finely chopped","1 celery stick, finely chopped","small handful of walnuts, roughly chopped","6 red grapes, finely chopped","2 tbsp natural yogurt","½ lemon, juiced","1 tsp Dijon mustard","50g crumbly blue cheese or vegetarian alternative"]','["Trim the root off each head of chicory and pull apart the individual leaves (you should get 16-20 leaves). Lay the leaves out on a large serving platter (see tip below).","Combine the apple pieces, celery, walnuts, grapes, yogurt, lemon juice and mustard in a bowl, and season well. Spoon a little of the filling into each of the chicory leaves towards the root end, leaving the leafy end to act as a handle. Crumble over the blue cheese and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6417,6417,'en','Gremolata','Elevate your cooking with gremolata, a mixture of herbs, citrus zest, garlic and olive oil. It adds freshness and depth to meat, fish and roasted veg dishes','["30g flat-leaf parsley, leaves and stalks","2 garlic cloves, peeled","2 unwaxed lemons, zested and ½ lemon, juiced","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil"]','["Finely chopthe parsley, grate the garlic finely, then mix together with the lemon zest and juice in a small bowl. Stir in the oil. This will feel like quite a dry mixture compared to a pesto or a dressing, but more oil can be added if you prefer a looser consistency. To serve, sprinkle the gremolata over cooked meat or vegetables."]','2026-01-10 12:17:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6419,6419,'en','Leftover turkey grain bowls with za’atar, rainbow slaw & harissa yogurt','Make the most of your turkey leftovers and make these grain bowls with rainbow slaw and a tahini dressing. They’re easy and full of flavour','["4 tbsp natural probiotic yogurt","1 tbsp rose harissa","200g cooked wild rice","200g cooked puy or black lentils","2 tbsp chopped mixed herbs (we used a mix of mint, parsley and coriander)","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp za’atar","200g leftover roast turkey (you can use a mix of white and dark meat)","1 avocado, stoned, halved, peeled and sliced","2 tbsp toasted pumpkin seeds","1 tsp maple syrup","large pinch of white pepper","2 tbsp tahini","1⁄2 tsp ground turmeric","1 clementine, juiced","1 lemon, juiced","2 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, grated","1 tsp grated ginger","1⁄2 tsp cayenne pepper","1⁄4 small red cabbage, finely sliced","4 carrots, julienned or grated","100g Brussels sprouts, finely sliced","1 parsnip, peeled and julienned or grated","1 apple, peeled, cored and julienned or grated","1⁄2 red onion, finely sliced","1 green chilli, finely sliced"]','["Combine the yogurt and harissa, and set aside. To make the dressing, tip the maple syrup, white pepper, a large pinch of salt, the tahini, turmeric, clementine juice, half the lemon juice, the oil, 2 tbsp hot water, the garlic, ginger and cayenne into a smallfood processorand blitz until combined and creamy. Taste and adjust the seasoning with a little more lemon or salt, as needed.","Toss all the slaw ingredients together in a large bowl. Season well, then drizzle with most of the dressing and toss again to coat. In another large bowl, combine the cooked rice, lentils and the herbs. Dress with the remaining lemon lemon juice, the olive oil and some seasoning. Scatter the za’atar over the leftover turkey. Divide the grain mixture between four serving bowls, and arrange the seasoned turkey, sliced avocado and slaw on top. Scatter over the pumpkin seeds and finish with a dollop of the harissa yogurt. Serve the remaining dressing on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:17:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6421,6421,'en','Lamb meatballs & green tahini tabbouleh','Combine grains and beetroot with lamb meatballs and a tahini dressing to make this quick and easy supper, which is full of textures and flavours','["2 tbsp tahini","2 tbsp fat-free yogurt","½ small bunch of parsley","1 lemon, juiced","½ small garlic clove","½ tbsp rapeseed oil","10-12 ready-made lamb meatballs","2 x 250g pouches mixed grains","4 cooked beetroots, chopped","2 spring onions, sliced","200g baby tomatoes, halved","50g pitted black olives, halved","1 cucumber, peeled and cubed","½ tbsp za’atar"]','["Blend the tahini, yogurt, parsley, lemon juice, garlic, 2-3 tbsp water and a pinch of salt in a food processor until smooth. Set aside.","Heat the oil in anon-stick frying panand cook the meatballs over a medium heat for 10-12 mins until cooked through, turning regularly.","Warm the grains following pack instructions. Leave to cool a little, then toss with the remaining ingredients. Season. Divide between four plates, top with the meatballs and drizzle over the tahini dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:17:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6423,6423,'en','Healthy meatball & noodle soup','Warm up on cold evenings with this one-pan, aromatic broth with pork meatballs and noodles. We’ve taken inspiration from Vietnamese pho flavours','["1 batch of meatballs (see recipe in ''Goes well with''))","1 tbsp vegetable oil","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely grated","8 spring onions, finely sliced","2 star anise","1 cinnamon stick","2 lemongrass sticks, tough outer leaves removed and finely sliced","1-2 green chillies (seeds removed if you prefer less heat), finely sliced","small bunch of coriander, leaves and stalks separated, both finely chopped","1 tbsp light brown soft sugar","1¼ litres beef stock","1-2 tsp fish sauce","1 tsp soy sauce, plus extra to serve","2 handfuls of ready-to-eat beansprouts","3 rice noodle nests","1 lime, cut into wedges"]','["Prepare the meatballs (see recipe in ''Goes well with''), then heat the oil in a largesaucepanover a medium heat. Fry the meatballs in batches, turning every 1-2 mins until browned all over. Remove the pan from the heat, transfer the meatballs to a plate and set aside.","Put the ginger, three-quarters of the spring onions, the star anise, cinnamon, lemongrass, half of the green chilli, the coriander stalks, sugar and beef stock in the pan, and bring to the boil over a medium heat. Reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 35 mins until the lemongrass has become tender and the flavours have infused.","Add the meatballs and simmer for 10-12 mins until cooked through, then add the fish sauce to taste, along with the soy sauce and freshly ground black pepper. Add the beansprouts, turn up the heat to medium-high, and cook for another 3 mins.","Meanwhile, cook the noodles following pack instructions. Drain well and divide between four bowls. Top with the meatballs and broth, removing the cinnamon and star anise. Scatter over the remaining spring onions, chilli and coriander leaves, and serve with lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:17:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6424,6424,'en','Rogan josh','This lamb curry’s a popular restaurant classic that’s really easy to make at home','[]','[]','2026-01-10 12:17:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6425,6425,'en','Chiu Chow smacked cucumber','Enjoy this spicy smacked cucumber with steak, if you like, or as an appetiser. ‘Smacking’ the cucumber allows the marinade to be absorbed into the flesh','["1 cucumber","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","2 tsp caster sugar","1 tbsp Lee Kum Kee Premium Light Soy Sauce","2 tsp Lee Kum Kee Seasoned Rice Vinegar","1-2 tsp Lee Kum Kee Chiu Chow Chilli Oil, plus extra to serve (optional)"]','["Put the cucumber on achopping boardand lightly bash it along the length using a rolling pin, or by using your fist to push down on the flat blade of a cleaver – you want to break the flesh a little but not turn it to a pulp. Cut the cucumber in half and scoop out the seeds, then cut the flesh into bite-sized pieces. Sprinkle over about ½ tsp sea salt (you can do this on the chopping board), leave for 10 mins, then rinse well in cold water and drain.","Mix the garlic, sugar, Premium Light Soy Sauce and Seasoned Rice Vinegar with the Chiu Chow Chilli Oil in a serving bowl. Add the cucumber and leave to marinade for 10 mins. Serve with more of the chilli oil on the side, if you like, for those who prefer more spice."]','2026-01-10 12:17:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6427,6427,'en','Sesame & spring onion stir-fried udon with crispy tofu','Do something different for dinner, with our vegan noodle, tofu, green bean and spring onion stir-fry. It’s quick and healthy, plus it’s budget-friendly too','["400g block firm tofu","1 tbsp cornflour","½ -1 tsp chilli flakes, to taste","¼-½ tsp Szechuan peppercorns, ground, to taste","1 tbsp vegetable oil","bunch of spring onions, trimmed and cut into lengths","200g green beans, trimmed and cut into lengths","400g ready-to-use thick udon noodles","½ tbsp sesame oil","2 tsp sesame seeds, plus a pinch to serve","1 tbsp low-salt soy sauce, plus extra to serve","1 tbsp rice vinegar"]','["Drain and pat the tofu dry with kitchen paper.Cutinto cubes, wrap in more kitchen paper, and place a heavy board over the top. Leave to drain for 15 mins.","Mix the cornflour, chilli flakes and ground peppercorns together in a bowl with a pinch of salt, then add the drained tofu. Toss well to coat.","Heat half the vegetable oil in a largenon-stick frying panover a high heat, and fry the tofu pieces for 5-6 mins until golden all over. Scoop out of the pan, and leave to drain on kitchen paper.","Add the remaining oil to the pan and stir-fry the spring onions and beans for 3-4 mins until tender and lightly golden. Pour a kettle of boiling water over the noodles in a sieve to loosen. Drain well, then tip into the pan. Fry for a few minutes until piping hot. Add the sesame oil and sesame seeds, and sizzle for a few seconds. Splash in the soy sauce, rice vinegar, then add the tofu. Toss well, then serve in bowls with a pinch of sesame seeds on top and more soy sauce on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:17:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6429,6429,'en','Mackerel with date, aubergine & preserved lemon relish','Enjoy mackerel fillets with a delicious date, aubergine and preserved lemon relish for a taste of Morocco. Serve with rice, couscous or bulgur wheat','["½  tbsp cumin seeds","½  tbsp coriander seeds","8 mackerel fillets","½  lemon, juiced","2 aubergines (about 550g)","2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for frying","1 small onion, finely chopped","2 plum tomatoes, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","2 tsp ground cumin","½  tsp ground ginger","1 tbsp runny honey","1 preserved lemon, plus 4 tsp juice from the jar","8 dates, stoned and finely chopped","8 mint sprigs, leaves torn","couscous or bulgur wheat and coriander sprigs, to serve (optional)"]','["First, make the relish. Cut the stalks off the aubergines, then cut the flesh into 1cm cubes. Heat 1½ tbsp of the oil in a large frying pan and fry the aubergine in batches over a medium heat for 8-10 mins, or until softened and golden. You may need to add more oil. Transfer to a plate and set aside.","Add another ½ tbsp oil to the pan and fry the onion until softened and golden, about 10 mins. Tip in the tomato and cook for another 10 mins, or until collapsed, then add the garlic, chilli, cumin and ginger, and cook for 2 mins more. Return the aubergine to the pan, add the honey, the juice from the jar of preserved lemons and the dates. Season. Turn the heat down and simmer for about 10 mins, or until thick but not stiff – add a splash of water if you need to. Chop the preserved lemon – pulp as well as skin – discarding any seeds, then add half to the relish. Taste to see if you need more – it should be assertive, sweet and savoury. You may want more honey as well. Leave to cool, then stir in the mint.","Toast the cumin and coriander seeds in a dry frying pan over a low heat until the seeds start to crackle and jump in the pan. Transfer to a pestle and mortar and crush to a coarse mixture. Add salt and pepper.","Rub olive oil all over the mackerel fillets, then sprinkle them with the spice mix. Heat a frying pan or griddle pan and, when it’s very hot, add the fish fillets, skin-side down. Cook for 2-3 mins. Turn them and cook for 2 mins more. Squeeze lemon juice all over the fillets and serve them with the relish. Serve with bulgur wheat or couscous and coriander, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6431,6431,'en','Prawn & harissa spaghetti','Try our spaghetti dinner for two, with king prawns and harissa dressing. It only takes 20 minutes to make and is healthy too – great for a midweek meal, or a special occasion like Valentine’s Day','["100g long-stem broccoli, cut into thirds","180g dried spaghetti","2 tbsp olive oil","1 large garlic clove, lightly bashed","150g cherry tomatoes, halved","150g raw king prawns","1 heaped tbsp rose harissa paste","1 lemon, finely zested"]','["Bring a pan of lightly salted water to the boil. Add the broccoli and boil for 1 min 30 secs, or until tender. Drain and set aside. Cook the pasta following pack instructions, then drain, reserving a ladleful of cooking water.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan, add the garlic clove and fry over a low heat for 2 mins. Remove with a slotted spoon and discard, leaving the flavoured oil.","Add the tomatoes to the pan and fry over a medium heat for 5 mins, or until beginning to soften and turn juicy. Stir through the prawns and cook for 2 mins, or until turning pink. Add the harissa and lemon zest, stirring to coat.","Toss the cooked spaghetti and pasta water through the prawns and harissa, season to taste and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6433,6433,'en','Parmesan pork with tomato & olive spaghetti','This healthy, balanced dinner is ready in under 45 minutes and is packed with lean protein, fibre, calcium, vitamin C, iron and three of your 5-a-day','["300g lean pork fillet, cut into 6 equal slices","3 tsp rapeseed oil","3 tsp finely chopped fresh sage","4 garlic cloves, finely grated","15g very finely grated parmesan","1 large carrot (215g), chopped","3 celery sticks (165g), chopped","6 Kalamata olives, thinly sliced","2 tbsp tomato purée","1½  tsp vegetable bouillon powder","150g wholemeal spaghetti","100g cherry tomatoes, halved","large handful chopped parsley (about 10g)"]','["Put the pork in a bowl with 1 tsp oil, 1 tsp sage, 1 garlic clove and lots of black pepper. Mix well, put on a tray and scatter with the cheese.","Heat the remaining 2 tsp oil in a pan and fry the carrot, celery and remaining garlic and sage for 5 mins, stirring frequently. Add the olives, tomato purée, bouillon and 200ml water, cover and cook for 5-8 mins or until the veg is tender.","Meanwhile, cook the spaghetti following pack instructions and heat the grill. Grill the pork for 6 mins, then leave to rest. Drain the spaghetti, reserving a little water, and toss into the veg with the tomatoes and parsley. Add the water to loosen, then serve with the pork."]','2026-01-10 12:17:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6435,6435,'en','Staffordshire oatcakes with mushrooms','Cook savoury pancakes for breakfast using porridge oats. The recipe is vegan and healthy, too, providing folate, fibre, iron and two of your 5-a-day','["85g porridge oats","85g plain wholemeal flour","½  tsp dried yeast","4 tsp rapeseed oil","320g button mushrooms, sliced","4 tomatoes, each cut into 8 wedges","4 tbsp milled seeds with flax and chia","4 tbsp tahini","a few coriander sprigs, chopped"]','["For the oatcakes, tip the oats and 350ml water into a bowl and blitz with a stick blender until smooth. Stir in the flour and yeast, cover and leave in the fridge overnight, or leave at room temperature for 2-3 hrs until bubbles appear.","Use kitchen paper to rub ½ tsp oil round a non-stick frying pan, then heat. Ladle in a quarter of the batter and swirl the pan to cover the base. Cook for 2 mins, then turn and cook for 2 mins more until golden. Make four oatcakes in the same way. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, chill two for another day. Will keep, covered in the fridge, for two days.","To make the topping for two oatcakes, heat 2 tsp oil in a non-stick pan, add 160g mushrooms and fry for 2-3 mins, stirring until softened. Stir in 2 tomatoes, then add 2 tbsp ground seeds and cook for 2 mins more. Reheat the oatcakes in a dry frying pan or the microwave if necessary, then spread each one with 1 tbsp tahini, the mushroom mixture and scatter with a little coriander before serving. On the second day, repeat step 3 with the remaining ingredients."]','2026-01-10 12:17:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6437,6437,'en','Caponata bake','This healthy, comforting veggie bake is topped with cheesy potato slices and packs in all 5 of your 5-a-day, along with calcium, vitamin C, iron and fibre','["700g medium potatoes (about 6), thinly sliced","4 tbsp milk","85g mature cheddar, finely grated","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions (320g), finely chopped","4 tsp balsamic vinegar","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","2 aubergines, cut into chunks","2 red peppers (540g), deseeded and chopped","30g pack basil, leaves picked and finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely grated","10 Kalamata olives, pitted and halved","2 tsp capers","⅓ x 30g pack flat-leaf parsley, chopped","320g broccoli florets"]','["Heat the grill to high. Boil the potato slices for 10 mins, then drain, tip into a bowl (don’t worry if they break up a little) and add the milk and half the cheese. Mix together.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large frying pan and cook the onion until softened. Spoon in the balsamic vinegar and bouillon powder, then stir in the tomatoes, aubergine, peppers, basil and garlic. Cover and cook for 20 mins, stirring frequently and adding a little water if necessary, until the aubergine is tender when tested with a knife.","Remove from the heat and stir in the olives, capers and parsley. Tip into two shallow baking dishes. Cover with the potatoes and sprinkle with the remaining cheese.","If you are following our Healthy Diet Plan, grill the one you are eating now until golden. While it’s grilling, steam or boil half the broccoli to serve with the bake. To reheat on the second day, heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and bake for 30-40 mins until bubbling and golden. Cook the remaining broccoli to serve with it."]','2026-01-10 12:17:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6439,6439,'en','Baked falafel & cauliflower tabbouleh, green tahini sauce & charred spring onions','Forget soggy sandwiches for lunch and try these easy falafels, served with delicious cauliflower tabbouleh, tahini sauce and charred spring onions','["400g can chickpeas, drained (or 85g dried chickpeas soaked in 500ml cold water overnight, then drained)","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","¼ tsp cayenne pepper","½ small red onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","1 tbsp sesame seeds","½ tsp baking powder (gluten free if you like)","small bunch parsley, stalks and leaves separated, leaves chopped","1 tbsp olive oil, plus 1 tsp","½ small cauliflower, cut into florets","½ small bunch mint, leaves chopped","1 lemon, juiced","6 spring onions, kept whole, topped and tailed","handful rocket","½ small bunch coriander, stalks and all","2 tbsp tahini"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Tip the chickpeas, ½ tsp ground cumin, ½ tsp ground coriander, cayenne pepper, red onion, 1 garlic clove, sesame seeds, baking powder, parsley stalks and ½ tbsp water into a food processor. Blitz until everything is combined but not mushy – you want the falafel to have some texture, rather than being like hummus. Season to taste, then roll into 18 even-sized balls. Flatten each ball into a disc shape and put them on the baking sheet (the more surface area the crisper they will become). Brush them with ½ tbsp oil. Bake for 20 mins, turning halfway, until golden and crisp.","Meanwhile, clean out the food processor. Briefly pulse the cauliflower until you have a ‘couscous’ consistency. Mix the cauliflower with the remaining ground spices, ½ tbsp olive oil and seasoning. Tip onto a baking tray and roast for 10–12 mins, stirring occasionally, until slightly toasted. Once cool, mix through the chopped parsley, mint and half the lemon juice. Season to taste.","Heat the grill to high (this can be done the night before, if you like). Brush the spring onions with 1 tsp oil, season, then grill until soft and charred for around 5 mins, turning halfway.","Meanwhile, blitz the rocket, coriander, remaining garlic, lemon juice and 1 tbsp water together in a food processor until bright green. Put the tahini in a bowl, then gradually whisk in the herby water until the tahini loosens to a sauce consistency. Season to taste.","Divide the green tahini and spring onions between the baked falafel and tabbouleh in bowls."]','2026-01-10 12:17:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6441,6441,'en','Baked falafel & cauliflower tabbouleh','Make a batch of our easy baked falafel for a tasty, low-calorie lunch option. This simple healthy recipe is perfect for pairing with plenty of salad','["3 x 400g cans chickpeas, drained (or 250g dried chickpeas, soaked in 1 litre cold water overnight, then drained)","3 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp cayenne pepper","1 red onion, quartered","3 garlic cloves","2 tbsp sesame seeds","1 ½  tsp baking powder (gluten-free, if you like)","2 small packs parsley, stalks and leaves separated, leaves chopped","4 tbsp olive oil","1 cauliflower, cut into large florets","1 small pack mint, leaves chopped and stalks discarded","1 lemon, juiced"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line two baking sheets with baking parchment. Tip the chickpeas, 2 tsp of the ground cumin, 1 tsp of the ground coriander, the cayenne pepper, onion, garlic, sesame seeds, baking powder, parsley stalks and 1 tbsp water into a food processor. Blitz until combined but not smooth (you want the falafel to have some texture, rather than being the consistency of hummus). Season to taste, then roll into 18 evenly sized balls. Flatten each ball into a disc shape and arrange on the baking sheets, then brush the tops with 1 tbsp of the oil. Bake for 20 mins until golden and crisp, turning halfway through cooking.","Meanwhile, clean out the food processor, then tip in the cauliflower and briefly pulse until it resembles couscous. Mix the cauliflower couscous with the remaining ground spices and olive oil, then add some seasoning. Tip onto a roasting tray and roast for 10-12 mins until lightly toasted, stirring occasionally.","Remove from the oven and leave to cool, then mix through the parsley leaves, mint leaves and lemon juice. Season to taste. Will keep for three days in the fridge. Serve the baked falafel with the cauliflower tabbouleh and some salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6443,6443,'en','Vegan Bolognese','Try our hearty vegan Bolognese for a quick and healthy meal for two. Our simple pasta dish packs in four of your five-a-day and it’s even low fat','["180g spaghetti","2 x portions vegan ragu (see ''Goes well with'' for recipe)","handful fresh basil leaves"]','["Cook the spaghetti in a large pan of salted water for 1 min less than pack instructions. Reheat the ragu. Drain the pasta, reserving a ladleful of water, then toss the spaghetti in the sauce, using a little liquid to loosen the ragu slightly. Serve topped with fresh basil and some black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:17:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6445,6445,'en','Chocolate chia pudding','Make a tasty, healthy chocolate pudding in just five minutes. It''s low-calorie and vegan, too, and the chia seeds are a great source of omega-3 fatty acids','["60g chia seeds","400ml unsweetened almond milk or hazelnut milk","3 tbsp cacao powder","2 tbsp maple syrup","½  tsp vanilla extract","cacao nibs, mixed","frozen berries, to serve"]','["Put all the ingredients in a large bowl with a generous pinch of sea salt and whisk to combine. Cover with cling film then leave to thicken in the fridge for at least 4 hours, or overnight.","Spoon the pudding into four glasses, then top with the frozen berries and cacao nibs."]','2026-01-10 12:17:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6447,6447,'en','Chicken katsu curry','This healthier katsu is coated in finely chopped flaked almonds and baked in the oven (rather than fried) until crisp and golden. If you''re following theHealthy Diet Planthen this a great dish to add to your repertoire','["25g flaked almonds","1 tsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","2 boneless, skinless chicken breasts (about 300g/11oz total)","lime wedges, for squeezing over","2 tsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","1 medium onion, roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and finely chopped","2 tsp medium curry powder","1 star anise","¼ tsp ground turmeric","1 tbsp plain wholemeal flour","100g long-grain brown rice","2 spring onions, finely sliced (include the green part)","1 medium carrot, peeled into long strips with a vegetable peeler","? cucumber, peeled into long strips with a vegetable peeler","1 small red chilli, finely chopped (deseeded if you don''t like it too hot)","juice ½  lime","small handful mint leaves","small handful coriander leaves"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Cook the brown rice in plenty of boiling water for 35 mins or until very tender.","Crush the almonds using a pestle and mortar, or blitz in a food processor until finely chopped, then sprinkle over a plate. Grease a small baking tray with a little of the oil. Brush the chicken on both sides with the remaining oil and season well. Coat the chicken with the nuts and place on the tray. Press any remaining nuts from the plate onto each breast. Bake for 20 mins or until browned and cooked through. Rest for 4-5 mins on the tray, then slice thickly.","Meanwhile, make the sauce. Heat the oil in a medium non-stick saucepan and add the onion, garlic and ginger. Loosely cover the pan and fry gently for 8 mins or until softened and lightly browned, stirring occasionally. Remove the lid for the final 2 mins, and don’t let the garlic burn.","Stir in the curry powder, star anise, turmeric and a good grinding of black pepper. Cook for a few secs more, stirring. Sprinkle over the flour and stir well. Gradually add 400ml water to the pan, stirring constantly.","Bring the sauce to a simmer and cook for 10 mins, stirring occasionally. If it begins to splutter, cover loosely with a lid. Remove the pan from the heat and blitz the sauce with a stick blender until very smooth. Adjust the seasoning to taste. Keep warm.","Once the rice is tender, add the spring onions and cook for 1 min more. Drain well, then leave to stand for a few mins while you make the salad. Toss the carrot and cucumber with the chilli, lime juice and herbs.","Divide the sliced chicken between two plates, pour over the sauce and serve with the rice, salad and lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:17:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6449,6449,'en','Beetroot, feta & asparagus salad','Tom Kime’s colourful salad is a great vegetarian option for summer entertaining','["a large handful of fresh oregano or marjoram leaves","1 garlic clove","juice of 1½ lemons","4 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","250g bunch asparagus, cut into 3cm/1¼in lengths","2 x 250g packs boiled fresh beetroot, cut into quarters","zest of 1 lemon","2 spring onions, finely sliced","85g bag watercress, large stalks removed","10 green and 10 purple basil leaves (or 20 of one colour)","400g feta or goat''s cheese"]','["The day before: make the dressing. Put the oregano or marjoram, a\r\npinch of salt and the garlic into a food processor and\r\npulse to a paste. Add the lemon juice and whizz until\r\nsmooth. Stir in the olive oil and season – it should be\r\nsharp and a bit salty.Cover and chill.","Two hours before serving: bring a pan of salted water to the boil, add the\r\nasparagus and cook for 3 minutes. Drain and cool\r\nunder the cold tap. Cover and keep cool.","Put the beetroot in a large bowl and toss with twothirds\r\nof the dressing. Add the lemon zest and spring\r\nonions, cover and keep at cool room temperature with\r\nthe remaining dressing.","To serve: add the watercress to the beetroot and tear in the basil.\r\nToss in the asparagus and season with freshly ground\r\nblack pepper. Taste before adding salt as the cheese is\r\nquite salty.Mix lightly, so you don’t dye everything pink,\r\nthen pile into a serving dish. Crumble over the cheese\r\nand pour the remaining dressing on top."]','2026-01-10 12:17:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6451,6451,'en','The ultimate makeover: Prawn cocktail','Try a lighter, modern version of this ever-popular retro starter','["650g prawns in their shells, cooked (to give 200g/8oz cooked, peeled prawns)","2 tbsp lime juice","100g/4oz cucumber","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","1 tbsp snipped dill","1 small ripe avocado","50g watercress","pinch cayenne pepper, for sprinkling","2 tbsp mayonnaise","5 tbsp fromage frais","1½ tbsp tomato ketchup","splash Tabasco sauce","splash Worcestershire sauce","1 tsp brandy"]','["Peel the prawns. Rinse them in a\r\nlarge sieve under a cold tap, then pat\r\ndry with kitchen paper. Lay the prawns\r\nin a shallow dish and squeeze over\r\n1 tbsp of the lime juice, then add\r\na twist of pepper. Set aside.","Chop the cucumber into small dice\r\nand tip into a dish. Spoon over the\r\nvinegar, scatter over the dill and a\r\ngrating of pepper, then set aside.\r\nHalve, stone and peel the avocado,\r\nthen chop into small dice. Spoon over\r\nthe rest of the lime juice and toss\r\ntogether gently with a twist of pepper.","For the sauce, mix together the\r\nmayonnaise, fromage frais and ketchup.\r\nStir in the Tabasco, Worcestershire and\r\nbrandy with a twist of pepper.","To serve, put a small spoonful of the\r\nsauce into the bottom of each cocktail\r\nglass. Very coarsely chop most of the\r\nwatercress, leaving a few sprigs whole.\r\nLay the chopped watercress on top of\r\nthe sauce. Drain the cucumber well, then\r\nspoon it over the watercress with the\r\navocado. Pile over the prawns, then\r\nspoon over the rest of the sauce. Tuck\r\nin the sprigs of watercress and serve\r\nwith a sprinkling of cayenne."]','2026-01-10 12:17:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6453,6453,'en','Spicy fish stew','Perfect with some crusty bread, this simple healthy stew will soon become a favourite – make it with chicken if you prefer','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp ground cumin","½  tsp paprika","200g can chopped tomatoes","1 red pepper, deseeded, cut into chunks","450g white fish fillets, cut into chunks","handful coriander, roughly chopped","1 lemon, cut into wedges"]','["Heat oil in a saucepan. Tip in the garlic, cumin and paprika and cook for 1 min. Add 100ml water and the tomatoes. Bring to the boil, then turn down the heat. Add the pepper, simmer for 5 mins. Add the fish, simmer for 5 mins. Serve with coriander and a wedge of lemon."]','2026-01-10 12:17:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6455,6455,'en','Stir-fried beef with hoisin sauce','Quick, easy to make and healthy','["1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp dry sherry","2 tsp sesame oil","1 fat garlic clove, crushed","1 tsp finely chopped fresh root ginger (or fresh ginger paste in a jar)","200g lean sirloin steaks, thinly sliced across the grain","1 tbsp sesame seeds","1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 large carrot, cut into matchsticks","100g mangetout, halved lengthways","140g mushrooms, sliced","3 tbsp hoisin sauce","Chinese noodles, to serve"]','["Mix together the soy\r\nsauce, sherry, sesame oil,\r\ngarlic\r\nand ginger in a shallow dish.\r\nAdd the steak and leave to\r\nmarinate for about 20\r\nminutes (or longer, if you\r\nhave time).","Heat a large heavy-based\r\nfrying pan or wok, add the\r\nsesame seeds and toast\r\nover a high heat, stirring,\r\nfor a few minutes until\r\ngolden. Tip on to a plate.","When ready to cook,\r\nheat the sunflower oil in a\r\nlarge frying pan or wok\r\nuntil hot. Add the steak with\r\nthe marinade and stir fry\r\nfor 3-4 minutes over a high\r\nheat until lightly browned.\r\nRemove, using a slotted\r\nspoon, on to a plate, leaving\r\nthe juices in the pan.","Toss the carrots in the pan\r\nand stir fry for a few\r\nminutes, then add the\r\nmangetout and cook for a\r\nfurther 2 minutes.","Return the steak to the\r\npan, add the mushrooms\r\nand toss everything\r\ntogether. Add the hoisin\r\nsauce and stir fry for a final\r\nminute. Sprinkle with the toasted sesame seeds and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:17:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6457,6457,'en','Trout with creamy potato salad','Try serving fish with a fresh-tasting potato salad instead of plain boiled spuds','["250g waxy potatoes, such as Charlotte, peeled if you like and halved","4 tsp natural yogurt","4 tsp mayonnaise","1 lemon, ½ zested","1 tbsp small capers, rinsed","4 small gherkins or cornichons, sliced","2 spring onions, finely sliced","¼ cucumber, diced","2 trout fillets"]','["Boil the potatoes in salted water\r\nfor 15 mins until just tender. Drain and\r\nrinse under cold water to cool, then\r\ndrain again. Heat the grill.","Meanwhile, mix together the yogurt\r\nand mayonnaise, then season with a\r\ngood squeeze of lemon. Gently stir into\r\nthe potatoes with the capers, gherkins,\r\nmost of the spring onion and cucumber.","Season the trout, then grill on a\r\nbaking sheet, skin-side down, for\r\n3-4 mins depending on thickness,\r\nuntil just cooked. Scatter with lemon\r\nzest and serve with the potato salad,\r\nscattered with remaining spring onions.\r\nCut the remaining lemon half into\r\nwedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:17:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6459,6459,'en','Thai-style steamed fish','Serve with Thai jasmine rice for a flavour-packed low-fat meal','["2 trout fillets, each weighing about 140g/5oz","a small knob of fresh root ginger, peeled and chopped","1 small garlic clove, chopped","1 small red chilli (not bird''s eye), seeded and finely chopped","grated zest and juice of 1 lime","3 baby pak choi, each quartered lengthways","2 tbsp soy sauce"]','["Nestle the fish fillets side\r\nby side on a large square of foil\r\nand scatter the ginger, garlic,\r\nchilli and lime zest over them.\r\nDrizzle the lime juice on top and\r\nthen scatter the pieces of pak choi\r\naround and on top of the fish.\r\nPour the soy sauce over\r\nthe pak choi and loosely seal the\r\nfoil to make a package, making\r\nsure you leave space at\r\nthe top for the steam to circulate\r\nas the fish cooks.","Steam for 15 minutes. (If you haven’t got a steamer, put the\r\nparcel on a heatproof plate over a\r\npan of gently simmering water,\r\ncover with a lid and steam.)"]','2026-01-10 12:17:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6461,6461,'en','Spicy falafels','Cheap and dead easy to make – stuff them into pittas with salad, or serve with couscous and hummus','["2 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","1 small onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","400g can chickpeas, washed and drained","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander (or use more cumin)","handful parsley, chopped, or 1 tsp dried mixed herbs","1 egg, beaten"]','["Heat 1 tbsp oil in a large pan, then fry the \r\nonion and garlic over a low heat for 5 mins \r\nuntil softened. Tip into a large mixing bowl \r\nwith the chickpeas and spices, then mash \r\ntogether with a fork or potato masher until \r\nthe chickpeas are totally broken down. Stir \r\nin the parsley or dried herbs, with seasoning \r\nto taste. Add the egg, then squish the \r\nmixture together with your hands.","Mould the mix into 6 balls, then flatten into \r\npatties. Heat the remaining oil in the pan, \r\nthen fry the falafels on a medium heat for \r\n3 mins on each side, until golden brown and \r\nfirm. Serve hot or cold with couscous, pitta \r\nbread or salad."]','2026-01-10 12:17:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6463,6463,'en','Greek island salad with chicken & avocado','Jill Dupleix’s colourful and summery avocado salad is perfect for a casual buffet','["1.8kg roasted chicken, at room temperature","2 hearts romaine lettuces","4 tomatoes","3 spring onions","2 ripe avocados","3 tbsp lemon juice, plus extra for squeezing","200g packet feta cheese","½ tsp dried oregano","½ tsp dried mint","half a bunch of flatleaf parsley","5 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","2 tbsp black kalamata olives","pitta bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Pull the meat from the chicken\r\nand shred it roughly. Trim the base\r\nfrom each lettuce, wash and dry the\r\nleaves, then roughly shred them.\r\nCut the tomatoes into wedges.\r\nFinely slice the spring onions (using\r\nboth white and green parts). Cut\r\nthe avocados in half lengthways,\r\nremove the stones and\r\npeel. Cut crosswise into slices,\r\nand squeeze with lemon juice.\r\nCrumble the feta cheese with your\r\nfingers and toss it with the dried\r\noregano and mint. Pick the leaves\r\noff the parsley and set aside.","Whisk the 3 tbsp of lemon juice\r\nwith the olive oil, sea salt and pepper.\r\nIn a large bowl, toss the chicken,\r\nlettuce, tomatoes and spring onion,\r\nthen fold through three quarters of\r\nthe dressing with the avocados\r\n(carefully, so the avocados don’t\r\nbreak up). Season with salt and\r\npepper, then scatter over the feta,\r\nolives and parsley, and drizzle with\r\nthe rest of the dressing. Squeeze\r\nextra lemon juice on top, and serve\r\nwith pitta bread if you wish."]','2026-01-10 12:17:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6465,6465,'en','Pan-fried sea bass with citrus-dressed broccoli','A restaurant-quality fish supper, ready in just half an hour','["2 sea bass fillets, about 140g each (see tips, below)","1 small head of broccoli","1 orange","6 tbsp olive oil","4 tbsp small capers","6 anchovies, roughly chopped","1 lemon"]','["Before you start cooking, get\r\neverything prepared. Trim each sea\r\nbass fillet so they are both the same\r\nshape, then score the skin, cutting into the\r\nflesh slightly, 5 or 6 times at about 1cm\r\nintervals. Set aside.","Segment the orange – slice off the\r\ntop and bottom, then cut away the\r\nskin and pith. Cut away each segment,\r\nthen squeeze out the juice from the rest of\r\nthe orange into a bowl. Cut the broccoli into\r\nmedium-size florets.","To make the warm broccoli salad,\r\ncook the florets in a pan of boiling\r\nsalted water for 1 min until just\r\ncooked. While the broccoli is cooking, put a\r\nfrying pan on to heat. As soon as the broccoli\r\nis cooked, drain it, then tip straight into the\r\nhot frying pan to ‘scorch’ out all the moisture.","Turn off the heat, then scatter the\r\norange segments over the broccoli.\r\nToss for a few moments just to heat\r\nthrough, then tip into a bowl and dress with\r\nthe orange juice and 2 tbsp olive oil. Season\r\nwith pepper and a small sprinkling of sea\r\nsalt, then set aside.","Wipe out the pan. Season the fish with a little salt and\r\npepper just before cooking.\r\nHeat the frying pan until\r\nvery hot, then add 2 tbsp oil. Lay the\r\nfish fillets in the pan, skin-side down.\r\nAs soon as it goes in, press each\r\nfillet down with your fingers or a fish\r\nslice to stop it from curling up.","Reduce the heat to medium, then\r\nleave the fish to cook for 3-4 mins,\r\nundisturbed, until you can see that\r\nthe flesh has cooked two-thirds\r\nof the way up and the skin is crisp\r\nand brown.","Flip the fillets over, then fry on the\r\nflesh side for about 2 mins until just\r\ndone, basting the skin with the oil in\r\nthe pan as it cooks. Leave to rest on a warm\r\nplate, skin-side up, and baste with the\r\nhot oil and juices from the pan.","Pour 2 tbsp olive oil into the pan and\r\nplace it back on a high heat. Scatter in\r\nthe capers and anchovies, then cook\r\nuntil they start to crisp. Grate over the lemon\r\nzest and squeeze in the juice of ½ the lemon.\r\nIf there isn’t enough juices in the pan to\r\ndrizzle over both plates, add a splash more\r\noil. You are now ready to plate up."]','2026-01-10 12:17:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6467,6467,'en','Minted courgette salad','A fresh and fragrant salad complements a Mediterranean antipasti spread for relaxed summer eating','["½ red onion, thinly sliced","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 courgettes","large handful mint leaves","2 tbsp olive oil"]','["Mix the onion and lemon juice together\r\nwith some seasoning and set aside for\r\n10 mins. When ready to serve, use a\r\nvegetable peeler to slice the courgettes\r\ninto thin ribbons. Put into a bowl with the\r\nonion and lemon juice, zest, mint and oil.\r\nCarefully toss together and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6469,6469,'en','Protein porridge','Increase the protein in your breakfast by adding protein-rich toppings to your porridge. It’s ideal after a workout','["80g porridge oats","500ml milk (any kind)","30g protein powder (vanilla, chocolate or berry work well)","4 tbsp Greek-style yogurt","2 tbsp pumpkin, chia, flax or sunflower seeds","2 tbsp nut or seed butter","100g frozen or fresh fruit (like berries, bananas or sliced apples)","honey or other syrup, to serve"]','["Cook the oats and milk in a pan over a medium-low heat for 4-6 mins, stirring continuously until thickened and creamy. Remove from the heat and sift in the protein powder. Add a splash more milk or water to loosen, if you prefer a thinner porridge.","Divide between bowls and top with any toppings of your choice."]','2026-01-10 12:17:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6471,6471,'en','Protein bars','Make your own homemade protein bars for a post-workout boost. They’re made with protein powder, bananas, nut butter and a blend of seeds','["150g porridge oats","2 small bananas (about 160g), peeled and mashed","100ml maple syrup","200g almond, peanut or sunflower butter","90g vanilla protein powder","50g mixed seeds , plus 1 tbsp for the topping","1 tbsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp milk , any kind (optional)","50g dark chocolate , melted"]','["Put the oats in a blender and blitz until they resemble flour. Add the mashed banana, maple syrup, nut butter, protein powder, the mixed seeds and vanilla extract. Blend again to make a thick dough, adding the milk, if needed, to bring it together.","Press the dough into a 20cm square tin lined with baking parchment, ensuring it''s in an even layer. Drizzle over the melted chocolate and scatter over the extra 1 tbsp mixed seeds and a pinch of sea salt flakes. Chill for 1 hr before cutting into bars. Will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:17:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6473,6473,'en','Baked cod with tomatoes, capers & basil','Enjoy white fish once a week for a low-fat, high-protein meal. It also provides vitamins that support the heart, brain and bones','["200g baby new potatoes (about 12)","3 tsp rapeseed oil","½ tsp dried oregano","2 garlic cloves , finely grated","400g can chopped tomatos","1 tbsp capers","15g basil , chopped","1 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","320g cod fillets , chunky and skinless","180g fine green beans"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the potatoes with 1 tsp of the oil, the oregano and plenty of ground black pepper then scatter into a baking dish and bake for 20 mins.","Meanwhile heat the remaining oil in a pan and briefly fry the garlic, stirring to make sure it doesn’t burn. Tip in the tomatoes, capers, chopped basil and bouillon then allow to bubble over a medium heat until it becomes a thick sauce – about 5 mins.","Remove the potatoes from the oven and push to one end of the dish. Tip the sauce into the other end and top with the cod then return to the oven for 15 mins until the cod flakes when tested, but is still moist.","While the fish is baking boil the green beans for 7 mins until tender. Pile the beans on to 2 plates to make a stack then spoon the sauce and cod on top. Add the potatoes and serve scattered with the whole basil leaves to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6475,6475,'en','Sticky tempeh stir-fry','Rustle up this vegan stir-fry which uses tempeh, a great source of protein made from soy beans. Quick and easy, it takes just 30 minutes to make','["2-3 tbsp vegetable oil","200g tempeh , torn into chunks","1 red onion , finely sliced","3 garlic cloves , roughly chopped","1 stick of lemongrass , chopped into thirds (optional)","2cm piece of ginger , peeled and roughly chopped","1 red chilli , roughly chopped (deseeded if you prefer)","100g mange tout , sliced at an angle","100g long-stem broccoli , chopped","2 tbsp low-sodium soy sauce","1½ tbsp brown sugar","15g coriander , roughly chopped","200g pouch cooked brown rice"]','["Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in awokor large frying pan over a high heat. Once shimmering, fry the tempeh for 3-4 mins until golden and charred at the edges. Remove from the pan and drain on kitchen paper.","Add a drizzle of oil to the pan if it’s dry, then fry the onion for 3-4 mins, stirring continuously. Once softened, add the garlic, lemongrass (if using), ginger and chilli. Cook for 3 mins, stirring frequently until fragrant.","Toss through the mange tout and broccoli, then pour 50ml water into the pan to create steam. Cook for 3-4 mins. Add the soy sauce and brown sugar. Return the tempeh to the pan and toss to combine, cooking 2-3 mins more until everything is tender and sticky. Stir in half the coriander.","Cook the rice following pack instructions, then divide between two bowls. Top with the stir-fry and remaining coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:17:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6477,6477,'en','Harissa vegetables with quinoa','Combine protein-rich quinoa with root veg to enjoy all five of your 5-a-day. The added fermented coconut yogurt will have gut bacteria benefits, too','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 red onions (160g), chopped","1 green pepper , deseeded and cubed","1 small sweet potato (200g), peeled and cut into chunks","2 large celery sticks (125g), cut into chunky slices","10g ginger , finely chopped","300ml vegetable stock made with 2 tsp vegan bouillon powder","1 tbsp harissa paste","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 dried apricots , quartered","10g coriander or parsley, chopped, plus a few extra leaves to serve","250g pack cooked red and white quinoa","4 tbsp coconut yogurt"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick pan and fry the vegetables and ginger for 10 mins, stirring frequently, until softened and starting to colour.","Stir in the stock, harissa, tomato purée and apricots. Bring to the boil, cover and simmer for 15 mins. Stir in the coriander.","Meanwhile, heat the quinoa following pack instructions. Serve with the veg and yogurt, plus a scattering of coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:17:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6479,6479,'en','Protein balls','Make tasty protein balls using oats, protein powder, flaxseed and cinnamon to enjoy post-exercise and replenish your protein stores.','["150g porridge oats","50g protein powder of your choice (we used vanilla whey)","1 tbsp ground flaxseeds","pinch of ground cinnamon","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp maple syrup","150g nut butter of your choice (we used peanut)","4 tbsp plant milk","25g chocolate chips or raisins (optional)"]','["Combine the oats, protein powder, flaxseed and cinnamon in a large bowl. Stir in the maple syrup, vanilla extract, nut butter, milk and chocolate chips.","Stir well to combine the mixture, then, using damp hands, roll it into 15 balls (they should be about 30g each). Arrange on a plate and chill for 30 mins until firm, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6481,6481,'en','Chicken pakoras','Make a batch of these crispy golden pakoras as a snack, or part of an Indian meal. Serve hot with sweet chilli sauce or green chutney','["700g boneless chicken, cut into bite-sized pieces","2 tbsp cornflour","50g rice flour","40g gram flour, sieved","3 dried chillies, crushed or 3 green chillies, finely chopped","½ tsp chilli powder","½ tsp curry powder","½ tsp ground coriander","½ tsp cumin","2 small onions, chopped","small bunch of coriander, finely chopped","vegetable oil, for deep-frying","sweet chilli sauce or green chutney, to serve"]','["Put the chicken in a large bowl, then use your hands to coat the pieces in the cornflour. Mix in the rice flour, followed by the gram flour. Add the chillies, spices, onion, coriander and 1 tsp salt. Mix well with your hands.","Gradually add around 150ml water until the ingredients have become moist and ever-so-slightly wet. You may not need all the water (adding too much will stop the pakora mixture binding).","Fill a deep pan no more than a third full with vegetable oil and heat to 180C. Squeeze a small amount of the pakora mixture together before carefully lowering into the hot oil with a spoon. Fry for 8-10 mins, turning regularly, until cooked through and browned all over. Set aside on a plate lined with kitchen paper while you repeat with the remaining mixture, frying in small batches. Serve hot with a sweet chilli sauce or green chutney."]','2026-01-10 12:17:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6483,6483,'en','Smoked brisket','Fire up the smoker for this flavourful slow-cooked brisket. Serve on a board with charred greens and salsa rossa so everyone can help themselves','["2.5kg piece beef brisket","1 tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp red chilli flakes","1 tsp black whole peppercorns","1 tsp fennel seeds","1 tsp dried thyme","2 tsp demerara sugar","2 tsp caster sugar","1 tsp paprika","1 tsp onion powder","1 tsp garlic powder","1 tsp mustard powder","1 tsp salt"]','["Gently toast the cumin, chilli flakes, peppercorns, fennel seeds and thyme in a pan over a low heat until aromatic. Grind to a fine dust with the demerara sugar using a spice blender orpestle and mortar. Tip into a bowl and mix in the remaining rub ingredients.","Season the brisket generously with the rub and leave to stand at room temperature for up to an hour. Prepare the smoker for indirect cooking at 120-130C. Once ready, place the seasoned brisket on the smoker, fat-side up. Leave for 10 hrs or until the outside is a dark, mahogany colour. Top up the smoker as needed.","Remove the brisket and wrap in butcher paper. Return to the smoker and continue to cook for 2-3 hrs until the meat reaches 93-94C when probed with a thermometer. Allow to rest for 40 mins before slicing and serving with charred greens and salsa rossa."]','2026-01-10 12:17:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6485,6485,'en','One-pan English breakfast','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis combines all the best ingredients of a traditional English breakfast in one frying pan, with no need to chop anything','["4 good-quality pork chipolata","4 rashers smoked back bacon","140g button mushroom","6 eggs, beaten","8 cherry tomatoes, halved","handful grated cheese (optional)","1 tbsp snipped chives"]','["Heat the grill to high. Heat a medium non-stick frying pan, add the chipolatas and fry for 3 mins. Add the bacon, turning occasionally, until it starts to crisp, about 5 mins more. Tip in the mushrooms and continue to cook for a further 3-5 mins. Drain any excess fat and move the ingredients so they are evenly spread out.","Season the eggs, then add to the pan, swirling to fill the spaces. Gently move with a fork for 2 mins over a low-medium heat until beginning to set. Scatter over the tomatoes, cheese, if using, and chives, then grill for 2 mins until set. Cut into wedges and serve with your favourite sauces."]','2026-01-10 12:17:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6486,6486,'en','Spiced & sweet lassis','Lassi is a refreshing non-alcoholic Indian drink, ideal to serve with any Indian dinner menu','["low fat yogurt","water","a few toasted cumin seeds","a little chopped fresh coriander","sugar, to taste","few drops of rosewater, to taste"]','["For spiced lassi, whisk equal amounts of low-fat yogurt with water using a balloon whisk to create a frothy foam, then serve sprinkled with a few toasted cumin seeds and a little chopped fresh coriander. For a sweet version, whisk the yogurt and water with a little sugar to taste and a few drops of rose water."]','2026-01-10 12:17:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6487,6487,'en','Herbed chicken skewers','A superhealthy chicken dish with a ‘no-cook’ relish','["500g tiny new potatoes - look for packets of tiny or baby new potatoes, or pick out the smallest ones you can find if they are sold loose","3 tbsp each of chopped parsley, mint and chives","6 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp lemon juice","500g skinless chicken breasts, cut into 3cm chunks","1 red onion, peeled","1 red pepper, seeded and cut into 3cm chunks","1 lemon, cut into 8 wedges","8 ripe tomatoes - vine grown tomatoes tend to have the best flavour","2 green chillies, seeded and finely chopped","2 small garlic cloves, finely chopped","4 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp white wine vinegar"]','["If using wooden or bamboo\r\nskewers soak eight in cold water\r\nfor about half an hour. Cook the\r\npotatoes in boiling salted water for\r\n10-12 minutes, until just tender,\r\ndrain and leave to cool. Mix the\r\nherbs, oil, lemon juice, salt and\r\npepper in a large bowl and add the\r\nchicken and potatoes. Mix well\r\nuntil everything is glistening. Cut\r\nthe onion into 6 wedges, then\r\nseparate the layers on each\r\nwedge. Add the onion and the\r\npepper to the marinade and mix\r\nthoroughly.","To make the relish, halve and\r\nseed the tomatoes, then chop the\r\nflesh finely. Mix the tomatoes,\r\nchillies, garlic, oil, vinegar, salt\r\nand pepper and spoon into a\r\nsmall dish.","Thread the chicken, potatoes,\r\npeppers and onion onto\r\n8 skewers, finishing each with a\r\nlemon wedge. Barbecue directly\r\nover a medium high heat for 5-6\r\nminutes on each side, until the\r\nchicken is cooked. Serve piled on\r\na serving platter with the tomato\r\nrelish."]','2026-01-10 12:17:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6489,6489,'en','Miniature omelettes with ricotta','These little omelettes – called frittatine in Italian – make a wonderful appetizer','["4 eggs","small handful flatleaf parsley, finely chopped, plus extra sprigs to serve","handful chives, finely snipped","1 small garlic clove, finely chopped","50g parmesan, freshly grated","olive oil, for frying","250g tub ricotta","handful fresh basil, torn","50g parmesan, freshly grated"]','["Beat the eggs with 2 tbsp water, then season if you want to. Mix in the parsley, chives, garlic and parmesan.","Heat a 23cm heavy-based frying pan on a medium heat with a little oil. When the oil’s hot, add a ladleful (about a third) of the egg mixture and tip the mixture so it covers the base. Reduce the heat and cook the omelette until just firm, then flip it over and cook the other side. Keep warm. Repeat to make three omelettes, adding a little extra oil to the pan each time.","Make the filling by combining the ricotta, basil, parmesan and some pepper. Spread mixture over each omelette, roll up loosely like a cigar and cut into thickish slices. Can be made up to 5 hrs ahead. Serve garnished with parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:17:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6491,6491,'en','Mexican bean chilli','The secret ingredient in this chipotle-spiced, beef chilli con carne is a storecupboard favourite – baked beans','["1 onion, diced","1 red pepper, diced","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp chilli powder","500g beef mince","415g can baked beans","150ml beef stock","1 tbsp chipotle paste","coriander leaves, rice and yogurt, to serve"]','["Fry the onion and red\r\npepper in olive oil over a medium\r\nheat for 10-15 mins or until softened.\r\nIncrease the heat, add the chilli\r\npowder and cook for a few minutes before\r\nadding the mince. Cook until\r\nbrowned and all the liquid has evaporated.","Tip in the baked beans, beef stock and chipotle paste.\r\nSimmer over a low heat for 15-20 mins.\r\nSeason, scatter with coriander leaves\r\nand serve with rice and yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:17:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6493,6493,'en','Fruit & nut yogurt','An energy-boosting breakfast pot that makes a great alternative to cereal and will keep you full until lunch','["3 tbsp chopped mixed nuts","1 tbsp sunflower seed","1 tbsp pumpkin seed","1 sliced banana","1-2 handfuls berries (frozen and defrosted is fine)","200g vanilla yogurt"]','["Mix the nuts, sunflower seeds and pumpkin seeds. Mix the sliced banana and berries. Layer up in a bowl with yoghurt and enjoy."]','2026-01-10 12:17:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6495,6495,'en','Simple seafood chowder','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA chunky, creamy soup with salmon and smoked haddock, mixed shellfish and potatoes – a hearty meal','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 large onion, chopped","100g streaky bacon, chopped","1 tbsp plain flour","600ml fish stock, made from 1 fish stock cube","225g new potatoes, halved","pinch mace","pinch cayenne pepper","300ml milk","320g pack fish pie mix (salmon, haddock and smoked haddock)","4 tbsp single cream","250g pack cooked mixed shellfish","small bunch parsley, chopped","crusty bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan over\r\na medium heat, then add the onion and\r\nbacon. Cook for 8-10 mins until the onion\r\nis soft and the bacon is cooked. Stir in\r\nthe flour, then cook for a further 2 mins.","Pour in the fish stock and bring it up\r\nto a gentle simmer. Add the potatoes,\r\ncover, then simmer for 10-12 mins until\r\nthe potatoes are cooked through.","Add the mace, cayenne pepper and\r\nsome seasoning, then stir in the milk.","Tip the fish pie mix into the pan,\r\ngently simmer for 4 mins. Add the\r\ncream and shellfish, then simmer\r\nfor 1 min more. Check the seasoning.\r\nSprinkle with the parsley and serve\r\nwith some crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:17:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6497,6497,'en','Spiced scrambled eggs','Make a wholesome start to the morning with creamy scrambled eggs on toast, perfect for using up a stray tomato or two','["1 small chopped onion","1 chopped red chilli","knob of butter","4 beaten eggs","splash of milk","good handful diced tomatoes","coriander leaves","toast, to serve"]','["Soften the onion and chilli in a knob of butter.\r\nStir in the beaten eggs and a splash of\r\nmilk. When nearly scrambled, gently\r\nstir in a good handful diced tomatoes\r\nfollowed by some coriander leaves.\r\nSeason and eat on toast."]','2026-01-10 12:17:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6499,6499,'en','Chicken, red pepper & almond traybake','A tasty one-pan roast chicken supper with lemon, cumin, paprika, coriander and other North African flavours','["500g boneless, skinless chicken thighs","3 medium red onions, cut into thick wedges","500g small red potatoes, cut into thick slices","2 red peppers, deseeded and cut into thick slices","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 tsp each ground cumin, smoked paprika and fennel seeds, slightly crushed","3 tbsp olive oil","zest and juice 1 lemon","50g whole blanched almonds, roughly chopped","170g tub 0% Greek yogurt, to serve","small handful parsley or coriander, chopped, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Place the chicken, onions, potatoes and peppers in a large bowl and season. in another bowl, mix together the garlic, spices, oil, and lemon zest and juice. Pour this over everything and spread the mixture between 2 baking trays.","Roast for 40 mins, turning over after 20 mins, until the chicken is cooked through. Add the almonds for the final 8 mins of cooking. Serve in bowls with a big dollop of Greek yogurt and some chopped parsley or coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:17:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6501,6501,'en','Thai salmon kebabs with sweet chilli & lime dip','Always pop some salmon fillets in your shopping basket? Try this new way to transform them…','["4 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","juice 1 lime","4 x 140g/5oz skinless salmon fillet, cut into large chunks","oil, for drizzling"]','["Combine the sweet chilli sauce and lime juice in a bowl. Pour half the mixture into a bowl for serving. Thread the salmon onto 4 skewers and brush with the remaining chilli sauce. Marinate for 20 mins.","Heat a griddle pan until very hot. Shake excess marinade from the kebabs, then drizzle with oil, season and griddle for 8 mins, turning occasionally until the salmon is opaque and comes away easily from the pan. Serve hot with the dipping sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:17:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6503,6503,'en','Spicy Cajun chicken quinoa','Protein-packed quinoa makes this midweek meal a superhealthy option','["4 skinless chicken breasts, cut into bite-sized pieces","1 tbsp Cajun seasoning","100g quinoa","600ml hot chicken stock","100g dried apricots, sliced","½ x 250g pouch ready-to-use Puy lentils","1 tbsp olive oil","2 red onions, cut into thin wedges","1 bunch spring onions, chopped","small bunch coriander, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nToss the chicken with the Cajun spice\r\nand arrange in a single layer in a roasting\r\ntin. Bake for 20 mins until the chicken\r\nis cooked. Set aside.","Meanwhile, cook the quinoa in the\r\nchicken stock for 15 mins until tender,\r\nadding the apricots and lentils for the\r\nfinal 5 mins. Drain and place into a large\r\nbowl with the chicken, toss together.","While the quinoa is cooking, heat\r\nthe oil in a large frying pan and soften the\r\nonions for 10-15 mins. Toss the onions\r\ninto the quinoa with the coriander and\r\nsome seasoning, then mix well."]','2026-01-10 12:17:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6505,6505,'en','Cajun turkey steaks with pineapple salsa','Turkey is the ultimate healthy, feelgood food – low in fat but high in protein. Jazz it up with a spicy salsa','["1 red onion, finely chopped","1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 red pepper, deseeded and diced","200g basmati rice","450ml chicken stock","400g can kidney beans, rinsed and drained","4 turkey steaks","2 tsp Cajun seasoning","5oz 140g fresh pineapples (or 220g can pineapple rings, drained)","½ green chilli, finely chopped","juice 1 lime"]','["Reserve 2 tbsp of the onion for the\r\nsalsa. Heat the oil in a saucepan and\r\ncook the remaining onion and half the\r\npepper for 4 mins or until softened and\r\ncoloured. Stir in the rice, then pour in the\r\nstock. Add the kidney beans and a pinch\r\nof salt. Bring to the boil, stir once, cover\r\nthe pan, then reduce the heat to a gentle\r\nsimmer. Cook for 15 mins until the rice is\r\ntender and the liquid absorbed.","Dust the turkey steaks with the Cajun\r\nspice and griddle or fry in a non-stick pan\r\nfor about 4-6 mins on each side until\r\ncooked through. Cut the pineapple into\r\nsmall pieces and mix together with the\r\nreserved red onion, pepper, green chilli\r\nand lime juice. Spoon some salsa over\r\neach steak and serve with the rice."]','2026-01-10 12:17:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6507,6507,'en','Spring salmon with minty veg','An easy-to-prepare healthy meal which counts for two of your five-a-day','["750g small new potatoes, thickly sliced","750g frozen peas and beans (we used Waitrose pea and bean mix, £2.29/1kg)","3 tbsp olive oil","zest and juice of 1 lemon","small pack mint, leaves only","4 salmon fillets about 140g/5oz each"]','["Boil the potatoes in a large pan for 4 mins.\r\nTip in the peas and beans, bring back up\r\nto a boil, then carry on cooking for another\r\n3 mins until the potatoes and beans are\r\ntender. Whizz the olive oil, lemon zest and\r\njuice and mint in a blender to make a dressing(or finely chop the mint and whisk into the\r\noil and lemon).","Put the salmon in a microwave-proof dish,\r\nseason, then pour the dressing over. Cover\r\nwith cling film, pierce, then microwave on\r\nHigh for 4-5 mins until cooked through.\r\nDrain the veg, then mix with the hot dressing\r\nand cooking juices from the fish. Serve the\r\nfish on top of the vegetables."]','2026-01-10 12:17:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6509,6509,'en','Hearty lamb stew','A classic one-pot is the easy answer to mid-week cooking- hearty, filling, warming and packed full of veggies','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","500g cubed stewing lamb","1 onion, thickly sliced","2 carrots, thickly sliced","2 leeks, thickly sliced","400ml hot vegetable or chicken stock","1 tsp dried rosemary or 1 fresh sprig","400g cannellini beans, rinsed and drained","crusty bread or boiled potatoes to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large casserole. Tip in the lamb and cook for 5 mins until any liquid has disappeared, then add the onion, carrots and leeks. Cook for 5 mins more, stirring often, until the veg is starting to soften.","Pour over the stock, add the rosemary, cover with a lid and cook over a low heat for 1 hr. Stir in the beans and cook for 30 mins more, topping up with water if necessary, until the lamb is tender and cooked through. Serve with some crusty bread or potatoes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6511,6511,'en','Easy hummus recipe','A smooth blended chickpea dip with tahini and garlic that''s versatile and good for you, this easy hummus makes a great snack or lunch','["1 x 400g can chickpea, don''t drain","1 tbsp tahini paste","1 fat garlic clove, chopped","3 tbsp 0% fat Greek yogurt","good squeeze lemon juice"]','["Drain the chickpeas into a sieve set over a bowl or jug to catch the liquid. Tip the chickpeas, tahini, garlic and yogurt into a food processor or blender and whizz to smooth. Whizz in a tbsp of the chickpea liquid at a time until you have a nice consistency, then scrape into a bowl, stir in a squeeze of lemon juice and season to taste."]','2026-01-10 12:17:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6513,6513,'en','Courgette fritters','Use grated courgette to make a simple but delicious summery starter or light supper with just five main ingredients. Use up a glut from the garden','["250g courgettes, grated","20g plain flour","1 egg, beaten","25g finely grated parmesan, or vegetarian alternative (optional)","1 tbsp olive oil","170g tub roasted red pepper hummus, to serve"]','["Combine the grated courgette, flour, egg and parmesan in a large bowl.","Heat a non-stick frying pan over a medium heat and add the oil. Fry the fritters for 2-3 mins on each side until golden brown. Serve straight away with red pepper hummus."]','2026-01-10 12:17:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6515,6515,'en','Roast green pepper & red kidney bean chilli','Make this easy veggie chilli to serve with baked sweet potato and cooling yogurt for a big lunch or light dinner','["3 green peppers , halved","1½ tsp hot smoked paprika","3 garlic cloves , finely sliced","2 tbsp olive oil","2 medium sweet potatoes","1 red onion , finely chopped","10g coriander , leaves picked and roughly chopped, stems finely chopped","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tbsp chipotle paste","1 tbsp tomato purée","400g can red kidney beans , drained","400g can black beans , drained","400g can cherry tomatoes","4-6 tbsp Greek yogurt","1 green chilli , finely sliced"]','["Heat the oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 9. Arrange the green peppers on a roasting tray cut-side up. Season with salt and ½ tsp of the paprika, then scatter a few of the garlic slices into each pepper with a drizzle of the olive oil. Put the sweet potatoes on the same tray, then roast for 30-35 mins until the peppers are slightly charred, but still soft and juicy, and the potatoes are tender. (Depending on their size, the potatoes may need to be returned to the oven for 5-10 mins.)","Meanwhile, heat the remaining olive oil in a large saucepan over a medium heat and cook the onions with a pinch of salt for 4-5 mins. Add the remaining garlic and paprika, the chopped coriander stems, cumin, chipotle paste and tomato purée, and cook for 1-2 mins more until fragrant. Add the kidney beans, black beans, cherry tomatoes and a canful of water, then simmer for 20-25 mins until the mixture has thickened and is glossy. Season with salt. You can also add more chipotle paste and/or cumin to taste, if needed.","Serve half a sweet potato and green pepper per person. Spoon over the chilli, then top with the yogurt, coriander leaves and sliced green chilli."]','2026-01-10 12:17:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6517,6517,'en','Hummus without tahini','Enjoy our easy, budget-friendly hummus recipe with your favourite sides, such as pittas, crackers and crudités. Add more liquid from the can of chickpeas for a smoother hummus, if you like.','["400g can chickpeas, drained (liquid reserved)","½ small garlic clove, crushed, or ½ tsp garlic purée","1 tsp lemon juice","2 tbsp olive oil, plus a drizzle","pittas or vegetable crudités, to serve"]','["Tip the chickpeas, garlic, lemon juice and olive oil into a smallblenderorfood processor. Season and add 1 tbsp of the reserved liquid from the can of chickpeas.","Blitz together until smooth, adding more of the reserved chickpea liquid to make a smoother hummus, if you like. Tip the hummus into a bowl, drizzle with more olive oil and chill until ready to serve. Serve with pittas or vegetable crudités."]','2026-01-10 12:17:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6519,6519,'en','Samphire & crab salad','Enjoy this salad as a generous dinner for two, or as a light lunch or supper for four. Samphire sings when paired with crab and this zesty dressing','["2 slices of sourdough bread","1½ tbsp rapeseed oil","180g samphire","1 lemon, juiced","1 tbsp crème fraîche","1 crab, brown and white meat separated (about 60g of each)","1 tbsp chopped dill (optional)","100g watercress"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Tear the bread into rough chunks and put in a bowl with ½ tbsp rapeseed oil and a little seasoning. Toss well, then tip onto abaking tray. Bake for 8-10 mins until golden. Set aside.","Bring a large pan of water to the boil and cook the samphire for 3 mins before draining and plunging into ice-cold water. Leave to cool for a few minutes before draining.","To make the dressing, combine the lemon juice, crème fraîche, remaining 1 tbsp rapeseed oil, the brown crabmeat and dill, if using, in a small bowl. Season, mix to evenly combine and set aside.","Mix the watercress and drained samphire together in a large bowl, drizzle over the dressing and toss well to coat. Serve on a platter or divide between plates, then top with the white crabmeat and croutons."]','2026-01-10 12:17:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6521,6521,'en','Honey & mustard sausage casserole','Rustle up a comforting sausage and spinach casserole with classic honey and mustard flavours. Serve with mashed potato for a crowd-pleasing winter supper','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","8 pork or meat-free sausages","1 large onion, sliced","2 carrots, or any other root veg, roughly chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tsp mixed dried herbs","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 vegetable stock cube","1 tbsp honey","1 tbsp English mustard","1 x 260g bag of spinach","mashed potatoes, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large, lidded pan over a medium heat and fry the sausages until browned. Reduce the heat to low-medium, add the onions and carrots, and cook gently for 5 mins until soft.","Add the garlic and dried herbs, then cook for 1 min. Stir in the chopped tomatoes, stock cube, honey and mustard. Turn up the heat to medium and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 30-40 mins, stirring now and then, until the carrots are tender and the sauce has reduced a little.","Around 5 mins before serving, add the spinach, in batches if necessary. Cover and cook for 5 mins, until wilted. Season with salt and pepper, and serve with mashed potato, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6523,6523,'en','Pea & mint soup with wand dippers','Celebrate World Book Day and get inspired by children’s bookThe Worst Witch, with warming bowls of pea and mint soup served with cheesy ‘wand’ dippers','["2 tsp vegetable oil","1 onion, roughly chopped","1 large potato, chopped","1 garlic clove, finely grated or crushed","1l vegetable stock","350g pack ready-rolled puff pastry","75g cheddar, finely grated","750g frozen peas","handful of mint leaves, plus extra shredded leaves to garnish"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Heat the oil in a largesaucepanover a medium heat and fry the onion for 6-8 mins until softened. Add the potato and garlic, and cook for a couple of minutes more before pouring in the stock and simmering for 12-15 mins until the potato is just tender.","Meanwhile, unravel the pastry and cut out wand shapes by cutting slightly diagonal lines, so one end of the strip is thicker than the other. Transfer the pastry wands to a baking tray on their baking parchment, then scatter over the cheese and season with black pepper, if you like. Bake for 10-12 mins until golden.","Once the potato is just tender, tip the peas and mint into the soup mixture, and cook for 5-8 mins until the peas are defrosted and tender. Remove from the heat and blitz using ahand blender. Ladle the soup into bowls, scatter over the shredded mint leaves, then serve with the pastry wands for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:17:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6525,6525,'en','Tuscan-style ribollita','Save up stale bread and transform it into this thick, chunky, delicious stew, which is low in fat and calories, and showcases tomatoes, beans and cavolo nero.','["2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","1 onion, finely chopped","2 celery sticks, finely chopped","1 carrot, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","pinch of chilli flakes","1 rosemary sprig","400g can chopped tomatoes","500ml hot chicken or vegetable stock","400g can cannellini beans, drained and rinsed","1 parmesan rind (optional)","250g cavolo nero or kale, chopped","150g stale crusty bread torn into chunks (see tip below)","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","a few leaves of basil (optional) and grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan or flameproofcasseroleover a medium heat and fry the onion, celery and carrot with a pinch of salt for 15 mins until soft. Add the garlic and chilli flakes, and cook for 1 min.","Stir in the rosemary sprig, tomatoes, stock, beans and parmesan rind, if using, and bring to a simmer. Add the cavolo and cook, covered, for 10 mins. Stir through the bread and cook for several minutes more to warm through, then add the vinegar and season. Spoon into bowls, drizzle with a little more oil and sprinkle with the basil, if using, and the grated cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:17:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6527,6527,'en','Green soup with crispy chorizo','Blend spinach, kale and potatoes to make this vibrant green soup, topped with crispy chorizo for extra flavour','["2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra to serve","1 onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","500g potatoes, peeled and chopped","1½ litres vegetable stock","250g spinach","120g kale","50ml double cream, plus extra for drizzling","½ lemon, juiced","100g chorizo, finely chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a casserole or saucepan over a medium heat. Add the onion and a pinch of salt and fry gently for 10 mins until softened and translucent. Add the garlic and fry for 1 min. Stir through the potatoes and stock, cover and cook for 15 mins. Add the spinach and kale, and cook for a further 5-10 mins or until wilted.  Use a hand blender to blitz everything until smooth, stir in the double cream and lemon juice, and season to taste.","Heat a small frying pan over a medium heat and fry the chopped chorizo until crispy. Ladle the soup into bowls. Top with the chorizo, a drizzle of chorizo oil from the pan and a good grinding of black pepper. Finish with a drizzle of cream."]','2026-01-10 12:17:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6529,6529,'en','Marrow soup','Make marrow the star of the show in this filling soup. Made with butter beans, coconut milk and curry powder, it has a delicate spiced flavour','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 onions, roughly chopped","250g potatoes, roughly chopped","1 marrow (about 750g), peeled, deseeded and roughly chopped (see tip, below)","1-2 tbsp curry powder, to taste","500ml vegetable or chicken stock","400g can butter beans, drained","400ml can light coconut milk","small handful of coriander leaves"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the onions with a pinch of salt for 6-8 mins until soft. Add the potatoes and cook for 2 mins more, then tip in the marrow and curry powder. Cook for 1 min. Pour in the stock, butter beans and most of the coconut milk (reserve a few tablespoons). Bring the mixture to the boil, then reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer for 20 mins until all the vegetables are tender.","Remove from the heat and leave to cool slightly, then transfer the mixture to ablenderand blitz until smooth. Return the soup to the pan and warm through over a low heat, then spoon into bowls. Drizzle with the reserved coconut milk and scatter with the coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:17:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6531,6531,'en','Beetroot rosti with green yogurt & smoked salmon','Enjoy these colourful beetroot rostis with smoked salmon, poached eggs and herb yogurt. They make a fabulous weekend brunch, lunch or supper','["600g beetroot, trimmed, peeled and coarsely grated","400g potatoes, coarsely grated","2 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, finely sliced","5 large eggs","4 tbsp flour","2 tbsp butter","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","200g smoked salmon","170g Greek yogurt","½ bunch of dill, plus extra to serve","½ bunch of parsley","pinch of ground cumin","1 tbsp capers, drained and rinsed"]','["Toss the beetroot and potato with a large pinch of salt, tip into acolanderin the sink, and leave to drain for 30 mins. Transfer to a clean tea towel and squeeze out any excess liquid. Heat half the oil in a frying pan and fry the onion for 5 mins. Add the grated veg and fry for 10 mins more until just soft. Remove from the heat. Cool slightly. Combine with 1 egg and the flour, season and form into eight patties.","For the herb yogurt, tip everything into afood processorwith a pinch of sea salt, and blitz until smooth.","Heat the butter and remaining oil in a largenon-stick frying panover a medium heat, and fry the rosti for 4-5 mins on each side until crisp and cooked through. Put on a baking tray and keep warm in a low oven.","Bring a pan of lightly salted water to a simmer with the vinegar. Stir to create a whirlpool. Crack 1 egg into a cup, wait until the whirlpool has almost subsided, then tip in the egg. Poach for 2-3 mins, remove with a slotted spoon and drain on kitchen paper. Repeat with the other eggs.","Serve the rosti with the herb yogurt, poached eggs, smoked salmon and some extra dill."]','2026-01-10 12:17:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6533,6533,'en','Charred onion & whipped feta flatbreads','Top homemade flatbreads with whipped feta and charred onions for a sensational lunch or supper. Finish off with a touch of harissa, thyme and honey.','["300g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","70ml olive oil, plus extra for proving","½ tbsp extra virgin olive oil","3 brown onions, cut into chunky wedges","5 thyme sprigs, plus extra leaves to serve","2 tbsp honey, plus extra to serve","100g feta","50g thick Greek yogurt","1-2 tbsp rose harissa"]','["Combine the flour, 1 tsp salt and the yeast in a large bowl. Make a well in the centre, and tip in 150ml warm water and the olive oil. Mix until combined, then knead on a lightly floured surface for 10 mins. Tip into a lightly oiled bowl, cover and leave to rise for at least 1 hr, or until doubled in size.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the extra virgin olive oil in a frying pan over a high heat, and fry the onions for about 5 mins until beginning to char, stirring every so often. Tip the onions into a roasting tin with the thyme and honey. Roast for 15 mins until softened.","Crumble the feta into a bowl with the yogurt, thenwhiskuntil smooth and creamy.","Heat a dry frying pan over a medium heat. Divide the dough into four to six balls and roll out each into a 1cm-thick circle on a lightly floured surface. Fry, one at a time, for 2 mins on each side until cooked through and lightly charred. Top with the feta yogurt, harissa, roasted onions, a bit of extra thyme and honey, and a pinch of sea salt."]','2026-01-10 12:17:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6535,6535,'en','Cornbread tamale pie','Try this Mexican-inspired chilli with cornbread topping. It takes a little effort, but it can be frozen for days when you need a comforting supper quick','["2 tbsp sunflower or groundnut oil","900g beef mince","200g cooking chorizo, chopped","2 onions, roughly chopped","2 red peppers, halved, deseeded and sliced","2 chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, grated","1 tbsp cumin","½ tsp ground cinnamon","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can black beans, drained","500ml beef or chicken stock","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 tsp dark brown soft sugar","½ lime, juiced","10g coriander, roughly chopped","1-2 tsp buffalo hot sauce, or another hot sauce, to taste","150g cornmeal or polenta","130g plain flour","2 tbsp light brown soft sugar","3 green chillies, halved, deseeded and finely sliced","3 spring onions, trimmed and chopped","3 tbsp finely chopped coriander","155ml milk","45g butter, melted and cooled","2 large eggs, lightly beaten","100g sweetcorn","115g extra mature cheddar, grated","2 ripe avocados, stoned, peeled, halved and chopped","1 lime, juiced","15g coriander, leaves picked","soured cream or Greek yogurt"]','["Heat the oil in acasseroleover a medium-high heat and fry the beef mince until browned all over – you may need to do this in batches. Transfer the browned mince to a bowl using a slotted spoon. Add the chorizo to the pan and brown all over for a few minutes, then add to the bowl with the mince.","Add the onions and peppers to the pan and fry over a medium heat until the onions are golden and the peppers are soft, about 15 mins. Add the chillies, garlic, cumin and cinnamon, and cook for another couple of minutes.","Return the beef and chorizo to the pan, then tip in the canned tomatoes, drained black beans, stock and tomato purée. Bring to just under the boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer. Add the sugar, lime juice and some seasoning. Cover slightly, leaving just a little opening on one side for steam to escape, and cook for 50 mins, stirring occasionally. In the last 10 mins of cooking time, stir in the coriander and hot sauce, and a little more seasoning. The chilli should be thick but not dry – if it’s too dry, splash in some water. Spoon into a roughly 1.5-litre pie dish or deep baking dish. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","To make the cornbread topping, mix together the cornmeal or polenta, flour, a large pinch of salt, the sugar, chillies, spring onions and coriander. Mix the milk, butter and eggs together in a jug. Pour the wet ingredients over the dry, then add the sweetcorn and cheese. Stir until just combined, being careful not to overmix, then spoon in dollops over the surface of the chilli.At this stage, the pie can be frozen. Leave to cool completely first, then wrap in a layer of baking parchment followed by a double layer of foil. Will keep in the freezer for up to two months.","Bake for 25 mins until a skewer inserted into the cornbread (being careful not to go through to the chilli) comes out clean.To bake from frozen, heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Unwrap the pie and bake for 1 hr-1 hr 10 mins, or until the filling is piping hot and the topping is cooked through. If the top starts to get too dark, cover with foil.","When you’re almost ready to serve, put the avocado in a serving bowl, squeeze over the lime juice, then add the coriander leaves and gently toss together. Serve alongside the pie with some soured cream or Greek yogurt, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6537,6537,'en','Chinese pork one-pot','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA fast soup with an oriental twist that’ll win over friends and family','["400g pork tenderloin, cut into long thin strips","600ml chicken stock","1 tbsp soy sauce","2 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","large knob of ginger, peeled and cut into matchsticks","200g pack baby leaf green quartered","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped or 1 tsp chilli flakes","bunch spring onions, whites and greens sliced"]','["Tip all the ingredients, except the spring onion greens, into a large saucepan, put the lid on and bring to a gentle simmer. Cook, without boiling, for about 8 mins, until the pork has changed colour and the greens are cooked, but still a bit crunchy. Ladle into bowls, scatter with the spring onion and serve with boiled rice or noodles on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:17:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6539,6539,'en','Chicken gumbo','A low-fat Creole-inspired okra and green pepper stew with cayenne, paprika, cumin and thyme','["1 tbsp olive oil","500g skinless, boneless chicken thighs, cut into chunks","1 onion, chopped","1 green pepper, deseeded and chopped","3 celery sticks, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","¼ tsp cayenne pepper","1 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp dried thyme","1 bay leaf","1 heaped tbsp plain flour","400g can chopped tomatoes","400ml chicken stock","100g okra, cut into 2cm rounds","small handful sage, leaves chopped","crusty bread or microwave rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium\r\nhigh heat. Add the chicken and cook in batches\r\nfor about 5 mins to brown all over. Remove the\r\nchicken with a slotted spoon and set aside.","Add the onion, green pepper and celery to the\r\npan, put on the lid and cook for 5 mins, stirring\r\noccasionally until softened a little. Stir in the garlic,\r\nspices, thyme and bay leaf and cook for 1 min\r\nuntil fragrant. Return the chicken and any\r\njuices to the pan with the flour, stirring to coat\r\neverything. Pour in the tomatoes and stock, and\r\nbring to the boil, cook for 5 mins, then add the\r\nokra and half the sage. Turn down to a simmer,\r\nput on the lid and cook for 10 mins. Then season\r\nand serve, scattering the rest of the sage over."]','2026-01-10 12:17:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6541,6541,'en','Turkey meatball Caesar salad','Try a fresh and healthy spin on the classic salad by using lean turkey mince rolled into patties and served with a buttermilk dressing','["500g pack lean minced turkey see tip, below","1 onion, finely chopped","small pack chives snipped","125ml buttermilk","1 garlic clove, crushed","4 tbsp grated pecorino or Parmesan, plus extra to serve (optional)","2 shakes Tabasco sauce","1 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","1 small ciabatta roll, chopped or torn into chunks","squeeze lemon juice","2 Cos lettuces"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 6.\r\nIn a bowl, mix the mince, onion, half\r\nthe chives, 1 tbsp of the buttermilk, the\r\ngarlic, 2 tbsp of the Parmesan, half\r\nthe Tabasco and half the Worcestershire\r\nsauce with some seasoning. Shape into\r\nabout 20 small meatballs (lightly oiled\r\nhands will make this easier).","Arrange the turkey balls in a single layer\r\nin a roasting tin and cook for 10 mins.\r\nRemove, turn the turkey balls and arrange\r\nthe bread chunks in between. Cook for\r\na further 10 mins.","Meanwhile, tip the rest of the buttermilk\r\ninto a bowl with the remaining Parmesan,\r\nTabasco, Worcestershire sauce and the\r\nlemon juice. Season and mix. Put the\r\nlettuce on top, toss together just before\r\nserving and divide between plates. Top\r\nwith some meatballs and baked croutons,\r\nthen sprinkle with chives. Serve with\r\nextra Parmesan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:17:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6543,6543,'en','Pea, feta & summer herb frittata','Use your favourite soft herbs in this thick grilled omelette with peas, cream cheese and courgette- we like dill, mint and parsley','["300g new potatoes (such as Jersey Royals), halved if large","4 eggs and 2 egg whites","splash of milk","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp gluten-free wholegrain mustard","handful mixed soft herbs, such as dill, mint and parsley, roughly chopped","3 tbsp cream cheese","1 tbsp olive oil","1 courgette, coarsely grated","½  tsp chilli flakes","140g petits pois (defrosted if frozen)","100g feta cheese, crumbled","50g sundried tomatoes, drained and roughly chopped","100g bag salad leaves, to serve"]','["Put the potatoes in a pan of salted\r\nwater, bring to the boil, then simmer for\r\n12-15 mins or until tender. Drain, leave to\r\ncool, then thinly slice. Whisk the eggs and\r\negg whites with the milk, garlic, mustard\r\nand herbs, and season generously. Add\r\nthe cream cheese and fold through just a\r\nlittle so that some lumps remain. Heat\r\nthe grill to medium-high.","Heat the oil over a medium heat in\r\na 23cm non-stick frying pan. Add the\r\npotatoes and fry for about 5 mins,\r\nuntil they start to turn golden. Add\r\nthe courgette and chilli flakes, and\r\ncontinue to fry for a couple mins more.\r\nStir through the petit pois.","Tip the egg mixture into the pan and\r\nscatter with the feta and tomatoes.\r\nCook over a gentle heat for 10-12 mins\r\nuntil almost set. Pop the pan under\r\nthe grill and cook for 3-5 mins until\r\npuffed, golden and cooked through.\r\nCut into wedges and serve with\r\na crisp green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:17:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6545,6545,'en','Nasi goreng with sardines','We throw a fresh spin on the traditional Indonesian rice pot- this version uses oily fish combined with turmeric rice, coriander and prawns','["4 sardines, gutted","2 tbsp sunflower oil","2 eggs, beaten","6 spring onions, 4 chopped, 2 shredded","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp shrimp paste","½  tsp turmeric","2 tsp tomato purée","2 red chillies, sliced","400g cooked rice (250g uncooked)","85g small prawns","1 tbsp soy sauce, plus extra to serve (optional)","large handful coriander leaves","3 tbsp crispy shallot flakes (optional)","finely sliced cucumber, to serve"]','["Heat the grill to high and brush the\r\nsardines with a little oil. Grill for about\r\n4 mins on each side until lightly blistered\r\nand cooked through, then set aside.","Heat half the remaining oil in a wok and\r\ncook the eggs to a thin omelette. Tip onto\r\na plate to cool. Heat the rest of the oil in\r\nthe same wok. Add the chopped spring\r\nonions, the garlic, shrimp paste, turmeric,\r\ntomato purée and half the chilli. Sizzle\r\neverything together to form a paste, then\r\nadd the rice and prawns. Season with\r\nsoy sauce and stir-fry for 5 mins until\r\neverything is combined and hot.","Roll up the omelette and finely shred.\r\nFlake the fish into large boneless chunks.\r\nStir the omelette ribbons and fish into\r\nthe rice, then scatter over the shredded\r\nspring onions, remaining chilli, coriander\r\nleaves and crispy shallot flakes (if using).\r\nServe the rice with extra soy, if you like,\r\nand finely sliced cucumber on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:17:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6547,6547,'en','Spicy jerk prawn & mango tacos with coconut dressing','Use Caribbean-style jerk paste to marinade shellfish, then serve in crunchy corn tacos with a textured salad and light sauce','["300g raw peeled king prawns","1½  tbsp Jamaican jerk paste","400g can black beans, drained and rinsed","1 large mango, stoned, peeled and diced","½  red onion, sliced","½  cucumber, chopped","bunch coriander, leaves roughly chopped","8 taco shells","½  tbsp vegetable oil","2 Little Gem lettuces, shredded","165ml can coconut milk","zest and juice 1 lime","2 pinches of sugar"]','["Stir the prawns and jerk paste together\r\nin a bowl and set aside. Mix together the\r\ndressing ingredients.","Tip the beans into a bowl along with\r\nthe mango, onion, cucumber, most\r\nof the coriander, the dressing and\r\nsome seasoning. Warm the taco shells\r\nfollowing pack instructions.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan,\r\nadd the prawns and cook for 2-3 mins\r\nor until cooked through.","To build the tacos, start with a handful\r\nof lettuce, followed by the bean salad,\r\nthen top with the prawns. Sprinkle over\r\nthe remaining coriander and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:17:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6549,6549,'en','Grilled chicken with chilli & sesame seeds','Flavour grilled chicken strips with Thai chilli sauce, ginger and honey and serve with broccoli for this speedy meal for two','["2 skinless chicken breasts","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1½  tbsp sriracha chilli sauce (see tip below)","2 tsp grated ginger","2 tbsp clear honey","2 tbsp rice vinegar","240g pack Tenderstem broccoli","1 tbsp sesame seeds, toasted"]','["Slice each chicken breast lengthways\r\ninto 2 thin pieces. Rub with the oil and\r\nseason on both sides. Heat a grill pan and\r\ncook the pieces for 2-3 mins each side.","While the chicken is cooking, mix the\r\nchilli sauce, ginger, honey and vinegar\r\nwith a little seasoning in a small bowl.\r\nBrush over the chicken as it cooks – wait\r\nuntil it is grilled on one side first before\r\nbrushing, or it will burn.","Blanch the broccoli, divide between the\r\nplates and pour over the remaining sauce.\r\nTop with the chicken and sesame seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:17:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6551,6551,'en','Satay grilled aubergine','Skewers at the ready- these vegetarian kebabs are marinated in soy and turmeric and served with a rich peanut dipping sauce','["1 large aubergine, peeled and cut into 3cm cubes","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tsp ground turmeric","2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","3 tbsp crunchy peanut butter","2 tbsp hoisin sauce","2 tbsp rice wine vinegar","2 tbsp coconut milk","basmati rice, to serve","1 small cucumber, cut into 2-3cm chunks","1 small red onion, cut into half moons","small handful fresh mint leaves","small handful fresh coriander leaves"]','["Toss the aubergine with the soy\r\nsauce, oil, turmeric, 1 tbsp chilli\r\nsauce and some black pepper, then\r\nthread onto pre-soaked wooden\r\nskewers. Heat a griddle pan or frying\r\npan until medium-hot. Grill the \r\naubergines on all sides turning after\r\ngrill marks appear. They need time to\r\nsoften so keep the heat on mediumlow\r\nand cook until soft and golden.\r\nBrush with a little oil if they start to\r\nstick to the pan.","For the salad, mix together all the\r\ningredients in a small bowl, then set\r\naside. In another bowl, mix the\r\nremaining chilli sauce, peanut butter,\r\nhoisin, vinegar and coconut milk.\r\nServe the skewers with the salad,\r\npeanut sauce and some basmati rice."]','2026-01-10 12:17:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6552,6552,'en','Spicy Indian rice','Sara Buenfeld’s delicious spicy rice is perfect served with your favourite curry','["a mugful of American long grain rice","2 onions, sliced","2 tbsp sunflower oil","½ tsp turmeric","1 cinnamon stick","6 cardamom pods","1 tsp cumin seeds","large handful of sultanas and roasted cashew nuts"]','["Fry the onions in the sunflower oil\r\nin a large frying pan for 10-12\r\nminutes until golden.","Fill a roomy saucepan with water, bring to the boil and tip in a heaped teaspoon of salt - the water will bubble furiously. Add turmeric and\r\nthe cinnamon stick to the water. Pour in the rice, stir once and return to the boil, then turn the heat down a little so that the water is boiling steadily, but not vigorously.\r\nBoil uncovered, without stirring (this makes for sticky rice) for 10 minutes. Lift some out with a slotted spoon and nibble a grain or two. If they''re too crunchy, cook for another minute and taste again. They should be tender but with a little bite.\r\nDrain the rice into a large sieve and rinse by pouring over a kettle of very hot water","Stir the crushed seeds\r\nof the cardamom pods into the onions with\r\nthe cumin seeds and fry briefly.","Toss in a large handful of sultanas and\r\nroasted cashew nuts, then the hot\r\ndrained rice. This is great with curry\r\nand will also give an exotic edge to grilled meat or fish."]','2026-01-10 12:17:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6553,6553,'en','Spicy lamb & feta skewers with Greek brown rice salad','Kofta-style kebabs with feta, harissa and onion, served with a wholesome basmati rice flavoured with parsley and mint','["300g brown basmati rice","500g lamb mince","1 tbsp harissa","50g feta cheese","1 large red onion, ½ thinly sliced, ½ grated","large handful parsley, roughly chopped","large handful mint, roughly chopped","85g pitted black kalamata olives, quartered","1 cucumber, diced","300g cherry tomatoes, halved","1 tbsp olive oil","juice 1 lemon"]','["Soak 12 wooden skewers in water\r\nfor 30 mins. Cook the rice following pack\r\ninstructions, then rinse under cold water\r\nand drain thoroughly.","Heat the grill. Mix the mince with the\r\nharissa, feta, grated onion and seasoning.\r\nForm into 12 sausage shapes and thread\r\nonto the skewers. Lay on a non-stick baking\r\ntray and grill for 6-8 mins, turning until\r\ncooked through and slightly browned.","Mix the brown rice with the remaining\r\ningredients and some seasoning. Serve\r\nalongside the hot skewers."]','2026-01-10 12:17:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6555,6555,'en','Sticky lemon chicken','A quick-to-make recipe','["4 part-boned chicken breasts, skin on","grated zest and juice of 1 large lemon","1 tbsp clear honey","1 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, chopped","1 tsp dried oregano","new potato and green salad, to serve"]','["Preheat the oven to fan\r\n170C/conventional 190C/gas 5.\r\nPut the chicken breasts, skin-side\r\nup, in one layer in a shallow\r\novenproof dish or tin. Put all the\r\nremaining ingredients in a bowl\r\nand warm through in the\r\nmicrowave or a small pan for\r\n1 minute, then stir to mix everything\r\ntogether and pour over the chicken.","Slide the dish\r\ninto the oven and roast the chicken\r\nfor 30-40 minutes, basting every\r\n10 minutes or so. The juices will\r\ngradually thicken and give the\r\nchicken a shiny coating at the end.\r\nLeave the chicken to stand for\r\n5 minutes before serving with new\r\npotatoes and a green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:17:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6559,6559,'en','Peach & blue cheese salad','Try this creamy and fruity salad – perfect for lunch or a light summer supper','["½  ciabatta loaf, sliced","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp clear honey","squeeze of lemon juice","1 bag of mixed salad leaves","handful of mint leaves, torn","4 peaches, each cut into 8 pieces","140g blue cheese or Brie, cut into chunks","100g sugar snap peas, sliced in half lengthways"]','["Toast the ciabatta slices and drizzle with 1 tbsp\r\noil. Make the dressing by whisking together the\r\nremaining oil, honey and lemon juice, then\r\nseason to taste. Mix all of the other ingredients\r\ntogether in a large bowl and toss with the\r\ndressing before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:17:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6561,6561,'en','Chicken with harissa & tomatoes','Quick and easy midweek chicken supper recipe, with just a little hint of spice','["4 skinless chicken breasts","2 tsp harissa (Belazu''s rose harissa is really full-flavoured)","1 tsp olive oil","1 tsp dried oregano","250g pack cherry tomatoes","handful olives (we used kalamata)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Put the \r\nchicken into a medium roasting tray, then \r\nrub with the harissa, oil and oregano.","Cover with foil and roast for 5 mins, then remove \r\nthe foil and add the cherry tomatoes and \r\nolives to the tray. Roast for 10 mins more \r\nuntil the tomato skins start to split and the \r\nchicken is cooked through. Serve with boiled \r\nnew potatoes"]','2026-01-10 12:18:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6563,6563,'en','Lemon linguine with ham','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyTry this tasty, tangy pasta dish, a perfect summer lunch or light supper','["400g linguine","cupful frozen peas","200ml tub crème fraîche","grated zest ½ lemon and juice of 1 lemon","3-4 slices of cooked ham, cut into strips"]','["Cook pasta following pack instructions, adding\r\nthe peas for the final 2 mins of cooking.","Drain the pasta well and return to the pan. Stir\r\nin the crème fraîche, lemon zest and juice, then\r\nseason. Serve with the ham strips scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6565,6565,'en','Easy Thai prawn curry','Perfect Friday night food, a warming low fat prawn curry ready in just 20 minutes','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, chopped","1 tsp fresh root ginger","1-2 tsp Thai red curry paste (we used Sharwood''s)","400g can chopped tomatoes","50g sachet coconut cream","400g raw frozen prawns","coriander, chopped, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a medium saucepan. Tip  \r\nin the onion and ginger, then cook for a few \r\nmins until softened. Stir in the curry paste, \r\nthen cook for 1 min more. Pour over the \r\nchopped tomatoes and coconut cream.  \r\nBring to the boil, then leave to simmer for  \r\n5 mins, adding a little boiling water if the \r\nmixture gets too thick.","Tip in the prawns, then cook for 5-10 mins \r\nmore, depending on how large they are. \r\nServe alongside some plain rice and sprinkle \r\nwith a little chopped coriander, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6567,6567,'en','Teriyaki prawns & broccoli noodles','This low-fat Japanese seafood supper uses healthier soba noodles made from buckwheat','["50ml low-sodium soy sauce","50ml mirin","2 tbsp lemon juice","1½  tbsp caster sugar","200g soba noodles","140g thin-stemmed broccoli","140g cooked prawns","1 small red chilli, thinly sliced"]','["In a small saucepan, heat the soy\r\nsauce, mirin, lemon juice and sugar.\r\nSimmer for 5 mins until syrupy, then\r\nremove from the heat. Bring a large\r\nsaucepan of salted water to the boil,\r\nthen cook the noodles and broccoli\r\nfor about 3 mins, adding the prawns\r\na few secs before draining. Divide the\r\nmixture between 2 plates, pour the\r\nwarm teriyaki sauce over the top,\r\nsprinkle with the red chilli and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6569,6569,'en','Tangy trout','Try this healthy trout recipe for a light summer supper','["4 trout fillets","50g breadcrumbs","1 tbsp butter, softened","1 small bunch parsley, chopped","zest and juice of 1 lemon, plus lemon wedges to serve","25g pine nuts, toasted and half roughly chopped","1 tbsp olive oil"]','["Heat the grill to high. Lay the fillets, skin side\r\ndown, on an oiled baking tray. Mix together the\r\nbreadcrumbs, butter, parsley, lemon zest and\r\njuice, and half the pine nuts. Scatter the mixture\r\nin a thin layer over the fillets, drizzle with the oil\r\nand place under the grill for 5 mins. Sprinkle\r\nover the remaining pine nuts, then serve with\r\nthe lemon wedges and a potato salad."]','2026-01-10 12:18:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6571,6571,'en','Fresh & light chowder','There’s no need for shop-bought soup with this quick and nutritious recipe','["100g smoked haddock fillets and 100g unsmoked, skin on","500ml skimmed milk","500ml vegetable stock","2 thyme sprigs","1 tsp vegetable oil","1 onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 leek, sliced","1 large sweet potato, diced","200g can sweetcorn in water, drained","50g red lentils","small handful parsley, chopped","crusty bread, to serve"]','["Place the fish in a deep frying pan, then\r\nadd the milk, stock and thyme. Bring to\r\nthe boil and take off the heat; leave until\r\ncool enough to handle. Take out the fish\r\n(reserving the liquid), peel off the skin and\r\nflake the fish onto a plate, to use later.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large\r\nsaucepan. Gently fry the onion, garlic\r\nand leek for 8-10 mins until soft and\r\ntranslucent. Add the sweet potato,\r\nsweetcorn and lentils, then pour over\r\nthe liquid you cooked the fish in. Bring\r\nto the boil and simmer for 30 mins. Check\r\nthe seasoning and semi-blitz with a hand\r\nblender – I like to leave it quite rough.\r\nAdd the flaked fish and chopped parsley.\r\nServe piping hot with some crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:18:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6573,6573,'en','Chickpeas with tomatoes & spinach','For a great night in, whip up this warming meal, serve with a bit of naan and get comfy on the sofa','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 red onion, sliced","2 garlic cloves, chopped","½ finger length piece fresh root ginger, shredded","2 mild red chillies, thinly sliced","½  tsp turmeric","¾  tsp garam masala","1 tsp ground cumin","4 tomatoes, chopped","2 tsp tomato purée","400g can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","200g baby spinach leaves","rice or naan bread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a wok and fry the onion\r\nover a low heat until softened. Stir in the\r\ngarlic, ginger and chillies and cook for\r\na further 5 mins until the onions are\r\ngolden and the garlic slightly toasted.","Add the turmeric, garam masala and\r\ncumin, stirring over a low heat for a few\r\nsecs. Tip in the chopped tomatoes and\r\nadd the tomato purée, then simmer\r\nfor 5 mins.","Add the chickpeas to the pan with\r\n300ml water (fill the can three-quarters\r\nfull). Simmer for 10 mins before stirring\r\nin the spinach to wilt. Season and serve\r\nwith rice or naan."]','2026-01-10 12:18:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6575,6575,'en','Light chicken korma','A mild and healthy chicken korma curry that’s still satisfying and full of flavour','["small knob fresh ginger, peeled and finely sliced","1 garlic clove","1 onion, sliced","1 tbsp vegetable oil","4 skinless chicken breasts, cut into bite-size pieces","1 tsp garam masala","100ml chicken stock","3 tbsp low-fat fromage frais","2 tbsp ground almonds","handful toasted, sliced almonds, to serve","coriander leaves, plain rice, naan bread or chapatis, to serve"]','["Cook the ginger, garlic and onion in a large pan\r\nwith the oil until softened. Tip in the chicken and\r\ncook until lightly browned, about 5 mins, then\r\nadd in garam masala and cook for 1 min further.","Pour over the stock and simmer for 10 mins\r\nuntil the chicken is cooked through. Mix together\r\nthe fromage frais and ground almonds. Take the\r\npan off the heat and stir in the fromage frais\r\nmixture. Sprinkle over sliced almonds, garnish\r\nwith coriander and serve with boiled rice, chapatis\r\nor plain naan bread."]','2026-01-10 12:18:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6577,6577,'en','Japanese tofu noodle bowl','This healthy soup is full of fresh spring flavours and makes a sophisticated vegetarian meal for guests','["3 tbsp tamari or dark soy sauce","2 tbsp seasoned rice vinegar","1 tbsp mirin or 2 tsp caster sugar","200g firm tofu, drained, patted dry and cut into 8 cubes","cornflour, for coating","sunflower oil, for frying","1 bunch asparagus, base of stalks snapped off, cut diagonally into about 4 pieces","50g fresh or frozen edamame beans","50g frozen peas","small piece ginger, grated","400g pack straight-to-wok udon noodles","coriander leaves, to garnish","chilli oil, to serve"]','["Combine the tamari or soy sauce,\r\nvinegar and mirin or sugar in a shallow\r\nbowl and stir until dissolved. Place the\r\ntofu in the marinade and turn to coat.\r\nLeave to absorb the flavours for about\r\n30 mins or more. (If marinating for\r\nseveral hours, keep in the fridge.)","When ready to cook, turn the oven\r\non to warm. Scatter the cornflour over\r\na plate. Remove the tofu from the\r\nmarinade, reserving the marinade, and\r\nroll in the cornflour to coat all sides. Heat\r\na wide frying pan over a medium-high\r\nand add enough sunflower oil to cover\r\nthe base of the pan. Fry the tofu, using\r\ntongs to turn, until dark golden and crisp\r\nall over. Drain on kitchen paper, then keep\r\nwarm in the oven.","Place 1 litre of water in a medium\r\nsaucepan with the reserved marinade\r\nand bring to the boil. Add asparagus,\r\nedamame beans, peas, ginger and\r\nnoodles and return to the boil. Simmer\r\nuntil the vegetables are just tender, about\r\n3-4 mins. Divide between 4 bowls and\r\nplace 2 tofu cubes in each. Top with\r\ncoriander leaves and serve drizzled\r\nwith a little of the chilli oil."]','2026-01-10 12:18:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6579,6579,'en','One-pan Spanish fish stew','Use any sustainable white fish or salmon in this easy, flavour-packed stew – perfect with crusty bread','["handful flat-leaf parsley leaves, chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","zest and juice 1 lemon","3 tbsp olive oil, plus extra to serve","1 medium onion, finely sliced","500g floury potatoes, cut into small chunks, no larger than 2cm cubes","1 tsp paprika","pinch cayenne pepper","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 fish stock cube","200g raw peeled king prawns","½ a 410g/14oz can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","500g skinless fish fillets, cut into very large chunks"]','["In a small bowl, mix the parsley with\r\n½ the garlic and lemon zest, then set\r\naside. Heat 2 tbsp oil in a large sauté\r\npan. Throw in the onion and potatoes,\r\ncover the pan, then sweat everything\r\nfor about 5 mins until the onion has\r\nsoftened. Add the remaining oil, garlic\r\nand spices, then cook for 2 mins more.","Pour over the lemon juice and sizzle\r\nfor a moment. Add the tomatoes, ½ a\r\ncan of water and crumble in the stock.\r\nSeason with a little salt, then cover the\r\npan. Simmer everything for 15-20 mins\r\nuntil the potatoes are just cooked.","Stir through the prawns and chickpeas,\r\nthen nestle the fish chunks into the top\r\nof the stew. Reduce the heat and recover\r\nthe pan, then cook for about 8\r\nmins, stirring very gently once or twice.\r\nWhen the fish is just cooked through,\r\nremove from the heat, scatter with the\r\nparsley mix, then bring the dish to the\r\ntable with the bottle of olive oil for\r\ndrizzling over and some crusty bread,\r\nif you want."]','2026-01-10 12:18:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6581,6581,'en','Steamed salmon in the microwave','Try a Chinese New Year feast with steamed fish','["450g fillets of salmon or firm white fish, such as cod","1½ tbsp finely shredded fresh root ginger","3 tbsp finely shredded spring onions","2 tbsp light soy sauce","2 tsp dark soy sauce","1 tbsp groundnut oil","2 tsp sesame oil","handful of fresh coriander sprigs, to garnish"]','["Pat the fish dry with kitchen paper\r\nthen cut into very big pieces. Put in\r\na heatproof dish and evenly scatter\r\nwith the ginger. Wrap tightly in cling\r\nfilm. Can be prepared to here up to\r\n2-3 hours ahead, chill. Put the plate\r\nof fish into the microwave and cook\r\nfor 3-5 minutes (depending on its\r\nthickness and how you like your fish\r\ncooked) on full power.","Remove the plate of cooked fish. Wait one minute and pour off any excess liquid that may have accumulated on the plate, then scatter the spring onions on the fish, together with the light and dark soy sauces.","Heat the two oils together in a small saucepan until very hot, then pour over the top of the fish. Scatter with a handful of coriander sprigs and serve at once."]','2026-01-10 12:18:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6583,6583,'en','Prawn & egg on toast','Meet your new favourite brunch recipe: quick and easy prawn and egg mayonnaise on toast. Sprinkle with chives to finish','["3 eggs","250g peeled and cooked prawns (defrosted if frozen)","3 tbsp mayonnaise","1 lemon, juiced","4 thick slices white bread","butter, to serve","small bunch of chives, finely sliced, to serve"]','["Bring a medium pan of water to the boil, then carefully lower in the eggs and cook for 9 mins. Remove to a bowl of iced water using a slotted spoon and leave to stand for 10 mins until cold. Peel, then finely chop.","Tip the chopped egg into a bowl along with the prawns. Stir in the mayonnaise and lemon juice, then season with salt and pepper.","Toastthe bread, then butter it. Spoon over the prawn and egg mayonnaise, then sprinkle with some chives and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6585,6585,'en','Easy almond mince pie puffs','Make a Christmas staple with some homemade mince pies made with puff pastry. Serve for breakfast, or enjoy hot with vanilla ice cream for dessert','["320g sheet ready-rolled puff pastry","plain flour, for dusting","1 egg, beaten","150g mincemeat (vegetarian, if needed)","20g flaked almonds","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Unroll the pastry on a lightly floured surface, and cut in half lengthways. Cut each half into six, so you have 12 squares. Working with one square at a time, fold in half diagonally to create a triangle. Lay the triangle out with the folded edge facing you. Cut a ½cm border along the other two edges, stopping just before the two cuts intersect. Carefully unfold the pastry, then brush the borders with a little beaten egg. Lift the far left corner of the pastry and fold it over to the right, pressing it down gently against the inner right corner to seal. Repeat from the far right corner of the pastry to the inner left corner. Arrange the pastries over two baking trays lined with baking parchment, and spoon 1 tsp mincemeat into the middle of each. Top each with a few flaked almonds.Will keep chilled for up to 24 hrs.","Heat the oven to 210C/190C fan/gas 6½. Brush the pastry with more egg and bake for 15-20 mins until puffed up and golden. Dust with icing sugar and enjoy warm, or leave to cool completely.Once cooled, will keep in an airtight container at room temperature for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:18:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6587,6587,'en','Banana pancakes','Gluten-free banana pancakes you can whip up in just 10 minutes! Scatter with pecans and raspberries to enjoy a low-calorie yet indulgent breakfast','["1 large banana","2 medium eggs, beaten","pinch of baking powder (gluten-free if coeliac)","splash of vanilla extract","1 tsp oil","25g pecans, roughly chopped","125g raspberries"]','["In a bowl, mash the banana with a fork until it resembles a thick purée. Stir in the eggs, baking powder and vanilla.","Heat a large non-stick frying pan or pancake pan over a medium heat and brush with half the oil. Using half the batter, spoon two pancakes into the pan, cook for 1-2 mins each side, then tip onto a plate. Repeat the process with the remaining oil and batter. Top the pancakes with the pecans and raspberries."]','2026-01-10 12:18:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6589,6589,'en','Kale, tomato & poached egg on toast','There''s no tastier way to eat kale than smothered in a runny yolk and scattered with feta cheese. This veggie, low-calorie breakfast has it all!','["2 tsp oil","100g ready-chopped kale","1 garlic clove, crushed","½  tsp chilli flakes","2 large eggs","2 slices multigrain bread","50g cherry tomatoes, halved","15g feta, crumbled"]','["Bring a large pan of water to the boil. Heat the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat and add the kale, garlic and chilli flakes. Cook, stirring occasionally, for 4 mins until the kale begins to crisp and wilt to half its size. Set aside.","Adjust the heat so the water is at a rolling boil, then poach your eggs for 2 mins. Meanwhile, toast the bread.","Remove the poached eggs with a slotted spoon and top each piece of toast with half the kale, an egg, the cherry tomatoes and feta."]','2026-01-10 12:18:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6591,6591,'en','Ham, mushroom & spinach frittata','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyTry a filling frittata that''s low in calories and guaranteed to keep you going until lunch. Save half in the fridge overnight if you''re cooking for one','["1 tsp oil","80g chestnut mushrooms, sliced","50g ham, diced","80g bag spinach","4 medium eggs, beaten","1 tbsp grated cheddar"]','["Heat the grill to its highest setting. Heat the oil in an ovenproof frying pan over a medium-high heat. Tip in the mushrooms and fry for 2 mins until mostly softened. Stir in the ham and spinach, and cook for 1 min more until the spinach has wilted. Season well with black pepper and a pinch of salt.","Reduce the heat and pour over the eggs. Cook undisturbed for 3 mins until the eggs are mostly set. Sprinkle over the cheese and put under the grill for 2 mins. Serve hot or cold."]','2026-01-10 12:18:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6594,6594,'en','Banana yogurt pots','Ideal as a pudding, or make it for breakfast','["1 x 450g tub thick yogurt","3-4 bananas cut into chunks","4 tbsp sort dark brown sugar","25g walnuts, toasted and chopped"]','["Dollop about 1 tbsp yogurt into the bottom of 4 small glasses. Add a layer of banana, then some more yogurt. Repeat the layers until the glasses are full. Scatter over the sugar and nuts, then leave in fridge for 20 mins until sugar has dissolved."]','2026-01-10 12:18:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6596,6596,'en','Welsh rarebit muffins','Get the kids to help make these yummy muffins, perfect for lunchboxes','["225g self-raising flour","50g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","½ level tsp bicarbonate of soda","¼ tsp salt","½ level tsp mustard powder","100g strong cheese, half grated, half cubed","6 tbsp vegetable oil","150g Greek yogurt","125ml milk","1 egg","1 tbsp Worcestershire sauce"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.","Mix together the self-raising and plain flour, baking powder, bicarbonate of soda, salt and mustard powder in a bowl.","In a separate bowl, mix the cheese, oil, yogurt, milk, egg and Worcestershire sauce.","Combine all the ingredients and divide between the muffin cases in the muffin tin.","Place in the oven for 20-25 mins until golden. Remove and cool slightly on a rack.","What you need: Ask the kids to help get everything ready, weighing scales, measuring jug, fork, 2 mixing bowls, 12 paper muffin cases, muffin tin, cheese grater, sharp knife, tablespoon, cooling rack."]','2026-01-10 12:18:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6598,6598,'en','Hash browns with mustard & smoked salmon','This brilliant brunch dish is especially sensational served with poached eggs','["1 large potato (about350g/12oz), washed","1 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard or horseradish sauce","knob of butter","1 tbsp sunflower oil","4 slices smoked salmon","soured cream or crème fraîche, to serve","chives, to serve"]','["Grate the unpeeled potato onto a clean tea towel. Bring up the edges of the towel, then squeeze over the sink to remove any excess water in the potatoes. Tip into a bowl and add the flour and mustard or horseradish. Season well and mix together.","Divide the mixture into 8 balls and flatten between your hands. Heat a large frying pan with the butter and oil, then add the\r\npotatoes to the pan. Cook for 2-3 mins on each side, over a medium heat, until golden.","Stack a couple of hash browns on each serving plate and top with a slice of smoked salmon, a dollop of soured cream or crème fraîche and some chives to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6600,6600,'en','Honey nut crunch pears','This simple idea makes a quick mid-week treat for all the family','["4 ripe pears","knob of butter","½  tsp mixed spice","2 tbsp clear honey","50g cornflakes","25g toasted flaked almonds"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180/gas 6. Cut the pears in half lengthways, take out the core (see tip, left), then top with a small knob of butter and a sprinkling of the mixed spice. Sit the pears in a shallow baking dish, then roast for 5 mins until starting to soften. Meanwhile, heat the honey and another knob of butter in a large bowl in the microwave for 30 secs. Toss with the cornflakes and nuts.","Take the pears out of the oven, then top with the cornflake mix. Cook for another 5 mins or until the cornflakes take on a rich golden colour. Allow to cool for a few mins (the cornflakes crisp up again as they cool), then serve warm with ice cream."]','2026-01-10 12:18:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6602,6602,'en','Yogurt, chickpea & spinach curry','Serve this light and creamy chickpea curry with a half-quinoa, half-rice mixture for more fibre and protein. It’s healthy and low in fat and calories','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 red onion , finely chopped","1 tsp cumin seeds","2 large garlic cloves , grated","50g ginger , peeled and grated","1-2 green chillies (optional; deseeded for less heat, if you like), finely chopped","300g tomatoes , finely chopped","1 tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp ground coriander","100g natural yogurt","570g jar chickpeas in water , or 2 x 400g cans chickpeas","1 tsp dried fenugreek (optional)","320g baby spinach leaves","100g basmati rice","100g quinoa"]','["To make the quinoa rice, rinse the rice well, then put in a large pan with the quinoa and 1.5 litres boiling water. Cook for 12-14 mins, or until tender. Drain and set aside.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large saucepan over medium heat and fry the onions for 12 mins until soft and lightly browned. Stir in the cumin seeds, followed by the garlic, ginger and half the chilli, if using. Cook for 1 min, stirring continuously to prevent the garlic from burning.","Add the tomatoes, turmeric, coriander and a big pinch of salt. Cook for about 15 mins until the tomatoes have softened. Transfer the mixture to a blender. Add the yogurt and blitz until smooth, then return to the pan.","Add the chickpeas along with the liquid from the jar or cans (this helps thicken the sauce and give it a glossy finish). Bring to a simmer, cover and cook over a medium heat for 5-10 mins until the oil starts to separate on the surface.","Stir in the fenugreek (if using) and spinach and cook until wilted. Add a splash of water if needed to adjust the consistency. Season to taste, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6604,6604,'en','Chicken jalfrezi with spinach, brown rice & quinoa','Enjoy a healthy, low fat and low calorie take on a chicken jalfrezi, packed with colourful peppers and spinach and served with brown rice and quinoa','["100g brown rice","100g quinoa","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 red onion , sliced","500g chicken breast , sliced into strips","1 tsp cumin seeds","2 tsp minced garlic","2 tsp minced ginger","120g tomato purée","1 tsp turmeric","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","1 tsp garam masala","3 peppers (red, yellow and green), sliced","200g baby spinach leaves","handful of fresh coriander , to serve"]','["First, prepare the rice and quinoa. Wash and rinse the brown rice well, then tip into a pan of salted boiling water. Reduce the heat and simmer for 20 mins, then add the quinoa and cook for a further 10 mins.","While the rice is cooking, heat the oil in a large pan on a medium heat and fry the onion until it’s just turning brown. Add the chicken strips and fry until brown, then add the cumin seeds, garlic and ginger. Mix for a minute, then tip in the tomato purée, turmeric, coriander, chilli powder and a pinch of salt, then mix well.","Pour 300ml boiling water into the spiced chicken mixture and simmer until the gravy turns a rich red, about 10 mins, then stir in the garam masala, peppers and spinach. Cover and cook on medium heat for a few minutes until the spinach is wilted but the peppers still have a slight bite to them. Add a little water to adjust the consistency as desired. Drain the rice and quinoa and serve with the chicken and coriander sprinkled over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6606,6606,'en','Pancetta & white bean stew','Use up any veg in the fridge in this speedy, low calorie stew, with white beans and pancetta. Mop up the juices with crusty bread, if you like','["150g pancetta","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion , finely chopped","1 celery stick , finely chopped","1 carrot , finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , finely chopped","2 x 400g cans white beans , one drained, one left undrained (we used cannellini and butter beans)","500ml chicken stock","1 parmesan rind (optional)","200g cavolo nero , leaves roughly chopped","½ tbsp sherry vinegar","10g chives"]','["Scatter the pancetta into a deep flameproof casserole dish and cook on a medium heat for 5-6 mins until crispy and releasing its fat. Remove from the pan using a slotted spoon, leaving any fat behind. Pour in the oil, then tip in the onion, celery and carrot. Cook for 12-15 mins until turning golden. Stir in the garlic and cook for 1 min more.","Pour in the beans, chicken stock and parmesan rind (if using). Cook for 15 mins on a medium heat, then stir in the cavolo nero and cooked pancetta for a final 5 mins. Stir in the sherry vinegar and season.","Divide between four bowls and sprinkle with chives to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6608,6608,'en','Cajun prawn & charred corn salad','Take inspiration from Tex-Mex flavours with this salad, studded with king prawns, sweetcorn and jalapeño peppers. It’s ideal for a barbecue side, or a light dinner','["200g fresh sweetcorn kernels","150g raw king prawns , peeled and deveined","½ tbsp Cajun spice blend","2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 lime , juiced","1 tsp honey","1 jalapeño , finely chopped (optional)","1 red pepper , finely chopped","1 avocado , peeled, halved, stoned and finely chopped","3 spring onions , finely chopped","small handful of coriander , finely chopped","1 romaine lettuce , chopped"]','["Heat a dryfrying panover a medium-high heat and cook the sweetcorn for a few minutes without stirring, then shake the pan and continue to cook for 5 mins until the kernels have browned. Tip onto a plate and leave to cool slightly.","Combine the prawns, Cajun spice blend and a pinch each of salt and pepper in a small bowl. Heat half the oil in the same pan as used to char the corn and cook the prawns over a medium-high heat for 2-4 mins, stirring until pink and cooked through. Transfer to the plate with the corn.","Combine the lime juice, honey, remaining oil and chopped jalapeño (if using) in a large bowl, and season well. Add the red peppers, avocado, spring onions, coriander and lettuce, then toss well. Stir in the corn and prawns, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6610,6610,'en','Cod & olive tagine with brown rice','Make the most of cod in this delicately spiced, aromatic tagine that’s low in fat and calories. Like other seafood, cod is a useful source of iodine','["3 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 red onions (about 320g), chopped","250g swede, finely chopped","2 carrots (about 200g), finely chopped","3 strips of lemon peel, finely chopped","4 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp cumin seeds","2 tsp ground coriander","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","300ml vegetable stock, made with 1½ tsp bouillon powder","12 pitted green olives, halved lengthways","250g easy-cook brown rice","4 frozen skinless cod fillets (about 360g)","⅓ pack of coriander, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the onions, swede, carrots, lemon peel and garlic for 10 mins, stirring frequently. Add the spices and stir briefly.","Stir in the tomatoes, tomato purée, stock and olives. Cover and cook for 25 mins.","Boil the rice following pack instructions. Stir the tomato mixture well, then nestle in the frozen cod fillets. Cover and cook for 20 mins until the fish is cooked through. Scatter with the coriander. Serve half with half the cooked rice.Leave the rest of the tagine and rice to cool, then keep chilled for up to three days. Reheat the tagine in a pan over a low heat until piping hot, and reheat the rice in themicrowaveuntil completely heated through.This recipe is part of our free 7-day healthy diet plan. To access the full meal plan,click here."]','2026-01-10 12:18:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6612,6612,'en','Prawn tikka masala','Forget a takeaway and tuck into a midweek meal that will please the whole family with our easy, low calorie prawn tikka masala. Serve with naan breads','["1 large onion , roughly chopped","1 thumb-sized piece ginger , peeled and grated","2 large garlic cloves","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2-3 tbsp tikka curry paste","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","½ tbsp light brown soft sugar","3 cardamom pods , bashed","200g brown basmati rice","3 tbsp ground almonds","300g raw king prawns","1 tbsp double cream","½ bunch of coriander , roughly chopped","naan breads , warmed, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the onion, ginger and garlic in afood processorand blitz to a smooth paste. Heat the oil in a large flameproofcasserole dishor pan over a medium heat. Add the onion paste and fry for 8 mins or until lightly golden. Stir in the curry paste and fry for 1 min more. Add the tomatoes, tomato purée, sugar and cardamom pods. Bring to a simmer and cook, covered, for another 10 mins.","Cook the rice following pack instructions.","Scoop the cardamom out of the curry sauce and discard, then blitz with ahand blender, or in a clean food processor. Return to the pan, add the almonds and prawns, and cook for 5 mins. Season to taste and stir through the cream and coriander. Serve with the rice and naan breads, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6614,6614,'en','Sticky hoisin pork fillet with sesame greens & noodles','Enjoy sticky hoisin pork fillet with sesame greens and noodles for an easy supper on busy weeknights. It’s low in calories and fat, yet full of flavour','["4 tbsp hoisin sauce, plus extra to serve","1 pork fillet (about 400g), fat and sinew trimmed","4 egg noodle nests","3 tsp sesame oil","300g kale, spring greens or swiss chard, chopped","100g spring onions, sliced","200g frozen podded edamame beans or peas, defrosted","1 tbsp sesame seeds","2 tsp low-salt soy sauce","1 tbsp rice vinegar"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Brush the hoisin all over the pork and transfer to a foil-linedbaking tray. Roast, basting every 10 mins, for 25-30 mins until cooked through. Remove from the oven and leave to rest for 5 mins.","Meanwhile, cook the egg noodles following pack instructions, drain, then toss with 1 tsp sesame oil to stop them sticking together. Heat the remaining sesame oil in a wok or largefrying pan, and fry the greens for 4 mins, adding a splash of water to help soften the stalks. Add most of the spring onions and all the edamame beans. Fry for another 2 mins until the greens are tender, then stir in the sesame seeds, soy sauce and rice vinegar. Toss everything to coat well.","Cut the pork into thick slices and serve with the noodles, sesame greens and remaining spring onions sprinkled over the top. Serve with more hoisin sauce, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6616,6616,'en','Baked salmon fillet with pickled cranberries, parsley & pistachios','Balance out an oily fish, such as salmon, with homemade pickled cranberries. They also add a fun, Christmassy feel to the dish','["300ml cider vinegar","300g caster sugar","340g fresh cranberries","½  tsp whole cloves","½  tsp juniper berries","75g panko breadcrumbs","½  tbsp dried thyme","2 tbsp sumac","1 lemon, zested","5 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","1kg salmon fillet, pin-boned (you can ask your fishmonger to do this for you)","60g pistachios, crushed","½  small bunch of parsley, chopped, to serve"]','["Make the pickled cranberries a week or two ahead. Put the vinegar and sugar in a pan over a medium heat and bring to the boil. Stir in the remaining ingredients and continue to boil for 4 mins. Pour the mixture into a 1-litre sterilised jar, or two smaller ones, and seal well, then leave to cool. Chill in the fridge for at least a week.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toast the breadcrumbs in a dry frying pan for 2-3 mins until golden and toasted, then tip onto a plate and leave to cool.","Combine the breadcrumbs, thyme, sumac, lemon zest and some seasoning in a mixing bowl. Drizzle with the 5 tbsp olive oil and mix in thoroughly.","Lay a piece of baking parchment on a baking tray large enough to fit the salmon fillet. Put the salmon fillet skin-side down on top, and carefully spread the crust mixture over the top of the salmon. Don’t press the mixture down too much. Drizzle with a little extra olive oil.","Bake the salmon for 20-25 mins ideally until it is just cooked and the crust has turned a golden colour. Once cooked, transfer to a serving platter and garnish with the pistachios, some drained pickled cranberries and the parsley. Try serving with buttered greens and roast new potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:18:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6618,6618,'en','Buckwheat with charred baby aubergines','Make the most of buckwheat with our healthy, low-calorie veggie lunch. Aubergines, lentils, walnuts, spring onions, dried cherries and goat''s cheese pack a real flavour punch','["350g baby aubergines, halved","8 whole spring onions, tops trimmed","250g buckwheat","2 tbsp cold pressed rapeseed oil","1 x 400g can green lentils, drained","30g dried cherries, roughly chopped","8 walnut halves, finely chopped","1 lemon, juiced","½  tsp chilli flakes","small bunch dill, finely chopped","30g soft goat’s cheese, crumbled"]','["Heat the grill to its highest setting. Spread the aubergines out on a baking sheet, cut-side up, and grill for 10-15 mins until they begin to soften and blister.","Meanwhile, heat a griddle pan over a high heat. Add the spring onions and cook on each side for 5-6 mins until softened and charred. Remove with tongs and set aside.","Bring a medium-sized pan of water to the boil. Tip the buckwheat into a frying pan and dry fry over a medium heat for 3 mins until lightly toasted. Add the buckwheat to the boiling water and cook for 4-5 mins. Drain and toss with the oil. Leave to cool down for 5 mins.","Toss the warm buckwheat, lentils, cherries, walnuts, lemon juice, chilli and most of the dill in a bowl. Spread out on a serving plate and top with the aubergines, charred spring onions, remaining dill and goat’s cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:18:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6620,6620,'en','Pork & apple burgers','Our budget-friendly pork and apple burgers are perfect for an easy and delicious family supper. This easy midweek meal takes just ten minutes to prepare','["300g sausagemeat","4 wholemeal burger buns","4 tsp onion marmalade","2 apples, cored and thinly sliced","2 handfuls rocket","2 tsp mayonnaise","a little English English mustard (optional)","sweet potato wedges, to serve (optional)"]','["Divide the sausagemeat into four portions and shape into patties. Fry in a non-stick pan for 10-12 mins, flipping a couple of times, until golden on both sides and cooked all the way through.","Heat grill to high. Slice the buns in half and toast under the grill, cut-side up.","Spread the bottom halves of the toasted buns with the marmalade, then add the burgers, apple slices, rocket, mayonnaise and mustard (if using). Top with the bun lids and serve alongside sweet potato wedges, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6622,6622,'en','Pork & bulgur-stuffed peppers','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis colourful feel-good supper brings summer flavour at any time of year','["4 pepper, halved and cores removed","200g minced pork","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp paprika","50g bulghar wheat","250ml vegetable stock","½ small bunch parsley, chopped","4 tbsp 0% Greek yogurt, to serve"]','["Put the peppers, cut-side down, on a plate and microwave on High for 4 mins until cooked through (but not so soft they collapse). If they need longer, microwave for 1 min more and repeat until done.","Put the pork in a cold frying pan and turn on the heat. Fry, breaking up any lumps, until it starts to brown. Stir in the garlic and spices for 1 min, then add the bulghar and stock. Cover and simmer for 10 mins until the bulghar is soft.","Heat the grill. Stir half the parsley into the bulghar, then stuff into the peppers on a baking tray. Grill to crisp, sprinkle over most of the parsley, then serve with the yogurt mixed with remaining parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:18:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6624,6624,'en','Poached salmon with tarragon','Lightly poach salmon fillets and serve with creamy green beans and baby new potatoes for a light meal','["1 lemon","200g half-fat crème fraîche","small pack tarragon, leaves only, chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed to a paste","400g green beans, trimmed and halved","4 salmon fillets","cooked baby new potatoes, to serve"]','["Zest the lemon and cut into wedges. Mix together the crème fraîche, tarragon, garlic, lemon zest and a squeeze of juice, season to taste and set aside.","Bring a large shallow pan of salted water to the bowl and cook the green beans for 3 mins until just done. Remove with a slotted spoon, drain and cool under cold running water before tossing with the crème fraîche mixture.","Bring the pan back to the boil, then turn the heat down to a very gentle simmer and slide in the salmon pieces. Poach for 8-10 mins or until cooked to your liking. Remove from the pan and put on kitchen paper before plating up. Serve with the green beans and baby new potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:18:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6626,6626,'en','Coconut & squash dhansak','This quick and easy vegetarian curry is perfect for a healthy weeknight dinner – with butternut squash, coconut milk, lentils and spinach','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","500g butternut squash (about 1 small squash), peeled and chopped into bite-sized chunks (or buy a pack of ready-prepared to save time), see tip, below left","100g frozen chopped onions","4 heaped tbsp mild curry paste (we used korma)","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can light coconut milk","mini naan bread, to serve","400g can lentils, drained","200g bag baby spinach","150ml coconut yogurt (we used Rachel’s Organic), plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Put the squash in a bowl with a splash of water. Cover with cling film and microwave on High for 10 mins or until tender. Meanwhile, add the onions to the hot oil and cook for a few mins until soft. Add the curry paste, tomatoes and coconut milk, and simmer for 10 mins until thickened to a rich sauce.","Warm the naan breads in a low oven or in the toaster. Drain any liquid from the squash, then add to the sauce with the lentils, spinach and some seasoning. Simmer for a further 2-3 mins to wilt the spinach, then stir in the coconut yogurt. Serve with the warm naan and a dollop of extra yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:18:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6628,6628,'en','Somerset stew with cheddar & parsley mash','This family winter warmer is full of flavour and goodness. Adapt for meat lovers by adding sausages','["1 tbsp oil","1 onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 large carrot, finely chopped","1 leek, chopped","1 tbsp tomato purée","400g can chopped tomatoes","200g can butter beans, drained","400g can flageolet beans, rinsed and drained","200ml dry cider","250ml vegetable stock","few sprigs thyme, leaves only","cheddar & parsley mash (see tip below)","2 sausages","1 tsp olive oil per portion"]','["Heat oil in a large pan and fry the onion,\r\ngarlic, carrot and leek until soft but not\r\ncoloured. Add the tomato purée, chopped\r\ntomatoes, butter beans, flageolet beans,\r\ncider, stock and thyme and simmer for\r\n15-20 mins until the stew has thickened\r\nand the veg are tender.","Meanwhile, if you’re adding sausages\r\nto any portion, snip each sausage into\r\n3-4 chunks. Heat the olive oil in a frying\r\npan and brown the chunks for 5 mins,\r\nthen stir in appropriate portions of the\r\nstew and gently simmer for the remaining\r\ncooking time. Serve with the mash."]','2026-01-10 12:18:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6630,6630,'en','Chicken korma','Want a curry without too many calories? Use fat-free Greek yogurt instead of cream for a healthy korma that will give your local takeaway a run for its money','["1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","thumb-sized piece ginger, roughly chopped","4 tbsp korma paste","4 skinless, boneless chicken breasts, cut into bite-sized pieces","50g ground almonds, plus extra to serve (optional)","4 tbsp sultanas","400ml chicken stock","¼ tsp golden caster sugar","150g pot 0% fat Greek yogurt","small bunch coriander, chopped"]','["Put the onion, garlic and ginger in a\r\nfood processor and whizz to a paste.\r\nTip the paste into a large high-sided\r\nfrying pan with 3 tbsp water and cook for\r\n5 mins. Add the korma paste and cook\r\nfor a further 2 mins until aromatic.","Stir the chicken into the sauce, then\r\nadd the ground almonds, sultanas, stock\r\nand sugar. Give everything a good mix,\r\nthen cover and simmer for 10 mins or\r\nuntil the chicken is cooked through.","Remove the pan from the heat, stir\r\nin the yogurt and some seasoning, then\r\nscatter over the coriander and flaked\r\nalmonds, if using. Serve with brown\r\nor white basmati rice."]','2026-01-10 12:18:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6632,6632,'en','Mexican bean burgers with lime yogurt & salsa','These veggie burgers are a doddle to make and the toppings make them wonderfully moist – cook from frozen to save time','["2 x 400g/14oz cans kidney beans, rinsed and drained","100g breadcrumbs","2 tsp mild chilli powder","small bunch coriander, stalks and leaves chopped","1 egg","200g tub fresh salsa","150ml low-fat natural yogurt","juice ½ lime","6 wholemeal burger buns, sliced avocado, sliced red onion and salad leaves, to serve"]','["Heat grill to high. Tip the beans into\r\na large bowl, then roughly crush with a\r\npotato masher. Add the breadcrumbs,\r\nchilli powder, coriander stalks and ½ the\r\nleaves, egg and 2 tbsp salsa, season to\r\ntaste, then mix together well with a fork.","Divide the mixture into 6, then wet your\r\nhands and shape into burgers. The burgers\r\ncan now be frozen. Place on a non-stick\r\nbaking tray, then grill for 4-5 mins on each\r\nside until golden and crisp. To cook from\r\nfrozen, bake at 200C/fan 180C/gas 6\r\nfor 20-30 mins until hot through.","While the burgers are cooking, mix\r\nthe remaining coriander leaves with the\r\nyogurt, lime juice and a good grind of\r\nblack pepper. Split the buns in half and\r\nspread the bases with some of the\r\nyogurt. Top each with leaves, avocado,\r\nonion, a burger, another dollop of the\r\nlime yogurt and some salsa, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6634,6634,'en','Oven-baked fish & chips','Give this classic combination a healthy makeover by oven cooking the ingredients instead of frying','["880g/ 1lb 12 oz floury potato, scrubbed and cut into chips","2 tbsp olive oil","50g fresh breadcrumbs","zest 1 lemon","2 tbsp chopped flat-leaf parsley","4 x 140g/5oz thick sustainable white fish fillets","200g/ 7oz cherry tomato"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nPat chips dry on kitchen paper, then lay\r\nin a single layer on a large baking tray.\r\nDrizzle with half the olive oil and season\r\nwith salt. Cook for 40 mins, turning\r\nafter 20 mins, so they cook evenly.","Mix the breadcrumbs with the lemon\r\nzest and parsley, then season well. Top\r\nthe cod evenly with the breadcrumb\r\nmixture, then drizzle .0with the remaining\r\noil. Put in a roasting tin with the cherry\r\ntomatoes, then bake in the oven for the\r\nfinal 10 mins of the chips’ cooking time."]','2026-01-10 12:18:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6636,6636,'en','Rich paprika seafood bowl','Eating healthy isn’t all about salad, this fish stew counts as 3 of your 5-a-day and it’s low-fat','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, halved and thinly sliced","2 celery stalks, finely chopped","large bunch flat-leaf parsley, leaves and stalks separated","2-3 tsp paprika","200g roasted red peppers, drained weight, thickly sliced","400g can chopped tomatoes with garlic","400g white fish fillet, cut into very large chunks","few fresh mussels (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a pan, then add the onions,\r\ncelery and a little salt. Cover, then gently fry\r\nuntil soft, about 10 mins. Put the parsley\r\nstalks, half the leaves, oil and seasoning into\r\na food processor and whizz to a paste. Add\r\nthis and the paprika to the softened onions,\r\nfrying for a few mins. Tip in the peppers and\r\ntomatoes with a splash of water, then simmer\r\nfor 10 mins until the sauce has reduced.","Lay the fish and mussels on top of the\r\nsauce, put a lid on, then simmer for 5 mins\r\nuntil the fish is just flaking and the mussels\r\nhave opened – discard any that stay shut.\r\nGently stir the seafood into the sauce,\r\nseason, then serve in bowls."]','2026-01-10 12:18:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6638,6638,'en','Thai beef stir-fry','A no fuss shopping list and super-quick to prepare, the perfect after work meal','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","400g beef strips, or steak cut into thin strips","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely sliced","2 tbsp oyster sauce","handful basil leaves"]','["Heat a wok or large frying pan until smoking \r\nhot. Pour in the oil and swirl around the pan, \r\nthen tip in the beef strips and chilli. Cook, \r\nstirring all the time, until the meat is lightly \r\nbrowned, about 3 mins, then pour over \r\nthe oyster sauce. Cook until heated through \r\nand the sauce coats the meat. stir in the \r\nbasil leaves and serve with plain rice."]','2026-01-10 12:18:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6640,6640,'en','Tomato & thyme cod','Ready in 20 minutes and low fat, this fish dish is great for a Monday night when you''d rather be on the sofa than in the kitchen','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 heaped tsp light, soft brown sugar","few sprigs thyme, leaves stripped","1 tbsp soy sauce","4 cod, fillets (we like No Catch) or another white flaky fish, such as pollack"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan, add the onion, then fry for 5-8 mins until lightly browned. Stir in the tomatoes, sugar, thyme and soy, then bring to the boil.","Simmer 5 mins, then slip the cod into the sauce. Cover and gently cook for 8-10 mins until the cod flakes easily.\r\nServe with baked or steamed potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:18:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6643,6642,'en','Moroccan meatball tagine with lemon & olives','A wonderfully aromatic North African lamb casserole with a citrus tang – great for dinner parties','["3 onions, peeled","500g minced lamb","zest and juice 1 unwaxed lemon, quartered","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground cinnamon","pinch cayenne pepper","small bunch flat-leaf parsley, chopped","2 tbsp olive oil","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and grated","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","pinch saffron strands","250ml lamb stock","1 tbsp tomato purée","100g pitted black kalamata olives","small bunch coriander, chopped","couscous or fresh crusty bread, to serve"]','["Put the onions in a food processor and\r\nblitz until finely chopped. Put the lamb,\r\nlemon zest, spices, parsley and half the\r\nonions in a large bowl, and season. Using\r\nyour hands, mix until well combined,\r\nthen shape into walnut-sized balls.","Heat the oil in a large flameproof dish, or\r\ntagine with a lid, then add the remaining\r\nonions, ginger, chilli and saffron. Cook for\r\n5 mins until the onion is softened and\r\nstarting to colour. Add the lemon juice,\r\nstock, tomato purée and olives, then\r\nbring to the boil. Add the meatballs, one\r\nat a time, then reduce the heat, cover\r\nwith the lid and cook for 20 mins, turning\r\nthe meatballs a couple of times.","Remove lid, then add the coriander and\r\nlemon wedges, tucking them in between\r\nthe meatballs. Cook, uncovered, for a\r\nfurther 10 mins until the liquid has\r\nreduced and thickened slightly. Serve hot\r\nwith couscous or fresh crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:18:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6645,6645,'en','Mediterranean vegetables with lamb','A one-pot packed with veg and tender lamb that will keep the whole family satisfied','["1 tbsp olive oil","250g lean lamb fillet, trimmed of any fat and thinly sliced","140g shallots, halved","2 large courgettes, cut into chunks","½  tsp each ground cumin, paprika and ground coriander","1 red, 1 orange and 1 green pepper, cut into chunks","1 garlic clove, sliced","150ml vegetable stock","250g cherry tomatoes","handful coriander leaves, roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large, heavy-based\r\nfrying pan. Cook the lamb and shallots\r\nover a high heat for 2-3 mins until golden.\r\nAdd the courgettes and stir-fry for\r\n3-4 mins until beginning to soften.","Add the spices and toss well, then add\r\nthe peppers and garlic. Reduce the heat\r\nand cook over a moderate heat for\r\n4-5 mins until they start to soften.","Pour in the stock and stir to coat. Add\r\nthe tomatoes, season, then cover with\r\na lid and simmer for 15 mins, stirring\r\noccasionally until the veg are tender.\r\nStir through the coriander to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6647,6647,'en','Mushroom stroganoff','A few clever substitutions can make this traditional creamy casserole low in fat and calories','["2 tsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","1 tbsp paprika","2 garlic cloves, crushed","300g mixed mushrooms, chopped","150ml low-sodium beef or vegetable stock","1 tbsp Worcestershire sauce, or vegetarian alternative","3 tbsp half-fat soured cream","small bunch parsley, roughly chopped","250g pouch cooked wild rice"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying\r\npan and soften the onion for about\r\n5 mins. Add the garlic and paprika, then\r\ncook for 1 min more. Add mushrooms\r\nand cook on a high heat, stirring often,\r\nfor about 5 mins.","Pour in the stock and Worcestershire\r\nsauce. Bring to the boil, bubble for 5 mins\r\nuntil the sauce thickens, then turn off the\r\nheat and stir through the soured cream and\r\nmost of the parsley. Make sure the pan is\r\nnot on the heat or the sauce may split.","Heat rice following pack instructions,\r\nthen stir through the remaining parsley\r\nand serve with the stroganoff."]','2026-01-10 12:18:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6649,6649,'en','Salmon & broccoli cakes with watercress, avocado & tomato salad','Bump up the good-for-you factor with these vegetable-packed salmon fishcakes, served with a fresh salad','["500g potatoes, cut into chunks","85g broccoli, cut into small florets","pack of 2 poached salmon fillets","juice 1 lemon, plus wedges to serve","small bunch dill, chopped","1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","1 avocado, peeled, stoned and roughly chopped","100g cherry tomatoes, halved","100g bag watercress"]','["Cover the potatoes in salted water,\r\nbring to the boil and simmer for\r\n8-10 mins, until just tender, adding the\r\nbroccoli 3 mins before the end of cooking\r\ntime. Drain, allow it all to steam dry,\r\nthen roughly mash. Flake in the salmon,\r\nadd half the lemon juice and dill with some\r\nseasoning, then shape into 4 cakes.","Heat the oil in a pan and fry the\r\ncakes for 3 mins each side until golden.\r\nMeanwhile, mix remaining lemon juice\r\nwith the mustard and seasoning, then\r\nset aside. Mix the avocado, tomatoes\r\nand watercress and divide between\r\nplates. Serve one fish cake each with\r\nthe salad, drizzled with dressing, and\r\nextra lemon wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6651,6651,'en','Steamed fish & pak choi parcels','Just add steamed rice for a flavour-packed, low-calorie meal','["4 plaice, haddock or other MSC-certified white fish fillets","2 pak choi, thickly sliced","4 spring onions, shredded","1 red chilli, thinly sliced","3cm ginger, cut into matchsticks","2 tbsp reduced-salt soy sauce","juice 1 lime","1 tsp sesame oil"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPlace each fillet in the centre of a large\r\nsquare of foil. Top with the pak choi,\r\nspring onions, chilli and ginger, then pull\r\nup the edges of the foil.","Mix together the soy sauce, lime juice\r\nand 1 tbsp of water then spoon a little\r\nover each fillet. Crimp the top of the foil\r\nto enclose the fish and make sure there\r\nare no gaps for the steam to escape.","Place the parcels on a baking sheet\r\nand bake for 10-15 mins until the fish\r\nis cooked through (this will depend on\r\nthe thickness of your fish). Open up the\r\nparcels and drizzle over a few drops of\r\nsesame oil. Serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:18:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6653,6653,'en','Roasted red pepper soup with crispy croutons','Warm up on colder evenings with this vibrant soup, spiked with fiery chilli powder and harissa. The crispy croutons are optional but add a satisfying crunch','["2 red onions, roughly chopped","2 carrots (250g), roughly chopped","1 tsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","200g jarred roasted red peppers (drained weight), drained and roughly chopped","1 tsp rose harissa paste","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp Kashmiri chilli powder (or any other chilli powder)","850ml low-salt vegetable stock","4 tbsp natural yogurt, to serve","100g slightly stale wholemeal crusty bread, cut into cubes","1tsp olive oil"]','["Blitz the onions and carrots together in afood processoruntil finely chopped, or finely chop by hand. If making the croutons, heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 6.","Heat the oil in a large saucepan over a medium heat and cook the chopped onion and carrot with a pinch of salt for 5-6 mins, stirring frequently until starting to soften. Stir in the garlic and peppers, and cook for 1 min more until fragrant.","Add the harissa paste, cumin seeds and chilli powder, and cook for 1 min, stirring. Add the stock and turn up the heat to medium-high, bring to the boil and cook for 15-18 mins until the veg is soft.","Meanwhile, if making the croutons, toss the bread with the oil and season well. Tip onto abaking trayand bake for 8-10 mins until deeply golden and crisp.","Transfer the veg mixture to a high-powered blender (or use ahand blender)and blend until smooth. Season and ladle into bowls. Top with the yogurt, and scatter over the croutons, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:18:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6655,6655,'en','Sesame & ginger sushi bowls','This vegan packed lunch is full of goodness, using fibre-rich wholegrain rice and protein-rich edamame beans with a tangy tamari and sesame dressing','["25g ginger (choose a straight piece that is quite slim), peeled","4 tbsp raw apple cider vinegar, plus 1 tbsp","200g brown basmati rice","320g frozen edamame beans","1½-2 tbsp tamari","2 avocados, destoned and sliced","1 large carrot, shredded into long matchsticks or coarsely grated","50g cherry tomatoes, halved","¼ cucumber, sliced","2 tsp sesame oil","3 tbsp toasted sesame seeds"]','["Cut the ginger as thinly as you can to make wafer thin slices or finely shred. Put in a bowl with the 4 tbsp vinegar and 1 tbsp water and massage briefly to soften. Set aside.","Put the rice in a medium pan and add 600ml water. Bring to the boil, cover and simmer on a low heat for 15 mins. Tip in the edamame beans, but don’t stir them in, then cover and cook for 7 mins more. The rice should be tender and have absorbed all the water.","Skim the beans off the rice and set aside. Tip the 1 tbsp of vinegar and ½ tbsp tamari into the rice, and stir well. Spoon onto a plate and spread out to cool quickly. Once cool, spoon into four bowls or lunchboxes. Top with the avocado, carrot, beans, tomatoes and cucumber.","Spoon the ginger from the vinegar and scatter on top. Add the remaining tamari and sesame oil to the vinegar. Spoon over the sushi bowl and scatter with the seeds. Will keep in the fridge for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:18:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6657,6657,'en','Asian prawn & quinoa salad','This fresh salad is 3 of your 5-a-day. With zingy lime and a hit of chilli heat, it''s also a great introduction to quinoa if you haven''t tried it before','["60g quinoa","150g cooked shelled prawns","1 small avocado, stoned and sliced","¼ cucumber, halved and sliced","50g watercress","100g cherry tomatoes, halved","finely grated zest and juice 1 large lime","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","2 spring onions, trimmed and finely chopped","1 tsp wheat-free tamari","handful coriander, chopped","1 tsp rapeseed oil","½  tsp maple syrup"]','["Boil the quinoa in a small pan for 15 mins until the grains are tender and look like they have burst. Drain well and tip into a bowl. Meanwhile, make the dressing: mix the lime zest and juice and the chilli in a bowl.","Stir half the dressing into the quinoa with the spring onions, tamari and half the coriander. Stir in all the salad vegetables, then spoon onto two serving plates.","Stir the oil and maple syrup into the remaining dressing and toss in the prawns. Spoon onto the quinoa salad and scatter over the coriander to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6659,6659,'en','Egg Niçoise salad','A vegetarian Niçoise salad, that''s packed with goodness – fibre, folate, iron, vitamin c and gluten-free too','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","juice 1 lemon","1 tsp balsamic vinegar","1 garlic clove, grated","? small pack basil, leaves chopped","3 pitted black kalamata olives, rinsed and chopped","2 eggs","250g new potatoes, thickly sliced","200g fine green beans","½  red onion, very finely chopped","14 cherry tomatoes, halved","6 romaine lettuce leaves, torn into bite-sized pieces","6 pitted black kalamata olive, rinsed and halved"]','["Mix the dressing ingredients together in a small bowl with 1 tbsp water.","Meanwhile boil the potatoes for 7 mins, add the beans and boil 5 mins more or until both are just tender, then drain. Boil 2 eggs for 8 minutes then shell and halve.","Toss the beans, potatoes and remaining salad ingredients, except the eggs, together in a large bowl with half the dressing. Arrange the eggs on top and drizzle over the remaining dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:18:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6661,6661,'en','Chicken satay salad','Marinate chicken breasts, then drizzle with a punchy peanut satay sauce for a no-fuss, midweek meal that’s high in protein and big on flavour','["1 tbsp tamari","1 tsp medium curry powder","¼ tsp ground cumin","1 garlic clove, finely grated","1 tsp clear honey","2 skinless chicken breast fillets (or use turkey breast)","1 tbsp crunchy peanut butter (choose a sugar-free version with no palm oil, if possible)","1 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","1 tbsp lime juice","a little sunflower oil, for wiping the pan","2 Little Gem lettuces hearts, cut into wedges","¼ cucumber, halved and sliced","1 banana shallot, halved and thinly sliced","generous handful coriander, chopped","seeds from ½  pomegranate"]','["Pour the tamari into a large dish and stir in the curry powder, cumin, garlic and honey.\r\nMix well. Slice the chicken breasts in half horizontally to make 4 fillets in total, then add to the marinade and mix well to coat. Set aside in the fridge for at least 1 hr, or overnight, to allow the flavours to penetrate the chicken.","Meanwhile, mix the peanut butter with the chilli sauce, lime juice, and 1 tbsp water to make a spoonable sauce. When ready to cook the chicken, wipe a large non-stick frying pan with a little oil. Add the chicken and cook, covered with a lid, for 5-6 mins on a medium heat, turning the fillets over for the last min, until cooked but still moist. Set aside, covered, to rest for a few mins.","While the chicken rests, toss the lettuce wedges with the cucumber, shallot, coriander and pomegranate, and pile onto plates. Spoon over a little sauce. Slice the chicken, pile on top of the salad and spoon over the remaining sauce. Eat while the chicken is still warm."]','2026-01-10 12:18:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6663,6663,'en','Dill scones with smoked salmon & cucumber relish','Savoury scones are a great alternative to burger buns or bagels','["200g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","200g wholemeal plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","20g pack dill, half finely chopped","50g unsalted butter, very cold and cut into cubes","300ml milk, warmed, plus extra for brushing","1 tsp poppy seeds","200g pack smoked salmon slices and 300g pack soft cheese, to serve","1 tbsp caster sugar","100ml rice wine vinegar","1 large cucumber, peeled","half red onion, very thinly sliced","1 mild red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped (optional)"]','["For the scones, heat oven to 230C/210C fan/gas 8 and lightly flour a baking sheet. Mix the flours, bicarb, chopped dill and 1 tsp fine salt in a large bowl, then rub in the butter until it disappears. Tip in the milk and stir briefly to a sticky dough.","Scrape the dough onto a floured surface, dust the dough and your hands with more flour, then fold the dough over 2-3 times to smooth a little. Pat into a 4cm-deep round. Use a 7cm cutter to stamp out scones (see tip, below). Press trimmings together and repeat. Brush with milk, scatter with poppy seeds, then bake for 15-18 mins or until golden and well risen. Cool on a rack. As with all scones, these are best eaten on the day.","For the pickle, stir sugar into vinegar until dissolved. Halve and deseed the cucumber, slice thickly, then toss with the vinegar, onion and chilli. Leave for at least 15 mins in the fridge. Can be made up to 24 hrs ahead. When ready to serve, tear remaining dill over the relish. Split scones, spread with soft cheese and top with a ribbon of salmon and a little relish."]','2026-01-10 12:18:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6665,6665,'en','Potato, spring onion, dill & cheese frittata','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThe perfect stress-free summer lunch. For a non-veggie option, add a couple of slices of ham','["2 tbsp olive oil","400g leftover cooked new potatoes, sliced","4 eggs, beaten","4 spring onions, finely sliced","1 bunch dill, roughly chopped","25g cheddar, grated"]','["In a small non-stick frying pan, heat\r\noil over a medium heat. Add potatoes,\r\nthen fry until beginning to crisp, about\r\n8 mins. In a bowl, whisk together eggs,\r\nspring onions, dill and some seasoning.\r\nHeat the grill.","Tip the eggs into frying pan, mix quickly,\r\nlower the heat, then sprinkle over\r\ncheese. After about 8 mins, once the top\r\nside has almost set, pop under the grill\r\nfor 2-3 mins or until firm and golden.\r\nSlide out of the pan. Eat straight away with mayo or ketchup or cool quickly and chill."]','2026-01-10 12:18:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6667,6667,'en','Hot-smoked salmon, lentil & pomegranate salad','No-cook, no-effort, but you won’t miss out on flavour with this vibrant supper for two','["2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","juice ½ lemon","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","2 tbsp roughly chopped tarragon","1 tsp clear honey","1 small red onion, thinly sliced","400g can Puy lentils, rinsed and drained","140g hot-smoked salmon","20g pack flat-leaf parsley, leaves picked","1 pomegranate, seeds removed","toasted pitta bread, to serve"]','["Combine the oil, lemon juice, garlic,\r\ntarragon and honey in a large bowl and\r\nseason. Toss in the red onion and lentils\r\nand set aside to marinate for 10 mins.","Break the salmon into large flakes and\r\nfold into the salad with the parsley and\r\npomegranate. Serve with toasted pitta."]','2026-01-10 12:18:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6669,6669,'en','Fresh tuna tortillas','An all round winner – vitamin D, omega 3 and 1 of your 5-a-day, it''s even simple to make','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","2 large tuna steaks","pinch cayenne pepper","1 tsp ground cumin","4 soft tortillas","1 avocado, sliced","2 tomatoes, sliced","juice 1 lime","handful coriander, chopped","soured cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Rub oil over each steak, then sprinkle with\r\nthe spices. Heat a griddle pan until hot, then\r\ncook the steaks on one side for 2 mins. Turn\r\nand cook for 1-2 mins more. Cut into strips.","Heat the tortillas for 30 secs in a microwave\r\nuntil soft. Pile tuna, avocado and tomatoes\r\non top of each, then squeeze over the lime\r\njuice and scatter with coriander. Dollop soured\r\ncream on top, if you like, then roll up and eat."]','2026-01-10 12:18:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6671,6671,'en','Sweet potato & lentil soup','Satisfying and simple to make, homemade soup is a great supper or take-to-work lunch','["2 tsp medium curry powder","3 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, grated","1 eating apple, peeled, cored and grated","3 garlic cloves, crushed","20g pack coriander, stalks chopped","thumb-size piece fresh root ginger, grated","800g sweet potatoes","1.2l vegetable stock","100g red lentils","300ml milk","juice 1 lime"]','["Put the curry powder into a large\r\nsaucepan, then toast over a medium\r\nheat for 2 mins. Add the olive oil, stirring\r\nas the spice sizzles in the pan. Tip in the\r\nonions, apple, garlic, coriander stalks and\r\nginger, season, then gently cook for\r\n5 mins, stirring every so often.","Meanwhile, peel, then grate the sweet\r\npotatoes. Tip into the pan with the stock,\r\nlentils, milk and seasoning, then simmer,\r\ncovered, for 20 mins. Blend until smooth\r\nusing a stick blender. Stir in the lime juice,\r\ncheck the seasoning and serve, topped\r\nwith roughly-chopped coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:18:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6673,6673,'en','Hoisin wraps','Make this delicious, healthy take on a Peking duck wrap for a speedy snack or tasty lunch.','["200g cooked turkey or chicken, cut into strips","4 tbsp hoisin sauce","2 flour tortillas","¼ cucumber, deseeded and shredded","4 spring onions, trimmed and finely shredded","good handful watercress"]','["Heat the grill to high. Mix the turkey or chicken with half of the hoisin sauce so that it’s coated, then spread out onto\r\nan ovenproof dish and grill until sizzling. Warm the tortillas under the grill or according to pack instructions.","Spread the tortillas with the rest of the hoisin sauce, then use to wrap up the turkey or chicken with the cucumber, onions and watercress. Cut in half and enjoy while still warm."]','2026-01-10 12:18:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6675,6675,'en','Prawn sweet chilli noodle salad','This low-fat salad is is great for a picnic, lunchbox or even a buffet','["3 nests medium egg noodles","½ large cucumber","bunch spring onions, finely sliced","100g cherry tomatoes, halved","1 green chilli, deseeded, finely chopped","200g cooked king prawns, defrosted if frozen","zest and juice 2 limes","4 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","100g baby spinach leaves","25g roasted cashews"]','["Boil the noodles for 4 mins, then drain.\r\nCool under running water, then drain\r\nagain. Put into a large bowl, then using\r\nscissors, cut into shorter lengths.","Halve cucumber lengthways, then\r\nscoop out the seeds. Slice into halfmoons\r\nand add to the noodles with the\r\nonions, tomatoes, chilli and prawns.","Mix the lime zest, juice and chilli sauce to\r\nmake a dressing and fold through noodles.\r\nPut a handful of spinach onto each serving\r\nplate, top with the noodles and cashews."]','2026-01-10 12:18:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6677,6677,'en','Roasted veg & couscous salad','Throw together a filling and fragrant couscous salad for a vegetarian lunchbox meal, or double it for a buffet','["1 red and 1 yellow pepper, halved and deseeded","½ butternut squash","2 courgettes, thickly sliced","4 garlic cloves, leave skin on","3 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 red onion, thickly sliced","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tbsp harissa paste","50g whole blanched almonds","250g couscous","300ml hot vegetable stock","zest and juice 1 lemon","20g pack mint, roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Cut\r\npeppers and squash into bite-size pieces\r\n(leave skin on the squash). Tip all the veg\r\ninto a baking tray, add garlic, 2 tbsp oil\r\nand seasoning, then mix and roast for 20 mins.\r\nAdd onion, cumin, harissa and almonds.\r\nRoast for another 20 mins, then cool.","Put couscous into a large bowl, pour\r\nover the stock, cover, then set aside for\r\n10 mins. Fluff up with a fork.","In a bowl, mix zest, juice and remaining\r\noil. Squeeze garlic pulp from skins into the\r\nbowl, mash well and fold in the mint. Pour\r\nover the veg, then toss with the couscous."]','2026-01-10 12:18:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6679,6679,'en','Smoky beef stew','Enjoy this simple stew for dinner, then pack into boxes to keep you going for lunches','["1kg stewing beef, cut into large chunks","2 onions, chopped","800g (2 cans) chopped tomatoes","2 tsp each sweet paprika, ground cumin and mild chilli powder","2 tbsp red or white wine vinegar","2 tbsp caster sugar","400g can butter beans, rinsed and drained"]','["Heat oven to 160C/\r\n140C fan/gas 3. Mix the\r\nbeef, onions, tomatoes,\r\nspices, vinegar and sugar in\r\na casserole dish. Cover and\r\nbake for 2½ hrs. Stir in the\r\nbeans and bake for 30 mins\r\nmore (with the lid off if the\r\ncasserole is a little wet or\r\nlid on if good consistency),\r\nuntil the beef is tender.","Cool, then freeze in\r\n6-8 portions in small food\r\nbags or plastic containers.\r\nDefrost in microwave or\r\novernight in fridge, then\r\nheat in the morning and\r\ntransfer to a thermos\r\ncontainer, or heat in the\r\nmicrowave at lunchtime."]','2026-01-10 12:18:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6681,6681,'en','Speedy meatball stew','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyServe beef meatballs in a tomato casserole with garlic and rosemary and eat with pasta or crusty bread','["2 medium potatoes, peeled and cut into bite-size cubes","1 tbsp olive oil","250g small lean beef meatballs","1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","1 tbsp chopped rosemary","560ml jar passata","200g frozen peas","few parmesan shavings, to serve (optional)"]','["Boil the potatoes for 10 mins until tender.\r\nMeanwhile, heat the oil in a large saucepan.\r\nSeason the meatballs, then brown them all\r\nover for about 5 mins. Remove from the pan,\r\ndrain off any excess fat, then add the onion,\r\ngarlic and rosemary. Fry gently for 5 mins.","Add passata to the pan, bring to a simmer,\r\nthen add the meatballs. Simmer for 5 mins\r\nor until everything is cooked through. Add\r\nthe potatoes and peas, then simmer for\r\n1 min. Pack into a flask or reheat at work,\r\nadd Parmesan, if using, and eat with good\r\ncrusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:18:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6683,6683,'en','Burger bowl','Get inspired by the popular trend for a low carb, deconstructed burger without the bun. Feel free to change up the toppings – fried mushrooms also work well','["2 large potatoes , cut into rough chunks","2 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tbsp Cajun spice mix","1 tsp garlic granules (optional)","250g lean beef mince","25g crinkle cut pickles , plus 1 tbsp brine from the jar","1 Iceberg lettuce , shredded","1 red onion onion, finely sliced into rings and rinsed in cold water, if you like (this will reduce the strong raw onion flavour)","150g cherry tomatoes , halved","50g cheddar , grated","3 tbsp low-sugar ketchup","2 tbsp light mayonnaise","½ tbsp American mustard"]','["Heat the air-fryer or oven to 220C/200C/gas 7. Put the potatoes in the air-fryer or oven, drizzle over 1 tbsp of the vegetable oil, 1 tbsp of the Cajun spice mix, the garlic granules (if using) and season. Cook for 20 mins, shaking halfway, or until crisp and cooked through.","When the potatoes have about 10 mins to go, heat the remaining 1 tbsp oil in a frying pan over a medium-high heat. Once shimmering, tip the mince into the pan, and use a spatula to break it up. Sprinkle over the remaining 1 tbsp Cajun spice mix and season. Cook for 7-8 mins, or until crisp and cooked through.","Divide the potatoes between four bowls, then top with pickles, lettuce, red onion, cherry tomatoes, mince and a little cheese.","Mix the ketchup, mayo, mustard and pickle brine in a small bowl, then drizzle over the burger bowls and tuck in."]','2026-01-10 12:18:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6685,6685,'en','Cheese & onion pork chops','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyEnjoy British pork with melted Cheshire cheese and a kick of English mustard','["4 pork chop","2 tsp olive oil","1 tsp English mustard","4 tbsp caramelised onion, from a jar","50g Cheshire cheese, grated","1 tsp thyme, chopped"]','["Heat grill to high, then place the chops on a grill pan, rub with oil and season. Grill for about 6 mins on each side, until golden.","Spread a little mustard over one side of each chop, then top with 1 tbsp onions. Mix the cheese and thyme, sprinkle over the chops, then grill until golden and bubbly."]','2026-01-10 12:18:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6687,6687,'en','Roast sirloin of beef & Port gravy','Serve up a stunning sirloin of beef this Sunday, for a roast dinner you won’t forget','["3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tbsp thyme leaves","2 tbsp olive oil","1½ -2kg/3lb 5oz-4lb 8oz piece rolled sirloin of beef","1 garlic clove","1 bay leaf","few thyme sprigs","75ml port","350ml red wine","200ml beef stock (if you''d rather make your gravy alcohol-free, simply double the quantity of stock)"]','["For the beef, mix the garlic, thyme and olive oil with some black pepper. Rub over the beef and leave for at least 1 hr, the longer the better. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, season the beef with salt and place in a roasting tin. Roast in the oven for 30 mins, then turn the heat down to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and cook for 10-15 mins per 450g depending on how you like your meat – 10 mins per 450g will give you rare meat and 15 mins will give you meat that is cooked through.","When the beef is cooked, take it out of the roasting tin and allow it to rest somewhere warm, loosely wrapped in foil, for 30 mins. Pour off and reserve any resting juices.","To make the gravy, place the roasting tin on a high heat with the garlic, bay and thyme. Splash in the Port, scrape with a wooden spoon to loosen any debris from the tin and bubble until almost completely reduced. Pour in the red wine and reduce by three-quarters before adding the stock. Bring to the boil and season to taste. Pour reserved resting juices back into the tin. Finally, pour the gravy through a sieve into a warm jug. Carve the meat and serve with the gravy."]','2026-01-10 12:18:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6689,6689,'en','Cloud bread','Light and fluffy, this bread substitute lives up to its name. Use it as a low-carb option for sandwiches','["oil or butter for greasing","4 eggs, separated","50g cream cheese","¼ tsp cream of tartar","½  tsp nigella seeds"]','["Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2 and line 2 large baking sheets with baking paper, then grease well with butter or oil.","In a large bowl and using electric beaters, whisk the egg whites together until stiff peaks form. You should be able to carefully turn the bowl upside down without it falling out.","In another bowl, put the egg yolks, cream cheese and cream of tartar then whisk together (no need to wash the beaters first) until smooth, pale and frothy. Next, fold the egg whites, a spoonful at a time into the yolk mixture, be as gentle as you can with this so you don’t knock out too much of the air and finally fold in the nigella seeds and season with salt and pepper.","Carefully dollop the mixture onto the prepared baking sheets, if the mixture is a little runny when you get to the bottom of the bowl don’t use the last few spoonfuls – only use the really fluffy mix on the top. Bake for 20 mins or until lightly golden and craggy on top. Allow to cool for a few moments before carefully removing from the paper with a palette knife."]','2026-01-10 12:18:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6691,6691,'en','Cured pollock with dill cream & radish salad','Tom Kerridge’s elegant Scandinavian-style seafood starter, similar to the salmon dish gravadlax, is sure to impress at any dinner party','["100g coarse sea salt","100g golden caster sugar","2 tbsp fennel seeds","1 small pack dill, chopped","400g skinless pollack fillet (see ''Tip'')","500ml rapeseed oil","140g full-fat crème fraîche","cayenne pepper, to season","½  small pack dill, chopped","finely grated zest 1 lemon","300g radishes (we used French breakfast radishes)","1 tbsp taramasalata","juice ½  lemon","½  pack chives, snipped","¼ tsp smoked paprika","toasted brown bread, to serve"]','["Mix the salt, sugar, fennel seeds and dill together in a bowl. Line a large dish with cling film and cover it with half the salt mix. Put the pollack fillet on top and cover it with the remaining salt mix. Bring the cling film over the top and cover the fish completely. Put the fish in the fridge and leave it to cure for at least 8 hrs or overnight. After this time, the fish will be very firm and have a salty flavour. Wash the salt off, put the fish in a large dish, cover completely in cold water and leave to soak for 30 mins. Drain and dry with kitchen paper.","Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2. Put the fish in an ovenproof dish or roasting tin. Pour the rapeseed oil over the top of the fish and cover the tin with a sheet of foil, seal it around the edges and cook in the oven for 25 mins. Remove from the oven and leave, covered with the foil, until needed for serving. Can be done several hours ahead and left to sit at room temperature.","Whisk the crème fraîche in a bowl with a pinch of salt and cayenne for 2-3 mins until it thickens like clotted cream. Fold in the chopped dill and lemon zest. Cover with cling film and keep in the fridge until needed.","Wash the radishes and cut in half lengthways. Put the taramasalata and the lemon juice in a bowl and whisk together. Remove the pollack from the oil (see tip, below), drain it on kitchen paper to remove the excess oil, then flake the fish onto a large serving plate. Add 3-4 tbsp of the cooking oil to the taramasalata and whisk together. Add the radishes, chives and the smoked paprika to the dressing and fold it all together, making sure the radishes get a good coating. Serve the warm fish with the dill, cream and the radish salad. Toasted brown bread goes really well with this too."]','2026-01-10 12:18:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6693,6693,'en','Prawn & crab cocktail lettuce cups','Serve seafood on a sharing platter and let everyone build their own little prawn cocktail bites for a perfect dinner party starter or canapé','["4 tbsp mayonnaise","3 tbsp tomato ketchup","2 tsp Worcestershire sauce","juice and zest 1 lemon","pinch of cayenne","4 tomatoes, deseeded and finely diced","1 small red onion, finely diced","1½  tbsp Tabasco","3 Little Gem lettuces, leaves separated","300g cooked and peeled prawns (we used a mixture of king prawns and small North Atlantic prawns)","200g white crabmeat","½  bunch chives, snipped","lemon wedges, to serve (optional)"]','["Mix together all the ingredients for the Marie Rose sauce and set aside in the fridge. Do the same with the tomato salsa ingredients. These can be chilled for up to 24 hrs.","Arrange the lettuce leaves, prawns, crab and chives in separate bowls. Put everything on the table with a pile of lemon wedges.","At the table, add some prawns and crab to the lettuce leaves, spoon over some tomato salsa and Marie Rose sauce, and scatter over a few chives. Squeeze over\r\na little lemon juice, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6695,6695,'en','Polenta & mushroom tart','This pretty vegetarian main is made from quick-cook cheesy polenta topped with mushrooms, mozzarella, rocket and balsamic vinegar','["25g butter, plus extra for greasing","850ml vegetable stock","200g quick-cook polenta","50g Parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), grated","2 rosemary sprigs, leaves finely chopped","500g chestnut mushrooms, halved","small bunch thyme, leaves only","2 tbsp olive oil","125g ball mozzarella, drained","large handful rocket","1 tsp balsamic vinegar"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nGrease and line a large baking tray with\r\nbaking parchment. Bring the stock to the\r\nboil in a large saucepan, then slowly pour\r\nin the polenta, whisking all the time. Bring\r\nit to the boil and bubble for 8 mins, whisking\r\ncontinuously. Remove from the heat and stir\r\nin the cheese, butter, rosemary and plenty\r\nof seasoning. Spread the polenta over the\r\nlined tray and bake for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, mix the mushrooms with the thyme and some seasoning. Heat a splash of oil in a large frying pan and fry the mushrooms in a couple of batches until golden. Tear the mozzarella into pieces and pat dry with kitchen paper. Top the baked polenta with the mushrooms and mozzarella, then bake again for 10 mins or until the cheese is melted and bubbling. Scatter the rocket over the tart and drizzle with the balsamic vinegar."]','2026-01-10 12:18:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6697,6697,'en','Aubergine melts','Choose a glossy, plump aubergine to make this warming vegetarian main course','["3 tbsp olive oil","2 aubergines, halved lengthways","4 tomatoes","1 x 150g ball mozzarella, drained","handful basil leaves"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Drizzle the oil over the aubergine and bake in the oven for 25 mins until softened. Meanwhile, slice the tomatoes and mozzarella, then arrange on top of the aubergine. Return to oven for another 5 mins or until the cheese has melted. Scatter over some basil leaves. Serve with couscous and green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:18:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6699,6699,'en','Thai chicken & mushroom broth','An ideal recipe for getting your Thai tastebuds into practice','["1l hot chicken stock","1 tbsp Thai red curry paste","1 tbsp Thai fish sauce","2 tsp sugar","zest and juice 2 limes","100g Portobello mushrooms, sliced","bunch spring onions, sliced, whites and greens seperated","200g leftover chicken, shredded"]','["Tip the stock into a saucepan, then stir\r\nin the curry paste, fish sauce, sugar, lime\r\njuice and most of the zest. Bring to the\r\nboil, then add the mushrooms and whites\r\nof the spring onion. Cover, then simmer\r\nfor 2 mins.","Stir in the chicken and most\r\nof the spring onion greens to gently heat\r\nthrough, then serve ladled into bowls and\r\nscattered with the remaining lime zest. Serve with extra lime juice, sugar and fish sauce on the side so everyone can adjust their own bowlfuls."]','2026-01-10 12:18:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6701,6701,'en','Prawn & chorizo frittata','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyNever tried seafood with spicy chorizo? Give it a go in this simple supper for two','["½ onion, finely chopped","50g chorizo, sliced","2 tsp olive oil","4 eggs, lightly beaten","1 tbsp milk","85g cooked, peeled prawns","100g frozen peas, defrosted","leafy salad, to serve"]','["Heat grill to medium. In a 20cm frying\r\npan, fry the onion and chorizo in the oil\r\nover a low heat. Cook for 4-5 mins,\r\nstirring occasionally until the onion is soft.","Take the pan off the heat, pour out\r\nany excess fat from the chorizo, then stir\r\nin the beaten eggs and milk with some\r\nseasoning. Stir in the prawns and peas\r\nand return to a low heat for 10-12 mins\r\nuntil all but the very top of the frittata is\r\nset. Flash it under the grill until golden\r\n(keep the handle away from the heat).\r\nServe in wedges with a leafy salad."]','2026-01-10 12:18:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6703,6703,'en','Greek salad omelette','A quick and healthy supper','["10 eggs","handful of parsley leaves, chopped (optional)","2 tbsp olive oil","1 large red onion, cut into wedges","3 tomatoes, chopped into large chunks","large handful black olives, (pitted are easier to eat)","100g feta cheese, crumbled"]','["Heat the grill to high. Whisk the eggs in a large bowl with the chopped parsley, pepper and salt, if you want. Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying pan, then fry the onion wedges over a high heat for about 4 mins until they start to brown around the edges. Throw in the tomatoes and olives and cook for 1-2 mins until the tomatoes begin to soften.","Turn the heat down to medium and pour in the eggs. Cook the eggs in the pan, stirring them as they begin to set, until half cooked, but still runny in places – about 2 mins. Scatter over the feta, then place the pan under the grill for 5-6 mins until omelette is puffed up and golden. Cut into wedges and serve straight from the pan."]','2026-01-10 12:18:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6705,6705,'en','Roasted salmon','Cooking whole sides of salmon for a centrepiece is a sociable and special way of eating','["1 x 2kg/4lb 8oz salmon, filleted to give two sides, skin on","1 lemon, sliced","good handful mixed herbs such as parsley, dill, chervil or tarragon","2 bay leaves","1-2 shallots, thinly sliced","splash white wine"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Sit\r\none of the salmon fillets, skin-side down,\r\non a large sheet of foil or baking parchment.\r\nScatter with the lemon slices, herbs,\r\nshallots and seasoning, then sit the\r\nsecond fillet on top – skin-side up. Tie in\r\n2-3 places with string to secure, splash\r\nwith wine and fold up the foil or paper to\r\nseal. Can be chilled for up to 3 hrs.","Place on a baking sheet and bake for\r\n50 mins-1 hr until the salmon is cooked\r\nthrough – check by poking a knife into\r\nthe fillets and making sure the flesh\r\nflakes easily. Serve in foil or paper on\r\na serving plate, or carefully lift out using a\r\ncouple of fish slices. Slice into portions and\r\nserve with the Lemon & chive mayonnaise and\r\nNew potatoes ''Lyonnaise'' (see ''Goes well with'' recipes) and half-steamed\r\nbroccoli (see below)."]','2026-01-10 12:18:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6707,6707,'en','Cod with bacon, lettuce & peas','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA good source of folate and fibre, this healthy fish supper also contains two of your five-a-day','["2 tsp sunflower oil","2 rashers rindless smoked streaky bacon, cut into small pieces","1 long shallot or small onion, very finely sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 x 140g/5oz thick skinless cod fillets","140g frozen peas","200ml chicken stock, fresh or made with ½ cube","2 Little Gem lettuces, thickly shredded","2 tbsp half-fat crème fraîche","2 thick slices crusty wholegrain bread, to serve"]','["Heat the sunflower oil in a medium\r\nnon-stick frying pan. Add the bacon,\r\nshallot or onion, and garlic. Cook gently,\r\nstirring, for 2 mins, then push to one\r\nside of the pan.","Season the cod with ground black\r\npepper. Fry in the pan for 2 mins, then\r\nturn over. Add the peas and stock, and\r\nbring to a simmer. Cook over a medium\r\nheat for a further 2 mins, then add the\r\nlettuce and crème fraîche. Cook for a\r\ncouple mins more, stirring the vegetables\r\noccasionally, until the fish is just cooked\r\nand the lettuce has wilted. Serve with\r\nbread to mop up the broth."]','2026-01-10 12:18:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6709,6709,'en','Haddock in tomato basil sauce','A deliciously simple and low fat fish dinner','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, thinly sliced","1 small aubergine, about 250g/9oz, roughly chopped","½ tsp ground paprika","2 garlic cloves, crushed","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp dark or light muscovado sugar","8 large basil leaves, plus a few extra for sprinkling","4 4x175g/6oz firm skinless white fish fillets, such as haddock"]','["Heat the olive oil in a large non-stick frying pan and stirfry the onion and aubergine. After about 4 minutes the vegetables will start to turn golden but won’t be soft yet, so cover with a lid and let the vegetables steam-fry in their own juices for 6 minutes – this helps them to soften without needing to add any extra oil.","Stir in the paprika, garlic,\r\ntomatoes and sugar with 1?2 tsp\r\nsalt and cook for another 8-10\r\nminutes, stirring, until onion\r\nand aubergine are tender.","Scatter in the basil leaves\r\nthen nestle the fish in the\r\nsauce, cover the pan and cook\r\nfor 6-8 minutes until the fish\r\nflakes when tested with a knife\r\nand the flesh is firm but still\r\nmoist. Tear over the rest of the\r\nbasil and serve with a salad\r\nand crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:18:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6711,6711,'en','Chicken Marengo','Try a chicken casserole with a difference and whip up this version with mushrooms, olives, tomato and parsley','["1 tbsp olive oil","300g pack cup mushrooms, halved","4 chicken legs, skin removed","500g jar garlic & herb passata","1 chicken stock cube","100g pitted black kalamata olives","chopped parsley, to serve (optional)","pasta and a salad, or mash and green veg, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large flameproof\r\ncasserole dish and stir-fry the\r\nmushrooms until they start to soften.\r\nAdd the chicken legs and cook briefly\r\non each side to colour them a little.","Pour in the passata, crumble in the\r\nstock cube and stir in the olives. Season\r\nwith black pepper – you shouldn’t need\r\nsalt. Cover and simmer for 40 mins until\r\nthe chicken is tender. Sprinkle with\r\nparsley and serve with pasta and a salad,\r\nor mash and green veg, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6713,6713,'en','Goan mussels','You can add any other seafood to this quick aromatic green curry – prawns can go in with the coconut milk and clams with the mussels','["1kg fresh mussels","sunflower oil, for frying","1 onion, chopped","thumb-sized piece ginger, grated","4 garlic cloves, crushed","2 green chillies, chopped","1 tsp black mustard seed","½  tsp ground turmeric","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","400ml coconut milk","coriander sprigs, to serve","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Remove the beards, then wash the\r\nmussels well in cold water. Refresh the\r\nwater and repeat until it is clear. Discard\r\nany mussels that are broken or stay\r\nopen when tapped.","Heat the oil in a flameproof casserole.\r\nFry the onion until very lightly brown,\r\nthen add the ginger, garlic, chillies,\r\nspices, a good pinch of salt and a grinding\r\nof pepper. Cook for 2-3 mins until fragrant\r\nand toasted. Pour in the coconut milk and\r\nbring to the boil, then simmer for a few\r\nmins to get everything mixed together.","Tip the mussels into the dish, cover,\r\nturn up the heat to maximum and boil\r\nfor 3-4 mins until the mussels have\r\njust opened. Scatter over the coriander\r\nsprigs and serve with lime wedges\r\nfor squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6715,6715,'en','Garlic beef','A cheap cut of beef transformed into a tender treat','["1 tbsp black peppercorn","6 garlic cloves","4 tbsp red wine vinegar","600g piece well-trimmed beef skirt"]','["In a pestle and mortar, crush peppercorns\r\nand garlic with a pinch of salt until you have\r\na smooth-ish paste, then stir in the vinegar.\r\nSit the beef in a non-metallic dish, then rub\r\nall over with the paste. Leave in the fridge\r\nfor a few hrs, but no longer.","To cook, place a griddle pan over a very\r\nhot heat. Rub the marinade off the meat,\r\nthen season with a little more salt. Cook\r\nmeat until charred on each side – about 5\r\nmins on each side for rare; if the cut is very\r\nthick, you may want to roast it in a hot oven\r\nfor 5 mins after searing. Lift onto a chopping\r\nboard, then rest for 5 mins before carving\r\ninto slices and serving with chips, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6717,6717,'en','Gentlemen’s relish & scrambled eggs','Gentleman’s Relish is a classic salty anchovy paste – it makes a great partner for buttery scrambled eggs.','["25g softened butter, plus extra for the eggs","2 tsp Gentleman’s Relish","4 eggs","4 slices of toasted wholemeal bread","1 tsp chopped flatleaf parsley"]','["Beat the butter and Gentleman’s Relish together with a wooden spoon until well blended. Beat the eggs lightly and season with pepper, but no salt. Melt a knob of butter in a pan and tip in the eggs. Let them cook for a few seconds, then stir, still over the heat, until creamily scrambled.","When the eggs are just not quite done, take them off the heat and stir in another generous knob of butter. (This is a useful trick if you’re making scrambled eggs for breakfast too: adding extra butter, or a tablespoonful of cream, brings the temperature down and means the eggs won’t overcook on the way to the table.) Butter the toast with the Gentleman’s Relish-flavoured butter, and top with the eggs. Cut into fingers, sprinkle over a little parsley and serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:18:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6719,6719,'en','Cinnamon berry granola bars','These granola bars are great for lunchboxes, breakfast on the run or just with a cup of coffee','["100g butter, plus extra for greasing","200g porridge oats","100g sunflower seeds","50g sesame seeds","50g chopped walnuts","3 tbsp honey","100g light muscovado sugar","1 tsp ground cinnamon","100g dried cranberries, cherries or blueberries, or a mix"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Butter and line the base of a 18 x 25cm tin. Mix the oats, seeds and nuts in a roasting tin, then put in the oven for 5-10 mins to toast.","Meanwhile, warm the butter, honey and sugar in a pan, stirring until butter is melted. Add the oat mix, cinnamon and dried fruit, then mix until all the oats are well coated. Tip into the tin, press down lightly, then bake for 30 mins. Cool in tin, then cut into 12 bars."]','2026-01-10 12:18:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6721,6721,'en','Goat’s cheese, pea & bean frittata','This recipe is great for a standby supper, as you’ll probably find all the ingredients in your fridge','["300g mix frozen peas and beans","8 large eggs","splash of milk","100g log goat''s cheese, the kind with rind, or use feta","1-2 tbsp chopped mint","a little oil"]','["Heat the grill to medium. Boil the peas\r\nand beans for 4 mins until just tender,\r\nthen drain well. Beat the eggs with a\r\nsplash of milk and some seasoning. Slice\r\n4 thin, round slices of goat’s cheese (you’ll\r\nuse about half the log), roughly chop or\r\ncrumble the rest into pieces, then stir this\r\ninto the eggs with the veg and mint.","Lightly oil an ovenproof shallow pan and place on the heat. Pour in the egg mix and gently cook on the hob for 8-10 mins until there is just a little un-set mix on the surface. Top with the slices of goat''s cheese, then put under the grill, and grill until set, golden and the cheese is bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:18:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6723,6723,'en','Apple & linseed porridge','Start the day the right way with a nutrient-packed oaty breakfast – full of stomach-friendly fibre, great for digestion','["100g porridge oats","2 eating apples, peeled and grated","½  tsp ground cinnamon, plus extra for sprinkling","500ml skimmed milk","2 tbsp ground linseeds","150ml pot probiotic yogurt","drizzle of honey or agave syrup"]','["In a medium saucepan, mix the oats,\r\napples, cinnamon and milk. Bring to\r\nthe boil, stirring occasionally, then turn\r\ndown the heat and cook for 4-5 mins,\r\nstirring constantly.","Stir in the ground linseeds, then\r\ndivide into 4 breakfast bowls. Top each\r\nwith a dollop of yogurt, a drizzle of\r\nhoney or agave syrup, and a sprinkle\r\nmore cinnamon."]','2026-01-10 12:18:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6725,6725,'en','On-the-run breakfast bars','No time for breakfast? Save time and money – make your own breakfast bars','["100g butter","3 tbsp golden syrup","85g demerara sugar","140g porridge oats","½ tsp ground cinnamon","50g desiccated coconut","2 tbsp linseeds, slightly crushed","1 tbsp sesame seeds","100g chopped hazelnuts"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Butter a 22cm square baking tin. Melt the butter, syrup and sugar in a pan. Pour in the oats, cinnamon, coconut, seeds and nuts, mix and pour into tin. Bake for 30-35 mins. Leave to cool for 5 mins, then cut into slices. Will keep for 1 week in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:18:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6727,6727,'en','Tropical treat','Kick start your day with a fruit and nut muesli treat','["250g jumbo oats","50g desiccated coconut","25g dark muscovado sugar","50g pumpkin seeds","100g mixture of chopped Brazil nuts and whole raw cashews","250g packet ready-to-eat tropical fruits","yogurt, fresh blueberries, sliced banana and honey to serve (optional)"]','["Preheat the oven to 200C/Gas\r\n6/fan oven 180C. Put oats, coconut,\r\nsugar and pumpkin seeds on a large\r\nbaking tray with sides, ideally nonstick.\r\nMix in sugar and break up\r\nlumps with fingers, then add nuts.","Bake for 15 minutes, stirring\r\nevery 5 minutes, until sugar starts\r\nto melt and nuts are lightly toasted.\r\nTip into a big bowl and leave to cool.","Snip bite-sized pieces of\r\ntropical fruits into the mixture. Serve\r\nwith chilled milk, yogurt and fruit","Store for up to 2 months, airtight."]','2026-01-10 12:18:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6729,6729,'en','Fruit, oat & seed bars','A tasty twist on flapjacks with a lusciouslayer of apricots inside','["140g light muscovado sugar","3 tbsp golden syrup","140g butter","250g rolled oats","85g raisins or sultanas","85g walnut pieces (or use your favourite nuts, roughly chopped)","50g sesame or mixed seeds","25g dried cranberries","50g ready-to-eat apricots, finely chopped"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3.\r\nGently heat the sugar, golden syrup\r\nand butter in a pan until the sugar and\r\nbutter have both melted. Stir the oats,\r\nraisins, walnuts, seeds and cranberries\r\ninto the pan until coated in the butter.","Spoon half the oaty mix into a traybake\r\ntin (23 x 23cm or thereabouts). Scatter\r\nthe apricots over the top, then top with\r\nthe remaining oat mix. Pack the mix\r\ndown well and smooth with the back\r\nof a metal spoon. Bake for 35 mins\r\nor until dark golden. Leave to cool\r\ncompletely before cutting into 16 bars\r\nwith a sharp knife."]','2026-01-10 12:18:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6731,6731,'en','Grilled steak salad with horseradish dressing','A colourful tomato salad livens up this speedy, healthy supper of marinated lean beef steak with hot mustard sauce','["250g/9oz bavette or skirt steak","1 tsp celery seeds, crushed","1 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","little olive oil, for brushing","6 celery sticks, thinly sliced, leaves reserved","200g mixed tomatoes, sliced or halved (beefsteak, plum and red and yellow cherry are all good)","1 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp horseradish sauce","1 tsp red wine vinegar","1 tsp tomato purée"]','["Rub the steak on both sides with the\r\ncrushed celery seeds, some seasoning\r\nand the Worcestershire sauce. Brush\r\nwith olive oil and leave to marinate while\r\nyou prepare the salad.","Mix the dressing ingredients in a small\r\nbowl. Divide the celery and tomatoes\r\nbetween 2 plates. Heat a griddle pan\r\nover a high heat, then cook the meat\r\nfor 2-3 mins on each side (depending\r\non how thick your steaks are). Remove\r\nfrom the heat and leave to rest, covered\r\nwith foil, for 5 mins.","Slice the steaks and place on top\r\nof the salads, pour the dressing over\r\nand scatter over the celery leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:18:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6733,6734,'en','Citrus soba noodles','Simple, zesty and quick. Throw in your favourite veg or a bit of chicken to make it a meal, or serve it as a simple side to Asian-inspired meals','["250g soba noodles (see know-how below)","4 spring onions, shredded","zest and juice 1 lime","1 tbsp soy sauce"]','["Cook the noodles in boiling water according to pack instructions, about 7 mins,\r\nthen rinse under cold running water until\r\ncool. Drain well.","Tip into a bowl and toss with the spring onions, lime zest and juice, and soy sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:18:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6734,6733,'en','Garlic prawns with Asian puy lentils','Don’t dismiss lentils too quickly – they’re filling, healthy and easy to combine with other flavours, as this dish proves.','["400g raw, peeled tiger prawns, defrosted if frozen","2 red chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","zest and juice 1 lime","2 large garlic cloves, crushed","2 tbsp oil","200g Puy lentils","2 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp clear honey","1 tbsp rice wine vinegar","3 tbsp sesame seeds, toasted","bunch coriander, leaves roughly chopped"]','["Place the prawns in a shallow dish. Mix\r\ntogether half the finely chopped chilli, lime\r\nzest and juice, garlic and oil, then pour over\r\nthe prawns. Cover and chill for 20 mins to\r\nmarinate.","Meanwhile, put the lentils in a pan, cover\r\nwith twice their depth in water, bring to the\r\nboil, then simmer for 15-20 mins until\r\ntender. Top up the water if you need to.","To make the dressing, put the remaining\r\nchopped chilli, the soy, honey and vinegar\r\ninto a small bowl and stir together. Drain the\r\nlentils, then tip into a large bowl. Spoon over\r\nalmost all the dressing while the lentils are\r\nhot, tip in the sesame seeds, then mix well.","Heat a frying pan until really hot. Lift the\r\nprawns out of the marinade, then fry for 1-2\r\nmins each side until pink and lightly golden.\r\nPour in the marinade and bring to the boil.\r\nFold the chopped coriander through the\r\nlentils, then spoon onto serving plates. Top\r\nwith the prawns and any pan juices."]','2026-01-10 12:18:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6736,6736,'en','Thai-style chicken & sweet potato parcels','An individual parchment-wrapped chicken dish flavoured with Asian spices and creamy coconut','["25g creamed coconut (from a block)","2 tsp soft brown sugar","1 tsp fish sauce","2 tsp Thai green curry paste","½ sweet potato, peeled and cut into small cubes","1 small red pepper, deseeded and cut into small cubes","1 skinless chicken breast","handful coriander leaves and a few lime wedges, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nDissolve the creamed coconut\r\nwith 3 tbsp boiling water and mix\r\nto a smooth paste. Stir in the\r\nsugar, fish sauce and curry paste.","Place a large piece of baking\r\nparchment on a baking sheet.\r\nArrange the sweet potato and\r\npepper in the middle of the paper,\r\nclearing a space in the centre. Lay the chicken breast in the space\r\nand pour over the sauce. Fold over\r\nthe top edges of the parchment to\r\nform a seal and scrunch up the\r\nends like a sweet wrapper.","Cook in the oven for 25-30 mins\r\nor until the chicken is cooked\r\nthrough and the vegetables are\r\ntender. Sit the parcel on a dinner\r\nplate or shallow bowl and carefully\r\nopen. Sprinkle with coriander\r\nand squeeze over some lime\r\njuice, to taste."]','2026-01-10 12:18:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6738,6738,'en','Steamed fish with ginger & spring onion','Take an Asian approach to low-fat cooking – steam fish with pak choi, mirin, garlic and soy and serve topped with coriander','["100g pak choi","4 x 150g fillets firm white fish","5cm piece ginger, finely shredded","2 garlic cloves, finely sliced","2 tbsp low-salt soy sauce","1 tsp mirin rice wine","1 bunch spring onions, finely shredded","handful coriander, chopped","brown rice, to serve","1 lime, cut into wedges, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nCut a large rectangle of foil, big enough\r\nto make a large envelope. Place the pak\r\nchoi on the foil, followed by the fish, then\r\nthe ginger and garlic. Pour over the soy\r\nsauce and rice wine, then season.","Fold over foil and seal the 3 edges, then\r\nput on a baking sheet. Cook for 20 mins,\r\nopen the parcel and scatter over the\r\nspring onions and coriander. Serve with\r\nbrown rice and squeezed lime juice."]','2026-01-10 12:18:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6740,6740,'en','Minced beef & sweet potato stew','Thrifty lean mince makes a great base for a hearty family casserole – serve this one-pot with seasonal greens','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 large onion, chopped","1 large carrot, chopped","1 celery stick, sliced","500g lean minced beef","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp mushroom ketchup","400g can chopped tomatoes","450g sweet potatoes, peeled and cut into large chunks","few thyme sprigs","1 bay leaf","handful parsley, chopped","Savoy cabbage, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the\r\nonion, carrot and celery, and sweat\r\nfor 10 mins until soft. Add the beef\r\nand cook until it is browned all over.","Add the tomato purée and cook for\r\na few mins, then add the mushroom\r\nketchup, tomatoes, sweet potatoes,\r\nherbs and a can full of water. Season\r\nwell and bring to the boil.","Simmer on a low heat for 40-45 mins\r\nuntil the sweet potatoes are tender,\r\nstirring a few times throughout cooking\r\nto make sure they are cooking evenly.","Once cooked, remove the bay leaf,\r\nstir through the chopped parsley and\r\nserve with cabbage."]','2026-01-10 12:18:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6742,6742,'en','Oriental salmon & broccoli traybake','Five ingredients is all you need to create this Asian flavoured fish dish with healthy greens and fresh lemon','["4 skin-on salmon fillets","1 head broccoli, broken into florets","juice ½ lemon, ½ lemon quartered","small bunch spring onions, sliced","2 tbsp soy sauce"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nPut the salmon in a large roasting tin,\r\nleaving space between each fillet.","Wash and drain the broccoli and, while\r\nstill a little wet, arrange in the tray around\r\nthe fillets. Pour the lemon juice over\r\neverything, then add the lemon quarters.","Top with half the spring onions, drizzle\r\nwith a little olive oil and put in the oven\r\nfor 14 mins. Remove from the oven,\r\nsprinkle everything with the soy, then\r\nreturn to the oven for 4 mins more until\r\nthe salmon is cooked through. Sprinkle\r\nwith the remaining spring onions just\r\nbefore serving."]','2026-01-10 12:18:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6744,6744,'en','Sweet potato & chipotle mash','As an alternative to a classic comforting mash, try roasting sweet potatoes and crushing with spicy smoked chilli paste','["4 large sweet potatoes, about 1kg/2lb 4oz","1 tbsp chipotle paste","125ml soured cream","25g butter"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPut the potatoes in the oven and roast\r\nfor 50 mins until tender when pierced\r\nwith a knife. Peel off the skins, put the\r\nflesh in a bowl and mash until smooth.","Add the chipotle paste, soured cream\r\nand butter, and mix well. Season to taste."]','2026-01-10 12:18:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6745,6745,'en','Crunchy cucumber & radish salad','Add crunch and freshness to any Asian-inspired meal with this simple side dish','["1?2 cucumber","1?2 bunch radishes","2g vegetable oil","1 tsp rice wine vinegar"]','["Thinly slice the cucumber and radishes, and arrange on a plate.","Whisk together the vegetable oil and rice wine vinegar, and drizzle over the vegetables to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6746,6746,'en','Mexican bake','Raid your storecupboard and try out this fresh idea for canned beans with fajita spices – top with tortillas and cheese','["2 x 400g cans black beans, drained and rinsed","35g sachet fajita seasoning of your choice","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes with chilli","6 tortillas","140g Monterey Jack cheese or cheddar, grated"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nHeat a non-stick frying pan, add the black\r\nbeans and fajita spice mix, stir together and\r\ncook for 1-2 mins. Add the tomatoes and\r\nsimmer over a low heat for 10 mins.","Cut the tortillas in half. Lightly grease a\r\n2-litre baking dish. Spread a third of the\r\nbean mixture over the base of the dish,\r\nfollowed by 3 tbsp of the cheese and a\r\nlayer of tortillas. Repeat the process,\r\nfinishing with a tortilla layer on top.\r\nSprinkle over the remaining cheese.\r\nBake for 15 mins until golden."]','2026-01-10 12:18:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6748,6748,'en','Chicken, butter bean & pepper stew','Use storecupboard pulses and tasty chicken thighs in this healthy paprika-flavoured casserole with peppers and tomato','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","2 celery sticks, chopped","1 yellow pepper, deseeded and diced","1 red pepper, deseeded and diced","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tbsp paprika","400g can chopped tomatoes","150ml chicken stock","2 x 400g cans butter beans, drained and rinsed","8 skinless chicken thighs"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nHeat the oil in a large flameproof\r\ncasserole dish. Add the onion, celery\r\nand peppers, and fry for 5 mins. Add\r\nthe garlic and paprika, and cook for\r\na further 3 mins.","Stir in the tomatoes, stock and butter\r\nbeans, and season well. Bring to the boil,\r\nthen nestle the chicken thighs into the\r\nsauce. Cover with a tight-fitting lid and\r\nput in the oven for 45 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:18:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6750,6750,'en','Moroccan chicken with sweet potato mash','Fragrant, tender chicken and creamy sweet potato mash makes a comforting and low-fat midweek meal','["1kg sweet potatoes, cubed","2 tsp ras-el-hanout, or a mix of ground cinnamon and cumin","4 skinless, boneless chicken breasts","2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, thinly sliced","1 fat garlic clove, crushed","200ml chicken stock","2 tsp clear honey","juice ½ lemon","handful green olives, pitted or whole","20g pack coriander, leaves chopped"]','["Boil the potatoes in salted water for\r\n15 mins or until tender. Mix the ras el\r\nhanout with seasoning, then sprinkle all\r\nover the chicken. Heat 1 tbsp oil in large\r\nfrying pan, then brown the chicken for\r\n3 mins on each side until golden.","Lift the chicken out of the pan. Add the\r\nonion and garlic and cook for 5 mins until\r\nsoftened. Add the stock, honey, lemon\r\njuice and olives, return the chicken to the\r\npan, then simmer for 10 mins until the\r\nsauce is syrupy and the chicken cooked.","Mash the potatoes with 1 tbsp oil and\r\nseason. Thickly slice each chicken breast\r\nand stir the coriander through the sauce.\r\nServe the chicken and sauce over mash."]','2026-01-10 12:18:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6752,6752,'en','Roasted ratatouille chicken','A classic chicken recipe that will keep the crowds coming back for more','["1 onion, cut into wedges","2 red pepper, seeded and cut into chunks","1 courgette, cut into chunks","1 small aubergine, cut into chunks","4 tomatoes, halved","4 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","4 chicken breasts, skin on","few rosemary sprigs (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Lay \r\nall the vegetables and the tomatoes in a \r\nshallow roasting tin. Pour over the olive oil \r\nand give everything a good mix round until \r\nwell coated (hands are easiest for this).","Put the chicken breasts, skin side up, on \r\ntop of the vegetables and tuck in some \r\nrosemary sprigs, if using. Season everything \r\nwith salt and black pepper and drizzle a little \r\noil over the chicken. Roast for about 35 mins \r\nuntil the vegetables are soft and the chicken \r\nis golden. Drizzle with oil before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:18:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6754,6754,'en','Wholewheat pasta with broccoli & almonds','Brown spaghetti keeps you fuller for longer – team it with healthy greens flavoured with garlic, chilli and lemon','["2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 red chilli, deseeded and sliced (add extra chilli if you like)","3 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","250g wholewheat spaghetti","300g thin-stemmed broccoli, cut into pieces","zest 1 lemon","25g flaked toasted almonds","parmesan shavings (or vegetarian alternative), to serve"]','["Bring a large pan of salted water to the\r\nboil. Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in a\r\nlarge frying pan. Add the chilli and garlic,\r\nand cook on a low heat until golden.\r\nRemove from the heat.","Add the pasta to the water and cook\r\nfollowing pack instructions. In the final\r\n4 mins of cooking, add the broccoli.\r\nOnce cooked, drain and tip into the garlic\r\npan. Add the lemon zest and almonds,\r\nand toss together well. Serve in bowls,\r\ntopped with Parmesan shavings."]','2026-01-10 12:18:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6756,6756,'en','Greek beans with seared lamb','Braise butter beans or ‘gigantes’ with tomatoes, onion and garlic and serve with tender lamb fillet and crumbled feta cheese','["500g lamb fillet","1½  tbsp olive oil","3 garlic cloves, crushed","1 large onion, chopped","2 tbsp tomato purée","small bunch dill, most chopped","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","500ml chicken stock","2 x 400g cans gigante or butter beans, drained","2 tbsp crumbled feta cheese"]','["Rub the lamb with ½ tbsp of the oil\r\nand 1 garlic clove. Season well and set\r\naside to marinate while you prepare the\r\nbeans, or for up to 2 hrs if you have time.","Heat the remaining oil in a pan. Add the\r\nonion and remaining garlic, and season.\r\nFry for 8 mins until soft. Add the tomato\r\npurée, chopped dill, vinegar, stock and\r\nbeans, season, and simmer for 15 mins\r\nor until most of the liquid has evaporated.","Meanwhile, heat a frying pan until hot.\r\nSear lamb on all sides, for about 5 mins in\r\ntotal. Rest, covered with foil, for 5 mins,\r\nthen thickly slice. Serve the lamb with the\r\nbeans, scattered with feta and the\r\nremaining dill leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:18:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6758,6758,'en','Chicken with mushrooms','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA healthy and low calorie chicken casserole with bacon, peas and a parsley sauce – use chicken thighs for extra flavour and juiciness','["2 tbsp olive oil","500g boneless, skinless chicken thighs","flour, for dusting","50g cubetti di pancetta","300g small button mushrooms","2 large shallots, chopped","250ml chicken stock","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","50g frozen peas","small handful parsley, finely chopped"]','["Heat 1 tbsp oil in a frying pan. Season\r\nand dust the chicken with flour, brown on\r\nall sides. Remove. Fry the pancetta and\r\nmushrooms until softened, then remove.","Add the final tbsp oil and cook shallots\r\nfor 5 mins. Add the stock and vinegar,\r\nbubble for 1-2 mins. Return the chicken,\r\npancetta and mushrooms and cook for\r\n15 mins. Add the peas and parsley and\r\ncook for 2 mins more, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6760,6760,'en','Barley, chicken & mushroom risotto','Love risotto? Try this low-fat version, which swaps traditional risotto rice for pearl barley','["1 tbsp butter","1 tbsp olive oil","2 large shallots, finely sliced","1 garlic clove, chopped","3 skinless chicken breasts, cut into chunky pieces","300g pearl barley","250ml white wine","400g mixed wild and chestnut mushrooms, chopped","1 tbsp thyme leaf","1l hot chicken stock","3 tbsp grated parmesan","snipped chives, to serve (optional)","parmesan shavings, to serve (optional)"]','["In a large heavy saucepan, heat\r\nthe butter and oil. Sauté the shallots\r\nand garlic with some seasoning for\r\n5 mins, then stir in the chicken and\r\ncook for 2 mins.","Add the barley and cook for 1 min.\r\nPour in the wine and stir until it is\r\nabsorbed. Add the mushrooms and\r\nthyme, then pour over ¾ of the stock.\r\nCook for 40 mins on a low simmer until\r\nthe barley is tender, stirring occasionally\r\nand topping up with remaining stock if\r\nit looks dry. Remove from the heat and\r\nstir in the grated Parmesan. Serve\r\nimmediately, with chives and Parmesan\r\nshavings scattered over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6762,6762,'en','Pea & broad bean hummus with goat’s cheese & sourdough','Any leftover hummus from this summery lunch dish will keep well covered in the fridge for up to three days and makes a great snack with toasted pittas','["300g fresh or frozen peas","300g fresh broad beans, podded (no need to remove their pale green jackets) or use frozen (defrosted)","4 tbsp olive or sunflower oil","2 garlic cloves, peeled","zest 2 lemons, juice of 1","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","8 slices sourdough bread, halved","125g/4½ oz log soft, spreadable goat''s cheese","50g bag peas shoots (or use watercress)"]','["Tip the peas and beans into a large\r\npan of salted boiling water, then cook\r\nfor 3 mins. Drain, cool under cold water,\r\nthen drain again thoroughly.","Put the 4 tbsp oil in a pan, heat gently,\r\nthen add the garlic. Cook for 3 mins, very\r\nvery gently, until the oil is infused and the\r\ngarlic has softened but is not coloured.\r\nTip the oil and garlic into a jug and cool.","Whizz the peas, beans and almost all\r\nthe zest in a food processor, then trickle\r\nin the garlicky oil. Add the garlic cloves,\r\nalmost all the lemon juice and 1 tbsp\r\nextra virgin olive oil. The houmous should\r\nbe swirling around the bowl nicely by this\r\npoint, but not be too fine in texture. Scrape\r\nthe sides down if you need to. Season\r\nwell – you’ll need about 1 tsp sea salt\r\nand lots of black pepper. Add the rest of\r\nthe lemon juice to taste. Spoon into a\r\ndish, swirl the top, then drizzle over the\r\nremaining extra virgin olive oil.","To serve, toast the bread, then spread\r\nwith the goat’s cheese. Dollop a good\r\nspoonful of houmous onto each piece,\r\ndrizzle with a little more olive oil, scatter\r\nwith the remaining zest, then grind over\r\na little black pepper. Top with a few pea\r\nshoots and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6764,6764,'en','Sweet potato salad','This simple healthy salad of baked potato chunks makes a great alternative to mayonnaise-based versions','["1.2kg sweet potatoes, peeled and cut into biggish chunks","1 tbsp olive oil","2 shallots (or half a small red onion), finely chopped","4 spring onions, finely sliced","small bunch chives, snipped into quarters or use mini ones","5 tbsp sherry vinegar","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","2 tbsp honey"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the sweet potato chunks with the olive oil and some seasoning, and spread on a baking parchment-lined baking sheet. Roast for 30 - 35 mins until tender and golden. Cool at room temperature.","When just about cool whisk together all the dressing ingredients with a little more seasoning and gently toss through the potato chunks – use your hands to avoid breaking them up."]','2026-01-10 12:18:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6766,6766,'en','Almond butter','If you think there’s no spread quite like peanut butter, try this version, sweetened with honey, as an energy-boosting snack','["300g skin-on almonds","good drizzle honey","malt loaf or wholegrain bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nSpread the almonds on\r\na baking tray and roast for 10 mins.\r\nRemove and allow to cool.","Put into a food processor and whizz\r\nfor 12 mins, stopping every so often to\r\nscrape the sides down, and finish with a drizzle of honey. Serve spread\r\nover malt loaf or wholegrain bread.Will keep in the fridge for up to 3 weeks."]','2026-01-10 12:18:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6768,6768,'en','Pea, mint & chilli dip','A speedy guacamole-style purée that’s ready in minutes and perfect for snacking or lunchboxes','["400g frozen peas, defrosted","100g fat-free natural yogurt","juice 1 lemon","1 tsp ground cumin","small handful mint leaves","1 small red chilli, chopped","4 wholemeal pitta breads","500g carrots, cut into batons"]','["Whizz the peas, yogurt, lemon juice,\r\ncumin, mint and chilli together in a\r\nfood processor to a texture you like.\r\nDivide between plastic tubs to pack\r\ninto lunchboxes, or tip into a serving\r\nbowl. Lightly toast the pittas, then\r\ncut into wedges and serve with the\r\ndip and carrots."]','2026-01-10 12:18:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6770,6770,'en','Spicy bean & avocado tostados','Get the kids involved in making this easy veggie Mexican buffet with healthy beans and avocado','["4 flour tortillas","400g can refried beans","big pinch cayenne pepper","200g can kidney beans in water, rinsed","2 handfuls cherry tomatoes, quartered","50g vegetarian cheddar","1 green chilli, thinly sliced","1 avocado, halved, stoned and sliced","handful coriander leaves, to serve"]','["Heat grill to medium-high. Put 2 tortillas onto a large baking sheet, then grill for 2 mins. In a bowl, mix the refried beans, cayenne pepper, kidney beans and cherry tomatoes, then divide half the mix between the tortillas. Scatter with half of the cheese and half of the sliced chilli, then grill again until the cheese melts. Lift onto plates and top with half of the avocado and coriander to serve. Repeat with the remaining tortillas."]','2026-01-10 12:18:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6772,6772,'en','Homemade Cajun tortillas','Oven bake flour tortillas into crunchy chips flavoured with traditional Louisiana spices and serve with dip','["2 tbsp oil","1 tbsp Cajun spice mix","8 plain tortillas"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Mix\r\nthe oil with the Cajun spice\r\nmix. Brush the spiced oil over tortillas, stacking the tortillas on top of\r\neach other as you go. Cut the stack into\r\n8 wedges. Separate the wedges and\r\nevenly spread out on baking sheets and\r\nbake for 6-7 mins until golden and crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:18:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6774,6774,'en','Prawn cocktail squares','Banish the glassware and serve your prawn cocktails in one stylish, bite-size go','["100g mayonnaise (use light, if you prefer)","3 tbsp tomato ketchup","300g peeled cooked prawns","black pepper","4 large slices rye bread","¼ iceberg lettuce","cayenne pepper"]','["Mix mayonnaise with tomato ketchup. Add\r\npeeled cooked prawns and some\r\nblack pepper.","Cut 4 large slices rye\r\nbread into small squares – you should be\r\nable to get 6 squares from each.","Arrange on a platter. Shred lettuce,\r\ndivide between the squares, top each\r\nwith a spoonful of prawns then a\r\nsprinkle of cayenne pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:18:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6776,6776,'en','Sweet potatoes with mushrooms & rosemary','Not sure what to do with sweet potatoes? Here''s the perfect answer','["2 sweet potatoes, about 300g/10oz each","1 tbsp olive oil","200g chestnut mushrooms, halved","1 tsp chopped fresh rosemary or ½ tsp dried","2 tbsp freshly grated parmesan"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Prick\r\nthe potatoes several times with a fork, then\r\nmicrowave on High for 8-10 mins, turning\r\nonce, until tender. Meanwhile, heat the oil\r\nin a non-stick pan, add the mushrooms and\r\nrosemary and cook over a fairly high heat,\r\nstirring, until the mushrooms are tender and\r\nlightly coloured. Season to taste.","Put the potatoes in the oven and roast for\r\n15 mins until the skins start to crisp. Split\r\nopen and spoon over the mushrooms.\r\nSprinkle with Parmesan to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6778,6778,'en','Best ever chunky guacamole','This is the best version of this classic dip. The ingredients are kept to a minimum, so it''s as fresh-tasting as possible','["1 large ripe tomato","3 avocados, very ripe but not bruised","juice 1 large lime","handful coriander, leaves and stalks chopped, plus a few leaves, roughly chopped, to serve","1 small red onion, finely chopped","1 chilli, red or green, deseeded and finely chopped","tortilla chips, to serve"]','["Use a large knife to pulverise the tomato\r\nto a pulp on a board, then tip into a bowl.\r\nHalve and stone the avocados (saving a\r\nstone) and use a spoon to scoop out the\r\nflesh into the bowl with the tomato.","Tip all the other ingredients into the bowl,\r\nthen season with salt and pepper. Use a\r\nwhisk to roughly mash everything together.\r\nIf not serving straight away, sit a stone in the\r\nguacamole (this helps to stop it going\r\nbrown), cover with cling film and chill until\r\nneeded. Scatter with the coriander, if using,\r\nthen serve with tortilla chips or spicy wedges\r\nand sour cream."]','2026-01-10 12:18:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6780,6780,'en','Spicy seed mix','For a healthy snack nibble on this mix of sunflower, pumpkin and linseeds, or sprinkle on salads and soups','["250g mixed seeds (sunflower, pumpkin, linseed)","1 tsp rapeseed oil","1 tsp ras-el-hanout","¼ tsp low-sodium salt","1 tsp reduced salt soy sauce","1 tsp agave syrup","pinch cayenne"]','["Preheat the oven to 160C/ 140 fan/ Gas mark 3.","Mix all the ingredients together in a bowl and spread onto a baking sheet. Cook for 15  - 20 mins until dry and golden. Stir once during cooking. Allow to cool and store in a sealed container for up to 3 weeks."]','2026-01-10 12:18:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6782,6782,'en','Mexican chilli bean tortilla','Colourful and delicious – a veggie feast for all the family','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 x 420g cans pinto or kidney beans, drained","4 ripe tomatoes","1 large courgette, diced","1 tsp smoked paprika","2 tbsp roughly chopped coriander leaves","8 flour or corn tortillas","½  iceberg lettuce, shredded","1 mini cucumber, cut lengthways into very thin slices using a potato peeler","180ml tub soured cream and chive dip"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and cook the onion\r\nfor 2 mins. Add 1 can of the beans and heat for a\r\nfurther 2-3 mins, while mashing into the onions\r\nwith a masher or fork to make a rough paste.","Add the remaining can of beans, the tomatoes,\r\ncourgettes, paprika and 5 tbsp water. Cover and\r\nvery gently simmer for 10 mins until thickened\r\nand pulpy, stirring occasionally. Season to taste\r\nwith lime juice, salt and pepper, then stir in the\r\ncoriander. Warm the flour tortillas in a dry frying\r\npan, then lay out with the chilli beans, shredded\r\nlettuce, sliced cucumber and soured cream dip.\r\nAsk everyone to help themselves: fill, roll and eat!"]','2026-01-10 12:18:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6784,6784,'en','Herby pork with apple & chicory salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA healthy crisp salad served with a low-fat cut of herb-crusted pork – a quick supper that’s good for you','["400g/14oz pork tenderloin, trimmed of any fat and sinew","1 tbsp walnut oil","2 tsp wholegrain mustard","1 tbsp each chopped tarragon and parsley","juice 1 lemon","1 tbsp honey","2 large eating apple, cored and sliced","270g pack chicory, leaves separated"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Rub the pork with 1 tsp oil, 1 tsp mustard and some seasoning. Brown, transfer to a baking tray and press on half the herbs. Roast for 15 mins until just cooked.","To make the salad, mix the lemon juice, honey and remaining walnut oil and mustard together. Season and toss through the apples, chicory and remaining herbs. Serve the pork sliced, with the salad on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:18:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6786,6786,'en','Tandoori tilapia with spicy sweet potato mash & tomato salad','This Indian-influenced grilled fish supper packs in all of your five-a-day in one mildly spiced, light dish','["4 x 140g tilapia fillets","1 tbsp tandoori paste","1kg sweet potatoes, cut into small chunks","4 carrots, chopped","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","8 tomatoes, chopped","small red onion, thinly sliced","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Coat the tilapia fillets with the tandoori paste and set aside. Put the sweet potatoes, carrots and garlic in a large pan of salted water. Bring to the boil and cook for 10 mins or until tender. Drain well, then allow to steam-dry for a few mins. Add the chilli to the pan and mash everything together with some seasoning. Cover and keep warm.","Heat the grill to high. Grill the tilapia for 8-10 mins or until cooked through. Meanwhile, mix the salad ingredients together and serve alongside the tilapia and mash."]','2026-01-10 12:18:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6788,6788,'en','Cooking with kids: Fajitas','Mexican wraps to get the whole family in the kitchen – fill flour tortillas with marinated chicken and peppers','["4 chicken breasts, cut into chunks","olive oil, for frying","4 limes, juice only","2 tsp fajita seasoning","4 spring onions, finely sliced","1 fat garlic clove, crushed","1 red pepper","½ jar roasted pepper (we used Gaea Red Peppers Flame Roasted 290g)","1 small apple, peeled","4 ripe tomatoes","½ lime, juice only","small bunch coriander, leaves picked","chilli sauce, to taste (optional)","2 very ripe avocados, halved and stone removed","½ lime, juice only","grated cheese, to serve","6 - 8 tortillas (you can now get mini tortillas for kids)","soured cream (optional)"]','["Grown-ups:Put the chicken and marinade ingredients in a bowl and cover. Put in the fridge for at least two hours.","Children:If your children are 5 or over, you can get them to roughly chop the pepper, roasted pepper, apple and tomatoes for the salsa using a good quality firm plastic knife or cutlery knife. Otherwise do this yourself.  Younger children can pick the leaves from the coriander and mix them into the salsa.","Grown-ups:Tip the salsa ingredients into a food processor, along with the lime juice and a little seasoning and pulse until finely chopped. Take out 2 large spoons of the mixture for younger children, then add chilli sauce, if using, and pulse again to combine.","Children:Squeeze or spoon the avocado into a bowl and use a potato masher to mash it. Stir in the lime juice and some black pepper with a spoon. Lime juice can sting so grown ups may want to squeeze them for younger children.","Grown-ups:Heat a little olive oil in a frying pan and pour the contents of the chicken bowl into the pan. Cook for 5- 8 minutes or until the chicken chunks are cooked through.","Children:Put the grated cheese, salsa (for grown-ups and children), guacamole and sour cream in separate colourful bowls to put on the table.","Grown-ups:Heat the tortillas according to the pack instructions and put the cooked chicken in a bowl. Show children how to fill and roll their tortilla.","Children:Lay out your tortilla, choose your toppings, roll them up and eat!"]','2026-01-10 12:18:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6790,6790,'en','Spiced bulgur pilaf with fish','Use sustainable white fish in this North African-inspired rice one-pot with harissa and apricot – full of iron, fibre and 2 of your 5 -a-day','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, finely sliced","3 carrots, grated","2 tsp cumin seeds","2 tbsp harissa","200g bulghar wheat","6 dried apricots, chopped","700ml weak chicken stock (we made using 1 stock cube)","200g baby spinach","4 firm white fish fillets","4 thin lemon slices"]','["Heat the oil in a lidded flameproof\r\ncasserole dish. Tip in the onions and cook\r\nfor 10 mins until soft and golden. Add the\r\ncarrots and cumin, and cook for 2 mins\r\nmore. Stir through the harissa, bulghar and\r\napricots, pour over the stock and bring to\r\nthe boil. Cover and simmer for 7 mins.","Add the spinach and stir through until\r\njust wilted. Arrange the fish fillets on top,\r\npop a slice of lemon on each and season.\r\nReplace the lid and cook for 8 mins,\r\nkeeping over a low-ish heat.","Turn heat to low and cook for 7-8 mins\r\nmore until the fish is cooked through\r\nand the bulghar is tender. Season with\r\npepper and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6792,6792,'en','Warm roasted squash and Puy lentil salad','This fresh and vibrant salad makes use of tinned lentils, a store cupboard staple. The result is filling, low-fat and contains all of your five-a-day','["1kg butternut squash, chunkily diced","1½  tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tsp thyme leaves","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","1 tsp wholegrain mustard","2 x 400g cans Puy lentils in water","½ red onion sliced","100g bag spinach","150g cherry tomatoes, halved","40g Cheshire cheese","1-2 tbsp toasted pumpkin seeds"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4. Toss the butternut squash with 1 tbsp olive oil, garlic clove, thyme leaves and seasoning. Roast for 25-30 mins or until tender.","Mix together the balsamic vinegar, ½ tbsp olive oil, the wholegrain mustard and 1-2 tbsp water. Drain the Puy lentils in water and toss with the dressing, red onion, spinach and cherry tomatoes.","Divide the lentils between four plates. Top with the squash, then crumble over Cheshire cheese and pumpkin seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:18:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6794,6794,'en','Creamy chicken with asparagus & tarragon','A light and low calorie chicken casserole with silky herb sauce, greens and baby new potatoes','["500g baby new potatoes, halved","4 skinless chicken breasts","1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 large onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","350ml chicken stock","small bunch tarragon","175g asparagus, trimmed","3 tbsp reduced-fat crème fraîche"]','["Cook the potatoes in a large pan of\r\nboiling water for 8-10 mins until tender,\r\nthen drain and keep warm in the pan.\r\nSeason the chicken with ground black\r\npepper. Heat the oil in a large non-stick\r\nfrying pan. Gently fry the chicken with\r\nthe onion and garlic for 5 mins until both\r\nare lightly browned. Turn over the\r\nchicken once and stir the onion regularly.","Pour over the stock, add 2 sprigs of\r\ntarragon and bring to a gentle simmer.\r\nCook for 5 mins, then turn the chicken,\r\nadd the asparagus and cook for 3 mins\r\nmore. Chop the remaining tarragon.","Stir the crème fraîche and tarragon\r\ninto the pan with the chicken and heat\r\nthrough, stirring, for a few secs. Serve\r\nwith the new potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:18:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6796,6796,'en','Healthier risotto primavera','Angela Nilsen works her magic on this favourite Italian rice dish, making it low-fat and nourishing','["350g bunch asparagus","2 tbsp olive oil","1 bunch (about 9) spring onions, ends trimmed, sliced","175g fresh or frozen peas","250g shelled fresh or frozen broad beans","2 tbsp shredded basil","2 tbsp snipped chives","1 tbsp finely chopped mint","finely grated zest 1 lemon","1.7 litres/3 pints vegetable bouillon (we used Marigold)","4 shallots, finely chopped","3 plump garlic cloves, finely chopped","300g carnaroli or arborio rice","150ml dry white wine","25g parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), grated","25g rocket leaves"]','["Cut the woody ends off the asparagus,\r\nthen slice the stems into 5cm diagonal\r\nlengths. Heat half the oil in a large, wide\r\nnon-stick frying pan. Tip in the asparagus\r\nand stir-fry over a medium-high heat for\r\nabout 4 mins or until nicely browned all\r\nover (Step 1). Stir in the spring onions and fry\r\nfor 1-2 mins with the asparagus until\r\nbrowned. Remove, season with pepper\r\nand set aside. Cook the peas and beans\r\nseparately in a little boiling water for\r\n3 mins each, then drain each through\r\na sieve. When the broad beans are cool\r\nenough to handle, pop them out of their\r\nskins. Set the peas and beans to one\r\nside. Mix the basil, chives, mint and\r\nlemon zest together in a small bowl\r\nand season with pepper (Step 2). Set aside.","Pour the stock into a saucepan and\r\nkeep it on a very low heat. Pour the\r\nremaining oil into a large, wide sauté\r\npan. Tip in the shallots and garlic, and\r\nfry for 3-4 mins until soft and only\r\nslightly brown. Stir in the rice and\r\ncontinue to stir for 1-2 mins over a\r\nmedium-high heat. As it starts to sizzle, pour in the wine and stir again until\r\nthe wine has been absorbed. Start to\r\nstir in the hot stock, 1½ ladlefuls at a\r\ntime (Step 3), so it simmers and is absorbed\r\nafter each addition. To tell when it is\r\nready to have the next 1½ ladlefuls\r\nadded, drag the spoon across the\r\nbottom of the pan and it should leave\r\na clear line. Keep stirring the whole\r\ntime, to keep the risotto creamy.\r\nContinue adding the stock as above –\r\nafter 20 mins the rice should be soft with\r\na bit of chew in the middle. If it isn’t,\r\nadd more stock – you should still have\r\nat least a ladleful of stock left at this\r\npoint. Season with pepper, you shouldn’t\r\nneed to add any salt.","Take the pan off the heat. Pour over\r\na ladleful of the remaining stock to keep\r\nthe mixture fluid, then scatter over all the\r\nvegetables, a grinding of pepper, half\r\nof the herb mix (Step 4) and half the cheese.\r\nCover with the pan lid and let the risotto\r\nsit for 3-4 mins to rest. Gently stir\r\neverything together, if necessary adding\r\na drop more remaining stock for good\r\nconsistency. Ladle into serving dishes\r\nand serve topped with a small pile of\r\nrocket and the rest of the herbs and\r\ncheese scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6798,6798,'en','Spanish seafood pasta','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyItaly and Spain collide in this paella-like dish of orzo pasta with chorizo, peas and your seafood of choice','["350g short pasta shapes (we used orzo )","1 chicken stock cube","1 tsp turmeric or a large pinch of saffron strands","85g chorizo, diced","200g pack mixed cooked seafood","2 roasted red peppers,from a jar, sliced","100g frozen peas","2 tbsp chopped parsley"]','["Cook the pasta in lots of water\r\nfollowing pack instructions, with\r\nthe stock cube and half the turmeric\r\nor saffron. About 7 mins before\r\nthe pasta is cooked, tip the chorizo\r\ninto a frying pan and cook over a\r\nmedium heat for 5 mins until slightly\r\ncrisp. Tip out some of the fat, then\r\nadd the remaining turmeric or\r\nsaffron, seafood, peppers and peas.","Drain the pasta, reserving some\r\nof the stock. Tip the pasta back\r\ninto the pan, add the chorizo and\r\nseafood mixture and a splash of\r\nthe reserved stock, and heat\r\nthrough. Stir in most of the parsley.","Serve in warm bowls, with the\r\nremaining parsley sprinkled on top."]','2026-01-10 12:18:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6800,6800,'en','Italian vegetable bake','A vibrant dish for slow cookers, layer summery courgettes, tomatoes and aubergine with bread and mozzarella – irresistible!','["4 garlic cloves, 3 crushed, 1 left whole","400g can chopped tomatoes","bunch oregano, leaves chopped","large pinch chilli flakes","about 300g/11oz baby or normal aubergines, sliced","2 courgettes, sliced","½ large jar roasted red peppers","3 beef tomatoes, sliced","bunch basil, torn (save a few leaves for sprinkling over)","small baguette, sliced and toasted","2 x 125g balls mozzarella, torn","green salad, to serve"]','["Put the slow cooker onto the High\r\nor the browning setting and tip in the\r\ncrushed garlic, canned tomatoes, half\r\nthe oregano leaves, chilli and some\r\nseasoning. Cook, covered, while you\r\nchop the rest of the vegetables.","Tip out most of the sauce and start\r\nlayering up half the vegetables and\r\nherbs with seasoning – the aubergines,\r\ncourgettes, red peppers, tomatoes,\r\nbasil and remaining oregano. Layer in\r\nhalf the bread, rubbed with the whole\r\ngarlic clove, half the mozzarella and\r\nhalf the tipped-out tomato sauce. Repeat\r\nvegetable, herb and tomato sauce layers,\r\nfollowed by the bread and mozzarella.\r\nPush everything down well to compress,\r\nthen cook on high for 5-6 hrs.","Flash under the grill before serving\r\nif you like (and your slow cooker pot\r\nis suitable), until golden and bubbling.\r\nServe with the leftover basil leaves\r\non top and a big salad on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:18:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6802,6802,'en','Squash, lentil & bean one-pot with fig raita','Hit your whole 5-a-day with this curried veggie spice-pot, packed with pulses and squash, served with cooling yogurt dip','["400g piece butternut squash, peeled, deseeded and chunkily diced","1 onion, sliced","1 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp ground cumin","½  tsp chilli flakes","400g can chopped tomatoes","100g dried red lentils","2 tsp agave syrup or brown sugar","2 tsp red or white wine vinegar","400g can kidney beans, drained and rinsed","2 dried figs, finely chopped","150ml pot fat-free natural yogurt","½ small bunch parsley, chopped"]','["Fry the squash and onion in the oil for\r\n5-8 mins until the onion is softened. Stir\r\nin the cumin and chilli for 1 min. Add the\r\ntomatoes plus a canful of water from\r\nthe tomato can, the lentils, agave or\r\nsugar and vinegar. Bring to a simmer\r\nand cook for 10 mins, then stir in the\r\nbeans and cook for a further few mins\r\nuntil the lentils are tender and the\r\nbeans heated through.","Meanwhile, mix the figs, yogurt and\r\nparsley together. Season the stew, then\r\nserve in bowls with fig raita on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:18:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6804,6804,'en','Salmon & cucumber sushi rolls','Follow our simple step-by-step guide to rolling your own, low-fat and healthy Japanese sushi','["2 nori sheets","100g skinless salmon fillets (use really fresh), thinly sliced lengthways","¼ cucumber, deseeded, thinly sliced lengthways","squeeze wasabi, plus extra to serve","pickled sushi ginger, to serve","light soy sauce, to serve","salmon roe, to serve (optional)","100g sushi rice","2 tsp saké or mirin (optional)","1 tbsp caster sugar (omit if using mirin)","25ml rice vinegar"]','["First, make the rice. Rinse the sushi\r\nrice in a colander, massaging it with your\r\nhands until the water runs clear. Leave\r\nto drain for 15 mins.","Put the rice in a saucepan with 200ml\r\nwater and the sake or mirin, if using.\r\nBring to the boil, then cover with a lid,\r\nreduce the heat to low and simmer\r\nfor 20 mins until the liquid is absorbed.\r\nRemove from the heat. Set aside,\r\ncovered, for 15-20 mins.","Transfer to a large bowl. Dissolve the\r\nsugar, if using, in the vinegar with a good\r\npinch of salt, pour over the rice and mix.\r\nCover with a damp tea towel and set aside\r\nat room temperature until ready to use.","Put 1 nori sheet on a bamboo mat and\r\ncover the surface with half of the cooled\r\nrice. Lay half of the salmon and cucumber\r\nslices along the length of the rice in a\r\nstrip, being careful not to overfill it. Run\r\na pea-sized blob of wasabi (more if you\r\nlike it really hot) along the edge of the filling with your finger.","Roll up tightly and squeeze to seal\r\nwhen you reach the end. Repeat with the\r\nremaining nori, salmon and cucumber,\r\nand more wasabi. Slice each roll into\r\n6 pieces, and serve with extra wasabi,\r\nginger, soy sauce and salmon roe, if you\r\nlike.Will keep in the fridge for 1 day."]','2026-01-10 12:18:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6806,6806,'en','Bombay potato & spinach pies','These spicy filo pies are ideal for a lunch with salad or as part of a buffet','["1¼kg large waxy potatoes such as Charlotte, halved","85g butter","2 onions, chopped","1 tbsp cumin seed","1 tbsp black mustard seed","2 tbsp finely chopped ginger","2 red chillies, halved, deseeded and sliced","3 tbsp Korma paste","400g bag fresh spinach","4 tomatoes, chopped","small bunch coriander, chopped","270g pack filo pastry (6 large sheets)","50g melted butter","1 tsp black mustard seed"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nTo make the filling, heat a pan of salted\r\nwater. When boiling, add potatoes and\r\nboil for 15 mins until tender. Melt the\r\nbutter then fry the onions for a few mins.\r\nAdd cumin, mustard seeds, ginger and\r\nchillies and fry, stirring occasionally, for\r\nabout 7 mins until soft. Stir in curry paste.","Cook the spinach in the microwave on\r\nHigh for 5 mins. Drain and squeeze out\r\nas much liquid as you can, then chop it.\r\nDrain the potatoes and tip them into the\r\nspice mixture. Crush lightly to break\r\nthem up into chunks rather than mash.\r\nToss in the spice mixture with plenty of\r\nsalt to coat them, then add the spinach,\r\ntomatoes and coriander.","Carefully unroll the pastry and brush\r\n2 x 20cm loose-bottomed sandwich tins\r\nwith some butter. Brush the first sheet of\r\npastry and lay it in and across the tin so\r\nthat it hangs over the side. Do the same\r\nwith another sheet of pastry to cover the\r\nother side of the tin (so the two form a\r\ncross), butter and fold the final sheet in\r\nhalf and lay it in the base of the tin to\r\ncreate a firm base. Do the same with the\r\nother tin and remaining pastry.","Spoon the filling into the tin and fold up\r\nthe pastry that is overhanging so that it\r\ncovers the filling. Brush generously with\r\nthe remaining butter and sprinkle with\r\nseeds. Bake for 35 mins until golden and\r\ncrisp. Serve with a salad and mango\r\nchutney, or a raita made by mixing plain\r\nyogurt with mint sauce or jelly, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6807,6808,'en','Spicy pepper & tomato soup with cucumber yogurt','Serve this healthy, vibrant, veggie blend cold as a Spanish-style gazpacho or hot as a comforting supper','["2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra to serve","2 onions, finely sliced","1 carrot, finely chopped","3 red peppers, roughly chopped","3 garlic cloves, sliced","1 red chilli, sliced","400g can chopped tomatoes","850ml-1 litre/1½-1¾pts vegetable stock or bouillon","4 tbsp Greek-style yogurt","½ cucumber, halved, deseeded, coarsely grated and squeezed of excess water","a few mint leaves, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan.\r\nTip in the onions, carrot and peppers.\r\nCook gently for 15 mins, to soften.\r\nAdd the garlic and chilli, and cook for\r\na few mins more. Pour over the chopped\r\ntomatoes and 800ml of the stock. Bring\r\nto the boil and simmer for 10-15 mins\r\nuntil the veg is completely tender.","Meanwhile, mix the yogurt, cucumber\r\nand mint in a bowl, and season.","Blitz the soup with a hand blender until\r\nsmooth, using the extra stock to thin if it\r\nhas become too thick. Heat through,\r\nseason and spoon into bowls. Serve\r\nwith a dollop of the yogurt mixture\r\non top and a drizzle of olive oil."]','2026-01-10 12:18:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6809,6809,'en','Courgette & tomato soup','Batch cook a vegetable soup when you have a seasonal bounty and you''ll always have a healthy meal in the freezer','["1 tbsp butter","2 onions, chopped","1kg courgettes, sliced","1kg tomatoes, chopped","2 tbsp plain flour","½  tsp turmeric","2l chicken or vegetable stock from cubes","crusty bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Melt the butter in a large pan,\r\nadd the onions and courgettes, and\r\ncook for 5 mins on a medium heat,\r\nstirring occasionally.","Add the tomatoes and flour. Cook\r\nfor a couple of mins, stirring around\r\nto stop the flour from becoming lumpy.\r\nAdd the turmeric and stock, cover and\r\nsimmer for 30 mins.","Purée with a stick blender, then sieve\r\nif you want a really smooth texture.\r\nServe hot with crusty bread, if you like,\r\nor chill, then freeze for up to 2 months."]','2026-01-10 12:18:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6811,6811,'en','Roast chicken & pea risotto','Make something special from your leftover roast chicken with this rich, creamy recipe','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","350g risotto rice","1 small glass white wine","1l hot stock","2 chicken breasts from the roast chicken, chopped","1 tbsp thyme leaf","200g frozen peas","1 tbsp crème fraîche","2 tbsp grated parmesan, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat oil in a large pan and cook the\r\nonion and garlic for 5 mins. Stir in the rice\r\nand cook for 1 min more, until it starts to\r\nlook transparent. Pour in the wine and\r\nkeep stirring until all the liquid is absorbed.","Add the stock and simmer until the\r\nrice is just tender. Stir through the\r\nchicken, thyme and peas, then cook for\r\n2 mins or until the chicken is warmed\r\nthrough. Add the crème fraîche and\r\nParmesan with some seasoning, then\r\nremove from the heat. Cover with a lid\r\nand leave to stand for 2 mins before\r\nserving with extra Parmesan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6813,6813,'en','Charred aubergine, pepper & bulgur salad','Flavour basic grains with sundried tomatoes, aubergines, red peppers and olives for a versatile side dish','["175g bulghar wheat","2 tbsp sundried tomato paste","4 baby aubergines, each sliced lengthways into 3","1 red pepper, sliced lengthways into 1cm pieces","2 tsp olive oil","handful basil leaves"]','["Prepare bulghar following pack\r\ninstructions. Tip into a large bowl and\r\nstir through the tomato paste. Season.","Heat a BBQ or griddle pan to high.\r\nDrizzle the aubergines and red pepper\r\nwith the oil and cook for 5 mins on\r\neach side until lightly charred.","Stir the aubergines and red pepper\r\ninto the bulghar mixture, then season\r\nand stir through the basil."]','2026-01-10 12:18:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6815,6815,'en','Moroccan tomato & chickpea soup with couscous','This filling soup is healthy and packed with the flavours of North Africa: harissa, ginger, lemon and coriander','["75g couscous","3 tbsp olive oil","750ml hot vegetable stock","1 large onion, finely chopped","1 carrot, chopped into small cubes","4 garlic cloves, crushed","half a finger of ginger, peeled and finely chopped","1-2 tbsp ras-el-hanout","1 tbsp harissa paste, plus extra to serve","400g tin chopped tomatoes","400g tin chickpeas","juice ½ lemon","roughly chopped coriander, to serve"]','["Tip the couscous into a bowl, season with salt and pepper and stir through 1 tbsp of the oil. Pour over enough hot stock just to cover and cover the bowl with cling film and set aside.","Heat the rest of the oil in a saucepan and cook the onion and carrot gently for 8 mins until softened. Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 2 mins more then stir in the ras el hanout and harissa and cook for another minute. Pour in the tomatoes and stock and give everything a good stir. Season, add the chickpeas and simmer everything gently for 20 mins until thickened slightly then squeeze over the lemon.","Uncover the couscous and fluff up with a fork. Spoon the soup into bowls, top each with a mound of couscous, scatter with coriander and serve with extra harissa for those who want it."]','2026-01-10 12:18:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6817,6817,'en','Tuna rainbow salad','Red, yellow, purple, green – not quite a whole rainbow, but this vibrant salad of tinned fish and veggies comes close','["1 red pepper, sliced","1 large carrot, grated","340g can sweetcorn kernels, drained","150g sugar snap peas","6 cooked baby beetroot, quartered","185g can flaked tuna in spring water, drained","100g mayonnaise","1 tbsp lemon juice","2 tsp wholegrain mustard","1 tsp water","lettuce leaves","1 spring onion, sliced"]','["In a large bowl, mix together red pepper, carrot, sweetcorn, sugar snap peas, beetroot and tuna.","In a small bowl, mix together mayonnaise, lemon juice, wholegrain mustard, water and\r\nseasoning, if you like, to make a dressing.","Line a large bowl with lettuce leaves, fill with the salad and\r\ndrizzle with dressing. Top with spring onion and serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:18:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6819,6819,'en','Curried chicken & mango salad','This lightly-spiced, fruity salad is a modern take on Coronation chicken – a low calorie-lunch for two','["6 chicken mini fillets","1 tsp olive oil","2 tsp curry powder","4 tbsp Greek yogurt","2 tbsp mango chutney","zest ½ lime and 2 tsp juice","1 Little Gem lettuce, leaves separated","1 ripe mango, peeled and sliced","½ red onion, finely sliced","2 tsp toasted sesame seeds"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nToss the chicken in the oil and 1 tsp of\r\nthe curry powder, season and mix well\r\nto coat. Put the chicken on a foil-lined\r\nbaking tray and bake for 20 mins until\r\ncooked through. Leave to cool a little,\r\nthen slice.","Meanwhile, make the dressing. In\r\na bowl, combine the remaining curry\r\npowder with the yogurt, chutney and\r\nlime zest and juice (add 1 tbsp water\r\nif the dressing is a little thick).","To serve, arrange the lettuce leaves\r\non 2 plates. Top with the mango and\r\ncooked chicken, then drizzle with the\r\ndressing. Scatter with the red onion\r\nand sesame seeds before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:18:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6821,6821,'en','Chicken livers on toast','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyNot just for stuffings and pâtés, pan-fried chicken livers make a good-value starter or light lunch','["250g chicken livers","2 shallots, finely chopped","large handful flatleaf parsley, leaves very roughly chopped","1 tbsp capers, rinsed and drained, roughly chopped","2 tbsp olive oil","3 tbsp sherry vinegar","4 slices nice bread, such as sourdough","1 tbsp plain flour","large pinch cayenne pepper"]','["Pick over the livers, cutting away any\r\nfatty bits and sinew, then pat the livers\r\ndry. Place the shallot, parsley and capers\r\ninto a bowl and drizzle with half the olive\r\noil and 1 tbsp of the Sherry vinegar.","Toast the bread (preferably on a griddle\r\nbut a toaster is fine). Toss the livers in\r\nthe flour and cayenne pepper, and\r\nseason generously with salt and pepper.\r\nHeat the rest of the oil in a frying pan and\r\nfry the livers over a really high heat for\r\n4-5 mins until brown and crisp on the\r\noutside and cooked, but still a little pink\r\nin the middle. Splash remaining vinegar\r\ninto the pan and bubble down for 1 min.","Tip the contents of the pan in with the\r\nshallot and parsley, toss everything\r\ntogether, season to taste, then pile onto\r\nthe toasted bread. Season with a little\r\ncrunchy sea salt and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6823,6823,'en','Cherry tomato, kale, ricotta & pesto pasta','Fresh basil sauce and cherry tomatoes give this healthy dish a beautiful colour – it’s also full of fibre and vitamin C','["2 tbsp olive oil","3 garlic cloves, chopped","1 tsp crushed chilli flakes","2 x 400g cans cherry tomatoes","500g penne","200g kale, chopped","4 tbsp ricotta","4 tbsp fresh pesto","parmesan or vegetarian alternative, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan, add\r\nthe garlic and cook for 2 mins until\r\ngolden. Add the chilli flakes and tomatoes,\r\nseason well, and simmer for 15 mins until\r\nthe sauce is thick and reduced.","While the sauce is cooking, cook the\r\npasta following pack instructions – add\r\nthe kale for the final 2 mins of cooking.\r\nDrain well and stir into the sauce, then\r\ndivide between 4 bowls. Top each with\r\na dollop of ricotta, a drizzle of pesto and\r\nshavings of Parmesan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6825,6825,'en','Easy sultana scones','The perfect weekend bake, a batch of these fluffy sultana scones won’t last long. Serve with plenty of butter and jam for an afternoon treat','["500g self-raising flour, sieved, plus extra for dusting","175g softened butter, cut into small pieces","3 tbsp caster sugar","150g sultanas","2 eggs, lightly beaten","a splash of milk, plus extra for brushing","clotted cream and jam, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Line a large baking tray with baking parchment. Tip the flour and butter into a large bowl. Gently start to rub the butter into the flour using your fingertips, allowing it to fall from a short height above the bowl. This will incorporate air into the scones, making them beautifully light. Continue doing this until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs.","Add a pinch of salt, the sugar, sultanas, eggs and enough milk to bring the mixture together into a soft dough. The amount of milk will vary accordingly to the size of the eggs, softness of the butter and temperature of the room. Be careful not to overwork the tough or it will become tough.","Turn the dough out onto a lightly floured surface. Generously flour a rolling pin and roll the dough out to a 2cm thickness. Cut into squares or triangles using a sharp knife, then transfer the scones to the prepared baking tray, spacing them apart to leave room for spreading. Brush the tops with a little milk, then bake for 10 mins. Leave to cool until just warm, then serve with clotted cream or butter and jam, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6827,6827,'en','Easiest ever paella','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThink paella''s too much of a challenge? Think again, this easy recipe makes it foolproof and is full of fantastic flavour','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 leek or onion, sliced","110g pack chorizo sausage, chopped","1 tsp turmeric","300g long grain rice","1l hot fish or chicken stock","200g frozen pea","400g frozen seafood mix, defrosted"]','["Heat the oil in a deep frying pan, then soften the leek for 5 mins without browning. Add the chorizo and fry until it releases its oils. Stir in the turmeric and rice until coated by the oils, then pour in the stock. Bring to the boil, then simmer for 15 mins, stirring occasionally.","Tip in the peas and cook for 5 mins, then stir in the seafood to heat through for a final 1-2 mins cooking or until rice is cooked. Check for seasoning and serve immediately with lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:18:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6829,6829,'en','Mustardy pork & apples','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyMake yourself a wholesome and traditional British square meal with this recipe','["4 pork steaks, approx 140g/5oz each, trimmed of excess fat","1 tbsp oil","2 eating apple, cored and cut into eight","1 onion, halved and sliced","small handful sage leaves, torn, or 2 tsp dried","100ml/3½ fl oz chicken or ham stock (from a cube is fine)","2 tsp Dijon mustard or wholegrain mustard"]','["Rub the pork steaks with a little oil and season with pepper and salt to taste. Heat a large frying pan and fry the steaks for 2 mins on both sides until golden. Transfer to a plate. Adding a little more oil to the pan, fry the apples, onions and sage for 5 mins or until the apples have softened.","Pour in the stock and spoon in the mustard, then return the pork to the pan and simmer for 10 mins until the sauce has reduced by about a third and the pork is cooked through. Serve with veg and mashed potatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:18:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6831,6831,'en','Low sugar chocolate sandwich cake','Moist and squidgy, who would believe that this gorgeous chocolate cake is just 2g of sugar per slice? The creamy chocolate topping is also low in sugar but high in deliciousness','["150ml rapeseed oil, plus extra for greasing","250g cooked beetroot","50g cocoa","140g plain wholewheat flour","100g plain white flour","50g ground almonds","200g xylitol, such as Total Sweet","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 large egg","2 tsp vanilla extract","50ml skimmed milk","150ml pot natural bio-yogurt","2 tbsp cocoa","100g xylitol such as Total Sweet","150ml pot double cream"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C/gas 3 and grease then line the base of two x 20cm sandwich tins with baking parchment. To start making the chocolate cream stir the yogurt with the cocoa and xylitol until completely blended then set aside while you make the cake. This helps to dissolve the xylitol granules.","To make the cake, first blitz the beetroot in a food processor until it resembles a thick puree. Tip in the cocoa, flours, ground almonds, xylitol, baking powder and soda and pulse briefly to mix the ingredients together.","Now add the eggs, the 150ml rapeseed oil, vanilla extract and milk, and blitz again to make a smooth liquid batter.","Divide the mixture evenly between the tins working quickly, as the baking powder activates once in contact with the liquid ingredients, then bake for 25-30 mins until a skewer poked into the middle of the cake comes out clean. Cool for few mins then remove from the tins and finish cooling on a wire rack. Once cold, carefully strip off the lining paper.","To finish the chocolate cream, whip the double cream until it holds its shape. Stir the cocoa mixture then fold in all but 2 tsp. Spread a third on top of one of the cold sponge cakes, top with the remaining sponge and spread with the rest of the chocolate cream to create a swirly finish. Dot over the reserved cocoa mixture and gently feather in with the end of a teaspoon. The cake will keep in the fridge for a couple of days, but return to room temperature before eating for the best taste and texture."]','2026-01-10 12:18:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6833,6833,'en','Mediterranean fish stew with garlic toasts','Feed a crowd like a Mediterranean mamma, with this gloriously summery seafood stew','["3 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, sliced","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 red chilli, finely chopped","2 tbsp tomato purée","1kg tomatoes, roughly chopped","200ml white wine","350ml fish stock","3 strips orange zest","1kg skinless halibut fillets, cut into large chunks","500g clams","400g large raw prawns","handful flat-leaf parsley, chopped","1 large ciabatta loaf, cut into 1cm slices","5 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, halved"]','["To make the garlic toasts, drizzle the\r\nbread with oil, then griddle or grill until\r\ngolden all over. While the toasts are still\r\nhot, rub them with garlic and set aside.","Heat the oil in a wide, deep frying pan.\r\nAdd the onion and cook over a gentle heat\r\nfor 5 mins until softened. Stir through the\r\ngarlic and chilli and cook a couple of mins\r\nmore. Add the tomato purée and tomatoes.\r\nTurn up the heat and cook for 10-15 mins,\r\nstirring until the tomatoes are pulpy. Pour\r\nover the wine and cook for 10 mins more\r\nuntil most of it has boiled away.","Add the fish stock and orange zest and\r\nheat until gently simmering. Nestle the\r\nhalibut chunks into the liquid and cook\r\nfor 5 mins. Add the clams and prawns\r\nand cook for 5 mins more until the fish\r\nis cooked through and the clams have\r\nopened (discard any that haven’t).\r\nSprinkle the parsley over the stew\r\nand serve with the garlic toasts."]','2026-01-10 12:18:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6835,6835,'en','Spicy salmon & lentils','This dish is easy to cook but still packed full of flavour.','["2 tsp curry paste","410g can green lentils, drained and rinsed","2 salmon fillets, about 175g/6oz each","3 tbsp olive oil","juice of 1 lemon","2 large handfuls baby spinach"]','["Heat a large, lidded\r\nshallow pan over a medium heat. Tip in\r\nthe curry paste and fry briefly, stirring\r\nconstantly, until sizzling and aromatic. Add\r\nthe lentils with about quarter of a can of\r\nwater and season. Heat until simmering\r\nthen lay salmon on top, skin side up.Cover\r\nand leave salmon to cook for 6-8 minutes\r\nuntil it feels firm when prodded.","While salmon is cooking,\r\nmake the dressing. Mix together the olive\r\noil and lemon juice and season well.\r\nWhen salmon is cooked lift it out of the\r\npan with a fish slice and set aside. Turn\r\nthe heat up, stir in the spinach and a third\r\nof the dressing and cook until the spinach\r\nhas just wilted. Spoon the lentils and\r\nspinach onto two plates then sit the\r\nsalmon on top. Drizzle over the remaining\r\ndressing and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6837,6837,'en','Mussels with tomatoes & chilli','This spicy seafood recipe makes a fantastic meal for two but can be easily increased for a stylish dinner party starter','["2 ripe tomatoes","2 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 shallot, finely chopped","1 red or green chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","small glass dry white wine","1 tsp tomato paste","pinch of sugar","1kg cleaned mussels","good handful basil leaves"]','["Put the tomatoes in a heatproof bowl.\r\nCover with boiling water, leave for 3 mins,\r\nthen drain and peel. Quarter the tomatoes\r\nand scoop out and discard the seeds using\r\na teaspoon. Roughly chop the tomato flesh.","Heat the oil in a large pan with a tight-\r\nfitting lid. Add the garlic, shallot and chilli,\r\nthen gently fry for 2-3 mins until softened.\r\nPour in the wine and add the tomatoes,\r\npaste, sugar and seasoning (mussels\r\nare naturally salty so take care with the\r\nsalt). Stir well and simmer for 2 mins.","Tip in the mussels and give them a stir.\r\nCover tightly and steam for 3-4 mins,\r\nshaking the pan halfway through, until the\r\nshells have opened.","Discard any shells that remain shut, then\r\ndivide the mussels between two bowls and\r\nadd the basil leaves. Provide a large bowl for\r\nthe empty shells."]','2026-01-10 12:18:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6839,6839,'en','Thai spiced turkey patties with noodle salad','Treat yourself to this low-fat, healthy Thai dish after a hard day’s work, it’s quick and easy to make','["400g turkey breast or fillet, roughly chopped","1 lemongrass stalk, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","zest and juice 1 lime","3 tbsp low-sodium soy sauce","small bunch coriander, chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","2 nests medium wheat noodles","300g pack mixed peppers stir-fry vegetables","sweet chilli sauce, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the grill to Medium. Put the\r\nturkey in a food processor and pulse\r\nuntil minced. Add the lemongrass,\r\ngarlic and lime zest, and half the soy\r\nsauce, coriander and chilli, then pulse\r\nagain until combined. Tip the mix into\r\na bowl and add some black pepper.\r\nShape into 8 patties, then transfer to\r\na non-stick baking tray and grill for 3-4\r\nmins each side, until cooked through.","Meanwhile, soak the noodles following\r\npack instructions, then drain and add\r\nthe vegetables, the remaining soy sauce\r\nand the lime juice. Toss well, divide\r\nbetween plates and sprinkle with the\r\nremaining coriander and chilli. Serve with\r\nthe turkey patties and some sweet chilli\r\nsauce for dipping, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6841,6841,'en','Ham & leek cobbler','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyUse up a leftover chunk of ham in this healthy, but hearty, family supper','["2½ tbsp olive oil","450g leeks, trimmed and thickly sliced","450ml vegetable stock","100g self-raising flour, plus a little extra for rolling the dough","75ml fat-free natural yogurt","1 tsp thyme leaves, plus extra to decorate","140g frozen peas","85g chunk of ham, shredded","1 small apple or ½ large apple, grated"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Heat\r\n½ tbsp oil in a large pan, then fry the leeks,\r\nstirring for 5 mins until starting to soften. Add\r\nthe stock, then simmer for 5 mins.","Meanwhile, tip the flour into a bowl, make\r\na well in the centre, then add the yogurt,\r\nremaining oil, thyme leaves and a little salt.\r\nUsing a cutlery knife, mix to bring together\r\nto a soft dough. Divide into 4 and shape into\r\nrounds on a floured surface.","Stir the peas, ham and grated apple into\r\nthe leeks, then divide between 4 individual\r\npie dishes or one large dish. Top each with\r\na round of dough, scatter with more thyme,\r\nthen bake for 20 mins until golden."]','2026-01-10 12:18:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6843,6843,'en','Chicken with crispy Parma ham','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA delicious low-fat dish in just 30 minutes, perfect if friends drop by midweek','["450g new potatoes, halved if large","225g runner beans, trimmed and sliced","4 skinless chicken breasts","1 tbsp olive oil","4 slices Parma ham","1 garlic clove, crushed","juice 1 lemon"]','["Cook the new potatoes in boiling salted\r\nwater for 10-15 mins, until just tender,\r\nadding the green beans for the final\r\n2 mins. Meanwhile, put each chicken\r\nbreast between two sheets of cling film\r\nand bash them with a rolling pin until\r\nthey’re about 1cm thick. Season.","Heat a large frying pan and add the\r\nParma ham. Cook for 2 mins, until crisp.\r\nDrain on kitchen paper. Add the oil to the\r\npan and add two of the chicken breasts.\r\nCook for 3 mins each side, transfer to a\r\nplate and keep warm. Cook the other\r\ntwo breasts in the same way.","Remove the pan from the heat and add\r\nthe garlic and lemon juice. Toss in the\r\ndrained beans and potatoes and crumble\r\nin the Parma ham. Divide the chicken and\r\nveg between four plates."]','2026-01-10 12:18:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6845,6845,'en','Indian-spiced shepherd’s pie','A low-fat, superhealthy shepherd''s pie that can be popped in the freezer or enjoyed on the day','["500g pack lean minced lamb","1 onion, chopped","2 carrots, diced","2 tbsp garam masala","200ml hot stock (lamb, beef or chicken)","200g frozen peas","800g potatoes, diced","1 tsp turmeric","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped","juice half lemon, plus wedges to serve"]','["In a large non-stick frying pan, cook the lamb, onion and carrots, stirring often, until the lamb is browned and veg is starting to soften, about 8 mins. Add the garam masala and some seasoning and cook for a further 2 mins until fragrant. Pour in the stock, bring to the boil, tip in the peas and cook for a further 2 mins until the peas are cooked and most of the liquid has evaporated.","Meanwhile, cook potatoes in a large pan of salted water until just tender, about 8 mins. Drain well, return to the pan and gently stir in turmeric and coriander – try not to break up the potatoes too much.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Transfer the mince to a baking dish and top with the turmeric potatoes. Squeeze over the lemon juice, then bake for 30-35 mins until potatoes are golden. Serve immediately with extra lemon wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:18:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6847,6847,'en','Salmon with mustardy celeriac mash','If beauty is skin deep, then celeriac is a case in point – and it’s delicious when served as a creamy mash','["2 salmon fillets, about 100g/4oz each","700g celeriac, peeled to remove all the knobbly skin and cut into chunks like potato","2 tsp wholegrain mustard","2 tsp lemon juice","100g baby spinach leaves"]','["Brush the salmon lightly with olive oil, and season with salt and\r\npepper. Line a grill pan with foil and\r\nlay the salmon on top.","Place the celeriac in a pan with cold water to cover. Salt and\r\nbring to the boil. Lower the heat,\r\ncover and simmer for 12-15\r\nminutes until tender.\r\nPreheat the grill to medium.\r\nWhisk together the mustard, lemon\r\njuice, a pinch of sugar, salt, pepper\r\nand 1 tbsp olive oil.","Grill the salmon for five minutes\r\non each side. Meanwhile, drain the\r\nceleriac, reserving 1 tbsp cooking\r\nwater. Return the celeriac to the\r\npan. Mash until fairly smooth. Add\r\nthe spinach, stirring occasionally\r\nover a low heat, until wilted. Stir in\r\n1 tbsp mustard dressing and the\r\nreserved cooking water. Season.","Spoon the mash on to two warm\r\nplates and top each with a fillet.\r\nDrizzle over the leftover dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:18:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6849,6849,'en','Chana daal halva infused with saffron, cloves & cardamom','Make halva using chana daal (split baby chickpeas). Infused with saffron, cloves and cardamom flavours and scattered with nuts, it’s a moreish sweet treat','["400g chana daal, soaked overnight","750ml whole milk (or use soya or almond milk)","2 tbsp ghee or 1 tbsp unsalted butter and 1 tbsp sunflower oil","6 green cardamom pods, lightly crushed","6 cloves","340g golden caster sugar","small pinch of saffron","2 tbsp chopped pistachios","2 tbsp chopped almonds"]','["Put the chana daal in a large bowl, pour over water to cover, and leave overnight. Drain, then tip into a largesaucepan. Pour over the milk and bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to medium and simmer, stirring frequently, for 25-30 mins, until the milk is completely absorbed.","Set aside to cool for 20-30 mins, until it comes to room temperature. Tip into the bowl of afood processorand whizz until it becomes a smooth paste – you may need to loosen it with a splash of water if it’s too thick.","Heat the ghee (or oil and butter) in a saucepan over a low-medium heat. When hot, add the cardamom and cloves, and fry for a few seconds until fragrant.","Add the blended lentil paste and cook for 15 mins, stirring constantly, until it begins to smell nutty and turns a light brown in colour. Remove the pan from the heat.","In another saucepan (or you could wash up the saucepan used for the milk), warm the sugar and 100ml water over a medium heat for 10-12 mins until the sugar dissolves and reaches a temperature of 104C on a sugarthermometer. It should look syrupy. Remove from the heat.","Pour into the lentil mixture, add the saffron and mix well until smooth. Allow the halva to cool in the pan for around 30 mins until cool enough to handle.","Shape tablespoonfuls of the halva into cylindrical shapes using your hands, then arrange on plate, and scatter over the chopped nuts. Serve straightaway or cool completely and keep chilled for up to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:18:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6851,6851,'en','Pistachio bird’s nests','Make these pistachio ‘bird’s nests’, made with kataifi pastry (a very finely shredded filo pastry available online) and a lemon sugar syrup for a sweet treat','["40g pistachios","400g sugar","2 tbsp lemon juice","300g kataifi pastry","375g butter, melted"]','["Soak the pistachios in water for 30 mins. Dissolve the sugar in 500ml water in a pan over a medium heat, then bring to a boil and bubble for 15-20 mins or until reduced and lightly syrupy. Stir in the lemon and boil for a minute more.","Cover the kataifi with a damp cloth so it doesn’t dry out. Take a finely twisted 30cm length of pastry and wrap it in a circular motion around two fingers into a nest shape. Transfer to abaking tray, then repeat with the rest of the pastry.","Drain the pistachios and gently press four or five into the middle of each nest. Cover the nests with a layer of baking parchment, then put another baking tray on top and put a 1kg weight on top. Leave at room temperature for 1 hr, then remove the parchment and leave for another hour to dry out.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Pour the butter over and around the nests, so that they’re sitting in a layer of melted butter. Cook for 20-25 mins until golden brown, turning the tray from time to time to make sure the nests are evenly coloured. Leave to cool for 10 mins, then transfer to a clean baking tray and pour over the syrup. Leave to cool completely in the syrup, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6853,6853,'en','Strawberry halva hamantaschen','Enjoy these triangular cookies made with a filling of tahini, honey and strawberry jam. Hamantaschen are often enjoyed during the Jewish festival of Purim','["300g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","165g unsalted butter, softened","65g icing sugar","50g double cream","1 egg yolk","120ml tahini","2 tbsp honey","100g strawberry jam","1 egg, beaten"]','["To make the dough, mix all the ingredients together with your hands to form a dough. Cut it in half and form into two discs. Wrap the discs and chill for about 1 hr.","To make the halva filling, mix the tahini and honey in a small bowl with a pinch of sea salt. If it’s very thick, add a little water – take care not to add too much or it will become too liquid.","Roll out one of the pieces of dough on a lightly floured surface until it''s about 2-3mm thick. It’s important to keep it thin or the hamantaschen will be too chunky once folded. Cut out circles of the dough using a 6 or 7cm pastry cutter – the smaller the cutter, the more hamantaschen you will have.","Smear about ½ tsp of the halva filling on each circle, and top with about ¼ tsp jam – you don''t want any more than about a teaspoon of the two combined, or it will be awkward to fold and the filling will ooze out when baking.","To assemble the hamantaschen, paint the outer edge of a circle very lightly with egg wash. Take the lower left edge of the circle (if it was a clock face, it would be from 5 to 8 o''clock) and fold it at an angle towards the centre to make a flap that covers the left third of the circle. Next, take the opposite side of the circle (7 to 3 o’clock) and fold it up towards the centre, slightly overlapping the left side flap to create a triangular tip at the bottom of the circle. You should be able to see the filling in the middle. Finally, fold the top part of the circle downwards to create a third flap and complete the triangle — a small triangle of filling should be visible in the centre. Gently press the points of the triangle together to make them really stick. Ideally, you want the edges to be over the next one on one side and under on the other to create a pinwheel effect. Place the hamantaschen on abaking traylined with baking parchment and chill for 20-30 mins to firm up. Repeat with the remaining circles, then with the second disc of dough and the remaining filling.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bake for about 20 mins until golden brown – check after 15 mins that they’re not getting too dark. Transfer to awire rackto cool."]','2026-01-10 12:18:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6855,6855,'en','Shahi tukda','Enjoy a classic Mughal dessert of fried bread slices, steeped in sweetened cardamom milk, scented with saffron and rosewater and topped with chopped nuts','["¼ tsp saffron stands","7 cardamom pods, seeds removed, plus 1 tsp caster sugar","1 tsp caster sugar","4 slices white bread , medium thickness, 2 days old","sunflower oil, for shallow frying","1 litre full-fat milk","75g caster sugar","125ml double cream","few drops rose water","1 tbsp almonds, chopped","silver leaf (optional)"]','["Put the saffron in a small bowl with 2 tbsp warm water and set aside for 1 hr. Meanwhile, grind the cardamom seeds to a powder with the caster sugar using apestle and mortar.","Remove the crusts from the bread and cut the slices in half diagonally.","Pour the oil in a high-sided frying pan, until it''s 2cm deep, and place over a medium heat. Once the oil reaches 180C, or when a cube of bread browns in 30 seconds, carefully add the bread slices in batches, and cook until golden on both sides. Drain on kitchen paper and set side.","Heat the milk and ground cardamom mixture in awokor karahi over a medium-high heat, stirring occasionally. Once it comes to a boil, turn the heat to medium, and continue cooking the milk for about 15 mins, stirring often, until it''s reduced by half.","Mix a ladleful of hot milk with the cream in a bowl, then pour it back into the pan. Stir in the saffron and its soaking water, and enough rose water to lend a soft floral flavour.","Add the fried bread in a single layer to the creamy milk – you will probably need to do this in two batches. Soften the bread over a low heat for 2-3 mins, then remove with a slotted spoon and arrange in a single layer on a serving plate.","Turn the heat to medium and reduce the milk left behind in the pan for a few mins, stirring all the time until creamy – it should have the consistency of double cream.","Leave the milk to cool and thicken for 15 mins, and then spoon it over the bread. Chill overnight so that the bread softens.","Sprinkle with the chopped almonds and silver leaf, if using, for a special occasion. Serve chilled."]','2026-01-10 12:18:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6857,6857,'en','Boondi laddu','Celebrate Diwali with boondi laddu, a traditional Indian sweetmeat, made with fried gram flour droplets soaked in cardamom and saffron syrup','["¼ tsp saffron strands","8 green cardamom pods , seeds only","225g caster sugar, plus 1 tsp","125g gram flour","1 litre sunflower oil or 500g ghee, for deep-frying, plus extra for your hands","2 tbsp chopped pistachios","1 tbsp pine nuts, chopped, or dried melon seeds (char magaz)","225g caster sugar"]','["Grind the saffron strands using apestle and mortar, then transfer to a small bowl and leave to soak in 2 tbsp warm water for 1 hr.","Meanwhile, using the same pestle and mortar, pound the cardamom seeds to a powder with the 1 tsp sugar.","Sieve the gram flour into a large bowl and whisk in enough water to make a batter the consistency of double cream.","Half-fill awokor karahi with oil and heat it to 180C. It''s ready when a cube of bread browns in 30 seconds.","For the gram flour droplets, you will need a slotted spoon, or use a coarse metal sieve, although the gram flour droplets won’t have a round shape when fried. Hold the spoon or metal sieve 2cm over the hot oil. Using a ladle, carefully pour a ladleful of batter onto the spoon, gently pushing the batter through the holes in the spoon or sieve in a circular motion with the rounded base of the ladle.","If the batter is too thin, the droplets will flatten, so add a little more sieved gram flour if needed. If it''s too thick, the droplets will be elongated and have wispy tails – a spoonful of water will loosen the batter.","Fry the flour droplets in batches for 30-40 seconds without browning, then drain on kitchen paper. If you''re using a slotted spoon, wipe the spoon clean with kitchen paper between every batch.","Once the droplets have cooled, break up any clumps with your fingers and transfer to a large bowl. Stir in the ground cardamom, pistachio nuts and pine nuts (or melon seeds) and set side.","For the syrup, dissolve the sugar in 225ml water and boil for about 10 mins over a medium heat, until it starts to thicken. The temperature should reach 110C on a sugar thermometer.","Stir in the saffron and its soaking water, and boil the syrup for a further 1 minute. Remove from the heat and pour the hot syrup over the gram flour droplets. Using the back of a wooden spoon, roughly crush one-third of the droplets into the syrup. Cover the bowl and leave to cool before chilling the mixture for 1-2 hrs. This will thicken the syrup and make it easier to shape the laddus.","Lightly oil your hands and firmly squeeze and shape portions of the mixture into 14-16 balls, about the size of a walnut. Arrange them on a parchment-lined tray and store the laddus in an airtight box in the fridge.Will keep chilled for up to one week.Serve at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:18:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6859,6859,'en','Pistachio eclairs','Flex your baking skills with these heavenly pistachio eclairs, made with choux pastry and pistachio custard – they’re well worth the effort','["250ml milk","45g pistachio paste","4 egg yolks","60g golden caster sugar","25g plain flour","15g cornflour","25ml whipping cream","125ml milk","65g unsalted butter, diced","125g plain flour","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","4 medium eggs, lightly beaten","25g icing sugar","1 ball of stem ginger, finely chopped","25g pistachios, toasted and roughly chopped"]','["Start by making the custard filling. Heat the milk with the pistachio paste.Whiskthe egg yolks in a separate bowl with the sugar, flour and cornflour until smooth. When the milk is steaming, just before boiling, gradually pour it over the yolk mixture and whisk thoroughly. Return the mixture to the heat and cook until thickened and starting to boil. It will go very lumpy, but keep whisking vigorously until smooth. Pour into a clean bowl. Cover and leave to cool completely.The pistachio custard can be made up to two days in advance and kept in an airtight container in the fridge.","Meanwhile, make the choux. Heat the milk, 125ml water and the butter in a large saucepan and bring to the boil. Take off the heat and add the flour, sugar and a pinch of salt. Mix and return to the heat, stirring with a wooden spoon until the mixture is smooth and comes away from the sides of the pan. Tip into a tabletop mixer and mix with the paddle attachment until the mixture has cooled (if you don’t have a mixer, spread out on a plate to cool). Once cooled, start gradually beating in the egg (either in thetabletop mixeror with an electric hand whisk) until fully incorporated. You want the mixture to be glossy and just fall off the spoon in 3-5 seconds. Put in a piping bag and set aside.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Line two baking trays with baking parchment. Snip about 1cm off the end of the piping bag and pipe the choux pastry down in a 10cm line, then back on itself, leaving space between the eclairs for the choux to expand. You may need to do this in batches. Bake for 3-4 mins, then reduce the heat to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bake for 12-15 mins more until golden all over and cooked through. Remove, pierce the side of each one to let out the steam, then cool them on awire rack.Can be made a day ahead and kept in an airtight container.","When ready to assemble, whip the cream until soft peaks form, then set aside. Using electric beaters, whisk the custard mixture until smooth. Fold in the whipped cream using aspatulaand put the custard in a piping bag.","To serve, cut the choux pastry in half horizontally and fill with blobs of the pistachio custard. Using a fine sieve, liberally dust the tops with icing sugar and sprinkle with stem ginger and chopped pistachios just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:18:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6861,6861,'en','Cardamom-spiced vermicelli (semiya payasam)','Indulge in a popular Indian dessert made with fried vermicelli strands simmered in cardamom milk. A perfect treat for festivities, it’s creamy, sweet and golden','["10 green cardamom pods, seeds removed","1 tsp caster sugar","1 litre whole milk","75g ghee","75g fine vermicelli, roughly crushed","100g jaggery or light muscovado sugar","250ml coconut milk","50g raisins, soaked in hot water for 10 mins then drained","50g cashews, fried until golden in 1 tsp ghee"]','["Pound the cardamom seeds to a powder with the caster sugar using apestle and mortar. Tip into a saucepan with the milk and bring to a boil over a medium heat, stirring occasionally.","Heat the ghee in awokor karahi over a medium heat and fry the vermicelli for 3-5 mins, stirring continuously, until they darken.","Pour the boiling milk over the vermicelli and continue simmering, stirring all the time, for 5 mins or until it thickens. Stir in the jaggery or muscovado sugar and cook for a further 2-3 mins.","Whisk the coconut milk to break up any lumps and pour it into the pan. Bring up to a simmer, then stir in the raisins. Spoon into small bowls and scatter over the fried cashews before serving immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:18:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6863,6863,'en','Gulab jamun','Make one of India’s most cherished festival desserts, gulab jamun. These fried dumplings are scented with cardamom and steeped in rose and saffron syrup','["4 green cardamom pods, pierced","600g caster sugar","few drops rosewater","¼ tsp saffron strands, soaked in 2 tbsp warm water for an hour","2 tsp chopped pistachios","1 tsp caster sugar","6 green cardamom pods, seeds removed","100g full-cream milk powder","40g plain flour","½ tsp baking powder","50g homemade ghee (see below), or softened unsalted butter","1 tbsp full fat natural yogurt","squeeze of lemon juice","4-5 tbsp whole milk","sunflower oil, for your hands","1kg shop-bought ghee, for frying"]','["To make the syrup, heat the cardamom, sugar and 500ml water in pan, not letting the water boil before the sugar has dissolved. Simmer for 10 mins, then leave to cool.","Add the rosewater, saffron and some of its soaking water, gradually adding to give a subtle flavour. Set aside in the pan.","To make the gulab jamun, grind the cardamom and sugar with apestle and mortar.","Sieve the milk powder, flour and baking powder into a mixing bowl and stir in the ground cardamom. Rub in the homemade ghee or butter using your fingertips until the mixture resembles coarse crumbs.","Add the yogurt, lemon juice and enough milk to form a soft dough – take care not to overwork the mixture.","Oil your hands with a little sunflower oil and shape small portions of the dough into balls the size of a small walnut, about 3cm in diameter and 20g each. You should have 16 balls. Take care that the dumplings are smooth and have no cracks or folds.","Reheat the syrup. Once it comes to a boil, turn off the heat and cover with a lid.","Heat the ghee in a wok or karahi to 130C. When a small piece of dough dropped into the oil turns golden in about 40 seconds, fry the balls in batches over a medium heat, moving them around until they are an even, deep brown, about 5-7 mins. Remove from the pan using a slotted spoon, then drain on kitchen paper. Add to the warm syrup, leaving them to soak for 2-3 hrs or preferably overnight.","When ready to eat, warm the gulab jamun through in a wide pan, spooning over the syrup. Serve piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:18:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6865,6865,'en','Carrot halwa (gajar halwa)','Make some indulgent gajar halwa, a popular dessert in North India. Often served at Diwali to mark the change of seasons, it’s almost fudgy in texture','["500g carrots, coarsely grated","8 green cardamom pods, pierced with a knife","500ml whole milk","125g unsalted butter","100g caster sugar","25g raisins","25g blanched almonds or chopped pistachios, roughly chopped"]','["Put the carrots, pierced cardamom pods and milk in a heavy-based pan and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat and simmer for 1 hr, stirring frequently until the milk has evaporated.","Heat the butter in a deep pan, and stir-fry the carrot mixture for about 15-20 mins until darkened in colour and it has lost its wet, milky appearance.","Add the sugar, raisins and almonds or pistachios, and stir-fry the halwa for another 5 mins. Serve hot.Will keep, covered in the fridge, for up to a week, or in the freezer for up to six months."]','2026-01-10 12:18:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6867,6867,'en','Honeyed squash & nut roast cake','Wow guests with this stunning honeyed squash and nut roast cake. It makes a crowd-pleasing veggie centrepiece for a celebration – perfect for Christmas','["300g mixed nuts (Brazil nuts, pecans, hazelnuts, walnuts and almonds all work well)","1 large carrot, grated","1 celery stick, grated","1 onion, grated","400-500g (½ medium) butternut squash, peeled, halved crosswise just above the bulb end","2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for the tin","3 tbsp honey or maple syrup","180g vacuum-packed cooked chestnuts","50g almond, cashew or peanut butter","small bunch of sage, leaves picked"]','["Put the mixed nuts into the bowl of afood processorand blitz until finely chopped, then tip out into a bowl. Alternatively, roughly chop using a knife. Put the carrot, celery and onion in a frying pan. Cut the long, thin half of the squash in half lengthways or into quarters (depending on how wide it is) and slice into long, thin slices using asharp knifeormandoline(reserve the thicker bulb half of the squash for another recipe).","Drizzle the oil over the veg in the frying pan, then fry for 15-20 mins over a low-medium heat until golden and soft. Scrape the mixture into the chopped nuts and stir in 2 tbsp honey, the chestnuts and nut butter. Stir everything together, then season.","Oil a 20cm springform cake tin and line the base with baking parchment. Arrange 3-5 sage leaves in the tin, face-down. Finely chop the rest of the sage leaves and add them to the nut mixture. Arrange some of the squash slices in the base of the tin, laying them neatly so the layers overlap slightly to form a spiral pattern. Drizzle over ½ tbsp of the remaining honey. Spoon in half the nut mixture, pressing it firmly into the tin with the back of a spoon, then top with another layer of squash, this time in a single layer rather than overlapping – this will make it easier to cut later. Drizzle over the rest of the honey. Spoon in the remaining nut mixture and press it in firmly with the back of a spoon. Any remaining squash will keep in the fridge for up to three days to use in tarts and quiches, or to be grilled for salads.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cover the tin with foil and roast for 30 mins, then uncover and roast for another 20 mins until the top of is golden and crisp. Leave to rest for 15 mins, then invert onto a plate and cut into wedges to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6869,6869,'en','Vegan chocolate party traybake','Make an indulgent vegan chocolate traybake the whole family will love. This simple bake is perfect for sharing at parties or a special occasion','["215ml sunflower oil, plus extra for the tin","300ml soy milk, almond or coconut milk","2 tsp apple cider vinegar","335g light muscovado sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract or vanilla bean paste","175g soy yogurt or coconut yogurt","300g self-raising flour","105g cocoa powder","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","¼ tsp salt","100g dark dairy-free chocolate","140g vegan spread, at room temperature","1 tsp vanilla bean paste or extract","265g icing sugar, sifted","½ –1 tbsp plant milk (whatever you used in the sponge)","colourful sprinkles (make sure they''re suitable for vegans), to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil a 23 x 33cm baking tin (at least 4cm deep) and line the bases and sides with baking parchment. Whisk the milk and vinegar together in a jug – the milk should curdle slightly. Set aside.","Whisk the sugar, oil and vanilla extract together in a bowl, then whisk in the yogurt, making sure to break down any sugar lumps. Pour in the soured milk and mix well.","Sift the flour, cocoa powder, baking powder, bicarbonate of soda and salt into a separate bowl and stir well to combine. Gradually whisk the wet ingredients into the dry until you have a smooth batter, but be careful not to over-mix.","Pour the batter into the tin and bake for 30-35 mins, until well risen and springy, and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out almost clean. A few sticky crumbs are fine, but the mixture should not be wet.","Leave the cake to cool in its tin for 20 mins, then carefully turn out onto a wire rack to cool completely. It will be delicate so be gentle. The sponge will keep, covered, at room temperature for up to two days.","For the vegan buttercream, melt the chocolate in the microwave or a bowl set over a pan of simmering water. Leave to cool. Beat the spread and vanilla on high speed in a stand mixer for a few mins until pale and fluffy. Add the icing sugar gradually, beating on slow to start with, then turning up the speed to max until the mixture is light and creamy. Pour in the cooled chocolate and combine thoroughly, add a splash of plant milk if the icing is very stiff. Chill the buttercream for at least 30 mins before using.","When the cake is completely cool, spread the icing over the top and decorate with the sprinkles, if you like. Keep the cake in the fridge to stay firm, then remove 1 hr before serving. Will keep, covered, in the fridge, for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:18:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6871,6871,'en','Rosewater & raspberry sponge cake','Eloise Shardlow creates a delicate, floral twist on the classic sponge cake. Dried rose petals, rose icing and raspberries make for a showstopping decoration','["225g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","225g golden caster sugar","4 medium eggs, beaten","1 tsp vanilla extract","225g self-raising flour, sifted","150ml double cream","1 tsp rosewater","4 tbsp raspberry jam","150g raspberries, slightly crushed","175g icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","½  tsp rosewater","dried rose petals","handful raspberries"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly grease two 20cm cake tins and line with baking parchment. In a large mixing bowl, beat the butter and sugar together until pale and fluffy. Gradually add the eggs a little at a time, scraping down the side of the bowl after each addition. If the mixture starts to curdle, add 1 tsp flour. Add the vanilla extract, mix in half the flour, then fold in the rest.","Divide the mixture between the cake tins and bake for 20-25 mins – a skewer inserted into the middle of the cakes should come out clean. Leave to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Whisk the cream to soft peaks, adding the rosewater as you go, then fold in the jam, being careful not to over-mix.","Place one of the sponges on a serving plate and top with the cream mixture. Scatter with the raspberries, then top with the other sponge.","For the icing, mix together the icing sugar, 2 tbsp water and the rosewater, and stir in the juice from a few crushed raspberries. Drizzle over the cake, arrange the rose petals and the remaining raspberries on top and dust with icing sugar."]','2026-01-10 12:18:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6873,6873,'en','Nutty chicken curry','Fast and flavoursome, this creamy chicken curry is ready in under 20 minutes','["1 large red chilli, deseeded","½ a finger-length piece fresh root ginger, roughly chopped","1 fat garlic clove","small bunch coriander, stalks roughly chopped","1 tbsp sunflower oil","4 skinless chicken breast, cut into chunks","5 tbsp peanut butter","150ml chicken stock","200g tub Greek yogurt"]','["Finely slice a quarter of the chilli, then put the rest in a food processor with the ginger, garlic, coriander stalks and one-third of the leaves. Whizz to a rough paste with a splash of water if needed.","Heat the oil in a frying pan, then quickly brown the chicken chunks for 1 min. Stir in the paste for another min, then add the peanut butter, stock and yogurt. When the sauce is gently bubbling, cook for 10 mins until the chicken is just cooked through and sauce thickened. Stir in most of the remaining coriander, then scatter the rest on top with the chilli, if using. Eat with rice or mashed sweet potato."]','2026-01-10 12:18:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6875,6875,'en','Orange & rhubarb amaretti pots','An easy dessert you can whip up for Sunday lunch entertaining. They only get better in the fridge, so make ahead and get one job out of the way!','["400g double cream","360g thick full-fat Greek yogurt","150g amaretti biscuits, broken into small pieces","500g rhubarb, chopped into 2½ cm lengths","150g golden caster sugar, plus a large pinch","150ml orange juice, plus zest 1 orange","4 medium eggs, plus 2 medium yolks","150g unsalted butter"]','["First, make the curd. Put the rhubarb, a pinch of sugar and the orange juice in a pan over a medium heat and cover with a lid. Cook for 10-15 mins until the rhubarb is very tender. Remove from the heat.","Pass the rhubarb through a fine sieve, pushing it to squeeze out as much pulp as possible. Keep the flesh in the sieve to incorporate later.","Whisk the eggs, egg yolks and sugar together until pale and frothy. Melt the butter steadily in a pan on a low heat. Once melted, slowly pour in the egg mix and orange zest, stirring continuously. Add in the strained rhubarb pulp and mix to combine, continuing to cook gently until the curd has thickened like custard. This could take 10-12 mins, but be patient and do not turn up the heat, as you might scramble the eggs.","Once the curd has thickened, transfer it to a bowl and whisk until smooth. At this point I like to add back in the rhubarb flesh from the sieve, to give more body to the dessert – but if you want a smooth curd, don’t do this.","Whip the cream, stopping just before soft peaks start to form. Fold in the yogurt, 300g of the curd and most of the amaretti biscuits.","Spoon the mix into eight glasses and sprinkle on the reserved amaretti. Save the remaining curd to use on pancakes, granola or to make little tartlets. Store it in a sterilised jar (wash a jar in hot soapy water, rinse, then put in the oven upside down at 120C/100C fan/gas 1 /2 for 15 mins to dry)."]','2026-01-10 12:18:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6877,6877,'en','Vegan chocolate banana ice cream','A low-fat chocolate ice cream? It really does exist! Our blitzed banana creation is gluten and dairy-free and ready in minutes','["1 frozen banana","1 tsp cocoa powder"]','["In a blender, blitz the frozen banana with the cocoa powder until smooth. Eat straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:18:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6879,6879,'en','Chocolate, peanut butter & avocado pudding','Avocado''s neutral flavour and creamy texture makes it a wonderful substitute for dairy in desserts or smoothies. These little pots will keep for a few days in the fridge – a great make-ahead dessert!','["2 large, ripe avocados, halved and stoned","1 large banana, chopped","5 soft prunes","6 tbsp unsweetened almond milk or coconut milk","2 tbsp smooth peanut butter (unsweetened, if possible)","3 tbsp cacao powder (or good quality cocoa powder)","100g coconut milk yogurt (such as CoYo)","2 tsp maple syrup or honey","dark chocolate (80% cocoa, if possible), to decorate"]','["Scoop the avocado flesh into a food processor. Add the chopped banana, prunes, almond or coconut milk, smooth peanut butter and cacao powder. Blend until smooth, adding a little more milk if the blade gets stuck. Scrape down the sides once or twice and blend again.","Divide the mixture between 4 small glasses. Mix the coconut yogurt with the maple syrup or honey and top each pudding with a generous dollop. Finely grate a little dark chocolate over the top and chill for at least 1 hr."]','2026-01-10 12:18:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6881,6881,'en','Quick & easy tiramisu','Condensed milk is the secret to this super snappy Italian dessert. Coffee and chocolate are a classic combo, simply layer them up and enjoy','["3 tsp instant coffee granules","3 tbsp coffee liqueur (or Camp Chicory & Coffee Essence)","250g tub mascarpone","85g condensed milk","1 tsp vanilla extract","4-6 sponge fingers","1 tbsp cocoa powder"]','["Mix the coffee granules with 2 tbsp boiling water in a large jug and stir to combine. Add the coffee liqueur and 75ml cold water. Pour into a shallow dish and set aside.","Make the cream layer by beating the mascarpone, condensed milk and vanilla extract with an electric whisk until thick and smooth.","Break the sponge fingers into two or three pieces and soak in the coffee mixture for a few secs. Put a few bits of the sponge in the bottom of two wine or sundae glasses and top with the cream. Sift over the cocoa and chill for at least 1 hr before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:18:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6883,6883,'en','Peach & almond tart','Authentic Italian Peach and almond tart','["100ml cold butter","200g plain flour","85g caster sugar","3 egg yolks","grated zest of a lemon","50g blanched whole almonds","50g caster sugar, plus 2 tbsp","50g butter","50g plain flour","1 large egg and 1 egg yolk","50g amaretti biscuits, lightly crushed","5-6 peaches or nectarines depending on their size","2 tbsp flaked almonds","icing sugar, to dust"]','["Dice the butter as small as you can. If\r\nyou dip your knife in the flour for the pastry\r\nand keep covering the butter with flour as\r\nyou dice, you will find it easier.","Put the diced butter and flour in the food\r\nprocessor and pulse until it looks like fine\r\nbreadcrumbs. Add a pinch of salt, the\r\nsugar, egg yolks and lemon zest and pulse\r\nagain – it should almost immediately\r\nadhere into a ball.Remove from the\r\nprocessor, lay it on a sheet of cling film or\r\nfoil, and lightly press and shape into a\r\ncompact log (touch it as little as possible).\r\nWrap and chill for at least 1 hour – the\r\nlonger it rests, the less it will shrink later.","Butter and flour a 24cm tart tin thoroughly.\r\nUnwrap and cut the pastry log into thin\r\neven slices and use to cover the bottom\r\nand sides of the tin with just touching or\r\nslightly overlapping slices. Keep a bowl of\r\nice cubes and some paper towels handy to\r\nchill and dry your hands as you work.","Pat the pastry lightly with cold fingers so\r\nthe base is even, and make the shell a little\r\nthicker round the sides, ensuring it reaches\r\nall the way up since it may shrink. To even\r\nthe base, run an ice cube quickly across,\r\nfrom the centre to the edges. Chill again.","Tip the almonds and 50g/2oz sugar\r\ninto the food processor and whizz until\r\nfinely chopped. Dice the butter and add\r\nto the almonds with the flour. Process\r\nagain until the mixture resembles fine\r\nbreadcrumbs, then add the egg and eg\r\nyolk and process briefly until soft and\r\ncreamy. Add the crushed amaretti and\r\nbriefly whizz again. Chill.","Preheat the oven to 180C/gas 4/fan\r\n160C.Drop the peaches into a pan of\r\nboiling water, lift out after a few seconds\r\nthen cool in cold water. Peel, halve and\r\nstone the peaches, sprinkle with 2 tbsp\r\nsugar and leave for 5 minutes. Spread th\r\namaretti cream in the base of the pastry\r\ncase. Put the peach halves on top,\r\nrounded side up, cutting them if necessa\r\nto fill the centre. Scatter with the almonds","Bake for 25-35 minutes until golden.\r\nCheck the filling with a toothpick (which\r\nshould come out barely flecked) and\r\nensure the pastry is shrinking away from\r\nthe tin. Dust with icing sugar and serve a\r\nroom temperature, with a glass of\r\nTuscan Vin Santo."]','2026-01-10 12:18:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6885,6885,'en','White chocolate cheesecake with rhubarb compote','This soft and creamy cheesecake makes a suitably impressive and indulgent end to a dinner party','["200g oatcake biscuits","85g butter melted","450g white chocolate","284ml pot double cream","400g full fat soft cheese, such as Philadelphia","4 eggs","1 tsp vanilla essence","600g rhubarb (trimmed weight), cut into 2½ cm chunks","250g golden caster sugar","½ vanilla pod, split in half lengthways","100ml orange blossom muscat dessert wine (we used Brown Brothers)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Line the base of a 23cm springform tin with baking parchment. Whizz the biscuits in a food processor until they resemble breadcrumbs. Pour in the butter, whizz briefly again, then tip the mixture into the tin and press down firmly. Bake for 10 mins, then cool.","Reduce oven temperature to 140C/fan 120C/gas 1. Wrap a double layer of foil, lined with cling film, around the base and sides of the tin to make it watertight. Break 400g chocolate into a pan, then pour in the cream and heat until the chocolate has melted. Leave to cool slightly. Rinse the bowl of the processor, then blend the cream cheese, eggs and vanilla essence together with the melted chocolate and cream until smooth.","Put the tin in a deep roasting tray, then pour in the filling. Half-fill the roasting tray with boiling water, bake for 1 hr, then turn the oven off. Leave to cool in the oven with the door slightly ajar for 1-2 hrs. Lift the cheesecake from the water, discard the foil, then cover with cling film and chill. The cheesecake can be made up to 3 days ahead. Grate the remaining chocolate over the cheesecake before serving.","For the compote, heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Mix the rhubarb and sugar in an ovenproof dish. Scrape the seeds from the vanilla pod on top of the rhubarb, then drop in the pod, too. Pour the muscat over, cover with foil, then bake for 30-40 mins, stirring halfway, until the rhubarb is cooked. Leave to cool, then remove the pod. Serve the compote with the cheesecake. The compote can be kept in the fridge for up to 4 days."]','2026-01-10 12:18:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6887,6887,'en','Lemon posset with sugared-almond shortbread','Making your own, individual citrus set puddings is even more impressive when served with homemade biscuits for scooping out the cream','["600ml double cream","200g golden caster sugar","zest 3 lemons, plus 75ml juice","140g cold butter, diced","140g plain flour","85g golden caster sugar, plus extra for dusting","50g ground rice (or more flour if you can''t find it)","85g flaked almonds"]','["Make the posset first. Put the cream in\r\na big saucepan with the sugar and gently\r\nheat, stirring, until the sugar has melted.\r\nBring to a simmer and bubble for 1 min.\r\nTurn off the heat and stir in the lemon\r\nzest and juice. Divide between pots or\r\nbowls, cool to room temperature, then\r\ncarefully cover and chill for at least 3 hrs,\r\nor up to 24 hrs.","To make the shortbread, heat oven\r\nto 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Whizz the butter and flour together in a food processor\r\nuntil no lumps of butter remain (or rub\r\ntogether with your fingertips). Tip into a\r\nbowl and stir in the sugar, ground rice and\r\nalmonds. Line the base of a roughly 22cm\r\nsquare tin with baking parchment. Tip\r\nin the mixture and press it down firmly,\r\nmaking it as flat as you can. Dredge with\r\nmore sugar and bake for 25-30 mins until\r\npale golden. Cool in the tin.","Cut the shortbread into shards and\r\nserve with the possets and little spoons."]','2026-01-10 12:18:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6889,6889,'en','Choc-peanut fondants with chocolate soil & cherries','Chocolate soil is a big restaurant trend at the moment – serve alongside your melting-middle pud for serious wow factor','["50g butter, softened, plus extra melted butter for greasing","cocoa powder, for dusting","85g crunchy peanut butter","175g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","4 large eggs","85g plain flour","300g dark chocolate, broken into chunks and melted","big jar cherry compote","6 scoops vanilla ice cream, to serve","6 cherries with stalks, to serve","1 bought chocolate loaf cake (un-iced), about 250g"]','["Make the soil first. Heat oven to\r\n180C/160C fan/gas 4. Thinly slice the\r\nchocolate cake and lay on baking trays\r\nlined with baking parchment. Bake for\r\n30 mins, turning the slices halfway, until\r\ncrisp to the touch. Put in a food processor\r\nand whizz to crunchy crumbs. Will keep\r\nwell for up to a week in an airtight tin.","Make the fondants by brushing 6\r\ndariole moulds well with melted butter.\r\nChill for 1 min, then brush again. Put a\r\nspoon of cocoa powder in one and shake\r\nabout so the whole inside is coated, then\r\ntip out the rest into the next and tap the\r\nbottom of the dariole to get out any\r\nexcess. Repeat with all the darioles.","Beat together the softened butter,\r\npeanut butter, sugar and vanilla to\r\ncream them, then beat in the eggs,\r\nfollowed by the flour. Stir in the melted\r\nchocolate and divide between the\r\ndarioles. Chill for up to 24 hrs.","To serve, heat oven to 200C/180C fan/\r\ngas 6. Bake the fondants for 10-12 mins –\r\nthe top will be set, but you should feel a\r\nsoft middle when you prod it. Add a small\r\npile of soil to each plate and top with a\r\ncherry – or put the soil in a mini bucket\r\nor flowerpot. Add a spoon of cherry\r\ncompote to each plate and top with\r\na scoop of vanilla ice cream. Finally,\r\ncarefully turn each chocolate fondant out\r\nonto the plate – they should come out\r\neasily. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:18:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6891,6891,'en','Chocolate balloon bowls','These edible bowls will turn your dinner party dessert into something really impressive – fill with ice cream or your favourite pud','["300g chocolate (we used dark, but choose your favourite)","a dessert of your choice (we used ice cream and honeycomb)","4 small balloons"]','["Break the chocolate into small pieces.\r\nPut in a bowl suspended over a pan of\r\nsimmering water and leave to melt.\r\nRemove from the heat and leave to cool\r\nfor 5 mins. Meanwhile, blow up your\r\nballoons – you want each bowl to be\r\nabout 10cm wide, so try to pick small\r\nballoons and don’t blow them up too\r\nmuch. Tie with a knot.","Line a baking tray with parchment.\r\nHolding the knotted end of the balloon,\r\ndip it into the melted chocolate to create\r\nyour bowl shape. Stand it on the tray and\r\nhold the balloon for a few secs until the\r\nchocolate pools around the base allowing\r\nyou to let go of the balloon. Continue\r\nwith the remaining balloons. Chill for at\r\nleast 30 mins or until set.","When the chocolate has set, pop\r\nthe balloons and carefully peel them\r\naway from the bowls. Fill with your\r\nchosen dessert – ice cream is good\r\nbecause it keeps the bowls cold."]','2026-01-10 12:18:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6893,6893,'en','Lemon tart with summer berries','A zingy lemon tart from Mr Ramsay. Gordon’s version of the classic French Tarte au citron is well worth the effort','["5 unwaxed lemons","6 eggs","250g golden caster sugar","200ml double cream","icing sugar, for dusting and decorating","375g block dessert pastry","4 tbsp icing sugar","300g strawberries, hulled, halved or quartered","350g raspberries","150g blueberries","1 tsp sherry vinegar","handful mint, leaves, finely shredded"]','["Finely grate the zest of 3 of the lemons into a bowl. Halve all the lemons, then use a fork to squeeze out all the juice and pulp into the bowl with the zest – don’t worry about the seeds. Crack the eggs into a separate bowl, then whisk in the caster sugar until completely combined. Whisk in the cream and lemon juice mix, then set aside.","Place a 23cm tart ring or loose-bottom flan tin on a baking sheet lined with greaseproof paper. On a surface dusted with icing sugar, roll out the pastry to the thickness of a £1 coin. Lift onto a rolling pin, then drape over the tart ring or flan tin, leaving the excess hanging over the edge. Carefully press the pastry into the sides with a small ball of pastry. Put in fridge or freezer for 20 mins to allow pastry to chill.","While the pastry is chilling, heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Prick the base of the pastry case, line with greaseproof paper and baking beans, then bake for 15 mins. Remove the paper and beans, then bake the case for 5-10 mins more until it is biscuity brown and crisp. Lower oven to 150C/fan 130C/gas 2.","Use a ladle to push the lemon custard through a sieve into a bowl, pressing down on the pulp to extract as much juice as possible. Skim the bubbles from the surface of the custard, then pour the custard into a jug. Pull the tart out of the oven slightly, then pour in the custard so it comes to the top. You may have some left over. Push tart back in, then bake for 35-40 mins until the top forms a light crust and the custard is just set. Leave to cool, then chill.","While the tart is cooling, make the berry salad. Place a large non-stick frying pan over a medium heat and scatter the icing sugar over the base. Heat until the sugar dissolves and caramelises. Throw in the berries, toss with the sugar, then splash in the sherry vinegar. Bubble for a min until everything is just starting to soften, then tip onto a plate and leave to\r\ncool slightly.","Use a serrated knife to trim away the pastry and make a neat edge. Dust the tart lightly with icing sugar, then use a blowtorch to caramelise the top. Leave the top to set, then repeat the process so that you get an extra-thick layer of caramel. Stir the mint through the berries. Serve the tart in slices with a bowl of the berry salad on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:18:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6895,6895,'en','Lemon curd & yogurt fool','Treat yourself to a delightfully easy family dessert – ready in just five minutes','["300g jar lemon curd (we used Duchy Originals Traditional Lemon Curd)","500g tub 0% Greek yogurt","200g punnet raspberries","1 tbsp icing sugar","shortbread, to serve"]','["Put the lemon curd and yogurt into a bowl. Fold together for a rippled effect. Divide the mixture between four glasses and chill.","Mix raspberries and icing sugar together and gently crush, then spoon with their juices over the chilled mix and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6897,6897,'en','Real vanilla ice cream','Make super-creamy vanilla ice cream and eat it as it is, or add different flavours to suit all tastes','["500ml full-fat milk","300ml pot double cream","1 vanilla pod","5 large egg yolks (freeze the whites for next time you want to make meringue)","140g golden caster sugar"]','["Put the milk and cream in a saucepan.\r\nSlit the vanilla pod down its length with\r\na small, sharp knife and scoop out as\r\nmany of the tiny black seeds as you can\r\ninto the milk mixture. Add the pod to\r\nthe pan, too. Heat the whole lot over a\r\nlow heat, stirring occasionally, until it\r\nalmost boils – you’ll see a few bubbles at\r\nthe edge. Take off the heat and set aside\r\nfor 30 mins so that the vanilla can infuse.","Mix the egg yolks and sugar together in\r\na bowl. Gradually pour the milk over the\r\negg mixture, whisking continuously\r\nuntil combined. Pour everything back into\r\nthe cleaned pan, return to a low heat and\r\ncook for 8-10 mins, stirring all the time\r\nwith a wooden spoon, until the custard\r\nis thick enough to coat the back of the\r\nspoon. Make sure it doesn’t boil or\r\nyou will end up with scrambled eggs.","Pour the custard through a fine sieve\r\ninto a bowl, then sit it in a bigger bowl,\r\none-third full of ice and water, to cool it\r\ndown – keep stirring every now and then\r\nto stop a skin forming. Chill to make sure\r\nit is completely cold, putting cling film\r\ndirectly on the surface of the custard\r\nto prevent a skin from forming.","Pour the custard into an ice-cream\r\nmachine. Churn following manufacturers’\r\ninstructions until frozen, then spoon into\r\na metal or plastic freezer-proof container.\r\nCover and freeze until solid. If you don’t\r\nhave an ice-cream machine, pour the\r\ncustard into the container and freeze.\r\nEvery 2-3 hrs, take the mixture out of the\r\nfreezer and give it a stir. Once it is softly\r\nset, beat it well with electric beaters,\r\nthen freeze solid. It will keep in the\r\nfreezer for 3 months. Remove from\r\nthe freezer 15 mins before serving to\r\nallow it to get soft enough to scoop."]','2026-01-10 12:18:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6899,6899,'en','Lemon syllabub','A quick dessert than can be as indulgent or as healthy as you want, experiment with your favourites','["284 tub whipping cream","50g caster sugar","50ml white wine","zest and juice from ½ lemon","almond thins or berries, to serve"]','["Whip the cream and sugar together until soft peaks form. Stir in the wine, most of the\r\nlemon zest and the juice. Spoon into glasses or bowls, sprinkle with the remaining zest and serve with almond thins or berries."]','2026-01-10 12:18:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6901,6901,'en','Passion fruit teacup puddings','Cook these steamed sponge puddings in small, sturdy ramekins and serve in little china cups when entertaining','["250g passion fruit or lemon curd","4 ripe passion fruits, seeds and pulp removed","3 large eggs","100g golden caster sugar","85g butter, melted","100ml milk","140g plain flour","½  tsp baking powder","icing sugar, to dust","clotted cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Line\r\na large, deep roasting tin with a tea towel,\r\nset aside, and boil the kettle. Put 100g of\r\nthe curd in a bowl, mix the remaining curd\r\nwith the passion fruit seeds and pulp, and\r\ndivide between 6 teacups or ramekins\r\n(mine were around 200ml).","Whisk the eggs and sugar together in\r\na large bowl until pale and fluffy – this will\r\ntake about 5 mins. Add the reserved\r\ncurd, butter, milk, flour and baking\r\npowder. Fold the mixture together with a\r\nspatula until there are no visible lumps of\r\nflour, then divide between the teacups.","Put the teacups in the roasting tin.\r\nCarefully fill the tin with hot water from\r\nthe kettle to come about halfway up the\r\nsides of the teacups, being careful not\r\nto get any water in the cups. Bake for\r\n50 mins until risen and golden. Once\r\ncooked, you can cool the puddings and\r\nchill for up to a day, or wrap in cling film\r\nand freeze for up to 2 months. To reheat,\r\nbring to room temperature, put back in a\r\nhot water bath in the oven and bake for\r\n15 mins at 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Before\r\nserving, dust each pudding with a little\r\nicing sugar and put a spoonful of clotted\r\ncream on top, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6903,6903,'en','Cornbread muffins','These savoury snacks are brilliant for picnics and lunchboxes – plus they can be frozen ahead','["85g melted butter, plus extra for frying","1 large sweetcorn, kernels sliced off","1 small onion, finely chopped","½ red chilli, deseeded, finely chopped","140g plain flour","140g polenta or cornmeal","2 tsp baking powder","50g strong cheddar, grated","2 eggs","284ml pot buttermilk","100ml milk"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and\r\nbrush a 12-hole muffin tin with some of\r\nthe melted butter Put the corn kernels\r\nin a pan with the onion, chilli and a knob\r\nof butter. Gently fry for 5-10 mins until\r\ngolden and soft.","Mix together the flour, polenta, baking\r\npowder and cheddar with 1 tsp salt in a\r\nlarge mixing bowl. Whisk together the\r\neggs, buttermilk and milk, then stir into\r\nthe dry ingredients with the remaining\r\nmelted butter and corn mixture. Divide\r\nbetween the muffin holes (they will be\r\nquite full) and bake for 25-30 mins or until\r\ngolden brown and cooked through – poke\r\nin a skewer to check. Best eaten warm."]','2026-01-10 12:18:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6905,6905,'en','Baked nectarines with almonds & Marsala','Create a delicious Italian-style topping for peaches and nectarines for a simple summer dessert','["6 nectarines, halved, stones removed","100g amaretti biscuits","100g butter, softened","85g ground almonds","85g golden caster sugar","1 egg","1-2 tbsp toasted, flaked almonds","250ml marsala","Greek yogurt or crème fraîche, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nSit the nectarine halves snugly in a\r\nbaking dish, cut-side up. Put the amaretti\r\nbiscuits into a large bowl and use the end\r\nof a rolling pin to bash into crumbs. Add\r\nthe softened butter, ground almonds,\r\ncaster sugar and egg, and stir together.","Push spoonfuls of the mixture into the\r\ncavities of the nectarines, piling more on\r\ntop until the mixture is evenly divided\r\namong them. Scatter with almonds, then\r\ncarefully pour the Marsala into the dish\r\nthrough a gap between the fruit so the\r\ntopping doesn’t get soggy. Bake for\r\n40-50 mins until golden and crisp, and\r\nthe fruit is soft. Eat warm with the juices\r\nspooned over, and a dollop of Greek\r\nyogurt or crème fraîche alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:18:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6907,6907,'en','Eton mess stacks','We love individual puddings, they add a certain ‘Je ne sais quoi’ to an occasion. And these fab little meringues are definitely an occasion pudding','["1 egg white","350g icing sugar","1 tsp crushed cardamom seeds","a little oil for greasing","142ml pot double cream","juice 1?2 lemon","250g punnet raspberries"]','["Lightly whisk the egg white, then stir in the\r\nicing sugar and cardamom to make a firm\r\nfondant icing. Roll the icing into 8 golfballsize\r\nballs (you probably won’t need all of it).\r\nTwo at a time, place the balls at opposite\r\nends of a greased piece of baking paper,\r\nthen microwave for 30-40 secs on High until\r\nquadrupled in size. Leave to cool for a few\r\nmins, then lift off the paper and repeat until\r\nall the balls are cooked.","Whip the cream with half the lemon juice.\r\nCrush half the raspberries, then fold through\r\nthe cream. To serve, place a little splodge\r\nof raspberry cream onto each plate. Stack\r\na meringue with some more cream, then\r\nplace another meringue on top. Spoon over\r\nmore cream, then top with a few whole\r\nraspberries. Dust with icing sugar and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6909,6909,'en','Corndogs','Make American-inspired corndogs by coating frankfurter sausages in a cornmeal batter, then deep-frying and serving with ketchup and yellow mustard','["100ml cornmeal","100g plain flour","1 egg, lightly beaten","1 tsp caster sugar","½ tsp fine sea salt","1 tbsp baking powder","150ml whole milk","8 frankfurters","vegetable oil, for deep-frying","ketchup and American mustard, to serve"]','["Tip the cornmeal, flour, egg, caster sugar, salt, baking powder and milk into a bowl, andwhiskuntil you have a smooth, lump-free batter. Carefully pour the batter into a tall jug or glass.","Push a wooden skewer through the length of each frankfurter, so it goes about three-quarters of the way through. Fill a pan no more than a third full with oil and heat to 180C, or until a cube of bread dropped in browns within 30 seconds.","Working with one frankfurter at a time, submerge it into the batter and gently turn to coat – it should be completely covered. Carefully drop into the oil and fry for 2-3 mins, or until the batter is crisp and golden. Drain on a sheet of kitchen paper. Repeat with the remaining frankfurters. Serve with ketchup and American mustard for dipping or drizzling over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6911,6911,'en','Simple salt beef','Making juicy, tender salt beef is easier than you think. Serve in a sandwich with New York-style rye bread, pickled cucumbers, mustard and sauerkraut','["1.6kg flat piece of pickled beef brisket","2 bay leaves","4 large carrots, peeled but left whole","1 tsp black peppercorns","4 juniper berries","1-2 tsp sugar (optional)"]','["If you can, allow the pickled beef to come up to room temperature before you start by leaving it on the kitchen counter for an hour. It will speed up the cooking time. Put the beef in a large pan and cover with cold water. Bring to the boil, skimming away any foamy scum that rises to the surface. Once the foam has been mostly removed, add all the other ingredients. Adding them now means they don’t get in the way of the skimming.","Reduce the heat, cover and simmer gently for 2 hrs 30 mins-3 hrs 30 mins or until a fork pushed into the meat slides in easily – it should be really soft. Start checking after 2 hours – there should be no resistance when you pull the fork out of the meat. You could also use a skewer to do the testing – make sure to push it into the thickest part of the meat.","Once the beef is tender, turn off the heat. Either leave it sitting in the cooking liquor if you''re not ready to eat (it can sit like this for up to an hour), or use two forks to lift the meat out, allow the water to drain off, then put it on a board. Keep the liquor if you plan to reheat or freeze the salt beef. Cover loosely with foil and allow to rest for 10-15 mins. To serve, slice thickly against the grain of the meat or it will crumble. Serve hot or cold.Leftovers will keep in the fridge for three days and in the freezer for up to six weeks. Before freezing, it’s best to slice it and wrap first in baking parchment, then foil. Make sure you also freeze the pot of cooking liquor. When you want to eat it, defrost and then put it (with slices arranged back into a whole brisket shape) in an ovenproof dish with the thawed liquor. Cover with foil and reheat at 180C/160C fan/gas 4 for 20 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:18:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6914,6913,'en','Maple & chilli-glazed leg of lamb','Make a lovely maple and chilli glaze to brush over a leg of lamb, ready for barbecuing – a great choice when you haven’t got time for marinating','["2.5kg leg of lamb, butterflied (ask your butcher to do this)","1 bunch of rosemary, snipped into 2cm lengths","100ml maple syrup","50g Dijon mustard","2 tbsp yeast extract","1 tbsp smoked paprika","3 medium green chillies, sliced"]','["Lay the butterflied lamb leg on a board and use asharp knifeto prick about 20 holes all over the skin side. Press the rosemary sprigs deep into the holes, then season all over.","To make the glaze, tip all of the ingredients into a small saucepan, reserving a few sliced chillies, and bring to the boil. Stir to combine, then remove from the heat and set aside. Light thebarbecue. It’s ready when the coals are ashen and you can hold your hand 5cm above the grill for at least 5 seconds.","Lay the lamb skin-side down on the grill and cook for 10 mins. Turn over using tongs and cook for 10 mins more. Repeat this two more times for 5 mins on each side so the lamb cooks for a total of 30 mins. Baste with the glaze, turn the lamb again and keep basting for another 10 mins until deep brown and sticky. Remove to a board, cover loosely and leave to rest for 20 mins. Carve into thin slices to serve, then scatter over the reserved sliced chillies."]','2026-01-10 12:18:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6915,6916,'en','Pastrami-style steak & mustard mayo','Pair sauerkraut and mustard mayo with steak to make a sensational combination. Serve with chips or mash, or make into an amazing steak sandwich','["2 tbsp mayonnaise","2 tsp English mustard","2 x 250g sirloin or ribeye steaks","sunflower or vegetable oil, for drizzling","50g butter","150g sauerkraut"]','["Mix the mayo with the mustard and set aside. Season the steaks. Heat a drizzle of oil and the butter in a largefrying panover a high heat until sizzling and turning nut brown. Cook the steaks for 1-2 mins on one side, then turn and cook for another 1-2 mins. Turn again and continue this process for 6-7 mins total for rare, 8-9 mins for medium- rare and 10 mins for medium. Turning the steaks helps them cook evenly and build a uniform crust.","When the steaks are cooked to your liking, transfer to a board and leave to rest. Meanwhile, cook the sauerkraut in the pan with the sticky steak juices for 3-4 mins until heated through and browned. Serve the steaks with the sauerkraut and the mustard mayo on the side, or spoon the sauerkraut over the steaks."]','2026-01-10 12:18:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6917,6917,'en','Air-fried chips','Make the most of an air fryer with this recipe for super-crispy chips. They’re simple to make, and air-frying means you’ll use less oil than deep-frying, so it’s a a healthier alternative','["4-5 large potatoes, about 1kg","1 tbsp sunflower or olive oil"]','["To make straight, neat chips, peel the potatoes and trim away all the rounded edges so they become rectangular blocks.Cutthe blocks into batons – they should be somewhere between fries and thick chips, as if they''re too thin, they might break; too thick, and they won’t cook through (if you like, save the offcuts to make mash or add to soups). Alternatively, cut the unpeeled potatoes into chips without trimming, if you''re not bothered by neatness. Rinse the chips and pat dry with a clean tea towel.","Tip the chips into the bottom of anair fryer(the part with the paddle), add the oil, and toss the chips in the oil so they are evenly coated. Program the fryer to cook for 30 mins using the paddle. After this time, check that the chips are tender and cooked through. If they''re not, cook for a further 5 mins. Season well."]','2026-01-10 12:18:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6919,6919,'en','Patty melt toasties','Enjoy these patty melt toasties for Friday night comfort food. They’re perfect when you can’t decide between a juicy beef burger or molten cheese toastie…','["3 tbsp butter","2 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, finely sliced","200g beef mince","½ tsp garlic granules","2 tsp Worcestershire sauce","4 slices bloomer loaf or white bread","100g mature cheddar, grated","100g Swiss cheese, grated","2 tsp Dijon mustard"]','["Heat 1 tbsp butter and half the oil in a large heavy-basedfrying panover a medium heat, and fry the onion with a pinch of salt for 20-25 mins until golden and sticky.","Tip the mince into a bowl with the garlic granules, Worcestershire sauce and some seasoning, and combine with your hands – mix until the mince has a fine texture. Divide into two balls, then flatten these out into patties, keeping the shape of the bread in mind (you may want to make them more oblong if using a bloomer loaf).","Scrape the caramelised onions onto a plate, and heat the remaining oil in the pan over a high heat. Fry the burger patties, pressing them down with the back of a spatula, for 3-4 mins on each side until golden brown and cooked through. Transfer to a plate, scraping any bits from the pan over the top.","Reduce the heat to medium-low, and melt ½ tbsp butter in the pan, swirling it around the base. Fry all four of the bread slices on one side, weighing them down with a grill press or pressing down with the back of thespatulaso they’re evenly golden and crisp. Do this in two batches, adding another ½ tbsp butter for the last two slices. Mix the two cheeses together in a bowl.","Put two of the bread slices, toasted-side up, on a board, and spread over the mustard. Add half the cheese, and spoon over the onions evenly. Top with the burgers, then scatter over the remaining cheese. Top with the remaining bread slices, toasted-side down, so the untoasted sides are on the outside of the sandwiches. Press down well to seal. Heat most of the remaining butter in the pan, and fry the sandwiches for 2-3 mins, pressing them down the whole time, until golden and toasted. Carefully flip and fry again, adding the last of the butter to the pan around the toasties. Cook until the cheese is melted and oozy, and the bread is golden and crisp on both sides."]','2026-01-10 12:18:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6921,6921,'en','Brie-stuffed pancakes with crispy bacon','Enjoy our fluffy American-style pancakes with an oozing cheese filling and crispy bacon topping. They’re great for Pancake Day or a weekend brunch','["10 smoked streaky bacon rashers","300g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","pinch of caster sugar","2 medium eggs, lightly beaten","300ml semi-skimmed milk","2 tbsp sunflower oil","25g salted butter, plus extra to serve","150g brie, thinly sliced","50g grated cheddar"]','["Heat the grill to high and grill the bacon for 5 mins until crisp, turning halfway through. Set aside and keep warm. Tip the flour, baking powder, sugar and a large pinch of salt into a large bowl, then graduallywhiskin the eggs and milk until you have a smooth, thick batter.","Heat a splash of the oil and small knob of the butter in anon-stick frying panover a medium heat until sizzling. Spoon in 1 tbsp of the batter and spread out to a rough 10cm circle with the back of the spoon. Top with a few slices of the brie, a pinch of the grated cheddar, and 1½ tbsp more of the pancake batter – the batter should cover all the cheese. Don’t worry if the batter starts to spread – you can shape it by pushing the cheese back toward the centre using aspatula. Cook for 2-3 mins until bubbles start to form on the surface, then carefully flip and cook for 2 mins more. Keep warm while repeating the process with the rest of the oil, butter, batter and cheese. Serve topped with some salted butter and the crispy bacon."]','2026-01-10 12:18:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6923,6923,'en','Beignets','Enjoy these crispy, golden New Orleans-style beignets. Made with evaporated milk, they are best served warm with a generous dusting of icing sugar','["4g fast-action dried yeast","250g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","25g caster sugar","125g evaporated milk","1 medium egg","25g unsalted butter, melted","1.5l rapeseed or vegetable oil, for the bowl and deep-frying","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Mix together the yeast, flour, sugar and 1 tsp sea salt in the bowl of astand mixer. Whisk together the evaporated milk and egg and tip into the bowl with the melted butter and 60ml just-boiled water. Knead on a medium speed for 2 mins in the stand mixer, or for 5 mins on a lightly floured work surface, until smooth. Shape the dough into a ball and put in a large, lightly oiled bowl. Cover with a damp tea towel and chill for 8-24 hrs.","Rollout the dough on a lightly floured work surface into a roughly 20 x 25cm rectangle about 1cm thick. Cut into 20 x 5cm squares.","Pour the oil into a deep stock pot orsaucepan, so it is no deeper than one-third full. Or, use a deep-fat fryer. Heat the oil to 175C. Line a baking tray with kitchen paper. Fry the beignets in batches for 3 mins, turning occasionally with tongs, until puffed up and golden brown. Lift the beignets onto the paper to drain, then move to awire rack, dust generously with icing sugar and serve warm."]','2026-01-10 12:18:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6925,6925,'en','Chicken-fried steak','Try a classic American Deep South dish that fuses steak with southern-fried chicken. The steak is coated in a spice mix and fried for an indulgent dinner','["2 fillet tail steaks (about 200g each), or 2 sirloin steaks, fat trimmed","2 eggs, beaten","1⁄2 tsp cayenne pepper","steamed greens and corn cobs, to serve (optional)","vegetable oil, for frying","4 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp cornflour","1 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp garlic powder","1 tsp dried thyme","1⁄2 tsp ground cumin","1⁄2 tsp ground cinnamon","1⁄2 tsp black pepper","1 tbsp flour","1 chicken stock cube","275ml milk","1 tbsp thyme leaves","squeeze of lemon juice"]','["Put the steaks on a board and bash with a rolling pin until about half the original thickness. Mix the eggs with the cayenne in a bowl. Combine the ingredients for the spice mix with a large pinch of salt in a separate shallow dish.","Dip the steaks into the egg, then the spice mix, turning to coat. Pour the oil into a largenon-stick frying panuntil the base of the pan is covered. Fry the steaks over a high heat for 2 mins until crisp, then turn and fry for 2 mins more. Transfer to a plate and keep warm.","If you’re making the sauce, pour away all but 1 tbsp oil from the pan and stir in the flour, cooking until browned. Crumble in the stock cube. Slowly pour in the milk,whiskinguntil smooth and fully incorporated. Reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 4-5 mins. Season. Add the thyme and plenty of black pepper, then squeeze in the lemon juice to taste. Serve the steaks with the sauce, and greens and corn, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6927,6927,'en','Lamingtons','Enjoy a lamington with a hot cup of tea. This traditional Australian bake is filled with cream and jam, coated in a chocolate icing and rolled in coconut','["125g salted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","250g golden caster sugar","3 large eggs","250g self-raising flour","3 tbsp milk","½ tsp salt","250ml double cream","2 tbsp icing sugar","200g raspberry jam","350g desiccated coconut","80g unsalted butter, melted","250ml milk","50g cocoa powder","400g icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Butter and line a 20 x 30cm rectangle tin.","Beat the butter and sugar in a free-standing mixer until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs one at a time and beat well. Beat through the flour, milk and salt until fully combined, then spoon into the tin. Bake in the oven for 25 mins or until golden and firm to the touch. Set aside to cool completely.","Slice the sponge horizontally to create two halves. Trim the edges to make perfect corners. Cut the sponge into 18 squares. Lightly whip the cream with the icing sugar until it reaches soft peaks. Spread a little of the jam on half of the sponge squares then pipe or spread over a little of the cream. Sandwich each one with a second square of sponge then set aside in the fridge to chill.","To make the icing, whisk together the melted butter and milk in a bowl. Sieve the cocoa powder and icing sugar together in a seperate bowl. Gradually add the cocoa and sugar to the butter and milk mixture, whisking continuously to ensure there are no lumps. If it gets lumpy, whizz with a hand blender until smooth.","Divide the coconut between three shallow bowls (this keeps it from getting coated in too much chocolate whilst you’re dipping).","Dip each lamington in the icing until completely covered. Roll in the coconut and set on a wire rack. Repeat with the remaining sponges. Chill for a minimum of 1 hr."]','2026-01-10 12:18:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6929,6929,'en','Philly cheesesteak','Pile steak, onion, peppers, cheese, ketchup and mustard into rolls to make these American-style Philly cheesesteaks. Just the food for a movie night in','["2 x 150g rib-eye steaks","2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 onion, sliced","1 red pepper, sliced","1 green pepper, sliced","2 tbsp white wine vinegar","8 cheese slices","50g grated mozzarella","4 soft white sub rolls","American mustard and ketchup, to serve"]','["Trim away and discard the long piece of fat running down the side of the steaks. Cut each steak in half and put on a baking tray, then transfer to the freezer and freeze for 40 mins.","Heat the oil in a heavy-based pan or casserole dish set over a medium heat. Add the onion and peppers along with a good pinch of salt and fry for 20 mins, or until the onions are golden and sticky. Add the vinegar and cook for a further 5 mins. Season to taste.","Using a sharp knife, slice the steak as thinly as possible and pile the slices into four portions. Heat a skillet over a high heat until almost smoking. Put one portion of the steak slices in the pan in a pile that''s roughly the length of your rolls. Fry for 3 mins over a high heat until some of the steak is cooked through, with pink bits remaining. Pile a quarter of the onion mixture on top, as well as a quarter each of the cheese slices and the mozzarella. Continue to cook undisturbed over a medium heat for 5-10 mins until the meat is brown and crisp around the edge and the cheeses have melted. Split one of the rolls open and carefully scoop the meat and cheese mixture into it. Repeat with the remaining meat, onions, cheese and rolls."]','2026-01-10 12:18:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6931,6931,'en','Pumpkin pie','Fill a sweet shortcrust pastry tart case with lightly spiced squash to make a traditional treat','["750g/1lb 10oz pumpkin or butternut squash, peeled, deseeded and cut into chunks","350g sweet shortcrust pastry","plain flour, for dusting","140g caster sugar","½  tsp salt","½  tsp fresh nutmeg, grated","1 tsp cinnamon","2 eggs, beaten","25g butter, melted","175ml milk","1 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Place the pumpkin in a large saucepan, cover with water and bring to the boil. Cover with a lid and simmer for 15 mins or until tender. Drain pumpkin; let cool.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Roll out the pastry on a lightly floured surface and use it to line a 22cm loose-bottomed tart tin. Chill for 15 mins. Line the pastry with baking parchment and baking beans, then bake for 15 mins. Remove the beans and paper, and cook for a further 10 mins until the base is pale golden and biscuity. Remove from the oven and allow to cool slightly.","Increase oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Push the cooled pumpkin through a sieve into a large bowl. In a separate bowl, combine the sugar, salt, nutmeg and half the cinnamon. Mix in the beaten eggs, melted butter and milk, then add to the pumpkin purée and stir to combine. Pour into the tart shell and cook for 10 mins, then reduce the temperature to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Continue to bake for 35-40 mins until the filling has just set.","Leave to cool, then remove the pie from the tin. Mix the remaining cinnamon with the icing sugar and dust over the pie. Serve chilled."]','2026-01-10 12:18:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6933,6933,'en','Next level fried chicken','Choose boneless thighs to make the ultimate fried chicken. For the coating, we’ve come up with a method that results in the crispiest finish ever','["8 skinless boneless chicken thighs","sunflower oil, for deep-frying","2 tbsp paprika","2 tsp garlic granules","1 tsp chilli powder","1 tsp black pepper","½ tsp dried oregano","1 chicken stock cube","500ml whole milk","2 tbsp cider or white wine vinegar","1 egg","100g self-raising flour","100g cornflour","¼ tsp turmeric"]','["To make the spice mix, combine all the ingredients. Whisk the milk with the vinegar, egg, ½ tsp salt and 1 tbsp spice mix in a bowl or deep plastic container to make the buttermilk marinade. Open the chicken thighs and put between two pieces of baking parchment, then flatten using a rolling pin. Transfer to the marinade, then cover and chill for 4 hrs, or overnight.","Make the coating by combining the flours and turmeric with most of the remaining spice mix (reserving 1 tsp) and a generous pinch of salt. Drain the chicken thighs, reserving the marinade. One by one, dredge each thigh in the flour, then dip in the reserved marinade, then dredge again in the flour, pressing on as much as you can to coat. Transfer the coated thighs to a large plate.","Heat a 10cm depth of oil in a shallow saucepan or deep-fat fryer until it reaches 175C. Lower two or three of the thighs in at a time and fry undisturbed for 3 mins, making sure the temperature doesn’t drop below 160C (it should stay at about 170C). Flip the thighs, then fry for another 2-3 mins until deeply golden and crisp on both sides. Lift the chicken out and transfer to a tray lined with kitchen paper to drain, then put on a rack and keep warm in a low oven while you fry the remaining thighs.","When all the chicken has been fried, combine the reserved spice mix with 1 tbsp flaky sea salt and sprinkle over the chicken to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6935,6935,'en','Nacho cheeseburger','Pile up burgers with cheese, guacamole, chipotle, salsa and nachos for a fiery and zingy twist on a cheeseburger. The nachos give added crunch','["2 beef burgers","2 slices cheddar","2 sesame seed burger buns","2 tbsp guacamole","2 tbsp chipotle or chilli mayo","2 tbsp salsa","small handful salted nachos","½  small bunch coriander, leaves torn"]','["Heat the grill to medium-high. Put the burgers on a baking sheet and grill for 5-8 mins on each side until cooked through. For the last minute, top the burgers with the cheese slices and grill until melted. Lightly toast the burger buns. Divide the guacamole, burgers, chipotle or chilli mayo, salsa and nachos, broken up, between each bun. Finish with a sprinkling of torn coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:18:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6937,6937,'en','American burnt onion dip','A tasty veggie dip with a mayonnaise and soured cream base, great for raw veggies or toasted pitta bread','["1 onion","1 tbsp olive oil","150ml soured cream","50g mayonnaise","raw vegetables, to serve"]','["Slice 1 onion and toss with 1 tbsp olive oil. Spread over a baking tray and grill under a high heat for 6-8 mins until nicely charred, then leave to cool. Chop and mix with 150ml soured cream and 50g mayonnaise. Season well and chill until needed. Serve with raw veg, for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:18:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6939,6939,'en','Choc chip pecan pie','An indulgent chocolate and pecan treat with buttery pastry and a gooey filling everybody can get stuck into','["300g plain flour","75g salted butter, cubed","100g cream cheese","1 tbsp icing sugar","150g salted butter","200ml maple syrup","250g light brown soft sugar","100g dark brown soft sugar","4 eggs, beaten","1 tsp vanilla extract","400g pecans, finely chopped","200g dark chocolate chips, or a bar, chopped"]','["First, make the pastry. Tip the ingredients into a food processor with 1 /4 tsp salt. Blend until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Drizzle 2-3 tsp cold water into the funnel while the blade is running – the mixture should start to clump together. Tip onto a work surface and bring together, kneading briefly into a ball. Pat into a disc, wrap in cling film, and chill for at least 20 mins. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Remove the pastry from the fridge and leave at room temperature for 5 mins to soften. Flour the work surface, then unwrap the pastry and roll to a circle the thickness of a £1 coin. Use the pastry to line a deep, 23cm round fluted tin – mine was about 3cm deep. Press the pastry into the corners and up the sides, making sure there are no gaps. Leave 1cm pastry overhanging (save some of the pastry scraps for later). Line with baking parchment (scrunch it up first to make it more pliable) and fill with baking beans. Blind-bake for 15-20 mins until the sides are set, then remove the parchment and beans and return to the oven for 5 mins until golden brown. Trim the pastry so it’s flush with the top of the tin – a small serrated knife is best for this. If there are any cracks, patch them up with the pastry scraps.","Meanwhile, weigh the butter, syrup and sugars into a pan, and add 1 /4 tsp salt. Heat until the butter has melted and the sugar dissolved, stirring until smooth. Remove from the heat and cool for 10 mins. Reduce oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.","Beat the eggs in a bowl. Add the syrup mixture, vanilla and pecans, and mix until well combined. Pour half the mixture into the tart case, scatter over half the chocolate chips, then cover with the remaining filling and chocolate chips. Bake on the middle shelf for 50-55 mins until set. Remove from the oven and leave to cool, then chill for at least 2 hrs before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:18:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6941,6941,'en','Texas BBQ medley','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyOnce you''ve tried smoking and slow cooking your chicken, you''ll be totally converted. The dry brine seasons the meat to the bone and keeps it succulent during cooking','["1 large chicken","5 beef short ribs (about 3kg), ribs separated","2kg piece boned pork shoulder, rind removed","Texas barbecue sauce","sliced sweet white onions and sliced gherkins, to serve","8 tbsp good-quality flaky sea salt","2 tsp fennel seeds","1 tbsp black peppercorns","3 bay leaves","2 tsp cayenne pepper","1 tbsp smoked paprika","2 tsp garlic salt","150g soft light brown sugar","50g golden caster sugar","wood chips (optional)"]','["You’ll need to brine the meat at least 24 hrs before your BBQ. First, spatchcock the chicken. Flip the chicken over so the backbone is facing you. Use a sturdy pair of kitchen or poultry scissors to cut down either side of the backbone, then discard. Turn the chicken over and push down firmly on the breastbone to flatten out the bird. Make a few slashes in each leg joint. (Watch a video showing how to spatchcock a chicken at bbcgoodfood.com/videos/spatchcock.)","Put each cut of meat in a separate, large sealable bag. Sprinkle 1 tbsp salt into each bag and massage it all over the meat. Squeeze the air from the bags, seal tightly and put in the fridge for 24 hrs.","Tip the remaining salt, fennel seeds and peppercorns into a mortar. Tear the bay into small pieces and add this too. Crush the ingredients with the pestle until finely ground. Add the cayenne, paprika, garlic salt and sugars, and mix well. Remove the meat from the bags and pat dry with kitchen paper. Cover each cut with the rub, making sure you get into every nook. Return to the fridge for at least 1-2 hrs while you prepare the barbecue, or up to 24 hrs.","You’ll need to start the barbecue 7-8 hrs before you want to eat. Heat the coals and leave them until ashen. Add your wood chips, if using. When the flames have died down and you’re left with smoky cinders, push the coals and wood chips to one side of the BBQ pit, then replace the grill and add the beef and pork, placing them above the empty side of the pit – this will ensure the meat smokes but doesn’t burn. Pull down the lid and cook the meat for 30-40 mins, turning every now and then, until a dark crust has formed around the meat. Don’t be afraid to take it quite far, the crust should be almost black (but caramelised as opposed to burnt). Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1.","Transfer the meat to roasting tins, wrap tightly with foil and cook in the oven for 5-6 hrs until really tender.","When the meat has 1 - 1 1/ 2 hrs to go, reheat the BBQ and wait for the coals to turn ashen before adding more wood chips. When the flames have died down, push to one side as before. Put the chicken on the BBQ, bone-side down, above the empty side of the pit. Cook for 20-25 mins on each side or until cooked through – check by piercing a leg to see if the juices are clear, or use a meat thermometer to check the internal temperature has reached 70C. Wrap tightly in foil and set aside to rest.","After 5-6 hrs, the beef and pork should be really tender. Remove from the oven and leave to rest for 15 mins. If you’ve made a BBQ sauce (see the Texas BBQ sauce recipe here), brush this over the meat for a glossy finish. Remove any string from the pork and shred the meat. Cut the chicken into portions and serve everything on a big platter with the sliced sweet onions, gherkins and sides."]','2026-01-10 12:18:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6943,6943,'en','Diner sloppy joes','A simple, American staple the whole family can get stuck into. Add a dash of spicy chipotle or smoky barbecue sauce to bring some zing','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 small red peppers or yellow peppers, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","400g minced beef","2 x 400ml cans chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp chipotle or smoky barbecue sauce","4 cheese slices","6 burger buns","crispy onions, to serve","iceberg lettuce, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a deep frying pan, then fry the onion, pepper and garlic for 8-10 mins until softened. Add the mince, breaking it up with a wooden spoon as you go, and stir until it browns all over. Tip in the tomatoes and chipotle, or barbecue sauce, and add a little seasoning. Simmer for 10-15 mins until the sauce has thickened.","Put the cheese slices on top of the mince and cover with a lid for 2 mins to let it melt into the sauce. Pile into the buns with the crispy onions, and lettuce on the side for scooping up the extra sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:18:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6945,6945,'en','Cornbread','You can prepare this cornbread ahead of time for a stree free brunch to have on the table in minutes. Top with devilled eggs and avocado or chilli con carne for a hearty lunch','["50g slightly salted butter, melted, plus extra for greasing","250g fine polenta or cornmeal, plus extra for dusting","325g can sweetcorn, drained","250ml buttermilk","4 large eggs","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","100g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and brush a 900g loaf tin with melted butter, then dust it with polenta and shake out the excess. Tip 175g of the sweetcorn into a food processor with the remaining ingredients and 1 tsp salt. Blend until smooth, then remove the blade and stir through most of the remaining sweetcorn.","Pour the batter into the tin, scatter over the last of the sweetcorn and bake for 45-50 mins until risen and golden. Insert a skewer into the centre – it should come out with a few moist crumbs, but the mixture should not be wet. Return to the oven for a further 5-10 mins if necessary, then test again.","Cool the loaf in its tin for 10 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool. Will keep, wrapped in cling film, for up to 3 days, or freeze in slices for up to 2 months."]','2026-01-10 12:18:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6947,6947,'en','Safe-to-eat uncooked cookie dough','Who doesn''t love cookie dough and this one takes only minutes to make. Keep a batch in the fridge, eat it by the spoon, serve it with ice cream, or mould it, shape it and colour it with food dye like edible Play-Doh!','["100g butter, softened to room temperature","175g soft brown sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","140g plain flour","2 tbsp full-fat milk"]','["Beat the butter and sugar together, preferably in a mixer. Add the vanilla, 1 /2 tsp salt and the flour, then mix until it looks like breadcrumbs. Keep mixing as you add the milk and you’re done – delicious, safe, raw cookie dough. If it’s not amazing enough as it is, then go crazy with these flavourings:","Salted caramel dough: Swirl 1 tbsp dulce de leche through the dough, plus 1/2 tsp of salt and a handful of dark chocolate chips.","S''more cookie dough: Add 1 tbsp Nutella, 2 crumbled digestive biscuits, and some mini marshmallows.","Apple & cinnamon dough: Add some little chunks of dried apple and a sprinkle of cinnamon sugar (1 tsp cinnamon mixed with 1 tbsp soft brown sugar).","Peanut heaven dough: Add 1 tbsp peanut butter and a handful of peanut M&Ms."]','2026-01-10 12:18:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6949,6949,'en','All-American T-bone','For a special supper, try this classic American cut from the sirloin. The steak has a T-shaped bone with meat on each side, perfect for sharing','["700g T-bone steak","2 garlic cloves, bashed","½  small pack thyme","½  tbsp olive oil","50g butter"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put an ovenproof griddle pan on a high heat. Season the steak on both sides, then rub both sides with the garlic cloves, thyme and olive oil. Put the steak in the hot pan and char the underside for 2 mins or until griddle lines appear. Turn the steak over to brown the other side, rub the top with the thyme again, then lay the thyme and garlic on top of the meat.","Once evenly browned all over with griddle lines, put the thyme and garlic to one side, hold the steak with a pair of tongs to cook its fatty side and render it down so it’s soft rather than gristly. This will take a few mins. Lay the steak flat again, put the thyme, garlic and butter on top and transfer the pan to the oven to finish cooking for 4-5 mins, until the meat reaches 62-65C on a probe thermometer (or until cooked to your liking).","Rest the meat for 5-6 mins. Serve on a board or large plate in the middle of the table."]','2026-01-10 12:18:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6951,6951,'en','Malt hot chocolate s’mores','Try a twist on American-style marshmallow and chocolate s’mores by swapping the traditional crackers for malted biscuits','["16 malted milk biscuits","8 squares of milk chocolate","8 marshmallows (vegetarian brand, if required)"]','["Preheat the grill to high and line a large baking sheet with parchment. Put all 16 malted milks on the tray with a square of milk chocolate on 8 and a marshmallow on the remaining 8. Grill until both are melting.","Sandwich the two different types on top of each other until oozing at the edges and eat while hot or dunked in a hot chocolate for extra chocolately flavour."]','2026-01-10 12:18:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6953,6953,'en','Caesar salad with crispy chicken','Have chicken left over from supper? Use it up in a crisp salad with creamy Caesar dressing','["4 crispy chicken thighs, sliced (see Tip)","125ml light mayonnaise","juice 1 lemon","1 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","50g parmesan, grated, plus extra to serve (optional)","1 garlic clove, crushed","50g croûtons","1 large Cos lettuce or 4 Little Gem, ripped into pieces"]','["In a large bowl, mix the mayonnaise,\r\nlemon juice, Worcestershire sauce,\r\ngrated Parmesan and garlic, then season.\r\nWhen ready to eat, add the chicken\r\nslices, croutons and lettuce. Mix well and\r\nsprinkle with extra Parmesan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6955,6955,'en','New York cheesecake','This authentic creamy dessert will add a taste of New York to any dining table','["85g butter melted, plus extra for tin","140g digestive biscuits, made into fine crumbs","1 tbsp sugar, granulated or golden caster","3 x 300g/11oz pack Philadelphia cheese, or other full-fat soft cheese","250g golden caster sugar","3 tbsp plain flour","1½  tsp vanilla extract","finely grated zest of 1 lemon (about 2 tsp)","1½  tsp lemon juice","3 large eggs, plus 1 yolk","284ml carton soured cream","142ml carton soured cream","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","2 tsp lemon juice"]','["Position an oven shelf in the middle of the oven. Preheat the oven to fan 160C/conventional 180C/gas 4. Line the base of a 23cm springform cake tin with parchment paper. For the crust, melt the butter in a medium pan. Stir in the biscuit crumbs and sugar so the mixture is evenly moistened. Press the mixture into the bottom of the pan and bake for 10 minutes. Cool on a wire rack while preparing the filling.","For the filling, increase the oven temperature to fan 200C/conventional 240C/gas 9. In a table top mixer fitted with the paddle attachment, beat the soft cheese at medium-low speed until creamy, about 2 minutes. With the mixer on low, gradually add the sugar, then the flour and a pinch of salt, scraping down the sides of the bowl and the paddle twice.","Swap the paddle attachment for the whisk. Continue by adding the vanilla, lemon zest and juice. Whisk in the eggs and yolk, one at a time, scraping the bowl and whisk at least twice. Stir the 284ml carton of soured cream until smooth, then measure 200ml/7fl oz (just over 3?4 of the carton). Continue on low speed as you add the measured soured cream (reserve the rest). Whisk to blend, but don''t over-beat. The batter should be smooth, light and somewhat airy.","Brush the sides of the springform tin with melted butter and put on a baking sheet. Pour in the filling - if there are any lumps, sink them using a knife - the top should be as smooth as possible. Bake for 10 minutes. Reduce oven temperature to fan 90C/conventional 110C/gas 1?4 and bake for 25 minutes more. If you gently shake the tin, the filling should have a slight wobble. Turn off the oven and open the oven door for a cheesecake that''s creamy in the centre, or leave it closed if you prefer a drier texture. Let cool in the oven for 2 hours. The cheesecake may get a slight crack on top as it cools.","Combine the reserved soured cream with the 142ml carton, the sugar and lemon juice for the topping. Spread over the cheesecake right to the edges. Cover loosely with foil and refrigerate for at least 8 hours or overnight.","Run a round-bladed knife around the sides of the tin to loosen any stuck edges. Unlock the side, slide the cheesecake off the bottom of the tin onto a plate, then slide the parchment paper out from underneath."]','2026-01-10 12:18:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6957,6957,'en','Salt beef club with Cajun fries','An indulgent solo supper of a layered sandwich with sliced beef, creamy dressing and homemade chips','["1 big potato, cut into thin chips","2 tsp olive oil","½  tsp Cajun seasoning","1 heaped tbsp mayonnaise","1 tsp chopped chive","1 tsp Dijon mustard","3 slices white or brown bread, lightly toasted","2 radishes, thinly sliced","1 baby or ½ avocado, sliced","2 slices salt beef","couple Little Gem lettuce leaves"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPlace the chips on a non-stick\r\nbaking tray, toss with oil and Cajun\r\nseasoning, then spread out in a\r\nsingle layer. Pop in the oven and\r\nbake, turning once, for 20-25 mins\r\nor until golden and crisp. Season.","Meanwhile, mix the mayonnaise,\r\nchives and mustard in a small\r\nbowl and season. Spread the mix onto 2 of the slices of bread.\r\nLayer 1 spread slice with radishes\r\nand avocado. Place the other slice,\r\nspread-side up, on top and add\r\nthe salt beef and lettuce. Top\r\nwith the final slice.","Cut up and secure with cocktail\r\nsticks if you like, then serve\r\nalongside the fries."]','2026-01-10 12:18:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6959,6959,'en','Griddled chicken & corn on the cob salad','Grill whole sweetcorn and serve with paprika-spiced chicken and crisp Little Gem for a healthy, speedy salad','["4 small skinless chicken breasts","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp paprika","juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp olive oil","2 corn cobs","4 Little Gem lettuces, quartered lengthways","½ cucumber, diced"]','["Cut the chicken breasts in half\r\nlengthways so you are left with\r\n8 chicken strips. Mix the garlic,\r\npaprika, lemon juice and 1 tbsp\r\noil with some seasoning and\r\ntoss with the chicken. Leave to\r\nmarinate for at least 15 mins.","Heat a griddle pan and brush\r\nwith half the remaining oil and\r\ncook the chicken for 3-4 mins each\r\nside until cooked through. Brush over\r\nthe remaining oil and griddle the corn\r\ncobs, turning to cook evenly, for about\r\n5 mins or until lightly charred. Remove\r\nand cut off the kernels.","Mix the lettuce and cucumber, top\r\nwith the corn and chicken, and drizzle\r\nover your choice of dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:18:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6961,6961,'en','Key lime pie','This creamy, dairy-free dessert is naturally sweetened and uses entirely raw ingredients, with a date, walnut and coconut crust and a creamy avocado and cashew nut filling','["300g Hob Nobs","150g butter, melted","1 x 397g tin condensed milk (we used Nestlé)","3 medium egg yolks","finely grated zest and juice of 4 limes","300ml double cream","1 tbsp icing sugar","extra lime zest, to decorate"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Whizz the biscuits to crumbs in a food processor (or put in a strong plastic bag and bash with a rolling pin). Mix with the melted butter and press into the base and up the sides of a 22cm loose-based tart tin. Bake in the oven for 10 minutes. Remove and cool.","Put the egg yolks in a large bowl and whisk for a minute with electric beaters. Add the condensed milk and whisk for 3 minutes then add the zest and juice and whisk again for 3 minutes.\r\nPour the filling into the cooled base then put back in the oven for 15 minutes. Cool then chill for at least 3 hours or overnight if you like.","When you are ready to serve, carefully remove the pie from the tin and put on a serving plate. To decorate, softly whip together the cream and icing sugar. Dollop or pipe the cream onto the top of the pie and finish with extra lime zest."]','2026-01-10 12:18:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6963,6963,'en','Spicy pork & ginger noodles','Combine spicy pork, mushrooms, bok choy and ginger noodles for a quick midweek meal in just 25 minutes. Easy and speedy, it’s ideal for busy weekdays','["250g medium egg noodles","½ tbsp sesame oil","1 tbsp vegetable oil","400g pork mince","300g mushrooms , finely sliced","30g ginger , finely grated","3 garlic cloves , crushed","1 red chilli , finely chopped","4 spring onions , finely sliced, green and white parts kept separate","3 bok choy , leaves separated, white parts finely sliced and leafy tops left whole","2 tbsp soy sauce","2 tbsp Shaoxing rice wine"]','["Cook the noodles following pack instructions, then drain well and set aside. Heat both oils in a large, deep frying pan over a medium-high heat. Stir in the pork mince, breaking it up using the back of a wooden spoon. Cook for 2-3 mins, until any water has evaporated. Mix in the mushrooms and cook for a further 4-5 mins until browned. Stir in the ginger, garlic, chilli and the white parts of the spring onions and bok choy. Cook for 2-3 mins until fragrant and softened.","Mix in the green parts of the bok choy along with the soy sauce, rice wine and the cooked noodles. Toss everything together to coat, then serve sprinkled with with the remaining green parts of the spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:18:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6965,6965,'en','Rice paper dumplings','Enjoy these pork and mushroom dumplings as a starter or side as part of a Vietnamese-inspired feast. Serve with our soy & sesame dipping sauce','["¼ small white cabbage , cored and roughly chopped","1 carrot , grated","100g shiitake mushrooms , finely chopped","400g pork mince","2 garlic cloves , crushed","20g ginger , peeled and grated","2 tsp soy sauce","2 tsp sesame oil","3 spring onions , finely sliced","20-40 Vietnamese spring roll wrappers or rice paper sheets","75ml vegetable oil , plus extra for the board","2 tbsp soy sauce","2 tbsp rice vinegar","½ tbsp sesame seeds , toasted","2 spring onions , finely sliced"]','["Tip the cabbage into a food processor and blitz until finely chopped. Season with ½ tsp salt, toss well and set aside for 15 mins. Tip into a clean tea towel and squeeze out as much water as you can. Tip into a bowl with the carrot, mushrooms, pork mince, garlic, ginger, soy sauce, sesame oil and spring onions. Season with black pepper. Scrunch everything together using your hands, mixing well until everything is combined.","Soak the spring roll sheets for a couple of seconds in a shallow dish of warm water, then transfer to an oiled chopping board. Working with one sheet at a time, spoon 1 heaped tbsp of the filling into the middle, then fold the bottom up and over the filling. Fold down the top of the sheet, then the sides to fully encase and make a neat square. If the dumpling feels a little fragile, soak another sheet and wrap it again. Repeat with the remaining sheets and filling, transferring the dumplings to an oiled plate as you go.","Heat the oil in a large, non-stick frying pan (ensuring it is no more than a third full) over a medium-high heat and fry the dumplings for 3-5 mins until golden brown. Use a slotted spoon or spider to turn them, then cover with a lid and cook for another 3-4 mins until golden. Remove the lid and cook for 1-2 mins.","Meanwhile, combine all the dipping sauce ingredients in small bowl. Serve the dumplings with the dipping sauce on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:18:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6967,6967,'en','Homemade kimchi','Kimchi exists in dozens of versions and these can be further varied. Shrimp or fish sauce is also traditionally used to prepare kimchi, we offer you a simplified version that is also suitable for vegans.','["40.00 g salt finely ground, sea","1.20 kg Chinese cabbage cut into squares about 5 x 5 cm","370.00 g spring onion cut into 5 cm pieces","49.00 g ginger (fresh) 9 cm piece, finely grated","10.00 clove garlic crushed or minced","30.00 g dried chili fine Korean chili powder (kochukaru), can be replaced with other dried chili powder","1.50 tbsp granulated sugar"]','["Dissolve 30 g of salt in 2 liters of cold water in a jug.","Pour the cabbage into a container of at least 2.5 liters made of inert material (glass, porcelain, earthenware, etc.). Pour salted water so that the cabbage is submerged. Cover with a plate and leave at room temperature to allow the cabbage to start fermenting (this takes about 12 hours, bubbles will appear in the liquid and the cabbage will turn slightly sour).","Drain the cabbage and keep the pickle. In a bowl, mix the cabbage with the spring onion, ginger, garlic, chili seasoning, sugar and the remaining salt.","Transfer to a sterilized 2 liter jar and cover with the reserved varnish to keep the cabbage submerged.","Pour some of the remaining marinade into a plastic bag, close it tightly and place it on top of the cabbage so that it remains submerged in the varnish.","Place in a room where the temperature does not exceed 20°C to ferment (leaven) to your liking. It will probably take 4-6 days.","Remove the bag, close the jar and store in the refrigerator. It lasts even 3 months."]','2026-01-10 12:18:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6969,6969,'en','Golden chicken with rice noodles & crispy shallots','Serve these noodles straight from the dish so people can tuck in and serve themselves. The star of the show is the chicken, with a fabulous mix of flavours','["400ml coconut milk (whisk well to combine the cream and water, if it has separated in the can)","2 tsp ground turmeric","15g piece ginger , finely grated","2 large garlic cloves , finely grated","2 limes , 1 zested and juiced, 1 cut into wedges to serve","½ large red chilli , frozen and finely grated (see tip below)","2 tbsp light brown soft sugar","2 tsp fish sauce","6 boneless and skinless chicken thighs","vegetable oil , for frying","4 shallots , finely sliced into rings","180g wide rice noodles (4 nests)","2 carrots , cut into matchsticks","6 baby cucumbers , sliced or ½ a cucumber, halved lengthways and sliced","small bunch mint , leaves picked","small bunch Thai basil , leaves picked","100g salted peanuts , roughly chopped"]','["In a large bowl, combine the coconut milk, turmeric, ginger, garlic, lime zest and juice, chilli, sugar, fish sauce and 1 tsp salt. Add the chicken thighs, stirring to coat, then put in the fridge to marinate overnight. Will keep covered and chilled for up to two days.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Transfer the chicken to a large roasting tin with high sides. Roast for 30 mins, spooning the sauce over the chicken a few times during cooking, until the chicken is cooked through and a little charred, and the sauce has reduced. At the end, if the chicken needs more colour, grill it for a few minutes, if you like.","While the chicken cooks, heat enough vegetable oil to cover the base of a large, deep frying pan, separate the shallot rings and cook in a single layer for 6-8 mins, or until golden brown (you may have to do this in batches). Drain on kitchen paper and season generously with salt.","Cook the noodles following pack instructions (or bring a pan of water to the boil, add the noodles, take off the heat and leave for 5 mins, then drain and rinse with cold water).","Remove the chicken from the tin and slice into chunks. Toss the drained noodles through the sauce in the roasting tin. Top with the chicken, veg, crispy shallots, herbs and peanuts. Serve with lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6971,6971,'en','Thai basil pork stir-fry','This recipe is inspired by the spicy and savoury Thai favourite pad kra pao. You can adjust the amount of chillies to suit your taste','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 large shallot , sliced","1 lemongrass stalk , finely sliced","2 red chillies , finely sliced, plus extra to serve (optional)","3 garlic cloves , finely chopped","2 tbsp soy sauce","2 tbsp oyster sauce","½ tbsp fish sauce","½ tsp caster sugar","500g pork mince","200g green beans , chopped into thirds","25g Thai basil , larger leaves torn","cooked jasmine rice , to serve"]','["This dish comes together quite quickly, so have all the ingredients to hand. Pour the vegetable oil into a large frying pan or wok over a high heat. Once shimmering, add the shallot, lemongrass, chillies and garlic. Cook for 5-6 mins, stirring, until softened and the edges are golden. Pour the soy sauce, oyster sauce, fish sauce and sugar into a small bowl or jug and stir in 1 tbsp water to combine.","Stir the pork into the pan, then pour in the sauce and green beans. Cook for an additional 5-6 mins, stirring all the while. When the beans are tender with a little bit of bite, stir in the Thai basil.","Serve immediately alongside the rice, garnished with more chillies if you want extra heat."]','2026-01-10 12:18:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6973,6973,'en','Charred asparagus & broccoli with blistered chilli dressing','These charred greens, tossed with a punchy chilli dressing, make a perfect barbecue side – enjoy with our maple & mustard glazed spatchcock chicken','["300g asparagus , woody ends trimmed","300g long-stem broccoli","2 tbsp olive oil , plus a drizzle","1 red chilli","1 tsp maple syrup","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","½ lemon , zested and juiced"]','["Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil. Drop in the asparagus and broccoli, boil for 1 min, then drain well, leave to cool and pat dry.","When the barbecue is hot, drizzle a little oil over the chilli and cook for 2-3 mins until charred and softened. Remove from the BBQ, leave to cool a little, then finely chop, and mix with the maple syrup, olive oil, lemon zest and juice. Season to taste and set aside.","Toss the asparagus and broccoli in the olive oil, and grill directly on the barbecue for 3-4 mins, turning occasionally, until lightly charred and smoky. Transfer the vegetables to a serving plate and season with flaky sea salt. Serve the blistered chilli dressing on the side for spooning over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6975,6975,'en','Chicken adobo','Leave this peppery Filipino stew in the pot overnight for even more flavour. Enjoy it with steamed jasmine rice','["2 tbsp vegetable oil , plus a splash if needed","2 chicken legs (about 600g)","2 skin-on, bone-in chicken thighs (about 300g)","65g garlic , finely chopped (about 1½ bulbs)","1 small onion , finely chopped","90ml coconut or cider vinegar","90ml light soy sauce","2 bay leaves","10 whole black peppercorns","small pinch of light brown soft sugar","2 spring onions , thinly sliced","steamed jasmine rice , to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a pan over a high heat and sear all the chicken, skin-side down, until caramelised, about 3-5 mins. Turn over and sear the other side for 2-3 mins, then remove from the pan and set aside on a plate. (The chicken doesn’t need to be cooked through at this point.)","Reduce the heat to medium and add a splash more oil if the pan seems dry. Fry the garlic until it begins to brown and becomes fragrant, about 2-3 mins. Stir in the onion, then cover and cook for 3-5 mins until softened, stirring occasionally. Return the chicken to the pan, skin-side down, and increase the heat to high. Add the vinegar, then bring to the boil and cook until the liquid has reduced by a quarter, about 4-5 mins. The vinegar should smell fragrant and slightly sweet, rather than raw and acrid.","Add the soy sauce, boil for 2-3 mins, then add the bay leaves, black peppercorns and sugar. Cover and simmer over a low heat for 10-12 mins. Gently stir, turn the chicken over and continue to cook for 6-10 mins, covered, until the chicken is tender and cooked through. Let the adobo rest in the pot for at least 5 mins before seasoning with black pepper and serving topped with the spring onions alongside steamed jasmine rice. Leftover chicken adobo will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:18:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6977,6977,'en','Nihari','Enjoy this slow-cooked spiced lamb stew from Pakistan. It’s particularly popular during Ramadan and is a staple at weddings and celebrations','["4 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tbsp ghee","2.5cm piece of ginger , finely grated","2-3 garlic cloves , finely chopped","4 lamb shanks","1½ tbsp Kashmiri red chilli powder","1 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp wholewheat flour","1 tbsp fennel seeds","1 cinnamon stick","2 black cardamom pods","2 whole star anise","1½ tbsp coriander seeds","1 tbsp cumin seeds","2 mace blades , or ½ tsp ground mace","½ tsp ground nutmeg","2 tbsp blue poppy seeds (not black)","15 whole cloves","¾ tbsp black peppercorns , or 2-3 pippali long peppers","large handful of coriander leaves , roughly chopped","5cm piece of ginger , julienned","2 green finger chillies , finely chopped","6 tbsp crispy fried onions","4 lemons , cut into wedges","naan"]','["In a spice grinder or mini food processor, add all the nihari masala ingredients with 2 tbsp hot water and blitz to a fine paste. Set aside 3 tsp of the nihari masala spice blend for serving.","Heat the oil and ghee in a large, heavy-based pan over medium heat. Fry the ginger and garlic until fragrant, around 2 mins. Add the lamb and fry all over for 10 mins or until well browned. Stir in the Kashmiri red chilli powder, the remaining nihari masala and 1 tsp salt. Fry until spices are fragrant, 1-2 mins, adding a splash of water if needed to prevent sticking. Add 1.5 litres of water, or just enough to submerge the meat.","Bring to a simmer, then cook, covered, over a medium-low heat for 45 mins-1 hr. Remove 150ml of the cooking liquid and whisk with both flours until combined. Return to pan and stir well. Cover and cook on a low heat for a further 2 hrs, or until the meat is fall-apart tender.","Serve garnished with coriander, ginger, chillies, fried onions, lemon wedges, and the reserved spice blend, and naan on the side, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6979,6979,'en','Halo-halo','Enjoy a traditional Filipino dessert that translates as ‘mix-mix’. It’s a colourful and refreshing medley of flavours and textures, ideal for hot days','["410ml can evaporated milk","50g large tapioca pearls","200g dark brown soft sugar","100g small tapioca pearls","neutral-tasting oil , such as vegetable, for the container","100g caster sugar","7g agar-agar","1 tsp green pandan extract","100g nata de coco , drained","100g jackfruit , drained and sliced","200g kaong (palm seeds)","200g red mung beans , drained","200g ube halaya"]','["Line a 20cm square cake tin with baking parchment. Combine the evaporated milk with 820ml water in a large bowl, stirring well. Pour the mixture into the prepared tin and freeze for 2 hrs, or until it starts freeze at the edges. Remove from the freezer and, using a fork, scrape up the partially frozen mixture to create fluffy, icy crystals. Return to the freezer. Repeat this process every 45 mins until the entire mixture is completely frozen and has a  granita-like texture – this will take a few hours. Once ready, keep frozen until ready to serve, fluffing with a fork if needed before you do.","Bring 750ml water to the boil and cook the large tapioca pearls for 30 mins. Cover, turn off the heat and leave to cool completely.","Combine the brown sugar with 100ml water in a saucepan and warm over a medium heat until the sugar has dissolved. Bring to a simmer and cook for 2-3 mins until thickened slightly. Remove from heat and divide between two jugs. Leave to cool.","Drain the large tapioca pearls and tip them into one of the jugs of brown sugar syrup. Bring 1 litre water to the boil in a separate pan and cook the small tapioca pearls for 20 mins. Drain immediately and transfer to the second jug of brown sugar syrup.","For the jelly, first oil a reusable container (about 15 x 10cm). Bring 570ml water to the boil in a saucepan and whisk in the caster sugar until dissolved, then whisk in the agar agar until it has also dissolved. Stir in the pandan extract, then pour the mixture into the prepared container and leave to set, about 1 hr. Once set, cut into cubes.","To assemble the halo-halo, divide the nata de coco, sliced jackfruit, kaong, red mung beans, ube halaya and most of the pandan jelly cubes between four tall dessert glasses. Spoon over the large tapioca pearls, followed by the small tapioca pearls. Generously spoon over the granita-style evaporated milk ice, then scatter over a few extra cubes of the pandan jelly on top, along with any additional toppings if desired (such as a drizzle of extra brown syrup or a scoop of ube halaya). Serve immediately and let guests ''mix-mix'' everything together as they eat."]','2026-01-10 12:18:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6981,6981,'en','Sticky air fryer salmon rice bowl','Air fry salmon pieces in a sauce made with soy, honey, ginger and sriracha, then serve over brown rice and top with fresh pickled vegetables for a quick and easy midweek meal','["500g piece of salmon fillet","3 tbsp soy sauce","15g ginger , grated","2 tbsp honey","1 tbsp sesame oil","2 tbsp sriracha","2 tbsp sesame seeds","150g frozen edamame beans","1 tbsp apple cider vinegar","1 tsp caster sugar","½ cucumber , halved and thinly sliced","200g radishes , finely sliced","cooked brown rice , to serve","15g pink pickled ginger","4 large nori sheets"]','["Heat your air fryer to 175C. Remove any skin from the salmon and cut into 2cm cubes. Combine 2 tbsp of the soy sauce, the ginger, honey, sesame oil, sriracha and half the sesame seeds in a bowl. Stir in the salmon cubes and toss well. Set aside to marinate for 10 mins. Arrange in an even layer in the air fryer basket, drizzling over any remaining sauce and cook at 175C for 5-7 mins until cooked through and sticky.","Meanwhile, cook the edamame following pack instructions, then drain well and set aside to cool slightly. Stir together the remaining sesame seeds with the vinegar, sugar and a large pinch of salt. Mix in the cucumber and cooled edamame, and set aside.  Mix the radishes with the remaining soy sauce.","Spoon the salmon on top of the cooked brown rice to serve, drizzling over any sauce leftover from the air fryer. Add the edamame and cucumber, radishes and a little pickled ginger on the side. Crumble over the nori to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6983,6983,'en','Thai-style fishcakes with cucumber smacked noodles','Liven up a weeknight dinner with these little fishcakes made in an air fryer and served with rice and smacked cucumbers. They can also work as a spicy snack','["250g skinless trout or salmon fillets","1 tbsp red Thai curry paste","10g coriander , finely chopped","1 tsp fish sauce","1 lime , zested and juiced","1 tbsp lemongrass paste","2 garlic cloves , grated","3 tbsp plain flour","50g panko breadcrumbs","2 x 250g pouches of ready-cooked brown rice , coriander and sriracha, to serve","1 cucumber","1 garlic clove , grated","2 tsp soy sauce","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tsp rice wine vinegar","2 tsp chilli oil"]','["Put the fish and other ingredients except the flour and panko in the bowl of a food processor. Pulse to form a chunky paste, then transfer to a bowl and stir in the flour.","Using slightly wet hands, shape them into small patties, around 8-10. Tip the breadcrumbs onto a plate, and roll the fishcakes through to coat. Will keep chilled for two days","Heat the air fryer to 180C. Cook for 10-15 mins, turning halfway until golden and cooked through.","Meanwhile, for the smacked cucumber, lightly bash the cucumber along its length using a rolling pin, breaking the flesh a little without turning it to a pulp. Cut the cucumber in half and scoop out the seeds, then cut the flesh into bite-sized pieces. Sprinkle over 1/2 tsp salt, leave for 10 mins, then rinse well in cold water and drain.","Mix the remaining ingredients in a medium bowl and toss the cucumber through.","Heat the rice following pack instructions, then serve with the fishcakes, smacked cucumber, coriander sprinkled over and some sriracha for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:18:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6985,6985,'en','Green goddess bowl with crispy sesame tofu','Use your air fryer to make these tofu batons coated in sesame seeds – they’re served with quinoa, plus an edamame, white cabbage and apple salad','["1 tbsp soy sauce","1 egg , beaten","3 tbsp flour","75g black and white sesame seeds","450g tofu , thoroughly dried using kitchen paper, and cut into strips","2 x 250g pouches of ready-cooked quinoa","½ white cabbage , shredded","160g edamame","1 green apple , cut into matchsticks","chilli flakes , to serve (optional)","1 avocado , peeled and chopped","15g coriander","15g basil","100g thick Greek yogurt","1 lime , zested and juiced"]','["Pour the soy sauce and beaten egg into a small bowl, and whisk to combine. Put the flour in another bowl and season, then put the sesame seeds in a third bowl. Using tongs, dip the tofu pieces first in the flour, then the egg, then in the sesame seeds, and turn to coat on all sides.","Transfer to the foil-lined basket of an air fryer. Cook for 10-15 mins, turning halfway, until golden and crisp.","Meanwhile, make the dressing by blitzing all the ingredients together in a blender until smooth. Season, then loosen with a little water until it''s a thick but pourable consistency. Will keep chilled for up to two days.","Heat the quinoa following pack instructions, then divide between four bowls. Put the cabbage, edamame and apple in a large bowl and toss with the dressing. Serve on top of the quinoa along with the crispy tofu. Scatter with chilli flakes, if you like, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6987,6987,'en','Sticky pork & rice noodle lettuce wraps','Assemble these sticky pork and rice noodle wraps at the table for a fun, festive way of eating. Cook in an air fryer and serve with your favourite chilli oil','["450g pork belly strips ,  cut into 3cm chunks","150g rice noodles , cooked following pack instructions","½ tsp sesame oil","2 limes , 1 juiced, 1 cut into wedges, to serve","5g coriander , roughly chopped, plus extra to serve","1 iceberg lettuce , or 2 Little Gem lettuce, leaves separated","1 carrot , cut into thin strips (use a mandoline if you have one) 1/2 cucumber, cut into thin strips (use a mandoline, if you have one)","chilli oil , to serve (optional)","3 tbsp oyster sauce","1 tbsp light soy sauce","1 tbsp maple syrup","½ tbsp rice wine vinegar","2 garlic cloves , grated","5g ginger , peeled and grated"]','["Mix all the sauce ingredients in a medium bowl, whisking to combine. Pour most of the sauce over the pork belly, making sure it is well coated. Reserve the remaining sauce for basting later.","Line the air fryer basket with foil and heat it to 200C. Once hot, tip the pork belly into the basket, spacing the pieces as best you can. Cook for 15-20 mins, turning every 7 mins. On the final turn, baste with the remaining glaze.","Meanwhile, mix the noodles with the sesame oil, lime juice and coriander. Season to taste.","When the pork is cooked, bring everything to the table and let everyone fill their lettuce cups with some noodles, pork and veg. Sprinkle over more coriander and serve with lime to squeeze over and chilli oil for drizzling, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6989,6989,'en','Hainanese chicken rice','Make this easy Hainanese chicken dinner inspired by Singapore’s national dish. It’s comforting, nourishing and healing for the soul','["1 whole chicken , around 1.2kg, or thighs for quicker cooking","4 garlic cloves , crushed or minced","150g piece of fresh ginger , sliced","1 ½ spring onions , sliced","½ tsp ground turmeric","210g rice , washed","small handul of coriander , chopped","sliced cucumber , to serve","thumb sized piece of ginger , finely chopped or finely grated","1 spring onion , thinly sliced","1 garlic clove , minced","pinch of sugar","½ tsp chicken bouillon powder","5 tbsp vegetable oil","2 red chillies , chopped","1 garlic clove , minced or crushed","1 tsp fish sauce (optional)","1 tsp light soy sauce","dash of vinegar , fresh lemon or lime (personal preference)","chicken fat , prepared from the whole chicken"]','["Trim any excess fat and loose flaps of skin from the chicken (otherwise keeping the skin on the chicken), then set aside. Reserve the offcuts too. Rub coarse salt all over the chicken, then poach in a saucepan of simmering water, ensuring it is fully immersed, with two-thirds of the ginger, three-quarters of the crushed garlic, 1 spring onion and the turmeric for 25-40 mins depending on the size of the chicken.","Put the cooked chicken in a bowl of iced water for 15 mins to stop the cooking process. Pour the chicken broth into a jug and set aside.","For the ginger & spring onion sauce, combine the garlic, ginger, spring onion and chicken bouillon powder in a serving dish and add a good pinch of salt and sugar. Heat the oil in a small pan until hot then pour over the other ingredients.","To make the red chilli sauce, combine all of the ingredients in small pan with 100ml of the reserved chicken broth, bring to a simmer, then remove from the heat and pour into a serving dish.","Prepare the rice by heating a frying pan or saucepan over a medium heat and adding the reserved chicken skin and fat from step 1. Once it has rendered (melted a little), add the remaining garlic, ginger and spring onion and cook for 1-2 mins until beginning to brown Stir in the washed rice and 1 litre of the reserved chicken broth. If you don’t have enough left, top up with water or chicken stock. Leave the rice to cook for around 10-15 mins or according to pack instructions. Remove the bones from the chicken, slice then serve with the rice and sauces. Garnish with the coriander and cucumber."]','2026-01-10 12:18:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6991,6991,'en','Korean BBQ sauce','Make barbecue sauce with a Korean twist by adding gochujang, a red pepper paste that creates a slightly smoky heat. Use the sauce as a glaze for sticky ribs, or spoon onto burgers','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tbsp grated garlic","500g passata","125g dark brown soft sugar","3 tbsp apple cider vinegar or rice vinegar","2 tbsp soy sauce","1½ tsp gochujang"]','["Heat the vegetable oil in a saucepan over a low heat and fry the garlic for 3 mins until softened. Add the remaining ingredients along with ¼ tsp salt, and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat and simmer for 10 mins until thickened, stirring occasionally. Will keep in a sterilised glass jar or bottle in the fridge for up to a month."]','2026-01-10 12:18:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6993,6993,'en','Kimchi jjigae','Make this spicy, warming Korean comfort food using pork belly and mature kimchi for maximum flavour','["400g mature kimchi","1 tbsp vegetable oil","¼ small brown onion , finely sliced","200g pork belly , finely sliced","1½ tsp gochugaru (Korean red pepper flakes)","1 tsp caster sugar","150g firm tofu , drained","2 spring onions , finely chopped"]','["Drain the kimchi in a sieve over a measuring jug (you''ll need about 100ml brine, so top up with more from the jar if needed). Heat the oil in a large saucepan over a high heat and fry the drained kimchi, brown onion and pork belly for 5 mins. Stir in the gochugaru and sugar, then fry for another 2 mins. Pour in 800ml water and the reserved kimchi brine, then bring to the boil. Simmer, uncovered, over a high heat for 15 mins.","Slice the tofu into 5cm squares that are about 1cm thick, then arrange these over the kimchi jjigae. Cover the pan with a lid and cook for 3-4 mins, or until the tofu is heated through. Scatter over the spring onions to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6995,6995,'en','Kimbap','Adapt these Korean-style rice rolls with almost anything you like – we’ve used seafood sticks and hot dogs, but spicy pork or tuna mayo work well too','["2 tsp vegetable oil","1 carrot , cut into thin matchsticks","2 eggs","100g danmuji (Korean pickled daikon), or use gherkins or cucumber","60g seafood sticks , sliced into thin lengths","2 hot dogs , sliced lengthwise into quarters","6 gim or nori seaweed sheets","100g baby spinach","1 tsp sesame oil , plus extra for brushing","½ tsp sesame seeds , plus extra for sprinkling","500g cooked sushi rice","1½ tsp sesame oil","2 tsp sesame seeds"]','["First, prepare the spinach. Put the spinach in a heatproof bowl and pour over boiling water from the kettle, pushing the leaves under the water using a spoon to make sure they all wilt. Drain, then rinse under cold running water and squeeze out any excess liquid. Return the spinach to the bowl and add the sesame oil, a pinch of salt and the sesame seeds. Mix and set aside.","Heat half the vegetable oil in a frying pan over a medium heat and fry the carrots for 2 mins until slightly softened. Remove to a plate and set aside.","Wipe the pan clean and heat the remaining oil over a high heat. Crack the eggs into a bowl and lightly whisk, then pour into the pan and swirl the pan to coat the base. Cook briefly until just set, then transfer the omelette to a chopping board and slice into strips, about ½cm thick. Put all the filling ingredients – the danmuji, seafood sticks, hot dogs, carrots, sliced omelette and spinach – on the same tray. Mix all the ingredients for the rice with ½ tsp salt in a large bowl.","Lay a seaweed sheet shiny-side down on a board and spread a quarter of the rice over three-quarters of the sheet in an even layer, leaving the top quarter of the sheet bare. Cut another seaweed sheet in half and lay this across the middle of the rice. (This will form the base layer for all the fillings.) Arrange a few pinches of each of the fillings across the length of that seaweed sheet. Lift the bottom of the larger seaweed sheet up and over the fillings, then tightly roll up, tucking everything in with your fingers as you go. At the end of the sheet, add a few grains of rice across the top to act as a glue to seal. Lightly brush with sesame oil and sprinkle with sesame seeds, then repeat to make the remaining rolls.","Slice into 1cm-thick circles using a sharp knife – if the knife starts to stick, wipe it with a piece of kitchen paper and sesame oil to create neat slices. You can also trim the edges if they’re a little rough."]','2026-01-10 12:18:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6997,6997,'en','Korean bibimbap','Use up your leftovers in a Korean bibimbap meaning ‘mixed rice’. Switch up the veg with whatever you’ve got in the fridge, then serve over rice with a fried egg and dress in a sweet, spicy gochujang sauce','["1 chestnut mushroom , finely sliced","½ courgette , halved and finely sliced","¼ carrot , cut into think matchsticks","40g beansprouts","30g spinach","¼ tsp sesame oil , plus extra to serve","½ tsp sesame seeds , plus extra to serve","2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 egg","150g cooked sushi rice","2 tbsp gochujang (Korean red pepper paste)","1 tsp sesame seeds","1 tsp caster sugar","½ tsp sesame oil"]','["Mix the bibimbap sauce ingredients together in a small bowl with 1 tbsp water and set aside.","Put the sliced mushroom, courgette, carrot and beansprouts on a plate. Put a small heatproof bowl or ramekin upside down in the middle of a medium lidded pan. Add enough water to come halfway up the ramekin and bring to a boil. Carefully put the plate of vegetables on top of the ramekin and put a lid on the pan. Steam the vegetables for 3 mins until tender.","Meanwhile, put the spinach in a bowl and pour boiling water over the top. Stir to wilt the leaves, then drain and rinse under cold water. Squeeze any excess water from the spinach, then mix in a bowl with the sesame oil, a pinch of salt and sesame seeds. Set aside.","Heat the vegetable oil in a frying pan over a high heat. Crack in the egg and fry to your liking.","Fill a bowl with the rice. Top with the fried egg, then use tongs to add the steamed vegetables around it. Serve with the bibimbap sauce, a little extra sesame oil and sesame seeds. Mix everything together before eating. Any leftover bibimbap sauce will keep chilled for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:18:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(6999,6999,'en','Super easy one-pan chilli beef','Make this super easy, one-pan version of takeaway favourite crispy chilli beef in just 30 minutes','["320g Morrisons British Beef Sizzle Steak , sliced","4 tbsp cornflour","5 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","1 onion , thinly sliced","2 red peppers , sliced","8 spring onions , sliced","1 red chilli , sliced","3 garlic cloves , crushed or finely grated","thumb-sized piece of ginger , finely grated","4 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","2 tbsp tomato ketchup","2 tbsp white wine or rice wine vinegar","2 tbsp dark soy sauce","600g straight-to-wok noodles","toasted sesame seeds , to serve (optional)"]','["Put the beef in a large bowl and toss with the cornflour and ½ tsp each of salt and ground black pepper. Heat the oil in a large frying pan or wok over a medium heat and fry the beef until crispy. Remove from the pan and set aside (you don’t have to remove it from the pan, this but it ensures the beef doesn’t overcook and stays as crispy as possible). Reserve the oil in the pan.","Stir in the onion and red pepper and fry for a few minutes until softened, then add the spring onions, chilli, garlic and ginger and cook for a couple of minutes longer before adding the chilli sauce, ketchup, vinegar and soy sauce. Mix everything together, cooking for 1 minute, then mix in the noodles and crispy beef. Cook for 2 mins, then serve in bowls with a scattering of sesame seeds, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7001,7001,'en','Hot honey, orange & sesame prawn stir-fry','This fragrant stir-fry is packed with prawns, peppers and pak choi. Serve with rice or noodles for an easy midweek win','["1 tbsp sesame oil","2 large oranges , zested and juiced (about 150ml)","4 tbsp honey","generous pinch of chilli flakes","4 tbsp soy sauce","2 tbsp rice vinegar","3 tbsp cornflour","2 tbsp sesame seeds","½ tsp Chinese five-spice","400g Morrisons Market Street Raw Peeled King Prawns","3 tbsp vegetable oil","2 garlic cloves , thinly sliced","thumb-sized piece of ginger , grated","4 spring onions , sliced into 2cm pieces","2 red peppers , cut into 3cm chunks","2 pak choi , sliced","rice or noodles, to serve (optional)"]','["To make the sauce, combine the oil, orange zest and juice, honey, chilli, soy and vinegar in a bowl. Combine the cornflour, sesame seeds, five-spice and a pinch of salt in another bowl. Run a small knife down the back of each Morrisons Market Street Raw Peeled King Prawn, so they butterfly as they cook.","Toss the prawns through the cornflour mixture. Heat the vegetable oil in a large wok or frying pan over a medium-high heat. When it’s hot, add the garlic and ginger. Sizzle for 10 seconds, but don’t let it brown. Add the prawns and any flour and seeds left in the bowl. Stir-fry over a high heat for a few minutes until the prawns are pink and the sesame seeds are golden.","Tip the prawns onto a plate. Add a drizzle more veg oil and the spring onions, peppers and pak choi. Stir-fry for 3-4 mins until cooked but still retaining some crunch.","Pour the sauce into the wok. Bubble for a few minutes until thickened, then add the prawns back to the wok and stir to coat in the sauce. Heat through for another 30 seconds, then serve with rice or noodles, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7003,7003,'en','Julie’s kari ikan (Malaysian fish curry)','Indulge in this fish curry on a Friday night. Light and fresh, yet rich and spicy, enjoy with a big bowl of steamed rice – ideally using your hands!','["3 tbsp vegetable oil","2 banana shallots , peeled and finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , grated","2.5cm piece of ginger , peeled and grated","2 medium dried red chillies , rehydrated then finely chopped","2 tbsp curry powder (Malaysian fish curry powder or any medium curry powder, plus 1 tsp fenugreek powder)","1 tsp ground turmeric","1 large tomato , chopped","200ml coconut milk","2 tbsp tamarind paste","2 lemongrass stalks , bruised","2 lime leaves","1 aubergine , cut into 3cm chunks","5 okra , cut into pieces","500g fish fillets (mackerel, snapper or any firm white fish) , cleaned and cut into 3-4 pieces each","small handful of coriander and steamed jasmine rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large, deep frying pan or flameproof casserole dish over medium heat and fry the shallots until translucent, about 3-4 mins. Add the garlic, ginger and chilli, and fry for another 2-3 mins until fragrant and lightly browned.","Stir in the curry powder and turmeric. Cook for about 1 min, stirring continuously to prevent the spices from burning. Add the tomato and cook until softened, about 2-3 mins.","Pour in the coconut milk and 200ml water, stirring to combine. Add the tamarind paste, lemongrass and lime leaves, and bring to a simmer. Add the aubergine and okra, and continue to simmer for about 20 mins until the vegetables are tender, adding a splash of water if the curry sauce has reduced.","Reduce the heat and gently lower in the fish pieces. Cover and simmer for 5-10 mins, or until the fish is cooked through and flakes easily when gently pressed with a fork. Season with salt to taste. Remove the lemongrass stalks and lime leaves, then garnish with the coriander and serve hot with steamed rice."]','2026-01-10 12:18:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7005,7005,'en','Leftovers prawn fried rice','Make this fried rice using the leftovers from our prawn, chorizo & courgette baked rice – it’s an easy supper the next day, which is ideal for busy weekdays','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","100g long-stem broccoli , trimmed","450g leftover rice with prawns (see recipe below)","220g can water chestnuts , drained","small handful of coriander , roughly chopped","25g cashews","2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp rice vinegar"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a frying pan over a medium-high heat and tip in the broccoli. Fry for 5 mins until browned, then transfer to a plate. Meanwhile, fish the prawns out of the rice and set aside. Combine the sauce ingredients in a bowl.","Drizzle the remaining oil into the pan and stir in the leftover rice. Leave undisturbed for 5 mins, then mix the prawns back in with the broccoli and water chestnuts. Cook for 1-2 mins, then stir in the sauce and coriander and serve with the cashews scattered over the top."]','2026-01-10 12:18:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7007,7007,'en','Classic chicken ramen','Make this speedy chicken ramen packed with veg. It’s ready in under 20 minutes and perfect for a flavourful lunch option','["2 skinless chicken breasts","2 handfuls of stir-fry vegetables (about 200g)","200g ramen noodles","1 egg","500ml chicken ramen broth","finely chopped chives , to serve","chilli flakes , to serve"]','["Heat a griddle or large frying pan over a medium heat and cook the chicken breasts for 5-7 mins until golden. Turn over and cook for another 4-5 mins until cooked through. Thinly slice and set aside. Cook the stir-fry veg in the pan for 2 mins until softened slightly.","Meanwhile, cook the noodles in a pan of boiling water following pack instructions, adding the egg to the pan for 5-6 mins (depending on how runny you like the yolk). Drain and set aside. Peel the egg, cut in half and set aside.","Warm the broth in a saucepan over a medium heat until piping hot, being careful not to let it boil.","Divide the noodles between two deep bowls, then top with the stir-fry veg, sliced chicken, egg halves and broth. Scatter over the chives and chilli flakes to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7009,7009,'en','Easy pork & chive dumplings','Try these Chinese dumplings filled with juicy pork and fresh Chinese chives. They’re easier to make than you think and fun to assemble as a group activity','["500g 20% fat pork mince","200g Chinese garlic chives or coriander or Chinese leaf if you can’t find them, finely sliced","1 ½ tbsp light soy sauce","1 tbsp oyster sauce","1 tsp white pepper","1 tsp sugar","1½ tsp cornflour","1 tbsp sesame oil","40 defrosted pre-made dumpling wrappers","vegetable oil, for frying","1 tbsp Chinese black vinegar","1 tsp chilli oil","½ tbsp sesame oil","1 small spring onion , finely sliced"]','["Tip the pork and chives into a bowl. Add the light soy sauce, oyster sauce, white pepper, 1 tsp salt, the sugar, cornflour and sesame oil, then mix well. Cover and leave to marinate in the fridge for 1 hr. Meanwhile, combine the dumpling sauce ingredients in a bowl and put in the fridge until needed.","Dipping a finger into cold water, wet the bottom half edges of a dumpling wrapper, then add ½ tbsp of the filling into the centre.","Fold the dumpling from the bottom up and firmly pinch at the middle, then start pleating each side from the right into the centre, firmly pinching as you go. Tuck in the sides and repeat with the left side. Firmly pinch across the top of the dumpling to ensure a tight seal. Repeat to make 40 dumplings.","Bring a large pan of water to boil and cook the dumplings in batches, around 10 at a time. Cook for 3-4 mins until the water starts simmering or the dumplings float to the top. Remove with a slotted spoon and set aside. Repeat until all the dumplings are cooked.","Add a splash of oil to afrying panand heat on a medium-high heat. Fry the boiled dumplings on each side for 4 mins or until golden brown, then serve with the dumpling sauce either drizzled over or for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:18:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7011,7011,'en','Thai red chicken curry','After a quick and easy Thai dish? It’s got to be a red curry. The flavours are so well balanced, it will make you fall in love with Thai food even more','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","400ml coconut milk","4 boneless chicken thighs (about 250g), cut into chunks or sliced","1 courgette , cut into 1.5cm rounds or roughly chopped","1 aubergine , roughly chopped","100g bamboo shoots , sliced","1 tsp sugar","1 tsp fish sauce","½ tbsp oyster sauce","½ tsp lemon juice","cooked jasmine rice and 1 sliced red chilli, to serve","3 dried arbol chillies soaked in water for 10 mins, deseeded","½ red chilli , sliced","10g coriander , stems sliced, leaves picked and reserved to serve","1 lemongrass stalk , thinly sliced","½ lime , zest pared","5g galangal , peeled and roughly chopped","1 shallot , roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves , crushed","2 tbsp vegetable oil","½ tbsp paprika","1 tsp shrimp paste (optional)"]','["Blend all the curry paste ingredients together in afood processorwith 2 tbsp water and ¼ tsp salt until smooth.","Heat the vegetable oil in a mediumsaucepanover a medium heat and fry the curry paste for 2-3 mins until fragrant. Spoon in 3 tbsp of the coconut milk and tip in the chicken. Cook, stirring, until the chicken has browned but is not completely cooked. Stir in the rest of the coconut milk, the courgette, aubergine and bamboo shoots. Bring to the boil and simmer for 15 mins. Stir in the sugar, fish sauce, oyster sauce and lemon juice. Serve with fluffy jasmine rice and scatter over the coriander leaves and sliced red chilli."]','2026-01-10 12:18:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7013,7013,'en','Ajwain puri','Enjoy these flatbread as part on an Indian feast. Puri is fried dough that puffs up once submerged in hot oil. Here they’re flavoured with carom seeds','["300g chapatti flour","½ tsp ajwain, or cumin seeds","sunflower oil, for deep-frying"]','["Put the flour, ½ tsp salt and the ajwain in a bowl and mix well. Slowly add 160ml water, mixing until you have a soft dough. (You might need all the water, or even a little more.) Knead the dough for a couple of minutes, then cover and rest for 15 mins.","Divide the dough into 20 pieces, roll each one into a ball, then flatten into roughly 10cm circles.","Heat a 5cm depth of oil in a deep-fryer or wide, deep pan to 180C, or until a pinch of the puri mixture sizzles immediately when dropped in. Fry the puris one at a time for 1 min on each side until golden brown. Serve piping hot with our alu tamatar masala (see below)."]','2026-01-10 12:18:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7015,7015,'en','Peanut, chilli & garlic oil','Spoon this fiery peanut, chilli and garlic oil over instant noodles, ramen, crispy fried eggs on toast and steak salad. The peanuts add a lovely crunch','["2 large garlic cloves","200ml sesame oil","2 tbsp rice wine vinegar","1-2 tsp chilli flakes","2 tbsp soy sauce","40g finely chopped peanuts"]','["Thinly slice the garlic cloves. Heat the sesame oil in a pan and sizzle the garlic until lightly golden. Leave to cool. Stir in the rice wine vinegar, chilli flakes, soy sauce and peanuts. Tip into a 200ml jar, season and shake well."]','2026-01-10 12:18:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7017,7017,'en','Thai green curry','Forget buying a jar of ready-made sauce and make an aromatic Thai green curry from scratch. This recipe makes more curry paste than needed, but you can freeze the rest for next time','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","2-3 tbsp green curry paste (see below)","200g chicken thighs, skinned, de-boned and cut into chunks","400g can coconut milk","2 Thai aubergines","50g pea aubergines","2 baby corn, sliced at an angle","50g sugar snap peas","2-4 tbsp fish sauce","2-4 tsp sugar or palm sugar","2 lime leaves, stems removed","¼ bunch of Thai basil","1 red chilli, sliced","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","8 green chillies, finely sliced","5g fresh turmeric root","1 lemongrass stalk, bruised and finely chopped","25g galangal, finely chopped","2 stalks coriander root, finely chopped","2 lime leaves, roughly chopped","4 Thai shallots, peeled and thinly sliced","10g ginger, finely chopped (optional)","½ tsp shrimp paste"]','["To make the curry paste, gradually combine all the ingredients, except the shrimp paste, using apestle and mortar. Add the ingredients one at a time and pound vigorously after each to form a rough paste. Add the shrimp paste and continue to pound together until you have a smooth paste. The paste is ready when you can no longer identify any of the ingredients.Will keep in an airtight container in the fridge for 3-5 days or in the freezer for up to three months.","To make the curry, heat the oil in asaucepanover a low heat. Add the green curry paste and stir until fragrant – you won''t need all the paste. Increase the heat to medium and add in the chicken pieces, coating with the paste. When the chicken has browned, spoon in half the coconut milk, avoiding adding any of the water at the bottom of the tin – this will split the curry. Stir continuously for 10 mins or until the chicken is fully cooked and the sauce is simmering.","Pour in the remaining coconut milk, discarding the water, and turn the heat up to bring to the boil, then return the heat to medium. Add the Thai and pea aubergines with the baby corn and sugar snap peas and simmer, stirring occasionally, for about 10 mins or until the flavours combine, the sauce thickens slightly and vegetables are tender.","Gradually add the fish sauce and palm sugar, stirring and tasting after each addition until you are happy. Add the lime leaves and most of the Thai basil, then cook for a further 5 mins to let their flavours infuse. To serve, pour the curry into individual serving dishes and scatter over the sliced chilli and the remaining Thai basil leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:18:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7019,7019,'en','Chicken inasal','Set yourself a cook’s challenge with our Filipino-inspired chicken inasal. It’s packed full of zingy flavours, from lime and lemongrass to ginger and garlic','["poussin, spatchcocked","achuete oil (see tip below)","banana leaf, to serve","spring onion, sliced, to serve","garlic bulb, roughly chopped","ginger, peeled and roughly chopped","red onion, roughly chopped","lemongrass stalks, roughly chopped","black peppercorns","lime, juiced","lemon, juiced (or 100ml calamansi juice to replace both the lemon and lime juice)","soft brown sugar","cane vinegar","bay leaves","garlic cloves, crushed","salted butter, softened","lemon, juiced","soft dark brown sugar","achuete oil (see tip, below)","bird''s-eye chilli, finely chopped","ginger, finely chopped","garlic clove, finely chopped","1 tbsp finely chopped shallot or red onion","cane vinegar","peppercorns","soy vinegar, to serve","achuete oil, to serve","atchara, to serve (see ''goes well with'' below)"]','["Score the legs of the poussins and remove the wishbones. Make the marinade by combining all the ingredients in a bowl, add the poussin, cover and chill. Leave to marinate for at least 4 hrs.","To make the basting butter, mix the garlic with the softened butter. Add the lemon juice, soft dark brown sugar and achuete oil for colour. Mix well.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and heat a griddle pan over a medium high heat. Remove the chicken from the marinade and pat dry. Season and coat with the achuete oil. Put upside-down on the griddle for 5 mins until the skin is crisp and golden, then flip over and transfer to the oven for 20-30 mins until cooked, checking and basting occasionally with butter. Leave to rest for 5-10 mins before serving.","While the poussins are grilling, make the sinamak by mixing all the ingredients together in a bowl. Set aside.","Cut the banana leaf into two 25 x 12cm rectangles using scissors. Run them under water, then toast in a dry pan, lightly blow torch or grill until toasted (this releases the natural oils and makes the leaf shiny). To serve, put the toasted banana leaf on a plate, top with a poussin, a spoonful of the atchara, a sprinkling of spring onions and serve the sauces and sinamak alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:18:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7021,7021,'en','Vegan chicken ramen','Use up leftover veg to make this easy vegan ramen. You could also add frozen sweetcorn, edamame or greens for a tasty midweek meal','["2 nests ramen noodles","1 vegetable stock pot or cube","1 tbsp sesame oil","160g pack What the Cluck Chicken Style Chunks","2 tbsp shredded ginger or frozen grated ginger","2 tbsp frozen sweetcorn, edamame or peas","handful spring greens or a couple of cabbage leaves, shredded","½-1 carrot, shredded","chilli oil or soy sauce, to serve (optional)"]','["Cook the noodles following pack instructions, drain well and set aside. Mix the vegetable stock pot in a pan with 300ml water and bring to a simmer. Keep warm on a low heat.","Heat ½ tbsp sesame oil in a frying pan, then fry the What the Cluck Chicken Style Chunks until browned. Set aside on a plate.","Heat the remaining oil in the pan and fry the ginger and sweetcorn until they begin to colour. Put the greens in the stock to warm through, adding the shredded carrot if you prefer it more tender. Bring the stock back to a simmer.","Divide the noodles between two bowls, arrange the vegetables and What the Cluck Chicken Style Chunks on top, then pour over the stock. Drizzle over the chilli oil or soy sauce, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:18:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7023,7023,'en','Aloo tikki','Enjoy these Indian potato patties, filled with peas spiced with fruity mango powder, with tamarind sauce and fresh coriander relish','["500g potatoes, Maris Piper or King Edwards, cut into even-sized chunks","3 tbsp fresh breadcrumbs","1 tbsp plain flour","3 tbsp sunflower oil, plus extra for frying","1 small red onion, finely chopped","20g fresh ginger, peeled and finely grated","1 green chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","½ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","½ tsp garam masala","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp mango powder (amchoor) or juice of ½ lemon","75g frozen peas","2 tbsp chopped coriander"]','["Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil and cook the potatoes until tender when pierced with a knife. Drain the potatoes, then mash and leave to cool before stirring in the breadcrumbs and flour.","Now, make the filling. Heat the oil in afrying panand cook the onion until softened. Stir in the ginger, green chilli, spices and mango powder, then add the frozen peas.","Cook over a medium heat, stirring all the time, until the peas have defrosted and are tender. Remove from the heat, then roughly crush the peas with a fork and stir in the chopped coriander. Leave to cool.","Divide the potato mixture into nine portions with wet hands. Flatten a portion into a 5cm diameter disc with a thickness of 1cm in your palm. Put a teaspoon of the spiced pea filling in the centre of the disc, then gently bring the mashed potato around the filling so it''s completely encased. Flatten the ‘tikki’ so that it resembles a patty. Repeat with the remaining potato and filling, then arrange on a baking tray and chill for 20-30 mins to firm up.","Heat 6-8 tablespoons of oil in a large frying pan or on agriddleand cook the tikkis in batches over a medium heat until golden and crisp. Serve straight away with tamarind and date sauce and coriander relish (see ''goes well with'' below)."]','2026-01-10 12:18:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7025,7025,'en','Cantonese char siu','Enjoy this delicious honey-glazed pork with jasmine rice, pak choi and spring onions for an easy supper. Choose fattier pork steaks for more flavour','["3 pork shoulder steaks (choose fattier steaks, if possible)","cooked jasmine rice and steamed pak choi, to serve","1 spring onion, finely sliced, to serve","2 tbsp hoisin sauce (you can also use oyster sauce, but you’ll need more honey as it’s less sweet)","1⁄2 cube red bean curd from a can, plus 3 tsp sauce from the can","1⁄2 tsp light soy sauce","1⁄2 tsp dark soy sauce","1 tsp Shaohsing rice wine (Chinese cooking wine)","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","6 tbsp honey"]','["First, make the marinade.Whiskthe hoisin sauce, red bean curd (along with the sauce from the can), the soy sauces, rice wine, garlic and 3 tbsp honey together. Tip half into a large bowl with the pork, reserving the rest of the marinade for basting later. Season the pork, toss to coat and chill for 5 hrs to marinate.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Transfer the pork to aroasting tinand roast for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, mix the remaining marinade with the rest of the honey. Brush over the pork every 10 mins, so it’s evenly coloured. Serve with the rice and pak choi, and the spring onions scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7027,7027,'en','Atchara','Serve atchara – pickled papaya – with our Filipino-inspired chicken inasal for a fabulous weekend feast. Use mooli as a substitute if you can’t get hold of green papaya. This salad will keep in the fridge for five days','["50g green papaya or mooli, peeled and cut into very thin strips","40g carrots, peeled and cut into very thin strips","20g banana shallots, cut into very thin strips","1 red chilli, cut into thin strips","2.5cm piece ginger, peeled and cut into thin strips","1 garlic clove, peeled and left whole","300ml cider vinegar","210g caster sugar"]','["Mix the papaya, carrots, shallots, chilli, ginger and garlic with a good sprinkle of sea salt and allow to drain in a sieve for 10 mins. Rinse the vegetable mix and drain well.","Meanwhile, bring the cider vinegar, caster sugar and 90ml water to the boil, then turn off the heat. Put the vegetables into two 330ml sterilised jars, or an airtight container, and pour over the pickling liquid. Serve with the chicken inasal (see ''goes well with'', below).Will keep in the fridge for five days."]','2026-01-10 12:18:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7029,7029,'en','Rainbow rice paper rolls','Escape from a lunchtime sandwich rut with these rice paper rolls. Red cabbage and radishes add a lovely pop of colour, or try iceberg or Little Gem lettuce','["50g fine vermicelli rice noodles","12 rice paper wraps","handful of mint or coriander leaves, or snipped chives (or a mixture)","200g cooked prawns, or cooked and shredded chicken","¼ cucumber, trimmed and finely sliced into matchsticks","1 carrot, trimmed and finely sliced into matchsticks","40g red cabbage, very finely sliced","small handful of radishes, trimmed and thinly sliced","½ mango, stoned, halved and finely sliced","2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","1 tbsp tahini","1 tbsp low-salt soy sauce","1 tsp sesame oil, plus extra for drizzling","½ lime, juiced"]','["Soak the noodles in boiling water from the kettle, following pack instructions. Drain and rinse under cold running water to cool, then toss in a little sesame oil to stop them sticking together.","Next, make the dipping sauce by mixing all the ingredients together. Set aside.","Fill a wide, shallow dish a few centimetres deep with warm water. Working with one rice paper wrap at a time, soak it for a few seconds until it’s flexible, then lay it on a chopping board. Scatter some of the herbs down the centre, then top with a couple of prawns or a little bit of chicken, then some veg pieces and mango, and a small bundle of noodles. Try to keep the fillings in the centre, and don’t overfill. Tuck the ends of the wrap over the ingredients to slightly enclose them, then roll up from the sides, keeping everything as tight as you can. Put the finished rolls on a plate covered with a damp sheet of kitchen paper until you’re finished assembling all the rolls. Will keep in the fridge for up to 24 hrs. Serve with the sesame dipping sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:18:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7031,7031,'en','One-pan coriander-crusted duck, roasted plums & greens','Enjoy this coriander-crusted duck with sweet roasted plums and pak choi as part of a summer menu. It’s quick and easy, and you won’t need to find any special ingredients in the shops','["2 tbsp coriander seeds, lightly crushed","2 small duck breasts","2 plums, stoned, halved and cut into wedges","2 pak choi, halved lengthways","100ml chicken stock","2 tbsp honey","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","¼ tsp chilli flakes, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and put the coriander seeds on a plate. Score the skin of the duck breasts as many times as you can with a small sharp knife, then season with salt and press the skin into the coriander seeds. Heat an ovenproof frying pan and add the breasts, skin-side down. Put a heavy pan on top to weigh them down, and cook for 7-8 mins to render the fat, occasionally draining off the excess.","Add the plums and pak choi to the pan, flip the breasts over and add half the stock. Transfer to the oven and cook for 4-5 mins. Remove the duck breasts from the pan and transfer to a plate to rest along with the pak choi.","Return the pan with the plums to the heat and add the honey, soy, vinegar and remaining stock. Bring to the boil and continue to cook until syrupy. Carve each duck breast into four chunks. Arrange two halves of pak choi over each plate, and nestle the chunks of duck breast and the plums among the greens. Drizzle with the sauce, then sprinkle over the chilli flakes."]','2026-01-10 12:18:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7033,7033,'en','Sweet chilli sauce','Make your own sweet chilli sauce to cook with. This Thai condiment often contains fish sauce but we’ve kept our version veggie','["20 red chillies, stems removed, deseeded for a milder sauce","1 finger sized piece of ginger, peeled and roughly chopped","5 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","100ml white wine or cider vinegar","200g white caster sugar"]','["Tip all the ingredients except the sugar into a mini chopper or blender and blend to a chunky sauce. Scrape the contents into a shallow saucepan with the sugar and 100ml water and bring to a simmer.","Simmer for 15 mins, stirring occasionally until it becomes syrupy. Keeping a close eye on it, continue to simmer and stir for 5 mins more until it easily coats the back of the spoon and you see the bottom of the pan when you stir. Leave to cool and infuse for 1-2 hours. Will keep in a small sterilised jar for up to a month."]','2026-01-10 12:18:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7035,7035,'en','Cheat’s sausage larb','Try our take on larb, a Thai dish traditionally made using minced meat. Here, we’ve used sausages to make things a bit simpler, but it’s still full of Asian-inspired flavours','["3 tbsp sesame oil","2 limes, juiced","1 tbsp chilli sauce","½ tbsp fish sauce","3 pork sausages","1 tbsp red Thai curry paste","4 spring onions, sliced and shredded","½ bunch of coriander, chopped","small bunch of mint, leaves picked and torn","2 Little Gem lettuces, leaves separated","1 small cucumber, cut into matchsticks"]','["Mix together 2 tbsp of the sesame oil, the lime juice, chilli sauce and fish sauce. Set aside.","Heat the remaining oil in a wok or non-stick frying pan over a medium heat. Squeeze the sausagemeat out of the skins and into the pan, breaking it up with a wooden spoon, and fry for 5-6 mins, or until golden brown. Stir through the curry paste and fry for 1 min. Mix through half the spring onions and half the herbs.","Arrange the lettuce and cucumber in two bowls, add the sausage mixture and drizzle over the spicy dressing. Finish with the remaining herbs."]','2026-01-10 12:18:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7037,7037,'en','Creamy curried chicken & rice soup','Use leftover chicken to make this Asian-inspired soup with rice. Simple to make, it''s a filling bowl for colder evenings','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","3 tbsp Thai red curry paste","2 x 400g cans coconut milk","400ml chicken stock","100g risotto rice","4 large eggs","about 200-300g leftover roast chicken, shredded","340g can sweetcorn, drained","2-3 limes, juiced","2 spring onions, sliced"]','["Heat the oil in a saucepan over a medium heat. Add the onion and fry for 10 mins or until softened and turning translucent. Add the curry paste and cook for 1 min. Stir in the coconut milk, chicken stock and risotto rice and bring to a simmer. Cook for 15-20 mins or until the rice is tender.","Bring a pan of water to a simmer, add the eggs and cook for 7 mins. Stir the chicken and sweetcorn into the soup and cook for 5 mins to warm everything through. Season to taste and finish with the lime juice. Gently peel the shells off the eggs and cut them in half. Top the soup with the eggs and spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:18:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7039,7039,'en','Prawn fried rice','Make this easy Asian-inspired dish in just 30 minutes. It''s healthy and low in calories but big on flavour, making it perfect for a speedy family supper','["250g long-grain brown rice","150g frozen peas","100g mangetout","1½ tbsp rapeseed oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","thumb-sized piece of ginger, finely grated","150g raw king prawns","3 medium eggs, beaten","2 tsp sesame seeds","1 tbsp low-salt soy sauce","½ tbsp rice or white wine vinegar","4 spring onions, trimmed and sliced"]','["Cook the rice following pack instructions. Boil a separate pan of water and blanch the peas and mangetout for 1 min, then drain and set aside with the rice.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large non-stick frying pan or wok over a medium heat and fry the onion for 10 mins or until golden brown. Add the garlic and ginger and fry for a further minute. Tip in the blanched vegetables and fry for 5 mins, then the prawns and fry for a further 2 mins. Stir the rice into the pan then push everything to one side. Pour the beaten eggs into the empty side of the pan and stir to scramble them. Fold everything together with the sesame seeds, soy and vinegar, then finish with the spring onions scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:18:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7041,7041,'en','Rainbow prawn cocktails','Serve this Asian-inspired twist on classic prawn cocktail as a starter or party canapés over the festive period','["7 heaped tbsp mayonnaise","1 lime, juiced","3 tsp sriracha or other chilli sauce","15g pickled pickled ginger, finely chopped","3 Little Gem lettuces, leaves separated","300g cooked king prawns","3 spring onions, shredded","2 tsp black sesame seeds","handful of prawn crackers, crushed","100ml rice wine vinegar","1 tbsp caster sugar","1 large carrot, peeled and julienned","½ large cucumber, peeled into ribbons","6 radishes, thinly sliced"]','["For the pickles, put the vinegar, 50ml water, the sugar and 2 tsp sea salt in a pan and simmer for 5 mins over a medium heat, stirring until the sugar and salt have dissolved. Leave to cool a little. Put the vegetables in a bowl and pour over the pickling liquid. Leave in the fridge for at least 1 hr.","Mix together the mayonnaise, lime juice, sriracha and pickled ginger. Arrange the lettuce leaves in six bowls, then top with the pickled veg, prawns and sauce. Finish with spring onions, sesame seeds and prawn crackers."]','2026-01-10 12:18:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7043,7043,'en','Taiwanese bah-tzang dumplings','Try these traditional Taiwanese dumplings – bah-tzang. Wrapped in aromatic bamboo leaves, they come with a delicious pork, shrimp and mushroom filling','["500g sushi rice","150g whole redskin peanuts","20 fresh bamboo leaves, about 50g (see tip, below)","100g dried shiitake mushrooms","20g dried shrimp","150g lean pork shoulder, cut into 1cm dice","150g fatty pork belly, cut into 1cm dice","vegetable oil, if needed","3 shallots, sliced","4 tbsp light soy sauce","40g golden caster sugar","3 tbsp crispy fried shallots","50g salted duck egg yolk (optional)","pickled chilli or radish and sweet and salty soy-based dipping sauce, to serve"]','["The day before you want to serve, fill a large saucepan with water and bring to the boil. Add the peanuts and simmer for 25 mins. Remove the peanuts, drain and soak overnight in fresh tepid water. Rinse the rice in a sieve under cold running water and leave to soak overnight.","To make the filling, put the dried shiitake mushrooms and dried shrimp in two separate bowls and cover with boiling water. Leave for 15 mins or until completely softened. Remove the mushrooms from the liquid with a slotted spoon and squeeze any excess water back into the bowl. Roughly chop the mushrooms to a similar size as the shrimp. Drain the shrimp and set aside.","Cook the bamboo leaves to make them flexible. Bring a large pan of water to the boil, add the leaves and cook on a high heat for 5 mins. Turn off the heat and keep the leaves in the water for 20 mins. The water should turn a little brown. Rinse and drain the leaves. Drain the rice and peanuts and mix together in a big bowl.","Meanwhile, for the filling, put the diced pork in a pan of boiling water. Simmer for up to 1 hr or until the meat is tender and falls apart easily. Drain and set aside. Heat a large wok on a medium-high heat and add the pork. As some of it is quite fatty, you shouldn’t need to add any more oil, but if it begins to stick, add a little vegetable oil.","Once the pork is browned, add the sliced shallots, shrimp and mushroom. Add the soy sauce and sugar. Cook for a further 1-2 mins until the meat is slightly caramelised. Take the pork off the heat and add the crispy shallots. Using a microplane or box grater, grate the salted egg yolk, if using, into the mixture and mix. Season.","To wrap the bah-tzang, cut around 10 lengths of butcher’s string to around 50cm.","Lay one cooked bamboo leaf on top of another to give a double thickness. Fold the leaves in half and use your hands to form a pointed cone shape. Hold the cone in your hand, point-side down, like a sushi hand-roll or an ice cream cone.","Pack the rice and peanut mix around the outside and the bottom of the leaf-cone to make a layer of rice over the entire surface. Continue until it’s about two-thirds full. Spoon the pork, shrimp and mushroom mixture into the centre of the rice and pack it down tightly. Add another spoonful of rice on top so the filling is completely covered.","To close the bah-tzang, fold the top edge of the bamboo leaves over the rice and tuck it in to seal the gap. Pull the leaves tightly so they enclose the rice and pork, tucking in any loose edges. Use one length of string to secure the parcel, winding it up in the string and leaving a length at the top. Make sure you tie the knots as tightly as possible so none of the filling escapes. Fill the remaining bamboo leaves, and tie them all together.","Bring a large pan of water to the boil, lower in the bah-tzang and cook for 45 mins to 1 hr, then remove them from the water, drain and serve immediately. Untie the string and peel away the leaves (don’t eat them) to reveal the sticky rice and tender pork. Serve with pickled chilli or radish and a sweet and salty soy-based dipping sauce. We’ve cut our bah-tzang open so that you can see the cross-section inside, but you would normally serve them unwrapped."]','2026-01-10 12:18:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7045,7045,'en','Steamed sea bass','Try this steamed sea bass with fragrant Asian ingredients as the centrepiece for a Chinese menu. Steaming ensures the fish stays moist and flakes apart','["30g ginger, peeled and cut into matchsticks (use a julienne peeler if you have one)","1 whole large sea bass (about 800g), gutted and cleaned (ask your fishmonger to do this), or 4 fillets of sea bass","1 tbsp light soy sauce","1 tbsp dark soy sauce","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tsp palm sugar","1 spring onion, sliced diagonally","½  small pack coriander, trimmed but still with most of the stalks on","½  red chilli, finely sliced diagonally"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put half the ginger in the cavity of the fish, then lay it on foil. Pull the sides of the foil up around the fish to create a foil bowl, then add 1 tbsp water (this will steam the fish), seal and cook in the oven for 15-20 mins or a large bamboo steamer until the fish is flaking apart.","Transfer to a serving platter, leaving the juices in the foil. Heat the soy sauces, oil and palm sugar in a saucepan with 1 tbsp water until boiling and bubbling. Top the fish with the spring onion, chilli, most of the coriander and the rest of the ginger. Pour the hot liquid over the fish to ‘cook’ the aromatics on top. Scatter over any leftover coriander stalks to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7047,7048,'en','Hoisin mackerel pancakes','Need a speedy, DIY family meal? Try these mackerel pancakes. Using sweet ingredients with stronger-flavoured fish such as mackerel helps tempt children to try them','["3 mackerel fillets, all bones removed, cut into finger-length strips","2 tbsp hoisin sauce, plus extra for dipping","4 spring onions","½  cucumber","2 Little Gem lettuces","1 tsp vegetable oil","10 Chinese pancakes (available from Waitress, Asian supermarkets or Chinese takeaways)"]','["Marinate the mackerel in the hoisin sauce while you prepare the veg. Cut the spring onions and cucumber into thin matchsticks, and separate the lettuce leaves.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat. Add the mackerel and fry for 3-4 mins until sticky and caramelised. Heat the pancakes following pack instructions. Serve everything in the middle of the table and let everyone help themselves."]','2026-01-10 12:18:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7049,7049,'en','Stir-fried garlic green beans','These easy, healthy garlic green beans make a great accompaniment to a Chinese feast, and they’re made with just 4 ingredients in 15 minutes','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","200g pack trimmed green beans","3 garlic cloves, finely sliced","1 tsp oyster sauce or soy sauce"]','["Heat the oil in a wok, then stir-fry the green beans for 5 mins until they start to brown. Add the garlic and continue to cook until just tinged brown, then splash in the oyster sauce and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7051,7051,'en','Hot & sour prawn & sweetcorn soup','The perfect warming starter for your Chinese New Year celebrations. We’ve added chilli for heat and used egg instead of traditional cornflour.','["1½ l hot chicken stock","1 tsp white caster sugar","2 tbsp Chinese black rice vinegar, cider or white wine vinegar","1 thumb-sized piece ginger, finely sliced into matchsticks","½  red chilli, sliced","½  pack silken tofu, diced","handful frozen sweetcorn","150g cooked prawns","2 eggs, beaten with 1 tsp sesame oil","150g beansprouts, rinsed","shredded spring onions, to serve"]','["Put the stock in a saucepan over a low heat, add the sugar, vinegar, ginger and chilli, and bring to a gentle simmer. Add the tofu, sweetcorn and prawns, simmer gently for 2 mins, then pour in the egg mixture in a steady stream, stirring to make egg strands.","Pile some beansprouts in each bowl and ladle the soup over. Scatter over the spring onions and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:18:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7053,7053,'en','Char sui puffs','We’ve combined sausage rolls with the flavours of Chinese char sui pork – doubly delicious!','["225g plain flour","125g slightly salted butter, wrapped in foil and chilled","400g pack pork sausages","2 tsp five-spice powder","2 tbsp oyster sauce","2 tbsp hoisin sauce","thumb-sized piece ginger, finely grated","a little flour, for dusting","1 egg, beaten","1 tbsp black and white sesame seeds"]','["You can make the pastry up to 2 days before. Weigh the flour into a bowl and add 1/2 tsp salt. Holding the butter by the foil (to prevent it from becoming too warm), grate it directly into the flour on the coarse side of the grater. Dip the block of butter into the flour every now and then, and mix the grated butter into the flour with a cutlery knife to prevent it clumping together in the bowl. When the butter is evenly distributed throughout the flour, pour in 100g cold water. Mix with the cutlery knife until it clumps together. Tip onto your work surface and knead briefly to bring the pastry together – don’t overwork or you’ll lose the pockets of butter, which will create the layers. Wrap in cling film and chill for at least 30 mins.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line two baking trays with parchment. Squeeze the sausagemeat from the skins into a bowl. Add the five-spice, oyster sauce, hoisin and ginger. Mix until fully combined.","Lightly flour your work surface. Roll out the pastry to the thickness of a 50p coin, then use a 10cm biscuit cutter to stamp out as many circles as you can. Fold the scraps back on themselves, but don’t scrunch up the pastry, or you’ll lose the layers. Re-roll and stamp out a few more if you can – you should make 18-20.","Scoop the sausage mixture into balls (the size of cherry tomatoes) with a spoon and put in the middle of each pastry circle. Brush a little beaten egg over the pastry, then fold three sides in to partially cover the sausage and create a triangle shape, pinching the corners together. Brush more egg over the top of the pastry and sprinkle with sesame seeds. Arrange on the trays and bake for 25 mins until golden brown. Cool on the trays, ready to pack up for a picnic – or serve warm. Will keep in the fridge for up to 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:18:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7055,7055,'en','English muffins','Serve these traditional English muffins warm, halved and spread with butter, or toasted in a poached egg and hollandaise brunch','["400g strong white flour , plus extra for dusting","1 tsp caster sugar","5g fast-action yeast","250ml whole milk , warmed","fine semolina , for dusting"]','["To make the dough combine the flour, sugar, yeast and 1 tsp salt in a large bowl. Gradually add the milk, mixing with your hands until the dough comes together. Knead for 8-10 mins until smooth and elastic. This can also be done in a tabletop mixer with a dough hook.","Turn the dough onto a lightly floured surface and roll to 1cm thick. Cut out 8 circles using a 7.5cm cutter, re-rolling the dough if needed. Arrange on semolina-dusted baking trays. Dust the tops with more semolina, cover loosely, and leave to rise in a warm spot for about 1 hr or so until doubled in size, or for a better flavour leave to prove overnight in the fridge.","To cook the muffins place a heavy-based frying pan or griddle over medium heat for 6-7 mins on each side until golden brown. Do this in batches. If the muffins brown too quickly, lower the heat and leave until cooked through. Set aside to cool slightly on a wire rack. Best served warm. Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days. Leave to cool first."]','2026-01-10 12:19:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7057,7057,'en','Air-fryer fish & chips','Use your air-fryer to make this British classic. Choose white fish such as cod, haddock or basa, and serve with mushy peas and tartar sauce','["60g cornflour","1 tsp smoked paprika","½ tsp dried mixed herbs","2 white fish fillets, such as cod, haddock or basa","3 medium potatoes, such as Desirée or Maris Piper","6-8 tbsp vegetable oil","mushy peas and tartar sauce, to serve (optional)"]','["Mix together the cornflour, paprika and mixed herbs with 1 tsp salt and ¼ tsp freshly ground black pepper and spread out on a large dinner plate. Coat the fish fillets in the flour mixture on both sides. If you prefer to cook on the hob, see tip below – the fish fillets are now ready to fry.","Cut the potatoes into 1cm-thick chips using a large,sharp knife. Leave the skin on, or peel them, if you like.","Put the chips in a large mixing bowl, then add 2 tbsp of the vegetable oil and a good pinch of salt and pepper. Toss until well coated. Set theair-fryerto 200C and cook the chips for around 18-22 mins, turning halfway (or shake the air-fryer basket) until crisp and cooked. Alternatively, you can cook them in the oven (see tip, below). Keep warm while you cook the fish or cook it in the second air-fryer basket, if you have one.","Spread 4 tbsp of the vegetable oil out on a large dinner plate and dredge the coated fish in the oil to cover. Set the air-fryer to 200C and cook for 8-10 mins (depending on the size of your fish fillets), carefully turning halfway. Serve with mushy peas and tartar sauce, if you like.If freezing the fish and chips, defrost fully in the fridge, then reheat in the oven until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:19:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7059,7059,'en','Queen of puddings','Whip up an indulgent British classic pudding, made by soaking breadcrumbs in hot milk and adding meringue and jam. It’s the perfect comforting dessert','["550ml milk","25g butter, plus extra for the dish","1 lemon, zested","100g fresh white breadcrumbs","240g caster sugar","4 eggs, yolks and whites separated","6-8 tbsp raspberry jam"]','["Warm the milk in a smallsaucepanover a low heat until simmering, then remove from the heat and stir in the butter, lemon zest, breadcrumbs and 40g of the caster sugar. Leave to soak for 30 mins until the crumbs have absorbed the liquid and cooled.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a medium-large baking or pie dish (ours was 22cm). Once the breadcrumb mixture has cooled, stir in the egg yolks and pour into the baking dish. Bake for 30 mins until the mixture has set, similar to a custard. Warm the jam in a small saucepan over a low heat to loosen, then spread this over the base. It should be a thin layer, so you may need less jam if your dish is deeper. Reduce the oven temperature to 160C/140C fan/gas 2.","Whisk the egg whites to stiff peaks in a clean bowl using an electric whisk, orstand mixer. Whisk in the remaining 200g caster sugar, a little at a time, until the sugar has dissolved and the meringue is glossy and stands upright. Spoon orpipethe meringue over the jam layer and bake for another 20-30 mins until the meringue is golden and set. Best served warm."]','2026-01-10 12:19:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7061,7061,'en','Rhubarb & custard scones','These delicious scones feature one of Britain’s best-loved flavour combinations: rhubarb and custard. Serve with clotted cream for an enjoyable afternoon tea in the garden','["300g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","50g custard powder","1 tsp baking powder","50g caster sugar","95g cold unsalted butter, cut into cubes","150-175ml whole milk","1 egg, beaten","clotted cream, to serve","250g rhubarb, roughly chopped (or use chopped frozen rhubarb)","100g caster or granulated sugar","1 lemon, zested","½ tsp vanilla bean paste","drop of red food colouring gel (optional)"]','["Mix the flour, custard powder, ¼ tsp fine salt, the baking powder and sugar together in a largebowl. Rub the butter into the dry ingredients using your fingertips until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs.","Gradually mix in the milk using your hands until you have a smooth dough – you may not need it all. Gentlyroll the dough outon a lightly floured surface to a 2cm thickness. Transfer to a baking tray lined with baking parchment, cover and chill for 30 mins to firm up, or up to 1 hr if you want to get ahead.","Meanwhile, make the rhubarb compote. Tip all the ingredients into a largesaucepanalong with 2 tbsp water (omit the water if you’re using frozen rhubarb). Simmer over a medium heat for 10-15 mins, stirring occasionally until the rhubarb has softened and is almost collapsing, and the mixture has thickened. If you’re using frozen rhubarb, you may like to stir in a drop of red food colouring to enhance the pink colour. Transfer the compote to a bowl and leave to cool completely.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and remove the dough from the fridge. Line a baking tray with baking parchment. Stamp out three or four scones from the dough using a 7cm round biscuit cutter (see tip below). Arrange the scones on the prepared tray, leaving a 2cm gap between each.","Roll the remaining dough out again as in step two, then stamp out as many scones as you can (you should get about six in total). Transfer these to the tray as well, then brush all the scones with the beaten egg (see tip below). Bake for 10-12 mins until the tops are golden brown, then leave to cool completely on the tray. Serve with the rhubarb compote and clotted cream.Best eaten the day they’re made."]','2026-01-10 12:19:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7063,7063,'en','Coronation quiche','A deep quiche with a crisp pastry case, and delicate flavours of spinach, broad beans and fresh tarragon. The pastry includes lard, but you can swap this for butter to make it vegetarian. Eat hot or cold with a green salad and boiled new potatoes – perfect for a Coronation Big Lunch!','["250g plain flour, plus a little for dusting","50g cold butter, diced","50g lard (or use butter if you prefer)","4 tbsp milk, plus a splash","Or 250g block of ready-made shortcrust pastry","125ml milk","175ml double cream","2 medium eggs","1 tbsp chopped fresh tarragon","100g cheddar, grated","180g cooked spinach, liquid squeezed out and lightly chopped","60g cooked broad beans or soya beans (double pod the broad beans, if you like)"]','["Sieve the flour into a bowl with ½ tsp salt. Add the butter and lard, and rub the mixture together using your fingertips until you get a sandy, breadcrumb-like texture. Add the milk, a little at a time, and using a cutlery knife, start to bring the dough together, using your hands, making sure it has no dry patches and feels smooth. Cover and allow to rest in the fridge for 30-45 mins.","Put a 20cm loose-bottomed tart tin or a 20cm pastry ring on a baking sheet. Lightly flour the work surface and roll out the pastry to a circle a little larger than the top of the tin and approximately 5mm thick. Carefully lift the pastry into the tin and gently press into the corners, taking care not to have any holes or the mixture could leak. Cover and rest for a further 30 mins in the fridge. Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.","Line the pastry case with greaseproof paper – to do this cut a disc of greaseproof paper larger than the tin, scrunch it into a ball (this makes it more pliable), then unwrap and place it in the pastry case. It should come above the sides. Fill with baking beans or uncooked rice and bake blind for 20-25 until nicely golden and dry. Carefully remove the greaseproof paper and baking beans, and return to the oven for 5 mins to dry the base. Reduce the oven temperature to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.","Beat the milk, cream, eggs and herbs with some seasoning. Scatter half of the grated cheese in the blind-baked base, top with the chopped spinach and beans, then pour over the liquid mixture. If required, gently give the mixture a delicate stir to ensure the filling is evenly dispersed, but be careful not to damage the pastry case. Sprinkle over the remaining cheese. Place into the oven and bake for 20-30 mins until set and very lightly golden."]','2026-01-10 12:19:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7065,7065,'en','Classic fish & chips','Skip the takeaway, and spend a little effort perfecting fish & chips at home – you’ll be rewarded with crisp, deeply golden fish and moreish chips','["about 1 litre sunflower oil, for frying","2 thick skinless fillets of whiting, ling, pollock, haddock or cod (about 150g each)","2 large Maris Piper potatoes","1 tsp malt vinegar, plus extra to serve","75g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","25g cornflour","small pinch of ground turmeric","125g cold lager or fizzy water","4 cornichons","1 tsp capers","1 shallot","handful of parsley leaves, chopped","5 tbsp mayonnaise"]','["Cut the potatoes into chips and soak in cold water for 5 mins, then wash until the water runs clear. Tip into a pan of cold water with a pinch of salt and 1 tsp vinegar. Bring to a simmer, then turn down the heat and simmer gently for 10-12 mins until cooked through but not falling apart. Drain gently, then place on a tray in a single layer and chill until needed.Can be prepared a day ahead.","To make the tartare sauce,chopthe cornichons, capers and shallot (finely chop if you prefer a smooth sauce), then combine with the parsley, mayo and a pinch of salt.Will keep chilled for up to 24 hours.","When you’re ready to fry, prepare the batter. Tip the flours and turmeric into a bowl with a pinch of salt, pour over the beer or fizzy water, and mix quickly until everything just comes together to the consistency of double cream – do not over-beat, a few lumps are fine. Keep chilled.","Pour the oil into a deep, wide pan like awok, or heat a deep-fat fryer to 180C. If using a pan or wok, ensure that it is no more than two-thirds full with oil. Heat the oil until it is shimmering and carefully lower in the chips using a slotted spoon. Fry for 8-10 mins, gently stirring occasionally until golden and crisp. Transfer to kitchen paper to drain.","Put a little flour in a dish, then bring the oil you used to cook the chips up to 185C, if you have a thermometer, or until a drizzle of batter sizzles and crisps in less than a minute. Working quickly, dust the fish in flour, then dredge through the batter. Hold the fillet above the batter to let the excess drip back into the bowl, then carefully lower into the oil. Fry the fillets for a minute until the batter is just starting to set, then take a spoon and drizzle the fillets with extra batter to create an even crunchier, wispy coating. Fry the fish for about 4 mins, turning once, until deep golden and crisp. Lift onto some kitchen paper to drain for a minute, then serve with the chips, tartare sauce, and plenty of salt and vinegar."]','2026-01-10 12:19:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7066,7066,'en','Versatile dip','Use spicy harissa to make a quick and easy dip for veggies and potato skins','["225g thick and creamy plain yogurt, strained","3-4 tbsp harissa (depending on taste)","small handful coriander, finely chopped","small handful fresh mint, finely chopped"]','["Spoon the yogurt into a bowl and beat in as much harissa as you like. Stir in most of the coriander and mint, and season if you like. Tip into a serving bowl, garnish with the rest of the herbs and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7067,7067,'en','Vegan apple cake','Make this apple and almond cake to fill your cake tin. It’s an ideal treat for anyone following a dairy-free or vegan diet, and is delicious for afternoon tea with a cuppa','["150g dairy-free spread, melted, plus extra for the tin","300ml oat milk","1 tbsp lemon juice","350g self-raising flour, plus 1 tbsp to coat the apples","100g caster sugar","100g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp almond extract","300g Granny Smith apples, peeled, cored and chopped into 2cm cubes","2 tbsp flaked almonds"]','["Use the spread to butter a 20cm deep cake tin and line with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Pour the oat milk into a jug, add the lemon juice and leave to sit for 5 mins at room temperature.","Put the flour, both sugars and the baking powder in a large bowl, pour over the thickened oat milk mixture and almond extract, then add the butter and ½ tsp salt. Beat everything together using an electric whisk. Tip the apples into a second large bowl, sprinkle over the extra 1 tbsp flour and toss to coat. Fold the apples through the cake batter using a spatula, then spoon the mixture into the prepared tin and sprinkle over the almonds.","Bake in the centre of the oven for 1 hr-1 hr 20 mins, or until golden and firm to the touch. Leave to cool for a few minutes in the tin. Serve warm, or turn out onto a wire rack and leave to cool completely.Once cool, will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:19:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7069,7069,'en','Welsh rarebit','Indulge in a slice of bubbling, golden-brown, cheesy Welsh rarebit for a satisfying lunch. Serve piping hot from the grill with plenty of chopped chives','["120ml brown ale","25g unsalted butter","25g plain flour","140g mature cheddar, coarsely grated","1 heaped tsp English mustard powder","1 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","1 tbsp chopped chives","2 large slices sourdough bread"]','["In a small saucepan gently warm the ale, set aside. Take another small saucepan and over a medium heat melt the butter until it begins to foam, tip in the flour and stir everything together, cooking for 1 min. Whisk in the warm ale in several additions to create a thick sauce then whisk through the cheese to create a thick paste. Stir the mustard, Worcestershire and chives through the sauce.","Heat a grill to its highest setting. Place the slices of bread on a flat baking sheet and grill on one side until golden brown. Flip the bread over and spread each one with the cheese mixture. Place back under the grill and cook for a further 1-2 mins or until golden brown and bubbling, serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:19:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7071,7071,'en','Easy mushy peas','Enjoy comfort food at its best with homemade mushy peas. Their subtle mint and lemon flavour means they''re perfect with fish and chips','["250g dried marrowfat peas","2 tbsp baking powder","25g salted butter, cubed","¼ small bunch of mint, finely chopped","½ lemon, juiced"]','["Put the marrowfat peas and baking soda in a large heatproof bowl and cover with boiling water. Leave to soak for 12 hours or overnight.","Drain the peas and rinse them twice with cold water to wash off the baking soda. Put the beans in a saucepan and cover with 650ml cold water. Bring to the boil, reduce the heat and simmer for 30 mins until tender, stirring occasionally.","Mash briefly and stir in the butter, mint and lemon, seasoning to taste."]','2026-01-10 12:19:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7073,7073,'en','Scotch eggs','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyUse a few chef’s tricks to create the perfect sausage and egg snack with this step-by-step recipe','["12 large eggs","800g good-quality Cumberland or Lincolnshire sausages, skinned","5 tbsp curly parsley, finely chopped","2 tsp Worcestershire sauce","2 tsp English mustard powder","2 tsp ground mace","12 rashers smoked streaky bacon","85g plain flour","140-200g/5-7oz dried breadcrumbs","about 1 litre/1¾ pints sunflower or vegetable oil, for frying","scraps of bread, for testing oil"]','["Put 9 eggs into a large saucepan. Cover with cold water and bring to the boil. Once boiling, set the timer for 5 mins. When 5 mins is up, quickly lift the eggs out with a slotted spoon and plunge into a big bowl of cold water.","Put the sausagemeat, parsley, Worcestershire sauce, mustard powder and mace into a bowl with plenty of seasoning. Break in 1 of the remaining eggs and mix everything together.","Crack remaining 2 eggs into a bowl, beat with a fork, then sieve onto a plate. Tip the flour onto another plate and season well. Finally, tip the breadcrumbs onto a third plate.","Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil. Drop in the bacon rashers, turn off the pan and fish out the bacon with a pair of tongs – it should be just cooked.","When the eggs are cool, tap lightly on a hard surface to crack the shell, then peel (Picture A). If you hold the eggs over the bowl of water as you peel, all the shell bits will collect in there and you can dip in the egg to wash off any fragments. Wrap a slice of bacon around the middle of each egg, overlapping, like a belt (Picture B).","Now finish coating the eggs. I set up the ingredients along my bench like a conveyer belt: eggs, then flour, mince, beaten egg and finally breadcrumbs, plus a baking parchment-lined tray at the end to put the finished scotch eggs on.","Roll your bacon-wrapped eggs in the flour, shaking off excess. Take a good chunk of mince and pat out to thinly cover one hand. Sit the egg on the meat (Picture C), then mould over the mince to cover, squeezing and patting so it is an even thickness. You’ll probably have a gap (depending on how big your hands are – just patch and pat with a bit more mince). Dip in the egg, shaking off the excess, then roll in the breadcrumbs to coat, and transfer to your tray. Repeat to cover all 9 eggs, then cover with cling film and chill for 4 hrs or overnight.","To cook, pour the oil in a large, deep saucepan to about 4cm deep. Heat until a small chunk of bread browns in about 1 min. Carefully lower in a scotch egg and fry for about 5 mins, turning gently, until evenly browned. Depending on your pan, you can probably do 2-3 at a time, but don’t overcrowd. Lift out onto a kitchen paper-lined tray. (If you like your scotch eggs warm, pop them into a low oven while you fry the rest.) keep an eye on the oil – if the scotch eggs start browning too quickly, the oil might be too hot and you risk the pork not being cooked before the scotch egg is browned. If the oil gets too cool, the scotch egg may overcook before it is browned. enjoy warm or cold; best eaten within 24 hrs of frying."]','2026-01-10 12:19:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7075,7075,'en','The ultimate makeover: Full English breakfast','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyAngela Nilsen makes a healthier version of an iconic English meal – without losing the nostalgia','["4 rashers good-quality lean unsmoked back bacon","4 brown-cap portabello mushroom","12-16 cherry tomatoes on the vine, room temperature","6 tsp olive oil","2 slices granary or wholegrain bread, cut on the diagonal","2 good-quality free-range pork sausage, minimum 86% pork","2 free-range, omega-3 rich egg, room temperature","few drops cider vinegar","2 x 100ml / 3½  fl oz glasses freshly-squeezed orange juice, plus 1 orange cut into wedges","handful fresh blueberries (about 50g/2oz)"]','["Lay the bacon, mushrooms and tomatoes on a foil-lined tray. Brush the tops of the mushrooms with 3 tsp of the oil and both sides of the bread with the remaining oil. Set aside. Heat the grill to very hot. Lay the sausages on a small foil-lined tray (best not to prick good-quality sausages or they may lose moisture). Grill for about 10 mins until cooked, turning occasionally.","Meanwhile, three-quarters fill a small pan, and a wide, deep sauté pan with water. Bring both to the boil. Lower an egg into the small pan and remove after 30 secs. Crack the egg into a cup. Add vinegar to the larger pan then, using a wire whisk, swirl the water around to create a whirlpool. Remove the whisk and slowly tip the egg into the centre of the whirlpool (see top picture). When the water comes back to the boil, remove the pan from the heat, cover and leave for 3 mins, then remove the egg. Place in a bowl of warm water while you cook the other egg – or cook both eggs an hour ahead, leave in a bowl of iced water, then reheat for 1½ mins in simmering water before serving.","Meanwhile heat a griddle pan to very hot. Place the tomatoes, bacon and mushrooms under the grill for 3-4 mins without turning. At the same time, lay the bread on the griddle pan, cook until crisp, about 1 min each side. Drain everything on kitchen paper.","Remove the eggs with a slotted spoon and drain briefly on a cloth. Arrange everything on a plate and serve with the juice and fruit."]','2026-01-10 12:19:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7079,7079,'en','Lighter Lancashire hotpot','This easy lamb one pot takes classic comfort food and makes it healthier, without compromising on flavour','["650g boned lamb shoulder, excess fat trimmed","4 tsp plain flour","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 medium onions, halved lengthways and thinly sliced","3 carrots (350g total weight), halved lengthways and cut into bite-sized chunks","225g swede, cut into bite-sized chunks","3 thyme sprigs, plus extra leaves to garnish","2 bay leaves","200ml chicken stock, made with ½  chicken stock cube","1½  tsp Worcestershire sauce","750g potatoes, such as Maris Piper or Desirée, very thinly sliced"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Cut the lamb into chunky 5-6cm pieces. Tip the flour onto a large plate, season with pepper and a little salt, and toss the lamb in the flour to coat evenly and completely. Set aside.","Heat 2 tsp of the oil in a large, deep frying or sauté pan. Put the onions, carrots, swede, thyme sprigs and bay leaves in the pan and season with pepper. Cook on a medium-high heat for 6-8 mins, stirring occasionally so it doesn’t stick, until the vegetables start to go brown around the edges – the bottom of the pan should be slightly brown and caramelised too. Pour in the stock; it should sizzle then bubble in the pan. Immediately remove the pan from the heat so the stock does not reduce in volume. Stir in the Worcestershire sauce.","Overlap a single layer of the potato slices in the bottom of a 2-litre casserole dish (about 20cm diameter x 10cm deep). Lay half the lamb over the potatoes, then spoon half the vegetable mix over the meat. Season with pepper. Sit the rest of the lamb on top, then tip the rest of the vegetables, herbs and all the liquid over the lamb. Press down with the back of a spoon, if necessary, to make room for the  remaining potatoes. Start to layer up the potato slices in 3 tightly overlapping layers, seasoning each layer with pepper and brushing with oil as you go – save a bit of oil for the top layer. Cover the dish with a tight-fitting lid and bake for 10 mins.","Reduce the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Cook for a further 2 hrs until the lamb is really tender and the potatoes are cooked. Take the lid off and pop under the grill for 8-10 mins until the potatoes are golden and crisp around the edges. Remove and let the hotpot settle for 5-10 mins, then serve scattered with thyme leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:19:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7081,7081,'en','St Clement’s pie','A very British version of Key lime pie – an indulgent, creamy tart with tangy oranges and lemons','["250g light digestive biscuits","100g cornflakes","85g butter, melted","140g caster sugar","1 large egg, plus 4 large egg yolks","397g can light condensed milk","zest and juice 3 lemons","zest and juice 2 oranges","150ml pot extra-thick double cream","100g 0% fat Greek yogurt","4 tbsp icing sugar","more lemon and orange zest, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Sit\r\na fluted 20cm round loose-bottomed tin\r\n(about 5cm deep, or a slightly shallower\r\n22cm tin) on a baking sheet. Break the\r\nbiscuits into a big bowl, or double-bag\r\nthem in food bags, and bash to big\r\ncrumbs with the end of a rolling pin or\r\nsmall saucepan. Add the cornflakes and\r\nbash a bit more to crumbs. Mix with the\r\nmelted butter and sugar and press into\r\nthe base and sides of the tin. Bake for\r\n15 mins, then remove and reduce oven\r\ntemperature to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.","Whisk egg and yolks in a big bowl until\r\npale and frothy. Whisk in the condensed\r\nmilk, followed by the zests and juices.\r\nPour in the tin and bake for 20 mins.\r\nCool in the tin, then chill for at least\r\n5 hrs, or overnight.","Whip the cream, yogurt and icing sugar\r\ntogether. Dollop on the pie and scatter\r\nwith zest to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7083,7083,'en','Roast lamb with spring herb crumbs','This iron-rich dish is ideal for a weekend with family and friends','["100g good-quality white bread","2 garlic cloves","zest 1 lemon","1 tsp thyme leaf, chopped","small bunch parsley, chopped","3-4 anchovy fillets, chopped (optional)","5 carrots, cut into chunks","2 onions, cut into chunks","4 bay leaves","small bunch rosemary","2 tbsp olive oil","large leg of lamb, about 3kg/6lb 8oz","3 garlic cloves, thickly sliced, plus a whole bulb, halved","5 tbsp plain flour","200ml white wine, plus a splash","600ml lamb stock"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nFor the lamb, scatter the vegetables, bay\r\nleaves and a few rosemary sprigs into a\r\nlarge roasting tin and drizzle with the\r\nolive oil. Use a sharp knife to make little\r\nslits all over the lamb. Poke a slice of\r\ngarlic and a small sprig of rosemary into\r\neach one. Sit the lamb on top of the veg\r\nin the roasting tin, add a splash of wine,\r\nthen cook for 2 hrs if you like it pink, or\r\n2 hrs 15 mins for cooked through. Remove\r\nfrom the oven, transfer to a board and\r\ncover with foil, then rest for 45 mins-1 hr.","To make the gravy, pour off most of the\r\nfat from the tin but leave the veg and any\r\nmeat juices. Place the tin on the heat to\r\ncaramelise the veg, then stir in the flour\r\nand cook to a paste. Gradually stir in the\r\nwine, cook for a min, then stir in the\r\nstock and simmer until you have\r\na tasty gravy. Push the gravy through a\r\nsieve into a small pan and keep warm.","Turn oven up to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nFor the crumbs, blitz everything in a food\r\nprocessor and scatter over a tray. Bake\r\nin the oven for 10-15 mins until crisp,\r\nthen re-blitz or break up with your fingers\r\nto crumbs again. These can be made in\r\nadvance and kept in an airtight container\r\nfor 2 days. Serve the lamb carved into\r\nslices, sprinkled with crumbs and a jug\r\nof gravy alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:19:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7085,7085,'en','Roast beef with caramelised onion gravy','Rare roast topside is the ultimate centrepiece – make it extra special with Marmite and sweet onion gravy','["1 tbsp black peppercorn","1 tbsp English mustard powder","1 tbsp dried thyme","1 tsp celery seeds","1 tbsp olive oil","about 2kg/4lb 8oz topside joint of beef","4 tbsp plain flour","2 beef stock cubes","3 tbsp caramelised onion chutney or marmalade","2-3 tsp Marmite"]','["Crush the peppercorns, mustard\r\npowder, thyme and celery seeds together\r\nwith some salt, using a pestle and mortar.\r\nStir in the oil, then rub it all over the beef.\r\n(If you have time, cover and chill the joint\r\novernight to marinate. Bring the beef out\r\nof the fridge 1 hr before roasting.)","Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5\r\nand sit the joint in a snug-ish roasting tin.\r\nRoast for 12 mins per 450g/1lb (about\r\n55 mins for a 2kg/4lb 8oz joint) for\r\nmedium-rare, or 15 mins per 450g/1lb\r\n(about 1 hr 10 mins) for medium-well.","Remove from the oven, lift onto a\r\nplatter, cover with foil and rest for 30\r\nmins. If you’re making the Yorkies (p90),\r\nincrease oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.","For the gravy, pour any juices from\r\nthe roasting tin into a jug. Let the juices\r\nseparate, then spoon 2 tbsp of the fat\r\nback into the tin – if there is no fat, use\r\n2 tbsp butter instead. Discard any other\r\nfat. Sit the roasting tin on the hob and stir\r\nin the flour, stock cubes, onion chutney or\r\nmarmalade and Marmite. Cook for 1 min,\r\nstirring well to scrape up any beefy bits\r\nstuck to the tin, then gradually stir in\r\n750ml hot water from the kettle. Bubble\r\nto thicken to a nice consistency, then\r\ngently keep warm until ready to serve\r\nwith the beef, carved into slices."]','2026-01-10 12:19:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7087,7087,'en','Beef, ale & parsnip pudding','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA traditional steak and ale pie with suet pastry. Make the filling the night before then steam the pudding the following morning for a delicious Sunday lunch','["1 large onion, chopped","100g smoked bacon lardons","2 tbsp olive oil","500g lean stewing beef, cubed","2 tbsp plain flour","3 parsnips, cubed","500ml brown ale","300ml beef stock","2 tbsp cranberry or redcurrant jelly","4 thyme sprigs","greens, to serve (optional)","butter, for greasing","300g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","2 tsp English mustard powder","140g shredded suet"]','["Heat a large pan and cook the onion\r\nand lardons together for 5 mins until\r\ngolden. Scoop out with a slotted spoon\r\nand set aside. Add the oil to the pan,\r\ndust the beef with the flour, then evenly\r\nbrown over a high heat.","Add the parsnips, ale, stock, jelly,\r\nthyme and lardon mixture to the pan.\r\nBring to the boil, then cover and simmer\r\nfor 1½ hrs until the meat is tender.","Generously butter a 1.5-litre pudding\r\nbasin. To make the pastry, mix together\r\nthe flour, mustard powder, suet and\r\n½ tsp table salt. Add enough cold water,\r\nabout 150ml, to make a soft dough.\r\nRemove one-quarter of the dough and set\r\nto one side. On a heavily floured surface,\r\nroll out the remaining dough to make a\r\nlarge round, big enough to line the basin.","Carefully lay the pastry in the basin\r\n(aim to have 1cm of pastry overhanging\r\nthe rim), then press the edges of the join\r\ntogether to seal. Roll out the remaining\r\none-quarter into a circle big enough to\r\ncover the top.","Pour off the cooking liquid from the\r\nfilling into a small pan and set aside.\r\nDiscard the thyme stalks. Spoon the\r\nfilling into the lined basin and pour over\r\n100ml of the cooking liquid. Fold over the\r\noverhanging pastry and brush with water.\r\nPlace the lid on top, pressing firmly\r\naround the edges to seal.","Butter a sheet of baking parchment,\r\nfold in a large pleat and lay, butter-side\r\ndown, on top of the pudding. Cover with\r\na pleated layer of foil and finally tie with\r\nstring, making a loop for the handle so\r\nyou can lift the pudding easily.","Sit a small trivet or a large cookie cutter\r\nin the bottom of a deep saucepan that’s\r\nbig enough to take the basin easily.\r\nHalf-fill the pan with water and bring to\r\nthe boil. Lower in the pudding, cover and\r\nsimmer for 2 hrs, topping up with boiling\r\nwater when necessary.","Reheat the cooking liquid, bubbling it\r\ndown a little so it reduces into a tasty\r\ngravy. Carefully lift out the pudding. Run\r\na knife around the rim, then turn out and\r\nserve with gravy and greens, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7089,7089,'en','Spiced parsnip shepherd’s pies','For shepherd’s pie – but not as you know it – try cooking up these spicy individual pies','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 large onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","small knob of ginger, peeled and granted","2 tbsp medium curry powder","500g minced beef or lamb","400g can chopped tomatoes","100g frozen peas","600g parsnips, peeled and chopped into large chunks","large potato, peeled and chopped into large chunks","1 green chilli, deseeded and chopped","large bunch coriander, chopped","2 tsp turmeric","juice of 1 lemon","50g butter"]','["For the sauce, heat the oil in a pan and add the onion. Cook until soft, add the garlic, ginger and curry powder, then cook until aromatic. Turn up the heat, add the mince, fry until browned, then add the tomatoes and simmer for 20 mins until thickened. A few mins before the end, add the peas.","Meanwhile, tip the parsnips and potatoes into a pan of cold water, bring to the boil, then cook for 10 mins. Drain, season and mash with the rest of the ingredients.","Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 8. Assemble the pies in individual dishes (or one large one) by placing some meat sauce\r\non the bottom and topping with mash. Ruffle up the tops with a fork, then bake for 20 mins until golden and bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:19:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7091,7091,'en','Beef Wellington','Update a celebration dinner centrepiece using prosciutto instead of pancakes to encase beef and porcini mushroom stuffing','["1kg beef fillet - ask your butcher to cut it from the middle of the fillet and say you don''t want the tail end or the head (chateaubriand) of the fillet","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for greasing","5 - 6 thin slices prosciutto","plain flour, for dusting","500g pack all-butter puff pastry","1 egg, beaten","20g dried porcini mushrooms","400g chestnut or button mushrooms, roughly sliced","1 tbsp fresh thyme leaf","50g butter","1 large shallot, finely chopped","splash of Worcestershire sauce","2 tbsp freshly grated parmesan","25g butter","1 shallot, finely chopped","sprig of thyme","1 bay leaf","1 tbsp plain flour","splash of brandy (optional)","glass of red wine","1 beef stock cube"]','["First soak the dried porcini in 400ml of kettle-hot water and set aside. Pat the beef fillet with kitchen paper to dry it of any blood then season with salt and then heavily with black pepper. Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan until very hot then spend 8-10 mins searing and turning the fillet with tongs until it’s well browned on all sides. Hold it up to sear both ends as well. Set the beef aside on a tray to catch any juices and turn the heat off the pan but don’t clean it.","Drain and squeeze out the dried porcini but reserve the juice and tip the porcini into a food processor with the other mushrooms and thyme. Season everything with salt and pepper and pulse until finely chopped but not completely smooth. Place the beef pan back on the heat with the butter and when it starts to sizzle add the shallot and cook for 2 mins until softened. Turn the heat up and tip in the mushrooms, add a splash of Worcestershire sauce and cook everything for 10-12 mins until you have a paste that comes away from the side of the pan. Tip into a bowl to cool, stir through the parmesan if using and set aside. Turn off the heat from the pan but don’t clean it.  The beef can be seared and the mushroom mixture can be made several hours in advance.","For the first stage of assembly get a large sheet of cling film and overlap the prosciutto slices on it in a row, tip the mushroom mix on top then cover with another sheet of cling film. Either with your hands or  a rolling pin, pat it down or roll it out to a thin layer that just covers the prosciutto. Remove the top sheet of cling film and sit the fillet down the centre of the mushrooms. Using the edge of the cling film lift and roll the prosciutto and mushrooms to encase the beef then use the cling film to roll everything into a tight sausage. For the best results now place the sausage in the freezer for 30 mins to firm up – do not leave for longer of cooking times will be affected.","On a lightly floured surface, roll the pastry to a rectangle a little larger than a magazine, trim the edges to neaten and save the trimmings. Lightly brush the pastry all over with beaten egg. Carefully unwrap the prosciutto parcel and lay in the middle of the pastry. Like wrapping a parcel or making a spring roll fold the shorter edges over the fillet then roll the whole thing around the fillet to encase. For a really neat finish get another clean sheet of cling film and roll the Wellington into a sausage tight sausage again. Place in the fridge and chill for at least 30 mins or up to a day.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 with a sturdy, lightly oiled baking tray in it. Re-roll the pastry trimmings and use to make 6 leaves. Unwrap the Wellington, brush all over with egg then decorate with the leaves. Brush the leaves with more egg. Sprinkle with flaky sea salt and transfer, sealed side down to the heated baking tray. Bake the for 10 mins then reduce the heat of the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and continue to bake for 25 mins for rare meat, 30 mins for medium rare, 35 mins for medium and about 45 mins for well-done, making sure the pastry doesn’t burn (you can cover it with foil if it starts to become too dark. Remove from the oven and leave for 10 mins to relax.","To make the gravy, heat the butter in the mushroom pan and fry the shallot, thyme and bay, scraping the crispy bits of the pan with a wooden spoon. Scatter over the flour and brown then splash in the brandy, sizzle for a minute, then add the red wine and boil to a purple paste. Pour in the mushroom soaking liquid, avoiding the gritty bits at the bottom, crumble in the stock cube and any juice from the resting beef and simmer for 5 mins until you have a tasty gravy, season to taste.","Using a very sharp knife carefully carve the Wellington into 6 thick slices. You can trim the pastry ends and serve them separately. Serve on heated plates with a jug of gravy."]','2026-01-10 12:19:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7093,7093,'en','The ultimate makeover: Steak & kidney pie','The ultimate comfort dish gets a superhealthy makeover','["200g lamb''s kidneys, halved","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 medium onions, chopped","2 bay leaves","4 thyme sprigs","600g lean stewing steaks, cut into chunks","100ml red wine","2 tsp tomato purée","1 tsp English mustard powder","2 tbsp plain flour","1 large carrot, chopped","4 flat mushrooms, quartered or halved if small","3 tbsp chopped parsley","140g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp thyme leaves (optional)","25g very cold (or frozen) butter","4 tbsp 2% fat Greek yogurt","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil"]','["Cut out and discard the thin tubes from\r\nthe kidneys. Rinse the kidneys in cold\r\nwater until the water runs clear, then\r\nchop them into small pieces. Heat the\r\noil in a large saucepan or deep sauté\r\npan. Add the onions, bay and thyme\r\nsprigs and fry over a medium heat for\r\n8-10 mins until the onions are really\r\ngolden, stirring often. Put the kettle on.","Add the steak and kidney to the pan\r\nand stir-fry briefly, just until it loses its\r\npink colour. Turn up the heat, pour in the\r\nwine, stir to deglaze the bottom of the\r\npan, then let it boil over a high heat for\r\n2-3 mins until reduced and absorbed into\r\nthe meat. Stir in the tomato purée and\r\nmustard powder. Sift in the flour, stirring,\r\nthen stir for a couple of mins. Pour in\r\n400ml boiling water and continue stirring\r\nuntil the mixture starts to boil and is\r\nthickened. Tip in the carrot and both\r\nmushrooms, reduce the heat, cover with\r\na lid, then leave to simmer gently for\r\nabout 1 hr, stirring occasionally. Remove\r\nthe lid and simmer another 25-30 mins\r\nor until the meat is very tender and the\r\ngravy has thickened slightly.","Remove from the heat and remove the\r\nbay leaves and thyme sprigs. Stir in the\r\nparsley, season to taste, then transfer\r\nto a pie or ovenproof dish (22-23cm in\r\ndiameter, 6cm deep, 1.7-litre capacity\r\nor similar), then leave to cool slightly.\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","While the meat is cooling, make the\r\npastry. Put the flour, and thyme if using,\r\ninto a bowl. Grate in the cold or frozen\r\nbutter, make a well in the centre, then\r\nadd the yogurt, olive oil, a pinch of salt\r\nand a good grinding of black pepper.\r\nUsing a round-bladed knife, mix together\r\nwith 2 tsp cold water, then gently gather\r\ntogether with your hands to form a\r\ndough. Remove from the bowl and knead\r\nbriefly until smooth.","Roll out the pastry on a lightly floured\r\nsurface so it’s slightly bigger than the top\r\nof the pie dish. Lay the pastry over the\r\nmeat and trim the edges with scissors so\r\nit slightly overhangs the edge of the dish.\r\nMake 2 small slits in the centre. Flute the\r\nedges, then roll out the trimmings and\r\ncut out 6 diamond-shaped leaves. Dampen\r\none side and lay them on the pastry lid.\r\nPlace the dish on a baking sheet, then\r\nbake in the oven for about 25 mins or\r\nuntil the pastry is golden."]','2026-01-10 12:19:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7095,7095,'en','Lemon & thyme butter-basted roast chicken & gravy','Smoothing butter under the bird’s skin helps to baste the chicken and herbs add a delicious flavour to the gravy','["50g butter, softened","bunch fresh thyme or lemon thyme, leaves picked, stalks reserved, plus extra to serve","4 garlic cloves, 1 mashed, the other 3 left whole but squashed","2 lemons, halved","1 chicken, about 1½ kg","2 carrots, roughly chopped","1 onion, roughly chopped","2 bay leaves","1 tbsp plain flour","250ml chicken stock","splash soy sauce (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nIn a small bowl, mash the butter with\r\none-third of the thyme leaves, the\r\nmashed garlic and the juice of half a\r\nlemon. Mix everything together with\r\nsome seasoning and set aside.","Use your hand to loosen the chicken\r\nskin away from the breast, then push\r\nmost of the butter mix into the gap.\r\nRub the rest of the butter all over the\r\noutside of the chicken, then stuff the\r\ncavity with the lemon halves, remaining\r\nthyme leaves and stalks, and the garlic.","Scatter the chopped carrot, onion\r\nand bay leaves over the base of a small\r\nroasting tin. Sit the chicken on top,\r\nbreast-side up, and roast on the middle\r\nshelf for 1 hr 30 mins, basting with the\r\nbuttery juices after about 40 mins. When\r\nthe chicken is dark golden, crispy-skinned\r\nand the juices run clear, remove from the\r\noven and leave in the tin for 5 mins. Use\r\na pair of tongs to pull the lemons, garlic\r\nand thyme out of the cavity and into the\r\ntin. Lift the chicken up, letting any juices\r\ndribble into the tin, and transfer the\r\nchicken to a serving platter to rest for\r\nat least another 15 mins.","To make the gravy, squeeze the juice\r\nout of the cooked lemon halves and\r\ndiscard the skins. Place the tin on a low\r\nheat, stir in flour and sizzle until light\r\nbrown. Gradually pour in the stock and\r\ncook for a few mins. If you like a darker\r\ngravy, add a splash of soy sauce to the\r\ntin. Strain the gravy into a jug and serve\r\nwith the chicken."]','2026-01-10 12:19:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7097,7097,'en','No-fuss shepherd’s pie','We''ve got some lovely twists on shepherd''s pie on the site, but we were missing a definitive version of this classic family recipe – here it is!','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 large onion, chopped","2-3 medium carrots, chopped","500g pack lamb mince","2 tbsp tomato purée","large splash Worcestershire sauce","500ml beef stock","900g potatoes, cut into chunks","85g butter","3 tbsp milk"]','["Heat the oil in a medium saucepan,\r\nthen soften the onion and carrots for\r\na few mins. When soft, turn up the heat,\r\ncrumble in the lamb and brown, tipping\r\noff any excess fat. Add the tomato\r\npurée and Worcestershire sauce, then\r\nfry for a few mins. Pour over the stock,\r\nbring to a simmer, then cover and\r\ncook for 40 mins, uncovering halfway.","Meanwhile, heat the oven to 180C/\r\nfan 160C/ gas 4, then make the mash.\r\nBoil the potatoes in salted water for\r\n10-15 mins until tender. Drain, then\r\nmash with the butter and milk.","Put the mince into an ovenproof dish,\r\ntop with the mash and ruffle with a fork.\r\nThe pie can now be chilled and frozen\r\nfor up to a month. Bake for 20-25 mins\r\nuntil the top is starting to colour and\r\nthe mince is bubbling through at the\r\nedges. (To bake from frozen, cook at\r\n160C/fan 140C/gas 3 for 1 hr-1 hr 20\r\nmins until piping hot in the centre. Flash\r\nunder the grill to brown, if you like.)\r\nLeave to stand for 5 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:19:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7099,7099,'en','Herby toad in the hole','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis family favourite marries meaty sausages with robust herbs and traditional, comforting Yorkshire pudding','["140g plain flour","3 eggs","300ml milk","2 tsp Dijon mustard","2 tbsp vegetable oil","8 Cumberland sausages","8 sage leaves","4 rosemary sprigs"]','["Heat oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 9. In a food processor, combine the flour, eggs, milk, mustard and some salt and pepper, blitz until smooth, then leave to rest for 30 mins.","Pour the oil into a metal roasting tin about 30 x 23cm and 7.5cm deep. Brush the oil all over the sides and bottom, then place in the oven. When the roasting tin is very hot and smoking, place the sausages inside, evenly spread out, and cook for 5 mins.","Give the rested batter a stir and pour into the really hot tin – take care as it may spit. Quickly sprinkle over the sage leaves and rosemary, then place in the middle of the oven. Do not open the door for 25 mins, then check – if needed, cook for a further 5-10 mins. Cook until puffed up and brown and the batter is completely cooked through. Serve straight from the dish."]','2026-01-10 12:19:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7101,7101,'en','Fish pie – in four steps','Delicious and easy – a fish pie anyone can make. You''ll learn how to poach fish and make a white sauce too','["400g skinless white fish fillet","400g skinless smoked haddock fillet","600ml full-fat milk","1 small onion, quartered","4 cloves","2 bay leaves","4 eggs","small bunch parsley, leaves only, chopped","100g butter","50g plain flour","pinch freshly grated nutmeg","1kg floury potato, peeled and cut into even-sized chunks","50g cheddar, grated"]','["Poach the fish. Put the fish in the frying pan and pour over 500ml of the milk. Stud each onion quarter with a clove,\r\nthen add to the milk, with the bay leaves. Bring the milk just to the boil – you will see a few small bubbles. Reduce the heat and simmer for 8 mins. Lift the fish onto a plate and strain the milk into a jug to cool. Flake the fish into large pieces in the baking dish.","Hard-boil the eggs. Bring a small pan of water to a gentle boil, then carefully lower the eggs in with a slotted spoon. Bring\r\nthe water back to a gentle boil, with just a couple of bubbles rising to the surface. Set the timer for 8 mins, cook, then drain and cool in a bowl of cold water. Peel, slice into quarters and arrange on top of the fish, then scatter over the chopped parsley.","Make the sauce. Melt half the butter in a pan, stir in the flour and cook for 1 min over moderate heat. Take off the heat,\r\npour in a little of the cold poaching milk, then stir until blended. Continue to add the milk gradually, mixing well until you have  a smooth sauce. Return to the heat, bringto the boil and cook for 5 mins, stirring continually, until it coats the back of a spoon. Remove from the heat, season with salt, pepper and nutmeg, then pour over the fish.","Assemble and bake. Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Boil the potatoes for 20 mins. Drain, season and mash with the\r\nremaining butter and milk. Use to top the pie, starting at the edge of the dish and working your way in – push the mash right to the edges to seal. Fluff the top with a fork, sprinkle with cheese, then bake for 30 mins. Make up to a day ahead, chill, then bake for 40 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:19:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7103,7103,'en','Sausages with apple mash','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyGive your bangers a spring makeover with the addition of apple mash, comfort food doesn’t get much better than this','["700g floury potatoes, cut into chunks","8 Cumberland sausages","25g butter","1 onion, thinly sliced","2 tsp plain flour","250ml beef stock","2 apples (about 280g/10oz), peeled and chopped into small chunks","3 tbsp milk"]','["Cook the potatoes in boiling,\r\nsalted water for 15 mins until tender.\r\nMeanwhile, heat a non-stick frying pan\r\nand add the sausages. Cook over a\r\nmedium heat for 15-20 mins, turning\r\noccasionally, until cooked through.\r\nRemove from the pan and keep warm.","Add a knob of the butter and the onion\r\nto the pan, then cook for 15-20 mins until\r\nsoft. Stir in the flour, then gradually add\r\nthe stock, stirring to make a sauce.\r\nSimmer for 2 mins, then pour into a jug\r\nand keep warm.","Cook the apples in half the remaining\r\nbutter for 5-10 mins until softened. Drain\r\nthe potatoes and mash well with the\r\nrest of the butter and the milk. Fold in\r\nthe apple, then serve with the sausages\r\nand onion gravy."]','2026-01-10 12:19:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7105,7105,'en','No-fail Yorkies','Perfect for mopping up gravy, these soft but crisp Yorkshire puddings will rise every time thanks to a great batter','["450ml milk","4 large eggs","250g plain flour","2 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil"]','["Up to 3-4 hrs before cooking, mix\r\ntogether the milk, eggs, flour and 2 tsp\r\nsalt in a food processor or blender until\r\nyou have a smooth batter. If you don’t\r\nhave a food processor or blender, whisk\r\nthe eggs into the flour and salt, then\r\ngradually whisk in the milk until smooth.\r\nTransfer to a jug, cover and leave at\r\nroom temperature for at least 15 mins.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and brush 12 holes of a muffin\r\ntin with the oil. Heat the tin in the oven\r\nfor 5 mins, then carefully lift out and\r\nquickly pour the batter into the holes.\r\nBake in the oven for 5 mins, then reduce\r\noven temperature to 200C/180C fan/\r\ngas 6 and cook for a further 30 mins\r\nuntil puffed, risen and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:19:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7107,7107,'en','Marzipan Eccles tarts','This fun spin on the traditional Lancashire fruit cakes uses leftover marzipan to make irresistible individual pies','["300g leftover dried fruit, like raisins, sultanas, currants","2 eating apples or pears, cored and grated","50g demerara sugar, plus a little extra to decorate","100g leftover marzipan, grated","½  tsp ground cloves","1 tsp ground cinnamon","500g block puff pastry","little flour, for rolling","1 egg, beaten"]','["Mix the dried fruit, grated apple or pear, Demerara sugar, marzipan, cloves and cinnamon.","Divide the pastry into 6. Then assemble tarts one by one. Halve a chunk of pastry and roll out each halve to a circle about the thickness of a 50p piece on a floured surface. Spoon a sixth of the filling into the centre of one circle in a pile. Brush edges with egg, and lift the second pastry circle on top. Gently press down on the fruit to push out as much air as you can. Press the pastry edges to seal. Use an appropriate sized bowl, glass etc to help you trim the edges to a neat circle. At this stage, you can cover and chill the tarts overnight, or freeze for 1 month. Defrost before continuing. Brush with beaten egg, then make three small slashes with a knife in a row. Repeat with remaining pastry and filling.","Pop the tarts in the fridge while you heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. When the oven is nice and hot, brush tarts all over with egg and sprinkle each with a little more sugar. Bake for 20 - 25 mins, until golden, then eat warm with ice cream or custard."]','2026-01-10 12:19:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7109,7109,'en','Chicken & mushroom puff pie','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis is just what you need on a cold night. Serve with creamy mashed potatoes','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","8 skinless boneless chicken thighs","8 rashers smoked streaky bacon, cut into large pieces","1 onion, halved and sliced","250g pack baby button mushrooms","handful thyme sprigs","2 tbsp plain flour","400ml chicken stock","200ml milk","500g pack fresh puff pastry, or frozen and defrosted","1 egg, beaten"]','["Heat the oil in a large, non-stick frying pan. Season the chicken to taste and fry for 5-8 mins until golden brown, turning occasionally. You may need to do this in two batches, depending on the size of your pan. Lift the chicken onto a plate and tip the bacon into the pan. Fry for 5 mins until crisp. Add the onion, mushrooms and thyme, then fry on a high heat for another 3 mins until the onions start to colour.","Tip the flour into the pan and cook, stirring, for 1 min. With the pan off the heat, gradually stir or whisk in the stock, followed by the milk, then add the chicken back to the pan. Bring to the boil, then simmer for 30 mins. Spoon the filling into a large pie or baking dish (approx 20 x 30cm) with a lip and leave to cool.","Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. On a floured surface, roll the pastry to the thickness of two £1 coins. Cut a long strip as wide as the rim of the pie dish and, using a little of the egg, fix to the edge of the pie dish. Brush with egg, then lift the rest of the pastry over the pie, using the rolling pin to help. Gently press the edges with your fingers and trim with a sharp knife. Brush lightly with egg to glaze, then bake for 30 mins or until the pastry is risen and dark golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:19:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7111,7111,'en','Sugared scones','A simple and quick scone recipe that has a great sweet finish – the crunchy sugar top adds texture too','["85g diced butter","350g self-raising flour","¼ tsp salt","1½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","4 tbsp caster sugar","200ml milk, warmed to room temperature, plus a splash extra","crushed sugar cubes, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Whizz butter into\r\nflour. Tip into a bowl and stir in salt with bicarbonate of soda\r\nand sugar. Using a cutlery\r\nknife, quickly stir in milk –\r\ndon’t over-mix.","Tip out onto a lightly floured surface\r\nand turn over a couple of times to very\r\ngently bring together with your hands.\r\nGently pat to about 1in thick, then stamp\r\nout rounds with a floured cutter. Pat\r\ntogether trimmings to stamp out more.\r\nBrush the tops with a splash more\r\nmilk, then scatter with crushed sugar\r\ncubes. Bake on a baking sheet for\r\n10-12 mins until risen and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:19:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7113,7113,'en','Roasted autumn vegetables with Lancashire cheese','A colourful and hearty vegetarian supper dish for autumn – made in one roasting tin, from Roz Denny','["1 large butternut squash (about 600-700g/1lb 5oz - 1lb 9oz in weight)","1 medium red onion","6 tbsp olive oil","1 large sprig fresh sage","1 large courgette","1 tbsp balsamic or sherry vinegar","100g Lancashire cheese"]','["Preheat the oven to\r\nfan180C/conventional 200C/\r\ngas 6. Using a sharp knife, cut\r\nthe squash in half and scoop\r\nout the seeds. Cut the halves\r\ninto smaller pieces so you can\r\npeel them more easily. Chop\r\nthe flesh into big bite-sized\r\npieces – they don’t have to\r\nbe neat.","Halve the onion and trim the\r\nroot end leaving a little on to\r\nhold the segments together.\r\nPeel and then cut each half\r\ninto four wedges. Scatter the\r\nsquash and onion in a large\r\nroasting tin so they have\r\nplenty of room to roast, drizzle\r\nover 5 tbsp of the oil and toss\r\ntogether. Strip the sage leaves\r\nfrom the stem and roughly\r\nchop – you should have about\r\n2 tbsps. Scatter over the\r\nvegetables and season.\r\nRoast for 20 minutes, stirring\r\nonce halfway through.","Meanwhile, slice the\r\ncourgette thickly and toss\r\nwith the remaining oil.\r\nRemove the roasting tin from\r\nthe oven and push the partly\r\ncooked squash and onion to\r\nthe side. Put the courgette\r\nslices flat on the base and\r\nseason. Roast for a further\r\n10 minutes, until all the\r\nvegetables are tender.","Remove tin from the oven,\r\nsprinkle the vinegar over the\r\nvegetables and toss. Crumble\r\nover the Lancashire cheese.\r\nToss lightly so the cheese\r\nmelts a little and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7115,7115,'en','Cherry & almond tarts','These mini Bakewell bites combine pastry and cake are designed for making in batches and cooking from frozen','["375g pack all-butter puff pastry","75g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","12 rounded tsp morello cherry jam","75g plain sponge or Madeira cakes","100g butter, softened","75g ground almonds","75g golden caster sugar","2 medium eggs","½  tsp almond extract","25g flaked almonds","100g icing sugar, sieved to decorate"]','["Very thinly roll out the pastry on\r\na lightly floured surface. Stamp out\r\n12 x 9cm circles with a fluted cutter, if\r\nyou have one, and use to line a bun tin.\r\nSpread 1 rounded tsp of the cherry jam\r\nin the bottom of each tart.","Whizz the cake to crumbs in a\r\nfood processor, then tip into a mixing\r\nbowl and add the flour, butter, ground\r\nalmonds, caster sugar, eggs and almond\r\nextract. Beat together until smooth,\r\nthen divide between the tarts,\r\nspreading a little with the back of a\r\nteaspoon to cover the jam. Scatter\r\nover the flaked almonds and openfreeze\r\nfor 2 hrs, then wrap well in cling\r\nfilm and freeze for up to 2 months.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4\r\nwith a baking sheet in it. Unwrap the\r\ntarts from the freezer and loosely top\r\nwith a sheet of foil. Bake on the heated\r\nbaking sheet for 30-40 mins until\r\ngolden, removing the foil halfway.\r\nCool the tarts a little, then add a splash\r\nof water into the icing sugar to make\r\na runny icing. Drizzle over the tarts\r\nand leave to set."]','2026-01-10 12:19:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7117,7117,'en','Easy treacle sponge','A simple baked version of this classic childhood pudding, with a zesty treacle sauce forming an irresistible puddle at the bottom','["250g golden syrup","zest 1 lemon, plus juice ½ lemon","5 tbsp breadcrumbs","200g pack butter, softened","200g golden caster sugar","3 medium eggs","200g self-raising flour","5 tbsp milk"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Mix the syrup, lemon zest, juice and breadcrumbs and spread over the base of a 1.5 litre baking dish.","Beat the butter and sugar until pale and fluffy, then beat in the eggs, one by one. Stir in the flour and milk and dollop over the syrup. Bake for 35-40 mins until golden and risen, and a skewer poked into the sponge comes out clean-ish. Eat with lots of custard, cream or ice cream and extra dribbles of syrup."]','2026-01-10 12:19:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7119,7119,'en','Curried goat','Enjoy this Jamaican-inspired goat curry that’s packed with flavour for a family feast. Bring the pot to the table and let everyone help themselves','["1kg goat meat, cut into cubes (we got ours from Cabrito Goat Meat)","4 tbsp curry powder","1 tbsp turmeric","1 tsp black pepper","1 tsp Jamaican allspice (ground pimento)","3 tsp salt, to taste","1 medium onion, sliced","4 spring onions, thinly sliced, plus extra to serve","2 tsp minced garlic","6-7 thyme sprigs","5 tbsp oil (vegetable or coconut)","1 medium carrot, cut into cubes","1 medium potato, cut into 2cm cubes","1 Scotch bonnet chilli, left whole"]','["Put the goat in a largemixing bowland add all the ingredients except the oil, carrot, potato and chilli. Rub everything into the meat until well coated. Put in the fridge to marinate for at least 1 hr or overnight.","Heat the oil in a large heavy-bottomed pan over a medium to high heat and add the meat. Stir until browned on all sides. Pour in enough hot water to just cover the meat (about 800ml). Put the lid on and allow to simmer over a low heat for 2 hrs, or until the meat is soft and tender. Keep checking and stirring every 30 mins and add a little more water if it reduces too much, to prevent the pan from drying out.","For the last 30 mins of cooking, add the carrots, potatoes, and chilli. Remove the lid and simmer for a little longer to thicken, if you like. Stir and season to taste, then scatter over some extra spring onion."]','2026-01-10 12:19:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7121,7121,'en','Rice & peas','Serve rice and peas as a side with Caribbean-style jerk chicken, or other barbecued meats. The ''peas'' are actually kidney beans','["400g can kidney beans, rinsed and drained","400ml can low-fat coconut milk","½ tsp dried thyme","½ tsp ground allspice","6 spring onions, sliced","200g long grain rice"]','["Put the beans, coconut milk, thyme, allspice, 4 of the spring onions and 100ml water in a pan, and bring to a simmer. Season with plenty of salt and black pepper.","Rinse the rice a few times in a sieve until the water runs clear. Tip into the pan and simmer for 10 mins over a medium heat, stirring occasionally, before lowering the heat. Put the lid on and cook for another 5 mins until the grains are tender and the liquid has been absorbed. Fluff up the rice with a fork before serving and scatter with the reserved spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:19:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7122,7122,'en','Prawns with Romesco sauce','Succulent tiger prawns are spiced up with chilli and peppers in this Spanish-style tapas dish','["1 red pepper, preferably the long, thin skinned romano variety","3 fat garlic cloves","1 fat, fresh red chilli","1 large ripe tomato","10 shelled hazelnuts","10 blanched almonds","3 sprigs parsley","small slice day-old bread","8 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","400g pack large, cooked, peeled tiger prawns, defrosted if frozen"]','["Prepare ahead - halve the pepper lengthways and remove the seeds and stalk. Line a grill pan with foil and put the pepper halves, skin side up, on the grill pan with the whole garlic cloves, chilli and tomato. Grill for 2 minutes, turn the tomato, then grill for a further 2 minutes. Remove the tomato with a large spoon, then peel, quarter and remove the seeds. Then chop the tomato roughly.","Continue grilling the pepper, chilli and garlic for 4-5 minutes, until the pepper and chilli skins have blackened and the garlic is starting to soften (the garlic skin will start to split when it is ready). When cool enough to handle, peel and halve the chilli, and scrape out and discard the seeds. Peel the pepper and roughly chop both the pepper and chilli.","Spread nuts over the foil and grill until toasted. Finely chop the nuts and parsley in a food processor. Tip into a small bowl.","Heat 3 tablespoons of oil in a frying pan, add the pepper, garlic and chilli and fry for 3 minutes. Tear up the bread and add to the pan, turning it in the oil until lightly browned. Pulse in food processor with the tomatoes, salt, vinegar and oil until roughly chopped. Tip into a bowl. Leave to cool and store in fridge for up to 3 days.","On the day add the nuts and parsley to the sauce and mix. Serve in a small bowl on a plate with the peeled prawns. Supply cocktail sticks for spearing the prawns."]','2026-01-10 12:19:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7123,7123,'en','Jerk pulled pork with banana salsa','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThe perfect party sharing dish is spiced up with Caribbean seasoning and served with a fruity coarse salsa','["200g sea salt","300g dark muscovado sugar","2kg piece boned shoulder of pork, trimmed of rind, but leave fat","4 tbsp jerk seasoning (we used Bart), mixed with 2 tsp ground cinnamon","150ml pineapple juice","50g treacle","2 x 400g cans black beans, drained and rinsed well","lots of soft flour tortillas (2-3 per person depending on size and appetites)","big pot of natural yogurt and shredded lettuce, to serve (optional)","3 medium banana, firm to ripe, peeled and cut into 1cm cubes","1 red onion, finely diced","2 just-ripe avocados","juice 1 lemon","juice 2 limes","1-2 red chillies, deseeded and diced","small pack coriander, stalks finely chopped, leaves roughly chopped"]','["The day before, mix the sea salt and 200g of the sugar in a large food bag. Add the pork and coat it well, then leave it in the fridge overnight.","The next day, remove the pork and wipe the meat down with kitchen paper to remove any excess sugar or salt. Rub 3 tbsp of the jerk spices all over and sit the meat on a rack, in a roasting tin. Leave to marinate a little in the fridge, then 30 mins before you start cooking, bring it out to room temperature.","Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Mix together the remaining 100g sugar with the pineapple juice, the remaining jerk spices and treacle, and rub half over the pork. Pour the other half into the tin and roast for 6 hrs. Baste the meat with the juices and roast for 1 hr more until the outside is charred and the inside tender. Rest the pork on a platter for 20 mins and pour any juices from the tin into a fat-separating jug.","Put the diced banana in a bowl with the onion. Stone, peel and dice the avocados and add these, too. Mix in the lemon and lime juice, chillies, coriander stalks and leaves, and some seasoning.","Heat the black beans in a microwave, and warm the tortillas following pack instructions. Add a couple of forks to the pork for shredding, discard the fat from the tin juices, and serve the rest alongside for pouring. Serve the pork with the wraps, beans, banana salsa, yogurt and shredded lettuce, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7125,7125,'en','Sticky jerk & brown sugar ribs with pineapple rice','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyStacks of pork ribs make an alternative to chicken in this Caribbean feast with sticky marinade and fruity basmati accompaniment','["2 x 500g racks pork ribs","3 tbsp jerk seasoning","600ml pineapple juice","5 tbsp dark soft brown sugar","4 tbsp cider vinegar","juice 1 lime","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 large banana shallot, finely sliced","1 green pepper, deseeded and finely diced","200g pack fresh pineapple chunks, finely diced","2 tsp brown sugar","200g basmati rice, cooked and cooled","small bunch coriander, chopped"]','["Lay the ribs in a roasting tin and rub all over with 2 tbsp of the jerk spice mix. Leave to marinate for at least 2 hrs, or preferably overnight.","Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Put the ribs in a clean roasting tin, season and pour over 500ml of the pineapple juice. Cover the tin with foil and bake for 2 hrs.","Mix the remaining jerk spice mix, pineapple juice, sugar, vinegar, lime juice and a good pinch of salt in a saucepan. Heat until the sugar dissolves, then bubble until thick and sticky.","To make the rice, heat the oil in a large pan or wok. Add the shallot and pepper, and stir-fry until softened. Add the pineapple, brown sugar and plenty of seasoning, and continue cooking until the pineapple starts to caramelise.","Remove the ribs from the oven and pour away the cooking liquid. Increase oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Pat the ribs dry with some kitchen paper, then brush the jerk sauce all over them. Return to the oven for 20 mins, brushing with any remaining sauce every 5 mins or so, until the ribs are really sticky.","Add the cooked rice to the pan with the pineapple and vegetables, stir-fry for a further 2 mins, stirring occasionally, then add the coriander. Serve with the sticky ribs – and some napkins!"]','2026-01-10 12:19:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7127,7127,'en','Jerk pork with rice & beans','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA speedy version of a Jamaican pork jerk favourite – loads of flavour, not too spicy','["1 tbsp olive oil","3 tbsp Jamaican jerk sauce","4 small boneless pork loin steak about 500g/1lb 2oz in total","1 chicken stock cube","50g creamed coconut (from a block)","1 bunch salad onions","2 x 250g packets Rizzazz pure basmati rice (ready cooked rice in a vacuum-pack)","410g can red kidney beans, drained"]','["Half fill the kettle and put on to boil.Warm the oil in a large nonstick frying pan over a low heat while you tip the jerk sauce into a shallow dish and use to coat the pork steaks on both sides. Place them in the hot oil (reserve the sauce left in the bowl) and turn up the heat. Fry for 4 minutes on each side until cooked and richly glazed.","While the pork is frying, pour 150ml/1?4 pint of boiling water into a medium pan over a high heat and crumble in the stock cube and creamed coconut. Trim and slice the spring onions, holding them together as a bunch so you can chop them all in one go. Add to the pan, give a quick stir, then tip in the rice and beans. Stir and heat gently, breaking down any clumps of rice with a spoon. If the rice looks a little dry, add an extra splash of water.","Tip the remaining sauce into the pan to heat through with the pork. Pile the rice onto plates, top with the pork and spoon the pan juices over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7129,7129,'en','Caribbean beef patties','Spice up beef mince with turmeric, thyme and hot pepper sauce before folding in shortcrust pastry for a tasty dinner or lunch','["drizzle of oil","1 small onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","250g beef mince","1 potato, cut into 1cm/½ in cubes","2 tsp turmeric","2 tbsp tomato purée","few thyme sprigs","2 tbsp hot pepper sauce","500g block shortcrust pastry","1 egg, beaten","green salad, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a pan, add the onion and cook for 5 mins. Add the garlic and beef, turn up the heat and cook until the meat is browned. Add the potato, half the turmeric, the purée and thyme, plus 200ml water. Cover and simmer for 15 mins, then remove the lid and cook for 5 mins more. Add the hot pepper sauce and leave to cool.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Roll out the pastry to the thickness of a £1 coin. Cut out 6 x 15cm circles, using a small plate as a guide. Divide the mince between the circles, piling it up on one side. Mix the egg with the remaining turmeric, brush around the edge of each circle, then fold over and use a fork to seal the edges. Arrange on a baking tray lined with baking parchment, brush with a little more egg and bake for 20-25 mins. Serve with a green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:19:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7130,7130,'en','Patatas bravas','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA classic tapas dish – cubes of potato in a spicy, tomato sauce','["175g piece chorizo, sliced","350g sliced new potatoes","½ tsp cumin seed, 1 seeded","sliced fresh red chilli","1 chopped garlic clove","400g can chopped tomatoes"]','["Slice up the chorizo and dry fry in a large frying pan for a minute. Add the sliced new potatoes and cook for 5 minutes until golden. The add the cumin seeds, 1 seeded and sliced fresh red chilli and chopped garlic clove and cook for 2 minutes. Tip in the can of chopped tomatoes, and simmer for 10-15 minutes until the potatoes are tender."]','2026-01-10 12:19:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7131,7131,'en','Sticky jerk salmon with mango slaw','Serve chunky salmon fillets with a spicy Caribbean honey glaze on a homemade coleslaw with cabbage, red pepper, mango and coriander','["2 heaped tbsp Jamaican jerk paste","2 tbsp clear honey","4 salmon fillets","juice 2 limes","½  red cabbage, core removed, thinly sliced","1 firm but ripe mango, skin removed, thinly sliced","1 red pepper, thinly sliced","6 spring onions, thinly sliced on an angle","small bunch coriander, leaves picked"]','["Heat the grill to medium-high. Mix the jerk paste and 1 tbsp honey together in a bowl. Place the salmon fillets on a foil-lined baking tray and brush all over with the sauce. Cook on the top shelf for 8-10 mins or until just cooked through (move the tray down a shelf if the salmon starts getting too caramelised).","Meanwhile, put the remaining honey, lime juice and some seasoning in a large bowl and mix together. Add the red cabbage, mango, pepper, spring onions and coriander, and toss through the dressing. Serve the salmon on a pile of the slaw."]','2026-01-10 12:19:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7132,7132,'en','Spanish tomato bread with jamón Serrano','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThese tasty tapas snacks are ready in just 5 minutes, the perfect accompaniment for a drinks party','["4 ripe tomatoes, chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","3 tbsp olive oil","salt","pepper","20 slices of baguette","5-6 slices serrano ham"]','["Mix together the chopped tomatoes, garlic glove, olive oil, salt and pepper. Keep in the fridge until needed.","To serve, toast 20 slices of baguette. Spoon a little tomato topping on to each piece of toast. Tear 5-6 slices of jamón serrano into pieces and put one piece on each slice of bread."]','2026-01-10 12:19:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7133,7133,'en','Easy jerk chicken with rice & peas','A Caribbean classic, this recipe makes a delicious and satisfying weekday meal','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","1kg chicken thighs and drumsticks","1 bottle jerk barbecue sauce (Levi Roots or Walkerswood from Waitrose)","1 bunch spring onions, sliced","200g basmati rice","2 x 410g cans kidney beans","400g can coconut milk","1 bunch spring onions, chopped","1 thyme sprig","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 tsp allspice"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nHeat the oil in a roasting tin, then\r\ncarefully add the chicken pieces.\r\nBrown them lightly on all sides\r\n– it will take about 6-8 mins. Pour\r\nover the jerk sauce, scatter over\r\nthe sliced spring onions, then toss\r\nto coat each piece of chicken.","Roast the chicken for 30 mins,\r\nturning occasionally to ensure\r\nit gets nice and sticky.","While the chicken is cooking,\r\nmake the rice & peas. Rinse the\r\nrice in a sieve until the water runs\r\nclear. Bring a pan of water to the\r\nboil with the liquid only from the\r\nkidney beans, the coconut milk,\r\nspring onions, thyme, garlic, allspice\r\nand some salt, then simmer for\r\n10 mins. Add the beans, then\r\nsimmer for 5 mins more until the\r\nrice is tender. Drain and serve\r\nstraight away with the chicken."]','2026-01-10 12:19:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7135,7135,'en','Jerk beefburger with pineapple relish & chips','Flavour your mince with Jamaican spices and serve up with a contrasting tropical chutney and fries','["4 very large potatoes","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 red onion, ½ grated and ½ finely chopped","1 carrot, grated","400g/ 14oz beef mince","2 tsp jerk seasoning (we used Bart)","200g/7oz fresh pineapple (we used pre-cut packet), finely chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","small handful coriander, roughly chopped","juice 1 lime","lettuce and burger buns, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nScrub the potatoes and cut into chips.\r\nLay the chips in a single layer on a baking\r\ntray, drizzle with oil, season and toss to\r\ncoat. Bake for 40 mins until crisp.","Mix together the grated onion, carrot,\r\nmince and jerk seasoning in a large bowl,\r\nthen shape into 4 evenly sized patties.","Heat a non-stick frying pan till hot, then\r\ncook the burgers for 5-6 mins each side.","To make the relish, mix the chopped\r\nonion, pineapple, chilli, coriander and\r\nlime juice. To serve, place the burgers\r\nin split buns with some lettuce and the\r\nspicy relish. Serve with the crispy chips."]','2026-01-10 12:19:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7137,7137,'en','Hot & spicy sweet potatoes','Tantalise your buds with hot and spicy sweet potatoes','["2 large sweet potatoes (about 500g/1lb 4oz each)","4 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp fresh thyme leaves, plus 2 sprigs of fresh thyme","1 red scotch bonnet chilli, seeded and finely chopped"]','["Peel the sweet potatoes and cut crossways into slices 2.5cm thick. Lay each potato on a large sheet of foil, keeping the slices together.","Drizzle each potato with the olive oil, sprinkle with the thyme leaves, about half of the chopped chilli and season with plenty of salt and pepper. With your hands, massage the flavourings into each slice. Replace the slices in their original positions. Lay a thyme sprig across the top of each potato and sprinkle with the remaining chilli. Wrap the foil securely round the potatoes to make two parcels. (You can prepare to this stage up to 24 hours ahead.)","Put the foil parcels on the rack over the hottest part of the barbecue and cook for 45 minutes until the potatoes are buttery and softened. (Unwrap and test with the point of a knife to check if they’re ready)."]','2026-01-10 12:19:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7139,7139,'en','Exotic avocado salad','Savour sharp, sweet flavours in this exotic avocado salad','["3 tbsp pumpkin seeds","2 ripe papayas","3 ripe avocados","85g bag trimmed and washed watercress","20g pack fresh mint","juice of 1 lime","3 tbsp olive oil"]','["Dry-fry the pumpkin seeds in a frying pan for a few minutes, tossing and turning them until they look toasted. Tip them out of the pan and let them go cold. Peel the papayas, halve them lengthways and scoop out the seeds. Cut the flesh into long, thin slices. Halve the avocados and remove the stones, then peel off the skin and slice the flesh lengthways into thin slices.","Put the papayas, avocados, pumpkin seeds and watercress into a large bowl. Chop about 1 tbsp of the mint leaves and set aside. Pick the remaining leaves from the stalks and tear them into the bowl.","Mix the lime juice and olive oil with the rest of the chopped mint to make a dressing, and season with salt and pepper to taste. Pour over the salad and gently mix all the ingredients together with your hands. Taste and add more salt and pepper if you think it needs it, then transfer to a serving platter."]','2026-01-10 12:19:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7141,7141,'en','Spiced glazed pineapple with cinnamon fromage frais','Try this tropical treat when you want to end a meal on a sweet note without too much effort or too many calories','["zest and juice 1 lime","2 tbsp clear honey","2 pinches ground cinnamon","few gratings whole nutmeg","2 tsp icing sugar, sifted","200g very low-fat fromage frais","2 tsp butter","1 fresh pineapple, cut into 8 long wedges, skin and core removed"]','["Mix the lime juice and half the lime zest\r\nwith 1 tbsp honey, a pinch of cinnamon\r\nand nutmeg. Set this sauce aside. Stir the\r\nicing sugar and a pinch of cinnamon into\r\nthe fromage frais.","Heat the butter and remaining honey\r\nin a non-stick frying pan until melted.\r\nAdd the pineapple and cook over a high\r\nheat for 8 mins, turning regularly until\r\ncaramelised. Pour in the spiced lime\r\nsauce and bubble for a few secs, tossing\r\nthe pineapple to glaze in the sauce.","Serve immediately, sprinkled with the\r\nremaining lime zest and accompanied by\r\na dollop of the cinnamon fromage frais"]','2026-01-10 12:19:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7143,7143,'en','Natalie’s Trinidadian fish stew','This dish of Caribbean sunshine is perfect for sharing with friend – make sure you marinate the fish in lemon and lime to get a really zingy taste','["2 limes, juice and grated zest of 1, the other halved for serving","1 skinned white fish fillets, such as cod or hoki, about 175-200g/6-8oz each","2 lemons, juice only","2 x 15g packets fresh thyme (you need a lot for the aroma)","¼ tsp white pepper","1 tbsp dark rum","3 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, cut into thin rings","a handful of fresh coriander, chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","1 beefsteak or 3 normal tomatoes, sliced","2 tsp dark muscovado sugar","shake of Angostura bitters, optional","basmati rice or boiled potatoes and steamed vegetables, to serve"]','["Pour the juice and scatter the zest of the first lime into a shallow dish big enough to fit the fish in one layer. Swirl the juice around so it covers the entire surface of the dish. Lay the fish on top and pour over the lemon juice.","Strip the thyme leaves off the stalks and crush them with a pinch of salt and the white pepper using a pestle and mortar to make a rough paste. Tip the thyme paste over the fish and gently massage it in, taking care not to break up the flesh at all. Pour the rum over and give it one last rub. Cover and leave to marinate out of the fridge for about 1 hour.","Heat the oil in a wide shallow pan with a lid. Throw in the onion rings and cook for 4-5 minutes until they begin to soften. Tip the coriander, garlic, tomato slices and sugar in with the onions, stir and cook for about 3-4 minutes until the tomatoes begin to release their juices and everything smells sweet.","Lift the fish from its marinade and nestle it in the pan among the onions and tomatoes. Pour over the marinade, 3 tbsp of water and the Angostura bitters, if you are using it.","Cover the pan and gently cook for 6-8 minutes until the fish flakes easily and the onions are softened but still have some bite to them. Season with salt and pepper. The authentic Trinidadian dish is tangy-sweet with lots of thyme flavour and very limey, so taste the sauce and if you want more tang, squeeze over the remaining lime. Serve with basmati rice or boiled potatoes and steamed vegetables."]','2026-01-10 12:19:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7145,7145,'en','Barbecued plantains','Cook perfect plantains by wrapping them in foil and barbecuing them. This Latin American relative of the banana is delicious in sweet and savoury dishes.','["2 ripe plantains - the skins must be black","2 tbsp butter","2 tbsp demerara sugar","8 tbsp freshly squeezed orange juice"]','["Peel the plantains and cut them crossways into slices 2.5cm thick. Lay each plantain on a large sheet of foil, keeping the slices together so they stay in their original shape.","Smear each plaintain with the butter (or dot it over if it’s hard) and sprinkle with the sugar. Make a gondola shape round each plantain with the foil, then pour over the orange juice and grind salt and pepper on top. Wrap the foil completely round the plantains so they’re securely sealed inside. (You can prepare to this stage up to 24 hours ahead.)","Put the foil parcels on the barbecue rack and cook for 30 minutes until the plantains are softened (to check if they’re ready, open a parcel and test with the point of a knife)."]','2026-01-10 12:19:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7149,7149,'en','Mango chicken, bean & rice bake','Drumsticks are ideal for an all-in-one traybake – the rice, beans and spicy seasoning make it a little like Caribbean jerk chicken','["small bunch spring onions, chopped","thumb-sized piece ginger, chopped","3 garlic cloves","1 red chilli, seeds removed if you don''t like it too hot","small handful coriander, stalks roughly chopped and leaves picked","1 tbsp thyme leaf","zest and juice 1 lime, plus 1 lime cut into wedges to serve","1½  tsp ground allspice","2 tbsp sunflower oil","8 chicken drumsticks","300g long grain rice","400g can kidney beans, rinsed and drained","500ml chicken stock","1 ripe mango, peeled, stoned and cut into bite-sized chunks","200g mango chutney, plus extra to serve (optional)"]','["Put the spring onions, ginger, garlic,\r\nchilli, coriander stalks, thyme, lime zest\r\nand juice, allspice and oil in a food\r\nprocessor, then blend to a paste. Pour\r\nover the chicken drumsticks and leave\r\nto marinate for at least 1 hr, or preferably\r\nup to 1 day.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nTip the rice and beans into a large\r\nroasting tin with deep sides. Remove\r\nthe chicken from the marinade and set\r\naside. Mix the stock into the marinade\r\nin the bowl and stir well. Pour the stock\r\nover the rice and beans, then put the\r\nchicken drumsticks and the mango\r\npieces on top. Cover the tray tightly\r\nwith foil and bake for 30 mins.","Take the tray out of the oven and\r\nremove the foil. Increase the temperature to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Spoon the\r\nmango chutney over the drumsticks\r\nand return to the oven, uncovered, for\r\n35-40 mins, to brown the chicken pieces\r\nand allow the rice to absorb all the liquid.\r\nBefore serving, fluff up the rice a little\r\nwith a fork and scatter with the coriander\r\nleaves. Serve with lime wedges and extra\r\nmango chutney, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7151,7151,'en','Simple coconut & bean soup','This vegetarian meal in a bowl shows how something delicious can be made from mostly storecupboard ingredients','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","½ bunch spring onions, whites and greens separated and sliced","1 red pepper, diced","1 Scotch bonnet chilli, deseeded and pounded to a paste","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 tsp dried thyme","1 tsp medium curry powder","1 tsp allspice","3 plum tomatoes, chopped","1 vegetable stock cube","410g can kidney beans, rinsed and drained","410g can pinto beans, rinsed and drained","410g can black-eyed beans, rinsed and drained","2 x 400g cans coconut milk","juice 2 limes"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan.\r\nSizzle the spring onion whites,\r\npepper, chilli paste and garlic for\r\n5-8 mins until soft and fragrant.\r\nAdd the thyme, curry powder and\r\nspices, then cook for 1 min more,\r\nStir in the tomatoes, then cook for\r\n2 mins to soften slightly.","Crumble in the stock cube, then\r\ntip in all the beans and the coconut\r\nmilk. Simmer for 10 mins. Turn off\r\nthe heat and stir in most of the\r\nspring onion greens, the lime juice\r\nand some seasoning. Ladle into\r\nbowls and scatter with remaining\r\nspring onions just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:19:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7153,7153,'en','Reggae reggae nachos','These nachos are a great crowd-pleaser, perfect for sharing with friends over a cocktail','["2 tsp olive oil","1 red onion, diced","½ Scotch bonnet chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","½ x 295g bottle Levi Roots Love Apple Tomato sauce or tomato sauce with a good splash Tabasco","½ tsp allspice","2 x 200g bags tortilla chips","200g jar sliced jalapeno chillies","2 x 125g balls mozzarella, torn","small handful coriander, chopped","230g tub fresh guacamole","½ x 300ml pot soured cream"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nHeat the oil in a frying pan, then\r\nsoften the onion and chilli for a few\r\nmins. Stir in the tomatoes, tomato\r\nsauce and allspice. Bubble for 1 min,\r\nthen remove from the heat.","Take a large ovenproof dish or\r\nplate and pile on the tortilla chips.\r\nCover with the tomato sauce, then\r\nsprinkle with the sliced jalapeños\r\nand mozzarella.","Place in oven for about 15 mins\r\nuntil cheese is melted. Scatter with\r\ncoriander. Serve with guacamole\r\nand soured cream on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:19:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7155,7155,'en','Sweet & sour chicken','Try an authentic version of this classic Chinese takeaway dish, with natural sweetness and a warm chilli flavour to spice things up','["sunflower or vegetable oil , for frying","100ml soda water , chilled","140g self-raising flour","25g cornflour","4 skinless, boneless chicken breasts , cut into chunks","spring onions , finely shredded, to serve","1 red pepper , deseeded and chopped into chunks","3 red chillies , 1 cut into chunks, 2 halved and deseeded","425g can pineapple chunks, drained and juice reserved","4 star anise","50g tamarind paste","100g caster sugar","100ml rice wine vinegar or Chinese vinegar"]','["For the sauce, put the red pepper, chunks of chilli and pineapple juice in a pan and bring to the boil. Cover and cook for 10 mins, then purée in a food processor.","Return to the pan with the pineapple chunks, chilli halves, star anise, tamarind, sugar and vinegar. Gently simmer for 20-30 mins until reduced and sticky. Keep warm, or reheat to serve.","Fill a large pan 1cm deep with oil and heat until shimmering. Whisk the soda water and 100ml cold water into the self-raising flour with a little salt. Stir the batter well.","Tip the cornflour onto a plate, line a tray with kitchen paper and turn on the oven to low. Dust the chicken with cornflour, then dip into the batter.","One at a time, lower into the hot oil (about 5-6 every batch). Turn up the heat to keep the chicken frying, if needed, and cook for 5-6 mins, turning once.","When cooked, drain on the tray, and keep warm in the oven. Repeat with the remaining chicken.","Stack onto a plate with the warm sauce on the side, and scatter with shredded spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:19:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7157,7157,'en','Kung pao sauce','Make this sauce that hails from Sichuan, China. Spicy-sweet and tangy with a hint of numbing spice from the Sichuan peppercorns, it’s delicious paired with chicken or prawns','["1 tbsp cornflour","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 tbsp garlic , finely chopped","1 tbsp ginger , grated","1 red chilli , deseeded and finely chopped","½ tsp Sichuan peppercorns , toasted and ground","2 dried chilli peppers ‘chao tian jiao’","1 tsp chilli bean sauce","1 tbsp hoisin sauce","1 tbsp tomato ketchup","2 tbsp light soy sauce","1 tbsp Chinkiang black rice vinegar","200ml hot vegetable or chicken stock"]','["Mix the cornflour with 2 tbsp water in a bowl and set aside. Heat a wok over medium heat. Once hot, add the oil, then mix in the garlic, ginger, chilli, Sichuan peppercorns and dried chillis. Fry for a few seconds before stirring in the chilli bean sauce, hoisin and ketchup. Once mixed in, pour in the soy sauce, vinegar and stock. Bring to the boil then drizzle in the cornflour mixture and stir well. Remove from the heat and pour into a heatproof bowl. Leave to cool then refrigerate until ready to use. Will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:19:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7159,7159,'en','Bang bang sauce','Use this classic sweet and spicy Chinese sauce to fold into chicken noodles or your favourite Chinese dishes. It works well with prawns, fried veg or tofu','["1 garlic clove , grated","1 tbsp ginger , grated","1 large red chilli , deseeded and finely chopped","1 large pinch ground Sichuan peppercorns","2 tbsp crunchy peanut butter","½ tsp dark soy sauce","2 tbsp low-sodium light soy sauce","2 tbsp black rice vinegar","1 tbsp toasted sesame oil","2 tbsp golden syrup"]','["Mix all the ingredients in a large jug and stir. Pour in 80ml hot water and whisk well to combine. Season to taste, adding a splash more sugar or soy sauce if needed. Use to dress chicken, prawns, vegetables or tofu."]','2026-01-10 12:19:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7161,7161,'en','Tanghulu','Try this classic Chinese dessert of hawthorn berries or fruit dipped in sugar. It’s crunchy, juicy and easy to make','["300g strawberries , hulled","150g grapes , removed from vines","350g white granulated sugar","18cm or shorter bamboo skewers"]','["Wash the fruit and pat dry thoroughly. Thread onto the skewer, alternating strawberries and grapes, with a grape either end. Repeat with the remaining fruit and set aside.","Pour some cold water and ice into a heatproof bowl and lightly oil a plate or tray with a neutral oil (such as sunflower) and set to one side. Tip the sugar into a large saucepan with 700ml water. Slowly bring to a boil over medium low heat, 5-6 mins, swirling the pan around to ensure the sugar melts evenly, but do not stir. Once melted, let it bubble for 20-25 mins, until the syrup has thickened and reduced. To test, dip a bare skewer into the syrup and plunge it immediately into the iced water, it if hardens and cracks – it’s ready.","Dip the prepared fruit skewers into the syrup using tongs, then immediately into the ice water until the outer shell hardens. Transfer to a lightly oiled plate or tray. Be sure to replenish the ice once melted. Repeat with the remaining skewers. If the sugar syrup starts to harden in the pan, gently reheat it again – the trick is to work quickly."]','2026-01-10 12:19:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7163,7163,'en','Chinese-style hotpot','Fill a cooking pot with broth, spiced with Sichuan pepper and chilli, then invites guests to poach their choice of ingredients in it – prawns, steak, tofu and chicken all work well','["300g tiger prawns , peeled and deveined, head and tail left on","250g beef sirloin , excess fat removed and thinly sliced","300g smoked tofu , drained and cut into 1 inch cubes","300g pork fillet , sinew removed, thinly sliced","4 skinless, boneless chicken thighs , sliced to strips","300g assorted seafood (we used scallops, fish balls and squid rings)","400g assorted vegetables (we used pak choi, Chinese cabbage, long-stem broccoli, carrots and red peppers), chopped","300g assorted mushrooms (we used oyster, chestnut, button, shiitake and wood ear fungus), halved or torn into large pieces","200g bean curd skin","400g assorted noodles (we used mung bean, vermicelli rice noodles, egg noodles)","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","3-4 dried long ‘chao tian jiao’ chillies","30g Sichuan peppercorns","1 tbsp chilli bean sauce","1.7l chicken or vegetable stock , hot","6 dried Chinese mushrooms","1 star anise","small handful of dried tangerine peel (optional)","50ml chilli oil","5cm piece ginger , peeled and sliced","½ Chinese cabbage , washed, leaves separated, sliced into 2.5cm thick pieces","3 spring onions , sliced at an angle","2 tbsp low-sodium light soy sauce","1 tbsp satay sauce","1 tbsp black rice vinegar","1 tsp toasted sesame oil","1 tsp garlic , crushed","1 tsp ginger , grated","1 tbsp coriander , finely chopped","2 spring onions , finely sliced","1 egg yolk (optional)","1 tsp toasted white sesame seeds","1 tsp garlic , crushed","2 spring onions , finely chopped","2 tbsp low-sodium light soy sauce","2 tbsp black rice vinegar","1 tbsp toasted sesame oil"]','["To make the soup base, heat a large 2-litre wok or a deep, wide saucepan, over high heat and add the oil. Add the chillies and Sichuan peppercorns and toss for 5 seconds until fragrant.","Add the chilli bean sauce and pour in the stock. Add the dried Chinese mushrooms and star anise, dried tangerine peel (if using), then pour in the chilli oil, add the ginger and bring to the boil. Tip in the Chinese cabbage and boil for 2 mins before stirring in the spring onions.","Mix together the ingredients for both sauces in separate bowls and set aside.","Set up an electric induction hob in the centre of your dining table and surround it with plates of the your choice of the raw ingredients. Put the wok full of broth to simmer on the hob.","Each person can add their ingredients to cook in the broth and use a wired metal spoon to fish them out. Cook seafood, chicken and pork until completely opaque, and vegetables can be cooked to taste. Serve with the dipping sauces."]','2026-01-10 12:19:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7165,7165,'en','Golden egg & onion fried rice','The golden hue of the scrambled egg and charred onion in this dish symbolises wealth for the Lunar New Year. Top with crispy chilli oil for extra flavour','["300g cooked long-grain rice","2 tbsp toasted sesame oil","1 red chilli , deseeded and finely chopped","3 tbsp light soy sauce","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","3 eggs , beaten","1 small onion , roughly chopped","½ tsp dark soy sauce","pinch of ground white pepper","1 spring onion , finely sliced","1 tsp crispy chilli oil , to serve (optional)"]','["Tip the cooked rice into a bowl and stir through 1 tbsp of the sesame oil. Put the chilli in a small bowl and stir through 2 tbsp of the light soy sauce.","Heat a wok over a high heat and add half the rapeseed oil. Add a pinch of salt then pour in the eggs, stirring quickly to scramble for around 30 secs. Remove using a slotted spoon and set aside.","Return the wok to the heat and add the remaining rapeseed oil, heat it for 20 secs. Add the onion and stir constantly for just less than a minute until golden. Mix in the rice until it has broken down. Season with dark soy sauce and toss well. Add the scrambled egg pieces back into the wok and stir through. Pour in the remaining light soy sauce, sesame oil and the white pepper. Sprinkle over the spring onions. To serve, garnish with the dressed red chilli and crispy chilli oil, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7167,7167,'en','Egg foo yung','Enjoy a version of Chinese scrambled eggs. It takes just 10 minutes to make, and you can add your choice of protein – prawns, chicken, tofu or char siu pork','["2 tbsp groundnut oil","150g protein of choice, such as raw king prawns (de-shelled and de-veined) or cooked chicken, cooked char siu pork or pre-fried tofu, cut into bite-sized pieces","1 small white onion, cut into strips","40g sliced mushrooms","40g peas","¼ tsp white pepper","4 eggs, whisked"]','["Heat awokover a medium-high heat. Once hot, pour in the oil, then add your protein of choice and spread it out across the bottom of the wok. When it begins to brown, add the sliced onion and continue to cook for 1-2 mins, stirring regularly, to soften slightly. Tip in the mushrooms and stir.","When the mushrooms have started to soften, add the peas along with the white pepper and ½ tsp salt. Stir-fry for 1 min, then add thewhiskedeggs. Try not to stir the eggs – instead, pick up the wok and swirl the eggs around the rest of the ingredients. Once they begin to set, slowly fold into the rest of the dish. Remove from the heat as soon as the eggs have nearly cooked all the way through."]','2026-01-10 12:19:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7169,7169,'en','Pineapple fried rice','Add chunks of fresh pineapple to fried rice to transform it into something special. Serve on its own for a family dinner, or as part of a Chinese banquet','["1½ tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","2 eggs, beaten","2 garlic cloves, crushed","small bunch of spring onions, chopped","1⁄2 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","400g cooked long-grain rice","85g frozen peas","2 tsp sesame oil","2 tbsp low-salt soy sauce","400g fresh pineapple, roughly chopped into chunks (about 1⁄2 medium pineapple)"]','["1 Heat 1 tbsp oil in a wok. Add the eggs, swirling them up the sides, to make a thin omelette. Once cooked through, roll the omelette onto a chopping board and cut into ribbons.","Heat the remaining oil. Add the garlic, onions and five-spice. Stir-fry until sizzling, then add the rice (if using pouches, squeeze them first, to separate the grains), peas, sesame oil and soy. Cook over a high heat until the rice is hot, then stir through the pineapple and omelette ribbons."]','2026-01-10 12:19:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7171,7171,'en','Beef with mangetout & cashews','Fire up your wok to make this speedy Chinese beef with mangetout and cashew nuts. A tasty dish for the whole family, it takes just 15 minutes to make','["50g unsalted cashew nuts","1 tsp cornflour","1½ tbsp low-salt soy sauce","4 tbsp oyster sauce","1 tbsp rice vinegar","1 tbsp honey","1 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","280g rump steak, thinly sliced","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and cut into matchsticks"]','["Toast the cashews in a dry wok or frying pan, tossing, until browned. Tip onto a plate and set aside. Mix the cornflour with the soy sauce to make a paste, then add the oyster sauce, vinegar and honey. When you’re ready to cook, have all the ingredients prepared and close to hand – it will only take 5 mins.","Heat the wok until very hot. Add the oil, swirl it around to cover the base of the pan, then use tongs to place the steak pieces in the wok in a single layer. Cook without turning for 30 seconds-1 min, until a dark crust starts to form on the meat. Add the ginger and garlic, give everything a quick stir, then add the mangetout and the sauce. Cook for another 30 secs-1 min until the beef is just cooked through and the sauce is thick and glossy. Sprinkle over the cashews and serve with rice or noodles."]','2026-01-10 12:19:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7173,7173,'en','Salt & pepper tofu','Use both types of peppercorns for our salt & pepper tofu if you can, for a tongue-tingling kick and a spicy warmth. The dish is great for a Chinese banquet','["396g pack firm tofu","2 tbsp cornflour","1 tsp Sichuan or black peppercorns (or a mixture of the two), ground to a powder","2 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","2 red peppers, sliced","¼ broccoli head, cut into very small florets","100g beansprouts","2 tsp low-salt soy sauce","sesame oil, for drizzling","handful of coriander, leaves picked"]','["Drain the tofu, wrap loosely in kitchen paper and put on a plate. Rest a chopping board on top. If you’re using a light chopping board, weigh it down with a couple of cans – a heavier chopping board will be sufficient on its own. Leave for 10-20 mins until the cloth feels wet from the excess liquid. Pressing the tofu like this helps to give it a firmer texture once cooked.","Cut the tofu in half down the centre like a book. Cut each piece into four triangles, as you would a piece of toast, then in half again to give you 16 pieces in total. Mix the cornflour, ground pepper and 1 tsp flaky sea salt on a plate. Gently turn each piece of tofu in the cornflour mix to coat.","Heat 1 tbsp oil in a wok. Stir-fry the peppers and broccoli for a few minutes, to soften a little. Add the beansprouts and soy sauce. Cook for another 1-2 mins, making sure the veg still has a nice crunch. Drizzle with a little sesame oil.","Heat the remaining sunflower oil in a large non-stick frying pan and fry the coated tofu for 5 mins on each side until crisp. Serve on top of the vegetables, scattered with the coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:19:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7175,7175,'en','Honey, sesame & orange king prawns','Enjoy our honey, sesame and orange king prawns as part of a Chinese feast the whole family will love. Top with spring onions and serve with rice','["2 tsp sesame oil","1 large orange, zested and juiced","3 tbsp honey","2 tbsp low-salt soy sauce","1 tbsp rice vinegar","3 tbsp cornflour","2 tbsp sesame seeds","generous pinch of Chinese five-spice powder","300g raw king prawns","3 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","1 garlic clove, thinly sliced","2 spring onions, sliced","200g long-grain rice, cooked, to serve"]','["Mix the oil, orange zest and juice, honey, soy and vinegar in a bowl, then combine the cornflour, sesame seeds, five-spice and a pinch of salt in another bowl. Run a small knife down the back of each prawn, so they butterfly out as they cook, helping more sauce stick to them.","Toss the prawns through the cornflour mixture. Heat the oil in a large wok or frying pan. When it’s very hot, add the garlic. Sizzle for 10 secs, but don’t let it brown. Add the prawns and any flour and seeds left in the bowl. Stir-fry over a high heat for a few minutes, until the prawns are pink and the sesame seeds are golden. Tip the prawns onto a plate and pour the sauce mixture into the wok. Bubble for a few minutes until thickened. Add the prawns back to the wok and stir to coat in the sauce. Heat through for another 30 seconds. Top with spring onions and serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7177,7177,'en','White chocolate fortune cookies','Bake these homemade fortune cookies for New Year''s Eve. While they require a bit of effort, they''ll keep keen cooks in the family entertained, and the results are seriously impressive','["2 egg whites","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 tbsp grapeseed oil","100g plain flour","2 tsp cornflour","100g golden caster sugar","150g white chocolate, chopped","sprinkles, to decorate"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a large baking sheet with a silicone baking sheet. Write fortunes on pieces of white paper measuring 6cm long by 1cm wide.","Using an electric whisk, whisk the egg whites, vanilla and oil with ½ tbsp cold water until frothy, about 30 seconds. Put the flour, cornflour, sugar and a good pinch of salt in a bowl, then tip into a sieve and sift into the egg white mixture. Whisk to a smooth batter and chill for 1 hr.","Put ½ tbsp of mixture onto the prepared baking sheet. Using a small palette knife, push the mixture out into a thin 8cm circle. Repeat with another ½ tbsp of the mixture to make two cookies, spacing them well apart as they will spread. Bake two cookies at a time, as you will need to shape them while they are hot. Bake for 8 mins until the edges turn golden.","Using a palette knife, lift the cookies one at a time onto a board, flipping them over. Put a fortune in the middle of the circle, then fold the circle in half, pinching the two edges together to seal. Lift the cookie onto the rim of a mug or pan and very gently pull the two corners down to shape. Hold for 10 seconds, then transfer the cookies to muffin tins so that they hold their shape while cooling and setting. Repeat with the remaining cookie mixture.","Melt the white chocolate in the microwave or in a bowl set over a pan of simmering water. Tip the sprinkles into small, deep bowls. Dip the two ends of each cookie into the chocolate, shake off any excess, then dip into the sprinkles. Leave to dry on a board. Will keep for three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:19:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7179,7179,'en','Ginger & chilli oil','We’ve added chilli to this traditional accompaniment for a little more heat. Serve with some stir-fried Chinese veg and our one-pot crystal chicken','["white parts of one bunch spring onions","a large piece of ginger","whole red chilli","3 tbsp vegetable oil"]','["Finely chop the spring onions, a large piece of ginger and a whole red chilli and tip into a small dish. Heat 3 tbsp vegetable oil until smoking hot, then pour into the dish and leave to sizzle. Can be made a day ahead covered with cling film."]','2026-01-10 12:19:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7181,7181,'en','Hot & sour pork & pepper stir-fry','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA fresh, simple dish with a refreshing hint of lime, and it’s superhealthy too – so what’s not to love?','["100g Thai jasmine rice","1 tbsp sesame seeds","1 tsp sunflower oil","250g pork fillet, cut into finger-width strips","1 red and 1 yellow pepper, deseeded and sliced","2 tsp cornflour","2 tsp soy sauce","juice 1 lime","2 tbsp clear honey","½ red chilli, sliced"]','["Place the rice in a saucepan with 300ml boiling water. Bring to the boil, stir once, cover with a lid and reduce the heat to low. Cook for 15 mins, by which time the rice should have absorbed all the liquid and be perfectly cooked. Dry-fry the sesame seeds until toasted golden, then tip into a small bowl and set aside.","Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan or wok, add the pork and peppers and stir-fry for 5-6 mins over a high heat until the pork is lightly browned and cooked through. Mix the cornflour and soy sauce together in a bowl, then add the lime juice, honey, chilli and sesame seeds, plus 6 tbsp cold water. Pour into the wok and cook until the sauce has slightly thickened, tossing the pan to coat the pork and peppers. Serve with the rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7183,7183,'en','Stir-fried pork with ginger & honey','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis healthy noodle dish is deliciously low-fat with a great mix of Asian flavours- the perfect midweek supper','["2 nests medium egg noodle","2 tsp cornflour","2 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp honey","1 tbsp sunflower oil","250g/9oz pork tenderloin, cut into bite-sized pieces","thumb-sized piece ginger, finely chopped","2 garlic clove, finely chopped","1 green pepper, deseeded and sliced","100g mange tout","1 tsp sesame seed"]','["Bring a pan of salted water to the boil and cook the noodles following pack instructions. Meanwhile, mix the cornflour with 1 tbsp water, then stir in the soy sauce and honey, and set aside.","Heat the oil in a wok over a high heat. Add the pork and cook for 2 mins until browned all over. Add the ginger, garlic, pepper and mangetout, and cook for a further 2 mins. Reduce the heat, then add the soy and honey mixture, stirring and cooking until the sauce bubbles and thickens. Divide the drained noodles between 2 bowls. Top with the pork and vegetables, and finish with a sprinkling of sesame seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:19:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7185,7185,'en','Chinese-style kale','Give a good ol’ British fave an Asian edge with a few simple shakes of the right sauces','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 large garlic clove, sliced","200g bag kale","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp oyster sauce"]','["Heat the oil in a large wok or frying pan, then tip in the garlic and cook for a few secs. Throw in the kale and toss around the pan to coat in the garlicky oil.","Pour over 100ml boiling water and cook for 7 mins more until the kale has wilted and is cooked through.","Stir in the soy and oyster sauces and heat through to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7187,7187,'en','Red braised ginger pork belly with pickled chillies','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyMalty Chinese black vinegar makes a great base for a slow-cooked one-pot with ginger, chilli and a thrifty cut of meat','["2½ kg pork belly, rind removed, cut into 5cm pieces","1 tbsp dark soy sauce","200ml Shaohsing rice wine","2 tbsp vegetable oil","2 garlic clove, thinly sliced","thumb-sized piece ginger, cut into matchsticks","pinch of chilli flakes","100ml Chinese black vinegar (available from Waitrose)","140g soft brown sugar","700ml vegetable stock","toasted sesame seeds","sliced spring onions","2 red chilli, sliced and soaked in rice wine vinegar for 1 hr, then drained","steamed white rice"]','["Toss the pork with the soy and 1 tbsp of the rice wine. Leave for 1 hr or, even better, overnight in the fridge.","Heat some of the oil in a medium heavy-based saucepan. Brown the meat, in batches, on both sides and set aside. Add a little more oil and cook the garlic, ginger and chilli for 2-3 mins until golden.","Pour the vinegar, remaining rice wine, sugar and stock into the pan and bring to the boil. Add the pork, then turn down the heat, cover and simmer for 2 hrs or until the meat is tender. For the final 30 mins, remove the lid, increase the heat and let the liquid reduce until thick and syrupy. Serve scattered with the sesame seeds, spring onions and sliced chillies, with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7189,7189,'en','Hoisin pork with garlic & ginger greens','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyMarinate lean loin steaks with Chinese sauce then serve with plenty of bok choi cabbage for a healthy  supper','["500g pork loin steak, cut into 2cm-thick slices","4 tbsp hoisin sauce","1 tbsp light soy sauce, plus a dash","350g thin-stemmed broccoli","1 tbsp sunflower oil","2 garlic clove, thinly sliced","5cm-piece ginger, shredded","1 bunch spring onion, halved lengthways","350g bok choi, halved lengthways","rice or noodles, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the pork, hoisin and soy sauce in a bowl and allow to stand for 10 mins. Heat the grill to high, shake off any excess sauce, then lay the pork on a tray. Grill for 5 mins, turning halfway, until cooked through. Remove and leave to rest in a warm place for 5 mins.","Meanwhile, put the broccoli in a microwave-safe bowl with 4 tbsp water, cover with cling film, then microwave on High for 3 mins. Heat the oil in a wok, add the garlic and ginger, and stir-fry for 1 min. Add the spring onions and bok choi, then stir-fry for a further 2 mins. Tip in the broccoli with a dash of soy sauce and stir-fry for 1-2 mins more until the veg is warmed through. Serve the pork with the greens, a drizzle of any resting pork juices and rice or noodles, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7191,7191,'en','Oriental pork balls in hoisin broth','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyLow in calories and cheap to make, these Chinese flavoured meatballs are served in a clear and nourishing broth with plenty of veg','["500g pack lean pork mince","2 tbsp soy sauce","2 tbsp cornflour","1 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","225g can water chestnut, drained, half finely chopped, half sliced","500ml chicken stock","3 tbsp hoisin sauce","thumb-sized piece ginger, shredded","2 large carrot, shaved into strips with a potato peeler","8 Chinese leaves, thick part sliced, leaves shredded","300g pack beansprout","bunch spring onions, cut into lengths, plus a few tops chopped to serve"]','["Tip the mince into a bowl with the soy, cornflour, five-spice, chopped water chestnuts and some black pepper. Work everything together, then shape into 12 meatballs.","Pour the stock into a wide, deep pan and stir in the hoisin and ginger. Add the meatballs, then cover and poach for 5 mins. Drop in the carrots, Chinese leaves, beansprouts, spring onions and sliced chestnuts, then put on the lid and simmer for 5 mins. Ladle into bowls, then serve scattered with spring onion tops."]','2026-01-10 12:19:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7193,7193,'en','Pork, green bean & oyster stir-fry','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA rich Asian dish of noodles or rice that’s ready in 20 minutes – a wholesome midweek family supper','["1 tbsp lime juice","1 tbsp chilli bean paste or chilli sauce","75ml oyster sauce","1 tsp soy sauce","2 tbsp vegetable oil","400g pork fillet, cut into thin slices","2 garlic clove, chopped","1 red onion, cut into chunky pieces","140g green bean, halved","steamed rice or noodle, to serve"]','["In a small bowl, mix together the lime juice, chilli bean paste, oyster sauce and half the soy sauce. Set aside. Heat a large wok with 1 tbsp of the oil. Season the pork and toss with the remaining soy sauce. Sear the meat quickly, then remove from the pan.","Add the remaining oil and stir-fry the garlic, onion and beans for 2 mins. Return the meat to the pan with the sauce and stir-fry for another 3 mins, until the sauce has thickened. Serve with steamed rice or noodles."]','2026-01-10 12:19:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7195,7195,'en','Chinese braised pork with double spring onions','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyUse spring onions as a vegetable in their own right in this slow-cooked pork dish','["4 pieces pork osso buco (about 850kg/1lb 14oz) or the equivalent of pork shoulder","1 tbsp olive oil","250ml Shaohsing rice wine or dry sherry","100g ginger, finely sliced","2 garlic cloves, sliced","12 spring onions, 8 fat ones and 4 thinner ones","1 dried red chilli (look for Kashmiri chillies for a good flavour)","500ml chicken or vegetable stock","1 tbsp miso paste (optional)","2 tbsp soy sauce","steamed rice and bok choi, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nBrown the pork on both sides in the oil,\r\nthen transfer it to a large casserole dish.\r\nDeglaze the pan you used for browning\r\nwith the rice wine or Sherry and add it to\r\nthe casserole. Add the ginger and garlic.\r\nTrim the ends off the 8 fat spring onions\r\nand add these to the pan whole along\r\nwith the chilli, stock, miso paste (if using)\r\nand soy sauce. Bring everything to a\r\nsimmer, then cover and put the casserole\r\nin the oven for 2 hrs.","Remove the lid from the casserole and\r\ncook for a further 20 mins. Chop the\r\n4 thinner spring onions and add them to\r\nthe casserole just before serving with\r\nsteamed rice and bok choi."]','2026-01-10 12:19:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7198,7198,'en','Braised pork with plums','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyMeltingly tender meat in a spicy, fruity sauce, this meal is guaranteed to impress','["about 1.6kg/3lb 8oz pork shoulder","5 tbsp rice wine","5 tbsp light soy sauce for flavour, 1 tbsp dark for colour","generous thumb-size piece fresh root ginger","5 garlic cloves","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","2 tbsp vegetable oil","bunch spring onions, finely sliced","2 star anise","1 ½ tsp five-spice powder","1 cinnamon stick","2 tbsp sugar, any type","1 tbsp tomato purée","500ml chicken stock","6 ripe plums, halved and stoned"]','["Cut the pork into big pieces about the length of your thumb and twice as wide. Put into a bowl or food bag, and add the wine, soy sauces, half the ginger, half the garlic and half the chilli. Marinate for at least 1 hr or up to 24 hrs.","Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3, then heat the oil in a large casserole. Tip in half the spring onions, remaining ginger and garlic, the star anise, five-spice powder and cinnamon. Fry gently until fragrant and soft. Stir in the sugar, turn up the heat, then lift the pork from the marinade and turn in the oniony mix for about 3 mins until the meat is just sealed but not browned. Tip in the marinade, tomato purée and stock, give it a stir, cover, then braise in the oven for 2 hrs.","After the first hr is up, add the plums to the pan. Take the lid off and carry on the cooking, uncovered. The meat should be completely tender, turning golden brown where it breaks the surface of the sauce. Spoon off any excess fat from the surface, then scoop the meat and plums carefully from the pan with a slotted spoon. Turn up the heat and boil the sauce for 5-10 mins until reduced and slightly syrupy. Return everything to the pan, gently warm through, then scatter the rest of the spring onions over the top to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7200,7200,'en','Crisp Chinese pork','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyBelly is the cheapest pork roasting joint and, as it’s rich, a little goes a long way, making it perfect for Sundays and dinner parties','["1.3kg piece boned pork belly, skin on and scored, ask the butcher for the thin end","2 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","4 tbsp soy sauce (we used Kikkoman)","small knob fresh root ginger, grated","1 tbsp Thai sweet chilli sauce","1 spring onion, finely chopped"]','["Rub the pork with the five-spice and 2 tsp sea salt then leave, uncovered, in the fridge for at least 2 hrs, but preferably overnight. When ready to cook, heat oven to its maximum setting. Lay the pork on a rack over a roasting tin, making sure the skin is exposed. Roast for 10 mins before turning down the heat to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4, then leave to cook for a further 1½ hrs. Have a look at the pork – if the skin isn’t crisp, turn up the heat to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7, then cook for another 30 mins until crisp. Leave to rest on a board for at least 10 mins.","To make the dipping sauce, mix all the ingredients together with 2 tbsp water. Cut the pork into small pieces, then serve with the sauce, plus boiled rice and steamed greens, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7202,7202,'en','Steamed pork & prawn wontons','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyLow fat but so impressive – you can find the wrappers in freezer cabinets of Asian food stores or speciality food halls','["175g minced pork","85g peeled prawn, thawed if frozen and finely chopped","2 spring onion, chopped small","2 fat garlic clove, crushed","2 tsp grated root ginger or purée","2 tbsp oyster sauce","1 tsp sesame oil","5 water chestnut (from a can), drained and finely chopped","about 36 wonton wrappers, 9cm square, thawed if frozen","large lettuce leaves, or baking parchment, for steaming","2 tbp soy sauce","2 tbsp dry sherry","2 tsp grated fresh root ginger, or purée","shreds of spring onion or sesame seeds, to garnish"]','["Mix together the pork, prawns, spring onions, garlic, ginger, oyster sauce, oil and water chestnuts.","Peel off a wonton wrapper and, with a pastry brush, lightly brush round the outside with cold water. Place 1 tsp of mixture in the centre and scrunch up into a pouch, squeezing to seal. Do not overfill. Repeat until you have around 35-40. (These can be chilled for up to 1 hr on a tray lined with baking parchment.)","For the sauce, mix together the soy sauce, sherry and ginger in a small bowl. To steam, bring a large pan of water to the boil. Line a bamboo or metal steaming basket with lettuce leaves to fit.","Arrange half the pouches in the basket (without them touching), cover and steam for 5 mins. Remove with tongs to a platter and steam the rest – check the water level. Serve, sprinkled with spring onion or sesame seeds, with the bowl of sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:19:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7204,7204,'en','Stir-fried beef with oyster sauce','Marinate slices of lean beef steak then pan-fry with chunks of red pepper and a savoury sauce in this classic Chinese dish','["450g lean beef steak","1 tbsp light soy sauce","2 tsp sesame oil","1 tbsp Shaoxing rice wine or dry Sherry","2 tsp cornflour","3 tbsp groundnut oil","1 red pepper, cut into chunky dice","1 green pepper, cut into chunky dice","3 tbsp oyster sauce","2 spring onions, finely shredded, to garnish"]','["Cut the beef into slices 5cm long and 5mm thick, cutting against the grain of the meat. Put them in a bowl. Mix in the soy sauce, sesame oil, rice wine or Sherry and cornflour. Leave to marinate for 20 mins.","Heat a wok until it is very hot, then add the groundnut oil. When it is slightly smoking, add the beef slices and stir-fry for 5 mins or until lightly browned. Remove the meat from the wok and drain well in a colander set inside a bowl. Discard the drained oil.","Wipe the wok clean and reheat it over a high heat. Add the peppers, and cook for 3-4 mins or until softened. Add the oyster sauce and bring it to a simmer. Return the drained beef slices to the wok and toss them thoroughly with the oyster sauce. Turn the mixture on to a serving platter, top with the spring onions and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:19:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7206,7206,'en','Chow mein','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA classic Chinese dish of stir-fried egg noodles with shredded chicken breast – experiment with different fish, meat, or vegetables','["225g dried or fresh egg noodles","1 tbsp sesame oil, plus 1 tsp","100g boneless, skinless chicken breasts, cut into fine shreds","2½  tbsp groundnut oil","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","50g mangetout, finely shredded","50g Parma ham or cooked ham, finely shredded","2 tsp light soy sauce","2 tsp dark soy sauce","1 tbsp Shaoxing rice wine or dry Sherry","½  tsp freshly ground white pepper","½  tsp golden caster sugar","2 spring onions, finely chopped","2 tsp light soy sauce","2 tsp Shaoxing rice wine or dry Sherry","1 tsp sesame oil","½  tsp freshly ground white pepper"]','["Cook the noodles in a large pan of boiling water for 3-5 mins, then drain and put them in cold water. Drain thoroughly, toss them with 1 tbsp of the sesame oil and set aside.","Combine the chicken with all the marinade ingredients and ½ tsp salt, mix well and then leave to marinate for about 10 mins.","Heat a wok over a high heat. Add 1 tbsp of the groundnut oil and, when it is very hot and slightly smoking, add the chicken shreds. Stir-fry for about 2 mins and then transfer to a plate. Wipe the wok clean. Reheat the wok until it is very hot, then add the remaining groundnut oil. When the oil is slightly smoking, add the garlic and stir-fry for 10 secs. Then add the mangetout and ham, and stir-fry for about 1 min.","Add the noodles, soy sauces, rice wine or Sherry, pepper, sugar, spring onions and 1 tsp salt. Stir-fry for 2 mins. Return the chicken and any juices to the noodle mixture. Stir-fry for about 3-4 mins or until the chicken is cooked. Add 1 tsp sesame oil and give the mixture a few final stirs. Put on a warm platter and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:19:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7208,7208,'en','Spicy Sichuan-style prawns','Stir-fry shellfish with a spicy tomato, ginger and chilli bean sauce for a classic Chinese seafood dish','["1½  tbsp groundnut oil","2cm piece ginger, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, coarsely chopped","1 spring onion, finely chopped","450g raw prawns, shelled and de-veined","1 tbsp tomato purée","3 tsp chilli bean sauce","2 tsp Chinese black vinegar or cider vinegar","2 tsp golden caster sugar","2 tsp sesame oil","handful coriander leaves, to serve","sliced spring onion, to serve"]','["Heat a wok over a high heat. Add the groundnut oil and, when it is very hot and slightly smoking, add the ginger, garlic and spring onions. Stir-fry for 20 secs, then add the prawns. Stir-fry for about 1 min, then add all the sauce ingredients, along with ½ tsp salt and ½ tsp ground black pepper. Continue to stir-fry for another 3 mins over a high heat. Serve at once, scattered with the coriander and spring onion."]','2026-01-10 12:19:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7210,7210,'en','Cashew chicken','Tender pieces of chicken breast are stir-fried with crunchy, sweet cashew nuts in this classic Chinese dish','["450g boneless, skinless chicken breasts, cut into large chunks","1 egg white","1 tsp sesame oil","2 tsp cornflour","300ml groundnut oil or water, plus 2 tsp groundnut oil","100g cashew nuts","1 tbsp Shaoxing rice wine or dry Sherry","1 tbsp light soy sauce","1 shredded spring onion, to garnish"]','["Put the chicken in a bowl with the egg white, sesame oil, cornflour and 1 tsp salt, and mix well. Chill for 20 mins.","If you are using oil for velveting the chicken, heat a wok until very hot and then add the oil. When it is very hot, remove the wok from the heat and immediately add the chicken, stirring vigorously to prevent it sticking. After about 2 mins, when the chicken turns white, quickly drain it and all of the oil into a stainless steel colander set over a bowl. Discard the oil. If you are using water instead of oil, do exactly the same but bring the water to the boil in a saucepan before adding the chicken. It will take about 4 mins for the chicken to turn white in the water.","If you have used a wok, wipe it clean. Heat it until it is very hot, then add the 2 tsp of groundnut oil. Add the cashew nuts and stir-fry for 1 min. Add the rice wine or dry Sherry and soy sauce. Return the chicken to the wok and stir-fry for 2 mins. Scatter over the spring onions and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:19:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7212,7212,'en','Chinese braised beef with ginger','Slow cooking beef shin or brisket in Asian aromatic spices gives a melt-in-the-mouth main course that’s delicious with steamed rice and crisp stir-fried vegetables','["2 - 3 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","1¼kg beef shin or brisket, cut into very large chunks","2 onions","50g ginger","3 garlic cloves","small bunch coriander","2 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","6 whole star anise","1 tsp black peppercorn","100g dark brown muscovado sugar","50ml light soy sauce","50ml dark soy sauce","2 tbsp tomato purée","beef stock","thumb-sized chunk ginger, shredded into matchsticks","1 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","cooked jasmine rice"]','["Heat a little of the oil in a large flameproof dish. Add the beef chunks, in batches, and fry until browned. When each batch is browned, transfer the beef to another dish. Very roughly chop the onions, ginger, garlic and coriander stalks. Put in a food processor and whizz to a paste.","Wipe any oil out of the dish you browned the beef in. Add the paste with a good splash of water and gently fry, scraping up any beef bits, until the paste is fragrant and softened (add more water if the paste sticks). Stir in the five-spice, star anise and peppercorns, cook for 1 min, then add the sugar, soy sauces and tomato purée. Return the beef and any juices to the dish, then stir in enough stock to just about cover. Bring to a gentle simmer. Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Cover the dish, put in the oven and cook for 21?2 hrs until the beef is really tender.","Lift the beef out of the sauce into a dish, to keep warm. Boil the sauce until reduced by about half and thickened. Meanwhile, fry the ginger in the oil until golden and crispy. Return the beef to the sauce. serve the beef spooned over rice and scattered with the crispy ginger."]','2026-01-10 12:19:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7214,7214,'en','Wrap-your-own spring rolls','A superhealthy recipe that’s ideal for cooking with young children','["300g pack cooked rice noodles from the chiller cabinet (see tips)","about 400g/14oz mixed vegetables, thinly sliced and put in separate bowls, such as red peppers, beansprouts, carrots, shredded Chinese leaf cabbage, spring onions","140g cooked prawns","100g cooked chicken or duck, shredded","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","small piece ginger, finely chopped","splash light soy sauce","Chinese five-spice powder, for sprinkling","8-10 sheets of brik or filo pastry (see tips)","1 egg, beaten","sesame seeds, for sprinkling if you want","100g reduced salt and sugar ketchup","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","small piece ginger, grated","pinch of caster sugar"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Before you get the kids cooking, put the noodles, vegetables, prawns and chicken in individual bowls for everyone to help themselves. Wash hands, put aprons on, sit the kids down and give them their own mixing bowl and spoon. Let them choose which ingredients they want (noodles are essential) in their rolls and if they want to graze as they choose, that’s fine – all the ingredients are cooked or can be eaten raw. Add a bit of garlic and ginger, a tiny dash of soy and sprinkling of five-spice to each bowl and let them mix everything together.","Push the bowl aside and lay a sheet of pastry in front of each child. Ask them to spoon the filling down one side of each sheet then give them the beaten egg and a brush so they can brush around the edges. Then help them to roll them up neatly by folding both sides over the filling, then rolling them up.","Lift the spring rolls onto a baking tray, seam side down, brush with a little more egg and sprinkle with sesame seeds, if you want. Try to remember which child made which roll to save any arguments at the end! Bake the rolls for 20-25 mins or until golden.","While the rolls are in the oven, make the dipping sauce. Get the kids to mix all the ingredients together until the sugar has dissolved. When the spring rolls are golden and crisp, remove from the oven. Leave until cool enough to handle, cut into pieces for smaller kids, then let them eat, dipping the rolls into the sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:19:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7216,7216,'en','Prawn chow mein','This low-fat stir-fry recipe is packed with crunchy vegetables and tangy oyster sauce','["3 nests medium egg noodles","140g broccoli, chopped into small florets","140g baby corn, halved","1 tbsp olive oil","1 red pepper, sliced","300g prawns","3 tbsp tomato ketchup","2 tbsp oyster sauce"]','["Cook the noodles, broccoli and corn in boiling water for 3-4 mins, or until tender. Drain and set aside. Heat the oil in a large frying pan or wok and fry the pepper for 3 mins, until starting to soften.","Tip in the noodles and vegetables along with the prawns and toss together. Add the sauce ingredients and heat everything through for 2-3 mins, until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:19:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7218,7218,'en','Steamed sea bass with black bean sauce','Chinese meals don’t need to be eaten out of a takeaway carton – this special fish dish makes a smart dinner for two','["1 sea bass, head on, gutted","2cm piece ginger, thinly sliced","2 tbsp Shaohsing rice wine","cooked jasmine rice, to serve","1 tbsp groundnut oil","2 garlic cloves","2 tbsp grated ginger","2 tbsp fermented black beans, rinsed and crushed with the back of a spoon (or use 100g black bean sauce instead)","1 tbsp Shaohsing rice wine","3 tbsp toasted sesame oil","3 tbsp light soy sauce","2 spring onions, shredded","1 small handful coriander, leaves picked"]','["Wash the fish in cold running water.\r\nPat dry with kitchen paper, then slash\r\n3-4 slits into the skin on both sides.\r\nSeason all over with salt and ground\r\nwhite pepper. Place ginger slices in the\r\nslits of the fish and inside the cavity.","Place the fish on a plate that fits inside\r\nyour wok. In your wok place a pudding\r\nbowl upside down and pour water to\r\ncome halfway up. Place the wok on\r\nthe heat and bring the water to a boil.","Pour the rice wine over the fish, put\r\nthe plate onto the upside-down bowl and\r\nplace the lid of the wok on top. Steam on\r\nhigh heat for 8-9 mins, then leave to rest.","While the fish is cooking, make the\r\nblack bean sauce. Add the groundnut\r\noil to a hot wok or frying pan. When it\r\nstarts to smoke, add the garlic, ginger\r\nand beans (or use 100g ready-made\r\nblack bean sauce) and stir-fry for a few\r\nsecs. Add the rice wine, sesame oil and\r\nlight soy sauce, then bring to the bubble.","Carefully remove the fish (you can keep\r\nit on the plate that you cooked it on).\r\nGarnish with the spring onions and\r\ncoriander, then drizzle over the black\r\nbean sauce and serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7220,7220,'en','Salt & pepper prawns','Use Sichuan peppercorns to flavour shellfish with a celery-like taste, then create a Chinese-style chilli garlic dip','["2 tbsp cornflour","vegetable oil, for deep frying","24 large king prawns, peeled and deveined, with tails","pea shoots or baby salad leaves, to serve (optional)","1 tbsp Sichuan peppercorns","4 black peppercorns","2 tbsp sea salt flakes","large pinch of chilli flakes","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp chopped coriander leaves","1 small red chilli, finely chopped","2 tbsp caster sugar","juice 3 limes","1 tbsp fish sauce"]','["First, make the dipping sauce. Crush\r\nthe garlic, coriander and chilli using a\r\npestle and mortar. (If you don’t have\r\none, just finely chop.) Pound in the sugar\r\nuntil dissolved, then add the lime juice\r\nand fish sauce. It should taste sweet,\r\nsalty and spicy.","To make the spice mix, toast the\r\nSichuan and black peppercorns in a frying\r\npan over a medium heat for 1 min or until\r\nfragrant. Finely grind in a spice mill or\r\nusing a pestle and mortar, then add the\r\nsalt and chilli flakes and mix together.\r\nTransfer to a bowl.","Combine the spice mix with the\r\ncornflour. Heat 7.5cm of oil in a large wok\r\nor deep heavy-based saucepan. You can\r\ntest the temperature by frying a small\r\npiece of bread – it should sizzle instantly\r\nand take 20 secs to turn golden. Toss the\r\nprawns with the spice mix, shake off the\r\nexcess and deep-fry, in batches, for\r\n1-2 mins or until crisp at the edges and\r\nstarting to curl. Remove with a slotted\r\nspoon, drain on a baking tray lined with\r\nkitchen paper and keep warm while you\r\ncook the remaining prawns. Scatter over\r\nthe pea shoots or salad leaves, if you like,\r\nand serve with the dipping sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:19:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7222,7222,'en','Gunpowder chicken with dried red chillies & peanuts','This classic dish from the Chinese province of Sichuan isn’t as spicy if you remove the chilli seeds – complete with a sticky, sweet and rich sauce','["12 boneless, skinless chicken thighs (about 900g), cut into pieces","1 tbsp dark soy sauce","2 tbsp vegetable oil","15 whole dried bird''s-eye chillies","1 tsp Sichuan peppercorn, ground","bunch spring onions, cut into 2½ cm pieces","50g whole roasted peanuts","5 tbsp dark soy sauce","2 tbsp Shaohsing rice wine","4 tbsp Chinese black vinegar","4 tbsp chicken stock","1 tbsp caster sugar","1 tbsp cornflour, mixed into 1 tbsp water"]','["Marinate the chicken with the soy and\r\nleave to sit for 1 hr. If you don’t have time\r\nto marinate, don’t worry – but it does add\r\nextra flavour. Mix the sauce ingredients in\r\na small bowl and set aside.","Using a wok and a small amount of the\r\noil, sear the chicken in batches. When it’s\r\nall browned, remove from the pan and\r\nset aside. Snip the stems from the chillies\r\nand shake out the seeds. Add the\r\nremaining oil and cook the chillies for\r\n1 min, shaking the pan constantly to\r\nprevent them burning. Add the chicken\r\nback in with the peppercorns, spring\r\nonions and peanuts, then stir-fry for\r\n1 min more. Add the sauce and stir for\r\na few mins more until thickened."]','2026-01-10 12:19:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7224,7224,'en','Ginger sweet tofu with pak choi','If you thought tofu was bland, this is the recipe to convince you otherwise','["250g fresh firm tofu, drained","2 tbsp groundnut oil","1cm piece ginger, sliced","200g pak choi, leaves separated","1 tbsp Shaohsing rice wine","1 tbsp rice vinegar","½ tsp dried chilli flakes","cooked jasmine rice, to serve","1 tbsp grated ginger","1 tsp dark soy sauce","2 tbsp light soy sauce","1 tbsp brown sugar"]','["Gently prick a few holes in the tofu with\r\na toothpick (this will help the marinade to\r\nsoak into it, giving better flavour), then\r\ncut into bite-size cubes.","Mix the marinade ingredients together\r\nin a bowl and toss in the tofu pieces.\r\nSet aside to marinate for 10-15 mins.","Heat a wok over high heat and add half\r\nthe groundnut oil. When the oil starts to\r\nsmoke, add the ginger slices and stir-fry\r\nfor a few secs. Add the pak choy leaves\r\nand stir-fry for 1-2 mins. Add a small\r\nsplash of water to create some steam\r\nand cook for 2 mins more. When the\r\nleaves have wilted and the stems are\r\ncooked but still a little crunchy, season\r\nwith salt and transfer to a serving dish.","Rinse the wok under cold water, then\r\nreheat it and add the remaining oil. When\r\nit starts to smoke, add the tofu pieces\r\n(retaining the marinade liquid) and stir-fry\r\nfor 5-10 mins. Take care not to break up\r\nthe tofu as you toss it to get it browned\r\nevenly on all sides. Season with the rice\r\nwine and rice vinegar. Add the remaining\r\nmarinade liquid, bring to the bubble and\r\nlet the liquid reduce. Sprinkle over the\r\nchilli flakes and toss well. Spoon onto\r\nthe pak choy and serve immediately\r\nwith jasmine rice, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7226,7226,'en','Festive golden five-spice chicken','Chinese five-spice gives this chicken a wonderfullywarm, aromatic flavour that adults andchildren will love','["8 chicken thighs and 8 drumsticks, skin on","3 spring onions, shredded, to finish","4 tbsp groundnut oil","6 garlic cloves, finely chopped","finger-length piece fresh root ginger, grated","4 tbsp Shaohsing rice wine or dry sherry","4 tbsp light soy sauce","4 tbsp clear honey","4 tsp five spice powder"]','["Whisk together the marinade ingredients,\r\nput the chicken into a dish, then pour over\r\nthe marinade, mixing to coat. Cover, then\r\nchill for at least 20 mins, or up to a day if\r\nyou have time.","Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4, and\r\nlift the chicken out of the marinade into a\r\nroasting tin. Roast for 40 mins, pour over\r\nthe remaining marinade, then cook for\r\na further 30 mins until golden and sticky.\r\nSprinkle with the spring onion, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7228,7228,'en','Special fried rice with prawns & chorizo','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA fusion dish that merges Spanish paella with Asian egg fried rice – a great way to get kids to eat vegetables','["100g basmati rice or long-grain rice","85g frozen peas","1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 egg, beaten","50g finely diced chorizo, bacon or ham","1 garlic clove, chopped","3 spring onions, sliced on an angle","½ red pepper, deseeded and chopped","good pinch five spice powder","1 tsp soy sauce","100g beansprouts (optional)","50g peeled prawns"]','["Boil the rice following pack\r\ninstructions, adding the peas for\r\nthe final min. Drain.","Heat half the oil in a wok. Pour in\r\nthe egg and stir-fry until scrambled.\r\nTip onto a plate and set aside.","Wipe the wok with kitchen paper,\r\nthen heat the remaining oil. Toss in\r\nthe meat, garlic, spring onions and\r\npepper, and stir-fry until the pepper\r\nstarts to soften. Add the five-spice,\r\nrice, peas and soy, then stir-fry for\r\n5 mins more. Finally add the\r\nbeansprouts, if using, the egg and\r\nprawns, and stir-fry to heat through."]','2026-01-10 12:19:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7230,7230,'en','Chinese noodles with tofu & hazelnuts','Exciting flavours permeate this easy veggie recipe','["250g packet medium egg noodle","2 tbsp olive oil","handful coriander, roughly chopped","300g mangetout","1 red chilli, seeded and finely chopped","handful toasted hazelnuts, roughly chopped","349g pack silken tofu, cut into cubes","3 tbsp Chinese yellow beans sauce"]','["Drop the noodles into a pan of boiling water, cook for 4 mins, then drain. Drizzle over a little oil and mix in half the coriander.","Heat a wok over a medium heat. Pour in the remaining oil, then throw in the mangetout and stir-fry for 2 mins. Add the chilli and cook for 2 mins more until the beans are just tender.","Tip the hazelnuts, tofu and yellow bean sauce into the wok and stir to warm through. Finally, stir in the remaining coriander, season if you want to, and serve with the noodles."]','2026-01-10 12:19:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7232,7232,'en','Beef stir-fry','Try this quick and easy stir-fry using lemongrass, ginger and chilli to pack a punch. Cook everything in just one pan and enjoy as a midweek meal','["500g beef rump, trimmed and cut into thin strips","1 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","300g pack ready-cooked rice noodles","1 large red chilli","1 fat garlic clove, chopped","4cm piece ginger, peeled and cut into matchsticks","1 stick lemongrass, trimmed and sliced","2 tbsp sunflower oil","100g sugar snap peas, cut into thin strips","8 baby corn, sliced diagonally","6 spring onions, trimmed and sliced diagonally","½ lime","2 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp fish sauce","2 tbsp roasted peanuts","roughly chopped coriander, to serve"]','["Mix the beef and five-spice in a bowl,\r\nthen set aside to marinate. Soften the\r\nnoodles in boiling water following pack\r\ninstructions, drain then set aside. Thinly\r\nslice the red chilli, leaving the seeds if\r\nyou prefer a little extra heat. Mix with\r\nthe garlic, ginger and lemongrass in\r\na small bowl. Heat half the oil in a wok,\r\nadd the chilli mixture and stir-fry for 1 min\r\nuntil softened but not coloured. Remove\r\nwith a slotted spoon and set aside while\r\nyou cook the beef.","Heat the remaining oil, add the beef\r\nand stir-fry over a high heat for 1 min\r\nuntil browned and just cooked through.","Return the chilli mixture to the pan with\r\nthe sugar snaps, baby corn and half the\r\nspring onions. Stir-fry for 1 min more\r\nbefore adding the drained noodles. Mix\r\nto thoroughly combine, take off the heat\r\nand add a squeeze of lime juice, the soy\r\nsauce and fish sauce.","Divide between four plates. Scatter\r\nwith the peanuts, garnish with remaining\r\nspring onions and chopped coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:19:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7234,7234,'en','Chinese steamed bass with cabbage','Full of flavour and void of guilt, this low-fat fish dish is full of omega 3 and counts as 1 of your 5-a-day. A perfect mid week meal','["2 sea bass, or other white fish fillets","1 green or red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 tsp fresh root ginger","300g green cabbages, finely shredded","2 tsp sunflower oil","1 tsp sesame oil","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","2 tsp low salt soy sauce"]','["Sprinkle the fish with the chilli, ginger and\r\na little salt. Steam the cabbage for 5 mins.\r\nLay fish on top of the cabbage and steam\r\nfor a further 5 mins until cooked through.","Meanwhile, heat the oils in a small pan,\r\nadd the garlic and quickly cook, stirring until\r\nlightly browned. Transfer the cabbage and\r\nfish to serving plates, sprinkle each with 1 tsp\r\nof soy sauce, then pour over the garlicky oil."]','2026-01-10 12:19:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7236,7236,'en','Sticky Chinese wings & cucumber','Chinese style chicken wings with an American twist using just 5 ingredients','["16 large chicken wings","125ml reduced salt soy sauce","140g dark soft brown sugar","5 tbsp white wine vinegar","half cucumber, peeled into fine ribbons"]','["Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. In a\r\nroasting tray, toss the wings with the soy\r\nsauce, 125g of the sugar, 2 tbsp of the vinegar\r\nand some cracked black pepper. Roast for\r\n40 mins, turning occasionally until lacquered.","Meanwhile, bring the remaining sugar and\r\nvinegar to the boil for about 1 min, until the\r\nsugar dissolves. Leave to cool, then toss with\r\nthe cucumber ribbons. Serve the sticky wings\r\nwith the cucumber and some boiled rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7240,7240,'en','Chinese roast duck with pancakes','Set out all the elements of this classic Chinese recipe on the table and let your guests help themselves','["1 oven-ready duck","2 tsp Chinese five-spices","2 star anise","1 orange, peel cut off in strips, then orange halved","2 tbsp Chinese black vinegar (we used Merchant Gourmet) (optional)","75ml Shaohsing rice wine or dry Sherry","100ml chicken stock","30 Chinese pancakes (shop-bought or see ''Goes well with'' for a recipe)","6 spring onions, cut into finger lengths and shredded, ½ cucumber, cut into matchsticks, hoisin sauce, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1.\r\nLoosen the skin on the duck by wriggling\r\nfirst your fingers, then your hand\r\nbetween it and the flesh until it pulls\r\naway – be careful not to break the skin.\r\nTrim off any excess fat from cavity and\r\nskin around the neck. Rub the skin all\r\nover with the five-spice plus a good\r\nsprinkling of salt. Put the duck in a\r\nroasting tin and push the star anise,\r\norange peel and orange halves inside.\r\nSpoon the vinegar, rice wine and stock\r\ninto the cavity, don’t worry if it spills out\r\nagain. Cover the roasting tin with a tent\r\nof foil and cook for 2 hrs.","Turn oven up to 240C/220C fan/gas 7.\r\nTake foil off, pour off any juices (keep for\r\nthe noodles, see ''Goes well with'') and\r\nreturn duck to the oven for 30-40 mins\r\nor until the skin is browned and crisp.","Once cooked let it rest for 10 mins. Slice\r\noff the breasts and shred meat and skin.\r\nPile onto a plate, keeping meat and skin\r\nseparate. Keep warm in a low oven, covering\r\nmeat with foil to stop it drying out but skin\r\nuncovered to crisp it further. (Remove the\r\nrest of the meat in chunks for the noodles - see ''Goes well with''.)","Heat the pancakes and serve the duck\r\nwith accompaniments."]','2026-01-10 12:19:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7242,7242,'en','Hot & sour broth with prawns','This healthy starter takes just 15 minutes to make and is a cleansing way to kick off a Chinese meal','["3 tbsp rice vinegar or white wine vinegar","500ml chicken stock","1 tbsp soy sauce","1-2 tbsp golden caster sugar","thumb-size piece ginger, peeled and thinly sliced","2 small hot red chillies, thinly sliced","3 spring onions, thinly sliced","300g small raw peeled prawns, from a sustainable source"]','["Put the vinegar, stock, soy sauce, sugar\r\n(start with 1 tbsp and add the second at\r\nthe end if you want the soup sweeter),\r\nginger, chillies and spring onions in a\r\nsaucepan and bring to a simmer. Cook\r\nfor 1 min, then add the prawns to heat\r\nthrough. Serve in small bowls or cups."]','2026-01-10 12:19:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7246,7246,'en','Kung po prawns','Whip up this budget-friendly, Chinese favourite in just 20 minutes','["1 tsp cornflour","2 tbsp light soy sauce","400g large raw prawns, frozen is fine, butterflied (see tip, below)","2 tbsp Chinese rice vinegar","1 heaped tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp caster sugar","2 tbsp sunflower or groundnut oil","85g unsalted, roasted peanuts","6 small or 3 large whole dried chillies","2 x 225g cans water chestnuts, drained","thumb-sized piece ginger, finely grated","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped"]','["Mix the cornflour and 1 tbsp soy sauce, toss in the prawns and set aside for 10 mins. Stir the vinegar, remaining soy sauce, tomato purée, sugar and 2 tbsp water together to make a sauce.","When you’re ready to cook, heat a large frying pan or wok until very hot, then add 1 tbsp oil. Fry the prawns until they are golden in places and have opened out– then tip them out of the pan.","Heat the remaining oil and add the peanuts, chillies and water chestnuts. Stir-fry for 2 mins or until the peanuts start to colour, then add the ginger and garlic and fry for 1 more min. Tip in the prawns and sauce and simmer for 2 mins until thickened slightly. Serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7248,7248,'en','Sea bass with sizzled ginger, chilli & spring onions','The aromas released while cooking this dish will have everyone licking their lips in anticipation','["6 x sea bass fillets, about 140g/5oz each, skin on and scaled","about 3 tbsp sunflower oil","large knob of ginger, peeled and shredded into matchsticks","3 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","3 fat, fresh red chillies deseeded and thinly shredded","bunch spring onion, shredded long-ways","1 tbsp soy sauce"]','["Season the fish with salt and pepper, then slash the skin 3 times. Heat a heavy-based frying pan and add 1 tbsp oil. Once hot, fry the fish, skin-side down, for 5 mins or until the skin is very crisp and golden. The fish will be almost cooked through. Turn over, cook for another 30 secs-1 min, then transfer to a serving plate and keep warm. You’ll need to fry the fish in 2 batches.","Heat the remaining oil, then fry the ginger, garlic and chillies for about 2 mins until golden. Take off the heat and toss in the spring onions. Splash the fish with a little soy sauce and spoon over the contents of the pan."]','2026-01-10 12:19:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7250,7250,'en','Shredded duck, watercress & orange salad','A Chinese-influenced salad of soft duck, crunchy radish and chicory and sweet orange- a casual supper','["2 duck legs","1 tsp five-spice powder","5 tbsp rice vinegar","5 tbsp soy sauce","2 big oranges, segmented, juice reserved","2 x 100g bag watercress","200g bag radishes, thinly sliced","140g pack chicory, leaves separated","small bunch spring onion, sliced diagonally"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Pat\r\nthe duck legs dry with kitchen paper\r\nand rub in the five-spice and some\r\nseasoning. Pour the vinegar, soy and\r\norange juice into a small roasting tin and\r\nput the duck on top. Cover with foil and\r\ncook for 30 mins, then remove the foil\r\nand increase oven to 240C/220C fan/\r\ngas 9, or put under the grill and cook\r\nuntil the skin is crisp. Remove and strain\r\nthe liquid through a sieve. Let the duck\r\ncool until you can shred the meat from\r\nthe bones. Skim fat from the liquid.","Meanwhile, gently toss together the\r\noranges, watercress, radishes, chicory\r\nand spring onions. Pour over reserved\r\ncooking liquid, then add the duck and\r\narrange on a platter."]','2026-01-10 12:19:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7252,7252,'en','Chinese-style braised beef one-pot','Great for casual entertaining, when you fancy a warming beef stew but with some more vibrant flavours','["3-4 tbsp olive oil","6 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","good thumb-size piece fresh root ginger, peeled and shredded","1 bunch spring onions, sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and thinly sliced","1½ kg braising beef, cut into large pieces (we used ox cheek)","2 tbsp plain flour, well seasoned","1 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","2 star anise (optional)","2 tsp light muscovado sugar (or use whatever you''ve got)","3 tbsp Chinese cooking wine or dry sherry","3 tbsp dark soy sauce, plus more to serve","500ml beef stock (we used Knorr Touch of Taste)","steamed bok choi and steamed basmati rice, to serve"]','["Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in a large,\r\nshallow casserole. Fry the garlic, ginger,\r\nonions and chilli for 3 mins until soft\r\nand fragrant. Tip onto a plate. Toss the\r\nbeef in the flour, add 1 tbsp more oil\r\nto the pan, then brown the meat in\r\nbatches, adding the final tbsp oil if you\r\nneed to. It should take about 5 mins\r\nto brown each batch properly.","Add the five-spice and star anise (if\r\nusing) to the pan, tip in the gingery mix,\r\nthen fry for 1 min until the spices are\r\nfragrant. Add the sugar, then the beef\r\nand stir until combined. Keep the heat\r\nhigh, then splash in the wine or sherry,\r\nscraping up any meaty bits. Heat oven\r\nto 150C/fan 130C/gas 2.","Pour in the soy and stock (it won’t\r\ncover the meat completely), bring to\r\na simmer, then tightly cover, transfer\r\nto the oven and cook for 1½-2 hrs,\r\nstirring the meat halfway through.\r\nThe meat should be very soft, and any\r\nsinewy bits should have melted away.\r\nSeason with more soy. This can now\r\nbe chilled and frozen for up to 1 month.","Nestle the cooked bok choi into the\r\npan, then bring to the table with the\r\nbasmati rice straight away and tuck in."]','2026-01-10 12:19:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7254,7254,'en','Quick & easy hot-and-sour chicken noodle soup','Keep tasting the broth and add as much chilli and rice vinegar as you like to get the right balance of flavours','["140g dried wholewheat noodles","1 tbsp groundnut oil","2 tbsp grated ginger","1 medium red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","4 skinless, boneless chicken thighs, chopped into small chunks","1 tbsp Shaohsing rice wine","700ml hot vegetable stock","4 chestnut mushrooms, sliced","1 tsp dark soy sauce","2 tbsp light soy sauce","2 tbsp rice vinegar","1 tbsp cornflour mixed with 2 tbsp cold water to make a paste","1 handful beansprouts","2 spring onions, sliced"]','["Bring a small pan of water to the boil\r\nand cook the noodles following pack\r\ninstructions. Drain, rinse under cold\r\nrunning water to stop them cooking\r\nfurther, then drizzle over a little oil to\r\nprevent them sticking together. Divide\r\nbetween 2 deep bowls.","Heat a wok over high heat and add the\r\nrest of the oil. When it starts to smoke,\r\nadd the ginger and chilli, then stir-fry for\r\na few secs. Add the chicken and stir-fry\r\nfor 2 mins. As the meat starts to turn\r\nbrown, add the rice wine and cook\r\nfor 3 mins more. Add the vegetable\r\nstock, bring to a simmer, then add the\r\nmushrooms. Season with the dark soy,\r\nlight soy and rice vinegar.","Bring back to\r\na simmer, then add the cornflour paste.\r\nSimmer and stir until thickened. Stir in\r\nthe beansprouts and most of the spring\r\nonions, then ladle the soup over the\r\nnoodles. Serve immediately, scattered\r\nwith the remaining spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:19:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7256,7256,'en','Egg drop chicken noodle soup','These quick and healthy noodles make the ideal midweek staple','["2 skinless, boneless chicken breasts, diced","1.2l low-salt chicken stock","140g wholewheat noodles","140g baby corn, halved lengthways, or frozen sweetcorn","2 eggs, beaten","squeeze lemon juice","½  tsp sherry vinegar","2 spring onions, finely chopped"]','["Place the chicken and stock in a large\r\npan and bring to a simmer for 5 mins.\r\nMeanwhile, cook the noodles following\r\npack instructions.","Add the corn to the stock and cook\r\nfor 2 mins. Stir the broth vigorously, then\r\nwhile it’s still swirling, hold a fork over the\r\npan. Pour the eggs over the prongs in a\r\nslow stream. Stir again in the same\r\ndirection then turn off the heat. Add a\r\nsqueeze of lemon juice and the vinegar.","Drain the noodles and divide between\r\nfour bowls. Ladle over the egg drop\r\nbroth, scatter with onions and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7258,7258,'en','Toffee & sesame bananas','Traditional toffee bananas are deep-fried, but this is a lighter version, served with caramel sauce','["6 large bananas, peeled and quartered","8 tbsp light muscovado sugar","2 tbsp butter","200ml double cream","2 tbsp sesame seeds, toasted","good-quality vanilla ice cream, to serve"]','["Toss the bananas in 2 tbsp of the sugar.\r\nHeat a griddle to medium, then cook the\r\nbananas, a few pieces at a time, until sticky\r\nand showing griddle marks. Keep warm\r\nin a low oven.","For the sauce, put the remaining sugar,\r\nthe butter and cream into a saucepan and\r\nstir over a gentle heat until the sugar has\r\nmelted. Stir in the sesame seeds. Can be\r\nmade up to a day ahead. To serve, put a\r\nfew pieces of banana into 8 serving dishes,\r\nspoon over some of the caramel, then top\r\nwith a scoop of ice cream."]','2026-01-10 12:19:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7260,7260,'en','Crispy chilli beef','Ditch the takeaway and whip up this Chinese flash-fried steak with a sweet gingery sauce and red peppers','["350g thin-cut minute steak, very thinly sliced into strips","3 tbsp cornflour","2 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","100ml vegetable oil","1 red pepper, thinly sliced","1 red chilli, thinly sliced","4 spring onions, sliced, green and white parts separated","2 garlic cloves, crushed","thumb-sized piece ginger, cut into matchsticks","4 tbsp rice wine vinegar or white wine vinegar","1 tbsp soy sauce","2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","2 tbsp tomato ketchup","cooked noodles, to serve (optional)","prawn crackers, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the beef in a bowl and toss in the\r\ncornflour and five-spice. Heat the oil in a\r\nwok or large frying pan until hot, then add\r\nthe beef and fry until golden and crisp.\r\nScoop out the beef and drain on kitchen\r\npaper. Pour away all but 1 tbsp oil.","Add the pepper, half the chilli, the white\r\nends of the spring onions, garlic and\r\nginger to the pan. Stir-fry for 3 mins to\r\nsoften, but don’t let the garlic and ginger burn. Mix the vinegar, soy, chilli sauce\r\nand ketchup in a jug with 2 tbsp water,\r\nthen pour over the veg. Bubble for\r\n2 mins, then add the beef back to the pan\r\nand toss well to coat. Serve the beef on\r\nnoodles with prawn crackers, if you like,\r\nscattered with the remaining chilli and\r\nthe green parts of the spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:19:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7262,7262,'en','Comté gougères','Fill these gougères with the optional comté crèmeux and transform them from a snack or drinks nibble to a starter – they make a great start to a French menu','["100ml milk","50g butter","125g plain flour","4 eggs","150g comté , grated","35g butter","20g plain flour","100ml whole milk","100ml double cream","200g comté , grated, plus extra finely grated comté to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 220/200C fan/gas 8. Put the milk, 100ml water and the butter in a medium pan over a low heat and warm until the butter has melted and the liquid is simmering. Stir in the flour and continue to cook, stirring, until the mixture comes away cleanly from the side of the pan. Transfer to a bowl and whisk in the eggs, one at a time, then beat in the cheese and some seasoning.","Spoon the mixture into a piping bag, snip off the end and pipe about 20 rounds over two baking trays lined with baking parchment. Use a finger or fork dipped in water to gently press down any peaks. Bake for 20 mins, or until the gougères are puffed up, deep golden and crisp. Leave to cool.","If you’re making the filling, melt the butter in a pan over a medium-low heat. Whisk in the flour to form a sandy paste. Slowly whisk in the milk and cream, and continue to cook until the mixture thickens. Stir in the cheese to melt, season, then remove from the heat and cool completely. Once cool, transfer to a second piping bag. Snip off the end.","Using a skewer, poke holes into the bottoms of the gougères that are big enough to fit the end of the piping bag. Pipe in the filling, then arrange four on each plate and scatter over more grated cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:19:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7264,7264,'en','Pain au chocolat','Try your hand at making these popular French breakfast pastries filled with chocolate. They’re perfect served with a cup of coffee, or as a mid-morning treat','["420g plain flour","8g sea salt","60g caster sugar","220g unsalted butter (at least 82% fat works best), 20g softened","20g fresh yeast , or 10g dried yeast","1 egg , beaten","110ml whole milk","16 dark chocolate batons"]','["Make the dough in a stand mixer. Combine the flour, salt, sugar and 20g softened butter. Dissolve the yeast in around 80ml tepid water, around 38C, not too hot or it will kill the yeast. Add 20g of beaten egg and the milk to the stand mixer bowl. Pour in the yeast-water mixture and turn on to a low speed with a dough hook attachment for approximately 5 mins until the dough comes together to form a rough ball. Increase the speed to medium-high and knead for a further 6-10 mins until the dough is smooth. The exact time will depend on your stand mixer.","Wrap the dough tightly and rest at room temperature for 10 mins. Unwrap and roll out the dough into a rectangle around 4mm thick, about 40 x 30cm. Wrap the dough rectangle and put in the freezer for 1 hr to rest or in the fridge overnight.","Meanwhile, on a sheet of baking parchment, shape the remaining 200g butter into a flat rectangle (about 20 x 30cm) using a rolling pin. It should be around half the length of your dough rectangle, but the same width. Put in the fridge until needed – you want it to be cold but flexible.","Take the chilled dough out of the fridge or freezer and lay the butter in the centre. Fold the dough edges in to meet at the centre, covering the butter. Rotate the dough 90 degrees and roll it out to about 40cm in length, keeping the same width. Handle the dough gently and return it to the fridge for 10-20 mins if it starts getting too warm.","Repeat the process of folding the edges of the dough into the middle, then fold it over on itself again like a book (this is known as a double turn). Chill for 30 mins.","Rotate the dough 90 degrees again. Roll it out long again and fold the edges in to meet in the middle. Chill for a further 30 mins.","Roll out the dough to 32 x 30cm and cut 8 rectangles, 8 x 15cm each. Put a chocolate baton on one long edge of each rectangle, fold the dough inwards, then put the second chocolate baton next to the folded dough and roll the dough around the encase the chocolate, with the seams of the dough now facing down.","Prove the pain au chocolat at 26-29°C (this is really important as proving at any higher temperature will mean the butter between the layers melts) for around 2-3 hrs, until doubled in size.","Heat the oven to 175C/155C fan/gas 4, brush the pain au chocolat with the remaining egg and bake for 15-18 mins until golden brown and cooked through. Best eaten on the day but will keep in an airtight container for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:19:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7268,7268,'en','Ultimate crème brûlée','With a rich, creamy vanilla custard and crunchy, caramelised topping, our crème brûlée makes the ultimate indulgent dessert. Follow our professional tips for mastering this classic French sweet','["2 cartons double cream, 1 large (284ml) plus 1 small (142ml)","100ml whole milk","1 vanilla pod","5 egg yolks","50g golden caster sugar, plus extra for the topping"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Sit four 175ml ramekins in a deeproasting tinat least 7.5cm deep (or a large deep cake tin), one that will enable abaking trayto sit well above the ramekins when laid across the top of the tin.","Pour the large and small cartons of double cream into a mediumpanwith the milk.","Lay the vanilla pod on a board and slice lengthways through the middle with asharp knifeto split it in two. Use the tip of the knife to scrape out all the tiny seeds into the cream mixture. Drop the vanilla pod in as well, and set aside.","Put the egg yolks and sugar in amixing bowland whisk for 1 min with anelectric hand whiskuntil paler in colour and a bit fluffy.","Put the pan with the cream on a medium heat and bring almost to the boil. As soon as you see bubbles appear round the edge, take the pan off the heat.","Pour the hot cream into the beaten egg yolks, stirring with a wire whisk as you do so, and scraping out the seeds from the pan.","Set a fine sieve over a large wide jug or bowl and pour the hot mixture through to strain it, encouraging any stray vanilla seeds through at the end.","Using a big spoon, scoop off all the pale foam that is sitting on the top of the liquid (this will be several spoonfuls) and discard. Give the mixture a stir.","Pour in enough hot water (from the tap) into the roasting tin to come about 1.5cm up the sides of the ramekins. Pour the hot cream into the ramekins so you fill them up right to the top – it’s easier to spoon in the last little bit.","Put them in the oven and lay a baking sheet over the top of the tin so it sits well above the ramekins and completely covers them, but not the whole tin, leaving a small gap at one side to allow air to circulate.","Bake for 30-35 mins until the mixture is softly set. To check, gently sway the roasting tin and if the crème brûlées are ready, they will wobble a bit like a jelly in the middle. Don’t let them get too firm.","Lift the ramekins out of the roasting tin with oven gloves and set them on awire rackto cool for a couple of minutes only, then put in the fridge to cool completely. This can be done overnight without affecting the texture.","When ready to serve, wipe round the top edge of the dishes, sprinkle 1½ tsp of caster sugar over each ramekin and spread it out with the back of a spoon to completely cover.","Spray with a little water using a fine spray (the sort you buy in a craft shop) to just dampen the sugar – then use a blow torch to caramelise it. Hold the flame just above the sugar and keep moving it round and round until caramelised. Serve when the brûlée is firm, or within an hour or two."]','2026-01-10 12:19:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7270,7270,'en','Flamiche','Try this French dish that’s halfway between a pizza and a quiche. Crème fraîche mixed with cheese and eggs makes a tasty topping along with delicious buttery leeks','["250g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","5g salt","5g fast-action dried yeast","2 tbsp olive oil, for the bowl","20g butter","500g leeks, white and pale green part only, thinly sliced","2 eggs, beaten","150g crème fraîche or soured cream","80g comté, gruyère or cheddar (use cheddar for vegetarians), grated","1 large thyme or rosemary sprig, leaves picked","¼ whole nutmeg, grated","20g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated","salad, to serve (optional)"]','["Mix the flour and salt together in a large bowl. Mix the yeast with 175ml warm water and leave for 5 mins to froth just a little, then add to the flour and mix vigorously with a metal spoon. Knead the dough as soon as it comes together on a lightly floured surface for around 5 mins until smooth. Alternatively, use a mixer fitted with a dough hook, working the dough for around 5 mins on medium speed, then adding the salt towards the end of the mixing time. Leave in a lightly oiled bowl covered with a clean, damp tea towel until nearly doubled in size, about 1 hr.","Meanwhile, heat the butter in a frying pan over a medium heat and cook the leaks until softened, about 8 mins. Don’t let them colour. When soft, remove from the heat and leave to cool. Beat the eggs, crème fraîche, grated cheese, herbs and nutmeg together, and season well with plenty of pepper and some salt. Mix in the leeks.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Line a 40 x 30cm baking tray with baking parchment. Lightly flour the work surface and roll the dough out to fit the baking sheet – it should be about 5mm thick. Make a small lip around the edge of the dough by folding the dough inward. Evenly spread the leek mixture over the dough, leaving a 1cm border. Sprinkle over the parmesan.","Cook the flamiche in the oven for around 25 mins until lightly golden on the top and the base is crisp. Remove from the oven,cut into squaresand serve with salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7272,7272,'en','Fig, burrata & prosciutto tartine','Use larger slices of sourdough for our fig, burrata and prosciutto tartines for an impressive-looking lunch or starter that’s deceptively easy.','["4 slices of sourdough","olive oil, for drizzling","2 tbsp fig chutney","2 x 100g balls burrata, drained","8 slices of prosciutto or parma ham","4-6 ripe figs, roughly torn or halved","handful of thyme or oregano, leaves picked","balsamic vinegar, to serve"]','["Heat agriddle panover a high heat or heat the grill to high. Drizzle each side of the bread with a little olive oil, then toast in the pan or under the grill for 2 mins on each side until golden brown.","Spread the fig chutney over the toasted bread. Tear or chop the burrata into chunky pieces and arrange these on the toast, create little nests of prosciutto on top, then add the fig pieces. Sprinkle with the thyme, then drizzle with more olive oil and a little balsamic vinegar."]','2026-01-10 12:19:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7274,7274,'en','French apple tart','Looking for a showstopper dessert for a dinner party? If you have the time, it’s well worth making a French apple tart, a classic shop-window patisserie.','["125g cold butter, cubed","200g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 egg, beaten","1 ¾ kg (about 12) eating apples, like Cox’s, Russet or Granny Smith","50g golden caster sugar","1 tbsp calvados, cognac or brandy (optional)","25g butter, melted","3 tbsp apricot jam","icing sugar, to serve (optional)"]','["For the pastry, rub the butter into the flour, sugar and a pinch of salt in a bowl until crumbly. Mix in the egg until it forms a dough, then form into a puck shape. Cover and chill for at least 30 mins.Will keep chilled for two days.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6.Roll the pastry outon a lightly floured surface to roughly the thickness of a £1 coin, and use to line a 23cm fluted tart tin, leaving some overhanging. Line with a disc of baking parchment big enough to cover the edges, and fill with some baking beans to weigh it down (use dried rice or lentils if you don’t have baking beans). Bake for 15 mins, then remove the parchment and beans and bake for 10-15 mins more until the pastry is biscuity. Trim away any overhanging pastry with a serrated knife. Set aside to cool.","Meanwhile, set aside four of the apples, thenpeel, core and roughly chop the rest. Put them in a shallow saucepan with 2 tbsp water, all but 1 tbsp of the sugar and the alcohol, if using. Cover and cook over a low heat for 25-30 mins, stirring occasionally and adding more water if needed, until the apples have collapsed into a purée. Taste the mixture and sweeten with more sugar, if needed.","Turn the oven up to 210C/190C fan/gas 8. Peel, core and halve the reserved apples, then cut into even-sized slices. Spread the apple purée over the base of the tart case, then arrange the apple slices in neat, concentric circles, starting from the outside. Brush the apples with butter, then scatter over the reserved sugar and bake for another 20-25 mins until golden.","Mix the jam with 1 tbsp hot water from a freshly boiledkettle. When the tart has finished baking, glaze generously with the jam, then leave to cool a little. Serve warm or cold, dusted with icing sugar, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7276,7276,'en','Allotment salad','Make the most of new season’s asparagus and radishes in a vibrant salad with a French-style dressing. Great for a barbecue','["8 asparagus spears, halved","250g green beans, halved","250g long-stem broccoli, chopped into 2cm lengths","200g peas, fresh or frozen","8 radishes, sliced","1 pointed cabbage, shredded","4 spring onions, sliced","handful of mint leaves, chopped","4 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","1 lemon, juiced"]','["To make the dressing, combine all the ingredients in a bowl and season well.","Bring a pan of salted water to the boil and fill a bowl with iced water. Cook the asparagus for 2 mins, then transfer to the iced water with a slotted spoon. Cook the beans for 4 mins and repeat, then do the same with the broccoli (cook for 2½ mins) and peas (cook for 1 min). Drain and pat dry with kitchen paper.","Tip into a bowl with the radishes, cabbage, spring onions and mint. Serve the dressing on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:19:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7278,7278,'en','Mocha madeleines','Give the classic French dessert a modern twist with these pretty mini mocha madeleines. These easy cakes are the perfect treat for afternoon tea','["100g butter, plus extra for the tin","85g plain flour","15g cocoa powder","2 eggs, separated","2 tsp honey","1 ½  tbsp coffee granules","80g caster sugar","15g demerara sugar","25g white chocolate"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and butter a 12-hole madeleine tin or a 24-hole mini madeleine tin. In a small pan, heat the butter over a medium heat until frothy and golden with a nutty aroma. Leave to cool.","Sieve the flour and cocoa into a large bowl, then stir in the egg yolks, honey, coffee, melted butter and both sugars. Whisk the egg whites until stiff peaks form, then fold into the cocoa mix.","Spoon the mixture into the tin, half-filling each of the madeleine holes. Chill in the fridge for 1 hr.","Bake for 7 mins if using a 24-hole mini madeleine tin, or for 10-12 mins if using a 12-hole tin. Remove from the oven and leave to cool.","Melt the white chocolate in the microwave in short bursts, then drizzle over the madeleines."]','2026-01-10 12:19:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7280,7280,'en','Steak haché with pommes frites & cheat’s Béarnaise sauce','A classic French recipe of bun-less burger & chips, that can be found in every brasserie and bistro. Kids will love it and it''s easy to create together at home','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","4 shallots, very finely chopped","600g freshly ground beef (ask the butcher for something with roughly 15% fat - we used chuck)","8 thyme sprigs, leaves picked and chopped","2 tsp Dijon mustard","2 tbsp plain flour","200ml crème fraîche","1 egg yolk","6 tarragon sprigs, leaves picked and finely chopped","dressed green salad, to serve","4 large baking potatoes (such as Maris Piper or Russet), peeled","2 tbsp vegetable oil"]','["Heat the oil in a pan and add about 3 /4 of the shallots. Cook for 5-10 mins, stirring occasionally, until soft and starting to caramelise in places. Set aside to cool.","In a large bowl, combine the beef, thyme, 1 tsp Dijon and the cooled shallots. Season with black pepper but not salt at this stage (this can cause the meat to dry out). Shape into four patties and dust with flour. Put on a plate, cover with cling film and chill for at least 30 mins (or up to 2 hrs).","Meanwhile, prepare the frites. Slice the potatoes into skinny chips, tipping into a large bowl of cold water as you go. Drain, then transfer to a large pan and cover with fresh water, seasoning with salt. Bring to a fast simmer, boil for 1 min, then drain well. Tip the chips onto a clean tea towel or some kitchen paper, spread in a single layer so they dry and cool quickly. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Tip the chips into a bowl with the vegetable oil and 1 tsp salt. Toss to coat, then spread out over two large baking trays. Cook for 45 mins or until crisp and golden.","When the chips are about 15 mins from being cooked, heat a large frying pan with a drizzle of oil. Season the patties with salt on both sides and cook for 3-4 mins each side, or until they have a dark brown crust but are still slightly pink inside (or cook them for a little longer if you’d prefer them well done). Transfer to a plate, cover with foil and set aside to keep warm while you make the sauce.","Return the pan to the heat and tip in the remaining shallots. Fry for 1-2 mins to soften, then remove the pan from the heat and stir in the crème fraîche, remaining Dijon, the egg yolk and tarragon, as well as any resting juices from the beef patties. Season well. Serve the steak with the pommes frites and a green salad, with the Béarnaise sauce on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:19:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7282,7282,'en','One-pot pork with orange, olives & bay','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA Provençal-style pork casserole with vibrant citrus flavours, sweet shallots, new potatoes and sundried tomatoes','["85g sundried tomato in oil, roughly chopped, plus 2-3 tbsp oil from the jar","1kg pork shoulder, cut into chunky cubes","2 tbsp plain flour, seasoned","400g shallot (see tip, below)","1 onion, thinly sliced","3 bay leaf","few thyme sprigs","5 garlic clove, thinly sliced","400ml red wine","strip of zest and juice from 1 orange","350ml chicken stock","400g can chopped plum tomato","800g large new potato, peeled & halved or cut into fat slices, depending on size","70g pack dry black olive"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the sundried tomato oil in a large, flameproof casserole dish. Toss the pork in the flour, tap off any excess, then brown it in 2 batches, transferring to a large bowl once golden and crusted. Use a splash more oil for the second batch if needed.","Tip 1 tbsp oil, shallots, onion, bay leaves and thyme into the pan and fry for 5 mins until golden here and there. Stir in the garlic and sundried tomatoes, cook for 1 min more, then tip onto the pork.","Splash the wine and orange juice into the dish, add the orange zest and boil hard for 5 mins. Add the meat and onions back in.","When ready to cook, heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Stir the stock, canned tomatoes, potatoes and olives into the casserole, then bring to a simmer. Prod the potatoes as far under the surface of the liquid as you can. Cover, leaving a slight gap to one side, then cook in the oven for 2½ hrs, or until the meat is tender enough to cut with a spoon. Spoon away any excess fat and let the stew rest for a few mins before ladling into shallow bowls."]','2026-01-10 12:19:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7286,7286,'en','Blood orange & dark chocolate madeleines','Best enjoyed fresh from the oven, these delicate madeleines dipped in dark chocolate and dusted with blood orange powder make a delectable dessert','["100g unsalted butter, plus extra for greasing","2 large eggs","100g golden caster sugar","zest 2 blood oranges plus juice of ½  (about 2 tbsp)","100g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp baking powder","140g dark chocolate (60-70% cocoa solids), finely chopped","blood orange dust (optional - see below)"]','["Put the butter in a small saucepan over a medium heat until it foams and turns a nutty brown colour – watch the pan carefully, as butter can burn quickly. Pour into a bowl and set aside to cool.","Beat the eggs, sugar and zest in a large bowl with an electric hand whisk for about 5 mins until thick and pale. Add the juice and mix to combine. Mix the flour and baking powder together, then sift over the batter mixture, a third at a time, and fold in.","Add a large spoonful of the batter to the butter, mixing together until smooth and combined. Pour this into the batter and gently fold together until fully combined. Press a sheet of cling film onto the surface of the mixture and chill overnight.","About 30 mins before you want to bake the madeleines, grease a 12-hole madeleine tin with a little extra butter and dust with a little flour. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and put the tin in the freezer to chill for 30 mins. Remove the batter from the fridge and add about 1 heaped tbsp to each madeleine hole – be careful not to overfill as they will bake over the edge and won’t form the characteristic hump. Depending on the size of your tin, you will have some batter left – either bake in batches or put the rest back in the fridge and bake within three days.","Bake in the oven for 10-12 mins or until golden brown around the edges. Immediately turn out the madeleines onto a wire rack and leave to cool fully. Put the chocolate in a microwaveable bowl and heat in the microwave on High in 30 sec bursts until about three-quarters of the chocolate has melted. Remove from the microwave and stir vigorously until the remaining chocolate has melted (this is a simple method of tempering and just ensures the chocolate will set properly at room temperature). Dip each madeleine halfway into the melted chocolate, allowing the excess to drip off, then place on a sheet of baking parchment. As the chocolate starts to set, but while still a little tacky, sprinkle with some of the Blood orange dust (below), if using, and allow to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:19:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7288,7288,'en','Sautéed potatoes with bacon lardons & persillade','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis fabulous French side dish of pan-fried potatoes and salty smoked bacon is finished with garlic and herbs, and pairs perfectly with roast meats and poultry','["1kg potatoes, cut into 2cm/¾ in pieces","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","300g smoked bacon lardons","25g unsalted butter","small pack flat-leaf parsley, chopped","2 tsp chopped chervil","1 tarragon sprig, leaves chopped","1 banana shallot, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed"]','["In a large saucepan on a high heat, simmer the potatoes for 5 mins in enough water to just cover them, then drain in a colander and leave for 1 min for the steam to escape.","In a small bowl, mix all the ingredients for the persillade together and set aside. Heat the oil in a large frying pan on a high heat, add the lardons and cook for 8-10 mins until lightly caramelised. Add the potatoes, then the butter.","Season with salt and freshly ground black pepper and cook for 10 mins, stirring regularly, until golden brown all over. Spoon out any excess fat and stir in the persillade. Taste and adjust the seasoning if necessary."]','2026-01-10 12:19:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7290,7290,'en','Chinon apple tarts','These little French tarts are wonderfully buttery and crisp, glazed with a red wine jelly – the perfect end to a special supper for two','["375ml red wine, such as Chinon","200g jam sugar","1 star anise","1 clove","2½ cm piece cinnamon stick","pinch of allspice","½  split vanilla pod, seeds scraped out","320g pack ready-rolled all-butter puff pastry","4 tbsp light brown soft sugar","2-3 eating apples (I used Pink Lady)","3 tbsp red wine jelly (see above recipe)","100ml crème fraîche","1 tbsp icing sugar","3 cardamom pods, pods discarded and seeds ground"]','["To make the red wine jelly, put the red wine, jam sugar, star anise, clove, cinnamon stick, allspice, split vanilla pod and seeds in a medium saucepan. Stir together, then heat gently to dissolve the sugar. Turn up the heat and boil for 20 mins until reduced and syrupy. Strain into a small, sterilised jam jar and leave to cool completely. Will keep in the fridge for up to 1 month.","Take the pastry out of the fridge and leave at room temperature for 10 mins, then unroll. Heat the grill to high and heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cut out 2 x 13cm circles of pastry, using a plate as a guide, and place on a non-stick baking sheet. Sprinkle each circle with 1 tbsp sugar and grill for 5 mins to caramelise, watching carefully so that the sugar doesn’t burn. Remove from the grill. Can be done a few hours ahead, and left, covered, out of the fridge.","Peel, quarter and core the apples, cut into 2mm-thin slices and arrange on top of the pastry. Sprinkle over the remaining sugar and pop in the oven for 20-25 mins until the pastry is cooked through and golden, and the apples are softened. Remove and allow to cool slightly. Warm 3 tbsp of the red wine jelly in a small pan over a low heat with 1 tsp water to make it a little more runny, then brush over the top of the tarts.","Tip the crème fraîche into a bowl, sift over the icing sugar and cardamom, and mix together. Carefully lift the warm tarts onto serving plates and serve with the cardamom crème fraîche."]','2026-01-10 12:19:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7292,7292,'en','Fennel Dauphinoise','Potatoes gratin is a French bistro classic and this creamy version for two has mild aniseedy flavour from added fennel','["225g medium-sized potatoes, very thinly sliced","1 small fennel bulb, sliced, fronds reserved","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","75ml whole milk","100ml double cream","butter, for ramekins","2 tbsp finely grated Parmesan (or vegetarian alternative)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put\r\npotatoes, fennel, and garlic in a medium non-stick pan.\r\nPour in milk and double cream, season well and simmer\r\ngently, covered, for 10 mins, stirring halfway\r\nthrough, until potatoes are just tender.","Divide the mixture between 2 small\r\n(about 150ml) buttered ramekins and\r\nscatter with Parmesan. Bake for 40 mins until the potatoes are\r\ngolden and tender when pierced with a\r\nknife. Snip the reserved fennel fronds\r\nover before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:19:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7294,7294,'en','Lighter crème brûlée','The secret to this healthier French pud is to make the custard very thick intially as unlike your normal recipe, it’s not baked afterwards','["4 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 tbsp custard powder","1 tbsp cornflour","200ml semi-skimmed milk","2 large egg yolks","125ml single cream","1 vanilla pod","140g half-fat crème fraîche"]','["Stir 2 tbsp of the sugar, the custard\r\npowder and cornflour in a medium bowl\r\nwith 2 tbsp of the milk to make a smooth\r\npaste. Beat in the egg yolks with a fork\r\nuntil well combined. Pour the remaining\r\nmilk into a pan, preferably non-stick, then\r\npour in the cream. Slit the vanilla pod\r\nlengthways and scrape the seeds into\r\nthe milk. Drop the pod into the pan and\r\nbring the creamy milk just to the boil –\r\nas soon as you see a few bubbles rising\r\nto the surface, remove from the heat.","Slowly pour and stir the hot milk\r\ninto the cornflour mix, including the\r\nvanilla pod, making sure the yolks\r\nare well blended in. Transfer to a clean\r\npan. Cook over a low heat, stirring\r\ncontinuously with a wooden spoon, for\r\nabout 15-20 mins until the mixture is very\r\nthick – when you drag the spoon across\r\nthe bottom of the pan, it should leave\r\na clean line. It should\r\nbe much thicker after about 10 mins,\r\nbut keep stirring until the mixture has\r\nthickened sufficiently to look like softly\r\nwhipped cream or mayonnaise. Keep adjusting the heat\r\nso that the mixture does not come\r\nto the boil or overheat, as it may curdle and become lumpy. If this\r\nhappens, beat the mixture smooth\r\nwith a wire whisk.","Remove from the heat, transfer to a\r\nbowl and leave to cool for 15-20 mins,\r\nstirring occasionally to prevent a skin\r\nfrom forming. Remove the vanilla pod.\r\nStir in the crème fraîche and divide\r\nthe mixture between 4 small ramekins\r\n(about 125-150ml capacity each). Spread\r\nthe mixtures level, then chill, uncovered,\r\novernight. By not covering them, a thin\r\nskin can form on top of the brûlées,\r\nwhich will help support the caramel layer.","Before serving, spoon the remaining\r\nsugar over the top of each brûlée\r\n(allow 1½ tsp per ramekin) and smooth\r\nover with the back of the spoon. To\r\ncaramelise, use a blowtorch. Hold\r\nthe flame just above the sugar and keep\r\nit moving until evenly caramelised (don’t\r\ntake too long or you will heat up the\r\ncustard too much). If the custard looks\r\nas though it has softened slightly, put\r\nthe ramekins in the fridge for 5-10 mins\r\nto firm it up again. Serve while the\r\ncaramel is still brittle."]','2026-01-10 12:19:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7296,7296,'en','Hot chocolate soufflés with chocolate cream sauce','Light as a feather, these chocolatey melt-in-the-mouth soufflés are sure to please','["142ml pot single cream","25g caster sugar","100g dark chocolate (70% cocoa), broken into pieces","25g butter","melted butter, for greasing","50g caster sugar, plus 2 tbsp extra","175g dark chocolate (70% cocoa), broken into pieces","2 tbsp double cream","4 egg yolks","5 egg whites","2 tbsp double cream","icing sugar, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7 and place a baking tray on the top shelf. For the sauce, heat the cream and sugar until boiling. Remove from the heat, stir in the chocolate and butter until melted, then keep warm.","Brush 6 x 150ml ramekins with melted butter, sprinkle with the 2 tbsp caster sugar, then tip out any excess. Melt the chocolate and cream in a bowl over a pan of simmering water, cool, then mix in the egg yolks. Whisk the egg whites until they hold their shape, then add the sugar, 1 tbsp at a time, whisking back to the same consistency. Mix a spoonful\r\ninto the chocolate, then gently fold in the rest.","Working quickly, fill the ramekins, wipe the rims clean and run your thumb around the edges. Turn oven down to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6, place the ramekins onto the baking tray, then bake for 8-10 mins until risen with a slight wobble. Don’t open the oven door too early as this may make them collapse.","Once the soufflés are ready, dust with icing sugar, scoop a small hole from their tops, then pour in some of the hot chocolate sauce. Replace the lids and serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:19:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7298,7298,'en','Summer fish stew with rouille','Conjure up thoughts of Mediterranean holidays with this light but indulgent meal for two','["6 large, raw, shell-on prawns","3 tbsp mild olive oil","150ml dry white wine","200ml fish stock (a cube is fine)","1 small fennel bulb (about 140g/5oz) halved and thinly sliced","1 small onion, thinly sliced","3 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","1 large potato, about 200g/8oz (I used King Edward)","1 orange","1 star anise","1 bay leaf","1½ tsp harissa paste (I used Belazu)","2 tbsp tomato purée","400g can chopped tomatoes","handful mussels or clams","200g skinless, sustainably-caught white fish (I used cod loin), cut into very chunky pieces","few thyme leaves","3 tbsp bought olive oil mayonnaise","good-quality crusty bread"]','["Twist the heads from the prawns, then\r\npeel away the legs and shells, but leave\r\nthe tails intact. Devein each prawn. Fry the shells in 1 tbsp\r\noil for 5 mins, until dark pink and golden\r\nin patches. Add the wine, boil down by\r\ntwo thirds, then pour in the stock. Strain\r\ninto a jug, discarding the shells.","Heat the rest of the oil in a deep frying\r\npan or casserole. Add the fennel, onion\r\nand garlic, season, then cover and\r\ngently cook for 10 mins until softened.\r\nMeanwhile, peel the potato and cut into\r\n2cm-ish chunks. Put into a pan of cold\r\nwater, bring to the boil and cook for 5 mins\r\nuntil almost tender. Drain in a colander.","Peel a strip of zest from the orange.\r\nPut the zest, star anise, bay and ½ tsp\r\nharissa into the pan. Fry gently, uncovered,\r\nfor 5-10 mins, until the vegetables are\r\nsoft, sweet and golden.","Stir in the tomato purée, cook for 2 mins,\r\nthen add the tomatoes and stock. Simmer\r\nfor 10 mins until the sauce thickens\r\nslightly. Season to taste. The sauce can\r\nbe made ahead, then reheated later in\r\nthe day. Meantime, scrub the mussels or\r\nclams and pull away any stringy beards.\r\nAny that are open should be tapped\r\nsharply on the worktop – if they don’t\r\nclose after a few seconds, discard them.","Reheat the sauce if necessary, then stir\r\nthe potato, chunks of fish and prawns\r\nvery gently into the stew. Bring back to\r\nthe boil, then cover and gently simmer\r\nfor 3 mins. Scatter the mussels or clams\r\nover the stew, then cover and cook for\r\n2 mins more or until the shells have\r\nopened wide. Discard any that remain\r\nclosed. The chunks of fish should flake\r\neasily and the prawns should be pink\r\nthrough. Scatter with the thyme leaves.","To make the quick rouille, stir the rest\r\nof the harissa through the mayonnaise.\r\nServe the stew in bowls, topped with\r\nspoonfuls of rouille, which will melt into\r\nthe sauce and enrich it. Have some good\r\nbread ready, as you’ll definitely want to\r\nmop up the juices."]','2026-01-10 12:19:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7300,7300,'en','Niçoise stuffed baguette','For the ultimate transportable sandwich, hollow out a French stick and fill with tuna, olives, anchovies and eggs','["3 large eggs","130g can tuna in olive oil, oil reserved","1 large flute or baguette measuring approx 54cm","2 tbsp mayonnaise","3 tomatoes, ends trimmed, thickly sliced","12-24 basil leaves (depending on how herby you like it)","12 pitted Kalamata olives","8 anchovy fillets","1 shallot, finely chopped","3 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","½  tsp Dijon mustard"]','["Bring a small pan of water to the boil.\r\nAdd the eggs and boil for 10 mins. Drain,\r\nthen run the eggs under the cold tap to\r\ncool quickly. Carefully shell and cut the\r\neggs into wedge-shaped quarters.\r\nMeanwhile, mix all the ingredients for\r\nthe shallot vinaigrette with seasoning\r\nand stir in the oil from the tuna.","Slice the loaf in half lengthways, but not\r\nall the way through, so it opens up like a\r\nbook. Use your fingers to pull out any\r\nbread that easily comes away from the\r\ntop half to hollow the loaf a little.","On the bottom half of the loaf, drizzle\r\nover the vinaigrette. Stir the mayonnaise\r\ninto the tuna and spread on top. Now\r\nlayer in the tomatoes, basil, olives,\r\neggs and anchovies.","Tightly roll up in baking parchment\r\nand secure down the length with elastic\r\nbands or string. Press really well all\r\nthe way down the loaf, then chill\r\novernight. Cut into slices if feeding\r\na crowd, or into 4 lengths."]','2026-01-10 12:19:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7302,7302,'en','Tomato & caramelised onion tart tatin','A vegetarian and savoury version of tart tatin – perfect for a light supper','["50g butter","1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, cut into thin wedges","1 tsp sugar","85g butter","175g self-raising flour","50g parmesan, finely grated","small handful fresh thyme leaves","1 large free range egg yolk","25g butter","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp sugar","1 fat garlic clove, thinly sliced","5 plum tomatoes, halved lengthways","several sprigs of thyme","300g pkt cherry tomatoes"]','["Heat the butter and oil in a frying\r\npan until the butter has melted.\r\nCook the onion over a medium\r\nheat for about 10 minutes until\r\nbeautifully golden, stirring often.\r\nStir in the sugar and cook for\r\nanother couple of minutes. Tip\r\nthe onion and juices into a bowl\r\nand set aside. Preheat the oven to\r\n200C/gas 6/fan 180C.","For the pastry, rub the butter into the flour to make fine crumbs. Stir\r\nin the parmesan, thyme and a\r\npinch of salt. Add the egg yolk and\r\n2 tbsp cold water, then mix to make\r\na dough. Wrap in cling film.","For the tomatoes, heat the butter\r\nand oil in a 20cm tart tatin tin on the\r\nhob until quite hot. Stir in the sugar\r\nand garlic, then put in the plum\r\ntomatoes cut-side down with a few\r\nthyme sprigs, and sizzle for no more\r\nthan 1 minute. Scatter in the whole\r\ncherry tomatoes and tuck in a bit\r\nmore thyme. Take off the heat and\r\nspread the onions on top. Season\r\nwith salt and pepper.","Roll out the pastry until it''s slightly bigger than the top of the tin. Lay it over the onions and tuck any excess down the sides.","Bake on a baking sheet for 25 minutes until golden. Cool for 5 minutes, invert a plate over the top and upturn the tart onto it. Scatter with extra thyme and black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:19:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7304,7304,'en','Mini eclairs','Afternoon tea goes glam with these Paris patisserie-style choux pastry fingers with berry liqueur cream filling','["150ml milk","100g butter, diced","200g plain flour, sieved","4 large eggs, beaten","200ml milk","1 tsp vanilla paste, or 1 vanilla pod, split down the middle","2 large egg yolks","4 tbsp caster sugar","1 tbsp plain flour","1 tsp cornflour","200ml double cream","500g pack fondant icing sugar, sifted","food colouring","sprinkles and edible cake decoration (we used Smarties and Mini Smarties)"]','["To make the buns, heat the milk,\r\nbutter and 150ml water very gently in\r\na medium-sized saucepan until all the\r\nbutter has melted. Get the flour and\r\nsome salt ready, then increase the heat\r\nand bring the liquid to the boil. As soon\r\nas it is boiling, remove from the heat and\r\nbeat in the flour and a pinch of salt with\r\na wooden spoon. Keep beating until the\r\nmixture is smooth and comes away from\r\nthe sides of the pan. Cool for 5 mins.","Beat in the eggs, a little at a time, to a\r\nsmooth, shiny dough. Spoon into a piping\r\nbag with a 1.5-2cm plain nozzle and set\r\naside until ready to bake.","To make the filling, bring the milk just\r\nto the boil in a saucepan with the vanilla\r\npaste or split pod. Meanwhile, whisk\r\ntogether the egg yolks, sugar and flours\r\nin a mixing bowl. Pour on the hot milk\r\nwhile continuously whisking the egg\r\nmixture. Discard the pod (if using) and\r\nreturn the mix to a wiped-out saucepan.\r\nCook over a gentle heat, stirring, until the\r\nmix is thicker than a custard – it will get\r\nlumpy, but just carry on stirring and beat\r\nout the lumps. Transfer to another mixing\r\nbowl and lay cling film directly on the\r\nsurface. Leave to cool, then chill.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nLine a couple of baking sheets with\r\nbaking parchment. Pipe on 8-10cm long\r\nlengths of the dough, about 2cm wide\r\n– leaving space to expand between each\r\none. Put in the oven for 5 mins, then\r\nreduce heat to 200C/200C fan/gas 6\r\nand bake for 10 mins more until golden,\r\npuffed and crisp. Using a skewer, poke\r\n3 small holes along the base of each\r\nbun. Put back on the baking sheets, base\r\nup, and return to the oven for a further\r\n8-10 mins until slightly crisper. Cool. Can\r\nbe frozen for up to a month, or stored in an airtight container for up to 3 days –\r\njust crisp up in a hot oven again when\r\nready to fill.","Add the cream to the thick custard\r\nfilling and beat with an electric whisk\r\nuntil it holds its own shape again. Put into\r\na piping bag with a tiny nozzle, then pipe\r\nsome filling into the bottom of the buns\r\nusing the skewer holes you made before\r\n(see Secrets of success, below). When it\r\nsquirts back out, that bit is probably full.","Stir the icing sugar, plus just enough water to make a pretty thick icing. Divide among as many bowls as you want colours, and colour each batch as you like. (Depending on your colouring, you may need to add a drop more water to icings so that they are thick but runny.)","Dip the top of each eclair in icing to cover, or use a teaspoon to spread a little on – use less at first and wait for it to spread and settle. Add sprinkles and decorations, then gently sit on wire racks to set. Eclairs are best eaten on the day they are filled and decorated, before they go soggy."]','2026-01-10 12:19:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7306,7306,'en','Brie wrapped in prosciutto & brioche','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis decadent bake from Paul Hollywood combines slightly sweet French bread with a creamy ham and cheese filling','["375g strong white bread flour","50g caster sugar","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","75ml milk","3 large eggs, plus 2 beaten eggs for glazing","185g unsalted butter, softened","250g round brie","8 slices prosciutto"]','["Mix the flour, 1 tsp salt, caster sugar, yeast, milk and eggs together in a mixer using the dough attachment for 5 mins until the dough is smooth. Add the butter and mix for a further 4 mins on medium speed. Scrape the dough bowl and mix again for 1 min. Place the dough in a container, cover with cling film and leave in the fridge for at least 6 hrs before using.","Wrap the Brie in the prosciutto and set aside. Turn out the dough onto a lightly floured surface. Roll into a 25cm circle. Place the wrapped Brie in the middle of the circle and fold the edges in neatly. Put the parcel onto a baking tray lined with baking parchment and brush with beaten egg. Chill in the fridge for 30 mins, then brush again with beaten egg and chill for a further 30 mins. Leave to rise for 1 hr at room temperature. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, then bake for 22 mins. Serve warm."]','2026-01-10 12:19:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7308,7308,'en','The ultimate makeover: French onion soup','Angela Nilsen gives the French classic a makeover, losing the butter and beef stock to make a lighter soup that’s still full of flavour','["4 large Spanish onions (about 900g/2lb)","3 tbsp extra virgin rapeseed oil","4 thyme sprigs","2 bay leaves","300ml dry white wine","1 rounded tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp Swiss vegetable bouillon","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp extra virgin rapeseed oil","4 long slices from a baguette","25g parmesan, or vegetarian alternative, coarsely grated","50g Gruyère, coarsely grated"]','["Cut the onions in half lengthways, then slice\r\ndown into very thin slices. Heat a very large\r\npan, add the oil when hot, stir in the onions,\r\n3 of the thyme sprigs and the bay leaves, then\r\nseason with a little salt. It will seem like a lot\r\nof onions, but they reduce right down. Cook\r\nover a high heat for 5 mins, stirring often. The\r\nonions shouldn’t brown yet, just start to soften.\r\nLower the heat, then cook slowly for 35 mins,\r\nuncovered, stirring often until the onions have\r\nreduced right down and are very soft.","While the onions are cooking, bring the wine\r\nto a boil in a small pan, then bubble away for\r\n30 secs. Remove and leave to cool. Tip the flour\r\ninto a small heavy pan and toast over a medium\r\nheat for a few mins, stirring occasionally, until\r\nlight brown in colour. Set aside.","When the onions are very soft and reduced,\r\nturn up the heat so they caramelise, then cook\r\nfor another 12-15 mins, stirring along the\r\nbottom of the pan occasionally to mix in the\r\nbrown sticky bits. When the bottom of the pan\r\nand all the onions are sticky and a rich brown\r\ncolour, stir in the flour. With the heat still high,\r\ngradually pour in the wine, again stirring in the\r\nbits from the bottom. Pour in 1.2 litres of cold\r\nwater. Stir in the bouillon, then slowly bring\r\neverything to the boil. Skim off any froth from\r\nthe surface. Simmer for 15 mins so all the\r\nflavours can mingle.","While the soup simmers, make the topping.\r\nHeat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Mix the\r\ngarlic and the oil together. Brush all over the\r\nbread slices, then cut each one into cubes.\r\nScatter over a baking sheet, then bake for\r\n8-10 mins until golden. Set aside. Line a\r\nbaking sheet with baking parchment or a\r\nsheet of non-stick silicone. Remove the leaves\r\nfrom the remaining thyme sprig, then mix\r\nwith the grated Parmesan. Scatter and spread\r\nover the lined baking sheet into a 13 x 8cm\r\nrectangle. Bake for about 8 mins until melted\r\nand turning golden. Remove, leave to firm up,\r\nthen snap into jagged pieces.","To serve, remove and discard the herbs from\r\nthe soup. Ladle the soup into bowls – scatter\r\nover a few croutons, the Gruyère and a grinding\r\nof pepper, then perch a Parmesan crisp on\r\ntop. Serve any remaining croutons separately."]','2026-01-10 12:19:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7310,7310,'en','Ultimate French omelette','The omelette is one of the most fundamental dishes in any cook''s arsenal, and this recipe will teach you how to get it right every time','["3 eggs, as fresh as possible, preferably organic and free-range, room temperature","2 knobs unsalted butter","1 tsp finely, freshly grated parmesan (or vegetarian alternative)","2-3 chopped tarragon leaves","1 tbsp each snipped chives and chopped chervil or parsley","3 rounded tbsp finely grated Gruyère"]','["Get everything ready. Warm a 20cm (measured across the top) non-stick frying pan on a medium heat. Crack the eggs into a bowl and beat them with a fork so they break up and mix, but not as completely as you would for scrambled egg. With the heat on medium-hot, drop one knob of butter into the pan. It should bubble and sizzle, but not brown. Season the eggs with the Parmesan and a little salt and pepper, and pour into the pan.","Let the eggs bubble slightly for a couple of seconds, then take a wooden fork or spatula and gently draw the mixture in from the sides of the pan a few times, so it gathers in folds in the centre. Leave for a few seconds, then stir again to lightly combine uncooked egg with cooked. Leave briefly again, and when partly cooked, stir a bit faster, stopping while there’s some barely cooked egg left. With the pan flat on the heat, shake it back and forth a few times to settle the mixture. It should slide easily in the pan and look soft and moist on top. A quick burst of heat will brown the underside.","Grip the handle underneath. Tilt the pan down away from you and let the omelette fall to the edge. Fold the side nearest to you over by a third with your fork, and keep it rolling over, so the omelette tips onto a plate – or fold it in half, if that’s easier. For a neat finish, cover the omelette with a piece of kitchen paper and plump it up a bit with your fingers. Rub the other knob of butter over to glaze. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:19:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7312,7312,'en','Prawn & fennel bisque','A luxurious seafood soup that is rich in flavour, perfect for formal entertaining and low in calories too','["450g raw tiger prawns in their shells","4 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","1 large fennel bulb, chopped, fronds reserved","2 carrots, chopped","150ml dry white wine","1 tbsp brandy","400g can chopped tomatoes","1l fish stock","2 generous pinches paprika","150ml pot double cream","8 tiger prawns, shelled, but tail tips left on (optional)","fennel fronds (optional)"]','["Shell the prawns, then fry the shells in the oil in a large pan for about 5 mins. Add the onion, fennel and carrots and cook for about 10 mins until the veg start to soften. Pour in the wine and brandy, bubble hard for about 1 min to drive off the alcohol, then add the tomatoes, stock and paprika. Cover and simmer for 30 mins. Meanwhile, chop the prawns.","Blitz the soup as finely as you can with a stick blender or food processor, then press through a sieve into a bowl. Spend a bit of time really working the mixture through the sieve as this will give the soup its velvety texture.","Tip back into a clean pan, add the prawns and cook for 10 mins, then blitz again until smooth. You can make and chill this a day ahead or freeze it for 1 month. Thaw ovenight in the fridge. To serve, gently reheat in a pan with the cream. If garnishing, cook the 8 prawns in a little butter. Spoon into small bowls and top with the prawns and snipped fennel fronds."]','2026-01-10 12:19:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7314,7314,'en','Pistachio & raspberry pithiviers','Frangipane and berry individual puff pastry parcels – for a special touch decorate with your guests’ initials','["140g shelled unsalted pistachios","100g caster sugar","100g butter, diced","2 medium eggs","3 tbsp plain flour, plus extra for dusting","500g pack puff pastry","24 raspberries, defrosted if frozen","red edible glitter and gold spray to decorate (optional)"]','["Whizz together the pistachios,\r\nsugar, butter, 1 egg and the flour\r\nin a food processor to an almost\r\nsmooth frangipane.","Roll the pastry into a ball (to break\r\nup some of the layers), then roll out\r\nvery thinly on a flour-dusted surface.\r\nCut out 4 x 11cm circles and 4 x 13cm\r\ncircles – you’ll probably need to re-roll\r\nonce. Save all the trimmings.","Put 6 raspberries in the centre of each\r\nof the 4 smaller circles, then dollop on\r\nsome pistachio frangipane. Using a small\r\npalette or round-bladed knife, spread and\r\nsmooth the mixture into a dome, covering\r\nand enclosing the raspberries – leave a\r\ngood 1cm of pastry clear around the edge.\r\nBeat the second egg and brush a little\r\naround the pastry edges. Carefully lay the\r\nlarger circles of pastry on top, easing and\r\npressing them over the filling bit by bit,\r\nall the way around, to squeeze out any\r\nair. Reshape the pithiviers to give a nice\r\nround dome shape, press the edges to\r\nseal, then trim any excess pastry around\r\nthe edges if you need to. Brush egg over\r\nall the pithiviers.","Decorate the tops by lightly scoring\r\na pattern with the tip of a sharp knife.\r\nPinch the edges to seal, then crimp to\r\ngive a fluted edge. If you like, brush egg\r\nover some of the rolled-out trimmings,\r\nthen brush with edible glitter. Use letter\r\ncutters to cut out the initials of your\r\nguests, or any other shapes you like.\r\nSpray other trimmings with gold spray\r\nand stamp out more shapes. Decorate\r\nwith the shapes and cover loosely with\r\ncling film. Chill for at least 2 hrs, but more\r\nif you can. Can be made 1 day in advance.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nBake the pithiviers for 20-25 mins until\r\ngolden and crisp. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:19:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7316,7316,'en','White chocolate crème brûlée','Serve this super-creamy chocolate dessert on its own, or as part of an ‘assiete’ of mini chocolate puddings','["568ml pot double cream","100g Green & Black''s white chocolate, broken into pieces","1 vanilla pod, split or 1 tsp vanilla extract","6 egg yolks","2 tbsp golden caster sugar, plus extra for topping"]','["Heat the cream, chocolate and vanilla pod\r\nin a pan until the chocolate has melted. Take\r\noff the heat and allow to infuse for 10 mins,\r\nscraping the pod seeds into the cream. If\r\nusing the vanilla extract, add straight away.\r\nHeat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3.","Beat yolks and sugar until pale. stir in the\r\nchocolate cream. Strain into a jug and pour\r\ninto ramekins. Place in a deep roasting tray\r\nand pour boiling water halfway up the sides.\r\nBake for 15-20 mins until just set with a wobbly\r\ncentre. Chill in the fridge for at least 4 hrs.","To serve, sprinkle some sugar on top of the\r\nbrûlées and caramelise with a blowtorch or\r\nbriefly under a hot grill. Leave caramel to\r\nharden, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7318,7318,'en','Apricot French toast','Put a sweet twist on eggy bread with this indulgent brunch-time recipe','["50g butter","6 apricots, halved and stoned","200g/8oz caramel sauce (we used Bonne Maman confiture de caramel)","350g ready-made vanilla custard","8 small, thick slices brioche or white bread, or 4 large slices, cut diagonally"]','["Melt 1 tbsp butter in a medium-size\r\nfrying pan. Put in the apricots, cut-side\r\ndown, and gently fry for 2-3 mins. Flip\r\nover and cook for 1 min more until lightly\r\ngolden. Add the caramel to the pan and\r\nmelt until saucy – if it’s still too thick to coat\r\nthe fruit, add a splash of water. Keep warm.","Mix the custard with 4 tbsp of water\r\nto loosen, then dip in the bread slices,\r\nturning to coat thoroughly. Melt half the\r\nremaining butter in a large non-stick\r\nfrying pan. Lightly shake off any excess\r\ncustard mixture from half the bread\r\nslices and fry in the butter for 2 mins\r\neach side until golden. Repeat with\r\nremaining butter and bread, then serve\r\nhot with the caramel apricots."]','2026-01-10 12:19:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7320,7320,'en','French-style chicken with peas & bacon','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis creamy one-pot chicken dish is a great-value way of feeding the whole family','["6 rashers smoked streaky bacon, chopped","8 skinless, boneless chicken thighs","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","1 bunch spring onions, roughly chopped","300ml hot chicken stock","250g frozen peas","1 Little Gem lettuce, roughly shredded","2 tbsp crème fraîche"]','["In a large frying pan, dry-fry the bacon\r\nover a medium heat for 3 mins until the\r\nfat is released and the bacon is golden.\r\nTransfer the bacon to a small bowl,\r\nleaving the fat in the pan. Add the\r\nchicken and brown for 4 mins each side.","Push the chicken to one side of the pan\r\nand tip in the garlic and spring onions,\r\ncooking for about 30 secs, just until the\r\nspring onion stalks are bright green. Pour\r\nin the chicken stock, return the bacon to\r\nthe pan, cover and simmer for 15 mins.","Increase heat under the pan. Tip the\r\npeas and lettuce into the sauce and cook\r\nfor 4 mins, covered, until the peas are\r\ntender and the lettuce has just wilted.\r\nCheck chicken is cooked through. Stir\r\nin the crème fraîche just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:19:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7321,7321,'en','Vietnamese lamb shanks with sweet potatoes','Meltingly tender and full of classic Asian flavours, these lamb shanks are perfect for freezing','["2 tbsp groundnut oil","4 lamb shanks, about 350g each","2 onions, halved and cut into half moons","2 tbsp finely chopped fresh root ginger","3 garlic cloves, finely sliced","2 red chillies, both deseeded, one chopped and one thinly sliced","1 tbsp soft brown sugar, plus 1 tsp","3 star anise","2 lemongrass stalks, tough outer leaves removed, then bruised","1.2l lamb stock","1½  tbsp tomato purée","4 sweet potatoes, peeled and cut into big chunks","2 tbsp fish sauce","juice 2 limes","big handful mint leaves, torn","handful basil leaves"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Heat 1 tbsp oil in a heavy-bottomed casserole, season the shanks, then brown them 2 at a time on all sides, adding the remaining oil for the second batch. Remove the lamb and add the onions. Fry them quite briskly, about 30 secs, add the ginger, garlic and chopped chilli, then turn the heat down and cook for 1 min. Add 1 tbsp sugar, stir, then add the star anise, lemongrass, stock, purée and seasoning. Bring to the boil.","Cover and cook in the oven for 1½ hrs, then add the sweet potatoes and cook for 1 hr more. The lamb should be completely tender and almost falling off the bones. Stir in the fish sauce, lime juice and 1 tsp sugar to just lift the flavour, then scatter with the mint, basil and the sliced chilli to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7322,7322,'en','Three-cheese soufflés','With a double layer of goat''s cheese and a coating of cream, these bistro-style bakes are authentically rich','["50g butter, plus extra for greasing","25g parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), finely grated","300ml full-fat milk","2 bay leaves","5 tbsp plain flour","½  tsp English mustard powder","pinch of cayenne pepper","140g Gruyère (or vegetarian alternative), grated","3 eggs, separated","8 slices goat''s cheese (see ''Try'', below)","150ml double cream","salad leaves, to serve (see ''Try'', below)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/\r\ngas 6 and butter 4 small (about\r\n200ml) ramekins. Sprinkle the\r\nParmesan into the ramekins, turning\r\nuntil all sides are covered. Place\r\nthe milk and bay leaves in a large\r\nsaucepan over a gentle heat and\r\nbring to the boil. Turn off the heat\r\nand leave to infuse for 15 mins.","Discard the bay leaves, add the\r\nbutter and flour, and return to a\r\nlow heat. Very gently simmer,\r\nstirring continuously with a balloon\r\nwhisk, for about 6 mins until you get\r\na smooth, thick white sauce. Make\r\nsure that you get right into the\r\ncorners of the pan to stop the sauce\r\nfrom catching or becoming lumpy.","Once thickened, transfer the\r\nsauce to a large bowl and\r\nstir in the mustard powder,\r\ncayenne pepper, Gruyère and egg\r\nyolks until fully combined.","In a spotlessly clean bowl\r\nand with a clean whisk,\r\nbeat the egg whites just\r\nuntil peaks begin to form.","Carefully fold the egg whites\r\ninto the cheese sauce in three\r\nstages making sure you fold,\r\nrather than stir, to keep the egg\r\nwhites light and airy. Fill the prepared\r\nramekins with the soufflé mix.","Top each soufflé with a slice\r\nof goat’s cheese, then place\r\non a baking tray. Bake for\r\n20-25 mins or until springy and well\r\nrisen but cooked through.","Leave to cool, then run a knife\r\naround the edge of each dish\r\nand remove the soufflés.If preparing in advance, place soufflés\r\nupside down (for neat presentation), on\r\na tray. Cover tray in cling film. Chill for\r\na few days or freeze for up to 1 month.","When ready to re-bake, heat\r\noven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPlace the upside-down\r\nsoufflés in a shallow baking dish,\r\ntop with the remaining goat’s cheese\r\nslices and pour over the cream (this\r\nstops them from drying out when\r\nbaked for the second time). Cook\r\nfor 8-10 mins until golden. Serve\r\nimmediately alongside some\r\nsimply dressed salad."]','2026-01-10 12:19:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7324,7324,'en','Garlic & herb roast lamb on boulangère potatoes','Cooking succulent lamb and herby potatoes together means the potatoes absorb all the lovely juices','["2kg leg of lamb","4 garlic cloves, sliced","few rosemary sprigs","few thyme sprigs","2kg large potatoes, such as King Edwards","2 onions, thinly sliced","600ml chicken stock","50g butter"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nCut small pockets into the skin and flesh\r\nof the lamb by piercing it with the point of\r\na sharp knife. Stuff each pocket with a\r\nslice of garlic and a few leaves of rosemary,\r\nor scatter with thyme. Put in a roasting\r\ntin, season well with salt and freshly\r\nground black pepper, then cover with foil.","Peel and thinly slice the potatoes, rinse\r\nunder the cold tap and pile into a large\r\novenproof dish or roasting tin. Toss with\r\nthe onions, remaining slices of garlic and\r\na good scattering of herbs.","Heat the stock and butter together, then\r\npour over the potatoes. Cover the dish\r\nwith foil and bake in the oven with the\r\nlamb for 1 hr. Uncover, put the lamb on\r\ntop of the potatoes and roast uncovered\r\nfor 45 mins more. Allow the lamb to rest\r\nbefore carving, for about 15 mins. Leave\r\nthe potatoes in the oven (covered, if\r\nstarting to brown too much) until ready\r\nto serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7325,7325,'en','Next-level moussaka','Conjure memories of a Greek holiday with this marvellous make-ahead moussaka, which is ideal for feeding a crowd, served with a simple side salad','["100ml olive oil","500g lamb mince","1 onion , finely chopped","3 large garlic cloves , crushed","½ tsp light brown soft sugar","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","400g can chopped tomatoes","200ml red wine","1 tbsp dried oregano","1 cinnamon stick","2 bay leaves","3 aubergines","mixed salad leaves , to serve","500ml Greek yogurt","1 egg , plus 1 yolk, lightly beaten (freeze the white for another recipe)","50g parmesan , grated","pinch of grated nutmeg","100g feta , crumbled"]','["Heat 2 tbsp of the olive oil in a pan over a medium-low heat, crumble in the mince and cook for 15-20 mins. Itwill release some liquid but once that has bubbled away, the mince will sizzle in its own fat and start to brown and caramelise. At this point, stir the mince with a wooden spoon.","Stir in the onion and continue to cook for 10 mins until it’s softened. Add the garlic and cook for a minute more. Scatter the sugar over, then stir through the tomato purée and cook until it’s toasted and starts to stick to the pan. Splash in the vinegar and let it simmer for a minute. Tip in the canned tomatoes, then use the wine to swill out the can and tip into the sauce. Season with salt and pepper, scatter in the oregano, nestle in the cinnamon stick and bay leaves, bring to a simmer and cook gently, stirring occasionally, for 40 mins until you have a thick ragu. Remove from the heat, fish out the bay and cinnamon, and stir through another 1 tbsp of the olive oil.","While the ragu is cooking, cut the tops off the aubergines, then cut lengthways into 1cm thick slices. Put in a bowl and lightly salt, and set aside for 20 mins until they soften and become droopy. Drizzle liberally with the rest of the olive oil and toss well. Heat a griddle pan over a high heat and cook the slices on both sides for a few minutes until soft and lightly charred. You’ll need to do this in batches. Leave to cool slightly on a plate. (This can also be done on a barbecue if you have time.)","For the topping, tip the yogurt into a bowl with the whole egg and yolk, half the parmesan, the nutmeg and some salt and pepper, then whisk until combined. Spoon a third of the meat into a large rectangular ovenproof dish (ours was roughly 20 x 30cm) and spread out evenly, lay half the aubergine on top, then another third of the meat sauce followed by the remaining slices of aubergine. Pour in the last of the lamb sauce, then spoon over the yogurt mix smoothing it to the edges. Scatter the feta over along with the rest of the parmesan. Will keep chilled for two days.","Heat the oven to 200C/180 fan/gas 4. Bake the moussaka for 50 mins or until deep golden brown. Set aside for at least 10 mins to cool before serving with a side salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7327,7327,'en','BBQ chicken gyros with dill & cabbage salad','Impress at your next barbecue with these Greek-inspired marinated chicken skewers and crunchy dill & white cabbage salad, or simply grill indoors if it’s raining','["½ white cabbage , core removed, finely shredded","10g dill , roughly chopped","1 lemon , zested and juiced","3 tbsp olive oil","3 tomatoes , halved and sliced","1 red onion , finely sliced","500g full-fat Greek yogurt","125ml olive oil","1 large lemon , zested and juiced","4 garlic cloves , crushed","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tbsp ground cumin","2 tsp smoked paprika","2 tsp dried oregano","1 tsp cayenne pepper","½ tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp crushed black pepper","1kg Morrisons Chicken Thigh Fillets","chips, pitta or flatbreads and tzatziki"]','["Combine all the ingredients for the chicken, except for the chicken, in a bowl with 1 tsp salt. Mix in the chicken and stir well to coat, then leave to marinate in the fridge for up to 24 hrs, or for at least 2 hrs.","Once marinated, thread the Morrisons chicken onto 2 large metal skewers, so that both skewers go through the meat. Discard any remaining marinade. Toss all the ingredients for the salad together in a large bowl and season to taste..","Heat your BBQ to medium-high if using gas, or for charcoal BBQs, light and let the flames die down and the coals go white. Put the chicken skewers on the BBQ, cover with the lid and cook for 15-20 mins, turning until they''re charred on all sides, or until a cooking thermometer inserted into the thickest part reads 70C. Remove to a baking tray to rest, covered, for 15-20 mins. Alternatively, place on a foil-lined tray and grill for 15 mins on each side until charred and cooked through.","Once rested, lift and carve down the skewers into thin slices and bring to the table along with the salad. To serve, pile into pittas with the salad, chips and some tzatziki, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7329,7329,'en','Lamb & spinach spanakopita','Make this stunning spanakopita – ‘spinach pie’. Traditionally made with filo pastry, feta and spinach, here we’ve added lamb, slow-cooked in stock','["2 tbsp olive oil","800g lamb neck or shoulder, cut into chunks","500ml lamb or chicken stock","1 cinnamon stick","1 bay leaf","1 tbsp butter","1 onion, finely sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp ground coriander","1 heaped tbsp ground cumin","1 heaped tsp ground cinnamon","500g spinach","150g feta, crumbled","1⁄2 small bunch of mint, leaves picked and finely chopped","2 tbsp pine nuts, toasted","1 egg, lightly beaten","100g butter, melted","270g filo pastry","2 tbsp sesame seeds"]','["Heat half the oil in a casserole pot over a medium-high heat and fry the lamb for 5-7 mins, or until deep brown all over. Cover with the stock, then add the cinnamon stick and bay leaf, and bring to a simmer. Cover and cook for 11/2 hrs, or until the lamb is tender and falling apart.","Heat the remaining oil and the butter in a frying pan, then fry the onions with a large pinch of salt for 15-20 mins, or until golden and sticky. Add the garlic and spices, and cook for 3 mins more. Remove the lamb from its stewing liquid (reserving the liquid), transfer to a chopping board and shred using two forks. Stir the shredded meat into the onion mixture, along with 50ml of the reserved liquid.","Put the spinach in a pan with 1 tbsp water, and cook for 3-4 mins, or until wilted. Wrap in a clean tea towel and squeeze out the excess liquid, or put in a fine sieve and press it out using the back of a wooden spoon. Roughly chop the spinach, then stir into the lamb and onion mixture along with the feta, mint, pine nuts and egg. Season.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, and brush a 22cm round springform cake tin with some of the melted butter. Layer four sheets of filo pastry across the tin, then brush with more melted butter. Spoon in the filling, and fold the overhanging pastry over the top. Scrunch up the remaining pastry sheets, put on top of the pie, and brush with the remaining melted butter. Sprinkle with the sesame seeds. Bake for 45-50 mins, or until golden and crisp. Will keep in the fridge for up to up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:19:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7331,7331,'en','Leek & globe artichoke pie','Make this Greek-inspired pie as a centrepiece dish for a special occasion. Encased in fabulous filo pastry, it''s packed with leeks, artichokes and cheese','["3 tbsp olive oil","3 leeks, trimmed, washed and chopped into fine rings","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","255g cooked artichoke hearts (drained of oil), sliced","250g ricotta, drained","55g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated","1 medium egg","½  small bunch of dill, chopped","½  small bunch of parsley, chopped","250g pack filo pastry (10-12 sheets)","85g butter, melted","½  tbsp sesame seeds"]','["Heat the olive oil in a heavy-bottomed pan and add the leeks and onion. Season and cook over a medium heat until the leeks and onion are soft, stirring frequently. Add the garlic and cook for another 2 mins. Make sure that the mixture isn’t too ‘wet’ or it will make your pie soggy. If it is, turn the heat up to cook off the excess moisture. Add the artichoke, then set aside to cool.","Mix together the ricotta, parmesan, egg and herbs together in a large bowl, then tip in the cooled vegetables. Season and mix with a fork.","Clear a big space on your work surface or kitchen table – you’re going to construct a pastry that is one metre wide. Take one piece of filo, put it on the work surface with the long side facing you and brush it with butter. Put two more pieces on top, brushing each one with butter. Now do the same again with three layers, overlapping the previous sheets to the left side by about 3cm. Keep doing this until you have one metre of overlapping buttered pastry sheets.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and put in a baking sheet to warm up. Spoon the filling in a thin layer onto the pastry, about 2.5cm from the edge. Keep going until you have filled the entire length. Carefully roll this up, working from the edge nearest you, until you have a long sausage shape. You need to be firm, but don’t roll too tightly or the filo will split. You should have a couple of unused sheets of filo left, so use these to patch things up, if you need to.","Working from one end of the sausage shape, coil the pastry, then carefully transfer onto a baking sheet (about the same size as the one warming in the oven).","Brush the pie with butter, sprinkle over the sesame seeds, then slide the baking sheet onto the one that’s already in the oven (this helps to ensure even cooking). Bake for 30-35 mins, or until golden. Leave the pie to cool a little before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:19:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7333,7333,'en','Greek lamb meatballs','Prep these comforting Greek lamb meatballs with chargrilled veg and potatoes in just five minutes. A guaranteed family favourite, perfect for busy weeknights','["2 tbsp olive oil","500g lamb meatballs","300g baby new potatoes, thickly sliced","2 large garlic cloves, crushed","185g chargrilled vegetables, drained if in oil","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes with herbs","2 tsp light brown soft sugar","100g black olives","40g feta, crumbled","½ small bunch mint, finely shredded","1 lemon, zested"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large shallow flameproof casserole or frying pan over a medium heat. Add the meatballs and fry for 5 mins or until golden brown. Set aside on a plate.","Heat the remaining oil in the same pan and fry the potatoes over a medium heat for 5 mins, or until they’re starting to turn golden brown.","Add the garlic to the pan and fry for 1 min. Stir through the chargrilled veg, tomatoes and sugar, as well as the olives. Season. Add the meatballs back to the pan, cover and cook over a medium-low heat for 30-35 mins, stirring occasionally. Remove the lid halfway through, the potatoes should be just cooked through with the liquid slightly reduced.","Remove the pan from the heat and serve at the table with the feta, mint and lemon zest scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7335,7335,'en','Artichoke, aubergine & lamb moussaka','A lightly spiced lamb bake with artichoke hearts, a cherry tomato ragu and layers of fried aubergine and potato','["olive oil, for frying","1kg lamb mince","2 large onions, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, chopped","2 x 395g cans cherry tomatoes in thick juice","2 bay leaves","1 cinnamon stick","½  tsp dried oregano","pinch of sugar","2 medium aubergines","700g large potatoes","2 x 390g cans artichoke hearts, drained really well (see tip)","100g butter","100g plain flour","900ml milk","very generous grating of nutmeg","125g grated Gruyère","25g grated Parmesan","3 medium eggs, lightly beaten"]','["Heat 1 1/2 tbsp olive oil in a broad, heavy-bottomed pan until hot, then fry the lamb until golden brown all over, about 10 mins (it’s important that the oil is hot, otherwise you’ll end up steaming the lamb instead of frying it). Remove with a slotted spoon and set aside in a large bowl. Pour off all but 2 tbsp oil in the pan (the lamb will release quite a bit). Heat this and fry the onions over a medium heat until soft and golden. Add the garlic and cook for another few mins, then add the tomatoes, bay, cinnamon, oregano, sugar and seasoning. Bring to the boil, then turn down to a simmer. Return the meat to the pan, cover and cook for 40 mins over a low heat. Take off the lid and cook until you have a thick sauce (it shouldn’t be too ‘soupy’).","While the meat is cooking, cut the aubergines into rounds. Cut the potatoes into thin slices. Heat 2 tbsp olive oil in a frying pan and cook the aubergine in batches until golden on both sides (get two pans on the go if you have them), then turn down the heat and cook until soft. Season and remove from the pan. Add a little more oil and cook the potatoes in batches, on both sides, until pale gold, removing them as you go. You’ll need to add more oil to the pan when you fry each batch. Season and set aside.","Fry the artichoke hearts in olive oil over a high heat to get some colour, but be careful that they don’t fall apart. Season.","Remove the bay leaves and cinnamon stick from the meat and taste for seasoning. Layer up the moussaka in a dish measuring roughly 32 x 23 x 6cm. Start by putting all the potatoes in the bottom, then add half the meat. Arrange a layer of aubergine on top of this, then the rest of the meat. Spoon the artichoke hearts on top.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. To make the sauce, melt the butter in a heavy-bottomed pan and stir in the flour until it becomes slightly dry and sandy in colour. Take off the heat and start to add the milk, a little at a time. Beat well after each addition and keep the mixture smooth. Keep adding until you have used up all the milk. Put the pan back on a medium heat and bring to the boil, stirring continuously, until it thickens to form a sauce. Add lots of nutmeg, salt and pepper. Turn down the heat and cook gently for about 5 mins – this just helps to cook the flour in the sauce. Add three-quarters of the cheese and stir to help it to melt. Check the seasoning – it needs assertive seasoning. Leave to cool a little, then beat in the eggs.","Pour this over the layers in the dish and scatter the remaining cheese on top. Bake in the oven for 30 mins until the top is brown and bubbling. Leave to cool for about 10 mins – Greeks never eat it piping hot – then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7337,7337,'en','Lamb kleftiko','Seal a leg of lamb in a parcel then roast it long and slow with garlic, lemon and herbs, and potatoes to soak up the delicious juices','["6 garlic cloves","3 tbsp roughly chopped oregano","1 tbsp roughly chopped rosemary","zest 1 lemon and juice of 2","½  tsp ground cinnamon","3 tbsp olive oil","2kg leg of lamb","1kg Desiree potatoes, halved or quartered","5 bay leaves","250g Greek yogurt","juice ½ lemon","1 tbsp olive oil","handful mint, shredded","1½  tsp red wine vinegar","1½  tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","100g baby spinach","small bunch parsley, roughly chopped","½  red onion, finely sliced","175g cherry tomatoes, halved","½  cucumber, halved lengthways, deseeded and sliced","75g black kalamata olives, stoned and quartered"]','["Crush together the garlic cloves\r\nand 1 tsp salt using a pestle and mortar.\r\nAdd the herbs, lemon zest, cinnamon,\r\nsome black pepper, crush a little more,\r\nthen stir through 2 tbsp of the olive oil.\r\nUsing a sharp knife, create lots of holes\r\nall over the lamb, and rub in the paste,\r\npushing it deep into the holes. Transfer\r\nthe lamb to a large food bag, pour in the\r\nlemon juice and marinate overnight.","The next day, take the lamb out of the\r\nfridge 1 hr before you want to cook it.\r\nHeat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Lay\r\n2 long pieces of baking parchment on top\r\nof 2 long pieces of foil – one widthways,\r\nthe other lengthways to form a cross.\r\nPop the potatoes in the centre of the\r\nparchment and toss with the remaining\r\noil and some seasoning. Bring up the\r\nsides of the foil, then pour the marinade\r\nfrom the lamb over the potatoes and throw in the bay leaves. Set the lamb on\r\ntop of the potatoes and scrunch the foil\r\ntogether tightly to completely enclose\r\nthe lamb. Lift into a roasting tin and roast\r\nin the oven for 4½ hrs until very tender.","Remove tin from the oven and increase\r\nthe temperature to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nUnwrap the parcel and scrunch the foil\r\nand parchment under the rim of the tin,\r\nbaste the lamb with the juices and return\r\nto the oven for a further 20 mins until\r\nbrowned. Remove the lamb from the tin,\r\nwrap in foil and rest. Turn the potatoes\r\nover and return to the oven for 30 mins,\r\nthen season with salt.","While the potatoes are cooking, stir\r\ntogether all the ingredients for the\r\nyogurt. Combine the red wine vinegar, oil\r\nand some seasoning to make a dressing\r\nfor the salad. Toss together the remaining\r\nsalad ingredients, adding the dressing\r\nwhen you’re ready to eat. Serve the lamb\r\nwith the potatoes and meaty juices, with\r\nthe salad and yogurt on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:19:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7339,7339,'en','Lamb burgers with tzatziki','Homemade burgers are always a winner – try this low-calorie, Greek spin with cucumber and mint yogurt and spicy patties','["25g bulghar wheat","500g extra-lean lamb mince","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp smoked paprika","1 garlic clove, very finely crushed (optional)","oil, for brushing","large burger buns, sliced tomato and red onion, to serve","5cm piece cucumber, deseeded and coarsely grated","200g pot thick Greek yogurt","2 tbsp chopped mint, plus a handful of leaves to serve"]','["Tip the bulghar into a pan, cover\r\nwith water and boil for 10 mins. Drain\r\nreally well in a sieve, pressing out any\r\nexcess water.","To make the tzatziki, squeeze and\r\ndiscard the juice from the cucumber,\r\nthen mix into the yogurt with the\r\nchopped mint and a little salt.","Work the bulghar into the lamb with\r\nthe spices, garlic (if using) and seasoning,\r\nthen shape into 4 burgers. Brush with\r\na little oil and fry or barbecue for about\r\n5 mins each side until cooked all the way\r\nthrough. Serve in the buns (toasted if you\r\nlike) with the tzatziki, tomatoes, onion\r\nand a few mint leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:19:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7341,7341,'en','Greek lamb & macaroni bake','A cross between moussaka and macaroni cheese, this thrifty Mediterranean pasta bake makes for a hearty meal','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","500g lean lamb mince","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 beef or lamb stock cube","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp dried oregano","400g macaroni","250g tub ricotta","50g parmesan, grated","50ml milk","garlic bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the\r\nonion and cook for 10 mins until soft.\r\nAdd the garlic and cook for 1 min more,\r\nthen tip in the lamb mince, turn up the\r\nheat and brown, breaking up the mince\r\nwith a wooden spoon.","Once the lamb is browned, add\r\nthe cinnamon, crumbled stock cube,\r\ntomatoes and oregano. Stir well and\r\nsimmer for 15 mins, covered, then for\r\n15 mins, uncovered, until the sauce\r\nhas thickened and the tomatoes have\r\ncooked down.","Meanwhile, cook the macaroni\r\nfollowing pack instructions. Drain well.\r\nHeat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Mix together the ricotta, most of the\r\nParmesan and the milk with plenty of\r\nseasoning, and stir into the macaroni.\r\nTip the mince into a large baking dish, top\r\nwith the macaroni mixture, and scatter\r\nover the remaining Parmesan. Bake for\r\n30 mins until golden and bubbling. Serve\r\nhot with garlic bread, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7343,7343,'en','Greek lamb with potatoes & olives','Entertain the easy way with this quick-to-prepare rustic one-pot – just serve with crusty bread','["800g medium-size potatoes, skin on, thinly sliced","4 large tomatoes, thinly sliced","1 aubergine, thinly sliced","4 garlic cloves, chopped","3 tbsp oregano leaves, plus extra for sprinkling","85g pitted Kalamata olives, halved","5 tbsp olive oil, plus a drizzle","100g feta cheese, crumbled","4 lamb steaks"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nLayer up half the potato, tomato and\r\naubergine in a baking dish, scattering\r\nwith garlic, oregano and olives, and\r\ndrizzling with oil and seasoning as you go.","Scatter over the feta, then repeat the\r\nlayers until all the ingredients are used\r\nup. Finish with potatoes and a little oil.","Bake for 50 mins or until the veg are\r\ntender (cover with foil if they’re getting\r\ntoo brown). Top with the lamb steaks,\r\nrubbing with a little more oil and\r\nseasoning. Bake for 15-20 mins more\r\nuntil the lamb is cooked. Allow to rest\r\nand cool a bit before scattering with\r\noregano and serving with crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:19:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7345,7345,'en','Lucknowi masala paneer pulao','Marinate paneer with garlic and chilli for an aromatic pulao with whole spices – an easy recipe that’s ideal for feeding a crowd this Diwali','["80ml vegetable oil , plus 3 tbsp","2 medium onions , chopped","4 large garlic cloves , roughly chopped","2 inch piece of ginger , roughly chopped","400g paneer , cut into cubes","2 green bird''s eye chillies , slit lengthways","1 tsp cumin seeds","5 green cardamom pods","2 dried bay leaves","1 cinnamon stick","1 tsp turmeric powder","250g basmati rice","20g butter , melted","1 tsp garam masala","1 lime , juiced","2 tbsp coriander leaves , finely chopped","raita, to serve","3 tbsp Greek yogurt","1 tbsp gram flour","1½ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","½ tsp garam masala","1 tbsp dried kasoori methi (fenugreek leaves)"]','["Heat the 80ml vegetable oil in a frying pan over a low heat and fry the onions for 30-35 mins until they turn golden brown. Remove from the pan using a slotted spoon, drain on kitchen paper and set aside.","Grind the garlic and ginger to a smooth paste with a splash of water using a pestle and mortar.","Put all the marinade ingredients into a mixing bowl along with half the garlic and ginger paste. Mix well and add the paneer cubes, stirring to coat. Set aside to marinate for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, in a large non-stick pan, heat 3 tbsp oil over a medium heat. Add the green chillies, cumin seeds, cardamom, bay leaves and cinnamon, then fry for a few seconds. Stir in the remaining garlic and ginger paste, fry for 1 min and add the turmeric, half the fried onions and the basmati rice. Stir well and season to taste. Pour in 500ml water, bring to a boil and simmer over a low heat with a lid on for 17-18 mins. Turn off the heat and leave to rest with the lid on for 15 mins.","Put the paneer cubes on a lined baking tray. Heat the grill to medium-high and cook the paneer for 3-4 mins, then toss with melted butter and continue cooking for a further 4-6 mins until softened and slightly charred.","Add the grilled paneer to the rice and stir well. Top with remaining fried onions, garam masala, lime juice and coriander. Serve with raita, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7347,7347,'en','Rasmalai','Enjoy this creamy Indian dessert made with milk, saffron, cardamom, pistachios and almonds. It’s a fabulous dish to serve at the end of an Indian feast','["1.5 litres milk","4 tbsp white vinegar","700ml milk","pinch of saffron strands","20g almonds , slivered","20g shelled pistachios , slivered","½ tsp ground cardamom","100g caster sugar","200g caster sugar","4 green cardamom pods","20g pistachios , finely chopped","20g almonds , finely chopped"]','["Put 1 tbsp water in a saucepan (this will prevent the milk from burning), then pour in the milk and bring to the boil over a medium heat. The milk will foam up; keep mixing in the film it creates at the top and side. When it comes to the boil, switch off the heat.","Mix 4 tbsp water into the vinegar, then add this to the milk in additions, stirring gently between each. Let stand for 10 mins, undisturbed, so the vinegar starts to curdle the milk (this will result in larger chunks of milk curd). If you don’t see the mixture separating, return to a low heat for a further 5 mins.","Line a large colander with cheesecloth, muslin or clean tea towel, and pour the curdled milk through it. Once all the whey has strained through and you have only the milk curd left behind, rinse the curd under cold water to remove any vinegar flavour. Leave to drain.","When most of the water has drained through the curd, lift up the cloth and squeeze until you''ve removed most of the moisture. Tie the cloth onto your tap and leave it hanging to drain completely.","Meanwhile, prepare the rabidi. Pour the milk into a saucepan and bring to the boil over a medium heat. Reduce the heat, stir and add the saffron, almonds, pistachios and cardamom. Keep stirring gently and, once the milk begins to bubble, add the sugar. Cook for another 5 mins or so until it comes to the boil. Remove from the heat and set aside.","By this time, the milk curd should be completely drained of excess moisture. Remove it from the cheesecloth and tip out onto a clean work surface. Break it up into small crumbs and, using the heel of your hand, knead the curd as you would bread for about 7-8 mins to bring it together, making sure not to overwork it.","To shape the rasmalai, roll the milk curd out into a log shape and divide into 10-14 equal-sized pieces. Roll each piece between the palm of your hand until you have a smooth ball without any cracks. Gently flatten each ball (don''t worry if there are a few cracks at the edge once flattened).","To make the sugar syrup, put the sugar, cardamom and 950ml water in a deep, wide saucepan over a medium-high heat and cook until the sugar has melted. Turn the heat up to high and bring to the boil, then remove the cardamom pods and carefully drop in the rasmalai. Cover with a lid and cook for 10 mins, then reduce the heat to medium-high and cook for a further 2-3 mins. Remove the pan from the heat, remove the lid and leave the rasmalai to cool completely in the syrup.","Reheat the rabdi slightly, then pour into a bowl. Take the cooked rasmalai out of the sugar syrup and gently squeeze each between the palms of your hands to drain out the sugar syrup, being careful not to break them. Add the rasmalai to the warm rabdi, then cover and leave to sit in the milk at room temperature for 5-6 hrs before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:19:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7349,7349,'en','Chicken chaat','Make an easy Indian dish with chicken, vegetables and spices. Serve as part of a bigger spread, or enjoy on its own as a main','["2 tbsp ghee or vegetable oil","4 boneless, skinless chicken thighs , cut into bite-sized chunks","1 onion , finely chopped","1 large garlic clove , crushed","2 green chillies , finely chopped","4 tbsp tamarind paste","1 tbsp garam masala","2 tsp chaat masala","1 large tomato , finely chopped","¼ cucumber , finely chopped","small handful coriander , finely chopped","1 spring onion , finely sliced","lemon wedges , to serve"]','["Heat half of the oil in a large wok or frying pan over a high heat. Add the chicken and cook for 5-6 mins until browned all over. It doesn’t need to be cooked through at this point. Remove to a plate using a slotted spoon and set aside.","Pour the remaining oil into the pan and set over a medium heat. Stir in the onion and fry for 2-3 mins, then stir in the garlic and chillies. Cook for a further 7-9 mins until the onions are softened and translucent. Return the chicken to the pan, along with the tamarind paste, garam masala and chaat masala. Season and stir well to coat. Cover and cook for 5 mins, or until the chicken is cooked through.","Remove from the heat and leave to cool for 2 mins before stirring in the tomato and cucumber. Garnish with the coriander and spring onion, and serve with lemon wedges on the side for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7351,7351,'en','Kadhai chicken chargha','Enjoy this easy kadhai chicken chargha recipe, featuring tender marinated chicken cooked with warming spices and served with a refreshing mint raita','["6-8 garlic cloves","2 tbsp Greek yogurt","1 tsp kashmiri chilli powder","1 tsp ground coriander","½ tsp ground turmeric","¼ tsp garam masala","700g chicken on the bone, skinless, cut into medium pieces","2 tbsp vegetable oil","½ tsp cumin seeds","2-3 dried kashmiri red chillies","1½ inch piece coarsely grated ginger","1 red chilli , thinly sliced","coriander , to garnish","naans , to serve","½ tsp cumin seeds","200g natural yogurt","40g mint leaves","10g coriander leaves","1 garlic clove"]','["Add the garlic and 1 tbsp of the yogurt to a blender and blitz to a smooth paste. Tip the paste into a bowl with the chilli powder, ground coriander, ground turmeric, garam masala and a pinch of salt and mix. Add the remaining 1 tbsp yogurt and the chicken and mix until the chicken is coated. Set aside the chicken to marinate in the fridge for 2-3 hours or preferably overnight.","In a wok or a deep frying pan heat the vegetable oil on a medium heat. Add the cumin seeds and dried chillies and let them sizzle and flavour the oil for 10 seconds. Tip in the marinated chicken pieces and fry for 5-7 mins, stirring continuously. Turn the heat down to low and cook for a further 20 mins with a lid on to help create steam in the wok.","Meanwhile, make the raita. Add the cumin seeds and 1/2 tsp black pepper to a pestle and mortar and grind to a fine powder. Now add 2 tbsp of the yogurt along with the other ingredients in a blender and blitz to a smooth paste. Tip into a serving bowl and mix in the rest of the yogurt. Chill until ready to serve.","Once the chicken is cooked all the way through and tender, add the coarse ginger and sliced chillies and sprinkle over the coriander. Mix well and serve warm with the mint raita and naan."]','2026-01-10 12:19:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7353,7353,'en','Onion bhaji board','Tuck into this sharing board with family and friends, with a mixture of onion bhajis, green chutney, cucumber raita, pomegranate salad and mini poppadoms','["2 onions , sliced","1 tsp sea salt flakes","100g gram flour","½ tsp baking powder , gluten-free if needed","½ tsp chilli powder","½ tsp turmeric","1 green chilli , finely chopped","2 tbsp chopped coriander","vegetable oil , for frying","small bunch of mint , leaves picked","small bunch of coriander , roughly chopped","1 tsp cumin","1 tsp sugar","1 green chilli , chopped","1 lemon , juiced","½ cucumber , coarsely grated","150g natural yogurt","2 tbsp finely chopped mint","4 tbsp pomegranate seeds","½ cucumber , diced","2 winter or seasonal vine tomatoes , chopped (optional)","1 small red onion , finely chopped","handful of coriander , chopped","½ lemon , juiced","mini poppadoms","sweet chutney (we used mango)","lime pickle"]','["Toss the onions in a bowl with the salt and leave for 5 mins. Meanwhile whisk the flour, baking powder and spices in another bowl. Add 100ml water to make a thick batter. Mix in the onions, chilli and coriander.","Pour the veg oil into a deep pan, ensuring it’s no more than a third full. Heat to 180C or until a piece of onion sizzles when dropped in and browns within 20 seconds. Lower in a few tablespoons of the mixture at a time and fry for 3-4 mins, then turn using a spider and cook for 1-2 mins more. Drain on kitchen paper and season. Keep warm in a low oven as you continue cooking or reheat later in an air fryer.","Blitz the ingredients for the green chutney with a pinch of salt and a splash of water in a small blender until smooth. Scrape into a small serving bowl.","Mix the raita ingredients in another bowl and season. Toss the salad ingredients in a third bowl. 5 Serve the bhajis in the middle of a large serving platter or board with the bowls of green chutney, salad and raita alongside, plus extras like mini poppadoms, mango chutney and lime pickle."]','2026-01-10 12:19:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7355,7355,'en','Stovetop lamb biryani','Make a dish that brings people together with a classic biriyani. It’s ideal as a feasting centrepiece when you have family and friends over for dinner','["5 green cardamom pods","5 cloves","2cm cinnamon stick","450g lamb rump , cut into 2cm cubes","250g tomatoes , roughly chopped","3 tbsp Greek yogurt","1 large onion , roughly chopped","3 garlic cloves , roughly chopped","10g ginger , peeled and roughly chopped","1 green chilli , deseeded and roughly chopped","small handful of coriander , roughly chopped","2½ tsp ghee","½ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","¼ tsp ground turmeric","200g basmati rice","3 green cardamom pods","2cm pandan leaf (optional)","75g raw cashew nuts","2 curry leaf sprigs , leaves picked","4 fridge-cold eggs"]','["Tip the cardamom pods, cloves and cinnamon into a small frying pan over a medium heat and toast for 1-2 mins until fragrant. Crush to a coarse powder using a pestle and mortar, discarding the cardamom husks. Put the lamb in a large bowl with the tomatoes, yogurt and 1/2 tsp fine sea salt. Add the crushed spices and mix well. Leave to marinate for at least 2 hrs, or overnight.","For the biryani, blitz half the onion with the garlic, ginger, chilli and coriander in a small food processor until finely chopped. Set aside. Melt 11/2 tsp ghee in a deep-sided, lidded saucepan over a medium heat and cook the remaining onions for 7-9 mins until soft and the edges are golden. Add the chilli powder, turmeric, blitzed onion mixture and a pinch of salt. Stir well, then add the lamb and any leftover marinade. Stir well, cover with the lid, reduce the heat and simmer for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, bring a pan of 300ml water to the boil. Tip in the rice, cardamom pods and pandan leaf, if using, and boil for 4-5 mins. Drain and remove the cardamom pods and pandan leaf. Set aside.","Melt the remaining ghee in a small frying pan over a medium-high heat and fry the cashews for 3-4 mins until golden. Tip into a small bowl and set aside. Add the curry leaves to the pan and cook for a minute, then set aside with the cashew nuts.","Uncover the lamb. Scatter over the rice, cashew nuts and curry leaves. Cover again and cook over a low heat for 20 mins, or until the rice is soft and fluffy.","Meanwhile, bring a small pan of water to the boil, carefully drop in the eggs and cook for 6-7 mins. Drain well, peel, then cut in half. Stir the rice, cashews and curry leaves into the meat, then spoon onto a serving platter and serve with the boiled eggs on top."]','2026-01-10 12:19:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7357,7357,'en','Tandoori chicken king kebab with turmeric & green bean biryani','Make a homemade version of a takeaway favourite using cost-effective chicken thighs, turning them into a large tandoori kebab to share','["3 tbsp tandoori paste","2 tbsp natural yogurt","small bunch of coriander","600g Morrisons boneless chicken thigh fillets","1 tbsp vegetable oil","25g butter","1 onion , finely sliced","300g basmati rice , soaked in cold water for 30 mins, then drained","3 cardamom pods , lightly crushed","1 cinnamon stick","1 tsp ground turmeric","750ml chicken stock","200g green beans , trimmed","2 lemons , cut into cheeks"]','["Mix the tandoori paste and yogurt together in a large bowl. Finely chop half of the coriander and stir this through, then add the chicken and toss to coat. Cover and set aside. Will keep chilled for up to a day.","Heat the oil and butter in a medium saucepan over a medium heat and fry the onion for 5-8 mins until soft and golden. Add the rice, then stir in the cardamom, cinnamon and turmeric, and season with salt.","Pour over the chicken stock, scatter over the green beans and bring to the boil. Cover with a lid, then reduce the heat to low and cook for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, line the chicken thighs up on a board with the longer sides against each other, tucking each thigh into a neat oblong shape. Push two long metal skewers parallel through the line of fillets so they are held together and make one large kebab. (If you don’t have long skewers, you can use shorter ones and make two separate kebabs.)","Heat the grill to high and grill the kebab for 20 mins, turning occasionally to make sure it browns evenly. (Or, do this in a hot griddle pan.) Check that the chicken is cooked through by looking at the spaces where the thighs rest against each other – if it''s still raw, continue to cook, checking every few minutes, then push a knife into the fattest part to ensure the juices run clear. Spoon the biryani onto a serving platter and top with the kebab. Chop the remaining coriander and scatter this over, then serve with the lemon cheeks for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7359,7359,'en','Mushroom jalfrezi pie','Be inspired by the classic Indian curry and make this flavour-packed pie, which is made extra-special by working spices into the pastry. It’s sure to please a crowd','["1kg mushrooms , sliced","2 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","1 onion , sliced","1 red pepper , chopped","3 garlic cloves , crushed or finely grated","1-2 green chillies , finely chopped  (deseeded, if you like)","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground turmeric","2 tsp garam masala","400g can chopped tomatoes","120g spinach","200g plain flour , plus extra for dusting","100g wholemeal plain flour (or use more plain flour)","150g cold butter , cut into cubes","1 tbsp caraway seeds","1 egg yolk or ½ tbsp plant milk (if using egg yolk, freeze the white to use in another recipe), plus extra for brushing"]','["For the pastry, put the flours and butter in a food processor. Blitz until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs (you can also rub them together using your fingers). Tip in the caraway seeds and pulse to combine. Add the egg yolk or plant milk and pulse again until you have a soft dough. If needed, add more plant milk or water, ½ tsp at a time, just to bring the dough together. Chill for 20 mins.","Tip the mushrooms into a large frying pan. Cook over a medium heat until the liquid has been released and evaporated, about 15 mins. Drizzle in the oil, then add the onions and peppers. Fry for 8-10 mins until the mushrooms are golden and the veg has softened.","Stir in the garlic and chillies and cook for 1-2 mins until fragrant. Add the spices, stir and cook for 1 min before adding the tomatoes and half a can of water. Stir, then cook for 5-10 mins until thickened slightly, adding a little water if needed to loosen. Add the spinach and cook for a few minutes to wilt.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the mixture into a pie dish. Roll the pastry out on a lightly floured surface until ½cm thick and large enough to cover the dish. Lay it on top and crimp the edges to seal. Poke a couple of holes in the top for steam to escape, then brush with some egg yolk or plant milk. Bake for 30-35 mins until golden."]','2026-01-10 12:19:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7361,7361,'en','Hara bhara kabab','Enjoy these vegan patties which are a popular snack in North India, with a green tint from the spinach. Serve with your favourite chutney – we went for mango','["500g Maris Piper potatoes , cut into quarters","130ml sunflower oil","2 garlic cloves , finely chopped","50g kale , finely chopped","50g spinach , finely chopped","50g frozen peas","½ tsp chilli powder","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp amchur (mango powder)","3 tbsp cornflour","chutney , to serve"]','["Tip the potatoes into a pan of cold water. Salt well and bring to the boil, then simmer for 12-15 mins until tender. Drain well and set aside to cool.","Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in a pan over a medium heat and add the garlic cloves. After a few seconds, add the kale, cover and reduce the heat to low for 5 mins. Add the spinach and peas, cover and cook over a low heat for a further 5 mins. Remove from the heat and tip into a food processor. Blitz to a coarse paste.","Tip the paste into a bowl with the boiled potatoes, spices, cornflour and ½ tsp salt. Mash well and divide into 12 slightly flattened balls.","Heat the remaining oil in a deep frying pan and cook the kebabs for 1-2 mins on each side until golden. Serve with a chutney of your choice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7363,7363,'en','Baked coconut dhal with spiced cauliflower & paneer','Let the oven do the work in this coconut, cauliflower and paneer dhal, where turmeric lends a beautifully golden colour. Enjoy with our homemade pickled onions','["1 large red onion , chopped","1 tbsp sunflower or veg oil","2 x 400g cans coconut milk","1 tbsp ginger , grated","1 tbsp garlic purée (about 6 garlic cloves)","2 tbsp curry paste (we used korma paste)","2 tsp ground turmeric","2 tsp nigella seeds","100g red lentils","150g chana dhal or split peas","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 lemon , juiced","½ large cauliflower (about 500g), broken into florets, stalks and leaves roughly chopped","225g paneer , cut into cubes","1 red onion , halved and thinly sliced","1 green chilli , finely sliced","small handful of coriander , leaves picked"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the onions in a large, deep roasting tin with the oil. Roast for 15 mins, until softened.","Spoon 3 tbsp coconut cream off the top of the coconut milk and set aside. Stir the ginger, garlic, 1 tbsp curry paste, 1 tsp turmeric, nigella seeds, lentils, chana dhal, tomatoes and remaining coconut milk into the onions. Fill the empty can with 400ml water, swirl it around and pour into the roasting tin. Season and mix well, then wrap the tray in foil and return to the oven to cook for 50 mins.","Meanwhile, mix the remaining curry paste and turmeric into the reserved coconut cream. Add a squeeze of lemon and season, then toss through the cauliflower and paneer until well coated.","Unwrap the dhal, stir and add a splash more water if it’s looking too dry. Scatter the cauliflower and paneer pieces on top and return to the oven for 40 mins uncovered. Meanwhile, toss the red onion and sliced chilli with a squeeze of lemon juice and a pinch of salt. Set aside to pickle.","When the dhal is cooked the lentils should be soft and the cauliflower and paneer should be charred. Leave to stand for 10 mins, then serve with the pickled onion and chilli, with a scattering of coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:19:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7365,7365,'en','Butter bean saag','Enjoy this take on saag, packed with spinach and spices. It’s perfect as a side in an Indian feast, or as a standalone dish served with chapatis','["25g ghee or butter","1 onion , finely chopped","1 tsp black mustard seeds","20g ginger , grated","3 garlic cloves , grated","1 green chilli (deseeded if you prefer less heat), finely chopped","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","½ tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp dried fenugreek leaves (optional)","400g frozen spinach","400g can butter beans , drained and rinsed","½ lemon , juiced","chapatis and mango chutney , to serve"]','["Heat the ghee or butter in a frying pan over medium-high heat. Stir in the onion and mustard seeds and fry for 5 mins, until golden around the edges and the mustard seeds are popping. Mix in the ginger, garlic, green chilli and tomato purée. Cook for 4-5 mins, until fragrant and caramelised.","Stir in the remaining spices, fenugreek leaves, if using, and frozen spinach with a splash of water. Leave to simmer for 10 mins, until the spinach has completely defrosted and the liquid has thickened and reduced. Stir through the beans and lemon juice, then season to taste. Serve with chapatis and mango chutney."]','2026-01-10 12:19:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7367,7367,'en','Rasgulla','Make this traditional Indian dessert using homemade cottage cheese rolled into balls, then soaked in rose-scented syrup – the result is sweet, spongy and light','["2 litres whole milk","2-3 tbsp distilled vinegar","saffron threads or chopped pistachios, to serve","200g granulated sugar","4 cardamom pods","1 tbsp rosewater extract (or to taste, depending on the brand)"]','["Line a large, fine mesh sieve with a muslin cloth and set over a large bowl. Bring the milk to the boil in a large saucepan over a medium heat, stirring to prevent it sticking or burning. Slowly add 2-3 tbsp vinegar, stirring until the milk has curdled. Immediately remove from the heat and leave to stand until the milk solids have separated from the whey. Strain the mixture using the prepared sieve, then rinse the milk solids in the cloth under cold running water (this will remove any lingering vinegar flavour). Gather up the edges of the cloth to enclose the milk solids, and gently squeeze to remove the excess liquid. Tie a knot in the cloth, hang it over the sink tap and leave to strain for 1 hr.","Tip the strained milk solids into a bowl and knead gently until they just form a soft dough, about 5 mins. Be careful not to overknead, or it may become tough. Roll a small portion of the dough into a smooth ball using your palms (the ball should be about 2-3cm and about 25g). Repeat with the remaining dough.","To make the syrup, put the sugar, 1 litre water, the cardamom pods and just enough rosewater extract in a pan to impart a slight floral flavour, without being too strong (you may not need the full 1 tbsp). Warm over a medium heat until the sugar has dissolved, then bring to the boil and cook for about 10 mins until the mixture thickens into a sticky syrup.","Carefully add the dough balls to the syrup, then cover with a lid and cook on for 10 mins more until the rasgullas have doubled in size. Remove to a plate using a slotted spoon and leave to cool completely, then sprinkle with saffron threads or chopped pistachios. Chill until set and cold, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7369,7369,'en','Gobi manchurian','Treat friends or family to this popular Indo-Chinese starter where crispy cauliflower florets are tossed in a hot, sweet and sour sauce','["1 cauliflower , cut into florets","neutral oil such as sunflower or vegetable , for frying","2 garlic cloves , chopped","1 green chilli , chopped","1 red onion , diced","2 spring onions , finely sliced, plus extra to serve","½ red pepper , diced","½ green pepper , diced","2 tbsp ketchup","2 tbsp chilli sauce","2 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp rice vinegar","1 tbsp chilli flakes","1 tbsp ground black pepper","100g plain flour","20g cornflour","1 tsp chilli powder","1 tsp Kashmiri chilli powder"]','["Cook the cauliflower florets in a large saucepan of boiling water for 8-10 mins, until tender, then drain in a colander and set aside.","Mix all the batter ingredients together in a large bowl with 1 tsp salt, then slowly pour in 200ml water, stirring all the time to make a smooth batter thick enough to coat the cauliflower.","Drop the florets into the batter and stir gently to coat. Pour enough oil into a large saucepan to half-fill the pan then put over a medium-high heat until it reaches 180C, or a cube of bread dropped in browns in 30 seconds. Fry the cauliflower florets in batches for about 6 mins until golden and crisp, then leave to drain in a colander.","Heat 1 tbsp oil in a large wok over a low heat, then add the garlic, chopped chilli, red onion, spring onion, red and green peppers, and cook, stirring, for 2 mins.","Stir in the ketchup, chilli sauce, soy sauce, rice vinegar, chilli flakes, black pepper and 1 tsp each salt and pepper and heat through for 1 min. Toss the fried florets in the sauce to coat. Serve in a bowl, sprinkled with chopped spring onions, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7371,7371,'en','Dum aloo','Go meat-free with this Indian potato curry. Aromatic and full of flavour, it could work as a side dish or veggie main with your favourite sides','["500g baby potatoes , peeled","2 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","1 onion , finely chopped","3 cardamom pods","3 bay leaves","2 cinnamon sticks","½ tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp kalonji seeds (nigella seeds), plus extra to serve","1 medium tomato , chopped","1 tsp ginger and garlic paste","1 tsp fenugreek","1 tsp chilli powder","½ tsp turmeric","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp cumin","1 tbsp gram flour (chickpea flour)","250g Greek yogurt","chopped coriander, garam masala and cashews , to serve"]','["Put the potatoes in a pan of salted water, bring to the boil and cook for 10 mins, until just tender. Drain and set aside.","Drizzle the oil into the pan and fry the potatoes for 3-4 mins over a medium-high heat until lightly golden all over. Remove from the pan and set aside.","Stir in the onion, cardamom pods, bay, cinnamon stick, cumin seeds and kalonji (nigella) seeds. Fry for 6-8 mins until golden.","Stir in the chopped tomato, ginger and garlic paste, fenugreek, chilli powder, turmeric, ground coriander and cumin. Cook for 1-2 mins until the tomato softens.","Mix the gram flour and Greek yogurt together until smooth, then stir into the masala mixture. Pour in 100ml water, simmer for 1 min, then stir in the potatoes to coat with the masala sauce. Cover and steam for 8-10 mins over a low heat. Sprinkle with more kalonji seeds, chopped coriander, garam masala and cashews to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7373,7373,'en','Vegan naan','Make a vegan version of naan to enjoy with your favourite meat-free Indian dishes using a dairy-free, plant-based block instead of ghee','["7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","2 tsp caster sugar","2 tbsp vegetable oil , plus extra for the bowl","½ tsp baking powder","500g plain flour , plus extra for dusting","50g vegan salted plant-based butter block","4 garlic cloves , finely chopped","small handful of coriander , finely chopped"]','["Combine the yeast, sugar, oil and 300ml warm water in a jug. Mix the baking powder, flour and 1 tsp fine sea salt together in a large bowl, make a well in the centre and pour in the yeast mixture. Mix well to combine, then turn out onto a lightly floured surface. Knead for 5-7 mins, or until the dough is elastic and smooth. Transfer to a lightly oiled bowl, cover with a tea towel and leave to rise in a warm place for 45 mins-1 hr until doubled in size.","Tip the dough out onto a clean work surface and knock back a couple of times. Divide into eight or 10 pieces (about 75g each), and roll into balls. Cover and leave to rise for 30-45 mins until doubled in size again.","Heat a dry cast iron or heavy-based frying pan over a medium-high heat. Roll one dough ball out at a time into an oval shape on a lightly floured surface, leaving the rest covered. Lightly brush the top with water and put in the hot pan, dampened-side down. Brush the other side with water and cook for 1-2 mins until puffed up and blistered. Flip and cook on the other side, then wrap in a tea towel to keep warm. Repeat with the remaining dough balls.","Mix the plant butter and garlic together in a small saucepan and warm over a low heat for a few minutes until the butter has melted and the garlic is sizzling, light brown and fragrant. Remove from the heat and stir in the coriander. Brush this over the warm naans and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7375,7375,'en','Chicken dhansak','Make chicken go further with this Parsi curry where lentils create a hearty, creamy texture. It also has sweet and sour flavour notes','["2 tbsp neutral-tasting oil (such as rapeseed), or ghee","1 large onion , finely chopped","1 cinnamon stick","1 tsp cumin seeds","½ butternut squash , peeled and cut into cubes","1 tsp finely chopped garlic","400g chicken breast or thigh, cut into cubes","1 tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","1 tbsp tomato purée","150g can red lentils , drained and rinsed","400g can chopped tomatoes","1-2 tbsp tamarind paste , or to taste","1 tsp dried fenugreek leaves","squeeze of lemon juice , to serve","handful of chopped coriander , to serve"]','["Heat the oil or ghee in a large, heavy-based pan over a medium heat and cook the onions and cinnamon stick for a few minutes until the onions start to brown. Add the cumin seeds and mix well.","Tip in the squash and continue to cook for a few minutes more, then add the garlic and cook for 1 min. Stir in the chicken and brown for a few minutes, then add the turmeric, ground coriander, chilli powder and tomato purée, stirring to coat the chicken in the spices.","Tip in the lentils and canned tomatoes, swilling out the tomato can with water twice and adding this, too. Season with salt to taste and bring to a simmer.","Add the tamarind to taste, crumble in the fenugreek leaves and stir to combine. Cover and cook for 20 mins more, stirring halfway through.","Uncover and cook for a few minutes more until the curry has reduced to your desired consistency – the longer it cooks, the thicker it will become, as the lentils will break down into the sauce. Squeeze in a splash of lemon juice and sprinkle over the fresh coriander to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7377,7377,'en','Manchurian chicken','Enjoy this popular Hakka (Indo-Chinese) shallow-fried chicken dish with a little chilli heat and some sweetness','["1 egg white (save the yolk for another recipe)","2 tsp soy sauce","2 tbsp cornflour","350g boneless chicken thighs , cut into strips","neutral oil , for shallow frying","cooked egg noodles , to serve (optional)","6 tbsp cornflour","2 tbsp plain flour","¼ tsp baking powder","½ tsp chilli powder","1 tbsp neutral oil","2 tsp grated ginger","2 garlic cloves , finely chopped or crushed","3 spring onions , chopped","2 tbsp tomato ketchup","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp sweet or garlic chilli sauce (add ½ tsp sugar if your chilli sauce isn’t sweet)","1 tsp cornflour"]','["Combine the egg white with the soy sauce and cornflour in a large bowl. Add the chicken and mix thoroughly to coat.","Mix all the coating ingredients together with ½ tsp salt in a bowl and set aside.","Make the sauce by heating the oil in a pan and frying the ginger, garlic and most of the spring onions (save some to serve) over a medium heat for 1 min. Stir in the ketchup, soy sauce and chilli sauce plus 3 tbsp water and cook for 1 min. Stir the cornflour into 1 tbsp cold water to make a paste and add this to the sauce. Turn the heat to low and cook for a minute or so – the sauce should thicken straight away. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Put a few tablespoons of oil in a large, shallow pan over a medium heat. Dip the chicken pieces, shaking off any excess marinade, into the bowl of coating and toss to coat. Shake off any excess flour and lower the chicken into the hot oil. Repeat this until you have a single layer of chicken in the pan. Fry the chicken pieces for about 4-5 mins each side, until they are crisp on both sides and lightly golden, they should be crunchy and cooked through. Scoop them out into a colander set over a bowl to catch any excess fat. Repeat with the remaining chicken.","Meanwhile, reheat the sauce over a low heat. Add all the fried chicken to the sauce and toss it gently to coat. Sprinkle over the remaining spring onions to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7379,7379,'en','Mushroom bhaji','Slow roast the garlic in this dish with cardamom to make it smoky and caramelised, and enjoy with rice or naan','["1 large garlic bulb","2 black cardamom pods","5 tbsp olive oil","400g exotic mushroom mix , larger mushrooms torn","1 small onion , roughly chopped","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp finely grated or chopped ginger","1 green chilli , sliced (optional)","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp turmeric","1 tsp ground coriander","1-2 tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","½ lemon , juiced","30g coriander , roughly chopped","cooked rice or naan , to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Slice the garlic bulb in half horizontally through its centre and put on a sheet of foil. Put 1 cardamom pod on top of each half and drizzle with 3 tbsp olive oil. Wrap in the foil and bake in the oven for 35-40 mins, or in an air-fryer for 20-25 mins, until it''s soft, jammy and just starting to caramelise on top.","Heat 1 tbsp oil in a large frying pan over a medium-high heat, add the mushrooms and fry until slightly browned, this will take 3-4 mins. Remove from the pan and set aside.","Add the onion to the same pan with a tablespoon more oil and a pinch of salt and cook over a medium heat until soft and just starting to brown, add the cardamom pods (from the garlic) and cumin seeds, mix well and add the ginger and green chilli, if using. Stir for 30 seconds.","Squeeze the garlic cloves from the bulb into the pan. Smash them slightly with the back of a spoon.","Next, add the tomato purée, ground spices and salt to taste and cook for a few minutes over a medium heat. Add a splash of water if needed to stop it sticking.","Finally, stir in the lemon juice, chopped coriander and cooked mushrooms. Serve straightaway with rice or naan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7381,7381,'en','Roasted cauliflower dhal with homemade gluten-free naan','Pack in four of your 5-a-day with a bowl of these spiced veggie lentils. Make your own gluten-free naan to scoop it up, or use shop-bought','["1 tbsp garlic oil","½ leek (about 100g) leek, finely chopped","1 tbsp ginger paste","½ tsp dried chilli flakes","2 tsp turmeric","2 tsp curry powder","1 tsp garam masala","400g can chopped tomatoes","400ml can coconut milk","500ml gluten-free vegetable stock","200g dried red lentils , uncooked (ensure gluten-free if needed)","2 handfuls fresh spinach (about 120g), washed","250g gluten-free self-raising flour","260g Greek yogurt (or any thick, plain yogurt)","1 cauliflower , cut into florets","3 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tsp garam masala"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. To prepare the naan, put the flour, Greek yogurt (give it a good stir before using) and a pinch of salt in a largemixing bowl. Mix together using aspatulaand, as it starts to come together, use your hands to bring it together into a slightly sticky ball. Cover and set aside.","To make the roasted cauliflower, tip the cauliflower onto a large baking tray, drizzle with the oil, then sprinkle with garam masala and a pinch of salt and pepper. Mix so the cauliflower is well coated and set aside.","To make the dhal, place a large pan with a lid on a medium heat and add the oil. Tip in the leek and cook for a few minutes to soften. Mix in the ginger paste, chilli flakes, turmeric, curry powder and garam masala and cook for 1 min. Pour in the chopped tomatoes, coconut milk, stock and lentils, then stir in. Bring to a simmer and cook for 20 mins, stirring occasionally so it doesn’t stick.","Meanwhile, put the cauliflower in the oven and roast for around 25-30 mins until softer and starting to colour, turning halfway.","To make the naan, knead the dough on a well-floured surface briefly until it''s smooth, combined and no longer sticky. Divide the dough into four equal portions. Using a lightly floured rolling pin, roll out a portion of dough into an oval  3mm thick. Heat a large frying pan over a high heat. The higher the heat, the more bubbles you’ll get in the naan. Once heated, carefully transfer the naan to the dry frying pan using a fish slice. Leave to cook on one side for 2 mins or until nicely browned, then flip and cook for 1 min. After flipping, press down firmly on the naan using a spatula – this encourages it to puff up a little. Repeat using the rest of the dough.","Once the dhal is ready, the lentils will be tender. Stir through the spinach to wilt and season to taste. Top the dhal with roasted cauliflower and serve with a naan on the side.To freeze, freeze the dhal and naan separately. Reheat the dhal in the microwave and the naan in the oven."]','2026-01-10 12:19:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7383,7383,'en','Creamy coconut & spinach dhal','“This meal is a complete hug in a bowl. Substituting half of the rice for quinoa not only adds extra wholegrain goodness but also boosts the meal’s fibre and protein content. Alternatively, wholegrain brown rice serves as an excellent alternative. A squeeze of lemon juice is an excellent way to include vitamin C, aiding in the absorption of iron from the lentils and spinach.” — Dr Chintal Patel','["300g red lentils","1 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp turmeric","2 large tomatoes (around 225g), roughly chopped","400ml can coconut milk","100g quinoa","320g baby spinach","100g basmati rice","25g coriander leaves, chopped, to serve","½ cucumber, deseeded and finely chopped","2 tomatoes, finely chopped","½ red onion, finely diced","½ lemon, juiced","1 tbsp olive oil","2 green chillies, halved","6 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","1 tsp chilli powder (optional)"]','["Rinse and drain the red lentils thoroughly at least three times and soak them in cold water until needed.","Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat. Add the onion and fry until it''s softened and just starting to brown, about 5-6 mins. Stir in the cumin seeds and fry for 1 min.","Add a pinch of salt and the turmeric, stir well, then tip in the tomatoes. Drain the lentils and add them to the pan along with 350ml water and the coconut milk. Stir to combine and bring to the boil. Cover and let it simmer over a medium-low heat for 15 mins.","Rinse and drain the quinoa and rice at least three times to remove excess starch. Tip into a large saucepan with 1.5 litres of salted boiling water. Bring back to the boil, simmer for 10-12 mins until tender, then drain.","Mix together all the kachumber ingredients in a bowl and season to taste. Set aside.","Remove the dhal from the heat, uncover and stir in the spinach, letting it wilt. Season to taste.","To make the tadka, heat the oil in a saucepan over a medium-high heat, add the chillies and garlic. Just before the garlic begins to brown, 1-2 mins, add the chilli powder, if using. Stir for a few seconds and remove from the heat. Set aside.","Serve the quinoa and rice in bowls topped with the dhal, tadka and chopped coriander, and the kachumber on the side, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7385,7385,'en','Rotis (chapatis)','Make a mainstay of many North Indian meals. Rotis – or chapatis – come in all sizes and thicknesses and are great served hot with butter or homemade ghee','["250g chapati flour (chapati atta), or 125g wholemeal flour and 125g plain flour, plus extra for dusting and rolling","1 tsp sunflower oil","2 tbsp salted butter or ghee, to serve"]','["Mix the flour, oil and ½ tsp fine sea salt in a mixing bowl. Gradually add enough cold water (about 120ml) to make a firm but not dry dough.","Turn out the dough onto a floured surface and knead well for about 7–10 minutes, until smooth. Return the dough to a clean, dry bowl, cover with an upturned plate or cloth and leave to rest for 30 mins.","Knead in a little more chapati or plain flour if the dough looks sticky and then divide it into 12 evenly sized balls. Sprinkle each one with flour.","Heat a dry griddle on the stove over a medium heat. Put 3 tbsps of flour in a small bowl. Using the palms of your hands, flatten one of the dough balls into a circular disc and dip both sides in the flour. Now roll it with a circular motion to make a 12-14cm diameter circle with the thickness of a £1 coin. It can be easier to use a thin wooden rolling pin for this – the kind used for rolling out pasta.","Put the dough onto the hot griddle and cook for 1 minute, or until small air pockets start to form on its surface. Turn the chapati over with a palette knife or tongs and continue cooking for about a further 90 seconds, until the chapati picks up flecks of colour.","Carefully press the bread with a clean cloth as it cooks on the griddle – the chapati should swell up with hot air. Keep turning the bread as it cooks. These rotis are best served straight away with dollop of butter or ghee in the middle, but you can also wrap them in foil and bring the package to the table."]','2026-01-10 12:19:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7387,7387,'en','Creamy tofu curry with homemade roti','Make a deceptively rich and filling tofu curry that’s entirely vegan. The roti will take just 10 minutes to make while the curry simmers','["400g firm tofu","2 tbsp cornflour","4 tbsp vegetable oil","5 tbsp tikka or madras paste","2 white onions, thinly sliced","1 tbsp tomato purée","500g tomato passata","200g creamed coconut","15g coriander, roughly chopped (optional)","100g plain or wholemeal flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp vegetable oil"]','["Heat the oven to 230C/210C fan/gas 8. Drain the tofu on kitchen paper andslice in halfhorizontally, patting it as you go to absorb as much moisture as possible. Tear the tofu into chunks, tip into a bowl and toss to coat in the cornflour, 1 tbsp of the vegetable oil and ½ tsp salt. Spread out on a baking sheet and bake in the oven for 25 mins.","Using the same bowl, make the roti. Mix the flour, a pinch of salt and the oil together with enough water (about 65ml) to make a soft, not sticky, dough. Knead on a floured surface for 3 mins, then cover and leave to rest while you make the sauce.","Heat the remaining 3 tbsp oil in afrying panover a medium heat and cook the tikka paste until fragrant, about 1 min. Add the onions and cook for 4-5 mins, adding a splash of water if needed to prevent any sticking, then cover and cook until completely softened (about 8-10 mins more), stirring occasionally.","Add the tomato purée, passata and a pinch of salt. Simmer for a further 5 mins before adding the creamed coconut. Reduce the heat to low while you make the roti. Loosen the sauce occasionally with a splash of water if it’s starting to look too thick.","Divide the roti mixture into four equal balls.Roll the balls outon a floured surface using a floured rolling pin until 2-3mm thick. Heat a dry frying pan until very hot, then cook each roti for 1 min on each side until charred in places. Wrap in a tea towel as they come off the heat to keep them soft.","Remove the tofu from the baking tray and stir into the sauce to coat before sprinkling with coriander and serving with the roti."]','2026-01-10 12:19:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7389,7389,'en','Chicken vindaloo','Turn up the heat with this member recipe for homemade chicken vindaloo made with plenty of aromatic spices. Serve with warmed flatbreads for a simple, satisfying supper','["4 tbsp vegetable oil","1 cinnamon stick lightly bruised or crushed","2 tsp chilli flakes","pinch of cayenne pepper","1 onion, finely chopped","1 can chopped tomatoes (400g)","coriander leaves, crispy onions, fresh chilli and warmed flatbreads or rice, to serve (optional)","2 tbsp lemon juice","1 tsp turmeric","1tbsp tomato purée","1 tsp chilli flakes","4 boneless, skinless chicken breasts, diced","1tsp crushed or grated garlic, approx 2-3 large garlic cloves","2 tsp finely grated ginger","2 tsp garam masala","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","cayenne pepper","1 tsp black mustard seeds"]','["To prepare the chicken, mix the lemon juice, diced chicken, garlic and ginger together in a large bowl with the dried spices and 2 tsp salt. Cover and leave to marinate in the fridge for at least 3-4 hrs, or overnight.","Heat 2 tbsp oil in a largesaucepanover medium-high heat. Add a tsp of turmeric for a burst of colour and flavour, followed by tomato purée to enhance the richness of the dish. Sprinkle in chilli flakes to taste for a hint of heat. Remove from the pan and set aside on a plate, it won’t be cooked through at this point. Add the remaining oil and diced onion, cook for 10-15 mins over a medium heat until soft and translucent. Add the remaining spices and cook for 2mins. Stir in the chopped tomatoes and 200ml of water, return the chicken to the pan, cover and simmer for 15-20 mins until the chicken is cooked through. Check the seasoning.","Garnish with some coriander, fresh chilli and crispy onions and serve with flatbreads or rice, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7391,7391,'en','Lime pickle','Pair this tart, tangy and refreshing lime pickle with a simple meal of dhal and boiled rice. The recipe makes a 500g jar and will last for three months','["500g limes (about 7)","8 large garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","1 tsp ground turmeric","30g fine sea salt","1 tsp black mustard seeds","½ tsp fenugreek seeds","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 star anise","1 tsp caster sugar","125ml vegetable oil, plus 30-50ml extra, if needed","30g root ginger, peeled and finely chopped","3 green chillies, deseeded and chopped","50ml white wine vinegar","70g granulated sugar"]','["Put the limes in a saucepan and cover with water. Place a small heatproof plate on top of the fruit to keep them submerged and then bring to a boil over a medium heat and simmer for 20-30 mins until the limes are tender. Scoop out the limes, pat them dry with kitchen paper, and discard the cooking water.","Once the limes are cool enough to handle, chop them (peel and pith included) into 3cm chunks and tip everything, including any juice, into a mixing bowl. Stir in the chopped garlic, chilli powder, turmeric and salt, and leave to one side for 1 hour.","Heat a sturdy and dry frying pan over a medium-low heat, and add the mustard seeds, fenugreek, cumin and star anise, Stir and toast the spices for about 40 seconds until aromatic. Tip them into amortar,add 1 teaspoon of sugar and pound to a powder with a pestle – you can also use an electricspice grinderfor this, too.","Add this ground spice mix to the limes, stir well, spoon everything into a sterilised jar and then seal. Leave the pickle in a warm place or on a sunny window ledge for 2-3 days so that flavours mature. Stir the limes once a day with a metal spoon to ensure they are evenly coated in the spice mix.","Heat the oil in awokor karahi over a medium-high heat and fry the ginger and green chillies for 2-3 mins, until the ginger starts to turn golden. Add the vinegar and sugar and simmer over a medium-low heat until the sugar has dissolved, then boil for 2 mins.","Turn the heat off and add the steeped limes and masala. Leave on one side to cool and then spoon the pickle back into the same jar. Using a metal spoon, push the limes down into the jar so that they are covered by the spicy oil – you might need to add a little extra oil. Seal the jar and leave the pickle for 3-4 days before tasting.It will keep for 3 months at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:19:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7393,7393,'en','Chicken tikka pasties','Make these moreish pasties for a picnic. They’re easy to pack up and take with you, and inspired by the flavours of a chicken tikka slice','["½ tbsp sunflower oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely grated or crushed","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely grated","4 boneless, skinless chicken thighs, cut into small chunks","5 tbsp tikka curry paste","227g can chopped tomatoes","2 tsp light brown soft sugar","100ml double cream","350g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","175g cold unsalted butter, cut into cubes","1 tsp caraway seeds (optional)","1 tsp cumin seeds (optional)","1 egg yolk (freeze the white for another recipe), plus 1 beaten egg"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onion until softened, about 6-8 mins. Stir in the garlic and ginger, and cook for 1 min more before stirring in the chicken pieces. Cook for 8-10 mins until the chicken is golden all over. Add the curry paste, stir, then mix in the chopped tomatoes and brown sugar. Cook for 10-12 mins until the liquid has reduced and you have quite a dry curry. Stir in the double cream and cook for 5 mins more until it has reduced slightly – you want a thick sauce, so it doesn’t seep out of the finished pasty. Leave to cool.","To make the pastry, tip the flour into afood processoralong with the butter, caraway and cumin seeds if using and pulse to fine crumbs. (You can also do this in a bowl by rubbing everything together using your fingertips.) Mix in the egg yolk and a splash of cold water, if needed,to bring the mixture into a dough. Wrap and keep chilled for 20 mins while the filling cools.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.Roll the chilled pastry outon a lightly floured surface until it’s about ½cm thick. Stamp out discs using a 10-12cm pastry cutter, or use a small plate as a template and cut out with a knife. (You should get about eight in total.) Put a couple of spoonfuls of the filling over each pastry circle, just off-centre, then brush the beaten egg around the filling and fold the pastry over so the edges meet. Crimp the edges or seal with a fork. Put on a baking tray, cut a few small slashes into the top of each pasty, brush over the remaining beaten egg and bake for 20-25 mins until crisp and golden brown. Cool slightly, then serve.Will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:19:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7395,7395,'en','Paneer & chickpea pulao','Make pulao – a quick, simple rice dish – extra special by adding paneer and chickpeas','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp mustard seeds","8 curry leaves (optional)","2 green chillies, finely chopped","2 medium onions, thinly sliced","5 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tomatoes, roughly chopped","1 tsp chilli powder (ensure gluten-free, if necessary)","1 tsp garam masala","1 tsp ground cumin","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","225g paneer, cut into small rectangles","300g basmati rice","10g coriander leaves, finely chopped","yogurt (to serve)"]','["Heat the oil in a pan that has a lid. Add the cumin and mustard seeds and let them sizzle until fragrant. Then add the curry leaves, chillies and onions and cook on medium heat for 5-8 mins until softened. Add the garlic and cook for another minute before tipping in the tomatoes. Cook for 5 mins more until the tomatoes begin to soften.","Add the spices and 1½ tsp salt and cook for 1 min. Mix in the chickpeas and paneer, followed by the rice, then pour in 700ml boiling water from the kettle. Bring the mixture to a boil, covering the pan with the lid.","Cook on a low heat for 12 mins then, before removing the lid, allow to rest for 10 mins. Serve with a sprinkling of the coriander and a dollop of yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:19:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7397,7397,'en','Fluffy pittas','Try making these Grecian-style pittas which are fluffier than the ones you’ll find in most shops. Fill with barbecued chicken or pork, salad and tzatziki for a satisfying fakeaway kebab','["500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp caster sugar","2 tsp fresh thyme leaves (optional)","200ml milk","1 tbsp olive oil, plus a little extra for proving and brushing"]','["A few hours before you want to eat, make the dough. Mix the flour, yeast, sugar, thyme, if using, and 2 tsp salt in a bowl with your fingertips. Pour over the milk, olive oil and 100ml lukewarm water and, still using your fingers, combine to make a dough. Tip onto a work surface and knead for 8-10 mins (or blitz in astand mixerfor 5 mins). Clean, then lightly oil a bowl, put the dough in the bowl and cover with a tea towel. Leave to rise for 1 hr or until nearly doubled in size. If you want to give yourself more time, the dough will take longer to rise in the fridge (at least 2 hrs).","Divide the dough into eight equal pieces. One at a time, on a lightly floured surface,roll outto circles about 20cm wide, then brush with a little more olive oil and cook on the hot side of thebarbecuefor 2-3 mins on each side until puffed up and blistered. Alternatively, heat a frying pan or griddle (or two if you can) over a medium-high heat and cook, one by one in each pan, until bubbles appear on the surface after 1-2 mins. When the underside is golden, flip and cook for another 2-3 mins. Continue until all the pittas are cooked, wrapping them in foil as you go to keep warm."]','2026-01-10 12:19:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7399,7399,'en','Kitchari','Make a batch of kitchari, a soothing, dhal-like dish linked to Ayurvedic cleanses (an ancient system of alternative medicine from India) for a healthy supper.','["1 tbsp ghee","1 small cauliflower, stalks and florets finely chopped","2 carrots, finely chopped","15g piece of ginger, peeled and grated","1 tsp ground cumin","½ tsp black mustard seeds","½ tsp fennel seeds","½ tsp ground coriander","½ tsp ground turmeric","150g moong dal, rinsed and drained (available in specialist shops and large supermarkets)","100g basmati rice, rinsed and drained","small handful of coriander, finely chopped","1 lime, cut into wedges"]','["Melt the ghee in a large flameproof casserole orsaucepanover a medium heat. Stir in all the cauliflower and carrots, and season lightly. Fry gently for 10 mins until the vegetables have softened and taken on a bit of colour.","Tip in all the spices and fry for a further 2 mins until fragrant. Pour in the moong dal and rice, and stir to coat in the spices. Season with salt and pour in 1.25 litres water. Bring to a simmer and cook for 45 mins, stirring occasionally until the beans and rice are fully tender and have broken down. The texture should be porridge-like. Season to taste and sprinkle over the coriander. Serve with the lime wedges on the side for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7401,7401,'en','Crispy paneer, spinach & coconut curry','Make this easy vegetarian curry for a speedy midweek meal. You can add more or less chillies depending on how spicy you like your food','["2 tbsp olive oil","200g paneer, cubed","1 onion, diced","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 fresh chillies, deseeded if you prefer less heat","1 red pepper, sliced","2 tbsp curry paste","400ml coconut milk","80g long-stem broccoli, steamed or microwaved until just tender","100g baby spinach","naan, rice, poppadoms and lime wedges, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat. Fry the paneer cubes for 2 mins on each side, turning with a pair of tongs, until golden brown. Remove from the pan and set aside on a plate lined with kitchen paper to drain.","Tip the onion into the leftover oil in the pan and fry for 5 mins over a medium heat until softened. Add the garlic and chillies, fry for 2 mins, then add the sliced pepper and fry for 3 mins until softened.","Make a well in the middle of the onion and pepper mixture and add the curry paste, stirring for 2 mins to heat through before pouring in the coconut milk and mixing to combine. Simmer for 5-10 mins or until thickened, then add the fried paneer, broccoli and spinach. Stir well and simmer until the spinach has wilted.","Serve with your choice of naans, rice or poppadoms, and lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7403,7403,'en','Samosa chaat','Try this fantastic way of serving samosas for a more substantial meal. It makes a good starter for a dinner party and to celebrate festivals such as holi','["1 small red onion, finely sliced","1 large lemon, juiced","2 tbsp vegetable, sunflower or rapeseed oil","1 tsp cumin seeds, plus a pinch for testing the oil","400g can chickpeas, drained","¾ tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp chilli powder","1 ½ tsp ground cumin","1 teabag","4 vegetarian samosas (use shop-bought, or see below)","200-300ml Greek yogurt, whisked","3-4 spring onions, finely chopped","handful of fine sev or Bombay mix (optional)"]','["Put the sliced red onion in a heatproof bowl filled with just- boiled water. Leave for 10 mins, drain, then toss with the lemon juice and a pinch of salt. Set aside. The onions will turn a wonderful magenta colour.","To make the spiced chickpeas, heat the oil in asaucepanover a medium heat. To test it’s ready, drop in a few cumin seeds – if they start to sizzle, add the rest, followed by the drained chickpeas. Scatter in 1 tsp salt and the turmeric, chilli powder, ground cumin and 60ml water. Break in the contents of the teabag and give everything a stir. Cover and simmer over a low heat for about 15 mins, or until all the flavours have infused. Gently mash some of the chickpeas in the pan to make a sauce – you might need to add a little more water.","Spoon the spiced chickpeas onto a serving platter. Cut the samosas into chunks and layer these over the top. Drizzle over the yogurt, then top with the sliced pickled onions. Sprinkle over the chopped spring onions and sev or Bombay mix."]','2026-01-10 12:19:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7405,7405,'en','Spiced paneer dhal','Omit the chilli if you prefer less heat, or if you’re making this spiced paneer dhal for kids. This is a balanced and flavourful midweek meal for the family','["1 tbsp rapeseed oil","150g paneer, cut into 1cm cubes","5 cardamom pods, bashed","1 cinnamon stick","1 large onion, finely sliced","3 garlic cloves, crushed","15g ginger, peeled and grated","1 green chilli, finely chopped and deseeded (optional)","1 tsp ground turmeric","300g red lentils, rinsed","850ml vegetable stock","small handful of coriander, leaves picked","naan or chapati and coconut yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in asaucepanover a medium heat. Fry the paneer until golden brown, about 5-7 mins. Transfer to a bowl and set aside. Put the cardamom and cinnamon in the pan and fry for 1-2 mins until fragrant. Add the onion, garlic, ginger, chilli and turmeric. Cook for 5 mins until softened before adding the lentils and stock. Season and bring to a simmer, then cook over a medium heat for 15-20 mins until the lentils are tender and thickened.","Season the dhal and tip in the paneer. Serve with the coriander sprinkled over, and chapati or naan and coconut yogurt, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7407,7407,'en','Dhal poached eggs with herby raita','Try this new take on dhal with poached eggs for a healthy, nutrient-rich meal. Served with a herby raita, it delivers four of your 5-a-day','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions (320g), halved and thinly sliced","2 tsp each cumin seeds and ground turmeric","1 tsp mustard seeds","2 tbsp garam masala","4 garlic cloves, sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and sliced","175g red lentils","400g can chickpeas","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder, mixed with 700ml boiling water","320g baby spinach","8 large eggs","150g natural bio yogurt","1 garlic clove","thin slice of peeled ginger","20g coriander leaves, plus a few extra leaves to serve (optional)","10g mint leaves"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onions for 5 mins until they start to colour. Stir in the spices, garlic and chilli, and cook for a few more seconds until aromatic.","Add the lentils, chickpeas and stock, then cook, uncovered, for 15 mins until the lentils are tender. Stir in the spinach until wilted.","Remove half the dhal from the pan and leave to cool.Will keep chilled for up to three days. Break 4 eggs, spaced apart, into the lentils that are left in the pan, cover and cook over a medium heat for 8-10 mins.","Meanwhile, put all the ingredients for the raita in a bowl and blitz together using ahand blender.","Serve the eggs and dhal with half the raita and scatter over a few extra coriander leaves, if you like.The remaining raita will keep chilled for up to three days. Reheat the remaining dhal in a pan over a medium heat until bubbling. Add a drop of water if it looks dry, then cook the eggs in the hot dhal as described in step 3 and serve with the remaining raita."]','2026-01-10 12:19:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7409,7409,'en','Quick & easy chickpea coconut dhal','Try this quick and easy version of dhal. It’s packed with good-for-you ingredients including chickpeas, lentils and spinach','["oil, for cooking","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","small piece of ginger, peeled and finely chopped","5 spring onions, finely chopped","10 cherry tomatoes, 5 chopped","½ bunch of coriander, leaves picked, stalks finely chopped","400g can coconut milk","400g can of chickpeas, drained and rinsed","400g can cooked lentils, drained and rinsed","2 tbsp curry powder","1 tsp ground turmeric","2 tsp ground cumin","1 lime, juiced","handful of spinach","wholemeal pittas, to serve"]','["Heat a drizzle of oil in a large non-stick pot or pan over a high heat. Add the garlic and ginger, reduce the heat to medium and cook for 3-5 mins, stirring occasionally. Tip in the spring onions, all the cherry tomatoes, the coriander leaves and stalks and 1 tsp salt. Cook for 3 mins more.","Add the coconut milk, chickpeas and lentils and stir well, then add the curry powder, turmeric, cumin, ½ tsp black pepper and the lime juice. Bring to the boil, then reduce to a simmer and cook for 5 mins. Add the spinach and wilt for a few minutes. Check for seasoning, then serve with pittas."]','2026-01-10 12:19:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7411,7411,'en','Spicy chicken & chickpea curry','Try our chicken and chickpea curry for a dish that packs in punchy flavour but doesn’t require a lot of effort to make. It’s great to freeze for busy days','["3 tbsp sunflower oil","2 onions, thinly sliced","6 garlic cloves","2 green chillies, finely chopped","3 tbsp tomato purée","8 skinless chicken thighs, on the bone","1 tsp chilli powder","1 tsp garam masala","2 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground turmeric","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","handful of coriander leaves","cooked rice or naans, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in asaucepanand add the onions. Cook over a medium heat for 10 mins until golden, then add the garlic and chillies and cook for 1 min until fragrant. Add the tomato purée and cook for 1 min. Move the mixture to the side of the pan, then add the chicken thighs. Spread the tomato mix on top of the chicken and cook over a high heat for 5 mins.","Add the spices, 1 tsp salt and 150ml just-boiled water, and mix well. Cover and cook over a low heat for 45 mins until the chicken is cooked. Add the chickpeas and cook for a final 5 mins.To freeze portions, divide into freezable containers and leave to cool first. Will keep frozen for up to three months. Defrost overnight in the fridge, then reheat in a saucepan until piping hot.Scatter over the coriander and serve with rice or warm naans, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7413,7413,'en','Chilli paneer','Enjoy this flavour-packed chilli paneer with rice and your favourite vegetarian sides for a delicious, lightly spiced dinner for two','["4 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tbsp cornflour","2 tbsp plain flour","½ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","226g paneer, cut into 1cm cubes","1 spring onion, finely sliced","cooked rice, to serve","2 tsp cornflour","1 tbsp dark soy sauce","1½-2 tbsp hot chilli sauce, to taste","1½ tbsp ketchup","1 tsp rice vinegar","1 tsp honey","25g ginger, peeled and finely grated","4 garlic cloves, crushed","1 green chilli, finely chopped (deseeded if you like)","½ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","1 red onion, roughly chopped","1 green pepper, deseeded and roughly chopped"]','["Heat the vegetable oil in a large non-stick pan over a medium heat. Combine the cornflour, plain flour, chilli powder, 1 tsp fine sea salt, ½ tsp freshly ground black pepper and 2 tbsp water in a bowl until you have a smooth paste, adding a splash more water if it''s too thick. Add the paneer cubes and toss to coat. Carefully tip the coated paneer into the hot oil in the pan and fry, stirring, until crisp and browned on all sides. Transfer to a plate lined with kitchen paper, and set aside.","To make the sauce, tip the cornflour into a jug and graduallywhiskin the soy sauce until smooth. Add the chilli sauce, ketchup, rice vinegar, honey and 90ml water, then whisk again and set aside. Drain most of the excess oil from the pan and return to a medium heat. Fry the ginger, garlic and chopped chilli for a few minutes until fragrant. Stir in the chilli powder, onion and pepper, turning up the heat to medium-high, and fry until lightly browned. Tip in the soy sauce mixture bubble until thickened slightly.","Remove from the heat and stir in the paneer, ensuring it’s well-coated in the sauce. Add a splash more water if needed, and season to taste. Sprinkle over the spring onion and serve with rice, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7415,7415,'en','Paneer makhani','Hosting a dinner party? No Indian-themed meal or celebration is complete without paneer, and this cheesy delight is just the ticket','["2 tsp butter","2 tbsp vegetable oil","4 tomatoes chopped, or use a 400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp tomato purée","6-7 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","4-5 cardamom pods, roughly bashed","1 small cinnamon stick","1 bay leaf","4 cashew nuts, finely chopped and soaked in water until soft","1cm piece of ginger, peeled and finely grated","1 tsp red chilli powder, such as kashmiri mirch","1 chilli, sliced in half lengthways (optional)","250g paneer, cut into medium cubes","1 tbsp fenugreek leaves","1 tsp garam masala","80ml single cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Melt 1 tsp butter and 1 tbsp oil in a non-stick pan over a low-medium heat until sizzling (watch closely so the butter doesn’t burn). Add the tomatoes, tomato purée, garlic, cardamom pods, cinnamon stick and bay. Cover with a lid and cook for 10 mins over a medium heat, stirring occasionally. After 10 mins, remove from the heat, leave to cool, then remove the bay, cinnamon stick and cardamom pods.","Once cooled, tip the mixture and the cashew nuts into ablenderand blitz to a smooth paste. Set aside.","Return the pan to a medium heat, add the remaining butter and oil and cook the ginger for a minute. Reduce the heat to low, add the chilli powder and stir for 2 mins. Tip in the tomato and cashew paste and cook for 5 mins more.","Add the sliced chilli, if using, 1½ tsp sugar and the paneer. Mix well and cook for a few minutes more. Add the fenugreek leaves and garam masala. Mix well. Stir in up to 100ml water to loosen, then remove from the heat, swirl in the cream, if using, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7417,7417,'en','Simple mushroom curry','Serve these garlicky mushrooms in a rich tomato masala spiced with ground ginger, fennel seeds and cumin for an autumnal supper. Enjoy with rice or naan','["50g unsalted butter","500g chestnut mushrooms, quartered","4-6 tbsp sunflower oil","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp fennel seeds","1 large onion, finely chopped","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tsp ground ginger","¼ tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","½ tsp garam masala","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp caster sugar","2 tbsp thick, full-fat Greek yogurt","2 tbsp chopped coriander","cooked rice or naan, to serve"]','["Melt the butter in a largewok, karahi or non-stick frying pan over a medium-high heat and cook the mushrooms for 10 mins, or until any moisture has evaporated and they’re starting to brown. Transfer to a bowl and set aside.","Heat the oil in the same pan over a medium-high heat and fry the cumin and fennel seeds, stirring continuously for about 30 seconds until they release a nutty aroma. Stir in the onion and cook for 12-15 mins until golden. Reduce the heat to medium, then add the garlic and continue frying for 1 min. Add the ginger, turmeric, chilli powder and garam masala, followed by the tomatoes and sugar. Cook, uncovered, for 5-7 mins, or until the masala thickens and a layer of oil forms around the edge of the pan.","Spoon the yogurt into a small bowl, add a small ladleful of the hot masala and mix well before stirring the yogurt into the pan of masala. Pour in 100ml hot water and simmer for 3-4 mins until the curry has the consistency of double cream. Season to taste, then return the mushrooms to the pan and stir to warm through. Scatter with the chopped coriander and serve with boiled rice or naan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7419,7419,'en','Roasting tin chicken tikka masala','Make a quick, hearty weeknight supper with this all-in-one chicken curry bake. Serve with naans and finely chopped red onion','["4 large chicken legs","1 tsp rapeseed oil","2 large garlic cloves","1 onion, roughly chopped","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and roughly chopped","1 red chilli, roughly chopped","2 tbsp ghee or butter","2 tsp ground turmeric","2 tsp garam masala","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp ground cumin","4 tbsp tomato purée","4 cardamom pods, bashed with the end of a rolling pin","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","200ml chicken stock","1 tsp caster sugar","100ml double cream","½ bunch of coriander, finely chopped","½ red onion, finely chopped, to serve","cooked pilau rice and naans, to serve"]','["Season the chicken legs with a little salt. Heat the rapeseed oil in a large, non-stick frying pan over a high heat and add the chicken legs to the pan, skin-side down. Fry for 5-7 mins, turning occasionally until deep golden brown and crisp on all sides. Remove to a plate and set aside.","Peel the garlic cloves and blitz to a purée in a food processor with the onion, ginger and chilli. Heat the ghee or butter in the pan over a medium heat and cook the oniony purée for 15 mins, stirring often. Stir in the spices, tomato purée and cardamom, then cook for 2 mins more. Tip in the canned tomatoes, stock and sugar, bring to a simmer, cover and cook for a further 15 mins. Season to taste.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Stir the double cream through the sauce, then tip it into a baking dish large enough to fit all the chicken legs in a single layer. Nestle the chicken legs in the sauce and bake in the oven for 25-30 mins until cooked through – the juices should run clear when pierced with the tip of a knife in the thickest part of the legs. Scatter with the coriander leaves and red onion, then serve with pilau rice and naans for mopping up the sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:19:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7421,7421,'en','Classic butter chicken','Swap your usual takeaway for homemade butter chicken. The dish is made in two parts, combining tandoori chicken with a rich, buttery sauce','["3 tbsp lemon juice","2-3 tbsp kashmiri chili powder or paprika","4 skinless chicken breasts or 8 thigh fillets, chopped into 5cm cubes","3 tbsp melted butter or ghee, for basting the skewers","200ml plain yogurt","1 tbsp crushed garlic","1 tbsp finely grated ginger","2 tbsp ground coriander","2 tbsp ground cumin","2 tsp amchoor powder (dried mango powder)","1 tbsp dried fenugreek leaves, crushed","1 tbsp dried mint leaves","½ tsp black salt (optional, see below)","½ tsp plain salt (use 1 tsp if you do not have black salt)","3 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tsp cumin seeds","4-8 hot green chillies, sliced","90g butter or ghee","2 medium onions, finely chopped","4 green cardamom pods, cracked","½ tbsp crushed garlic","½ tbsp grated ginger","1 tsp ground turmeric","2 tsp dried fenugreek leaves, crushed","500ml passata, diluted with 150ml water","2 tsp garam masala","100ml single cream","large pinch of coriander leaves, to garnish"]','["Rub the lemon juice and chilli powder or paprika into the chicken with a pinch of salt, then chill for 1 hr. Mix all the marinade ingredients together in a bowl, taste for seasoning, then add the chilled chicken. Mix well and chill for another 2 hrs.","Thread the marinated chicken pieces onto metal skewers, reserving any leftover marinade. Grill over a hotbarbecuefor 5 mins, turning occasionally and basting with the melted butter or ghee. Alternatively, cook under a hot grill for 8-10 mins, turning occasionally. Don''t worry if the chicken is a little under cooked, as it will finish cooking in the sauce. Remove the skewers to a board.","To make the sauce, heat 2 tbsp vegetable oil in awokor large frying pan and drop in a few cumin seeds. When they start sizzling, tip in the rest of the seeds. Swirl the pan, reduce the heat and add the green chillies. Stir once or twice until the skins of the chillies have blistered, then add the butter or ghee. Turn the heat up to high and continue to cook until all the butter or ghee has melted. Tip in the onions and fry for 10 mins until the onions are light brown and soft. If you prefer a smooth sauce, tip the mixture into a blender and blitz until smooth. Alternatively, scrape into a bowl and set aside.","Wipe the pan clean with kitchen paper and heat the remaining oil. Drop in the crushed cardamom pods. When they have swelled and lightened in colour, reduce the heat, add the garlic and ginger and fry for 30 seconds, stirring continuously until you can no longer smell raw garlic and ginger. Return the cooked onion mixture to the pan and mix well. Add the turmeric and half the fenugreek leaves. Season with salt. Taste and adjust the seasoning if needed – if you like, you can add some chilli powder. Pour in the diluted passata, mix well and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to a simmer and cook, covered and stirring occasionally, for around 20 mins. Oil will eventually rise to the surface when the sauce is cooked.","Remove the chicken pieces from the skewers and chop into bite-sized pieces. Add these to the sauce along with any resting juices. Tip about 125ml warm water into the bowl with the reserved marinade, swirl to loosen, then stir into the sauce. Bring the sauce to the boil and reduce the heat to a simmer. Sprinkle over with garam masala and continue to cook for 3-4 minutes, or until chicken is cooked through. If you like, add a splash of boiling water to loosen the sauce, then taste for seasoning. Pour in half the cream and mix well.","Transfer the butter chicken to a serving bowl, drizzle over the remaining cream, sprinkle with the remaining fenugreek leaves and garnish with the fresh coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:19:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7423,7423,'en','Fragrant lamb kofta curry','Rustle up our one-pan lamb meatball curry which uses our own specially created spice blend. It’s ideal for a Friday night treat to share with the family','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 small red onion, finely chopped","500g lamb mince","1 green or red chilli, sliced, to serve (optional)","basmati rice, to serve","2 tsp garam masala","1½ tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp ground coriander","½ tsp red chilli powder","1 small red onion, finely chopped","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely grated","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","1 green chilli, finely chopped (optional)","small bunch of coriander, leaves and stalks separated, stalks finely chopped, leaves reserved","400g can finely chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp tomato purée","300ml lamb stock","200ml can coconut cream"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onion for 8 mins until soft but not golden. Remove to a bowl and set aside to cool. Tip the lamb mince and half the spice blend into a medium bowl with 1/2 tsp each salt and black pepper and the cooled onions. Knead with your hands to combine evenly, then form into 16 equal meatballs. Return the pan to a medium heat and brown the meatballs all over. Remove to a plate using a slotted spoon.","To make the sauce, fry the onion in the pan for 5 mins until beginning to soften, then add the ginger, garlic, chopped chilli (if using) and coriander stalks, and cook for a further 3 mins. Scatter in the remaining spice blend and cook for 1 min, then tip in the tomatoes, tomato purée, stock and three- quarters of the coconut cream. Stir to combine, bring to a simmer and cook for 15 mins until the sauce has reduced by a quarter.","Return the meatballs to the pan and cook for a further 15 mins, basting the meatballs in the sauce every few minutes until the sauce has reduced by a further quarter, and the meatballs are cooked through. Drizzle over the remaining coconut cream, then scatter over the coriander leaves and sliced chilli and serve with cooked basmati rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7425,7425,'en','Minced lamb & lentil patties (shami kebab)','Cook popular Indian party kebabs for Diwali made with lamb mince and lentils, seasoned with spices and sharpened with fresh coriander, ginger and chillies','["80g split Bengal gram (chana dal)","30g ghee","1 onion, finely chopped","500g lamb mince","10 garlic cloves","50g ginger, peeled and finely chopped","1 tsp Kashmiri chilli powder","1 tsp garam masala","½ tsp black cumin seeds (shahi jeera), or ½ tsp ground cumin","1 egg, lightly beaten","1 lime, juiced","4 tbsp roughly chopped coriander","2 green chillies, finely chopped","50ml sunflower oil","150ml full-fat Greek yogurt","1 small garlic clove, crushed","2 tbsp shredded mint leaves","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp caster sugar","lime juice, for seasoning"]','["Put the split Bengal gram in a small heatproof bowl, cover with boiling water from the kettle and leave to soak for 3 hrs or ideally overnight, if you have the time.","Melt the ghee in a flameproofcasseroleover a medium heat and fry the onions for 7-10 mins until starting to turn golden. Add the lamb mince. Peel the whole garlic cloves and tip these into the dish along with the ginger and cook, stirring often, for 10 mins more until any liquid from the lamb evaporates. Drain the soaked Bengal gram and add this to the dish with the chilli powder, garam masala and black cumin seeds or ground cumin.","Pour over 300ml hot water to just barely cover the mince, cover with a lid, reduce the heat and simmer for 20-25 mins until the mince is tender. Remove the lid and continue to cook, stirring frequently, until all the water has evaporated and the Bengal gram is tender. By now, the mince will be dry and crumbly in texture. Spread the mixture out on a baking tray and leave to cool completely before transferring to a largefood processor.","Add the beaten egg, lime juice, coriander and green chillies to the processor and blend until smooth. Using damp hands, roll the lamb mixture into about 20 walnut-sized balls. Flatten each ball in your palm into a 4cm patty (with a thickness of 1cm) using your fingers. Transfer to a baking tray lined with baking parchment and chill for 30 mins.","For the mint raita, mix the yogurt with the garlic, mint, cumin and sugar and add enough lime juice to sharpen the flavour. Taste for seasoning, then set aside.","Heat 2 tbsp oil in a heavy-based frying pan over a medium heat and fry the kebabs in batches for 3-4 mins on each side until browned. Pour off the excess oil between batches and wipe the pan clean with kitchen towel before adding fresh oil. Drain the kebabs on kitchen paper and serve warm with the mint raita."]','2026-01-10 12:19:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7429,7429,'en','Choleh bhature ‘naan’','Enjoy a tasty Punjabi dish of spiced chickpeas served with bhature – here they are dry-fried making it more of a naan, and paired with raita and a kachumber salad','["¼ cucumber, diced","3 tomatoes, diced","1 large red onion, diced","2 tsp mint sauce","1 lemon, juiced","175g cucumber, grated","2 tsp garam masala","500ml natural yogurt","500ml milk","10g coriander, finely chopped","1½ tbsp olive oil","4 medium onions, finely chopped","5 garlic cloves, finely chopped","thumb-sized piece of ginger, grated","4 green chillies, finely chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tsp garam masala","2 tsp paprika","1 tsp methi (dried fenugreek)","4 x 400g cans chickpeas, rinsed and drained","handful of coriander, chopped, to serve","1kg self-raising flour","250ml natural yogurt","2 tbsp powdered potato (Smash or alternative)","100ml flavourless oil, plus a little extra","1 tsp sugar","1 tsp baking powder","2 tsp ajwain","50g salted butter","4 garlic cloves, finely sliced","1 tbsp fresh coriander, chopped","2 tsp kalonji (nigella seeds)"]','["To make the kachumber salad, mix all the ingredients in a large bowl and set aside.","To make the raita, mix all the ingredients in a large bowl and set aside. When you''re ready to serve, add 1 tsp salt if required and mix well (if you add the salt before this, it will draw out the water, so only add it just before serving).","To make the choleh, heat the oil in a largesaucepan, then add the onions and cook for 8-10 mins over a low-medium heat, until softened. Add the garlic, ginger and chillies, and cook for a further 2-3 mins. Add a splash of water to the pan if the mixture sticks to the bottom. Add the tomatoes and another splash of water, continue to cook for 5-10 mins until the onions and tomatoes are well combined. Add 2 tsp salt and the spices, and cook for 10 mins more until the mixture is well incorporated, and the oil separates. Add some more water if needed to stop it sticking to the bottom of the pan.","Tip in the chickpeas, and 500ml water. Cook over a medium heat for 10 minutes. Once they''re softened, using a potato masher, mash the chickpeas until they''re partially broken up (this helps to thicken the sauce), and then simmer for another 10 minutes. Scatter with the coriander, to serve.","To make the bhature, mix all the ingredients with a metal spoon in a large bowl, until it forms a shaggy dough. Oil a large bowl and your hand with some flavourless oil. Then, knead until the dough is springy and well combined. If the dough seems dry, add more warm water as you go. Smear some oil on the surface of the dough, transfer to the oiled bowl and cover it with a damp tea towel. Leave to rest for 2-3 hours.","Meanwhile, if making the butter, melt the butter in a small pan and add the garlic. Fry until aromatic, add the chopped coriander and nigella seeds, and set aside until needed.","Divide the dough into 16 equal portions. Take one piece of dough, roll into a ball and, using arolling pin, roll until it’s around 1cm in thickness and oval shape. Heat a dry frying pan/thava until it''s hot and drop the dough on. Bubbles will rise on the surface after a minute or so. Turn it over and cook on the other side for 2 mins. Spread some of the butter on top and serve with all of the accompaniments."]','2026-01-10 12:19:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7431,7431,'en','Halwa','Try whipping up some halwa, a traditional Indian dessert made from either semolina or carrots, plus nuts and cardamom. Ours is made with semolina','["100g caster sugar","few drops of orange food colouring (optional)","6 cardamom pods","100g ghee","50g pistachios, chopped","175g semolina (coarse or fine)","puris or parathas, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat 250ml water in apanuntil boiling, then stir in the sugar and food colouring, if using.","Remove the seeds from the cardamom pods and discard, then add 3 of the cardamom husks to the pan. Boil for several minutes, then transfer to a heatproof jug or bowl.","Heat the ghee in the same pan, then add the remaining cardamom husks and the pistachios. Fry for 1 min, then add the semolina. Toast for a few minutes, stirring frequently to prevent burning. Return the hot sugar syrup to the pan, stirring continuously to avoid clumping until all the liquid has been absorbed. The cooked halwa should mould together easily. Scoop out the cardamom husks and serve hot with puris or parathas, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7433,7433,'en','Cauliflower & green bean curry','Try this aromatic curry using two spice mixes: garam masala and Chinese five-spice powder. Coconut yogurt gives a creamy texture without the extra calories','["1tbsp rapeseed oil","1 thumb-sized piece of ginger (about 30g), thinly sliced into shreds","1tbsp curry leaves","320g diced butternut squash (prepared weight)","250g baby potatoes, halved or quartered","225g brown basmati rice","red chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","4 garlic cloves, finely grated","1tbsp garam masala","1tsp Chinese five-spice (check the label to make sure there is no added salt)","4 tomatoes, chopped","400g cauliflower, large florets and leaves roughly chopped","2tsp vegetable bouillon powder","320g French beans, trimmed and cut into lengths","150g coconut yogurt","15g fresh coriander, chopped","½ lime, juiced"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan over a low heat. Add the ginger and curry leaves and fry, stirring, for about a minute. Tip in the squash and potatoes, turn the heat up to medium and fry for 5 mins more. Meanwhile, put the rice on to boil for 20 mins until tender.","Scatter the chilli over the squash and potatoes along with the garlic, garam masala and five-spice. Stir briefly, then add the tomatoes, cauliflower, 400ml water and the bouillon powder. Bring to the boil, then cover and simmer for 10 mins. Add the beans and cook for another 10 mins until all the veg is tender, but still holding their shape.","Turn off the heat and stir in the yogurt, coriander and lime juice. Serve half with half the rice. Chill the remaining two portions of curry and rice for another night.Will keep covered in the fridge for up to two days. Reheat the rice in the microwave and the curry in a pan set over a low heat until piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:19:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7435,7435,'en','Indian pancakes with saffron & rosewater cream (malpua & rabri)','Enjoy Indian fried pancakes as a sweet treat. Often served at the festival Holi, they are steeped in saffron-cardamom syrup and topped with a rosewater cream','["1l full-cream Jersey milk","25g caster sugar","¼ tsp saffron strands soaked in 1 tbsp milk","1 tsp rosewater","75g plain flour","¼ tsp fine salt","75g whole milk powder","1 tsp fennel seeds","250ml whole milk","ghee, for shallow frying","250g caster sugar","6 green cardamom pods, pierced","½ tsp saffron strands, soaked in 4 tbsp warm water for 1 hour","25g pistachios, chopped","dried rose petals (optional)"]','["To make the rabri, heat the milk over a medium heat, then boil until it reduces to a cream. It’s best to use awok, karahi or a sturdy casserole for this – you want the milk to reduce quickly so that it retains its creamy colour without browning. Stir continuously, scraping down the sides of the pan as it cooks.","After about 20 mins, the milk will have reduced by two-thirds and have the consistency of double cream. Stir in the caster sugar and continue cooking until the sugar has dissolved. Add the saffron strands along with the soaking milk and the rosewater. Spoon the cream into a bowl and leave to cool, before transferring to the fridge.","To make the malpua batter, sieve the flour and salt into a medium bowl and mix in the milk powder and fennel seeds. Make a well in the middle of the flour and whisk in enough milk to make a smooth batter – aim for the consistency of double cream. Cover and leave it to rest at room temperature for 20 mins.","To make the syrup, put the sugar in a pan with 300ml water, heat gently, stirring, to dissolve (do not let the water boil). Add the cardamom pods, then simmer for 5 mins. Turn off the heat and gradually stir through the saffron along with its soaking water. Cover the pan and keep the syrup warm while you make the pancakes.","Heat enough ghee in a deep-sided frying pan to create a depth of 3cm when melted. Whisk the batter – it will have thickened slightly and should now have a coating consistency. Add a little more milk if needed.","Once the ghee reaches 130C, or when a cube of bread dropped in browns in 1 min, carefully drop in tablespoons of the batter, leaving room for them to spread. Each pancake should be about 7cm in diameter when it spreads. Take care not to overcrowd the pan.","Cook the pancakes in batches for 2-3 mins. Once the batter has set, increase the heat slightly, and continue cooking until the pancakes are golden. Remove from the oil using a fish slice and drain on kitchen paper.","Add the hot pancakes to the warm syrup in batches, letting them steep for 2-3 mins. Drain the pancakes, then transfer to a serving plate and cover to keep them warm. Repeat the process with the remaining batter and syrup – there should be 14-16 small pancakes.","Spoon any extra saffron and cardamom syrup around the pancakes and top each with a generous helping of chilled rabri. To serve, scatter with chopped pistachios and rose petals, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7437,7437,'en','Lamb bhuna','Make this stunning lamb bhuna a day or two ahead of a big family feast – slow-cooked curries are better when the flavours have time to develop.','["600g lamb neck fillet or shoulder, cut into large chunks","6 garlic cloves, finely grated","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely grated","2 tbsp malt vinegar","½ tsp ground cinnamon","1 tbsp sunflower oil","3 tbsp sunflower oil, plus a little extra if needed","2 onions, finely chopped","10 curry leaves","2 dried chillies, or ½ tsp chilli flakes","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp mustard seeds","1 tsp ground coriander","½ tsp fenugreek seeds or ground fenugreek","1 tbsp tomato purée","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tsp garam masala"]','["To make the marinade, combine the ingredients with a large pinch of salt in a large bowl. Toss in the lamb, cover and marinate for 1 hr at room temperature, or chill overnight.","For the sauce, heat the oil in a flameproofcasseroleand fry the onions for 10 mins, stirring until soft and golden. Drizzle in more oil if the pan gets dry. Add the curry leaves and chillies and fry for a few minutes, then add the spices and cook for 5 mins more until the onions start to caramelise.","Tip in the lamb along with the marinade and turn the heat to high. Cook, stirring, for 5 mins until the lamb browns. Add the tomato purée and cook for 1 min, then stir in the tomatoes and 100ml water. Bring to a simmer, reduce the heat, cover and cook, stirring now and then, for 1 hr 20 mins until the lamb is tender.","Uncover and cook for 8-10 mins more until the sauce has reduced and thickened. Remove from the heat, stir in the garam marsala and season.Will keep chilled for up to three days or frozen for two months."]','2026-01-10 12:19:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7439,7439,'en','Quick & puffy flatbreads','Whip up these speedy flatbreads for an Indian-style feast. They’re like a cheat’s version of naan bread, and are great for mopping up a curry.','["300g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","½ tsp baking powder","150g natural yogurt","1 tbsp vegetable oil","melted ghee or butter, for brushing","cumin seeds, chopped garlic cloves, chopped coriander or chopped chillies (optional)"]','["Combine the flour, baking powder, yogurt and oil with 1 tsp salt and 2 tbsp water, and bring together into a rough dough. Tip onto a lightly floured surface and knead for a few minutes until slightly smooth, then divide into four to eight pieces, depending on the size of flatbread you want.","Heat a heavy-basedfrying panover a high heat. To make basic flatbreads,rollthe dough pieces out on a lightly floured surface into rough ovals, then fry for 1-2 mins on each side until golden and slightly charred in spots. Alternatively, roll the dough pieces out, brush with a little melted ghee or butter, and scatter over the cumin seeds, garlic, coriander or chillies, if you like. Fold each piece of dough over on itself, then roll out again into a rough oval and cook in the same way.","Brush the flatbreads with a little melted butter or ghee, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7441,7441,'en','Indian rice pudding (kheer)','Celebrate Diwali with this indulgent slow-cooked Indian rice pudding. Studded with dried fruit, it has a sweetly spiced floral flavour and a lovely creaminess','["½ tsp saffron strands","2 litres whole milk","20 green cardamom pods, pierced with the point of a knife","100g basmati or long grain rice","100g caster sugar","100ml double cream","2 tsp pure rosewater","2 tbsp blanched almonds, shredded","50g raisins, soaked in hot water"]','["Put the saffron strands in a small bowl and soak in 2-3 tbsp of warm water. Bruise the stems with the back of a teaspoon – this will help release the flavour and colour.","Heat the milk with the pierced green cardamom pods in a sturdypan. When it comes to the boiling point, scatter the rice into the milk, turn the heat to low and simmer until the rice has broken down and is really soft, about 40 mins. Stir often to prevent the rice scorching on the bottom of the pan.","Add the sugar to the cooked rice and heat until dissolved. You can scoop out the cardamom pods, if you like.","Stir in the cream and gradually add the rosewater and enough saffron and its soaking liquid to lightly flavour the kheer. Stir in the shredded almonds and drained raisins and serve either piping hot or chilled."]','2026-01-10 12:19:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7443,7443,'en','Tamarind prawn curry','Our tamarind prawn curry will quickly become a family favourite. It’s quick, healthy and low in fat and calories','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, chopped","1 red chilli, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp grated ginger","1 tsp turmeric","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp ground coriander","400g can cherry tomatoes","1-2 tbsp tamarind paste (see tip, below)","250g raw king prawns","250g cooked basmati rice","handful of coriander leaves, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in afrying panover a medium heat and cook the onion for 5-8 mins until light golden. Stir in the chilli, garlic and ginger, and fry for another minute before adding the spices. Tip in the cherry tomatoes, swirl the can out with a splash of water and stir that into the pan as well.","Simmer for 5 mins until the tomatoes burst and the sauce thickens. Stir in the tamarind and prawns, and simmer for 2-3 mins until the prawns are cooked. Serve the curry on top of the rice, with the coriander scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7445,7445,'en','Oven-baked bhajis','Deliver on flavour with these oven-baked bhajis served with lemon rice and chickpea salad. It makes a healthy dinner for four that’s low in fat and calories','["80g chickpea (gram) flour","1 tbsp medium curry powder","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp vegetable bouillon powder","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 eggs","1 large carrot, coarsely grated (about 150g)","2-3 onions (320g), halved and thinly sliced","2 tbsp chopped ginger","2 tsp rapeseed oil, plus extra for the tin","2 tsp rapeseed oil","150g easy-cook brown rice","½ tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp cinnamon","400ml hot vegetable stock, made with ½ tsp bouillon powder","2 thick strips of lemon peel (from the lemon in the salad, below)","70g coconut yogurt","½ lemon, juiced","400g can chickpeas, drained","⅓ pack of coriander, chopped","4 tomatoes, chopped","170g carrots, cut into thin strips or coarsely grated","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Mix the flour with the spices and bouillon, and the tomato purée with the eggs. Toss the carrot, onion and ginger in the flour mix. Pour in the eggs, mix well and stir in the oil.","Oil a largebaking tray. Spoon on 12 neat mounds of batter. Bake for 20-25 mins until golden.","For the rice, heat the oil in a pan over a medium heat and fry the rice and spices for 1 min. Add the stock and peel. Simmer for 20-25 mins until the rice is tender and the liquid absorbed.","Mix the salad ingredients together and serve with the hajis and rice. If you''re following the healthy diet plan, serve half the bhajis and rice with half the salad.Cool the remaining bhajis and rice and keep chilled with the rest of the salad for up to three days. Reheat the bhajis at 180C/160C fan/gas 4 for 10-15 mins until piping hot. Reheat the rice in themicrowave. Serve with the salad.This recipe is part of our free 7-day healthy diet plan. To access the full meal plan,click here."]','2026-01-10 12:19:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7447,7447,'en','Boondi raita','Try this simple Indian side featuring boondi – small deep-fried chickpea flour balls – in yogurt with mint and cumin','["300g natural yogurt","¼ tsp ground cumin, plus a pinch","60g boondi (available in many Indian supermarkets or online)","a few mint leaves, ½ finely chopped, ½ left whole"]','["Whiskthe yogurt with 100ml water until smooth. Whisk in the cumin, ¼ tsp salt and a pinch of ground black pepper.","Add the boondi and mix well to combine. Leave to stand for 10 mins or up to 2 hrs until the boondi has soaked up some of the liquid and softened slightly (no longer, as the boondi will get too soft). Sprinkle over the chopped and whole mint leaves and a pinch of cumin."]','2026-01-10 12:19:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7449,7449,'en','Paneer & chickpea fry','Enjoy this fragrant paneer and chickpea fry with onion pickle garnish as part of an Indian-inspired feast','["2 tbsp ghee (or use sunflower oil or butter)","250g paneer, chopped","1 onion, sliced","3 garlic cloves, chopped","1 tsp ground turmeric","½ tsp chilli powder","½ tsp cardamom seeds","1 red chilli, sliced","5 curry leaves","1 green pepper, cut into large chunks","400g can chickpeas, drained","½ bunch of coriander, roughly chopped","½ lemon, juiced","½ red onion, sliced"]','["First, make the pickle. Combine the lemon juice, onion and pinch of salt in a small bowl. Set aside.","Heat half the ghee in afrying panand fry the paneer for 10 mins, stirring until lightly brown and crisp on all sides. Scoop out onto a plate using a slotted spoon.","Heat the rest of the ghee in the pan over a high heat, and fry the onions for 5 mins until starting to brown at the edges. Add the garlic, turmeric, chilli powder, cardamom seeds, chilli, curry leaves and pepper, and stir-fry for 5 mins until the onions are caramelised.","Return the paneer to the pan along with the chickpeas and a large splash of water, and simmer everything for 5 mins until the liquid has evaporated and the mixture is sticky. Season with salt, then spoon into a dish and top with the coriander and pickled onions."]','2026-01-10 12:19:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7451,7451,'en','Coriander relish','Enjoy this fresh, fragrant, lightly-spiced coriander relish as a cooling contrast to rich dishes. It’s great with fried snacks too','["1 large handful of coriander leaves, roughly chopped","1 Bramley apple, peeled, cored and roughly chopped","2 tbsp mint leaves","1 small green pepper, roughly chopped","3 tsp caster sugar","1 tsp roasted cumin seeds, ground","20g ginger, peeled, roughly chopped","2 large garlic cloves, roughly chopped","1 green chilli, chopped, with seeds","25g cashew nuts, unsalted, soaked in hot water for 30 minutes","½ lime, juiced"]','["Whizz all the ingredients, except the cashew nuts, in ablenderwith a generous splash of hot water. Once the chutney is smooth, drain the nuts and add to the chutney, then blitz again. Aim for a sweet-tangy flavour, adding more sugar or lime juice if needed. Transfer to a bowl and store in the fridge.Will keep, covered, in the fridge for one day."]','2026-01-10 12:19:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7453,7453,'en','Punjabi semolina halwa (suji halwa)','Serve this Indian dessert at special occasions such as Diwali. With almonds, cardamom and raisins, it has a rich, buttery flavour and toasty semolina aroma','["6 green cardamom pods","175g golden caster sugar","125g ghee","125g semolina, chapati flour or wholewheat flour","25g raisins, soaked in hot water","25g almonds, sliced with their skin on"]','["Split the cardamom pods with asharp knifeand remove the seeds. Grind the seeds to a powder with 1 tsp of the sugar using apestle and mortar. Keep the empty pods for the syrup.","Heat the remaining sugar in a pan over a medium heat with 600ml water until dissolved. Add the empty cardamom pods and simmer, uncovered, for 5 mins. Turn off the heat, cover the pan and set aside.","Heat the ghee in a wok or karahi over a medium heat, then add the semolina or flour. Reduce the heat to low and cook, stirring all the time, until it releases a toasted aroma and turns a biscuity golden colour, about 10 mins.","Take the pan off the heat. Discard the empty cardamom pods from the warm syrup and pour it over the semolina in a thin, steady stream, stirring all the time. Take care – it will sputter. Return the pan to a medium heat and cook, stirring constantly, until the semolina thickens. It should have the consistency of creamy mashed potato. Stir in the ground cardamom, drained raisins and most of the sliced almonds. Serve piping hot with the remaining almonds scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7455,7455,'en','Tandoori roast guinea fowl','Make a roast with a difference with this tandoori roast guinea fowl. Delicious served with flatbreads and raita, enjoy any leftovers wrapped in a naan bread','["1 guinea fowl","flatbreads and raita, to serve (optional)","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and finely grated","5 garlic cloves, finely grated","1 lemon, juiced","1 tsp paprika","½ tsp turmeric","½ tsp ground cumin","½ tsp ground coriander","150ml natural yogurt","100ml double cream","squeeze of lemon juice"]','["First, make the marinade. Combine all the ingredients with 1 tsp salt and a generous amount of freshly ground black pepper. Sit the guinea fowl in a large bowl or container and rub the marinade all over, including under the skin of the breast. Transfer to the fridge to marinate for at least 1 hr, or for up to 24 hrs.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/ gas 7. Put the marinated guinea fowl in a smallroasting tinand pour over any leftover marinade. Pour a small glass of water into the tin around the guinea fowl and roast for 50 mins-1 hr until cooked through and lightly charred. Carefully lift the guinea fowl onto a board, draining any cooking juices from the cavity into the tin, and leave to rest for about 10 mins while you make the sauce.","Add a splash of water to the roasting tin. If the tin is flameproof, set it over a medium heat and bring to a simmer. If the tin is not flameproof, scrape everything into a saucepan and bring to a simmer. Add the cream and bring to the boil. Season to taste, adding a squeeze more lemon juice if needed. Pour the sauce into a serving dish, or pass through a sieve into a dish if you prefer a smoother sauce. Carve the guinea fowl and serve with the sauce, some flatbreads and raita, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7457,7457,'en','Cheat’s beetroot biriyani','Cook this beetroot biriyani and freeze the leftovers for busy weeknights. With colourful beetroot taking centre stage, it’s full of spices and is a flavourful dish','["3 large (500g unprepped), raw beetroot, peeled and cut into 2cm cubes","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 large onion, finely sliced","thumb-sized piece of ginger, grated","2 small garlic cloves, crushed","1 bay leaf","4 cardamom pods","2 tsp turmeric","2 tbsp garam masala","250g basmati rice, rinsed","500ml low-salt veg stock","100ml fat-free yogurt","small bunch of coriander","your favourite chutney or pickle, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the beetroot with half the oil and some seasoning, then tip into a roasting dish and cook for 25-30 mins, tossing halfway through, until tender.","Meanwhile, heat the remaining oil in a large, shallow casserole dish or ovenproof frying pan. Fry the onion over a medium heat for 10 mins until golden. Add the ginger and half the garlic, and cook for 1 min. Stir through the bay, cardamom pods, turmeric and garam masala, then cook for 2 mins. Stir in the rice and beetroot, then season. Pour in the stock and bring to the boil.","Put in the oven, uncovered, and cook for 20-25 mins until the rice is cooked through. Give it a stir when it’s out of the oven.","Put the yogurt, coriander and remaining garlic in a food processor and whizz until smooth. Season to taste. Serve the biriyani with the coriander yogurt and pickle."]','2026-01-10 12:19:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7459,7459,'en','Roast chicken & spiced rice','Throw together this wholesome chicken traybake for the family, gently spiced using a little curry paste, with just 15 mins prep. Mango chutney adds a fruity tang','["1 chicken stock cube","4 tbsp mild or medium curry paste (we used korma)","2 tbsp butter or oil, plus extra for frying","350g basmati rice","1 cinnamon stick","6-8 chicken thighs, bone-in, skin on","1 onion, halved and sliced","20g toasted almonds","350g green beans","handful of coriander leaves","mango chutney, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/ gas 6. Pour 800ml just-boiled water into a heatproof jug, crumble in the stock cube and stir in along with half the curry paste and the butter or oil. Pour the mixture into a large baking dish or roasting tin (ours was 25 x 35cm and 5cm deep), and tip in the rice and cinnamon stick. Season and stir well.","Cut a few deep slashes into each chicken thigh, then rub all over with the remaining curry paste and some seasoning. Arrange on top of the rice mixture, then cover the dish or tin with foil and bake for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan over a medium heat, and fry the onion for 10-15 mins, or until soft and caramelised.","Uncover the chicken and rice. The rice should still be wet, but if not, top up with 50-100ml more water. Scatter over the almonds and bake, uncovered, for 10-15 mins more until the chicken is browned, all the liquid has been absorbed and the rice is cooked through and crisp at the edges. Meanwhile, cook the green beans in boiling water for 2-3 mins, then drain. Scatter the coriander and fried onions over the chicken and rice, spoon a few dollops of chutney over the dish, and serve with the green beans."]','2026-01-10 12:19:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7461,7461,'en','Easy sausage & courgette pilaf','Whip up this speedy sausage, courgette and rice dish in just 20 minutes. Full of flavour, it’s ideal for when you want something quick and easy','["100g basmati rice","1 tsp vegetable oil","3 sausages, meat squeezed from the skins","1 tsp fennel seeds, black onion seeds or crushed coriander seeds","1 courgette, sliced into half-moons","100g frozen peas","200ml vegetable stock","½  small bunch of mint, leaves picked and finely chopped","½  small bunch of dill, finely chopped","2 tbsp fat-free yogurt"]','["Rinse the rice a couple of times until the water runs clear, then leave to soak. Heat the oil in a medium saucepan with a tight- fitting lid, and fry the sausagemeat for 2-3 mins until crisp and golden. Stir in the seeds and courgette, and fry for another 2 mins over a high heat so the water from the courgette evaporates.","Stir in the drained rice, peas, stock and half the chopped herbs. Bring to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10-12 mins until the rice is tender.","Fold most of the remaining herbs into the rice. Serve with a scattering of the remaining herbs on top and the yogurt on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:19:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7463,7463,'en','Lamb jalfrezi with cumin rice','Satisfy your curry cravings with this healthy version of a popular takeaway, served with brown rice. It packs in three of your 5-a-day along with iron, vitamin C and fibre','["2 tsp cold-pressed rapeseed oil","600g lean lamb leg steak, trimmed of all visible fat, diced","1 large onion, finely chopped","2 large garlic cloves, chopped","50g ginger, shredded","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp cumin seeds","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 large peppers, seeded and diced","1 medium onion, cut into wedges","1 red or green chilli, deseeded and sliced","25g fresh coriander, chopped","250g brown basmati rice","1-2 tsp cumin seeds"]','["Heat 1 tsp oil a large wide non-stick frying pan and fry the lamb for about 4 mins, stirring until browned. Scoop from the pan and set aside.","Add the chopped onion, garlic and half the shredded ginger to the pan and fry for 5 mins until softened. If the onions start to catch, add a splash of water. Add the spices and cook for a minute more. Tip in the tomatoes and half a can of water along with the bouillon, then blitz everything in the pan with a hand blender until really smooth. Stir in the lamb, then cover and simmer over a low-medium heat for 25 mins until tender.","Meanwhile boil the rice with the cumin seeds in a pan of water for 25 mins until tender. Drain.","Heat the remaining oil in a non-stick wok. Add the peppers, onion wedges, chilli and remaining ginger, and stir-fry everything together for around 5 mins, or until tender, but still with some bite. Stir into the curry with the coriander and serve with the rice. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, eat two portions of the curry and rice now, then chill the rest for another day. To serve the second night, just reheat portions in the microwave on plates."]','2026-01-10 12:19:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7465,7465,'en','Baath na bhajia (rice pakoras)','Enjoy these moreish rice pakoras as a starter in an Indian feast, or alone as a snack. Serve on a sharing platter with plenty of ketchup for dunking','["400g cooked basmati rice","1 medium red onion, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed","2-3 green chillies, finely chopped","1½ tsp sugar","½ tsp ground turmeric","150g gram flour","3 tbsp natural yogurt","large bunch of coriander, finely chopped","vegetable or sunflower oil, for deep-frying","ketchup, to serve"]','["Mix the cooked rice, onion, garlic, chillies, sugar, turmeric, flour and yogurt together in a large bowl. Stir in the coriander, 1-1½ tsp salt (to taste) and 100ml water, then leave the mixture to rest for 15 mins.","Heat a deep pan no more than two-thirds full of oil to 180C. If you don’t have a thermometer, drop a small spoonful of the mixture into the oil – it’s ready when it turns golden within 1 min. Drop heaped teaspoonfuls of the mixture into the oil in batches and cook for 2-3 mins, or until evenly golden and crisp. Transfer to kitchen paper to drain.","Tip onto a platter and serve with plenty of ketchup for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:19:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7467,7467,'en','Pressure cooker beef curry','Make this beef curry in a pressure cooker for an easy midweek meal. Serve with rice or naan bread to mop up the juices','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","500g beef, stewing or braising steak","1 tbsp butter","1 large onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 thumb-sized piece ginger, finely grated","¼ tsp hot chilli powder","1 tsp turmeric","2 tsp ground coriander","3 cardamom pods, crushed","400g can chopped tomatoes","500ml beef stock","1 tsp caster sugar","2 tsp garam masala","2 tbsp double cream (optional)","½ small bunch of coriander, roughly chopped","naan bread or rice, to serve"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a pressure cooker. Season the beef and fry in batches for 5-8 mins, turning occasionally until evenly browned. Set aside on a plate.","Heat the remaining oil and butter in the pan and fry the onion gently for 10 mins or until golden brown and caramelised. Add the garlic, ginger, chilli, turmeric, coriander and cardamom and fry for 2 mins. Stir in the beef and cook for 1 min to coat the beef in the spices.","Tip in the tomatoes, stock and sugar and bring to a simmer. Lock the lid onto the cooker and bring up to high pressure. Cook for 15 mins, then turn off the heat and let the pressure drop naturally. Give everything a good stir and add more water if the sauce is already thick.","Lock the lid back in place and give it another 10 mins, then let the pressure drop naturally. Check the meat is tender – depending on the cut it might need 5 mins more.","Take it off the heat, stir through the garam masala and cream, if you like. Season to taste. Scatter over the coriander and serve with naan bread or rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7469,7469,'en','Beef curry','Make our easy beef curry and serve with a hunk of naan bread to mop up the delicious juices. If you prefer it less spicy, simply add less chilli powder','["2 tbsp oil","500g diced braising steak","1 tbsp butter","1 large onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 thumb sized piece of ginger, finely grated","¼ tsp hot chilli powder","1 tsp turmeric","2 tsp ground coriander","3 cardamom pods, crushed","400g can chopped tomatoes","300ml beef stock","1 tsp sugar","2 tsp garam masala","2 tbsp double cream (optional)","½ small bunch coriander, roughly chopped","naan bread or rice, to serve"]','["Heat one tbsp of the oil in a casserole pot over a medium-high heat. Season the beef and fry in the pot for 5-8 mins, turning with a pair of tongs half way until evenly browned. Set aside on a plate.","Heat the remaining oil and butter in the pan and add the onions. Fry gently for 15 mins or until golden brown and caramelised. Add the garlic, ginger, chilli, turmeric, ground coriander and cardamom and fry for two mins. Tip in the tomatoes, stock and sugar and bring to the simmer.","Add the beef, put a lid on top of the curry and cook over a low heat for 1 ½ – 2 hrs or until the meat is tender and falling apart. Remove the lid for the last 20 minutes of cooking.","Stir through the garam masala and cream (if using) and season to taste. Scatter over the coriander and serve with naan breads or rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7471,7471,'en','West Indian spiced aubergine curry','Make the most of aubergines with this vegan curry. Low in fat yet packed with flavour, you can serve it with rice or roti','["1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","½ tsp ground turmeric","1 large aubergine","2 tbsp tomato purée","½ green chilli, finely chopped","1cm piece ginger, peeled and finely chopped","2 tsp caster sugar","½-1 tbsp rapeseed oil","3 spring onions, chopped","½ bunch of coriander, shredded","cooked rice, natural yogurt, roti and lime wedges, to serve"]','["Mix the dry spices and 1 tsp salt together in a bowl and set aside.","Slice the aubergine into 1cm rounds, then score both sides of each round with the tip of a sharp knife. Rub with the spice mix until well coated (you should use all of the mix), then transfer to a board. Put 150ml water in the empty spice bowl with the tomato purée, chilli, ginger and sugar. Set aside.","Heat the oil in a large non-stick frying pan over a medium heat and arrange the aubergine in the pan, overlapping the rounds if needed. Fry for 5 mins on each side, or until golden. Add the liquid mix from the bowl, bring to a simmer, cover and cook for 15-20 mins, turning the aubergine occasionally until it’s cooked through. If it seems dry, you may need to add up to 100ml more water to make it saucier. Season.","Scatter over the spring onions and coriander, and serve with rice, yogurt, roti and lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7473,7473,'en','Next level dhal makhani','Make no excuses for how rich this delicious black dhal is  – the buttery lentil dish is meant to be enjoyed as a comforting celebration dish','["200g whole urad dhal (also called urad beans, urid dhal or black lentils)","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","thumb-sized piece of ginger, ⅓ finely sliced, ⅓ grated, ⅓ cut into fine matchsticks","2 green chillies, 1 whole, 1 chopped","½ tsp turmeric","100g butter","1 tsp cumin seeds","2 tbsp dried fenugreek leaves","1 tbsp ground coriander","5 garlic cloves, crushed","100g tomato purée","400g can kidney beans, undrained","¼ tsp garam marsala","50ml double cream"]','["Tip the dhal into a sieve and rinse under cold water several times until the water runs clear. Put in a large bowl or pot and cover in double their volume of warm water. Stir in the bicarbonate of soda and leave to soak at room temperature for at least 12 hrs.","Drain the dhal (but don’t rinse), tip into a pan and cover with 1.5 litres water. Add the sliced ginger, whole chilli and turmeric, then bring to the boil, skim off any scum that rises to the top and reduce the heat. Simmer for 1 hr until very tender, or cook in a pressure cooker for 20 mins. Remove the ginger and chilli.","Heat the butter in a separate pan over a medium-high heat until it has foamed up and turned nut-brown. Pour half into a small container and set aside. Return the pan and remaining butter to the heat and add the cumin seeds, fenugreek leaves, ground coriander, garlic, grated ginger and tomato purée and cook for 2 mins more. Stir the spice mixture into the cooked dhal, then add the kidney beans along with the liquid from the can.","Roughly mash the dhal mixture with a potato masher until some of the pulses are crushed. Cook, stirring, over a very low heat for 15-20 mins until the dhal is thick and creamy. Stir through most of the reserved brown butter, the garam marsala and half the cream. Tip the dhal into a serving dish and drizzle over the remaining cream and brown butter. Scatter over the chopped chilli and ginger matchsticks and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7475,7475,'en','Paneer korma','Cook this recipe inspired by saag paneer in just 30 minutes. It''s a flavourful veggie curry that''s heady with fresh ginger and cardamom. Serve with rice or naan breads','["3 tbsp vegetable oil","225g block of paneer, cut into 2cm cubes","1 large onion, roughly chopped","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled","2 large garlic cloves","5 tbsp korma paste","3 cardamom pods, crushed","70g ground almonds","500ml vegetable stock","150g spinach","100g Greek yogurt","rice or naan breads, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a deep frying pan over a medium-high heat. Add the paneer cubes and fry for 5 mins, turning regularly, so each side is golden brown. Remove with tongs and put on a plate lined with kitchen paper.","Put the onion, ginger and garlic in a food processor with a splash of water and blitz until completely smooth. Heat the remaining oil in the frying pan over a medium-low heat. Add the onion mixture and a pinch of salt, and fry for 10 mins or until lightly golden. Add the korma paste and cardamom, and fry for 1 min. Stir in the ground almonds and fry for 1 min to make a thick paste.","Add the stock, bring to a simmer and cook for 5-10 mins, uncovered, or until reduced a little. Add the spinach to the sauce and cook for 5 mins. Stir through the yogurt and paneer, and season generously. Serve with rice or warm naan breads."]','2026-01-10 12:19:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7477,7477,'en','Spiced broccoli, paneer & peas with garam masala cashews','Serve this subtly spiced broccoli and paneer dish with naan breads or rotis. A meat-free, veg-packed main, perfect for Friday night','["2 tbsp groundnut oil","thumb-sized piece of ginger, grated","2 garlic cloves, crushed","½  tsp cumin seeds","½  tsp turmeric","1 tbsp garam masala, plus an extra 1 tsp","225g block paneer, cut into 2cm cubes","small bunch of coriander, chopped","100g fat-free natural yogurt","50g cashews","1 large head of broccoli, cut into florets and stem cut into 2cm chunks","400g Brussels sprouts, halved or quartered","250g defrosted peas","1 lime, juiced, plus wedges to serve","mango chutney and naan breads or rotis, warmed, to serve"]','["Whisk 1 tbsp of the oil with the ginger, garlic, cumin, turmeric, 1 tbsp garam masala and some seasoning in a bowl. Add the paneer and stir in the mixture to coat it, then leave to marinate in the fridge for at least 2 hrs, or overnight.","Blend the coriander and yogurt with a stick blender or in a small food processor with a pinch of salt until you get a green sauce. Keep in the fridge for serving later.","Heat the grill to medium. Tip the cashews into a shallow baking tray, then toss with 1 tsp garam masala and ½ tsp sea salt. Grill for 2 mins until toasted and golden, tossing again halfway through. Tip into a bowl and set aside.","Toss the broccoli and sprouts with the remaining oil. Season and spread out on the tray you used for the cashews and grill for 10 mins until just starting to turn tender, tossing halfway through. Mix in the paneer along with its marinade and grill again for 10 mins, until golden and lightly charred. Scatter over the peas and toss everything together well. Warm through for 1-2 mins under the grill (don’t leave for too long or the peas will shrivel).","Scatter over the spiced cashews, then squeeze over the lime juice. Drizzle with the yogurt dressing and serve with the chutney, naan breads or rotis and lime wedges to squeeze over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7479,7479,'en','Kolhapuri spit chicken (kala masala roast chicken)','This indian spiced roast chicken makes a great alternative to a traditional Sunday roast. Try with black pepper and garlic sweet potato wedges','["1 whole chicken (about 1.4kg)","50ml rapeseed oil, plus extra for the tin, if needed","100g strained yogurt","lime wedges, to serve","1 tbsp garlic paste","1 tbsp ginger paste","½  tsp turmeric","1 tsp chilli powder","1 lime, juiced","2 tbsp vegetable oil, for frying","1 small whole dried red chili","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp black peppercorns","½  small cinnamon stick","1 tsp coriander seeds","1 tsp mace","1 tsp whole cloves","1 black cardamom pod, seeds removed","1 tsp caraway seeds","1 bay leaf","1 small star anise","½  tsp grated nutmeg","2 green cardamom pods, seeds removed","½  tsp Szechuan peppercorns"]','["Mix all the marinade ingredients with 1 tsp salt, rub all over the chicken to cover, then chill for at least 4 hrs, or up to 24 hrs.","To make the spice mix, heat the oil in a pan over a medium heat, and add all the spices. Fry for 3-5 mins until smelling toasted, then drain through a sieve and cool, discarding the oil. Grind to a fine powder in a spice blender or using a pestle and mortar, and keep in an airtight jar.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Line a baking tray with foil, or lightly oil a roasting tin. Pat the chicken dry with kitchen paper, removing the excess marinade. Mix the yogurt, oil and all the spice mix together, then rub over the chicken and under the skin. Don’t worry if the mix splits a little.","Put the chicken, breast-side up, on the tray or in the tin. Roast for 1 hr 30-1 hr 40 mins, basting halfway through the cooking time and covering with foil if it gets too dark, until the juices run clear when a thigh is pierced with a skewer.","Remove from the oven, cover with foil and leave to stand for 10 mins before serving. Drizzle with pan juices and serve with lime wedges and sweet potato wedges, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7481,7481,'en','South Indian aloo masala (dosa stuffing)','Enjoy these spicy Indian potatoes as a filling for dosa (pancakes made with rice flour) for a comforting vegan supper, or serve as a side dish','["4 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tsp mustard seeds","10-15 curry leaves","¼ tsp asafoetida","1 onion, thinly sliced","1 heaped tbsp tomato purée","3 tsp sambar masala mixed with ¼ cup water","4 large potatoes, boiled and cut into bite size chunks","handful fresh coriander, finely chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a pan over a medium heat. Fry the mustard seeds, curry leaves and asafoetida until they begin to crackle, then add the onions. Cook for 3-4 mins until the onions are slightly golden.","Stir in the tomato purée along with the diluted sambar masala. Tip in the potatoes, 1¼ tsp of salt and mix well. Lightly crush the potatoes with a wooden spoon and cook for a further 3-4 mins. Taste for seasoning. Serve garnished with the coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:19:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7483,7483,'en','Dosa','Make your own dosa – Indian rice pancakes made from fermented batter. They take a little effort, but are delicious served with aloo masala and other fillings','["50g split urad lentils, washed","1 tbsp channa dal /bengal gram","190g basmati rice","1 tbsp fenugreek seeds (optional)","vegetable oil, for frying"]','["Wash all the ingredients, except for the oil, three or four times, then drain. Leave to soak in cold water in a bowl overnight.","Drain the water from the ingredients, but keep it and set aside. Transfer the soaked ingredients to a food processor and grind to make a smooth paste. Make sure the batter doesn''t look grainy – you can use a little of the soaking water if you need to. It should be like a thick, smooth pancake batter and should coat the back of a spoon. Empty into a large bowl and cover. Keep it in a warm place overnight to allow the batter to ferment (see tip, below). It will have doubled in quantity and look bubbly. If you''re not using the batter straight away, chill for later. It will keep for up to five days.","Very gently stir the batter. It will have thickened in consistency, so you can add a little water to give it a thick but pourable consistency.","Heat a non-stick frying pan on a low to medium heat for 5 mins. Drizzle over a few drops of oil, then wipe the pan with kitchen paper to get rid of any excess oil.","Sprinkle a handful of water on the hot pan to cool it, then dry with some kitchen paper. Pour one ladle of the dosa batter in the middle of the pan. Using the bottom of the ladle, quickly move it in a circular motion, allowing the batter to spread outwards from the middle towards the edge of the pan, to form a round, thin pancake.","Drizzle a few drops of oil all over the dosa and increase the temperature to a high heat. When it turns slightly golden and the edges begin to lift, add any stuffing (like dosa masala potato stuffing) to the middle. Continue to cook until the underside looks completely golden and crisp. Use a flat spatula to loosen the edges, then roll over the potato stuffing and lift onto a plate.","Before you make the next dosa, decrease the temperature of the pan back to a medium heat and repeat the above steps."]','2026-01-10 12:19:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7485,7485,'en','Coronation prawns on toasted naan','Create a speedy supper that''s big on flavour with curried king prawns and chickpeas served on garlic naan. You can make it in just 11 minutes so it''s perfect for busy days','["2 tsp mild curry powder","1 tsp ground turmeric","½ x 400g can chickpeas, drained","60g cooked king prawns","2 tbsp fat-free Greek yogurt","1 tbsp mayonnaise","1 tbsp mango chutney","½ small bunch coriander, chopped","½ large garlic naan bread","15g flaked almonds, toasted"]','["Heat a small frying pan over a high heat, add the curry powder and turmeric, and toast for 1 min. Rinse the chickpeas under cold water, then pat dry with kitchen paper. Put in a bowl with the prawns, yogurt, mayonnaise, mango chutney, toasted spices and coriander. Mix everything together until well combined and season to taste.","Cut the naan bread in half and toast in a toaster or under a grill for 1-2 mins. Top with the prawn and chickpea mixture, then finish with the flaked almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:19:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7487,7487,'en','Roti','Mop up a delicious curry sauce with a warm roti. These easy Asian flatbreads puff up in the pan and are perfect for grabbing handfuls of a filling veggie masala','["115g self raising flour","115g wholemeal plain flour","1½ tsp salt","3 tbsp vegetable oil plus extra for frying","2 tsp butter, for frying"]','["Sift both flours and salt into a large mixing bowl. Add 1 tbsp of the oil and 175-200ml warm water and bring together to make a soft but not too sticky dough. If it feels a little wet, add a bit more flour.","Tip the dough onto a lightly floured worktop and knead for 4-5 mins or until smooth and elastic. Set aside in a lightly oiled bowl for 30 mins.","Divide the dough into six equal-sized pieces (weigh each piece for accuracy if you like). Using a rolling pin roll each one into a thin circle about 18-20cm wide.","Heat a little of the remaining oil and butter in a heavy-based pan over a high heat. Once foaming, add the rolled out roti, one at a time, and cook for 1-2 mins on each side or until speckled golden brown and beginning to puff up. Set aside on a warm plate until ready to eat."]','2026-01-10 12:19:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7491,7491,'en','Creamy veggie korma','Creamy and healthy – a winning combination for this curry, which can be easily adapted to suit all the family if some want to add meat','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, finely chopped","3 cardamom pods, bashed","2 tsp each ground cumin and coriander","½  tsp ground turmeric","1 green chilli, deseeded (if desired) and finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","thumb-size piece ginger, finely chopped","800g mixed vegetables, such as carrots, cauliflower, potato and courgette, chopped","300-500ml hot vegetable stock","200g frozen peas","200ml yogurt","2 tbsp ground almonds (optional)","½ small raw chicken breast per portion","toasted flaked almonds, chopped coriander, basmati rice or naan bread"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Cook onion\r\nwith the dry spices over a low heat for\r\n5-6 mins until the onion is light golden.\r\nAdd the chilli, garlic and ginger and cook\r\nfor 1 min, then throw in the mixed\r\nvegetables and cook for a further 5 mins.","Divide the mixture appropriately\r\nbetween two pans if serving vegetarians\r\nand meat eaters. Chop the chicken into\r\nsmall chunks and stir into one pan. Add\r\nthe stock, dividing between the pans\r\nappropriately, and simmer for 10 mins (if only cooking the veggie version in one pan, use 300ml stock; if dividing between two pans, add 250ml to each).\r\nDivide the peas, if necessary, and add,\r\ncooking for 3 mins more until the veg are\r\ntender and the chicken is cooked through.","Remove from the heat and stir through\r\nthe yogurt and ground almonds, if using.\r\nServe sprinkled with the toasted almonds\r\nand coriander, with basmati rice or naan\r\nbread on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7493,7493,'en','Spiced paneer','Indian cheese paneer makes a great vegetarian dish as it holds its form – flavour with fenugreek and garam masala','["vegetable oil, for frying","400g paneer, cut into bite-sized pieces","1 tsp coriander seed","knob of ginger, peeled and chopped","1 medium onion, chopped","4 large ripe tomatoes, chopped","1½ tsp chilli powder","1 tsp fenugreek seed","1 tsp garam masala","1 tbsp clear honey","small handful of fresh coriander, chopped","small knob of ginger, peeled and shredded into matchsticks","1 small red and 1 small green pepper, seeded and finely chopped","3 spring onions, finely shredded"]','["Heat 1cm oil in a large frying pan\r\nand fry the paneer in batches until\r\ngolden brown – watch out as the oil\r\nspits. Scoop it on to kitchen paper.","Heat 1 tbsp oil in a frying pan and\r\ngently fry the coriander seeds,\r\nginger, chilli and onion for about 8-\r\n10 minutes until golden. Tip in the\r\ntomatoes and cook for another 5\r\nminutes until they start to soften.\r\nAdd the other spices and honey,\r\nstir and simmer for a few minutes.","Tip the paneer into the sauce and\r\nstir. Simmer for a few minutes, then\r\nadd the chopped coriander and\r\nshredded ginger. Serve sprinkled\r\nwith peppers and spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7495,7495,'en','Tandoori spiced sea bream','Simple to prep but with pretty special results, this Indian-inspired menu from MasterChef winner Dhruv Baker makes a romantic meal for two','["drizzle olive oil, for frying","2 sea bream fillets","1 tsp garlic paste (blend lots of peeled garlic with a little vegetable oil, then freeze in ice cube trays)","1 tsp ginger paste (made as above)","2 green chillies","¼ tsp red chilli powder","½ tsp turmeric","½ tsp garam masala","juice ½ lime","100g unsalted butter"]','["Mix the tandoori butter ingredients,\r\nplus some seasoning, in a small food\r\nprocessor or with a hand-held blender\r\nuntil smooth. Scrape onto cling film, then\r\nuse the cling film to help you roll it into\r\na cylinder. Twist the ends to seal in the\r\nbutter and chill until firm. The butter will\r\nlast in the fridge for a week, or in the\r\nfreezer for up to 3 months.","Heat a heavy-based frying pan with\r\na drizzle of oil until really hot. Season\r\nthe fish, then place in the pan, skin-side\r\ndown, and cook for 4-5 mins until crisp\r\nand almost cooked through. Carefully\r\nturn over, add a good tbsp of tandoori\r\nbutter to the pan and spoon it over the\r\nfish as it melts. Serve straight away with\r\nthe Crushed saffron potatoes and Green\r\nbeans with coconut (recipes below),\r\nwith any pan juices poured over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7497,7497,'en','Chicken masala skewers','These skewers are great with a dollop of mango chutney or raita, and can also be cooked on the barbecue for hot summer days','["150ml 0% fat Greek yogurt","2 tbsp masala paste","handful of coriander leaves, chopped, plus extra leaves to serve","juice 1 lime, pinch of zest, plus wedges to serve","4 skinless, boneless chicken breasts, each cut into 6 chunks","wholemeal chapatis, to serve","250g pack cherry tomatoes, hulled or quartered","1 red onion, finely chopped","1 cucumber, cut into chunks"]','["In a large bowl mix the yogurt, paste,\r\nhalf the chopped coriander, half the lime\r\njuice and all the the zest. Tip in the chicken,\r\nstir to coat and leave in the fridge to\r\nmarinate for 30 mins if you have time.","Thread the chicken onto 8 skewers\r\nand cook in batches on a hot griddle\r\npan, frying pan or barbecue for about\r\n10-12 mins, turning until cooked though.","Meanwhile, mix the salad ingredients\r\nwith the remaining lime juice and coriander\r\nin a bowl and season. Sprinkle with extra\r\ncoriander and serve alongside the skewers\r\nwith warmed wholemeal chapatis."]','2026-01-10 12:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7499,7499,'en','Malai kofta with spicy gravy','This North Indian dish is often served at Diwali and makes the perfect dinner party dish.','["800g potatoes, peeled","5 tbsp plain flour","2 eggs, beaten","100g fine breadcrumbs","oil for frying","2 heaped tbsp grated paneer cheese","5 cashew nuts, chopped","1 tbsp raisins","2-3 green chillies, finely chopped","¼ tsp sugar","1 tsp each ground coriander, cumin and chilli powder","½ tsp cardamom powder","3 tbsp vegetable oil or ghee","2 medium onions, chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed","large piece ginger, grated","2 tsp poppy seeds, crushed to a powder","1 tbsp peanut or cashew nuts","3 tbsp vegetable oil","3 large tomatoes, puréed","1 tsp chilli powder","½ tsp each garam masala, ground coriander, cumin and sugar","flaked almond and single cream, to serve"]','["Boil the potatoes until tender, then\r\ndrain, return to the pan and put over a\r\nlow heat to steam dry for a few mins.\r\nMash with some seasoning and cool.","Mix all the filling ingredients together.\r\nMake 12 balls of potato. Take one, press\r\nyour finger into it to make a little hole,\r\nthen place a little of the filling mixture\r\ninto the centre. Pinch the potato back\r\nover to seal and shape into a round.\r\nRepeat with remaining potato balls and\r\nfilling. Roll each kofta in flour, dip in the\r\nbeaten egg, then roll in the breadcrumbs.\r\nFill a deep saucepan halfway with oil, and\r\nheat until a small piece of bread browns\r\nin 20 secs. Fry the koftas in batches for\r\na few mins until golden, then set aside\r\non kitchen paper.","For the gravy, blend together the\r\nonions, garlic, ginger, poppy seeds and\r\nnuts in a food processor to a purée. Heat\r\nthe oil, then fry the onion purée until just\r\nturning brown. Add the puréed tomatoes,\r\nspices and sugar. The gravy should be\r\nquite thick, but if you want to thin it down\r\na bit, add a little water.","When the gravy comes to a boil, add\r\nthe koftas. Heat through and serve with\r\na drizzle of single cream and some flaked\r\nalmonds scattered on top."]','2026-01-10 12:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7501,7501,'en','Indian spiced barbecued lamb','Yogurt-based marinades create a delicious thin crust when they char, so are ideal for barbecues','["1 butterflied leg of lamb, about 2½ kg/5lb 8oz (ask your butcher to do this for you)","finger-length piece ginger, chopped","4 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","1 tbsp each turmeric, garam masala and cumin seeds","1 tsp paprika","handful coriander leaves, plus extra sprigs to serve","juice 1 lemon","150ml natural yogurt"]','["Using a hand blender or mini food\r\nprocessor, whizz marinade ingredients\r\nto a smooth paste, then season with salt.\r\nLay the lamb in a ceramic dish and coat\r\nwith the marinade. Cover in cling film\r\nand leave to marinate in the fridge for\r\nat least 4 hrs or preferably overnight.","If you are using a charcoal barbecue,\r\nwait for the coals to become white and\r\nglowing (light the barbecue about an hour before you want to cook the lamb). If using a gas barbecue, cook the lamb over medium heat. Lift lamb out of the marinade\r\nand barbecue, flesh-side down, for about\r\n25 mins. Flip it over and give the fat side\r\nabout 15 mins. When the lamb has a dark\r\nbrown crust and is cooked to your liking,\r\nleave it to rest on a board for 15 mins. (If the weather forces you indoors, the lamb can be roasted at 220C/200C fan/gas 7 for about an hour for pink meat; the breads can be cooked on a very hot griddle).","To serve, carve the lamb into thick\r\nslices and scatter with the coriander\r\nand some of the Pickled red onion (see\r\nbelow). Serve the remaining onion in\r\na dish alongside the raita and breads\r\n(see recipes, below)."]','2026-01-10 12:19:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7503,7503,'en','Fragrant vegetable & cashew biryani','A delicious vegetarian main dish or accompaniment to another curry, ideal for a curry buffet or spicy feast','["500g basmati rice","2 large onions, halved and thinly sliced","4 tbsp sunflower oil","thumb-size piece fresh root ginger, shredded","65g sachet korma curry paste (we used Sharwood''s)","2 cinnamon sticks","6 green cardamom pods","3 star anise","250g diced potatoes","1 small cauliflower, cut into small florets","250g Greek yogurt","225g frozen peas","2 good pinches saffron","½  tsp rosewater","butter, for greasing","100g roasted, salted cashews nuts","2 onions, halved and very thinly sliced","3 tbsp sunflower oil","good handful coriander"]','["Rinse the rice in several changes of water\r\nto remove excess starch, then put in a bowl\r\nof cold water and leave to soak for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, fry the onions in the oil for\r\n8 mins until soft and starting to colour. Add\r\nthe ginger, then cook for 2 mins more. Stir in\r\nthe curry paste followed by the whole spices,\r\ncook for 1 min more, then tip in the potatoes\r\nand cauliflower. Pour in 300ml water, cover\r\nand boil for about 5-7 mins until the veg are\r\njust tender, but still have a little resistance.\r\nStir in the yogurt and peas with 1 tsp salt.","Mix the saffron, rosewater and 3 tbsp\r\nboiling water together and stir well. Drain the\r\nrice, tip into a pan of boiling salted water,\r\nthen cook for 5 mins until almost tender.\r\nDrain again. Get out a large ovenproof dish\r\nwith a lid and butter the base. Tip the curry\r\nsauce into the base, scatter over the nuts,\r\nthen spoon over the rice. Drizzle over the\r\nrosewater mixture, then cover with foil\r\nfollowed by the lid. Can be chilled overnight\r\nuntil ready to cook.","Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Put\r\nthe biryani in the oven for 45 mins-1 hr until\r\nthoroughly heated through. To check it’s\r\nready, try a spoonful from the centre of the\r\nrice. For the garnish, slowly fry the onions in\r\nthe oil until really golden and crisp (this can\r\nbe done in advance). When the biryani is hot\r\nand ready to serve, gently toss through the\r\nonions and coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:19:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7505,7505,'en','Coronation chicken naans with Indian slaw','Top Indian bread with shredded meat, fruity mild curry sauce and a carrot and cabbage slaw','["1 ready-roasted chicken, about 950g","2 x packs 4 mini coriander and garlic naan bread","150ml yogurt","150ml light mayonnaise","1 tbsp mild curry powder","4 tbsp mango chutney","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped, plus extra to serve","2 large carrots, grated","1 red cabbage, shredded","2 tsp black mustard seeds"]','["Shred the meat from the chicken\r\nand set aside. To make the sauce,\r\nmix the yogurt, mayonnaise,\r\ncurry powder, chutney and some\r\nseasoning with half the coriander.\r\nToss this through the chicken.","To make the slaw, mix the\r\ncarrots, cabbage and mustard seeds in a large bowl with the\r\nremaining coriander, then season.","Heat the naan breads in the\r\ntoaster. Allow 2 per person and\r\ntop with some of the slaw, then the\r\nchicken mixture. Serve sprinkled\r\nwith coriander, with extra slaw\r\non the side."]','2026-01-10 12:19:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7507,7507,'en','Goan prawn & coconut curry with cumin rice','Spice up your mid-week meals with a curry in a hurry – throw in a handful of spices with shellfish, tomatoes, and spinach','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 onion, thinly sliced","1 tbsp freshly grated ginger","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 red chilli, deseeded and sliced","½  tsp turmeric","½  tsp chilli powder","1 tsp ground coriander","10 curry leaves","1 large potato, diced","400ml can half-fat coconut milk","8 cherry tomatoes, halved","handful baby spinach","200g pack raw peeled prawns","1 tsp cumin seed","175g basmati rice"]','["Heat the oil and fry the onion, ginger,\r\ngarlic and chilli for 5 mins until starting\r\nto soften. Add the spices, curry leaves\r\nand potato, then cook for 1 min more.\r\nStir in the coconut milk and tomatoes,\r\ncover and leave to simmer for 10 mins\r\nuntil the potato is tender.","Add the spinach and prawns. Cook\r\nfor 1 min more until the spinach wilts\r\nand the prawns turn pink.","Meanwhile, make the rice. Tip the\r\ncumin into a pan and toast over a dry\r\nheat for 30 secs. Add the rice, salt to\r\ntaste and 400ml water, then cover\r\nand cook for 8-10 mins until the rice is\r\ntender and the water has been absorbed.\r\nServe with the curry."]','2026-01-10 12:19:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7509,7509,'en','Tandoori roast chicken','Serve this Indian spiced bird with rice, potatoes and vegetables for an alternative roast dinner','["1.8kg chicken","2 onions, thickly sliced","1 lemon, halved","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and thickly sliced","400g can coconut milk","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped","150ml pot natural yogurt","1 tbsp tomato purée","juice 1 lemon","1 tsp each hot chilli powder, turmeric, ground coriander, ground cumin, garam masala and ground cinnamon","6 garlic cloves, whizzed to a paste with the ginger","½ finger-length piece ginger, whizzed to a paste with the garlic","few drops red food colouring (optional)"]','["Mix the marinade ingredients with\r\n2 tsp salt and 1 tsp black pepper. Slash\r\nthe legs of the chicken a few times, then\r\nrub the marinade all over, including under\r\nthe skin of the breast. Marinate in the\r\nfridge for up to 24 hrs.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put\r\nthe onions, lemon halves and ginger in\r\na roasting tin. Sit the chicken on top and\r\nroast for 1½ hrs or until the thigh juices\r\nrun clear when tested with a skewer.","When the chicken is done, lift out of\r\nthe tin, sit in a new dish, cover loosely\r\nwith foil and leave to rest. Fish out the\r\nginger from the tin and discard. Scrape\r\nout the roasted middles from the lemons\r\ninto a food processor, add the onions\r\nand any pan juices, and whizz to a purée.\r\nScrape the purée back into the tin and\r\nsit on the hob. Stir in the coconut milk\r\nand bubble gently, scraping up any\r\nchicken bits that have stuck. You can\r\nadd a splash of water if the sauce is\r\ntoo thick. Stir in the coriander and\r\nserve with the chicken."]','2026-01-10 12:19:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7511,7511,'en','Ultimate kedgeree','There are a million versions of kedgeree, but we reckon this is the best and easiest of the lot','["2 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","2 medium onions, halved and very thinly sliced","350g undyed smoked haddock","175g lightly smoked salmon fillet","1 dried red chilli (Angela used Kashmiri)","½ pint full-fat milk","3 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","1 medium onion, chopped","about 14 fresh or freeze-dried curry leaves","4 cardamom pods, split","1 cinnamon stick, broken into pieces","280g basmati rice","½  tsp turmeric","50g butter","2 eggs","handful of coriander leaves and some lime wedges, to serve"]','["For the crisp onions, heat the oil in a frying pan, add the onions with a pinch of salt (which helps to stop them burning), then cook on a medium heat, stirring occasionally, until deep golden, about 20-25 mins. When done, spread on paper towels and leave to crisp up. While the onions are frying, put both fish in a frying pan with the chilli. Pour the milk over, cover and simmer for 4 mins. Take off the heat and let stand, covered, for 10 mins to finish gently cooking the fish.","Meanwhile, heat the 3 tbsp oil in a deep frying or sauté pan (with a lid). Add the onion, curry leaves, cardamom and cinnamon and fry until the onion is soft and golden, about 7-8 mins, stirring often. Lift the fish from the milk with a slotted spoon, discard the skin and any bones, cover to keep warm and set aside. Make the milk up to 600ml/1pt with water. Rinse the rice in warm water in a colander, drain, then stir it into the onion. Keep stirring for 1 min so the rice is coated. Pour in the milk mix and stir in the turmeric. Bring to a boil, then simmer for 10 mins, covered, lowering the heat if it starts to stick on the bottom.","When the rice is tender, remove from the heat, drop the butter on top so it melts in, then lay the whole pieces of fish on the rice. Cover and leave for the flavours to mingle. Meanwhile, put the eggs in a pan, cover with cold water and bring to the boil, then boil for 6 mins (for lightly boiled). Remove from the heat and plunge into cold water, cracking the shells against the side of the pan. Peel off the shells and quarter the eggs.","To serve, break the fish into big pieces with a fork, throw in the coriander and stir gently to mix without breaking up the fish, adding the eggs at the end. Season, scatter crisp onions on top and serve with lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:19:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7513,7513,'en','Cardamom butter chicken','A homemade curry to rival your favourite Indian takeaway – a rich blend of spices mixed with creamy ghee','["2 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","thumb-sized piece ginger, chopped","2 green chillies, chopped (leave seeds in if you like it hot)","small bunch coriander, leaves picked, stalks roughly chopped","3 tbsp ghee, or vegetable oil","2 onions, sliced","2 tsp each turmeric, garam masala and ground cumin","1 tsp ground fenugreek","4 chicken breasts, cut into 2½ cm cubes","4 cloves","12 cardamom pods, seeds removed","1 cinnamon stick","400g can tomatoes","150ml pot yogurt","50ml double cream","chapatis and rice, to serve"]','["Place the garlic, ginger, chillies and\r\ncoriander stalks in the small bowl of\r\na food processor with a good pinch of\r\nsalt, and blend to a fine paste – or grind to a paste using a pestle and mortar.","Heat 2 tbsp of the ghee or oil in a\r\nlarge pan, add the onions and cook\r\nslowly for 15-20 mins until golden and\r\ncaramelised. Tip in the garlic-ginger\r\npaste, turn up the heat and cook for\r\na further 5 mins. Add the ground\r\nspices and cook for 2 mins more until\r\nfragrant. Scoop the spicy onion mixture\r\nout of the pan into a bowl.","Add the remaining ghee or oil to the\r\npan and cook the chicken over a\r\nmedium-high heat until browned all over.\r\nTip into a bowl, cover and set aside.","Return the onion mixture to the pan\r\nalong with the whole spices, tomatoes\r\nand a can full of water (400ml). Bring\r\nto the boil, then cover and simmer\r\ngently for 40 mins.","Return the chicken to the pan and\r\ncook, uncovered, for a further 10 mins\r\nuntil the sauce has thickened and\r\nthe chicken is cooked through. Stir\r\nin the yogurt and cream, season well\r\nand scatter with coriander leaves.\r\nServe with chapatis and rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7515,7515,'en','Flatbread','Indian flatbreads (naan) can be shallow-fried or baked and they only need 15 mins to cook. Perfect for mopping up the sauce of a lovely, homemade curry','["500g strong white flour","2 tsp salt","7g sachet fast-action yeast","3 tbsp olive oil","300ml water"]','["Mix the flour, salt, yeast and oil in a large bowl and add enough water to make a soft, but not sloppy, dough. Knead well. Put into a lightly oiled bowl to rise for 1 hr until doubled in size.","Divide the dough into 8 pieces, about 250g each, and use a rolling pin to flatten each one into a circle, 15cm in diameter, about 1cm thick. Then leave the pieces on a lightly floured baking tray to prove for 5 mins. Heat a large frying pan to a medium heat and dry-fry each piece until browned on both sides, about 5 mins in total. Set aside to cool slightly before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:19:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7517,7517,'en','Spiced Indian potato wraps','Sweet potatoes are a versatile veg and far healthier than your everyday spud','["4 sweet potatoes, cut into chunky wedges","1 red chilli, finely chopped","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp cumin seeds","1 tbsp garam masala","1 red onion, thinly sliced","juice 1 lime","2 tsp sugar","6-9 chapatis","150ml natural yogurt","large bunch coriander"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nToss the sweet potatoes with chilli,\r\n1 tsp oil, cumin seeds, garam masala\r\nand plenty of seasoning on a roasting\r\ntray. Roast for 25-35 mins, turning\r\nwedges halfway, until tender and golden.","Meanwhile fry onion in remaining oil\r\nfor a few mins until partly softened, stir\r\nin the lime juice and sugar with some\r\nseasoning, then turn off the heat.","Warm chapatis following pack\r\ninstructions, then assemble by adding\r\na couple of wedges of sweet potato to\r\neach, followed by a scattering of onions,\r\na dollop of yogurt and a small handful of\r\ncoriander leaves. Roll up and eat."]','2026-01-10 12:19:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7519,7519,'en','Spiced chicken balti','Compliments came rolling in about this almost as soon as the magazine went on sale. Try it and let us know your thoughts','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","2 large onions, thickly sliced","4 skinless chicken breasts","4 tbsp balti curry paste","200g quinoa","400g can chopped tomatoes","1l chicken stock","50g roasted salted cashews","small bunch coriander, leaves chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, fry the onions\r\nfor 5 mins until golden and softened, then\r\ntip onto a plate. Add the chicken breasts,\r\nbrowning for a few mins on each side, then\r\nstir in the balti paste, quinoa and onions.\r\nSizzle for a few mins, then pour in the\r\ntomatoes and stock and give everything\r\na good mix. Bubble for 25 mins until the\r\nquinoa is tender and saucy.","Stir in the cashews and most of the\r\ncoriander with some seasoning, then pile\r\ninto bowls and scatter over the rest of the\r\ncoriander to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7521,7521,'en','Chicken tikka with spiced rice','Indian food needn’t be a guilty pleasure – this healthy baked chicken with fragrant, fresh rice is nutritious and flavoursome','["4 skinless chicken breasts","150g pot low-fat natural yogurt","50g tikka paste","100g/4oz cucumber, diced","1 tbsp roughly chopped mint leaves","1 red onion, cut into thin wedges","140g easy-cook long grain rice","1 tbsp medium curry powder","50g frozen peas","1 small red pepper, diced"]','["Slash each chicken breast deeply with\r\na knife 3-4 times on one side. Put in a\r\nbowl and add 50g of the yogurt and the\r\ntikka paste. Mix well, cover and marinate\r\nin the fridge for 30 mins. Make the raita\r\nby stirring the cucumber and most of the\r\nmint into the rest of the yogurt. Season\r\nwith black pepper, cover and chill.","Heat oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 9.\r\nScatter the onion wedges over a\r\nfoil-lined baking tray. Remove the\r\nchicken from the marinade, shake off\r\nany excess and place on top of the\r\nonion wedges. Cook for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, tip the rice, curry powder,\r\npeas and pepper into a pan of boiling\r\nwater and simmer for 10 mins or until\r\nthe rice is just tender. Drain well and\r\ndivide the rice between 4 plates.\r\nAdd the chicken, roasted onion and\r\nremaining mint. Serve with the\r\ncucumber raita."]','2026-01-10 12:19:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7523,7523,'en','Pistachio pilau rice','This lightly spiced, vibrant side dish is the perfect accompaniment to curry','["1 onion, sliced","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tsp turmeric","300g basmati rice","600ml hot vegetable stock","bunch spring onions, sliced","50g pistachios, roughly chopped"]','["Fry the onion in the oil in a large frying\r\npan or saucepan until softened. Stir in\r\nthe turmeric, then the rice, and keep\r\nstirring until the grains are golden.","Pour in the hot stock, bring to the boil,\r\nthen reduce the heat, cover and cook for\r\n15 mins until the rice is tender. Remove\r\nfrom the heat and stir through the spring\r\nonions, pistachios and some seasoning\r\nbefore serving hot, or allowing to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:19:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7525,7525,'en','Creamy beetroot curry','Try an original approach to serving thickly sliced beetroot by combining with Madras spices, mustard seeds and green chilli','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 onions, very finely chopped","2 tsp yellow mustard seeds","3 tbsp madras curry paste","1kg (peeled weight) raw beetroot, peeled, halved and thickly sliced","1 green chilli, halved lengthways","400g can chopped tomatoes","3 tbsp ground almonds","4 tbsp low-fat natural yogurt, plus extra to serve","basmati rice, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large lidded pan, stir\r\nin the onions and cook for 8 mins until\r\nsoft. Tip in the mustard seeds and cook\r\nfor 1 min until toasted. Stir through the\r\ncurry paste and sizzle for 3 mins.","Mix the beetroot through the spicy\r\nonions, then add the chilli, tomatoes\r\nand 2 cans of water. Cover and simmer\r\nfor 30 mins, stirring occasionally, until\r\nthe beetroot is tender. Remove the lid,\r\nturn up the heat and cook until the\r\nsauce is thick.","Take off the heat, then stir through\r\nthe almonds, yogurt and some seasoning.\r\nTop with yogurt and serve with basmati\r\nrice, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7527,7527,'en','Curried chickpeas','Serve this side as part of an Indian meal for a healthy bit of spice','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tsp cumin seeds","1-2 red chillies, deseeded and chopped","1 clove","1 small cinnamon stick","1 bay leaf","1 onion, finely chopped","½  tsp ground turmeric","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","400g can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","1 tsp paprika","1 tsp ground coriander","2 small tomatoes, chopped","1 tbsp chopped coriander"]','["Heat the oil in a heavy-bottomed pan.\r\nFry the cumin, chillies, clove, cinnamon\r\nand bay leaf together until the cumin\r\nstarts to crackle. Tip in the onion, turmeric\r\nand a pinch of salt. Cook for 2 mins until\r\nstarting to soften, then add the garlic.","Continue cooking 4-5 mins until the\r\nonion is soft, then add chickpeas, paprika,\r\nblack pepper and ground coriander. Give\r\neverything a good stir so the chickpeas\r\nare well coated in the spices.","Add the tomatoes and 2 tbsp water.\r\nCook on a medium heat until tomatoes\r\nare soft and the sauce is thick and\r\npulpy. Take off the heat and sprinkle\r\non the coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:19:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7529,7529,'en','Indian lamb cutlets','This aromatic dish will have everyone’s mouthwatering','["50g parmesan, finely grated","1 tbsp curry powder (we used Schwartz Mild Curry Powder)","4 lamb cutlets","1 tbsp olive oil","tomato chutney, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Mix\r\nthe parmesan and curry powder together.\r\nSeason the lamb, then press the meat into\r\nthe cheese mix to coat. Heat the oil in an\r\novenproof frying pan or heavy baking tray\r\nand fry the cutlets for 2 mins on each side\r\nto brown.","Transfer to the oven for 5 mins for medium,\r\nor longer for well done. Delicious served\r\nwith a dollop of tomato chutney and some\r\nmash flavoured with chopped coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:19:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7531,7531,'en','Indian mince with fresh tomato salad','This flavour-packed dish is super-cheap and speedy to make, the perfect family meal','["1 red onion, sliced","300g beef mince","2 tbsp medium or mild curry powder","100g dried red lentils","700ml hot beef stock","3 tomatoes","handful coriander leaves","4 mini naan bread"]','["In a non-stick frying pan, dry-fry onion\r\nand mince over a high heat for 2 mins,\r\nbreaking up the mince as you go. Stir in\r\nthe curry powder and lentils, pour in\r\nstock, then fiercely simmer for 10 mins.","While the mince is cooking, dice\r\nthe tomatoes and roughly chop the\r\ncoriander, then mix together in a small\r\nbowl. Put the naans briefly in a toaster\r\nto warm through, then pop one on each\r\nplate. Spoon a quarter of the mince over\r\neach naan, then top with a spoonful of\r\nthe fresh tomato and coriander salad."]','2026-01-10 12:19:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7533,7533,'en','Fried fish & tomato curry','Use a sustainable white fish like pollock in this southern Indian-style coconut and tomato curry with fresh coriander','["2 tbsp vegetable oil, plus 2 tsp","2 onions, thinly sliced","8 large vine tomatoes, roughly chopped","4 garlic cloves","thumb-sized piece ginger, roughly chopped","3 tbsp Madras curry paste","165ml can coconut milk","large handful coriander, finely chopped, plus extra sprigs to serve","500g pollack fillets, skinned","6 tbsp plain flour","basmati rice, to serve"]','["Heat 2 tsp oil in a pan. Tip in the onions\r\nand a pinch of salt. Cook for about 8 mins\r\nuntil soft and golden.","Meanwhile, blitz the tomatoes, garlic\r\nand ginger in a food processor to a\r\nsmooth purée. Add the curry paste\r\nto the onions and fry for 3 mins more.\r\nStir in the tomato mix and simmer\r\nfor 10 mins until thickened. Add the\r\ncoconut milk and chopped coriander.\r\nSimmer again to thicken.","Dust the fish fillets in some seasoned\r\nflour. Heat the remaining oil in a non-stick\r\nfrying pan. Cook the fillets, in batches,\r\nover a high heat for 1 min or so on each\r\nside, until they begin to brown. Carefully\r\nplace fish in the tomato mixture and\r\nsimmer until just cooked through. Scatter\r\nover coriander sprigs and serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:19:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7535,7535,'en','Sweet & sour lentil dhal with grilled aubergine','Spice up supper with this superhealthy recipe that’s high in fibre, packed with iron and counts as 4 of your 5-a-day – it’s cheap too!','["100g red lentils, rinsed","1 tsp turmeric","1 tbsp tamarind paste (we used Bart)","2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 medium onion, thinly sliced","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","3cm/1¼ inch piece ginger, grated","1 tsp curry powder","1 medium aubergine, cut into 2 cm slices","cooked basmati rice, lime or mango chutney and a few coriander leaves, to serve, if you like"]','["Cover the lentils, turmeric and tamarind paste with 500ml water. Add some salt and boil for 15 mins or until very soft. Skim off any foam that forms on the top. Meanwhile, heat 1 tbsp of the oil and cook the onion, garlic and ginger until golden, about 5 mins.","Add the curry powder and cook for a further 2 mins. Pour in the lentil mixture and cook for another 10 mins.","Meanwhile, heat a griddle pan until very hot. Rub the remaining oil over the aubergine slices and season. Cook for 2-3 mins each side until cooked through and charred. Eat with basmati rice, lime or mango chutney and a sprinkling of coriander, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:19:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7537,7537,'en','Paneer with broccoli & sesame','Serve this vegetarian dish made with Indian cheese, paneer, as part of a curry night or with rice as a midweek supper','["200g sprouting broccoli","1 tbsp vegetable oil","pinch asafoetida","1 tsp cumin seed","1 tbsp sesame seeds","1 large green chilli, finely chopped","½  tsp brown mustard seeds","6 curry leaves","1 medium onion, sliced","140g paneer cheese, cut into strips","1 tbsp grated ginger","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp lemon juice","½  tsp ground mace"]','["Trim the broccoli and boil or steam\r\nfor 5-6 mins until tender but firm to the\r\nbite. Drain and cool under cold running\r\nwater. Heat the oil in a wok or large frying\r\npan, then add the asafoetida, cumin\r\nseeds, sesame seeds, chilli, mustard\r\nseeds and the curry leaves. Cook for\r\n1 min until fragrant, then add the onion\r\nand cook another 2 mins.","Throw in the paneer, ginger and garlic,\r\nand season. Cook on a medium heat for\r\n4-5 mins until the paneer turns golden.\r\nAdd the broccoli and mix through the\r\npaneer and spices, then add lemon juice,\r\nmace and twist of pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:19:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7539,7539,'en','Cauliflower & chickpea pilaf','Delicious served on its own, or as a side dish with grilled chicken breasts rubbed with a little curry paste','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","2 large onions, sliced","1 tbsp curry paste of your choice","200g basmati rice","350g cauliflower florets","400g can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","500ml vegetable stock","50g toasted flaked almonds","handful chopped coriander"]','["Heat the oil in a large, non-stick pan\r\nand add the onions. Cook over a medium\r\nheat for 5 mins until starting to turn\r\ngolden. Stir in the curry paste and cook\r\nfor 1 min. Add the rice, cauliflower and\r\nchickpeas, stirring to coat in the paste.","Pour in the stock and stir. Cover and\r\nsimmer for 10-15 mins until the rice and\r\ncauliflower are tender and all the liquid\r\nhas been absorbed. Stir in the almonds\r\nand coriander, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7541,7541,'en','Vegetable curry for a crowd','This vegetarian curry is great for feeding a group of mates on a budget, or make a batch to freeze','["1 large potato, diced","1 small butternut squash, peeled, deseeded and diced","1 aubergine, diced","6 tbsp tikka masala paste","3 tbsp vegetable oil","2 onions, sliced","680g-700g jar tomato passata","400g can coconut milk","2 red peppers, sliced","2 courgettes, diced","few coriander sprigs, to serve","rice or naan bread, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nToss the potato, squash and\r\naubergine with 2 tbsp curry paste\r\nand 2 tbsp oil in a large roasting tin.\r\nSeason, then roast for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, make the sauce. Fry\r\nthe onions in the remaining oil in\r\na large pan until softened and\r\ngolden – add a splash of water\r\nif they start to dry out. Stir in the\r\nremaining curry paste, cook for\r\n3 mins, then add the passata,\r\ncoconut milk and 100ml water.\r\nSimmer for a few mins.","When the vegetables are roasted,\r\ntip them into the sauce with the\r\npeppers and courgettes. Simmer\r\nfor 10-15 mins until tender. Scatter\r\nwith coriander and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7543,7543,'en','Chicken biryani bake','Keep this biryani bake in the freezer for an easy midweek health kick','["1 tbsp olive oil","4 skinless chicken breasts, chopped into chunks","4 skinless, boneless chicken thighs, chopped into chunks","2 onions, sliced","4 tbsp curry paste (we used korma and tikka masala)","300g cauliflower, chopped into small florets","700ml chicken stock","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","200g natural yogurt","300g spinach","400g basmati rice, cooked following pack instructions","5 tbsp flaked almonds"]','["Start by making the curry. Heat 1 tbsp\r\nof the oil in a large, deep frying pan. Season\r\nthe chicken and fry until browned, then\r\nremove and set aside. Fry the onion in\r\nthe rest of the oil for 10-12 mins until soft\r\nand starting to caramelise.","Add the paste and cauliflower, stirring\r\nto coat everything, then return the chicken.\r\nPour in the stock, tomatoes and chickpeas\r\nand simmer everything for 30 mins until\r\nthe cauliflower is nearly tender. There\r\nshould be just enough liquid to cover\r\neverything so add a splash more water\r\nor stock if you need to. Remove from the\r\nheat and stir in the yogurt.","Assemble the bake in either 1 large or\r\n2 smaller, deep ovenproof dishes. Start\r\nwith a ¹/³ of the spinach leaves, season,\r\nthen top with a ¹/³ of the curry. Finish\r\nwith a ¹/³ of the rice then repeat twice\r\nmore. Scatter on the almonds and either\r\ncool completely to freeze, or heat oven\r\nto 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and cook for\r\n20-25 mins until the topping has crisped\r\nup and the dish is piping hot through."]','2026-01-10 12:19:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7545,7545,'en','Family meals: Mild chicken curry','A mildly-spiced curry with a rich yogurt sauce that will appeal to adults and children alike','["1-1½ tsp coconut oil (we used Fushi) or sunflower oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","2 fat garlic cloves, crushed","1cm fresh ginger, grated or finely chopped","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp yellow mustard seed","1 tsp garam masala","½  tsp ground cumin","1 x 500g pack chicken pieces (thighs and drumsticks), or thighs","1 chicken stock cube","1 cinnamon stick","250g Greek yogurt, at room temperature","2 tbsp sultanas","handful chopped coriander, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a heavy-based pan. Fry the onions gently for 5 – 10 mins until soft. Add the garlic, ginger, coriander, mustard seeds, garam masala and cumin and cook for 1 - 2 min allowing the aromas to release.","Add the chicken and cook for 10 mins over a gentle heat, flipping occasionally and making sure the spices don’t catch. Pour in around 300 ml boiling water until almost covering. Stir in the stock cube and cinnamon stick. Simmer for around 45 mins - 1 hour with the lid off so there is a small amount of thickened sauce at the bottom of the pan. Remove the cinnamon stick.","Stir in the yogurt and sultanas, heat through gently and serve. Scatter with coriander, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:19:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7547,7547,'en','Home-style chicken curry','A rustic and authentic quick Indian one-pot packed with tonnes of hot Asian spices and fragrant coriander','["1 large onion","6 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","50g ginger, roughly chopped","4 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp fennel seed","5cm cinnamon stick","1 tsp chilli flakes","1 tsp garam masala","1 tsp turmeric","1 tsp caster sugar","400g can chopped tomatoes","8 chicken thighs, skinned, boneless (about 800g)","250ml hot chicken stock","2 tbsp chopped coriander"]','["Roughly chop the onion, transfer to a small food processor, and add 3 tablespoons of water - process to a slack paste. You could use a stick blender for this or coarsely grate the onion into a bowl – there’s no need to add any water if you are grating the onion. Tip into a small bowl and leave on one side.","Put the chopped garlic and ginger into the same food processor and add 4 tbsp water – process until smooth and spoon into another small bowl. Alternatively, crush the garlic to a paste with a knife or garlic press and finely grate the ginger.","Heat the oil in a wok or sturdy pan set over a medium heat. Combine the cumin and fennel seeds with the cinnamon and chilli flakes and add to the pan in one go. Swirl everything around for about 30 secs until the spices release a fragrant aroma.","Add the onion paste – it will splutter in the beginning.  Fry until the water evaporates and the onions turn a lovely dark golden - this should take about 7-8 mins.  Add the garlic and ginger paste and cook for another 2 mins – stirring all the time.","Stir in the garam masala, turmeric, and sugar and continue cooking for 20 secs before tipping in the tomatoes. Continue cooking on a medium heat for about 10 mins without a lid until the tomatoes reduce and darken.","Cut the chicken thighs into 3cm chunks and add to the pan once the tomatoes have thickened to a paste. Cook for 5 mins to coat the chicken in the masala and seal in the juices, and then pour over the hot chicken stock. Simmer for 8-10 mins without a lid until the chicken is tender and the masala lightly thickened – you might need to add an extra ladleful of stock or water if the curry needs it. Sprinkle with chopped coriander and serve with Indian flatbreads or fluffy basmati rice and a pot of yogurt on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:19:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7549,7549,'en','Spiced roast side of salmon','Serve salmon with paprika, ginger and honey mustard glaze for an Indian-inspired, original roast','["1½ kg side of salmon, skin on","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for brushing","½  tsp ground ginger","1 tsp paprika","½  tsp coarsely ground black peppercorns","1 tbsp wholegrain mustard","1 tsp honey","1 lemon, cut into wedges, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nLine a big roasting tin with baking\r\nparchment or foil – this helps to prevent\r\nthe fish from sticking to the tin as it\r\ncooks. Brush the salmon skin with oil and\r\nplace it, skin-side down, on the paper.","Mix the ground ginger with the paprika,\r\npepper, mustard, honey and 1 tbsp olive\r\noil. Spread it evenly over the fleshy side\r\nof the fish.","Roast, uncovered, for about 20 mins\r\nuntil the salmon is cooked through –\r\ncheck by poking a knife into the fillet\r\nand making sure the fish flakes easily.","Serve directly from the tin, or use\r\na couple of fish slices to carefully lift\r\nthe salmon onto a big plate. Slice into\r\nportions and serve with lemon wedges\r\non the side."]','2026-01-10 12:19:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7551,7551,'en','New potato & tamarind salad','Tamarind is commonly used to flavour potatoes in India, and makes this low-fat salad authentic and punchy','["1½  tbsp tamarind pulp or paste","50g golden muscovado sugar","1 tbsp ground cumin","thumb-sized piece ginger, chopped","1.2kg new potatoes","3 tbsp natural low-fat yogurt","4 tbsp chopped coriander"]','["To make the dressing, put the tamarind\r\npulp in a small pan, pour over 75ml\r\nboiling water and add the sugar, cumin\r\nand ginger. Simmer, without a lid, until\r\nthe dressing thickens and becomes\r\nsyrupy, about 10-15 mins. It should have a\r\npleasant tang – add extra sugar if needed.","While the tamarind is cooking, bring a\r\nlarge pan of salted water to the boil and\r\nadd the potatoes. Return to the boil and\r\ncook for 15 mins until tender. Drain, then\r\ncool slightly before halving them. Transfer\r\nto a big mixing bowl and spoon over the\r\ndressing, gently stirring to make sure the\r\npotatoes are well coated. Drizzle over the\r\nyogurt, scatter over the coriander, and\r\nserve warm or at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:19:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7553,7553,'en','Proper chicken curry','Impress with this tandoori masala-spiced Indian dish with peppers, coconut and fresh coriander','["6 tbsp tandoori masala powder","2 tbsp ginger paste","2 tbsp garlic paste","500g pot coconut yogurt, plus extra to serve","4 onions, 2 cut into wedges, 2 chopped","2 peppers, cut into large chunks","1¼kg skinless chicken thighs, cut into large chunks","1 tsp olive oil","big bunch coriander, stalks chopped","2-3 tsp hot chilli powder","680ml jar passata","160ml can coconut cream","rice and naan bread, to serve"]','["In a very large bowl, mix half the\r\nspice mix, 1 tbsp each of the pastes,\r\nthree-quarters of the yogurt and\r\nsome salt. Stir in the onion wedges,\r\npeppers and chicken, then leave to\r\nmarinate overnight in the fridge.","Fry the chopped onions in the oil\r\nuntil really soft. Add the remaining\r\nspice mix and pastes, the coriander\r\nstalks and chilli powder. Cook for\r\n1 min, then stir in 100ml water and\r\nthe passata. Simmer for 15 mins,\r\nthen add the coconut cream and\r\nremaining yogurt. Leave chunky\r\nor blitz with a blender.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nSpread the chicken and veg on a\r\nbaking tray. Roast for 15-20 mins\r\nuntil cooked and slightly charred. Tip\r\ninto the sauce. Serve with rice, naan,\r\nextra yogurt and coriander leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:19:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7557,7557,'en','Indian-spiced fish cakes','Spice up leftover cooked salmon in these simple, freezable fishcakes with cooling raita','["600g potatoes, quartered if large","½ tsp cumin seeds","2 spring onions, finely chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","2 tbsp chopped coriander","1 egg, beaten","100g cooked leftover salmon, flaked into large pieces","plain flour, for coating","25g butter and 1 tbsp sunflower oil","leftover avocado mayo, raita or mango chutney, to serve"]','["Boil the potatoes. Meanwhile, dry-fry the\r\ncumin seeds for a couple of secs in a large\r\nnon-stick frying pan. When soft, drain the\r\npotatoes, return to the saucepan, add the\r\ncumin, onions, chilli and coriander with\r\nplenty of seasoning, then mash well.\r\nWhen cooled a little, beat in 2 tbsp of\r\nthe egg, then carefully stir through the\r\nsalmon. Shape into 4 rough cakes, then\r\ncoat in flour. If freezing, freeze on a\r\nbaking sheet until solid, then pack up.","In the frying pan, melt the butter with\r\nthe oil. Fry the cakes for about 2 mins\r\neach side until golden. Serve with the\r\nmayo, raita (recipe below) or mango\r\nchutney and some salad leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:19:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7559,7559,'en','Indian spiced greens','This recipe suits any greens you have to hand – from shredded kale to Brussels sprouts. For the less adventurous, less chilli can be used','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tsp cumin seed","½  tsp mustard seed","4 green chillies, finely chopped","large piece fresh root ginger, grated","½  tsp turmeric","500g shredded greens, such as kale, Brussels sprouts, or any other","100g peas","juice 1 lemon","½  tsp ground coriander","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped","2 tbsp unsweetened desiccated coconut"]','["Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan or wok,\r\nsizzle the cumin and mustard seeds for 1 min,\r\nthen add the chilli, ginger and turmeric. Fry\r\nuntil aromatic, then add the greens, a pinch\r\nof salt, a splash of water and the peas.","Cover the pan and cook for 4-5 mins until the greens\r\nhave wilted. Add the lemon juice, ground\r\ncoriander, half the fresh coriander and half\r\nthe desiccated coconut, then toss everything\r\ntogether. Pile into a serving dish and scatter\r\nwith the rest of the coconut and coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:19:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7561,7561,'en','Rosewater & pistachio kulfi with griddled mangoes','Kulfi is usually made from milk that has been boiled for several hours. This sneaky version is made with condensed milk, so all the hard work has been done for you.','["450g tin condensed milk","2 tbsp rosewater","50g very finely chopped pistachios, plus roughly chopped pistachios to serve","284ml tub double cream","3 small, ripe mangoes"]','["Squeeze the condensed milk into a bowl\r\nand beat in the rosewater and pistachios.\r\nLightly whip the cream until it holds its\r\nshape, then fold into the pistachio mixture.","Pour into 6 small ramekins or pyramid\r\nmoulds. Freeze, then cover with cling film.","To serve: Slice each mango on either side of the stone to make 6 halves, but don’t peel. Score\r\na criss-cross into the flesh, but don’t slice through the skin. You can do this several hrs ahead. Cook on the barbecue flesh-side down until starting to caramelise. Leave as it  is or turn inside out to make the segments stand proud. Serve with the kulfi scattered with the pistachios (and a squeeze of lime,\r\nif you like)."]','2026-01-10 12:19:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7563,7563,'en','Fresh tomato chutney','A fresh Indian accompaniment that goes well with naan bread dippers or poppadums – good for a New Year or Diwali buffet','["6 large vine-ripened tomatoes","1 large red onion, finely chopped","2 handfuls of fresh coriander, finely chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp cumin seed"]','["Halve the tomatoes, remove the seeds, chop the flesh and place in a sieve over a bowl so the excess juices can drain away.","Put the onion and coriander into a bowl. Heat the oil and fry the cumin seeds for about 30 seconds then tip them into the bowl. Mix in the tomatoes, cover and chill.","To serve, add some salt (see tip below) and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:19:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7565,7565,'en','Authentic carbonara','This authentic, foolproof carbonara recipe shows you how to achieve silky, perfect sauce every time, with no scrambled eggs or stress','["340g guanciale","2 eggs , plus 5-6 egg yolks (freeze the extra whites to use in another recipe)","150g pecorino romano , grated, plus extra to serve","400g mezzi rigatoni or spaghetti"]','["Remove the rind from the guanciale and discard. Cut the guanciale into ½cm-thick slices, then into thick strips. Fry the guanciale in a pan over a low heat for 10-15 mins to slowly render the fat – when ready, the guanciale will be crisp and golden. Scoop the guanciale from the fat using a slotted spoon and pat dry on kitchen paper. Dispose of half the fat in the pan, reserving the rest – don’t rinse out the pan.","For the sabayon, whisk the eggs, yolks and grated cheese together in a large heatproof bowl with a good twist of black pepper and the reserved guanciale fat. Set the bowl over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the bowl doesn''t touch the water, and cook for 2-3 mins, whisking until the mixture has a thick, custard-like consistency (if you have a kitchen thermometer, the sabayon will be ready when it reaches 64C). Don''t let the water come to the boil, or it will scramble the eggs.","Cook the pasta in a large pot of boiling salted water following pack instructions, stirring occasionally until al dente. Drain, reserving a mugful of the cooking water.","Put the cooked pasta in the pan you used to cook the guanciale, and mix well in any residual fat over a low heat. Remove from the heat and add the sabayon, followed by a splash of the reserved pasta cooking water to loosen and create a creamy, saucy consistency. Stir and toss the pasta in the sauce to make sure it is well coated.","Add the crispy guanciale and plenty of freshly ground black pepper. Serve in large pasta bowls and top with extra grated cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:20:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7567,7567,'en','Italian stuffed muffuletta','Try our take on the classic Italian-American sandwich from New Orleans. Pack it up for a picnic – the flavour and texture improves when left to chill overnight','["400g round bread loaf","3 tbsp olive oil","300g mixed vegetable pickles , roughly chopped","60g pitted chilli garlic olives , roughly chopped","2 anchovy fillets , finely chopped","10g basil , roughly chopped","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","9 emmental slices","85g salami slices","150g Morrisons The Best mortadella"]','["Carefully slice a 15cm circle off the top of the bread loaf, reserving it. Remove most of the bread inside the loaf until it is nearly hollow, leaving a roughly 1-2cm thick shell (you can freeze the removed bread to make breadcrumbs or croutons for another recipe).","Drizzle the inside of the loaf with 1 tbsp of the olive oil. Combine the pickles, olives, anchovies, basil, vinegar and remaining oil in a medium bowl. Season with salt and pepper, then spoon a few tablespoons of the mixture over the base of the hollowed-out loaf.","Cover the base with 3 emmental slices, 4-5 salami slices and 3 mortadella slices before topping with more of the veg mixture. Repeat, layering the ingredients until all the veg, meat and cheese has been used. Return the sliced-off ''lid'' to the top of the loaf, then wrap well.","Put the loaf on a plate, then weigh it down by stacking another plate with a couple of cans on top. Chill for 1-2 hrs (or overnight, if you have time) before slicing and serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7569,7569,'en','Next level caponata','Prep this Italian classic ahead of time and serve as a celebration of in-season summer ingredients. Serve it at room temperature as a starter or side','["2 large or 3 small aubergines , diced into small chunks","200ml olive oil , or as needed","1 garlic clove (use this for the crostini first, if making)","4 celery sticks , leaves picked and roughly shredded, sticks chopped into small pieces","1 onion , finely chopped","pinch of chilli flakes (optional)","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp red wine vinegar (ensure vegan, if needed)","400g can finely chopped tomatoes (or use passata-style)","1 tbsp capers , roughly chopped","large handful of pitted green olives , roughly chopped","small handful of basil leaves leaves picked and roughly torn, stalks tied together","2 tbsp toasted pine nuts","1 small baguette or ciabatta loaf, sliced into 1cm-thick rounds"]','["Tip the aubergine chunks into a colander, season generously with salt, then toss to coat. Sit the colander in the sink or over a bowl, then put a saucer or small plate on top and weigh it down with a few cans (this will help extract excess moisture, so you’ll need less oil when frying). Leave to stand for at least 30 mins or up to 1 hr.","Pat the aubergine dry using kitchen paper, then heat 3-4 tbsp of the olive oil in a large frying pan over a medium-high heat. Fry the aubergine in two batches for a few minutes until golden and soft, adding more oil as needed so the pan is never dry. Tip the cooked aubergine into a bowl and set aside.","For the crostini, heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Arrange the baguette slices on a baking tray in a single layer, then drizzle generously with some of the olive oil. Bake for 12-15 mins, flipping over halfway through, until golden and crisp. While still warm, rub the garlic clove over the slices. Cool to room temperature. The crostini can be made a day ahead and stored in an airtight container. Meanwhile, heat another drizzle of oil in the pan used for the aubergine and fry the chopped celery for about 6 mins, or until it starts to soften. Scatter in the onion and cook for 8-10 mins more until soft and golden. Finely chop the garlic clove you used for the crostini, and scatter this in along with the chilli flakes, if using. Cook for another minute, then add the sugar and tomato purée. Cook for 2 mins, then add the vinegar and bubble for 10-15 mins until thickened and reduced.","Stir in the canned tomatoes and bring to a simmer, then tip in the aubergines, capers, olives and the bunched basil stalks. Simmer for 10 mins more, stirring occasionally until thick, rich and glossy. Turn off the heat and stir through another 1 tbsp olive oil, then taste and adjust the seasoning – you want a balance of sweet and sour flavours, with a salty hit from the olives and capers. Cool to room temperature before removing and discarding the basil stalks. Stir through most of the torn basil. Will keep chilled for three days, or if serving the next day, leave in an airtight container at room temperature. (Caponata is best served at room temperature.)"]','2026-01-10 12:20:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7571,7571,'en','Spinach & ricotta ravioli with sage butter','Matty fills these simple ravioli with creamy spinach and ricotta, then tosses them in a fragrant, buttery sauce. (You will need a pasta machine for this)','["400g ''00'' pasta flour , plus extra for dusting","4 large eggs","200g spinach","500g ricotta","1⁄2 tsp chilli flakes","1⁄4 tsp","50g parmesan , grated","100g butter","12 sage leaves","50g parmesan , finely grated"]','["Tip the flour out onto a clean work surface and make a well in the centre. Crack the eggs into the well and use a fork to combine the ingredients. When a dough begins to form, use your hands to shape it into a ball and knead for 5-10 mins, or until the dough becomes smooth. Form into a neat ball, cover and set aside to rest for 30 mins.","Boil a kettle full of water. To make the filling, add the spinach to a colander and pour over the boiled water to wilt. Leave to cool slightly, then tip onto a clean towel and use it to squeeze the spinach over a sink to remove the excess water. Tip out onto a chopping board and finely chop. Add the ricotta to a bowl with the chilli flakes, nutmeg and parmesan, and season with salt and pepper. Mix together with a fork, then stir in the spinach. Cover and set aside in the fridge.","Once the dough is rested, divide into quarters and flatten each one slightly using the palm of your hand. Take one of the pieces of dough and leave the other three covered. Start with the thickest setting on your pasta machine and roll the dough through. Work your way through the settings, reducing by one each time, and dusting the dough with extra flour as necessary to prevent any sticking, until you reach the thinnest setting. Repeat with the remaining pieces of dough.","Dust a clean work surface with flour and lay out all of the pasta sheets. Take one sheet and dot teaspoons of filling down the centre, leaving 2cm between each one. Brush the edges of the pasta with a little water, then layer another sheet on top. Start at one end and push down around each teaspoon of filling to remove any air and seal the pasta. Repeat with the remaining filling and pasta sheets. Use a knife or pasta cutter to trim the edges of the pasta, then cut out each ravioli. Dust a large baking tray with flour and arrange the ravioli on the tray.","Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil. Reduce to a simmer, carefully add the ravioli and cook for 4-5 mins. Add the butter to a large frying pan over a medium heat. Once melted and foaming, add the sage and cook until the butter is lightly golden. Using a slotted spoon, add the cooked ravioli into the pan of butter and gently toss to coat. Serve with parmesan scattered over the top."]','2026-01-10 12:20:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7573,7573,'en','Spaghetti aglio e olio with crispy bacon','Enjoy this super-simple and super-speedy spaghetti supper, with garlic, parsley and bacon tossed through pasta. It’s ideal on days when your fridge is bare','["75ml extra virgin olive oil","4 rashers streaky bacon","400g spaghetti","6 large garlic cloves , finely grated","25g fresh parsley , finely chopped"]','["Heat 1 tsp of the oil in a non-stick frying pan and cook the bacon over a medium heat for 5-6 mins until crisp. Remove from the heat, leaving the oil behind. Set aside to drain on kitchen paper, then when cool enough to handle, finely chop.","Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil and cook the spaghetti following pack instructions.","A few minutes before the pasta is ready, pour the rest of the oil into the pan and cook the garlic over a medium-low heat for 1-2 mins until fragrant and beginning to brown (don’t let it burn or it will taste bitter).","Drain the pasta, reserving a little pasta water, and tip into the garlic oil. Scatter in the parsley and fold together, adding a splash of pasta water to loosen, if needed. Spoon into bowls and scatter over the bacon."]','2026-01-10 12:20:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7575,7575,'en','Aubergine milanese','Give mild aubergines an extra punch of flavour with capers, chilli and plenty of cheese in this milanese. Serve alongside our tomato caper spaghetti','["2 large aubergines , stalks removed, quartered lengthways","olive oil , for frying","4 tbsp flour","2 eggs","100g dried breadcrumbs , such as panko","½ tsp garlic granules","1 tsp dried oregano","20g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated, plus extra shavings to serve","350g spaghetti","handful of basil , to serve","2 tbsp olive oil","4 large garlic cloves , crushed","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","½ tsp dried oregano","2 tsp sugar","1 tbsp capers","large pinch of chilli flakes"]','["Sprinkle 1 tsp fine salt over the fleshy sides of the aubergines, then leave to rest for 1 hr.","Pat the aubergines dry using a sheet of kitchen paper. Heat 1-2 tbsp oil in a frying pan over a medium heat and fry the aubergines for a few minutes on each side until golden. Transfer to a plate using tongs and leave to cool.","For the tomato sauce, heat the olive oil in the same pan over a medium heat (no need to clean it first) and fry the garlic for a minute. Stir in the tomato purée, canned tomatoes, oregano, sugar, capers, chilli flakes and a small pinch of salt. Bubble, covered with a lid, for 30 mins until rich and saucy.","Tip the flour onto a plate and season. Beat the eggs with a splash of water in a shallow bowl, then combine the breadcrumbs, garlic granules, oregano and parmesan on another plate or shallow bowl. Dip the aubergines in the flour, then shake off the excess and dip into the egg, followed by the breadcrumbs. If you have breadcrumbs leftover, you can repeat the process with just the egg and breadcrumbs. At this stage, the aubergines can be chilled for up to a day.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C/gas 4. Fill the base of a large frying pan with oil and heat over a medium heat. Fry the aubergines for 2-3 mins on each side until crispy and golden, then transfer to a baking tray and bake for 10 mins until softened.","Meanwhile, cook the spaghetti in a large pan of boiling salted water following pack instructions, or until al dente. Lift the spaghetti straight into the sauce using tongs, so a few splashes of the pasta water fall into the pan. Cook for 1-2 mins in the sauce to coat, then divide between plates and top with the aubergines, basil and parmesan shavings."]','2026-01-10 12:20:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7577,7577,'en','Next level focaccia','Set aside time for a bit of kitchen therapy and bake this classic Italian bread for a savoury treat. It’s best eaten straightaway, but will keep for two days','["200g strong white bread flour","½ x 7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","400g strong white bread flour","½ x 7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","10g fine salt","100ml olive oil","1 garlic bulb","2 rosemary sprigs , leaves picked","1 tsp sea salt flakes"]','["To make the preferment, mix the flour with the yeast and 200g room temperature water in a small bowl.Cover the bowl and leave to ferment for 12-24 hrs. Don’t worry about it bubbling up and coming down again – this is just about creating flavour.","For the dough, tip the preferment into a large bowl and pour over 225g tepid water. Stir with a spatula to combine. Tip in the flour and the rest of the yeast and mix everything together to make a rough dough. Make sure all the flour is mixed in and that there are no dry bits on the side of the bowl. Cover and leave to rest for at least 30 mins or up to 1 hr.","Scatter the fine salt over the dough, dip a hand into water and scrunch the salt through the dough to mix it in completely. Cover again and leave for 20-30 mins.","Wet your hands, grab the dough from one side and stretch it back over itself. Repeat with the other side – it should be very elastic. Curl the dough around itself so that it’s smooth and taught, then cover and leave for another 20-30 mins. Repeat this process twice more, then cover and leave to prove for 2-3 hrs until risen by about 40 per cent – the dough should be bubbly and soft.","Drizzle a deep, roughly 20 x 30cm baking tray with 2 tbsp of the olive oil and scrape the dough onto the tray. Incorporate the oil into the dough by stretching and folding it on the tray. Don’t worry if it’s a bit stringy to start, keep stretching and bringing it back on itself. When the dough has come together and is oily, cover and leave to prove at room temperature for 2 hrs, or for a much better flavour, up to 48 hrs in the fridge. Remove from the fridge 1 hr before baking.","Heat the oven to 230C/210C fan/gas 7. Meanwhile, cut the top off the head of garlic to expose the cloves. Sit the garlic on a piece of foil, drizzle with 1 tsp of the olive oil and season with salt. Wrap the bulb in the foil to create a parcel, put on a tray and roast for 25 mins. Remove from the oven and leave until cool enough to handle, then slip the garlic cloves out from their skins – they don’t need to be completely soft at this point.","Use your fingers to stretch the dough so it fits into the tray evenly, then dimple the surface using your fingertips. Push the garlic cloves and rosemary leaves deeply into the dough, evenly spaced apart. Drizzle with 1 tbsp olive oil and dimple a few more times to create oil puddles on the surface. Scatter over the 1 tsp sea salt flakes, give the dough a final poke and bake for 25-30 mins until puffed up and deep golden. Remove from the oven, drizzle with the remaining olive oil then leave to cool for at least 40 mins before cutting and serving. Best eaten straightaway, but will keep for two days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:20:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7579,7579,'en','Air-fryer arancini','Use your air-fryer to make these crunchy, golden rice balls – they’re an ideal side for an Italian-inspired feast','["15g unsalted butter","1 onion , finely chopped","1 large garlic clove , crushed","200g risotto rice","700ml hot chicken or vegetable stock","50g parmesan , finely grated, plus extra to serve","125g mozzarella","100g plain flour","2 eggs , beaten","100g dried breadcrumbs (we used panko)","olive oil spray , for misting"]','["Melt the butter in a largesaucepanover a medium heat and cook the onion and garlic for 5 mins until softened. Stir in the rice and cook for 1 min, then add half the stock, stirring well.","Continue to cook the risotto for 20 mins, stirring frequently and adding more stock as it is absorbed, until the rice is tender and creamy. Stir in the parmesan, then season to taste. Spread out on a tray and leave to cool to room temperature.","Cut the mozzarella into 12 pieces and pat dry using kitchen paper.","Shape the risotto into 12 even-sized balls. Flatten one of the balls in the palm of your hand and add a piece of mozzarella. Bring up the edges to enclose it, then roll into a neat ball. Repeat to make 12 balls.","Roll each risotto ball in the flour, followed by the egg and finally the breadcrumbs until evenly coated. Chill until ready to air-fry, or until set and holding their shape well.","Heat theair-fryerto 190C. Mist the arancini with the olive oil spray and cook in batches for 10-15 mins until crunchy and golden brown. Scatter with parmesan before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7581,7581,'en','Spaghetti aglio e olio','Toss golden garlic and silky olive oil through spaghetti to make this classic Italian dish – ready in the time it takes to boil the pasta. It’s simple, flavourful and perfect for busy days','["200g spaghetti","3 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","3-4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1/2 small red chilli, finely chopped (optional)","a small handful parsley, finely chopped"]','["Bring a large pan of well-salted water to the boil and cook the spaghetti for about 10 mins, or until al dente – it should retain a little bite.","When the pasta is nearly ready, heat the oil in a frying pan set over a medium heat and sizzle the garlic and chilli, if using, for 1 minute until fragrant and the garlic is lightly golden but not brown (the garlic will taste bitter if it gets too dark).","Drain the spaghetti and add it to the garlicky oil with the parsley. Season and toss to combine, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7583,7583,'en','Olive, cherry tomato & feta focaccia','Bake this moreish focaccia with the flavours of the Med – it’s ideal for a picnic. Or try it minus the olives, tomatoes and feta for a very reliable plain focaccia','["500g strong bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","5 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for the tin","200g cherry tomatoes, halved (a mixture of colours looks nice)","small bunch of oregano, leaves picked, or use 1 tsp dried oregano","150g kalamata olives, pitted","100g feta, crumbled"]','["Tip the flour into a large bowl with the yeast and 2 tsp salt, and mix together. Add 2 tbsp of the olive oil, then slowly pour in 350ml lukewarm water, continuing to mix until you have a slightly sticky dough. Tip the dough out onto a lightly floured work surface, scraping around the sides of the bowl. Knead for 5-10 mins until the dough is soft and less sticky, then put in a clean bowl, cover with a tea towel and leave to prove for 1 hr until doubled in size.","Generously oil a shallow rectangular baking tin (ours was 20 x 30cm). Tip in the dough, then use your hands to stretch it out until it reaches the corners of the tin. Cover with a clean tea towel and leave to prove for a further 35-45 mins. Meanwhile, tip the tomatoes into a bowl, season, add the oregano and drizzle with 1 tbsp olive oil. Toss together and set aside.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/ gas 7. Press the tomato halves evenly into the into the dough, then do the same with the olives. Crumble over the feta, then lightly press everything down again using your fingertips. Drizzle with 1 tbsp olive oil and scatter with sea salt, then bake for 25-30 mins until deep golden and puffed up. While the bread is still hot, drizzle over the remaining 1 tbsp olive oil. Leave to cool completely in the tin, then slice. You can wrap it in the tin to take on a picnic, or wrap individual squares.Will keep wrapped, or in an airtight container, for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:20:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7585,7585,'en','Ricciarelli biscuits','Rustle up these Italian-inspired almond biscuits. Gift to family and friends at Christmas, or make a batch for your own biscuit tin as a treat','["2 egg whites (use the yolks in another recipe, such as fried rice)","½ tsp almond extract","1 lemon, zested","200g icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","260g ground almonds"]','["Whiskthe egg whites to stiff peaks in a clean bowl, then whisk in the almond extract and lemon zest.","In a separate bowl, sift together the icing sugar, ground almonds and a pinch of salt. Gently fold this into the whisked egg whites until it all comes together into a dough. Cover and chill for at least 4 hrs, or ideally overnight.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/ gas 5. Turn the dough out onto a work surface generously dusted with icing sugar. Roll into a long, fat sausage (about 40cm long) and cut 2cm-thick slices down the length (you should get about 20). Shape each slice into an oval and pat down the tops a little – the biscuits should be about 4-5cm wide and 5-6cm long. Arrange on abaking traylined with baking parchment and dust with more icing sugar.","Bake for 20-23 mins until the biscuits are just turning brown. They will be soft, but will firm up as they cool. Leave to cool completely on the tray.Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:20:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7587,7587,'en','Italian-style roast cabbage wedges with tomato lentils','Roast cabbage for a veggie centrepiece, with crisp, caramelised leaves on the outside and a soft, sweet centre. Serve with our Italian-inspired lentils and golden roast new potatoes','["100ml extra virgin olive oil","4 garlic cloves , crushed","2 small winter green cabbages , outer leaves removed, each cut into 6 wedges","750g baby new  potatoes","1 tbsp olive oil","2 lemons , zested","1 tbsp olive oil","2 onions , finely chopped","2 celery stalks, finely chopped","250g red lentils","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 vegetable stock cubes","3 tbsp sundried tomato purée","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","small bunch of basil , finely chopped, plus a few whole leaves to serve","2 tbsp olive oil","1 garlic clove , crushed","½ -1 tsp chilli flakes","3 thick slices stale crusty bread or sourdough, crusts removed then blitzed into breadcrumbs (about 120g)","1 lemon , zested","100g Kalamata olives , pitted and roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Bring a large pan of water to the boil and blanch the potatoes for 10-12 mins until tender, then drain and leave to cool.","For the cabbage, mix together the oil and garlic, rub all over the wedges, season, then spread out on a largebaking tray. Roast on the top shelf for 15 mins.","While the cabbage is cooking, put the new potatoes onto a large baking tray and gently crush with the back of a spoon or a masher, so they split open slightly. Drizzle over the oil and some seasoning, then stir in the lemon zest. Once the cabbage has had 15 mins, put the potatoes on the top shelf of the oven and move the cabbage to the bottom. Cook for 45 mins, turning everything halfway through.","For the lentils, heat the oil in a mediumsaucepanand fry the onions and celery until soft and translucent, about 10-15 mins. Tip in the lentils, tomatoes, 450ml water, stock cubes, tomato purée and vinegar, bring to the boil and simmer uncovered for 30-35 mins, stirring occasionally until the lentils are soft and cooked through. If the mixture gets a little dry, add a splash of water to stop it sticking. Stir in the basil and an extra 50ml boiling water to loosen the mixture. Season well.","While the lentils are cooking, make the pangrattato. Heat the oil in a large frying pan, fry the garlic and chilli for 30 seconds, then add the breadcrumbs. Toast until golden and crunchy, then tip in the lemon zest and olives and fry for a further 3 mins. Set aside to cool.","To serve, spoon lentils onto each plate, put a cabbage wedge on top and sprinkle over the pangrattato. Garnish with the extra basil and serve the potatoes on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:20:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7589,7589,'en','Aubergine parmigiana lasagne','Combine two Italian classics – parmigiana and lasagne – in this veggie bake. It’s ideal for batch cooking as you can freeze it before or after baking','["3 large aubergines, trimmed and thinly sliced lengthways","4 tbsp olive oil","250g vegetarian mozzarella, drained and coarsely grated","50g vegetarian Italian-style hard cheese, grated","1 bunch of basil, leaves picked and roughly chopped, plus extra to serve","8 dried lasagne sheets (egg lasagne sheets are best for this)","2 tbsp olive oil","6 garlic cloves, finely sliced","¼ tsp golden caster sugar","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","3 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes"]','["For the sauce, heat the oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the garlic for 1 min until golden. Add the sugar and vinegar, simmer for 30 seconds, then add the tomatoes. Season with salt and return to a simmer. Bubble for 10 mins, then remove from the heat and set aside.Can be prepared up to two days ahead and chilled.","Heat agriddleor large frying pan over a medium-high heat. Brush the aubergine slices on both sides with the olive oil and season with a little salt, then griddle in batches until the slices are softened and slightly charred (ensure the heat isn’t too high or the aubergine will char before it softens). Transfer the cooked slices to a plate as you go.","To assemble, lay a third of the aubergine slices over the base of a rectangular or square gratin dish, then pour over a third of the sauce. Scatter with a small handful of both cheeses (you’ll want to keep most of the cheese for the top) and half the basil, then top with half the lasagne sheets. Repeat once more, then finish with a final layer of aubergines topped with the rest of the sauce. Scatter over the remaining cheese.After leaving to cool completely, the dish can be covered and chilled for up two days or frozen for up to three months. Defrost fully before cooking.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the dish on a baking tray and bake for 30 mins until the cheese is golden and the sauce is bubbling at the edges. Leave to cool for at least 10 mins, then scatter with the reserved basil and serve.The cooked lasagne will keep frozen for up to three months, covered with foil. Defrost thoroughly, uncover and bake as stated above. Or to cook from frozen, bake at 180C/160C fan/gas 4 for 40 mins. Remove the foil, turn the oven up to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and bake for a further 30 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:20:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7591,7591,'en','Arrabbiata sauce','Make our version of a classic Italian pasta sauce, packed with tomatoes, red chilli and garlic. Stir it through spaghetti or linguine for an easy, delicious supper','["2 small garlic cloves, peeled and crushed","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 x 400g can chopped tomatoes"]','["Pour the oil into a saucepan and fry the garlic over a medium heat for 1-2 mins until fragrant, but not browned. Add the chilli, fry for another minute, then add the tomatoes along with 1 tsp salt and ½ tsp sugar. Stir well to combine the ingredients and simmer gently for 20 mins, stirring regularly. The sauce will thicken slowly as it cooks.","Taste and adjust the seasoning if needed. Serve stirred through pasta, orblendit first to create a smoother sauce if you prefer.Will keep chilled for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:20:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7593,7593,'en','Red pesto','Blend together pine nuts, sundried tomatoes, parmesan and olive oil to make a red pesto, perfect for stirring into pasta or to flavour chicken dishes','["50g pine nuts","200g semi-soft sundried tomatoes, drained","125ml extra virgin olive oil","25g parmesan, grated","1 large garlic clove, peeled and crushed","1 lemon, juiced (optional)"]','["Start by toasting the pine nuts. Tip them into afrying panset over a medium heat. Shake the pan or gently stir the nuts around, so that they toast evenly. When the nuts are golden brown, remove from the heat and set aside.","Put all the remaining ingredients in ablenderwith ½ tsp sea salt and the toasted pine nuts, then blend until the sauce is quite smooth but retains some texture. If necessary you can add 2-3 tbsp of cold water and blitz to loosen slightly. Taste, adjust the seasoning if needed, and serve immediately.Will keep in a jar in the fridge for a week."]','2026-01-10 12:20:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7595,7595,'en','Red pepper & anchovy spaghetti','Make the most of anchovies by combining them with red peppers in this speedy pasta dish. The sweetness of the peppers complements the umami anchovies so well','["300g spaghetti","3 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","4 garlic cloves, sliced","4 anchovies","1 tsp chilli flakes","300g jar roasted red peppers, drained and sliced","1 tbsp tomato purée","handful of basil, finely sliced"]','["Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil, then stir in the spaghetti. Cook for 1 min less than the pack instructions. Tip the oil, garlic, anchovies and chilli flakes into anothersaucepanor a high-sided frying pan set over a medium heat. Cook for about 1 min, until the oil is hot and the garlic has started to sizzle slightly.","Add the roasted peppers and tomato purée. Stir well. Continue to cook the anchovy and pepper mixture until the spaghetti is ready, adding a ladleful of the pasta cooking water as it cooks to loosen it and make a sauce.","When the spaghetti is ready, use tongs to transfer it directly from its cooking water to the sauce, adding a little more of the water to loosen if needed. Cook the spaghetti in the sauce for 30 seconds, tossing to coat, then remove from the heat and toss through the basil. Serve straightaway, drizzled with a little olive oil."]','2026-01-10 12:20:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7597,7597,'en','Sausage & winter greens cannelloni','Stretch a pack of sausages and feed the whole family with this cannelloni. The meaty ragu sauce is bulked out with nutrient-dense winter greens','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 red onions, halved and sliced","6 pork sausages","3 garlic cloves, crushed","small bunch of thyme, leaves picked","pinch of chilli flakes","1 tbsp tomato purée","400g can plum tomatoes","200g cavolo nero or other winter greens","75g butter","75g plain flour","850ml milk","nutmeg, for grating","50g parmesan, grated","12 lasagne sheets","green salad, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large flameproofcasseroleover a medium heat and cook the onions for 8-10 mins until softened and starting to caramelise. Meanwhile, squeeze the sausagemeat from the skins.","Push the onions to one side of the casserole, then add the sausagemeat to the other. Squash it into smaller pieces using a wooden spoon, stirring occasionally for 10-12 mins until cooked and starting to brown in places. Mix the onions back in, then add the garlic, thyme, chilli flakes and tomato purée. Cook for another 1-2 mins. Tip in the plum tomatoes, crushing them with the back of the spoon. Season and bubble for 15-20 mins until the tomatoes have broken down and the sauce has reduced to a thick ragu.","Put thekettleon to boil. If using cavolo nero, remove and discard the tough stalks and roughly chop the leaves. For softer veg like spinach or chard, you can leave the stalks on. Put in acolanderset over the sink and pour over a kettle of just-boiled water, then rinse the leaves under cold running water until cool enough to handle. Squeeze out as much water as you can, transfer to a board and finely chop. Stir the greens into the sausage ragu, cook for 1-2 mins until any excess liquid has evaporated (the mixture should be quite dry), remove from the heat and leave to cool a little.","Melt the butter in a separate saucepan over a medium heat. When sizzling, stir in the flour to make a sandy paste.Whiskinthe milk, a splash at a time, until completely incorporated. When the sauce is smooth and the consistency of custard, season well, grate in a good amount of nutmeg and stir in half the parmesan. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Drop the lasagne sheets into a large pan of boiling salted water one at a time to prevent them sticking together, then cook for 5-6 mins, stirring until soft enough to roll up but not fully cooked through. Drain and plunge into a bowl of cold water to stop the cooking process.","If the béchamel sauce has thickened as it’s cooled down, stir in a splash more milk. Spoon a third of the sauce over the base of a baking dish roughly 25 x 35cm. Lift a sheet of lasagne out of the bowl of cold water and lay on a board with one of the short ends facing you. Spoon a generous tbsp of the sausage ragu over one end, then roll it up to enclose the filling, making a short cannelloni – there will be a little overlapping pasta. Place it in the baking dish, then continue with the remaining ragu and lasagne sheets, arranging them in the baking dish in two rows of six cannelloni. Spoon any remaining ragu over the top, then pour over the béchamel sauce to cover all the cannelloni rolls. Sprinkle with the remaining parmesan.Will keep covered and chilled for up to two days or frozen for up to two months.Leave to cool completely first.Defrost thoroughly in the fridge overnight before cooking.Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, then bake the cannelloni for 40 mins until bubbling at the edges and golden brown on top. Grind over some black pepper, if you like, and serve with a crisp green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7599,7599,'en','Sausage pasta bake','An Italian-American classic, this freezable sausage pasta bake is an ideal make-ahead family dish for busy days','["400g rigatoni or penne","125g ball mozzarella, chopped into chunks","2 tbsp olive oil","6 pork sausages","4 garlic cloves, sliced","pinch of chilli flakes (optional)","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp butter","1 tbsp plain flour","350ml milk","50g parmesan, grated, plus extra to serve"]','["To make the ragu, heat the oil in a large shallow pan or flameproofcasserole. Squeeze the sausagemeat from its skins in small balls straight into the pan. Sizzle for 10 mins until browned (don’t worry if the meat breaks up). Add the garlic and sizzle for another minute until starting to turn golden, then stir in the chilli flakes, if using, the tomato purée and vinegar. Tip in the tomatoes and bring to a simmer. Reduce the heat to low and bubble for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, make the white sauce. Melt the butter in a saucepan and stir in the flour to make a loose paste. Sizzle for a minute, then graduallywhiskin the milk. Simmer gently for 10 mins, whisking occasionally to ensure the sauce stays smooth. Season and whisk in the parmesan. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Cook the pasta in a largesaucepanof boiling water for 9 mins, or a minute less than pack instructions. Drain and return to the pan. Scrape most of the white sauce into the pasta and stir to coat. Tip in most of the ragu and most of the mozzarella and stir until just combined. Pour the pasta mixture into a large baking dish and spoon over the remaining white sauce and ragu. Dot with the rest of the mozzarella and sprinkle with extra parmesan. Leave to cool completely, then wrap and chill for up to a day, or freeze for up to two months. Defrost in the fridge for 24 hrs before baking.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Bake for 25-30 mins until the top is slightly crisp at the edges and the cheese is melted. Leave to rest for 5-10 mins, then take the baking dish straight to the table for people to scoop onto their plates."]','2026-01-10 12:20:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7601,7601,'en','Chicken & bacon pasta','Toss chicken and bacon with ribbons of tagliatelle in a deliciously creamy sauce to make this easy pasta dish. Serve with a green salad for an easy supper','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp butter","1 onion, finely chopped","1 large garlic clove, finely grated","200ml double cream","100g mascarpone","75g parmesan, finely grated","1 chicken stock cube","2 cooked chicken breasts (about 210g), shredded","8 rashers cooked streaky bacon (about 25g), roughly chopped","300g tagliatelle","¼ small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","green salad, to serve"]','["Heat the oil and butter in a mediumsaucepanover a low heat and fry the onion for 10 mins, or until softened and translucent. Add the garlic and cook for 2 mins more. Add the cream, mascarpone, parmesan and stock cube. Give it a stir and add the cooked chicken and bacon to heat through.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta following pack instructions. Reserve 100ml of the pasta water. Toss the pasta in the creamy sauce and enough of the reserved water to loosen. Season with black pepper. Top with the parsley and serve with a green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7603,7603,'en','Courgette & broad bean risotto with basil pesto','Make this vibrant risotto with courgettes and broad beans to make the most of summer veg. Swirl through homemade pesto for a fabulous starter or main','["3 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp butter","2 medium courgettes (about 350g), cut into 1-2cm dice","pinch of chilli flakes or pul biber","pinch of grated nutmeg","2 spring onions, finely sliced","½ lemon, zested","150g risotto rice","75ml dry white wine or vermouth","750g warm vegetable or chicken stock","80g broad beans, blanched and peeled","courgette flowers, stamen removed and petals torn (optional)","20g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, grated, plus extra to serve","1 garlic clove","1 tbsp toasted pine nuts","large handful of basil leaves, plus extra to serve","handful of mint leaves","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp grated parmesan or vegetarian alternative"]','["To make the pesto, crush the garlic to a paste with a pinch of salt using a pestle and mortar. Add the pine nuts and pound to a coarse paste, then tear in the basil and mint, pounding again until they’ve broken down. Stir in the oil and cheese, then taste for seasoning – add more cheese if you like.","Heat the oil and butter in a large non-stick frying pan over a medium heat. Add the courgettes, sprinkle in the chilli flakes and nutmeg, and season with salt and pepper. Fry for 3-5 mins until the courgettes are golden and softened. Add the spring onions and lemon zest, and stir for a minute or two. Tip in the rice and stir to coat in the oil until translucent, about 2 mins.","Pour in the wine, then cook for a couple of minutes until it’s mostly evaporated. Add a ladleful of the stock and stir for a few minutes until it’s absorbed. Continue adding a ladleful at a time for 20-30 mins, stirring continually, until all of the stock is absorbed.","Stir in the blanched broad beans and flowers, if using, and warm through for 2 mins. Remove from the heat and stir through the parmesan. Allow to sit for about 5 mins, then swirl through half of the pesto. Any remaining pesto will keep chilled for up to two days.","Divide the risotto between bowls and scatter with the extra basil leaves, extra cheese and another spoonful of the pesto, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7605,7605,'en','Panzanella','Prepare your own version of one of Tuscany’s most famous dishes, panzanella. It’s a good way to use up leftovers, as it’s made with stale bread – simply toss with ripe tomatoes and an olive oil dressing','["1kg ripe mixed tomatoes, halved if small, quartered if large","300g day-old sourdough or ciabatta, torn into large chunks","100ml extra virgin olive oil","50ml red wine vinegar","1 small shallot, finely chopped","50g tin anchovies, drained and roughly chopped","100g black olives, pitted","large handful of basil leaves, torn"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the tomatoes in a colander and sprinkle over 1 tsp sea salt, then leave to sit for 15 mins.","Spread the chunks of bread out on a baking tray and toss with 1 tbsp of the oil. Bake for 10-15 mins, or until lightly toasted.","In a bowl, whisk together the remaining oil, the vinegar and shallot. Season to taste. Toss the anchovies with the tomatoes, croutons, olive oil dressing, the olives and half the basil in a large bowl. Spoon the panzanella onto a serving plate and top with the remaining basil."]','2026-01-10 12:20:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7607,7607,'en','Asparagus risotto','Put asparagus centre stage in this satisfying risotto. Top with a sprinkling of parmesan for an easy midweek meal for two','["1 bunch asparagus (about 200g)","800ml vegetable stock","1 tbsp olive oil","25g butter","1 small onion, finely chopped","175g risotto rice","100ml white wine or vermouth (optional)","25g parmesan or vegetarian alternative, finely grated"]','["Snap the woody ends off the asparagus stalks and tip them into a saucepan with the stock. Put on a low heat to very gently simmer. Meanwhile, cut off the tips of the asparagus, add to the stock for exactly 1 min. Scoop out with a slotted spoon and set aside. Finely slice the rest of the stalks into rounds.","Heat the oil and half the butter in a heavy, wide pan. Cook the onions gently for 5 mins until soft, stirring often. Add the chopped asparagus stalks and cook for 2 mins more. Add the rice and continously stir for a few minutes until it turns semi-transparent and makes a hissing sound.","Stir in the wine, if using – it will evaporate almost immediately. Reduce the heat to a gentle simmer. Add the stock, a ladleful at a time, stirring between each addition until it is absorbed, about 15 mins.","Try the rice – it should feel just cooked with a slight bite to it. Stir in the asparagus tips and any last dregs of stock and cook for 1 or 2 mins more. Remove from the heat and top with the remaining butter and most of the parmesan. Season generously, cover and leave for a few minutes to settle.","Give the risotto a thorough stir to incorporate the butter and cheese and serve straight away with the remaining parmesan for sprinkling over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7609,7609,'en','Caponata with cheesy polenta','Make something different for dinner with vegetable-rich caponata and cheesy polenta. It’s healthy, gluten-free, full of nutrients and sure to satisfy','["1-2 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, cut into thin wedges","1 courgette, cut into rounds","1 aubergine, cut into chunks","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp dried oregano","¼ tsp chilli flakes","400g can chopped tomatoes","30g pitted green olives, halved","½ tbsp capers, drained and rinsed","½ small bunch of basil, finely chopped, plus extra to serve","100g instant polenta","a little milk, to loosen (optional)","40g parmesan or vegetarian Italian-style hard cheese, grated"]','["Heat the oil in a medium pan set over a medium heat, and fry the onion, courgette and aubergine for 5-10 mins, or until beginning to soften. Stir in the garlic, oregano and chilli flakes, followed by the tomatoes, olives and capers. Season to taste, then simmer, covered, for 20 mins, or until all the veg is soft and cooked through. Stir in the basil and taste for seasoning.","Meanwhile, cook the polenta following pack instructions – you may need to loosen with some water or milk if it’s too thick. Mix with the parmesan, then spoon and spread over two plates. Top with the caponata and extra basil. Season."]','2026-01-10 12:20:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7611,7611,'en','Mozzarella, pepper & aubergine calzone','Try these healthy Italian-inspired mozzarella, pepper and aubergine calzones for a working lunch, or pack up and eat outdoors on a warm day','["400g strong wholewheat bread flour, plus extra for dusting","⅛ tsp salt (optional)","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","2 tsp rapeseed oil, plus extra for the baking sheet","2 tsp rapeseed oil","1 red and 1 yellow pepper, deseeded and cut into small chunks","1 large aubergine, halved lengthways and thinly sliced","2 large garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","small bunch basil, roughly torn","8 pitted Kalamata olives, halved","125g ball mozzarella (drained weight), quartered","milk or beaten egg, for brushing"]','["Put the flour, salt (if using), yeast, oil and 300ml lukewarm water in a bowl and mix until soft. Knead into a ball (try not to add any extra flour) – it will be sticky but the flour will absorb some moisture. Return to the bowl, cover and leave somewhere warm.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Heat the oil in a large non-stick pan, then stir-fry the peppers for about 1 min until they start to soften. Add the aubergine and garlic and continue to cook over a medium heat for 8-10 mins, gently pressing the veg with a wooden spoon until it breaks down a little. If it doesn’t, fry, covered, for a few extra mins.","Stir in the tomato purée, vinegar and 2 tbsp water. When the veg is soft, remove the pan from the heat and stir through the basil.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Quarter the risen dough and roll each piece out to a 20cm circle on a lightly floured surface. Spoon a quarter of the filling over one side, scatter over a quarter of the olives, top with a quarter of the cheese, and brush the edges with the milk or beaten egg. Fold the dough over the filling and pinch the edges together at the side, a bit like making a Cornish pasty. Lift onto a lightly oiled baking sheet and brush with more milk or beaten egg. Repeat with the remaining dough and filling to make four calzones, then bake for 15-20 mins until golden. Leave to cool slightly and serve at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:20:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7613,7613,'en','Puttanesca meatball bake','This quick-to-prepare pasta bake with capers, chilli flakes, olives and courgettes is the ideal midweek meal. Tasty and filling, it''ll satisfy the whole family','["1 tbsp olive oil","24 ready-made meatballs","2 garlic cloves, finely sliced","pinch dried chilli flakes (optional)","2 anchovies, chopped (optional)","2 small courgettes (about 250g), coarsely grated","2 tbsp capers, rinsed, drained and roughly chopped","70g pitted black olives, halved","500ml passata","300g penne (or other pasta shapes)","2 tbsp grated parmesan"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Heat the oil in a frying pan and gently fry the meatballs until they are browned all over, then tip them into a dish. Add the garlic and chilli, if using, to the leftover oil in the pan and cook it briefly along with the anchovies, if using. Fry until the anchovies almost melt, then add the courgettes and cook until any liquid they give off has evaporated. Stir in the capers, olives and passata and bring to a simmer. Add the meatballs and cook for 5 mins more, then season if needed.","Meanwhile, cook the pasta following pack instructions, drain well, then tip into an ovenproof baking dish about 25cm wide. Spoon over the meatball mixture, stir into the pasta and level the surface as much as possible. Sprinkle over the parmesan and bake for 30 mins, or until the top is browned a little and the sauce is bubbling. Rest for 5 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7615,7615,'en','Ricotta & spinach gnudi','Try these light ricotta and herb dumplings from Lina Stores for a classic Italian main. Serve your gnudi with plenty of sauce and parmesan','["500g spinach, ends trimmed","500g ricotta (needs to be dry, so strain overnight if it''s wet)","75g egg yolks","75g dried breadcrumbs","50g plain flour","whole nutmeg, for grating","125g Grana Padano, grated, plus extra for the sauce and to serve","50g butter","20g sage, sliced if the leaves are large"]','["Pour boiling water over the spinach, then leave to cool a little before squeezing out any excess liquid. Chop the spinach finely. Drain and squeeze out any excess water again. Put the spinach in a mixing bowl with the ricotta, egg yolks, breadcrumbs, flour, a grating of nutmeg, a pinch of salt and the cheese. Mix well.","Scoop up 24 equal-sized lumps of the mixture, using an ice cream scoop if you have one, and shape each one into a log by rolling it between your hands. Lay each log on a baking sheet, then chill for 30 mins, or until needed.","Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil. Lower the gnudi into the water, turn down to a simmer and cook for 3-4 mins (do this in batches if you need to). Meanwhile, heat the butter in a large frying pan, add the sage and fry until crisp. Drain the gnudi well, then tip into the pan with the sage, along with a good grating of cheese. Swirl everything together, doing it in batches if it’s easier. Arrange four gnudi on each serving plate, pour over more of the sauce and scatter with more grated cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:20:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7617,7617,'en','Ravioli with walnuts, goat’s cheese & cavolo nero sauce','Make this pasta dish using lasagne sheets and a homemade goat’s cheese paste. If you have time, it’s worth using freshly shelled walnuts for a sweeter flavour','["200g cavolo nero","75ml olive oil, plus extra to toss the pasta","1 small garlic clove","1 lemon, juiced","8-12 fresh or dried lasagne sheets, depending on size","finely grated pecorino, parmesan or vegetarian alternative, to serve","140g walnuts","handful sage leaves, chopped","120g goat’s cheese","lemon juice, to taste","50ml olive oil"]','["Bring a large pan of lightly salted water to the boil, then add the cavolo nero. Cook for 1-2 mins until the kale turns bright green and softens. Lift out with tongs into a colander, keeping the cooking water to boil the pasta. Run cold water over the kale, squeeze out any excess water, then transfer to a food processor. Add the oil, garlic, lemon juice and 1 tsp salt, then blitz to a fine pesto. Season to taste and transfer to a small pan. Gently warm over a medium-low heat.","Clean the food processor. For the goat’s cheese paste, tip in the nuts, sage, goat’s cheese, a good squeeze of lemon juice and the oil, then blitz to a paste. Season, then warm in another small pan over a medium-low heat, stirring occasionally.","Bring the pan of cavolo water to the boil again, adding more water if needed. Add the pasta sheets and simmer following pack instructions. Drain, keeping back a cup of the pasta water to add to the sauce (about 400ml). Cut the pasta sheets in half and toss in a little olive oil.","Stir the reserved pasta water through the cavolo sauce and keep on a low heat. If the sauce looks thick, thin down with a little more water, or increase the heat a little if too thin; it should be pourable like double cream. Spoon a pool of sauce onto each plate. Layer the lasagne sheets on top with spoonfuls of the goat’s cheese paste in-between each layer. Top with the last sheet of pasta and ladle over a little more sauce, then scatter over the cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:20:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7619,7619,'en','Italian pork burger with fresh tomato salsa','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyFlavour pork mince with fennel, chilli and oregano and serve in ciabatta buns with mascarpone cheese and a tomato and olive dressing','["500g pork mince","1 tsp fennel seed","1 tsp chilli flakes","1 tsp dried oregano","drizzle of olive oil","2 large tomato, chopped","6 black olive, chopped","drizzle of balsamic vinegar","4 ciabatta bread rolls, split and toasted","4 tbsp mascarpone","handful baby spinach"]','["Mix the pork mince with the fennel seeds, chilli flakes, oregano and some seasoning. Mix well with your hands until well combined, then shape into 4 burgers. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan – or fire up the BBQ and brush the burgers with a little oil – and cook the burgers for 5-7 mins on each side until cooked through.","Meanwhile, mix the tomatoes, olives, balsamic vinegar and a drizzle more oil with some seasoning to make a salsa. Top the base of each roll with 1 tbsp mascarpone, a few spinach leaves, a burger and a spoonful of the salsa, then sandwich everything with the lid."]','2026-01-10 12:20:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7621,7621,'en','Gnocchi with parsley, butter & samphire','Pass on the pasta and try making your own potato gnocchi – forage for samphire to make a fresh and frugal meat-free main','["900g floury potatoes, roughly the same size or halved if large, unpeeled","50g salted butter","1 medium egg, beaten","225-280g plain white flour","100g salted butter","6 shallots, finely sliced","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","200g samphire","2 small packs parsley, chopped"]','["To make the gnocchi, cook the potatoes in boiling water for 40-50 mins until very tender, then drain well. Peel away the skin and press through a sieve or a potato ricer into a bowl.","While the potatoes are still warm, add 1 tsp salt, the butter, egg and half the flour. Lightly mix together and turn out onto a floured board. Gradually knead in enough of the remaining flour to make a smooth, soft but slightly sticky dough.","Roll out the dough into sausages, 2.5cm in diameter. Cut into roughly 2cm pieces and put on a floured tea towel to prevent the gnocchi sticking together.","Bring a large pan of water to the boil. Drop the gnocchi into the water in batches and allow to cook for 2-3 mins until they float to the surface. Remove with a slotted spoon and keep hot while you cook the rest.","Meanwhile, gently heat the butter in a large heavy-based pan, add the shallots and garlic, and gently soften for 5-6 mins. Add the samphire and cook for 4-6 mins more.","Add the gnocchi to the pan with most of the parsley. Gently toss everything together and season. Serve immediately, scattered with the rest of the parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:20:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7623,7623,'en','Taleggio tart with walnut pastry','Delicate, nutty pastry provides a perfect backdrop to the creamy filling of this mouthwatering meat-free main course','["200g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","50g walnuts (shelled weight)","50g cold butter, chopped into small pieces","25g vegetarian hard cheese (or Parmesan if you’re not making a strictly vegetarian version), grated","1 medium egg, beaten","1 tbsp olive oil","6 shallots, sliced","3 large garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 whole egg and 2 egg yolks","200ml double cream","140g vegetarian Taleggio, rind removed, cut into 1cm/½ in chunks","1 punnet cress","zest 1 lemon, plus extra to serve"]','["To make the pastry, whizz the flour and walnuts in a food processor until the walnuts are very fine. Add the butter and cheese and whizz again until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Add the beaten egg and 1 tsp cold water. Pulse until the mixture forms a dough, adding a little more water if needed. Wrap in cling film and chill for 30 mins.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. On a lightly floured surface, roll out the pastry to the thickness of a 50p piece and use it to line a 23cm tart tin. Prick the base several times with a fork and return to the fridge to chill for a further 15 mins. (Don’t be tempted to skip this step – it will help prevent any shrinkage.)","Heat the olive oil in a frying pan over a medium heat and add the shallots and garlic. Fry for 5-10 mins until the shallots have softened and are golden. Remove from the heat and allow to cool slightly.","Line your pastry with baking parchment, fill with baking beans and bake for 15 mins. Remove the parchment and return to the oven for a further 10 mins – this will allow the base to dry out before you add the filling. Reduce oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.","Crack the egg into a medium-sized mixing bowl and add the yolks. Beat lightly with a fork before pouring in the cream. Stir in the shallots and garlic, as well as three-quarters of the Talegio, three-quarters of the cress and the lemon zest. Season.","Pour the mixture into the tart case, add the remaining cheese and season with pepper.","Bake for 40-50 mins until the filling is set and feels firm to the touch. Remove from the oven and allow to cool for 10 mins. Scatter over the remaining cress and lemon zest."]','2026-01-10 12:20:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7625,7625,'en','Nettle gnudi with wild pesto','These Italian dumplings are like light balls of ricotta gnocchi, or the filling for ravioli – use freshly foraged nettles for a simple sauce','["2 x 250g tubs good-quality ricotta","200g young nettle leaves (foraged - see tip)","50g Parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), plus extra to serve","2 egg yolks","nutmeg, for grating","350g semolina flour or fine semolina","6 tbsp wild pesto (see recipe in Goes well with)"]','["Line a sieve with a piece of muslin and set over a bowl. Tip in the ricotta, gather up the ends of the muslin and gently tie together. Leave to drain for 4 hrs or preferably overnight.","Meanwhile, bring a pan of water to the boil. Blanch the nettle leaves quickly, then drain and chill under the cold tap. Thoroughly drain again, and squeeze out as much water from the leaves as you can, then very finely chop and chill until needed.","To make the gnudi, transfer the strained ricotta to a large bowl. Beat a little, then add all but a few tbsp of the Parmesan, the egg yolks, nettles, a good grating of nutmeg and plenty of seasoning. Give it a good stir to combine. Tip the semolina into a large baking tray (it will need to fit in your fridge later). Wet your hands, dip them in the semolina and, working quickly, scoop 1 heaped tsp of the ricotta mixture into your hands and gently roll into a ball. Place the ball on the semolina tray and roll around so that it is completely coated. Pick it up and roll between the palms of your hands to create a smooth ball, then put back in the semolina. Continue with the rest of the mixture – you should have about 28 balls in total. Leaving the balls in the semolina, make sure that they are well spaced, then cover loosely with cling film. Chill for 12-24 hrs – the longer the better – until a skin has formed on the gnudi.","To cook, bring a large pan of water to the boil. Meanwhile, spoon the pesto into a frying pan. Once the water is boiling, drop in batches of the gnudi and simmer for 2-3 mins or until they rise to the surface. Scoop out with a slotted spoon and transfer to a sieve. Repeat with the remaining gnudi. Heat the pesto in the pan with a few tbsp of the gnudi cooking water, to loosen it. Tip the cooked gnudi into the frying pan and gently turn the balls in the pesto. Divide between plates and scatter over the remaining Parmesan and a good grinding of black pepper before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7627,7627,'en','Wild garlic butter on music paper bread','This delicate, super-thin bread is inspired by a Sardinian classic, carta di musica – serve with flavoured butter for a special starter or side','["200g ''00'' flour, plus extra for dusting","100g semolina flour or fine semolina","olive oil, for brushing","8 slices wild garlic butter (see recipe in Goes well with), to serve","flaky sea salt, to serve"]','["In a bowl, mix together the flours and 1/2 tsp salt. Pour in 175ml water and mix to a soft dough. Tip onto a lightly floured surface and knead for about 5 mins or until smooth. Wrap in cling film and leave to rest for 30 mins. Meanwhile, place a pizza stone or one or two large baking trays in the oven, then heat it to 240C/220C fan/gas 9 or as high as it will go.","Divide the dough into 8 and shape into balls. On a floured surface, roll out balls very thinly into rough circles about 20-22cm in diameter.","Cut out 8 squares of baking parchment a little larger than the dough circles. Pop the dough circles on top and brush with olive oil. Cook the breads, 1 or 2 at a time, on the hot pizza stone or baking tray (still on the baking parchment) for 6-8 mins or until bubbled up in places, golden brown and crisp. Remove and leave to cool on a wire rack while you cook the rest. Pop all the breads back in the oven for 1 min to warm through. Remove and top with a slice of garlic butter (see Goes well with) and sea salt."]','2026-01-10 12:20:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7629,7629,'en','New potato & rosemary focaccia','This easy Italian-style loaf is inspired by the classic chip buttie – perfect as an alternative to a dinner party bread basket','["250g new potatoes (we used Jersey Royals)","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","8 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for greasing","500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for kneading and dusting","small pack rosemary"]','["Cook the potatoes in boiling water for 15 mins, then drain and leave to cool completely. Meanwhile, boil the kettle.","Pour 175ml boiling water and 100ml cold water into a large bowl. Sprinkle over the yeast, 1 tsp salt and 2 tbsp olive oil. Mix well, then stir in the flour, adding a splash more water if the mixture feels too dry.","Turn out the dough onto a clean work surface and knead for 15 mins until smooth and elastic (dust the surface with a little flour if the dough is sticky), then shape into a ball. Grease the inside of a large bowl with olive oil, then add the dough to the bowl and turn a few times to coat in the oil. Cover with cling film and leave in a warm place for 1 hr or until doubled in size.","Grease a large roasting tin (about 26cm x 35cm) with olive oil and dust with a little flour. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Carefully stretch out the dough to fit the tin, pressing it into the corners. Cut the cooked potatoes into wedges and tuck them into the dough at regular intervals, along with sprigs of rosemary, and scatter a few sprigs over the top. Cover the tin with cling film and leave to prove for another 45 mins. Remove the cling film, pour over 3 tbsp olive oil and sprinkle over a little salt. Bake in the oven\r\nfor 30-35 mins or until the bread is golden and the potatoes are browning lightly.","When the bread is cooked, remove it from the oven and quickly drizzle over another 3 tbsp olive oil while it’s still hot. Leave to cool for 10 mins, then turn out onto a board, slice and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7631,7631,'en','Artichoke & olive calzones','These Italian parcels make a great vegetarian weeknight dinner – use a shop-bought bread mix to save time','["1 tbsp olive oil","390g can artichoke hearts in water, drained and sliced","4 rosemary sprigs, leaves only, chopped","½  x 250g tub ricotta","2 garlic cloves, crushed","300g bread mix","75g green olives, sliced","125g ball mozzarella, diced","mixed leaves, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Heat the oil in a frying pan and cook the artichokes and rosemary for a few mins until the artichokes are a little golden. Stir together the ricotta and garlic, and season.","Empty the bread mix into a bowl and make up following pack instructions. Divide into 4 balls and roll each one out to a 20cm circle. Spread one side of each with the ricotta, scatter with the olives, the artichokes and rosemary, then top with the mozzarella. Brush the edges of the dough with water and fold the uncovered half over the filling. Press the edges together to seal. Place on a baking sheet and bake for 12-15 mins until puffed and golden, then serve with mixed leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:20:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7633,7633,'en','Pappardelle with rabbit & chestnut ragu','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis is rainy-day comfort food at its best – flat pasta strips tossed with a rich meaty ragu, creamy chestnuts and fragrant orange zest','["2 tbsp rapeseed or olive oil","1 rabbit, jointed (ask your butcher to do this for you)","2 tbsp plain flour","200g smoked bacon lardons","1 onion, finely chopped","1 carrot, finely chopped","1 celery stick, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp juniper berries, crushed using a pestle and mortar","3 bay leaves, scrunched up in your hand to release the flavour","2 rosemary sprigs, leaves picked and chopped","200ml red wine","1 chicken stock cube","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","200g cooked chestnuts, roughly chopped","400g pappardelle","3 tbsp milk","zest ½  orange or 1 clementine","small bunch parsley, chopped","Parmesan, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large, wide pan or flameproof casserole dish with a lid. Season the rabbit and toss in the flour. Add to the hot oil and brown on all sides – you may have to do this in batches. When it is a deep golden brown all over, transfer to a plate. Add the remaining oil and the lardons to the pan and cook for 10 mins until crisp and golden. Add the onion, carrot and celery, and stir for 10 mins, scraping up any crispy bits from the bottom, until the veg has softened. Add the garlic and cook for 1 min more.","Next, stir in the cinnamon, juniper, bay leaves and rosemary. After 1 min, pour in the wine and crumble in the stock cube. Simmer for 5 mins, then add the tomatoes and return the rabbit to the pan. Nestle the rabbit into the sauce, cover with a lid and simmer gently for 2 hrs, stirring once or twice.","Remove the rabbit, give the sauce a good stir, then cover again. Continue simmering the sauce while you shred the meat from the bones using 2 forks. Discard the bones and add the meat back to the pan, along with half the chestnuts. Cook, uncovered, for another 30 mins until reduced to a thick, rich sauce. Add the remaining chestnuts. Can now be cooled and chilled overnight, or frozen for up to 2 months.","Cook the pasta following pack instructions. Stir the milk, orange zest and parsley into the sauce and reheat, if chilled. When the pasta is cooked, add it to the sauce and cook together for 1 min more. Serve with Parmesan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7635,7635,'en','Torta del Nonna','Give this Tuscan tart a delicious twist by adding dark chocolate to the traditional custard filling and delicate sweet pastry','["280g plain flour","175g cold unsalted butter, cut into cubes","75g icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","2 egg yolks, lightly beaten","1l full-fat milk","1 vanilla pod, split","8 large egg yolks","250g golden caster sugar","85g ''00'' flour","100g ricotta","zest 2 oranges","200g bar dark chocolate, grated","75g pine nuts"]','["To make the pastry, put the flour, butter and icing sugar in a food processor and pulse until it resembles breadcrumbs. With the motor running, slowly add the egg yolks. If the mixture looks too dry, drizzle in 1-2 tbsp cold water. Tip it out onto your work surface and gently knead together. Flatten the pastry into a disc, wrap in cling film and chill for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Pour the milk into a saucepan. Scrape the vanilla seeds from the split pod into the milk and add the pod as well. Heat the milk over\r\na medium heat until it just starts to bubble around the edges. Remove from the heat and leave to cool a little.","Beat the egg yolks, sugar and flour together with an electric whisk for 5-10 mins until pale and mousse-like. Remove the vanilla pod from the cooled milk and steadily pour over the beaten egg yolks, whisking constantly.","Pour the custard mixture into a clean saucepan. Heat over a medium-low heat, whisking all of the time. Cook the custard for 10 mins, still whisking, until it is very thick. Remove from the heat and push through a sieve into a wide dish. Cover the surface with cling film to prevent the custard from forming a skin. Set aside to cool while you prepare the pastry case.","Roll out the pastry between 2 pieces of baking parchment to line a 24cm loose bottomed, fluted tart tin. Cover with cling film and chill for 30 mins. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line the tart case with foil or baking parchment and fill with baking beans. Bake in the oven for 15 mins. Carefully remove the baking beans and foil, then return to the oven for 5-10 mins until the pastry is golden brown. Leave to cool in the tin on a wire rack while you finish the filling.","Reduce oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Gently beat the custard with the ricotta, orange zest and grated chocolate until just combined, and spread evenly in the tart shell. Sprinkle over the pine nuts and bake for 35-40 mins – the filling will still be quite wobbly but it will firm up as it cools. Chill for at least 3 hrs, or overnight. Dust with icing sugar to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7637,7637,'en','Spaghetti with chilli prawns, salami & gremolata breadcrumbs','Sautée red chillies with garlic, fennel seeds and tomatoes for a delicious and easy pasta sauce base – finish with crunchy parsley breadcrumbs','["4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 thumb-sized red chillies, sliced and most seeds removed","3 garlic cloves, chopped","1 tsp fennel seeds","10 slices fennel salami, chopped","140g cherry tomatoes, halved","400g spaghetti or bucatini pasta","300g large raw prawns, shells removed","2 slices crusty bread, pulsed to crumbs","large handful flat-leaf parsley, chopped","zest 1 lemon"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. In a large frying pan, heat 3 tbsp of the oil. Add the chillies and most of the garlic (save 1 tsp for the breadcrumbs) and sauté until golden, about 2-3 mins. Add the fennel seeds and salami, and stir for 1 min. Tip in the tomatoes and a pinch of salt, then sauté for a further 10 mins.","Tip the breadcrumbs onto a baking sheet, pour over the remaining oil, season and bake for 7 mins. Toss the remaining garlic through the crumbs and bake for 3 mins more. Remove and add the parsley and lemon zest.","Cook the pasta in boiling salted water to packet instructions, about 9 mins. Heat the sauce and just before the pasta is ready, stir in the prawns so that they cook through. Drain the pasta and mix with the sauce, then sprinkle with the crumbs."]','2026-01-10 12:20:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7639,7639,'en','Strawberry panna cotta','Serve this creamy set Italian dessert with a top layer of fresh strawberry sauce and our homemade salted almond snaps on the side','["3 gelatine leaves","450ml double cream","200ml whole milk","100g white caster sugar","1 vanilla pod","400g strawberries, hulled and halved, or quartered if very large","1½  tsp cornflour","50g white caster sugar"]','["For the panna cotta, put the gelatine leaves in a small bowl of cold water to soften – this will take about 5 mins. Meanwhile, pour the cream, milk and sugar into a pan, split the vanilla pod, scrape out the seeds and add, along with the pod, to the cream mixture. Heat gently until hot, but not bubbling. Remove the gelatine leaves from the water, squeeze out any excess liquid then add, one at a time, to the hot cream. Stir until dissolved. Leave to stand for 20-30 mins until cooled – the vanilla pods should be suspended in the liquid by this point. Strain the mixture through a sieve into 6 serving glasses, then chill for at least 3 hrs.","Toss the strawberries with the cornflour and sugar in a saucepan. Place over a medium heat and cook for 4-5 mins, until the released juices thicken and the strawberries soften. Set aside to cool. Once completely cooled, top the set panna cottas with the strawberry mixture. Chill until ready to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7641,7641,'en','Aubergine & chilli tagliolini','Taglioni is a thin, flat ribbon pasta, similar to tagliatelle. If you can’t find it, use linguine for this vegetarian pasta dish instead','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 large aubergine, cut into bite-sized cubes","1 small onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 tsp dried oregano","400g fresh tomatoes, roughly chopped, or 400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","400g dried taglioni pasta or linguine","small bunch basil, roughly chopped","50g pecorino, grated, or vegetarian alternative"]','["Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan and cook the aubergine for 5 mins until starting to brown and soften.","Add the onion, garlic, chilli and oregano, and cook for just a few mins. Add the tomatoes, balsamic vinegar and about 200ml water, then reduce heat and simmer gently for about 20 mins, until the tomatoes are reduced and really softened, and the sauce is thickened.","Meanwhile, bring a large pan of water to the boil and cook the tagliolini following pack instructions. Drain the pasta and return to the pan. Add the sauce and toss well into the pasta with the basil. Serve with the grated pecorino."]','2026-01-10 12:20:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7643,7643,'en','Beefy melanzane parmigiana','Try a meaty take on the traditional Italian aubergine bake by adding rich beef ragu. Top with mascarpone, mozzarella and Parmesan cheese','["2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for brushing","800g beef mince","3 garlic cloves, crushed","3 thyme sprigs","3 rosemary sprigs","3 bay leaves","2 x 400g cans chopped tomato","glass of red wine","1 beef stock cube","1 tbsp sugar","5 aubergines, sliced lengthways into 5mm slices","2 x 125g balls mozzarella, torn into small chunks","50g Parmesan, grated","250g tub mascarpone"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan or flameproof casserole dish. Add the mince and brown over a high heat, breaking up with a wooden spoon as you go. (You may need to do this in batches.) Once well browned, tip onto a plate.","Add the remaining oil, the garlic and herbs to the pan and gently cook for 1 min. Tip in the tomatoes and red wine, and bring to a simmer, stirring up any meaty bits stuck to the bottom of the pan. Return the mince to the pan, crumble in the stock cube, and add sugar and seasoning. Gently simmer for at least 1 hr, stirring occasionally, splashing in more water to keep it saucy if you need to. If you have time to simmer for longer, go for it – the longer the better. Fish out the herb stalks and bay leaves.","Meanwhile, heat a griddle or frying pan. Brush the aubergine slices on both sides with olive oil, then griddle in batches. You want each slice softened and slightly charred, so don’t have the heat too high or the aubergine will char before softening. Remove to a plate as you go.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Set aside some of each cheese to go on the top. In a large baking dish spread a spoonful of mince sauce over the base then top with a layer of aubergines and season well. Spoon over some more mince sauce, then scatter over some mozzarella, Parmesan and blobs of mascarpone. Add another layer of aubergines and some seasoning. Repeat, layering everything up and finish with a layer of meat sauce. Top with your reserved cheese and bake for 30-40 mins until the top is crisp and golden and mince bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:20:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7645,7645,'en','Creamy polenta & mushroom ragout','Parmesan polenta topped with a rich mushroom mix and melting Taleggio cheese makes for a vegetarian main with a difference','["small handful dried porcini mushrooms","25g butter","1 shallot, finely sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","5 thyme sprigs, leaves picked","500g large field mushrooms, sliced","200g chestnut mushrooms, sliced","small glass of red wine","125ml vegetable stock","100g taleggio cheese (or vegetarian alternative), sliced","500ml milk","1 bay leaf","3 thyme sprigs","250g instant polenta","50g butter","75g Parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), grated"]','["Soak the dried mushrooms in 150ml warm water. Set aside for 20 mins, then drain and squeeze, reserving the soaking liquid. Heat the butter in a large frying pan. When sizzling, add the shallot and cook for a few mins until soft. Add the garlic and thyme leaves, cook for 1 min more, then turn up the heat and add the soaked mushrooms. After 1 min, add all the other mushrooms and fry over a very high heat for 5 mins until soft. Splash in the red wine and boil rapidly for 1 min. Pour in the stock and reserved mushroom liquid, and simmer for 15 mins until you have a thickened stew. Turn off the heat.","For the polenta, bring the milk to the boil with 500ml water, the bay and thyme. Turn off the heat and leave to infuse for 20 mins, then fish out the herbs and bring back to the boil. Add the polenta in a steady stream, whisking steadily. Cook for 1 min until thickened, then stir in the butter and Parmesan. Spoon a ‘crater’ of polenta onto a baking tray and fill with the ragout. Top with slices of Taleggio, place under a hot grill until melting and oozy, then let everyone help themselves."]','2026-01-10 12:20:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7646,7647,'en','Orecchiette with anchovies & purple sprouting broccoli','This humble southern Italian dish spiked with chilli and lemon juice is topped with fried breadcrumbs for added crunch','["200g orecchiette","4 tbsp olive oil","6 anchovy fillets in oil, chopped (reserve 1 tbsp oil)","4 fat garlic cloves, thinly sliced","1 red chilli, thinly sliced","zest 1 lemon, plus juice ½","50g fresh breadcrumbs","200g purple sprouting broccoli"]','["Cook the orecchiette following pack instructions. Meanwhile, heat 3 tbsp of the olive oil and 1 tbsp of the oil from the anchovies in a frying pan. Add the garlic and chilli, and sizzle for 3-4 mins until the garlic is just starting to turn golden. Add the anchovies and lemon juice, and cook for 1-2 mins more until the anchovies melt into the sauce. Put the remaining olive oil, breadcrumbs and lemon zest in another frying pan, stir together and cook until crisp.","When the pasta has 4-5 mins to go, add the broccoli to the pan. When cooked, drain, reserving a cup of the pasta water, then add to the frying pan with the garlic and anchovies. Stir and cook over a low heat for a further 2 mins, adding a splash of pasta water if it looks dry. Season, then serve in pasta bowls with the lemony crumbs sprinkled over the top."]','2026-01-10 12:20:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7648,7648,'en','Baked conchiglioni with sausage, sage & butternut squash','Melting fontina cheese, rich truffle oil and a creamy squash and Parmesan sauce turn these stuffed pasta shells into an indulgent dinner','["1 small butternut squash, peeled, seeds discarded, flesh chopped into small cubes","2 tsp olive oil","small pack sage, leaves picked and roughly chopped","8 good-quality sausages","good grating nutmeg, about ¼ of a whole one","350g conchiglioni, see below","50g butter","50g plain flour","850ml milk","50g Parmesan, grated, plus extra for sprinkling","100g fontina, grated, or 125g ball mozzarella, chopped","drizzle of truffle oil"]','["Place the squash in a microwavable bowl with 1 tbsp water. Cook in the microwave on High for 10 mins or until soft. Meanwhile, heat the oil in a frying pan, add the sage leaves and sizzle for 1 min. Remove the sausages from their skins and divide into small balls about the size of unshelled hazelnuts. Add to the pan and fry until browned. Add half the squash and set aside. Mash the remaining squash with any liquid from the bowl, the nutmeg and seasoning.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Cook the pasta following pack instructions. Meanwhile, melt the butter in a saucepan, then add the flour and stir to a paste. Cook for 1-2 mins, stirring the whole time, then gradually mix in the milk until you have a smooth sauce. Add the mashed squash, Parmesan and plenty of seasoning. Add 3-4 tbsp of the sauce to the sausage mix to moisten it a little.","Spread the remaining squash sauce over the base of a large, shallow baking dish. Drain the pasta, but keep a little liquid in the pan to stop the shells from sticking together. Fish any broken bits of pasta out of the pan and scatter these over the sauce. Line up the shells on top, pushing them down into the sauce so only the tops of the shells are poking out. Fill each shell with the sausage mixture. Scatter with fontina or mozzarella, grate over some extra Parmesan and drizzle with a little truffle oil, if you like. Bake for 30 mins or until golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:20:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7651,7650,'en','Venetian duck ragu','Cinnamon adds complexity to this slow-cooked pasta sauce, which goes perfectly with large tubular paccheri pasta, or ribbons of pappardelle','["1 tbsp olive oil","4 duck legs","2 onions, finely chopped","2 fat garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tsp plain flour","250ml red wine","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 chicken stock cube, made up to 250ml","3 rosemary sprigs, leaves picked and chopped","2 bay leaves","1 tsp sugar","2 tbsp milk","600g paccheri or pappardelle pasta","Parmesan, grated, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Add the duck legs and brown on all sides for about 10 mins. Remove to a plate and set aside. Add the onions to the pan and cook for 5 mins until softened. Add the garlic and cook for a further 1 min, then stir in the cinnamon and flour and cook for a further min. Return the duck to the pan, add the wine, tomatoes, stock, herbs, sugar and seasoning. Bring to a simmer, then lower the heat, cover with a lid and cook for 2 hrs, stirring every now and then.","Carefully lift the duck legs out of the sauce and place on a plate – they will be very tender so try not to lose any of the meat. Pull off and discard the fat, then shred the meat with 2 forks and discard the bones. Add the meat back to the sauce with the milk and simmer, uncovered, for a further 10-15 mins while you cook the pasta.","Cook the pasta following pack instructions, then drain, reserving a cup of the pasta water, and add the pasta to the ragu. Stir to coat all the pasta in the sauce and cook for 1 min more, adding a splash of cooking liquid if it looks dry. Serve with grated Parmesan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7653,7653,'en','Italian sausage & chestnut pasta','A mix of sausagemeat and chestnut chunks creates a rich and nutty pasta sauce, lifting this from an everyday dish to something special','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","450g pack Lincolnshire sausages, meat squeezed out","200g vacuum-packed chestnuts from a can or jar, very roughly chopped (see tip, below)","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tsp chopped rosemary","1 tsp fennel seed","1 glass full-bodied red wine","500g carton passata","500g large pasta shells or pappardelle","small pack curly parsley, finely chopped","Parmesan or Grana Padano, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan, and\r\nfry the onion for 5 mins. Once starting\r\nto soften, add the sausagemeat and\r\nchestnuts, and fry for another 10-12 mins,\r\nbreaking the meat up with a wooden\r\nspatula or spoon as you fry it. Keep the\r\nheat quite high and stir often.","When the meat and chestnuts are\r\ngolden brown, add the garlic, rosemary\r\nand fennel seeds, and cook for 2 mins\r\nmore. Splash in the wine, let most of it\r\nboil away, then tip in the passata. Cover\r\nand simmer the sauce for 10 mins while\r\nyou boil the pasta in plenty of salted\r\nwater, following pack instructions.","Reserve a cup of the pasta cooking\r\nwater, then drain the pasta well. Toss\r\nthe pasta, 3 tbsp of the water, the ragu\r\nand most of the parsley together, then\r\nseason to taste. Share between bowls,\r\nadd a grinding of black pepper, the\r\nremaining parsley, then a handful of\r\nParmesan shavings."]','2026-01-10 12:20:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7655,7655,'en','Shaved pear, cheese & bresaola salad','A rustic salad with cured beef, blue cheese and chicory teamed sweet pears, and dressed in a red wine vinaigrette','["100g walnut halves","2 crisp pears, blushing pink if possible","2 heads red chicory or radicchio, broken into leaves","100g bresaola (thinly sliced, cured beef)","140g dolcelatte or your favourite local soft blue cheese, sliced","1 tbsp virgin olive or rapeseed oil","2 tbsp red wine or port","2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","1 tbsp golden caster sugar"]','["Toast the nuts and make the dressing\r\nfirst as they will need to cool. Heat\r\noven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the\r\nwalnuts onto a baking tray and toast for\r\n5 mins or until dark golden. Cool. Put the\r\nwine or Port in a small saucepan with\r\nthe vinegar and sugar. Boil for 3 mins\r\nor until slightly syrupy (it will thicken as\r\nit cools, so don’t get carried away), then\r\ntake off the heat and set aside.","When ready to serve, shave thin slices\r\nfrom the pears using a large sharp knife,\r\nmandolin or potato peeler. Mingle them\r\ntogether with the leaves, bresaola,\r\ncheese and nuts on a large platter.\r\nSeason the dressing, then drizzle over\r\nthe salad, followed by the oil. Enjoy\r\nstraight away."]','2026-01-10 12:20:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7657,7657,'en','Margherita risotto balls','These deep-fried, arancini patties, made with tomato arborio rice, have moreish melting mozzarella cheese middles.','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","500ml passata","850ml vegetable stock","1 garlic clove, crushed","300g arborio rice","small glass of white wine","25g Parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), grated","knob of butter","3 tbsp roughly chopped basil","125g ball mozzarella, cut into 12 pieces","75g seasoned flour","2 eggs, beaten","125g pack dried breadcrumbs","1½ l oil, for deep-frying","rocket, to serve"]','["Heat the olive oil in a heavy-based\r\nsaucepan. Add the onion, cover and sweat\r\nuntil soft. In another pan, mix the passata\r\nand stock, and warm over a low heat.","Add the garlic to the onion, cook for\r\n30 secs, then tip in the rice and stir to\r\ncoat in the oil. Increase the heat, pour in\r\nthe wine and let it simmer until absorbed.\r\nKeeping the pan over a medium heat,\r\nstart adding the tomato stock mixture\r\nto the rice a ladleful at a time, letting the\r\nrice absorb most of the liquid after each\r\naddition. Keep stirring as you go, adding\r\nliquid until the rice is al dente – you may\r\nnot need all the liquid. You don’t want\r\nthis to be as wet as a normal risotto,\r\nso keep cooking until your wooden\r\nspoon can stand up in it. Turn off the\r\nheat, stir through the Parmesan,\r\nbutter and basil, then cover for 5 mins.\r\nSeason and tip onto a tray to cool\r\ncompletely, then chill until firm.","Shape the risotto into 12 large balls.\r\nMake a hole in the centre with your finger\r\nand stuff in a piece of mozzarella, then\r\nreshape into a ball. Now start a little\r\nproduction line, dipping the balls in the\r\nflour, then the egg and coating with the\r\nbreadcrumbs – then chill for 30 mins.","Heat the oil to 160C in a large deep\r\nsaucepan and heat the oven to 180C/160 fan/gas 4. Deep-fry the risotto balls\r\nfor 8-10 mins – you’ll need to do this in\r\nbatches. Drain on kitchen paper, then\r\ntransfer to a tray and pop in the oven for\r\n6-8 mins to make sure the mozzarella is\r\ncompletely melted. Sprinkle with salt,\r\nthen leave to cool for a few moments\r\nbefore tucking in. Serve with some\r\ndressed rocket."]','2026-01-10 12:20:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7659,7659,'en','Pizza Margherita in 4 easy steps','Even a novice cook can master the art of pizza with our simple step-by-step guide. Bellissimo','["300g strong bread flour","1 tsp instant yeast (from a sachet or a tub)","1 tsp salt","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","100ml passata","handful fresh basil or 1 tsp dried","1 garlic clove, crushed","125g ball mozzarella, sliced","handful grated or shaved parmesan","handful cherry tomatoes, halved","handful basil leaves (optional)"]','["Make the base: Put the flour into a large bowl, then stir in the yeast and salt. Make a well, pour in 200ml warm water and the olive oil and bring together with a wooden spoon until you have a soft, fairly wet dough. Turn onto a lightly floured surface and knead for 5 mins until smooth. Cover with a tea towel and set aside. You can leave the dough to rise if you like, but it’s not essential for a thin crust.","Make the sauce:  Mix the passata, basil and crushed garlic together, then season to taste. Leave to stand at\r\nroom temperature while you get on with shaping the base.","Roll out the dough: If you’ve let the dough rise, give it a quick knead, then split into two balls. On a floured surface, roll out the dough into large rounds, about 25cm across, using a rolling pin. The dough needs to be very thin as it will rise in the oven. Lift the rounds onto two floured baking sheets.","Top and bake: Heat oven to 240C/fan 220C /gas 8. Put another baking sheet or an upturned baking tray in the oven\r\non the top shelf. Smooth sauce over bases with the back of a spoon. Scatter with cheese and tomatoes, drizzle with olive oil and season. Put one pizza, still on its baking sheet, on top of the preheated sheet or tray. Bake for 8-10 mins until\r\ncrisp. Serve with a little more olive oil, and basil leaves if using. Repeat step for remaining pizza."]','2026-01-10 12:20:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7661,7661,'en','Fig & prosciutto pizzettas','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyImpress when entertaining with these mini pizzas topped with creamy mozzarella, sweet fruit and salty Italian ham','["knob of butter","3 shallots, finely diced","250g full-fat crème fraîche","50g parmesan, finely grated","4 ripe figs, cut into chunks","125g ball good-quality buffalo mozzarella, roughly torn","2 handfuls rocket","6 slices prosciutto, torn into strips","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","2 tbsp good balsamic vinegar","400g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp salt","4 tbsp olive oil"]','["To make the dough, mix the flour,\r\nyeast and salt in a bowl. Measure\r\n250ml hand-warm water into a jug, add\r\nthe oil, then tip into the flour mixture. Mix\r\ntogether with a wooden spoon, followed\r\nby your hands, to make a wet dough –\r\nadd a splash more warm water if needed.\r\nCover with oiled cling film and leave\r\nsomewhere warm-ish to rise for 1 hr\r\nor until doubled in size. Heat the butter,\r\nthen soften the shallots and set aside.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nTip the dough onto a floured surface,\r\nknead briefly to smooth, then divide into\r\n6-8 balls. Roll out each to a thin circle,\r\nthen arrange on flour-dusted baking\r\nsheets. Mix the crème fraîche, Parmesan\r\nand shallots with a little salt and lots\r\nof black pepper. Spread over the dough and bake for\r\n10-15 mins until crisp at the edges\r\nand slightly puffed up.","Toss the figs and mozzarella with the\r\nrocket. Sprinkle over the pizzettas with\r\nthe prosciutto. Mix the oil and vinegar,\r\ndrizzle over the pizzettas and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7663,7663,'en','Sweet potato & goat’s cheese ravioli','Fresh pasta is incredibly satisfying to make and far easier than you may think','["2 sweet potatoes","2 tbsp pumpkin seeds, plus extra to serve","125g crumbled goat''s cheese","semolina, for dusting","chilli oil, grated parmesan, to serve","300g ''00'' pasta flour, plus extra for kneading and dusting","3 large eggs"]','["For the filling, bake, steam or microwave the\r\npotatoes, then roughly mash. Mix with\r\nthe pumpkin seeds and goat’s cheese.","For the pasta, place the flour and a pinch of salt in\r\na food processor and crack in the eggs.\r\nPulse until mixture forms sticky-looking\r\ncrumbs. Turn the mixture out onto a\r\nlightly floured surface and bring together\r\nto form a firm dough. Knead for 5 mins\r\nuntil the dough feels smooth, wrap in cling\r\nfilm and chill for 30 mins. To make by hand,\r\nshape flour into a ‘ring’ on a work surface,\r\ncrack eggs into the middle, then gradually\r\nwork the flour into eggs using your fingers.","Cut the pasta into quarters, then roll\r\nout each piece using a pasta machine.\r\nDust with flour as you go and move it\r\ndown a notch onto a thinner setting\r\nevery second roll. Continue until you get\r\nto the penultimate setting. If you like your\r\npasta very thin and delicate, you can go\r\nfor the thinnest setting. If you don’t have\r\na machine, use a heavy rolling pin to roll\r\nthe dough as thinly as possible.","Stamp out rounds using a ravioli cutter or\r\na 6cm biscuit cutter – work quickly so\r\nthe pasta doesn’t dry out. Lay the circles\r\non a semolina-dusted surface and cover\r\nwith cling film as you cut the rest.","Place a small tsp of filling in the centre\r\nof each round. Dampen the edges\r\nwith water, then sandwich another round\r\non top. Use your fingertips to seal the\r\nedges, trying to expel all the air as you go.\r\nLay the ravioli on a semolina-dusted\r\ntea towel to dry for a few mins.","Cook ravioli in a large pan of gently\r\nboiling salted water for 4-5 mins. Do not\r\nuse a full rolling boil as it is likely to make\r\nravioli split. Drain, and serve with a little\r\nchilli oil, Parmesan and pumpkin seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:20:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7665,7665,'en','Tiramisu ice-cream cake','Treat your guests with this stunning summer dessert, perfect for al fresco dinner parties','["2 x 250g tubs mascarpone","115g caster sugar","6 tbsp marsala","50g dark chocolate, chopped","142ml tub double cream, lightly whipped","5 tbsp fresh ground coffee","85g caster sugar","3 tbsp brandy","200g bag Italian sponge fingers, we used Savoiardi Boudoir biscuits","cocoa, for dusting","142ml tub double cream, lightly whipped","chocolate shavings or curls"]','["Line a 1kg loaf tin with cling film. Beat the mascarpone, sugar and marsala together \r\nthen fold in the chocolate and cream.","Make up the coffee with 600ml boiling water, leave for 5 mins then strain into a \r\nbowl and stir in the sugar and brandy.","Reserve 2 biscuits then quickly dip the remainder as you use them into the coffee \r\nmixture and line them along the base and up the long sides of the tin (they will stand \r\nabove the rim).","Spoon in half the creamy mixture. Dip the last biscuits into the coffee and place on top end to end. Spoon the remaining creamy mixture on top, then fold over  the sponge fingers above the rim and press lightly into the filling. Cover and freeze. To serve, turn out onto a plate, strip off  the cling film and dust generously with cocoa. Spoon the cream down the centre and decorate with the chocolate."]','2026-01-10 12:20:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7667,7667,'en','Chocolate, pistachio & nougat semi-freddo','This traditional Italian ice cream bar is the perfect solution for an effortless frozen, creamy dessert','["butter, for the tin","75g golden caster sugar","4 medium eggs","250g dark chocolate, finely chopped","450ml double cream","140g hard nougat or torrone, chopped into ½ cm chunks","50g pistachios, roughly chopped"]','["Butter and line a 900g/2lb loaf tin with\r\ncling film. Bring a pan of water to a gentle\r\nsimmer. Put the sugar and eggs in a\r\nheatproof bowl, then place over the\r\nsimmering water and whisk until pale,\r\nthick and doubled in volume. Remove\r\nfrom the heat, plunge the bottom of\r\nthe bowl into cold water and continue\r\nwhisking until the mixture is cool.","Melt the chocolate in the microwave on\r\nLow, stir, then fold into the egg mixture.\r\nWhip the cream to soft peaks and fold\r\ninto the chocolate egg mixture with the\r\nnougat and pistachios.","Pour the mixture into the loaf tin,\r\nsmooth the surface with a spoon, then\r\ncover and freeze until firm. This can be\r\ndone up to 2 weeks ahead. To serve,\r\nturn out onto a serving dish, remove\r\nthe cling film and leave in the fridge for\r\n15 mins to soften slightly before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:20:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7669,7669,'en','Rabbit cacciatore','‘Cacciatore’ means hunter in Italian and, although we now think of it as a chicken dish, it is a particularly good way to cook rabbit','["900g/2lb rabbit pieces","2 tbsp flour seasoned with salt and pepper","3 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, chopped","3 garlic cloves, chopped","large bunch parsley, chopped","300ml white wine","2 x 400g/14oz cans cherry tomatoes","about 20 large green olives","1 tbsp sugar"]','["Toss the rabbit in the flour. Heat 1 tbsp\r\nolive oil in a large, shallow pan and brown\r\nthe rabbit in 3 batches, adding another\r\ntbsp oil for each batch. Lift out all the\r\nrabbit onto a plate and set aside. Add\r\nthe onions and garlic to the pan with the\r\nremaining oil, then gently cook for 15 mins\r\nuntil softened. Add most of the parsley\r\nand cook for a few mins more. Return the\r\nrabbit to the pan and pour in the wine.\r\nTurn up the heat and bubble the wine\r\nuntil half-reduced, then stir in the cherry\r\ntomatoes. If the rabbit isn’t completely\r\ncovered, add a splash of water.","Cover the pan and simmer for 40 mins\r\nuntil the rabbit is tender – the timing can\r\nvary, but if it’s still tough just continue to\r\ncook, adding more water if needed, and\r\nthe meat will eventually start to come\r\naway from the bone. When the meat is\r\nready, throw in the olives, cover and\r\nsimmer for 5-10 mins more. Season with\r\nsugar, salt and pepper, then scatter\r\nwith the remaining parsley to serve.\r\nServe with polenta, mash or a buttery,\r\nflat pasta, such as tagliatelle"]','2026-01-10 12:20:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7671,7671,'en','Italian vegetable soup','Warm up your week with this good-for-you vegetable soup that’s easy to freeze ahead','["2 each of onions and carrots, chopped","4 sticks celery, chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp sugar","4 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 bay leaves","few sprigs thyme","3 courgettes, chopped","400g can butter beans, drained","400g can chopped tomatoes","1.2l vegetable stock","100g parmesan or vegetarian equivalent, grated","140g small pasta shapes","small bunch basil, shredded"]','["Gently cook the onion, carrots and\r\ncelery in the oil in a large saucepan for\r\n20 mins, until soft. Splash in water if they\r\nstick. Add the sugar, garlic, purée, herbs\r\nand courgettes and cook for 4-5 mins on\r\na medium heat until they brown a little.","Pour in the beans, tomatoes and stock,\r\nthen simmer for 20 mins. If you’re freezing\r\nit, cool and do so now (freeze for up to three months). If not, add half the\r\nParmesan and the pasta and simmer for\r\n6-8 mins until pasta cooked. Sprinkle with\r\nbasil and remaining Parmesan to serve.\r\nIf frozen, defrost then re-heat before\r\nadding pasta and cheese and continuing\r\nas above."]','2026-01-10 12:20:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7673,7673,'en','Plum & amaretti semifreddo','A ripple of sweet plum purée and chunks of almond biscuit turn this Italian ice cream into an all-in-one dessert','["450g ripe purple plums, halved and stoned","350g caster sugar","2 large egg whites","300ml double cream","1 tbsp Disaronno liqueur","85g soft amaretti biscuits, roughly broken up"]','["Line a 30 x 20cm tray with cling film.\r\nPut the plums in a pan with 2 tbsp water\r\nand 110g of the sugar. Cover with a lid and\r\nstew over a medium heat for 10 mins\r\nuntil soft. Allow to cool slightly, then blitz\r\nwith a hand blender. Pass through a sieve\r\nto remove the plum skins. Allow to cool.","Put the remaining sugar in a pan with\r\n150ml water, and dissolve over a low\r\nheat. Boil for 5 mins or until the mixture\r\nreaches 120C on a cooking thermometer.","To make the meringue base, whisk\r\nthe egg whites until stiff. With the\r\nbeaters running, carefully pour the\r\nsugar mixture onto the egg white,\r\nwhisking until thick. In another bowl,\r\nsoftly whip the cream, then gently fold\r\nin the liqueur, plum pulp, biscuits and\r\nthe meringue. Pour into the tin, cover\r\nwith cling film and freeze for a few hrs\r\nuntil set. To serve, remove from the\r\nfreezer 5 mins before scooping into balls."]','2026-01-10 12:20:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7675,7675,'en','Italian cottage pie','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyAdd a little ''mamma mia'' to a beef stew with pancetta and oregano, and a crunchy topping of Parmesan-coated potatoes','["700g floury potatoes, sliced","25g butter","50g grated parmesan","140g pancetta or streaky bacon, cut into strips","2 oregano sprigs, leaves stripped, or 2 tsp dried oregano","½ quantity beef with red wine & carrots (see ''Goes well with'')"]','["First make the Beef with red wine & carrots (see ''Goes well with''). You will need half the finished stew for this recipe.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nCook the potatoes in boiling, salted\r\nwater for 10 mins until almost done.\r\nDrain well, then mix with the butter\r\nand half the Parmesan.","In a large saucepan, fry the pancetta\r\nor bacon until golden. Stir in the fresh\r\noregano leaves or dried oregano, then\r\nadd the beef stew and heat through. Tip\r\ninto an ovenproof dish and top with the\r\ncheesy potatoes, overlapping. Sprinkle\r\nwith the remaining Parmesan and bake\r\nfor 20 mins until golden and crisp on top.\r\nServe with a green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7677,7677,'en','Italian butter beans','This healthy side dish gives Mediterranean flavour to grilled chicken or chops','["1 tbsp olive oil","4 garlic cloves, crushed","400g tin chopped tomatoes","2 tsp sugar","2 x 400g tins butter beans, rinsed and drained","small bunch basil, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a medium saucepan.\r\nFry the garlic for 1 min, then add the\r\ntomatoes, sugar and some seasoning.\r\nTip in the beans and a splash of water.\r\nCover and simmer for 5 mins, then stir\r\nin the basil and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7679,7679,'en','Aubergine rolls with spinach & ricotta','This spin on Italian ‘melanzane alla Parmigiana’ is quick to prepare and makes a deliciously creamy, veggie bake','["2 aubergines, cut into thin slices lengthways","2 tbsp olive oil","500g spinach","250g tub ricotta","grating of nutmeg","350g jar tomato sauce","4 tbsp fresh breadcrumbs","4 tbsp parmesan (or vegetarian alternative)"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Brush\r\nboth sides of the aubergine slices with\r\noil, then lay on a large baking sheet. Bake\r\nfor 15-20 mins until tender, turning once.","Meanwhile, put the spinach in a large\r\ncolander and pour over a kettle of boiling\r\nwater to wilt. Cool, then squeeze out the\r\nexcess water, so that it is dry. Mix with the\r\nricotta, nutmeg and plenty of seasoning.","Dollop a spoonful of the cheesy spinach\r\nmix in the centre of each aubergine\r\nslice, fold over to make a parcel and lay,\r\nsealed-side down, in an ovenproof dish.\r\nPour over tomato sauce, sprinkle with\r\nbreadcrumbs and cheese, and bake for\r\n20-25 mins until golden and piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:20:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7681,7681,'en','Lamb tagliata with watercress & tomatoes','Traditionally this Italian dish uses thinly sliced beef, rocket and Parmesan, but this version is given a simple twist with British seasonal produce','["handful fresh rosemary, needles chopped","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","4 thick British boneless lamb leg steaks or steaks cut from lamb rumps (about 450g/1lb in total)","250g British baby plum tomatoes","1 tbsp redcurrant jelly","2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","2 tbsp capers, drained and rinsed","100g bag British watercress, thick stems removed","100g feta cheese, crumbled","good crusty bread, to serve"]','["Rub the rosemary and 1 tbsp of the\r\noil over the lamb, and leave to marinate\r\nfor 30 mins at room temperature.","Heat a frying pan until very hot. Wipe\r\nmost of the rosemary from the lamb,\r\nthen season the steaks with plenty\r\nof flaky salt and freshly ground black\r\npepper. Add the steaks and the\r\ntomatoes to the pan. Sear the meat for\r\n2 mins on one side until golden, then\r\nturn and cook for 2 mins more. This will\r\ngive pink lamb. Transfer the meat and\r\ntomatoes to a plate and leave to rest.","Take the pan from the heat. Spoon in\r\nthe redcurrant jelly, pour in the vinegar\r\nand remaining oil, then whisk to make\r\na warm dressing. Add the capers, plus\r\nany juices from the lamb plate.","Slice the lamb thickly on an angle.\r\nSpread over a large platter with the\r\nwatercress and tomatoes, then finish\r\nwith a crumbling of cheese. Spoon over\r\nthe warm dressing and enjoy straight\r\naway with crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:20:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7683,7683,'en','Rustic bread','This is a traditional Sicilian bread that you can make in the morning to get ahead','["250g strong white bread flour","1 tsp fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","200ml sparkling water","semolina, for sprinkling (optional)","finely chopped rosemary and Maldon salt, for sprinklng"]','["Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Mix together the flour, yeast and 1/2 tsp salt. Add the oil, then pour in the water gradually, adding enough to make a soft dough. Knead the dough on a lightly floured surface for about 4-5 mins until the dough feels strong, bouncy and has a silky feel to it.","Cut the dough into 8 pieces, then roll out into rough rounds about 16-17cm in diameter. (Don’t pile them on top of each other or they will stick together.)","Sprinkle a baking sheet or two with semolina if you have it, otherwise leave plain. Lay the breads on the sheets and let them sit for 5 mins, then scatter with rosemary, salt and pepper and drizzle with olive oil. Bake in batches for 8-10 mins until puffy and golden. Can be made 3-4 hrs ahead."]','2026-01-10 12:20:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7685,7685,'en','Blackberry zabaglione','Italian zabaglione is lovely rippled with a few crushed berries for a quick, outstanding dessert','["400g blackberries","140g golden caster sugar","6 egg yolks","1 vanilla pod","3 tbsp marsala or sweet wine"]','["In a bowl, lightly crush the berries with\r\n25g of the sugar. Add a spoonful to the\r\nbottom of 6 small glasses, then set the\r\nrest of the berry mixture aside.","Bring some water to a gentle simmer in\r\na medium-size saucepan and tip the egg\r\nyolks into a large heatproof bowl. Halve\r\nand scrape the seeds from the vanilla\r\npod into the egg yolks and add the\r\nremaining sugar. Using an electric whisk,\r\nbeat until light and airy. Splash in the\r\nMarsala, place the bowl over the pan of\r\nsimmering water, then whisk your heart\r\nout for 10-12 mins until the egg yolks are\r\nthick and foamy and the whisk leaves a\r\ndefined trail. Drain off some of the juice,\r\nthen ripple the remaining berries through\r\nthe mousse and spoon into the glasses."]','2026-01-10 12:20:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7687,7687,'en','Affogato al caffè (Vanilla ice cream & coffee)','This heavenly combination is so simple – yet impressive','["12 scoops good-quality vanilla ice cream","6 shots hot espresso coffee"]','["Several hours in advance, lay ice cream on\r\na freezer-proof tray and put the tray\r\nback in the freezer.","To serve, put balls of ice cream into\r\n6 small glasses or bowls, and pour a\r\nshot of hot espresso coffee over\r\neach. Serve straight away, stirring the\r\nvanilla ice cream into the hot coffee\r\nso that it melts a little."]','2026-01-10 12:20:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7689,7689,'en','Apricot & ratafia sponge cake','A simple fruit cake flavoured with almond and Amaretti biscuits – perfect with tea or as dessert served with cream or custard','["200g softened butter, plus extra for the tin","200g caster sugar","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","4 large eggs","½-1 tsp almond essence (optional)","410g can apricot halves in natural juice, drained, 100g roughly chopped, remainder halved","85g ratafia or amaretti biscuits (keep ratafias whole or break the amaretti)","25g flaked almonds"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nButter the base and sides of a 22cm\r\nloose-bottom cake tin and line with\r\nbaking parchment.","Put the butter, sugar, flour and baking\r\npowder in a large bowl. Break in the\r\neggs, add the almond essence, if using,\r\nthen beat with an electric mixer until\r\nsmooth and creamy. Set aside a quarter\r\nof the mixture, then stir the chopped\r\napricots and 25g of the biscuits into the\r\nremainder. Spoon into the tin and lightly\r\nsmooth with the back of the spoon. Bake\r\nfor 25 mins until the cake is almost set.\r\nMeanwhile, stir the apricot halves,\r\nremaining biscuits and flaked almonds\r\ninto the reserved cake mixture until well\r\nmixed. Quickly dot the extra cake mixture\r\nonto the part-baked cake, then return to\r\nthe oven for 20 mins more or until a\r\nskewer inserted into the centre of the\r\ncake comes out clean."]','2026-01-10 12:20:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7690,7690,'en','Sugar-dusted vanilla shortbread','Great for keeping the biscuit tin topped up over Christmas, these sweet shortbread thins make a perfect treat','["1 quantity vanilla shortbread dough (see below)","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["With your hands, roll the\r\ndough on a lightly floured\r\nsurface into a sausage\r\nshape about 25cm/9in long\r\nand 5cm/2½in in diameter.\r\nWrap the roll and chill for at\r\nleast 1 hour. (The roll can be\r\nfrozen for up to 6 weeks. To\r\nuse, remove from the freezer\r\nand allow to thaw for one\r\nhour at room temperature so\r\nthat the dough is soft enough\r\nto be sliced into biscuits.)","Preheat the oven to\r\n180C/gas 4/fan 160C and lightly grease 2 large baking\r\nsheets. Using a sharp knife,\r\ncut the dough into slices,\r\neach a generous 5mm/¼in\r\nthick, then arrange them\r\non the greased baking\r\nsheets, spacing the biscuits\r\nslightly apart so they have\r\na bit of room to spread as\r\nthey cook.","Bake for 20 minutes until\r\nthe biscuits are just turning\r\npale golden around the\r\nedges, then transfer to a\r\nwire rack to cool. Dust\r\ngenerously with icing sugar.\r\nThe biscuits will keep fresh\r\nfor up to one week stored in\r\nan airtight tin."]','2026-01-10 12:20:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7691,7691,'en','Italian stuffed chicken','Chicken recipes are always among the most searched-for on bbcgoodfood.com, so the cookery team came up with this quick and easy supper dish specially','["2 tbsp chopped olives or sundried tomatoes - whatever you''ve got","1 garlic clove, crushed","½ tsp dried mixed herbs","200g tub full-fat soft cheese","4 plump boneless, skinless chicken breasts","4 ripe tomatoes, sliced","olive oil, for drizzling"]','["Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7.\r\nBeat the olives or sundried tomatoes,\r\ngarlic and almost all the herbs into the\r\ncheese, then season. Cut a slit along the\r\nside of each chicken breast, then use\r\nyour knife to open it out into a pocket.","Stuff each breast with a quarter of\r\nthe cheese mix, then press to close. Lift\r\nonto a greased baking tray. Season the\r\ntop of the chicken, then overlap tomato\r\nslices over the top of each piece of\r\nchicken. Season, then scatter with the\r\nremaining herbs. Drizzle with olive oil.","Roast for 20 mins until the chicken\r\nis golden around the edges and the\r\ntomatoes look a little shrivelled. Serve\r\nwith a green salad and crusty bread\r\nto mop up the juices."]','2026-01-10 12:20:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7693,7693,'en','Quick Japanese-style rice salad','Use up leftover rice to make a salad packed with prawns, edamame beans, radish, cucumber, avocado and spring onions, tossed in a mirin and ginger dressing','["250g cooked basmati rice","150g cooked peeled king prawns","¼ cucumber , diced","2 spring onions , chopped","50g edamame beans , defrosted if frozen","6 radishes , chopped","½ avocado , diced","black sesame seeds , to serve (optional)","2 tbsp rice vinegar","1 tbsp toasted sesame oil","1 tbsp mirin","1 tbsp pickled ginger"]','["Whisk the dressing ingredients together in a small bowl.","If using a pouch, heat the rice following pack instructions then tip into a bowl, break up and leave to cool until just warm. Alternatively use cold leftover rice. Fluff it up, then add half the dressing and toss.","Add the prawns and veg and toss again. Divide between two plates and spoon over the rest of the dressing. Sprinkle with black sesame seeds to garnish, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7695,7695,'en','Japanese-style chicken curry','Pair easy, comforting curry sauce with our tender, juicy brined chicken to make a Japanese-style chicken curry – serve with white rice and Japanese pickles','["1 prepared roast chicken (see recipe below)","1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 onions, thickly sliced","2 large garlic cloves, finely grated","25g ginger, peeled and grated","45g unsalted butter","30g plain flour","1 tbsp medium curry powder","½ tsp garam masala","850ml vegetable stock","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp honey","2 tsp rice wine vinegar","500g Maris Piper potatoes, cut into eighths","3 large carrots, sliced on the diagonal","cooked short-grain white rice","sliced spring onions","Japanese pickles (optional)"]','["For the sauce, heat the oil in a large flameproof casserole or pan over a medium heat and cook the onions for 10 mins until lightly golden. Mix in the garlic and ginger, and cook gently for a couple of minutes until fragrant. Add the butter and, once sizzling, stir in the flour, curry powder and garam masala. Cook for 3-4 mins until the mixture has darkened in colour. Gradually ladle in the stock, stirring well after each addition.","Bring to a gentle simmer and add the soy sauce, honey and vinegar. Stir in the potatoes and carrots, then cover and simmer for about 15-20 mins until the sauce has thickened and the vegetables are cooked. Season to taste, adding a splash more stock if it’s too thick. Slice the chicken and serve with the rice. Spoon over the sauce and scatter over the spring onions. Serve with Japanese pickles, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7697,7697,'en','Matcha mochi ice cream','Make vegan ice cream using tofu, coconut cream and matcha, then envelop it in soft mochi dough for this moreish sweet treat that hails from Japan','["300g organic silken soft tofu, drained","320g coconut cream","1 tsp vanilla paste","1 tsp arrowroot powder (optional)","60ml maple syrup","35g cornflour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp matcha powder","100g glutinous sweet white rice flour","80g caster sugar"]','["To make the ice-cream, put all of the ingredients in ablenderand blitz until smooth. Chill the mixture for at least 1 hr or overnight. Remove from the fridge, stir and pour into anice cream makerand churn for 45 mins, or until thick and frozen. Alternatively, pour into a freezable container and freeze for 90 mins. Remove from the freezer and whisk the mixture, freeze for a further 45 mins, then whisk the mixture again. Put it back into the freezer for another 30 mins. Repeat this 2-3 times more, freezing for 30 mins each time. Then, freeze for a final 2-3 hrs.","Remove the ice cream from the freezer to soften slightly, then use a 5cm-sized ice cream scoop to make 8 balls. Scoop them onto a tray lined with baking parchment, then freeze for at least 30 mins or overnight. If they are tricky to scoop, leave the ice cream for a few minutes to soften or use your hands to shape the balls.","Dust a 30 x 20cm baking tray with half the cornflour. Pour 200ml water into a 1-litre sized saucepan along with the matcha powder. Mix well, then add the rice flour and caster sugar and set over a medium heat. Use a whisk to break up any lumps, then switch to aspatulawhen it begins to thicken after 2-3 mins. Stir quickly for another 30 seconds until it begins to come together like a sticky ball of dough.","Transfer the dough to the prepared baking tray and carefully flatten out with the spatula. Once cool enough to touch, dust over the remaining cornflour and use your hands to flatten out to about the size of the tray. Leave it to cool down, cover and keep in the fridge for 30 mins.Will keep covered and chilled for up to three days.","Roll out the mochi dough on a dry chopping board dusted with a little extra cornflour until 5mm thick. Cut out 10cm circles using a cookie cutter or cup. Place a scoop of ice cream on top of a circle of dough, then carefully fold the dough around the ice cream, pinching at the top to seal, then turn over so that the top becomes the bottom. (This will be easier if you dust your hands with cornflour.) Repeat until all the ice cream and dough is used, then freezer for at least 2 hrs before serving.Will keep frozen for up to one month. Take the mochi out of the freezer and leave at room temperature for around 3-5 mins to soften, before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7699,7699,'en','Perfect sushi rice','Learn how to make perfect sushi rice with this simple step-by-step recipe. Make a batch and craft your own sushi selection platter for entertaining','["120ml rice vinegar or brown rice vinegar","3tbsp sugar","450g Japanese rice (3 Japanese cups)"]','["To make the rice, first wash it thoroughly in a sieve for 4 mins, gently turning it over by hand until the water runs clear. Drain the rice and put it in a pan with 540ml water.","Leave it to stand for a minimum of 30 mins. It can be left overnight, but for best results, leave it for 30 mins-1 hr. Leave the soaking water in the pan with the rice and bring to the boil, put the lid on, reduce the heat and simmer for 8 -9 mins. Turn the heat off and let it stand with the lid on for a further 5 mins. Do not lift the lid.","While the rice is cooking, to make the sushi-su, put the rice vinegar, sugar and 1 tbsp salt into a pan and leave on a low heat until the sugar and salt have dissolved. Be careful not to let it boil or the flavour will spoil. Remove from the heat and leave to cool.","Put the rice into a wide flat dish such as a sushi oke, a baking dish or a roasting tray. Pour the sushi-su over the rice and fold it carefully into the rice with a wooden spoon as it cools down, being careful not to damage the grains. You can use a fan or a hairdryer on the coolest setting to speed up the cooling process, directing it at the rice. The sushi-su gives the rice more flavour and that familiar sticky glazed look.","If you don’t want to use the rice immediately, cover it with a damp cloth so that it doesn’t dry out. Leave in a cool place, but do not refrigerate. The fridge will make the rice hard and dry, and the sushi-su helps to preserve the rice without refrigeration.Will keep for a day."]','2026-01-10 12:20:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7701,7701,'en','Sushi rice','Make sushi rice to accompany your favourite Japanese-inspired dishes, from bento boxes to sushi and katsu curry. The secret is in the ratio of rice to water','["1 cup sushi rice (about 220g)","sushi rice seasoning, to taste (optional)"]','["The most important thing to get right when cooking sushi rice is the ratio of rice to water. It’s better to use a volume measure rather than weighing. Use a cook’s 250ml measuring cup if you have one, or a short glass, teacup or small mug. Once you’ve made one batch, you’ll know how much cooked rice that measure makes – it should be about 2½ cups.","Measure out 1 cup rice into a saucepan, rinse the rice, swirling it around the pan, then drain off the water. Try not to lose any of the rice. Add 1½ cups water (about 375ml).","Bring the rice to a simmer quickly, put on a tight-fitting lid and reduce the heat to low. Cook for 13 mins – don’t take the lid off.","Check a couple of grains at the top – the rice should be just about cooked and the water evaporated. If not, continue to cook and check at 2 min intervals, each brand of rice will differ. Turn the heat off and leave the rice to stand with the lid on for 10 mins so all the moisture is absorbed. Add sushi rice seasoning, if you like, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7703,7703,'en','Vegan katsu curry','Enjoy a vegan version of katsu curry, with crispy, golden tofu. Serve with rice, fresh herbs and cucumber and carrot ribbons','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil or vegetable oil","200g cooked rice (we used basmati)","¼ large cucumber, peeled into ribbons","1 carrot, peeled into ribbons","handful of mint leaves or coriander leaves, or both","lime wedges, to serve","1 tbsp rapeseed oil or vegetable oil","1 onion, chopped","1 large carrot, chopped","1 large garlic clove, crushed","2cm piece ginger, peeled and grated or finely chopped","½ tbsp curry powder, mild or medium","¼ tsp ground turmeric","200ml coconut milk","2 tsp maple syrup (or honey if not cooking for vegans)","1 tbsp cornflour","280-300g block firm tofu","200g dried breadcrumbs, we used panko (gluten-free if necessary)"]','["First, make the curry sauce. Heat the oil in a pan and cook the onion and carrot until soft and starting to caramelise, about 8 mins. Add the garlic and ginger and sizzle for another minute or so, then stir in the curry powder and turmeric. Once the spices are warmed through, add the coconut milk, maple syrup and 100ml water. Season well, cover and simmer over a low heat for 20 mins, topping up with more water if it gets too thick.","Meanwhile, slice the tofu in half through the centre. Carefully cut each piece into four triangles. In a wide bowl, mix the cornflour with 3 tbsp water and some seasoning until combined. Put the breadcrumbs in a second bowl. Dip a tofu piece into the flour mixture, then the breadcrumbs, turning until well coated. If the crumbs are not sticking well make the cornflour mixture a little bit thicker and try again. Press firmly.","When the carrot in the curry sauce is soft, blitz using a stick or tabletop blender. If the sauce is too thick, add a little more water. Taste and add more salt, maple syrup or some lime juice, if you like. Keep warm.","Heat the oil in a frying pan and cook the tofu for 4-5 mins on each side until golden and hot through. To serve, put the rice in bowls and top with the curry sauce, crispy tofu, the cucumber and carrot ribbons, herbs and lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:20:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7705,7705,'en','Furikake devilled eggs','Try furikake – a Japanese seasoning – in this easy retro canapé with a hint of wasabi and pickled ginger. The seasoning is traditionally sprinkled on rice','["6 large eggs","2 spring onions, trimmed","2 tbsp kewpie mayonnaise (available in Sainsbury’s, Waitrose and online) or salad cream","2 tsp wasabi paste","½ tsp sesame oil","1 tbsp pickled sushi ginger, finely sliced, plus 1 tsp vinegar from the jar","3 tbsp furikake (available online), plus a pinch"]','["Bring a large pan of water to a simmer, then gently lower in the eggs. Simmer for 10 mins, then transfer to a bowl of iced water to cool. Meanwhile, finely slice the spring onions into long, thin strands, and add these to the ice water with the eggs. They will spiral and curl up in the cold.","Peel the eggs and cut them in half lengthways. Using a teaspoon, scoop the egg yolks into a bowl, and add the mayo, wasabi, sesame oil, vinegar from the ginger and some salt and pepper, and mash with a fork until smooth. For a smoother texture, blend using a stick blender until you get a pipeable mixture.","Put the furikake on a small plate and dip the egg halves, rounded-side down, into the seasoning so some sticks to the white of the egg. Pipe or spoon the egg yolk mix into the middles, then top with the pickled ginger. Pat the spring onion dry with kitchen paper, then use to decorate the eggs along with a pinch more furikake."]','2026-01-10 12:20:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7707,7707,'en','Miso soup','Make your own miso soup with soft cubes of tofu, crunchy curls of seaweed and aromatic spring onions. Enjoy it as a starter or as a snack','["5g dried wakame seaweed","1l dashi (shop bought or see tip)","200g fresh silken tofu, or firm if you prefer, cut into 1cm cubes","2 tbsp white miso paste","3 tbsp red miso paste","spring onion, finely chopped, to serve"]','["Put the wakame in a small bowl and cover with cold water, then leave it for 5 mins until the leaves have fully expanded.","Make the dashi (see tip below) or heat until it reaches a rolling boil. Add the tofu and cook for 1 min before adding the seaweed.","Reduce the heat. Put both types of miso in a ladle or strainer and dip it into the pot. Slowly loosen up the miso with a spoon inside the ladle or strainer; the paste will slowly melt into the dashi. Once all the miso is dissolved into the soup, turn off the heat immediately. Sprinkle with chopped spring onions to add colour and fragrance."]','2026-01-10 12:20:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7709,7709,'en','Next level chicken katsu curry','Make this Japanese-inspired dish of crunchy chicken and a rich, warmly spiced sauce. Our ultimate version is easy to make but packs plenty of flavour','["2 large chicken breasts","400ml milk","100g plain flour","2 eggs, beaten","150g panko breadcrumbs or coarse dried breadcrumbs","sprinkling shichimi togarashi or chilli power, plus extra to serve","splash of soy sauce","sunflower oil, for frying","50g butter","1 large carrot, chopped","1 onion, chopped","4 garlic cloves, chopped","large piece of ginger, chopped","2 tbsp mild curry powder","1 tbsp honey","1 tbsp ketchup","1 tbsp red or brown miso paste","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 chicken stock cube","shredded white cabbage, shredded nori, sesame seeds and cooked rice, to serve"]','["Cut each chicken breast in half lengthways, creating four fillets. Put each fillet between two sheets of baking parchment and beat with a rolling pin to even out the thickness.","Pour the milk into a bowl and season with a large pinch of salt, then add the chicken fillets. Cover and leave in the fridge for at least 20 mins or for up to 24 hrs (the longer you leave the chicken in the milk, the more succulent it will be).","When you’re ready to coat the chicken, tip the flour, eggs and breadcrumbs into three separate bowls, then season the flour with the togarashi and stir the soy sauce into the eggs. Scoop one chicken fillet out of the milk and coat in the flour mix, then dip into the egg mix and coat in the breadcrumbs. Set on a plate and repeat with the rest of the chicken fillets. Can be prepared up to a day ahead and frozen for up to a month.","To make the curry sauce, heat the butter in a saucepan and sizzle the carrot and onion for 5 mins, then add the garlic and ginger and cook for a few mins more. Scatter over the curry powder and cook for 1 min, then stir in the honey, ketchup, miso paste and soy sauce to create a sticky paste. Cook for 1 min more, then pour in 700ml boiling water and crumble in the stock cube. Cover and simmer for 20 mins until the carrot is soft. Tip the sauce into a blender and blitz until completely smooth (alternatively, use a hand blender). Season to taste. Can be made up to three days ahead and chilled or frozen for up to three months.","To cook the katsu, heat a good layer of oil in a large frying pan, then add as many of the chicken fillets as you can fit and fry for 3-4 mins on each side until deep golden and crisp. Transfer to a tray and keep warm in a low oven while you cook the remaining fillets.","Mix the cabbage and seaweed and sprinkle over some sesame seeds, if using. Top the katsu with the curry sauce and serve with the rice and salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7711,7711,'en','Katsu pork with sticky rice','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyBreadcrumb your pork fillet with panko, Japanese style, then serve with a sweet, spicy, light curry sauce and sushi rice','["200g short-grain or sushi rice, rinsed","100g panko breadcrumbs","1 tsp turmeric","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 egg white","450g pork fillet, trimmed and cut into 8 pieces","coriander sprigs, to garnish (optional)","pickled ginger, to serve (optional)","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, chopped","1 medium carrot, grated","2 eating apple, such as Braeburn, peeled, cored and roughly chopped","2 fat garlic clove, sliced","2 tsp medium curry powder","½  tsp ground ginger","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tsp clear honey","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp cornflour","350ml chicken stock","1 tsp sesame oil"]','["To make the sauce, heat the oil in a large pan and add the onion, carrot and apples. Cover and cook gently for 10 mins until softened, stirring a couple of times. Uncover the pan, turn up the heat, add the garlic and cook for 1 min.","Stir in the curry powder and ginger. Cook for 1 min more, then stir in the tomato purée, honey, soy and cornflour. Gradually stir in the stock and simmer for 5 mins until the vegetables are totally soft and the sauce has thickened. Blitz with a blender or in a liquidiser until smooth, then season to taste with the sesame oil, salt and pepper. The sauce can be made up to 3 days ahead.","While the sauce is cooking, put the pork between 2 sheets of cling film and bash with a rolling pin until the meat is about 1cm thick. In a shallow bowl, rub together the crumbs, turmeric and oil with some seasoning. Beat the egg white with a fork until a little frothy and have a non-stick baking tray ready.","Put the rice in a saucepan with 400ml cold water and a pinch of salt. Bring to the boil, cover, then simmer for 10 mins. Take off the heat and set aside until ready to serve the pork.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Dip each piece of pork into the egg, then the crumbs, pressing them onto the surface before transferring the meat to the tray. Bake the pork for 10-15 mins or until golden and crisp, turning once if needed. Serve with the rice and katsu sauce, garnished with coriander, if using, plus pickled ginger, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7713,7713,'en','Japanese-style brown rice','A simple healthy side of brown rice served with ginger, garlic, spring onions, soy sauce and soya beans','["250g brown rice","175g frozen soya beans","1 tbsp low-salt soy sauce","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 tsp finely grated ginger","1 garlic clove, crushed","4 spring onions, thinly sliced on the diagonal"]','["Cook the brown rice following pack\r\ninstructions, adding the soya beans for\r\nthe final 2 mins of cooking. Meanwhile,\r\nmix together the soy sauce, olive oil,\r\nginger and garlic.","Drain the cooked rice and beans,\r\ntransfer to a serving bowl and stir\r\nin the soy sauce mixture. Scatter\r\nwith the spring onions and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7715,7715,'en','Japanese-style bento box','This Asian-inspired lunchbox with mackerel sushi, edamame beans and fresh fruit will keep you going all afternoon','["100g fresh edamame in the pods (or frozen soya beans)","handful of a favourite fruit, such as fresh pineapple, blueberries or strawberries","100g sushi rice","1 tbsp rice vinegar","½  tsp golden caster sugar","1 sheet nori","1 smoked mackerel fillet, about 75g, flaked","1 tbsp light mayonnaise","2 spring onions, chopped","pea-sized blob wasabi (optional)","¼ red pepper, thinly sliced lengthways, about 6 slices"]','["Bring a pan of water to the boil and cook the\r\nedamame for 3-4 mins (or 1-2 mins if using frozen\r\nsoya beans) until tender. Drain, sprinkle with salt\r\nand set aside.","Rinse the rice well in cold water until the water\r\nruns clear. Put the rice in a heavy-based pan with\r\na tight-fitting lid and cover with 200ml water.\r\nBring just to the boil, then put on the lid, turn the\r\nheat to its lowest point and cook for 15-20 mins,\r\nuntil the liquid is absorbed. Remove from the\r\nheat and leave with the lid on for another 10 mins.","Spoon the cooked rice into a wide bowl and\r\nleave to cool a little. Stir together the rice vinegar,\r\nsugar and a small pinch of salt, until the sugar\r\nand salt dissolve. Mix this into the cooled rice.\r\nLay the nori sheet on a sushi rolling mat or sheet\r\nof cling film. With damp hands, spread the rice\r\nover two-thirds of the nori sheet.","Mix the smoked mackerel, mayonnaise and\r\nspring onions, season well with black pepper.\r\nSpread a line of wasabi down the middle of the\r\nrice, if using, and layer on the red pepper pieces,\r\nthen the fish mixture. Roll the sushi up, starting\r\nfrom the end covered with rice. Dampen the\r\nuncovered end to help it stick. Slice into about\r\n6 x 3cm thick pieces.","Pop the sushi rolls into a bento box or\r\nlunchbox, adding the edamame and fruit\r\nto the other compartments."]','2026-01-10 12:20:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7717,7717,'en','Vegetable tempura with soy & dipping sauce','These crisp Japanese-style treats are great for nibbles or a veggie main course.','["100g (approx) each of a mix of firm vegetables, cut into bite-size pieces, such as aubergine, broccoli, courgette, mushrooms, red pepper and sweet potatoes","tempura batter (see below)","groundnut or sunflower oil, for deep frying","3 tbsp soy sauce","3 tbsp dry sherry","1 tbsp sugar","1 lemon, zest only"]','["Heat oven to 150C/fan 130C/gas 2. Mix together the sauce ingredients in a small bowl. Make the batter (see right). Cover a baking tray with sheets of kitchen paper. Start to heat a deep-fat frying pan or large wok a third full of oil and have the frying basket, or slotted spoon to hand","When the oil reaches 190C dip some of the prepared veg briefly into the batter, shake off any excess, then lower straight into the hot oil. Don’t crowd the frying basket. Fry for about 2 mins until light golden and crisp, then drain on kitchen paper.","Repeat with the remaining vegetables in batches, dipping into the batter just before you fry them and remember to let the oil heat back up to temperature between each batch. Keep the tempura warm in the oven, leaving the door slightly ajar so that they stay crisp. They are best served immediately on a warm plate with the sauce alongside for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:20:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7719,7719,'en','Miso-marinated salmon','Ever wondered what to do with the Japanese paste miso? This variation of a classic Nobu fish dish is a great place to start','["3 tbsp pale (shiro) miso paste","2 tbsp mirin","1 tbsp sugar","1 tbsp saké (optional)","2 x 100g salmon fillets","half a cucumber","2 tsp rice wine vinegar","1 tsp vegetable oil","pinch caster sugar"]','["Stir together the miso, mirin, sugar and\r\nsake, if using. Place the salmon fillets on a\r\nplate or in a medium food bag and cover\r\nwith the miso marinade. Leave in the fridge\r\nfor at least 30 mins or, better still, overnight.","Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Lightly\r\noil a baking tray. Use kitchen paper to wipe\r\noff the marinade (don’t be tempted to wash\r\nit off as you will lose some of the flavour).\r\nPlace the fillets on the baking tray, skin side\r\ndown. Cook in the oven for 15 mins until the\r\nfish flakes easily and is cooked through.","Meanwhile, make the cucumber salad.\r\nUsing a vegetable peeler, shave the\r\ncucumber into long, thin ribbons. Whisk\r\ntogether the rice wine vinegar, oil and sugar.\r\nToss the cucumber ribbons in the dressing,\r\nthen curl them up on two plates. Serve\r\nwith the salmon and some plain white\r\nrice sprinkled with toasted sesame seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:20:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7721,7721,'en','Green tea frozen yogurt with sesame brittle shards','Frozen yogurt is really easy to make and lower in fat than ice cream. You can find ‘matcha’ green tea powder in healthfood stores','["2 x 500g pots 2% Greek yoghurt","200g caster sugar","2 tbsp green tea matcha powder","200g caster sugar","4 tbsp toasted sesame seeds"]','["In a large mixing bowl, whisk the\r\nyogurt, sugar and matcha powder well\r\nuntil the sugar is dissolved. Cover and\r\nchill for 1 hr or until the mixture is very\r\ncold. Pour into an ice-cream machine\r\nfollowing the manufacturer''s instructions.\r\nScrape into a freezable container and\r\nfreeze for 4-5 hrs until firm.","To make the sesame brittle, line a\r\nbaking sheet with baking parchment.\r\nHeat the sugar in a medium saucepan.\r\nLeave to melt, without stirring, for about\r\n5 mins until bubbling and golden. Stir the\r\nsesame seeds into the light caramel,\r\nboil for a few secs, then pour the mix\r\nonto the baking sheet, spreading as\r\nthin as possible. Once hardened, bash\r\nthe brittle on the counter to crack into\r\npieces. Can be made 1 week in advance\r\nand stored in an airtight tin.","Remove the frozen yogurt from the\r\nfreezer 1 hr or so before serving, to\r\nsoften slightly. Spoon into small bowls\r\nwith the sesame brittle scattered over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7723,7723,'en','Grilled salmon teriyaki with cucumber salad','Salmon fillets are cooked straight from frozen for convenience – the sticky glaze helps to keep the fishmoist while it cooks','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","5 tbsp soy sauce","5 tbsp mirin or dry sherry","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 piece fresh root ginger, peeled and finely grated","2 garlic cloves, crushed to a paste","4 frozen boneless, skinless salmon fillets","1 small cucumber","1 tbsp rice wine vinegar","1 tbsp soy sauce","½ tsp golden caster sugar","1 tbsp toasted sesame seeds"]','["Heat the grill to high and brush a sturdy\r\nbaking tray with oil. In a large bowl, mix\r\nthe soy, mirin, sugar, ginger and garlic\r\ntogether until the sugar has dissolved,\r\nthen toss the frozen salmon in the soy\r\nmix until coated. Tip the remaining\r\nmarinade into a small saucepan and\r\nbring to a simmer.","Place the tray about 4in away from the\r\nheat, then grill for 20 mins. Brush the fish\r\nevery few mins with the simmering\r\nmarinade until cooked through and\r\nglazed. If the fillets are thick, you may\r\nneed to turn them on their sides so they\r\ncook evenly. Remove from the grill.\r\nSimmer the marinade until sticky, then\r\npour it over the cooked salmon.","For the cucumber salad, use a swivel\r\nblade peeler to peel the cucumber into\r\nslices. Make the dressing by mixing the\r\nvinegar with the soy sauce, sugar and\r\nsesame seeds. Toss the cucumber with\r\nthe dressing and serve with the salmon\r\nand boiled rice."]','2026-01-10 12:20:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7725,7725,'en','Saucy Japanese greens with sticky sesame rice','Serve long-stemmed broccoli and Asian pak choi with sesame sushi rice and a miso ginger dressing','["1 tbsp caster sugar","140g sushi rice","1 tbsp sesame seed, toasted","1 tsp sesame oil","1 tbsp sunflower oil","250g long-stemmed broccoli, such as Tenderstem or purple sprouting","90g pack baby pak choi, each halved lengthways","6 spring onions, halved lengthways","2 tbsp brown miso paste","1 tbsp mirin","1 tbsp rice wine vinegar","1 tbsp soft brown sugar","2 tsp finely grated ginger","1 red chilli, deseeded and diced"]','["Stir together all the sauce ingredients\r\nwith 1 tbsp water. Set aside.","Bring a large pan of water to the boil\r\nwith the caster sugar and ½ tsp salt. Add\r\nthe rice and boil for 15 mins (or following\r\npack instructions) until just cooked. Drain\r\nwell and return to the pan. Sprinkle over\r\nthe sesame seeds and sesame oil, then\r\ncover and set aside to keep warm.","Heat the sunflower oil in a wok until\r\nvery hot, then toss in the broccoli and\r\nstir-fry for 2-3 mins until almost tender,\r\nadding splashes of water occasionally\r\nto create steam. Add the pak choi and\r\nspring onions, and stir-fry for 30 secs,\r\nthen stir in the sauce and cook for a\r\nfurther 1-2 mins, stirring constantly.","Spread the rice over 2 plates, divide\r\nover the stir-fry and serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:20:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7727,7727,'en','Avocado prawns in wasabi dressing','Wasabi, the paste that adds a hot peppery bite to sushi, peps up this creamy combo of avocado and prawns','["2 tsp wasabi paste","4 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp lime juice, plus 6 wedges, to serve","1 tsp clear honey","2 large ripe, but firm avocados","250g pack chilled large peeled prawns","2 heads of chicory, red if possible, separated into leaves","few sprigs of watercress","prawn crackers, to serve"]','["In a large bowl, mix dressing ingredients until blended. Season with salt, then set aside.","To serve, halve and stone the avocados. Dice the flesh while it’s still in the skin then scoop into a bowl. Add the prawns and toss in the dressing. Line six small serving bowls or tumblers with two or three chicory leaves. Pile in avocado and prawn mixture. Top with watercress and lime wedges. Serve with prawn crackers."]','2026-01-10 12:20:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7729,7729,'en','Japanese salad with ginger soy dressing','Serve this salad alongside grilled tuna or steak or tuck into it as a superhealthy lunch','["4 baby gem lettuces, halved lengthways","200g frozen shelled edamame (soy) beans, defrosted","4 carrots, cut into long matchsticks","140g radishes, thinly sliced","2 tbsp rice wine vinegar","2 tbsp reduced-salt soy sauce","2 tbsp caster sugar","½ small onion, chopped","2 tsp chopped ginger","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp vegetable oil"]','["Place all the dressing ingredients in a\r\nblender or food processor and add 1 tbsp\r\nwater. Blend until smooth. Arrange the\r\nhalved lettuce, edamame, carrots and\r\nradishes on 4 plates or 1 big platter.\r\nWhen ready to serve, drizzle the\r\ndressing over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7731,7731,'en','Soy tuna with wasabi mash','Enjoy this Japanese-inspired dish with someone special','["3 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp rice wine vinegar","1 tbsp caster sugar","2 tuna steaks, each about 140g/5oz","500g potatoes","100ml semi-skimmed milk","2 tsp wasabi paste (see Know-how)","1 spring onion, finely sliced","frozen broad bean or soya beans, to serve"]','["Mix together the soy sauce, vinegar and\r\nsugar. Pour over the tuna and marinate for\r\nat least 20 mins or up to 2 hrs in the fridge.\r\nPlace the potatoes in a pan of lightly salted\r\nboiling water, then cook for 10-15 mins until\r\nsoft. Drain well. Heat the milk in the pan and\r\nmix in the wasabi, return the potatoes to the\r\npan, then mash until smooth. Stir through\r\nthe spring onion and keep warm.","Heat a non-stick griddle pan until smoking\r\nhot. Remove the tuna from the marinade.\r\nCook on the griddle for 2-3 mins on each\r\nside until seared on the outside, but still\r\npink inside. Cook the broad or soy beans\r\naccording to pack instructions, then serve\r\nalongside the tuna and mash."]','2026-01-10 12:20:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7733,7733,'en','Smoked trout & cucumber sesame noodles','Fast becoming as popular as salmon, trout has been a forgotten gem for two long. Make the most of it in this fresh salad','["1.2l vegetable stock","knob fresh root ginger, peeled and shredded","100g soba noodles","1 tbsp reduced-salt soy sauce, plus extra to serve if you like","1 tbsp tahini paste or peanut butter","125g pack smoked trout fillets, flaked","½ large cucumber, sliced","6 spring onions, finely sliced","sesame seed, to serve","sesame oil, to serve"]','["Bring the stock and shredded ginger to\r\nthe boil in a large pan, add the noodles,\r\nthen simmer for 4 mins until tender.","Drain, then cool under cold running water. \r\nMix together the soy, tahini and 2 tbsp\r\nwater (or more if you need) to make a\r\ndressing the consistency of single cream.\r\nToss the cooled noodles and fish with the\r\ndressing and cucumber. Scatter with the\r\nspring onions and sesame seeds, then\r\ndrizzle with a little sesame oil, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:20:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7735,7735,'en','Easy miso soup','A low fat soup ready in under 5 minutes','["sachet of Japanese miso soup","dash of soy sauce","1 tbsp diced silken tofu","a good sprig of watercress"]','["Dissolve a sachet of Japanese miso soup mix in a bowl with boiling water. Add a dash soy sauce, diced silken tofu and a good sprig of watercress."]','2026-01-10 12:20:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7737,7737,'en','Cauliflower tempura','A healthy, Japanese-style snack','["1 small cauliflower, cut into medium-size florets","100g plain flour","2 eggs, separated","2 tbsp vegetable oil","vegetable oil for deep frying"]','["Cook the cauliflower in boiling water for 2 mins. Tip into a colander, rinse \r\nunder the cold tap, drain well and set aside.","Put the flour in a large bowl with a pinch  \r\nof salt. Whisk the egg yolks and 175ml iced  \r\nwater together, then whisk into the flour with the \r\noil to make a smooth batter. In a separate, clean \r\nbowl whisk the egg whites until stiff, then fold \r\ninto the batter.","Heat the oil in a deep fryer or large wok to \r\n190C. Coat some of the cauliflower in the batter \r\nthen use a slotted spoon to carefully lift into the \r\nhot oil. Deep-fry the cauliflower for 2-3 mins until \r\ngolden and puffy.  Drain on kitchen towel and \r\ncontinue with the rest in batches. Sprinkle the \r\ncauliflower with salt and serve with a bowl of  \r\naïoli or mayonnaise."]','2026-01-10 12:20:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7741,7741,'en','Japanese salmon & avocado rice','This dish contains the goodness of sushi butsaves you the painstaking rolling and shaping','["300g sushi rice","350g skinless salmon fillets","2 small, ripe avocados, sliced","juice 1 lemon","4 tsp light soy sauce","4 tsp toasted sesame seeds","2 spring onions, thinly sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and thinly sliced","small handful coriander leaves"]','["Rinse the rice in a sieve until the water\r\nruns clear. Drain and put in a large pan\r\nwith 400ml water. Bring to the boil, turn\r\nthe heat to low, cover, then cook for\r\n10-12 mins until the rice is almost\r\ncooked. Remove from the heat, then\r\nleave, covered, for another 10 mins.","Thinly slice the salmon and arrange on\r\na platter with the sliced avocado. Drizzle\r\nover the lemon juice and soy, making\r\nsure everything is evenly covered. Leave\r\nin the fridge to marinate for 10 mins.","Carefully tip the juices from the salmon\r\nplatter into the rice, then stir in with a\r\nlittle salt. Divide the rice between 4 bowls.\r\nScatter the sesame seeds, spring onions,\r\nchilli and coriander over the salmon and\r\navocado, then serve with the rice."]','2026-01-10 12:20:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7743,7743,'en','Teriyaki tuna skewers','Colourful and quick, these simple skewers taste as good as they look!','["30ml soy sauce","50ml mirin (See know-how below)","1 tsp vegetable oil","1 mango, peeled","3 spring onions","250g pack tuna steaks"]','["Make a teriyaki sauce by mixing the soy sauce, mirin and sugar in a shallow dish. Put the tuna steaks in the dish, turn over a few times so they’re coated with the sauce, then leave in the fridge to marinate for at least 1 hr and up to 2 hrs.","To cook, heat a large frying pan. Take the tuna steaks out of the marinade and pat dry, then rub all over with the oil. Fry the tuna for 2 mins on each side, so they are still pink in the middle. Remove from the pan, then pour in the marinade and 2-3 tbsp water. Bring to the boil and cook for a few mins to heat through. Strain through a sieve into a small dipping bowl.","To serve, slice the cooked tuna, mango and spring onion into bite-size pieces. Thread onto wooden skewers, then serve warm or cold with the dipping sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:20:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7745,7745,'en','Miso pollock with cucumber & spring onion salad','Swap cod for a sustainable white fish like pollock and serve with Japanese flavours for a low-calorie supper you’ll feel good about','["2 tbsp white miso paste","1 tsp low-sodium soy sauce","4 tbsp rice wine vinegar","2 x 125g/4½oz skiness pollack fillets","1 bunch spring onions, sliced diagonally","½ cucumber, peeled into strips with a potato peeler","140g/ 5oz beansprout","100g/ 4oz radishes, sliced","1 red chilli, chopped (deseeded if you like)","3 limes, 2 juiced, 1 cut into wedges","1 tsp sesame oil"]','["Mix together the miso paste, soy sauce\r\nand half the vinegar. Cover the fish in the\r\nmarinade and leave for at least 15 mins,\r\nor ideally overnight in the fridge.","Mix the spring onions, cucumber,\r\nbeansprouts and radishes. Make a\r\ndressing with the chilli, lime juice and\r\nremaining vinegar. Pour over the salad\r\nand set aside while you cook the fish.","Heat the sesame oil in a frying pan\r\nand cook the fish for 3-4 mins each side.\r\nRemove and transfer to a plate. Tip the\r\nmarinade into the pan, bring to the boil\r\nand boil rapidly to reduce by half. Pour\r\nover the fish and serve with the salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7747,7747,'en','Miso chilli steak with crispy sweet potatoes','Try this Asian twist on steak and chips – serve griddled beef with a chilli miso baste and sesame-flecked sweet potatoes','["2 large sweet potatoes, cut into wedges","1 tbsp vegetable oil, plus a little extra","1 tbsp sesame seed","1 tbsp miso paste","juice 1 lemon","1 tbsp hot chilli sauce (sriracha is nice)","1 tbsp mirin","2 bavette or other lean steaks (about 200g each)","large handful watercress leaves, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPut the potato wedges on a baking tray\r\nand rub with the oil. Sprinkle the sesame\r\nseeds and some seasoning over. Bake\r\nfor 25 mins or until crisp at the edges.","In a small bowl, mix together the miso,\r\nlemon juice, chilli sauce and mirin. Rub\r\nthe steaks with a tiny bit of oil and some\r\nseasoning. Spoon 1 tbsp of the sauce\r\nover each steak and rub into both sides.","Heat a griddle pan until really hot, cook\r\nthe steaks for 2 mins each side, or longer\r\nif you prefer it well done. Brush more\r\nof the sauce over after you turn them.\r\nTransfer to a plate, cover loosely with\r\nfoil, and leave to rest for 5 mins. Serve\r\nthe steaks sliced, with extra sauce, the\r\npotatoes and watercress."]','2026-01-10 12:20:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7749,7749,'en','Teriyaki chicken meatballs with rice & greens','Try a family supper with a difference with these chicken patties served in a sweet Japanese sauce and basmati','["2 shallots","1 carrot, cut into chunks","500g boneless, skinless chicken breasts or thighs, cut into chunks","zest and juice 1 lemon","a little oil","200g basmati rice","200g spring greens, chopped","100ml mirin","3 tbsp soy sauce","3 tbsp caster sugar"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPulse the shallots and carrot in a food\r\nprocessor until finely chopped. Add the\r\nchicken, lemon zest and some seasoning,\r\nand pulse again until mixed. Using oiled\r\nhands, shape into small meatballs.\r\nPut on a baking tray lined with baking\r\nparchment and bake for 10 mins until\r\nbrowned and cooked through.","Meanwhile, boil the rice following pack\r\ninstructions, adding the spring greens for\r\nthe final 4 mins. Drain well.","Add the mirin, soy, lemon juice and\r\nsugar to a saucepan. Bring to the boil,\r\nthen simmer until saucy. Remove from\r\nthe heat, add the meatballs to the pan\r\nand roll them around in the sauce. Divide\r\nthe rice and greens between plates or\r\nbowls and spoon the meatballs over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7753,7753,'en','Sesame beef wraps','The perfect Asian-inspired pre-dinner nibble, perfect for a Christmas get-together with friends','["1 tsp vegetable oil","175g beef steak, cut into thin strips","1 red pepper, deseeded and thinly sliced","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","2cm piece fresh root ginger, thinly sliced and cut into matchsticks","1 tbsp sesame seed","2 tbsp soy sauce","2 Baby Gem lettuces","1 tsp sesame oil"]','["Heat oil in a large frying pan. When the pan is\r\nreally hot, tip in the beef and pepper, then cook\r\nfor a few mins until lightly browned and the\r\nbeef is cooked through. Tip in the garlic, ginger\r\nand sesame seeds, then cook for 1-2 mins more,\r\nstirring often until they start to turn golden.","Pour over the soy sauce and 2 tbsp water, let\r\nit bubble down a bit until it starts to look syrupy,\r\nthen drizzle with the sesame oil. Separate the\r\nleaves from the lettuces and arrange on a plate.\r\nSpoon a little of the beef mixture into each leaf,\r\ndrizzle with pan juices and serve warm."]','2026-01-10 12:20:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7755,7755,'en','Ajiaco','This classic Colombian soup is served with cream, capers, avocado, mote (boiled corn) and shredded chicken breast, all mixed in just before eating','["2 skinless chicken breasts","2 cobs choclo corn (a variety of large-kernel yellow corn) or regular corn cobs","4 garlic cloves, sliced","½  white onion, diced","1 yellow pepper, diced","4 medium potatoes (red or white), peeled and diced","2 spring onions, chopped","6 coriander sprigs, chopped, plus extra to serve","12 papas criollas (small yellow potatoes), cut in half","8 tbsp guascas","100ml single or double cream","4 tbsp capers, drained","1 avocado, peeled, stoned and cut into small cubes"]','["Put the chicken, corn cobs, garlic, onion, pepper, potatoes, spring onions and coriander in a pan with 2 litres water and bring to the boil, season well, then simmer for approximately 45 mins over a medium heat.","Remove the corn and the chicken and transfer them to a plate. Blend the remaining ingredients in the pan with a hand blender until you get a creamy consistency.","Add the papas criollas and the guascas to the pan and cook over a medium heat for around 10-12 mins, or until the papas criollas start to get soft but do not disintegrate.","Meanwhile, shred the chicken breasts finely with your hands, and cut the corn cobs into thick slices. Put into separate small bowls.","Put the cream, capers, avocado and extra chopped coriander in small bowls as well, so that everyone can help themselves to what they want. Pour the soup into four soup bowls and serve alongside the other ingredients. Don’t forget napkins for eating the slices of corn."]','2026-01-10 12:20:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7757,7757,'en','Puttanesca hake traybake','Shop for sustainable hake to cook this Mediterranean-style one-pan bake with green olives and tomatoes','["1 onion , sliced","500g baby potatoes , sliced into chunky coins","2 tbsp olive oil","3 garlic cloves , lightly bashed but still in their skins","400g can chopped tomatoes","60g pitted olives , we used nocellara, sliced","1 tsp chilli flakes","2 tbsp capers , drained and roughly chopped","3 anchovy fillets , finely chopped","4 hake fillets , roughly 100g each","10g parsley , roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/190C fan/gas 6. Put the onion and potatoes in a roasting dish, drizzle with oil and top with the garlic. Season well with salt and pepper. Roast for 25-30 mins, turning halfway, until golden and cooked through. Remove the garlic from their skins and squeeze over the potatoes.","When the potatoes are cooked, mix the chopped canned tomatoes with a good pinch of salt and pepper. Scatter the olives, chilli flakes, capers and anchovies over the potatoes and mix well. Pour over the seasoned canned tomatoes. Nestle in the hake fillets on top.","Cover with foil, then return to the oven for 10-15 mins, until the fish is cooked. It should be opaque and flake easily when lightly pushed with a fork.","Scatter with the parsley and serve straight from the tray."]','2026-01-10 12:20:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7759,7759,'en','Mediterranean salad with hummus dressing','Liven up your usual salad with roasted courgette, artichokes, chickpeas and feta in a creamy hummus dressing','["2 courgettes","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp dried mixed herbs","100g chargrilled artichokes , roughly chopped","½ cucumber , roughly chopped","400g can chickpeas , drained and rinsed","300g cherry tomatoes , halved","100g pitted olives , roughly chopped","100g feta , crumbled","small handful of parsley , finely chopped","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 lemon , juiced","100g hummus"]','["Trim the courgettes, then cut in half lengthways, so you have two long halves. Score the flesh of the courgettes in a criss-cross. Sprinkle a large pinch of salt over the cut side of the courgettes and set aside for 10 mins. Pat dry then brush with the olive oil and sprinkle over the mixed herbs on the cut side.","Heat a dry frying pan over a medium-high heat. Put the courgettes, scored-side down in the pan and cook for 8-10 mins, until deeply browned. Flip and cook for a further 5 mins until the courgettes are completely soft.","Meanwhile, combine the dressing ingredients in a wide shallow serving bowl and season to taste. Add the remaining ingredients, reserving a little of the parsley, and toss well to combine. Top with the courgettes and sprinkle over the remaining parsley to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7761,7761,'en','Hummus snack packs','Save the liquid from a can of chickpeas to make a creamy hummus. We’ve served it with vegetable crudités for a healthy snack that contributes to your 5-a-day','["400g can chickpeas, drained, liquid reserved","1 garlic clove","½ tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","1-2 tbsp lemon juice","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 x 200g bags rainbow carrots or 4 regular carrots","2 x 200g bags baby cucumbers or 4 regular cucumbers"]','["Tip the chickpeas and garlic into a bowl with the cumin, coriander, 1 tbsp lemon juice and the oil. Add 2 tbsp of the reserved liquid from the chickpeas, then blitz using ahand blenderuntil smooth. If the blender is struggling, add another splash of the liquid. Season and add a little more lemon juice if needed.","Spoon the hummus into four small containers.Will keep covered and chilled for up to three days.Slice the carrots and cucumber into batons when you’re ready to eat and serve with the hummus."]','2026-01-10 12:20:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7763,7763,'en','Crispy squid with caponata','Squid is cheap, plentiful, quick to cook, and delicious with the classic Italian vegetable dish, caponata','["800g cleaned squid tubes (about 3 large tubes)","150g plain flour","1 tbsp cayenne pepper or chilli powder","sunflower oil, for frying","1 large aubergine","4 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 onion, chopped","3 celery sticks, sliced","250g cherry tomatoes","3 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar","150g green olive, stoned","30g caper, rinsed if salted","handful basil leaves, shredded"]','["To prepare the squid, lay the squid flat on a board. Insert a long, thin knife in the opening and neatly cut it along one side. Open it out to a flat sheet and scrape away any leftover membrane. Use the tip of the knife to lightly score the flesh in a diamond pattern, taking care not to cut through the squid completely. Cut the scored squid into large triangles ready to be floured and fried.","For the caponata, the aubergine needs to be cut into uniform dice: slice it lengthways about 1cm thick, cut long strips the same size, then chop them into squares.","Heat half the oil in a large sauté pan. Fry the onions for 3-4 mins until starting to soften, add the aubergine, then continue to cook for 8-10 mins until brown and soft. Tip into a colander over a bowl.","Tip any oil from the bowl back into the pan and top it up with a splash of fresh oil. Fry the celery, tomatoes and the crushed garlic together. Sprinkle the sugar over, splash in the vinegar, then cook for 3-4 mins until the tomatoes start to release their juice.","Tip the aubergine and onion back in with the celery. Scatter in the olives, capers and basil, then give everything a good stir. Cook for 5 mins until simmering, then season to taste. Turn off the heat, drizzle in the rest of the oil, then set aside.","Just before cooking, tip the squid into a large bowl. Sift the flour and cayenne pepper together over the squid, then toss well and season with salt. Tip the squid back into the sieve and shake off all the excess flour.","Pour enough sunflower oil into a large frying pan so it’s about 1cm deep. Heat the oil until it sizzles when sprinkled with a little flour. In batches, fry the squid for 2-3 mins on each side until golden and crisp. When cooked, use tongs to lift the squid onto a plate lined with kitchen paper. You are now ready to serve.","Spoon the caponata inside a 10cm wide metal ring (or simply make a neat pile) in the middle of a medium dinner plate. Use the back of the spoon to press down lightly on the caponata and level the top of the pile. Carefully lift the ring away, keeping the tower of caponata circular. Lean five or six pieces of squid around the caponata like petals on a flower, then serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:20:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7765,7765,'en','Polenta, roasted vegetables & peppered Parmesan crisps','Emma Booth won our Home Cooking Month competition with this sumptuous and creamy polenta dish, topped with vibrant roasted squash and beetroot','["1 small butternut squash (about 450g), peeled and cut into 2cm cubes","3 raw beetroot (about 200g), cut into 2cm cubes","2 small red onions, cut into slim wedges","3 tbsp olive oil","juice of ½ lemon","200g fine polenta","½  tsp salt","50g butter","60g grated cheese (we used a 50/50 mix of Parmesan and Taleggio)","a big handful of rocket, to serve","2 tsp freshly picked thyme leaves","50g grated parmesan"]','["To make the crisps, turn the oven down to 200C/ 180C fan/ gas mark 6.  Season the grated Parmesan with a large pinch of black pepper and scatter evenly over a baking tray covered with a silicone sheet or lightly oiled greaseproof paper and bake for 5 minutes, until golden but not browned.  After cooling for five minutes, break into crisp pieces with your fingers.","Turn the oven up to 220C/ 200C fan/ gas mark 7. Toss the squash and beetroot chunks in the lemon juice and oil, season lightly with salt and pepper, and bake in a roasting tin for 20 minutes. Add the onion wedges and continue to bake for a further 25 minutes.","Meanwhile bring a litre of water, salt and half the butter to a simmer in a large pot, then slowly add the polenta in a fine stream, stirring all the time.  Continue to simmer over a low heat for 35 minutes (or according to the instructions if using quick cook polenta), stirring often to prevent it sticking to the bottom.  The polenta should be thickened but still soft at this point.  If it starts to dry out too much, add a cup of water.  When cooked, stir through the rest of the butter, the Parmesan and Taleggio and a pinch of white pepper.","To serve, spoon the polenta over a board or onto plates, scatter over the vegetables and any roasting juices, then the rocket and thyme.  Tuck the parmesan crisps in between the veg, and eat hot."]','2026-01-10 12:20:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7767,7767,'en','Spiced baked figs with ginger mascarpone','This dish makes the perfect ending to a relaxed dinner party, special yet stress-free','["8 figs, halved","2 tbsp butter","2 tbsp clear honey","2 tbsp brown sugar","2 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tbsp orange juice","2 star anise","shortbread fingers, to serve","1 ball stem ginger, very finely chopped","1 tbsp ginger syrup from the jar","½ a 250g tub mascarpone"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Lay\r\nthe figs in an ovenproof roasting dish, dot\r\nover the butter and drizzle with honey.\r\nSprinkle over the sugar and cinnamon,\r\nthen pour over the orange juice and mix lightly. Nestle the star anise amongst the figs and roast for 15-20 minutes.","When ready to serve, mix the ginger\r\nand syrup through the mascarpone.\r\nPlace 4 fig halves, drizzled with syrup,\r\non a plate with a dollop of mascarpone\r\nand some shortbread fingers."]','2026-01-10 12:20:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7769,7769,'en','Watermelon & feta salad with crispbread','A cool, refreshing combo for warm summer evenings','["½ a watermelon (about 1½ kg), peeled, deseeded and cut into chunks","200g block feta cheese, cubed","large handful black olives","handful flat-leaf parsley and mint leaves, roughly chopped","1 red onion, finely sliced into rings","olive oil and balsamic vinegar, to serve","½ a 500g pack white bread mix","1 tbsp olive oil, plus a little extra for drizzling","plain flour, for dusting","1 egg white, beaten","a mix of sesame seeds, poppy seeds and fennel seeds, for scattering"]','["Make up the bread according to pack\r\ninstructions with 1 tbsp olive oil. Leave\r\nto rise in a warm place for about 1 hr\r\nuntil doubled in size. Heat oven to\r\n220C/200C fan/gas 7. Knock the bread\r\nback and divide into 6 pieces. On a\r\nfloured surface, roll the breads out as\r\nthinly as possible, then transfer to baking\r\ntrays. Brush with the egg white and\r\nscatter with the mixed seeds. Bake for\r\nabout 15 mins until crisp and brown; if\r\nthey puff up, even better. You may need\r\nto do this in batches. The breads can be\r\nmade the previous day and kept in an\r\nairtight container.","In a large serving bowl, lightly toss\r\nthe melon with the feta and olives.\r\nScatter over the herbs and onion rings,\r\nthen serve with the olive oil and balsamic\r\nfor drizzling over. Serve the pile of\r\ncrispbreads on the side for breaking\r\nup and using to scoop the salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7771,7771,'en','Aïoli','A creamy garlic hit, a perfect dip for steamed spring vegetables','["small pinch saffron strands","3 garlic cloves, crushed","2 egg yolks","1 tbsp Dijon mustard","300ml olive oil"]','["In a small bowl pour 1 tbsp of boiling water over \r\nthe saffron and set aside. Put the garlic, egg yolks \r\nand mustard into a food processor or blender. Blitz \r\ninto a paste and very slowly dribble in the olive oil \r\nto make a thick mayonnaise-style sauce. When \r\neverything''s come together add the saffron, saffron \r\nwater and lemon juice, then season to taste. The \r\naïoli will keep covered in the fridge for up to 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:20:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7773,7773,'en','Chorizo pilaf','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyFalling somewhere between a paella and a risotto, this slow-cooked basmati rice pot has deep paprika flavours','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, thinly sliced","250g baby cooking chorizo, sliced","4 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp smoked paprika","400g can chopped tomatoes","250g basmati rice","600ml stock","1 lemon, zest peeled off in thick strips, plus wedges to serve","2 fresh bay leaves","small bunch parsley, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan with a lid.\r\nAdd the onion and cook for 5-8 mins\r\nuntil soft and golden. Push to the side of\r\nthe pan and add the chorizo. Cook until\r\nlightly browned and some of the oils are\r\nreleased into the pan.","Add the garlic and paprika, then the\r\ntomatoes. Bubble over a medium heat\r\nfor 5 mins, then add the rice, stock,\r\nlemon zest and bay leaves. Stir\r\neverything together well and bring to\r\nthe boil. Put the lid on and cook over\r\na very low heat for 12 mins.","Turn off the heat and leave to sit and\r\nsteam for 10-15 mins. Stir through the\r\nparsley and serve with lemon wedges\r\nfor squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7775,7775,'en','Spinach with chilli & lemon crumbs','Wilt fresh greens then serve with crispy breadcrumbs, chilli and garlic for a low-fat, healthy side dish','["25g butter","100g fresh breadcrumbs","zest 1 lemon","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 red chilli, finely chopped","500g spinach"]','["Melt the butter in a large frying pan,\r\nthen when it starts to foam, tip in the\r\nbreadcrumbs, zest, garlic and chilli.\r\nCook until golden and crunchy. Remove\r\nfrom the pan, season and set aside.","Add the spinach to the pan and wilt,\r\nstirring. Season and serve with the\r\ncrunchy crumbs sprinkled over the top."]','2026-01-10 12:20:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7777,7777,'en','Mediterranean chicken tray bake','A colourful all-in-one bake bursting with summer flavour','["2 red peppers, deseeded and cut into chunks","1 red onion, cut into wedges","2 tsp olive oil","4 skin-on chicken breasts","½ x 150g pack full-fat garlic & herb soft cheese","200g pack cherry tomatoes","handful black olives"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Mix\r\nthe peppers and onion on a big baking\r\ntray with half the oil. Transfer to the oven\r\nand cook on the top shelf for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, carefully make a pocket\r\nbetween the skin and the flesh of each\r\nchicken breast, but don’t pull off the skin\r\ncompletely. Push equal amounts of\r\ncheese under the skin, smooth the skin\r\nback down, brush it with the rest of the\r\noil, season, then add to the tray along\r\nwith the tomatoes and olives. Return to\r\nthe oven and cook for 25-30 mins more\r\nuntil the chicken is golden and cooked.\r\nServe with baked potatoes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7779,7779,'en','Mediterranean chicken with roasted vegetables','A healthy dish, full of sunshine flavours','["250g baby new potatoes, thinly sliced","1 large courgette, diagonally sliced","1 red onion, cut into wedges","1 yellow pepper, seeded and cut into chunks","6 firm plum tomatoes, halved","12 black olives, pitted","2 skinless boneless chicken breast fillets, about 150g/5oz each","3 tbsp olive oil","1 rounded tbsp green pesto"]','["Preheat the oven to 200C/\r\nGas 6/fan oven 180C.\r\nSpread the potatoes,\r\ncourgette, onion, pepper\r\nand tomatoes in a shallow\r\nroasting tin and\r\nscatter over the olives.\r\nSeason with salt and\r\ncoarsely ground black\r\npepper.","Slash the flesh of each\r\nchicken breast 3-4 times\r\nusing a sharp knife, then\r\nlay the chicken on top of\r\nthe vegetables.","Mix the olive oil and pesto\r\ntogether until well blended\r\nand spoon evenly over the\r\nchicken. Cover the tin with\r\nfoil and cook for 30\r\nminutes.","Remove the foil from the\r\ntin. Return to the oven and\r\ncook for a further 10\r\nminutes until the\r\nvegetables are juicy and\r\nlook tempting to eat and the\r\nchicken is cooked through\r\n(the juices should run clear when pierced with a skewer)."]','2026-01-10 12:20:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7781,7781,'en','Pancetta-wrapped fish with lemony potatoes','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyWrap up sustainable white fish in crispy bacon and serve as an all-in-one tray bake with potatoes','["300g new potatoes","100g green beans","small handful black kalamata olives","zest and juice 1 lemon","2 tbsp olive oil","2 chunky pollack fillets or another sustainable white fish","4 slices pancetta or thinly sliced smoked streaky bacon","few tarragon sprigs, leaves picked"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPlace the potatoes in a pan of water and\r\nboil for 10-12 mins until tender. Add the\r\nbeans for the final 2-3 mins. Drain well\r\nand slice the potatoes in half. Tip into\r\na roomy baking dish and toss with the\r\nolives, lemon zest and oil. Season well.","Season the fish and wrap with the\r\npancetta or bacon. Place on top of\r\nthe potatoes. Bake for 10-12 mins until\r\ncooked through, then add a squeeze\r\nof lemon juice and scatter with\r\ntarragon before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7783,7783,'en','Herbed lamb cutlets with roasted vegetables','A healthy Mediterranean-style tray bake with sweet potato, peppers, courgettes and chunky onion','["2 peppers, any colour, deseeded and cut into chunky pieces","1 large sweet potato, peeled and cut into chunky pieces","2 courgettes, sliced into chunks","1 red onion, cut into wedges","1 tbsp olive oil","8 lean lamb cutlets","1 tbsp thyme leaf, chopped","2 tbsp mint leaves, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Put\r\nthe peppers, sweet potato, courgettes\r\nand onion on a large baking tray and\r\ndrizzle over the oil. Season with lots of\r\nground black pepper. Roast for 25 mins.","Meanwhile, trim the lamb of as much\r\nfat as possible. Mix the herbs with a few\r\ntwists of ground black pepper and pat\r\nall over the lamb.","Take the vegetables out of the oven,\r\nturn over and push to one side of the\r\ntray. Place the cutlets on the hot tray\r\nand return to the oven for 10 mins.","Turn the cutlets and cook for a further\r\n10 mins or until the vegetables and lamb\r\nare tender and lightly charred. Mix\r\neverything on the tray and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7785,7785,'en','Broad bean & feta cheese toasts','Slice up a baguette, toast, then use as a bruschetta base for beans and salty Greek cheese for a healthy bite','["350g broad beans, fresh or frozen","100g feta cheese (or vegetarian alternative), drained","2 tbsp chopped or shredded mint leaves","1 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","50g bag mixed salad leaves","10 cherry tomatoes, halved","1 tsp lemon juice","4 thin slices baguettes (white or brown)"]','["Bring a small pan of water to the boil.\r\nAdd the beans, return to the boil and\r\ncook for 4 mins. Drain in a colander\r\nunder running water until cold. Press\r\neach bean out of its skin into a bowl.","Crumble over the feta and scatter\r\nover the mint leaves. Season with a\r\ngood grind of black pepper and drizzle\r\nwith 2 tsp of the oil. Toss together.","Toss the salad leaves and tomatoes\r\nwith the remaining olive oil and lemon\r\njuice. Divide between 2 plates. Toast\r\nthe bread under the grill or in a toaster\r\nuntil golden and crisp on both sides.\r\nTo serve, spoon the bean and cheese\r\nmixture onto the warm toasts and place\r\nalongside the salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7786,7787,'en','Easy stuffed peppers','A fifteen minute supper that won''t leave you feeling stuffed','["4 red peppers","2 x 250g pouches cooked tomato rice (we used Tilda Rizazz Mediterranean Tomato)","2 tbsp pesto","handful pitted black olives, chopped","200g goat''s cheese, sliced"]','["Use a small knife to cut the top out of\r\nthe peppers, then scoop out the seeds. Sit the\r\npeppers on a plate, cut-side up, and cook\r\nin the microwave on High for 5-6 mins until\r\nthey have wilted and softened.","While the peppers are cooking, mix the\r\nrice together with the pesto and olives and\r\ntwo-thirds of the cheese. Scoop the rice into\r\nthe peppers, top with the remaining goat’s\r\ncheese and continue to cook for 8-10 mins"]','2026-01-10 12:20:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7788,7789,'en','Mediterranean slices','Keep sliced roasted peppers, puff pastry and artichokes in the freezer and you’ll never be stuck for a smart starter again','["375g pack ready-rolled puff pastry","4 tbsp green pesto","140g frozen sliced roasted peppers","140g frozen artichokes (about 3 wedges per serving)","125g ball mozzarella, or 85g cheddar, grated"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.  \r\nUnroll the pastry and cut into 4 rectangles. \r\nTake a sharp knife and score a 1cm edge \r\ninside each rectangle, taking care that you \r\ndon’t cut all the way through the pastry. \r\nPlace on a baking sheet.","Spread 1 tbsp pesto onto each slice, \r\nstaying inside the border, then pile up the \r\npeppers and artichokes. Cook in the oven for \r\n15 mins until the pastry is starting to brown.","Tear the mozzarella ball into small pieces, \r\nthen scatter it (or use cheddar, if you prefer) \r\nover the veg. Return to the oven for 5-7 mins \r\nuntil the pastry is crisp and the cheese has \r\nmelted. Serve with a green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7790,7790,'en','Mediterranean scones','New flavours in an old favourite – great for coffee mornings or an afternoon snack','["350g self-raising flour","1 tbsp baking powder","¼ tsp salt","50g butter, cut in pieces","1 tbsp olive oil","8 halves Italian sundried tomatoes, coarsely chopped","100g feta cheese, cubed","10 black olives, pitted and halved","300ml full fat milk","1 egg, beaten, to glaze"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Butter a large baking sheet. In a large bowl, mix together the flour, baking powder and salt. Rub in the butter with the oil, until the mixture resembles fine crumbs, then add the tomatoes, cheese and olives. Make a well in the centre, pour in the milk and mix with a knife, using a cutting movement, until it becomes a soft ‘stickyish’ dough. (Use all the milk – it helps give a light texture.) Don’t overhandle the dough.","Flour your hands and the work surface well, and shape the dough into a round, about 3-4cm thick. Cut into eight wedges and place them well apart on the baking sheet. Brush with beaten egg and bake for 15-20 mins until risen, golden and springy to the touch. Transfer to a wire rack and cover with a clean tea towel to keep them soft. These are best served warm and buttered. Will keep for 2-3 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:20:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7792,7792,'en','Mediterranean fig & mozzarella salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyIf you want to make this more substantial, you could serve some prosciutto or Serrano ham with it','["200g fine green beans, trimmed","6 small figs, quartered","1 shallot, thinly sliced","1 x 125g ball mozzarella, drained and ripped into chunks","50g hazelnuts, toasted and chopped","small handful basil leaves, torn","3 tbsp balsamic vinegar","1 tbsp fig jam or relish","3 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil"]','["In a large saucepan of salted water,\r\nblanch the beans for 2-3 mins. Drain, rinse\r\nin cold water, then drain on kitchen paper.\r\nArrange on a platter. Top with the figs,\r\nshallots, mozzarella, hazelnuts and basil.","In a small bowl or jam jar with fitted lid,\r\nadd the vinegar, fig jam, olive oil and\r\nsome seasoning. Shake well and pour\r\nover salad just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7794,7794,'en','Roasted peppers with tomatoes & anchovies','This vibrant dish has all the flavours of the Mediterranean for holiday dining at home','["4 red peppers, halved and deseeded","50g can anchovies in oil, drained","8 smallish tomatoes, halved","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","2 rosemary sprigs","2 tbsp olive oil"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nPut the peppers into a large baking\r\ndish, toss with a little of the oil from the\r\nanchovy can, then turn cut-side up. Roast\r\nfor 40 mins, until soft but not collapsed.","Slice 8 of the anchovies along their\r\nlength. Put 2 halves of tomato, several\r\ngarlic slices, a few little rosemary sprigs\r\nand two pieces of anchovy into the hollow\r\nof each pepper. Drizzle over the olive oil,\r\nthen roast again for 30 mins until the\r\ntomatoes are soft and the peppers are\r\nfilled with pools of tasty juice. Leave to cool\r\nand serve warm or at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:20:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7796,7796,'en','Elote (Mexican street corn) pasta bake','Try this twist on a pasta bake, inspired by the flavours of Mexican street-food favourite elote – charred corn cobs topped with mayonnaise, cheese, herbs and chillies','["50g salted butter","1 tsp mustard powder","1 tsp smoked paprika","½ tsp cayenne pepper","20g plain flour","350ml whole milk","175g mild cheddar , grated","100g soured cream","25g pickled jalapeños , finely chopped","250g pasta (we used spirali)","Morrisons 2 Sweetcorn Cobs","2 spring onions , finely sliced","125g grated mozzarella"]','["Melt 20g butter in a large pan over a medium heat and, once foaming, add the mustard powder and spices and toast for 30 seconds. Sprinkle in the flour and cook for 2 mins, stirring continuously. Slowly pour in the milk, stirring continuously until you have a smooth sauce. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer and bubble until slightly thickened.","Remove from the heat and stir in the cheddar and soured cream until the cheese has melted and everything is incorporated. Add the jalapeños and season well with salt and pepper. Cook the pasta following pack instructions, then drain well.","Meanwhile, melt the remaining 30g butter in a separate frying pan over a medium heat and, once foaming, cook the sweetcorn for 5-6 mins, stirring often until golden and charred. Pour most of the sweetcorn into the cheese sauce along with the cooked pasta and spring onions. Mix well and season to taste.","Heat the grill to high. Pour the pasta into a large baking dish and sprinkle over the mozzarella and remaining charred sweetcorn. Slide under the grill for 5-6 mins, or until golden and bubbling. Let stand for 10 mins, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7798,7798,'en','Flan','Make this creamy, delicious flan inspired by the classic Mexican recipe – it’s easy to make and can be prepared a day ahead','["120g caster sugar","5 medium eggs , at room temperature","½-1 tsp vanilla extract","397g can condensed milk","400ml evaporated milk","150ml whole milk"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tip the caster sugar into a large saucepan along with 2 tbsp water, and cook over a high heat without stirring until the sugar starts to dissolve. Once the sugar has started to dissolve, you can swirl the pan occasionally until you have an evenly coloured, golden caramel, about 5 mins. (It''s crucial that the sugar dissolves completely to achieve this.) As soon as the mixture has turned into caramel, tip it into a 20cm flan tin (it should not be a loose-bottomed tin), tilting the tin back and forth to completely coat the base. Set aside to cool.","Whisk the eggs and vanilla together in a large bowl, then vigorously whisk in the condensed, evaporated and whole milks until well combined. Pour the custard into the tin and cover with foil, sealing well at the edge. Put the tin in a high-sided baking tray (about 5cm deep) and pour boiling water from the kettle into the tray so it reaches about halfway up the side of the tin. Transfer the tray in the oven and bake for 50 mins.","Carefully remove the tin from the tray and remove the foil. Put the tin on a work surface and leave to cool for about 30 mins. Once just warm, cover and chill for at least 6 hrs, or overnight.","When you''re ready to serve, run a cutlery knife around the edge of the tin, then put a large serving plate (use a plate with a lip, as the caramel will run out) over the tin and invert quickly. Cut into wedges to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7800,7800,'en','Pasilla mole','Make one of Mexico’s most iconic recipes, mole, a sauce made with chillies, spices and dark chocolate. Use as a topping on enchiladas and meat','["4 dried pasilla chillies , seeds and stems removed","3 dried guajillo chillies , seeds and stems removed","2 medium tomatoes","1 onion , quartered","1 pear , halved but core left in","2 garlic cloves","40g sesame seeds","60g peanuts , blanched","5g cinnamon stick","3 cloves","½ tsp oregano","½ tsp coriander","½ tsp cumin seeds","10 black peppercorns","3 tbsp pork lard or sunflower oil","300-400ml hot vegetable stock","1 tbsp tomato purée","45g dark chocolate"]','["Turn the grill on to high. Lay the dried chillies on a tray and grill to char them for 1 min on each side. Transfer them to a jug or bowl and cover with hot water to rehydrate for 10 mins.","Put the tomatoes, onion, pear and garlic on a tray and put them under the grill to blacken for about 10 mins, turning the tomatoes halfway. This might take more or less time, depending on your grill, so keep an eye on them. Take them out and set aside.","While the vegetables are charring, toast the sesame seeds and peanuts in a dry frying pan over a medium heat. Remove from the pan and set aside.","In the same frying pan, add all the spices and toast for 1 min. Remove them from the heat and set aside with the nuts.","Put the soaked chillies (reserving the liquid), charred vegetables, pear, nuts and spices in a high-speed blender adding about 200ml of the water from the chillies and blend until it is very smooth.","In a large cast iron pot or lidded pan, melt the pork lard or sunflower oil over a high heat. Pour in the mole and fry for 3 mins, stirring continuously. Add around 100ml of the vegetable stock and lower the heat, leaving to simmer gently for a few minutes.","Stir in the tomato purée, chocolate and ½ tbsp sea salt, mix to combine everything well. Add a bit more of the stock (50-100ml) and mix. Cook the mole for 1 hr, mixing in vegetable stock from time to time to avoid it burning or going dry. You want it to be the consistency of a loose paste. The mole is ready when a layer of oil appears on the surface. Serve over meat with rice or use to top enchiladas."]','2026-01-10 12:20:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7802,7802,'en','Beef enchiladas','Serve enchiladas for a Mexican-inspired family feast. Stuffed with beef mince and black beans and topped with melted cheese, they’re a guaranteed crowd-pleaser','["2 tsp olive or rapeseed oil","1 onion , finely chopped","400g beef mince","2 large garlic cloves , crushed or finely grated","2 tsp dried oregano","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp smoked paprika","½-1 tsp chilli powder (optional)","2 tbsp tomato purée","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can black beans","1 vegetable or chicken stock cube","8 medium tortillas","100g mature cheddar , grated","coriander leaves , to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan orsaucepanover a medium-low heat and fry the onion for 6-8 mins until softened but not golden. Tip in the beef mince and continue to fry until the beef has browned, about 5 mins. Stir in the garlic and cook for 1-2 mins before stirring in the oregano, cumin, paprika and chilli powder, if using. Cook for 1 min more.","Add the tomato purée, tomatoes and black beans, including the liquid from the can of beans. Crumble in the stock cube. Stir well, then add half a can of water and bring to a simmer. Simmer for 30 mins until the sauce has thickened. Remove from the heat.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Spoon an eighth of the beef mixture down the centre of one of the tortillas, then fold the sides in to enclose the filling. Arrange seam-side down in a large ovenproof dish, and repeat until all the filling and tortillas have been used, tucking the enchiladas next to one another snugly. Scatter the cheese over the top and bake for 15-20 mins until the cheese has melted and the tortillas are golden. Scatter over the coriander leaves to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7804,7804,'en','Chicken tinga tacos','Try a classic Mexican dish; a delicious shredded chicken stew with a touch of chipotle. It can be eaten on top of corn tostadas or in tacos','["3 boneless, skinless chicken breasts (about 650g)","3 plum tomatoes, halved (about 300g)","1 onion, cut in half","3 garlic cloves, crushed","3 tbsp vegetable oil","2-3 chipotle peppers in adobo sauce, minced","½ tsp dried oregano","12 x 12cm corn tortillas or tostadas","pickled red onions (see recipe, below)","200g queso fresco or feta cheese, crumbled","handful of coriander leaves","4 limes, cut into wedges"]','["Put the chicken in a mediumsaucepan, add the tomatoes, one of the onion halves, the garlic, 1 tsp salt and 500ml water. Bring to a boil over high heat, then lower the heat to a simmer. Put the lid on and cook for 15-20 mins until the chicken is cooked through. Turn the heat off and leave to cool slightly.","Thinly slice the remaining onion. Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a medium-low heat and fry the onion slices until translucent and slightly golden, about 5 mins. Meanwhile, shred the cooked chicken using two forks or your hands, reserving the broth and cooked vegetables. Set aside.","Put the cooked tomatoes, stewed onion and garlic in ablenderwith the chipotle peppers and blitz until smooth. Mix the sauce, 150ml of the reserved chicken broth and the dried oregano into the pan with the fried onions. Mix well and reduce the heat to low, cover the pan, and simmer for 15 mins, so the flavours can meld together. Stir in the shredded chicken to heat through, around 1-2 mins. Remove the pan from the heat and leave to cool slightly, around 3-5 mins. Serve the chicken tinga over warm tortillas or corn tostadas or and sprinkle over your favourite toppings (we used crumbled feta, pickled red onions and coriander). Serve the lime wedges on the side for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7806,7806,'en','Mexican-style stuffed peppers','Stuff peppers with rice and black beans, then top with chilli cheese and fresh guacamole for an easy vegetarian family meal. If the kids don’t like spice, use a mild cheese instead','["3 large mixed peppers , halved","oil , for drizzling","2 x 250g pouches lime & coriander rice , cooked","400g can black beans , drained and rinsed","6 Mexican-style chilli cheese slices (use regular cheddar or monterey jack, if you like)","150g fresh guacamole"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Remove the seeds and any white pith from the peppers and arrange, cut-side up, in aroasting tin. Drizzle with oil and season, then bake for 20 mins.","Combine the rice and beans. Remove the peppers from the oven and fill with the rice mixture. Top each with a slice of cheese and bake for 10-15 mins more, until the rice has melted and the filling is hot. Top with spoonfuls of guacamole."]','2026-01-10 12:20:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7808,7808,'en','Cabbage roll enchiladas','Pack in the flavour with these lighter spicy beef enchiladas. Delicious and gluten-free, they’re made with cabbage leaves instead of the usual tortillas','["1 tsp olive or rapeseed oil","2 peppers, deseeded and finely chopped","500g 5% fat steak mince","2 tbsp smoked paprika, plus extra to serve","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp ground coriander","400g chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp vegetable bouillon powder (ensure it is gluten-free if needed)","3 garlic cloves, finely grated","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped, plus extra to serve","2 x 400g cans black beans, undrained","1 large sweetheart cabbage, leaves peeled away (you’ll need 12 leaves)","150g bio yogurt","25g finely grated mature cheddar","handful of chopped coriander and lime wedges, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a deepnon-stick frying panand stir-fry the peppers briefly until softened. Add the beef and continue to fry, breaking it up with a wooden spoon until it turns brown, then stir in the spices and cook for 1 min more. Tip in the tomatoes, tomato purée, bouillon, powder, garlic, chilli and beans (along with the liquid from the cans), and simmer, uncovered, for 15 mins, stirring until the beef is cooked and the mixture is thick.","Meanwhile, bring a large pan of water to the boil. Add the cabbage leaves and cook, submerged, for 2 mins until softened. Rinse under cold running water to cool. Drain.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Working with one cabbage leaf at a time, spoon some of the meat mixture into the centre. Roll up so the filling is enclosed. Lay seam-side down in a large shallow baking dish. Repeat with the rest of the leaves and filling, packing the rolls against one another in the dish.","Mix the yogurt and cheese. Spread over the rolls. Bake for 20-25 mins until bubbling. Sprinkle over the coriander, extra chilli and paprika. Serve with lime wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:20:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7810,7810,'en','BBQ halloumi fajita skewers','Love fajitas? These grilled halloumi versions will be a winner. Cooking the cheese, peppers and onions on the barbecue imparts a smoky flavour','["3 peppers (any colour), cut into wedges","2 large red onions, cut into wedges","2 x 250g blocks of halloumi, halved then cut into quarters","2 tbsp olive oil","2 ripe avocados, halved and stoned","1 large lime, juiced","8 soft tortilla wraps","small bunch of coriander, leaves picked","120g soured cream","chipotle chilli sauce, to serve (optional)","1 ½ tbsp smoked paprika","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp dried oregano","½ tsp garlic powder","4 metal skewers"]','["Combine all the ingredients for the spice mix. Light thebarbecueand wait until the coals are ashen.","Put the peppers, onions and halloumi in a bowl, drizzle with the oil, sprinkle over the spice mix and season with salt and pepper. Gently toss together to coat the veg and cheese, being careful not to break up the halloumi. Thread the peppers, onions and cheese alternately onto the skewers.","Scoop the avocado flesh into a bowl along with the lime juice and a pinch of salt. Mash everything together with a fork and set aside until you’re ready to eat.","Cook the skewers on the barbecue for 5-8 mins on each side (this will depend on the heat of the barbecue). The peppers, onions and halloumi should be soft and charred in places. Meanwhile, warm the tortilla wraps on the barbecue, then wrap in a clean tea towel to keep warm.","Serve the skewers alongside the tortillas, smashed avocado, coriander and soured cream, and some chipotle chilli sauce, if you like, then let everyone dig in to assemble their own fajitas."]','2026-01-10 12:20:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7812,7812,'en','Chicken chilli con carne','Not too keen on red meat? Try our chicken version of chilli con carne, with all the richness of the classic dish. It’s the perfect sofa supper on cold nights','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, sliced","2 mixed peppers, sliced (use red, yellow or orange peppers)","2 large garlic cloves, crushed","1 small bunch of coriander, stalks finely chopped and leaves roughly chopped","½ tbsp ground coriander","1 tbsp ground cumin","1-2 tsp chipotle paste","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp tomato purée","300ml chicken stock","1 small cinnamon stick","4 chicken thighs, bone-in","400g can black beans","400g can kidney beans, drained","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","20g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids)","cooked rice or tortilla chips","guacamole and soured cream (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in acasserole dishover a medium heat, and fry the onion and peppers for 10-12 mins, or until softened. Add the garlic, coriander stalks, ground coriander, cumin and chipotle paste, and fry for 2 mins more. Tip in the tomatoes, tomato pureé and stock, then add the cinnamon stick. Nestle the chicken thighs into the mixture, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 45 mins or until the chicken is tender. Remove the chicken from the casserole and transfer to achopping board, then shred the meat off the bone using two forks.","Return the shredded chicken to the pan, then tip in the black beans along with the liquid from the can, the drained kidney beans, vinegar and chocolate. Stir well to combine all of the ingredients and melt the chocolate, then turn the heat up to medium and simmer, uncovered, for 10-15 mins, or until the mixture has thickened slightly.","Remove the cinnamon stick, season to taste and stir though most, or all of the coriander leaves (you can reserve a few leaves to scatter over at the end, if you like). Serve the chilli with rice or tortilla chips, topped with guacamole and soured cream, if using, and scatter over any remaining coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:20:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7814,7814,'en','Smoky chilli con carne','Add chipotle and brown the mince first for an out of this world chilli con carne. With bags of flavour, this will soon become your go-to chilli recipe…','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","400g beef mince","1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp cumin seeds","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp dried oregano","1 tbsp cider vinegar","1-2 tsp chipotle paste","1 tbsp tomato paste","400g can chopped tomatoes","¼ tsp yeast extract","1 beef stock cube","400g can black or kidney beans","cooked rice","soured cream","sliced jalapeños from a jar, drained","handful of coriander leaves","1 small onion, chopped"]','["Heat the oil in acasseroleor shallow saucepan over a medium heat, then fry the beef for about 10 mins until any fat has been released and the beef has started to brown. Add the onion and fry for another 8-10 mins until the onions have softened and started to brown slightly. Add the garlic and stir for another minute.","Stir in the cumin seeds, ground coriander, oregano and a good grinding of black pepper, and continue to fry the mixture for a few minutes until fragrant. Add the vinegar, then the chipotle and tomato pastes, and stir everything together. Tip in the tomatoes and a can of water, then add the yeast extract and crumble in the stock cube. Stir well and bring the mixture to a simmer. Cook for 20 mins, stirring occasionally.","When the chilli has thickened, tip in the beans and half the liquid from the can. Simmer for 20 mins more, taste for seasoning, then serve with rice, and top with the soured cream, jalapeños, coriander leaves and onion."]','2026-01-10 12:20:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7816,7816,'en','Crispy chicken & pineapple tacos','Treat yourself to a Friday night round of crispy, spicy chicken tacos with a punchy pineapple and chilli salsa.','["6 skin-on boneless chicken thighs","2 tsp smoked paprika","2 tsp ground coriander","2½ tbsp olive oil","3 tbsp mayonnaise","100ml soured cream","½ tbsp chipotle paste","1 large, ripe avocado","1 lime, juiced","8 small flour tortillas","½ medium pineapple","½ small red onion, finely chopped","1 red chilli, finely chopped","small bunch of coriander, finely chopped","1 lime, juiced"]','["Remove the skin from the chicken and set the skin aside. Slice the chicken into strips. Toss in a bowl with the paprika, ground coriander, 2 tbsp of the olive oil and a good pinch of salt. Cover and leave to marinate for at least 1 hr or up to 24 hrs.","For the salsa, cut the pineapple down the length, cut out the core, then cut the flesh into small cubes. Toss in a bowl with the red onion, chilli, coriander and lime juice.","Heat the remaining oil in a non-stick frying pan. Season the chicken skin with salt and fry over a high heat for 3-5 mins on each side until golden brown and crisp. Set aside on a plate lined with kitchen paper. Tip the marinated chicken into the pan and fry over medium-high heat for 10-12 mins, turning halfway through.","Mix the mayo, soured cream and chipotle paste together in a bowl. Mash the avocado with the lime juice and some seasoning in another bowl.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and warm the tortillas on a baking tray for 5-7 mins, or in a microwave for 1-2 mins. Let everyone fill their own with the spicy soured cream, avocado, chicken, salsa and crumbled chicken skin."]','2026-01-10 12:20:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7818,7818,'en','Barbacoa pulled-beef tacos','Treat family and friends to these tasty pulled-beef tacos marinated in a punchy sauce with chipotle, lime juice and garlic. It’s a great sharing dish','["100ml cider vinegar","2 limes, juiced","1 tbsp chipotle paste","6 garlic cloves, crushed","pinch of ground cloves","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp dried oregano","2 bay leaves, crumbled","1 tsp light brown soft sugar","1kg boneless beef shin, cut into large pieces","300ml beef stock","6 large or 12 small soft tacos","small handful of coriander, chopped","pickled red onion, sliced radishes, or crumbled feta"]','["Pour the vinegar and lime juice into a large bowl (it should be able to hold all the beef ). Whisk in the chipotle paste, garlic, spices, herbs, sugar and some seasoning. Mix in the beef, ensuring it’s well-coated, then cover and leave to marinate for 1-2 hrs, or chill overnight.","Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/ gas 3. Put the beef on a plate, then tip the marinade into an ovenproof casserole, along with any bits that have stuck to the bowl. Pour in the stock and bring to a simmer. Add the beef and simmer for 1 min, then cover and cook in the oven for 2 hrs.","If the beef isn’t tender enough to shred, cook for 15 mins more, then check again. Leave until cool enough to handle, then lift onto a board using a slotted spoon. Bring the sauce to the boil and reduce to about 300ml. Meanwhile, roughly shred the beef, discarding any fat or gristle. Stir back into the sauce to reheat, then serve in the casserole dish with the tacos, coriander and toppings on the side for everyone to help themselves."]','2026-01-10 12:20:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7820,7820,'en','Vegan fajitas','Make a vegan version of fajitas with all the flavours of the classic Mexican dish. It makes a great sharing dish where everyone can help themselves','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","2 red or yellow peppers, cut into strips","1 red onion, sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","½ tsp chilli powder or chilli flakes","½ tsp smoked paprika","½ tsp ground cumin","1 lime, juiced","400g can black beans, rinsed and drained","small bunch coriander, finely chopped","4 large or 8-12 small tortillas","1 avocado, sliced","dairy free yogurt, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan and fry the peppers and onions over a medium high heat until tender and starting to turn golden brown, about 6-8 mins. Add the garlic and spices and fry for 1 min more until fragrant. Add half of the lime juice and season. Transfer to a serving dish and keep warm while you heat the beans.","Tip the black beans into the same frying pan and add the remaining lime juice. Season well, and stir until warmed through and coated in any remaining spices from the pan. Stir in most of the coriander.","Warm the tortillas in the microwave or wrapped in foil in a low oven, then cover with a tea towel to keep them warm. Serve the wraps with the peppers, beans, avocado, dairy-free yogurt, extra coriander and extra lime wedges to squeeze over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7822,7822,'en','Pulled pork tacos with pineapple salsa','Put the pork for these pulled pork tacos in the slow cooker in the morning, and you’ll have a family feast for dinner. Serve with cabbage, avocado and salsa','["1½ kg boneless pork shoulder, rind removed and cut into 6 chunks","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp chipotle paste","1 orange, juiced","2 limes, juiced","432g can pineapple, juice only (save the chunks for the salsa, below)","2 tsp dried oregano","2 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","grating of fresh nutmeg","432g can pineapple, drained","½ red onion, finely chopped","handful of coriander, chopped","1 lime, juiced","1 red chilli, chopped (optional)","8-10 taco shells or wraps","½ red cabbage, finely shredded","1 avocado, sliced","100ml soured cream (optional)"]','["Put the pork in a large, lidded ovenproof dish with the remaining ingredients and mix well to coat. If you can, chill and marinate overnight.","Heat the oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Put the lid on the dish and cook on the middle shelf for 4 hrs. Check after 2 hrs and spoon over the juices. Check the meat is tender by pulling it apart with two forks. If it resists, cook for 1-2 hrs more.","Mix the ingredients for the salsa in a bowl and warm the tacos. Shred the pork and remove any fat or sinew. Serve with the cabbage, avocado, soured cream and salsa."]','2026-01-10 12:20:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7824,7824,'en','Sweetcorn fritters with chipotle cod','Rustle up some sweetcorn fritters to enjoy with cod in a spicy tomato sauce for a speedy midweek meal. It’s ready in just 20 minutes','["3 large eggs","2 tbsp plain flour","200g can sweetcorn","3 spring onions, finely sliced","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 garlic clove, finely sliced","200g cherry tomatoes, halved","1-2 tbsp chipotle chilli sauce","1 lime, zested and juiced","2 skinless cod fillets","½ small bunch of coriander, chopped"]','["Beat the eggs and flour together until smooth. Stir through the corn, spring onion and some seasoning.","Heat half the oil in a medium non-stick frying pan. Pour in the batter and fry over a medium heat for 3 mins on each side until golden.","Heat the grill to high. Heat the remaining oil in a frying pan and cook the garlic and tomatoes for 5 mins. Stir through the chipotle and the lime juice and zest.","Meanwhile, cook the fish on a baking tray under the grill, set to medium-high and cook for 3-4 mins on each side.","Slice the corn fritter into four and divide between two plates. Sprinkle over the coriander and serve with the fish and chipotle tomatoes."]','2026-01-10 12:20:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7826,7826,'en','Barbacoa marinated lamb cutlets','Rub lamb cutlets with this traditional North Mexican marinade made from ancho chillies, garlic, and chipotle chilli. The marinade gives the lamb a lovely flavour','["2 dried ancho chillies","1 dried chipotle chilli","6 garlic cloves","1⁄2 onion","100ml olive oil","8 lamb cutlets","micro herbs, to decorate"]','["The day before, remove seeds and stem from the ancho and chipotle chillies. Put skin-side down in a dry frying pan over a medium heat, turning until softened and toasted without burning.","In the same pan, cook the garlic and onions on a medium heat until slightly blackened all over. Once cooled, place in a blender with the chillies, olive oil and a pinch of salt. Whizz to a paste.","Rub the lamb cutlets with the marinade at least 12 hours before cooking, preferably overnight, and store in the fridge. Remove them at least an hour before cooking to allow them to come to room temperature.","Heat a frying or griddle pan over a medium heat. Cook the lamb cutlets until the fat turns brown and starts to melt (around 7 mins), then cook the other side for at least 5 mins more – this will need at least two batches, depending on the size of your pan. We like to serve them pink, sprinkled with sea salt and herbs."]','2026-01-10 12:20:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7828,7828,'en','Classic guacamole','Enjoy a Mexican-inspired guacamole from chef Edson Diaz-Fuentes, with green jalapeños, coriander and lime. It’s perfect to serve with tortilla chips','["1⁄4 red onion","2 ripe tomatoes","a few coriander sprigs","2 green jalapeños","2 ripe avocados, halved","1 lime, juiced","tortilla chips, to serve"]','["Finely chop the red onion, tomatoes, coriander and jalapeños separately. Mix together the onion, tomatoes, coriander and a pinch of salt. Keep the jalapeños to one side.","Scoop all the avocado flesh into a bowl and crush with a fork, leaving it chunky – it should not be puréed. Add the lime juice and onion mixture, combining gently.","Add jalapeños, to taste, and more sea salt if needed. Serve with the tortilla chips."]','2026-01-10 12:20:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7830,7830,'en','Mexican seafood cocktail','Make this classic starter from Mexico’s Pacific coast. Prawns and scallops are used here, but any seafood or fish will work well','["300g cooked prawns","200g raw scallops (you can cook them, if preferred)","20g tomato ketchup","1 tsp Tabasco sauce (add more if you like)","1 tsp Worcestershire sauce","50ml tomato juice","25ml lime juice","50ml orange juice","1 ripe avocado, diced","a few coriander sprigs, chopped","coriander cress, or micro coriander (optional)","corn tortillas or crackers"]','["Peel all the prawns and chop the raw scallops. Mix the ketchup, Tabasco sauce, Worcestershire sauce, tomato juice, lime juice and orange juice in a mixing bowl. Season, adding more Tabasco if you prefer it spicy. Fold in the seafood and some cubes of avocado, being careful to mix it in gently so it doesn’t go mushy.","Spoon into bowls or glasses and add some chopped coriander. Serve with some coriander cress on top, if using, and corn tortillas or crackers for scooping."]','2026-01-10 12:20:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7832,7832,'en','Tortillas','Forget shop-bought and try homemade tortillas. They''ll store for two days or you can freeze them to use later. They''re perfect for wraps','["250g plain flour, plus a little more for dusting","2 tbsp vegetable oil","½ tsp fine salt"]','["Combine the flour, vegetable oil and salt in a bowl. Pour over 150ml warm water and knead to bring the mixture together. Remove from the bowl and knead on a lightly floured work surface for around 5 mins until you make a soft, smooth ball of dough. Cover with a clean tea towel and rest for at least 15 mins before rolling out.","Cut the dough into 6 equal pieces (about 75g each). Roll out each ball of dough as thinly as possible on a floured work surface. They should make rounds about 20 cm wide, 2mm thick.","Heat a large frying pan over a medium-high heat. Cook the tortillas for 1-2 mins on each side until golden brown and toasted. Wrap them in foil and cover in a tea towel to keep warm, while you cook the rest. Keeps for two days well wrapped, or cool, wrap and freeze for up to three months."]','2026-01-10 12:20:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7834,7834,'en','Vegan bean chilli fries','Treat family and friends to Mexican-inspired loaded fries. This plant-based dish is great for entertaining, whether for a movie night or party','["400g frozen French fries","2 tbsp olive oil","1 finely chopped onion","1 ripe avocado","½  lime, juiced, plus wedges to serve","½  finely chopped small red onion","1 finely chopped tomato","1 crushed garlic clove","½  tbsp chipotle paste","½  tsp ground cumin","½  tsp ground coriander","400g can mixed beans, drained","½  400g can chopped tomatoes","½  chopped small bunch of coriander","2 tbsp dairy-free crème fraîche","2 tbsp crispy fried onions"]','["Cook the French fries following pack instructions. Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in a frying pan and fry the onion for 10 mins. Prepare the guacamole by mashing the avocado and mixing in the lime juice, red onion and chopped tomato.","Add the garlic, chipotle paste, ground cumin and ground coriander to the onions, which should be softened and translucent. Fry for 1 min, then tip in the mixed beans and the chopped tomatoes. Simmer for 10 mins, then stir in most of the coriander and season. Tip the fries into a bowl and top with the bean chilli, guacamole, crème fraîche and crispy fried onions. Scatter over the remaining coriander and serve with lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:20:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7836,7836,'en','Smoky pulled aubergine & black bean tacos','These summery veggie tacos are filled with a charred, smoky aubergine and black bean ragu, topped with creamy feta and crunchy pink pickled onions. They also contain four of your 5-a-day – bonus!','["2 aubergines","2 tbsp olive oil","1 bay leaf","½  tsp cumin seeds","1 red onion, diced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp tomato purée","400g fresh tomatoes, chopped","pinch dried oregano or thyme","½  tsp chilli powder","pinch chilli flakes","2 tsp red wine vinegar","2 x 400g cans black beans, 1 drained and rinsed","½  lime, juiced, plus wedges to serve","8 small tortillas, warmed","small bunch coriander, leaves picked","50g feta cheese, crumbled","½  iceberg lettuce, shredded","pink pickled onions, to serve (see tip, below)"]','["Prick the aubergines all over with a fork, then set over a medium gas flame (or on the coals of a barbecue or under the grill) and cook, turning occasionally with tongs, until blackened and collapsing, about 20-25 mins. Transfer to a plate and leave to cool. Peel the skin from the cooled aubergines or scoop out the flesh using a spoon. Try to remove most of the skin, but don’t worry if a few flecks remain.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the olive oil in a large ovenproof frying pan with the bay leaf and cumin seeds. When they start to sizzle, add the onion and garlic. Fry for about 5 mins until fragrant but not coloured, then stir in the tomato purée and cook it down for a couple of mins.","Add the tomatoes and dried oregano, and cook for a few mins more until they have collapsed into the sauce. Add the aubergine flesh, chilli powder, chilli flakes and vinegar, and cook, stirring, for 1 min, then tip in the cans of black beans, one drained and one still with its liquid. Squeeze over a little of the lime juice and cook for 5 mins until reduced and bubbling, then transfer to the oven and roast for 15-20 mins until deep, dark and fully reduced.","Season with more lime juice, if you like, and spoon the aubergine mixture into the warm tortillas with the coriander, crumbled feta, lettuce and pink pickled onions to serve"]','2026-01-10 12:20:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7838,7838,'en','Tres leches cake','Bake a classic Mexican tres leches cake for an afternoon treat or coffee morning – it gets its name from the three types of milk used','["flavourless oil, for the tin","4 eggs, separated","200g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","100ml milk","410g can evaporated milk","200ml sweetened condensed milk","300ml double cream","2 tbsp icing sugar","pinch cinnamon"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly oil and line the base and sides of a 20cm square cake tin.","Put the egg whites in a large bowl with a pinch of salt. Beat with an electric hand whisk until foamy, about 3 mins. Keep mixing while you add 150g of the sugar, a spoonful at a time, until thick and glossy.","In another bowl, mix the egg yolks, remaining sugar and vanilla (no need to clean the beaters first) for 2 mins, or until pale and foamy. Add the flour, baking powder and milk to the egg yolks, and use a spatula to fold everything together.","Add a large spoonful of egg white to the cake mix, beat together to loosen the mixture, then gently fold through the remaining egg whites with a large metal spoon (being careful not to over-stir so you don’t knock out too much air), until you have a smooth batter.","Pour into the tin, smooth the top and bake for 40-45 mins until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Mix together the evaporated milk, condensed milk and 3 tbsp of the cream.","Leave the cake to cool for 10 mins in the tin, then ease a knife around the sides. Poke holes over the surface with a skewer, then pour over half the milk mixture. After 5 mins or so, most of it should have soaked into the cake. Leave for another 5 mins, then transfer to a plate and pour over some of the remaining milk until it starts to leak a little. (Any leftover milk that won’t soak into the cake can be served on the side.) Leave to cool.","Whip the remaining cream and icing sugar together until holding soft peaks. Spread the cream over the cake and sprinkle with a little cinnamon. Can be made and chilled a day ahead. Serve in squares with any remaining soaking milk."]','2026-01-10 12:20:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7840,7840,'en','Spice-cured tuna tacos','Use the freshest fish possible in these tacos. Instead of tuna, you could use fresh or smoked salmon, sliced scallops, picked white crabmeat, or chopped cooked king prawns','["400g fresh line-caught tuna","3 tbsp olive oil","2 limes, zested, 1 juiced","1 tbsp cumin seeds","1 tbsp coriander seeds","½ tsp chilli flakes","3 ripe avocados, de-stoned and peeled","3 tbsp coriander leaves","1 tbsp pickle liquorfrom the pickled jalapeño chillies","8 small soft flour tacos","vegetable oil, for brushing and drizzling","pickled jalapeño chillies","50g pomegranate seeds","1 bunch coriander, chopped, with a few leaves left whole","4 shredded spring onions","2 limes, cut into wedges"]','["Slice the tuna into 1cm strips, then dice into rough 1cm cubes. Drizzle over the olive oil and scatter over the lime zest, stir and put in the fridge for 20 mins or so. Gently toast the cumin and coriander in a small frying pan, then tip into a pestle and mortar with a pinch of salt and the chilli flakes and crush to a coarse powder. Stir the spice mix into the tuna with the lime juice and put the bowl back in the fridge for at least 10 mins or up to 1 hr.","To make the avocado purée, put all the ingredients in a food processor with a pinch of salt and blitz until you have a smooth purée, adding a little oil if it’s too thick to blitz. Spoon the mixture into a container.","If you like your tacos crispy, heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4, brush them with a little oil, place on a baking sheet and cook for 10-15 mins. To build each taco, spoon on some avocado purée and spread out to the edge. Spoon on the spiced tuna and sprinkle over the chillies, pomegranate seeds, coriander and spring onions, drizzle with more oil and add a lime wedge to the plate. Eat with your hands, if soft, or a knife and fork if crispy."]','2026-01-10 12:20:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7842,7842,'en','Smoky pork & black bean tacos','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyMexican pork chilli with a smoky barbecued flavour, served in crispy tortilla shells with ripe avocado','["2 tsp vegetable oil","½ red onion, chopped","2 tsp each smoked paprika and ground cumin","500g pack lean pork mince","300ml passata","5 tbsp barbecue sauce","400g can black bean, drained","small bunch coriander, chopped","8 taco shells","1 ripe avocado, peeled and sliced","½ iceberg lettuce, finely shredded","soured cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan, add the onion and cook for 5 mins until softened. Sprinkle over the spices and cook for 1 min more. Add the mince, breaking it up with the back of a wooden spoon, and stir until cooked through.","Stir the passata and barbecue sauce into the pan along with 4 tbsp water. Increase the heat and allow the sauce to bubble and reduce until it clings to the meat. Add the beans, season and cook for a further 2 mins, then stir in the coriander. Heat the tacos following pack instructions.","Use the pork and bean mix to fill the tacos, top with slices of avocado, shredded iceberg lettuce and a dollop of soured cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7844,7844,'en','Pulled pork with Mexican almond mole sauce','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyPopular in Mexican cuisine, a mole is a thick sauce with complex flavours. Great help-yourself party food','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","750g trimmed pork shoulder, cut into large chunks","1 tsp tomato purée","200ml hot chicken stock","strips of zest and juice 1 orange","1 cinnamon stick","2 thyme sprigs","2 onions, cut into chunks","2 garlic clove","250g pack cherry tomato","2-3 tbsp vegetable oil","2 x 335g packs corn tortillas","50g flaked almond","50g raisin","2 tsp each ground coriander and cumin","1-2 tsp chipotle paste","25g plain chocolate, finely chopped","200g radish, trimmed and thinly sliced","2 avocado, chopped","juice 2 limes","bunch coriander, leaves only","1-2 green chillies, finely chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a casserole dish. Brown the pork for about 10 mins until golden all over, stir in the tomato purée and cook for 1 min. Pour over the chicken stock, then add the strips of orange zest and juice, cinnamon and thyme. Bring to the boil, reduce the heat, then cover and simmer for 1½ hrs.","Meanwhile, make the sauce. Heat a non-stick frying pan and dry-fry the onions and whole garlic cloves for about 5 mins, turning often until softened and lightly charred all over. Tip into a blender. Add the tomatoes to the pan. Cook for 3 mins until starting to blister and char, then tip into the blender. Add 1 tbsp oil to the pan. Fry 1 of the tortillas for 1 min on each side until golden. Tear into pieces and tip into the blender. Adding more oil if you need, fry the almonds for 3 mins until golden. Add to the blender. Finally add the raisins, coriander and cumin to the pan and cook for 1-2 mins until the raisins are plump. Add these to the blender along with the chipotle paste and finely chopped chocolate. Whizz together until a rough paste forms.","Using a slotted spoon, remove the meat from the pan to a board, leave to cool a little, then use forks or your fingers to tear into shreds. Remove the cinnamon, orange zest and thyme sprigs from the pan and discard. Pour a little of the cooking liquid into the blender, then carefully whizz together with the mole sauce. Tip sauce into the pan with the rest of the pork cooking juices. Simmer on the hob for 10-15 mins, then return the shredded pork to the pan and cook for 20 mins more. Season to taste. Can be made up to this point up to 2 days in advance and stored in the fridge or frozen for up to 3 months.","Just before serving, microwave the tortillas for 1 min to warm them. Toss together all the salsa ingredients and season well. Set everything out on the table. To serve, spoon some of the pork mole onto a tortilla, top with some salsa, then roll up and eat."]','2026-01-10 12:20:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7846,7846,'en','Pork tenderloin with chipotle sauce & pickled red onions','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThe ultimate Friday night food, these smoky flavoured wraps will bring the taste of Mexico to your table','["2 red onion, one thickly and one thinly sliced","juice 2 limes","2 tsp dried oregano","8 fat garlic clove, unpeeled","6 medium plum tomatoes, halved","2 tbsp chipotle paste (we used Discovery, available from Waitrose)","2 tbsp chilli powder","3 tbsp soft brown sugar","2 pork tenderloin, about 500g each","coriander sprigs and warm soft tortillas (flour or corn), to serve"]','["Place the thinly sliced onion in a bowl with juice 1 lime, half the oregano and a pinch each of salt and pepper. Set aside.","Dry-fry the whole garlic in a non-stick pan until blackened on both sides, about 8 mins, then peel. Heat the grill. Arrange the thickly sliced onion on a baking tray with the tomatoes, cut-side up. Season and grill until blackened, about 8 mins. Tip into a bowl with the garlic, chipotle paste, 1 tsp chilli powder, 1 tbsp sugar and remaining lime juice. Season and whizz in a blender until smooth. Gently heat through in a pan.","Rub the pork with the remaining chilli powder, oregano, sugar and seasoning. Grill for 5 mins each side until cooked. Serve sliced in warm tortillas with some sauce, the pickled onions and coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:20:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7848,7848,'en','Mexican supper pot','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyHelp your kids learn to cook, with this simple one pot tasty meal – serve with tortilla chips for a hands-on meal','["2 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","1 onion, chopped","450g pork (or turkey) mince","400g can chopped tomatoes","3 tbsp tomato purée","2 x 250g sachets ready-cooked Mexican rice (see tip)","a handful of fresh parsley, roughly chopped","plain tortilla chips, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a medium saucepan until hot, tip in the onion and let it sizzle and turn golden (4-5 minutes) as you stir occasionally. Add the mince and cook until it’s no longer pink, stirring to break it up and scraping the bottom of the pan so it doesn''t stick. If it does, add a splash of oil.","Tip the tomatoes into the mince, then fill the can with water and pour this in. Add the tomato purée, give it all a good stir and let it come to the boil. Simmer, covered, for 25 minutes to cook the mince through.","Stir in the rice from both packets and let it heat through gently, then stir in the parsley. Serve with tortilla chips."]','2026-01-10 12:20:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7850,7850,'en','Mexican steak with homemade refried beans','All the flavours of a good beef chilli con carne in a fraction of the time, cook it in a frying pan or on the bbq','["2 small sirloin or rump steaks, or 1 big","2 tsp sunflower oil","1 tsp chipotle paste (we used Discovery)","about 2 whole roasted red pepper from a jar, quartered","1 small ripe avocado, stoned and chunkily diced","1 lime, cut into wedges","few coriander sprigs, leaves picked","few dollops soured cream","1 onion, chopped","1 tbsp sunflower or vegetable oil","2 tsp ground cumin","½  tsp hot paprika, plus a pinch extra (optional)","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tsp each chipotle paste, brown sugar and wine vinegar (red or white)","400g can black beans, drained and rinsed","400g can pinto or kidney beans, drained and rinsed"]','["Put the steaks on a plate and rub them all\r\nover with the oil, chipotle paste and ½ tsp\r\nfreshly ground black pepper. Leave at room\r\ntemperature while you start the beans.","For the beans, soften the onion in the\r\noil in a frying pan. Once softened, stir\r\nin the spices for 2 mins, followed by\r\nthe tomato purée, chipotle, sugar and\r\nvinegar. Tip in all the beans with 1 tsp\r\nsalt, some pepper and half a can of\r\nwater. Bubble gently until the water is\r\nalmost evaporated.","Heat a griddle or non-stick frying pan (or\r\na barbecue). Season the steaks with salt.\r\nFry, with the peppers alongside, for about\r\n2 mins on each side, until the steaks are\r\ncooked to your liking and the peppers are\r\ncharred. Lift the steaks onto a clean plate\r\nto rest for a few mins while you mash\r\ntwo-thirds of the beans. Stir in the whole\r\nbeans and check the seasoning.","Slice the steaks. Spread a good pile of\r\nbeans onto 2 plates, and top with sliced\r\nsteak and peppers. Add the avocado, a\r\nbig squeeze of lime juice, some coriander\r\nleaves, a good dollop of soured cream\r\nand a pinch more paprika, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7852,7852,'en','Grilled salmon tacos with chipotle lime yogurt','Grill healthy fish with chipotle spice then serve with cabbage salad, coriander and chilli in soft tortillas','["1 tsp garlic salt","2 tbsp smoked paprika","good pinch of sugar","500g salmon fillets","200ml fat-free yogurt","1 tbsp chipotle paste or hot chilli sauce","juice 1 lime","8 small soft flour tortillas, warmed","¼ small green cabbage, finely shredded","small bunch coriander, picked into sprigs","few pickled jalapeno chillies, sliced","lime wedges, to serve","hot chilli sauce to serve, (optional)"]','["Rub the garlic salt, paprika, sugar\r\nand some seasoning into the flesh\r\nof the salmon fillet. Heat grill to high.","Mix the yogurt, chipotle paste or hot\r\nsauce and lime juice together in a bowl\r\nwith some seasoning, and set aside.\r\nPlace the salmon on a baking tray lined\r\nwith foil and grill, skin-side down, for\r\n7-8 mins until cooked through. Remove\r\nfrom the grill and carefully peel off\r\nand discard the skin.","Flake the salmon into large chunks and\r\nserve with the warmed tortillas, chipotle\r\nyogurt, shredded cabbage, coriander,\r\njalapeños and lime wedges. Add a shake\r\nof hot sauce, if you like it spicy."]','2026-01-10 12:20:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7854,7854,'en','Chicken fajitas with avocado & Caesar dressing','A fun, light and healthy family dinner that the kids can get involved in making too','["4 boneless, skinless chicken breasts","1 small lime","2 garlic cloves","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp chilli powder (optional)","1 large red pepper","15g fresh coriander","2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 Romaine lettuce heart","2 ripe avocados","8 flour tortillas","Caesar dressing"]','["Slice the chicken on a board\r\nwith a sharp knife, then put in a\r\nlarge bowl. Grate in the lime zest\r\nand squeeze in the juice. Crush\r\nthe garlic, then add to the chicken\r\nwith the ground coriander, chilli\r\npowder (if using) and seasoning\r\nto taste. Stir well, cover, then chill\r\nuntil ready to cook. You could do\r\nthis the night before.","On a clean chopping board,\r\nand using a clean knife cut the\r\navocado into quarters. Ease the\r\nquarters away from the stone,\r\nthen peel off the skin. Slice or\r\nchop the flesh. Thinly slice the\r\nlettuce. Halve the pepper, remove\r\nseeds and stalk, then slice or chop\r\nthe flesh.","Chop the fresh coriander, then stir\r\nit into the chicken. Heat the oil in\r\na wok or large frying pan. Add\r\nthe pepper, then stir, continuously,\r\nover a high heat for 2 mins. This is\r\ncalled stir-frying. Add the chicken,\r\nthen stir-fry over a high heat for\r\n5 mins until the chicken is cooked.","Heat a large, dry frying pan\r\nuntil hot, then add the tortillas one\r\nat a time to heat and brown a little.\r\nTurn them over with tongs so that\r\nboth sides are warmed.","Take a warm tortilla and\r\nspread with some Caesar\r\ndressing. Add some lettuce\r\nand avocado, then some of the\r\nchicken and pepper mixture\r\nand a little more Caesar dressing\r\nif you like.","Fold in the sides of the\r\ntortilla, then carefully roll up\r\nso that the filling is completely\r\nenclosed. Alternatively, put the\r\ndishes of the salad, chicken\r\nand tortillas on the table for\r\nthe family to make up their own."]','2026-01-10 12:20:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7856,7856,'en','Mexican chilli chicken','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA great spicy supper that can be made in advance','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, halved and sliced","2 tsp each chilli powder and ground cumin","2 x 400g cans peeled plum tomatoes","1 chicken stock cube","200g piece chorizo, skinned and diced","8 chicken thighs, skinned","2 red peppers, seeded and cut into chunks","2 x 300g cans cannellini beans, drained","1 large avocado, stoned, peeled and sliced","lime juice","handful fresh coriander","4 large spoonfuls soured cream"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan and fry the onion until softened. Stir in the spices and cook for a few secs. Pour in the tomatoes and 2 cans of water, then crumble in the stock cube. Bring to the boil and add the chorizo and chicken thighs. Push the chicken under the liquid, cover and simmer for 20 mins.","Stir the peppers into the pan, then cook for 20 mins more. Tip in the cannellini beans.","To eat now: Warm through to heat the beans. Toss the avocado with the lime and some salt and serve on top of the casserole with a sprinkling of coriander. Top each portion with soured cream. Serve with rice, jacket potatoes or a handful of spicy tortilla chips.","To eat later: Cool and keep in the fridge for up to 48 hours. Warm on top of the stove until bubbling and serve as above."]','2026-01-10 12:20:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7858,7858,'en','Grilled salmon with chilli glaze & lime crème fraîche','Spice up your midweek meal with this fragrant Mexican recipe','["6 garlic cloves, unpeeled","1 small onion, cut into thick slices","1 ancho chilli or large red dried chilli, deseeded and trimmed","4 tbsp soft brown sugar","4 tbsp cider vinegar","4 x 150g skinless salmon fillets","1 lime, zested, then cut into wedges","200g crème fraîche or soured cream","chopped coriander, to serve (optional)"]','["Blacken the whole garlic and the onion\r\nslices on all sides in a large, dry non-stick\r\nfrying pan. Remove, cool briefly, then\r\npeel the garlic cloves. Soak the ancho\r\nchilli in boiling water for 15 mins, drain,\r\nthen place in a blender with the sugar,\r\ncider vinegar, garlic, onion and some salt\r\nand pepper. Whizz to a smooth sauce.","Heat the grill. Brush each salmon fillet\r\nliberally with the sauce and save any\r\nremaining. Grill for 8 mins. Meanwhile,\r\nmix the lime zest with the crème fraîche.\r\nServe the fish with extra chilli sauce,\r\na dollop of the crème fraîche and lime\r\nwedges for squeezing over. Sprinkle with\r\ncoriander, if you like, and serve with\r\ngreen beans or rice and a salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7860,7860,'en','Mexican potatoes','Spicy fried potatoes with soured cream for dipping, great as part of a Tex-Mex meal','["800g potatoes, cut into cubes","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","1 garlic clove, finely chopped","½ tsp mild chilli powder","½ tsp paprika","1 tsp cumin","½ tsp cayenne pepper","soured cream, to serve"]','["Boil the potatoes for 5 mins.\r\nMeanwhile, heat the oil in a frying pan\r\nand gently fry the onion for 8 mins.\r\nAdd the garlic and spices, then fry for\r\n2 mins more.","Drain the potatoes and tip into the\r\nonion mix. Turn up the heat and shake\r\nthe potatoes around so that they are all\r\ncovered. Cook for 10 mins more until\r\ntender, then serve with soured cream,\r\nsprinkled with a little cayenne."]','2026-01-10 12:20:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7862,7862,'en','Black bean chilli','This chilli is great for casual entertaining – just lay everything out and let people add their own toppings','["2 tbsp olive oil","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 large onions, chopped","3 tbsp sweet pimenton (Spanish paprika ) or mild chilli powder","3 tbsp ground cumin","3 tbsp cider vinegar","2 tbsp brown sugar","2 x 400g (2 x 14oz) cans chopped tomatoes","2 x 400g (2 x 14oz) cans black beans, rinsed and drained","a few, or one, of the following to serve: crumbled feta cheese, chopped spring onions, sliced radishes, avocado chunks, soured cream"]','["In a large pot, heat the olive oil and fry\r\nthe garlic and onions for 5 mins until\r\nalmost softened. Add the pimenton and\r\ncumin, cook for a few mins, then add the\r\nvinegar, sugar, tomatoes and some\r\nseasoning. Cook for 10 mins.","Pour in the\r\nbeans and cook for another 10 mins.\r\nServe with rice and the accompaniments\r\nof your choice in small bowls."]','2026-01-10 12:20:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7864,7864,'en','Mexican beef chilli','A delicious one-pot of spicy braised beef is a great, stress-free way to fill up a hungry crowd','["up to 6 tbsp sunflower oil","4kg stewing beef","4 white onions, sliced","4 tbsp chipotle paste","8 garlic cloves, crushed","50g ginger, grated","1 tbsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tbsp plain flour","2l beef stock","3 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp dried oregano","5 x 400g cans pinto or kidney beans, drained"]','["Heat a small drizzle of the oil in an\r\nextra-large flameproof dish. Brown\r\nthe meat in batches, adding a drop\r\nmore oil, remove from the dish and set\r\naside. Add 1 tbsp oil to the dish, then\r\nthe onions, and cook for 7-10 mins or\r\nuntil caramelised.","Stir the chipotle paste, garlic, ginger,\r\ncumin, cinnamon and flour in with the\r\nonions and cook for a couple of mins.\r\nGradually add the stock, stirring all the\r\ntime, so it’s fully mixed in with the other\r\ningredients. Add the tomatoes and\r\noregano, season and simmer for 10 mins.","Now tip in the beef, cover and simmer\r\nvery gently for about 1 hr 45 mins until\r\ntender, removing the lid and adding the\r\nbeans for the final 15 mins. If the sauce\r\nis thin, let it boil down for a further 5-10\r\nmins with the lid off. Before serving,\r\nadjust the seasoning. Serve with the\r\ngarlic bread and salsa."]','2026-01-10 12:20:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7866,7866,'en','Smoky Mexican meatball stew','A simple spicy meatball recipe that makes a great alternative to beef chilli','["1½  tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","400g beef mince","50g fresh white breadcrumbs","1 tsp each ground cumin and coriander","1½  tbsp chipotle paste","200g basmati rice","400g can chopped tomatoes","400g can kidney beans, drained and rinsed","small handful coriander, to serve"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large\r\nfrying pan. Cook the onion\r\nfor 8-10 mins until soft, then\r\nremove from the pan.","Meanwhile, place the mince,\r\nbreadcrumbs, spices and chipotle\r\npaste in a bowl, season generously\r\nand mix thoroughly. Roll mixture\r\ninto 20 walnut-sized meatballs.\r\nAdd the remaining oil to the\r\npan and fry the meatballs for\r\nabout 8 mins until brown all over.","Meanwhile, cook the rice\r\nfollowing pack instructions. Return\r\nthe onion to the pan, adding the\r\ntomatoes, as well as a can full of\r\nwater. Simmer for 5 mins, then add\r\nthe kidney beans and cook for a\r\nfurther 10 mins, until the sauce\r\nhas thickened and the meatballs\r\nare cooked through. Season the\r\nmeatballs, scatter with coriander\r\nand serve with the rice."]','2026-01-10 12:20:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7868,7868,'en','Tex-Mex fish fillets','A good way to spice up fish if children aren’t that keen, get them to help cook','["4 boneless white fish fillets, such as haddock, hoki, pollock (about 140g/5oz each)","2 tbsp fajita seasoning or Tex-Mex seasoning","2 tbsp sunflower oil","200g pot guacamole","handful of coriander leaves, roughly chopped","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Dust the fish in the seasoning, then set aside.\r\nHeat the oil in a shallow frying pan, then fry\r\nfor 3-4 mins on each side until crisp. Serve\r\neach piece of fish with a spoonful of\r\nguacamole on top, a scattering of chopped\r\ncoriander and a lime wedge for squeezing."]','2026-01-10 12:20:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7870,7870,'en','Mexican veggie wraps','Get your mates round for a self-assembly supper. These meat-free fajitas are superhealthy too','["½ butternut squash, peeled and cut into large wedges","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","1 tbsp Cajun seasoning mix","1 tbsp oil","400g can refried beans","2 tomatoes, chopped","4 tbsp yogurt","zest and juice 1 lime","50g bag rocket","8 flour tortillas"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. In\r\na roasting tray, toss the squash with\r\nthe chilli, spices, oil and seasoning, then\r\nroast for 25 mins until tender. Gently heat\r\nthe refried beans with the chopped\r\ntomatoes until warmed through. Mix\r\nthe yogurt with lime zest and juice.","Warm wraps according to pack\r\ninstructions and spread with a thin layer\r\nof beans. Top with squash, some rocket,\r\nand a dollop of lime yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:20:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7872,7872,'en','Homemade chicken nachos','A super-quick Mexican snack to enjoy on game day','["200g plain corn tortilla chips","2 cooked chicken breasts, shredded into small pieces","6 spring onions, thinly sliced","140g Red Leicester cheese, grated","1 small jar red or green sliced pickled jalapeño peppers","small bunch coriander, leaves roughly chopped","your choice of salsa, hot pepper sauce (like Chipolte Tabasco), crème fraîche, guacamole or extra jalapeños, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Layer\r\nup the tortilla chips in an ovenproof dish\r\nor baking tray with the chopped chicken,\r\nspring onions, cheese and pickled\r\njalapeños. Bake for 8 mins or until the\r\ncheese is melted.","To serve, sprinkle with\r\nthe coriander and eat with your favourite\r\naccompaniments."]','2026-01-10 12:20:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7874,7874,'en','Spicy chicken, mango & jalapeño salad','Flavour chicken breasts with coriander, chilli and lime then serve with Mexican corn chips and a fresh, crunchy salad','["250g pack cherry tomatoes, sliced or quartered","2 tbsp finely chopped jalapeños","small handful coriander, roughly chopped","juice 1 lime, plus halves to serve","1 small red onion, finely chopped","1 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","4 cooked chicken breasts, torn into bite-sized shreds","2 Little Gem lettuces, torn into bite-sized pieces","1 red pepper, deseeded and sliced","1 ripe mango, stoned, peeled and diced","handful tortilla chips, broken up a little"]','["Put the cherry tomatoes, jalapeños,\r\ncoriander, lime juice, onion and oil in\r\na large bowl with some seasoning.","Pop the remaining ingredients, except\r\nthe tortilla chips, on top of the dressing.\r\nGently mix the salad together to coat.","Sprinkle the tortilla chips over the top\r\nand serve immediately with lime halves."]','2026-01-10 12:20:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7876,7876,'en','Warm Mexican bean dip with tortilla chips','A quick and easy party dip which is superhealthy, freezable and counts towards your five-a-day – what more could you want?','["1 onion, chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp soft brown sugar","1 tsp wine vinegar","1 tsp Cajun seasoning","400g tin mixed beans, rinsed and drained","400g tin chopped tomatoes, with garlic","handful grated cheddar","100g tortilla chips","serve with chopped avocado (optional)"]','["Fry the chopped onion in olive oil\r\nuntil soft. Add soft brown\r\nsugar, wine vinegar and Cajun seasoning.\r\nCook for 1 min then add the mixed\r\nbeans and chopped tomatoes\r\nwith garlic. Simmer for 10-15 mins until\r\nthe sauce has thickened then season.","Scatter handful grated cheddar onto\r\ntortilla chips. Microwave on High\r\nfor 1 min until cheese has melted.\r\nServe alongside the dip (top with some\r\nchopped avocado if you like). Make ahead\r\nand reheat dip before guests arrive."]','2026-01-10 12:20:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7878,7878,'en','Chicken nacho grills','A fun way to serve chicken breasts and keep kids interested – why not get them to help?','["40g bag tortilla chips","4 skinless chicken breasts","200g tub spicy tomato salsa","142ml pot soured cream","handful grated mature cheddar"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Crush\r\nthe tortilla chips. Put the chicken breasts on\r\na non-stick baking tray, season, then slash\r\neach 3 times with a knife. Spoon 1 tbsp of\r\nsalsa on top of each, then 1 tbsp soured cream.","Sprinkle the chips over the chicken, then\r\nthe cheese. Roast for 15-20 mins until the\r\ntopping is golden and melting."]','2026-01-10 12:20:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7880,7880,'en','Corn cakes with avocado salsa','A light, easy-to-prepare snack-supper with Mexican flavours','["50g self-raising flour","1 egg, beaten","200g canned or frozen sweetcorn","bunch spring onions, trimmed and finely chopped","1 avocado, cut into small chunks","1 lime, ½ juiced and the rest cut into 4","handful coriander leaves, chopped","1-2 tbsp vegetable oil","refried beans, to serve"]','["In a bowl, combine the flour, egg, corn\r\nand half the onions with some seasoning,\r\nthen mix well. Mix the avocado with the\r\nremaining onions, lime juice, coriander\r\nand seasoning, then set aside.","Heat 1 tbsp oil in a non-stick frying pan.\r\nDrop tbsps of the corn mixture into the\r\nfrying pan, smoothing them down to\r\nform cakes. Cook for about 2-3 mins on\r\neach side over a medium heat, adding the\r\nremaining oil if you need to. Serve hot\r\nwith the avocado salsa, lime wedges and some warm refried beans."]','2026-01-10 12:20:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7882,7882,'en','Mexican bean salad','Not one to leave your tummy rumbling, this filling salad really hits the spot and has a spicy kick','["4 eggs","2 avocados, peeled and stoned","2 x 400g cans of beans, (we used pinto bean and kidney beans, rinsed and drained","small red onion, finely sliced","large bunch coriander, leaves only, roughly chopped","250g punnet cherry tomatoes, halved","bottle bought good-quality dressing (we used English Provender Company Lime & Coriander dressing)","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely sliced","½  tsp cumin"]','["Lower the eggs into boiling water and boil\r\nfor 6½ mins, then put into a bowl of cold\r\nwater to cool. Slice the avocados and place in\r\na large bowl with the beans, onion, coriander\r\nand tomatoes. Measure 3 tbsp of the dressing\r\ninto a small bowl, then mix in the chilli and\r\ncumin. Once the eggs have cooled but are\r\nstill warm, peel off the shells and cut into\r\nquarters. Toss the salad with the dressing\r\nand nestle in the eggs. Serve straight away\r\n– delicious with toasted tortillas."]','2026-01-10 12:20:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7884,7884,'en','Mexican fish wraps','Kids can grab one of these yummy fish wraps on the go, a great low-fat snack','["finely grated zest and juice of 1 lime","700g skinless white fish fillet, cut into strips","2 egg whites, beaten with a fork","100g coarse fresh breadcrumbs","4 squirts oil spray","200g pot tzatziki","8 small, soft flour tortillas","small wedge iceberg lettuce or white cabbage, shredded"]','["Sprinkle the lime zest over the pieces of fish, then season. Dip the fish into the egg whites, then coat with breadcrumbs and place on a baking sheet. Spray the fish with 2 squirts oil, then grill for 2 mins. Flip them over, spray with more oil, then grill for a further 2 mins until the fish is cooked and the breadcrumbs are golden and crispy.","Squeeze the lime juice into the tzatziki and stir. Warm the tortillas according to pack instructions. To assemble the wraps, place a handful of cabbage or lettuce onto the top two-thirds of a tortilla, then rest 3 fish fingers on top with a good dollop of the lime tzatziki. Bring the bottom third of the tortilla up and fold the sides over to envelop the filling."]','2026-01-10 12:20:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7886,7886,'en','Roll-your-own fajitas','It’s always fun to assemble fajitas at the table, and it makes it easier for people to pick and choose ingredients depending on dietary requirements too','["2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","pinch cayenne pepper","2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 onion, halved and sliced","3 red peppers, cut into strips","300g rump steaks, sliced","small handful fresh coriander leaves","8 tortillas wraps","100g cheddar cheese, grated","tubs of guacamole and sour cream"]','["Mix the cumin, coriander and cayenne with\r\nsome salt and pepper, then set aside. Heat half\r\nthe oil in a frying pan, then throw in the onion,\r\npeppers and half the spice mix. Cook for about 3\r\nmins. Tip the vegetables into a bowl.","Place pan back on the heat with remaining oil,\r\nthen fry the steak and remaining spice mix\r\ntogether for 4 mins until cooked through. Tip the\r\nsteak into a separate bowl, garnishing with\r\ncoriander. Heat the wraps. Bring everything to\r\nthe table and let everyone help themselves."]','2026-01-10 12:20:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7888,7888,'en','Spicy vegetable fajitas','Here’s a spicy, vegetarian, help-yourself dish that’s ideal for hungry teenagers','["8 pancakes (see recipe link below)","2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","1 small cauliflower, cut into small florets","410g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","400g jar arrabbiata tomato sauce (we used Loyd Grossman)","3 tbsp chopped fresh coriander","150g tub low-fat natural yogurt","50g baby spinach leaves"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/gas 4/fan\r\n160C. Wrap the pancakes in foil\r\nand warm them through in the oven\r\nfor 10 minutes. Alternatively, wrap\r\nin cling film and reheat in the\r\nmicrowave on Medium (750W) for\r\n2-3 minutes.","Heat the oil in a saucepan, add\r\nthe onion and fry for 5 minutes until\r\nsoftened. Tip in the cauliflower\r\nflorets and fry briefly until they take\r\non a little colour. Splash in 5 tbsp\r\nwater, cover the pan and cook for\r\n5 minutes until the cauliflower is\r\njust tender.","Stir the chickpeas into the pan\r\nwith the arrabbiata sauce and bring\r\nto the boil. Simmer for 2-3 minutes,\r\nthen stir in the coriander and\r\nremove from the heat.","Transfer the sauce to a serving\r\nbowl and put on the table with the\r\nwarm pancakes, yogurt and\r\nspinach leaves. Let everyone put a\r\nfew spinach leaves in the centre of\r\neach pancake, spoon the filling\r\nover and top with a little yogurt. The\r\nsides can then be folded into the\r\nmiddle and the pancakes eaten\r\nwith a knife and fork."]','2026-01-10 12:20:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7890,7890,'en','Mexican soup with chicken','All those typically Mexican flavours – lime, coriander, chilli – combined in a soup with the crunch of tortilla chips','["2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","4 garlic cloves, crushed","1 ancho or other large dried chilli, deseeded and softened in boiling water for about 10 mins","½ tsp ground cumin","400g can plum tomatoes","1½ l chicken stock","2 chicken breasts, sliced","juice 2 limes","tortilla chips or homemade tortilla strips (see below), chopped avocado, lime wedges, red onion and coriander, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan. Add the\r\nonion and garlic, soften for 5 mins, then stir\r\nin the dried chilli, cumin, tomatoes and chicken\r\nstock. Blitz in a food processor in batches, or\r\nuse a hand blender to purée until smooth.","Return to the pan, then bring to the boil.\r\nAdd the chicken, reduce the heat, then simmer\r\nfor 10 mins until cooked through. Stir in the\r\nlime juice and some seasoning, then ladle\r\ninto bowls. Put the toppings in the middle\r\nof the table for everyone to help themselves."]','2026-01-10 12:20:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7892,7892,'en','Prawn fajitas with avocado cream','Mexican flavours of lime, garlic, chilli and coriander infuse these tasty tortilla wraps served with creamy guacamole','["juice 2 lime, plus wedges to serve","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","small bunch coriander, chopped","225g large raw peeled prawns","1 avocado, stoned and skinned","1 heaped tbsp soured cream, plus extra to serve","1 tbsp olive oil","1 red pepper, deseeded and sliced","4 flour tortillas and a good handful mixed salad leaves, to serve"]','["Mix half the lime juice, half the chilli,\r\nhalf the garlic and half the coriander\r\nwith some seasoning in a shallow\r\ndish. Add the prawns and mix to coat\r\nthem all. Leave to marinate while you\r\nprepare the avocado.","Roughly chop the avocado and pop\r\nit in a small food processor with the\r\nremaining lime juice, chilli, garlic, the\r\nsoured cream and some seasoning.\r\nWhiz until smooth, then stir in the\r\nremaining coriander. (You could also use\r\na stick blender for this.)","Heat the oil in a frying pan and\r\ncook the pepper for a few mins, until\r\nstarting to soften. Add the prawns and\r\nfry, in a single layer, for 1-2 mins each\r\nside – you will know they are cooked\r\nwhen they turn pink and feel firm to\r\nthe touch. Serve in warm tortillas with\r\nsalad leaves, if you like, alongside the\r\navocado cream, soured cream and\r\nsome lime wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:20:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7894,7894,'en','Chicken enchiladas with red mole sauce','Try a traditional Mexican favourite with this spicy and varied recipe','["4 boneless, skinless chicken breasts","4 ancho chillies","2 plum tomatoes, halved","2 tbsp oil or lard","1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves","3 tbsp blanched almonds, plus extra for serving","2 tsp raisins","1 tsp dried oregano","1 tsp ground cumin","½ tsp ground cinnamon","small piece of dark chocolate","375g pack fresh tortillas"]','["Put the chicken in the pan, then pour in 300ml cold water. Bring to the boil, then reduce down to a simmer and cook for 20 mins, turning once, until the chicken is cooked through. Remove chicken from water (saving the liquid) and when it’s cool enough to handle, shred with your fingers or a fork.","Halve the chillies, pull out the seeds and discard. Place in a small bowl and cover with boiling water. Leave to soak for 20 mins until softened, then discard the water, roughly chop the chillies then put into a blender.","Heat a frying pan and tip in the tomato. Cook for 5 mins, until the tomato skins start to blister and turn brown. Add to the blender. Heat the oil or lard in the same frying pan and cook the onion, garlic and almonds for 5 mins. Stir in the raisins, oregano, cumin and cinnamon, then cook 2 mins more until the onion is softened, the almonds are golden and the raisins have puffed up. Tip into the blender with 100ml of the chicken poaching liquid and give it a good whizz.","Pour the mixture back into the pan, stir in 350ml of the poaching liquid and chocolate and let it simmer for 20 mins. To serve, soften the tortillas in a microwave for 30 secs then pile the chicken on top, spoon over the sauce and roll up. Serve scattered with coriander leaves, limes and more chopped almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:20:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7896,7896,'en','Crab & avocado tostadas','Use a corn tortilla as a base then top with storecupboard crabmeat, guacamole-style Mexican dip and salad','["1 small red onion, sliced into thin rings","juice 2 limes, plus wedges to serve","pinch of caster sugar","170g can white crabmeat in brine, drained","2 spring onions, finely sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","1 really ripe avocado, peeled, stoned and chopped","1 small garlic clove, crushed","2 corn tortillas","handful mixed salad leaves"]','["Put the onion in a bowl and cover\r\nwith half the lime juice and a good\r\npinch each of sugar and salt. Leave\r\nto soften while you get everything\r\nelse ready.","Mix together the crabmeat,\r\nspring onions and half the chilli.\r\nSeason with black pepper\r\nand set aside. Mash the avocado with the\r\nremaining lime juice, garlic and\r\nsome seasoning. You can leave\r\nit quite chunky or mash it until\r\nsmooth. Stir in the rest of the chilli.","Bend each tortilla in half and\r\ntoast in a toaster for 1 min. Put\r\non 2 plates and top with the salad\r\nleaves, then mashed avocado.\r\nFinish with the crabmeat and\r\ndrained pickled onion. Serve with\r\nlime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7898,7898,'en','Mexican salad with tortilla croutons','Black beans make a great salad base – mix them with avocado, tomatoes and coriander Latin American style','["3 flour tortillas, cut into crouton-sized pieces","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp Cajun or Mexican seasoning mix","1 iceberg lettuce, shredded","400g can black beans, rinsed and drained","200g pack cherry tomatoes, halved","2 avocados, stoned, peeled and sliced","juice 1 lime","½ bunch coriander, leaves only"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPlace the tortilla pieces on a baking tray,\r\ntoss with the oil and the seasoning mix,\r\nthen cook for 10-12 mins until crisp. In\r\na large bowl, toss the iceberg, beans\r\nand tomatoes. Toss the avocado in the\r\nlime juice and add to the bowl.","Drizzle over your chosen dressing and\r\ntoss to coat all the ingredients. Top with\r\nthe croutons and coriander, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7900,7900,'en','Little almond cookies','These delicate snow-dusted Mexican cookies are rich, crumbly and melt in the mouth','["50g whole almonds","100g soft butter","2 tbsp caster sugar","1 tbsp dark rum","140g-175g plain flour, plus extra for rolling out","icing sugar, to serve (about 100g)"]','["Heat oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3\r\nand roast the almonds for 5-10 mins\r\nuntil they are a pale golden colour.\r\nCream together the butter, sugar, rum\r\nand a pinch of salt, then add the flour\r\nuntil the dough just comes together –\r\nit will be soft. Roughly chop the almonds\r\nand add them to the dough. Carefully\r\nroll out the dough on a well-floured\r\nsurface to a 4-5mm thickness and cut\r\nout small cookies roughly 3-4cm across.\r\nFreeze the cookies on a baking sheet\r\nfor 20 mins to harden.","Bake the cookies in the oven for\r\nabout 20 mins until just set – they will\r\nstill be very pale. Lay out on a wire rack\r\nand dust icing sugar on both sides while\r\nthey are still warm, being careful not to\r\nbreak them as you turn them. The icing\r\nsugar will melt. When they are cool,\r\nsprinkle them extremely generously\r\nwith more icing sugar so that they are\r\ncompletely white. Store in an airtight\r\ncontainer for up to 2 days, or freeze\r\nfor up to 2 months."]','2026-01-10 12:20:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7902,7902,'en','Rice pudding with raisin & cinnamon syrup','Known as Arroz con Leche in Mexico, this isperfect served in small glasses','["200g pudding rice","zest 1 lemon","zest 1 orange","1l whole milk","100g caster sugar","85g raisins or sultanas","1 cinnamon stick","100g light brown muscovado sugar","3 tbsp double cream"]','["Put the rice in a large pan with 500ml\r\nwater and the lemon and orange zest.\r\nBring to the boil, cover, lower the heat,\r\nthen cook for about 15 mins until all the\r\nwater has been absorbed. Uncover, stir in\r\nthe milk and sugar, then simmer for 20-25\r\nmins, stirring often, until the rice is\r\ntender and sauce thickened. Cool,\r\nthen leave at room temperature.","Put the raisins into a small pan\r\nwith the cinnamon, muscovado\r\nand 100ml water. Gently heat\r\nuntil the sugar has melted,\r\nthen bubble for a min until\r\nsyrupy. Stir in the cream,\r\nthen cool in the pan.","Dish up at the last minute - stir a little milk through the rice mixture if it has become ''solid'' after sitting for a while. To serve, divide the rice\r\npudding between 8 glasses\r\nor small bowls and top with a\r\nspoonful of the syrupy raisins."]','2026-01-10 12:20:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7904,7904,'en','Chicken enchiladas','Mildly spicy and satisfying, these easy enchiladas stuffed with refried beans, onion and red pepper will be popular with the whole family','["3 tbsp olive oil","2 red onions, sliced","2 red peppers, sliced","3 red chillies, 2 deseeded and chopped, 1 sliced","small bunch coriander, stalks finely chopped, leaves roughly chopped - plus extra to serve (optional)","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tbsp cumin seeds","6 skinless chicken breasts, cut into small chunks","415g can refried beans (we used Discovery)","198g can sweetcorn, drained","700ml bottle passata","1 tsp golden caster sugar","10 tortillas","2 x 142ml pots soured cream","200g cheddar, grated"]','["Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in your largest\r\npan, then fry the onions, peppers, chopped\r\nchilli and coriander stalks with half the\r\ngarlic for 10 mins until soft. Stir in 2 tsp\r\nground coriander and 2 tsp cumin seeds,\r\nthen fry for 1 min more. Meanwhile, in\r\nanother frying pan, fry the chicken in the\r\nremaining oil, in batches, until browned\r\n– add it to the pan of veg as it is done.","Stir the beans, sweetcorn, coriander\r\nleaves and 150ml of the passata into the\r\nveg and chicken. In a bowl, mix the rest\r\nof the passata with the other crushed\r\ngarlic clove, the remaining spices and the\r\nsugar, then set aside.","To assemble, lay the tortillas onto\r\na board and divide the chicken mixture\r\nbetween them, folding over the ends\r\nand rolling up to seal. Divide the passata\r\nsauce into the dishes you are using, then\r\ntop with the enchiladas. Dot over the\r\nsoured cream, sprinkle with grated\r\ncheese and scatter with the sliced chilli.","Cool and freeze (see freezing tips, below)\r\nor, if eating straight away, heat oven\r\nto 200C/180C fan/gas 6, then bake for\r\n30 mins, scattering with more coriander\r\nleaves to serve, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7906,7906,'en','Labneh','Make the easiest homemade cheese in minutes. It’s a common addition to meze platters as a dip','["900g full-fat yogurt (regular or Greek)","olive oil , for drizzling","za’atar , for sprinkling"]','["Mix the yogurt with ½ tsp coarse sea salt. Set a sieve over a large measuring jug or bowl and line it with a muslin cloth. Spoon in the yogurt, bring the sides of the cloth together and tie it tightly with kitchen string, leaving enough string to allow you to suspend it. Make a loop with the excess and hang the muslin parcel from the tap of the kitchen sink, putting the bowl or jug below it. Leave for 12-24 hrs until all the liquid has drained out. (If the weather is warm, chill in a sieve over a bowl instead.)","When the labneh is ready, it will be firm – the longer you leave it, the firmer it will become, so drain for slightly less time if you want to eat it as a dip. Scrape the labneh into a bowl or container, and serve drizzled with olive oil and seasoned with za’atar."]','2026-01-10 12:20:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7908,7908,'en','Za’atar & feta croissants','Use ready-made pastry to create flaky Middle Eastern-spiced croissants. The herby za’atar and creamy feta combine for a deliciously savoury bite','["350g pack croissant dough","100g feta , crumbled","1 tbsp za''atar","1 egg , beaten"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Unroll the croissant dough and use a knife to separate the dough triangles. Scatter the feta and ½ tbsp of the za’atar over the dough triangles, pressing it all in with your hands.","Starting from the base of one triangle, roll the dough upwards towards the narrow point. Bend each end in slightly to form a croissant shape. Repeat with the remaining dough. Put the croissants on the lined baking tray, brush each one with beaten egg and sprinkle over the remaining za’atar. Bake for 15-20 mins until deep golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:20:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7910,7910,'en','Roasted asparagus & labneh flatbreads with salted almond dukkah','Get inspired by Middle Eastern flavours – these flatbreads are topped with roasted asparagus and salted almond dukkah. Save the leftover dukkah for other recipes','["250g thick Greek yogurt","70g salted roasted almonds","50g mixed seeds","1 tbsp sesame seeds","1 tbsp cumin seeds","2 tbsp olive oil","350g asparagus , woody ends snapped off","2 garlic cloves , grated","25g salted butter","10g dill , leaves picked, plus extra sprigs to serve","4 Greek-style flatbreads"]','["Start by making the labneh. Mix the Greek yogurt with 1 tsp sea salt flakes, then pour into a sieve lined with a clean muslin cloth and set over a bowl. Chill for at least 1 hr. Will keep chilled overnight.","For the dukkah, heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Mix the almonds with the seeds on a lined baking tray. Season with salt and pepper, then bake for 6-8 mins. Leave to cool completely on the tray.","Put a wide frying pan over a medium-high heat. Drizzle in the olive oil and scatter in the asparagus. Cook for 5-6 mins, stirring, until charred and beginning to soften. Add the garlic, butter and dill. Stir well, turning the heat off when the butter begins to brown and smell nutty.","To assemble, spread the labneh over a warmed flatbread, top with the asparagus, a sprinkling of dukkah and the extra dill sprigs."]','2026-01-10 12:20:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7912,7912,'en','Curried bean stew with coconut & coriander drizzle','Make the most of a pantry staple – butter beans – in this hearty and fragrant stew. They are filling, packed with protein and low-cost, too','["2 tbsp vegetable oil , plus a drizzle","1 onion , finely chopped","2 tsp black or brown mustard seeds","1 tsp coriander seeds","1 tbsp medium curry powder","2 garlic cloves , grated","15g ginger , grated","700ml coconut milk","2 x 400g cans butter beans , drained","200g curly kale , leaves torn","20g coriander , roughly chopped","1 green chilli , roughly chopped (optional)","1 lime , zested and juiced"]','["Put a large, deep, saucepan with a lid over a medium heat. Once hot, pour in the oil. Scatter in the onion and cook for 8-10 mins to soften. Tip in the mustard seeds, coriander seeds, curry powder, garlic and ginger, and cook for 2-3 mins until fragrant and the seeds are beginning to sizzle and pop.","Pour in 600ml coconut milk and bring to the boil. Reduce to a simmer, then tip in the beans. Let it bubble for 10 mins, stirring occasionally.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C/ gas 4. Drizzle half of the kale with oil and season well with salt. Spread over a baking tray and bake for 8-10 mins until darkened and crisp.","Meanwhile, put the coriander, remaining coconut milk, green chilli, half of the lime juice and a good pinch of salt in the bowl of a small food processor, or in a deep bowl if using a hand blender. Blitz to a drizzlable consistency, then set aside.","Stir the remaining kale leaves into the butter beans, put a lid on and cook for 5 mins. Once they’re tender, stir in the remaining lime juice. Divide between four bowls, top with the crispy kale, then drizzle with the coriander chutney and a sprinkling of lime zest."]','2026-01-10 12:20:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7914,7914,'en','Peanut butter squash curry','Make this easy vegan curry with butternut squash and all the flavour of satay sauce. Top with coriander, chilli and peanuts, and serve with rice','["6 garlic cloves","3 lemongrass stalks , bashed and roughly chopped","thumb-sized piece of ginger , peeled and chopped","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tbsp ground turmeric","2 red chillies , 1 roughly chopped and  1 sliced to serve (optional)","1 small onion , roughly chopped","2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 butternut squash , peeled, deseeded and cut into chunks","1 tbsp light brown soft sugar","100g smooth peanut butter","3 tbsp soy sauce","440ml can coconut milk","250ml vegetable stock","1 lime , juiced","coriander , chopped","peanuts , roughly chopped (optional)","cooked rice"]','["Blitz the garlic, lemongrass, ginger, spices, chillies, onion and a large splash of water in a food processor with a pinch of salt until you have a smooth paste.","Heat the oil in a pan and cook the paste for 8-10 mins until it splits. Stir through the squash to coat in the paste, then stir through the sugar, peanut butter and soy sauce and cook until combined.","Pour in the coconut milk and stock, bring to a simmer, season and continue to simmer for 30-35 mins or until the squash is tender (keep on checking it as it depends on the squash – some take 15 mins and others 45 mins) stirring often. Turn off the heat, add the lime juice, then scatter over the fresh coriander, sliced chilli and peanuts, if you like, and serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:20:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7916,7916,'en','Schmaltzy lentils with chicken, olives & lemon','Golden chicken fat (schmaltz) adds flavour to the lentil and kale base in this hearty dish. It makes a moreish midweek meal','["1 tbsp olive oil","4 skin-on chicken breasts","1 red onion, , finely sliced","2 garlic cloves , finely chopped","1 tsp sumac","1 tsp ground turmeric","500ml low-salt chicken stock","500g cooked lentils , tomato flavoured if you can get them","125g kale , finely chopped","1 lemon , half sliced and half juiced","50g green olives , pitted and roughly chopped","small handful of parsley , finely chopped, to serve"]','["Heat the olive oil in a casserole dish or deep frying pan over a medium-high heat. Season the chicken all over and add to the pan, skin-side down. Cook for 6-8 mins until well browned and golden, then flip and cook for 2-3 mins until just golden, they don’t need to be cooked through at this point. Remove the chicken to a plate.","Stir the onion and garlic into the chicken pan. Cook for 2-3 mins before stirring in the spices. Cook for 1-2 mins until fragrant, then splash in the chicken stock, scraping the bottom to remove any browned bits. Mix in the lentils, kale, lemon slices and olives. Bring to a simmer, nestle the chicken breasts back in, skin-side up and cook for 8-10 mins until reduced and the chicken is cooked through. Season with the lemon juice and some black pepper, then garnish with the parsley to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7918,7918,'en','Pasta & purple sprouting broccoli with anchovies, garlic & preserved lemon','Love anchovies? This pasta dish is for you – the salty flavour works well with iron-rich purple sprouting broccoli, and is lifted by the zing of lemon','["8 anchovy fillets , finely chopped, plus 2 tbsp oil from the jar","100g butter","2 red onions , halved and thinly sliced","4 garlic cloves , thinly sliced","3 small preserved lemons , seeds and flesh removed, skin finely chopped","400g trofie pasta (or another small pasta shape)","300g purple sprouting broccoli","1 lemon , juiced","2 tbsp olive or rapeseed oil","150g fresh breadcrumbs","1 lemon , zested","2 good pinches of dried chilli flakes"]','["Boil the kettle. Drizzle the oil from the anchovy jar into a large frying pan, set over a medium heat. Add the anchovies and stir for a couple of minutes to break them up. Add the butter to the pan, swirling until it’s melted and foaming, then stir in the onions. Sizzle gently for 10 mins until the onions are soft, then add the garlic and preserved lemon and stir for another minute.","Fill a large saucepan with kettle-hot water, season with salt and bring to the boil. Add the pasta, cook for 5 mins, then tip in the broccoli and cook for another 5 mins, or until the pasta is cooked but still has a little bite. Scoop out a mugful of pasta water and set it aside, then drain the pasta and broccoli in a colander.","While the pasta cooks, heat the oil for the chilli crumbs in a frying pan and tip in the breadcrumbs. Stir regularly until the crumbs are golden and crispy, then add the lemon zest and chilli flakes.","Tip the pasta and broccoli into the anchovy sauce and add a good splash of the reserved pasta water and a squeeze of lemon. Cook for a few minutes, stirring, until it’s silky smooth and coats the pasta. Check and adjust the seasoning if necessary. Serve the pasta scattered with the crispy chilli crumbs."]','2026-01-10 12:20:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7920,7920,'en','Curried filo pie','Make a batch of spiced lentils then use it as a base to make the filling for this curried filo pie with cauliflower. Scatter over nigella seeds to serve','["1 small cauliflower , around 800g","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","4 spring onions , finely sliced","700g leftover coconut, curry leaf & turmeric saucy lentils (see step 2)","2 tbsp lime pickle","100ml double cream","150g mature cheddar , grated","270g filo pastry","25g butter , melted","1 tsp nigella seeds"]','["Discard any tatty outer leaves from the cauliflower, then cut the cauliflower into small florets. Thinly slice the stalk and leaves too. Heat the oil in a large pan over a medium-high heat. Stir in all the chopped cauliflower and the spring onions with 100ml hot water. Cook for 10-15 mins until soft and the water has evaporated.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Stir in the leftover lentils, lime pickle and double cream. Bring to a gentle simmer, then remove from the heat and stir in the cheese. Tip into a baking dish (ours was 20 x 30cm) and spread out. Take each sheet of filo, tear and lightly scrunch up a bit and dot over the top of the filling, making sure the whole top is covered. Brush over the melted butter then scatter over the nigella seeds. Bake in the oven for 25-30 mins until golden and crispy."]','2026-01-10 12:20:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7922,7922,'en','Jamaican oxtail','Cook the oxtail low and slow in this recipe so it becomes beautifully tender and falls off the bone. The rich flavour is enhanced by herbs and spices','["2 onions , roughly chopped","2 spring onions , roughly sliced","4 garlic cloves , finely chopped","2 tbsp ginger , finely chopped","12g thyme sprigs , leaves picked (see tip below)","90ml soy sauce","1kg oxtail , ask your butcher to chop cut into 1-inch thick chunks","3 tbsp cornflour","2 tbsp sunflower oil","2 scotch bonnet peppers (add more if you prefer more heat)","cooked white rice , or rice and peas"]','["Tip the onions, spring onions, garlic, ginger, thyme, soy sauce, a large pinch of salt and 1 tsp freshly ground black pepper into a bowl. Mix well and add the oxtail, turning to coat. Keep chilled overnight, or for at least 12 hrs.","When ready to cook, remove the oxtail from the marinade (reserve the marinade), put on a plate and dust lightly with the cornflour. Heat the oil in a large, deep saucepan or casserole dish and sear each piece of oxtail on both sides, around 2-3 mins each side, working in batches. Set the oxtail aside on a plate, then pour the reserved marinade into the saucepan and cook for 2-3 mins, scraping the bottom with a wooden spoon to release any browned bits.","Return the oxtail to the pan then add enough water to just cover the meat, around 800ml should suffice. Mix in the scotch bonnets, then bring to boil. Cover and cook on low for 2 hrs 30 mins – 3 hrs until the meat slips off the bone. Season to taste and serve with cooked white rice, or rice and peas."]','2026-01-10 12:20:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7924,7924,'en','Jamaican bully beef','Enjoy this Jamaican classic, also known as corned beef. Corned beef became a staple during wartime due to its affordability and long shelf-life','["1 tbsp sunflower oil , for frying","1 onion , finely chopped","1 spring onion , finely sliced","2 garlic cloves , finely chopped","2 whole sprigs thyme","½ scotch bonnet chilli , deseeded and finely chopped (you can adjust this according to your spice levels)","1 large tomato , chopped","1 pepper , cored and finely chopped","240g can corned beef","2 tbsp ketchup","cooked white rice"]','["In a frying pan, heat oil over medium-low heat. Once hot, stir in the onion, spring onion, garlic, thyme and scotch bonnet. Cook for 8 mins until the onions have softened slightly. Add the tomato and pepper and cook for 4-5 mins until everything is tender.","Increase the heat to medium-high and add the corned beef, breaking it up in the pan with a wooden spoon before stirring in the ketchup and ½ tsp freshly ground black pepper. Cook for another 6 mins, stirring occasionally and serve with steamed white rice and thyme leaves to garnish."]','2026-01-10 12:20:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7926,7926,'en','Peanut chickpea rice bowl','Make a rice bowl that’s full of texture thanks to chickpeas and peanuts. It can be cooked in the oven or air-fryer and leftovers kept for lunch the next day','["2 x 400g cans of chickpeas , drained and dried using kitchen paper","small bunch of coriander , finely chopped (save some extra whole leaves to serve, optional)","1 carrot , cut into matchsticks (no need to peel)","½ cucumber , seeds scooped out and cut into half-moons","½ red cabbage , finely shredded","400g brown rice , cooked","sesame seeds , crispy onions or sliced red chilli, to serve","4 tbsp crunchy peanut butter","3 tsp reduced salt soy sauce","1 lime , juiced","1 tbsp chilli oil (optional)","½ tsp maple syrup or mild flavoured honey"]','["Heat the oven or air fryer to 200C/190C fan/gas 6. Make the dressing by mixing all of the ingredients together and season lightly. Pour the chickpeas onto a lined baking sheet and toss with half the dressing. Bake for 20-25 mins until crispy and golden. Leave to cool for 5 mins.","Mix the remaining dressing with enough water to make a pourable consistency. Mix the chopped coriander, carrot, cucumber and red cabbage together in a small bowl, and season lightly.","Split the rice between bowls, top with the veg mix and crispy chickpeas, then scatter over the coriander leaves, sesame seeds, crispy onions and sliced chilli, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7928,7928,'en','One-pot garlicky chicken thighs & giant cous cous','Feel free to swap the cavolo nero for curly kale in this chicken dish, if you like. It comes with a light parsley, lemon zest and olive oil dressing','["4 large skin-on, bone-in chicken thighs","1 onion , thinly sliced","200g cavolo nero , stalks finely chopped, leaves roughly chopped","5 garlic cloves , grated","250g giant couscous","small bunch of parsley , finely chopped","1 lemon , zested and juiced","1 tbsp olive oil"]','["Season the chicken, then put skin-side down in a wide, ovenproof frying pan, roughly 30cm wide. Turn it up to a medium-low heat, then cook for 8-10 mins until the skin is golden.","Transfer the chicken thighs to a plate (you’ll finish cooking them later). Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Put the onion and cavolo stalks in the pan, season and cook for 8-10 mins until beginning to soften. Stir in the garlic and cavolo nero leaves, and cook for another 3-4 mins. Stir in the giant couscous.","Pour in 675ml cold water, stirring well. Season, bring to the boil, then reduce to a simmer and nestle the chicken thighs back in, skin-side up. Put in the oven for 18-20 mins.","Meanwhile, mix the parsley with the lemon zest, juice and olive oil. Season.","Remove the chicken from the oven, leave to stand for 5 mins, then drizzle over the dressing and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7930,7930,'en','Tomato & sardine spaghetti with crispy breadcrumbs','Whip up this flavour-packed, speedy dish made using storecupboard ingredients','["2 tbsp olive oil","30g panko breadcrumbs","1 onion , finely sliced","300g spaghetti","2 garlic cloves , grated","2 x 120g cans sardines in tomato sauce","½ tsp chilli flakes (optional)","200g can chopped tomatoes","25g black olives , roughly chopped","1 lemon , juiced and zested","small bunch of flat-leaf parsley , roughly chopped"]','["Put a wide frying pan on a medium heat, and pour in 1 tbsp of the olive oil. Scatter in the breadcrumbs and cook for 4-5 mins, stirring often, until golden and crisp. Season and transfer to a small bowl lined with kitchen paper.","Wipe out the pan, pour in the remaining 1 tbsp oil, then scatter in the onion and a pinch of salt. Cook for 8-10 mins until softening and golden around the edges. Cook the spaghetti following pack instructions and drain, reserving a little of the cooking water.","Add the garlic to the frying pan, cook for 1 min, then tip in the sardines and chilli flakes, if using. Gently mash with a wooden spoon to make a thick sauce. Scatter in the olives, lemon juice and cooked spaghetti, along with a good splash of the pasta cooking water. Mix very thoroughly to coat.","Stir through the chopped parsley, divide between bowls, then sprinkle over the crispy breadcrumbs and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7931,7931,'en','Chocca mocca caramel cake','A delight at any time, but especially when strewn with chocolate eggs for Easter','["2 tsp instant coffee granules/powder","2 tbsp cocoa powder","2 tbsp hot water","175g softened butter","175g golden caster sugar","2 eggs","2 tbsp golden syrup","200g self-raising flour","4 tbsp milk","0 2 x 50g/2 x 2oz chocolate caramel bars","100g chocolate caramel bars","50g butter","2 tbsp milk","100g icing sugar, sifted"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/Gas 4/fan oven 160C. Butter a 20cm/8in round cake tin and line the base with baking parchment.","Measure the coffee and cocoa into a cup, add the hot water and mix to a smooth paste. Put the butter, sugar, eggs, syrup, flour, milk and cocoa paste in a large mixing bowl and beat with a wooden spoon or electric beaters for 2-3 minutes until smooth.  Break the caramel bars into sections and stir into the mixture.","Turn the mixture into the prepared tin and smooth the top.  Bake for 35-40 minutes, until the top springs back when you press it lightly. Cool in the tin for 5 minutes, then turn out, peel off the lining paper and leave to cool.","To make the icing, break up the caramel bars and put in a small pan with the butter and milk.  Gently heat until smooth, stirring all the time, then remove from the heat and stir in the icing sugar (don’t worry if it doesn’t dissolve immediately, just keep stirring). Leave to cool until it thickens enough to leave a trail\r\nwhen you lift the spoon. Put the cake on a serving plate, spread the icing over the top, letting it fall softly down the sides, then leave to set."]','2026-01-10 12:20:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7932,7932,'en','Meatballs & garlic bread & butter pudding','Make your own meatballs and bake in a rich tomato sauce with layers of cheesy garlic bread. A delicious twist on classic comfort food','["4 tbsp olive oil , plus extra for drizzling","3 garlic cloves , crushed","1 tsp oregano","1 tsp caster sugar","small handful basil leaves , finely chopped (reserve some whole to serve, if you like)","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 garlic baguette (around 210g), sliced","125g ball buffalo mozzerella , drained and torn into pieces","green salad , to serve","50g dried breadcrumbs","2 tbsp milk","500g beef mince","1 small onion , finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , crushed","1 egg","1 tsp mixed herbs"]','["To make the tomato sauce, heat half the oil in a flameproof oven dish or ovenproof frying pan over a medium heat. Stir in the garlic and let it sizzle for 2 mins until fragrant, then mix in the oregano, sugar, basil and chopped tomatoes. Rinse out the cans with a splash of water each, then pour into the pan. Bring to a simmer, then leave to bubble away for 15-20 mins until thickened and reduced. Season to taste.","Meanwhile, for the meatballs, mix the breadcrumbs and milk together in a large bowl, and set aside for 5 mins to absorb. Mix in the beef mince, onion, garlic, egg, mixed herbs, ½ tsp salt and some pepper. Shape into 20 balls, around the size of golf balls.","Heat the remaining oil in a second frying pan over medium-high heat. Add the meatballs and brown all over. Once browned, remove to a plate (they don’t need to be cooked through at this point).","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip half the tomato sauce into a baking dish, then add the garlic bread in layers with the meatballs. Drizzle over the remaining sauce with a spoon and dot over the mozzarella pieces. Drizzle over a little more olive oil and season with pepper. Bake for 20-25 mins until golden and bubbling. Scatter over some whole basil leaves, if you like, and serve with a big, green, sharply dressed salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7934,7934,'en','Fragrant chilli crab-fried rice with crispy leeks','Transform a weeknight dinner into something more special using sustainably sourced crab and crispy fried leeks. Drizzle over sriracha chilli sauce to serve','["3 leeks","sunflower or vegetable oil , for frying","4 garlic cloves , grated","2 tbsp ginger , peeled and grated","1 tbsp caster sugar","1½ tbsp soy sauce","2 tsp fish sauce","1½ tbsp sriracha , plus extra to serve","500g cooked basmati or jasmine rice","2 eggs , beaten","100g white crabmeat","1 lime , ½ juiced, ½ cut into wedges or cheeks to serve","small handful of coriander , to serve"]','["Cut the leeks in half down the centre, rinse under cold running water to remove any dirt trapped between the layers, then thinly slice.","Heat enough oil in a wok or deep frying pan to come a few centimetres up the side. Heat the oil over a medium heat for a few minutes, then drop the green ends of the leeks into the hot oil, being careful not to splash. Fry the leeks for 2-3 mins until golden brown and crispy, then use a slotted spoon to transfer to a sheet of kitchen paper. Season the crispy leeks with salt and set aside until ready to serve.","Pour away all but 1-2 tbsp oil from the pan (save for future stir-fries). Add the remaining leeks, garlic and ginger and stir-fry over a medium heat for a few minutes to soften.","Combine the sugar, soy, fish sauce and sriracha in a bowl. Add to the pan with the cooked rice and fry for a few minutes, until the rice has broken up. Create space in the centre and add the eggs. Leave to set for a minute, then scramble into the rice.","Add the crabmeat and lime juice. Serve scattered with coriander and the crispy leeks, with lime wedges and extra sriracha on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:20:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7936,7936,'en','Beef, green olive & sumac koftas','Pile these spiced koftas onto a platter and let everyone dig in. An ideal sharing dinner, serve with salad, pickled chillies and flatbreads','["800g 12% fat beef mince","2 garlic cloves , grated","100g green olives , pitted and roughly chopped","50g pistachios , roughly chopped","2 tsp sumac","1 tbsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","½ tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp mild chilli powder","2 tbsp olive oil , plus extra for frying","1 red onion , sliced","1 lemon , juiced","1 whole cucumber , deseeded and finely sliced","2 large handfuls of parsley leaves (see tip below)","50g pomegranate seeds","pinch of sumac","1 tbsp honey , for glazing","hummus , pickled chillies and flatbreads"]','["If you’re prepping ahead, line a freezer-proof container with baking parchment. Mix together all the ingredients for the kofta in a large bowl, along with 1 tsp salt and a big pinch of black pepper. Roughly form into koftas using your hands (using about 40g for each kofta) – you should have 24 in total. Will keep chilled for up to four days, or frozen for up to three months. Fill the prepared container with the koftas, putting another sheet of baking parchment between them if you need to make a second layer.","To make the salad, scrunch the red onion and lemon juice together along with a pinch of salt. Set aside for 10 mins to lightly pickle, then mix in the cucumber, parsley and pomegranate seeds. Season to taste. Tip into a serving bowl and sprinkle over the sumac.","To cook from frozen, brush olive oil over a large frying pan or griddle pan if you have one, and heat over a medium-high heat. Fry the kofta in batches, turning often for 5-7 mins until browned all over. Pour in 200ml water and cover with a lid. Turn the heat up to high and cook for 5-7 mins until cooked through and the water has evaporated. Remove from the heat and stir in the honey, tossing to coat. If you’re cooking from chilled, cook for 8-10 mins until cooked through.","Spread the hummus out on a serving platter, and pile over the koftas. Serve with the salad, pickled chillies and flatbreads."]','2026-01-10 12:20:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7938,7938,'en','Kimchi chicken schnitzels','Serve these moreish chicken schnitzels with our punchy kimchi mayonnaise and crisp cabbage on the side, plus lemon wedges for squeezing over','["4 chicken breasts","150g kimchi , finely chopped, plus 3 tbsp of the brine","2 eggs","50g plain flour","150g fine white dried breadcrumbs","½ white cabbage , finely sliced","1.5 litres vegetable oil","150g mayonnaise","1 tbsp rice vinegar","lemon wedges , to serve"]','["Butterfly the chicken breasts by cutting through the thickest part of the breast, stopping 1cm before the edge, then opening them out like a book. Cover with a sheet of baking parchment and, using a rolling pin, bash out each chicken breast as thinly as possible. Transfer to a container and pour over the kimchi brine, turning to coat. Chill for at least 2 hrs, or up to 24 hrs.","Remove the chicken breasts from the brine and lay on a clean chopping board. Lightly salt both sides of the chicken and set aside. Pour the brine into a shallow bowl and whisk in the eggs. Tip the flour and breadcrumbs into two separate shallow bowls. Dip each chicken breast into the flour first, pressing to coat, then into the egg mixture and finally the breadcrumbs, then press well again. Transfer to a wire rack lined with baking parchment. To freeze the schnitzels, carefully put the wire rack flat in the freezer and freeze until solid, about 5 hrs. Transfer to a container with baking parchment between each schnitzel. Will keep frozen for up to three months.","On the day of serving, put the cabbage in a bowl of iced water and leave for 10 mins. Just before serving, drain and dry in a salad spinner to crisp it up, or put in a clean tea towel and swing it round to spin it in the same way.","Pour the oil into a wide, deep saucepan (make sure it’s no more than a third full) set over a medium heat and heat gently until a few breadcrumbs sprinkled in sizzle and turn brown in around 30 seconds. Carefully lay the schnitzels in the hot oil, one or two at a time, depending on how wide the pan is, and fry for 2-3 mins each side or 5 mins on each side from frozen. Transfer to a baking tray and keep warm in a low oven.","Meanwhile, combine the kimchi, mayonnaise and vinegar, and season to taste. Serve the schnitzels with the kimchi mayonnaise and crisp cabbage on the side, with lemon wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7940,7940,'en','Slow cooker self saucing pud','Create a treat for family and friends in your slow cooker. The added ginger sauce means it promises to be deliciously moist, but you could serve with cream for extra indulgence','["100g butter , melted, plus extra for the basin","125g caster sugar","100g light brown soft sugar","2 eggs","200ml milk","275g self-raising flour","½ tsp baking powder","1½ tbsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cinnamon","double cream , to serve (optional)","1 tbsp cornflour","175g light brown soft sugar","1 tbsp ground ginger"]','["Heat the slow cooker on high for 20 mins. Carefully rub the basin of your slow cooker with butter. Make the sponge by combining the melted butter with both sugars, the eggs and milk, then fold in the flour, baking powder, ginger and cinnamon. Whisk to remove any lumps if needed, then pour into your slow cooker.","For the sauce, mix the cornflour with 1 tsp water, then set aside. Combine the sugar and ginger with 350ml boiling water until the sugar has dissolved. Mix in the cornflour paste, then pour over the batter.","Cook on high for 1 hr 30 mins- 2 hrs 30 mins (this will vary depending on your slow cooker), until the sponge has set and is firm to the touch. To serve, pour over some double cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7941,7941,'en','Honeycomb','Making your own cinder toffee requires a little care and attention but it’s worth it. Break into shards and scatter over ice cream and other desserts','["butter, for greasing","200g caster sugar","5 tbsp golden syrup","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda"]','["Grease a 20cm square tin with the butter. Mix the caster sugar and syrup in a deep saucepan and stir over a gentle heat until the sugar has melted. Try not to let the mixture bubble until the sugar grains have disappeared. Once completely melted, turn up the heat a little and simmer until you have an amber coloured caramel (this won’t take long), then as quickly as you can turn off the heat, tip in the bicarbonate and beat in with a wooden spoon until it has all disappeared and the mixture is foaming. Scrape into the tin immediately but be careful as the mixture will be very hot.","The mixture will continue bubbling in the tin, simply leave it and in about 1 hr- 1 hr 30mins the honeycomb will be hard and ready to crumble or snap into chunks."]','2026-01-10 12:20:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7942,7942,'en','Prawn, pea & spinach coconut curry with microwave quinoa rice','Try this simple curry for a family dinner. It delivers seven plant points, plenty of fibre and two of your five-a-day','["150g quinoa","150g basmati rice","1 small red onion , chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","½ tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp finely chopped ginger","1 tsp finely chopped garlic","3 tbsp tomato purée","300g coconut cream","300g frozen peas","300g king prawns","200g baby spinach leaves","½ tsp ground turmeric","1 lime , to serve (optional)"]','["Rinse and drain the quinoa and rice in a sieve three times to remove excess starch. Tip into a very large bowl (to prevent over-spill in the microwave), then pour in 300ml boiling water from the kettle, cover with a heavy plate, and microwave on high for 15 mins. Leave to rest, still covered, for 5 mins before fluffing with a fork.","Meanwhile, prepare the curry. In a pan over medium heat, fry the onion in the oil until it starts to brown. Add the cumin, ginger and garlic, and stir for a minute. Mix in the tomato purée and cook for another minute.","Add the coconut cream, peas, prawns, spinach, turmeric and salt. Cover and cook until the prawns turn opaque and pink, and the spinach has wilted, about 5 mins. Add a little water to adjust the consistency as needed. Serve the curry over the quinoa rice with a squeeze of fresh lime, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7944,7944,'en','Orange chicken','Serve crispy chicken fillets in a quick orange sauce, on a bed of shredded iceberg lettuce','["1 egg , beaten","2 skinless chicken breasts","pinch of ground white pepper","6 heaped tbsp self-raising flour","4 heaped tbsp cornflour","2-3 tbsp vegetable oil","1 orange , sliced then quartered or halved","shredded iceberg lettuce , steamed basmati rice and finely chopped spring onions, to serve","2 tsp cornflour","4 tbsp double-strength orange cordial"]','["Mix the beaten egg with a pinch of salt and the white pepper in a bowl. Cut the chicken breasts in half so you have two thin fillets per breast, then tip these into the bowl and toss to coat in the egg.","Combine both the flours with a pinch of salt, and tip onto a plate. Lift the chicken fillets out of the egg, allowing the excess to drip off, and dip in the flour mixture until fully coated. Set aside on a plate.","Heat the vegetable oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat (you''ll want to add enough oil to coat the bottom of the pan) until shimmering, and fry the coated chicken fillets for 3-4 mins on each side until golden. (You may need to do this in batches.) Put the cooked chicken fillets on a wire rack set over kitchen paper to drain. The chicken fillets can be fried up to a day ahead, cooled and chilled. Crisp up again in a 200C/180C fan/gas 6 oven for 8-10 mins.","To make the sauce, combine the cornflour with 2 tsp water. Tip the cordial and 150ml water into a medium saucepan, then whisk in the cornflour paste. Slowly bring to the boil over a low heat, whisking continuously until it becomes translucent and starts to thicken. If the flavour is too strong or the sauce is too thick, add up to 50ml more water. Or, if you want the flavour to be more intense, add more orange cordial, 1 tsp at a time.","Cut the chicken fillets into strips, about 1.5-2cm wide, then scatter over shredded iceberg lettuce. Top with the orange pieces and pour over the sauce, then garnish with spring onions and serve with hot basmati rice."]','2026-01-10 12:20:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7946,7946,'en','Creamy Marmite chicken','Love Marmite? Try mixing it with creme fraîche and chicken stock to make a creamy sauce for chicken breasts. Serve with seasonal veg and quinoa or mash','["2 tbsp olive oil","4 skin-on chicken breasts","1 onion , finely chopped","3 garlic cloves , grated","½ tbsp Marmite","200ml low-salt chicken stock","100g crème fraîche","10g parmesan , finely grated","240g bag of microwave vegetables","10g chives , finely chopped","quinoa or mash, to serve"]','["Pour 1 tbsp of the olive oil into a deep frying pan on a medium heat. Once shimmering, season the chicken breasts lightly, then lay them in the pan, skin-side down. Cook for 4-5 mins until the skin is deeply golden, then turn over and cook on the other side until nearly cooked through (they’ll be cooked through later). Remove from the pan and set aside on a plate.","Pour the remaining oil into the pan, tip in the onion and cook for 10 mins until starting to soften. Add the garlic and cook for 3 mins.","Stir in the Marmite, then add the chicken stock, crème fraîche and parmesan, mixing well to combine. Bring to a simmer, then put the chicken in the sauce, skin-side up. Cook for 8-10 mins, or until the chicken is cooked through.","Cook the vegetables following pack instructions, then sprinkle the chives over the chicken and serve with quinoa or mash and the veg."]','2026-01-10 12:20:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7948,7948,'en','Stroganoff meatballs & mash','Make a stroganoff sauce with mushrooms as the base to serve with meatballs, mash and spinach. It’s sure to be a crowd-pleaser','["2 tbsp garlic oil , plus extra for the tray","500g beef mince","1 egg","2 tbsp gluten-free plain flour","150g mushrooms , chopped","1½ tsp smoked paprika","1½ tsp wholegrain or Dijon mustard","½ tbsp tomato purée","250ml gluten-free vegetable stock","80g soured cream","mashed potato and wilted spinach , to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7 and oil abaking tray. Combine the beef mince, egg, 1 tbsp flour and a pinch each of salt and ground black pepper in a large bowl. Scoop as many meatballs as you can out onto the tray using an ice-cream scoop, then bake for 10-12 mins until the meatballs are evenly browned.","Meanwhile, make the sauce. Heat the garlic oil in a small pan over a medium heat and cook the mushrooms for a few minutes until slightly golden. Stir in the remaining flour, the paprika, mustard and tomato purée, then mix to coat the mushrooms. Pour in the stock, season, then simmer for a 5-6 mins until slightly thickened. Reduce the heat to low and stir in the soured cream. Cook for 1 min more, then add the meatballs and stir to coat in the sauce.Once completely cool, will keep frozen for up to three months. Defrost overnight in the fridge, then reheat until piping hot. Serve the meatballs and sauce with mash and wilted spinach."]','2026-01-10 12:20:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7950,7950,'en','Maqlooba','Try this Iraqi-inspired maqlooba. Meaning “upside-down”, it’s a special dish combining lamb chops, aubergine, tomatoes, basmati rice and potatoes','["4-6 lamb chops","2-3 tsp pul biber (Turkish pepper flakes)","3 tbsp date molasses or date syrup (see tip, below)","2 medium aubergines, cut into 1cm slices","300g basmati rice","2 tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp baharat spice mix","6½ tbsp olive oil","5 tbsp pomegranate molasses","2 medium onions, sliced into 1cm rings","4 medium potatoes, cut into 1cm slices","4-5 tomatoes (enough to cover the base of the pan), cut into 1cm slices","lemon wedges, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the lamb chops in a bowl. Combine 2 tsp salt, ½ tsp black pepper, the pul biber (to taste) and 2 tbsp of the date molasses or date syrup, if using. Rub all over the lamb, cover and leave to marinate at room temperature for 1 hr.Will keep chilled overnight.","Meanwhile, soak the aubergine slices in a bowl of salted water for 20 mins. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Heat a 23cm flameproof casserole over a medium heat. Add the rice, then pour in 700ml boiling water from thekettle. Add a pinch of salt along with 1 tsp of the turmeric, the baharat spice and ½ tsp black pepper. Cook for 3-5 mins until the rice begins to soften, then drain and set aside.","Drain and rinse the aubergine, then toss with 4 tbsp of the olive oil, a pinch of salt and 2 tbsp of the pomegranate molasses. Tip onto a baking tray and bake for 20-25 mins until tender and starting to brown. In addition, put the onions on a separatebaking tray, toss with 1 tbsp of the olive oil, 2 tbsp of the pomegranate molasses and a pinch of salt, and bake for 20 mins until tender. Put the potatoes on a third baking tray and toss with 1 tbsp of the olive oil, the remaining turmeric and a pinch of salt. Bake for 20 mins until lightly golden.","Meanwhile, remove the lamb chops from the marinade and gently shake to remove any excess. Heat the remaining ½ tbsp olive oil in a frying pan over a medium-high heat and fry the chops for 2 mins on each side until browned but still pink in the middle.","Line the base of the casserole with a circle of baking parchment. Arrange the tomato slices, slightly overlapped, in concentric circles on the parchment, followed by the onion rings, then the lamb chops, potatoes and aubergines. Spoon the rice on top and gently flatten the surface into an even layer.","Put the casserole over a medium heat. Dissolve 1 tsp salt in 150ml water and pour it over the rice, followed by the remaining 1 tbsp date molasses and 1 tbsp pomegranate molasses. Cover and cook for 5-10 mins, then reduce the heat and simmer for 20 mins until the rice is cooked through and the veg has caramelised slightly.","Remove from the heat, put a clean tea towel over the pan and cover with the lid (to prevent condensation dripping back into the rice). Leave to rest for 10 mins. Remove the lid, put a large plate over the pan and quickly invert. Tap the base and lift the pan carefully to keep the layers stacked. Peel off the baking parchment and serve with lemon wedges, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7952,7952,'en','One-pan lamb tagine with chickpeas','Make this lamb tagine a day or two ahead to really develop the flavours. It makes entertaining that little bit easier, as all you’ll need to do is reheat it','["1kg lamb neck fillet, cut into large chunks","3 tbsp ras el hanout","2 tbsp olive oil, plus an optional drizzle","2 onions, chopped","4 carrots, cut into large chunks","6 garlic cloves, finely chopped","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely grated","2 tbsp rose harissa paste, plus 1 tsp to serve","½ preserved lemon, finely chopped, or a peeled strip of lemon zest","1 cinnamon stick","400g can chopped tomatoes","600ml chicken or lamb stock","2 x 400g cans chickpeas, drained but not rinsed","100g dried apricots, roughly chopped (optional)","150g natural yogurt","small bunch of coriander, roughly chopped","small handful of flaked almonds, toasted","cooked couscous"]','["Toss the lamb pieces with the ras el hanout and a large pinch of salt to coat.Will keep chilled for up to 4 hrs. Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Heat the oil in a large flameproofcasseroleover a medium heat and brown the lamb on all sides. (You will need to do this in batches.) Scoop onto a plate using a slotted spoon and set aside, then cook the onions and carrots in the pan for 10-12 mins until soft and golden, adding a drizzle more oil if the pan is dry. Add the garlic and ginger, and cook for 2 mins more, then stir in the 2 tbsp harissa and preserved lemon. Cook for another minute until the vegetables are coated in the mixture and sticky. Add the cinnamon, then tip in the tomatoes and bring to a simmer.","Cook for a few minutes more until reduced to a thick paste. Tip the lamb and its resting juices back into the pan and pour over the stock. Season and return to a simmer. Put the lid on the casserole and transfer to the oven to cook for 1 hr.","Stir in the chickpeas and apricots, if using, cover again and return to the oven for 1 hr until the lamb is tender. Season, then leave the tagine to stand for 10 mins.Will keep chilled for up to three days or frozen for three months. Leave to cool first. Defrost in the fridge overnight before reheating over a low heat until piping hot. Swirl the 1 tsp harissa through the yogurt, then scatter the tagine with the coriander and flaked almonds. Serve with the couscous and spiced yogurt on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:20:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7954,7954,'en','Meze meatballs','Try our meatball meze with hummus, tzatziki, onion, cucumber and tomatoes. It’s ideal as a family weeknight platter if people eat at different times','["100g breadcrumbs","50ml milk","400g beef or lamb mince","1 egg","2 tsp dried oregano","small bunch of flat-leaf parsley, finely chopped","1 onion, coarsely grated","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","2 tbsp plain flour","2 tbsp olive oil","½ cucumber, chopped into chunks","12 cherry tomatoes, quartered","1 red onion, finely sliced","hummus","tzatziki","4 pittas"]','["Put the breadcrumbs in a bowl and add the milk. Leave for 5 mins, or until the milk has been absorbed. Add the rest of the meatball ingredients, except the flour and oil. Season well with salt and pepper and mix everything well with your hands, then shape into meatballs a bit larger than a cherry tomato. You should have about 24. Cover and chill the meatballs for at least 30 mins. Will keep covered and chilled for up to 24 hrs.","When you’re ready to cook, tip the flour into a shallow bowl. Roll the meatballs in the flour to coat, then heat the oil in a largefrying panover a medium heat. Fry the meatballs for 10-12 mins, rolling them around the pan until nicely browned on all sides and cooked through. To serve, arrange on a platter with some chopped salad made using the cucumber, tomatoes and red onion, and bowls of hummus and tzatziki alongside.Toastthe pittas and let everyone make their own meatball kebab, stuffing the meatballs, salad and dips into the pittas."]','2026-01-10 12:20:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7956,7956,'en','Fatteh makdous (lamb-stuffed baby aubergines in tomato & tahini sauce)','Enjoy these delicious lamb-stuffed baby aubergines in tomato and tahini sauce as part of a Middle Eastern-inspired menu. Top with cashew nuts to serve','["oil, for deep-frying","8 baby aubergines","2 large round flatbreads, cut into squares","cashew nuts, to serve","oil, for frying","¼ tsp cumin seeds","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp tomato paste","½ tsp mild madras powder","½ tsp black pepper","½ tsp ground cumin","½ tsp seven spice powder (see tip, below)","100g lamb mince","olive oil, for frying","25g pine nuts","200ml Greek yogurt","4 tbsp tahini","½ lemon, juiced","1 garlic clove, crushed"]','["First, make the red sauce. Heat a little oil in a pan, then add the cumin seeds and fry until they smell fragrant. Add the rest of the ingredients along with ½ tsp salt and 200ml water, and cook until the sauce thickens a little – it should be the consistency of single cream.","Trim the tops off the baby aubergines, then peel strips of skin off in stripes and hollow out the core out witha smallsharp knifeor the end of a teaspoon. Soak the aubergines in salted cold water so they keep their colour, then drain well, squeeze lightly and pat dry.","Fill a pan one-third full of oil and heat until a cube of bread browns in 30 seconds. Deep-fry the flatbread pieces until they are crisp and browned but not burnt, about 30-40 seconds. Drain well. Deep-fry the aubergine in batches for 4-5 mins until browned and tender, then drain on kitchen paper.","Fry the minced lamb in a pan with a little olive oil until browned and cooked through, then add the pine nuts and season. Stuff the aubergines with the lamb mince mixture – you can either stuff the mince into the hole at either end, or split the aubergines and then add the stuffing (this way allows you to get more lamb in). Put the stuffed aubergines in a pan with 6 tbsp of the red sauce and cook for 5 mins.","Put the Greek yogurt, tahini, lemon juice, garlic and some salt in a bowl, and mix well. If it feels a little thick, add some cold water.You can make this ahead and chill in the fridge until ready to serve.","To serve, spoon the tahini yogurt into a large bowl. Top with a handful of the flatbread chips, the aubergines and all the red sauce. Finish with a sprinkle of cashew nuts, then serve the rest of the chips on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:20:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7958,7958,'en','Harissa-honey marinade','Try this harissa-honey marinade on chicken or halloumi skewers, and use as a glaze. Harissa is a Tunisian hot chilli paste made with red peppers and spices','["2 tbsp rose harissa","2 tbsp olive oil","1 crushed garlic clove","3 tbsp honey"]','["Combine the rose harissa, olive oil, garlic clove and honey. Season with salt."]','2026-01-10 12:20:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7960,7960,'en','Crispy za’atar chicken pilaf with pomegranate','Nestle crispy za’atar chicken pieces amongst pistachio pilaf rice for an irresistible supper. It’s a riot of colour, texture and flavour','["8 skin-on chicken thighs","3 tbsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 lemon, juiced","3 tbsp za’atar","70g pomegranate seeds","½ small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","1 tbsp olive oil","50g butter","2 large onions, sliced","220g basmati rice","350ml hot chicken stock","70g pistachios, chopped","1 tsp chilli flakes"]','["Toss together the chicken thighs oil, 1 tsp salt, garlic and lemon juice in a large bowl. Cover and chill for at least 1 hr, or up to 12 hrs.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4, and heat a frying pan over a high heat. Fry the chicken, skin-side down, for 5-7 mins, or until golden and crisp. Transfer to abaking trayand sprinkle with the za’atar, then roast for 10 mins.","For the rice, heat the oil and butter in a large, shallowcasseroleor frying pan over a low-medium heat. Fry the onions with a pinch of salt for 15 mins until caramelised and sticky. Stir in the rice, stock, pistachios and chilli flakes. Season. Arrange the roasted chicken thighs on top of the rice, and pour over any roasting juices from the tray. Cook in the oven for 45 mins, or until the rice is tender. Remove from the oven, cover and rest for 5 mins.","Scatter the chicken pilaf with the pomegranate seeds and parsley, then serve in shallow bowls."]','2026-01-10 12:20:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7962,7962,'en','Harissa cauliflower pilaf','Evoke the Middle East with our veggie harissa cauliflower pilaf with a heady combination of fruit, nuts and spice. Cook it in the oven for lovely fluffy rice','["300g basmati rice","1 red onion, finely sliced","2 lemons, 1 juiced, 1 cut into wedges","2 tsp sugar","4 tbsp harissa","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp olive oil","1 large or 2 medium cauliflower, broken into large florets, stalk chopped, large leaves roughly chopped","pinch of saffron","2 bay leaves","700ml hot vegan vegetable stock","100g sultanas","100g flaked almonds, toasted until golden brown","½  small bunch of dill, chopped, plus extra to serve","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","50g pomegranate seeds (optional)"]','["Wash the rice really well, then leave to soak in cold water for 1 hr. Put the onion in a small bowl and toss with the lemon juice, the sugar and a pinch of salt. Leave to pickle while you make the pilaf.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Whisk 2 tbsp harissa, the garlic and oil in a large bowl, then add the cauliflower and toss to coat in the sauce. Season, then tip into a roasting tin and roast for 30 mins until tender and golden.","Meanwhile, mix the saffron, bay leaves, stock and 2 tbsp harissa in a pan over a very low heat to keep warm while the cauli roasts.","Remove the cauli from the oven, tip into a dish and squeeze over the juice from one of the lemon wedges. Drain the rice and tip into the roasting tin. Pour over the infused stock, and mix well. Stir in the sultanas, half the almonds, the dill, chickpeas, and half the cauliflower. Cover the tin with a double layer of foil, sealing well, then bake for 30 mins until the rice is tender and stock is absorbed.","Fluff up the rice with a fork, then fold in the remaining cauliflower (this creates a contrast of cauli textures). Scatter over the extra dill, the remaining almonds, the pomegranate seeds, if using, the pickled red onions and remaining lemon wedges to squeeze over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7964,7964,'en','Roasted cauliflower with harissa & chickpea sauce','Make the most of seasonal cauliflower with this Middle Eastern-inspired main. The roasted veg is served with a spiced chickpea sauce made with onion, tomatoes and harissa','["1 large cauliflower","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil, plus extra for the tin","½  tsp cumin seeds","1 large onion, sliced","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp rose harissa","35g butter","400g can chickpeas, rinsed and drained","2 tbsp flaked almonds, toasted","salad, to serve (optional)","200g natural yogurt","2 tsp smoked paprika","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp onion granules","pinch of dried or fresh thyme leaves","1 garlic clove, crushed","½  lemon, juiced","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 tbsp tahini","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","4 tbsp plain natural yogurt"]','["Make the marinade by combining all the ingredients with 1½ tsp sea salt in a mixing bowl and stirring until well combined. Remove any leaves from the cauliflower and slice them lengthways. Put the cauliflower leaf slices in a bowl with a pinch of salt. Set aside for later.","Cut the cauliflower into thick slices about 1½cm-2cm thick – don’t worry if some of the florets break off, it’s all being roasted. Oil a large roasting tray and tip in the cauliflower slices and florets. Pour over the marinade and stir to coat, then cover with foil and marinate for at least 2 hrs, but you could leave it in the fridge all day or overnight if you wanted.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Roast the cauliflower covered with foil for 40-45 mins. Meanwhile, make the sauce. Heat the olive oil with the cumin seeds in a heavy-bottomed frying pan over a medium heat. Add the onion and a pinch of salt and fry, stirring, for 8-10 mins until starting to caramelise. Tip in the chopped tomatoes and some seasoning. Turn the heat up slightly and cook, continuing to stir, for 6-8 mins until reduced, then add in the garlic, harissa and butter, and stir to combine. Blitz in a food processor until smooth, then pour back into the pan, add the chickpeas and cauliflower leaves, and warm through for a minute or two.","Remove the foil from the cauliflower and return the tray to the oven for 10 mins to caramelise. Stir the tahini and olive oil into the yogurt in a bowl and season. Once the cauliflower is ready, divide the warm sauce between plates, then top with the cauliflower slices and tahini yogurt. Scatter over the almonds. Serve with a well-dressed salad of crunchy leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:20:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7966,7966,'en','Chicken with crushed harissa chickpeas','Need something speedy for dinner? Try this chicken, coated in flavourful za’atar and served with spiced chickpeas. It’s simple, but seriously delicious','["2 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 onion, chopped","1 red pepper, finely sliced","1 yellow pepper, finely sliced","4 chicken breasts","1 tbsp za''atar","400g can chickpeas","1½ tbsp red harissa paste","150g baby spinach","½ small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","lemon wedges, to serve"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of oil in a frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onions and peppers for 7 mins until softened and golden.","Meanwhile, put the chicken between two sheets of baking parchment and lightly bash until about 2cm thick. Mix together the remaining oil and the za''atar, then rub over the chicken. Season to taste.","Heat the grill to high. Put the chicken on a baking tray lined with foil, and grill for 3-4 mins each side, or until golden and cooked through.","Heat the chickpeas in a pan with the harissa paste and 2 tbsp water until warmed through, then roughly mash with a potato masher. Wilt the spinach in a pan with 1 tbsp of water or in the microwave in a heatproof bowl. Stir the pepper and onion mixture, spinach and parsley through the chickpeas. Serve with the sliced chicken and the lemon wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7968,7968,'en','Beef & sour cherry manti with tomato-chilli butter','Treat yourself to a Turkish feast and put these beef and sour cherry manti (dumplings) centre stage. You can pre-make the manti and freeze them for ease','["300g Turkish inci flour or ‘00’ pasta flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp fine salt","1 large egg, beaten","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","fine semolina, for dusting","toasted pine nuts, to serve","thyme leaves, to serve","125g beef mince","30g onion (½ small), very finely chopped","20g parsley, very finely chopped","20g dried sour cherries, chopped","½ tsp fennel seeds, ground using a pestle and mortar","200g unsalted butter","pinch dried oregano","1½ tbsp tomato purée","500g tomato passata","sherry vinegar, to season","caster sugar, to season","1 tbsp pul biber (Turkish chilli flakes)","125g Greek yogurt","½ small garlic clove, finely grated","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","a pasta machine"]','["To make the dough, put the flour and salt in a stand mixer with a dough hook. Add the egg and oil, then mix on a low speed. Gradually add about 2 tbsp water. Once the mixture starts to clump, tip out onto a lightly floured work surface and knead for about 10 mins until you have a firm, smooth dough. Cut into four portions, wrap each one and rest in the fridge for 30 mins.","To make the filling, combine all the ingredients with some salt and mix well by hand. Fry a small amount to check the seasoning.","Feed one piece of dough through the largest setting on a pasta machine, then fold in half before rolling again. Continue until you reach setting 2/3. Lay the dough out on a work surface dusted with semolina and cut into squares about 6 x 6cm. Spoon 1 tsp of the filling into the centre of each. Brush a little water around the edges and gather up in the centre to form a manti shape (see top image). Continue until you run out of filling, putting the finished manti on a tray heavily dusted with semolina. Keep the remaining pasta wrapped as you work. You’ll have more than you need (see tip, below). Chill the manti for up to 24 hrs.","To make the tomato-chilli butter, melt half the butter in a pan, add the oregano and tomato purée and cook briefly before pouring in the passata with a pinch of salt. Cook over a low heat for around 20 mins. Finish with a splash of sherry vinegar and a pinch of caster sugar. Heat the remaining butter until it browns, pour through a fine sieve, leave to cool for 2 mins, then add the pul biber. Combine the sauce and chilli butter and keep warm. Make the garlic yogurt by whisking the ingredients with 2 tbsp water.","Cook the manti in boiling water for about 5 mins until tender and the meat is cooked though. Drain and serve the manti with the yogurt sauce and chilli butter, and sprinkle with pine nuts and thyme."]','2026-01-10 12:20:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7970,7970,'en','Pistachio, almond, lemon & rose baklava','Wrap up a Middle Eastern or Turkish-inspired menu with fragrant homemade baklava for dessert. Diana Henry’s recipe features pistachio, almond, rose and lemon flavours','["125g ground almonds","300g pistachios, chopped in a food processor (some roughly, some finely)","1 lemon, finely zested and juiced, plus 4 broad strips of zest","500g granulated sugar, plus 3 tbsp","200g butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","2 x 250g packs of filo pastry (you won’t use all the sheets)","about 2 tsp rosewater (add to taste as brands vary in strength)","handful of pink rose petals, unsprayed (optional)"]','["Mix the ground almonds and chopped pistachios in a bowl, reserving 3 tbsp of the pistachios to garnish. Stir in the finely grated lemon zest, the 3 tbsp of sugar and 5 tbsp of the melted butter. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Brush the inside of a roasting or baking tin (30 x 20cm) with the butter.","Whatever size of filo sheets you have, cut them to fit the tin. Lay one sheet of filo in it, butter it, and keep going until you have 6 sheets of filo. Spoon the nut mixture on top and press down with the back of a spoon, like making a biscuit base, then put 8 filo sheets on the top, again buttering each one. Using a sharp knife, cut a diamond trellis on top, then bake in the oven for 1 hr until golden brown.","Make the syrup by putting the sugar, lemon juice and strips of zest into a saucepan with 250ml water. Bring to a boil, stirring to help the sugar dissolve, then turn the heat down a little and simmer for 10 mins. The mixture will look quite syrupy. Remove the lemon zest and add the rosewater to taste.","While the baklava and the syrup are still warm, pour the syrup carefully over the pastry. Return the baklava to the oven for 5 more mins.","Sprinkle the remaining pistachios over the baklava, then leave to cool overnight – so that the baklava can absorb all the syrup. If you’re making this for a special occasion, it’s nice to scatter over some torn rose petals (they have to be small pieces) just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7972,7972,'en','Feta, date & spinach pastries','Make the most of dates with these Middle Eastern-inspired sweet and savoury filo pastries. Packed with feta, dates and spinach, they make a great side dish','["500g spinach, any coarse stalks removed","115g butter","1 tbsp olive oil","½  small onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","4 spring onions, finely chopped","8 dates, stoned and finely chopped","½ small bunch of parsley, leaves finely chopped","8 mint sprigs, leaves torn","25g toasted pine nuts","150g feta, crumbled","1 medium egg, lightly beaten","250g pack filo pastry sheets","black sesame seeds, for sprinkling"]','["Put the spinach in a pan with 2 tbsp water over a low-medium heat and cover. Stir the spinach a couple of times until wilted, about 4 mins, then drain. When cool enough to handle, firmly squeeze the excess water from the spinach with your hands, then roughly chop.","Heat 10g of the butter and all of the oil in a large frying pan. Add the onion and cook over a medium-low heat until pale and softened. Add the drained spinach and garlic, season and cook for about 5 mins, stirring occasionally. Leave to cool.","Transfer the spinach mixture to a bowl, then mix in the spring onions, dates, parsley, mint, pine nuts, feta and egg. Season.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Unroll the filo pastry and cut it into strips 9-10cm wide. Melt the rest of the butter, then brush one strip with some of it before putting another strip on top and brushing that too. Keep the remaining pastry covered with a tea towel as you work. Put two heaped teaspoonfuls of the filling at the end of the strip nearest to you. Fold the bottom corner of the pastry diagonally over the filling, so that what was the bottom edge now meets the right-hand edge of the pastry. Fold over the filled triangle and keep going like this with the whole strip, brushing with butter as you go, until you have a neat triangular filo package. Repeat the process with all the pastry and filling. Brush the top of each one with butter, then put onto baking sheets. Sprinkle with the black sesame seeds and bake for 25-30 mins, or until the pastry is golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:20:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7974,7974,'en','Middle Eastern-style cabbage rolls','Add this vegan dish to your repertoire. We''ve filled cabbage leaves with satisfying brown rice and lentils along with mint, lemon, tahini and pine nuts','["16 large Savoy cabbage leaves, stems trimmed (430g prepared weight)","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 large onions (360g), finely chopped","40g pine nuts","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp ground coriander","1½  tsp cinnamon","150g brown basmati rice","1½  tbsp vegetable bouillon powder","390g can green lentils, drained","1 lemon, zested and juiced","4 tbsp chopped mint","2 tbsp tahini","1 garlic clove, finely grated","6 tomatoes, sliced","¼ cucumber (150g), sliced","12 Kalamata olives, pitted and sliced","1 tbsp chopped mint"]','["Bring a large pan of water to the boil, add the cabbage leaves and put a heavy ladle on top to keep them submerged. Boil for 4 mins, then drain, reserving the water.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a non-stick pan. Reserve 2 tbsp of the onion, then fry the rest for 10 mins until just golden. Stir in the pine nuts and cook until starting to colour. Add the spices and rice, then pour in 450ml of the reserved water. Stir in the bouillon powder, cover and cook for 15 mins until the rice is almost tender and the liquid is absorbed. Stir in the zest and mint.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put a spoonful of the rice into the centre of a cabbage leaf, roll up and put in a shallow casserole dish. Repeat with the remaining rice and leaves. Cover and bake for 30 mins until the rice is fully tender.","Meanwhile, combine the tahini, lemon juice, garlic and 3 tbsp water, and mix the salad ingredients with the reserved onion. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, serve half the rolls with half of the sauce and half of the salad. Cover and chill the rest to eat another day. Will keep in the fridge for two to three days. Reheat in the microwave until hot."]','2026-01-10 12:20:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7976,7976,'en','Lebanese-style meatballs with mujadara','Brown rice, lentils and onions make a delicious base for this healthy dinner. We''ve used lean lamb mince and plenty of herbs and spices to add flavour','["250g lamb mince (10% fat or lower)","2 large onions (320g), 1 very finely chopped, 1 halved and thinly sliced","1 garlic clove, finely grated","3 tsp ground cumin","1 lemon, half zested and juiced, half cut into four wedges to serve","2 tsp rapeseed oil","200g brown basmati rice","1 tbsp bouillon powder","390g can green lentils, drained","2 tbsp tahini","4 tomatoes, cut into wedges","¼ cucumber (about 150g), sliced","12 Kalamata olives, quartered","1 tbsp chopped mint, plus a few small leaves to serve"]','["Tip the lamb into a bowl with ¼ of the chopped onion, the garlic, ½ tsp cumin, the lemon zest and some black pepper. Mix well with your hands, then shape into 16 small meatballs. Chill for at least 30 mins.","Heat 1 tsp oil in a non-stick frying pan over a medium-high heat. Reserve most of the remaining chopped onion for the salad, then fry the rest for 5 mins until golden. Stir in the remaining cumin, then tip in the rice, bouillon powder, 500ml water and some black pepper. Reduce the heat to a simmer, then cover and cook over a medium heat for 30 mins. Tip in the lentils, cover again and cook for 5-10 mins more until the rice is tender and all the water has been absorbed.","Meanwhile, heat the remaining oil in a non-stick pan over a medium-high heat. Add the meatballs and sliced onion, cover and cook for 5 mins. Stir, then cook for 5 mins more until the meatballs are cooked through and the onions are golden. Stir the tahini and lemon juice together with 3-4 tbsp water to make a sauce.","Mix all of the salad ingredients with the reserved chopped onion. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, divide half of the mujadara between two plates and top with half of the meatballs and onions. Spoon over half of the tahini sauce and serve with half of the salad, two lemon wedges and a few mint leaves. Cover and chill the remaining portions to eat another day. Will keep for two to three days in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:20:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7978,7978,'en','Twisted spiced bread with honey & tahini butter','Bake this Middle Eastern-inspired loaf to serve for a festive brunch. To make things extra indulgent, spread thick slices with our moreish honey and tahini butter','["120-140ml whole milk","50g unsalted butter, cubed","300g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","50g golden caster sugar","½ tsp fine sea salt","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 medium egg, lightly beaten","oil, for the bowl","50g unsalted butter, softened","2 tbsp sesame seeds, toasted","50g light brown soft sugar","3 tsp cinnamon","¼ tsp ground cardamom","70g salted butter, softened","2 tbsp runny honey","2 tbsp tahini","75g golden icing sugar","sesame seeds, for sprinkling (optional)"]','["Warm 120ml milk and the butter in a small saucepan until melted. Leave to cool to lukewarm.","Combine the flour, sugar, salt and yeast in the bowl of a stand mixer. Make a well in the centre and pour in the egg and warmed milk, then mix until just combined. If it seems a little dry, add an extra 20ml milk. Knead the mixture on a gentle speed using a dough hook for 5-8 mins, or until the dough is smooth and springs back when pressed. If you don’t have a stand mixer, combine everything in a bowl, then knead on a lightly floured surface for 8-10 mins. Shape the dough into a ball and leave to prove in a large, lightly oiled bowl covered with a tea towel for 1 hr-1 hr 30 mins, or until doubled in size.","To make the filling, combine the ingredients and set aside.","Line a large baking sheet with baking parchment. Roll the proved dough out on a lightly floured surface to a 40cm square. Spread the filling evenly over the dough using a palette knife, leaving a 2cm border around the edge. Roll the dough up into a tight log, starting with the end furthest from you – it should measure roughly 40cm in length. Cut the dough log in half lengthways down the middle so you have two long pieces laying beside each other, horizontally, cut-side up. Pinch together at both ends, then pick up the ends and twist the pieces around each other, as though you’re making a rope.","Transfer the loaf to the prepared sheet. Loosely cover and let it prove in a warm place until doubled in size again, about 45 mins-1 hr. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Put the sheet in the centre of the oven and bake for 35-40 mins, covering loosely with foil if it starts to become too dark during baking. When ready, the loaf should be golden and sound hollow when tapped on the bottom. Leave to cool slightly for 15 mins if you’re serving it warm, or leave to cool completely on a wire rack.","To make the tahini butter, mix the ingredients with a pinch of salt using a wooden spoon until combined. To make the icing, mix the sugar with 1 tbsp warm water until smooth, adding more if it’s too thick. Drizzle over the loaf and sprinkle with the sesame seeds, if using. Slice the loaf and serve with the honey & tahini butter. Best eaten the day it’s made."]','2026-01-10 12:20:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7980,7980,'en','Griddled squid, lentil, roast pepper & preserved lemon with tahini','Pair homemade tahini sauce with griddled squid, lentils and peppers for a tasty supper. The sauce also goes well with roast veg or fish','["3 large red peppers, halved and deseeded","4 tbsp extra virgin olive oil, plus a little extra for roasting and frying","½  small onion, finely chopped","1 celery stick, diced","225g puy lentils","1 lemon, juiced","½  small bunch parsley, chopped","600g cleaned and prepared squid","2 green and 2 red chillies, halved, deseeded and finely sliced","2 garlic cloves, finely sliced","1 preserved lemon, flesh removed and discarded, rind very finely sliced","4 tbsp tahini","2 tbsp Greek yogurt","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","½  lemon, juiced","½  small bunch coriander, finely chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Put the peppers on a baking tray and brush with some olive oil. Roast for 25-30 mins, until soft and blistered. Leave to cool slightly.","To make the dressing, combine everything together until it is the consistency of double cream. If it’s too thick, add a little water and adjust the seasoning to taste. Set aside. Slice the peppers into strips.","Heat a little olive oil in a medium pan and fry the onion and celery for 10 mins until soft but not coloured. Tip in the lentils and cover with water. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for 15 mins, or until the lentils are tender, topping up the water if needed.","Drain the lentils, then spoon into a serving bowl. Season well, then stir in 1 tbsp olive oil, half the lemon juice and the parsley. Leave to cool a bit, then add the peppers.","Cut the ‘wings’ from the squid and put them aside with the tentacles. Slice the bodies down one side so they open out, then clean the inside by running a knife blade firmly over the flesh. Score the flesh on the inside, ensuring you don’t cut all the way through. Pat dry with kitchen paper, then transfer to a bowl with just enough olive oil to moisten the pieces (about 2 tbsp). Heat a griddle pan until very hot.","Season the squid and griddle in batches for 20-30 seconds on each side until just golden. Cut into bite-sized pieces, then toss through the lentil salad and drizzle over the remaining lemon juice.","In a small frying pan, heat 1 tbsp oil and fry the chillies and garlic until golden. Pour over the squid, then toss through the preserved lemon. Serve with the dressing spooned over or on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:20:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7982,7982,'en','Lamb chops with hummus & roasted tomatoes','Introduce a little sunshine to your day whatever the weather with Mediterranean-style lamb chops served on a bed of hummus, roasted tomatoes, olives and feta','["3 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for drizzling","4 garlic cloves, crushed","8 lamb chops","200g mixed cherry tomatoes on the vine","40g pine nuts","handful watercress","12 black olives, pitted and halved","50g feta, crumbled","handful fresh mint, finely chopped, to serve","2 flatbreads, warmed, to serve","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","½ lemon, juiced","1 small garlic clove, roughly chopped","1½ tsp tahini","1 tbsp olive oil"]','["Mix the oil and garlic together, then rub half over the lamb chops. Season well, then set aside to marinate. Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.","Put the tomatoes on a baking tray, then drizzle over the remaining oil mixture and season. Cook for 8-10 mins until soft, adding the pine nuts for the final 2-3 mins to toast.","Make the hummus by blitzing all the ingredients together with 2-3 tbsp water until smooth.","Heat a griddle pan over a medium-high heat and cook the lamb for 4-5 mins on each side, or until cooked to your liking. Hold the fatty side of the meat against the pan for 2-3 mins until crisp. Cover and set aside to rest for 5 mins.","Spread the hummus over a platter or four plates and top with the tomatoes, a drizzle of olive oil, the lamb and watercress. Scatter over the olives, pine nuts, feta and mint, and serve with the flatbreads."]','2026-01-10 12:20:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7984,7984,'en','Baba ganoush','A delicious smoky aubergine dip, perfect with warm flatbreads or pittas, or serve with other Middle Eastern dishes as part of a sharing meal','["2 medium aubergines","40ml extra virgin olive oil","¼ tsp ground coriander","¼ tsp ground cumin","2 tbsp tahini","1 large lemon, juiced","½  small bunch parsley, finely chopped","flatbreads or pitta bread, to serve"]','["Heat the grill to its highest setting. Put the aubergines on a baking sheet and grill for 35-40 mins or until completely softened, blackened and blistered, turning them halfway through with a pair of tongs. Set aside and leave to cool completely.","Once your aubergines are cool enough to handle, gently peel off the charred skin and discard. Transfer the flesh to the large bowl of a food processor along with 30ml of the oil, the coriander, cumin, tahini, lemon and half the parsley. Season and pulse the flesh three or four times to create a chunky textured dip.","Transfer the dip to a bowl and drizzle with the remaining oil, scatter over any leftover parsley and serve with warm flatbreads or pitta."]','2026-01-10 12:20:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7986,7986,'en','Turkish eggs','Looking for a warming bowl of comfort food for two? These easy vegetarian Turkish poached eggs can be ready in just 20 minutes','["1 red chilli, finely sliced","50g butter","1 garlic clove, crushed","200g Greek yogurt","½  lemon, juiced","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","2 medium eggs","2 tsp sumac","small pack coriander, leaves picked","toast, to serve"]','["Put the chilli and butter in a small pan and melt on a very gentle heat to ensure the chilli flavour infuses while you make the rest of the dish.","Whisk the garlic into the yogurt. Season well and add the lemon juice. Bring a large pan of water to a simmer. Add the vinegar, make a swirl with a large spoon, then crack each egg into the water. Poach for 3 mins until set, then drain on kitchen paper.","To serve, put half the yogurt in each bowl, add a poached egg to each, then drizzle with the melted chilli butter. Season, top with sumac and coriander leaves, and serve with toast."]','2026-01-10 12:20:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7988,7988,'en','Turkish kebabs with tomato chilli sauce','These spicy chicken kebabs can be marinated the day before for extra flavour. Wrap in a warm flatbread and top with pickled chilli and cooling yogurt','["2 garlic cloves","200g Greek yogurt","1 lemon, juiced","2 tsp tomato purée","2 tsp chilli flakes (Aleppo are nice)","2 tsp sumac","4 chicken breasts, cut into chunks","300g baby plum tomatoes","1 thumb-sized red chilli, stem removed","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 small red onion, sliced","1 tbsp pomegranate molasses","4 Middle Eastern flatbreads","long pickled chillis (guindillas)","a handful fresh coriander","a handful fresh flat-leaf parsley"]','["Crush 1 garlic clove and mix with 3 tbsp yogurt, the lemon juice, 1 tsp tomato purée, half the spices, and some seasoning in a medium bowl. Add the chicken, toss, cover and chill in the fridge for at least 1 hr or overnight.","Make the chilli sauce. Put 100g of the tomatoes, the whole red chilli, the remaining spices, garlic clove and tomato purée, plus 1 tbsp olive oil, half the red onion and the pomegranate molasses in a food processor. Add some seasoning and pulse until puréed, then set aside.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, and heat a griddle pan. Thread the chicken onto metal skewers or wooden ones that have been soaked, then wipe off the excess marinade. Skewer the remaining tomatoes on a separate skewer. Lightly oil the griddle with the remaining olive oil and brown the chicken on both sides, then transfer to a baking tray and bake in the oven for 10 mins, or until cooked through. Meanwhile, griddle the tomatoes for 1-2 mins, turning halfway through so they have griddle marks on both sides.","Serve the chicken and tomatoes on flatbreads with the remaining red onion, pickled chillis, the remaining Greek yogurt, parsley and coriander with the chilli sauce spooned over."]','2026-01-10 12:20:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7990,7990,'en','Turkish lamb flatbread','Perfect finger food for a party, put out this spiced lamb flatbread, sliced into squares and watch it disappear in minutes','["1 tsp dried yeast","400g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp salt","a little oil","semolina, for dusting","500g lean lamb leg meat, finely chopped (or lean mince)","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 tsp Turkish chilli flakes or 1tsp chilli flakes","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground cinnamon","4 tbsp tomato purée","400g can plum tomatoes, drained","4 tbsp pomegranate molasses, plus extra for drizzling","2 small red onions, thinly sliced into half moons","50g pine nuts","100g feta, crumbled","2 tbsp chopped flat-leaf parsley","50g pomegranate seeds"]','["Mix the yeast and 250ml warm water in a small bowl, and leave to stand for 5-10 mins until foamy – this means the yeast is working. Put the flour and salt in a large mixing bowl (or use a tabletop mixer fitted with a dough hook and set at a low speed). Add the yeast mixture and mix by hand or machine until the dough comes together into a ball. If the mixture is too sticky to form a ball, add 2 tbsp flour and mix again. Knead for 12 mins by hand, or 8-10 mins on a high speed in the mixer, until smooth, then put in a lightly oiled bowl. Turn to coat the dough in the oil, cover with cling film and leave in a warm place for 2-4 hrs until doubled in size. (You can also put it in the fridge overnight, punch down and let it rise again at room temperature.)","Heat the oven to 240C/220C/gas 9. Put a baking sheet or pizza stone on the middle shelf. If you’re using lamb leg meat, blitz it in a food processor until it’s finely minced. Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan over a medium-high heat until hot. Add the onion and garlic, and cook for 10 mins until golden. Add the lamb and cook for 5 mins or until brown, breaking up any lumps with a spoon, then pour off any excess oil. Add the spices, some seasoning, tomato purée, tomatoes and the pomegranate molasses, and cook for 5 mins more, mixing everything together well and breaking down the tomatoes with a spoon. Remove from the heat and leave to cool completely. Can be done one or two days ahead.","Roll out the dough on a floured surface into a large rectangle about 30 x 40cm. Sprinkle 1 tsp or so of the semolina on a baking sheet. Put the dough on top and make sure it can move around. Add the spicy lamb first, then top with the red onions, pine nuts and feta. Slide onto the heated baking sheet or pizza stone and cook for 10-15 mins until crisp on the bottom.","Remove and drizzle with a little extra pomegranate molasses, then scatter over the parsley and pomegranate seeds. Transfer to a large board and cut into diamonds to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7991,7991,'en','Rainbow cheesecake','Our show-stopping rainbow cheesecake is sure to brighten up any party. This easy dessert has a delicious biscuit base and vibrant, colourful layers','["170g butter","140g Oreo biscuits (or similar) cream removed","140g digestive biscuits, crushed to fine crumbs","600g full fat soft cheese (we used Philadelphia)","170g golden caster sugar","2 tbsp plain flour","1 ½ tsp vanilla extract","2 large eggs","200g soured cream","gel food colourings","double cream, whipped to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/ 160C fan/ gas 4. Line the base of a 20cm springform tin by putting a square piece of parchment paper or foil on top of the tin base and then clipping the side on so the paper or foil is trapped and any excess sticks out of the bottom.","For the crust, melt 85g butter in a medium pan. Stir in the darker biscuit crumbs so the mixture is evenly damp. Press the mixture into the bottom of the pan. Melt the remaining butter and stir in the digestive crumbs as before. Make a layer on top of the first, tamp everything down firmly and bake for 10 minutes. Cool while preparing the filling.","Increase the oven temperature to fan 220C/ 200C fan/ gas 7. Whisk the soft cheese with the caster sugar, plain flour and a pinch of salt, and vanilla extract. Whisk in the eggs and soured cream but don''t over-beat. The batter should be smooth and and very thick. Divide the batter equally between 6 bowls and colour each one using purple, blue, green, yellow, orange and red.","Brush the sides of the tin with melted butter and put on a baking sheet. Spoon in the filling, starting with red and then orange, yellow etc. The mixture should be thick enough to spoon and spread each layer carefully on top of the other. Bake for 10 minutes.","Reduce oven temperature to 110C/ 90C fan/ gas ¼ and bake for 35-40 minutes more. If you gently shake the tin, the filling should have a very slight wobble in the centre, if it looks liquid, cook for a little longer and check again. Turn off the oven and cool with the door very slightly ajar. Chill the cooled cheesecake until you want to serve it. Decorate just before serving.","To serve whip the cream until it is thick enough to pipe. Spoon in the cream and pipe blobs or rosettes on top of the cheesecake. For rainbow rosettes, using a paint brush make some rainbow stripes of food colour down the inside of a piping bag fitted with a nozzle before spooning in the cream."]','2026-01-10 12:20:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7992,7992,'en','Turkish-style sharing bread','This deep-pan version of a classic Turkish ''pizza'' called lahmacun, topped with spicy lamb mince and red onion, cuts into bite-size wedges for a fuss-free yet flavour-packed party nibble','["500g pack ciabatta bread mix","2 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, quartered","1 garlic clove","1 tsp cinnamon","1 tsp cumin","¼ tsp chilli powder","handful flat-leaf parsley","2 tbsp sundried tomato paste","250g lamb mince","150g pot baba ganoush","juice 1 lemon","1 tbsp olive oil","1 red onion, cut into thin rings","50ml red wine vinegar","50g toasted pine nuts","1 tbsp chopped flat-leaf parsley"]','["Make the ciabatta bread dough following pack instructions. Once it has risen, knock it back by punching some of the air out and kneading it a little. Roll into an oval shape (approx 35 x 25cm) and place on a large baking tray. Lightly brush the whole surface with olive oil and cover with cling film. Leave to prove for 30 mins while you make the topping.","Put all the topping ingredients, except the lamb, in a small food processor and blitz until finely chopped. Tip into a large bowl, mix in the lamb, season well, then squish everything together with your hands until thoroughly mixed. Chill until needed.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. In a small saucepan, heat the red onion rings with the vinegar and 1 tbsp water until really soft, then leave to cool.","Dot the surface of the dough with the lamb topping – gently press it down with your fingers to spread it evenly over the surface, but try not to press too much air out of the dough. Bake in the oven for 15-20 mins or until the base is risen and golden, and the meat is cooked through and caramelised at the edges.","Meanwhile, make the dressing. Stir together the baba ganoush, lemon juice and olive oil, then pop in the fridge until serving.","Once the bread is baked, transfer to a wooden board. Drain the onions in a metal sieve and scatter over the bread. Drizzle over the baba ganoush dressing, leaving some on the side as a dip, then sprinkle over the pine nuts and parsley. Serve warm."]','2026-01-10 12:20:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7994,7994,'en','Turkish pilaf with saffron & goji berries','We’ve put together the ultimate recipe for brain health, packed with brain-boosting nutrients like cinnamon, almonds and goji berries','["2 large garlic cloves","generous pinch of saffron","3 tsp rapeseed oil","200g diced skinless turkey thigh","85g wholegrain basmati rice","½  tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp vegetable bouillon","3 celery sticks, finely chopped","1 tbsp fresh thyme leaves","1 tbsp dried goji berries","1 medium onion, halved and very thinly sliced","100g baby spinach leaves","25g flaked almonds"]','["Finely chop the garlic and set aside to activate (see tip). Meanwhile, pour 2 tbsp boiling water over the saffron and set aside to infuse. Heat 2 tsp of the oil in a large, non-stick sauté pan with a lid, then add the turkey and fry for 5 mins, stirring frequently, until it starts to brown.","Stir the rice and cinnamon into the pan, then pour in 400ml boiling water and the bouillon, and stir well. Add the celery, thyme, goji berries and lots of ground black pepper. Cover the pan tightly to prevent steam escaping, and cook over a low heat for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, heat the remaining oil in a non-stick pan and add the onion. When it starts to soften, cover the pan for 5 mins to steam it a little more. Take off the lid and slowly fry for 12-15 mins until golden, stirring frequently.","After the rice has cooked for 20 mins, check the water level – if the rice is still too nutty and the liquid has all been absorbed, add up to 100ml more water. Stir in the saffron, cover again, and cook for 5-10 mins until the rice is tender.","Add the garlic and spinach, cook briefly to wilt the leaves, then turn off the heat. Toss through the fried onions and almonds. Cover the pan and leave to rest for 5 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7996,7996,'en','Middle Eastern eggs with merguez & pistachios','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyBring some bold flavours into this brunch for two with harissa, sumac and pistachios – swap for chipolatas or chorizo if you prefer','["drizzle of olive or rapeseed oil","1 small red onion, chopped","4 merguez sausages","15 cherry tomatoes, halved","pinch of sugar (any will do)","2 tsp harissa paste (preferably rose harissa, as it’s fragrant and not too hot)","2 eggs","2 wholemeal pitta breads","pinch of sumac or paprika (optional)","2 tbsp Greek yogurt","few parsley sprigs, chopped","1 tbsp shelled pistachio, roughly chopped"]','["Heat a drizzle of oil in a heavy-bottomed, small frying pan – a cast-iron one is perfect. Add the onion and cook for a few mins until soft, then push them to one side of the pan. Add the sausages and fry for 5-10 mins, rolling them around in the pan until golden brown. Add the tomatoes, sugar and harissa, season well and add a splash of water. Cook for 5-10 mins, stirring now and then, until the tomatoes have cooked down to a thick, chunky sauce.","Push the sausages aside in the pan so that you can create 2 large holes in the sauce using a spoon. Crack the eggs into the holes and cook for 4-5 mins until the whites are just set and the yolk is still runny. Meanwhile, toast the pitta breads.","Sprinkle each egg with a little sumac, dollop on some yogurt, then sprinkle over the parsley and pistachios. Cut each pitta bread in half and serve on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:20:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(7998,7998,'en','Falafel burgers','Whizz up chickpeas with garlic, spices and herbs to make delicious vegetarian patties for lunch or dinner','["250g chickpeas from a can","1 medium onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp ground cumin","small pack flat-leaf parsley, chopped","2 rounded tbsp plain flour","2 tbsp vegetable oil","100g houmous","4 burger buns, cut in half","watercress, to serve"]','["Drain, rinse and dry the chickpeas thoroughly, then tip into the bowl of a food processor. Pulse until lightly broken up into coarse crumbs.","Add the onion, garlic, spices, parsley, flour and some seasoning, and continue to pulse until combined. Using your hands, gently form the mixture into 4 patties about 10cm in diameter and 2cm thick.","In a large pan, heat the oil and fry the falafels on each side for 2-3 mins or until golden (you may need to do this in batches). Lightly griddle the burger buns on the cut side in a griddle pan, or toast under the grill.","Spread one side of each bun with houmous, top with a falafel burger, add a handful of watercress, then pop the remaining bun half on top."]','2026-01-10 12:20:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8000,8000,'en','Lebanese chicken wraps','Marinate chicken in yogurt, lemon and allspice before char-grilling and wrapping in flatbread with salad for a light and delicious midweek meal','["4 skinless chicken breasts","200g Greek yogurt","juice and zest 1 lemon","1 tsp allspice","2 tsp olive oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","25g pine nuts, toasted","small bunch parsley, finely chopped","2 tomatoes, diced","½  cucumber, diced","4 large tortilla wraps or large flatbreads","mixed salad, to serve"]','["Lay the chicken breasts on a sheet of baking parchment, cover with another sheet of parchment, then flatten by bashing them with a rolling pin. Mix half the yogurt in a large bowl with half the lemon juice, the lemon zest, allspice, olive oil, garlic and a pinch of salt. Mix thoroughly, then stir in the chicken, making sure it is well coated in the mixture. Cover and chill for 30 mins to marinate.","Heat a griddle pan over a high heat and cook the chicken for 5-6 mins each side or until cooked through (you may need to do this in batches). Transfer to a board and slice. Spread the rest of the yogurt over the wraps and fill with the pine nuts, cooked chicken, parsley, tomatoes and cucumber. Drizzle over the rest of the lemon juice and roll up. Put the wraps back on the griddle pan for 30 secs each side to lightly toast, then serve with a mixed salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8002,8002,'en','Falafels with spicy tomato & cashew sauce & poached spring vegetables','A vegan and gluten-free chickpea feast with a delicious dipping sauce and poached asparagus, carrots, radishes and broad beans','["200g dry chickpeas","25g parsley, leaves picked, stems reserved for the broth","2 garlic cloves, roughly chopped","1 banana shallot, roughly chopped","2 tsp ground cumin","1½  tsp ground coriander","1½  tsp turmeric","¼ tsp cayenne pepper","½  tsp gluten-free baking powder","sunflower or rapeseed oil, for frying","splash white wine (vegan if necessary, optional)","1 bay leaf","1 banana shallot, roughly chopped","1 celery heart or 2 stalks, cut into chunks","pinch of whole peppercorn","200g baby carrots, trimmed (if the green parts are intact, leave a short stem)","1 bulb fennel, trimmed and cut into slim wedges","20 asparagus tips (about 200g)","12 pink radishes (about 100g), halved","100g fresh or frozen broad beans, podded and skinned","100g tub pomegranate seeds","25g cashews","1 tbsp sesame seed","1 tsp cumin seed","½  tsp chilli flakes, or to taste","1 tbsp cold-pressed rapeseed or sunflower oil","300g tomatoes, cut into chunks","4 garlic cloves","1 tbsp agave syrup or dark brown sugar"]','["Prepare the chickpeas. Put them in a large bowl and cover with at least 3 times their volume of cold water. Cover and soak for at least 8 hrs, or overnight.","To make the falafel mixture, drain the chickpeas then put them in a food processor with some seasoning. (Don’t worry if the chickpeas still feel quite firm at this stage – this is how they should be. Add the parsley leaves to the food processor along with the rest of the falafel ingredients. Whizz on high speed, adding 2-3 tbsp water, until a smooth but fairly solid mixture forms. Scrape into a bowl and cover.","Put all the ingredients for the poaching broth, plus 1 tsp salt, 800ml water, and the reserved parsley stems, in a medium saucepan and bring to the boil. Simmer for 20 mins and set aside.","Meanwhile, make the sauce. Put the cashews, sesame seeds, cumin and chilli flakes in a dry frying pan over a medium heat. Toast, stirring frequently, until the sesame seeds start to turn golden. Remove to a plate to cool. Add the oil to the pan and return to the heat, adding the tomatoes and garlic. Cook over a medium heat until the tomatoes collapse, about 5 mins. Allow to cool for a few mins, then transfer to a blender along with the toasted nuts and spices, the agave or sugar, and a generous pinch of salt. Whizz on high speed until smooth. Leave in the blender and set aside.","Meanwhile, make the falafel balls. Use wet hands to form balls the size of large cherries and place on a tray – you should have enough to make 20-24 balls. The balls can be made a day ahead and chilled.","About 15 mins before serving, strain the poaching liquid, then return the liquid to the pan, and bring to a simmer. Heat a 5cm depth of frying oil in a large, heavy-based pan over a medium heat. When the oil is hot enough, a small piece of bread dropped in it should turn brown in 20-30 secs. Carefully lower the falafel balls into the oil, cooking in batches of 6 at a time. Fry until deep golden brown all over, about 3 mins. Remove with a slotted spoon and drain on kitchen paper, and keep warm in the oven while you cook the remaining batches. Safely set aside the oil.","Finally, poach the vegetables. Add the carrots to the poaching liquid and cook for 3-5 mins depending on the size, then add the remaining veg. Return to the boil and simmer for 3 more mins. Strain the vegetables, discarding the liquid.","To serve, first whizz the sauce once more (it has a tendency to separate). Place spoonfuls of sauce on each warmed plate (one spoonful for each falafel looks nice). Divide the falafel and spring veg between the plates, scatter with pomegranate seeds and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:20:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8004,8004,'en','Middle Eastern carrot & feta salad','A simple side salad packed with sunshine flavours, from cumin, cinnamon and coriander, to lemons, sultanas and cheese','["1kg bag carrots, peeled, halved lengthways and cut into chunks","2 tsp cumin seeds","½  tsp ground cinnamon","½  tsp ground coriander","2 tbsp runny honey","juice 2 lemons","50g sultanas or raisins","200g pack feta cheese","½  small pack coriander or flat-leaf parsley, roughly chopped"]','["Bring a large pan of water to the boil. Add the carrots, and cook for about 8-10 mins until tender. Meanwhile, in a large mixing bowl, mix together the cumin seeds, ground spices, honey and lemon juice, with some seasoning, using a small whisk or fork.","Drain the carrots, let them steam-dry for a few minutes in the colander, then mix them into the dressing with the sultanas or raisins. Leave at room temperature.","To serve, crumble over the feta and scatter with the herbs. Gently toss together."]','2026-01-10 12:20:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8006,8006,'en','Cranberry & chestnut falafel','Add a bit of seasonal spirit to your chickpea bites with fruit and nuts. Serve with a creamy yogurt dip and fresh coriander','["1 sweet potato, peeled and cut into big chunks","400g can chickpeas, drained","200g ready-cooked vacuum-packed chestnuts","1 large egg","½  tsp chilli flakes","2 tsp cumin seeds","1 garlic clove","small pack coriander, roughly chopped, plus a little more to serve","85g cranberries, defrosted if frozen and halved if you have time","4 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","150g pot creamy Greek-style yogurt, to serve"]','["Put the sweet potato into a microwave-proof bowl, add 1 tsp water and cook on High for 2 mins. Mash in a large bowl.","Put the chickpeas and chestnuts into a food processor and pulse until well chopped but not pasty. Tip on top of the sweet potato, then add the egg, spices, garlic and coriander. Season generously and mix well with your hands. Add the cranberries. Shape dessertspoon-sized balls of the mix into 20 or so patties. Can be made ahead and chilled for up to 3 days.","Heat 2 tbsp oil in a large non-stick frying pan. Fry half of the falafels for 2 mins on each side until golden. Lift onto kitchen paper to drain. Repeat with the second batch. Can be made up to 2 days ahead and reheated. Let the falafel cool for a few mins before serving with the yogurt, plus a scattering of coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:20:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8008,8008,'en','Middle Eastern carrot salad','A light and vibrant shredded salad flavoured with orange blossom water, cumin and mint- serve alongside spiced meats','["½  tsp orange blossom water","½  tsp ground cumin","1 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","juice ½ lemon","500g carrots, shredded or grated","large handful small mint leaves"]','["Put the orange blossom water, cumin,\r\noil, lemon juice and some seasoning\r\ninto a jar. Screw on the lid and shake\r\nwell to combine.","Tip the carrots and mint into a bowl.\r\nPour over the dressing, season and toss\r\neverything together."]','2026-01-10 12:20:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8010,8010,'en','Halloumi with broccoli tabbouleh & honey-harissa dressing','Couscous makes a great base for a quick salad. Flavour with smoky harissa, sweet honey and herbs, then top with fried cheese slices','["140g couscous","300g broccoli florets","6 spring onions, finely sliced","150g cherry tomatoes, quartered","large bunch parsley, finely chopped","small bunch mint, finely chopped","juice 2 lemons, zest of ½ lemon","2½  tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1½  tbsp harissa","1 tbsp clear honey","2 x 250g packs halloumi cheese, cut into 1cm-thick slices","25g toasted flaked almonds"]','["Put the couscous into a bowl and\r\ncover with boiling water. Cover with\r\ncling film and set aside for 5 mins.","Blanch the broccoli for 2 mins, then\r\ndrain well. Cut it into small pieces or blitz\r\nit in a food processor.","Fork the broccoli, spring onions,\r\ntomatoes, herbs, lemon zest, the juice\r\nof 1½ lemons and 2 tbsp oil through the\r\ncouscous. Season and mix well.","To make the dressing, combine the\r\nharissa, honey, remaining lemon juice\r\nand oil, and some seasoning.","Heat a non-stick frying pan and cook\r\nthe halloumi for 1-2 mins on each side\r\nuntil golden. Divide the couscous\r\nbetween the plates, top with the\r\nhalloumi slices and dressing, then\r\nscatter over the almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:20:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8012,8012,'en','Turkish pizza with spiced pomegranate beef & feta','Homemade pizza always wins over takeaway- try this new topping idea of spiced mince, sweet Peppadew peppers, feta cheese and pine nuts','["500g pack bread mix","1 tsp olive oil, plus a little extra for the dough","2 medium onions, chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","250g extra-lean minced beef","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tbsp red chilli flakes","5 tbsp tomato purée","6 tbsp pomegranate molasses","400g jar sweet pickled peppadews peppers, roughly chopped","50g feta cheese, crumbled","1 tbsp pine nuts"]','["Mix the dough following pack\r\ninstructions (leave about 2 tbsp of the\r\nbread mix in the bag for dusting and\r\nrolling out later). Knead for 8-10 mins,\r\nthen coat the dough in oil, place in a\r\nlarge bowl and cover. Leave to rise until\r\ndoubled in size. The warmer your kitchen\r\nis, the faster it will rise, but generally it\r\nshould take 1-2 hrs.","Heat oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 9 (or\r\nthe highest setting). Sprinkle 2 baking trays with a little of the reserved flour\r\nand place in the oven to heat up.","Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan until\r\nhot. Add the onions and garlic, and cook for\r\na few mins until softened. Add the beef and\r\nlet it brown for about 5 mins, breaking up\r\nthe mince as it cooks. Pour off any excess\r\noil. Add the spices, chilli, 2 tbsp of the\r\ntomato purée, 5 tbsp of the pomegranate\r\nmolasses and some seasoning. Cook\r\nfor 1 min, then remove from the heat.","Divide the dough into 6 balls. Sprinkle the\r\nremaining flour over a work surface and roll\r\nout the dough, each to about 25cm across.\r\nRemove the trays from the oven and place\r\n2 pizza bases on each (you’ll need to cook\r\nin batches). Spread the remaining tomato\r\npurée on each base. Top with the meat\r\nmixture, peppers, feta and pine nuts.\r\nCook for 10 mins or until the bases are\r\ncooked through and golden brown around\r\nthe edges. Drizzle over the remaining\r\npomegranate molasses and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8014,8014,'en','Tabbouleh','This fresh and healthy salad uses mostly herbs with a little bulgur wheat','["50g bulghar wheat","50g flat-leaf parsley, chopped","50g mint, chopped","200g ripe tomatoes, deseeded and diced","3 spring onions, finely sliced","juice 1 lemon","3 tbsp olive oil"]','["Rinse the bulghar wheat in a sieve\r\nuntil the water runs clear. Drain well,\r\nthen transfer to a bowl. Pour over 200ml\r\nboiling water, cover with cling film and\r\nleave to soak for 30 mins or so while\r\nyou prepare the rest of the ingredients.","Keeping the parsley in a bunch, chop\r\nthe leaves roughly. Don’t worry about the\r\ninclusion of some of the stalks; this all adds\r\nto the flavour. Now do the same with the\r\nmint. Put the chopped herbs in a large\r\nbowl and add the tomato and spring onion.","Thoroughly drain the bulghar, then add to\r\nherb mix, along with lemon juice and olive\r\noil. Mix thoroughly, season and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8016,8016,'en','Pumpkin falafel pockets','Make some magic in your microwave with these easy-to-prepare pumpkin or butternut squash pockets','["1kg pumpkins or butternut squash, deseeded and cut into wedges","400g can chickpeas, drained, rinsed and dried","1 garlic clove, chopped","½ tsp chilli flakes","1 tsp ground cumin","small bunch parsley, roughly chopped","2 slices white bread, whizzed to crumbs","2 carrots, coarsely grated","½ small red onion, finely sliced","100g feta cheese, crumbled","4 wholemeal pitta breads to serve"]','["Put the pumpkin in a microwave-safe\r\nbowl and cover with cling film. Cook on\r\nHigh for 10 mins or until soft. Tip the\r\nchickpeas, garlic, chilli flakes, cumin and\r\nhalf of the parsley into a food processor,\r\nthen whizz until the chickpeas are finely\r\nchopped but not smooth.","Allow the pumpkin to cool slightly, then\r\nscoop the flesh from the skin and add to\r\nthe chickpea mix with some seasoning\r\nand the breadcrumbs. Give everything a\r\ngood stir, then shape into 12 little patties\r\nwith your hands. Put the falafels on a\r\nplate and chill for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, mix the remaining parsley\r\nwith the grated carrot, onion and feta\r\ncheese, then set aside. Heat the grill to\r\nMedium, then cook the falafels on a\r\nbaking tray for 3-5 mins on each side until\r\ngolden. Split the pitta breads lengthways\r\nand fill with the warm falafels and some\r\nof the feta salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8018,8018,'en','Beetroot falafel','Jazz up an all-time vegetarian favourite by adding vibrant beetroot – serve with tahini yoghurt dip and pickled beets','["1 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, chopped","2 tsp ground cumin","2 x 400g cans chickpeas, drained","500g raw beetroot, peeled, trimmed and coarsely grated","100g fresh breadcrumbs","1 egg","1 tbsp tahini paste","vegetable oil, for brushing or frying","1 tbsp tahini paste","2 x 150ml pots natural yogurt","pinch of sugar","flatbreads","few pickled golden beetroot, diced (see ''Goes Well With'')","3 handfuls beet leaves or a bag of beet salad"]','["Heat the olive oil in a frying pan and\r\nfry the onions until softened but not\r\ncoloured. Add the cumin and cook for\r\n1 min, then scrape the mixture into\r\na food processor with the chickpeas,\r\ntwo-thirds of the grated beetroot, the\r\nbreadcrumbs, egg and tahini. Whizz\r\nto a rough paste, then scrape into a\r\nbowl and stir in the remaining grated\r\nbeetroot with plenty of seasoning.","With damp hands, shape into\r\nabout 20 balls and space on baking\r\nparchment-lined baking sheets. Chill\r\nuntil ready to serve.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nBrush the falafels with a little vegetable\r\noil and bake for 20-25 mins until crisp\r\nand hot through. Alternatively, heat\r\n2.5cm oil in a deep wok and fry in\r\nbatches, turning, until crisp and hot.","To serve, mix the tahini with the yogurt,\r\nsugar and some seasoning, then dollop\r\nonto the flatbreads with the warm or\r\nroom-temperature falafels, diced\r\nbeetroot and beet leaves or salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8020,8020,'en','Couscous & falafel salad with minty yogurt','This no-cook, mezze-style platter can be whipped up in no time using supermarket or deli ingredients','["300g couscous","300ml hot vegetable or chicken stock","250g tub olives and feta cheese in olive oil","1 heaped tbsp harissa paste","2 x 200g packs falafel","290g jar roasted red peppers, drained and thinly sliced","300g fat-free yogurt","bunch mint, roughly chopped"]','["Put the couscous in a large bowl\r\nand pour over the stock. Cover\r\nwith cling film and leave for 5 mins\r\nto swell. Drain the olives and feta,\r\nreserving some of the oil. Stir most\r\nof the harissa into the couscous\r\nwith the reserved oil, then season.","Tip the couscous onto a platter\r\nand scatter over the falafel. Pile\r\nthe peppers, olives and feta to one\r\nside. Mix the yogurt and most\r\nof the mint with some seasoning in a small bowl, ripple through\r\nthe rest of the harissa, and scatter\r\nover the remaining mint. Serve\r\nwith the couscous & falafel salad."]','2026-01-10 12:20:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8022,8022,'en','Bulgur wheat with carrots & hazelnuts','Give your salad great texture by adding pumpkin seeds, sultanas and hazelnuts to wheat cooked in stock','["600g bulghar wheat","140g sultanas","1l hot vegetables or chicken stock","4 medium carrots, coarsely grated","100g pumpkin seeds","100g toasted hazelnuts, chopped","juice 1 large lemon","5 tbsp rapeseed oil"]','["Put the bulghar and sultanas in a bowl\r\nand pour over the hot stock. Cover with\r\ncling film and leave for 20-30 mins for\r\nthe liquid to be absorbed. Once\r\nabsorbed, run a fork through the grains\r\nto separate. Leave to cool.","Add the carrots, pumpkin seeds,\r\nhazelnuts, lemon juice and rapeseed\r\noil, and season. Mix well and transfer\r\nto a large serving bowl."]','2026-01-10 12:20:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8024,8024,'en','Spinach & feta falafel bites','These simple canapés can be made ahead of time and served up at your Christmas party','["200g baby spinach","400g can drained chickpeas","100g feta cheese","2 tsp cumin","100g plain flour","vegetable oil, for frying","tzatziki, to serve"]','["Pour a kettle of boiling water over\r\nbaby spinach in a colander.\r\nWhen cool enough to handle, squeeze\r\nout any water – do this really well or\r\nyour falafels will be too soft. Pulse in a\r\nfood processor with drained\r\nchickpeas, feta, cumin and\r\nplain flour until just combined.\r\nRoll into tbsp-sized balls with wellfloured\r\nhands, then flatten into patties.","Fry in batches in vegetable oil for 2-3\r\nmins each side, then leave to cool. Place\r\non a baking tray, cover with cling film\r\nand freeze. To serve, defrost in the fridge\r\novernight and cook at 180C/160C fan/\r\ngas 4 for 5-10 mins. Serve with tzatziki."]','2026-01-10 12:20:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8026,8026,'en','Turkish-style lamb','Bring the taste of Turkey to your kitchen with these fun lamb pittas, great hand held food','["4 lamb leg steaks","2 tsp seasoning (we used Schwartz Lamb Simply Shake seasoning)","1 tsp dried oregano, or mixed herbs would do","small bunch mint, leaves only, chopped","2 x 150g tubs low-fat plain yogurt","4 pitta breads, white or wholemeal","½ iceberg lettuce, shredded","1 red onion, thinly sliced","1 lemon, cut into wedges for squeezing, optional"]','["Heat grill to high. Season the lamb, then grill for 2 mins on each side until browned, but still very rare. Meanwhile,\r\nmix the seasoning, oregano and half of the mint into one of the tubs of yogurt, smother this over the lamb, then return to the grill for another 2-3 mins or until the yogurt is blistered and the meat is cooked to your liking.","Leave the meat to rest on a board for a few mins while you toast the pittas, shred the lettuce and thinly slice the red onion. Stir the rest of the mint into the second tub of yogurt. Thickly slice the meat and stuff into the pitta bread with the salad and minted yogurt. Squeeze over lemon juice before tucking in, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8028,8028,'en','Turkish lamb pilau','Serve up a basmati rice one pot flavoured with cinnamon, mint and apricot, studded with tender lamb','["small handful pine nuts or flaked almonds","1 tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, halved and sliced","2 cinnamon sticks, broken in half","500g lean lamb neck fillet, cubed","250g basmati rice","1 lamb or vegetable stock cube","12 ready-to-eat dried apricots","handful fresh mint leaves, roughly chopped"]','["Dry-fry the pine nuts or almonds in a large pan until lightly toasted, then tip onto a plate. Add the oil to the pan, then fry the onion and cinnamon together until starting to turn golden. Turn up the heat, stir in the lamb, fry until the meat changes colour, then tip in the rice and cook for 1 min, stirring all the time.","Pour in 500ml boiling water, crumble in the stock cube, add the apricots, then season to taste. Turn the heat down, cover and simmer for 12 mins until the rice is tender and the stock has been absorbed. Toss in the pine nuts and mint and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8030,8030,'en','Falafel tabbouleh with lemon yogurt','A platter salad that’s perfect for the whole family to share','["16 ready-made falafel","200g couscous","2 large lemons, 1 zested, juice of both","3 tbsp olive oil","bunch spring onions, finely sliced","1 cucumber, halved and sliced","small bunch mint, leaves roughly chopped","large bunch parsley, leaves roughly chopped","150ml tub natural yogurt"]','["Cook the falafels according to pack\r\ninstructions and boil the kettle. Tip the\r\ncouscous into a large bowl, pour over\r\n325ml boiling water, cover, then leave\r\nto stand for 5 mins until all of the water\r\nis absorbed.","Fluff up the couscous with a fork, then\r\nstir through the lemon zest, juice from\r\n1½ lemons, olive oil, spring onions,\r\ncucumber, mint and three-quarters\r\nof the parsley with plenty of seasoning.\r\nTip onto a large platter.","Mix the remaining lemon juice and\r\nparsley into the yogurt, then spoon into\r\na small bowl. Scatter the hot falafel over\r\nthe couscous salad, then serve the\r\nyogurt sauce alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:20:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8031,8031,'en','Simple elegance wedding cake','To make a three-tier wedding cake, allyou need to do is multiply basic cakemixtures and icings, and take your time','["5 x ingredients for Easy vanilla cake (see ''Goes well with'' recipe below)","5 x ingredients for Basic vanilla buttercream (see recipe below)","340g/12oz jar strawberry jam, optional (I used Tiptree Strawberry & Champagne)","340g/12oz jar apricot jam, warmed and sieved","4kg white ready-to-roll icing (I used Regalice)","15cm, 23cm and 30cm thin round cake boards","40cm thick round cake board","cocktail sticks","palette knife","a roll of baking parchment","a flat baking sheet or cake lifter","icing sugar, for rolling out","string, for measuring","8 x long plastic dowels","kitchen scissors","3½ m x 1½ cm white satin ribbon","tube of UHU glue, or similar","12cm and 15cm polystyrene cake dummies","18-gauge floristry wire, cut into about 20 x 10cm lengths","15-20 white and pale green hydrangea heads (get some smaller, some larger, if you can); your florist can advise","40cm, 30cm and 18cm cake boxes with lids, if you''re transporting the cake"]','["MAKING THE CAKES: Make the basic Easy vanilla cake recipe (see ''Goes well with''), following the instructions below for each tier, then cool and drench with the syrup. The cakes can be frozen ahead, without icing. However, if you bake them three days before the wedding, the cake will be fine until the big day.","For the bottom tier, triple the quantities for the basic cake mix, then spoon into a ready-lined deep round 30cm cake tin. Bake for 2 hrs 15 mins on the middle shelf until risen and cooked through as before. While this cooks, make up a quadruple batch of the syrup - this will be enough for all three cakes. Cool and drench the cake with syrup as before.","For the middle and top tiers, double the quantities for the basic cake mix, then spoon it into ready-lined 15cm and 23cm cake tins, filling each to about two-thirds full. Bake them together on the middle shelf, taking the small cake out after 1 hr 15 mins, and leaving the larger cake to cook for 1 hr 30 mins in total. If you know that your oven has hot spots, quickly move the cakes around after 50 mins. Cool and drench with syrup as before.","LAYER AND COVER THE CAKES: Make the buttercream as in the basic recipe. You will need 5 x basic quantity - this is a lot, so split your weighed-out quantities in two before you start mixing. You may have some left over, but better too much than too little. Weigh out the buttercream - you will need approximately 400g for the 15cm cake, 600g for the 23cm cake and 1.3kg for the 30cm cake. Spread a little buttercream over the 15cm cake board. Level the top of the cake if you need to, then upturn the 15cm cake onto it. Split into three using a bread knife. I like to mark the front of the cake on each layer before lifting it off, using toothpicks, so I can reassemble it in exactly the right way. Take the top third off first (what was the bottom of the cake) and set aside. Carefully cut the middle layer and set that aside, too. A flat baking sheet or cake lifter can be very helpful here to slide the cake layers off and then back onto each other.","Spread a layer of buttercream over the cake on the board. Return the middle layer, lining up the toothpick markings, then spread another layer of buttercream on top. Add a little jam if you like, dotting it over, then spreading evenly. Top with the final piece of cake, then dust off any crumbs on or around the cake. Now brush the whole cake with a thin layer of apricot jam. This should stop you getting too many crumbs in the buttercream. Sit the whole cake on a large sheet of baking parchment.","Spread the rest of the buttercream over, starting with the top, then smooth and paddle it around the sides and down to the board. Repeat the whole process with the remaining cakes, using the corresponding boards and the different quantities of buttercream. The cakes are now ready to be iced. You can leave them overnight if needed, loosely covered with cling film.","COVERING THE CAKE WITH ICING: You will need about 500g icing for the 15cm cake, 1kg for the 23cm cake and 1.7kg for the 30cm cake. Dust the work surface with icing sugar, knead the icing until pliable, then use your rolling pin to roll it into a circle large enough to cover the sides and top of the cake, with a little left over. Use string to check the size. Use your rolling pin to help you lift the icing over the cake.","Smooth the icing around the cake with your hands, easing it over the edges and down to the board. Then trim off the excess with a sharp knife, flush with the bottom of the cake board. Smooth any marks with the flats of your hands, buffing the icing to a slight shine.","Once you''ve iced all the cakes, cover the thick base board. Lightly brush with cooled boiled water, then lay the icing over. Trim to the edge of the board with a knife (I tend to do this like I would a pie crust, holding the board in my left hand, and knife in my right), then leave the board and the cakes to dry overnight.","STACKING THE CAKES: Dowels, which are basically plastic sticks, provide stability and strength to tiered cakes, and polystyrene blocks allow you to add a ''floating'' layer of flowers. By measuring and cutting the dowels to the same length as the polystyrene, you''ll provide an even platform for the next cake to sit on, even if the cake below is a bit wonky.","Sit the 15cm dummy centrally on top of the biggest cake. Insert four of the dowels into the cake, around the outside of the dummy, in a square shape. Push them right down until they meet the cake board. Mark with a pen where the top of the dummy comes to.","Carefully pull out the dowels; then, using scissors, score around each dowel where you marked it. Snap the plastic cleanly. Re-insert the dowels in their original holes, rounded end down. Repeat the process with the 23cm cake and the 12cm dummy.","Position the biggest cake in the middle of the covered board. Run a thin line of glue around the base board and fix the ribbon around it. Fix the ribbon around each cake, using a spot of the glue on the ribbon to secure it to itself. If you''re moving the cake to a venue, put the cakes into their boxes now. Make a little kit to take with you - glue, scissors, etc - just in case you have to re-do anything.","ON THE DAY - STACKING AND DECORATING THE CAKE WITH FLOWERS: I used hydrangeas - they''re beautiful, in season and you can achieve a dramatic effect with relatively few blooms. \r\nOn the day, save putting the flowers on the cake until as late as you reasonably can. Cut the stems of the hydrangeas to about 2-3cm. Split your least-favourite bloom into smaller pieces - this will help you fill any awkward gaps later. Make sure you save one beautiful bloom for the top.","Insert a length of floristry wire into each stem (or wind it around the stem), leaving a spike of wire about 3cm long. Push this into the polystyrene dummy. Repeat until the two dummies are surrounded with a halo of flowers. The bottom cake should be in its permanent position now - out of direct light and away from any radiators. Lift the 23cm cake onto the bottom polystrene dummy, taking care not to squash any petals, then repeat with the top cake. Fill any gaps with the broken-up flower head you reserved earlier. Sit the final bloom on top of the cake, and you''re done!","CUTTING THE CAKE: Cut the cake across, in a grid, rather than into wedges. You should be able to get 50 servings from the large cake, 30 from the middle and 12 from the top, when cut into 2.5 x 5cm pieces."]','2026-01-10 12:20:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8032,8032,'en','Middle Eastern bread & goat’s cheese salad','Barney’s version of fattoush – a classic Middle Eastern bread salad. Fattoush doesn’t normally contain goat’s cheese, but it turns it into more of a main meal','["2 pitta breads","1 garlic clove","juice 1 lemon","3 ripe plum tomatoes, cut into chunks","1?2 cucumber, cut into chunks","6 radishes, sliced","1 small red onion, halved and sliced","large handful mint leaves, very roughly chopped","1 small Cos lettuce, roughly chopped","1 Baby Gem lettuce, roughly chopped","2 large handfuls rocket","5 tbsp olive oil","200g firm goat''s cheese, crumbled into large chunks"]','["Cook the pitta bread on a griddle or in\r\na toaster until brown and crisp. When cool\r\nenough to handle, tear into bite-size pieces.","Mash the garlic clove with a pinch of salt,\r\nthen tip into a large bowl and stir in the\r\nlemon juice. Tip all the other ingredients,\r\nexcept the olive oil and goat’s cheese, into\r\nthe bowl, then drizzle over the oil. Gently\r\ntoss everything together until mixed and\r\ndressed. Serve the salad in piles with goat’s\r\ncheese crumbled over each serving."]','2026-01-10 12:20:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8034,8034,'en','Rose cream & raspberry jellies','With all the flavours of Turkish delight, these fragrant Middle Eastern-style puddings make a light finish to an entertaining menu','["135g pack raspberry jelly","500ml double cream","1 tsp rosewater","12 raspberries, halved","drizzle of clear honey","small handful mint leaves","1 tbsp pistachio, chopped"]','["Boil a kettle. Break the jelly cubes into\r\na jug, pour over 100ml boiling water and\r\nstir to dissolve. Gently warm the cream in\r\na small pan, then remove from the heat\r\nand pour in the jelly mixture. Stir in the\r\nrose water, then tip the mixture back into\r\nyour jug. Divide the jelly between 6 small\r\nglasses and chill for 2 hrs or until set.Can be made 1 day ahead.","Remove the jellies from the fridge\r\nabout 20 mins before serving. Divide the\r\nraspberries between them, then add a\r\ndrizzle of honey, a few mint leaves and\r\na sprinkling of pistachios to each."]','2026-01-10 12:20:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8036,8036,'en','Thick yogurt & herb dip','Try this Middle Eastern-inspired dip, also known as labneh, with crunchy carrot sticks','["400g Greek yogurt","4 spring onions, finely sliced","1 tbsp each dill and mint, chopped","extra-virgin olive oil, for drizzling"]','["Tip the yogurt into a fine sieve set over a\r\nbowl, then leave to drain in the fridge for\r\n1 hr. Discard any liquid that has drained off.\r\nScrape into a mixing bowl, then stir in the\r\nonions and most of the herbs. When ready\r\nto serve, drizzle with a little extra virgin olive\r\noil and sprinkle with the remaining herbs\r\nand a little black pepper."]','2026-01-10 12:20:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8038,8038,'en','Chilli ginger lamb chops','Marinate your chops with ginger, lemon, chilli and cumin then chargrill until juicy in the middle','["4 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp grated ginger","1 tbsp lemon juice","1 tbsp olive oil","½  tsp chilli powder","1 tsp cumin","8 lamb chops"]','["Put the garlic in a bowl with the ginger,\r\nlemon juice, oil, spices and seasoning.\r\nBlitz with a hand blender until smooth,\r\nthen use to coat the lamb chops on both\r\nsides. Leave to marinate in the fridge for\r\na couple of hours or overnight.","Heat a barbecue until hot. Barbecue\r\nthe chops over the coals for 3 mins on\r\neach side until cooked but still pink and\r\njuicy in the centre."]','2026-01-10 12:20:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8040,8040,'en','Apricot & Turkish delight mess','Try a Middle Eastern twist on the British classic Eton Mess, served with fresh mint tea','["100g mascarpone","50g Greek yogurt","25g icing sugar, sifted","2 tbsp orange flower water","1 meringue nest, broken into rough pieces","3 apricots, stoned and chopped","2 cubes Turkish delight, orange flavoured if available, chopped","25g skin-on almonds, roughly chopped","4 mint leaves, shredded, plus extra to decorate (optional)"]','["Place the mascarpone, yogurt, sugar and\r\norange flower water into a large bowl and\r\nwhisk until thickened. Fold the remaining\r\ningredients through, then divide the mix\r\nbetween 2 dessert glasses or bowls and\r\ndecorate with extra mint, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:20:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8042,8042,'en','Moroccan-style chicken with sour cherries & olives','By adding dried fruit, Tom Kerridge brings a subtle sweetness to this North African chicken tagine. Plus, you can double up and freeze half for later','["8 free-range chicken thighs, skin-on, bone-in","2 tbsp ras el hanout","3 tbsp olive oil, plus a drizzle","2 onions, chopped","2 carrots, cut into large chunks","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely grated","1 tbsp harissa paste (see tip, below)","½ preserved lemon, finely chopped, or 1 strip of lemon peel","1 cinnamon stick","2 bay leaves","400g can chopped tomatoes","500ml chicken stock","300g pitted green olives, drained","100g dried sour cherries or any other dried fruit (like cranberries, apricots, raisins or sultanas)","chopped coriander and cooked couscous (see tips, below), to serve"]','["Season the chicken well, and toss with the ras el hanout to coat.This can be prepared the night before and kept chilled. Heat the oil in a large flameproof casserole or frying pan over a medium heat and spend 15-20 mins browning the chicken on all sides. (You can do this in batches to avoid crowding the pan.) Transfer the chicken to a plate using a slotted spoon and set aside.","Cook the onions and carrots in the pan for 8-10 mins until soft and golden, adding a drizzle more oil if the pan is dry. Add the garlic and ginger, and cook for 2 mins more. Stir in the harissa and preserved lemon. Cook for another minute until the vegetables are well coated and sticky. Add the cinnamon and bay leaves, then tip in the tomatoes and bring to a simmer.","Cook for a few minutes until the liquid has reduced to a thick paste. Tip the chicken and its resting juices back into the pan, and pour over the stock. Stir in the olives and cherries and return to a simmer. Put the lid on and simmer gently for 45 mins–1 hr until the chicken is cooked through and tender.","Scatter over the chopped coriander and serve with couscous.Once completely cool, will keep chilled for up to three days or frozen for three months. Defrost in the fridge overnight before reheating over a low heat or in themicrowaveuntil piping hot."]','2026-01-10 12:20:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8044,8044,'en','Slow roast ras el hanout lamb & couscous','Let your oven do all the work with this shoulder of lamb. It’s heady with North African spices and the couscous is soaked in the pan juices','["5 garlic cloves","1 lemon, juiced","6 tbsp ras el hanout spice mix (shop-bought or see tip, below)","2 tbsp olive oil","small shoulder of lamb (about 2kg)","2 red onions, cut into large wedges","400g couscous","100g raisins","400g can chickpeas, drained","small bunch of parsley, chopped","small bunch of coriander, chopped","1 preserved lemon, finely chopped or the juice of ½ lemon"]','["Using apestle and mortaror a mini chopper, mash or chop the garlic with a generous pinch of salt, then add the lemon juice, ras el hanout spice mix and olive oil, then pound or chop to a rough paste. Use a small knife to make small incisions all over the lamb. Sit the lamb in a large, shallowcasserole dishor deep roasting tin, then rub the paste all over the lamb and into the cuts. Leave at room temperature for 1 hr, or better still cover and chill overnight.","When ready to cook, heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Scatter the onion wedges around the lamb, then cover the dish with a lid or tightly with foil and roast for 3 hrs. Remove from the oven and uncover. Stir the onions and baste the lamb in the juices, then turn the oven up to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and continue to roast the lamb, uncovered, for 25-30 mins until browned.","Lift the lamb and onions onto a board to rest and put thekettleon. Stir the couscous and raisins into the lamb dish so they’re coated in the roasting juices. Pour over enough boiling water from the kettle to just cover the couscous, then cover the dish and leave for 5 mins. Uncover and fluff the couscous up with a wooden spoon, then stir through the chickpeas, chopped herbs and preserved lemon or lemon juice, and season to taste. Bring the lamb, onions and the couscous to the table to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:20:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8046,8046,'en','Slow cooker Moroccan lamb stew','Warm up with our easy slow cooker lamb stew, with aromatic spices and bags of flavour. This simple, crowd-pleasing dish takes just 10 minutes to prep','["2 tbsp olive oil or rapeseed oil","1kg diced lamb shoulder","2 onions, halved and sliced","5 garlic cloves, crushed","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and grated or finely chopped","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground cinnamon","pinch saffron (or turmeric, to add colour)","½  large or 1 small preserved lemon, skin only, finely chopped","1 tbsp tomato purée","600ml hot beef stock or lamb stock","1 tbsp honey","1 lemon, tested, plus a squeeze of juice","80g pitted Kalamata olives","handful chopped mint, coriander or parsley (or a combination)","couscous or rice, to serve"]','["Set the slow cooker to low. Heat 1 tbsp oil in a pan and brown the lamb in batches, transferring to the slow cooker as you go. Add the remaining oil and the onions to the pan and cook for 8-10 mins until softened. Tip in the garlic and ginger and stir for 1-2 mins, then add the spices, preserved lemon and tomato purée. Warm through, then tip into the slow cooker. Swirl some water around the pan, then pour into the slow cooker along with the stock. Season, cover and cook for 6-8 hrs.","Once the meat is really tender, turn the heat up to high. Add the honey, lemon and olives and cook for 20-30 mins. Top with the herbs and serve with couscous or rice."]','2026-01-10 12:20:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8048,8048,'en','Moroccan sausage stew','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyRas el hanout is a fragrant North African spice. It works perfectly with pork sausages in a tomato casserole sauce with dates and onions','["2 tsp vegetable oil","8 good-quality pork sausage","2 red onion, cut into wedges","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tbsp Moroccan spice mix or ras el hanout","100g soft pitted date, roughly chopped","400g can chopped tomato","175ml hot beef stock","1 tbsp cornflour","mashed potato, to serve"]','["In a large saucepan or flameproof casserole dish, heat the oil and brown the sausages with the onions for 10 mins until golden. Add the garlic and spice mix with 75ml water to prevent them from burning, and cook for 2 mins until fragrant. Add the dates and tomatoes, mix well, then spread out onto 2 plates to cool before pouring into a freezer bag and freezing for up to 3 months.","To cook from frozen, put the stew into a large saucepan or flameproof casserole dish with all but 2 tbsp of the stock. Cover with a lid and gently heat to defrost for 25 mins, stirring occasionally.","Once the stew is fully defrosted, mix the cornflour with the reserved stock and pour into the pan. Bring to the boil and simmer, uncovered, for 5 mins until thickened and piping hot. Serve with mashed potato."]','2026-01-10 12:20:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8050,8050,'en','Stuffed Moroccan pitta','Stuff wheat-free bread with falafels, hummus, red pepper and rocket leaves for a healthy and filling lunch','["2 wheat-free pitta breads pockets","4 falafels, halved (from Falafels with houmous recipe, in ''goes well with'')","4 tbsp houmous (from Falafels with houmous recipe, see ''goes well with'')","½  red pepper, deseeded and sliced","handful rocket leaves"]','["Spread the houmous on the inside of each pitta, then layer with the falafels, pepper and rocket."]','2026-01-10 12:20:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8052,8052,'en','Lamb, apricot & shallot tagine','Adapted from the Moroccan roast lamb fish ‘mechoui’, this slow-cooked dish has an aromatic marinade and irresistably fruity sauce','["1 large leg of lamb, bone in (about 2kg)","600g shallots, halved if particularly large","400g small apricots, halved and stoned","85g whole skinless almonds","2 preserved lemons, flesh discarded, peel and pith finely chopped","1 tbsp ras el hanout","1 tbsp clear honey","150ml hot chicken stock","small pack coriander, leaves picked","couscous and natural yogurt, to serve","4 tbsp olive oil","4 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp ground cumin","2 tbsp clear honey","2 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tsp ground ginger","2 tsp coriander seeds","pinch of saffron strands"]','["Slash the lamb leg all over and put in a big food bag, or in a large casserole dish. Smash the marinade ingredients together using a pestle and mortar. Add some black pepper and rub all over the lamb. Marinate overnight, or up to 24 hrs.","Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Sit the lamb in a big roasting tin, scraping off any leftover marinade on the top. Cover the tin with foil, pinching the edges to seal. Cook for 6-7 hrs, basting every hour or so, until the meat is incredibly tender.","Remove the roasting tin from the oven and increase oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Pour the juices from the lamb into a measuring jug, cool slightly and skim off the fat. Put the shallots in the tin with the lamb and toss to coat in some of the juices. Roast for 15 mins, then add the apricots and almonds. Whisk the cooking juices with the lemon, ras el hanout, honey and stock, then pour over the lamb and roast for another 20 mins.","Rest for 10 mins, then scatter over the herbs and serve with couscous and yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:20:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8054,8054,'en','Moroccan harira & chicken soup','This North African-inspired soup is flavoured with harissa and spices. Serve with hummus toasts and cooling yogurt','["3 tbsp olive oil, plus extra to drizzle","4 boneless, skinless chicken thighs","1 leek, washed and finely sliced","4 fat celery sticks, chopped into small pieces","3 large carrots, chopped into small pieces","2 big parsnips, peeled and chopped into small pieces","small pack coriander, stalks finely chopped, leaves reserved to serve","1 tbsp cumin seed","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tsp ground turmeric","2 tbsp harissa (we used Belazu)","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","2 chicken stock cubes, crumbled","85g raw green lentils","zest and juice 1 lemon","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","natural yogurt, toast and houmous, to serve"]','["Heat half the oil in a frying pan, season the thighs and brown really well on both sides. Remove to a plate. Tip a mug of water into the pan and simmer, scraping up all the browned bits. Tip this liquid into a measuring jug for later.","Put the remaining oil, the vegetables and coriander stalks in a big saucepan. Gently cook until the veg is softened – about 5 mins. Stir in the spices, turn up the heat, and cook for a few mins. Stir in the harissa, followed by the tomatoes, the chicken, stock cubes and lentils. Top up your jug of chickeny juices to 500ml with water, then add this, too. Bring to a simmer, cover and cook for 30 mins.","Lift the chicken from the soup and shred finely using a couple of forks. Return to the soup with the lemon zest and juice, sugar, and season to taste. Ladle into bowls with a dollop of yogurt and the coriander leaves, and serve with toast, spread with houmous and drizzled with oil."]','2026-01-10 12:20:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8056,8056,'en','Sweet spiced lamb shanks with quince','A cross between a Persian stew and Moroccan tagine, the spices in this slow cooked one-pot are mellow. Serve with rice, couscous or flatbreads','["1 tbsp olive oil","4 lamb shanks","large knob of butter","2 large onions, halved then cut into wedges","4 garlic cloves, crushed","4 strips zest from 1 unwaxed lemon, plus the juice","2 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cumin","good pinch of saffron strands (optional)","1 heaped tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp clear honey","400ml good lamb or beef stock","2 quinces, peeled, quartered and cored"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan. Season\r\nthe shanks, then brown in the oil for\r\n10 mins, or until dark golden all over.","Meanwhile, in a casserole dish or large\r\npan, melt the butter. Soften the onions\r\nfor 10 mins on a medium heat until they’re\r\nturning golden, then add the garlic. Heat\r\noven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.","Add the strips of lemon zest and spices\r\nto the onion pan. Cook for 1 min, then stir\r\nin the tomato purée, honey, stock and half\r\nthe lemon juice. Sit the shanks in the pan,\r\nthen poke the quince quarters in and\r\naround the meat. (It might be quite a tight\r\nfit, but the meat will shrink as it cooks.)\r\nBring to a simmer, then cover with a lid\r\nand braise in the oven for 2 hrs.","Remove the lid and cook for 30 mins\r\nmore. Spoon away any excess fat. The\r\nsauce will be fairly thin, so if you prefer a\r\nthicker stew, remove the lamb and quinces\r\nto a serving plate, then boil the cooking\r\njuices until thickened. Season, add the\r\nlemon juice and serve with the lamb."]','2026-01-10 12:21:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8058,8058,'en','Fish tagine with saffron & almonds','A low calorie Moroccan fish stew flavoured with saffron, almonds, cinnamon, ginger and more. It’s ideal for entertaining- make a batch ahead and freeze','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","good pinch saffron","600ml hot fish or chicken stock","2 garlic cloves, crushed","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and grated","½  green chilli (deseeded if you don''t like it too hot), finely sliced","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp cinnamon","1 tbsp tomato purée","10 cherry tomatoes, halved","2 tbsp ground almonds","zest 1 orange, juice of ½","1 tbsp honey","700g white fish, cut into large chunks","small bunch coriander, chopped","handful flaked almond, toasted","½  green chilli, (deseeded if you don''t like it too hot), to serve","couscous and natural yogurt, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Add the\r\nonion and cook for a few mins until soft.\r\nMeanwhile, put the saffron in the hot\r\nstock and leave to steep. Add the garlic,\r\nginger and chilli to the pan and cook for\r\na few mins more. Tip in the spices and\r\ntomato purée, stir for a few mins until\r\nfragrant, then add the tomatoes, ground\r\nalmonds, orange zest and juice, honey and\r\nsaffron-scented stock, making sure that\r\nyou use all of the saffron strands.\r\nSimmer, uncovered, for 10 mins, until\r\nthe tomatoes have broken down and the\r\nsauce has thickened a little.","Add the fish to the pan, making sure\r\nthe pieces are all nestled under the\r\nsauce. Cover with a lid and simmer on a\r\nlow heat for 2-3 mins until just cooked.\r\nCheck seasoning, add the coriander\r\nand scatter with the toasted almonds.\r\nServe scattered with the chilli, along\r\nwith some couscous and a blob of\r\nnatural yogurt, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8060,8060,'en','Moroccan roast chicken with apricots','Come rain or shine, serve up this sumac-marinated spatchcocked bird, that can be barbecued or oven cooked, with a sweet, fruity accompaniment','["2 small chicken","6 tbsp olive oil","small bunch coriander","2 tbsp sumac (see tip, below)","1 tbsp cumin seed","1 tbsp fennel seed","2 tsp chilli flakes","2 garlic cloves","zest and juice 2 lemons","4 tbsp pomegranate molasses","250g natural yogurt, mixed with 1-2 pinches saffron, to serve","12 apricots, halved and stoned","2 preserved lemons, rinsed, seeds removed, finely chopped","3 tbsp clear honey","1 tbsp orange blossom water","4 tbsp white wine vinegar"]','["Spatchcock the chickens – see\r\ntip, below, or ask your butcher to\r\ndo it for you. Put the olive oil, coriander,\r\nsumac, cumin, fennel, chilli, garlic, lemon\r\nzest and juice, pomegranate molasses\r\nand some ground black pepper into a\r\nfood processor or blender, and whizz to a\r\npaste. Divide between 2 large food bags,\r\nadd a chicken to each, then squeeze out\r\nthe air and seal before giving everything\r\na good squelch to coat thoroughly.\r\nMarinate for 24-48 hrs in the fridge,\r\nturning and squishing every so often.","Fire up a barbecue and let the flames\r\ndie down, or heat oven to 220C/200C\r\nfan/gas 7. Lift the chicken out of the bags\r\nand season well with salt. Barbecue or\r\nroast the chicken for 25-30 mins on each\r\nside until crisp and cooked through. Set\r\naside on a platter, loosely cover with foil,\r\nto rest while you do the apricots. If you\r\nroasted rather than barbecued, keep the\r\ntin juices warm for serving.","Put the apricots in a small, snug\r\nroasting tin. Whisk the preserved lemon,\r\nhoney, orange blossom and vinegar\r\nwith some seasoning. Pour over the\r\napricots and roast, or sit on the\r\nbarbecue, for 20 mins until soft.","Serve the chicken with any cooking\r\njuices, the apricots and saffron yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:21:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8062,8062,'en','Moroccan spiced pie','The perfect showpiece to your Christmas Day meal – and it''s suitable for veggies','["2 tsp each coriander and cumin seeds","1 tsp paprika, plus extra for dusting","½ tsp ground cinnamon","150ml/¼ pint olive oil","900g squash, peeled and cut into small chunks (about 2cm)","12 shallots, quartered","4cm/1½ in piece root ginger, finely chopped","140g whole blanched almonds","140g shelled pistachios","75g pack dried cranberries","6 tbsp clear honey","225g pack fresh spinach","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","2 garlic cloves","1 tsp ground cumin","3 tbsp lemon juice","4 tbsp chopped fresh coriander","100g butter","8 large sheets of filo pastry","lemon wedges to serve","200g carton Greek yogurt","6 tbsp milk","3 large sprigs mint, leaves chopped","2-3 tbsp harissa paste"]','["Preheat the oven to fan 180C/\r\nconventional 200C/gas 6. Dry fry\r\nthe seeds briefly in a small pan over a medium heat until toasty – don’t\r\nlet them burn. Grind coarsely using\r\na pestle and mortar (or a bowl and\r\nthe end of a rolling pin), then mix in\r\nthe paprika, cinnamon, 1?2 tsp salt\r\nand 4 tbsp oil. Tip the squash into a\r\nroasting tin, pour over the spiced oil\r\nand toss. Roast for 20 minutes.","Meanwhile, heat 2 tbsp of oil in a\r\nfrying pan, add the shallots and\r\ncook, stirring, until they start to\r\nbrown. Stir in the ginger and\r\n100g/4oz each almonds and\r\npistachios.When brown, toss in the\r\ncranberries, 2 tbsp honey, and the\r\nspinach so it wilts. Take off the heat\r\nand stir into the squash, when it\r\ncomes out of the oven. Set aside.","In a food processor, whizz the\r\nchickpeas with the garlic, cumin,\r\nremaining oil, lemon juice, 2 tbsp\r\nwater and salt and pepper to make\r\nhoumous. Stir in the coriander.","Melt the butter in a small pan. Put\r\na loose-bottomed 28cm quiche tin\r\non a baking sheet and brush with\r\nsome butter. Keeping the filo covered\r\nwith a damp cloth so it doesn’t dry\r\nout, lay one sheet over half of the\r\ntin so that it hangs over the edge by\r\nabout 10cm. Lay another sheet on\r\nthe other side, so it overlaps the\r\nfirst in the centre and hangs over\r\nthe opposite edge. Brush with\r\nbutter. Lay two more filo sheets in\r\nthe opposite direction in the same way and brush with more butter.","Build up two more layers in this\r\nway, so you use a total of eight\r\nsheets of filo. Pile half the squash\r\nmixture in the centre of the pastry.\r\nSpread over the houmous and then\r\nthe rest of the squash mixture.One\r\nat a time, bring the edge of each\r\nfilo sheet up to the centre to cover\r\nthe filling, creating voluptuous folds\r\nas you go. Brush carefully with\r\nmore butter. (If making a day ahead,\r\ncover now with cling film and\r\nchill. To reheat, remove the pie\r\nfrom the fridge, heat the oven, then\r\nbake for 35-40 minutes.)","Bake for 30-35 minutes, until crisp\r\nand golden. Just before the pie is\r\nready, reheat any remaining butter\r\nin the pan, tip in the rest of the nuts\r\nand fry until golden. Spoon in the\r\n4 remaining tbsps of\r\nhoney and, when it\r\nmelts, take off the\r\nheat and pour over\r\nthe pie. Serve with\r\nHarissa yogurt sauce (mix the yogurt and milk together to make a thin sauce, stir in the herbs and season. Swirl in harissa to taste) and lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:21:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8064,8064,'en','Spicy Moroccan rice','Spice up plain old chicken with a taste of the exotic','["4 skinless chicken breasts, diced","1 tbsp Moroccan spice seasoning","1 onion, finely sliced","50g butter","300g rice","12 dried apricots, halved","chicken stock cube","410g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","15g pack flatleaf parsley, chopped"]','["Coat chicken with the Moroccan spice. Fry the onion in butter until soft.","Tip in the chicken, then cook for a few mins more. Stir in the rice and apricots, then pour in the stock cube with 700ml boiling water and the chickpeas.","Cover the pan and simmer for 10 mins until the rice is tender and has absorbed most of the liquid. Toss in the chopped flat leaf parsley and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8066,8066,'en','Moroccan spiced carrots','Create a carrot sensation with this simple idea for a dressing and experiment with your favourite veg','["500g carrots, halved and cut into thin rounds","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","harissa paste","1 tbsp lemon juice","handful chopped coriander, plus extra"]','["Place the carrots in a steamer set over\r\na pan of boiling water and cook for 7-10 mins\r\nuntil just soft. Mix together the remaining\r\ningredients, then toss the warm carrots\r\nthrough the dressing.","Sprinkle with extra chopped coriander to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8068,8068,'en','Aromatic lamb with dates','A warming one-pot with a Moroccan feel, perfect served with couscous','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","500g diced boneless lean lamb, preferably from the leg","300g sweet potatoes, cut into small chunks","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tbsp tomato purée","50g pitted dates","2 tbsp coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, add the onion\r\nand lamb, then quickly fry until the lamb is\r\nlightly browned.","Add the sweet potatoes and\r\nspices, then mix well. Pour in 425ml boiling\r\nwater and the tomato purée, then bring to\r\nthe boil.","Cover and simmer for 15 mins until\r\nsweet potatoes and lamb are tender, adding\r\nthe dates for the final 10 mins. Sprinkle with\r\ncoriander and serve with couscous."]','2026-01-10 12:21:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8072,8072,'en','Easy chicken tagine','Simple one-pots are perfect  for the busy cook. This chicken tagine is great eaten with cous cous for something a bit more filling','["2 tbsp olive oil","8 skinless boneless chicken thighs, halved if large","1 onion, chopped","2 tsp grated fresh root ginger","pinch saffron or tumeric","1 tbsp honey","400g carrots, cut into sticks","small bunch parsley, roughly chopped","lemon wedges, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large, wide pan with a lid, add the chicken, then fry quickly until lightly coloured. Add the onion and ginger, then fry for a further 2 mins.","Add 150ml water, the saffron, honey and carrots, season, then stir well. Bring to the boil, cover tightly, then simmer for 30 mins until the chicken is tender. Uncover and increase the heat for about 5 mins to reduce the sauce a little. Sprinkle with parsley and serve with lemon\r\nwedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:21:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8074,8074,'en','Lamb, squash & apricot tagine','A Moroccan mainstay, this slow-cooked casserole is flavoured with coriander and ras-el-hanout spices','["2 tbsp oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tbsp ras-el-hanout","1 tsp ground coriander","600g lamb leg, diced into 2cm pieces, excess fat trimmed","200g butternut squash, diced","200g soft dried apricots","400g can chopped tomatoes","500ml lamb or beef stock","zest 1 lemon","small bunch coriander","couscous and natural yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nHeat the oil in a flameproof casserole\r\ndish, add the onion and cook for 5 mins\r\nuntil softened. Add the garlic and spices\r\nand cook for a couple mins more,\r\nstirring to prevent them catching and\r\nburning.","Add the lamb, squash and apricots\r\nto the casserole, pour over the\r\ntomatoes and stock, season well\r\nand bring to the boil. Put the lid on\r\nand transfer to the oven. After 1 hr,\r\nstir the tagine and return to the\r\noven, uncovered, for a further 30\r\nmins.","Check the seasoning. Sprinkle over\r\nthe zest and coriander, and serve in\r\nwarm bowls with couscous and\r\nyogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:21:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8076,8076,'en','Tangy couscous salad','Throw together a deliciously tangy and superhealthy couscous salad in just 10 minutes','["300g couscous or bulghar wheat","vegetable stock","2 courgettes","1 tbsp olive oil","100g feta cheese, crumbled","20g pack parsley, chopped","juice 1 lemon"]','["Cook the couscous or bulghar wheat in vegetable stock according to pack instructions. Trim the ends off the courgettes, then cut into slices.","Heat a griddle pan or grill. Drizzle the courgette slices with oil, then season. Cook for 2 mins, then turn over and cook 1-2 mins more until softened and golden brown. Tip into a large bowl along with the cooked couscous or bulghar wheat, then mix through the remaining ingredients. Serve at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:21:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8078,8078,'en','Speedy Moroccan meatballs','A great twist on meatballs for a quick and tasty supper','["1 tbsp olive oil","350g pack ready-made beef or chicken meatballs (approx 16)","1 large onion, sliced","100g dried apricots, halved","1 small cinnamon stick","400g tin chopped tomatoes with garlic","25g toasted flaked almonds","handful coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Heat the oil in a large deep frying pan, then fry the meatballs for 10 mins, turning occasionally until cooked through. Scoop out of the pan and set aside, then cook the onion for 5 mins, until softened.","Add the dried apricots, cinnamon stick, tomatoes and half a can of water to the pan, then bring to the boil and simmer for 10 mins. Remove the cinnamon stick. Return the meatballs to the pan and coat well with the tomato sauce. Serve sprinkled with the almonds and coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:21:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8080,8080,'en','Moroccan chard & lamb pan-fry','A quick, exotic one-pan dish','["1 bunch chard","1oz olive oil","600g diced shoulder of lamb","1 onion, sliced","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 tsp each ground turmeric, cumin seeds, coriander seeds","pinch chilli flakes","400ml stock, lamb or chicken","handful raisins","handful toasted pine nuts"]','["Strip the chard leaves from the stalk. Cut the \r\nstalk into batons and roughly shred the leaves. \r\nSet aside separately.","Heat the oil in a sauté pan and fry the lamb for \r\n5-6 mins over a high heat until browned. Add the \r\nonion, garlic, chard stalks and spices and continue \r\nto cook for 3-4 mins until softened. Pour over the \r\nstock and scatter in the raisins, then simmer for  \r\n4-5 mins to make a sauce. Wilt chard leaves through \r\nthe stock, season and serve scattered with pine nuts."]','2026-01-10 12:21:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8082,8082,'en','Spiced bulgur wheat with roasted peppers','This filling vegetarian salad has the spicy flavours of cumin and warming cinnamon','["200g bulghar wheat","250ml hot vegetable stock","½ tsp Morroccan spice mix, or large pinch each ground cumin and ground cinnamon","zest 1 lemon, juice of ½ lemon","1 tbsp olive oil","½ red onion, finely sliced","400g can chickpeas, drained","210g jar roasted peppers, drained and torn into shreds","small bunch coriander, leaves only"]','["In a large microwave proof bowl, cover bulghar wheat with stock. Cover with cling film and microwave on High for 4 mins. Set aside, covered; it will absorb the stock within another 5 mins. Make a dressing with spice mix, lemon zest and juice and olive oil, then season to taste. Add the onion, chickpeas, peppers and coriander, toss through the cooked bulghar wheat and serve warm or cold."]','2026-01-10 12:21:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8084,8084,'en','Guinea fowl tagine with chickpeas, squash & apricots','This game bird is a lot like chicken, so can be cooked in the same way – give it a whirl in this fragrant Moroccan-spiced casserole','["3 tbsp olive oil","2 guinea fowl, jointed like a chicken (ask your butcher to do this or see our video on how to joint a chicken, in ''Try'', below)","2 onions, roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","1 butternut squash or small pumpkin, peeled, deseeded and cut into large chunks","1 tbsp ras-el-hanout","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","¼ tsp ground ginger","1 large cinnamon stick","small squeeze of clear honey","large pinch of saffron, soaked in 1 tbsp boiling water","juice 1 lemon","850ml chicken stock","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","200g dried apricots","small bunch coriander","couscous or rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large, shallow flameproof\r\ncasserole dish. Season the guinea fowl\r\npieces and brown them – in batches, if\r\nnecessary – then remove to a plate.","Fry the onions in the same dish until\r\nsoftened, then add the garlic and squash,\r\ncooking for 1-2 mins. Tip in the spices\r\nand cook for a few mins before adding\r\nthe honey, saffron and lemon juice. Pour\r\nin the chicken stock and the chickpeas.","Submerge the guinea fowl pieces in\r\nthe stock and add the apricots. Cover the\r\ndish and simmer everything very gently\r\nfor 50 mins-1 hr, until the fowl and squash\r\nare both tender. Stir through the coriander\r\nand serve with couscous or rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8086,8086,'en','Moroccan chicken couscous with dates','Wholewheat grains keep you fuller for longer – flavour with dates, lemon, cumin and cinnamon','["2 tbsp olive oil","500g skinless chicken thighs","140g wholewheat couscous","2 onions, sliced","4 garlic cloves, sliced","zest 2 lemons, juice of 1","350ml chicken stock","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground cinnamon","6 large dates, pitted and chopped (Medjool are nice)","50g flaked almonds","small bunch parsley, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/\r\ngas 4. Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a\r\nlarge frying pan over a high heat.\r\nSeason the chicken, then cook for\r\n10 mins or until browned on both\r\nsides. Remove and put in a large\r\nbaking dish with the dry couscous.","Heat the remaining oil in the\r\npan, add the onions and garlic, and\r\ncook for 5 mins until softened. Add\r\nthe zest and juice of 1 lemon along\r\nwith the stock, cumin, cinnamon\r\nand dates, then bring to the boil.","Pour the date mixture over the\r\nchicken and couscous, sprinkle\r\nover the almonds, cover with\r\nfoil and bake for 20 mins. Serve\r\nsprinkled with the remaining\r\nzest and parsley."]','2026-01-10 12:21:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8088,8088,'en','Gambas al ajillo','Whip up this tapas dish in no time, evoking the laid-back bars of the Spanish coast. Traditionally, it’s cooked in a flameproof terracotta dish','["12 large raw prawns","3 garlic cloves , thinly sliced","100ml olive oil","3 dried cayenne chillies (or other dried chilli)","1 tbsp chopped flat-leaf parsley"]','["Peel the prawns, leaving the tails intact, and, using a cocktail stick, remove the digestive tracts. Or, if you are using a frying pan rather than a terracotta pot, you can cook the prawns in their shells. Season with a little sea salt.","Put the garlic, olive oil and chillies in a flameproof terracotta pot or frying pan and set over a high heat. When the garlic starts to turn golden, add the prawns and cook for 1-2 mins on each side until just pink. Sprinkle over the chopped parsley and some freshly cracked black pepper, and serve immediately. If using a terracotta pot, you can take that straight to the table, but be careful with it as the oil and terracotta will remain hot for several minutes."]','2026-01-10 12:21:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8090,8090,'en','Crema Catalana','It’s the citrus in the custard that sets apart this classic Spanish dessert, topped with golden, caramelised sugar. The perfect way to round off a tapas menu','["400ml whole milk","150ml double cream","1 cinnamon stick","1 orange , zest pared into strips","1 lemon , zest pared into strips","7 egg yolks (freeze the whites to use in another recipe)","100g caster sugar , plus 6 tbsp for the topping","45g cornflour"]','["Put the milk, cream, cinnamon stick and all the citrus zest in a saucepan set over a medium heat. Cook, stirring often, until the milk is just steaming but not boiling, about 3-5 mins. Remove from the heat, cover with a plate and leave to infuse for at least 30 mins.","When the cream mixture has infused, whisk the egg yolks, sugar and cornflour together in a separate bowl for 3-5 mins, or until light and pale in colour. Pour the infused milk through a sieve into the egg mixture, whisking continuously. Return the mixture to the saucepan.","Put the saucepan over a medium-high heat and whisk for around 10-12 mins. The mixture should start thickening to a custard-like consistency – you can tell it’s ready by dipping a wooden spoon in the mixture, then running a finger through the mixture on the back of the spoon. If the line holds, it''s ready. Sieve the mixture into a jug to remove any froth.","Divide the custard between six 150ml ramekins or small terracotta dishes, then leave to cool for 1 hr at room temperature until set with a slight wobble. Chill overnight.","Just before serving, sprinkle 1 tbsp caster sugar over the top of each ramekin and caramelise using a kitchen blowtorch. Alternatively, slide the ramekins under a hot grill until the sugar turns golden and starts to bubble. Serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:21:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8092,8092,'en','Ensaimada','Try this Spanish bake for a breakfast or afternoon treat to enjoy with coffee, or as a savoury snack. Its spiral shape is iconic, as is its featherlight texture','["5g dried yeast (or 16g fresh yeast)","200g caster sugar","2 medium free-range eggs","600g strong white bread flour","vegetable oil , for the work surface and rolling pin","100g lard , softened (or 50g if using sobrasada as a filling)","50g sobrasada de Mallorca (cured, spreadable sausage)","200ml whipped cream","3 tbsp icing sugar (optional)"]','["Pour 230ml lukewarm water into a bowl and add the yeast. Leave to stand for 3 mins, then add the caster sugar, eggs, flour and 1 tsp sea salt flakes. Mix together to form a dough, then knead for 10 mins in stand mixer using a dough hook (or 15 mins by hand) until the dough is elastic enough to be almost see-through when stretched. Cover and set aside to rest for 30 mins, then cut into four equal pieces. Transfer to a baking tray lined with baking parchment. Leave to rest for another 30 mins.","Oil the work surface and a rolling pin with vegetable oil. Working with one portion of dough at a time, flatten it against the surface using the palm of your hand, then roll it out into a thin rectangle, about 30 x 50cm. Let it rest for 2 mins while you spread a quarter of the lard over the top. (If you want to fill your pastry with sobrasada de Mallorca, mix 50g lard with the sobrasada, and spread this over the dough instead.) Pull one corner of the flattened dough and stretch it out as far as it will go without breaking. Repeat every 10cm or so around the dough rectangle in every direction until it reaches about 50 x 70cm.","Cut a strip from each of the shorter sides and lay these beside each other along one of the longer sides of the rectangle; this is what we call the heart of the ensaimada. From there, begin rolling the dough until you have a long pastry snake. Repeat with the remaining portions of dough.","Take the first roll of dough and stretch it until it is over a metre long. Then, roll it up into a spiral, leaving 1cm between each turn of the spiral so the dough can expand. Flatten a little and transfer to a baking sheet lined with baking parchment. Repeat with the remaining dough. Leave to rise in a warm place for at least 12 hrs, or ideally 24 hrs.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the ensaimadas in the top third of the oven and immediately reduce the temperature to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bake for 18 mins until dark golden. Leave to cool on a wire rack. To fill your ensaimada with whipped cream, slice and open, then spread over the cream and close. Dust with a generous amount of icing sugar, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8094,8094,'en','Microwave cheat’s paella','Try this shortcut version of the Spanish classic paella, with chicken and chorizo for a midweek meal. The recipe is based on a microwave with a power of 750W','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed or finely grated","700ml chicken stock","pinch of saffron (optional)","½ tbsp sweet smoked paprika","300g paella rice","200g chicken, thinly sliced","200g chorizo, chopped","150g frozen peas","½ lemon, juiced, plus wedges to serve","small handful of parsley, roughly chopped"]','["Put the olive oil, onion, garlic and a pinch of salt in a large microwaveable dish, mix well andheat on highfor 3 mins. Meanwhile, combine the chicken stock and saffron in a jug and leave to infuse for a couple of minutes.","Stir the paprika, rice, chicken and chorizo into the onions and garlic, then pour in the chicken stock and saffron before seasoning well. Cover and cook on high for 15 mins. Stir, cover and cook for a further 5 mins.","Uncover, being careful with the steam, then stir in the frozen peas and another 100ml water if it’s looking a little dry. Cook, uncovered, for 3 mins before drizzling with lemon juice and scattering over the parsley. Serve with lemon wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:21:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8096,8096,'en','Easy Spanish chicken','Enjoy our Spanish chicken recipe – a classic, comforting stew made with chicken thighs nestled in a tomato and smoked paprika sauce with chorizo and butter beans','["2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 onion, thinly sliced","150g chorizo, cut into rings","1 red pepper, deseeded and sliced into strips","1 yellow pepper, deseeded and sliced into strips","1 tsp sweet smoked paprika","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","150g pitted green olives","400g can butter beans, drained and rinsed","8 bone-in, skin-on chicken thighs","small handful of flat-leaf parsley, chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the olive oil in a large ovenproof frying pan over a medium heat and fry the onion, chorizo and peppers along with a pinch of salt and pepper for 15 mins until the veg has softened and the chorizo has released its oils. Add the paprika and garlic, and cook for another few minutes until fragrant.","Tip in the chopped tomatoes, olives and butter beans, stir to combine and season. Nestle in the chicken thighs and season well. Transfer to the oven and bake for 40 mins until the chicken skin is crisp and the meat cooked through and tender. Scatter with the parsley and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8098,8098,'en','Patatas bravas meatballs','Take inspiration from the classic tapas dish patatas bravas with this recipe. The addition of homemade pork meatballs makes it the ideal Friday night family treat','["3½ tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed","1½-2 tsp hot smoked paprika (depending on how spicy you like it)","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tsp sugar","100g pitted black olives","400g pork mince","70g fresh breadcrumbs","1 egg yolk","pinch of chilli flakes","small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","1kg white potatoes, cut into 3cm cubes","aïoli, to serve (optional; see tip, below)"]','["Heat 1 tbsp olive oil in asaucepanand fry the onions with a pinch of salt for 10 mins until soft. Stir in two-thirds of the garlic and cook for 1 min more. Add the paprika and cook for another minute, then stir in the tomatoes and sugar. Season to taste. Cook for 15 mins until thickened. Remove from the heat, stir through the olives and set aside.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Put the mince in a large bowl with the breadcrumbs, the rest of the garlic, the egg yolk, chilli flakes and half the parsley. Season. Mix using your hands until well combined. Divide into 12 pieces, weighing for accuracy if you like, then roll into meatballs. Cover and put in the fridge to chill while you prepare the potatoes.","Toss the potatoes in aroasting tinwith 1½ tbsp of the remaining oil and some seasoning. Roast for 40 mins until golden, tossing halfway through. Heat the rest of the oil in a frying pan over a medium-high heat and fry the meatballs for 5 mins, stirring until evenly browned. Add the meatballs to the tin with the potatoes and roast for 10 mins more. Reheat the tomato sauce, if needed, then spoon over the meatballs and potatoes. Top with the remaining chopped parsley and serve with some aïoli, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8100,8100,'en','Paella mixta','Try our version of paella, made with a combination of meat and seafood. With king prawns, mussels, chorizo and chicken, every forkful is a treat that’s reminiscent of Spanish holidays','["400g can chopped tomatoes","600ml chicken stock","1 heaped tsp smoked paprika","2 pinches of saffron","1 onion, chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed or finely chopped","4 tbsp olive oil","300g paella rice","4 skinless, boneless chicken thighs, cut in half","200g chorizo, sliced","85g frozen peas","150g raw king prawns, peeled if you like","250g mussels, cleaned","1 lemon, quartered (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Combine the tomatoes, stock, paprika and saffron in a large heatproof jug, then microwave for 5 mins on high, or until steaming hot. Or, heat in a pan on the hob.","Put the onion and garlic in a large ovenproof frying pan or roasting tin, drizzle over the olive oil and stir to coat. Roast for 20 mins, or until the veg is starting to brown.","Stir in the rice, chicken, chorizo and hot stock mix. Season and bake for 20 mins (don’t cover the pan).","Gently stir in the peas, dot over the prawns and press the mussels in, hinged-side down, so they’re standing up. Arrange the lemon wedges around the edge, if using. Bake for 5-10 mins more until the rice, chicken and prawns are cooked, and the mussels have opened (discard any that stay shut). Check for seasoning, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8102,8102,'en','Roast cod with paella & saffron olive oil','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyImpress your friends with Jason Atherton’s luxurious shellfish rice, topped with juicy cod and drizzled with saffron','["1 tbsp olive oil","200g raw chorizo, diced","3 large shallots, thinly sliced","3 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp smoked sweet paprika (pimenton)","300g paella rice","1l fish stock","knob of unsalted butter","300g prawns, chopped into bite-sized pieces","handful cooked, shelled mussels, plus 18 in their shells","juice ½ lemon (optional)","small bunch parsley, chopped","75ml extra-virgin olive oil","juice ½ lemon","pinch saffron threads","1 tbsp olive oil","knob of unsalted butter","6 x 175g/6oz cod fillets, skin on","squeeze lemon juice"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nTo make the paella, put the olive oil,\r\nchorizo, shallots and garlic in a large\r\npan and fry for 7-8 mins until the chorizo\r\nreleases its oil and the shallots have\r\nsoftened. Add the paprika and cook,\r\nstirring, for 5 mins, then add the rice,\r\nmix well and cook for a few mins more.","Pour in 600ml of the stock, season and\r\nmix well to combine. Cover and put in\r\nthe oven for 15 mins. Uncover, give\r\neverything a good stir, then return to the\r\noven for 10 mins. When almost cooked,\r\nremove from the oven and spread onto\r\na tray to cool. Chill and reserve for later.You can make this a day ahead.","To make the saffron oil, whisk the\r\nolive oil and lemon juice together in\r\na small saucepan. Add the saffron and\r\nheat gently for 5 mins, then remove from\r\nthe heat and leave to infuse and cool.You can make this a day ahead.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nFor the cod, put the olive oil and butter\r\nin an ovenproof frying pan over a high\r\nheat, but don’t let it burn. Season the\r\ncod with sea salt and black pepper, then\r\ncook, skin-side down, in the hot pan, for\r\n4 mins, then carefully turn the fish over\r\nand put the pan in the oven for a further\r\n3 mins, finishing with a little more sea\r\nsalt and a squeeze of lemon juice.","Meanwhile, put the paella back in the\r\npan, stir in the remaining fish stock and\r\ncook for 2 mins until completely heated\r\nthrough. Stir through a knob of butter,the prawns and shelled mussels. Taste,\r\nseason with lemon juice, salt and pepper\r\nif necessary, and finish with the chopped\r\nparsley. Serve with the roast cod,\r\nmussels in their shells and steamed\r\npurple broccoli or a green vegetable,\r\nif you like. Finally, drizzle everything\r\nwith the saffron dressing."]','2026-01-10 12:21:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8104,8104,'en','Churros with chocolate dipping sauce','Try a fresh spin on doughnuts by piping them Spanish-style and serving with a thick and indulgent dark chocolate sauce','["50g butter, melted","½  tsp vanilla extract","250g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","about 1 litre sunflower oil","few chunks of bread","200g bar dark chocolate, not too bitter, broken into chunks","100ml double cream","100ml whole milk","3 tbsp golden syrup","½  tsp vanilla extract, if you have some","100g caster sugar","2 tsp cinnamon"]','["Boil the kettle, then measure 350ml boiling water into a jug and add the melted butter and vanilla extract. Sift the flour and baking powder into a big mixing bowl with a big pinch of salt. Make a well in the centre, then pour in the contents of the jug and very quickly beat into the flour with a wooden spoon until lump-free. Rest for 10-15 mins while you make the sauce.","Put all the sauce ingredients into a pan and gently melt together, stirring occasionally until you have a smooth shiny sauce. Keep warm on a low heat.","Fill a large deep saucepan one-third full of oil. Heat until a cube of bread browns in 45 seconds – 1 min. Cover a tray with kitchen paper and mix the caster sugar and cinnamon together.","Fit a star nozzle to a piping bag, 1.5-2cm wide is a good size. Fill with the rested dough, then pipe 2-3 strips directly into the pan, snipping off each dough strip with a pair of kitchen scissors. Fry until golden brown and crisp, then remove with a slotted spoon and drain on the kitchen paper-lined tray. Carry on cooking the rest of the dough in batches, sprinkling the cooked churros with some cinnamon sugar as you go. Once you’ve cooked all the churros, toss with any remaining cinnamon sugar and serve with the chocolate sauce, for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:21:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8106,8106,'en','Warm salad of chicken livers, smoked paprika & Sherry','A delicious warm salad, full of smoky, garlicky flavours','["100g bag blanched hazelnuts, minus 3 tbsp for the sauce, below","2 tbsp olive oil","small knob of butter","450g pack chicken livers, cut into bite-size pieces","125ml glass Oloroso sherry","juice ½ lemon","120g bag rocket salad","sherry vinegar, to dress the leaves","2 garlic cloves","20g pack flat-leaf parsley, leaves only","3 tbsp blanched hazelnuts","2 tsp hot smoked paprika","4 tbsp olive oil"]','["Put all the ingredients for the sauce\r\ninto a food processor, then whizz to a\r\nrough paste. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/\r\ngas 6. Put the remaining hazelnuts onto a\r\nbaking sheet, roast for 5 mins until lightly\r\ntoasted, roughly chop, then set aside.","Now make the salad – add the olive oil\r\nand butter to a large frying pan over a\r\nmedium-high heat. Quickly fry the livers\r\nin 2 batches until browned, about 2 mins\r\nper batch. Add the Sherry, then bubble for\r\na few mins over a high heat. Stir in the\r\nsauce and allow it to thicken and heat\r\nthrough. Splash in the lemon juice, then\r\nseason to taste. Dress the salad leaves\r\nwith a little Sherry vinegar. Spoon the\r\nlivers and sauce onto serving plates,\r\nsprinkle with the toasted chopped\r\nhazelnuts, then scatter over the dressed\r\nsalad leaves and serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:21:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8108,8108,'en','Spanish chicken pie','Roasted peppers, olives and paprika give this bake tons of flavour. It’s a great way to use up leftover cooked chicken too','["1kg potatoes, chopped","3 tsp paprika (use smoked paprika if you have it)","2 tsp olive oil","2 onions, sliced","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","300g cooked chicken, shredded","140g roasted peppers from a jar, sliced (we like Karyatis)","handful Kalamata olives, halved"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Boil\r\nthe potatoes for 15-20 mins until tender.\r\nDrain, return to the pan, then mash with\r\nsome seasoning and 2 tsp of the paprika.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large pan,\r\nthen fry the onions and garlic for a few\r\nmins until softened. Stir in the remaining\r\npaprika for 1 min, add the tomatoes ,\r\nthen, bring to a simmer. Tip into a large\r\novenproof dish, then stir in the chicken,\r\npeppers, olives and some seasoning.","Spoon over the mash, then bake for\r\n15 mins until the mash is golden on\r\ntop and the sauce is bubbling."]','2026-01-10 12:21:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8110,8110,'en','Garlicky prawns with sherry','Seafood lovers will love this simple tapas-style recipe that’s low fat and quick to cook up','["3 tbsp olive oil","3 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","400g large prawns, uncooked","2 tbsp dry sherry (fino)","handful parsley, chopped"]','["Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan. Tip in the garlic slices and cook for a few secs.\r\nThen stir through the prawns and cook for a couple of mins until they start to turn pink.","Pour over the sherry and cook for a few mins more, just until the prawns are cooked\r\nthrough. Sprinkle with parsley before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8112,8112,'en','Spiced tortilla','Perfect for dinners, lunches and snacks, this spiced tortilla is a great in-the-fridge standby for many occasions','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 onion, sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and shredded","2 tsp curry spices (we used coriander, cumin and turmeric)","300g cherry tomatoes","500g cooked potatoes, sliced","bunch coriander, stalks finely chopped, leaves roughly chopped","8 eggs, beaten"]','["Heat the oil in a large frying pan. Fry the onion and half the chilli for 5 mins until softened. Tip in the spices, fry for 1 min\r\nmore, then add the cherry tomatoes, potatoes and coriander stalks to the pan. Season the eggs well, pour over the top of the veg and leave to cook gently for 8-10 mins until almost set.","Heat the grill and flash the tortilla underneath for 1-2 mins until the top is set. Scatter the coriander leaves and remaining\r\nchilli over the top, slice into wedges and\r\nserve with a green salad."]','2026-01-10 12:21:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8114,8114,'en','Spanish fig & almond balls','A festive version of Pan deHigo, a dried fig cake that the Spanish traditionally eat with cheese and a drizzle of honey','["100g whole almonds, toasted","500g pack dried whole figs, hard stalk and centre of base removed","85g dried apricots, chopped into small pieces","50g dried cranberries","1 tbsp brandy","1 tbsp clear honey","1 tsp ground cloves","100g sesame seeds, toasted"]','["Whizz the almonds in a food processor until most are finely chopped, then tip into a large bowl. Roughly chop the figs, then whizz to \r\na smooth sticky paste. Scrape onto the almonds then, using your hands, mix together well with the dried fruit, brandy, honey and cloves.","Divide the mixture into 6 and roll into balls. Tip the sesame seeds onto a tray, then roll the balls in them until covered. Cover the tray loosely with a clean tea towel, then leave the fig balls to dry for a week before packaging. Will keep in a cool place for 2 months."]','2026-01-10 12:21:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8116,8116,'en','Chorizo & chickpea soup','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlySizzling Chorizo & chickpea soup','["400g can chopped tomatoes","110g pack of chorizo sausage (unsliced)","140g wedge Savoy cabbages","sprinkling dried chilli flakes","410g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed","1 chicken or vegetable stock cube","crusty bread or garlic bread, to serve"]','["Put a medium pan on the heat and tip  \r\nin the tomatoes, followed by a can of water. \r\nWhile the tomatoes are heating, quickly  \r\nchop the chorizo into chunky pieces \r\n(removing any skin) and shred the cabbage.","Pile the chorizo and cabbage into the pan \r\nwith the chilli flakes and chickpeas, then \r\ncrumble in the stock cube. Stir well, cover \r\nand leave to bubble over a high heat for \r\n6 mins or until the cabbage is just tender. \r\nLadle into bowls and eat with crusty or  \r\ngarlic bread."]','2026-01-10 12:21:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8118,8118,'en','Chorizo & soft-boiled egg salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis anytime summer salad will be on the table in just 30 minutes','["500g bag baby new potatoes, halved","4 eggs","225g green beans, trimmed","225g chorizo ring, sliced","1 garlic clove, sliced","2 tbsp sherry vinegar","2 tbsp chopped parsley"]','["Cook the potatoes in a large pan of\r\nboiling salted water for 12 mins, adding\r\nthe eggs after 6 mins, and the beans\r\nfor the final 2 mins. Drain everything and\r\ncool the eggs under cold running water.","Meanwhile fry chorizo slices for\r\n1-2 mins, until beginning to crisp. Remove\r\nfrom the pan with a slotted spoon and\r\nset aside, leaving the oil from the chorizo\r\nin the pan. Add the garlic to the pan and\r\ncook gently for 1 min.","Remove the pan from the heat, stir\r\nin the vinegar and parsley, then toss\r\nwith the potatoes, beans, chorizo\r\nand seasoning. Shell the eggs, cut into\r\nquarters and add to the salad."]','2026-01-10 12:21:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8120,8120,'en','Chorizo, potato & cheese omelette','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyWhisk up your eggs with Spanish sausage and potato to make a decadent omelette lunch for one','["1 small potato, cut into 2cm dice","1 tsp olive oil","50g chorizo, chopped","2-3 eggs","chopped parsley","25g grated cheddar"]','["Cook the potato in boiling water for 8-10 mins or until tender. Drain and allow to steam-dry. Heat oil in an omelette pan, add chorizo and cook for 2 mins. Add the potato and cook for a further 5 mins until the potato starts to crisp. Spoon pan contents out, wipe pan and cook a 2 or 3-egg omelette in the same pan. When almost cooked, scatter with the chorizo and potato, parsley and cheese. Fold the omelette in the pan and cook for 1 min more to melt the cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:21:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8122,8122,'en','Spanish chicken','For maximum flavour and minimum washing up, try this tasty one-pot','["8 chicken thighs, skin on and bone in","3 onions, thinly sliced","2 tsp paprika","zest and juice 1 lemon","good handful parsley, roughly chopped","150ml stock","1 tbsp olive oil"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nPut all the ingredients into a large, wide\r\novenproof dish. Mix everything together\r\nwith your hands and season.","Bake for 45 mins, stirring the onions\r\nafter 20 mins, until the chicken is golden\r\nand the onions tender. Serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8123,8123,'en','Kahlúa chocolate cheesecake','Decadent, tempting chocolate cheesecake with the taste of coffee liqueur','["50g butter","225g plain chocolate digestive biscuits, crushed","225g dark chocolate (at least 50% cocoa solids), broken","2 x 200g full fat soft cheese, at room temperature","100g golden caster sugar","4 medium eggs","0 284ml carton double cream","5 tbsp Kahlúa","200ml tub crème fraîche","2 tbsp Kahlúa","cocoa powder, for dusting","extra Kahlúa to serve"]','["Lightly oil the base of a 23cm\r\nspring-form tin. Melt the butter in a\r\npan, stir in the crushed biscuits and\r\npress on to the base of the tin with\r\nthe back of a spoon. Chill while you\r\nmake the filling.","Melt the chocolate in a bowl over\r\na pan of gently simmering water,\r\nstirring halfway through. Remove\r\nthe bowl from the pan. Preheat the\r\noven to 160C/gas 3/fan 140C.","Beat the cheese and sugar\r\ntogether with an electric hand mixer\r\nuntil fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a\r\ntime, but don’t over-beat. With the\r\nbeater on low speed, blend in the\r\nmelted chocolate, the cream and\r\nthe Kahlúa. Pour on to the biscuit\r\nbase and bake on a baking sheet for\r\n55 minutes-1 hour or until set. Test\r\nby touching the surface, which\r\nshould be shiny, and a bit wobbly\r\nand darker in the centre. Loosen the\r\ncheesecake from the tin with a\r\nround-bladed knife and leave to\r\ncool. Chill for 3 hours or overnight.","Take the cheesecake from the tin.\r\nFor the topping, combine the crème\r\nfraîche with the Kahlúa and spread\r\nover the top. Dust lightly with cocoa\r\npowder and serve in wedges with a\r\nlittle Kahlúa poured over each slice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8124,8124,'en','Quick gazpacho','Packed with vitamin C, low fat and counts as two of your five a day – this should be on the menu every week!','["250g passata","1 red pepper, deseeded and chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tsp sherry vinegar","juice ½ lime"]','["In a blender (or with a stick blender), whizz \r\ntogether the passata, red pepper, chilli, garlic, \r\nsherry vinegar and lime juice until smooth. \r\nSeason to taste, then serve with ice cubes."]','2026-01-10 12:21:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8128,8128,'en','Chickpea, chorizo & spinach stew','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyFor a healthy, warming supper that takeslittle effort or time, you can’t beat thissimple one-pan dish','["3-4 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 onion, chopped","1 carrot, finely diced","1 celery stick, finely diced","few thyme sprigs","2 bay leaves","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","200g chorizo, diced","¼ tsp cinnamon","1 tsp hot smoked paprika","2 x 410g/14oz cans chickpeas, rinsed and drained","1-2 tbsp sherry vinegar","400g bag spinach leaves, washed and drained"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan, then gently\r\nfry the onion for 3-4 mins until it begins\r\nto soften. Stir in the carrot, celery, thyme\r\nand bay leaves. Season, then cook for\r\n2-3 mins, stirring occasionally. Add the\r\ngarlic, chorizo, cinnamon and smoked\r\npaprika. Gently fry until the vegetables\r\nsoften and the chorizo starts to release\r\nits oils and crisp up.","Stir in the chickpeas, vinegar and\r\n150ml water, then bring to a simmer for\r\n1-2 mins until the chickpeas have heated\r\nup. Add the spinach, then stir through the\r\nchickpeas until it wilts a little. Remove\r\nfrom the heat, season to taste, then\r\nserve warm with crusty bread."]','2026-01-10 12:21:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8130,8130,'en','Crispy squid with capers','A hint of garlic mayo makes everything that little bit more delicious, and this crisp calamari is no exception','["300g baby squid, cleaned","200g plain flour","2 tbsp capers, drained and finely chopped","1 garlic clove, crushed","5 tbsp mayonnaise","vegetable or sunflower oil, for frying","lemon wedges, to serve"]','["Cut the squid into rings about ½cm thick. Tip the flour into a freezer bag and season well. Add the capers, then give everything a good shake to mix together. Tip the squid into the bag, then shake again until all the rings are well coated. Mix together the garlic and mayonnaise, then place in a serving bowl.","Pour some oil into a large pan until it comes about 7cm up the sides, but the pan is no more than a third full. Place over a medium heat and let the oil warm up. To test that the oil is ready, place a small piece of bread in the pan – it should sizzle when it touches the oil.","Remove a handful of squid from the flour and shake off any excess. Gently drop into\r\nthe oil, then cook for about 3 mins until crisp. Remove with a slotted spoon and\r\nplace on kitchen paper. Repeat with the remaining squid. Serve straight away with\r\nthe mayonnaise and lemon wedges."]','2026-01-10 12:21:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8132,8132,'en','Chicken with saffron, raisins & pine nuts','This full-flavoured Spanish dish is great for the familyor entertaining friends midweek','["1¼kg chicken, jointed and on the bone (ask your butcher to do this for you or see Know-how)","2 tbsp olive oil","2 onions, chopped","3 garlic cloves, chopped","good pinch of saffron (about 20 strands)","125ml glass dry sherry (such as Fino or Manzanilla)","200ml chicken stock","1 tbsp thyme leaves","50g raisins","2 tbsp pine nuts","handful chopped flat-leaf parsley, to serve"]','["Heat a large frying pan on a high heat\r\nand season the chicken. Add the olive oil\r\nto the pan, then the chicken. Brown for\r\nabout 5 mins on each side, remove onto\r\na plate, then set aside.","Lower the heat to medium. In the\r\nremaining fat, fry the onions for\r\n3 mins, then add the garlic and saffron.\r\nCook for 3-4 mins more. Add the Sherry,\r\nthen simmer for 3-5 mins until syrupy.","Put the chicken leg pieces back into\r\nthe pan, tip in the stock, thyme and\r\nraisins, cover, then gently cook on a low\r\nheat for 20 mins. Add the breast meat\r\nand any juices left on the plate, simmer\r\nfor 10 mins more until cooked through\r\nand the sauce in the pan has reduced.","While the chicken is cooking, heat oven\r\nto 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Scatter the pine\r\nnuts over a baking sheet, then roast for\r\n10 mins until golden and toasted. Once\r\nthe chicken has cooked through, season\r\nto taste, scatter with pine nuts and\r\nparsley, then serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8138,8138,'en','Spaghetti with Spanish flavours','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA 10 minute dish which infuses spaghetti with the flavours of Spain – you can make a vegetarian version too','["80g pack sliced chorizo sausage","300g bag fresh spaghetti","20g pack flatleaf parsley (a good handful)","2 red peppers from a jar, in brine or oil","2 tbsp olive oil","50g finely grated fresh parmesan, plus extra to serve"]','["Put a pan of water on over a high\r\nheat to boil. Meanwhile, snip the\r\nchorizo into strips with scissors,\r\nand chop the parsley and peppers\r\n(check for stray seeds first).","When the water is boiling briskly,\r\nadd the spaghetti with a good\r\nmeasure of salt, stir and return to\r\nthe boil. Cook for 3 minutes.","In a large frying pan, heat the oil,\r\nadd the chorizo and peppers and\r\nplenty of black pepper. Cook for a\r\nminute or so, until heated through\r\nand the juices are stained red from\r\nthe paprika in the chorizo. Scoop\r\nhalf a mugful of pasta water from\r\nthe pan, drain the remainder and\r\ntip the spaghetti into the frying pan.","Add the parsley and parmesan,\r\ntoss well and splash in the pasta\r\nwater, to moisten. Hand round extra\r\nparmesan at the table."]','2026-01-10 12:21:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8140,8140,'en','Thai tea','Try to find an authentic Thai tea blend for this recipe if possible. A blend of tea and condensed milk and served with ice, it’s a sweet and moreish drink','["90g Thai tea leaves (we used ChaTraMue)","397g can condensed milk (or condensed coconut milk for a vegan option)","410g can evaporated milk (or oat milk)","ice, to serve"]','["Carefully whisk the loose tea and 1.5 litres boiling water together in a large heatproof bowl. Leave to steep for 8 mins. Meanwhile, set a sieve over a large jug and line with muslin.","After 8 mins, carefully pour the tea through the lined sieve and squeeze to extract all the flavour (it will be hot, so be careful). Whisk in the condensed and evaporated milks, then chill for 1 hr. Fill a serving jug with ice, pour in the tea, then serve in tall glasses over ice with reusable straws."]','2026-01-10 12:21:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8142,8142,'en','Thai-style shredded apple salad','Green mango is a more traditional element of Thai-style salads, but when it’s not available, Granny Smith apples work well as a substitute','["90g rice noodles (about 2 nests)","2 large carrots , grated","100g mangetout , shredded","small bunch of spring onions , finely sliced","25g coriander , roughly chopped, plus extra to serve","50g roasted peanuts , roughly chopped, plus extra to serve","2 Granny Smith apples , cored and sliced into matchsticks","100g radishes , finely sliced","50g smooth peanut butter","2 limes , zested and juiced, plus extra wedges to serve","1 tbsp maple syrup","2 tbsp sesame oil","2 tbsp fish sauce","1 tbsp soy sauce or tamari","1 tsp finely grated ginger"]','["Put the rice noodles in a heatproof bowl, cover with boiling water and leave to stand for 3 mins until softened slightly, then drain. Whisk all the dressing ingredients together until smooth.","Put the cooked noodles, the carrots, mangetout, spring onions, coriander, peanuts, apples and radishes in a bowl, and toss with dressing until everything is coated. Serve topped with extra coriander and peanuts, with lime wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:21:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8144,8144,'en','Drunken noodles (pad kee mao)','Spicy, savoury and full of punch, these Thai ‘drunken noodles’ are the ultimate fast food, ready in just 20 minutes','["200g flat rice noodles (choose wide noodles, if possible)","2 tbsp neutral-tasting oil (such as vegetable)","3 garlic cloves , finely chopped","3 bird’s-eye chillies , finely chopped","225g sirloin steak , thinly sliced","100g long-stemmed broccoli , cut into 3-4cm pieces","large handful of Thai basil leaves","3½ tbsp light soy sauce","3½ tbsp oyster sauce","1 tsp fish sauce","1 tbsp sugar"]','["Prepare the noodles following pack instructions, then drain and set aside. Combine all the ingredients for the sauce in a small bowl or jug, and set aside.","Heat the oil in a large wok or frying pan over a high heat and stir-fry the garlic and chilli for 20 seconds until just starting to turn golden. Add the steak and stir-fry for 1 minute until seared and starting to brown. Add the broccoli and stir-fry for another minute, then tip in the noodles and add the sauce. Stir-fry for another 1-2 mins until well combined and piping hot.","Stir through the basil and turn off the heat. Serve immediately to avoid overcooking."]','2026-01-10 12:21:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8146,8146,'en','Thai-style salmon fishcakes with lime mayo dip','Rustle up these easy fishcakes for supper. They also make a great snack to pack for lunch during Jewish Passover. Use the best mayo you can find for the dip','["2 x 220g cans red salmon","4 spring onions , finely chopped","2 tbsp fresh coriander , roughly chopped","1 lime , zested and juiced","2 eggs , beaten","75g medium matzo meal","1 tbsp desiccated coconut (optional)","1-2 tbsp neutral oil","100g mayonnaise","1 tsp grated lime zest (roughly 1 lime)","1 tbsp lime juice (roughly ½ lime)"]','["Drain the salmon and mash in a medium sized bowl. Add the spring onions, coriander, lime zest and juice, the eggs, matzo meal and coconut, if using. Season generously with salt and pepper and mix until evenly combined.","Heat your air fryer to 180C. Meanwhile brush the top of the fishcakes with a little oil.","Place the fishcakes in a single layer, oiled side down, and lightly brush the other side of each. If you can’t fit them all in one go you can do this in batches. Air-fry at 180C for 8 mins then turn and fry for another 7-10 mins until they are lightly browned and crisp.","Meanwhile mix the mayonnaise with the lime zest and juice. Taste for seasoning. Serve the fishcakes hot with the dip, or at room temperature. Will keep chilled for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8148,8148,'en','Tempeh pad Thai','Add protein-packed tempeh to this pad Thai for an easy midweek family meal. Swap for tofu, chicken or prawns, if you like','["150g rice noodles","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","200g tempeh , cubed","4 spring onions , sliced","300g beansprouts","3 small peppers , different colours ideally, sliced","3 eggs","handful of roasted salted peanuts , roughly chopped","1 sliced red chilli , a few coriander  leaves and 1 lime, cut into wedges, to serve (optional)","2 tbsp palm sugar or brown sugar","3 tbsp fish sauce","3 tbsp tamarind paste","1 tbsp soy sauce","1 tsp finely chopped garlic (about 4 cloves)"]','["Soak the noodles in water according to pack instructions. Once softened, drain and set aside.","Heat the oil in a pan over a medium heat and fry the tempeh for a few minutes until browned. Remove and set aside on a plate.","In the same pan, stir-fry the spring onions, beansprouts and peppers for a few minutes, ensuring the vegetables remain crunchy.","Crack the eggs into a bowl and whisk lightly with a fork. Push the vegetables to one side of the pan, then pour in the eggs. Scramble the eggs gently, then add the noodles and tempeh. Stir everything together until well combined.","In a separate pan, combine all the sauce ingredients with 100ml water. Cook over a medium heat, stirring constantly until the sugar dissolves and the sauce thickens slightly. Pour the sauce over the noodles and veg, and mix well to ensure all the ingredients are evenly coated. To serve, sprinkle with the peanuts, along with the sliced red chilli and coriander, and lime wedges on the side for squeezing over, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8150,8150,'en','Fragrant lemongrass & coconut chicken stir-fry','Whip up a quick and wholesome dinner on busy days – this Thai-inspired chicken stir-fry provides two of your five-a-day','["1 lemongrass stick, outer husk removed, finely chopped (see tip, below)","15g ginger , peeled and grated","2 garlic cloves , crushed","1 lime , juiced","2 tsp light brown soft sugar","2 tbsp reduced-salt light soy sauce","60ml coconut water (or use water)","1 bird''s-eye chilli , finely chopped (optional)","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 courgette , chopped","2 chicken breasts , thinly sliced","200g sugar snap peas , trimmed","15g desiccated coconut","250g pouch microwave wholegrain rice"]','["Combine the lemongrass, ginger, garlic, lime juice, sugar, soy sauce, coconut water and chilli, if using, and set aside. Heat the oil in awokor large, high-sided pan over a high heat and stir-fry the courgette and chicken for 4 mins until browned. Stir in the peas and coconut and cook for 1-2 mins, stirring well to ensure the coconut doesn’t burn.","Pour the lemongrass mixture around the edge of the pan, then stir in to combine. Continue to cook over a high heat for about 1-2 mins, until the chicken is cooked through and the sauce has reduced. Season to taste. Warm the rice following pack instructions, then serve with the stir-fry."]','2026-01-10 12:21:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8152,8152,'en','Tom yum soup with prawns','Enjoy an impressive homemade Thai tom yum soup that’s healthy and easy to make – it’s vibrant, fresh and full of flavour','["200g onions, roughly chopped","150g tomatoes, roughly chopped","20g red chilli, sliced","15g galangal, peeled and sliced","2 lemongrass stalks, bashed","270g whole raw king prawns, peeled and deveined, heads removed and reserved","1 chicken stock cube","120g oyster mushrooms, sliced","8 lime leaves","5 tsp fish sauce","5 tsp lime juice","70ml Thai coconut milk","1 tbsp Thai chilli jam (optional)","small handful of coriander, roughly chopped (optional)"]','["Pour 1.3 litres water into a largesaucepanover a high heat. Add the onion, tomato, chilli, galangal, lemongrass, prawn heads and chicken stock cube. Stir and bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to medium and simmer for 20 mins until the liquid has reduced.","Carefully strain the hot broth into a large heatproof bowl or jug, then discard the prawn heads. Return the strained veg and herb mixture to the saucepan and pour over the broth. Stir through the mushrooms and lime leaves, then cook for 3 mins until the mushrooms are tender.","Add 1 tbsp sugar, the fish sauce, lime juice, coconut milk and prawns. Bring to the boil and cook until the prawns are cooked through, about 1-2 mins. Remove from the heat. Remove the lemongrass, then stir in the Thai chilli jam, if using. Scatter over the coriander to finish, if you like, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8154,8154,'en','Easy veggie red curry noodles','Try our vegetarian Thai red curry noodles for a filling midweek meal loaded with red pepper, mangetout and baby corn','["1tbsp vegetable oil","½ 170g jar Blue Dragon Thai Red Curry Paste","200ml coconut milk","1tsp brown sugar","1 red pepper , seeds removed and sliced","250g mixed baby veg (mangetout, baby corn, broccoli etc), halve any big pieces","100g dried medium egg noodles"]','["Place a deep, wide frying pan or wok on medium heat and add the vegetable oil.","Add the Blue Dragon Thai Red Curry Paste to the oil and cook for 1 min, or until the paste is smelling fragrant. Add the coconut milk and bring to a boil. Add the sugar, then reduce to a simmer and cook for 1 min.","Add the vegetables, (if you are using mangetout then keep these back) and turn the heat up to medium, cooking until just tender but retaining a bite, about 6-8 mins. 2 mins before the end of cooking time add the mangetout.","Meanwhile, cook the noodles following the packet instructions and divide them between two bowls. Add some vegetables to the bowls and top with the curry sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:21:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8156,8156,'en','Easy Thai green chicken & mushroom curry','Packed with tender chicken, hearty mushrooms and fresh veg, this Thai curry comes together in a flash on busy days','["1tbsp vegetable oil","½ 170g jar Blue Dragon Thai Green Curry Paste","1 large or 2 small chicken breasts , sliced","½ red onion , sliced","200g button mushrooms , halved or quartered","200ml coconut milk","50g mangetout , halved lengthways or 50g small broccoli florets","cooked rice to serve"]','["Put the vegetable oil in a frying pan, and heat on high. Season the chicken slices with salt and brown them on high until just golden then remove from the pan and set aside. You don’t need to cook the chicken all the way through, just get it nicely golden.","Add the Blue Dragon Thai Green Curry Paste, stir fry for 1 minute then add the onion and reduce the heat to medium. Stir fry for 2 mins, or until the onion is becoming softened.","Add the mushrooms and cook on medium-high heat for 5 minutes. Add the coconut milk and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat then simmer, covered for 5 mins, add the chicken strips. Cook for another 3 mins, or until the chicken is cooked through and the sauce is piping hot, then add the mangetout and cook for 1 min.","Divide cooked rice between two bowls. Spoon over the chicken curry mixture to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8158,8158,'en','Fragrant coconut, salmon & prawn traybake','Get inspired by Thai flavours with this fragrant coconut, salmon and prawn ‘fakeaway’. It’s made easy with an all-in-one method – and works with cod, too','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","5 tbsp Thai red curry paste","2 garlic cloves, grated","thumb-sized piece of ginger, peeled and finely grated","2 x 400ml cans coconut milk","1 red chilli, halved","1 tbsp fish sauce","3 lime leaves (optional)","4 thick salmon fillets, skin left on","4 baby pak choi, cut into quarters","150g mangetout","150g raw king prawns","½ small bunch of coriander, roughly chopped","2-3 limes, cut into wedges to serve","cooked jasmine rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the oil in a deep frying pan orwok, and fry the curry paste, garlic and ginger for 1 min. Stir in the coconut milk and chilli, and bring to a simmer. Add the fish sauce and lime leaves, if using.","Pour the mixture into a mediumroasting tin, and nestle in the salmon, pak choi and mangetout. Cover and cook in the oven for 15 mins. Scatter in the prawns and cook for a further 10 mins. Garnish with the coriander and serve with the lime wedges and rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8160,8160,'en','Chicken pad Thai','Enjoy our version of the classic noodle dish with spring onions, egg, beansprouts and peanuts. Add chilli to suit your taste and serve with lime wedges','["150g dried flat rice noodles","4 tbsp sunflower oil","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 red chilli, finely chopped","2 chicken breasts, sliced finely sliced","½ small pack coriander, leaves picked, and stalks finely chopped","60g spring onions, shredded (reserving some to serve)","2 tbsp chopped pickled turnip (optional)","50ml chicken stock","100g beansprouts","2 eggs","60g roasted unsalted peanuts, chopped","soy sauce, to serve","fresh red chilli, sliced, to serve (optional)","2 tbsp tamarind paste","2 tbsp fish sauce","1 tbsp light brown soft sugar","1 lime, half juiced, half cut into wedges to serve","½ tbsp siracha","pinch chilli powder (optional)"]','["Soak the noodles in warm water for about 20 mins or until al dente, then drain. Meanwhile, make the sauce by mixing together the tamarind paste, fish sauce, sugar, lime and siracha until smooth.","Heat half the oil in a frying pan or a wok over a medium heat. Add the garlic and chilli and fry for 30 seconds until fragrant. Tip in the chicken and cook for 5 mins until golden. Add the coriander stalks, spring onions and turnip (if using), and fry for 1 min. Add in the soaked noodles, 50ml of the chicken stock and the prepared sauce. Keep stir-frying the noodles until they’re starting to dry, then add the sauce. Stir everything together and cook over a high heat for 3 mins until the noodles are just cooked. Add a splash more water if needed.","When the sauce has reduced, scatter over the beansprouts and fold them into the noodles. Push everything to one side of the pan, then pour in the rest of the oil on the empty side and crack in the eggs. Fry for 2 mins until the white is just set and beginning to crisp around the edges, then roughly scramble the runny yolks in with the whites. When the eggs have just set, combine with the noodles.","Scatter over half of the peanuts and quickly toss together. Divide between two plates with the remaining peanuts and spring onion, the lime wedges and soy sauce on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:21:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8162,8162,'en','Thai red curry with quick pickled cucumber','Pack in three of your 5-a-day with this vegan Thai red curry. It''s a fragrant and hearty dish boasting butternut squash, a hint of chilli and creamy coconut','["2 tsp vegetable oil","1 shallot, finely chopped","4 tbsp vegan Thai red curry paste","400ml Alpro coconut drink, unsweetened","400ml vegan vegetable stock","300g butternut squash, cut into 2cm cubes","150g baby potatoes, halved","150g green beans, trimmed","60g baby spinach leaves","100g shelled edamame beans","1 tbsp low sodium soy sauce or tamari","2 limes, juiced","coriander or Thai basil leaves, to serve (optional)","cooked brown rice, to serve","1 large cucumber","4 tbsp rice vinegar","pinch of chilli flakes"]','["To make the pickled cucumber, split the cucumber in half, remove the core with a teaspoon and discard. Cut the cucumber halves into thin semi-circles, then toss in a bowl with the vinegar, chilli and a pinch of salt. Leave to pickle while you make the curry.","Heat the oil in a deep frying pan over a medium heat. Add the shallot and fry for 5 mins until soft, then stir in the curry paste and cook for 2-3 mins until fragrant. Tip in the coconut milk and stock and bring to a simmer.","Add the squash and potatoes and cook uncovered for 20 mins until the potatoes are tender and the sauce has reduced and thickened slightly.","Stir in the green beans, spinach and edamame and cook for 4 mins more until tender. Season with the soy and lime juice and sprinkle over the coriander or Thai basil, if using. Serve in bowls over the rice with the pickled cucumber alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:21:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8164,8164,'en','Next level pad Thai','Take the classic pad Thai to new levels, adding king prawns and tofu, pickled turnip and tamarind paste – a dish for two that''s packed with flavour','["200g dried flat rice noodles","2 tbsp tamarind paste","3 tbsp fish sauce","1 tbsp light brown soft sugar","1 lime, half juiced, half cut into wedges to serve","pinch chilli powder (optional)","4 tbsp sunflower oil","100g firm tofu, diced","200g raw king prawns, butterflied","100g beansprouts","2 eggs","100g salted roasted peanuts, chopped","2 spring onions, shredded","2 tbsp chopped pickled turnip (preserved radish)","soy sauce, to serve"]','["Soak the noodles in warm water for about 20 mins until softened but with plenty of bite, then drain. Meanwhile, mix together the tamarind paste, fish sauce, sugar and lime juice until the sugar dissolves. Season with a pinch of chilli powder if you like it spicy. Can be made up to two weeks ahead and kept in the fridge. If you make pad Thai regularly, double the quantity and keep half.","Heat half the oil in a frying pan and cook the tofu on each side until golden. Add the prawns and fry until they just start to turn pink. Tip the noodles into the pan and drizzle over the tamarind mixture with about 5 tbsp of water. Stir everything together and cook over a high heat for 3 mins until the noodles are just cooked. Add a splash more water if needed.","When the sauce has reduced, scatter over the beansprouts and fold them into the noodles. Push everything to one side of the pan, then pour in the rest of the oil on the empty side and crack in the eggs. Fry for 2 mins until the white is just set and beginning to crisp around the edges, then roughly scramble the runny yolks in with the whites. When the eggs have just set, combine with the noodles.","Scatter over half of the peanuts, half the spring onion and all the turnip, and quickly toss together. Divide between two plates with the remaining peanuts, spring onion, chilli powder, lime wedges and soy sauce on the side, to garnish as preferred."]','2026-01-10 12:21:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8166,8166,'en','Skinny Thai burgers with sweet potato chips & pineapple salsa','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA healthy, Asian-inspired beefburger with sweet potato fries and a fruity relish – a vibrant spin on a classic','["4 sweet potato, unpeeled and cut into chunky chips","1 tbsp olive oil","400-500g extra lean minced pork or beef","2 tbsp Thai red curry paste","6 spring onion, chopped","small bunch coriander, chopped","200g pineapple chunks, diced","juice ½ lime","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce, plus extra for dipping chips","1 Little Gem lettuce","4 bun, toasted"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the sweet potato chips with the oil and some seasoning on a baking sheet. Roast for 40-45 mins until golden and crisp.","Mix the mince with the curry paste, half the spring onions, half the coriander and some seasoning. Shape into 4 burgers.","Mix remaining spring onions and coriander with the pineapple, lime juice, red chilli and sweet chilli sauce.","When the chips have 10 mins to go, heat a non-stick frying pan or griddle and cook the burgers for 3-5 mins on each side until golden and cooked through. Serve the burgers in the buns with lettuce leaves and salsa piled on top, the sweet potato chips and extra chilli sauce for dipping."]','2026-01-10 12:21:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8168,8168,'en','Thai pork & peanut curry','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyUse fragrant hot red curry paste as the base to this coconut curry dish with baby sweetcorn, coriander and soy','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","bunch spring onions, sliced","small bunch coriander, stalks finely chopped, leaves picked","400g pork tenderloin, sliced","4 tbsp Thai red curry paste","4 tbsp peanut butter","1 tbsp soft brown sugar","1 tbsp soy sauce","400ml can light coconut milk","175g pack baby corn","juice 1 lime","steamed jasmine rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan or flameproof casserole. Add the spring onions and coriander stalks and cook for 1 min. Add the pork slices and cook for 5 mins until starting to brown.","Stir in the curry paste and peanut butter. After 30 secs, add the sugar, soy and coconut milk, plus ½ can of water. Mix well, put a lid on and leave to simmer for 15 mins, stirring occasionally.","Remove the lid, add the baby corn and increase the heat. Bubble for 3 mins until the corn is cooked and the sauce has thickened a little. Stir in the lime juice and check the seasoning. Can now be frozen for up to 2 months. To cook from frozen: thoroughly defrost, then heat in a pan on the hob until curry is hot all the way through. Serve scattered with the coriander leaves and rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8170,8170,'en','Chiang Mai curried noodles (Khao soi gai)','This creamy, tangy curry from northern Thailand, with coconut milk and juicy chicken thighs, is topped with pickled shallots and crispy noodles','["400ml vegetable oil, plus 1 tbsp","4 tbsp Thai red or yellow curry paste","2 tsp mild curry powder","1 tsp red chilli flakes","400ml can coconut milk","150ml coconut cream","200ml vegetable or chicken stock","2 tbsp fish sauce","juice 2 limes","500g skinless boneless chicken thighs","300g Chinese dried egg noodles (medium or thin)","1 long red chilli (deseeded if you don''t like it too hot), sliced","3 small shallots, cut into quarters","150ml rice wine vinegar","small pack coriander, roughly chopped","100g beansprouts, trimmed","3 chopped spring onions","chilli oil"]','["First, make the pickled chilli & shallots: Put the chilli and shallots in a small bowl and pour the vinegar over. Add some salt and let it sit to pickle while you make the curry.","In a large saucepan, heat the 1 tbsp vegetable oil. Add the curry paste and turn the heat down to medium. Cook for 5 mins, then add the curry powder and chilli flakes. Cook for 1 min more, then add the coconut milk, coconut cream, stock, fish sauce and lime juice. Bring to a simmer.","Chop the chicken into pieces and add to the curry. Cook for 15 mins or until tender.","Boil some water in a large saucepan for the noodles. Meanwhile, heat the vegetable oil in a small wok – it’s ready when a small piece of bread sizzles when dropped in. Add 75g of the noodles to the wok in 4 batches until they bubble up and go crispy. Use a wire mesh ladle or slotted spoon to remove them and drain on kitchen paper.","Boil the remaining noodles for 2-3 mins until al dente, then drain. Divide the noodles between 4 bowls. Pour the curry over each and top with coriander, beansprouts, some drained pickled chilli & shallots, spring onions and a drizzle of chilli oil. Top with the crisp noodles and devour while it’s hot."]','2026-01-10 12:21:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8172,8172,'en','Pea, feta & quinoa spring rolls with roast tomato nam prik','Serve up these vegetarian filo pastry canapés with nam prik – a Thai chilli paste that we’ve mixed with oven-roasted tomatoes to make a dipping sauce','["50g quinoa","200g frozen petits pois","85g feta cheese, crumbled","small bunch mint leaves, chopped","3 spring onions, finely chopped","zest and juice 1 lemon","6 sheets filo pastry (270g pack)","1 egg, beaten","sunflower oil, for frying","6 large tomatoes, halved","4 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 garlic clove, chopped","½ red chilli, chopped","2 tsp grated ginger","½ bunch coriander including stalks, roughly chopped","¼ bunch mint leaves, roughly chopped","1 tbsp lime juice","1 tbsp tamarind paste","1 tsp palm sugar"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nTo make the nam prik, place the\r\ntomatoes, cut-side up, on a baking\r\nsheet. Drizzle with 1 tbsp of the olive\r\noil, season, then roast for 1½-2 hrs\r\nuntil semi-dried. Remove from the oven,\r\nlet cool, then tip into a food processor\r\nwith the remaining ingredients and\r\nblitz to a medium purée.","Cook the quinoa in a pan of boiling\r\nsalted water following pack instructions.\r\nTip into a bowl and set aside to cool.\r\nCook the peas for 1 min in boiling water,\r\nthen drain and run under cold water for\r\na few mins. Drain thoroughly, tip into a\r\nfood processor and pulse to a chunky\r\npurée. Add this to the cooled quinoa\r\nalong with the feta, mint, spring onions\r\nand lemon zest and juice. Mix well to\r\ncombine and season to taste, adding\r\nmore lemon juice if required.","Lay a sheet of filo in\r\nfront of you, keeping the remainder\r\ncovered under a damp tea towel. Cut\r\nthe filo in half across the width to make\r\n2 squares. With one corner pointing\r\ntowards you (so you are looking at a\r\ndiamond shape rather than a square),\r\nspoon 2 tbsp of the filling just below the\r\ncentre line and shape into a log. Brush\r\nthe pastry edges with egg, then fold in\r\nthe 2 side corners. Keeping your fingers\r\non the corners, bring the bottom corner\r\nup over the filling towards the centre,\r\nthen roll up tightly towards the top corner.\r\nIt’s important to roll as tightly as possible,\r\nso the spring rolls cook evenly. Repeat\r\nwith the remaining filo sheets and filling.","Heat about 3cm sunflower oil in a large\r\npan or wok and fry the spring rolls, in\r\nbatches, for 2-3 mins or until golden\r\nbrown. Remove with a slotted spoon\r\nand drain on kitchen paper. Transfer\r\nthe spring rolls to a plate and serve\r\nwith the nam prik."]','2026-01-10 12:21:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8174,8174,'en','Thai minced chicken salad','Known as larb gai in Thailand, the hot spiciness in this chicken salad recipe works really well with the crunchy veg, creating a perfect balance of flavour and heat','["2 lemongrass","4 lime leaves, stalks removed","2 red chillies, deseeded","3 garlic cloves","fingertip-length piece fresh root ginger","4 skinless chicken breasts","1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 tbsp sesame oil","1 tsp chilli powder","50ml fish sauce","1 red onion, chopped","3 tbsp lime juice","handful each mint, basil and coriander leaves, roughly chopped","3 Baby Gem lettuces, leaves separated","1 cucumber, seeds removed and cut into strips lengthways","200g beansprouts","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Roughly chop the lemongrass, lime leaves,\r\nred chillies, garlic and ginger, then throw\r\nthem all into a processor and blitz until\r\neverything is very finely chopped together.\r\nMince the chicken breasts into tiny pieces.","Heat a wok over a high heat and add the\r\nvegetable oil and the sesame oil. Throw in\r\nthe lemongrass mixture and fry briefly before\r\nadding the minced chicken and the chilli\r\npowder. Stir-fry the chicken for 4 mins then\r\nsplash in the fish sauce. Turn down the heat\r\na little and allow the chicken and fish sauce\r\nto bubble together for another 4 mins,\r\nstirring, then add the chopped red onion\r\nand cook for another min.","Remove from the heat, pour over the lime\r\njuice and toss in the herbs. Serve with the\r\nsalad veg and a lime wedge on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:21:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8177,8177,'en','Thai rice noodle salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis salad is full of flavour and is healthy too, as it’s served with an oil-free dressing','["½ a 250g pack fine vermicelli rice noodles","200g bag beansprouts","zest and juice 2 limes","2-3 tbsp fish or soy sauce, to taste","1 tsp muscovado sugar or soft brown sugar","1 red onion, halved and thinly sliced","2 Little Gem lettuce hearts, leaves separated and roughly torn","500g minced pork","small knob grated ginger","pinch cayenne pepper","1 tsp sunflower oil","2 tbsp sesame seeds","1 tsp oil","4 x 175g sirloin steaks","1 deseeded and shredded red chilli"]','["Place the noodles and beansprouts in a\r\nheatproof bowl and cover with boiling water.\r\nLeave for 4 mins, or until the noodles are\r\ntender. Drain, then cool under cold running\r\nwater and drain again. Return to the bowl.","Stir together the lime zest and juice, fish\r\nor soy sauce and sugar. Stir into the noodles\r\nwith the red onion and lettuce.","To make with mince, heat a little\r\noil in a non-stick frying pan and stir-fry 500g\r\nminced pork, a small knob of grated ginger\r\nand pinch cayenne pepper or chilli powder\r\nfor 10 mins, until the mince is browned and\r\ncooked through. Mix into the noodles, divide\r\nbetween four bowls and serve warm.","To make with steak, make the rice noodle salad. Heat 1 tsp\r\nsunflower oil in a frying pan. Tip 2 tbsp sesame\r\nseeds onto a plate. Rub 1 tsp oil into 4 x 175g\r\nsirloin steaks and press into sesame seeds. Fry\r\nfor 5 mins for medium rare, turning halfway.\r\nLeave to rest for 5 mins, then thinly slice. Toss 1\r\ndeseeded and shredded red chilli, and a handful\r\nmint leaves into noodles. Top with steak to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8179,8179,'en','Easy pad Thai','Almost a national dish of Thailand, Mary Cadogan''s simplified take makes it easy to shop for – and very authentic tasting','["125g (half a 250g pack) rice noodles","3 tbsp lime juice about 2 limes","½  tsp cayenne pepper","2 tsp light muscovado sugar","2 tbsp fish sauce (nam pla)","2 tbsp vegetable oil","200g cooked and peeled tiger prawns, tails left on","4 spring onions, sliced","140g beansprouts","25g salted peanuts, finely chopped","a small handful of coriander leaves","1 or 2 lime, cut into wedges","sweet chilli sauce"]','["Put the noodles in a large heatproof bowl, pour boiling water over them and leave for 4 minutes, then drain and refresh under cold running water.","Put the lime juice, cayenne, sugar and fish sauce in a bowl and mix well. Have all the other ingredients ready by the cooker.","Heat the oil and fry the prawns until warmed through. Add the spring onions and noodles and toss around. Tip in the lime juice mixture, then stir in the beansprouts and half the peanuts and coriander. Cook for 1 minute until everything is heated through.","Pile into a large dish, scatter with the rest of the peanuts and coriander, and serve with lime wedges and sweet chilli sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:21:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8182,8181,'en','Thai shredded chicken & runner bean salad','This low-fat yet satisfying salad is full of authentic Asian flavour and will add plenty of zing to al fresco dining','["200g runner beans (or any other green bean), topped and tailed","1 red chilli, halved and finely sliced, use a bird''s eye chilli for more heat","2 shallots, finely sliced","1 lemongrass, finely sliced","2cm piece ginger, shredded","2 cooked, skinless chicken breasts","small bunch mint leaves","large bunch Thai basil or coriander","1 lime cut in wedges or cheeks, to serve","steamed jasmine rice, to serve","100ml coconut cream","1 garlic clove, crushed","3 tbsp fish sauce","1 tsp sugar","juice 1 lime","1 bird''s eye chilli, finely diced"]','["Run a potato peeler down either side of\r\nthe beans to remove any stringy bits. Cut\r\ninto strips using a bean slicer, or on the\r\ndiagonal into 2cm pieces. Cook the beans\r\nin simmering salted water for 4 mins or\r\nuntil tender but still bright green. Drain\r\nand put in a bowl with the chilli, shallots,\r\nlemongrass and ginger. Pull the chicken\r\nbreasts into shreds using your fingers\r\nand add to the bowl.","Make the dressing. Mix the coconut\r\nwith the garlic, fish sauce, sugar, lime\r\nand chilli. Tear the mint and Thai basil\r\nover the chicken and toss everything\r\ntogether. Pile onto a plate and pour over\r\nthe dressing. Serve with the lime to\r\nsqueeze over and jasmine rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8184,8184,'en','Pad Thai with prawns','This udon noodle stir fry has a peanut and tamarind sauce – it’s on the table in just 20 minutes','["250g udon noodles","2 tsp vegetable oil","100g peeled raw prawns","4 spring onions, chopped","2 eggs, beaten","2 tbsp roasted peanuts, chopped","small handful coriander leaves","lime wedges, to serve","2 tbsp tamarind paste","1 tbsp fish sauce","juice 1 lime","1 tbsp soft brown sugar"]','["Boil the noodles in salted water for\r\n3 mins until soft. Drain and rinse in cold\r\nwater. To make the sauce, mix all the\r\ningredients together in a small bowl.","Heat a wok with half the oil. Add the\r\nprawns and spring onions, and cook,\r\nstirring quickly, for 1 min or until the\r\nprawns turn pink. Push to the side and\r\nadd the remaining oil. Add the egg and\r\nlet sit for 30 secs, then scramble until\r\ncooked. Add the noodles and sauce, and\r\ncook, stirring continuously, for 3 mins\r\nor until everything is hot.","Serve the noodles with the peanuts\r\nand coriander sprinkled on top, and\r\nlime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:21:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8186,8186,'en','The ultimate makeover: Thai green chicken curry','This normally super-rich curry can be turned into one that’s healthier but stillcreamy','["20g bunch coriander, stalks and leaves separated","2 shallots, finely chopped","1 lemongrass, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1cm piece fresh root ginger, finely chopped","3 small hot green chillies, finely chopped (include the seeds)","1 larger, mild-to-medium green chilli, finely chopped (include the seeds)","small handful basil leaves","½ tsp each ground cumin and coriander","¼ tsp black pepper","1 tsp crumbled freeze-dried kaffir lime leaves","1 tbsp lime juice","1 tsp sunflower oil","1 tbsp sunflower oil","400ml/14fl oz can reduced-fat coconut milk","3 boneless, skinless chicken breasts (450g/1lb total weight), cut into bite-size pieces","2 tsp fish sauce","½ tsp granulated palm or light muscovado sugar","4 freeze-dried lime leaves","100g mange tout, thinly sliced lengthways","100g green beans, halved lengthways","2 spring onions, finely shredded","250g Thai fragrant rice, cooked","lime wedges"]','["For the curry paste, finely chop the\r\ncoriander stalks and put them into a mini\r\nfood blender or small food processor\r\nwith the shallots, lemongrass, garlic and\r\nginger. Pulse until as smooth as you can\r\nget it. Add the chillies, basil, threequarters\r\nof the coriander leaves, the\r\nground cumin, coriander, pepper, lime\r\nleaves and lime juice, then pulse again.\r\nMix in the oil and set aside. You will only\r\nbe using half of this paste, the rest can\r\nbe chilled for a couple of days, or frozen\r\nfor up to a month.","For the curry, heat the oil in a non-stick\r\nwok or deep sauté pan, stir in half the\r\ncurry paste, then stir-fry for 1 min. Shake\r\nthe coconut milk in its can, open, then\r\npour two-thirds into the pan. Let it bubble\r\naway for 4-5 mins, stirring now and then,\r\nuntil reduced and thickened slightly.","Tip in the chicken, then stir-fry for\r\n1-2 mins until no longer pink. Stir in the\r\nfish sauce and sugar, then pour in the\r\nrest of the coconut milk to give a thinnish,\r\ncreamy sauce. Lower the heat, add the\r\nlime leaves, then simmer for 5 mins to\r\ngently finish cooking the chicken. Can be\r\nfrozen at this point for up to 1 month.","While the chicken simmers, steam the\r\nmangetout and beans for a couple of\r\nmins. Serve the curry in bowls with some\r\nof the veg piled on top (serve the rest\r\nseparately) along with the spring onions\r\nand the rest of the coriander leaves.\r\nServe with a bowl of Thai fragrant rice\r\nand lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:21:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8188,8188,'en','Thai coconut crumbed chicken traybake','Contrast breaded chicken with squash, tomatoes and aubergine flavoured with spicy Thai red curry paste','["1 butternut squash, peeled, deseeded and cubed","1 large aubergine, cubed","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","3 tbsp desiccated coconut","4 tbsp fresh breadcrumbs","4 skinless chicken breasts","1 egg, beaten","300g cherry tomatoes","2 tbsp Thai red curry paste","handful coriander leaves, roughly chopped","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nIn a large, shallow roasting tin, toss the\r\nsquash and aubergine in the oil, then\r\nseason and spread out in a single layer.\r\nRoast for 30 mins, turning once.","On a plate, mix the coconut and\r\nbreadcrumbs with some seasoning.\r\nDip the chicken breasts in the egg, then\r\npress in the crumbs to coat, shaking\r\noff any excess.","Toss the tomatoes and curry paste in\r\nwith the roasted veg and give everything\r\na good stir. Nestle the chicken breasts\r\nin the veg and pop back in the oven for\r\na further 25-30 mins until the chicken\r\nis cooked through, shaking the pan once\r\nor twice. Sprinkle over the coriander and\r\nserve with lime wedges to squeeze over."]','2026-01-10 12:21:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8190,8190,'en','Thai salmon noodles','This fast, fragrant and filling dish is just what you need after a hard day at work','["200g egg or rice noodles","1 tsp olive oil","2-3 tsp Thai red curry paste","2 spring onions, chopped","1 sweet potato, cubed","200ml vegetable or chicken stock","100ml skimmed milk","2 skinless salmon fillets, cut in half and then into fine strips","½ small bunch coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Cook the noodles following the pack\r\ninstructions, rinse and drain. Heat the oil\r\nin a deep saucepan and fry the curry\r\npaste for 1 min until fragrant. Add the\r\nspring onions, reserving 1 tbsp, the\r\nsweet potato, stock and milk, bring\r\nquickly to the boil and simmer for 5 mins\r\nuntil the potato is tender. Add the salmon\r\npieces and cook for 2 mins, then stir in\r\nhalf the coriander.","Divide the noodles between 4 bowls\r\nand spoon over the salmon and sauce.\r\nSprinkle over the remaining coriander\r\nand spring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:21:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8192,8192,'en','Thai-style fish broth with greens','A ramen-style noodle soup with sustainable pollock, prawns and healthy vegetables – a low-fat, low-calorie bowl','["100g brown rice noodles","500ml chicken or fish stock","1 tbsp Thai red curry paste","4 dried or fresh kaffir lime leaves","1 tbsp fish sauce","200g skinless sustainable white fish, such as pollack","100g raw king prawns","2 pak choi, leaves separated","handful coriander leaves"]','["Cook the noodles following pack\r\ninstructions. Refresh in cold water\r\nand drain well.","Put the stock in a large saucepan and\r\nstir in the curry paste, lime leaves, fish\r\nsauce and 250ml cold water. Bring to\r\na simmer and cook for 5 mins.","Cut the fish into roughly 3cm cubes\r\nand add to the pan. Return to a simmer,\r\nthen cook for 2 mins uncovered.","Stir in the noodles, prawns and pak\r\nchoi, and simmer for 2-3 mins or until\r\nthe fish and prawns are just cooked.\r\nServe in bowls scattered with coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:21:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8193,8193,'en','Double chocolate Easter Danish','Everyone loves a Danish pastry, especially when it’s chocolaty and big enough to share','["175ml warm milk","1 egg, beaten","450g strong white flour","1 sachet fast-action dried yeast","50g golden caster sugar","250g block cold butter, sliced","200g toasted flaked almonds","50g icing sugar","25g cocoa powder","50g butter, softened","1 egg white","50g dark chocolate, chopped into small places","1 egg yolk","3 tbsp milk","golden caster sugar, for sprinkling","50g icing sugar"]','["Make the dough a day ahead if you have time. Beat the milk and egg in a jug. Put the flour, yeast, sugar and butter in a food processor with a pinch of salt. Pulse until the mix starts to come together, but is still flecked with pieces of butter. Tip into a bowl and use your hands to work in the contents of the jug. Turn the dough out onto a floured surface, knead slightly, then roll out to a rectangle and fold the two short sides over so the edges meet in the middle, then fold into the middle again. Roll out and fold twice more, flouring the surface as you work. Cover the dough with cling film, then rest it in the fridge for at least 4 hrs or overnight.","For the filling, tip 150g of the almonds into a food processor with the icing sugar and cocoa powder and blitz until combined. Add the butter and egg white, pulse to a paste, then fold in the chocolate and set aside.","Split the dough in two and press one half into the base of a 23cm non-stick springform cake tin. Spread the filling over the middle of the dough, leaving a border, and top with the remaining dough. Cover with cling film and leave in a warm place for about an hour.","Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Beat the egg yolk with the milk and brush over the top to glaze. Sprinkle with the remaining almonds and a little caster sugar and bake for 40-50 mins until puffed up and golden. Leave to cool for an hour. Mix the icing sugar with a few drops cold water to make a runny icing and drizzle it over the cake. Serve in wedges with coffee, or with ice cream for dessert."]','2026-01-10 12:21:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8194,8194,'en','Thai coconut & veg broth','Get a taste of Thai with this quick and easy noodle soup cooked all in one pan','["1½  tbsp Thai red curry paste","1 tsp vegetable oil","1l vegetable stock","400ml can half-fat coconut milk","2 tsp brown sugar","175g medium egg noodles","2 carrots, cut into matchsticks","½ head Chinese leaf, sliced","½ x 300g bag beansprouts","6 cherry tomatoes, halved","juice 1 lime","3 spring onions, halved, then finely sliced lengthways","handful coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Place the curry paste in a large\r\nsaucepan or wok with the oil. Fry\r\nfor 1 min until fragrant. Tip in the\r\nvegetable stock, coconut milk and\r\nbrown sugar. Simmer for 3 mins.","Add the noodles, carrots and\r\nChinese leaf and simmer for\r\n4-6 mins, until all are tender. Mix\r\nin beansprouts and tomatoes. Add\r\nlime juice to taste and some extra\r\nseasoning, if you like. Spoon into\r\nbowls and sprinkle with spring\r\nonions and coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:21:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8196,8196,'en','Thai green chicken curry','Making your own fragrant curry paste takes some special Asian ingredients and a little time but you''ll taste the difference','["225g new potatoes, cut into chunks","100g green beans, trimmed and halved","1 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","1 garlic clove, chopped","1 rounded tbsp or 4 tsp Thai green curry paste (you can''t fit the tablespoon into some of the jars)","400ml can coconut milk","2 tsp Thai fish sauce","1 tsp caster sugar","450g boneless skinless chicken (breasts or thighs), cut into bite-size pieces","2 fresh kaffir lime leaves finely shredded, or 3 wide strips lime zest, plus extra to garnish","good handful of basil leaves","boiled rice, to serve"]','["Put the potatoes in a pan of\r\nboiling water and cook for\r\n5 minutes. Throw in the beans\r\nand cook for a further 3\r\nminutes, by which time both\r\nshould be just tender but not too\r\nsoft. Drain and put to one side.","In a wok or large frying pan,\r\nheat the oil until very hot, then\r\ndrop in the garlic and cook until\r\ngolden, this should take only a\r\nfew seconds. Don’t let it go very\r\ndark or it will spoil the taste.\r\nSpoon in the curry paste and\r\nstir it around for a few seconds\r\nto begin to cook the spices and\r\nrelease all the flavours. Next,\r\npour in the coconut milk and let\r\nit come to a bubble.","Stir in the fish sauce and\r\nsugar, then the pieces of\r\nchicken. Turn the heat down to a\r\nsimmer and cook, covered, for\r\nabout 8 minutes until the\r\nchicken is cooked.","Tip in the potatoes and beans\r\nand let them warm through in\r\nthe hot coconut milk, then add a\r\nlovely citrussy flavour by\r\nstirring in the shredded lime\r\nleaves (or lime zest). The basil\r\nleaves go in next, but only leave\r\nthem briefly on the heat or they\r\nwill quickly lose their\r\nbrightness. Scatter with the\r\nlime garnish and serve\r\nimmediately with boiled rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8198,8198,'en','Super-fast Pad Thai','This classic Thai dish from Good Food reader Emily Cramer is made using mainly storecupboard ingredients, and it’s on the table in under 15 minutes','["200g rice noodles","140g frozen peas","200g frozen prawns","2 tbsp sunflower oil","100g beansprouts","small bunch spring onions, sliced","2 beaten eggs","3 tbsp roasted peanuts","2 tbsp soy sauce","2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","small bunch coriander, leaves only"]','["Bring a pan of water to the boil, add the\r\nnoodles and cook for 3 mins, adding the\r\npeas and prawns for the final min. Drain,\r\nand set aside while you heat the oil in a\r\nlarge frying pan.","Fry the noodles, prawns,\r\npeas, beansprouts and spring onions,\r\ntossing to coat in the oil for a few mins.\r\nPush everything to one side of the pan\r\nand pour in the egg. Stir until cooked,\r\nthen mix everything well. Toss through\r\nthe peanuts, soy and sweet chilli sauce\r\nso everything is combined. Scatter with\r\nthe coriander and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8200,8200,'en','Red curry chicken kebabs','Chicken and kebabs are two of our most popular choices so this former cover star is a real winner – for barbecues or the grill','["2 boneless, skinless chicken breasts, cut into large chunks","2 tbsp Thai red curry paste","2 tbsp coconut milk","1 red pepper, deseeded and chopped into chunks","1 courgette, halved and cut into chunks","1 red onion, cut into large wedges","1 lime, halved, to serve"]','["Fire up the barbecue or heat a griddle pan  to high. Tip chicken, curry paste and coconut  milk into a bowl, then mix well until the  chicken is evenly coated. Thread vegetables  and chicken onto skewers. Cook the skewers \r\non the barbecue or griddle for 5-8 mins,  turning every so often, until the chicken is  cooked through and charred. Serve with herby  rice, salad and a lime half to squeeze over."]','2026-01-10 12:21:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8202,8202,'en','Thai fried rice with prawns & peas','Similar to pad Thai but with better-for-you brown rice, this Asian shellfish pot with egg, coriander and peas is filling and fresh','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 red onion, halved and sliced","2 garlic cloves, sliced","1 red chilli, sliced","250g raw large peeled prawns","300g cooked brown rice (about 140g uncooked rice)","75g frozen peas","1 tbsp dark soy sauce","1 tbsp fish sauce","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped, plus a few leaves to serve","4 large eggs","chilli sauce, to serve (optional- we used sriracha)"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a wok,\r\nadd the onion, garlic and chilli,\r\nand cook for 2-3 mins until golden.\r\nAdd the prawns and cook for\r\n1 min. Tip in the rice and peas,\r\nand keep tossing until very hot.\r\nAdd the soy and fish sauce, then\r\nstir through the chopped coriander.\r\nKeep warm while you fry the eggs.","Heat the remaining oil in a frying\r\npan and fry the eggs with some\r\nseasoning. Divide the fried rice\r\nmix between 4 bowls and top\r\neach with a fried egg. Serve\r\nscattered with coriander, with\r\nchilli sauce, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8204,8204,'en','Thai beef curry','A spicy, authentic Thai green curry for your slow cooker that''s ideal for taking the last-minute stress out of entertaining','["2-3 tbsp groundnut oil","2kg beef short ribs (bone-in ribs left whole), or brisket, cut into large chunks","large bunch coriander","2 lemongrass stalks, 1 bashed, 1 roughly chopped","3 garlic cloves, chopped","1-2 green chillies, roughly chopped, deseeded if you like","2cm-piece galangal or ginger, peeled and chopped","50ml rice wine vinegar","50ml fish sauce","2 tbsp palm or light brown sugar","400g can coconut milk","2 star anise","6 kaffir lime leaves","juice 2 limes, plus wedges to serve"]','["Heat a little of the oil in a large pan and\r\nbrown the beef in batches, removing to\r\na plate after, reserving any juices. If your\r\nslow cooker has a browning function,\r\nuse this instead. Meanwhile, in a mini\r\nchopper or food processor, whizz half\r\nthe coriander, the chopped lemongrass,\r\ngarlic, chillies and galangal with the rest\r\nof the oil until you have a rough paste.","Turn the slow cooker to High. Heat\r\nthe paste for a few mins, then add the\r\nbeef and all the remaining ingredients,\r\napart from the remaining coriander\r\nand lime juice. Turn slow cooker to\r\nLow and cook for 8 hrs, or until the\r\nmeat is falling off the bone.","If using beef ribs, remove bones from\r\nthe beef, then shred the meat with\r\n2 forks. If the sauce is too thin, strain\r\nit off and boil it to reduce. Stir in the\r\nremaining coriander and lime juice, then\r\nseason with more fish sauce or sugar."]','2026-01-10 12:21:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8206,8206,'en','Spicy Thai prawn noodles','These low-fat noodles make for a no-fuss supper and will be on the table in 30 minutes','["200g Thai rice noodles","1 tbsp sesame oil","2 eggs, beaten","1 red chilli, finely chopped","1 thumb-size piece ginger, grated","450g peeled cooked Atlantic prawns","1 tbsp soy sauce","small bunch coriander, roughly chopped","½ small bunch mint, roughly chopped","zest and juice 1 lime","small handful roasted peanuts, chopped"]','["Cook the noodles following the pack\r\ninstructions, drain and set aside for later.\r\nHeat the oil in a large frying pan and\r\npour in the beaten egg. Swirl around the\r\npan to make a thin omelette, cook for\r\n1-2 mins, then flip over and cook the\r\nother side for 1 min. Tip out and slice\r\ninto thin strips.","Add the chilli and ginger to the pan,\r\nfry for 1-2 mins then tip in the noodles,\r\nprawns and egg. Splash in the soy sauce\r\nand stir-fry for 1 min more. Throw in the\r\nchopped herbs and pour over the lime\r\njuice and zest, then sprinkle over the\r\nchopped peanuts and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8208,8208,'en','Thai green chicken soup','Use chicken thighs for this – they are tastier and better value than breasts','["2 tbsp sunflower oil","1 onion, finely chopped","500g pack skinless chicken thigh fillets, finely chopped","4 garlic cloves, finely sliced","285g jar Thai green curry paste","400ml can coconut milk","1¾ l chicken stock","5 kaffir lime leaves","2 tbsp fish sauce","1 bunch spring onions, the white sliced on the diagonal and the green finely chopped","280g pack fine green beans, trimmed and halved","150g pack bamboo shoots","juice 2 limes, plus wedges to serve","small bunch basil"]','["Heat the oil in your largest pan, add the\r\nonion and fry for 3 mins to soften. Add\r\nthe chicken and garlic, and cook until the\r\nchicken changes colour.","Add the curry paste, coconut milk,\r\nstock, lime leaves and fish sauce, then\r\nsimmer for 12 mins. Add the chopped\r\nonion tops, green beans and bamboo\r\nshoots and cook for 4-6 mins, until the\r\nbeans are just tender.","Meanwhile, put the lime juice and\r\nbasil in a narrow jug and blitz with a\r\nhand blender to make a smooth green\r\npaste. Pour into the soup with the\r\nsliced spring onion and heat through.\r\nServe with lime wedges for a light lunch\r\nor supper or as a make-ahead starter."]','2026-01-10 12:21:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8210,8210,'en','Thai spinach bites','These little Thai nibbles are ready in just 10 minutes','["2 segmented and chopped limes","2cm piece chopped ginger","1 finely sliced shallot","½ chopped chilli","1 tbsp coriander leaves","2 tbsp peanuts","dash fish sauce","sprinkle sugar","8-12 baby spinach leaves"]','["Mix together\r\nlimes, ginger, shallot, chilli,\r\ncoriander leaves and\r\npeanuts. Season with a dash of fish\r\nsauce and a sprinkle of sugar.","Lay the spinach leaves on a\r\nplatter. Place a spoonful of the mix on\r\neach, then hand round and get everyone\r\nto roll them up before eating in one bite."]','2026-01-10 12:21:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8212,8212,'en','Thai chicken and sweet potato soup','A smooth and and spicy chicken soup with a vibrant colour that''s packed full of Asian aromatics','["1 tsp olive or rapeseed oil","2 garlic cloves, chopped","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","2cm chunk root ginger, chopped","1 stalk lemongrass, bashed","1 x 25g pack coriander, leaves and stalks chopped separately","2 tbsp red Thai curry paste","750ml chicken stock (made with 2 stock cubes)","1 small can (160ml) coconut cream","500g sweet potatoes, peeled and roughly chopped","2 skinless chicken breasts, sliced","1 lime, juice only","1 tsp sugar","½  tsp fish sauce","crusty bread, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a large saucepan. Add the garlic, chilli, ginger, lemongrass, coriander stalks and curry paste and cook for 2 - 3 minutes until the aromas are released.","Add the chicken stock, coconut cream and sweet potatoes and cook for 15 minutes or until the potatoes are soft. Remove the lemongrass and discard. Carefully transfer to a blender and blitz until smooth. If freezing, for best results freeze at this point, otherwise as an easier option freeze complete recipe.","Return to the saucepan, add the chicken and cook gently for 5 - 10 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.  Stir through the lime juice, sugar and fish sauce, scatter with the coriander leaves and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8214,8214,'en','Fragrant Thai drumsticks','Marinate chicken drummers in aromatic Thai red curry paste and sweet chilli for super tasty fingerfood','["2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","grated zest 1 orange, plus 2 tbsp juice","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tbsp good-quality Thai red curry paste","8 chicken drumsticks, skin removed, the flesh slashed"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6\r\nand line a baking tray with foil. Mix the\r\nchilli sauce with the orange zest and\r\njuice, garlic, curry paste and ¼ tsp salt.\r\nAdd the chicken and coat really well.","Arrange the drumsticks on the foil,\r\nspaced apart. Coat the chicken with any\r\nmarinade left in the bowl, then roast for\r\n35-40 mins until tender. Wrap in foil or\r\npack into a food container."]','2026-01-10 12:21:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8216,8216,'en','Lemongrass beef stew with noodles','Get a taste of South East Asia with this iron-rich, fragrant stir-fry with chilli, ginger, lemongrass and coriander','["1 tbsp ginger, chopped","2 garlic cloves, chooped","3 stalks lemongrass, outer leaves removed, finely chopped","2 tbsp coriander leaves, plus extra to serve","2 red chillies, thinly sliced (leave the seeds in if you like it spicy)","2 tbsp vegetable oil","250g stewing beef, cut into 2½ cm cubes","2 tbsp dark soy sauce","1 tsp five spice powder","1 tsp brown sugar","400ml beef stock","100g wide rice noodles","lime wedges, to serve"]','["Put the ginger, garlic, lemongrass,\r\ncoriander and 1 chilli in a food processor,\r\nthen pulse until puréed. Heat the oil in\r\na pan over a low heat. Add the purée\r\nand cook for 5 mins. Stir in the beef,\r\nsoy, five-spice, sugar and stock. Put on a\r\nlid and bring to the boil, then lower heat\r\nand simmer for 1 hr 15 mins. Remove\r\nthe lid and cook for a further 15 mins\r\nuntil the beef is tender.","Just before serving, prepare noodles\r\nfollowing pack instructions. Drain well,\r\nthen divide between 2 bowls and spoon\r\nover the beef stew. Serve sprinkled with\r\nthe remaining chilli and coriander leaves,\r\nwith lime wedges for squeezing over."]','2026-01-10 12:21:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8218,8218,'en','Ken Hom’s stir-fried chicken with chillies & basil','A traditional Thai dish packed with aromatic flavours, that''s easy to prepare and packed with aromatic flavour','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","450g boneless skinless chicken thighs, cut into chunks","3 tbsp coarsely chopped garlic","3 tbsp finely sliced shallots","3 fresh green or red chillies, seeded and finely shredded","2 tbsp fish sauce (nam pla)","2 tsp dark soy sauce","2 tsp sugar","a large handful of Thai or ordinary basil leaves"]','["Heat a wok or large frying\r\npan until it is very hot, then\r\nadd 1 tbsp of the oil. When it\r\nis very hot, add the chicken\r\nand stir-fry over a high heat for\r\n8-10 minutes, until browned\r\nall over. Using a slotted spoon,\r\ntake the chicken from the pan\r\nand set aside.","Reheat the wok and add the\r\nremaining oil. Toss in the garlic\r\nand shallots and stir fry for 3\r\nminutes, until golden brown.","Return the chicken to the\r\nwok and add the chillies, fish\r\nsauce, dark soy sauce and\r\nsugar. Stir fry over a high heat\r\nfor a further 8-10 minutes or\r\nuntil the chicken is cooked\r\nthrough. Stir in the basil leaves\r\nand serve at once."]','2026-01-10 12:21:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8220,8220,'en','Pepper & halloumi pide','Try this Turkish street food using a shop-bought bread mix for ease. Topped with spiced halloumi and peppers, it’s a tasty lunch to make for the family','["250g ciabatta bread mix","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion , diced","2 garlic cloves , crushed","½ small red pepper , diced","½ small green pepper , diced","½ tsp ground cumin","½ tsp ground cinnamon","handful of parsley , chopped","1 block of halloumi , diced","plain flour , for dusting","25g butter , melted"]','["Make the ciabatta dough following pack instructions and set aside to rise while you make the filling.","Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan over medium heat and fry the onion, garlic and peppers for 10 mins or until soft. Add the spices and some seasoning, and cook for a few minutes, then stir in the parsley and take off the heat. Stir in the halloumi.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Divide the dough into quarters then roll out on a lightly floured surface into long oval shapes (about 22cm x 9cm). Arrange on two baking trays lined with baking parchment. Scatter with the pepper and cheese mix leaving 1cm borders. Pinch at each end to make a slipper shape.","Bake for 20-25 mins or until puffed and golden. Brush the pides all over with melted butter and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8222,8222,'en','Turkish rice (vermicelli rice)','This classic Turkish side dish uses long-grain white rice boosted with chicken broth and toasted vermicelli pasta','["300g long-grain white rice","3 tbsp vegetable oil","70g crushed vermicelli strands","30g unsalted butter","625ml chicken stock , made with one stock cube"]','["Pour the rice into a very large bowl under cold running water and carefully drain the water out of the bowl through a sieve. Repeat a few times until the water in the bowl is clear, then fill the bowl up with cold water and leave rice to soak for 10 mins while you cook the vermicelli.","Put the oil into a medium pan over medium heat. Add the vermicelli and stir continuously until the strands turn a rich golden brown, 2-3 mins. Remove from the heat, stir through the butter until it melts and allow the vermicelli to cool for 1-2 mins.","Drain the rice thoroughly through a sieve. Add the rice to the pan and stir well. Pour the hot stock into the pan, sprinkle in ½ tsp salt, stir well then return the pan to the hob over a high heat. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to the lowest it will go, put the lid on the pan and simmer for 7-9 mins. Remove the pan from the heat, cover with a couple of sheets of kitchen paper or a light tea towel and the pan lid, and let the rice sit in the pan for 10 mins. Fluff up with a fork before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8224,8224,'en','Adana kebab','These Turkish kebabs use minimal ingredients so the flavour of the lamb stands out, complemented by red peppers and spicy pul biber','["2 large red romano peppers , cored, deseeded, and cut into large chunks","800g 20% fat lamb mince","3 tbsp Turkish mild (sweet) red pepper paste","1 tbsp pul biber","3 tbsp sunflower oil"]','["Finely chop the peppers in a food processor, then tip them in a sieve and press into the sieve so that the peppers release all of their juices. Tip into a bowl along with the mince, red pepper paste, pul biber, 1½ tsp flaky sea salt, and 2 tbsp of the oil. Mix together, kneading well for at least 2-3 mins. If you need to, wet your hands with cold water to prevent the mixture from sticking. The mixture should be sticky when ready. Cover and chill for at least 2 hrs, or up to 12 hrs.","When ready to cook, heat the grill to high or an oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 6. Divide the mixture into 12 equal portions, around 85g each. If you’d like to skewer them, divide into 8 equal portions and roll into balls. Using wet hands, thread the balls onto the end of the skewers, massaging the mixture down the skewers in between the palms of your hands, until evenly distributed. Ensure that the mixture is fully wrapped tightly around the skewers without any exposed metal. Alternatively, lay them on a large baking tray lined with parchment paper if cooking in the oven, or foil if cooking under the grill. Shape into 20cm-long köfte. Wet your fingers with a little cold water and make indents all along the köfte for the traditional shape.","Gently brush each köfte with the remaining 1 tbsp oil and cook under the grill, on the top shelf for 10-12 mins, turning regularly, or cook in the oven for 16-18 mins, until crispy on the outside and juicy in the middle"]','2026-01-10 12:21:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8226,8226,'en','Dolma (yalancı dolma)','Enjoy a meat-free version of stuffed vine leaves, with tomatoes and onions. Once you’ve got the knack of the recipe, try experimenting with other fillings','["250g long-grain white rice","6 tbsp extra virgin olive oil","1 large onion , very finely diced","4 tbsp tomato purée","25g fresh mint leaves , finely chopped","30g fresh flat leaf parsley , finely chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 tbsp pomegranate molasses","100ml fresh lemon juice , around 3 lemons","2 tbsp dried mint","1 x 420g vacuum-packed vine leaves"]','["Wash the rice in a sieve under cold running water until the water runs clear, then allow to drain fully in a sieve.","Meanwhile, heat 3 tbsp of the olive oil over a low heat and add the onions. Soften for 15-20 mins until translucent and caramelised. Add 3 tbsp of the tomato purée to the onions, gently breaking it down into the oily juices, around 2 mins. Stir in the rice, coating the grains fully in the tomato and onion mix, then remove the pan from the heat and transfer the contents to a large dish, ours was 22cm. Add the fresh mint and parsley to the dish, along with the chopped tomatoes, pomegranate molasses, lemon juice, dried mint, 1½ tsp fine sea salt and ¾ tsp freshly ground black pepper. Stir to combine, then allow to cool to room temperature. Chill for 1 hr to allow the flavours to come together.","While the mixture is chilling, prepare the vine leaves. Put them in the widest saucepan you have, then wash them thoroughly in cold water 3-4 times. Fill the pan up with cold water, place it on the hob over a medium heat, bring to the boil for 10 mins. Switch off the heat, then cover the pan and leave the leaves to sit in the boiling water for another 10 mins. Carefully drain the hot water from the pan, then fill the pan up with cold water and drain a couple more times to rid the leaves of any brine. Fill the pan up with cold water again so that the leaves are covered – this will make it easier to remove the leaves from the pan without tearing them. Reserve 4-5 large vine leaves for later, then use the rest of them to make the dolma.","Dissolve the remaining 1 tbsp tomato purée in a heatproof jug with 200ml boiling water, then top up with 300ml cold water and stir well.","Lay one vine leaf on a large plate with the widest side of the leaf facing you and the point furthest away. If the leaves still have a stalk attached to them, cut them off. Cover with a heaped teaspoon of the mixture along the widest point, leaving just over 1 cm (½ inch) of space at the sides and along the edge closest to you. Fold this closest edge over the filling, fold in the sides, then roll the dolma away from you until you have a tightly packed cigar-shaped roll.","Add a couple of the reserved leaves at the bottom of a large pan, then lay the rolled dolma (with the pointy end of the leaf facing the underside of the pan to prevent the dolma unravelling while cooking) at the bottom of the pan and repeat with the remaining leaves and filling. Arrange the dolma snugly, but ensure to leave enough space for them to expand while cooking, in layers.","Drizzle the remaining 3 tbsp olive oil into the pan, then cover the dolma with the remaining reserved leaves. Add a couple of heatproof plates on top of the leaves to lightly weigh down the contents of the pan, then pour in just enough of the tomato liquid so that it comes just over the rim of the plates by 2 cm (¾ inch). Feel free to top up with a little more water if the quantity of liquid is not quite enough, or hold back if it is too much. Set the pan over a medium heat, bring to the boil, then reduce the heat as low as possible. Put the lid on the pan and cook for around 20-25 mins until most of the water has reduced, but you can still see a small amount bubbling away. Remove the pan from the heat and allow to cool for at least 2 hrs (preferably a few more) before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8228,8228,'en','Turkish egg flatbreads','Enjoy these Turkish egg flatbreads for a quick and easy lunch or supper. Make sure you crack the eggs into hot oil to get a lovely, crispy bottom','["175g 0% fat Greek yogurt","1 garlic clove, grated","½ lemon, zested","1 ½ tsp za’atar","small handful of parsley, finely chopped","2 flatbreads","1 tbsp olive oil","2 eggs","30g vegetarian feta, crumbled","25g green olives, sliced","large pinch of Aleppo chilli flakes or chilli oil (optional)","½ cucumber, halved, deseeded and finely sliced"]','["Combine the yogurt with the garlic, lemon zest, half the za’atar, half the parsley and some salt and pepper. Heat a dryfrying panover a medium heat and brush the flatbreads lightly with a little of the oil. Fry each side for 1 min, then transfer to two plates and set aside.","Heat the remaining olive oil in the pan. Once very hot, crack the eggs into the pan and fry for a few minutes until the white is set and the edges are crisp. Spread the spiced yogurt evenly over the two flatbreads and top with the crispy eggs, feta, olives, remaining parsley and za''atar, chilli, if using, and the cucumbers on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:21:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8230,8230,'en','Pistachio katmer','Try this fabulous Turkish dessert of ice cream sandwiched between filo pastry and sprinkled with pistachio nuts. Serve the katmer with fresh fruit','["2 sheets filo pastry, about 37 x 30cm each","30g unsalted butter, melted","80g shelled pistachios, toasted and roughly ground, plus a little more to decorate","4 tbsp caster sugar","40g clotted cream","4 scoops vanilla ice cream","grapefruit or orange segments (or other fresh fruit), to serve"]','["Take 1 sheet of filo and brush with a little melted butter. Sprinkle over half the pistachios to form a square measuring about 12 x 12cm in the centre of the sheet. Sprinkle over half the sugar and dot half the clotted cream on top of the pistachios. Starting at the top left corner, fold the corner into the centre, then fold the bottom right corner into the centre. Fold the two remaining corners into the centre, overlapping them slightly to end up with a square.","Put a large frying pan on a medium-high heat and brush with half the remaining melted butter, then lay the katmer in the pan seam-side down. Cook on either side for 1-2 mins or until golden and crisp. Repeat the process for the other katmer.","Cut the crisped katmer in half, so you have four pieces. Divide the ice cream between two of them, lightly pressing it down, then top with the remaining pieces of pastry to make two sandwiches. Halve them again to make four pieces. Serve straightaway, sprinkled with more pistachios, grapefruit segments or other seasonal fruit."]','2026-01-10 12:21:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8232,8232,'en','Simit bread','Simit breads are sesame bread rings, which look similar to bagels. They are sold on every street corner in Turkey and are popular for breakfast or as a snack','["250g strong white bread flour","1 tsp salt","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tsp (5g) fast-action dried yeast","100g sesame seeds","1 tbsp pomegranate molasses or molasses syrup"]','["Tip the flour, salt and sugar into a bowl and mix together. Add the yeast and 150ml warm water, mix, then knead for a few mins to bring everything together into a soft dough. Tip onto your work surface and continue kneading for 10-12 mins until the dough feels stretchy. Return to a clean bowl, cover and leave to rise for an hour or two until doubled in size.","Meanwhile, toast the sesame seeds in a dry frying pan until golden. Set aside in the pan. Mix the molasses syrup or pomegranate molasses with 50ml water in a wide shallow bowl.","Divide the dough into four equal pieces. Roll each into a sausage about 45cm long. Flip the rope of dough back on itself then twist the two strands and loop into a ring, squeezing the ends together to secure. Once shaped, dip each piece into the molasses water, turning to coat, then into the sesame seeds, making sure each one is well covered. Transfer to a baking tray, cover and leave to prove for another 45 mins-1 hr. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","When the breads have puffed up, uncover them and bake for 15-18 mins until golden. Cool, then wrap in a tea towel to keep them fresh. Can be made up to a day ahead and warmed gently before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8234,8234,'en','Chicken wings with cumin, lemon & garlic','Pick up a few extras from the deli and turn this into a Middle Eastern mezze spread to share with friends','["12 chicken wing","2 garlic clove, crushed","zest and juice 1 lemon","1 tsp cumin seed","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp honey"]','["Using a pair of sharp kitchen scissors, cut each wing at the knuckle into two pieces. Mix the garlic, lemon zest and juice, cumin and oil with plenty of seasoning, then tip into a dish with the chicken wings and toss to coat. Cover and put in the fridge to marinate for at least 1 hr, or overnight if you have time.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, or heat an outdoor barbecue. Bake the chicken wings on an oven tray for 45-50 mins until crisp, or barbecue for 20 mins, drizzling over the honey for the final 10 mins of each method. Serve on a platter with plenty of paper napkins. Fill small bowls with olives, pistachios or almonds, dates and pickled chillies and flatbreads to serve alongside, along with the dishes below."]','2026-01-10 12:21:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8235,8235,'en','Dark chocolate & orange cake','A dense, dark and devilishly delicious cake, this will be gone before you know it','["1 Seville orange","a little melted butter, for greasing","100g plain chocolate, broken into pieces","3 eggs","280g caster sugar","240ml sunflower oil","25g cocoa powder","250g plain flour","1½ tsp baking powder","orange candied peel, to decorate","200g plain chocolate, broken into pieces","225ml double cream"]','["Pierce the orange with a skewer (right through). Cook in boiling water for 30 minutes until soft. Whizz the whole orange in a food processor until smooth; let cool.","Preheat the oven to 180C/gas 4/fan 160C.Grease and line the base of a 23cm/9in round cake tin. Melt the chocolate in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water or in the microwave for 2 minutes on High, stirring after 1 minute. Let cool.","In a large bowl, lightly beat the eggs, sugar and oil. Gradually beat in the puréed orange, discarding any pips, then stir in the cooled melted chocolate. Sift in the cocoa, flour and baking powder. Mix well and pour into the tin. Bake in the centre of the oven for 55 minutes, or until the cake springs back when lightly pressed in the middle. (Check after 45 minutes and cover with foil if it is browning too much.) Allow to cool for 10 minutes in the tin, then turn out on to a wire rack to cool completely.","Make the chocolate ganache: put the chocolate into a heatproof bowl. Bring the cream to the boil and pour over the chocolate. Leave for 2 minutes, then stir until smooth. Set aside until firm enough to spread over the cake – up to 1½ hours.","Transfer the cake to a serving plate. Using a palette knife, swirl the ganache over the top. Decorate with strips of candied orange peel."]','2026-01-10 12:21:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8236,8236,'en','Baked aubergine stuffed with roast pumpkin, feta & walnut with minted courgettes','New Zealand chef Peter Gordon showcases seasonal flavours in this impressive, healthy vegetarian meal','["2 large aubergines","200g/7oz pumpkin or squash (try kabocha or butternut squash)","100g red onions, thinly sliced","1 tsp cumin seeds (or use slightly less ground cumin)","2 garlic cloves, thinly sliced","4 tbsp virgin rapeseed or olive oil","2 tsp fresh herbs (thyme, oregano, sage or rosemary work well)","100g feta cheese, diced","large handful walnuts, lightly toasted and halved","4 courgettes","1 lemon","2 tsp extra-virgin olive oil","small handful mint leaves, chopped","small handful flat-leaf parsley, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nCut the aubergines in half lengthways,\r\nleaving the stem in place (this can be\r\nremoved when eating). Using a small\r\nsharp knife, scoop out the inner flesh\r\nleaving a shell about 1cm thick. Chop\r\nthe flesh and put into a bowl.","Peel the pumpkin or squash, remove\r\nthe seeds, then cut into 1-2cm dice and\r\nmix with the chopped aubergine and red\r\nonion. Mix in the cumin, garlic and 2 tbsp\r\noil and toss together with some salt and\r\nblack pepper. Lay on a baking tray lined\r\nwith parchment paper. Rub 1 tbsp oil over\r\nthe aubergine halves and season. Place,\r\ncut-side down, on another tray lined with\r\nparchment paper. Bake for 15-20 mins,\r\nuntil the pumpkin and aubergine shells\r\nare almost cooked through.","Tip the pumpkin mixture back into the\r\nbowl and stir through the mixed herbs,\r\nfeta and walnuts. Turn over the aubergine\r\nhalves, then pile up the mixture inside.\r\nDrizzle with the remaining 1 tbsp oil and\r\nbake for 20 mins, at which point the\r\npumpkin will be fully cooked. If it starts to\r\ncolour too much, cover loosely with foil.","Meanwhile, make the courgette salad.\r\nTop and tail the courgettes, then slice\r\nvery thinly into wide ribbons. Toss with\r\nthe zest, juice of half the lemon and the\r\noil. Leave for 10 mins to let the\r\ncourgettes soften a little.","To serve, toss the herbs through the\r\ncourgettes and cut the remaining lemon\r\nhalf into wedges. Place an aubergine half\r\non each plate, pile up the salad beside it\r\nand serve with a lemon wedge."]','2026-01-10 12:21:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8238,8238,'en','DIY kofta burgers','With these quick, easy and cheap koftas, there''s no excuse for hitting the kebab van','["1kg lamb mince","2 onions, coarsely grated","1 garlic bulb, broken into cloves and finely chopped or grated","6 tbsp garam masala","bunch coriander, chopped (optional)","1 tbsp chilli sauce, plus extra to serve","8 pitta breads","4 tomatoes, halved and sliced","half a red cabbage, shredded","1 red onion, sliced (optional)","small pot plain yogurt"]','["Tip the mince into a large bowl (use a\r\nclean washing-up bowl if you don’t have\r\nanything big enough) with all the other\r\nburger ingredients and a good pinch of salt.\r\nRoll up your sleeves, get your hands into the\r\nmix and squelch everything together through\r\nyour fingers until completely mixed. Pat the\r\nmix into 16 small burgers. These may now\r\nbe frozen for up to 1 month or chilled up\r\nto a day ahead.","To cook, heat grill to its highest setting and\r\nlay the burgers in a single layer on a baking\r\ntray (you may need to do this in batches,\r\ndepending on how big your tray is). Grill on\r\nthe highest shelf for 5-6 mins on each side\r\nuntil browned and cooked through. Pile\r\nburgers onto a platter and serve with all\r\nthe accompaniments, so everyone can\r\nconstruct their own sandwich."]','2026-01-10 12:21:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8240,8240,'en','Spiced lamb & feta gozleme with special tomato sauce','A savoury Turkish pastry that’s actually made with bread. Stuff with lamb, feta, raisins and pine nuts and serve with pomegranate dip','["7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp golden caster sugar","250g plain flour","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra to finish","500g pack lamb mince","2 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp mild chilli powder","50g raisins","zest 1 lemon","3 spring onions, finely sliced","50g toasted pine nuts","100g feta cheese","8 tbsp tomato ketchup","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses","1 tbsp very finely chopped red onion"]','["For the dough, mix the yeast, sugar\r\nand 175ml lukewarm water in a small\r\nbowl. Stir to dissolve the yeast, then\r\nset aside for 10 mins, or until the liquid\r\nstarts to froth.","Mix the flour with ½ tsp salt in a big\r\nbowl. Make a well in the centre, pour\r\nin the yeasty mixture and olive oil, and\r\nmix to a dough. Knead for 10 mins,\r\nthen put the dough in a lightly oiled\r\nbowl and cover with oiled cling film.\r\nLeave somewhere quite warm until\r\ndoubled in size.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Heat the\r\noil in a frying pan, add the mince and\r\nfry, breaking up lumps as you go, until\r\nwell browned. Stir in the garlic, spices\r\nand raisins, and fry for a few more mins,\r\nthen turn off the heat and stir in the\r\nlemon zest, spring onions, pine nuts\r\nand seasoning. Set aside to cool a little.","Divide the dough into 4. Working a\r\npiece at a time, roll out on a lightly\r\nfloured surface to 25 x 30cm, without\r\nthe dough splitting. With a long edge\r\nof the pastry laying in front of you, spoon\r\n¼ of the mince on the bottom half –\r\nleaving a 2cm border all round. Crumble\r\nover ¼ of the feta. Fold the other half of\r\nthe dough over the filling, folding in and\r\npinching the edges to seal in the lamb.\r\nRepeat with the remaining ingredients.","Heat a large frying pan over a high heat\r\nand brush the gozleme all over with oil.","Cook in batches for 3-5 mins on each\r\nside, or until golden and heated through.\r\nQuickly mix the tomato ketchup,\r\npomegranate and onion, and serve with\r\nthe hot, crispy gozleme."]','2026-01-10 12:21:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8242,8242,'en','Imam bayildi with BBQ lamb & tzatziki','There are hundreds of versions of this Turkish aubergine dish. It is authentically quite oily, but reduce the oil if you prefer','["3 aubergines","2 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for brushing","1 Spanish onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp cinnamon","8 ripe tomatoes, peeled","small bunch flat-leaf parsley, chopped","12 lamb chops or cutlets","paprika, for seasoning","1 lemon, halved","150g tub Greek yogurt","½ cucumber, seeds scooped out, grated","2 tbsp chopped mint"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nHalve the aubergines lengthways and\r\nscore the flesh side deeply, brush with a\r\ngood layer of olive oil and put on a baking\r\nsheet. Roast for 20 mins or until the flesh\r\nis soft enough to scoop out.","Fry the onion in a little oil until soft, add\r\nthe garlic and cinnamon and fry for 1 min.\r\nOnce the aubergines are cool enough to\r\nhandle, scoop out the centres. Roughly\r\nchop the flesh and add it to the onions.\r\nHalve the tomatoes, scoop the seeds\r\nand juice into a sieve set over a bowl,\r\nthen chop the flesh. Add the chopped\r\ntomatoes to the pan and cook everything\r\nfor 10 mins until nice and soft. Add a little\r\nmore oil if you need to. Stir in the parsley,\r\nleaving a little for scattering at the end.","Lay the aubergine halves in a baking\r\ndish and divide the tomato mixture\r\nbetween them. Pour over the juice from\r\nthe tomatoes, drizzle with more olive oil\r\nand bake for 30 mins until the aubergines\r\nhave collapsed.","Meanwhile, mix the tzatziki ingredients\r\ntogether and put in a small serving bowl.","Season the lamb with salt, black\r\npepper and a pinch of paprika. Griddle,\r\ngrill or barbecue for 3 mins on each side\r\nor until the fat is nicely browned, then\r\nput in a serving dish and squeeze over\r\nthe lemon halves. Scatter the aubergines\r\nwith parsley, then serve with the lamb\r\nand tzatziki."]','2026-01-10 12:21:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8244,8244,'en','Almond & honey pastries with orange cream','Serve these prepare-ahead puds with coffee, dessert wine or fresh mint tea for a real after-dinner treat','["200g whole blanched almonds, toasted and roughly chopped","85g icing sugar, plus extra to serve","85g butter, melted","2 tsp orange flower water","1 tsp cinnamon","1 egg yolk","190g pack brik pastry","clear honey, to serve","zest 1 orange","300g Greek yogurt","300ml tub double cream","2 tbsp icing sugar, sifted"]','["Set aside a quarter of the almonds. Put\r\nthe rest in a food processor with the icing\r\nsugar, half the butter, orange blossom\r\nwater, cinnamon and egg yolk. Whizz to\r\na paste. Scrape into a bowl and stir in\r\nmost of the remaining chopped nuts.","Unroll one sheet of brik pastry at a\r\ntime, brush all over with melted butter\r\nand halve into 2 semi-circles. Shape\r\n1 heaped tbsp of the nut mixture to look\r\nlike a thin wedge shape along half the\r\npastry edge you’ve just cut (leaving 2.5cm\r\nborder on the rounded side), so it looks\r\nas if you’re cutting the semi-circle of\r\npastry into pieces like a cake. Roll up like\r\na pastry cone, sealing the nut mixture\r\ninside, then brush all over with more butter\r\nand fold over the open, wide end to seal.\r\nSit on a baking tray, end flap side down to\r\nhelp it stay closed, and repeat until nut\r\nmixture is used up. Cover with cling film\r\nand chill. Put zest, yogurt, cream and icing\r\nsugar in a mixing bowl. Cover and chill.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, put the pastries in and bake for 15 mins\r\nuntil golden and crisp. Just before they’re\r\nready, beat together the yogurt mixture\r\nuntil thick. Pile pastries onto a serving\r\ndish, drizzle with honey and scatter with\r\nremaining nuts. Serve with the orange\r\ncream and Honeyed orange & grapefruit (see ''Goes well with'')."]','2026-01-10 12:21:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8246,8246,'en','Lamb & apricot meatballs','No one can resist meatballs, and this recipe is so moreish you might want to make double and freeze for another time','["2 tbsp olive oil","2 red onions, very finely chopped","4 garlic cloves, crushed","2 tsp each ground cumin and coriander (or 4 tsp Moroccan spice blend)","400g can chopped tomatoes","½ tsp sugar","½ 20g pack mint, finely chopped","500g pack lean lamb mince","8 dried apricots, finely chopped","50g fresh breadcrumbs","pitta bread and salad, to serve"]','["Heat 2 tsp oil in a pan and soften the\r\nonions for 5 mins. Add the garlic and\r\nspices and cook for a few mins more.\r\nSpoon half the onion mixture into a bowl\r\nand set aside to cool. Add the tomatoes,\r\nsugar and seasoning to the remaining\r\nonions in the pan and simmer for about\r\n10 mins until reduced.","Meanwhile, add the mint, lamb,\r\napricots and breadcrumbs to the cooled\r\nonions, season and mix well with your\r\nhands. Shape into little meatballs.","Heat the rest of the oil in a non-stick\r\npan and fry the meatballs until golden\r\n(in batches if you need to). Stir in the\r\nsauce with a splash of water and gently\r\ncook everything for a few mins until\r\nthe meatballs are cooked through.\r\nServe with pitta bread and salad."]','2026-01-10 12:21:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8248,8248,'en','Hot cumin lamb wrap with crunchy slaw & spicy mayo','A healthy kebab flatbread – make double the cabbage and carrot coleslaw and have leftovers for lunch','["4 small lamb leg steaks","2 tsp olive oil","1 heaped tsp ground cumin","1 tbsp sugar","3 tbsp white wine vinegar","2 carrots, coarsely grated","2 spring onions, finely sliced","400g/14oz white cabbage, very finely sliced","5 sweet peppadew peppers, 2 roughly sliced","3 tbsp mayonnaise","4 large pitta or flatbreads, warmed"]','["Heat a griddle pan. Rub the lamb steaks\r\nwith the oil, cumin and some seasoning.\r\nGriddle for about 3-4 mins on each side\r\nor until cooked to your liking. Place to one\r\nside on a plate to rest.","In a large bowl, stir the sugar into the\r\nvinegar until dissolved. Add the carrots,\r\nspring onions, cabbage and some\r\nseasoning, and toss together.","Blitz the whole peppers and the mayo\r\nin a food processor. Add a heap of the\r\nsalad to each flatbread. Slice the lamb,\r\ntrimming off any excess fat and lay on\r\ntop of the salad, drizzling with the resting\r\njuices. Spoon over the mayo and scatter\r\nwith a few of the sliced peppers. Roll up\r\nand eat. If using pitta, split and stuff.\r\nServe any extra salad on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:21:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8250,8250,'en','Aubergine & hummus grills','Try something new with aubergines and make them the main part of your meal with this veggie dish','["2 aubergines, thickly sliced lengthways","2 tbsp vegetable oil, plus extra for brushing","3 slices brown or white bread, crusts removed","300g tub houmous","100g walnuts, toasted","half an 80g pack flat-leaf parsley, leaves roughly chopped","200g pack cherry tomatoes, quartered","juice ½ lemon","splash extra-virgin olive oil"]','["Lay the aubergine out in one layer on a large baking sheet. Brush sparingly with vegetable oil, then season generously. Grill for 15 mins, turning twice and brushing with oil until the slices are softened and cooked through. Meanwhile, whizz the bread into crumbs. Add 2 tsp oil and whizz briefly again, to coat.","Spread a couple of tsps of houmous on top of each slice of aubergine. Tip the breadcrumbs onto a large plate, then press the houmous side of the aubergines into the crumbs to coat. Grill again, crumb-side up, for about 3 mins until golden.","Toss the walnuts, parsley and cherry tomatoes in a bowl, season, then add the lemon juice and olive oil and toss again. Serve the grills with the salad, a dollop more houmous and some pitta bread."]','2026-01-10 12:21:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8252,8252,'en','Roast aubergine with goat’s cheese & toasted flatbread','Punchy flavours and plenty of crunch – you won’t even notice you’re eating a superhealthy salad','["2 aubergines, thinly sliced lengthways","3 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","12 cherry tomatoes, halved","1 Middle Eastern flatbread or pitta","3 tbsp balsamic vinegar","handful mint leaves","2 shallots, 1 finely chopped, the other thinly sliced","1 red chilli, finely chopped","50g goat''s cheese, crumbled","handful wild rocket, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nBrush the aubergine slices with 1 tbsp\r\nof the oil, then season. Arrange on a\r\nbaking tray or sheet and roast for 20 mins\r\nuntil browned, popping the tomatoes on\r\nthe tray for the final 5 mins. Tear the\r\nflatbread into pieces and place on a\r\nseparate baking sheet. Brown in the oven\r\nfor 8 mins, or until crisp, then remove.","For the dressing, in a small bowl, mix\r\nthe vinegar, mint, chopped shallots, chilli,\r\nremaining oil and some salt and pepper.","Scatter the aubergine slices, tomatoes,\r\nsliced shallot and crisp flatbread into a\r\nserving bowl. Pour over the dressing,\r\nsprinkle with the goat’s cheese and\r\nscatter over a little rocket."]','2026-01-10 12:21:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8254,8254,'en','Grilled lamb with wintry rice salad','A taste-packed and superhealthy supper. Leftovers are great for lunch, too','["2 red onions","1 tsp cinnamon","1 tbsp olive oil","400g lean lamb steak","140g wild and basmati rice","handful mint, chopped","handful parsley, chopped","120g pack fresh pomegranate seeds","50g chopped pistachios","50g dried cranberries","juice ½ orange","juice ½ lemon"]','["Grate 1 onion into a shallow dish,\r\nadd the cinnamon and ½ tbsp olive oil,\r\nthen mix. Place the lamb steaks in the\r\ndish, rub in the marinade, then cover\r\nand set aside while you make the rice.","Place the rice and 600ml water in a\r\npan. Bring to the boil, then turn down\r\nand simmer, covered, until all the water\r\nhas evaporated – about 20 mins. Take\r\noff the lid and cool. Finely chop the\r\nremaining red onion and mix into the\r\nrice along with the herbs, pomegranate,\r\npistachios and cranberries. Finally mix\r\nin the orange and lemon juice, the\r\nremaining olive oil and season well.","Remove the lamb from the marinade,\r\nshaking off any excess. Griddle for about\r\n5 mins on each side, depending on how\r\nyou like your meat, and serve with a\r\nbig spoonful of rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8256,8256,'en','Griddled aubergines with sesame dressing','Dress chargrilled aubergine with tahini, garlic, coriander and yoghurt for a versatile veggie side dish that you can cook on the hob or bbq','["2 large aubergines, cut into 2cm slices","2 tbsp olive oil","250g full-fat Greek yogurt","3 tbsp tahini paste","1 large garlic clove, crushed","juice 1 lemon","handful chopped coriander, parsley and mint, plus extra leaves to serve"]','["Brush each aubergine slice with some\r\noil, then season. Heat a griddle pan\r\nor barbecue. When hot, griddle the\r\naubergine slices for 2-3 mins on each\r\nside until golden brown and tender.","Mix the yogurt with the tahini, garlic,\r\nlemon juice and herbs, then season.\r\nTop the aubergines with the dressing\r\nand scatter over extra herb leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:21:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8258,8258,'en','Smoked aubergine purée','This is great served with grilled meat or chicken and also makes a simple lunch for vegetarians','["2 medium aubergines","juice 1 lemon","2-3 garlic cloves, crushed","150ml pot thick yogurt","small bunch dill, leaves chopped"]','["Heat grill to very hot. Slice the aubergines in\r\nhalf lengthways, then grill for 25 mins, turning\r\noccasionally, until soft – the skin will remain firm,\r\nbut the flesh will soften. Lift the aubergines off\r\nthe grill and leave until cool enough to handle.","Using a sharp knife, score the grilled flesh\r\nand scoop out the flesh with a spoon. Tip into a\r\nbowl and mash with a fork until you get a thick\r\npulp. Beat in the lemon juice and garlic. Add the\r\nyogurt and dill, and season. Serve while still warm."]','2026-01-10 12:21:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8260,8260,'en','Minty lamb flatbreads','Serve these Turkish-style pizzas for a simple, speedy supper for friends','["400g lamb mince","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","2 handfuls mint leaves, half chopped","2 large tomatoes, deseeded and diced","4 small khobez flatbreads or 4 soft flour tortillas (you can buy khobez flatbreads from larger Sainsbury''s)","4 tbsp low-fat natural yogurt"]','["Cook the lamb mince for 5-6 mins in\r\na non-stick frying pan over a high heat.\r\nWhen starting to brown, stir in the garlic\r\nand spices, then cook for 2-3 mins more\r\nuntil the mince is brown and there is no\r\nliquid left in the pan. Stir in the chopped\r\nmint, tomatoes and some seasoning.","Heat the grill to high. Arrange the\r\nflatbreads on a baking tray and spread\r\nthe mince mixture over them. Grill for\r\n2-3 mins. To serve, scatter over the whole\r\nmint leaves and drizzle with yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:21:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8261,8262,'en','Aubergine couscous salad','A handful of mint leaves really brings this salad alive, veggies will love it, but if you do need some meat lamb cutlets are the perfect addition','["1 large aubergine, sliced into 1cm rounds","3 tbsp olive oil","140g couscous","225ml hot vegetable stock","200g cherry tomatoes, halved","handful mint leaves, roughly chopped","100g log firm goat''s cheese, cubed","juice 1?2 lemon"]','["Heat grill to high. Put the aubergine on a\r\nbaking sheet, brush with oil and season. Grill\r\nfor about 15 mins, turning and brushing with\r\nmore oil halfway, until browned and softened.","Meanwhile, tip the couscous into a large\r\nbowl, pour over the stock, then cover and\r\nleave for 10 mins. Mix the tomatoes, mint,\r\ngoat’s cheese and remaining oil together. Fluff\r\nthe couscous up with a fork, then stir in the\r\naubergines, tomato mixture and lemon juice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8263,8263,'en','Slow-roast lamb with cinnamon, fennel & citrus','For lamb that will melt in your mouth and surprise your palate, follow Sarah Cook''s easy recipe','["1 leg of lamb","zest and juice 1 lemon and 1 orange","4 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp clear honey","1 tbsp each of cinnamon, fennel seeds, ground cumin","3 garlic cloves, crushed"]','["Put the lamb into a large food bag with\r\nall the juice and marinate overnight.","The next day, take the lamb out of the\r\nfridge 1 hr before you want to cook it.\r\nHeat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Take\r\nthe lamb out of the marinade (reserve\r\nremaining marinade) and pat dry. Rub with\r\nhalf the oil and roast for 15-20 mins until\r\nbrowned. Remove lamb and reduce oven\r\nto 160C/140C fan/gas 3.","Mix the zests, remaining oil, honey,\r\nspices and garlic with plenty of seasoning.\r\nLay a large sheet of baking parchment on\r\na large sheet of foil. Sit the lamb leg on\r\ntop, rub all over with the paste and pull\r\nup the sides of the foil. Drizzle marinade\r\ninto base, and scrunch foil to seal.","Roast for 4 hrs, until very tender. Rest,\r\nstill wrapped, for 30 mins. Unwrap and\r\nserve with juices."]','2026-01-10 12:21:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8265,8265,'en','Smoky chicken skewers','A tapas-style canapé of marinated and grilled chicken kebabs, best served with smoked garlic mayonnaise dip','["6 boneless, skinless chicken thighs (about 500g/1lb 2oz)","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tsp fennel seed, crushed","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp sweet smoked paprika (pimenton)","1 garlic clove, crushed","1 tsp red wine vinegar","smoky aïoli, to serve (see tips below)"]','["You need 15 skewers: if wooden, soak\r\nin water for 10 mins. Cut chicken into\r\n3cm pieces and place in a bowl. Add\r\n1 tbsp olive oil, the spices, garlic and\r\nvinegar, toss well and season. You can\r\ndo this up to a day before and refrigerate.","Thread 2-3 pieces on each skewer.\r\nPour remaining oil in a frying pan or rub\r\nonto a griddle pan. Get the pan hot and\r\nsear the chicken for 3-4 mins on each\r\nside – you may have to do this in batches,\r\nkeeping the cooked skewers warm in a\r\nlow oven. Serve with smoky aïoli if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8267,8267,'en','Roasted chicken with creamy walnut sauce','This Turkish-inspired sauce makes a wonderful alternative to a classic bread sauce','["8 chicken thighs, skin on and bone in","1 tsp cumin","½ tsp paprika","2 tbsp olive oil","6 pitta breads","150ml hot chicken stock","175g walnuts","1 small onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","50ml single cream","juice 1 lemon","handful coriander, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nIn a roasting tin, toss together the\r\nchicken, cumin, paprika, 1 tbsp olive oil\r\nand seasoning. Cook for 40 mins until\r\nthe chicken is crisp and cooked through.","Meanwhile, tear up 1 pitta bread and\r\nplace in a small bowl. Pour over a couple\r\nof tbsp chicken stock and leave to soak.\r\nDry-fry the walnuts in a frying pan for\r\nabout 3 mins until golden and toasted.\r\nSet aside. Heat the remaining oil in the\r\npan and cook the onion and garlic until\r\nsoftened. Place the softened pitta bread,\r\nonion mixture and most of the nuts into\r\na blender. Pour over the rest of the\r\nchicken stock and whizz together until\r\na rough paste forms. Return the mixture\r\nto the pan. Add the cream and lemon\r\njuice, season and keep warm.","When the chicken is cooked, arrange\r\non a platter. Stir the coriander through\r\nthe sauce and spoon into a bowl. Roughly\r\nchop the remaining walnuts and scatter\r\nover the chicken. Toast the pittas, cut\r\ninto wedges and serve alongside"]','2026-01-10 12:21:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8269,8269,'en','Walnut, date & honey cake','A tea-time treat – packed with sweet honey. A great way to use up those ripe bananas too','["225g self-raising flour","½ tsp ground cinnamon","175g softened butter","100g light muscovado sugar","3 tbsp clear honey","2 eggs, beaten","2 medium, ripe bananas, about 250g/9oz total weight in their skins","100g stoned dates","50g pack walnut pieces"]','["Preheat the oven to 160C/Gas 3/fan oven 140C. Line the base and long sides of a 900g/2lb loaf tin with greaseproof paper, buttering the tin and paper.","Tip the flour, cinnamon, butter, sugar, 2 tablespoons of the honey and the eggs into a large mixing bowl. Mash the bananas and chop the dates (kitchen scissors are easiest for this) and add to the bowl. Beat the mixture for 2-3 minutes, using a wooden spoon or hand-held mixer, until well blended.","Spoon into the prepared tin and level the top. Scatter the walnut pieces over. Bake for 1 hour, then lightly press the top – it will feel firm if cooked. If not, bake for a further 10 minutes.","Cool for 15 minutes, then lift out of the tin using the paper. When cold, drizzle the remaining honey over. Cut into thick slices."]','2026-01-10 12:21:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8272,8272,'en','Vietnamese egg coffee','This sweet after-dinner coffee is like drinking liquid tiramisu and is our new favourite caffeinated treat','["4 egg yolks","150ml condensed milk","1 tsp vanilla extract","200ml strong espresso (approx 4 x double espressos)","dark chocolate, grated (optional)"]','["Put the egg yolks, condensed milk and vanilla extract in a large mixing bowl. Whisk with electric beaters for at least 5 mins or until pale and foamy.","Put 4 heatproof glasses or ramekins into slightly larger bowls that have been half-filled with boiling water (this will keep the coffee in the glasses hot for longer).","Pour the freshly brewed coffee into the glasses, reserving 2 tbsp, then top with scoops of the egg mixture. Drizzle the remaining coffee on top so that it stains the topping and sinks in. Scatter over a pinch of the grated dark chocolate, if you like. Serve immediately, with spoons."]','2026-01-10 12:21:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8274,8274,'en','Vietnamese pork & peanut burgers','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyMix up your midweek menu with these Asian-style burgers, made from pork mince and flavoured with oyster sauce, ginger and lime','["500g pork mince","2 tbsp oyster sauce","6 spring onions, trimmed and finely chopped (both green and white parts)","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and finely grated","½ -1 tsp chilli flakes","1 lime, zested and cut into wedges","1 tbsp sesame or sunflower oil","iceberg or Baby Gem lettuce leaves, to serve","4 sesame burger buns","25g roasted unsalted peanuts, roughly chopped","mayonnaise or sweet chilli sauce, to serve (optional)"]','["In a large bowl, mix together the pork, oyster sauce, spring onions, ginger, chilli flakes and lime zest. Shape the mixture into 4 patties using your hands. Heat the oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat, add the patties and cook for 8 mins each side until cooked through.","To serve, put lettuce leaves on the bottom halves of the buns and squeeze over a little lime juice. Add the burgers, sprinkle over the peanuts and cover with the top halves of the buns. Serve with the remaining lime wedges and mayonnaise or sweet chilli sauce, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8276,8276,'en','Vietnamese-style caramel pork','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyStir-fry chunks of pork with shallots, ginger and chilli in a wok then add fish sauce and brown sugar for a sweet, sticky and spicy sauce','["1½  tbsp groundnut oil","500g pork shoulder steaks, cut into bite-sized chunks","2 shallots, finely chopped","1 tbsp finely grated ginger","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","75g brown sugar","1 tbsp fish sauce, plus extra to taste","1-2 tsp chilli sauce (we used sriracha)","4 spring onions, halved and shredded lengthways","steamed rice, to serve","pak choi, to serve"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a wok over a high heat and stir-fry the pork in batches until browned all over. Remove with a slotted spoon and set aside.","Turn the heat right down and add the remaining oil, then stir in the shallots, ginger and chilli. Cook over a low heat for a couple of mins until just starting to soften. Add the sugar, fish sauce and 200ml water to the pan and stir everything together. Bring to the boil, stirring, so that the sugar dissolves, then return the pork to the pan. Bubble vigorously for 8-10 mins until the sauce thickens to coat the meat and become glossy. Taste and stir in a little more fish sauce, if needed, along with the chilli sauce. Sprinkle with the spring onions and serve with steamed rice and pak choi."]','2026-01-10 12:21:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8278,8278,'en','Sticky pork belly with Vietnamese-style salad & smashed peanuts','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyFlavour pork with hoisin, honey, soy and ginger and serve with a crunchy cucumber, radish and herb salad with zesty chilli dressing','["600g pork belly","6 tbsp hoisin sauce","3 tbsp clear honey","3 tbsp rice vinegar","3 tbsp soy sauce","4 tbsp tomato ketchup","2½ cm piece ginger, peeled and finely chopped","Coconut rice, to serve (see see tip, below)","¼ cucumber, cut into ribbons using a vegetable peeler","6 radish, sliced","75g sugar snap pea, halved horizontally","2 spring onion, thinly sliced","2 tbsp mint leaves, large leaves torn","2 tbsp Thai basil, large leaves torn (use coriander if you can''t find this)","1 tbsp salted peanut, toasted and lightly smashed in a pestle and mortar","1 small red chilli, finely chopped","½  garlic clove, grated","juice ½ lime (leftover from crab cakes)","1½  tsp light brown sugar","1 tbsp rice vinegar"]','["Remove the rind from the pork and put the meat in a large sealable food bag or casserole dish. In a bowl, mix the hoisin, honey, vinegar, soy, ketchup and ginger, then pour over the pork and massage well. Seal the bag or cover the dish and leave to marinate in the fridge for at least 4 hrs, or overnight.","Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Transfer the pork and its marinade to a snug roasting tin, lined with foil. Pour over 50ml water, cover with foil and roast for 2 hrs, or until tender, basting halfway through. Take the pork out and increase oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Remove the foil and pour the sauce into a small pan. Bring the sauce to the boil and let it bubble until thick and syrupy. Brush some of the sauce all over the pork and pop back in the oven, uncovered, for 20 mins until sticky and caramelised in places. Transfer to a chopping board, cover lightly with foil and leave to rest for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, prepare the salad. Toss all the ingredients, except the peanuts, together in a bowl. To make the dressing, combine all the ingredients and set aside. Reheat the remaining sauce, adding a splash of water if it has become too thick. Toss the dressing through the salad and divide between 2 plates, then top with the smashed peanuts. Cut the pork into thick slices, arrange alongside the salad, then drizzle over the sauce. Serve with Coconut rice (see tip, below)."]','2026-01-10 12:21:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8280,8280,'en','Vietnamese pork salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyTom Kime’s Vietnamese salad can be made ahead, leaving you to relax on a balmy summer’s evening','["1 tsp golden caster sugar","juice of 2 limes","1 fresh red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","a handful of coriander stems or roots, chopped","1 tbsp each sesame oil, Thai fish sauce and light soy sauce","50g sesame seeds, dry roasted until golden","500g pork tenderloin, trimmed of fat","vegetable oil, for brushing","¼ white cabbage, shredded","1 cucumber, cut into matchsticks","5 celery stalks, cut into matchsticks","3 spring onions, finely sliced","1 red chilli, seeded and finely chopped","2 trimmed stems of lemongrass, finely sliced","zest of 1 lime","a handful each of coriander and mint leaves, chopped"]','["The day before: make the dressing. Put the sugar and lime juice in a pan with 1 tbsp water and bring to the boil to dissolve the sugar. Add the chilli and coriander and stir well, then pulse in a blender until smooth. Tip into a bowl, then stir in the sesame oil, fish sauce, soy sauce and sesame seeds to make a dressing. Cover and chill until needed.","Two hours before serving: heat a griddle pan. Preheat the oven to 200C/gas 6/fan 180C. Brush the pork with oil and griddle on all sides for a few minutes until seared. Transfer to a baking tray and put in the oven for about 10-12 minutes until cooked through. Cool, thinly slice against the grain of the meat. Tip into a bowl and pour over half the dressing.","To serve: toss the remaining salad ingredients in a bowl with the remaining dressing. Pile on to a platter, top with the pork slices and spoon over any juices."]','2026-01-10 12:21:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8282,8282,'en','Barbecue pork buns','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyTastier than a take away and great for nibbling and sharing. These dim sum will impress your guests.','["85g sugar","500g pack white bread mix","1 tbsp sunflower oil","12 rashers streaky bacon unsmoked bacon or pancetta, chopped","knob ginger, peeled and chopped","2 garlic clove, chopped","2 tbsp soy sauce","3 tbsp clear honey","3 tbsp tomato purée","1 egg beaten, to glaze"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas. Mix the sugar into the bread mix in a large bowl, then add water as instructed on the pack. Bring the dough together with a wooden spoon, then knead on a lightly floured surface for 5 mins until smooth. Put into a large bowl, cover with oiled cling film then leave in a warm place until doubled in size.","Meanwhile, heat the oil in a pan, then fry the bacon until crisp, about 5 mins. Add the ginger and garlic and fry for 1 min until soft, then tip in the soy, honey and tomato purée and stir well. Can be made up to 3 days ahead.","Turn out the dough and knead briefly, then pull into 12 even-sized balls. Flatten with your hands, then put a teaspoon-size blob of the filling in the middle. Draw the dough up and pinch it closed like a purse, then turn the bun over and sit it on a large baking sheet. Cover with oiled cling film and leave to rise for about 30 mins until the dough feels pillowy. Brush with egg and bake for 20 mins until golden. Serve warm with dipping sauce. Can be frozen after second rise for up to 1 month or baked up to a day ahead and re-warmed."]','2026-01-10 12:21:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8284,8284,'en','Asian pork with rice noodle salad','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyA weeknight supper that’s full of colour and spice and all things nice, and ready in just 20 minutes','["1 tsp lemongrass paste (we used Bart''s)","1 tsp finely-grated fresh root ginger","½ red chilli, finely chopped","1 tsp sunflower oil","3 tbsp fish sauce","4 pork chop","200g thin rice noodle","zest and juice 1 lime","½ tsp caster sugar","½ cucumber","handful chopped mint leaves"]','["Mix together the lemongrass paste, ginger, chilli, oil and 1 tbsp of the fish sauce. Smear the mixture all over the pork chops, then set aside to marinate while you make the salad.","Tip the noodles into a large bowl. Pour over a kettleful of boiling water, then leave to sit for 5 mins until the noodles are soft (or prepare them according to pack instructions). Drain the noodles into a sieve. Run under the cold tap until cool, then drain again and tip back into the bowl. Whisk the remaining 2 tbsp fish sauce with the lime zest and juice and sugar. Pour over the cold noodles. Slice the cucumber into thin strips, then toss through the salad along with the mint leaves.","Heat a griddle pan until smoking hot. Griddle the chops for 5 mins on each side or until cooked through, then serve alongside the noodle salad."]','2026-01-10 12:21:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8286,8286,'en','Vietnamese chicken wraps','Fill soft flour tortillas with pan-fried chicken, lightly pickled cucumber and carrot for an Asian-style lunch or dinner','["½  cucumber, halved, deseeded and sliced","1 small carrot, grated","1 tbsp white wine vinegar","2 tbsp vegetable oil","8 boneless, skinless chicken thighs, cut into thin strips","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","25g ginger (peeled weight), finely grated","3 tbsp light brown soft sugar","2 tbsp soy sauce","8 mini or 4 large soft flour tortillas","2 Little Gem lettuces, leaves separated and cut in half"]','["Put the cucumber, carrot and vinegar in a small bowl and set aside. Heat 1 tbsp oil in a large frying pan, add the chicken and fry on a medium heat until golden brown and cooked through. Remove and set aside. Pour the remaining oil into the pan and lower the heat. Add the garlic and ginger, and cook for 2 mins until softened but not coloured. Add the sugar, soy sauce and 150ml water, and bubble for 5 mins until saucy. Return the chicken to the pan and heat through.","Warm the tortilla wraps following pack instructions. Top the tortillas with the lettuce, chicken, and pickled cucumber and carrot."]','2026-01-10 12:21:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8288,8288,'en','Vietnamese-style beef salad','Lighten up beef mince in this Asian inspired noodle salad with crunchy carrots, beansprouts, and crushed peanuts','["500g beef mince","2 red chillies, 1 finely chopped, the other thinly sliced","4 garlic cloves, crushed","100ml oyster sauce","3 limes, juice of 2, 1 cut into wedges","300g bag cooked rice noodles","3 carrots, cut into thin julienne","300g bag beansprouts","small bunch mint, leaves picked","50g unsalted peanuts, roughly chopped"]','["Dry-fry the beef in a frying pan until nicely browned and starting to crisp, then pour off any fat. Add the chopped chilli and garlic, and fry for a few more mins. Add the oyster sauce and lime juice, and cook for another 5 mins until sticky.","To assemble the salad, divide the rice noodles between bowls, top with the beef, then place a handful of carrot, beansprouts and mint leaves around each bowl. Sprinkle with peanuts and the sliced chilli. Before eating, toss all the ingredients together."]','2026-01-10 12:21:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8290,8290,'en','Vietnamese caramel trout','A caramel base balances out the hot and salty ingredients of this Asian-inspired one-pan fish dish for two','["50g golden caster sugar","1 tbsp Thai fish sauce","1 red chilli, finely sliced","large piece of ginger, finely sliced","2 rainbow trout fillets","2 heads bok choi, halved","juice ½ lemon","coriander sprigs","steamed rice, to serve"]','["Put the sugar in a large shallow pan, along with a small splash of water. Heat gently, swirling the pan, until the sugar has dissolved. Increase the heat and bubble the syrup until it turns a dark amber colour. Add the fish sauce, most of the chilli and ginger, then splash in 1 tbsp water to dilute. Boil again until syrupy, then add the fish fillets, skin-side down, and the bok choi, cut-side down.","Cover the pan with a lid and simmer for 4-5 mins until the fish is cooked and the bok choi has wilted. Turn off the heat, squeeze over the lemon and scatter with the remaining chilli, ginger and the coriander sprigs. Serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8292,8292,'en','Vietnamese chicken baguettes          (Bhan Mi)','Stuff your sandwich with chicken, carrot, cucumber, spring onion and sweet chilli dressing for Asian zing','["1 small chicken breast","1 tsp olive oil","1 tsp rice vinegar","½  tsp golden caster sugar","juice ½ lime","½  small carrot, peeled and grated","2 spring onions, thinly sliced","2½cm/1in piece cucumber, deseeded and sliced","½  red chilli, thinly sliced into rounds","1 sandwich baguette","3-4 Little Gem lettuce leaves, washed","1-2 tbsp sweet chilli sauce"]','["Put the chicken breast between 2 pieces of\r\ncling film and bash with a rolling pin to about\r\n1cm thick. Heat a griddle pan until hot. Rub the\r\nchicken with the oil, cook for 2-3 mins per side,\r\nor until cooked through. Set aside to cool.","Mix together the rice vinegar, sugar and lime\r\njuice, stirring until the sugar is dissolved. Add the\r\ncarrot, spring onions, cucumber and chilli.","Split a sandwich baguette along the top. Stuff\r\nwith the Little Gem leaves and shred the chicken\r\non top. Pile on the carrot mixture and wrap or\r\nplace in a plastic box. Put the sweet chilli sauce\r\nin a small portable pot and when it’s time for\r\nlunch, pour over the sauce just before tucking in."]','2026-01-10 12:21:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8294,8294,'en','Vietnamese seafood salad','A spicy zingy dressing lifts a bag of defrosted fish and a few fresh ingredients into a super, feelgood supper that’s ready in just 10 minutes','["400g pack cooked seafood mix","300g pack cooked thin rice noodles","300g pack cooked beansprouts","3 carrots, thinly sliced","1 bunch spring onions, sliced lengthways","bunch mint and coriander, leaves chopped","5 tbsp rice wine vinegar","1 tsp caster sugar","1 red chilli, chopped","1 stick lemongrass, sliced","1 tbsp low sodium soy sauce"]','["To make the salad put all of the vegetables and seafood in a large bowl, reserving a few of the herbs for the top. Mix everything together, so that the seafood and noodles are combined.","Make the dressing by mixing all of the ingredients, toss this through the salad, then divide between 5 deep bowls or pile on to a large platter and let everyone help themselves. Scatter the reserved herbs over the top to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8296,8296,'en','Vietnamese chicken salad','A no-cook main course salad with all the light, fragrant flavours of Southeast Asia such as peanut, chilli, mint and soy','["140g Thai rice noodles","1 carrot","½ cucumber","2 cooked chicken breasts, shredded","50g radishes, thinly sliced","½ red onion, finely sliced","small bunch mint, leaves picked","25g natural roasted peanuts, roughly chopped","1 small red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","zest and juice 1 lime","1½  tbsp each fish sauce, low-sodium soy sauce and sesame oil"]','["To make the dressing, whisk all the\r\ningredients together in a large serving\r\nbowl. Cook the noodles following pack\r\ninstructions, then drain and add to the\r\nbowl with the dressing.","Peel the carrot into long strips using\r\na vegetable peeler. Do the same for the\r\ncucumber, until you reach the seeds\r\n(discard them). Add the carrot and\r\ncucumber to the noodle mixture along\r\nwith the shredded chicken, radishes,\r\nred onion and mint. Toss well to coat\r\nin the dressing, scatter over the peanuts\r\nand serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8298,8298,'en','Salt & pepper squid','Crisp, spicy coating and hot, tender squid make an irresistible combination','["85g cornflour","85g plain flour","2 tsp black pepper, cracked","2 tbsp ground Szechuan peppercorns, roughly crushed","sunflower or vegetable oil, for frying","400g squid, cleaned and cut into strips (see tips, below)","finely sliced spring onion and green chilli, to serve","1 red chilli, finely chopped","half cucumber, finely diced","1 small red onion, finely chopped","100ml rice wine vinegar","1 tbsp caster sugar","2 tsp fish sauce"]','["To make the dipping sauce, mix all the ingredients in a small bowl until the sugar has dissolved, then set aside. Mix the cornflour and plain flour with both peppers and 2 tsp sea salt in a large bowl, then set aside. Line a tray with kitchen paper and make sure you have more salt to sprinkle with.","Heat about 7cm of oil to 180C in a deep fryer, wok or deep pan. If you don’t have a thermometer, you can test it with a cube of bread – it should brown in 20 secs. Coat the squid well with the flour mix and fry in batches for about 2 mins each or until crisp. Use a slotted spoon to lift out the squid, then drain on the kitchen paper and sprinkle with a little more salt. Serve the squid scattered with the spring onion and chilli, with the dipping sauce on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:21:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8300,8300,'en','Tangy carrot, red cabbage & onion salad','This autumnal salad makes a fresh and healthy side dish and is great served with grilled halloumi or burgers','["4 carrots, cut into thin sticks or grated","½ red cabbage, finely shredded","2 small red onions, finely sliced","handful mint leaves","handful coriander leaves","handful toasted peanuts, roughly chopped","juice 2 limes","1 tbsp groundnut oil","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","1 tbsp soft brown sugar"]','["Tip the carrots, cabbage and onions into\r\na bowl. Make the dressing by stirring the\r\ningredients together until the sugar has\r\ndissolved. Pour over salad, tossing the\r\nvegetables in the dressing. Add the herbs,\r\ntoss again, then scatter over the peanuts."]','2026-01-10 12:21:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8302,8302,'en','Crunchy prawn noodle salad','This Vietnamese-style dressing is best madejust before serving to preserve the vibrantcolour of the mint.','["100g rice noodles","100g sugar snap peas, shredded","2 carrots, coarsely grated","100g baby spinach","85g peeled, cooked prawns, defrosted if frozen","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely chopped","3 tbsp rice vinegar","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tsp fish sauce","1 tbsp roughly chopped mint"]','["Pour boiling water over the noodles to cover,\r\nleave for 4 mins, then cool under cold running\r\nwater. Drain well. Mix the sugar snaps,\r\ncarrots, spinach, noodles and prawns in\r\na shallow bowl. Mix together the dressing\r\ningredients until the sugar has dissolved,\r\npour over the salad, then toss everything\r\ntogether. Serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:21:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8304,8304,'en','Vietnamese prawn summer rolls','Fresh-tasting rice paper rolls packed with shellfish, light vermicelli noodles, carrots, cucumber and herbs, with a sweet ginger chilli dipping sauce','["2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 small red chilli (deseeded if you don''t like it too hot), finely chopped","1 tbsp finely chopped ginger","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","3 tbsp fish sauce","juice 1 lime","100g vermicelli rice noodles or bean thread noodles","12 x 20cm round rice paper wrappers (see tip, below)","handful mint leaves","18 cooked prawns, cut in half lengthways","2-3 large iceberg lettuce leaves, torn into 12 pieces","1 carrot, cut into thin batons","a handful coriander","a handful Thai basil","a handful long chives","50g beansprouts"]','["Make the dipping sauce by\r\npounding the garlic, chilli,\r\nginger and sugar together\r\nusing a pestle and mortar, then stir\r\nin the fish sauce and lime juice.\r\nAlternatively, just blitz everything\r\ntogether in a mini blender.","Soak the rice noodles in\r\na bowl of hot water for\r\n15 mins, then drain well.\r\nAssemble all the prepared filling\r\ningredients – once you start,\r\nyou will need everything to hand.","When you are ready to make\r\nthe rolls, dip one of the rice\r\npapers in a bowl of hot water,\r\nmoving it around until the whole\r\nwrapper is soft – about 10-15 secs\r\n– then drain on a tea towel.","Place a rice paper wrapper\r\non a board and at one edge\r\nof the wrapper, add a few mint\r\nleaves, then three prawn halves.","Place some lettuce on top\r\nof the prawns, followed by\r\nsome noodles, a few strips of\r\ncarrot and cucumber, some more\r\nherbs and finally some beansprouts.\r\nDon’t overfill the pancakes or they\r\nwill be hard to roll.","Lift the edge of the rice\r\npaper wrapper nearest\r\nto you over the filling\r\nand, holding the filling in\r\nposition with your fingers,\r\nstart rolling up tightly.","When you’re about halfway,\r\nfold the ends of the rice paper\r\nin and over the filling so that\r\nit is completely enclosed.","Keep on rolling tightly until\r\nthe whole rice paper wrapper\r\nis rolled up. To serve, cut the\r\nrolls in half on the diagonal."]','2026-01-10 12:21:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8306,8306,'en','Crunchy Asian cabbage & prawn salad','This no-cook main course is packed full of good-for-you ingredients','["250g/9oz Chinese cabbage","175g/60z white cabbage","2 celery sticks","2 carrots","small handful mint, chopped","small handful coriander, chopped","200g cooked large peeled prawns","4 tbsp roasted peanuts, chopped","1-2 small red chillies, sliced","1 garlic clove, crushed","2 tbsp caster sugar","2 tbsp rice vinegar","3 tbsp lime juice","3 tbsp fish sauce"]','["Shred the cabbages, celery and carrot\r\nfinely on a mandolin or grate them on the\r\nlargest holes on a grater. Add the mint\r\nand coriander to the vegetables along\r\nwith the prawns. Toss everything together.","Make the dressing by whisking all the\r\ningredients together. Dress the salad\r\nand tip it into a bowl, sprinkle over the\r\npeanuts and serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:21:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8308,8308,'en','Vietnamese prawn & noodle salad with crispy shallots','Making the fried shallots for this superhealthy salad is optional, but well worth it – they’re incredibly delicious','["200g thin rice noodles","200g large cooked, peeled prawns","1 small red onion, halved and sliced","1 small red chilli, sliced","1 small cucumber, shaved into ribbons (use a peeler)","1 large handful each coriander and mint","2 tbsp roasted peanuts, roughly chopped","juice 3 limes","1 tbsp soft brown sugar","2 tsp fish sauce","1 garlic clove, crushed","5 shallots, thinly sliced","vegetable oil, for frying","flour, for dusting"]','["For the crispy shallots, heat 5cm of oil\r\nuntil hot in a wok. You will know the oil is\r\nhot enough when one piece of shallot\r\nsizzles as soon as it’s dropped in. Toss\r\nthe shallot slices with flour, shake off\r\nexcess and fry in the oil until golden. They\r\nfry quickly, about 1 min. Drain on kitchen\r\npaper, sprinkle with salt and set aside.","To make the dressing, mix the lime\r\njuice, sugar, fish sauce and garlic and set\r\naside. In a large mixing bowl, pour boiling\r\nwater over the noodles. Leave them for\r\n2 mins or until they are just cooked, then\r\nrinse under cold water. Drain well, shaking\r\nthe sieve numerous times to get out the\r\nexcess water, then place back in the\r\nbowl. Add prawns, onion, chilli, cucumber\r\nand herbs. Pour the dressing over, mix,\r\nthen sprinkle with the shallots and peanuts."]','2026-01-10 12:21:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8310,8310,'en','Vietnamese veg parcels','Fancy something a bit different? Try these healthy vegetable parcels, based on Vietnamese rolls','["2 x 50g pack rice flour pancakes","50g thin rice noodles","1 cooked skinless chicken breast, shredded","1 carrot, finely sliced","½ cucumber, finely shredded","1 red pepper, deseeded and finely sliced","Baby Gem lettuce, coriander and mint leaves, to serve","4 tbsp Thai fish sauce","2 tbsp rice wine vinegar","squeeze lime","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely sliced"]','["Soak the rice fl our pancakes according to pack\r\ninstructions or in boiling water for 30 secs. Remove\r\nand cool on kitchen paper. Soak the rice noodles\r\naccording to pack instructions, then drain and cut\r\nthem into 2cm strips.","Lay a rice pancake on a board and arrange some\r\nrice noodles, chicken, vegetables and herb leaves\r\nabout a third of the way up, leaving a 1cm edge at\r\nthe side. Fold the sides over the vegetables and then\r\nroll up lengthways to make a cigar. Store in the fridge,\r\ncovered with moist kitchen paper for up to 1 day.","Mix together the ingredients for the dipping\r\nsauce and put into a bowl. To serve, arrange the\r\nrolls on a plate along with the leaves and herbs.\r\nTo eat, wrap each roll in a piece of lettuce with a\r\nherb sprig and dunk into the sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:21:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8312,8312,'en','Noodle bowl salad','Fresh and healthy salad for picnic fare','["½ x 250g pack medium rice noodles","200g sugar snap peas, sliced lengthways","2 tsp sesame oil","4 spring onions, thinly sliced diagonally","pack coriander, roughly torn","150g pack hot smoked flaked salmon","pretzel or bread roll, to serve","3 tbsp soy sauce","1 tbsp clear honey","1 tbsp lemon juice","1 tbsp groundnut or sunflower oil","1 plump garlic clove, finely grated","knob root ginger, coarsely grated"]','["Drop the noodles into a large bowl, then pour over enough boiling water to cover. Tip in the sliced sugar snaps and leave for 4 minutes. Drain in a colander, put under cold running water to cool off, then drain again. Tip into a bowl and toss in the sesame oil.","Mix the dressing ingredients. Pile spring onions, coriander and salmon onto the noodles, pour over the dressing and toss everything together. Serve with a pretzel or bread roll."]','2026-01-10 12:21:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8314,8314,'en','Minty Asian chicken salad','Cheer up a chicken salad, make it minty and then add some Asian flavours','["250g pack thin rice noodles","2 cooked skinless chicken breasts, shredded","½ cucumber, halved and sliced","3 spring onions, sliced","1 red chilli, finely chopped","4 tbsp soy or fish sauce","zest and juice 1 lime","2 tsp sugar","20g pack mint, leaves only, roughly chopped"]','["Soak the noodles for 5 mins in boiling water or according to pack instructions, until softened. Drain, then cool under a running tap. Drain again well, then tip into a large bowl along with the chicken, cucumber, spring onions and chilli.","Mix together the soy or fish sauce, lime zest and juice and sugar, then pour over the noodles. Toss through the mint leaves and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8316,8316,'en','Oriental duck salad','Who says a duck supper has to be expensive? Make your meat go further with this flavour-packed salad','["1 duck leg","1 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","140g rice noodles","1 celery stick, cut into matchsticks","1 carrot, cut into matchsticks","½ cucumber, deseeded and cut into matchsticks","2 spring onions, sliced lengthways","2 tbsp hoisin sauce","1 tbsp soy sauce"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nRub the duck leg all over with\r\nfive-spice and seasoning, place on\r\na baking tray and roast for 25 mins.","Meanwhile, cook the rice noodles\r\nfollowing pack instructions. Drain\r\nand cool under cold running water,\r\nthen drain again well and toss\r\nwith the celery, carrot, cucumber\r\nand spring onions. When cool\r\nenough to handle, remove the\r\nduck meat and crispy skin from\r\nthe bone and finely shred.","To make the dressing, mix\r\nthe hoisin and soy sauce with\r\n2 tbsp water. Divide the noodles\r\nbetween two plates and top\r\nwith the shredded duck. Drizzle\r\nover the dressing and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8318,8318,'en','Bang bang prawn salad','Ready in 20 minutes, this lovely salad can just as easily be made with chicken if you’re not in a seafood mood','["140g flat rice noodles","3 tbsp crunchy peanut butter","4 tbsp half-fat coconut milk","3 tbsp sweet chilli sauce","3 spring onions, sliced","1 cucumber, peeled, halved lengthways, deseeded and sliced","300g pack beansprouts","200g pack cooked peeled prawns"]','["Cook the noodles following pack\r\ninstructions, then rinse under cold water\r\nand drain thoroughly. In a small saucepan\r\nmelt together the peanut butter, coconut\r\nmilk, sweet chilli sauce and half the\r\nspring onions, adding 1-2 tbsp of water\r\nto loosen the mixture to a drizzling\r\nconsistency.","Mix the noodles, cucumber and\r\nbeansprouts in a serving dish. Top with\r\nthe prawns, drizzle over the peanut\r\nsauce and scatter over the remaining\r\nspring onions."]','2026-01-10 12:21:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8320,8320,'en','Tofu, greens & cashew stir-fry','Healthy, light and quick – just what you need in an after-work meal','["1 tbsp vegetable oil","1 head broccoli, cut into small florets","4 garlic cloves, sliced","1 red chilli, deseeded and finely sliced","1 bunch spring onions, sliced","140g soya beans","2 heads pak choi, quartered","2 x 150g packs marinated tofu pieces","1 ½ tbsp hoisin sauce","1 tbsp reduced-salt soy sauce (add extra to suit your own taste)","25g roasted cashew nuts"]','["Heat the oil in a non-stick wok. Add the\r\nbroccoli, then fry on a high heat for 5 mins\r\nor until just tender, adding a little water if\r\nit begins to catch. Add the garlic and chilli,\r\nfry for 1 min, then toss through the spring\r\nonions, soya beans, pak choi and tofu.\r\nStir-fry for 2-3 mins. Add the hoisin, soy\r\nand nuts to warm through."]','2026-01-10 12:21:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8322,8322,'en','Asian noodle & turkey soup','This soup is a little like pho, a Vietnamesebroth traditionally made with beef andserved with a plate of zingy fresh herbs,chilli and lime on the side.','["1½ l turkey or chicken stock","thumb-size piece root ginger, peeled and sliced","2 star anise","1 cinnamon stick","3 cloves","200g dried rice noodles, any type","2-3tbsp fish sauce","2 limes, one juiced, one for wedges","400g roast turkeys, shredded","100g bag beansprouts","bunch coriander","bunch mint","4 spring onions, thinly sliced","2 red chillies, sliced (leave the seeds in if you like it hot)"]','["Pour the stock into a large pan, add the\r\nginger and spices, then leave to simmer and\r\ninfuse for 10 mins. Soak the noodles according\r\nto the pack instructions, then drain and rinse.","Add the fish sauce and lime juice to the\r\nstock and taste for seasoning – add more\r\nfish sauce if you like. Divide the noodles\r\nbetween four bowls, then top with the\r\nshredded meat, beansprouts and a scattering\r\nof herbs, spring onion and chillies. Ladle the\r\nhot stock over the noodles, then serve with\r\nmore herbs and lime wedges for squeezing."]','2026-01-10 12:21:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8324,8324,'en','Vietnamese veggie hotpot','A warming supper dish that’s aromatic without being spicy, so the kids can enjoy it too','["2 tsp vegetable oil","thumb-size piece fresh root ginger, shredded","2 garlic cloves, chopped","½ large butternut squash, peeled and cut into chunks","2 tsp soy sauce","2 tsp soft brown sugar","200ml vegetable stock","100g green beans, trimmed and sliced","4 spring onions, sliced","coriander leaves and cooked basmati or jasmine rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a medium-size, lidded\r\nsaucepan. Add the ginger and garlic, then\r\nstir-fry for about 5 mins. Add the squash, soy\r\nsauce, sugar and stock. Cover, then simmer\r\nfor 10 mins. Remove the lid, add the green\r\nbeans, then cook for 3 mins more until the\r\nsquash and beans are tender. Stir the spring\r\nonions through at the last minute, then\r\nsprinkle with coriander and serve with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8326,8326,'en','Salmon noodle soup','This wholesome noodle soup is low fat, heart healthy and packed full of tasty ingredients','["1l low-salt chicken stock","2 tsp Thai red curry paste","100g flat rice noodles","150g pack shiitake mushrooms, sliced","125g pack baby corn, sliced","2 skinless salmon fillets, sliced","juice 2 limes","1 tbsp reduced-salt soy sauce","pinch brown sugar","small bunch coriander, chopped"]','["Pour the stock into a large pan, bring\r\nto the boil, then stir in the curry paste.\r\nAdd the noodles and cook for 8 mins.\r\nTip in the mushrooms and corn and cook\r\nfor 2 mins more.","Add the salmon to the pan and cook\r\nfor 3 mins or until cooked through.\r\nRemove from the heat and stir in the\r\nlime juice, soy sauce and a pinch of\r\nsugar. Ladle into 4 bowls and sprinkle\r\nover the coriander just before you serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8330,8330,'en','Almond croissant muffins','Almond croissant muffins inspired by a French bakery favourite with a nourishing twist, Linwoods Sprouted Flax.','["2 tbsp flaxseed","4 tbsp water","100ml maple syrup","80g almond butter","1 tsp almond extract","100g soy yoghurt","50ml plant milk","180g self-raising flour","¼ tsp salt","50g ground almonds","1 tbsp Linwoods Sprouted Flax","30g maple syrup","½ tsp almond extract","30ml plant milk","flaked almonds","icing sugar , for dusting"]','["Preheat the oven to 180°C fan and line a muffin tin with 6 cases. In a small bowl, mix the flaxseed with water and leave to thicken for 5 minutes.","In a large bowl, whisk together the thickened flax mix, maple syrup, almond butter, almond extract, soy yogurt, and plant milk. Add the self-raising flour and salt, and gently fold until just combined – avoid overmixing.","In a separate bowl, mix together all the almond filling ingredients until a thick paste forms. Spoon half of the muffin batter into the cases, add a dollop of almond filling to each, then top with the remaining batter. Sprinkle with flaked almonds and bake for 20 minutes, or until golden and a skewer comes out clean.","Allow to cool slightly, then dust with icing sugar before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8332,8332,'en','Brown butter & cardamom lebkuchen','Make a twist on the classic lebkuchen over Christmas. Spiced with fragrant cardamom, brown butter gives these chewy cookies a nutty edge','["100g salted butter","150g light brown soft sugar","200ml honey","350g plain flour , plus extra for dusting","100g ground almonds","1 tsp ground cardamom","1 tsp ground cinnamon","¼ tsp ground cloves","¼ tsp ground allspice","¼ tsp ground ginger","pinch of ground mace","pinch of ground nutmeg","1 tbsp cocoa powder","1 tsp baking powder","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 egg","1 lemon , zested","200g icing sugar , sifted","1 egg white"]','["Tip the butter into a saucepan over a medium heat. Once melted, cook until the butter foams, stirring regularly. It should start to smell nutty and the milk solids at the bottom will turn golden brown in around 7 mins. Remove from the heat and stir in the sugar and honey. Return to the heat on low. Cook for 3-5 mins until the sugar has melted. Set aside to cool slightly.","Combine the flour, ground almonds, spices, cocoa powder, baking powder and bicarb together in a bowl. Whisk the egg into the cooled butter mixture then pour into the dry ingredients and add the lemon zest. Mix well and bring into a ball. Set aside in the fridge for 1 hr to firm up.","Lightly dust a clean work surface with flour and line two large baking trays with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tip out the dough and roll out to around 1cm thick. Use cutters shaped like hearts, gingerbread people and stars of varying sizes, around 5-8cm, to stamp out the lebkuchen. If you want to hang them, use a skewer to poke a little hole in the top. Arrange on the baking tray, with a little space in between. Bake for 13-15 mins until golden on the edges and just set, then leave to cool fully on the trays.","To ice the cooled biscuits, whisk together the icing sugar and egg white to form a smooth, pipeable icing. Pour into a reusable piping bag and pipe decorations onto the top of the biscuits. Set aside for the icing to set, at least 1 hr. Will keep in an airtight container for five days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8334,8334,'en','Jam roly poly buns','Take a jam roly poly pudding and transform it into swirled buns. It uses tangzhong – a Chinese-style milk and flour paste that yields exceptionally fluffy buns','["400ml whole milk","150g plain flour , plus extra for  dusting","2 eggs , beaten","300g strong white bread flour","7g instant yeast","2 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 tbsp custard powder","100g salted butter , cubed and softened","vegetable oil , for proving","6-7 tbsp raspberry jam","2 tbsp custard powder","5 tbsp icing sugar","1½ tbsp milk","½ tsp vanilla bean paste or extract"]','["First, make the tangzhong. Mix 200ml of the milk with 50g of the plain flour in a small heatproof bowl. Microwave for 1-2 mins, stirring every 30 seconds, until you have a gluey, thick paste. Leave to cool for a few minutes while you assemble the rest of the dough.","Gently warm the remaining milk in a small pan over a low heat on the hob. Once steaming, remove from the heat and leave to cool to just lukewarm before whisking in half the beaten egg.","Sift both the flours into the bowl of a stand mixer fitted with the dough hook. Add the yeast, 1 tsp salt, the golden caster sugar and the custard powder, and whisk briefly to combine.","With the mixer on low, add the tangzhong, then slowly add the milk and egg mixture in a continuous stream. Turn the mixer up to medium and mix for 7-8 mins until you have a smooth dough.","Add the butter, a cube at a time, waiting until the first cube has been incorporated before adding the next; this should take about 10 mins. It will be a soft dough, so flour your hands and the work surface well before forming the dough into a ball and putting in a large, oiled bowl. Leave to rise in a warm spot for 1 hr, then cover and chill overnight.","The next day, roll the dough out into a roughly 40 x 30cm rectangle. Spread over the jam, then roll the rectangle up tightly from one of the longer sides. Slice into 12 spirals using a sharp, serrated knife, then transfer to a baking tray or tin lined with baking parchment, spacing them slightly apart. Cover and leave to rise for another hour until puffed up and touching at the sides. Brush over the remaining beaten egg.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and bake for 20-25 mins until golden and cooked. Cool for 15 mins. While the buns cool, make the icing. Whisk together the custard powder and icing sugar. Combine the milk and vanilla bean paste, then add this slowly to the dry mix in a steady stream, mixing all the while until you have a thick yellow icing. Transfer to a piping bag.","Snip the tip of the piping bag and drizzle the icing over the warm buns before serving. Best eaten the day they’re made, but will keep at room temperature for two days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:21:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8336,8336,'en','Kitty paw brioche buns','Make these ‘kitty paws’ for breakfast with jams or any other toast toppers your family might like. Breadmaking is a great indoor activity for little ones','["200ml whole milk","50g salted butter","500g strong white bread flour","5g fine sea salt","50g golden caster sugar","7g sachet fast-action yeast","3 eggs , 1 beaten to glaze"]','["Warm the milk and butter together in a jug in the microwave, or in a small pan over a low heat, until the butter has melted and the milk is just warm.","Tip the bread flour into the bowl of a stand mixer, then add the salt and sugar on one side and the yeast on another. Whisk briefly with the dough hook, then add the milk and butter mixture and 2 of the eggs, and knead on a low speed for 6-8 mins until soft, smooth and elastic. You can also do this in a bowl by making a well in the middle, adding the milk and 2 eggs, then bringing it together and kneading the dough on a work surface until smooth. Try not to add more flour, just fold the sticky dough over itself, scraping down your hands every so often. A dough scraper is a great tool for kids to use when making breads and doughs. Place in a bowl, cover with a clean tea towel and leave to prove for 1-2 hrs until doubled in size.","Knock back the dough, then cut into 12 balls. Form eight of the balls into neat rounds, then place on a large baking sheet lined with baking parchment. Cut each of the remaining balls into eight small pieces to form 32 small balls of dough. Use some of the beaten egg to stick four small balls on each of the larger ones so they look like paws. Leave to prove for another 45 mins to puff up again.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Brush the buns with more egg, then cook for 20-25 mins until golden and puffed up. Leave to cool a little before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:21:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8338,8338,'en','Rhubarb & custard crumble cake','Enjoy the classic flavours of rhubarb crumble and custard in a slice of cake – it’s a dreamy combination of textures. Serve with double cream, if you like','["125g butter , softened, plus extra for the tin","400g rhubarb , chopped into 1cm chunks","200g golden caster sugar","150g self-raising flour","50g quick-cook polenta","3 tbsp custard powder","½ tsp baking powder","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","125ml soured cream","icing sugar , for dusting","double cream , to serve (optional)","100g golden caster sugar","60g plain flour","2 tbsp custard powder","1 tbsp quick-cook polenta","50g butter , cubed"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line the base and sides of a 23cm round springform cake tin with baking parchment. Mix a third of the rhubarb with 1 tbsp of the sugar and set aside.","To make the crumble topping, mix the sugar, flour, custard powder and polenta together in a bowl. Add the butter and rub into the dry ingredients until the mixture resembles coarse breadcrumbs, then set aside.","To make the sponge, mix the flour, polenta, custard powder, baking powder and ½ tsp salt in a bowl, then set aside. In a second bowl, beat the butter and remaining sugar until well combined, and lightened in colour slightly. Add the eggs one by one, beating well after each addition. Stir in the vanilla and soured cream, before folding in the flour mix and the remaining rhubarb that was not coated in sugar.","Spread the cake mixture in the prepared tin, then top with the sugar-covered rhubarb and scatter over the crumble topping. Bake for 1 hr-1 hr 10 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 15 mins, then carefully remove from the tin and leave to cool completely on a wire rack. Cut into slices to serve and dust with a little icing sugar, if you like. Will keep in the fridge for up to three days. Pour over double cream to serve, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8340,8340,'en','Cinnamon & apple doughnut muffins','Make these muffin takes on doughnuts when you prefer to avoid the faff of deep-frying. Full of wintry flavours, they’re ideal for a festive afternoon tea','["110g butter , melted, plus extra for the tin","70g caster sugar , plus 30g for dusting","110g plain flour , sifted","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp cinnamon , plus ½ tsp for dusting","50ml natural yogurt","1 medium free-range egg","1 tsp vanilla extract","60g smooth apple compote","12 tsp blueberry jam"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Use melted butter to very lightly brush the wells of a 24-hole mini muffin tray.","Mix 70g caster sugar with the flour, bicarb and 1 tsp cinnamon in a large mixing bowl using a whisk to disperse any lumps.","Mix the yogurt, egg, vanilla and apple compote with 110g melted butter, then pour into the flour mixture. Gently fold until just incorporated with no lumps.","Spoon half the batter into the muffin tray using a small ice cream scoop, or two teaspoons. Top each muffin with ½ tsp jam, then the rest of the batter. Bake for 8-9 mins or until golden brown and slightly springy when pressed gently.","Put 30g of caster sugar and the remaining cinnamon in a large shallow bowl and mix to combine. When the muffins are ready, leave to cool for 5 mins in the tin, then gently ease them out using the end of a cutlery knife and roll each warm doughnut muffin in the cinnamon sugar. Leave to cool completely on a wire rack or serve warm. Will keep for up to three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:21:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8341,8341,'en','Cherry & almond Easter cupcakes','These little Simnel cakes are really almondy, with pieces of marzipan in the mix – and they look gorgeous','["250g pack butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","175g golden caster sugar","5 eggs, beaten","250g self-raising flour, plus an extra 2 tbsp","1 tsp baking powder","zest 1 orange, plus 2 tbsp of the juice","250g natural marzipan, coarsely grated (easiest if chilled beforehand)","½ tsp almond essence, optional","200g glacé cherries, halved","about 100g/4oz icing sugar, sifted","mini chocolate eggs, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4 and place 24 cupcake cases into cupcake tins. Beat the butter and sugar together with electric beaters or a tabletop mixer until light and fluffy. Add the eggs, 250g flour, baking powder, orange zest and juice and beat well till thick, creamy and evenly mixed.","Toss cherries in the extra 2 tbsp flour and fold into the batter along with grated marzipan and almond essence (if using). Spoon into the cupcake cases and bake for 20-25 mins, or until well risen and golden. Leave to cool in tin for 10 mins, then place on a cooling rack to cool completely.","Mix the icing sugar with around 1 tbsp water to make a loose but not-too-runny icing. Ice the tops of the cupcakes and top each one with about 3 mini chocolate eggs."]','2026-01-10 12:21:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8342,8342,'en','Sticky carrot & date cake with tahini maple icing','Add sticky dates and a salty-sweet icing to take the traditional carrot cake to new, delicious heights. Decorate with crumbled sesame snaps and pecans','["200g stoned dates","200g softened butter","4 eggs","2 tsp vanilla extract","300g self-raising flour","1½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","200g light muscovado sugar","2 tsp ground cinnamon","½ tsp ground ginger","¼ fresh nutmeg , finely grated","300g carrots (about 3), washed well and coarsely grated (no need to  peel)","75g pecans , roughly chopped, plus a few whole to decorate","60g sesame snaps","100g soft cheese","1 tbsp tahini","200g salted butter , softened","600g icing sugar","1 tbsp maple syrup","1 tsp vanilla extract"]','["Put the dates in a bowl and pour over 200ml boiling water. Leave to soak for 30 mins.","Line the base and sides of two 20cm round cake tins with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/ 160C fan/gas 4. Tip the dates and their soaking liquid into a food processor, then blitz to a purée. Add the butter, eggs, vanilla, flour, bicarb, sugar, cinnamon, ginger, nutmeg and a pinch of salt and blend to a smooth cake batter.","Put the carrots in a large mixing bowl and add in the cake mixture along with the chopped pecans, then fold everything together. Divide the mixture between the tins, then level the tops with a spatula. Bake for 45 mins until risen and golden brown. A skewer inserted into the centre should come out clean, if not, return to the oven for 5-10 mins. Leave to cool in the tin for 20 mins, then transfer to a cooling rack.","To make the icing, beat the soft cheese and tahini together until smooth, if the tahini is very thick, add a little soft cheese and beat until smooth before adding more. Add the butter, icing sugar, maple syrup and vanilla extract and beat again until you have a smooth, fluffy icing.","Place one of the cakes on a cake stand or plate and spoon a generous amount of the icing on top. Spread to the edges, then top with the other cake. Pile the rest of the icing on top and use a spatula or palette knife to work it over the top and down the sides until completely covered. Crumble the sesame snaps and mix with the whole pecans. Sprinkle in a ring on top of the cake. Will keep in a cool place for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8344,8344,'en','Peanut butter & jelly blondies','Bake blondies with the moreish American combo of peanut butter and strawberry jam. Use any jam you like – strawberry, blackberry or plum will all work well','["150g salted butter , cubed, plus extra for the tin","100g crunchy peanut butter","300g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 eggs , beaten","220g plain flour","1/2 tsp baking powder","6-7 tbsp strawberry jam"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/170C fan/gas 4. Butter a roughly 20cm square baking tin and line with baking parchment. Melt the peanut butter, butter, brown sugar and vanilla together in a large saucepan over a low heat, stirring occasionally until combined. Remove from the heat and leave to cool slightly.","Whisk in the eggs and a generous pinch of salt, then sift over the flour and baking powder, and fold in using a spatula until just combined. Pour the mixture into the prepared tin. Dot the jam over the top, then use a skewer to gently swirl it in and create a marbled effect.","Bake for 30-40 mins, or until the blondies are shiny on top with a gentle wobble in the middle. Leave to cool completely in the tin. If you like, chill the cooled blondies for 1 hr if you prefer them to be fudgy. Slice into 16 squares."]','2026-01-10 12:21:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8346,8346,'en','Spiced plum & coconut cake','Try this bake in the period between late summer and early autumn. Plums pair so well with coconut and spices. Serve warm with a dollop of yogurt or cream','["200g butter , melted","200g Greek-style coconut flavoured yogurt , plus extra to serve (optional)","200g light brown soft sugar , plus 1 tbsp","3 medium eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g self-raising flour","85g desiccated coconut","½ tsp baking powder","1 tsp ground mixed spice","1 tsp ground cinnamon","4 plums , halved, stoned and cut into wedges","handful of coconut flakes , or extra desiccated coconut (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 20cm springform cake tin with baking parchment. Whisk the melted butter, yogurt, 200g brown sugar, the eggs and vanilla together in a jug to combine. Mix the flour, desiccated coconut, baking powder, spices and ½ tsp salt together in a bowl.","Pour the wet ingredients into the dry and mix into a smooth batter. Pour into the tin, then arrange the plums on top. Scatter over the 1 tbsp brown sugar and coconut flakes, if using. Bake for 1 hr 10 mins, or until risen, golden and a skewer inserted into the middle of the cake comes out clean.","Leave to cool in the tin for 15 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool slightly. Serve warm with a spoonful of coconut yogurt, if you like, or leave to cool completely. Will keep in an airtight container for three days or frozen for three months."]','2026-01-10 12:21:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8348,8348,'en','Carrot cake & cream cheese muffins','For a new twist on a favourite, try these carrot cake muffins, flavoured with warming spices and filled with a gooey soft cheese centre.','["175g light brown soft sugar , plus 1 tbsp for sprinkling","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 tsp ground cinnamon","1½ tsp ground ginger","2 eggs","150ml sunflower oil","1 orange , zested","2 tsp vanilla extract","175g Morrisons Market Street carrots , peeled and grated","50g raisins","50g walnuts , roughly chopped","100g full-fat soft cheese"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with cases. In a large bowl, combine the sugar, flour, bicarb, cinnamon and ginger with a pinch of salt.","In a jug, whisk the eggs, oil, orange zest and vanilla. Pour into the dry ingredients, add the Morrisons carrots, raisins and walnuts, and mix with a spatula to fully combine.","Spoon 2 tbsp of the mixture into each muffin case. Top with ½ tbsp soft cheese, then finish with the remaining carrot cake mixture. Sprinkle a pinch of brown sugar over each and bake for 25 mins until risen and golden. Leave to cool completely on a wire rack. Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8350,8350,'en','German apple cake','Use your favourite eating apples to bake this traditional German apple cake. Enjoy it with afternoon tea or take to a coffee morning','["125g butter , at room temperature, plus extra for the tin","220g plain flour , plus extra for dusting","175g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 lemon , zested and juiced","4 eggs","½ tsp baking powder","40g cornflour","100ml milk","800g eating apples , cored and cut into wedges","2 tsp icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 23cm springform cake tin and dust with flour. Beat the softened butter with 115g of the sugar and a pinch of salt for 3-5 mins until pale and creamy. Add the vanilla extract, lemon zest and juice and mix until combined.","Separate the eggs, putting the egg whites in a large mixing bowl. Use an electric hand mixer to beat the whites with the remaining sugar until stiff peaks form. Mix the egg yolks into the butter and sugar mixture.","Mix the flour with the baking powder and cornflour, then tip into the butter, sugar and yolk mixture. Mix to combine, then stir in the milk followed by a spoonful of the egg whites. Once that is fully incorporated, gently fold the remaining egg whites into the batter.","Spoon the batter into the springform pan. Press the apples into the batter cut side down and bake for 45-50 mins until golden and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for a while, then transfer to a cooling rack. Dust with icing sugar.Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8352,8352,'en','Almond, orange & ginger florentines','Present these florentines as part of a foodies gift box at Christmas. With ginger, orange, almonds, and a chocolate topping, they’re deliciously decadent','["flavourless oil , for the tin","50g salted butter","50g light brown muscovado sugar","50g golden syrup","50g plain flour","50g stem ginger , roughly chopped","125g flaked almonds","2 oranges , zested","175g dark chocolate","175g white chocolate"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly brush the base and sides of a 12-hole muffin tin with oil. Melt the butter, sugar and golden syrup in a smallsaucepanover a low heat, stirring frequently. Remove from the heat and whisk in the flour, then add the ginger, flaked almonds and orange zest.","Scoop 1 flat tbsp of the mixture into each hole of the muffin tin. You may be left with some mixture, but you can bake in batches. Bake for 10 mins until golden. Leave to cool for 2 mins until firm enough to transfer to awire rackand cool completely. Repeat with any of the remaining mixture.","Melt the dark and white chocolate in two different bowls, each over a simmering saucepan of water (ensuring the bowls don’t touch the water), or in themicrowavein 30-second bursts. Dip half of a cooled florentine in the dark chocolate then drizzle over the white chocolate. Leave to set on a wire rack.Will keep in an airtight container for one week."]','2026-01-10 12:21:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8354,8354,'en','Gingerbread mince pies','Combine two very traditional Christmas bakes – gingerbread and mince pies – to create a brilliant modern classic. Top with mini gingerbread people.','["400g mincemeat (ensure vegetarian, if needed)","50g stem ginger, chopped, plus 1 tbsp ginger syrup from the jar","250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","¼ tsp ground cinnamon","½ tsp ground ginger","125g cold unsalted butter, cut into small pieces","3 tbsp golden caster sugar, plus extra for sprinkling","1 egg, beaten","8cm round biscuit cutter","mini gingerbread person biscuit cutter"]','["For the pastry, tip the flour, spices and butter into a large bowl with a large pinch of salt. Rub together with your fingertips until the mix resembles fine breadcrumbs. Stir in the sugar. Add the egg and use a cutlery knife to mix everything until the ingredients start to clump together. Tip out onto a lightly floured work surface and knead briefly until you have a smooth dough. Or, pulse the ingredients together in afood processor. Shape into a disc, then wrap and chill for at least 30 mins.Will keep chilled for a day or frozen for three months.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Mix the mincemeat with the ginger and syrup.Roll the pastry outon a lightly floured surface to a 3mm thickness. Stamp out 12 discs using an 8cm biscuit cutter and lightly press into a 12-hole cupcake tin.","Fill each pastry case with 1 tbsp of the mincemeat mixture. Re-roll the pastry scraps and stamp out 12 mini gingerbread people, then place one on top of each pie.Will keep frozen for up to two months.","Bake for 20 mins, or 30 mins from frozen. Leave to cool in the tin for 5 mins, then lift out onto awire rackto cool completely. Dust with icing sugar.Will keep in an airtight container for up to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8356,8356,'en','Sunken chocolate, olive oil & hazelnut cake','Indulge in a cake with a lovely crunchy topping that gives way to a soft, gooey middle. With its flourless sponge, it’s ideal for guests who can’t eat gluten','["100g blanched hazelnuts , roughly chopped (see tip, below)","175ml extra virgin olive oil , plus extra for the tin","200g 70% dark chocolate , roughly chopped","5 eggs , separated","175g golden caster sugar","1 tbsp icing sugar and vanilla ice cream, to serve"]','["Heat a dry frying pan over a medium heat and tip in the hazelnuts. Toast, shaking the pan from time to time, until golden and fragrant. Transfer to a plate to cool completely, then tip into afood processorand blitz until finely chopped, like breadcrumbs.","Oil and line the base and sides of a 23cm springform cake tin. Tip the chocolate into a heatproof bowl and set over a pan of simmering water, making sure the base of the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Melt the chocolate, giving it a stir every now and then. Alternatively, melt in short blasts in themicrowave. Once fully melted, remove from the heat and slowly pour in the olive oil, whisking constantlyuntil smooth and glossy.","Beat the egg yolks and 50g of the caster sugar in another bowl until pale and thickened, around 5 mins. Gently fold the whisked yolk mixture into the chocolate mixture along with the chopped hazelnuts and a pinch of sea salt. (The ingredients don’t need to be fully combined yet.) Set aside.","Whiskthe egg whites and the remaining sugar together in a separate bowl, using a stand mixer or an electric whisk, until medium soft peaks form. Use a large metal spoon to stir a little of the whites into the chocolate mixture to loosen, then gently fold in the remainder. Carefully pour the batter into the prepared tin.Will keep wrapped in the freezer for up to two months.","If not freezing the cake, heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and bake for 35-45 mins. To bake from frozen, heat the oven as above, but bake for 55-60 mins, until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out almost clean, with just a few crumbs clinging to it. Leave to cool in the tin until warm, then carefully remove the base and sides of the tin. Dust over the icing sugar and serve with scoops of vanilla ice cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8358,8358,'en','Genoise sponge','Learn how to achieve the perfect genoise sponge with a light, airy texture. Paul Hollywood’s stunning layer cake makes the most of summer berries and cream','["50g butter , melted, plus extra for greasing","250g plain flour , plus extra for dusting","250g caster sugar plus 1 tbsp","8 medium eggs","600ml pot double cream","400g punnet strawberries , halved","180g punnet blueberries","150g punnet raspberries","icing sugar , to dust"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Brush 2 x 20cm cake tins with melted butter, line the bases with baking paper, then dust well with flour tipping out any excess. Set aside.","Put the sugar and eggs in a large heatproof bowl, then set it over a pan of barely simmering water. Whisk with an electric hand whisk for about 7 mins or until the mixture is pale and has trebled in volume. Remove from the heat, then slowly pour in the butter folding it in as you pour until it is completely mixed in.","Gently fold the flour and a pinch of salt into the egg mixture, then pour into your prepared cake tins. Cook for 20 mins until the cake is golden and risen – a skewer pushed into the cake should come out clean. Allow the cakes to cool for a few mins in the tin, then remove and cool completely on a wire rack.","Meanwhile, whip the cream until it just holds its shape, then set aside. Whizz about a quarter of the strawberries with 1 tbsp sugar until smooth, then fold this purée through the cream so you get a ripple effect.","To assemble the cakes, cut each one in half horizontally. Put one sponge on a serving plate, spread a quarter of the cream mix on top, then dot a quarter of the blueberries and raspberries around the edge. Repeat this step two more times, put the last layer of cake on top (save a top half of cake for the top layer), spread the remaining cream over, then put the blueberries and raspberries around the edge and pile the strawberries in the centre. Dust with icing sugar just before you serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8360,8360,'en','Classic lasagne','Prepare this easy homemade lasagne ahead of time and save in the freezer, uncooked, for when you need it during a busy week. Just bake for an extra 45 mins','["2 olive oil, plus extra for the dish","750g lean beef mince","90g pack prosciutto","800g passata or half our basic tomato sauce","200ml hot beef stock","nutmeg","300g fresh lasagne sheets","white sauce (find a recipe in the method, or use shop-bought)","125g ball mozzarella, torn into thin strips"]','["To make the meat sauce, heat 2 tbsp olive oil in afrying panand cook 750g lean beef mince in two batches for about 10 mins until browned all over.","Finelychop4 slices of prosciutto from a 90g pack, then stir through the meat mixture.","Pour over 800g passata or half our basictomato saucerecipe and 200ml hot beef stock. Add a little grated nutmeg, then season.","Bring up to the boil, then simmer for 30 mins until the sauce looks rich.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and lightly oil an ovenproof dish (about 30 x 20cm).","Spoon one third of the meat sauce into the dish, then cover with some fresh lasagne sheets from a 300g pack. Drizzle over roughly 130g ready-made or homemadewhite sauce.","Repeat until you have three layers of pasta. Cover with the remaining 390g white sauce, making sure you can’t see any pasta poking through.","Scatter 125g torn mozzarella over the top.","Arrange the rest of the prosciutto on top. Bake for 45 mins until the top is bubbling and lightly browned."]','2026-01-10 12:21:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8362,8362,'en','Halloumi & chipotle loaf','Enjoy a loaf filled with delicious textures and kicking flavours, with creamy halloumi and the heat of smoky, sweet chipotle. Enjoy with lashings of butter','["500g strong bread flour, plus extra for dusting","25g unsalted butter, softened","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp caster sugar","1 tsp fine salt","vegetable oil, for proving","250g halloumi, grated","2 tbsp chipotle chilli flakes"]','["Weigh the flour out into a large bowl. Rub in the softened butter using your fingers until the mixture resembles fine crumbs. Add the yeast and sugar to one side of the bowl, and the salt on the other. Using aspatula, mix everything together to combine.","Make a well in the centre and pour in 300ml warm water. Using the spatula, mix until you have a rough dough. Tip the dough out onto the work surface and bring together into a large mound.","Knead the dough by hand for 10-15 mins or in astand mixerfitted with the dough hook for 6-8 mins on high speed until smooth and elastic. Oil a large bowl and drop in the dough. Cover and leave to prove somewhere warm for 1 hr until doubled in size.","Once the dough has doubled, tip it out onto the work surface and flatten it to remove any air pockets. Sprinkle over the halloumi in an even layer, then the chipotle flakes. Fold the dough over and knead in the cheese and chilli until evenly distributed. Line a large baking tray with baking parchment.","Tuck the edges of the dough into the centre until you have a neat dough ball. Transfer this to the tray, seam-side down, cover with a clean tea towel and leave to prove for another hour until doubled in size again. You will know the dough is ready when you poke it with your finger – if it springs back slowly and a small indent remains, it’s ready.","Heat the oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 7 with aroasting tinon the bottom shelf. Uncover the dough and lightly sieve some flour over it. Cut a cross into the top using the tip of a sharp serrated knife.","Put the loaf on its tray into the roasting tin, then pour some hot water into the tin around the tray to create steam while baking. This will give you a crisp crust. Bake for 20-25 mins until the loaf is golden and sounds hollow when you tap the base.","Remove from the oven and and leave to cool on awire rack. Cut into slices and enjoy with lashings of butter."]','2026-01-10 12:21:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8363,8363,'en','Simple sugar roses','These pretty roses can be used on cakes and cupcakes to give a romantic and sophisticated finish','["edible food colouring paste (we used Claret and Party Green)","200g ready-to-roll icing","a little solid vegetable fat, for rolling (see Know-how below)","edible lustre (we used a shimmery pink), optional","edible sparkles (we used bright pink), optional"]','["Start with the roses. Knead a little of the colouring paste into 150g of the icing until\r\npale and even. Break into three balls, then add a little more colouring to two, giving three varying depths of colour. Keep under cling film. Rub a very thin layer of fat over a smooth work surface. Roll out one of the\r\nballs of icing thinly, about 1-2mm, then trim into a rectangle about 8 x 20cm. Cut off a 1cm strip of icing widthways, keeping the rest covered.","Carefully roll the icing up and around itself. For a more realistic rose look, start rolling slightly skew-whiff so that the\r\noutside edge of the finished rose sticks out further than the middle. With about 2cm to go, start to guide the end of the icing down and under to make a neat rosebud. Pinch to shape, then cut or pinch off the bottom. Set aside for at\r\nleast 1 hr until firm. Repeat with the rest of the icing.","For the leaves, colour the remaining icing green. Pinch off small pea-size pieces, roll into balls, then flatten a little. Pinch one  end to make a leaf shape. Leave to dry.","Once the roses are dry and firm, dust a little lustre onto each rose using a paintbrush or your fingertip. Sprinkle with sparkles, if using. Position the roses onto the cupcakes in clusters of three, following with three leaves. You’ll need 36 leaves and roses for 12 cakes."]','2026-01-10 12:21:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8364,8364,'en','Roasted kohlrabi traybake','Roast kohlrabi with baby plum tomatoes and top with crème fraîche and chives for a dinner or side that’s full of flavour. It’s a great dish for autumn','["2 large kohlrabi (about 1.3kg), peeled and cut into wedges","230g baby plum tomatoes","3 thyme sprigs","1 red chilli, roughly chopped","2 tsp coriander seeds, crushed (optional)","5 garlic cloves, bashed","25g unsalted butter, cubed","2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil, plus a drizzle","10g chives, finely sliced","5g bunch of basil, finely chopped","1 lime, zested and juiced","125g crème fraîche"]','["Heat the oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 9. Line a large, high-sidedbaking traywith baking parchment. Tip the kohlrabi, tomatoes, thyme, chilli, coriander (if using) and unpeeled garlic onto the tray. Scatter over the cubes of butter and drizzle over the oil. Season well, then toss together. Roast for 20 mins. Turn the oven down to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and cook for 35 mins until softened and slightly charred.","Combine the topping ingredients in a bowl and season. Leave the kohlrabi to cool for 5 mins, then dollop over the dressing and drizzle over a little oil."]','2026-01-10 12:21:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8366,8366,'en','Air-fryer tuna pasta bake','Make this comfort food classic with your air-fryer. Top with mozzarella, and serve warm with salad or your favourite sides','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 small onion , finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , finely chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","½ tsp chilli flakes (optional)","150g pasta of your choice, cooked following pack instructions","145-165g can tuna in olive oil, drained","50g grated mozzarella","2 tbsp chopped parsley"]','["Heat theair-fryerto 190C. Tip the oil, onion and garlic into a heatproof dish and air-fry for 3 mins. Add the tomatoes and chilli flakes, if using, along with some seasoning. Air-fry for a further 5 mins.","Reduce the temperature to 170C. Stir in the cooked pasta, tuna, most of the mozzarella and the parsley. Scatter the reserved mozzarella over the top.","Air-fry for 5 mins until golden, then cover with foil and cook for a further 5 mins until bubbling. Serve warm with salad."]','2026-01-10 12:21:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8368,8368,'en','Baklava sticky buns','Unite sticky buns with Turkish baklava to make these glorious buns. The filling is richly spiced and filled with pistachios, walnuts and orange','["500g strong white bread flour , plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","3 tbsp light brown soft sugar","320ml whole milk","70g unsalted butter","a little oil , for rising","100g butter , softened","3 tbsp light brown soft sugar","2 large oranges , zested","130g walnuts","130g pistachios","2 tsp ground cinnamon","pinch of ground allspice","100g light brown soft sugar","100g honey","1 tbsp orange juice"]','["Combine the flour, yeast, sugar and ½ tsp fine salt in a large bowl. Heat the milk and butter in a small pan over a low heat, swirling the pan regularly until beginning to steam. Pour into a bowl and set aside to cool to room temperature.","Make a well in the dry ingredients, then pour in the milk and butter mixture. Swiftly combine using a spoon, then turn out on to a floured surface and knead the dough for 10 mins. Or, do this in astand mixerusing the dough hook for 7 mins. Transfer to a lightly oiled bowl, cover and leave in a warm place to double in size for at least 1 hr. Alternatively, for the best flavour, leave the dough to rise in the fridge overnight.","For the filling, use a wooden spoon to beat together the butter, sugar and orange zest. Finely chop the walnuts and 100g of the pistachios – by hand or in afood processor. Mix into the butter mixture along with the cinnamon, allspice and ¼ tsp fine sea salt.","Tip the dough onto a lightly floured surface, shape into a rough rectangle, then roll out until it’s about 45 x 35cm. Spread the cinnamon nut butter over the dough, all the way out to the edges. Working from one of the longer sides, roll the dough up as tightly as you can into a sausage shape. Cut into 12 equal pieces. (You can mark with a ruler at around 3.5-4cm per bun, then cut with a piece of dental floss, thread or sharp knife.) Line a large 20 x 30cmbaking trayor tin with baking parchment.","Arrange the buns, cut-side up, in the tray. Make sure the tails of the buns (where the dough opens) are tucked in so they don’t unfurl when baked. Leave some space around each bun, as they will expand. Cover loosely and leave to rise for 30-45 mins (depending on how warm your kitchen is) until the buns are puffed up and touching at the sides. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Bake for 30 mins, or until golden and risen.","Meanwhile, make the syrup. Put the sugar and honey in a small pan, simmer for 5 mins, then remove from the heat. Leave to cool, then stir in the orange juice. Take the buns out of the oven, immediately pour over the syrup and leave to cool.","Finely chopthe remaining pistachios and sprinkle over the buns in little mounds – just as is done on baklava. Serve warm.Will keep in an airtight container for three days.Warm briefly in the oven before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:21:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8370,8370,'en','Raspberry & white chocolate crumble muffins','Mix tangy raspberries with white chocolate chips, a light sponge and toasty topping to make these moreish muffins. They’re ideal for a mid-morning snack','["100g unsalted butter, softened","65g caster sugar","65g light brown soft sugar","2 large eggs, at room temperature","125g Greek yogurt","1 tsp vanilla paste","5 tbsp milk","250g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","175g raspberries (fresh or frozen)","90g white chocolate chips","3 tbsp plain flour","3 tbsp light brown soft sugar","50g cold unsalted butter, cut into cubes","50g rolled oats"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper cases. Put all of the crumble topping ingredients in abowlalong with a pinch of salt and rub together using your fingertips until you have a crumbly mixture.","For the muffins, beat the butter and sugars together for 5 mins until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs gradually, beating until combined. Mix in the yogurt, vanilla and milk.","Fold in the flour, baking powder and a pinch of fine salt until you have a smooth batter. Finally, fold in the raspberries and the white chocolate chips and fill the muffin cases leaving a little gap at the top. Cover the muffins with a layer of the crumble topping and bake for 10 mins, then reduce the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and bake for 25-30 mins more until risen and golden, and a cocktail stick inserted into the centre comes out clean."]','2026-01-10 12:21:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8372,8372,'en','Burnt Basque cheesecake','Try this Spanish-style baked cheesecake with a burnished exterior. With crème caramel-style bittersweet notes and a creamy yet light centre, it’s heavenly','["butter, for the tin","800g soft cheese","225g caster sugar","2 tbsp plain flour","200g soured cream","4 medium eggs","2 tsp vanilla"]','["Heat the oven to 240C/220C fan/ gas 9 ensuring plenty of space above the middle shelf. Butter a deep 20cm, loose-bottom or springform cake tin. Lay two large sheets of baking parchment, one on top of the other, one sheet turned 45 degrees, so the corners point in different directions. Push the parchment into the tin, pressing into the corners and making sure plenty of paper is sticking out above the rim. Press the creases up the sides, but don’t worry about lining the tin too neatly – the grooves in the parchment give this cheesecake its characteristic look.","Tip the soft cheese and sugar into a large bowl or astand mixer. Beat together using an electricwhisk(or stand mixer) for a minute or 2, until the grains of sugar have dissolved – check this by rubbing a little of the mixture between your fingertips. If it feels grainy, keep mixing for another minute or so.","Tip in the flour, soured cream, eggs, vanilla and ¼ tsp salt to the bowl and mix again until you have a smooth consistency. Pour into your lined cake tin, scraping out every last bit of cheesecake mixture. Give the tin a sharp bang on the worktop to remove any air bubbles, then bake for 30 mins.","Once cooked, the cheesecake should be deeply caramelised on the outside and puffed up like a soufflé. It will still have a wobble when you shake the tin. Leave it to cool completely in the tin – it will sink as it cools. Chill for at least 1 hr before serving.Will keep in the fridge for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8374,8374,'en','Red onion tarte tatin','Put red onion centre stage in this vibrant tarte tatin made with a puff pastry base and served with a punchy salsa verde. It’s an ideal dish for entertaining','["320g sheet ready-rolled puff pastry","50g unsalted butter","3 large red onions, cut into wedges, leaving most of the root intact","2 tbsp balsamic vinegar","30g light brown soft sugar","small handful of flat-leaf parsley, roughly chopped","small handful of mint, leaves picked and roughly chopped","small handful of chives, finely chopped","2 tbsp capers, roughly chopped","1 lemon, juiced","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","80ml extra virgin olive oil"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4. Unravel the puff pastry sheet, removing the parchment. Cut a 25cm circle from the pastry, using an ovenproof frying pan as a template. Put the pastry circle on a tray and chill until needed. Melt the butter in the same pan over a medium heat. Once foaming, arrange the onions in concentric circles in the pan, packing them in tightly, and reduce the heat to low. Season with a pinch of salt and cook for 10-15 mins until the onions are beginning to caramelise. Keep an eye on them so they don’t burn.","Add the vinegar and sugar, and turn the heat down to medium-low. Cook for 5-8 mins more until a sticky glaze has formed in the base of the pan and the onions are deeply caramelised. Remove the pastry from the fridge and put it on top of the onions, tucking it in around the edge. Prick it all over using a fork, then transfer to the oven and bake for 20-25 mins, or until the pastry is golden brown and puffed up.","Meanwhile, make the salsa verde. Combine the herbs and capers in a large bowl, then add the lemon juice, vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt, pepper and a pinch of sugar.","Remove the tarte tatin from the oven and leave to cool for 5 mins. Put a large plate over the pan and invert the tarte tatin onto it, leaving the pan in place (you’ll need to use oven gloves as the pan will still be hot). Leave the pan upside-down on the plate for a few minutes more (this will help the tart release from the base naturally), then remove the pan and spoon over the salsa verde before slicing into wedges to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8376,8376,'en','Bakewell pudding','For a warm and cosy alternative to the bakewell tart, try making this egg-based pud. It’s best served with cream or ice cream','["320g sheet ready-rolled all-butter puff pastry","150g butter , softened","150g caster sugar","3 eggs","150g ground almonds","1 lemon , zested","1 tsp almond extract","3 tbsp raspberry jam","25g flaked almonds","1 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Unravel the pastry and use it to line a 20cm cake or pie tin with sloped sides. Trim the pastry, leaving about 2cm overhanging. Chill the pastry case while you prepare the filling. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Beat the butter and sugar together in a bowl using an electric whisk for 2-3 mins until smooth and creamy.  Add the eggs, ground almonds, lemon zest, almond extract and a pinch of salt, then beat again until combined. Remove the pastry case from the fridge and spread the jam over its base, then spoon in the almond and egg mixture, smoothing it to the edge using a spatula. Scatter the flaked almonds on top and bake for 50 mins until golden brown. Leave to cool for at least 30 mins, then dust with icing sugar and serve with cream or ice cream.Will keep in an airtight container for a few days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8378,8378,'en','Courgette brownies','Growing courgettes in the garden? Use them to make these glorious fudgy courgette brownies studded with chocolate chips. Serve with vanilla ice cream','["200g unsalted butter, cut into cubes, plus extra for the tin","120g plain flour","50g cocoa powder","200g dark chocolate, broken into pieces","4 eggs","300g caster sugar","1 courgette (about 300g), grated","100g milk chocolate chips"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 30 x 20cm cake tin or deepbaking trayand line with baking parchment. Sift the flour and cocoa into a bowl and set aside.","Melt the butter and dark chocolate together in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, making sure the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Or, do this in short bursts in themicrowave. Once melted, set aside to cool slightly.","Beat the eggs and sugar together in a large bowl using an electricwhiskuntil thick and doubled in volume. (When you lift the beaters, the mixture should leave a trail that lasts 2-3 seconds.) Fold in the melted chocolate mixture followed by the flour mixture, then the grated courgette and milk chocolate chips. Do this gently to retain as much air in the batter as possible.","Tip the batter into the prepared tin, gently level the surface with aspatulaor palette knife, and bake for 20-30 mins, or until just set – the top should have a shiny crust, but the centre should have a slight wobble. Leave to cool completely in the tin, about 1 hr. Remove to a board and cut into 16 pieces.Will keep in an airtight container for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8380,8380,'en','Marble bundt cake','If you need an easy but impressive cake for a celebration or charity bake sale, try this chocolate and vanilla sponge cake','["180g butter, very soft, plus extra for the tin","6 eggs, separated","300g granulated sugar","250ml milk or cream","2 tbsp vanilla sugar","450g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","3 tbsp cocoa powder","icing sugar, to dust"]','["Butter and line a 2.5l bundt tin. Heat the oven to 180°C/160°C fan/gas 4. Beat the egg yolks with the sugar until lighter in colour, then beat in the soft butter followed by the milk or cream.","In another bowl, beat the egg whites until they form soft peaks, then add the vanilla sugar and beat until stiff. Beat the flour and baking powder into the yolk mixture, then fold in the egg whites.","Pour half of the batter into the tin, fold the cocoa powder into the remaining batter, then pour in over the vanilla layer. Use the handle of a spoon to swirl the batters together. Bake for about 1 hr or until the cake is risen and lightly browned and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean.","Remove the cake from the oven, let it cool for a while in the tin, then turn it out and leave to cool completely on a wire rack. Dust with icing sugar to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8382,8382,'en','Lemon & elderflower traybake','This clever twist on the classic bakewell has a delicate floral flavour, making it ideal for serving at spring garden parties or bake sales','["250g lemon curd, plus extra to decorate","250g butter, softened","250g caster sugar","2 lemons, zested","4 eggs","100g self-raising flour","150g ground almonds","200g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","125g cold unsalted butter, cut into cubes","1 tbsp caster sugar","1 lemon, zested","1 egg yolk","200g icing sugar","2 lemons juiced (use the zested lemons above)","2 tbsp elderflower cordial"]','["First, make the pastry. Tip the flour, butter, sugar and lemon zest into afood processorand blitz until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs. Tip in the egg yolk and ½-1 tbsp cold water and blitz again to bring everything together into a dough. If the dough isn’t coming together, add more cold water, ½ tsp at a time, and blitz again. Roll the pastry out on a lightly floured surface to a 3mm thickness, then use it to line the base of a loose-bottomed traybake or brownie tin (ours was 20 x 30cm). Transfer to the fridge and chill for 20 mins.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line the chilled pastry case with baking parchment and baking beans, then bake for 15 mins. Remove the parchment and beans and bake for 5 mins more until the pastry is lightly golden. Leave to cool for a few minutes before spreading over the lemon curd, leaving a 2cm border around the edges (it will spread out when the cake batter is poured over). Turn the oven down to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Beat the butter, sugar and lemon zest together using an electric whisk or in astand mixeruntil pale, light and fluffy, about 8 mins. Beat in the eggs, one at a time along with 1 tbsp of the flour, then fold in the remaining flour and the ground almonds. Carefully spoon the batter over the lemon curd and gently spread out using the back of the spoon, then bake for 35-40 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin completely, then carefully remove to a board.","To make the icing, combine the icing sugar, lemon juice and elderflower cordial until loose enough to drizzle over the sponge, then swirl over extra lemon curd, if you like. Cut into squares and serve.Will keep in an airtight tin for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8384,8384,'en','Spiced parsnip & maple muffins','Got a glut of parsnips? Do something different with this familiar veg box favourite and rustle up some spiced parsnip and maple muffins for the cake tin','["200g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp ground cinnamon, plus extra to serve (optional)","1 tsp ground nutmeg","125g light brown soft sugar","1 parsnip (around 200g), peeled and grated","100g pecans, chopped, plus 10-12 whole pecans to serve (optional)","3 tbsp maple syrup","3 eggs","125ml vegetable oil","50g icing sugar","50g softened butter","100g soft cheese","1 tbsp maple syrup, plus extra for drizzling (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper cases. Sift the flour, baking powder, cinnamon and nutmeg into a large bowl. Tip in the sugar and rub any lumps between your fingers to break them up.","Mix in the grated parsnip and chopped pecans, ensuring that everything is fully combined. Pour the maple syrup into a jug and mix in the eggs and oil. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry, and mix with a wooden spoon until nearly combined with a few specks of flour remaining. Spoon about 2 tbsp of the batter into each case, so they’re about three-quarters full. Bake for 22-24 mins until risen and a skewer inserted into the middle of a muffin comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins before transferring to awire rackto cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the frosting. Sift the sugar into a bowl and beat in the butter using an electricwhisk. Fold in the soft cheese and maple syrup. If the frosting is too loose, whisk for a few minutes more or chill until it has stiffened up again.","Spoon or pipe the frosting over the cooled muffins, then drizzle over some maple syrup, dust with cinnamon and decorate each one with a whole pecan, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8386,8386,'en','Triple-chocolate Easter roulade','Make this deeply rich roulade for Easter Sunday – it’s almost like a cross between a cake and a brownie','["vegetable oil, for the tin","150g dark chocolate, chopped","5 eggs","150g golden caster sugar","2 tbsp cocoa powder, plus extra for dusting","110g white chocolate, chopped","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","250g mascarpone","200ml double cream","200ml double cream","200g milk chocolate, chopped","1 tbsp golden syrup","a mixture of mini chocolate eggs, to decorate","white and dark chocolate bars, roughly chopped or broken up, to decorate"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and lightly oil a 33 x 23cm swiss roll tin. Line the base and sides with baking parchment, then lightly oil again. Melt the dark chocolate in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water (ensuring the base of the bowl doesn''t touch the water), or in 20-second bursts in the microwave. Set aside to cool slightly.","Separate the eggs, putting the whites in one large bowl and the yolks in another. Whisk the whites to stiff peaks using an electric whisk – they should hold their shape. Tip the sugar into the yolks and whisk until the mixture is pale. Fold the melted dark chocolate into the yolk mixture, then loosen the chocolate mixture by folding in two big spoonfuls of the whipped egg whites. Add the remaining whipped egg whites, cocoa and ¼ tsp salt, and gently fold everything together to combine, being careful not to knock out the air. Spoon the batter into the prepared tin and bake for 18 mins. Remove from the oven and leave to cool until warm.","While the sponge is still warm, gently roll it up into a spiral (with the baking parchment inside) from one of the short ends. Leave to cool completely, still rolled up (this will make it easier to roll once it''s been filled). Melt the white chocolate as you did the dark, then leave to cool for 10 mins. Whisk together the vanilla, mascarpone, double cream and melted white chocolate until the mixture is thick and spoonable.","Place the rolled-up roulade on a sheet of baking parchment and carefully unravel. Remove the original baking parchment, then evenly spread the mascarpone and white chocolate filling over the sponge, leaving a small border around the edges. Using the parchment to guide you, roll the roulade back into a spiral and chill for 20 mins.","For the topping, heat the double cream in a small pan over a low heat until steaming. Tip the milk chocolate into a heatproof bowl with the golden syrup, then pour over the hot cream. Leave to stand for a moment, then stir everything together until melted together and smooth. Sit the roulade on a wire rack set over a baking tray and gently spoon the ganache over the top so it drips down the sides. Top the roulade with the mini chocolate eggs and pieces of chocolate, then leave to set slightly before cutting into slices.Will keep covered and chilled for up to 24 hrs."]','2026-01-10 12:21:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8388,8388,'en','Easy chocolate tart','Perfect for a dinner party, this vegan tart has a crunchy digestive base and creamy chocolate filling made with coconut milk','["350g digestive biscuits","2 tbsp cocoa powder","1 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp golden syrup","125-175g vegan margarine or butter, plus extra for the tin","2 x 400g cans coconut milk, chilled","200g dark chocolate","1 tbsp golden syrup","edible silver or gold glitter spray","raspberries"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Crush the biscuits to crumbs in a bowl using the end of a rolling pin or by pulsing in afood processor. Mix in the cocoa powder, flour, syrup and enough vegan margarine or butter to create a dough. Butter a 23cm loose bottom tart tin and press the mixture into the tin.","Bake in the oven for 10-12 mins, then leave to cool in the tin.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Open the cans of coconut milk which will have separated with the water at the top and the thick coconut at the bottom. Discard the water (or use it to make a smoothie) and tip the thick coconut into a bowl.","Break the dark chocolate into pieces and melt in themicrowaveon high in 10-second bursts, stirring in between, or in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water until smooth. Add the coconut along with the golden syrup and whisk together, beating hard until there are no lumps of coconut left.","Pour the filling over the base of the tart and put in the fridge to set for 3-4 hrs, or overnight.","Spray the tart with edible silver or gold glitter spray, if you like, and serve with raspberries.Will keep in the fridge for three days – it actually tastes even better one or two days after baking."]','2026-01-10 12:21:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8390,8390,'en','Baked mücver (courgette & feta bake)','Turn Med-inspired courgette fritters into a large bake – it’s easier to cook, more substantial and can be served as lunch with a side salad and garlic yogurt','["6 courgettes (about 325g)","2 spring onions, finely sliced","½ small bunch of parsley, finely chopped","½ small bunch of mint, finely chopped","½ small bunch of dill, finely chopped, plus extra to serve","4 eggs","75g grated halloumi","100g crumbled feta","2 garlic cloves, grated","4 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for the tin","80g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tbsp toasted sesame seeds, plus extra to serve","1 tbsp nigella seeds, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Coarsely grate the courgettes into a clean tea towel, wrap and squeeze out all of the excess liquid. Tip into acolanderthen set aside to drain completely. Meanwhile, tip all of the remaining ingredients into a large bowl. Add the drained, grated courgettes, season and mix.","Line a roughly 25-26cm round ovenproof dish or cake tin with baking parchment and drizzle with the extra olive oil to cover the surface. Heat the dish in the oven for 5 mins.","Carefully remove the dish from the oven and pour the courgette mixture over the hot oil (this will ensure the mixture browns on the bottom). Sprinkle with the extra sesame and nigella seeds and bake for 35 mins until golden brown on top. Leave to rest for at least 20 mins before serving scattered with more dill."]','2026-01-10 12:21:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8392,8392,'en','Lemon drizzle cake','It’s difficult not to demolish this classic lemon drizzle in just one sitting, so why not make two at once?','["225g unsalted butter, softened","225g caster sugar","4 eggs","225g self-raising flour","1 lemon, zested","1½ lemons, juiced","85g caster sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Beat togetherthe butter and caster sugar until pale and creamy, then add the eggs, one at a time, slowly mixing through.","Sift in the self-raising flour, then add the lemon zest and mix until well combined.","Line a loaf tin (8 x 21cm) with greaseproof paper, then spoon in the mixture and level the top with a spoon.","Bake for 45-50 mins until a thinskewerinserted into the centre of the cake comes out clean.","While the cake is cooling in its tin, mix together the lemon juice and caster sugar to make the drizzle.","Prick the warm cake all over with a skewer or fork, then pour over the drizzle – the juice will sink in and the sugar will form a lovely, crisp topping.","Leave in the tin until completely cool, then remove and serve.Will keep in anairtight containerfor 3-4 days, or freeze for up to 1 month."]','2026-01-10 12:21:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8394,8394,'en','Lemon clotted cream cake','Make a rich and delicately lemony cake as an afternoon treat. It has a lovely lemon curd swirled through to give it a sticky topping. Enjoy with ice cream','["125g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","200g golden caster sugar, plus 2 tbsp","100g clotted cream","2 lemons, zested and juiced","2 eggs","200g self-raising flour","¼ tsp baking powder","4 tbsp lemon curd","vanilla ice cream, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 20cm round cake tin and line with baking parchment. Put the butter, 200g sugar, the clotted cream and lemon zest in the bowl of a stand mixer and beat for 3-5 mins until lightened in colour and creamy. Alternatively, use a large bowl and wooden spoon. Pour in half the lemon juice and beat for a further 2 mins until well combined. Crack in the eggs, one at a time, beating well after each addition. Finally, stir in the flour and baking powder, making sure it’s just combined, with no pockets of flour. Scrape the mixture into the tin – it will be quite thick. Beat the lemon curd in a small bowl to loosen, and drizzle over the batter. Bake for 40-45 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 15 mins.","Meanwhile, pour the remaining lemon juice and 2 tbsp sugar into a bowl. Stir well to combine before generously drizzling this over the cake. Transfer to awire rackto cool completely, then cut into slices and serve with vanilla ice cream, if you like.Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8396,8396,'en','Salted caramel cupcakes','Treat yourself to these easy cupcakes with a caramel-flavoured sponge and salted caramel topping. Perfect for afternoon tea','["100g softened salted butter","100g golden caster sugar","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g self-raising flour","1 tbsp milk","6 tsp caramel sauce","75g soft salted butter","150g icing sugar","200g caramel sauce","a pinch of sea salt flakes"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a 12-hole cake tin with paper cases.","Beat the butter and sugar together with an electricwhiskuntil pale and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, and the vanilla extract. Briefly mix in the flour until just combined, and stir in the milk until the batter just falls off the beaters.","Divide the mixture between the cases, leaving about 2 tbsp batter in the bowl. Add a pinch of salt to the caramel sauce if it’s not salted caramel, then add ½ tsp to the tops of each cupcake. Use a teaspoon to cover the caramel sauce with the remaining batter. Bake for 15-20 mins until springy and golden. Leave to cool completely on awire rack.","Meanwhile, make the icing. Beat the butter and half of the icing sugar together, then tip in the remaining icing sugar and whisk vigorously until pale and fluffy. Stir in half of the caramel sauce, then spoon the mixture into apiping bagwith a round or star nozzle.","Pipe swirls of icing on top of the cooled cupcakes. Stir the remaining caramel sauce with a pinch of salt, if unsalted, then use to drizzle over the icing. Sprinkle over a small pinch of sea salt over each, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8398,8398,'en','Sourdough hot cross buns','Enjoy baking sourdough bread? Then you have to give these hot cross buns a go. They take more effort, but the result is some of the best buns you’ll ever taste','["300g active sourdough starter (see recipe, below)","2 large eggs, beaten","200ml milk","500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","60g golden caster sugar","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp mixed spice","1 orange, zested","150g raisins, or a mixture of small dried fruits (such as raisins, mixed peel and cranberries)","100g unsalted butter, softened"]','["Before you start, ensure the sourdough starter is very bubbly (if it’s not, feed it and wait until 1 tsp of the starter floats in warm water). Tip 200g of the starter into a large bowl with all but 2 tbsp of the egg, the milk, flour, sugar, cinnamon, mixed spice, orange zest and raisins. Mix with your hands until you have a shaggy dough (all the flour should be mixed in). Or, do this in astand mixerfitted with a dough hook. Cover with a clean, damp tea towel and leave to prove for 30 mins. Cover the rest of the sourdough starter and keep chilled.","Work the butter and 1 tsp salt into the dough by squashing it in using your hands. Once fully combined, tip the dough onto a surface and knead gently for 5 mins until smooth and springy (again, this can be done in a stand mixer fitted with a dough hook). Form the dough into a ball, then return it to the bowl. Cover and leave somewhere slightly warm for 3-4 hrs to prove until the dough has almost doubled in size.","Tip the dough onto a floured work surface and knead briefly, then divide into 12 pieces, about 100g each. Roll the pieces into balls and arrange on abaking traylined with baking parchment, leaving some room between each. Cover with a clean, damp tea towel, then leave to prove again for 2-3 hrs at room temperature until doubled in size, or chill overnight (this will result in better flavour and a neater shape).","If the buns have been chilled, remove from the fridge 1 hr before baking. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Brush the buns with the reserved egg. Tip the remaining starter into apiping bagfitted with a small nozzle, and pipe crosses onto the buns. Bake for 20-25 mins until light brown. Leave to cool slightly and serve warm, or cool completely.Best eaten on the day, but will keep for two days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:21:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8400,8400,'en','Crusty bread','Try our next level recipe for crusty white bread – it takes a lot longer to prepare but the result will be the best loaf of bread you’ve baked at home','["500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","4g fast-action dried yeast","10g fine sea salt, sea salt flakes or table salt"]','["Tip the flour into a large bowl along with the yeast. Pour over 325g room-temperature water (you’ll get a more accurate amount by weighing the water, but you can also use 325ml, depending on yourscales), then use your hands or aspatulato mix until a dough forms. It’s important that you ensure all of the flour is mixed in, including any bits around the side of the bowl. Cover with a damp tea towel and leave to rest for 30 mins.","Sprinkle over the salt, then work it in by stretching the dough over the salt several times until fully incorporated. Tip out onto a lightly floured surface. Use the heel of one hand to stretch the dough while you hold it with your other hand. Then, fold the dough back onto itself, turn it 90 degrees to the left and repeat. Do this for about 5 mins, or until the dough looks shinier and immediately bounces back when rolled into a tight ball or gently poked. Roll the dough into a tight ball, cover with a damp tea towel and leave to prove at room temperature for 1 hr until doubled in size. Or, for a deeper flavour, transfer to a clean bowl, cover and leave to prove in the fridge overnight until doubled in size. Cold dough is easier to work with, so overnight is best.","When the dough has doubled in size and is light and pillowy, tip it out onto a work surface and knead it a few more times to knock the air out. Gather the dough into a ball and leave to rest for 5 mins. Gently form the dough ball into a tight, rounded shape on the work surface, then tip domed-side down into a proving basket or bowl lined with a clean tea towel. Leave to prove in a warm place for 40 mins-1 hr, or in the fridge for 2-3 hrs until roughly doubled in size.","Put a casserole along with its lid in the oven, then heat the oven to 230C/210C fan/gas 8. Once the oven is at temperature, remove the casserole. Flip the dough onto a square of baking parchment, slash it using a sharp knife and use the sides of the parchment to carefully lower the dough (still on the parchment) into the hot casserole. Cover with the lid. Bake for 25 mins. Remove the lid and bake for 5-10 mins more until it has a deeply golden, crisp crust and sounds hollow when tapped on the bottom. Cool on awire rackfor 40 mins before slicing.Will keep in an airtight container for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8402,8402,'en','Cowboy pie','What says comfort food better than sausages and baked beans in a pie topped with cheesy, buttery mashed potato? This is a guaranteed family favourite','["2 tsp sunflower oil","1 onion, finely chopped","8 pork sausages, cut into bitesize pieces","2 garlic cloves, crushed or finely grated","2 tsp hot smoked paprika","2 x 410g cans baked beans","3 tbsp barbecue sauce","1 kg potatoes, peeled and roughly chopped","50g butter","4 tbsp milk","75g grated cheddar","2 tbsp chopped chives, to garnish, optional"]','["First, make the mashed potato. Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil over a medium heat, then carefully tip in the chopped potatoes. Cook for 15-20 mins until tender. Drain, then tip back into the pan and leave to air-dry for a couple of minutes before mashing. Tip in the butter and milk, and stir through until combined. Set aside with the lid on to keep warm.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C/gas 6. While the potatoes are cooking, heat the oil in a frying pan orsaucepanover a medium heat and fry the onion for 6-8 mins until softened. Tip in the sausage pieces and fry for 4 mins until browned all over, then add the garlic and cook for 1 min before stirring in the smoked paprika and cooking for 1 min more. Pour in the beans and barbecue sauce and cook until just about to simmer before removing from the heat.","Spoon the sausage and bean mixture into an ovenproof tin or dish (ours was 20x20cm), then spoon over the mashed potato and sprinkle the grated cheddar on top. Bake in the oven for 25-30 mins until bubbling round the edges and the cheese is golden. Remove from the oven and scatter over the chives, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:21:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8404,8404,'en','Brazilian carrot cake','Love carrot cake? Try this Brazilian-inspired take on the baking favourite, with a chocolate drizzle topping which takes it to new levels of deliciousness','["250ml vegetable oil, plus extra for the tin","260g plain flour","400g caster sugar","1 tsp baking powder","2 medium carrots (around 250g), peeled and roughly chopped","2 eggs","250ml milk","30g cocoa powder","60g caster sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Oil and line the base of a 20cm springform cake tin. Mix the flour, sugar and baking powder together in a large bowl and set aside. Tip the oil, carrots and eggs in ablenderand blitz until smooth. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry, stirring until smooth.","Pour the batter into the cake tin and give it a shake to get rid of air bubbles. Bake for 45 mins to 1 hr, until a clean knife or skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. If the middle is sticky, put back in the oven for a further 5 mins. Remove from the oven and leave to cool in the tin.","For the drizzle, heat the milk, cocoa and sugar in a saucepan over a low heat. Stir until the sugar dissolves (about 5 mins), creating a thick, shiny drizzle.","Remove the cake from the tin and level the top using aserrated knife, then flip so the bottom becomes the top. Pierce all over using a knife or toothpick and put on a wire rack with a tray or large bowl underneath. Pour the drizzle over the cake in batches until it’s all absorbed. You can reuse any drizzle caught in the tray or bowl. Most of the drizzle should be absorbed."]','2026-01-10 12:21:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8406,8406,'en','Coconut cookies','Make these coconut cookies for the perfect pick-me-up. They’re coated in luxurious dark chocolate and toasted coconut sprinkles','["200g unsalted butter, softened","75g caster sugar","75g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","1 large egg","275g plain flour","125g desiccated coconut, toasted and cooled","100g dark chocolate"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Beat the butter in a large bowl using an electricwhiskor in astand mixeruntil very soft. Beat in both sugars and the vanilla until light and fluffy, then beat in the egg until just combined. Sift in the flour and a pinch of salt and stir to combine. Fold in 100g of the toasted coconut.","Roll the dough into 14-16 balls (about 45g each) and arrange on a baking sheet lined with baking parchment, well spaced apart. Flatten each slightly using the palm of your hand and bake for 12-15 mins until golden brown and slightly firm to the touch. Leave to cool on the sheet briefly, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.","Break the chocolate into pieces and tip into a heatproof bowl, then melt in 20-second bursts in themicrowave. Or set the bowl over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water, stirring until smooth. Dip one half of each cookie into the melted chocolate, then lay on a sheet of baking parchment and sprinkle with the remaining toasted coconut. Leave to set for about 30 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:21:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8408,8408,'en','Stollen bites','Turn stollen into bite-size treats. With squidgy, sweet bread studded with fruit and wrapped in marzipan, it’s easy to see why this German bake is so popular.','["150g sultanas","300g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp caster sugar","¼ tsp ground cardamom","¼ tsp ground nutmeg","¼ tsp ground cinnamon","150ml whole milk","2 tsp vanilla extract","1 medium egg","1 lemon, zested","100g glacé cherries, roughly chopped","flavourless oil, for proving","250g marzipan","100g icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","75g unsalted butter"]','["Put the sultanas in a heatproof bowl and pour over 100ml hot water from thekettle. Leave to soak for at least 2 hrs, or overnight.","Tip the flour, yeast, caster sugar, spices and 1 tsp salt into a large bowl. Heat the milk in a pan over a low heat or microwave until just warm, but do not boil.Whiskthe vanilla and egg into the warm milk, and pour into the dry ingredients. Use your hands to combine everything into a soft dough, then tip out onto a work surface and knead for 8-10 mins until soft and springy. (You can also do this in a stand mixer fitted with the dough hook, for 5 mins.)","Drain the sultanas well and knead these into the dough along with the lemon zest and cherries until the fruit is evenly distributed. Clean the bowl and lightly oil it, then return the dough to the bowl, cover with a clean tea towel and leave to prove in a warm place for 2 hrs, or until roughly doubled in size. You can also prove in the fridge overnight to enhance the flavour of the dough.","Line a 20 x 20cm cake tin with baking parchment. If the dough is chilled, leave it at room temperature for 1 hr before shaping. On a floured work surface, halve it and roll or stretch each piece into a square to fit the tin. Use one piece to line the base, thenroll outthe marzipan on a surface dusted with icing sugar to the same size as the dough and lay it on top. Lay the second dough square over that, pinching it around the edges to seal in the marzipan. Cover loosely and prove again for 30 mins-1 hr, or until risen slightly. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Bake for 30 mins until golden brown. Leave to cool in the tin for 5-10 mins, then lift out onto awire rackand leave to cool completely. Once cooled, cut into 25-36 mini squares (use a ruler if you want to be precise). Melt the butter in a small pan over a low heat and use this to brush the tops of the stollen bites, then dust generously with the icing sugar. Leave to set for 30 mins, then serve.Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8410,8410,'en','Rhubarb & custard blondies','Add custard powder to blondie mix for an extra fudgy texture. Pair with rhubarb for a classic flavour combination, or try swirling in some jam or compote','["225g salted butter (or unsalted with a pinch of salt), plus extra for the tin","200g light brown soft sugar","100g caster sugar","150g plain flour","50g custard powder","½ tsp baking powder","3 medium eggs","250g white chocolate chips or white chocolate finely chopped","2 tsp vanilla extract","200g rhubarb (frozen, or canned and drained is fine)","75g caster sugar","pink or red food colouring (optional)","4 tbsp ready-made custard (from a carton is fine, or made up from powder)"]','["For the rhubarb & custard swirl, put the rhubarb and sugar in a wide pan with 2 tbsp water (omit the water if using canned rhubarb). Cook over a medium heat, stirring frequently for about 10 mins, until the rhubarb breaks down and turns jammy. Add a few drops of food colouring if you want a pink rhubarb swirl, but the flavour will still be great if you’re using green-tinged rhubarb. Leave to cool.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the butter and both sugars into a pan and put over a low heat. Melt together until smooth and shiny, then remove from the heat, and leave to cool for 10 mins while you sieve the flour, custard powder and baking powder in a bowl. Butter a 20 x 30cm baking tin and line with baking parchment.","Beat the eggs into the cooled sugar and butter mixture, then fold in the dry ingredients until you have a smooth batter. Stir in 150g of the chocolate chips and the vanilla. Pour into the brownie tin, then use a teaspoon to swirl rhubarb compote on top of the batter. Add dollops of the custard, then swirl a skewer or cocktail stick through the compote to create a marbled pattern.","Bake for 35-40 mins until set and the edges are coming away from the sides of the tin, then leave in the tin to cool. Melt the remaining 100g chocolate in short blasts in themicrowaveor in a bowl set over a pan of simmering water. Use a spoon to drizzle the chocolate over the blondie in a zig-zag pattern. Cut into squares to serve.Will keep for three days in an airtight container, or freeze the squares individually."]','2026-01-10 12:21:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8412,8412,'en','Jammy blackberry & almond crumble cake','Enjoy these blackberry and almond cake slices for afternoon tea, or as dessert served with vanilla ice cream. They’re made with fresh blackberries and jam','["225g butter, plus extra for the tin","225g golden caster sugar, plus 1 tbsp","3 medium eggs","275g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","50g ground almonds","2 tbsp milk","1 tsp vanilla or almond extract","3 tbsp berry jam of your choice (we used blackcurrant)","150g blackberries","handful of flaked almonds"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4, butter a 20cm square tin and line with baking parchment. Beat 200g of the butter and 200g of the sugar together in a large bowl using an electricwhiskuntil light and fluffy. Beat in the eggs, one at a time, until well combined. When smooth and creamy, add 225g of the flour, the baking powder, almonds, milk and vanilla, and mix to combine.","Scrape the mixture into the tin and level the surface with aspatula. Dot over teaspoons of jam, then scatter over the blackberries, pressing them in gently.","To make the crumble topping, weigh the remaining 25g butter and 25g sugar into a bowl, add the rest of the flour and a pinch of salt. Rub the ingredients together between your fingertips until they are a crumbly consistency. Mix in the flaked almonds, then scatter the crumble over the cake. Scatter with the 1 tbsp caster sugar and bake for 45 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean.","If the cake isn’t ready, return to the oven for 5-10 mins more, then check again. Leave to cool for at least 20 mins in the tin before slicing and serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8414,8414,'en','Puff pastry cinnamon rolls','Use ready-made puff pastry to quickly and easily make these cinnamon rolls – an all-butter pastry will give the best flavour','["1½ tbsp ground cinnamon","3 tbsp caster sugar","320g ready-rolled puff pastry","plain flour, for dusting","1 medium egg, beaten","50g icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line largebaking traywith baking parchment. Stir the cinnamon and sugar together in a small bowl. Unravel the puff pastry on a lightly floured work surface, then sprinkle the cinnamon sugar mixture all over the top. Gently level the cinnamon sugar mixture with the back of a spoon so it covers the pastry almost completely, leaving a 1cm border on one of the short sides. Brush a little of the beaten egg over the exposed pastry border.","Roll the pastry up in a tight log from the short side without the border. Gently press along the egg-washed border to seal, then slice into 12 equal rounds. Arrange the cinnamon rolls on the prepared baking tray, placing them up against each other so they''re just touching. Brush the remaining beaten egg all over the tops and sides of the pastry, then bake for 15-18 mins until golden and risen. Leave to cool on the tray for 10-15 mins.","Combine the icing sugar with 1½ tsp water in a small bowl until you have a thick icing that easily runs off the spoon. Drizzle this over the warm rolls, then immediately serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8416,8416,'en','Citrus, almond & yogurt cake','Enjoy this zesty citrus, almond and yogurt cake for afternoon tea. Best served warm with a cup of tea','["165g butter, plus extra for the tin","200g golden caster sugar, plus 2 tbsp","150g self-raising flour","100g ground almonds","3 eggs","75g natural yogurt, plus 2 tbsp","1 large lemon","1 orange","100g icing sugar","15g toasted flaked almonds"]','["Melt the butter in a small pan. Remove from the heat and leave to cool slightly. Meanwhile, butter a 23cm springform cake tin and line with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Put the 200g caster sugar, flour and ground almonds in a largebowland mix well.Whiskthe eggs and 75g yogurt into the cooled melted butter, then pour this into the bowl with the dry ingredients. Zest the lemon and orange over the bowl. Stir with aspatulauntil there are no streaks of flour, then scrape into the tin and bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 40 mins.","Cut a few slices each from the zested lemon and orange, then squeeze the juice from what’s left of each into a saucepan (you’ll need about 6 tbsp total). Add the 2 tbsp caster sugar and the fruit slices to the pan. Bring to the boil and cook for 5-10 mins, or until the juice has reduced to a thin syrup and the fruit slices have softened. Leave to cool. Remove the fruit slices to a sheet of baking parchment and leave to dry.","Insert a skewer into the middle of the cake – it should come out dry, with no wet cake mix clinging to it. If it’s not ready, bake for 5-10 mins more and check again. Leave to cool in the tin for 5 mins, then spoon over the citrus syrup. Leave to cool for 10 mins more, then remove from the tin.To freeze, first leave to cool completely, then wrap the cake well. Will keep frozen for up to three months.","Mix the 2 tbsp yogurt with the icing sugar to make a thick icing. Spoon this onto the centre of the cake and use the back of a spoon to ease it to the edge (it should drip over the side). Scatter over the flaked almonds and decorate with the fruit slices. Serve warm, or leave to cool completely.Will keep in an airtight tin for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8418,8418,'en','Next level chocolate chip cookies','Forget brittle packet versions and make these ultimate choc chip cookies. Expect a crisp exterior, chewy middle and chunks of gooey dark chocolate','["125g unsalted butter","100g plain flour","100g rye flour","1 tsp sea salt flakes, plus extra for sprinkling","1 tsp baking powder","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","200g light brown soft sugar","100g golden caster sugar","1 large egg , plus 2 large yolks","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g chocolate , chopped into small chunks (choose dark or milk, or a mixture of the two)"]','["Melt the butter in a smallsaucepanuntil sizzling. Watch it carefully – the butter will foam, and, when the foam subsides, it will turn from yellow to a hazelnut brown. At this point, remove from the heat, tip into abowland leave to cool. Meanwhile, mix the flours, salt, baking powder and bicarb together in a bowl and set aside.","When the butter is cool, tip in the sugars and beat with a wooden spoon to combine. Add the egg, yolks and vanilla and beat together. Scrape the wet mixture into the dry ingredients and stir until it all comes together into a dough. Fold in the chocolate, then chill for at least 3 hrs, or until firm.Will keep chilled for up to 24 hrs.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line two largebaking sheetswith baking parchment. Separate the dough into 12 pieces, weighing for accuracy if you like. Roll each piece into a ball using your hands, then put six balls on each sheet, leaving space between them for spreading. Bake for 10 mins, then, one sheet at a time, remove from the oven, sprinkle with some sea salt and slam the sheet hard against your work surface.","Bake for another 3 mins, then repeat the slamming of the sheet. Bake for 3 mins more. This timing will give you soft cookies, but if you prefer them a bit firmer, cook for a few minutes longer. Leave to cool on the sheets for 10 mins before transferring to awire rackto cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:21:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8420,8420,'en','Date & walnut loaf','Bake this rich date and walnut loaf at the weekend to enjoy during the week. You can freeze it for another day to serve to last-minute guests, too','["125g unsalted butter, cubed and softened, plus extra for the tin","200g soft dates, pitted and roughly chopped","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","150g light muscovado sugar","2 eggs","1 tsp baking powder","225g self-raising flour","100g walnuts, roughly chopped","1 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 2lb loaf tin (ours was 22 x 10cm and 6cm deep) and line with baking parchment. Put the butter, dates and bicarbonate of soda (which helps break down the dates) in a large bowl and add 150ml boiling water. Give it a stir so the butter melts, and leave to stand for around 20 mins until the dates have softened.","Whiskin the sugar until smooth, then gradually whisk in the eggs until combined. Beat in the baking powder, flour and a pinch of sea salt until there are no lumps of flour left and it’s smooth. Fold in three-quarters of the walnuts, then pour into the prepared tin. Sprinkle the remaining walnuts over the top.","Bake for 20 mins, then turn the oven down to 170C/150C fan/gas 3 and cook for another 45-50 mins until golden brown and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Leave the cake to cool in the tin for 15 mins, then transfer to acooling rackto cool completely. Lightly dust with the icing sugar and serve in slices.Freeze whole or cut into slices, then place in an airtight container or divide between reusable freezer bags. Can be frozen for up to three months. Defrost thoroughly overnight."]','2026-01-10 12:21:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8422,8422,'en','No-bake raspberry cheesecake','Customise our raspberry cheesecake by adding white chocolate, yogurt or mascarpone, or, for a richer base, swap the digestive biscuits for shortbread','["300g digestive biscuits","100g unsalted butter, melted","500g full-fat soft cheese","100g caster sugar, plus 2 tbsp","1 tsp vanilla extract","300ml double cream","300g raspberries","icing sugar, for dusting (optional)"]','["Blitz the biscuits in afood processoror tip into a food bag and bash to fine crumbs using a rolling pin. Transfer to a bowl and stir in the melted butter until the mixture looks like damp sand. Tip the buttery crumbs into a 20cm springform tin and press into the base using the back of a spoon until you have a smooth, even layer. Chill until needed.","Tip the soft cheese, sugar, vanilla, and cream into a bowl and beat using an electric whisk until thick and creamy. Fold in about two-thirds of the raspberries, pressing the berries lightly against the side of the bowl as you do to squeeze out some of their juices and lightly ripple the cream.","Scrape the cheesecake mixture over the chilled base and smooth the top with aspatula. Chill for at least 6 hrs, or preferably overnight.Can be made up to two days ahead and chilled. To serve, carefully remove from the tin, scatter with the remaining raspberries and dust with icing sugar, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:21:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8424,8424,'en','Fruit cake','Rustle up this easy boiled fruitcake for your cake tin. Packed with juicy raisins, sultanas, currants and mixed peel, it’s perfect for afternoon tea with a cuppa','["125g unsalted butter, cubed, plus extra for the tin","175g light brown soft sugar,","200g raisins","200g sultanas","100g currants","50g mixed peel","225g self-raising flour","1½ tsp mixed spice","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 eggs, beaten"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Butter and line a 900g loaf tin with baking parchment. Melt the sugar, butter and 225ml water in a largesaucepan. Once melted, add the raisins, sultanas, currants and mixed peel. Bring to a gentle boil, and stirring occasionally, cook until reduced and softened, around 10-15 mins. Remove from the heat and leave to cool to room temperature.","Tip the flour, mixed spice, bicarbonate of soda and a pinch of salt into a large bowl. Add the cooled fruit mixture and stir, then add the eggs and mix to combine. Bake for 45-55 mins until dark brown and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely. Cut into slices to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8426,8426,'en','Marble traybake','Get creative with Jane Dunn’s marble traybake, with vanilla and chocolate sponges and swirled buttercream. It’s a sweet treat the whole family will love','["375g unsalted butter, softened","375g golden caster sugar","6 medium eggs","375g self-raising flour","50g cocoa powder","2 tsp vanilla extract","250g unsalted butter, at room temperature","500g icing sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","50g cocoa powder"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4 and line a 23 x 33cm baking tin with baking parchment. Beat the butter and sugar together until light and fluffy using an electricwhisk, about 4-5 mins. Add the eggs and flour, then beat again until smooth. Divide the batter between two bowls. Add the cocoa powder to one and the vanilla to the other, then mix each bowl well to combine.","Drop alternating spoonfuls of the chocolate and vanilla batters into the prepared tin until everything has been used up. Use a skewer or the tip of a cutlery knife to slightly swirl the batters together for a marble effect. Bake for 45-50 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool completely in the tin.","For the buttercream, beat the butter using an electric whisk until pale and soft. Sift in the sugar, a large spoonful at a time, and beat on a low speed to combine. Divide the buttercream between two bowls. Stir the vanilla into one and the cocoa into the other, and beat until light and fluffy. (Add 1-2 tbsp boiling water to loosen, if needed.)","Cut the cake into squares. Spoon the vanilla buttercream into one side of apiping bagfitted with a star nozzle and the chocolate into the other side. Pipe swirls over the squares to serve.Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8428,8428,'en','Quick florentines','Take a handful of ingredients and create these dark chocolate florentines. They make a delicious treat with your afternoon tea or a tasty homemade gift','["100g caster sugar","40g honey","60g butter","75g double cream","200g flaked almonds","60g ground almonds","100g dark chocolate"]','["Heat the sugar, honey and butter with the cream in a small pan. Bring the mixture to a boil and cook for 5 minutes. Add the almond flakes and ground almonds, take off the heat and mix everything well.","Heat the oven to 180C/fan 160/gas 4. Use two teaspoons to form 35 small heaps on a baking sheet lined with baking parchment. Bake for 15 minutes or until lightly caramelised to a golden colour. If the mixtures separates, simply put it back into piles with the two teaspoons.","Let the florentines cool completely. Melt the dark chocolate in a microwave or a bowl set over a pan of simmering water. Using a pastry brush, brush the underside of each florentine with chocolate, place chocolate side up and leave to set."]','2026-01-10 12:21:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8430,8430,'en','Speculoos cookies','These delectable biscuits are easy to make and full of spice. Make a batch of these moreish bites for a thoughtful homemade gift for someone special','["270g plain flour, plus a little for dusting","150g caster sugar","pinch baking powder","2 tsp speculoos spice (a mixture of cinnamon, cloves, coriander, ginger, cardamom and nutmeg), available online","100ml milk","100g butter, at room temperature","200g flaked almonds"]','["Mix the flour, sugar, a pinch of salt, the baking powder and spice in a bowl. Add 50ml of milk and the butter. Knead quickly into a smooth dough, then wrap in foil and chill for 1 hour.","Heat the oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Line 2-3 baking sheets with baking parchment. Sprinkle the baking parchment with the flaked almonds. Roll the dough out on a lightly floured worksurface to about 3mm thick. Cut into rectangles (about 4cm x 6cm). Put these on the trays and press them down lightly on the almonds. Brush the biscuits with the remaining milk and bake for 8 minutes, keeping an eye on them to make sure they don’t get too brown at the edges. Allow to cool.","Trim any almonds sticking out of the edges of the speculoos to neaten them.Store in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:21:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8432,8432,'en','Simnel cinnamon rolls','Roll all your favourite Easter treats into one spiced sticky bun with these fragrant breakfast rolls. We’ve proved them in the fridge for a better flavour','["3 eggs, beaten","125ml milk","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","½ tsp mixed spice","40g light muscovado sugar","100g unsalted butter, at room temperature, plus extra for the tin","100g raisins","125g butter, softened","125g light muscovado sugar, sifted","1 tbsp ground cinnamon","500g marzipan (see tip below)","2 tbsp golden syrup"]','["Tip the eggs, milk, yeast, flour, mixed spice, sugar and 1 tsp salt into the bowl of astand mixerfitted with the paddle attachment. Beat until the mixture comes together into a smooth dough, then beat for 2 mins more. Gradually add the butter, 1-2 tsp at a time, while mixing on medium speed. When all the butter has been incorporated, tip in the raisins and mix for 1 min. If you don’t have a stand mixer, stir everything together in a bowl, slowly kneading in the butter using your hands, followed by the raisins. Tip the dough out onto a lightly floured surface and flatten into a square roughly 20 x 20cm. Cover and chill for 30 mins or up to 2 hrs.","Meanwhile, for the filling, beat the butter, sugar and cinnamon with a pinch of salt using anelectric whisk. Set aside at room temperature. Butter a roughly 30 x 20cm baking tin and line with baking parchment. Roll the chilled dough out on a lightly floured surface to a roughly 40 x 30cm rectangle. Spread the cinnamon butter over the surface until completely covered. Roll out 400g of the marzipan on a lightly floured surface into a rectangle the same size as the dough, then lay this over the cinnamon butter layer. With a long edge facing you, roll the dough into a tight log. Cut in half to make two logs, then lift both onto a tray and freeze for 15 mins, or chill for 30 mins-1 hr mins to firm up.","Cut the chilled logs into 12 equal slices, then arrange these, spiral side-up, in the prepared tin. Leave to prove for 1 hr in a warm place, or for up to 24 hrs in the fridge until they’re about a third larger in size and are touching at the sides.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Bake the rolls for 20 mins. Meanwhile, roll the rest of the marzipan into 11 balls. After 20 mins, place the marzipan balls on 11 of the rolls, leaving one plain (this traditionally represents the apostles and Judas on a simnel cake). Bake for 10-15 mins more until the rolls are golden brown and the marzipan balls are toasted.","Mix the golden syrup with 2 tsp boiling water. Immediately brush the hot rolls (but not the marzipan balls) with the syrup glaze. Leave to cool slightly before eating warm or at room temperature. Will keep in an airtight container for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8434,8434,'en','Little burnt honey & almond cakes','Serve these honey and almond cakes warm for dessert, or just as a teatime treat. Dust with icing sugar and enjoy with our hot chocolate espresso sauce','["50g butter, plus extra for the tin","1 tbsp honey","1 egg","50g golden caster sugar","30g plain flour","30g ground almonds","½ tsp baking powder","icing sugar, for dusting (optional)"]','["Put the butter and honey in a smallsaucepanand cook over a medium-high heat for 2-3 mins until the butter foams and the mixture turns a mahogany colour.","Whiskthe egg, sugar and the honey and butter mixture together in a large bowl. Stir in the flour, almonds, baking powder and a pinch of sea salt to make a batter.Can be used straightaway or kept in the fridge overnight.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and butter four holes of a muffin tin. Divide the mixture between the holes and bake for 12-14 mins until golden and cooked through. Turn out onto acooling rackand leave to cool for a few minutes. Dust with icing sugar, if you like, and serve with hot chocolate espresso sauce (see ''goes well with'', below)."]','2026-01-10 12:21:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8436,8436,'en','Classic rice pudding','Have this creamy rice pudding cooking in the oven while you make dinner and round off your meal with a comforting pud. Serve with jam for a feel-good treat','["butter, for the dish","130g pudding rice","70g caster sugar","2 tsp vanilla bean paste or 1 vanilla pod, split and seeds scraped out","800ml whole milk","170ml double cream","grating of nutmeg","fruit jam of your choice, to serve (strawberry or apricot work well)"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3 and butter a 1.5-litre baking dish. Put the pudding rice, sugar, vanilla, milk and cream in a bowl and stir to combine. Pour the mixture into the prepared dish and grate over a generous layer of nutmeg. Bake for 1 hr 30 mins until a brown skin has formed on top and the rice is cooked and tender.","Leave to cool slightly, then scoop the warm pudding into bowls and serve with a dollop of jam on top."]','2026-01-10 12:21:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8438,8438,'en','Vegan ginger loaf cake','Get set for autumn with this iced and spiced ginger loaf cake. It’s a real treat, whether you’re vegan or not','["100ml vegetable oil, plus extra for the tin","275g self-raising flour","150g dark muscovado sugar","1 tsp baking powder","1 tbsp ground ginger","50g treacle","50g stem ginger from a jar, finely grated, plus 1 tsp of the ginger syrup","150g icing sugar","½ lemon, juiced","4 crystallised stem ginger pieces, sliced"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Oil a 900g loaf tin (ours was 19 x 9 x 6cm) and line with a long strip of baking parchment. Mix the flour, muscovado sugar, baking powder and ground ginger together in a large bowl. Tip in the oil, treacle, grated stem ginger and 170ml cold water, then beat together until smooth using a wooden spoon.","Pour the cake mixture into the prepared tin and bake in the centre of the oven for 45-50 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 5 mins, then transfer to awire rackto cool fully.","Sieve the icing sugar into a bowl, add the ginger syrup and mix in just enough lemon juice to make a thick, pourable icing that can coat the back of a spoon. Put the cake on a plate or stand, remove the parchment and drizzle over the icing. Immediately scatter over the stem ginger. Cut the cake into thick slices to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8440,8440,'en','Cherry loaf cake','Make this moreish cherry cake for afternoon tea or a coffee morning. Made with sweet glacé cherries and crunchy almonds, it won’t last long','["200g soft unsalted butter, plus extra for the tin","200g golden caster sugar","4 eggs","2 tsp vanilla extract","1 tsp almond extract (optional)","75g glacé cherries, patted dry if in syrup, then quartered","175g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","½ tsp baking powder","100g icing sugar","a drop of almond extract","1-2 tbsp milk","2 tbsp toasted flaked almonds"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 900g loaf tin and line with baking parchment. Beat the butter and sugar together until pale and fluffy, then beat in the eggs one at a time, followed by the vanilla and almond extract (if using).","Toss the cherries with 2 tbsp of the flour in a bowl. Tip the rest of the flour, the ground almonds, baking powder and a pinch of salt into the bowl with the sugar and eggs, and mix until just combined. Fold in the cherries and any remaining flour in the bowl. Spoon into the prepared tin and smooth over the top.","Bake for 50-55 mins, or until a skewer inserted in the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool for 10 mins in the tin, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely. Serve as it is, or mix the icing sugar with the extract and enough milk to make a thick but pourable consistency. Drizzle over the loaf cake, and scatter over the flaked almonds to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8442,8442,'en','White chocolate cake','If you’re celebrating a special occasion, this layer cake makes a great centrepiece. It’s topped with silky white chocolate ganache and fresh raspberries','["300g butter, softened, plus extra for the tins","300g caster sugar","5 large eggs, beaten","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","1 tsp baking powder","300g self-raising flour","100g white chocolate, finely chopped","350g fresh raspberries, halved","450g white chocolate, finely chopped","200ml double cream","1 tbsp vanilla paste"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter three 18cm sandwich cake tins and line with baking parchment. Beat together the butter, sugar, eggs, vanilla, baking powder and flour using astand mixeror electric hand whisk until you have a fluffy mixture, about 5 mins. Fold in the white chocolate until it’s well distributed throughout.","Divide the mixture evenly between the tins and level out using a palette knife or the back of a spoon until smooth. Bake for 25-30 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Remove from the oven and leave the sponges to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then remove from the tins and transfer to a cooling rack, top side down, and leave to cool completely. If the sponges are not level use a serrated knife to cut away the peaks.","While the sponges are cooling, make the ganache. Put the white chocolate in a large bowl. Pour the cream into a saucepan over a medium heat and bring to a simmer. Immediately pour the cream over the chocolate and leave to stand for 4-5 mins until the chocolate has melted. Mix together to form a smooth ganache, ensuring all the chocolate has fully melted, then mix in the vanilla. Chill in the fridge for 30 mins, stirring occasionally so it doesn''t completely harden, until spreadable and thick enough to coat the cake.","Once the sponges are cool and the ganache has set to a spreadable consistency, you can construct the cake. Place one sponge on a serving plate, spread over a thin layer of the chocolate ganache, then fill the middle with a third of the raspberries. Place another sponge on top and repeat with a layer of ganache and another third of raspberries. Put the final sponge on top and gently coat the whole cake with a thin layer of ganache. Leave in the fridge to set for at least 20 mins. To finish, spread over any remaining ganache and top with the remaining raspberries.Will keep chilled for up to three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:21:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8444,8444,'en','Halloween gingerbread','Make a batch of gingerbread for your biscuit tin this Halloween. Pipe ghoulish ghosts and monstrous mummies for the icing topping for a suitably spooky theme','["100g unsalted butter, cubed","50g golden syrup","50g black treacle","100g light brown soft sugar","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tbsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cinnamon","½ tsp mixed spice","225g plain flour","100g icing sugar","black writing icing"]','["Heat the butter, syrup, treacle and sugar in a medium saucepan over a low heat for 6-8 mins until the sugar has dissolved. Remove from the heat, and leave to cool for 10 mins.","Brieflywhiskthe bicarb, ginger, cinnamon, mixed spice and plain flour in a large bowl to combine. Add a pinch of salt, and the butter and sugar to the mixture. Mix briefly with a spoon, then knead to a rough ball in the bowl. Add 1 tbsp water to bring to the dough together, if you need to. Tip out onto a worksurface and knead briefly again until you have a soft, pliable dough. Press out to a flat disk, wrap and freeze for 15 mins or chill for 30 mins.","Roll the dough outon a lightly floured worksurface, split the dough into sections and work in batches if you need to. Roll out to 5mm thick. Cut out using a gingerbread person cutter. Reroll the offcuts. You’ll get 20-25 depending on the size of your cutter.","Transfer the biscuits to a parchment lined tray with a little room in-between and chill again for 10 mins.","Heat the oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3. Bake the gingerbread for 10-15 mins until the edges and lightly golden. Cool on the tray for 5 mins then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.","Mix icing sugar with ½-1 tbsp water to make a thick, pipeable icing. Transfer half of the icing to apiping bagand cut a very small hole in the bottom.","To make the ghostsUsing the piping bag icing to make an outline around the gingerbread people and leave to set. Once set, add a drop more water to the remaining icing in the bowl to loosen slightly, then use to fill the ghost shapes. Use a cocktail stick to smooth out the icing right up to the set outline. Leave to set again. Add two black dots for the eyes, then an oval for the open mouth.","To make the mummiesSnip a slightly larger hole in the piping bag at an angle, and go back and forth over the remaining gingerbread people, so it looks like bandages. Add two white dots as eyes and leave to dry. Add pupils to the white dots once set with the black writing icing."]','2026-01-10 12:21:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8446,8446,'en','Marzipan chocolate loaf cake','Combine the nutty marzipan flavour with a rich chocolate cake to make the ultimate treat. This easy recipe is perfect for baking with kids','["165g salted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","icing sugar, for dusting","350g marzipan","100g caster sugar","60g dark brown soft sugar","3 large eggs","200g self-raising flour","½ tsp baking powder","½ tsp almond extract","75ml milk","3 tbsp cocoa powder","50g dark chocolate chips","180ml double cream","140g dark chocolate, finely chopped","1 tbsp golden syrup","1 tsp almond extract"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 1kg loaf tin (ours was 14 x 24 x 7cm) and line with a long strip of baking parchment. Lightly dust a surface with icing sugar androll the marzipan outto a 1cm-thick rectangle, then cut it so that it’s just smaller than the base of the loaf tin.","Beat the butter and both sugars together in a large bowl using an electricwhiskuntil light and fluffy. Beat in the eggs, flour, baking powder, almond extract, milk and cocoa powder until smooth. Fold in the chocolate chips, scraping down the sides of the bowl to ensure everything is combined.","Pour half the batter into the tin. Top with the marzipan rectangle, then pour the remaining batter on top and smooth the surface. Bake for 1 hr-1 hr 15 mins until golden, risen and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool completely in the tin.","To make the ganache, bring the cream to a simmer in a small pan. Meanwhile, put the dark chocolate, golden syrup and almond extract in a heatproof bowl. Once the cream is simmering, pour it over the chocolate mixture and set aside for 2 mins to melt. Whisk until smooth, then leave for 5 mins to cool and thicken slightly. Pour the ganache all over the cake, and cut into slices to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8448,8448,'en','Salted caramel & hazelnut banoffee pie','Try a new take on banoffee pie with a crunchy hazelnut praline, salted caramel and muscovado whipped cream. A few cheat’s ingredients will save you time','["100g blanched hazelnuts","4 tbsp caster sugar","300g chocolate oat biscuits","85g salted butter, melted","400g dulche de leche","300ml double cream","3 tbsp dark muscovado sugar","1 tsp vanilla bean paste, or 1 tsp vanilla extract","3 medium bananas, peeled and sliced"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the hazelnuts onto a baking sheet, and toast in the oven for 10-15 mins until evenly golden. Tip into a bowl. Line the baking sheet with baking parchment and set aside.","Tip the caster sugar, half the toasted hazelnuts and a small pinch of sea salt into a smallsaucepanset over a low heat. Cook gently for 7-10 mins until the sugar melts and turns an amber colour – do not stir, but swirl the pan every now and again. Tip the mix onto the baking sheet. Leave to cool completely, then break up into small pieces.","Line the base of a 23cm fluted tart tin with baking parchment. Break the biscuits into afood processor, and blitz with the rest of the hazelnuts to a fine crumb. Or, seal the biscuits and nuts in a food bag and crush with a rolling pin. Tip the crumbs into a bowl and combine with the melted butter. Press into the base of the tin and up the side, then chill for 2 hrs.","Remove the cold tart base from the tin (if it sticks slightly, put it in a warm oven for 3-4 mins to help release it), then set on a serving plate. Spoon the dulche de leche into a bowl and gently fold in a large pinch of sea salt (don’t overmix, or it will become too loose).","Tip the cream, muscovado sugar and vanilla into another bowl and gently beat with an electricwhiskuntil softly whipped. Spread the salted caramel over the base of the tart, then arrange the banana slices on top. Spoon over the muscovado cream. Chill for at least 3 hrs, or overnight. Scatter with the hazelnut praline just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8450,8450,'en','Sausage & mash pie','Enjoy this ingenious take on a family favourite, sausage and mash. It brings the two ingredients together into one hearty pie that can be easily frozen','["1 tbsp sunflower oil","8 pork sausages","25g butter","2 onions, finely sliced","pinch of golden caster sugar","2 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","500ml beef stock","peas, to serve (optional)","1.25kg King Edward or Maris Piper potatoes, cut into large chunks","150ml whole milk","25g butter","25g mature cheddar, coarsely grated (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan and gently cook the sausages over a medium-high heat for 10-12 mins, turning them until browned on all sides. Transfer to a plate, then put the butter in the pan and heat until sizzling. Tip in the onions, stirring them into the butter, then sprinkle over the sugar and fry for 8-10 mins until the onions are golden. Scatter over the flour and stir to make a paste, then add the tomato purée. Cook for a minute, then add the vinegar, pour in the stock and bring to the boil. Turn down to a simmer. Tip in any juices from the sausages, then cut the sausages into thick slices and add to the pan. Simmer everything together for 5 mins until you have a glossy onion gravy. Tip the mixture into a baking dish.","To make the mash, tip the potatoes into a pan of cold salted water and bring to the boil, then turn down and simmer for 10-12 mins or until just cooked (the tip of a knife should slide in easily). Drain and leave for a minute. Pour the milk into the pan and bring to a simmer, then tip in the drained potatoes and butter, and mash thoroughly. Season to taste.","Top the sausages and gravy with the mash, starting from the edge of the dish and working your way into the middle. Use a fork to scrape lines in the topping and scatter over the cheese, if using.Can be assembled, covered and chilled for up to two days or frozen for three months. Defrost completely before cooking.Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Bake the pie on a tray for 35-40 mins until the top has browned. Leave to cool for 5 mins before scooping straight from the baking dish at the table and serving with peas, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8452,8452,'en','Egg custard','Treat the family to this baked egg custard for a comforting dessert. Serve warm or leave to cool in the fridge overnight and enjoy with poached fruit','["3 eggs, plus 1 yolk, lightly beaten","1 vanilla pod, split lengthways and seeds scraped out or 1 tsp vanilla bean paste","60g caster sugar","215ml whole milk","215ml double cream","nutmeg, to grate"]','["Heat the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2. Beat together the eggs, vanilla and sugar with a wooden spoon until combined. Mix in the milk and cream and pour into a medium-sized dish. Finely grate over a generous grating of nutmeg.","Half-fill a roasting tin with water to make a bain-marie. Place the dish in the tin so that the water comes about three-quarters of the way up the sides of the dish. Bake for 45-50 mins, or until just set with a slight wobble in the centre. Serve warm or leave to cool in the fridge overnight. Serve with poached fruit."]','2026-01-10 12:21:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8454,8454,'en','Maple pear, pecan & mascarpone roulade','Try the combo of pecans and maple syrup with juicy pears and a light-as-air sponge in this impressive roulade. It’s great with a cuppa or served as a pudding','["vegetable oil, for the tin","4 large eggs","1tsp vanilla extract","50g golden caster sugar","50g light brown soft sugar","100g plain flour","1tsp baking powder","½ tsp ground cinnamon","icing sugar, for dusting","3 small ripe pears, peeled, cored and chopped into 1cm pieces","1 lemon, juiced","250g mascarpone","150g double cream","5tbsp dark maple syrup, plus extra to serve (optional)","200g pecans"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Oil a 30 x 24cm swiss roll tin and line with baking parchment. Put the eggs, vanilla and both sugars in a largebowl, and beat with an electricwhiskfor 5 mins, or until thickened and doubled in volume. The beaters should leave a thick trail when lifted out of the mixture.","Sift over the flour, baking powder, cinnamon and ¼ tsp salt, and very gently fold in using a large metal spoon. Pour into the prepared tin and bake for 10-15 mins until golden and springy. Leave to cool in the tin a little, then turn out onto a sheet of baking parchment dusted with icing sugar. Roll up from a longer end, along with the parchment, then leave to cool.","Toss the pears with the lemon juice in a bowl, then tip into a sieve set over a bowl to drain off any excess liquid. Beat together the mascarpone, double cream and 3 tbsp of the maple syrup until thick and spoonable. Tip the pecans into afood processorand blitz until finely chopped, then spread out on a large sheet of baking parchment.","When the sponge is completely cool, unroll and drizzle over the remaining maple syrup. Spread with three-quarters of the mascarpone mixture, then scatter over the pears and roll up again tightly. Spread the remaining mascarpone all over the outside of the roulade, then swiftly roll in the chopped pecans. Cut into thick slices and serve with an extra drizzle of maple syrup, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8456,8456,'en','Blackberry & orange cake','Try a twist on layered sponge cake with blackberries, zesty oranges and marmalade in place of your usual filling. Pipe the topping for a professional look','["225g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tins","225g caster sugar","4 large eggs","1tsp vanilla extract","250g self-raising flour","1tsp baking powder","2 oranges, zested (reserve the oranges for the drizzle, below)","150g blackberries, halved if large","3 oranges, juiced (use the zested oranges, above, you’ll need about 150ml), 1 zested","100g caster sugar","150g unsalted butter, softened","350g icing sugar","1 orange, zested, plus extra zest to serve","1tbsp milk","200g marmalade","100g blackberries"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Butter two 20cm loose-bottomed cake tins and line with baking parchment. Beat the butter and caster sugar together in a largebowlusing an electricwhiskuntil pale and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, until combined. Tip in the vanilla, flour and baking powder and fold until smooth, then gently fold in the orange zest and blackberries, being careful not to overmix.","Divide the batter between the two tins and bake for 35-40 mins until golden and a skewer inserted into the middles comes out clean. Cover with foil after 30 mins if they start to colour too quickly.","Meanwhile, make the drizzle. Put the orange juice, zest and sugar in a small pan and simmer for 4-5 mins until a thin syrup forms. Pour into a heatproof bowl and set aside.","When the sponges are ready, drizzle the syrup over both while still warm and brush over evenly using a pastry brush. Leave to cool completely in the tins.","Meanwhile, make the buttercream for the topping. Beat the butter and icing sugar in a large bowl with an electric whisk until light, pale and fluffy. Whisk in the orange zest and milk until loosened slightly. Spoon into apiping bagfitted with a large round nozzle. Beat the marmalade to loosen, then transfer a little to a piping bag fitted with a small round nozzle.","Remove the cooled sponges from the tins, and place one on a cake board or plate. Pipe buttercream dots on top in a circle around the edge, then three dots in the middle. Spoon some marmalade into the gaps between the buttercream, then top with the second sponge. Pipe more buttercream dots all over the surface, then fill in the gaps by piping in the remaining marmalade. To finish, scatter with the blackberries and extra orange zest."]','2026-01-10 12:21:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8458,8458,'en','Roasted plum & pistachio custard pastries','Make the most of plums in late summer and bake them in a pastry case with a pistachio and custard filling. They’re well worth the effort','["50g cold butter, chopped, plus 120g frozen butter (see step 1)","300g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","50g icing sugar","2 eggs, beaten","100g pistachios, shelled","150ml whole milk","150ml double cream","3 egg yolks (freeze the whites for another recipe)","65g caster sugar","15g plain flour","15g cornflour","4 red plums, halved and stoned","1tbsp light brown soft sugar","1⁄2 tsp vanilla extract"]','["The night before you make the pastries, wrap 120g butter in foil and freeze until solid. Combine the flour, icing sugar and ¼ tsp salt in a largebowl. Add the chopped butter and rub into the flour mixture until it resembles fine breadcrumbs. Stir in 7 tbsp very cold water (if it still seems a little dry, add an extra 2 tbsp). Lightly knead the dough until it just comes together, thenroll outon a lightly floured surface into a rectangle. Using a coarse cheese grater, grate half the frozen butter over the middle and bottom thirds of the pastry. Fold down the top third and fold up the bottom third, as if folding a letter. Turn the pastry 90 degrees and repeat with the rest of the frozen butter. Wrap and chill for at least 30 mins.","Put 75g of the pistachios in a heatproof bowl. Cover with boiling water, then leave to soak for 5 mins. Drain, tip into afood processorand blitz for 5-10 mins until you have a smooth paste. Set aside.","Put the milk and double cream in a small pan set over a medium heat. Bring to a simmer, then remove from the heat. Whisk the egg yolks, caster sugar and flours together in a bowl. Gradually whisk in the milk mixture in several additions, then pour into a clean pan set over a low heat. Cook, stirring continuously, until the custard is thick. Simmer for 2 mins more, then stir in a small pinch of sea salt. Transfer to a bowl and leave to cool. Once cooled, tip into a food processor with the pistachio paste and blitz until smooth. Put in a bowl and set aside.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Put the plums in a roasting tin, cut-side down. Sprinkle over the sugar and vanilla. Roast for 15 mins until softened but holding their shape. Set aside to cool. Turn the oven up to 220C/200C fan/gas 8.","Roll the chilled pastry out on a lightly floured surface to a rectangle of about 38 x 24cm. Trim the sides with a sharp knife, then cut the pastry into eight 11 x 10cm rectangles. Score a 1cm border around each, then put on a baking tray lined with baking parchment (you may need two trays). Brush with the beaten egg, then chill for 15 mins. Bake for 20 mins. Push down the centres, then pipe or spoon in the pistachio custard and top each with a plum half. Bake for 10-15 mins more. Finely chop the rest of the pistachios and scatter them over the warm pastries. Leave to cool completely before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8460,8460,'en','Caramel apple cinnamon buns','Balance the sharp flavour of apple with the sweetness of caramel and a tangy soft cheese icing to make these toffee-apple-inspired cinnamon buns','["320ml milk (any milk will work), plus an extra splash","50g cold butter, cut into cubes","500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","2 tbsp light brown soft sugar","vegetable oil, for proving","3 medium eating apples, peeled, cored and cut into 1cm cubes","knob of butter","2 tbsp light brown soft sugar","100g butter, softened","100g light brown soft sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","1 tbsp cinnamon","150g soft cheese","150g icing sugar","large pinch of cinnamon","3 tbsp canned caramel"]','["Prepare the dough for the buns the day before you want to bake them, if you have time – this will develop a better flavour. Warm the milk in a pan until steaming but not boiling. Add the butter and swirl the pan for 1-2 mins until the butter has melted and the milk cooled slightly. It should be just warm.","Put the flour in a large bowl, or the bowl of astand mixer. Add the yeast and sugar to one side of the bowl, then ½ tsp salt to the other.Whisktogether, then pour in the warm buttery milk. Mix until the ingredients form a soft dough (it should be a little sticky), then tip onto a lightly floured work surface and knead by hand for 8-10 mins, or keep the stand mixer going for 5 mins or so. The dough will feel stretchy and soft when it’s ready – you should be able to pull it apart without it breaking straightaway (this means the gluten has been developed). Lightly oil a bowl, add the dough and cover. Leave to rise at room temperature for a few hours, or until the dough has doubled in size. Or, chill overnight.","To make the apple filling, cook the apples, butter, sugar and 1 tbsp water in a pan for 5-10 mins until soft and sticky. Add a splash more water if the pan looks dry or the sugar starts to burn. Leave to cool.","If the dough has been chilled, take it out of the fridge 30 mins before shaping. For the cinnamon butter, mix the butter, sugar, vanilla and cinnamon together with a pinch of salt. Tip the dough onto a lightly floured surface, shape into a rough rectangle, thenroll outuntil it’s about 50 x 40cm. Spread the cinnamon butter over the dough and all the way out to the edges. Spoon over the apple filling.","Working from one of the longer sides, roll the dough up as tightly as you can into a sausage shape. Cut into 12 equal pieces. To easily do this, first cut the dough in half crosswise, then cut each half into three pieces, then halve each piece. Line a large round baking dish or cake tin (about 33cm) with baking parchment. Arrange the buns, cut-side up, in the dish or tin. Make sure the tails of the buns (where the dough opens) are tucked in towards the middle of the tin, so they don’t unfurl when baked. Leave some space around each bun, as they will expand as they prove. Cover loosely and leave to rise for 30 mins-2 hrs (depending on how hot your kitchen is) until the buns are puffed up and touching at the sides. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Bake for 35-40 mins until golden. Check the buns after 25 mins – if they still look a little doughy at the centre but the edges are burning, cover with foil and continue baking. Leave to cool in the tin while you make the icing.","Mix the soft cheese, icing sugar and cinnamon together. Spread over the buns while still slightly warm, so the icing drips into the swirls of the buns a little without melting completely. Loosen the caramel with a drop of milk, if needed, then drizzle over the icing. Leave to set for 30 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8462,8462,'en','Iced finger buns','These picture-perfect iced buns are ideal for an afternoon tea spread or a weekend baking project. Fill with jam and cream for a traditional treat.','["350ml milk, plus extra for brushing","30g butter, cubed","500g strong white bread flour","10g fast-action dried yeast","2 tbsp caster sugar","300g icing sugar, plus 1 tbsp","yellow, pink and purple food colouring (optional)","300ml whipping cream, or double cream","200g lemon curd","200g raspberry jam","200g blackcurrant jam","glacé cherries, sprinkles or crystallised rose and violet petals, to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat the milk in a pan until steaming. Add the butter and swirl until melted. Leave to cool slightly. Tip the flour and yeast into a bowl or stand mixer fitted with a dough hook, then add the caster sugar and ½ tsp salt.","When the milk mix has cooled slightly (it should feel just warm), pour into the flour mix. If using a stand mixer, mix for 5-8 mins on a medium speed until springy. Or, knead in the bowl for about 10 mins – when the dough is pulled apart, it should be able to stretch without ripping.","Put the dough in a clean bowl, cover with a tea towel and leave to rise for 1½ hrs or until doubled in size. Or, transfer to the fridge to slowly rise for up to 24 hrs (this will improve the texture and flavour).","If the dough is chilled, remove from the fridge 1 hr before shaping. Divide into 10 equal portions (weigh them out if you want to be accurate). To make finger buns, take a piece of dough and roll it into a rough finger shape, like a mini hot dog bun. Tuck the sides into the middle of the bun. Flip the bun over, and make sure the surface is nice and taut. Arrange on a lined baking tray, leaving space between each. Cover loosely and leave to rise for 30 mins-1 hr until doubled in size.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Brush the buns with milk and bake for 25-30 mins until golden. Put on a wire rack and leave to cool.","Mix the icing sugar with 2-3 tbsp water – it should be thick. Divide between bowls, depending on how many food colourings you’re using (we used three). Dye each with a different colouring, adding a splash more water if needed.","Whisk the cream and 1 tbsp icing sugar until just holding its shape. Don’t overwhip, as it will thicken as you pipe (see tip below). Fit a piping bag with a star nozzle and fill with a third of the cream (see tip below).","Split the finger buns down the middle lengthways. Spoon roughly 60g lemon curd or jam over the bottom half of each bun (or down the middle), alternating the flavours, then pipe over a swirl of cream. Continue until all the buns are filled, refilling the piping bag with cream as needed. Spoon some icing over each bun, matching the colours to the jam (we used yellow for the curd, pink for the raspberry jam and purple for the blackcurrant). Decorate with the glacé cherries, sprinkles and crystallised petals, if you like, then leave to set for about 20 mins before serving.Best eaten the day they’re made, but will keep in the fridge for 24 hrs."]','2026-01-10 12:21:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8464,8464,'en','Pumpkin cornbread with whipped jalapeño butter','Spread a wedge of cornbread with some spiced jalapeño butter for a knockout combination served with a chilli con carne. It’s fantastic sharing food','["50g salted butter, melted, plus extra for the pan","300g fine semolina or polenta","150g plain flour","1 tbsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 large eggs","425g pumpkin purée","250ml buttermilk or natural yogurt","2 red chillies, seeds removed and finely chopped","150g butter, softened","25g sliced jalapeños from a jar, roughly chopped, plus 2 tbsp liquid from the jar"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Butter a 30cm ovenproof pan. Combine the semolina, flour, baking powder and bicarb in a large bowl and season. Put the butter, eggs, pumpkin, buttermilk and chillies in a jug and whisk until combined. Gradually stir the wet ingredients into the dry, being careful not to over-mix. Pour into the pan and bake for 50 mins-1 hr until golden.","Meanwhile, prepare the whipped jalapeño butter. Beat the butter with the jalapeños and the liquid from the jar using an electricwhisk, until the mixture has turned light and pale. Season to taste.","Once the cornbread is cooked, serve warm or leave to cool, with the jalapeño butter on the side to spread over.The cornbread will keep in an airtight container for up to three days, or frozen for two-three months. The butter will keep in the fridge, covered, for up to one week."]','2026-01-10 12:21:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8466,8466,'en','Vegan date & walnut flapjacks','Make these easy date & walnut flapjacks for elevenses, or when you need a pick-me-up. Plant-based and vegan, they’re ideal for anyone following a dairy-free diet','["100g pitted medjool dates","1 ripe banana","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g walnut halves","250g porridge oats","50g hemp seeds"]','["Line a 20 x 20cm square tin with parchment. Roughlychopthe dates and cover with 100ml boiling water. Leave to soak for 10 mins.","Put the banana in a bowl, mash with a fork, then stir in the cinnamon, vanilla, a pinch of sea salt and the soaked dates along with their liquid.","Tip the mixture into afood processorwith half of the walnuts and 100g of the oats. Pulse until you have a thick paste. Tip into a bowl and combine with most of the remaining nuts, oats and hemp seeds.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Press the mixture into the lined tin, top with the remaining nuts and seeds and, bake for 20-25 mins until golden and firm. Leave to cool completely before cutting into nine squares."]','2026-01-10 12:21:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8468,8468,'en','Cheese, chive & ham tear-and-share bread','Bake this satisfying pull-apart loaf, stuffed with oozy cheese, mustard and ham. You can use any cheese you have in the fridge','["170ml whole milk","1 tsp caster sugar","100g unsalted butter, cut into cubes","1½  tsp fine sea salt","3 tsp English mustard powder","500g strong white bread flour","1 x 7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","4 medium eggs, lightly beaten, plus 1 to glaze","oil, for proving","250g mature cheddar, grated","50g parmesan, grated","½  bunch of chives, finely chopped","150g smoked ham, coarsely chopped"]','["Pour the milk into a pan and add the sugar and butter. Warm gently, swirling the pan until the butter has melted. Set aside until lukewarm.","Tip the salt, mustard, flour and yeast into a large mixing bowl and stir. Make a well in the centre, then pour in the beaten eggs and milk mixture. Swiftly mix with a wooden spoon to make a rough dough, then tip onto a lightly floured surface and knead for 10-15 mins until elastic and springy. Alternatively, knead in a stand mixer for 7-10 mins using the hook attachment. Lightly oil a large mixing bowl. Put the dough in the bowl and cover loosely with a tea towel. Leave in a warm place for 1½-2 hrs or until doubled in size.","Knock the dough back on a lightly floured surface by lightly punching and briefly kneading it. Sprinkle over half the cheese, all of the chives and all the ham. Knead the dough until the ham and cheese are well distributed. Divide the dough into 18 equal-sized balls. Pinch the bottoms to create uniform, round balls. Line a baking sheet with baking parchment and draw a 25cm round template on the parchment (a large dinner plate works well for this). Arrange the dough balls in concentric circles in the circle you have drawn. Fill each gap with another scattering of cheese. Cover lightly. Leave for 1-1½ hrs or until the dough is risen.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Beat the remaining egg and use to lightly brush the dough balls. Sprinkle over most of the remaining cheese, then bake for 25 mins. Sprinkle over the last of the cheese and bake for 5 mins more. Leave to cool a little before serving warm."]','2026-01-10 12:21:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8470,8470,'en','Next level sausage rolls','Go the extra mile with homemade sausage rolls and make your own flaky pastry. Shop-bought sausagemeat and herby stuffing mix saves the extra time','["800g sausagemeat","100g sage & onion stuffing mixture","1 egg, beaten","English mustard, ketchup or brown sauce, to serve","250g pack butter, frozen","400g plain flour (or 350g plain flour and 50g white rye flour), plus extra for dusting","1 tsp English mustard powder","1 tbsp cider or white wine vinegar"]','["The night before baking, freeze the butter for the pastry. On the day, tip the flour into a big bowl with a pinch of salt and the mustard powder. Hold the butter block in its wrapping and coarsely grate straight into the flour, peeling back the wrapping a little at a time as needed and dipping the end of the butter into the flour every so often to stop it clumping in the bowl. Use a palette or cutlery knife, and lightly stir together, then stir in about 200ml ice cold water and the vinegar to bring the dough together. Wrap and chill for at least 30 mins.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Tip the sausagemeat into a bowl with the stuffing mix, 100ml cold water and lots of black pepper. Squish everything together with your hands until evenly blended, then chill in the fridge while you roll out the pastry. Tip the dough onto a floured surface, roll out to a rectangle about 50cm x 25cm and trim the edges. Brush the pastry lightly all over with some of the egg, then mould the sausage mixture into a 50cm roll. Sit the sausage just off-centre on the pastry, then fold the pastry over and crimp or use a fork to press the ends together. Slice into eight pieces using a knife dipped in warm water and wiped clean between slices. Place on a baking tray and chill for at least 30 mins. Will keep chilled for up to to 24 hrs. To bake sooner, put in the freezer for 15 mins.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Brush the rolls with more beaten egg, bake for 20 mins, then brush again and return to the oven for a further 10-15 mins until light mahogany in colour. Leave to cool on a wire rack, then serve warm with English mustard, ketchup or brown sauce and a chilled glass of cider, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8472,8472,'en','Chocolate ganache drip cake','Make this impressive chocolate ganache drip cake with Swiss meringue buttercream for a special occasion. This indulgent sponge is perfect for a celebration','["340g butter, softened, plus extra for the tins","340g caster sugar","6 large eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","340g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","2 tbsp milk","3 large egg whites","225g caster sugar","300g unsalted butter, cubed and softened","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g dark chocolate, finely chopped","75ml double cream","edible flowers, glitter or chocolate, to decorate (optional)"]','["Butter three 20cm round cake tins and line with non-stick baking paper. Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Beat the butter and sugar together in a large bowl until light and smooth. Gradually beat in the eggs until combined, then mix in the vanilla. Fold in the flour and baking powder until everything is combined. Stir in the milk to loosen.","Bake the sponges for 20 mins until golden and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then transfer onto a wire rack to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the Swiss meringue buttercream. Put the egg whites and sugar into a heatproof bowl over a small pan of gently simmering water. Make sure the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Whisk for 3-4 mins until the sugar dissolves. Put into an electric mixer and whisk for 10 mins over a medium-high speed until you have a thick meringue.","Gradually add the butter into the meringue mixture for 5 mins until incorporated and the buttercream is fluffy.","Put one sponge onto a plate or cake stand, top it with a few tablespoons of the buttercream and spread into an even layer. Add the next sponge, and repeat. Top with the final sponge.","Smooth a thin layer of the buttercream around the cake, so all the sides are coated – this is called a crumb coat. Chill in the fridge for 45 mins. Remove and smooth a thick layer of the remaining buttercream around the cake using a palette knife, reserving a little for decoration. Put back in the fridge for 45 mins-1 hr to set.","Meanwhile, make the ganache. Put the dark chocolate in a bowl and heat the cream in a small pan until just steaming. Pour the cream over the chocolate and leave to melt for 5-10 mins. Stir to make a glossy ganache, then set aside to firm up a little – you want it to be pourable but not too runny. Spoon the ganache over the top edge of the cake, encouraging it to drizzle down the side with your spoon – start at the back of the cake to get the hang of it. Fill in the middle of the top of the cake with chocolate too. Leave to set for 10 mins.","To decorate, put the leftover buttercream in a piping bag with a round nozzle and pipe little dots on top of the cake. Decorate as you like, remove any flowers before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:21:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8474,8474,'en','Brioche','Make homemade brioche and enjoy with jam or butter for breakfast. It takes a little effort, but the results of this sweet, soft bread are well worth it','["450g strong white flour","2 tsp fine sea salt","50g caster sugar","7g dried active yeast","100ml whole milk","4 eggs at room temperature, beaten, plus 1 for egg wash","190g salted butter, cubed and softened"]','["Put the flour in a bowl of a stand mixer with a dough hook. Add the salt to one side and sugar to the other. Pour in the yeast to the side with the sugar. Mix each side into the flour with your hands, then mix it all together with the dough hook.","Heat the milk until warm to the touch, but not hot. Mix into the flour mix until combined. With the dough hook on medium, gradually add the eggs and mix for 10 mins.","Gradually add the softened butter, one or two cubes at a time, until combined. This will take 5-8 mins. Scrape down the sides, the dough will be very soft.","Scrape the dough into a large bowl, cover with a tea towel and leave for 1 hr 30 mins-2 hrs until doubled in size and well-risen. Once risen, put in the fridge for 1 hr.","Line the bottom and sides of a 900g loaf tin with baking parchment. Portion the dough into seven equal pieces (the easiest way to do this accurately is to weigh it). Lightly dust a work surface with flour, take a piece of dough and pull each corner into the middle to form a circular shape. With a bit of pressure, push down and roll into ball. Repeat with the six remaining pieces.","Put the balls into the tin, four on one side and three in the gaps on the other side. Cover with a tea towel and leave to prove for 30-35 mins until almost doubled in size. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly brush the dough with the egg wash and bake for 30-35 mins until golden and risen. Leave to cool in the tin for 20 mins, then remove and cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:21:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8476,8476,'en','Cinnamon twists','Bake these fabulous cinnamon twists for an on-the-go breakfast or sweet treat. They take a little effort but are well worth it','["275g whole milk","40g unsalted butter, cubed","500g strong white flour, plus extra for dusting","7g dried active yeast","50g caster sugar","1 small egg, plus 1 egg, beaten, for glazing","75g butter, melted","150g caster sugar","3 tsp ground cinnamon","50g caster sugar","1 tsp ground cinnamon"]','["Heat the milk and butter in a small pan until the butter has melted. Allow to cool slightly – the milk should be warm, not hot. Put the flour in a large mixing bowl with a pinch of salt to one side of the bowl. Add the yeast into the flour on the other side of the bowl, so it’s not touching the salt. Pour in the sugar, then mix it all together.","Gradually pour the warm milk into the dry ingredients, mixing with your hands until you have a relatively sticky dough. You may not need all of the milk. Add in the egg and continue to work until combined.","Lightly dust a surface with flour and tip out the dough. It will be quite wet – the more you knead it, the easier it will become. Knead for around 10 mins until you have a smooth dough. Put in a lightly floured bowl to prove for 1 hr or until doubled in size.","To make the filling, mix the melted butter, sugar and cinnamon together until you get a smooth paste. Set aside.","Roll out the dough on a lightly floured surface to around a 30 x 40cm rectangle. Spread over the filling using a palette knife until the dough is completely covered.","Fold in half widthways and cut into 16-18 strips down the shortest side. Twist both ends of each strip in opposite directions until a spiral shape forms. Holding one end in your hand, wrap the rest of the dough around it and over, pressing the ends into the bottom of the bun so it doesn’t unravel during cooking.","Lay on two lined baking trays spaced 5cm apart. Leave to prove for 30-45 mins until risen slightly. Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Brush the tops of the buns with a little egg and bake for 18-20 mins until golden. Don’t worry if a little cinnamon butter comes out.","For the coating, mix together the sugar and cinnamon. Whilst still warm, toss the buns in the sugar and eat straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:21:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8478,8478,'en','Sourdough cinnamon buns','Use a sourdough starter to make these moreish cinnamon buns. It adds a contrasting tang to the classic sweet and sticky flavours. Top with a soft cheese icing, if you like','["200g active white sourdough starter","350g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","50g wholemeal flour","1 tsp ground cinnamon","50g golden caster sugar","200ml warm milk","1 egg","50g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","150g light brown sugar","125g butter, softened","2 tbsp ground cinnamon","2 tbsp golden syrup","100g soft cheese","150g icing sugar","¼ tsp vanilla paste or extract"]','["Make sure your starter is active – it should be nice and bubbly. If it isn’t, feed it and wait until a tsp of the starter floats in warm water.","Tip all the ingredients for the dough, except the butter, into a bowl and mix with your hands to form a shaggy dough – make sure all the flour from around the bowl is mixed in. Leave the dough in the bowl, covered with a damp cloth, for 30 mins.","Work the butter into the dough with 1 tsp salt. Once fully combined, tip the dough onto a surface and knead gently for 5 mins until smooth and springy. Form the dough into a ball and sit back in the bowl. Cover and leave somewhere warm-ish for 3-4 hrs until the dough has just about doubled in size.","Meanwhile, make the filling by beating together the sugar, butter, cinnamon and a pinch of salt. Set aside at room temperature to keep soft.","Butter and line a square baking tin –  smaller tins (20 x 20cm) will hold nine buns, larger tins (25 x 25cm) will hold 12. Tip the dough onto a floured surface and roll it to a rectangle roughly 50 x 25cm. Spread the filling over the rectangle so it’s completely covered. Roll the dough along the long edge into a tight swiss-roll type sausage. Cut your dough into pieces and arrange them, spiral side-up, in the tin. Leave for 1 hr at room temperature, then cover and leave in the fridge overnight.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Cover the tin with foil and bake on a baking tray (this will stop any leaking mixture dripping into your oven) for 30 mins, then remove the foil and bake for 10-15 mins more to brown slightly.","Meanwhile, mix the golden syrup with 1 tbsp boiling water. As soon as buns come out of the oven, brush them generously with the syrup, then leave to cool a little. Lift the buns out of the tin while still warm and leave to cool on a wire rack. To make the icing, beat the soft cheese, sugar and vanilla until thick but drizzly. Drizzle over the buns when completely cool."]','2026-01-10 12:21:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8480,8480,'en','Empire biscuits','Make a batch of these easy empire biscuits and enjoy with a cuppa. Sandwich with raspberry jam and top with thick icing and a glacé cherry to finish','["175g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","100g cold salted butter, cut into cubes","335g icing sugar","½ tsp vanilla extract","2 medium egg yolks","100g raspberry jam","50g glacé cherries, quartered"]','["Put the flour, butter, 85g of the icing sugar, the vanilla and egg yolks in a food processor and pulse in bursts until combined (alternatively, rub together the butter and flour with your fingertips and mix in the sugar, vanilla and egg yolks). Add ½ tbsp water if the mix feels a little dry. Tip the rough mixture onto a work surface and briefly knead until the dough has come together. Wrap and chill for 30 mins.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line two baking sheets with baking parchment. Lightly dust your work surface with flour and roll the dough out to around 3mm thick. Cut 24 rounds from the dough with a 7cm cutter. Bring the remaining scraps of pastry together and reroll to make more biscuits. Line up the discs of dough on the baking sheets, then bake for 10-12 mins or until lightly golden brown around the edges. Transfer to a wire rack and leave to cool completely.","Mix the remaining icing sugar with 2-3 tsp of water to make a very thick icing. Spoon or pipe the icing over the top of half of the biscuits, leaving a border around the edge of each one. Top with a small piece of glacé cherry in the centre, then leave to set for 30 mins. Spread the jam over the un-iced biscuits and sandwich together with the iced halves. Will keep for two days in an airtight tin."]','2026-01-10 12:21:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8482,8482,'en','Egg-free cookies','Rustle up some egg-free choc chip cookies for a treat and add cocoa, if you like, to make chocolate versions. They’re ideal if you follow an egg-free diet','["125g butter, softened","125g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla essence or extract","200g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp baking powder","50g milk or white chocolate chips","2 tbsp cocoa powder (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Cream the butter and sugar together using a wooden spoon or an electric whisk in a large bowl until light, fluffy and golden.","Stir in the vanilla, flour, baking powder and chocolate chips. Add 1 tbsp water to bring the mixture together if needed, and the cocoa powder to make them chocolate cookies, if you like. Bring the dough together into a ball with your hands.","Sprinkle some flour over your work surface and the dough. Roll out the dough until 3mm thick and, using cookie cutters, cut them out and lay them out on lined baking sheets, spacing them well apart.","Bake for about 12 mins or until golden brown. If baking on two trays, swap the trays over halfway through cooking. Leave on the baking sheets for 5 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool. Will keep in an airtight tin for three-four days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8484,8484,'en','Onion soda bread with whipped English mustard butter','Perk up homemade soda bread with onion and a light but punchy mustard butter. Serve alongside your favourite cold meats and a fresh salad','["340g strong wholemeal flour","340g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","40g dried onion flakes","1 tbsp nigella seeds","85g butter, melted","625ml natural yogurt","splash of milk","1 tbsp oats","135g unsalted butter, chopped and softened","25g English mustard"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Tip the flours into a bowl with the bicarb, onion flakes, nigella seeds and 1½ tbsp salt. Stir together and make a well in the middle. Tip in the butter and yogurt, and bring together into a soft, sticky dough using a spatula. If it seems dry, add a splash of milk.","Tip the dough out onto a lightly floured surface and gently form into a round. Lift onto a lightly floured baking sheet, cut a deep cross in the top using a sharp knife and sprinkle over the oats. Bake for 1 hr, or until golden and the loaf sounds hollow when tapped underneath. Leave to cool on a wire rack.","While the bread cools, beat the butter, mustard and a pinch of sea salt together until light and airy. Spoon into a small pot. Slice the bread and serve with the mustard butter for spreading over."]','2026-01-10 12:21:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8486,8486,'en','Strawberry cake','Make the most of strawberry season with our strawberry cake, with light sponge, jam and soft cheese icing. It makes a fabulous centrepiece dessert','["400g softened butter, plus more for the tin","400g caster sugar","5 large eggs","400g self-raising flour","100ml natural yogurt","300g strawberries, hulled and halved","2 tsp vanilla extract","100g butter, softened","250g soft cheese","600g icing sugar","400g strawberry jam"]','["Butter and line the bases of three 18cm cake tins. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Blend the butter and sugar in a food processor until smooth and creamy. Add the eggs, flour and yogurt and blend again. Add 200g strawberries (save the best ones to decorate) and the vanilla. Blend once more, until the mixture is well combined.","Divide the cake batter evenly between the three cake tins. Spread and smooth the tops with a spatula, then bake for 25-30 mins, until the cakes have risen and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Return to the oven for another 5 mins if any wet mixture clings to the skewer. Leave in the tins for 5 mins, then turn onto a wire rack and leave to cool completely. The cakes can be made up to two days before icing, or frozen for two months.","For the icing, blend the butter and half the sugar until smooth and creamy, add the soft cheese and the remaining sugar and blend again. Be careful not to over mix as the icing will become runny. (If you do overmix, don’t worry – keep mixing with an electric whisk and it’ll thicken back up).","Layer the cakes with the jam and half the icing. Invert the final cake on top, so the base of the cake it now the top, giving you a flat surface. Pile the rest of the icing on top of the cake, using a palette knife to spread the icing over the top and down the sides. Save a little icing to pipe rosettes around the edge of the cake, if you like. Top with the remaining strawberries. Can be made up to a day ahead of serving, keep somewhere cool or in the fridge. Will keep for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8488,8488,'en','Easy banoffee pie','Treat loved ones to a banoffee pie for dessert featuring a classic biscuit base, oozy caramel, bananas, cream and chocolate. Who could resist?','["225g digestive biscuits","150g butter, melted","397g can caramel or 400g dulce de leche","3 small bananas, sliced","300ml double cream","1 tbsp icing sugar","1 square dark chocolate (optional)"]','["Crush the digestive biscuits, either by hand using a wooden spoon, or in a food processor, until you get fine crumbs, tip into a bowl. Mix the crushed biscuits with the melted butter until fully combined. Tip the mixture into a 23cm loose bottomed fluted tart tin and cover the tin, including the sides, with the biscuit in an even layer. Push down with the back of a spoon to smooth the surface and chill for 1 hr, or overnight.","Beat the caramel to loosen and spoon it over the bottom of the biscuit base. Spread it out evenly using the back of a spoon or palette knife. Gently push the chopped banana into the top of the caramel until the base is covered. Put in the fridge.","Whip the cream with the icing sugar until billowy and thick. Take the pie out of the fridge and spoon the whipped cream on top of the bananas. Grate the dark chocolate over the cream, if you like, and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:21:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8490,8490,'en','Easy vanilla pound cake','Bring a smile to your friends and family with a slice of our vanilla pound cake. It’s the perfect partner to a cuppa for elevenses or afternoon tea','["200g unsalted butter, softened","200g caster sugar","3 eggs, beaten","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","3 tbsp whole milk","1 tbsp vanilla paste / ½ vanilla pod seeds","125g icing sugar","1 tbsp vanilla paste / ½ vanilla pod seeds"]','["Pre-heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 900g loaf tin with parchment paper (mine was 19cm x 9cm x 6cm). Put all of the ingredients except those for the icing into a large bowl and beat together, either using an electric hand whisk or a wooden spoon until smooth and combined. Pour the mix into the loaf tin and spread evenly with the back of spoon. Bake for 40 – 45 mins.","Once out of the oven, leave to cool and make the icing. Combine the icing sugar and vanilla paste with three tbsp of water – you may need more but add it gradually to get a thick icing. Spread it over the top of the cake; it’s fine if it drips down the edges. Allow to set and then slice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8492,8492,'en','Iced buns with cream & jam','Make our iced buns for an afternoon tea party or bake sale. Learn how to pipe cream and shape dough using our step-by-step guide to make these extra special','["350ml milk, plus extra for brushing","30g butter, cubed","500g strong white bread flour","10g fast-action dried yeast","2 tbsp caster sugar","300g icing sugar, plus 1 tbsp","few drops of yellow, pink and purple food colouring (optional)","300ml whipping or double cream","200g lemon curd","200g raspberry jam","200g blackcurrant jam","glacé cherries, sprinkles or crystallised rose and violet petals, to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat the milk until steaming. Add the butter and swirl until melted. Leave to cool slightly. Tip the flour and yeast into a bowl or stand mixer fitted with a dough hook, then add the caster sugar and ½ tsp salt.","When the milk mix has cooled slightly (it should feel just warm when you stick a finger in) pour into the flour mix. If using a stand mixer, mix for 5-8 mins on a medium speed until springy. Or, knead in the bowl for about 10 mins – when the dough is pulled apart, it should be able to stretch without ripping.","Put the dough in a clean bowl, cover with a tea towel and leave to rise for 1½ hrs or until doubled in size. Or, transfer to the fridge to slowly rise for up to 24 hrs (this will improve the texture and flavour).","If the dough is chilled, remove from the fridge 1 hr before shaping. Divide into 10 equal portions (weigh them out if you want to be accurate). To make round buns, roll and shape each piece into a smooth ball, or to make finger buns, roll and shape each piece into a finger shape. Arrange on a lined baking tray, leaving space between each. Cover loosely and leave to rise for 30 mins-1 hr more until doubled.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Brush the buns with milk and bake for 25-30 mins until golden. Put on a wire rack and leave to cool.","Mix the icing sugar with 2-3 tbsp water – it should be thick. Divide between bowls, depending on how many food colourings you’re using (we used three). Dye each with a different colouring, adding a splash more water if needed.","Whisk the cream and 1 tbsp icing sugar until just holding its shape. Don’t overwhip, as it will thicken as you pipe (see tip, below). Fit a piping bag with a star nozzle and fill with a third of the cream.","Split the round buns in half as you would a burger bun, or the finger buns down the middle lengthways. Spoon roughly 60g lemon curd or jam over the bottom half of each bun (or down the middle), alternating the flavours, then pipe over a swirl of cream. Continue until all the buns are filled, refilling the piping bag with cream as needed. Spoon some icing over each bun, matching the colours to the jam (we used yellow for the curd, pink for the raspberry jam and purple for the blackcurrant). Decorate with the glacé cherries, sprinkles and crystallised petals, if you like, then leave to set for about 20 mins before serving. Best eaten the day they’re made, but will keep in the fridge for 24 hrs."]','2026-01-10 12:21:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8494,8494,'en','Rhubarb & custard sandwich biscuits','Combine two retro treats in one delicious bite. These rhubarb and custard biscuits have a jammy centre, to bring a touch of nostalgia to an afternoon tea or bake sale','["175g unsalted butter, cubed","50g caster sugar","50g icing sugar","¼ tsp fine sea salt","250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","50g custard powder","2 egg yolks","1 tbsp vanilla bean paste","200g rhubarb, trimmed and chopped","200g caster sugar","¼ lemon, juiced"]','["To make the jam, put the rhubarb, sugar and lemon juice in a pan over a medium heat. Bring to a simmer and cook for 15 mins, or until the rhubarb has broken down and released its liquid. Blitz using a hand blender until smooth, then simmer for another 5-10 mins until thick and jammy. To test it’s ready, run a wooden spoon over the base of the pan – it should leave a trail rather than filling in straightaway. Leave to cool (it will set more as it does), then chill until ready to use. Will keep in a sealed container or jar in the fridge for up to one week.","To make the biscuit dough, put the butter, both sugars and salt in a food processor and pulse a few times to a coarse paste. Scrape down the sides, then add the flour and custard powder and pulse again to a damp, sandy consistency. Add the egg yolks and vanilla and pulse again until the dough comes together into a ball. Add ½-1 tbsp water to bring it together, if needed. Tip the dough out, then wrap and put in the fridge to chill for at least 30 mins.","Roll the dough out on a floured surface to a 5mm thickness. Stamp out as many biscuits as you can using a 6mm round cutter – you should get about 32 in total.","Cut circles or hearts out of the centres of half the biscuits using the wide end of a plain piping nozzle (about 1.5cm), or a small heart cutter. Transfer all the biscuits to lined baking sheets, then transfer to the fridge and chill for 15 mins. You can also cook the cut-out shapes to make mini biscuits – if doing so, put these on their own baking sheet.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6, then bake the biscuits for 8-10 mins until golden (5-6 mins for the mini biscuits). Put on a wire rack and leave to cool completely.","Transfer the jam to a piping bag, snip off the end, and pipe a small layer of jam onto the plain biscuits (those without the centres cut out). Or, use a teaspoon. Spread the jam out – it may squidge out of the sides when sandwiching the biscuits, so don’t go too far to the edge.","Sandwich the remaining biscuits over the jam (don’t press down too firmly), then transfer to an airtight container in a single layer and leave to set overnight. This ensures the jam won’t leak when you bite into them, but they can be eaten straightaway if you can’t resist. Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days, but the biscuits will start to soften over time."]','2026-01-10 12:21:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8496,8496,'en','Apricot, almond & polenta cake','Pair almonds and apricots in this moreish cake. Made with polenta, the cake has a lovely moist texture and a fruity tang. Enjoy with crème fraîche','["50g unsalted butter, plus extra for the tin","125g granulated sugar","8 fresh apricots, halved and stoned (you may need more if the apricots are small)","150g unsalted butter, at room temperature, cubed","150g caster sugar","2 large eggs, lightly beaten","1 lemon, zested","1 tsp almond extract","50g plain flour","50g fine ground polenta","1½ tsp baking powder","100g ground almonds","125ml milk","3 tbsp apricot jam, to glaze","crème fraîche or cream, to serve"]','["Butter a 20-23cm round cake tin. If it has a loose bottom, you will need to wrap the outside with foil to prevent any of the caramel from leaking. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. For the apricots, put the granulated sugar and 75ml water into a saucepan. Heat slowly until the sugar has dissolved. When the sugar has melted, bring to the boil and watch the syrup until it starts to turn to a deep amber colour. Remove from the heat and add the butter. Stir until it has melted. Pour into the tin, then lay the apricots in it, cut-side down.","For the cake, beat together the butter and sugar until light with an electric whisk. Add the egg a little at a time, then the zest and almond extract. Mix all the dry ingredients together, then fold them gradually into the egg mixture, alternating with the milk. Spoon this over the apricots and bake for 50 mins. To test it’s baked, push a skewer into the centre. It should come out clean.","Leave the cake to cool for 15 mins, then run a knife in-between the cake and the inside of the tin and invert it onto a plate. If any of the apricot halves get left behind in the tin carefully scoop them up – trying to keep their shape intact and not squash them too much – and put them back, cut-side up, on the cake. Leave the cake to cool, or serve warm if you want.","Heat the apricot jam with 2 tbsp of water. Once the jam has dissolved, push it through a sieve to remove the bits of apricot. Leave it to cool a little – otherwise it overcooks the apricots, which should be perfectly cooked and not collapsing – then paint the jam thickly on the top of the cake. Leave this to set a little, then serve with crème fraîche or cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8498,8498,'en','Ginger & white chocolate cake','Bake our sticky ginger cake in a bundt tin for the wow factor. Spiced with stem ginger and decorated with white chocolate icing, it’s a real crowd pleaser','["220g unsalted butter, softened","365g self-raising flour","200g muscovado sugar","50g black treacle","150g golden syrup","2 large eggs, lightly beaten","300ml milk","2 balls stem ginger in syrup, finely chopped, plus 50ml of the syrup","1 tsp fine sea salt","3 tsp ground ginger","½ tsp cinnamon","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","small handful of crystallised ginger pieces, chopped, to decorate","30ml milk","160g icing sugar, sieved","150g white chocolate, chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Melt 1 tbsp butter in a small pan, then stir in ½ tbsp flour to create a wet paste. Brush it over the inside of a 9-inch bundt tin. Put the remaining butter, sugar, treacle and golden syrup in a pan set over a medium heat and stir until everything has melted together. Leave to cool a little.","Pour the mixture into a large bowl and whisk in the eggs and milk. Fold in the stem ginger, remaining flour, salt, ground ginger, cinnamon and bicarb. Tip into the prepared tin and bake for 40-45 mins, or until firm to the touch. Leave to cool for 10 mins in the tin, then turn out onto a wire rack to cool completely.","To make the icing, whisk the milk, ginger syrup and icing sugar together. Melt the chocolate in a heatproof bowl in the microwave in 1-min bursts. Leave to cool a little, then whisk into the milk mixture. Spoon the icing over the cake, then decorate with the crystallised ginger pieces."]','2026-01-10 12:21:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8500,8500,'en','Chocolate eclairs','These deliciously decadent chocolate eclairs filled with creamy vanilla custard are worth the effort. Make a batch of these classic French pastries','["140g plain flour","pinch of sugar","125ml milk","100g butter","4 eggs","300ml milk","50g caster sugar","2 egg yolks","1 tsp vanilla extract","4 tsp plain flour","4 tsp cornflour","375ml double cream","100g plain chocolate","25g butter","1 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Start by making the custard filling. Heat the milk until almost boiling in a saucepan. Meanwhile, mix together the sugar, egg yolks and vanilla in a bowl, then stir in the flours, a couple of tsp at a time, to a smooth paste.","Gradually whisk in the hot milk, pour everything back into the saucepan and cook over a high heat, stirring constantly, for about 5 mins until thick – it will go alarmingly lumpy but don’t worry, just keep stirring it vigorously with a wooden spoon until smooth","Lay a sheet of cling film directly on the custard surface, then cool and chill until you’re ready to fill the buns.","To make the choux buns, heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Sift the flour with the sugar and a pinch of salt into a small bowl. Put the milk and butter into a medium saucepan with 125ml water and gently heat so the butter melts but the liquid doesn’t bubble.","Once the butter has completely melted, increase the heat until the liquid comes to a fast rolling boil. Immediately turn off the heat, tip in the sifted flour and beat vigorously with a wooden spoon until you a have a smooth dough that comes away from the sides of the pan. Spread over a large dinner plate to cool to hand temperature.","Allow to cool for a few minutes, then gradually add the eggs, mixing well between each addition until the mixture reluctantly drops off the spoon. Don’t add all the egg unless you need to.","Cut two large sheets of baking parchment. On each one draw two sets of ‘track’ lines with a 10cm gap – these will be your guidelines so your eclairs will all be roughly the same size. Use the paper to line two large baking sheets – penside down.","Spoon your choux mixture into a piping bag with a 1cm star or round wide nozzle, or into a disposable piping bag with a similar-size hole snipped off for piping. Pipe two rows of well-spaced, squashed ‘S’ shapes on each sheet between the guidelines. Bake, one tray at a time, on a high-ish shelf for 25 mins, reducing temperature to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 as soon as they go in the oven.","After 25 mins, poke a hole in the end of each bun, or using a small serrated knife, split down the middle and return to the oven, upside-down, to dry out for 5 mins until crisp and golden. Set aside to cool.","While the buns are cooling, finish your filling. Whisk the cream until thick, then use your electric whisk to beat the cooled, set custard until just smooth again. Fold in the cream. Spoon your filling into a piping bag – use a small nozzle if you’re filling the buns through the holes you''ve pierced, or a large nozzle if you’ve split the buns in half. Carefully pipe the custard into each cooled bun – they should feel heavy once full.","To make the icing, melt 100g plain chocolate and 25g butter together in a heatproof bowl over a pan of barely simmering water. Once melted, remove from the heat and stir in 75ml double cream and 1 tbsp sifted icing sugar. Once cooled a little, spread over the tops of the buns and leave to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:21:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8502,8502,'en','Simnel cake','Celebrate Easter with a springtime seasonal bake. This classic simnel cake is packed with dried fruit and spices and topped with marzipan','["225g sultanas","100g currants","50g mixed peel","2 lemons, 1 juiced and 2 zested","50ml orange juice","50ml brandy (optional)","225g butter, softened","225g light muscovado sugar","4 medium eggs","225g self-raising flour","100g glacé cherries, quartered","2 tsp mixed spice","500g yellow marzipan","1 tbsp apricot jam"]','["Put the sultanas, currants and mixed peel in a bowl with the lemon juice, orange juice, and brandy, if using. Mix well, cover and leave to soak overnight.","Heat the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2. Line the base and sides of a 20cm round cake tin with baking parchment.","Add the rest of the cake ingredients to the soaked fruit and stir until well combined. Spoon half of this mixture into the bottom of the cake tin and level it off so it''s as flat as possible. Roll a third of the marzipan into a circle 20cm diameter and put it on the top. Gently add the rest of the mixture, levelling the surface again.","Bake for approximately 2½ hours until brown, well-risen and firm to the touch. A metal skewer should come out clean when inserted. Allow to cool for 20 mins in the tin and then turn out to cool on a wire rack.","Warm the apricot jam in a small saucepan and brush on the top of the cake. Roll out half of the remaining marzipan to the size of the top of the cake. Press it down firmly and push the edges down with your thumb to crimp it round the sides.","Roll the rest of the marzipan into 11 balls (these represent the Apostles). Place the balls evenly on top of the cake in a circle, sticking them down with a little dab of the jam. Gently blow torch the top of the cake until the balls are a light golden brown, alternatively put the whole cake under a hot grill until the marzipan turns a light golden colour."]','2026-01-10 12:21:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8504,8504,'en','Lemon & raspberry doughnut pudding','Expect requests for second helpings of this decadent dessert! Bake raspberry doughnuts with fresh custard, lemon curd and raspberries','["butter, for the baking dish","8 raspberry jam doughnut","150g raspberries","500ml shop-bought fresh custard","250ml whole milk","150g lemon curd"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and butter a 20 x 20cm baking dish. Quarter the raspberry jam doughnuts and arrange in overlapping layers in the prepared dish. Scatter over 100g raspberries.","Heat the custard with the milk until steaming, then whisk through the lemon curd. Pour the lemon custard over the doughnuts, then leave to soak for 30 mins, ensuring some of the doughnuts stick out so they’ll crisp up when baked.","Scatter over another 50g raspberries and bake for 35-40 mins, or until golden brown and just set."]','2026-01-10 12:21:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8505,8505,'en','Elegant berry wreath cake','Simple, smart, but still reassuringly traditional','["500g pack natural marzipan","3 tbsp apricot jam, warmed and sieved","400g icing sugar","2 egg whites","1 egg white","50g golden caster sugar","several eucalyptus sprigs (smaller-leaf varieties look best)","plenty of fresh bay leaves, in sprigs if possible","100g cranberries, defrosted if frozen"]','["MAKE A RING-SHAPED CAKE: Prepare Hot toddy fruitcake mix (recipe opposite), then grease and double-line a 23cm round, deep cake tin. Peel off the label from an empty 400g can and wash well. Butter the outside of the can and\r\nwrap in non-stick baking paper. Fill the can one-third full with baking beans, rice or dried pulses (to weigh\r\nit down), then position in the middle of the tin. Spoon the cake mix around the ‘ring’, then smooth the top. Bake at 160C/fan 140C/gas 3 for 1½ hrs, then turn down to 140C/fan 120C/gas 1 and bake for another hour or until a skewer comes\r\nout clean.","While the cake is still warm, use the skewer\r\nto pepper the cake with holes, poking it all\r\nthe way down. Dissolve the sugar in the tea,\r\nadd the whisky or orange juice, then spoon\r\nover the surface. If you’re making the cake\r\nahead of time, feed it with a fresh swig of hot\r\ntoddy every week, but take care not to make\r\nthe cake soggy. Can be kept for a month\r\nwell-wrapped in an airtight container in a\r\ncool, dry place. If short on time, the cake can\r\nbe made the same day that you decorate it.","To decorate, lightly beat the egg white,\r\nthen put the caster sugar on a flat plate or\r\ntray. Dip the tips of the leaves into the egg\r\nwhite, shake off any excess, then dip into the\r\nsugar to coat. Leave to dry while you cover\r\nthe cake with marzipan. If your cranberries\r\nare frozen, leave them on a few sheets of\r\nkitchen towel at this stage to thaw and dry\r\nout, or the juice will run into the icing.","Roll the marzipan to a 23cm circle, shaping\r\nit into a round with your hands. Alternatively,\r\nroll the marzipan a little larger than you need,\r\nthen cut a round using the cake tin’s base as\r\na guide. Turn the marzipan over. Brush the\r\ntop of the cake with jam, then put it, jam side\r\ndown, on the marzipan.","Make the hole in the middle. Using the can,\r\npush through the hole in the centre of the\r\ncake and punch out excess marzipan – this is\r\nthe easiest way to make sure the hole in the\r\ncovering matches hole in the cake. Turn cake\r\nright way up and sit on a cake plate.","Sieve the icing sugar, then beat with the\r\negg white until thick and smooth. Spread\r\nover the marzipan with a palette knife, then\r\ndecorate the top with cranberries, bay leaves\r\nand the frosted eucalyptus sprigs. Leave\r\nto set overnight before cutting. Can be\r\ndecorated up to a day ahead. Keep cake\r\nwrapped in foil up to the icing."]','2026-01-10 12:21:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8506,8506,'en','Lemon curd, mascarpone & passion fruit tart','Serve this vibrant lemon curd and passion fruit tart as an easy dessert or sweet treat. Its tropical flavours make it perfect for summer','["320g sheet of puff pastry","1 egg, beaten","250g mascarpone","150ml double cream","6 tbsp lemon curd","3 passion fruit, seeds removed","30g chopped pistachios"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Unroll the puff pastry onto a lined baking tray. Score a 2cm border around the edge of the pastry using a sharp knife, then brush the border with the egg.","Bake for 15-20 mins, or until golden and crisp. Gently push down the middle with the back of a spoon, then leave to cool completely.","Whisk the mascarpone with the double cream and 3 tbsp lemon curd until soft and spoonable. Fold in another 3 tbsp lemon curd and the seeds of 1 passion fruit.","Spoon the cream mixture in the centre of the pastry and scatter over the seeds of 2 passion fruit and the chopped pistachios."]','2026-01-10 12:21:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8508,8508,'en','Lemon curd & orange cake','Enjoy a slice of lemon curd and orange cake for elevenses or afternoon tea. Top with flaked almonds and lemon zest and serve with a cuppa','["170g soft salted butter","150g golden caster sugar","2 eggs","70g natural yogurt","150g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","1 large orange, zested","2-3 tbsp milk","10 tbsp lemon curd","20g flaked almonds","lemon zest, to decorate"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 1-litre loaf tin and line with baking parchment.","Put the butter, sugar, eggs, yogurt, self-raising flour, ground almonds, orange zest, milk and 5 tbsp lemon curd in a large bowl and whisk until smooth. Put another 5 tbsp lemon curd in a second bowl and whisk to loosen.","Spoon half the batter into the prepared tin, dollop over the lemon curd and top with the remaining batter. Scatter over the flaked almonds and bake for 50 mins, or until risen and golden. Leave to cool on a wire rack, scatter over some lemon zest and slice."]','2026-01-10 12:21:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8510,8510,'en','Chocolate chip traybake','Bake these chocolate chip squares for the family. Easy to make, this traybake is ideal for cooking (and eating!) with kids','["190ml rapeseed oil, plus extra for the tin","250g plain flour","80g cocoa powder","3 tsp baking powder","300g light brown soft sugar","350ml whole milk","2 tsp vanilla extract","2 large eggs","100g white chocolate chips","150g butter, cubed","200g icing sugar, sieved","4 tsp cocoa powder","2 tbsp milk"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil the base and sides of a 33 x 23cm roasting tin that’s at least 2.5cm deep. Line with baking parchment. Combine the flour, cocoa powder, baking powder, sugar and a good pinch of salt in a large bowl. Break up any sugar lumps with a whisk.","Whisk the oil together with the milk, vanilla and eggs in a jug, and pour into the dry ingredients, then stir in the chocolate chips. Stir well using a spatula until there are no pockets of flour. Pour the mix into the prepared tin and bake for 25-30 mins until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. If any wet mix clings to the skewer, return to the oven for 5 mins, then check again. Leave to cool in the tin for at least 20 mins.","Meanwhile, make the icing. Melt the butter, then remove from the heat and stir in the icing sugar, cocoa powder and milk. The icing will be very runny, but will thicken a little as it cools. (If the icing has thickened too much before the cake has cooled, reheat it slightly to make it easier to pour.)","Pour the chocolate icing over the cake and leave until it has set before slicing into sqaures."]','2026-01-10 12:21:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8512,8512,'en','Cherry crumble cake','Make the most of juicy cherries in this cake, enriched with almonds and soured cream, and finished with a crumble topping. It''s delicious with custard','["180g salted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","220g golden caster sugar","3 large eggs, lightly beaten","250g self-raising flour","½ tsp baking powder","50g ground almonds","80g soured cream","300g fresh cherries, stoned and halved","45g plain flour","35g cold salted butter, cubed","20g golden caster sugar"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter the base of a deep 20cm loose-bottomed cake tin and line with baking parchment.","To make the crumble topping, put the flour and butter in a bowl and rub together with your fingertips until you have a coarse, crumbly texture. Stir through the sugar, then transfer to the fridge.","Beat the butter and sugar with an electric whisk for 5 mins until light and fluffy. Gradually whisk in the eggs, beating well after each addition. Fold in the flour, baking powder, ground almonds and soured cream, then most of the cherries, reserving a handful to garnish. Spoon the mixture into the prepared tin and smooth over the top with a spatula. Dot with the reserved cherries, then bake in the centre of the oven for 30 mins.","Scatter over the crumble topping, then return the cake to the oven and bake for a further 30-50 mins until a skewer inserted in the middle comes out clean. Remove from the oven and leave to cool in the tin.","Slice the cake into thick wedges and serve with custard or ice cream, if you like. Store in a tin or airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8514,8514,'en','Chocolate chip shortbread','Bake a batch of these easy chocolate chip shortbreads to pair with your afternoon cup of tea. These simple sweet treats are perfect for sharing','["300g plain flour","200g cold salted butter, cubed","1 large egg yolk","100g caster sugar plus extra to sprinkle","80g milk or dark chocolate chips"]','["Sieve the flour into a large mixing bowl and add the butter. Rub the butter and flour between your fingers until the mixture looks like crumbs. Stir through the egg yolk, sugar and chocolate chips and squish everything together in the bowl to create a dough. Once it has begun to come together in the bowl tip out on to your work surface and form it into a flattened round puck shape, wrap and chill for 30 mins.","Preheat the oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3. Line 2 baking sheets with baking parchment.","Roll out the dough in between two sheets of baking parchment until its 1cm thick. Remove the top sheet of parchment, and cut into 14 rounds with a 7cm round biscuit cutter. Re-roll any offcuts to make the most from your dough. Carefully transfer the rounds to your baking sheets using a palette knife or spatula, leaving some space in between them. Sprinkle each one with a little sugar. Bake in the oven for 15-20 mins or until lightly golden. Remove from the oven and allow to cool for 10 mins before transferring to a wire rack to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:21:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8515,8515,'en','Classic winter fruitcake','This festive icing is easy to use, looks amazing and makes a lighter end to a meal. The perfect centrepiece for Christmas tea','["1 egg white","50g caster sugar","small bunch black grapes","holly or bay leaves","20cm/8 inch round fruitcake","1-2 clementines","1-2 just ripe figs","a few kumquat","a few physalis (Cape gooseberries)","approx 65cm red or gold ribbon","2 egg whites","175g icing sugar"]','["Lightly beat the egg white in a shallow bowl and spread out the caster sugar on a baking sheet or tray. Dip the grapes and\r\nthe holly or bay leaves into the egg white, or use a paintbrush. Shake off the excess, then coat in the sugar. Set aside to dry for at least 10 mins, ideally about 30 mins.","When you’re ready to decorate, make the frosting. Put a large bowl over a pan of simmering water, making sure the bottom of the bowl does not touch the water. Put the egg whites and icing sugar into the bowl and whisk for 5-7 mins until you have a thick, very glossy frosting. Use a spatula to clean around the edges of the bowl every so often as you whisk. Scoop the frosting onto the top of the cake and spread it around with a flat-edged knife, swirling as you go to create a snowy effect (see Knowhow, below).","Halve the clementines, figs and kumquats, then arrange on top of the frosted cake with the physalis, frosted grapes and leaves. Fix a ribbon around the base and leave the cake somewhere cool – but not the fridge – until your guests arrive."]','2026-01-10 12:21:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8516,8516,'en','Caramelised banana & chocolate galette','Impress friends and family with this simple, 5-ingredient galette with caramelised banana and chocolate. This easy dessert goes wonderfully with ice cream','["70g hazelnuts, roughly chopped","150g dark chocolate, finely chopped","500g block shop-bought puff pastry","3 bananas, sliced","3 tbsp light brown soft sugar","vanilla ice cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Blitz 50g of the hazelnuts in a small food processor until they resemble fine breadcrumbs, then tip into a bowl with the chocolate.","Roll the pastry out to a round roughly 30cm in diameter on a sheet of baking parchment. Scatter the chocolate and hazelnut mixture over the pastry circle, leaving a 5cm border. Top with the bananas and most of the remaining hazelnuts, then fold the edges of the pastry over. Transfer the galette to a baking sheet along with the baking parchment, then chill in the fridge for at least 10 mins.","Remove from the fridge and sprinkle the sugar over the galette, then bake for 25-30 mins, or until golden and puffed up. Scatter over the remaining hazelnuts and serve with a scoop of vanilla ice cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8518,8518,'en','Sticky toffee banana bread','Use up overripe bananas to make this sticky toffee banana loaf. It’s even more indulgent with the toffee sauce and nut brittle','["125g soft butter, plus extra for the tin","75g caster sugar","50g dark brown soft sugar","3 medium eggs","2 large ripe bananas, mashed","50g natural yogurt","200g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","50g pitted dates, chopped (about 10)","50g pecans or walnuts, chopped (or mixed chopped nuts)","100g light brown soft sugar","25g butter, cut into cubes","100ml double cream","150g caster sugar","50g pecan or walnuts (or mixed nuts)","50g banana chips","½ tsp sea salt flakes"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Butter and line a 900g loaf tin with a strip of baking parchment.","Beat the butter and both sugars in a bowl for 5 mins with an electric whisk until really fluffy. Whisk the eggs, banana and yogurt in a separate bowl until mostly smooth, then whisk this into the butter and sugar mixture. Fold in the flour and baking powder until just combined, then fold in the dates and nuts. Spoon into the tin, smooth over the top and bake for 1 hr-1 hr 15 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then lift out using the strip of parchment. You can serve it warm now, or leave to cool completely on a wire rack. Will keep for four days in an airtight container.","Meanwhile, make the toffee sauce. Put the sugar in a heavy-based frying pan and melt over a medium-low heat until light golden brown and liquid – don’t stir, just tilt the pan to melt the sugar. Carefully whisk in the butter until smooth, then pour in the cream slowly and bring to a bubble. Mix until the sauce is smooth and shiny. Pour into a heatproof bowl, cover and leave to cool to room temperature.","For the brittle, put the sugar in a frying pan with 2 tbsp water over a medium heat, stir briefly, then simmer for 10 mins until the caramel turns amber. Don’t stir after the initial mix, just tilt the pan to get an even deep golden colour.","Meanwhile, line a baking tray with baking parchment. Carefully stir the nuts, banana chips and salt into the caramel, until well coated, then pour onto the tray. Tip the tray (or use a spoon) to make sure the nuts are in a single layer – or they will be harder to separate later. Leave to cool completely before breaking the brittle into shards.","Stir the toffee sauce to loosen if it’s become stiff, or warm for a few seconds in the microwave (add a splash more cream if you need to), then drizzle over the cake so it drips down the sides. Top with the shards of brittle. Will keep for two days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:21:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8520,8520,'en','Lemon drizzle sponge pudding','Transform a classic lemon drizzle cake into a self-saucing pud for a cheap, comforting dessert. Serve with cream or custard','["250g soft butter, plus extra for the dish","380g caster sugar","4 eggs","250g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","3 lemons, zested and juiced","2½ tbsp cornflour","custard or cream, to serve","50g icing sugar","1 lemon, juiced and zested"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 30 x 20cm deep baking dish.","Put the butter and 250g caster sugar in a bowl and beat for 5 mins until pale and fluffy. Whisk in the eggs, then sieve over the flour and baking powder and fold in until you have a batter. Stir in the lemon zest, reserving a little for decoration.","Spoon the sponge batter into the dish and smooth over the top.","Mix the lemon juice with the cornflour in a heatproof bowl to make a smooth paste. Mix the remaining 130g caster sugar with 300ml boiling water in a jug, pour over the cornflour mix and whisk until smooth. Pour this over the sponge. Bake for 45-50 mins until golden and set, and the sponge springs back when touched.","While the pudding is baking, make the lemon drizzle. Mix the icing sugar with enough lemon juice (about half of it) to create a loose consistency. Drizzle over the sponge while it’s still warm and decorate with the reserved lemon zest. Serve straightaway with cream or custard."]','2026-01-10 12:21:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8522,8522,'en','Red velvet cookies','Turn the popular cake into chewy cookies, complete with cream cheese icing. Box them up to give as a gift, or make a batch of dough to keep in the freezer','["175g soft salted butter","200g light brown soft sugar","100g caster sugar","1 large egg","2 tsp vanilla extract","½-1 tbsp red food colouring gel, depending on strength","225g plain flour","25g cocoa powder","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","150g white chocolate chips or chunks","2 tbsp soft cheese","6 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Beat the butter and sugars together with an electric whisk until pale and fluffy. Beat in the egg, vanilla and food colouring until you have a bright red batter. Sieve over the flour, cocoa and bicarb. Fold everything together to make a stiff evenly-coloured dough, then fold in the chocolate chips.","Put the dough on a sheet of baking parchment, fold the parchment over the dough and mould into a sausage shape about 6cm wide. Chill until ready to bake. Will keep for a week in the fridge or one month in the freezer.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Cut the cookie dough into 1cm thick slices using a sharp knife and arrange on two large baking sheets lined with baking parchment well-spaced apart so they have room to spread in the oven. Bake in batches, keeping the unbaked cookies on the sheet in the fridge while the rest are baking.","Bake in the middle of the oven for 13-15 mins until the cookies are crisp at the edges, but still soft in the centre. Leave to cool on the baking sheet for a few minutes, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely. Beat the soft cheese in a small bowl to a loose consistency, then stir in the icing sugar. Use a piping bag or spoon to drizzle the icing over the cookies. Un-iced cookies keep for five days in an airtight container, or two days iced."]','2026-01-10 12:21:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8524,8524,'en','Lemon & blueberry rice pudding tart','Transform a classic rice pudding into a modern tart with crisp pastry and zesty lemon. It''s a lovely dessert to end any dinner menu','["500g ready-made shortcrust pastry","plain flour, for dusting","500ml whole milk","125ml double cream","3 lemons, zested","100g caster sugar","100g pudding rice, rinsed","4 tbsp lemon curd","100g mascarpone","75g blueberry jam","2 eggs, beaten","100g frozen blueberries","1 tbsp blueberry jam"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Roll the pastry out on a lightly floured surface into a circle the thickness of a £1 coin. Line a deep 20cm tart tin with the pastry, leaving about 2cm hanging over the edge. Prick the base with a fork, then chill for 30 mins.","To make the rice pudding, put the milk, cream, lemon zest and sugar into a pan. Bring to the boil, then pour in the rice and stir. Simmer, covered, over a low heat for 15 mins, then uncover and cook, stirring, for 25-30 mins until the rice is cooked but retains some bite. Remove from the heat and stir in half the lemon curd and mascarpone, then leave to cool slightly.","Meanwhile, cover the pastry with a slightly scrunched sheet of baking parchment and fill with baking beans. Put on a baking sheet and bake for 15 mins. Remove the parchment and beans and bake for 15-20 mins more until golden. Leave to cool, then trim the edges with a serrated knife and set aside.","Whisk the jam until smooth and spoon into the base of the pastry case, spreading it out. Stir the eggs into the rice pudding and tip into the case. Bake for 20 mins until just golden and set with a slight wobble. Leave to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the compote. Combine the blueberries, 1 tbsp water and the jam and microwave for 1-2 mins, stirring occasionally, until syrupy. The blueberries should be soft but still holding their shape.","Remove the tart from the tin, put the rest of the curd in a piping bag and pipe over the top, then drizzle over most of the compote. Serve with any extra compote on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:21:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8526,8526,'en','Jam doughnut','Make a batch of our sweet jam doughnuts for the ultimate indulgent treat. These pillowy soft doughnuts are well worth the effort and are great for sharing','["500g strong white bread flour","60g golden caster sugar","15g fresh yeast, crumbled","4 eggs","½  lemon, zested","2 tsp fine sea salt","125g softened unsalted butter","about 2 litres sunflower oil, for deep-frying","caster sugar, for tossing","300g jam for filling"]','["Put 150g water and all the dough ingredients, apart from the butter, into the bowl of a mixer with a beater paddle. Mix on a medium speed for 8 mins or until the dough starts coming away from the sides and forms a ball. Turn off the mixer and let the dough rest for 1 min.","Start the mixer up again on a medium speed and slowly add the butter to the dough – about 25g at a time. Once it''s all incorporated, mix on high speed for 5 mins until the dough is glossy, smooth and very elastic when pulled.","Cover the bowl with cling film or a clean tea towel and leave to prove until it''s doubled in size. Knock back the dough in the bowl briefly, then re-cover and put in the fridge to chill overnight.","The next day, take the dough out of the fridge and cut it into 50g pieces (you should get about 20).","Roll the dough pieces into smooth, tight buns and place them on a floured baking tray, leaving plenty of room between them, as you don’t want them to stick together while they prove.","Cover loosely with cling film and leave for 4 hrs or until doubled in size. Fill your deep-fat fryer or heavy-based saucepan halfway with oil. Heat the oil to 180C. Read our guide on how to deep-fry safely for more essential information.","When the oil is heated, carefully slide the doughnuts from the tray using a floured pastry scraper. Taking care not to deflate them, put them into the oil. Do 2-3 per batch, depending on the size of your fryer or pan.","Fry for 2 mins each side until golden brown – they puff up and float, so you may need to gently push them down after about 1 min to help them colour evenly.","Remove the doughnuts from the fryer and place them on kitchen paper.","Toss the doughnuts in a bowl of caster sugar while still warm. Repeat the steps until all the doughnuts are fried, but keep checking the oil temperature is correct – if it''s too high, they will burn and be raw in the middle; if it''s too low, the oil will be absorbed into the doughnuts and they will become greasy. Set aside to cool before filling.","To fill the doughnuts, make a hole with a small knife in the crease of each one, anywhere around the white line between the fried top and bottom.","Fill a piping bag with jam and pipe into the doughnut until nicely swollen – about 1 tbsp per doughnut. After filling, the doughnuts are best eaten straight away, but will keep in an airtight tin."]','2026-01-10 12:21:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8528,8528,'en','Blood orange pound cake','Try this modern take on an American pound cake, with soured cream and sharp blood orange icing to balance the sweetness. Decorate with pistachios','["150g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","250g caster sugar","3 medium eggs, at room temperature","250g plain flour","1½ tsp baking powder","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","½ tsp fine sea salt","100g full-fat soured cream","3 blood orange, finely zested","3 tbsp chopped pistachios, to decorate (optional)","candied peel, to decorate (optional, see tip, below)","170g icing sugar, sifted","2-3 tbsp blood orange juice"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and butter and line a 1-litre loaf tin.","Beat the butter and sugar in a bowl for 8 mins until fluffy and very pale. Beat in the eggs one at a time. Fold in the flour, baking powder, bicarbonate of soda and salt, then the soured cream and zest. Spoon into the tin and bake in the centre of the oven for 45-50 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool slightly in the tin, then turn out onto a rack to cool completely.","To make the icing, combine the sugar and juice and spoon over the cake. Sprinkle over the pistachios and candied peel, if using (see tip, below). Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8530,8530,'en','Butterfly cakes','Treat family and friends to pretty butterfly cupcakes. Ours are topped with a light vanilla buttercream, jam and sprinkles, but you can decorate them any way you like','["110g butter, softened","110g caster sugar","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","110g self-raising flour","½ tsp baking powder","1 tbsp milk, plus 2 tbsp if needed, to loosen the buttercream","strawberry jam (optional)","sprinkles (optional)","300g icing sugar","150g butter, softened","2 tsp vanilla paste"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a cupcake tin with 10 cases. To make the sponge, tip the butter, sugar, eggs, vanilla, flour, baking powder and milk into a large mixing bowl and beat with either a hand whisk or electric mixer until smooth, pale and combined. Divide the batter between the cases and bake for 15 mins until golden brown and a skewer inserted in the middle of a cake comes out clean. Leave on a wire rack to cool.","While the cakes are cooling, make the buttercream by beating together the icing sugar, butter and vanilla until pale and fluffy. Mix in the extra milk if the icing feels too stiff.","Once the cakes are cool, use a sharp knife to slice off the tops, then cut the tops in half. Pipe or spread the buttercream on top of the cakes, then gently push two semi-circular halves into the buttercream on each cake, doing this at an angle to look like butterfly wings. You can serve the cupcakes at this stage, or decorate them with a little blob of jam in the centre and a scattering of sprinkles, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8532,8532,'en','Red velvet cupcakes','Bake a batch of red velvet cupcakes as a treat. With chocolate sponge and a cream cheese topping, they''re perfect for elevenses served with a cuppa','["150g plain flour","1 tbsp cocoa powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","50g butter, softened","150g caster sugar","1 large egg, beaten","1 tsp vanilla paste","100ml buttermilk or kefir","50ml vegetable oil","1 tsp white wine vinegar","1 tbsp red gel food colouring","100g slightly salted butter, softened","225g icing sugar","100g full fat cream cheese, stirred to loosen"]','["Line a cupcake tin with 12 cupcake cases and set aside. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Sieve the flour, cocoa, bicarb and a pinch of fine salt into a medium bowl and mix to combine.","Using a stand mixer or an electric hand whisk, beat together the butter and sugar until light and fluffy, then beat in the egg, vanilla, buttermilk, oil and vinegar until combined. Gradually mix the wet ingredients into the dried. Once combined, mix in the red food colouring until you have a deep red mix – the colour may vary depending on what brand you use.","Divide the batter between the cupcake cases and bake for 15 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the centre of a cake comes out clean.","While the cakes are cooling, make the icing. Beat together the butter and icing sugar using an electric whisk or by hand until pale and fluffy, about 3 mins, then beat in the cream cheese for a further 1-2 mins until well combined.","Once the cakes are cool, use a piping bag fitted with a star nozzle to cover the cakes with the cream cheese icing, or dollop the icing on top using a spoon."]','2026-01-10 12:21:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8534,8534,'en','Chocolate muffins','Make chocolate muffins as a weekend baking project with the kids. They''re perfect with a cuppa, and you can double up on the chocolate by adding choc chips, if you want','["125g plain flour","25g cocoa powder","1 tsp baking powder","1 large egg","60g caster sugar","2 tbsp vegetable oil","100ml whole milk","50g chocolate chips (optional)","100g icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a muffin tin with six muffin cases. Sieve the flour, cocoa and baking powder into a medium bowl. Mix together the egg, sugar, oil and milk together in a jug, then gradually pour into the dry ingredients (add chocolate chips now to make double chocolate muffins, if you like) and mix until combined.","Spoon the mixture evenly into the cake cases and bake for 20-25 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Remove from the oven and leave to cool.","Meanwhile, gradually mix ½-1 tbsp water into the icing sugar until you have a loose consistency that''s not too runny. Drizzle the icing over the muffins once cool."]','2026-01-10 12:21:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8536,8536,'en','Spiced walnut cake with pomegranate molasses frosting','Bake this celebration cake filled with walnuts for an alternative Eid dessert. It’s topped with a stunning pomegranate molasses frosting and candied walnuts','["4 eggs","150g golden caster sugar","100ml light olive oil","1 tbsp honey","1 tsp vanilla extract","150g self-raising flour","½ tsp baking powder","1 tsp ground cinnamon","6 green cardamom pods, seeds removed and crushed","200g walnut flour (blitz walnuts in a food processor to a coarse flour – be aware that blitzing it too fine will turn it into paste)","100g chopped walnuts","40g walnut halves","50g golden caster sugar","20g pomegranate molasses","60g icing sugar","400g tub full-fat cream cheese","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses","50g pomegranate seeds"]','["Line two 20cm springform cake tins with baking parchment. Whisk the eggs with the sugar in a bowl for 5 mins or so until thick and aereated. Slowly pour in the olive oil, whisking continuously, then pour in the honey and vanilla, and whisk again to combine.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Combine the flour, baking powder, spices and a pinch of salt in another bowl and mix. Lightly sieve this into the wet mixture, fold in, then add the walnut flour, little by little, until combined. Fold through the chopped walnuts and divide between the tins.","Bake for 25-30 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Remove and leave to cool in the tins.","To make the candied walnuts, tip the walnuts onto a baking tray and roast in the oven at 200C/180C fan/gas 6 for 4-5 mins until crisp. Meanwhile, combine the sugar, molasses and 20ml water in a saucepan, and set over a medium heat until the mixture turns a deep caramel colour (around 3-4 mins). Turn the heat down low, then add the nuts, stirring constantly until completely coated. Remove from the heat and tip out onto a layer of baking parchment to cool.","To make the frosting, beat together the icing sugar and cream cheese until well combined and smooth (the icing will get thinner before it thickens, so continue to whisk for 2 mins), then briefly stir through the molasses to create a ripple effect. Spread half of the frosting on top of one of the cake layers, then sandwich with the other. Top with more icing, the pomegranate seeds and candied walnuts. Serve cut into slices. Will keep chilled in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8538,8538,'en','Chocolate orange cookies','Top rich chocolate biscuits with candied orange peel to make these moreish bites. They make a great edible gift for Christmas','["225g butter, softened","60g icing sugar","1 orange, zested and ½  juiced","300g self-raising flour","40g cocoa powder","175g dark chocolate, chopped","40g chopped candied orange peel","5 strips sugared candied orange peel, each cut into 5 pieces"]','["Beat the butter with an electric whisk until it is light and fluffy, then beat in the icing sugar a little at a time, adding the orange zest and 1 tbsp orange juice. Beat in the flour and cocoa a little at a time, then mix in the chocolate and orange peel.","Divide the mixture into two, pat each into a rough log shape on a piece of non-stick wrap or baking parchment, then use the wrap to help you shape each piece into a log around 15cm long. Chill until firm, about 2 hrs (see tip, below).","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line two baking sheets. Cut ½cm-thick cookies from the dough and lay them on the baking sheets, leaving space so they can puff up and spread. Put a piece of sugared candied orange on top of each. Bake for 10-15 mins or until the cookies are puffed. Cool on the sheets for a couple of mins before sliding them onto a wire rack. Will keep for two to three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:21:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8540,8540,'en','Gingerbread cookies','Put your feet up and enjoy these moreish gingerbread cookies with a cuppa, made with aromatic cloves, ginger, cinnamon and rich black treacle','["120g unsalted butter, softened","1½ tbsp black treacle","170g soft light brown sugar","½ tsp fine sea salt","1 medium egg","200g plain flour","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","¼ tsp ground cloves","1½ tsp ground ginger","½ tsp ground cinnamon","60g golden caster sugar"]','["Beat together the butter, treacle, brown sugar and salt in a large mixing bowl. Add the egg, then beat through all of the remaining dry ingredients apart from the caster sugar. Chill the mixture in the fridge for 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4. Line two baking sheets with baking parchment. Roll the mixture into 20 even-sized balls (weighing for accuracy, if you like). Tip the caster sugar onto a small plate, then add each ball and roll around to coat. Space each ball out on the baking sheets. Bake for 9-10 mins until golden brown. Leave to cool completely on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:21:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8542,8542,'en','Vegan shortbread','Make our vegan shortbread with olive oil for a buttery flavour and cornflour to get the crumbliness of traditional versions. They taste great with nut butter','["250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","75g caster sugar, plus 1 tbsp","½  tbsp cornflour","1 tsp vanilla extract","125ml light olive oil"]','["Whizz the flour, sugar and cornflour in a food processor to sieve and mix briefly, then add the vanilla and drizzle in the olive oil, pulsing the food processor blades until you get a soft, golden dough. Wrap and chill for 30 mins to rest.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4, and line a baking sheet with parchment or a baking mat. Roll the dough out on a lightly floured work surface to a 5mm thickness and use a round or fluted cutter, about 6cm diameter, to cut out shortbread rounds. Use a small palette knife to transfer to the baking sheet. Can be frozen on the baking tray, then transfered to a box when solid. Will keep for up to three months.","Sprinkle the 1 tbsp sugar over the biscuits and bake for 15-20 mins until golden brown. Leave to cool for a few mins to firm up on the tray, then transfer to a cooling rack to cool completely. Add 2-4 mins to the cooking time if baking from frozen."]','2026-01-10 12:21:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8544,8544,'en','Caramel pear blondies','Bake these caramel pear blondies for an indulgent teatime treat. With a biscuity flavour that comes from browning the butter, they''re moreish and chewy','["250g unsalted butter, cubed, plus extra for the tin","3 large eggs","275g light brown soft sugar","25g dark brown muscovado sugar","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","1 tsp fine sea salt","200g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","100g dried pears, roughly chopped","100g dark chocolate, roughly chopped","3 tbsp caramel, from a can or jar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 20 x 25cm square brownie tin.","Melt the butter in a saucepan over a medium heat, swirling it around. Allow to bubble for a few minutes, or until it turns a light golden brown and smells biscuity. Remove from the heat and leave to cool a little.","Tip the eggs into a large mixing bowl and whisk together with the light and dark sugars until just combined. Whisk through the melted butter, vanilla and salt.","Gently fold through the flour, baking powder, dried pears and most of the chocolate chunks, being careful not to overmix (this will make the blondies dense).","Pour the mixture into the lined tin. Top with the remaining chocolate and dollops of the caramel. Put in the centre of the oven to bake for 30 mins, or until a skewer inserted comes out with sticky crumbs (it shouldn’t be wet). Leave to cool completely in the tin. It will sink a little – the centre should be slightly squidgy. Cut into 12 squares. Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:21:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8546,8546,'en','Fig sponge pudding','Sponge pudding gets taken up a level with the addition of delicious baked figs and thyme, resulting in a seriously comforting wintry dessert. Serve warm with cream, ice cream or Greek yogurt','["250g butter, softened, plus extra for the dish","5 tbsp golden syrup","4 tbsp honey","8 fresh figs","4 large eggs","250g golden caster sugar","250g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp vanilla extract","4 tbsp full-fat Greek yogurt","2-3 thyme sprigs (optional)","extra virgin olive oil or honey, for drizzling (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 20 x 22cm ovenproof dish, then pour in the golden syrup and honey. Trim the stalks from the figs, then cut a deep cross in the top, just so they open out a bit, but be careful not to cut all the way through. Sit the figs upright on top of the syrup and put them in the oven to bake for 15-20 mins until softened and starting to caramelise a little at the edges.","While the figs are cooking, make the sponge mixture. Put the eggs, sugar, flour, baking powder, vanilla and butter in a bowl and use an electric whisk to beat until smooth.","Remove the dish from the oven, scoop the figs out with a slotted spoon and set aside. Once the syrup mixture has cooled in the dish, take spoonfuls of the sponge batter and gently place them on top of the syrup. It’s best to do this all the way around the edge first, then end in the middle – this helps keep the syrup mixture separate. Smooth the batter out very gently to cover any gaps and seal the syrup mixture in.","Bake for 35-40 mins or until the sponge springs back when pressed. Allow to cool for around 5 mins or until just warm, then seconds before serving, dot the surface with eight small dollops of the yogurt. Top each mound with a baked fig, then scatter over some thyme leaves and drizzle with extra virgin olive oil, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:21:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8548,8548,'en','Kiwi slime pies','Make these kiwi pies for a Halloween party and they''ll go down a treat with kids and grown-ups alike. Green jelly and custard make a delicious ''slime'' filling','["320g shop-bought ready-rolled shortcrust pastry","4 egg yolks, plus 1 egg white (freeze the remaining whites to make meringues another day)","400ml milk","35g golden caster sugar","1 heaped tbsp plain flour","5 cubes green jelly","2-3 green and golden kiwi fruit, peeled and sliced"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Divide the pastry into eight equal pieces. Roll each out until large enough to line deep 7-8cm fluted tartlet tins or eight holes of a large muffin tin. Line the tins with the pastry, leaving a little sticking up above the rims, then line with paper cases and baking beans. Put the tins on a baking tray and bake for 10 mins, then remove the paper and beans, brush with the egg white and bake for 5-10 mins more until crisp and golden. Leave to cool for 5 mins, then remove from the tins and leave to cool completely.","Put the milk in a pan and bring almost to the boil, then remove from the heat. Put the egg yolks, sugar and flour in a bowl and whisk with an electric whisk until pale and fluffy – it should leave a trail that stays on the surface momentarily when the whisk is lifted. Pour a third of the hot milk into the bowl, slowly whisking all the time, until it has all been mixed in. Whisk in the remaining milk.","Return the mixture to the pan, scraping it out using a rubber spatula. Bring slowly to the boil, stirring, until the custard is thick, smooth and glossy. At first, it will look a bit lumpy, but keep stirring and it will become smooth. Reduce the heat and simmer for 2 mins, stirring. Stir in the jelly until the cubes have dissolved. Leave the mixture to cool until just warm, then divide it between the baked tart cases. Top each with a slice of kiwi and leave to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:21:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8550,8550,'en','Quick crumble mix','Make this speedy fruit crumble for when guests pop over. It takes 20 minutes to prep, then you can leave it in the oven while you entertain','["450g fruit, chopped into 1cm chunks (we used 400g Bramley apples and 50g fresh blackberries)","75g granulated sugar","50g butter, cold and cubed","100g plain flour","50g demerara sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Mix together the fruit and granulated sugar (you will need less sugar for canned fruit) so it’s evenly coated. Tip into a pie dish where it fits snugly.","Rub the butter into the flour to make a light breadcrumb texture. Do not overwork it or the crumble will become heavy. Add in the demerara sugar until combined and spread over the fruit until completely covered.","Bake for 35-50 mins until golden brown and bubbling, and the fruit is tender. Leave to cool for 5 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:21:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8553,8553,'en','Chocolate tiffin','Go all out and treat yourself to these chocolate tiffin slices, full of milk and dark chocolate, raisins and biscuit. Be warned: they won''t last long!','["150g butter, cubed, plus extra for the tin","3 tbsp caster sugar","3 tbsp golden syrup","6 tsp cocoa powder","225g biscuits, crushed","handful of raisins","110g milk chocolate","110g dark chocolate"]','["Butter and line a 15-20cm tin with baking parchment. In a large saucepan, melt the butter, sugar, syrup and cocoa. Stir through the biscuits and raisins.","Pour the mixture into the prepared tin and press down, then smooth the top with the back of a spoon. Microwave both chocolates in short 20 second bursts, stirring frequently, until melted. Pour them over the mixture in the tin. Use a palette knife or spoon to smooth over, so it''s completely coated in chocolate.","Put the tin into the fridge and leave for about 2 hrs to set, or overnight. Run a kitchen knife under the hot tap then cut into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8555,8555,'en','Classic cheese scones','Indulge in some cheese scones for afternoon tea or as part of a picnic. They''re also great served alongside soups and you can freeze them for later use','["225g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","pinch of salt","pinch cayenne pepper","1 tsp baking powder","55g chilled butter, cut into cubes","120g mature cheddar, grated","90-100ml milk, plus 1 tbsp for glazing"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 with a large baking tray inside. Sift the flour, salt, cayenne pepper and baking powder into a bowl, then sift again to make sure the ingredients are thoroughly combined.","Add the butter to the bowl and combine with your fingertips to make breadcrumbs. Sprinkle 100g of the cheese into the breadcrumb mixture and rub together until evenly distributed. Try not to mix too much as the heat from your hands may start to melt the butter.","Make a well in the centre of the mixture and pour in enough milk to give a fairly soft but firm dough. Do not pour in all the milk at once as you may not need it all to get the right consistency.","Lightly flour a surface and roll out the dough to approximately 2cm thick. Cut out the scones with a medium (about 8cm) cutter, then put on a sheet of baking parchment, glaze with a little milk and sprinkle with the remaining cheese. Slide onto the hot oven tray.","Bake in the oven for 15-20 mins or until golden brown and cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:22:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8557,8557,'en','Mermaid cake','Create a cake with the wow factor with our colourful ombre mermaid. It''s a baking challenge but makes a magical party cake for kids and grown-ups alike','["300g butter, softened, plus extra for the tins","300g caster sugar","5 large eggs, beaten","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","1 tsp baking powder","300g self-raising flour","purple gel food colouring (or a mixture of purple, blue and red gel colouring)","700g icing sugar","350g butter, softened","Blue or purple gel food colouring","edible pearls and silver sprinkles, or extra optional decoration","200g white chocolate","2 tsp gold or metallic lustre (see tip below)","mermaid tail mould and small shell moulds, available online"]','["If you''re making the mermaid tails, melt the white chocolate in a heatproof bowl in 20-second bursts in the microwave, stirring after each turn. Pour into the tail moulds and small shells, and put on a small tray flat in the freezer for 15-20 mins until set. You can repeat this for four tails if you only have one mould.","Once set, remove from the mould, mix the lustre with ¼ tsp of water and paint it onto the mermaid tails (see tip, below). Put back on a plate or tray in the freezer until needed.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line the base of three 18cm sandwich cake tins with baking parchment. Using a stand mixer or electric hand whisk, beat together the butter, sugar, eggs, vanilla, baking powder and flour until you have a fluffy mix.","Divide the mixture evenly between three bowls and mix a few drops of colouring into each bowl until fully combined, making each bowl a different shade of purple, getting lighter. Pour each coloured sponge mix into separate tins and smooth over the tops. Bake for 25-30 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. After 10 mins, remove the cakes from their tins and transfer to a cooling rack, top-side facing down, and leave to cool. Don’t worry if the outside doesn’t look purple, the inside will!","While the cake is cooling, make the icing. Beat together the icing sugar and butter until pale and fluffy, mixing in 1 tbsp warm water to loosen the mixture if necessary. Set half of the icing aside in a bowl. Divide the other half of the icing between three bowls and colour each a different shade of blue, a dark, medium and light. Stack the sponges, spreading most of the white icing over each one using a palette knife, then use the palette knife to roughly coat the outside of the cakes with the remaining white icing to create a crumb coat. Chill for 30 mins.","Put each of the blue icing shades in separate piping bags and cut a large 2cm hole at the bottom. Starting with the dark shade at the bottom of the cake, pipe an even ring onto the whole cake, two-three times around. Continue working your way up the cake with the icing getting lighter as you reach the top of the cake. Using a small palette knife, work your way around the join in between each row, gently pushing to join each line together. Save some icing in the piping bags to decorate the top. Smooth over the cake with a large palette knife or cake scraper to create a smooth ombre icing, keeping the excess to decorate the top.","You can either mix all the leftover icing together and put in a clean piping bag with a star nozzle to get a multicoloured effect, or pipe individual shades on the top. Add a few dots around the top of the cake in the varying blue colours to look like waves (using some of the white to look like the top of a crashing wave), and dot around the pearls, sprinkles, shells and mermaid tails, pushing them into the icing on the side of the cake, and on top to finish."]','2026-01-10 12:22:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8559,8559,'en','Basic cookies','Bake a batch of these easy cookies with just five ingredients – or fewer. A perfect partner to a cup of tea, you can whip them up in no time','["225g butter, softened","110g caster sugar","275g plain flour","1 tsp cinnamon or other spices (optional)","75g white or milk chocolate chips (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Cream the butter in a large bowl with a wooden spoon or in a food mixer until it is soft. Add the sugar and keep beating until the mixture is light and fluffy. Sift in the flour and add the optional ingredients, if you’re using them. Bring the mixture together with your hands in a figure-of-eight motion until it forms a dough. You can freeze the dough at this point.","Roll the dough into walnut-sized balls and place them slightly apart from each other on a baking sheet (you don’t need to butter or line it). Flatten the balls a little with the palm of your hand and bake them in the oven for around 10-12 mins until they are golden brown and slightly firm on top. Leave the cookies on a cooling rack for around 15 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8561,8561,'en','Raspberry, pistachio & lemon curd trifles','Enjoy these individual raspberry, pistachio & lemon trifles as part of a summer menu. They’re easy to assemble and you can easily pack them up','["1 madeira cake (about 200g)","5 tbsp lemon curd","300g raspberries","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 tbsp limoncello","100g skinless green pistachios, finely chopped","400g thick custard","300ml double cream","2 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Cut the madeira cake into 1cm thick slices, and sandwich pieces together using 4 tbsp of the lemon curd. Cut into small squares, and pile into four dessert glasses or one medium trifle dish.","Mash half the raspberries in a bowl with a fork, and stir in the vanilla and limoncello. Spoon over the sponge. Top with more halved or whole raspberries – saving some to finish – and a scattering of the pistachios.","Stir most of the remaining pistachios into the custard, then spoon over the fruit and sponge.","Whip the cream and sugar in a large bowl until thick and billowy, and holding soft peaks. Spoon over the trifles. Top with the reserved pistachios, a swirl of lemon curd and the remaining raspberries."]','2026-01-10 12:22:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8563,8563,'en','Tahini banana cake','Try tahini as a secret ingredient in banana cake – it works brilliantly. Decorate it with our tahini buttercream topping and chocolate chips','["100g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","250g light brown soft sugar","85g tahini","2 large eggs, lightly beaten","1 tsp vanilla extract","275g plain flour","½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","60ml milk","2-3 small, very ripe bananas, mashed (about 275g)","3 tbsp sesame seeds","115g unsalted butter, softened","125g icing sugar","½  tsp vanilla extract","2½  tbsp tahini","3 tbsp chocolate chips"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/ gas 5. Butter and line a 20cm square cake tin with baking parchment.","Beat the butter, sugar and tahini together until pale and smooth. Beat in the eggs a little at a time, then add the vanilla, scraping down the sides of the bowl as needed.","Mix the flour, bicarbonate of soda and ½ tsp salt together, then fold into the butter mixture. Stir in the milk. Carefully fold in the banana and sesame seeds, then spoon the batter into the prepared tin and bake for 40-50 mins until a skewer inserted in the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool slightly in the tin, then lift out and transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","To make the buttercream topping, beat all the ingredients, except the chocolate chips, together until smooth. Spread this over the cooled cake, then scatter over the chocolate chips and cut the cake into squares or rectangles to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8565,8565,'en','Jam turnovers','Make these super-easy jam turnovers from simple squares of shop-bought puff pastry and your favourite jam. Dust with icing sugar and serve with clotted cream','["320g sheet puff pastry","1 heaped tbsp jam (apricot, raspberry or strawberry work well)","1 beaten egg","icing sugar, for dusting","clotted cream, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Unravel the puff pastry on a lightly floured surface. Cut the pastry into six squares. Spoon the jam in the centre of each pastry square. Seal the edges by pressing down with a fork and brush with the egg. Lay on a lined baking sheet and bake for 20 mins. Dust with the icing sugar and serve with the clotted cream."]','2026-01-10 12:22:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8567,8567,'en','Ginger biscuits','Use fresh and ground ginger to make these moreish biscuits. They''re perfect served with a cuppa for afternoon tea, or as a treat anytime','["100g salted butter, cubed","75g light brown soft sugar","1 tbsp grated fresh ginger","100g golden syrup","250g self-raising flour","1½ tbsp ground ginger","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 small egg yolk, beaten"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Line two large baking trays with baking parchment. In a saucepan over a low heat, melt the butter, sugar, fresh ginger and golden syrup and leave to cool.","Mix the flour, ground ginger and bicarbonate of soda together in a bowl with a wooden spoon. Gradually stir in the cooled sugar mixture and the egg yolk and knead briefly to make a dough.","Roll the dough into 20g balls and put on the prepared baking trays with 3cm between each to allow for spreading. Bake for 8-10 mins until golden brown. Leave to cool on the trays for a min, then transfer to a cooling rack to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:22:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8569,8569,'en','Easy caramel cake','Need to make a celebration cake at short notice? This foolproof, showstopping caramel cake uses storecupboard ingredients and is quick to whip up','["225g softened salted butter, plus extra for the tins","125g golden caster sugar","100g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","4 large eggs","225g self raising flour","2 tbsp milk","toffee, chocolate or caramel pieces, to decorate","200g softened salted butter","400g icing sugar (golden icing sugar if you can find it – it adds a golden colour and caramel flavour)","70g caramel sauce, dulce de leche or caramel spread, plus 3 tbsp to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter two 20cm springform tins and line the bases with baking parchment.","Beat the butter and both sugars in a bowl with an electric whisk for a few mins until lighter in colour and fluffy. Add the vanilla and the eggs, one at a time, adding a spoonful of flour and beating in between each egg. Add the remaining flour and milk. Divide between the cake tins and bake for 25-30 mins until they’re golden, spring back when pressed, and a skewer comes out clean when inserted into the middle. Cool in the tins for a few mins, then tip out and leave to cool completely on a wire rack.","Meanwhile, for the icing, put the butter and icing sugar in a bowl and whisk for a few mins until light and airy. Whisk in the caramel briefly, adding 1 tbsp of boiling water to loosen, if needed. Set aside until the sponges are completely cool before assembling, or the icing will melt.","Use half the icing to sandwich the cakes together, then spread the remainder over the top, smoothing it out with a knife or the back of a spoon. Leave in a cool place until ready to serve. Drizzle with the 3 tbsp extra sauce (warm briefly in the microwave if it’s a little stiff ), allowing some to drip down the sides if you like, and scatter over the toffee, chocolate or caramel pieces to serve. Edible glitter, birthday candles or sparklers, optional."]','2026-01-10 12:22:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8571,8571,'en','Spiced honey drizzle cake','Enjoy this fabulous honey cake made with mixed spice and ginger and a lovely honey butter drizzle topping. It''s ideal for afternoon tea or elevenses','["100g salted butter, plus extra for the tin","100g light brown soft sugar","100g runny honey","1 large egg","100ml milk","1 tsp mixed spice","½  tsp ground ginger","150g self-raising flour","25g salted butter","25g runny honey"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 900g loaf tin with baking parchment. Beat the butter and sugar with an electric whisk until creamy. Whisk in the honey, egg, milk, spices and a pinch of salt (don’t worry if it curdles slightly, it will become a loose batter), then fold in the flour.","Tip into the prepared loaf tin and bake for 45 mins until a skewer inserted in the middle comes out clean. Leave the cake to cool for 10 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","For the glaze, melt the butter and honey in a small pan until smooth. Leave to cool until thickened, then drizzle over the top of the cooled cake. Leave to set before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8573,8573,'en','Pistachio, rose & white chocolate blondies','Try a different take on blondies using pistachios, rose and white chocolate. Scatter with dried rose petals for a pretty finish, if you like','["60g pistachios","150g white chocolate, chopped","100g unsalted butter, cubed, plus extra for the tin","200g light brown soft sugar","2 large eggs","½-1 tbsp rosewater","85g plain flour","100g white chocolate chips","dried rose petals, to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and butter and line a 20 x 20cm baking tin. Tip the pistachios into a pan and toast over a medium heat for 3-4 mins until aromatic, tossing occasionally so they don’t burn. Set aside.","Melt the chopped white chocolate and butter together, either in a bowl set over a pan of simmering water or in the microwave in short bursts. Leave to cool slightly, then beat in the brown sugar with a wooden spoon. Add the eggs, mixing well after each addition, then stir in the rosewater and ¼ tsp salt. Sieve in the flour and gently fold together.","Roughly chop the cooled pistachios, then add them to the blondie mix and fold in the white chocolate chips. Pour the mixture into the lined baking tin.","Bake for 35-40 mins until set and golden brown, then leave to cool completely before slicing. To serve, scatter with dried rose petals, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8575,8575,'en','Little carrot cakes with orange & honey syrup','Bake these gorgeous carrot cupcakes made with a delicious orange and honey icing for an afternoon treat. Edible flowers make a lovely finishing touch','["150ml sunflower oil, plus a little for the tin","175g light muscovado sugar","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 tsp mixed spice","1 orange, zested and juiced (save the juice for the syrup)","2 large eggs","50g natural yogurt","200g carrots, about 2 large ones, peeled and grated","50ml runny honey, plus extra to drizzle (optional)","150g mascarpone","100g thick natural yogurt","75g icing sugar, sieved","edible flowers or extra orange zest, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and oil a 12-hole muffin tin, or line it with muffin cases. In a large mixing bowl, mix the sugar, flour, bicarb, mixed spice and orange zest. Whisk together the eggs, oil and yogurt, then stir into the dry ingredients along with the grated carrots. Pour the mixture into the prepared tin, or divide between the cases, if using, then bake for 20-22 mins until a skewer inserted in to the middle comes out clean. Turn the cakes out onto a wire rack and leave them to cool a little.","Meanwhile, to make the syrup, heat the honey and orange juice in a pan. Bring to the boil, then simmer for a minute until syrupy. Spoon a few tsp over each cake while still warm, then leave to cool completely. For the icing, mix the mascarpone, yogurt and icing sugar until just combined (if you over-mix, it will become runny). Use a palette or cutlery knife to swirl the icing on top of the cakes, drizzle with a little more honey, if you like, and decorate with edible flowers or orange zest."]','2026-01-10 12:22:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8577,8577,'en','Tea loaf','Enjoy a classic, fruity cake, packed full of plump tea-infused currants and raisins. Slice it into thick wedges and spread with salted butter for a satisfying treat','["170g sultanas","170g raisins","1 orange, zested","300ml hot strong Earl Grey or Lady Grey tea","2 medium eggs, lightly beaten","250g self-raising flour","200g light soft brown sugar","butter, for greasing, plus extra to serve"]','["Mix the sultanas, raisins and orange zest in a large mixing bowl. Pour over the tea and cover the bowl. Leave to sit for a minimum of 6 hours or ideally overnight to allow the dried fruit to soak up all the liquid.","Heat the oven to 180C/160 fan/gas 4. Grease and line a 900g loaf tin. Add the eggs, flour and sugar to the soaked fruit, ensuring everything is well combined. Spoon the mixture into the tin and place in the centre of the oven for 1 hour 30 mins or until firm to the touch. Leave to cool in the tin for 15 mins before transferring to a wire rack.","Cut into thick slices and serve with butter. To store, wrap tightly and keep in an airtight container for up to five days. The loaf will taste even better after a few days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8579,8579,'en','Vegan flapjacks','Choose your favourite nuts and dried fruits in this versatile dairy-free flapjack recipe, or change it up each time you make them – be adventurous!','["140g dairy-free spread","140g soft light brown sugar","2 tbsp golden syrup","175g rolled oats","75g chopped nuts of your choice","75g dried fruit (such as raisins, dried cranberries, chopped apricots)"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 4 and line a 20cm square baking tin with baking parchment.","Melt the dairy-free spread, sugar and syrup in a saucepan over a medium heat. Remove from the heat and tip in the oats, chopped nuts and dried fruit. Transfer to the tin, packing the mix in with the back of a spoon.","Bake for 30 - 35 mins until lightly golden and crisp around the edges. Leave to cool in the tin before slicing into squares. Keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8581,8581,'en','Vegan hot cross buns','What says Easter better than hot cross buns? Try this vegan version, using dairy-free spread and almond milk – cinnamon, mixed spice, sultanas and citrus bring all the traditional flavours','["300ml unsweetened almond milk","50g dairy-free spread","500g strong white bread flour","7g sachet fast action yeast","70g golden caster sugar","½ tsp salt","2 heaped tsp ground cinnamon","2 heaped tsp mixed spice","1 large orange, zested","70g sultanas","50g mixed peel","70g plain flour","50g apricot jam"]','["Put the almond milk in a saucepan over a medium heat. Once simmering, add the spread, remove from the heat and allow to melt. Set aside to cool to hand temperature.","Mix the flour, yeast, sugar, salt and spices in a large mixing bowl. Make a well in the centre and pour in the milk mixture, swiftly combining with a wooden spoon to create a sticky dough. Tip out of the bowl onto a lightly floured surface.","Knead the dough by stretching it back and forth on the surface for 5 - 7 mins or until smooth, springy and elastic. Shape into a ball and put into a lightly oiled mixing bowl. Cover and leave in a warm spot to rise, for 1hr or until doubled in size.","Turn the dough back onto the surface and flatten into a round. Spread the orange zest, sultanas and mixed peel onto the dough and knead again until everything is well distributed. Form into a ball, return to the bowl, cover and leave to rise for another hour.","Line a large baking sheet with baking parchment. Knock the dough back by turning it out onto your surface and gently punching out the air. Divide the dough into 12 even-sized pieces, weighing for accuracy if you like. Roll each one into a ball. Arrange the buns on the baking sheet, leaving a 2cm space between each one. Cover with lightly oiled cling film and leave to rise for 45 mins.","Heat the oven to 220C/ 200 fan/ gas 7. To make the cross, in a small bowl, mix together the flour with 1 tbsp of water at a time to create a thick, pipeable paste. Spoon it into a piping bag fitted with a small round nozzle and pipe crosses on the buns. Transfer to the middle shelf of the oven and bake for 15-20 mins or until deep golden brown.","Meanwhile, gently heat the jam in a small saucepan over a low heat to loosen. Pass through a sieve to remove any lumps. Once cooked, brush the warm jam over the tops of the buns. Set aside to cool a little before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:22:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8583,8583,'en','Amarena cherry & almond tart','This sweet and sour cherry and almond tart from Lina Stores is the ultimate Italian treat. Serve up a slice as the perfect end to any meal','["125g butter","125g golden caster sugar","225g plain flour","½  egg or 1 egg yolk","125g butter, at room temperature","125g golden caster sugar","3 medium eggs","1 lemon, zested","125g finely ground almonds or almond flour","120g Fabbri amarena cherries (see tip)","icing sugar, for dusting (optional)"]','["Mix together the butter, sugar, flour, a pinch of salt and the egg in a food processor to make a dough, then wrap and leave to rest in the fridge for 30 mins. The dough should be cold but still easy to work with by the time you roll it out.","Meanwhile, make the frangipane filling. Melt the butter in a pan over a low heat, then set aside to cool slightly. Beat the sugar with the eggs and lemon zest in a bowl until creamy. Pour in the melted butter while continuing to beat, then add the ground almonds (or almond flour) and fold into the mixture. Heat oven to 175C/155C fan/gas 3½.","Line a buttered tart tin or ring mould (approximately 23cm) with the rolled-out pastry dough, then trim any overhanging edges. Spread the frangipane evenly into the tin and arrange the cherries on top with some of their syrup, so the top of the tart is covered in a thin layer.","Put the tart in the oven and bake for about 40-45 mins until golden brown, puffed and firm to the touch. Leave to cool on a rack. Dust with some icing sugar, if you like, before serving in slices."]','2026-01-10 12:22:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8585,8585,'en','Matcha mousse cake','A popular ingredient in Asian desserts, matcha powder is made from finely ground green tea leaves. This pretty cake with white chocolate glaze and cherries is a bit of a challenge but worth it','["vegetable oil, for greasing","6 large eggs, separated","200g white caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g plain flour","25g ground almonds","50g butter, melted and cooled","5 gelatine leaves","600ml pot double cream","2 tbsp matcha powder (see tip)","250g icing sugar, plus a little for dusting","150ml double cream","150g white chocolate, chopped into small pieces","1 tsp matcha powder","cherries and fresh pink cherry blossom flowers, to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease two 20cm cake tins (one should be at least 8cm deep) with oil, and line the base and sides with baking parchment. Tip the egg yolks, caster sugar and vanilla into a large bowl, and the egg whites into a second large bowl. Combine the flour, almonds and 1 /4 tsp salt in a third bowl.","Using an electric hand whisk, beat the egg whites until doubled in size and holding soft peaks. Transfer the beaters to the egg yolk bowl (no need to clean the beaters first) and whisk until the mixture is thick and pale. Lift the beaters and drizzle the mixture around the bowl – a ribbon should sit on the surface for 2-3 secs.","With a large metal spoon, transfer a spoonful of egg white to the yolks, and mix to loosen the consistency. Add the remaining whites and gently fold into the yolks, trying to retain as much volume as possible. Stop before the mixture is totally combined. Sprinkle the flour and almond mixture evenly over the surface, then drizzle the cooled butter around the edge of the bowl. Fold everything together until just combined, making sure you scoop the spoon right down to the bottom of the bowl to catch the butter and any pockets of flour. Divide the mixture between the cake tins, level the surfaces, then bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 22-25 mins. Test the cakes are done by inserting a skewer into the centre – it should come out clean. Cool in their tins on a wire rack for 30 mins, then remove the tins and parchment, and leave to cool completely.","Boil the kettle. Put the gelatine in a bowl of cold water and set aside to soften. Pour 150ml cream and 50ml hot water into a saucepan. Add the matcha powder and whisk over a gentle heat until well combined and steaming. Remove from the heat. Squeeze the water from the gelatine leaves and add them, one by one, to the hot matcha cream, whisking until they’re dissolved. Pour the warm cream into a bowl and put in the fridge to cool to room temperature – don’t leave it too long or the gelatine will set.","Line the deepest of your 20cm cake tins with a double layer of cling film, ensuring the sides are well covered. Put one of the sponges in the tin, flattest-side down. Pour the remaining 450ml cream into a bowl and add the icing sugar. Whip until the cream is holding soft peaks, then fold through the cooled matcha cream. Scrape the cream into the cake tin and level the surface. Put the remaining sponge on top, flattest-side facing up, pushing the sponge gently into the cream. Wrap the tin in cling film and chill for at least 4 hrs.","Put the cream, chocolate and matcha powder in a saucepan and heat very gently, stirring until the chocolate has melted and the matcha is well mixed in. Set aside to cool and thicken for 10 mins. Remove the cake from the fridge and unwrap the tin. Invert the cake onto a cake stand or plate and remove from the tin and the cling film. Using a palette knife held at a 90-degree angle to the side of the cake, scrape around the edge to remove any excess mousse and give the cake a smooth finish. Using baking parchment, create a tight collar, sitting about 2cm taller than the cake. Pour the cooled chocolate glaze over the top, smoothing it to the edge – the collar should prevent it from dribbling down the sides. Chill for 30 mins more, or for up to 24 hrs.","Carefully pull off the parchment collar. Hold a chopping board (or another object with a straight edge) over half the cake and dust the exposed surface with icing sugar. Arrange fresh cherries and cherry blossom or another edible flower on top, if you like, and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:22:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8587,8587,'en','Cardamom buns','This spiced Swedish bun has an intense floral perfume from cardamom seeds, which works its way into the dough during cooking','["35 cardamom pods","350ml full-fat milk","200g butter, cubed","500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","225g golden caster sugar","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","½  tsp ground cinnamon","vegetable oil or sunflower oil, for greasing","1 large egg, beaten","2 tbsp pearl sugar (available from ocado.com)"]','["Crack open 10 of the cardamom pods with a pestle and mortar, and tip into a saucepan. Add the milk and warm until steaming but not boiling. Add 50g butter (leave the remaining butter at room temperature to soften) and set aside to cool until lukewarm, swirling the pan from time to time to encourage the butter to melt.","Put the flour, 75g of the sugar, the yeast, cinnamon and 1 /2 tsp salt into a large bowl, or the bowl of a freestanding mixer. Mix until well combined. When the milk has cooled, strain it through a sieve into the flour, discarding the cardamom. Using a wooden spoon or dough hook, mix to form a soft dough. Tip onto a work surface and knead for 10 mins, or run the freestanding mixer for 5 mins, until the dough is smooth and stretchy. Clean the bowl, lightly grease with oil, then return the dough to the bowl and turn it over until well coated in oil. Cover the bowl with a tea towel or cling film and leave to rise for 2 hrs or until doubled in size (you could prove it in the fridge overnight).","Crack the remaining cardamom pods using a pestle and mortar. Prise them open and tip the seeds back into the mortar, discarding the pods. Crush the seeds to a powder, then combine with 150g sugar. In a bowl, mix the remaining butter with all but 2 tbsp of the cardamom sugar.","Line two baking trays with parchment. Punch the dough down to knock out the air, then roll to a rectangle roughly 35 x 45cm, with the longer edge facing you. Spread the cardamom butter over the surface, right to the edges. Fold the top third down to the middle and the bottom third up, like an envelope, so you have three layers of dough. Score, then cut into 12 equal strips, measuring about 3.5 x 11cm each. Cut each strip down the centre, leaving it attached at the top. Twist each strip away from the centre two or three times, then tie the dough in a knot and tuck the ends underneath the bun. Put each on the tray when done.","Cover both trays with a sheet of lightly oiled cling film and leave somewhere warm to rise for 30 mins - 1 hr, or until almost doubled in size. Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.","Uncover the buns and brush all over with the beaten egg, then sprinkle with the pearl sugar. Bake for 20-25 mins until golden brown – swap the trays halfway through if they’re browning unevenly.","Tip the remaining cardamom sugar into a pan and add 50ml water. Bring to a boil, then remove from the heat and set aside to cool, swirling to dissolve the sugar. Brush the syrup over the buns two or three times as they cool, leave them to soak for 20 mins before eating. Will keep for 2 days in a sealed container, or freeze for 2 months. Defrost at room temperature and reheat for 5 mins in the oven before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:22:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8589,8589,'en','Black tahini chocolate cookies','Make your own tahini using black or white sesame seeds, this recipe shows you how. Black ones have a nuttier, sweeter flavour, making them perfect for baking','["50g salted butter, softened","125g light brown muscovado sugar","125g golden caster sugar","1 egg, beaten","200g self-raising flour","2 tbsp cocoa powder","200g milk chocolate, broken into chunks","100g white chocolate, melted, for drizzling","100g black sesame seeds (available at Waitrose), plus extra for decorating","100g flavourless oil","30g maple syrup"]','["First, make the black tahini. Toast the sesame seeds in a small pan over a gentle heat until you can smell the sesame aroma. Transfer to a mini processor and blitz. Pour in the oil gradually until a paste forms. Add the maple syrup and blitz again. Tip into a small bowl until ready to use.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line two baking sheets with parchment. In a large bowl, beat the butter and sugars together until pale and fluffy. Add the egg and 80g of black tahini paste, and beat to combine. Tip in the flour, cocoa and milk chocolate chunks, and beat until fully incorporated.","Using an ice cream scoop, ball the dough into about 20 pieces and place on the baking sheets. Press each ball lightly so it’s a little flatter, leaving plenty of room between them, as they will spread.","Bake for 6-8 mins until still soft in the middle – they will harden as they cool. Leave to cool on the sheets for a few mins before transferring to wire racks to cool completely.","Once cooled, drizzle white chocolate zigzags all over the cookies and sprinkle some black sesame seeds on top. Will keep in an airtight container for 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8591,8591,'en','Lemon drizzle slices','A classic British cake from the Bake Off judge, Paul Hollywood''s lemon drizzle is a simple traybake, made extra special with feather icing','["70g softened unsalted butter","120g caster sugar","2 medium eggs","140g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","finely grated zest 1 lemon","1 tbsp lemon curd","2 tbsp full-fat milk","30g granulated sugar","juice 1 lemon","250g icing sugar","3 tbsp water","splash of yellow food colouring"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Line a 20 x 20cm square baking tin with baking parchment.","Using an electric whisk, beat the butter and sugar together until pale, light and fluffy. Add the eggs and mix again. Add the flour, baking powder, lemon zest, lemon curd and milk, and mix with a wooden spoon until all the ingredients are thoroughly combined. Pour the mixture into the prepared tin and bake for 25-30 mins or until a skewer comes out clean.","Mix the sugar and lemon juice together and pour over the hot cake. Leave to cool in the tin. You can eat the cake as it is, or for a fancy finish, try making this feather icing.","Mix the icing sugar with just enough water to give a runny, but not watery, icing. Put a small amount of icing in a separate bowl. Add a few drops of the food colouring to the icing until pale yellow. Spoon into a disposable icing bag.","Remove the cake from the tin and peel off the baking parchment. Sit the cake on a wire rack over a baking tray. Spread the white icing over the top. Pipe thin lines of the coloured icing across the width of the cake. Use a cocktail stick to drag through the lines in opposite directions to create a feathered effect. Leave to set before cutting into slices."]','2026-01-10 12:22:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8593,8593,'en','Baked almond, banana & blueberry cheesecake','Sweetened with natural fruits and a little maple syrup, this cheesecake combines ricotta and yogurt for a lower-fat, yet rich and creamy texture','["50g butter, plus a little for greasing","1 tsp maple syrup","75g oatcakes, finely crushed to crumbs","40g ground almond","2 bananas","2 x 250g tubs ricotta","150g pot natural bio yogurt","4 large eggs, beaten","2 tbsp maple syrup","2 tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp ground almonds","140g blueberries"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and lightly grease a 20cm round non-stick springform cake tin. Melt the butter and syrup in a pan, then stir in the oatcakes and almonds until well mixed and coated. Press firmly into the base of the tin to make a compact layer, then bake for 10 mins. Remove from the oven and increase it to 240C/220C fan/gas 9.","To make the filling, mash the bananas in a large bowl. Add the ricotta, yogurt, eggs, syrup, vanilla and almonds, and beat with a wooden spoon until everything is very well mixed. Pour onto the base, scatter over the blueberries and bake for 10 mins, then turn the oven down to 110C/90C fan/gas 1 /4 and cook for 30-35 mins more. It should still have a bit of wobble in the middle when you gently shake the tin. Turn off the oven and leave the cheesecake inside to cool and set. Chill before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8595,8595,'en','Hazelnut latte cake','Give coffee cake the ultimate upgrade – layer with chocolate hazelnut frosting, add a creamy topping and sprinkle with crushed nuts','["100g unsalted butter, plus extra for greasing","100g bag chopped toasted hazelnuts","300g light brown soft sugar","6 tbsp semi-skimmed milk","1 tsp fine instant coffee powder (see tip)","6 large eggs, at room temperature","2 tbsp cornflour","175g plain flour","50g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp fine instant coffee powder","1 tbsp Frangelico (hazelnut) liqueur, or use Kahlua or Tia Maria","400g mascarpone","300g hazelnut chocolate spread (Nutella has the best texture for this)","1 tbsp fine instant coffee powder","50g chopped toasted hazelnuts","150ml pot double cream","4 tsp icing sugar","3 tbsp semi-skimmed milk","1 tbsp fine instant coffee powder, dissolved in 1 tsp boiling water"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Generously butter two 20cm sandwich tins (ideally about 4.5cm deep or deeper) and line the bases with baking parchment. Put the hazelnuts into a food processor with 2 tbsp of the sugar, then pulse until finely chopped. Don’t expect them to go as fine as ground almonds and avoid over-processing, as this can make the nuts greasy.","Put the butter, milk and coffee powder into a small pan and heat gently until the butter has melted. Set aside.","Now start the sponge. Crack the eggs into the bowl of a tabletop mixer, add the rest of the sugar and beat for 5-10 mins (or beat with an electric hand mixer in a large deep bowl for 15-20 mins) or until thick and billowy, and the mixture leaves a trail that holds for a couple of seconds. It is really important that the mixture has thickened, almost doubling in size, in order to achieve a light sponge.","Mix the cornflour, plain flour and 1/2 tsp salt, and sift onto the whisked mixture. Using a large metal spoon, fold in very carefully. Sprinkle in the ground nuts, then fold these in too. Pour the warm milk mix around the edge of the bowl, and fold this in. Don’t rush the folding, and continue with a light lifting and cutting motion until ribbons of liquid stop appearing. Divide the batter between the tins, then bake for 25 mins until risen to the middle and a burnished gold.","Loosen the sides of the cakes with a palette knife, then cool in the tins on a rack for 20 mins (the cakes will level off, and possibly go a bit wrinkly, but that’s normal). Carefully remove from the tins and cool, paper-side down.","Make the syrup and the frosting while you wait. Put the sugar and 4 tbsp water into a small pan. Bring to the boil and leave for 1 min then take off the heat. Stir in the coffee and alcohol. Beat the mascarpone, hazelnut chocolate spread and coffee together with a wooden spoon, until silky and even.","To assemble, cut the cold cakes horizontally across the middle, using a long serrated knife. With a pastry brush, dampen the cut surfaces all over with the syrup. Use it all. Put one cake layer onto a plate or stand, cut-side up. Spoon on 3 generous dollops of the frosting, then spread to the edges with a palette knife. The frosting should be about 5mm deep. Repeat with the next two layers. When you come to the final layer, place it cut-side down, so that the top of the cake is smooth. Paddle the rest of the frosting over the top and sides of the cake. The layer on the top can be thin. Clean the knife then use it to press a neat ring of nuts into the frosting on the side of the cake. Brush any excess away.","For the topping, put 3 tbsp of the cream, 1 tsp icing sugar and 1 tbsp milk into a small bowl. Put the rest of the cream, milk and sugar, plus most of the dissolved coffee into a larger bowl. Whip the white cream, then the coffee cream, until they look like soft cappuccino froth, thick but still able to flow from a spoon. Pour most of the coffee cream onto the cake and push it out to cover the top. Whisk a little more coffee into what is left, so that it turns a few shades darker.","To decorate with a characteristic latte ‘tree’ shape, load a pointy teaspoon with a little of the white cream. Start at the base of the tree, just right of the centre of the cake. Push the spoon into the coffee cream and let the white cream flow slowly. As it flows, drag the spoon then pull it gently away, to make a leaf-like shape. Repeat with more white cream on the left to make another leaf, then repeat 3-4 times, working up the cake top graduating from large to small leaves. Use the same technique to sweep a couple of arc shapes around the edge of the pattern.","Use the dark cream to add detail to each leaf – you can paint this on with the tip of a teaspoon or a clean cocktail stick. Use a cocktail stick to drag the points of each leaf up and outwards. Draw a line down from the top of the ‘tree’ to the bottom to finish. The cake will keep for up to 2 days. Loosely cover any cut edges but avoid covering the cake directly as you could damage the decoration. Serve from the fridge or at cool room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:22:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8597,8597,'en','Lighter gingerbread','This dark and sticky ginger cake is made healthier with naturally sweet dates, buttermilk and plenty of cinnamon and fresh ginger','["140g dried pitted whole dates preferably Medjool, chopped into small pieces","75ml rapeseed oil, plus a few drops for greasing","75g black treacle","50g maple syrup","1 tsp finely grated fresh ginger","1 large egg","175ml buttermilk","250g plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tbsp ground ginger","½  tsp ground cinnamon","50g dark muscovado sugar"]','["Put the dates in a small bowl and pour over 125ml of boiling water. Leave to cool for 30 mins. Lightly oil a 28 x 19 x 3cm traybake tin, then line the base with baking parchment.","Meanwhile, put the oil, black treacle, maple syrup and freshly grated ginger in a bowl and beat together with a fork to mix well. Set aside. Beat the egg in a small bowl and stir in the buttermilk. In a large bowl, mix the flour with the bicarbonate of soda, ground ginger, cinnamon and sugar – rub the mixture between your fingers to break down any lumpy bits of sugar. Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.","Blend the dates and their liquid to a thick purée in a small food processor.\r\nPour the egg, the dates and the treacle mixture into the bowl with the flour. Stir together briefly with a wooden spoon just until well mixed – the mixture will be soft like a thick batter. Pour it into the lined tin, gently level the mixture and bake for 40-45 mins. To test if it’s done, insert a skewer in the centre – if the skewer comes out clean with no uncooked mixture on it, and the cake feels firm but springy to the touch, it should be done.","Leave in the tin for a few mins before removing to a wire rack, peeling off the parchment and leaving to cool completely. If you can wait, wrap it well in parchment, then foil. Leave for a day before cutting, as it will become stickier – it will keep moist for 3-4 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8599,8599,'en','Easy vegan chocolate cake','This indulgent, fudgy vegan bake is topped with a rich frosting – you''d never guess that it''s free from dairy, eggs, wheat and nuts','["a little a little dairy-free sunflower spread, for greasing","1 large, ripe avocado (about 150g)","300g light muscovado sugar","350g gluten-free plain flour","50g good quality cocoa powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 tsp gluten-free baking powder","400ml unsweetened soya milk","150ml vegetable oil","2 tsp vanilla extract","85g ripe avocados flesh, mashed","85g dairy-free sunflower spreads","200g dairy-free chocolate, 70% cocoa, broken into chunks","25g cocoa powder","125ml unsweetened soya milk","200g icing sugar, sifted","1 tsp vanilla extract","gluten-free and vegan sprinkles, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Grease 2 x 20cm sandwich tins, then line the bases with baking parchment. Put the avocado and the sugar in a food processor and whizz until smooth. Add the rest of the cake ingredients to the bowl with 1/2 tsp fine salt and process again to a velvety, liquid batter. Divide between the tins and bake for 25 mins or until fully risen and a skewer inserted into the middle of the cakes comes out clean.","Cool in the tins for 5 mins, then turn the cakes onto a rack to cool completely. While you wait, start preparing the frosting. Beat together the avocado and sunflower spread with electric beaters until creamy and smooth. Pass through a sieve and set aside.","Melt the chocolate, either over a bowl of water or in the microwave, then let it cool for a few mins. Sift the cocoa into a large bowl. Bring the soya milk to a simmer, then gradually beat into the cocoa until smooth. Cool for a few mins. Tip in the avocado mix, icing sugar, melted chocolate and vanilla, and keep mixing to make a shiny, thick frosting. Use this to sandwich and top the cake. Cover with sprinkles or your own decoration, then leave to set for 10 mins before slicing. Can be made 2 days ahead."]','2026-01-10 12:22:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8601,8601,'en','Almond & raspberry cruffins','Cross a croissant with a muffin and you’ll get these buttery, flaky, fruity pastries – perfect for brunch or an indulgent treat','["1 tsp fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp lemon juice","225g strong white flour, sifted, plus extra for shaping","25g golden caster sugar","140g cold unsalted butter, chopped into sugar-cube-sized pieces","50g unsalted butter","50g golden caster sugar","50g ground almonds","1 tsp plain flour","a few drops almond extract","1 egg yolk","a few tbsp seedless raspberry jam","icing sugar, to dust"]','["For the pastry, measure 75ml just-warm water, add the yeast and stir it to dissolve. Measure another 75ml ice-cold water and add the lemon juice to it. Mix the flour and sugar with 1/2 tsp fine salt in a large bowl, then toss in the cubes of butter until coated in the flour. Splash the yeast water and lemon water over the contents of the bowl. Using a round-bladed knife, work quickly to bring the mix to a rough dough with lumps of butter held inside it.","Turn onto a floured work surface, shape into a squat rectangle without kneading it too much, then wrap in cling film and chill for 15 mins in the freezer.","Dust the work surface and pastry with flour. Roll the pastry in one direction until it’s 3 times long as it is wide, or about 45 x 15cm. Try to keep the sides straight as you roll, and the top and bottom edges as square as possible.","Fold the pastry over itself. Fold the bottom third up, then the top third down, to make a neat block. Turn the block so that its open edge is facing to the right, like a book. Press the edges together gently with the rolling pin. Roll out and fold the pastry like this 3 more times to make a smooth dough, with the odd streak of butter here and there. If it feels greasy at any point, or becomes springy, cover and chill for 10 mins before continuing. Wrap the finished dough and chill for at least 1 hr.","To make the filling, beat together all the ingredients and season with a pinch of salt. Set aside until needed.","To shape, put the dough on a floured work surface. Cut it in half across the middle and return one half to the fridge. Roll the other to a 30 x 20cm rectangle, then cut this into 3 strips, each 10cm wide. To create even more layers, fold each piece in half lengthways. Put a generous teaspoon of the almond mix at one end of the pastry, then roll the pastry around it in a spiral. Place, cut-edge up, into a non-stick muffin tin. Repeat to make 6 cruffins. Loosely cover with cling film. Can be chilled overnight. (You may have some filling left over, which can be frozen.)","Prove the dough at a cool room temperature for 2 hrs or until the pastry has filled the wells of the tin. Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Bake the cruffins for 20-25 mins until risen and deep golden brown. Remove and cool a little on a rack. To fill with jam, spoon the jam into a piping bag fitted with a 5mm nozzle, or use a chef’s squeezy bottle. Push the nozzle into the middle of the cruffin and squeeze. Dust the cruffins with icing sugar and eat cool or warm on the day of baking."]','2026-01-10 12:22:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8603,8603,'en','Seeded wholemeal loaf','This hearty, wholesome bread is rich in flavour and packed with seeds – try pumpkin, sunflower, poppy or linseeds','["400g strong wholemeal bread flour","100g spelt flour","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp black treacle","oil, for greasing","50g mixed seeds (we used pumpkin, sunflower, poppy and linseeds)","1 egg yolk, loosened with a fork"]','["Combine both flours in a large bowl with the yeast and 1 tsp fine salt. Mix the treacle with 250ml warm water until well combined. Stir into the flour to make a slightly sticky dough. If you need to add more water, splash it in 1 tbsp at a time.","Knead the dough on a lightly floured surface for 10 mins (or in a tabletop mixer for 5-7 mins). Your dough should be smooth and elastic when it’s ready. Place the dough in a lightly oiled bowl, flip the dough over\r\nto coat it in oil, then cover with a sheet of oiled cling film. Leave in a warm place until doubled in size – this will take about 1 hr (see note, below). Lightly oil a 900g loaf tin.","Once doubled in size, knead the dough again for 3-5 mins to knock out the air bubbles – add most of the seeds and work these into the dough as you knead. Shape the dough into an oval roughly the same length as your tin. Place in the tin and leave to prove, covered with oiled cling film, for 30-45 mins until it has nearly doubled in size again. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Gently press a finger into the loaf to check if it has had enough proving time (see tip). When it’s ready, glaze the top of the loaf with the egg yolk and sprinkle over the remaining seeds. Bake in the oven for 40-45 mins until golden brown – if you tip the loaf out of the tin and tap the bottom, it should sound hollow. Leave to cool on a wire rack for at least 30 mins before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:22:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8605,8605,'en','Easy sourdough bread','Don''t be daunted by making a sourdough bread starter at home – this easy, overnight version makes a lovely loaf','["100g strong white bread flour","100g organic dark rye flour","½  x 7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","400g strong white bread flour","½  x 7g sachet fast-action dried yeast"]','["To make your starter, place all the ingredients in a bowl and add 250ml cold water. Mix together thoroughly with a spoon until you have a spongy mixture, then cover with cling film and leave at room temperature at least overnight, but up to 24 hrs if you have time.","To make the bread dough, tip the ingredients into a clean bowl and add 1 tbsp fine salt, 200ml cold water and your starter. Bring all the ingredients together to a dough, adding a splash more water if too stiff, then tip out onto a lightly floured surface and knead for at least 10 mins until smooth, elastic and springy (this will take 5-7 mins in a mixer with a dough hook). Place the dough in a clean, lightly oiled bowl, cover with cling film and leave until doubled in size – about 1 hr at room temperature, 3 hrs in the fridge (see tips, below).","Tip the dough onto a floured surface and gently shape into a round – you don’t want to knock too much air out of the dough. Dust a piece of baking parchment heavily with flour and sit the dough on top. Cover with a tea towel and leave to prove for 1 hr until doubled in size.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Place a sturdy flat baking tray on the middle shelf of the oven and a smaller tray with sides underneath. Dust the dough with flour and slash with a utility knife. Slide the bread onto the hot tray on top and throw a few ice cubes (or pour some cold water) onto the tray below – this creates a burst of steam, which helps the bread form a nice crust. Bake for 25-30 mins until the loaf sounds hollow when tapped on the bottom. Leave the bread to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:22:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8607,8607,'en','Cheese & pesto whirls','These herby tear-and-share bread rolls have mozzarella and sun-dried tomatoes baked into them – perfect for a picnic or for dipping into soup','["450g strong white bread flour, plus a little for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp golden caster sugar","2 tbsp olive oil, plus a drizzle","150g tub fresh pesto","240g tub semi-dried tomatoes, drained and roughly chopped","100g grated mozzarella (ready-grated is best for this, as it is drier than fresh)","50g Parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), grated","handful basil leaves"]','["Combine the flour, yeast, sugar and 1 1/2 tsp fine salt in a large mixing bowl, or the bowl of a tabletop mixer. Measure out 300ml warm water and add roughly 280ml to the flour, along with the olive oil, and start mixing until the ingredients start to clump together as a dough. If the dough seems a little dry, add the remaining water. Once combined, knead for 10 mins by hand on your work surface, or for 5 mins on a medium speed in a mixer. The dough is ready when it feels soft, springy and elastic. Clean the bowl, drizzle in a little oil, then pop the dough back in, turning it over and coating the sides of the bowl in oil. Cover with some oiled cling film and set aside in a warm place to double in size – this will take 1-3 hrs, depending on the temperature.","Line a baking tray with parchment. Uncover the dough and punch it down a couple of times with your fist, knocking out all the air bubbles. Tip out onto a floured work surface and dust the top with a little flour too, if it is sticky. Roll the dough out to a rectangle, roughly 40 x 30cm. Spread the pesto over the dough, then scatter over the tomatoes, both cheeses and the basil. Roll the dough up from one of the longer sides, into a long sausage.","Use a sharp knife to cut the dough into 12 even pieces. Place on the baking tray, cut-side up, in a 3-by-4 formation, making sure the open end of each roll is tucked in towards the centre on the arrangement – this will prevent them from uncoiling during cooking. Leave a little space between each roll as they will grow and touch as they prove. Loosely cover with oiled cling film and leave to prove for 30 mins–1 hr until almost doubled in size again. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Uncover the bread when it is puffed up. Bake on the middle shelf in the oven for 35-40 mins until golden brown and the centre looks dry and not doughy. Remove from the oven and leave to cool for at least 10 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:22:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8609,8609,'en','Salted caramel brownies','Take indulgent, fudgy chocolate brownies to the next level with a layer of salted caramel running through the centre of each bite','["200g unsalted butter, plus a little extra for greasing","100g chocolate, 70% cocoa solids","100g chocolate, 50% cocoa solids","397g can Carnation caramel","1 tsp flaky sea salt, plus a little extra for the top","200g golden caster sugar","4 medium eggs, at room temperature","100g plain flour, plus 2 tbsp","50g cocoa powder"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease then line a 23cm square traybake tin with baking parchment. Melt the butter in a medium pan, break in all the chocolate, then remove the pan from the heat and wait for the cubes to melt.","In a small bowl, mix 175g of the caramel with 1 tsp sea salt – it will loosen up. Put the rest of the caramel in a large bowl with the sugar and eggs, and beat with an electric hand mixer or balloon whisk until even.","Whisk in the chocolate and butter. In another bowl, combine the flour, cocoa and a good pinch of table salt, then sift this on top of the chocolate mix. Beat briefly until smooth.","Pour half the brownie batter into the tin and level it with a spatula. Using a teaspoon, spoon half of the salted caramel on top of the batter layer in 5 thick, evenly spaced stripes. Spoon the rest of the brownie batter on top and smooth it out, trying not to disturb the caramel beneath. Top with the rest of the caramel in the same stripy fashion. Drag a skewer or tip of a knife through the caramel to make a feathered pattern on the top.","Scatter with a little more sea salt, then bake for 25-30 mins or until risen all the way to the middle with a firm crust on top. When ready, the brownie will jiggle just a little when you shake the tin. Let it cool completely in the tin, then cut into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8611,8611,'en','Monkey bread','This American, pull-apart sweet treat is sticky, spiced and stuffed with pecans – an indulgent breakfast, brunch or dessert to share','["200ml semi-skimmed milk","85g unsalted butter","2 large eggs","550g strong white bread flour, plus extra for kneading if doing it by hand","2½  tsp fast-action dried yeast","50g golden caster sugar","oil, for greasing","125g unsalted butter, plus extra for greasing","1 tbsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground nutmeg","225g light muscovado sugar","140g pecans, toasted then roughly chopped","100g icing sugar, sifted","½  tsp vanilla extract","1 tbsp semi-skimmed milk","pinch of ground cinnamon","2 tbsp unsalted butter, melted"]','["Start with the dough. Put the milk and butter into a medium pan and heat gently until the butter melts and the milk is at a simmer. Cool for a few mins, then beat in the eggs with a fork. Mix the dry ingredients in a large bowl with 1 1/2 tsp fine salt, then add the liquid and stir to a sticky dough. Leave for 5 mins, then tip onto a floured worktop and knead for 5-10 mins until smooth and springy. Use a little oil to grease a large bowl, add the dough, turn it in the oil to coat, then cover the bowl with clingfilm. Leave in a warm place for 1 hr or until doubled in size. Knead in a tabletop mixer with a dough hook if you prefer.","To assemble, grease a 25cm bundt pan with butter. Melt the rest of the butter in a pan. In a medium bowl mix the spices and sugar plus a pinch of salt. Spoon 2 tbsp melted butter, 3 tbsp spiced sugar and 4 tbsp pecans into the bottom of the tin.","Pull the dough into about 65 small pieces and roll into balls. Taking 4 or 5 at a time, dunk the dough balls into the melted butter, let the excess drain off, then tip them into the spiced sugar. Roll to coat, then put haphazardly into the tin. Repeat until there’s a full layer of dough in the tin. Scatter with the rest of the chopped nuts, then carry on filling the tin with the coated dough balls. Tip any leftover sugar and butter over the dough. Can be frozen now for up to 1 month. Defrost in the fridge then let prove.","Cover the pan with oiled clingfilm then leave to rise in a warm place for 1 hr, or until risen and the dough no longer springs back when you poke it.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Bake the monkey bread for 35 mins, or until well risen and golden. Let the pan cool for 5 mins, then give it a sharp rap on the counter. Leave in the tin until just warm.","Whisk all of the ingredients together to make the glaze. It will thicken as the melted butter cools. Turn the monkey bread onto a serving plate, then drizzle with the glaze. Let it set, if you can bear the wait."]','2026-01-10 12:22:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8613,8613,'en','Luscious lemon baked cheesecake','A simple but very impressive pud, light enough to have a slice to finish a big meal','["225g digestive biscuits","100g butter, melted","250g tub mascarpone","600g soft cheese","2 eggs, plus 2 yolks","zest 3 lemons, juice of 1","4 tbsp plain flour","175g caster sugar","½ a 284ml pot soured cream","3 tbsp lemon curd","handful raspberries, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.\r\nLine the bottom of a 23cm springform\r\ntin with greaseproof paper. Tip the\r\nbiscuits and melted butter into a food\r\nprocessor, then blitz to make fine\r\ncrumbs. Press into the tin and chill.","Whisk all the other ingredients in\r\na large bowl until completely\r\ncombined, pour into the tin, then bake\r\nfor 35-40 mins until the cheesecake\r\nhas a uniform wobble.","Turn off the oven and leave the cake\r\ninside until cool. When it is completely\r\ncooled, remove from the tin and top\r\nwith soured cream. Swirl lemon curd\r\nover the top and decorate with\r\nraspberries, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8615,8615,'en','Little rose & almond cupcakes','Pretty as a picture, but dead simple. Add a paper flag and these will double as place names or favours at a wedding','["140g self-raising flour","100g ground almonds","½ tsp baking powder","175g caster sugar","½ tsp almond extract","3 large eggs","100g natural yogurt","175g melted butter","100g icing sugar, plus extra for dusting and sticking syrup","350g ready-roll icing","175g marzipan","green, yellow and pink food colourings"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and\r\nline a 12-hole muffin tin with cupcake\r\nor muffin cases. Mix the flour, almonds,\r\nbaking powder and sugar together in a\r\nlarge bowl. Beat the almond extract and\r\neggs into the yogurt, then tip this into the\r\ndry ingredients with the butter. Whisk\r\ntogether until lump-free, then divide\r\nbetween the cases. Bake for 18-22 mins\r\nuntil a skewer poked in comes out clean.\r\nCool on a wire rack. The cakes will freeze\r\nfor up to 1 month.","Roll out the marzipan on a surface\r\ndusted with a little icing sugar, to about\r\nthe thickness of a £1 coin. Using a 6cm\r\nround biscuit cutter, stamp out 12 circles,\r\nre-rolling and stamping trimmings if\r\nnecessary. Mix enough icing sugar into\r\na cup of water to give a syrupy icing, then\r\nbrush over backs of the marzipan circles\r\nand stick onto cakes.","Knead a little yellow food colouring into\r\none-quarter of the ready-roll icing, a little\r\npink into another quarter and green into\r\nanother quarter. Wrap up the green icing\r\nand set aside, then repeat step 2 using a\r\n7cm cutter to stamp out 4 circles each from the pink, yellow and white icing,\r\nsticking again with syrup.","Mix enough water into the 100g icing\r\nsugar to give a stiff-ish icing. Divide into\r\nthree, leave one white, and colour the\r\nothers pink and yellow – make these\r\ncolours a little darker so the roses stand\r\nout. Transfer icing into small food bags,\r\ntwist tops to seal and snip off just the\r\ntiniest tip of one corner on each bag. Pipe\r\nspirals on cakes, mixing up the colours.\r\nPinch small bits of the green icing into\r\nleaves, marking the vein with a toothpick\r\nif you like. Add 1, 2 or 3 leaves to each\r\nspiral so it looks like a rose (you can use\r\nthe syrupy icing to help them stick if you\r\nneed). The cakes are best eaten within\r\n2 days, and once decorated will keep for\r\n1-2 days in airtight containers."]','2026-01-10 12:22:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8617,8617,'en','Chocolate & orange fudge squares','Rich chocolate brownies with a light, carrot cake-style orange topping','["200g plain chocolate, broken into cubes (we used Bournville)","200g dark muscovado sugar","175g butter, plus extra for greasing","3 eggs, separated","140g plain flour","1 tsp vanilla extract","zest 1 orange","200g tub soft cheese (I used Philadelphia Extra Light)","½ tsp vanilla extract","50g icing sugar"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.\r\nButter and line a traybake tin, 23 x 23cm\r\nor thereabouts. Put the chocolate,\r\nsugar and butter in a pan, then heat very\r\ngently for about 5 mins, stirring every min\r\nuntil the butter and chocolate have\r\nmelted. Leave to cool for 10 mins. Beat\r\nin the egg yolks, flour, vanilla and half the\r\norange zest.","Put the egg whites into a large, very\r\nclean bowl, then whisk until they stand\r\nup in peaks. Stir ¼ of the whites into the\r\nchocolate mix to loosen it, then carefully\r\nfold in the rest with a metal spoon. Pour\r\nthe mix into the tin, then bake for 25 mins\r\nor until evenly risen and just firm to the\r\ntouch. Cool in the tin, then cut into squares.\r\nCan be frozen for up to 1 month.","Beat together the cheese, vanilla, sugar\r\nand remaining zest until smooth. Spread\r\nover each chocolate square and serve. If\r\nyou’re making ahead, spread the topping\r\nover just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8619,8619,'en','Ultimate quiche Lorraine','The key to making the perfect quiche is simplicity, as you can see with this tasty recipe','["175g plain flour","100g cold butter, cut into pieces","1 egg yolk","200g pack lardon, unsmoked or smoked","50g Gruyère","200ml carton crème fraîche","200ml double cream","3 eggs, well beaten","pinch ground nutmeg"]','["For the pastry, put the flour, butter, egg yolk and 4 tsp cold water into a food processor. Using the pulse button, process until the mix binds. Tip the pastry onto a lightly floured surface, gather into a smooth ball, then roll out as thinly as you can. Line a 23 x 2.5cm loose-bottomed, fluted flan tin, easing the pastry into the base. Trim the pastry edges with scissors (save any trimmings) so it sits slightly above the tin (if it shrinks, it shouldn’t now go below the level of the tin). Press the pastry into the flutes, lightly prick the base with a fork, then chill for 10 mins. Put a baking sheet in the oven and heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.","Line pastry case with foil, shiny side down, fill with dry beans and bake on the hot sheet for 15 mins. Remove foil and beans and bake for 4-5 mins more until the pastry is pale golden. If you notice any small holes or cracks, patch up with pastry trimmings. You can make up to this point a day ahead.","While the pastry cooks, prepare the filling. Heat a small frying pan, tip in the lardons and fry for a couple of mins. Drain off any liquid that comes out, then continue cooking until the lardons just start to colour, but aren’t crisp. Remove and drain on paper towels. Cut three quarters of the cheese into small dice and finely grate the rest. Scatter the diced cheese and fried lardons over the bottom of the pastry case.","Using a spoon, beat the crème fraîche to slacken it then slowly beat in the double cream. Mix in the beaten eggs. Season (you shouldn’t need much salt) and add nutmeg. Pour three-quarters of the filling into the pastry case.","Half-pull the oven shelf out and put the flan tin on the baking sheet. Quickly pour the rest of the filling into the pastry case – you get it right to the top this way. Scatter the grated cheese over the top, then carefully push the shelf back into the oven. Lower the oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Bake for about 25 mins, or until golden and softly set (the centre should not feel too firm). Let the quiche settle for 4-5 mins, then remove from the tin. Serve freshly baked, although it’s also good cold."]','2026-01-10 12:22:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8621,8621,'en','Lemon & poppyseed cupcakes','These zesty cupcakes look so gorgeous you won''t want to eat them, but once you start you won''t be able to stop','["225g self-raising flour","175g golden caster sugar","zest 2 lemons","1 tbsp poppy seeds, toasted","3 eggs","100g natural yogurt","175g butter, melted and cooled a little","225g butter, softened","400g icing sugar, sifted","juice 1 lemon","few drops yellow food colouring","icing flowers or yellow sprinkles, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4\r\nand line a 12-hole muffin tin with cupcake\r\nor muffin cases. Mix the flour, sugar,\r\nlemon zest and poppy seeds together in\r\na large mixing bowl. Beat the eggs into\r\nthe yogurt, then tip this into the dry\r\ningredients with the melted butter. Mix\r\ntogether with a wooden spoon or whisk\r\nuntil lump-free, then divide between the\r\ncases. Bake for 20-22 mins until a skewer\r\npoked in comes out clean – the cakes will\r\nbe quite pale on top still. Cool for 5 mins\r\nin the tin, then carefully lift onto a wire\r\nrack to finish cooling.","To ice, beat the softened butter until\r\nreally soft in a large bowl, then gradually\r\nbeat in the icing sugar and lemon juice.\r\nStir in enough food colouring for a pale\r\nlemon colour, then spoon the icing into\r\na piping bag with a large star nozzle.","Ice one cake at a time, holding the\r\npiping bag almost upright with the nozzle\r\nabout 1cm from the surface of the cake.\r\nPipe one spiral of icing around the edge,\r\nthen pause to break the flow before\r\nmoving the nozzle towards the centre\r\nslightly and piping a second, smaller\r\nspiral that continues until there are\r\nno gaps in the centre. Slightly ‘dot’\r\nthe nozzle into the icing as you stop\r\nsqueezing to finish neatly. Repeat to cover\r\nall the cakes, then top with sugar\r\ndecorations or scatter with sprinkles."]','2026-01-10 12:22:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8623,8623,'en','Rhubarb & pear crumble','This has a lovely crunchy topping that tastes like flapjack, perfect comfort food','["3 ripe pears","600g rhubarb","100g golden caster sugar","finely grated zest and juice of 1 orange","200g wholemeal flour","200g cold butter, diced","140g soft, light brown sugar","50g muesli or porridge oats","25g Grape-Nuts or Clusters breakfast cereal"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. For the topping, tip all the ingredients together and rub with your fingers until you have a rough pastry, then set aside in the fridge.","Peel the pears and chop into large chunks, then chop the rhubarb into finger-length batons. Tip into a large ovenproof dish and toss with the sugar and orange zest and juice. Crumble over the topping and bake for 40 mins until golden and bubbling at the sides. Leave to cool for 5 mins before spooning into bowls and serving with custard or ice cream."]','2026-01-10 12:22:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8624,8625,'en','Raspberry & almond traybake','One mixture all whizzed in the food processor makes the base and topping for this bake','["250g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","200g butter, diced","280g golden granulated sugar","50g desiccated coconut","2 medium eggs","350-450g/12oz-1lb fresh or frozen raspberries"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/fan160C/gas 4. Butter an oblong cake tin (about 31 x 17 x 3cm). Tip the flour, ground almonds, butter and sugar into a food processor and whizz just until the butter is evenly distributed – or rub together by hand. Remove 85g/3oz of the mix, stir in the coconut and put to one side. Add the eggs to the remaining mixture in the food processor and whizz quickly – or mix with a wooden spoon. It doesn’t need to be very smooth.","Spread this mixture over the base of the tin, then scatter half the raspberries over the top. Sprinkle with the coconut mixture and bake for 45 mins. Dot the remaining fruit over the surface and cook for a further 15 mins, until firm to the touch. Cool in the tin and cut into slices, squares, whichever shape you want. They will keep for up to 2 days in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:22:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8626,8626,'en','Banbury cakes','The Banbury cake reigns in the Midlands. Try this quick recipe for a teatime treat, lovely with a cup of Earl Grey','["50g unsalted butter, softened","1 tbsp English honey","½  tsp freshly grated nutmeg","½  tsp ground cinnamon","100g currants","50g candied orange peel","plain flour, for dusting","500g pack all-butter puff pastry","1 egg white, beaten","1-2 tbsp nibbed sugar or crushed rough-edged sugar cubes"]','["Cream the butter and honey together\r\nwith the spices. Add the currants and the\r\ncandied peel and mix well. On a lightly\r\nfloured surface roll out the pastry to the\r\nthickness of a £1 coin and cut out 10 x\r\n10cm circles, re-rolling any trimmings.\r\nDivide the filling between the circles.","Bring up the edges of the pastry to\r\nenclose the filling and crimp the edges\r\nof the pastry together to look like little\r\npurses. Turn the parcels over, with the\r\nfolds underneath. Roll each parcel out\r\ngently to an oval shape, taking care not\r\nto expose the filling.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nPlace the cakes on a baking sheet lined\r\nwith non-stick paper. Brush with the egg\r\nwhite and sprinkle with sugar. Cook for\r\n25-30 mins until cooked and crispy. Turn\r\nthe oven down if the tops brown too quickly.","When cooked, transfer to a wire rack\r\nand allow to cool a little before eating.\r\nWhen cold, they’re excellent spread\r\nwith a little salted butter."]','2026-01-10 12:22:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8628,8628,'en','Courgette & mushroom bread','A great accompaniment to soups and salads or just served warm with a bit of butter','["3 medium courgettes, grated","2 tsp salt","2 tbsp olive oil","1 small onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","100g chestnut mushrooms, chopped","350g plain flour","7g sachet easy-blend dried yeast","2 tbsp chopped fresh basil","½ tbsp coarse sea salt, to sprinkle"]','["Put the grated courgettes in a colander and sprinkle with 1 tsp of the salt. Leave to stand for 20 mins, then, using your hands, squeeze out as much of the moisture as possible. Rinse the courgettes thoroughly, then squeeze again.","Heat 1 tbsp of the olive oil in a frying pan and cook the onion and garlic for 4 mins until softened. Add the mushrooms and cook for a further 4 mins until softened and browned, then add the courgettes and cook for another 2 mins. Strain well and set aside to cool; discard the liquid.","Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Place the flour in a large mixing bowl, stir in the yeast, the remaining oil and salt, the basil and the courgette mixture. Mix well to combine. Make a well in the centre and add 125ml hand-hot water. Mix well to form a slightly sticky dough. Knead on a floured surface for about \r\n10 mins, then shape into a ball and place on a greased baking sheet.","Flatten the ball of dough very slightly with the palm of your hand and loosely cover with oiled cling film. Leave to rise in a warm place for 25-30 mins until doubled in size. Brush the top of the dough with a little water, then sprinkle with the sea salt and bake for 40 mins until golden. Leave to cool on a wire rack before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8630,8630,'en','Lemon drizzle cakes','The mini and extra marvellous version of our most popular recipe, the lemon drizzle cake','["250g pack of butter, softenend","400g caster sugar","3 eggs, lightly beaten","250g self-raising flour","zest and juice 3 lemons"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nLine a muffin tin with 12 muffin cases.\r\nWith an electric whisk, whisk the butter,\r\n250g of the sugar, eggs, flour, zest of\r\n2 lemons and juice from 1 lemon until\r\njust combined – don’t over-whisk. Divide\r\nbetween the cases (they will be quite\r\nfull), then bake on a middle shelf for\r\n30 mins, until a skewer poked in comes\r\nout clean.","Cool for 10 mins, then transfer cakes to\r\na cooling rack on a tray and poke each a\r\nfew times with a skewer. Pour remaining\r\nlemon juice over remaining 150g sugar\r\nand zest 1 lemon, and immediately spoon\r\nover the cakes. Leave to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:22:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8632,8632,'en','Bread pudding','This simple bake is lovely with tea, or custard or ice cream for dessert','["500g white or wholemeal bread","500g/1lb 2oz mixed dried fruit","85g mixed peel","1 ½ tbsp mixed spice","600ml milk","2 large eggs, beaten","140g light muscovado sugar","zest 1 lemon (optional)","100g butter, melted","2 tbsp demerara sugar"]','["Tear the bread into a large mixing bowl\r\nand add the fruit, peel and spice. Pour in\r\nthe milk, then stir or scrunch through\r\nyour fingers to mix everything well and\r\ncompletely break up the bread. Add eggs,\r\nmuscovado and lemon zest if using. Stir\r\nwell, then set aside for 15 mins to soak.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nButter and line the base of a 20cm\r\nnon-stick square cake tin (not one with\r\na loose base). Stir the melted butter into\r\nthe pudding mixture, tip into the tin, then\r\nscatter with demerara. Bake for 1½ hrs\r\nuntil firm and golden, covering with foil\r\nif it starts to brown too much. Turn out\r\nof the tin and strip off the paper. Cut into\r\nsquares and serve warm."]','2026-01-10 12:22:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8634,8634,'en','Custard tart with nutmeg pastry','There’s something so honest about a custard tart, simply topped with a grating of nutmeg','["500g pack shortcrust pastry","1 whole nutmeg, for grating","4 large eggs","140g golden caster sugar","300ml double cream","300ml whole milk","1 vanilla pod, seeds scraped out"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nRoll the pastry out to about 1cm thick,\r\nthen grate over a dusting of nutmeg\r\nusing a fine grater. Fold the dough in half,\r\nthen roll out again, to the thickness of\r\n2 x £1 coins and large enough to line a\r\n20cm loose-bottomed sandwich tin with\r\nsome overhang. Press the pastry into the\r\ntin (leaving the excess draped over the\r\nsides), put onto a baking sheet and chill\r\nfor 10 mins. Line the pastry with baking\r\nparchment and fill with baking beans.\r\nBake for 20 mins, then remove beans\r\nand paper. Bake for another 15 mins until\r\ngolden and sandy all over. Trim the edges\r\nof the tart with a sharp serrated knife.","Turn oven down to 150C/130C fan/\r\ngas 2. Whisk together the eggs and sugar\r\nin a large bowl. Put the cream, milk,\r\nvanilla pod and seeds into a saucepan\r\nand bring to the boil. Pour onto the eggs,\r\nwhisking as you go. Sieve into a jug. Put\r\nthe baking sheet onto the pulled-out\r\noven rack, then pour in the custard, right\r\nto the top. You may not need every last\r\ndrop. Grate over a nice layer of nutmeg,\r\nthen slide gently back into the oven and\r\nbake for 1 hr. When it’s ready, the tart\r\nshould be set and pale golden on the top,\r\nand have just the merest tremor in the\r\ncentre when you jiggle the tray. Cool\r\ncompletely, then serve in slices."]','2026-01-10 12:22:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8636,8636,'en','Pistachio & milk chocolate squares','Try something different with Sarah Cook’s Pistachio & milk chocolate squares – you won’t be able to stop at just one piece!','["140g shelled pistachios","200g milk chocolate, broken into chunks","200g golden caster sugar","200g very soft butter","3 eggs","200g self-raising flour","100ml milk","150ml soured cream"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLine a 20cm square cake tin with baking\r\nparchment. Whizz 125g of the pistachios,\r\n75g of the chocolate and about half the\r\nsugar in a food processor until very finely\r\nchopped. Tip into a bowl with remaining\r\nsugar, butter, eggs, flour and milk, plus a\r\npinch of salt, and beat. Scrape into the tin\r\nand bake for 35-45 mins until a skewer\r\npoked in comes out clean. Cool.","Melt the remaining milk chocolate,\r\nstir in the soured cream and cool until\r\nspreadable. Trim the edges off the cake,\r\nthen split in half. Spread a little icing over\r\nthe base, sandwich the top of sponge\r\nback on. Spread remaining icing over\r\nthe top, roughly chop the remaining\r\npistachios and scatter them over.\r\nCut into 16 squares to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8638,8638,'en','Eve’s pudding','Here’s a little reminder of a delicious British pudding you probably haven’t eaten in years','["6 large Bramley apples, finely sliced","200g unsalted butter","140g raisins","100g soft brown sugar","4 eggs","200g self-raising flour"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nPeel, core and slice the apples. Grease a\r\nlarge serving dish, about 2.5 litre/3 litre\r\nwith 25g/1oz of the butter and tip in the\r\napple. Scatter the raisins over the top.","In a separate dish beat the remaining\r\nbutter and sugar together for 10 mins\r\nuntil the butter turns pale and the sugar\r\nstarts to dissolve. Beat in the eggs, then\r\ncarefully fold in the flour with a large\r\nspoon. Spread the batter over the apples,\r\nthen bake for 45 mins until golden. Serve\r\nwith the custard, below."]','2026-01-10 12:22:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8640,8640,'en','Cheesy garlic bread wedges','A wonderfully gooey version of garlic bread with jarlsberg','["85g butter, room temperature","2 garlic cloves, finely chopped","175g jarlsberg cheese, coarsley grated","2 tbsp chopped parsley","¼ tsp crushed dried chillies","1 round French country loaf, or ciabatta"]','["Preheat the oven to fan\r\n170C/conventional 190C/\r\ngas 5. Beat the butter and\r\ngarlic, then mix in the cheese,\r\nparsley and chillies. Cut the\r\nbread in half crossways\r\nthrough the centre.","Spread the cheese mixture\r\non the cut sides of both bread\r\nhalves. Wrap each half\r\nloosely in foil and put on a\r\nbaking sheet. Bake for 20\r\nminutes, unwrap the foil and\r\nbake a further 10-15 minutes\r\nuntil starting to turn pale\r\ngolden. Cut into wedges\r\nand serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8642,8642,'en','Blackcurrant Bakewell','Baking doesn’t have to be complicated – this simple fruity traybake is ready in 45 minutes','["250g softened butter, plus extra for greasing","280g self-raising flour","250g golden caster sugar","½ tsp baking powder","4 eggs","150ml pot natural yogurt","1 tsp vanilla paste or extract","1 tsp almond extract","4 tbsp blackcurrant jam","25g toasted flaked almonds","icing sugar, to dust"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease a 20 x 30cm baking or roasting\r\ntin and line with baking parchment. To\r\nmake the sponge batter, beat the butter,\r\nflour, sugar, baking powder, eggs, yogurt,\r\nvanilla and almond extract in a large bowl\r\nwith an electric whisk until lump-free.\r\nSpoon into the tin and bake for 10 mins.","Quickly dot over the jam, scatter over the\r\nalmonds, then bake for 15-20 mins more\r\nuntil golden and risen and a skewer poked\r\nin comes out clean. Cool in the tin, then\r\ndust with icing sugar."]','2026-01-10 12:22:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8644,8644,'en','Millionaire’s chocolate tart','A dinner party version of teatime favourite, millionaire''s shortbread. It''s not too bitter, so the kids will love it too','["375g pack dessert shortcrust pastry","1 tsp vanilla paste or extract","flour, for dusting","250g/9oz caramel (we used Carnation caramel from a can)","100g 70% plain chocolate, broken into pieces","100g white chocolate, broken into pieces","6 tbsp melted butter","2 eggs, plus 3 egg yolks","4 tbsp golden caster sugar","icing sugar and single cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Break the pastry into chunks and drop\r\ninto a food processor. Drizzle over the\r\nvanilla paste and pulse until the vanilla is\r\nspeckled through the pastry (the extract\r\nshould be completely absorbed). Tip out\r\nonto a floured surface, bring together\r\ninto a ball, then roll out to line a 23cm\r\ntart tin (leave any overhanging pastry as\r\nyou will trim this away when the tart is\r\nbaked). Chill for 30 mins.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line\r\nthe pastry with greaseproof paper. Fill with\r\nbaking beans, bake blind for 15-20 mins,\r\nthen remove the paper and beans and\r\nbake for 5-10 mins more until pale golden.\r\nCarefully spread caramel over the base\r\nand set aside while you make the filling.\r\nLower oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Melt the chocolates in a bowl over a\r\npan of barely simmering water, then stir\r\nin the melted butter. Whisk the eggs,\r\nyolks and sugar together with an electric\r\nwhisk in a large mixing bowl for 10 mins,\r\nuntil pale and thick enough to leave a trail\r\nwhen the beaters are lifted up. Fold in\r\nthe melted chocolate with a large metal\r\nspoon, then scrape into the tin.","Bake for 20-25 mins – the surface should be set\r\nand puffed but still with a slight wobble.\r\nCool, then chill for at least 3 hrs or\r\novernight, before dusting with icing\r\nsugar and serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8646,8646,'en','Shortbread recipe','Bake these classic shortbread biscuits to wow a crowd. You only need four ingredients, but you can mix it up with lemon or orange zest, or try adding chopped pistachios','["300g butter, softened","140g golden caster sugar, plus 4 tbsp","300g plain flour","140g rice flour"]','["Place the butter and 140g sugar in a\r\nfood processor and whizz until smooth.\r\nTip in both the flours and a pinch of salt,\r\nthen whizz until mixture comes together.","Using your hands, roughly spread the\r\nmixture out in a 20 x 30 x 4cm baking tray.\r\nCover with cling film and smooth over\r\nuntil there are no wrinkles. Place in the\r\nfridge, uncooked, for at least 30 mins\r\nand up to 2 days.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nRemove cling film, then lightly mark the\r\nshortbread all over with a fork. Sprinkle\r\nwith the remaining sugar, then bake for\r\n20-25 mins. Leave to cool in the tin, then\r\ncut into 24 thin slices. Shortbread will keep\r\nin an airtight container for up to 1 week."]','2026-01-10 12:22:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8648,8648,'en','Bread in four easy steps','Kids can help with this super-simple bread recipe. Use whichever flour you like, granary, wholemeal or white','["500g granary, strong wholewheat or white bread flour (I used granary)","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp salt","2 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp clear honey"]','["Tip the flour, yeast and salt into a large bowl\r\nand mix together with your hands. Stir 300ml\r\nhand-hot water with the oil and honey, then stir\r\ninto the dry ingredients to make a soft dough.","Turn the dough out onto a lightly floured\r\nsurface and knead for 5 mins, until the dough\r\nno longer feels sticky, sprinkling with a little\r\nmore flour if you need it.","Oil the loaf tin and put the dough in the tin,\r\npressing it in evenly. Put in a large plastic food\r\nbag and leave to rise for 1 hr, until the dough has\r\nrisen to fill the tin and it no longer springs back\r\nwhen you press it with your finger.","Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Make\r\nseveral slashes across the top of the loaf with\r\na sharp knife, then bake for 30-35 mins until the\r\nloaf is risen and golden. Tip it out onto a cooling\r\nrack and tap the base of the bread to check it\r\nis cooked. It should sound hollow. Leave to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:22:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8650,8650,'en','Irish soda bread','Get the taste of Ireland with this fresh, no-fuss soda bread','["250g plain white flour","250g plain wholemeal flour","100g porridge oats","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp salt","25g butter, cut in pieces","500ml buttermilk"]','["Preheat the oven to 200C/gas 6/fan\r\n180C and dust a baking sheet with flour.\r\nMix the dry ingredients in a large bowl,\r\nthen rub in the butter. Pour in the buttermilk\r\nand mix it in quickly with a table knife, then\r\nbring the dough together very lightly with\r\nyour fingertips (handle it very, very gently).\r\nNow shape it into a flat, round loaf\r\nmeasuring 20cm/8in in diameter.","Put the loaf on the baking sheet and\r\nscore a deep cross in the top. (Traditionally,\r\nthis lets the fairies out, but it also helps the\r\nbread to cook through.) Bake for 30-35\r\nminutes until the bottom of the loaf sounds\r\nhollow when tapped. If it isn’t ready after\r\nthis time, turn it upside down on the baking\r\nsheet and bake for a few minutes more.","Transfer to a wire rack, cover with a clean\r\ntea towel (this keeps the crust nice and soft)\r\nand leave to cool. To serve, break into\r\nquarters, then break or cut each quarter in\r\nhalf to make 8 wedges or slices – or simply\r\nslice across. Eat very fresh."]','2026-01-10 12:22:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8652,8652,'en','Coconut flour cookies','Bake a batch of coconut cookies for the biscuit tin. They have a delicate coconut flavour and a texture similar to a macaroon. Add choc chips, if you like, too','["75g coconut flour","60g coconut oil, melted","2 eggs","2 tbsp peanut butter","60g light brown soft sugar","¼ tsp baking powder","2 tbsp chocolate chips (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line abaking traywith baking parchment. Put everything in a bowl and mix well until it''s combined and has a wet sand-like consistency.","Form 10-12 balls of dough roughly the size of a walnut and put onto the baking tray a few centimetres apart. Push down to create a disc a couple of centimetres thick, then put in the oven and bake for 12-14 mins, until lightly golden. Allow to cool for 10 mins before removing to awire rackand cooling completely."]','2026-01-10 12:22:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8654,8654,'en','Black and white pinwheel cookies','Black and white biscuits are a classic among Christmas cookies. You can make them into a checkerboard pattern or as a beautiful spiral like these','["300g plain flour","100g icing sugar","8g vanilla sugar or 8g caster sugar, plus 1 tsp vanilla extract","1 egg, plus 1 egg white for glazing","125g butter, softened","1 tbsp cocoa","1 tbsp milk"]','["Put the flour, icing sugar, vanilla sugar, a pinch of salt, egg and soft butter in a stand mixer and mix. Tip the dough onto a lightly floured worksurface and knead briefly by hand. Cut the dough in half. Wrap one half and chill for an hour. Knead the cocoa and milk into the other half. Wrap and chill for an hour.","Roll each batch of dough into a rectangle (about 30cm x 20cm) on a lightly floured worksurface. Coat the top of one layer with egg white then lift the other colour of dough on top and coat the top with egg white. Roll up tightly like a Swiss roll. Wrap and chill for 30 minutes.","Heat the oven to 175C/fan 155C/gas 3½. Line 2 baking sheets with baking parchment. Cut the dough into slices about 5mm thick with a sharp knife. Bake in batches for 10-12 minutes, but don’t let the pale dough darken as you want to keep the contrast. Allow to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:22:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8656,8656,'en','Bonfire Night cookies','Celebrate Bonfire Night with these cute cookies. Decorate these autumnal spiced biscuits with iced firework designs','["75g unsalted butter, softened","100g caster sugar","1 large egg","250g plain flour","2 tbsp cocoa powder, sifted","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp ground ginger","1 large egg white","250g icing sugar, sifted","½ tsp lemon juice","gel food colourings (we used blue, yellow and red)","star sprinkles (optional)"]','["Beat the butter and sugar together with an electricwhiskfor 4-5 mins until light and fluffy. Beat in the egg until combined. Add the flour, cocoa powder, cinnamon and ginger, and continue to beat until the mixture comes together into a dough. Put the dough between two pieces of baking parchment and roll out to a 6mm thickness using arolling pin.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Remove the top layer of parchment and cut out cookies using a 6cm round or star cutter. Re-roll the offcuts and continue to cut out cookies until all the dough has been used (you should get 20-22, depending on the cutter).","Arrange the cookies on a large baking sheet lined with baking parchment, spacing them at least 2cm apart (you may need two baking sheets). Bake for 7-10 mins until slightly golden at the edges. Leave to cool on the baking sheet for 10 mins, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.","Once cool, make the icing. Beat the egg white with an electric whisk until just starting to froth up, about 1 min. Add the icing sugar, 1 tbsp at a time, whisking continuously at a medium-high speed until combined. Add the lemon juice and whisk to stiff peaks, about 5 mins – the icing should be shiny. Add more icing sugar if needed to help it stiffen up.","To decorate, divide the icing into bowls and colour with the gel food colourings (we left some icing white, then coloured three bowls with blue, yellow and red). Spoon the coloured icing into separatepiping bagsfitted with small round nozzles (or snip off the ends). Pipe lines on the biscuits to create firework-like ‘burst’ patterns or swirls. While the icing is wet, decorate with star sprinkles, if you like. Leave to set slightly, then serve.Will keep in an airtight container for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:22:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8658,8658,'en','Lusikkaleivät (Finnish spoon biscuits)','Bake these delicate jam-filled biscuits at Christmas. They’re a Finnish festive tradition, and the secret to their delicious nutty flavour is the brown butter','["200g unsalted butter","125g caster sugar","2 tsp vanilla sugar or 1 tsp vanilla paste","300g plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","75g good-quality or homemade raspberry jam","50g caster sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 195C/175C fan/gas 51/2 and line two baking sheets with baking parchment.","Melt the butter in asaucepanover a low heat and cook for 10 mins, stirring regularly, until it turns golden and smells slightly nutty. Keep an eye on the colour as the butter can burn quickly. Immediately pour the butter into a large bowl, add the sugar and vanilla, and mix thoroughly. Leave to cool a little, then sieve in the flour and bicarb.","Use a large teaspoon to scoop pieces of the mixture and mould them, pushing down slightly to flatten the tops and smoothing away the excess on the sides with a finger. Slide off the spoon and arrange on the prepared baking sheet, flat side down. Repeat with the remaining mixture. Bake for 10-12 mins until light golden. Leave to cool completely.","Spread a small amount of jam on the flat side of each biscuit. Sandwich with another biscuit. Tip the sugar onto a plate, then roll each of the biscuits in it to coat."]','2026-01-10 12:22:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8660,8660,'en','Florentines','Enjoy these classic florentines at Christmas time. Jewelled with cherries and pistachios and coated in chocolate, these biscuits are the perfect festive gift','["50g salted butter","50g light muscovado sugar","50g golden syrup","50g plain flour","50g glacé cherries, chopped","75g flaked almonds","50g pistachios, chopped","2 oranges, zested","175g dark chocolate"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C/gas 4. Line two baking sheets with baking parchment.Melt the butter, sugar and golden syrup in a smallsaucepanover a low heat, stirring frequently. Remove from the heat andwhiskin the flour then add the cherries, flaked almonds, pistachios and orange zest.","Scoop 10 flat tbsp of the mixture onto the baking sheets, leaving room for them to spread. You will need to do these in batches. Bake for 10 mins until golden. Leave to cool for 2 mins until firm enough to lift onto awire rack. Cool completely. Repeat with the remaining mixture.","Melt the chocolate in a bowl over a simmering saucepan of water or in themicrowavein 30 second bursts. Turn the florentines over on the wire rack. Spoon chocolate onto the base of each florentine and gently spread to the edges. When the chocolate is firm enough to hold its shape, use a fork to draw wavy lines across the chocolate. Leave to set and then store in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:22:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8662,8662,'en','Chocolate orange fudge crinkle biscuits','Try baking these simple chocolate orange fudge crinkle biscuits with the kids. With an orange sugar coating, they’re great fun to make (and eat!)','["60g cocoa powder, sieved","230g caster sugar","60ml vegetable oil","2 large oranges, zested","2 large eggs","180g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","few drops of orange food colouring, or use red and yellow","40g icing sugar"]','["Mix the cocoa, 200g caster sugar and oil together with most of the orange zest. Whisk in the eggs one at a time, until fully combined.","Stir the flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt together in a separate bowl, then add to the cocoa mixture and mix until you form a soft dough. If the dough feels very soft, transfer it to the fridge and chill for 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and line a baking tray with baking parchment. Tip the remaining caster sugar into a small bowl. Add a drop of food colouring and stir it through the sugar until it’s all coloured – add more if you want a stronger colour. Stir in the icing sugar until all of the sugar is coloured, then stir in the remaining orange zest.","Form a heaped teaspoon of the dough into a ball, then roll in the sugar to coat, you might have to press the sugar on, particularly if you’ve chilled the dough. If the sugar is not sticking well, roll the balls of dough between your hands until the mixture warms up a little. Repeat with the remaining dough, then put, evenly spaced, on the baking tray.","Bake in the centre of the oven for 10 mins – they will crinkle as they cook. The biscuits will firm up as they cool so don’t overcook them. Transfer to a wire rack and leave to cool. Will keep for four days in a biscuit tin."]','2026-01-10 12:22:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8664,8664,'en','Chocolate fudge sprinkle-crinkle biscuits','Make a batch of these fun chocolate fudge sprinkle-crinkle biscuits. Kids will love helping out – especially decorating with sprinkles!','["60g cocoa powder, sieved","200g caster sugar","60ml vegetable oil","2 large eggs","180g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 small tub sprinkles"]','["Mix the cocoa, caster sugar and oil together. Whisk in the eggs one at a time, until fully combined.","Mix the flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt together in a separate bowl, then add to the cocoa mixture and mix until you form a soft dough. If the dough feels very soft, transfer it to the fridge and chill for 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and line a baking tray with baking parchment. Tip the sprinkles into a shallow dish. Form a heaped teaspoon of the dough into a ball, then roll in the sprinkles to coat – you might have to press the sprinkles on, particularly if you’ve chilled the dough. If they’re not sticking well, roll the balls of dough between your hands until the mixture warms up a little. Repeat with the remaining dough, then put, evenly spaced, on the baking tray.","Bake in the centre of the oven for 10 mins – they will crinkle as they cook. The biscuits will firm up as they cool so don’t overcook them. Transfer to a wire rack and leave to cool. Will keep for four days in a biscuit tin."]','2026-01-10 12:22:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8666,8666,'en','Chocolate fudge crinkle biscuits','Use storecupboard ingredients to make these moreish chocolate fudge crinkle biscuits. They make the perfect partner to a coffee as an afternoon treat','["60g cocoa powder, sieved","200g caster sugar","60ml vegetable oil","2 large eggs","180g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","70g icing sugar"]','["Mix the cocoa, caster sugar and oil together. Add the eggs one at a time, whisking until fully combined.","Stir the flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt together in a separate bowl, then add to the cocoa mixture and mix until a soft dough forms. If it feels soft, transfer to the fridge and chill for 1 hr. Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Tip the icing sugar into a shallow dish. Form a heaped teaspoon of the dough into a ball, then roll in the sugar to coat. Repeat with the remaining dough, then put, evenly spaced, on a baking tray lined with baking parchment.","Bake in the centre of the oven for 10 mins – they will firm up as they cool. Transfer to a wire rack and leave to cool. Will keep for four days in a biscuit tin."]','2026-01-10 12:22:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8668,8668,'en','Double choc peanut butter cookies','What could be better with a glass of cold milk than a warm, gooey peanut butter cookie? These choc chunk treats are topped with crunchy chopped peanuts','["100g unsalted butter, softened at room temperature","100g light brown sugar","100g caster sugar","1 egg, beaten","150g self-raising flour","2 tbsp cocoa powder","¼ tsp salt","200g milk chocolate, 150g chopped into chunks and 50g melted for drizzling","75g peanut butter (crunchy or smooth is fine)","handful of salted peanuts, roughly chopped","milk to serve, optional"]','["Heat the oven to 180c/160 fan/gas mark 4 and line two baking trays with parchment. Using a food mixer or electric whisk beat the butter and sugar together until light and fluffy. Add in the egg and whisk to combine then beat in the flour, cocoa powder, salt and chocolate chunks until fully incorporated. Using a spoon swirl the peanut butter through the cookie dough.","Scoop the dough into 12 large cookies onto the two trays using a dessert spoon, leaving plenty of room between each cookie as they''ll spread. Bake in the oven for 9-10 mins until still soft and melty in the middle. They will look underbaked but will harden once cool. Drizzle over the melted milk chocolate and top with a few chopped peanuts and a pinch of flaky sea salt. Serve with a glass of milk for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:22:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8670,8670,'en','Florentine biscuits','We''ve given the classic Florentine a chocolate covered biscuity base so they''re perfect for dunking. Enjoy yourself or give as a homemade gift','["175g slightly salted butter, softened","85g golden caster sugar","½  tsp vanilla extract","225g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","¼ tsp ground cinnamon","50g butter","50g light brown soft sugar","50g golden syrup","½  tsp salt","50g plain flour","75g glacé cherries, chopped","75g flaked almonds","150g dark chocolate, chopped"]','["To make the biscuits, put the butter, sugar and vanilla in a bowl and beat with an electric whisk until creamy. Add the flour and cinnamon, and combine with a spatula to make a soft dough. Form into a ball, wrap in cling film and chill for at least 1 hr.","In a saucepan, melt the butter, sugar, golden syrup and salt. Remove from the heat and whisk in the flour, then stir in the cherries and almonds. Set aside to cool and firm up a little. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a baking sheet with parchment.","Tip the dough onto a floured work surface and roll out to the thickness of a £1 coin. Using a 6cm fluted cookie cutter, stamp out as many circles as you can, then scrunch up the trimmings, re -roll and stamp out some more. Transfer to the baking sheet, and spoon some of the Florentine mixture onto each biscuit until it’s all used up. Bake on the middle shelf for 12-15 mins until the biscuits are golden and the topping has melted. Leave to cool on the sheet for at least 15 mins.","While the biscuits cool, melt the chocolate in a small heatproof bowl suspended over a pan of gently simmering water, or in short bursts in the microwave. Stir every 30 secs or so to ensure it doesn’t burn. Dip each biscuit about a third of the way into the chocolate, then return to the sheet to set. You may need to spoon the chocolate over the final few. Will keep for up to four days in a sealed container."]','2026-01-10 12:22:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8672,8672,'en','Viennese whirls','These elegant, buttery biscuits might look extra impressive but they''re surprisingly easy to make. Dip in chocolate for an extra sweet treat','["200g slightly salted butter, softened","50g icing sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","200g plain flour","2 tsp cornflour","½  tsp baking powder","100g butter, softened","170g icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","50g raspberry jam or strawberry jam"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line 2 baking sheets with baking parchment. Put the butter and icing sugar in a large bowl and beat with an electric hand whisk for about 5 mins until pale and fluffy. Add the vanilla extract and beat again until fully incorporated.","Sift in the flour, cornflour and baking powder, and fold into the mixture using a spatula until combined (the dough should have a tacky consistency). Spoon the dough into a piping bag fitted with a large star-shaped nozzle. If all the mixture doesn’t fit, do it in 2 batches.","Pipe swirly circles 5cm diameter onto 2 baking sheets making sure there are 3cm spaces between each swirl.","Bake for 10-12 mins, swapping the trays over halfway through the cooking time so the biscuits are evenly baked, until pale golden and cooked through. Leave to cool on the baking sheets for a few mins, then transfer to wire racks.","While the biscuits cool, make the filling. Put the softened butter in a large mixing bowl and add the icing sugar. Stir together initially with a wooden spoon then switch to electric beaters or a whisk to get the buttercream fluffy and smooth. Add the vanilla extract and beat once more to combine. Transfer the buttercream to a piping bag and snip off the end.","Turn the biscuits over so their flat side is facing up then pipe buttercream over half of the biscuits and spread a little jam on the rest. Sandwich a jam covered biscuit together with a buttercream one and repeat until all the biscuits are used up."]','2026-01-10 12:22:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8674,8674,'en','Oaty hazelnut cookies','Soft and slightly chewy, these oaty cookies contain apple and maple syrup instead of sugar. They''re packed with hazelnuts which are a good source of vitamins and minerals','["50g butter, plus a little for greasing","2 tbsp maple syrup","1 dessert apple, unpeeled and coarsely grated (you need 85g)","1 tsp cinnamon","50g raisins","50g porridge oats","50g spelt flour","40g unblanched hazelnuts, cut into chunky slices","1 egg"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and lightly grease a non-stick baking tray (or line a normal baking tray with baking parchment). Tip the butter and syrup into a small non-stick pan and melt together, then add the apple and cook, stirring, over a medium heat until it softens, about 6-7 mins. Stir in the cinnamon and raisins.","Mix the oats, spelt flour, and hazelnuts in a bowl, pour in the apple mixture, then add the egg and beat everything together really well.","Spoon onto the baking tray, well spaced apart to make 9 mounds, then gently press into discs. Bake for 18-20 mins until golden, then cool on a wire rack. Will keep for 3 days in an airtight container or 6 weeks in the freezer."]','2026-01-10 12:22:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8676,8676,'en','White rabbit biscuits','These adorable bunny biscuits will hop off the plate faster than you can bake them. They make a great Easter activity for kids or an extra special gift','["200g unsalted butter, at room temperature","400g plain flour","280g caster sugar","1 egg","¼ tsp vanilla extract","a pinch of salt","½  tsp cream of tartar","600g icing sugar","170g pack of desiccated coconut","pink food colouring gel","15 mini marshmallows","1 x rabbit head-shaped cookie cutter","1 x 7cm round cookie cutter","1 x 3cm round cookie cutter"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly rub the butter and flour together with your fingertips until the mixture looks like fresh breadcrumbs.","Mix the sugar and egg together in another in a bowl with a whisk and when it is really well combined and runny add it to the flour mixture.","Add all the other ingredients and squish it together with your hands, keep working the dough until it’s smooth, soft and comes together in one piece.","Roll the dough out on a lightly floured surface with a rolling pin until it is about half a centimetre thick. Cut into shapes. We did 15 rabbit heads, 15 large circles and 30 mini circles.","Place your biscuits on baking sheets lined with baking paper and bake in batches for about 15 mins (or until they are lightly golden at the edges).","Let them cool in the tin for a few minutes before carefully transferring them to a wire rack to cool completely and become crisp.","While the biscuits cool mix enough cold water with the icing sugar to create a thick icing. Place a quarter of the icing in another bowl and add a very small amout of pink gel food colouring. Transfer both the white icing and the pink icing into disposable piping bags and snip off the end to make a very small nozzle on the pink icing and a wider one on the white icing.","Pipe white icing over the small round biscuits and leave to dry. Then pipe white icing to cover all of the large circular biscuits and the rabbit biscuits (be fairly sparing and spread it out with the back of a spoon – it doesn’t have to be neat on these ones). Once you’ve iced each one sprinkle generously with dessicated coconut before the icing dries.","Take the pink icing and use to create paws on the smaller circles then stick 2 of them onto each of the large circles using icing like glue. With the icing you have left, coat the marshmallows and cover those in coconut too before sticking them onto the middle of the larger circles to create a fluffy tail. Leave to set completely for about 15-20 mins then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8677,8677,'en','Raspberry Coffee Time muffin','The perfect coffee break treat','["2 tbsp finely ground coffee","100g butter","50g pine nuts","1 tbsp milk","400g self-raising flour","175g golden caster sugar","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 large eggs","284ml carton buttermilk or soured cream","225g fresh raspberries"]','["Stir 2 tbsp boiling water into the coffee. Set aside for a few mins. Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Cut out 12 x 10cm squares of baking parchment. Melt the butter, use a little to brush the insides of a deep 12-hole muffin tin, and leave the rest to cool slightly. Line the tin with the paper squares, so they stick up a bit. (Or use paper cases.) Toast half the pine nuts. Strain and mix the coffee with the milk.","Mix the flour, toasted pine nuts, sugar and bicarbonate of soda in a large bowl. In another bowl, beat the eggs, then mix in the buttermilk, cooled butter and coffee. Stir this into the flour mixture until almost combined – it will need only a few stirs and the mix will feel light and airy. Tip in the raspberries, give a few more stirs to finish the mixing, but don’t overbeat or the mix will toughen. Spoon the mix into the muffin tins – they will be very full.","Scatter the rest of the pine nuts on top, and bake for about 25 mins until risen and golden. Let them cool in the tin a few minutes, then move to a cooling rack. Eat within 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8678,8678,'en','Sugared flower shortbreads','These delicate shortbreads make a perfect gift. Given a floral hint with rosewater, you could also use orange blossom extract or dried lavender','["250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","140g cold, slightly salted butter, cut into small cubes","85g white caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","½  tsp rosewater (optional)","assortment of 15-20 edible flowers, unsprayed, (we used pansies, violas, primroses and rose petals - see tip)","50g caster sugar","1 egg white, beaten","300g royal icing sugar food colouring pastes (we used yellow, purple and pink)","edible shimmer dust (optional)","tweezers","1 small paintbrush","8cm biscuit cutter","1 disposable piping bag","1 fine writing piping nozzle","tissue paper and a pretty box, to wrap the biscuits in","First, check that any flowers you’ve picked from your garden are edible (visitrhs.org.ukif you’re unsure.) If you''re buying the flowers, check that they''re unsprayed (organic) and free from chemicals.To buy ready-crystallised flowers, tryeatmyflowers.co.uk."]','["Remove the stalks and any leaves from small flowers like violas or pansies, and carefully pull apart the roses to separate the petals. Place a sheet of baking parchment on your work surface. Sprinkle the caster sugar over a saucer, then lightly whisk the egg white in a small bowl. Holding a flower or petal with tweezers, use a small paintbrush to paint both sides with egg white. Spoon the sugar over, then shake off the excess and place on the parchment. Repeat with the remaining petals or flowers. Leave to dry for 3 hrs, or overnight if you can. Will keep in an airtight container for up to 1 month, but their colour may start to fade after a few weeks.","Tip the flour into a large bowl and add the butter. Use your fingertips to rub the butter into the flour until you have a damp, crumby texture. Pour in the sugar and gently mix in with your fingertips. Whisk the vanilla, rosewater and egg yolks together in a small bowl with a fork, then drizzle the mixture over the buttery flour. Mix again, squashing the crumbs together to form a dough. If the mixture is a little crumbly, drizzle over 1-2 tsp cold water, then mix again. Tip onto your work surface and knead very briefly until the dough looks even, with no streaks of egg. Wrap in cling film, pat into a round disc and chill for 30 mins.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line two large baking trays with baking parchment. Remove the dough from the fridge – if it’s very firm, leave it at room temperature for 15 mins to soften. Lightly dust the work surface with flour, unwrap the dough and roll it to the thickness of a £1 coin. Stamp out 8cm disks with the fluted side of a biscuit cutter and transfer them to the baking trays. Bake for 10-12 mins, swapping the trays over halfway through cooking. Once lightly golden and firm, remove the biscuits from the oven. Leave to cool on the trays for 10 mins or until stable enough to transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","Mix the icing sugar with enough water to make a thick icing. Divide the icing between as many bowls as the number of colours you’d like to use, and dye each one a pastel shade with a drop of food colouring. Transfer half of one of the icings to a disposable piping bag fitted with a fine writing nozzle. Pipe a ring around the outside of the biscuit and set aside to dry. Continue until you’ve iced a third of the biscuits (if you’re using three colours), then move on to the next colour, transferring any leftover icing back to its original bowl. Leave the biscuits to dry for 10-15 mins.","Add 2-3 tsp water to each icing to make it a little runnier. Spoon the icing onto the biscuits, matching the colour to the rings. Encourage the icing to flood the surface by easing it to the edges with your spoon – don’t be too generous with the icing as it may overspill when you add the flowers and petals. You can now dust the surface of each biscuit with a little shimmer dust, if you like, then top with the flowers. Leave the biscuits to set for at least 1 hr before wrapping in tissue paper in a pretty box. Will keep for up to 1 week."]','2026-01-10 12:22:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8679,8679,'en','Christmas muffin mix','A festive treat to give or receive','["300g self-raising flour","2 tsp baking powder","2 tsp ground cinnamon","2 tsp ground mixed spice","100g pecans or walnuts","140g tropical dried fruits medley","100g light muscovado sugar"]','["Layer all the ingredients in a 1 litre glass or plastic preserving jar in the order the ingredients are listed.","Write the following method on a gift label: ‘Tip the contents of the jar into a large mixing bowl. Make a well in the centre and add 2 beaten eggs, 300ml/½pt milk and 100g/4oz melted butter. Mix quickly and lightly to a soft batter. Divide between 12 muffin cases. Bake at 190C/fan 170C/gas 5 for 18-20 mins. Use within 4 weeks.’ Attach the label and a wooden spoon to the top of the jar with some raffia or coloured ribbon."]','2026-01-10 12:22:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8680,8680,'en','Fortune cookies','Fill homemade fortune cookies with personalised messages for a customised treat – ideal for any occasion, such as Chinese New Year, Christmas, Valentine''s Day, birthdays and weddings','["2 egg whites","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tsp almond extract","3 tbsp sunflower oil","100g plain flour","2 tsp cornflour","100g caster sugar","1½  tbsp black sesame seeds"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/160 fan/gas 4 and line a large baking sheet with baking parchment, or use a silicone baking sheet. Write or print fortunes on paper measuring 6cm long by 1cm wide.","Put the egg whites, vanilla, almond extract, oil and 2 tsp cold water into a bowl and whisk with an electric hand whisk until frothy, 20-30 secs. Measure the flour, cornflour, sugar and a good pinch of salt into a bowl, then sift into the egg white mixture. Whisk everything together until you have a smooth batter-like consistency. Chill the mixture for 1 hr.","Next, put a tbsp of mixture onto the prepared baking sheet. Oil a metal spoon, then use the back of it to swirl the mixture out into a 8-10cm circle. Repeat with another tablespoon of the mixture, to create 2 cookies. Make sure there is space between each cookie as they will spread in the oven. It is best to only bake 2-3 cookies at a time, as you will need to shape them whilst they are hot. Sprinkle 1 of the cookies with black sesame seeds, then bake for 10-12 mins until the edges of the cookies turn golden.","One at a time remove the cookies with a palette knife once they are out the oven. You want them to still be soft so you can shape them so work quickly. Turn the cookie over so that the sesame seeds are face down and put the fortune in the middle of the circle. Fold the circle in half to secure the fortune and pinch the 2 edges together to seal. Pop the cookie on the rim of a mug or cup and very gently pull the 2 corners down to get the fortune cookie shape. Hold for 10 secs, then transfer the cookies to muffin tins so that they hold their shape whilst cooling completely. Repeat with the remaining cookie mixture."]','2026-01-10 12:22:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8682,8682,'en','Coconut Nice','Upgrade the classic Nice biscuit with a coconut cream icing and desiccated coconut topping – they’re vegan, too','["1 tbsp linseeds","400g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","200g coconut oil","50g desiccated coconut","280g golden caster sugar","4 tbsp coconut cream","200-225g icing sugar","50g desiccated coconut"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the linseeds in a small bowl and add 3 tbsp water. Leave to soak for 5-10 mins. Meanwhile, rub the flour and coconut oil together in a large mixing bowl until the coconut oil is well distributed and the mixture looks like fresh breadcrumbs. Stir in the desiccated coconut and set aside.","Tip the linseeds, together with their soaking water, into the bowl of a mini food processor and blitz until frothy. Add the sugar and blitz again until well mixed. Pour the linseed and sugar mixture into the flour and coconut oil and knead together to form a ball of dough. If the dough feels like it’s too dry and may crack when rolling out, add a little water, 1 tsp at a time.","Transfer the dough to a floured surface and roll it out to about the thickness of a £1 coin. Cut into 7cm x 4cm rectangles and place on a large baking sheet lined with baking parchment – make sure you leave 2-3cm between each biscuit. Bake in batches for 10-12 mins or until just starting to turn golden at the edges. Transfer to a wire rack using a palette knife or fish slice and leave to cool completely before decorating.","To decorate, mix together the coconut cream and enough icing sugar to make a thick paste. Transfer to a piping bag and pipe a thin line all around the outside edge of a biscuit, then dip the icing into the desiccated coconut. Repeat with all of the biscuits. Pipe the word ‘NICE’ onto the middle of each biscuit, then leave to set."]','2026-01-10 12:22:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8684,8684,'en','Lemon sherbet jammy dodgers','Everyone’s favourite jam biscuit gets a zesty makeover – sandwich with lemon curd and sprinkle with sherbet for extra zing','["175g cold slightly salted butter, cubed","250g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","100g icing sugar","zest 1 lemon, plus 1-2 tsp juice","1 large egg yolk","23g pack sherbet (I used Dip Dab)","75g slightly salted butter, at room temperature","250g icing sugar","100g lemon curd"]','["In a food processor, whizz the butter, flour and a pinch of salt until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs. Add the sugar and lemon zest and whizz again. Add the lemon juice and egg yolk and blend until clumps of dough form around the blades. Keep blending, using the pulse button, until larger balls of dough have formed. Tip out the mixture onto a work surface and knead briefly to bring it together in a smooth ball – don’t overwork it or it will be tough. Cut the dough into 2 equal pieces and pat into flat discs, then wrap in cling film and chill for at least 30 mins. Line 2 baking sheets with baking parchment.","Remove the dough from the fridge 15 mins before you’re ready to roll it. Lightly flour your work surface and rolling pin. Unwrap 1 piece of dough and roll it out to the thickness of\r\na 50p piece. Use a 6cm cutter to stamp out discs (you should get about 15) and transfer to a baking sheet using a palette knife.","Unwrap and roll out the remaining dough to the same thickness. Stamp out 15 discs and transfer to the second baking sheet. Use a small round cutter (about 1cm) or the end of a piping nozzle to stamp holes from the middle of 15 of the biscuits. Loosely cover the trays with cling film and chill for 15 mins. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Bake the biscuits for 15 mins, swapping the trays over halfway through. Remove from the oven, leave to cool for 5 mins, then transfer to a wire rack and leave to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Place the butter, sugar and half the lemon curd in a bowl. Mash together, then blend with an electric hand whisk. Transfer to a piping bag and snip off the end, making a 1cm opening. Place the remaining lemon curd in another piping bag and snip off the end to make a slightly smaller hole. Dust a little sherbet over the biscuits with a hole in the centre.","Pipe blobs of lemon filling in a ring shape onto each whole biscuit, leaving space in the centre to fill with lemon curd. Fill the middles, then sandwich a sherbet-dusted biscuit on top of each one. Store in a biscuit tin for 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8686,8686,'en','Anzac biscuits','These iconic biscuits were originally made to send to the ANZACs (Australian and New Zealand Army Corps) serving in Gallipoli','["85g porridge oats","85g desiccated coconut","100g plain flour","100g caster sugar","100g butter, plus extra butter for greasing","1 tbsp golden syrup","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Put the oats, coconut, flour and sugar in a bowl. Melt the butter in a small\r\npan and stir in the golden syrup. Add the bicarbonate of soda to 2 tbsp boiling water, then stir into the\r\ngolden syrup and butter mixture.","Make a well in the middle of the dry ingredients and pour in the butter and golden syrup mixture. Stir gently\r\nto incorporate the dry ingredients.","Put dessertspoonfuls of the mixture on to buttered baking sheets, about 2.5cm/1in apart to allow room for spreading. Bake in batches for 8-10 mins until golden. Transfer to a wire rack to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:22:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8688,8688,'en','Pistachio & cranberry cookies','These crunchy, fruit & nut biscuits are sure to be a family favourite – make ahead and freeze, or wrap up for the perfect homemade gift','["175g butter, softened","85g golden caster sugar","½  tsp vanilla extract","225g plain flour","75g pistachios","75g dried cranberries"]','["Mix the butter, sugar and vanilla extract with a wooden spoon. stir in the flour, then tip in the pistachios and cranberries – you might need to get your hands in at this stage to bring the mix together as a dough. Halve the dough and shape each half into a log about 5cm across. Wrap in cling film, then chill for 1 hr or freeze for up to 3 months.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. slice the logs into 1cm-thick rounds, place on a baking tray lined with baking parchment and bake for 12-15 mins. Cool completely on the tray."]','2026-01-10 12:22:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8690,8690,'en','Orange, oat & sultana cookies','Cookies don’t have to be a guilty pleasure – these tasty treats from Leiths School of Food and Wine are superhealthy','["100g butter at room temperature","1 egg","50g mashed ripe banana","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g light soft brown sugar","½  tsp grated orange zest","100g wholemeal flour","¼ tsp salt","1 tsp baking powder","100g rolled oats","25g desiccated coconut","50g chopped walnuts","75g sultanas or dark chocolate chips"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nCream the butter and sugar together\r\nuntil well blended and smooth.\r\nGradually beat in the banana, vanilla\r\nextract and egg. Add the\r\nzest. Mix well with a wooden spoon\r\nuntil thoroughly blended.","In a large bowl, mix the flour, salt,\r\nbaking powder, oats, coconut,\r\nwalnuts and sultanas or chocolate\r\nchips. Stir the dry ingredients into\r\nthe wet and mix thoroughly until a\r\nthick dough is formed. Line a baking\r\nsheet with parchment. Drop heaped\r\ntbsps onto the sheet, leaving a 5cm\r\n(2in) space around each one, and\r\npress down lightly. Bake for 15-20\r\nmins until lightly browned. Cool."]','2026-01-10 12:22:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8692,8692,'en','Birthday biscuits','These ring biscuits are perfect for parties and work well in any shape, get the kids to help','["250g plain white flour","85g golden caster sugar","175g unsalted butter, at room temperature, cubed","2 tbsp lemon curd","250g white icing sugar","1 tbsp strawberry conserve (we used St Dalfour)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.  \r\nPut the flour, sugar and butter into a food \r\nprocessor. Whizz until the mixture forms \r\ncrumbs, then pulse a little more until  \r\nit forms a ball.","Spread a large sheet of baking parchment \r\nover the work surface and turn the dough \r\nonto it. Dust with a little flour, then roll out to \r\nabout the thickness of two £1 coins. Stamp \r\nout 24 rounds using a 5cm round fluted \r\ncutter, then cut out the middles with the end \r\nof a piping nozzle. Carefully peel the rest of \r\nthe mixture away from the stamped shapes. \r\nLift onto baking sheets and bake for 10 mins \r\nuntil pale golden. Cool on a wire rack.","Put the lemon curd into a bowl with 2 tbsp \r\nboiling water and mix until smooth. Sieve in \r\n175g of the icing sugar; stir together to make \r\na smooth icing. Put the strawberry fruit spread \r\nin another bowl and add 2 tsp boiling water, \r\nmix, then sieve in the remaining icing sugar.","Spoon the lemon icing over the biscuits, \r\nthen drizzle or pipe over the pinky icing. Leave \r\nto set for at least 20 mins. Will keep for up to \r\n2 days in an airtight tin, longer if left un-iced."]','2026-01-10 12:22:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8694,8694,'en','Bumper oat cookies','Oaty, chewy, spicy cookies – ready in under an hour and great for tea time','["175g butter","175g demerara sugar","100g golden syrup","85g plain flour","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","250g porridge oats","1 tsp ground cinnamon","100g each of ready-to-eat dried apricots, chopped and stem ginger, chopped","75-80g pack dried sour cherries","2 tbsp boiling water","1 medium egg, beaten"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/fan160C/gas 4. Line several baking sheets with baking parchment or non-stick sheets. Warm the butter, sugar and golden syrup in a large saucepan over a medium heat until the butter has melted. Stir in the flour, bicarbonate of soda, oats, cinnamon, dried fruits and ginger, then the water and finally the egg. Leave to cool until easy to handle.","With dampened hands, shape the mixture into 18 large balls, then flatten them onto the baking sheets – allowing plenty of space for spreading – and bake for 15-20 mins until golden. (This will give a soft, chewy cookie. For a crisper one, reduce the heat to 160C/fan140C/gas 3 and bake for a further 5-10 mins.)","Allow the cookies to cool on the trays briefly, then lift onto to a cooling rack. Will keep in an airtight container, separated with baking parchment, for up to 1 week."]','2026-01-10 12:22:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8698,8698,'en','Hanukkah biscuits','Good Food reader Danielle Brown shares her grandmother’s recipe for savoury Kaak biscuits, traditionally eaten during the Jewish holiday of Hanukkah','["450g strong white flour","1 tsp caraway seed","7g sachet fast-action yeast","100g oil-based margarine, melted","1 egg, beaten"]','["Place the flour, ½ tsp salt, caraway seeds and yeast in a large bowl. Make a well in the centre and pour in the melted margarine and 200ml warm water. Mix to combine all of the ingredients, adding more water or flour if needed, then knead for 2 mins to form a soft dough. Place in an oiled bowl, cover with cling film and leave in a warm place to rise for 1 hr.","Once doubled in size, knead the dough for 1 min, then divide the mixture into 12 balls. Cut each ball in half and roll each piece into a thin sausage shape. Twist the 2 pieces together, then join the ends to\r\nform a circle. Place on a lightly greased baking tray, cover with a tea towel and leave to rise again for 30 mins.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 5. Brush the biscuits with a little beaten egg and bake for 10-15 mins until golden. Remove to cool on a wire rack, then turn the oven down to 110C/90C fan/gas 1?4. Once cool, return the biscuits to the oven and bake for a further 10 mins, then turn off the heat completely, leaving the biscuits in the oven to dry out for 2 hrs."]','2026-01-10 12:22:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8700,8700,'en','Fruity biscotti','The perfect make-ahead gift, these will keep for up to a month after baking and look really impressive','["350g plain flour, plus extra for rolling","2 tsp baking powder","2 tsp mixed spice","250g golden caster sugar","3 eggs, beaten","coarsely grated zest 1 orange","85g raisins","85g dried cherries","50g blanched almonds","50g shelled pistachios"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Line\r\n2 baking sheets with baking paper. Put the\r\nflour, baking powder, spice and sugar in a large\r\nbowl, then mix well. Stir in the eggs and zest\r\nuntil the mixture starts forming clumps, then\r\nbring the dough together with your hands – it\r\nwill seem dry at first but keep kneading until no\r\nfloury patches remain. Add the fruit and nuts,\r\nthen work them in until evenly distributed.","Turn the dough out onto a lightly floured\r\nsurface and divide into 4 pieces. With lightly\r\nfloured hands, roll each piece into a sausage\r\nabout 30cm long. Place 2 on each tray, well\r\nspaced apart. Bake for 25-30 mins until the\r\ndough has risen and spread and feels firm.\r\nIt should still look pale. Remove from the\r\noven, transfer to a wire rack for a few mins\r\nuntil cool enough to handle, then turn down\r\nthe oven to 140C/fan 120C/gas 1.","Using a bread knife, cut into slices about 1cm\r\nthick on the diagonal, then lay the slices flat on\r\nthe baking sheets. The biscuits can be cooled\r\nand frozen flat on the sheet at this point, then\r\nbagged and frozen for up to 2 months. Bake\r\nfor another 15 mins (20 mins if from frozen),\r\nturn over, then bake again for another 15 mins\r\nuntil dry and golden. Tip onto a wire rack to\r\ncool completely, then store in an airtight tin\r\nfor up to one month, or pack into boxes or\r\ncellophane bags if giving as gifts straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:22:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8702,8702,'en','All-American chocolate chunk cookies','Irresistible All-American chocolate chunk cookies','["300g plain chocolate (about 55% cocoa solids)","100g bar milk chocolate","100g light muscovado sugar","85g butter, at room temperature","100g peanut butter, crunchy is best","1 medium egg","½ tsp vanilla extract","100g self-raising flour","100g large salted roasted peanuts"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/gas 4/fan 160C.Gather together and weigh all the ingredients.","Chop 200g/7oz of the plain chocolate into rough, irregular chunks. Chop the milk chocolate in the same way, but keep separate.","Break the remaining plain chocolate into a large heatproof mixing bowl. Melt in the microwave on medium for about 11?2 minutes (or over a pan of simmering water).","Stir the chocolate until melted, then tip in the sugar, butter, peanut butter, egg and vanilla and beat with a wooden spoon until well mixed. Stir in the flour, all the milk chocolate chunks, the nuts (no need to chop) and half the plain chocolate chunks. The mixture will feel quite soft, and drop easily from the spoon if you shake it.","Drop big spoonfuls in 12 piles on to 2 or 3 baking sheets, leaving room for them to spread (you may need to bake in batches). Stick the remaining chunks into the cookies (2-3 pieces in each).","Bake for 10-12 minutes until they are tinged very slightly darker around the edges. The smell will let you know they are ready. They will be soft in the middle, but will crisp up as they cool. (Cook for longer and you’ll have crisper cookies.) Let them cool and firm up for a few minutes on the baking sheet (they’ll break if you move them while still hot), then lift off with a wide spatula on to a cooling rack. They will keep crisp in an airtight tin for 3-4 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8704,8704,'en','Coconut & chocolate macaroons','A delicious macaroon with the tropical taste of fresh coconut','["1 egg white","200g caster sugar","4 tbsp plain flour","200g coarsely grated fresh coconut (about 1 coconut in total)","150g bar dark chocolate, chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. In a clean bowl, whisk the egg whites until stiff then gradually add the sugar, whisking continuously until thick and glossy. Sift in the flour, then fold into the egg whites with the coconut until completely combined.","Using an 8cm pastry cutter, squash spoonfuls of the mixture onto a baking tray lined with non-stick baking paper or silicone plastic sheets – you may need to do this in two batches.  Bake for 15-18 mins until golden around the edges and just starting to brown on top. Leave to cool, then transfer to a rack.","While the macaroons are cooling, melt the chocolate in a microwave or over a pan of hot water and leave to cool slightly. Cover the smooth side with chocolate and leave to set in the fridge. The macaroons will keep in an airtight container for 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8706,8706,'en','Toffee apple cookies','These are truly delicious – crunchy round the edges, chewy in the centre','["175g unsalted butter, at room temperature","140g golden caster sugar","2 egg yolks","50g ground almonds","85g chewy toffees, roughly chopped","85g/3oz ready-to-eat dried apple chunks, roughly chopped","225g self-raising flour","2 tbsp milk"]','["Preheat the oven to fan 170C/conventional 190C/gas 5. Using\r\nan electric whisk, beat together\r\nthe butter and sugar until pale\r\nand creamy.","Stir in the egg yolks, ground\r\nalmonds, toffees, dried apple and\r\nflour. Mix well together then roll into\r\nwalnut-sized balls.","Place well apart on two non-stick\r\nor lined baking sheets and flatten\r\nslightly with your hand. Brush with\r\nmilk and bake for 8-12 minutes until\r\ngolden. Leave to firm up for 5\r\nminutes, then transfer to a wire rack\r\nand leave to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:22:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8708,8708,'en','Blueberry & pecan oaties','Make double the quantity of this fruity cookie dough and freeze, so delicious home-baked biscuits are always close at hand','["175g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","½ tsp baking powder","85g porridge oats","175g golden caster sugar","1 tsp ground cinnamon","140g butter, chopped","70g pack dried blueberries (or use raisins or dried cranberries)","50g pecans, roughly broken","1 egg, beaten"]','["Tip the flour, baking powder, oats,\r\nsugar and cinnamon into a bowl, then mix\r\nwell with your hands. Add the butter, then\r\nrub it into the mixture until it has disappeared.","Stir in the blueberries and pecans,\r\nadd the egg, then mix well with a cutlery\r\nknife or wooden spoon until it all comes\r\ntogether in a big ball. Lightly flour the work\r\nsurface, then roll the dough into a fat sausage\r\nabout 6cm across. Wrap in cling film, then\r\nchill in the fridge until solid.","To bake, heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/\r\ngas 4. Unwrap the cookie log, thickly slice\r\ninto discs, then arrange on baking sheets.\r\nBake for 15 mins (or a few mins more if\r\nfrom frozen) until golden, leave on the trays\r\nto harden, then cool completely on a wire\r\nrack before tucking in."]','2026-01-10 12:22:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8710,8710,'en','Almond & lemon curd buttons','Hidden inside these crumbly biscuits lies aheart of lemon curd, giving an unexpectedburst of flavour','["250g butter, softened","140g golden caster sugar, plus extra","1 egg","1 tsp vanilla extract","zest 2 lemons","300g plain flour","100g ground almonds","a little milk, to seal","about 3 tbsp lemon curd","flaked almonds, for the top"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5.\r\nBeat the butter, sugar, egg, vanilla, zest\r\nand a pinch of salt in a large bowl until\r\nsmooth, then fold in the flour and ground\r\nalmonds. Shape into 2 rounds, flatten\r\nthem, then wrap in cling film and chill\r\nuntil firm, about 30 mins.","Roll out 1 piece of dough on a floured\r\nsurface to about £1 thickness, then\r\nstamp out rounds with a 7cm cutter.\r\nBrush all over with milk, then spoon\r\n20p-size blobs of lemon curd into the\r\nmiddle of half of the rounds.","Carefully lay the remaining rounds\r\non top of the lemon curd, then gently\r\npress around the edges with your fingers\r\nto seal. Scatter with a little caster sugar\r\nand the flaked almonds. Bake for 15 mins\r\nuntil light golden. Repeat with remaining\r\npastry, then squish any offcuts together\r\nand re-roll. You can freeze the biscuits\r\nbefore baking, but add up to 5 mins more\r\nto the cooking time."]','2026-01-10 12:22:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8712,8712,'en','Gooey chocolate cherry cookies','If you like American-style cookies, you’ll lovethese pale, chewy delights. Plus, they can be baked from frozen','["200g unsalted butter, at room temperature","85g light muscovado sugar","85g golden caster sugar","1 egg","225g self-raising flour","50g plain chocolate, 50-70% cocoa, roughly chopped","50g white chocolate, roughly chopped","85g natural colour glacé cherries, roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5.\r\nBeat the butter, sugars and egg until\r\nsmooth, then mix in the flour, chocolates\r\nand cherry pieces and ½ tsp salt. Spoon\r\nonto non-stick baking sheets in large\r\nrough blobs – you’ll get 20 out of this\r\nmix. Make sure they are well spaced as\r\nthe cookies grow substantially as they\r\nbake. The raw dough can be frozen.","Bake for 12-14 mins until just golden,\r\nbut still quite pale and soft in the middle.\r\nIf baking from frozen, give them a few\r\nmins more. Cool on the sheets for 5 mins,\r\nthen lift onto racks with a fish slice and\r\nleave to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:22:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8714,8714,'en','Hot honey pumpkin bread','Combine soft pumpkin, hot honey and a hint of spice to make this moist, flavourful loaf. It’s a comforting autumn bake that’s ideal for afternoon tea','["175g butter , softened","140g hot honey , or clear honey mixed with a pinch of chilli flakes, plus extra to serve","100g light brown soft sugar","1 egg , beaten","250g pumpkin , peeled and coarsely grated","350g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","2 tsp ground cinnamon","butter or crème fraîche, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 1.5kg loaf tin with baking parchment.","Mix the butter with the hot honey, sugar and egg in a large bowl. Stir in the grated pumpkin, then mix in the flour, baking powder and cinnamon.","Tip the mixture into the prepared loaf tin and level the top. Bake for 45-50 mins until risen and golden brown. Drizzle the top with 1 tsp hot honey. Leave in the tin to cool for 10 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack.","Serve thickly sliced while still warm with butter or crème fraîche and more hot honey, or leave to cool completely and toast the slices to serve in the same way. Will keep for several days in a cool place. You can slice when cool and freeze, then defrost when needed."]','2026-01-10 12:22:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8716,8716,'en','Tomato, burrata & prosciutto loaded focaccia','Enjoy these loaded foccacia with a leafy salad on the side for a satisfying lunch. You can use fresh, shop-bought pesto if you don’t have time to make your own','["400g strong white bread flour","5g sachet dried fast-action yeast","50ml olive oil , plus extra for the baking tray and for drizzling","1 tbsp semolina or polenta","600g mixed tomatoes , a variety of colours and sizes works well, larger ones halved or quartered","4 whole garlic cloves , unpeeled","2 x 250g balls burrata","6 slices prosciutto","small bunch of basil , plus a few leaves to serve","25g toasted pine nuts","25g parmesan","1 lemon , zested, plus a squeeze of juice","1 garlic clove","75ml extra virgin olive oil , plus extra for drizzling"]','["Make the dough the day before you want to bake the focaccia. Mix the flour, yeast, 1 tsp salt and 275ml warm water in a large bowl, or the bowl of a stand mixer with a dough hook attached. The dough should be quite wet and sticky. Work it for a few minutes, stretching and folding it in the bowl by hand, or letting the dough hook do the work. With wet hands, tuck the dough into a rough ball, then cover the bowl, put in the fridge and leave overnight.","To make the pesto, blitz all the ingredients together with a good pinch of salt and twist of black pepper. Transfer to a bowl and chill until needed. Will keep chilled for up to a week or frozen for two months.","Remove the dough from the fridge and leave at room temperature for 1-2 hrs, until it has doubled in size and the outside of the bowl has lost its chill. Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.","Oil a 22cm x 32cm baking tray and dust with semolina. Gently tip the dough out of the bowl onto the tray and, working with oiled hands, stretch it to fit the tray. Leave in a warm place to prove for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, put the tomatoes and garlic cloves in a roasting tin. Season well and drizzle with a little oil. Roast for 20 mins, then cool for 10 mins.","Spoon the warm tomatoes over the focaccia dough, drizzling with any of the oily juices in the bowl. Pop the garlic cloves out of their skins and squeeze them between your fingers into smaller pieces, dot the soft garlic over the tomatoes. Scatter with flaky salt and bake in the top of the hot oven for 30 mins.","When the focaccia is cooked, leave to cool for at least 15-45 mins (or cool and reheat to warm before serving). Cut the focaccia into 8 chunky rectangles then tear each burrata into quarters and place a piece on each chunk. Arrange ribbons of prosciutto on top, then spoon over the fresh pesto, scatter with basil leaves and drizzle with a little extra virgin olive oil."]','2026-01-10 12:22:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8718,8718,'en','Cheddar & harissa garlic bread','Take your garlic bread to the next level with this pull-apart loaf packed with melted cheese and gently spiced with harissa.','["500g Morrisons Market Street round crusty loaf of white bread (a sourdough boule works well)","100g salted butter , softened","2-3 tbsp harissa (depending on how spicy you like it)","3 large garlic cloves , grated","75g mature cheddar , coarsely grated","75g grated mozzarella"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Cut into the Morrisons bread loaf at 2cm diagonal intervals using a serrated knife, going almost all the way though, then repeat in the opposite direction so you create a diamond pattern. Put the loaf on a baking tray lined with baking parchment.","Put the butter, harissa and garlic in a small bowl and beat together using a spatula or wooden spoon. Season with a little salt and pepper.","Spread the butter into the cuts of the bread loaf, then sprinkle both of the cheeses into the cuts and over the top of the loaf, making sure every gap is filled with butter and cheese. Wrap well in foil.","Bake for 20 mins, then remove the foil from the top and return to the oven for 10 mins more until melted, golden and gooey. Serve whole so everyone can tear and share."]','2026-01-10 12:22:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8720,8720,'en','Milk buns','Use the ‘tangzhong’ method (making a roux-like paste to add to the dough) to give the bread in these milk buns an excellent rise and soft, fluffy texture','["125ml milk, preferably whole milk, plus extra for glazing","7g fast-action dried yeast","350g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","50g caster sugar","1 egg","50g unsalted butter, softened and cut into cubes","neutral-tasting oil, such as sunflower, for proving","20g strong white bread flour","60ml milk, preferably whole"]','["Line a high-sided 20 x 30cm baking tin with baking parchment. To make the tangzhong, put the flour, milk and 30ml water in a small saucepan.Whiskover a medium heat until it becomes a thick paste, then set aside until it is at room temperature.","Pour the milk into a saucepan and set over a low heat until just warm. Alternatively, warm in the microwave in 10-second blasts, but be careful not to boil it. Stir in the yeast to fully combine. Mix the flour, sugar and 1 tsp fine sea salt in the bowl of astand mixerwith a dough hook attachment. With the mixer running, add the egg, tangzhong and milk mixture. Knead for 2 mins, then add the butter, bit by bit. Continue to knead for a further 7-8 mins until soft, elastic and slightly sticky. Form into a ball and put into a lightly oiled clean bowl. Cover and set aside to rise for around 2 hrs until doubled in size.Will keep chilled overnight. Bring up to room temperature, then leave to rise until doubled before continuing.","Lightly dust a clean work surface with flour and knock back the dough for 10 seconds. Divide into eight pieces (around 85g each), and form into small balls. Put the balls in the prepared tin and cover. Set aside to rise for 1 hr or until doubled in size.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Generously brush some milk over the buns to glaze and bake for 20-25 mins until golden and risen. Leave to cool in the tin for 15-20 mins before transferring to awire rackto cool completely.Will keep in an airtight container for three days or frozen for two months."]','2026-01-10 12:22:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8722,8722,'en','Homemade breadcrumbs','Learn how to make breadcrumbs at home with our super-simple recipe and method. Use them as a crunchy coating for fried foods, treacle tart filling or pasta bake topping','["2 slices day-old white bread (crusts removed, if you prefer)"]','["To make fresh breadcrumbs, tear the bread into pieces and drop into afood processorfitted with a blade attachment. Pulse until you have breadcrumbs of the size you want. If you want to make very even breadcrumbs, push them through a coarse sieve.Will keep in an airtight container at room temperature for up to a week.","To make dried breadcrumbs, tear the bread into pieces and bake in a low oven until the pieces are completely dried out. Pulse in a food processor as before.Will keep chilled for up to two months, or frozen for six months."]','2026-01-10 12:22:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8724,8724,'en','Giant cinnabun','Take cinnamon whirls to a new level of indulgence with this giant version. Perfect for a party, it takes a little more effort but the results are well worth it','["200ml milk","50g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","450g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tsp ground cinnamon","75g golden caster sugar","1 egg, beaten","vegetable oil, for the bowl","200g light brown soft sugar","150g butter, softened","2 tbsp ground cinnamon","100g icing sugar","¼ tsp vanilla extract"]','["For the dough, gently heat the milk and butter until the butter has just melted. Leave to cool until just warm to the touch (it shouldn’t be hot). Tip the flour into a large bowl with the yeast, cinnamon, sugar and a pinch of salt. Pour in the warm butter and milk mixture along with the egg, then combine with your hands until a dough forms. Tip the dough out onto a floured surface, and knead for about 10 mins until springy. Alternatively, you can do this in astand mixerfitted with a dough hook – the dough will only require about 5 mins of kneading using this method. Bring the dough together into a ball, then place in an oiled bowl. Cover with a clean tea towel and leave to rise for about 1 hr, or until doubled in size.","Meanwhile, beat the filling ingredients with a small pinch of salt using an electricwhiskuntil completely combined. Set aside. Butter a 20cm springform or loose-bottomed cake tin. Tip the dough out onto a lightly floured surface and knead briefly to knock the air out. Leave to rest for a few minutes, then roll out to a 30 x 50cm rectangle, and lay it on the surface so the short edge is facing you. Spread over the filling so the dough rectangle is completely covered. Cut the dough into four strips down the length. Roll the first strip up into a tight spiral from the short end, then place the spiral at the short end of the second strip and roll this up into a spiral around the first. Place this larger spiral at the short end of the third strip and roll up again, then repeat with the final strip of dough. You should end up with one large cinnamon bun. Transfer to the prepared tin, cover with a clean tea towel and leave to rise for 45 mins-1 hr, or until it has risen by about a third.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the cake tin on a baking tray and bake for 50 mins-1 hr until puffed up, golden and cooked through. Meanwhile, combine the icing sugar, vanilla and 3 tbsp water until you have a loose icing that can be drizzled. Leave the bun to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then remove from the tin, drizzle with the icing and leave to cool completely on awire rack. Serve in slices, or let everyone pull it apart.Will keep in an airtight container for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8726,8726,'en','Chocolate orange babka','Make a chocolate orange babka for a showstopping treat at Christmas. Babka is an enriched bread dough usually made in a loaf tin, but we’ve shaped it as a wreath','["100ml whole milk","550g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","100g caster sugar","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","4 large eggs, at room temperature","150g unsalted butter, at room temperature, cut into cubes","50g light brown soft sugar","30g cocoa powder","125g dark chocolate, finely chopped","100g unsalted butter, chopped","3 oranges, zested","100g caster sugar","3 oranges, juiced (or use the juice of 2 oranges mixed with 25ml triple sec), plus 1 orange, zest peeled and finely sliced into strips"]','["Heat the milk in a small pan over a low heat until warm, but not hot. Set aside. Put the flour into the bowl of astand mixer. Add ½ tsp salt to one side of the bowl and the sugar and yeast to the other. Mix each side into the flour with your hands, then using the dough hook attachment until fully combined.","Pour in the warm milk, then, with the mixer on medium, add the eggs one at a time. Keep mixing the dough for 10 mins until smooth, then gradually add the butter, one or two cubes at a time, until fully incorporated, about 5-8 mins. Scrape down the sides of the bowl – the dough will be very soft.","Scrape the dough into a large bowl, cover with a clean tea towel and leave to rise for 1 hr 30 mins-2 hrs until doubled in size. Once doubled, chill for 1 hr.","Line a large baking sheet with baking parchment and set aside. To make the filling, put all the filling ingredients and a large pinch of sea salt flakes in a smallsaucepanover a low-medium heat, stirring continuously until everything has melted together. Transfer to a bowl, leave to cool completely, then transfer to the fridge and chill for 40 mins, stirring every 20 mins until the mixture has thickened but is still spreadable.","Remove the dough from the fridge, androll outon a lightly floured surface to a roughly 70 x 40cm rectangle. Spread the filling evenly over the dough using a spatula or palette knife. With a shorter end closest to you, roll the dough up into a tight sausage. Transfer to a board, seam-side down, and cut in half across the length so you have two long pieces. Lay the two pieces out in front of you, parallel to one another, and cross them over each other along the length in a plait-like pattern. Curl into a circle and join the ends to make a wreath, then carefully transfer to the lined sheet.","Cover with a tea towel and leave to rise for 1 hr until doubled in size. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and bake the babka for 35-40 mins until golden.","For the syrup, simmer the sugar, orange juice and zest over a high heat for 5-10 mins until thickened. Brush the babka with the warm syrup. Strain the candied orange zest and scatter over the babka. Serve warm, or leave to cool completely, then keep wrapped.Will keep wrapped at room temperature for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8728,8728,'en','Belgian buns','Indulge in these moreish Belgian buns as an afternoon treat with a cup of tea. They’re filled with lemon curd and topped with icing and a glacé cherry','["450g strong white flour, plus extra for dusting","7g fast action yeast","75g caster sugar","165ml warm milk","1 large egg, beaten plus 1 for egg wash","50g unsalted butter, melted, plus extra for the tray","5 tbsp lemon curd","150g sultanas","250g icing sugar","12 glacé cherries"]','["Mix the flour, yeast, caster sugar and 1 tsp sea salt in a large bowl. Make a well in the centre and pour in the warm milk, beaten egg and melted butter. Mix well a soft dough forms. If it feels dry, add a bit of warm water, if it feels too sticky and wet, add 1 tbsp flour.","Dust a work surface with flour and tip the mixture onto it. Knead the dough until it feels smooth and elastic. Shape into a ball and put in a large, lightly floured bowl. Cover and leave to rise in a warm place for 1 hr or until doubled in size. Or, leave to prove in the fridge overnight, removing 45 mins before continuing.","Line a large baking tray with non-stick baking paper. Lightly dust a work surface and roll out the dough to 30 x 45cm. Evenly spread the lemon curd over the dough and sprinkle with the sultanas. Roll the dough up lengthways from the shortest side, like a Swiss roll, to form a log. Cut into 12 equal sized buns with a sharp knife, egg-washing the loose end of the pastry and pressing it down, so it doesn’t unravel. Arrange, spread apart, on the prepared baking tray, cover, and leave to prove for 45 mins until doubled in size.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Brush the buns with a little egg wash. Bake for 10 mins, then reduce the temperature to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and cook for a further 10 mins. Leave to cool.","Meanwhile, sieve the icing sugar and mix with 3 tbsp water until a thick, white icing forms. Spread the icing on top of the buns with the back of a spoon, then put a cherry in the middle of each one."]','2026-01-10 12:22:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8730,8730,'en','Meatball & garlic bread traybake','Make this comforting meatball and garlic bread traybake for a dinner the whole family will enjoy. You could buy a pack of meatballs if you’re short on time','["350g turkey thigh mince","1 tsp dried oregano","1 tsp fennel seeds","1½ tbsp olive oil","1 large onion, chopped","3 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","2 tsp sugar","150g ball mozzarella, torn into pieces","4 garlic breadsticks or garlic bread slices, torn or chopped into chunks","25g cheddar, grated","green salad or spaghetti, to serve"]','["Combine the mince, oregano, fennel seeds and some seasoning in a bowl. Take walnut-sized pieces of the mixture and roll into balls. Heat half the oil in a large, shallow ovenproof pan and cook the meatballs until browned all over – don’t worry if they’re not cooked through. Transfer to a plate. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Heat the remaining oil in the pan and add the onion. Cook until softened, about 10-12 mins, stirring regularly. Stir in the garlic for another minute, then the tomato purée, chopped tomatoes and sugar.","Simmer for 10-15 mins, then season to taste. Place the meatballs on top of the sauce, then add the mozzarella, garlic bread and the cheddar on top. Bake for 15-20 mins until golden and crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:22:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8732,8732,'en','Cheese-stuffed garlic dough balls with a tomato sauce dip','Impress family and friends with the ultimate sharing starter: cheesy, moreish garlic dough balls. With a tomato-based dipping sauce, they make an ideal addition to any Italian-inspired menu','["50g butter, cubed","300g strong white bread flour","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1 tbsp caster sugar","200g block mozzarella, cut into 1½ cm cubes","65g gruyère, coarsely grated (optional)","100g butter","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 rosemary sprig, leaves picked and finely chopped","1 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for the bowl and baking sheet","1 garlic clove, sliced","250g passata","1 tsp red wine vinegar","1 tsp caster sugar","pinch of chilli flakes","½ small bunch of basil, torn, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat 175ml water in a saucepan until steaming, then add the butter. Remove from the heat and leave to cool until the mixture is just warm (it should not be hot). Combine the flour, yeast, sugar and 1 tsp salt in a large bowl or stand mixer. Add the cooled butter mixture, and mix to a soft dough using a wooden spoon or the mixer. Knead for 10 mins by hand (or 5 mins using a mixer) until the dough feels bouncy and smooth. Transfer to an oiled bowl and cover with a clean tea towel. Leave somewhere warm to rise for 1½-2 hrs, or until doubled in size. Alternatively, leave to prove in the fridge overnight.","Oil and line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Knock the air out of the dough, then knead again for several minutes. Flatten a small piece of dough (about 20g) into a disc, and put a cube of the mozzarella and a pinch of the gruyère into the middle of the disc. Enclose the cheeses with the dough, then roll into a ball. Transfer to the prepared baking sheet. Repeat with the remaining cheese and dough, placing the dough balls ½cm apart on the baking sheet – they should be just touching after proving. Cover with a clean tea towel and leave somewhere warm to rise for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, make the garlic butter. Melt the butter in a small pan over a low heat, then stir in the garlic and rosemary. Remove from the heat and set aside until needed. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Brush the risen dough balls with the garlic butter, then bake for 25-30 mins until the dough balls are cooked through and the middles are oozing.","While the dough balls are baking, make the tomato sauce dip. Heat the oil in a saucepan and fry the garlic for 30 seconds. Tip in the passata, vinegar, sugar and chilli flakes, and simmer for 10 mins until thickened. Season to taste and stir in the basil. Brush the warm dough balls with any remaining garlic butter, then serve with the tomato sauce dip on the side for dunking."]','2026-01-10 12:22:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8734,8734,'en','Rye sourdough bread','This basic all-rye sourdough loaf has a deep malty flavour which works well with smoked fish or cured meats. Rye has less gluten than wheat so requires a slightly different technique','["250g wholemeal rye flour","100g active rye starter (see above)","500g wholemeal rye flour, extra for dusting","10g fine salt","25g butter, softened, for the tin"]','["Day 1: To begin your starter, mix 50g of the flour with 50g tepid water in a jar or, better still, a plastic container. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, covered with a tea towel, at room temperature for 24 hrs.","Days 2, 3, 4 & 5 : Mix 25g flour with 25g tepid water and stir into yesterday’s mixture. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, covered with a tea towel, at room temperature for 24 hrs.","Day 6: The mix should be really bubbly and giving off a strong smell of alcohol. A teaspoonful of the starter should float in warm water if ready. If not, continue adding 25g flour and 25g tepid water into the mixture daily until it becomes active.If your jar is becoming full, spoon half the mix out of the jar and continue. You now have rye starter, which is a malty flavoured base to sourdough bread. Keep it in the fridge (it will stay dormant) and 12 hrs before you want to use it, spoon half of it off and feed it with 100g flour and 100g water. Leave, covered, at room temperature.","Tip 100g of the starter into a bowl and add 400g of tepid water. Whisk or rub the two together with your hands, don’t worry if there are a few lumps. Add the flour and bring together (with a spatula or your hand) into a thick, sticky dough, making sure all the flour is mixed in, including any dry bits on the sides of the bowl. Cover with a damp tea towel and leave at room temperature for 2 hrs.","Work the salt into the dough then leave, covered, for another 2 hrs.","Heavily butter a 900g loaf tin. Dust the work surface with more rye flour, then scrape all the dough out. Mould the dough into a block roughly the same size as the tin and sit it in the tin. Press the dough down so it fills it completely and scatter the top generously with more flour. Leave the loaf out, uncovered, for 2 hrs until it’s risen by about a quarter and gone craggy on the top, or leave it in the fridge, uncovered, overnight. This will give it an even deeper flavour.","Heat the oven to 230/210C fan/gas 8 with a shelf in the middle of the oven and a shelf below with a roasting tray on it. Put the loaf on the middle tray and carefully pour a small glass of water into the roasting tray. Cook for 50-55 mins until hollow sounding when tapped. (The middle of the loaf will read 98C on a digital thermometer when ready.) Remove the tin and leave to cool on a wire rack for at least 4 hrs. Will keep for 3-4 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:22:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8736,8736,'en','Slow cooker bread','Make an easy loaf with this slow cooker bread recipe. This simple project is perfect for beginners and uses strong wholemeal or white flour','["500g strong wholemeal flour or strong white flour (or a mix of flours, see tip), plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","1g fine sea salt"]','["Mix the flour, yeast and salt in a large bowl and make a well in the middle. Measure 350ml warm water and pour most of it into the well. Mix the flour and water together with your fingers or a wooden spoon until combined into a slightly wet, pillowy, workable dough – add a splash more water if necessary.","Tip the dough onto a lightly floured surface and knead for at least 10 mins until smooth and elastic. This can also be done in a tabletop mixer with a dough hook.","Shape the dough into a large, tight ball and sit the ball on a square of baking parchment. Use the parchment to lift the dough into your slow cooker, cover and set the slow cooker to high. Leave for 2 hrs.","Lift the bread out using the parchment. The bottom should be crusty and the top should be springy, not soft. (If you have a digital cooking thermometer, the middle of the loaf should be 90C.) If it isn’t ready, return to the slow cooker for 15 mins and test again – it could take up to 2 hrs 30 mins.","The bread won’t get a significant crust or golden colour in the slow cooker. Once cooked, you can leave it to cool, or put in the oven at 240C/220C fan/gas 9 for 5-10 mins to get some colour."]','2026-01-10 12:22:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8738,8738,'en','Flatbreads','Make our easiest ever flatbread recipe with just a handful of ingredients. They’re perfect for mopping up a warming curry or saucy shakshuka','["110g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","110g plain wholemeal flour or atta flour","3 tbsp rapeseed oil, plus extra for the bowl","small knob of butter, melted"]','["Sift the flours and 1 tsp salt into a large bowl. Add 1 tbsp of the oil and 150ml warm water. Bring together into a soft but not too sticky dough (you may need up to 175ml water). If it feels too wet, add some flour. If it’s too dry, add water.","Tip onto a floured surface and knead for 4-5 mins, or until smooth. Put the dough in an oiled bowl, cover and leave for 30 mins.","Tip onto a floured surface. Divide into six balls and roll each out into a thin, 18-20cm wide circle using a rolling pin. If you prefer, you can divide again into twelve balls to make smaller flatbreads.","Brush a heavy-based pan with oil and cook one flatbread over a high heat for 1-2 mins on each side, or until golden and starting to puff. Put on a plate and brush with butter. Repeat with the rest of the dough."]','2026-01-10 12:22:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8740,8740,'en','Easy bread rolls','Bake these simple white bread rolls for sandwiches, burger buns or to dunk in soup. Using only a handful of ingredients, bread-making has never been so easy','["500g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast action yeast","1 tsp white caster sugar","2 tsp fine salt","1 tsp sunflower oil, plus extra for the work surface and bowl"]','["Tip the flour, yeast, sugar, salt and oil into a bowl. Pour over 325ml warm water, then mix (with a spatula or your hand), until it comes together as a shaggy dough. Make sure all the flour has been incorporated. Cover and leave for 10 mins.","Lightly oil your work surface and tip the dough onto it. Knead the dough for at least 10 mins until it becomes tighter and springy – if you have a stand mixer you can do this with a dough hook for 5 mins. Pull the dough into a ball and put in a clean, oiled bowl. Leave for 1 hr, or until doubled in size.","Tip the dough onto a lightly floured surface and roll into a long sausage shape. Halve the dough, then divide each half into four pieces, so you have eight equal-sized portions. Roll each into a tight ball and put on a dusted baking tray, leaving some room between each ball for rising. Cover with a damp tea towel and leave in a warm place to prove for 40 mins-1 hr or until almost doubled in size.","Heat the oven to 230C/210C fan/gas 8. When the dough is ready, dust each ball with a bit more flour. (If you like, you can glaze the rolls with milk or beaten egg, and top with seeds.) Bake for 25-30mins, until light brown and hollow sounding when tapped on the base. Leave to cool on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:22:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8742,8742,'en','Plain flour bread','This no-yeast bread is made using any plain flour you have at home. It’s slightly denser than a yeasted bread, but very satisfying spread with butter or dunked in hot soup','["500g plain white flour or wholemeal flour, plus extra","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","½ tsp fine salt","1 tbsp sugar","350ml-400ml natural yogurt or buttermilk","handful of oats or seeds, optional"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a 900g loaf tin with baking parchment. Put a flat baking sheet in the oven to get really hot.","Mix the flour, bicarb, salt and sugar in a large bowl until evenly distributed. Make a well in the centre and tip in the yogurt. Bring together to make a slightly sticky dough.","Lightly dust the dough with extra flour and form into a fat log, around the same size as the tin. Put in the tin. Dip a wooden spoon in flour and make a line along the centre. Top with a small handful of oats or seeds, if you like.","Bake on the hot baking sheet for 40-45 mins or until golden brown. Leave to cool in the tin then turn out onto a wire rack to cool completely before cutting into slices."]','2026-01-10 12:22:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8744,8744,'en','Sourdough starter','Learn how to make a bubbling sourdough starter using white bread flour and water. After feeding the starter for five days, you can use it to make a sourdough loaf','["250g strong white bread flour, preferably organic or stoneground"]','["Day 1:To begin your starter, mix 50g flour with 50g tepid water in a jar or, better still, a plastic container. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, semi-uncovered, at room temperature for 24 hrs.","Day 2:Mix 50g flour with 50g tepid water and stir into yesterday’s mixture. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, semi-uncovered, at room temperature for another 24 hrs.","Day 3:Mix 50g flour with 50g tepid water and stir into yesterday’s mixture. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, semi-uncovered, at room temperature for another 24 hrs.","Day 4:You should start to see some activity in the mixture now; there should be some bubbles forming and bubbling on top. Mix 50g flour with 50g tepid water and stir into yesterday’s mixture. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, semi-uncovered, at room temperature for another 24 hrs.","Day 5:The mixture should be very active now and ready for making your levain (starter). If it’s not bubbling, continue to feed it on a daily basis until it does. When it’s ready, it should smell like yogurt.","You now have a starter, which is the base to the bread. You’ll need to look after it, but naming is optional! Keep it in the fridge (it will stay dormant) and 24 hrs before you want to use it, pour half of it off and feed it with 100g flour and 100g water. Leave it at room temperature and it should become active again. The longer the starter has been dormant, the more times it will need to be refreshed – the process of pouring off half the starter and replacing it with new flour and water – to reactivate. If your starter is ready to use, a teaspoonful of the mixture should float in warm water.The starter can now be used to make white sourdough bread."]','2026-01-10 12:22:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8746,8746,'en','Focaccia','Forget shop-bought focaccia and make a simple, homemade version of this classic Italian bread. Serve alongside pasta dishes or enjoy with salads','["500g strong bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g dried fast action yeast","2 tsp fine sea salt","5 tbsp olive oil, plus extra for the tin and to serve","1 tsp flaky sea salt","¼ small bunch of rosemary, sprigs picked"]','["Tip the flour into a large mixing bowl. Mix the yeast into one side of the flour, and the fine salt into the other side. Then mix everything together, this initial seperation prevents the salt from killing the yeast.","Make a well in the middle of the flour and add 2 tbsp oil and 350-400ml lukewarm water, adding it gradually until you have a slightly sticky dough (you may not need all the water). Sprinkle the work surface with flour and tip the dough onto it, scraping around the sides of the bowl. Kneed for 5-10 mins until your dough is soft and less sticky. Put the dough into a clean bowl, cover with a tea towel and leave to prove for 1 hr until doubled in size.","Oil a rectangle, shallow tin (25 x 35cm). Tip the dough onto the work surface, then stretch it to fill the tin. Cover with a tea towel and leave to prove for another 35-45 mins.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Press your fingers into the dough to make dimples. Mix together 1½ tbsp olive oil, 1 tbsp water and the flaky salt and drizzle over the bread. Push sprigs of rosemary into the dimples in the dough.","Bake for 20 mins until golden. Whilst the bread is still hot, drizzle over 1-2 tbsp olive oil. Cut into squares and serve warm or cold with extra olive oil, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8748,8748,'en','Einkorn soda bread','Use einkorn flour – one of the earliest forms of wheat eaten by humankind – to make this soda bread. It delivers a lovely rich and nutty flavour','["250g einkorn flour, plus extra for dusting","250g plain flour","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1½ tsp fine sea salt","1 tbsp soft brown sugar","370ml natural yogurt","1 large egg"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Sprinkle a little of the einkorn flour over a baking sheet, then tip both flours, the bicarbonate of soda, salt and sugar into a bowl and stir to combine. Whisk the yogurt and egg together in a jug.","Make a well in the centre of the dry ingredients and pour in the wet mixture. Swiftly mix the ingredients together to create a slightly sticky dough. Form into a round, about 4-5cm thick and put in the middle of the baking sheet. Dip the handle of a wooden spoon into some flour, then lightly press into the top to create a cross. Lightly dust with a little more einkorn flour.","Bake in the oven for 40-45 mins or until slightly risen with no grey, uncooked patches in the cross. Set aside to cool, then serve with salted butter, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8750,8750,'en','Italian-style rolls','Load ciabatta rolls with fresh pesto, buffalo mozzarella, artichokes, roasted red peppers and basil leaves for a delicious Italian-Inspired sandwich lunch','["2 ciabatta-style rolls, toasted","1½  tbsp fresh pesto","50g marinated artichokes from a jar, drained and sliced","1 large roasted red pepper from a jar, drained and sliced","1 ball buffalo mozzarella or burrata, torn","handful of fresh basil leaves"]','["Split the rolls and spread the pesto over the bases. Top with the artichokes, pepper, cheese, basil and the bun tops to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8752,8752,'en','White sourdough','Master the art of making sourdough bread with our step-by-step recipe. Learn how to create a starter, levain and the loaf itself with our expert tips.','["250g strong white bread flour, preferably organic or stoneground","1 tbsp sourdough starter (see above)","100g strong white bread flour, preferably organic or stoneground","levain (see above)","1kg strong white bread flour, preferably organic or stoneground, plus extra for dusting","20g fine sea salt"]','["Day 1, Monday: To begin your starter, mix 50g flour with 50g tepid water in a jar or, better still, a plastic container. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, semi-uncovered, at room temperature for 24 hrs.","Day 2, Tuesday: Mix 50g flour with 50g tepid water and stir into yesterday’s mixture. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, semi-uncovered, at room temperature for another 24 hrs.","Day 3, Wednesday: Mix 50g flour with 50g tepid water and stir into yesterday’s mixture. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, semi-uncovered, at room temperature for another 24 hrs.","Day 4, Thursday: You should start to see some activity in the mixture now; there should be some bubbles forming and bubbling on top. Mix 50g flour with 50g tepid water and stir into yesterday’s mixture. Make sure all the flour is incorporated and leave, semi-uncovered, at room temperature for another 24 hrs.","Day 5, Friday:The mixture should be very active now and ready for making your levain. If it’s not bubbling, continue to feed it on a daily basis until it does. When it’s ready, it should smell like yogurt.","You now have a starter, which is the base to the bread. You’ll need to look after it, but naming is optional! Keep it in the fridge (it will stay dormant) and 24 hrs before you want to use it, pour half of it off and feed it with 100g flour and 100g water. Leave it at room temperature and it should become active again. The longer the starter has been dormant, the more times it will need to be refreshed – the process of pouring off half the starter and replacing it with new flour and water – to reactivate. If your starter is ready to use, a teaspoonful of the mixture should float in warm water.","For the levainMix 1 tbsp of the starter with 100g flour and 100g water (this is the same process as feeding the starter, but you should do this in a new, separate bowl, keeping the original starter as back-up, as this is the mixture you''ll use to bake your bread). Leave the levain for 8 hrs at room temperature until it becomes active. When ready, a teaspoonful of the mixture should float in warm water.","For the breadPour 600g tepid water into the levain and stir with a rubber spatula to mix together – don’t worry if there are unmixed bits of levain. Tip in the flour and mix everything together with a rubber spatula to make a rough dough, ensuring all the flour is incorporated evenly and that there are no dry bits up the side of the bowl. Cover and leave somewhere warm for at least 30 mins, or up to 4 hrs.","Sprinkle over the salt and add 50g water to the dough. Pinch and scrunch the salt and water through the dough with your hands. If the dough goes stringy (like old chewing gum), just keep working it until it’s one smooth texture. Leave for another 15 mins.","Wet your hands, grab the dough from one side and stretch it over itself, then repeat with the other side. This stretching technique helps develop the gluten. Pick the dough up and curl it around onto itself, then cover and leave for another 20-30 mins. Repeat this process two more times (three in total), then leave the dough for another 2-3 hrs until it’s risen by about 30% and looks bubbly and soft.","Using a rubber spatula, scrape the dough out onto a lightly floured work surface and split in two. Fold each piece onto itself to create a ball, then leave uncovered for 30 mins. The dough balls will spread during this time.","Dust two bread-proving baskets generously with flour.  Scrape one of the balls of dough off the work surface, then fold it onto itself to create a tight ball that’s trapped in all the air. Lift the ball into a basket, seam-side up, then transfer to the fridge to chill overnight, or for up to 18 hrs. Repeat with the other dough ball.","Heat the oven to 240C/220C fan/gas 9 and put a lidded casserole dish in the oven to heat. Cut a sheet of baking parchment into a square slightly larger than the base of one of the loaves. Carefully remove the hot casserole dish from the oven and remove the lid. Invert one loaf onto the baking parchment, then, working quickly, score the top at an angle. Use the corners of the parchment to lift the loaf into the casserole dish. Cover with the lid and bake for 30 mins, then carefully uncover and continue to bake for another 10 mins (or longer for a darker finish). Carefully lift the bread out of the dish using a spatula, transfer to a wire rack and leave to cool to room temperature before slicing. Repeat with the second loaf."]','2026-01-10 12:22:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8754,8754,'en','Pesto focaccia sandwich','The fillings for your sandwiches are baked into the bread, making this an easy veggie picnic option that won''t go soggy','["500g strong white flour","7g fast-action yeast","2 tbsp olive oil, plus a little extra","small pack basil, leaves picked","2 x 125g mozzarella balls","2 tbsp pine nuts, toasted","3 tbsp green pesto"]','["Put the flour, yeast and 1 tsp salt in a large bowl, ensuring the yeast and salt don’t touch. Pour in 350ml lukewarm water and the olive oil, and bring together with a spoon to form a wet, elastic dough. If using a stand mixer, knead for 5 mins or until the dough stops sticking to the side of the bowl. If kneading by hand, knead for 10 mins on a lightly floured surface.","Put the dough in a lightly oiled bowl, cover with a clean, damp tea towel and leave to rise for 1 hr or until doubled in size.","Line a 20 x 30cm roasting tin with a piece of crumpled baking parchment. Cut the dough in half and press, as lightly as possible, one half into the roasting tin, stretching it out to fill the tin. Cover with the basil, mozzarella and pine nuts, then spread out the other half of the dough and place on top. Cover and leave to rise for 1 hr or until light and puffy.","Meanwhile, heat oven to 200C/ 180C fan/gas 6. Once risen, press indents with your fingers into the top of the dough. The dough is ready if the indents stay; if they bounce back, leave the dough for longer. Fill the indents with pesto, then sprinkle with a little flaky sea salt and drizzle with a little olive oil.","Bake on the top shelf of the oven for 25-30 mins, without opening the oven door, until golden.","Transfer to a wire rack and leave to cool completely. Take to your picnic whole and slice into 10-12 sandwiches when serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8756,8756,'en','Lamb shoulder & smoky aubergine flatbread','This is loosely based on the Turkish dish of lahmacun, but with a thicker bread base similar to pizza. Great for using leftover lamb, the charred aubergine gives a smoky depth','["7g fast-action dried yeast","200g ''00'' flour","200g strong bread flour","1 tbsp olive oil","1 aubergine","½  red onion, finely sliced","150g leftover lamb, shredded or chopped","2 tbsp finely chopped parsley","1 tomato, finely chopped","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 garlic clove, crushed","pinch of ground cumin","pinch of smoked paprika","1 tbsp pomegranate molasses (optional)","1 tbsp olive oil","1 tbsp pine nuts","1 tsp tahini"]','["To make the flatbread, put the yeast and 250ml warm water in a jug and mix well. Leave to sit for a few mins.","Sift the flours into a bowl with 2 tsp salt, then slowly incorporate the yeast mix, stirring with a wooden spoon. Stir in the oil and turn the dough out onto a clean surface. Knead for 5 mins until you have a smooth, springy dough. Return to the bowl, cover with cling film and leave for 30 mins to puff up","Char the aubergine over a gas flame or under a hot grill until smoky and collapsing – it should be soft enough to pull apart with a fork. Set aside to cool.","Tip the dough out and knead for a few mins more, then divide it into four and roll each piece into a smooth ball. Wrap three in cling film and freeze for later use.","Heat oven to 240C/220C fan/ gas 8. Flatten the ball of dough with the palm of your hand and roll out into a wide, flat base 25-30cm long. Place on an oiled baking sheet and leave to rise a little while you make the topping.","Scoop the soft smoky flesh from the charred aubergine into a bowl and combine with all the other topping ingredients apart from the pine nuts. Spread the topping over the flatbread, then scatter over the pine nuts. Bake for 10-12 mins until the bread is puffed and golden, and the topping is piping hot.","Mix the tahini with 1 tbsp water to form a smooth dressing. Drizzle over the flatbread, cut into pieces and share."]','2026-01-10 12:22:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8758,8758,'en','Steamed bao buns','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyFill these steamed Chinese bread rolls with BBQ pork and pickled vegetables for a perfect Chinese New Year party nibble','["525g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1½  tbsp caster sugar, plus a pinch","1 tsp fast-action dried yeast","50ml milk","1 tbsp sunflower oil, plus extra for greasing and brushing","1 tbsp rice vinegar","1 tsp baking powder"]','["Mix together the flour, sugar and 1/2 tsp salt in a large bowl (see tip). Dissolve the yeast and a pinch of salt in 1 tbsp warm water, then add it to the flour with the milk, oil, vinegar and 200ml water. Mix into a dough, adding a little extra water if needed.","Tip the dough onto a lightly floured work surface and knead for 10-15 mins, or until smooth. Place in a lightly oiled bowl, cover with a damp cloth and leave to rise for 2 hrs, or until doubled in size.","Tip the dough out onto a clean work surface and punch it down. Flatten the dough with your hands, then sprinkle over the baking powder and knead for 5 mins.","Roll out the dough into a long sausage shape, about 3cm thick, then cut into pieces that are about 3cm wide – you should have 18.","In the palm of your hand, roll each piece of dough into a ball and leave to rest for 2-3 mins.","Use a rolling pin to roll out each ball, one by one, into an oval shape about 3-4mm thick. Rub the surface of the dough ovals with oil and brush a little oil over a chopstick.","Place the oiled chopstick in the centre of each oval. Fold the dough over the chopstick, then slowly pull out the chopstick.","Transfer the prepared buns to a baking tray lined with baking parchment, cover with a clean tea towel or lightly oiled cling film and leave to prove in a warm place for 1 hr 30 mins, or until doubled in size.","Heat a large steamer over a medium-high heat. Steam the buns for 8 mins until puffed up (you’ll need to do this in batches). Prise open each bun and fill with the barbecue pork and Pickled carrot & mooli. Eat while they’re still warm."]','2026-01-10 12:22:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8760,8760,'en','Courgette & cheddar soda bread','This simple loaf is easy to make but big on flavour and texture, with mature cheese, grated courgettes, oats and thyme','["400g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","2 medium courgettes","50g rolled oat","1½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","75g mature cheddar, grated","small bunch thyme, leaves only","284ml pot buttermilk","1 tbsp clear honey","1 egg, beaten"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and dust a baking sheet with a little flour. Place a box grater on top of a clean tea towel and coarsely grate the courgettes. Lift the corners of the tea towel and, holding it over the sink, twist to compact the courgettes and squeeze out as much liquid as you can.","Put the flour, oats, bicarb and 1 tsp fine salt in a large bowl. Add most of the cheddar (save a little for the top), the thyme and the courgette. Mix the buttermilk and honey, then pour into the flour mixture. Stir with a wooden spoon until the dough starts to clump together, then tip onto a work surface and knead briefly to bring all the loose bits together – try not to overwork the dough or the bread will be heavy.","Shape into a round loaf and place on the baking sheet. Brush with egg and sprinkle with the remaining cheese. Use a sharp knife to score a deep cross on top of the loaf, then bake for 40 mins until deep golden brown. Best served warm, but leftovers will keep for 1-2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8762,8762,'en','Gruyère & onion tear & share','These tasty white bread rolls are filled with cheese and onion – let everyone help themselves as part of a buffet','["500g strong bread flour, plus extra for dusting","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","pinch of sugar","2 tbsp olive oil, plus 2 tsp extra","knob of butter","2 onions, thinly sliced","140g Gruyère, grated","1 tbsp thyme leaves"]','["In a large bowl, combine the flour, yeast, sugar and 1 tsp salt. Make a well in the centre and gradually pour in 350ml tepid water, stirring and mixing the water into the flour. If the mix is a little wet, stir in a bit of extra flour; if a little dry, add a bit more water. The dough should be soft but not too sticky. Turn the dough out onto a floured work surface and knead for about 10 mins until the dough is springy but smooth. Put in a large floured bowl, cover with cling film and leave in a warm place to rise until doubled in size (this will take 45 mins-1 hr).","While the dough rises, heat the 2 tbsp oil and butter in a non-stick frying pan. Stir in the onions and cook over a medium heat for 10-15 mins until golden and softened. Leave to cool, then stir in the cheese and thyme leaves, and season.","Once the dough has risen and doubled in size, knock it back and divide into 12 balls. Flour a work surface and roll out the balls to about 10cm across. Spoon 1 heaped tbsp of the onion mixture in the middle of the dough and gather up the edges over the filling, pressing together to seal. Do this with all the balls, reserving a little onion mixture. Oil a baking tray and arrange the balls, seam-side down, in rows. Cover with oiled cling film and leave in a warm place to prove for another 30 mins.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Once the buns have risen a little more and are beginning to join together, remove the cling film, drizzle with the remaining oil and spoon over the leftover onion mixture. Bake for 10 mins, then turn the oven down to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and cook for another 10 mins. The buns should be golden and crisp on the bottom. Cool before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8764,8764,'en','Garlic bread pizzas','A fresh, easy-to-prepare snack','["500g strong white flour, plus extra for rolling","7g sachet fast-action yeast","1 tsp salt","2 tbsp olive oil","50g butter, softened","2 garlic cloves, crushed","300g pack mozzarella, drained","4 tomatoes, roughly chopped","handful basil leaves, roughly chopped","1 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil","1 tsp balsamic vinegar"]','["Tip all of the base ingredients into a\r\nmixing bowl. Pour over 300ml warm\r\nwater – not too hot. Stir quite hard with a\r\nspoon until the mixture comes together.","Turn out onto a lightly floured surface\r\nand knead 2-3 times until the mixture\r\nforms a ball. Divide dough into 8 equalsize\r\npieces. Take 1 piece, leaving the\r\nremainder loosely covered with oiled\r\ncling film. Lightly flour the surface again\r\nand use a rolling pin to roll out dough into\r\na round about 15cm diameter or as thin\r\nas you can. Put pizza on a baking sheet.","Mix together the butter and crushed\r\ngarlic, then spread a little over the pizza.\r\nTear the mozzarella into thin strips and\r\nscatter over. Repeat for the remaining\r\npieces of dough. You should be able to fit\r\n2 pizzas per baking sheet; depending on\r\nhow many baking sheets you have, you\r\nmay have to cook in batches.","Heat oven to 240C/fan 220C/gas 9.\r\nBake pizzas for 12-15 mins until crisp and\r\ncooked through. Meanwhile, mix together\r\nthe remaining ingredients, then season\r\nwell. When the pizza comes out of the\r\noven, top with the tomato mixture and\r\nserve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:22:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8766,8766,'en','Artichoke focaccia','Inject the taste of Italy into your picnics and al fresco dinner parties with this irresistibly moreish focaccia','["500g strong flour","7g sachet fast-action yeast","1 heaped tsp salt","large bunch rosemary","285g jar artichokes antipasti in oil (we used Sacla)","50g freshly grated parmesan (or vegetarian alternative), plus extra for grating"]','["Tip the flour into a large bowl and make a well in the centre. Add the yeast and salt, then gradually pour in 350ml tepid water, stirring as you go. Bring the dough together with a spoon, then with your hands. It should be soft, but not too sticky or wet. If it won’t come together, pour in a little extra water; if the dough is too wet, add extra flour. Tip onto a floured work surface and knead for about 10 mins, or until it’s  smooth, soft and springs back when pushed with a finger. Leave to rise in an oiled bowl covered with cling film in a warm place for 1 hr or Packed with summer flavours until the dough has doubled in size.","Strip leaves from half the rosemary and finely chop. Break the rest into smaller pieces. Drain the artichokes, reserving the oil, and chop into chunks.","When risen, tip the dough onto an oiled work surface and roll out into a 35 x 45cm rectangle. Slip an oiled baking sheet under half of the dough. Top the half with artichokes, all the Parmesan and rosemary. Grind over black pepper and drizzle with a little of the reserved oil. Fold over the other dough half, pressing the edges together and under to seal. Leave to rise in a warm place, covered with the oiled cling film, for 30 mins. Heat oven to 240C/fan 220C/gas 9.","Drizzle with a little more of the oil and make dents in the top with your fingers. Pop the rosemary sprigs into the dents and grate over a little more cheese. Bake for 15 mins, until golden and risen. Cool on a rack for 30 mins, cut into squares and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8768,8768,'en','Roquefort & walnut rolls','Use your favourite cheese in these delicious rolls from Great British Bake Off judge Paul Hollywood','["140g walnuts","100g wholemeal flour","400g strong white bread flour","14g sachet fast-action yeast","25g butter","250g Roquefort cheese, crumbled","2 medium eggs, beaten"]','["Place the walnuts in a food processor\r\nand pulse to chop finely; leave to one side.\r\nPut the flours, 10g salt, yeast, butter and\r\n300ml water in a bowl, stir together and\r\nbegin massaging the ingredients for a\r\nminute. If the mixture seems dry, add\r\nmore water a tbsp at a time to make a\r\nsoft but not sticky dough, then knead in\r\nthe bowl for a further couple of minutes\r\nto bring the dough together.","Tip the dough onto a lightly floured\r\nwork surface and knead well for 10 mins\r\nbefore returning to the bowl. Cover the\r\nbowl with cling film and leave to rise in\r\na warm place for 1 hr. Briefly knead the\r\nwalnuts into the dough, then leave to rise\r\nin the bowl for a further 20 mins.","Tip the dough out onto a lightly floured\r\nsurface and roll out into a rectangle,\r\napprox 50 x 20cm, 1cm thick. Sprinkle\r\nthe Roquefort evenly over the dough and\r\nlightly press in. Place the rectangle\r\nwidth-ways in front of you and roll up the\r\nrectangle like a Swiss roll. Cut into 8 equal sized\r\npieces and place them onto a lightly\r\ngreased baking tray, cut-side down. Cover\r\nwith cling film and leave to rise for 1 hr.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nBrush each round of dough with the\r\nbeaten egg and bake for 20 mins. Leave\r\nto cool for a few minutes and eat while\r\nstill warm. These are delicious on their\r\nown or served with a soup or a chunky\r\nsalad with apple in it."]','2026-01-10 12:22:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8770,8770,'en','Focaccia with pesto & mozzarella','This homemade pesto bread is a delicious accompaniment to Italian food','["500g strong white bread flour, plus some for dusting","1 ½ tsp salt","7g sachet fast-action yeast","2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil, plus some for drizzling","125g ball mozzarella, drained","5 tbsp pesto (shop-bought or see recipe, below)","sea salt, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the flour into a bowl and mix in the\r\nsalt. Mix the yeast into 325ml tepid water.\r\nAdd the water and oil to the flour, then mix\r\nwell with a plastic scraper or your hands.\r\nWhen most of the liquid is incorporated,\r\nuse your hands to bring all the ingredients\r\ntogether into a ball of dough.","Tip the dough out onto a worktop\r\nlightly dusted with flour and work it by\r\npulling and stretching for at least 10 mins.\r\nTry to get as much air into it as possible.\r\nPut the ball of worked dough into a\r\nwell-oiled bowl, cover with a little more\r\noil and a tea towel or cling film. Leave to\r\nrest for 1 hr or so in a non-draughty\r\nwarm spot, until doubled in size.","Now stretch the dough out onto a\r\nbaking sheet until it’s about 20 x 30cm.\r\nLeave the dough to rise again to about\r\nhalf as high again, about 30-40 mins in\r\na warm draught-free place, loosely\r\ncovered with a tea towel.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nWhen the dough has risen, press your\r\nfingers into it gently to make some holes.\r\nBake for about 15 mins, then remove\r\nfrom the oven. Tear over the mozzarella,\r\nthen bake for another 5-10 mins until\r\ngolden and cooked through. Drizzle over\r\nthe pesto and scatter with sea salt, if you\r\nlike. Serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:22:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8772,8772,'en','Mixed seed bread','This recipe uses a basic bread dough method, but the mix of flours gives an interesting texture and flavour','["350g wholemeal flour","100g rye flour","50g quinoa flour or extra rye flour","2 tsp salt","7g sachet fast-action yeast","125g pack sunflower seeds","25g caraway seeds","50g each poppy seeds and sesame seeds","75ml black treacle","300ml water"]','["Mix the flours, salt, yeast, sunflower, caraway, and poppy seeds in a large bowl. Add the black treacle and water, then mix well. If the dough seems a little stiff, add 1 tbsp or more extra water. Mix well, then put on a lightly floured work surface and gently knead the dough for 7 mins. Put it back into a lightly oiled bowl for approx 2 hours until doubled in size.","Line a tray with baking parchment. Tip the dough onto a lightly floured work surface and knock back, then gently mould the dough into a ball. Roll the dough in the sesame seeds and place on the baking tray to prove for a further hour until doubled in size.","Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Cut the top into criss-cross slashes with a sharp knife and bake for 30 mins until golden brown and the loaf sounds hollow when tapped underneath. Cool on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:22:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8774,8774,'en','Easy white bread','A great recipe for an electric breadmaker – or do it the traditional way','["500g strong white flour, plus extra for dusting","2 tsp salt","7g sachet fast-action yeast","3 tbsp olive oil","300ml water"]','["Mix the flour, salt and yeast in a large bowl. Make a well in the centre, then add the oil and water, and mix well. If the dough seems a little stiff, add 1-2 tbsp water, mix well then tip onto a lightly floured work surface andknead. Once the dough is satin-smooth, place it in a lightly oiled bowl. Leave to rise for 1 hour until doubled in size or place in the fridge overnight.","Line a baking tray with baking parchment. Knock back the dough, then gently mould the dough into a ball. Place it on the baking parchment to prove for a further hour until doubled in size.","Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Dust the loaf with flour and cut a cross about 6cm long into the top of the loaf with a sharp knife. Bake for 25-30 mins until golden brown and the loaf sounds hollow when tapped underneath. Cool\r\non a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:22:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8776,8776,'en','Rye bread','This rye bread recipe is lower in gluten than your average white loaf – this recipe uses white or wholemeal flour to give a light texture but you can experiment with ratios','["200g rye flour, plus extra for dusting","200g strong white or wholemeal flour","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","½  tsp fine salt","1 tbsp honey","1 tsp caraway seed (optional)"]','["Tip the flours, yeast and salt into a bowl. In a jug, mix the honey with 250ml warm water, pour the liquid into the bowl and mix to form a dough. Rye flour can be quite dry and absorbs lots of water, if the dough looks too dry add more warm water until you have a soft dough Tip out onto your work surface and knead for 10 mins until smooth. Rye contains less gluten than white flour so the dough will not feel as springy as a conventional white loaf.","Place the dough in a well oiled bowl, cover with cling film and leave to rise in a warm place for 1-2 hrs, or until roughly doubled in size.  Dust a 2lb/900g loaf tin with flour.","Tip the dough back onto your work surface and knead briefly to knock out any air bubbles. If using caraway seeds work these in to the dough.  Shape into a smooth oval loaf and pop into your tin.  Cover the tin with oiled cling film and leave to rise somewhere warm for a further 1 – 1.5 hr, or until doubled in size.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Remove the cling film and dust the surface of the loaf with rye flour. Slash a few incisions on an angle then bake for 30 mins until dark brown and hollow sounding when tapped. Transfer to a wire cooling rack and leave to cool for at least 20 mins before serving"]','2026-01-10 12:22:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8778,8778,'en','Basic granary bread dough (for rolls or a large loaf)','Nothing beats homemade bread straight from the oven – ready in just 35 minutes','["225g strong white flour","225g malted granary bread flour","1 tsp salt","1 tsp caster sugar","7g sachet easy-blend yeast","150ml warm milk","1 egg, beaten","1 tbsp olive oil","100-150ml warm water"]','["Mix the flours and salt together in a large bowl, then stir in the sugar\r\nand yeast. Make a well in the centre of the flour and pour in the warm milk, beaten egg, olive oil and enough of the water to form a soft, wet dough.","On a lightly floured surface, knead dough for 10 mins until smooth. Put\r\nthe dough in a lightly oiled bowl, cover with oiled cling film, then leave to rise in a warm place until doubled in size. The dough is now ready to be shaped.","To make 12 rolls, divide the dough into 12 pieces and shape into rolls. Lightly flour 3 baking sheets. Place the rolls onto the sheets and cover loosely with oiled cling film. Set aside in a warm place for 30 mins\r\nor until they have doubled in size.","Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Brush the bread with beaten egg and sprinkle with sesame and poppy seeds. Bake for 15-20 mins until deep golden brown and well risen.","To make a flowerpot loaf, leave the dough to rise for about 1 hour, or until doubled in size. Soak one large or eight small terracotta flowerpots in cold water for about 30 mins. Dry thoroughly, then brush the inside of the pots with oil and line with parchment paper. Shape dough into a smooth round with a roughly pointed shape at one end so it half-fills the pot. Leave until doubled in size.","Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Brush the top of the loaf with beaten egg, sprinkle with poppy or sesame seeds and bake for 45-50 mins (15-20 mins for small loaves) until golden. Let it sit for 5-10 mins, then take out of the pot and leave to cool on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:22:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8780,8780,'en','Cheesy bonfire bread','Best eaten fresh, this savoury bread can also be made ahead and frozen – perfect for Bonfire Night','["200g wholemeal flour","200g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 tsp cream of tartar","1 tsp salt","1 tsp caster sugar","25g butter, melted","300ml milk, at room temperature","175g cheddar, coarsely grated","3 tbsp pumpkin seeds","85g ready-roasted peppers from a jar, drained and chopped"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Sift the\r\ndry ingredients into a large bowl and make a large\r\nwell in the middle. Combine the melted butter and\r\nmilk, then pour into the well. Mix to a soft dough.","Dust the work surface with flour. Add most of\r\nthe cheddar, 2 tbsp of the pumpkin seeds and the\r\nchopped peppers to the dough. Gently knead to\r\ncombine on the floured surface. Divide into 8 lumps\r\nand shape into rough rounds two finger-widths deep.","Place the pieces side by side on a floured baking\r\nsheet, scatter the remaining cheddar and pumpkin\r\nseeds over the top and bake for 30 mins until golden\r\nbrown and the cheese is bubbling. Cool on a wire rack\r\nand eat while warm. The bread can be frozen at this\r\npoint. To reheat, wrap the bread tightly in foil and\r\nbake at 200C/fan 180C/gas 6 for about 30 mins."]','2026-01-10 12:22:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8781,8781,'en','Creating your wedding cake','Jane Hornby’s wedding cake is our simplest ever. And each tier is flavoured differently, so there’s something for everyone…','["1 x top tier, see ''Goes well with''","1 x middle tier, see ''Goes well with''","1 x bottom tier, see ''Goes well with''","half a 454g jar apricot jam, you''ll use the rest later","500g pack natural marzipan","500g unsalted butter, softened","1kg icing sugar, sifted","jar good-quality lemon curd","142ml carton double cream","200g bar plain chocolate (70% cocoa), broken into pieces","FRUIT CAKE - 500g/1lb2oz white ready-to-roll icing, cream food colouring paste","LEMON CAKE - 1kg/2lb4oz white ready-to-roll icing, dusty pink food-colouring paste","CHOCOLATE CAKE - 1.7kg/3lb 10oz white ready-to-roll icing, ivory food-colouring paste","FOR THE BOARD - 800g/1lb12oz white ready-to-roll icing, ivory food-colouring paste","200g icing sugar","1 egg white","dowelling rods","15cm, 23cm and 30cm deep-round cake tin","plenty greaseproof paper","thick 35cm diameter silver cake drum (base)","thin 15cm, 23cm and 30cm diameter silver cake board","long serrated knife","palette knife","cream, ivory and pink food colouring pastes","long roll ing pin","6 standard plastic dowelling rods","strong kitchen scissors","1m ivory ribbon, 15mm wide","medium artist''s paintbrush","cooling rack","string for measuring","20cm, 25cm, 33cm cake boxes with lids (if transporting the cake)"]','["COVER THE FRUIT CAKE WITH THE MARZIPAN: How to do it: \r\nBoil the apricot jam with 2 tbsp water and sieve into a bowl. Brush the 15cm cake board with a little of the apricot jam. Cut off the rounded top of the cake and turn upside-down onto the board. Measure across the top and sides of the cake with string, cut to length and set the string aside. Brush the cake all over with a thin layer of apricot jam.","Dust the work surface with icing sugar and roll the marzipan into a circle big enough to cover the cake top and sides, using the cut string as a guide. Lift over the cake and smooth with your hands. Trim the marzipan to the base of the cake (so you can’t see the board) and leave to dry for one day if time. If not, the cake can be iced straight away.","FILL & COVER THE CHOCOLATE & LEMON CAKES WITH BUTTERCREAM: Adding good-quality lemon curd or silky chocolate ganache transforms simplebuttercream into an indulgent filling.","How you do it: First make the buttercream. Beat the butter until creamy, then gradually beat in the sifted\r\nicing sugar. Weigh 600g/1lb 5oz of the mix and stir 5 tbsp of the lemon curd into it.","In a small pan, bring the cream just to the boil, then pour over the chocolate. Leave to stand for 2 mins, then stir until smooth. Once cool but still liquid, fold into the remaining basic buttercream.","Once each cake is completely cool, level off the top using a long serrated knife. Spread a little of the corresponding buttercream over the matching thin cake board. Turn cake upside down onto the board and brush all over with a thin layer of the sieved apricot jam – this helps to prevent stray crumbs getting into the buttercream.","Cut into three layers horizontally - don’t worry if you cut the layers unevenly as it won’t affect the finished cake. If it’s a hot day or warm in your kitchen, refrigerate the cakes for a while – it will firm them up and make cutting and lifting much easier. Lift off each layer as you cut it, and set it aside so that when you re-stack the layers they are in the right order.","If you’ve made the buttercream in advance and it has hardened slightly, warm in the microwave on Defrost for 10 secs and beat well. Using a palette knife, spread approx 1/4 of the buttercream over the first layer of the cake. For the lemon cake, swirl another tbsp or so of lemon curd over the icing. Stack the remaining layers this way, spreading all of the remaining icing over the top and sides of the cake, smoothing it down to meet the cardboard cake base. Smooth all over with your palette knife and set aside. The cakes are now ready for covering with ready-to-roll icing. Filled with buttercream and iced, the cakes will keep for up to 3 days.","COVER ALL THE CAKES WITH READY-TO-ROLL ICING: The next stage is to subtly colour the different tiers with the ivory, dusky pink and cream colouring pastes.","How to do it: For the marzipanned fruit cake only, first lightly brush with cooled, boiled water to help the icing\r\nstick. For all the cakes, dust the work surface with icing sugar and knead the icing until pliable. Add a few specks of the food colouring with a toothpick or the end of a skewer – be very sparing as a little goes a long way. Work the colour in until you have an evenly coloured, smooth paste. Add more and knead again if you want the colour to be more intense.","Lightly dust the work surface again and roll the icing into a circle large enough to cover the sides and top of the cake, with a little excess. Use string to measure as before. Lift the icing over the cake, using your rolling pin to help you.","Smooth the icing around the cake with your hands, then trim off the excess with a sharp knife. Leave overnight to dry. Once iced, keep for 3 days.","Once you’ve iced the cakes, cover the 35cm base. Lightly brush with cooled, boiled water and cover with ivory-coloured icing. Trim and leave overnight to dry.","STACK THE CAKES: Dowels give stability and strength to tiered cakes. By measuring and cutting\r\nthe dowels to the same length, you’re providing an even platform for the next cake to sit on, even if your cake is a bit wonky. For this cake, the tiers are stacked like steps, just off centre.","How you do it: In a large bowl, gradually beat icing sugar into the egg white until thick and smooth. Cover with\r\ncling film until ready to use.","Starting with the chocolate cake, insert three dowelling rods in a triangle, slightly offset to one side and no wider than the base of the lemon cake that’s going to sit on top. With a permanent pen, lightly mark where the top of the icing comes to on the dowel.","Carefully pull out the dowels and line up on the work surface. Using a ruler, re-mark each rod to the highest point. Score the dowels with scissors around the new marks and snap the plastic cleanly.","Re-insert the rods in their original holes, rounded end down. Cut the thin ivory ribbon to fit around the thick base board, securing at the back with glue or double-sided tape. To stack the cakes, spoon a little royal icing over each of the dowel holes. Carefully lift the chocolate cake onto the covered board, then stack cakes on top of one\r\nanother, positioning each cake and gently lowering one side of it onto the base or cake below. Slide your palette knife under it at this point and gently lower the cake down. Slide the knife out at the last minute. (If you’re moving the cake to the venue, put the cakes into their boxes and take the icing with you.)","THE TIME PLAN: UP TO A MONTH AHEAD: 1. Make the fruit cake and cover with marzipan.  2. Make the chocolate and lemon cakes if freezing – they will freeze for up to 1 month (although they are best made fresh if you can).","UP TO 4 DAYS AHEAD: 1. Make the chocolate and lemon cakes if making fresh – keep well rapped in baking parchment and cling film in a cool place. 2. Make the chocolate and lemon buttercream and keep in the fridge. 3. Make the chocolate and lemon cakes if making fresh – keep well wrapped in baking parchment and cling film in a cool place. 4. Make the chocolate and lemon buttercream and keep in the fridge.","UP TO 3 DAYS AHEAD: 1. Fill and cover the chocolate and lemon cakes with buttercream and cover all of the cakes and the board with icing. 2. Insert the dowelling rods.","UP TO 2 DAYS AHEAD: 1. Frost the rose petals.","ON THE DAY: 1. Stack the cakes and decorate with petals once the cakes are in place."]','2026-01-10 12:22:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8782,8782,'en','Cracked black pepper & figgy bread','A fiery hit that goes well with cheese','["650g strong white flour","2 tsp cracked black pepper","2 tsp salt","7g sachet easy blend yeast","2 tbsp olive oil","425-450ml/¾ pint-16fl oz warm water","350g dried, ready-to-eat figs, roughly chopped"]','["In a large bowl, stir together the flour, pepper, salt and yeast. Stir in the olive oil and enough warm water to form a soft dough. Turn out onto a lightly floured surface and knead for 10 mins until smooth and elastic.","Put the dough in a lightly oiled, large bowl. Cover with oiled cling film and leave in a warm place for about 1 hr or until doubled in size. Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. When the dough has risen, knead it again to incorporate the figs, by pushing the dough and lightly kneading them in. Don’t overwork the dough; it can look quite rough.","Shape the dough into a rough oval and put on a lightly floured baking sheet. Using scissors, slash the top of the loaf and sprinkle over a little flour. Leave it to rise again, uncovered, until slightly swelled, about 10-15 mins (if the kitchen is warm). Bake for 40-45 mins until it sounds hollow when you tap it underneath, then cool on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:22:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8783,8783,'en','Tahini dressing','Forget shop-bought and make a homemade tahini dressing. Creamy and tangy, it will bring salads to life. It will keep chilled for up to five days','["4 pitted dates , roughly chopped","1 tbsp tahini","1 lemon , juiced","1 small garlic clove","½ tsp ground cumin","75ml neutral-tasting oil , such as vegetable"]','["Put the pitted dates in a heatproof bowl. Pour over 150ml boiling water to cover. Leave to soak for 20 mins until softened, then tip into a blender with the water from the bowl, tahini, lemon juice, garlic clove, ground cumin and neutral-tasting oil. Blitz until smooth, adding more water if needed to make it drizzly. Season to taste. Will keep chilled in an airtight container for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8784,8784,'en','Red onion & rosemary focaccia','This simple, rustic bread makes a great partner to salads and antipasti','["1 batch white bread dough (see ''Goes well with'' recipe below)","5 tbsp olive oil","2 large red onions, sliced","handful rosemary sprigs","1 tsp sea salt flakes"]','["Make the basic dough, adding 2 tbsp olive\r\noil and only a pinch of salt. While the dough\r\nis rising, cook onions in 1 tbsp olive oil for\r\n5 mins until soft, then set aside.","When the dough has risen, knock it back\r\nand stretch it to fit an oiled Swiss roll tin\r\nabout 25 x 35cm. Leave the dough to prove\r\nfor about 20 mins.","Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.\r\nSpread the onions over the dough and\r\nscatter with the rosemary. Press your fingers\r\ninto the dough to make dimples, drizzle the\r\nremaining oil over and scatter over the salt,\r\nthen bake for 30 mins until golden. Leave\r\nto cool, then serve cut or torn into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8786,8786,'en','Olive bread swirls','These delicious savoury rolls make an excellent side dish for a lunch party','["500g strong white flour, plus extra for rolling","1 tsp salt","7g sachet easy-blend dried yeast","6 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil, plus a little for brushing","small bunch of basil","170g pitted black olives (about 200g unpitted weight)","1 garlic clove, crushed","4 tinned anchovies (optional)","50g pitted green olives"]','["In a large bowl, mix the flour, salt,\r\nyeast, 1 tbsp olive oil and 300ml warm\r\nwater, to make a soft dough. Knead by\r\nhand for 10 mins or with the dough hook\r\nin a food processor or mixer for 5 mins.\r\nPut the dough back in the cleaned out\r\nmixing bowl, then cover the bowl with\r\noiled cling film. Leave to rise for an hr\r\nin a warm place until doubled in size.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Discard\r\nany tough basil stalks (leave tender ones\r\non) and put in a mini food processor or\r\nhand blender beaker with the black olives.\r\nAdd 4 tbsp olive oil, the garlic and the\r\nanchovies, if using. Whizz to a rough paste.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nLine a shallow baking tin about 30 x 20cm\r\nwith non-stick paper. On a floured worktop,\r\nroll out the dough to a rectangle roughly\r\n30 x 40cm. Spread the olive paste all over\r\nand arrange the whole green olives in a\r\nline down one of the short edges. Roll\r\nup the dough like a Swiss roll, starting at\r\nthe short olive-encrusted end to make\r\na sausage shape.","Cut the dough into 12 slices, then\r\ncarefully lift each one into the tin, to\r\nmake 4 rows of 3 swirl shapes. Lightly\r\nbrush all over with the remaining olive oil.\r\nLoosely cover with cling film, then leave\r\nto rise for 20 mins or so, until slightly\r\npuffed up and filling the tin. Cook for\r\n20-25 mins until golden, then leave to\r\ncool in the tin."]','2026-01-10 12:22:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8788,8788,'en','Ham & tomato Stromboli','Contains pork – recipe is for non-Muslims onlyThis pizza-style bread will feed a crowd for lunch','["1 batch white bread dough (see ''Goes well with'' recipe below)","6 tbsp good-quality tomato sauce","3 wafer-thin ham slices, torn","100g ball mozzarella, grated","handful basil leaf","1 egg, beaten"]','["Make the dough, leave to rise and\r\nknock back as stated. Heat oven to\r\n200C/fan 180C/gas 6.","On a lightly floured surface, roll the dough\r\nout to a rough rectangle about 40 x 25cm.\r\nSpread the sauce over the dough, leaving\r\na small border, and scatter over the ham,\r\nmozzarella and basil. Tuck the short sides\r\nin and roll up the long side like a Swiss roll.\r\nLift onto a tray, seal-side down, and brush\r\nwith the egg. Bake for 30 mins until puffed\r\nup and golden – don’t worry if there are a\r\nfew cracks. Leave to cool slightly, then serve\r\nsliced on a board."]','2026-01-10 12:22:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8789,8789,'en','Chicken kebabs with homemade flatbreads','Grill spiced chicken shish skewers and wrap in warm flatbreads with a vibrant salad – this is a winning recipe from Matty','["300g plain flour , plus extra for dusting","1 tsp nigella seeds","1 tsp chilli powder","2 tbsp olive oil , plus extra for frying","30g unsalted butter , melted","1 onion , grated","1kg chicken mince","5 garlic cloves , crushed","1 green chilli , deseeded and finely chopped","1 tbsp cumin seeds","1 tbsp ground coriander","1 tsp chilli flakes","1 tbsp sumac","1 tbsp olive oil","200g red cabbage , finely sliced","2 tbsp white wine vinegar","1⁄4 cucumber , finely sliced","1 Little Gem , shredded","3 beef tomatoes","1 red onion , sliced","small handful of parsley","1 lemon , juiced","250g Greek yogurt","1 lemon , juiced","1 tsp sumac"]','["Begin by making the chicken kebabs. Tip the grated onion into a clean tea towel and squeeze out as much water as you can over a sink. Add to a bowl along with the remaining ingredients except the oil, then season with 1 tsp salt and 1 tsp ground black pepper. Mix well until sticky, then divide into four portions. Wet your hands slightly and bring each portion together into a log, then thread onto a large metal skewer. Cover and set aside in the fridge until needed.","For the salad, add the cabbage to a small bowl with the vinegar and season. In a serving bowl, add all the remaining ingredients and season well. For the yogurt dressing, combine all the ingredients, season and set aside until needed.","To make the flatbreads, tip the flour, nigella seeds and chilli powder into a bowl with a large pinch of salt. Pour in the olive oil and 150ml warm water and mix to combine. Bring it together into a ball, then turn out onto a lightly floured work surface. Knead for 5 mins, until the dough is smooth and no longer sticking to your fingers. Divide into 4 even balls and roll each one out on a lightly floured surface into a large, thin circle, around 18cm wide.","Heat a large frying pan over a medium-high heat. Once hot, add a small drizzle of olive oil and spread across the pan. Add the first flatbread to the pan and cook for 2-3 mins on each side, or until it becomes speckled with brown spots. Once cooked, remove to a baking tray, brush one side with the melted butter and repeat with the remaining flatbreads. Keep warm in a low oven.","When ready to cook the chicken, heat the grill to medium-high. Line a large baking tray with foil and add the skewers. Drizzle with the oil and grill for 20-25 mins, turning regularly, until the chicken is cooked through. Use a meat thermometer if you have one to check its cooked through – it should read 70C.","Serve the chicken skewers with the flatbreads, salad and yogurt for people to build their own wraps."]','2026-01-10 12:22:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8790,8790,'en','Sweet potato brownies','Use the natural sugars in sweet potatoes to make fudgy brownies. It’s easy to make the recipe vegan, too – just make sure the dark chocolate and cocoa powder you’re using are dairy-free','["2 (about 400g) sweet potatoes , halved","125g almond butter","100g maple syrup","25g cocoa powder , sifted","50g plain flour","½ tsp baking powder","25g chopped almonds (optional)","100g dark chocolate , roughly chopped (dairy-free if necessary)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line a 20cm square baking tin with baking parchment and set aside. Put the sweet potato halves in a different baking tin or tray and roast for 40-50 mins until softened. Leave to cool, then put in a food processor and blitz until smooth.","Reduce the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tip the sweet potato mix into a bowl and combine with all the remaining ingredients, except the almonds and 50g of the dark chocolate. Spoon the batter into the prepared baking tray. Scatter over the almonds, if using, then bake in the oven for 30-40 mins until a skewer comes out with a few crumbs. Leave to cool. Melt the remaining dark chocolate in a heatproof bowl in the microwave for 30 seconds, stirring, then in 10-second blasts until melted. Drizzle over the brownies, then leave to cool before cutting into 12 or 16 pieces. Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8792,8792,'en','Next level triple chocolate brownies','Treat yourself to these melt-in-the-mouth brownies – they’re dense, gooey and flavourful, ideal for Easter or any time you fancy chocolate','["150g unsalted butter","350g dark chocolate (at least 70%), chopped","1 espresso or 30ml very strong coffee","100g rye or plain flour","25g organic cocoa powder","4 eggs , room temperature","300g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp vanilla paste","100g milk chocolate , chopped","100g white chocolate , chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 20 x 20cm baking tin with baking parchment, leaving some overhang. Put the dark chocolate, butter and coffee in a heatproof bowl and set over a saucepan of barely simmering water ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Stir until smooth, then set aside to cool slightly. This can also be done in short bursts in the microwave, stirring between each burst. In a separate bowl, mix together the rye flour, cocoa powder and ½ tsp sea salt.","Using a stand mixer or electric hand whisk, beat together the eggs, sugar and vanilla for 5 mins until thick, pale, and doubled in volume. Gradually fold in the cooled melted chocolate mixture, being careful to retain as much air as possible. Gently sift the dry ingredients over the batter and fold in until just combined. Add two thirds of the chopped milk and white chocolate, and fold through briefly. Scrape the batter into the tin and smooth the top with a spatula, then scatter over the rest of the chocolate chunks and push them into the top slightly with the spatula. Bake for 30 mins or until the edges are set but the middle still has a slight wobble. Remove from the oven and scatter with a little flaky sea salt.","Let the brownies cool completely in the tin, then lift them out using the paper. If you want them super-gooey and soft in the middle, serve them at room temperature, but if you want them fudgy, chill in the fridge – either way they will cut into nine generous squares or 16 smaller pieces. Store in an airtight container at room temperature for up to three days, or in the fridge to go fudgy for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:22:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8794,8794,'en','Easy gooey brownies','Know the secret to gooey brownies? Don’t overcook them, and dot through caramel or chocolates filled with liquid caramel or ganache to help add moisture','["150g butter","75g light soft brown sugar","150g plain chocolate, broken into pieces","1 tbsp golden syrup","3 eggs","125g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","150g plain flour","½ tsp baking powder","3 tbsp cocoa powder, plus more to dust","4-6 tbsp dulce de leche, caramel or chocolate hazelnut spread"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a 20cm square cake tin with baking parchment. Melt together the butter, brown sugar, chocolate and golden syrup gently on a low heat until it is smooth. Remove the pan from the heat.","Whisktogether the eggs and caster sugar in a large bowl until light and fluffy – this will take a few minutes and is worth doing properly. Add the vanilla extract, then sift over the flour, baking powder and cocoa powder and add the chocolate mixture. Fold everything together quickly and scoop half of the mixture into the tin. Dot over scoops of caramel or chocolate hazelnut spread and then scoop the rest of the brownie mixture over the top. Add more scoops of caramel or chocolate spread, if you like, and bake for 30 mins. The top of the mixture should now be set and slightly cracked looking, but the mixture underneath will still have a slight wobble.","Remove from the oven and allow to cool completely before cutting into squares. Dust the tops with cocoa or icing sugar, if you like, or if serving as a dessert drizzle with more caramel. Will keep for 3 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:22:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8796,8796,'en','Flourless brownies','Serve these flourless brownies warm with ice cream for dessert. They’re easy to make and require just five ingredients, so they’re great for novice bakers','["200g butter, chopped, plus extra for the tin","250g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids), broken into small pieces","225g caster sugar","3 eggs","100g ground almonds"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 4cm-deep, 20 x 20cm square cake tin and line with baking parchment. Melt 200g of the chocolate together with the butter in a large heatproof bowl set over a pan of just simmering water (ensure the bottom of the bowl doesn’t touch the water), stirring occasionally. Remove from the heat and leave to cool for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, whisk the sugar, eggs and a pinch of salt together in a large bowl until pale and foamy – it should look like a frothy milkshake. This will take 2-3 mins with an electric whisk, or about 5-8 mins with a balloon whisk. Pour in the butter and chocolate mixture along with the almonds, then fold everything together until there are no streaks of chocolate. Tip the mixture into the tin, scatter over the rest of the chocolate, and bake for 25 mins, until cooked with a slight wobble in the middle.","Leave to cool for 10 mins, then scoop into bowls and serve warm for a pudding. Alternatively, leave to cool completely in the tin, then cut into squares and store in an airtight tin. Will keep for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8798,8798,'en','Salted chocolate & hazelnut brownies','Chocolate hazelnut spread ensures these moreish brownies have a fudgy centre. Flecked with pecans and sea salt – they''ll be the new go-to brownie recipe','["100g slightly salted butter, cut into small pieces, plus extra for the tin","200g 70% dark chocolate, broken into chunks","150g chocolate and hazelnut spread","3 eggs, beaten","200g golden caster sugar","150g plain flour","100g toasted pecan nuts, roughly chopped","ice cream and caramel sauce, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Butter and line the base and sides of a 20cm square tin. Put the butter, chocolate and chocolate spread in a heatproof bowl and melt over a pan of lightly simmering water. Once melted, stir and set aside to cool a little.","In another bowl, use an electric whisk to beat the eggs and sugar together for 5 mins until light and fluffy. Pour in the chocolate mixture and whisk briefly to combine. Sift in the flour and gently fold through the mixture, then add most of the pecans. Scrape the mixture into the tin and spread out with a spatula. Scatter over the last of the pecans and a good sprinkling of sea salt.","Bake for 30-35 mins until set but a little gooey in the middle. Cool, then cut into squares and serve with ice cream and caramel sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:22:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8800,8800,'en','Easter egg brownies','Loaded with chocolate eggs and chicks, this is the ultimate Easter centrepiece – an ''eggstra'' special treat for afternoon tea or dessert','["185g unsalted butter, cut into small chunks, plus extra for greasing","185g best dark chocolate, broken into pieces","3 large eggs","275g golden caster sugar","85g plain flour","40g cocoa powder","5 fondant filled eggs (we used Cadbury''s creme eggs)","150g mini eggs (we used a mixture of Cadbury''s and Smarties mini eggs)","You will also need a few fluffy chenille Easter chick to decorate (optional)"]','["Put the butter and the chocolate in a medium-sized heatproof bowl and set over a pan of simmering water, stirring occasionally until melted. Alternatively, cover the bowl loosely with cling film and microwave at 30 sec intervals until melted. Leave the melted chocolate mixture to cool to room temperature.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease a 20cm square tin with butter and line with 2 long strips of folded baking paper or foil – one running top to bottom, the other left to right then line the base with a piece of baking paper. The strips will help you lift it out later.","Break the eggs into a large bowl and tip in the caster sugar. With an electric mixer on maximum speed, whisk the eggs and sugar for around 5-8 mins or until they look thick and creamy and have doubled in size.","Pour the cooled chocolate mixture over the egg mixture, then gently fold together.","Sieve the flour and cocoa into the wet ingredients then continue to fold the mixture gently with a spatula just until everything is fully combined, try not to over-mix.","Pour the mixture into the prepared tin and carefully level the mixture with the spatula. Put in the middle of the oven and bake for 20 minutes.","Meanwhile, cut the fondant filled eggs in half and set aside then place the mini eggs into a pestle and mortar. Crush a few of the mini eggs but leave some whole. After 20 mins take the brownie out of the oven and press in the fondant eggs, cut side up. Scatter over half of the mini eggs too then put it back in the oven for a further 5 mins.","Once baked, top with the remaining mini eggs, leave to cool completely then place in the fridge for about 1hr to firm up. Lift it out of the tin using the strips of baking paper and cut into squares to serve. Decorate with little Easter chicks if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8802,8802,'en','Black Forest brownies','These easy-to-make, fudgy brownies, complete with retro decoration, marry a much-loved flavour pairing of cherry and chocolate','["250g unsalted butter, softened at room temperature, plus extra for greasing","1 tbsp instant coffee powder","350g light brown soft sugar","4 medium eggs","75g cocoa powder","100g self-raising flour","1 tsp cherry essence (optional), available from Lakeland","100g dried sour cherries, chopped","200g dark chocolate (60% cocoa solids)","25g unsalted butter, softened at room temperature","50g icing sugar","green food colouring gel","20 glacé cherries, halved"]','["Grease a 30 x 20cm cake tin and line with parchment. Heat oven to 180C/ 160C fan/gas 4. Mix the coffee with 2 tbsp boiling water, then set aside to cool.","Cream the butter and sugar together for about 5 mins until light and fluffy, then add the eggs, one at a time, incorporating well after each addition. In a separate bowl, combine the cocoa powder and the flour. Add in the cherry essence and cooled coffee to the butter mixture, followed by the dry ingredients. Mix well, then fold in the cherries.","Spoon into the prepared tin, level the top with the back of a spoon and bake in the centre of the oven for 30-35 mins or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool completely in the tin.","Once cool, melt the dark chocolate in the microwave or over a pan of simmering water, then spread in an even layer over the top of the brownies.","While the chocolate is setting, mix the butter with the icing sugar and a few drops of green food colouring. Put the buttercream in a piping bag fitted with a writing tip nozzle. Cut the brownies into 20 squares, place two glacé cherry halves on top of each one and use the buttercream to create the cherry stem."]','2026-01-10 12:22:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8804,8804,'en','Hazelnut brownies','Ferrero Rocher chocolates make an indulgent finishing touch to these fudgy chocolate brownie squares studded with chopped nuts','["box of 16 Ferrero Rocher chocolates","250g pack salted butter, plus extra for greasing","250g golden caster sugar","225g light muscovado sugar","100g cocoa powder","4 large eggs","100g self-raising flour","85g ready-chopped hazelnuts","4 tbsp Frangelico or Fratello hazelnut liqueur (or Disaronno)"]','["Unwrap the chocolates, place on a tray and pop in the freezer. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly grease and line the base and sides of a 21-22cm square tin with baking parchment.","Put the butter, sugars and cocoa into your largest saucepan and gently melt together, stirring regularly so the mixture doesn’t catch. Once the sugar granules have just about disappeared, take off the heat, tip into a bowl and leave to cool for 5 mins.","Use a whisk or wooden spoon to beat the eggs, one by one, into the mixture. When they’re completely incorporated and the mixture is smooth and shiny, stir in the flour, hazelnuts and liqueur. Tip the mixture into the prepared tin and bake for 35 mins.","Remove the tin from the oven and use a cutlery knife to mark the top of the brownies into 16 squares (don’t cut through, it’s just as a guide). Use a teaspoon to push a little dent in the centre of each portion and add a frozen Ferrero Rocher chocolate into each dip. Return to the oven for 3 mins, then remove and leave to cool completely.","Once cool, cut into 16 squares. Will keep for 3 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:22:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8806,8806,'en','Microwave peanut butter & jam brownies','Forget microwave mug cakes – if you''re after some serious indulgence in just 15 minutes, this easy chocolate brownie recipe is sure to hit the spot','["75g butter, plus a little extra for greasing","50g peanut butter","1 egg","25g cocoa powder","50g plain flour","100g sugar","few tsp of jam"]','["Add the butter and peanut butter to a microwave-safe bowl and cook on High for 30 secs to melt. Remove from the microwave and stir thoroughly. Allow to cool slightly then add the egg and stir to combine. Grease with butter and line a second microwaveable round dish (about 15cm wide) with cling film. Tip the peanut butter mix into the lined dish then sieve in the cocoa powder and flour and tip in the sugar. Mix gently to form a thick, sticky paste. Smooth the top of the mixture with the back of a large spoon.","Using a teaspoon, make crater-holes in the top of the brownie mixture and fill each generously with jam as it will melt and bubble down when cooked. Pop in the microwave for 3-4 mins on High. Remove and leave to cool for 15 mins (it will carry on cooking as it cools) then enjoy!"]','2026-01-10 12:22:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8808,8808,'en','Black & white brownies','Improve the classic brownie with gooey chocolate batter topped with a creamy cheesecake mixture for a striking marbled effect','["250g butter, plus extra for greasing","200g dark chocolate","50g white chocolate","375g golden caster sugar","5 medium eggs","50g plain flour, plus 1 tbsp","85g cocoa","½  tsp baking powder","200g tub cream cheese"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line a 20 x 30cm tin with baking parchment. Finely chop 150g of the dark chocolate, and roughly chop the remaining dark chocolate and the white chocolate. Put the finely chopped chocolate in a bowl and melt over a small pan of gently simmering water, or in the microwave. Set aside to cool a little.","Put the butter and 350g of the sugar in a bowl, and beat until light and fluffy. Add 4 of the eggs, one at a time, beating well between each addition, then sift in the flour, cocoa, baking powder and a good pinch of salt. Finally, stir in the melted chocolate and the chopped chocolate chunks. Scrape the mixture into the prepared tin and smooth the surface.","Working quickly, tip the cream cheese into a bowl and beat to soften with a spatula. Add the remaining egg, flour and sugar, and mix until just combined. Spoon blobs of the cream cheese mixture onto the brownie until all used up, and use the end of a cutlery knife or a skewer to swirl the 2 mixtures together to create a marbled effect. Bake for 30 mins until just set – it should still have a little wobble when it comes out of the oven, and a skewer inserted into the centre should come out with sticky crumbs. Cool completely in the tin before cutting into squares to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8810,8810,'en','Cherry brownie babycakes','Beautiful individual chocolate brownie cakes with a dollop of softly whipped cream and extra fruit for garnish','["175g butter, chopped, plus extra for greasing","200g dark chocolate, chopped","250g soft light brown sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","85g plain flour","50g cocoa powder, plus a little extra to serve","¼ tsp baking powder","3 large eggs, beaten","200g cherries, halved and stoned, plus 12 with stalks attached, to serve (optional)","double cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter 12 holes of a deep muffin tray and line each hole with a strip of baking parchment – this will help you lift out the brownies later (or line 16 holes of 2 trays with muffin cases). Put the butter, 150g of the chocolate, sugar and vanilla in a heatproof bowl, suspended over a pan of barely simmering water. Heat gently, stirring now and again until melted, then remove from the heat and leave to cool for a few mins. Meanwhile, sift the flour, cocoa, baking powder and a good pinch of salt together in a large bowl.","Add the warm, melted chocolate mixture, the eggs, cherries and the remaining 50g chocolate to the dry ingredients, then mix until just combined. Divide the mixture between the holes of the muffin tray/cases, making sure each one gets a few pieces of cherry. Bake for 18 mins until cooked but still gooey in the centre – they will continue cooking a little as they cool down. Leave to cool for 30 mins in the tin before transferring to a wire rack to cool completely, or eating warm with a dollop of cream, a dusting of cocoa and extra cherries on top, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8812,8812,'en','Vegan cherry & almond brownies','Deeply rich and decadent, this dairy- and egg-free chocolate bake makes an indulgent vegan treat','["80g vegan margarine, plus extra for greasing","2 tbsp ground flaxseeds","120g dark chocolate","½  tsp coffee granules","125g self-raising flour","70g ground almonds","50g cocoa powder","¼ tsp baking powder","250g golden caster sugar","1½  tsp vanilla extract","70g glacé cherries (rinsed and halved)"]','["Heat oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 31?2. Grease and line a 20cm square tin with baking parchment. Combine the flaxseed with 6 tbsp water and set aside for at least 5 mins.","In a saucepan, melt the chocolate, coffee and margarine with 60ml water on a low heat. Allow to cool slightly.","Put the flour, almonds, cocoa, baking powder and 1?4 tsp salt in a bowl and stir to remove any lumps. Using a hand whisk, mix the sugar into the melted chocolate mixture, and beat well until smooth and glossy, ensuring all the sugar is well dissolved. Stir in the flaxseed mixture and vanilla extract, the cherries and then the flour mixture. It will now be very thick. Stir until combined and spoon into the prepared tin. Bake for 35-45 mins until a skewer inserted in the middle comes out clean with moist crumbs. Allow to cool in the tin completely, then cut into squares. Store in an airtight container and eat within 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8814,8814,'en','Chocolate gingerbread brownie bars with fudgy icing','These luxurious bars are based on a classic flourless cake, so they''re rich and light in equal measure','["400g dark chocolate, broken into chunks","25g cocoa powder","250g golden caster sugar","250g butter","1 tbsp ground ginger","140g ground almonds","6 large eggs, separated","100g butter, cubed","50g dark chocolate, use a bar broken into pieces, or chips","50g cocoa","200g icing sugar, sifted","2 tbsp ground ginger","few chunks crystallised ginger, chopped into small pieces"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease a 20 x 30cm cake tin, and line the base and sides with baking parchment. Melt the chocolate, cocoa, sugar and butter together in a saucepan over a very low heat. Once the chocolate and butter have melted and sugar dissolved, remove from the heat and stir in the ginger and almonds, followed by the egg yolks, one at a time.","Beat the egg whites to stiff peaks. Using a metal spoon, stir a couple of spoonfuls of the egg whites into the chocolate mixture to loosen before very gently folding in the rest.","Gently scrape into the tin. Bake for 30-35 mins until the top looks set and the centre doesn’t wobble too much. Sit the cake tin on a wire rack and leave to cool completely.","Once cool, make the icing. Put the butter, chocolate, cocoa, icing sugar, ground ginger and 4 tbsp water in a pan. Gently heat, stirring, until you have a smooth icing. Pour over the cake (still in its tin), leave for 1-2 mins to cool slightly, then scatter over the ginger. Cool completely (you can also store in the fridge if you bring out to room temperature about 20 mins before serving) before cutting into bars."]','2026-01-10 12:22:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8816,8816,'en','Fudgy chocolate squares','These deeply chocolatey squidgy sponge squares are gluten-free – try served as a dessert with ice cream','["200g butter, chopped","200g gluten-free dark chocolate, roughly chopped","350g golden caster sugar","50g gluten-free self-raising flour blend","50g ground almonds","50g cocoa","1 tsp xanthan gum","4 large eggs, beaten","50g walnuts, broken or roughly chopped","100g butter, chopped","2 heaped tbsp cocoa","200g icing sugar, sifted","2 tbsp milk","50g walnuts, broken or roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4\r\nand line a 20 x 30cm brownie tin with\r\nbaking parchment. Tip the butter and\r\nchocolate into a non-stick saucepan and\r\nmelt over a low heat, stirring every now\r\nand then, until smooth – take care not to\r\noverheat it. Leave to cool.","Meanwhile, mix the sugar, flour, cocoa\r\nand almonds with the xanthan gum. Stir\r\ninto the chocolate mixture, then beat in\r\nthe eggs and add the walnuts. Turn the\r\nmixture into the tin, level with a spatula\r\nand bake for 30-35 mins until firm and\r\njust cooked – when tested with a skewer,\r\nthe crumb should still be a little moist.\r\nCool in the tin.","To make the icing, melt the butter in a\r\nnon-stick pan. Stir in the cocoa and cook,\r\nstirring, for about 1 min. Add the icing\r\nsugar and milk, and beat well. Pour on\r\ntop of the cooled cake, scatter with the\r\nwalnuts and lightly press them in. Leave\r\nuntil set, then carefully remove from the\r\ntin, strip off the baking parchment and\r\ncut into squares. Will keep for several\r\ndays in a tin."]','2026-01-10 12:22:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8818,8818,'en','Easy brownies','A gooey and delicious treat, these brownies are so easy to make. Try the rich chocolate topping for an even more decadent bake','["375g good-quality dark chocolate","375g butter, cut into pieces","6 medium eggs","500g caster sugar","225g plain flour","140g good-quality dark chocolate","50g butter, cut into pieces","icing sugar for dusting"]','["Butter and line a 30cm x 21cm tin. Preheat\r\nthe oven to fan 160/conventional 180/gas 4.\r\nBreak up the chocolate with the butter and\r\nmelt in the microwave on Medium for about\r\n5 minutes, stirring halfway through.","Beat the sugar and eggs in a bowl. Stir in\r\nthe melted chocolate, add the flour and beat\r\nwell. Pour into the tin and bake for 40-45\r\nminutes, or until the top looks papery and\r\nfeels slightly wobbly. Leave to cool in the tin.","Break up the chocolate with the butter\r\nand melt in the microwave on Medium for\r\nabout 1 minute. Stir until smooth then\r\nspread over the cake. Dust with icing sugar\r\nand cut into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8820,8820,'en','Cranberry-pistachio brownies','Moist, fruity and nutty – what more could you want from a brownie? Ready in under an hour','["200g butter, diced, plus extra for greasing","2 x 150g bars plain chocolate (about 40% cocoa solids is fine)","280g light muscovado sugar","4 tbsp cranberry juice or milk","4 medium eggs","200g plain flour","½ tsp ground cinnamon","1 x 75g pack dried cranberries","100g pistachios, sliced","icing sugar to dust, optional"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter a non-stick baking tin (about 31 x 17 x 3.5cm) or line the base if you prefer. Break the chocolate into a saucepan, add the butter, sugar and juice or milk, then warm gently, stirring frequently until melted and evenly mixed. Allow to cool slightly, then beat in the eggs one at a time. Fold in the flour, cinnamon and cranberries.","Spread half the mixture into the prepared tin, scatter over the nuts, then gently spread the rest of the mixture on top. Bake for 25-30 mins. Cut into squares while still warm. Will keep in an airtight container for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:22:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8822,8822,'en','Peanut butter brownies','Two of our favourite things – peanut butter and brownies – combine to make these irresistible treats','["225g crunchy peanut butter","200g bar dark chocolate, broken into pieces","280g soft light brown sugar","3 medium eggs","100g self-raising flour"]','["Set aside 50g each of the peanut butter\r\nand chocolate. Heat oven to 180C/160C\r\nfan/gas 4 and line a 20cm square baking\r\ntin with baking parchment. Gently melt\r\nremaining peanut butter, chocolate and\r\nall the sugar in a pan, stirring occasionally,\r\nuntil the sugar has just about melted.\r\nTurn off heat and use a wooden spoon\r\nto beat in the eggs one by one. Stir in the\r\nflour and scrape into the tin.","Melt reserved peanut butter in the\r\nmicrowave on High for 45 secs, or in\r\na pan, until runny, then drizzle over the\r\nbrownie. Bake for 30-35 mins until it\r\nhas a crust, but the middle still seems\r\nslightly uncooked.","Melt reserved chocolate, drizzle over\r\nthe brownie, then cool in the tin before\r\ncutting into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8823,8823,'en','Best ever chocolate raspberry brownies','Squidgy and super moreish, these gorgeous foolproof fruity chocolate bakes will be snapped up in seconds','["200g dark chocolate, broken into chunks","100g milk chocolate, broken into chunks","250g pack salted butter","400g soft light brown sugar","4 large eggs","140g plain flour","50g cocoa powder","200g raspberries"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLine a 20 x 30cm baking tray tin with\r\nbaking parchment. Put the chocolate,\r\nbutter and sugar in a pan and gently\r\nmelt, stirring occasionally with a\r\nwooden spoon. Remove from the heat.","Stir the eggs, one by one, into the\r\nmelted chocolate mixture. Sieve over\r\nthe flour and cocoa, and stir in. Stir\r\nin half the raspberries, scrape into the\r\ntray, then scatter over the remaining\r\nraspberries. Bake on the middle shelf\r\nfor 30 mins or, if you prefer a firmer\r\ntexture, for 5 mins more. Cool before\r\nslicing into squares.Store in an airtight\r\ncontainer for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8825,8825,'en','The ultimate makeover: chocolate brownies','Angela gives these rich treats a makeover, with a magic ingredient to reduce the fat content…','["85g dark chocolate, 70% cocoa solids, chopped into small pieces","85g plain flour","25g cocoa powder","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","100g golden caster sugar","50g light muscovado sugar","½ tsp coffee granules","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp buttermilk","1 egg","100g mayonnaise (I used Hellman''s)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.\r\nPour enough water into a small pan to\r\none-third fill it. Bring to the boil, then\r\nremove the pan from the heat. Put the\r\nchopped chocolate into a large bowl\r\nthat will fit snugly over the pan without\r\ntouching the water. Sit the pan over the\r\nwater (still off the heat) and leave the\r\nchocolate to melt slowly for a few mins,\r\nstirring occasionally until it has melted\r\nevenly. Remove the bowl from the pan,\r\nthen let the chocolate cool slightly.","Meanwhile, lightly oil and base-line a\r\n19cm square cake tin that is 5cm deep.\r\nCombine the flour, cocoa and bicarbonate\r\nof soda. Using a wooden spoon, stir both\r\nthe sugars into the cooled chocolate\r\nwith the coffee, vanilla and buttermilk.\r\nStir in 1 tbsp warm water. Break and beat\r\nin the egg, then stir in the mayonnaise\r\njust until smooth and glossy. Sift over\r\nthe flour and cocoa mix, then gently\r\nfold in with a spatula without overmixing.","Pour the mixture into the tin, then\r\ngently and evenly spread it into the\r\ncorners. Bake for 30 mins. When a\r\nskewer is inserted into the middle, it\r\nshould come out with just a few moist\r\ncrumbs sticking to it. If cooked too long,\r\nthe mix will dry out; not long enough\r\nand it can sink. Leave in the tin until\r\ncompletely cold, then loosen the sides\r\nwith a round-bladed knife. Turn out onto\r\na board, peel off the lining paper and cut\r\ninto 12 squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8827,8827,'en','Fudgy coconut brownies','Dense and gooey, these storecupboard treats are made with cocoa rather than bars of chocolate','["100g cocoa","250g butter","500g golden caster sugar","4 eggs, beaten","100g self-raising flour","100g desiccated coconut","icing sugar, to dust (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLine the base of a 21cm square tin with\r\nbaking parchment. Put the cocoa, butter\r\nand sugar in your largest saucepan and\r\ngently melt, stirring so the mixture doesn’t\r\ncatch. When the cocoa mixture is melted\r\nand combined, cool slightly, then stir in\r\nthe eggs, little by little, followed by the\r\nflour and coconut.","Tip into the tin and bake for 45 mins\r\non a middle shelf – check after 30 mins\r\nand cover with another piece of baking\r\nparchment if the crust is browning too\r\nmuch. Cool in the tin, then carefully lift\r\nout and cut into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8829,8829,'en','Chocolate brownie chunks with chocolate dip','Pop thesetiny temptations into a low oven to warmthrough quickly before serving','["200g dark chocolate, broken into chunks","100g milk chocolate, broken into chunks","85g butter","100g light muscovado sugar","85g dark muscovado sugar","3 eggs, at room temperature and lightly beaten","140g plain flour","140g walnuts, roughly chopped","200ml natural yogurt"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 6 and line\r\nthe base of a 20cm square shallow baking\r\ntin with baking parchment. Melt 100g dark\r\nchocolate, all of the milk chocolate and the\r\nbutter in a heatproof bowl over a pan of\r\nsimmering water. Remove from the heat,\r\nthen stir in the sugars. Cool a little while you\r\nprepare the rest of the ingredients.","Stir the eggs into the chocolate mixture,\r\nfollowed by the flour, walnuts and a pinch\r\nof salt until really well combined. Pour the\r\nmixture into the prepared tin, then bake for\r\n25-30 mins until an inserted skewer comes\r\nout with sticky crumbs. Cool in the tin.","For the dip, gently melt the remaining\r\nchocolate as above, then stir into the yogurt\r\nand chill. To serve, cut the brownies into\r\nchunks, then spoon the dip into small bowls."]','2026-01-10 12:22:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8831,8831,'en','Chocolate, cranberry & macadamia brownies','Leftover cranberry sauce? Use it as an excuse to make these delicious chocolate, nutty cake squares','["150g dark chocolate, broken into chunks","200g butter","200g soft brown sugar","150g self-raising flour","40g cocoa powder, sifted","3 large eggs, beaten","50g dried cranberries","100g macadamia nuts","60g cranberry sauce"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/ 160C fan/ gas 4 and line a 20cm x 20cm baking tin with baking parchment. Melt  the dark chocolate with the butter in the microwave or in a heatproof bowl over just simmering water.","Mix together the sugar, flour and cocoa powder and stir in the melted chocolate and butter mixture, followed by the eggs. Stir through the dried cranberries and macadamia nuts, then swirl through the cranberry sauce.","Pour into the tin and smooth the surface. Bake for 25 - 30 mins. Allow to cool before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:22:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8833,8833,'en','Next level lemon drizzle','Take the humble lemon drizzle to new heights with this next level recipe. Whether it’s for a bake sale or celebration, it’s sure to be a crowd-pleaser','["350g butter , softened","350g golden caster sugar","6 medium eggs","350g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","2 tbsp milk","1 tsp vanilla bean paste or extract","3 unwaxed lemons , zested and juiced","150g granulated sugar , plus a little extra to serve","300ml double cream","50g icing sugar , sifted","½ tsp vanilla extract","4 tbsp lemon curd"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line the base of three 20cm tins with baking parchment – if you don’t have three, line as many as you have and bake in batches. Beat the butter and caster sugar together using an electric whisk for 3 mins until smooth and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well between each addition and scraping down the sides of the bowl. Fold in the flour and baking powder until well combined, then fold in the milk, vanilla and zest from 2½ lemons. Divide the batter between the tins, then bake for 30-35 mins, or until golden and a skewer inserted into the middle of the sponges comes out clean (or when a probe thermometer reads 90C).","Meanwhile, make the drizzle. Combine the lemon juice and granulated sugar in a bowl. Leave the sponges to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then invert two onto a wire rack set over a baking tray, flat-side up. Put the third on the rack domed-side up. Spoon the drizzle over the sponges, then leave to cool completely.","For the filling, beat the cream, icing sugar and vanilla together using an electric whisk until thick and spreadable. Put one cool sponge, flat-side up, on a serving plate or stand. Spread over half the filling, then drizzle over half the lemon curd. Top with a second sponge, flat-side up, and repeat with the remaining filling and curd. Top with the final sponge, domed-side up. Sprinkle over the remaining lemon zest and a little granulated sugar. Serve straightaway, or leave at room temperature for 1 hr. Will keep chilled for up to 24 hrs (remove from the fridge 30 mins before serving)."]','2026-01-10 12:22:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8835,8835,'en','Swiss meringue buttercream','Fill your cakes with a silky smooth meringue buttercream. This recipe makes enough to fill and ice a three-tier cake, and it’s easily halved for smaller bakes','["300g egg whites","600g caster sugar","800g unsalted butter, softened","1 tsp vanilla extract"]','["Put the egg whites and caster sugar in a heatproof bowl and place over a pan of barely simmering water, making sure the water doesn’t touch the bottom of the bowl. Gently stir for a few minutes until you can no longer feel any grains of sugar between your fingers when you touch it. Transfer to the bowl of astand mixerfitted with the whisk attachment.","Whisk on medium speed until the mixture becomes meringue-like and has reached stiff peaks, about 3 mins. (You could use an electric whisk, but it will take considerably longer, around 35 mins.) Add the butter 1 tbsp at a time, whisking to combine before the next addition. It may look curdled and soupy but be patient and keep whisking until you have a smooth, fluffy buttercream. Whisk in the vanilla. If using this buttercream to ice a cake, change to the paddle attachment and set it on a low speed for a few minutes – this helps remove air bubbles from the icing and makes for a smoother finish to your cake. If you like, you can also add melted chocolate, freeze-dried fruit powder, malt extract or other flavourings."]','2026-01-10 12:22:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8837,8837,'en','Gooseberry buckle cake','Got a glut of homegrown gooseberries? Showcase them at their very best in this glorious cake, with a sponge base, gooseberry filling and crumble topping','["200g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","200g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 eggs","200g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","50g ground almonds","100ml soured cream","60g plain flour","50g cold unsalted butter, cut into cubes","60g golden caster sugar","60g porridge oats","25g flaked almonds","500g fresh or frozen gooseberries (see tip below; a mixture of green and pink if available)","2 tbsp caster sugar"]','["For the filling, combine the gooseberries and sugar in a bowl, lightly crushing the berries. Set aside to macerate.","To make the crumble topping, rub the flour and butter together in a small bowl until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Stir in the sugar, oats and almonds, and bring together into a loose dough using your hands. Chill for at least 30 mins, or up to a day.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 23cm loose-bottom cake tin and line with baking parchment. Beat the butter, sugar and vanilla together using astand mixeror electric whisk until light and fluffy. Beat in the eggs, one at a time, adding a spoonful of flour in between each addition to prevent the mixture from curdling. Fold in the rest of the flour, the baking powder, ground almonds and soured cream to combine. Spoon into the tin, followed by the gooseberry filling. Scatter the crumble topping over the surface to cover the filling and bake for 1 hr-1 hr 10 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. If the cake brown too quickly, cover it with foil for the final 15 mins. Leave to cool completely in the tin, then chill until just cold to make slicing easier.Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8839,8839,'en','Blueberry cake','Bake this simple blueberry cake when you’re craving something sweet. This easy, fruity bake uses natural yogurt to keep the sponge moist and squidgy','["1 tsp butter","400g frozen blueberries","335g flour, plus a spoonful for berries","275g caster sugar","2 eggs","165ml vegetable oil","2 tbsp lemon zest","65ml lemon juice","250ml thick natural yogurt","4 tsp baking powder"]','["Preheat the oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Butter a 22cm cake tin, line the bottom with baking parchment. Put a third of the frozen blueberries aside, sprinkle the rest with flour, set aside (do not defrost).","In a large bowl, beat the sugar and eggs until smooth, add the vegetable oil, lemon zest and juice and yogurt. Combine the wet ingredients with the flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt using a whisk. Don’t worry if a few lumps remain. Add the blueberries mixed with flour.","Pour the cake mixture into the prepared tin. Sprinkle the remaining berries on top. Put the tin in the oven, reduce the temperature to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Bake for 1 hr 10 mins-1hr 20 mins or until a skewer inserted into the cake comes out clean. Remove from oven and set aside to cool. After removing from the baking tin, sprinkle the cake with icing sugar, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8841,8841,'en','Classic carrot cake','Perfect a classic with our next level carrot cake recipe. It’s been meticulously tested so you can bake the best version of this traditional cake','["vegetable oil, for the tins","200g butter, softened","200g light muscovado sugar","4 eggs","150g self-raising flour","50g rye or spelt flour (optional – use a total of 200g self-raising flour if you prefer)","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp ground cinnamon","¼ tsp mixed spice","250g (about 3 medium) carrots, trimmed and coarsely grated","75g raisins or sultanas","75g light muscovado sugar","100g pecans","150g butter, softened","150g icing sugar","340g full-fat soft cheese","½ lemon, zested"]','["For the praline, line abaking traywith baking parchment, then tip the sugar into a saucepan with 1 tbsp water. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for 1-2 mins until the sugar starts to caramelise. Scatter in the pecans and a pinch of sea salt, and stir until the nuts are fully coated. Carefully scrape the hot pecan mix onto the tray and leave to set for at least 10 mins. Break about 12 whole pecans out of the praline and reserve for decorating later, then chop or smash the rest of the praline into small shards. Set aside.Will keep in an airtight container for a day.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil two 20cm round sandwich tins and line with baking parchment. Tip the butter and sugar into a bowl and beat using an electricwhiskfor 3 mins until light and fluffy, then beat in the eggs, one at a time – or do this using a stand mixer. When the eggs are incorporated, fold in the flours, bicarb, spices and a pinch of salt, followed by the carrots, raisins and half of the smashed praline.","Divide the batter between the tins and level the surface with aspatula. Bake for 25-30 mins until the sponges are springy and a skewer inserted into the middle of each comes out clean. Cool in the tins for 10 mins, then put on a wire rack to cool fully.Will keep wrapped overnight.","To make the icing, beat the butter and sugar using an electric whisk until smooth. Add half the soft cheese and lemon zest and beat again, then add the remaining and beat until smooth.","To assemble, place one sponge, flat-side up, on a cake stand or plate and spread with a third of the icing. Scatter with most of the remaining smashed praline, then top with the other sponge, also flat-side up. Spread the rest of the icing over the top and sides, then decorate with the whole praline pecans. Chill for 1 hr to set, then slice and serve with any remaining smashed praline for sprinkling over.Will keep in an airtight tin for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8843,8843,'en','Jaffa cakes','Take the classic snack of jaffa cakes to another level by making a homemade version with marmalade-spiked orange jelly and rich dark chocolate','["butter, for the tin","1 egg","2 tbsp caster sugar","2 tbsp self-raising flour","1 orange, zested","125g dark chocolate","135g pack orange jelly, cut into cubes (ensure vegetarian, if needed)","1 tbsp orange marmalade (optional)","1-2 oranges, juiced (you’ll need 50ml juice)"]','["First, make the orange jelly. Put the jelly cubes and marmalade (if using) in a medium heatproof bowl. Pour in the orange juice and 100ml boiling water, then stir until the jelly cubes have dissolved. Pour the mix into a shallow baking tray (ours was 25 x 20cm) lined with cling film – it should come about ½cm up the side. Chill for 2 hrs or overnight until set.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and butter a shallow 12-hole cupcake tin. Tip the egg and sugar into a bowl and beat with an electricwhiskfor 5 mins until pale and fluffy. Or, do this in a stand mixer. Sift over the flour, add the orange zest and fold gently until there are no more pockets of flour. Spoon 1 tbsp into each hole of the tin and gently spread to the edges using the back of the spoon. Bake for 8-9 mins until the sponge is golden and a skewer comes out clean. Cool in the tin for 2 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","Invert the set jelly onto a board, remove the cling film and stamp out discs using a 5cm round cutter. Flip the sponges over so the flat side is facing up, then top each with a jelly disc. Tip the chocolate into a heatproof bowl and melt in short bursts in themicrowave, or set the bowl over a pan of simmering water ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Spoon 1-2 tsp of the melted chocolate over each disc of jelly, spreading it gently to cover. Leave to set for 2-3 mins, then gently press the tines of a fork into the chocolate. Leave to set for 1 hr before serving.Will keep for up to three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:22:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8845,8845,'en','Easter traybake','Make this easy Easter-themed traybake with the kids. It features a chocolate sponge covered in fudge icing then decorated with Easter sweets and treats','["150ml sunflower oil, plus extra for the tin","165g golden caster sugar","2 eggs","150ml milk","165g self-raising flour","3 tbsp cocoa powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","100g milk or dark chocolate, chopped (either a chocolate bar or Easter egg, broken up)","100g butter, softened","100g icing sugar","100g Easter treats (chocolate eggs, sweets, chocolate bar pieces)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil and line a traybake tin, about 20 x 30cm, and 5cm deep. Put the oil, sugar, eggs and milk in a bowl andwhiskuntil well combined. Sieve over the flour, cocoa and bicarb, and stir briefly until combined. Pour the mixture into the tin, and bake for 20-25 mins until the cake is well risen and springs back when pressed. Transfer to awire rackand leave to cool completely.","Melt the chocolate in a bowl set over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the bowl doesn''t touch the water, or in short blasts in the microwave until melted. Leave to cool for a few minutes.","Beat the butter and icing sugar together until pale and fluffy, then drizzle in the chocolate and beat again until smooth and uniform in colour. Swirl the icing over the top of the cake, with a few peaks and swirls to decorate. Scatter with the Easter treats to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8847,8847,'en','Vegan vanilla cupcakes','Bake these vegan versions of vanilla cupcakes for a sweet treat. They’re ideal served with a cuppa for a mid-morning treat or for afternoon tea','["50ml rapeseed oil","1 tsp cider vinegar","200ml plant milk (we used oat)","225g self-raising flour","½ tsp baking powder","150g golden caster sugar","2 tsp vanilla paste","200g vegan plant butter block, softened","2 tsp vanilla paste","400g icing sugar"]','["Combine the rapeseed oil, cider vinegar and oat milk in a jug. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a 12-hole cupcake or muffin tray with paper cases. Tip the flour, baking powder and sugar into a large bowl. Make a well in the middle and slowly pour in the wet mixture,whiskingconstantly. Add the vanilla paste and stir to combine. Divide evenly between the paper cases and bake for 15-20 mins until golden and a skewer inserted into the middle of a cupcake comes out clean. Transfer to acooling rackto cool completely.","For the icing, beat the plant block and vanilla until soft and creamy, around 2 mins. Add the icing sugar in batches, beating well after each addition, and a large pinch of salt. Transfer to apiping bagfitted with a star nozzle. Pipe swirls on top of each cooled cupcake.Will keep, iced, for up to three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:22:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8849,8849,'en','Vegan courgette cake','Use up a glut of courgettes and bake this vegan loaf cake with tangy lemon drizzle. Ideal for a coffee morning or afternoon tea','["80g vegan butter block, softened, plus extra for the tin","175g golden caster sugar","2 lemons, zested, 1 juiced","100ml plant milk (we used oat)","100g ground almonds","175g self-raising flour","½ tsp baking powder","175g courgettes, coarsely grated","200g icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 900g loaf tin. Beat together the vegan butter block, sugar and lemon zest until combined. Add the plant milk and beat slowly to combine. Add the ground almonds, flour and baking powder, along with the grated courgette, and stir to combine. Spoon the batter into the prepared tin (it will be quite thick) and level the top. Bake for 55-60 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Transfer to awire rackand leave to cool completely in the tin.","To make the icing, sieve the icing sugar into a bowl and add 1 tbsp of the lemon juice and stir to combine. Add a little more lemon juice if needed, ½ tsp at a time, until you reach your desired consistency. Remove the cake from the tin and drizzle over the icing, allowing it to drip down the sides. Leave to set for 20-30 mins. Cut into slices to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8851,8851,'en','Chocolate orange baked cheesecake','Make a dessert that’s the talk of the party with this creamy, rich chocolate orange cheesecake','["225g gingernuts or digestives","115g unsalted butter, melted","1 orange, zested","candied orange slices, to serve (optional)","600g full-fat soft cheese","3 eggs, plus 2 egg yolks (freeze the extra white for another recipe)","175g double cream","175g light brown soft sugar","350g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids), roughly chopped, plus extra to serve","3 oranges, zested"]','["For the filling, take the soft cheese, eggs and double cream out of the fridge to come to room temperature 1 hr before you begin. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line the base of a 23cm springform cake tin with baking parchment: unclip the ring, lay the parchment over the base and clip the ring back. This will ensure there is no lip on the bottom of the finished cheesecake.","Tip the gingernuts into afood processorand blitz to a fine crumb. Add the melted butter and orange zest, then blitz briefly until the crumbs are coated. Tip the mixture into the prepared tin and press into an even layer using the back of a spoon. Bake for 10-15 mins until the base is slightly crisped up.","Beat the soft cheese and light brown sugar together until creamy using an electric whisk. Whisk in the whole eggs, the egg yolks and cream until smooth. Tip the dark chocolate into a heatproof bowl and melt in themicrowavein 20-second bursts, or do this in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Leave to cool until warm to the touch. Slowly pour the melted chocolate over the soft cheese mixture, whisking continuously until combined. Stir in the orange zest, reserving the oranges.","Tightly wrap the bottom of the cake tin in foil to prevent leaking, then sit it in a deep roasting tin. Pour the cheesecake filling over the biscuit base. Put the roasting tin in the oven, then pour enough hot water into the roasting tin to come 2½cm up the side of the cake tin. Bake for 1 hr-1 hr 15 mins until the edge of the cheesecake is set, but the centre has a slight wobble (it will continue to set in the fridge).","Put the cake tin on a wire rack, then run a small, sharpknifearound the edge to loosen. Remove the foil and leave to cool completely in the tin, then chill for at least 6 hrs in the fridge before removing to a plate. Segment the reserved oranges, avoiding the pith, and use these to decorate the top along with a grating of dark chocolate and candied orange slices, if you like.Will keep covered in the fridge for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8853,8853,'en','White chocolate & raspberry ripple baked cheesecake','Swirl sharp raspberry purée through a creamy white chocolate and vanilla cheesecake filling for a perfectly-balanced dessert. It’s ideal for a special occasion','["225g digestive biscuits","15g freeze-dried raspberries (optional)","115g butter, melted","250g fresh or frozen raspberries","½ lemon, juiced","175g caster sugar, plus 2 tsp","600g full-fat soft cheese","3 large eggs, plus 2 egg yolks","175g double cream","1 tbsp vanilla bean paste","350g white chocolate"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4, and line the base of a 23cm springform cake tin with baking parchment. Tip the biscuits and freeze-dried raspberries, if using, into afood processor, and blitz to fine crumbs. Pulse in the butter to coat the crumbs, then tip the mixture into the prepared tin and press into an even layer using the back of a spoon. Chill until needed.","For the filling, put the raspberries, lemon juice and 2 tsp caster sugar in apanover a medium heat. Cook for 4-5 mins until the berries have softened and become juicy. Transfer to a food processor and blitz until smooth. Tip into a bowl and leave to cool. If you prefer a smooth purée, sieve the mixture through a fine mesh sieve and discard the pips.","Beat the soft cheese using an electricwhiskuntil loosened, then whisk in 175g sugar, the eggs, yolks, cream and vanilla until smooth. Melt the white chocolate in a heatproof bowl in themicrowavein 20-second bursts, or over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the bottom of the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Slowly pour a third of the sweetened soft cheese mixture into the melted chocolate, whisking continuously until combined, then pour that into the rest of the soft cheese mixture. Whisk until fully combined.","Remove the tin from the fridge, and tightly wrap the bottom of the tin with foil to prevent any leaking. Sit the tin in a deep roasting tin. Pour the cheesecake mixture over the biscuit base. Spoon over the raspberry purée, and swirl it into the cheesecake mix using a skewer.","Put the roasting tin in the oven, then pour enough hot water into the roasting tin to come 2½cm up the side of the cake tin. Bake for 1 hr 15 mins-1 hr 30 mins, or until the edge of the cheesecake is set, but the centre has a slight wobble (it will continue to set in the fridge).","Put the tin on a wire rack, then run a small, sharp knife around the edge. Leave to cool completely in the tin, then chill for at least 6 hrs before removing from the tin."]','2026-01-10 12:22:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8855,8855,'en','Sweet potato cheesecake','Layer maple syrup, spiced sweet potato and cool cream cheese on a crushed digestive base to make this dessert. Trust us, it really works','["100g butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","250g digestive biscuits","1 tsp ground cinnamon","300g cream cheese","50g icing sugar","1 vanilla pod, seeds only","150ml double cream","350g sweet potato, cooked, blitzed to a purée and cooled","150ml double cream","1-2 tsp mixed spice","3 tbsp maple syrup, plus extra to serve","caramel popcorn, to serve"]','["Butter and line a 20cm loose-bottomed tin with baking parchment. Blitz the biscuits in afood processorwith the cinnamon, then pour in the melted butter. Mix well to coat all the biscuit crumbs, then press into the lined tin to create an even base. Put in the fridge to set for about 1 hr.","To make the cream cheese filling, beat the cream cheese with the icing sugar and vanilla until light, then add the double cream and beat until well mixed and thickened. Spoon this onto the biscuit base, smoothing across the surface and ensuring no air bubbles remain. Smooth with the back of a spoon orspatulaand put in the fridge to set for 3 hrs.","For the topping, beat the sweet potato, cream and mixed spice together until thickened. Carefully spoon this onto the cream cheese layer, once again using the back of a spoon or a spatula to smooth across the surface and ensure no air bubbles remain. Leave to set in the fridge overnight. Drizzle over the maple syrup, then sprinkle with the caramel popcorn and a pinch of sea salt."]','2026-01-10 12:22:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8857,8857,'en','Twix cookies','Chocolatey, fudgey cookies that are amazing warm from the oven or made into ice cream sandwiches. The ultimate indulgence','["100g butter, at room temperature","120g light brown sugar","1 egg","100g self-raising flour","50g rolled Oats","100g milk chocolate chips","1 tbsp mini fudge pieces","4 x 25g packs Twix bars, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line 2 baking trays with greaseproof baking parchment.","Beat the butter and sugar together in table top mixer until pale and light, then add the egg, flour, oats and a pinch of salt then beat once more.","Stir in the chocolate chips and fudge pieces then dollop rounded dessertspoonfuls of the cookie dough onto your prepared baking trays – you should end up with 12. Gently press pieces of Twix into the top of each mound and bake in the oven for 12-15 mins or until golden brown at the edges.","Leave to cool for a few minutes on the paper then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely. Amazing in ice cream sandwiches!"]','2026-01-10 12:22:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8859,8859,'en','Vegan millionaire’s bars','These vegan, gluten-free chocolatey treats with dates, cashews and maple syrup are just as sticky and moreish as the original Millionaire''s shortbreads','["150g cashew nuts","50g rolled oat","4 Medjool dates, pitted","50g coconut oil, melted","350g pitted Medjool dates","125ml unsweetened almond milk","25ml maple syrup","150g coconut oil","1 tsp vanilla extract","150g coconut oil","5 tbsp cocoa powder","2 tsp maple syrup"]','["Grease a 20cm square cake tin and line with baking parchment. Tip the cashew nuts and oats into a food processer and blitz to crumbs. Add the dates and coconut oil, and blend again. Transfer to the tin and use a spoon to press the nutty mixture into a compact, even layer that covers the base. Chill while you prepare the filling.","For the filling, add the dates, almond milk, maple syrup and coconut oil to a saucepan with a generous pinch of salt and bring to a simmer. Boil for 2-3 mins until the dates are really soft, then tip into the blender, add the vanilla extract and blitz to a smooth purée. Add a little more salt if the mixture is too sweet. Pour over the nutty base and spread to the sides of the tin, getting the surface as smooth as possible. Chill while you prepare the topping.","Gently heat the coconut oil in a saucepan until melted. Remove from the heat and whisk in the cocoa and maple syrup until there are no lumps. Cool for 10 mins, pour over the caramel layer and return to the fridge for at least 3 hrs or until firmly set. To serve, cut into squares. Will keep in the fridge for up to 1 week."]','2026-01-10 12:22:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8861,8861,'en','Carrot cake cookies','A universal favourite, in cookie form! Give your standard carrot cake an upgrade with these bite-sized, biscuity treats','["140g cream cheese","140g icing sugar, plus 3 tbsp","½  tsp vanilla extract","350g plain flour, plus extra for dusting your hands","½  tsp baking powder","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp mixed spice","140g butter, softened","140g soft light brown sugar","1 egg beaten","200g carrot, finely grated","zest and juice 1 orange","3 tbsp finely chopped walnuts"]','["Mix together the cream cheese, 3 tbsp icing sugar and the vanilla extract in a bowl, then put in the freezer to firm up for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, combine the flour, baking powder and spices in a bowl. In a larger bowl, beat the butter and sugar together until creamy. Beat in the egg, followed by the carrot. Tip in the dry ingredients and mix to form a dough.","Line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Dust your hands with a little flour, then divide the dough into 14 balls and place on the sheet. Use the palm of your hand to flatten each one to a thin circle. Add 1 tsp of the cream cheese mixture to the centre of each one, then carefully wrap the dough up and around the filling to seal it in, pinching the top and rolling back into a rough ball to stop any of the filling leaking out.","When all the balls are shaped, use your palm to flatten them slightly, then put in the fridge to chill for 30 mins. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Bake the cookies for 20 mins until golden and crisp. Remove from the oven, let them firm up on the tray for 10-15 mins, then transfer to wire racks to cool completely.","Mix the icing sugar with the orange juice to a drizzling consistency. Drizzle all over the cookies, sprinkle with the walnuts and orange zest, then allow to set. Best eaten on the day they are made, but will keep in the fridge in an airtight container for up to 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8863,8863,'en','Coconut cupcakes','Get a triple hit of coconut in these light and fluffy cupcakes, topped with whipped coconut cream and snowy desiccated coconut – a lovely gluten-free teatime treat','["400g can full-fat coconut milk (must not contain stabilisers)","140g icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","50g desiccated coconut","100g coconut oil","225g golden caster sugar","3 large eggs","200g gluten-free self-raising flour (the mix should include xanthan gum – I used Doves Farm)","100ml coconut milk","1 tsp vanilla extract"]','["Chill the can of coconut milk overnight. The next day, make the cakes. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with muffin cases. Put the coconut oil and sugar in a large bowl and use an electric whisk to beat together for about 5 mins until light and creamy. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating until fully combined before adding more. Working in three additions, add the flour, alternating with the coconut milk, then add the vanilla extract.","Scoop the batter into the prepared muffin tin using an ice cream scoop, then bake for 20-22 mins or until the cakes are golden and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Remove the cupcakes from the tin and cool on a wire rack.","The whipped cream is best made within a few hours of serving. Open the can of coconut milk upside down and pour off the thin liquid. Scoop the thick coconut milk into a large bowl, add the icing sugar and the vanilla, and whisk for 2-3 mins until soft and fluffy. Spread or scoop the whipped cream onto the cupcakes and sprinkle with the desiccated coconut. Best stored in the fridge and eaten within a couple of days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8865,8865,'en','Fudgy fig roll','The flavours of the traditional biscuit are turned into a Swiss roll, with added nutmeg, cinnamon, banana in the sponge and a touch of fig jam','["140g soft dried figs, chopped","1 medium very ripe banana","knob of butter, for greasing","3 large eggs, separated","225g light muscovado sugar","120g wholemeal flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp ground cinnamon","good grating fresh nutmeg (optional)","4 tbsp golden caster sugar","300ml double cream","4 tbsp icing sugar, sifted","about 250-300g fig jam or conserve"]','["Cover the figs with boiling water in a\r\nbowl and set aside to soften for 30 mins.\r\nDrain and mash well with the banana.","Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nGrease a Swiss roll tin – about 34 x 24cm.\r\nLine the base with baking parchment.","Separate the eggs, collecting the\r\nwhites in a large clean bowl. Beat with\r\nan electric whisk until stiff peaks hold on\r\nthe end of your whisk, then add half the\r\nsugar and beat until thick and glossy.","In another mixing bowl, beat the yolks\r\nwith the remaining sugar until pale. Whisk\r\nin the mashed fig mixture. Fold this mixture\r\ninto the meringue mixture until well\r\ncombined. Mix the flour, bicarbonate of\r\nsoda, spices and a pinch of salt. Sprinkle it\r\nover the wet mixture and very gently fold\r\nin, again until well combined. Gently scrape\r\nand spread the batter into the tin. Bake\r\nfor 12-15 mins until springy to the touch.","Meanwhile, lay a clean tea towel on\r\nthe bench (this helps keep the cake nice\r\nand moist). Scatter the caster sugar over\r\nthe towel, flip on the cake, peel off the\r\nparchment, then roll up from the shortest\r\nside with the tea towel into a Swiss roll.\r\nLift onto a wire rack to cool completely.","Unroll the cake gently. Using electric\r\nbeaters, whisk the cream and icing sugar\r\ntogether to soft peaks. Spread the fig jam\r\nover the cake, followed by the cream.\r\nRoll up again and slice to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8867,8867,'en','Curly twirlies','Use ready-to-roll croissant pastry to create these chocolate and toffee-filled treats that are gooey and sticky when eaten warm','["140g soft toffees","2 x tubes of 6 ready-to-roll croissants (we used Jus Rol)","100ml milk","50g dark chocolate drops- or use a block of chocolate and roughly chop","golden icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nPut the toffees into a small pan with\r\nthe milk and melt over a very low heat,\r\nstirring occasionally to bring together\r\nto a smooth sauce. Cool off the heat for\r\n1-2 mins until a little less molten and\r\nthickened slightly.","Cover two baking sheets with baking\r\nparchment. Unroll one tube of croissant\r\ndough. Pinch together the diagonal\r\nperforated seams, but divide the dough\r\ninto three rectangles along the straight\r\ncrossing seams. Cut each rectangle into\r\n4 long, thin strips – so you end up with 12.\r\nDrizzle a little toffee along the length of\r\neach strip, then scatter with some\r\nchocolate drops. Unroll the other dough\r\nand cut into the same size strips, then\r\nsandwich together with the toffee-choc\r\ncovered ones. Holding the ends of each\r\nstrip, twist tightly and lay on the prepared\r\nbaking sheets – they’ll expand a little.","Once all are shaped, bake for 12-15 mins\r\nuntil golden and crisp. Dust with a little\r\ngolden icing sugar to serve and enjoy\r\nbest, freshly baked."]','2026-01-10 12:22:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8869,8869,'en','Caramel button cupcakes','These individual sponges have a secret centre and a cream cheese frosting- serve topped with homemade caramel buttons','["175g butter, softened","175g light muscovado sugar","2 large eggs","175g self-raising flour","2 tbsp milk","homemade caramel buttons (see recipe in tips, below)","397g can Nestlé Carnation Caramel","200g tub full-fat cream cheese","100g salted butter, softened","450g golden icing sugar"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and\r\nline a 12-hole muffin tin with cases. Put\r\nthe butter and sugar into a mixing bowl,\r\ncream with an electric whisk until smooth\r\nand pale. Add the eggs and whisk again,\r\nthen add the flour and milk, and mix with\r\na spatula until well combined. Divide the\r\nmixture between the muffin cases. Bake\r\nfor 18-20 mins until springy and a skewer\r\ncomes out clean. Leave to cool.","Mix 140g of the Carnation Caramel with\r\nthe cream cheese, butter and icing sugar\r\nwith an electric hand whisk, until smooth.\r\nChill for 10 mins. Cut a hole in the centre\r\nof each cupcake (we used an apple corer)\r\nand fill with remaining Carnation Caramel.\r\nTransfer the icing to a piping bag fitted with\r\na round nozzle and swirl over the cupcakes.\r\nWill keep for 3 days if kept in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:22:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8871,8871,'en','Giant jaffa orange cake','Give the classic flavour combo of chocolate orange even more wow factor in this cake with zingy jelly and luxurious chocolate ganache','["250g pack butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","300g golden caster sugar","4 large eggs","100g full-fat natural yogurt","300g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","zest 4 large orange (use the oranges below)","juice 5 large oranges (about 500ml), save the zest of 1 orange to finish","100g golden caster sugar","6 gelatine leaves","300ml pot double cream","200g milk chocolate, finely chopped","100g dark chocolate, finely chopped","2 tbsp apricot jam","zest 1 orange"]','["First make the jelly. Grease a 20cm\r\nround cake tin and line with cling film\r\n(you can use the 23cm tin that you will\r\nbake the cake in, but you’ll have to make\r\nthis the day before so that you can\r\nremove it before making the cake).\r\nRemove the zest from 4 of the oranges\r\nand set aside for the cake. Tip the orange\r\njuice and sugar into a saucepan and gently\r\nheat to dissolve the sugar. Meanwhile,\r\nsoak the gelatine leaves in cold water\r\nfor a few mins until soft. Remove the\r\ngelatine from the water, squeeze out\r\nany excess and add to the warm\r\norange juice, stir until the gelatine\r\nhas dissolved. Pour the liquid into the\r\nlined cake tin and chill for at least 4 hrs\r\nor preferably overnight.","Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3 and\r\nline a 23cm round cake tin with baking\r\nparchment. Tip all the cake ingredients\r\ninto a large mixing bowl and combine with\r\nan electric hand whisk until smooth. Spoon\r\ninto the tin and smooth over the surface.\r\nBake in the centre of the oven for\r\n55 mins, or until a skewer inserted\r\ncomes out clean. Cool in the tin for\r\n15 mins, then invert onto a wire rack\r\nand leave to cool completely.","Now make the ganache. Heat the\r\ncream in a small pan until hot. Put the\r\nchocolate in a small bowl and pour over\r\nthe cream, leave for 10 mins, then mix\r\nwell – you should be left with a smooth\r\nchocolate sauce. Leave at room\r\ntemperature until the ganache cools\r\nand thickens a little (you can put it in\r\nthe fridge to speed this up, but keep\r\nan eye on it, as it will set quickly).","To assemble the cake, place it on a\r\ncake stand and trim the top to give you\r\na flat surface. Warm the apricot jam in\r\nthe microwave until a little runny. Paint\r\nit over the top of the cake, then flip the\r\norange jelly out of its tin, and position on\r\ntop. Using a palette knife, swirl the\r\nchocolate ganache over the orange jelly,\r\nletting it dribble down the sides of the\r\ncake a little. Serve straight away or\r\nwithin 24 hours."]','2026-01-10 12:22:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8873,8873,'en','Whoopie pies','These fun little treats take under an hour to make and will be a sweet addition to any bake sale','["300g self-raising flour","50g cocoa","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","175g soft light brown sugar","1 egg","75ml sunflower oil, plus extra","150ml buttermilk","1 tub ready-to-use frosting","colourful sprinkles, to decorate","100g icing sugar","50g cocoa","100ml double cream"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and\r\nline baking trays with parchment. Mix\r\nflour, cocoa, bicarb, sugar and a pinch of\r\nsalt. Whisk the egg, oil and buttermilk\r\ntogether, then mix into dry ingredients with\r\n75ml boiling water. Spoon 20 spoonfuls\r\nonto trays, well spaced. Bake for 12 mins\r\nor until firm to touch, peel off trays. Cool.","For the glaze, sift icing sugar and cocoa\r\ninto a small pan. Gradually stir in cream\r\nfollowed by 100ml boiling water. Heat\r\ngently until syrupy.","Sandwich 2 cakes together with the\r\nfrosting, spoon over some glaze and\r\ndecorate with sprinkles."]','2026-01-10 12:22:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8875,8875,'en','Iced fairy cakes','Teach 8-14 year olds how to make fairy cakes and guarantee a fun kitchen activity','["100g caster sugar","100g very soft butter","100g self-raising flour","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g very soft butter","200g icing sugar","food colouring, sprinkles, marshmallows etc"]','["Ask a grown-up\r\nhelperto turn\r\nthe oven on to\r\n180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nPut a paper case\r\nin each bun hole.","Put the sugar\r\nand butter (it\r\nmust be soft or you\r\nwon’t be able to mix\r\nit properly) in a bowl\r\nand mix it together.\r\nSift in the flour.","Break the eggs\r\ninto a separate\r\nbowl (spoon out any\r\nbits of shell that fall\r\nin) and add them\r\nto the bowl with\r\nthe vanilla. Mix\r\neverything together.","Divide between\r\nthe cases using\r\na spoon, scraping\r\nit off with a knife.Ask a grown-up\r\nhelperto put the\r\ntray in the oven for\r\n20 minutes.","Mix the butter\r\nand icing sugar\r\nto make a creamy\r\nicing. Add colouring,\r\nif you like. Push an\r\nicing nozzle into\r\nan icing bag, then\r\nscoop in the icing.","Let the cakes\r\ncool completely\r\nin the tray. Pipe\r\nicing onto each cake\r\nand decorate with\r\nmarshmallows\r\nor sprinkles, or\r\nwhatever you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8877,8877,'en','Crazy cookies','Whether you’re sharing them at work or including them in a bake sale, these bold little biscuits are guaranteed to brighten everyone’s day!','["350g plain flour, plus extra","200g salted butter, cubed","120g golden caster sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","2 egg yolks","2 x 300g tubs ready-to-use royal icing (We used Dr Oetker, Sainsbury''s)","red and yellow food colourings"]','["Whizz the flour and butter until the\r\nmixture looks like breadcrumbs. Add the\r\nsugar, vanilla and egg yolks and whizz\r\nto a smooth dough. Roll the dough on\r\na lightly floured surface into 2 sausage\r\nshapes about 4-5cm in diameter. Wrap\r\nin cling film and chill for at least 30 mins.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nCut the dough into 4mm-thick slices and\r\narrange on baking sheets, spaced slightly\r\napart. Bake for 15 mins or until pale\r\ngolden. Transfer to a wire rack to cool.","Heat icing following pack instructions.\r\nAdd a little food colouring to each tub\r\nand ice half the cookies in yellow, and\r\ndecorate with red, then ice the other half\r\nred and decorate in yellow. Leave to dry."]','2026-01-10 12:22:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8879,8879,'en','Sticky chocolate drop cakes','This easy-to-make bake will keep somewhere cool in an airtight tin for up to two days','["250g pack unsalted butter","300g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs","200g self-raising flour","50g cocoa","100g milk chocolate drops","85g butter","85g caster sugar","200g light condensed milk","50g milk chocolate drops, plus extra, to scatter"]','["Butter and line a traybake or small\r\nroasting tin, about 20 x 30cm. Heat\r\noven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Gently\r\nmelt the butter in a large saucepan,\r\ncool for 5 mins, add sugar, vanilla\r\nand eggs, then beat until smooth with\r\na wooden spoon. Stir in the flour,\r\ncocoa and ¼ tsp salt. Stir in the milk chocolate drops and bake\r\nfor 35 mins until risen all over and a skewer\r\ncomes out with a few damp crumbs.","For the top, gently heat 85g butter\r\nand 85g caster sugar together until\r\nboth are melted. Stir in 200g light\r\ncondensed milk and bring to a boil.\r\nCool for 5 mins, then stir in 50g milk\r\nchocolate drops to melt. Spread\r\nover the cold cake, scatter with more\r\nchocolate drops and cut into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8881,8881,'en','Dotty banana fairy cakes','These sweet banana cakes are lovely and simple to make for a bake sale or children’s party','["100g caster sugar","100g butter, softened","140g self-raising flour","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 very ripe banana","140g icing sugar","100g ready-to-roll regal icing","red food colouring","hundreds and thousands"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLine a 12-bun tin with fairy cake cases.\r\nPut the sugar, butter, flour, eggs, vanilla\r\nand banana in a big bowl together.\r\nBeat with an electric whisk until banana\r\nis mashed and everything mixed. Divide\r\nbetween the cases and bake for\r\n20-22 mins until a skewer poked in\r\ncomes out clean. Cool.","To decorate, mix the icing sugar with\r\nenough water to be spoonable, but not\r\ntoo runny or it will dribble off the cakes.\r\nSpread some over each cake. Knead\r\nsome food colouring into the regal\r\nicing to make a bright red colour. Roll\r\n12 different-size balls, dip one side or\r\nthe top of each in some sprinkles and\r\nstick one on each cake."]','2026-01-10 12:22:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8883,8883,'en','Coconut carrot slices','If you’re looking for a treat for afternoontea, or something to make for a cake sale, try this crunchy-topped traybake','["250g pack unsalted butter","300g light muscovado sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs","200g self-raising flour","50g desiccated coconut","200g grated carrots","2 tsp mixed spice","85g desiccated coconut","25g light muscovado sugar","25g butter, melted"]','["Butter and line a traybake or small\r\nroasting tin, about 20 x 30cm. Heat\r\noven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Gently\r\nmelt the butter in a large saucepan,\r\ncool for 5 mins, add the sugar, vanilla\r\nand eggs, then beat until smooth with\r\na wooden spoon. Stir in the flour,\r\ncoconut and ¼ tsp salt. Stir the carrot and mixed spice into the mix. Bake for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, evenly mix 85g more\r\ncoconut with 25g light muscovado\r\nsugar and 25g melted butter.\r\nSmooth this over the cake, then bake\r\nfor 10 mins more until golden and a\r\nskewer inserted comes out clean.\r\nCool, then cut into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8885,8885,'en','Red Nose Day raspberry cookies','Raise some money for Comic Relief with these cheeky cookies.','["1 quantity Basic biscuit dough See ''Goes well with'' below","1 tsp cinnamon","6 tbsp raspberry jam","6 tbsp icing sugar, sifted","icing, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Make up the Basic biscuit dough, sifting in the cinnamon when you add the flour. Shape\r\ninto 2 balls, wrap in cling film and chill for 20-30 mins.","Roll out the dough on a lightly floured surface, then stamp out 28 biscuits with a 7-8cm wide cutter. Lay these on non-stick baking sheets. Using a 4cm cutter, cut out the ‘noses’ from half the biscuits. Bake for 10-12 mins until pale golden, then lift onto a cooling rack.","Mix the raspberry jam with the sifted icing sugar. When the biscuits are cool, spoon a little of the jam onto each whole biscuit, then carefully sandwich the other biscuits on top. Serve as they are, or pipe icing, made with a little water, to draw funny faces."]','2026-01-10 12:22:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8887,8887,'en','Double choc shortbreads','These sweet treats will go down a storm at your next bake sale, and cost only around 15p each to make','["200g butter, cubed","325g plain flour, plus extra for rolling","100g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 egg yolks","100g dark or milk chocolate chips","200g bar white chocolate, melted","red writing icing tube"]','["Rub the butter into the flour to make\r\ncrumbs, then stir in sugar, vanilla, yolks\r\nand chocolate chips and bring together\r\nto form a dough. Roll out on a lightly\r\nfloured surface and stamp out 6cm round\r\nbiscuits. Re-roll the trimmings and\r\nrepeat. Arrange on parchment-lined trays\r\nand chill for 30 mins.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nBake biscuits for 10-12 mins until golden.\r\nCool. Spread each with white chocolate\r\nand leave to set. Decorate, or write on\r\nbuyer’s name with red icing on the spot,\r\nif you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8889,8889,'en','Peach Melba squares','This traybake can be mixedtogether in no time and is simple to slice andtransport','["250g pack unsalted butter","300g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs","200g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","2 just-ripe peaches, stoned, halved, then each half cut into 3","100g raspberries","handful flaked almonds","1 tbsp icing sugar, to finish"]','["Butter and line a traybake or small\r\nroasting tin, about 20 x 30cm. Heat\r\noven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Gently\r\nmelt the butter in a large saucepan,\r\ncool for 5 mins, add the sugar, vanilla\r\nand eggs, then beat until smooth with\r\na wooden spoon. Stir in the flour,\r\nalmonds and ¼ tsp salt.","Tip the mix into the tin, then lay the\r\npeach slices evenly on top – that way\r\neach square of cake will have a bite of\r\nfruit. Scatter the raspberries and almonds\r\nover, then bake for 1 hr-1 hr 10 mins,\r\ncovering with foil after 40 mins. Test with\r\na skewer: the middle should have just a\r\ntiny hint of squidginess, which will firm\r\nup once the cake cools. Cool in the tin\r\nfor 20 mins, then lift out onto a cooling\r\nrack. Once cold, dredge with icing sugar,\r\nthen cut into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8891,8891,'en','Sprinkle & spice caramel fault-line cake','Wow guests with this magical celebration cake. Layers of gently spiced sponge are wrapped in fluffy vanilla buttercream and glittering sparkles – this bake is something special','["200ml whole milk","4 tbsp golden syrup","300ml vegetable oil, plus extra for the tins","500g plain flour","4 tsp baking powder","500g light brown soft sugar","2 tsp ground cinnamon","4 small pinches of ground cloves","400ml buttermilk (if you can’t get buttermilk, use 300g Greek yogurt mixed with 100ml milk)","4 medium eggs","2 tsp vanilla extract","500g slightly salted butter, softened","1kg icing sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","splash of milk (optional)","150g canned caramel","50g sprinkles (we used a mixture of gold, bronze, and metallic purple, red and turquoise – a mixture of different colours and shapes will give the best result), plus extra for the top (optional)","edible gold decorating pen, or edible gold lustre mixed with a few drops of clear spirit (such as vodka)"]','["Put half the milk and half the golden syrup in a saucepan and bring to a gentle simmer. Stir until combined, then remove from the heat and set aside to cool. Or, heat the mixture in a heatproof jug in themicrowavefor 1 min. Meanwhile, oil two 20cm loose-bottomed cake tins, and line the bases with baking parchment (if the tins are less than 4cm deep, line the sides with a tall ring of baking parchment, too). Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","For the sponges, you’ll need to use half the ingredients for the first batch of cakes, then the remaining ingredients for another batch, to make four sponges in total. For the first batch, tip 250g flour, 2 tsp baking powder, 250g sugar, 1 tsp cinnamon and 2 pinches of ground cloves into a large bowl with ¼ tsp fine salt.Whisktogether, breaking up any large lumps of sugar to create an even, sandy mixture.","Whisk together 150ml of the oil, 200ml buttermilk, 2 eggs and 1 tsp vanilla in a large jug. Add the cooled milk and syrup mixture, and whisk again. Gradually whisk the wet ingredients into the dry until smooth. Divide between the tins. Bake for 25-30 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the middle of each sponge comes out clean.","Leave the sponges to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then invert onto awire rack(so the bases become the tops), peel off the parchment and leave to cool completely. Clean, oil and line the tins again as described in step 1, and repeat steps 1-3 to make two more sponges. Leave all four sponges to cool completely.Once cooled, the sponges can be wrapped and stored in a cool place for up to three days, or frozen for up to two months.","To make the buttercream icing, put the butter and half the icing sugar in a large bowl. Mash roughly with a spatula, then beat with an electric whisk until smooth and pale. Add the remaining sugar, the vanilla, and the milk to loosen the mixture to a spreadable consistency, if needed. Beat again until smooth. Transfer half the buttercream to a second bowl and set aside.","Working with the first bowl of of buttercream, spread a few tablespoons in the centre of a 20cm cake board or stand, and put one of the sponges on top, upside-down, so the flat base is on top. Spread over a quarter of the buttercream, followed by a third of the caramel. Top with another sponge, then another layer of buttercream and caramel, then repeat the process with a third sponge. Place the final sponge on top, upside-down, so you have a flat surface. Cover the entire cake in a very thin layer of the buttercream, using what remains from the first bowl – don’t worry about making it neat, as any crumbs trapped in the icing will be covered in the final coat. Chill the cake for 30 mins until the icing is firm.","","","","","",""]','2026-01-10 12:22:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8893,8893,'en','Speculoos profiterole wreath','Ditch the shop-bought dessert at Christmas for this stunning choux centrepiece. Made with speculoos biscuits, it’s topped with luscious salted caramel','["100g plain flour","85g unsalted butter","3 eggs, at room temperature","4-5 speculoos biscuits, crumbled","gold sprinkles, to decorate (optional)","400ml double cream","250g speculoos biscuit spread","½ tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp mixed spice","grating of nutmeg","130g granulated sugar","20g unsalted butter","6 tbsp double cream","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","¼ tsp ground cinnamon","¼ tsp mixed spice"]','["Sieve the flour and ¼ tsp salt into a bowl. Bring the butter and 225ml water to the boil in a saucepan, then simmer until the butter has melted. Tip in the flour mixture and quickly beat with a wooden spoon until everything comes together into a smooth, shiny dough that pulls away from the side of the pan. Tip the dough into a clean bowl, and spread it up the side with the spoon to help it quickly cool down a bit (you don’t want it to cool completely – it’s easier to incorporate the eggs while it’s still a bit warm). Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line two baking sheets with baking parchment. Set aside.","While the dough is still slightly warm, crack in the eggs one at a time, beating well with the wooden spoon between each addition until smooth (you may not need to use all the eggs). When ready, the dough should slowly fall off the spoon in a V-shape – if the mixture is too runny, you won’t be able to pipe it; if it’s too thick, it won’t puff up in the oven. Spoon the dough into apiping bagand snip off the end so it has a 1cm opening.","Holding the piping bag at a 90-degree angle to thebaking tray, pipe walnut-sized balls of dough over the two sheets – you should get 18-20 in total. Dip your finger in a little water and gently pat down any peaks on top of the balls. Bake for 30-35 mins, swapping the trays over after 20 mins. The choux buns should be puffed up and crisp when cooked. Leave to cool completely.","To make the filling, beat the cream with the biscuit spread and spices in a large bowl using an electricwhiskuntil softly whipped.","For the caramel sauce, tip the sugar into a saucepan set over a medium heat, add 6 tbsp water and cook until the sugar has dissolved. Turn up the heat slightly and simmer, swirling the pan occasionally until golden (do not stir or the sugar will crystallise). Remove from the heat, add the butter and swirl the pan until the butter has melted and combined with the syrup. Quickly beat in the cream, vanilla, cinnamon, mixed spice and a pinch of sea salt. Leave to cool slightly.","Cut each cooled choux bun in half through the middle. Spoon the filling into a piping bag, snip off the end and pipe over the bases of the buns. Sandwich these with the tops, then arrange in a roughly 27cm round wreath shape on a large serving plate or board. Drizzle all over with the caramel sauce, then scatter over the crumbled biscuits and gold sprinkles, if using. Best eaten straightaway.Will keep chilled for up to 24 hrs."]','2026-01-10 12:22:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8895,8895,'en','Salted caramel fudge','Dig out your sugar thermometer to make this fudge. It requires a little precision, but the result is fabulous, with a lovely salted caramel flavour','["450g golden caster sugar","400g double cream","50g butter","1 tbsp glucose syrup","1 tbsp vanilla bean paste","2 tbsp canned caramel","450g golden caster sugar","400g double cream","50g butter","1 tbsp glucose syrup","1 tbsp vanilla bean paste","2 tbsp canned caramel"]','["Line a 20 x 20cm cake tin with baking parchment. Tip the sugar, cream, butter and glucose syrup into a largepan. Warm over a low heat to dissolve the sugar and melt the butter, stirring occasionally.","When the sugar has dissolved, put a sugar thermometer in the mixture, making sure the end is completely covered by the syrup – if it’s not, transfer the mixture to a smaller pan that’s still large enough for the syrup to bubble. Turn up the heat to medium-high and bring the syrup to the boil, stirring occasionally to stop it catching. When the thermometer reaches 116C – or ‘soft ball’ stage, remove the pan from the heat.","Leave the mixture to stand, undisturbed, for 5 mins, until the temperature drops to 110C, then stir in the vanilla bean paste and a good pinch of salt.","Remove the thermometer, then vigorously beat the mixture with a wooden spoon, checking the temperature every minute or so until it drops again to about 60C. By this time, the mixture will be really thick and have lost its glossy shine. Take the thermometer out and continue beating the mixture for a few more minutes. This part is crucial as it helps create small sugar crystals that give the fudge its smooth, creamy texture.","Quickly pour the fudge mixture into the prepared tin and smooth the surface using aspatula. Dot the caramel over the top, and swirl it through the fudge using a skewer. Sprinkle with 1 tsp sea salt, then leave to cool overnight at room temperature – don’t put it in the fridge, as it will become sticky and won’t set properly. Cut into 36 bite-sized pieces.Will keep in an airtight container at room temperature for up to two months.","Line a 20 x 20cm cake tin with baking parchment. Tip the sugar, cream, butter and glucose syrup into a largepan. Warm over a low heat to dissolve the sugar and melt the butter, stirring occasionally.","When the sugar has dissolved, put a sugar thermometer in the mixture, making sure the end is completely covered by the syrup – if it’s not, transfer the mixture to a smaller pan that’s still large enough for the syrup to bubble. Turn up the heat to medium-high and bring the syrup to the boil, stirring occasionally to stop it catching. When the thermometer reaches 116C – or ‘soft ball’ stage, remove the pan from the heat.","Leave the mixture to stand, undisturbed, for 5 mins, until the temperature drops to 110C, then stir in the vanilla bean paste and a good pinch of salt.","Remove the thermometer, then vigorously beat the mixture with a wooden spoon, checking the temperature every minute or so until it drops again to about 60C. By this time, the mixture will be really thick and have lost its glossy shine. Take the thermometer out and continue beating the mixture for a few more minutes. This part is crucial as it helps create small sugar crystals that give the fudge its smooth, creamy texture.","Quickly pour the fudge mixture into the prepared tin and smooth the surface using aspatula. Dot the caramel over the top, and swirl it through the fudge using a skewer. Sprinkle with 1 tsp sea salt, then leave to cool overnight at room temperature – don’t put it in the fridge, as it will become sticky and won’t set properly. Cut into 36 bite-sized pieces.Will keep in an airtight container at room temperature for up to two months."]','2026-01-10 12:22:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8897,8897,'en','Chocolate caramel terrine','Make this decadent chocolate and caramel terrine for a sophisticated dinner party dessert. Dust generously with cocoa powder before cutting into slices','["sunflower oil, for the tin","200ml double cream","1 tbsp cocoa powder, plus extra for dusting","300g caramel from a jar or can","100g dark chocolate, finely chopped","200g mascarpone","7-8 caramel wafers (depending on the tin size), cut in half lengthways"]','["Oil a 900g loaf tin and line with a double layer of baking parchment. Put the cream, cocoa, 200g caramel and a pinch of salt in apanset over a medium heat and bring to the boil, whisking occasionally to combine. Tip the chocolate into a medium heatproof bowl and pour over the hot cream mixture. Leave to sit for 1 min, then stir everything together until the chocolate is melted and smooth. Leave to cool slightly for 5-10 mins.","Beat the mascarpone into the cooled chocolate mixture using an electricwhiskfor 3-4 mins until smooth, glossy and the whisk leaves a trail behind in the mixture.","To assemble the terrine, press the top halves of the caramel wafers into the bottom of the tin, cut-side up, trimming to fit if needed.","Beat the remaining caramel with a whisk to loosen it, then spread half over the wafers in the tin. Spoon half the chocolate mixture over the top, then arrange the remaining wafer halves over the chocolate layer. Cover with the remaining caramel, ensuring everything is evenly covered, then top with the rest of the chocolate mixture. Cover the terrine with a strip of baking parchment, then freeze for at least 6 hrs, or overnight.","Remove the terrine from the freezer 10 mins before serving, then turn out onto a chilled dish or serving plate. Dust generously with cocoa powder before cutting into slices."]','2026-01-10 12:22:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8899,8899,'en','Salted caramel & popcorn eclairs','Give the classic French bake a modern makeover! Pipe an indulgent salted caramel filling into light choux pastry buns and scatter with crunchy pieces of toffee popcorn','["1 quantity eclairs and crème pâtissière recipe - see link in method","1 x 397g tin Nestlé Carnation Caramel","600g fondant icing sugar","sea salt flakes","600ml double cream","2 tsp vanilla bean paste","100g chopped toffee popcorn"]','["Make the eclairs and crème pâtissière using our classic recipe.","Mix 150g Carnation Caramel with the fondant icing sugar. Mix into a thick but drizzly icing, adding a splash of water if it’s too thick. Cover with cling film.","Transfer another 200g Carnation Caramel to a piping bag and pipe a line along the bottom half of the split eclairs, then sprinkle over a few sea salt flakes.","Pour the double cream into a bowl with the remaining caramel and vanilla bean paste. Beat with an electric hand whisk to thicken the cream to stiff peaks. Fold through the crème pâtissière, then transfer to a piping bag. Pipe generous blobs of cream over the base, then sprinkle over 50g chopped toffee popcorn.","Spread the glaze carefully over the tops of the eclairs, then position on top of the cream. After every four or five eclairs, decorate the tops, while the icing is still wet, with 50g chopped toffee popcorn and a pinch of sea salt flakes.For more help, see our how to make choux pastry and eclairs video."]','2026-01-10 12:22:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8901,8901,'en','Asian caramel chicken wings','Using dark caramel in savoury dishes is common in Asian cooking- it adds depth of flavour and contrasts well with sour and spicy notes','["100g golden caster sugar","4 tbsp gluten-free fish sauce","1 green chilli, halved (optional)","small piece cinnamon bark","small piece ginger, finely chopped","juice 1 large lime, plus extra for squeezing over","1kg chicken wing, tips removed and cut in half","small bunch spring onion, cut into 1cm lengths","large piece ginger, cut into matchsticks","1 green chilli (seeds removed if you don''t like it too hot), cut into rings","handful coriander sprigs","boiled white rice, to serve"]','["Put the sugar in a medium sauté pan with enough water to make it go sludgy. Place on a low heat and bring to the boil, then cook until you have a dark amber caramel (see tip, below).","At arms length, add the other ingredients, except for the chicken and garnish, and bring to a simmer – take care as it will spit. Once it has calmed down a little and you have a thick sauce, stir in the wings until well coated. Pour over 100ml water and simmer on a medium heat for about 30 mins, stirring every now and then until the sauce is a thicker consistency – add a splash more water if needed.","Turn down the heat and continue to cook, covered, for a further 15 mins, stirring occasionally, until the wings are lacquered and tender and the sauce is very thick. Turn off the heat and quickly stir through half the spring onion, ginger and chilli. Tip the wings and sauce onto a platter. Scatter with the remaining garnish and coriander, and serve with extra lime and rice."]','2026-01-10 12:22:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8903,8903,'en','Salted caramel & peanut butter s’mores','What’s more delicious than a classic American marshmallow and cracker s’more? Our deluxe dessert version with toffee, chocolate, nuts and waffle biscuits','["16 waffle biscuits","8 peanut butter cups","8 tsp caramel (we used Carnation)","sea salt flakes, for sprinkling"]','["Preheat the grill to high and line a baking sheet with parchment. Put 8 waffle biscuits on the tray with a peanut butter cup on each and grill until it starts melting.","Put a tsp of caramel on the other 8 waffles and sprinkle a few salt flakes over each.","Sandwich the waffle biscuits together and enjoy with a cappuccino."]','2026-01-10 12:22:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8905,8905,'en','Pumpkin pancakes with salted pecan butterscotch','Pumpkin purée makes a delicious addition to a stack of fat, fluffy pancakes – the perfect brunch to get the weekend off to a sweet start','["250g pumpkins or squash, peeled, deseeded and chopped into large chunks","2 eggs","3 tbsp light brown soft sugar","25g butter, melted, plus a little for cooking","125ml buttermilk (or use the same quantity of milk, with a squeeze of lemon juice)","200g plain flour","2½  tsp baking powder","1 tsp ground cinnamon","drizzle of flavourless oil, such as sunflower or groundnut, for frying","ice cream, to serve, or yogurt or crème fraîche","50g pecans, roughly chopped","50g butter","50g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp sea salt flakes","100ml double cream"]','["Put the pumpkin or squash in a large heatproof bowl, add 1 tbsp water, cover with cling film and microwave on High for 5-8 mins or until really soft – different types will take a varying amount of time. Drain the pumpkin well and cool completely. If you want to eat the pancakes for breakfast, this step is best done the night before.","Once cool, put the pumpkin in a food processer with the remaining pancake ingredients and add a good pinch of salt. Blend until everything is well combined to a smooth, thick batter (alternatively, mash the pumpkin well, then whisk in the remaining ingredients). Transfer to a jug or piping bag and set aside while you make the butterscotch sauce.","Toast the pecans in a saucepan for 1-2 mins until a shade darker. Tip out and set aside. Add the butter, sugar, salt and cream to the pan. Bring to a simmer, then bubble gently for a few mins until you have a shiny sauce. Stir in the pecans and set aside to cool a little.","Heat a knob of butter and a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan. Heat oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1, to keep the pancakes warm while you cook them in batches – have a baking tray to hand. When the butter is foaming, swirl it around the pan, then pour tennis-ball-sized amounts of batter into the pan (see tip below) – they will spread a little as they cook, so leave some space between each pancake and don’t overcrowd the pan. Cook over a low-medium heat. Don’t touch the pancakes until you see a few bubbles appear on the surface – have a look underneath and, if the pancakes are golden, flip them over and cook for another 2 mins on the other side. Transfer the cooked pancakes to the baking tray and keep warm in the oven while you continue cooking.","Once cooked, pile the pancakes onto plates, top with ice cream, yogurt or crème fraîche, and pour over the salted pecan butterscotch sauce."]','2026-01-10 12:22:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8907,8907,'en','Cheat’s salted caramels','These cheat''s sweets make a great addition to a party spread or gift hamper. Use chocolate caramels and cover with edible gold','["chocolate-covered caramels (we used Rolos)","edible gold lustre (we bought ours from Waitrose)","sea salt flakes"]','["Unwrap the chocolate-covered caramels and use a small paintbrush to dust the outsides with gold lustre. Add a few flakes of sea salt to the top of each one, then arrange on a serving plate (stacking in a tower makes them look extra special). Chill for at least 1 hr before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8909,8909,'en','Salted caramel & popcorn crumble choux buns','Edd Kimber puts a new spin on classic French choux pastry with these salted caramel buns filled with popcorn cream and finished with a crispy craquelin top','["125g toffee popcorn (to fill the buns)","icing sugar, to serve","edible gold leaf, to decorate (optional)","50g plain flour","50g golden caster sugar","40g unsalted butter, cold and chopped into small pieces","150g granulated sugar","125ml double cream","10g unsalted butter","large pinch of flaked sea salt","600ml double cream, plus a little extra to top up","125g toffee popcorn","large pinch of flaked sea salt","60g unsalted butter, chopped into small cubes","¼ tsp golden caster sugar","85g plain flour","2-3 large eggs"]','["For the crumble topping, mix the flour and sugar together in a medium bowl. Add the butter and rub until you have a breadcrumb texture. Using your hands, press this mixture together to form a uniform dough. Place this between 2 sheets of baking parchment and roll out until it is a few millimetres thick. Pop in the freezer on a baking tray until needed.","For the salted caramel, put the sugar in a medium-sized saucepan and set over a medium heat. Allow the sugar to melt and caramelise, stirring occasionally. Once the sugar is a dark copper caramel colour, add half the double cream. When the bubbling has subsided, add the remaining cream, the butter and salt, and stir to combine. If you have any remaining lumps, put back on the heat and stir until melted and smooth. Remove from the heat, pour into a small bowl, cover with cling film and chill until needed.","For the popcorn cream, put all the ingredients in a medium saucepan over a medium-high heat and bring to the boil. Remove from the heat, cover the pan and allow to infuse for 1 hour. Strain the cream through a sieve into a measuring jug, pressing down on the softened popcorn to get as much cream out as possible. Top the cream up so you still have 600ml. Press a piece of cling film onto the surface of the cream and chill until needed. Can be prepared the day before up to this point.","For the choux pastry, heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line 2 baking trays with baking parchment. Using a 5cm cookie cutter as a guide, draw 5 circles onto each piece of baking parchment and turn them over. Put 140ml water, the butter, ¼ tsp salt and the sugar in a medium saucepan and, over a medium-high heat, bring the mixture to a full rolling boil. Once boiling, and the butter has melted, remove from the heat, tip in the flour and immediately mix together with a wooden spoon until a smooth paste forms. Return to the heat and beat for 1-2 mins to dry out a little. Tip the paste into a large bowl and beat for a few mins to cool down slightly.","Add in the eggs, one at a time, beating until fully combined before adding another – add the last egg a little at a time as you may not need it all. Stop when the smooth choux drops off your spoon in a V-shape. Put the dough in a piping bag fitted with a large round nozzle, then pipe rounds of dough onto the prepared baking trays, using the circles as templates. Remove the crumble topping from the freezer and peel off the top layer of parchment. Using a 5cm cookie cutter, cut out 10 discs of the crumble topping and place one on top of each round of dough. Bake for 40 mins, or until the choux is well risen and the crumble is golden. Turn the oven off but leave the choux in until fully cooled.","To assemble the buns, use a large serrated knife to carefully slice in half. Place a few pieces of popcorn in the base of each bun and spoon some caramel in too (if you have prepared the caramel ahead of time, it will have firmed up, so place over a bowl of simmering water to loosen it). For the filling, remove the cream from the fridge and whip to soft peaks, then put in a piping bag fitted with a large star tip and pipe a swirl onto the base of each bun. To finish, place the top of the choux buns back on top of the cream and dust lightly with icing sugar. I finished mine with a piece of edible gold leaf."]','2026-01-10 12:22:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8911,8911,'en','Salted caramel parsnips','Don’t reserve salted caramel for desserts – it works perfectly with earthy roasted root vegetables too','["1kg parsnips, peeled","3 tbsp rapeseed oil","50g golden caster sugar","large knob of butter","1 tsp sea salt"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Halve the parsnips, then cut the thicker end in two lengthways. Boil for 5 mins, then drain well and leave to steam-dry for a few mins. Meanwhile, pour the oil into a shallow roasting tin or a lipped baking tray and heat in the oven for 3 mins.","Remove the tin from the oven and carefully add the parsnips to the hot oil. Turn them to coat, and make sure they aren’t overcrowded (otherwise they won’t crisp up). Roast for 30-35 mins or until golden and crisp, turning them halfway through the cooking time.","About 10 mins before the parsnips are ready, tip the sugar and 2 tbsp water into a small frying pan. Heat very gently until the sugar has dissolved. Turn up the heat and bring the liquid to the boil. Measure 3½ tbsp cold water into a jug. Keep swirling the pan around until the sugar reaches a rich, dark-reddish caramel colour, then remove from the heat. Stand well back and add the water (it will splutter!). Return to the heat, add the butter and the salt, and stir to remove any lumps. The caramel should be runny, so add a splash more water if needed. Pile the parsnips into a serving dish, then drizzle over the salted caramel."]','2026-01-10 12:22:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8913,8913,'en','Utterly nutterly caramel layer cake','The toffee nut topping gives this sponge the edge- we used Brazil nuts, hazelnut, pecans and almonds','["250g pack salted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","175g mixed nuts, we used Brazil nuts, hazelnuts, pecans and almonds, roughly chopped","250g soft light brown sugar","3 tbsp golden syrup","4 large eggs","140g self-raising flour","75g ground almonds","½  tsp baking powder","1 tsp almond extract","3 tbsp milk","200ml double cream","5 tbsp caramel, from a can (we used Carnation)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line 2 x 20cm loose-bottomed Victoria sandwich cake tins with baking parchment, then grease one of the tins over the top of the parchment (this will help to prevent the caramel-nut topping from sticking when you turn it out).\r\nTip the nuts into a frying pan and toast over a medium heat until golden. Add 50g of the butter, 50g sugar, the golden syrup and a good pinch of salt. Stir until the butter has melted, then bubble for 2 mins until the buttery sauce is golden brown – don’t let it bubble for too long or the topping will set hard once cooled. Tip into the cake tin with the greased parchment and smooth over. Leave to cool while you make the cake.","Tip the remaining butter and sugar into a large bowl and beat with an electric whisk until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, mixing well between each addition. Add the flour, almonds, baking powder, 1?2 tsp salt, almond extract and milk, and mix again until just combined. Divide the cake mixture between the tins and smooth over the surface. Bake for 25 mins, or until a skewer comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then flip out onto a wire rack and remove the parchment. Allow to cool completely.","Whisk the cream and 2 tbsp of the caramel until softly whipped and just holding its shape. To assemble the cake, place the plain cake on a plate or stand. Top with the whipped cream, swirling it out towards the edges. Drizzle over the remaining caramel (give it a good mix first to loosen it), letting it dribble down the sides. Top with the remaining sponge, nutty-side up. Serve within 1 day, or store in fridge for 3 days, removing it from the fridge 10 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8915,8915,'en','Crème brûlée tartlets','We combine a smooth and creamy classic French dessert with crisp golden pastry in these decadent caramel puds','["175g plain flour","100g cold butter, cubed","2 tsp caster sugar","zest ½ orange","1 egg yolk, beaten with 2 tbsp cold water","300ml carton double cream","1 vanilla pod, halved lengthways","3 egg yolks and 1 whole egg","2 tbsp caster sugar","sunflower oil, for greasing","85g caster sugar"]','["Put the flour, a pinch of salt and the butter in a food processor and pulse until it resembles fine crumbs. Add the sugar and orange zest, and briefly pulse again. Pour in 2 tbsp of the egg mixture and pulse until the dough comes together, adding more liquid if needed.","Roll out the pastry on a lightly floured surface and use to line four deep-fluted tartlet tins (8 x 3cm). Place the tins on\r\na tray and chill for 30 mins. Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Line each pastry case with baking parchment and fill with baking beans. Bake for 10-15 mins, until the sides are set. Remove the parchment and beans and cook for 5-10 mins. Leave to cool. Can be made up to 1 day ahead at this stage and be stored in an airtight container. Lower the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2.","Pour the cream into a heavy-based saucepan, scrape in the seeds from the vanilla pod, then throw in the 2 halves\r\nof the pod. Heat until small bubbles begin to form around the sides of the pan, then leave to infuse for 5 mins. Remove the pod. In a bowl, beat together the egg yolks, whole egg and sugar. Keep stirring, then pour in the cream, mixing until combined. Strain through a sieve into a jug. Pour the custard into the tart shells, then bake for 18-22 mins until almost set (they should be quite wobbly in the centre but will firm up on cooling). Leave to cool completely, then chill for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, make the caramel topping. Grease a lipped metal baking tray with\r\na little oil. Tip the caster sugar into a frying pan with 3 tbsp water and heat gently until the sugar starts to melt. Don’t be tempted to stir the sugar, as this can encourage the caramel to crystalise. However, you can tilt the pan to move it around. Once the sugar is almost melted, turn up the heat and bubble the caramel to a deep golden-brown colour. Quickly tip onto the greased tray and leave to cool completely. Once cool, turn the tray upside down and tap to release the caramel. Break into pieces, then whizz in a food processor until you have fine crystals.","Heat the grill. Scatter a thick layer of caramel crystals over the surface of each tart, and pop a collar of foil around the top edge of the pastry. Place under the grill, not too near the heat source, and let the caramel melt – watch carefully as they will burn easily. Leave to cool, then chill for 30 mins or until ready to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8917,8917,'en','Shallot Tatin','This twist on a classic apple dessert gives often-overlooked shallots star billing and makes a stunning vegetarian main course','["450g shallots","3 tbsp demerara sugar","50g butter","1 tsp fresh thyme leaf","1 tbsp balsamic vinegar or a few grindings of cracked black pepper","plain flour, for dusting","500g pack puff pastry"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Pour boiling water over the shallots and leave them until the water cools. (This makes it easier to slip the skins off.) Peel and halve the shallots, then set aside. Put the sugar in a 23cm ovenproof frying pan and heat until it dissolves and you have a sticky caramel. Add the butter, thyme and a splash of balsamic vinegar or cracked black pepper – take care as it will spit.","Remove the pan from the heat and put all the shallots into the pan, cut-side down. On a lightly floured surface, roll out the pastry and cut out a round 2cm larger than the pan. Drape the pastry over the shallots and tuck in the edges, so that it ‘hugs’ the shallots. Place the pan in the oven and cook for 25-30 mins until the pastry is puffed up and golden. Leave to rest for 1 min, then invert the tart onto a plate. Serve with a punchy salad of rocket and goat’s cheese."]','2026-01-10 12:22:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8919,8919,'en','Cranberry, pumpkin seed & caramel flapjacks','Salted butter balances the sweetness of the caramel and dried fruit in this indulgent traybake made from rolled oats','["250g pack salted butter","6 tbsp caramel, from a 397g can Carnation caramel (use remainder for topping, see below)","50g golden caster sugar","350g rolled oats","85g self-raising flour","remaining caramel","50g salted butter","25g pumpkin seeds","50g dried cranberries","25g dark chocolate chips"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3\r\nand line a 22cm square cake tin with\r\nbaking parchment. Melt the butter,\r\ncaramel and sugar in a large saucepan,\r\nthen tip in the oats and flour. Stir well,\r\nmaking sure every oat is covered in\r\nthe buttery mixture, then tip into your\r\ncake tin and press down firmly with the\r\nback of a spoon to level the surface.\r\nBake for 40 mins.","Tip the remaining caramel and butter\r\ninto a small saucepan, and bubble for\r\n5 mins, stirring continuously, until the\r\nmixture turns dark golden brown and\r\nthickens a little. When the flapjacks have\r\nfinished cooking, remove them from the\r\noven and pour over the hot caramel.\r\nLeave to cool for 5 mins, then scatter\r\nwith the seeds, cranberries and\r\nchocolate chips. Leave to cool completely\r\nin the tin before cutting into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8922,8922,'en','Chocolate, salted caramel & banana mess','Swap the berries of an Eton mess with banana, and turn the traditional cream dessert into a banoffee-like treat','["½ vanilla pod, scraped of seeds","150ml double cream","2 ready-made meringue nests, crumbled into chunks","2 bananas, sliced","2 tbsp caster sugar","3 tbsp double cream","1 tbsp butter","pinch of sea salt flakes","2 tbsp full-fat milk","1 tbsp double cream","50g dark chocolate, broken into small pieces"]','["To make the salted caramel, put the\r\nsugar and 2 tbsp water in a small\r\nheavy-bottomed saucepan. Place on a\r\nlow heat and swirl gently until the sugar\r\nhas melted. Turn up the heat and let the\r\nsugar bubble and caramelise to a nutty\r\nbrown. Take off the heat and pour in the\r\ncream, butter and salt flakes – do this\r\ncarefully, as it may spit. Gently stir\r\ntogether until smooth and glossy.","For the chocolate sauce, bring the\r\nmilk and cream to the boil in a small\r\nsaucepan. Put the chocolate bits into a\r\nbowl. Pour over two-thirds of the milk\r\nand cream mixture, stirring until melted\r\nand smooth. Adjust the consistency with\r\nthe remaining hot milk mixture.","Put the vanilla seeds into the cream\r\nand whip until just holding soft peaks.\r\nFold the meringues and banana slices\r\ninto the cream, leaving a few slices\r\nfor garnish. Put in serving dishes and\r\ndrizzle with the two sauces. Top\r\nwith the remaining banana slices.\r\nServe immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:22:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8924,8924,'en','Ginger & caramel apple puddings','Quintessentially British ingredients make up Frances Auger’s comforting puds, impressing the judges of Britain’s Best Pud','["50g butter, plus extra for the ramekins","1 large cooking apple, peeled, cored and finely chopped","75g light brown muscovado sugar","140g butter, softened","100g light brown muscovado sugar","1 egg","125ml buttermilk","2 balls preserved stem ginger, finely chopped, plus 1 tbsp syrup from jar","100g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","1½  tbsp ground ginger","½  tsp baking powder","½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","icing sugar, for dusting","cream or custard, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLightly butter and flour 6 x 8cm deep\r\nramekins, tapping out excess flour. Heat\r\nthe butter in a pan until foaming, add the\r\napple and cook for 1 min on a medium\r\nheat. Toss in the sugar and cook until\r\ndissolved. Divide between the ramekins.","For the puddings, beat the butter\r\nand sugar together with an electric\r\nwhisk until fully combined. In a separate\r\nbowl, mix together the egg, buttermilk,\r\nchopped ginger and ginger syrup, then\r\nstir this into the butter mixture. Fold\r\nin the flour, ground ginger, baking\r\npowder, bicarbonate of soda and a pinch\r\nof salt. Divide between the ramekins\r\nso they are filled to 1cm below the top.\r\nPlace them on a baking tray and bake\r\nfor 20 mins, until golden and risen.","Serve warm, dusted with icing sugar.\r\nAccompany with cream or custard."]','2026-01-10 12:22:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8925,8925,'en','Berry bliss smoothie bowl','This delicious healthy recipe has absolutely no dairy, soy, gluten or added sugars. It was created by health food expertsNana Bowls.','["3 frozen bananas, peeled and chopped","200g frozen blueberries","100g frozen strawberries","20ml rosewater","100ml coconut milk","50ml cold water","20g pea protein powder","30g almonds, crushed","30g pistachios, crushed","20g bee pollen","20g cacao nibs"]','["Add the frozen bananas, blueberries, strawberries, rosewater, coconut milk and cold water to a high powered blender.","Blend well for about 30 seconds. Then add in your protein powder and blend again until a thick, smooth and creamy texture forms.","Pour into your bowls and top with the crunchy almonds, crushed pistachios, bee pollen and cacao nibs. You can also add some toasted coconut flakes, homemade granola or a drizzle of nut butter for some extra goodness."]','2026-01-10 12:22:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8926,8926,'en','Caramelised apple cake with streusel topping','This moist cake with a crunchy nut topping is sure to become a teatime favourite','["100g butter, plus 1 tbsp","175g light brown muscovado sugar, plus 1 tbsp","2 dessert apples, peeled and cut into 1½ cm pieces","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","½ tsp ground cinnamon","100ml milk","25g flour","85g demerara sugar, plus 1 tbsp","½ tsp ground cinnamon","50g cold butter","3 tbsp toasted, chopped hazelnuts"]','["Heat 1 tbsp butter and 1 tbsp sugar in a\r\nlarge frying pan over medium heat until the\r\nsugar starts to melt. Add apples, then cook\r\nfor about 5 mins, until nicely browned and\r\nthe sauce is a rich caramel. Leave to cool.","While the apples cool, make the topping.\r\nIn a food processor or using the tips of\r\nyour fingers, rub together flour, 85g sugar,\r\ncinnamon and cold butter until the mixture\r\nis crumbly and only pea-size pieces of\r\nbutter remain. Stir in 2 tbsp of hazelnuts.\r\nSet aside in a cool place.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nTo make the cake, place the remaining\r\nbutter and sugar in a bowl or food mixer\r\nand beat until light and creamy. Add the\r\neggs one at a time, followed by the\r\nvanilla extract. Add the flour, baking\r\npowder, cinnamon and milk in two\r\ngoes, alternating between dry and wet\r\ningredients. When the mixture is well\r\ncombined, stir through the apples.","Grease a 20cm cake tin with removable\r\nbase and line the base with a circle of\r\nbaking paper. Spoon in the cake mixture,\r\nsmooth over the top with a spoon, then\r\nsprinkle over the streusel topping. Scatter\r\nwith the remaining 1 tbsp demerara\r\nsugar and hazelnuts. Cook in the oven\r\nfor 50 mins-1 hr or until a skewer inserted\r\ninto the cake comes out clean. Leave to\r\ncool in the tin for 10 mins, then turn out\r\nonto a baking rack, remove paper and cool."]','2026-01-10 12:22:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8928,8928,'en','Caramel cheesecake','Molasses flavour from muscovado sugars and a topping of thinly sliced fudge… this make-ahead pud is pure indulgence','["50g unsalted butter","140g plain digestive biscuits","4 gelatine leaves (I used Supercook), cut into wide strips (or 1 x 11g sachet, see Know-how, below)","400g crème fraîche","100g light muscovado sugar","50g dark muscovado sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","400g ricotta","50g fudge, finely sliced","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Gently melt the butter in a small pan\r\nover a low heat. Place the digestives in\r\na plastic bag and crush to fine crumbs\r\nusing a rolling pin; you can also do this in\r\na food processor. Tip them into the pan\r\nwith the melted butter, stir to coat, then\r\ntransfer to a 20cm springform cake tin\r\n(9cm deep). Using the back of a spoon,\r\npress them into the base, making sure\r\nyou seal the edges. Place in the fridge\r\nwhile you prepare the next stage.","If using leaf gelatine, place in a bowl,\r\ncover with cold water, soak for 5 mins,\r\nthen drain. Pour 3 tbsp boiling water over\r\nthe soaked gelatine and stir to dissolve.\r\nIf using a sachet, see Know-how, below.","Place the crème fraîche in a small pan\r\nwith the muscovado sugars and a pinch\r\nof sea salt, then gently heat, stirring\r\nconstantly with a wooden spoon until\r\nthe mixture liquefies and the sugar has\r\ndissolved. Give the mixture a quick whisk\r\nto get rid of any lumps. It should be warm,\r\nroughly the same temperature as the\r\ngelatine solution. Stir the gelatine and\r\nvanilla extract into the crème fraîche\r\nmixture, transfer to a bowl and cool.","Place the ricotta in a food processor\r\nand whizz until smooth, then add the\r\ncrème fraîche mixture and whizz again.\r\nPour this on top of the cheesecake base.\r\nCover with cling film and chill overnight.","Run a knife around the sides of the tin,\r\nthen undo the clip and remove it. Transfer\r\nto a plate or leave the cheesecake on the\r\nbase for ease of serving. Pile the fudge\r\nflakes in the centre and dust with icing\r\nsugar. Cover and chill until required."]','2026-01-10 12:22:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8930,8930,'en','Salted caramel banana tatins with crème fraîche ice cream','Combining on-trend salted caramel with a French classic makes for a stylish individual pudding that could grace any smart restaurant menu','["1 vanilla pod","200ml double cream","100ml milk","3 egg yolks","85g golden caster sugar","300ml full-fat crème fraîche","250g puff pastry","plain flour, for dusting","1 banana, peeled","50g soft light brown sugar","50g butter","2 tbsp double cream"]','["To make the ice cream, split the vanilla\r\npod in half lengthways and scrape out\r\nthe seeds. Put the pod and seeds in a\r\nsaucepan with the cream and milk, and\r\nbring slowly to the boil. Meanwhile, in\r\na bowl, whisk the egg yolks and sugar\r\ntogether until pale. Pour the hot cream\r\nmixture over the egg and sugar, whisking\r\ncontinuously. Pour back into the pan, set\r\nover a gentle heat and stir with a wooden\r\nspoon. Heat gently until the custard\r\nmixture thickens enough to coat the back\r\nof the spoon, then remove from the heat.","Pour the crème fraîche into a bowl and\r\nwhisk to loosen. Slowly pour in the hot\r\ncustard mixture, whisking as you go. Pour\r\nthe mixture into an ice-cream machine\r\nand churn until softly frozen. Transfer to\r\na container, then freeze for 2 hrs to firm.","To make the Tatins, roll out the pastry\r\non a floured surface to the thickness of a\r\n£1 coin. Using the banana as a guide, cut\r\nout 2 pastry lids big enough to fit over the\r\nbanana, leaving a 1cm border around the\r\nedge. Place the pastry on a baking tray\r\nand put in the fridge.","Set an ovenproof, heavy-bottomed\r\nfrying pan over a medium heat. Add the\r\nsugar, butter and cream, and cook for\r\n5 mins until the sugar has melted and\r\nthe caramel is bubbling. Add ½ tsp sea\r\nsalt flakes. Slice the banana in half\r\nlengthways and place the 2 halves,\r\ncut-side down, into the caramel.","Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nPlace a pastry lid on top of each banana\r\nhalf, tucking each in tightly around the\r\nedges. This can be done 1 hr ahead.\r\nTransfer the pan to the oven and cook\r\nfor 20 mins until the pastry is risen and\r\ngolden. Quickly and carefully turn out the\r\nTatins, sprinkle with a few flakes of sea\r\nsalt and serve with scoops of crème\r\nfraîche ice cream."]','2026-01-10 12:22:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8932,8932,'en','Chocolate, hazelnut & salted caramel tart','A buttery pastry case with a layer of caramel and just a hint of salt, studded with nuts and finished with a fudge filling','["50g blanched hazelnuts","200g plain flour","1 tbsp icing sugar","140g cold butter, diced","1 egg yolk","flour, for dusting","75g caster sugar","25g butter","100ml double cream","1 tbsp golden syrup","large pinch sea salt flakes","50g blanched hazelnuts, toasted and roughly chopped","100g dark chocolate (70%)","75g butter","2 large eggs, plus 1 yolk","50g caster sugar","1 tbsp cocoa"]','["To make the pastry, whizz the\r\nhazelnuts in a food processor until finely\r\nground. Add the flour, icing sugar and\r\nbutter, and pulse until the mixture\r\nresembles breadcrumbs. Add the egg\r\nyolk and 1-2 tbsp cold water, and pulse\r\nuntil the dough comes together. Tip the\r\ndough out and flatten into a disc, then\r\nwrap in cling film and chill for 30 mins.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nOn a floured surface, roll out the pastry\r\nto line a 23cm loose-bottomed, deep\r\ntart tin. Trim the edges and prick the\r\nbase with a fork, then line with baking\r\nparchment and fill with baking beans.\r\nBake for 20 mins, then carefully remove\r\nthe baking beans and parchment and\r\nbake for a further 5-10 mins until light\r\ngolden. Allow to cool.","Meanwhile, make the salted caramel.\r\nTip the sugar into a small pan, add\r\n1-2 tbsp water and heat gently to dissolve\r\nthe sugar. Increase the heat and cook\r\nuntil the sugar turns to an ambercoloured\r\ncaramel. Reduce the heat and\r\nadd the butter, cream and golden syrup,\r\nand stir until the sauce is smooth and\r\nthickened. Remove from the heat and\r\nadd the salt. Allow to cool for a few mins,\r\nthen spread onto the tart base. Scatter\r\nwith chopped hazelnuts and set aside.","For the chocolate filling, melt the\r\nchocolate and butter in a heatproof bowl\r\nset over a pan of simmering water. Stir\r\nuntil smooth, then remove from the heat\r\nand allow to cool slightly. In a separate\r\nbowl, whisk the eggs, egg yolk and caster\r\nsugar for about 6 mins until thick and\r\npale. Fold in the melted chocolate and\r\ncocoa, then pour into the tart case.\r\nTransfer to a baking sheet and cook for\r\n20-25 mins or until set and the top has\r\nformed a crust. Allow to cool to room\r\ntemperature before serving in slices."]','2026-01-10 12:22:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8934,8934,'en','Salted caramel & peanut butter billionaire’s slice','This popular shortbread bake is placed in a whole new league with the addition of an extra layer of indulgence plus a salted toffee topping','["225g butter, chopped into cubes, plus a little for greasing","140g unsalted peanuts, toasted and cooled","225g plain flour","50g cornflour","85g golden caster sugar","140g butter","225g smooth peanut butter","140g icing sugar","2 X 397g cans Carnation caramel","1½ tsp flaky sea salt or ½ tsp fine sea salt","3 x 100g bars dark chocolate, broken into small pieces","140g soft dairy toffees","3 tbsp milk","½  tsp flaky sea salt"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line a 20 x 30cm rectangular\r\ncake tin with baking parchment – the\r\nbest way to do this is with 2 long strips\r\nof parchment. Put the ingredients for\r\nthe base in a food processor and blitz\r\nuntil it starts to clump together – don’t\r\nworry if the peanuts are still a little\r\nchunky, they will add a lovely texture.\r\nTip onto your work surface and knead\r\nbriefly to bring together as a dough.\r\nPress the dough into the base of your\r\ntin in an even layer. Bake for 25 mins\r\nuntil golden, then set aside to cool.","To make the peanut butter layer, melt\r\nthe butter and peanut butter in a small\r\npan and mix until smooth. Sieve the\r\nicing sugar into a bowl, then pour in the\r\nhot butter mixture and stir to combine.\r\nWhile the mixture is still warm, pour over\r\nthe base and smooth out with a spatula.\r\nChill for 2 hrs until set.","To make the caramel layer, put the\r\ncaramel and salt in a pan, bring up to the\r\nboil and simmer vigorously for 2-3 mins,\r\nwhisking continuously, until the colour\r\ndarkens a shade or two and the caramel\r\nthickens slightly. Leave the caramel to\r\ncool for 20 mins (see tips, below).\r\nOnce cooled, pour it over the peanut\r\nbutter layer and return to the fridge for\r\na further 2 hrs.","Melt the chocolate in a heatproof bowl\r\nset over a pan of barely simmering water.\r\nMeanwhile, put the toffees and the milk\r\nin a small saucepan and gently heat. They\r\nwill clump together and struggle to melt\r\nat first, but keep heating and eventually\r\nthey will turn into a runny toffee sauce.","Remove the tin from the fridge and\r\npour the chocolate over the salted\r\ncaramel layer, tipping the tin to spread\r\nthe chocolate over the surface. Use a\r\nspoon to quickly drizzle the caramel over\r\nthe chocolate in a thin loopy pattern (or\r\nsee tip, below). If the toffee starts to get\r\ntoo thick, add a splash more milk or\r\ncream and pop it back on the heat until\r\nrunny. Sprinkle over the sea salt flakes\r\nand put the tin back in the fridge to chill\r\nfor 2 hrs before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:22:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8938,8938,'en','Orange crème caramel cheesecakes','These individual cheesecakes are better made a couple of days ahead so the caramel in the ramekin dissolves into a sticky sauce','["284ml pot double cream","peel from 1 orange","225g caster sugar","4 tbsp orange liqueur","200g tub cream cheese","4 eggs","250g digestive biscuits","85g butter, melted","100g caster sugar","sunflower oil"]','["Heat oven to 150C/fan 130C/gas 2. In a small pan, bring the cream to the boil with the orange peel, then set aside to infuse. Tip 140g/5oz sugar into another saucepan with just enough water to make it sludgy. Bring to the boil, then turn the heat down to a simmer and boil to make a darkish caramel. Add 2 tbsp of the orange liqueur (watch out as it will splutter). Leave it to settle slightly, then pour the caramel over the base of 6 x 250ml ramekins and set aside.","Beat the cream cheese and the remaining 85g/3oz sugar together \r\nin a large bowl, then beat in the eggs and the remaining orange liqueur. Strain in the infused cream, then beat everything together to make a custard. Skim off any froth and set aside.","Boil the kettle. Place the ramekins in a deep roasting tin. Divide the custard between them – it will only come to halfway – then bring the tin to the oven and fill with hot water from \r\nthe kettle so it comes halfway up the outside of the ramekin dishes. Bake the cheesecakes for 40 mins or until just set, then remove from the oven and the tin. Leave to cool, then chill \r\nat least overnight. These can be made up to 2 days ahead and left to chill.","Up to 2 days before serving, make the bases. Crumble the biscuits into \r\na food processor, then blitz to fine crumbs. Add the melted butter and pulse until everything is mixed. Line \r\na flat baking tray with greaseproof paper, tip the base mix onto it, then top with another sheet of greaseproof paper. Gently roll the mix out until large enough to cut 6 bases the same size as the ramekins out of it. Chill.","To make the caramel squiggles, \r\nheat the sugar with a little water in a saucepan and boil to make caramel, then set aside to cool slightly. Line \r\na tray with baking parchment and grease with a little oil. Drizzle the caramel up and down so that all \r\nthe strands of caramel stick together \r\nto create stars, then leave to set.","To serve, use a cutter the same diameter as the ramekin to cut out \r\n6 bases from the biscuit mix. Lift \r\nthe bases onto 6 plates. Unmould the cheesecakes, saving the caramel sauce in the ramekin. Top the bases with the crème caramels, drizzle the sauce over and around the plates, garnish with a star and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8940,8940,'en','Iced vanilla & caramel profiteroles','Filled with rich vanilla ice cream and drenched in caramel sauce, these decadent caramel profiteroles make a spectacular dessert','["50g butter","60g plain flour","1 tbsp caster sugar","2 eggs, beaten","200g caster sugar","2 tbsp double cream","splash cognac","300g good-quality vanilla ice cream, bought or homemade (see below)","250ml milk","250ml double cream","50g sugar","6 egg yolks","seeds of 2 vanilla pod"]','["Put 150ml water, the butter and a pinch of salt into a medium pan and gently heat until the butter melts. Turn up the heat\r\nand bring to the boil. As soon as it’s boiling, tip in the flour in one go. Beat quickly to combine. TIP: It’s important to tip the flour in as soon as the water boils, because losing too much liquid by evaporation will affect your pastry.","The starch in the flour needs to be cooked out now. Beat well, over the heat, until the mix turns smooth and glossy and starts to come away from the edge of the pan. Tip the mix into a bowl and allow to cool a little.","Give the mixture a quick beat, then start adding the eggs a little at a time, using a whisk, wooden spoon or electric beaters. You may not need to add all the egg – stop once the pastry is smooth and elastic and drops easily off a spoon.","Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Drop a medium nozzle into a large piping bag and scoop the pastry into it. Line two baking sheets with non-stick paper and pipe 15 x 10p-size balls of pastry onto each one. Use a wetted finger to smooth the tops. Bake for 15-20 mins until dark golden and very firm. Transfer to a rack, turn each one upside down, then leave to cool. Will keep in an airtight container for up to 2 days. TIP: The just-piped pastry buns have pointy tops, which can quickly burn. Tap them down gently with a wet finger before you put them in to bake.","For the sauce, heat the sugar in a large, non-stick frying pan. Melt it gently, swirling every now and again until dissolved. Turn up the heat a little, then bubble until you have a dark golden caramel, about 5 minutes in total. Keep the pan on the heat and carefully stir in the cream to make a silky sauce. Add the Cognac and stir again. Pour into a serving jug. Can be\r\nmade up to 2 days ahead – warm in the microwave for a few secs and stir to loosen.","If making your own ice cream, place the milk and double cream in a pan. Take 1 tbsp of the sugar and add to the pan, too. Whisk the remaining sugar with the egg yolks and the seeds of the vanilla pods. Heat the milk until just boiling, then pour it onto the egg mix, whisking constantly. Tip back into the pan and heat gently, stirring with a wooden spoon until the custard thickens and coats the back of a spoon. Pour through a sieve and allow to cool. Now churn the mix in an ice-cream machine, or freeze it in a shallow container, beating thoroughly at least three times, until it is frozen and smooth. Will keep frozen for up to 1 month. Makes about 500 ml, 5 mins prep, 20 mins cooking and freezing.","Allow the ice cream to soften slightly in the fridge for 30 mins. Scoop into a piping bag then, holding the bag with\r\na tea towel, poke the nozzle into the bottom of one of the buns. Pipe in the ice cream until completely filled (see tips). Work as quickly as you can – you need to get the profiteroles back in the freezer before the ice cream starts to melt. Will keep well-wrapped in the freezer for up to 1 week. NOTE: Wrapping a tea towel around the piping bag insulates the ice cream from the warmth of your hands. If piping in the ice cream seems too fiddly, simply cut the buns open with a serrated knife and fill with teaspoon-size scoops of ice cream."]','2026-01-10 12:22:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8942,8942,'en','Caramel ripple cheesecake cups','Individual pudding pots with almond flavours from crunchy amaretti biscuits combined with smooth cream and caramel','["100g amaretti biscuits (about 20)","400g soft cheese","50g golden caster sugar","¼ tsp vanilla extract","6 tbsp caramel sauce, we used Carnation, beaten until smooth"]','["Crush the biscuits into large crumbs and divide between 4 ramekins or small glasses.","In a bowl, beat the cheese with the sugar and vanilla then add 4 tbsp of the sauce and beat until mostly incorporated but still streaked slightly. Carefully spoon over the biscuits and smooth the top.","Spoon the rest of the caramel over the top and use a teaspoon to swirl the top of the cheese layer with the caramel. Set in the fridge for at least 2 hours but up to 2 days before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8944,8944,'en','Caramel sauce','This classic sauce uses only three ingredients. Drizzle around chocolate puddings or over your favourite ice cream','["250g caster sugar","142ml pot double cream","50g butter"]','["Tip the sugar into a heavy-based frying\r\npan, stir in 4 tbsp water, then place over\r\na medium heat until the sugar has dissolved.\r\nTurn up the heat and bubble for 4-5 mins\r\nuntil you have caramel. Take off the heat,\r\nthen carefully stir in the cream and butter.\r\nLeave the sauce to cool, then tip into a\r\nsqueezy bottle."]','2026-01-10 12:22:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8946,8946,'en','Nutty caramel & choc sundaes','Reach into your storecupboard and freezer to create this sumptuous ice cream medley with salted peanuts, biscuits and caramel','["100g dark chocolate, broken into chunks","200ml milk","300g/11oz caramel (we used Carnation)","85g crunchy peanut butter","4 crunchy biscuits, crumbled into chunks (we used Fox''s butter crinkle crunch biscuits)","50g salted roasted peanuts, chopped","6 big scoops vanilla ice cream","6 big scoops chocolate ice cream"]','["Put the chocolate and 100ml milk in a\r\nsmall pan, and put the caramel, peanut\r\nbutter and 100ml milk in another pan.\r\nGently melt both, stirring until saucy.\r\nSet aside to cool.","Give the sauces a good stir to loosen,\r\nthen layer the 2 sauces, biscuit bits,\r\npeanuts and ice cream in 6 sundae\r\nglasses or bowls, and eat straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:22:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8947,8947,'en','Caramel soufflés with caramel sauce','Soufflés are always an after-dinner winner, and these saucy caramel treats are no exception','["100g unsalted butter, plus extra for greasing","200g light, soft brown sugar, plus 4 tbsp extra","200ml whipping cream","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 egg yolks","1 tbsp plain flour","3 egg whites"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nButter 5 x 150ml individual soufflé dishes\r\nor ramekins and sprinkle all over with\r\n2 tbsp soft brown sugar. Place on a\r\nbaking sheet. Melt the butter in a\r\nsaucepan, then add sugar, cream, vanilla\r\nand a good pinch salt. When sugar is\r\nmelted, bubble for 1 min until it looks like\r\na sauce. Pour 200ml into a jug for serving.","Stir egg yolks and flour into remaining\r\ncaramel in the saucepan. Whisk constantly\r\nover medium heat until mixture thickens,\r\nabout 3 mins. Sieve into a bowl and cool\r\nfor 15 mins. Beat egg whites in large bowl\r\nuntil foamy, then gradually beat in\r\nremaining 2 tbsp sugar until whites are\r\nstiff but not dry. Fold one-third of whites\r\ninto caramel mixture in the pan, then fold\r\nthat back into the whites. Divide among\r\ndishes, and use a palette knife to scrape\r\ntop level. Bake until soufflés are puffed\r\nand golden – about 11 mins. The soufflés\r\nshould still be a little unset in the middle,\r\nbut not runny, so if you’re serving four,\r\nbreak into your tester to check. Return\r\nthe rest to oven for 2 mins if underdone.\r\nServe immediately with caramel sauce,\r\nwarmed a little while soufflés are baking."]','2026-01-10 12:22:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8948,8948,'en','Caramel apple loaf cake','Moist cake topped with a sticky, crunchy topping will keep your guests coming back for more','["175g soft butter, plus extra for greasing","175g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 eggs","225g self-raising flour","½ tsp cinnamon","4 rounded tbsp Greek yogurt","2 eating apples","50g walnuts, very roughly chopped, plus 1 tbsp extra, chopped","50g soft toffees (we used Werther''s chewy toffees)","2 tbsp double cream"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease a 2lb loaf tin and line the base and\r\nends with a long strip of baking paper.","Beat together the butter, sugar and\r\nvanilla until pale, then beat in the eggs,\r\none by one. Tip in the flour, cinnamon\r\nand yogurt. Peel, core and chop apples\r\ninto small chunks, then add to the bowl\r\nand mix everything together with a\r\nwooden spoon.","Scrape into the tin, smooth the top and\r\nscatter the walnuts down the middle.\r\nBake on a middle shelf for 1 hr 20-30 mins\r\nuntil a skewer poked in comes out clean.\r\nCool in the tin.","To decorate, put the toffees in a small\r\nsaucepan with the double cream. Gently\r\nheat, stirring, until toffees have melted\r\ninto a smooth caramel sauce. Cool for\r\nabout 1 min while you gently turn out the\r\ncake. Slowly drizzle the toffee sauce over\r\nthe top of the cake. Scatter immediately\r\nwith the extra walnuts – they should stick\r\nwhere they hit toffee. Leave for 10 mins\r\nbefore serving. Best fresh but will keep\r\nin an airtight tin for 3-4 days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8949,8949,'en','Next level black forest gateau','Rework this retro crowdpleaser with a thicker, creamier filling and more chocolate for pure indulgence. It’s the perfect centrepiece dessert','["200g unsalted butter , plus extra for the tins","200g dark chocolate , chopped","300g plain flour","50g cocoa powder , sifted, plus extra for dusting","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","400g light brown soft sugar","300ml natural yogurt","2 tsp vanilla extract","3 eggs","100ml syrup from the jarred cherries (see below), topped up with water if needed","2 tbsp kirsch (optional)","150g dark chocolate , chilled","500g mascarpone","600ml double cream","100g caster sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","8 tbsp cherry conserve","2 x 370 jars black cherries , drained and syrup reserved (you may not need all the cherries)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter the bases of two deep 20cm springform cake tins and line with baking parchment. Melt the butter and chocolate together in a heatproof bowl in short bursts in the microwave, or over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Stir until smooth, then set aside.","Combine the flour, cocoa, baking powder, bicarb, sugar and ½ tsp salt in a large bowl. Whisk the yogurt, vanilla and eggs together in a jug until smooth. Pour the yogurt mixture and melted chocolate mixture into the dry ingredients, then fold together to combine into a thick batter.","Divide the batter between the tins and bake for 30-35 mins, or until risen and a skewer inserted in the centres comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack and leave to cool completely. Will keep chilled and wrapped for up to three days or frozen for three months. Trim the tops of the sponges so they sit flat.","Meanwhile, combine the cherry syrup with the kirsch, if using, and set aside. Will keep chilled for three days. (If you prefer not to use kirsch, set aside the cherry syrup as is.) Shave the chilled chocolate using a veg peeler, and chill the flakes again or freeze on a tray lined with baking parchment until ready to use. For the filling, beat the mascarpone, cream, sugar and vanilla together to firm peaks using an electric whisk.","To assemble, cut each sponge in half through the equator so you have four even layers. Secure one layer on a serving plate or cake stand using a little whipped cream. Generously brush over some of the syrup, then spread over half the cherry conserve. Top with a second sponge layer, brush with more syrup, then spread over about a quarter of the whipped cream. Arrange enough cherries on top to just cover the cream (reserving 12-14 to decorate), then spoon over a bit more cream to cover the cherries. Top with the third sponge, brush with more syrup and spread over the remaining conserve, then sandwich with the final sponge, cut-side down. Brush over the rest of the syrup.","Spoon about a quarter of the remaining cream into a piping bag fitted with a star nozzle and set aside. Spread the rest over the top and side of the cake, smoothing it with a palette knife. Put the cake on a serving plate or stand on a large tray or dish, and press most of the cold chocolate shavings all over the side of the cake, re-pressing any that fall onto the tray back onto the cake so it’s fully coated. Scatter any remaining chocolate shavings on top. Pipe 12-14 cream swirls around the top edge, then put a cherry on each swirl. Chill until ready to serve. Will keep chilled for up to a day."]','2026-01-10 12:22:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8950,8950,'en','Cherry bakewell cake','Bring all the beloved flavours of the classic bakewell tart together into a showstopping cake. It’s just the thing for a celebration or afternoon tea','["300g salted butter , softened, plus extra for the tins","300g golden caster sugar","2 tsp almond extract","4 medium eggs , at room temperature (use ‘golden-yolked’ eggs for a richer yellow sponge)","75ml milk","150g self-raising flour","150g ground almonds","1 tsp baking powder","a few flaked toasted almonds","380g butter , softened","650g icing sugar","½ tsp almond extract","2-3 tbsp milk (optional)","drop of pink food colouring","400g cherries , 12 with stalks attached","300g black cherry conserve or jam"]','["Butter three 20cm loose-bottomed cake tins and line with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Weigh the butter, sugar and almond extract into a large bowl or the bowl of a stand mixer, and beat using an electric whisk (or the mixer) for 2-3 mins until light and fluffy.","Whisk the eggs and milk together in a jug, and weigh the flour, ground almonds and baking powder into a bowl. With the motor running, add the egg mix to the butter mix, a little at a time, adding a spoonful of the flour mix between each addition to prevent splitting. When everything is incorporated, mix for another minute until you have a smooth batter with no pockets of flour.","Divide the batter evenly between the tins. Bake for 25 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the centres comes out clean. If any wet crumbs remain, bake for another 5 mins, then check again. Cool in the tins for 30 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack, remove the parchment and leave to cool completely.","For the buttercream, beat the butter, sugar and almond extract in a large bowl using an electric whisk until smooth and fluffy, adding a drop of milk if too stiff – it should be spreadable (or, do this using a stand mixer). Spoon roughly a quarter of the plain buttercream into a piping bag fitted with a large star nozzle. Add a drop of pink food colouring to the rest and beat until it is a uniform shade of pink. Spoon about another quarter of pink buttercream into a piping bag and snip off the tip.","Pick out the 12 best cherries with their stalks and set aside. Remove the stones from the remaining cherries, then quarter them. Mix with the conserve or jam. Set aside.","Spread a little pink buttercream onto a serving plate or cake stand (this will hold the cake in place) and put the first sponge on top. Spread a little pink butter cream on top, then pipe a ring of it around the edge (this will prevent the jam from oozing out the side). Spoon half the jam mix into the middle. Repeat with the second sponge, more buttercream and the remaining jam. Sandwich with the final sponge. Chill for at least 20 mins until firm.","When the cake is firm, cover the top and sides in a thin layer of pink buttercream, smoothing it using a palette knife or spatula – this is a crumb coat, which traps any crumbs. Chill for 20 mins more.","Spread the remaining pink buttercream over the cake. You can warm the palette knife under hot water, then pat dry before sweeping it over the buttercream for a neater finish, if you like. Pipe 10-12 rosettes on top of the cake in a circle around the edge using the plain buttercream, then decorate with the whole cherries and flaked almonds. Will keep in a cake tin for four days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8951,8951,'en','Malteser cake','Indulge your inner child with this rich chocolate and malt cake with mascarpone icing. Decorate with milk chocolate shavings, sprinkles and Maltesers','["80g salted butter , cut into cubes, plus extra for the tin","100g dark chocolate , at least 70%  cocoa solids, roughly chopped","50g cocoa powder","80g malted chocolate drink powder","250g plain flour","300g golden caster sugar","1½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp baking powder","2 eggs , beaten","250ml buttermilk","200ml brewed coffee","1 tsp vanilla extract","400g dark chocolate , at least 70% cocoa solids, roughly chopped","50g malted chocolate drink powder","50g golden caster sugar","50g salted butter","400ml double cream","150g mascarpone","milk chocolate shavings","sprinkles","Maltesers"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line the base and sides of 2 x 20cm round cake tins. Tip the butter and chocolate into a heatproof bowl. Set the bowl above a saucepan filled with simmering water ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Stir regularly, until melted then remove from the heat. Alternatively, you can melt in the microwave in 20-second bursts, stirring regularly.","Sieve the cocoa powder and malted chocolate drink powder into a large bowl. Add the flour, sugar, bicarb and baking powder along with a large pinch of salt and whisk together. In a jug, whisk together the eggs, buttermilk, coffee and vanilla, then pour into the dry ingredients. Whisk well until smooth, then pour in the melted chocolate and mix to make a smooth batter. Divide between the tins and bake for 35-40 mins, until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Set aside on a wire rack to cool completely. Will keep in an airtight container for up to two days.","To make the icing, tip the chocolate into a heatproof bowl and set aside. Tip the malted drink powder, sugar, butter, and cream into a saucepan and set over a medium-low heat. Heat gently until the sugar and butter have melted, then pour this over the chocolate, whisking well. If the chocolate hasn’t melted, fill the saucepan with hot water from the kettle and set the bowl over the top, then whisk again. Using electric beaters, beat the mixture until thick and glossy, then add the mascarpone and continue to beat until well mixed. Set aside to cool to room temperature (it will thicken as it cools).","When ready to assemble, set one of the cakes on a cake stand or serving plate then spoon over some of the cooled icing, spreading out evenly over the cake. Sandwich with the other sponge, then layer over the remaining icing, thickly spreading over the top and sides of the cake. Scatter over some milk chocolate shavings, sprinkles and Maltesers® to decorate. Will keep covered for up to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8952,8952,'en','Pumpkin & pecan cheesecake pie','Indulge in our cheesecake pie with homemade pastry, a pumpkin filling and pecan topping. It’s a perfect dessert for autumn','["250g plain flour , plus extra for dusting","125g cold butter , cut into chunks","50g caster sugar","1 whole nutmeg , for grating","2 eggs , plus 1 egg yolk (freeze the extra white to use in another recipe)","425g can pumpkin purée","150g light brown soft sugar","½ tsp ground cinnamon","½ tsp ground ginger","250g soft cheese","125g pecan halves","50ml maple syrup"]','["Blitz the flour and butter together in afood processoruntil the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs, then pulse in the caster sugar and a few gratings of nutmeg. Pulse in the egg yolk and enough cold water (about 1 tbsp) to create a firm dough. Tip into a bowl, cover and chill for at least 20 mins. Alternatively, rub the butter into the flour in a large bowl using your fingertips, then stir in the sugar, nutmeg, egg yolk and water.","Roll the chilled pastry outon a lightly floured surface until it’s slightly larger than a 22cm fluted loose-bottomed tart tin, then use it to line the tin. Prick the base all over using a fork, then chill for 20 mins.","About 5 mins before the pastry has finished chilling, heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Remove the pastry from the fridge, then line with a piece of baking parchment and fill with baking beans or uncooked rice or lentils. Bake for 12 mins, then remove the beans and parchment and bake for another 8-10 mins until the pastry is lightly golden.","Meanwhile, combine the pumpkin purée, 2 eggs, light brown soft sugar, cinnamon, ginger and soft cheese. Grate in about ½ tsp nutmeg, mix well, then pour the filling into the pastry case. Bake for 30 mins until the filling is lightly set with a slight wobble in the middle. Arrange the pecans over the filling in concentric circles, then brush over the maple syrup. Return to the oven for a further 15 mins until the pecans are lightly golden and the filling is set. Leave to cool completely in the tin before removing and serving.Will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8953,8953,'en','Pistachio cake','Try this light and fluffy pistachio cake, topped with sweet pistachio cream, fresh raspberries, crushed nuts and lime zest','["250g butter , softened, plus extra for the tin","200g pistachios , roughly chopped","80g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","225g caster sugar","4 eggs , at room temperature","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g icing sugar","250g mascarpone","200ml double cream","100g pistachio paste","400g raspberries","1 unwaxed lime , zested"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 23cm springform cake tin. Tip 150g of the pistachios into a food processor and blitz until finely ground. Tip into a bowl and mix in the flour, baking powder and pinch of salt. Beat the butter and sugar in a separate bowl until fluffy and pale, around 5 mins. Crack in the eggs one at a time, beating well for 1 min after each addition, until they have all been added. Beat in the vanilla, then fold in the flour mixture gently. Carefully spoon into the prepared tin and bake for 35-40 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Set aside to cool completely on a wire rack in the tin.","Meanwhile, sift the icing sugar into a bowl, then tip in the mascarpone, double cream and pistachio paste. Beat until well combined, then set aside in the fridge for 20-30 mins to thicken to a spooning consistency.","Cut the cooled cake in half horizontally using a serrated knife, so you have two layers. Put the bottom layer on a plate or cake stand and spread over a generous spoonful of the pistachio cream. Top with a generous handful of the raspberries so the cake is covered. Top with the other sponge half, then cover the top and sides of the cake with the remaining cream. Scatter over the last of the raspberries, the remaining pistachios and the lime zest to serve.Will keep chilled in an airtight container for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8954,8954,'en','Tahini Mississippi mud pie','Try our take on this classic dessert from the States – it’s ideal for making ahead, topped with sesame brittle for a stunning centrepiece pud','["300g bourbon biscuits","100g butter , melted","125g dark chocolate (70% cocoa), broken into small pieces","125g unsalted butter","175g light brown soft sugar","2 eggs","100g tahini","75g plain flour","1 tbsp cocoa powder","250g vanilla custard","75g dark chocolate (70% cocoa), broken into small pieces","350ml double cream","1 tbsp tahini","1 tbsp icing sugar","sesame brittle , to decorate"]','["Put the biscuits in afood processorand blitz to crumbs, or tip into a bowl and gently bash with the end of a rolling pin. Mix in the melted butter. Tip into a deep 26cm fluted tart tin, and use a spoon to press the crumbs into the base and up the sides of the tart tin making sure it''s compact and there are no gaps. Leave to chill in the fridge.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Melt the chocolate and butter in a bowl in themicrowavein 30-second bursts, stirring regularly until smooth, or in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water (ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water). In another bowl, beat the sugar and eggs with an electric whisk for 4-5 mins until creamy.","Pour the chocolate mixture and tahini into the sugar and egg mixture.Sievethe flour, cocoa powder and ½ tsp salt over the wet ingredients, then gently fold everything together, being careful not to knock out too much air. Pour the brownie mixture into the tart case and put on a baking tray (some butter might ooze from the tin). Bake in the middle of the oven for 20 mins until just set – it should still have a wobble in the centre. Cool at room temperature for about 2 hrs.","Meanwhile, make the topping. Put the custard and chocolate in a pan and cook over a medium heat, stirring, until the chocolate has melted. Remove from the heat and set aside to cool.","Spread the chocolate custard over the brownie layer. Chill for 30 mins until firm.","Whip the cream, 1 tbsp tahini and icing sugar together until it holds soft peaks. Pile on top of the pie and decorate with the sesame brittle.Will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8955,8955,'en','Carrot & pineapple cake','Make this budget-friendly tropical cake with canned or fresh pineapple. If you’re using fresh, decorate with pineapple ‘flowers’ for the wow factor','["175ml vegetable oil , plus extra for the tin","250g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp mixed spice","300g light brown soft sugar","3 eggs","100ml milk","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g carrot , grated","200g pineapple , from a can and drained, or fresh, juice reserved, finely chopped","75g walnuts , chopped (optional)","pineapple flowers , to serve (optional; see recipe, below)","100g butter","275g icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","150g full fat soft cheese"]','["Oil a 23cm cake tin with a depth of at least 7cm, then line the base and sides with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Combine the flour, bicarb, spices and sugar in a large bowl with ¼ tsp salt. Using your fingertips, rub the floury mixture for a few minutes to squash out any lumps of sugar into the flour.","Whiskthe oil, eggs, milk and vanilla extract in a jug and pour into the dry ingredients. Add the grated carrot, chopped pineapple and walnuts (if using), then fold everything together with aspatula.","Scrape the mixture into the tin and level the top with the spatula. Bake for 1 hr until risen and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. If there is any raw cake mixture sticking to it, return to the oven for 5 mins, then check again. Leave to cool in the tin for 15 mins, then transfer to a wire rack and spoon 1 tbsp pineapple juice (if using canned pineapple) over the sponge. Leave to cool completely.","To make the icing, beat the butter and half of the icing sugar together, by hand or using an electric whisk, until smooth. Add the rest of the icing sugar and the vanilla and beat for a few more minutes until smooth, then mix in the soft cheese. Put the cake on a plate or cake stand and pile the icing on top. Arrange the pineapple flowers on top, if using (see below for the recipe).Will keep in an airtight container in a cool place for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8956,8956,'en','Gingerbread tres leches cake','Give this Mexican-inspired cake a festive twist using ginger and cinnamon. The cake is soaked in a trio of sweetened milks, then topped with whipped cream','["flavourless oil , for the tin","4 eggs , separated","200g muscovado sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","1½ tsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cinnamon , plus a pinch","100ml milk","410g can evaporated milk","200ml sweetened condensed milk , plus 2 tbsp","300ml double cream"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil a 23cm springform cake tin that’s at least 6cm deep and line the base with baking parchment. Put the egg whites in a large bowl with a pinch of salt, and beat using an electric whisk until foamy, about 3 mins. Slowly add 150g of the sugar, a spoonful at a time, whisking continuously until thick and glossy.","Mix the egg yolks, remaining sugar and vanilla together in a second bowl for 2 mins, or until pale and foamy. Add the flour, baking powder, spices and milk, then fold together using aspatula.","Add a large spoonful of the whipped egg whites to the cake batter, beat to loosen, then fold through the remaining egg whites using a large metal spoon (don’t over-mix, or you’ll knock out the air) until smooth. Pour this into the tin, smooth the surface and bake for 40-45 mins until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Combine the evaporated and condensed milks with 50ml of the double cream.","Leave the cake to cool in the tin for 10-15 mins, then carefully invert onto a serving plate or cake stand and remove the parchment. (Be sure to use a plate or stand with a slight lip to catch the excess milk.) Leave to cool for another 10 mins.","Poke holes over the cake with a skewer and, while it’s still warm, slowly pour roughly a quarter of the milk mixture over the top. Leave the cake to absorb this before adding more, then repeat until all of the milk mixture is used up – if the cake becomes saturated before you’ve used all the milk, pour what’s left into a jug and serve alongside the cake later for pouring over. This process could take a couple of hours, but as soon as the cake is cool, you should transfer it to the fridge. Once all of the milk has been absorbed, chill for another 2 hrs, or overnight, to chill and improve the texture.","Whip the remaining cream and the 2 tbsp condensed milk to soft peaks. Spoon over the chilled cake, then dust with a pinch of cinnamon.Will keep chilled for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8957,8957,'en','Frosted pinecone cake','Create this stunning bake for the Christmas table. Decorated with almond pinecones, it’s a perfect centrepiece if you aren’t a fan of traditional fruitcake','["250g butter , softened, plus extra for the tins","300g golden caster sugar","100g plain yogurt","3 tbsp vegetable oil","2 tsp vanilla extract","4 eggs","300g self-raising flour","150g apricot jam","150g marzipan","100g flaked toasted almonds","cocoa powder , for dusting","200g butter","500g icing sugar","75ml milk","1 tsp vanilla extract","½ tsp almond extract","1 egg white","100g caster sugar","8 rosemary sprigs","50g cranberries"]','["Butter two 20cm loose-bottomed roundcake tinsand line with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Beat the butter and sugar together in a large bowl using an electric whisk until light and fluffy, about 2 mins.","Mix the yogurt, oil, vanilla and eggs together in a jug. Add the flour and wet ingredients to the butter mixture, along with a pinch of salt. Mix everything for 1-2 mins until smooth and creamy.","Divide the batter between the tins and level the surfaces with a spatula. Bake for 25 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the centres comes out clean. If there is any wet mixture, return the sponges to the oven for another 5 mins, then check again. Leave to cool in the tins for 15 mins, then turn out onto awire rackto cool completely.Once cooled, the sponges will keep in an airtight tin for five days or wrapped well and frozen for three months.","Make the decorations next. Line a baking tray with baking parchment. Lightlywhiskthe egg white and put the caster sugar in a dish. Bend the rosemary sprigs into curves – this will help them sit around the base of the cake. Brush or dip the rosemary sprigs and cranberries in the egg white, then coat in the sugar. Shake off the excess, then lay on the tray and leave to dry out for at least 1 hr.","To make the almond pinecones, divide the marzipan into five pieces and roll each one into an egg shape. Starting at the wider end, press the flaked almonds into the marzipan at an angle to make them look like a pinecone. Cover one side of each marzipan ball this way, being careful not to snap the almond flakes. Put the marzipan pinecones on a tray and dust lightly with cocoa powder.","To make the buttercream, beat the butter, icing sugar, milk, vanilla and almond extract in a large bowl using an electricwhisk, or in a stand mixer until smooth and creamy, about 3 mins.","Put one cake on acake standor plate, and spread over roughly 6 tbsp buttercream using a palette knife. Top with the apricot jam, then sandwich the second cake on top.","Pile the remaining buttercream on top of the cake and spread it over the top and sides. This cake looks best with a ‘naked’ style frosting. To create this, scrape most of the buttercream off the sides using a palette knife so the cake is slightly visible through a thin layer of buttercream. Clean the plate around the edge of the cake using a sheet of kitchen paper.","Arrange the frosted rosemary sprigs round the base of the cake, and top with the frosted pinecones and cranberries.Will keep in an airtight tin for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8958,8958,'en','Easy speculoos cake','Love speculoos biscuits? Transform them into this cake, which also makes the most of speculoos spread in the icing. It’s sure to be a family favourite!','["175g unsalted butter, at room temperature","175g light brown soft sugar","150g speculoos biscuit spread","50g natural yogurt","4 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tsp ground cinnamon","175g self-raising flour","4 tbsp caramel or dulce de leche","6 speculoos biscuits , roughly crushed","200g unsalted butter","400g icing sugar","100g speculoos biscuit spread"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line the bases of two 20cm cake tins with baking parchment. Beat the butter and sugar together using an electric whisk until light and fluffy, about 2 mins. Add the spread and beat again to combine.","Combine the yogurt, eggs and vanilla in a jug, then add this along with the cinnamon, flour and a pinch of salt. Beat for 1-2 mins until combined. Divide between the tins, level the tops using aspatulaand bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 30 mins until risen and golden, or a skewer inserted into the middles comes out clean – if any wet batter remains, bake for 5 mins more, then check again. Leave in the tins for 15 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack to cool completely.","For the icing, beat the butter, half the sugar and all the spread together using an electric whisk until smooth. Add the rest of the sugar and beat again. Warm the caramel in themicrowavefor 30 seconds to loosen. Sandwich the two sponges together using half the icing and a drizzle of caramel, then spread the rest of the icing over the top and side. Drizzle over the rest of the caramel and sprinkle over the crushed biscuits.Will keep in a cake tin for up to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8959,8959,'en','Spiced apple cider cake','Add allspice, cloves and nutmeg to this apple cider cake for some autumnal warmth. Bramley apples are added to the sponge mix, and it’s topped with crunchy pecans','["125g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","250ml apple cider","1 tsp ground allspice","1 tsp ground nutmeg","1 tsp ground cinnamon","½ tsp ground ginger","large pinch of ground cloves","250g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","150g golden caster sugar","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","75ml Greek-style natural yogurt","250g Bramley apples, peeled, cored and chopped","125g icing sugar, sifted","30g pecans, chopped"]','["Butter a 20cm round cake tin and line with baking parchment. Pour the cider into asaucepan, bring to the boil and boil rapidly for 10 mins until reduced to about 100ml, or by about half. Cool. Combine the spices, reserving 1 tsp of the mix for the icing. Mix the rest with the flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Beat the butter and sugar together in a stand mixer or using an electric whisk until light and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well between each addition. Mix in the vanilla, yogurt and 75ml of the reduced cider. Finally, fold in the flour mixture and apples until no streaks of flour remain. Spoon into the prepared tin and smooth the surface. Bake for 55 mins-1 hr, or until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 20 mins, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.Once completely cool, the cake can be wrapped and frozen for up to three months. Defrost completely before icing and serving as below.","When the cake has cooled,whiskthe remaining 25ml reduced cider with the icing sugar and reserved spice mix until smooth, adding a splash of water if needed to make a thick, drizzly icing. Spoon this over the cake, letting it drip down the side. Sprinkle over the chopped pecans, in a ring if you like, and leave the icing to set before serving.Will keep in an airtight container in a cool place for up three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8960,8960,'en','Pistachio cheesecake','Enjoy a Persian take on cheesecake from Good Food reader Amani Al-Sitrawi, who shares this dessert recipe inspired by a gift from her brother','["500g soft cheese","225g caster sugar","3 tbsp cornflour","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g soured cream","3 eggs","40g pistachios, chopped","4 tbsp pistachio cream, melted","40g ground pistachios","400g digestive biscuits, crushed","140g melted butter"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and put an ovenproof dish half-filled with water on the bottom shelf. For the base, combine the digestives and melted butter in a bowl, then tip into a deep 23cm springform cake tin. Press into the base and up the side using aspatula. Set aside on a baking tray.","Whiskthe cheese, sugar, cornflour, vanilla and soured cream together, then add the eggs, one at a time, beating until creamy. Mix in the chopped pistachios, then pour the filling over the base. Bake on the middle shelf for 10 mins, then reduce the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2 and bake for 40 mins more until set with a slight wobble in the middle. Turn off the oven and leave the cheesecake inside with the door ajar for 30 mins (to avoid cracks). Leave to cool completely, then chill for 24 hrs. Pour over the pistachio cream and sprinkle with the ground pistachios to serve.Will keep chilled for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8961,8961,'en','Strawberry lemonade cake','Wow guests with this showstopping celebration cake. It tastes of strawberry lemonade, with lemon-syrup-soaked sponges, a cheesecake icing, candied lemons and popping candy','["225g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","225g caster sugar","4 medium eggs","225g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","75g natural yogurt","2 unwaxed lemons","500g strawberries","1 tbsp popping candy (optional)","1 unwaxed lemon","75g caster sugar","250g butter, softened","600g icing sugar","180g full-fat soft cheese","10g freeze-dried strawberry or raspberry powder (see tip, below)"]','["Butter two 20cm loose-bottomedcake tinsand line the base and sides with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tip the butter and caster sugar into a stand mixer and beat until pale and fluffy. Or, do this using an electric whisk. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating between each addition.","Add the flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt and mix again, then the yogurt. Zest the two lemons, add this and mix until everything is fully combined. You may need to scrape the sides of the bowl as you go.","Divide the cake batter between the prepared tins and smooth the surfaces with aspatula. Bake for 30 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the middles comes out clean. Cool in the tins for 10 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool fully.Once cool, the cakes can be wrapped and frozen for up to three months. Defrost overnight before icing.","For the candied lemon peel, use avegetable peelerto remove the peel from the remaining lemon in long, thin strips. Use a small, sharp knife to cut the white pith away from the peel, then cut it into thinner strips. Put 50g of the caster sugar in a small pan with 100ml water. Juice all three lemons and pour into the pan. Bring the mixture to the boil, reduce to a simmer and cook for a few minutes until the sugar has dissolved. Tip in the strips of lemon peel, then return to the boil, reduce the heat to a simmer again and cook for 5 mins until the peel is soft. Tip the remaining 25g sugar into a bowl. Remove the lemon peel from the syrup using a fork and add to the bowl of sugar. Shake the bowl gently to coat the strips of peel, then shake off the excess and arrange the candied peel on a plate or baking tray in a single layer to dry, about30 mins.Once set, the candied peel will keep in an airtight container in a cool place for six months.","Spoon 3 tbsp of the lemon syrup over each of the cooled sponges. For the icing, beat the butter in a stand mixer until soft and creamy, or do this using an electric whisk. Add half the icing sugar and half the soft cheese, then beat again. Add the rest of the icing sugar and soft cheese and most of the freeze-dried strawberry powder (reserving 1 tsp for decorating later), and beat until well-combined.","Hull and finely chop 200g of the strawberries. Put one of the sponges on acake standor plate and spread over a generous amount of icing. Scatter evenly with some of the chopped strawberries and put the second sponge on top. Spoon the rest of the icing over the top and use a palette knife to spread it all over the top and sides, smoothing and swirling it as you go. Thinly slice five or six strawberries of a similar size, then arrange these around the base of the cake, with the pointed ends facing upwards. Cut half the remaining strawberries in half, leaving the rest whole with their stalks intact, and pile all of these on top of the cake. Scatter over the candied lemon peel, reserved freeze-dried strawberry powder and the popping candy, if using.Best eaten within a day, but will keep chilled for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8962,8962,'en','Chocolate & vanilla celebration cake','Round off the Easter weekend with this stunning showstopper cake. The sponges taste even better after a day or two, so it’s a great get-ahead recipe','["225ml vegetable oil, plus extra for the tins","300g plain flour","100g cocoa powder","2 tsp baking powder","1½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","400g light brown soft sugar","300ml milk","2 tsp white wine vinegar","100ml strong coffee or espresso, cooled","2 tsp vanilla extract or paste","3 medium eggs","400g butter, at room temperature","800g icing sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract or paste","4-5 tbsp milk","food colouring pastes","edible flowers, pastel sugared almonds or chocolate eggs"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil three 20cm cake tins and line with baking parchment.Weighout the flour, cocoa powder, baking powder, bicarb and sugar into a large bowl, add a pinch of salt and whisk gently to combine. Shake the bowl to bring any lumps of sugar to the surface and squeeze these with your fingertips.","Measure the oil, milk, vinegar, coffee and vanilla into a jug, then add the eggs andwhiskto combine. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry and stir with a whisk until smooth, making sure there are no pockets of flour at the bottom of the bowl – the mixture will be quite runny. Divide the batter evenly between the prepared tins, then bake on the middle shelf of the oven (or middle and top if they don’t all fit on one shelf) for 25 mins. Swap the tins around and bake 5 mins more.","Check the cakes are cooked by inserting a skewer into the centre of each – if any wet batter clings to the skewer, return the tins to the oven for another 5 mins, then check again. Leave to cool in the tins for 30 mins, then turn the sponges out ontowire racksto cool completely.If making ahead, wrap the cooled sponges well and store in an airtight container for up to three days, or the freezer for up to two months.","For the buttercream, beat the butter using an electric whisk or in astand mixerfor a few minutes until smooth and creamy. Add half the icing sugar and beat again to combine. Add the remaining icing sugar, the vanilla and 4 tbsp milk and beat again to combine, adding a splash more milk if needed to make a smooth, fluffy buttercream. Divide between three bowls. Add a few drops of different food colouring paste to each bowl, then mix well – we used pastel pink, purple and yellow.","Spoon the coloured buttercream mixtures into three separatepiping bagsand snip off the tips. Pipe a dot of buttercream onto a cake stand or board and place a sponge on top to help keep it in place. Pipe small blobs of purple buttercream all over the top of the sponge by holding the piping bag directly above the cake, about ½cm from the surface, and squeezing the bag while pulling upwards to create a small peak.","Place the second sponge on top, then repeat the process with the pink buttercream. Add the third sponge on top, then neatly pipe blobs of yellow buttercream over the surface. Decorate with edible flowers, sugared almonds or mini chocolate eggs, if you like.Will keep in a tin at room temperature for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8963,8963,'en','Rose & pistachio cacen ffenest (‘window cake’)','Impress friends with this colourful rose & pistachio battenberg-style cake. It not only tastes delicious, but looks wonderful as part of an afternoon tea spread','["175g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","175g caster sugar","3 eggs","175g self-raising flour","50g pistachios, ground in a blender","few drops each of green and pink food colouring","2-4 tbsp milk","50g ground almonds","few drops of rose essence","100-150g apricot jam","icing sugar and caster sugar, for dusting","400g marzipan","a few crushed pistachios and dried rose petals, to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 20cm square tin. Cut a sheet of non-stick baking parchment into a 40 x 20cm rectangle. Fold in half, so the short ends meet, then lower into the middle of the tin, ensuring the fold sticks up to divide the tin into two equal parts, each measuring 20 x 10cm. The parchment should overhang a little on two sides.","Beat the butter and sugar in astand mixeror in a bowl using an electric whisk for 5 mins until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs one at a time, adding a tablespoon of the flour with the last egg to prevent curdling. Carefully fold in the rest of the flour using a metal spoon.","Scrape half the cake mixture into a separate bowl. Add the ground pistachios to one of the bowls along with the green food colouring and 1-2 tbsp milk and mix to combine. The mixture should form a dropping consistency. If it is too stiff, add a drop more milk. Add the ground almonds to the other bowl of mixture along with 1-2 tbsp milk, the pink food colouring and rose essence (don’t add more than ¼ tsp or the rose flavour will be overpowering). The pink mixture should be the same consistency as the green.","Pour the different mixtures into the different sections of the cake tin, and level the tops using the back of a spoon. Bake for 25-30 mins until a skewer inserted in the middle of each cake comes out clean. Leave to cool completely before lifting out of the tin using the baking parchment.","Level the tops of the two cakes using aserrated knifeand trim the edges so that both are the same size. Slice both cakes in half lengthways to give you two long pieces of pink cake and two of green.","Spread apricot jam along the length of a green piece and a pink, then stick them together. Spread more apricot jam on top of them, and on one long side of each of the remaining pieces. Place the green piece on top of the pink and the pink on top of the green, again using the jam as glue. Brush the top of the cake with more jam.","Sprinkle icing sugar onto a clean work surface androll outthe marzipan into a rectangle large enough to enclose the cake (around 20 x 35 cm). Use the rolling pin to lift away the marzipan, then brush away the icing sugar and sprinkle the caster sugar over your work surface. Lay the marzipan on top of the caster sugar with one of the longer ends closest to you.","Carefully place the cake, jam-side down, into the middle of the marzipan, sitting lengthways, and brush the sides and top with more jam. Fold the marzipan around the cake, trimming the longer edges if you need to. Pinch the edges of the marzipan together and smooth using a knife. Tidy each end by cutting away a thin slice. Carefully turn the cake the right way up onto a serving plate and decorate with pistachios and rose petals, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:22:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8964,8964,'en','Dark chocolate, orange & ginger bara brith','Try a twist on bara brith – the classic Welsh teacake – made with chocolate, orange and ginger. It’s perfect for celebrating St David’s Day','["3 strong black teabags","300g dried mixed fruit","butter, for the tin","180g dark brown soft sugar","4-5 balls of stem ginger, roughly chopped","100g dark chocolate, chopped","2 tsp marmalade","2 drops of orange essence, or use 1 orange, zested","1 medium egg, beaten","230g self-raising flour","½ tsp mixed spice","1 tsp ground cinnamon","pinch of ground ginger","50g dark chocolate","2 oranges (optional)"]','["Drop the teabags into a heatproof jug, pour over 350ml boiling water from thekettleand leave to brew for 5 mins. Tip the dried fruit into a large heatproof bowl and pour over the hot tea. Cover and soak overnight.","Heat the oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3. Butter a 2lb loaf tin and line with baking parchment. Scatter the sugar over the soaked fruit and stir to dissolve. Add the ginger, chocolate, marmalade, orange essence, egg, flour, a pinch of salt and all the spices, then mix to a thick batter.","Scrape into the tin and bake for 1 hr 15 mins. Leave in the tin for 10 mins, then turn out onto awire rackto cool.","To decorate, melt the chocolate in short bursts in themicrowave, or in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water. If you’re making the dried peel, peel the oranges and cut the peel into strips. Press dry with a kitchen towel, then scatter over a baking tray and bake at 90C or your oven’s lowest setting for 3 hrs, checking every 45 mins. Leave to cool. Drizzle the chocolate over the loaf and scatter with the peel."]','2026-01-10 12:22:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8965,8965,'en','Tottenham cake','Treat yourself to a nostalgic vanilla and raspberry cake, first baked in the eponymous north London district in the late 1800s, and still a British favourite','["250g salted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","250g caster sugar","2 tsp vanilla bean paste","4 eggs","250g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","4 tbsp milk","1 lemon, zested","desiccated coconut or sprinkles, to decorate","150g raspberries or blueberries","1 lemon, juiced (you’ll need 30ml)","300g icing sugar","pink food colouring gel (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Butter a 20 x 30cm cake tin and line with baking parchment. Tip the butter, sugar and vanilla into a large bowl and beat with an electricwhiskfor 4-5 mins until pale and fluffy. Or, do this in astand mixer. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well between each addition. Fold in the flour, baking powder, milk and lemon zest using a rubber spatula until smooth.","Pour the batter into the prepared tin and level the top with the back of a spoon. Bake for 25-30 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. If it’s not ready, check every 5 mins to ensure it doesn’t overbake. Leave to cool for 10 mins in the tin, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the icing. Put the raspberries or blueberries into a small heatproof bowl along with the lemon juice.Microwavefor 1 min, stirring halfway through, until softened. Or, do this in a small pan over a low heat. Roughly break up the berries with a fork to release the juices, then press the crushed berries through a sieve into a small bowl to collect the seedless juice.","Tip the icing sugar into a large bowl and pour over the berry juice. Whisk well until you have a thick but spreadable icing – if it’s too thick, add 1 tsp water at a time until you reach the desired consistency. Add a drop of pink food colouring gel for a brighter colour, if you like. Spread the icing over the cooled cake, then immediately scatter over the coconut or sprinkles. Leave to set for 30 mins, then slice and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8966,8966,'en','Unicorn cake','Stop people in their tracks with a stunning unicorn cake. With a light sponge and salted caramel buttercream, it looks fabulous and tastes divine too','["300g white fondant","edible gold lustre dust","multicoloured sprinkles, to decorate (optional)","10g black fondant","325g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","325g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","6 eggs","325g self-raising flour","2 tsp baking powder","4 tbsp milk","450g unsalted butter, softened","900g icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","200g salted caramel (optional)","purple, pink and blue gel food colourings"]','["Start by making the unicorn''s horn and ears – they''ll need to dry completely before use. Roll 225g white fondant into a long sausage shape, with one end slightly thicker than the other. Starting from the thicker end, twist the sausage into a tight coil until you have a horn shape. Pinch the small end upwards into a pointed tip. Next, divide the remaining white fondant into two pieces. Roll each one out into a rough oval on a sheet of baking parchment, then pinch the top end of each oval upwards to make a point. Set the ears aside with the horn and leave to dry while you make the cake.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter the base of three 20cm sandwich tins and line with baking parchment. Beat the butter, sugar and vanilla together in a large bowl with an electric whisk for 8-10 mins until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well after each addition. Sift in the flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt, and fold in using a large metal spoon. Add just enough of the milk to create a soft dropping consistency.","Divide the batter between the prepared tins and smooth the tops with aspatula. Bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 25-30 mins, or until golden and firm to the touch. Leave to cool slightly in the tins, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.","While the cake is cooling, make the buttercream. Beat the butter, icing sugar and vanilla together until pale and fluffy, beating in 4-6 tbsp hot water to loosen the mixture if necessary.","Put one of the cooled sponges on a cake board or stand and spread a little of the buttercream on top using a palette knife. Gently spread over half the salted caramel, if using, then sandwich with another sponge. Repeat the process with a little more buttercream, the remaining salted caramel (if using) and the third sponge. Spread the outside of the cake with a thin layer of buttercream – this doesn''t have to be neat. Chill for 30 mins.","Spread a thick, even layer of buttercream over the chilled cake using a palette knife. Divide the remaining buttercream into three bowls and colour each one differently using the gel food colouring. Ours were light pink, purple and dark pink.","Put a little gold lustre dust into a bowl, add a drop of water and stir to make a gold paste. Using a small paintbrush, paint the unicorn horn gold using the paste, as well as the inside of the ears, if you like. Carefully place the gold horn in the middle of the iced cake, with the ears on either side.","Fit threepiping bagswith three different nozzles (we used a round nozzle and two different-sized star nozzles) and fill each with a different colour of buttercream. Pipe each colour around the ears and horn and all over the top of the cake, coming down one side and over the edge of the front – this is the unicorn''s mane. Decorate with some sprinkles, if using.","Divide the black fondant in two pieces, and roll each into a thin sausage shape. Shape each into an arch, then press onto the front of the cake for eyes. If you like, curve the outer edges of the eyes upwards for eyelashes. Cut into slices and serve.Will keep in the fridge for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8967,8967,'en','Jewish honey cake','This simple honey cake, also known as ‘lekach’, is a must-have sweet treat when celebrating the Jewish New Year, or Rosh Hashanah. It’s best made a few days ahead, as the spicing and texture improve as it matures','["100ml sunflower oil","175g golden syrup","50g runny honey","50g soft dark brown sugar","150ml strong tea, cooled","2 large eggs, beaten","225g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp cinnamon","1 tsp ginger","½ tsp mixed spice","flaked almonds, to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line the base and sides of a 20cm squarebaking tin. Warm the oil, golden syrup, honey and sugar in a small pan to dissolve the sugar. Stir to combine, then leave to cool. Add the tea and beaten eggs.","Lightlywhiskthe flour, baking powder, spices and a pinch of salt in a largebowlto combine. Make a well in the dry ingredients and mix in the wet ingredients, using a whisk or wooden spoon, until combined and lump-free.","Pour the batter into the lined tin and sprinkle with the almonds, if you like. Bake for 50-55 mins, until the cake springs back when gently pressed and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Don''t open the oven for the first 45 mins of baking.","Leave to cool completely in the tin on a wire rack. Wrap well and keep for three to four days before eating, so the flavour can improve. Cut into nine squares to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8968,8968,'en','Snowy coconut loaf cake','Have the kids help you make this snowy coconut loaf cake. Decorate with coconut shavings, ‘snowballs’, and anything else you like','["185g butter softened, plus extra for the tin","185g coconut milk, whisked","250g caster sugar","250g self-raising flour","3 large eggs","1 tsp coconut extract (optional)","25g desiccated coconut","100g butter, softened","250g icing sugar","2 tbsp coconut milk","½ tsp coconut extract (optional)","25g coconut chips or desiccated coconut","white chocolate truffles or large white sprinkles, to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 900g loaf tin (ours measured 10 x 21 x 5cm) and line the base with a long strip of baking parchment that overhangs the sides.","Put the butter, coconut milk, sugar, flour, eggs, coconut extract (if using) and desiccated coconut in a large bowl and beat with an electricwhiskuntil combined. Scrape into the prepared tin and level the top with aspatulaor the back of a spoon. Bake for 55 mins-1 hr, or until the cake is risen and golden brown and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. If any wet cake mixture clings to the skewer, bake for another 5-10 mins, then check again. Leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then lift the cake out onto awire rack, using the parchment to help you. Leave to cool completely.The cooled cake will keep in the freezer, well wrapped, for up to two months.","To make the icing, beat the butter, sugar, coconut milk and coconut extract, if using, in a bowl until smooth and creamy. Spread over the top of the cake using a palette knife or the back of a spoon, then scatter over a generous layer of coconut chips. Decorate with white chocolate truffle ‘snowballs’ or large white sprinkles, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8969,8969,'en','Gingerbread & honey loaf','Make our multifunctional ginger and honey loaf cake. Enjoy with yogurt and stewed fruit for a festive brunch, or try as a teatime treat slathered with butter','["100g butter, plus extra for the tin","100g honey","125g dark brown demerara sugar","4 tbsp milk","½ tsp vanilla extract","200g self-raising flour","¼ tsp baking powder","1 tsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cinnamon","large pinch of grated nutmeg","large pinch of ground cloves","large pinch of ground allspice","1 egg, beaten"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and butter and line a 900g loaf tin. Put the honey, butter and sugar in asaucepanand warm over a low heat, stirring occasionally, until the butter has melted and the sugar dissolved. Remove from the heat and pour in the milk and vanilla, then set aside to cool.","Tip the flour into a bowl with the baking powder, spices and a pinch of salt. Add the egg, then gently fold in along with the melted butter mixture. Once combined, tip into the prepared tin, place on abaking tray, and bake for 40 mins until springy to the touch and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool for 10 mins in the tin, then place on acooling rackand leave to cool completely.Will keep in an airtight container for up to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8971,8971,'en','Vegan birthday cake','Bake a plant-based version of a chocolate fudge cake for a birthday party. Everyone can enjoy it, including guests who have a dairy intolerance or egg allergies','["320ml sunflower oil, plus extra for the tins","450ml soy, almond or coconut milk (the pouring variety, not a can)","1 tbsp apple cider vinegar","500g light muscovado sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract or vanilla bean paste","260g plain soy or coconut yogurt","450g self-raising flour","160g cocoa powder","1½ tsp baking powder","1½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","200g dairy-free dark chocolate","400g vegan spread, at room temperature","2 tsp vanilla extract or vanilla bean paste","800g icing sugar, sifted","colourful sprinkles (make sure they are suitable for vegans)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil three 20cm round cake tins and line the bases and sides with baking parchment (if you don’t have three tins, cook the batter in batches). Whisk the milk and vinegar together in a jug – the milk should curdle slightly. Set aside.","Whisk the sugar, oil and vanilla extract together in a bowl, then whisk in the yogurt, making sure to break down any sugar lumps. Pour in the soured milk and mix well.","Sift the flour, cocoa powder, baking powder, bicarbonate of soda and ½ tsp salt into a separate bowl and stir well to combine. Gradually whisk the wet ingredients into the dry until you have a smooth batter, but be careful not to over-mix.","Divide the batter evenly between the tins and bake for 25-30 mins, until well risen and springy, and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out almost clean. A few sticky crumbs are fine, but the mixture should not be wet.","Leave the cakes to cool in their tins for 20 mins, then carefully turn them out onto a wire rack to cool completely. They will be delicate so be gentle (a cake lifter is helpful). The sponges will keep, covered, at room temperature for up to two days.","For the vegan buttercream, melt the chocolate in the microwave or a bowl set over a pan of simmering water. Leave to cool. Beat the spread and vanilla on high speed in a stand mixer for a few minutes until pale and fluffy. Add the icing sugar gradually, beating on slow to start with, then turning up the speed to max until the mixture is light and creamy. Pour in the cooled chocolate and combine thoroughly. Chill the buttercream for at least 30 mins before using.","To assemble the cake, first use a sharp knife to trim the tops off the sponges to make them level. Put one of the sponges on a serving plate, cake stand or 20cm round cake drum (using a cake drum makes it easier to ice the cake neatly and to move it onto a stand or plate later). Spread over a layer of the buttercream, using a palette knife to get an even, neat finish. Top with the second sponge and spread over another layer of buttercream.","Top with the last sponge upside-down, so the bottom of the cake becomes the top (this will help to keep the icing neat and relatively crumb-free). Spread the sides of the cake with buttercream. Hold the top sponge steady with a palm if you need to stabilise the cake. Once you have the sides covered as neatly as you can, cover the top with a thin layer of buttercream. Use your palette knife to neaten the top and sides. If you have a side scraper, use it to sweep around the sides and top to sharpen the coating. (This is a crumb coat, trapping any crumbs to give you a neat, firm base.) Put the cake in the fridge to firm up and chill for 1-2 hrs.","To finish, cover the sides and top of the cake in the same manner, using most of the remaining buttercream. Press the sprinkles up against the bottom of the cake, about a quarter to a third of the way up. You can dress the top of the cake with a circle of sprinkles, or for a fancier finish, pipe little swirls around the top edge of the cake using any remaining buttercream scraped into a piping bag fitted with a large open star nozzle, then finish with more sprinkles.","Keep the cake in the fridge to stay firm, then remove 1 hr before serving. Will keep, covered, in the fridge, for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8972,8972,'en','Chocolate & raspberry birthday layer cake','Who could resist our chocolate and raspberry cake? Like a Victoria sponge but better, try budget-friendly frozen raspberries for the cream','["225ml sunflower oil, plus extra for the tins","250g caster sugar","3 large eggs","225ml milk","250g self-raising flour","4 tbsp cocoa","1½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","150g raspberry jam","100g frozen raspberries, defrosted","300ml double cream","2 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil and line two round 20cm springform cake tins with baking parchment. Whisk the oil, sugar, eggs and milk in a bowl until smooth. Sieve the flour, cocoa and bicarb into another large bowl, then gradually mix in the wet ingredients.","Divide the mixture between the tins and bake for 35-40 mins until the cakes are risen and spring back when pressed. Leave to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","For the raspberry layer, stir the jam and the defrosted raspberries together. Once the cakes are cool, whip the cream with the sugar to soft peaks, then gently fold half the raspberry mixture through the cream to create a ripple effect.","Spoon most of the reserved raspberry mixture over one of the cakes, then dollop on half of the cream. Smooth over with a palette knife, then place the other sponge on top. Swirl over the remaining cream and swirl the last of the raspberry mixture through it. Will keep in the fridge for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8973,8973,'en','Rainbow zebra cake','Celebrate our 30th birthday with us – or your own special occasion – with this impressive rainbow sponge. Iced with buttercream and topped with coloured sprinkles, it''s a cake that has the wow factor','["375g salted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","375g golden caster sugar","6 large eggs, at room temperature","375g self-raising flour","1½ tsp baking powder","150ml milk","blue and pink food colouring (see tip, below)","sprinkles, to decorate","250g salted butter, softened","400g icing sugar, sifted","vanilla pod, seeds scraped out","100g full-fat cream cheese"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line three 20cm loose-bottomed sandwich cake tins with baking parchment.","To make the sponge, beat the butter and sugar together in a stand mixer or using an electric whisk for 5-8 mins or until light and fluffy. Whisk in the eggs, one at a time, beating well after each addition. Fold in the flour, baking powder and milk to loosen. Divide the mixture between three mixing bowls, weighing for accuracy if you like. Colour one of the batters blue and another pink, starting with a little colouring, then adding more for a deeper finish. Leave one of the bowls of batter uncoloured.","Get the three cake tins and bowls of batter ready in front of you. Spoon a heaped tablespoon of blue batter into the centre of the first tin, then pink in the second, and plain in the third. Working quickly so that it doesn’t spread too much, add another dollop of a different coloured batter on top of each one. Don’t wait for the batter to settle or spread, just keep alternating the colours until you run out. The weight of each layer will cause the batter to spread as you go, so very gently tap and shake the cake tins to even out the mixture, then bake in the centre of the oven for 25-30 mins or until firm to the touch. Turn out top-side down onto wire racks straightaway, then leave to cool completely.","For the icing, put the butter, icing sugar and vanilla seeds into a stand mixer fitted with the paddle attachment or put in a bowl and use an electric whisk. Beat for 5 mins or until fluffy and aerated. Add the cream cheese and beat briefly until just combined.","Place one of the cakes on a cake stand or serving plate and spread 2 tbsp of the buttercream on top, then repeat with the other sponges. Spread a smooth layer of the icing over the top and sides of the cake, using a large palette knife, leaving some slightly less iced spots for a ‘naked’ finish. Top with sprinkles and candles, if you like. Will keep in an airtight tin for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8974,8974,'en','Rhubarb & elderflower cake','Make the most of vibrant pink rhubarb with a cake which combines its delicious tart flavours and sweet elderflower cordial – a stunning centrepiece!','["400g trimmed rhubarb, cut into 4-5cm slices","110g caster sugar","½ lemon, zested and juiced","2 tbsp elderflower cordial","115g unsalted butter, at room temperature, plus extra for the tins","95g whole, skin-on almonds (or use blanched or ground almonds)","200g golden caster sugar","1 lemon, zested","3 eggs, 2 whole and 1 white only","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tbsp elderflower cordial, plus extra for brushing","100g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","130g full-fat natural yogurt","elderflowers, rinsed and patted dry, to garnish (or rose, lilac, geranium or peony petals)","300ml double cream","2 tbsp elderflower cordial","100g full-fat natural yogurt"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Butter the sides of two 20cm round cake tins and line the bases with baking parchment.","To roast the rhubarb, line a high-sided baking tray with baking parchment, add the rhubarb, then top with the sugar, lemon juice, zest and cordial. Cover with foil and roast in the oven for 25 mins until soft. Remove from the oven and reduce the temperature to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Strain the rhubarb from the poaching liquor, reserving the syrup.","Tip the almonds into the bowl of a food processor and blitz until ground (if using whole almonds), but still retaining some texture.","Put the butter in the bowl of a stand mixer fitted with a whisk attachment (or use an electric whisk) and cream it on medium speed for 2 mins, then, using a rubber spatula, scrape down the butter from the sides of the bowl, then tip in the sugar and lemon zest. Turn up the mixer speed slightly and continue whisking for 5 mins until light and fluffy. Turn the mixer speed down slightly, then add the eggs, egg white, vanilla extract and cordial and mix together.","Combine the flour, almonds, baking powder, bicarbonate of soda and a pinch of salt in a bowl. Scrape the butter mixture down from the sides of the stand mixer bowl, turn the mixer to low speed – so it’s just stirring – then spoon in the flour and almond mixture in four batches, alternating with spoonfuls of the yogurt, and finishing with a batch of the flour and almond mixture. Mix until just combined, with no streaks remaining, then add half the roasted rhubarb and 1 tbsp of its syrup to the batter and fold it in.","Divide the batter evenly between the cake tins and bake in the oven for 25-30 mins until a skewer inserted into each cake comes out clean. Remove the cakes from the oven, leave them to cool completely in the tins on a wire rack, then carefully remove from the tins.","For the filling, whip the cream to soft peaks in a bowl and fold in three-quarters of the remaining roasted rhubarb, along with the elderflower cordial and yogurt.","Put one of the cakes flat-side down on a cake stand or plate, prick it all over with a skewer, and use a pastry brush to brush the cake with a little elderflower cordial. Spoon on half the cream mixture, top with the other cake, and brush that cake with cordial, too. Spoon over the remaining cream mixture, top with the remaining rhubarb and spoon over some of the poaching syrup. Garnish with elderflowers or seasonal flowers."]','2026-01-10 12:22:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8975,8975,'en','Triple chocolate & peanut butter layer cake','Make a showstopping cake this Easter. Top chocolate sponge with peanut butter frosting, ganache drip, pretzel bark and chocolate eggs for a divine dessert','["225ml rapeseed oil, plus more for the tins","250g self-raising flour","4 tbsp cocoa","1½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","225g caster sugar","3 tbsp golden syrup","3 large eggs, beaten","225ml milk","200g dark chocolate, chopped","2 tbsp chocolate chips","small handful pretzel pieces","2 tbsp honeycomb pieces","65g dark chocolate","250g soft salted butter","500g icing sugar","45g smooth peanut butter","1-2 tbsp cocoa","200ml double cream","100g dark chocolate, finely chopped","a mixture of different-sized chocolate eggs, some hollow, some filled, gold lustre, toffee popcorn and pretzels"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil and line the base of three 19cm sandwich tins. Mix the flour, cocoa, bicarb and sugar in a bowl. Make a well in the centre and beat in the syrup, eggs, oil and milk with an electric whisk until smooth.","Divide the mix between the tins, and bake for 25-30 mins until the cakes are risen and firm to the touch. Cool in the tins for 10 mins before turning out onto a cooling rack and cooling completely. At this stage, they can be frozen, well wrapped, for up to eight weeks.","Make the bark while the cake is cooling. Melt the chocolate in short bursts in the microwave, stirring every 20 secs, until smooth. Spoon onto a parchment-lined baking tray and smooth over with a spatula to make a thinnish layer, around 35 x 20cm. Sprinkle over the chocolate chips along with the pieces of pretzel and honeycomb, then chill until solid. Remove the bark from the fridge and leave for a minute to come to room temperature before using a sharp knife to cut it into shards (if it’s fridge cold, the chocolate will snap rather than cut). Chill again until you’re ready to decorate the cake.","To make the icing, melt the chocolate in the microwave, stirring between short blasts, then leave to cool a little. Meanwhile, beat the butter, icing sugar and 1 tbsp boiling water with an electric whisk or stand mixer, slowly at first, then turn up the speed and beat until you get a pale, fluffy icing. Spoon out a third of the mix into a separate bowl and stir in the peanut butter. Whisk the melted chocolate into the remainder of the icing, then beat in the cocoa if you want a darker, more chocolatey-coloured icing.","Sandwich the three cakes together with the peanut butter icing. Use half the chocolate icing to coat the sides and top of the cake and fill in the edges between the layers, scraping off any excess. Chill for 20 mins. This is called a crumb coating, allowing you to get a really smooth finish when it comes to the final icing.","Spread the remaining chocolate icing over the lightly chilled cake, smoothing over the sides and top so you get a neat finish. Chill again for 20 mins.","To make the ganache, heat the cream in a small pan until steaming. Tip the dark chocolate into a bowl, then pour over the cream. Mix well until smooth and shiny. Transfer to a piping bag and leave to cool for a few mins at room temperature.","Pipe the ganache on top of the cake, nudging it over the edge and allowing it to drip down neatly. Do this all the way round the cake, then fill in the centre with more ganache. Smooth the top with a knife. Chill for 1 hr for the ganache to set.","Press the bark shards into the cake, sticking up. Add lots of chocolate eggs, popcorn and pretzels in and around the shards. Cut into slices to serve. Will keep for up to three days kept in a cool place in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:22:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8976,8976,'en','Pimm’s cake','Yes, you read right, Pimm''s in cake form. Smooth strawberry and lemon buttercream coupled with cucumber essence make this the ultimate taste of summer','["1 cucumber","zest and juice 1 lemon","300g butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","300g golden caster sugar","4 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","400g self raising flour","1 ½  tsp baking powder","200g butter, softened","500g icing sugar","80g strawberries, hulled","200g butter, softened","400g icing sugar","juice & zest 1 lemon","100g strawberries, hulled and sliced plus 3 strawberries, halved, (stalks on)","3 tbsp Pimm''s","¼ cucumber, sliced"]','["Put the sliced and halved strawberries for the filling and decoration into a small bowl and pour over the Pimm''s. Leave to soak in for at least one hour or overnight. Heat oven to 190C /170C fan/gas 5. Line 3 x 20cm sandwich tins with baking parchment and grease with butter.","Cut the whole cucumber in half lengthways and using a teaspoon scrape out and discard the seeds. Roughly chop the rest of the cucumber and puree in a blender with the lemon juice.","In a large bowl and using electric beaters whisk up the softened butter with the sugar until pale and light. Continue whisking as you add the eggs, one at a time, whisking in between additions. Once all the eggs have been added pour in the cucumber purée, lemon zest and vanilla extract. Don’t worry if the mixture splits - it will come back together when you add the flour.","Fold in the flour and baking powder and whisk once again briefly until there are no lumps of flour remaining then divide the mixture between the three tins. Bake in the oven for 30-35mins or until a skewer pushed into the middle of the cakes comes out clean. Take the cakes out of the oven and leave to cool in their tins for five minutes then turn out onto wire racks to cool completely.","While the cakes are cooking and cooling make the buttercreams. To make the strawberry buttercream, mash the strawberries in a small bowl with a fork until mushy. In a larger bowl whisk up the butter and half the icing sugar until smooth, then whisk in the mashed strawberries followed by the remaining icing sugar. Whisk until smooth and pale pink and place in the fridge until needed. Repeat the process with the lemon buttercream.","Once the cakes are completely cold, put one of the cakes onto a cake turntable and add about one third of the lemon buttercream, spread over the surface evenly then top with half of the soaked strawberry slices. Next, spread one third of the strawberry buttercream onto another of the cakes and top with the remaining strawberry slices. Carefully stack the two filled layers with the final cake on top.","Transfer the remaining buttercreams to disposable piping bags and snip off the ends. Pipe the strawberry buttercream in rings around the outside of the cake, starting at the base. Once you reach three quarters of the way up, switch to the lemon buttercream and continue piping onto the top of the cake. Smooth over the top using a palette knife then smooth the sides with either a large palette knife or, better still a pastry scraper. Use long sweeping movements and gently turn the cake turntable so that you get a smooth finish but a subtle gradient effect where the two colours meet. Scrape any excess icing into a bowl.","To finish, top with the remaining soaked strawberry halves and the slices of cucumber."]','2026-01-10 12:22:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8977,8977,'en','Summer party cake','This generous cake is big enough to feed a crowd and is a combination of all our favourite summer ingredients: strawberries, Victoria sponge, meringues, fresh cream, white chocolate and buttery shortbread','["300g salted butter, at room temperature","300g golden caster sugar","1 tbsp vanilla bean paste (or the seeds from 2 vanilla pods with 2 tsp vanilla extract)","6 medium eggs, lightly beaten","300g self-raising flour","900ml double cream","1 heaped tbsp icing sugar","2 tsp vanilla bean paste","300g good-quality or homemade strawberry jam (see tip)","1kg strawberries, chopped into even slices for neat layers (save 8 to decorate)","pack of gold leaf (optional)","meringue kisses, chocolate bark & chocolate-coated strawberries (see recipes in ''goes well with'')","shortbread biscuits (see recipe, or use shop-bought biscuits)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line two x 23cm tins with baking parchment. Beat the butter, sugar and vanilla in a tabletop mixer (or with a hand mixer or wooden spoon) until the mixture is very light, pale and fluffy.","Gradually mix in the beaten eggs, scraping down the side of the bowl after each addition, until fully combined. If using a mixer, on slow, add the flour until just combined - don''t over-beat as it can make the sponge heavy. If you''re not using a mixer, fold in the flour with a large metal spoon.","Divide the mixture between the tins and bake in the oven for 30 mins or until the cakes come away from the side and the skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Remove and cool in the tin for 5 mins. Turn out onto a wire rack and remove the parchment to allow the steam to escape and the cakes to cool. Meanwhile, make the decorations.","Now assemble your cake. Before you split the sponges, trim the domed tops off each cake with a bread knife. Use the same knife or a cake wire, to split each sponge horizontally, so you''re left with four sponge layers. A good tip is to cut a marker line on each sponge using a bread knife, so that once you''ve cut the sponges and filled them, you can use the line to put them back together in the right place. That way, if your cutting was a little wonky, it won''t make the cake uneven.","Whip the double cream with the icing sugar and vanilla until light and fluffy, and just holding shape. Put the bottom layer on a cake stand or board. Spread with a thin layer of jam, then spread or pipe on a good layer of cream. Arrange an even layer of strawberries neatly round the edge, then dot the middle of the sponge with more fruit. Repeat with two more of the cake layers.","For the top layer, add the sponge and jam, but neatly pipe the cream over. Gently press gold leaf onto the chocolate on the strawberries, a few meringues and some of the bark.","Arrange the chocolate-coated strawberries on top of the creamy sponge, then nestle in shards of bark, meringues and biscuit. Finish with a sprinkling of crushed meringue and a little more of the freeze-dried strawberries (from the chocolate bark recipe). Serve and eat within a few hours."]','2026-01-10 12:22:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8978,8978,'en','Funfetti cake','Perfect for a party, this rainbow-speckled cake screams ''celebrate''! Pipe creamy vanilla icing and scatter over sprinkles for a showstopping cake that adults and kids will love','["300g golden caster sugar","450g butter, softened","1 tbsp vanilla bean paste","8 eggs, beaten","450g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","4 tbsp whole milk","200g rainbow sprinkles, plus extra to decorate","150g softened butter","450g icing sugar, sifted","180g tub full-fat cream cheese","1 tbsp vanilla paste"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/160 fan/ gas 4 and grease and line 4 x 20cm cake tins. If you don’t have 4, halve the sponge recipe and bake in 2 batches.","Put the sugar, butter and vanilla paste in a large bowl and beat with an electric whisk (or in a table top mixer) until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs gradually, beating between each addition until fully incorporated. Add a tbsp or 2 of flour if the mixture looks like it’s curdling.","Sift in the flour and baking powder with a tsp of salt and fold into the cake batter. Pour in the milk and beat to loosen the mixture. Scatter over the sprinkles and ripple through the cake batter before dividing between each cake tin. Bake for 25-30 mins until golden and the sponge springs back when you press it lightly. Swap the tins around in the oven after 15 mins to ensure they cook evenly. Cool on wire racks completely before icing.","Meanwhile, make the icing by beating the butter with half of the icing sugar until combined and fluffy. Add the cream cheese and the rest of the icing sugar, beating again until fully combined. Drizzle over the vanilla paste and beat until incorporated. Put a large round nozzle into a piping bag and spoon in the icing.","When the cakes have cooled put a blob of icing onto a cake board and sit 1 of the sponges on top. Pipe blobs of vanilla icing in a circle covering the whole base of the sponge, then top with the next sponge. Repeat with all 3 layers, scattering over some extra sprinkles on the top. Serve in slices."]','2026-01-10 12:22:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8979,8979,'en','Wedding cake – light fruit cake','This makes the top tier of a three tier wedding cake, or make it alone for christenings, Christmas, or whenever you need a good, lighter, fruit cake','["2 tbsp orange flower water","zest and juice 1 orange","zest and juice 1 lemon","140g unsalted butter, softened","140g golden caster sugar","2 large egg, beaten","175g plain flour","100g undyed glacé cherry, halved","100g dried apricot, roughly chopped","100g mixed peel, chopped (we used Sundora)","100g golden sultana","50g shelled pistachio, left whole","50g (3 balls) stem ginger from a jar"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Grease and double-line the base and sides of a deep, 15cm cake tin. Wrap a double layer of greaseproof or brown paper around the outside of the tin, too, then secure with string.","Using an electric whisk or a tabletop mixer, cream the butter and sugar together until fluffy and light. Beat in the eggs gradually. In a small bowl, mix the orange flower water with the zest and juice of the orange and lemon. Fold the flour, then dried fruit, pistachioes and ginger into the creamed mix, followed by the juice and zest mix.","Spoon the mix into the prepared tin and bake for 30 mins, then turn oven down to 150C/ fan 130C/gas 2 and bake for another 1 hr 45 mins until risen, golden and an inserted skewer comes out clean. Leave to cool for 15 mins before transferring to a wire rack to cool completely.","The cake will keep well wrapped in a cool place for up to 1 month."]','2026-01-10 12:22:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8980,8980,'en','Black Forest gâteau','Impress your guests with this chocolate cherry layered cream cake – a revamped version of a retro classic','["175g salted butter, plus extra for greasing","200g bar dark chocolate","300g plain flour","375g golden caster sugar","25g cocoa","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 medium egg","200g buttermilk or natural yoghurt","425g can pitted cherry, 2 tbsp juice reserved, rest drained","100g morello cherry jam","4 tbsp kirsch (or more juice from a can if you want it to be non-alcoholic)","500ml tub double cream","3 tbsp icing sugar","1 small punnet fresh cherries (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line the base of 3 x 20cm cake tins. Boil the kettle. Put the butter and 75g chocolate broken into chunks in a small pan and gently heat, stirring, until completely melted.","Mix together the flour, sugar, cocoa and bicarbonate of soda with a pinch of salt in a mixing bowl. Whisk the eggs and buttermilk or yogurt together. Scrape the melted chocolate mixture and egg mixture into the dry ingredients, add 100ml boiling water and whizz briefly with an electric whisk until the cake batter is lump free.","Divide the mixture between the tins and bake for 25 mins, swapping the tins round after 20 mins if they’re on different shelves. To test they''re done, push in a skewer and check that it comes out clean.","Prick the cakes a few times with a skewer. Mix together the 2 tbsp reserved cherry juice and the kirsch (or more juice) and drizzle over the cakes. Cool the cakes.","Mix together the remaining drained cherries and jam. Tip 200ml of the cream into a small pan and heat until just below simmering point. Chop the remaining chocolate and put in a heatproof bowl, pour over the hot cream and stir until melted. Set aside until spreadable.","When the cakes are cool whisk the remaining cream and the icing sugar together until softly whipped. Spread over two of the cakes, then spoon over the jammy cherries. Stack the cakes together. Spread the chocolate cream over the third cake and sit on top of the other cakes. Pile the fresh cherries in and around the cake and serve"]','2026-01-10 12:22:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8981,8981,'en','Honey & almond layer cake','April opts for the ''naked'' style of decorating so the cake isn''t swamped with icing, but instead delicately finished with candied almonds and Swiss meringue buttercream','["280g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","225g light muscovado sugar","140g clear honey, plus 2 tbsp","3 medium eggs, plus 4 medium egg yolks (reserve the whites for the buttercream)","280g plain flour","100g ground almonds","1 tbsp baking powder","1 tsp vanilla extract","125ml milk","140g white caster sugar","75g blanched almonds","350g unsalted butter, softened","4 medium egg whites","250g golden caster sugar","2 tbsp clear honey"]','["First, make the honey & almond sponges. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Grease two 15cm cake tins and line the bases with baking parchment. Using a stand mixer or electric hand mixer, beat the butter, muscovado sugar and 140g honey until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs and yolks, one at a time, beating after each addition until well incorporated. In a clean bowl, whisk together the flour, almonds, baking powder and 1 / 4 tsp salt. Add half the flour mixture to the butter mixture and beat until just combined. Add the vanilla and milk, continuing to beat, then add the remaining flour mixture, beating until just combined. Divide the mixture evenly between the tins and bake for 45-55 mins or until a skewer inserted into the centre of each cake comes out clean. Allow the cakes to cool for 10 mins in their tins, then turn out onto a wire rack to cool completely. Leave the oven on for the candied almonds.","To make a honey syrup, put 2 tbsp honey and 2 tbsp water in a small saucepan and heat for 1-2 mins or until the honey has dissolved. Set aside.","Make the candied almonds by heating 150ml water and the sugar in a medium, heavy-bottomed saucepan with a sugar thermometer attached, and swirl until the sugar has dissolved. Meanwhile, spread the almonds out on a baking sheet and bake in the oven for 10-12 mins until golden brown. Heat the sugar syrup to 119C, turn off the heat and stir in the warm almonds. Keep stirring until the syrup coats the nuts and turns white and crunchy. Tip the almonds back onto the baking sheet and roughly chop half of them.","Next, make the Swiss meringue buttercream. Using a stand mixer or electric hand mixer, beat the butter until pale and fluffy. Put the egg whites and sugar in a clean heatproof bowl over a pan of simmering water. Whisk using a clean electric hand mixer and heat the mixture until the sugar has dissolved (you can check this by feeling some of the egg white between your fingers to check that it isn’t grainy). Remove the bowl from the heat and, using a stand or electric hand mixer, whisk for 10 mins or until the mixture forms stiff peaks and has cooled to room temperature. Add the butter, 1-2 tbsp at a time, and beat until the mixture is smooth and creamy. Beat in the honey and transfer to a piping bag fitted with a 1cm nozzle.","To assemble the cake, level the sponges by cutting off the domed tops and split each sponge in half to create four layers. Fix the bottom layer to a cake board or stand with a splodge of buttercream, brush with the honey syrup and pipe a layer of buttercream on top. Gently press the second layer on top and repeat with the remaining layers. Cover the cake with a thin layer of buttercream, then use a palette knife to scrape the sides clean. Pipe a ring of buttercream blobs around the top, or spread a thick layer with a palette knife. Decorate with the candied almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:22:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8982,8982,'en','Orange & almond cupcakes','Delicate little cupcakes with almond buttercream icing- if you’re feeling ambitious, follow our guide to creating an edible bouquet','["300g butter, softened","300g golden caster sugar","4 large eggs","250g plain flour","100g ground almonds","2½  tsp baking powder","zest 1 orange, plus 2 tbsp juice","1 tsp almond extract","200g butter, softened","450g icing sugar, plus a little extra","200g cream cheese","1 tsp almond extract","1 tbsp orange juice","food colouring paste of your choice (we used a mixture of pink and yellow to create coral)","250g pack green sugar paste (or fondant icing mixed with green food colouring)","24 muffin cases (we used green ones)","large piping bag","large curved star point piping nozzle","15cm/6in styrofoam ball","15cm/6in flowerpot (measured across the top)","green tissue paper","sticky tape","24 short wooden skewers (or long ones cut in half)","ribbon, to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3½.\r\nLine 2 x 12-hole muffin tins with muffin\r\ncases. Put the butter and caster sugar\r\nin a large bowl and blend with an electric\r\nhand whisk until pale and fluffy. Add\r\nthe eggs, one at a time, whisking well\r\nbetween each addition. Add the flour,\r\nalmonds, baking powder and a pinch\r\nof salt. Mix again, then add the orange\r\nzest and juice, and almond extract.\r\nGive a final mix to combine everything.","Use 2 dessertspoons to divide the\r\nmixture between the cases. Bake for\r\n22-25 mins, changing the tins over after\r\n15 mins. Remove from the oven, leave to\r\ncool for 10 mins in the tins, then transfer\r\nto a wire rack to cool completely. Can\r\nnow be frozen for up to 3 months.","To make the icing, tip the butter into\r\na large bowl and blend with an electric\r\nhand whisk until smooth. Add the icing\r\nsugar, cream cheese, almond extract and\r\norange juice. Mash everything together first with a spatula (to avoid a mess),\r\nthen go in with the electric whisk\r\nand mix until smooth. Add your\r\nfood colouring and mix again until\r\nyou have an even colour. (If you’re\r\nusing liquid food colouring, it will\r\nmake the icing runny, so add a little\r\nmore icing sugar.)","Fit the piping bag with a large curved \r\nstar point piping nozzle, then fill the \r\nbag with half of the icing and twist \r\nthe end closed. To pipe, hold the \r\npiping bag directly above the centre of \r\nthe cake and, applying a steady pressure, \r\npipe in a swirl, working out towards the \r\nedge of the cupcake. When you reach \r\nthe edge, swipe the nozzle to create a \r\nsmooth finish – you can always cover \r\nthis bit with leaves, so don’t worry too \r\nmuch if it looks messy. When you have \r\npiped 12 cupcakes, empty any remaining icing from the\r\nbag back into the bowl with the reserved\r\nicing. Add a little more colouring to\r\ncreate a deeper shade (and a little extra\r\nsifted icing sugar if the icing gets too\r\nrunny). Whisk again, then refill your\r\npiping bag and ice the remaining cakes.\r\nCan be stored somewhere cool for up to\r\n1 day (the fridge is fine, just make sure\r\nthat you remove 30 mins before eating).","Before serving, add a few leaves, if you\r\nlike: pinch off small pieces of green sugar\r\npaste or fondant icing and shape into\r\nleaves. Use a sharp knife to add detail,\r\nthen stick onto the cupcakes.See tips, below left,\r\nfor how to build your bouquet."]','2026-01-10 12:22:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8983,8983,'en','Chocolate tiramisu cake','This creamy chocolate and coffee layer cake has real wow factor and is ideal for a celebration','["50g butter, plus extra for the tins","4 large eggs","140g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g plain flour","25g cocoa","½  tsp baking powder","1 tbsp demerara sugar","75ml hot espresso or strong rich coffee","4 large egg yolks","75g caster sugar","125ml marsala","200g white chocolate, half chopped, half grated","500g tub mascarpone","200g dark chocolate, grated","1 tbsp cocoa"]','["For the cakes, heat oven to 180C/\r\n160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line 2 x 20cm\r\nsandwich tins. Melt the butter and allow\r\nto cool slightly. Put the eggs, sugar and\r\nvanilla into a bowl and whisk for about\r\n8 mins or until the mixture is pale, thick\r\nand has trebled in volume.","Sift the flour, cocoa, baking powder\r\nand a pinch of salt over the egg\r\nmixture, then gently fold together.\r\nPour the cooled butter around the\r\nedge of the bowl and fold in until\r\nfully incorporated. Divide the batter\r\nbetween the prepared tins and bake\r\nfor 10-12 mins or until a skewer inserted\r\ninto the middle of the cakes comes\r\nout clean. Allow to cool in the tins\r\nfor a few mins, then transfer to a wire\r\nrack to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Dissolve\r\nthe sugar in the coffee and set aside.\r\nPut the egg yolks, sugar and Marsala into\r\na heatproof bowl, then set over a large\r\npan of simmering water. Whisk for 5 mins\r\nuntil the mixture is thick and has trebled\r\nin volume – make sure the mixture is\r\nreally thick. Remove from the heat and\r\ntake the bowl off the pan. Keep whisking\r\nuntil the mixture is cool.","Melt the chopped white chocolate\r\nin the microwave on Low and allow\r\nto cool slightly. Meanwhile, beat the\r\nmascarpone until smooth, then fold\r\ninto the egg mixture with the cooled\r\nwhite chocolate.","Slice the cakes in half horizontally.\r\nPlace one layer in the bottom of a 20cm\r\nspringform tin. Brush with the coffee\r\nsyrup and spread with 3 tbsp of the\r\nmascarpone mixture. Scatter with\r\n1 tbsp grated dark chocolate, then repeat\r\nuntil you end with the fourth layer of\r\ncake. Cover with cling film and chill for\r\nat least 2 hrs along with the remaining\r\nmascarpone mixture.","Remove the tin and put the cake\r\non a serving plate, then cover with the\r\nremaining mascarpone mixture. Mix\r\nthe remaining dark chocolate with the\r\ngrated white chocolate and press\r\ncarefully onto the sides of the cake.\r\nDust the top with cocoa."]','2026-01-10 12:22:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8984,8984,'en','Edd Kimber’s Bakewell ombre cake','Inspired by the classic Bakewell tart, the raspberry jam and almond flavours of this sandwich sponge complement the stunning pink graduated frosting','["325g plain flour","25g cornflour","4½  tsp baking powder","225g butter, at room temperature","400g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 tsp almond extract","5 medium egg whites, lightly beaten","300ml whole milk","300g butter, at room temperature","625g icing sugar","450g full-fat cream cheese","300g seedless raspberry jam","red paste food colouring"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease 3 x 20cm round cake tins and\r\nline the bases with baking parchment,\r\ngreasing the parchment, too.","In a medium bowl, stir together the\r\nflour, cornflour, baking powder and ½ tsp\r\nsalt, then set aside. Put the butter in a\r\nlarge bowl and beat for about 3 mins\r\nuntil smooth and creamy. Add the caster\r\nsugar and beat for about 5 mins until\r\nlight and fluffy. Add the extracts and\r\nmix to combine.","Add the egg white a little at a time,\r\nbeating until fully combined. Sift in\r\nthe flour mixture in 3 additions,\r\nalternating with the milk, but starting\r\nand finishing with the flour.","Divide the mixture equally between the\r\nprepared tins, gently levelling out. Bake\r\nfor 25-30 mins, or until the cake springs\r\nback when lightly touched. Allow the\r\ncakes to cool in the tins for 10 mins\r\nbefore inverting onto a wire rack to\r\ncool completely. The sponge is quite\r\ndelicate, so take care when working\r\nwith the cooled cake.","For the frosting, beat the butter for\r\nabout 3 mins until light and creamy. Add\r\nthe icing sugar, a little bit at a time, until\r\nfully combined. Beat the frosting until\r\nlight and smooth, then add the cream\r\ncheese and half the jam. Mix until just\r\nsmooth – don’t overmix as it will get\r\nthinner the more you stir.","Put the first cake on a serving plate and\r\nspread a layer of the frosting over the top.\r\nThen spread half the remaining jam evenly\r\nover the frosting. Repeat with the second\r\ncake and finally place the third cake on\r\ntop. Cover the outside of the whole cake\r\nwith a thin layer of frosting using a palette\r\nknife, and put it in the fridge while you\r\nprepare the frosting for the decoration.","Divide the remaining frosting between\r\n3 small bowls. Add about ½ tsp of red\r\npaste colouring to one of the bowls and\r\nabout 1 tsp colouring to another bowl,\r\nleaving the third bowl as it is. You want\r\nto have three bowls of frosting with\r\nclearly different colours.","To decorate the cakes, put each\r\nfrosting into a piping bag fitted with a\r\nsmall round piping tip. Pipe 6 dots of\r\nfrosting up the cake, 2 of each colour,\r\nwith the darkest at the base of the cake.\r\nUse a teaspoon or small palette knife to\r\nsmear the frosting to the right. Repeat\r\nthe piping process, moving the dots up\r\none so that as you pipe around the cake\r\nthe colour will graduate in a swirl. For\r\nthe top, pipe 2 rings of the darker pink\r\ndots around the outside, spreading the\r\nfrosting in the same fashion, followed\r\nby 2 rings of the medium pink dots, and\r\nfinish with the lighter frosting in the\r\nmiddle.Will keep for up to 3 days, chilled."]','2026-01-10 12:22:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8985,8985,'en','John Whaite’s Chocolate chiffon cake with salted caramel butter cream','Give this celebration sponge a showstopping finish by piping spikes of ganache on top and filling with salted caramel butter icing','["125ml sunflower oil, plus extra for greasing","7 large eggs, separated","2 tsp vanilla bean paste","375g golden caster sugar","50g cocoa powder","300g plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","250g light soft brown sugar","150ml double cream","140g butter, softened","½  tsp salt","250ml double cream","250g dark chocolate, finely chopped or grated","sea salt crystals, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line a 25cm round deep cake\r\ntin with baking parchment. In a large\r\nbowl, mix the oil, egg yolks, vanilla paste,\r\ncaster sugar and 200ml water until well\r\ncombined. Sift in the cocoa powder and\r\nwhisk until smooth.","Sift in the flour, bicarb and 1 tsp salt.\r\nIn a separate bowl, whisk the egg whites\r\nto stiff peaks. Fold into the batter with\r\na large metal spoon and mix until\r\neverything is well combined.","Gently pour the mixture into your cake\r\ntin, then bang it on the work surface twice\r\nto expel any large air pockets. Bake for\r\n1 hr 10 mins or until the cake springs back\r\nwhen gently prodded and an inserted\r\nskewer comes out clean. (Cover with foil\r\nafter 1 hr if the cake starts to get too\r\ndark.) Remove from the oven, cool in the\r\ntin for 10 mins, then transfer to a large\r\nwire rack and peel off the parchment.\r\nLeave until the cake is completely cool.","Make the salted caramel icing while\r\nthe cake bakes. Heat the brown sugar,\r\n½ tsp salt and cream in a saucepan\r\nuntil the sugar has dissolved. Bubble\r\nfor a few mins, then leave to cool\r\ncompletely. Beat the butter until smooth,\r\npour in the cooled cream mixture and\r\ncontinue mixing until softly whipped.\r\nChill until needed.","To make the ganache, heat the cream\r\nuntil just boiling. Remove from the heat\r\nand pour over the chocolate. Leave to\r\nstand for a few mins until the chocolate\r\nhas melted and you have a smooth sauce\r\nconsistency. Leave to cool at room\r\ntemperature until the ganache is a\r\npipeable thickness, then transfer to a\r\npiping bag fitted with a star nozzle. To\r\nfinish the cake, slice in half and fill with\r\nthe salted caramel buttercream. Pipe tall\r\nspikes of chocolate ganache on top and\r\ndecorate with the sea salt crystals. Will\r\nkeep for up to 2 days in a cool place."]','2026-01-10 12:22:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8986,8986,'en','Raspberry red velvet cake','Puréed fruit imparts much of the colouring in this rosy hued cake, that combines raspberries, cocoa and a good helping of cream cheese frosting','["280g golden caster sugar","175g butter, softened","3 large eggs","280g self-raising flour","75g cocoa powder","150ml buttermilk","1 tsp white wine vinegar","85g full-fat cream cheese","75g puréed raspberries, sieved to remove seeds","¼ tsp red food gel","150g punnet raspberries, optional","200g icing sugar","50g butter, softened","140g cream cheese"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line the bases of 2 x 20cm\r\nsandwich tins with baking parchment.\r\nUsing an electric hand whisk, beat\r\ntogether the caster sugar and butter until\r\nlight and fluffy. Add the eggs one at a\r\ntime, beating well between each addition.","Sieve the flour and cocoa powder\r\ninto a bowl. Add half to the egg mixture\r\nand fold in carefully. Mix together the\r\nbuttermilk, vinegar, cream cheese,\r\nraspberry purée and food gel. Fold half\r\nthe buttermilk mixture into the cake\r\nbatter and repeat the process with both\r\nthe flour mixture and buttermilk mixture.","Spoon the combined mixtures into\r\nyour prepared tins and cook for about\r\n25-30 mins, until an inserted skewer\r\ncomes out clean. Leave to cool for 10 mins\r\nbefore turning out onto a wire rack.","For the frosting, mix together the icing\r\nsugar and butter until soft and creamy,\r\nthen stir in the cream cheese. Sandwich\r\nthe cooled cakes together with half of the\r\nfrosting, adding 150g fresh raspberries if\r\nyou like, then spread the remaining\r\nfrosting over the top.Will keep for up\r\nto 3 days in a cool place."]','2026-01-10 12:22:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8987,8987,'en','Blackberry & almond meringue cake','Impress your friends and family with this fabulous celebration cake','["200g butter, softened","200g golden caster sugar","200g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","2 eggs and 2 egg yolks, beaten","2-4 tbsp milk","150g punnet blackberries","2 egg whites","100g golden caster sugar, plus a sprinkle","2 tbsp flaked almonds","200ml double cream, lightly whipped","4 tbsp bramble jelly"]','["Line the base of two loose-bottomed 20cm non-stick sandwich tins with baking parchment. Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3.","Put all the cake ingredients (except the blackberries and using just half the milk) in a bowl, then beat until creamy and well mixed. Stir in 100g blackberries, along with the extra milk if you need it to loosen the mixture a little. Divide between the sandwich tins and level the tops.","Quickly whisk the egg whites in a clean bowl, adding the 100g sugar, a spoonful at a time, until really thick and glossy. Lightly spread onto one of the cakes, then sprinkle with the flaked almonds and extra sprinkle of sugar. Bake both cakes for 40 mins, then take the cake without the meringue out of the oven and set aside. Bake the remaining cake for 30 mins more until a skewer inserted into the cake comes out clean. Carefully remove cakes from the tins and cool on a wire rack. When the cakes are cold, peel off the paper.","To serve, spread the cream on the plain cake right up to the edges. Spoon over the bramble jelly, then sandwich with the meringue-topped cake and decorate with the remaining blackberries."]','2026-01-10 12:22:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8988,8988,'en','Fruity flag traybake','A fail-safe sponge that’s easier than it looks – almonds and yoghurt keep it moist while its fruity decoration is suitably patriotic','["100g butter or baking spread (Stork for cakes), softened, plus extra for the tin","175g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","2 tsp baking powder","4 large eggs","225g caster sugar","125ml full-fat Greek yogurt","zest 2 lemons","175g butter, softened","350g icing sugar, sieved","300g raspberries","175g blueberries"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nButter and line a 30 x 20cm traybake tin with baking parchment. Measure all the\r\nsponge ingredients into a mixing bowl\r\nand mix together using an electric hand\r\nwhisk until smooth. Spoon into the tin\r\nand level the surface.","Bake for 25-30 mins until lightly golden\r\nand the top of the cake springs back\r\nwhen pressed with your finger, and the\r\nsides of the sponge are shrinking away\r\nfrom the sides of the tin. Carefully lift\r\nthe sponge out of the tin, then transfer\r\nto a wire rack to cool. Remove the\r\nbaking parchment.","To make the icing, tip the butter into\r\na bowl and whisk using an electric hand\r\nwhisk until light and fluffy. Add half\r\nthe icing sugar and whisk again until\r\nincorporated. Add the remaining sugar\r\nand whisk again until smooth. Spread\r\nthe icing over the top of the cold cake.","To decorate, place a double row of\r\nraspberries across the centre and down\r\nthe length of the cake to make a cross.\r\nNext, place a single row diagonally from\r\neach corner to the middle. Now fill in\r\nthe empty spaces with blueberries. Cut\r\ninto squares to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8989,8989,'en','Raspberry spice cake','A show-stopping layer cake of moist buttermilk sponge, jam, berries and cream cheese frosting – a real centrepiece','["250g pack butter, softened","450g plain flour","140g golden caster sugar","140g light soft brown sugar","5 large eggs","4 tbsp honey","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp cinnamon","1 tsp mixed spice","½  tsp ground cloves","½  tsp ground ginger","¼ tsp salt","4 tbsp buttermilk","200g raspberry jam","200g raspberries, plus extra to decorate (optional)","200g pack butter, softened","200g pack soft cheese","200g icing sugar, sifted, plus extra for dusting (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line 3 x 20cm cake tins with\r\nbaking parchment. Tip all the cake\r\ningredients into a large bowl and beat\r\nwith an electric whisk until smooth.\r\nDivide between tins and bake for 25 mins\r\nuntil a skewer poked in comes out clean.\r\nTurn out onto wire racks to cool.","Split each cake in half. Mash\r\nthe jam and raspberries together, then\r\nspread over 5 cake halves, leaving 1 top\r\nhalf free. Sandwich together, with the\r\nplain cake on top. Put on a plate and cling\r\nfilm thoroughly. Invert a cake tin on top\r\nlike a hat and top with 3 x 400g food\r\ncans. Leave overnight.","To finish, beat the butter, cheese and\r\nicing sugar together, then spread over\r\nthe cake. Decorate with extra raspberries\r\nand a dusting of icing sugar, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:22:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8991,8991,'en','Double-the-love chocolate cake','A simple white chocolate buttercream looksgreat when it’s swirled over this gorgeous wedding cake – howeverroughly you do it','["400g butter","200g plain chocolate","700g plain flour","800g caster sugar","100g cocoa","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","4 large eggs","400ml buttermilk","2 x 200g bars white chocolate","550g softened butter","550g icing sugar","2-3 x 80g bags white chocolate buttons, flowers and ribbons, optional"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line the base and sides of\r\ndeep, round 20cm and 15cm cake tins\r\nwith baking parchment – making sure the\r\npaper comes a few cms above the sides.","Boil the kettle. Put half the butter and\r\nchocolate in a pan and gently melt,\r\nstirring. Mix together half of the flour,\r\nsugar, cocoa and bicarb with a pinch\r\nof salt. Whisk 2 of the eggs and 200ml\r\nbuttermilk together. Scrape the melted\r\nchocolate mixture and egg mixture into\r\nthe dry ingredients. Add 150ml boiling\r\nwater and whizz everything together\r\nwith an electric whisk until lump-free.\r\nDivide between the tins and bake for\r\n40-45 mins, swapping round after\r\n30 mins if they’re on different shelves\r\n(the 15cm one should be done after\r\n40 mins). To test they’re cooked, push in\r\na skewer and check it comes out clean.\r\nCool the cakes in their tins.","Repeat steps 1 and 2 again, so you\r\nend up with 2 x 20cm cakes and\r\n2 x 15cm cakes.","Melt the white chocolate in a bowl over\r\na pan of barely simmering water. Beat\r\ntogether the butter and icing sugar, then\r\nbeat in the white chocolate. When the\r\ncakes are cool, split each one in half.\r\nUse the icing to sandwich back together\r\nso you end up with 2 x four-layered\r\ncakes. Sit the 20cm cake on your serving\r\nplate and spread some more icing over\r\nthe top. Sit the smaller cake on top of\r\nthat, and completely cover with icing.\r\nDecorate with the chocolate buttons.","If you want to add some flowers\r\nchoose something edible, like roses.\r\nMake a posy, wrapping the stems in\r\na little damp kitchen paper then some\r\ncling film, add a ribbon and add to the\r\ncake on the day of the wedding."]','2026-01-10 12:22:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8992,8992,'en','Passion cake','Bake Sarah Cook’s scrumptious triple-layer cake for someone you love this Valentine’s Day','["150ml sunflower oil, plus a little extra for the tin","300g self-raising flour","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp baking powder","300g caster sugar","50g desiccated coconut","2 eggs, plus 2 egg whites, whole eggs beaten","2 over-ripe bananas, mashed","140g carrots, grated","432g can crushed pineapples in juice, drained in a sieve, reserving the juice (or briefly whizz a can of pineapple chunks, then sieve)","100ml milk","4 ripe passion fruits, halved","25g caster sugar","200g tub soft cheese","100g softened butter","85g icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nOil and line the bases of 3 x 20cm\r\nsandwich tins with baking parchment.\r\nMix the flour, cinnamon, baking powder,\r\nhalf the sugar and the coconut in a large\r\nmixing bowl. In another bowl mix the\r\nbeaten whole eggs, mashed bananas,\r\ngrated carrot, drained crushed pineapple,\r\nmilk and oil. Beat the egg whites until\r\nstiff, then add the remaining sugar and\r\nbeat until stiff and shiny again.","Stir the wet mixture into the dry until\r\nsmooth and lump-free, then using a\r\nlarge metal spoon or spatula, fold in\r\nthe egg white mixture. Divide evenly\r\nbetween the tins and bake for 25 mins\r\nuntil risen and a skewer comes out\r\nclean. You might need to swap the\r\nposition of the tins after 20 mins.","For the drizzle, scoop out the passion fruit\r\npulp into a small pan. Add the pineapple\r\njuice and caster sugar and heat until\r\nbubbling, then bubble until syrupy. For\r\nthe icing, beat the cheese and butter\r\nuntil lump-free, then beat in icing sugar\r\nand vanilla. Chill until ready to assemble.","Poke the cakes all over with a skewer,\r\ndrizzle over most of the passion syrup,\r\nthen cool. Once cool, spread the icing\r\nover two of the sponges. Sandwich\r\ntogether and top with the third, un-iced,\r\nsponge. Drizzle over the remaining syrup."]','2026-01-10 12:22:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8993,8993,'en','Wedding cake – zingy lemon','Tier two of our three tier wedding cake, this gives a real citrus hit and the drenching of lemon syrup keeps it beautifully moist','["350g unsalted butter, softened","350g golden caster sugar","6 eggs, beaten","140g plain flour","280g self-raising flour","zest of 4 lemons, juice of 3 (about 100ml/3½fl oz)","zest and juice 2 lemons","100g golden caster sugar"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan140C/gas 3. Prepare the inside and outside of a 23cm tin, as before. Cream the butter and sugar together until light and fluffy, then gradually beat in the eggs a little at a time. Add a tbsp of the plain flour if it starts to split. Fold in the flours and a pinch of salt, followed by the lemon zest and juice.","Spoon the mix into the tin and bake for 1 hr 15 mins until well-risen and golden and a skewer inserted comes out clean. Meanwhile, make the syrup by heating the sugar, lemon zest and juice in a small pan until the sugar dissolves. Set aside.","Once the cake is out of the oven, leave to cool until it’s just warm, then use a skewer to poke holes down to the bottom all over the cake. Pour the syrup over, letting it completely soak in after each addition. Leave to cool completely, then either wrap or fill and ice the cake. The unfilled cake will keep well if you wrap it with baking parchment and cling film for up to 4 days, or in the freezer for up to a month."]','2026-01-10 12:22:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8994,8994,'en','Chococcino cake','We know you all love coffee cake as much as chocolate cake, so why not combine the two?','["200g soft, butter, plus extra for greasing","1 tsp baking powder","85g good-quality cocoa powder, such as Cafédirect or Green & Black''s","140g self-raising flour","200g golden caster sugar","4 eggs","2 tbsp milk","2 x 250g tubs mascarpone","85g golden caster sugar","4 tbsp very strong coffee (see tip below)","50g dark chocolate, for grating"]','["Heat the oven, line the tins and make the sponge as described in the ''goes well with'' recipe, sifting the cocoa powder with the flour and baking powder.","For the filling, beat the mascarpone and sugar together, then beat in the coffee. Use half the mix to sandwich the cakes and spread the other half over the top, swirling with the back of a spoon to make pointy curls. Finely grate the chocolate over the top, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8995,8995,'en','Peek-a-boo Battenberg cake','A stunning rose and almond sponge in the distinctive checkered pattern, hidden in sweet marzipan icing','["225g very soft salted butter, plus a little extra for greasing","225g golden caster sugar","225g self-raising flour","85g ground almonds","3 large eggs","½  tsp vanilla extract","½  tsp almond extract","1 tbsp milk","225g very soft salted butter","225g golden caster sugar","225g self-raising flour","85g ground almonds","3 large eggs","½  tsp vanilla extract","1 tsp rosewater","1 tbsp milk","a little artificial pink food colouring (see tip, below)","jar of apricot jam","1 tsp rosewater","a little icing sugar, for dusting","2 x 500g packs white marzipan (you''ll have trimmings, but better to have leftovers than leave yourself short)"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line the base of 2 x 18cm round\r\nsandwich tins with baking parchment.","Start with the almond sponge: put all\r\nthe ingredients in a bowl and beat with\r\nan electric whisk until the mix comes\r\ntogether smoothly. Weigh the mixture and\r\nspread exactly half into each tin. Bake for\r\n30 mins – when you poke a skewer into\r\nthe middle, it should come out clean. Cool\r\nin the tins for 15 mins, then carefully turn\r\nout onto wire racks to finish cooling while\r\nyou make the second sponge.","Clean the tins, then grease and line\r\nas above. Beat together the butter,\r\nsugar, flour, ground almonds, eggs,\r\nvanilla, rose water and milk as above.\r\nWhen smooth, beat in a little pink\r\nfood colouring, bit by bit, until you get\r\na nice colour – it will fade a little during\r\nbaking, so you can go slightly stronger\r\nthan you want the finished sponge.\r\nWeigh, divide between the tins and\r\nbake as above. Cool in the same way.","Once the sponges are cool, cover\r\ngently and chill for 30 mins – this will\r\nmake cutting them easier and neater.","Unwrap the sponges and, if they have\r\ndomed in the centre, trim to flatten. Cut\r\na 6cm diameter circle out of the centre of\r\neach sponge (a 6cm biscuit cutter is ideal,\r\nor make yourself a paper template) and set\r\naside. Then cut a 12cm diameter circle\r\nfrom the centre of each sponge by tracing a\r\nknife around a plate of the same diameter\r\n(or use another paper template). So from\r\neach sponge you should end up with a 6cm\r\ncircle, a 12cm ring and an 18cm ring.","Swap the middle rings of the almond\r\nsponges with the middle rings from the\r\nrose sponges, and fit the cut pieces back\r\ntogether. Handle the sponges very gently,\r\nto avoid cracking or crumbling up the\r\nedges too much. You should end up\r\nwith 4 sponges that look like targets.","Heat the apricot jam to melt, then sieve\r\nand stir in the rose water. Brush some\r\nover the top of one of the sponges and\r\ntop with an alternating sponge. Repeat\r\nto stack up all the layers. Sit the cake on\r\na serving plate or cake stand.","Dust your work surface with a little\r\nicing sugar and roll out your marzipan\r\nuntil big enough to cover the cake (use\r\na piece of string to measure the cake; see\r\ntip below). Brush some more jam all over the\r\ntop and sides of the cake. Use your rolling\r\npin to lift up the marzipan onto the cake,\r\nthen ease it down the sides, pressing to\r\nstick. Trim the marzipan from the base,\r\nthen decorate the cake as you like. Cut\r\ninto wedges and serve with tea. Will keep\r\nfor 3 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:22:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8996,8996,'en','Summer celebration cake','This fruity cake is impressive but easy to make – perfect for birthdays or for dessert','["Easy vanilla cake mix (see recipe below - you won''t need the syrup)","2 x 170g punnets raspberries","225g punnet blueberries","225g tub crème fraîche","icing sugar (optional)"]','["Butter and line the base and sides of a round, loosebottomed\r\n23cm cake tin with non-stick baking paper.\r\nMake the Easy vanilla cake batter (see ''Goes well with''), spread half of it into the tin,\r\nthen mix half the berries into what is\r\nleft. Spoon this over the first layer and\r\nsmooth the top. Bake for 1 hr 30 mins;\r\ncheck with a skewer - it should come out clean.","Cool for 30 mins, then remove from\r\nthe tin and leave to cool on a wire rack.\r\nOnce completely cold, put onto a plate,\r\nsmooth the crème fraîche over and pile\r\nthe remaining berries on the top. Dust\r\nwith icing sugar, if using. The cake is best\r\neaten fresh, but will keep in the fridge for\r\nup to 2 days; return to room temperature\r\nbefore topping with the cream and fruit\r\nand serving."]','2026-01-10 12:22:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8997,8997,'en','Wedding cake – rich dark chocolate cake','This recipe makes the bottom layer of our three tier wedding cake or a simple delicious chocolate cake, perfect with a touch of cream','["650g unsalted butter","650g plain chocolate (70% cocoa)","100ml very strong coffee- espresso is ideal","3 tsp vanilla essence","650g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","950g light soft brown sugar","10 eggs","2 x 284ml/9½  fl oz soured cream"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Butter, double-line and wrap the sides of the 30cm deep-round cake tin as before. Put the butter and chocolate into a medium saucepan, then stir over a low heat until melted and smooth. Stir in the coffee and vanilla.","Sift the flour, baking powder and bicarbonate of soda into the biggest bowl you have. Add the sugar, breaking down any lumps with your fingertips if necessary. Beat the eggs and soured cream together in a jug or bowl and pour into the flour mix. Pour in the melted chocolate mix as well, then stir with a wooden spoon until you have a thick, even chocolaty batter.","Pour into the prepared tin and bake for 2½ hrs – don’t open the oven door before 2 hrs is up, as this will cause the cake to sink. Once cooked, leave in the tin to cool completely. The unfilled cake will keep for up to four days, wrapped as before, or\r\nfrozen for a month."]','2026-01-10 12:22:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8998,8998,'en','Dubai chocolate cheesecake','Draw on the Dubai chocolate trend in this baked cheesecake. With a kataifi pastry base, pistachio filling and chocolate ganache topping, it’s a showstopper','["100g butter , melted, plus extra for the tin","200g digestive biscuits","50g shelled pistachios , plus extra to decorate","50g toasted kataifi pastry , plus extra to decorate","800g full-fat soft cheese","200g pistachio crème or butter","200g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp plain flour","4 eggs","200ml soured cream","150ml double cream","100g dark chocolate , finely chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Butter a 23cm springform tin and line the side with baking parchment. Blitz the biscuits and pistachios to fine crumbs in a food processor. Tip the mixture into a bowl, then add the pastry and the melted butter, and mix well. Press the mixture into the base of the tin and bake for 10 mins. Leave to cool while you make the filling.","Rinse out the food processor, then tip in the soft cheese, pistachio crème, sugar, vanilla, flour, eggs and soured cream. Blitz until the mixture is smooth and a consistency similar to double cream. Put the cheesecake base on a baking tray to catch any unwanted drips escaping the tin, and carefully pour the cheesecake mixture over the base.","Reduce the oven temperature to 160C/140C fan/gas 3 and put the cheesecake on the middle shelf, then bake for a further 45 mins. After this second bake, turn off the oven, and leave the cheesecake to cool inside with the door closed for 1 hr – don’t be tempted to peek, or the cheesecake may crack. Open the oven door after this time and leave it ajar for another hour (you can use a wooden spoon propped in the door to keep it slightly open). Cool for a third hour at room temperature, then cover and chill overnight.","To make the topping, heat the double cream in a heatproof bowl in the microwave in short bursts or in a small pan over a low heat until just steaming. Put the dark chocolate in a heatproof bowl, pour over hot cream and let stands for a few minutes, then stir to make a smooth ganache. Carefully pour this over the cheesecake layer and quickly spread to the edge before it sets. Sprinkle the extra pistachios and kataifi pastry around the edge. Chill the for at least 30 mins, then remove from the tin and carefully peel off the parchment before serving. Will keep chilled for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(8999,8999,'en','Japanese cheesecake (chizu keki)','Try this Japanese-style cheesecake with its signature fluffy and jiggly texture. Decorate with berries and mint leaves to serve','["250g soft cheese , at room temperature","35g unsalted butter , at room temperature","60ml milk","3 eggs , separated","2 tbsp yuzu juice","20g cornflour , sifted","15g plain flour , sifted","75g golden caster sugar","strawberries , blueberries, and a few mint leaves, to decorate"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line the base and sides of an 18cm springform cake tin with baking parchment. Wrap the outside of the tin with foil to make it watertight.","Fill a small heatproof bowl or pan with just-boiled water. Put the soft cheese, butter and milk in a large heatproof bowl and set it over the pan of hot water. Leave for a few minutes for the butter to melt, then stir with a spatula until it is fully melted and the mixture is smooth. Remove from the heat. Add the egg yolks and yuzu juice, then gently mix in the sifted flours until just combined. Strain the mixture through a sieve into another bowl to ensure a smooth batter. Chill in the fridge while you prepare the rest of the cheesecake.","In a clean bowl, whisk the egg whites, gradually adding the sugar, until you have soft peaks (taking care not to over-whisk). Stir one-third into the cheese mixture to loosen it, then gently fold in the remaining two-thirds in two batches, creating a light, airy batter. Pour into the prepared cake tin.","Place the cake tin in a medium roasting tin and fill the roasting tin halfway with just-boiled water to create a water bath. Bake for 20 mins, then reduce the oven temperature to 110C/90C fan/gas ¼. Continue to bake for 1 hr, or until the top is golden.","Remove the cake from the oven and lift the cake tin out of the water bath immediately. Carefully remove the foil and leave the cheesecake to cool in the tin. This step is crucial to prevent the sponge from shrinking. Will keep covered and chilled for up to five days. Once cooled, decorate with strawberries, blueberries and a few mint leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:22:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9000,9000,'en','Next level baked strawberry cheesecake','Elevate strawberry cheesecake with a buttery crust and baked filling that’s velvety and rich while still being light. It’s a stunning summertime dessert','["120g unsalted butter , melted, plus extra for the tin","300g digestive biscuits","25g golden caster sugar","750g full-fat soft cheese","200g golden caster sugar","4 eggs","200ml soured cream","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 lemon , zested","2 tbsp plain flour","400g strawberries , halved","25g golden caster sugar","100g strawberry jam","1 tbsp lemon juice"]','["Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Butter a 20cm springform cake tin and line the base with baking parchment. Blitz the biscuits to fine crumbs in a food processor, or put in a food bag and bash with a rolling pin. Tip into a bowl. Stir in the butter and the sugar until the mixture resembles damp sand. Press the mixture firmly into the base of the tin, then use the back of a spoon or a glass to press the crumbs up the side in an even layer. Chill for 20 mins to firm up.","Meanwhile, for the filling, beat the soft cheese and sugar together in a large bowl using an electric whisk until smooth and creamy. Add the eggs, one at a time, whisking well after each addition. Whisk in the soured cream, vanilla and lemon zest, then sift in the flour and fold through until just combined. Scrape the filling over the biscuit base and smooth the surface using a spatula.","Put the cheesecake on a baking tray and bake for about 1 hr 10 mins, or until the centre is just set with a very slight wobble. Turn the oven off and leave the cheesecake inside to cool with the oven door ajar for 1 hr. (This helps prevent cracking.) Once cooled, transfer to the fridge and chill for at least 4 hrs, or overnight.","Meanwhile, for the topping, put the strawberries in a sieve set above a bowl, then scatter over the sugar and toss to combine. Leave the strawberries to macerate for about 1 hr. Tip any strawberry juice from the bowl into a small pan with the jam and lemon juice, and warm over a low heat until the jam has melted and the mixture is glossy. Toss the strawberries through the jam mixture, then pile over the chilled cheesecake. Will keep chilled for up to two days. Carefully remove the cheesecake from the tin, transfer to a serving plate and slice into wedges to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9001,9001,'en','Terrazzo jelly cheesecake','Try this bright and playful dessert. Cubes of jelly are suspended in a creamy cheesecake to create a contrast of textures and a pretty terrazzo effect','["135g pack orange jelly","135g pack raspberry jelly","300g digestive biscuits","100g unsalted butter , melted","4 gelatine leaves","300ml double cream","100g caster sugar","500g full-fat soft cheese","1 tsp vanilla extract"]','["First, make the orange jelly. Boil the kettle, break up the orange jelly cubes and tip into a jug or bowl. Pour over 250ml boiling water and stir until dissolved, add another 100ml cold water and mix well. Pour into a small container or tray (ours was 20 x 30cm) and leave to cool to room temperature, then chill for at least 2 hrs or until set.","Repeat the same process with the raspberry jelly.","Line the sides of a 23cm springform tin with baking parchment. Blitz the biscuits in a food processor or tip into a food bag and bash to fine crumbs using a rolling pin. Transfer to a bowl and stir in the melted butter until the mixture looks like damp sand. Tip into the prepared tin and press into the base using the back of a spoon until you have a smooth, even layer. Chill until needed.","Fill a large bowl with cold water, add the gelatine leaves one at a time to prevent them from sticking together, ensuring they’re fully submerged. Leave for 5 mins until soft. Meanwhile, in a saucepan, gently heat the cream and sugar for a few minutes until the sugar dissolves and the cream is steaming. Remove from the heat. Lift each gelatine leaf from the water, squeeze out the excess water and stir into the hot cream until all the gelatine has been added and dissolved. Leave to cool to room temperature, about 30 mins.","Tip the soft cheese, vanilla and cooled cream into a bowl and beat together using an electric whisk until thick and creamy.","Cut the jellies into small cubes of about 1cm, then very gently fold them through the creamy mixture, trying not to break them up. Scrape the mixture into the springform tin and smooth the top using a spatula. Chill for at least 3 hrs.","Release the cheesecake from the tin and carefully transfer to a plate, then cut into slices to serve. Will keep in the fridge for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9002,9002,'en','Blackcurrant cheesecake','Use up foraged blackcurrants to make this moreish cheesecake, with the classic digestive biscuit base and creamy topping. It makes a gorgeous summer dessert','["140g unsalted butter , melted, plus extra for the tin","300g digestive biscuits","275g golden caster sugar","100g fresh or frozen blackcurrants (brought to room temperature for 1 hr before using, if frozen)","1 tsp cornflour","900g full-fat soft cheese","4 tbsp plain flour","2 tsp vanilla extract","3 eggs","200ml soured cream"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Butter the side of a 23cm springform tin and line with baking parchment. Put the biscuits in a food processor and blitz to a fine crumb, then add the butter and blitz again to combine. Tip into the tin, then press down firmly into an even layer and bake for 10 mins. Set aside.","Tip 25g of the sugar and the blackcurrants into a small pan. Mix the cornflour with 1 tbsp cold water, then add to the pan. Warm over a low-medium heat for 1-2 mins until the sugar has dissolved, then turn up the heat to medium and bubble for 1-2 mins until saucy. Set aside.","Whisk the soft cheese in a large bowl using an electric whisk until smooth. Add the remaining sugar and whisk again, then add the flour, vanilla, eggs and soured cream, then whisk for a third time until smooth and well combined.","Pour half the cheesecake mixture over the cooled biscuit base, then dot over half of the cooled blackcurrant sauce. Pour over the remaining cheesecake mixture, and carefully smooth the surface using a spatula. Drizzle over the remaining blackcurrant sauce, then gently ripple it through the cheesecake mixture using a skewer or the end of a spoon. Bake for 10 mins, then reduce the oven temperature to 110C/90C fan/gas ¼ and bake for a further 30 mins until set with a slight wobble in the middle. Turn off the oven and leave the cheesecake inside with the door closed for 1 hr, then open the door slightly and leave for 1 hr more. Finally, leave to cool completely at room temperature, then chill for at least 3 hrs or overnight before slicing. Will keep chilled for five days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9003,9003,'en','Blackberry cheesecake','Treat family and friends to this creamy dessert in late summer and early autumn. It’s topped with fresh blackberries – or use raspberries during the summer months','["150g digestive biscuits","50g ground almonds","100g butter melted","700g soft cheese","220g granulated sugar","1 tbsp vanilla extract, plus 1 tsp","3 eggs","250g blackberries, plus a handful to serve","250g soured cream","a few mint leaves, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Mix the crushed biscuits with the almonds and butter, then press the mixture into the bottom of a 18-20cm cake tin, lined with baking parchment. Bake for 15 mins, then cool completely until the crust firms up. Reduce the oven temperature to 140C/120C fan/gas 1 and place a baking tray filled with water at the bottom of the oven.","Beat the soft cheese with 200g of the sugar. When fully combined, stir in the vanilla extract and beat in all the eggs, one at a time. Finally, stir in the soured cream.","Whizz the blackberries in a blender and pour through a fine sieve, discarding the seeds. You should be left with about 60ml of blackberry purée. Mix in 1 tsp vanilla extract and the remaining sugar, then set aside. Pour half of the cheesecake mixture onto the crushed biscuit base and drizzle over half of the blackberry purée. Use a skewer to create a ''blackberry swirl''. Repeat with the remaining half of the mixture and blackberry purée.","Bake the cheesecake for 50 mins-1 hr or until the edges are firm and the centre still wobbles. Turn off the oven, open the door slightly and let the cheesecake cool inside until nearly cold. Then take it out, leave to cool completely and put it in the fridge overnight. Scatter over a handful of fresh blackberries and a few mint leaves to serve.Will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9004,9004,'en','Chocolate orange cheesecake','Rich and indulgent, this fruity chocolate orange cheesecake doesn’t take long to prepare. You can make it the night before, too, so it’s perfect for busy days ahead','["100g butter","200g digestive biscuits","300g orange flavoured chocolate 275g broken into pieces","400g cream cheese","300ml double cream","75g icing sugar","2 oranges"]','["Line the base and sides of a 20cm loose-bottom cake tin. Crush the biscuits either by pulsing in a food processor or put in food bag and crush with a rolling pin. Melt the butter in a pan or the microwave then stir in the crushed biscuits. Press into an even layer in the base of the tin and chill for 30 minutes.","Melt the 275g of the chocolate in a microwave or in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of barely simmering water. Whip the cream to soft peaks then beat in the cream cheese. Sift in the icing sugar and mix well then pour in the melted chocolate and mix until fully combined. Spoon the mixture into the tin and level out the top using the back of the spoon. Chill in the fridge for 4 hours or overnight.","When ready to serve, cut the tops and bottoms off the oranges using a small sharp knife then slice off the peel following the curve of the orange. Holding the orange in one hand over a bowl, carefully cut out each segment and drain in a sieve. Remove the cheesecake from the tin and arrange the segments on top then grate over the remaining chocolate."]','2026-01-10 12:22:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9005,9005,'en','Gooseberry cheesecake','Pair sharp gooseberries with sweet elderflower cordial and creamy mascarpone in this light cheesecake. It’s a gorgeous summer dessert – perfect for a party','["750g gooseberries","4 tbsp elderflower cordial","1 orange, zested and juiced","125g ginger biscuits","125g digestive biscuits","125g unsalted butter","500g soft cheese","250g mascarpone","125g icing sugar"]','["Tip the gooseberries, 2 tbsp of the elderflower cordial and the orange juice into asaucepan. Cook over a medium heat for 10 mins until the gooseberries have softened but not broken down completely. Set aside.","Line the base of a deep 23cm springform cake tin with baking parchment. Blitz all the biscuits in afood processorto fine crumbs, then tip into a bowl. Melt the butter over a low heat and stir into the biscuit crumbs to combine. Tip into the tin and press down into an even base. Chill for at least 30 mins or up to 1 hr.","Put the soft cheese, mascarpone, remaining cordial and the orange zest in a bowl, and mix well to combine. Sift in the icing sugar and mix everything together. Fold in three-quarters of the cooked gooseberries along with 1 tbsp of their cooking liquid, then pour this over the biscuit base. Chill for at least 4 hrs or overnight.","Just before serving, remove the cheesecake from the tin and put on a cake plate or stand. Spoon the remaining gooseberries over the middle of the cheesecake, along with a drizzle of the cooking liquid."]','2026-01-10 12:22:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9006,9006,'en','No-bake PB&J cheesecake squares','Try these peanut butter and jam cheesecake squares. We’ve chosen a fruit topping, but you could opt for chocolate – turning it into a giant peanut butter cup.','["100g butter","250g digestive biscuits, crushed into fine crumbs","500g full-fat soft cheese","100g icing sugar","237g crunchy peanut butter","1 tsp vanilla extract","300ml double cream","4 cubes raspberry jelly, chopped into smaller chunks","200g frozen raspberries, defrosted","1 tbsp caster sugar"]','["Line an 18-20cm square baking tin with a strip of baking parchment, leaving the ends overhanging – this will help you lift the cheesecake out later. Put the butter in a large heatproof bowl that has a wide lip and set over a smaller heatproof bowl filled with boiling water from thekettle. Leave to stand for a minute, then stir until completely smooth. Stir in the crushed biscuits, then spoon the mixture into the prepared tin, pressing it down using the back of a spoon.","Beat the soft cheese, icing sugar, peanut butter and vanilla together in a bowl until well combined.Whiskthe double cream in a separate bowl until it’s just holding its shape. Gently fold this into the peanut butter mixture, then spread over the biscuit base and smooth the surface using the back of a spoon. Chill for at least 1 hr to set.Will keep chilled for up to one day.","Meanwhile, tip the jelly cubes into a heatproof bowl and pour over 100ml boiling water. Stir to dissolve, then add the raspberries and sugar and stir, crushing the berries with the spoon. Push through a sieve into a jug, then pour this over the set cheesecake. Chill for at least 4hrs.Will keep chilled for up to two days. Run a knife around the sides, then use the overhanging parchment to lift the cheesecake onto a board. Cut into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:22:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9007,9007,'en','Peach cheesecake','This stunning cheesecake uses tinned peaches, meringue and a lattice pastry top to create a mouth-watering sharing dessert','["5 eggs, separated, plus 7 yolks","375g icing sugar","1 tbsp vanilla sugar","1 orange","450g plain flour","80g potato flour","½ tsp baking powder","500g butter, cold","3 tbsp caster sugar","1kg curd cheese, at room temperature","50g vanilla pudding (or cornflour plus 1 tsp vanilla extract)","3 drops orange extract","1 tin peaches"]','["Whisk 4 egg yolks with 125g icing sugar and the vanilla sugar until light and fluffy. Scald the orange with hot water and grate off the zest.","Sift the plain flour and potato flour and tip them onto a pastry board or lightly floured worksurface, together with the baking powder. Grate over 250g of the butter and chop it through the flour with a knife and then rub it in to make the mixture more like crumbs. Pour on the yolk mixture and orange zest and bring the mixture together, then knead to a soft dough.","Cut off a third of the dough, wrap it tightly and put it in the fridge. Roll out the remaining dough and use it to line the base and sides of a 26cm springform pan that you have already lined with a circle of buttered baking parchment. Put the tin in the fridge for 20 minutes. Heat the oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Line the dough with baking parchment and fill with baking beans to keep the sides in place, then bake the base for 10-15 minutes.","To make the filling, push the curd cheese through a metal strainer. Beat the remaining butter until light and fluffy, add the cheese, 8 egg yolks, 80g icing sugar, the pudding powder and orange extract. Mix for about 2 minutes until fluffy. Beat 2 egg whites with a pinch of salt until stiff and beat in the remaining icing sugar to make a stiff meringue mixture. Fold the egg whites into the curd mixture.","Beat the remaining 3 egg whites with the caster sugar until meringue-like. Unwrap the raw dough and grate it on a large-tooth grater. Spread the cheese mixture into the baked base. Drain the peaches, cut them into smaller pieces and put them on top of the cheese filling. Cover the dough with meringue, then sprinkle a little grated pastry on top. Knead the remaining dough, roll it out, cut out thin strips and arrange them in a lattice pattern. Bake for 50 mins-1 hr. Cool in the turned off oven for 40 mins before removing. Cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:22:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9008,9008,'en','Cheesecake-filled Easter eggs','Treat family and friends to this luscious Easter dessert with crushed biscuits and a creamy cheesecake filling packed into hollow chocolate eggs','["1 hollow chocolate Easter egg","75g digestive biscuits","25g butter, melted","75g mascarpone","100g soft cheese","2 tbsp icing sugar, sieved","2 tbsp cocoa powder, sieved","100g double cream","Easter treats, such as mini chocolate eggs or crumbled chocolates","caramel sauce or cooled melted chocolate"]','["Carefully separate the Easter egg in half along the seam. (Use a knife dipped into a bowl of hot water to cut through the seam rather than slicing, as it may break the chocolate.)","Tip the digestive biscuits into a bowl or food bag and bash to crumbs with the end of a rolling pin. Stir in the melted butter until the mixture resembles damp sand. Spoon this into the Easter egg halves and pack down gently using the back of the spoon. Chill until needed.","Mix the mascarpone, soft cheese, icing sugar and cocoa together in a medium bowl with a wooden spoon until smooth. In a separate bowl, beat the double cream to soft peaks using an electric whisk. Gently fold the whipped cream into the mascarpone mixture, then carefully spoon the cheesecake filling over the chilled biscuit bases in the Easter eggs. Gently level the surfaces with a palette knife or spatula, then chill for at least 2 hrs or overnight until firm and set. You may be left with extra cheesecake filling, depending on the size of your Easter eggs – this can be spooned into glasses over extra digestive crumbs for another treat.","Scatter the set cheesecake-filled eggs with mini chocolate eggs or other Easter treats, then drizzle with caramel or melted chocolate to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:22:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9009,9009,'en','Baked vegan cheesecake with raspberries & clementine','Enjoy a baked cheesecake made with cashews for a vegan take on a classic dessert. With clementines, raspberries and pistachios, it’s perfect for Christmas','["100g unsalted cashews","175g coconut cream","150g vegan soft cheese","1 tbsp cornflour","2 tsp vanilla bean paste","70ml maple syrup","50g coconut oil, melted","½ lemon, juiced","200g raspberries","2 tbsp caster sugar","50g shelled pistachios, roughly chopped","50g candied clementine peel","200g porridge oats","75g caster sugar","4 tbsp coconut oil, melted"]','["Put the cashews in a large heatproof bowl and cover with boiling water from thekettle. Leave to soften for 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line the base of a 20cm (4cm deep) round cake tin with baking parchment. To make the base, put the oats, sugar and a pinch of salt in afood processorand blitz to a fine powder. Pulse in the coconut oil until combined, then gradually pulse in 3-4 tbsp water until it comes together into a dough – it should be crumbly, not sticky.","Press the dough into the base and up the side of the tin using the back of a spoon. Bake for 20-25 mins until golden. Leave to cool.","Reduce the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Drain the cashews, then transfer to ablenderalong with the coconut cream, soft cheese, cornflour, vanilla, maple syrup, coconut oil, lemon juice and a pinch of salt. Blitz on high speed until the mixture is creamy and smooth.","Pour the cashew and soft cheese mixture over the base and bake for 1 hr-1 hr 15 mins until the edge is just coloured and the centre has mostly set with just a slight wobble. Leave to cool completely (it will sink slightly as it cools), then chill for at least 3 hrs, or overnight.","Put the raspberries and sugar in a heatproof bowl andmicrowavefor 1 min 30 seconds on high. Stir and leave to cool completely, then pour this over the cheesecake. Scatter over the pistachios and candied clementine peel.Will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:22:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9010,9010,'en','Pumpkin cheesecake','Celebrate autumn with this seasonal baked cheesecake. With a moreish, lightly spiced, creamy filling and crunchy ginger base, it’s well worth the effort','["80g butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","275g digestive or ginger biscuits","1 large egg white (use the egg yolk in the filling, below)","800g full-fat soft cheese","425g can pumpkin purée","200g light brown soft sugar","50g plain flour","5 large eggs, plus 1 large yolk","400ml whipping cream","ground cinnamon or pumpkin spice, for dusting","25g pecans, chopped","3 tbsp caramel sauce"]','["Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Butter a deep 22cm loose-bottomed cake tin and line with baking parchment. Wrap the base and side of the tin with three layers of cling film, followed by three layers of foil (this helps keep it waterproof during baking). Fold a clean tea towel and put it in the base of a largeroasting tin.","Blitz the biscuits to crumbs in afood processor. Add the melted butter and pulse to coat the crumbs. Tip the mixture into the prepared cake tin, spreading up to the side and pressing down with the back of a spoon. Bake for 10 mins. Remove from the oven, brush with the egg white and bake for another 3 mins (this will help stop the base from becoming soggy).","To make the filling, put the soft cheese in a bowl or the bowl of a stand mixer, and beat with an electric whisk or the mixer until loosened. Add the pumpkin purée, sugar and flour and beat again until combined. With the motor running, gradually add the eggs and egg yolk until the mixture is smooth and creamy. Pour the filling over the baked biscuit base, then sit the cake tin on the tea towel in the roasting tin. Pour a kettleful of just-boiled water into the roasting tin so the water comes halfway up the side of the cake tin.","Bake for 10 mins, then reduce the oven temperature to 110C/90C fan/gas ¼. Bake for a further 1 hr 30 mins until the cheesecake is set with just a slight wobble in the middle when you gently shake the tin. Turn off the oven, then open the oven door slightly and leave the cheesecake to cool inside for 2 hrs until completely cool. Remove from the oven and chill overnight.","Carefully remove the cold cheesecake from the tin and transfer to a cake stand or serving plate. Whip the cream to soft peaks using an electric whisk, and spoon in big dollops over the cheesecake. Dust with a little cinnamon or pumpkin spice, sprinkle over the chopped pecans and drizzle with the caramel sauce before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9011,9011,'en','White chocolate, mascarpone & pistachio cheesecake','Try this baked cheesecake with a difference. With a slightly sour tang, plus white chocolate and pistachio flavours, it’s a heavenly dessert','["butter, for the tin","100g white chocolate","200g digestive biscuits, crushed","500g mascarpone","200g full-fat yogurt","3 eggs","100g caster sugar","1 lemon, zested, ½  juiced","½  tsp vanilla bean paste","50g shelled pistachios, roughly chopped","1 tbsp icing sugar (optional)","mixed berries, to serve (optional)"]','["Line the base of a deep 20cm springform cake tin with baking parchment and butter the base and sides. Melt the white chocolate in a large heatproof bowl set over a pan of just simmering water (ensure the bottom of the bowl doesn’t touch the water). Alternatively, melt the chocolate in a microwave in short bursts. When the chocolate is completely smooth, stir in the biscuits and a small pinch of salt. Press into the base of the tin, all the way to the edges, ensuring the base is even. Put in the fridge to chill for at least 20 mins.","Heat the oven to 140C/120C fan/gas 1. Beat the mascarpone, yogurt, eggs, caster sugar, lemon zest and juice and vanilla bean paste together with an electric whisk until smooth, then tip over the biscuit base. Transfer the tin to a baking tray and bake for 45 mins until almost set, with just a slight wobble in the middle. Turn the oven off with the cheesecake inside, and leave the door ajar. Leave the cheesecake to cool completely.","Once completely cool and set, loosen the sides and base of the tin with a knife, and carefully transfer the cheesecake to a serving plate. Scatter over the pistachios and dust with the icing sugar, then serve with the berries on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:23:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9012,9012,'en','Cookie dough cheesecake','Celebrate Easter with our creamy choc cheesecake – it has a rich base studded with cookie dough, and it’s all topped with silky ganache. Decorate with mini eggs and cookies','["sunflower or veg oil, for the tin","200g milk chocolate, chopped","100g dark chocolate, chopped","500g soft cheese","3 large eggs, at room temperature","200g golden caster sugar","200ml soured cream","3 tbsp plain flour","1 tsp vanilla paste","225g light brown soft sugar","225g golden caster sugar","250g salted butter, softened","2 egg yolks (freeze the whites for another recipe)","2 tbsp vanilla paste","3 tbsp milk","225g plain flour","225g self-raising flour","200g dark chocolate chips","100g dark chocolate, chopped","100g milk chocolate, chopped","300ml double cream","2 tbsp caster sugar","chocolate mini eggs, chocolate nests and white chocolate buttons (see tips, below)"]','["Line the base of a deep 20cm loose-bottomed cake tin with baking parchment, then line the sides using a strip of parchment that comes above the tin by about 7cm (as the cheesecake will rise in the oven). Lightly oil the parchment.","Make the cookie dough by beating both sugars and the butter in a stand mixer for 5 mins, or until light and fluffy. Tip in the egg yolks, vanilla paste and milk, then beat again until well combined. Divide the mixture between two mixing bowls, then beat the plain flour into one half of the mixture and the self-raising into the other. Divide the chocolate chips between the two bowls and beat both again until the chocolate chips are evenly distributed. Will keep covered in the fridge for up to three days.","Put the self-raising flour mixture in the fridge while you press the plain flour cookie dough into the base of your prepared cake tin. Keep chilled in the fridge while you prepare the rest of the cheesecake.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line two baking sheets with baking parchment, then take the cookie dough made with the self-raising flour out of the fridge. Pinch pieces of the dough and roll into balls the size of marbles until you have used all the dough. Space them apart on the baking sheets and bake for 5-7 mins or until golden brown. Leave on a wire rack to cool.","To make the main part of the cheesecake, melt both the milk and dark chocolate pieces in a heatproof bowl set over a saucepan of barely simmering water, then set aside to cool down a little. Beat the soft cheese in a large bowl to loosen it, then beat in one egg at a time. Whisk in the sugar, soured cream, flour and vanilla for 5 mins or until light and frothy. Leave for 20 mins to come to room temperature, then slowly pour in the chocolate and gently fold it in until the mixture is even in colour.","Heat the oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3½. Remove the cake tin from the fridge and pour the chocolate and cheese mixture over the cookie dough base. Bake for 40 mins or until set on top with a slight wobble in the centre, then turn the oven off and leave the cheesecake inside to cool down slowly for 3 hrs (it will dip slightly in the middle). Chill in the fridge until completely cold.","For the ganache, put the dark and milk chocolate in a heatproof bowl. Put the cream and sugar in a saucepan and set over a medium heat until steaming (don’t let it boil), then pour over the chocolate. Whisk to melt the chocolate and create a smooth, glossy mixture. Chill in the fridge for 1 hr or until the ganache is thick and spoonable.","When the cheesecake is cold, place on a serving plate or cake stand, then swirl over the ganache. Decorate with the choc chip cookies and some chocolate mini eggs, chocolate nests and white chocolate buttons, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9013,9013,'en','Funfetti cheesecake','Get the family in the kitchen with this simple ‘funfetti’ cheesecake. It uses just seven ingredients and requires no cooking – perfect for making with children','["75g butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","200g digestive biscuits","600g full-fat soft cheese","75g icing sugar","300ml double cream","1 tbsp vanilla extract","6 tbsp sprinkles"]','["Butter and line a 20cm loose-bottomed cake tin. Put the biscuits in a food bag and bash to crumbs with a rolling pin, or blitz in a food processor. Transfer to a bowl and mix in the butter. Tip into the prepared tin and press down firmly into an even layer. Chill in the fridge for 30 mins, or until set.","Beat the soft cheese and icing sugar together with an electric whisk until smooth. Tip in the cream and vanilla, then continue to beat until everything is fully combined. Stir in 4 tbsp of the sprinkles and spoon the mixture over the biscuit base. Tap the tin on a work surface to make sure there are no air bubbles, then smooth the surface with a spatula or the back of a spoon. Chill for at least 5 hrs or overnight.","Bring the cheesecake out of the fridge to come to room temperature 30 mins before serving. Sit the tin on top of a can, then pull the sides of the tin down. Carefully slide the cheesecake onto a serving plate, then remove the baking parchment and the base of the tin. Decorate with the remaining sprinkles."]','2026-01-10 12:23:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9014,9014,'en','Raspberry coulis','Make a batch of raspberry coulis to use as a fruity topping for a cheesecake, as a sauce for desserts, to swirl into yogurt or pour over ice cream','["450g raspberries","½ small lemon, juiced","3 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Put all the ingredients in a small food processor or use a stick blender to blitz until very smooth.","Set a sieve over a jug. Tip the mixture into the sieve and push through the liquid using a spatula. Discard the seeds. The coulis is ready to use. Will keep refrigerated in an airtight jar for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9015,9015,'en','Chocolate cheesecake','Treat family and friends to this decadent chocolate dessert. It''s an indulgent end to a dinner party or weekend family meal','["150g digestive biscuits (about 10)","1 tbsp caster sugar","45g butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","150g dark chocolate","120ml double cream","2 tsp cocoa powder","200g full-fat cream cheese","115g caster sugar"]','["To make the biscuit base, crush the digestive biscuits with a rolling pin or blitz in a food processor, then tip into a bowl with the sugar and butter and stir to combine. Butter and line an 18cm springform tin and tip in the biscuit mixture, pushing it down with the back of a spoon. Chill in the fridge for 30 mins.","To make the cheesecake, melt the chocolate in short bursts in the microwave, then leave to cool slightly. Whip the cream in a large bowl using an electric whisk until soft peaks form, then fold in the cocoa powder. Beat the cream cheese and sugar together, then fold in the cream mixture and the cooled chocolate.","Spoon the cheesecake mixture over the biscuit base, levelling it out with the back of a spoon. Transfer to the freezer and freeze for 2 hrs, or until set. Remove from the tin and leave at room temperature to soften for about 20 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9016,9016,'en','Yogurt cheesecake with honey-roasted apricots','Transform your desserts with a drizzle of golden nectar. Top this honeyed cheesecake with honey-roasted apricots or swap with any soft fruit or rhubarb','["75g salted butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","200g custard cream biscuits","250ml double cream","150g full-fat Greek yogurt","500g full-fat soft cheese","3 tbsp runny honey","1 tbsp vanilla bean paste","6 ripe apricots, halved and pitted (about 240g)","50g runny honey, plus 2 tbsp to serve","1 small orange, zest pared into strips","½  vanilla pod, halved lengthways"]','["Butter the base of a 23cm springform tin and line with a circle of baking parchment. Blitz the biscuits to fine crumbs in a food processor, then tip into a bowl and mix with the butter. Pack the mixture into the base of the tin and chill for 10 mins.","Whip the double cream to soft peaks. In a separate bowl, whisk together the yogurt, soft cheese, honey and vanilla until smooth. Fold in the cream and spoon over the base. Smooth over the top with a spatula and cover. Chill for at least 4 hrs or overnight.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the apricots with the 50g honey, the orange zest and vanilla on a baking tray. Roast on the middle shelf for 20-25 mins until the apricots are tender but still hold their shape. Toss everything halfway through, adding 1 tbsp water if the honey starts to catch. Leave to cool, discarding the orange and vanilla pod.","Use a knife to release the sides of the cheesecake and remove from the tin. Spoon over the apricots along with the roasting juices. Drizzle extra honey over the top, allowing it to run down the sides."]','2026-01-10 12:23:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9017,9017,'en','Christmas pudding cheesecake','Cross a Christmas pudding with a cheesecake and what do you get? A fantastic alternative festive dessert with a crunchy ginger base and creamy filling','["200g ginger nut biscuits, crushed","30g light muscovado sugar","1 tsp flaky sea salt","110g unsalted butter, melted","240g Christmas pudding","30ml brandy","30ml stout","1 orange, zested","2 x 280g tubs full-fat cream cheese","300ml pot double cream","200g light muscovado sugar","2 vanilla pods, split and seeds scraped","2 clementines","light muscovado sugar, for sprinkling"]','["To make the base, mix the gingernuts and sugar in a large bowl and sprinkle in the flaky salt. Pour in the melted butter and mix with a wooden spoon to form a biscuit crumb-like mixture. Press into a 20cm round springform cake tin, spreading the mixture in an even layer to the corners. Chill in the fridge for 30 mins until set.","Put the Christmas pudding, brandy, stout and orange zest in a blender, and whizz to a purée.","Using an electric hand whisk, beat the cream cheese with the double cream, sugar and vanilla seeds, then fold through the purée. Spread the mixture over the biscuit base and leave to chill in the fridge overnight.","The next day, peel the clementines, slice into rounds and place on a baking tray. Sprinkle them with sugar, then blowtorch until caramelised and leave to cool. Release the cheesecake from the tin and arrange the clementines on top. Will keep for three days in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:23:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9018,9018,'en','Slow cooker muscovado cheesecake with hazelnuts & blackberries','This unbelievably creamy cheesecake has a sumptuous berry syrup and the crunch of toasted hazelnuts to top it off – ideal for feeding a crowd','["50g butter, melted, plus extra for greasing","225g oat biscuits (such as Hobnobs)","100g blanched hazelnuts","250g light muscovado sugar","4 tbsp full-fat milk","750g full-fat cream cheese","2 tbsp plain flour","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs","200ml pot soured cream","1 tbsp Frangelico (optional)","2 tsp cornflour","3 tbsp golden caster sugar","200g blackberries"]','["Boil the kettle and prepare your slow cooker (at least 22cm wide). Make a trivet for your cheesecake by scrunching a long piece of foil into a sausage. Roll into a loose coil and put on the bottom of the slow cooker. Turn the slow cooker to high and pour in enough hot water to come 4 cm up the sides. Wrap the outside of a 20cm springform cake tin in two layers of cling film and then foil – make sure there are no gaps for water to seep in. Grease the inside with butter, line with cling film and grease again, then line the base and sides with baking parchment.","Tip the biscuits and 50g hazelnuts into a food processer and blitz to fine crumbs. Add the butter and blend again until well combined. Tip the crumbs into the tin – use a spoon to press into the base. Chill for 10 mins.","In a saucepan, heat the muscovado and milk until the sugar has dissolved. Set aside to cool. In a bowl, beat the cream cheese, flour, vanilla and eggs until smooth. Stir in the soured cream, Frangelico (if using) and cooled sugar mixture until well combined. Pour into the tin and carefully put it in the slow cooker. Wrap the lid in a tea towel to prevent condensation from dripping onto the cheesecake. Cover and cook for 2 hrs, then turn off the slow cooker. Leave the cheesecake inside without opening for another 2 hrs. Remove from the slow cooker and cool at room temperature for a further 1 hr, then chill for 4 hrs, or overnight.","Put the cornflour, caster sugar and half the blackberries in a saucepan and set over a high heat. Cook for 3-4 mins, squashing the blackberries a little, until syrupy. Toss in the remaining berries, heat through, then remove from the heat and cool until you’re ready to serve. Roughly chop the remaining nuts and toast in a frying pan.","To serve, carefully remove the cheesecake from the tin, remove the baking parchment and transfer to a plate or cake stand. Top with the berries and hazelnuts, and serve with a shot of Frangelico, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9019,9019,'en','Tropical cheesecake bars','Fresh mango, a crunchy biscuit base and smooth cream cheese filling make a light summer dessert everyone will love. Top with passion fruit, pineapple and creamy lemon curd','["200g ginger biscuits","200g digestive biscuits","200g butter, melted","3 x 280g cream cheese","200g caster sugar","50g plain flour","zest 1 lemon","3 large eggs, beaten","200ml double cream","100g fresh mango, chopped into small cubes","4 passion fruits","3 tbsp lemon curd","50g mango and pineapple slices","mint leaves"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line the base and sides of a 20 x 30cm rectangular tin with baking parchment. Put the biscuits into a large food bag and bash with something heavy like a rolling pin, alternatively blitz in a food processor. Put the biscuit crumbs into a large bowl and pour over the melted butter, stir well to combine then tip into your prepared tin. Press the mixture down well with the back of a spoon to form a compressed layer. Bake in the preheated oven for 10 mins. Take it out of the oven to cool and turn the oven down to 120C/100C fan/gas 1/2.","In another large bowl whisk together the remaining cheesecake ingredients until smooth, you can do this with electric beaters or with a balloon whisk. Pour onto the biscuit base then scatter over the mango pieces here and there, pushing some of them into the cheesecake and letting others sit proud on the surface. Bake for 1hr then prop the oven door open and leave to cool for a further 30 mins. Once cold, chill the whole cheesecake in the fridge overnight.","When you’re ready to serve, push the passion fruit flesh through a sieve to get rid of the seeds then mix the resulting pulp with the lemon curd. Drizzle the mixture over the cheesecake and decorate with fresh mango, pineapple and mint leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:23:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9020,9020,'en','Chocolate hazelnut ice cream cheesecake','No one will guess that this easy, rich and creamy no-cook, make-ahead cheesecake uses only 4 ingredients – ideal for a dinner party','["200g honey nut cornflakes","2 x 400g jars chocolate hazelnut spread","2 x 180g tubs full-fat cream cheese","1 tbsp roasted and chopped hazelnuts"]','["Put the cornflakes and half a jar of chocolate hazelnut spread in a bowl and beat to combine – don’t worry about breaking up the cornflakes. Press the mix into the base of a 23cm springform tin.","In a separate bowl, beat the cream cheese until smooth, then fold in the remaining chocolate hazelnut spread. Smooth onto the cornflake base, wrap tightly in cling film and freeze overnight.","Remove from the freezer 30 mins before serving, or until you can cut it easily with a sharp knife. Serve in slices with hazelnuts sprinkled over. Will keep in the freezer for up to 1 month."]','2026-01-10 12:23:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9021,9021,'en','Hot cross bun cheesecakes','A creamy dessert that tastes exactly like your favourite Easter bake – the hot cross bun. Top with orange zest, juice and a drizzle of icing for the characteristic cross','["150g ginger biscuits","25g sultanas","25g mixed peel","50g butter","½  tsp cinnamon","280g pack cream cheese","25g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","½  tsp cinnamon","100g mascarpone","2 eggs, lightly beaten","150g icing sugar","½  orange, zest and juice"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter 6 x 150ml capacity ramekins. Place the ginger biscuits in a food processor and blitz until chopped into very small pieces then add the sultanas and mixed peel and blitz again just once or twice to combine.","Melt the butter in a pan, then mix in the cinnamon followed by the biscuit mixture. Divide equally between the ramekins, so the base of each is covered with a layer about 1cm thick. Press down a little with the back of a teaspoon then bake them on a tray in the oven for 10 mins until crisp and golden. Leave to cool, then turn oven down to 150C/130C fan /gas 2.","Whisk together all the cheesecake filling ingredients until smooth. Place the ramekins on a baking tray and pour some mixture into each one, filling to about 1cm below the rim. Carefully slide them into the oven and cook for 25-30 mins until just set. The mixture should still be ever so slightly wobbly when gently tapped. Don’t worry if it dips a little or cracks. Remove from the oven and leave to cool completely before covering with cling film and putting in the fridge. You can make to this point up to 2 days ahead.","To make the decoration, place the icing sugar into a large bowl and add enough orange juice to make a stiff paste. Transfer to a disposable piping bag and snip off the end. Run a small knife around the edge of the cheesecakes and turn them out onto a board so that the biscuit layer is facing upwards. Use the orange icing mixture to pipe a cross on the top of each one then use a cake slice or palette knife to place onto plates then sprinkle with the orange zest before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9022,9022,'en','Lingonberry & ginger cheesecake pots','Layer up ginger snaps, a zesty cream cheese and lingonberry jam in glasses for these stunning individual desserts to finish off a Swedish supper for two','["50g full-fat cream cheese","75ml double cream","grated zest ½  orange","4 tbsp lingonberry jam (we used Felix wild lingonberry jam) or cranberry jelly, plus a little extra to serve","8 Swedish pepparkakor ginger snaps or 4 ginger nuts, crushed, plus 1 extra to serve","knob of butter, melted"]','["Whip the cream cheese, double cream and orange zest in a medium bowl until thick and holding its shape. Be careful not to overwhip or the cream cheese will become watery. Gently ripple through the lingonberry jam.","Mix together the crushed biscuits and butter, and spoon into 2 glasses. Divide the lingonberry mixture between the glasses and chill until needed – at least 30 mins. The cheesecakes can be made up to this point the day before.","To serve, mix a little of the jam with 1 tsp water and drizzle over the cheesecakes. Crumble the remaining biscuit and sprinkle on top."]','2026-01-10 12:23:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9023,9023,'en','Lemon meringue cheesecake','Serve a slice of this sweet treat and find yourself in double dessert heaven – lemon meringue pie meets creamy citrus cheesecake','["rapeseed oil, for greasing","300g pack ginger nuts, bashed to crumbs","100g butter, melted","3 x 280g tubs full-fat cream cheese","300g golden caster sugar","3 tbsp plain flour","2 tsp vanilla extract","zest 3 lemons, juice of 1","3 large eggs, plus 1 yolk (save the white)","300ml soured cream","2 x 312g jars lemon curd (we used Tiptree)","1 large egg, plus 3 large yolks (save the whites)","juice 1 lemon","3 tbsp plain flour","4 large egg whites (from above)","300g caster sugar","1 tbsp liquid glucose"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Grease a 25cm loose-bottomed or springform round tin with a little oil, and line the base and sides with a double layer of baking parchment. Mix the biscuit crumbs and melted butter, then press into the bottom of the tin. Bake for 10 mins.","To make the filling, beat the cream cheese for 1-2 mins with an electric hand whisk in your largest mixing bowl until creamy. Add the sugar, flour, vanilla, lemon zest and juice with a pinch of salt. Finally, whisk in the eggs and soured cream until blended. Pour the filling into the tin and tap a few times sharply on the counter to get rid of any bubbles. Bake for 40 mins.","Whisk together the ingredients for the lemon layer. Gently spoon the mixture over the cheesecake and pop back in the oven for 40 mins more until firm at the edges but still a bit wobbly in the middle. Turn off the oven and leave the cheesecake in until it is cold, then chill for at least 2 hrs or overnight.","A few hours before you want to serve, make the meringue. Put the egg whites in a big mixing bowl and put the sugar in a small saucepan with 100ml water and the liquid glucose. Place over a low-medium heat until the sugar has melted, then increase the heat and boil with a sugar thermometer in the pan. When the thermometer reaches 100C, beat the whites with an electric whisk until stiff peaks form. Keep boiling the sugar syrup until it reaches soft-ball stage – 113C on the thermometer. Remove from the heat and, while beating the whites, pour in the syrup in a slow, steady stream – avoid hitting the whisk blades. Keep beating until the meringue is stiff. Use a large spoon to pile on top of the cheesecake, then use a blowtorch to caramelise the meringue, or bake at 200C/180C fan/gas 6 for 5 mins or so. Chill until ready to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9024,9024,'en','Mascarpone & pineapple cheesecake','This clever cheesecake uses crushed oatcakes and desiccated coconut for the base and naturally sweet pineapple for a lower-sugar dessert','["40g butter","100g oatcakes, crushed to crumbs","25g toasted desiccated coconut","425g can pineapple in natural juice, drained","5 leaves gelatine","250g tub reduced fat mascarpone","500g tub fromage frais (full fat version)","160g can coconut cream","grated zest ½  lemon"]','["Melt the butter in a pan and stir in the biscuit crumbs and all but 1 tbsp of the coconut. Mix well then press very firmly onto the base of a lightly oiled 21cm spring-form tin to make a firm layer. Chill.","Finely chop a slice of pineapple  then pulse the remainder to a pulp in a food processor or with a hand blender. Soak the gelatine in cold water to soften it. In a bowl beat together the mascarpone and fromage frais.","Very gently warm the coconut cream in a small pan. Squeeze the excess moisture from the gelatine, add to the warm coconut and stir until melted. Stir into the mascarpone mixture with the crushed and chopped pineapple and lemon zest then pour onto the biscuit base and chill until set.","Carefully remove from the tin, slide onto a plate,  and decorate with the reserved coconut round the edge."]','2026-01-10 12:23:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9025,9025,'en','Lime semifreddo cheesecake','This attractive frozen dessert can be made ahead and frozen for up to 3 months – perfect to get ahead for a Christmas dinner party','["140g digestive biscuits, roughly broken","75g butter, melted","300g condensed milk","200g full-fat cream cheese","150ml double cream","finely grated zest 3 limes, plus extra to serve","3 tbsp lime juice (from 2 limes)","200g fresh or frozen cranberries","100g golden caster sugar","1 tbsp ground arrowroot or cornflour"]','["Line a 900g loaf tin with a large piece of foil. Press down well into the base and sides of the tin, and leave plenty overhanging the edges. Put the biscuits in a freezer bag and bash to crumbs with a rolling pin. Mix with the melted butter and tip the crumbs into the prepared tin – press firmly into the base to create an even layer. Chill while the filling is made.","Use an electric whisk on a medium setting to beat the condensed milk, cheese and cream together until smooth and thickened – this will take around 2 mins. Add the grated zest and juice, and beat slowly until the cheese mixture forms soft peaks.","Spoon the lime mixture over the biscuit base. Cover lightly with the overhanging foil and seal firmly to keep out as much air as possible. Wrap in a second layer of foil, pop into a large freezer bag and freeze overnight.","To make the cranberry compote, put the cranberries, sugar and 150ml cold water in a saucepan and bring to a simmer. Cook for 5 mins, stirring occasionally, until the cranberries are softened but holding their shape. Mix the arrowroot or cornflour with 2 tbsp cold water until smooth, then stir into the fruit. Cook for another 2 mins, stirring regularly. Leave to cool, then cover and chill. Can be frozen at this stage.","Turn out the frozen cheesecake onto a platter or board and leave to thaw for 30 mins, then carefully peel off the foil. Warm the cranberry compote gently and serve with the sliced semifreddo."]','2026-01-10 12:23:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9026,9026,'en','Spiced maple & pecan cheesecake bars','This rich cheesecake is spiced with warming flavours of ginger, cinnamon and nutmeg – top with maple syrup and nuts','["250g pack ginger nut biscuits","140g salted butter, melted","200g pecans","3 x 250g tubs cream cheese","300ml pot soured cream","150ml maple syrup (buy a 330ml bottle)","85g light muscovado sugar","3 medium eggs","2 tsp vanilla extract","4 tbsp plain flour","2 tsp ground cinnamon","½  whole nutmeg, grated","remaining maple syrup (roughly 175ml)","100g salted butter","3 tbsp light muscovado sugar","100g pecans, roughly broken"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line a 20 x 30cm brownie tin with baking parchment – if using a loose-bottomed tin, make sure you line it really well, as the cheesecake mixture is very runny (this recipe will also work in a deep 23cm cake tin). Put the biscuits in a food processor and blitz to fine crumbs, add the butter and pecans, and blitz again until well combined and the pecans are finely chopped but still have a little texture. Tip into the baking tin and press to an even, compact layer with the back of a spoon. Bake for 10 mins, then remove from the oven and set aside to cool.","Beat the cream cheese and soured cream in a large bowl until smooth and combined. Add the maple syrup, sugar, eggs, vanilla, flour and spices, and blend again until smooth. Pour onto the biscuit base, put in the centre of the oven and bake for 15 mins.","Lower the heat to 110C/90C fan/gas 1/2 and continue cooking for a further 30 mins. Turn off the oven and leave the cheesecake inside for 1 hr, then leave for 1 hr more with the door ajar. Finally, leave at room temperature until completely cool, then chill for at least 3 hrs or, even better, overnight.","To make the topping, melt the remaining maple syrup with the butter, sugar  and a good pinch of salt. Bubble for 2-3 mins, then stir in the pecans and leave to cool and thicken a little. Before serving, remove the cheesecake from the tin, spoon the maple-pecan caramel over the top of the cheesecake (reheat it if it’s started to set too much), then cut into bars. Leftovers will keep in the fridge for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9027,9027,'en','Cheesecake biscuit beach','If you''re feeling creative, this biscuit beach scene with vanilla cheesecake filling will not only look brilliant but will taste great too','["375g slightly salted butter","oil, for greasing","500g full-fat cream cheese","1 tbsp vanilla extract","200g icing sugar","300ml pot double cream","100g slightly salted butter, softened","100g golden caster sugar","100g self raising flour","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 eggs, beaten","150g punnet raspberries","hundreds and thousands, to decorate","500g assorted biscuits","ice cream, to serve (optional)"]','["First make your sandcastle and cheesecake icing. Gently heat the butter in a saucepan. Meanwhile, tip the biscuits into a food processor and pulse until you have fine, sand-like crumbs. Add the butter and blitz again until well combined. Set aside while you make the cheesecake icing.","Put the cream cheese in a large bowl and, using an electric whisk, beat for a few secs until smooth. Add the vanilla extract, sift over the icing sugar and mix well. Pour in the cream and whisk until the mixture is smooth and thick enough to pipe. Transfer to a piping bag fitted with a large star nozzle.","Brush your sandcastle mould with a little oil, then line the base with a circle of baking parchment. Fill with some of the buttery biscuit sand, so that it comes 2.5cm up the side, and pack down. To create a hole for the cheesecake icing centre to go into, find a glass that will sit on top of the biscuit sand in your mould, and leave about 1.5cm space around the edge. Grease the glass with a little oil and pop inside the sandcastle container. Pack more of the biscuit sand around the glass until the mould is full, then reserve any leftover sand. Chill for 1 hr. Give the glass a wiggle and remove from the mould – if it doesn’t come out easily, fill with hot water and leave for a few mins. Slide the glass out and tip the water away. Pipe icing into the cavity, dropping in a couple handfuls of raspberries as you go – make sure you reserve about 20 raspberries for decorating the cupcakes and filling the whole cone. Keep the remaining icing in the piping bag and chill. Tip in a little more buttery sand to cover the icing, packing the mixture firmly into the container, then chill for at least 1 hr or until set.","Make the cone cakes. To make the mini cones and waffle cupcake cases, place a folded tea towel on your work surface and lay a waffle cone on top. Use the tea towel to support the cone and, with a serrated knife, gently score around the middle of the cone. Repeat with another 8 cones (you need to keep 1 cone whole for the top of the sandcastle). Very carefully cut each cone in half along the scored line, trying not to break or shatter them. You will end up with 9 mini cones from the bottom of the cone, and 9 waffle cupcake cases from the top of the cone. If any of the cones do shatter, just add them to the sand mix in step 7.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. To make the mini cone cakes, line a 12-hole muffin tin with 9 scrunched-up nests of foil. Place the mini cones into the centre of the foil nests and mould the foil around the tips to support them and keep them upright. Put 25g butter, 25g sugar, 25g flour, 1?4 tsp vanilla extract and 25g of the beaten egg into a large bowl. Using an electric whisk, beat together until everything is combined. Transfer the mixture to a disposable piping bag and snip off 1cm from the end. Pipe the mixture into the mini cones, making sure you only fill them three-quarters full, as the sponge will rise up in the oven – you may have a little mixture leftover. Bake for 10-12 mins until lightly golden and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Leave\r\nto cool.","To make the waffle cone cupcakes, line a 12-hole mini muffin tin with circles of baking parchment. Place the 9 waffle cupcake cases in the tin. Put the remaining 75g butter, 75g sugar, 75g flour, 3?4 tsp vanilla extract and the remaining beaten egg in a large bowl and beat together with an electric whisk until well combined. Transfer to a piping bag and use to fill the larger cone cases, again only filling three-quarters full. Bake for 18-20 mins until lightly golden and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Set aside to cool, remembering to peel off the discs of baking parchment before icing.","Next make the biscuit sand. Now make the sand for your beach. Pulse the biscuits, and any broken cones, in a food processor until they resemble fine crumbs, then set aside. Cut 3 Flakes down to size so that you have half a Flake for the upturned ice cream, 9 medium pieces of Flake for the cupcakes, and mini pieces of Flake for the cones. Some Flakes may break so there’s spare – they’re easier to cut when they’re at room temperature.","Assemble your beach scene. Once the cakes have cooled and the sandcastle has set, you’ll be ready to assemble the beach scene. Carefully turn the sandcastle out onto a clean surface or tray and surround with the biscuit sand. You’ll need to bash the bottom of the container with a rolling pin (or see tip, opposite) if your sandcastle doesn’t come out easily.","Pop a raspberry on each cupcake and pipe some icing over the top. Sprinkle with Hundreds & Thousands and insert a medium-sized piece of Flake. Pipe icing onto the mini cones, scatter with Hundreds & Thousands, and top with a mini Flake. Insert the mini cones and cupcakes into the sand, in and around the main sandcastle, using the sand to support them.","To make the upside-down cone, pipe some icing into your reserved whole waffle cone, dropping in the remaining raspberries as you go. Set the cone upside down on the top of the sandcastle and pipe icing around it to create the effect of a dropped ice cream. Sprinkle with Hundreds & Thousands and insert the half piece of Flake. Serve the biscuit beach with scoops of your favourite ice cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9028,9028,'en','Maracuja (Passion fruit mousse traybake)','We''ve turned this tangy Brazilian mousse pudding into a traybake cheesecake with biscuit base and gelatine to help with slicing','["2 passion fruits, flesh scooped out","250ml passion fruit juice from a carton","4 sheets gelatine","2 x 400g cans sweetened condensed milk","500ml double cream, loosely whipped","250g digestive biscuits","100g butter, melted","2 mangoes","juice 1 lime","2 tbsp golden caster sugar","2 passion fruits, flesh scooped out and chopped"]','["For the base, crush the biscuits in a bag with a rolling pin, or pulse in a food processor. Add the butter and stir. Line a 20 x 30cm cake tin with non-stick baking parchment. Tip the biscuit mixture in and firmly press down. Chill.","Mix the passion fruit flesh with the juice. Place the gelatine in a small bowl of cold water to soak. Pour the flesh and juice into a saucepan and heat until hot. Squeeze the water out of the gelatine, add to the pan and stir until dissolved, then remove and pour into a bowl.","Add the milk and loosely whipped cream and fold together. Pour into the tin and chill until firm, about 2 hrs.","For the coulis, purée 1 mango with the lime juice and sugar in a food processor, then stir to dissolve the sugar. Chop up the other mango.","To serve, cut the traybake into squares. Top each one with the coulis, some chopped mango and passion fruit."]','2026-01-10 12:23:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9029,9029,'en','No-bake chocolate hazelnut cheesecake','Reader Jessica Creed shares her showy, no-fail chocolate dessert – it’s perfect for entertaining','["140g unsalted butter","300g digestive biscuits, broken up","500g cream cheese, softened","85g icing sugar","300ml double cream","1 tsp vanilla extract","15 hazelnut chocolate (we used Ferrero Rocher), 5 roughly chopped, remainder reserved, to decorate","4 tbsp hazelnut chocolate spreads","25g hazelnuts, roughly chopped"]','["Make the cheesecake base: melt the butter in a small pan over a medium heat. Blitz the biscuits in a food processor to a fine crumb, add the melted butter and pulse until well combined. Tip into a 23cm springform cake tin and press down firmly into the base. Chill while you make the filling.","Beat the cream cheese and icing sugar in a bowl to soften. Whisk the cream and vanilla in a separate bowl until soft peaks form, then fold into the cream cheese. Stir through the chopped chocolates. Spoon over the biscuit base and smooth with a spatula. Cover with cling film and chill for at least 6 hrs, or overnight.","Once it has set, place the chocolate hazelnut spread in a saucepan and melt over a low heat for 3-4 mins until runny. allow to cool slightly before spreading over the top of the cheesecake. Decorate with remaining chocolates and some chopped hazelnuts. Chill until ready to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9030,9030,'en','Blueberry swirl cheesecake','The creamy, sweet texture of this baked vanilla pudding is complemented by a vibrant fruit sauce','["300g digestive biscuits","140g butter, melted","275g golden caster sugar","100g blueberries","1 tsp cornflour","3 x 300g packs full-fat cream cheese","4 tbsp plain flour","2 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs","200ml pot soured cream"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nLine a 20 x 30cm rectangular tin with\r\nbaking parchment. Put the biscuits in a\r\nfood processor and blitz to a fine crumb.\r\nAdd the butter and blitz again to combine.\r\nTip into the tin, press down firmly with\r\nthe back of a spoon to cover the base,\r\nthen bake for 10 mins. Leave to cool.","Meanwhile, tip 25g of the sugar and the\r\nblueberries into a small pan. Mix the\r\ncornflour with 1 tbsp cold water and add\r\nthis to the pan. Heat gently until the sugar\r\ndissolves. Increase the heat and bubble\r\nfor 1-2 mins until saucy. Set aside to cool.","In a large bowl, whisk the cream\r\ncheese with an electric hand-held whisk\r\nuntil smooth. Add the remaining sugar\r\nand whisk again. Add the flour, vanilla,\r\neggs and soured cream, and whisk until\r\nsmooth and well combined.","Pour half the cheesecake mixture over\r\nthe biscuit base, then spoon half the\r\nblueberry sauce on top in small blobs.\r\nCover with the remaining cheesecake\r\nmix and smooth the surface with a\r\nspatula. Drizzle the remaining blueberry\r\nsauce over the top, then use the end\r\nof the spoon to ripple it into the\r\ncheesecake. Bake for 10 mins, then\r\nlower the heat to 110C/90C fan/ gas ¼\r\nand bake for a further 30 mins. Turn off\r\nthe oven and leave the cheesecake inside\r\nfor 1 hr, then leave for 1 hr more with\r\nthe door ajar. Finally, leave at room\r\ntemperature until completely cool, then\r\nchill for at least 3 hrs or, even better,\r\novernight. Slice into 14 bars.Will keep\r\nin the fridge for up to 5 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9031,9031,'en','Peanut butter cheesecake','This irresistible cheesecake is the perfect indulgence for peanut butter fans – freeze for up to two months and serve as a show-stopping dinner party dessert','["50g butter","175g pack peanut cookies","5 gelatine leaves","500g tub ricotta","175g smooth peanut butter","175g golden syrup","150ml milk","270ml pot double cream","2 tbsp soft brown sugar","1 bar peanut brittle, crushed"]','["Oil and line a 20cm round loose- bottomed cake tin with cling film, making it as smooth as possible. Melt the butter in a pan. Crush the biscuits by bashing them in a bag with a rolling pin, then stir them into the butter until very well coated. Press the mixture firmly into the base of the tin and chill.","Soak the gelatine in water while you make the filling. Tip the ricotta into a bowl, then beat in the peanut butter and syrup. Ricotta has a slightly grainy texture so blitz until smooth with a stick blender for a smoother texture if you prefer.","Take the soaked gelatine from the water and squeeze dry. Put it into a pan\r\nwith the milk and heat very gently until the gelatine dissolves. Beat into the peanut mixture, then tip onto the biscuit base. Chill until set.","To freeze, leave in the tin and as soon as it is solid, cover the surface with cling film, then wrap the tin with cling film and foil.","To defrost, thaw in the fridge overnight.","To serve, carefully remove from the tin. Whisk the cream with the sugar until it holds its shape, then spread on top of the cheesecake and scatter with the peanut brittle."]','2026-01-10 12:23:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9032,9032,'en','Iced chestnut ripple cheesecake','With a dark chocolate digestive base and nutty cream cheese topping, this frozen dessert has a winter twist','["10 dark chocolate digestive biscuits","50g butter, melted","sunflower oil, for greasing","100g golden caster sugar","100g chestnut pieces, roughly chopped","435g can chestnut purée","200g icing sugar","3 tbsp dark rum","300ml pot double cream","140g golden caster sugar","½  tsp vanilla extract","300g tub soft cheese, beaten until smooth"]','["For the base, blitz the biscuits in\r\na food processor or bash in a bag\r\nto make crumbs. Stir in the butter,\r\nthen press into the base of a 22cm\r\nspringform cake tin. Chill.","For the praline, line a tray with baking\r\nparchment and lightly oil it. Tip the caster\r\nsugar into a frying pan and place over\r\na high heat. Cook for 5 mins, without\r\nstirring, until dissolved and you have\r\na dark amber caramel. Throw in the\r\nchestnut pieces, then quickly tip onto\r\nthe baking parchment and leave to\r\nharden. Break or chop into small pieces\r\nand set aside.","For the filling, blitz the chestnut purée\r\nin a food processor with the icing sugar\r\nand 1 tbsp of the rum. Set 3 tbsp of the\r\nmix aside. In a large bowl, whisk the\r\ncream with the caster sugar and vanilla\r\nuntil it holds its shape, then whisk in the\r\nsoft cheese. Beat in the pieces of praline,\r\nthen gently fold through the chestnut\r\npurée so that it ripples the cream. Spoon\r\nonto the biscuit base. Bang the cake tin\r\ngently on the work surface to level and\r\nsmooth over the top. Cover with cling\r\nfilm and freeze for at least 12 hrs or up\r\nto 1 month.","For the drizzle, mix the remaining rum\r\nwith the reserved chestnut purée and\r\nenough water to make it just runny. If\r\nserving the cake within 2 days, chill the\r\ndrizzle; if keeping for longer, freeze and\r\ndefrost when needed.","Put the cheesecake in the fridge to thaw\r\na little 30 mins before serving. Using a\r\nsandwich bag with a corner tip cut off,\r\npipe the drizzle over the top of the cake\r\nin a zig-zag pattern. Carefully remove from\r\nthe tin and serve in small wedges – with a\r\nglass of rum if you fancy it."]','2026-01-10 12:23:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9033,9033,'en','Tia Maria cheesecake','Perfect for a special occasion, this American style dessert really has the wow-factor','["85g hot melted butter, plus extra butter for greasing","14 plain chocolate digestive biscuits, finely crushed","3 x 300g packs full-fat Philadelphia cheese","200g golden caster sugar","4 tbsp plain flour","2 tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp Tia Maria","3 large eggs","285ml carton soured cream","142ml carton soured cream","2 tbsp Tia Maria","cocoa, for dusting","8 Ferrero Rocher chocolates, unwrapped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Line the base of a 25cm springform tin with baking parchment. Blend butter and biscuit\r\ncrumbs. Press onto the base of the tin, bake for 10 mins, then cool.","Increase the oven temperature to 240C/fan 200C/gas 9. Beat the cheese and sugar with an electric whisk until smooth, then whisk in the flour, vanilla, 2 tbsp Tia Maria, eggs and 285ml soured cream.","Grease sides of the cake tin with butter. Pour in the mixture and smooth. Bake for 10 mins, then turn oven down to 110C/fan 90C/ gas ¼ for 25 mins. Turn off the oven, then open the door and leave to cool inside the oven for 2 hrs. Don’t worry if it cracks a little.","Mix 142ml soured cream and Tia Maria, then smooth on top of the cheesecake. Chill."]','2026-01-10 12:23:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9034,9034,'en','Little strawberry cheesecakes','Individual portions will save fights over the biggest slice of this creamy ricotta pud with fruity compote','["50g butter","6 digestive biscuits, finely crushed","250g tub ricotta","50g icing sugar","zest 1 lemon, juice of ½","1 egg and 1 yolk","½  tsp vanilla extract","150ml double cream","2 tbsp strawberry jam, melted","3 strawberries, halved"]','["Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2\r\nand line 6 muffin tin holes with muffin\r\npaper cases. Melt the butter, stir in the\r\nbiscuit crumbs until well mixed, then\r\npress as firmly as you can into the bases\r\nof each paper case. Chill them while\r\nyou make the filling.","Beat the ricotta with the sugar, lemon\r\nzest and juice, whole egg, egg yolk and\r\nvanilla. In another bowl, whisk the\r\ncream until it just holds its shape, then\r\nfold into the cheese mixture. Spoon\r\nevenly into the paper cases, right up\r\nto the tops, then tap the tin on the work\r\nsurface to flatten the filling. Bake for\r\n30 mins, then turn off the oven and allow\r\nto cool completely inside.","To decorate, top each cheesecake\r\nwith 1 tsp jam and a strawberry half."]','2026-01-10 12:23:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9035,9035,'en','The ultimate makeover: New York cheesecake','Angela Nilsen rises to the ultimate challenge – keeping a cheesecake creamy and decadent while making it healthier and lighter','["35g butter","85g reduced-fat digestive biscuits, finely crushed","2 x 300g/11oz tubs light soft cheese, we used Philadelphia cheese, at room temperature","175g golden caster sugar","3 tbsp cornflour","1½  tsp finely grated lemon zest, preferably using a Microplane grater","1 tsp lemon juice","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 eggs, room temperature, beaten","150g fromage frais","25g golden caster sugar","225g punnet blueberries","½  tsp finely grated lime zest","100g fromage frais"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Line a 20cm loose-bottomed or springform tin with baking parchment and stand it on a baking sheet. Melt the butter and stir in the biscuit crumbs. Press the mix into the base of the tin, then bake for 10 mins. Remove from the oven and raise the temperature to 240C/fan 220C/gas 9.","For the filling, beat the soft cheese just until smooth with an electric hand mixer on low speed. Gradually add the sugar, also on a low speed, then the cornflour without overbeating. Scrape the sides of the bowl. Slowly whisk in the lemon zest and juice, the vanilla, then the eggs. Scrape the sides of the bowl, then finally whiskin the fromage frais. The mixture should be smooth and quite runny.","Pour the filling over the crumb base. Jiggle the tin to level the mix and squash surface bubbles with the back of a teaspoon. Bake for 10 mins, then lower the heat to 110C/fan 90C/gas ¼. Bake another 25 mins and, if you are using an electric oven, leave the oven door slightly ajar for the first 3 mins. After the 25 mins, shake the tin and there should be a wobble in the centre of the filling. If left until firmer it is more likely to crack later. Turn off the oven, keep the door closed and leave the cake in for 2 hrs. Open the door, loosen the top edges of the cake with a round bladed knife, then leave in the oven to cool gently for another 1-1½ hrs.","Meanwhile, put the sugar for the topping in a small pan with 3 tbsp water. Bring to a simmer, stirring to dissolve the sugar, then let it bubble for 1-2 mins to make a thin syrup. Tip in the blueberries, gently stir and cook for about 1 min, just to slightly burst the fruit and release the purple juices. Stir\r\nin the lime zest, then leave to cool.","Spread the fromage frais over the top of the cooled cheesecake. Cover with foil and chill for at least 4 hrs (or overnight). Remove from the fridge 1 hr before serving, loosen the sides of the cheesecake completely, remove from the tin, then slide onto a plate, peeling off the paper as you do. Slice with a sharp knife and serve each wedge topped with a spoonful of syrupy blueberries."]','2026-01-10 12:23:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9037,9037,'en','Lemon quark cheesecake','This light and luscious lemon cheesecake tastes as good as it looks','["80g digestive biscuits","50g melted butter","200g light soft cheese","500g Quark","200g icing sugar","zest 2 lemons, juice of 3","4 gelatine sheets"]','["Crush the digestive biscuits and mix\r\nwith the melted butter. Press into the\r\nbase of a 20cm springform tin. Chill to\r\nfirm.","Whisk the light soft cheese with\r\nthe quark and icing sugar, then fold through zest\r\n2 lemons.","Soak the gelatine sheets in cold water, then melt\r\nin the juice 3 lemons over a low heat. Beat into the cheese\r\nmix, then spoon on top of the biscuit base. Chill until set."]','2026-01-10 12:23:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9038,9038,'en','White chocolate berry cheesecake','A stunning no-cook pudding bursting with summer flavours – great for relaxed entertaining','["2 x 150g bars white chocolate","2 x 300g tubs soft cheese (we used Philadelphia)","284ml pot double cream","50g caster sugar","170g punnet raspberries","5 tbsp raspberry jam","85g amaretti biscuits","200g small strawberries","a few blueberries (optional)"]','["Break the chocolate into a glass bowl,\r\nthen put it over a pan of just simmering\r\nwater to melt, making sure the bottom\r\nof the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Line\r\na lightly oiled 900g loaf tin with cling film.","Whisk the cheese, cream and sugar\r\ntogether, preferably with electric beaters,\r\nthen stir into the almost-cool melted\r\nwhite chocolate until well combined.","Stir 50g raspberries with 2 tbsp of the\r\njam. Spoon half the cheese mixture into\r\nthe loaf tin, then spoon the jammy\r\nraspberries down the centre. Top with\r\nthe rest of the cheese mixture, level the\r\ntop, then press in the biscuits. Cover and\r\nchill for 6 hrs or overnight.","Set aside about 6 strawberries. Halve\r\nthe rest, then warm in a pan with the\r\nremaining jam until soft. Whizz in a food\r\nprocessor or with a hand blender, then\r\nrub through a sieve to remove the seeds\r\nand make a sauce. Add a drop of water\r\nif the sauce is too thick.","To serve, carefully turn the tin onto\r\na plate, lift it away and strip off the cling\r\nfilm. Halve the remaining strawberries,\r\nthen arrange on top of the cake with the\r\nremaining raspberries and blueberries (if\r\nusing). Pour over a little sauce and serve\r\nthe rest separately for drizzling over."]','2026-01-10 12:23:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9039,9039,'en','Peach Melba cheesecake','A no-cook, make-ahead party favourite with a thick, cream cheese topping, a buttery biscuit base and finished with raspberry coulis','["100g butter, melted, plus a little extra for the tin","200g crunchy biscuits (we used Fox''s butter biscuits)","600g soft cheese","100g icing sugar, plus extra to taste","2 tsp vanilla extract","300ml pot double cream","450g raspberries","3 really ripe peaches, peeled if you like, or 6 canned peach halves (juice saved), diced into raspberry-sized chunks"]','["Line the base and sides of a 20cm\r\nloose-bottomed or springform tin\r\nwith baking parchment – use smudges\r\nof butter to help the paper stay in place\r\naround the sides. Put the biscuits in a\r\nplastic food bag and crush to crumbs\r\nusing a rolling pin, then mix thoroughly\r\nwith the melted butter. Tip into the\r\nprepared tin and press down firmly\r\nto create an even base. Chill while\r\nyou prepare the filling.","Put the soft cheese, icing sugar and\r\nvanilla in a bowl, then beat with an\r\nelectric mixer until smooth. Tip in\r\nthe cream and continue beating until\r\nmixture is combined. Scatter over\r\n100g of the raspberries and half of\r\nthe peach chunks. Using a spatula,\r\nfold in with just a few folds – as you\r\nassemble the cheesecake they’ll\r\nripple through more.","Spoon the cream mixture onto the\r\nbiscuit base, working from the edges\r\ninwards. Smooth the top of the cheesecake\r\ndown with the back of a dessertspoon or\r\nspatula. Leave to set in the fridge overnight.","In a food processor, blitz 250g of the\r\nremaining raspberries, sieve, stir back\r\nin 1 tsp of the seeds, if you like, and\r\nsweeten to taste with icing sugar. Add\r\nenough water or canned peach juice to\r\nmake it saucy and chill until serving.","Bring the cheesecake to room\r\ntemperature about 30 mins before\r\nserving. If using a loose-bottomed tin,\r\nunmould by placing on top of a can,\r\nthen gradually pull down the sides of the\r\ntin. Slip the cheesecake onto a serving\r\nplate, removing the lining paper and\r\nbase. Scatter the remaining raspberries\r\nand peach chunks over the cheesecake,\r\ndribble over some of the sauce and\r\nserve the rest alongside."]','2026-01-10 12:23:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9040,9040,'en','Baked raspberry & lemon cheesecake','A rich and creamy baked cheesecake that makes a great dinner party dessert','["200g digestive biscuits","75g butter, melted","600g full-fat soft cheese","250g golden caster sugar","150g tub natural yogurt","3 medium eggs","finely grated zest 2 lemons, juice of 1","50g plain flour","200g raspberries","icing sugar, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 120C/100C fan/gas and line the base of a 20cm round springform tin with greaseproof paper.  Crush the biscuits in a food processor or in a food bag using a rolling pin. Tip into a bowl with the melted butter and mix well. Push the biscuits into an even layer into the base of the cake tin and chill until needed.","In a separate bowl use an electric whisk to beat the soft cheese with the sugar. Next beat in the yoghurt then the eggs one at a time. Finally beat in the lemon zest, lemon juice and flour. Fold through two thirds of the raspberries crushing them very slightly so they start to bleed into the mix then tip the mix on top of the biscuit base and smooth over the top. Bake for 45 mins then turn off the oven, leave the cake inside for another hour then cool at room temperature. Chill overnight. To serve, remove from tin, scatter with remaining raspberries and dust heavily with icing sugar."]','2026-01-10 12:23:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9041,9041,'en','Bakewell cheesecake','This almond and cherry baked cheesecake is a heavenly marriage of two amazing desserts','["200g/7oz almond biscuits","100g toasted flaked almonds","½  tsp almond extract","100g butter, melted","3 x 300g packs full-fat soft cheese","250g caster sugar","4 tbsp plain flour","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs","200ml tub soured cream","just over half a 300g jar cherry jam","icing sugar and cream, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nLine the base and sides of a 23cm\r\nspringform tin with baking parchment.\r\nBash the biscuits and 75g of the flaked\r\nalmonds to crumbs – try double-bagging\r\nin food bags and crushing with a rolling pin. Mix with the almond extract and\r\nmelted butter, then press into the\r\nbase of the prepared tin and bake for\r\n10 mins. Set aside to cool while you\r\nmake the filling.","In your largest bowl, whisk the cheese\r\nwith an electric whisk until creamy. Add\r\nthe sugar and whisk to combine. Whisk\r\nin the flour, then the vanilla, the eggs, one\r\nat a time, and finally the soured cream.","Dollop spoonfuls of mixture into the tin,\r\ndotting in tbsps of jam as you go. Smooth\r\nthe top as gently as you can.","Carefully place tin on the middle shelf\r\nof the oven and bake for 10 mins. Scatter\r\nwith remaining almonds. Decrease oven\r\nto 110C/90C fan/gas ¼ and bake for a\r\nfurther 35 mins. Turn off the oven, keep\r\nthe door closed and leave cheesecake\r\nto cool for 1 hr. Open oven door and\r\nleave it ajar for another hour (you can use your\r\noven gloves to wedge it open). Cool\r\nfor a third hour at room temp, then cover\r\nand chill overnight.","Remove from the tin and carefully peel\r\noff the parchment. Dust with icing sugar\r\nand serve with cream."]','2026-01-10 12:23:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9042,9042,'en','Berry cheesecake in a glass','Mascarpone is a great standby for making an almost-instant dessert. Here, its creamy richness is cut by the sharpness of the blackberries','["150g punnet blackberries","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 lemon, finely grated zest and juice","4 gingernut biscuits, crushed","knob of butter, melted","2 tbsp icing sugar","½ x 250g tub mascarpone or ricotta"]','["Toss the blackberries, caster sugar and 1 tbsp of the lemon juice in a small pan. Heat gently for 3-4 mins or until the berries start to burst. Leave to cool.","Meanwhile, mix together the crushed biscuits and melted butter. Spoon into 2 glasses. Gently fold the rest of the lemon juice, the lemon zest and icing sugar into the mascarpone or ricotta. Divide the lemony cheese between the glasses, then spoon over the blackberries and their syrupy juices."]','2026-01-10 12:23:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9043,9043,'en','Chocolate pizza','Make this fun chocolate pizza baking project with the kids. Alongside marshmallows, bananas, pretzels and caramel sauce work well as toppings, too','["40g unsalted butter","200ml milk, plus extra for brushing","1 tsp vanilla extract","300g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp fast-action dried yeast","2 tsp golden caster sugar","40g milk chocolate chips","5 tbsp chocolate & hazelnut spread","mini marshmallows (optional)"]','["Melt the butter in asaucepanover a medium heat, then set aside 1 tbsp in a small bowl. Pour the milk and vanilla into the pan and simmer until warmed through. Combine the flour, yeast, sugar and a pinch of salt in a large bowl. Pour the milk mixture into the bowl and mix with a wooden spoon until well combined. Tip out onto a work surface and knead for 5 mins until you have a smooth and elastic dough. Roll the dough into a tight ball, sit in a clean bowl and cover. Leave somewhere warm to prove for 2-3 hrs until doubled in size, or chill for up to 48 hrs.","Tip the dough out onto a floured surface and knock out any air bubbles.Roll itinto a round pizza base about 40cm wide. Dust a large baking sheet with a little more flour and put the dough on top. Use the chocolate chips to create a ring around the outside of the pizza base, ½cm from the edge. Brush a little milk inside the chocolate chip ring, then fold over the outside edge to enclose the chocolate and create a stuffed crust, pressing down very firmly to stick the dough in place. Can be prepared up to 1 hr ahead and set aside to puff up.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 8. Brush the middle of the dough with the reserved melted butter and bake for 15 mins until golden. Remove from the oven and spread over the chocolate spread and scatter over the marshmallows, if using, and any other toppings you like. Return the pizza to the oven for 4-5 mins to warm through the topping. Let stand for a minute before slicing to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9044,9044,'en','Chocolate chip banana bread','Rustle up a moreish chocolate chip banana bread – it’s a great way to use up ripe bananas that are lingering in the fruit bowl','["140g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","140g golden caster sugar","2 eggs, beaten","1 tsp vanilla extract","140g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","3 ripe bananas, peeled and mashed","100g chocolate chips"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 900g loaf tin and line the base and sides with baking parchment. Beat the softened butter and sugar together using an electric whisk until light and fluffy. Combine the egg and vanilla extract and pour this in, a little at at time, mixing between each addition. Fold in the flour, a pinch of salt, the baking powder, mashed banana and all but a handful of the chocolate chips.","Scrape the mixture into the prepared tin and scatter over the rest of the chocolate chips. Bake for about 50 mins, or until puffed up and cooked through – a skewer inserted into the middle of the loaf should come out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then remove to awire rackand leave to cool completely. Slice before serving.Will keep in an airtight container for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9045,9045,'en','Christmas muffins','Make these zesty, spiced muffins ahead of Christmas Day, then begin the festivities by handing them out while everyone opens their gifts under the tree','["125g unsalted butter","250g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","200g golden caster sugar","2 tsp cinnamon","¼ nutmeg, freshly grated","150g natural yogurt","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 medium eggs","1 orange, zested and juiced","150g chocolate (white, milk or dark), chopped","50g dried cranberries","50g icing sugar","2 tbsp pearl sugar (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 12-hole muffin tray with paper muffin cases.","Melt the butter in themicrowaveor a small pan over a low heat, then set aside to cool for 10 mins. Meanwhile, mix the flour, bicarb, sugar, cinnamon and nutmeg in a large bowl with a pinch of salt.","Add the yogurt, vanilla and eggs to the cooled butter and mix well. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry ingredients along with the orange zest, chocolate and dried cranberries. Mix well until there are no pockets of flour.","Divide the mixture evenly between the paper cases, then bake for 30 mins until risen and golden. Check they’re cooked by inserting a cocktail stick into the centre of one of the muffins (choose one in the centre of the tray). If any wet cake batter clings to the skewer, return to the oven for 5 mins.","Remove the muffins from the oven and leave to cool in the tin for at least 10 mins. Meanwhile, mix the icing sugar with enough of the orange juice to make a loose icing. Brush the orange glaze over each muffin, then sprinkle with a little pearl sugar, if using. Leave to cool before eating.Will keep in an airtight container for up to five days, or frozen for up to two months."]','2026-01-10 12:23:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9046,9046,'en','Dark chocolate & passion fruit tart','Pair chocolate with passion fruit to make this deliciously decadent dessert. The tangy fruit curd works wonderfully with the rich ganache','["180g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","85g icing sugar","50g cocoa powder, plus 1-2 tbsp for dusting","140g cold unsalted butter, cut into cubes","2 egg yolks","cocoa nibs, to decorate (optional)","crème fraîche, to serve","200g passion fruit pulp (from around 8-10 passion fruits)","1 leaf gelatine","3 medium eggs","70g unsalted butter","50g caster sugar","1½ tbsp cornflour","150g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids)","150ml double cream","150g light brown soft sugar"]','["Sift the flour, icing sugar, cocoa and ½ tsp salt into a bowl. Rub the butter in with your fingers until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Add the egg yolks along with 2 tbsp ice-cold water, and continue to mix with your hands until a soft dough forms. Alternatively, pulse the ingredients together in afood processor. Wrap the dough and chill for at least 1 hr.Will keep chilled for up to two days.","Line the base of a 23cm loose-bottomed tart tin with baking parchment. Roll the dough out on a lightly floured surface to the thickness of a £1 coin, then use it to line the tart tin, pressing it up the side and leaving some overhanging. Cover and chill for another 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Line the pastry with baking parchment and fill with baking beans. Bake for 20 mins. Remove the beans and parchment and bake for 20 mins more until crisp. Leave to cool completely, then use asharp knifeto trim the excess pastry.","To make the curd, put the passion fruit pulp in a food processor and blitz to separate the seeds and flesh. Push through a sieve over a medium saucepan, then discard the seeds. Tip in the remaining ingredients and set the pan over a low heat.Whiskuntil the butter has melted, then, using a wooden spoon, stir until the curd has thickened, about 10 mins. (Don’t turn up the heat to speed up the process, as the eggs will curdle.) Stir well, especially at the edge, as this is where the curd can catch. Sieve into a bowl, leave to cool, then spoon into the case. Chill the filled tart for 30 mins.","To make the ganache, melt the chocolate, cream, sugar and a pinch of sea salt in a heatproof bowl over a pan of simmering water, making sure the bowl doesn’t touch the water, stirring until glossy and thick. Remove from the heat, leave to cool for 15 mins, then pour over the curd layer. Scatter over the cocoa nibs, if using, then chill for at least 4 hrs, or overnight. Dust with cocoa, then slice and serve with crème fraîche."]','2026-01-10 12:23:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9047,9047,'en','Chocolate orange brownie tart','Wow family and friends with this chocolate orange brownie tart. With a crumbly pastry base, it’s a deliciously decadent dessert course or anytime treat','["320g pack Jus-Rol™ Shortcrust Pastry Sheet","120g dark chocolate, chopped","120g butter, cubed","2 eggs","80g golden caster sugar","80g light brown soft sugar","80g plain flour","1 orange, zested and juiced plus more zest to serve","crème fraîche to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Unravel the Jus-Rol™ Shortcrust Pastry Sheet and use to line a 20cm tart tin. Press into the sides of the tin and loosely cut around the edges, leaving a little overhanging. Line the pastry with a scrunched-up piece of baking parchment, and fill with raw rice or baking beans. Bake for 15 mins, remove the paper and bake for another 5-10 mins until dry.","While the pastry is cooking, put the butter and chocolate into a heatproof bowl set over a pan of just-simmering water and melt together, stirring often. When melted, remove from the heat and leave to cool slightly. Add a pinch of salt if your butter is unsalted.","Whisktogether the eggs and sugars briefly in a bowl until combined, then stir in the melted chocolate and butter. Sieve over the flour and fold in until just combined. Stir in the orange juice and zest.","Trim the edges of the pastry tart with a serrated knife to neaten, and spoon the brownie mixture into the middle. Smooth over with the back of a spoon orspatula, and bake for a further 30-35 mins until the top forms a crust, and the filling is no longer wet but slightly wobbly.","Leave to cool for 15 mins before removing from the tin if serving warm, or serve at room temperature. Serve with a dollop of crème fraîche, and some more orange zest grated over. Keeps for 3 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9048,9048,'en','Chocolate & peanut butter pavlova','Combine sweet and salty peanuts, crisp meringue and a creamy chocolate crémeux mixed with rich peanut butter cream in this dessert. It’s a sensory delight','["75g whole milk","115ml whipping cream","2 egg yolks, reserving the whites for the meringue","50g caster sugar","150g dark chocolate, finely chopped","60g salted butter, softened","3 large egg whites","200g caster sugar","1 tsp white wine vinegar","2 tsp cornflour","50g dark chocolate, melted and cooled","100g shelled peanuts, regular or roasted","60g granulated sugar","100g white chocolate, roughly chopped","100g smooth peanut butter","25g cold salted butter, cut into cubes","225ml double cream","dark chocolate shavings, to serve (optional)"]','["First, make the crémeux. Bring the milk and cream to the boil in a smallsaucepan, whisking occasionally.Whiskthe egg yolks and sugar together in a medium heatproof bowl until smooth. Pour in the hot cream mixture in a steady stream, whisking continuously until combined. Return to the saucepan, and simmer over a low heat for 3-4 mins, stirring continously until thickened to a custard.","Put the dark chocolate into a large heatproof bowl and strain the hot custard over it through a fine mesh sieve, whisking until the chocolate has melted and the mixture is smooth. Leave to cool for 5 mins until just warm. Add the butter and blitz using ahand blenderuntil smooth. Cover and leave at room temperature until needed.","Heat the oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2 and line two baking sheets with baking parchment. For the meringue, beat the egg whites in a large, clean bowl using an electric whisk or in a stand mixer until soft peaks form, then gradually beat in the sugar, 1 tsp at a time, until the meringue is thick and glossy. Whisk in the vinegar and cornflour.","Spoon half the meringue mixture into the middle of one of the prepared baking sheets, and spread out into a roughly 20-25cm circle. Repeat with the the remaining meringue mixture on the second baking sheet. Drizzle the melted chocolate evenly over both circles, then gently swirl it using a cutlery knife or skewer until you have a marbled effect. Bake for 1 hr, turn off the oven and leave the meringues to cool completely inside.","Meanwhile, make the candied peanuts. Tip the peanuts, sugar and 1 tbsp water into a heavy-bottomed saucepan and cook over a medium heat for 3-4 mins, stirring until the peanuts start to crystallise and turn white. Continue to cook, stirring, for another 3-4 mins until the peanuts turn dark brown. Sprinkle with a pinch of sea salt flakes, then scrape onto a sheet of baking parchment. Spread out using aspatula, and leave to cool completely.","For the peanut butter cream, melt the white chocolate, peanut butter, butter and 25ml cream in a small saucepan over a low heat, stirring until smooth. Transfer to a bowl and leave to cool for 10 mins. Whisk the remaining cream to soft peaks, then fold in the peanut butter mixture until thick and billowy.","To assemble, put one meringue circle on a serving plate, spoon over half the crémeux followed by half the peanut butter cream, then sprinkle with half the candied peanuts. Top with the second meringue circle, then the remaining crémeux and peanut butter cream, and the rest of the candied peanuts. Scatter over some dark chocolate shavings, if you like.Will keep chilled for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9049,9049,'en','Vegan yule log','Make this vegan chocolate yule log ahead of time for a stress-free festive dessert – a great alternative to Christmas pudding','["50g dairy-free margarine, melted, plus extra for the tin","250ml soya milk","2 tsp cider vinegar","250g self-raising flour","50g caster sugar, plus 2 tbsp","1 tsp baking powder","1 tbsp cocoa powder","90g dairy-free margarine","200g icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g dark chocolate","1½ tbsp brown sugar","130g silken tofu","mixed berries, holly or icing sugar, to decorate (optional)"]','["First, make the ganache. Melt the chocolate and sugar together in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of gently simmering water, ensuring the bottom of the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Leave to cool slightly. Beat the tofu in a medium bowl with an electricwhiskuntil smooth. Add the melted chocolate mixture and beat for 1-2 mins more until thickened and smooth. Set aside in a cool place.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 33 x 23cm Swiss roll tin with baking parchment. Mix the milk and vinegar together in a jug, then set aside to thicken slightly. Whisk the flour, 50g sugar, baking powder and cocoa powder together until combined. Whisk the melted margarine into the milk mixture and gradually pour this into the dry ingredients, whisking continuously until smooth. Pour into the tin, smooth the surface and bake for 20 mins. Leave to cool in the tin for 5 mins.","Sprinkle the 2 tbsp sugar over a large sheet of baking parchment. Turn the warm sponge out onto the sugared parchment, then peel off the parchment used to line the tin. Roll up the sponge from one of the short ends, using the sugared parchment to help you. While rolled up, cover with a tea towel and leave to cool completely (rolling the sponge while warm helps prevent large cracks). Don’t worry if there are small cracks – they’ll be hidden by the ganache.","Make the icing by whisking the margarine, icing sugar and vanilla together until pale and fluffy. Unroll the cooled sponge carefully, then spread the icing over using a palette knife, keeping a roughly 5cm border on the short end of the roll. Roll the sponge up again.","Stir the ganache to loosen it, then spread over the yule log with a palette knife. Drag a fork down the length of the log several times to create a bark-like pattern. Chill for 30 mins.Will keep in the fridge for up to three days.Decorate with berries and holly, or dust with icing sugar, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9050,9050,'en','Easy homemade chocolate bark','Make our chocolate bark as a thoughtful gift at Christmas time. The recipe is adaptable, so use whatever biscuits you have, or your giftee’s favourites','["400g milk or dark chocolate, broken into pieces","100g white chocolate, broken into pieces","75g biscuits, of your choice, broken into pieces","2 tbsp sprinkles, chopped nuts or sweets"]','["Melt the milk or dark chocolate in a large heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water. Remove from the heat, then melt the white chocolate in the same way. Or, melt the chocolates in themicrowavein short bursts.","Line a baking tray or sheet with baking parchment. Use a baking sheet if you want thinner shards of bark, or a smaller tray for fewer, chunkier pieces.","Pour the melted milk or dark chocolate over the prepared sheet or tray, then tip side to side to spread the chocolate out to your desired shape and thickness. Spoon over teaspoonfuls of the white chocolate, reserving a little, then use the tip of a knife or a skewer to swirl the white chocolate through the milk or dark.","Scatter over the biscuit pieces, then drizzle over the remaining white chocolate in a spiral pattern. Scatter over the sprinkles, nuts or sweets, then leave in a cool place to set fully. Cut or break into pieces and wrap."]','2026-01-10 12:23:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9051,9051,'en','Millionaire’s chocolate brownie tart','Imagine a chocolate shortbread pastry case with fudgy brownie filling that hides pockets of oozy caramel… This is a chocolate lover’s dream dessert','["175g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","85g icing sugar","50g cocoa powder","140g cold butter, cut into cubes","2 egg yolks, lightly beaten","150g butter, chopped","200g dark chocolate, broken into pieces","2 eggs","200g golden caster sugar","75g cocoa powder, plus extra to serve","18 caramel-filled chocolates"]','["To make the pastry, sift the flour, icing sugar and cocoa together into abowl. Add the butter and rub it in with your fingers until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Add the egg yolks and 3 tbsp ice-cold water, and continue to mix with your fingers until you have a soft dough. Alternatively, do this in afood processorby pulsing the ingredients together. Wrap the dough and chill for at least 1 hr.Will keep chilled for up to two days.","Roll the dough outon a lightly floured surface to the thickness of a £1 coin, then use it to line a 23cm loose-bottomed tart tin, working the pastry to the edge and leaving some overhanging. Cover and put in the fridge to chill for a further hour.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Line the case with baking parchment, then fill with baking beans. Bake for 20 mins. Remove the baking beans and parchment, and bake for a further 15-20 mins, or until the base is crisp. Leave to cool completely. Once cooled, use a sharp knife to trim off the excess pastry and create a smooth edge.","For the filling, melt the butter and dark chocolate together in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, making sure the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Stir until smooth, remove from the heat and leave to cool slightly. Beat the eggs and sugar with an electricwhiskin another bowl for 5-6 mins, or until thick and pale. Fold in the chocolate, then sift in the cocoa.","Scatter the caramel chocolates over the base of the pastry case, then pour over the filling. Transfer the tart to a baking sheet and put in the oven (still set at 190C/170C fan/gas 5) for 20-25 mins, or until set and the top has formed a crust. Leave to cool to room temperature, then carefully remove from the tin and put on a serving plate. Dust with the extra cocoa and sprinkle over a little sea salt, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9052,9052,'en','Double choc & coconut traybake','Pair creamy milk chocolate with coconut for a match made in heaven, then decorate with more coconut and a drizzle of white chocolate','["200g unsalted butter, softened","100g golden caster sugar","100g light brown soft sugar","3 large eggs","60g desiccated coconut","200g self-raising flour","100g Greek yogurt","½ tsp coconut flavouring (optional, see tip below)","200g milk or dark chocolate, chopped into small pieces","200ml double cream","40g white chocolate, melted","handful of coconut flakes, toasted, or desiccated coconut or sprinkles"]','["Line a 22 x 28cm rectangular cake tin with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","First, prepare the topping. Put the milk or dark chocolate pieces in a large heatproof bowl. Heat the double cream in a medium pan until just steaming, then slowly pour over the chocolate, whisking until the chocolate has melted and the mix is smooth. Leave to cool slightly, then chill for 1 hr 30 mins until soft, but still spoonable.","Beat the butter, sugars and ¼ tsp salt together in a stand mixer or using an electric whisk for 5 mins, or until light and fluffy. Add the eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition. Add the desiccated coconut, flour, yogurt and coconut flavouring, if using, and briefly beat until just combined. Spoon the mix into the tin, smooth the surface using the back of a spoon, then bake for 30 mins until golden and firm to the touch. Leave in the tin to cool completely.","When fully cool, spread over the chocolate topping, then drizzle with the white chocolate and scatter over the toasted coconut flakes. Chill for around 15 mins until the topping is set. Cut into 12 squares, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9053,9053,'en','Raspberry & white chocolate financier traybake','Think of financiers like posh bakewells made with brown butter. Tom Kerridge turns them into a traybake here, using raspberries and white chocolate','["200g butter, plus extra for the tin","200g golden caster sugar","100g plain flour","100g ground almonds","small pinch of ground cinnamon","6 large egg whites (freeze the egg yolks for another recipe)","150g raspberries","100g white chocolate chips or chunks","icing sugar, for dusting","227g tub clotted cream, to serve"]','["Melt the butter in a small pan until sizzling. Watch it carefully – the butter will foam, and, when the foam subsides, it will turn from yellow to a nutty brown. Remove from the heat, tip into a bowl to stop it cooking and leave to cool.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 20 x 25cm baking tin at least 4cm deep and line with baking parchment. Mix the sugar, flour, almonds and cinnamon together. Beat the egg whites in a separate large bowl using an electric whisk to soft peaks. Fold the beaten egg whites into the flour mix using a large metal spoon. Slowly pour in the brown butter, folding it in until everything is combined and the batter is light. Scrape into the prepared tin. Scatter over the raspberries and chocolate.","Bake for 20-25 mins until firm. Leave to cool in the tin, then dust with some icing sugar and cut into squares or bars. Will keep, well wrapped, for up to three days at room temperature. Serve with clotted cream."]','2026-01-10 12:23:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9054,9054,'en','Chocolate & marmalade steamed pudding with marmalade cream','Pair chocolate and marmalade for a dessert made in heaven. The cream – which works with lots of other desserts, too – takes it up another notch','["175g butter, plus extra for the basin","45g cocoa powder","175g plain flour","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp baking powder","200g light brown soft sugar","1 orange, zested","3 large eggs, lightly beaten","115g soft-set marmalade, beaten to loosen","100g dark chocolate, chopped","300ml double cream","1 heaped tbsp icing sugar","125g soft-set marmalade, beaten to loosen, plus extra to serve"]','["Butter a 1.2-litre pudding basin and put a circle of buttered baking parchment in the base.","Sift together the cocoa, flour, bicarb, baking powder and a pinch of salt. Beat the butter and sugar together in an electric mixer until pale and fluffy, then add the orange zest. Gradually add the eggs, a little at a time, beating well after each addition. Stir in the marmalade. Fold in the sifted ingredients followed by the dark chocolate chunks. Scrape the batter into the prepared pudding basin.","Put a piece of baking parchment on top of a sheet of foil (both should be large enough to cover the basin and overhang the edges). Fold a pleat along the middle, then place this, parchment side down, onto the pudding. The pleat should run across the centre. Tie to the basin firmly with string, using it to make a handle. Trim off the excess parchment and foil.","Put the pudding in a large saucepan on a trivet or upturned saucer. Add enough boiling water to come one-third of the way up the sides of the basin. Bring the water to the boil, turn down to a simmer, cover the pan and steam the pudding for 2 hrs-2 hrs 15 mins. Keep topping up with hot water.","Lift the pudding out of the pan, leave to sit for 10 mins, then run a knife between the basin and the edge of the pudding. Invert onto a plate – the pudding should slide out. Remove the parchment.","Whip the cream and icing sugar to soft peaks, then stir in the marmalade. Serve the pudding with a dollop of the cream and some marmalade on top."]','2026-01-10 12:23:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9055,9055,'en','Banoffee chocolate cups','Make these to give as an edible Christmas gift. Made with chocolate, dulce de leche and banana chips, they''re all the taste of banoffee pie in one small bite','["150g dark chocolate, chopped","150g milk chocolate, chopped","12 mini digestive biscuits (or some crushed digestive biscuits)","40g banana chips, finely crumbled","100g dulce de leche","chocolate curls, gold sprinkles or edible gold leaf, to decorate (optional)"]','["Line a 12-hole cupcake tin with paper or silicone cases. Melt the dark and milk chocolate together for 1-2 mins in the microwave. Divide the digestive biscuits between the cases and put the banana chips in each. Pour enough melted chocolate into the cases to cover the biscuits, reserving the rest. Transfer the tin to the freezer to chill for 15 mins.","Stir the dulce de leche to loosen it, then spoon or pipe a small dot into the centre of each cup. Pour over the reserved chocolate so the filling is covered, then decorate with chocolate curls, gold sprinkles or edible gold leaf, if you like. Put in the fridge to chill for 2 hrs, then remove the cases and pack into gift boxes. Will keep in the fridge for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9056,9056,'en','Christmas rocky road','Adapt this festive rocky road however you like. It’s great for using up leftover Christmas sweets and biscuits, and you can get kids involved in making them, too','["100g butter, cut into cubes, plus extra for the tin","250g Christmas biscuits, such as shortbread or chocolate biscuits","75g shelled nuts (use up a bag of whole nuts, or bits and bobs from the baking cupboard)","100g mixed dried fruit (such as raisins, cherries or glacé ginger)","75g Christmas sweets (candy canes, marshmallows or jelly sweets)","400g milk or plain chocolate (or a mixture of both), chopped","140g golden syrup (weigh this straight into the pan you will use for melting)","2 tbsp sprinkles, or more sweets, to decorate"]','["Butter and line a 20cm square tin, or use a 20cm square silicone mould. Break the biscuits into pieces – they need to be no smaller than a pea, but not too chunky or your rocky road won’t hold together.","Halve any larger nuts either by snapping them or carefully cutting with a knife, then combine them with the biscuits. Halve any large pieces of dried fruit and chop or snap sweets into smaller pieces, then add these to the bowl.","Melt 300g of the chocolate, the butter and the golden syrup carefully in a pan set over a low heat, stirring occasionally, then pour this over the biscuit and nut mixture and mix together so the chocolate covers everything.","Tip the mixture into the tin, then level the top – it doesn’t need to be completely smooth. Melt the remaining chocolate in the microwave in short blasts, or in a heatproof bowl over a small pan of simmering water, then drizzle this over the top and sprinkle with the decorations. Chill for at least 3 hrs or overnight before cutting into squares. Will keep in the fridge for three to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9057,9057,'en','Next level chocolate fondant','Wow dinner guests with our ultimate chocolate fondant. Its molten middle is the stuff of dessert dreams – and we’ve added in caramel and coffee flavours too','["200g butter, melted","3 tbsp cocoa powder, for dusting","50g caramel sauce","200g dark chocolate, chopped","4 tbsp very strong coffee powder (espresso is ideal)","6 eggs, three whole, plus the yolks of 3 (freeze the leftover egg whites for another recipe)","75g golden caster sugar","50g plain flour","6 small metal pudding basins"]','["Use 50g of the butter to brush the insides of the pudding basins. Put them on a baking tray and transfer to the fridge to chill until the butter sets. Brush over another layer of the butter, then dust generously with the cocoa. Return to the fridge to set. Mix the caramel sauce with a good pinch of sea salt flakes, then chill in the fridge until ready to use.","Tip the remaining butter, the chocolate and coffee powder into a heatproof bowl. Set the bowl over a pan of gently simmering water, ensuring the bottom of the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Stir the mixture until smooth, adding another small pinch of sea salt. Tip the whole eggs, egg yolks and sugar into another bowl and beat together using an electric whisk until very pale – the whisk should leave a trail in the mixture when lifted. Sift in the flour, then gently fold in the melted chocolate mixture.","Spoon the fondant mixture into the prepared basins until just about halfway full, then transfer to the freezer on a baking tray for about 20-25 mins, or until the mixture is just set. Add 1 tsp of the salted caramel sauce to the middle of each fondant, then top up with the remaining fondant mixture. Return to the freezer until frozen. Can be prepared up to two weeks ahead.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the fondants on a baking tray and bake for 15 mins until the tops have formed a crust and they are starting to come away from the sides of the basins. Remove from the oven, then leave to rest for 1 min before turning out onto warm plates. Sprinkle with extra sea salt, then serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:23:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9058,9058,'en','Chocolate concrete with caramel sauce','Update a classic school-dinner recipe by using caramel sauce instead of pink custard to serve alongside chocolate squares. Kids (and big kids) will love it','["175g plain flour","50g ground almonds","60g cocoa","115g golden caster sugar","145g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","demerara sugar, for sprinkling over","4 tbsp caramel","50ml single cream"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the flour, almonds, cocoa, caster sugar and a large pinch of salt into a food processor and whizz briefly. Add the butter and whizz until the mixture resembles damp sand.","Generously butter the base and sides of a small (15 x 25cm) baking tin. Tip the mixture into the tin and press it down. Bake for 30 mins. Remove from the oven, sprinkle over some demerara sugar and cut into squares using a sharp knife while still it’s soft.","Meanwhile, heat the caramel and cream together in a pan. Serve the concrete warm with the caramel sauce. You can cool any leftovers and eat them cold – they will harden like shortbread."]','2026-01-10 12:23:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9059,9059,'en','Double choc hot cross buns','An indulgent twist on a traditional Easter treat. If you''re a chocolate orange fan, add some zest to the dry dough and soak the raisins in orange juice','["300ml milk","400g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","50g cocoa powder","7g sachet fast-action dried yeast","50g golden caster sugar","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 large egg, beaten","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g raisins","100g milk chocolate chips","50g white chocolate","2 tbsp milk","50g plain flour"]','["For the dough, warm 275ml of the milk for a few mins in a small pan or 1 min in a microwave on High. Mix the flour, cocoa, yeast, sugar and cinnamon in a large mixing bowl, and whisk the egg and vanilla extract into the warm milk. Pour the liquid into the dry ingredients and stir to make a soft dough. Tip the dough onto a clean work surface and knead for 10 mins until smooth and elastic. Put the dough back in the cleaned mixing bowl, cover with oiled cling film and leave to rise until doubled in size – about 1 hr.","Turn the dough back out onto a work surface, scatter over the raisins and chocolate chips, and knead them in.","Line a large baking sheet with baking parchment. Divide the dough into 12 equal pieces and shape each into a smooth ball. Arrange the balls on the prepared baking sheet in a 4 x 3 formation, leaving some room in between for rising. Score a cross on the top of each bun, cover loosely with oiled cling film and leave to prove until the buns have nearly doubled in size.","Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. For the white chocolate crosses, melt the white chocolate with the milk in a small pan or in the microwave, then stir in the flour, 1 tbsp at a time, to make a smooth paste. Spoon into a disposable piping bag or food bag, and snip off the tip of the corner.","Glaze the buns with the remaining milk and bake for 15 mins, then pipe on crosses where you scored the dough and bake for 5 mins more. Cool on a wire rack before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:23:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9060,9060,'en','Chocolate, orange & hazelnut cake','You''d never guess that this spectacular dessert is dairy-free, decorated with a zesty ganache using orange juice instead of cream','["175ml light-coloured olive oil, plus extra for greasing","140g blanched hazelnuts","100ml orange juice, plus zest 1 orange","140g self-raising flour","½  tsp baking powder","50g cocoa powder","3 large eggs","175g light brown muscovado sugar","300g golden caster sugar","1 large orange, cut into 3mm/1/8in slices","75ml orange juice","100g dairy-free dark chocolate","50g blanched hazelnuts, toasted","1 tsp edible gold powder (see tip)"]','["Make the candied orange slices a day ahead if you can. Put the sugar and 300ml water in a medium saucepan and bring to the boil. Reduce to a gentle simmer, add the orange slices and cook for 1 hr-1 hr 10 mins or until the pith is translucent, turning occasionally. Line a baking tray with parchment. Carefully remove the slices from the syrup, place on the prepared tray and set aside to dry (at least 8 hrs) before cutting in half. Reserve the syrup.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly grease a loaf tin (mine was 900g) with olive oil and line with a strip of baking parchment.","Grind the hazelnuts in a food processor until they resemble coarse breadcrumbs (do not blitz them too much or they will become oily), then add to a bowl along with the orange zest, a pinch of salt and the rest of the dry ingredients. Mix together until evenly combined.","Pour the oil and the orange juice into a jug and mix together. Put the eggs and sugar in a tabletop mixer or large bowl and whisk together for 5-10 mins or until the mixture has tripled in volume and holds a ribbon on the surface when the beaters are lifted out. Slowly pour the oil mixture into the egg mixture and fold together until combined.","Add the flour mixture to the egg mixture in 3 or 4 additions, folding together until combined. You can’t sieve this mixture over the eggs because of the hazelnuts, but try not to dump the flour in one place – you need to be careful and fold the batter to retain its lightness. Once fully combined, pour the batter into the prepared loaf tin and bake for 50-55 mins or until a skewer inserted into the centre of the cake comes out clean.","Prick the top of the cake all over, then pour over 5 tbsp of the reserved orange syrup. Cool in the tin for 15 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack to cool completely. Trim the top of the cake (keep this for a mini trifle) and turn out, cut-side down, onto a serving platter.","To decorate, pour the orange juice into a small pan and bring to a simmer. Put the chocolate in a small bowl, pour the orange juice over and stir together to form a smooth ganache. Set aside in the fridge until thickened, about 20-25 mins. Tip the hazelnuts into a small bowl and add the gold powder with a dash of water, stirring together to coat. Put the ganache in a piping bag fitted with a small round piping tip. Pipe in peaks over the top of the cake, decorating with the golden hazelnuts and the orange slices. Will keep for up to 3 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9061,9061,'en','Malted chocolate drip cake','This layered drip cake is smothered in cream cheese icing and drizzled with a dark chocolate ganache – a stunning centrepiece for a big occasion','["200g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","250g golden caster sugar","3 large eggs","225g plain flour","25g powdered malt drink","2 tsp baking powder","100g natural yogurt","2 tsp vanilla extract","175g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","250g golden caster sugar","3 large eggs","225g plain flour","25g cocoa powder","2 tsp baking powder","50g natural yogurt","100g dark chocolate, melted and cooled a little","butter or flavourless oil, for greasing","200g golden caster sugar","5 tbsp golden syrup","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","37g pack Malteasers","250g pack slightly salted butter, softened","750g icing sugar","3 tbsp powdered malt drink","1 tsp vanilla extract","280g tub full-fat cream cheese","100g dark chocolate, finely chopped","75ml double cream"]','["First make the malt sponges. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line the bases of 2 x 20cm cake tins with baking parchment. Put the butter and sugar in a large bowl and whisk until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, whisking well between each addition. Tip the flour, malt and baking powder into the bowl with 1/4 tsp salt and fold together, then add the yogurt and vanilla, and give everything a final stir. Divide the cake mixture between the 2 tins, level the tops and bake on the middle shelf for 25-30 mins or until a skewer pushed into the centre of the cakes comes out clean. Cool for 10 mins, then remove from the tins, peel off the baking parchment and transfer to a wire rack to cool completely. Wash the tins.","Now make the chocolate sponges. Grease and line the base of the tins as before and boil the kettle. In the same bowl (don’t worry about washing it), cream the butter and sugar as before, adding the eggs, one at a time, and mixing until combined. Sift in the flour, cocoa and baking powder with 1/4 tsp salt. Fold the mixture together, then add the yogurt, melted chocolate and 100ml boiling water. Stir until combined, then divide between the tins. Bake for 25-30 mins, testing with a skewer as before. Cool in the tins for 10 mins, then turn out, remove the baking parchment and cool completely. The sponges can be made up to 2 days before being iced, cooled and wrapped tightly in cling film.","Make the honeycomb. Grease a baking tray with a little butter or oil. Put the sugar and golden syrup in a large pan. Warm over a medium heat and leave to bubble to a liquid caramel, but don’t stir. When you’re happy with the colour (the darker it gets, the more intense the flavour will be), add the bicarbonate of soda and quickly stir into the syrup. Before the bubbles die down, pour the foaming mixture onto the baking tray, then set aside for 30 mins to cool and firm up.","Make the icing. In your largest mixing bowl, beat the butter with half the icing sugar, the malt and vanilla until smooth. Add the remaining icing sugar and the cream cheese, and beat again until well combined – don’t overmix or the icing may become runny.","You’re now ready to assemble. Put one of the sponges on a cake stand or cake board, sticking it down with a small blob of icing. Use 1/4 of the icing to stack the cakes, alternating between the malt and chocolate sponges. Place the final sponge on top, flat-side up. When assembled, use a palette knife to cover the entire cake with a thin layer of the icing, filling any gaps between sponges, but don’t worry about completely covering the sponges at this stage. This is called a crumb coat and ensures that your final layer is crumb-free. Make space in your fridge and chill the cake for 30 mins to firm up the icing.","Once the icing is chilled, use the remaining icing to completely cover the cake. This is easiest if you pile the icing on top of the cake, then use a palette knife to ease it over the edge and down the sides. You can make it as smooth or as rough as you like. Chill for another 30 mins.","Make the drizzle. Meanwhile, put the dark chocolate in a bowl and heat the cream in a small pan until just steaming. Pour the cream over the chocolate and leave to melt for 5-10 mins. Stir to make a glossy ganache, then set aside to firm up a little – you want the ganache to be pourable but not too runny, to make drizzly droplets down the side of the cake.","When the ganache is the correct consistency, remove the cake from the fridge and spoon the ganache over the top edge of the cake, encouraging it to drizzle down the side with your spoon – start at the back of the cake to get the hang of it. Fill in the middle of the top of the cake with chocolate too.","Break the honeycomb into tall shards and stack them on top of the cake. Finish with whole and halved Maltesers, adding a few around the base, along with some honeycomb crumbs. The cake is best served within 2-3 hrs of assembling, but will still taste delicious for up to 3 days. Store leftovers in the fridge and allow to come back to room temperature before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9062,9062,'en','Flowerpot chocolate chip muffins','Children will love to make these yummy double chocolate chip cakes topped with rice paper flowers – perfect for a kids Easter baking project','["3 tbsp vegetable oil","125g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","25g cocoa powder","100g golden caster sugar","1 large egg","100ml milk","150g milk chocolate chips","25g chocolate cake decorations such as vermicelli sprinkles or chocolate-coated popping candy","20 rice paper wafer daisies (these come in packs of 12, so get 2 packs)","10 mini teracotta pots (see tip)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly oil the inside of the terracotta pots with a little vegetable oil and place on a baking tray. Place a paper mini muffin case in the bottom of each pot.","Put the flour, baking powder and cocoa in a bowl and stir in the sugar.","Crack the egg into a jug and whisk with the milk and remaining oil. Pour this over the flour and cocoa mixture, and stir in with 50g of the chocolate chips. Be careful not to overmix – you want a loose but still quite lumpy mixture. Spoon into the pots up to three-quarters full. Place in the middle of the oven and bake for 12-15 mins until risen and firm. Transfer to a wire rack (still in the pots) and leave to cool.","Put the rest of the chocolate chips in a small bowl and melt over a small pan of gently simmering water (don’t let the water touch the bowl), or put in a microwave-proof bowl and heat on High for 1 min until melted.","Spread the tops of the muffins with the melted chocolate. Sprinkle over the chocolate decorations and add 2 rice paper wafer daisies to each pot to serve. Will keep for 2 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9063,9063,'en','Choc chunk, cashew & cranberry cookies','These nutty biscuits are packed with chocolate chunks and chewy dried fruit – swap the cashews for peanuts if you prefer','["100g pack cashew nuts, or more if you like","140g unsalted butter, at room temperature, plus extra for greasing","250g plain flour","½  tsp baking powder","200g white caster sugar","100g crunchy cashew nut butter, or use peanut butter","1 large egg, beaten","2 tbsp golden syrup","200g bar chocolate, 50% cocoa solids, chopped into 1cm chunks","50g dried cranberries (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Scatter the cashews over a baking tray and toast for 5-7 mins until golden. Cool, then roughly chop.","Meanwhile, grease and line 2 baking sheets with parchment. Sift the flour, baking powder and 1/2 tsp salt into a large bowl, then stir in the sugar. Cut the butter into rough cubes, and add this and the nut butter to the bowl. Rub together until the mixture resembles damp breadcrumbs.","Using a cutlery knife, work the egg and syrup into the bowl to make a soft dough. Tip in the chocolate, nuts and cranberries (if using), and stir to combine. Try not to overwork the dough at this point.","Roll slightly heaped tablespoons of dough into balls and place onto each baking sheet, leaving plenty of room for the cookies to spread. Bake for 12 mins or until golden at the edges and risen in the middle. Let them cool for 5 mins, then move to a rack to cool completely. Repeat until all the dough is shaped and baked. To make ahead, freeze the raw cookies on a baking sheet, then transfer to a freezer bag or box once solid. Bake from frozen, adding 5 mins to the cooking time."]','2026-01-10 12:23:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9064,9064,'en','Dark & white chocolate cardamom swirl tart','Layer up two types of chocolate ganache on a biscuit base to make a stunning marbled tart – perfect as a dinner party dessert','["7 cardamom pods","400g double cream","100g white caster sugar","200g bar white Belgian chocolate","180g pack Willie’s Cacao Venezuelan Black 100% Carenero cacao, or try Lindt 99% cacao (both available from Waitrose)","25g unsalted butter, cut into small pieces and softened","1 tsp vanilla extract","150ml whole milk","200g dark chocolate digestives","75g unsalted butter, melted, plus extra for greasing","3 tbsp caster sugar (white or golden)"]','["Crush the cardamom pods with a pestle and mortar, then put the seeds and the husks in a medium pan. Pour in the cream and sugar, stir, then heat gently until the cream begins to simmer. Remove the pan from the heat and leave to infuse for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, finely chop the white chocolate in a food processor, then tip into a medium bowl. Repeat with the cacao, tip this into another bowl and add the butter. Season each chocolate with a pinch of salt.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and lightly grease a 23cm fluted tart tin or springform tin. Without cleaning the processor, tip in the digestives and pulse to fine crumbs. Pulse in the melted butter and sugar until the mixture looks like wet sand, then press firmly into the base of the tin. Slide it onto a baking sheet, bake for 10 mins, then cool completely.","When the base is cold, reheat the infused cream to a simmer. Strain half the cream on top of the white chocolate and stir. Add the milk to what is left in the pan, reheat, then strain this over the chopped cacao and butter, and stir. It will take a few mins before each chocolate melts completely.","Pour all but about 3 tbsp of the cacao ganache on top of the biscuit base and chill for 15 mins or until just set. Now flood the top with the white chocolate ganache. Finish with the reserved cacao mix,\r\ndropping 6 dollops on top like a clock face, and one in the middle. Use a skewer to swirl the colours together. Chill for at least 4 hrs or ideally overnight to let the ganache set firm, then bring it out of the fridge for 30 mins before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9065,9065,'en','Chocolate & spice hot cross buns','Flecked with dark chocolate, cinnamon, orange zest and plump raisins, these buns make an extra-special Easter treat','["zest and juice 1 large orange","sunflower oil, for greasing","225ml semi-skimmed milk","50g unsalted butter, plus extra for greasing","1 large egg","450g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","2 tsp fast-action yeast","50g golden caster sugar","140g raisins","100g chocolate, 70% cocoa solids","1 tsp ground cinnamon","4 tbsp golden caster sugar","100g plain flour"]','["Make the dough first. Heat the milk in a pan until steaming. Remove from the heat, and drop in the butter. After a couple of mins, beat in the egg and half the orange zest.\r\nThe liquid should be just warm for step 2.","Mix the strong flour, yeast, 1 tsp salt and the sugar in a large bowl, then tip in the liquid and stir to make a soft dough without dry patches. Flour the work surface and your hands, then knead the dough for 5-10 mins until smooth and elastic. Use a stand mixer or processor if you like. Oil a large bowl, sit the dough inside it, then cover with oiled cling film. Rise in a warm place for about 1 hr or until doubled in size.","Put the raisins and half the orange juice in a small pan or covered bowl, and either simmer for a few mins or microwave on High for 1 min until hot. Cool completely. Break the chocolate into a food processor with the cinnamon and 2 tbsp sugar, then pulse until very finely chopped. Mix in the rest of the zest. If you don’t have a processor, chop it by hand or grate it, then mix with the other ingredients.","Turn the risen dough onto a floured surface and press it out to a large rectangle, a little bigger than A4 paper. Scatter it evenly with the chocolate mix and the raisins, which should have absorbed all of the juice (drain them if not). Roll the dough up around the filling, then knead it well for a few mins until the chocolate and fruit are evenly spread. Some raisins and chocolate will try to escape, but keep kneading them back in.","Grease then line a large baking sheet with baking parchment. Divide the dough into 12 equal pieces. Shape into buns by pinching each ball of dough into a purse shape, concentrating on making the underneath of the ball (which will be the top) as smooth as you can. Put the buns, smooth-side up, onto the baking sheet, leaving room for rising. Cover loosely with oiled cling film and prove in a warm place for 30-45 mins or until the dough has risen and doesn’t spring back quickly when prodded gently.","Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. To make the paste for the crosses, gradually stir 6-7 tbsp water into the plain flour to make a smooth, thick paste, then put in a food bag and snip off the end to about 5mm. Pipe the crosses, then bake for 20-25 mins until the buns are risen and dark golden brown.","Mix the rest of the orange juice with the remaining sugar and let it dissolve. Brush the syrup over the buns while they are hot, then leave to cool. Eat on the day of baking, or toast the next day."]','2026-01-10 12:23:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9066,9066,'en','Brooklyn blackout cake','This rich, dark sponge is filled and coated with a thick chocolate custard, then finished with crumbled cake – best eaten chilled','["140g unsalted butter, plus extra for greasing","100ml vegetable oil","140g buttermilk","100ml coffee, made with 1 tsp espresso powder","2 large eggs, at room temperature","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g light muscovado sugar","250g plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 tsp baking powder","50g cocoa powder","250g golden caster sugar","500ml full-fat milk","140g chocolate, 85% cocoa solids, broken into cubes","50g cornflour","2 tsp espresso powder","2 tsp vanilla extract"]','["Make the custard first as it needs to chill. Put all the ingredients, except the vanilla, in a large pan and bring gently to the boil, whisking all the time, until the chocolate has melted and you have a silky, thick custard. It will take 5-7 mins from cold. Stir in the vanilla and a generous pinch of salt, then scrape the custard into a wide, shallow bowl. Cover the surface with cling film, cool, then chill for at least 3 hrs or until cold and set.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease then line the bases of 2 x 20cm sandwich tins. Melt the butter in a pan, then remove from the heat and beat in the oil, buttermilk, coffee and eggs. In a large bowl, whisk the dry ingredients togetherplus 1/4 tsp salt (saves sifting) and squish any resistant lumps of sugar with your fingers. Tip in the wet ingredients and whisk until smooth.","Divide the batter between the prepared tins and bake for 25-30 mins until risen and a skewer inserted into the middle of the cakes comes out clean. Cool for 10 mins, then transfer to a rack to cool completely, parchment-side down.","Remove the parchment linings from the cakes. If the cakes are domed, trim them flat. Now cut each cake across the middle using a large serrated knife. Put your least successful layer and any trimmings into a processor and pulse it to crumbs. Tip into a large bowl.","Sit one layer on a cake plate and spread it with a quarter of the custard. Sandwich the next layer on top, add another quarter of the custard, then top with the final layer of cake. Spoon the remaining custard on top of the cake, then spread it around the top and down the sides until smooth. Chill for 15 mins to firm up the custard again.","Hold the cake over the bowl containing the crumbs, then sprinkle and gently press a layer of crumbs all over the cake. Brush any excess from the plate. You’ll have some crumbs left. Chill for 2 hrs, or longer, before serving, and eat it cold. Can be made up to 2 days ahead. The cake gets fudgier and more enticing the longer you leave it."]','2026-01-10 12:23:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9067,9067,'en','Chocolate meringue Mont Blanc cake','This towering cake has layers of chocolate sponge, meringue and chestnut cream – a stunning centrepiece for a festive dinner party','["300g butter, plus extra for greasing","200g dark chocolate, finely chopped","2 large eggs, plus 3 yolks","200g golden caster sugar","140g light brown soft sugar","200g chestnut purée from a 415g can (reserve the rest for the filling, below)","175g plain flour","50g cocoa powder","1½  tsp baking powder","3 large egg whites","140g golden caster sugar","300ml pot double cream","215g chestnut purée (from can, above)","100g icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","chocolate shavings (optional)"]','["Grease 2 deep 20cm loose-bottomed cake tins and line the base and sides with baking parchment. Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/ gas 3. Melt the chocolate and butter in a bowl over a pan of gently simmering water, then set aside to cool a little.","In a large bowl, whisk the whole eggs, yolks and sugars with an electric whisk until doubled in size – this will take about 5 mins. Sieve in the flour, cocoa and baking power with a pinch of salt. Fold the chestnut purée into the chocolate butter mixture, then add to the other bowl and gently fold everything together. Divide evenly between the tins.","Working quickly, clean the whisks and your large bowl, put the egg whites in the bowl and whisk until stiff. Add the sugar, a spoonful at a time, whisking continuously, until thick and able to hold stiff peaks. Use a spoon to dot the meringue on top of the cake mixture in both tins, then use the back of the spoon to spread the mixture. Fill the gaps to touch the edges of the tins – make nice swirly dips and peaks as you spread. Bake for 1 hr 15 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle of the cake comes out with moist\r\nbut set crumbs. Cool completely.","When you’re ready to serve, make the filling. Put the cream, chestnut purée and icing sugar in a bowl and whisk until softly whipped. Remove the cakes from their tins and place 1 on a cake stand or plate (save the one with the prettiest top for the final layer). Dollop on the cream and swirl out towards the edges (don’t worry if you crush the meringue a bit). Place the next sponge on top, dust with icing sugar, then top with chocolate shavings, if using. Best served straight away, but will keep in the fridge\r\nfor 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9068,9068,'en','Squidgy chocolate pear pudding','This hot, gooey chocolate pud, with dark chocolate and canned pears, can be made ahead and frozen – a perfect no-fuss dinner party dessert','["200g butter, plus extra for greasing","300g golden caster sugar","4 large eggs","75g plain flour","50g cocoa powder","410g can pears halves in juice, drained","100g plain dark chocolate (70% cocoa solids)","25g flaked almonds (optional)","cream or ice cream, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Lightly\r\ngrease a roughly 20 x 30cm shallow\r\novenproof dish. Put the butter in a large\r\nsaucepan and place over a low heat until just\r\nmelted. Remove the butter from the heat\r\nand stir in the sugar until well combined.","Whisk the eggs together in a large bowl. Gradually add the eggs to the butter and\r\nsugar, beating well with a wooden spoon in\r\nbetween each addition. Sift the flour and\r\ncocoa powder on top of the egg mixture,\r\nthen beat hard with a wooden spoon until\r\nthoroughly combined.","Pour into the prepared tin or dish and\r\nnestle the pears into the chocolate batter.\r\nPut the chocolate on a board and cut into\r\nchunky pieces roughly 1.5cm with a large\r\nknife. Scatter the chocolate pieces over the\r\nbatter and sprinkle with almonds, if you like.\r\nCan be frozen at this stage.","Bake in the centre of the oven for 30 mins\r\nor until the mixture is crusty on the surface\r\nand lightly cooked inside. Do not allow to\r\novercook, as the cake will become spongy\r\nrather than gooey in the centre. Serve warm\r\nwith cream or ice cream"]','2026-01-10 12:23:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9069,9069,'en','Chocolate truffle star cake','Glamorous enough to serve as a dessert, this makes a stunning centrepiece. And the bonus is you can make the whole thing ahead and freeze until you need it','["140g dark chocolate, 70% cocoa solids, broken into pieces","140g butter, cut into pieces","2 tsp coffee granules","50g self-raising flour","50g plain flour","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","140g light muscovado sugar","140g golden caster sugar","1½  tbsp cocoa powder","2 medium eggs","3 tbsp soured cream","100g white chocolate","25g dark chocolate","5-6 small chocolate truffles","100ml double cream","50g white chocolate, very finely chopped","1 tbsp boiling water","100ml double cream","2 tsp golden caster sugar","50g dark chocolate, very finely chopped","1½  tbsp boiling water"]','["The cake and stars are best made a day ahead (the cake is easier to slice and fill, and the stars have time to set). Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Butter and base-line a deep loaf tin (22 x 11 x 6cm). Put the chocolate and butter for the cake in a saucepan. Mix the coffee with 50ml water, then pour into the pan. Warm through over a low heat, just to melt – be careful not to overheat.","While the chocolate melts, mix both flours with the bicarbonate of soda, both sugars and the cocoa. Break down any lumps in the sugar with your fingers. Beat the eggs, then stir \r\nin the soured cream. Pour this and \r\nthe melted chocolate over the flour mixture, then stir everything together – the mix will be very soft. Pour it into the tin, then bake for about 1½ hrs, or until firm on top. Let the cake cool in the tin (it may crack if you turn it out too soon), then loosen the sides and carefully turn it out onto a wire rack to cool completely.","To make the stars, line a baking sheet with baking parchment. Melt both chocolates separately. Pour and spread the white chocolate thinly into a rectangle on the parchment. Drizzle the dark chocolate off the end of a teaspoon in bold squiggles over the top. Leave in a cool, dry place (not the fridge) until almost set but not hard, then lightly press down with a star cutter, about 5.5cm across, to make at least 6 star outlines. (Make a few extra in case of breakages and wipe the cutter each time you press a star shape.) When completely set, cut through the star outlines with a small sharp knife, then carefully lift them off onto baking parchment.","For the white chocolate icing, heat the cream just to boiling. Remove from the heat, tip in the chocolate and swirl so it starts to melt, then pour in the boiling water and stir to melt completely. Pour into a small bowl and chill in the fridge for about 1 hr to cool and thicken slightly. Beat with an electric hand mixer until thick and glossy.","When the cake is completely cold, place it into the fridge to chill (this makes it easier to slice). Take the cake out of the fridge and turn it over so the flat base becomes the top of the cake. Slice the cake horizontally into three. Sandwich back together with the white chocolate icing, not quite up to the edges. (This can be done a day ahead and chilled.)","For the dark chocolate icing, heat the cream with the sugar just to boiling. Remove from the heat, tip in the chocolate, then stir in the boiling water. Leave to cool and thicken a little. Put the cake on a wire rack with parchment paper underneath (to catch any drips). Pour and spread the icing all over the cake. Leave to set slightly, then arrange the truffles down the centre and prop 5 or 6 of your best stars against them."]','2026-01-10 12:23:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9070,9070,'en','Angela’s lighter chocolate tart','A chocolate tart with a rich taste and moussey texture – but with two-thirds less fat than the classic version','["140g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","50g butter, cut into pieces","2 tsp cocoa powder","1 tbsp icing sugar","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 medium egg yolk","half-fat crème fraîche, to serve (optional)","100g dark chocolate, 70% cocoa solids, very finely chopped","1 tbsp cocoa powder, plus extra ½ tsp for sifting","¾  tsp coffee granules","½  tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp semi-skimmed milk","2 medium egg whites","2 tbsp dark muscovado sugar","85g half-fat crème fraîche"]','["Tip the flour into a mixing bowl and\r\nremove 2 tsp (the cocoa will replace\r\nit later). Add the butter and rub into the\r\nflour until the mixture resembles fine\r\nbreadcrumbs. Sift in the cocoa and icing\r\nsugar, then, using a round-bladed knife,\r\nstir in the oil, egg yolk and 1½-2 tbsp cold\r\nwater, until the dough comes together.\r\nGently gather into a ball, then roll out on\r\na lightly floured surface, big enough to\r\nfit a 20cm round x 3.5cm-deep loose-bottomed\r\nflan tin. Ease the pastry into\r\nthe tin, leaving a slight overhang. Lightly\r\nprick the base with a fork, then chill for\r\nabout 10 mins.","Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Sit\r\ntin on a baking sheet. Line the pastry with\r\nfoil and fill with baking beans. Blind-bake\r\nfor 15 mins or until set. Carefully lift out\r\nthe beans and paper, then bake the\r\npastry case for another 10 mins or until\r\nthe base is cooked. Remove, carefully\r\ntrim off the overhanging pastry with a\r\nsharp knife, to give the pastry a flat edge,\r\nthen leave until completely cold.","To make the filling, put the chocolate\r\nin a large bowl that will fit over a pan of\r\nsimmering water without touching it. Mix\r\nthe cocoa, coffee and vanilla with the milk.\r\nPour over the chocolate. Sit the bowl over\r\na pan of gently simmering water, stir, then\r\nimmediately remove pan from the heat,\r\nwith the bowl of chocolate still over the\r\nwater, stirring occasionally, to check when\r\nmelted. Stir the melted chocolate – it will\r\nbe quite thick. Stir in 2 tbsp boiling water\r\nand the chocolate will immediately thin\r\ndown and become silky smooth. Take the\r\nbowl off the pan and leave to cool slightly.","Whisk the egg whites to stiff peaks, then\r\nwhisk in the sugar until thick and glossy.\r\nFold the créme fraîche into the cooled\r\nchocolate. Fold one-third of the egg\r\nwhites into the chocolate mixture using\r\na large metal spoon, then very gently fold\r\nin the remaining whites, a third at a time,\r\nuntil evenly mixed in. Remove the pastry\r\ncase from the tin and place on a serving\r\nplate. Spoon the filling into the case, then\r\nspread out gently and evenly. Chill for\r\nabout 3 hours, or overnight, before\r\nserving. Serve with a sifting of cocoa\r\nand half-fat créme fraîche, if you like.Please note, pregnant women, the\r\nelderly, babies and toddlers, and people\r\nwho are generally unwell, should avoid\r\neating raw or partially cooked eggs."]','2026-01-10 12:23:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9071,9071,'en','Homemade eclairs','Homemade eclairs are a labour of love, but the reward will be a decadent mouthful of crisp pastry oozing creamy vanilla custard','["140g plain flour","pinch of sugar","125ml milk","100g butter","4 eggs","300ml milk","50g caster sugar","2 egg yolks","1 tsp vanilla extract","4 tsp each plain flour and cornflour","300ml double cream"]','["Start by making the custard filling.\r\nHeat the milk until almost boiling in a\r\nsaucepan. Meanwhile, mix together the\r\nsugar, egg yolks and vanilla in a bowl,\r\nthen stir in the flours, a couple of tsp at a\r\ntime, to a smooth paste. Gradually whisk\r\nin the hot milk, pour everything back into\r\nthe saucepan and cook over a high heat,\r\nstirring constantly, for about 5 mins until\r\nthick – it will go alarmingly lumpy but\r\ndon’t worry, just keep stirring it\r\nvigorously with a wooden spoon until\r\nsmooth. Lay a sheet of cling film directly\r\non the custard surface, then cool and\r\nchill until you’re ready to fill the buns.","To make the choux buns, heat oven to\r\n220C/200C fan/gas 7. Sift the flour with\r\nthe sugar and a pinch of salt into a small\r\nbowl. Put the milk and butter into a\r\nmedium saucepan with 125ml water and\r\ngently heat so the butter melts but the\r\nliquid doesn’t bubble. Once the butter\r\nhas completely melted, increase the heat\r\nuntil the liquid comes to a fast rolling boil.\r\nImmediately turn off the heat, tip in the\r\nsifted flour and beat vigorously with a\r\nwooden spoon until you a have a smooth\r\ndough that comes away from the sides of\r\nthe pan (see picture 1). Spread over a large\r\ndinner plate to cool to hand temperature.","Once the dough mix has cooled, scrape\r\nit back into your pan. Using your wooden\r\nspoon, beat in each egg, one by one, until\r\nyou have a smooth, shiny mixture.","Cut 2 large sheets of baking parchment.\r\nOn each one draw 2 sets of ‘track’ lines\r\nwith a 10cm gap – these will be your\r\nguidelines so your eclairs will all be\r\nroughly the same size (see picture 2). Use the\r\npaper to line 2 large baking sheets – penside\r\ndown. Spoon your choux mixture\r\ninto a piping bag with a 1cm wide nozzle,\r\nor into a disposable piping bag with a\r\nsimilar-size hole snipped off for piping.\r\nPipe 2 rows of well-spaced, squashed\r\n‘S’ shapes on each sheet between the\r\nguidelines (see picture 3). Bake, one tray at a\r\ntime, on a high-ish shelf for 25 mins,\r\nreducing temperature to 200C/180C fan/\r\ngas 6 as soon as they go in the oven.","After 25 mins, poke a hole in the end of\r\neach bun, or using a small serrated knife,\r\nsplit down the middle and return to the\r\noven, upside-down, to dry out for 5 mins\r\nuntil crisp and golden. Set aside to cool.","While the buns are cooling, finish your\r\nfilling. Whisk the cream until thick, then\r\nuse your electric whisk to beat the\r\ncooled, set custard until just smooth\r\nagain. Fold in the cream. Spoon your\r\nfilling into a piping bag – use a small\r\nnozzle if you’re filling the buns through\r\nthe holes you''ve pierced, or a large\r\nnozzle if you’ve split the buns in half.\r\nCarefully pipe the custard into each\r\ncooled bun – they should feel heavy once\r\nfull. Arrange the buns on a wire rack and\r\nspread each with a little of your chosen\r\nicing (see below). If you can’t\r\ndecide, it’s really\r\neasy to split your\r\nbatch of choux\r\nbuns, halve\r\nicing quantities,\r\nand make a\r\nselection to keep\r\neveryone happy."]','2026-01-10 12:23:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9073,9073,'en','Brownie fudge pie','This gooey chocolate dessert is given a hint of spice with cinnamon in the pastry. It freezes well for an easy dinner party dessert','["175g plain flour","85g butter, chopped into pieces","2 tbsp icing sugar","1 tsp ground cinnamon","3 large eggs","300g light brown muscovado sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","175g butter, melted","50g plain flour","50g cocoa, plus extra to serve","50g macadamia nuts, chopped","50g dark chocolate, chopped","ice cream to serve"]','["Tip the flour, butter, icing sugar and cinnamon into a food processor and pulse to make crumbs. Add 2 1?2-3 tbsp water and pulse until it comes together. Wrap in cling film and chill for 20 mins.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Roll out the pastry on a lightly floured surface and use to line a deep 23cm loose-based tart tin. Leave the excess pastry overhanging the edges of the tin. Line with baking parchment, fill with baking beans and chill for 15 mins.","Bake for 15 mins, remove the paper and beans, then bake 5 mins more until the pastry is crisp and pale golden.","Beat the eggs and sugar together to create a mousse-like texture. Stir in the vanilla and melted butter, then fold in the flour and cocoa. Scatter the nuts and chocolate over the pastry case and pour the filling on top. Bake for 30 mins until firm with a slight wobble. Trim away the excess pastry and leave to cool. If freezing, wrap in cling film and foil. To defrost, unwrap and thaw.","Serve at room temperature or warm, with a scoop of ice cream and dusting of cocoa."]','2026-01-10 12:23:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9074,9074,'en','Chocolate fondant','A gooey prepare-ahead dessert that''s perfect for entertaining – it''s all a matter of timing…','["50g melted butter, for brushing","cocoa powder, for dusting","200g good-quality dark chocolate, chopped into small pieces","200g butter, in small pieces","200g golden caster sugar","4 eggs and 4 yolks","200g plain flour","Caramel sauce (see ''Goes well with'') and vanilla ice cream or orange sorbet, to serve"]','["First get your moulds ready. Using upward strokes, heavily brush the melted\r\nbutter all over the inside of the pudding mould.\r\nPlace the mould in the fridge or freezer. Brush more melted butter over the chilled\r\nbutter, then add a good spoonful of cocoa\r\npowder into the mould. Tip the mould so the powder completely coats\r\nthe butter. Tap any excess cocoa back into the jar,\r\nthen repeat with 1 the next mould.","Place a bowl over a pan of\r\nbarely simmering water, then slowly melt the\r\nchocolate and butter together. Remove bowl\r\nfrom the heat and stir until smooth. Leave to\r\ncool for about 10 mins.","In a separate bowl whisk the eggs\r\nand yolks together with the sugar until\r\nthick and pale and the whisk leaves\r\na trail; use an electric whisk if you want. Sift\r\nthe flour into the eggs, then beat together.","Pour the melted chocolate into the egg\r\nmixture in thirds, beating well between\r\neach addition, until all the chocolate\r\nis added and the mixture is completely\r\ncombined to a loose cake batter.","Tip the fondant batter into a jug, then\r\nevenly divide between the moulds.\r\nThe fondants can now be frozen for\r\nup to a month and cooked from frozen. Chill\r\nfor at least 20 mins or up to the night before. To bake from frozen, simply carry on as stated, adding 5 mins more to the\r\ncooking time.","Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.\r\nPlace the fondants on a baking tray,\r\nthen cook for 10-12 mins until the\r\ntops have formed a crust and they are\r\nstarting to come away from the sides of their\r\nmoulds. Remove from the oven, then leave\r\nto sit for 1 min before turning out.","Loosen the fondants by moving the\r\ntops very gently so they come away\r\nfrom the sides, easing them out of the\r\nmoulds. Tip each fondant slightly onto your\r\nhand so you know it has come away, then\r\ntip back into the mould ready to plate up.","Starting from the middle of each plate, squeeze\r\na spiral of caramel sauce – do all the plates you\r\nneed before you go on to the next stage.","Sit a fondant in the middle of each plate.\r\nUsing a large spoon dipped in hot water, scoop\r\na ‘quenelle’ of ice cream.","Carefully place the ice cream on top of the\r\nfondant, then serve immediately. Repeat with\r\nthe rest of the fondants."]','2026-01-10 12:23:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9075,9075,'en','Chocolate & pecan tart','Pecan pie crossed with chocolate tart with a dash of maple syrup – we can’t argue with that','["375g pack shortcrust pastry","a little flour, for dusting","185g dark chocolate","50g salted butter","4 eggs, beaten","200ml maple syrup","200g whole pecan nuts"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Roll\r\nthe pastry out on a lightly floured surface\r\nand use to line a 20cm loose-bottomed\r\ntart tin. Fill the tart with baking paper and\r\nbaking beans, bake for 25 mins, then\r\nremove the baking paper and beans.\r\nContinue to cook for 10 mins more until\r\ngolden. Remove from the oven and cool.","Melt the chocolate and butter together\r\nin a large bowl over a pan of simmering\r\nwater. Whisk the eggs and maple syrup\r\ntogether, then stir into the chocolate with\r\nmost of the nuts. Pour into the tart shell,\r\ntop with the remaining nuts and bake for\r\n30-40 mins until set. Cool and serve with\r\nvanilla ice cream or double cream."]','2026-01-10 12:23:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9076,9076,'en','Double chocolate shortbreads','You’re only five ingredients away from a double chocolate melt-in-your-mouth delight','["175g butter, softened","85g golden caster sugar","200g plain flour","2 tbsp cocoa powder","100g chocolate chips, milk or dark"]','["Mix the butter and sugar together with\r\na wooden spoon. Stir in the flour and\r\ncocoa, followed by the chocolate chips\r\n– you’ll probably need to mix it together\r\nwith your hands at this stage. Halve the\r\ndough and roll each piece into a log\r\nabout 5cm thick. Wrap in cling film and\r\nchill for 1 hr or for several days. Can be\r\nfrozen for up to 1 month.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nSlice logs into 1cm-thick rounds, transfer\r\nto a baking tray lined with baking\r\nparchment and bake for 10-12 mins.\r\nCool on the tray."]','2026-01-10 12:23:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9077,9077,'en','Chocolate & Earl Grey torte','Never before has it been so easy to impress – this soft-centered torte can be made ahead and frozen or baked from scratch in just an hour','["leaves from 2 Earl Grey tea bags","100ml hot milk","250g good dark chocolate (we used a 78% bar)","200g butter, diced","140g ground almonds","6 eggs, separated","200g caster sugar","cocoa, icing sugar and crème fraîche or cream, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line the base and sides of\r\na deep, 22cm loose-bottomed tin with\r\nbaking parchment, so the paper comes\r\nabout 2.5cm above the sides. Stir the Earl\r\nGrey tea into the hot milk.","Melt the chocolate, butter and a pinch\r\nof salt together in a bowl over a pan of\r\nbarely simmering water. Then stir in the\r\nground almonds, followed by the egg\r\nyolks and milky tea, including the leaves.\r\nBeat the egg whites until stiff, then beat\r\nin the caster sugar until stiff-ish again.\r\nFold the whites through the chocolate\r\nmix and scrape into the tin. Bake for\r\n30-35 mins – it should still have a slight\r\nwobble. Then cool completely in the tin.","Carefully remove from the tin and lift\r\nonto a serving plate. Dust all over with\r\ncocoa and icing sugar, then serve in\r\nslices with crème fraîche or cream."]','2026-01-10 12:23:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9078,9078,'en','Chocolate chunk pecan cookies','You can’t beat American-style cookies with big chunks of chocolate and nuts. The perfect grown-up biscuit','["200g dark chocolate, broken into squares (we like Green & Black''s)","100g butter, chopped","50g light muscovado sugar","85g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 egg, beaten","100g whole pecans","100g plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Melt 85g chocolate in the microwave on High for 1 min or over a pan of simmering water.","Beat in the butter, sugars, vanilla and egg until smooth, then stir in three-quarters of both the nuts and remaining chocolate, then the flour and bicarbonate of soda.","Heap 12 spoonfuls, spaced apart, on 2 baking sheets (don’t spread the mixture), then poke in the reserved nuts and chocolate. Bake for 12 mins until firm, then leave to cool on the sheets. Can be stored in a tin for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9079,9079,'en','Cherry chocolate Pavlova','Finish your meal with this impressive dessert, with billowing cream and fresh summer fruit','["6 large egg whites","300g caster sugar","1 tbsp cornflour","2 tsp white wine vinegar","25g cocoa powder","50g finely chopped dark chocolate","284ml pot double cream","3 tbsp icing sugar","½ 600g jar stoned cherry compote (I used Bonne Maman)","fresh cherries, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 140C/fan 120C/gas 1.\r\nWhisk the egg whites just until they form\r\nstiff peaks. Gradually whisk in the sugar, a\r\ncouple of tbsp at a time, making sure you\r\nwhisk really well between each addition.\r\nWhen all the sugar has been added, keep\r\nwhisking for a couple of mins until the\r\nmixture is really thick and glossy and looks\r\na little like shaving foam. Carefully stir in\r\nthe cornflour, vinegar, cocoa powder and\r\nchocolate with a large metal spoon, just\r\nuntil incorporated.","Tear off a sheet of baking parchment\r\nand use to cover a baking sheet. Mark a\r\n25cm circle on the paper. Spoon over the\r\nmeringue mixture, swirling into the circle,\r\nbuilding up the sides a little, ready to keep\r\nthe filling in. Cook for 1½ hrs. Leave to cool.","When ready to serve, whip the double\r\ncream and icing sugar together in a big\r\nbowl until soft peaks form. Spoon the\r\ncherry compote over the meringue, dollop\r\nover the cream, then swirl around. Arrange\r\na few of the fresh cherries on top to finish."]','2026-01-10 12:23:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9080,9080,'en','Chocolate cherry cola cake','Bake this crowd-pleaser made with cola, then decorate with rainbow sprinkles, cocktail cherries and cola bottle sweets for a nostalgic treat','["200ml vegetable oil , plus extra for the tin","275g plain flour","100g cocoa powder","1 tbsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","250g golden caster sugar","150ml natural yogurt","250ml cherry or plain cola","3 eggs","50g butter","250g icing sugar","2-3 tbsp milk","few drops of pink food colouring","rainbow sprinkles , cocktail cherries and cola bottle sweets (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil the base and sides of a 34 x 25cm roasting or cake tin (at least 2½cm deep) and line with baking parchment. Combine the flour, cocoa, baking powder, bicarb, sugar and a good pinch of salt in a large bowl. Break up any lumps of sugar by rubbing between your fingers, shaking the bowl to bring them to the surface.","Whisk the oil, yogurt, cola and eggs together in a jug, then pour the wet ingredients into the dry. Stir well, ensuring no pockets of flour remain, then pour into the tin and bake for 30 mins until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. If any wet mixture clings to the skewer, bake for 5 mins more. Cool in the tin for at least 20 mins.","For the icing, melt the butter in a pan over a low heat. Remove from the heat and stir in the sugar, milk and food colouring. Spread the icing over the cake, then decorate with the sprinkles, cherries and sweets, if using. Leave to set, then cut into squares. Will keep in an airtight container for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9081,9081,'en','Chocolate roulade','Make our next level chocolate roulade, with a spectacular chocolate meringue encasing a chocolate and cream filling and caramel sauce','["vegetable oil, for the tin","5 egg whites","1 tsp lemon juice","225g caster sugar","60g cocoa powder, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp cornflour","100g dark chocolate, plus extra to serve","100ml double cream","150ml double cream","25g caster sugar","100g caramel sauce (from a can or jar), stirred until smooth","pinch of sea salt flakes"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil the base and sides of a 23 x 32cmbaking trayand line with baking parchment. Beat the egg whites, lemon juice and a pinch of salt together using astand mixeror electric whisk until very stiff. Add 1 tbsp of the sugar and beat to stiff peaks, then add the rest of the sugar, a spoonful at a time, until the mixture is thick and shiny. Sift over the cocoa and cornflour, then gently fold these in with a spatula until completely combined. Spread the mixture evenly into the prepared tin, then bake for 14-15 mins until just crisp to the touch. Leave to cool completely in the tin.","Meanwhile, make the fillings. For the chocolate filling, tip the chocolate and cream into a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water and stir until the chocolate has melted and the mixture is shiny and smooth. Remove from the heat and leave to cool to room temperature. For the cream filling,whiskthe cream and sugar together to stiff peaks using an electric whisk.","Dust a large sheet of baking parchment with cocoa powder, then carefully flip the meringue onto it. Remove the tin and carefully peel away the parchment. With a short end facing you, score a line across the meringue, 2cm in from the edge. Spread over the chocolate filling followed by the cream, then drizzle with most of the caramel sauce. Sprinkle over the sea salt flakes and drag a palette or cutlery knife through the fillings to gently swirl them. Roll up the roulade into a tight log, starting at the scored end and using the parchment underneath to help you. Lift onto a platter or board.Will keep chilled for up to a day.Drizzle over the remaining caramel sauce, then finely grate over more chocolate to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9082,9082,'en','Black Forest fridge cake','Make an easy ‘fridge cake’ version of Black Forest gateau by layering cherries, chocolatey cream and chocolate biscuits. It’s a moreish dessert to end a meal','["vegetable oil, for the tin","300g dark chocolate","400ml double cream","250g full-fat soured cream","80g icing sugar","½ tsp vanilla bean paste","460g jar cherries in kirsch (available online, or in the baking section of larger supermarkets)","700g bourbon biscuits","50g caster sugar"]','["Lightly oil a 20 x 25cm springform cake tin, line with cling film, then lightly oil again. Set aside.","Put 200g chocolate in a heatproof bowl and melt in themicrowavein 20-second bursts, stirring until smooth. Alternatively, melt the chocolate in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, making sure the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Leave to cool for 10 mins.Whisktogether the double cream, soured cream, icing sugar and vanilla bean paste until soft but spoonable (it should be quite loose at this stage but will firm up in the fridge later). Transfer half the mixture to a second bowl, then fold in the melted chocolate.","Tip half the cherries and all the kirsch into asaucepan. Chop the remaining cherries and set aside. Line the bottom of the prepared tin with a layer of bourbon biscuits, then spoon over half the chocolate cream, half the chopped cherries, and half the vanilla cream. Repeat with a second layer of biscuits and the remaining chocolate cream, chopped cherries and vanilla cream. Cover and chill overnight.","Tip the caster sugar into the saucepan with the remaining whole cherries and kirsch. Cook over a low heat for about 5 mins, stirring until the sugar has dissolved. Turn up the heat, bring to the boil and continue cooking on a high heat for 8-10 mins, or until the liquid has reduced to a syrupy consistency that coats the back of a spoon. Leave to cool completely.","Carefully remove the cake from the tin, and peel away the cling film. Leave at room temperature for 30 mins to soften slightly. Roughly chop the remaining dark chocolate. Spoon the cooled cherries and syrup over the cake, and scatter over the chocolate. Cut into 12 squares to serve.Will keep, covered in the fridge, for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9083,9083,'en','Chocolate salted caramel cookie cake','Bake this show-stopping chocolate cake topped with decadent salted caramel and cookies. Perfect for celebrating a special occasion','["150ml vegetable oil , plus extra for the tins","200g self-raising flour","50g cocoa powder","1 tsp baking powder","250g brown sugar","150ml Greek yogurt","50ml milk","100ml strong coffee , cold","2 large eggs","100g white chocolate chips","150g salted butter , softened","300g icing sugar","1 tbsp cocoa powder","50g dark chocolate","200g cookies","4 tbsp salted caramel sauce","½ tbsp milk","dark chocolate (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Oil two 20cm sandwich tins and line the bases with non-stick baking paper. Sieve the flour, cocoa and baking powder into a large bowl, then stir in the sugar. Whisk together the yogurt, milk, coffee and eggs in a jug until combined. Gradually whisk the wet ingredients into the flour mixture until you have a smooth batter. Fold in the chocolate chips.","Divide the mixture between the tins and bake for 30-35 mins, until a skewer inserted into the centre of each sponge comes out clean. Remove from the tins and put on a wire rack to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the buttercream. Beat together the butter, icing sugar and cocoa for 5-8 mins until smooth and creamy. Melt the dark chocolate in a bowl over a pan of boiling water, or in 30 second blasts in the microwave. Whisk the melted chocolate into the buttercream until fully incorporated. Put three quarters of it into a piping bag with a large, round nozzle.","Put one of the sponges onto a plate and pipe buttercream around its edge, with dots going around the circumference. Spread 2 tbsp of the remaining buttercream in the centre of the cake using a spoon or palette knife.","Mix together the caramel and milk with a pinch of salt. Spread half the caramel into the centre to cover the layer of buttercream. Crumble half of the cookies on top of that. Chill for 30 mins until the buttercream has hardened slightly.","Lay the second sponge on top of the first. Repeat the piping of the dots around the top of the cake, but this time fill the whole circle with dots of buttercream. Drizzle the salted caramel over the buttercream dots. Break the remaining cookies into halves or quarters and arrange on top of the cake, then grate over a little dark chocolate, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9084,9084,'en','Chocolate orange cupcakes','Treat family and friends to these decadent cupcakes with chocolate orange-flavoured sponge and buttercream topping. Decorate with orange zest and chocolate','["140g light brown sugar","100g self raising flour","50g cocoa powder","1 tsp baking powder","2 large eggs","135ml vegetable oil","4 tbsp milk","50g dark chocolate, finely chopped, plus extra for decoration","2 large oranges, zested","300g icing","150g unsalted butter, softened","1 orange, zested, plus extra zest to decorate","25g cocoa powder","2 tbsp milk","orange gel food colouring"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the sugar, flour, cocoa, pinch of salt and baking powder in a large bowl. Whisk together the eggs, vegetable oil and milk. Gradually whisk the wet ingredients into the dry until you have a smooth mixture. Fold in the dark chocolate. Put 12 cupcake cases in a 12-hole tin. Divide the mixture between the cases, then bake for 20 mins until risen. Leave to cool.","Meanwhile, make the icing. Beat the icing sugar and butter together until pale and fluffy. Whisk in 2 tbsp hot water to loosen and fold in the orange zest. Divide the icing evenly between two bowls. Add a few drops of orange food colouring to one bowl and stir until the icing turns bright orange. In the other bowl, add the cocoa powder and 2 tbsp milk, then beat until combined.","Fill one side of a piping bag (use one with a large round nozzle) with the orange icing, then fill the other side with the chocolate buttercream. Pipe on top of each cupcake. Decorate with some extra orange zest and a grating of dark chocolate."]','2026-01-10 12:23:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9085,9085,'en','Chocolate & sesame loaf cake','Tahini gives this cake a subtle nutty flavour that partners perfectly with rich chocolate. This recipe makes 2 cakes, so why not freeze one as a treat for another day!','["200g butter, plus extra for greasing","200g dark chocolate, chopped","200g golden caster sugar","100ml strong espresso","100ml soured cream","2 eggs","200g self-raising flour","5 tsp cocoa powder","250g self-raising flour","150g tahini","1 heaped tsp baking powder","150ml strong black coffee","150g golden caster sugar","¼ tsp cinnamon","2 tbsp milk","200ml double cream","40g butter","200g dark chocolate, chopped","4 x 30g pack sesame snaps"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease two 900g loaf tins (8.5cm deep) and line with baking parchment.","First, make the chocolate cake mixture. Put the butter and chocolate in a large heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, stirring occasionally. Put all the other ingredients in a large mixing bowl and, when the chocolate and butter have melted, pour over and mix with an electric whisk until smooth and well combined. Set aside and rinse the beaters.","In another large bowl, add all the sesame cake ingredients, then combine with an electric whisk until smooth.","Alternating with dollops of each mixture, divide between the two tins. Level the top, then swirl a skewer through the mixture to create a marbled effect. Bake in the middle of the oven for 45-50 mins or until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Leave the cakes to cool completely on a wire rack while you make the topping (there’s enough for both cakes but the topping recipe is easily halved if you want to freeze one and ice it later)","Heat the double cream and butter together gently in a small pan until just simmering, then remove from the heat and add the chocolate. Stir until the mixture is smooth, then place in the fridge for 20 mins to firm up.","Beat well with a wooden spoon, then transfer to a disposable piping bag. Snip the end off to make a wide opening, then pipe thick, overlapping zigzags across the cakes. Cut the sesame snaps into shards and arrange on top, scattering over any crumbs, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9086,9086,'en','Cookies & cream party cake','Stack up our best ever chocolate sponges and smother in an Oreo biscuit icing to make this towering celebration cake','["300ml vegetable oil, plus extra for greasing","400g plain flour","130g cocoa powder","4 tsp baking powder","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","560g light brown soft sugar","400ml buttermilk","200ml strong coffee, or espresso","4 tsp vanilla extract","4 large eggs","250g pack slightly salted butter, softened","600g icing sugar","280g tub full-fat cream cheese","2 tsp vanilla extract","10 Oreo biscuits (about ¾  of a pack)","Oreo biscuits, as many as you need for the letters on top (some may break when you insert the skewers, so buy extra)","thin wooden skewers","100g white chocolate, finely chopped","ready-to-roll fondant icing, coloured (we used a mixture of blue and green food colouring), or an icing writing pen"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line two 20cm cake tins with baking parchment – if your cake tins are quite shallow, line the sides to a depth of at least 5cm. Put 200g flour, 8 tbsp cocoa powder, 2 tsp baking powder, 1 tsp bicarbonate of soda, 280g light brown soft sugar and 1 tsp salt in a bowl and mix well. If there are any lumps in the sugar, squeeze these through your fingers to break them up.","Measure 200ml buttermilk, 100ml coffee, 150ml oil and 2 tsp vanilla in a jug. Add 2 eggs and whisk until smooth. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry and whisk until well combined. Pour the cake mixture evenly into the two tins, and bake for 25-30 mins until risen and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Cool in the tins for 10 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack, peel off the baking parchment and leave to cool.","Repeat steps 1 and 2, so that you have 4 sponge cakes in total. These sponges can be made up to three days ahead and will stay moist if wrapped in cling film, or you can wrap well and freeze for up to two months.","To make the icing, put the butter in a large bowl and sieve in half the icing sugar. Roughly mash together with a spatula, then whizz with a hand mixer until smooth. Add the cream cheese and sieve in the remaining icing sugar, mash together again, then blend once more with the hand mixer. Put the Oreos in a food processor and whizz to fine crumbs. Add the biscuit crumbs to the icing and mix again until combined.","Next, make the cookie cake toppers. You’ll need one Oreo for each letter of the word you’d like to write – someone’s name or, like we have done, ‘WOW!’ Carefully insert a skewer into the creamy filling in the middle of each Oreo – some cookies may break, so save these ones for later. Melt the chocolate in the microwave, stirring every 20 secs or so, or in a heatproof bowl suspended over a pan of gently simmering water. Spread a little chocolate over the surface of one side of each cookie. Roll out the fondant icing to the thickness of a 50p coin, and cut out your letters, then stick these to the cookies and set aside to dry. Alternatively, let the chocolate dry, then use an icing pen to write the name or word directly on the surface.","To assemble the cake, stick one of your sponges to a cake stand or board with a little of the cream cheese icing. Use roughly half the icing to stack the remaining cakes on top, spreading a generous amount between each layer. Pile the remaining icing on top of the assembled cake, and use a palette knife to ease it over the edges, covering the entire surface of the cake. Tidy the plate with a piece of kitchen paper.","If you have any leftover Oreos, break them into pieces and push these around the base of the cake. Insert the dried cookie cake toppers into the top of the cake and serve. Store leftovers in the fridge for up to 2 days, but bring back to room temperature for an hour or so before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:23:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9087,9087,'en','Gravity-defying sweetie cake','Anti-gravity cakes are this year’s must-have trend for birthdays or parties – this stunning Smartie cake will delight kids and grown-ups alike','["150ml vegetable oil, plus extra for greasing","200g plain flour","8 tbsp cocoa powder","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","280g light brown soft sugar","200ml buttermilk","100ml strong coffee or espresso","2 tsp vanilla extract","2 large eggs","2½  x 114g packs milk chocolate fingers","8 tubes of Smarties, or other sweets","100g milk chocolate, chopped into small pieces, plus 50g/2oz for decorating","200g slightly salted butter, softened","400g icing sugar, seived","4 tbsp cocoa powder","2 tbsp milk","1 bendy straw","2 wooden skewers","1 paper bag or sweet packet (see tip)","sticky tape"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line two 20cm cake tins with baking parchment – if your cake tins are quite shallow, line the sides to a depth of at least 5cm. Put the flour, cocoa powder, baking powder, bicarbonate of soda, sugar and 1 tsp salt in a bowl and mix well. If there are any lumps in the sugar, squeeze these through your fingers to break them up.","Measure the buttermilk, coffee, oil and vanilla in a jug. Add the egg and whisk until smooth. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry and whisk until well combined. Pour the cake mixture evenly into the two tins, and bake for 25-30 mins until risen and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Cool in the tins for 10 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack, peel off the baking parchment and leave to cool. These sponges can be made up to three days ahead and will stay moist if wrapped in cling film, or you can wrap well and freeze for up to two months.","To make the chocolate fudge icing, put the chocolate in a heatproof bowl, suspended over a pan of barely simmering water. Stir every now and then until melted. (Alternatively, melt in the microwave, stirring the chocolate every 20 secs so it doesn’t burn.) Remove the bowl from the heat and leave to cool a little. Meanwhile, put the butter and icing sugar in another large bowl and mash with a spatula to combine (this will prevent you covering the work surface in icing sugar), then whisk with a hand mixer until smooth. Sift in the cocoa and pour in the melted chocolate and milk, then mix again until smooth.","Use roughly half the icing to sandwich the cakes together on a cake stand or board. Use a palette knife to cover the entire cake with the remaining icing – don’t worry about being too neat. Use the chocolate fingers to cover the sides of the cakes – do this straight after icing as the icing will set after a while, and the chocolate fingers won’t stick.","Melt the remaining 50g chocolate in the microwave or in a small bowl suspended over a pan of gently simmering water. Leave to cool until the chocolate is a spreadable consistency. You can speed this up by putting it in the fridge – just stir it every 5 mins or so to prevent the chocolate from setting.","Push a skewer into the centre of the cake and slip the straw over the top – this will give it more stability. Push 1-2cm of the straw into the cake. Use a cutlery knife to spread a blob of chocolate onto a Smartie and, starting at the base, stick the Smarties to the straw. You will have to do this in stages to allow the chocolate to set a little before adding another layer of Smarties. Work your way up the straw until it’s completely covered. If the chocolate in your bowl becomes too firm, simply heat again until it is at the correct consistency. Stop when you reach the bend in the straw.","Stick the remaining skewer into the top of the straw so that it pokes out at an angle. Place the paper bag on top – you may have to use a little sticky tape to hold it in place. If any of the straw is exposed, cover it with more Smarties.","Tip the remaining Smarties on top of the cake to flood the surface. Will keep well stored in an airtight tin for 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9088,9088,'en','Lighter Chocolate cake with chocolate icing','You’d never guess that this rich-tasting, light-textured sponge is lower in fat, calories and sugar thanks to ground almonds and yogurt','["25g butter","140g self-raising flour","25g cocoa powder, sifted","1½  tsp baking powder","50g light muscovado sugar","75g golden caster sugar","25g ground almonds","175g natural yogurt","¼ tsp vanilla extract","2 large eggs, beaten","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","25g dark chocolate (preferably 70% cocoa solids), finely chopped","50g icing sugar","1 tbsp cocoa powder, sifted","25g butter, room temperature","1 tsp semi-skimmed milk","100g light cream cheese, straight from the fridge","100g Quark cheese","10 sugared almonds (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line the bases of 2 x 18cm round sandwich cake tins with baking parchment. Melt the butter and set aside to cool. Mix the flour in a large bowl with the cocoa powder, baking powder, both sugars and ground almonds. Stir the yogurt and vanilla into the beaten eggs. Pour this into the dry mixture along with the melted butter and oil. Briefly stir until just mixed, creamy and smooth. Do not overbeat.","Spoon the mixture evenly between the two tins and level the surfaces. Bake for 20 mins until risen and starting to come away from the sides of the tin. Remove from the tins, peel off the parchment and leave the cakes to cool on a wire rack.","Meanwhile, make the icing. Melt the chocolate in a bowl set over a pan of gently simmering water. Remove the bowl from the pan and leave the chocolate to cool. Sift the icing sugar and cocoa into a separate bowl. Add the butter and milk, and beat until smooth. Beat in the cream cheese and quark, then stir in the cooled, melted chocolate.","When the cakes are cold, use half the icing to sandwich both cakes together. Spread the rest of the icing on top in fluffy folds, then decorate with sugared almonds, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9089,9089,'en','Espresso, chocolate & chilli cake with coffee cream','The warmth of coffee and chilli combine beautifully with chocolate in this impressive dinner party dessert, finish with double cream','["3 tbsp plain flour, plus extra for the tin","250g dark chocolate, broken into pieces","250g salted butter, softened and chopped, plus extra for greasing","1 tbsp instant espresso powder","2 red bird''s-eye chillies, deseeded and finely chopped","¼ tsp chilli powder (optional)","6 medium eggs, separated","4 tbsp brown sugar","175g caster sugar","½  tsp cream of tartar","4 tbsp ground almonds","cocoa powder, to serve","300ml double cream","1 tbsp instant espresso powder"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease a 22cm springform cake tin with soft butter and line the bottom with baking parchment. Shake a little flour around the buttered edges.","Melt the chocolate and butter together over a pan of simmering water, or in a microwave. Once melted, whisk together until smooth and add the espresso powder and chillies and chilli powder, if using. Whisk the egg yolks with the brown sugar and caster sugar, either in an electric mixer or with an electric hand whisk, for 5-10 mins until thick and pale. In a separate bowl, using a clean whisk, beat the egg whites and cream of tartar until soft rounded peaks form.","Pour the chocolate mixture onto the beaten yolks and sugar, and gently mix until smooth. Add the almonds and flour and mix again. Spoon the egg whites into the chocolate mixture and gently fold together. Pour the batter into the prepared tin and bake for 40-45 mins until the cake is set but with a slight jiggle in the centre. (If the cake is starting to brown too quickly, cover with a piece of baking parchment.)","Leave to cool in the tin – it will sink a little as it cools. Run a knife around the inside of the cake tin to loosen. Remove the baking parchment and place on a cake stand. Whisk the cream and espresso powder until soft peaks form. Serve on the side or spoon on top of the cake dusted with a little cocoa powder."]','2026-01-10 12:23:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9090,9090,'en','Chocolate layer cake with passion fruit icing','Great British Bake Off winner Jo Wheatley shares her never-fail sponge recipe in this layered cake with a zingy butter icing','["175g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","300g golden caster sugar","3 large eggs, beaten","75g self-raising flour","200g plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","75g cocoa","200ml soured cream, at room temperature","50g full-fat cream cheese, at room temperature","250g unsalted butter, softened","500g icing sugar","150g full-fat cream cheese","3 very ripe passion fruits"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line the base of a 20cm springform cake tin with baking parchment. Beat the butter and caster sugar together until pale, light and fluffy – this is easiest using a freestanding machine or an electric hand-held mixer. Gradually add the egg, a little at a time, beating well between each addition.","Sift both flours, the bicarbonate of soda and the cocoa into a bowl. Add half the sifted dry ingredients to the egg mixture and fold in using a large metal spoon. In another bowl, mix the soured cream and cream cheese together until smooth. Add half to the cake batter and fold in. Repeat this process with the remaining flour and soured cream, and mix until smooth. Pour into the cake tin. Bake on the middle shelf for 1 hr or until a skewer inserted into the middle of the cake comes out clean. Leave the cake to cool in the tin for 10 mins before turning out onto a wire rack and removing the baking parchment.","Meanwhile, make the icing. Using an electric mixer, beat the butter until pale and softly whipped. Add the icing sugar and whisk until smooth, then add the cream cheese and whisk again. Sieve the juice from the passion fruits, reserving the pulp and seeds. Add the juice to the icing.","To assemble, split the cake into 3 even layers and place the bottom layer on a cake stand or plate. Spread one-third of the icing over the bottom layer, swirling out to the edges. Repeat with the remaining 2 layers of cake and icing, finishing with a layer of icing. Top with the passion fruit pulp and seeds. Serve straight away. Will keep for 3 days, chilled – but bring back to room temperature before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9091,9091,'en','Fudgy dark chocolate cake','Fudgy dark chocolate sponge, the perfect party cake, afternoon-tea cake or any-excuse cake','["200g caster sugar","200g softened butter","4 eggs, beaten","200g self-raising flour - swap 2 tbsp of the flour for 2 tbsp sifted cocoa powder (we used Green & Black''s)","1 tsp baking powder","2 tbsp milk","200ml double cream","50g butter","3 tbsp clear honey","200g dark chocolate (use 70% cocoa solids if you can), broken into pieces","top with shaved or grated chocolate"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Butter two 20cm sandwich tins and line with non-stick baking paper. In a large bowl, beat all the cake ingredients together until you have a smooth, soft batter.","Divide the mixture between the tins, smooth the surface with a spatula or the back of a spoon, then bake for about 20 mins until golden and the cake springs back when pressed. Turn onto a cooling rack and leave to cool completely.","For the fudge frosting, heat the cream until it just begins to boil. Take off the heat and add butter, honey and chocolate (broken into pieces).","Leave to melt for 5 mins, then stir briefly to combine - don''t over-mix or it will lose its shine. Sandwich the cakes with a third of the just-warm frosting and spread the rest over the top and sides. Top with shaved or grated chocolate, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9092,9092,'en','Chocolate birthday cake','We used colourful candles rather than artificial sweets to brighten up this tasty birthday cake','["140g butter, plus extra for the tin","175g golden caster sugar","2 eggs","225g self-raising wholemeal flour","50g cocoa powder","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","250g natural yogurt","300g golden icing sugar, sieved","2 tbsp cocoa powder, sieved","1 tbsp butter, melted","3-4 tbsp boiling water","50g each white, plain and milk chocolate, broken into squares"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter \r\nand line the base of a 18 x 28cm cake tin  \r\nor tray. Put the butter and sugar into a bowl; \r\nbeat together with electric hand beaters until \r\nlight and fluffy. add the eggs a little at a time, \r\nbeating well between each addition.","Sieve the flour, cocoa and bicarbonate  \r\nof soda into the bowl, then tip in any  \r\nbran left in the sieve. Pour in the natural \r\nyogurt. Stir everything to a smooth mixture \r\nand spoon into the prepared tin. Bake for \r\n20-25 mins until just firm and shrinking  \r\naway from the sides of the tin. Cool in the  \r\ntin for 5 mins, then turn onto a wire rack  \r\nto cool completely.","For the icing, sieve the icing sugar and \r\ncocoa into a bowl, then pour in the butter \r\nand 2 tbsp just-boiled water. Stir together  \r\nto a smooth, spreadable consistency. if it’s \r\ntoo stiff, very carefully add a little more \r\nboiling water, drop by drop.","Spread the icing over the top of the cake, \r\nusing a palette knife dipped in hot water. Will \r\nkeep in an airtight container for up to 1 week.","Melt the chocolates in three different \r\nbowls in the microwave on High for 1 min  \r\nor over a pan of simmering water. Spoon  \r\nthe melted chocolates into three plastic \r\ndisposable piping bags. Snip the ends off \r\nand pipe 12 simple shapes on top of the \r\ncake. Leave to set. Just before serving,  \r\ncut the cake into 12 squares and push  \r\nin the candles."]','2026-01-10 12:23:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9094,9094,'en','Chocolate dipped cherry cake','Bake your chocolate dipped cherry cake and eat it','["150g good quality milk chocolate","175g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","140g golden caster sugar","140g very soft, slightly salted butter","3 large eggs","3 tbsp milk","1 medium banana, mashed","200g white chocolate","400g cherries","150ml crème fraîche","2 tbsp kirsch (optional)"]','["Preheat the oven to fan 160C/\r\nconventional180C/gas 4. Butter and line\r\nthe base of two 20cm sandwich tins.\r\nCoarsely grate two thirds of the\r\nchocolate and chop the rest. Set aside.","Put the flour, baking powder and sugar\r\ninto a large mixing bowl. Make a well in\r\nthe centre and add the butter, eggs and\r\nmilk (the butter must be very soft for this\r\nto work). Beat together with a hand held\r\nelectric whisk for about 2 minutes until\r\nlight and fluffy (or use a wooden spoon\r\nand beat well for 3 minutes). Lightly fold\r\nin the grated, chopped chocolate and\r\nmashed banana.","Divide the mixture evenly between the\r\ntins. Gently level the surface with the\r\nback of a metal spoon or spatula. Bake\r\nside by side on the middle shelf for 25-30\r\nminutes until springy to the touch and\r\nbeginning to shrink away from the sides.","Remove from the oven, leave to cool in\r\nthe tins for 5 minutes. Turn out on a wire\r\nrack, remove the lining paper and leave\r\nto cool for about 1 hour before icing.","For the icing and filling, break up the white chocolate into a heatproof bowl and melt gently\r\nover a pan of hot, not quite simmering\r\nwater until just melted. Remove from the\r\npan and set aside for 5-6 minutes.","Cover a baking sheet with foil or waxed\r\npaper. Dip the cherries, one by one,\r\ninto the chocolate to half coat them, then\r\nput them on the baking sheet to set.","Stir the crème fraîche into the\r\nremaining melted chocolate until\r\nsmooth and shiny. Then let cool\r\nand thicken (5 minutes or so). Now\r\ntransfer half of this mixture to another\r\nbowl. Pit another 200g/8oz\r\ncherries, cut them in half then add to one\r\nof the bowls with 2tbsp kirsch (optional)\r\nand stir until mixed. Put one sponge cake\r\non a serving plate and spread the surface\r\nwith the cherry mixture, then sandwich\r\nwith the second sponge. Spread the rest\r\nof the chocolate mixture over the top and\r\ndecorate with the dipped whole cherries.\r\nThis cake is best eaten on the day it’s\r\nbeen made."]','2026-01-10 12:23:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9095,9095,'en','White chocolate & cherry loaf','This indulgent cake is perfect for tea in the garden','["225g butter, softened","225g golden caster sugar","4 eggs, beaten","2 tsp vanilla extract","225g self-raising flour, sifted, plus extra for dusting","375g fresh cherries, pitted","175g white chocolate, chopped into small chunks","100g white chocolate, broken into small pieces","140g half-fat mascarpone","white chocolate curls or fresh cherries, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Line a 1kg loaf tin with baking parchment, making sure the paper comes up higher than the sides. Beat the butter and sugar together until fluffy, then add the eggs, a little at a time, along with the vanilla. Fold in the flour until you have a smooth mixture.","Dust the cherries in a little flour, then carefully stir half of the fruit and chocolate into the mixture. Spoon into the prepared tin, then scatter the remaining cherries and chocolate on top, pressing them in lightly. Bake for 1 hr 10 mins - 1 hr 15 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Make sure you don''t mistake melted chocolate for raw cake mix. Leave to cool in the tin for a few mins, then turn out on to a wire rack and leave to cool completely. This can now be wrapped tightly in cling film and stored in the fridge for up to 3 days.","Remove the marscapone from the fridge to come to room temperature. Melt the white chocolate in a bowl over a pan of hot water. Quickly stir in 1 tbsp of the marscapone, then beat in the rest (be careful not to overbeat the mixture or it will go grainy). Spread over the top of the loaf and finish with white chocolate curls or fresh cherries."]','2026-01-10 12:23:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9096,9096,'en','Chocolate & ginger torte','This decadent dessert with a triple-ginger hit is a chocoholic’s dream','["250g unsalted butter, diced, plus extra for the tin","cocoa, for dusting","350g dark chocolate, chopped","2 tbsp Stone''s Ginger wine","140g caster sugar","100g light muscovado sugar","5 eggs, separated","75g ground almonds","1 tsp ground ginger","1 heaped tbsp ginger preserve","140g dark chocolate, finely chopped","150ml double cream","25g unsalted butter","2 tbsp Stone''s Ginger wine"]','["Heat oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3-4.\r\nButter and line a 23cm round springform\r\ntin with a disc of buttered baking\r\nparchment. Lightly dust the inside\r\nof the tin with cocoa and tip out excess.","Put the chocolate and butter into a\r\nmedium-size heatproof bowl, add the\r\nginger wine and set the bowl over a pan\r\nof barely simmering water. Stir occasionally\r\nuntil melted and smooth. Remove from\r\nthe heat and cool slightly.","Tip both the sugars into a large mixing\r\nbowl or the bowl of an electric mixer and\r\nadd the egg yolks. Whisk until pale and\r\nlight. Pour the melted chocolate and\r\nbutter into the yolks and stir until\r\nsmooth. With another large, spotlessly\r\nclean bowl and whisk, beat the egg\r\nwhites with a pinch of salt until they\r\njust hold a stiff peak.","Sift the almonds and ginger into the\r\nchocolate mixture and fold in using\r\na large metal spoon. Add one-third of\r\nthe egg whites and stir in to loosen\r\nthe mixture. Fold in the remaining\r\negg whites until combined.","Spoon half the mixture into the\r\nprepared tin and gently spread level\r\nusing a palette knife. Gently warm the\r\nginger preserve until it’s just spreadable\r\nand carefully spoon onto the cake in\r\nsmall dollops. Spoon over the remaining\r\nchocolate mixture, spread level and\r\nbake just below the middle shelf of\r\nthe oven for 50 mins-1 hr until a wooden\r\nskewer inserted into the middle of\r\nthe cake comes out with a moist crumb\r\nattached. Allow the cake to cool in the\r\ntin and don’t be dismayed if the top\r\nsinks and cracks.","To make the ganache icing, tip the\r\nchocolate into a heatproof bowl. Then\r\nadd the cream, butter and ginger wine.\r\nSet the bowl over a pan of barely\r\nsimmering water and stir until melted\r\nand velvety smooth. Remove from\r\nthe heat and allow to cool slightly.","Carefully run a palette knife around the\r\nedge of the cake to loosen it, then put on\r\na serving plate. Spread the ganache over\r\nthe top, and leave to set before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9097,9097,'en','White & dark chocolate cake','For big celebrations this cake is a must, four layers of moist sponge, lashings of chocolate ganache and the crunch of Maltesers','["175g butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","100g white chocolate (we like M & S or Green & Black’s with real vanilla)","100g dark chocolate (70% cocoa)","3 eggs","100ml whole or semi-skimmed milk","175g caster sugar","1 tsp baking powder","200g self-raising flour","2 tbsp very strong coffee (instant is fine)","1 tsp vanilla extract","284ml pot double cream","200g dark chocolate (70% cocoa)","50g white chocolate, melted","small bag white chocolate Maltesers (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter and bottom-line 2 x 20cm sandwich tins. For the cake, break the white and dark chocolate into two small bowls, then melt in the microwave on High for 1 min or over a pan of simmering water. Put everything else, except the coffee and vanilla, into a large bowl, then beat until creamy.","Divide the mixture in two, then add the coffee and melted dark chocolate to one bowl, and the vanilla and melted white\r\nchocolate to the other. Stir until mixed through, then tip into the tins. Bake for 20-25 mins until risen and slightly shrunk from the sides of the tins. Cool in the tins for a few mins, then turn onto a wire rack.","For the ganache, heat the cream in a pan, then break the dark chocolate into a large bowl. Once the cream is just boiling, pour it onto the chocolate, then leave for 5 mins. Stir until smooth, then leave until thickened and cool. Split the cakes in two across the middle (a bread knife works well), layer up the pieces, alternating white and dark layers, and sandwiching, then topping them with the ganache.","To decorate, spoon the melted white chocolate into a piping bag with a fine nozzle (or use a sandwich bag and snip off the end instead). Zig-zag the white chocolate over the cake, then finish with a scattering of white Maltesers. Serve on its own or for dessert with pouring cream. Best eaten on the day, but keeps in an airtight container for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9098,9098,'en','Chocolate fudge cake with angel frosting','The ultimate in indulgence, this chocolate fudge cake looks like a star with American-style frosting and bakes in just one tin','["250g dark chocolate, broken into chunks - standard supermarket chocolate is fine","300g self-raising flour","300g light, soft brown sugar, plus 2 tbsp","50g cocoa","200ml sunflower oil, plus a little extra for greasing","284ml soured cream","3 eggs","1 tsp vanilla essence","500g white caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tbsp liquid glucose","2 egg whites","25g icing sugar, sifted"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 4\r\nand grease and line a deep, 20cm round\r\ncake tin. Whizz the chocolate in a food\r\nprocessor until crumbs. Tip the flour,\r\nsugar, cocoa, oil, 150ml soured cream,\r\neggs, vanilla and 150ml water into the\r\nlargest mixing bowl you have. Whisk\r\nwith an electric whisk until smooth, then\r\nquickly stir in 150g of your whizzed-up\r\nchocolate bits. Scrape into a tin, and bake\r\non the middle shelf for 1 hr 20-1 hr 30\r\nmins, or until a skewer inserted in the\r\ncentre comes out clean. Cool in the tin.","While the cake is baking, make the\r\nicing. Combine remaining chocolate bits\r\nand soured cream with 2 tbsp soft brown\r\nsugar in a small saucepan and heat,\r\nstirring, until the chocolate is melted and\r\nyou have a smooth icing. Leave to cool.","When the cake is cool, slice it into\r\n3 even layers. Spread 2 layers with\r\nchocolate icing.","To make the angel frosting, put the\r\nsugar, vanilla and liquid glucose in a pan\r\nwith 125ml water. Bring to the boil and\r\ncook just until the sugar has melted and\r\nthe syrup turns clear. Take off the heat.\r\nMeanwhile, beat the egg whites until\r\nstiff, then continue beating, gradually\r\npouring in the hot sugar syrup in a steady\r\nstream, until the mixture is fluffy and\r\nthick enough to spread – this might take\r\na few mins as the mixture cools. Beat in\r\nthe icing sugar. Work quickly and spread\r\na tiny bit over each chocolate-covered\r\nlayer. Assemble cake and swirl remaining\r\nfrosting over entire cake."]','2026-01-10 12:23:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9099,9099,'en','Chocolate & caramel ombre cake','For the ultimate indulgence look no further than Sarah Cook’s four-layered chocolate-caramel extravaganza','["225g very soft butter, plus extra for greasing","225g golden caster sugar","175g self-raising flour","85g ground almonds","1 tsp baking powder","3 eggs","150ml pot natural yogurt","1 tsp vanilla extract","5 tbsp cocoa powder","225g very soft butter, plus extra for greasing","175g light muscovado sugar","50g dark muscovado sugar","175g self-raising flour","85g ground almonds","1 tsp baking powder","3 eggs","150ml pot natural yogurt","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tbsp cocoa","397g can caramel (stocked near the condensed milk in stores)","140g dark chocolate","140g milk chocolate","300ml double cream"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line bases of 2 x 20cm\r\nsandwich tins with baking parchment.\r\nFor the Vanilla & chocolate sponges, mix\r\nall the ingredients, apart from the cocoa,\r\ntogether with an electric whisk. Scrape\r\nhalf the mix into a second bowl and\r\nwhizz in the cocoa. Scrape into the tins\r\nand bake for 20-25 mins until a skewer\r\npoked in comes out clean.","Repeat step 1 for the Caramel &\r\ncaramel-choc sponges, again leaving\r\ncocoa out of the first mixing, then\r\nsplitting the mix in half and whizzing the\r\ncocoa into one batch. Cook as above.","While sponges are cooling, melt the\r\ndark and milk chocolate together in a\r\nbowl over a pan of barely simmering\r\nwater. Remove from the heat, stir in the\r\ncream and cool or chill until spreadable.","When the sponges are cool, spread\r\na third of the caramel over the Vanilla\r\nsponge and top with the Caramel sponge.\r\nSpread over another third of the caramel\r\nand top with the Caramel-choc sponge,\r\nthen the final third of caramel and top\r\nwith the Chocolate sponge (don’t panic\r\nif you mix up the layers, the cake will still\r\nlook great when you cut in). Spread the\r\nchocolate icing over the whole cake to\r\nserve. It will keep in a cool place in an\r\nairtight container for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9100,9100,'en','Dense & dark chocolate loaf','This cake is mixed and made in a saucepan– how easy is that! It’s best eaten on thesame day, or within two','["200g butter, plus extra for greasing","100g dark chocolate (use one that''s 70% cocoa solids), broken into chunks","150g pot natural yogurt","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs","250g self-raising flour","175g dark muscovado sugar","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","100ml double cream","1 tbsp butter","100g dark chocolate, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5 and\r\nmake sure there’s a shelf ready in the middle\r\nof the oven. Butter a large loaf tin (about 20cm\r\nlong, measured from the top edge), then cut\r\na strip of baking paper a few inches longer\r\nthan the total length of the base and the two\r\nshortest sides. Press it into the tin. (When your\r\ncake’s ready, you can use the paper ‘wings’\r\nat either end to help lift it out.)","Put the butter and chocolate in a large\r\nsaucepan and heat very gently until melted,\r\nstirring now and again. Cool for 5 mins, then\r\nuse a whisk to mix in the yogurt and vanilla,\r\nthen the eggs and a pinch of salt.","Mix the flour, sugar and bicarbonate of soda\r\nin a large bowl, squishing any big lumps of\r\nsugar with your fingers, then stir into the\r\nchocolate mix in the saucepan until even. Pour\r\nor spoon into the tin, then bake for 45 mins\r\nuntil risen and shiny (and probably with a nice\r\ncrack along the length). Test if it’s ready by\r\npoking a skewer into the middle of the cake\r\n(see tip, below). Cool in the tin for 15 mins, then\r\nturn out and cool completely on a wire rack.","Put the cream into a small saucepan, bring\r\nto the boil, then add the butter and half the\r\nchopped chocolate. Take off the heat and\r\nleave to melt. Stir until smooth and shiny,\r\nthen spoon over the cake. Scatter with the\r\nrest of the chopped chocolate and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9101,9101,'en','Orange & white chocolate sponge','A stunning cake that will fast become a failsafe option for any event','["175g butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","175g golden caster sugar","finely grated zest 4 orange and juice of 1","4 egg, separated","100g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","100g ground almonds","200g white chocolate","200ml crème fraîche","100g white chocolate, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter\r\ntwo 20cm round sandwich tins and line the\r\nbases with baking parchment. Tip the sugar\r\ninto a mixing bowl and add the softened\r\nbutter and orange zest. Beat for 1 min or\r\nso until pale and fluffy, then beat in the egg\r\nyolks. Sift the flour and baking powder over\r\nthe cake mixture and fold in lightly. Finally,\r\nfold in the almonds and orange juice. Whisk\r\nthe egg whites until they just hold their\r\nshape. Fold one-third of the egg white into\r\nthe cake mix, using the whisk. Repeat with\r\nanother third, then the final third. Take care\r\nnot to over-mix or you will lose the lightness\r\nof the egg whites.","Divide the cake mix between the prepared\r\ntins and bake for 30-35 mins. Cool in the tin\r\nfor 5 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack,\r\npeel off the lining paper and leave to cool.","To make the icing, melt the chocolate over\r\na pan of barely simmering water or in the\r\nmicrowave on High for 1½ mins, stirring\r\nevery 30 secs, then leave to cool. Whip the\r\ncrème fraîche until thick, then fold in the\r\nwhite chocolate. Set one cake on a serving\r\nplate or cake stand. Spoon half the icing onto\r\nthe cake and top with the other cake. Spread\r\nwith the rest of the icing, then allow to set\r\nin the fridge for at least 1 hr.","If you want to make the decorative curls,\r\nmelt the chocolate in a bowl over simmering\r\nwater or in a microwave and spread thinly\r\nover a baking tray. Leave the tray in the fridge\r\nfor the chocolate to harden a bit, then use\r\na fish slice or angled knife blade to scrape\r\nchocolate curls. Pile the curls in the middle\r\nof the cake and serve cut into slices."]','2026-01-10 12:23:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9102,9102,'en','Ultimate chocolate cake','Indulge yourself with this ultimate chocolate cake recipe that is beautifully moist, rich and fudgy. Perfect for a celebration or an afternoon tea','["200g good quality dark chocolate, about 60% cocoa solids","200g butter","1 tbsp instant coffee granules","85g self-raising flour","85g plain flour","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","200g light muscovado sugar","200g golden caster sugar","25g cocoa powder","3 medium eggs","75ml buttermilk (5 tbsp)","grated chocolate or curls, to decorate","200g good quality dark chocolate, as above","284ml carton double cream (pouring type)","2 tbsp golden caster sugar"]','["Butter a 20cm round cake tin (7.5cm\r\ndeep) and line the base. Preheat the\r\noven to fan 140C/conventional 160C/\r\ngas 3. Break200g good quality dark chocolatein pieces into\r\na medium, heavy-based pan. Cut200g butterinto pieces and tip in with the chocolate, then mix1 tbsp instant coffee granulesinto125ml cold waterand pour into the\r\npan. Warm through over a low heat just\r\nuntil everything is melted – don’t overheat.\r\nOr melt in the microwave on Medium for\r\nabout 5 minutes, stirring half way through.","While the chocolate is melting, mix85g self-raising flour, 85g plain flour, ¼ bicarbonate of soda,\r\n200g light muscovado sugar, 200g golden caster sugar and 25g cocoa powderin a big bowl,\r\nmixing with your hands to get rid of\r\nany lumps. Beat3 medium eggsin a bowl\r\nand stir in75ml (5 tbsp) buttermilk.","Now pour the melted chocolate\r\nmixture and the egg mixture into the flour\r\nmixture, stirring just until everything is\r\nwell blended and you have a smooth,\r\nquite runny consistency. Pour this into\r\nthe tin and bake for 1 hour 25-\r\n1 hour 30 minutes – if you push a\r\nskewer in the centre it should\r\ncome out clean and the top\r\nshould feel firm (don’t worry if it cracks a\r\nbit). Leave to cool in the tin (don’t worry if\r\nit dips slightly), then turn out onto a wire\r\nrack to cool completely.","When the cake is cold, cut it horizontally\r\ninto three. Make the ganache: chop200g good quality dark\r\nchocolateinto small pieces and tip into a\r\nbowl. Pour a284ml carton of double creaminto a pan, add2 tbsp golden caster sugar, and heat until it is about to boil.\r\nTake off the heat and pour it over the\r\nchocolate. Stir until the chocolate has\r\nmelted and the mixture is smooth.","Sandwich the layers together with just\r\na little of the ganache. Pour the rest over\r\nthe cake letting it fall down the sides and\r\nsmoothing to cover with a palette knife.\r\nDecorate withgrated chocolate or a pile of \r\nchocolate curls. The cake keeps moist and \r\ngooey for 3-4 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9103,9103,'en','Chocolate courgette cake','Grated courgette gives this cake a lovely moist texture – a great way to use up a glut from your garden','["350g self-raising flour","50g cocoa powder","1 tsp mixed spice","175ml extra-virgin olive oil","375g golden caster sugar","3 eggs","2 tsp vanilla extract","500ml grated courgettes (measure by volume in a measuring jug, but it''s about 2 medium courgettes; if using 1 overgrown one, peel first and take out seeds)","140g toasted hazelnuts, roughly chopped","200g dark chocolate, chopped","100ml double cream"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nIn a large bowl, combine the flour, cocoa\r\npowder, mixed spice and 1 tsp salt. In\r\nanother bowl, combine the olive oil,\r\nsugar, eggs, vanilla essence and grated\r\ncourgette. Mix the dry and wet mixture\r\nuntil just combined, then fold in the\r\ntoasted hazelnuts. Line a 24cm cake\r\ntin with greaseproof paper, then pour in\r\nyour mixture. Bake for about 40-50 mins,\r\nor until a knife inserted into the middle\r\ncomes out clean. Cool in the tin for\r\n10 mins, then turn out onto a wire\r\nrack and leave to cool.","To make the icing, place the chocolate\r\nin a bowl and bring cream to the boil in\r\na saucepan. Pour the hot cream over\r\nthe chocolate and stir until completely\r\nsmooth and melted. Leave the icing to\r\ncool slightly and thicken, then spread\r\nit over the cake so it’s covered and\r\nthe icing starts to drip down the sides.\r\nServe with a cup of tea or enjoy as a pud\r\nwith a spoonful of something creamy."]','2026-01-10 12:23:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9104,9104,'en','Seriously rich chocolate cake','Dark, rich and delicious – the perfect dessert','["100g butter, diced, plus extra for greasing","flour, for dusting","140g best-quality dark chocolate, with 70% cocoa solids, broken into pieces","6 large eggs, separated","140g ground almonds","1 tbsp kirsch or Cointreau (optional)","pinch of salt","85g caster sugar","cocoa powder and crème fraîche, to serve"]','["Preheat the oven to 170C/Gas 3/fan oven 150C. Grease a 23cm/9in springform cake tin and line the base with greaseproof paper or baking parchment. Dust the sides with a little flour. Put the chocolate and butter into a heatproof bowl set over a pan of gently simmering water. Heat until melted, then remove the bowl from the pan and stir until smooth. Leave for about 5 minutes to cool slightly.","Stir in the egg yolks, ground almonds, and the liqueur, if using. Put the egg whites into a large bowl, add a pinch of salt and whisk until soft peaks form. Continue whisking, sprinkling in the sugar a little at a time, until stiff peaks form. Stir 2 tablespoons of the whites into the chocolate mixture, then carefully fold in the remainder until no\r\ntraces of white are left.","Spoon the mixture into the prepared tin and bake for 30-35 minutes until well risen and just firm to the touch. Cool in the tin (don’t worry if the cake sinks and cracks slightly – it will still be fine). You can make the cake up to this stage up to four days ahead and keep it in an airtight container in a cool place. It also freezes well for up to one month.","To serve, remove the cake from the tin and peel away the lining paper. Sift cocoa powder liberally over the top and cut into slices. Serve with crème fraîche."]','2026-01-10 12:23:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9105,9105,'en','Beetroot & chocolate cake','Beetroot is actually very sweet and keeps this rich chocolate loaf wonderfully moist','["1 large cooked beetroot, about 175g in weight, roughly chopped","200g plain flour","100g cocoa powder","1 tbsp baking powder","250g golden caster sugar","3 eggs","2 tsp vanilla extract","200ml sunflower oil","100g dark chocolate, (not too bitter), chopped into pieces","crème fraîche or clotted cream, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5.  \r\nTip the beetroot into a food processor and blitz  \r\nuntil chopped. Add a pinch of salt and the \r\nrest of the ingredients, except the oil and \r\nchocolate. When completely mixed (you  \r\nmay need to scrape the sides down once \r\nor twice), add the oil in a steady stream, \r\nas if you were making mayonnaise.","When all the oil has been added, stir in  \r\nthe chocolate, then tip the mix into a lined \r\n900g loaf tin. Cook for 1 hr until an inserted \r\nskewer comes out practically clean. leave \r\nthe loaf to cool on a rack. Serve in slices  \r\nwith the crème fraîche or clotted cream."]','2026-01-10 12:23:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9106,9106,'en','Chocolate marble cake','Marble cake is a classic childhood cooking memory. Whether using lurid colours for a psychedelic finish, or just chocolate and vanilla, it''s a teatime treat','["225g butter, softened","225g caster sugar","4 eggs","225g self-raising flour","3 tbsp milk","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp cocoa powder"]','["Heat oven to 180C/gas 160C/gas 4. Grease a 20cm cake tin and line the bottom with a circle of greaseproof paper. If you want to make life easy, simply put all the ingredients (except the cocoa powder) into a food processor and whizz for 1-2 mins until smooth. If you prefer to mix by hand, beat the butter and sugar together, then add the eggs, one at a time, mixing well after each addition. Fold through the flour, milk and vanilla extract until the mixture is smooth.","Divide the mixture between 2 bowls. Stir the cocoa powder into the mixture in one of the bowls. Take 2 spoons and use them to dollop the chocolate and vanilla cake mixes into the tin alternately. When all the mixture has been used up (and if young kids are doing this, you’ll need to ensure the base of the tin is fairly evenly covered), tap the bottom on your work surface to ensure that there aren’t any air bubbles. Take a skewer and swirl it around the mixture in the tin a few times to create a marbled effect.","Bake the cake for 45-55 mins until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Turn out onto a cooling rack and leave to cool. Will keep for 3 days in an airtight container or freeze for up to 3 months."]','2026-01-10 12:23:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9107,9107,'en','Double chocolate loaf cake','Chocolate and cake are two of our favourite things, so what’s not to love about this indulgent cake?','["175g softened butter, plus extra for greasing","175g golden caster sugar","3 eggs","140g self-raising flour","85g ground almonds","½ tsp baking powder","100ml milk","4 tbsp cocoa powder","50g plain chocolate chips or chunks","few extra chunks white, plain and milk chocolate, for decorating"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line a 2lb/900g loaf tin with\r\na long strip of baking parchment. To\r\nmake the loaf cake batter, beat the butter\r\nand sugar with an electric whisk until\r\nlight and fluffy. Beat in the eggs, flour,\r\nalmonds, baking powder, milk and cocoa\r\nuntil smooth. Stir in the chocolate chips,\r\nthen scrape into the tin. Bake for 45-50\r\nmins until golden, risen and a skewer\r\npoked in the centre comes out clean.","Cool in the tin, then lift out onto a wire\r\nrack over some kitchen paper. Melt the\r\nextra chocolate chunks separately in\r\npans over barely simmering water, or\r\nin bowls in the microwave, then use a\r\nspoon to drizzle each in turn over the\r\ncake. Leave to set before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:23:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9108,9108,'en','Chocolate caramel cake','This rich cake makes an impressive centrepiece for any summer tea party','["300g butter, plus extra for greasing","300g light muscovado sugar","3 large eggs","1½ tsp baking powder","85g cocoa powder","225g plain flour","225ml soured cream","300ml pot double cream","5 tbsp dulce de leche or caramel sauce","25g caramel flavoured chocolate, finely chopped (we used Lindt)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLightly grease 2 x 23cm loose-bottom\r\ncake tins and line with a circle of baking\r\nparchment. Beat together the butter and\r\nsugar until pale and creamy. Add the\r\neggs, one at a time, beating well between\r\neach addition, then add the baking\r\npowder, cocoa and a third of the flour.\r\nMix well to combine, then stir in half the\r\nsoured cream. Alternating between\r\nadding the flour and soured cream, mix\r\neverything until just combined. Spoon\r\ninto the prepared tins, then smooth over\r\nthe surface with a spoon.","Bake for 30 mins or until the cakes are\r\nfirm to touch and a skewer inserted into\r\nthe centres comes out clean. Leave to\r\ncool in the tins for 5 mins, then turn out\r\nonto a rack and cool completely.","When you’re ready to serve, whip the\r\ndouble cream with 2 tbsp Dulce de leche\r\nuntil soft peaks form. Place 1 cake on a\r\nserving plate and spread with half the\r\ncream, then drizzle over the remaining\r\nDulce de leche. Top with the other cake,\r\nthen spread the remaining cream on top.\r\nSprinkle with the chocolate. Chill until\r\nready to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9109,9109,'en','Reindeer peanut butter thumbprint cookies','Bake a batch of these sweet reindeer cookies on Christmas Eve to leave out for Santa. Kids will love helping out and adding Rudolph’s jammy red nose!','["100g smooth peanut butter","2 eggs","100g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","225g plain flour","¼ tsp baking powder","½ jar seedless raspberry or strawberry jam","22 small pretzels","22 pairs of edible eye decorations","white icing pen or mix a little icing sugar with a drop of water"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line two baking trays with baking parchment. Blitz the peanut butter, eggs, sugar, vanilla, flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt in a food processor until you have a smooth dough that clumps together.","Roll the dough into walnut-sized balls and arrange on the trays. Push a thumb into the middle of each to make an indent, and fill each one with ½ tsp jam for the noses.","Cut the pretzels in half and push into the top of the cookies to create ‘antlers’. Bake for 10-12 mins until they look dry. Leave to cool on the trays. Decorate with the eyes, sticking them on using the icing. Will keep in an airtight container for up to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9110,9110,'en','Salted chocolate chip tahini cookies','These have a sweet and salty flavour with perfect crispy edges and a chewy centre – they’ll become your go-to cookie recipe','["120g salted butter , softened","120g tahini , well stirred","90g golden caster sugar","110g soft light brown sugar","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","1 Morrisons The Best White Golden Yolk free range egg , plus a yolk (save the white for another recipe)","175g plain flour","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","100g milk chocolate , roughly chopped","125g dark chocolate , roughly chopped","3 tbsp white sesame seeds","3 tbsp black sesame seeds"]','["In a large bowl or the bowl of a stand mixer, put the salted butter, tahini, golden caster sugar, soft brown sugar, vanilla bean paste and a small pinch of salt. Whip using electric beaters until fluffy, about 5-6 mins.","Crack in the Morrisons The Best White Golden Yolk free range egg and add the extra yolk, then beat to combine, about 2 mins. Sieve over the flour and bicarb, mixing gently until just combined, then mix through both chocolates. Chill the dough in the fridge for at least two hours.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Use an ice cream or cookie scoop to measure out 12 balls of dough – roughly 65g each. Pour the sesame seeds into a shallow bowl and gently mix them. Roll each cookie dough ball in the sesame seeds. Put them onto two large, lined baking trays, spaced well apart as they will spread.","Bake for 13-15 mins until lightly golden, then remove from the oven and give the tray a good tap on the kitchen side. This helps create a crispy, chewy texture. Leave to cool completely on the tray before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9111,9111,'en','Frosty chocolate cookies','Keep a batch of uncooked cookie dough balls in the freezer ready to air fry for unexpected guests over Christmas. They’re ideal for the festive biscuit tin','["2 eggs","175g caster sugar","75g salted butter , melted","150g self-raising flour","50g cocoa powder","65g milk chocolate chips","50g icing sugar"]','["Whisk the eggs and sugar with an electric whisk until thick and voluminous. Mix in the melted butter. Sift over the flour and cocoa powder, add the chocolate chips and mix to combine. Cover and chill for 1 hr. Dough will keep chilled in an airtight container for up to a week.","Heat the air fryer to 170C and put a square of baking parchment in the basket. Shape heaped teaspoons of the mixture into balls. If cooking straight away, roll the balls in the icing sugar until well coated. Put on the parchment, leaving plenty of room for them to spread out. The un-dusted cookie balls can be frozen for up to two months.","Air fry in batches for 8-10 mins (or 10-12 mins from frozen), then leave to cool and firm up for a few minutes before carefully transferring to a wire rack to cool completely. Will keep in a tin for five days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9112,9112,'en','Gooey s’mores cookies','Combine cookies with s’mores, an American campfire treat consisting of chocolate, marshmallow and crackers','["150g salted butter , softened","160g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","½ tsp almond extract","1 egg , beaten","225g plain flour","5 large marshmallows , cut in half crosswise","10 squares of chocolate (about 100g)","20 salted crackers"]','["Tip the butter into a large bowl and beat in the sugar using an electric whisk until light and fluffy. Add the vanilla, almond extract and egg, and whisk until combined and thickened.","Sift in the flour and mix to form a dough. Divide the dough into 10 pieces about 55g each, then roll into balls (lightly dampen your hands to prevent sticking, if needed). Gently flatten each dough ball between your palms, then put a marshmallow half and a piece of chocolate in the middle, and bring the dough up and around to enclose the fillings, ensuring they''re completely encased. Gently press a cracker into base and top of each filled dough ball. Put in the fridge to chill for 1 hr so they firm up slightly before baking.","About 10 mins before you want to bake, remove from the fridge. Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 3 and line two large baking trays with baking parchment. Arrange the dough balls on the trays, well spaced out (we put five on each tray). Bake for 15 mins until lightly golden. Remove from the oven and leave to cool slightly on the trays before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9113,9113,'en','Cinnamon cookies','Leave out a few of these cinnamon-spiced cookies for Father Christmas on Christmas Eve. Perfect for the festive biscuit tin, you could add some raisins too','["120g softened salted butter","50g light brown muscovado sugar","150g golden caster sugar","3 tsp ground cinnamon","1 egg, lightly beaten","220g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","50g raisins (optional)","1 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Beat the butter, muscovado sugar, caster sugar and 2 tsp cinnamon together with an electricwhiskfor 2-3 mins until well-combined. Add the egg, flour, baking powder and raisins, if using, and continue to beat until the mixture becomes a uniform dough. Roll tablespoons of the dough into balls between the palms your hands (you should have 12-15). Chill in the fridge for at least 2 hrs until firm, or overnight. The unbaked dough balls will keep in an airtight container in the freezer for up to three months (see tip, below).","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4 and line two largebaking trayswith baking parchment. Place the dough balls 3-4cm apart on the prepared baking trays to allow the mixture to spread without touching. Bake for 10-12 mins until lightly golden at the edges but still soft and gooey in the centre. Leave to cool completely on the baking trays.","Mix the icing sugar with the remaining cinnamon, then dust over the cookies.Will keep in an airtight container for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9114,9114,'en','Butter cookies','These six-ingredient biscuits are beautifully buttery. Dip them in chocolate and add a dusting of edible glitter for sparkle if you like','["165g butter","100g icing sugar","1 tsp lemon zest","250g plain flour","1 tbsp milk","100g dark chocolate, milk chocolate or white chocolate"]','["Beat the butter with the icing sugar, a pinch of salt and the lemon zest until a smooth.","Sift in the flour and add the milk, mix to a dough and then knead briefly. Wrap and chill for 1-2 hours.","Heat the oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Line 2 baking sheets with baking parchment. Roll the dough out on a floured worksurface to 2mm and cut out different shapes. Arrange the biscuits on the baking sheets, grouping all the same sizes together. Bake for 10-12 minutes until golden, then cool completely.","Melt the chocolate in a microwave or in a bowl set over simmering water. Dip one side of each cookie into the chocolate and leave to cool and set."]','2026-01-10 12:23:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9115,9115,'en','Sugar-free cookies','These simple buttery biscuits are made with agave syrup as a clever sugar alternative. Whip up a batch in just 25 minutes with only five ingredients','["150g plain flour","80g butter","3 tbsp agave syrup","2 egg yolks","1 vanilla pod"]','["Beat the flour, butter, agave syrup, egg yolks, the seeds from the vanilla pod and a pinch of salt together in a stand mixer to make a smooth dough. Wrap the dough and chill for 30 minutes.","Roll out the dough on a lightly floured worksurface and cut out 36 cookies with biscuit cutters.","Heat the oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Cover 2 baking sheets with baking parchment. Lift the cookies onto the baking sheets and bake for 8-10 minutes until golden. Allow to cool completely.Store in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9116,9116,'en','Caramelised honey and tahini cookies','Use up that jar of sesame paste in the back of your cupboard to bake these decadent honey and tahini biscuits. They’re sweet, salty and totally addictive','["150g honey","150g salted butter, cubed","75g dark brown soft sugar","75g caster sugar","100g tahini","1 large egg, plus 1 large yolk","250g plain flour","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp sea salt flakes","1 tbsp mixed black & white sesame seeds"]','["Bring the honey to a boil in a small pan set over a medium-high heat. Boil for 5 mins until it has darkened and smells nutty – don’t worry if it looks quite dark, this will add flavour. Whisk briefly, then remove from the heat and carefully whisk in the butter until melted. Transfer to a heatproof bowl and leave to cool.","Tip both the sugars, tahini, egg and yolk into the bowl with the honey mix, then beat to combine. In a separate bowl, mix the flour and bicarb together, then gradually pour the wet ingredients into the dry and mix until it comes together into a dough. Chill for 3 hrs, or overnight.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line two baking trays with baking parchment. Roll the dough into 18 even balls (weigh for accuracy, if you like – they should be around 45g each), and arrange on the trays spaced 5cm apart. Gently press down with the back of a spoon to slightly flatten the tops, then sprinkle over the sea salt flakes and sesame seeds and bake for 10-12 mins.","Tap the tray on a work surface to slightly flatten the cookies. Leave to cool on the trays for 10 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely. Will keep in an airtight container for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9117,9117,'en','Chewy chocolate chip cookies','Enjoy these chewy chocolate chip cookies with a cup of tea. If you have time, leave the dough overnight for the best flavour and texture','["150g butter, softened","150g soft brown sugar, golden caster sugar, or ideally half of each","1 egg","1 tsp vanilla extract","180-200g plain flour (see tip below)","½ tsp baking powder","200g chocolate chips or chopped chocolate"]','["Mix the butter and sugar together using an electric whisk or hand whisk until very light and fluffy, then beat in the egg and vanilla. Fold in the flour, baking powder, chocolate and ¼ tsp salt as quickly as you can. Don’t overwork the dough as this will toughen the cookies.","For the best flavour, leave the mixture overnight: either cover the bowl and chill, or roll the mixture into balls and chill.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line two baking sheets with parchment. Divide the mixture into balls, the craggier the balls, the rougher the cookies will look. If you want to give the dough more texture, tear the balls in half and squidge them lightly back together. Space out evenly on the baking sheets, leaving enough space between each to allow for spreading.","Bake the fresh cookies for 8-10 mins and the chilled ones for 10-12 mins, or until browned and a little crisp at the edges but still very soft in the middle – they will harden a little as they cool. Leave to cool on the tray for a few minutes before eating warm, or transfer to a wire rack to cool completely. Will keep for three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9118,9118,'en','Double-dipped shortbread cookies','What could be better than shortbread biscuits? Shortbread double-dipped in milk and white chocolate! They''re sure to go down a storm with family and friends','["200g salted butter, softened","100g icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g plain flour","1 tbsp milk, plus extra if needed","50g white chocolate, chopped","50g milk chocolate, chopped"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Beat the butter with the icing sugar using an electric whisk until the mixture is light and fluffy. Beat in the vanilla and flour (the mixture will stiffen and look like crumble as the flour is added). Add the milk and keep beating until the mixture softens and sticks together (add some more milk if needed).","Scoop the dough into a piping bag fitted with a large star nozzle and pipe swirled rings onto a baking sheet lined with baking parchment. If the mixture is too stiff to pipe easily, you can roll the dough into balls and put them on the sheet instead. The cookies will spread as they cook so don’t worry if there’s a small gap in the centre of the piped swirls, but ensure there is enough space between each cookie so they don’t stick together as they cook. Bake for 15 mins, or until lightly golden, then transfer to a wire rack to cool.","Put the white and milk chocolate in separate bowls and microwave each in 20-second bursts until melted. Dip the cookies into each chocolate, milk at one end and white on the other, then let any excess drip off before returning them to the rack to set. Will keep in an airtight tin for up to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9119,9119,'en','Hazelnut & chocolate cookie sandwiches','How do you make chocolate chip cookies even better? Stuff them with chocolate! These hazelnut & chocolate cookie sandwiches are the ultimate indulgence','["120g unsalted butter, softened","100g light brown soft sugar","75g golden caster sugar","½ tsp fine sea salt","1 medium egg, lightly beaten","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g plain flour","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","100g milk chocolate, roughly chopped","70g skinless hazelnuts, roughly chopped and toasted","120g chocolate hazelnut spread"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4. Line two baking sheets with baking parchment and set aside.","Cream the butter with both sugars in a large mixing bowl using an electric whisk, then beat in the salt, egg and vanilla. Stir in the flour, bicarbonate of soda, chocolate and hazelnuts using a wooden spoon until well combined.","Scoop the dough onto the baking sheets in 24 heaps, well spaced apart. Bake for 10-12 mins or until lightly golden at the edges. Remove from the oven and allow to cool completely on the baking sheets. Spread 1 tsp of chocolate spread on the bottoms of half the cookies, then sandwich with the other halves. Will keep in a cake tin or airtight container for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9120,9120,'en','Cookie dough pizza','We''ve seen pizza in all sorts of varieties, but this has to be our favourite. Top your cookie dough pizza base with any treats that take your fancy','["185g butter, softened","185g golden caster sugar","150g soft light brown sugar","2 medium eggs, beaten","2 tsp vanilla extract","335g self raising flour","1 tsp salt","200g chocolate chips","200g dark chocolate, melted","25g giant white chocolate buttons","25g mini marshmallows","25g strawberries, hulled and sliced"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160 fan/ gas 4. Beat the butter and sugars together in a large bowl using an electric whisk or table top mixer. Pour in the beaten eggs and vanilla, beating well until combined.","Sift in the flour and salt and fold until evenly combined. Scatter over the chocolate chips and stir until they are rippled throughout the dough.","Roll into a big round cookie and place onto a large baking sheet covered with parchment. Bake in the preheated oven for 25 mins until golden at the edges and still a little wobbly in the middle. Leave to cool for a couple of mins before topping. Spread the melted chocolate over the cookie, sprinkle with giant chocolate buttons, mini marshmallows and strawberries. Cut into about 15 slices and serve while it is still a little warm."]','2026-01-10 12:23:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9121,9121,'en','Chocolate & hazelnut thumbprint cookies','The food processor does most of the work in this cookie recipe, but younger children will enjoy rolling the dough into balls and thumbprinting. Older kids can make them on their own','["180g hazelnuts, toasted","100g plain flour","90g buckwheat flour","60g golden caster sugar","180g unsalted butter","100g dark chocolate, roughly chopped","1 tsp coconut oil (or use any flavourless oil)"]','["Line a baking tray with baking parchment. Tip the hazelnuts into the bowl of a food processor and pulse until finely chopped. Add the flours, sugar and a pinch of flaked sea salt, and process for 20-30 secs until fully combined. Add the butter and pulse until the mixture just starts to come together. Tip the dough out onto a work surface and knead by hand until smooth.","Roll the dough into 25 small balls, then transfer to the prepared baking tray. Using your thumb or the handle of a wooden spoon, make an indent in the centre of each piece of dough. Put the tray in the fridge and chill for 30 mins before baking. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Bake in the oven for 15-20 mins or until light golden brown. Put the chocolate and oil in a heatproof bowl and set over a pan of simmering water, stirring occasionally, until fully melted. Use a teaspoon to top each cookie with a little melted chocolate. Put aside until the chocolate has set."]','2026-01-10 12:23:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9122,9122,'en','Peanut butter cookies','With just three ingredients, these simple peanut butter cookies will delight kids and grown-ups alike – and they''re gluten-free, too','["200g peanut butter (crunchy or smooth is fine)","175g golden caster sugar","¼ tsp fine table salt","1 large egg"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line 2 large baking trays with baking parchment. Measure the peanut butter and sugar into a bowl. Add ¼ tsp fine table salt and mix well with a wooden spoon. Add the egg and mix again until the mixture forms a dough.","Break off cherry tomato sized chunks of dough and place, well spaced apart, on the trays. Press the cookies down with the back of a fork to squash them a little. The cookies can now be frozen for 2 months, cook from frozen adding an extra min or 2 to the cooking time. Bake for 12 mins, until golden around the edges and paler in the centre. Cool on the trays for 10 mins, then transfer to a wire rack and cool completely. Store in a cookie jar for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9123,9123,'en','Double ginger cookies','If you love ginger nuts, you’ll love these American-style spiced biscuits with chunks of stem ginger, dipped in dark chocolate','["350g plain flour","1 tbsp ground ginger","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","175g light muscovado sugar","100g butter, chopped","8 pieces of stem ginger, chopped (not too finely), plus thin slices, to decorate (optional)","1 large egg","4 tbsp golden syrup","200g bar dark chocolate, chopped"]','["Mix the flour, ground ginger, bicarbonate of soda, 1/2 tsp salt and sugar in a bowl, then rub in the butter to make crumbs. Stir in the chopped stem ginger.","Beat together the egg and syrup, pour into the dry ingredients and stir, then knead with your hands to make a dough. Cut the dough in half and shape each piece into a thick sausage about 6cm across, making sure that the ends are straight. Wrap in cling film and chill for 20 mins. You can now freeze all or part of the dough for 2 months.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line 2 baking sheets with baking parchment. Thickly slice each sausage into 12 and put the slices on the baking sheets, spacing them well apart and reshaping any, if necessary, to make rounds. Bake for 12 mins, then leave to cool for a few mins to harden before transferring to a wire rack to cool completely.","Melt the chocolate in a bowl over a pan of gently simmering water, making sure that the water isn’t touching the bottom of the bowl. Dip half of each cookie into the chocolate – you may need to spoon it over when you get to the final few. Decorate with a slice of ginger, if you like, and leave to set. Will keep for 1 week in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9124,9124,'en','Oatmeal raisin cookies','Fill the biscuit tin with these rustic cookies. Soaking the raisins gives a boost to the texture and stops them from burning during cooking','["100g raisins","150ml vegetable oil","200g golden caster sugar","1 large egg, beaten","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp vanilla extract","140g plain flour","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","300g oats"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line 2 baking trays with baking parchment. Pour 50ml/2fl oz boiling water over the raisins and leave to soak for 20 mins until plump. Drain, reserving the liquid.","Meanwhile, in a large bowl, mix together the oil and sugar. Gradually beat in the egg, along with the reserved water from the raisins, the cinnamon and vanilla extract. Sift the flour, bicarbonate of soda and a pinch of salt into the bowl, then add the oats. Finally, mix in the raisins.","Drop heaped tbsps of the cookie dough onto the baking trays, well spaced apart as they will spread when cooking. Bake for 12-15 mins until golden. Leave to cool on the trays for 10 mins before tucking in, or transfer to a cooling rack to cool completely. Will keep in an airtight container for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9125,9125,'en','Orange pumpkin face cookies','Great fun biscuits for trick or treaters – make a day or two ahead, then fill in before your spooky guests arrive','["140g butter, softened","175g plain flour","50g icing sugar","finely grated zest 1 medium orange","100g mascarpone","1 tsp icing sugar","25g plain chocolate (55% cocoa solids is fine), melted","50g icing sugar","about 1 tbsp orange juice"]','["Preheat the oven to fan 160C/\r\nconventional 180C/gas 4. Put the butter in\r\na bowl and beat with a wooden spoon until\r\nsmooth. Add the flour, icing sugar and\r\norange zest and beat together to make a\r\nsoftish dough. Knead into a ball and wrap\r\nin cling film. Chill for 1 hour.","Roll the dough out on a lightly floured\r\nsurface to a thickness of about 3mm. Cut\r\n24 circles with a 7.5 cm round plain cutter.\r\nPut them on a couple of baking sheets.","Using a small sharp knife, cut out\r\nHallowe’en faces on 12 of the circles.\r\nGather up the spare biscuit dough and\r\npress into pumpkin stem shapes, trimming\r\nwith a sharp knife. Press to the top of each \r\nbiscuit with a knife to join. Make lines on\r\nthe face biscuits with the back of a roundbladed\r\nknife, to look like the markings on a\r\npumpkin. Bake all the biscuits for about 15\r\nminutes until pale golden. Leave to set for a\r\nwhile, then cool completely on a wire rack.","Mix the glaze ingredients to make a\r\nsmooth, runny icing, adding a bit more juice\r\nif needed, then set aside. For the filling,\r\nbeat the mascarpone with the icing sugar,\r\nthen stir in the cooled melted chocolate.","Spread the filling over the cooled plain\r\nbiscuits, then press the ‘face’ ones on top\r\n– do this just before you want to eat them,\r\notherwise they go soft. Brush with the\r\nglaze, using a clean paint brush or pastry\r\nbrush. Eat the same day."]','2026-01-10 12:23:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9126,9126,'en','Sparkling vanilla Christmas cookies','Hang these from a Christmas tree or pack them into boxes as end-of-term gifts for teachers and friends.','["140g icing sugar, sieved","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 egg yolk","250g butter, cut into small cubes","375g plain flour, sieved","200g icing sugar, sieved","edible food colouring, optional","edible gold and silver balls","approx 2m thin ribbon cut into 10cm lengths"]','["Tip the icing sugar, vanilla extract, egg yolk and butter into a mixing bowl, then stir together with a wooden spoon (or pulse in a food processor until well combined). Add the flour and mix to a firm dough. Shape the dough into two flat discs and wrap in clingfilm. Chill for 20-30 mins. Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5 and line two baking sheets with non-stick baking paper.","Roll out the dough on a lightly floured surface to about the thickness of two £1 coins. Cut out Christmassy shapes (use a cutter if you like) and place on the baking sheets. Using the tip of a skewer, cut a small hole in the top of each cookie. Bake for 10-12 mins until lightly golden.","Lift the biscuits onto a wire rack to cool. Meanwhile, mix the icing sugar with a few drops of cold water to make a thick, but still runny icing. Colour with edible food colouring, if you like. Spread it over the cooled biscuits, decorate with edible balls and thread with ribbon when dry."]','2026-01-10 12:23:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9127,9127,'en','Show your spots cookie sandwiches','These dinky biscuits, stacked with buttercream and topped with Smarties, are perfect for bake sales and cooking with kids','["200g butter, softened","140g icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 large eggs, 1 beaten for glazing","350g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","147g bag Smarties","4 tbsp hundreds and thousands","100g butter, softened","140g icing sugar","¼ tsp vanilla extract"]','["In a food processor, whizz the butter,\r\nicing sugar and vanilla until smooth.\r\nAdd 1 egg and blend to combine, then\r\ntip in the flour and blitz once more.\r\nScoop the dough into a ball and wrap\r\nin cling film. Chill for 30 mins.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nDust 2 large baking trays with flour. Break\r\nthe dough into large cherry-sized pieces.\r\nRoll into balls and put on the baking\r\ntrays, spaced a little apart. Squash down\r\nthe balls slightly with 3 fingers. Bake (in\r\nbatches, if necessary) for 8 mins – the\r\ncookies will still be very pale at this stage.","Remove the cookies from the oven.\r\nWhile still warm, quickly brush the tops\r\nwith the beaten egg, then dip half in the\r\nhundreds & thousands, and press a few\r\nSmarties onto each of the remaining\r\ncookies – do this while the egg is still\r\nwet, so the toppings will stick once\r\ncooked. Bake for a further 4 mins.\r\nLeave to cool on wire racks.","To make the icing, beat together the\r\nbutter, icing sugar and vanilla. Once the\r\ncookies are completely cool, use the icing\r\nto sandwich together the 2 different\r\ncookies.Un-iced cookies can be made\r\nup to 4 days ahead and kept in an\r\nairtight container. You can fill with\r\nthe icing up to 1 day ahead."]','2026-01-10 12:23:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9128,9128,'en','Freezer biscuits','Everyone needs a treat now and again, and these biscuits are packed with oats, which takes away some of the guilt','["200g pack butter, softened","200g soft brown sugar","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g self-raising flour","140g oats","50g chopped nuts such as pecans, hazelnuts or almonds","50g desiccated coconut","50g raisins, or mixed fruit"]','["When the butter is really soft, tip it into a bowl along with the sugar. Using an electric hand whisk or exercising some arm muscle, beat together until the sugar is mixed through. Beat in the eggs, one at a time, followed by the vanilla extract and a pinch of salt, if you like. Stir in the flour and oats. The mixture will be quite stiff at this point. Now decide what else you would like to add – any or all of the flavours are delicious – and stir through.","Tear off an A4-size sheet of greaseproof paper. Pile up half the mixture in the middle of the sheet, then use a spoon to thickly spread the mixture along the centre of the paper. Pull over one edge of paper and roll up until you get a tight cylinder. If you have problems getting it smooth, then roll as you would a rolling pin along a kitchen surface. You’ll need it to be about the width of a teacup. When it is tightly wrapped, twist up the ends and then place in the freezer. Can be frozen for up to 3 months.","To cook, heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4 and unwrap the frozen biscuit mix. Using a sharp knife, cut off a disk about\r\n½cm wide. If you have difficulty slicing through, dip the knife into a cup of hot water. Cut off as many biscuits as you\r\nneed, then pop the mix back into the freezer for another time. Place on a baking sheet, spacing them widely apart\r\nas the mixture will spread when cooking, then cook for 15 mins until the tops are golden brown. Leave to cool for at least\r\n5 mins before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:23:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9129,9129,'en','Butterscotch cookies','Hidden rice puffs give reader Pamela Johnson’s butterscotch chocolate chip biscuits a good crunch','["100g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the baking sheet","100g light soft brown sugar","2 tbsp golden syrup","175g self-raising flour","25g puffed rice cereal, such as Rice Krispies","dark chocolate chips, for decoration"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nIn a large bowl, beat together the butter,\r\nsugar and golden syrup until smooth.","Sift in the flour and mix together,\r\nthen fold through the puffed rice cereal.\r\nRoll into walnut-sized balls and place,\r\nwell spaced, on a lightly buttered baking\r\nsheet. Decorate each ball with a few\r\nchocolate chips.","Bake for 15-20 mins until golden.\r\nLeave on the baking sheet for 1 min\r\nbefore removing to a wire rack to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:23:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9130,9130,'en','Fruity cookies','This easy yet delicious recipe was whipped up by the Year 7 pupils from the Priory School in Suffolk','["200g butter","175g soft brown sugar","2 tbsp thin-cut marmalade","2 tsp ground mixed spice","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp ground ginger","175g porridge oats","200g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","2 tsp baking powder","175g dried fruits - try chopped glacé cherries, apricots and sultanas","100g nuts, chopped (we used hazelnuts)"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nCream the butter and sugar until light\r\nand fluffy. Mix the marmalade with 2 tbsp\r\nboiling water. Stir into the creamed mix,\r\nthen add the spices, oats, flour and\r\nbaking powder. Mix in the fruit and nuts.","Dust your hands and surface with flour\r\nand roll the dough into a long sausage\r\nshape. Cut into about 20 discs. Place on\r\na baking tray lined with baking parchment,\r\nspaced out as they will spread. Bake\r\nfor about 25 mins until golden brown."]','2026-01-10 12:23:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9131,9131,'en','Cherry & coconut Florentines','Cute chewy bites. Make one giant version, then stamp out the star shapes – leaving lots of bits to nibble!','["140g light muscovado sugar","100g clear honey","200g salted butter","100g desiccated coconut","140g flaked almonds","300g glacé cherries, sliced","4 tbsp plain flour","250g dark, milk or white chocolate, or a mix"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put\r\nthe sugar, honey and butter in a large pan\r\nand gently melt together. When all the\r\nsugar has dissolved stir in the coconut,\r\nflaked almonds, sliced cherries and flour.","Line a large baking tray with greaseproof paper (about 40 x 30cm), and\r\nroughly spread the Florentine mixture\r\nout to a thin layer – don’t worry if you\r\nhave small gaps, it should melt together\r\nin the oven. Bake for 10-12 mins until\r\na rich golden colour, then set aside to\r\ncool and firm up.","Melt the chocolate(s) all in separate\r\nheatproof bowls over gently simmering\r\nwater. Line a second large tray or board\r\nwith greaseproof paper and carefully flip\r\nthe cooled Florentine bake onto it. Peel\r\noff the greaseproof paper. Spread the\r\nmelted chocolate over, if you’re using a\r\nfew types just leave a gap between each.","Leave aside until set, then stamp out shapes using cookie star cutters - if the cutter is digging into your hands (as the Florentine mix may be a little hard), rest a small plate or pan on top of it and push down on this instead."]','2026-01-10 12:23:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9132,9132,'en','Forgotten cookies','What’s in a name? Pop these in the oven, forget about them overnight, and you’ll have crumbly cookies in the morning','["2 large egg whites","120g golden caster sugar","120g pecans, roughly chopped","150g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids), roughly chopped","1 tsp vanilla extract"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/gas\r\n4/fan 160C. Line two baking sheets\r\nwith foil to cover. In a large clean\r\nbowl, whisk the egg whites with\r\na pinch of salt until stiff and dry.\r\nGradually whisk in the sugar a little\r\nat a time to make a thick and glossy\r\nmeringue. Tip in the pecan nuts\r\nand chocolate, then the vanilla\r\nextract and gently fold into the\r\nmeringue with a large metal spoon.","Spoon heaped teaspoonfuls of\r\nthe meringue mixture, spaced\r\napart, on to the lined baking\r\nsheets. Put the sheets in the oven,\r\nthen turn it off and leave the\r\ncookies for at least 3 hours,\r\novernight or until the oven is cold.","Carefully peel the cookies from\r\nthe foil. Store in an airtight tin\r\nwhere they will keep for 3-4 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9133,9133,'en','Clove sugar cookies','These sweet, nutty, spiced biscuits can be served after dinner, or packaged up as gifts for family and friends','["250g butter, softened","100g hazelnuts","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g icing sugar","1½  tsp ground cloves","350g plain flour"]','["Put the butter, hazelnuts, vanilla extract and 85g of the icing sugar in a food processor and whizz to a paste. Add 1 tsp of the ground cloves and the flour, and pulse together until a dough forms.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line a couple of baking sheets with baking parchment. Roll the dough into walnut- sized balls and arrange on the baking sheets. Use the back of a fork to lightly squash each ball, then bake for 12-15 mins until they turn a pale biscuit colour – if they get too brown, they will become dry.","Mix the remaining icing sugar and ground cloves, then sieve thickly over the hot biscuits. Leave to cool slightly before eating just warm, or cool."]','2026-01-10 12:23:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9134,9134,'en','Vintage chocolate chip cookies','An easy chocolate chip cookie recipe for soft biscuits with a squidgy middle that will impress family and friends. Make plenty as they''re sure to be a hit','["150g salted butter, softened","80g light brown muscovado sugar","80g granulated sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","1 large egg","225g plain flour","½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","¼ tsp salt","200g plain chocolate chips or chunks"]','["Preheat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Line two baking trays with non-stick baking paper.","Put the butter and sugars into a bowl and beat until creamy. Beat in the vanilla extract and egg. Sieve the flour, bicarbonate of soda and salt over the mixture and mix in with a wooden spoon. Add the chocolate chips and stir well.","Using a teaspoon, place small mounds of the mixture well apart on the baking trays. Bake in the oven for 8–10 mins until light brown on the edges and still slightly soft in the centre.","Leave on the tray for a couple of minutes to firm up and then transfer to a cooling rack."]','2026-01-10 12:23:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9135,9135,'en','Triple chocolate cookies','You''ve got all bases covered with white, milk and dark chocolate in these American-style cookies, best enjoyed warm with a cold glass of milk','["100g soft brown sugar","100g golden caster sugar","100g butter, softened","1 egg","1 tsp vanilla extract","225g plain flour","140g milk chocolate, melted","85g white chocolate, chips or chopped into chunks","85g plain chocolate, chips or chopped into chunks"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nLine 1-2 baking sheets with baking\r\nparchment. Mix the sugars and butter\r\ntogether with a wooden spoon, then add\r\nthe egg, vanilla, flour and half the melted\r\nmilk chocolate and mix together. Stir in\r\nthe white and plain chocolate chips or\r\nchunks, then use an ice-cream scoop or\r\nround tablespoon (like a measuring spoon)\r\nto scoop out balls of cookie dough and\r\ndrop them straight onto the trays.","Bake in batches for 8-9 mins until pale\r\ngolden and still soft to touch – they will\r\nfirm up as they cool. Carefully transfer to\r\na wire rack as soon as they can be lifted\r\nup, then drizzle with the remaining\r\nmelted chocolate."]','2026-01-10 12:23:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9136,9136,'en','Rainbow cookies','These colourful cookies are bound to be a big hit with kids and adults alike','["175g softened butter","50g golden caster sugar","50g icing sugar","2 egg yolks","2 tsp vanilla extract","300g plain flour","zest and juice 1 orange","140g icing sugar, sifted","sprinkles, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nMix the butter, sugars, egg yolks and\r\nvanilla with a wooden spoon until\r\ncreamy, then mix in the flour in\r\n2 batches. Stir in the orange zest.\r\nRoll the dough into about 22 walnut-size\r\nballs and sit on baking sheets. Bake for\r\n15 mins until golden, then leave to cool.","Meanwhile, mix the icing sugar with\r\nenough orange juice to make a thick,\r\nrunny icing. Dip each biscuit half into\r\nthe icing, then straight into the sprinkles.\r\nDry on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:23:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9137,9137,'en','Rainbow cupcakes','Make someone smile with these cheery rainbow cupcakes. The striped sponge and buttercream sprinkle topping are sure to brighten anyone’s day','["110g unsalted butter, softened","½ tsp vanilla extract","110g caster sugar","2 large eggs","110g self-raising flour","red, blue and yellow gel food colouring","sprinkles (optional)","150g butter, softened","300g icing sugar","3 tbsp milk"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and fill a cupcake tray with 10 cases.","Beat the butter, vanilla and caster sugar together with an electric whisk until pale and fluffy. Gradually whisk in the eggs, scraping down the sides of the bowl after each addition.","Mix in the flour and a pinch of salt until just combined. Divide into five bowls and colour each a different shade with a drop of food colouring. We chose red, yellow, green, blue and purple.","Starting with the end of the rainbow (in our case purple), evenly spread 1 tsp of the mixture into each cupcake case using a piping bag or the back of a teaspoon. Top with 1 tsp of the next colour and spread – be careful not to mix the colours together whilst bringing the mix all the way to the edge of the case. Repeat until all the colours are used up and you’re left with an even layer of red on the top.","Bake for 15 mins, until a skewer inserted into the middle of each cake comes out clean. Leave to cool completely on a wire rack.","To make the buttercream, beat the butter until very soft. Add the icing sugar, vanilla extract and a pinch of salt and whisk together until smooth (start off slowly to avoid an icing sugar cloud). Beat in the milk until combined.","Pipe the buttercream on top of the cupcakes using a circular nozzle, or spread on with a palette knife. Top with sprinkles, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9138,9138,'en','Butterfly cupcakes','These pretty cupcakes are perfect for a special occasion. The flavoured syrup help the cakes stay moist, so you can make them a day ahead and decorate the next day','["300g golden caster sugar","4 eggs","300g butter, melted and cooled","300g self-raising flour","300g golden caster sugar","1 tbsp dried lavender flowers (see tip)","400g butter, softened","550g icing sugar","3 food colouring gels (we used purple, yellow and pink)","400g white chocolate","3 food colouring gels (we used purple, yellow and pink)","2 chocolate biscuits, crushed (we used Oreos but removed the white filling)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line two 12-hole cupcake tins with paper muffin cases. Put all the cake ingredients in a large bowl and whisk with an electric whisk for 3-4 mins or until pale and light. Divide the mixture evenly among the 24 cases and bake for 20 mins or until a skewer inserted into the centre of a cake comes out clean. Leave to cool on a wire rack.","While the cupcakes bake, make the syrup. Put the sugar, lavender and 300ml water in a medium pan over a low heat. Bring gradually to the boil, cook for 2 mins, then turn off the heat and leave to infuse. When cold, strain through a sieve into a small jug.","To make the icing, put the butter, icing sugar and 100ml of the syrup in a large bowl. Mix with a wooden spoon, then switch to an electric whisk and whisk until smooth and fluffy. Divide the mixture between three bowls. Add a tiny dot of food colouring gel to each bowl to make three different colours of buttercream – stir to mix, then transfer half of each colour to disposable piping bags.","Use a cocktail stick to poke a few little holes in the top of the cupcakes, then drizzle each with 1 tsp of the syrup. Put 1 heaped tsp of icing onto each cake (do eight of each colour) and swirl it round with the back of the spoon to completely cover the top. Next, use the matching piping bag to pipe a straight line about 2-3 cm long across the middle of each cake.","To make the wings, melt the white chocolate in a heatproof bowl over a pan of simmering water. Divide into three smaller bowls and add the same gel colours as before. Cut 8cm squares of baking parchment and, using a pen, draw a pair of butterfly wings on each square so that the design shows through on the other side or, if you prefer, trace the design below. Turn the paper over and, using the line as a guide, paint on the melted chocolate. Sprinkle crushed biscuits on the edges to create patterns, then leave to set. Once set, gently push the wings into the cupcakes at a 45-degree angle."]','2026-01-10 12:23:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9139,9139,'en','Moon cycle cupcakes','Budding star gazers, bake your way through the moon cycle with our tasty chocolate cupcakes. Arrange them in the right order to make a gorgeous display and test your science skills','["175g softened unsalted butter","175g caster sugar","3 large eggs","150g self-raising flour","50g cocoa powder","4 tbsp icing sugar","100g blue ready-made fondant icing","100g black ready-made fondant icing","140g white fondant icing","gold edible glitter (optional)"]','["Line a 12-hole muffin tin with 12 dark brown or black muffin cases. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put all the ingredients in a large bowl and using a hand-held electric whisk, beat for 2-3 minutes, until fluffy.","Divide the mixture between the muffin cases, then bake for 20 -25 minutes, until risen and springy to the touch – ask an adult to help you with this bit. When the cakes are cooked, take them out of the oven and transfer to a wire rack to cool completely – ask an adult to help you with this bit too. You will need 8 of the cakes to make a full cycle of the moon. If you need to, you can trim the tops of the cakes so that they are flat.","Mix 3 tbsp of the icing sugar with enough water to make a spreadable paste and set aside. Knead the blue and black fondant icing together until the colours are almost blended together, leaving a few streaks of blue running through.","Dust a work surface with a little icing sugar and roll out the coloured icing so that it''s large enough to cut out 12 x 7cm rounds. Spread a little smear of the icing sugar paste on top of each cake and stick an icing round on top.","Roll out the white icing to about 0.5cm thick. Using a small sharp knife, cut out 2 thin crescent shapes to make the waxing and waning crescent. Using a 7cm cutter, cut out 4 rounds. Cut one round in half to make the first and third quarter of the moon. Leave one round as it is to make the full moon and cut a small crescent away from the remaining 2 rounds, to make the waxing and waning gibbous moon. Using a little of the icing paste, stick each shape on to a cake. Leave one cake with nothing on – this will be the new moon. Use a star-shaped cutter to decorate the 4 cupcakes not included in the cycle with the leftover white icing.","Using a pastry brush, apply a tiny bit of water over the darker icing then sprinkle a little glitter over the top – the water helps it stick in place. Have fun arranging your cakes in a lunar cycle!"]','2026-01-10 12:23:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9140,9140,'en','Easter nest coconut & white chocolate cupcakes','Try saying no to these little sponges with frosting and clever bird decoration made with chocolate eggs','["3 medium eggs, beaten","100ml milk","1 tsp vanilla extract","175g golden caster sugar","100g desiccated coconut","200g self-raising flour","50g melted butter","100g white chocolate, melted","100g white chocolate, melted","200g unsalted butter, at room temperature","225g icing sugar, sifted","about 25g shredded coconut","36 mini eggs","orange or yellow icing for beaks","black writing icing tube"]','["Line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper cases and heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Whisk together the eggs, milk and vanilla. Whizz the sugar with the coconut in a food processor until very finely ground. Tip into a big mixing bowl with the flour and mix. Add the whisked egg mixture, melted butter and chocolate, then stir together until smooth.","Spoon into the cases (they will be quite full) and bake for 18-20 mins on a middle shelf until golden and a skewer poked into the middle comes out clean. Cool the cakes on a wire rack (keep the oven on).","Spread the shredded coconut on a baking tray and put in the oven for about 10 mins to lightly toast – stir halfway through. Cool. To make the frosting, put the chocolate, butter and icing sugar in a big bowl and beat together with an electric whisk until just combined.","Spread some of the frosting generously over the top of the cooled cakes – you don’t have to go right to the edges. Once you’ve done all 12, scrape the rest of the icing into a piping bag fitted with a 1-2cm nozzle, and pipe a ring around the top edge to make a nest. Roll in the cooled coconut to roughly coat.","Turn each mini egg into a baby chick by moulding little beaks from the orange or yellow icing and sticking on with a little runny black icing when you add the eyes. Stick baby chicks into the middle of each cake and enjoy."]','2026-01-10 12:23:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9141,9141,'en','Hot cross bun cupcakes','These cakes have all the fruit and spice of the traditional bun but are quicker to make. Finish with spiced cream cheese frosting crosses','["1 tbsp lemon juice","100ml whole milk","175g unsalted butter","175g self-raising flour","½  tsp baking powder","175g light soft brown sugar","2 tsp mixed spice","100g ground almonds","3 large eggs, beaten, at room temperature","zest ¾ orange","100g raisins, sultanas or a mix of both","1 medium eating apple, peeled then grated","1 tbsp apricot jam, warmed with a splash of water","zest ¼ orange","50g full-fat cream cheese","50g icing sugar","25g butter, softened","¼ tsp mixed spice"]','["Combine the lemon juice and milk in a large jug, and set aside for 5 mins. Meanwhile, heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and melt the butter in a saucepan. Use a little of the butter to grease a 12-hole muffin tin.","Put the flour, baking powder, sugar, spice, almonds and a pinch of salt into a large bowl, then sift through it with your fingers to squash any lumps of sugar. Beat the eggs, zest and melted butter into the thickened milk. Pour this into the dry ingredients, then beat with a balloon whisk until even. Stir in the dried fruit and apple, scoop mix into the tin (the holes will be full; see tip below), then bake for 18-20 mins until golden and well risen. Cool for 10 mins in the tin, then remove to a rack.","When the buns are cold, cut a cross from the top of each one using a serrated knife, then brush the tops with the apricot jam. For the spiced buttercream, beat everything together until creamy and pale. Pipe the buttercream into the crosses. Alternatively, simply glaze the buns and pipe crosses across the tops."]','2026-01-10 12:23:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9142,9142,'en','Celebration cupcakes','Make these individual party sponges ahead then follow our suggestions for decorating and icing','["3 large eggs","200g natural yogurt","2 tsp vanilla extract","250g caster sugar","280g self-raising flour","140g ground almonds","250g pack butter, softened","250g pack butter, softened","300g icing sugar, sifted, plus extra for rolling","500g pack ready-to-roll icing, for the tops","few different food colourings","extra icing and decorations of your choice (see method section for ideas)"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Line 2 x 12-hole muffin tins with paper cases. Put the eggs, yogurt, vanilla, sugar, flour, almonds and butter in your largest mixing bowl and beat until smooth and lump-free. Divide between the paper cases and bake for 25-30 mins (swapping the trays after 15 mins if you have to use 2 shelves) until a skewer poked into the centre of the cakes comes out clean.Cool on a wire rack. They can be frozen for up to 1 month or kept in an airtight container overnight.","To decorate, beat the butter and icing sugar together until smooth and light. Use a teaspoon to spoon a heaped dollop into the centre of each cake or, for speed, spoon into a food bag, cut about 2cm off the corner and pipe a dollop onto each.","Divide the icing into as many colours as you want – plus a piece left to be white, or to brush with glitter, if you like. Knead a little colouring into each piece until you have a good colour, then roll out onto a surface lightly dusted with icing sugar. Use a 6.5cm fluted cutter to stamp out rounds and press down onto the icing to flatten it a bit. Repeat with the other colours to cover all the cakes. Now decorate as you wish, or see our ideas, below."]','2026-01-10 12:23:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9143,9143,'en','Strawberry & polenta cupcakes','These cupcakes are little portions of perfection and are great to share with friends','["140g unsalted butter, softened","140g golden caster sugar","grated zest ½ lemon","85g polenta","3 eggs, beaten","140g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tbsp milk","140g strawberries, hulled and chopped into chunks","140g icing sugar","3 strawberries, hulled and roughly chopped, plus 6 halved, for decoration","lemon juice"]','["Line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper cases and heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. In a large bowl, cream together the butter, sugar and lemon zest until pale and fluffy. Add the polenta and continue to whisk until combined. Beat in the eggs, a little at a time.","Sift in flour and baking powder, then fold in quickly with a large spoon or spatula until you have a thick batter (the mixture may look lumpy because of the polenta). Stir in the milk to loosen, then gently fold in the chopped strawberries. Divide the mixture between the paper cases, then bake for 20 mins or until golden, risen and springy to touch. Cool for a few mins, then place the cakes on a wire rack to cool completely. The cakes can now be stored in an airtight container for up to two days.","Carefully peel the cases off the cakes. Sift the icing sugar into a large bowl. Place the chopped strawberries in a bowl with 1 tsp lemon juice and mash with a fork until pulpy. Push through a sieve over the icing sugar (you only need a few drops of juice to colour the icing a rosy pink). Stir in more lemon juice, a dribble at a time, until you have a thick yet fluid paste. Dip the top of each cake into the icing, then top immediately with a strawberry half. Leave to set, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9144,9144,'en','Devil’s food cupcakes','These sponges with a cream cheese topping are light yet wonderfully chocolatey','["50g cocoa powder","2 large eggs, at room temperature","1 tsp vanilla extract","175g plain flour","½  tsp salt","½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","225g caster sugar","175g unsalted butter, softened","4 tbsp unsalted butter, softened","200g cream cheese, softened","1 tsp vanilla","400g icing sugar, sifted","small handful silver balls or sprinkles, for decoration"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line 2 muffin tins with 16 paper muffin cases. Whisk together 175ml boiling water with the cocoa powder in a medium-sized bowl until smooth. Allow the mixture to cool until it reaches room temperature (put it in the freezer to speed it up), then whisk it with the eggs and vanilla.","In an electric mixer, combine the flour, salt, bicarbonate of soda and sugar. Mix on a low speed for 30 secs, then add one-third of the cocoa liquid and softened butter. Keep mixing on a low speed, then turn up to medium high and beat for 1 min. Add the remaining liquid in 3 batches, beating each one\r\nfor 30 secs. Scrape the sides and bottom of the bowl with a spatula and mix one more time. Fill the cupcake liners three-quarters full and bake for 20 mins, then remove and let them cool in the tin.","To make the frosting, beat the butter and cream cheese for 2-3 mins until creamy, then add the vanilla. While still mixing, pour in the sugar in 4 batches, beating each time to fully combine. Beat for a further min, then chill for 2 hrs.","Swirl the frosting over the cooled cupcakes and decorate with silver balls or whatever you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9145,9145,'en','Pumpkin passion cupcakes','Use grated pumpkin or butternut squash for these gorgeous, spiced cupcakes','["175ml sunflower oil","175g light muscovado sugar","3 large eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g coarsely grated pumpkin or butternut squash flesh","100g sultanas","grated zest 1 orange","2 tsp ground cinnamon","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","200g tub full-fat cream cheese","85g icing sugar","toasted chopped pecans to decorate (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLine a 12-hole muffin tray with paper\r\ncases. Pour the oil into a large bowl and\r\nadd the sugar, eggs and vanilla. Beat\r\ntogether, then add the grated pumpkin,\r\nsultanas and orange zest.","Stir in the cinnamon, flour and\r\nbicarbonate of soda, the mixture will be\r\nquite wet. Spoon into the cases. Bake\r\nfor 25 mins until firm and springy to the\r\ntouch and a skewer inserted in the\r\ncentre of a cupcake comes out clean.\r\nCool completely on a wire rack. At this\r\nstage you can freeze the cakes for 4 months.","To make the frosting, beat the cream\r\ncheese and sugar together until smooth\r\nthen spread on top of the cupcakes.\r\nLeave plain or decorate with toasted\r\npecans. Store in the fridge, but return to\r\nroom temperature to serve for the best\r\nflavour and texture."]','2026-01-10 12:23:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9147,9147,'en','Chocolate fudge cupcakes','These bright and fun cupcakes are perfect for kids'' parties','["200g butter","200g plain chocolate, under 70% cocoa solids is fine","200g light, soft brown sugar","2 eggs, beaten","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g self-raising flour","Smarties, sweets and sprinkles, to decorate","200g plain chocolate","100ml double cream, not fridge-cold","50g icing sugar"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3\r\nand line a 12-hole muffin tin with cases.\r\nGently melt the butter, chocolate, sugar\r\nand 100ml hot water together in a large\r\nsaucepan, stirring occasionally, then set\r\naside to cool a little while you weigh the\r\nother ingredients.","Stir the eggs and vanilla into the\r\nchocolate mixture. Put the flour into\r\na large mixing bowl, then stir in the\r\nchocolate mixture until smooth. Spoon\r\ninto cases until just over three-quarters\r\nfull (you may have a little mixture leftover),\r\nthen set aside for 5 mins before putting\r\non a low shelf in the oven and baking for\r\n20-22 mins. Leave to cool.","For the icing, melt the chocolate in a\r\nheatproof bowl over a pan of barely\r\nsimmering water. Once melted, turn off\r\nthe heat, stir in the double cream and sift\r\nin the icing sugar. When spreadable, top\r\neach cake with some and decorate with\r\nyour favourite sprinkles and sweets."]','2026-01-10 12:23:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9148,9148,'en','Coffee cream & walnut cupcakes','Retro favourite coffee and walnut cake in a cupcake version, with a choice of luxurious mascarpone topping or classic buttercream','["100g butter, well softened","100g light muscovado sugar","100g self-raising flour","2 large eggs","2 tsp instant coffee, mixed with 100ml/3½fl oz boiling water, then cooled","25g walnut halves, chopped, plus 12 more for the tops","200ml tub mascarpone (you''ll find this with the soft cheeses)","2 tbsp light muscovado sugar"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4 and\r\nmake sure there’s a shelf ready in the middle.\r\nLine a 12-hole bun tin with fairy cake cases.\r\nBeat the butter, sugar, flour and eggs with\r\n4 tsp of the coffee and a pinch of salt until\r\ncreamy. Stir in the chopped walnuts.","Spoon the mix into the cases (start by\r\nadding 1 heaped tsp to each, then go back\r\nand top them up – that way they should all\r\nbe of equal size), then bake for 18-20 mins\r\nuntil light golden and springy. Cool for a few\r\nmins in the tin, then lift the cakes out and\r\ncool completely on a rack.","Put the mascarpone, 3 tsp more of the\r\ncoffee and the sugar into a large bowl, then\r\nbeat together. Spread a dollop of the coffee\r\ncream onto the top of each cake, then finish\r\nwith a walnut half. The cakes are best if\r\nthey’re iced fairly near the time of eating,\r\nso if you’re making ahead, whip up the\r\nmascarpone mix, keep in the fridge, beat\r\nit again, then spoon onto the cakes just\r\nbefore serving. Un-iced cakes will keep up\r\nto 2 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9149,9149,'en','Pistachio cupcakes','Turn any gathering into a special occasion with these glamorous cupcakes for grown-ups','["100g pistachios","140g golden caster sugar","140g butter, very soft","2 eggs","140g self-raising flour","5 tbsp milk","edible glitter, to decorate","250g icing sugar, sifted","mint green food colouring"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3 and\r\nline a 12-hole muffin tin with cases. Put\r\n85g pistachios into a food processor with\r\nabout half the sugar, then whizz until very\r\nfinely chopped. Tip into a large mixing\r\nbowl with the remaining sugar, butter,\r\neggs, flour and milk and beat until smooth.\r\nDivide between cases, then bake on a low\r\nshelf for 22-25 mins until a skewer poked\r\nin comes out clean. Cool on a wire rack.","For the icing, mix just enough water\r\ninto the icing sugar to get a very thick but\r\nstill runny icing – just add 1 tbsp of water\r\nat a time. Stir in enough food colouring\r\nto give a pretty, pale green colour. If any\r\ncakes poke above the top of the cases,\r\ntrim with a small knife, or scoop out with\r\na teaspoon – being very careful not to\r\nrelease any of the case from the sides of\r\nthe cake. Put a generous spoonful of icing\r\non each cake and let it gently spread to\r\ncover. Chop the remaining pistachios and\r\nscatter these over with a pinch of edible\r\nglitter. Set, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9150,9150,'en','Christmas cupcakes','Have fun with the kids over the Christmas holidays making and decorating these easy cakes','["200g dark muscovado sugar","175g butter, chopped","700g luxury mixed dried fruits","50g glacé cherries","2 tsp grated fresh root ginger","zest and juice 1 orange","100ml dark rum, brandy or orange juice","85g/3oz pecan nuts, roughly chopped","3 large eggs, beaten","85g ground almonds","200g plain flour","½ tsp baking powder","1 tsp mixed spice","1 tsp cinnamon","400g pack ready-rolled marzipan (we used Dr Oetker)","4 tbsp warm apricot jam or shredless marmalade","500g pack fondant icing sugar","icing sugar, for dusting","6 gold and 6 silver muffin cases","6 gold and 6 silver sugared almonds","snowflake sprinkles"]','["Tip the sugar, butter, dried fruit, whole\r\ncherries, ginger, orange zest and juice\r\ninto a large pan. Pour over the rum,\r\nbrandy or juice, then put on the heat and\r\nslowly bring to the boil, stirring frequently\r\nto melt the butter. Reduce the heat and\r\nbubble gently, uncovered for 10 mins,\r\nstirring every now and again to make sure\r\nthe mixture doesn’t catch on the bottom\r\nof the pan. Set aside for 30 mins to cool.","Stir the nuts, eggs and ground almonds\r\ninto the fruit, then sift in the flour, baking\r\npowder and spices. Stir everything\r\ntogether gently but thoroughly. Your\r\nbatter is ready.","Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2.\r\nScoop the cake mix into 12 deep muffin\r\ncases (an ice-cream scoop works well),\r\nthen level tops with a spoon dipped in hot\r\nwater. Bake for 35-45 mins until golden\r\nand just firm to touch. A skewer inserted\r\nshould come out clean. Cool on a wire rack.","Unravel the marzipan onto a work\r\nsurface lightly dusted with icing sugar.\r\nStamp out 12 rounds, 6cm across. Brush\r\nthe cake tops with apricot jam, top with\r\na marzipan round and press down lightly.","Make up the fondant icing to a\r\nspreading consistency, then swirl on top\r\nof each cupcake. Decorate with sugared\r\nalmonds and snowflakes, then leave to\r\nset. Will keep in a tin for 3 weeks."]','2026-01-10 12:23:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9151,9151,'en','Warm raspberry cupcakes with orange sugar drizzle','These wonderful tangy treats taste perfect with a spoonful of crème fraîche','["200g self-raising flour","2 tsp baking powder","200g unsalted butter, softened","4 eggs","200g caster sugar","3 tbsp milk","50g ground almonds","zest of 1 medium orange","150g punnet raspberries, lightly crushed, plus extra to decorate","juice of 1 medium orange","4 tbsp caster sugar"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper muffin cases. Tip the first 8 ingredients into a large bowl and beat with electric whisk until smooth. Fold the crushed raspberries through the batter.","Divide the batter between the cases (they should be about half full) and bake for 20-25 mins or until golden and just firm. Make the topping by mixing together the orange juice and sugar until well blended.","Remove the cupcakes from the oven and allow to cool a little. Drizzle each with the orange and sugar crust mix. Top with the extra raspberries to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9152,9152,'en','Cranberry ripple cheese-cupcakes','These one-portion puds have a sharp ripple of cranberry to cut through the sweetness','["250g digestive biscuits","100g butter, melted","600g soft cheese","2 tbsp plain flour","175g caster sugar","dash vanilla extract","2 eggs, plus 1 yolk","400g cranberries, fresh or frozen","100g icing sugar, plus extra for dusting"]','["First make the ripple by putting the\r\ncranberries and icing sugar into a shallow\r\npan and cooking down over a mediumhigh\r\nheat for 10 mins until the berries\r\ncollapse into a thick and sticky sauce.\r\nTurn off the heat and leave to cool.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLine a 12-hole muffin tin with 12 muffin\r\ncases. Crush the biscuits in a plastic bag\r\nor whizz in a food processor, then mix\r\nwith the melted butter. Divide between\r\nthe muffin cases and press down with\r\nyour fingers. In a separate bowl, mix the\r\nsoft cheese with the flour, sugar and\r\nvanilla extract, then gradually beat in the\r\neggs and yolk until smooth. Ripple the\r\nberry mix through the cheese, being\r\ncareful not to over-mix. Spoon the mix\r\ninto the cases and smooth the tops with\r\nthe back of the spoon. Bake for 30 mins,\r\nleave to cool, then chill in the fridge until\r\ncompletely cold.","To serve, peel the cases off the cakes,\r\nif you like, then dust with icing sugar.\r\nServe piled up on a nice dish for\r\neveryone to help themselves."]','2026-01-10 12:23:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9153,9153,'en','Carrot & cream cheese cupcakes','This crowd-pleasing recipe turns the ultimate afternoon-tea favourite into delightful cupcakes','["175g brown muscovado sugar","100g wholemeal self-raising flour","100g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 tsp mixed spice","zest 1 orange","2 eggs","150ml sunflower oil","200g carrots, grated","orange coloured sprinkles, to decorate","100g butter, softened","300g soft cheese","100g icing sugar, sifted","1 tsp vanilla extract"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and\r\nline a 12-hole muffin tin with cases. In\r\na large mixing bowl, mix the sugar, flours,\r\nbicarbonate of soda, mixed spice and\r\norange zest. Whisk together the eggs\r\nand oil, then stir into the dry ingredients\r\nwith the grated carrot. Divide the mixture\r\nbetween cases and bake for 20-22 mins\r\nuntil a skewer poked in comes out clean.\r\nCool on a wire rack before icing.","For the icing, beat the butter until really\r\nsoft, then beat in the soft cheese, icing\r\nsugar and vanilla. Use a palette or cutlery\r\nknife to swirl the icing on top of the\r\ncakes, then sprinkle with decorations."]','2026-01-10 12:23:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9154,9154,'en','Easy chocolate cupcakes','These light cakes are perfect for freezing – they just need a quick blast in the microwave to bring them back to life','["300g dark chocolate, broken into chunks - don''t use one with a high cocoa content","200g self-raising flour","200g light muscovado sugar, plus 3 tbsp extra","6 tbsp cocoa","150ml sunflower oil, plus a little extra for greasing","284ml pot soured cream","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4\r\nand line a 10-hole muffin tin with paper\r\ncases. Whizz the chocolate into small\r\npieces in a food processor. In the\r\nlargest mixing bowl you have, tip\r\nin the flour, sugar, cocoa, oil, 100ml\r\nsoured cream, eggs, vanilla and 100ml\r\nwater. Whisk everything together with\r\nelectric beaters until smooth, then\r\nquickly stir in 100g of the whizzed-up\r\nchocolate bits. Divide between the\r\n10 cases, then bake for 20 mins until\r\na skewer inserted comes out clean\r\n(make sure you don’t poke it into a\r\nchocolate chip bit). Cool on a wire rack.","To make the icing, put the remaining\r\nchocolate bits, soured cream and 3 tbsp\r\nsugar in a small saucepan. Heat gently,\r\nstirring, until the chocolate is melted\r\nand you have a smooth icing. Chill in\r\nthe fridge until firm enough to swirl\r\non top of the muffins, then tuck in."]','2026-01-10 12:23:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9155,9155,'en','Lemon meringue cupcakes','These mini meringues will bring a touch of zing to your party, and can be made one day ahead for extra ease','["200g caster sugar","100g softened butter","2 eggs, plus 2 egg whites","zest 2 lemons, plus 2-3 tbsp lemon juice","100g self-raising flour","4 tbsp lemon curd"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nBeat half the sugar and all the butter until\r\npale, then add whole eggs, one by one,\r\nbeating in well each time. Stir in the zest\r\nand a squeeze of lemon juice, then fold in\r\nflour. Check the batter’s consistency; it\r\nshould softly drop off the end of a spoon.\r\nAdd more lemon juice if it’s a bit stiff.","Line a 12-hole bun tin with cake cases\r\nand put 1 large tbsp mix in each. Smooth\r\nthen make a little dip in the centre. Spoon\r\n1 tsp lemon curd into each dip and cover\r\nwith 1 tbsp cake mix. Bake for 10 mins.","Meanwhile, place the egg whites into\r\na clean bowl, whisk until stiff peaks form,\r\nthen whisk in the rest of the sugar a tbsp\r\nat a time. Keep whisking until the mixture\r\nlooks glossy and has thickened a little,\r\nlike shaving foam. Spoon the mixture into\r\na freezer bag and snip off the end to\r\nleave a hole with a 1.5cm diameter.","Take the cakes out of the oven – tops\r\nshould be very pale and just firm – then\r\npipe meringue all over the cakes. Return\r\nto the oven for 10-15 mins until the cakes\r\nare cooked through and meringue lightly\r\nbrowned. Can be made 1 day ahead."]','2026-01-10 12:23:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9156,9156,'en','Little Louise cupcakes','These cupcakes bring sweet bursts of joy with every bite, perfect for a celebration or party','["175g butter, softened","350g golden or white caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","5 eggs, 4 separated","175g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","150ml milk","12 tsp raspberry jam - use a firm jam, we used Waitrose Essential Raspberry Jam","85g desiccated coconut"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4\r\nand line a 12-hole muffin tin with cases.\r\nIn a large mixing bowl beat together the\r\nbutter, 175g of the sugar and the vanilla\r\nextract until light and fluffy. Beat in the\r\nwhole egg, followed by the 4 yolks,\r\nbefore briefly beating in the flour, baking\r\npowder and milk until smooth. Divide\r\ntwo-thirds of the mix evenly between\r\nthe cases, then top the centre of each\r\nwith 1 tsp jam. Divide remaining cake\r\nmix over the top, using a wet finger to\r\nsmooth it in place so no jam is visible.\r\nBake for 18-22 mins until a skewer poked\r\ninto the centre comes out clean. Wait\r\nuntil cool enough to handle, then transfer\r\nthe cakes to a flat baking sheet.","Lower oven to 110C/90C fan/gas ¼.\r\nUsing a large, clean bowl, beat the 4 egg\r\nwhites until stiff, then continue whisking\r\nwhile you gradually add the remaining\r\n175g sugar. Beat until thick and shiny,\r\nthen fold in the coconut and use\r\nspoonfuls of the mixture to top each\r\ncake. Bake for 30-35 mins until the\r\noutside of the meringue is crisp, then\r\ncool before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9158,9158,'en','Spinach savoury muffins','Make these super green muffins as a first weaning food. Made with spinach, cheese and wholemeal flour, they’re a good first food for babies from six months','["200g fresh spinach","100g cheddar , grated","1 tbsp dried thyme","2 eggs","150ml Greek yogurt","2-3 tbsp milk","150g plain flour","150g wholemeal flour","3 tsp baking powder","butter , for the tin"]','["Set the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the spinach in a food processor and blitz until shredded (not puréed). Put in a bowl along with the grated cheese and dried thyme.","Crack the eggs into a bowl, and mix along with the yogurt. Mix in 2 tbsp milk, adding another tablespoon if needed.","Sieve the flour and baking powder over the bowl, then mix well to combine.","Butter a muffin tin, then spoon in the batter and bake for 20-25 mins. Cool."]','2026-01-10 12:23:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9159,9159,'en','Strawberry & chocolate focaccia','Showcase sweet Morrisons Market Street strawberries in this easy bake – focaccia doesn’t always need to be savoury','["2 tbsp caster sugar","7g sachet fast-action yeast","500g strong white bread flour , plus extra to dust","1½ tsp fine sea salt","5 tbsp olive oil","100g dark chocolate , roughly chopped","150g Morrisons Market Street strawberries , halved","1½ tbsp demerara sugar"]','["Tip the sugar into a bowl and pour in 350ml warm water. Stir well to dissolve the sugar, then mix in the yeast. Add the flour, salt, 2 tbsp of the olive oil and the chocolate. Stir well to bring together into a ball and tip out onto a lightly floured work surface and knead for 5-10 mins until elastic, soft and less sticky. Transfer to a clean bowl, cover and set aside to rise in a warm place for 1-2 hrs, or until doubled in size.","Line a 25 x 35cm baking tin with baking parchment and drizzle 1 tbsp of the oil over the base. Gently tip the focaccia into the prepared tin, stretching it slightly to get into the sides, then cover and set aside in a warm spot for 30 mins-1 hr until risen and puffy.","Heat the oven to 220C/200C fan/ gas 7. Drizzle over the remaining olive oil then, using your hands, dimple the dough all over. Scatter over the strawberries, pressing them lightly into the dimples. Sprinkle over the demerara sugar and bake for 20-25 mins until golden all over. Remove and set aside until just warm before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9160,9160,'en','Blueberry & almond galette','Give past-their-best blueberries a chance to shine in this almond galette. Serve cut into wedges with vanilla ice cream for an easy family dessert','["400g blueberries","2 tbsp cornflour","1 lemon , juiced","½ tsp ground cinnamon","50g golden caster sugar","2 tbsp ground almonds","2 tbsp flaked almonds","1 egg , beaten","1½ tbsp demerara sugar","vanilla ice cream , to serve","200g plain flour , plus extra for dusting","2 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","150g butter , cut into cubes","3-4 tbsp milk"]','["To make the pastry, tip the flour, sugar, vanilla, butter and a pinch of salt into a food processor. Blitz until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs, then pour in 3 tbsp milk and pulse until it begins to come together, adding a little more milk if needed. Bring together into a ball, then pat out into a disc. Wrap well and chill for 30 mins. Will keep chilled for up to three days.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and put a large baking sheet inside to heat up. Lightly dust a clean work surface with flour and roll out the pastry until it measures 30cm in circumference. Transfer to a sheet of baking parchment. Tip the blueberries, cornflour, lemon juice, cinnamon and sugar into a bowl, and stir well.","Sprinkle the ground almonds onto the base of the pastry, leaving a 4cm border, then pour the blueberry mixture on top and spread it out. Scatter over the flaked almonds then fold in the edge of the pastry, overlapping the filling slightly. Brush some egg over the edge and sprinkle over the demerara sugar.","Carefully slide the galette onto the hot baking sheet and bake for 25-30 mins until the pastry is golden. Leave to set and cool on the tray until warm. Serve cut into wedges with vanilla ice cream."]','2026-01-10 12:23:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9161,9161,'en','Jamaican ginger cake','Bake this sticky, spicy cake using ingredients that historically thrived in Jamaica – best enjoyed with an afternoon cup of tea','["120g unsalted butter , softened, plus extra for the tin","285g plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp baking powder","2 tsp mixed spice","1 tbsp ground ginger","200g light brown soft sugar","2 eggs","2 tsp vanilla extract","80ml stem ginger syrup (from a jar of stem ginger), plus extra for the top","50ml honey","110ml coconut milk"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 900g (2lb) loaf tin with baking parchment. Mix the flour, bicarb, baking powder, mixed spice, ginger and ½ tsp fine salt in a bowl.","In a separate bowl, tip in the butter and sugar and beat together using an electric whisk, until smooth and fluffy, 3-5 mins. Add the eggs, vanilla, stem ginger syrup, honey and coconut milk and beat until evenly mixed.","Tip in the dry ingredients and gently fold the batter until no streaks of flour remain, taking care not to overmix. Pour the batter into the prepared tin and bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 45-55 mins, until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Remove and brush over a little stem ginger syrup. Leave in the tin until completely cooled, then serve in slices. Will keep in an airtight container for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:23:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9162,9162,'en','Chocolate chip & pecan butternut bread','Love banana bread? You’ll love this butternut bread, which is really more of a cake. The squash provides sweetness while keeping the texture dense and squidgy','["250g butternut squash","2 eggs","125ml vegetable or sunflower oil","200g light brown soft sugar","100ml milk","2 tsp vanilla extract","¼ tsp ground nutmeg","2 tsp ground cinnamon","225g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","100g dark chocolate , chopped","75g pecans , roughly chopped"]','["Cut the squash into 2cm cubes, tip into a heatproof bowl, then add 2 tbsp water, cover with a heatproof plate or lid, and microwave on high for 5-8 mins until soft. (Or, roast or air-fry for 15-20 mins at 200C/180C fan/gas 6.) Leave to cool.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a 900g loaf tin with baking parchment. Mash the squash using a fork, then add the eggs, oil, sugar, milk, vanilla extract, spices and ½ tsp salt. Mix until smooth, then add the flour and baking powder. Mix again until smooth and no pockets of flour remain.","Stir through most of the chopped chocolate and pecans. Scrape the batter into the prepared tin and scatter over the remaining chocolate and pecans.","Bake in the centre of the oven for 50 mins until risen and golden, and a skewer inserted into the centre of the cake comes out clean. If any wet batter clings to the skewer, return to the oven for another 5 mins, then check again. Once cooked, leave to cool in the tin for 15 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely. Will keep in an airtight container at room temperature for up to five days, or frozen for up to three months."]','2026-01-10 12:23:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9163,9163,'en','Fork biscuits','Fill up your biscuit tin with these easy treats which take their name from the fork indent added before baking. Dip them in chocolate, if you like, for added indulgence','["100g salted butter , softened","50g caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","150g self-raising flour","100g dark chocolate , to top (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line a large baking tray with baking parchment. Tip the butter and sugar into a bowl and beat, using electric beaters or a stand mixer, for 3-5 mins, until really soft and creamy. Pour in the vanilla and beat for 20 seconds, until well incorporated. Add the flour and stir together using a spatula. Once almost mixed in, bring together with your hands.","Divide the dough into 18-20 balls, weighing roughly 15g each, and roll into balls. Put the balls on the prepared baking trays, well spaced apart. Using a fork dipped in water, gently press down to flatten the balls, and leave a fork indent. Bake for 12-15 mins, until pale golden around the edges. Leave to cool completely on the trays.","To cover the biscuits with chocolate, melt the chocolate in a heatproof bowl, set over a pan of gently simmering water. Line a baking tray with baking parchment. Once the biscuits have cooled, dip half of each biscuit into the chocolate, then carefully transfer to the rack to set."]','2026-01-10 12:23:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9164,9164,'en','Sticky ginger loaf cake','Enjoy a slice of sticky ginger cake with a cup of afternoon tea or take along to a coffee morning – it’s always a crowd-pleaser','["200g butter , plus extra for the tin","100g honey","100g black treacle","2 balls of stem ginger from a jar, chopped, plus 2 tbsp syrup","225ml milk","275g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp freshly grated nutmeg","1 tbsp ground ginger","1 egg"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line a 2-litre loaf tin. Put the butter, honey, treacle, chopped stem ginger and ginger syrup in a small pan over a low heat until the butter has melted. Set aside to cool for a few minutes, then pour in the milk and leave to cool for around 15 mins.","Siftthe flour, bicarb and spices into a large bowl, then pour in the milk mixture, stirring to combine. Beat in the egg, then tip the mixture into the prepared tin. Bake in the oven for 1 hr, or until the cake is cooked through and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 15 mins, then turn out to cool completely on awire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:23:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9165,9165,'en','Banana mug cake','Make this easy banana mug cake in the microwave for a quick dessert for one. Add chopped pecans or chocolate chips, if you like, and drizzle with maple syrup','["1 banana, peeled","1 egg, beaten","1 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","½ tsp vanilla extract","3 tbsp maple syrup, plus extra for drizzling (optional)","4 tbsp plain flour","½ tsp baking powder","1 tbsp chopped pecans or chocolate chips (optional)"]','["Cut 2 thin slices of banana from the centre of the fruit, set aside, thenmashthe rest.","Tip the mashed banana into a microwave-safe mug, then stir in the remaining ingredients, except the banana slices.Microwaveon high for 1 min 30 seconds-2 mins until cooked through and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Cool for 1 min, then top with the banana slices and drizzle over maple syrup, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9166,9166,'en','Sugared doughnuts','Evoke memories of days out at the beach with these seaside-style homemade doughnuts, with a sugary crisp outer and warm, fluffy middle – try them with dipping sauces','["2 eggs","300ml soured cream","400g self-raising flour , plus extra for dusting","1 lemon , zested (optional)","2 tbsp caster sugar , plus 75g for dusting","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","40g butter , cut into cubes and slightly softened","vegetable oil , for deep-frying"]','["Whiskthe eggs and soured cream together in a jug and set aside. Tip the flour, lemon zest (if using), 2 tbsp sugar, the bicarb and a pinch of salt into a medium bowl, stir briefly to combine, then rub in the butter using your fingertips until the mixture resembles coarse breadcrumbs. Pour in the soured cream mixture and bring together into a dough using a cutlery knife.","Turn the dough out onto a floured surface. Knead briefly until you have a cohesive dough with no dry streaks of flour. Lightly flour the top of the dough, then gently pat down until it’s about 2.5cm thick. Stamp out doughnuts using a 3.5cm round cutter, re-rolling the offcuts until you have about 40 doughnuts.","Fill a medium saucepan no more than a third full of oil. Heat over a low heat to 180C, or until a cube of bread dropped in sizzles and browns within 30 seconds. Tip the 75g sugar into a shallow bowl. Set aside.","Carefully lower the doughnuts into the hot oil and fry for 3-4 mins until golden and cooked through, gently moving them around using a fish slice or slotted spoon so they are evenly coloured. Transfer to awire rackset above a sheet of kitchen paper to drain, then, while still hot, toss in the bowl of sugar to coat. If you like, divide between paper bags before serving.Best served the day they’re made."]','2026-01-10 12:23:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9167,9167,'en','Oven-baked pork chops','Enjoy oven-baked pork chops cooked in a honey and wholegrain mustard glaze with new potatoes for a deliciously easy dinner, just add your favourite veg','["1kg new potatoes, halved","4 tbsp olive oil","6 garlic cloves, bashed","small handful of thyme","6 tbsp honey","6 tbsp wholegrain mustard","4 thick-cut bone-in pork chops (about 250g each)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Toss the potatoes, oil, garlic and thyme on a shallow roasting tray and mix will with your hands to coat in the oil. Season well. Roast for 25 mins until the potatoes are just turning tender when pierced with a knife.","Whiskthe honey and mustard together in a small bowl. Season thepork chopswith salt and pepper, then brush with half the marinade. Nestle into the potatoes on the tray, and bake for another 10 mins before turning the chops  and spooning over the remaining glaze. Continue to bake for 10 more mins until cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:23:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9168,9168,'en','Pepperoni pizza rolls','Rustle up these family-friendly pepperoni pizza rolls. You could speed things up if you like by using ready-made pizza dough and pizza sauce.','["450g strong white bread flour, plus extra for dusting","5g fast-action dried yeast","2 tsp olive oil, plus extra for proving","1 tbsp fine polenta or cornmeal","175g pizza sauce","100g grated mozzarella","75g pepperoni","small bunch of basil, chopped"]','["Put the flour and yeast in a large bowl. Add 1 tsp sugar and 1½ tsp salt, and mix to combine. Add 300ml tepid water and 2 tsp of the oil, and mix with your hands or the dough hook attachment of astand mixeruntil a dough forms. If making by hand, tip the dough onto a work surface and knead for 10 mins until the dough feels smooth and elastic, or knead using the mixer for 5 mins.","Clean and lightly oil the bowl, tip in the dough and leave to prove in a warm place for 2 hrs, or until roughlydoubled in size. You can also put it in the fridge overnight – just bring it up to room temperature before shaping.","Loosely line a 22cm cake tin or ovenproof frying pan with a disc of baking parchment and sprinkle 1 tsp of the polenta over the base. Scatter the remaining polenta over a work surface along with some flour (add more if it begins to stick) and tip the dough on top. Roll and stretch the dough into a rectangle, about 35 x 45cm. Spread the pizza sauce on top, then scatter over the cheese, pepperoni and basil. From the longer side, tightly roll up the. dough to make a sausage shape. Use asharp knifeto cut it into eight pieces, and arrange cut-side up in the tin or pan. Cover loosely and leave to prove for another 30 mins until the rolls look light and puffy.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Bake the rolls for 30-35 mins until golden brown and the cheese is oozing. Cool for 5 mins before serving.Best eaten within 24 hrs."]','2026-01-10 12:23:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9169,9169,'en','Ham, cheese & potato pie','Craving comfort food? Try this easy ham, cheese and potato pie, which you can make with just five ingredients. Make a family meal of it by serving with a green salad','["350g new potatoes","375g ready-rolled puff pastry","100g crème fraîche","50g thinly sliced ham","125g brie or camembert cheese, halved and sliced","green salad , to serve (optional)"]','["Boil the potatoes in salted water for 8-10 mins, until tender but still firm. Leave to cool, then slice.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Unroll the pastry with its baking parchment on abaking tray. Reserve 1 tbsp of the crème fraîche, then spread the rest over the pastry, leaving a 2cm border around the edge. Season. Layer the potatoes, ham and cheese over half of the pastry, seasoning the potatoes as you go.","Fold over the other half of the pastry and use a fork to seal the edges. Trim with aknifefor a neat finish – the pie should look like a big sausage roll. Mix a little water into the reserved crème fraîche, then brush all over the pastry. Make a few cuts along the length, then bake for 35-40 mins until golden. Leave to cool for 10 mins, then serve with a salad, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9170,9170,'en','Filo custard pie','Make our crowd-pleasing filo custard tart. A custard tart can be tricky to get right but this version is just as impressive but much easier to make','["250ml milk","150ml double cream","2 egg yolks (freeze the whites for another recipe)","50g white caster sugar","2 tbsp instant custard powder","40g icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","1 tsp ground cinnamon","40g butter, melted","5 large filo pastry sheets"]','["Pour the milk and cream into asaucepanover a low heat and warm until just simmering, then remove from the heat. Meanwhile, tip the egg yolks into a bowl, add the sugar and custard powder, andwhisktogether until smooth. Pour over the warm cream mixture, stir well, then pour back into the pan. Cook over a medium heat for about 5 mins, stirring constantly, until you have a thick custard. Cover the surface with baking parchment or wax wrap so it doesn’t form a skin.Will keep covered and chilled for up to three days.","To assemble the pie, mix the icing sugar and cinnamon together in a bowl and set aside. Brush a 22cm loose-bottomed cake tin with some of the butter. Unravel the filo pastry and drape a sheet into the cake tin with some overhang. Brush with more butter, and dust with a little of the cinnamon sugar. Repeat with another sheet of pastry, turning it by about 45 degrees over the first, then do the same again with the last three pastry sheets, always brushing with butter and dusting with the sugar. Spoon in and smooth over the custard filling, then pull the overhanging pastry up and towards the centre, scrunching it to enclose the filling. Drizzle with any remaining butter and dust with all but about 1 tbsp of the sugar mix.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the tin on a baking tray and bake for 30-35 mins until the pastry is crisp and golden brown. Leave to cool a little, then carefully remove from the tin and transfer to a serving plate. Leave to cool completely to room temperature.Will keep for up to a day, covered, at room temperature.Dust with a little icing sugar and cut into wedges to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9171,9171,'en','Seeded soda bread','Make our easy yeast-free, wholemeal loaf, which requires no kneading or proving. We’ve used vegan-friendly oat milk, but you can use ordinary milk if you prefer','["520g plain wholemeal flour, plus extra for dusting","50g four-seed mix (sunflower, pumpkin, sesame and golden flax seeds), plus extra for sprinkling","1½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","400ml fortified oat milk","2 tbsp lemon juice"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Mix the flour, seeds and bicarb in abowl, then mix together the milk and lemon juice in a small jug and pour it into the dry ingredients. Stir with a knife until the mixture comes together into a sticky dough.","Tip onto a lightly floured work surface and lightly shape into a ball with wet or floured hands, as it will be sticky to handle. Lift onto a floured baking tray, reshape if required, then sprinkle more seeds over the top and press them in lightly. Bake for 35-40 mins until firm and golden. Cool on awire rack, then wrap in foil until needed.Will keep chilled for up to four days, or frozen for up to a month."]','2026-01-10 12:23:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9172,9172,'en','Nduja lasagne','Update a classic lasagne with the help of nduja which brings extra richness to a family favourite. Enjoy with a fresh green salad on the side','["1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, finely chopped","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped or grated","2 tbsp sundried or regular tomato purée","500g beef mince","4 tbsp nduja","2 large tomatoes, chopped","400g can chopped tomatoes","500ml vegetable stock","1 basil sprig, leaves picked and torn","9 dried lasagne sheets","200g grated mozzarella or cheddar","125g ball mozzarella, torn","200g crème fraîche","250g mascarpone","50g grated parmesan, plus extra to serve"]','["Heat the olive oil in a large pan over a medium heat and fry the onions and garlic for 5-6 mins until slightly softened. Add the tomato purée and stir. Add the beef mince, breaking it up with the back of spoon, and brown for a few minutes. Stir in the nduja, fresh and canned tomatoes, and the stock. Season with salt, black pepper and 1 tsp sugar. Add the basil, then bring to a simmer and cook for 45 mins-1 hr until slightly reduced.","To make the white sauce, mix together the crème fraîche, mascarpone, parmesan and a good grinding of black pepper in a bowl.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/ gas 6. Spread a third of the beef ragu over the base of a rectangular baking dish (ours was 25 x 18cm), then layer in three lasagne sheets. Spoon on a third of the white sauce, then add a handful of grated mozzarella or cheddar. Repeat to make three layers of each, finishing with the remainder of the white sauce. Top with mozzarella and more grated parmesan, if you like.","Cover and bake for 45 mins, then uncover, reduce the oven temperature to 180C/160C fan/gas 4, and bake for 15-20 mins more until the cheese is bubbling and golden."]','2026-01-10 12:23:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9173,9173,'en','Plum upside-down cake','Enjoy our plum upside-down cake as a lovely treat with a cup of tea, or as a wonderful pudding served with a spoonful of custard or drizzle of double cream','["150ml sunflower oil, plus extra for the tin","50g butter, softened","300g light brown soft sugar","6 plums, stoned and cut into 8 wedges","284ml pot buttermilk","1 tsp vanilla extract","4 eggs","325g self-raising flour","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil and line the base of a deep 20cm springform cake tin. Combine the butter with 50g of the light brown soft sugar and spread onto the base of the lined tin. Arrange the plum wedges on top in concentric circles.","Tip the buttermilk, vanilla, oil, remaining sugar and eggs into a large bowl and beat for 1-2 mins using a fork orwhiskto break up the eggs. Tip in the flour and bicarbonate of soda and mix until you have a smooth batter. Carefully pour this on top of the plums, then put in the oven for 45 mins to 1 hr until a skewer comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin completely, then remove from the tin and invert onto a board or serving plate."]','2026-01-10 12:23:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9174,9174,'en','Snickerdoodles','Is your dream cookie crisp on the outside and soft in the middle? If so, these cinnamon biscuits are for you. A classic American bake, they’re popular for a reason','["200g unsalted butter, softened","150g caster sugar","50g light brown soft sugar","2 tsp vanilla bean paste","300g plain flour","1½ tsp cream of tartar","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","3 tbsp milk","3 tbsp caster sugar","1 tbsp ground cinnamon"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6, and line a baking tray with baking parchment. Beat the butter and both sugars in a large bowl using an electricwhiskfor 2 mins until smooth and fluffy.","Add the vanilla and beat until combined, scraping down the sides once. Add the flour, cream of tartar, bicarbonate of soda and ¼ tsp salt, and mix until just combined. Stir in the milk to loosen the mixture.","For the topping, combine the sugar and cinnamon in a shallow bowl. Roll 40g of the dough into a ball. Roll the dough ball in the cinnamon-sugar mixture, then place it on the prepared tray and press it down lightly. Repeat with the remaining dough and topping, spacing the balls about 5cm apart.","Bake for 10-12 mins until golden and puffed up. Leave to cool on the tray for 5 mins, then transfer to awire rackand leave to cool completely.Will keep in an airtight tin for up to four days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9175,9175,'en','Raspberry frangipane croissant bake','Love almond croissants? You’ll adore this luxurious brunch dish. It’s a great way to use up any leftover pastries, and you can serve it as dessert, too','["100g butter, softened, plus extra for the dish","100g caster sugar, plus 1 tbsp","150g ground almonds","1 tbsp self-raising flour","½ tsp almond extract","3 eggs","100g crème fraîche, plus extra to serve","300ml whole milk","½ tsp vanilla extract","4 croissants","150g fresh or frozen raspberries","25g flaked almonds","yogurt, cream or ice cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Butter a baking dish (ours was 18 x 26cm) and set aside. Put the butter, 100g caster sugar, the ground almonds, flour and almond extract in a bowl, then crack in 1 egg. Beat the mixture with an electricwhiskuntil you have a smooth frangipane, about 2 mins.","Crack the remaining eggs into a large jug and whisk with the crème fraîche, milk, vanilla and 1 tbsp caster sugar to make a smooth custard.","Tear open each croissant and fill with 2-3 tbsp of the frangipane and a few raspberries. Arrange in the dish cut-side up. Pour over the custard, making sure each croissant is saturated, then spoon over any remaining frangipane. Leave to soak at room temperature for 1 hr.At this stage, the croissant bake can be chilled overnight.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Scatter over the flaked almonds bake in the middle of the oven for 35 mins until the custard is just set and the almonds are toasted. Serve with crème fraîche, yogurt, cream or ice cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9176,9176,'en','Raspberry cake','Make this summery cake with seasonal fresh raspberries. A dusting of icing sugar offsets the red of the raspberries, but you could also serve with a glaze.','["125ml sunflower oil, plus extra for the tin","175g self-raising flour","175g caster sugar","125ml 10% fat Greek yogurt","3 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 lemon, zested","200g raspberries","icing sugar, to dust","100g raspberries (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/ gas 4. Oil a deep, 20cm loose-bottomed cake tin and line with baking parchment. Combine the flour and sugar in a bowl. Set aside.","Mix the oil, yogurt, eggs, vanilla extract and lemon zest in another bowl. Tip in the flour and sugar mixture and fold in until smooth. Gently fold in the raspberries and bake for 30-40 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for a few minutes, then cool completely on awire rack. Dust lightly with icing sugar and serve topped with more raspberries, if you like.Will keep for up to three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9177,9177,'en','Mini victoria sponges','Make these bite-sized victoria sponges for a special afternoon tea or birthday celebration. Choose your favourite jam for the filling, then add whipped cream','["150g unsalted butter, softened","150g golden caster sugar","2 eggs","1 tbsp milk","½ tsp vanilla extract","150g self-raising flour","250ml double cream","2 tbsp icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","185g jam of your choice (strawberry or raspberry works well)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper cases. Beat the butter and caster sugar together using an electricwhiskuntil pale and fluffy, then whisk in the eggs, one at a time, scraping down the sides of the bowl after each addition.","Add the milk, vanilla, flour and a pinch of salt, then beat again until smooth. Divide the batter evenly between the paper cases – this can be easily done using an ice cream scoop. Bake for 17-20 mins, or until the sponges are golden, risen and a skewer inserted into the middles comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 10 mins, then transfer to awire rackto cool completely.Once completely cool, the sponges can be frozen for up to three months.","Remove the paper cases from the sponges, then split the sponges in half through the equator using a small serrated knife. Set aside.","Whip the cream and icing sugar together to soft peaks using an electric whisk. Spread a little jam over the base of each sponge, then spoon or pipe over a dollop of whipped cream and sandwich with the tops of the sponges. Dust with a little icing sugar before serving.Best eaten on the same day."]','2026-01-10 12:23:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9178,9178,'en','Peanut butter cookie cups','Pair the winning combination of peanut butter and dark chocolate in these cookie cups. They’re perfect for a picnic or pick-me-up treat for the whole family','["175g butter, softened","200g light brown soft sugar","100g golden caster sugar","1 tbsp vanilla extract","1 large egg","250g plain flour","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","150g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids)","240g peanut or almond butter"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Tip the butter, sugars and vanilla into a bowl and beat with an electricwhiskuntil pale and fluffy. Beat in the egg. Add the flour, bicarb and a pinch of salt, and mix everything together with aspatula.","Break off golf-ball-sized lumps of dough (about 65g each) and press into the holes of a 12-hole muffin tin, ensuring it comes up the sides – if you’re using a deep muffin tin, the dough should come about halfway up the side of each hole. Bake for 15 mins until golden. The dough will sink as it bakes, so leave until cool enough to handle, then press it up the sides of the holes again. Leave to cool completely.","Break the chocolate into a heatproof bowl and melt until smooth in themicrowavein 20-second bursts, or set over a pan of barely simmering water ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Remove the cookie cups from the tin (you may need a cutlery knife to help you do this). Spoon 1 tsp nut butter into the centre of each, then cover with the melted chocolate. Leave to cool until the chocolate sets, about 1 hr.Will keep in an airtightcontainerfor up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9179,9179,'en','Toffee apple turnover puff pie','Think apple turnover made into one big pie in this super-simple pudding with a caramelised apple centre. Serve with a scoop of ice cream or double cream','["6 eating apples (about 800g), peeled, cored and quartered","25g butter","50g golden caster sugar","320g sheet ready-rolled puff pastry","1 egg yolk, beaten"]','["Chopthe apples into small chunks. Heat the butter in a pan over a medium-high heat until sizzling, then scatter in most of the sugar, reserving about 1 tsp. Bubble until the sugar has dissolved and the mixture is sticky. Tip in the apples and stir to coat. Season with a small pinch of sea salt flakes and cook for 5-6 mins until the apples have softened and started to caramelise and any juices they have released have evaporated. Remove from the heat and set aside to cool completely.Once cooled, will keep chilled for up to a day.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 with abaking trayinside on the middle shelf. Unravel the pastry on its baking parchment. Spoon the apple mixture over the right side of the pastry, leaving about a 1-2cm border around the edge, then brush the border all around the pastry with some of the beaten egg yolk. Fold the left side of the pastry over the apple filling to enclose it. Crimp or pinch the edge, or use a fork to seal. Use the back of a knife to score six triangles over the top of the pie, and make a few small slits in the centre of each. Brush all over with the rest of the egg yolk, then scatter with the reserved 1 tsp sugar.","Carefully lift the pie, still on its parchment, onto the hot baking tray in the oven. Bake for 25-30 mins until puffed up and deeply golden. Leave to cool for 10 mins, then cut into wedges using the marked-out triangles as a guide."]','2026-01-10 12:23:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9180,9180,'en','Salted caramel & apple pudding','Whip up this warming, family-friendly dessert in under an hour using apples and golden caramel. Serve hot from the oven with a scoop of ice cream.','["1 tbsp butter, softened","3 large eggs, and 2 egg yolks","50g dark brown soft sugar","200ml whole milk","300ml double cream","375g can caramel, beaten until smooth","2 tsp vanilla extract","75g plain flour","3 apples (we used Pink Lady)","ice cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter a 30 x 20 x 4cm baking dish. Put the eggs, extra yolks, sugar, milk, cream, 200g of the caramel, the vanilla and a large pinch of sea salt in a large bowl, thenwhiskuntil combined. Stir in the flour until the batter is smooth.","Halve, core and cut the apples into 1cm slices – there’s no need to peel them. Arrange in the baking dish and pour over the batter. Bake for 30-35 mins until the batter is set in the centre, golden and slightly risen.","Drizzle over the remaining caramel, then sprinkle with a little extra sea salt. Leave to rest for 5-10 mins (it will deflate a little). Serve warm with vanilla or peanut butter ice cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9181,9181,'en','Lemon layer cake with soft cheese icing','Indulge in a slice of lemon cake for afternoon tea. With lovely light sponge layers, a citrus zing offsets the rich and creamy soft cheese icing.','["225g unsalted butter, softened","225g caster sugar","4 large eggs","225g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","75g natural yogurt","1 tsp vanilla bean paste or extract","3 lemons, zested","150g granulated sugar","3 lemons, zest of 2 pared into strips, juiced (you’ll need 60ml)","150g unsalted butter, softened","150g icing sugar, sieved","1 tsp vanilla bean paste or extract","300g full-fat soft cheese"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line the base of two 20cm sandwich tins with baking parchment. Beat the butter and sugar together for 3 mins using an electricwhiskuntil smooth and fluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating well between each addition and scraping down the sides of the bowl. Fold in the flour and baking powder until well incorporated, then fold in the yogurt, vanilla and lemon zest. Divide between the tins and bake for 30-35 mins until golden and a skewer inserted into the middles comes out clean.","Meanwhile, make the drizzle. Tip the sugar, lemon juice and 100ml water into a small pan set over a medium heat and stir until dissolved. Add the lemon zest, bring to the boil and simmer for 2-3 mins until the zest has softened and the liquid is syrupy. Remove the zest to a sheet of baking parchment using a slotted spoon, and remove the syrup from the heat.","Leave the sponges to cool for 10 mins in the tins, then pour over the warm drizzle. Leave to cool completely.","For the icing, beat the butter and icing sugar together using an electric whisk for 4-5 mins until smooth, scraping down the sides of the bowl as you go. Add the vanilla and soft cheese and beat for 4 mins more until thick and creamy. Don’t worry if it doesn’t look thick at first – it will loosen, then thicken again as you beat it.","Remove the cooled sponges from the tins. Spoon the icing into apiping bagfitted with a star nozzle. Put one sponge on a cake stand or serving plate, and pipe just under half the icing around the edge using a circular motion for a wavy effect. Pipe a little more icing over the empty middle (this doesn’t need to be neat) and smooth with the back of a spoon. Chill for 45 mins-1 hr until set. Top with the second sponge, then pipe eight blobs of icing around the edge at regular intervals, leaving a gap between each. Spoon the candied lemon zest into each gap, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9182,9182,'en','Mincemeat, marzipan & apple tarte fine','Serve this festive French-inspired mincemeat, marzipan and apple tarte with crème fraîche to cut through the sweetness. It’s a fabulous Christmas dessert','["320g sheet ready-rolled puff pastry","5 tbsp mincemeat (check it’s vegetarian, if needed)","200g ready-to-roll marzipan","icing sugar, for dusting","4 medium Granny Smith apples","25g cold butter, cut into small cubes","25g golden caster sugar","crème fraîche, to serve"]','["Line a baking sheet with baking parchment, and unroll the pastry on top. Prick all over with a fork, then spread the mincemeat over the pastry so it’s covered in a thin layer, leaving a 1cm border around the edges. Chill for 20 mins.","Rollthe marzipan out on a work surface dusted with icing sugar to a roughly 30 x 21cm rectangle that’s about 2mm thick. Drape it over the rolling pin and lay over the pastry, on top of the mincemeat layer. It should fit neatly in the middle of the pastry, within the border. Chill for another 20 mins.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 with a baking sheet inside. Peel and core the apples, but keep them whole. Using a mandoline or sharpknife, thinly slice the apples crosswise, so you end up with thin apple rings. Arrange the apple rings over the marzipan in an overlapping tight spiral shape that goes from the outside into the centre, or in neat overlapping lines. Dot over the butter and sprinkle with the sugar.","Bake for 35-40 mins until the apples are golden and caramelised, and the pastry is cooked through. Serve in small slices with crème fraîche.Will keep, covered in the fridge, for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9183,9183,'en','Sugar mice','Make these sugar mice at least a day before serving, so they have time to dry out. The recipe makes 12 mice – enough for one for each of your family and friends!','["1 egg white","1 tsp lemon juice","400-500g icing sugar, sifted","pink gel or paste food colouring","small chocolate sprinkles","kitchen string","cocktail stick","1 baking sheet lined with baking parchment"]','["Put the egg white in a large bowl andwhiskuntil foamy. Stir in the lemon juice.","Gradually stir in the icing sugar with a wooden spoon until really stiff, like dough. Or, dust the work surface with some icing sugar and knead the sugar into the mixture until you get the right consistency.","Divide the mixture in half. Add a dot of pink food colouring to one half, then knead in to evenly distribute the colour. Add a tiny bit more colouring if you want a stronger colour. Leave the second half plain.","Break off a walnut-sized piece of the mixture and roll into a rounded cone shape, then flatten one side so that the mouse can sit on a flat surface without toppling over. Pinch out little ears on top of the narrow end, then squeeze the same end into a nose. Press chocolate sprinkles into the face below the ears to make eyes. Cut a length of kitchen string about 4cm long, and push it into the round end of the mouse to make a tail.","Use a cocktail stick to dab a tiny amount of pink food colouring onto the nose, then put the mouse on a baking sheet lined with baking parchment.","Repeat the process with the remaining pink and white mixtures, then leave the mice to dry out for at least 12 hrs."]','2026-01-10 12:23:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9184,9184,'en','Norwegian butter cookies','Enjoy these traditional Norwegian butter cookies at Christmas as a treat for family and friends. They’re quick to make, and taste delicious','["300g plain flour, sifted","1 tbsp baking powder","200g cold butter, cut into cubes","125g icing sugar, plus 2 tbsp","2 tsp vanilla-infused sugar or golden caster sugar","1 egg, plus 1 lightly beaten egg white for brushing","pearl sugar, or flaked or chopped almonds, for sprinkling"]','["Mix the flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt together. Add the butter and rub in with your fingers until the mixture resembles coarse crumbs. Mix in all the icing sugar and the vanilla sugar, then add the whole egg and mix until just combined, but be careful not to overmix.","Transfer the dough to a food bag and put in the fridge to chill for about 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Roll the chilled dough into about 40 even balls (around 15g each). Arrange the dough balls over two baking sheets lined with baking parchment, leaving space between each for spreading. Using the back of a fork, press the balls down gently in the middle, so they spread to a diameter of about 3cm (they will spread more as they bake). If you prefer flat cookies, use the bottom of a glass.","Brush the cookies with the beaten egg white and sprinkle over the pearl sugar or almonds. Bake for 10 mins, or until just cooked through (the cookies should not be fully browned, just lightly golden at the edges). Remove from the oven and transfer towire racksto cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:23:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9185,9185,'en','Ultimate easy gingerbread','Make some gingerbread stars to hang from your Christmas tree. This biscuit dough is extremely forgiving if overworked, so it’s perfect for baking with children','["100g salted butter","3 tbsp golden syrup","100g dark muscovado sugar","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tbsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cinnamon","225g plain flour","50g icing sugar"]','["Heat the butter, syrup and sugar together in a smallpanuntil melted, stirring occasionally. Set aside to cool slightly.","Mix together the bicarb, ginger, cinnamon and flour in a large bowl. Pour in the buttery syrup mixture and stir to combine, then use your hands to bring together to form a dough. The dough will be soft at this point, but it’ll firm up in the fridge.","Put the dough on a sheet of baking parchment, shape into a rectangle, and lay another sheet of parchment on top of it. Roll the dough out to a thickness of ½cm. Transfer to a baking sheet to keep it flat, leaving the parchment in place, then chill in the fridge for 1 hr.","Heat the oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5 and line a large baking sheet with more baking parchment. Remove the dough from the fridge and cut out shapes using a cookie cutter. We used 9cm stars, but you can choose any shape. We also made some with smaller stars cut out of the centre to thread ribbon through and hang from a Christmas tree.","Place the shapes, spread apart, on the lined baking sheet, and bake for 10-12 mins. (Depending on the size of the cutters you use, they might need a few minutes more or less cooking in the oven). Leave to cool completely on the baking sheet.","Meanwhile, mix the icing sugar with 1-2 tbsp water – you want to create a consistency that’s thick and pipeable, and not too thin or it will run. Decorate the cooled biscuits with the icing using a piping bag with a thin nozzle. Find out how tomake a piping bag."]','2026-01-10 12:23:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9186,9186,'en','Easy egg muffins','Make these mini egg muffins for an easy breakfast or lunch with the kids. Add chopped ham, bacon or smoked salmon, if you fancy','["1 tbsp oil","150g broccoli, finely chopped","1 red pepper, finely chopped","2 spring onions, sliced","6 large eggs","1 tbsp milk","large pinch of smoked paprika","50g cheddar or gruyère, grated","small handful of chives, chopped (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4. Brush half the oil in an 8-hole muffin tin. Heat the remaining oil in a frying pan and add the broccoli, pepper and spring onions. Fry for 5 mins. Set aside to cool.","Whisk the eggs with the milk, smoked paprika and half the cheese in a bowl. Add the cooked veg. Pour the egg mixture into the muffin holes and top each with the remaining cheese and a few chives, if you like. Bake for 15-17 mins or until golden brown and cooked through."]','2026-01-10 12:23:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9187,9187,'en','Rhubarb & apple crumble','Use up a glut of rhubarb and apples for this simple crumble. Ground ginger adds a nice spice to the topping, but leave it out if you’d prefer','["450g rhubarb, cut into 3cm slices","350g apples (Bramley or Granny Smith work well), peeled and cut into 3cm chunks","1 vanilla pod, split open or 1 tsp vanilla paste or extract","120g golden caster sugar","ice cream or custard, to serve","200g plain flour","1 tsp ground ginger (optional)","100g cold salted butter, chopped","70g light soft brown sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the rhubarb, apples, vanilla and sugar together in an ovenproof dish and roast for 10 mins.","Mix the flour and ginger, if using, together in a large bowl. Rub in the butter with your fingertips to create a chunky breadcrumb textured mixture. Stir through the sugar. Sprinkle the crumble topping onto the fruit and cook for a further 30-35 mins or until the topping is lightly golden brown. Serve with ice cream or custard."]','2026-01-10 12:23:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9188,9188,'en','Mix & match pancake muffins','Forget standing over a hob flipping pancakes on Pancake Day – make these fluffy pancake muffins instead. They’re simple to make and kids will love to help','["sunflower or vegetable oil, for the tin","350g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","50g butter","350ml milk","2 eggs","2 tbsp maple syrup, plus extra to serve","handful of raspberries or blueberries, or a bit of each","½ banana, sliced","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Oil a 12-hole muffin tin generously, using a pastry brush to make sure you get in all the corners and up the sides. Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Mix the flour, baking powder and a pinch of salt in a bowl.","Melt the butter in a jug in the microwave. Add the milk, then the eggs and maple syrup, whisk together, then pour into the dry ingredients and whisk again to a smooth batter. Divide evenly between the holes of your tin.","Top each muffin with a few berries or slices of banana. Bake for 20-25 mins until golden brown. Test if the muffins are cooked by pushing a skewer into the centre of one. If it comes out clean, they’re ready. If not, continue cooking for a few more minutes. Once cooked, cool for 5 mins, then remove from the tin with a cutlery knife. Pile onto a plate, dust with icing sugar and serve while still warm with plenty of extra maple syrup."]','2026-01-10 12:23:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9189,9189,'en','Super-simple fruitcake','This easy fruit cake by one of our younger readers, Bree Hamilton, is simple, uses storecupboard ingredients and is perfect for a quick winter pick-me-up','["175ml olive oil, plus extra for greasing","100g light brown muscovado sugar","2 eggs, beaten","225g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp ground cinnamon","½  tsp allspice","½  orange, juiced","½  lemon, juiced","200g mixed dried fruit","200g apricot jam","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/ gas 3. Grease and line the base of two 20cm springform cake tins with baking parchment.","Stir together the oil and sugar, add the eggs, flour, baking powder, spices and juices, and mix thoroughly with a wooden spoon until pourable and reasonably runny. Gently fold in the fruit, then divide the batter evenly between the tins. Bake for 20-25 mins or until a skewer inserted in the centre comes out clean, then leave to cool.","When cool, remove from the tins and sandwich the cakes together with jam. Sieve some icing sugar on top to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9190,9190,'en','Malted milk melting snowman cake','Everyone loves a white Christmas and this snowman cake conjures up that festive feeling. Kids can help decorate with buttons, icing and chocolate sticks','["500g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","500g golden caster sugar","10 eggs","200g plain flour","200g full-fat natural yogurt","460g self-raising flour","4 tbsp malt extract (or 2 tbsp vanilla paste) (see tip below)","1 tbsp full-fat milk (or 2 tbsp if using vanilla paste)","400g unsalted butter, softened","700g icing sugar","2 tbsp malt extract (or 1 tbsp vanilla paste)","1 tbsp full-fat milk","100g white chocolate","½  tsp vegetable oil","30g black fondant","30g bright orange fondant","1 wooden dowel, cut the same length as the nose","2-3 giant chocolate buttons","2 white chocolate Mikado sticks, for the arms","2 x 20cm cake tins","16cm hemisphere cake tin (see tip below)","23cm cake board","16cm cake board","squeezy bottle"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Grease two 20cm round cake tins and line with baking parchment. Heavily grease a 16cm hemisphere cake tin and stand on a ramekin on a baking sheet to hold it steady.","First, make the sponges. Using electric beaters or a tabletop mixer, beat the butter and sugar together until pale and fluffy. Pour the eggs in, one at a time, giving the mix a thorough beating before adding the next. If the mix starts to look curdled, add 2 tbsp of the plain flour. Beat in the yogurt.","Mix both the flours together, adding 1 /2 tsp salt, and slowly beat into the batter, followed by the malt extract (or vanilla paste) and milk. Spoon half the mixture into one of the 20cm tins, and split the remaining half between the other 20cm tin and the 16cm hemisphere. Bake the smaller amount of cake batter in the 20cm tin and the 16cm tin for 1 hr, and the larger amount for 1 hr 20 mins or until a skewer comes out clean when inserted into the middle of the cakes. Cool in the tin for 10 mins before turning out onto a wire rack to cool completely. Can be frozen at this stage for up to three months.","Meanwhile, make the buttercream by beating all the butter and half the icing sugar together using an electric whisk or tabletop mixer. Add the rest of the icing sugar once incorporated, followed by the malt extract (or vanilla paste) and milk. Set aside until ready to use.","To assemble, halve the largest 20cm cake horizontally so you are left with two equal-sized sponges the same size as the remaining 20cm cake. Put a blob of buttercream onto a 23cm cake board (or cake stand) and spread using a palette knife. Stick one of the sponges to the board. Spread a thick layer of buttercream on top of the cake and sandwich another sponge on top. Spread over another thick layer and sit the final sponge on top. Using a palette knife, coat the entire cake in a thin layer of buttercream and smooth the sides and top carefully, working around the whole cake, scraping off any excess icing. Chill in the freezer for 10 mins or in the fridge for 1 hr until set.","Meanwhile, put the hemisphere sponge on the smaller cake board and halve horizontally. Fill the middle with some buttercream, sandwich with the top and coat the entire cake in a thin layer of buttercream. Chill in the freezer for 5 mins or in the fridge for 30 mins.","Take the larger cake out of the fridge/ freezer and coat in another layer of buttercream. Take care when covering this time, as you want a smooth finish to the cake. Running the palette knife under hot water helps smooth over the sides once it is coated completely. Chill again for 5 mins in the freezer.","Cover the hemisphere sponge with buttercream and smooth over with the palette knife. Carefully lift the hemisphere onto the centre of the cake (as the sponge has been frozen you shouldn’t leave finger marks). Press down lightly to set on the buttercream. If there is a gap around the rim, use a small palette knife to fill in with any remaining buttercream. Chill for 10-15 mins.","Meanwhile, make the eyes and nose using coloured fondant. Roll the black fondant into two balls for the eyes, and five smaller balls for the mouth. Roll the orange fondant into a carrot shape. Leave to set and harden slightly while you make the drippy ganache.","Make the drippy ganache by mixing the chocolate and oil and microwaving for 30 secs, stirring and then giving it another 30 secs until melted. Transfer to a squeezy bottle, then pour down the edges of the round cake to create the melting snow effect.","To finish the cake, stick the eyes to the head using a little remaining buttercream. Poke the wooden dowel into the carrot nose, leaving some poking out to stick it to the face. Stick the five small black fondant balls for the mouth and the chocolate buttons down the front of the cake for buttons. Insert the Mikado sticks on either side for the arms. Bring the cake to room temperature before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9191,9191,'en','Peach melba pop pies','These easy peasy pies are stuffed with flavour and are great fun for little fingers to decorate','["200g raspberries","410g can peach slices in fruit juice, drained and chopped","1 tbsp cornflour","1 tbsp honey","2 x 320g shortcrust pastry sheet","1 egg, beaten","150g icing sugar","freeze-dried raspberries or sprinkles, optional"]','["Set 6 plump raspberries aside and tip the rest into a bowl. Add the peaches and toss together. In a small bowl mix the cornflour and honey to make a paste, pour over the fruit and combine.","Unroll the pastry sheets and use a pizza wheel to cut out 6 rectangles from each one. Turn a piece of pastry so the long side is nearest to you, and fold it in half like a book, to create a fold down the middle. Open the pastry out and spoon the fruit filling onto one side, leaving a border of about 1cm around the edge. Brush the beaten egg around the edges and fold the pastry again to encase the filling. Use a fork to seal the edges all the way around, then brush all over with more egg. Poke a few air holes in the top with the fork. Repeat with the remaining pastry and filling. Arrange the pop pies on a baking sheet lined with baking parchment and chill for at least 30 mins, or for up to 24 hrs. Alternatively freeze for up to 2 months.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Bake the pop pies for 20 mins, or until the pastry is golden and the filling is bubbling through the holes. Remove from the oven and cool for at least 20 mins. If cooking from frozen, bake for an extra 5 mins. Meanwhile crush the remaining raspberries until juicy and mix with the icing sugar to make a thick icing. Spread thinly over the pies and sprinkle with freeze dried raspberries or sprinkles, if you like. Eat warm, or cold, for breakfast or drizzle with cream or custard for dessert."]','2026-01-10 12:23:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9192,9192,'en','PBJ Bakewell tart','We''ve taken everything we love about a Bakewell tart and added an American twist with peanut butter and jam or ''jelly'' as they call it stateside!','["80g roasted unsalted peanuts, plus 2 tbsp to serve","100g peanut butter","75g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","120g butter, softened","150g golden caster sugar","1 egg, plus 1 egg white (use the yolk in the pastry)","50g raspberry jam, plus 2 tsp to serve","200g plain flour","4 tbsp cocoa powder","130g cold butter, chopped into small pieces","1 egg yolk","2 tbsp icing sugar, plus 5 tbsp for the drizzle"]','["First, make the pastry. Tip the flour, cocoa, butter and a pinch of salt into a food processor and blitz until the mixture resembles fine breadcrumbs. Add the egg yolk, icing sugar and 2 tbsp cold water and blitz again until just starting to clump together. Tip onto your work surface (don’t worry about washing the bowl), knead briefly into a smooth ball of dough, then flatten into a thick disc shape, wrap in cling film and chill for 30 mins.","Add the remaining ingredients – except for the jam and the peanuts to serve – to the food processor and blitz until smooth and creamy. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Remove the pastry from the fridge and roll out to the thickness of a £1 coin. Lift the pastry into a 22cm fluted tart tin and press it into the corners, taking care not to rip it. Trim the excess pastry with scissors, leaving an overhang of about 1cm. Line with baking parchment and baking beans, and bake for 15 mins.","Remove the parchment and beans and return to the oven for 5 mins more, until it looks biscuity. Remove from the oven and use a small serrated knife to trim the pastry to the height of the tin. Discard (or nibble on) the off-cuts.","Spoon the jam onto the base of the tart and spread to the edges. Top with the peanut mixture, spreading to the edges to cover the jam. Bake for 45 mins until the sponge is cooked and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Cool in the tin for 15 mins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","Mash the remaining icing sugar and jam together to make a smooth icing and drizzle on top. Roughly chop the remaining peanuts and scatter over. Leftovers will keep in an airtight container for 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9193,9193,'en','Sweet potato, avocado & feta muffins','Use super-ripe avocados in this savoury bake, topped with crumbly cheese, sweet potato chunks and a scattering of mixed seeds','["1 sweet potato (about 200g), peeled and chopped into small chunks","drizzle of flavourless oil, such as vegetable or sunflower","1 large avocado, peel and stone removed, roughly chopped (about 150g prepared weight)","100g ground almonds","100g fine polenta","80ml maple syrup","3 large eggs","1 ½  tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","100ml semi-skimmed milk","50g feta, crumbled, optional","2 tbsp mixed seeds","¼ tsp sweet paprika"]','["Place the sweet potato in a heatproof bowl, cover with cling film and microwave on High for 8 mins, or until really soft. Leave to cool completely. Grease 9 holes of a muffin tin with a little oil (or line each hole with a square of baking parchment.)","Chop 1/4 of the sweet potato into even smaller pieces and set aside. Place the sweet potato, avocado, almonds, polenta, maple syrup, eggs, baking powder, bicarb, milk and 1/4 tsp salt in the bowl of a food processor. Blend until completely smooth. Divide the mixture evenly between the muffin tin holes, then top with the reserved chopped sweet potato, feta, seeds and a dusting of paprika. Bake for 22 mins, or until risen, browning on top and cooked through – check by inserting a skewer to the centre, it should come out dry. Cool in the tin for 5 mins, then transfer to a wire rack and cool completely. Store in a sealed container for up to 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9194,9194,'en','Rhubarb buckle','This vanilla and rhubarb buckle, a brighter cousin to the traditional American-style teatime cake, is perfect for the cold months when forced rhubarb shines','["50g plain flour","50g golden caster sugar","½  tsp ground ginger","50g unsalted butter, chilled","25g rolled oat","225g thin, forced rhubarb, trimmed, rinsed and cut into 2½ cm/1in-long pieces","50g golden caster sugar","zest 1 orange","100g unsalted butter, room temperature, plus extra for greasing","200g golden caster sugar","zest 1 orange","2 large egg","200g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","125ml soured cream"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease a deep 20cm round cake tin and line the base with baking parchment.","To make the crumble topping, put the flour, sugar and ginger in a bowl and mix together. Add the butter and rub together until the mixture resembles breadcrumbs. Stir in the oats and, using your hands, bring the mixture together into a dough, wrap in cling film and chill until needed.","Put the rhubarb pieces in a bowl with the sugar and orange zest, and mix together. Set aside while you make the cake batter.","Put the butter, sugar and orange zest in a large bowl and, using an electric whisk, beat together until light and fluffy, about 5 mins. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating together until combined before adding the next.","In a separate bowl, mix the flour, baking powder, vanilla paste and a pinch of salt together and, in two additions, fold into the butter mixture, alternating with the soured cream. Tip into your cake tin and level out with a spatula. Top with the rhubarb mixture and finish by breaking the chilled crumble into irregular-sized pieces and scattering over the rhubarb. Bake in the oven for about 1 hr 10 mins or until the crumble is golden and a skewer inserted into the middle of the cake comes out clean. Check the cake after 1 hr – if it is colouring too quickly, cover lightly with foil for the final 10 mins.","Allow to cool in the tin for 10 mins before carefully transferring onto a wire rack to cool completely. Will keep in an airtight container for up to 3 days, but the crumble will lose some of its texture after the first day."]','2026-01-10 12:23:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9195,9195,'en','Coconut chai traybake','This simple traybake is inspired by one of our favourite brews – chai. Spiced with cinnamon, nutmeg and cardamom, this moist coconut sponge is the perfect accompaniment to a cuppa','["100ml vegetable oil, plus a little for greasing","300ml coconut milk (not low-fat) - if the cream has separated in the can, give it a good mix before measuring","4 large eggs","2 tsp vanilla extract","280g light brown soft sugar","250g self-raising flour","75g desiccated coconut","1 tsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cinnamon","¼ nutmeg, finely grated","¼ tsp ground cloves","10 cardamom pods, seeds removed and crushed using a pestle and mortar","4 tbsp ginger syrup","3-4 tbsp coconut milk","140g icing sugar","2 balls stem ginger, finely chopped","chopped pistachios and coconut flakes (optional)"]','["Grease a 20 x 30cm baking tin with a little oil, and line the base and sides with baking parchment. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Measure the coconut milk and oil into a jug. Crack in the eggs, add the vanilla and whisk with a fork to combine.","In a large bowl, mix the sugar, flour, coconut, spices and a pinch of salt. Squeeze any lumps of sugar through your fingers, shaking the bowl a few times so they come to the surface. Pour in the wet ingredients and use a large whisk to mix to a smooth batter. Pour into the tin, scraping every drop of the mixture out of the bowl with a spatula.","Bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 25 mins or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. If there is any wet mixture clinging to it, bake for a further 5 mins, then check again. Leave to cool for 15 mins in the tin, then transfer to a wire rack and drizzle over the ginger syrup.","To make the icing, mix the coconut milk with the icing sugar until smooth. Drizzle the icing over the cake in squiggles, then scatter with the chopped ginger, pistachios and coconut flakes, if using. Eat warm or cold. Will keep for 3 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9196,9196,'en','Blueberry Bakewell muffins','These easy blueberry muffins have a delightfully jammy centre and crunchy crumble topping – a tasty treat for teatime or packed lunch','["100g unsalted butter, softened, plus 1 tbsp, melted, for greasing","140g golden caster sugar","2 large eggs","140g natural yogurt","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tsp almond extract","2 tbsp milk","250g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","125g pack blueberries (or use frozen)","3 tbsp demerara sugar","¼ tsp ground cinnamon","3 tbsp flaked almonds, roughly chopped","2 tbsp ground almonds","3 tbsp plain flour","1 tbsp cold butter diced","12 tsp wild blueberry conserve (I used Felix wild blueberry jam, available from ocado.com)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper cases. Put all the topping ingredients, apart from the jam, in a bowl and rub together.","Beat the butter and caster sugar together until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs and beat in for 1 min, then mix in the yogurt, extracts and milk. Combine the flour, baking powder and bicarb in a bowl with 1/4 tsp fine salt, then tip this into the wet ingredients and stir in. Finally, fold in the blueberries and divide the mixture between the muffin cases. Top each muffin with 1 tsp blueberry jam, then scatter over the crumble mixture.","Bake for 5 mins, then reduce oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and bake for 15-18 mins more until risen and golden, and a cocktail stick inserted in comes out with just jam on it – no wet cake mixture.","Cool in the tin for 10 mins, then carefully lift out onto a wire rack to finish cooling. Will keep for 3-4 days in an airtight container – after a day or two, pop them in the microwave for 10-15 secs on High to freshen up."]','2026-01-10 12:23:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9197,9197,'en','Ginger cookie sandwiches with lemon mascarpone','Sandwich ginger biscuits with a creamy, zesty filling to make these gluten-free teatime treats that are aromatic with wintry spices – cloves, nutmeg and cardamom','["100g unsalted butter, melted","50g golden caster sugar","100g light brown soft sugar","25g black treacle","1 large egg","½  tsp vanilla extract","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","175g gluten-free flour blend (I used Doves Farm)","1 tbsp ground ginger","½  tsp ground black pepper","¼ tsp ground nutmeg","¼ tsp ground cloves","¼ tsp ground cardamom (the seeds from 3 pods, crushed – see tip)","75g demerara sugar, to coat","175g mascarpone","85g lemon curd"]','["To make the cookies, put the butter, sugars, treacle, egg and vanilla in a large bowl and mix together with an electric whisk until smooth and combined. In a separate bowl, mix together the remaining ingredients except the demerara. Add the dry ingredients to the egg mixture and mix until a very sticky dough is formed. Cover with cling film and chill for at least 4 hrs.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line two baking trays with baking parchment. Roll the cookie dough into balls, about a tablespoon in size, then roll in the demerara sugar. Place on the lined trays, leaving about 2.5cm space between cookies.","Bake for about 14 mins or until just lightly browned around the edges, swapping the trays over halfway through cooking. Allow to cool on the trays for 10 mins before transferring to a wire rack to cool completely.","To make the filling, beat together the mascarpone and lemon curd in a bowl until smooth and creamy. Transfer to a piping bag fitted with a plain round piping tip. Pipe a layer of the cream onto the base of half the cookies and sandwich together with the other half. Will keep for 3-4 days in a sealed container in the fridge – the texture will turn soft and cakey (this is no bad thing)."]','2026-01-10 12:23:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9198,9198,'en','Orange & coriander drizzle cake','This fruity bake has a whole orange whizzed up and added to the batter for a zesty teatime treat','["1 large orange","175g golden caster sugar","2 tbsp coriander seeds","50g polenta","175g butter, softened","150g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","3 eggs","1 orange","50g golden caster sugar","100g icing sugar"]','["To make the cake, put the orange in a saucepan, cover with water, bring to the boil and simmer for 1 hr or until you can pierce the orange easily with a knife.","Drain, leave to cool, then cut the orange into quarters. Cut each quarter in half so that you have 8 pieces, and remove any pips. Put 75g of the sugar in a small pan and add 100ml water and the orange pieces. Heat gently until the sugar has dissolved, then turn up the heat and simmer for 10 mins. Allow the orange to cool slightly, then either blitz with a stick blender or liquidise to a pulp. Crush the coriander seeds using a pestle and mortar or a spice grinder, then add to the warm orange pulp along with the polenta. Stir to combine, then leave to cool.","Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Grease and line the base and sides of a 22cm loose-bottomed cake tin. Put the butter, flour, baking powder, eggs and the remaining 100g caster sugar in a large mixing bowl along with the cooled orange pulp. Mix until thoroughly blended using an electric hand mixer. Spoon into the prepared tin and bake for 35-45 mins or until springy to the touch – a skewer inserted into the centre should come out clean. The cake should be pale in colour and just leaving the sides of the tin. Transfer to a wire rack and leave to cool.","Meanwhile, prepare the decoration. Using a potato peeler, peel half the zest from the orange into large strips, then slice very thinly so that you have lots of orange zest shreds (like you would for marmalade). Put the caster sugar and 100ml water in a small saucepan set over a low heat until the sugar has dissolved, then add the orange shreds. Bring to the boil, then simmer for 8-10 mins until the shreds are quite soft. Remove using a slotted spoon and set aside on a tray lined with baking parchment.","When the cake has cooled, sift the icing sugar into a small bowl. Juice the orange and add enough of it to the icing sugar to make a runny icing. Drizzle the icing over the cooled cake and scatter the orange shreds on top."]','2026-01-10 12:23:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9199,9199,'en','Cinnamon cashew flapjacks','Whip up a batch of these chewy, oaty flapjacks, packed with nuts, seeds and desiccated coconut – perfect as a afternoon pick-me-up','["140g butter, plus extra for greasing","140g light brown soft sugar","2 tbsp set honey","1 tbsp ground cinnamon","140g porridge oats","85g desiccated coconut","85g sesame seeds","50g sunflower seeds","1 tbsp plain flour","85g cashews or pecans"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Grease and line a 20 x 30cm cake tin with baking parchment. Melt the butter in a large non-stick pan, add the sugar, honey and cinnamon, and stir with a wooden spoon over a low heat for 5-10 mins until the sugar dissolves.","Remove from the heat and stir in all the remaining ingredients until well coated in the buttery spice mixture. Tip into the tin and press down to an even layer. Bake for 30-35 mins until golden. Cool for 5 mins, then mark into squares – don’t remove from the tin yet as they won’t hold together until they are cold. Will keep in a sealed container for a couple of days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9200,9200,'en','Malty choc chip cookies','Try these easy, chewy chocolate chip cookies with malted milk – pop in the biscuit tin or cookie jar for up to 5 days','["140g butter, softened","50g golden caster sugar","100g soft light brown sugar","2 medium eggs","200g plain flour","175g malted milk drink powder (we used Horlicks)","½  tsp baking powder","100g bar dark chocolate, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line 2 baking sheets with baking parchment. Beat the butter and sugars in a bowl until light and fluffy, then beat in the eggs one at a time.","Add the flour, malted milk drink powder, baking powder and a good pinch of salt, then stir with a wooden spoon until the mixture forms a dough. Tip out onto the work surface and gently knead in the chocolate. Divide the mixture into 20 pieces, roughly the size of a whole walnut. Roll each piece into a ball and place on the baking trays, leaving plenty of room for the cookies to spread. Flatten each ball slightly with your hand.","Bake for 10-12 mins until starting to turn golden brown on the edges. Remove from the oven, leave on the baking tray for 5 mins to cool slightly then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely. Will keep in a cake tin or cookie jar for up to 5 days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9201,9201,'en','Apple & walnut cake with treacle icing','This easy all-in-one cake is perfect if you’ve got friends coming for coffee or afternoon tea','["300g plain flour","1 tsp ground cinnamon","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","140g dark brown soft sugar","50g golden caster sugar","250ml rapeseed or sunflower oil","4 eggs","3 unpeeled apples, coarsely grated","100g walnuts, roughly chopped","100g butter, softened","50g dark soft brown sugar","1 tbsp black treacle","200g tub full fat soft cheese"]','["Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2. Line\r\ntwo 20cm cake tins. Put the flour,\r\ncinnamon and bicarbonate of soda in a\r\nbig bowl, then stir in the sugars, making\r\nsure there are no lumps of sugar. Add the\r\noil, eggs and apples, and beat everything\r\ntogether. Fold in the walnuts then divide\r\nthe mixture between the tins and bake\r\nfor 45 mins or until a skewer comes out\r\nclean. Allow to cool for a few mins in the\r\ntin then remove and cool completely on a\r\nwire rack.","For the icing, beat all the ingredients\r\ntogether then chill until the mixture is\r\nthick but spreadable. Spread half the\r\nicing on top of one cake, sandwich\r\nwith the other and spread the remaining\r\nicing on top"]','2026-01-10 12:23:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9202,9202,'en','Elderflower crunch cake','Capture the essence of summer in this simple loaf cake with elderflower drizzle','["175g softened butter, plus extra for greasing","175g golden caster sugar","3 eggs","140g self-raising flour","85g ground almonds","½ tsp baking powder","100ml milk","4 tbsp elderflower cordial","4 tbsp white or golden granulated sugar"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line a 2lb/900g loaf tin with\r\na long strip of baking parchment. To make\r\nthe loaf cake batter, beat the butter and\r\nsugar with an electric whisk until light\r\nand fluffy. Beat in the eggs, flour,\r\nalmonds, baking powder and milk\r\nuntil smooth. Pour into the tin and\r\nbake for 45-50 mins until golden, risen\r\nand a skewer poked in the centre comes\r\nout clean.","As soon as the cake has come out of\r\nthe oven, prick it all over with a skewer.\r\nMix together the cordial and extra sugar,\r\nthen pour all over the cake. Cool in the\r\ntin, then carefully lift out to slice."]','2026-01-10 12:23:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9203,9203,'en','Cherry, choc & coconut tray bake','Keep these five ingredients in your storecupboard so you can whip up a tasty traybake when friends drop by unexpectedly','["200g desiccated coconut","85g caster sugar","2 eggs, beaten","200g bar white chocolate, roughly chopped","85g glacé cherries, halved"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLine a 20 x 30cm baking tray with baking\r\nparchment. In a large bowl, mix the\r\ndesiccated coconut, sugar, eggs,\r\nwhite chocolate and glacé cherries\r\nuntil combined. Cook for 20 mins until\r\ngolden brown and set, then cool in\r\nthe tin before slicing into bars."]','2026-01-10 12:23:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9204,9204,'en','Summer fruit drizzle cake','Sarah Cook’s scrummy cake is really easy and versatile – use whatever fruit you like, and you’ll make it again and again','["2 large eggs","2 tsp vanilla extract","175g fruits, stoned and diced weight","140g granulated sugar","1-2 tbsp citrus juice - lemon, lime or orange","175g very soft butter, plus extra for greasing","175g golden caster sugar","250g self-raising flour"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease a 900g/2lb loaf tin and line the\r\nbase and ends with a long strip of baking\r\nparchment. Put the butter, sugar, flour,\r\neggs and vanilla extract into a large bowl\r\nand beat with an electric hand mixer\r\nfor 5 mins until pale and creamy – the\r\nmixture will be very thick.","Spread one-third of the cake mix into\r\nthe tin, then scatter over 50g of the fruit.\r\nCarefully dot and spread another third of\r\nthe cake mix on top, and scatter with\r\nanother 50g fruit. Finally dot the rest of\r\nthe cake mix over and gently spread with\r\nthe back of a spoon. Bake for 1 hr, until\r\nan inserted skewer comes out clean.","Poke the cake all over with a skewer.\r\nPut remaining 75g fruit into a bowl with\r\nthe granulated sugar. Stir in 1 tbsp of the\r\ncitrus juice first with a fork, mashing a\r\nlittle of the fruit as you go. If it’s a bit dry,\r\nadd a splash more juice and spoon over\r\nthe cake. Leave in the tin until the cake is\r\ncool and the topping is set and crisp."]','2026-01-10 12:23:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9205,9205,'en','Raspberry & white chocolate traybake','The perfect summer pud for a lunch party, or treat with afternoon tea','["375g pack ready-rolled shortcrust pastry","500g mascarpone","100g golden caster sugar","100g ground almonds","2 large eggs","250g fresh raspberries","100g white chocolate, roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 160c/fan 140c/gas 4. roll out the pastry a little more on a\r\nfloured surface and use to line a 30 x 20cm tin, or a Swiss roll tin. Line with\r\ngreaseproof paper, fill with baking beans and cook for 10 mins. Take out the\r\nbeans and paper, then return to the oven for a further 5 mins.","Whisk together the mascarpone, sugar, almonds and eggs until well\r\nblended. Fold in the raspberries and chocolate, then pour into the tin. Bake\r\nfor 20-25 mins until just set and lightly golden. Turn off the oven, open the\r\ndoor and leave the tray bake to cool gradually. For the best results, chill for\r\nat least 1 hr before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:23:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9206,9206,'en','Chocolate & peanut butter sundae','Save time and use shop-bought vanilla ice cream to make a stunning ice cream sundae flavoured with crunchy peanut butter and dark chocolate','["175g dark chocolate , broken up","200ml double cream","125g crunchy peanut butter , melted and cooled","1kg vanilla ice cream","handful of unsalted roasted peanuts , chopped, to garnish"]','["Melt 100g of the dark chocolate with the cream and 75g of the peanut butter together in a small saucepan over a low heat, stirring until the mixture is smooth and the sauce has thickened. If the sauce seems too thick, you can add a little more double cream.","Melt the remaining chocolate in a heatproof bowl in the microwave in short bursts. Or, do this over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water.","Scoop some of the ice cream into four sundae glasses, then drizzle in half of the sauce. Repeat this, then top with another scoop of ice cream each. Drizzle over the melted chocolate which should set on the cold ice cream. Scatter over the chopped peanuts and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9207,9207,'en','Peanut butter & jelly doughnut ice cream sandwiches','Transform a classic PB&J into an indulgent doughnut ice cream sandwich – it’s fun to make and will bring joy to all','["200ml peanut butter-flavoured ice cream","4 shop-bought jam doughnuts","50g smooth peanut butter","150g raspberries, any larger ones halved","30g mini chocolate-covered peanut butter cups, roughly chopped"]','["Remove the ice cream from the freezer to soften while you prepare the doughnuts. Heat the grill to high. Split the doughnuts in half through the equator and arrange on abaking tray,cut-side up. Toast under the hot grill for 2 mins until golden.","Meanwhile, warm the peanut butter in a small pan over a low heat, stirring often until it has melted and loosened. Remove from the heat and leave to cool for 5 mins.","Scoop the softened ice cream over the toasted doughnut bases, drizzle over the warm peanut butter, then scatter over the raspberries and chopped peanut butter cups. Sandwich with the doughnut tops and serve straightaway."]','2026-01-10 12:23:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9208,9208,'en','Coconut ice cream','Make a creamy and refreshing vegan coconut ice cream. It can be served in cones or bowls, and is great topped with even more coconut','["400g can coconut milk","400g can coconut cream","150g caster sugar","50g liquid glucose","2 tsp cornflour","shaved coconut or toasted coconut flakes, to serve (optional)"]','["Tip all of the ingredients, except the coconut flakes, into asaucepanover a low-medium heat and bring to a simmer. Cook for 1 min, then remove from the heat and leave to cool completely, about 1 hr.","Pour the cooled mixture into anice cream machineand churn for 30 mins-1 hr, according to the manufacturer’s instructions. At this stage, it will still be soft. Scrape the churned ice cream into a freezerproof container or loaf tin and freeze for at least 4 hrs or overnight until it is firm enough to be scooped.Will keep frozen for up to three months. Serve in cones or bowls topped with shaved coconut or toasted coconut flakes, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9209,9209,'en','Strawberry & elderflower semifreddo','Finish your summer menu with the perfect al fresco pudding – this semifreddo is incredibly easy to make but looks so impressive','["500g strawberries, hulled and quartered","50g caster sugar, plus 2 tbsp (optional)","6 tbsp elderflower cordial","300ml double cream","300ml full-fat Greek yogurt"]','["Line a 1-litre loaf tin with cling film. Cook 300g of the strawberries with the 50g sugar and 4 tbsp of the elderflower cordial for 8-10 mins in a small pan over a medium heat until the strawberries have released some of their liquid and it has reduced a little. Leave to cool.","Whiskthe double cream to soft peaks, then fold in the Greek yogurt until combined. Gently fold the cooked strawberries through the cream and yogurt mixture to create a ripple effect. Tip the mixture into the lined tin, then gently even out with the back of a spoon. Cover with cling film and freeze for at least 5 hrs or overnight.Will keep frozen for up to one month.","To serve, remove from the freezer, turn out onto a serving plate, peel off the cling film and defrost for 20 mins. Meanwhile, mix the rest of the strawberries with the remaining elderflower cordial, sprinkle over the 2 tbsp sugar, if using, and pile these on the semifreddo."]','2026-01-10 12:23:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9210,9210,'en','Dulce de leche','This rich, creamy caramel sauce is a great way to level up your favourite desserts. It’s easy to make and tastes heavenly – try it drizzled over vanilla ice cream','["50g granulated sugar","50g unsalted butter, cubed","75ml whole milk","1 x 397g can condensed milk"]','["Put the sugar in a large saucepan. Turn the heat to a medium temperature and carefully melt the sugar. Gently tilt the pan as the sugar melts, rather than stirring, as it will adhere to a spoon orspatula.","When the sugar is melted, add the butter and stir into the sugar. It will bubble, so take care. Next, add the milk a little at a time, stirring continuously.","Finally, add the can of condensed milk and stir well until it is fully incorporated. Keep stirring as the dulce de leche bubbles and thickens over a medium heat. It will need a further 5-10 mins of cooking. It will turn a darker shade of brown and take on a slight orange-red hue as it darkens. It should be thick enough to leave a clear channel in the pan when a spoon is run through and then add a pinch of salt. It will firm up as it cools.The dulce de leche can be stored in a jar in the fridge and will keep for up to a month.If not storing in a jar ensure it''s covered so a skin doesn’t form."]','2026-01-10 12:23:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9211,9211,'en','Chocolate ice cream','Forget the faff of ice cream makers and custard – this fudgy chocolate ice cream not only tastes divine, it’s easy to make at home too','["200g dark chocolate (at least 70% cocoa solids), chopped into small pieces","500ml double cream","340g can sweetened condensed milk","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 tbsp organic cocoa powder, sifted","50g milk chocolate chips","sea salt flakes, to serve (optional)"]','["Melt the chocolate in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of just-simmering water, ensuring the bowl doesn’t touch the water, or do this in themicrowavein 20-second bursts until smooth and glossy. Leave to cool slightly. Pour the cream, condensed milk and vanilla into a second bowl and beat for 3 mins using an electricwhiskuntil slightly thickened and the beaters leave a trail in the mixture when lifted across the bowl. Be careful not to overwhip, as you don’t want the mixture to be too stiff – as soon as the beaters leave a trail, it’s ready.","Gently fold the melted chocolate and cocoa powder into the cream mixture until thoroughly combined, ensuring thespatulais reaching the bottom of the bowl so all the chocolate gets mixed in. Fold in most of the chocolate chips, reserving a small handful. Scrape the mixture into a 1-litre freezerproof container, then scatter over the reserved chocolate chips. Cover and freeze for at least 6 hrs until firm but scoopable.Will keep frozen for up to a month. To serve, scoop the ice cream into chilled bowls or ice cream cones and sprinkle with a pinch of sea salt, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9212,9212,'en','Raspberry & dark chocolate cheat’s ice cream terrine','Try this easy terrine for dessert, layered with ice cream, dark chocolate and marbled with a zingy raspberry purée. Prepare it ahead to wow your guests','["225g raspberries","1 tbsp caster sugar","½ lemon, juiced","400ml double cream","1 tbsp vanilla paste","275g condensed milk","200g dark chocolate, melted and cooled slightly, plus extra for topping"]','["Line a 900g loaf tin (ours was 9 x 20 x 7cm) with two sheets of overlapping baking parchment, leaving some overhanging on all sides of the tin. Put 175g of the raspberries, the caster sugar and lemon juice in a pan over a medium heat and simmer for 3 mins until softened slightly. Tip into afood processoror use ahand blenderto blitz until smooth.","Whisk the double cream, vanilla and condensed milk using an electric whisk until soft peaks form. Pour in the raspberry purée, then stir carefully a few times to marble the raspberry through the cream.","Tip the remaining raspberries into the base of the lined tin. Cover with a third of the cream mixture, spreading it out evenly. Tap the tin down on a surface so that the mixture covers the raspberries. Using a spoon, drizzle over half of the melted chocolate to cover the cream. Top with another third of the cream mixture and spread it out. Drizzle over the remaining chocolate and top with the remaining cream.","Use the overhanging parchment to cover the top of the tin, using more parchment if it doesn’t cover the terrine completely, and freeze for at least 8 hrs, or overnight. Before serving, let the ice cream sit at room temperature for 10 mins. Tip upside down and remove from the tin, and drizzle with a little more melted chocolate to decorate. Run boiling water over your knife, wipe dry, and slice to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9213,9213,'en','Blueberry & coconut frozen ‘cheesecake’ bars','These gluten and dairy-free berry and coconut cream sweet treats from BBC Good Food magazine reader Jenna Hope are entirely raw','["280g unsalted cashew nuts","flavourless oil, for greasing","140g unsalted almonds","140g pitted dates","100g coconut cream","2 tbsp coconut oil, melted","2 tbsp clear honey","1 tsp vanilla extract","juice ½  lemon","140g blueberries, plus a handful","5 pitted dates"]','["Soak the cashew nuts in boiling water for 10 mins, or overnight in cold water if you have time. Lightly oil a 20 x 20cm square cake tin.","To make the base, whizz the almonds and dates in a food processor until very finely chopped. Tip into your prepared tin and press the mixture down, smoothing with the back of a spoon until evenly spread across the base. Put the tin in the freezer to firm up while you make the ‘cheesecake’ layer.","Drain the cashew nuts and put half in the food processor. Add the ingredients for the ‘cheesecake’ layer and blitz until smooth and creamy. Remove the tin from the freezer and spread the creamy mixture on top of the base. Return to the freezer for 30-40 mins until firm.","To make the topping, blend the 140g blueberries and the dates together with the remaining cashews in the food processor. Take the tin out of the freezer and spoon over the topping, then scatter over a handful of blueberries. Return to the freezer for at least 1 hr to firm up. Can be stored in the freezer for up to 2 months. Remove from the freezer 10 mins before serving, then slice into 10-12 bars and enjoy."]','2026-01-10 12:23:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9214,9214,'en','Strawberry shortbread frozen yogurt','You don’t need an ice cream machine to make this easy frozen dessert, topped with freeze-dried strawberries and crushed biscuits','["550g strawberries, hulled","500g pot Greek yogurt","397g can condensed milk","2 tsp vanilla bean paste or extract","200ml double cream","8 shortbread biscuits, crushed (optional)","2 tbsp freeze-dried strawberry pieces (optional, available from Waitrose, Sainsbury’s or online)"]','["Put 400g strawberries in a food processor and blitz to a smooth purée. Chop the remaining strawberries into small pieces and set aside. Add the yogurt, condensed milk and vanilla to the processor and whizz again to combine.","Pour the cream into a bowl and lightly whip until it’s just holding its shape. Add roughly one-third of the strawberry mixture, fold together with a spatula, then add the remaining strawberry mixture and the chopped strawberries and mix again.","Pour half into a freezer-proof container, scatter over half the shortbread pieces, if using, and half the freeze-dried strawberries, then cover with the remaining yogurt mixture, crushed shortbread and freeze- dried strawberries. Freeze for at least 4 hrs until solid. Remove from the freezer 10-15 mins before scooping. Freeze for up to 2 months."]','2026-01-10 12:23:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9215,9215,'en','Frozen banana ghosts','Bananas taste spookily like creamy ice cream when frozen in ghostly robes of white chocolate – quick and easy, with just 4 ingredients','["200g bar white chocolate (supermarket own brand Belgian is good), broken into chunks","4 medium-large, ripe bananas","85g desiccated coconut (you won’t use it all)","handful dark chocolate drops"]','["In a small bowl, gently melt the chocolate either in the microwave – in short bursts on high or over a pan of simmering water (make sure the bowl isn’t touching the water). Set aside for a moment while you get the bananas ready.","Peel the bananas, cut in half, and push a lolly stick into the middle of each piece. Spread the coconut out in a shallow bowl. Line a large baking tray with baking parchment, and make sure there is room for the tray in the freezer.","Using a pastry brush, coat a banana half in chocolate, letting excess drip away. Sprinkle with plenty of the coconut until coated, then set it on the prepared sheet. Now add two chocolate eyes and a mouth, and if you like, cut a few little eyebrows from the chocolate drops too. Freeze the lollies for at least 4 hrs, and up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:23:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9216,9216,'en','Blackberry & apple frozen yogurt cake','Layers of frozen yogurt are given a crunchy contrast with an oaty biscuit base in this impressive pud – a great alternative to cheesecake','["85g butter, plus extra for greasing","1 tbsp light muscovado sugar","½  tsp ground cinnamon","200g Hobnob biscuits, finely crushed","1 large (about 350g) Bramley apple, peeled and chopped to give 250g","2 tbsp lemon juice","450g blackberries, plus a few more to serve","2 x 400g cans condensed milk","750g full-fat Greek yogurt (we used Total)","600ml double cream","½  tsp ground cinnamon","4 tbsp light muscovado sugar","1 tsp arrowroot powder mixed with 1 tsp water (optional)"]','["Grease and line the base and sides of a deep 20cm round cake tin with baking parchment, leaving 2.5cm of parchment sticking up above the rim, like a collar. In a large pan, melt the butter with the sugar. Mix together the cinnamon and biscuit crumbs, then stir into the butter and mix until it looks like wet sand. Press the crumbs into the base in an even layer, then freeze.","Put the apple, lemon juice and 1 tbsp water into a large pan. Bring to a simmer, then cover and cook for 3 mins or until totally soft. Pass this pulpy mix through a sieve into a large bowl. Leave to cool. Mash the blackberries with a fork, then sieve into another bowl – a rubber spatula is best for pressing every last bit of fruit from the seeds.","Stir together the condensed milk, 500g yogurt and 300ml cream until evenly mixed. Pour 450g of this onto the apple purée, add 1?4 tsp cinnamon, then whip with a balloon whisk until slightly thickened. Pour onto the biscuit layer, level, then freeze for 30 mins or until firm. Chill the remaining yogurt mixture in the fridge.","Whisk about 3 tbsp of the blackberry purée into the rest of the yogurt mixture until pale pink. Pour one-third of this on top of the apple layer, then freeze until firm. Repeat twice, adding enough fruit to the yogurt mixture to make each layer slightly darker pink than the last. Freeze overnight or until totally solid. Can be made 1 month ahead, wrapped well in the freezer.","When you’re ready to serve, defrost the remaining blackberry purée, if frozen. Bring the purée, 1?4 tsp cinnamon and 1 tbsp of the sugar to a simmer. Stir in the arrowroot mix until slightly thickened and shiny. (Arrowroot does not freeze well, so don’t freeze after this point.) Cool.","Take the cake from the freezer 10 mins before serving. Remove from the tin after 5 mins, peel away the paper and transfer to a plate. Whip the remaining 300ml cream, 250g yogurt and 3 tbsp sugar together until billowy but not stiff. Spoon on top of the cake in peaks and scatter with a few more berries. Add a drizzle of the sauce just before serving, and pass the rest around in a jug."]','2026-01-10 12:23:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9217,9217,'en','Frozen raspberry honeycomb pie','A sweet treat, packed with ice cream, honeycomb and raspberries to satisfy any sweet tooth.','["85g butter, melted","500g tub vanilla ice cream","400g raspberries","150g honeycomb, broken up","150ml pot double cream","100g muscovado sugar","75g butter"]','["Put the caramel biscuits in a food processor and blitz to crumbs. Add the melted butter and blitz again until well combined. Use the biscuit crumbs to line a deep 22cm fluted tart tin, pressing the crumbs into the base and up the sides with the back of a spoon until really compact. Chill for 30 mins while you prepare the filling.","Remove the ice cream from the freezer 20 mins before you’re ready to use it. Tip the raspberries into a bowl, reserving a handful, and lightly crush about half with the back of a fork until juicy. Once the ice cream has softened, tip into another bowl and mash with the back of a spoon until pliable but not totally defrosted. Add the raspberries and half the Honeycomb, then ripple together.","Remove the tart case from the fridge and tip the raspberry ice cream mixture into the centre, smoothing out to the edges. Top with the reserved raspberries and honeycomb, pushing them down into the ice cream layer a little, then freeze for 4 hrs until frozen solid.","To make a caramel sauce, put the cream, sugar and butter in a saucepan with a good pinch of salt, and bring to a simmer. Bubble for 5 mins until it’s the consistency of caramel, then cool for 2 mins before serving with slices of the pie. Will keep for 1 week."]','2026-01-10 12:23:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9218,9218,'en','Frozen berry & gingernut yogurt pops','These lollies are seriously cool customers – they''re a cross between cheesecake, frozen yogurt and fruit ice cream','["100g ginger nut biscuits","405g can light condensed milk","250g red berries, we used strawberries, raspberries and redcurrants","500g pot 0% fat natural Greek yogurt","250g purple berries, we used blueberries, blackberries and blackcurrants","8 paper cups","8 wooden lolly sticks"]','["Place the biscuits in a food processor and blitz into crumbs. Add 2 tbsp condensed milk and blend again until the crumbs start to clump together. Divide the biscuit crumbs between 8 paper cups, pressing down with the back of a spoon. Make sure you scrape out every last crumb, then you won’t have to wash the processor before the next step.","Roughly chop any large berries. Put half the red berries, half the remaining condensed milk, and half\r\nthe yogurt in the food processor and blend until smooth. Remove the blade from the processor and stir through the remaining chopped red berries. Divide the mixture between 4 of the paper cups. Repeat with the purple berries and remaining ingredients.","Place a lolly stick into each cup, pushing down into the biscuit base to help it stand up straight. Freeze for at least 4 hrs before serving. To remove the lollies from the cups, tip upside down, and gentle squeeze the cup until the lolly slips out."]','2026-01-10 12:23:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9219,9219,'en','Frozen banana yogurt','This no-churn frozen dessert is a great alternative to ice cream. Serve topped with crunchy banana chips','["4 overripe bananas - the blacker the better - about 375 after peeling","500g pot full-fat Greek yogurt","175g condensed milk","big handful banana chips"]','["Whizz the flesh from the bananas, yogurt and condensed milk together in a food processor or blender until smooth. Scrape into an ice cream container or loaf tin, or divide between individual pots.","Crush up the banana chips, if using, by tipping them into a food bag and bashing with the end of a rolling pin – like you would biscuits for a cheesecake base. Swirl through the frozen yogurt mix, then cover the container or containers well with cling film and freeze overnight until solid. Will keep for 3 months in the freezer."]','2026-01-10 12:23:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9220,9220,'en','Frozen raspberry & white choc cheesecake','With its biscuit base and creamy topping, cheesecake is always a winner. This fruity frozen version is a perfect make-ahead dessert for entertaining','["200ml pot double cream","200g bar white chocolate, broken into chunks, plus extra to serve","300g raspberries, plus extra to serve","500g cream cheese","50g golden caster sugar","300g vanilla or white chocolate ice cream - all will taste good, but ice creams without too many chunks in are best","175g crunchy butter biscuits - we used Fox''s Butter Crinkle Crunch","140g ginger nuts","140g butter, melted"]','["Brush a 20 x 30cm baking tin with a\r\nlittle oil, then line well with two layers of\r\ncling film, leaving overhang for lifting out\r\n– or use a tin with a loose bottom. Put the\r\nbiscuits into a food processor and whizz\r\nto crumbs, then tip in the melted butter\r\nand mix again. Press the crumbs firmly\r\ninto the base of the prepared tin, then\r\nchill while you make the filling.","Put the cream and chocolate in a small\r\npan. Melt very gently, stirring, until no\r\nlumps of chocolate remain. Clean out the\r\nfood processor and add the raspberries\r\nand creamy chocolate mixture. Whizz together until it can’t get any\r\nsmoother, then rub through a sieve to\r\nget rid of the raspberry seeds.","Put the cream cheese into a mixing\r\nbowl with the sugar and the sieved\r\nraspberry mixture. Beat with an\r\nelectric whisk until smooth.","Let the ice cream soften in a big bowl,\r\nbut not melt, then fold in the cream\r\ncheese mixture a little at a time until\r\nwell mixed and no ice-cream lumps are\r\nvisible. Scrape into the prepared tin and level the top. Cover with cling film, not\r\nletting it touch the top of the cheesecake,\r\nthen freeze at least overnight or up\r\nto 3 months before serving.","To serve, remove the covering cling\r\nfilm, lift out the cheesecake, or slide out\r\nif in a loose-bottomed tin. Remove any\r\nremaining cling film. Decorate the top\r\nwith fresh raspberries and drizzle with\r\na little more melted white chocolate."]','2026-01-10 12:23:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9221,9221,'en','Frozen banana & praline parfait','This freeze-ahead dinner party dessert has real wow-factor, so all that’s left for you to do on the night is present it in stunning style','["200g caster sugar","100g whole blanched hazelnuts","sunflower oil, for greasing","2 ripe bananas (the skin should be very spotty, but not bruised or black)","2 tsp lemon juice","300ml double cream","2 egg whites","100g caster sugar","4 ripe but firm bananas","100g caster sugar"]','["To make the praline, put the sugar\r\ninto a heavy-based pan with 3 tbsp\r\nwater. Place over a low heat until the\r\nsugar has dissolved and is clear. Don''t stir, or it will crystallise. Increase\r\nthe heat and bubble to a dark caramel\r\n(see video technique), about\r\n5 mins. Remove from the heat, stir\r\nthrough the nuts, then tip onto a lightly\r\ngreased non-stick baking tray. Spread to\r\nlevel and leave to cool. Be careful as the\r\ntray will get very hot.","When the praline is cold and brittle,\r\nbreak it into pieces. Then, using the end\r\nof a rolling pin, smash it up until fairly well\r\ncrushed. If this is proving hard work, tip\r\ninto a food processor and pulse until it’s\r\nthe texture of coarse breadcrumbs.","Line a 1.2-litre loaf tin with a strip of\r\nbaking parchment (this size tin gives a neat shape, but you can set the parfait in any shaped tin, or individual pudding basins or ramekins). In a bowl, mash the\r\nbananas with half the lemon juice until\r\nyou have a rough purée, then set aside.","Put the cream into a bowl and whip\r\nuntil it holds its shape but is still a little\r\nsoft. In another very clean bowl and\r\nusing a very clean electric whisk, beat\r\nthe egg whites with a squeeze more\r\nlemon juice until stiff. Slowly add the\r\nsugar until you have a stiff, shiny\r\nmeringue.","Gently fold the whipped cream and\r\nmeringue together, then add the banana\r\nand most of the praline, leaving about\r\n4 tbsp to serve. Spoon into the loaf tin,\r\nsmooth the top and freeze until firm,\r\npreferably overnight.","To serve, remove the parfait from the\r\nfreezer 10 mins before serving and leave\r\nin the fridge to soften slightly. Meanwhile,\r\nslice the bananas on a slant, allowing\r\n3 slices for each serving. Lay the slices\r\non a baking tray set on a wooden board\r\nand scatter heavily with the sugar. Use a\r\nblowtorch to caramelise the banana, then set aside. Be very\r\ncareful as the tray will be extremely hot. If you don''t have a blowtorch, place the slices into a hot, dry frying pan and sear the sugar-coated sides until caramelised. Lift and flip them over to a tray.","To plate up, sprinkle a neat line of praline\r\njust off-centre on each plate. Arrange the slices of caramelised\r\nbanana at opposing angles. Unmould the parfait, then use a\r\nwarmed knife to neaten the sides\r\nand cut into finger-thick slices. Lay the slice on the opposite\r\nside of the plate to the banana\r\nand serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:23:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9222,9222,'en','Frozen blackberry fool','Falling somewhere between an ice cream and a syllabub, this berry-rippled dessert is seasonal and spectacular','["300g blackberries","juice 1 lemon","85g golden caster sugar","300ml double cream","shortbread biscuits, to serve"]','["Mash most of the blackberries with the\r\nlemon juice and half the sugar. Whip\r\nthe cream with the remaining sugar.\r\nFold the whipped cream and blackberry\r\nmix together to make a mauve cream,\r\nthen tip into a freezer container and\r\nfreeze until set. Serve in scoops in\r\nglasses, with the shortbread and\r\nremaining blackberries on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:23:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9223,9223,'en','Frozen banana & peanut butter cheesecake','A great standby dessert with that works well and will impress children and adults','["3 small bananas","50g butter, melted","10 digestive biscuits, crushed to crumbs","142ml tub double cream","140g icing sugar","400g tub soft cheese","½  tsp vanilla extract","237g pot crunchy peanut butter"]','["Several hours before, place 2 bananas in the freezer until the skins go black, then remove and defrost. You’ll be left\r\nwith really soft bananas. Peel, then mash well and set aside.","Mix the butter and biscuits together, then press into a 22cm springform cake tin. Whip the cream until it just holds its\r\nshape. In a separate bowl, beat the sugar, soft cheese and vanilla together until completely combined. In another bowl, beat the peanut butter to loosen it.","Fold the cheese mixture into the peanut butter, then tip in the mashed banana and gently fold in the cream. Spread the mix over the biscuit base and smooth the top. Freeze for several hours or preferably overnight. To serve, leave the cake in the fridge for 20 mins, then run a knife around the side and remove the sides of the tin. Slice the remaining banana and use to decorate the cheesecake."]','2026-01-10 12:23:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9224,9224,'en','Christmas light cake','Wow guests with our fairy light Christmas cake topping, made with fondant icing and sugared almonds. You could also use jelly sweets, if you like','["100g smooth apricot jam","1 x 20cm fruitcake","300g icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","600g marzipan","blue food colouring gel","1kg ready-to-roll white fondant icing","green food colouring gel","500g coloured sugared almonds (see tip, below)"]','["Warm the jam in a small pan over a low heat until loosened. Brush the fruitcake all over with half the jam. Lightly dust a work surface with icing sugar, thenroll themarzipan out into a circle large enough to cover the top and side of the cake – it should be about ½cm thick. Lift the marzipan onto the cake using the rolling pin, then smooth the marzipan down the side and trim away any excess.","Add a few drops of blue food colouring to the fondant icing, then knead until the fondant is soft and pale blue (see tip, below).","Brush the marzipan-covered cake all over with the remaining jam. Roll the blue fondant out into a circle large enough to cover the top and side of the cake, then lift onto it using the rolling pin and smooth down the side. Trim away any excess fondant, and smooth out any marks using the palm of your hand. Set aside.","Mix the icing sugar with 1 tbsp water at a time until you have a thick, pipeable icing (you can use up to 3 tbsp water). Divide the icing between two bowls. Add a few drops of the green food colouring to one of the bowls (leaving one bowl plain), stir to combine, then transfer to apiping bagfitted with a medium round nozzle.","Pipe wiggly lines of the green icing all the way around the top and side of the cake a few times – this will be the ‘wire’ for the fairy lights. Use the tip of a cutlery knife or teaspoon to dot a small amount of the plain icing onto the backs of the sugared almonds, then arrange these along the piped green wire so the almonds resemble a string of fairy lights."]','2026-01-10 12:23:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9225,9225,'en','Cranberry & hazelnut cake','A versatile and light fruitcake with a hint of spice and plenty of juicy cranberries and cherries – ice as you wish!','["200g butter, softened, plus a little extra for greasing","100g raisin","200g pot glacé cherry, halved","100g dried cranberries","200g fresh or frozen cranberry","zest and juice 1 orange","50ml sherry, brandy, Disaronno or Frangelico","250g light soft brown sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","4 large egg","200g self-raising flour","100g ground almond","100g toasted hazelnut, chopped","1 tbsp mixed spice"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. grease a deep 20cm cake tin and line with baking parchment – high enough to come 2.5cm above the top of the tin. Put the raisins, cherries, all the cranberries, orange zest and juice, and alcohol into a small pan. Bring to the boil and leave to simmer for 3 mins, until the cranberries have softened a little and most of the liquid has evaporated. Set aside to cool.","Put the sugar, butter and vanilla in a bowl and beat with an electric mixer until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs, flour, almonds, hazelnuts and mixed spice. Whisk again until just combined, then stir through the soaked fruit and any remaining juices. Tip the cake mixture into the tin and level the top, then bake for 1 hr 20 mins, until a skewer pushed into the centre of the cake comes out clean. If the skewer has any uncooked cake mixture on it, return it to the oven for 10 mins, then check again. Leave in the tin to cool. Will freeze for 4 months wrapped in cling film then foil."]','2026-01-10 12:23:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9226,9226,'en','Suits-all Christmas cake','Give the classic Christmas fruitcake a makeover with cinnamon, rose, orange blossom and tropical mango for a fruity and fragrant cake','["zest 1 orange or 2 clementines, plus 100m juice","zest 2 lemons, plus 100ml juice","1 tbsp orange blossom water","1 tsp rosewater","3 tbsp clear honey","200g glacé cherries","200g mixed peel","200g dried apricots, diced","175g golden sultanas","140g dried cranberries or sour cherries, or a mix","100g dried mangoes, diced","280g butter at room temperature, plus extra for greasing","140g golden caster sugar","140g light muscovado sugar","4 large eggs, beaten","250g plain flour","100g ground almonds","2 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp orange blossom water","50ml orange juice"]','["Mix together the orange and lemon zests and juice, the orange blossom water, rosewater and honey in a large bowl. Stir in all of the dried fruit, cover and leave overnight to soak.","The next day, heat oven to 160C/140C fan/ gas 3. Grease and double-line a 22cm round or square cake tin (for a flatter cake) or a 20cm round or square tin (for a deeper cake) with baking parchment. In another big bowl, beat the butter and sugars together with an electric mixer until pale and fluffy. Beat in the eggs, one by one, then fold in the flour, almonds and cinnamon.","Tip in the soaked fruits and any juices left in the bowl, and stir in. Spoon the mix into the prepared tin and level the top. If you want your cake flat rather than slightly rounded, make a gradual dip in the centre of the mix with the back of a wooden spoon. Bake for 1 hr 30 mins, then turn the oven down to 140C/120C fan/gas 1 and bake for another 1 hr 30 mins for 22cm cakes, or 1 hr 50 mins for 20cm cakes, until a skewer poked into the centre comes out clean. Cool in the tin, sitting on a wire rack.","While the cake is still warm, mix together the feeding ingredients, pepper the cake with holes using a thin skewer and spoon over the liquid. If you’re making the cake ahead of time, feed once a week for up to 4 weeks. Keep well wrapped in parchment, inside an airtight container, for up to 1 month. If you’re not getting ahead, this cake tastes just as delicious a day or two after baking."]','2026-01-10 12:23:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9227,9227,'en','Jewelled fruit, nut & seed cake','If you’re not keen on icing and marzipan, bake a crown of toasted nuts, seeds and juicy cherries ontoyour cake instead','["1 batch uncooked Hot toddy fruitcake mix (see link below)","20cm thin cake board (optional)","approx 65cm length wide ribbon","50g butter","50g golden syrup","2 tbsp large unsalted cashew nuts","3 tbsp whole blanched almonds","5 tbsp shelled pistachios","25g Brazil nuts","85ml glacé cherries","50g dried cranberries","2 tbsp pumpkin seeds"]','["Make the Hot toddy cake (see link, right) in a loose-bottom tin, holding back about 2 tbsp of the mix for later. While it bakes, bake the fruit and nut topping. Melt the butter and golden syrup together, then toss with the nuts, dried fruit and seeds. Set aside; the butter mix will start to cool and thicken.","Take the cake out of the oven 30 mins before the end of cooking, then gently spread over the remaining cake mix with\r\nthe back of a spoon. The cake will still be quite soft but will take the weight, don’t worry about it sinking. Scatter the fruit and nut mix over the top in an even layer. Bake for the remaining 30 mins until the cake is cooked and the nuts golden. Test for doneness by poking a skewer through the topping and into the cake. If it’s underdone, but the nuts are golden, just cover with foil and give it another 10 mins; then test again.","Leave the cake to cool completely in the tin, so that the nutty topping firms up. Loosen any obviously sticky edges, then push the cake out of the tin from the bottom. Transfer to a cake board or plate and fix the ribbon around the base before serving. Can be kept in an airtight tin for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:23:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9229,9229,'en','Dundee cake','A famous traditional Scottish fruitcake with cherries, sultanas and almonds, and a sweet glaze','["100g blanched almonds","180g unsalted butter, at room temperature","180g light muscovado sugar","zest 1 large orange","3 tbsp apricot jam or marmalade","225g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","3 large eggs, beaten","100g ground almonds","2 tbsp milk","500g mixed dried fruits","100g whole glacé cherries","1 tbsp milk","2 tsp caster sugar"]','["Put the almonds into a small bowl and pour over boiling water to just cover. Leave for 5 mins then drain in a sieve and leave to dry.","Preheat the oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 5. Line a deep loose-based 20cm cake tin with baking parchment.","Put the butter in a large bowl and beat well until soft. Add the sugar and beat until light and fluffy. Stir in the orange zest and apricot jam.","Sieve together the flour and baking powder. Add the eggs to the creamed butter and sugar, a little at a time, beating well between each addition. If the mixture starts to curdle, stir in a little flour.","Add the remaining flour and ground almonds and mix well. Mix in the milk and then add the dried fruit and cherries and mix gently together.","Spoon the mixture into the prepared tin and spread level using the back of a spoon. Arrange the whole almonds close together in neat circles on the top of the cake. Bake in the oven for 45 mins.","Lower the oven temperature to 160C/130 C fan/gas 2 and cook for a further 60–80 minutes. Check the cake after 50 minutes by inserting a wooden or metal skewer into the cake. When it’s done it should have just a few crumbs attached. Check every 10 minutes  - it’s important not to overcook this cake so the centre will be a little soft.","When cooked, remove the cake briefly from the oven, put the milk and sugar into a small pan and heat gently until the sugar has dissolved. Brush over the top of the cake and return the cake to the oven for 2-3 mins. Remove and allow the cake to cool in the tin. When quite cold remove from the tin and wrap in foil and keep for at least 2 days before cutting."]','2026-01-10 12:23:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9230,9230,'en','Gingered rich fruit cake','This traditional cake has been jazzed up with lots of ginger – you’d never know it’s gluten-free and dairy-free. Perfect for weddings and Christmas','["oil, for greasing","100g each dried currants, sultanas and raisins","225g each semi-dried figs and prunes, roughly chopped","200g tub crystallised ginger","100g stem ginger, from a jar, chopped","2 tbsp stem ginger syrup","4 tbsp Cointreau","1 tsp each ground ginger and mixed spice","zest 2 lemons","150ml olive oil","175g light muscovado sugar","4 eggs","225g gluten-free flour","1 tsp gluten-free baking powder","4 tbsp apricot jam","1 tbsp Cointreau","450g mixed fruit, including figs, prunes, dates and apricots"]','["Heat oven to 140C/fan 120C/gas 1. Lightly oil a 71?2cm deep, 25cm round cake tin, and line it with a double layer of baking parchment.","Mix the dried fruits, ginger and syrup, Cointreau, spices and lemon zest. Put the olive oil, sugar and eggs in a bowl, whisk together until light and fluffy. Sift the flour and baking powder into the mixture and tip in the fruit. Fold and stir together well.","Spoon the mixture into the cake tin. Bake in the centre of the oven for 2-21?2 hrs, or until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Cover with foil if the cake begins to over-brown. Take from the oven and leave to cool in the tin. Remove, leaving the baking parchment in place until you decorate.","For the topping: warm the jam and Cointreau together until the jam is liquid, allow to cool. Arrange the fruit on the cake and brush with the jam."]','2026-01-10 12:23:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9231,9231,'en','Fruitcake with apricot butter icing','This delicious light fruit sponge is packed with storecupboard staples like nuts and dried fruit, it''s also budget-friendly','["200g butter, softened","100g whole almonds","200g plain flour","200g icing sugar","4 medium eggs","700g mixed dried fruits","25ml brandy","150g butter, softened","150g apricot jam","275g icing sugar, sifted"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease a deep 20cm round cake tin with\r\na little bit of the butter, then line with\r\ngreaseproof paper or baking parchment.\r\nWrap a couple of sheets of newspaper\r\naround the outside of the tin, then\r\nsecure with string.","In a food processor, whizz the almonds\r\nwith the flour until the mix resembles\r\ncrumbs. Beat the butter and icing sugar\r\nuntil light and fluffy. Beat in the eggs,\r\none by one, then fold in the flour and\r\nalmonds, dried fruit and brandy. Scrape\r\ninto the tin, level the surface and bake\r\nfor 1 hr 15 mins, until a skewer poked in\r\ncomes out clean. Cool in the tin.","When the cake is completely cold,\r\nmake the icing quickly by beating the\r\nbutter, jam and icing sugar until pale.\r\nDon’t allow the butter to get too warm\r\nor overbeat as the icing might split.\r\nSwirl all over the cake, then leave in\r\na cool place to set (but not the fridge)."]','2026-01-10 12:23:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9232,9232,'en','Hot toddy fruitcake','This fabulous Christmas cake can be made and decorated in four very different ways. Just choose yourfavourite','["200ml hot, strong black tea (use any type)","3 tbsp whisky","3 tbsp good-quality orange marmalade, thin or medium shred","700g mixed dried fruits","100g mixed peel","100g glacé cherries (natural colour)","225g butter","225g golden caster sugar","4 eggs, beaten","225g plain flour","1 tsp ground mixed spice","1 tsp ground cinnamon","finely grated zest 1 lemon","2 tsp caster sugar","50ml hot black tea","1 tbsp whisky (or use orange juice if you prefer)"]','["Mix the hot tea, whisky and marmalade\r\nin a large bowl until the marmalade melts.\r\nStir in all of the dried fruit, peel and cherries,\r\nthen cover and leave to soak overnight.","Next day, heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3\r\nand grease and double-line a 20cm round,\r\ndeep cake tin with non-stick baking paper.\r\nUsing electric beaters, cream together the\r\nbutter and sugar until fluffy. Add the eggs\r\na little at a time, beating well after each\r\naddition, then fold in the flour and spices,\r\nfollowed by the lemon zest and soaked fruit.\r\nAdd any liquid that hasn’t been absorbed by\r\nthe fruit, too. Spoon into the prepared tin,\r\nlevel the top, then bake for 1½ hrs. Turn the\r\noven down to 140C/fan 120C/gas 1 and\r\nbake for another 1½ hrs or until a skewer\r\ninserted into the centre of the cake comes\r\nout clean. Cool on a wire rack in the tin.","While the cake is still warm, use the skewer\r\nto pepper the cake with holes, poking it all\r\nthe way down. Dissolve the sugar in the tea,\r\nadd the whisky or orange juice, then spoon\r\nover the surface. If you’re making the cake\r\nahead of time, feed it with a fresh swig of hot\r\ntoddy every week, but take care not to make the cake soggy. Can be kept for a month \r\nwell-wrapped in an airtight container in a\r\ncool, dry place. If short on time, the cake can\r\nbe made the same day that you decorate it."]','2026-01-10 12:23:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9234,9234,'en','Festive fruit & nut cake','This fabulously moist and nutty Christmas cake is baked with a syrup and nut topping – a bit like a Florentine biscuit','["250g butter, at room temperature","140g light muscovado sugar","6 large eggs, beaten","280g plain flour","85g ground almonds","2 tsp ground ginger","2 tsp ground cinnamon","700g luxury mixed fruits (including raisins, currants, sultanas, mixed peel and glace cherries)","3 tbsp dark rum","140g white marzipan, diced","50g each whole skinned hazelnuts and blanched almonds","85g each Brazil nuts and flaked almonds","140g whole glacé cherries","100g golden syrup","1 metre of wide ribbon"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/gas\r\n4/fan 160C and lightly grease\r\nand line the base and sides of a\r\ndeep 22-23cm round loose-based\r\ncake tin with Bake-o-Glide or\r\nbaking parchment (see overleaf).\r\nBeat the butter, sugar, eggs, flour,\r\nground almonds and spices until\r\nthoroughly mixed and creamy,\r\npreferably with an electric beater\r\nor in a food mixer.","Measure off 100g/4oz of the\r\ncake mixture, put in a bowl and\r\nset aside. Fold the fruit and rum\r\ninto the remaining mixture, then\r\ngently stir in the marzipan. Spoon\r\nthis mixture into the prepared\r\ncake tin and flatten with a spatula\r\nto make a smooth even surface,\r\nthen make a slight dip in the centre\r\nof the cake. This simple trick will\r\ngive the finished cake a nice flat\r\ntop. Bake for 11?4 hours.","While the cake is in the oven,\r\nmake the fruit and nut topping. Mix\r\nall the nuts, cherries and syrup into\r\nthe remaining cake mixture (see tip\r\noverleaf). Spoon the mixture on top\r\nof the part-cooked cake (once it\r\nhas had its 11?4 hours), evenly\r\ndistributing the mixture of nuts and\r\ncherries across the surface of the\r\ncake. Loosely cover the top of the\r\ntin with foil.","Return to the oven for 40 minutes\r\nmore, then take off the foil and\r\nbake for another 10-15 minutes,\r\nso the nuts can turn golden. Keep\r\nan eye on them, so they don’t get\r\ntoo dark. To test the cake mixture is cooked, insert a fine skewer into\r\nthe cake – if it comes out clean\r\nthen it''s ready. Cool in the tin then\r\nturn out, keeping the lining on, and\r\nwrap with foil. (The cake will\r\nkeep for up to 2 weeks or can be\r\nfrozen for up to 2 months.)","To serve, remove the cake from\r\nthe foil and strip away the lining.\r\nPlace on a board or serving plate\r\nand tie with a decorative ribbon."]','2026-01-10 12:23:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9235,9235,'en','Sugar-crunch fruitcake','Moist fruit and a crunchy sugary topping mean it’s impossible to have just one slice of this delicious cake','["100g butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","2 eggs","85g caster sugar","50g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","zest ½ lemon","2 portions Apple, pear & cherry compote (see ''Goes well with'')","2 tbsp demerara sugar"]','["First make the Apple, pear & cherry compote (see ''Goes well with''). You''ll need 2 of the 12 portions of compote for this cake.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and\r\ngrease a 20cm cake tin. Beat together\r\nthe butter, eggs, caster sugar, flour,\r\nalmonds and lemon zest to a smooth\r\nmixture. Scrape into the tin, dollop over\r\nthe compote, then bake for 25-30 mins\r\nuntil well risen. Scatter over the sugar\r\nand return to the oven for 10-15 mins\r\nuntil the cake is cooked through.","Remove\r\nfrom the tin and eat warm or at room\r\ntemperature with cream or custard."]','2026-01-10 12:23:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9236,9236,'en','Apricot & almond fruitcake','This bake is lighter than the traditional rich fruitcake and is a blank canvas to ice and decorate as you wish','["140g golden sultanas","4 tbsp sherry","250g pack butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","250g light soft brown sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs, beaten","200g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","100g ground almonds","50g toasted flaked almonds","140g dried apricots, chopped","140g mixed peel","zest and juice 1 lemon","zest and juice 1 orange"]','["Mix the sultanas and sherry and set aside for 1 hr to soak.","Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Grease a deep, 23cm loose-bottomed cake tin, and line the base and sides with a double layer of baking parchment that comes about 2.5cm above the sides of the tin. In your largest mixing bowl, beat the butter, sugar and vanilla together until pale and fluffy. Beat in the eggs one by one.","Stir in the flour, baking powder, and the ground and flaked almonds. Next, add the soaked sultanas with any remaining sherry, the dried apricots, the mixed peel, and all the zest and juice. Scrape into the cake tin, smoothing out the surface.","Bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 1 hr 25 mins. Poke with a skewer in the centre to check it is cooked – if the skewer comes out with any uncooked mixture stuck to it, bake for 10 mins more before checking again. Cool in the tin. Decorated, or wrapped in greaseproof paper and foil, the cake will keep for up to a month."]','2026-01-10 12:23:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9237,9237,'en','Chocolate fruitcake','If anyone in your family isn’t keen on traditional fruitcake, this might be the compromise you’ve been looking for','["200g butter","200g dark brown soft sugar","100g dark chocolate (we used 80%) broken into chunks","75ml brandy","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g raisins","250g currants","100g dried cranberries","100g dried sour cherries","100g mixed peel","200g self-raising flour","100g ground almonds","3 tbsp cocoa","1 tsp mixed spice","3 eggs, beaten with a fork"]','["Put the butter, sugar, chocolate, brandy,\r\nvanilla and dried fruits into a large\r\nsaucepan. Heat gently, stirring occasionally\r\nuntil everything has melted together.\r\nRemove from the heat.","Heat oven to 150C/130C fan/gas 2.\r\nLine a deep cake tin, 20cm round or\r\n18cm square, with a double layer of\r\nbaking parchment. Wrap a few layers\r\nof newspaper around the outside and\r\nsecure with string.","Mix the flour, almonds, cocoa and spice\r\ntogether. Stir the eggs into the slightly\r\ncooled chocolate mixture in the saucepan,\r\nfollowed by the flour mixture. Scrape into\r\nyour prepared tin and bake for 1½ hrs-\r\n1 hr 45 mins or until a skewer poked in\r\ncomes out clean. Cool in the tin, then\r\ndecorate (see ''Goes well with'', right, for decoration ideas).Greaseproof-wrapped cake will\r\nkeep for 2 months in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9238,9238,'en','Hazelnut fruitcake','Enjoy this ‘glut and nut’ cake, made with excess courgettes and apples, with a cup of tea','["225g soft, unsalted butter, plus a little extra for the tin","100g bag blanched hazelnuts, half very roughly chopped","225g light muscovado sugar","225g self-raising flour","3 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 tsp mixed spice or ground cinnamon","1 tsp baking powder","175g courgettes, coarsely grated","1 eating apple, grated (about 85g/3oz flesh)","250g mixed dried fruits"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nButter a deep, 20cm round cake tin\r\nand line the base and sides with baking\r\nparchment. Put the whole hazelnuts, plus\r\n1 tbsp each of the sugar and flour, into\r\na food processor and whizz until the\r\nhazelnuts are as fine as you can get them.","Add the butter, remaining sugar and\r\neggs to the processor, then tip in the\r\nvanilla, spice, ¼ tsp salt, remaining flour\r\nand baking powder. Whizz until smooth.\r\nRemove the blade, then stir in the grated\r\ncourgettes, apple and dried fruit.","Spoon the mix into the tin, smooth\r\nthe top, then scatter with the chopped\r\nhazelnuts, pressing them into the batter\r\na little. Bake for 1 hr 10 mins (see tip,\r\nbelow), covering the top loosely with foil\r\nafter 45 mins, until the cake is risen and\r\ngolden. Cool in the tin for 20 mins, then\r\nremove and cool on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:23:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9239,9239,'en','Easy apple fruit cake','This cake has all the flavours of Christmas, but won’t take ages to make – you can decorate it any way you like. Ideal for a wedding cake too','["200g butter, softened plus extra for greasing","200g dark muscovado sugar","3 eggs, beaten","1 tbsp black treacle","200g self-raising flour","2 tsp mixed spice","1 tsp baking powder","2 eating apples, grated (approx 100g each)","300g mixed sultanas and raisins"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter and line the bottom of a deep, round 20cm cake tin with greaseproof paper. Beat the first seven ingredients together in a large bowl (electric hand-\r\nbeaters are best for this), until pale and thick. Using a large metal spoon, gently fold in the fruit until evenly combined.","Spoon the batter into the tin and bake for 50 mins-1 hr or until the cake is dark golden, springy to the touch and has shrunk away from the tin slightly. A skewer inserted into the centre will come out clean when it’s ready. Cool completely before decorating. Will keep, wrapped in an airtight container or iced, for up to a week, or can be frozen un-iced for up to a month – defrost fully before decorating."]','2026-01-10 12:23:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9240,9240,'en','Little frosty Christmas cakes','These delightful mini fruitcakes make perfect gifts for friends and neighbours','["butter, for greasing","1 quantity Easy apple fruit cake, uncooked (see link below)","2 tbsp apricot jam","500g pack natural marzipan","500g pack ready-to-roll white icing","16 fresh cranberries","bunch rosemary, broken into small fronds","50g caster sugar","1 egg white","50g icing sugar","approx 1m gold ribbon"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Butter eight 150ml ramekins and line the bottoms with circles of non-stick baking paper. Divide the cake mix between the ramekins, transfer to a baking sheet and slide into the oven. Bake for 30 mins until springy and dark golden brown. Leave until cool enough to handle, then run a round-edged knife around the edge of the each cake. Turn out and cool completely on a rack.","If the cakes have risen into peaks, make flat by slicing the tops off with a serrated knife. Melt the jam with 1 tbsp water and brush over the top of the cakes. Lightly knead the marzipan and shape eight golf ball-sized balls. (You will have some left over – wrap up well for another time.) Using a rolling pin, gently roll the balls into flat circles, approx 1cm thick and the same diameter as the cakes. Sit the marzipan on the jammy side of the cakes. Do the same with the icing, brushing the marzipan with a little cooled, boiled water to help it stick.","Beat the egg white until just frothy and broken up. Spread the caster sugar over a plate. Dip the cranberries and rosemary in the egg white, shake off the excess and roll in the caster sugar to create a frosty effect. Leave to dry for 15 mins. Tip away all but 2 tsp of the egg white and mix with the icing sugar to create a thick paste. Use to fix two cranberries and a sprig of rosemary to the top of each cake. Decorate with gold ribbon. The cakes will keep in an airtight container for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:23:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9241,9241,'en','Blood orange upside-down cake','Make the most of the flavour and beautiful colour of blood oranges in this stunning upside-down cake. It’s a perfect cake to enjoy with a cuppa','["2 blood oranges, zested","200g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","200g light brown soft sugar","4 eggs","125g plain flour","75g polenta or cornmeal","2 tsp baking powder","100g natural yogurt","2-3 tbsp milk (optional)"]','["Carefully remove the pith from the zested oranges, being careful to keep them whole. Slice into thin rounds, picking out and discarding the pips. Set aside.","Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line the base of a 23cm loose-bottomed cake tin with baking parchment. Put the tin on a baking sheet, then arrange the orange slices in the base, overlapping slightly to cover as much of it as possible.","Beat the butter, sugar and zest together until pale and fluffy. Mix in the eggs, one at a time, folding in a couple of spoonfuls of flour between each addition to prevent the mixture from curdling. Fold in the remaining flour, polenta and baking powder followed by the yogurt. If the mixture seems a little dry, add 2-3 tbsp milk. Bake for 35-40 mins until a skewer comes out clean. Serve in slices.Will keep chilled for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9242,9242,'en','Royal summer trifle','Wow a crowd with this fruity trifle. It serves 10, making it ideal as a sharing dessert for an al fresco party to mark the Queen’s Platinum Jubilee','["500ml fresh shop-bought vanilla custard","400g madeira cake, cut into chunks","70ml berry cordial of your choice","150g raspberries","300ml double cream","3 tbsp icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla bean paste","250g strawberries","small handful of mint leaves, to garnish","1 orange, halved and sliced","6 gelatine leaves","100g caster sugar","1 lemon, zest pared into strips, juiced","500g strawberries, hulled","a drop of red food colouring (optional)","600ml double cream","200ml caster sugar","2 oranges, zested and juiced"]','["First, make the jelly. Put the gelatine in a small bowl, cover with water and set aside to soak. Meanwhile, tip the sugar, lemon zest and juice and 400ml water into a pan over a low heat and simmer, stirring occasionally until the sugar has dissolved. Add the strawberries and bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer and cook for 5 mins until the strawberries have broken down. Pour the mixture through a sieve into a jug. Squeeze the excess water from the gelatine and stir this through the strawberry mixture until dissolved, then stir in a drop of red food colouring, if using.","Pour the custard into the base of a 3-litre trifle bowl and top with the cake pieces. Drizzle with the berry cordial and scatter with the raspberries. Slowly and carefully pour over the jelly mixture and chill for 5 hrs until set.","When the jelly layer is set, make the orange cream layer. Put the cream, sugar and orange zest in a pan over a low heat and bring to a simmer. Turn up the heat to medium and bubble for 3 mins exactly, then immediately remove from the heat and stir in the orange juice. Pour the mixture through a sieve over the set jelly layer and chill for 4 hrs.","Whip the double cream, icing sugar and vanilla bean paste to soft peaks using an electric whisk, then dollop the whipped cream over the trifle using a large spoon. Chill for at least 1 hr or until ready to serve. Halve most of the strawberries through the stem and scatter these over the trifle along with the mint leaves. Serve the orange slices and remaining whole strawberries in a bowl on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:23:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9243,9243,'en','Gooseberry jam, muscat & mascarpone cake','Impress guests with this stunning muscat and mascarpone cake, made with a luxurious gooseberry jam centre. This grown-up dessert is perfect for afternoon tea','["215g butter, at room temperature, plus extra for the tins","285g caster sugar","1 tsp almond extract","½  lemon, zested","250g self-raising flour","150g ground almonds","165g plain yogurt","3 medium eggs, at room temperature, lightly beaten","200g mascarpone","150ml double cream","2 tbsp muscat dessert wine","2-3 tbsp icing sugar, to taste, plus extra to serve","250g gooseberry jam","edible flowers or lightly toasted flaked almonds, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and butter two 23cm cake tins, then line with baking parchment. Beat the butter and sugar together until light and fluffy using an electric whisk, then beat in the almond extract and the lemon zest. Mix the flour, almonds and a pinch of salt together in another bowl. With the whisk on a low speed, gradually add the yogurt and eggs to the bowl with the butter and sugar mixture, alternating with spoonfuls of the flour and almond mixture until everything is fully combined.","Scrape the batter into the prepared tins, dividing it evenly. Bake for 30 mins until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave the cakes in the tin to cool for 5 mins, then turn them out onto a wire rack, peel away the parchment and leave to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Whisk the mascarpone, cream, wine and icing sugar together using an electric whisk for 2-3 mins until you have soft peaks.","Put one of the cooled cakes on a serving plate. Carefully spread over the jam (it’s easy to break the sponge so be gentle), then gently spread the mascarpone cream on top of the jam. Put the second sponge on top. Sift over some icing sugar and decorate with edible flowers, if you like. White or cream flowers are lovely on this, but if you can’t find them, go for a single colour. Alternatively, sprinkle over some lightly toasted flaked almonds before sifting over the extra icing sugar."]','2026-01-10 12:23:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9244,9244,'en','Summer apricot Victoria sponge','Try a new twist on a classic Victoria sponge with an apricot and lemon thyme compote layer. Sandwiched with vanilla whipped cream, it’s decadently delicious','["225g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tins","225g golden caster sugar","4 large eggs, at room temperature","225g self-raising flour","½ tsp baking powder","½ tsp fine sea salt","2 tbsp milk","200g apricot conserve","3-4 canned apricot halves, drained and chopped","6 lemon or regular thyme sprigs, leaves picked from 1, the rest left whole","300ml double cream","2 tbsp icing sugar, plus extra for dusting","1 vanilla pod, split and seeds scraped, or 1 tsp vanilla bean paste"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line the base and sides of two 20cm sandwich tins.","Beat the butter and sugar together in a large bowl with an electric whisk for 8-10 mins, or until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition. Sift in the flour, baking powder and salt, and fold in using a large metal spoon. Add just enough of the milk to create a dropping consistency.","Divide the batter between the prepared tins and smooth the tops with a spatula. Bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 25-30 mins, or until golden and firm to the touch. Leave to cool slightly in the tins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the filling. Spoon the conserve into a small pan and stir in the apricots and whole thyme sprigs. Warm over a low heat for 2 mins until loosened, then transfer to a heatproof bowl and leave to cool and infuse for 1-2 hrs.","Whip the cream with the icing sugar and vanilla until the mixture just holds its shape (be careful not to overwhip – see tip, below).","Remove and discard the whole thyme from the conserve mixture and stir in the thyme leaves. Spread the mixture over one of the sponges, then top with the vanilla whipped cream and sandwich with the remaining sponge. Dust the cake with some icing sugar. Will keep in the fridge for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9245,9245,'en','Blood orange & olive oil bundt cake','Using a bundt tin, gives a stunning effect to this zesty cake with light olive oil sponge and decadent white chocolate and blood orange glaze','["cake release spray (available from Lakeland and amazon.co.uk) or melted butter, for greasing","300g golden caster sugar","5 large eggs","zest and juice 3 blood oranges (about 150ml juice)","150g light olive oil","280g self-raising flour","140g white chocolate, roughly chopped","zest 1 blood orange, plus juice of 1 ½  (about 75ml juice)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and grease a 2.5-litre bundt tin with the cake release spray or butter.","Put the sugar, eggs and zest in a large bowl and whisk with an electric hand whisk for about 10 mins until thick and pale. With the mixer on medium-low speed, pour in the juice and oil, mixing until fully combined. Sieve the flour into the bowl and whisk until just combined to a smooth batter. Pour into the prepared tin, place on a baking tray and bake in the oven for 35-40 mins or until a skewer inserted into the cake comes out clean. Allow to cool for 5 mins before carefully turning out onto a wire rack to cool completely.","To make the glaze, put the chocolate in a heatproof bowl over a pan of barely simmering water, stirring occasionally. Once the chocolate has melted, pour in the blood orange juice and stir to combine. Remove the bowl from the heat and leave to cool, then chill until the glaze is thick but still pourable. Once the glaze is at the desired consistency, pour over the cake, allowing it to drip down the sides. Sprinkle the orange zest over to finish. Will keep in an airtight container for 3-4 days; can be frozen for up to 3 months."]','2026-01-10 12:23:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9246,9246,'en','Toffee apple cake','This showstopping bake is a celebration of classic apple desserts with spiced sponge, vanilla icing and a sticky caramel apple filling','["150ml vegetable oil, plus extra for greasing","175g dark brown soft sugar","2 large eggs","250g eating apples (prepared weight – about 3 apples), peeled, cored and coarsely grated","200g self-raising flour","2 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp ground ginger","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","25g rolled oats","50g ground almonds","100g sultanas","zest 1 lemon","juice 1 lemon","4 eating apples (I used Pink Lady)","25g butter","50g dark brown soft sugar","1 tbsp golden syrup","¼ tsp cinnamon","100g white caster sugar (optional, for the tiny toffee apples)","75g dark brown soft sugar","juice 1 lemon","1 tbsp brandy, or water","50g butter","100g white chocolate","280g tub cream cheese","1 vanilla pod, seeds only","170g pot Greek yogurt","8 long wooden skewers (optional, for the tiny toffee apples)"]','["Start by making the cakes. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line 2 x 18cm springform cake tins with baking parchment and brush with a little oil. Put the sugar and eggs in a large mixing bowl and whisk with electric beaters until glossy and pale. Keep the beaters running as you pour in the oil.","Stir in the grated apple, then fold in all the other cake ingredients. Divide the mixture between the tins and bake for 30 mins or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean.","While the cakes cook, prepare the apple filling. Tip the lemon juice into\r\na large bowl and fill halfway with cold water. Peel the apples, then cut into spheres using a melon baller – pop them in the bowl of lemon water as you go to stop them discolouring. In a medium saucepan, combine the butter, dark brown sugar, golden syrup, cinnamon and 200ml water, and heat until boiling. Take the apple balls out of the water and put them in the pan –if you want to make the tiny toffee apples for the top, keep 8 apple balls in the water until needed. Bring the mixture in the pan back to the boil for 8 - 10 mins or until the apples are soft but not losing their shape, and a thick syrup starts to form. Remove from the heat and allow to cool completely, then chill until needed.","Stir all the syrup ingredients together in a bowl. When the cakes are cooked, keep them in the tin but prick holes all over the surface with a skewer and drizzle the syrup over. Leave the cakes to cool completely in the tin.","While the cakes cool, make the icing. In a small heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, melt the butter and white chocolate together. Once melted and glossy, pour into a large bowl. Add the cream cheese, whisk until smooth, then\r\nadd the vanilla. Finally, fold in the yogurt. When the mixture is cool,\r\nchill until needed.","To assemble the cake, take the cooled sponges out of their tins and put one of them on a cake stand. Top with half the white chocolate icing – use a spoon or pipe it using a very large round nozzle. Scatter the cooked apple pieces, along with a drizzle of the syrup, over the icing, then place in the fridge to firm up for 15 mins. Add the top layer of the cake, then decorate with the rest of the icing by piping it in lots of regular little mounds all over the top using a large round nozzle. Put the whole cake in the fridge until ready to serve. Will keep for 2 days in the fridge.","For a showstopping, but optional, finish, make some beautiful miniature toffee apples. Their effect is stunning but fleeting, so make them just before serving your cake, as the caramel will dissolve quickly due to the moisture in the air. Brush a baking tray with a little vegetable oil and set aside. Very thoroughly dry the reserved apple balls from step 3 of the cake with kitchen paper or a clean tea towel and insert a long wooden skewer into each one.","Put the caster sugar in a small saucepan over a medium heat, stirring often, until the sugar melts. Keep cooking until the sugar has become a liquid golden caramel, then remove from the heat. If it looks like it’s getting too hot, sit the base of the pan in a heatproof dish of cold water.","Tilt the pan and, working quickly (as the sugar will continue to cook), hold the apple balls by the skewer and dip each one in turn into the caramel and twist\r\nit around to coat it. It’s really important that the apple balls are well dried and that you don’t turn them in the hot caramel more than twice, otherwise the apple will cook and release liquid, which will stop the caramel from sticking. As soon as they are coated, slowly lift them out vertically. Hold the apple up out of the pan and pause before transferring it to the oiled tray on its side. Holding it up like this will allow a long drip of caramel to set hard and create a beautiful long spike. Repeat the process with the rest of the apples, working quickly so that the caramel doesn’t harden completely before all the apples have been coated. However, don’t worry too much as you can always gently reheat it over a low heat before continuing – just be careful not to burn it, otherwise it will taste bitter.","After a couple of minutes, the apples should have set. When they are cool enough to handle, pull out the skewers. Place the apples on top of the cake so that the spike is pointing upwards and the base of the apple (where the skewer was) is pressed into the icing. Serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:23:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9247,9247,'en','Plum crumble cake','This sumptuous seasonal bake is topped with halved plums or apricots and a buttery crumble topping – serve as a pudding or cake','["175g butter, at room temperature","175g golden caster sugar","3 large eggs","225g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","2 tsp vanilla extract","100g ground almonds","85g soured cream","5-6 ripe plums, halved and stoned","50g ground almonds","50g plain flour","50g golden caster sugar","50g butter, chopped into pieces","soured cream or yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line a 22cm deep, round cake tin (preferably with a loose bottom) with baking parchment.","First make the topping: put all the crumble ingredients in a bowl and rub together until crumbly.","For the cake, put the butter, sugar, eggs, flour, baking powder, vanilla, ground almonds and soured cream in a big bowl. Beat with an electric whisk until smooth, then tip into the tin and level the top. Arrange the plums, cut-side up, over the mix, then scatter over the crumble.","Bake for 50 mins-1 hr on a middle shelf until a skewer poked into the cake mixture comes out clean (plums will remain sticky, however). Cool in the tin for 20 mins, then finish cooling on a wire rack. Serve plain or with soured cream or yogurt. Keeps for 3-4 days in an airtight cake tin."]','2026-01-10 12:23:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9248,9248,'en','Spiced fig, coffee & hazelnut cake','This sophisticated cake is gently spiced and full of treacly flavours from dried figs and muscovado sugar, finished with a cream cheese icing','["4 dried figs, chopped into small pieces","75ml hot strong coffee or espresso","100g blanched hazelnuts","200g slightly salted butter, very soft, plus a little for greasing","225g light muscovado sugar","200g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","2 tsp vanilla extract","2 tsp mixed spice","50g natural yogurt","4 large eggs","250g pack slightly salted butter, very soft","2 tsp vanilla extract or bean paste","400g icing sugar","250g tub full-fat cream cheese","6 tbsp fig jam or conserve","10-12 figs, halved or quartered","200g caramel (Carnation or Bon Maman work well)"]','["First, make the sponge. Put the dried figs in a bowl and pour over the coffee. Leave to soak for 30 mins. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tip the hazelnuts onto a baking tray and toast in the oven for 5-8 mins until golden brown and aromatic. Tip 75g of the nuts into a food processor (set aside the rest for later) and leave to cool for 10 mins. Meanwhile grease the base and sides of a 20 x 30cm rectangular cake tin with butter and line with baking parchment.","Whizz the cooled nuts until finely chopped. Add the soaked figs and any remaining coffee, and whizz again to a paste. Add the remaining sponge ingredients to the processor with a good pinch of salt. Blend until well combined, scraping down the sides once or twice and blending again. Scrape into your cake tin, level the surface and bake for 25 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the centre of the cake comes out clean. Cool in the tin for 10 mins, then flip onto a wire rack, peel off the parchment and leave to cool.","While the cake cools, make the icing. Put the butter, vanilla and half the sugar in a large bowl. Roughly mash together with a spatula, then blend with an electric hand whisk until smooth. Add the cream cheese and the remaining icing sugar, mash, then blend again until smooth. Split the icing into 2 batches, one for layering and a crumb coat, and one for a final coat. You can chill the icing while the cake cools, but remove it from the fridge 15 mins before using to bring back to room temperature.","Now assemble the cake. Transfer the cooled cake to a chopping board. Score the sponge at 10cm intervals along the length of the cake, marking out 3 sections, 20 x 10cm each. Cut through, then stack the cakes on top of each other to check they are the same size. Trim any uneven edges, then unstack.","Put 1 sponge on a cake board or plate. Spread with a little icing and 3 tbsp fig jam, keeping the jam about 1cm from the edges. Top with another sponge, more icing and jam, then sandwich with the final sponge. Use a palette knife to cover the entire cake with the remaining first batch of icing (the crumb coat) – don’t worry if it’s a little messy. Make sure you fill any gaps between the layers with icing. Once covered, chill for at least 30 mins to firm up the icing. Chill the remaining icing too, but bring it out of the fridge 10-15 mins before the cake so it is ready for spreading.","Decorate the cake. Remove it from the fridge and cover with the remaining icing. Use a palette knife to create smooth edges, or leave it fairly rough, if you like. Top the cake with the figs, pointy ends up. Put the caramel in a small piping bag, snip off the corner and drizzle over the top of the cake, encouraging it down the sides (or just drizzle it over with a spoon). Roughly chop the remaining toasted nuts and scatter over the top. Serve in slices with extra figs on the side, if you like. Keep leftovers in the fridge for 3 days, but bring to room temperature before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:23:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9249,9249,'en','Lemon meringue cake','Take lemon meringue to a new level with this caramel-infused sponge filled with lemon curd and topped with Italian meringue','["75g unsalted butter, softened","225g caster sugar","zest 3 lemons","100ml lemon juice, sieved to remove any seeds and pith","3 large eggs","1 tbsp cornflour","85g caster sugar","300g unsalted butter, softened","200g caster sugar","75g light muscovado sugar","300g self-raising flour","5 medium eggs, beaten","25g cornflour","1 tsp baking powder","zest 4 lemons","1 lemon","175g caster sugar","300g caster sugar","6 medium egg whites","½  tsp cream of tartar"]','["Start by making the curd. Put all the ingredients in a saucepan and whisk together. It will look like it has curdled but don’t worry – simply put the pan over a low heat and stir constantly until it is smooth and thick enough to coat the back of a spoon. Pass the mixture through a sieve into a bowl. Leave to cool, covered with cling film. Put in the fridge until ready to use, preferably overnight.","For the caramel sugar syrup, heat the caster sugar in a saucepan over a medium heat until it melts and starts to caramelise. Stir until smooth and a deep golden colour. Remove from the heat and carefully pour in 50ml boiling water. It will steam and spit a little, so take care. (If the sugar hardens, pop the pan back on the heat for 1-2 mins to melt again.) Stir, pour immediately into a heatproof jug and top up with a little extra boiling water (about 10ml) so you have 100ml of liquid in total. Leave on one side to cool.","To make the cake, heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease 3 x 20cm sandwich tins, lining the bases and sides with baking parchment.","In a large bowl, beat together the butter and sugars with an electric whisk until light and fluffy. Mix in 1 tbsp flour, then add the eggs, a little at a time, beating after each addition until fully combined.","Mix together the remaining dry ingredients, the lemon zest and 1/2 tsp salt, then fold in to the butter mixture with the caramel sugar syrup. Divide the batter between the tins and level the tops with the back of a wet spoon. Bake for 25-30 mins or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Allow the cakes to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack, peeling off the parchment. Leave to cool completely.","Make the caramelised lemon slices while the cakes are baking. Slice the lemon into 5mm thick slices, discarding the ends. In a shallow non-stick pan, bring 350ml water and the sugar to the boil. Add the lemon slices, boil for 10 mins, then reduce the heat to a simmer for 20-25 mins until the liquid has evaporated and the slices have caramelised. Remove from the pan and put on a non-stick A silicone mat or baking parchment to cool.","To assemble the cake. Place a sponge the right way up on a cake board or presentation plate. Top with an even layer of curd but don’t go right to the edge, leave about 1cm uncovered. Gently put the next sponge on top and repeat the process, putting the last sponge upside down on top.","To make the Italian meringue, put the sugar and 175ml water in a saucepan and B bring to a rolling boil over a high heat. Continue to boil until it reaches 115C on a sugar thermometer. Meanwhile, put the egg whites and cream of tartar in a large mixing bowl (a tabletop mixer is ideal if you have one). Whisk the egg whites to soft peaks (when lifting the whisk out, the peaks should slowly vanish back into the mixture). Whisk the egg whites at high speed and very slowly trickle in the hot syrup. The meringue will C begin to thicken and go glossy after about 10 mins. Continue to whisk until it is still just warm. Use the meringue immediately, as it is easier to work with while warm.","Using a palette knife, spread a thin layer of meringue around the side of the cake to level and square it up, then spread an even layer about 3mm thick on the top of the cake (see step-by-step for guidance). Put the remaining meringue in a large piping bag fitted with a small star nozzle and pipe vertical columns up the side of the cake, level with the top. Finally, pipe small meringue stars on the top of the columns. It’s easier to do this with the cake on a turntable.","Brown the meringue using a kitchen blowtorch. Finally, cut the caramelised lemon slices in half and use to decorate the top of the cake. Will keep for 3 days in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:23:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9250,9250,'en','Morello cherry & almond traybake','This fruity cake uses ground rice and almond extract for a cheaper bake – perfect for a cake sale or as a teatime treat','["300g butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","300g golden caster sugar","375g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","zest 1 lemon (save the juice for the icing)","85g ground rice or ground almonds","4 eggs, lightly beaten","25g marzipan, chilled until firm, then grated","2 tsp almond extract","1 tsp baking powder","3 tbsp whole milk","200g morello glacé cherries, washed, dried and quartered","500g fondant icing sugar","juice 1 lemon (from the lemon above)","50g marzipan","red and green food colouring gels (we used Dr Oetker)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line a large square traybake tin, about 28 x 28cm, with baking parchment. Put all the cake ingredients (apart from the cherries) in a large mixing bowl or tabletop mixer and beat together until thoroughly combined. Toss the cherries in a little flour, then fold them into the cake mixture using a spatula. Spoon the mixture into the prepared tin and bake for 30-35 mins until the cake is golden brown, springy to the touch, and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Leave to cool completely in the tin.","To make the icing, sift the icing sugar into a bowl, then add the lemon juice and enough water to make a thick yet fairly fluid icing. Transfer 3 tbsp of the icing to a small bowl and set aside. Spoon the remaining icing over the cooled cake – it should be liquid enough to level itself out; if not, use a knife to smooth it. Knead the marzipan to soften it, then incorporate enough red food colouring to turn it bright red. Roll into 48 cherry balls.","When the icing is almost set, place 2 balls directly next to each other on the icing, in rows of 4, with enough space between each to cut 24 equal pieces. Colour the reserved icing with green food colouring, then transfer to a piping bag fitted with a very fine nozzle, or simply snip off the end, and pipe cherry stalks next to the marzipan balls. When all the icing is completely set, take the cake out of the tin and cut into 24 pieces."]','2026-01-10 12:23:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9251,9251,'en','Passion layer torte','Get ahead for a dinner party or celebration with this indulgent, fruity cake which can be frozen for up to 2 months','["225g softened butter, cubed, plus extra for greasing","225g caster sugar","4 large eggs","225g self-raising flour","50g desiccated coconut","finely grated zest 1 orange","1 tsp baking powder","5 large passion fruits","225g softened butter, cubed","375g icing sugar, sifted","280g full-fat cream cheese","75g white chocolate"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5. Grease 2\r\nx 20cm loose-based sandwich tins and line\r\nthe bases with discs of baking parchment.\r\nPut the butter, sugar, eggs, flour, coconut,\r\norange zest and baking powder in a food\r\nprocessor or food mixer and blend or beat\r\nuntil well combined, thick and creamy. Do not\r\nover-blend or the cake will be tough rather\r\nthan light. If you don’t have a food mixer, put\r\nall the ingredients in a bowl and beat hard\r\nwith a wooden spoon until soft and creamy.","Spoon the mixture evenly into the\r\nprepared tins and smooth the surface. Bake\r\non the same shelf in the centre of the oven\r\nfor 25 mins or until well risen and just\r\nbeginning to shrink back from the sides of\r\nthe tin. Remove the tins from the oven and\r\nleave to cool for 5 mins before running a\r\nknife around the edge of the cakes and\r\nturning out onto a wire rack. Peel off the\r\nparchment and leave to cool completely.","When the cakes are completely cold, very\r\ncarefully cut horizontally through each one\r\nwith a serrated knife to make 4 thin\r\nsponges. To make the frosting, cut the\r\npassion fruits in half and scoop into a sieve.\r\nPress through the sieve to strain the juice\r\n– you should have 4 tbsp. Set aside and\r\nreserve the seeds. Put the butter, icing sugar\r\nand cheese in a food processor or mixer and\r\nblend until smooth. Do not overbeat or it will\r\nbecome runny. Slowly add the passion fruit\r\njuice and blend until just combined.","Place one of the sponges, cut-side down,\r\non the metal base of the sandwich tin and\r\nput on an upturned bowl on a tray. This will\r\nhelp make frosting the cake easier. Spread\r\nwith roughly a fifth of the frosting – just\r\nenough to cover the sponge. Use a paddling\r\nmotion with a palette knife or soft spatula for\r\nthe best result, trying to keep contact with\r\nthe cake to prevent the sponge from lifting.","Cover with a second cake, spread with\r\nfrosting and repeat the layers once more,\r\nending with the last sponge, cut-side down.\r\nBy this stage, you should have layered 4\r\ncakes with passion fruit frosting between\r\n3 of them. Use the remaining frosting to\r\nspread over the top and sides of the cakes\r\nto cover completely. Don’t worry if the sides\r\nare a little messy, as the grated chocolate\r\nshould cover any imperfections.","Put the cake in the fridge for 30-60 mins\r\nto allow the icing to set a little. Coarsely\r\ngrate the chocolate. Working your way\r\nslowly around the cake, scoop grated\r\nchocolate onto a palette knife and sweep\r\nup the sides of the cake, pressing into\r\nthe soft icing.","Take the cake off the bowl, slide the\r\npalette knife between the cake and the\r\nmetal base, and gently transfer to a plate or\r\ncake stand. (If the icing is too soft to do this,\r\npop the cake in the freezer for 30 mins and\r\nthen try again.) Chill until ready to serve.\r\nBefore serving, drizzle over 1 tsp of the\r\nreserved passion fruit seeds over the top of\r\nthe cake. If making a day ahead, cover with\r\na cake tin or a bowl large enough to cover\r\nthe cake without touching it, so the cake\r\ndoesn’t get damaged in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:23:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9252,9252,'en','Raspberry & amaretti crunch cake','Delicious raspberry and amaretti crunch cake','["175g soft butter","175g golden caster sugar","3 eggs","140g self-raising flour","85g ground almonds","140g amaretti biscuits, roughly broken","250g punnet raspberries","icing sugar, to dust","142ml carton single cream"]','["Preheat the oven to fan 140C/conventional 160C/gas 3. Butter and base line a loose-bottomed 20cm round cake tin. Put the butter, caster sugar, eggs, flour and ground almonds into a large bowl. Beat using an electric hand whisk until all the ingredients are well blended.","Spread half the cake mixture in the lined tin. Scatter over half of the amaretti biscuits then a third of the raspberries. Very lightly press into the cake mixture.","Dollop dessertspoonfuls of the remaining cake mixture over the amaretti and raspberries and spread evenly. Scatter the remaining amaretti and half the remaining raspberries over the top. Bake for 55-60 minutes, until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean.","Cool for 15 minutes in the tin. Run a knife round the edge and turn out. It will keep in a covered container in the fridge for up to 2 days.","To serve, remove from the fridge an hour before serving and lightly dust with icing sugar before bringing to the table. Serve with the remaining raspberries and a little single cream."]','2026-01-10 12:23:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9253,9253,'en','Iced berry mousse cake','A frozen dessert like this is always useful when entertaining… and the bright pink mousse will be a talking point!','["100g butter, softened","100g caster sugar","100g self-raising flour","¾ tsp baking powder","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 eggs","500g mixed berries (fresh or frozen)","icing sugar, to sweeten","3 sheets leaf gelatine","3 egg whites","140g golden caster sugar","300ml double cream, whipped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nBeat the butter with the sugar, then beat\r\nin the flour, baking powder, vanilla and\r\neggs. Pour the batter into a lined 24cm\r\nloose-based cake tin and bake for\r\n30 mins or until risen and cooked through.","Remove the cake from the tin and\r\ncool on a wire rack, leaving the base\r\npaper on the bottom of the cake. When\r\nthe cake is completely cool, cut it in half\r\nhorizontally. Clean the tin and line with\r\ncling film. Put the top of the cake into\r\nthe base of the tin.","To make the mousse, put the berries in\r\na pan over a low heat and bring gently to\r\na simmer, you shouldn’t need any extra\r\nliquid as they release juice. Sweeten to\r\ntaste with icing sugar – you want a\r\nslightly tart flavour as they will be later\r\nmixed with a sweet meringue. Whizz\r\nwith a stick blender or pop into a blender\r\nand purée, then sieve. You should end\r\nup with about 250ml purée. Soak the\r\ngelatine in water until floppy, stir into the\r\nhot berry purée and set aside to cool.","Whisk the egg whites to soft peaks,\r\nthen whisk in the caster sugar in 4 batches.\r\nContinue whisking until you have a stiff,\r\nglossy meringue. Fold in the berry purée\r\nfollowed by the cream. Pour onto the\r\nsponge base, then carefully lay the other\r\npiece of sponge on top, paper-side up.\r\nFreeze until 40 mins-1 hr before you need\r\nit, then remove from the freezer and peel\r\noff the paper. Remove the tin and cling\r\nfilm. When you are ready to serve, dust\r\nthe top with icing sugar."]','2026-01-10 12:23:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9254,9254,'en','Orange & almond cake with citrus mascarpone','An unbelievably moist and yummy dessert','["3 large oranges","scrap of unsalted butter","140g polenta, plus 1-2 tbsp","200g flaked almonds","1 scant tbsp baking powder","7 large eggs","2 large egg yolks","350g golden caster sugar","500g tub mascarpone","3-4 tbsp Cointreau or other orange liqeur, to taste","3-4 heaped tbsp homemade (or artisan) lime marmalade, to taste"]','["Boil two of the oranges (whole) in water, with\r\nthe lid on the pan, for about 1 hour or until\r\nsquidgy. Drain and leave to cool.","Butter a springform cake tin, 23cm/9in wide\r\nand 7cm/23?4in deep. Add 1-2 tablespoons of\r\npolenta, tip the grains around until the tin is\r\ncoated, then knock out the excess. Set aside.","Whizz the flaked almonds to a grainy powder in\r\na food processor, then mix in a bowl with the\r\npolenta and baking powder. Set aside.","Halve the cooked oranges and remove any\r\npips. Remove zest from the third orange. Whizz\r\nthe zest and the orange halves (with skin on) to a\r\nsmooth purée in the food processor. Set aside.","Preheat the oven to 180C/Gas 4/fan oven\r\n160C. Using a mixer or electric beaters, beat\r\nthe eggs, yolks and sugar for a good 5-7 minutes until the batter looks like a very thick milkshake.","Quickly beat in the almond mixture, then the\r\npurée until just blended. Pour the batter into the\r\ntin, leaving at least 1.5cm/5?8in at the top.","Bake the cake in the middle of the oven. After\r\n10 minutes, reduce the temperature to 150C/\r\nGas 2/fan oven 130C, bake for 30 minutes,\r\nthen reduce temperature to 140C/fan oven\r\n120C for a further 30 minutes (if you have a gas\r\noven, cook at gas 4 for 10 minutes, then at gas\r\n2 for 11?4 hours until done without reducing the\r\ntemperature further). The cake is ready when it\r\nhas risen, is golden-brown and the centre is just\r\nfirm – don’t panic that it still feels fragile.","Leave the cake to cool in its tin (it will sink a\r\nlittle), then run a palette knife around the edge\r\nbefore releasing the sides. Only attempt to\r\ntransfer it from the metal base to a decorative\r\nplate or stand if you have a proper cake lifter.","Whisk the liqueur and marmalade into the\r\nmascarpone. Serve the cake in thick wedges\r\nwith the mascarpone dolloped on top."]','2026-01-10 12:23:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9255,9255,'en','Raspberry & blueberry lime drizzle cake','The perfect teatime treat, this moist and fruity cake is easy baking at its best','["225g softened butter, plus extra for greasing","225g golden caster sugar","4 medium eggs","2 limes, grated zest and juice","250g self-raising flour, sifted with a pinch of salt, plus extra flour","25g ground almonds","100g each blueberries and raspberries","8 tbsp lime juice (about 4 limes)","1 lime, grated zest","140g golden caster sugar"]','["Line the base and sides of a 20cm/8in square cake tin (not loose-based) with greaseproof paper and butter the paper. Set oven to 180C/Gas 4/fan oven 160C.","Cream the butter and sugar together until light. Gradually beat in the eggs, adding a little flour towards the end to prevent curdling. Beat in the lime zest, then fold in the flour and almonds. Fold in enough lime juice – about 3 tablespoons – to give you a good dropping consistency (the mixture should drop easily from the spoon when tapped).","Fold in three quarters of the blueberries and raspberries and turn into the prepared tin. Smooth the surface, then scatter the remaining fruit on top – it will sink as the cake rises.","Bake for about 1 hour (cover with foil if beginning to brown too much), or until firm to a gentle prod in the centre. A skewer pushed into the centre should be clean when removed.","Meanwhile make the syrup: put the lime juice, zest and sugar in a small saucepan. Put over a gentle heat and stir, without allowing to bubble. The sugar should dissolve a little. As soon as the cake comes out of the oven, prick all over with a skewer then spoon the syrup over it. To store, cool before wrapping in paper and/or foil.","Carefully remove the cake from the tin, discard the lining paper and cut into 12 pieces to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9256,9256,'en','Cherry & almond cake','Not just for Easter, this delicious cake makes a good centrepiece all year round','["250g butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","175g golden caster sugar","5 eggs, beaten","250g self-raising flour, plus an extra 2 tbsp","1 tsp baking powder","zest 1 orange, plus 2 tbsp of the juice","250g natural marzipan, coarsely grated (easiest if chilled beforehand)","½ tsp almond essence, optional","200g glacé cherries, halved","100g icing sugar, sifted","50g toasted flaked almonds","12 natural glacé cherries","zest 1 orange"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3 and butter and line a 20cm round, loose-bottomed deep cake tin. Beat the butter and sugar together with electric beaters or a tabletop mixer until light and fluffy. Add the eggs, 250g flour, baking powder, orange zest and juice and beat well till thick, creamy and evenly mixed.","Toss cherries in the extra 2 tbsp flour and fold into the batter along with grated marzipan and almond essence (if using). Spoon into the prepared tin, level and bake for 1 hr 30 mins, or until well risen and golden. A skewer will come out clean when ready. Leave to cool in tin for 10 mins, then turn onto a cooling rack to cool completely.","Mix the icing sugar with just over 1 tbsp water to make a loose but not-too-runny icing. Scatter the almonds over the top\r\nof the cake and position the 12 glace cherries around the edge, using a dot of the icing to fix. Drizzle the icing over the cake and finish with a scattering of orange zest."]','2026-01-10 12:23:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9257,9257,'en','Blueberry soured cream cake with cheesecake frosting','The blueberries in this recipe will burst in your mouth as you bite into your slice. The cake is delicious with a cup of tea, or served as an impressive dessert','["175g soft butter","175g golden caster sugar","3 large eggs","225g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","2 tsp vanilla extract","142ml carton soured cream","3 x 125g punnets blueberries","200g tub Philadelphia cheese","100g icing sugar"]','["Preheat the oven to fan160C/\r\nconventional 180C/gas 4 and\r\nbutter and line the base of a\r\nloose-based 22cm round cake\r\ntin with non-stick baking paper\r\nor reusable Bake-o-glide.","Put the butter, sugar, eggs,flour, baking powder and\r\nvanilla in a bowl. Beat with\r\na wooden spoon for 2-3\r\nminutes, or with a hand electric\r\nbeater for 1-2 minutes, until\r\nlighter in colour and well\r\nmixed. Beat in 4 tbsp soured\r\ncream, then stir in half the\r\nblueberries with a large spoon.","Tip the mixture into the tin\r\nand spread it level. Bake for 50\r\nminutes until it is risen, feels\r\nfirm to the touch and springs\r\nback when lightly pressed.\r\nCool for 10 minutes, then take\r\nout of the tin and peel off the\r\npaper or lining. Leave to finish\r\ncooling on a wire rack.","To make the frosting, beat\r\nthe soft cheese with the icing\r\nsugar and the remaining\r\nsoured cream in a bowl until\r\nsmooth and creamy. Spread\r\nover the top of the cooled\r\ncake (don''t be impatient as\r\nthe frosting will melt if the\r\ncake is too warm) and scatter\r\nwith the remaining\r\nblueberries. The cake will\r\nkeep in the fridge for a couple\r\nof days. Bring it to room\r\ntemperature for about an hour\r\nbefore serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9258,9258,'en','Apricot & blueberry crumble cake','This crumble cake is great for a picnic, pudding, or for afternoon tea with friends','["200g butter, softened","225g golden caster sugar","225g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","3 eggs, beaten","2 tbsp milk","150g pot vanilla yogurt","300g apricots, skinned, halved and stoned, or use a drained 410g tin instead","225g punnet blueberries","25g butter","3 heaped tbsp self-raising flour","3 tbsp demerara sugar","1 tsp ground cinnamon"]','["Line an oblong traybake tin (21 x 30cm) with baking parchment and heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Beat the butter, sugar, flour, baking powder, eggs and milk together until creamy. Spoon into the tin, level the top, then bake for 25 mins until almost set.","Meanwhile, get the yogurt and fruit at the ready and make the crumble by rubbing all the ingredients together.","When cake has baked for 25 mins, whip it out of the oven. Working quickly, spoon over the yogurt, scatter over the fruit, then top with the crumble. Return to oven for 15-20 mins until a skewer comes out clean. Serve warm as a pudding, or cooled and cut into squares with tea."]','2026-01-10 12:23:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9259,9259,'en','Bitter orange & poppy seed cake','This easy all-in-one cake is made with yogurt for a light texture.','["3 tbsp good-quality thick marmalade (we used Frank Cooper''s Thick Cut Oxford marmalade)","150g pot natural bio yogurt","3 eggs","175g golden caster sugar","200g self-raising flour","½  tsp baking powder","175g butter, softened","zest 1 orange","2 tsp poppy seeds, toasted","juice ½ orange","5 tbsp marmalade"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. Butter a deep, medium-sized loaf tin (about 20 x 10cm, measured from the top), then line the base with a rectangle of non-stick baking paper. Put the marmalade into a small pan, heat gently until melted (or use a microwaveproof jug or bowl, then cook on High for 30 secs). Beat in the yogurt, then let cool for a few mins.","Put the remaining cake ingredients into a large bowl and beat with an electric hand whisk until smooth. Quickly beat in the\r\nyogurt and marmalade mix, then pour into the prepared tin. It will be quite runny. Leave the mix mounded in the middle of the tin rather than levelling the top, to help it rise and crack in the middle.","Bake for 1 hr-1 hr 10 mins until golden and well-risen; a skewer should come out clean. Take a look at the cake after 45 mins; if it has taken on a lot of colour, loosely cover with baking paper.  Meanwhile, heat the orange juice and\r\nmarmalade in a small pan over a gentle heat until the marmalade melts (or use the microwave as before). Set aside to cool, stirring now and again, until you have a thick, but still runny, glaze. When the cake is ready, cool in the tin for 10 mins, then turn onto a rack. Spoon the topping over the cake while it’s just warm. The cake is best served the\r\nday it’s made, but will keep for up to 3 days tightly wrapped in an airtight container. Will freeze for up to 1 month, un-glazed."]','2026-01-10 12:23:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9260,9260,'en','Raspberry layer cake','Try this light, creamy raspberry cake for a sweet summer treat','["200g caster sugar","200g softened butter","4 eggs, beaten","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","icing sugar, to decorate","85g caster sugar","50ml Disaronno liqueur","284ml tub double cream","250g tub mascarpone","3 tbsp caster sugar","150g punnet raspberries"]','["Heat oven to 190c/fan 170c/gas 5. Butter\r\n2 x 20cm sandwich tins and line each with a circle\r\nof baking parchment. In a large bowl, beat\r\ntogether all the cake ingredients until you have a\r\nsmooth, soft mixture. Spoon the mixture equally\r\ninto the two tins, smoothing over the top of each\r\nwith the back of the spoon. Bake in the oven for\r\n20 mins until golden and the cake springs back\r\nwhen gently pressed. Turn the cakes onto a\r\ncooling rack.","Heat the sugar, 2 tbsp water and Disaronno\r\ntogether until the sugar has dissolved. Leave to\r\ncool, about 10 mins. Use a large serrated knife\r\nto cut each cake in half. Brush the syrup all over\r\nall four pieces of cake with a pastry brush.","For the filling, whip the cream until it forms soft\r\npeaks. Beat the mascarpone and caster sugar in\r\na large bowl to loosen, then fold in the cream and\r\nmix together until smooth.","Spoon a third of the cream mixture over one of\r\nthe cake halves. Scatter over some of the fruit\r\n(you don’t want to cover the cake), then sandwich\r\nanother half on top. Spread with cream and fruit\r\nas before and top with another half of cake and\r\nmore cream and berries. Lay the final cake half on\r\ntop. Gently press down, then wrap tightly in cling\r\nfilm and leave in the fridge overnight. To stop\r\nthe cream from melting, this cake needs to be\r\ntransported to the picnic in a cooler box. At the\r\npicnic, carefully remove clingfilm and dust with\r\nicing sugar to decorate, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9261,9261,'en','Orange & poppy seed cake with chocolate sauce','A light, zingy cake with a drizzle of chocolate and candied zest for a special finishing touch','["250g butter, at room temperature, plus 1 tbsp extra","200g golden caster sugar, plus 25g","3 eggs","250g plain flour, sifted","1½ tsp baking powder","juice of 2 oranges, zest of 4","50g poppy seeds, toasted","100ml double cream","100g chocolate, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.\r\nGrease a 20cm springform cake tin or line a\r\nsimilar-size cake tin with baking paper. Using\r\nan electric mixer, combine 200g butter and\r\n200g sugar in a large bowl. Beat until light\r\nand creamy, about 2 mins, then add the\r\neggs, one at a time, beating well after you\r\nadd each one. Tip in the flour and baking\r\npowder, mix for a few secs, then add the\r\norange juice, zest of 2 oranges and poppy\r\nseeds. Stir everything together, then pour into\r\nthe cake tin. Bake for 50 mins, then remove\r\nfrom the oven. Cool completely in the tin.","Meanwhile, make the candied orange\r\nzest by combining the remaining zest (finely sliced), 25g\r\nsugar and 100ml water in a small pan. Bring\r\nto the boil and cook for 5 mins until thick.\r\nRemove the zest with a slotted spoon onto\r\na sheet of non-stick baking paper.","For the sauce, heat the cream in a small\r\npan until nearly boiling. Put the chocolate\r\nand remaining butter into a bowl, then pour\r\nthe hot cream over it and leave for 1 min to\r\nmelt. Stir together until smooth, then let it sit\r\nuntil the cake is cool (if it hardens, just reheat\r\ngently). Drizzle the sauce over the cake,\r\nsprinkle with the candied zest and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9262,9262,'en','Pear & mincemeat crumble cake','With a hint of spice and little pockets of mincemeat, this is a lovely post-Christmas cake, great with warm custard','["4 firm pears, peeled, cored and cut into thumb-size pieces","3 tbsp golden caster sugar","1 tsp mixed spice","250g pack salted butter, softened (use a tiny bit for greasing)","250g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract or vanilla paste","5 large eggs","200g self-raising flour","100g ground almonds","7 tbsp plain flour","6 tbsp mincemeat"]','["Put pears into a non-stick frying pan\r\nwith 2 tbsp sugar and 2 tbsp water. Cover,\r\nthen cook over a medium heat for 10 mins\r\nuntil just tender, stirring every so often.\r\nThere shouldn’t be juices once the pears\r\nare cooked. Add the spice; leave to cool.","Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nButter then line the base and sides of a\r\n20cm round, deep cake tin. Put butter,\r\nsugar, vanilla and ¼ tsp salt into a large\r\nbowl. Beat with an electric hand whisk\r\nuntil pale and fluffy. Add eggs and flour,\r\nbeat until smooth, then fold in almonds\r\nwith a spoon. Remove 85g batter and put\r\ninto a small bowl. Into this add the plain\r\nflour and chop into the mix with a cutlery\r\nknife to make a soft, crumbly-looking mix.","Spoon half the cake mix into the tin,\r\ntop with half the pears, dot over half the\r\nmincemeat, then dollop the rest of the\r\ncake mix on top. Scatter with remaining\r\npears, mincemeat, then the crumble mix.\r\nSprinkle with final 1 tbsp sugar. Bake for\r\n1½ hrs, covering with foil after 1 hr, until\r\ngolden, risen and a skewer inserted into\r\nthe middle comes out clean. Cool in the\r\ntin for 10 mins, then cool on a rack. Keep\r\nit in the lining paper, as this will help it\r\nstay moist. Will keep, well wrapped in an\r\nairtight tin, for 5 days. Freeze for 1 month."]','2026-01-10 12:23:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9263,9263,'en','Norwegian cream cake','Good Food reader Per Kind shares his recipe for a huge fruit-filled cake, perfect for a big Easter buffet','["10 eggs","300g golden caster sugar","300g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","2 tbsp blueberry or strawberry jam","1l double cream","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tbsp icing sugar","100ml milk","3 x 180g packs of blueberries"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nGrease and line a 20cm x 30cm baking tin\r\n– the lining paper should come up at least\r\n2.5cm above the edge of the tin. In your\r\nbiggest bowl, whisk the eggs and sugar\r\nfor 8-10 mins until the mixture is pale\r\nand thickened.","Sift the flour and baking powder onto\r\nthe egg mixture, then use a metal spoon\r\nto gently fold in. Pour this into the baking\r\ntin and bake for 35 mins until a skewer\r\ninserted into the centre comes out clean\r\n– the cake should be golden and spring\r\nback when touched. Remove from the\r\noven and allow to stand for 5 mins before\r\nturning out onto a wire rack to cool.","Once cool, take a sharp knife and divide\r\ninto 3. Mix the jam with 1 tbsp warm\r\nwater and whip the cream with the\r\nvanilla essence and icing sugar until it\r\nholds its shape. Transfer one layer to a\r\nserving plate then drizzle with ¹/³ of\r\nthe milk. Spread with a thin layer of jam,\r\nthen cream, then scatter over 1 pack of\r\nblueberries. Cover with the second layer\r\nof sponge and then repeat with ¹/³ of the\r\nmilk, a layer of jam, the cream and 2nd\r\npack of blueberries. Put the third layer of\r\nsponge on top, drizzle over the remaining\r\nmilk, then cover with cream and dot the\r\nremaining pack of blueberries on top."]','2026-01-10 12:23:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9264,9264,'en','Anjou pear cake','This fruity cake is at its best when made with melting, buttery pears','["50g butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","500g ripe buttery pears, peeled, cored and roughly chopped","juice 1 lemon","1 tbsp poire William liqueur (optional)","75g plain flour","1 heaped tsp baking powder","75g caster sugar","2 eggs, beaten","2 tbsp apricot jam, for the glaze","icing sugar, for dusting","crème fraîche, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line\r\na 20cm loose-bottomed cake tin with\r\nbaking parchment and brush with butter.","Put the prepared pears in a bowl with\r\nthe lemon juice and Poire William, if\r\nusing, to prevent them discolouring.\r\nSieve the flour and baking powder into\r\na bowl, adding a pinch of salt and the\r\ncaster sugar. Next beat in the eggs and\r\nmelted butter. Finally, fold in the pears\r\nwith their juices. Pour the cake mixture\r\ninto the tin. Bake for about 50 mins or\r\nuntil a skewer comes out clean. Place\r\non a wire rack and allow to cool slightly\r\nbefore removing from the tin, gently\r\npeeling away the parchment.","To make the glaze, melt the apricot jam\r\nwith 1 tbsp water and pass through a\r\nsieve to remove any lumps. Brush the\r\ncake with the glaze, dust with icing sugar\r\nand serve warm with crème fraîche."]','2026-01-10 12:23:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9265,9265,'en','Apple & spice tealoaf','Perfect with a fresh pot of tea, this looks and tastes just as good as a farmers’ market buy','["175g butter, plus extra for greasing","175g light muscovado sugar, plus 1 tsp","3 large eggs, beaten","1 eating apple","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g dried mixed vine fruits","85g ground almonds","1 tsp baking powder","175g plain flour","1 tsp cinnamon","½ tsp ground nutmeg","splash lemon or orange juice","1 tbsp marmalade or apricot jam"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.\r\nButter a 900g/2lb loaf tin and line with\r\na strip of baking paper, or use a loaf tin\r\nliner (see tip, below). Beat together the\r\nbutter and sugar until pale and creamy,\r\nthen beat in the eggs one by one. Grate\r\nhalf the apple and mix it into the batter\r\nwith the vanilla, dried fruit and ground\r\nalmonds. Mix the baking powder, flour\r\nand spices together with a pinch of salt,\r\nthen fold into the mix until even. Spoon\r\ninto the tin and level the top.","Thinly slice the remaining apple half,\r\ntoss with the lemon or orange juice, poke\r\nthe slices a little way into the batter, then\r\nsprinkle with 1 tsp more sugar. Bake for\r\n45 mins, then turn the oven down to\r\n140C/fan 120C/gas 1. Cover the cake\r\nwith foil, then bake for another 45 mins\r\nuntil a skewer inserted into the middle\r\ncomes out clean. Cool in the tin.","To finish the cake, melt the marmalade\r\nor jam in a small pan, sieve to remove\r\nany lumps, then brush it over the cake to\r\nglaze the top. Serve cut into thick slices,\r\nand spread with a little butter, if you like. Will freeze for up to 1 month."]','2026-01-10 12:23:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9266,9266,'en','Raspberry Bakewell cake','This simple almondy cake is a great way of using up pick-your-own raspberries','["140g ground almonds","140g butter, softened","140g golden caster sugar","140g self-raising flour","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g raspberries","2 tbsp flaked almonds","icing sugar, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4\r\nand base-line and grease a deep 20cm\r\nloose-bottomed cake tin. Blitz the ground\r\nalmonds, butter, sugar, flour, eggs and\r\nvanilla extract in a food processor until\r\nwell combined.","Spread half the mix over the cake tin\r\nand smooth over the top. Scatter the\r\nraspberries over, then dollop the\r\nremaining cake mixture on top and\r\nroughly spread – you might find this\r\neasier to do with your fingers. Scatter\r\nwith flaked almonds and bake for\r\n50 mins until golden. Cool, remove from\r\nthe tin and dust with icing sugar to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9267,9267,'en','Lemon curd & blueberry loaf cake','Kids can help make this simple springtime treat – delicious with extra lemon curd and yogurt as a pud, or serve with a cuppa','["175g softened butter, plus extra for greasing","500ml tub Greek yogurt (you need 100ml/3½ fl oz in the cake, the rest to serve)","300g jar good lemon curd (you need 2 tbsp in the cake, the rest to serve)","3 eggs","zest and juice 1 lemon, plus extra zest to serve, if you like","200g self-raising flour","175g golden caster sugar","200g punnet of blueberries (you need 85g/3oz in the cake, the rest to serve)","140g icing sugar","edible flowers, such as purple or yellow primroses, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease a 2lb loaf tin and line with a long\r\nstrip of baking parchment. Put 100g\r\nyogurt, 2 tbsp lemon curd, the softened\r\nbutter, eggs, lemon zest, flour and caster\r\nsugar into a large mixing bowl. Quickly\r\nmix with an electric whisk until the batter\r\njust comes together. Scrape half into the\r\nprepared tin. Weigh 85g blueberries from\r\nthe punnet and sprinkle half into the tin,\r\nscrape the rest of the batter on top, then\r\nscatter the other half of the 85g berries\r\non top. Bake for 1 hr 10 mins-1 hr 15 mins\r\nuntil golden, and a skewer poked into the\r\ncentre comes out clean.","Cool in the tin, then carefully lift onto\r\na serving plate to ice. Sift the icing sugar\r\ninto a bowl and stir in enough lemon juice\r\nto make a thick, smooth icing. Spread\r\nover the top of the cake, then decorate\r\nwith lemon zest and edible flowers, if\r\nyou like. Serve in slices with extra lemon\r\ncurd, Greek yogurt and blueberries."]','2026-01-10 12:23:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9268,9268,'en','Sticky citrus sponge cake','A great dessert to feed a crowd at the end of a Sunday lunch – it’s like a baked version of a steamed syrup sponge','["4 medium oranges","6 tbsp golden syrup, plus extra to serve, optional","200g butter, at room temperature, plus extra for greasing","200g soft brown sugar","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","100g ground almonds","4 large eggs"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nFinely grate the zest from 2 oranges into\r\na large bowl. Cut the peel and pith from\r\nall the oranges with a serrated knife, and\r\nslice quite thickly.","Drizzle the golden syrup evenly over\r\nthe base of a greased 23cm round cake\r\ntin. There is no need to line the tin and\r\nit shouldn’t have a loose bottom\r\notherwise the syrup will bubble through.\r\nArrange the best orange slices on top\r\nof the syrup and finely chop any that\r\ndon’t fit.","Put all the remaining ingredients in the\r\nbowl with the zest and chopped orange.\r\nBeat with an electric hand mixer until\r\nsmooth. Spoon on top of the oranges,\r\nspread lightly and make a deep hollow\r\nin the centre of the mix with the back\r\nof a spoon – this will ensure that the cake\r\nrises evenly.","Bake for 45-50 mins until firm when\r\npressed. Allow to settle for 5 mins before\r\nturning out. Drizzle with golden syrup\r\nif you like, and serve with custard or\r\nice cream."]','2026-01-10 12:23:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9269,9269,'en','Pear, hazelnut & chocolate cake','Moist, fruity pear, hazelnut and chocolate cake – try it warm with cream as a teatime treat','["100g blanched hazelnuts","140g self-raising flour","175g butter, cut into small pieces","140g golden caster sugar","2 large eggs, beaten","5 small, ripe Conference pears","50g dark chocolate, chopped into small chunks","2 tbsp apricot jam"]','["Preheat the oven to fan 140C/\r\nconventional 160C/gas 3. Butter and line\r\nthe base of a 20cm round cake tin. Grind\r\nthe hazelnuts in a food processor until\r\nfairly fine. Add the flour and mix briefly.\r\nAdd the butter and pulse until it forms\r\ncrumbs. Add the sugar and eggs and mix\r\nbriefly. Peel, core and chop two of the pears. \r\nStir the pears and chocolate\r\nlightly into the cake mixture.","Spoon the mixture into the prepared tin\r\nand smooth the top. Peel, core and slice\r\nthe remaining pears and scatter over the\r\ntop of the cake. Press down lightly and\r\nbake for 50-60 minutes, until firm to the\r\ntouch. Cool in the tin for 10 minutes, then\r\nturn out and cool on wire rack. Warm the\r\njam and brush over the top. Serve warm\r\nor cold."]','2026-01-10 12:23:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9270,9270,'en','Courgette, lemon & thyme cake','Inspired by the allotment, this fragrant, modern bake makes the most of a late-summer courgette crop','["350g unsalted butter, softened at room temperature, plus extra for greasing","350g golden caster sugar","zest 2 unwaxed lemons","6 large eggs","400g self-raising flour","2 tsp baking powder","4 courgettes (about 600g), coarsely grated","2 tbsp chopped thyme leaves","250g mascarpone","250g unsalted butter, softened at room temperature","zest 2 unwaxed lemons","900g icing sugar","50g golden caster sugar","12 thyme sprigs (use a combination of thinner and thicker sprigs)","1 egg white, lightly beaten","200g golden caster sugar","2 unwaxed lemons, thinly sliced into rounds","gold paint and gold leaf (optional)"]','["Start by making the decorations. For the crystallised thyme, put the sugar on a plate, brush the thyme with the egg white, then roll in the sugar. Shake off some of the excess, then leave the sprigs on a piece of baking parchment to dry out completely.","For the candied lemon slices, tip the sugar into a saucepan with 200ml water. Heat gently to dissolve the sugar, then bring the syrup to the boil. Drop in the lemon slices and cook for 15 mins until softened. Carefully remove the slices from the syrup and place on a piece of baking parchment to dry. (Lift them gently as they will be quite delicate, and you want to keep them in rounds if possible.) Keep the remaining syrup for brushing over the cake.","Heat oven to 180C/160 fan/gas 4. Grease and line the bases of two 20cm springform cake tins. Make the four sponges in two batches. To make the first batch, in a stand mixer or in a large bowl using an electric hand whisk, beat 175g butter with 175g sugar and the zest of 1 lemon until creamy. Gently beat three of the eggs together in a jug. Gradually add the egg to the mixture, scraping down the side and whisking well after each addition. In a separate bowl, mix together 200g self-raising flour, 1 tsp baking powder and a pinch of salt, and fold this into the cake mixture. Finally, stir in 300g courgette and 1 tbsp thyme leaves. Divide the mixture between the tins and bake for 25 mins or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean.","While the sponges are still warm, prick all over with a skewer and brush over a little of the reserved lemon syrup. Once cool enough to handle, remove from the tins and place on a wire rack. Make and cook the second batch of cakes using the remaining ingredients – you can use the same baking parchment, just re-grease the parchment and the sides of the tins.","When the cakes are cool, make the icing. Whisk all the ingredients together with a pinch of salt until smooth and fluffy.","Using a cake turntable, if you have one, sandwich the cakes together with a little of the icing. Using a palette knife, spread a thin layer of icing all around the cake and chill for 30 mins to set. (This layer is known as a ‘crumb coat’ because it traps any loose crumbs on the surface of the cake – so when you put a second layer of icing on, the cake will be nice and smooth.) If you are short of time, put it in the freezer for 5 mins.","Once chilled, completely cover the cake in a second layer of icing to achieve a smooth finish. Stick the crystallised thyme and candied lemon slices over one side of the cake and top as if they are cascading.","Return the cake to the fridge or freezer until the icing has completely set. For extra shimmer, use a thin paintbrush to brush a little of the gold paint across the lemon slices for a burnished, autumnal effect, and dot pieces of gold leaf as you go, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:23:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9271,9271,'en','Allotment cake','Carrot meets courgette cake in this ultimate vegetable bake from Good Food reader Katie Ready – smother in cream cheese icing and finish with chopped nuts','["200g light brown soft sugar","2 eggs, beaten","200ml sunflower oil","200g spelt flour","¾  tsp bicarbonate of soda","¾  tsp baking powder","¾  tsp cinnamon","½  tsp ground ginger","200g carrots, grated","¼ tsp vanilla extract","100g golden caster sugar","2 eggs, beaten","125ml sunflower oil","225g spelt flour","¾  tsp bicarbonate of soda","¾  tsp baking powder","¾  tsp mixed spice","250g courgettes, grated","50g butter, softened","250g cream cheese","600g icing sugar"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Line 4 x 20cm cake tins with baking parchment (or use 2 and make the carrot sponges first, then the courgette layers).","Start by making the carrot layers. Put the sugar, eggs and oil in a large mixing bowl. Using an electric whisk, beat until incorporated. Sieve the flour and all the dry ingredients into the same bowl, then gently fold in before adding the carrot, a pinch of salt and vanilla extract. Stir to combine.","Divide the carrot cake mixture between 2 of the prepared cake tins and bake for 20-25 mins or until golden brown and firm to the touch. Leave the cakes to cool in the tins for a few mins, then turn out onto wire racks when cool enough to handle.","Meanwhile, make the courgette layers. Put the sugar, eggs and oil in a large bowl and use a hand whisk to combine. Sieve in the dry ingredients and fold in, then add the courgettes and mix together.","Pour the courgette cake mixture into the remaining 2 cake tins and bake for 20-25 mins or until golden brown. Leave to cool in the tins, then turn out onto wire racks to cool fully.","To make the frosting, tip the butter into a large bowl and beat with an electric hand whisk until smooth. Add the cream cheese and beat again. Sieve in the icing sugar and beat until combined.","Layer up the cakes alternately, spreading a little frosting between each layer as you go. Cover the whole cake with the rest of the frosting and serve. Will keep for 2 days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9272,9272,'en','Pistachio, courgette & lemon cake','Big on flavour but light on texture, this easy bake is just as good packed into a tin for a picnic or served with Greek yogurt for dessert','["175g shelled pistachios","250g golden caster sugar","200g butter, at room temperature, plus extra for greasing","280g plain flour","1¼ tsp baking powder","1¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","3 large eggs","140g Greek-style, full-fat yogurt (buy a big pot and keep the rest to serve alongside)","zest and juice 3 lemons","140g coarsely grated courgettes","175g icing sugar","2 tbsp lemon curd (optional)"]','["Put 150g of the pistachios and the sugar in a food processor and whizz until the nuts are very finely ground.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4, grease a 20 x 30cm cake tin and line the base with baking parchment. Tip the pistachio sugar into a big mixing bowl with the butter, flour, baking powder and bicarb, eggs, yogurt and the zest and juice from 2 of the lemons. Beat with an electric whisk until smooth and combined.","Stir in the courgette until everything is well mixed, then scrape into the prepared tin. Bake for 35-40 mins until the cake is risen and golden, and a skewer poked into the centre comes out clean. Leave to cool.","When the cake has fully cooled, remove from the tin and peel off the baking parchment. Sift the icing sugar into a bowl, and gradually stir in enough lemon juice to get a runny-ish consistency. If you run out of juice, carry on mixing with water. Drizzle thickly over the cake, and repeat with lemon curd, if you like. Roughly chop the remaining pistachios and scatter over the icing, along with the remaining lemon zest. Leave to set for 10 mins, then cut into squares and serving with Greek yogurt. Will keep for 3 days in an airtight tin."]','2026-01-10 12:23:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9273,9273,'en','Courgette & orange cake with cream cheese frosting','Forget the carrot cake, this light, moist courgette cake is packed with flavour and it goes perfectly with a cup of tea','["350g courgettes (no need to peel them)","200g soft brown sugar","125ml sunflower oil","3 large eggs, lightly beaten","grated zest 1 orange","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g sultanas","300g self raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","200g full-fat cream cheese","100g icing sugar, sifted"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly oil and line a 1kg loaf tin with a strip of baking parchment. Finely grate the courgettes, then squeeze out as much liquid as you can with your hands (too much will make the cake soggy).","Stir the courgettes with the sugar, sunflower oil, eggs, orange zest, vanilla and sultanas, then fold in the flour and baking powder until they disappear, but don’t overmix.","Scrape the mixture into the tin and bake for 50 mins until a skewer inserted into the cake comes out clean. Remove from the tin and cool on a wire rack.","Meanwhile, beat the cream cheese with the icing sugar (don’t overbeat as this can make the mixture too soft), then chill. Spread over the cooled cake, scatter with the zest and chill until ready to serve. Will keep for a week in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:23:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9274,9274,'en','Marrow & pecan cake with maple icing','Using grated marrow in this homely cake gives it a great texture- top with cream cheese frosting','["250ml sunflower oil, plus extra for greasing","300g self-raising flour","3 tsp mixed spice","½  tsp baking powder","250g light soft brown sugar","4 large eggs","finely grated zest and juice 1 orange","300g marrow flesh, coarsely grated and squeezed of any liquid","200g pecans, roughly chopped","50g butter, softened","250g cream cheese","4 tbsp maple syrup"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line a 22cm round springform\r\ncake tin with baking parchment. Sift the\r\nflour, spice and baking powder into\r\na bowl and crumble in the sugar. In a\r\nseparate bowl, beat the eggs with the\r\norange zest and juice, then pour in the\r\noil. Add the marrow and 150g of the\r\npecans to the oil mixture, then beat\r\ninto the flour until combined. Tip into\r\nthe cake tin, smooth the top and bake\r\nfor 1 hr 20 mins, or until a skewer comes\r\nout clean. Leave to cool for 30 mins in\r\nthe tin before removing and placing on\r\na wire rack to cool completely.","While the cake is cooling, make the\r\nicing by beating all the ingredients\r\ntogether. When the cake has cooled,\r\nuse a spatula to spread the icing over\r\nthe top. Sprinkle over the rest of the\r\npecans to decorate and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9275,9275,'en','Halloween pumpkin cake','Like carrot cake? Then try using up your leftover pumpkin in this clever traybake for Halloween','["300g self-raising flour","300g light muscovado sugar","3 tsp mixed spice","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","175g sultanas","½  tsp salt","4 eggs, beaten","200g butter, melted","zest 1 orange","1 tbsp orange juice","500g (peeled weight) pumpkin or butternut squash flesh, grated","200g pack soft cheese","85g butter, softened","100g icing sugar, sifted","zest 1 orange and juice of half"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4.\r\nButter and line a 30 x 20cm baking or small\r\nroasting tin with baking parchment. Put\r\nthe flour, sugar, spice, bicarbonate of soda,\r\nsultanas and salt into a large bowl and stir\r\nto combine. Beat the eggs into the melted\r\nbutter, stir in the orange zest and juice, then\r\nmix with the dry ingredients till combined.\r\nStir in the pumpkin. Pour the batter into the\r\ntin and bake for 30 mins, or until golden and\r\nspringy to the touch.","To make the frosting, beat together the\r\ncheese, butter, icing sugar, orange zest\r\nand 1 tsp of the juice till smooth and creamy,\r\nthen set aside in the fridge. When the cake\r\nis done, cool for 5 mins then turn it onto a\r\ncooling rack. Prick it all over with a skewer\r\nand drizzle with the rest of the orange juice\r\nwhile still warm. Leave to cool completely.","If you like, trim the edges of the cake.\r\nGive the frosting a quick beat to loosen,\r\nthen, using a palette knife, spread over the\r\ntop of the cake in peaks and swirls. If you’re\r\nmaking the cake ahead, keep it in the fridge\r\nthen take out as many pieces as you want\r\n30 mins or so before serving. Will keep,\r\ncovered, for up to 3 days in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:23:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9276,9276,'en','Catherine Berwick’s Parsnip & maple syrup cake','The winner of Good Food’s 20th birthday cake competition, we think this is the new carrot cake','["175g butter, plus extra for greasing","250g demerara sugar","100ml maple syrup","3 large eggs","250g self-raising flour","2 tsp baking powder","2 tsp mixed spice","250g parsnips, peeled and grated","1 medium eating apple, peeled, cored and grated","50g pecans, roughly chopped","zest and juice 1 small orange","icing sugar, to serve","250g tub mascarpone","3-4 tbsp maple syrup"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease 2 x 20cm sandwich tins and line\r\nthe bases with baking parchment.\r\nMelt butter, sugar and maple syrup in a\r\npan over gentle heat, then cool slightly.\r\nWhisk the eggs into this mixture, then stir\r\nin the flour, baking powder and mixed\r\nspice, followed by the grated parsnip,\r\napple, chopped pecans, orange zest and\r\njuice. Divide between the tins, then bake\r\nfor 25-30 mins until the tops spring back\r\nwhen pressed lightly.","Cool the cakes slightly in the tins\r\nbefore turning out onto wire racks to\r\ncool completely. Just before serving, mix\r\ntogether the mascarpone and maple\r\nsyrup. Spread over one cake and sandwich\r\nwith the other. Dust with icing sugar just\r\nbefore serving."]','2026-01-10 12:23:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9277,9277,'en','The ultimate makeover: Carrot cake','Angela Nilsen rethinks traditional ingredients and baking techniques to create a healthier version of a classic','["1 medium orange","140g raisins","125ml rapeseed oil","115g plain wholemeal flour","1 tsp baking powder, plus a pinch","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 rounded tsp ground cinnamon","140g dark muscovado sugar","280g finely grated carrots (about 375-400g carrots before peeling)","2 eggs","115g self-raising flour","100g light soft cheese, straight from the fridge","100g Quark","3 tbsp sifted icing sugar","½  tsp finely grated orange zest","1 ½  tsp lemon juice"]','["Heat oven to 160C/fan 140C/gas 3. For the cake, finely grate the zest from the orange and squeeze 3 tbsp of juice. Pour the juice over the raisins in a bowl, stir in zest, then leave to soak while you make the cake. Lightly oil and line the base of a deep 20cm square cake tin. Mix the flours with 1 tsp baking powder, bicarbonate of soda and cinnamon.","Separate one of the eggs. Put the white in a small bowl and the yolk in a large one. Break the remaining whole egg in with the yolk, then tip in the sugar. Whisk together for 1-2 mins until thick and foamy. Slowly pour in the oil and continue to whisk on a low speed until well mixed. Tip in the flour mix, half at a time, and gently stir it into the egg mixture with a rubber spatula or big spoon. The mix will be quite stiff. Put the extra pinch of baking powder in with the egg white and whisk to soft peaks.","Fold the carrot, raisins (and any liquid) into the flour mixture. Gently fold in the whisked egg white, then pour into the tin. Jiggle the tin to level the mixture. Bake for 1 hr until risen and firm or until a skewer inserted in the centre comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin 5 mins, turn out onto a wire rack, peel off the paper, then leave until cold.","To make the frosting, stir the soft cheese, Quark, icing sugar and orange zest together - don''t overbeat. Stir in the lemon juice. Swirl the frosting over the cake and cut into 16 square. This cake is even better if left well wrapped for a day or two before icing and eating. Will keep up to 5 days uniced in an airtight tin, or in the fridge if iced."]','2026-01-10 12:23:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9278,9278,'en','Courgette loaf cake','Use up a garden glut in this sweet, spiced sponge loaf – the hidden veg keeps it moist and walnuts add crunch','["butter, for the tin","2 large eggs","125ml vegetable oil","85g soft brown sugar","350g courgettes, coarsely grated","1 tsp vanilla extract","300g plain flour","2 tsp cinnamon","¼ tsp nutmeg","½  tsp bicarbonate of soda","½  tsp baking powder","85g walnuts, roughly chopped","140g sultanas"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nButter and line a 2lb loaf tin with baking\r\nparchment. In a large bowl, whisk\r\nthe eggs, oil and sugar, then add the\r\ncourgettes and vanilla.","In another bowl, combine the remaining\r\ningredients with a pinch of salt.","Stir the dry ingredients into the wet\r\nmixture, then pour into the tin. Bake for\r\n1 hr, or until a skewer inserted into the\r\ncentre comes out clean. Leave to cool,\r\nthen serve, or freeze for up to 1 month."]','2026-01-10 12:23:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9279,9279,'en','Pumpkin & ginger teabread','A moist cake bread to serve thickly sliced and buttered- it’s good for lunchboxes and with a cup of tea','["175g butter, melted","140g clear honey","1 large egg, beaten","250g raw peeled pumpkin, or butternut squash, coarsely grated (about 500g/1lb 2oz before peeling and seeding)","100g light muscovado sugar","350g self-raising flour","1 tbsp ground ginger","2 tbsp demerara sugar"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/gas 4/\r\nfan 160C. Butter and line the base\r\nand two long sides of a 1.5kg loaf\r\ntin with a strip of baking paper.","Mix the butter, honey and egg and stir in the pumpkin or squash. Then mix in the sugar, flour and ginger.","Pour into the prepared tin and sprinkle the top with the demerara sugar. Bake for 50-60 minutes, until\r\nrisen and golden brown. Leave in the tin for 5 minutes, then turn out and cool on a wire rack. Serve\r\nthickly sliced and buttered."]','2026-01-10 12:23:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9280,9280,'en','Frosted courgette & lemon cake','This luscious cake is lemony and light, with an extra citrus kick from the lemon syrup drizzle','["250g pack unsalted butter, very soft, plus extra for the tin","3 unwaxed lemons","200g golden caster sugar","3 eggs","2 medium courgettes, coarsely grated (you''ll need 300g/10oz flesh)","1 tsp poppy seed, plus extra to decorate","1 tsp vanilla extract","100g self-raising flour","100g plain wholemeal flour","1 tsp baking powder","85g icing sugar","200g pack full-fat soft cheese","4 tbsp lemon curd (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nButter 2 x 20cm sandwich tins and line\r\nthe bases with baking parchment. Zest\r\n2 lemons, then squeeze their juice into a\r\nseparate bowl. Put 200g butter, the caster\r\nsugar, eggs, courgettes, poppy seeds,\r\nvanilla and lemon zest into a mixing bowl.\r\nBeat to a creamy batter. Stir in 1 tbsp\r\nlemon juice, the flours, baking powder\r\nand ¼ tsp salt. Spoon the mix into the\r\ntins, then bake for 25 mins or until risen,\r\ngolden and springy in the middle.","Make a drizzle by mixing another tbsp\r\nlemon juice with 25g icing sugar. Put the\r\nremaining icing sugar and butter into a\r\nbowl, add the soft cheese, remaining\r\nlemon juice (about 2 tbsp) and grate in\r\nthe final lemon’s zest. Beat to make a\r\ncreamy, smooth frosting.","When the cakes are ready, cool for\r\n15 mins in their tins, then turn onto a\r\ncooling rack. Prick several times with\r\na cocktail stick, spoon over the drizzle\r\nand cool completely.Can be frozen at\r\nthis stage for up to 1 month. Put one cake\r\nonto a serving plate and spread with just\r\nunder half the frosting. Spread over the\r\nlemon curd, if using. Top with the second\r\ncake, spread the remaining frosting over\r\nthe top and sprinkle with poppy seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:23:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9281,9281,'en','Zesty carrot & ginger loaf','Lovers of ginger cake and carrot cake should enjoy this one. It mellows and improves over a couple of days','["100g unsalted butter, plus extra for the tin","100g dark muscovado sugar","50g black treacle","50g golden syrup (or use more black treacle if you like your ginger cake really dark)","zest 1 orange","zest and juice 1 lemon","1 large carrot, grated (you will need 140g/5oz flesh)","5 balls stem ginger from a jar, finely chopped","175g self-raising flour","¼ tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 tsp ground ginger","¼ tsp freshly ground black pepper","2 eggs","140g icing sugar"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nButter then line a 900g loaf tin with a\r\nstrip of baking parchment. Put the butter,\r\nsugar, treacle, syrup and half the zests\r\ninto a large saucepan. Heat gently until\r\neverything has melted together.","Add the carrot, ¾ of the chopped\r\nginger, all the flour, bicarb, ¼ tsp salt,\r\nthe ground ginger, pepper and eggs to the\r\npan and stir well until you have a smooth\r\nbatter. Pour into the tin and bake for\r\n45 mins, or until dark brown and risen\r\nand a skewer inserted into the middle\r\ncomes out clean. Cool for 20 mins in\r\nthe tin, then turn out onto a wire rack.","Sift the icing sugar into a bowl, add\r\nthe remaining zests, then stir in enough\r\nlemon juice (about 4 tsp should do it) to\r\nmake a smooth, thick icing. Cover the\r\nsurface of the icing with cling film until\r\nready to decorate the cake.","When the cake is completely cool,\r\nspread the icing over the top and let it\r\ndribble down the sides. Scatter with the\r\nreserved chopped ginger. Allow to set,\r\nthen cut into slices and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:23:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9282,9282,'en','Beetroot brownies','With around half the fat of regular brownies, these are a slightly less guilty pleasure, but still have that intense chocolate hit','["500g whole raw beetroot (3-4 medium beets)","100g unsalted butter, plus extra for the tin","200g bar plain chocolate (70% cocoa)","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g golden caster sugar","3 eggs","100g plain flour","25g cocoa powder"]','["Wear a pair of rubber gloves to stop\r\nyour hands from staining, then top, tail\r\nand peel the beetroot – you’ll need about\r\n400g flesh. Roughly chop and put into a\r\nlarge bowl. Add a splash of water, cover\r\nwith cling film, then microwave on High\r\nfor 12 mins or until tender.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nWhile the beetroot cooks, butter then\r\nline a 20 x 30cm traybake or small\r\nroasting tin. Roughly chop the chocolate\r\nand cut the butter into cubes. Tip the\r\ncooked beetroot into a sieve, drain\r\noff any excess liquid, then put into a food\r\nprocessor or blender with the chocolate,\r\nbutter and vanilla. Whizz until the mix is\r\nas smooth as you can get it. The chocolate\r\nand butter will melt as you do this.","Put the sugar and eggs into a large\r\nbowl, then beat using an electric hand\r\nwhisk until thick, pale and foamy, about\r\n2 mins. Spoon the beetroot mix into the\r\nbowl (it won’t look too pretty at this\r\nstage, but bear with me), then use a large\r\nmetal spoon to fold it into the whisked\r\neggs. Try to conserve as much air in the\r\nmixture as you can. Sift in the flour and\r\ncocoa powder, then gently fold these in\r\nto make a smooth batter.","Pour into the prepared tin and bake\r\nfor 25 mins or until risen all over, with\r\njust the merest quiver under the centre\r\nof the crust when you shake the pan.\r\nCool completely in the tin, then cut\r\ninto squares."]','2026-01-10 12:23:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9283,9283,'en','Chocolate apples','Make these chocolate apples as a treat for a kids’ party. Great for Bonfire Night or Halloween, cover in chopped nuts, sprinkles and honeycomb pieces','["200g milk chocolate, finely chopped","4 small eating apples","sugar strands, finely chopped nuts, sprinkles, honeycomb pieces","50g of each white and dark chocolate, chopped (optional)","4 skewers, wooden chopsticks or large lolly sticks"]','["Put the chocolate in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of just simmering water, being careful that the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Stir frequently for 10 mins until completely melted, smooth and shiny. Remove from the heat. Alternatively, heat the chocolate in short bursts in themicrowave, stirring between each burst, until melted.","Put the apples in a heatproof bowl and pour over boiling water from thekettle. Drain carefully, and wash under hot water to remove any residual wax on the skin. This helps the chocolate stick better. Pat dry with kitchen paper, remove the stalks and push a lolly stick or skewer in its place.","Line a baking tray or large board with baking parchment. Hold the apples by their sticks and dunk into the melted chocolate. Use a spoon to coat the tops of the apples if you like. Once the apples are completely coated, hold over the bowl for a few seconds for excess chocolate to drip back into it, then place, stick pointing up, onto the prepared tray. Leave to set for a minute or two.","Tip the decorations into separate bowls. When the chocolate on the apples is just starting to set but not fully firm, sprinkle the decorations onto the apples. Hold them on their side and rotate using the stick to completely cover. Place back on the tray and leave until completely set.","If using the white and dark chocolate to decorate, heat each separately, as you did the milk chocolate in step 1, then leave to cool slightly. Melt the dark chocolate first, then when the chocolate apples are set hard, use a teaspoon to drizzle this over them, again holding the stick so the apple is on its side and rotating the apple. Have a sheet of baking parchment underneath to catch any drips. Place back on the tray and leave to set, then repeat the process using the white chocolate.Will keep in an airtight container in a cool place for two days."]','2026-01-10 12:23:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9284,9284,'en','Halloween pavlova','The ultimate Halloween pavlova cake, sandwiched together with cream and topped with ghoulishly cute decorations. This showstopping bake is perfect for a party','["500g caster sugar","250g egg whites","1 tsp cream of tartar","600ml double cream","300g blackberries","300g raspberries","100g frozen berries","a drizzle of honey","a squeeze of lemon","black food writing pen, for ghost eyes","edible flowers","black or white macarons","a drizzle of dark chocolate","edible gold leaf","freeze-dried raspberry pieces"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the caster sugar in a small roasting tray lined with baking parchment. Shake to level out the sugar and heat in the oven for about 5 mins until hot but not melting (this helps stabilise the egg whites and give a smooth and glossy meringue).","Beat the egg whites in a stand mixer with the cream of tartar. Whisk slowly at first, gradually increasing the speed until the egg whites are at the stiff peak stage, about 5 mins. It’s important not to over-whisk the egg whites. Remove the sugar from the oven as soon as the whites are stiff.","Turn the oven down to 110C/90C fan/gas ¼, leaving the door ajar to help it cool down quickly – your meringues need to be baked at a low temperature.","Turn the mixer up to full speed and start adding the sugar one tablespoon at a time. You egg whites should maintain their volume as you keep adding sugar – if you see it starting to collapse, stop adding sugar and allow the mixture to stiffen and rise before adding the rest, a spoonful at a time.","Line three baking trays with baking parchment, and put the ‘B’B’, ‘O’O’ ‘O’’O’ templates underneath so that you can trace them. Fill your piping bag with the meringue, about two-thirds of the way up. Avoid over-filling the bag or you''ll find it difficult to pipe – you can add more into the bag later.","Cut a hole at the tip of the bag, around 1cm wide, and hold the bag near to the bottom while your other hand holds the top, keeping the top of the bag closed so there are no meringue spillages.","Start with the piping bag directly upright and squeeze gently with the bottom hand to trace around the edge of the letters to make a meringue border; once you have the shape, you can fill it in. Smooth any rough lines and edges with the back of a spoon or mini palette knife.","To form the ghosts, hold the bag steady about 1cm above the tray and squeeze the bag from the top to start forming the body of your ghost. Keep the bag completely still while squeezing, using your lower hand to keep the bag steady. Stop squeezing once the meringue hits the tray. Lift the piping bag a tiny amount, without creating a break between the meringue on the tray and the meringue left in the piping bag. Drop the bag back down again and squeeze gently to form the top part of the ghost''s body - lift the piping bag straight up to leave a cute peak on the top of your ghosts'' heads. This will take a bit of practice so don’t worry if you don’t get it right the first time, just keep going and get a feel for it.","Place your six letters and the mini ghosts in the oven for 2 hrs until the meringue is crisp on the outside and mallowy in the middle. Turn off the oven and leave the pavlova to cool in the oven. If after 2 hrs your meringue is too gooey in the middle, bake for another 30 mins, then leave it to cool in the oven again.Will keep for one week stored loosely in a tin somewhere cool and dry.","To make the the raspberry ‘blood’ coulis, put the frozen berries in a pan over a medium heat, then add a tbsp of honey and a squeeze of lemon juice. Cook for 5 mins. For a smooth sauce, strain through a fine sieve, then leave to cool.Will keep for up to three days in the fridge.","When you''re ready to serve, place the bottom letters on the board to spell out ‘BOO’ on a lovely serving platter or board. If you had enough mixture to make mini meringue ghosts, add their faces. We like to draw on two big, droopy eyes and an open mouth so you can really imagine them making spooky, ghostly sounds. If you don’t have an edible pen, you can gently melt 50g dark chocolate in a microwave and use a small paint brush to paint on the faces.","Whip the double cream until soft peaks form. Fill your second piping bag with your whipped cream and cut a small hole, around 2cm, at the end. Pipe blobs all over the letters – you can add some sliced berries on top of the cream at this stage. Carefully place the second letters on top. Repeat the cream blobs on the top layer. Decorate with the blackberries, raspberries, edible flowers and ghost meringues. Drizzle with some of the raspberry ‘blood’ coulis. Feel free to add sprinkles, macarons, Halloween sweets, a drizzle of dark chocolate, edible gold leaf or freeze-dried raspberry pieces – go to town with what you have!We recommend eating it the same day, but it will keep for a day in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:23:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9285,9285,'en','Meringue monsters','Make a colourful and creative set of meringue monsters to complete your Halloween party spread. Mix colours and designs to make different designs','["500g caster sugar","250g free-range egg whites","1 tsp cream of tartar","green and purple food colouring, (PME natural food colouring works well)","3 piping bags","100g royal icing (made following pack instructions)","black gel food colouring"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Put the caster sugar in a small roasting tray lined with baking parchment. Shake to level out the sugar and heat in the oven for about 5 mins until hot but not melting. This helps stabilise the egg whites and give a smooth and glossy meringue.","Put the egg whites and cream of tartar into the bowl of a stand mixer. Whisk slowly at first, gradually increasing the speed until the egg whites are at the stiff peak stage, about 5 mins. It’s important not to over-whisk the egg whites. Remove the sugar from the oven as soon as the eggs whites are stiff.","Turn the oven down to 110C/90C fan/gas ¼, leaving the door ajar to help it cool down quickly – the meringues need to be baked at a lower temperature.","Turn the mixer up to full speed and start adding the sugar one tablespoon at a time. You want the egg whites to maintain their volume as you keep adding sugar, so if you see it starting to collapse, stop adding sugar and allow the mixture to stiffen and rise before adding the rest, a spoonful at a time.","Once all the sugar has been added, keep whisking until you have a stiff and glossy mixture. It’s ready to use when it holds its shape, about 2-5 mins after you add the last of the sugar. You should also be able to see peaks in the mixture as you remove and upturn the whisk.","To add colour to your monsters, you will need to paint your piping bags. This mixture will make enough for two piping bags – one green, and one purple – but feel free to choose your own monster colours, and even mix them up by painting stripes. Turn your piping bags inside out. Place the bags over jugs or bottles so that they hold themselves up. Paint a thick layer of food colouring from the tip of the piping bag to halfway down the bag. Invert the bags, then carefully spoon your meringue into piping bags – one batch should fill two bags, shaking the mixture down to the bottom of the bag. Try to get rid of any big air bubbles you can see at this stage, but don''t be too rough with the mixture.","Cut some baking parchment to the size of your baking trays. Cut off the bottom inch of the piping bag (about a 50p-sized hole) and squeeze small dollops on to the corner of your baking trays to stick the parchment down.","Hold the piping bag with both hands, placing your dominant hand at the top of the bag and your other hand halfway down the bag. Hold the bag steady, about 2cm above the tray and squeeze the bag from the top to start forming the body of your monsters. Stop squeezing once the meringue hits the tray. Lift the piping bag a little without creating a break between the meringue on the tray and the meringue left in the piping bag. Drop the bag back down again and squeeze gently to form the top part of the monster’s body.","Repeat until you have piped all of your mixture, working quickly as the mixture will loosen over time. Bake for 40-50 mins until crisp on the outside and soft in the middle. Leave to cool on the baking trays.","If you want to make your own googly eyes, do this at least 24 hrs in advance. Make 100g stiff royal icing, colouring a quarter of this black using black gel colouring. Put the white and black icing into two separate piping bags. Use scissors to snip a little hole at the tip. Carefully pipe white dots onto a parchment-lined baking tray, then leave them to set. Once dry, use the black icing for the pupils. Pipe different-shaped eyes – some big, some small, or perhaps three adjoining. Leave to set overnight until they lift off the baking parchment easily. Use more icing to stick the eyes onto the meringues.Once set,will keep for two weeks in a cool dry place in a loosely covered container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9286,9286,'en','Halloween brownies','Forget packets of sweets – if you want a real treat at Halloween, these decadent spooky brownies will do the trick. Both kids and adults will love them','["200g butter","200g dark chocolate, roughly chopped","4 large eggs","350g caster sugar","100g plain flour","cocoa powder","milk chocolate, chopped","white chocolate, chopped","créme-filled chocolate sandwich cookies","sugar-coated chocolates","icing pens"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 24 x 20cm brownie tin with baking parchment. Melt the butter and dark chocolate in a heatproof bowl set over a small pan of just simmering water. Stir until completely smooth, then leave to cool for 10 mins.","Beat the eggs and sugar with an electric whisk until thick and pale – the mixture should double in volume and leave a trail when the beaters are lifted. Pour the cooled dark chocolate mixture around the edge of the bowl. Sift over the flour and cocoa, add the milk chocolate, and gently fold everything together with aspatulaor large metal spoon. Pour into the prepared tin and bake for 35-40 mins.","Meanwhile, make the ‘eyeballs’. Melt the white chocolate in a heatproof bowl over the pan of just simmering water. Stir until smooth. Dip each cookie into the chocolate to cover one side. Stick a sugar-coated chocolate in the centre of each, then leave to set. When the chocolate is fully dry, pipe a pupil and red veins onto each eyeball using the icing pens.","Remove the traybake from the oven, and immediately push the eyeballs into the surface in even rows – do this gently, so they’re just pushed in slightly. Leave to cool completely.Cutinto 12 squares."]','2026-01-10 12:23:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9287,9287,'en','Halloween slash cake','What says ''Halloween party'' more than this cake? Fondant icing, strawberry jam and red food colouring are the secrets behind the ''blood'' topping and filling','["140g unsalted butter, plus extra for the tin","100ml grapeseed oil, or another flavourless oil","200ml milk","3 tbsp yogurt","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 large eggs, at room temperature","250g light muscovado sugar","250g plain flour","3 tsp baking powder","50g cocoa powder","¾  x 340g jar strawberry jam","1¼ kg ready-to-roll white fondant icing","600g icing sugar, sifted, plus extra for dusting","300g butter, softened","red food colouring"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line the bases of two 20cm sandwich tins. Melt the butter in a pan, then remove from the heat and beat in the oil, milk, yogurt, vanilla and eggs. Whisk the dry ingredients together with a large pinch of salt, squishing any lumps of sugar with your fingers. Tip the wet ingredients into the dry, then whisk until smooth.","Divide the batter between the tins and bake for 25-30 mins on the same shelf of the oven until risen and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool for 10 mins in the tins, then transfer to a rack to cool completely.","To make the buttercream, beat together the sugar, butter and a few drops of the red food colouring. Add 2-3 tbsp of boiling water if needed to soften the mixture, until you end up with a smooth, spreadable icing.","Trim the cakes flat if needed, then halve each through the middle using a large serrated knife. Put one cake layer on a board or plate, spread over a thin layer of the buttercream and dot over a third of the jam. Top with another cake layer and repeat with the buttercream, jam and cake, finishing with a layer of cake. Use most of the remaining buttercream to ice the cake all over, reserving a small amount.","Roll the fondant icing out on a surface dusted with icing sugar until large enough to cover the top and sides of the cake. Carefully lift it up onto the cake and smooth down to help it to stick. Use a sharp knife to cut slashes into the icing, then drizzle a little of the reserved buttercream mixed with some water into each to look like blood."]','2026-01-10 12:23:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9288,9288,'en','Ghost cake','Get seasonal and spooky with this simple but effective ghost cake – the perfect bake for a Halloween party with friends','["300ml rapeseed oil plus more for the tins","325g self-raising flour","5 tbsp cocoa powder","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","300g caster sugar","4 tbsp golden syrup","4 large large eggs, beaten","300ml milk","750g white fondant icing","black food colouring (or black fondant icing)","100g butter, very soft","225g icing sugar, plus more to dust","2 tbsp cocoa powder"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil and line the base of two 16cm (or smaller) sandwich tins and a 1.2L pudding basin. Mix the self-raising flour, cocoa powder, bicarbonate of soda and sugar in a bowl. Make a well in the centre and beat in the golden syrup, eggs, oil and milk with an electric whisk, until smooth.","Pour the mixture into the pudding basin until it is ¾ full, then divide the rest between the two sandwich tins and bake for 25-30 mins until the cakes are risen and firm to the touch. The sponge in the pudding basin may need longer depending on whether the basin is metal or ceramic. Cool for 10 mins before turning out onto a cooling rack and cool completely.","Meanwhile, to make the icing beat the butter until it is creamy, beat in the icing sugar a little at a time, beat in the cocoa powder and 2 tbsp water.","Cut the pudding basin cake in half horizontally and sandwich it back together with a little icing. Put a round sponge on a cake board or plate, sandwich the next one on top with a little icing. Sandwich the pudding basin cake onto the top of the round cake. If the bottom cake sticks out beyond the bottom of the pudding basin cake then trim the top edge of the lower cake at an angle to make the sides flatter. Ice the outside of the cake with a thin layer of chocolate icing, using it all up.","Roll the fondant out on a surface dusted with icing sugar to make a sheet shape that is big enough to cover the whole cake. Drape it carefully over the iced cake and press it on around the top to make your ghost, with ruffles around the edges, cutting off the excess round the base. Colour some of the excess icing black by kneading in the food colouring, or use the black fondant icing. Roll it out to a few mm thick. Cut out eyes and a mouth and stick them on."]','2026-01-10 12:23:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9289,9289,'en','Pumpkin & caramel cake','This cake uses a few shortcuts but the final result is a deliciously impressive dulce de leche and pumpkin spice-filled sponge','["80ml vegetable oil, plus extra for greasing","450g pack vanilla or white cake mix (or make your own cake mix, see tip below)","½  x 425g can pumpkin purée","125ml full-fat milk","4 large eggs","1 tsp pumpkin pie spice (available from uk.iherb.com, or mix it yourself by combining ½  tsp ground cinnamon, ¼ tsp ground ginger, ¼ tsp nutmeg and a pinch of ground cloves)","4 tbsp dulce de leche from a jar","225g full-fat cream cheese","125g icing sugar, sifted","1 tsp pumpkin pie spice","½  x 425g can pumpkin purée","440ml double cream","70g pecans, toasted and roughly chopped"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease and line the bases of two 23cm cake tins. In a big bowl, beat the oil, cake mix, pumpkin purée, milk, eggs and spice mixture until smooth. Pour the mixture into the cake tins and bake for 22-25 mins until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Cool in the tins while you make the filling.","Beat the cream cheese briefly in a medium bowl until fluffy, then add the icing sugar, spice and pumpkin purée and beat until smooth. Be careful not to overbeat or it will go runny. In another bowl, whip the cream and fold it gently into the cream cheese mixture.","When the cakes are cool, cut each one in half horizontally so you have four thin sponges. Put the bottom layer on a plate, spread with 1 tbsp dulce de leche, then smooth over a quarter of the filling. Add the next layer and repeat until you have an amazing tower of pumpkin, cake, caramel and cream, then sprinkle the pecans on top. Boom."]','2026-01-10 12:23:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9290,9290,'en','Spider’s web cake','Swiss meringue buttercream icing transformed into a spooky Halloween showstopper – this rich chocolate sponge will be the guest of honour at any Halloween party','["110g unsalted butter, plus extra for greasing","3 tbsp cocoa powder","140ml chocolate stout (we used Young''s Double Chocolate Stout, available from Tesco)","170g white caster sugar","170g light brown soft sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs, lightly beaten","100g dark chocolate, melted and cooled","280g plain flour","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","3 large egg whites","240g caster sugar","360g unsalted butter, room temperature","200g white chocolate, melted and cooled","100g white mini marshmallows","25g black sugar paste"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Grease three 20cm round cake tins and line the bases with baking parchment. To make the cake, put the cocoa in a bowl, add 280ml boiling water and whisk until dissolved. Pour in the stout, mix, then set aside to cool.","In a stand mixer or a large bowl using an electric hand whisk, beat together the butter, both sugars and vanilla extract until light and fluffy (about 5 mins). Add the eggs little by little, mixing until fully incorporated before adding more. Once all the egg has been added, spoon in the melted chocolate and mix to combine.","In another bowl, mix the flour, bicarb and 1/2 tsp salt. Add this mixture to the butter mixture in three stages, alternating with the stout mixture (which will be very runny). Pour the batter equally between the prepared tins and bake for 25-30 mins until a skewer inserted into the cake comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tins for 10 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack to cool completely.","To make the buttercream, put the egg whites and sugar in a heatproof bowl and set over a pan of gently simmering water. Stir with a whisk until the sugar has dissolved and the mixture is warm to the touch. Remove the bowl from the heat and beat with an electric hand whisk on high speed until the mixture has tripled in volume and has cooled down. Slowly add the butter 1 tbsp at a time while continuing to whisk. Once all the butter has been added, the mixture should look glossy and thick – if it doesn’t, keep whisking until it does, or if the bowl still feels warm, chill for 10 mins before whisking again. Once ready, mix in the melted white chocolate.","To assemble the cake, put one of the cake layers on a cake stand and top with a layer of buttercream. Repeat with the other two layers. Spread the remaining buttercream all over the cake, using a spatula or palette knife to smooth the sides. Chill for 1 hr or until the buttercream is firm (see tip, below).","To decorate, melt the marshmallows in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, stirring from time to time. Remove from the heat and put to one side for a few mins until the mixture is cool enough to handle. Use your fingers to grab a small amount of the marshmallow and stretch it out to form long strands (dipping your fingers in vegetable or sunflower oil will help!) Drape the strands over the cake in a random pattern, so it’s thoroughly covered. Create a spider using the sugar paste (roll two balls, one bigger than the other, for the body, and thin strands for the legs) and place on top of the cake. Will keep for up to three days in an airtight container."]','2026-01-10 12:23:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9291,9291,'en','Frankenstein cupcakes','Make your own monsters this Halloween with our easy baking recipe – decorate with green and black icing and mini marshmallows','["200g soft butter","175g golden caster sugar","250g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","¼ tsp salt","3 large eggs, at room temperature?","½  tsp vanilla extract","100ml milk, at room temperature","300g icing sugar, sifted","2-3 tbsp milk","green food colouring paste (we used Party Green from Sugarflair)?","36 mini marshmallows, 12 snipped in half (for the eyes)","tube of black piping icing or gel"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with deep muffin cases. Cream the butter with the sugar until pale and fluffy. Add the remaining cake ingredients and beat until smooth. Spoon into the muffin cases and bake for 20 mins or until golden and a skewer inserted into one of the middle cakes comes out clean. Cool for 5 mins in the tin, then completely on a wire rack.?","Using a small, sharp serrated knife, cut a semi-circle piece of cake from the left and right of each cake, to make stepped edges, level with the cupcake case. Next, make? a widthways cut about 3cm from the top ?of the cake, about 1cm deep. Slice a 5mm piece off the surface of the cake to meet this cut, to make a flat, raised face and prominent forehead. Chill for 10 mins to firm the crumbs.?","Mix the icing sugar, milk and green colouring to make a very thick icing that flows slowly from the spoon. Spoon 1 tbsp onto a cake and let it begin to spread ?itself over the cut shape. Ease it here and there with a palette knife to coat. Add marshmallow neck bolts and eyes. Repeat for each cupcake. Leave to set, then pipe on the faces and hair."]','2026-01-10 12:23:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9292,9292,'en','Freaky finger red velvet cake','Terrify and delight this Halloween with a dramatic chocolate red velvet cake, sandwiched with an easy cream cheese frosting','["175g soft butter, plus extra for greasing","225g white caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs, at room temperature","1 tbsp red food colouring paste (we used Christmas red from Sugarflair)","200g plain flour","50g cocoa powder (we used Green & Black''s)","1½  tsp bicarbonate of soda?","½  tsp baking powder","¼ tsp salt","150g pot low-fat plain yogurt, loosened with 2 tbsp milk","about 3 x 114g boxes white chocolate fingers (we found them in Tesco)","140g icing sugar","2 tsp milk","small blob of red food colouring paste","100g soft butter","300g full-fat cream cheese, fridge cold (we used Philadelphia as it has the firmest texture)","zest 1 orange (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. For the cake, grease 2 x 20cm sandwich tins and line the bases with baking parchment. Cream together the butter, sugar and vanilla, then add the eggs, one at a time, beating well after each egg, until fluffy and light. Beat in the colouring.","Mix the dry ingredients for the cake, and sift half onto the creamed mix. Fold ?in with a spatula, followed by half of the thinned yogurt. Repeat, then spoon the smooth batter into the tins and level.? Bake for 25 mins or until risen and springy when pressed lightly in the centre. Cool for 10 mins, then turn out onto a wire rack and cool completely.","For the fingers, line a baking tray with parchment. Cut one end from each chocolate finger. Mix 50g icing sugar, the milk and a small blob of colouring to make a thick, red icing. The icing needs to be thick to stay put; add a little more sugar if you need to. Dip the severed biscuit ends into the icing, let the excess drip off, then paint a red fingernail on the other end, using a small paintbrush. Leave to dry on the parchment.?","For the frosting, use an electric mixer to beat the butter well until very smooth, then beat in the cream cheese and the zest (if using) until even. Sift in the remaining icing sugar, then fold it into the cheese mixture using a spatula until smooth. Don’t overbeat. Chill until needed.","Sandwich and cover the top and sides? of the cake with the frosting – you will only need a thin layer on the sides of the cake to stick on the chocolate fingers. Stand the severed fingers around the cake in a neat collar, pressing them lightly into the frosting. You’ll have a few left over to put on the top. Keep the cake in the fridge but enjoy it at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:23:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9293,9293,'en','Haunted graveyard cake','The perfect centrepiece for a Halloween celebration, this cake is guaranteed to make your party extra spooky','["1 egg white","50g icing sugar","200ml single cream","200g dark chocolate, finely chopped","125g rich tea finger biscuits","100g double chocolate cookies","25g white chocolate","silver balls, to decorate","85g cocoa powder","200g self-raising flour","375g light brown muscovado sugar","4 eggs","200ml milk","175ml vegetable oil"]','["To make the ghosts, heat oven to\r\n110C/90C fan/gas ¼. Whip the egg\r\nwhite in a clean bowl until stiff peaks\r\nform. Whisk in the sugar a tbsp at a time\r\nand keep whisking for a couple of mins\r\nuntil the mixture is thick and resembles\r\nshaving foam. Gently spoon the mixture\r\ninto a large freezer bag, then cut a 1.5cm\r\nhole in one of the corners. Cover a baking\r\nsheet with some baking parchment.\r\nCarefully squeeze a small circle of\r\nwhipped egg white out of the bag, pulling\r\nupwards as you do to make a ghost\r\nshape. Repeat until the mixture is used\r\nup – you should get about 15 ghosts.\r\nBake for 1½ hrs until crisp. Can be stored\r\nin an airtight container for up to 2 days.","Now make the cake. Heat oven to\r\n180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tip the cocoa\r\npowder, self-raising flour and sugar\r\ninto a large bowl, breaking up any\r\nclumps of sugar. Mix together the eggs,\r\nmilk and oil in a measuring cup or bowl,\r\nthen pour over the dry ingredients and\r\nstir everything together until smooth.\r\nGrease and line a deep baking dish\r\n(20 x 30 x 5cm) with baking parchment.\r\nPour in the cake mixture and bake for\r\n30 mins. Leave to cool, then turn out\r\nonto a serving plate. Alternatively, wrap\r\nwell and store for up to 2 days.","Finish decorating the cake: heat cream\r\nin a saucepan until just boiling. Place the\r\ndark chocolate in a large bowl and\r\npour over the hot cream. Stir until the\r\nchocolate melts. Use a clean brush to\r\npaint a layer of chocolate over 7 rich\r\ntea finger biscuits, then set aside to cool.\r\nPour the rest of the chocolate mixture\r\nover the cake and smooth over with a\r\nknife. Whizz the chocolate cookies, or\r\nbash in a freezer bag with a rolling pin,\r\nuntil small crumbs form. Sprinkle over\r\nthe top of the cake.","Place the white chocolate in a small\r\nbowl, set over a pan of simmering water.\r\nLeave for 5 mins or until melted, then\r\nspoon into a small freezer bag. Wait for\r\n10 mins so the mixture is not too runny,\r\nthen cut a tiny hole in one corner of the\r\nbag. Pipe out 2 small blobs onto each\r\nghost, place a silver ball on each to make\r\neyes, then pipe out suitable words and\r\nshapes on the gravestones. Leave for\r\n30 mins to set, then push the biscuit\r\ngravestones into the cake and arrange\r\nthe ghosts around. To get the ghosts to\r\n‘fly’, push a thin wire (you can get these\r\nfrom a florist shop – remember to\r\nremove before eating) into the bottom of\r\nthe ghost, then place in the cake, hiding\r\nthe wire behind a gravestone."]','2026-01-10 12:24:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9294,9294,'en','Eerie eyeball pops','These spooky chocolate cake balls will be a hit with kids at Halloween – they can help decorate them too','["100g/4oz Madeira cake","100g Oreo cookies","100g bar milk chocolate, melted","200g bar white chocolate, melted","few Smarties and icing pens, to decorate","10 wooden skewers","½ small pumpkin\n or butternut squash, deseeded, to stand pops in"]','["Break the Madeira cake and cookies\r\ninto the bowl of a food processor,\r\npour in the melted milk chocolate\r\nand whizz to combine.","Tip the mixture into a bowl, then\r\nuse your hands to roll into about\r\n10 walnut-sized balls. Chill for 2 hrs\r\nuntil really firm.","Push a skewer into each ball, then\r\ncarefully spoon the white chocolate\r\nover the cake balls to completely cover.\r\nStand the cake pops in the pumpkin,\r\nthen press a Smartie onto the surface\r\nwhile wet. Chill again until the chocolate\r\nhas set. Before serving, using the icing\r\npens, add a pupil to each Smartie and\r\nwiggly red veins to the eyeballs."]','2026-01-10 12:24:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9295,9295,'en','Hooting Halloween owls','Delicious and simple chocolate cup cakes to make with the kids at Halloween – real crowd-pleasers','["280g butter, softened","280g golden caster sugar","200g self-raising flour, minus 1 rounded tbsp","1 rounded tbsp cocoa powder","6 medium eggs","200g butter, softened","280g icing sugar, sifted","1 tube orange ready-to-use icing","1 small bag Maltesers","1 tube choco M&Ms minis (use just the brown sweets) or Cadbury''s mini buttons","1 tub jelly diamonds (just the orange ones)"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Line a 12-cup muffin tin with brown muffin cases. Beat the first 5 ingredients to a smooth batter and spoon between the cases, almost filling them to the top. You may have a little left over. Bake for 20-25 mins until risen and spongy. Cool on a rack.","Beat the butter and icing sugar until smooth. Slice off the very tops of the cakes and cut each piece in half. Spread a generous layer of icing over each cake.","Working on one cake at a time, squirt a pea-sized blob of orange icing onto two Maltesers and use to fix a brown M&M on each. Sit the eyes, two pieces of cake top (curved edge up) and a jelly diamond on the icing to make an owl."]','2026-01-10 12:24:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9296,9296,'en','Spooky spider cakes','Children will have great fun decorating these at Halloween parties','["200g butter, at room temperature","200g golden caster sugar","200g self-raising flour","4 eggs","½ tsp baking powder","1 tsp vanilla extract","6 tbsp chocolate chips or chopped chocolate","2 packs liquorice Catherine wheels","12 tbsp Nutella or other chocolate spread","liquorice allsorts (the black ones with the white centre)","tube black writing icing","1 length red bootlace"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4 and\r\nline a muffin tin with 12 cases, preferably\r\nbrown ones. Put the butter, sugar and flour\r\nin a mixing bowl. Break the eggs into a\r\nsmaller bowl, taking care not to get any shell\r\ninto it, then tip on top of the butter mixture.","Add the baking powder and vanilla to the\r\nlarger bowl, then beat with an electric hand\r\nwhisk until smooth and creamy. Stir in the\r\nchocolate drops or chocolate. Spoon the\r\ncake mixture evenly into the cases and bake\r\nfor 20-25 mins until golden – a cocktail stick\r\npushed into the middle of one of the cakes\r\nshould come out clean. Cool on a wire rack.","To decorate the cakes, unravel the liquorice\r\nwheels and cut into lengths with scissors\r\nto make dangly legs. Stick 8 into the top of\r\neach cake, making small cuts with the tip of\r\na sharp knife so they push in really securely.","Spoon the chocolate spread on top and\r\nspread lightly within the liquorice legs to\r\nmake a round spider’s body. Now cut the\r\nAllsorts to make eyes and the red bootlaces\r\nto make mouths, then stick them onto the\r\ncakes and dot on the icing to make eyeballs.\r\nWill keep for up to 2 days in a cool place."]','2026-01-10 12:24:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9297,9297,'en','Spider web chocolate fudge muffins','Special Hallowe''en chocolatey bakes for lucky trick or treaters – you can make ahead and freeze','["50g dark chocolate (55% cocoa solids is fine)","85g butter","1 tbsp milk, water or coffee","200g self-raising flour","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","85g light muscovado sugar","50g golden caster sugar","1 egg","142ml carton soured cream","100g dark chocolate (as above)","100g white chocolate"]','["Preheat the oven to fan 170C/\r\nconventional 190C/gas 5 and line a\r\nmuffin tin with 10 paper muffin cases.\r\nBreak the chocolate into a heatproof\r\nbowl, add the butter and liquid. Melt\r\nin the microwave on Medium for 30-45 seconds (or set the bowl over a \r\npan of gently simmering water). Stir\r\nand leave the mixture to cool.","Mix the flour, bicarbonate of soda\r\nand both sugars in a bowl. Beat the\r\negg in another bowl and stir in the\r\nsoured cream, then pour this on the\r\nflour mixture and add the cooled\r\nchocolate. Stir just to combine –\r\ndon’t overmix or it will get tough.","Spoon the mixture into the cases to\r\nabout three quarters full. Bake for 20\r\nminutes until well risen. Loosen the\r\nedges with a round-bladed knife, let\r\nthem sit in the tins for a few minutes,\r\nthen lift out and cool on a wire rack.","For the topping, make two piping\r\nbags out of greaseproof paper (or\r\ncut the ends off two clean plastic\r\nbags). Break the dark and white\r\nchocolate into separate bowls and\r\nmelt in the microwave on Medium for\r\n2 minutes (or over a pan as in step 1).\r\nPut 2 spoonfuls of dark chocolate in\r\none bag and the same of white\r\nchocolate in the other.","Working with one muffin at a time,\r\nspread with dark chocolate from the\r\nbowl, letting it run down a bit, then\r\npipe four concentric circles of white\r\nchocolate on top. Using a small\r\nskewer, drag through the circles at\r\nregular intervals, from the centre to\r\nthe edge, to create a cobweb effect.\r\nRepeat with four more muffins. On\r\nthe remaining five, spread over the\r\nwhite chocolate and decorate with\r\nthe dark. Best eaten the day they’re\r\nmade – even better while the\r\nchocolate’s soft."]','2026-01-10 12:24:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9298,9298,'en','Malloween ghosts','Made with melted marshmallows, these spooky little Halloween cakes are both chewy and crisp','["100g unsalted butter, plus a little extra for the tin","300g pink and white marshmallows","200g rice cereal (try Rice Krispies)","300g white chocolate, melted, for coating","a little melted plain chocolate or black writing icing, to decorate","wooden lolly sticks or coffee stirrers (stirrers are a little more bendy)"]','["Butter, then line a 30 x 20cm Swiss roll\r\ntin with baking parchment. Melt the\r\nbutter in a large non-stick saucepan.\r\nTip in the marshmallows, then melt very\r\ngently for about 10 mins, stirring regularly\r\nto make sure they don’t stick.","Once smooth, stir in the cereal until all\r\nof the grains are coated. Spoon the mix\r\ninto the tin, then press down to make\r\nit flat and smooth. Chill until cool and set.\r\nCan be made up to 2 days ahead.","Make the ghost shapes two ways.\r\nCut the cake into rectangles, then use\r\na sharp knife to round off the tops and\r\nzig-zag the bottoms. Or, to make flying\r\nghosts, stamp out circles about 9cm\r\nacross and use a sharp knife to divide\r\ninto teardrop-shaped ghosts. Cut pieces\r\nof leftover cake to make arms, if you like.","Carefully push a lolly stick into the\r\nbottom of each ghost. Put onto a cooling\r\nrack. If you’ve made arms, stick them on\r\nusing a little white chocolate, then spoon\r\nover more chocolate and paint it over\r\nand down the sides of the ghosts with a\r\npastry brush. Leave to set. Pipe on eyes\r\nwith the plain chocolate or icing."]','2026-01-10 12:24:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9299,9299,'en','Squeamish squares','These will be a big hit at Halloween – sticky, crunchy andchewy in one bite','["150g dark chocolate, broken into pieces (70% cocoa solids is good)","100g unsalted butter","4 tbsp golden syrup","100g Rice Krispies cereal","50g dried blueberries","50g dried cranberries","100g mini marshmallows","50g white chocolate, broken into pieces","jelly snakes and bugs, to decorate"]','["Line a 20cm square tin with baking\r\nparchment or cling film. Place the dark\r\nchocolate, butter and golden syrup in a pan over a low heat and stir until melted.","Put the Rice Krispies in a large bowl and\r\nmix in the blueberries, cranberries and\r\nmarshmallows. Stir in the melted chocolate\r\nmixture until everything is well-coated. Spoon\r\nthe mixture into the tin and spread out\r\nevenly. Chill in the fridge for an hour until set\r\n(or make the day before and chill overnight).","Remove from tin and peel away paper\r\nor cling film. Using a sharp knife, cut into\r\n16 squares or 32 bite-size pieces. Melt the\r\nwhite chocolate in a small bowl over a pan\r\nof barely-simmering water, or in the\r\nmicrowave on High for 1 min, stirring\r\nhalf way. Using a teaspoon, drizzle the\r\nwhite chocolate over the squares. Scatter\r\nwith the jelly sweets, then allow to set\r\nbefore piling onto a serving plate.\r\nKeep in an airtight container for up to 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9300,9300,'en','Chocolate muffins with hot chocolate custard','These classic cocoa puddings with a hot chocolate sauce contain just 215 calories each – and there''s a lemon version too','["1 tbsp cocoa powder","100g self-raising flour","½ tsp bicarbonate of soda","50g golden caster sugar","100ml skimmed milk","1 egg","2 tbsp sunflower oil, plus extra for greasing","2 x 150g pots low-fat custard","25g dark chocolate, chopped"]','["Heat oven to 170C/fan 150C/gas 5. Brush 6 holes of a muffin tin with a drop of oil. Sieve the cocoa into a large bowl, then add the rest of the dry ingredients. Stir to combine, then make a well in the centre.","Beat the milk, egg and oil together in a jug, pour into the well, then stir quickly to make a batter. Spoon into the muffin tin, then bake for 15 mins or until risen and firm to the touch. Heat the custard in the microwave according to instructions, or in a pan, then tip in the chopped chocolate and stir until smooth. Turn the puddings into bowls and pour the custard over."]','2026-01-10 12:24:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9301,9301,'en','Mango & passion fruit roulade','There’s no need to say ‘no’ to this fruity roulade, whisked sponges are famously low in fat –especially if you use yogurt instead of cream','["3 eggs","85g golden caster sugar, plus 1 tbsp","85g plain flour, sifted","1 tsp baking powder, sifted","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tbsp golden caster sugar","flesh from 2 large, ripe passion fruits","2 mangoes, peeled and cut into small chunks","250g frozen raspberries, defrosted","200g tub 2% Greek yogurt or very low-fat fromage frais"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Grease\r\nand line a 30 x 24cm Swiss roll tin with nonstick\r\npaper. Put the eggs and sugar into a\r\nlarge bowl and beat with electric beaters\r\nuntil thick and light, about 5 mins. Fold in the\r\nflour and baking powder, then the vanilla. Tip\r\ninto the tin, tilt to level the mix, then bake for\r\n12-15 mins until golden and just springy. Turn\r\nonto another sheet of paper, dusted with\r\n1 tbsp caster sugar. Roll the paper up inside\r\nthe sponge, then leave to cool completely.\r\nSponge can be frozen for up to 1 month.","Fold sugar, passion fruit pulp and one-third\r\nof the mango and raspberries into the yogurt.\r\nUnroll the sponge, spread with filling, then\r\nroll up. Serve with the rest of the fruit on the\r\nside. Roulade can be filled and rolled up to\r\n2 hrs before serving and kept in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:24:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9302,9302,'en','The ultimate makeover: Chocolate log','The lighter version of this much-loved festive treat keeps all of the chocolatey richness','["1 tsp instant coffee granules","4 eggs, at room temperature","85g golden caster sugar, plus extra for rolling","50g light muscovado sugar","120g self-raising flour","2 tbsp cocoa powder","50g plain chocolate, 70% cocoa solids or more, very finely chopped","250g mascarpone light","140g Quark","50g icing sugar","1 ½ tbsp cocoa powder","1 tsp instant coffee granules","½ tsp vanilla extract","holly sprigs"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nLightly oil and line a 23 x 32cm Swiss roll\r\ntin with baking paper. Mix the coffee with\r\n1 tbsp warm water. Beat the eggs, both\r\nsugars and the coffee mix together in a\r\nlarge mixing bowl with an electric whisk\r\nfor about 8 mins or until the mixture is\r\nthick and airy like meringue and holds\r\na trail when you lift up the beaters.","Sift the flour and cocoa powder over\r\nthe fluffy egg mix, then fold in very gently\r\nusing a large metal spoon. Pour the\r\nmixture evenly into the lined tin and\r\ncarefully tip it so it spreads evenly\r\nwithout being deflated. Use a knife if\r\nnecessary to very gently tease it into the\r\ncorners. Bake for 12-15 mins or until the\r\ncake feels spongy but firm when touched.","Lay a sheet of baking paper on the\r\nwork surface and sprinkle with a little\r\ncaster sugar. Tip the tin upside-down\r\nonto the paper and let the cake fall out.\r\nCarefully peel off the paper. Roll up the\r\ncake lengthways from one of the short\r\nends with the help of the paper, rolling it\r\ninside so the cake doesn’t stick. Cool.\r\nThe cake becomes even more moist\r\nif left overnight wrapped up, then iced\r\nthe next day.","For the chocolate icing, put the\r\nchopped chocolate in a medium bowl.\r\nHeat a small pan of water (one-third full)\r\nuntil boiling, remove it from the heat,\r\nthen sit the bowl of chocolate over the\r\ntop. Leave for a few mins off the heat\r\nuntil melted. Remove the bowl from the\r\npan, then leave the chocolate until it is\r\ncool to the touch. Beat the mascarpone\r\nand quark together, then sift and stir in\r\nthe icing sugar and cocoa powder. Stir\r\nin the cooled melted chocolate (keeping\r\na couple of tsp back for drizzling), then\r\nthe coffee mixed with the vanilla extract.","Carefully unroll the cake, don’t\r\nworry if it cracks a bit, and discard the\r\npaper. Spread half the icing over the\r\nunrolled cake, then re-roll it, finishing\r\nwith the join underneath. Place the cake\r\non a serving plate. Swirl the rest of the\r\nicing all over the cake to cover it, then\r\ndrizzle over the reserved melted\r\nchocolate. Decorate with a sprig of holly."]','2026-01-10 12:24:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9303,9303,'en','Lemon & violet drizzle cake','A simple and sweet all-in-one cake – ideal for Mothering Sunday','["100g softened butter","175g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","175g golden caster sugar","2 large eggs","6 tbsp milk","finely grated rind of 1 large lemon","juice of 1 large lemon (you need 3 tablespoons)","100g golden caster sugar","mimosa balls and crystallised violets, to decorate"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/Gas 4/fan oven 160C.  Butter and line the base of a shallow oblong tin (about 18x28cm/7x11in) with baking parchment.  Tip all the cake ingredients into a large mixing bowl and beat for 2-3 minutes, until the mixture drops\r\neasily off the spoon.","Spoon the mixture into the tin and smooth the surface with the back of a spoon. Bake for 30-40 minutes, until golden and firm to the touch.  Meanwhile, make the icing: beat together the lemon juice and sugar, pour the mixture evenly over the cake while it is still hot, then leave to cool.","Cut the cake into 15 squares. Top each one with a crystallised violet and mimosa ball."]','2026-01-10 12:24:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9304,9304,'en','The ultimate makeover: Coffee walnut cake','A delicious but lighter version of teatime favourite, coffee and walnut cake','["1 tbsp coffee granules, plus 1 tsp","225g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","50g ground almonds","85g light muscovado sugar","50g golden caster sugar","25g chopped walnuts","2 eggs, beaten","250g natural yogurt","75ml walnut oil","2 tbsp golden caster sugar","2 tsp coffee granules","140g light mascarpone","100g Quark","1 tbsp icing sugar","¼ tsp vanilla extract","140g fondant icing sugar","1 tsp coffee granules","1 tbsp finely chopped walnuts"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nOil and bottom-line a 20cm round (6cm\r\ndeep) loose-bottom tin. For the cake,\r\nmix the coffee with 2 tsp warm water\r\nand set aside. Tip the flour into a large\r\nmixing bowl. Stir in the baking powder,\r\nground almonds, both sugars (use\r\nfingers to rub out any lumps from the\r\nmuscovado) and walnuts, then make\r\na dip in the centre. Put the eggs, yogurt,\r\noil and coffee mix into the dip and stir\r\nthe mixture with a wooden spoon so\r\neverything is evenly mixed. Spoon the\r\nmixture into the tin, smooth the top to\r\nlevel it, then bake for 40-45 mins, or until\r\na skewer inserted into the centre of the\r\ncake comes out clean. Let the cake cool\r\nin the tin briefly, then turn it out and peel off\r\nthe lining paper. Leave to cool completely\r\nwhile you make the filling and icing.","Make the syrup for the filling: put the\r\ncaster sugar and coffee into a small,\r\nheavy-based saucepan, then pour in\r\n3 tbsp water. Heat gently, stirring to\r\nhelp the sugar dissolve. Once dissolved,\r\nraise the heat, then boil at a fast rolling\r\nboil for about 2½-3 mins until thickened\r\nand syrupy. Pour into a small heatproof\r\nbowl and set aside to cool. When cold it\r\nshould be the consistency of treacle.","Meanwhile, finish off the filling and\r\nmake the icing. Beat the mascarpone,\r\nquark, icing sugar and vanilla together\r\nuntil smooth, then stir in the cold coffee\r\nsyrup. Set aside. For the icing, sift the\r\nfondant icing sugar into a bowl. Mix the\r\ncoffee with 1 tbsp warm water, stir this\r\ninto the fondant icing sugar with about\r\n1 more tsp water to give a smooth, thick\r\nbut spreadable icing. Split the cake into\r\n3, then sandwich back together with\r\nthe filling. Spread the icing over the top,\r\nscatter over the chopped walnuts and\r\nleave to set. Store in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:24:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9305,9305,'en','Summer pudding','This quintessentially British pud, packed with juicy summer berries, is so much easier than it looks, perfect for beginners','["300g strawberries","250g blackberries","100g redcurrants","500g raspberries","OR 1¼kg/2lb 12oz mixed berries and currants of your choice","175g golden caster sugar","7 slices day-old white bread, from a square, medium-cut loaf"]','["Bring out the juices: Wash fruit and gently dry on kitchen paper – keep strawberries separate. Put sugar and 3 tbsp water into a large pan. Gently heat until sugar  dissolves – stir a few times. Bring to a boil for  1 min, then tip in the fruit (not strawberries). Cook for 3 mins over a low heat, stirring 2-3 times. The fruit will be softened, mostly intact and surrounded by dark red juice. Put a sieve over a bowl and tip in the fruit and juice.","Prepare the bread: Line the 1.25-litre basin with cling film as this will help you to turn out the pudding. overlap two pieces in the middle of the bowl as it’s easier than trying  to get one sheet to stick to all of the curves.  Let the edges overhang by about 15cm. Cut the crusts off the bread. Cut 4 pieces of bread in half, a little on an angle, to give 2 lopsided rectangles per piece. Cut 2 slices into 4 triangles each and leave the final piece whole.","Build the pud: Dip the whole piece of bread into the juice for a few secs just to coat. Push this into the bottom of the basin. Now dip the wonky rectangular pieces one at a time and press around the basin’s sides so that they fit together neatly, alternately placing wide and narrow ends up. If you can’t quite fit the last piece of bread in it doesn’t matter, just trim into a triangle, dip in juice and slot in. Now spoon in the softened fruit, adding the strawberries here and there as you go.","Let flavours mingle then serve: Dip the bread triangles in juice and place on top – trim off overhang with scissors. Keep leftover  juice for later. Bring cling film up and loosely seal. Put a side plate on top and weight down with cans. Chill for 6 hrs or overnight. To serve, open out cling film then put a serving plate upside-down on top and flip over. serve with \r\nleftover juice, any extra berries and cream."]','2026-01-10 12:24:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9306,9306,'en','Guilt-free sticky toffee puds','A lighter version of the classic pudding – full of sticky dates and maple syrup. Yum','["175g pitted dried dates","150ml maple syrup","1 tbsp vanilla extract","2 large eggs, separated","85g self-raising flour","0% Greek yogurt and extra maple syrup, to serve (optional)"]','["Preheat the oven to 180C/Gas 4/fan oven 160C. Put the dates and 175ml/6fl oz water in a pan and simmer for 5 minutes.  Tip into a food processor, add 6 tablespoons maple syrup and the vanilla extract, and blend until smooth.","Transfer to a bowl and mix in the egg yolks, followed by the flour. In another bowl, whisk the egg whites until stiff, and fold into the date mixture.","Put 1 tablespoon maple syrup into each of four 200ml/7fl oz pudding moulds and add the mixture. Cover each tightly with foil, stand in an ovenproof dish and pour in hot water to halfway up the sides of the moulds. Cook for 1 hour, until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean.","Uncover, run a knife around the edges, and invert onto plates. Drizzle over yogurt and maple syrup to serve, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:24:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9307,9307,'en','Berry bake with passion fruit drizzle','A fruity family pud for summer – and the bonus is that it’s low fat too','["100g/4oz low-fat spread","85g caster sugar","grated zest and juice 1 lemon","1 egg","140g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","4 tbsp low-fat natural yogurt, plus extra to serve (optional)","200g apple sauce","140g raspberries, blueberries or blackberries (or a mixture)","50g demerara sugar","2 passion fruits, halved and pulp scooped out"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLightly grease a medium baking dish with\r\n1 tsp of the spread. Put the remaining\r\nspread, caster sugar, lemon zest, egg,\r\nflour, baking powder and yogurt in a\r\nmixing bowl. Whisk together for 2 mins\r\nuntil pale and fluffy. Stir in the apple\r\nsauce – this might make the mixture look\r\ncurdled, but don’t worry. Gently fold in\r\nthe berries, then pour the batter into the\r\nprepared dish and level the surface. Bake\r\nfor 25-30 mins until the sponge is golden\r\nbrown and firm in the centre.","Meanwhile, mix lemon juice, demerara\r\nsugar and passion fruit pulp together.\r\nRemove pudding from the oven, lightly\r\nprick the surface with a fork and drizzle\r\nover passion fruit mixture. Serve warm\r\nwith low-fat vanilla ice cream or the yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:24:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9308,9308,'en','Little toffee apple cake','Get children aged 8-14 inspired in the kitchen by making an afternoon tea treat','["3 tbsp sunflower oil, plus more for the tin","1 large apple","1 egg","1 tsp vanilla extract","110g self-raising flour","50g golden caster sugar","3 soft toffees"]','["Ask your\r\ngrown-up helperto switch the oven\r\non to 190C/170C fan/\r\ngas 5. Brush a small (500g/ 1 lb) loaf tin\r\nwith a little oil.","Peel the apple\r\nwith a potato\r\npeeler, then cut it\r\ninto quarters and\r\ncut out the cores.Ask a grown-up for\r\nhelp if you need to.","Grate the apple\r\nusing a rotary or\r\nbox grater and put it\r\nin a large bowl.","Break the egg\r\ninto a small bowl.\r\nIf any pieces of shell\r\nfall in, lift them out\r\nwith a spoon. Add\r\nto the apple, then\r\nadd 3 tbsp oil and\r\nthe vanilla. Mix well.","Add the flour\r\nand sugar and\r\nstir together. The\r\nmixture is quite stiff\r\nso keep going until\r\nall of the flour is\r\nmixed in. Scrape\r\ninto prepared tin.","Push 3 toffees\r\ninto the mix\r\nin a row. Ask a\r\ngrown-up to put the\r\ntin in the oven for\r\n30-40 mins or until\r\ncooked through.\r\nCool before tipping\r\nout and slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:24:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9309,9309,'en','Pear & toffee muffins','These gooey muffins are delicious warm when the toffee is still melty – you can reheat them in the microwave','["300g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","2 tsp ground cinnamon","85g golden caster sugar","250ml milk","2 eggs, beaten","100g butter, melted","2 ripe pears, peeled and cut into small chunks","100g soft toffees, chopped into pieces","25g flaked almonds"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6.\r\nLine a 12-hole deep muffin tin with\r\npaper cases. Tip the flour, baking powder,\r\ncinnamon and a pinch of salt into a large\r\nbowl, then stir in the sugar. Mix together the\r\nmilk, eggs and melted butter in a large jug\r\nand pour into the dry mix all at once, along\r\nwith the pears and a third of the toffee\r\npieces. Stir briefly until just beginning to\r\ncombine – the batter should still be quite\r\nlumpy and have streaks of flour.","Divide the mixture between the cases,\r\nthen sprinkle with the remaining toffee and\r\nthe flaked almonds. Bake for 25-30 mins\r\nuntil the muffins are risen, golden and feel\r\nfirm when pressed (the molten toffee will be\r\nextremely hot so be careful not to touch it).\r\nRemove from the tin to a wire rack to cool."]','2026-01-10 12:24:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9310,9310,'en','Carrot & pecan muffins','Based on the flavours of carrot cake, these have a surprise ingredient – cannellini beans! They add a lovely texture and help provide 1 of your 5 a day','["2 x 400g can cannellini beans in water, drained","2 tsp ground cinnamon","100g porridge oats","4 large eggs","2 tbsp rapeseed oil","4 tbsp maple syrup","2 tsp vanilla extract","zest 1 large orange","170g carrot, coarsely grated","100g raisins","80g pecan halves, 12 reserved, the rest roughly chopped","2 tsp baking powder"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper cases. Tip the beans into a bowl and add the cinnamon, oats, eggs, oil, maple syrup, vanilla extract and orange zest. Blitz with a hand blender until really smooth – the beans and oats should be ground down as much as possible.","Stir in the carrot, raisins, chopped pecans and baking powder, and mix well. Spoon into the muffin cases – use a large ice cream scoop if you have one, to get nice even muffins.","Top each muffin with a reserved pecan and bake for 20 mins until set and light brown. Cool on a wire rack. Will keep in the fridge for a few days, or freeze for 6 weeks; thaw at room temperature."]','2026-01-10 12:24:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9311,9311,'en','Basic muffin recipe','Good Food reader Charlotte Hilsdon shares her simple, chocolate chip muffin recipe, to which you can add fruit, chocolate or nuts','["2 medium eggs","125ml vegetable oil","250ml semi-skimmed milk","200g golden caster sugar","400g self-raising flour (or same quantity plain flour and 3 tsp baking powder)","1 tsp salt","100g chocolate chips (see tip) or dried fruit such as sultanas or dried cherries (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line 2 muffin trays with paper muffin cases. In a large bowl beat the eggs lightly with a handheld electric mixer for 1 min. Add the oil and milk and beat until just combined then add the sugar and whisk until you have a smooth batter. Sift in the flour and salt (and baking powder if using) then mix until just smooth. Be careful not to over-mix the batter as this will make the muffins tough. Stir in the chocolate chips or dried fruit if using.","Fill muffin cases two-thirds full and bake for 20-25 mins, until risen, firm to the touch and a skewer inserted in the middle comes out clean. If the trays will not fit on 1 shelf, swap the shelves around after 15 mins of cooking. Leave the muffins in the tin to cool for a few mins and transfer to a wire rack to cool completely."]','2026-01-10 12:24:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9312,9312,'en','Maple-glazed blueberry muffins','Give the classic blueberry muffin a makeover by adding a crisp maple-sugar glaze, which sets to a cracked crust','["250g plain flour","1½  tsp baking powder","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","140g granulated sugar","100g unsalted butter, melted","50g buttermilk","2 large eggs","50g maple syrup, plus 1½  tbsp for the topping","1 tsp vanilla extract","175g blueberries, plus extra for the top","3 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Place the muffin cases in a muffin tray. In a large bowl, combine the flour, baking powder, bicarb, sugar and 1/2 tsp salt. Whisk the butter, buttermilk, eggs, maple syrup and vanilla extract in a jug. Pour the wet ingredients into the dry and add most of the blueberries. Stir briefly to just combine, but don’t overmix or the muffins will be heavy.","Divide the mixture between the muffin cases (use an ice cream scoop if you have one) and bake for 22-25 mins until well risen and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Transfer to a wire rack.","Mix the remaining maple syrup and the icing sugar together with a pinch of salt until smooth. Brush the icing over each muffin while they are still warm. Dot a few blueberries on top of each one. Best eaten within a day or two."]','2026-01-10 12:24:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9313,9313,'en','Blood orange & poppy drizzle muffins','These citrussy muffins are lovely and light, and make a delicious pudding served with ice cream or thick Greek yogurt','["5 tbsp light rapeseed or sunflower oil, plus a little extra for greasing","300g self-raising flour","175g golden caster sugar","1 tsp baking powder","2 tbsp poppy seeds","200ml milk","1 large egg","zest 2 blood orange, juice 2½","140g granulated sugar"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and lightly grease a 12-hole muffin tin. Mix together the flour, caster sugar, baking powder and poppy seeds in a large mixing bowl. In another bowl, whisk together the oil, milk, egg, and zest and juice from 1 of the oranges.","Working very quickly, pour the wet ingredients into the dry and barely mix together with a fork – the mixture should be lumpy, so don’t overwork it. Spoon the mixture into the tins and bake for 10-12 mins until risen and browned.","While the muffins are baking, mix the remaining zest with the granulated sugar in a small bowl. Have the remaining blood orange juice ready too.","Leave the muffins to cool for 2 mins, then transfer to a wire rack. Again working quickly, pour the juices into the sugar mix and spoon some over each muffin, repeating until it\r\nis all used up. Leave to set for 5 mins before eating."]','2026-01-10 12:24:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9316,9316,'en','Flourless lemon & polenta drizzle cake','This gluten-free citrus cake has a grown-up bitter edge. Serve with creamy mascarpone and black coffee','["2 lemons","140g butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","3 eggs","250g golden caster sugar","200g ground almonds","175g polenta or fine cornmeal","1 tsp gluten-free baking powder","mascarpone, to serve","140g golden caster sugar","juice 1 lemon"]','["Grease a 23cm cake tin and heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the lemons in a saucepan and cover with cold water. Bring to the boil, drain, pour over more cold water, then simmer for 1 hr until the lemons are really soft, topping up with more water if you need to. Drain the lemons well. When cool, halve them, remove the pips and blitz in a food processor to a purée.","Add all the other cake ingredients and carry on blitzing until you have a loose batter. Scrape the batter into the cake tin and bake for 40-50 mins until golden and starting to shrink away from the sides. While the cake bakes, make the drizzle by mixing the sugar with the lemon juice. When the cake is ready, remove from the oven and leave to cool a little. While still warm, pour over the drizzle and leave to cool completely. Serve with mascarpone."]','2026-01-10 12:24:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9317,9317,'en','Cherry blossom cake','A gluten-free light bake that uses polenta in place of flour and orange blossom to flavour a drizzle syrup','["300g cherries, stoned and roughly chopped","250g polenta","250g pack butter, softened","250g golden caster sugar","4 large eggs","100g ground almonds","2½  tsp baking powder","150ml pot natural yogurt","1 tsp orange blossom water","juice ½ orange","juice 1 orange","3 tbsp golden caster sugar","½  tsp orange blossom water","50g cherries, stoned, plus extra cherries on stalks to serve","175g icing sugar"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nUse a little of the butter to grease a\r\ndeep 23cm cake tin and line with baking\r\nparchment. Mix the cherries and 50g of\r\nthe polenta, then set aside.","In a large bowl, combine the butter and\r\nsugar with an electric whisk until pale and\r\nfluffy. Add the eggs, one at a time, mixing\r\nwell between each addition. Add the\r\nremaining polenta, the almonds, baking\r\npowder, yogurt, orange blossom water,\r\norange juice and cherry mix, and stir\r\neverything until just combined. Tip into\r\nthe tin, smooth the top and bake for 45 mins\r\nor until a skewer comes out clean.","Meanwhile, make the syrup. Boil the\r\norange juice and sugar for a few mins until\r\nthe sugar has dissolved. Remove from the\r\nheat, add the orange blossom water and\r\nlet cool. When the cake is done, remove\r\nfrom the oven and pour over the syrup.\r\nLeave to cool in the tin for 20 mins, then\r\ntransfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","To make the cherry icing, put the\r\ncherries and icing sugar in a small food\r\nprocessor and blend until smooth.\r\nDrizzle all over the cake, then top with\r\nwhole cherries. Will keep for up to\r\n5 days in a cake tin."]','2026-01-10 12:24:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9318,9318,'en','Orange polenta cake','Give your dessert an Italian flavour with this moist and fruity polenta cake','["250g unsalted butter","250g golden caster sugar","4 large eggs","140g polenta","200g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","zest and juice 2 oranges (less 100ml juice for the glaze)","100ml orange juice","100g golden caster sugar"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Line the base and sides of a round 23cm cake\r\ntin with baking parchment. Cream the\r\nbutter and sugar together until light and\r\nfluffy. Add the eggs one at a time and\r\nmix thoroughly. Once the mixture is\r\ncombined, add all the dry ingredients\r\nand the zest and juice after you have\r\nmeasured off 100ml for the glaze.","Transfer the mixture to the tin, spread\r\nevenly, then cook for about 45 mins or\r\nuntil a skewer inserted into the centre\r\nof the cake comes out clean. Remove\r\nfrom the oven and turn out onto a wire\r\nrack to cool.","To make the glaze, put the juice and\r\nsugar in a medium saucepan and bring\r\nto the boil. Let it simmer for 5 mins, then\r\nremove from the heat and allow to cool.\r\nDrizzle the orange glaze over the top of\r\nthe cooled cake. Serve with Lemon ice cream, below."]','2026-01-10 12:24:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9319,9319,'en','Coconut cream cake','A tempting egg-free cake with a taste of the exotic to it','["juice of 1 lemon","50g desiccated coconut","200ml carton coconut cream","85g fine or medium polenta","2 level tsp baking powder","140g butter at room temperature","140g golden caster sugar","finely grated zest of ½ lemon","140g plain flour","2 tbsp toasted desiccated coconut","140g icing sugar, sieved"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/gas 4/fan\r\noven 160C. Line an 18cm round\r\ncake tin with baking parchment.\r\nCream together the butter and\r\nsugar until soft. Add 150ml/1?4pint\r\nof the coconut cream and the\r\nremaining cake ingredients and\r\nbeat lightly to make a soft and\r\nslightly wet mixture.","Spoon the ingredients into the\r\ntin and bake for 50-55 minutes,\r\nuntil the top of the cake is golden\r\nand a skewer inserted comes\r\nclean. Remove from the oven\r\nallow to cool in the cake tin.","When cold, remove the cake\r\nfrom the tin, peel away the\r\npaper and put the cake on a\r\nplate. Put the icing sugar into a\r\nbowl and add enough of the\r\nreserved coconut cream to\r\nmix to a thick but flowing\r\nconsistency. Spread the icing\r\nover the cake, allowing it to\r\ndribble down the sides, then\r\nsprinkle the toasted coconut\r\naround the top edge."]','2026-01-10 12:24:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9320,9320,'en','Lighter lemon drizzle cake','Angela Nilsen gives one of our site’s most popular cakes the ultimate healthy makeover by reducing fat','["75ml rapeseed oil, plus extra for the tin","175g self-raising flour","1½  tsp baking powder","50g ground almonds","50g polenta","finely grated zest 2 lemons","140g golden caster sugar","2 large eggs","225g natural yogurt","85g caster sugar","juice 2 lemon (about 5 tbsp)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLightly oil a 20cm round x 5cm deep cake\r\ntin and line the base with baking parchment.\r\nFor the cake, put the flour, baking powder,\r\nground almonds and polenta in a large\r\nmixing bowl. Stir in the lemon zest and\r\nsugar, then make a dip in the centre. Beat\r\nthe eggs in a bowl, then stir in the yogurt.\r\nTip this mixture along with the oil into the\r\ndip (see step-by-step number 1), then briefly and gently stir with a\r\nlarge metal spoon so everything is just\r\ncombined, without overmixing.","Spoon the mixture into the tin and level\r\nthe top (step 2). Bake for 40 mins or until a\r\nskewer inserted into the centre of the\r\ncake comes out clean. Cover loosely with\r\nfoil for the final 5-10 mins if it starts to\r\nbrown too quickly.","While the cake cooks, make the lemon\r\nsyrup. Tip the caster sugar into a small\r\nsaucepan with the lemon juice and\r\n75ml water. Heat over a medium heat,\r\nstirring occasionally, until the sugar has\r\ndissolved. Raise the heat, boil for 4 mins\r\nuntil slightly reduced and syrupy, then\r\nremove from the heat.","Remove the cake from the oven and\r\nlet it cool briefly in the tin. While it is still\r\nwarm, turn it out of the tin, peel off the\r\nlining paper and sit the cake on a wire\r\nrack set over a baking tray or similar.\r\nUse a skewer to make lots of small holes\r\nall over the top of the cake (step 3). Slowly\r\nspoon over half the lemon syrup (step 4) and\r\nlet it soak in. Spoon over the rest in the\r\nsame way, brushing the edges and sides\r\nof the cake too with the last of the syrup."]','2026-01-10 12:24:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9321,9321,'en','Raspberry & lemon polenta cake','Give your sponge an Italian twist with Jane Hornby’s easy-to-make polenta cake','["225g very soft butter","225g caster sugar, plus 1 tbsp","4 eggs, beaten","175g fine polenta","50g plain flour","1½ tsp baking powder","½ tsp vanilla extract","finely grated zest of 1½ lemons","200g frozen raspberries, left frozen","icing sugar, or more to taste (optional)","100g soft cheese at room temperature (we used Philadelphia)","1 tbsp icing sugar, or more to taste","finely grated zest of ½ lemon, plus a squeeze of juice","142ml tub double cream","100g frozen raspberries, defrosted"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5 and butter two 20cm sandwich tins. Line the bottom of the tins with baking paper. In\r\na large bowl, beat the butter and 225g caster sugar together until creamy and light. Gradually add the egg, little by little, until all the egg is worked in and the mix is pale and fluffy. If the mix looks like it’s starting to split, add 1 tsp of the flour, then carry on.","Put the polenta in another bowl, then stir in the flour and baking powder. Beat the vanilla extract and zest into the eggy mix, then fold in the dry ingredients. Spoon half the batter into each tin and level the top. Scatter all but a handful of the raspberries over the mix and poke in gently. Sprinkle one of the sponges with the 1 tbsp sugar. Bake for 20 mins until risen and golden, but still with a little wobble under the crust.","Open the oven, whip out the sugar-crusted sponge and quickly poke the remaining frozen raspberries into the top. Bake both sponges for 10 more mins or until springy in the middle. If this sounds too tricky, just leave the sponges to bake for 30 mins – the cake won’t look as glam, but will still taste great (you can add the leftover berries to the filling instead).\r\nCool in the tin for 10 mins, then cool completely on a rack. Be careful when turning out the raspberry-topped sponge and slide it off its base rather than turning it upside down.","When the sponges are cold, beat the soft cheese with the icing sugar, lemon zest and a little of the juice to loosen if it needs it. Very lightly whip the cream so that it just holds its shape, then fold into the cheese. Fold in the defrosted raspberries. Use to sandwich the sponges together, sugar-crusted on top, and serve dusted with more icing sugar."]','2026-01-10 12:24:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9322,9322,'en','Swirly lemon drizzle fingers','Polenta (sometimes called fine cornmeal)gives this cake its yellow colour and softtexture','["200g butter, well softened, plus extra","200g golden caster sugar","4 large eggs","100g fine polenta or fine cornmeal","140g self-raising flour","zest 3 lemons","4 tbsp lemon curd","5 tbsp golden or white caster sugar","zest and juice 1 lemon"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4 and\r\nmake sure there’s a shelf ready in the middle\r\nof the oven. Butter a rectangular baking tray\r\nor small roasting tin, about 20cm x 30cm.\r\nCut out a sheet of baking paper a bit larger\r\nthan the tin, then push it in and smooth it\r\nout with your hands so it sticks to the butter.\r\nSnip into the corners with a pair of scissors\r\nto get the paper to lie neatly.","Put all the cake ingredients and a pinch of\r\nsalt into a large bowl, then use electric beaters\r\nto beat until creamy and smooth. Scoop into\r\nthe tin, then level the top. Spoon the lemon\r\ncurd over the batter in thick stripes. Use\r\nthe handle of the spoon to swirl the curd\r\ninto the cake – not too much or you won’t\r\nsee the swirls once it’s cooked. Bake for\r\nabout 35 mins or until golden and risen. It\r\nshould have shrunk away from the sides of\r\nthe tin ever so slightly and feel springy. Don’t\r\nopen the oven before 30 mins cooking is up.","Leave the cake in the tin for 10 mins or\r\nuntil just cool enough to handle. Carefully lift\r\nout of the tin and put it onto a cooling rack,\r\nsat over a tray or something similar to catch\r\ndrips of drizzle. To make the drizzle, mix\r\n4 tbsp sugar and the lemon juice together\r\nand spoon over the cake. Toss the lemon\r\nzest with the final 1 tbsp sugar and scatter\r\nover the top. Let the cake cool completely,\r\nthen lift onto a board, peel away the sides\r\nof the baking paper and cut the cake into\r\nfingers. Will keep in an airtight tin for 3 days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9323,9323,'en','Classic Arctic roll','Follow our step-by-step guide to this retro frozen dessert of vanilla ice cream wrapped in a light sponge cake, with homemade strawberry jam','["2 eggs, separated","50g icing sugar","1 vanilla pod, seeds only","150ml double cream","200g strawberries, quartered, plus a few extra for decoration","juice ½  lemon","200g golden caster sugar","knob of butter, for greasing","3 eggs","100g golden caster sugar, plus extra for dusting","100g plain flour","½  tsp baking powder","¼ tsp vanilla extract"]','["To make the ice cream, whisk the egg whites in a bowl with an electric whisk until stiff. In another bowl, whisk the yolks, icing sugar and vanilla seeds until pale and billowy. In a third bowl, whip the double cream until holding its shape.","Fold the yolk mixture into the cream, then fold in the egg whites. Pour into a 900g loaf tin lined with a sheet of baking parchment bigger than you’ll need – this will help you later. Freeze for 2 hrs.","Remove the ice cream from the freezer and tin when it feels set but soft. Use a spatula to shape the mixture into a rough sausage shape, then use the parchment to roll the mixture tightly together into a cylinder about 35cm in length.","Twist the ends of the baking parchment like a cracker and return to the freezer for a further 1 hr.","To make the jam, first put a saucer in the freezer. Put the strawberries, lemon juice and sugar in a heavy- based saucepan over a high heat. Bring to the boil, stirring occasionally. Boil rapidly for 5 mins, then take off the heat.","Put 1/4 tsp of the jam onto the cold saucer – if it wrinkles when pushed with your finger, the jam is ready. If it’s still runny, return it to the heat and boil again for another 2-3 mins, then test again. Once the jam is set, leave it to cool.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Line a 24 x 32cm Swiss roll tin with baking parchment (with plenty of excess) and grease well. Whisk the eggs and sugar together with an electric hand whisk for 2-3 mins or until thickened and pale.","Fold the flour, baking powder and vanilla extract into the egg mixture with a large metal spoon until there are no pockets of flour visible.","Gently tip the mixture into your prepared Swiss roll tin and bake in the oven for 15 mins or until lightly golden and springy to the touch.","Remove from the oven, allow to cool for 1-2 mins or until cool enough to handle, then carefully roll up the sponge while it’s still warm (keeping the baking parchment attached). Leave to cool completely in its rolled-up shape.","Uncurl the sponge and spread the jam on the inside. Working quickly, unwrap the ice cream and put it on top of the jam. Roll the cake up around it.","Wrap the Arctic roll in a new sheet of baking parchment and a layer of foil too. Return to the\r\nfreezer for a further 20-30mins, then unwrap, slice and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:24:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9324,9324,'en','Glamorous fairy cakes','A retro twist to a childhood favourite – learn how to make fairy cakes then decorate for any occasion','["140g butter, very well softened","140g golden caster sugar","3 medium eggs","100g self-raising flour","25g custard powder or cornflour","600g icing sugar, sifted","6 tbsp water, or half water and half lemon juice, strained","edible green and pink food colourings","crystallised violets","crystallised roses or rose petals","edible wafer flowers"]','["Heat the oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Arrange paper cases in bun tins. Put all the cake ingredients in a large bowl and beat for about 2 mins until smooth. Divide the mixture between the cases so they are half filled and bake for 12-15 mins, until risen and golden. Cool on a wire rack.","Mix the icing sugar and water until smooth and use a third on eight of the cakes. Divide the rest in half, and colour one half pale green and the other half pale pink. Decorate the white ones with crystallised violets, the pink ones with the roses and the green ones with the wafer flowers. Leave to set. Will keep for up to 2-3 days stored in an airtight container in a cool place."]','2026-01-10 12:24:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9325,9325,'en','Fruity simnel squares','This easy twist on the classic fruit sponge makes plenty of squares – all decorated with marzipan eggs','["250g mixed dried fruits","100g dried apricots, chopped","85g glacé cherries, chopped","zest 2 oranges, juice 1 orange (use the second in the topping)","200g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","200g light muscovado sugar","4 large eggs","200g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","2 tsp mixed spice","1 tsp ground cinnamon","½  tsp freshly grated nutmeg","500g marzipan, 200g/7oz cut into 2cm chunks, the rest for the topping","50g butter","50g light muscovado sugar","100g plain flour","100g flaked almonds","3 tbsp golden syrup","85g icing sugar, sieved","2-3 tsp orange juice"]','["Soak all the dried fruit in the orange\r\njuice for 2 hrs, or overnight.","Butter and line a 20 x 30cm tin with\r\nbaking parchment. Heat oven to 160C/\r\n140C fan/gas 3. In a large bowl, beat the\r\nbutter and sugar with an electric whisk\r\nuntil pale and fluffy. Add the eggs one at\r\na time; mix well between each addition.","Sift the flour into the bowl and mix\r\nin the ground almonds and spices.\r\nAdd the marzipan chunks, zest and dried\r\nfruit with any remaining juice, and give\r\neverything a good stir to combine.","Tip the cake mix into the prepared tin,\r\nlevel the surface, and bake for 45 mins\r\n– the cake may still be a little gooey in\r\nthe centre at this point. Remove from\r\nthe oven and increase the heat to 200C/\r\n180C fan/gas 6.","Make the topping. Rub the butter, sugar\r\nand flour together with your fingers to a\r\ncrumbly breadcrumb texture. Grate in\r\n200g reserved marzipan, add the flaked\r\nalmonds and golden syrup. Mix\r\neverything with a fork, making sure it\r\nstays crumbly and doesn’t clump. Sprinkle\r\nover the cake and return to the oven for\r\n12-15 mins. Meanwhile, divide the rest of\r\nthe marzipan into 11 and roll into balls.","Remove the cake from the oven once\r\ncooked through, arrange the marzipan\r\nballs on top and allow to cool in the tin.\r\nMix the icing sugar with enough orange\r\njuice to give a runny icing, drizzle it all\r\nover the cake, then let it set a little before\r\nslicing it."]','2026-01-10 12:24:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9326,9326,'en','Clotted cream & raspberry ripple Arctic roll','A stunning version of the retro classic, complete with seasonal berries, home-churned ice cream and light sponge','["2 large eggs","140g golden caster sugar","227g tub clotted cream","350ml whole milk","seeds from 1 vanilla pod","100g punnet raspberries","300g jar raspberry jam","4 large eggs","125g golden caster sugar, plus extra for sprinkling","125g self-raising flour"]','["Chill the bowl of your ice-cream maker,\r\nif using one. In a large bowl, whisk the\r\neggs (note that this recipe contains\r\nraw eggs) and sugar until pale and fluffy.\r\nAdd the clotted cream, milk and vanilla\r\nseeds, and whisk again until smooth.\r\nPour into your ice-cream maker and\r\nchurn until frozen. Alternatively, you can\r\ntip the mixture into a tub and freeze for\r\n2 hrs, then transfer to a food processor\r\nand blitz to remove any ice crystals.","Line a 900g loaf tin (about 20cm long)\r\nwith cling film. At this stage – while your\r\nice cream is quite pliable – squash the\r\nraspberries with 2 tbsp of the jam\r\n(leaving a few chunky pieces), then\r\nripple through the ice cream. Transfer\r\nto your loaf tin and freeze again until\r\nsolid – about 6 hrs, or overnight.","Now make the sponge. Heat oven to\r\n190C/170C fan/gas 5. Grease and line\r\na 25 x 35cm Swiss roll tin with baking\r\nparchment. Put the eggs and sugar in a\r\nlarge bowl and whisk until pale and fluffy\r\n– this will take about 5 mins. Sift over the\r\nflour and fold together until there are no\r\nvisible lumps of flour. Carefully pour into\r\nthe tin and smooth over the top. Bake\r\nfor 10-12 mins until springy to the touch.","While the sponge is cooking, lay a sheet\r\nof baking parchment, bigger than your tin,\r\non your surface and sprinkle with caster\r\nsugar. When the sponge is cooked, flip it\r\nonto the sugary parchment, loosely roll it\r\nup from one of the shorter ends and twist\r\nthe parchment to secure. Leave to cool.","Remove the ice cream from the freezer\r\nand leave to soften for 10 mins. Transfer\r\nthe ice cream to a large sheet of baking\r\nparchment, roll the parchment around the ice cream like a cracker, then roll and\r\nsqueeze the ice cream with your hands to\r\nshape it into a cylinder, about 25cm long.","Unwrap and unroll the sponge, then\r\nspread the inside surface with the\r\nremaining jam. Place the unwrapped ice\r\ncream in the centre and wrap the sponge\r\naround it to form your Arctic roll. Roll the\r\nwhole thing back up in the baking\r\nparchment, twist the ends tightly to\r\nsecure, then re-freeze for a further 2 hrs.\r\nBefore serving, unwrap the Arctic roll and\r\nslice off either end with a serrated knife\r\nto make it look neat. (Your chance to get\r\na sneaky taste!)Can be stored in the\r\nfreezer for up to 1 week."]','2026-01-10 12:24:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9327,9327,'en','Date & ginger malt loaf','A dark, sticky and lightly spiced cake that merges Jamaican ginger cake with sticky toffee pudding and malt loaf','["200g butter, cut into cubes, plus extra for greasing","140g stoned dates, chopped","410ml can evaporated milk","100g soft dark brown sugar","225g plain flour","3 tbsp malted milk powder (we used Horlicks)","2 tsp ground ginger","50g stem ginger, roughly chopped (reserve the syrup)","2 tsp bicarbonate of soda","2 large eggs","50g stem ginger, chopped","5 tbsp ginger syrup (from the stem ginger jar)","5 tbsp icing sugar"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line a 900g/2lb loaf tin\r\nwith baking parchment. Put the dates,\r\nevaporated milk and sugar in a small\r\nsaucepan, bring to the boil and cook for\r\n5 mins until the dates are soft and the\r\nsugar has dissolved. Leave to cool.","Put the flour, malted milk powder,\r\nground ginger, stem ginger, bicarb\r\nand butter into a food processor,\r\nand blitz until the mixture resembles\r\nbreadcrumbs. Pour in the cooled date\r\nmixture and the eggs, and pulse briefly\r\nuntil the mixture is combined. Tip into\r\nyour prepared tin and bake for 1 hr 15 mins\r\nuntil a skewer inserted comes out clean.\r\nLeave to cool for 10 mins in the tin, then\r\ntransfer to a wire rack. Combine all the\r\ningredients for the drizzle and spoon over\r\nthe cake. Leave to set before serving.This cake is delicious if eaten on the day\r\nit is made, but will improve after a day\r\nor 2 in the cake tin."]','2026-01-10 12:24:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9328,9328,'en','Lemon & lavender fondant fancies','Elegant sponge squares that are petite and pretty as a picture – impress with light flavours and silky butter icing','["175g butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","250g caster sugar","3 large eggs","100g full-fat natural yogurt","275g plain flour","1½  tsp baking powder","1 tsp dried lavender, plus a little to decorate","100g butter","100g icing sugar","zest 1 lemon, plus a little to decorate","8 tbsp apricot jam, sieved and heated in the microwave until runny","1kg pack fondant icing sugar","yellow and purple food colouring"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line a 20cm square tin with\r\nbaking parchment. Put the butter, sugar,\r\neggs, yogurt, flour and baking powder in\r\na large bowl and beat with an electric\r\nwhisk until smooth. Tip into your cake tin\r\nand smooth the top. Bake for 45-50 mins\r\nuntil risen and golden, and a skewer\r\ninserted comes out clean. Leave to cool\r\nfor 10 mins in the tin, then turn out onto\r\na wire rack to cool completely.","Grind the lavender to a powder using\r\na pestle and mortar. To make the butter\r\nicing, beat the butter and icing sugar\r\ntogether until pale and fluffy. Divide the\r\nmixture into 2 bowls, add the lemon\r\nzest to one batch and the lavender to\r\nthe other, then mix each to combine.\r\nTransfer the icings to 2 piping bags.","When the sponge has completely\r\ncooled, use a large serrated knife to\r\nremove the top and give you a flat\r\nsurface. Flip the cake over so the\r\nflattest side becomes the top. Carefully trim off the edges, then cut the sponge\r\ninto 16 squares. Use a ruler if you want\r\nthem to be the same size. Brush the top\r\nand sides of each sponge square with a\r\nlittle jam. Pipe a small dome of butter\r\nicing onto each sponge, 8 with lavender\r\nicing and 8 with lemon. Chill the cakes\r\nfor at least 1 hr.","Sieve the fondant icing sugar into a large\r\nbowl, and add enough water to make a\r\nthick but pourable icing. Spoon a little\r\nwhite icing into a sandwich bag or piping\r\nbag to use later. Divide the remaining\r\nicing into 2 bowls, dye one batch lemon\r\nyellow and the other pale lilac.","Remove the sponges from the fridge\r\nand transfer to a wire rack, sitting the\r\nrack on a tray to catch any drips. Spoon\r\na little icing over each sponge, lilac for\r\nthe lavender-flavoured fancies and\r\nyellow for the lemon. Use a small palette\r\nknife to spread the icing down the sides\r\nof the sponge to completely cover each\r\none. Leave to set for 30 mins, then cover\r\nthe cakes with a second layer of icing\r\nto give a smooth surface. Drizzle the\r\nwhite icing over the cakes and decorate\r\nwith a little lemon zest and lavender\r\nbuds. Leave to set for 1 hr at room\r\ntemperature before serving. Will last\r\n2-3 days in a tin."]','2026-01-10 12:24:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9329,9329,'en','Battenberg cake','Sarah Cook’s traditional Battenberg cake is a delicious project for an afternoon in the kitchen','["175g very soft butter","175g golden caster sugar","140g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds","½  tsp baking powder","3 medium eggs","½  tsp vanilla extract","¼ tsp almond extract","1 x ingredients for almond sponge","pink food colouring, we used ½ tsp Squires rose food paste","200g apricot jam","2 x 500g blocks white marzipan","little icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and\r\nline the base and sides of a 20cm square\r\ntin with baking parchment (the easiest\r\nway is to cross 2 x 20cm-long strips over\r\nthe base). To make the almond sponge,\r\nput the butter, sugar, flour, ground\r\nalmonds, baking powder, eggs, vanilla\r\nand almond extract in a large bowl. Beat\r\nwith an electric whisk until the mix\r\ncomes together smoothly. Scrape into\r\nthe tin, spreading to the corners, and\r\nbake for 25-30 mins – when you poke in\r\na skewer, it should come out clean.\r\nCool in the tin for 10 mins, then transfer\r\nto a wire rack to finish cooling while you\r\nmake the second sponge.","For the pink sponge, line the tin as\r\nabove. Mix all the ingredients together\r\nas above, but don’t add the almond\r\nextract. Fold in some pink food colouring.\r\nThen scrape it all into the tin and bake\r\nas before. Cool.","To assemble, heat the jam in a small\r\npan until runny, then sieve. Barely trim\r\ntwo opposite edges from the almond\r\nsponge, then well trim a third edge.\r\nRoughly measure the height of the\r\nsponge, then cutting from the\r\nwell-trimmed edge, use a ruler to help\r\nyou cut 4 slices each the same width as\r\nthe sponge height. Discard or nibble\r\nleftover sponge. Repeat with pink cake.","Take 2 x almond slices and 2 x pink\r\nslices and trim so they are all the same\r\nlength. Roll out one marzipan block on\r\na surface lightly dusted with icing sugar\r\nto just over 20cm wide, then keep\r\nrolling lengthways until the marzipan\r\nis roughly 0.5cm thick. Brush with\r\napricot jam, then lay a pink and an\r\nalmond slice side by side at one end of\r\nthe marzipan, brushing jam in between\r\nto stick sponges, and leaving 4cm clear\r\nmarzipan at the end. Brush more jam\r\non top of the sponges, then\r\nsandwich remaining 2 slices on top,\r\nalternating colours to give a checkerboard\r\neffect. Trim the marzipan to the\r\nlength of the cakes.","Carefully lift up the marzipan and\r\nsmooth over the cake with your hands,\r\nbut leave a small marzipan fold along the\r\nbottom edge before you stick it to the\r\nfirst side. Trim opposite side to match\r\nsize of fold, then crimp edges using\r\nfingers and thumb (or, more simply,\r\npress with prongs of fork). If you like,\r\nmark the 10 slices using the prongs of\r\na fork.","Assemble second Battenberg and\r\nkeep in an airtight box or well wrapped\r\nin cling film for up to 3 days. Can be\r\nfrozen for up to a month."]','2026-01-10 12:24:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9330,9330,'en','Eccles cake','A new take on the traditional pastry, this cake will go down well on any occasion','["250g pack butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","250g soft light brown sugar","2 tsp vanilla extract","4 large eggs","100g plain flour","250g self-raising flour","100g buttermilk","2 eating apples, peeled, cored and diced to about 1cm pieces","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tsp mixed spice","¼ tsp ground cloves","zest 1 lemon","2 tbsp melted butter","2 tbsp soft light brown sugar","85g currants","85g raisins","50g mixed peel","85g icing sugar, sifted","zest and juice 1 lemon","a few sugar cubes, roughly crushed"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line a deep 20cm cake tin\r\nwith baking parchment. Mix together\r\nthe filling ingredients and set aside.","Put butter, sugar and vanilla in a bowl\r\nand whisk until pale. Beat in the eggs, then\r\nfold in the flours, buttermilk and apples.\r\nSpoon half the mixture into the tin. Scatter\r\nover filling, leaving a 2.5cm clear border\r\nall around the edge. Spoon remaining\r\nmixture on top, starting by dolloping round\r\nthe edges, then moving into the middle.\r\nBake for 1 hr 25 mins or until a skewer\r\npoked in comes out clean. Cool in the tin.","Mix the icing sugar with enough lemon\r\njuice to make a runny-ish icing. Remove\r\ncake from the tin, drizzle over the icing,\r\nthen scatter with crushed sugar cubes\r\nand lemon zest."]','2026-01-10 12:24:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9331,9331,'en','Pineapple upside-down cake','Retro rocks. This classic pineapple upside-down cake makes a fun centre piece for afternoon tea and brings back many childhood memories.','["50g softened butter","50g light soft brown sugar","7 pineapples rings in syrup, drained and syrup","glacé cherry","100g softened butter","100g golden caster sugar","100g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","1 tsp vanilla extract","2 eggs"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. For the\r\ntopping, beat the butter and sugar together\r\nuntil creamy. Spread over the base and a\r\nquarter of the way up the sides of a 20-21cm\r\nround cake tin. Arrange pineapple rings on top,\r\nthen place cherries in the centres of the rings.","Place the cake ingredients in a bowl along\r\nwith 2 tbsp of the pineapple syrup and, using\r\nan electric whisk, beat to a soft consistency.\r\nSpoon into the tin on top of the pineapple and\r\nsmooth it out so it’s level. Bake for 35 mins.\r\nLeave to stand for 5 mins, then turn out onto\r\na plate. Serve warm with a scoop of ice cream."]','2026-01-10 12:24:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9332,9332,'en','Queen of pudding cakes','Super quick to prepare, these little meringue-topped cakes were made for sharing','["200g soft butter, plus extra for greasing","200g golden caster sugar","3 eggs","140g self-raising flour","50g custard powder","5-6 tbsp raspberry jam","16 mini meringues","icing sugar, to dust"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line a 20cm square baking tin.\r\nWhisk together the butter, sugar, eggs,\r\nflour and custard powder until well\r\ncombined and fluffy. Spread into the tin\r\nand bake for 25-30 mins until golden and\r\nrisen. Cool in the tin.","Remove cooled cake from tin and\r\nspread with the jam. Trim the edges,\r\nthen cut into 16 squares. Add a meringue\r\nto each just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:24:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9333,9333,'en','Blueberry & coconut pudding','The combination of blueberries and coconut makes this indulgent dessert incredibly moreish','["50g caster sugar","50g soft butter","1 large egg","50g self-raising flour","50g desiccated coconut, plus 2 tsp","50g crème fraîche, plus extra to serve","zest and juice 1 lemon","180g punnet of blueberries"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Beat the sugar and butter until pale and creamy, then beat in the egg. Stir in the flour, coconut, crème fraîche and lemon zest.","Put most of the blueberries in a baking dish (about 18cm square-ish) and squeeze over the juice from half the lemon. Dollop on the cake mixture and scatter over the remaining blueberries and 2 tsp coconut. Bake for 35-40 mins until golden, risen and the sponge is cooked. Serve with a dollop more crème fraîche."]','2026-01-10 12:24:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9334,9334,'en','Easy iced buns','Kids will love these old fashioned iced buns, get them to help you decorate them too!','["500g white bread mix (we used Wright''s)","100g caster sugar","1 egg","350g icing sugar","sprinkles (plus food colouring, if you like)"]','["Pulse together the bread mix and sugar\r\nin a food processor or table-top mixer.\r\nWhile the motor is running, add the egg\r\nand about 250-300ml lukewarm water,\r\nuntil a soft dough is formed. Knead on\r\na lightly floured surface until smooth, about 5-10 mins. Leave in an oiled bowl,\r\ncovered with oiled cling film, in a warm\r\nplace until doubled in size – about 1 hr.","Knock back dough by squashing with\r\nyour fist, and divide into 20 even-sized\r\npieces – keep covered with a clean tea\r\ntowel so they don’t dry out. Shape each\r\ninto a sausage and place on an oiled\r\nbaking tray. Cover with oiled cling film\r\nand rise until doubled in size again.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.\r\nRemove film and cook buns on top shelf\r\nfor 8-10 mins, until golden. Cool on a wire\r\nrack. To decorate, mix icing sugar with a\r\nlittle water until stiff but spreadable – add\r\nfood colouring, if you like. Dip in the top of\r\neach bun and scatter with sprinkles."]','2026-01-10 12:24:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9335,9335,'en','Welsh cakes','Pice ar y maen, a Welsh teatime treat passed on through generations and still as popular as ever. Perfect for making with the children','["225g plain flour","85g caster sugar","½  tsp mixed spice","½  tsp baking powder","50g butter, cut into small pieces","50g lard, cut into small pieces, plus extra for frying","50g currants","1 egg, beaten","splash milk"]','["Tip the flour, sugar, mixed spice, baking powder and a pinch of salt into a bowl. Then, with your fingers, rub in the butter and lard until crumbly. Mix in the currants. Work the egg into the mixture until you have soft dough, adding a splash of milk if it seems a little dry – it should be the same consistency as shortcrust pastry.","Roll out the dough on a lightly floured work surface to the thickness of your little finger. Cut out rounds using a 6cm cutter, re-rolling any trimmings. Grease a flat griddle pan or heavy frying pan with lard, and place over a medium heat. Cook the Welsh cakes in batches, for about 3 mins each side, until golden brown, crisp and cooked through. Delicious served warm with butter and jam, or simply sprinkled with caster sugar. Cakes will stay fresh in a tin for 1 week."]','2026-01-10 12:24:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9336,9336,'en','Jam roly-poly','This jam roly-poly is simple to make, comforting and sure to bring back memories of traditional school dinners','["50g salted butter, cold and cut into chunks, plus extra for greasing","250g self-raising flour, plus extra for rolling","1 vanilla pod, seeds scraped out","50g shredded suet","150ml milk, plus a drop more if needed","100g/4oz raspberry or plum jam, or a mixture","custard, to serve"]','["Put a deep roasting tin onto the bottom\r\nshelf of the oven, and make sure that\r\nthere’s another shelf directly above it.\r\nPull the roasting tin out on its shelf, fill\r\ntwo-thirds with boiling water from the\r\nkettle, then carefully slide it back in. Heat\r\noven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Tear off a\r\nlarge sheet of foil and greaseproof paper\r\n(about 30 x 40cm). Sit the greaseproof on\r\ntop of the foil and butter it.","Tip butter, flour and vanilla seeds into a\r\nfood processor; pulse until the butter has\r\ndisappeared. Tip into a mixing bowl. Stir\r\nthrough the suet, pour in the milk and\r\nwork together with a cutlery knife until\r\nyou get a sticky dough. You may need a\r\ndrop more milk, depending on your flour.","Tip the dough out onto a floured\r\nsurface, quickly pat together to smooth,\r\nthen roll out to a square roughly 25 x\r\n25cm. Spread the jam all over, leaving a\r\ngap along one edge, then roll up from the\r\nopposite edge. Pinch the jam-free edge\r\ninto the dough where it meets, and pinch\r\nthe ends roughly, too. Carefully lift onto the\r\ngreased paper, join-side down (you might\r\nfind a flat baking sheet helpful for this),\r\nloosely bring up the paper and foil around\r\nit, then scrunch together along the edges\r\nand ends to seal. The roly-poly will puff\r\nquite a bit during cooking so don’t wrap\r\nit tightly. Lift the parcel directly onto the\r\nrack above the tin and cook for 1 hr.","Let the pudding sit for 5 mins before\r\nunwrapping, then carefully open the foil\r\nand paper, and thickly slice to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:24:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9337,9337,'en','Chocolate orange marble cake','For a deliciously nostalgic cake, combine a classic flavour combination of orange and chocolate in this retro two-tone bake','["225g very soft butter, plus extra for greasing","225g caster sugar","225g self-raising flour","4 large eggs, beaten","2 tbsp milk","3 tbsp cocoa powder, sifted","1 large orange, zest and 1 tbsp orange juice","a few drops orange food colouring (optional)","50g orange chocolate (we used Green & Black''s Maya Gold), broken into pieces"]','["Heat oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4. Grease and line the base of a loaf tin (8 x 21cm/ 2lb) with baking parchment. Beat the butter, sugar, eggs and flour together in a large bowl with an electric whisk or in a food processor until lump free.","Split the mixture into two bowls, beat the milk, followed by the cocoa powder into one. Beat the orange juice, zest and orange food colouring, if using, into the other.","Spoon alternate dollops of the mixture into the cake tin, then use a skewer to create a marble pattern by dragging it through the mixture in swirls. Make sure you don’t overmix or you won’t see the pattern. Smooth the surface if necessary.","Bake the cake for 45 - 55 mins until golden and risen, and a skewer poked in comes out clean.","Leave the cake in the tin to cool, then turn out. Melt the chocolate in a bowl over barely simmering water or gently in the microwave. Use a spoon to drizzle the chocolate over the cake."]','2026-01-10 12:24:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9338,9338,'en','Madeira loaf cake','A classic English sponge cake, delicately flavoured with lemon and almond – perfect for afternoon tea','["175g butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","175g golden caster sugar","3 large eggs","grated zest 1 lemon","few drops vanilla extract","200g self-raising flour","50g ground almonds"]','["1 Heat oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3.  Butter and line the base of a 900g loaf tin with greaseproof paper. Using an electric whisk, beat together the butter and sugar until light and creamy then beat in the eggs one at a time. Add the lemon zest and vanilla. Now beat in the flour and almonds until you have a thick batter. The batter should be loose enough that it falls off a wooden spoon, if it’s too thick mix in a splash of milk.","Tip the batter into the tin and smooth over the top. Bake for 55 mins – 1hr until a skewer inserted in the middle comes out clean. Remove from the oven then leave to cool for 15 mins then remove from the tin, peel away the paper and leave on a wire rack to cool completely before slicing. The loaf will keep in an airtight container for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9339,9339,'en','Eton mess scones','Take the classic strawberry, clotted cream and meringue combo and serve it on easy-to-make scones- irresistible','["400g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","¼ tsp salt","1 tsp baking powder","100g butter, cut into cubes","3 tbsp caster sugar, plus extra for sprinkling","200ml buttermilk","1 tsp vanilla extract","5 tbsp milk, plus extra for brushing","good handful small strawberries, halved","small jar good strawberry jam","2 meringue nests, crumbled into chunks","200ml tub clotted cream"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7.\r\nMix the flour, salt and baking powder\r\ntogether in a large bowl. Rub in the butter\r\nor whizz the lot in a food processor to\r\nfine crumbs, then stir in the sugar.","Warm the buttermilk, vanilla and milk\r\nto hand temperature, then quickly stir it\r\ninto the flour mixture with a knife. Using\r\nyour hands, bring the dough together,\r\nbeing careful not to overwork the mix.","Turn dough out onto a lightly floured\r\nwork surface and pat out to a 2.5cm thick\r\nround. Stamp out 12 x 5cm rounds,\r\ndusting the cutter with flour as you\r\nstamp – you’ll need to re-pat trimmings\r\nto make 12. Put the rounds onto floured\r\nbaking sheets, brush the tops with milk\r\nand sprinkle with a little more sugar.\r\nBake for 12-15 mins until golden.","To serve, lightly mash the\r\nstrawberries with the jam, and fold\r\nthe meringues into the clotted cream.\r\nDollop some strawberry mixture onto\r\neach split scone, and top with a dollop\r\nof meringue cream."]','2026-01-10 12:24:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9340,9340,'en','Parkin','Parkin is a traditional sponge cake from Northern England flavoured with syrupy molasses, oatmeal and ginger. A lovely teatime treat!','["200g butter, plus extra for greasing","1 large egg","4 tbsp milk","200g golden syrup","85g treacle","85g light soft brown sugar","100g medium oatmeal","250g self-raising flour","1 tbsp ground ginger"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Grease a deep 22cm/9in square cake tin and line with baking parchment. Beat the egg and milk together with a fork.","Gently melt the syrup, treacle, sugar and butter together in a large pan until the sugar has dissolved. Remove from the heat. Mix together the oatmeal, flour and ginger and stir into the syrup mixture, followed by the egg and milk.","Pour the mixture into the tin and bake for 50 mins - 1 hr until the cake feels firm and a little crusty on top. Cool in the tin then wrap in more parchment and foil and keep for 3-5 days before eating if you can – it’ll become softer and stickier the longer you leave it, up to 2 weeks."]','2026-01-10 12:24:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9341,9341,'en','Pimm’s drizzle cake','Use the flavours of a summery Pimm’s cup in this simple bake. A cocktail in cake form, top with strawberries and mint leaves for a stunning summer dessert','["225g butter , softened, plus extra for the tin","225g strawberries , quartered","100ml Pimm''s","1 orange , zested and juiced","275g golden caster sugar","4 eggs","225g self-raising flour","125g icing sugar","handful of mint leaves"]','["Butter a 2-litre loaf tin and line with baking parchment. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Put the strawberries in a bowl and stir in half the Pimm’s, half the orange juice and 25g of the caster sugar. Set aside to macerate while you make the cake.","Beat the butter, 225g of the remaining caster sugar and the orange zest together using an electric whisk until the mixture is thick, creamy and lighter in colour. Beat in the eggs, one at a time, adding a spoonful of the flour between each to prevent curdling. Fold in the remaining flour, tip into the tin and bake for 45 mins-1 hr, or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean.","Meanwhile, pour the remaining orange juice, Pimm’s and caster sugar into a small pan. Bring to a simmer and cook for 5-10 mins until you have a light syrup. Remove from the heat and set aside.","Leave the cake to cool in the tin for 15 mins. While the cake cools, strain the strawberries through a sieve set over a bowl. Prick the top of the cake all over using a skewer, then pour over the Pimm’s syrup. Once the cake has cooled completely, combine the icing sugar with enough of the reserved macerating liquid to create a runny icing (you’ll need about 1 tbsp of the liquid). Drizzle this over the cake, then top with the strained strawberries and mint leaves."]','2026-01-10 12:24:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9342,9342,'en','Lemon, raspberry & almond victoria sandwich','Make a centrepiece cake for a summer get-together. This take on a victoria sandwich comes with a twist in the form of an almond and raspberry sponge','["225g salted butter , softened, plus extra for the tin","toasted almonds","225g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla or almond extract","2 lemons , zested","2 tbsp milk","4 medium eggs , at room temperature (use ‘golden yolk’ eggs for a rich yellow sponge)","125g self-raising flour","100g ground almonds","½ tsp baking powder","250 raspberries","250ml double cream","100g mascarpone","2-3 tbsp icing sugar , plus extra for dusting","1 tsp vanilla or almond extract"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter two 20cm cake tins and line with baking parchment. Scatter half the toasted almonds over the base of one of the tins, ensuring they’re evenly spread out.","Tip the butter and caster sugar into a large bowl with the vanilla or almond extract and lemon zest, and beat using an electric whisk until light, smooth and creamy, about 3-4 mins. Add the milk, then the eggs, one at a time, beating well between each addition. Fold in the flour, ground almonds, baking powder and a pinch of salt until no streaks of flour remain.","Divide the mixture between the prepared tins, being careful not to disturb the toasted almonds too much as you spread it out. Level the tops, then push half the raspberries into the mixture. Bake in the centre of the oven for 25-30 mins until golden and risen, and a skewer inserted into the centres comes out clean. If any wet mixture clings to the skewer, return to the oven for another 5 mins, then test again. Leave to cool in the tins for 30 mins, then remove to a wire rack, remove the baking parchment and leave to cool completely – the sponges will be quite delicate. Once cooled, the sponges will keep wrapped and frozen for up to three months.","For the filling, pour the cream, mascarpone, icing sugar and vanilla or almond extract into a large bowl. Whisk for a few minutes until the cream is just holding its shape.","Put the plain sponge on a cake stand or plate. Spoon over the cream filling, spreading it to the edge. Scatter over the rest of the berries and toasted almonds. Sandwich with the second sponge, almond-side up, then dust with icing sugar. Will keep chilled in an airtight container for up to two days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9343,9343,'en','Peach tarte tatin','This pudding makes it look like you’ve spent a summer in France learning the arts of the pâtissier, but it’s simply shop-bought puff pastry and peaches','["320g sheet shop-bought puff pastry","30g unsalted butter","2 tbsp caster sugar","2 peaches, stoned and sliced into 16 wedges each","vanilla ice cream, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 4. Use an 18cm ovenproof frying pan as a template to cut out a circle of puff pastry. Melt the butter in the pan over a low heat, stir in the sugar for a few minutes until it has dissolved, then add the peaches. Cook over a medium-high heat for 5 mins until bubbling and the sauce has thickened.","Remove the pan from the heat, then lay the puff pastry circle on top. Carefully tuck the edges in using a tablespoon. Bake for 25 mins, or until the pastry is golden brown. Leave to stand for 2 mins before turning out onto a plate. Serve with ice cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:24:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9344,9344,'en','Marmalade cake','Use up any marmalade you have to make this sunny bake, perhaps with some ice cream alongside it','["200g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","2 unwaxed oranges","325-350g golden caster sugar","4 eggs","80g marmalade","200g self-raising flour","double cream or ice cream, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and butter a 23cm cake tin. Zest the oranges, then remove the peel and pith using a small,serrated knife. Set aside. Cut the oranges along the equator into 1cm-thick slices. Sprinkle 25g sugar over the base of the tin and arrange the orange slices on top. Set aside while you make the syrup and cake batter.","Weighthe orange peels into a saucepan with the pith, and add the same amount of sugar and water (about 100g). Bring to a simmer, then boil for 10 mins until reduced and thickened. Set aside to infuse until needed, then strain.","Beat the butter and 200g of the sugar together in astand mixeror using an electric whisk until light and fluffy, about 5 mins. Crack in the eggs, one by one, beating well after each addition. Finally, beat in the orange zest and marmalade before carefully folding in the flour and a pinch of salt. Spoon the batter over the orange slices and carefully level the surface. Bake for 35-40 mins until golden and a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean.","Leave to cool in the tin for 15-20 mins before carefully inverting onto a plate. Brush some of the bitter orange syrup over the top (any leftover syrup can be used for cocktails).The syrup will keep chilled for two weeks.Serve warm with cream or ice cream.Once completely cool, the cake will keep in an airtight container for three days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9345,9345,'en','Cookies & cream fridge cake','Make this no-cook cookies and cream fridge cake with the help of your fridge – it’s ideal for summer evenings when it’s too warm to put the oven on','["flavourless oil (such as vegetable), for the tin","600ml double cream","200ml mascarpone or soft cheese","1 tsp vanilla extract","3 tbsp icing sugar","4 x 154g packets chocolate cream-filled sandwich cookies, plus extra to serve","200g dark chocolate, broken into small pieces"]','["Oil a 20cm loose-bottomed or springform cake tin and line with baking parchment, ensuring the inside of the tin is fully covered.Whiskthe cream, mascarpone, vanilla and icing sugar together in a large bowl until smooth and holding soft peaks.","Line the base of the tin with a single layer of the cookies, (don’t worry if there are small gaps, as these will be filled with the cream mixture). Spoon over a third of the cream mixture and smooth with aspatula, spreading it to the edge. Repeat twice with the rest of the cookies and the cream mixture.Cover and chill for at least 24 hrs, or up to two days.","Melt the chocolate in 20-second bursts in themicrowave, or in a heatproof bowl set over a pan of simmering water, ensuring the base of the bowl doesn’t touch the water. Leave to cool for 10 mins. Unwrap the cake, remove it from the tin and peel off the parchment. Drizzle over the melted chocolate, letting it drip down the sides, and crumble over the extra cookies. Serve, or chill for up to 1 hr."]','2026-01-10 12:24:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9346,9346,'en','Ultimate traditional Victoria sponge','Take the classic Victoria sponge cake to a whole new level by using crème diplomat in place of standard whipped cream, and sweet macerated berries','["225g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tins","225g golden caster sugar","4 large eggs, at room temperature","225g self-raising flour","½ tsp baking powder","½ tsp fine sea salt","2 tbsp milk","icing sugar, for dusting","2 tbsp caster sugar","½ lemon, juiced","1 vanilla pod, split and seeds scraped (pod reserved, see below)","½ small bunch of mint, leaves picked and roughly bashed","200g strawberries, hulled and halved","125g raspberries","500g fresh custard","1 vanilla pod, pod only","50g caster sugar","2 tbsp custard powder","300ml double cream"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Butter and line the base and sides of two 20cm sandwich tins.","Beat the butter and sugar together in a large bowl with an electric whisk for 8-10 mins, or until pale and fluffy. Add the eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition. Sift in the flour, baking powder and salt, and fold in using a large metal spoon. Add just enough of the milk to create a dropping consistency.","Divide the batter between the prepared tins and smooth the tops with a spatula. Bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 25-30 mins, or until golden and firm to the touch. Leave to cool slightly in the tins, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","Meanwhile, make the macerated berries. Mix the sugar, lemon juice, vanilla and mint together until the sugar has dissolved. Gently stir in the strawberries and raspberries until coated in the mixture. Transfer to the fridge and chill for 30-45 mins until softened.","To make the crème diplomat, put the custard, vanilla pod and sugar in a pan set over a medium heat and bring to the boil, stirring occasionally. Mix the custard powder with 3 tbsp water to dilute and stir until smooth. Whisk into the boiling custard, then reduce the heat to a simmer and continue whisking for 2-3 mins until thick. Put in a heatproof bowl and leave to cool slightly, then chill until cooled completely. Whisk the double cream to soft peaks, and when the custard is cool, remove the vanilla pod and whisk in the cream until the mix is thick enough to pipe.","Drain the macerated berries, reserving the liquid. To assemble, spread half the crème diplomat over one of the sponges, then top with three-quarters of the berries. Invert the second sponge on top, so the flat base of the sponge is facing up, and dust with some icing sugar. Put the remaining crème diplomat in a piping bag fitted with a star nozzle and pipe rosettes around the edge of the cake. Dot the rest of the berries between the rosettes of cream, and serve with the reserved macerating liquid alongside – don’t pour it over before serving as it will split the crème diplomat. Will keep in the fridge for up to three days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9347,9347,'en','Raspberry & pistachio tea cake','Add raspberry icing to this pistachio tea cake and you''ll not only get a lovely pop of colour but fabulous flavour too. It''s perfect for afternoon tea','["150g shelled pistachios","275g golden caster sugar","250g butter, softened","3 eggs","275g self-raising flour","75g Greek yogurt","a little milk, if needed","sugar flowers, pearl sugar or sprinkles, to decorate (optional)","150g raspberries","300g icing sugar"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a 15 x 25cm cake tin. Put the pistachios in a food processor with half the sugar and blitz until the nuts are finely chopped. Tip into a bowl, add the remaining sugar and the butter and beat with an electric whisk until creamy. Add the eggs one at a time, then beat in the flour and yogurt until smooth, adding some milk if it’s too thick.","Spoon the batter into the tin, level and bake for 50-55 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin for 15 mins, then turn the cake out onto a board. Remove and discard the baking parchment, then leave to cool completely. Cut into neat squares.","To make the icing, put the raspberries in a pan with 2 tbsp water and cook briefly until soft and juicy. Push the mixture through a sieve and discard any pips. Whisk in the sugar until you have a smooth pink icing.","Pour the icing over the cooled cake, then decorate with the sugar flowers, pearl sugar or sprinkles, if you like. Leave to set before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:24:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9348,9348,'en','Triple-layered berry cheesecake','Make this showstopping cheesecake for summer entertaining. Top with strawberries or a mix of fresh berries, plus a drizzle of chocolate for extra indulgence','["100g butter, melted, plus extra for the tin","200g digestive biscuits","2 gelatine leaves","50g raspberries","50g caster sugar, plus 2 tbsp","350g strawberries","500g full-fat soft cheese","250ml double cream","few drops red or pink food colouring","1 tbsp vanilla bean paste","50g white chocolate, melted","few drops lemon extract (optional)"]','["Butter and line the base and sides of a 20cm springform tin. Blitz the digestives in a food processor until you get fine crumbs, or bash in a sandwich bag with a rolling pin. Transfer to a bowl and stir in the melted butter until it looks like damp sand. Tip into the prepared tin, and smooth the mixture with the back of a spoon to make an even base, then chill.","Soak the gelatine leaves in cold water. Put the raspberries in a food processor or in a jug using a stick blender, and blitz to a smooth purée. Sieve out the seeds. Warm the raspberry sauce in a small pan with 1 tbsp sugar until just starting to steam, then pour over 1 drained gelatine leaf in a bowl and stir to dissolve.","Blitz 3 (about 65g) of the strawberries in a food processor, and warm through with 1 tbsp sugar in the same way. Tip into a bowl and stir in the other drained gelatine leaf.","Whisk the soft cheese, cream and caster sugar until it just starts to thicken. Divide between three bowls (about 260g per bowl). Fold the strawberry purée into one with a few drops of food colouring to make it light pink, the raspberry mix with the gelatine into another with more food colouring so it’s dark pink, and the vanilla bean paste into the third.","Spoon the raspberry filling over the biscuit base, smoothing the surface so it’s flat. Next, add the strawberry filling, gently smoothing over without disturbing the bottom layer, then repeat with the vanilla mixture, using a clean spoon to level the top. A spatula or knife might help with this to keep from dragging the below layers. Chill for 4 hrs or overnight.","Run a knife around the sides of the cake tin between the cheesecake and the parchment, and loosen the base. Transfer to a cake stand, and smooth the sides, using a palette knife, to neaten the layers. Mix the chocolate with a few drops of lemon extract, if using. Pile the remaining strawberries, some sliced, some whole, on top, and drizzle over the chocolate to finish."]','2026-01-10 12:24:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9349,9349,'en','Strawberry & pistachio olive oil cake','Try this versatile strawberry and pistachio cake made with olive oil and polenta or cornmeal. Perfect for afternoon tea or dessert, it’s also gluten-free','["200ml olive oil, plus extra for the tin","225g shelled pistachios","200g caster sugar","3 large eggs","150g fine cornmeal or polenta","1 tsp gluten-free baking powder","200g strawberries, chopped, plus extra to serve","icing sugar and crème fraîche or yogurt, to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Oil and line the base of a 23cm cake tin. Put 200g of the pistachios in a blender, and whizz until it looks like ground almonds.","Whisk the sugar and eggs together with an electric whisk until pale and fluffy – this should take about 5 mins. Add the olive oil, continually whisking, then fold in the ground pistachios, cornmeal or polenta and baking powder with a pinch of salt. Fold in the strawberries, then scrape into the tin. Roughly chop the remaining pistachios and scatter over the top.","Bake for 50-55 mins until golden and risen. Leave to cool in the tin to room temperature before transferring to a cake stand or plate. Dust with icing sugar and serve with crème fraîche or yogurt and extra strawberries."]','2026-01-10 12:24:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9350,9350,'en','Tropical tart','Create a stunning geometric design on this tropical fruit tart using triangles of mango and kiwi or dragon fruit and pineapple – or dream up your own','["100g mascarpone","140g cream cheese","30g icing sugar","¼ tsp vanilla extract","¼ tsp coconut extract(optional)","50ml coconut creamfrom a can, shaken first (save the rest for another recipe)","1 sweet pastry case","tropical fruitof your choice, sliced, then each slice cut into triangles or the shapes required for your design (we used mangoes, kiwis, pineapple and dragon fruit)"]','["Using an electric whisk, beat the mascarpone, cream cheese, sugar, vanilla, coconut extract, if using, and a pinch of salt until smooth. Whisk in the coconut cream.","Spoon the filling into the pastry case, smooth the top and return to the fridge for at least 2 hrs or overnight. Once set, use the tropical fruit to decorate the top of the tart in your desired geometric pattern."]','2026-01-10 12:24:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9351,9351,'en','Blueberry & pistachio cake with cardamom cream','Reader Janine Watkins shares her recipe for a light and nutty celebration sandwich sponge with floral notes and bursting berries','["4 large eggs","225g golden caster sugar, plus extra for dusting","175g butter, melted and cooled","200g self-raising flour, plus extra for dusting","85g pistachios, ground","50g blueberries","100g butter, softened","200g icing sugar","seeds from 6 cardamom pod, ground","200ml double cream","85g pistachios, roughly chopped","200g blueberries"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLightly grease and line the base of\r\n2 x 20cm sandwich tins with baking\r\nparchment. Grease the tins again,\r\ndust with a little caster sugar and a\r\nlittle flour, then tap out any excess.","Put the eggs and sugar in a heatproof\r\nbowl and, using an electric whisk, mix\r\nbriefly to combine. Place the bowl over \r\na pan of steaming water and continue to\r\nwhisk until the mixture is pale and thick\r\n– when the whisk is lifted, the mixture\r\nshould leave a trail on the surface lasting\r\nabout 5 secs. Remove the bowl from the\r\npan and continue beating for 2 mins.","Continue to whisk the mixture while\r\ntrickling the melted butter around the\r\nedge of the bowl. Sift in the flour and\r\nground pistachios, very gently give the\r\nmixture 2-3 folds, then add the blueberries\r\nand fold again, being careful not to knock\r\nout all the air. Divide the mixture between\r\nthe tins and bake for 25-30 mins, until a\r\nskewer inserted comes out clean.","To make the filling, beat the butter and\r\nsugar together until pale and fluffy. Add\r\nthe cardamom, then drizzle in the cream.\r\nContinue to beat until light and airy.","Cool cakes in their tins for 10 mins, then\r\nturn out onto a wire rack. Remove lining\r\npaper when completely cooled. Sandwich\r\nthe cakes together with the cardamom\r\ncream, top with some more, then\r\ndecorate with pistachios and blueberries."]','2026-01-10 12:24:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9352,9352,'en','Spotty blueberry & clotted cream cake','Spotty blueberry and clotted cream sponge, the perfect fruity party cake','["200g caster sugar","200g softened butter","4 eggs, beaten","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","2 tbsp milk","150g blueberries","50g caster sugar","227g pot clotted cream","4 tbsp blueberry conserve","a handful of blueberries, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Butter two 20cm sandwich tins and line with non-stick baking paper. In a large bowl, beat all the cake ingredients together until you have a smooth, soft batter. Fold in the blueberries through the raw batter before baking.","Divide the mixture between the tins, smooth\r\nthe surface with a spatula or the back of a spoon, then bake for about 20 mins until golden and the cake springs back when pressed. Turn onto a cooling rack and leave to cool completely.","To make the filling, beat the butter until smooth and creamy, then gradually beat in icing sugar. Beat in vanilla extract if you’re using it. Spread the butter cream over the bottom of one of the sponges, top it with jam and sandwich the second sponge on top. Dust with a little icing sugar before serving. Keep in an airtight container and eat within 2 days.","For a simple filling, stir the caster sugar into the clotted cream.  Sandwich the sponges with the blueberry conserve and a third of the clotted cream filling. Top with remaining cream and decorate with blueberries."]','2026-01-10 12:24:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9353,9353,'en','Rhubarb & lemon curd cake','A lemon sponge cake dotted with tender pink pieces of rhubarb and topped with decadent cream frosting','["225g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","225g caster sugar","zest 1 lemon","4 medium eggs at room temperature, beaten","75g ground almonds","200g self-raising flour","140g forced rhubarb, washed and cut into small chunks","1 tbsp demerara sugar","75ml double cream","3 tbsp lemon curd, plus extra for drizzling"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nLightly butter a deep, round 20cm cake\r\ntin and line the base with a circle of\r\nnon-stick baking parchment.","Place the butter in a large bowl and\r\nbeat with an electric whisk until light\r\nand fluffy, then add the caster sugar and\r\nlemon zest and beat again. Gradually add\r\nthe eggs to the mixture, beating well with\r\neach addition, until fully combined. The\r\nmixture will begin to look glossy – if at\r\nany stage the mixture curdles, beat in a\r\nspoonful of ground almonds and continue\r\nto add the egg until it is all amalgamated.","Stir in the ground almonds, then the\r\nflour, and fold everything carefully\r\ntogether using a large spoon. Fold\r\nthrough half the rhubarb, then transfer\r\nthe mixture into the prepared cake tin\r\nand scatter with the remaining rhubarb.\r\nFinish with the demerara sugar sprinkled\r\non top. Bake the cake for 45 mins, or\r\nuntil a skewer inserted into the middle\r\ncomes out clean. Transfer to a wire rack\r\nto cool slightly in the tin, then remove\r\nfrom the tin. When the cake is cold,\r\nmake the topping.","Whip the cream in a large bowl until it\r\nforms soft peaks. In a small bowl, loosen\r\nthe lemon curd with about 1 tbsp water\r\nand carefully fold it through the cream,\r\nwithout overworking. Spread over the\r\ncake, drizzle with a little more lemon\r\ncurd and serve immediately."]','2026-01-10 12:24:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9354,9354,'en','Strawberry & poppy seed cake','A light vanilla sponge dotted with seeds and sandwiched with orange frosting and fresh strawberries – heavenly','["4 tbsp poppy seeds","200g unsalted butter, melted, plus a little extra for greasing","225g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","4 large eggs, at room temperature","225g golden caster sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","zest and juice 1 large orange","100g golden caster sugar","1 tbsp orange liqueur (optional)","170g pot full-fat Greek yogurt","500ml pot full-fat crème fraîche","350g strawberries, sliced, plus extra to serve (optional)"]','["Dry-fry the poppy seeds in a pan over\r\na gentle heat for 2 mins or until aromatic.\r\nLet cool. Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nGrease and line 2 x 20cm sandwich tins.","Mix together the flour and baking\r\npowder, then set aside. Put the eggs\r\nand sugar in a large mixing bowl. Using\r\nelectric beaters, whisk until thick, pale\r\nand foamy. Pour in the cooled butter and\r\nvanilla extract, and briefly whisk again.\r\nSift in the flour mix, add 3 tbsp poppy\r\nseeds then, using a large metal spoon,\r\ncarefully fold into the cake mixture until\r\neven. Pour the mixture into the tins and\r\nbake for 25 mins or until golden and\r\nspringy to the touch. Cool in the tins\r\nfor 10 mins, then transfer to a wire rack.","To make the syrup, warm the orange\r\njuice and 50g of the sugar in the\r\nmicrowave for 30 secs. Stir in the liqueur,\r\nif using. Using a large serrated knife, cut\r\neach cake in half horizontally to make a\r\ntotal of 4 circles. Brush the cut side and\r\nedges of each circle with plenty of the\r\nwarm orange syrup.","To make the filling, beat together\r\nthe yogurt, crème fraîche, remaining\r\nsugar and orange zest until thick and\r\nspreadable. Stack the cakes with the\r\ncreamy filling and strawberries, finishing\r\nwith a creamy layer on top. Sprinkle the\r\nremaining poppy seeds over the top, then\r\nlet the cake sit for 30 mins before slicing."]','2026-01-10 12:24:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9355,9355,'en','English rose cake','A stunning floral layer cake, flavoured with rosewater and layered up with vanilla cream, raspberry icing and crystallised petals','["350g butter, softened","500g golden caster sugar","6 large eggs","200g full-fat natural yogurt","500g plain flour","2 tsp baking powder","1 tsp vanilla extract","1 tsp rosewater","140g golden caster sugar","1-2 tsp rosewater (depending on your taste)","85g raspberries, defrosted if frozen, plus 100g to decorate","250g icing sugar","1 tsp vanilla extract","300ml double cream","rose petal pieces and crystallised rose petals (see step-by-step, above), to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease and line the base and sides of\r\n3 x 20cm round loose-bottomed cake\r\ntins with baking parchment. Tip all the\r\ningredients for the cake into a large bowl\r\nand beat with an electric whisk until well\r\ncombined. Divide the mixture between\r\nthe 3 cake tins and smooth the tops. Bake\r\nfor 45 mins, swapping the tins halfway\r\nthrough so they cook evenly. Leave to cool\r\nfor 10 mins in the tins, then remove and\r\ntransfer to a wire rack to cool completely.","To make the rose syrup, put the sugar\r\nin a pan with 100ml water and heat until\r\nthe sugar has dissolved. Turn up the heat\r\nand bubble for 1-2 mins, then remove\r\nfrom the heat. Add the rose water: start\r\nwith 1 tsp and taste, as some varieties\r\nare much stronger than others – just be\r\ncareful as the syrup will be really hot.\r\nSpoon half the syrup over the 3 sponges\r\nand set aside.","Add 2 tbsp of the syrup to the raspberries\r\nand crush them with a fork. Push the\r\nraspberries through a sieve into a bowl and\r\ndiscard the seeds. Sift in the icing sugar\r\nand mix to a smooth icing. In a second\r\nbowl, add another 2 tbsp of the syrup\r\nand the vanilla to the cream and whisk\r\nuntil it holds soft peaks. Chill until needed.","To assemble, place one cake, flat-side\r\nup, on a plate or cake stand, and top\r\nwith half the cream and a third of the\r\nremaining raspberries (see tips,\r\nbelow). Sandwich another cake on top\r\nand add the remaining cream, another\r\nthird of the raspberries, then the last\r\ncake. Smooth the raspberry icing\r\nover the top, letting it drizzle down\r\nthe sides. To decorate, we used a\r\nmixture of rose petal pieces (available\r\nfrom cookshops or online), homemade\r\ncrystallised rose petals (see step-by-step, above) and\r\nthe reserved raspberries."]','2026-01-10 12:24:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9356,9356,'en','Peach, pistachio & white chocolate pound cake','A dense and indulgent tea shop-style sponge cake with white chocolate and cream cheese frosting','["250g pack butter, softened","200g caster sugar","300g plain flour","1 tsp baking powder","2 tsp vanilla extract","3 large eggs","200g full-fat Greek yogurt","200g bar white chocolate, 50g grated, remainder broken into chunks","2 peaches, stoned and diced into 1cm or smaller chunks","white chocolate chunks (see above)","200g tub full-fat soft cheese","200g Greek yogurt","3 tbsp finely chopped pistachios"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nButter and line the base and sides\r\nof a deep 22cm cake tin with baking\r\nparchment, then beat the rest of the\r\nbutter and the sugar together until pale.\r\nAdd the flour, baking powder, vanilla,\r\neggs, yogurt and grated chocolate.\r\nBeat together, then stir in the peaches.","Scrape into the tin and bake for 1 hr,\r\nuntil an inserted skewer comes out\r\nclean. Cool in the tin.","To make the icing, melt the chocolate\r\nchunks in a bowl over a pan of barely\r\nsimmering water, then remove from\r\nthe heat. Beat the soft cheese in a\r\nmixing bowl until smooth, then beat in\r\nthe yogurt until smooth. Scrape in the\r\nmelted chocolate and beat again. Chill\r\nuntil ready to use.","Swirl the icing over the top of the\r\ncake and scatter over the pistachios."]','2026-01-10 12:24:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9357,9357,'en','Grapefruit & poppy seed cake','A bundt cake tin gives a pretty finish to this citrus sponge, drizzled with a zesty butter glaze','["175g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","300g plain flour, plus a little extra for dusting","300g caster sugar","3 large eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","1½  tsp baking powder","225ml soured cream","zest 2 grapefruit, plus 3 tbsp juice","4 tsp poppy seeds, toasted","100g caster sugar","25g butter","zest 1 grapefruit, plus 4 tbsp juice"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nButter then flour a 1.5-litre Bundt or ring\r\ntin. Beat together the butter and sugar\r\nuntil pale and fluffy. Beat in the eggs, one\r\nat a time, followed by the vanilla, flour,\r\nbaking powder, soured cream, grapefruit\r\nzest and juice, and toasted poppy seeds.\r\nScrape into the tin and level it off. Bake\r\nfor 40-55 mins, depending on the shape\r\nof your tin, until a skewer poked in comes\r\nout clean. Leave in the tin to cool a little\r\nwhile you make the icing.","Gently heat the caster sugar, butter and\r\ngrapefruit juice to melt the butter. Bring\r\nto the boil, then reduce heat and simmer\r\nfor 3 mins. Remove from the heat, stir in\r\nthe zest and cool for about 10 mins until\r\nthickened and syrupy.","Turn the warm cake out onto a cooling\r\nrack and brush half the glaze over the\r\ncake. Spoon the rest over, little by little,\r\nso it sinks in."]','2026-01-10 12:24:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9358,9358,'en','Iced coconut & lime slice with summer fruit','This no-cook dessert is served straight from the freezer, for a true taste of summer indulgence','["300ml double cream","85g golden caster sugar","250ml coconut cream","zest and juice 1 lime","800g mixed red fruits (we used strawberries, raspberries and redcurrants)","2 tbsp golden caster sugar","juice 1 lime"]','["Line a 900g loaf tin with enough cling\r\nfilm to allow you to wrap the sides over\r\nthe top of the tin later on. Whisk cream\r\nwith the sugar until it holds peaks. Whisk\r\nin coconut cream and the lime juice and\r\nzest until it holds its shape again. Tip into\r\ntin and smooth the top, wrap the cling\r\nfilm back over and place in the freezer for\r\nat least 4 hrs but preferably overnight.\r\nCan be made up to 2 weeks ahead.","Before serving, toss all the fruit with\r\nthe sugar and the lime and set aside. When ready to serve, take the slice out of the freezer (don''t take it out sooner as you would with most other frozen desserts).\r\nUnmould the slice onto a long, chilled\r\nplatter, then use a knife dipped in very\r\nhot water to cut thick portions. Serve\r\non chilled serving plates with the\r\nfruit spooned around."]','2026-01-10 12:24:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9359,9359,'en','Blackberry & apple cake','A moist fruit sponge, packed with the best seasonal produce with a touch of almond and cinnamon too','["125g butter, softened, plus extra for the tin","125g caster sugar","3 large eggs, beaten","50g ground almonds","100g self-raising flour","2 Discovery, Russet or Worcester apples, peeled and cored, each cut into 12 segments","100g blackberries","1 large pinch cinnamon","2 tbsp demerara sugar","25g butter, cut into small flakes","25g peeled and toasted hazelnuts, roughly chopped","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nButter a 22cm round loose-bottomed\r\ncake tin and line the base with baking\r\nparchment. Beat the butter and caster\r\nsugar together in a large bowl until it\r\nis light and fluffy. Gradually pour in and\r\nbeat the eggs, a little at a time, until\r\nyou have used two-thirds, adding flour\r\nif it curdles. Fold in the remaining egg,\r\nthe ground almonds and finally the flour,\r\nand combine everything gently.","Add two-thirds of the apples to the\r\ncake mixture and all the blackberries.\r\nTurn the mixture into the prepared tin\r\nand smooth it out evenly. Scatter the\r\nremaining apples over the surface of the\r\ncake. For the topping, sprinkle over the\r\ncinnamon, demerara sugar and butter.\r\nBake for 50-55 mins or until a skewer\r\ncomes out clean. Remove the cake from\r\nthe oven and scatter on the toasted\r\nhazelnuts. When the cake is cool, dust\r\nlightly with icing sugar. Serve in slices."]','2026-01-10 12:24:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9360,9360,'en','Gooseberry & orange drizzle cake','Use up a garden glut in this simple and fruity adaptation of a classic – serve with custard for a winning pudding','["225g softened butter, plus extra for the tin","225g caster sugar","225g self-raising flour","4 large eggs","grated zest and juice 1 orange","225g gooseberries, topped and tailed","140g granulated sugar"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nButter and line a 20 x 30cm traybake tin\r\nwith baking parchment.","Put the butter, caster sugar, flour,\r\neggs and orange zest in a bowl. Beat\r\nthoroughly with an electric whisk until\r\ncreamy and smooth. Stir in the\r\ngooseberries, then spoon into the tin\r\nand level the surface. Bake for 35 mins\r\nuntil a skewer inserted into the cake\r\ncomes out clean.","Stir the orange juice and granulated\r\nsugar together, spoon over the surface\r\nof the warm cake and leave to cool and\r\nset. Cut into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:24:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9361,9361,'en','Classic Victoria sandwich recipe','The perfect party cake, a Victoria sponge is a traditional bake everyone will love. Makes an easy wedding cake, too','["200g caster sugar","200g softened butter","4 eggs, beaten","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","2 tbsp milk","100g butter, softened","140g icing sugar, sifted","drop vanilla extract (optional)","half a 340g jar good-quality strawberry jam","icing sugar, to decorate"]','["Heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. Butter two 20cm sandwich tins and line with non-stick baking paper.","In alarge bowl,beat200g caster sugar, 200g softened butter, 4 beaten eggs, 200g self-raising flour, 1 tsp baking powder and 2 tbsp milk together until you have a smooth, soft batter.","Divide the mixture between the tins, smooth the surface with aspatulaor the back of a spoon.","Bake for about 20 mins until golden and the cake springs back when pressed.","Turn onto acooling rackand leave to cool completely.","To make the filling, beat the 100g softened butter until smooth and creamy, then gradually beat in 140g sifted icing sugar and a drop of vanilla extract (if you’re using it).","Spreadthe buttercream over the bottom of one of the sponges. Top it with 170g strawberry jam and sandwich the second sponge on top.","Dust with a little icing sugar before serving. Keep in anairtight containerand eat within 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9362,9362,'en','Frances Quinn’s Summer’s day wedding cake','Frances creates her own version of the latest bridal trend – the ‘naked’ cake. She skips the traditional fondant icing for mascarpone seasonal berries.','["1.375kg slightly salted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing (buy 6 x 250g packs)","1.375kg golden caster sugar","21 large eggs","2 tbsp vanilla extract","1.375kg self-raising flour","210g ground almonds","zest 21 large lemons, plus 10 tbsp lemon juice","600g golden caster sugar","700ml lemon juice (use the lemons from the cake mixture)","large bunch fresh mint, leaves torn","2kg mascarpone","2 x 325 jars good-quality lemon curd","1kg raspberries","icing sugar, for dusting","roughly 1.2kg mixed berries and cherries (we used strawberries, cherries, blueberries, blackberries and redcurrants)","a few mint leaves","assortment of unsprayed flowers (see tip, below)","30cm deep cake tin","20cm deep cake tin","10cm deep cake tin","sewing cotton, for cutting cake","20cm and 10cm thin cake boards","cake paddle (optional, but very useful)","about 20 plastic straws","2 large wire racks","large cake stand or board","flower tape or kitchen foil"]','["To make the cakes.Heat oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3. For the bottom tier, grease a deep 30cm cake tin with butter, then line the base and sides with a double layer of baking parchment.","Using an electric whisk, cream 400g of the butter with 400g of caster sugar. Whisk 6 eggs in a jug with ½ tbsp of the vanilla, then gradually add to the creamed butter, beating between additions. Once combined, sift in 400g of the flour, and mix in 60g of ground almonds and add the zest of 6 lemons. Gently stir in 3 tbsp of the lemon juice.","Scrape into the prepared cake tin and level the top with a spatula. Bake on the middle shelf of the oven for 1 hr. Don’t worry if the top looks a little dark, as this will become the base. The cake is ready when the surface feels springy to the touch and a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Set aside to cool in the tin for 30 mins, then turn out on to a large wire rack, or use 2 smaller wire racks pushed together.","To make a middle tier, line a deep 20cm cake tin as before, and make the cake following the method in step 2, using 4 eggs and 250g each of sugar, flour and butter. Add the zest of 4 lemons, 40g ground almonds, 1 tsp of vanilla extract and 1½ tbsp of lemon juice. Bake for 50 mins, testing as before.","For the top tier, use a deep 10cm cake tin and make the cake following the method as before, using 1 egg, 75g each of sugar, flour and butter, 10g ground almonds, the zest of 1 lemon, 1 tsp vanilla and ½ tsp lemon juice. Bake for 30 mins.","Repeat steps 1-4 so you have 2 bottom tiers, 2 middle tiers and 1 top tier. Leave until all the cakes are completely cool. Once cooled, the cakes can be wrapped in a double layer of cling film and kept in a cool place for up to 4 days, or frozen for up to 1 month. To defrost, leave the cakes at room temperature overnight.","To make the syrup.Put the sugar and lemon juice in a saucepan over a medium-high heat. Simmer for about 10 mins, stirring occasionally, until the sugar has dissolved. Remove from the heat, stir through the mint, then allow to cool and steep for up to 5 hrs. Sieve into a jug or bowl, then cover with cling film and chill until ready to use. The syrup will now keep for up to 1 week.","To make the mascarpone cream.Empty the mascarpone into a large bowl. Beat with an electric whisk to soften slightly, then fold through 300ml of the cooled Lemon & mint syrup until fully combined (save the remaining syrup for assembling). Chill until ready to use, but leave at room temperature for 20 mins to soften before using. Can be made 1 day ahead of assembling.","To assemble the cake.Split the two 30cm cakes and the two 20cm cakes in half through the centre, and the 10cm cake into 4 layers. Use the cake paddle or a large chopping board to help move the sponges and flip one of the largest layers onto a serving plate or cake stand, so that the top of the cake now becomes the bottom. Spoon over a little of the reserved syrup, then spread with some of the lemon mascarpone filling using a small offset spatula or knife. Drizzle over some of the lemon curd, then scatter with raspberries. Now top with the remaining layer, so the bottom of the cake now becomes the top, realigning the cocktail sticks to ensure the cake is level. Then layer more syrup, mascarpone, lemon curd and raspberries with the remaining 30cm sponges.","Push 6 straws into the middle of the cake in a circle formation, no wider than 20cm in diameter – these will support the next tier. Snip the straws where they protrude from the cake, so that they are flush with the top. Repeat the assembly with the two 20cm cakes, placing these onto thin cake boards before sitting on top of the larger cakes, then poke in more straws to support the top tie. Finally, assemble the top layer using the same method. Spread any remaining mascarpone on top, then dust the tiers lightly with icing sugar. Decorate with an assortment of mixed berries, mint sprigs and flowers (see tip, left)."]','2026-01-10 12:24:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9363,9363,'en','Moreish mocha profiteroles','A classic profiterole recipe with an added kick for coffee lovers – pile up a batch as modern wedding cake!','["100g plain flour","85g unsalted butter","3 eggs, beaten","4 tbsp Bird''s custard powder","6 tbsp golden caster sugar","600ml milk","2 tbsp coffee essence (dissolve 2 tbsp instant coffee granules in 2 tbsp hot water - we used Nescafé Partners’ Blend)","284ml double cream","100g icing sugar","100g dark chocolate, in pieces","50g butter","50ml coffee","1-2 tbsp coffee liqueur such as Kahlúa"]','["Sift the flour into a bowl and stir in a pinch of salt. Put butter and 200ml cold water into a pan, bring to a rolling boil, then take off the heat. Tip in the flour and salt and stir to form a smooth paste. Now beat the mixture until it starts to come away from the sides of the pan, then tip onto a plate and leave to cool.","Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Return paste to the pan, then gradually beat in the eggs, mixing well. Spoon walnut-sized balls onto a baking sheet, then bake for 20-25 mins until golden. Remove from oven, poke the underneath with a teaspoon, turn upside-down, then bake for 5 mins to dry out. Cool on a wire rack before filling.","For the filling, mix the custard powder and sugar with a splash of milk until you have a smooth paste. Heat the remaining milk, then stir into the paste. Pour the mixture into a pan and bring to the boil, stirring. Cook for 5 mins until you have a thick custard. Stir in coffee, then leave to cool. Softly whip the cream, sift in the icing sugar and mix, then fold into the\r\ncustard. Pipe the cream into each choux bun.","For the sauce, melt chocolate and butter with the coffee in a bowl in the microwave on Medium for 1-2 mins. Pour in the liqueur, mix well, then pour over the filled buns."]','2026-01-10 12:24:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9364,9364,'en','Easy vanilla cake','A moist cake drenched with vanilla syrup. Use as the basis for a range of fabulous celebration cakes','["250g pack unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for greasing","250g golden caster sugar","seeds scraped from 1 vanilla pod or 1 tsp vanilla paste","5 large eggs, cracked into a jug","85g plain flour","100g full-fat Greek yogurt (I used Total)","250g self-raising flour","3 tbsp semi-skimmed milk","50g golden caster sugar","seeds ½ vanilla pod or ½ tsp vanilla paste"]','["Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\nGrease a round, deep 20cm tin, then\r\nline the base and sides with non-stick\r\nbaking paper.","Using electric beaters or a tabletop\r\nmixer, beat the butter, sugar, vanilla and\r\n¼ tsp salt together until pale and fluffy,\r\nthen pour in the eggs, one at a time,\r\ngiving the mix a really good beating\r\nbefore adding the next. Add 1 tbsp of the\r\nplain flour if the mix starts to look slimy\r\nrather than fluffy. Beat in the yogurt.","Mix the flours; then, using a large metal\r\nspoon, fold them into the batter, followed\r\nby the milk. Spoon the mix into the tin\r\nand bake for 1 hr 20 mins or until well\r\nrisen and golden – a skewer inserted into\r\nthe middle should come out clean.","Meanwhile, make the syrup by gently\r\nheating 50ml water with the sugar and\r\nvanilla in a pan until the sugar dissolves.\r\nSet aside. Once the cake is out of the\r\noven, leave to cool for 30 mins in the\r\ntin, then use a skewer to poke holes all\r\nover the cake, going right to the bottom.\r\nPour the syrup over, letting it completely\r\nsoak in after each addition. Leave to cool\r\ncompletely, then either wrap the cake\r\nwell or fill and ice it. If you wrap it with\r\nbaking parchment and cling film, the\r\nunfilled cake will keep well for up to 3\r\ndays, or in the freezer for up to a month.","For ideas on how to decorate the cake and to try out some variations on this basic cake mixture, have a look at the ''Goes well with'' recipes for Simple elegance wedding cake, Birthday bug cake and Summer celebration cake."]','2026-01-10 12:24:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9365,9365,'en','Romantic rose cupcakes','These decorative cupcakes make the perfect centrepiece for a wedding or christening, or a lovely gift','["150ml pot natural yogurt","3 eggs, beaten","1 tsp vanilla extract","175g golden caster sugar","140g self-raising flour","1 tsp baking powder","100g ground almonds","175g unsalted butter, melted","100g white chocolate","140g unsalted butter","140g icing sugar"]','["Line a 12-hole muffin tin with paper cases and heat oven to 190C/fan 170C/gas 5. In a jug, mix the yogurt, eggs and vanilla extract. Put the dry ingredients, plus a pinch of salt, into a large bowl and make a well in the middle.","Add the yogurty mix and melted butter, and quickly fold in with a spatula or metal spoon – don’t overwork it. Spoon into the\r\ncases (they will be quite full) and bake for 18-20 mins or until golden, risen and springy to the touch. Cool for a few mins, then lift the cakes onto a wire rack to cool completely. Keep in an airtight container for up to 3 days or freeze as soon as possible.","White chocolate frosting: Melt the chocolate in the microwave on High for 1½ mins, stirring halfway. Leave to cool. Beat the butter and icing sugar in a large bowl until creamy.  Beat in the chocolate. Cover and chill for up to one month.","Up to 48 hrs before serving (or the day before if it’s really hot), bring the frosting back to room temperature, then spread over the cakes. Put the ribbon around the cakes now if you like, tying or glueing in place. Keep cool, out of direct sunlight."]','2026-01-10 12:24:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9368,9368,'en','Crispy lamb & pea tabbouleh','Make our faff-free traybake kebab and use the leftovers as the base to make this lamb, pea, pomegranate and bulgur wheat tabbouleh. It’s great for make-ahead lunches','["120g dried bulgur","4 tbsp olive oil","1 lemon , juiced","small handful of parsley , roughly chopped","small handful of mint sprigs , leaves picked and finely chopped","200g frozen peas","150g leftover traybake lamb kebab , roughly chopped (see step 2)","4 spring onions , finely sliced","2 roasted red peppers , finely chopped","30g pomegranate seeds , to serve"]','["Cook the bulgur following pack instructions then drain and rinse under cold water. Set aside to cool slightly. Mix 3 tbsp olive oil with the lemon juice and herbs in a large bowl, then stir in the bulgur and season to taste.","Drizzle the remaining olive oil into a frying pan and put over a medium-high heat. Mix in the frozen peas and leftover lamb and fry for 5-6 mins until crispy and the peas are popping. Stir in the spring onions and peppers and cook for just 1 min then remove from the heat. Stir into the tabbouleh and scatter over pomegranate seeds to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:24:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9369,9369,'en','Ezme','Enjoy this salad to serve with your favourite Turkish dishes. Authentic ezme is very finely hand-chopped, or you can use a food processor, if you like','["2-3 large ripe tomatoes , quartered, around 400g","1 medium red Romano pepper , deseeded and roughly chopped","1 medium sivri biber or small green chilli, deseeded and roughly chopped","1 small onion , roughly chopped","2 large garlic cloves , crushed","25g fresh flat-leaf parsley","2 tbsp red pepper paste","1 tbsp tomato purée","2 tbsp pomegranate molasses","1 tbsp pul biber","2 tsp sumac","1 tbsp dried mint","60ml extra virgin olive oil"]','["Put the tomatoes and all of the peppers in a food processor and blitz until finely chopped. Tip out into a sieve, set over a bowl and leave to strain. Add the onions, garlic and parsley to the food processor and blitz until finely chopped, then set aside.","Add red pepper paste, tomato purée, pomegranate molasses, pul biber, sumac, dried mint and most of the extra virgin olive oil to a serving bowl and whisk well so everything comes together as a sauce. Tip in the blitzed onion mixture and the strained pepper mixture along with 1 tsp flaky sea salt . Stir well, then drizzle with the remaining extra virgin olive oil to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:24:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9371,9371,'en','Spicy red pepper dip & crispy harissa mince','This is my interpretation of an amazing dish, muhammara, a spicy Middle Eastern red pepper and walnut dip. It’s very easy to pull together, especially if you use a jar of roasted peppers. I’ve topped mine with crispy harissa mince for a more complete meal, but if you leave it out it’s perfect for parties, served with crudités or pitta breads, or spread on the inside of sandwiches.','["2tbsp olive oil , plus more to drizzle","1 onion , finely diced","400g vegan mince","1 garlic clove , finely minced","2tbsp harissa paste","handful of flat-leaf parsley leaves","handful of fresh dill","salt and pepper","100g walnuts","400g roasted red peppers","4tbsp olive oil","Juice of one lemon","1tsp paprika","1 lemon , cut into wedges","4-8 flatbreads"]','["In a large frying pan, dry toast the walnuts for about 5 minutes over medium heat, occasionally shaking the pan, until the walnuts are fragrant and toasted. Remove from the pan and set aside.","Using the same frying pan, heat the 2 tablespoons of olive oil over a medium heat, and fry the onion with a generous pinch of salt and black pepper, stirring often until very soft. Add the mince and turn the heat up slightly. Cook for 5-7 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the mixture is browned and crispy. Add the garlic and cook for a minute further, then spoon in the harissa and combine. Remove from heat and set aside.","Reserving 1 tablespoon for a garnish, blitz the toasted walnuts with the rest of the muhammara ingredients in a high-speed blender, until it forms a smooth sauce. Taste and season with salt and pepper, then spread on a big platter using the back of a spoon.","Top the sauce with the crispy harissa mince, scatter with the remaining walnuts, chopping them up a little if you want. Finish with fresh herbs, an extra drizzle of olive oil and a crack of black pepper. Serve with flatbreads for scooping it all up, or with rice."]','2026-01-10 12:24:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9372,9372,'en','Air-fryer chicken tikka kebabs','Use your air-fryer to make these chicken tikka kebabs. Enjoy on naans with your favourite sides, like mango chutney, raita, lime pickle or crumbled bhaji','["3-4 chicken breasts (about 600g), cut into bite-size pieces","150g natural yogurt , plus extra to serve (optional)","2 tbsp tikka masala curry paste","2 garlic cloves , crushed or finely grated","thumb-sized piece of ginger , peeled and grated","2 large naans (we used round naans)","handful of coriander , chopped","your choice of mango chutney, lime pickle, diced cucumber or raita and crumbled bhaji"]','["Put the chicken in a bowl with the yogurt, curry paste, garlic and ginger. Mix everything together and leave for at least 20 mins to marinate, or chill overnight. Will keep covered and chilled for a day.","Heat the air-fryer to 180C. Thread the chicken onto skewers – you’ll need between four and eight. If your air-fryer is big enough to hold the longer skewers, then use four, otherwise use eight shorter ones or cut them in half. (Alternatively, air-fry the chicken in pieces for 15-20 mins, turning halfway, until cooked through. You may need to do this in batches.)","Warm the naans following pack instructions – the microwave is a good option as it tends to soften them, which is helpful for wrapping around the chicken. Or, splash the breads with water, then toast.","Serve the naans topped with the chicken, chopped coriander, a drizzle of yogurt, if you like, and accompaniments of your choice."]','2026-01-10 12:24:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9373,9373,'en','Ful medames','Try this brilliant Egyptian recipe from the head chef of London restaurant Ombra. Made using fava beans, it’s mashed into a chunky purée along with garlic, lemon and tahini','["400g can fava beans (available online) or broad beans","1 small onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","100ml olive oil","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp chilli flakes","2 large, ripe tomatoes, roughly chopped (or 200g can of chopped tomatoes, if tomatoes aren’t in season)","½ lemon, juiced","2 tbsp tahini"]','["Drain the beans and rinse. Fill the empty, clean can with water and pour into asaucepanwith the beans. Bring them to the boil to warm through, then take them off the heat.","Meanwhile, in a separate mediumfrying pan, gently fry the onion and garlic in all but a few tablespoons of the olive oil for 5 mins, then add 2 tsp sea salt flakes, the cumin, chilli flakes and tomatoes. Drain the beans, reserving some of the cooking liquid. Add to the onion mixture and cook over a low heat for 30 mins, stirring often and adding some of the cooking liquid if it looks dry.","Using a potato masher, mash the beans with the remaining olive oil, lemon juice and tahini. The final consistency should be a chunky, soft purée. If it splits slightly, mix in a drop of cold water."]','2026-01-10 12:24:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9374,9374,'en','Iraqi lamb kofta kebabs','Make these lamb kebabs with harissa aubergines. The winner of Celebrity MasterChef UK 2020 shares the recipe that transports his dad back to his homeland','["3 garlic cloves , crushed or grated","thumb-sized piece of ginger , peeled and finely grated","2 shallots , roughly chopped","small handful of parsley , roughly chopped","2 mint sprigs , leaves picked and roughly chopped","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp ground cinnamon","1 tbsp tomato purée","500g lamb mince","1 tbsp chopped coriander","2 tbsp pomegranate seeds","hummus , fattoush salad, flatbreads and tzatziki, to serve (optional)","6 baby aubergines","4 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp ground cumin","75g butter","2 tbsp harissa"]','["First, make the aubergines. Heat the oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.Slicethe aubergines in half lengthways and score the flesh crosswise, being careful not to cut all the way through. Combine the oil and cumin in a small bowl and season well. Brush this over the aubergines. Roast for 45 mins or until soft. Remove to a platter.","Melt the butter in a small pan and fry the harissa with a pinch of salt for a few minutes. Drizzle this over the cooked aubergines.","Meanwhile, put the garlic, ginger, shallots, parsley, half the mint, the cumin, coriander, cinnamon, tomato purée and 1 tsp each salt and freshly ground black pepper in afood processor. Blitz until everything is finely chopped, about 30 seconds.","Tip the lamb into a large bowl and add the spice mix, stirring until everything is well combined. If using bamboo skewers, soak these for 15 mins before continuing.","Form rough handfuls of the lamb mixture into meatballs and thread these onto the skewers. Roll the meat in your hands to flatten into an egg-like shape. Continue until all the mixture has been used.","Heat the grill to high and grill the kofta for about 6 mins, then turn and cook for a further 6 mins, or until the meat is cooked through. Put the kofta on top of the aubergines and scatter over the remaining mint, coriander and pomegranate seeds. Serve with hummus, fattoush salad, flatbreads and tzatziki, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:24:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9375,9375,'en','Golden spiced pilaf with crispy shallots','Combine crispy shallots, warming spices, crunchy nuts and soft fruits to make this stunning pilaf. Serve alone with yogurt, or alongside veg, meat or fish','["250g basmati rice","25g butter","2 tbsp vegetable oil , plus extra for deep-frying","1 onion , finely chopped","2 garlic cloves , finely chopped","1 tsp ground turmeric","1 tsp ground cumin","1 small cinnamon stick","8 cardamom pods","1 star anise","1 lemon","600ml hot vegetable or chicken stock , or 1 stock cube mixed with hot water from the kettle","6 shallots , peeled, halved and thinly sliced","50g nuts of your choice (we used a mixture of cashews, pistachios and flaked almonds)","200g natural yogurt","large pinch of saffron","125g dried fruit of your choice, such as apricots, cranberries or raisins","handful of coriander , leaves picked"]','["Tip the rice into asaucepanand cover with warm water, then leave to soak for 30 mins.","Meanwhile, melt the butter in a large pan over a medium heat, then drizzle in the oil and fry the onion and garlic for 8-10 mins, stirring until the onion is translucent.","Stir in the ground and whole spices, sizzling them in the butter and oil for 1-2 mins, then drain the rice and add it to the pan. Peel three long strips of zest from the lemon using avegetable peeler, and drop these into the pan. Stir everything together, pour over the stock and bring to a simmer. Stir again and cover, then continue to simmer for 2 mins more. Turn off the heat and leave to stand, without opening the lid, for 15 mins.","Pour a 2cm depth of oil into a deep pan orwokset over a medium heat and heat to 180C or until a cube of bread browns in 20 seconds. Fry the shallots in two batches, sizzling for 8 mins per batch until golden brown. This will take a while, and they catch quickly, so watch closely to prevent this. Spoon onto a plate lined with kitchen paper using a slotted spoon, then sprinkle with salt and leave to cool slightly.","Toast the nuts in a dry frying pan over a medium-low heat for 2-3 mins until golden. Mix the yogurt with the saffron and a pinch of salt in a small serving bowl and set aside.","Uncover the rice and check it’s ready – it should be tender and all the liquid should have been absorbed. If not, cover and leave to stand for another 5 mins. Once cooked, fluff up the grains using a fork, and stir through the nuts and dried fruit. Tip out onto a serving platter, removing the whole spices and lemon peel as you do. Scatter over the crispy shallots and the coriander leaves, then serve with the saffron yogurt on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:24:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9376,9376,'en','Slow-cooked harissa lamb','Try this slow cooked harissa lamb as an alternative roast. We love the texture – it’s half-roasted and half-pulled, fork-tender but still easy to carve','["2kg whole leg of lamb on the bone","10 red onions, cut in half","300ml chicken stock","4 tbsp chopped coriander","20 dried chillies","6 garlic cloves, grated","100ml olive oil","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp caraway seeds","2 tsp smoked paprika","2 tbsp red wine vinegar"]','["If you’re making the harissa, tip the dried chillies into a heatproof bowl and pour over just enough boiled water from thekettleto cover. Cover the bowl and leave to cool. Once cool enough to handle, drain the chillies, reserving the water. Remove any stalks and pat dry with kitchen paper. Tip the chillies into afood processorwith the garlic, 1 tsp salt, the olive oil, spices and vinegar, and blitz to a purée. If needed, add a little of the reserved water to loosen.Will keep, chilled, for up to a month.","Make 15 cuts, about 3-5cm long, all over the lamb. Reserve 1 tbsp of the harissa paste, then rub the rest all over the lamb and into the cuts. Scatter the onions into a largeroasting tinand sit the lamb on top. Leave at room temperature for 1 hr, or cover and chill overnight.","Heat the oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 2. Roast the lamb for 4-5 hrs until the meat is fork-tender. Lift the lamb out onto a large board or serving plate. If the tin is flameproof, pour in the stock; if not, tip the contents of the tin into a saucepan first. Bring to the boil, scrape up any browned bits using a wooden spoon, and cook until the liquid is reduced by about a third – it should be a thick, rich onion gravy. Stir in the reserved harissa and the chopped coriander. Serve the lamb with the onion gravy."]','2026-01-10 12:24:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9377,9377,'en','Self-saucing sticky toffee chocolate pudding','Combine sticky toffee pudding sponge with a generous helping of chocolate chunks and chocolate sauce for the ultimate comforting dessert.','["200g pitted medjool dates","100g unsalted butter, softened, plus extra for the dish","75g demerara sugar","75g dark brown soft sugar","2 large eggs","250g plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1 tbsp baking powder","100g dark chocolate, roughly chopped","vanilla ice cream or custard, to serve","200ml double cream","75g unsalted butter, cubed","200g dark brown soft sugar","30g cocoa powder"]','["Put the dates in a bowl and pour in 300ml boiling water. Leave to soak for 30 mins. Meanwhile, make the sauce by tipping all the ingredients, a big pinch of salt and 300ml boiling water into a pan, thenwhiskover a medium heat and simmer for 2 mins. Pour into a jug and leave to cool slightly. Once the dates are soaked, use ahand blenderto blitz the dates and water until you have smooth paste. Leave to cool slightly. Butter a deep 35 x 25cm dish.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Beat together the butter and sugar for 3 mins until smooth. Add the eggs, one at a time, beating between each addition. Fold in the flour, bicarb and baking powder along with a pinch of salt. Once combined, mix in the date purée, then fold in the dark chocolate. Pour the sponge batter into the prepared dish and spread out evenly using the back of a spoon. Pour the chocolate sauce evenly over the top of the batter.","Bake in the oven for 30-35 mins until risen, then leave to rest for 2 mins. Serve warm with a big scoop of ice cream or warm custard."]','2026-01-10 12:24:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9378,9378,'en','Vegan date & chocolate bread & butter pudding','Use soya milk to make this delicious vegan bread pudding. Dates, cinnamon and vanilla all bring sweetness, so you don’t need to add lots of sugar','["3 tbsp cornflour","500ml Alpro Soya Original","½ tsp ground cinnamon","½ lemon, zested","½ tbsp vanilla bean paste","2 tbsp maple or agave syrup","flavourless oil (such as vegetable oil), for the dish","6-8 slices stale vegan white bloomer, halved into triangles","4 medjool dates, pitted and finely sliced","50g vegan dark chocolate chips","Alpro Plain Yogurt, to serve (optional)"]','["Mix the cornflour, Alpro Soya Original, cinnamon, lemon zest, vanilla and maple syrup together in a pan andwhiskuntil smooth. Set over a low heat and cook, whisking continuously, for 8-10 mins until the mixture has thickened slightly to a thin custard that just coats the back of a spoon.","Lightly oil roughly 20 x 25cm wide baking dish. Cut the crusts off the bread, if you like, and arrange in the dish, overlapping slightly. Stir most of the dates into the custard, then pour over the bread, pressing the bread into the mixture gently with the back of a spoon to help it absorb the liquid. Leave to soak for 15 mins.","Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Scatter the chocolate chips and remaining sliced dates over the bread pudding, and bake for 20-25 mins until golden and crisp at the edges. Leave to rest for 10 mins before serving with a spoonful of Alpro Plain Yogurt or dairy-free ice cream, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:24:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9379,9379,'en','Azerbaijani-style lamb with apricots & chestnuts','Make this lamb stew ahead and freeze for busy days, or for when you’re entertaining. With apricots, chestnuts and spices, it’s beautifully aromatic','["pinch of saffron","2 tbsp sunflower or groundnut oil","800g braising lamb (such as shoulder), trimmed of excess fat","2 large onions, roughly chopped","4 plum tomatoes, roughly chopped","2 garlic cloves, chopped","½ tsp ground cinnamon","½ tsp allspice","250ml lamb or chicken stock","100g dried apricots","125g cooked chestnuts (canned or vacuum-packed)","½ lemon, juiced","½ tsp sumac","15g coriander, leaves picked and roughly chopped"]','["Put the saffron in a heatproof cup and pour over 75ml boiling water. Leave for 30 mins, or until the water is a deep yellow colour.","Heat the oil in a heavy-bottomedsaucepan, and brown the lamb all over – you’ll need to do this in batches. Transfer the browned lamb to a bowl using a slotted spoon as you continue cooking the rest.","Fry the onions in the residual fat in the pan over a medium-low heat for 10-12 mins until golden and soft. Add the tomatoes and garlic, and continue to fry until the tomatoes have softened. Stir in the spices and cook for a few minutes, then return the lamb to the pan with some seasoning. Pour in the stock and infused saffron water. Bring to just under the boil, then add the apricots, chestnuts, and a little more seasoning. Reduce the heat to a simmer, cover and cook over a very low heat for 1 hr-1 hr 15 mins until the lamb is tender.At this stage, the lamb can be frozen. Leave to cool completely first, then transfer to a freezer proof airtight container. Will keep in the freezer for up to three months.","To serve straightaway, stir in the lemon juice, sumac and coriander. Alternatively, if you have frozen the lamb, defrost in the fridge overnight, then transfer to a saucepan and heat gently. When it is piping hot, add the lemon juice, sumac and coriander. Taste to check for seasoning, then serve."]','2026-01-10 12:24:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9380,9380,'en','Carrot and orange smoothie','Start your day with a vibrant orange and carrot smoothie for breakfast. With added oats and ginger, it will give you vitamin C and count towards your 5-a-day','["2 medium carrots, peeled and roughly chopped or grated depending on your blender","2 oranges, peeled","2cm piece of ginger, grated","2 tbsp oats","100g ice"]','["Tip all the ingredients into a blender or smoothie maker and blitz until smooth, adding 150ml water if it’s too thick – alter the consistency to your liking."]','2026-01-10 12:24:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9381,9381,'en','Slow cooker sticky toffee pudding','Leave our slow cooker sticky pudding to cook all day so it’s ready to serve in the evening with ice cream. Rich and indulgent, it’s the ultimate comforting dessert','["250g pitted dates, chopped","100g butter, plus extra for the basin","4 tbsp treacle","1 tsp vanilla extract","250g light brown soft sugar","300ml double cream","2 eggs, lightly beaten","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","vanilla ice cream, to serve"]','["Put the dates in a heatproof bowl, cover with 150ml boiling water, and leave to soak for 30 mins. Butter a 1-litre pudding basin and line the base with baking parchment.","Tip half the butter, half the treacle, the vanilla, 75g of the sugar and the cream into a pan set over a medium heat. Cook for 4-5 mins, stirring, until the sugar dissolves. Turn up the heat, bubble for 3 mins, thenwhiskin a pinch of salt. Pour a third of the sauce into the basin.","Beat the remaining butter, treacle, sugar and the eggs together, then fold in the flour, bicarb, ¼ tsp salt, the dates and their soaking liquid. Spoon into the basin and smooth the surface, leaving a 1cm gap from the top. Cover with a double layer of baking parchment and foil, making a pleat in the middle so the pud can expand. Secure with kitchen string.","Set theslow cookerto low. Sit the basin inside, then add boiling water so it comes halfway up the basin. Cover and cook for 7-8 hrs. Run a knife around the edge of the pudding and turn out onto a plate. Reheat the remaining sauce and pour over. Serve with ice cream."]','2026-01-10 12:24:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9382,9382,'en','Chai teabags','Fill teabags with spices and tea leaves for a gorgeous bespoke gift. They’re a lovely present at Ramadan','["18 cardamom pods, cracked","2 tbsp ground ginger","1 tbsp ground cinnamon","½  tbsp ground black pepper","½ nutmeg, grated","¼ tsp ground cloves","150g black assam tea leaves"]','["Toast the cardamom pods, ginger, cinnamon, pepper, nutmeg, and cloves in a dry frying pan for 1 min.","Mix the spices in a bowl with the tea leaves, then fill 18 empty teabags with the mixture and seal. Package with serving instructions: To make a chai latte, brew 1 teabag in 200ml boiled whole or coconut milk for 5 mins, then sweeten with honey to taste. Or, simply brew with boiling water. Will keep in a sealed jar for six months."]','2026-01-10 12:24:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9383,9383,'en','Moroccan chicken with fennel & olives','Get four of your 5-a-day with our healthy chicken tagine using fennel and olives. Serve with wholewheat couscous','["½  lemon","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 large onion, finely chopped","1 fennel bulb, halved and thinly sliced, fronds reserved","thumb-sized piece ginger, finely chopped","2 large garlic cloves, chopped","4 skinless chicken thigh fillets, halved and any fat trimmed","½  tsp turmeric","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","400ml hot vegetable stock, made with 2 tsp bouillon powder","2 tomatoes, cut into wedges","6 Kalamata or green olives, pitted and halved","generous handful coriander, chopped, plus extra to serve","70g wholewheat couscous","400g can chickpeas, drained and rinsed"]','["Squeeze the lemon over a bowl and set the bowl aside. Cut the lemon in two, remove the pith from one half and chop the rind.","Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan and fry the onion, fennel, ginger and garlic until soft. Add the chicken and fry for a few mins more until just browned.","Add the lemon rind and spices, then pour in the stock. Cover and simmer for 25 mins, then add the tomatoes, olives, coriander and half the lemon juice. Cook for 5 mins more until the fennel and chicken are tender and the sauce reduced.","Meanwhile, cook the couscous following pack instructions and stir in the chickpeas. Add more lemon juice to taste, then serve the tagine with the couscous, extra coriander and fennel fronds."]','2026-01-10 12:24:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9384,9384,'en','Halloumi & quinoa fattoush','With griddled halloumi, toasted pitta pieces, grains, tomatoes, dill and mint, this Middle Eastern-inspired salad makes a speedy and satisfying lunch for four','["2 brown pittas, torn into pieces","5 tbsp olive oil","2 lemons, juiced","1 garlic clove, crushed","250g block halloumi, sliced","250g microwavable pouch quinoa","350g medium tomatoes, quartered","1 large cucumber, halved, deseeded and sliced","4 spring onions, sliced","½ small bunch mint, chopped","½ small bunch dill, roughly chopped"]','["Heat the grill to high. Toss the pitta pieces with 1 tbsp oil and spread out onto a baking sheet. Grill for 3-4 mins, turning halfway, until golden and crisp. Set aside to cool.","Meanwhile, whisk together the remaining oil with the lemon juice and garlic, then season. Heat a large griddle pan or non-stick frying pan over a high heat and cook the halloumi for 1-2 mins on each side or until lightly charred.","Cook the quinoa following pack instructions, leave to cool, then toss with the tomatoes, cucumber, spring onion, most of the fresh herbs and the dressing. Season to taste. Tip onto a serving plate and top with the halloumi, pitta and remaining herbs."]','2026-01-10 12:24:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9385,9385,'en','Special lamb biryani','Classically, Indian biryani is cooked in a ‘dum’, a clay pot sealed with dough. Try this lamb version with a pastry lid that releases the aromas when you break into it','["500g lamb neckor shoulder, chopped into small chunks","3 tbsp Indian spice mix, plus a pinch (see below)","100g yogurt, plus extra to serve","½  lemon, juiced","3 tbsp vegetable oil","2 large onions, halved and sliced","300g basmati rice","4 garlic cloves, crushed","thumb-sized piece ginger, peeled and finely chopped","4 plum tomatoes, chopped or 200g can chopped tomatoes","good pinch saffron","100g butter","2 cinnamon sticks","6 cardamom pods","4 bay or 6 curry leaves","2 star anise","320g sheet ready-rolled puff pastry","1 egg, beaten","2 tsp nigella seeds","handful chopped corianderor mint","1 red onion, halved and thinly sliced","2 tbsp coriander seeds","2 tbsp cumin seeds","1 tbsp sweet paprika","2 tsp mild chilli powder(kashmiri chilli powder if you can find it)","2 tsp fenugreek seeds","3 whole cloves","1 tsp fennel seeds","1 tsp ground turmeric","10 cardamom pods, seeds removed and pods discarded"]','["Mix the lamb with the spice blend, yogurt, lemon juice and a pinch of salt. Leave at room temperature for at least 30 mins or chill overnight.","Heat 2 tbsp oil in a large frying pan and cook the onions over a low-medium heat for 15-20 mins until caramelised. Meanwhile, rinse the rice three times under cold water. Drain, then cover with fresh water and leave for 30 mins.","Transfer the onions to a bowl, add the remaining oil to the pan and brown the lamb in batches. If the marinade starts to catch, scrape it from the bottom of the pan and keep stirring – it’ll add to the flavour. Tip the meat back into the pan with the garlic and ginger. Cook for another minute or 2, then add the tomatoes and 200ml water (swill the water around the dish the lamb was marinating in to pick up all the marinade before adding it to the pan). Season with salt and bring to a gentle simmer. Cover and cook for 45 mins, stirring now and then and topping up with a splash of water if the sauce is catching. You can now chill the lamb for up to two days.","Pour away the rice water, cover with fresh water and season. Bring to the boil, bubble for 2 mins, then drain and leave to cool. Put the saffron in a bowl, pour over 50ml boiling water and leave for 10 mins to steep.","Smear 50g butter inside a casserole dish. Sprinkle over a little of the Indian spice mix and some salt. To assemble the biryani, start with 1/3 of the lamb, top with 1/3 of the rice, 1/3 of the onions, a cinnamon stick, a couple of cardamom pods, a few bay or curry leaves and a star anise. Repeat until all of the ingredients have been used up. Spoon the saffron and its water over the final layer of rice, dot with the remaining butter and season with salt. You can now chill it for up to 24 hrs.","Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Unroll the pastry and cut into a circle a little larger than the dish. Brush a little egg around the outside lip of the dish, then lift the pastry on top, pressing it around the edge to seal. Brush with more egg and sprinkle with nigella seeds. Bake for 45-50 mins until golden brown. Mix the herbs and onion, and serve with the biryani and extra yogurt."]','2026-01-10 12:24:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9386,9386,'en','Chicken tagine with lemons, olives & pomegranate','Cook a one-pot chicken tagine the whole family will love. It somehow says summer and autumn in one bite using a gentle but heady Moroccan spice mix','["2 tbsp olive oil","8 chicken thighs","1 onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves","2 tbsp Moroccan spice mix(see below)","1 large or 2 small preserved lemons, skin only, finely chopped","2 large tomatoes, chopped","1 chicken stock cube","1 tbsp honey","1 tbsp red wine vinegar","handful olives","1 small lemon, ½  very thinly sliced","½  pomegranate, seeds only","100g feta, crumbled","small bunch mint, leaves only","couscous, to serve","2 tbsp coriander seeds","1 tbsp cumin seeds","1½  tsp fennel seeds","½  tsp black pepper","¼ tsp ground ginger","1 tsp ground cinnamon","good pinch saffron"]','["Heat 1 tbsp oil in a wide, shallow casserole dish or ovenproof pan. Season the chicken and cook, skin-side down, for 8-10 mins, until crispy. Flip over and cook for another 5 mins. Transfer to a plate. Heat oven to 170C/150C fan/gas 3.","Add the rest of the oil and the onion to the pan. Stir for a few mins, then add the garlic and Moroccan spice mix. Stir, scraping any bits of onions and chicken from the bottom, until the spices smell fragrant. Add the preserved lemon, tomatoes, stock cube, honey, vinegar and 750ml water. Bring to the boil, then place the chicken on top. Cover with a lid or foil and transfer to the oven for 1 hr.","Uncover, place the olives and lemon slices on top and drizzle the lemons with a little oil. Return to the oven for 20 mins, or until the sauce has reduced a little (you can do this on the hob if you’re short on time). Check the seasoning, adding a squeeze of lemon, more honey or salt if you think it needs it. Scatter over the pomegranate seeds, feta and mint, and serve with couscous."]','2026-01-10 12:24:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9387,9387,'en','Hummus with pistachio lamb meatballs','Transform simple shop-bought hummus with these fabulous meatballs, topped with pistachios and mint. This takes just 15 minutes to make, yet tastes so decadent','["250g lamb mince","½ a small bunch of mint, plus a few mint leaves to garnish","30g pistachios, plus a few extra to garnish","1 lemon, zested","1 tbsp oil","200g tub plain hummus","30g feta, crumbled"]','["Put the lamb mince, mint and pistachios in a food processor. Roughly pulse to combine, then add the lemon zest and season generously with salt and pepper. Shape into eight meatballs.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan. Fry the meatballs for 8-10 mins, turning so that they become evenly browned. Spread the hummus onto a plate. Top with the meatballs, a few mint leaves, the crumbled feta, some chopped pistachios and a squeeze of lemon juice."]','2026-01-10 12:24:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9388,9388,'en','Slow cooker lamb tagine','Cook something hearty and exotic for the family when it’s cold outside, like our lamb tagine. If you can’t get dried cherries, use apricots or prunes instead','["900g lamb shoulder, neck or leg, cut into chunks","1 tbsp olive oil","1 onion, chopped","3 carrots, cut into chunks","2 tsp ras-el-hanout","1 tsp ground cumin","1 tbsp tomato purée","1 chicken or lamb stock cube or stock pot","1 sweet potato, cut into chunks","30g dried cherries","½  tsp honey","½  bunch coriander, chopped","couscous, to serve"]','["Fry the lamb in the oil in batches and tip it into the slow cooker. Fry the onion in the same pan for 5 mins or until it softens a little. Add the carrots and spices, stir everything together, add the tomato purée, stock and 250ml water and swirl everything around the pan. Tip into the slow cooker. Add the sweet potato, dried cherries, honey and another 500ml water.","Cook on low for 8 hrs or high for 4 hrs. Stir in the coriander and serve with couscous. Leave to cool before freezing."]','2026-01-10 12:24:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9389,9389,'en','Lamb biryani','Make this classic Indian dish and ensure deliciously moist lamb with paneer, rice and spinach, all spiced to perfection. Great for casual entertaining','["400g lamb neck, cut into small cubes","4 garlic cloves, grated","1 tbsp finely grated ginger","1 tbsp sunflower oil","1 large onion, chopped","1 tbsp cumin seeds","1 tbsp nigella seeds","1 tbsp Madras spice paste","200g basmati rice, rinsed well","8 curry leaves","400ml good-quality lamb or chicken stock","100g paneer, chopped","200g spinach, cooked and water squeezed out","chopped coriander","sliced green chillies","plain yogurt"]','["Toss the lamb in a bowl with the garlic, ginger and a large pinch of salt. Marinate in the fridge overnight or for at least a couple of hours.","Heat the oil in a casserole. Fry the lamb for 5-10 mins until starting to brown. Add the onion, cumin seeds and nigella seeds, and cook for 5 mins until starting to soften. Stir in the curry paste, then cook for 1 min more. Scatter in the rice and curry leaves, then pour over the stock and bring to the boil. Meanwhile, heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.","Stir in the paneer, spinach and some seasoning. Cover the dish with a tight lid of foil, then put the lid on to ensure it’s well sealed. Cook in the oven for 20 mins, then leave to stand, covered, for 10 mins. Bring the dish to the table, remove the lid and foil, scatter with the coriander and chillies and serve with yogurt on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:24:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9390,9390,'en','Butternut biryani with cucumber raita','Cook our healthy veggie curry using dried mushrooms, spices and butternut squash. It contains three of your 5-a-day along with calcium, iron and fibre','["20g dried porcini mushrooms, roughly chopped","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","2 onions, sliced (160g)","2 garlic cloves, shredded","1 tbsp chopped fresh ginger","1 red chilli, deseeded and chopped","85g brown basmati rice","160g diced butternut squash (prepared weight)","1 tsp cumin seeds","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp vegetable bouillon","10cm length cucumber, grated, core removed","125g bio yogurt","2 tbsp chopped mint, plus a few leaves","one third of a pack fresh coriander, chopped","25g toasted flaked almonds"]','["Pour 425ml boiling water over the dried mushrooms and set aside.","Heat the oil in a non-stick pan. Add the onions, garlic, ginger and chilli and stir-fry briefly over a high heat so they start to soften. Add the rice and squash and stir for a few mins. Tip in the cumin and coriander then stir in the mushrooms and their water with the bouillon.","Cover the pan and simmer for 20 mins until the rice is tender. Meanwhile mix the cucumber and yogurt with the mint to make a raita. Stir the coriander and almonds into the rice when it is ready and serve with the raita and a few extra leaves of mint or coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:24:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9391,9391,'en','Lamb & squash biryani with cucumber raita','Cook our healthy lamb curry with butternut squash for a tasty, filling dinner. It’s low-calorie, rich in iron and provides three of your 5-a-day','["4 lean lamb steaks (about 400g), trimmed of all fat, cut into chunks","2 garlic cloves, finely grated","8 tsp chopped fresh ginger","3 tsp ground coriander","4 tsp rapeseed oil","4 onions, sliced","2 red chillies, deseeded and chopped","170g brown basmati rice","320g diced butternut squash","2 tsp cumin seeds","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","20cm length cucumber, grated","100ml bio yogurt","4 tbsp chopped mint, plus a few extra leaves","handful coriander, chopped"]','["Mix the lamb with the garlic, 2 tsp chopped ginger and 1 tsp ground coriander and set aside.","Heat 2 tsp oil in a non-stick pan. Add the onions, the remaining ginger and chilli and stir-fry briefly over a high heat so they start to soften. Add the rice and squash and stir over the heat for a few mins. Tip in all the remaining spices, then stir in 500ml boiling water and the bouillon. Cover the pan and simmer for 20 mins.","Meanwhile, mix the cucumber, yogurt and mint together in a bowl to make a raita. Chill half for later.","About 5 mins before the rice is ready, heat the remaining oil in a non-stick frying pan, add the lamb and stir for a few mins until browned but still nice tender. Toss into the spiced rice with the coriander and serve with the raita and a few mint or coriander leaves on top."]','2026-01-10 12:24:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9392,9392,'en','Egyptian egg salad','Give salad a shake-up with an Egyptian-inspired recipe that combines fava beans with egg and the rich flavours of tahini, garlic, lemon and cumin','["2 large eggs","1 lemon, juiced","1 tbsp tahini","1 tbsp rapeseed oil","1 red onion, chopped","3 large garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tsp ground cumin","½  tsp cumin seeds","400g can borlotti or fava beans, juice reserved","2 Little Gem lettuces cut into wedges","2 tomatoes, cut into wedges","sprinkling of dried chilli flakes and roughly chopped flat-leaf parsley, optional"]','["Bring a pan of water to the boil, lower in the eggs and boil for 8 mins. Drain and run under the cold tap to cool them a little, then peel and halve. Meanwhile, mix 1 tbsp lemon juice and 3 tbsp water with the tahini to make a dressing.","Heat the oil and fry the onion and garlic for 5 mins to soften them. Add the ground cumin and seeds, stir briefly then add the beans and lightly crush some of them as you heat them, adding some of the juice from the can to get a nice creamy consistency but keeping whole beans, too. Taste and add lemon juice and just a little seasoning if you need to.","Spoon the beans on to plates with the lettuce, then add the eggs and tomatoes, with the tahini dressing, chilli and parsley, if using."]','2026-01-10 12:24:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9393,9393,'en','Butternut squash & chickpea tagine','Make this tasty vegetarian tagine that kids will love as much as grown-ups. It’s a great way to serve four of their five-a-day and it’s freezeable','["1 tbsp oil","1 red onion, finely chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tsp grated ginger","½  tsp ground cumin","1 tsp ground coriander","1 tsp cinnamon","¼ tsp mild chilli powder","500g bag frozen butternut squash chunks","2 carrots, cut into small dice","1 courgette, cut into small dice","2 x 400g cans chopped tomatoes","1 x 400g can chickpeas, drained","cooked couscous or rice, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a heavy-based pan, then slowly cook the onions for around 10 mins until starting to caramelise. Stir in the garlic, ginger and spices and cook for a further 2 mins. Add the vegetables and canned tomatoes and bring to a simmer. Put the lid on and simmer for around 15 mins or until all the veg are tender. Stir in the chickpeas, heat through and serve with couscous or rice."]','2026-01-10 12:24:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9394,9394,'en','Spiced koftas with honey & chickpeas','Spiced lamb koftas are a great budget option for a simple family meal. Serve with a drizzle of the creamy yogurt dressing, and baked chickpeas','["1 ½  tsp fennel seeds","500g lamb mince","1 ½  tbsp ras el hanout","2 tbsp pine nuts, toasted and roughly chopped","2 x 40g cans chickpeas, drained and rinsed","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tbsp honey","80g Greek yogurt","2 tbsp tahini","1 lemon, ½  juiced, ½  cut into wedges to serve","25g parsley, roughly chopped, to serve"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Using a pestle and morter, crush the fennel seeds. In a large bowl, combine the crushed seeds, lamb, ras el hanout and pine nuts, and season well. Divide the mixture into eight equal egg-shaped koftas.","Tip the chickpeas into an ovenproof dish, season to taste and put in the oven while you fry the koftas. Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a frying pan over a medium heat. Add the koftas and gently fry for 5 mins, turning from time to time, until evenly browned. Remove from the pan with a slotted spoon and set aside on a plate.","Remove the chickpeas from the oven, add the koftas to the dish, then pour over the rest of the oil and the honey, and return to the oven for 15 mins.","In a bowl, combine the yogurt, tahini and lemon juice with 70-100ml water and season well. Serve the koftas and chickpeas topped with parsley and a good drizzle of the creamy dressing, with the lemon wedges on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:24:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9395,9395,'en','Spiced lamb pie','This stunning filo pastry pie is a twist on a lamb tagine. A hearty main meal that wouldn’t look out of place on any dinner-party table','["3 tbsp vegetable oil","800g lamb shoulder, fat removed, diced","3 tbsp plain flour","1 large onion, chopped","2 garlic cloves, crushed","1 tbsp ras el hanout","2 tsp ground coriander","2 tsp ground cumin","good pinch of ground cloves","good pinch of saffron (optional)","1 cinnamon stick","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 lemon, zested and juiced","1 tbsp honey","4 tbsp pomegranate molasses","270g pack filo pastry (4-6 sheets)","50g butter, melted","50g flaked almonds","50g pomegranate seeds"]','["Heat the oil in a large flameproof casserole dish. Toss the lamb in the flour with some seasoning, then brown it in the dish. Do this in batches so you don’t overcrowd the dish (which will cause the meat to steam instead of fry). Take your time to build up a deep brown colour, which will add lots of meaty flavour to the stew. Set the meat aside on a plate as you go.","Add the remaining oil to the dish along with the onion and garlic. Cook for 5 mins until softened, then stir in the spices, tomatoes, lemon zest and juice, honey and molasses. Fill the tomato can halfway with water, swill around and add this too. Season well, bring to a simmer and cover with a lid. Reduce the heat and cook for 2 hrs 30 mins-3 hrs or until the meat is tender. Leave to cool.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Transfer the meat to a pie dish that’s about 25cm wide, or leave it in the casserole if it’s wide enough to fit the topping. Unwrap the filo and brush a sheet with butter, scrunch up and place on top of the pie. Continue with the remaining sheets until the tagine is covered. Drizzle any remaining butter over the top and scatter over the almonds, then bake for 45 mins or until the pastry is crisp and golden. Scatter over the pomegranate seeds just before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:24:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9396,9396,'en','Baked feta with sumac & grapes','A modern dinner party starter that’s great for a budget – salty feta, sweet grapes, tangy sumac and aniseed dill create contrasting yet complementary flavours','["1 small red onion, halved and sliced","2 tbsp red wine vinegar","1 tsp golden caster sugar","350g red grapes, left on the vine in small bunches","2 tbsp olive oil","2 tsp sumac","½  small pack dill, chopped","2 x 250g blocks feta","bread or sesame flatbreads, to serve (optional)"]','["Put the red onion in a bowl and add the vinegar, sugar and a pinch of salt. Massage everything together with your fingers for 1 min – this will slightly pickle the onions. Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Scrunch up a sheet of baking parchment and use to line a gratin dish. Add the grapes, drizzle over 1 tbsp olive oil, 1 tsp sumac, most of the dill and some seasoning, then toss everything to coat. Nestle the blocks of feta in among the grapes, then scatter over the onions and any of the pickling vinegar, the remaining oil and sumac. You can now leave in the fridge for up to 24 hrs, or bake straight away.","Bake for 30-35 mins until the feta is browning and the grapes look juicy. Scatter over the remaining dill, then serve in the middle of the table with bread for scooping up the cheese, grapes and juices."]','2026-01-10 12:24:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9397,9397,'en','Roasted roots fattoush','We’ve given this classic Middle Eastern bread salad a winter makeover with good-value roasted root veg and a rich, brown-butter yogurt dressing','["2 turnips, peeled and cut into wedges","4 parsnips, peeled and cut into quarters lengthways","1 swede, peeled and cut into wedges","2 tbsp dukkah, plus extra for sprinkling","4 tbsp olive oil","3 pitta breads","½  tbsp sumac","large pack parsley, roughly chopped","small pack mint, leaves picked and roughly chopped","1 red chilli, thinly sliced, deseeded if you don''t like it too hot","100g pomegranate seeds","75g butter","1 lemon, juiced","200g natural yogurt"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Toss the root veg in the dukkah and 2 tbsp oil and season well. Divide between two baking trays and roast for 1 hr until soft and beginning to char.","Meanwhile, tear the pittas into pieces and coat in sumac, the remaining oil, and some seasoning. Put on a baking tray, roast for 15 mins until golden and crisp, then set aside.","For the dressing, melt the butter in a saucepan over a low heat and cook slowly until nut-brown, about 8 mins. Immediately pour in the lemon juice and leave to cool. Once cool, stir in the yogurt.","Assemble the roasted veg on a sharing platter with the herbs and pitta, then scatter over the chilli and pomegranate seeds. Drizzle over some of the dressing, and serve the remainder on the side."]','2026-01-10 12:24:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9398,9398,'en','Spicy meatball tagine with bulgur & chickpeas','Who knew meatballs could be 4 of your 5-a-day? This healthy tagine is full of flavour and low on fat, just make sure you choose a lean mince with 5% fat','["2 onions, 1 quartered, 1 halved and sliced","2 tbsp tomato purée","2 garlic cloves","1 egg","1 tbsp chilli powder","500g pack extra-lean beef mince","2 tsp rapeseed oil","4 large carrots, cut into batons","1 tsp ground cumin","2 tsp ground coriander","400g can chopped tomatoes","1 lemon, zest removed with a potato peeler, then chopped","12 Kalamata olives, chopped","1 tbsp vegetable bouillon powder","? pack fresh coriander, chopped","200g bulghar wheat","400g can chickpeas","2 tsp vegetable bouillon powder","2 tsp ground coriander"]','["Put the quartered onion in the food processor and process to finely chop it. Add the minced beef, 1 tbsp tomato purée, the garlic, egg and chilli powder and blitz to make a smoothish paste. Divide the mixture into 26 even-sized pieces and roll into balls.","Heat the oil in a large frying pan and cook the meatballs for about 5-10 mins to lightly brown them. Tip from the pan onto a plate.","Now add the sliced onion and carrots to the pan and stir fry briefly in the pan juices to soften them a little. Add the spices and pour in the tomatoes with 1 ½ cans of water then stir in the chopped lemon zest, remaining tomato purée, olives and bouillon powder. Return the meatballs to the pan then cover and cook for 15 mins until the carrots are just tender. Stir in the coriander.","While the tagine is cooking, tip the bulghar into a pan with the chickpeas and water from the can. Add 2 cans of water, the bouillon and coriander. Cover and cook for 10 mins until the bulghar is tender and the liquid had been absorbed. Serve half with half of the tagine and chill the remainder for another night if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:24:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9399,9399,'en','Chicken tagine with spiced Brussels sprouts & feta','Joe Wicks’ tasty sprout recipe balances earthy, sweet and spicy flavours, using tender chicken thighs, chickpeas and cheese for a hearty festive stew','["1 ½  tbsp coconut oil","1 large red onion, sliced","1 red pepper, finely sliced","3 garlic cloves, finely chopped","10 chicken thigh fillets (boneless and skinless)","½  tsp ground cinnamon","½  tsp ground turmeric","½  tsp smoked paprika","1 tbsp tomato purée","250ml chicken stock","6 dried apricots, cut in half","175g canned chickpeas, drained and rinsed","½  tsp cumin seeds","275g Brussels sprouts, shredded","50g feta","½  small bunch coriander, roughly chopped"]','["Heat 1 tbsp of the coconut oil in a large flameproof casserole dish over a medium heat. When melted and hot, add the onion, pepper and garlic. Cook, stirring regularly, for 3 -4 mins or until just starting to soften. Increase the heat to maximum and add the chicken thighs. Fry everything together for about 3 mins, stirring occasionally.","Sprinkle in the spices, squeeze in the tomato purée and fry, stirring almost constantly, for 1 min. Pour in the stock and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to a simmer and partially cover with a lid. After 30 mins, add the dried apricots and chickpeas, and continue to simmer for a further 10 mins.","While the tagine is bubbling away, heat the remaining 1/ 2 tbsp of coconut oil in a frying pan over a high heat. When melted, add the cumin seeds, toast for 10 secs, then add the shredded sprouts. Fry the sprouts over the high heat, stirring almost constantly, for 5 mins, by which time they should have softened and browned in places.","Serve the tagine in a large bowl, scatter over the fried sprouts, crumble over the feta and finish with the coriander."]','2026-01-10 12:24:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9400,9400,'en','Lamb & cranberry tagine','This is a fragrant onepot that lets your oven do all the hard work. If you’re Christmas entertaining, serve up this succulent lamb with couscous and yogurt','["1½ kg lamb shoulder, trimmed of excess fat, then cubed","1 tbsp ground cumin","1 tbsp coriander","1 tsp sweet paprika","1 tsp hot paprika","3 tbsp olive oil","2 large red onions, sliced into half moons","4 garlic cloves, finely chopped","2 cinnamon sticks, broken in half","6 cardamom pods, lightly crushed","400g can chopped tomatoes","2 tbsp honey","200g fresh or frozen cranberries","50g shelled pistachios, toasted and roughly chopped, to serve","natural yogurt, handful mint leaves and couscous, to serve"]','["At least 3 hrs before (or preferably a day), toss the lamb with half the cumin, coriander, sweet and hot paprika in a large bowl. Cover and leave in the fridge to infuse.","Heat oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3. Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large flameproof casserole dish over a high heat and season the spiced lamb well. Working in batches, fry until completely brown, then set aside. Add more of the oil as you need it and get some deep colour on the meat – this will add to the flavour of the tagine.","Once the lamb is browned, pour any remaining oil into the dish,reduce the heat to medium and add the onions, garlic and remaining ground spices. Cook for 5 mins until softened, then stir in the cinnamon sticks and cardamom pods. Return the lamb to the dish along with the tomatoes, plus 1 /2 a can of water and the honey. Bring to the boil, season, cover with a lid and put in the oven for 2 hrs 15 mins.","Bring the tagine out of the oven, give it a good stir and tip in the cranberries. Return to the oven, with the lid off, for a further 15 mins until the lamb is completely tender.","Taste the tagine for seasoning and remove the cinnamon sticks and cardamom pods. Scatter over the pistachios, yogurt and mint leaves, then serve out of the dish at the table with couscous."]','2026-01-10 12:24:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9401,9401,'en','Nutty baklava','Our version of this syrup-soaked pastry is gently spiced with cinnamon and cardamom, and has a blend of pecans, pistachios and walnuts','["200g butter, plus extra for greasing","200g pistachios","50g walnuts","50g pecans","3 tbsp honey","2 x 270g pack filo pastry","250g golden caster sugar","50g honey","2 tsp orange blossom water","½  tsp ground cinnamon","¼ tsp ground cardamom (from 3 pods)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and grease a 21cm x 21cm square cake tin with butter. Chop the nuts into small pieces using a food processor, taking care not to blitz them to a paste. Put them into a bowl, stir in the honey and a pinch of salt and set aside.","Melt the butter in a pan over a low heat. Cut the first pack of filo pastry sheets in half (so that they fit the tin). Put one sheet in the tin and brush with the melted butter. Lay another sheet on top and brush with butter again, keep layering like this until the whole pack is used up.","Spread the honey and nut mixture over the pastry and press it down lightly with the back of a spoon. Open the other pack of filo, cut in half and continue the layering and buttering process. When you reach the last sheet pour any remaining butter over the top to finish. Use a sharp knife to cut deep lines into the pastry to create either squares or diamond shapes then bake in the oven for 20 mins.","Reduce the heat to 150C/130C fan/gas 2 and bake for a further 45 mins. While the baklava cooks put all the syrup ingredients into a saucepan and add 200ml water. Heat gently until the sugar has dissolved then boil the mixture for 8-10 mins or until it has reduced to the consistency of runny honey.","When the baklava comes out of the oven, pour the warm syrup over the top, allowing it to run into the lines you have cut. Leave it to soak in and serve when it’s completely cold."]','2026-01-10 12:24:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9402,9402,'en','Chicken fattoush','This healthy Middle Eastern salad topped with sumac-sprinkled pitta bread is a quick and easy lunch or supper','["juice 2 lemons","2 tbsp olive oil","1 Cos lettuce, chopped","2 tomatoes, chopped into chunks","small pack flat-leaf parsley, chopped","½  cucumber, chopped into chunks","200g pack cooked chicken pieces (or leftover cooked chicken)","2 spring onions, sliced","2 pitta breads","1-2 tsp ground sumac"]','["Pour the lemon juice into a large bowl and whisk while you slowly add the oil. When all the oil has been added and the mixture starts to thicken, season.","Add the lettuce, tomatoes, parsley, cucumber, chicken pieces and spring onions, and stir well to coat the salad in the dressing.","Put the pitta breads in the toaster until crisp and golden, then chop into chunks. Scatter the toasted pitta pieces over the salad and sprinkle over the sumac. Serve straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:24:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9403,9403,'en','Rose baklava','Serve sweet, sticky squares of this cinnamon and almond-filled pastry as a light dessert to end a Greek dinner party or Sunday roast','["Greek yogurt, to serve","300g golden caster sugar","juice ½  lemon","4 tbsp rosewater (not concentrated, see tip)","1 large cinnamon stick","75ml olive oil","500g chopped almonds","75g golden caster sugar","2 tbsp ground cinnamon","½  tsp ground cloves","250g-270g pack filo pastry sheets","150ml rosewater (not concentrated, see tip)"]','["Put all the ingredients for the syrup in a heavy-based saucepan, and add 400ml cold water. Stir over a gentle heat to dissolve the sugar, then bring to a steady simmer for 10 mins or until it becomes slightly syrupy. Leave to cool.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4. Lightly brush the sides and base of a 23 x 33cm shallow ovenproof dish with a little of the oil.","For the baklava, mix together the almonds, sugar, cinnamon, cloves and rosewater.","Place 1 sheet of filo in the bottom of the dish and brush liberally with oil. (If the filo sheets are very large, cut them all in half before using.) Place another one on top and coat again with oil. Repeat this process of layering and brushing with oil until half of the filo sheets are used up. Now spread on the filling and cover with the remaining filo sheets, layering and oiling as before. Be sure to brush the top sheet with oil too. Score the top to form diamond-shaped slices.","Bake in the oven for about 30 mins, increasing the heat for the last 5 mins to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 to give the pastry a light golden colour.","Remove from the oven and immediately pour half the cooled rose syrup over the hot pastry. Leave to rest for at least 30 mins so the syrup can seep through the layers. Serve with big dollops of Greek yogurt and the remaning syrup."]','2026-01-10 12:24:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9404,9404,'en','Honeyed nut & pomegranate pots','Create a cheat’s baklava by soaking shredded wheat in honey. Top with creamy yogurt, pistachios and citrus','["85g shredded wheat, crushed","200g pistachios, chopped","100g honey","juice ½ orange","300ml pot double cream","½  x 250g pot Greek yogurt","2 tsp rosewater","110g pot pomegranate seeds"]','["In a bowl, mix the crushed shredded wheat with the nuts, 50ml of the honey and the orange juice, then divide between 8 small glasses or teacups.","Whip the cream until very softly whipped, then fold in the yogurt, remaining honey and rose water. Divide this between the pots, too. Chill for at least 2 hrs, or up to 24 hrs. Before serving, top the pots with pomegranate seeds."]','2026-01-10 12:24:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9405,9405,'en','Chicken biryani','A great one-pot rice dish that can still be served up a few days later, perfect for leftovers','["300g basmati rice","25g butter","1 large onion, finely sliced","1 bay leaf","3 cardamom pods","small cinnamon stick","1 tsp turmeric","4 skinless chicken breasts, cut into large chunks","4 tbsp curry paste (we used Patak''s balti paste))","85g raisins","850ml chicken stock","chopped coriander and toasted flaked almonds to serve"]','["Soak the rice in warm water, then wash in\r\ncold until the water runs clear. Heat butter\r\nin a saucepan and cook the onions with the\r\nbay leaf and other whole spices for 10 mins.\r\nSprinkle in the turmeric, then add chicken\r\nand curry paste and cook until aromatic.","Stir the rice into the pan with the raisins,\r\nthen pour over the stock. Place a tight-fitting\r\nlid on the pan and bring to a hard boil, then\r\nlower the heat to a minimum and cook the\r\nrice for another 5 mins. Turn off the heat and\r\nleave for 10 mins. Stir well, mixing through\r\nhalf the coriander. To serve, scatter over the\r\nrest of the coriander and the almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:24:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9406,9406,'en','Easiest ever bread pudding','The ultimate in quick comfort food – only five minutes to prepare, perfect to pop in the oven before the main course','["150ml whole milk","140g white bread","50g raisins or dried cherries","568ml pot of fresh custard","butter, for greasing","5-7 tbsp caster sugar"]','["Heat oven to 140C/fan 120C/gas 1. Stir the custard together with the milk. Trim the crusts from the bread, cut into triangles, then place in a large bowl with the raisins or dried cherries. Pour over the custard mixture, then carefully stir everything together so all the pieces of bread are coated. Lightly grease a small ovenproof dish with butter, then spoon in the mixture.","Cook for 30-35 mins until there is just a slight wobble in the centre of the custard. Sprinkle over the sugar to cover the surface, then pop under a hot grill for 1-2 mins until the sugar starts to melt and caramelise."]','2026-01-10 12:24:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9407,9407,'en','Spiced vegetable biryani','This simple vegetarian curry, full of fresh Indian flavours, is quick to make and cooks in a single pot','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","1 small cauliflower, broken into small florets","2 large sweet potatoes, peeled and cubed","1 large onion, sliced","1l hot vegetable stock","3 tbsp hot curry paste (Madras is good)","1 red chilli, seeded and finely chopped","large pinch of saffron strands","2 tsp mustard seeds (black or white)","500g basmati rice","140g trimmed green beans, halved","2 lemons, juice only","a handful of fresh coriander leaves","50g packet salted roasted cashew nuts","poppadoms and raita, to serve"]','["Preheat the oven to 220C/gas 7/fan 200C. Pour the oil into a large roasting tin or ovenproof dish and put in the oven for a couple of minutes to heat through. Add all the vegetables to the tin, except the beans, stirring to coat them in the hot oil. Season with salt and pepper and return to the oven for 15 minutes until beginning to brown.","While the vegetables are roasting, stir together the stock, curry paste, chilli, saffron and mustard seeds.","Mix the rice and green beans with the vegetables in the tin, then pour over the stock mixture. Lower the oven to 190C/gas 5/fan 190C. Cover the dish tightly with foil and bake for 30 minutes until the rice is tender and the liquid has been absorbed. Stir in the lemon juice and check the seasoning, then scatter over the coriander and cashew nuts. Serve with a pile of poppadums and a bowl of raita."]','2026-01-10 12:24:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9408,9408,'en','Chicken biryani pilau','Easy and cheap to recreate at home, students won’t need to order takeaways ever again!','["2 tbsp vegetable oil","6 large chicken thighs, skin on","1 large onion, finely sliced","2 tbsp curry powder (hot if you like it spicy, mild for tamer curries)","350g easy-cook, long grain rice","700ml chicken or vegetable stock","250g frozen peas"]','["Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Heat the oil in a large sauté pan and fry the chicken thighs, skin side down, for 8-10 mins until the skin is golden and crispy. Tip in the onion and continue to cook for 5 mins until the onion softens. Sprinkle in the curry powder and cook for a minute more, then stir in the rice and pour over the stock. Bring the stock to the boil.","Cover the pan and bake for 30 mins until all the liquid has been absorbed and the rice is cooked. Stir in the peas and leave the rice to stand for a few moments before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:24:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9409,9409,'en','Turkish delight','Make your own Turkish delight with our easy recipe. It makes a great gift for Eid, or just treat yourself to something sweet','["flavourless oilfor the tray","500g granulated sugar","½ tsp cream of tartar","120g cornflour, plus extra for dusting","½ tsp rosewater(or 2 tbsp rose syrup)","pink food colouring, if not using the rose syrup","icing sugar, for dusting"]','["Oil a shallow square metal or silicone baking tray, about 18 x 18cm. Put the sugar in a pan with the cream of tartar and 500ml water and heat gently at first, stirring so that the sugar melts. Then, turn up the heat and boil for 10-15 mins until the mixture is a little more syrupy. If you have a sugar thermometer, it should reach 115-118C.","Stir the cornflour into 150ml water, then, whisking all the time, pour it into the sugar syrup. Keep whisking, until everything combines to make a smooth, gloopy mix. Take out the whisk and start to stir with a spatula or spoon over a medium heat. Keep stirring until the mixture is thick enough to see a clear line drawn through it with the spoon and it starts to leave the sides of the pan. It will be very thick and make big bubbles that burst as it cooks, so be careful. This can take up to an hour. Test the mix by dropping a small amount into very cold water; it should form a ball that can be pressed gently when cold and that will feel a little springy.","Stir in the rosewater or rose syrup and the food colouring, if using, then pour everything into the tray and level the top. Leave to cool and set completely. Sieve some cornflour and icing sugar together over a board and carefully turn out the Turkish delight. Cover it with more icing sugar and cornflour and cut it into cubes with a sharp knife. Dust with yet more of the icing sugar mixture and move the pieces apart so they can dry. Can be stored openly or in small cardboard boxes or bags."]','2026-01-10 12:24:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9410,9410,'en','Cardamom & pistachio biscuits','Everyone will love these beautiful biscuits and they make an impressive homemade gift. Dip them in chocolate and sprinkles to finish','["200g unsalted butter, at room temperature","400g plain flour, plus extra for dusting","150g golden caster sugar","50g runny honey","¼ tsp rosewater","1 egg","a pinch of salt","5 cardamom pods, shelled and crushed","½  teaspoon cream of tartar","100g dark chocolate, melted","choice of sprinkles - we used dried rose petals, chopped pistachios, desiccated coconut and orange zest","rolling pin","2 baking trays","baking parchment"]','["Put the butter and the flour in a large mixing bowl and rub together with your fingertips until the mixture looks like grainy sand.","In another bowl, stir together the rest of the ingredients until smooth and runny. Pour over the butter and flour mixture and combine with your hands. When the dough is soft and squidgy, shape it into a ball, wrap it up in cling film and put it in the fridge for 20-30 mins to firm a little.","Just before you remove the dough from the fridge heat your oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line 2 baking sheets with baking parchment.","Remove the dough from the fridge. Sprinkle some flour on your work surface and on a rolling pin then roll out the dough until it’s about the thickness of a £1 coin.","Use your ruler and a dinner knife to carefully cut the biscuit dough into rectangles that are 10cm long and 3cm wide and put them on the trays, leaving 2 fingers worth of space between each biscuit.","Put the biscuits in the oven for 10-12 mins. Once baked, cool in the trays for a few minutes then carefully transfer to a wire rack until completely cool. Repeat until all the dough is used up.","To decorate, melt the chocolate in the microwave then dip the end of each biscuit in the melted chocolate and leave to set on a plate or tray lined with baking parchment. Before the chocolate sets sprinkle them with a pinch of your favourite toppings then leave somewhere cool for 1-2 hrs. If giving as a gift, pack into little boxes once the chocolate is completely set (keeps for 2-3 days)."]','2026-01-10 12:24:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9411,9411,'en','Persian pudding with whipped rose & honey butter','Orange and rose flavours are incorporated into this alternative steamed pudding. Sweet spiced butter makes the perfect accompaniment','["250g pitted dates, roughly chopped","300g raisins","100g mixed peel","50g whole almonds","50g shelled pistachios","175g light muscovado sugar","175g white breadcrumbs","1 tsp mixed spice","½  tsp ground ginger","125g self-raising flour","zest 2 oranges","1 tbsp orange water","1 tbsp rosewater","2 large eggs, beaten","175g melted butter, plus extra for greasing","125g soft butter","2 tbsp icing sugar, plus extra to serve","50g clear honey","pinch of cinnamon","1 tsp rosewater"]','["Tip the dates into a bowl with the raisins, cover with 200ml hot water from the kettle and set aside. Meanwhile, grease a 1.5 litre pudding basin and line the base with a disk of parchment paper. Put the dry ingredients and orange zest in a large bowl. Stir in the dates and raisins (and soaking liquid), the rose and orange water, with the eggs and butter. Mix until everything is combined. Tip into the basin and cover with a circle of parchment paper, then foil, then tie the rim with string.","Place the pudding on an upturned jar lid in a large pan and pour in hot water from the kettle until it comes halfway up the bowl. Cover the pan and gently steam for 4 hrs, topping up with more water if needed. The pudding can be eaten straight away, chilled and kept for up to a week, or frozen for 1 month. To reheat, defrost completely or remove from the fridge and steam pud again for 30 mins until piping hot.","To make the butter, whisk the ingredients together. Serve the pudding in wedges with a spoonful of the butter melting over it."]','2026-01-10 12:24:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9412,9412,'en','Apple crumble energy balls','Make a batch of our easy, no-cook energy balls for the perfect on-the-go snack. These quick vegan bites with apples and cinnamon take just 10 minutes to make','["50g oats","50g pitted dates (about 3)","50g ground almonds","2 tbsp almond butter","¼ tsp cinnamon, plus extra for dusting","30g dried apple slices","½  apple"]','["Blitz 30g of the oats with the dates, ground almonds, almond butter, cinnamon, dried apple slices and a pinch of salt until roughly chopped and beginning to clump together. Grate in the apple, skin and all, then add the remaining oats and pulse until combined.","Roll into 10 balls and dust with a little more cinnamon. Put in the fridge for 30 mins to firm up. Will keep in an airtight container in the fridge for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9413,9413,'en','Choc-orange energy boosters','It only takes 15 minutes to blitz dates, nuts, seeds and oats to make this high-energy snack – perfect popped into a lunch box','["100g pitted Medjool dates","100g pecans nuts","50g pumpkin seeds","50g rolled oats","4 tbsp cacao powder or unsweetened cocoa","2 heaped tbsp almond butter","zest and juice 1 orange"]','["Place all the ingredients and 3 tbsp orange juice in a food processor. Blitz until chopped and starting to clump together. If it’s a bit dry, add a drop more orange juice. Roll the mixture into walnut-sized balls with lightly oiled hands. Pop 2 or 3 into a lunchbox for a snack. Keeps in a sealed container for 2 weeks in the fridge."]','2026-01-10 12:24:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9414,9414,'en','Veg & cheese rolls','Get little hands to help grate the carrots and beetroot and mix with mature cheddar to fill these vegetarian pastry rolls','["1 tbsp olive or rapeseed oil","1 large onion, halved and grated (kids might need to wear goggles to avoid any tears!)","2 carrots, grated","1 beetroot, grated (wear gloves to avoid pink fingers)","100g mature cheddar, grated","small bunch thyme, leaves picked","50g flaked almonds","320g sheet puff pastry","1 egg, beaten","salad or baked beans, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a large pan. Add the onion and sizzle for 5 mins, stirring now and then, until softened. Add the carrot and beetroot, season well and cook gently for 5-10 mins, stirring until the veg is soft. Tip into a bowl.","Stir the cheese and thyme leaves into the vegetable mixture while it’s still warm. Roughly crumble half the almonds in your hands and add these to the bowl too. Chill the mixture for 30 mins or so until cool enough to handle.","Unroll the pastry. Cut in half lengthways, then pile the cooled filling down the middle of each strip of pastry. Brush the edges of the pastry with a little beaten egg, then fold the sides over to cover the filling. Turn the rolls over so the pastry seam is tucked underneath and cut each roll into 3, so you have 6. Place on a baking tray lined with baking parchment, brush with a little more egg and sprinkle over the remaining almonds. Chill until ready to cook (or at least 15 mins). Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6.","Bake for 20 mins until golden brown. Serve the rolls warm or cold with salad or baked beans."]','2026-01-10 12:24:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9415,9415,'en','Mini schnitzels with garlic sauce','These baked, breadcrumbed chunks of chicken thigh make delicious bite-sized nuggets – perfect with oven chips','["500g skinless, boneless chicken thighs fillets","4 tbsp plain flour","2 eggs, beaten","140g dried breadcrumbs","75g butter","4 fat garlic cloves, finely chopped","200g crème fraîche","½  small bunch curly parsley, finely chopped","mixed leaf (optional), to serve","skinny fries (optional), to serve"]','["Heat oven to 220C/200C fan/gas 7. Place the chicken thigh fillets between 2 pieces of cling film and bash with a rolling pin to about 1cm thick. Cut the chicken into bite-sized pieces.","Put the flour, eggs and breadcrumbs on 3 separate plates. Season the flour, then toss the chicken pieces in it to coat, followed by the egg and finishing with a coating of breadcrumbs.","Put the breadcrumbed chicken on a baking sheet and cook for 10-12 mins.","Meanwhile, in a small pan, melt the butter, then stir in the garlic and cook for 3-4 mins until it is softened. Turn down the heat, whisk in the crème fraîche and most of the parsley and season to taste. Serve the sauce in a small pot on the side, to dip into, sprinkle the remaining parsley over the sauce, and serve with salad leaves and skinny fries, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:24:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9416,9416,'en','Kefir breakfast smoothie','Kick-start your morning with this probiotic-rich kefir breakfast smoothie. With mango, orange juice, ginger and turmeric, you’ll be ready for the day ahead','["1 large mango, stoned and chopped","2cm piece ginger, finely grated","½  tsp ground turmeric","200ml fresh orange juice","300ml kefir","1-2 tbsp honey or agave, to taste"]','["Put all the ingredients in a blender and blitz until completely smooth. Taste and add a little more ginger, turmeric and honey, if you like.","Pour into two tall glasses and serve. Can be chilled in a covered jug in the fridge for up to 24 hrs."]','2026-01-10 12:24:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9417,9417,'en','Strawberry green goddess smoothie','Try this tasty breakfast smoothie to start your day, pairing sweet fruit with nutritious spinach and avocado for a dose of calcium, vitamin C, folate and fibre','["160g ripe strawberries, hulled","160g baby spinach","1 small avocado, halved and the flesh scooped out","150ml pot bio yogurt","2 small oranges, juiced, plus ½  tsp finely grated zest"]','["Put all the ingredients in a blender and whizz until completely smooth. If it’s a little thick, add a drop of chilled water then blitz again. Pour into glasses and drink straight away."]','2026-01-10 12:24:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9418,9418,'en','Two-minute breakfast smoothie','Whizz up a low-fat breakfast smoothie in no time. Use banana with other soft fruit, plus honey for a little sweetness and oats for slow-release fuel','["1 banana","1 tbsp porridge oats","80g soft fruit (whatever you have – strawberries, blueberries, and mango all work well)","150ml milk","1 tsp honey","1 tsp vanilla extract"]','["Put all the ingredients in a blender and whizz for 1 min until smooth.","Pour the mixture into two glasses to serve."]','2026-01-10 12:24:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9419,9419,'en','Kale smoothie','Give yourself a dose of vitamin C in the morning with this vegan green smoothie. Along with kale and avocado, there’s a hit of zesty lime and pineapple','["2 handfuls kale","½  avocado","½  lime, juice only","large handful frozen pineapple chunks","medium-sized chunk ginger","1 tbsp cashew nuts","1 banana, optional"]','["Put all of the ingredients into a bullet or smoothie maker, add a large splash of water and blitz. Add more water until you have the desired consistency."]','2026-01-10 12:24:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9420,9420,'en','Breakfast super-shake','This smoothie is high in natural fats and sugar – ideal if you need some fuel for intense exercise','["100ml full-fat milk","2 tbsp natural yogurt","1 banana","150g frozen fruits of the forest","50g blueberries","1 tbsp chia seeds","½  tsp cinnamon","1 tbsp goji berries","1 tsp mixed seeds","1 tsp honey (ideally Manuka)"]','["Put the ingredients in a blender and blitz until smooth. Pour into a glass and enjoy!"]','2026-01-10 12:24:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9421,9421,'en','Sunshine smoothie','Start your day off with a little ray of sunshine – a low-fat smoothie that’s two of your five-a-day and tasty too!','["500ml carrot juice, chilled","200g pineapple (fresh or canned)","2 bananas, broken into chunks","small piece ginger, peeled","20g cashew nuts","juice 1 lime"]','["Put the ingredients in a blender and whizz until smooth. Drink straight away or pour into a bottle to drink on the go. Will keep in the fridge for a day."]','2026-01-10 12:24:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9422,9422,'en','Banana smoothie','Quick and easy to make, this banana, prune, almond milk and nut butter smoothie is an ideal on-the-go energy boost','["500ml unsweetened almond milk","2 tbsp almond butter","6 prunes","1 tsp cinnamon","1 small ripe banana"]','["In a blender, whizz the almond milk with the almond butter, prunes, cinnamon and banana. Transfer to 2 bottles and chill until ready to drink, or pack for lunch on the go. They will keep in the fridge for 2 days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9423,9423,'en','Coconut & banana smoothie','This creamy smoothie is packed with nutritious ingredients. Baobab adds a tangy, sherbet flavour and is high in fibre, antioxidants and vitamin C','["100g coconut yogurt","3 tbsp milk of your choice (we used unsweetened almond milk)","½  tsp ground turmeric","3cm piece of fresh ginger, peeled","2 tsp baobab powder (optional)","1 small ripe banana","1 tsp honey","1 tbsp oats","juice of ½  a lemon"]','["Add the coconut yogurt and milk to a high-speed blender then add the turmeric, fresh ginger and baobab powder (if using). Tip in the remaining ingredients then blend until smooth. Add ice and blitz again if you prefer a colder drink. Pour into glasses and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:24:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9424,9424,'en','Green smoothie','This sweet smoothie packs in plenty of nutritious ingredients, such as spinach, flaxseeds and banana, with an optional spoonful of maca powder for a natural energy boost','["250ml milk of your choice (we used unsweetened almond milk)","1 tbsp ground flaxseed","1 tsp maca powder (optional)","pinch ground cinnamon","1 Medjool date, stoned","1 small ripe banana","handful cavolo nero or spinach","1 tbsp almond butter"]','["Pour the milk into a high-speed blender then add the ground flaxseed, maca powder (if using) and the cinnamon. Add the remaining ingredients then blitz until smooth. Pour into glasses and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:24:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9425,9425,'en','Green breakfast smoothie','Blitz healthy ingredients for an energy-boosting breakfast. Using unsweetened brown rice milk fortified with calcium and vitamins makes it more nutritious','["1 handful spinach (about 50g/2oz), roughly chopped","100g broccoli florets, roughly chopped","2 celery sticks","4 tbsp desiccated coconut","1 banana","300ml rice milk (see Tip)","¼ tsp spirulina or 1 scoop of greens powder or vegan protein powder (optional)"]','["Whizz 300ml water and the ingredients in a blender until smooth."]','2026-01-10 12:24:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9426,9426,'en','Strawberry & banana almond smoothie','Kick-start your day with this healthy fruit smoothie, made extra filling with ground almonds and calcium-packed dairy','["1 small banana","7 strawberries, hulled","3 tbsp 0% bio-yogurt","3 tbsp skimmed milk","2 tbsp ground almonds"]','["Slice the banana into the bowl of a food processor, or a jug if using a hand blender. Add the strawberries, yogurt, milk and ground almonds, and blitz until completely smooth. Pour into a glass and enjoy."]','2026-01-10 12:24:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9427,9427,'en','Açaí smoothie','Açaí is a hero ingredient – reputed to be one of the best antioxidants, it makes the perfect base for a fruit smoothie. Combine with pineapple, strawberries and banana','["100g raw, frozen, unsweetened açaí pulp, thawed","50g frozen pineapple","100g strawberries","1 medium banana","250ml mango or orange juice","1 tbsp agave nectar or honey"]','["Place all ingredients in the blender or a food processor. Blend until smooth. If it’s too thick add a bit more mango or orange juice. Serve in 2 tall glasses."]','2026-01-10 12:24:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9428,9428,'en','Breakfast egg wraps','Enjoy these protein-rich egg wraps filled with mushrooms and tomatoes for a quick, filling and healthy breakfast. It provides iron, folate and fibre.','["500g pack closed cup mushrooms","4 tsp cold pressed rapeseed oil, plus 2 drops","320g cherry tomatoes, halved, or 8 tomatoes, cut into wedges","2 generous handfuls parsley, finely chopped","8 tbsp porridge oats (40g)","10 eggs","4 tsp English mustard powder made up with water"]','["Thickly slice half the pack of mushrooms. Heat 2 tsp rapeseed oil in a non-stick pan. Add the mushrooms, stir briefly then fry with the lid on the pan for 6-8 mins. Stir in half the tomatoes then cook 1-2 mins more with the lid off until softened.","Beat together the eggs really well with the parsley and oats. Heat a drop of oil in a large non-stick frying pan. Pour in a ¼ of the egg mix and fry for 1 min until almost set, flip over as if making a pancake. Tip from the pan, spread with a quarter of the mustard, spoon a ¼ the filling down the centre and roll up. Now make a second wrap using another ¼ of the egg mix and filling. If you''re following our Healthy Diet Plan, save the rest for the following day."]','2026-01-10 12:24:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9429,9429,'en','Chia & almond overnight oats','Start the day with energising oats and omega-3-rich chia seeds with this delicious breakfast. It’s vegan, but you can use cow’s milk and yogurt, if you prefer','["200g porridge oats","50g chia seeds","600ml unsweetened almond milk, plus 8 tbsp","2 tsp vanilla extract","125g punnet raspberries","100g almond yogurt","250g punnet blueberries","20g flaked almonds, toasted"]','["Tip the oats and seeds into a bowl and pour over the milk and vanilla extract. Leave for 5-10 mins for the oats to absorb some of the liquid.","Reserve 16 raspberries, then add the remainder to the oats and crush them into the mixture. Spoon into four tumblers or sundae dishes, then top with the yogurt and both lots of berries. Cover and chill overnight or until needed. To serve, pour 2 tbsp almond milk over each and scatter with the almonds."]','2026-01-10 12:24:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9430,9430,'en','Date butter','Whip up this easy date butter with just a handful of ingredients. There’s no cooking involved, it’s delicious on toast or banana bread – and it’s vegan if you make it with coconut oil','["150g coconut oil or butter","80g soft pitted dates","1 tbsp maple syrup","pinch of cinnamon","pinch of salt"]','["In a small food processor, blend the coconut oil or butter, dates (we used medjool), maple syrup, cinnamon and salt. Chill until needed, will keep for up to a week."]','2026-01-10 12:24:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9431,9431,'en','Raspberry honey flapjacks','Make these easy raspberry honey flapjacks using just five ingredients. Serve with a cuppa for a perfect mid-morning pick-me-up, or freeze for a later date','["150g butter","150g light brown soft sugar","4 tbsp honey (we used heather honey)","300g porridge oats","100g frozen raspberries"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6 and line a 20 x 20cm baking tin with parchment. Melt the butter, sugar, honey and a pinch of salt in a pan. Once the mixture is bubbling and combined, stir in the oats.","Tip the oat mixture into the lined baking tin and press down with your fingers or the back of a spoon. Scatter over the raspberries, then lightly press them into the oat mixture. Bake for 25-30 mins until golden brown. Leave to cool, then cut into 9 or 12 flapjacks."]','2026-01-10 12:24:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9432,9432,'en','Peanut butter & date oat pots','Try these make-ahead overnight oats for a healthy start to your day. They’re naturally sweetened with dates and cinnamon and a good source of calcium.','["180g porridge oats","75g crunchy peanut butter (we used Meridian 100% nuts)","40g stoned medjool dates, chopped","2 tsp vanilla extract","5 x 120g pots plain bio yogurt (or 600g from a large pot)","ground cinnamon, for dusting"]','["Tip the oats into a large bowl and pour over 600ml boiling water. Add the peanut butter, dates and vanilla and stir well. Cool, then stir through 240g of the yogurt. Dilute with a small amount of water if the consistency is a little stiff.","Spoon into six glasses, then top with the remaining yogurt and dust with cinnamon. Cover each glass and keep in the fridge until ready to eat. Will keep well for up to five days."]','2026-01-10 12:24:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9433,9433,'en','Breakfast naans','Top naan breads with cream cheese, chutney, avocado and eggs for a tasty breakfast or brunch. They take just 10 minutes to make and deliver one of your 5-a-day','["1 tbsp vegetable or sunflower oil","2 eggs","2 small naan breads","4 tbsp low-fat cream cheese","2 tbsp mango chutney","1 avocado, halved and sliced","½ lime, juiced","1 green chilli","small handful coriander, leaves picked"]','["Heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Heat the oil in a pan, then fry the eggs. Warm the naan breads in the oven while the eggs are cooking.","Spread the warm naans with the cream cheese, then drizzle with the chutney. Add a fried egg to each naan and top with the avocado, lime juice, chilli and coriander. Season and tuck in."]','2026-01-10 12:24:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9434,9434,'en','Spiced carrot & apple muffins','These fruity muffins are great for breakfast on-the-go or a mid-morning treat. Add dried fruit, nuts or seeds for texture, if you like','["100ml rapeseed oil","100ml natural yogurt","50ml runny honey","2 eggs","1 tsp vanilla extract","200g self-raising flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","1½ tsp ground mixed spice","1 apple, grated","1 carrot, grated","50g sultanas, raisins, chopped nuts or seeds (optional)"]','["Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4 and line a muffin tin with nine cases (alternatively, use squares of baking parchment). Mix the oil, yogurt, honey, eggs and vanilla in a jug. In a bowl, combine the flour, bicarb, mixed spice and ¼ tsp salt. Pour the yogurt mixture into the flour mixture and add the apple and carrot, as well as any extra ingredients you’re using. Mix with a spatula until well combined, then spoon the mixture into the muffin cases.","Bake for 20-22 mins, or until a skewer inserted into the middle of a muffin comes out clean. Leave to cool for at least 5 mins. Can be stored in a tin for three days or frozen for two months; defrost overnight before serving."]','2026-01-10 12:24:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9435,9435,'en','Chickpea, red pepper, egg & feta hash','Kick-start your day with our vegetarian chickpea, red pepper, egg and feta hash. This brilliant breakfast is easy to make and delivers two of your 5-a-day','["1 tbsp olive or rapeseed oil","1 onion, halved and sliced","400g can chickpeas, drained","1½ tsp cumin seeds","4 roasted red peppersfrom a jar, torn into chunks","2-4 eggs","40g feta, crumbled","½  lemon, zested","small handful mint, leaves chopped","flatbreads, to serve (optional)"]','["Heat the oil in a frying pan. Cook the onion for 12-15 mins until starting to caramelise. Add the chickpeas, cumin and peppers and season well, then cook for a few mins until hot throughout.","Create spaces in the pan for each of the eggs. Crack the eggs into the pan, then cover and cook for 2-3 mins, or until the eggs are done to your liking. Scatter over the feta, lemon zest and mint. Serve alongside the flatbreads, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:24:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9436,9436,'en','Porridge with quick berry compote, figs & pistachios','Make time for a nutritious, healthy breakfast to set you up for the day. Porridge goes perfectly with our quick berry compote, figs and pistachio topping','["150g porridge oats","100ml milk","120g frozen berries","½  orange, zested and juiced","1 fig, sliced","1 tbsp pistachios, toasted and chopped"]','["Put the oats, milk and 450ml water in a pan with a pinch of salt. Cook for about 5 mins until thick and creamy. Meanwhile, microwave the berries, orange juice and zest for 2-3 mins.","Divide the porridge between bowls and top each with the berry compote, fig and pistachios."]','2026-01-10 12:24:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9437,9437,'en','Açaí bowl','Try this fruit-packed breakfast bowl for a quick, easy start to your day. Vary toppings according to the season – fresh berries or peaches work well in summer','["2 tsp açaí powder","handful frozen berries","½ a very ripe banana, chopped","handful ice cubes","1 tsp coconut flakes, 5 pineapple chunks, ½ passionfruit, 1 tbsp toasted oats, to top (optional)"]','["Put the açaí powder, frozen berries, banana and ice cubes into a powerful blender with 100ml water. Blitz until smooth, then pour into a bowl and add your choice of toppings."]','2026-01-10 12:24:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9439,9439,'en','Microwave shakshuka','Whip up shakshuka, a Middle Eastern favourite, in just 10 minutes. Perfect for brunch, lunch or supper, it’s healthy and a great option for a budget meal','["1 tbsp olive oil","200ml passata or canned tomatoes, whizzed to a paste","1 garlic clove, finely sliced","1 heaped tbsp red pepper salsa (we used Gran Luchito) or ¼-½ red pepper, chopped","2 medium eggs","1 tbsp chopped coriander and pitta bread, to serve"]','["Brush a microwave bowl or dish with a little of the oil. Stir the passata, garlic and salsa together and season well. Tip into the bowl and make a dip in the centre. Break in the egg, then prick the yolk with the tip of a sharp knife.","Cover the bowl with its lid or clingfilm. Microwave on high for 1 min, and then in 20 sec bursts until the white is set. Scatter over the coriander and serve with the warmed pitta."]','2026-01-10 12:24:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9440,9440,'en','Date & walnut cinnamon bites','These date and walnut cinnamon bites are quick to whip up for a healthy snack. They also work as an after-dinner treat if you have friends round','["3 walnut halves","3 pitted medjool dates","ground cinnamon, to taste"]','["Carefully cut each walnut half into three slices, then do the same with the dates. Place a slice of walnut on top of each date, dust with cinnamon and serve."]','2026-01-10 12:24:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9441,9441,'en','Homemade muesli with oats, dates & berries','Packed with oats, pecans, seeds, dates, puffed wheat and berries, this delicious breakfast muesli will help you to start your day the right way','["100g traditional oats","12 pecan nuts, broken into pieces","2 tbsp sunflower seeds","6 pitted medjool dates, snipped into pieces","25g high-fibre puffed wheat (we used Good Grain)","4 x 150ml pots bio yogurt","300g mixed berries, such as raspberries, strawberries and blueberries","generous sprinkling of ground cinnamon (optional)"]','["Tip the oats into a frying pan and heat gently, stirring frequently until they are just starting to toast. Add the pecans and seeds to warm briefly, then tip into a large bowl and toss so they cool quickly.","Add the dates and puffed wheat, mix well until thoroughly combined, then serve topped with the yogurt and fruit, and a sprinkling of cinnamon, if you like."]','2026-01-10 12:24:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9442,9442,'en','Green shakshuka','Treat yourself to a shakshuka with a difference. Mix up your favourite greens, eggs and flatbreads to serve with this healthy weekend breakfast','["3 tbsp olive oil","2 leeks, washed and sliced","200g bag baby spinach","250g frozen peas","2 fat garlic cloves, finely chopped","1 tbsp cumin seeds","small pack parsley, roughly chopped","small pack coriander, roughly chopped","small pack mint, leaves picked and roughly chopped, reserving a few leaves to garnish","8 medium eggs","150g pot natural yogurt","1 tbsp harissa","flatbread, to serve"]','["Heat the oil in a wide, shallow frying pan over a medium heat. Add the leeks with a pinch of salt and cook for 4 mins until softened. Add handfuls of spinach to the pan, stirring until wilted.","Stir in the peas, garlic, cumin, herbs and some seasoning. Cook for a few mins until it smells fragrant, then create four gaps and crack two eggs into each. Cover and cook for 10 mins or until the whites are set but the yolks are runny – they will carry on cooking slightly as you take them to the table.","Season the eggs with flaky sea salt, dollop spoonfuls of the yogurt interspersed with the harissa, and scatter over a few mint leaves. Serve with a pile of flatbread for scooping."]','2026-01-10 12:24:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9443,9443,'en','Green rainbow smoothie bowl','Start as you mean to go on with this super-healthy breakfast bowl of berries and avocado','["50g spinach","1 avocado, stoned, peeled and halved","1 ripe mango, stoned, peeled and cut into chunks","1 apple, cored and cut into chunks","200ml almond milk","1 dragon fruit, peeled and cut into even chunks","100g mixed berries (we used strawberries, raspberries and blueberries)"]','["Put the spinach, avocado, mango, apple and almond milk in a blender, and blitz until smooth and thick. Divide between two bowls and top with the dragon fruit and berries."]','2026-01-10 12:24:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9444,9444,'en','Turmeric smoothie bowl','Full of warming and nourishing ingredients, this creamy breakfast bowl can be ready in just 10 minutes','["10cm/4in fresh turmeric, or 2 tsp ground turmeric","3 tbsp coconut milk yogurt (we used Co Yo), or the cream skimmed from the top of canned coconut milk","50g gluten-free oats","1 tbsp cashew butter (or a handful of cashews)","2 bananas, peeled and roughly chopped","½  tsp ground cinnamon","1 tbsp chia seeds or chopped nuts, to serve"]','["Peel the turmeric root, if using, and grate. Put all ingredients in a blender with 600ml water and blend until smooth. Serve in a bowl with chia seeds or some chopped nuts sprinkled over."]','2026-01-10 12:24:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9445,9445,'en','Date & fig bread','A sourdough-style bread that’s just bursting with fruit and flavour – it bakes in just 20 minutes','["400g wholemeal flour","7g sachet fast-action yeast","300ml water","175g wholemeal flour","400g strong white flour","2 tsp salt","7g sachet fast-action yeast","140g butter, melted","1 tbsp treacle","225ml water","200g figs, coarsely chopped","100g dates, coarsely chopped"]','["Mix the starter ingredients together in a bowl. Turn out and knead for 10 minutes. Place in a lightly oiled bowl and leave to rise overnight in the fridge.","To make the second dough, mix the remaining flours, salt and yeast in a large bowl. Make a well in the centre, stir together the butter and treacle, then pour in the dry ingredients along with almost all the water. If the dough seems a little stiff, add the rest of the water. Turn out onto a lightly floured work surface. Knead the starter into the dough and knead for 10 mins. Put the dough into a lightly oiled bowl and leave to rise for 1 hour until doubled in size.","Turn out onto a lightly floured work surface. Press the dough out into a rectangle about 2.5cm thick and sprinkle over the figs and dates, then roll up like a Swiss roll, kneading to combine evenly. Cut into 20 pieces and shape into rolls. Leave for 1 hour to prove until doubled in size. Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7. Bake for 18-20 mins, until the rolls sound hollow when tapped underneath. Leave to cool on a wire rack."]','2026-01-10 12:24:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9446,9446,'en','Date & apple squares','A chewy, oaty tray bake with sticky dates and apples – bound to be a big hit.','["225g butter, plus a little extra for greasing","140g cooking apples, peeled, cored and chopped","140g stoned dates, chopped","280g light soft brown sugar","175g plain flour","1 tsp bicarbonate of soda","100g porridge oats"]','["Heat oven to 190C/170C fan/gas 5.\r\nGrease an 18cm square tin and line\r\nwith baking parchment.","Tip the apples into a pan with 2 tbsp\r\nwater. Bring to the boil and simmer on\r\na low heat for 5 mins until tender and slightly pulpy. Add the dates and 50g of\r\nthe sugar, and cook for a further 5 mins.\r\nTake off the heat and break the apples\r\ndown with the back of a spoon until\r\nsmooth and well mixed with the\r\ndates. Set aside.","Gently melt the butter in a\r\nsaucepan. Mix the flour, bicarb,\r\noats and remaining sugar in a\r\nbowl. Pour in the melted butter\r\nand stir well until oats are coated.","Press half the mixture firmly\r\ninto the tin, spread the apple\r\nmix on top and smooth over.\r\nCover with the remaining oat\r\nmixture and press down. Bake\r\nfor 30-35 mins until golden and\r\nfirm. Cool in the tin before\r\ncutting into squares."]','2026-01-10 12:24:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9447,9447,'en','Sticky date buns','The longer the dough for this sweet fruit bread stays in the fridge the better the flavour – perfect with a cup of tea','["1 tsp caster sugar","2 x 7g sachets fast-action dried yeast","600g 00 flour, sponge flour or plain flour, plus extra for dusting","400ml warm milk","200g butter, 50g melted, remainder very soft","1 large egg, beaten with a fork","200g dates","250g light soft brown sugar","icing sugar, for dusting (optional)"]','["Up to 3 days before you want to bake,\r\nmix the caster sugar, yeast, 400g of the\r\nflour and 1 tsp salt in a big bowl. Whisk\r\ntogether the milk, melted butter and\r\negg, then tip into the dry ingredients and\r\nmix with a wooden spoon. Cover with\r\nbuttered cling film and put in the fridge\r\nat least overnight or for up to 3 days.","When you’re ready to make the buns,\r\nput the dates in a bowl and pour over\r\njust enough boiling water to cover. Leave\r\nto soak for 15-20 mins. Drain, pat dry,\r\nstone and chop.","Mix the remaining flour into the dough.\r\nUse your hands to bring the dough\r\ntogether, then tip out onto a lightly\r\nfloured surface and lightly knead. Roll\r\nout with a little more flour to a large\r\nrectangle, about 50 x 30cm, with one of\r\nthe short sides facing you. Spread over\r\nthree-quarters of the soft butter, then\r\nsprinkle over three-quarters of the brown\r\nsugar. Fold the bottom third of the dough\r\nup and over the middle third, then the\r\ntop third down over the other two.","Heat oven to 180C/160C fan/gas 4.\r\nRotate the dough 90 degrees, or a\r\nquarter turn one way. Roll out again to\r\na similar-sized rectangle as before, this\r\ntime with one of the long edges facing\r\nyou. Spread over all but 1 heaped tsp of\r\nthe remaining butter, scatter over the\r\nremaining brown sugar, and sprinkle over\r\nthe dates. Roll up tightly like a Swiss roll\r\nfrom one of the long edges. Trim the ends\r\na tiny bit, and slice into 12 roughly even\r\nportions. Lightly butter the holes of a\r\nmuffin tin with the reserved butter, then\r\npush a roll, cut-side up, into each hole.","Bake for 50 mins until golden and risen.\r\nRemove from the tin while warm, so they\r\ndon’t stick. Dust tops with icing sugar, if\r\nyou like, or serve sticky-bottom up."]','2026-01-10 12:24:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9448,8330,'fr','Muffins aux croissants aux amandes','Muffins aux croissants aux amandes inspirés d''un favori de la boulangerie française avec une touche nourrissante, le lin germé de Linwoods.','["2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin","4 cuillères à soupe d''eau","100 ml de sirop d''érable","80g de beurre d''amande","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","100 g de yaourt au soja","50 ml de lait végétal","180 g de farines autolevantes","¼ cuillère à café de sel","50g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à soupe de lin germé Linwoods","30g de sirop d''érable","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","30 ml de lait végétal","amandes effilées","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C ventilé et tapisser un moule à muffins de 6 caissettes. Dans un petit bol, mélangez les graines de lin avec de l''eau et laissez épaissir 5 minutes.","Dans un grand bol, fouetter ensemble le mélange de lin épaissi, le sirop d''érable, le beurre d''amande, l''extrait d''amande, le yaourt de soja et le lait végétal. Ajoutez la farine autolevante et le sel et pliez délicatement jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé – évitez de trop mélanger.","Dans un autre bol, mélanger tous les ingrédients de la garniture aux amandes jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte épaisse se forme. Versez la moitié de la pâte à muffins dans les moules, ajoutez une cuillerée de garniture aux amandes dans chacun, puis recouvrez du reste de la pâte. Saupoudrer d''amandes effilées et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et qu''un cure-dent en ressorte propre.","Laisser légèrement refroidir, puis saupoudrer de sucre glace avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:00:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9449,8332,'fr','Pain d''épices au beurre noisette et à la cardamome','Donnez une touche différente au lebkuchen classique à Noël. Épicé avec de la cardamome parfumée, le beurre noisette donne à ces biscuits moelleux une touche de noisette','["100g de beurre salé","150 g de sucre mou roux clair","200 ml de miel","350 g de farine nature + un peu pour saupoudrer","100 g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à café de cardamome moulue","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","¼ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","¼ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","¼ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","pincée de masse moulue","pincée de muscade moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 oeuf","1 citron , zesté","200 g de sucre glace tamisé","1 blanc d''oeuf"]','["Versez le beurre dans une casserole à feu moyen. Une fois fondu, faites cuire jusqu''à ce que le beurre mousse, en remuant régulièrement. Il devrait commencer à sentir la noisette et les solides du lait au fond deviendront dorés en 7 minutes environ. Retirer du feu et incorporer le sucre et le miel. Remettre sur feu doux. Cuire 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit fondu. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Mélanger la farine, la poudre d''amandes, les épices, la poudre de cacao, la levure chimique et le bicarbonate de soude dans un bol. Battez l''œuf dans le mélange de beurre refroidi puis versez-le sur les ingrédients secs et ajoutez le zeste de citron. Bien mélanger et mettre en boule. Réserver 1 h au réfrigérateur pour qu''il raffermisse.","Saupoudrez légèrement un plan de travail propre de farine et tapissez deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Démouler la pâte et l''étaler sur environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Utilisez des emporte-pièces en forme de cœurs, de bonhommes en pain d''épices et d''étoiles de différentes tailles, environ 5 à 8 cm, pour découper le lebkuchen. Si vous souhaitez les accrocher, utilisez une pique à brochette pour percer un petit trou dans le haut. Disposer sur la plaque à pâtisserie, en laissant un peu d''espace entre les deux. Cuire au four pendant 13 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés et juste pris, puis laisser refroidir complètement sur les plaques.","Pour glacer les biscuits refroidis, fouettez ensemble le sucre glace et le blanc d''œuf pour former un glaçage lisse et utilisable. Verser dans une poche à douille réutilisable et poser les décorations de pipes sur le dessus des biscuits. Réserver pour que le glaçage prenne, au moins 1 heure. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique pendant cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:00:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9450,8334,'fr','Petits pains roly poly à la confiture','Prenez un pudding roly poly à la confiture et transformez-le en petits pains tourbillonnants. Il utilise du tangzhong – une pâte de lait et de farine de style chinois qui donne des petits pains exceptionnellement moelleux.','["400 ml de lait entier","150 g de farine nature + un peu pour saupoudrer","2 œufs , battus","300 g de farine à pain blanche forte","7g de levure instantanée","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de crème anglaise","100 g de beurre salé coupé en cubes et ramolli","huile végétale, pour lever","6-7 cuillères à soupe de confiture de framboises","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de crème anglaise","5 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","1½ cuillère à soupe de lait","½ cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de gousse de vanille"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le tangzhong. Mélangez 200 ml de lait avec 50 g de farine nature dans un petit bol résistant à la chaleur. Cuire au micro-ondes pendant 1 à 2 minutes, en remuant toutes les 30 secondes, jusqu''à obtenir une pâte gluante et épaisse. Laissez refroidir quelques minutes le temps d''assembler le reste de la pâte.","Faites chauffer doucement le reste du lait dans une petite casserole à feu doux sur la plaque de cuisson. Une fois cuit à la vapeur, retirez du feu et laissez refroidir juste tiède avant d’incorporer la moitié de l’œuf battu.","Tamisez les deux farines dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle équipé du crochet pétrisseur. Ajoutez la levure, 1 cuillère à café de sel, le sucre en poudre doré et la poudre à crème anglaise, et fouettez brièvement pour combiner.","Avec le mélangeur à basse température, ajoutez le tangzhong, puis ajoutez lentement le mélange de lait et d''œufs en un filet continu. Allumez le batteur à feu moyen et mélangez pendant 7 à 8 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse.","Ajouter le beurre, un cube à la fois, en attendant que le premier cube soit incorporé avant d''ajouter le suivant ; cela devrait prendre environ 10 minutes. Ce sera une pâte molle, alors farinez bien vos mains et le plan de travail avant de former une boule de pâte et de la mettre dans un grand bol huilé. Laisser lever 1 h dans un endroit tiède, puis couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Le lendemain, étalez la pâte en un rectangle d''environ 40 x 30 cm. Étalez sur la confiture, puis enroulez fermement le rectangle sur l''un des côtés les plus longs. Coupez en 12 spirales à l''aide d''un couteau dentelé bien aiguisé, puis transférez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie ou un moule recouvert de papier sulfurisé, en les espaçant légèrement. Couvrir et laisser lever encore une heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé et touche les côtés. Badigeonner du reste d’œuf battu.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et cuit. Refroidir 15 minutes. Pendant que les petits pains refroidissent, préparez le glaçage. Mélangez ensemble la poudre à crème anglaise et le sucre glace. Mélangez le lait et la pâte de gousse de vanille, puis ajoutez-le lentement au mélange sec en un filet constant, en mélangeant tout le temps jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage jaune épais. Transférer dans une poche à douille.","Coupez le bout de la poche à douille et versez le glaçage sur les petits pains chauds avant de servir. Mieux consommés le jour de leur préparation, mais se conservent à température ambiante pendant deux jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:00:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9451,8336,'fr','Petits pains briochés patte de chat','Préparez ces « pattes de chat » pour le petit-déjeuner avec des confitures ou toute autre garniture de toasts que votre famille pourrait aimer. La fabrication du pain est une excellente activité d''intérieur pour les tout-petits','["200 ml de lait entier","50g de beurre salé","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte","5g de sel marin fin","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","3 oeufs , 1 battu pour glacer"]','["Faites chauffer le lait et le beurre ensemble dans un pichet au micro-ondes ou dans une petite casserole à feu doux, jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu et que le lait soit juste chaud.","Versez la farine à pain dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle, puis ajoutez le sel et le sucre d''un côté et la levure de l''autre. Fouettez brièvement avec le crochet pétrisseur, puis ajoutez le mélange de lait et de beurre et 2 œufs, et pétrissez à basse vitesse pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, lisses et élastiques. Vous pouvez également le faire dans un bol en faisant un puits au milieu, en ajoutant le lait et 2 œufs, puis en réunissant et en pétrissant la pâte sur un plan de travail jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse. Essayez de ne pas ajouter plus de farine, repliez simplement la pâte collante sur elle-même en vous grattant les mains de temps en temps. Un grattoir à pâte est un excellent outil que les enfants peuvent utiliser pour préparer du pain et de la pâte. Placer dans un bol, couvrir d''un torchon propre et laisser lever 1 à 2 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Battez la pâte, puis coupez-la en 12 boules. Formez huit boules en ronds bien nets, puis placez-les sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Coupez chacune des boules restantes en huit petits morceaux pour former 32 petites boules de pâte. Utilisez un peu d’œuf battu pour coller quatre petites boules sur chacune des plus grosses afin qu’elles ressemblent à des pattes. Laisser lever encore 45 minutes pour gonfler à nouveau.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Badigeonner les petits pains avec plus d''œuf, puis cuire pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et gonflés. Laisser refroidir un peu avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:00:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9452,8338,'fr','Gâteau crumble à la rhubarbe et à la crème anglaise','Savourez les saveurs classiques du crumble à la rhubarbe et de la crème anglaise dans une tranche de gâteau : c''est une combinaison de textures de rêve. Servir avec de la crème double, si vous le souhaitez','["125 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","400 g de rhubarbe coupée en morceaux de 1 cm","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","150 g de farines autolevantes","50 g de polenta à cuisson rapide","3 cuillères à soupe de poudre de crème anglaise","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","125 ml de crème sure","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","crème double, pour servir (facultatif)","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","60 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de crème anglaise","1 cuillère à soupe de polenta à cuisson rapide","50 g de beurre coupé en cubes"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à charnière rond de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez un tiers de la rhubarbe avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre et réservez.","Pour préparer le crumble, mélangez le sucre, la farine, la poudre à crème et la polenta dans un bol. Ajouter le beurre et incorporer les ingrédients secs jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure grossière, puis réserver.","Pour faire la génoise, mélangez la farine, la polenta, la poudre à crème anglaise, la levure chimique et ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un bol, puis réservez. Dans un deuxième bol, battre le beurre et le reste du sucre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et légèrement éclairci. Ajoutez les œufs un à un en battant bien après chaque ajout. Incorporer la vanille et la crème sure, avant d''incorporer le mélange de farine et le reste de rhubarbe non enrobée de sucre.","Étalez le mélange à gâteau dans le moule préparé, puis recouvrez de rhubarbe enrobée de sucre et répartissez sur la garniture à crumble. Cuire au four 1h-1h10 jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes, puis démouler délicatement et laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille. Coupez-le en tranches pour servir et saupoudrez-le d''un peu de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours. Versez sur la crème double pour servir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:00:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9453,8340,'fr','Muffins beignets à la cannelle et aux pommes','Préparez ces muffins avec des beignets lorsque vous préférez éviter les problèmes de la friture. Pleins de saveurs hivernales, ils sont idéaux pour un thé d’après-midi festif','["110 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","70 g de sucre en poudre, plus 30 g pour saupoudrer","110 g de farine ordinaire tamisée","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de cannelle, plus ½ cuillère à café pour saupoudrer","50 ml de yaourt nature","1 œuf fermier moyen","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","60 g de compote de pommes onctueuse","12 cuillères à café de confiture de myrtilles"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Utiliser du beurre fondu pour badigeonner très légèrement les alvéoles d''un moule à mini muffins 24 trous.","Mélangez 70 g de sucre en poudre avec la farine, le bicarbonate et 1 cuillère à café de cannelle dans un grand bol à mélanger à l''aide d''un fouet pour disperser les grumeaux.","Mélangez le yaourt, l''œuf, la vanille et la compote de pommes avec 110 g de beurre fondu, puis versez dans le mélange de farine. Pliez délicatement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste incorporé, sans grumeaux.","Versez la moitié de la pâte dans le moule à muffins à l''aide d''une petite cuillère à glace ou de deux cuillères à café. Garnir chaque muffin avec ½ cuillère à café de confiture, puis le reste de la pâte. Cuire au four pendant 8 à 9 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et légèrement élastiques lorsqu''on les presse doucement.","Mettez 30 g de sucre en poudre et le reste de cannelle dans un grand bol peu profond et mélangez. Lorsque les muffins sont prêts, laissez-les refroidir 5 minutes dans le moule, puis démoulez-les délicatement à l''aide du bout d''un couteau et roulez chaque muffin beignet tiède dans le sucre à la cannelle. Laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille ou servir chaud. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:00:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9454,8342,'fr','Gâteau collant aux carottes et aux dattes avec glaçage au tahini et à l''érable','Ajoutez des dattes collantes et un glaçage salé-sucré pour propulser le gâteau aux carottes traditionnel vers de nouveaux sommets délicieux. Décorer avec des boutons-pression au sésame et des noix de pécan émiettés','["200 g de dattes dénoyautées","200g de beurre ramolli","4 œufs","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","300 g de farines autolevantes","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","200 g de sucre muscovado léger","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","¼ de muscade fraîche, finement râpée","300 g de carottes (environ 3), bien lavées et râpées grossièrement (pas besoin de les éplucher)","75 g de noix de pécan hachées grossièrement, plus quelques-unes entières pour décorer","60 g de boutons-pression au sésame","100g de fromage à pâte molle","1 cuillère à soupe de tahin","200 g de beurre salé ramolli","600 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Mettez les dattes dans un bol et versez dessus 200 ml d''eau bouillante. Laisser tremper 30 mn.","Tapisser le fond et les côtés de deux moules à gâteau ronds de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Versez les dattes et leur liquide de trempage dans un robot culinaire, puis mixez-les en purée. Ajouter le beurre, les œufs, la vanille, la farine, le bicarbonate, le sucre, la cannelle, le gingembre, la muscade et une pincée de sel et mélanger pour obtenir une pâte à gâteau lisse.","Mettez les carottes dans un grand bol à mélanger et ajoutez le mélange à gâteau ainsi que les pacanes hachées, puis pliez le tout. Répartissez le mélange dans les moules, puis nivelez le dessus avec une spatule. Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés. Un cure-dent inséré au centre doit ressortir propre, sinon remettre au four pendant 5 à 10 minutes. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 20 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille de refroidissement.","Pour faire le glaçage, battez le fromage à pâte molle et le tahini ensemble jusqu''à consistance lisse, si le tahini est très épais, ajoutez un peu de fromage à pâte molle et battez jusqu''à consistance lisse avant d''en ajouter davantage. Ajoutez le beurre, le sucre glace, le sirop d''érable et l''extrait de vanille et battez à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage lisse et mousseux.","Placez l''un des gâteaux sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette et versez une généreuse quantité de glaçage dessus. Étaler sur les bords, puis garnir de l''autre gâteau. Empilez le reste du glaçage sur le dessus et utilisez une spatule ou un couteau à palette pour le travailler sur le dessus et sur les côtés jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement recouvert. Émiettez les boutons de sésame et mélangez-les aux noix de pécan entières. Saupoudrer en cercle sur le dessus du gâteau. Se conserve trois jours au frais."]','2026-01-11 00:00:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9455,8344,'fr','Blondies au beurre de cacahuète et à la gelée','Préparez des blondies avec le combo américain gourmand de beurre de cacahuète et de confiture de fraises. Utilisez n''importe quelle confiture de votre choix : fraise, mûre ou prune feront toutes l''affaire.','["150 g de beurre salé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","100 g de beurre de cacahuète croquant","300 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 œufs , battus","220 g de farine nature","1/2 cuillère à café de levure chimique","6-7 cuillères à soupe de confiture de fraises"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule carré d''environ 20 cm de diamètre et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le beurre de cacahuète, le beurre, la cassonade et la vanille dans une grande casserole à feu doux, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Incorporer les œufs et une généreuse pincée de sel, puis tamiser la farine et la levure chimique et incorporer à l''aide d''une spatule jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé. Disposez la confiture sur le dessus, puis utilisez une pique à brochette pour la faire tourner doucement et créer un effet marbré.","Cuire au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les blondies soient brillants sur le dessus avec une légère oscillation au milieu. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule. Si vous le souhaitez, refroidissez les blondies refroidis pendant 1 heure si vous préférez qu''ils soient fondants. Couper en 16 carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:00:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9456,8346,'fr','Gâteau épicé aux prunes et à la noix de coco','Essayez cette pâtisserie entre la fin de l’été et le début de l’automne. Les prunes se marient si bien avec la noix de coco et les épices. Servir chaud avec une cuillerée de yaourt ou de crème','["200 g de beurre fondu","200 g de yaourt grec aromatisé à la noix de coco, plus un supplément pour servir (facultatif)","200 g de cassonade légère, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","3 œufs moyens","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de farines autolevantes","85 g de noix de coco desséchée","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées moulues","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","4 prunes, coupées en deux, dénoyautées et coupées en quartiers","une poignée de flocons de noix de coco ou un supplément de noix de coco desséchée (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à charnière de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Fouetter le beurre fondu, le yaourt, 200 g de cassonade, les œufs et la vanille dans un pichet. Mélangez la farine, la noix de coco desséchée, la levure chimique, les épices et ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un bol.","Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs et mélangez pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Versez dans le moule, puis disposez les prunes dessus. Répartir sur 1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade et de flocons de noix de coco, le cas échéant. Cuire au four pendant 1 h 10, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé, doré et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu du gâteau en ressorte propre.","Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir légèrement. Servir chaud avec une cuillerée de yaourt à la noix de coco, si vous le souhaitez, ou laisser refroidir complètement. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique pendant trois jours ou congelé pendant trois mois."]','2026-01-11 00:00:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9457,8348,'fr','Gâteau aux carottes et muffins au fromage à la crème','Pour une nouvelle version d''un favori, essayez ces muffins au gâteau aux carottes, parfumés d''épices réconfortantes et fourrés d''un centre de fromage à pâte molle gluant.','["175 g de sucre mou roux clair, plus 1 cuillère à soupe pour saupoudrer","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","1½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","2 œufs","150 ml d''huile de tournesol","1 orange , zestée","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","175 g de carottes Morrisons Market Street, pelées et râpées","50g de raisins secs","50 g de noix hachées grossièrement","100 g de fromage à pâte molle entière"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de caissettes. Dans un grand bol, mélanger le sucre, la farine, le bicarbonate, la cannelle et le gingembre avec une pincée de sel.","Dans un pichet, fouetter les œufs, l''huile, le zeste d''orange et la vanille. Verser dans les ingrédients secs, ajouter les carottes Morrisons, les raisins secs et les noix et mélanger avec une spatule pour bien mélanger.","Versez 2 cuillères à soupe du mélange dans chaque moule à muffins. Garnir de ½ cuillère à soupe de fromage à pâte molle, puis terminer avec le reste du mélange de gâteau aux carottes. Saupoudrez une pincée de cassonade sur chacun et faites cuire au four pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés. Laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:00:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9458,8350,'fr','Gâteau aux pommes allemand','Utilisez vos pommes préférées pour préparer ce gâteau aux pommes allemand traditionnel. Dégustez-le avec le thé de l''après-midi ou prenez un café le matin','["125 g de beurre à température ambiante, plus un peu pour le moule","220 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","175 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 citron , zesté et pressé","4 œufs","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","40g de farine de maïs","100 ml de lait","800 g de pommes de table épépinées et coupées en quartiers","2 cuillères à café de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à charnière de 23 cm et saupoudrer de farine. Battre le beurre ramolli avec 115 g de sucre et une pincée de sel pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et crémeux. Ajouter l''extrait de vanille, le zeste et le jus de citron et mélanger jusqu''à homogénéité.","Séparez les œufs en mettant les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol à mélanger. Utilisez un batteur électrique à main pour battre les blancs avec le reste du sucre jusqu''à formation de pics fermes. Mélangez les jaunes d''oeufs au mélange beurre et sucre.","Mélangez la farine avec la levure chimique et la maïzena, puis versez-y le mélange beurre, sucre et jaune. Mélangez, puis incorporez le lait suivi d''une cuillerée de blancs d''œufs. Une fois le tout incorporé, incorporez délicatement les blancs d''œufs restants à la pâte.","Versez la pâte dans le moule à charnière. Pressez les pommes dans la pâte, côté coupé vers le bas, et faites cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir un moment dans le moule, puis transférer sur une grille de refroidissement. Saupoudrer de sucre glace. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:00:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9459,8352,'fr','Florentines aux amandes, oranges et gingembre','Présentez ces florentins dans le cadre d’un coffret cadeau gourmand à Noël. Avec du gingembre, de l''orange, des amandes et une garniture au chocolat, ils sont délicieusement décadents','["huile sans saveur, pour la boîte","50g de beurre salé","50 g de sucre brun clair muscovado","50g de sirop doré","50g de farine nature","50 g de gingembre en tige, haché grossièrement","125 g d''amandes effilées","2 oranges , zestées","175g de chocolat noir","175g de chocolat blanc"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Badigeonner légèrement le fond et les côtés d''un moule à muffins à 12 trous avec de l''huile. Faire fondre le beurre, le sucre et le golden sirop dans une petite casserole à feu doux en remuant fréquemment. Retirer du feu et incorporer la farine, puis ajouter le gingembre, les amandes effilées et le zeste d''orange.","Versez 1 cuillère à soupe plate du mélange dans chaque trou du moule à muffins. Il se peut qu''il vous reste un peu de mélange, mais vous pouvez cuire par lots. Cuire au four 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Laisser refroidir pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment ferme pour être transféré sur une grille et refroidir complètement. Répétez avec n’importe quel mélange restant.","Faites fondre le chocolat noir et le chocolat blanc dans deux bols différents, chacun au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante (en veillant à ce que les bols ne touchent pas l''eau), ou au micro-ondes par rafales de 30 secondes. Trempez la moitié d''une florentine refroidie dans le chocolat noir puis arrosez-la de chocolat blanc. Laisser prendre sur une grille. Se conserve une semaine dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:00:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9460,8354,'fr','Tartes au pain d''épices','Combinez deux pâtisseries de Noël très traditionnelles – le pain d’épices et les tartelettes – pour créer un classique moderne et brillant. Garnir de mini personnages en pain d''épices.','["400 g de viande hachée (assurer végétarienne, si nécessaire)","50 g de tige de gingembre hachée et 1 cuillère à soupe de sirop de gingembre du pot","250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","125 g de beurre doux froid coupé en petits morceaux","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 œuf battu","Emporte-pièce rond de 8 cm","coupe-biscuits mini bonhomme en pain d''épices"]','["Pour la pâte, versez la farine, les épices et le beurre dans un grand bol avec une grosse pincée de sel. Frottez du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine. Incorporer le sucre. Ajoutez l''œuf et utilisez un couteau à couverts pour mélanger le tout jusqu''à ce que les ingrédients commencent à s''agglutiner. Versez sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez brièvement jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Ou bien, mélangez les ingrédients dans un robot culinaire. Façonner en disque, puis envelopper et réfrigérer pendant au moins 30 minutes. Se conservera au frais une journée ou au congélateur pendant trois mois.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Mélanger la viande hachée avec le gingembre et le sirop. Abaisser la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné sur 3 mm d''épaisseur. Découpez 12 disques à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 8 cm et pressez légèrement dans un moule à cupcake 12 trous.","Remplissez chaque fond de tarte avec 1 cuillère à soupe du mélange de viande hachée. Reroulez les chutes de pâte et découpez 12 mini bonhommes en pain d''épices, puis placez-en un sur chaque tarte. Se conserve au congélateur jusqu''à deux mois.","Cuire au four 20 minutes ou 30 minutes après surgelé. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Saupoudrer de sucre glace. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:00:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9461,8356,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat, à l''huile d''olive et aux noisettes englouti','Offrez-vous un gâteau avec une belle garniture croustillante qui laisse place à un milieu moelleux et gluant. Avec sa génoise sans farine, il est idéal pour les convives qui ne peuvent pas manger de gluten','["100 g de noisettes blanchies, hachées grossièrement (voir astuce ci-dessous)","175 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu pour la boîte","200 g de chocolat noir 70% haché grossièrement","5 œufs , séparés","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace et glace vanille, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer une poêle sèche à feu moyen et versez-y les noisettes. Faire griller, en secouant la poêle de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et parfumé. Transférer dans une assiette pour refroidir complètement, puis verser dans un robot culinaire et mixer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit finement haché, comme de la chapelure.","Huiler et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm. Versez le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et placez-le sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en vous assurant que la base du bol ne touche pas l''eau. Faites fondre le chocolat en remuant de temps en temps. Vous pouvez également faire fondre par petits coups au micro-ondes. Une fois complètement fondu, retirez du feu et versez lentement l''huile d''olive en fouettant constamment jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et brillante.","Battez les jaunes d''œufs et 50 g de sucre en poudre dans un autre bol jusqu''à ce que le mélange blanchisse et épaississe, environ 5 minutes. Incorporez délicatement le mélange de jaunes d''œufs fouetté au mélange de chocolat avec les noisettes hachées et une pincée de sel marin. (Il n’est pas encore nécessaire que les ingrédients soient complètement combinés.) Réserver.","Fouetter les blancs d''œufs et le sucre restant dans un bol séparé, à l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou d''un fouet électrique, jusqu''à formation de pics moyennement mous. Utilisez une grande cuillère en métal pour incorporer un peu de blancs au mélange chocolaté afin de les détacher, puis incorporez délicatement le reste. Versez délicatement la pâte dans le moule préparé. Se conservera enveloppé au congélateur jusqu''à deux mois.","Si vous ne congelez pas le gâteau, chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et faites cuire au four pendant 35 à 45 minutes. Pour cuire surgelé, chauffez le four comme ci-dessus, mais faites cuire au four pendant 55 à 60 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte presque propre, avec juste quelques miettes qui s''y accrochent. Laisser refroidir dans le moule jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud, puis retirer délicatement le fond et les côtés du moule. Saupoudrez de sucre glace et servez avec des boules de glace vanille, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:00:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9462,8358,'fr','Génoise','Apprenez à réaliser la génoise parfaite avec une texture légère et aérienne. Le superbe gâteau étagé de Paul Hollywood tire le meilleur parti des baies d''été et de la crème','["50 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de farine nature + un peu pour saupoudrer","250 g de sucre en poudre et 1 cuillère à soupe","8 œufs moyens","Pot de 600 ml de crème double","400 g de fraises barquette, coupées en deux","180 g de barquette de myrtilles","150 g de framboises barquette","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Badigeonner 2 moules à cake de 20 cm de beurre fondu, tapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé, puis bien saupoudrer de farine en éliminant l''excédent. Annuler.","Mettez le sucre et les œufs dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur, puis placez-le sur une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante. Fouetter avec un fouet électrique à main pendant environ 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et triple de volume. Retirez du feu, puis versez lentement le beurre en l''incorporant au fur et à mesure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement mélangé.","Incorporez délicatement la farine et une pincée de sel au mélange d''œufs, puis versez dans vos moules à gâteau préparés. Cuire 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit doré et levé – un cure-dent enfoncé dans le gâteau doit en ressortir propre. Laissez les gâteaux refroidir quelques minutes dans le moule, puis retirez-les et laissez-les refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Pendant ce temps, fouettez la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle conserve sa forme, puis réservez. Mélangez environ un quart des fraises avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez cette purée à la crème pour obtenir un effet d''entraînement.","Pour assembler les gâteaux, coupez chacun en deux horizontalement. Disposez un biscuit sur une assiette de service, étalez dessus un quart du mélange de crème, puis parsemez un quart des myrtilles et des framboises sur le pourtour. Répétez cette étape encore deux fois, posez la dernière couche de gâteau dessus (conservez une moitié supérieure du gâteau pour la couche supérieure), étalez le reste de crème dessus, puis disposez les myrtilles et les framboises sur le pourtour et empilez les fraises au centre. Saupoudrez de sucre glace juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:00:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9463,8360,'fr','Lasagnes classiques','Préparez à l’avance ces lasagnes maison faciles et conservez-les au congélateur, non cuites, lorsque vous en aurez besoin pendant une semaine chargée. Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes supplémentaires','["2 huiles d''olive, plus un peu pour le plat","750 g de bœuf haché maigre","90 g de jambon","800g de passata ou la moitié de notre sauce tomate de base","200 ml de bouillon de bœuf chaud","noix de muscade","300 g de feuilles de lasagnes fraîches","sauce blanche (trouver une recette dans la méthode, ou utiliser du commerce)","125 g de boule de mozzarella déchirée en fines lanières"]','["Pour préparer la sauce à la viande, faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle et faites cuire 750 g de viande hachée maigre en deux fois pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit entièrement dorée.","Hachez finement 4 tranches de prosciutto d''un paquet de 90 g, puis incorporez-les au mélange de viande.","Versez dessus 800 g de passata ou la moitié de notre recette de base de sauce tomate et 200 ml de bouillon de bœuf chaud. Ajoutez un peu de muscade râpée, puis assaisonnez.","Portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce soit riche.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et huiler légèrement un plat allant au four (environ 30 x 20 cm).","Versez un tiers de la sauce à la viande dans le plat, puis recouvrez de quelques feuilles de lasagnes fraîches en paquet de 300 g. Arroser d''environ 130 g de sauce blanche toute prête ou faite maison.","Répétez jusqu''à ce que vous ayez trois couches de pâtes. Couvrir avec les 390 g de sauce blanche restants en veillant à ce qu''aucune pâte ne dépasse.","Répartir 125 g de mozzarella déchirée sur le dessus.","Disposez le reste du prosciutto dessus. Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus bouillonne et soit légèrement doré."]','2026-01-11 00:00:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9464,8362,'fr','Pain halloumi et chipotle','Savourez un pain rempli de textures délicieuses et de saveurs relevées, avec du halloumi crémeux et la chaleur du chipotle fumé et sucré. Déguster avec du beurre','["500 g de farine à pain forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","25 g de beurre doux, ramolli","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de sel fin","huile végétale, pour lever","250 g de halloumi râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de flocons de piment chipotle"]','["Pesez la farine dans un grand bol. Frottez le beurre ramolli avec vos doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de fines miettes. Ajoutez la levure et le sucre d''un côté du bol et le sel de l''autre. À l’aide d’une spatule, mélangez le tout pour combiner.","Faites un puits au centre et versez-y 300 ml d''eau tiède. A l''aide de la spatule, mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte grossière. Versez la pâte sur le plan de travail et rassemblez-la en un gros tas.","Pétrir la pâte à la main pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou au batteur sur socle équipé du crochet pétrisseur pendant 6 à 8 minutes à haute vitesse jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Huiler un grand bol et y déposer la pâte. Couvrir et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Une fois que la pâte a doublé, versez-la sur le plan de travail et aplatissez-la pour éliminer les poches d''air. Saupoudrer le halloumi en une couche uniforme, puis les flocons de chipotle. Replier la pâte et pétrir le fromage et le piment jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient uniformément répartis. Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé.","Rentrez les bords de la pâte au centre jusqu''à obtenir une boule de pâte bien nette. Transférez-le sur le plateau, couture vers le bas, couvrez d''un torchon propre et laissez lever encore une heure jusqu''à ce qu''il double à nouveau de volume. Vous saurez que la pâte est prête lorsque vous la piquez avec votre doigt – si elle rebondit lentement et qu’il reste une petite empreinte, elle est prête.","Chauffez le four à 240°C/220°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 avec un plat à rôtir sur la grille inférieure. Découvrez la pâte et tamisez légèrement un peu de farine dessus. Découpez une croix sur le dessus à l''aide de la pointe d''un couteau dentelé bien aiguisé.","Mettez le pain sur sa plaque dans le plat à rôtir, puis versez un peu d''eau chaude dans le moule autour de la plaque pour créer de la vapeur pendant la cuisson. Cela vous donnera une croûte croustillante. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le pain soit doré et sonne creux lorsque vous tapotez la base.","Retirer du four et laisser refroidir sur une grille. Couper en tranches et déguster avec du beurre."]','2026-01-11 00:00:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9465,8364,'fr','Plateau de chou-rave rôti','Chou-rave rôti avec des petites tomates italiennes et garnir de crème fraîche et de ciboulette pour un dîner ou un accompagnement plein de saveurs. C''est un bon plat pour l''automne','["2 gros chou-rave (environ 1,3 kg), pelés et coupés en quartiers","230 g de petites tomates italiennes","3 brins de thym","1 piment rouge, haché grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de graines de coriandre écrasées (facultatif)","5 gousses d''ail, écrasées","25 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un filet","10 g de ciboulette finement tranchée","5 g de bouquet de basilic finement haché","1 citron vert, zesté et pressé","125g crème fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 240°C/220°C chaleur tournante/gaz 9. Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie à bords hauts de papier sulfurisé. Versez le chou-rave, les tomates, le thym, le piment, la coriandre (le cas échéant) et l''ail non pelé sur le plateau. Répartir sur les cubes de beurre et arroser d''huile. Assaisonnez bien, puis mélangez. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes. Baissez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et laissez cuire 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et légèrement carbonisé.","Mélanger les ingrédients de la garniture dans un bol et assaisonner. Laissez le chou-rave refroidir pendant 5 minutes, puis versez-le sur la vinaigrette et arrosez d''un peu d''huile."]','2026-01-11 00:00:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9466,8366,'fr','Cuisson de pâtes au thon à la friteuse','Préparez ce classique des plats réconfortants avec votre friteuse à air. Garnir de mozzarella et servir chaud avec une salade ou vos accompagnements préférés','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon , finement haché","2 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment (facultatif)","150 g de pâtes au choix, cuites selon les instructions du paquet","145-165g de thon à l''huile d''olive en boîte, égoutté","50 g de mozzarella râpée","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché"]','["Chauffer la friteuse à 190°C. Versez l''huile, l''oignon et l''ail dans un plat résistant à la chaleur et faites frire à l''air libre pendant 3 minutes. Ajoutez les tomates et les flocons de piment, le cas échéant, ainsi qu''un peu d''assaisonnement. Faites frire à l''air libre pendant 5 minutes supplémentaires.","Réduisez la température à 170°C. Incorporer les pâtes cuites, le thon, la majeure partie de la mozzarella et le persil. Répartir la mozzarella réservée sur le dessus.","Faire frire à l''air libre pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, puis couvrir de papier d''aluminium et cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles bouillonnent. Servir chaud avec une salade."]','2026-01-11 00:00:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9467,8368,'fr','Petits pains collants Baklava','Unissez des petits pains collants avec du baklava turc pour réaliser ces magnifiques petits pains. La garniture est richement épicée et remplie de pistaches, de noix et d''orange.','["500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","3 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","320 ml de lait entier","70g de beurre doux","un peu d''huile, pour lever","100 g de beurre ramolli","3 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","2 grosses oranges , zestées","130g de noix","130g de pistaches","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","pincée de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","100g de miel","1 cuillère à soupe de jus d''orange"]','["Mélangez la farine, la levure, le sucre et ½ cuillère à café de sel fin dans un grand bol. Faites chauffer le lait et le beurre dans une petite casserole à feu doux, en remuant régulièrement la poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à fumer. Verser dans un bol et laisser refroidir à température ambiante.","Faire un puits avec les ingrédients secs, puis y verser le mélange lait et beurre. Mélangez rapidement à l''aide d''une cuillère, puis démoulez sur un plan fariné et pétrissez la pâte pendant 10 minutes. Ou faites-le au batteur sur socle en utilisant le crochet pétrisseur pendant 7 minutes. Transférer dans un bol légèrement huilé, couvrir et laisser dans un endroit chaud doubler de volume pendant au moins 1 heure. Alternativement, pour une meilleure saveur, laissez la pâte lever au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Pour la garniture, utilisez une cuillère en bois pour battre ensemble le beurre, le sucre et le zeste d''orange. Hachez finement les noix et 100 g de pistaches – à la main ou au robot culinaire. Incorporer au mélange de beurre avec la cannelle, le piment de la Jamaïque et ¼ cuillère à café de sel marin fin.","Versez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée, formez un rectangle grossier, puis étalez-la jusqu''à ce qu''elle mesure environ 45 x 35 cm. Étalez le beurre de noix et de cannelle sur la pâte, jusqu''aux bords. En travaillant à partir de l''un des côtés les plus longs, enroulez la pâte aussi étroitement que possible en forme de saucisse. Couper en 12 morceaux égaux. (Vous pouvez marquer avec une règle à environ 3,5 à 4 cm par petit pain, puis couper avec un morceau de fil dentaire, du fil ou un couteau bien aiguisé.) Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie ou un moule de 20 x 30 cm de papier sulfurisé.","Disposez les petits pains, côté coupé vers le haut, dans le plateau. Assurez-vous que les queues des petits pains (là où la pâte s''ouvre) sont rentrées afin qu''elles ne se déploient pas à la cuisson. Laissez un peu d''espace autour de chaque chignon, car ils se dilateront. Couvrez légèrement et laissez lever pendant 30 à 45 minutes (selon la température de votre cuisine) jusqu''à ce que les petits pains soient gonflés et se touchent sur les côtés. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et levé.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le sirop. Mettez le sucre et le miel dans une petite casserole, laissez mijoter 5 minutes puis retirez du feu. Laisser refroidir, puis incorporer le jus d''orange. Sortez les petits pains du four, versez immédiatement dessus le sirop et laissez refroidir.","Hachez finement les pistaches restantes et saupoudrez-les sur les petits pains en petits monticules – comme on le fait sur le baklava. Servir chaud. Se conserve trois jours dans un contenant hermétique. Réchauffer brièvement au four avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:00:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9468,8370,'fr','Muffins crumble aux framboises et chocolat blanc','Mélangez des framboises acidulées avec des pépites de chocolat blanc, une génoise légère et une garniture grillée pour réaliser ces muffins gourmands. Ils sont idéaux pour une collation en milieu de matinée','["100 g de beurre doux, ramolli","65 g de sucre en poudre","65 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 gros œufs, à température ambiante","125 g de yaourt grec","1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","5 cuillères à soupe de lait","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","175 g de framboises (fraîches ou surgelées)","90 g de pépites de chocolat blanc","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","3 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","50 g de beurre doux froid, coupé en cubes","50 g de flocons d''avoine"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de caissettes en papier. Mettez tous les ingrédients du crumble dans un bol avec une pincée de sel et frottez du bout des doigts jusqu''à obtenir un mélange friable.","Pour les muffins, battre le beurre et les sucres ensemble pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter les œufs progressivement en battant jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer le yaourt, la vanille et le lait.","Incorporez la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel fin jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Incorporez enfin les framboises et les pépites de chocolat blanc et remplissez les moules à muffins en laissant un petit vide en haut. Couvrir les muffins d''une couche de crumble et cuire au four pendant 10 minutes, puis réduire le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et cuire encore 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés, et qu''un bâton à cocktail inséré au centre en ressorte propre."]','2026-01-11 00:00:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9469,8372,'fr','Cheesecake basque brûlé','Essayez ce cheesecake cuit à la manière espagnole avec un extérieur bruni. Avec des notes douces-amères de style crème caramel et un centre crémeux mais léger, c''est paradisiaque','["beurre, pour le moule","800 g de fromage à pâte molle","225 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","200 g de crème sure","4 œufs moyens","2 cuillères à café de vanille"]','["Chauffez le four à 240°C/220°C chaleur tournante/gaz 9 en vous assurant qu''il y a suffisamment d''espace au-dessus de la grille du milieu. Beurrer un moule à cake profond ou à charnière de 20 cm de diamètre. Posez deux grandes feuilles de papier sulfurisé, l''une sur l''autre, une feuille tournée à 45 degrés, de sorte que les coins pointent dans des directions différentes. Poussez le parchemin dans le moule, en appuyant dans les coins et en vous assurant qu''une grande quantité de papier dépasse au-dessus du bord. Repassez les plis sur les côtés, mais ne vous inquiétez pas de trop bien tapisser le moule : les rainures du papier sulfurisé donnent à ce cheesecake son aspect caractéristique.","Versez le fromage à pâte molle et le sucre dans un grand bol ou sur un batteur sur socle. Battez le tout à l''aide d''un fouet électrique (ou d''un batteur sur socle) pendant une minute ou deux, jusqu''à ce que les grains de sucre soient dissous – vérifiez cela en frottant un peu du mélange entre le bout des doigts. Si le mélange est granuleux, continuez à mélanger pendant environ une minute.","Versez la farine, la crème sure, les œufs, la vanille et ¼ cuillère à café de sel dans le bol et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Versez dans votre moule à gâteau tapissé, en grattant jusqu''au dernier morceau du mélange de cheesecake. Donnez un coup sec au moule sur le plan de travail pour éliminer les bulles d''air, puis enfournez pour 30 minutes.","Une fois cuit, le cheesecake doit être profondément caramélisé à l''extérieur et gonflé comme un soufflé. Il vacillera encore lorsque vous secouerez la boîte. Laissez-le refroidir complètement dans le moule – il coulera en refroidissant. Réfrigérer au moins 1 heure avant de servir. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:00:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9470,8374,'fr','Tarte tatin d''oignons rouges','Mettez l''oignon rouge au centre de cette vibrante tarte tatin faite avec une base de pâte feuilletée et servie avec une salsa verde percutante. C''est un plat idéal pour recevoir','["320 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","50g de beurre doux","3 gros oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers, laissant la majeure partie de la racine intacte","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","30 g de sucre mou roux clair","une petite poignée de persil plat haché grossièrement","une petite poignée de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement","une petite poignée de ciboulette finement hachée","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres, hachées grossièrement","1 citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","80 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Dérouler la feuille de pâte feuilletée en retirant le papier sulfurisé. Découpez un cercle de 25 cm de côté dans la pâte en utilisant comme gabarit une poêle allant au four. Placer le cercle de pâtisserie sur un plateau et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Faire fondre le beurre dans la même poêle à feu moyen. Une fois mousseux, disposez les oignons en cercles concentriques dans la poêle, en les emballant bien, et réduisez le feu à doux. Assaisonner avec une pincée de sel et cuire 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons commencent à caraméliser. Gardez-les à l’œil pour qu’ils ne brûlent pas.","Ajoutez le vinaigre et le sucre et baissez le feu à moyen-doux. Cuire encore 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un glaçage collant se forme au fond de la poêle et que les oignons soient profondément caramélisés. Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et posez-la sur les oignons en la rentrant sur le pourtour. Piquez-le partout à l''aide d''une fourchette, puis transférez au four et faites cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée et gonflée.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la salsa verde. Mélangez les herbes et les câpres dans un grand bol, puis ajoutez le jus de citron, le vinaigre et l''huile d''olive. Assaisonner avec du sel, du poivre et une pincée de sucre.","Sortez la tarte tatin du four et laissez-la refroidir 5 min. Posez une grande assiette sur le moule et retournez la tarte tatin dessus en laissant le moule en place (vous devrez utiliser des gants de cuisine car le moule sera encore chaud). Laissez le moule à l''envers sur l''assiette pendant quelques minutes supplémentaires (cela aidera la tarte à se détacher naturellement du fond), puis retirez le moule et versez-la sur la salsa verde avant de la couper en quartiers pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:00:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9471,8376,'fr','Pudding au four','Pour une alternative chaleureuse et confortable à la tarte Bakewell, essayez de préparer ce pud à base d''œufs. Il est préférable de le servir avec de la crème ou de la glace','["320 g de pâte feuilletée pur beurre toute prête","150 g de beurre ramolli","150 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs","150 g d''amandes moulues","1 citron , zesté","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","3 cuillères à soupe de confiture de framboise","25g d''amandes effilées","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Déroulez la pâte et utilisez-la pour tapisser un moule à gâteau ou à tarte de 20 cm aux bords inclinés. Coupez la pâte en laissant dépasser environ 2 cm. Refroidissez le fond de tarte pendant que vous préparez la garniture. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Battre le beurre et le sucre dans un bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse.  Ajouter les œufs, la poudre d''amandes, le zeste de citron, l''extrait d''amande et une pincée de sel, puis battre à nouveau jusqu''à homogénéité. Sortez le fond de tarte du réfrigérateur et étalez la confiture sur son fond, puis versez-y le mélange d''amandes et d''œufs en lissant jusqu''aux bords à l''aide d''une spatule. Répartissez dessus les amandes effilées et enfournez pendant 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Laisser refroidir au moins 30 minutes, puis saupoudrer de sucre glace et servir avec de la crème ou de la glace. Se conserve quelques jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:00:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9472,8378,'fr','Brownies aux courgettes','Cultiver des courgettes au jardin ? Utilisez-les pour préparer ces glorieux brownies aux courgettes et au fondant parsemés de pépites de chocolat. Servir avec de la glace vanille','["200 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","120 g de farine nature","50g de cacao en poudre","200 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","4 œufs","300 g de sucre en poudre","1 courgette (environ 300 g), râpée","100 g de pépites de chocolat au lait"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake ou une plaque à pâtisserie de 30 x 20 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Tamisez la farine et le cacao dans un bol et réservez.","Faites fondre le beurre et le chocolat noir dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d’eau frémissante, en veillant à ce que le bol ne touche pas l’eau. Ou faites-le par courtes rafales dans le micro-ondes. Une fois fondu, laisser refroidir légèrement.","Battre les œufs et le sucre ensemble dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et double de volume. (Lorsque vous soulevez les batteurs, le mélange doit laisser une trace qui dure 2-3 secondes.) Incorporez le mélange de chocolat fondu suivi du mélange de farine, puis de la courgette râpée et des pépites de chocolat au lait. Faites-le doucement pour retenir autant d''air que possible dans la pâte.","Versez la pâte dans le moule préparé, nivelez doucement la surface avec une spatule ou un couteau à palette et faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste prise – le dessus doit avoir une croûte brillante, mais le centre doit avoir une légère oscillation. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, environ 1 h. Retirer sur une planche et couper en 16 morceaux. Se conservera dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:00:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9473,8380,'fr','Gâteau marbré','Si vous avez besoin d''un gâteau simple mais impressionnant pour une fête ou une vente de pâtisseries caritative, essayez cette génoise au chocolat et à la vanille.','["180 g de beurre très mou, plus un peu pour le moule","6 œufs, séparés","300g de sucre semoule","250 ml de lait ou de crème","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre vanillé","450 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 2,5 litres. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Battre les jaunes d''œufs avec le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient plus clairs, puis incorporer le beurre ramolli suivi du lait ou de la crème.","Dans un autre bol, battre les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils forment des pics mous, puis ajouter le sucre vanillé et battre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes. Incorporer la farine et la levure chimique au mélange de jaunes, puis incorporer les blancs d''œufs.","Versez la moitié de la pâte dans le moule, incorporez la poudre de cacao au reste de la pâte, puis versez sur la couche de vanille. Utilisez le manche d’une cuillère pour mélanger les pâtes ensemble. Cuire au four environ 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit levé et légèrement doré et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre.","Sortez le gâteau du four, laissez-le refroidir un moment dans le moule, puis démoulez-le et laissez-le refroidir complètement sur une grille. Saupoudrer de sucre glace au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:00:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9474,8382,'fr','Plateau de cuisson au citron et aux fleurs de sureau','Cette variante astucieuse du plat de cuisson classique a une saveur florale délicate, ce qui le rend idéal pour servir lors des garden-partys printanières ou des ventes de pâtisseries.','["250 g de crème de citron, plus un peu pour décorer","250 g de beurre ramolli","250 g de sucre en poudre","2 citrons, zestés","4 œufs","100 g de farines autolevantes","150 g d''amandes moulues","200 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","125 g de beurre doux froid, coupé en cubes","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 citron, zesté","1 jaune d''oeuf","200 g de sucre glace","2 citrons pressés (utiliser les citrons zestés ci-dessus)","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la pâte. Versez la farine, le beurre, le sucre et le zeste de citron dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine. Ajoutez le jaune d''œuf et ½ à 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau froide et mixez à nouveau pour rassembler le tout en une pâte. Si la pâte ne se rassemble pas, ajoutez plus d''eau froide, ½ cuillère à café à la fois, et mixez à nouveau. Étalez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée sur une épaisseur de 3 mm, puis utilisez-la pour tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake ou à brownie à fond meuble (le nôtre mesurait 20 x 30 cm). Transférer au réfrigérateur et réfrigérer 20 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser le fond de tarte réfrigéré de papier sulfurisé et de fèves au four, puis enfourner pendant 15 minutes. Retirez le papier sulfurisé et les haricots et enfournez encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit légèrement dorée. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes avant de l''étaler sur la crème au citron en laissant une bordure de 2 cm sur les bords (elle s''étalera lorsque la pâte à gâteau sera versée dessus). Baissez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Battre le beurre, le sucre et le zeste de citron ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou au batteur sur socle jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle, léger et mousseux, environ 8 minutes. Battez les œufs un à un avec 1 cuillère à soupe de farine, puis incorporez le reste de la farine et la poudre d''amandes. Versez délicatement la pâte sur la crème au citron et étalez-la délicatement avec le dos de la cuillère, puis enfournez pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis retirer délicatement sur une planche.","Pour faire le glaçage, mélangez le sucre glace, le jus de citron et le cordial de fleur de sureau jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient suffisamment lâches pour en arroser la génoise, puis ajoutez du caillé de citron supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez. Couper en carrés et servir. Se conserve dans une boîte hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:00:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9475,8384,'fr','Muffins aux panais épicés et à l''érable','Vous avez une surabondance de panais ? Faites quelque chose de différent avec cette boîte de légumes préférée et préparez des muffins épicés au panais et à l''érable pour le moule à gâteau.','["200 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","1 cuillère à café de muscade moulue","125 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 panais (environ 200g), pelé et râpé","100 g de noix de pécan hachées, plus 10 à 12 noix de pécan entières pour servir (facultatif)","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable","3 œufs","125 ml d''huile végétale","50g de sucre glace","50g de beurre ramolli","100g de fromage à pâte molle","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable, plus un peu pour arroser (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de caissettes en papier. Tamisez la farine, la levure chimique, la cannelle et la muscade dans un grand bol. Versez le sucre et frottez les grumeaux entre vos doigts pour les briser.","Incorporer le panais râpé et les pacanes hachées, en veillant à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le sirop d''érable dans un pichet et mélangez les œufs et l''huile. Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs et mélangez avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient presque combinés avec quelques grains de farine restants. Versez environ 2 cuillères à soupe de pâte dans chaque casier, pour qu''ils soient remplis aux trois quarts environ. Cuire au four pendant 22 à 24 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu d''un muffin en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes avant de transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. Tamisez le sucre dans un bol et incorporez le beurre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique. Incorporer le fromage à pâte molle et le sirop d''érable. Si le glaçage est trop lâche, fouettez encore quelques minutes ou laissez refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il se solidifie à nouveau.","Versez ou déposez le glaçage sur les muffins refroidis, puis arrosez d''un peu de sirop d''érable, saupoudrez de cannelle et décorez chacun d''entre eux avec une noix de pécan entière, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:00:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9476,8386,'fr','Roulade de Pâques aux trois chocolats','Préparez cette roulade très riche pour le dimanche de Pâques – c''est presque comme un croisement entre un gâteau et un brownie','["huile végétale, pour la boîte","150 g de chocolat noir haché","5 œufs","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","110 g de chocolat blanc haché","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","250 g de mascarpone","200 ml de crème fraîche","200 ml de crème fraîche","200 g de chocolat au lait haché","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","un mélange de mini œufs en chocolat, pour décorer","tablettes de chocolat blanc et noir, grossièrement hachées ou brisées, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et huiler légèrement un moule à rouleau suisse de 33 x 23 cm. Tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé, puis huiler légèrement à nouveau. Faites fondre le chocolat noir dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante (en vous assurant que le fond du bol ne touche pas l''eau), ou par tranches de 20 secondes au micro-ondes. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Séparez les œufs en mettant les blancs dans un grand bol et les jaunes dans un autre. Montez les blancs en neige ferme à l''aide d''un fouet électrique : ils doivent conserver leur forme. Versez le sucre dans les jaunes et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle. Incorporez le chocolat noir fondu au mélange de jaunes, puis détendez le mélange chocolaté en incorporant deux grosses cuillerées de blancs d''œufs montés en neige. Ajoutez le reste des blancs d''œufs battus, le cacao et ¼ de cuillère à café de sel, et pliez délicatement le tout pour combiner, en faisant attention de ne pas faire tomber l''air. Versez la pâte dans le moule préparé et enfournez pendant 18 minutes. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud.","Pendant que la génoise est encore chaude, enroulez-la délicatement en spirale (avec le papier sulfurisé à l''intérieur) à partir de l''une des extrémités courtes. Laisser refroidir complètement, encore enroulé (cela facilitera le roulage une fois rempli). Faites fondre le chocolat blanc comme vous avez fait le noir, puis laissez refroidir 10 min. Fouetter ensemble la vanille, le mascarpone, la crème double et le chocolat blanc fondu jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et utilisable à la cuillère.","Disposez la roulade enroulée sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé et démêlez-la soigneusement. Retirez le papier sulfurisé d''origine, puis étalez uniformément la garniture au mascarpone et au chocolat blanc sur le biscuit en laissant une petite bordure sur les bords. En vous guidant sur le papier sulfurisé, enroulez la roulade en spirale et placez-la au réfrigérateur pendant 20 minutes.","Pour la garniture, faites chauffer la crème double dans une petite casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fumante. Versez le chocolat au lait dans un bol résistant à la chaleur avec le sirop doré, puis versez dessus la crème chaude. Laisser reposer un moment, puis mélanger le tout jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu et lisse. Placez la roulade sur une grille posée sur une plaque à pâtisserie et versez délicatement la ganache sur le dessus pour qu''elle coule sur les côtés. Garnir la roulade avec les mini œufs en chocolat et les morceaux de chocolat, puis laisser reposer légèrement avant de la couper en tranches. Se conservera couvert et au frais jusqu''à 24 heures."]','2026-01-11 00:00:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9477,8388,'fr','Tarte au chocolat facile','Parfaite pour un dîner, cette tarte végétalienne a une base digestive croquante et une garniture crémeuse au chocolat au lait de coco','["350g de biscuits digestifs","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","125-175 g de margarine ou de beurre végétalien, plus un peu pour la boîte","2 boîtes de 400 g de lait de coco réfrigéré","200 g de chocolat noir","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","spray comestible à paillettes argentées ou dorées","framboises"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Réduire les biscuits en miettes dans un bol à l''aide du bout d''un rouleau à pâtisserie ou en pulsant dans un robot culinaire. Mélangez la poudre de cacao, la farine, le sirop et suffisamment de margarine ou de beurre végétalien pour créer une pâte. Beurrer un moule à tarte de 23 cm de diamètre et presser le mélange dans le moule.","Cuire au four 10 à 12 minutes, puis laisser refroidir dans le moule.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Ouvrez les boîtes de lait de coco qui se seront séparées avec l''eau en haut et la noix de coco épaisse en bas. Jetez l’eau (ou utilisez-la pour faire un smoothie) et versez la noix de coco épaisse dans un bol.","Cassez le chocolat noir en morceaux et faites-le fondre au micro-ondes à puissance élevée par rafales de 10 secondes, en remuant entre les deux, ou dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez la noix de coco avec le sirop doré et fouettez ensemble en battant fort jusqu''à ce qu''il ne reste plus de grumeaux de noix de coco.","Versez la garniture sur le fond de tarte et mettez au réfrigérateur pendant 3 à 4 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Vaporisez la tarte avec un spray comestible à paillettes argentées ou dorées, si vous le souhaitez, et servez avec des framboises. Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant trois jours – elle est en fait encore meilleure un ou deux jours après la cuisson."]','2026-01-11 00:00:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9478,8390,'fr','Mücver au four (cuisson de courgettes et feta)','Transformez les beignets de courgettes d''inspiration méditerranéenne en un grand plat au four : c''est plus facile à cuisiner, plus consistant et peut être servi au déjeuner avec une salade d''accompagnement et du yaourt à l''ail.','["Error 504 (Server Error)!!1504.That’s an error.There was an error. Please try again later.That’s all we know.","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","½ petit bouquet de persil finement haché","½ petit bouquet de menthe finement hachée","½ petit bouquet d''aneth, finement haché, plus un peu pour servir","4 œufs","75 g de halloumi râpé","100 g de feta émiettée","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la boîte","80 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame grillées, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de nigelle, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Râper grossièrement les courgettes dans un torchon propre, envelopper et essorer tout l''excédent de liquide. Versez dans une passoire puis laissez égoutter complètement. Pendant ce temps, versez tous les ingrédients restants dans un grand bol. Ajoutez les courgettes égouttées et râpées, assaisonnez et mélangez.","Tapisser un plat rond allant au four ou un moule à gâteau d''environ 25 à 26 cm de papier sulfurisé et arroser d''un filet d''huile d''olive supplémentaire pour couvrir la surface. Faites chauffer le plat au four pendant 5 min.","Sortez délicatement le plat du four et versez le mélange de courgettes sur l''huile chaude (cela permettra au mélange de dorer au fond). Saupoudrer de graines de sésame et de nigelle supplémentaires et enfourner pendant 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré. Laisser reposer au moins 20 minutes avant de servir parsemé d''aneth."]','2026-01-11 00:00:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9479,8392,'fr','Gâteau au citron','Il est difficile de ne pas démolir ce filet de citron classique en une seule fois, alors pourquoi ne pas en faire deux à la fois ?','["225 g de beurre doux, ramolli","225 g de sucre en poudre","4 œufs","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 citron, zesté","1½ citrons, jus","85 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Battez ensemble le beurre et le sucre en poudre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et crémeux, puis ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en mélangeant lentement.","Tamisez la farine autolevante, puis ajoutez le zeste de citron et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Tapisser un moule à cake (8 x 21 cm) de papier sulfurisé, puis y verser le mélange et égaliser le dessus avec une cuillère.","Cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une fine brochette insérée au centre du gâteau en ressorte propre.","Pendant que le gâteau refroidit dans son moule, mélangez le jus de citron et le sucre semoule pour obtenir un filet.","Piquez le gâteau chaud partout avec une brochette ou une fourchette, puis versez-le dessus : le jus coulera et le sucre formera une belle garniture croustillante.","Laisser dans le moule jusqu''à refroidissement complet, puis retirer et servir. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique pendant 3 à 4 jours, ou au congélateur jusqu''à 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:00:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9480,8394,'fr','Gâteau à la crème caillée au citron','Préparez un gâteau riche et délicatement citronné en guise de gourmandise l''après-midi. Il contient une belle crème de citron qui tourbillonne pour lui donner une garniture collante. A déguster avec de la glace','["125 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","100 g de crème caillée","2 citrons, zestés et pressés","2 œufs","200 g de farines autolevantes","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","4 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","glace à la vanille, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake rond de 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mettez le beurre, 200 g de sucre, la crème caillée et le zeste de citron dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle et battez pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit de couleur claire et crémeuse. Vous pouvez également utiliser un grand bol et une cuillère en bois. Versez la moitié du jus de citron et battez encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Cassez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien après chaque ajout. Enfin, ajoutez la farine et la levure chimique, en vous assurant qu’elles sont bien mélangées, sans poches de farine. Versez le mélange dans le moule – il sera assez épais. Battez la crème au citron dans un petit bol pour la détacher et arrosez-la de pâte. Cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule 15 min.","Pendant ce temps, versez le reste du jus de citron et 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre dans un bol. Bien mélanger avant de verser généreusement ce mélange sur le gâteau. Transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement, puis couper en tranches et servir avec de la glace à la vanille, si vous le souhaitez. Se conservera dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:00:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9481,8396,'fr','Cupcakes au caramel salé','Offrez-vous ces cupcakes faciles avec une génoise au caramel et une garniture au caramel salé. Parfait pour le thé de l''après-midi','["100 g de beurre salé ramolli","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","6 cuillères à café de sauce caramel","75 g de beurre mou salé","150g de sucre glace","200 g de sauce caramel","une pincée de flocons de sel marin"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à cake 12 trous de caissettes en papier.","Battre le beurre et le sucre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, et l''extrait de vanille. Incorporer brièvement la farine jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste combinée, et incorporer le lait jusqu''à ce que la pâte tombe des batteurs.","Répartissez le mélange dans les caissettes en laissant environ 2 cuillères à soupe de pâte dans le bol. Ajoutez une pincée de sel à la sauce caramel si ce n''est pas du caramel salé, puis ajoutez ½ cuillère à café sur le dessus de chaque cupcake. Utilisez une cuillère à café pour recouvrir la sauce caramel avec le reste de la pâte. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient élastiques et dorés. Laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. Battez ensemble le beurre et la moitié du sucre glace, puis versez le reste du sucre glace et fouettez vigoureusement jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Incorporez la moitié de la sauce caramel, puis versez le mélange dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille ronde ou étoile.","Déposez des tourbillons de glaçage sur les cupcakes refroidis. Mélangez le reste de la sauce caramel avec une pincée de sel, si elle n''est pas salée, puis utilisez-la pour arroser le glaçage. Saupoudrez une petite pincée de sel marin sur chacun, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:00:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9482,8398,'fr','Petits pains croisés chauds au levain','Vous aimez faire du pain au levain ? Ensuite, vous devez essayer ces petits pains chauds. Ils demandent plus d''efforts, mais le résultat est l''un des meilleurs petits pains que vous ayez jamais goûtés.','["300 g de levain actif (voir recette ci-dessous)","2 gros œufs, battus","200 ml de lait","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","60 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","1 orange, zestée","150 g de raisins secs, ou un mélange de petits fruits secs (comme des raisins secs, un mélange d''écorces et des canneberges)","100 g de beurre doux, ramolli"]','["Avant de commencer, assurez-vous que le levain fait beaucoup de bulles (si ce n''est pas le cas, nourrissez-le et attendez qu''une cuillère à café de levain flotte dans l''eau tiède). Versez 200 g de levain dans un grand bol avec tout sauf 2 cuillères à soupe d''œuf, le lait, la farine, le sucre, la cannelle, le mélange d''épices, le zeste d''orange et les raisins secs. Mélangez avec vos mains jusqu''à obtenir une pâte hirsute (toute la farine doit être mélangée). Ou faites-le dans un batteur sur socle équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur. Couvrir d''un torchon propre et humide et laisser lever 30 minutes. Couvrir le reste du levain et réserver au frais.","Incorporez le beurre et 1 cuillère à café de sel à la pâte en l''écrasant avec vos mains. Une fois complètement mélangée, versez la pâte sur une surface et pétrissez doucement pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique (encore une fois, cela peut être fait dans un batteur sur socle équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur). Formez une boule avec la pâte, puis remettez-la dans le bol. Couvrir et laisser lever dans un endroit légèrement chaud pendant 3 à 4 heures jusqu''à ce que la pâte ait presque doublé de volume.","Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail fariné et pétrissez brièvement, puis divisez-la en 12 morceaux d''environ 100 g chacun. Roulez les morceaux en boules et disposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé en laissant un peu d''espace entre chacune. Couvrir d''un torchon propre et humide, puis laisser lever à nouveau pendant 2-3 heures à température ambiante jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume, ou réfrigérer toute la nuit (cela donnera une meilleure saveur et une forme plus soignée).","Si les petits pains ont été refroidis, sortez-les du réfrigérateur 1 heure avant la cuisson. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Badigeonner les petits pains avec l''œuf réservé. Versez le reste du levain dans une poche à douille munie d''une petite douille et déposez des croix sur les petits pains. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Laisser légèrement refroidir et servir tiède ou complètement frais. A consommer de préférence dans la journée, mais se conserve deux jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:00:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9483,8400,'fr','Pain croustillant','Essayez notre recette de niveau supérieur pour du pain blanc croustillant – cela prend beaucoup plus de temps à préparer mais le résultat sera la meilleure miche de pain que vous ayez cuite à la maison.','["500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","4 g de levure sèche à action rapide","10 g de sel marin fin, de flocons de sel marin ou de sel de table"]','["Versez la farine dans un grand bol avec la levure. Versez dessus 325 g d''eau à température ambiante (vous obtiendrez une quantité plus précise en pesant l''eau, mais vous pouvez également en utiliser 325 ml, selon votre balance), puis utilisez vos mains ou à l''aspatule pour mélanger jusqu''à obtenir une pâte. Il est important de vous assurer que toute la farine est mélangée, y compris tous les morceaux sur les côtés du bol. Couvrir d''un torchon humide et laisser reposer 30 min.","Saupoudrez de sel, puis travaillez-la en étirant plusieurs fois la pâte sur le sel jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit complètement incorporée. Versez sur une surface légèrement farinée. Utilisez le talon d''une main pour étirer la pâte pendant que vous la tenez de l''autre main. Ensuite, repliez la pâte sur elle-même, tournez-la de 90 degrés vers la gauche et répétez. Faites cela pendant environ 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte paraisse plus brillante et rebondisse immédiatement lorsqu''elle est roulée en boule serrée ou enfoncée doucement. Rouler la pâte en boule serrée, couvrir d''un torchon humide et laisser lever à température ambiante pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. Ou, pour une saveur plus profonde, transférez dans un bol propre, couvrez et laissez lever au réfrigérateur toute la nuit jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. La pâte froide est plus facile à travailler, il est donc préférable de la travailler toute la nuit.","Lorsque la pâte a doublé de volume et qu''elle est légère et moelleuse, versez-la sur un plan de travail et pétrissez-la encore quelques fois pour chasser l''air. Rassemblez la pâte en boule et laissez-la reposer 5 minutes. Formez délicatement la boule de pâte en une forme serrée et arrondie sur la surface de travail, puis versez le côté bombé vers le bas dans un panier de fermentation ou un bol recouvert d''un torchon propre. Laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 40 min à 1 h, ou au réfrigérateur pendant 2 à 3 h jusqu''à ce qu''il double à peu près de volume.","Mettez une cocotte avec son couvercle au four, puis chauffez le four à 230C/210C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Une fois le four à température, retirez la cocotte. Retournez la pâte sur un carré de papier sulfurisé, coupez-la à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé et utilisez les côtés du papier sulfurisé pour abaisser délicatement la pâte (toujours sur le papier sulfurisé) dans la cocotte chaude. Couvrir avec le couvercle. Cuire au four 25 mn. Retirez le couvercle et faites cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la croûte soit bien dorée et croustillante et qu''elle sonne creux lorsqu''on la tape sur le fond. Laisser refroidir sur une grille pendant 40 minutes avant de trancher. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:00:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9484,8402,'fr','Tarte au cow-boy','Qu''est-ce qui dit mieux une nourriture réconfortante que des saucisses et des fèves au lard dans une tarte garnie de purée de pommes de terre au fromage et au beurre ? C''est un favori garanti de la famille','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de tournesol","1 oignon, finement haché","8 saucisses de porc, coupées en petits morceaux","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées ou finement râpées","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé à chaud","2 boîtes de 410 g de fèves au lard","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce barbecue","1 kg de pommes de terre pelées et hachées grossièrement","50g de beurre","4 cuillères à soupe de lait","75 g de cheddar râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de ciboulette hachée, pour garnir, facultatif"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la purée de pommes de terre. Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée à feu moyen, puis versez-y délicatement les pommes de terre hachées. Cuire 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter, puis remettre dans la casserole et laisser sécher à l''air pendant quelques minutes avant de l''écraser. Versez le beurre et le lait et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Réserver avec le couvercle pour garder au chaud.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C/gaz 6. Pendant que les pommes de terre cuisent, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle ou une casserole à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Incorporez les morceaux de saucisses et faites frire pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient entièrement dorés, puis ajoutez l''ail et laissez cuire 1 minute avant d''incorporer le paprika fumé et de cuire encore 1 minute. Versez les haricots et la sauce barbecue et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils mijotent avant de retirer du feu.","Versez le mélange de saucisses et de haricots dans un moule ou un plat allant au four (le nôtre mesurait 20 x 20 cm), puis versez-le sur la purée de pommes de terre et saupoudrez le dessus de cheddar râpé. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que des bulles bouillonnent sur les bords et que le fromage soit doré. Retirer du four et parsemer de ciboulette, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:01:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9485,8404,'fr','Gâteau aux carottes brésilien','Vous aimez le gâteau aux carottes ? Essayez cette version d''inspiration brésilienne du favori de la pâtisserie, avec une garniture au chocolat qui l''élève à de nouveaux niveaux de délices.','["250 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour la boîte","260 g de farine nature","400 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 carottes moyennes (environ 250 g), pelées et hachées grossièrement","2 œufs","250 ml de lait","30g de cacao en poudre","60 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler et tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm. Mélanger la farine, le sucre et la levure chimique dans un grand bol et réserver. Versez l''huile, les carottes et les œufs dans l''Ablender et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs en remuant jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Versez la pâte dans le moule à cake et secouez-la pour éliminer les bulles d''air. Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes à 1 heure, jusqu''à ce qu''un couteau ou une brochette propre inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Si le milieu est collant, remettez au four encore 5 min. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir dans le moule.","Pour le filet, faites chauffer le lait, le cacao et le sucre dans une casserole à feu doux. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve (environ 5 minutes), créant un filet épais et brillant.","Retirez le gâteau du moule et nivelez le dessus à l''aide d''un couteau dentelé, puis retournez-le pour que le fond devienne le dessus. Percez partout à l''aide d''un couteau ou d''un cure-dent et placez-le sur une grille avec un plateau ou un grand bol en dessous. Versez le filet sur le gâteau par lots jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement absorbé. Vous pouvez réutiliser toute bruine récupérée dans le plateau ou le bol. La majeure partie de la bruine devrait être absorbée."]','2026-01-11 00:01:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9486,8406,'fr','Biscuits à la noix de coco','Préparez ces biscuits à la noix de coco pour un remontant parfait. Ils sont enrobés de luxueux chocolat noir et de pépites de noix de coco grillées.','["200 g de beurre doux, ramolli","75 g de sucre en poudre","75 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","1 gros œuf","275 g de farine nature","125 g de noix de coco desséchée, grillée et refroidie","100g de chocolat noir"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Battre le beurre dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique au batteur sur socle jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très mou. Incorporer les sucres et la vanille jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux, puis incorporer l''œuf jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tout juste combiné. Tamisez la farine et une pincée de sel et mélangez. Incorporez 100 g de noix de coco grillée.","Roulez la pâte en 14 à 16 boules (environ 45 g chacune) et disposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, bien espacées. Aplatissez légèrement chacun avec la paume de votre main et faites cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et légèrement fermes au toucher. Laisser refroidir brièvement sur la plaque, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Cassez le chocolat en morceaux et versez-le dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, puis faites-le fondre par tranches de 20 secondes au micro-ondes. Ou placez le bol sur une casserole d’eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l’eau, en remuant jusqu’à consistance lisse. Trempez la moitié de chaque biscuit dans le chocolat fondu, puis déposez-le sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé et saupoudrez du reste de noix de coco grillée. Laisser reposer environ 30 min."]','2026-01-11 00:01:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9487,8408,'fr','Morsures volées','Transformez les objets volés en bouchées. Avec du pain sucré et glacé parsemé de fruits et enveloppé dans de la pâte d''amande, il est facile de comprendre pourquoi cette pâtisserie allemande est si populaire.','["150 g de raisins secs","300 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","¼ cuillère à café de cardamome moulue","¼ cuillère à café de muscade moulue","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","150 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","1 œuf moyen","1 citron, zesté","100 g de cerises glacées hachées grossièrement","huile sans saveur, pour lever","250 g de pâte d''amande","100 g de sucre glace + un peu pour saupoudrer","75g de beurre doux"]','["Mettez les raisins secs dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et versez dessus 100 ml d''eau chaude de la bouilloire. Laisser tremper au moins 2 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Versez la farine, la levure, le sucre en poudre, les épices et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol. Faites chauffer le lait dans une casserole à feu doux ou au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste chaud, mais ne faites pas bouillir. Fouettez la vanille et l''œuf dans le lait tiède et versez-les dans les ingrédients secs. Utilisez vos mains pour combiner le tout en une pâte molle, puis versez-la sur un plan de travail et pétrissez pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre et élastique. (Vous pouvez également le faire dans un batteur sur socle équipé du crochet pétrisseur, pendant 5 minutes.)","Égouttez bien les raisins secs et pétrissez-les dans la pâte avec le zeste de citron et les cerises jusqu''à ce que les fruits soient uniformément répartis. Nettoyez le bol et huilez-le légèrement, puis remettez la pâte dans le bol, couvrez d''un torchon propre et laissez lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 2 heures, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double à peu près de volume. Vous pouvez également laisser lever au réfrigérateur toute la nuit pour rehausser la saveur de la pâte.","Tapisser un moule à cake de 20 x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Si la pâte est réfrigérée, laissez-la à température ambiante pendant 1 h avant de la façonner. Sur un plan de travail fariné, coupez-le en deux et roulez ou étirez chaque morceau en carré pour l''adapter au moule. Utilisez un morceau pour tapisser le fond, puis étalez la pâte d''amande sur une surface saupoudrée de sucre glace à la même taille que la pâte et posez-la dessus. Posez le deuxième carré de pâte dessus, en le pinçant sur les bords pour sceller la pâte d''amande. Couvrir légèrement et laisser lever à nouveau pendant 30 minutes à 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il lève légèrement. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5 à 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidi, coupez en 25 à 36 mini carrés (utilisez une règle si vous voulez être précis). Faites fondre le beurre dans une petite casserole à feu doux et badigeonnez-en le dessus des bouchées volées, puis saupoudrez généreusement de sucre glace. Laisser reposer 30 minutes, puis servir. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9488,8410,'fr','Blondies à la rhubarbe et à la crème anglaise','Ajoutez de la poudre de crème anglaise au mélange blondie pour une texture encore plus fondante. Associez-le à la rhubarbe pour une combinaison de saveurs classique, ou essayez de l''incorporer de la confiture ou de la compote.','["225 g de beurre salé (ou doux avec une pincée de sel), plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de sucre en poudre","150 g de farine nature","50 g de poudre de crème anglaise","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 œufs moyens","250 g de pépites de chocolat blanc ou de chocolat blanc finement haché","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de rhubarbe (surgelée ou en conserve et égouttée, c''est très bien)","75 g de sucre en poudre","colorant alimentaire rose ou rouge (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe de crème anglaise prête à l''emploi (en carton c''est bien, ou composée de poudre)"]','["Pour le tourbillon de rhubarbe et de crème anglaise, mettez la rhubarbe et le sucre dans une grande casserole avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau (omettez l''eau si vous utilisez de la rhubarbe en conserve). Cuire à feu moyen, en remuant fréquemment, pendant environ 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la rhubarbe se décompose et devienne confiturée. Ajoutez quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire si vous voulez un tourbillon de rhubarbe rose, mais la saveur sera toujours excellente si vous utilisez de la rhubarbe teintée de vert. Laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettre le beurre et les deux sucres dans une casserole et mettre sur feu doux. Faites fondre le tout jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et brillante, puis retirez du feu et laissez refroidir 10 minutes pendant que vous tamisez la farine, la poudre à crème anglaise et la levure chimique dans un bol. Beurrer un moule à pâtisserie de 20 x 30 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé.","Battez les œufs dans le mélange de sucre et de beurre refroidi, puis incorporez les ingrédients secs jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Incorporez 150 g de pépites de chocolat et la vanille. Versez dans le moule à brownie, puis utilisez une cuillère à café pour faire tourbillonner la compote de rhubarbe sur la pâte. Ajoutez des cuillerées de crème anglaise, puis faites tourner une brochette ou un bâton à cocktail dans la compote pour créer un motif marbré.","Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient pris et se détachent des côtés du moule, puis laisser refroidir dans le moule. Faites fondre les 100 g de chocolat restants par petits coups au micro-ondes ou dans un bol posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante. Utilisez une cuillère pour verser le chocolat sur le blondie en zigzag. Couper en carrés pour servir. Se conserve trois jours dans un contenant hermétique, ou congele les carrés individuellement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9489,8412,'fr','Gâteau crumble confituré aux mûres et aux amandes','Dégustez ces tranches de gâteau aux mûres et aux amandes pour le thé de l''après-midi ou en dessert accompagnées de glace à la vanille. Ils sont préparés avec des mûres fraîches et de la confiture','["225 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","225 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","3 œufs moyens","275 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","50g d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille ou d''amande","3 cuillères à soupe de confiture de petits fruits de votre choix (nous avons utilisé du cassis)","150g de mûres","une poignée d''amandes effilées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4, beurrer un moule carré de 20 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battre ensemble 200 g de beurre et 200 g de sucre dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Incorporer les œufs, un à la fois, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Lorsqu''il est lisse et crémeux, ajoutez 225 g de farine, la levure chimique, les amandes, le lait et la vanille et mélangez.","Versez le mélange dans le moule et nivelez la surface avec une spatule. Disposez des cuillères à café de confiture, puis répartissez sur les mûres en les pressant doucement.","Pour réaliser le crumble, pesez les 25 g de beurre restants et 25 g de sucre dans un bol, ajoutez le reste de la farine et une pincée de sel. Frottez les ingrédients ensemble entre le bout des doigts jusqu''à ce qu''ils aient une consistance friable. Incorporez les amandes effilées, puis répartissez le crumble sur le gâteau. Saupoudrez avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre et enfournez pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre.","Si le gâteau n’est pas prêt, remettez au four encore 5 à 10 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir au moins 20 minutes dans le moule avant de trancher et de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9490,8414,'fr','Petits pains feuilletés à la cannelle','Utilisez de la pâte feuilletée toute prête pour réaliser rapidement et facilement ces brioches à la cannelle – une pâte 100 % beurre donnera le meilleur goût','["1½ cuillère à soupe de cannelle moulue","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","320 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","1 œuf moyen, battu","50g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mélanger la cannelle et le sucre dans un petit bol. Déroulez la pâte feuilletée sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné, puis saupoudrez le mélange sucre cannelle sur tout le dessus. Égalisez délicatement le mélange sucre-cannelle avec le dos d''une cuillère pour qu''il recouvre presque entièrement la pâte en laissant une bordure de 1 cm sur l''un des petits côtés. Badigeonner un peu d''œuf battu sur le bord de la pâte exposé.","Rouler la pâte en une bûche serrée sur le côté court sans le bord. Appuyez doucement le long de la bordure lavée à l''œuf pour sceller, puis coupez en 12 rondelles égales. Disposez les brioches à la cannelle sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée, en les plaçant les unes contre les autres de manière à ce qu''elles se touchent. Badigeonner le reste de l''œuf battu sur le dessus et les côtés de la pâte, puis cuire au four pendant 15 à 18 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et levé. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque pendant 10 à 15 minutes.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec 1½ cuillère à café d''eau dans un petit bol jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage épais qui coule facilement de la cuillère. Versez-en un filet sur les petits pains chauds, puis servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9491,7419,'fr','Poulet tikka masala à rôtir','Préparez un souper de semaine rapide et copieux avec ce plat de poulet au curry tout-en-un. Servir avec des naans et de l''oignon rouge finement haché','["4 grosses cuisses de poulet","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","2 grosses gousses d''ail","1 oignon, haché grossièrement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché grossièrement","1 piment rouge, haché grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de ghee ou de beurre","2 cuillères à café de curcuma moulu","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","4 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","4 gousses de cardamome, écrasées avec le bout d''un rouleau à pâtisserie","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","200 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","100 ml de crème double","½ bouquet de coriandre finement hachée","½ oignon rouge, finement haché, pour servir","riz pilaf cuit et naans, pour servir"]','["Assaisonnez les cuisses de poulet avec un peu de sel. Faites chauffer l''huile de colza dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu vif et ajoutez les cuisses de poulet dans la poêle, côté peau vers le bas. Faites frire pendant 5 à 7 minutes, en retournant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés et croustillants de tous les côtés. Retirer dans une assiette et réserver.","Épluchez les gousses d''ail et réduisez-les en purée au robot culinaire avec l''oignon, le gingembre et le piment. Faites chauffer le ghee ou le beurre dans la poêle à feu moyen et faites cuire la purée d''oignons pendant 15 minutes en remuant souvent. Incorporez les épices, le concentré de tomates et la cardamome, puis laissez cuire encore 2 min. Versez les tomates en conserve, le bouillon et le sucre, portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez cuire encore 15 minutes. Assaisonner au goût.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Incorporer la crème double dans la sauce, puis versez-la dans un plat allant au four suffisamment grand pour contenir toutes les cuisses de poulet en une seule couche. Plongez les cuisses de poulet dans la sauce et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites – le jus doit être clair lorsqu''on perce la pointe d''un couteau dans la partie la plus épaisse des cuisses. Parsemer de feuilles de coriandre et d''oignon rouge, puis servir avec du riz pilaf et des naans pour éponger la sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:01:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9492,8416,'fr','Gâteau aux agrumes, amandes et yaourt','Savourez ce gâteau piquant aux agrumes, aux amandes et au yaourt pour le thé de l’après-midi. Meilleur servi chaud avec une tasse de thé','["165 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","150 g de farines autolevantes","100 g d''amandes moulues","3 œufs","75 g de yaourt nature, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","1 gros citron","1 orange","100g de sucre glace","15 g d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une petite poêle. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement. Pendant ce temps, beurrez un moule à charnière de 23 cm et tapissez-le de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Dans un grand bol, mélangez bien les 200 g de sucre semoule, la farine et la poudre d''amandes. Battez les œufs et 75 g de yaourt dans le beurre fondu refroidi, puis versez le tout dans le bol avec les ingrédients secs. Zester le citron et l''orange sur le bol. Remuer avec des aspatules jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de traces de farine, puis gratter dans le moule et cuire au milieu du four pendant 40 minutes.","Coupez quelques tranches de citron et d''orange zestés, puis pressez le jus de ce qui reste de chacun dans une casserole (vous aurez besoin d''environ 6 cuillères à soupe au total). Ajoutez les 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre et les tranches de fruits dans la poêle. Porter à ébullition et cuire pendant 5 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le jus soit réduit en un mince sirop et que les tranches de fruits aient ramolli. Laisser refroidir. Déposez les tranches de fruits sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé et laissez sécher.","Insérez une pique à brochette au milieu du gâteau – elle doit ressortir sèche, sans que la préparation à gâteau humide ne s''y accroche. Si ce n’est pas prêt, faites cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes et vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5 minutes, puis verser dessus le sirop d''agrumes. Laisser refroidir encore 10 minutes, puis démouler. Pour congeler, laisser d''abord refroidir complètement, puis bien envelopper le gâteau. Se conserve congelé jusqu''à trois mois.","Mélangez les 2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt avec le sucre glace pour obtenir un glaçage épais. Versez-le au centre du gâteau et utilisez le dos d''une cuillère pour le faire glisser jusqu''au bord (il doit couler sur le côté). Répartissez dessus les amandes effilées et décorez avec les tranches de fruits. Servir chaud ou laisser refroidir complètement. Se conserve dans une boîte hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9493,8418,'fr','Cookies aux pépites de chocolat de niveau supérieur','Oubliez les versions en paquets cassants et préparez ces cookies aux pépites de chocolat ultimes. Attendez-vous à un extérieur croustillant, un cœur moelleux et des morceaux de chocolat noir gluant','["125g de beurre doux","100 g de farine nature","100 g de farine de seigle","1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 gros œuf et 2 gros jaunes","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de chocolat coupé en petits morceaux (choisissez noir ou au lait, ou un mélange des deux)"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille. Surveillez-le attentivement : le beurre va mousser et, lorsque la mousse s''atténuera, il passera du jaune au brun noisette. À ce stade, retirez du feu, versez dans un bol et laissez refroidir. Pendant ce temps, mélangez les farines, le sel, la levure chimique et le bicarbonate de soude dans un bol et réservez.","Une fois le beurre refroidi, ajoutez les sucres et mélangez avec une cuillère en bois. Ajouter l''œuf, les jaunes et la vanille et battre ensemble. Grattez le mélange humide dans les ingrédients secs et remuez jusqu''à ce que le tout forme une pâte. Incorporez le chocolat, puis réfrigérez pendant au moins 3 heures ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Séparez la pâte en 12 morceaux, en pesant pour plus de précision si vous le souhaitez. Roulez chaque morceau en boule avec vos mains, puis placez six boules sur chaque feuille, en laissant un espace entre elles pour l''étalement. Cuire au four 10 minutes, puis, une feuille à la fois, retirer du four, saupoudrer d''un peu de sel marin et plaquer fort la plaque contre votre plan de travail.","Cuire encore 3 minutes, puis répéter le claquement de la plaque. Cuire au four encore 3 minutes. Ce timing vous donnera des biscuits moelleux, mais si vous les préférez un peu plus fermes, laissez cuire quelques minutes de plus. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques pendant 10 minutes avant de transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9494,8420,'fr','Pain aux dattes et aux noix','Préparez ce riche pain aux dattes et aux noix le week-end pour le déguster pendant la semaine. Vous pouvez également le congeler un autre jour pour le servir aux invités de dernière minute.','["125 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes et ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de dattes molles, dénoyautées et hachées grossièrement","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","150 g de sucre muscovado léger","2 oeufs","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","225 g de farines autolevantes","100 g de noix hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à pain de 2 livres (le nôtre mesurait 22 x 10 cm et 6 cm de profondeur) et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mettez le beurre, les dattes et le bicarbonate de soude (qui aide à décomposer les dattes) dans un grand bol et ajoutez 150 ml d''eau bouillante. Remuez pour que le beurre fonde et laissez reposer environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les dattes aient ramolli.","Fouettez le sucre jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez progressivement les œufs jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer la levure chimique, la farine et une pincée de sel marin jusqu''à ce qu''il ne reste plus de grumeaux de farine et que le mélange soit lisse. Incorporez les trois quarts des noix, puis versez dans le moule préparé. Saupoudrer le reste des noix sur le dessus.","Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, puis baisser le four à 170°C/150°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et cuire encore 45-50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laissez le gâteau refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes, puis transférez-le sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement. Saupoudrez légèrement de sucre glace et servez en tranches. Congelez entières ou coupées en tranches, puis placez dans un récipient hermétique ou répartissez dans des sacs de congélation réutilisables. Peut être congelé jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler complètement toute la nuit."]','2026-01-11 00:01:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9495,8422,'fr','Cheesecake aux framboises sans cuisson','Personnalisez notre cheesecake aux framboises en y ajoutant du chocolat blanc, du yaourt ou du mascarpone, ou, pour une base plus riche, troquez les biscuits digestifs contre des sablés','["300g de biscuits digestifs","100 g de beurre doux, fondu","500 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","100 g de sucre en poudre, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","300 ml de crème fraîche","300g de framboises","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)"]','["Passez les biscuits au robot culinaire ou versez-les dans un sac alimentaire et réduisez-les en miettes fines à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Transférer dans un bol et incorporer le beurre fondu jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à du sable humide. Versez les miettes de beurre dans un moule à charnière de 20 cm et pressez-les dans le fond à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère jusqu''à obtenir une couche lisse et uniforme. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Versez le fromage à pâte molle, le sucre, la vanille et la crème dans un bol et battez à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et crémeuse. Incorporez environ les deux tiers des framboises, en pressant légèrement les baies contre le bord du bol pour en extraire une partie de leur jus et onduler légèrement la crème.","Grattez le mélange de cheesecake sur la base réfrigérée et lissez le dessus avec une aspatule. Réfrigérer pendant au moins 6 heures, ou de préférence toute la nuit. Peut être préparé jusqu''à deux jours à l''avance et réfrigéré. Pour servir, démouler délicatement, parsemer du reste des framboises et saupoudrer de sucre glace, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:01:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9496,8424,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits','Préparez ce gâteau aux fruits bouilli facile pour votre moule à gâteau. Rempli de raisins secs juteux, de raisins secs, de groseilles et d''écorces mélangées, il est parfait pour le thé de l''après-midi avec une tasse de thé.','["125 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","175 g de cassone blonde,","200g raisins","200 g de raisins secs","100g de groseilles","50 g de zestes mélangés","225 g de farines autolevantes","1½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 oeufs, battus"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g de papier sulfurisé. Faites fondre le sucre, le beurre et 225 ml d''eau dans une grande casserole. Une fois fondu, ajoutez les raisins secs, les raisins secs, les groseilles et le zeste mélangé. Porter à légère ébullition et en remuant de temps en temps, cuire jusqu''à réduction et ramollissement, environ 10 à 15 minutes. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir à température ambiante.","Versez la farine, le mélange d''épices, le bicarbonate de soude et une pincée de sel dans un grand bol. Ajoutez le mélange de fruits refroidi et remuez, puis ajoutez les œufs et mélangez. Cuire au four pendant 45 à 55 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient brun foncé et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Couper en tranches pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9497,8426,'fr','Plateau de marbre','Faites preuve de créativité avec le plateau de cuisson en marbre de Jane Dunn, avec des éponges à la vanille et au chocolat et de la crème au beurre tourbillonnée. C''est une friandise que toute la famille adorera','["375 g de beurre doux, ramolli","375 g de sucre en poudre doré","6 œufs moyens","375 g de farine autolevante","50g de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","500 g de sucre glace","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","50g de cacao en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 23 x 33 cm de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, environ 4 à 5 minutes. Ajouter les œufs et la farine, puis battre à nouveau jusqu''à consistance lisse. Répartissez la pâte dans deux bols. Ajoutez la poudre de cacao dans l''un et la vanille dans l''autre, puis mélangez bien chaque bol pour bien combiner.","Déposez en alternance des cuillerées de pâte au chocolat et à la vanille dans le moule préparé jusqu''à ce que tout soit épuisé. Utilisez une pique à brochette ou la pointe d''un couteau à couverts pour remuer légèrement les pâtes ensemble pour un effet marbré. Cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Pour la crème au beurre, battre le beurre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et mou. Tamisez le sucre, une grosse cuillerée à la fois, et battez à basse vitesse pour combiner. Répartissez la crème au beurre dans deux bols. Incorporer la vanille dans l''un et le cacao dans l''autre, et battre jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. (Ajoutez 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante pour détendre, si nécessaire.)","Coupez le gâteau en carrés. Verser la crème au beurre vanille d''un côté d''une poche à douille munie d''une douille étoile et le chocolat de l''autre côté. Faites des tourbillons sur les carrés pour servir. Se conservera dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9498,5347,'fr','Assaisonnement pour poulet','Essayez ce simple mélange de poivre noir, de paprika, d''ail, d''oignon, de thym et d''origan pour assaisonner le poulet avant de le cuire, de le rôtir ou de le frire.','["1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir fraîchement moulu","1 cuillère à café de paprika","1 cuillère à café de granulés d''ail","1 cuillère à café de granulés d''oignon","1 cuillère à café de thym séché","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché"]','["Mesurez tous les ingrédients dans un bol et mélangez bien. Ils peuvent également être légèrement combinés dans un mélangeur ou écrasés ensemble à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier pour créer une poudre plus fine, si vous préférez. Saupoudrer sur le poulet avant de le cuire, de le rôtir ou de le frire."]','2026-01-11 00:01:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9499,8428,'fr','Florentins rapides','Prenez une poignée d''ingrédients et créez ces florentins au chocolat noir. Ils constituent un délicieux régal avec votre thé de l''après-midi ou un délicieux cadeau fait maison.','["100 g de sucre en poudre","40g de miel","60g de beurre","75 g de crème fraîche","200 g d''amandes effilées","60 g d''amandes moulues","100g de chocolat noir"]','["Faites chauffer le sucre, le miel et le beurre avec la crème dans une petite casserole. Portez le mélange à ébullition et laissez cuire 5 minutes. Ajoutez les flocons d''amandes et la poudre d''amandes, retirez du feu et mélangez bien le tout.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160/gaz 4. Utilisez deux cuillères à café pour former 35 petits tas sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement caramélisés jusqu''à obtenir une couleur dorée. Si le mélange se sépare, remettez-le simplement en tas avec les deux cuillères à café.","Laissez les florentins refroidir complètement. Faire fondre le chocolat noir au micro-ondes ou dans un bol posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante. A l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie, badigeonnez le dessous de chaque florentin de chocolat, placez le côté chocolat vers le haut et laissez prendre."]','2026-01-11 00:01:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9500,8430,'fr','Biscuits spéculoos','Ces délicieux biscuits sont faciles à préparer et pleins d''épices. Préparez un lot de ces bouchées gourmandes pour un cadeau fait maison attentionné pour quelqu''un de spécial','["270 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","150 g de sucre en poudre","pincée de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café d''épices spéculoos (un mélange de cannelle, clous de girofle, coriandre, gingembre, cardamome et muscade), disponible en ligne","100 ml de lait","100 g de beurre, à température ambiante","200 g d''amandes effilées"]','["Mélangez la farine, le sucre, une pincée de sel, la levure chimique et les épices dans un bol. Ajoutez 50 ml de lait et le beurre. Pétrir rapidement pour obtenir une pâte lisse, puis envelopper dans du papier aluminium et réfrigérer pendant 1 heure.","Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Tapisser 2-3 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Saupoudrer le papier sulfurisé d''amandes effilées. Abaisser la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné jusqu''à obtenir une épaisseur d''environ 3 mm. Découpez des rectangles (environ 4 cm x 6 cm). Disposez-les sur les plaques et pressez-les légèrement sur les amandes. Badigeonnez les biscuits avec le reste de lait et enfournez 8 minutes en surveillant pour qu''ils ne brunissent pas trop sur les bords. Laisser refroidir.","Coupez les amandes qui dépassent des bords des spéculoos pour les nettoyer. Conservez-les dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9501,3833,'fr','Pain blanc classique','Commencez votre voyage de boulangerie avec ce simple pain blanc – une fois que vous aurez conquis cela, vous pourrez passer à des recettes plus avancées.','["500 g de farine blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","huile de tournesol, pour prouver"]','["Versez la farine, la levure et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol et faites un puits au milieu. Versez un peu moins de 350 ml d’eau tiède et utilisez vos doigts ou une cuillère en bois pour mélanger le mélange de farine et l’eau – vous devriez avoir une pâte légèrement humide, moelleuse et malléable, alors ajoutez un peu d’eau si nécessaire.","Versez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrissez pendant au moins 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Ou faites-le dans un batteur sur socle équipé du crochet pétrisseur pendant 3 à 5 minutes. Mettez la pâte dans un bol propre et huilé, couvrez et laissez lever jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume, environ 1 à 2 heures.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Renverser la pâte en la basculant sur le plan fariné et en chassant l''air avec la paume des mains. Formez une boule de pâte, transférez-la sur une plaque à pâtisserie, couvrez d''un torchon propre et laissez lever à nouveau pendant 40 à 45 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double à nouveau de volume.","Saupoudrez le dessus du pain avec un peu de farine et faites une croix sur le dessus avec un couteau bien aiguisé, si vous le souhaitez. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, puis réduire le feu à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5 et cuire encore 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le pain sonne creux lorsqu''on tapote sur le dessous. Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à trois jours ou congelé pendant un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:01:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9502,8432,'fr','Brioches à la cannelle Simnel','Roulez toutes vos friandises de Pâques préférées dans un petit pain collant épicé avec ces petits pains parfumés. Nous les avons testés au réfrigérateur pour une meilleure saveur','["3 œufs battus","125 ml de lait","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","40 g de sucre muscovado léger","100 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante, plus un peu pour le moule","100g de raisins secs","125 g de beurre ramolli","125 g de sucre muscovado léger tamisé","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle moulue","500 g de pâte d''amande (voir astuce ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré"]','["Versez les œufs, le lait, la levure, la farine, le mélange d''épices, le sucre et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans le bol du batteur sur socle équipé de la palette. Battez jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte lisse, puis battez encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez progressivement le beurre, 1 à 2 cuillères à café à la fois, tout en mélangeant à vitesse moyenne. Lorsque tout le beurre est incorporé, versez les raisins secs et mélangez 1 min. Si vous n''avez pas de batteur sur socle, mélangez le tout dans un bol, en pétrissant lentement le beurre avec vos mains, suivi des raisins secs. Étalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné et aplatissez-la pour former un carré d''environ 20 x 20 cm. Couvrir et réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à 2 heures.","Pendant ce temps, pour la garniture, battez le beurre, le sucre et la cannelle avec une pincée de sel à l''aide d''un fouet électrique. Réserver à température ambiante. Beurrer un moule à pâtisserie d''environ 30 x 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Abaisser la pâte réfrigérée sur un plan légèrement fariné jusqu''à obtenir un rectangle d''environ 40 x 30 cm. Étalez le beurre de cannelle sur la surface jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit complètement recouverte. Étalez 400 g de pâte d''amande sur un plan légèrement fariné en un rectangle de la même taille que la pâte, puis déposez-la sur la couche de beurre à la cannelle. Avec un bord long face à vous, roulez la pâte en une bûche serrée. Coupez-le en deux pour faire deux bûches, puis soulevez les deux sur un plateau et congelez-les pendant 15 minutes, ou réfrigérez-les pendant 30 minutes à 1 heure pour les raffermir.","Coupez les bûches réfrigérées en 12 tranches égales, puis disposez-les, côté spirale vers le haut, dans le moule préparé. Laissez lever 1 heure dans un endroit chaud, ou jusqu''à 24 heures au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient environ un tiers plus gros et se touchent sur les côtés.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Enfourner les petits pains pendant 20 min. Pendant ce temps, roulez le reste de la pâte d''amande en 11 boules. Au bout de 20 minutes, placez les boules de massepain sur 11 des rouleaux, en laissant une nature (cela représente traditionnellement les apôtres et Judas sur un gâteau simnel). Cuire au four encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les petits pains soient dorés et que les boules de pâte d''amande soient grillées.","Mélangez le sirop doré avec 2 cuillères à café d''eau bouillante. Badigeonnez immédiatement les petits pains chauds (mais pas les boules de massepain) avec le glaçage au sirop. Laisser refroidir légèrement avant de déguster tiède ou à température ambiante. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9503,8434,'fr','Petits gâteaux au miel et aux amandes brûlés','Servez ces gâteaux au miel et aux amandes chauds en dessert ou tout simplement à l''heure du thé. Saupoudrez de sucre glace et dégustez avec notre sauce expresso au chocolat chaud','["50 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 oeuf","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","30g de farine nature","30g d''amandes moulues","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le beurre et le miel dans une petite casserole et faites cuire à feu moyen-vif pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le beurre mousse et que le mélange prenne une couleur acajou.","Fouetter l''œuf, le sucre et le mélange de miel et de beurre dans un grand bol. Incorporer la farine, les amandes, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel marin pour obtenir une pâte. Peut être utilisé immédiatement ou conservé au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et beurrer quatre trous d''un moule à muffins. Répartissez le mélange entre les trous et faites cuire au four pendant 12 à 14 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bien cuit. Démoulez sur une grille et laissez refroidir quelques minutes. Saupoudrez de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez, et servez avec une sauce expresso au chocolat chaud (voir « va bien avec » ci-dessous)."]','2026-01-11 00:01:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9504,4898,'fr','Biscuits flapjack fruités','Faites griller les flocons d''avoine avant de les mélanger à la pâte pour réaliser ces biscuits fruités, un délicieux hybride de flapjacks sirupeux et de macarons à la noix de coco.','["125 g de flocons d''avoine géants","150g de beurre ramolli","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de farines autolevantes","100 g de noix ou de raisins secs mélangés","75 g d''abricots secs finement hachés","50g de noix de coco desséchée","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Répartir les flocons d''avoine sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, en retournant une fois jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir. Versez le beurre et le sucre dans un bol et battez avec un fouet électrique pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à consistance mousseuse. Cassez l''œuf et ajoutez le sirop doré et la vanille, puis battez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement mélangé. Répartir la farine, tous les fruits secs, la noix de coco, la cannelle (si utilisée), les flocons d''avoine grillés et une pincée de sel. Battez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que tout soit combiné et que vous obteniez une pâte épaisse. Utilisez la pâte immédiatement ou couvrez et réfrigérez jusqu''à deux jours.","Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et disposer sur chacune six grosses cuillerées de pâte, bien espacées. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes (ou 18 à 20 minutes si la pâte est froide au réfrigérateur) jusqu''à ce que les biscuits soient étalés et dorés sur les bords mais mous au milieu. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque à pâtisserie pendant 5 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Se conservera dans un récipient hermétique ou un moule jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9505,8436,'fr','Riz au lait classique','Faites cuire ce riz au lait crémeux au four pendant que vous préparez le dîner et terminez votre repas avec un pud réconfortant. Servir avec de la confiture pour un moment de bien-être','["beurre, pour le plat","130 g de riz au lait","70 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de pâte de gousse de vanille ou 1 gousse de vanille fendue et grattée","800 ml de lait entier","170 ml de crème fraîche","râpe de muscade","confiture de fruits au choix, pour servir (fraise ou abricot fonctionnent bien)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et beurrer un plat allant au four de 1,5 litre. Mettez le riz au lait, le sucre, la vanille, le lait et la crème dans un bol et mélangez. Versez le mélange dans le plat préparé et râpez sur une généreuse couche de muscade. Cuire au four pendant 1h30 jusqu''à ce qu''une peau brune se forme sur le dessus et que le riz soit cuit et tendre.","Laisser refroidir légèrement, puis verser le pudding chaud dans des bols et servir avec une cuillerée de confiture dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:01:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9506,8438,'fr','Gâteau au gingembre végétalien','Préparez-vous pour l’automne avec ce gâteau au pain de gingembre glacé et épicé. C''est un vrai régal, que l''on soit vegan ou non','["100 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour la boîte","275 g de farines autolevantes","150 g de sucre muscovado noir","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","50g de mélasse","50 g de gingembre en tige d''un pot, finement râpé, plus 1 cuillère à café de sirop de gingembre","150g de sucre glace","½ citron, jus","4 morceaux de gingembre confit, tranchés"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Huiler un moule à cake de 900g (le nôtre faisait 19 x 9 x 6 cm) et le tapisser d''une longue bande de papier sulfurisé. Mélanger la farine, le sucre muscovado, la levure chimique et le gingembre moulu dans un grand bol. Versez l''huile, la mélasse, le gingembre râpé et 170 ml d''eau froide, puis battez ensemble jusqu''à consistance lisse à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois.","Versez le mélange à gâteau dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au centre du four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Tamisez le sucre glace dans un bol, ajoutez le sirop de gingembre et mélangez juste assez de jus de citron pour obtenir un glaçage épais et versable qui peut recouvrir le dos d''une cuillère. Disposez le gâteau sur une assiette ou un support, retirez le papier sulfurisé et arrosez-le de glaçage. Répartissez immédiatement sur la tige de gingembre. Coupez le gâteau en tranches épaisses pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9507,6209,'fr','Fromage de chou-fleur entier cuit au four','Pourquoi se donner la peine de couper du chou-fleur ? Le rôtir entièrement est très simple à préparer et constitue un ajout impressionnant à un dîner rôti.','["1 gros chou-fleur (environ 1 kg)","50g de beurre doux","50g de farine nature","grosse pincée de paprika doux fumé","600 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise","170g mature cheddar, gruyère, comté or a mixture","½ bouquet de ciboulette finement hachée"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée. Retirez toutes les grandes feuilles du chou-fleur, mais laissez les plus petites attachées. Plongez délicatement le chou-fleur dans l''eau et faites-le bouillir pendant 15 minutes, puis égouttez-le et réservez.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle moyenne à feu moyen, puis incorporer la farine et le paprika et cuire 1 à 2 minutes. Retirer du feu et fouetter lentement le lait jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporer la moutarde. Remettez la casserole sur le feu et portez le mélange à ébullition en fouettant continuellement. Ajoutez les deux tiers du fromage et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu. Assaisonner au goût.","Mettez le chou-fleur au milieu d''un plat allant au four et versez dessus la sauce au fromage. Saupoudrer du reste de fromage. Cuire au four à découvert pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bouillonnants. Parsemer de ciboulette avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9508,3870,'fr','Biscuits macarons moelleux aux amandes','Préparez ces biscuits aux amandes faciles. Populaires pour la Pâque, ils sont sans produits laitiers et sans gluten. Vous pouvez également ajouter un peu de cannelle pour les transformer en boules de cannelle, si vous le souhaitez.','["225 g d''amandes moulues","120 g de sucre en poudre","2 blancs d''œufs","20 amandes blanchies (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle moulue","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mettez la poudre d''amandes et le sucre dans un grand bol à mélanger et mélangez.","Dans un autre bol, battre les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient mousseux, puis les ajouter au mélange d''amandes et de sucre. Remuez bien – cela formera un mélange légèrement collant mais devrait conserver sa forme.","Mouillez-vous légèrement les mains et roulez une cuillère à café bombée du mélange en boule entre vos paumes – elle doit mesurer environ 4 cm de diamètre. Disposez sur la plaque et aplatissez légèrement avec les doigts mouillés jusqu''à obtenir un disque épais en laissant au moins 3 cm entre chaque biscuit. Pressez une amande blanchie dans chacune d''elles, si vous le souhaitez.","Cuire au four pendant 18 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords commencent à dorer, puis retirer du four et laisser refroidir sur une grille. Vous voulez qu’ils aient un centre moelleux et doux et plus ils deviennent foncés, plus le milieu sera dur.","Pour faire des boules de cannelle, ajoutez la cannelle aux amandes et au sucre avant d''ajouter le blanc d''œuf. Lors du façonnage, laissez-les sous forme de boules. Cuire au four pendant 18 à 20 minutes – vous voulez qu’ils restent moelleux au centre. Pendant qu''ils sont encore chauds, mettez-les délicatement dans un bol de sucre glace et retournez-les pour les enrober. Laisser refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9509,8440,'fr','Gâteau aux cerises','Préparez ce gâteau aux cerises gourmand pour le thé de l’après-midi ou un café le matin. À base de cerises glacées sucrées et d''amandes croquantes, il ne durera pas longtemps','["200 g de beurre doux doux, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande (facultatif)","75 g de cerises glacées, épongées si elles sont au sirop, puis coupées en quartiers","175 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","100g de sucre glace","une goutte d''extrait d''amande","1-2 cuillères à soupe de lait","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake de 900 g et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battez le beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux, puis incorporez les œufs un à la fois, suivis de l''extrait de vanille et d''amande (le cas échéant).","Mélangez les cerises avec 2 cuillères à soupe de farine dans un bol. Versez le reste de la farine, la poudre d''amandes, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel dans le bol avec le sucre et les œufs, et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer les cerises et le reste de farine dans le bol. Verser dans le moule préparé et lisser le dessus.","Cuire au four pendant 50 à 55 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes dans le moule, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Servir tel quel ou mélanger le sucre glace avec l''extrait et suffisamment de lait pour obtenir une consistance épaisse mais versable. Arroser le gâteau et parsemer d''amandes effilées pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9510,7067,'fr','Gâteau végétalien aux pommes','Réalisez ce gâteau aux pommes et aux amandes pour remplir votre moule à cake. C''est un régal idéal pour tous ceux qui suivent un régime sans produits laitiers ou végétalien, et il est délicieux pour le thé de l''après-midi avec une tasse de thé.','["150 g de pâte à tartiner sans produits laitiers, fondue, plus un supplément pour la boîte","300 ml de lait d''avoine","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","350 g de farine autolevante, plus 1 cuillère à soupe pour enrober les pommes","100 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","300 g de pommes Granny Smith pelées, épépinées et coupées en cubes de 2 cm","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées"]','["Beurrez avec la pâte à tartiner un moule à cake de 20 cm de profondeur et tapissez-le de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Versez le lait d''avoine dans un pichet, ajoutez le jus de citron et laissez reposer 5 min à température ambiante.","Mettez la farine, les deux sucres et la levure chimique dans un grand bol, versez dessus le mélange épaissi de lait d''avoine et d''extrait d''amande, puis ajoutez le beurre et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Battez le tout à l''aide d''un fouet électrique. Versez les pommes dans un deuxième grand bol, saupoudrez de 1 cuillère à soupe de farine supplémentaire et mélangez pour bien enrober. Incorporez les pommes dans la pâte à gâteau à l''aide d''une spatule, puis versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et saupoudrez d''amandes.","Cuire au centre du four pendant 1 h à 1 h 20 ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et fermes au toucher. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes dans le moule. Servir chaud ou démouler sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidi, se conserve dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9511,8442,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat blanc','Si vous célébrez une occasion spéciale, ce gâteau étagé constitue une excellente pièce maîtresse. Il est garni d''une ganache soyeuse au chocolat blanc et de framboises fraîches.','["300 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","300 g de sucre en poudre","5 gros œufs battus","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","300 g de farines autolevantes","100 g de chocolat blanc finement haché","350 g de framboises fraîches coupées en deux","450 g de chocolat blanc finement haché","200 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de vanille"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer trois moules à sandwich de 18 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battre ensemble le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, la vanille, la levure chimique et la farine à l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou d''un fouet électrique à main jusqu''à obtenir un mélange mousseux, environ 5 minutes. Incorporez le chocolat blanc jusqu’à ce qu’il soit bien réparti.","Répartissez le mélange uniformément dans les moules et nivelez à l''aide d''un couteau à palette ou du dos d''une cuillère jusqu''à consistance lisse. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir les génoises dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis les retirer des moules et les transférer sur une grille de refroidissement, dessus vers le bas, et laisser refroidir complètement. Si les éponges ne sont pas de niveau, utilisez un couteau dentelé pour couper les pics.","Pendant que les génoises refroidissent, préparez la ganache. Mettez le chocolat blanc dans un grand bol. Versez la crème dans une casserole sur feu moyen et portez à ébullition. Versez immédiatement la crème sur le chocolat et laissez reposer 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu. Mélangez pour former une ganache lisse, en vous assurant que tout le chocolat est bien fondu, puis incorporez la vanille. Réfrigérer au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps pour qu''il ne durcisse pas complètement, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tartinable et suffisamment épais pour enrober le gâteau.","Une fois que les génoises ont refroidi et que la ganache a pris une consistance tartinable, vous pouvez construire le gâteau. Disposez un biscuit sur une assiette de service, étalez-le sur une fine couche de ganache au chocolat, puis remplissez le milieu avec un tiers des framboises. Déposez un autre biscuit dessus et répétez avec une couche de ganache et un autre tiers de framboises. Posez le dernier biscuit par dessus et enduisez délicatement l''ensemble du gâteau d''une fine couche de ganache. Laisser prendre au réfrigérateur au moins 20 minutes. Pour terminer, étaler sur le reste de la ganache et garnir du reste des framboises. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9512,8444,'fr','Pain d''épice d''Halloween','Préparez un lot de pain d''épices pour votre boîte à biscuits cet Halloween. Placez des fantômes macabres et des momies monstrueuses pour le glaçage pour un thème suffisamment effrayant.','["100 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes","50g de sirop doré","50 g de mélasse noire","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","225 g de farine nature","100g de sucre glace","glaçage d''écriture noir"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre, le sirop, la mélasse et le sucre dans une casserole moyenne à feu doux pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir 10 minutes.","Fouetter brièvement le bicarbe, le gingembre, la cannelle, le mélange d''épices et la farine ordinaire dans un grand bol pour mélanger. Ajoutez une pincée de sel, ainsi que le beurre et le sucre au mélange. Mélangez brièvement avec une cuillère, puis pétrissez jusqu''à obtenir une boule grossière dans le bol. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour mélanger la pâte, si nécessaire. Versez sur un plan de travail et pétrissez à nouveau brièvement jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle et souple. Presser sur un disque plat, envelopper et congeler pendant 15 minutes ou réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes.","Étalez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné, divisez la pâte en sections et travaillez par lots si nécessaire. Etalez-la sur 5 mm d''épaisseur. Découpez à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce bonhomme en pain d''épices. Reroulez les chutes. Vous en obtiendrez 20 à 25 selon la taille de votre cutter.","Transférez les biscuits sur une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé avec un peu d''espace entre les deux et réfrigérez à nouveau pendant 10 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 170C/150C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Cuire le pain d''épices pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient légèrement dorés. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque pendant 5 minutes puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec ½ à 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour obtenir un glaçage épais et pratique. Transférez la moitié du glaçage dans une poche à douille et découpez un tout petit trou au fond.","Pour réaliser les fantômesÀ l''aide de la poche à douille, tracez un contour autour des bonhommes en pain d''épices et laissez prendre. Une fois pris, ajoutez une goutte d''eau supplémentaire au glaçage restant dans le bol pour le desserrer légèrement, puis utilisez-le pour remplir les formes fantômes. A l''aide d''un pique à cocktail, lisser le glaçage jusqu''au contour fixé. Laisser reposer à nouveau. Ajoutez deux points noirs pour les yeux, puis un ovale pour la bouche ouverte.","Pour faire les momies, coupez un trou légèrement plus grand dans la poche à douille en biais et faites des allers-retours sur les bonhommes en pain d''épices restants, pour que cela ressemble à des bandages. Ajoutez deux points blancs en guise d''yeux et laissez sécher. Ajoutez des pupilles aux points blancs une fois fixés avec le glaçage d''écriture noir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9513,3876,'fr','Tortilla de patates douces et courgettes rôties au four','Savourez une tortilla cuite au four plutôt que frite, ce qui la rend plus saine et plus facile à préparer. Si vous n''avez pas de manchego, vous pouvez utiliser du cheddar ou de la feta émiettée','["2 patates douces moyennes (500 g), pelées et tranchées finement","1 oignon, tranché finement","1 courgette, tranchée finement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","6 oeufs","50g crème fraîche","30g de manchego ou alternative végétarienne, râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette hachée","salade verte, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Versez les tranches de patate douce, l''oignon et la courgette dans un plat allant au four antiadhésif moyen (le nôtre mesurait 18 cm x 30 cm x 4 cm), arrosez d''huile d''olive, assaisonnez et mélangez le tout. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes en remuant les légumes à mi-cuisson. Les patates douces doivent être tendres, la courgette un peu carbonisée et l''oignon ramolli.","Pendant ce temps, fouettez les œufs et la crème fraîche avec une pincée d''assaisonnement. Versez le mélange d''œufs battus sur la patate douce, l''oignon et la courgette. Saupoudrer de manchego et remettre au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la tortilla soit juste prise. Saupoudrer de ciboulette et déguster chaud ou froid accompagné d''une salade."]','2026-01-11 00:01:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9514,3894,'fr','Pommes de terre nouvelles rôties écrasées','Combinez des pommes de terre rôties, des rösti et de la purée avec cette recette simple. Vous pouvez l''agrémenter en écrasant des olives dénoyautées, des câpres, des herbes, des oignons nouveaux ou de l''ail.','["1 kg de pommes de terre nouvelles","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites mais sans se désagréger. Bien égoutter. Versez 1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une plaque à pâtisserie peu profonde (environ 30 x 20 cm – un moule à rouleau suisse fonctionne bien). Versez les pommes de terre dans le moule et ajoutez l''huile. Écrasez les pommes de terre à l''aide d''un presse-purée ou d''une fourchette – les pommes de terre écrasées doivent remplir le plateau et être jointes sur les bords comme des morceaux de puzzle. Se conserveront au frais jusqu''à une journée.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Arroser les pommes de terre avec le reste d''huile et assaisonner de sel marin. Cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient profondément dorés et croustillants."]','2026-01-11 00:01:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9515,3920,'fr','Pain de maïs aux courgettes et au cheddar','Dégustez ce pain de maïs au fromage avec un piment épicé, ou grillé et garni d''œufs pochés et de tomates grillées pour le petit-déjeuner.','["75 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","75 g de farine à pain blanche forte","150 g de polenta instantanée","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","3 œufs","350 ml de lait entier","100 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","2 petites ou 1 moyenne courgette (environ 200 g), parées et grossièrement râpées"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Beurrer un moule à cake de 900g et le tapisser d''une large bande de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la farine, la polenta et la levure chimique dans un bol avec 1 cuillère à café de sel.","Fouetter les œufs, le lait et le beurre fondu dans un pichet. Verser sur les ingrédients secs et mélanger. Incorporer le fromage et les courgettes. Elle sera assez liquide à ce stade mais ne vous inquiétez pas, car la polenta gonfle progressivement et absorbe le liquide du four.","Verser dans le moule à pain préparé et cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, puis baisser le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et cuire encore 25-30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu du pain en ressorte propre (vous pouvez couvrir le dessus sans serrer avec du papier d''aluminium s''il commence à noircir trop rapidement).","Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis démouler et trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:01:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9516,4317,'fr','Pide aux épinards et au fromage','Préparez notre version de pide turque aux épinards et au fromage de chèvre, idéale pour un déjeuner léger ou un pique-nique. Les pide sont des pains plats en forme de bateau qui sont fourrés et cuits au four.','["300 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 œuf battu","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 oignon blanc, finement haché","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin entières","240 g d''épinards","50 g de fromage de chèvre à pâte ferme, émietté","2 cuillères à soupe d''aneth haché"]','["Mettez la farine, la levure, le sucre et 1 cuillère à café de sel marin dans un grand bol et mélangez. Incorporez 80 ml d’eau et l’huile pour rassembler le tout en une pâte ferme et lisse (vous devrez peut-être ajouter un peu plus d’eau). Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse et élastique. Remettre dans le bol, couvrir et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud jusqu''à ce qu''il ait doublé de volume, environ 1 heure.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit translucide. Ajoutez le cumin et les épinards et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés et que tout le liquide se soit évaporé – cela prendra environ 5 minutes. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Lorsque la pâte a levé, chauffez le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Déposez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et divisez-la en quatre. Roulez chaque morceau en boule, puis chaque boule en un ovale rugueux d''environ 3 à 4 mm d''épaisseur. Transférez les ovales de pâte sur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive d''environ 30 x 20 cm.","Verser la garniture aux épinards refroidie au centre de chaque ovale de pâte, en laissant une bordure de 2 cm sur le pourtour. Saupoudrer le fromage de chèvre et l''aneth sur la garniture. Pliez soigneusement les côtés de la pâte sur environ 1 cm pour qu''ils chevauchent légèrement la garniture et rapprochez les extrémités pour former une pointe. Il faudra peut-être légèrement tordre les extrémités et les appuyer pour les fixer en place.","Lorsque les quatre pides sont assemblées, badigeonnez la pâte d''œuf battu. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée et que la garniture bouillonne. Servir tiède (les restes peuvent également être consommés froids)."]','2026-01-11 00:01:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9517,5125,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat sans gluten','Préparez un gâteau au chocolat dense et riche pour une occasion spéciale ou une gâterie à tout moment. Bien qu’il convienne à ceux qui suivent un régime sans gluten, il plaira à tout le monde.','["150 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour les boîtes","175g de farine sans gluten","1 cuillère à café de gomme xanthane","50g de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","75 g de cassonade foncée","75 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","2 œufs","100 g de yaourt grec","100 ml de lait","2 cuillères à soupe de café instantané, dissoutes dans 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude","300g de sucre glace","25g de cacao en poudre","150 g de beurre mou salé","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","65 g de chocolat noir fondu"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler le fond de deux moules à sandwich de 18 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la farine, la gomme xanthane, le cacao, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude, une grosse pincée de sel et les deux sucres dans un grand bol.","Fouetter le sirop doré, les œufs, l''huile, le yaourt, le lait et le café dans un pichet. Incorporez progressivement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs jusqu''à obtenir un mélange lisse.","Versez le mélange dans les moules préparés et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et ferme au toucher. Sortir du four et laisser refroidir 10 min dans les moules avant de démouler sur une grille de refroidissement.","Pendant que les gâteaux refroidissent, préparez le glaçage. Battez ensemble le sucre glace, le cacao en poudre, le beurre et le lait pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et mousseuse. Versez progressivement le chocolat fondu en battant, en raclant les parois du bol pour vous assurer que tout est inclus.","Étalez la moitié du glaçage au milieu d''une génoise à l''aide d''un petit couteau à palette. Placez l''autre génoise sur le dessus, avec le fond plat vers le haut. Étalez le reste du glaçage sur le dessus et les côtés du gâteau, en lissant avec un couteau à palette. S''il vous reste du glaçage, vous pouvez déposer quelques rosaces sur le dessus du gâteau."]','2026-01-11 00:01:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9518,3932,'fr','Saucisses Glamorgan','Impliquez la famille et préparez vos propres saucisses Glamorgan, une saucisse végétarienne galloise traditionnelle composée de fromage, de poireaux et de chapelure. Préparez-en 12 et congelez ceux que vous ne mangez pas','["50g de beurre","2 gros poireaux, tranchés","400 g de chapelure fine, blanche et fraîche","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de thym","4 gros œufs, séparés","400 g de Caerphilly ou de cheddar fort affiné, finement râpé","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de moutarde complète ou de Dijon ou 2 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise","50 g de farine nature, pour saupoudrer","100 ml d''huile végétale pour la friture, plus un peu si nécessaire"]','["Faites fondre le beurre dans une poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il mousse, puis faites revenir les poireaux avec une pincée de sel pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Mettez 200 g de chapelure molle, le thym, les jaunes d''œufs, le fromage, la moutarde et une généreuse mouture de poivre dans un bol et mélangez. Incorporer les poireaux frits et le beurre restant dans la poêle. Salez et mélangez bien avec vos mains.","Moulez le mélange en 12 saucisses (divisez et pesez pour plus de précision si vous le souhaitez). Vous pouvez trouver de l''aide pour les mains humides en vous nettoyant les mains de temps en temps pour éviter qu''elles ne collent. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et congeler pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à consistance ferme, ou réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes au réfrigérateur.","Pendant que les saucisses se raffermissent, fouettez les blancs d''œufs dans un bol peu profond avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement mousseux. Mettez la farine et un peu de chapelure restante dans des assiettes séparées.","Saupoudrez les saucisses réfrigérées et fermes dans la farine, puis trempez-les dans le blanc d''œuf et roulez-les dans la chapelure. Remplissez l''assiette de chapelure selon vos besoins. Réfrigérez pendant au moins 1 heure et jusqu''à 24 heures avant de faire frire.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-vif. Faites frire les saucisses par lots, en les retournant doucement toutes les minutes, pendant 4 à 6 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes partout. Ajoutez un peu plus d''huile entre les lots si nécessaire. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et enfourner pendant 10 minutes. Si vous congelez les saucisses, une fois qu''elles sont dorées, transférez-les sur un plateau et laissez-les refroidir pendant quelques minutes, puis ouvrez-les au congélateur (à découvert) jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient solides et transférez-les dans des récipients allant au congélateur. Elles se conserveront congelées jusqu''à trois mois. Cuire congelées au four pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très chaudes."]','2026-01-11 00:01:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9519,5479,'fr','Tarte au poisson crémeuse aux poireaux, pommes de terre, cheddar et ciboulette','Utilisez du poisson frais pour préparer cette tarte crémeuse garnie de pâtisserie. La garniture aux crevettes, à l''aiglefin et au saumon et la garniture friable rendent cette tarte extrêmement savoureuse.','["400 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de sel fin","½ petit bouquet de thym, feuilles cueillies","½ cuillère à soupe de poudre de moutarde anglaise","180 g de beurre doux froid, coupé en cubes","2 gros œufs, battus","légumes verts cuits à la vapeur, pour servir","1 pomme de terre (environ 270 g), coupée en morceaux de 3 cm","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","50g de beurre","2 poireaux, finement tranchés","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","400 ml de lait entier","100 ml de crème double","100 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","3 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon","¼ bouquet de ciboulette finement hachée","200 g de filet de saumon sans peau, coupé en morceaux","200 g de filet d''aiglefin fumé sans peau, coupé en morceaux","100 g de gambas crues, décortiquées"]','["Versez la farine, le sel, le thym et la poudre de moutarde dans un robot culinaire et mélangez brièvement. Ajouter le beurre et mélanger à nouveau pour obtenir une fine texture de chapelure. Ajoutez la moitié de l’œuf et 1 cuillère à soupe d’eau froide et mélangez jusqu’à obtenir une pâte (vous pouvez ajouter jusqu’à 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d’eau supplémentaire si elle est sèche). Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail et pétrissez brièvement. Filmer et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Pour préparer la garniture, faites cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 8 à 10 minutes. Égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur. Faites chauffer l''huile et le beurre dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les poireaux pendant 5 minutes. Incorporer la farine et cuire 2 minutes, puis ajouter le lait petit à petit en remuant entre chaque ajout pour bien mélanger. Ajouter la crème, le fromage et la moutarde et cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu. Incorporer la ciboulette et assaisonner. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir 15 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Incorporer délicatement le saumon, la pomme de terre, l''aiglefin et les crevettes au mélange crémeux de poireaux, puis verser dans un plat à tarte rond de 27 cm. Étalez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à obtenir l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Étalez la pâte sur la tarte, puis coupez l''excédent. Sertissez les bords, puis façonnez les chutes pour décorer le dessus, si vous le souhaitez. Badigeonner avec le reste de l''œuf, puis cuire au centre du four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Servir avec des légumes verts cuits à la vapeur."]','2026-01-11 00:01:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9520,8446,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat et au massepain','Combinez la saveur de noisette du massepain avec un riche gâteau au chocolat pour obtenir le régal ultime. Cette recette facile est parfaite pour cuisiner avec les enfants','["165 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","350 g de pâte d''amande","100 g de sucre en poudre","60 g de cassonade foncée","3 gros œufs","200 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","75 ml de lait","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","50 g de pépites de chocolat noir","180 ml de crème fraîche","140 g de chocolat noir finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake de 1 kg (le nôtre faisait 14 x 24 x 7 cm) et le tapisser d''une longue bande de papier sulfurisé. Saupoudrez légèrement une surface de sucre glace et étalez la pâte d''amande en un rectangle de 1 cm d''épaisseur, puis coupez-la de manière à ce qu''elle soit juste plus petite que le fond du moule à cake.","Battre le beurre et les deux sucres ensemble dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Incorporer les œufs, la farine, la levure chimique, l''extrait d''amande, le lait et le cacao en poudre jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporez les pépites de chocolat en raclant les parois du bol pour vous assurer que tout est bien combiné.","Versez la moitié de la pâte dans le moule. Garnir du rectangle de pâte d''amande, puis verser le reste de pâte dessus et lisser la surface. Cuire au four pendant 1 h à 1 h 15 jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, levés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Pour réaliser la ganache, faites mijoter la crème dans une petite casserole. Pendant ce temps, mettez le chocolat noir, le sirop doré et l''extrait d''amande dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Une fois la crème frémissante, versez-la sur le mélange chocolaté et laissez fondre 2 minutes. Fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis laisser refroidir 5 minutes et épaissir légèrement. Versez la ganache sur tout le gâteau et coupez-le en tranches pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9521,5253,'fr','simit pâtisserie','Préparez un petit pain simit poğaça, rempli d''olives, de fromage et d''herbes pour toutes les saveurs d''un petit-déjeuner turc. Ils sont délicieux servis avec une tasse de thé','["350 ml de lait entier","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","2 jaunes d''œufs (congeler les blancs pour une autre recette)","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","115 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante, coupé en morceaux","1 œuf battu","1 cuillère à café de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à café de graines de nigelle","125 g d''olives noires marinées, dénoyautées et hachées (voir astuce ci-dessous)","125 g de feta émiettée","125 g de cheddar râpé","½ petit bouquet de persil haché","75g de pâte de poivre turc"]','["Faites chauffer le lait dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au micro-ondes ou dans une casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tiède. Ajoutez la levure et le sucre, puis laissez reposer 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit mousseux. Versez les jaunes d''œufs, la farine, le beurre et ½ cuillère à café de sel dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur et ajoutez le mélange de lait tiède. Pétrissez pendant 10 minutes – la pâte doit être collante. Ou pétrir à la main pendant environ 15 minutes.","Couvrir et laisser lever pendant au moins 1 à 2 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume, ou réfrigérer toute la nuit. Si vous faites lever la pâte à température ambiante, réfrigérez la pâte pendant 30 minutes après qu''elle ait doublé pour la rendre plus facile à travailler.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Mélangez les olives, les fromages et le persil, puis réservez. Abaissez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné en un grand rectangle (environ 46 x 30 cm).","Étalez la pâte de poivre sur toute la pâte. Avec un côté long face à vous, répartissez la moitié de la garniture sur la moitié du rectangle la plus proche de vous, puis repliez l''autre moitié par-dessus pour enfermer la garniture. Abaissez à nouveau délicatement la pâte pour que la garniture adhère à la pâte, puis découpez le rectangle verticalement en bandes de 20 x 2½ cm. En travaillant avec une bande à la fois, pliez la bande en deux sans serrer, puis en la tenant aux deux extrémités, tournez, puis tirez doucement les extrémités libres à travers la boucle.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 8 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Déposez le simit sur la plaque et badigeonnez-le d''œuf battu. Saupoudrer de graines de sésame et de nigelle, puis laisser reposer sur la plaque pendant environ 20 min.","Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir légèrement sur la plaque avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9522,8448,'fr','Tarte banoffee caramel salé et noisettes','Essayez une nouvelle version de la tarte au banoffee avec un praliné croquant aux noisettes, du caramel au beurre salé et de la chantilly au muscovado. Quelques ingrédients de triche vous feront gagner du temps','["100 g de noisettes blanchies","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","300 g de biscuits au chocolat et à l''avoine","85 g de beurre salé fondu","400 g de dulche au lait","300 ml de crème fraîche","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre muscovado noir","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille ou 1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 bananes moyennes, pelées et tranchées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez les noisettes sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les griller au four pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient uniformément dorées. Versez dans un bol. Tapisser la plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et réserver.","Versez le sucre semoule, la moitié des noisettes grillées et une petite pincée de sel marin dans une petite casserole sur feu doux. Cuire doucement pendant 7 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre fonde et prenne une couleur ambrée – ne remuez pas, mais remuez la casserole de temps en temps. Versez le mélange sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Laisser refroidir complètement, puis briser en petits morceaux.","Tapisser le fond d''un moule à tarte cannelé de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé. Cassez les biscuits au robot culinaire et mixez-les avec le reste des noisettes jusqu''à obtenir une fine miette. Ou bien, scellez les biscuits et les noix dans un sac alimentaire et écrasez-les avec un rouleau à pâtisserie. Versez la chapelure dans un bol et mélangez-la avec le beurre fondu. Presser au fond du moule et sur les côtés, puis réfrigérer pendant 2 heures.","Retirez le fond de tarte froid du moule (s''il colle légèrement, mettez-le à four chaud pendant 3 à 4 minutes pour faciliter le démoulage), puis déposez-le sur une assiette de service. Versez le dulche de leche dans un bol et incorporez délicatement une grosse pincée de sel marin (ne pas trop mélanger, sinon il deviendra trop lâche).","Versez la crème, le sucre muscovado et la vanille dans un autre bol et battez délicatement avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit doucement fouetté. Étalez le caramel au beurre salé sur le fond de tarte, puis disposez les tranches de banane dessus. Verser dessus la crème muscovado. Réfrigérer au moins 3 heures, voire toute la nuit. Parsemer de praliné noisette juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9523,5491,'fr','Tourbillon gluant de tomates et épinards au tamarin','Essayez ce riff sur une spanakopita grecque. Avec une touche sucrée-collante, épicée et piquante, c''est une pièce maîtresse végétarienne spectaculaire pour toute occasion spéciale.','["300 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","4 petites gousses d''ail, tranchées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tamarin","1 cuillère à café de sucre","1 poireau, coupé en deux et finement tranché","5 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","300 g d''épinards flétris, essorés et hachés grossièrement","400 g de feta émiettée","3 gros œufs battus","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de coriandre finement hachées, plus quelques feuilles pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","6 feuilles de pâte filo","100 g de beurre doux, fondu","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Mélanger les tomates, l''ail, la moitié de l''huile, le tamarin et le sucre, ainsi qu''une généreuse pincée d''assaisonnement. Verser sur une plaque à pâtisserie et mettre au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit collant et rôti. Laissez refroidir un peu.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen, puis ajoutez les poireaux et les oignons nouveaux en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''ils ramollissent, environ 10 minutes. Laisser refroidir complètement, puis verser dans un bol et mélanger avec les épinards, la feta, les tomates rôties, les œufs, la coriandre, le paprika fumé et l''assaisonnement.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C/gaz 6. Badigeonner une feuille de filo de beurre fondu, puis poser une autre feuille dessus et badigeonner à nouveau de beurre, en gardant le reste du filo recouvert d''un torchon propre et humide pour l''empêcher de sécher. Verser un tiers de la garniture le long du côté long du rectangle et rouler délicatement dans un long tube. Répétez cette opération encore deux fois jusqu''à ce que vous ayez utilisé toute la filo et la garniture. Dans un plat à tarte rond ou un moule rond allant au four, enroulez délicatement les trois rouleaux de filo de l''extérieur du plat vers le milieu, afin d''obtenir une grande spirale. Ne vous inquiétez pas s’il se fissure un peu – vous pouvez superposer la pâte filo pour couvrir les fissures. Badigeonnez toute la spirale de beurre, saupoudrez de flocons de piment et faites cuire au four pendant 50 à 60 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien dorée. Parsemer de coriandre supplémentaire pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9524,3950,'fr','Biscuits végétaliens au beurre de cacahuète','Préparez des biscuits végétaliens au beurre de cacahuète pour une gâterie bienvenue en milieu de matinée. Fabriqués avec des ingrédients sans produits laitiers, ils seront certainement appréciés de tous','["100 g de margarine sans produits laitiers","100 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de vanille","100 g de beurre de cacahuète croquant","225 g de farine nature","3 cuillères à soupe de cacahuètes grillées, divisées en deux"]','["Battre la margarine, le sucre et la vanille à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et lisses, puis incorporer le beurre de cacahuète et la farine jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement incorporés. Réunissez en une pâte lisse avec vos mains.","Étalez la pâte entre deux feuilles de papier sulfurisé jusqu''à ce qu''elle fasse environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Si la pâte est très molle (cela dépend de la margarine utilisée), placez-la au réfrigérateur pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement ferme. Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et tapisser une grande ou deux plaques à pâtisserie moyennes de papier sulfurisé.","Découpez des cercles dans la pâte à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 8 cm en plaçant les ronds sur les plaques à pâtisserie tapissées. Pressez fermement quelques moitiés de cacahuètes, côté coupé vers le haut, sur le dessus des biscuits. Cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient légèrement dorés. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques pendant 5 minutes, puis soulever sur une grille pour refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9525,8450,'fr','Tarte aux saucisses et à la purée','Savourez cette version ingénieuse d''un plat préféré de la famille, la saucisse et la purée. Il rassemble les deux ingrédients dans une tarte copieuse qui peut être facilement congelée','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","8 saucisses de porc","25g de beurre","2 oignons, finement tranchés","pincée de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","500 ml de bouillon de bœuf","petits pois, pour servir (facultatif)","1,25 kg de pommes de terre King Edward ou Maris Piper, coupées en gros morceaux","150 ml de lait entier","25g de beurre","25 g de cheddar affiné, râpé grossièrement (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites cuire doucement les saucisses à feu moyen-vif pendant 10 à 12 minutes, en les retournant jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées de tous les côtés. Transférer dans une assiette, puis mettre le beurre dans la poêle et faire chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille. Ajoutez les oignons en les mélangeant au beurre, puis saupoudrez de sucre et faites revenir pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient dorés. Répartissez la farine et remuez pour obtenir une pâte, puis ajoutez le concentré de tomates. Laissez cuire une minute, puis ajoutez le vinaigre, versez le bouillon et portez à ébullition. Baissez le feu et laissez mijoter. Versez le jus des saucisses, puis coupez les saucisses en tranches épaisses et ajoutez-les à la poêle. Laisser mijoter le tout pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une sauce à l''oignon brillante. Versez le mélange dans un plat allant au four.","Pour faire la purée, versez les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau froide salée et portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste cuites (la pointe d''un couteau doit glisser facilement). Égoutter et laisser reposer une minute. Versez le lait dans la casserole et portez à ébullition, puis versez les pommes de terre égouttées et le beurre et écrasez soigneusement. Assaisonner au goût.","Garnir les saucisses et la sauce avec la purée, en commençant par le bord du plat et en progressant vers le milieu. Utilisez une fourchette pour gratter les lignes de la garniture et répartissez-les sur le fromage, le cas échéant. Peut être assemblé, couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à deux jours ou congelé pendant trois mois. Décongeler complètement avant la cuisson. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Cuire la tarte sur une plaque pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes avant de démouler directement du plat de cuisson à table et de servir avec des petits pois, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9526,4537,'fr','Calzones au chorizo, roquette & citron confit','Remplissez ces calzones pleines de saveurs à l''avance, puis faites-les cuire directement du congélateur lorsque vous êtes occupé. Le combo chorizo ​​épicé et pâtisserie au paprika fumé est divin','["500 g de farine à pain forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à soupe de paprika","1½ cuillère à café de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour le bol","semoule, pour saupoudrer","100 g de chorizo ​​à cuire tranché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","350 ml en purée","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 petits citrons confits, coupés en quartiers, sans la peau et le zeste finement haché","½ petit bouquet de basilic haché grossièrement","50 g de roquette hachée grossièrement","75 g de mozzarella coupée en morceaux","25 g de parmesan râpé"]','["Pour la pâte, mettez la farine, le paprika, la levure, l''huile, 300 ml d''eau tiède et une grosse pincée de sel dans un bol. Mélanger en une pâte molle et légèrement humide. Pétrir au batteur sur socle équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur ou à la main pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse (elle sera encore assez molle). Versez dans un bol huilé, couvrez et laissez lever 2 heures.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Faites frire le chorizo ​​dans une grande casserole à feu moyen pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une partie de son huile soit libérée. Ajoutez l''ail et continuez à frire pendant 30 secondes. Ajouter la passata, le sucre, le vinaigre et les citrons confits et laisser mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Incorporer le basilic et la roquette. Laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 avec une plaque à pâtisserie à l''intérieur. Divisez la pâte en quatre morceaux, puis étalez chacun sur une surface légèrement saupoudrée en un mince cercle de 30 cm. Disposez chaque cercle sur un carré de papier sulfurisé saupoudré de semoule. Étalez la garniture refroidie sur la moitié de chaque cercle en laissant une bordure, puis recouvrez d''un peu de mozzarella. Badigeonnez le pourtour de chaque cercle d’un peu d’eau. En travaillant un cercle à la fois, repliez une moitié sur l''autre pour que la garniture soit enfermée, puis sertissez le bord pour sceller. Les calzones peuvent maintenant être congelées jusqu''à trois mois (voir ci-dessous). Soulevez les calzones sur les carrés de papier sulfurisé sur la plaque à pâtisserie chaude du four, saupoudrez de parmesan dessus et faites cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient gonflées et dorées."]','2026-01-11 00:01:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9527,8452,'fr','Crème aux œufs','Offrez à la famille cette crème aux œufs cuite au four pour un dessert réconfortant. Servir chaud ou laisser refroidir au réfrigérateur toute la nuit et déguster avec des fruits pochés','["3 œufs et 1 jaune légèrement battus","1 gousse de vanille fendue dans le sens de la longueur et les graines grattées ou 1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","60 g de sucre en poudre","215 ml de lait entier","215 ml de crème fraîche","muscade, à râper"]','["Chauffer le four à 150C/130C chaleur tournante/gaz 2. Battre ensemble les œufs, la vanille et le sucre avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à homogénéité. Incorporer le lait et la crème et verser dans un plat de taille moyenne. Râpez finement sur une généreuse râpe de muscade.","Remplissez à moitié une rôtissoire avec de l''eau pour faire un bain-marie. Placez le plat dans le moule de manière à ce que l''eau arrive aux trois quarts environ de la hauteur des parois du plat. Cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tout juste pris avec une légère oscillation au centre. Servir tiède ou laisser refroidir au réfrigérateur toute la nuit. Servir avec des fruits pochés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9528,8454,'fr','Roulade à l''érable, aux poires, aux pacanes et au mascarpone','Essayez le combo de pacanes et de sirop d''érable avec des poires juteuses et une génoise légère comme l''air dans cette impressionnante roulade. C''est excellent avec une tasse de thé ou servi comme pudding','["huile végétale, pour la boîte","4 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","3 petites poires mûres, pelées, évidées et coupées en morceaux de 1 cm","1 citron, jus","250 g de mascarpone","150 g de crème fraîche","5 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable noir, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","200 g de noix de pécan"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler un moule à rouleau suisse de 30 x 24 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mettez les œufs, la vanille et les deux sucres dans un grand bol et battez avec un fouet électrique pendant 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à épaississement et doublement de volume. Les batteurs doivent laisser une épaisse traînée lorsqu’ils sont retirés du mélange.","Tamisez la farine, la levure chimique, la cannelle et ¼ de cuillère à café de sel, et incorporez très délicatement à l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal. Verser dans le moule préparé et cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et élastique. Laisser refroidir un peu dans le moule, puis démouler sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé saupoudrée de sucre glace. Rouler par une extrémité plus longue avec le papier sulfurisé, puis laisser refroidir.","Mélangez les poires avec le jus de citron dans un bol, puis versez-les dans une passoire placée au-dessus d''un bol pour égoutter tout excès de liquide. Battre ensemble le mascarpone, la crème double et 3 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et onctueuse. Versez les noix de pécan dans un robot culinaire et mixez-les jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement hachées, puis étalez-les sur une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé.","Lorsque la génoise est complètement refroidie, déroulez-la et arrosez-la du reste de sirop d''érable. Tartiner avec les trois quarts du mélange au mascarpone, puis répartir sur les poires et rouler à nouveau bien serré. Étalez le reste du mascarpone sur tout l''extérieur de la roulade, puis roulez rapidement dans les noix de pécan hachées. Couper en tranches épaisses et servir avec un filet supplémentaire de sirop d''érable, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9529,8456,'fr','Gâteau aux mûres et à l''orange','Essayez une variante d''une génoise en couches avec des mûres, des oranges piquantes et de la marmelade à la place de votre garniture habituelle. Appliquez la garniture pour un look professionnel','["225 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","225 g de sucre en poudre","4 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 oranges zestées (réserver les oranges pour le filet ci-dessous)","150 g de mûres, coupées en deux si grosses","3 oranges pressées (utilisez les oranges zestées, ci-dessus, il vous en faudra environ 150 ml), 1 zestée","100 g de sucre en poudre","150 g de beurre doux, ramolli","350 g de sucre glace","1 orange, zestée, plus un zeste supplémentaire pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","200 g de marmelade","100g de mûres"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer deux moules à cake de 20 cm de diamètre et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre et le sucre en poudre ensemble dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter les œufs, un à la fois, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien mélangés. Versez la vanille, la farine et la levure chimique et incorporez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez délicatement le zeste d''orange et les mûres, en prenant soin de ne pas trop mélanger.","Répartissez la pâte entre les deux moules et faites cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium après 30 minutes s''ils commencent à colorer trop vite.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le filet. Mettez le jus d''orange, le zeste et le sucre dans une petite casserole et laissez mijoter pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un sirop fin se forme. Verser dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et réserver.","Lorsque les génoises sont prêtes, versez le sirop sur les deux encore chaudes et badigeonnez-les uniformément à l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie. Laisser refroidir complètement dans les moules.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la crème au beurre pour le topping. Battre le beurre et le sucre glace dans un grand bol avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger, pâle et mousseux. Incorporer le zeste d''orange et le lait jusqu''à ce qu''ils se détachent légèrement. Verser dans une poche à douille munie d''une grosse douille ronde. Battez la marmelade pour la décoller, puis transférez-en un peu dans une poche à douille munie d''une petite douille ronde.","Retirez les génoises refroidies des moules et placez-en une sur un plateau ou une assiette à gâteau. Disposez des points de crème au beurre sur le dessus en cercle autour du bord, puis trois points au milieu. Versez un peu de marmelade dans les interstices entre la crème au beurre, puis recouvrez avec la deuxième génoise. Déposez davantage de points de crème au beurre sur toute la surface, puis remplissez les espaces en versant le reste de la marmelade. Pour finir, parsemez de mûres et de zeste d''orange supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:01:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9530,8458,'fr','Pâtisseries à la crème aux prunes rôties et aux pistaches','Profitez des prunes à la fin de l''été et faites-les cuire dans un fond de tarte fourré à la pistache et à la crème anglaise. Ils en valent bien la peine','["50 g de beurre froid haché plus 120 g de beurre surgelé (voir étape 1)","300 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50g de sucre glace","2 oeufs, battus","100 g de pistaches décortiquées","150 ml de lait entier","150 ml de crème fraîche","3 jaunes d''œufs (congeler les blancs pour une autre recette)","65 g de sucre en poudre","15g de farine nature","15g de farine de maïs","4 prunes rouges, coupées en deux et dénoyautées","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","1⁄2 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["La veille de préparer les pâtisseries, enveloppez 120 g de beurre dans du papier aluminium et congelez-le jusqu''à ce qu''il soit solide. Mélangez la farine, le sucre glace et ¼ cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol. Ajoutez le beurre haché et incorporez-le au mélange de farine jusqu''à ce qu''il ressemble à de la chapelure fine. Incorporez 7 cuillères à soupe d''eau très froide (si elle semble encore un peu sèche, ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires). Pétrissez légèrement la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle se rassemble, puis étalez-la sur une surface légèrement farinée en un rectangle. À l''aide d''une râpe à fromage grossière, râpez la moitié du beurre congelé sur les tiers médian et inférieur de la pâte. Rabattez le tiers supérieur et repliez le tiers inférieur, comme si vous pliez une lettre. Retournez la pâte à 90 degrés et répétez avec le reste du beurre congelé. Filmer et réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes.","Mettez 75 g de pistaches dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Couvrir d''eau bouillante, puis laisser tremper 5 min. Égoutter, verser dans un robot culinaire et mixer pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Annuler.","Mettez le lait et la crème fraîche dans une petite casserole sur feu moyen. Portez à ébullition, puis retirez du feu. Fouetter les jaunes d''œufs, le sucre en poudre et les farines dans un bol. Incorporez progressivement le mélange de lait en plusieurs fois, puis versez dans une casserole propre posée sur feu doux. Cuire en remuant continuellement jusqu''à ce que la crème soit épaisse. Laisser mijoter encore 2 minutes, puis incorporer une petite pincée de sel marin. Transférer dans un bol et laisser refroidir. Une fois refroidi, versez-le dans un robot culinaire avec la pâte de pistache et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Mettre dans un bol et réserver.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 6. Mettez les prunes dans une rôtissoire, côté coupé vers le bas. Saupoudrer de sucre et de vanille. Rôtir pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis mais en conservant leur forme. Laisser refroidir. Allumez le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 8.","Étalez la pâte refroidie sur un plan légèrement fariné jusqu''à obtenir un rectangle d''environ 38 x 24 cm. Coupez les côtés avec un couteau bien aiguisé, puis coupez la pâte en huit rectangles de 11 x 10 cm. Tracez une bordure de 1 cm autour de chacun, puis déposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé (vous aurez peut-être besoin de deux plaques). Badigeonner d''œuf battu, puis réfrigérer 15 min. Enfourner 20 mn. Abaissez le centre, puis versez ou versez la crème pistache et garnissez chacun d''une moitié de prune. Cuire au four encore 10 à 15 minutes. Hachez finement le reste des pistaches et répartissez-les sur les pâtisseries chaudes. Laisser refroidir complètement avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9531,8460,'fr','Brioches au caramel, aux pommes et à la cannelle','Équilibrez la saveur piquante de la pomme avec la douceur du caramel et un glaçage au fromage à pâte molle acidulé pour préparer ces brioches à la cannelle inspirées de la pomme au caramel.','["320 ml de lait (n''importe quel lait fera l''affaire), plus un peu supplémentaire","50 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","huile végétale, pour lever","3 pommes moyennes de consommation, pelées, évidées et coupées en cubes de 1 cm","noisette de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","100 g de beurre ramolli","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle","150g de fromage à pâte molle","150g de sucre glace","grosse pincée de cannelle","3 cuillères à soupe de caramel en conserve"]','["Préparez la pâte pour les petits pains la veille de leur cuisson, si vous avez le temps – cela développera une meilleure saveur. Faites chauffer le lait dans une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fumant mais pas bouillant. Ajoutez le beurre et remuez la poêle pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu et que le lait ait légèrement refroidi. Il devrait être juste chaud.","Mettez la farine dans un grand bol ou dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle. Ajoutez la levure et le sucre d''un côté du bol, puis ½ cuillère à café de sel de l''autre. Fouettez ensemble, puis versez le lait beurré tiède. Mélangez jusqu''à ce que les ingrédients forment une pâte molle (elle doit être un peu collante), puis versez-la sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez à la main pendant 8 à 10 minutes, ou laissez le batteur sur socle fonctionner pendant environ 5 minutes. La pâte sera extensible et molle lorsqu’elle sera prête – vous devriez pouvoir la séparer sans qu’elle se brise immédiatement (cela signifie que le gluten a été développé). Huiler légèrement un bol, ajouter la pâte et couvrir. Laisser lever à température ambiante pendant quelques heures, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte ait doublé de volume. Ou détendez-vous toute la nuit.","Pour préparer la garniture aux pommes, faites cuire les pommes, le beurre, le sucre et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau dans une casserole pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres et collantes. Ajoutez un peu d''eau si la casserole semble sèche ou si le sucre commence à brûler. Laisser refroidir.","Si la pâte a été refroidie, sortez-la du réfrigérateur 30 minutes avant de la façonner. Pour le beurre à la cannelle, mélangez le beurre, le sucre, la vanille et la cannelle avec une pincée de sel. Versez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné, formez un rectangle grossier, puis étalez-la jusqu''à ce qu''elle mesure environ 50 x 40 cm. Étalez le beurre de cannelle sur la pâte jusqu''aux bords. Verser sur la garniture aux pommes.","En travaillant à partir de l''un des côtés les plus longs, enroulez la pâte aussi étroitement que possible en forme de saucisse. Couper en 12 morceaux égaux. Pour ce faire facilement, coupez d''abord la pâte en deux sur la largeur, puis coupez chaque moitié en trois morceaux, puis coupez chaque morceau en deux. Tapisser un grand plat rond allant au four ou un moule à gâteau (environ 33 cm) de papier sulfurisé. Disposez les petits pains, côté coupé vers le haut, dans le plat ou le moule. Assurez-vous que les queues des petits pains (là où la pâte s''ouvre) sont repliées vers le milieu du moule, afin qu''elles ne se déploient pas à la cuisson. Laissez un peu d''espace autour de chaque chignon, car ils se dilateront au fur et à mesure. Couvrez légèrement et laissez lever pendant 30 minutes à 2 heures (selon la température de votre cuisine) jusqu''à ce que les petits pains soient gonflés et se touchent sur les côtés. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Vérifiez les petits pains après 25 minutes – s’ils semblent encore un peu pâteux au centre mais que les bords brûlent, couvrez de papier d’aluminium et poursuivez la cuisson. Laissez refroidir dans le moule pendant que vous préparez le glaçage.","Mélangez le fromage à pâte molle, le sucre glace et la cannelle. Étalez-le sur les petits pains encore légèrement tièdes, afin que le glaçage coule un peu dans les tourbillons des petits pains sans fondre complètement. Détendez le caramel avec une goutte de lait, si besoin, puis arrosez-le de glaçage. Laisser reposer 30 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9532,8462,'fr','Petits pains glacés','Ces petits pains glacés parfaits sont parfaits pour un thé de l''après-midi ou un projet de pâtisserie du week-end. Remplissez de confiture et de crème pour une gâterie traditionnelle.','["350 ml de lait, plus un peu pour le brossage","30 g de beurre coupé en cubes","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte","10 g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","300 g de sucre glace, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","du colorant alimentaire jaune, rose et violet (facultatif)","300 ml de crème fouettée ou de crème double","200 g de crème de citron","200 g de confiture de framboise","200 g de confiture de cassis","cerises glacées, pépites ou pétales de rose et de violette confits, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer le lait dans une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fumant. Ajouter le beurre et remuer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. Laisser refroidir légèrement. Versez la farine et la levure dans un bol ou un batteur sur socle équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur, puis ajoutez le sucre en poudre et ½ cuillère à café de sel.","Lorsque le mélange de lait a légèrement refroidi (il doit être juste chaud), versez-le dans le mélange de farine. Si vous utilisez un batteur sur socle, mélangez pendant 5 à 8 minutes à vitesse moyenne jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit élastique. Ou pétrissez dans le bol pendant environ 10 minutes – lorsque la pâte est séparée, elle devrait pouvoir s’étirer sans se déchirer.","Mettez la pâte dans un bol propre, couvrez d''un torchon et laissez lever 1h30 ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. Ou transférez-le au réfrigérateur pour qu''il lève lentement jusqu''à 24 heures (cela améliorera la texture et la saveur).","Si la pâte est froide, sortez-la du réfrigérateur 1 h avant de la façonner. Divisez en 10 portions égales (pesez-les si vous voulez être précis). Pour faire des petits pains aux doigts, prenez un morceau de pâte et roulez-le en forme de doigt grossier, comme un mini pain à hot-dog. Rentrez les côtés au milieu du chignon. Retournez le chignon et assurez-vous que la surface est bien tendue. Disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée en laissant un espace entre chacun. Couvrir légèrement et laisser lever 30 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Badigeonner les petits pains de lait et cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Mettez sur une grille et laissez refroidir.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau – il doit être épais. Répartissez dans les bols, en fonction de la quantité de colorants alimentaires que vous utilisez (nous en avons utilisé trois). Teignez chacun avec une coloration différente, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire.","Fouetter la crème et 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''elle conserve sa forme. Ne fouettez pas trop, car cela épaissira au fur et à mesure que vous pipez (voir conseil ci-dessous). Equipez une poche à douille avec une douille étoile et remplissez-la avec un tiers de la crème (voir astuce ci-dessous).","Divisez les petits pains au milieu dans le sens de la longueur. Versez environ 60 g de crème de citron ou de confiture sur la moitié inférieure de chaque petit pain (ou au milieu), en alternant les saveurs, puis nappez d''un tourbillon de crème. Continuez jusqu''à ce que tous les petits pains soient remplis, en remplissant la poche à douille de crème au besoin. Versez un peu de glaçage sur chaque pain en faisant correspondre les couleurs à la confiture (nous avons utilisé du jaune pour le caillé, du rose pour la confiture de framboise et du violet pour le cassis). Décorez si vous le souhaitez avec les cerises glacées, les pépites et les pétales confits, puis laissez reposer environ 20 minutes avant de servir. A consommer de préférence le jour même de leur préparation, mais se conserve 24 heures au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:01:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9533,8464,'fr','Pain de maïs à la citrouille et beurre de jalapeño fouetté','Étalez un morceau de pain de maïs avec du beurre de jalapeño épicé pour une combinaison à couper le souffle servie avec un chili con carne. C''est fantastique de partager de la nourriture','["50 g de beurre salé fondu, plus un peu pour la poêle","300 g de semoule fine ou polenta","150 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 gros œufs","425 g de purée de potiron","250 ml de babeurre ou de yaourt nature","2 piments rouges épépinés et finement hachés","150 g de beurre ramolli","25 g de jalapeños tranchés dans un pot, hachés grossièrement, plus 2 cuillères à soupe de liquide du pot"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Beurrer un moule allant au four de 30 cm. Mélanger la semoule, la farine, la levure chimique et le bicarbe dans un grand bol et assaisonner. Mettez le beurre, les œufs, la citrouille, le babeurre et les piments dans un pichet et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporez progressivement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs, en prenant soin de ne pas trop mélanger. Verser dans le moule et cuire au four pendant 50 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le beurre jalapeño fouetté. Battre le beurre avec les jalapeños et le liquide du pot à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, jusqu''à ce que le mélange devienne clair et pâle. Assaisonner au goût.","Une fois le pain de maïs cuit, servir chaud ou laisser refroidir, avec le beurre jalapeño sur le côté pour l''étaler. Le pain de maïs se conservera dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à trois jours, ou congelé pendant deux à trois mois. Le beurre se conserve au réfrigérateur, couvert, jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:01:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9534,8466,'fr','Flaps végétaliens aux dattes et aux noix','Préparez ces flapjacks faciles aux dattes et aux noix pour les onze ans ou lorsque vous avez besoin d''un remontant. À base de plantes et végétaliens, ils sont idéaux pour toute personne suivant un régime sans produits laitiers','["100 g de dattes medjool dénoyautées","1 banane mûre","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de moitiés de noix","250 g de flocons d''avoine","50g de graines de chanvre"]','["Tapisser un moule carré de 20 x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Hachez grossièrement les dattes et couvrez de 100 ml d''eau bouillante. Laisser tremper 10 min.","Mettez la banane dans un bol, écrasez-la à la fourchette, puis incorporez la cannelle, la vanille, une pincée de sel marin et les dattes trempées ainsi que leur liquide.","Versez le mélange dans un robot culinaire avec la moitié des noix et 100 g de flocons d''avoine. Pulsez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse. Verser dans un bol et mélanger avec la plupart des noix, de l''avoine et des graines de chanvre restantes.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Presser le mélange dans le moule tapissé, garnir du reste des noix et des graines et cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et ferme. Laisser refroidir complètement avant de couper en neuf carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9535,8468,'fr','Pain à partager fromage, ciboulette et jambon','Faites cuire ce pain à séparer satisfaisant, farci de fromage fondant, de moutarde et de jambon. Vous pouvez utiliser n''importe quel fromage que vous avez au réfrigérateur','["170 ml de lait entier","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","100 g de beurre doux coupé en cubes","1½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","3 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte","1 sachet de 7g de levure sèche à action rapide","4 œufs moyens, légèrement battus, plus 1 pour glacer","huile, pour prouver","250 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","50 g de parmesan râpé","½ bouquet de ciboulette finement hachée","150 g de jambon fumé haché grossièrement"]','["Versez le lait dans une casserole et ajoutez le sucre et le beurre. Réchauffer doucement en remuant la poêle jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu. Réserver jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tiède.","Versez le sel, la moutarde, la farine et la levure dans un grand bol à mélanger et remuez. Faites un puits au centre, puis versez-y le mélange œufs battus et lait. Mélangez rapidement avec une cuillère en bois pour obtenir une pâte grossière, puis versez-la sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrissez pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit élastique et élastique. Vous pouvez également pétrir dans un batteur sur socle pendant 7 à 10 minutes à l’aide du crochet. Huiler légèrement un grand bol à mélanger. Mettez la pâte dans le bol et couvrez-la légèrement d''un torchon. Laisser dans un endroit chaud pendant 1h30 à 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Renversez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée en la frappant légèrement et en la pétrissant brièvement. Saupoudrer la moitié du fromage, toute la ciboulette et tout le jambon. Pétrir la pâte jusqu''à ce que le jambon et le fromage soient bien répartis. Divisez la pâte en 18 boules de taille égale. Pincez le fond pour créer des boules rondes et uniformes. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et dessiner un gabarit rond de 25 cm sur le papier sulfurisé (une grande assiette convient bien pour cela). Disposez les boules de pâte en cercles concentriques dans le cercle que vous avez dessiné. Remplissez chaque espace avec une autre pincée de fromage. Couvrir légèrement. Laisser reposer 1 à 1h30 ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte lève.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Battre l''œuf restant et badigeonner légèrement les boules de pâte. Saupoudrer la majeure partie du reste de fromage, puis enfourner pour 25 minutes. Saupoudrer du reste de fromage et enfourner encore 5 minutes. Laisser refroidir un peu avant de servir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:01:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9536,4129,'fr','Feta au four au sésame et au miel','Combinez les saveurs du fromage salé et du miel sucré pour créer un plat qui est bien plus que la somme de ses parties. Riche et décadent, servir avec du pitta chaud','["1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame grillées","200 g de bloc de feta","2 cuillères à soupe de miel, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à café d''origan grossièrement haché","huile d''olive, pour arroser","pains pitta réchauffés, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettez les graines de sésame dans un plat peu profond et badigeonnez tout le bloc de feta de miel. Pressez délicatement la feta enrobée de miel dans les graines de sésame, en la retournant pour qu''elle soit bien recouverte de graines.","Mettez la feta dans un plat allant au four (elle doit être bien ajustée), puis saupoudrez d''origan et d''une pincée de sel marin. Arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la feta soit tendre, puis arroser d''un peu de miel supplémentaire et servir avec les pains pitta à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:01:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9537,8470,'fr','Rouleaux de saucisses de niveau supérieur','Allez plus loin avec des rouleaux de saucisses faits maison et réalisez votre propre pâte feuilletée. Le mélange de viande de saucisse et de farce aux herbes du commerce permet de gagner du temps','["800 g de chair à saucisse","100 g de mélange de farce à la sauge et à l''oignon","1 œuf battu","Moutarde anglaise, ketchup ou sauce brune, pour servir","250 g de beurre surgelé","400 g de farine nature (ou 350 g de farine nature et 50 g de farine de seigle blanche), plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre ou de vin blanc"]','["La veille de la cuisson, congelez le beurre pour la pâtisserie. Le jour même, versez la farine dans un grand bol avec une pincée de sel et la moutarde en poudre. Tenez le bloc de beurre dans son emballage et râpez-le grossièrement directement dans la farine, en retirant l''emballage petit à petit si nécessaire et en trempant le bout du beurre dans la farine de temps en temps pour éviter qu''il ne s''agglutine dans le bol. Utilisez une palette ou un couteau à couverts et mélangez légèrement, puis ajoutez environ 200 ml d''eau glacée et le vinaigre pour rassembler la pâte. Filmer et réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Versez la chair à saucisse dans un bol avec le mélange à farce, 100 ml d''eau froide et beaucoup de poivre noir. Écrasez le tout avec vos mains jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène, puis placez-le au réfrigérateur pendant que vous étalez la pâte. Versez la pâte sur un plan fariné, étalez-la en un rectangle d''environ 50 cm x 25 cm et coupez les bords. Badigeonnez légèrement la pâte d''un peu d''œuf, puis façonnez le mélange de saucisses en un rouleau de 50 cm. Placez la saucisse juste de manière décentrée sur la pâte, puis repliez la pâte et sertissez-la ou utilisez une fourchette pour presser les extrémités ensemble. Coupez-le en huit morceaux à l''aide d''un couteau trempé dans de l''eau tiède et essuyé entre les tranches. Placer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à 24 heures. Pour cuire plus tôt, mettre au congélateur pendant 15 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Badigeonner les petits pains avec encore de l''œuf battu, cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, puis badigeonner à nouveau et remettre au four encore 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient de couleur acajou clair. Laisser refroidir sur une grille, puis servir chaud avec de la moutarde anglaise, du ketchup ou de la sauce brune et un verre de cidre bien frais, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9538,4135,'fr','Roulés au fromage, marmite et épinards','Préparez ces moulinets faciles aux saveurs de cheddar, de marmite et d''épinards à servir avec une soupe ou dans le cadre d''un pique-nique familial. Congeler avant la cuisson, si vous préférez','["320 g de pâte feuilletée légère toute prête","1 cuillère à soupe de Marmite","2-3 grosses poignées d''épinards","80 g de cheddar"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Déroulez la pâte avec le côté le plus long directement devant vous. Étalez la Marmite sur la surface. Déchirez les épinards sur la Marmite et parsemez-les de fromage en veillant à ce qu''ils soient bien répartis.","Roulez fermement la pâte loin de vous (en commençant par le côté le plus long) pour créer une longue forme de boudin, puis coupez-la en 12 morceaux. Disposer sur deux plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé, côté spirale vers le haut, et écraser un peu avec la main. Restera couvert et congelé à ce stade. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes (ou 25 minutes si la cuisson est congelée), jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit gonflée et dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:01:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9539,8472,'fr','Gâteau goutte à goutte à la ganache au chocolat','Préparez cet impressionnant gâteau à la ganache au chocolat avec de la crème au beurre à la meringue suisse pour une occasion spéciale. Cette éponge gourmande est parfaite pour une fête','["340 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","340 g de sucre en poudre","6 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","340 g de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","3 gros blancs d''œufs","225 g de sucre en poudre","300 g de beurre doux coupé en cubes et ramolli","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de chocolat noir finement haché","75 ml de crème fraîche","des fleurs comestibles, des paillettes ou du chocolat, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Beurrer trois moules à cake ronds de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble dans un grand bol jusqu''à consistance légère et lisse. Incorporer progressivement les œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient combinés, puis incorporer la vanille. Incorporer la farine et la levure chimique jusqu''à ce que tout soit combiné. Incorporer le lait pour détendre.","Cuire les génoises pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la crème au beurre meringuée suisse. Mettez les blancs d''œufs et le sucre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une petite casserole d''eau frémissante. Assurez-vous que le bol ne touche pas l''eau. Fouettez pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Mettez dans un batteur électrique et fouettez pendant 10 minutes à vitesse moyenne-élevée jusqu''à obtenir une meringue épaisse.","Ajoutez progressivement le beurre au mélange de meringue pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit incorporé et que la crème au beurre soit mousseuse.","Placez une génoise sur une assiette ou un support à gâteau, recouvrez-la de quelques cuillères à soupe de crème au beurre et étalez-la en une couche uniforme. Ajoutez l’éponge suivante et répétez. Garnir avec la dernière génoise.","Étalez une fine couche de crème au beurre autour du gâteau pour que tous les côtés soient enrobés – c''est ce qu''on appelle une couche de chapelure. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant 45 minutes. Retirez et lissez une épaisse couche du reste de crème au beurre autour du gâteau à l''aide d''une spatule en réservant un peu pour la décoration. Remettre au réfrigérateur 45 min à 1 h pour prendre.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la ganache. Mettez le chocolat noir dans un bol et faites chauffer la crème dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste fumante. Versez la crème sur le chocolat et laissez fondre 5 à 10 minutes. Remuer pour obtenir une ganache brillante, puis réserver pour qu''elle raffermisse un peu – vous voulez qu''elle soit versable mais pas trop liquide. Versez la ganache sur le bord supérieur du gâteau, en l''encourageant à arroser le côté avec votre cuillère – commencez par l''arrière du gâteau pour bien comprendre. Remplissez également le milieu du dessus du gâteau avec du chocolat. Laisser poser 10 min.","Pour décorer, mettez les restes de crème au beurre dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille ronde et déposez des petits points sur le dessus du gâteau. Décorez à votre guise, retirez les fleurs avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:01:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9540,8474,'fr','Brioche','Réalisez une brioche maison et dégustez-la avec de la confiture ou du beurre au petit-déjeuner. Cela demande un peu d''effort, mais les résultats de ce pain sucré et moelleux en valent la peine.','["450 g de farine blanche forte","2 cuillères à café de sel marin fin","50 g de sucre en poudre","7g de levure active séchée","100 ml de lait entier","4 œufs à température ambiante, battus, plus 1 pour la dorure","190 g de beurre salé coupé en cubes et ramolli"]','["Mettez la farine dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle muni d''un crochet pétrisseur. Ajoutez le sel d''un côté et le sucre de l''autre. Versez la levure à côté du sucre. Mélangez chaque face avec la farine avec vos mains, puis mélangez le tout avec le crochet pétrisseur.","Faites chauffer le lait jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tiède au toucher, mais pas brûlant. Incorporer au mélange de farine jusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné. Avec le crochet pétrisseur sur feu moyen, ajoutez progressivement les œufs et mélangez pendant 10 min.","Ajoutez progressivement le beurre ramolli, un ou deux cubes à la fois, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Cela prendra 5 à 8 minutes. Raclez les côtés, la pâte sera très molle.","Grattez la pâte dans un grand bol, couvrez d''un torchon et laissez reposer 1h30 à 2h jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume et soit bien levée. Une fois levé, mettre au réfrigérateur pendant 1 h.","Tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à cake de 900 g de papier sulfurisé. Répartissez la pâte en sept morceaux égaux (le moyen le plus simple de le faire avec précision est de la peser). Saupoudrez légèrement un plan de travail de farine, prenez un morceau de pâte et tirez chaque coin vers le milieu pour former une forme circulaire. Avec un peu de pression, poussez vers le bas et roulez en boule. Répétez avec les six pièces restantes.","Mettez les boules dans le moule, quatre d''un côté et trois dans les interstices de l''autre côté. Couvrir d''un torchon et laisser lever 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il double presque de volume. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Badigeonner légèrement la pâte avec la dorure aux œufs et cuire au four pendant 30-35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et levée. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 20 minutes, puis retirer et laisser refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9541,8476,'fr','Torsades à la cannelle','Préparez ces fabuleuses torsades à la cannelle pour un petit-déjeuner sur le pouce ou une friandise sucrée. Ils demandent un peu d''effort mais en valent la peine','["275g de lait entier","40 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes","500 g de farine blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","7g de levure active séchée","50 g de sucre en poudre","1 petit œuf et 1 œuf battu pour le glaçage","75 g de beurre fondu","150 g de sucre en poudre","3 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","50 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue"]','["Faites chauffer le lait et le beurre dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu. Laisser refroidir légèrement – ​​le lait doit être tiède, pas brûlant. Mettez la farine dans un grand bol à mélanger avec une pincée de sel sur un côté du bol. Ajoutez la levure dans la farine de l’autre côté du bol, pour qu’elle ne touche pas le sel. Versez le sucre, puis mélangez le tout.","Versez progressivement le lait tiède dans les ingrédients secs en mélangeant avec les mains jusqu''à obtenir une pâte relativement collante. Vous n’aurez peut-être pas besoin de tout le lait. Ajoutez l''œuf et continuez à travailler jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Saupoudrez légèrement une surface de farine et étalez la pâte. Il sera assez humide – plus vous le pétrirez, plus cela deviendra facile. Pétrissez environ 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Mettre dans un bol légèrement fariné pour lever pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Pour réaliser la garniture, mélangez le beurre fondu, le sucre et la cannelle jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Annuler.","Etalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné jusqu''à obtenir un rectangle d''environ 30 x 40 cm. Étaler sur la garniture à l''aide d''une spatule jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit complètement recouverte.","Pliez en deux dans le sens de la largeur et coupez en 16 à 18 bandes sur le côté le plus court. Tournez les deux extrémités de chaque bande dans des directions opposées jusqu''à ce qu''une forme de spirale se forme. En tenant une extrémité dans votre main, enroulez le reste de la pâte autour et par-dessus, en appuyant les extrémités dans le bas du pain pour qu''il ne s''effiloche pas pendant la cuisson.","Disposer sur deux plaques à pâtisserie tapissées et espacées de 5 cm. Laisser lever 30 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il lève légèrement. Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Badigeonner le dessus des petits pains avec un peu d''œuf et cuire au four pendant 18-20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ne vous inquiétez pas si un peu de beurre à la cannelle en sort.","Pour l''enrobage, mélangez le sucre et la cannelle. Pendant qu''ils sont encore chauds, mélangez les petits pains dans le sucre et dégustez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:01:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9542,8478,'fr','Brioches au levain et à la cannelle','Utilisez une entrée au levain pour préparer ces petites brioches à la cannelle. Il ajoute une saveur contrastée aux saveurs sucrées et collantes classiques. Garnir d''un glaçage au fromage à pâte molle, si vous le souhaitez','["200 g de levain blanc actif","350 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50g de farine complète","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 ml de lait tiède","1 oeuf","50 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","150 g de sucre roux clair","125 g de beurre ramolli","2 cuillères à soupe de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","100g de fromage à pâte molle","150g de sucre glace","¼ cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de vanille"]','["Assurez-vous que votre entrée est active – elle doit être agréable et pétillante. Si ce n’est pas le cas, nourrissez-le et attendez qu’une cuillère à café de démarreur flotte dans l’eau tiède.","Versez tous les ingrédients de la pâte, sauf le beurre, dans un bol et mélangez avec vos mains pour former une pâte hirsute – assurez-vous que toute la farine autour du bol est bien mélangée. Laissez la pâte dans le bol, recouverte d''un chiffon humide, pendant 30 minutes.","Incorporez le beurre à la pâte avec 1 cuillère à café de sel. Une fois bien mélangée, versez la pâte sur une surface et pétrissez doucement pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Formez une boule avec la pâte et reposez-vous dans le bol. Couvrir et laisser dans un endroit tiède pendant 3 à 4 heures jusqu''à ce que la pâte ait presque doublé de volume.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture en battant ensemble le sucre, le beurre, la cannelle et une pincée de sel. Réserver à température ambiante pour garder le moelleux.","Beurrer et tapisser un moule carré – les moules plus petits (20 x 20 cm) peuvent contenir neuf petits pains, les moules plus grands (25 x 25 cm) en contenir 12. Versez la pâte sur une surface farinée et étalez-la pour obtenir un rectangle d''environ 50 x 25 cm. Étalez la garniture sur le rectangle pour qu''il soit complètement recouvert. Roulez la pâte le long du bord long pour obtenir une saucisse serrée de type rouleau suisse. Coupez votre pâte en morceaux et disposez-les, côté spirale vers le haut, dans le moule. Laisser reposer 1 h à température ambiante, puis couvrir et laisser au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Chauffez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Couvrez le moule de papier d''aluminium et faites cuire au four sur une plaque à pâtisserie (cela empêchera toute fuite de mélange de couler dans votre four) pendant 30 minutes, puis retirez le papier d''aluminium et faites cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes supplémentaires pour dorer légèrement.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sirop doré avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau bouillante. Dès la sortie du four, badigeonnez-les généreusement de sirop, puis laissez refroidir un peu. Sortez les petits pains du moule encore chauds et laissez-les refroidir sur une grille. Pour faire le glaçage, battez le fromage à pâte molle, le sucre et la vanille jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient épais mais en filet. Verser sur les petits pains lorsqu''ils sont complètement refroidis."]','2026-01-11 00:01:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9543,8480,'fr','Empire biscuits','Préparez un lot de ces biscuits empire faciles et dégustez-les avec une tasse de thé. Sandwich avec de la confiture de framboise et garnir d''un glaçage épais et d''une cerise glacée pour finir','["175 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","100 g de beurre salé froid coupé en cubes","335 g de sucre glace","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 jaunes d''œufs moyens","100 g de confiture de framboise","50 g de cerises glacées, coupées en quartiers"]','["Mettez la farine, le beurre, 85 g de sucre glace, la vanille et les jaunes d''œufs dans un robot culinaire et mélangez par rafales jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène (vous pouvez également frotter le beurre et la farine du bout des doigts et incorporer le sucre, la vanille et les jaunes d''œufs). Ajoutez ½ cuillère à soupe d''eau si le mélange est un peu sec. Versez le mélange grossier sur un plan de travail et pétrissez brièvement jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit homogène. Filmer et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Saupoudrez légèrement votre plan de travail de farine et étalez la pâte sur environ 3 mm d''épaisseur. Découpez 24 ronds de pâte avec un emporte-pièce de 7 cm. Rassemblez les restes de pâte et relancez-les pour obtenir d''autres biscuits. Alignez les disques de pâte sur les plaques à pâtisserie, puis enfournez pendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés sur les bords. Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement.","Mélangez le reste du sucre glace avec 2-3 cuillères à café d''eau pour obtenir un glaçage très épais. Versez ou déposez le glaçage sur le dessus de la moitié des biscuits, en laissant une bordure sur le pourtour de chacun. Garnir d''un petit morceau de cerise glacée au centre, puis laisser reposer 30 min. Étalez la confiture sur les biscuits non glacés et sur le sandwich avec les moitiés glacées. Se conserve deux jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9544,8482,'fr','Biscuits sans oeufs','Préparez des biscuits aux pépites de chocolat sans œufs pour vous régaler et ajoutez du cacao, si vous le souhaitez, pour faire des versions chocolatées. Ils sont idéaux si vous suivez un régime sans œufs','["125 g de beurre ramolli","125 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''essence ou d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","50 g de pépites de chocolat au lait ou blanc","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Crémer le beurre et le sucre ensemble à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois ou d''un fouet électrique dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger, mousseux et doré.","Incorporer la vanille, la farine, la levure chimique et les pépites de chocolat. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour rassembler le mélange si nécessaire, et la poudre de cacao pour en faire des biscuits au chocolat, si vous le souhaitez. Rassemblez la pâte en boule avec vos mains.","Saupoudrez un peu de farine sur votre plan de travail et sur la pâte. Abaissez la pâte jusqu''à obtenir une épaisseur de 3 mm et, à l''aide d''emporte-pièces, découpez-la et disposez-la sur des plaques à pâtisserie tapissées en les espaçant bien.","Cuire au four environ 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Si vous cuisez sur deux plaques, échangez les plaques à mi-cuisson. Laisser reposer 5 minutes sur les plaques à pâtisserie, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir. Se conserve dans une boîte hermétique pendant trois à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9545,8484,'fr','Pain soda à l''oignon et beurre fouetté à la moutarde anglaise','Rehaussez le pain soda fait maison avec de l''oignon et un beurre de moutarde léger mais percutant. Servir avec vos charcuteries préférées et une salade fraîche','["340 g de farine complète forte","340 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","40 g de flocons d''oignons séchés","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de nigelle","85 g de beurre fondu","625 ml de yaourt nature","un peu de lait","1 cuillère à soupe d''avoine","135 g de beurre doux haché et ramolli","25g de moutarde anglaise"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez les farines dans un bol avec le bicarbonate, les flocons d''oignon, les graines de nigelle et 1½ cuillère à soupe de sel. Mélangez et faites un puits au milieu. Versez le beurre et le yaourt et rassemblez en une pâte molle et collante à l''aide d''une spatule. S''il semble sec, ajoutez un peu de lait.","Versez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée et formez délicatement un rond. Placez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie légèrement farinée, coupez une croix profonde sur le dessus à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé et saupoudrez de flocons d''avoine. Cuire au four pendant 1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et que le pain semble creux lorsqu''on le tape en dessous. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Pendant que le pain refroidit, battez ensemble le beurre, la moutarde et une pincée de sel marin jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et aéré. Verser dans une petite casserole. Trancher le pain et servir avec le beurre de moutarde pour l''étaler."]','2026-01-11 00:01:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9546,8486,'fr','Gâteau aux fraises','Profitez au maximum de la saison des fraises avec notre gâteau aux fraises, accompagné d''un glaçage léger avec une génoise, de la confiture et du fromage à pâte molle. Cela fait un fabuleux dessert central','["400 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","400 g de sucre en poudre","5 gros œufs","400 g de farines autolevantes","100 ml de yaourt nature","300 g de fraises équeutées et coupées en deux","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de beurre ramolli","250 g de fromage à pâte molle","600 g de sucre glace","400 g de confiture de fraises"]','["Beurrer et tapisser le fond de trois moules à cake de 18 cm. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger le beurre et le sucre dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse. Ajoutez les œufs, la farine et le yaourt et mélangez à nouveau. Ajoutez 200 g de fraises (gardez les meilleures pour la décoration) et la vanille. Mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit bien mélangé.","Répartissez uniformément la pâte à gâteau entre les trois moules à gâteau. Étalez et lissez le dessus avec une spatule, puis enfournez pendant 25-30 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les gâteaux soient levés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Remettre au four encore 5 minutes si du mélange humide adhère à la brochette. Laissez reposer 5 minutes dans les moules, puis retournez sur une grille et laissez refroidir complètement. Les gâteaux peuvent être préparés jusqu''à deux jours avant le glaçage, ou congelés pendant deux mois.","Pour le glaçage, mélangez le beurre et la moitié du sucre jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse, ajoutez le fromage à pâte molle et le reste du sucre et mélangez à nouveau. Attention à ne pas trop mélanger car le glaçage deviendra liquide. (Si vous mélangez trop, ne vous inquiétez pas – continuez à mélanger avec un fouet électrique et le mélange épaissira à nouveau).","Superposez les gâteaux avec la confiture et la moitié du glaçage. Inversez le gâteau final sur le dessus, de sorte que la base du gâteau soit maintenant sur le dessus, vous donnant une surface plane. Empilez le reste du glaçage sur le dessus du gâteau, à l''aide d''un couteau à palette, étalez le glaçage sur le dessus et sur les côtés. Conservez un peu de glaçage pour former des rosaces sur le pourtour du gâteau, si vous le souhaitez. Garnir du reste des fraises. Peut être préparé jusqu''à un jour avant de servir, à conserver dans un endroit frais ou au réfrigérateur. Se conservera trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9547,8488,'fr','Tarte banoffee facile','Offrez à vos proches une tarte au banoffee en dessert composée d''une base de biscuit classique, de caramel suintant, de bananes, de crème et de chocolat. Qui pourrait résister ?','["225g de biscuits digestifs","150 g de beurre fondu","Carton de 397 g de bonbon ou 400 g de lait sucré","3 petites bananes, tranchées","300 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","1 carré de chocolat noir (facultatif)"]','["Écrasez les biscuits digestifs, soit à la main à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois, soit au robot culinaire, jusqu''à obtenir une chapelure fine, versez-les dans un bol. Mélangez les biscuits écrasés avec le beurre fondu jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le mélange dans un moule à tarte cannelé à fond lâche de 23 cm et recouvrez le moule, y compris les côtés, avec le biscuit en une couche uniforme. Appuyez avec le dos d''une cuillère pour lisser la surface et réfrigérez pendant 1 heure ou toute la nuit.","Battez le caramel pour le décoller et versez-le sur le fond du biscuit. Étalez-le uniformément à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère ou d''un couteau à palette. Poussez doucement la banane hachée dans le dessus du caramel jusqu''à ce que la base soit recouverte. Mettre au réfrigérateur.","Fouettez la crème avec le sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit mousseuse et épaisse. Sortez la tarte du réfrigérateur et versez la chantilly sur les bananes. Râpez le chocolat noir sur la crème, si vous le souhaitez, et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9548,5185,'fr','Pain aux bananes sans gluten','Utilisez les bananes trop mûres et préparez du pain aux bananes avec de la poudre d''amandes et de la farine sans gluten. Cette recette est idéale pour toute personne suivant un régime sans gluten','["5 petites bananes mûres (4 écrasées, 1 tranchée au milieu pour décorer le dessus)","150 g de farine sans gluten et sans mer","100 g de flocons d''avoine sans gluten","50g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","90 g de cassonade foncée","90 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de beurre fondu","2 gros œufs, battus","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à cake de 900g de papier sulfurisé (notre moule mesurait 19 x 9 x 6 cm). Mettez tous les ingrédients, sauf la banane tranchée, 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre et le sucre glace, dans un grand bol et remuez jusqu''à consistance lisse et homogène.","Versez dans le moule et placez les deux moitiés de banane restantes, côté coupé vers le haut, sur le dessus de la pâte, en appuyant légèrement. Saupoudrer de sucre en poudre. Enfourner 1h-1h15 jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette en ressorte propre, recouvrir de papier d''aluminium vers la fin de la cuisson si elle dore trop.","Saupoudrer de sucre glace et laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9549,8490,'fr','Quatre-quarts facile à la vanille','Faites sourire vos amis et votre famille avec une tranche de notre quatre-quarts à la vanille. C''est le partenaire idéal d''une tasse de thé pour les onze heures ou du thé de l''après-midi.','["200 g de beurre doux, ramolli","200 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs battus","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 cuillères à soupe de lait entier","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de vanille / ½ graines de gousse de vanille","125g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de vanille / ½ graines de gousse de vanille"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g de papier sulfurisé (le mien mesurait 19 cm x 9 cm x 6 cm). Mettez tous les ingrédients sauf ceux du glaçage dans un grand bol et battez ensemble, soit à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, soit d''une cuillère en bois, jusqu''à consistance lisse et homogène. Versez le mélange dans le moule à cake et étalez-le uniformément avec le dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes.","A la sortie du four, laissez refroidir et réalisez le glaçage. Mélangez le sucre glace et la pâte de vanille avec trois cuillères à soupe d''eau – vous en aurez peut-être besoin de plus, mais ajoutez-le progressivement pour obtenir un glaçage épais. Étalez-le sur le dessus du gâteau; ce n''est pas grave si ça coule sur les bords. Laisser prendre puis trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:01:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9550,8492,'fr','Petits pains glacés à la crème et à la confiture','Préparez nos petits pains glacés pour un goûter ou une vente de pâtisseries l''après-midi. Apprenez à préparer de la crème et à façonner la pâte à l''aide de notre guide étape par étape pour les rendre très spéciales.','["350 ml de lait, plus un peu pour le brossage","30 g de beurre coupé en cubes","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte","10 g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","300 g de sucre glace, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire jaune, rose et violet (facultatif)","300 ml de crème fouettée ou double","200 g de crème de citron","200 g de confiture de framboise","200 g de confiture de cassis","cerises glacées, pépites ou pétales de rose et de violette confits, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer le lait jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fumant. Ajouter le beurre et remuer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. Laisser refroidir légèrement. Versez la farine et la levure dans un bol ou un batteur sur socle équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur, puis ajoutez le sucre en poudre et ½ cuillère à café de sel.","Lorsque le mélange de lait a légèrement refroidi (il devrait être juste chaud lorsque vous y mettez un doigt), versez-le dans le mélange de farine. Si vous utilisez un batteur sur socle, mélangez pendant 5 à 8 minutes à vitesse moyenne jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit élastique. Ou pétrissez dans le bol pendant environ 10 minutes – lorsque la pâte est séparée, elle devrait pouvoir s’étirer sans se déchirer.","Mettez la pâte dans un bol propre, couvrez d''un torchon et laissez lever 1h30 ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. Ou transférez-le au réfrigérateur pour qu''il lève lentement jusqu''à 24 heures (cela améliorera la texture et la saveur).","Si la pâte est froide, sortez-la du réfrigérateur 1 h avant de la façonner. Divisez en 10 portions égales (pesez-les si vous voulez être précis). Pour faire des petits pains ronds, roulez et façonnez chaque morceau en une boule lisse, ou pour faire des petits pains, roulez et façonnez chaque morceau en forme de doigt. Disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée en laissant un espace entre chacun. Couvrir légèrement et laisser lever 30 minutes à 1 heure de plus jusqu''à ce qu''il double.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Badigeonner les petits pains de lait et cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Mettez sur une grille et laissez refroidir.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau – il doit être épais. Répartissez dans les bols, en fonction de la quantité de colorants alimentaires que vous utilisez (nous en avons utilisé trois). Teignez chacun avec une coloration différente, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire.","Fouetter la crème et 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''elle conserve sa forme. Ne fouettez pas trop, car il épaissira au fur et à mesure que vous pipez (voir conseil ci-dessous). Monter une poche à douille avec une douille étoile et remplir avec un tiers de la crème.","Divisez les petits pains ronds en deux comme vous le feriez pour un pain à hamburger, ou les petits pains au milieu dans le sens de la longueur. Versez environ 60 g de crème de citron ou de confiture sur la moitié inférieure de chaque petit pain (ou au milieu), en alternant les saveurs, puis nappez d''un tourbillon de crème. Continuez jusqu''à ce que tous les petits pains soient remplis, en remplissant la poche à douille de crème au besoin. Versez un peu de glaçage sur chaque pain en faisant correspondre les couleurs à la confiture (nous avons utilisé du jaune pour le caillé, du rose pour la confiture de framboise et du violet pour le cassis). Décorez si vous le souhaitez avec les cerises glacées, les pépites et les pétales confits, puis laissez reposer environ 20 minutes avant de servir. A consommer de préférence le jour de leur préparation, mais se conserve 24 heures au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:01:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9551,8494,'fr','Biscuits sandwich rhubarbe et crème anglaise','Combinez deux friandises rétro en une seule délicieuse bouchée. Ces biscuits à la rhubarbe et à la crème anglaise ont un cœur confituré, pour apporter une touche de nostalgie à un goûter ou à une vente de pâtisseries.','["175 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes","50 g de sucre en poudre","50g de sucre glace","¼ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de poudre de crème anglaise","2 jaunes d''œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gousse de vanille","200 g de rhubarbe parée et hachée","200 g de sucre en poudre","¼ citron, jus"]','["Pour réaliser la confiture, mettez la rhubarbe, le sucre et le jus de citron dans une casserole sur feu moyen. Porter à ébullition et cuire 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la rhubarbe se soit décomposée et ait libéré son liquide. Mixez à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis laissez mijoter encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et confit. Pour vérifier qu’il est prêt, passez une cuillère en bois sur le fond de la casserole – cela devrait laisser une trace plutôt que de la remplir immédiatement. Laisser refroidir (il durcira davantage au fur et à mesure), puis réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser. Se conserve dans un récipient ou un pot scellé au réfrigérateur jusqu''à une semaine.","Pour faire la pâte à biscuits, mettez le beurre, les sucres et le sel dans un robot culinaire et mélangez plusieurs fois pour obtenir une pâte grossière. Raclez les côtés, puis ajoutez la farine et la poudre de crème anglaise et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir une consistance humide et sableuse. Ajoutez les jaunes d''œufs et la vanille et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que la pâte forme une boule. Ajoutez ½ à 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour le rassembler, si nécessaire. Démoulez la pâte, puis enveloppez-la et mettez-la au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 30 minutes.","Abaisser la pâte sur un plan fariné sur une épaisseur de 5 mm. Découpez un maximum de biscuits à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce rond de 6 mm – vous devriez en obtenir environ 32 au total.","Découpez des cercles ou des cœurs au centre de la moitié des biscuits à l''aide de l''extrémité large d''une douille à douille ordinaire (environ 1,5 cm) ou d''un petit emporte-pièce en forme de cœur. Transférez tous les biscuits sur des plaques à pâtisserie tapissées, puis transférez au réfrigérateur et réfrigérez pendant 15 minutes. Vous pouvez également cuisiner les formes découpées pour réaliser des mini biscuits – si vous le faites, disposez-les sur leur propre plaque à pâtisserie.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6, puis enfourner les biscuits pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés (5 à 6 minutes pour les mini biscuits). Mettez sur une grille et laissez refroidir complètement.","Transférez la confiture dans une poche à douille, coupez l''extrémité et déposez une petite couche de confiture sur les biscuits nature (ceux dont le centre n''est pas découpé). Ou utilisez une cuillère à café. Étalez la confiture – elle peut déborder des côtés lorsque vous prenez les biscuits en sandwich, alors n''allez pas trop loin jusqu''au bord.","Sandwichez le reste des biscuits sur la confiture (n''appuyez pas trop fort), puis transférez dans un récipient hermétique en une seule couche et laissez reposer toute la nuit. Cela garantit que la confiture ne coulera pas lorsque vous mordez dedans, mais elle peut être mangée immédiatement si vous ne pouvez pas résister. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours, mais les biscuits commenceront à ramollir avec le temps."]','2026-01-11 00:01:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9552,8496,'fr','Gâteau aux abricots, amandes et polenta','Associez les amandes et les abricots dans ce gâteau gourmand. Fabriqué avec de la polenta, le gâteau a une belle texture moelleuse et une saveur fruitée. A déguster avec de la crème fraîche','["50 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour le moule","125g de sucre semoule","8 abricots frais, coupés en deux et dénoyautés (vous en aurez peut-être besoin de plus si les abricots sont petits)","150 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante, coupé en cubes","150 g de sucre en poudre","2 gros œufs, légèrement battus","1 citron, zesté","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","50g de farine nature","50 g de polenta finement moulue","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g d''amandes moulues","125 ml de lait","3 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots, pour glacer","crème fraîche ou crème, pour servir"]','["Beurrer un moule à cake rond de 20 à 23 cm. S''il a un fond lâche, vous devrez envelopper l''extérieur avec du papier d''aluminium pour éviter que le caramel ne coule. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Pour les abricots, mettre le sucre semoule et 75 ml d''eau dans une casserole. Chauffer lentement jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Lorsque le sucre est fondu, portez à ébullition et surveillez le sirop jusqu''à ce qu''il prenne une couleur ambrée foncée. Retirer du feu et ajouter le beurre. Remuer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. Versez dans le moule, puis déposez-y les abricots, côté coupé vers le bas.","Pour le gâteau, battre ensemble le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à consistance légère avec un fouet électrique. Ajoutez l''œuf petit à petit, puis le zeste et l''extrait d''amande. Mélangez tous les ingrédients secs ensemble, puis incorporez-les progressivement au mélange d''œufs en alternant avec le lait. Versez-le sur les abricots et enfournez pendant 50 minutes. Pour tester la cuisson, enfoncez une brochette au centre. Il devrait ressortir propre.","Laissez le gâteau refroidir pendant 15 minutes, puis passez un couteau entre le gâteau et l''intérieur du moule et retournez-le sur une assiette. Si des moitiés d''abricot restent dans le moule, ramassez-les soigneusement – ​​en essayant de garder leur forme intacte et de ne pas trop les écraser – et remettez-les, côté coupé vers le haut, sur le gâteau. Laissez le gâteau refroidir ou servez-le chaud si vous le souhaitez.","Faites chauffer la confiture d''abricots avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Une fois la confiture dissoute, passez-la au tamis pour retirer les morceaux d''abricot. Laissez refroidir un peu – sinon cela va trop cuire les abricots qui doivent être parfaitement cuits et ne pas s''effondrer – puis badigeonnez le dessus du gâteau d''une couche épaisse de confiture. Laissez reposer un peu, puis servez avec de la crème fraîche ou de la crème, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9553,8498,'fr','Gâteau au gingembre et au chocolat blanc','Faites cuire notre gâteau au gingembre gluant dans un moule à gâteau pour un effet époustouflant. Épicé avec des tiges de gingembre et décoré d''un glaçage au chocolat blanc, il plaira vraiment à tout le monde.','["220 g de beurre doux, ramolli","365 g de farines autolevantes","200 g de sucre muscovado","50 g de mélasse noire","150g de sirop doré","2 gros œufs, légèrement battus","300 ml de lait","2 boules de gingembre tige au sirop, hachées finement, plus 50 ml de sirop","1 cuillère à café de sel marin fin","3 cuillères à café de gingembre moulu","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","une petite poignée de morceaux de gingembre confits, hachés, pour décorer","30 ml de lait","160 g de sucre glace tamisé","150 g de chocolat blanc haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Faire fondre 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre dans une petite casserole, puis incorporer ½ cuillère à soupe de farine pour créer une pâte humide. Badigeonnez-en l''intérieur d''un moule à gâteau de 9 pouces. Mettez le reste du beurre, du sucre, de la mélasse et du sirop doré dans une casserole sur feu moyen et remuez jusqu''à ce que tout soit fondu. Laissez refroidir un peu.","Versez le mélange dans un grand bol et incorporez les œufs et le lait. Incorporer la tige de gingembre, le reste de la farine, le sel, le gingembre moulu, la cannelle et le bicarbe. Versez dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme au toucher. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes dans le moule, puis démouler sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pour faire le glaçage, fouettez ensemble le lait, le sirop de gingembre et le sucre glace. Faites fondre le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au micro-ondes par rafales d''une minute. Laisser refroidir un peu, puis incorporer au mélange de lait. Versez le glaçage sur le gâteau, puis décorez avec les morceaux de gingembre confits."]','2026-01-11 00:01:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9554,8500,'fr','Éclairs au chocolat','Ces éclairs au chocolat délicieusement décadents fourrés à la crème anglaise à la vanille en valent la peine. Préparez un lot de ces pâtisseries françaises classiques','["140 g de farine nature","pincée de sucre","125 ml de lait","100g de beurre","4 œufs","300 ml de lait","50 g de sucre en poudre","2 jaunes d''œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 cuillères à café de farine nature","4 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","375 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de chocolat nature","25g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Commencez par préparer la garniture à la crème anglaise. Faites chauffer le lait jusqu''à ébullition dans une casserole. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sucre, les jaunes d''œufs et la vanille dans un bol, puis incorporez les farines, quelques cuillères à café à la fois, pour obtenir une pâte lisse.","Incorporez progressivement le lait chaud, versez le tout dans la casserole et faites cuire à feu vif, en remuant constamment, pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à épaississement – ​​il deviendra grumeleux de manière alarmante, mais ne vous inquiétez pas, continuez simplement à le remuer vigoureusement avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Posez une feuille de film alimentaire directement sur la surface de la crème anglaise, puis laissez refroidir et réfrigérez jusqu''à ce que vous soyez prêt à remplir les petits pains.","Pour réaliser les choux, chauffez le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tamisez la farine avec le sucre et une pincée de sel dans un petit bol. Mettez le lait et le beurre dans une casserole moyenne avec 125 ml d''eau et faites chauffer doucement pour que le beurre fonde mais que le liquide ne bouillonne pas.","Une fois le beurre complètement fondu, augmentez le feu jusqu’à ce que le liquide atteigne une ébullition rapide. Éteignez immédiatement le feu, versez la farine tamisée et battez vigoureusement avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse qui se détache des parois de la casserole. Étaler sur une grande assiette pour laisser refroidir à température des mains.","Laisser refroidir quelques minutes, puis ajouter progressivement les œufs en mélangeant bien entre chaque ajout jusqu''à ce que le mélange coule de la cuillère à contrecœur. N’ajoutez pas tout l’œuf sauf si vous en avez besoin.","Coupez deux grandes feuilles de papier sulfurisé. Sur chacun d''entre eux, tracez deux séries de lignes « piste » avec un espace de 10 cm : ce seront vos lignes directrices afin que vos éclairs soient tous à peu près de la même taille. Utilisez le papier pour tapisser deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie – tête vers le bas.","Versez votre préparation à choux dans une poche à douille avec une douille en étoile ou ronde large de 1 cm, ou dans une poche à douille jetable avec un trou de taille similaire coupé pour la douille. Disposez deux rangées de formes en « S » bien espacées et écrasées sur chaque feuille entre les lignes directrices. Cuire au four, une plaque à la fois, sur une grille haute pendant 25 minutes, en réduisant la température à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 dès la mise au four.","Après 25 minutes, percez un trou au bout de chaque petit pain ou, à l''aide d''un petit couteau dentelé, divisez-le au milieu et remettez au four, à l''envers, pour sécher pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant et doré. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant que les petits pains refroidissent, terminez votre garniture. Fouettez la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit épaisse, puis utilisez votre fouet électrique pour battre la crème anglaise refroidie et prise jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit à nouveau lisse. Incorporer la crème. Versez votre garniture dans une poche à douille – utilisez une petite douille si vous remplissez les petits pains à travers les trous que vous avez percés, ou une grande douille si vous avez divisé les petits pains en deux. Versez délicatement la crème anglaise dans chaque petit pain refroidi – ils devraient être lourds une fois pleins.","Pour faire le glaçage, faites fondre ensemble 100 g de chocolat noir et 25 g de beurre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante. Une fois fondu, retirez du feu et incorporez 75 ml de crème fraîche et 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace tamisé. Une fois un peu refroidi, étalez-le sur le dessus des petits pains et laissez refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9555,8502,'fr','Gâteau Simnel','Célébrez Pâques avec une pâtisserie de saison printanière. Ce gâteau simnel classique est rempli de fruits secs et d''épices et garni de pâte d''amande.','["225 g de raisins secs","100g de groseilles","50 g de zestes mélangés","2 citrons, 1 pressé et 2 zestés","50 ml de jus d''orange","50 ml de cognac (facultatif)","225 g de beurre ramolli","225 g de sucre muscovado léger","4 œufs moyens","225 g de farines autolevantes","100 g de cerises glacées, coupées en quartiers","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","500 g de pâte d''amande jaune","1 cuillère à soupe de confiture d''abricots"]','["Mettez les raisins secs, les groseilles et le mélange de zestes dans un bol avec le jus de citron, le jus d''orange et le cognac, le cas échéant. Bien mélanger, couvrir et laisser tremper toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2. Tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à gâteau rond de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé.","Ajoutez le reste des ingrédients du gâteau aux fruits trempés et remuez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez la moitié de ce mélange au fond du moule à gâteau et nivelez-le pour qu''il soit le plus plat possible. Roulez un tiers de la pâte d''amande en un cercle de 20 cm de diamètre et posez-le dessus. Ajoutez délicatement le reste du mélange en nivelant à nouveau la surface.","Cuire au four environ 2h30 jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, bien levés et fermes au toucher. Une brochette en métal doit ressortir propre une fois insérée. Laisser refroidir 20 minutes dans le moule puis démouler sur une grille.","Faites chauffer la confiture d''abricots dans une petite casserole et badigeonnez le dessus du gâteau. Étalez la moitié de la pâte d''amande restante à la taille du dessus du gâteau. Appuyez fermement dessus et poussez les bords vers le bas avec votre pouce pour le sertir sur les côtés.","Roulez le reste de la pâte d''amande en 11 boules (celles-ci représentent les Apôtres). Disposez les boules uniformément sur le gâteau en formant un cercle, en les collant avec un peu de confiture. Soufflez doucement le dessus du gâteau jusqu''à ce que les boules soient légèrement dorées, ou placez le gâteau entier sous un gril chaud jusqu''à ce que la pâte d''amande prenne une couleur légèrement dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:01:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9556,8504,'fr','Pudding de beignets au citron et aux framboises','Attendez-vous à des demandes pour une deuxième portion de ce dessert décadent ! Cuire des beignets aux framboises avec de la crème anglaise fraîche, de la crème de citron et des framboises','["beurre, pour le plat allant au four","8 beignets à la confiture de framboises","150g de framboises","500 ml de crème anglaise fraîche du commerce","250 ml de lait entier","150 g de crème de citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et beurrer un plat allant au four de 20 x 20 cm. Coupez les beignets à la confiture de framboises en quatre et disposez-les en couches superposées dans le plat préparé. Répartissez sur 100 g de framboises.","Faites chauffer la crème anglaise avec le lait jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fumante, puis incorporez la crème au citron. Versez la crème au citron sur les beignets, puis laissez tremper 30 minutes en veillant à ce que certains beignets dépassent pour qu''ils soient croustillants à la cuisson.","Répartir sur 50 g supplémentaires de framboises et cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et juste prises."]','2026-01-11 00:01:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9557,8506,'fr','Tarte au citron, mascarpone et fruit de la passion','Servez cette vibrante tarte au citron et aux fruits de la passion comme dessert facile ou comme gourmandise sucrée. Ses saveurs tropicales le rendent parfait pour l''été','["320 g de pâte feuilletée","1 œuf battu","250 g de mascarpone","150 ml de crème fraîche","6 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","3 fruits de la passion épépinés","30 g de pistaches concassées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Dérouler la pâte feuilletée sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée. Tracez une bordure de 2 cm sur le pourtour de la pâte à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, puis badigeonnez la bordure avec l''œuf.","Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Appuyez doucement au milieu avec le dos d''une cuillère, puis laissez refroidir complètement.","Fouettez le mascarpone avec la crème double et 3 cuillères à soupe de crème au citron jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et faciles à utiliser. Incorporez encore 3 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron et les graines d''un fruit de la passion.","Versez le mélange de crème au centre de la pâte et parsemez-le de graines de 2 fruits de la passion et de pistaches hachées."]','2026-01-11 00:01:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9558,8508,'fr','Gâteau au citron et à l''orange','Dégustez une tranche de crème au citron et un gâteau à l''orange pour le dîner ou le thé de l''après-midi. Garnir d''amandes effilées et de zeste de citron et servir avec une tasse de thé.','["170 g de beurre mou salé","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 œufs","70g de yaourt nature","150 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues","1 grosse orange, zestée","2-3 cuillères à soupe de lait","10 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","20 g d''amandes effilées","zeste de citron, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake d''1 litre et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé.","Mettez le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, le yaourt, la farine auto-levante, les amandes moulues, le zeste d''orange, le lait et 5 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron dans un grand bol et fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Mettez encore 5 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron dans un deuxième bol et fouettez pour desserrer.","Verser la moitié de la pâte dans le moule préparé, verser sur la crème au citron et garnir avec le reste de la pâte. Répartir sur les amandes effilées et cuire au four pendant 50 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient levées et dorées. Laisser refroidir sur une grille, parsemer d''un peu de zeste de citron et trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:01:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9559,8510,'fr','Plateau de pépites de chocolat','Préparez ces carrés aux pépites de chocolat pour la famille. Facile à réaliser, ce plateau de cuisson est idéal pour cuisiner (et manger !) avec les enfants','["190 ml d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour la boîte","250 g de farine nature","80g de cacao en poudre","3 cuillères à café de levure chimique","300 g de sucre mou roux clair","350 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","2 gros œufs","100 g de pépites de chocolat blanc","150 g de beurre coupé en cubes","200 g de sucre glace tamisé","4 cuillères à café de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler le fond et les côtés d''un plat à rôtir de 33 x 23 cm et d''au moins 2,5 cm de profondeur. Tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la farine, le cacao en poudre, la levure chimique, le sucre et une bonne pincée de sel dans un grand bol. Cassez les morceaux de sucre avec un fouet.","Fouettez l''huile avec le lait, la vanille et les œufs dans un pichet, versez-les dans les ingrédients secs, puis incorporez les pépites de chocolat. Bien mélanger à l''aide d''une spatule jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de poches de farine. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et enfournez pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Si du mélange humide adhère à la brochette, remettez au four pendant 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir dans le moule au moins 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. Faire fondre le beurre, puis retirer du feu et incorporer le sucre glace, le cacao en poudre et le lait. Le glaçage sera très liquide, mais épaissira un peu en refroidissant. (Si le glaçage a trop épaissi avant que le gâteau ait refroidi, réchauffez-le légèrement pour qu''il soit plus facile à verser.)","Versez le glaçage au chocolat sur le gâteau et laissez-le prendre avant de le couper en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9560,8512,'fr','Gâteau crumble aux cerises','Profitez au maximum des cerises juteuses dans ce gâteau, enrichi d''amandes et de crème sure, et terminé par une garniture crumble. c''est délicieux avec de la crème anglaise','["180 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","220 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 gros œufs légèrement battus","250 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","50g d''amandes moulues","80 g de crème sure","300 g de cerises fraîches dénoyautées et coupées en deux","45g de farine nature","35 g de beurre salé froid en cubes","20 g de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Chauffer le four à 180 C/160 C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Beurrer le fond d''un moule à gâteau profond de 20 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé.","Pour réaliser le crumble, mettez la farine et le beurre dans un bol et frottez du bout des doigts jusqu''à obtenir une texture grossière et friable. Incorporer le sucre, puis transférer au réfrigérateur.","Battre le beurre et le sucre au fouet électrique pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Incorporez progressivement les œufs en fouettant bien après chaque ajout. Incorporez la farine, la levure chimique, la poudre d''amandes et la crème sure, puis la majeure partie des cerises en en réservant une poignée pour la garniture. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et lissez le dessus avec une spatule. Parsemer des cerises réservées, puis enfourner au centre du four pendant 30 min.","Répartir sur la garniture crumble, puis remettre le gâteau au four et cuire encore 30 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir dans le moule.","Coupez le gâteau en quartiers épais et servez-le avec de la crème anglaise ou de la glace, si vous le souhaitez. Conserver dans une boîte de conserve ou un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9561,8514,'fr','Sablés aux pépites de chocolat','Préparez un lot de ces sablés aux pépites de chocolat faciles à accompagner avec votre tasse de thé de l''après-midi. Ces friandises simples sont parfaites à partager','["300 g de farine nature","200 g de beurre salé froid en cubes","1 gros jaune d''oeuf","100 g de sucre en poudre et un peu pour saupoudrer","80 g de pépites de chocolat au lait ou noir"]','["Tamisez la farine dans un grand bol et ajoutez le beurre. Frottez le beurre et la farine entre vos doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à des miettes. Incorporez le jaune d''œuf, le sucre et les pépites de chocolat et écrasez le tout dans le bol pour créer une pâte. Une fois qu''il a commencé à se rassembler dans le bol, versez-le sur votre plan de travail et formez-le en forme de rondelle ronde aplatie, enveloppez-le et réfrigérez-le pendant 30 minutes.","Préchauffer le four à 170C/150C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé.","Étalez la pâte entre deux feuilles de papier sulfurisé jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne 1 cm d''épaisseur. Retirez la feuille supérieure de papier sulfurisé et coupez-la en 14 ronds avec un emporte-pièce rond de 7 cm. Reroulez les chutes pour tirer le meilleur parti de votre pâte. Transférez délicatement les ronds sur vos plaques à pâtisserie à l''aide d''un couteau à palette ou d''une spatule, en laissant un peu d''espace entre eux. Saupoudrez chacun d''un peu de sucre. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir 10 minutes avant de transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9562,6927,'fr','Lamington','Dégustez un lamington avec une tasse de thé chaud. Cette pâtisserie australienne traditionnelle est remplie de crème et de confiture, enrobée d''un glaçage au chocolat et roulée dans de la noix de coco.','["125 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 gros œufs","250 g de farines autolevantes","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","½ cuillère à café de sel","250 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","200 g de confiture de framboise","350 g de noix de coco desséchée","80 g de beurre doux, fondu","250 ml de lait","50g de cacao en poudre","400 g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 200 C/180 C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Beurrer et tapisser un moule rectangulaire de 20 x 30 cm.","Battre le beurre et le sucre dans un batteur sur pied jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs un à un et battez bien. Battre la farine, le lait et le sel jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis verser dans le moule. Cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et fermes au toucher. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Coupez la génoise horizontalement pour créer deux moitiés. Coupez les bords pour créer des coins parfaits. Coupez le biscuit en 18 carrés. Fouettez légèrement la crème avec le sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne des pics mous. Étalez un peu de confiture sur la moitié des carrés de génoise puis pochez ou étalez dessus un peu de crème. Sandwich chacun avec un deuxième carré de biscuit puis réservez au réfrigérateur pour refroidir.","Pour faire le glaçage, fouettez ensemble le beurre fondu et le lait dans un bol. Tamisez ensemble la poudre de cacao et le sucre glace dans un bol séparé. Ajoutez progressivement le cacao et le sucre au mélange de beurre et de lait, en fouettant continuellement pour vous assurer qu''il n''y a pas de grumeaux. S''il devient grumeleux, mixez-le avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse.","Répartissez la noix de coco dans trois bols peu profonds (cela l''empêche d''être enrobée de trop de chocolat pendant que vous la trempez).","Trempez chaque lamington dans le glaçage jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement recouvert. Rouler dans la noix de coco et déposer sur une grille. Répétez avec les éponges restantes. Mettre au frais minimum 1h."]','2026-01-11 00:01:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9563,8516,'fr','Galette banane caramélisée & chocolat','Impressionnez vos amis et votre famille avec cette galette simple à 5 ingrédients avec banane caramélisée et chocolat. Ce dessert facile se marie à merveille avec la glace','["70 g de noisettes grossièrement hachées","150 g de chocolat noir finement haché","Bloc de 500 g de pâte feuilletée du commerce","3 bananes, tranchées","3 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","glace à la vanille, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mixez 50g de noisettes dans un petit robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''elles ressemblent à de la chapelure fine, puis versez-les dans un bol avec le chocolat.","Etalez la pâte en un rond d''environ 30 cm de diamètre sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé. Répartir le mélange chocolat et noisettes sur le cercle pâtissier en laissant un bord de 5 cm. Garnir avec les bananes et la plupart des noisettes restantes, puis replier les bords de la pâte. Transférer la galette sur une plaque à pâtisserie avec le papier sulfurisé, puis réfrigérer au moins 10 minutes.","Sortez du réfrigérateur et saupoudrez de sucre sur la galette, puis faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et gonflée. Répartissez sur le reste des noisettes et servez avec une boule de glace vanille, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9564,8518,'fr','Pain aux bananes et au caramel collant','Utilisez des bananes trop mûres pour préparer ce pain aux bananes et au caramel collant. C''est encore plus indulgent avec la sauce au caramel et le cassant aux noix','["125 g de beurre mou, plus un peu pour le moule","75 g de sucre en poudre","50 g de cassonade foncée","3 œufs moyens","2 grosses bananes mûres, écrasées","50g de yaourt nature","200 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","50 g de dattes dénoyautées et hachées (environ 10)","50 g de noix de pécan ou de noix hachées (ou un mélange de noix hachées)","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","25 g de beurre coupé en cubes","100 ml de crème double","150 g de sucre en poudre","50 g de noix de pécan ou de noix (ou de noix mélangées)","50 g de chips de banane","½ cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g d''une bande de papier sulfurisé.","Battez le beurre et les deux sucres dans un bol pendant 5 minutes avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit bien mousseux. Fouettez les œufs, la banane et le yaourt dans un bol séparé jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient presque lisses, puis incorporez-les au mélange de beurre et de sucre. Incorporez la farine et la levure chimique jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien combinées, puis incorporez les dattes et les noix. Verser dans le moule, lisser le dessus et cuire au four pendant 1h-1h15 jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir 10 min dans le moule, puis démouler à l''aide de la bande de papier sulfurisé. Vous pouvez le servir chaud maintenant ou le laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille. Se conserve quatre jours dans un contenant hermétique.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce au caramel. Mettez le sucre dans une poêle à fond épais et faites-le fondre à feu moyen-doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré et liquide – ne remuez pas, inclinez simplement la poêle pour faire fondre le sucre. Incorporer délicatement le beurre jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis verser lentement la crème et porter à bulle. Mélangez jusqu''à ce que la sauce soit lisse et brillante. Verser dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, couvrir et laisser refroidir à température ambiante.","Pour le cassant, mettez le sucre dans une poêle avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau sur feu moyen, remuez brièvement, puis laissez mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le caramel devienne ambré. Ne remuez pas après le mélange initial, inclinez simplement la poêle pour obtenir une couleur dorée encore plus profonde.","Pendant ce temps, tapissez une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Incorporez délicatement les noix, les chips de banane et le sel au caramel jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien enrobés, puis versez sur le plateau. Inclinez le plateau (ou utilisez une cuillère) pour vous assurer que les noix sont en une seule couche – sinon elles seront plus difficiles à séparer plus tard. Laisser refroidir complètement avant de briser le fragile en éclats.","Remuez la sauce au caramel pour la détendre si elle devient ferme, ou réchauffez-la quelques secondes au micro-ondes (ajoutez un peu de crème si nécessaire), puis versez-en un filet sur le gâteau pour qu''il coule sur les côtés. Garnir avec les éclats de cassants. Se conserve deux jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9565,8520,'fr','Pouding éponge au citron','Transformez un gâteau au citron classique en un pud auto-sauce pour un dessert réconfortant et bon marché. Servir avec de la crème ou de la crème anglaise','["250 g de beurre mou, plus un peu pour le plat","380 g de sucre en poudre","4 œufs","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 citrons, zestés et pressés","2½ cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","crème anglaise ou crème, pour servir","50g de sucre glace","1 citron, jus et zesté"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un plat allant au four de 30 x 20 cm de profondeur.","Mettez le beurre et 250 g de sucre en poudre dans un bol et battez pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Incorporer les œufs, puis tamiser la farine et la levure chimique et incorporer jusqu''à obtenir une pâte. Incorporer le zeste de citron en réservant un peu pour la décoration.","Versez la pâte à biscuit dans le plat et lissez le dessus.","Mélangez le jus de citron avec la maïzena dans un bol résistant à la chaleur pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Mélangez les 130 g de sucre en poudre restant avec 300 ml d''eau bouillante dans un pichet, versez sur le mélange de maïzena et fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez-le sur l''éponge. Cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et pris, et que la génoise reprenne sa forme au toucher.","Pendant que le pudding cuit, préparez le filet de citron. Mélangez le sucre glace avec suffisamment de jus de citron (environ la moitié) pour obtenir une consistance souple. Arroser le biscuit encore tiède et décorer avec le zeste de citron réservé. Servir aussitôt avec de la crème ou de la crème anglaise."]','2026-01-11 00:01:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9566,8522,'fr','Biscuits de velours rouge','Transformez le gâteau populaire en biscuits moelleux, complétés par un glaçage au fromage à la crème. Emballez-les pour les offrir ou préparez un lot de pâte à conserver au congélateur.','["175g de beurre mou salé","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de sucre en poudre","1 gros œuf","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","½ à 1 cuillère à soupe de gel colorant alimentaire rouge, selon la force","225 g de farine nature","25g de cacao en poudre","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","150 g de pépites ou de morceaux de chocolat blanc","2 cuillères à soupe de fromage à pâte molle","6 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Battre le beurre et les sucres avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Incorporer l''œuf, la vanille et le colorant alimentaire jusqu''à obtenir une pâte rouge vif. Tamisez la farine, le cacao et le bicarbe. Pliez le tout pour obtenir une pâte ferme et de couleur uniforme, puis incorporez les pépites de chocolat.","Déposez la pâte sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé, repliez le papier sulfurisé sur la pâte et façonnez un boudin d''environ 6 cm de large. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de cuire. Se conserve une semaine au réfrigérateur ou un mois au congélateur.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Couper la pâte à biscuits en tranches de 1 cm d''épaisseur à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé et disposer sur deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé bien espacées pour qu''elles aient de la place pour s''étaler dans le four. Cuire au four par lots, en conservant les biscuits non cuits sur la plaque au réfrigérateur pendant que le reste cuit.","Cuire au milieu du four pendant 13 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les biscuits soient croustillants sur les bords, mais encore moelleux au centre. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque à pâtisserie pendant quelques minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Battez le fromage à pâte molle dans un petit bol jusqu''à obtenir une consistance souple, puis incorporez le sucre glace. Utilisez une poche à douille ou une cuillère pour verser le glaçage sur les biscuits. Les biscuits non glacés se conservent cinq jours dans un contenant hermétique ou deux jours glacés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9567,8524,'fr','Tarte au riz au lait citron & myrtilles','Transformez un riz au lait classique en une tarte moderne avec une pâte croustillante et du citron piquant. C''est un délicieux dessert pour terminer n''importe quel menu de dîner','["500 g de pâte brisée toute prête","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","500 ml de lait entier","125 ml de crème fraîche","3 citrons, zestés","100 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de riz au lait, rincé","4 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","100 g de mascarpone","75 g de confiture de myrtilles","2 oeufs, battus","100 g de myrtilles surgelées","1 cuillère à soupe de confiture de myrtilles"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Abaisser la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné en un cercle de l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Tapisser un moule à tarte profond de 20 cm de diamètre avec la pâte en laissant dépasser environ 2 cm sur le bord. Piquez le fond avec une fourchette, puis mettez au frais 30 min.","Pour réaliser le riz au lait, mettez le lait, la crème, le zeste de citron et le sucre dans une casserole. Portez à ébullition, puis versez le riz et remuez. Laisser mijoter à couvert à feu doux pendant 15 minutes, puis découvrir et cuire en remuant pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit cuit mais conserve un peu de mordant. Retirer du feu et incorporer la moitié de la crème de citron et du mascarpone, puis laisser refroidir légèrement.","Pendant ce temps, recouvrez la pâte d''une feuille de papier sulfurisé légèrement froissée et remplissez-la de fèves au four. Disposez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et enfournez 15 min. Retirez le papier sulfurisé et les haricots et faites cuire encore 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir, puis couper les bords avec un couteau dentelé et réserver.","Fouetter la confiture jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et verser dans le fond du fond de tarte en l''étalant. Incorporer les œufs au riz au lait et verser dans le moule. Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste dorés et pris avec une légère oscillation. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la compote. Mélangez les myrtilles, 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et la confiture et passez au micro-ondes pendant 1 à 2 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit sirupeux. Les myrtilles doivent être tendres mais conserver leur forme.","Sortez la tarte du moule, mettez le reste du caillé dans une poche à douille et pochez dessus, puis arrosez sur la majeure partie de la compote. Servir avec une compote supplémentaire en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9568,8526,'fr','Beignet à la confiture','Préparez un lot de nos beignets sucrés à la confiture pour une gâterie gourmande ultime. Ces beignets moelleux et moelleux valent bien l''effort et sont parfaits pour le partage','["500 g de farine à pain blanche forte","60 g de sucre en poudre doré","15 g de levure fraîche émiettée","4 œufs","½ citron, zesté","2 cuillères à café de sel marin fin","125 g de beurre doux ramolli","environ 2 litres d''huile de tournesol, pour la friture","sucre en poudre, pour mélanger","300g de confiture pour la garniture"]','["Mettez 150 g d''eau et tous les ingrédients de la pâte, sauf le beurre, dans le bol d''un mixeur muni d''un batteur. Mélangez à vitesse moyenne pendant 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte commence à se détacher des côtés et forme une boule. Éteignez le batteur et laissez reposer la pâte 1 min.","Remettez le batteur à vitesse moyenne et ajoutez lentement le beurre à la pâte – environ 25 g à la fois. Une fois le tout incorporé, mélangez à grande vitesse pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit brillante, lisse et très élastique une fois tirée.","Couvrir le bol d''un film alimentaire ou d''un torchon propre et laisser lever jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. Remuez brièvement la pâte dans le bol, puis recouvrez et mettez au réfrigérateur pour qu''elle refroidisse toute la nuit.","Le lendemain, sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et coupez-la en morceaux de 50 g (vous devriez en obtenir environ 20).","Roulez les pâtons en petits pains lisses et serrés et placez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie farinée, en laissant suffisamment d''espace entre eux, car vous ne voulez pas qu''ils collent ensemble pendant la levée.","Couvrir légèrement d''un film alimentaire et laisser reposer 4 heures ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. Remplissez votre friteuse ou votre casserole à fond épais à moitié avec de l''huile. Faites chauffer l''huile à 180°C. Lisez notre guide sur la façon de faire frire en toute sécurité pour plus d’informations essentielles.","Lorsque l''huile est chauffée, faites glisser délicatement les beignets de la plaque à l''aide d''un grattoir à pâtisserie fariné. En prenant soin de ne pas les dégonfler, mettez-les dans l''huile. Faites-en 2 à 3 par lot, selon la taille de votre friteuse ou poêle.","Faites frire pendant 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés – ils gonflent et flottent, vous devrez donc peut-être les pousser doucement après environ 1 minute pour les aider à se colorer uniformément.","Retirez les beignets de la friteuse et placez-les sur du papier absorbant.","Mélangez les beignets dans un bol de sucre en poudre encore chauds. Répétez les étapes jusqu''à ce que tous les beignets soient frits, mais continuez à vérifier que la température de l''huile est correcte : si elle est trop élevée, ils brûleront et seront crus au milieu ; s''il est trop bas, l''huile sera absorbée par les beignets et ils deviendront gras. Laisser refroidir avant de garnir.","Pour remplir les beignets, faites un trou avec un petit couteau dans le pli de chacun, n''importe où autour de la ligne blanche entre le haut et le bas frits.","Remplissez une poche à douille de confiture et versez-y le beignet jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien gonflé – environ 1 cuillère à soupe par beignet. Une fois remplis, il est préférable de manger les beignets immédiatement, mais ils se conservent dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9569,8528,'fr','Quartiers d''orange sanguine','Essayez cette version moderne d''un quatre-quarts américain, avec de la crème sure et un glaçage à l''orange sanguine piquant pour équilibrer la douceur. Décorer avec des pistaches','["150 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","250 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs moyens, à température ambiante","250 g de farine nature","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","100 g de crème sure entière","3 oranges sanguines finement zestées","3 cuillères à soupe de pistaches hachées, pour décorer (facultatif)","écorces confites, pour décorer (facultatif, voir astuce ci-dessous)","170 g de sucre glace tamisé","2-3 cuillères à soupe de jus d''orange sanguine"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake d''1 litre.","Battre le beurre et le sucre dans un bol pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à consistance mousseuse et très pâle. Incorporez les œufs un à un. Incorporez la farine, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude et le sel, puis la crème sure et le zeste. Verser dans le moule et cuire au centre du four pendant 45 à 50 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser légèrement refroidir dans le moule, puis démouler sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pour faire le glaçage, mélangez le sucre et le jus et versez-le sur le gâteau. Saupoudrer de pistaches et d''écorces confites, le cas échéant (voir astuce ci-dessous). Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9570,8530,'fr','Gâteaux papillons','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis de jolis cupcakes papillon. Les nôtres sont garnis d''une crème au beurre légère à la vanille, de confiture et de pépites, mais vous pouvez les décorer comme vous le souhaitez.','["110 g de beurre ramolli","110 g de sucre en poudre","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","110 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à soupe de lait, plus 2 cuillères à soupe si besoin, pour assouplir la crème au beurre","confiture de fraises (facultatif)","des pépites (facultatif)","300g de sucre glace","150 g de beurre ramolli","2 cuillères à café de pâte de vanille"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à cupcakes de 10 caissettes. Pour faire la génoise, versez le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, la vanille, la farine, la levure chimique et le lait dans un grand bol à mélanger et battez avec un fouet à main ou un batteur électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse, pâle et homogène. Répartissez la pâte entre les moules et enfournez 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu d''un gâteau en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Pendant que les gâteaux refroidissent, préparez la crème au beurre en battant ensemble le sucre glace, le beurre et la vanille jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit pâle et mousseuse. Incorporez le lait supplémentaire si le glaçage est trop ferme.","Une fois les gâteaux refroidis, utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour trancher le dessus, puis coupez le dessus en deux. Pochez ou étalez la crème au beurre sur les gâteaux, puis enfoncez doucement deux moitiés semi-circulaires dans la crème au beurre sur chaque gâteau, en le faisant en biais pour ressembler à des ailes de papillon. Vous pouvez servir les cupcakes à ce stade, ou les décorer avec une petite goutte de confiture au centre et un peu de pépites, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9571,8532,'fr','Cupcakes de velours rouge','Préparez un lot de cupcakes de velours rouge comme gâterie. Avec une génoise au chocolat et une garniture au fromage à la crème, ils sont parfaits pour les onze servis avec une tasse de thé','["150 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","50 g de beurre ramolli","150 g de sucre en poudre","1 gros oeuf, battu","1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","100 ml de babeurre ou de kéfir","50 ml d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de colorant alimentaire en gel rouge","100 g de beurre légèrement salé ramolli","225 g de sucre glace","100 g de fromage à la crème entier, mélangé pour le détendre"]','["Tapisser un moule à cupcakes de 12 caissettes à cupcakes et réserver. Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tamiser la farine, le cacao, le bicarbe et une pincée de sel fin dans un bol moyen et mélanger pour combiner.","À l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou d''un fouet électrique à main, battez ensemble le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux, puis incorporez l''œuf, la vanille, le babeurre, l''huile et le vinaigre jusqu''à homogénéité. Mélangez progressivement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients séchés. Une fois combiné, mélangez le colorant alimentaire rouge jusqu''à obtenir un mélange rouge foncé ; la couleur peut varier en fonction de la marque que vous utilisez.","Répartissez la pâte entre les moules à cupcakes et faites cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre d''un gâteau en ressorte propre.","Pendant que les gâteaux refroidissent, préparez le glaçage. Battre ensemble le beurre et le sucre glace à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou à la main jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux, environ 3 minutes, puis incorporer le fromage à la crème pendant encore 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Une fois les gâteaux refroidis, utilisez une poche à douille équipée d''une douille étoile pour recouvrir les gâteaux avec le glaçage au fromage à la crème, ou déposez le glaçage dessus à l''aide d''une cuillère."]','2026-01-11 00:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9572,8534,'fr','Muffins au chocolat','Préparez des muffins au chocolat comme projet de pâtisserie du week-end avec les enfants. Ils sont parfaits avec une tasse de thé, et vous pouvez doubler la quantité de chocolat en ajoutant des pépites de chocolat, si vous le souhaitez.','["125 g de farine nature","25g de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 gros œuf","60 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","100 ml de lait entier","50 g de pépites de chocolat (facultatif)","100g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à muffins de six caissettes à muffins. Tamisez la farine, le cacao et la levure chimique dans un bol moyen. Mélangez l''œuf, le sucre, l''huile et le lait dans un pichet, puis versez progressivement dans les ingrédients secs (ajoutez maintenant les pépites de chocolat pour faire des muffins doubles au chocolat, si vous le souhaitez) et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Répartir uniformément le mélange dans les moules à gâteau et cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez progressivement ½ à 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau au sucre glace jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lâche et pas trop liquide. Versez le glaçage sur les muffins une fois refroidis."]','2026-01-11 00:01:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9573,8536,'fr','Gâteau aux noix épicé avec glaçage à la mélasse de grenade','Préparez ce gâteau de célébration rempli de noix pour un dessert alternatif de l''Aïd. Il est garni d''un superbe glaçage à la mélasse de grenade et de noix confites.','["4 œufs","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 ml d''huile d''olive légère","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","150 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","6 gousses de cardamome verte, graines enlevées et écrasées","200 g de farine de noix (passez les noix au robot culinaire pour obtenir une farine grossière – sachez qu''un mixage trop fin les transformera en pâte)","100 g de noix concassées","40 g de moitiés de noix","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","20 g de mélasse de grenade","60g de sucre glace","Pot de 400 g de fromage à la crème entier","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","50g de graines de grenade"]','["Tapisser deux moules à charnière de 20 cm de diamètre de papier sulfurisé. Fouetter les œufs avec le sucre dans un bol pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient épais et aérés. Versez lentement l''huile d''olive en fouettant continuellement, puis versez le miel et la vanille et fouettez à nouveau pour combiner.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger la farine, la levure chimique, les épices et une pincée de sel dans un autre bol et mélanger. Tamisez légèrement le tout dans le mélange humide, incorporez-le, puis ajoutez la farine de noix, petit à petit, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporez les noix hachées et répartissez-les dans les moules.","Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Retirer et laisser refroidir dans les moules.","Pour préparer les noix confites, versez les noix sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les rôtir au four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sucre, la mélasse et 20 ml d''eau dans une casserole et faites chauffer à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le mélange prenne une couleur caramel foncé (environ 3-4 minutes). Baissez le feu, puis ajoutez les noix en remuant constamment jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient complètement enrobées. Retirer du feu et verser sur une couche de papier sulfurisé pour laisser refroidir.","Pour faire le glaçage, battez ensemble le sucre glace et le fromage à la crème jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et lisse (le glaçage deviendra plus fin avant d''épaissir, continuez donc à fouetter pendant 2 minutes), puis incorporez brièvement la mélasse pour créer un effet d''entraînement. Étalez la moitié du glaçage sur l’une des couches de gâteau, puis prenez l’autre en sandwich. Garnir avec plus de glaçage, les graines de grenade et les noix confites. Servir coupé en tranches. Se conserve au frais dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9574,7978,'fr','Pain d''épices torsadé au miel et beurre de tahini','Préparez ce pain d''inspiration moyen-orientale pour le servir lors d''un brunch festif. Pour rendre les choses encore plus gourmandes, tartinez des tranches épaisses avec notre miel gourmand et notre beurre de tahini','["120-140 ml de lait entier","50 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes","300 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 œuf moyen, légèrement battu","huile, pour le bol","50 g de beurre doux, ramolli","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame grillées","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","3 cuillères à café de cannelle","¼ cuillère à café de cardamome moulue","70 g de beurre salé ramolli","2 cuillères à soupe de miel liquide","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","75 g de sucre glace doré","graines de sésame, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer 120 ml de lait et le beurre dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus. Laisser refroidir à tiède.","Mélangez la farine, le sucre, le sel et la levure dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle. Faites un puits au centre et versez l''œuf et le lait tiède, puis mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. S''il semble un peu sec, ajoutez 20 ml de lait supplémentaires. Pétrir le mélange à vitesse douce à l''aide d''un crochet pétrisseur pendant 5 à 8 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse et reprenne sa forme lorsqu''elle est pressée. Si vous n''avez pas de batteur sur socle, mélangez le tout dans un bol, puis pétrissez sur une surface légèrement farinée pendant 8 à 10 minutes. Formez une boule de pâte et laissez-la lever dans un grand bol légèrement huilé recouvert d''un torchon pendant 1h-1h30 ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Pour préparer la garniture, mélangez les ingrédients et réservez.","Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Étalez la pâte levée sur un plan légèrement fariné jusqu''à obtenir un carré de 40 cm. Étalez uniformément la garniture sur la pâte à l''aide d''une spatule en laissant une bordure de 2 cm sur le pourtour. Roulez la pâte en une bûche serrée, en commençant par l''extrémité la plus éloignée de vous – elle doit mesurer environ 40 cm de longueur. Coupez la bûche de pâte en deux dans le sens de la longueur au milieu afin d''avoir deux longs morceaux posés l''un à côté de l''autre, horizontalement, côté coupé vers le haut. Pincez les deux extrémités, puis ramassez les extrémités et enroulez les morceaux les uns autour des autres, comme si vous fabriquiez une corde.","Transférez le pain sur la feuille préparée. Couvrir sans serrer et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud jusqu''à ce qu''il double à nouveau de volume, environ 45 minutes à 1 heure. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Placez la plaque au centre du four et faites cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes, en la recouvrant légèrement de papier d''aluminium si elle commence à devenir trop foncée pendant la cuisson. Une fois prêt, le pain doit être doré et sonner creux lorsqu’on le tape sur le fond. Laissez refroidir légèrement 15 minutes si vous le servez chaud, ou laissez-le refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Pour faire le beurre de tahini, mélangez les ingrédients avec une pincée de sel à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois jusqu''à homogénéité. Pour faire le glaçage, mélangez le sucre avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau tiède jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant davantage s''il est trop épais. Arroser le pain et saupoudrer de graines de sésame, le cas échéant. Trancher le pain et servir avec le miel et le beurre de tahini. Mieux mangé le jour où il est préparé."]','2026-01-11 00:01:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9575,8538,'fr','Biscuits au chocolat et à l''orange','Garnissez de riches biscuits au chocolat d’écorces d’orange confites pour réaliser ces bouchées gourmandes. Ils font un excellent cadeau comestible pour Noël','["225 g de beurre ramolli","60g de sucre glace","1 orange, zestée et ½ jus","300 g de farines autolevantes","40g de cacao en poudre","175 g de chocolat noir haché","40 g d''écorces d''orange confites hachées","5 lanières d''écorces d''orange confites sucrées, chacune coupée en 5 morceaux"]','["Battez le beurre au fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''il soit léger et mousseux, puis incorporez petit à petit le sucre glace en ajoutant le zeste d''orange et 1 cuillère à soupe de jus d''orange. Incorporer petit à petit la farine et le cacao, puis incorporer le chocolat et le zeste d''orange.","Divisez le mélange en deux, tapotez chacun en forme de bûche grossière sur un morceau de film antiadhésif ou de papier sulfurisé, puis utilisez le film pour vous aider à façonner chaque morceau en une bûche d''environ 15 cm de long. Réfrigérer jusqu''à consistance ferme, environ 2 heures (voir conseil ci-dessous).","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie. Découpez des biscuits de ½ cm d''épaisseur dans la pâte et disposez-les sur les plaques à pâtisserie en laissant de l''espace pour qu''ils puissent gonfler et s''étaler. Déposez sur chacun un morceau d''orange confite sucrée. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les biscuits soient gonflés. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes sur les feuilles avant de les glisser sur une grille. Se conserve deux à trois jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9576,8540,'fr','Biscuits au pain d''épice','Levez les pieds et dégustez ces délicieux biscuits au pain d''épice avec une tasse de thé, à base de clous de girofle aromatiques, de gingembre, de cannelle et de riche mélasse noire.','["120 g de beurre doux, ramolli","1½ cuillère à soupe de mélasse noire","170 g de sucre roux clair et mou","½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","1 œuf moyen","200 g de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","¼ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","1½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","60 g de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Battre ensemble le beurre, la mélasse, la cassonade et le sel dans un grand bol à mélanger. Ajoutez l''œuf, puis battez tous les ingrédients secs restants à l''exception du sucre en poudre. Refroidissez le mélange au réfrigérateur pendant 1 heure.","Chauffer le four à 200 C/180 C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Roulez le mélange en 20 boules de taille égale (en pesant pour plus de précision, si vous le souhaitez). Versez le sucre en poudre dans une petite assiette, puis ajoutez chaque boule et roulez pour enrober. Espacez chaque boule sur les plaques à pâtisserie. Cuire au four pendant 9 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:01:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9577,8542,'fr','Sablés végétaliens','Réalisez nos sablés vegan avec de l''huile d''olive pour une saveur beurrée et de la maïzena pour obtenir le friabilité des versions traditionnelles. Ils sont délicieux avec du beurre de noix','["250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","75 g de sucre en poudre, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","½ cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","125 ml d''huile d''olive légère"]','["Mélangez la farine, le sucre et la maïzena dans un robot culinaire pour tamiser et mélanger brièvement, puis ajoutez la vanille et arrosez d''huile d''olive en mélangeant les pales du robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle et dorée. Envelopper et réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes pour reposer.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé ou d''un tapis de cuisson. Abaissez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné sur 5 mm d''épaisseur et utilisez un emporte-pièce rond ou cannelé d''environ 6 cm de diamètre pour découper des ronds de sablés. Utilisez un petit couteau à palette pour transférer sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Peut être congelé sur la plaque à pâtisserie, puis transféré dans une boîte une fois solide. Se conservera jusqu''à trois mois.","Saupoudrez 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre sur les biscuits et faites cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes pour raffermir sur la plaque, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Ajoutez 2 à 4 minutes au temps de cuisson si vous cuisez surgelé."]','2026-01-11 00:01:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9578,8544,'fr','Blondies poire caramel','Faites cuire ces blondies aux poires et au caramel pour une gourmandise à l''heure du thé. Avec une saveur biscuitée provenant du brunissement du beurre, ils sont gourmands et moelleux','["250 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","3 gros œufs","275 g de sucre mou roux clair","25 g de sucre muscovado brun foncé","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","1 cuillère à café de sel marin fin","200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g de poires séchées hachées grossièrement","100 g de chocolat noir haché grossièrement","3 cuillères à soupe de caramel, en boîte ou en pot"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à brownie carré de 20 x 25 cm.","Faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole à feu moyen en le remuant. Laisser bouillonner pendant quelques minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il devienne légèrement doré et sente le biscuit. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir un peu.","Versez les œufs dans un grand bol à mélanger et fouettez avec les sucres clair et foncé jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer le beurre fondu, la vanille et le sel.","Incorporez délicatement la farine, la levure chimique, les poires séchées et la plupart des morceaux de chocolat en faisant attention de ne pas trop mélanger (cela rendrait les blondies denses).","Versez le mélange dans le moule chemisé. Garnir avec le reste du chocolat et des cuillerées de caramel. Mettre au centre du four et cuire pendant 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré en ressorte avec des miettes collantes (il ne doit pas être mouillé). Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule. Il coulera un peu – le centre devrait être légèrement squameux. Coupez en 12 carrés. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9579,8546,'fr','Pouding éponge aux figues','Le pudding éponge passe à un niveau supérieur avec l''ajout de délicieuses figues cuites au four et de thym, ce qui donne un dessert hivernal très réconfortant. Servir chaud avec de la crème, de la glace ou du yaourt grec','["250 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le plat","5 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","4 cuillères à soupe de miel","8 figues fraîches","4 gros œufs","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec entier","2-3 brins de thym (facultatif)","huile d''olive extra vierge ou miel, pour arroser (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un plat allant au four de 20 x 22 cm, puis verser le sirop doré et le miel. Coupez les tiges des figues, puis coupez une croix profonde sur le dessus, juste pour qu''elles s''ouvrent un peu, mais veillez à ne pas couper complètement. Placez les figues debout sur le sirop et mettez-les au four pour cuire pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies et commencent à caraméliser un peu sur les bords.","Pendant que les figues cuisent, préparez le mélange de génoise. Mettez les œufs, le sucre, la farine, la levure chimique, la vanille et le beurre dans un bol et utilisez un fouet électrique pour battre jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Sortez le plat du four, retirez les figues avec une écumoire et réservez. Une fois le mélange de sirop refroidi dans le plat, prélevez des cuillerées de pâte à biscuit et déposez-les délicatement sur le sirop. Il est préférable de faire cela d’abord sur tout le pourtour, puis de terminer au milieu – cela aide à garder le mélange de sirop séparé. Lisser la pâte très doucement pour couvrir les éventuels trous et sceller le mélange de sirop.","Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la génoise reprenne sa forme lorsqu''elle est pressée. Laisser refroidir pendant environ 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste chaud, puis quelques secondes avant de servir, parsemer la surface de huit petites cuillerées de yaourt. Garnissez chaque monticule d''une figue cuite au four, puis parsemez de quelques feuilles de thym et arrosez d''huile d''olive extra vierge, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9580,8548,'fr','Tartes au slime au kiwi','Préparez ces tartes au kiwi pour une fête d''Halloween et elles raviront les enfants et les adultes. La gelée verte et la crème anglaise constituent une délicieuse garniture au « slime »','["320 g de pâte brisée toute roulée du commerce","4 jaunes d''œufs, plus 1 blanc d''œuf (congeler les blancs restants pour faire des meringues un autre jour)","400 ml de lait","35 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de farine nature","5 cubes de gelée verte","2-3 kiwis verts et dorés, pelés et tranchés"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Divisez la pâte en huit morceaux égaux. Étalez chacun jusqu''à ce qu''il soit assez grand pour tapisser des moules à tartelettes cannelés de 7 à 8 cm de profondeur ou huit trous d''un grand moule à muffins. Tapisser les moules avec la pâte en laissant un peu dépasser au-dessus des bords, puis tapisser de caissettes en papier et de fèves au bicarbonate de soude. Placez les moules sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 10 minutes, puis retirez le papier et les haricots, badigeonnez de blanc d''œuf et faites cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes, puis démouler et laisser refroidir complètement.","Mettez le lait dans une casserole et portez presque à ébullition, puis retirez du feu. Mettez les jaunes d''œufs, le sucre et la farine dans un bol et fouettez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Il doit laisser une trace qui reste momentanément à la surface lorsque le fouet est soulevé. Versez un tiers du lait chaud dans le bol, en fouettant lentement tout le temps, jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporez le reste du lait.","Remettez le mélange dans la casserole en le grattant à l''aide d''une spatule en caoutchouc. Portez lentement à ébullition en remuant jusqu''à ce que la crème soit épaisse, lisse et brillante. Au début, cela aura l''air un peu grumeleux, mais continuez à remuer et cela deviendra lisse. Baissez le feu et laissez mijoter 2 minutes en remuant. Incorporer la gelée jusqu''à ce que les cubes soient dissous. Laissez le mélange refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tiède, puis répartissez-le entre les fonds de tarte cuits. Garnir chacun d''une tranche de kiwi et laisser refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9581,8550,'fr','Mélange à crumble rapide','Préparez ce crumble rapide aux fruits lorsque les invités viennent. La préparation prend 20 minutes, puis vous pouvez le laisser au four pendant que vous recevez','["450 g de fruits coupés en morceaux de 1 cm (nous avons utilisé 400 g de pommes Bramley et 50 g de mûres fraîches)","75g de sucre semoule","50 g de beurre froid et coupé en cubes","100 g de farine nature","50 g de sucre démérara"]','["Chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélangez les fruits et le sucre cristallisé (vous aurez besoin de moins de sucre pour les fruits en conserve) pour qu''ils soient uniformément enrobés. Versez-la dans un plat à tarte où elle s''ajuste parfaitement.","Frottez le beurre dans la farine pour obtenir une texture légère de chapelure. Ne le travaillez pas trop, sinon le crumble deviendra lourd. Ajoutez le sucre demerara jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et étalez-le sur les fruits jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement recouverts.","Cuire au four pendant 35 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bouillonnants et que les fruits soient tendres. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9582,8553,'fr','Tiffin au chocolat','Allez-y à fond et offrez-vous ces tranches de tiffin au chocolat, pleines de chocolat au lait et noir, de raisins secs et de biscuit. Attention : ils ne dureront pas longtemps !','["150 g de beurre coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","6 cuillères à café de cacao en poudre","225 g de biscuits écrasés","une poignée de raisins secs","110g de chocolat au lait","110g de chocolat noir"]','["Beurrer et tapisser un moule de 15 à 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Dans une grande casserole, faire fondre le beurre, le sucre, le sirop et le cacao. Incorporer les biscuits et les raisins secs.","Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et appuyez, puis lissez le dessus avec le dos d''une cuillère. Chauffez les deux chocolats au micro-ondes par courtes rafales de 20 secondes, en remuant fréquemment, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus. Versez-les sur le mélange dans le moule. Utilisez un couteau à palette ou une cuillère pour lisser afin qu''il soit complètement enrobé de chocolat.","Mettez le moule au réfrigérateur et laissez reposer environ 2 heures, voire toute la nuit. Passez un couteau de cuisine sous le robinet chaud puis coupez en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9583,8555,'fr','Scones au fromage classiques','Offrez-vous des scones au fromage pour le thé de l''après-midi ou dans le cadre d''un pique-nique. Ils sont également excellents avec des soupes et vous pouvez les congeler pour une utilisation ultérieure.','["225 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","pincée de sel","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","55 g de beurre réfrigéré coupé en cubes","120 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","90 à 100 ml de lait, plus 1 cuillère à soupe pour le glaçage"]','["Chauffez le four à 200 C/180 C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 avec une grande plaque à pâtisserie à l''intérieur. Tamisez la farine, le sel, le poivre de Cayenne et la levure chimique dans un bol, puis tamisez à nouveau pour vous assurer que les ingrédients sont bien mélangés.","Ajoutez le beurre dans le bol et mélangez du bout des doigts pour obtenir de la chapelure. Saupoudrer 100 g de fromage dans le mélange de chapelure et frotter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément réparti. Essayez de ne pas trop mélanger car la chaleur de vos mains pourrait commencer à faire fondre le beurre.","Faites un puits au centre du mélange et versez suffisamment de lait pour obtenir une pâte assez molle mais ferme. Ne versez pas tout le lait d’un coup, car vous n’en aurez peut-être pas besoin pour obtenir la bonne consistance.","Farinez légèrement une surface et étalez la pâte sur environ 2 cm d''épaisseur. Découpez les scones avec un emporte-pièce moyen (environ 8 cm), puis déposez-les sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé, badigeonnez d''un peu de lait et saupoudrez du reste de fromage. Glisser sur la plaque du four chaude.","Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits."]','2026-01-11 00:01:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9584,8557,'fr','Gâteau sirène','Créez un gâteau avec le facteur wow avec notre sirène ombrée colorée. C''est un défi de pâtisserie, mais cela fait un gâteau de fête magique pour les enfants et les adultes.','["300 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","300 g de sucre en poudre","5 gros œufs battus","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","300 g de farines autolevantes","colorant alimentaire en gel violet (ou un mélange de colorant en gel violet, bleu et rouge)","700 g de sucre glace","350 g de beurre ramolli","Colorant alimentaire en gel bleu ou violet","perles comestibles et pépites d''argent, ou décoration supplémentaire facultative","200 g de chocolat blanc","2 cuillères à café de lustre doré ou métallique (voir astuce ci-dessous)","moule queue de sirène et moules petites coquilles, disponibles en ligne"]','["Si vous préparez des queues de sirène, faites fondre le chocolat blanc dans un bol résistant à la chaleur par tranches de 20 secondes au micro-ondes, en remuant après chaque tour. Verser dans les moules à queue et les petites coquilles, et mettre sur un petit plateau à plat au congélateur pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris. Vous pouvez répéter cette opération pour quatre queues si vous n''avez qu''un seul moule.","Une fois pris, démoulez, mélangez le lustre avec ¼ cuillère à café d''eau et peignez-le sur les queues de sirène (voir astuce ci-dessous). Remettre sur une assiette ou un plateau au congélateur jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond de trois moules à sandwich de 18 cm de papier sulfurisé. À l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou d''un fouet électrique, battez ensemble le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, la vanille, la levure chimique et la farine jusqu''à obtenir un mélange mousseux.","Répartissez le mélange uniformément dans trois bols et mélangez quelques gouttes de colorant dans chaque bol jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, donnant à chaque bol une nuance de violet différente, devenant plus claire. Versez chaque mélange de génoise coloré dans des moules séparés et lissez le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Au bout de 10 minutes, retirez les gâteaux de leurs moules, transférez-les sur une grille de refroidissement, le dessus vers le bas, et laissez refroidir. Ne vous inquiétez pas si l''extérieur n''est pas violet, l''intérieur le sera !","Pendant que le gâteau refroidit, préparez le glaçage. Battre ensemble le sucre glace et le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux, en mélangeant avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau tiède pour détendre le mélange si nécessaire. Réserver la moitié du glaçage dans un bol. Répartissez l''autre moitié du glaçage dans trois bols et colorez chacun d''une nuance de bleu différente, un foncé, un moyen et un clair. Empilez les génoises en étalant la majeure partie du glaçage blanc sur chacune d''entre elles à l''aide d''un couteau à palette, puis utilisez le couteau à palette pour enduire grossièrement l''extérieur des gâteaux avec le reste du glaçage blanc afin de créer une couche de chapelure. Mettre au frais 30 min.","Mettez chacune des nuances de glaçage bleues dans des poches à douille séparées et découpez un grand trou de 2 cm au fond. En commençant par la teinte foncée au bas du gâteau, formez un anneau uniforme sur l''ensemble du gâteau, deux à trois fois autour. Continuez à monter sur le gâteau, le glaçage devenant plus léger à mesure que vous atteignez le sommet du gâteau. À l''aide d''un petit couteau à palette, contournez la jointure entre chaque rangée, en poussant doucement pour joindre chaque ligne ensemble. Gardez un peu de glaçage dans les poches à douille pour décorer le dessus. Lisser le gâteau avec un grand couteau à palette ou un grattoir à gâteau pour créer un glaçage ombré lisse, en gardant l''excédent pour décorer le dessus.","Vous pouvez soit mélanger tous les restes de glaçage et mettre dans une poche à douille propre avec une douille en étoile pour obtenir un effet multicolore, soit déposer des nuances individuelles sur le dessus. Ajoutez quelques points autour du dessus du gâteau dans les différentes couleurs bleues pour ressembler à des vagues (en utilisant une partie du blanc pour ressembler au sommet d''une vague déferlante), et parsemez les perles, les pépites, les coquillages et les queues de sirène, en les poussant dans le glaçage sur le côté du gâteau et sur le dessus pour terminer."]','2026-01-11 00:01:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9585,8559,'fr','Cookies de base','Préparez un lot de ces biscuits faciles avec seulement cinq ingrédients – ou moins. Accompagnant parfaitement une tasse de thé, vous pouvez les préparer en un rien de temps','["225 g de beurre ramolli","110 g de sucre en poudre","275 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de cannelle ou d''autres épices (facultatif)","75 g de pépites de chocolat blanc ou au lait (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Crémer le beurre dans un grand bol avec une cuillère en bois ou au batteur jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez le sucre et continuez à battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Tamisez la farine et ajoutez les ingrédients facultatifs, si vous les utilisez. Mélangez le mélange avec vos mains dans un mouvement en huit jusqu''à ce qu''il forme une pâte. Vous pouvez à ce stade congeler la pâte.","Roulez la pâte en boules de la taille d''une noix et placez-les légèrement espacées les unes des autres sur une plaque à pâtisserie (vous n''avez pas besoin de la beurrer ni de la tapisser). Aplatissez un peu les boules avec la paume de la main et faites-les cuire au four environ 10-12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et légèrement fermes sur le dessus. Laissez les biscuits sur une grille de refroidissement pendant environ 15 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9586,8561,'fr','Bagatelles à la framboise, à la pistache et au citron','Dégustez ces bagatelles individuelles à la framboise, à la pistache et au citron dans le cadre d''un menu d''été. Ils sont faciles à assembler et vous pouvez facilement les emballer','["1 gâteau madère (environ 200g)","5 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","300g de framboises","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 cuillères à soupe de limoncello","100 g de pistaches vertes sans peau, hachées finement","400 g de crème anglaise épaisse","300 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Coupez le gâteau de Madère en tranches de 1 cm d''épaisseur et mettez les morceaux en sandwich avec 4 cuillères à soupe de crème au citron. Couper en petits carrés et empiler dans quatre verres à dessert ou dans un plat à bagatelle moyen.","Écrasez la moitié des framboises dans un bol avec une fourchette et incorporez la vanille et le limoncello. Verser sur l''éponge. Garnir d’autres framboises coupées en deux ou entières – en gardant quelques-unes pour finir – et d’un peu de pistaches.","Incorporer la plupart des pistaches restantes à la crème anglaise, puis verser sur les fruits et la génoise.","Fouetter la crème et le sucre dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient épais et gonflés et qu''ils maintiennent des pics mous. Verser sur les bagatelles. Garnir avec les pistaches réservées, un tourbillon de crème au citron et le reste des framboises."]','2026-01-11 00:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9587,8563,'fr','Gâteau aux bananes et au tahini','Essayez le tahini comme ingrédient secret dans le gâteau à la banane : cela fonctionne à merveille. Décorez-le avec notre garniture à la crème au beurre au tahini et nos pépites de chocolat','["100 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","250 g de sucre mou roux clair","85 g de tahin","2 gros œufs, légèrement battus","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","275 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","60 ml de lait","2-3 petites bananes bien mûres, écrasées (environ 275g)","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","115 g de beurre doux, ramolli","125g de sucre glace","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2½ cuillères à soupe de tahin","3 cuillères à soupe de pépites de chocolat"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake carré de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé.","Battre le beurre, le sucre et le tahini ensemble jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et lisse. Battez les œufs petit à petit, puis ajoutez la vanille en raclant les parois du bol au besoin.","Mélangez la farine, le bicarbonate de soude et ½ cuillère à café de sel, puis incorporez-les au mélange de beurre. Incorporer le lait. Incorporez délicatement la banane et les graines de sésame, puis versez la pâte dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir légèrement dans le moule, puis retirer et transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pour préparer la garniture à la crème au beurre, battez tous les ingrédients, à l''exception des pépites de chocolat, jusqu''à consistance lisse. Étalez-le sur le gâteau refroidi, puis répartissez-le sur les pépites de chocolat et coupez le gâteau en carrés ou en rectangles pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9588,8565,'fr','Chaussons de confiture','Préparez ces chaussons à la confiture ultra faciles à partir de simples carrés de pâte feuilletée du commerce et de votre confiture préférée. Saupoudrer de sucre glace et servir avec de la crème caillée','["320 g de pâte feuilletée","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de confiture (l''abricot, la framboise ou la fraise fonctionnent bien)","1 œuf battu","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","crème caillée, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Déroulez la pâte feuilletée sur un plan légèrement fariné. Coupez la pâte en six carrés. Versez la confiture au centre de chaque carré de pâte. Scellez les bords en appuyant avec une fourchette et badigeonnez d''œuf. Disposez sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée et enfournez pendant 20 minutes. Saupoudrez de sucre glace et servez avec la crème caillée."]','2026-01-11 00:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9589,8567,'fr','Biscuits au gingembre','Utilisez du gingembre frais et moulu pour préparer ces biscuits gourmands. Ils sont parfaits servis avec une tasse de thé pour le thé de l''après-midi ou comme gâterie à tout moment.','["100 g de beurre salé coupé en cubes","75 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre frais râpé","100 g de sirop doré","250 g de farines autolevantes","1½ cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 petit jaune d''oeuf battu"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Dans une casserole, à feu doux, faire fondre le beurre, le sucre, le gingembre frais et le golden sirop et laisser refroidir.","Mélangez la farine, le gingembre moulu et le bicarbonate de soude dans un bol avec une cuillère en bois. Incorporez progressivement le mélange de sucre refroidi et le jaune d''œuf et pétrissez brièvement pour obtenir une pâte.","Rouler la pâte en boules de 20 g et disposer sur les plaques à pâtisserie préparées en espacant chacune 3 cm pour permettre l''étalement. Cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques pendant une minute, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9590,8569,'fr','Gâteau au caramel facile','Besoin de préparer un gâteau de fête dans un délai très court ? Ce gâteau au caramel infaillible et époustouflant utilise des ingrédients du commerce et est rapide à préparer.','["225 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","125 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 gros œufs","225 g de farines autolevantes","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","morceaux de toffee, de chocolat ou de caramel, pour décorer","200 g de beurre salé ramolli","400 g de sucre glace (sucre glace doré si vous en trouvez – il ajoute une couleur dorée et un goût de caramel)","70 g de sauce caramel, dulce de leche ou caramel à tartiner, plus 3 cuillères à soupe pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer deux moules à charnière de 20 cm et tapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé.","Battre le beurre et les deux sucres dans un bol avec un fouet électrique pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit plus clair et mousseux. Ajouter la vanille et les œufs, un à un, en ajoutant une cuillerée de farine et en battant entre chaque œuf. Ajoutez le reste de la farine et le lait. Répartissez dans les moules à gâteau et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, reprennent leur forme lorsqu''ils sont pressés et qu''un cure-dent en ressorte propre lorsqu''il est inséré au milieu. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes dans les moules, puis démouler et laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Pendant ce temps, pour le glaçage, mettez le beurre et le sucre glace dans un bol et fouettez pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et aéré. Incorporer brièvement le caramel en ajoutant 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau bouillante pour le détendre, si nécessaire. Réserver jusqu''à ce que les génoises soient complètement refroidies avant de les assembler, sinon le glaçage fondrait.","Utilisez la moitié du glaçage pour prendre les gâteaux ensemble, puis étalez le reste sur le dessus en lissant avec un couteau ou le dos d''une cuillère. Laisser au frais jusqu''au moment de servir. Arroser avec les 3 cuillères à soupe de sauce supplémentaire (réchauffer brièvement au micro-ondes si elle est un peu ferme), en laissant un peu couler sur les côtés si vous le souhaitez, et parsemer sur les morceaux de caramel au beurre, de chocolat ou de caramel pour servir. Paillettes comestibles, bougies d''anniversaire ou cierges magiques, facultatif."]','2026-01-11 00:01:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9591,8571,'fr','Gâteau épicé au miel','Savourez ce fabuleux gâteau au miel composé d''un mélange d''épices et de gingembre et d''un joli filet de beurre au miel. C''est idéal pour le thé de l''après-midi ou les onze heures','["100 g de beurre demi-sel + un peu pour le moule","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de miel liquide","1 gros œuf","100 ml de lait","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","150 g de farines autolevantes","25g de beurre salé","25 g de miel liquide"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre et le sucre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse. Incorporez le miel, l''œuf, le lait, les épices et une pincée de sel (ne vous inquiétez pas s''il caille légèrement, cela deviendra une pâte lâche), puis incorporez la farine.","Versez dans le moule à cake préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laissez le gâteau refroidir pendant 10 minutes, puis transférez-le sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pour le glaçage, faites fondre le beurre et le miel dans une petite poêle jusqu''à consistance lisse. Laisser refroidir jusqu''à épaississement, puis verser en filet sur le dessus du gâteau refroidi. Laisser prendre avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9592,8573,'fr','Blondies pistache, rose et chocolat blanc','Essayez une version différente des blondies en utilisant des pistaches, de la rose et du chocolat blanc. Parsemer de pétales de roses séchées pour une jolie finition, si vous le souhaitez','["60g de pistaches","150 g de chocolat blanc haché","100 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 gros œufs","½ à 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau de rose","85 g de farine nature","100 g de pépites de chocolat blanc","pétales de roses séchées, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et beurrer et tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 20 x 20 cm. Versez les pistaches dans une poêle et faites-les griller à feu moyen pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient aromatiques, en remuant de temps en temps pour qu''elles ne brûlent pas. Annuler.","Faites fondre le chocolat blanc haché et le beurre ensemble, soit dans un bol posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, soit au micro-ondes par petites rafales. Laisser refroidir légèrement, puis incorporer la cassonade avec une cuillère en bois. Ajoutez les œufs en mélangeant bien après chaque ajout, puis incorporez l''eau de rose et ¼ cuillère à café de sel. Tamiser la farine et incorporer délicatement.","Hachez grossièrement les pistaches refroidies, puis ajoutez-les au mélange blondie et incorporez les pépites de chocolat blanc. Versez le mélange dans le moule à pâtisserie tapissé.","Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pris et dorés, puis laisser refroidir complètement avant de trancher. Pour servir, parsemez de pétales de roses séchées, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9593,8575,'fr','Petits cakes aux carottes au sirop d''orange et de miel','Préparez ces magnifiques cupcakes aux carottes préparés avec un délicieux glaçage à l''orange et au miel pour un régal l''après-midi. Les fleurs comestibles apportent une jolie touche finale','["150 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour la boîte","175 g de sucre muscovado léger","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","1 orange, zestée et pressée (conserver le jus pour le sirop)","2 gros œufs","50g de yaourt nature","200 g de carottes, environ 2 grosses, pelées et râpées","50 ml de miel liquide, plus un peu pour arroser (facultatif)","150 g de mascarpone","100 g de yaourt nature épais","75 g de sucre glace tamisé","fleurs comestibles ou zeste d''orange supplémentaire, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et huiler un moule à muffins 12 trous, ou le tapisser de moules à muffins. Dans un grand bol, mélanger le sucre, la farine, le bicarbonate, le mélange d''épices et le zeste d''orange. Fouettez ensemble les œufs, l''huile et le yaourt, puis incorporez les ingrédients secs ainsi que les carottes râpées. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé ou répartissez-le entre les moules, le cas échéant, puis faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 22 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Démoulez les gâteaux sur une grille et laissez-les refroidir un peu.","Pendant ce temps, pour préparer le sirop, faites chauffer le miel et le jus d''orange dans une casserole. Porter à ébullition, puis laisser mijoter une minute jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit sirupeux. Versez quelques cuillères à café sur chaque gâteau encore chaud, puis laissez refroidir complètement. Pour le glaçage, mélangez le mascarpone, le yaourt et le sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tout juste combinés (si vous mélangez trop, cela deviendra liquide). Utilisez une palette ou un couteau à couverts pour faire tourbillonner le glaçage sur les gâteaux, arrosez d''un peu plus de miel, si vous le souhaitez, et décorez de fleurs comestibles ou de zeste d''orange."]','2026-01-11 00:01:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9594,8577,'fr','Pain de thé','Savourez un gâteau classique et fruité, rempli de groseilles et de raisins secs infusés au thé. Coupez-le en quartiers épais et tartinez-le de beurre salé pour une gâterie satisfaisante','["170 g de raisins secs","170g de raisins secs","1 orange, zestée","300 ml de thé Earl Grey ou Lady Grey fort et chaud","2 œufs moyens, légèrement battus","250 g de farines autolevantes","200 g de cassonade légère et molle","beurre, pour graisser, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Mélangez les raisins secs, les raisins secs et le zeste d''orange dans un grand bol à mélanger. Versez dessus le thé et couvrez le bol. Laisser reposer minimum 6 heures ou idéalement toute la nuit pour permettre aux fruits secs d''absorber tout le liquide.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160° chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g. Ajoutez les œufs, la farine et le sucre aux fruits trempés, en vous assurant que tout est bien mélangé. Versez le mélange dans le moule et placez-le au centre du four pendant 1 heure 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme au toucher. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes avant de transférer sur une grille.","Couper en tranches épaisses et servir avec du beurre. Pour conserver, emballez hermétiquement et conservez dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours. Le pain sera encore meilleur après quelques jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9595,8579,'fr','Flaps végétaliens','Choisissez vos noix et fruits secs préférés dans cette recette polyvalente de flapjack sans produits laitiers, ou changez-la à chaque fois que vous les préparez : soyez aventureux !','["140 g de pâte à tartiner sans produits laitiers","140 g de sucre roux clair et mou","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","175 g de flocons d''avoine","75g de noix hachées de votre choix","75 g de fruits secs (comme des raisins secs, des canneberges séchées, des abricots hachés)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160 C/140 C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule carré de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé.","Faire fondre la pâte à tartiner sans produits laitiers, le sucre et le sirop dans une casserole à feu moyen. Retirer du feu et verser les flocons d''avoine, les noix hachées et les fruits secs. Transférer dans le moule en tassant le mélange avec le dos d''une cuillère.","Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient légèrement dorés et croustillants. Laisser refroidir dans le moule avant de découper en carrés. Conserver dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9596,8581,'fr','Petits pains croisés végétaliens','Qu''est-ce qui dit mieux Pâques que les petits pains chauds ? Essayez cette version végétalienne, utilisant de la pâte à tartiner sans produits laitiers et du lait d''amande – la cannelle, le mélange d''épices, les raisins secs et les agrumes apportent toutes les saveurs traditionnelles.','["300 ml de lait d''amande non sucré","50 g de pâte à tartiner sans produits laitiers","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte","Sachet de 7g de levure à action rapide","70 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café de sel","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à café bombées d''épices mélangées","1 grosse orange, zestée","70 g de raisins secs","50 g de zestes mélangés","70 g de farine nature","50g de confiture d''abricots"]','["Mettez le lait d''amande dans une casserole sur feu moyen. Une fois mijoté, ajoutez la pâte à tartiner, retirez du feu et laissez fondre. Laisser refroidir à la température des mains.","Mélangez la farine, la levure, le sucre, le sel et les épices dans un grand bol à mélanger. Faites un puits au centre et versez le mélange de lait en mélangeant rapidement avec une cuillère en bois pour créer une pâte collante. Versez le bol sur une surface légèrement farinée.","Pétrir la pâte en l''étirant d''avant en arrière sur la surface pendant 5 à 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse, élastique et élastique. Formez une boule et mettez-la dans un bol à mélanger légèrement huilé. Couvrir et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Retournez la pâte sur la surface et aplatissez-la en rond. Étalez le zeste d''orange, les raisins secs et le mélange d''écorces sur la pâte et pétrissez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien réparti. Former une boule, remettre dans le bol, couvrir et laisser lever encore une heure.","Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Renversez la pâte en la retournant sur votre surface et en expulsant doucement l''air. Divisez la pâte en 12 morceaux de taille égale, en pesant pour plus de précision si vous le souhaitez. Roulez chacun en boule. Disposez les petits pains sur la plaque à pâtisserie en laissant un espace de 2 cm entre chacun. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire légèrement huilé et laisser lever 45 min.","Chauffer le four à 220 C/ 200 chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Pour faire la croix, dans un petit bol, mélanger la farine avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau à la fois pour créer une pâte épaisse et pipelable. Versez-le dans une poche à douille munie d''une petite douille ronde et dressez des croix sur les petits pains. Transférer sur la grille du milieu du four et cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer doucement la confiture dans une petite casserole à feu doux pour la décoller. Passer au tamis pour éliminer les grumeaux. Une fois cuit, badigeonnez le dessus des petits pains de confiture tiède. Laisser refroidir un peu avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9597,8583,'fr','Tarte aux cerises et aux amandes Amarena','Cette tarte aux cerises et aux amandes aigre-douce de Lina Stores est le régal italien ultime. Servir une tranche pour terminer parfaitement n''importe quel repas','["125g de beurre","125 g de sucre en poudre doré","225 g de farine nature","½ œuf ou 1 jaune d''œuf","125 g de beurre à température ambiante","125 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs moyens","1 citron, zesté","125 g d''amandes finement moulues ou de farine d''amande","120g de cerises Fabbri amarena (voir astuce)","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez le beurre, le sucre, la farine, une pincée de sel et l''œuf dans un robot culinaire pour obtenir une pâte, puis enveloppez et laissez reposer 30 min au réfrigérateur. La pâte doit être froide mais encore facile à travailler au moment où vous l''étalez.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture à la frangipane. Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle à feu doux, puis laisser refroidir légèrement. Battre le sucre avec les œufs et le zeste de citron dans un bol jusqu''à consistance crémeuse. Versez le beurre fondu en continuant de battre, puis ajoutez la poudre d''amandes (ou la farine d''amandes) et incorporez au mélange. Chauffer le four à 175C/155C ventilateur/gaz 3½.","Tapisser un moule à tarte ou un cercle beurré (environ 23 cm) avec la pâte feuilletée étalée, puis couper les bords qui dépassent. Répartissez uniformément la frangipane dans le moule et disposez dessus les cerises avec un peu de leur sirop, afin que le dessus de la tarte soit recouvert d''une fine couche.","Mettez la tarte au four et faites cuire environ 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée, gonflée et ferme au toucher. Laisser refroidir sur une grille. Saupoudrez éventuellement d''un peu de sucre glace avant de servir en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9598,8585,'fr','Gâteau mousse au matcha','Ingrédient populaire dans les desserts asiatiques, la poudre de matcha est fabriquée à partir de feuilles de thé vert finement moulues. Ce joli gâteau au glaçage au chocolat blanc et aux cerises est un peu un défi mais en vaut la peine','["huile végétale, pour graisser","6 gros œufs, séparés","200 g de sucre blanc en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de farine nature","25g d''amandes moulues","50 g de beurre fondu et refroidi","5 feuilles de gélatine","Pot de 600 ml de crème double","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de matcha (voir astuce)","250 g de sucre glace + un peu pour saupoudrer","150 ml de crème fraîche","150 g de chocolat blanc coupé en petits morceaux","1 cuillère à café de poudre de matcha","cerises et fleurs de cerisier roses fraîches, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer deux moules à gâteau de 20 cm (dont l''un doit avoir au moins 8 cm de profondeur) avec de l''huile et tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Versez les jaunes d''œufs, le sucre en poudre et la vanille dans un grand bol et les blancs d''œufs dans un deuxième grand bol. Mélangez la farine, les amandes et 1/4 cuillère à café de sel dans un troisième bol.","À l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battre les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils doublent de volume et maintiennent des pics mous. Transférez les batteurs dans le bol du jaune d''œuf (pas besoin de nettoyer les batteurs au préalable) et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et pâle. Soulevez les batteurs et versez le mélange autour du bol – un ruban doit rester sur la surface pendant 2-3 secondes.","Avec une grande cuillère en métal, transférez une cuillerée de blanc d''œuf sur les jaunes et mélangez pour assouplir la consistance. Ajoutez les blancs restants et incorporez délicatement aux jaunes en essayant de conserver le plus de volume possible. Arrêtez-vous avant que le mélange ne soit totalement combiné. Saupoudrer uniformément le mélange de farine et d''amandes sur la surface, puis verser le beurre refroidi sur le pourtour du bol. Pliez le tout jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien combiné, en veillant à bien enfoncer la cuillère jusqu''au fond du bol pour récupérer le beurre et les éventuelles poches de farine. Répartissez le mélange dans les moules à gâteau, nivelez les surfaces, puis enfournez à mi-hauteur du four pendant 22 à 25 minutes. Testez la cuisson des gâteaux en insérant un cure-dent au centre – il doit ressortir propre. Laisser refroidir dans leurs moules sur une grille pendant 30 minutes, puis retirer les moules et le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir complètement.","Faites bouillir la bouilloire. Mettez la gélatine dans un bol d''eau froide et laissez-la ramollir. Versez 150 ml de crème et 50 ml d''eau chaude dans une casserole. Ajoutez la poudre de matcha et fouettez à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et fumant. Retirer du feu. Pressez l’eau des feuilles de gélatine et ajoutez-les une à une à la crème de matcha chaude en fouettant jusqu’à ce qu’elles soient dissoutes. Versez la crème tiède dans un bol et mettez-la au réfrigérateur pour qu''elle refroidisse à température ambiante – ne la laissez pas trop longtemps sinon la gélatine durcira.","Tapissez le plus profond de vos moules à cake de 20 cm de diamètre d''une double couche de film alimentaire en veillant à ce que les côtés soient bien recouverts. Mettez l''une des génoises dans le moule, le côté le plus plat vers le bas. Versez les 450 ml de crème restante dans un bol et ajoutez le sucre glace. Fouettez jusqu''à ce que la crème forme des pics mous, puis incorporez-la à la crème matcha refroidie. Versez la crème dans le moule à cake et nivelez la surface. Posez le reste de la génoise dessus, côté le plus plat vers le haut, en poussant délicatement la génoise dans la crème. Enveloppez le moule dans du film alimentaire et placez-le au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 4 heures.","Mettez la crème, le chocolat et la poudre de matcha dans une casserole et faites chauffer très doucement en remuant jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu et que le matcha soit bien mélangé. Laisser refroidir et épaissir pendant 10 minutes. Sortez le gâteau du réfrigérateur et déballer le moule. Retournez le gâteau sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette et retirez-le du moule et du film alimentaire. À l''aide d''un couteau à palette tenu à un angle de 90 degrés par rapport au côté du gâteau, grattez le pourtour pour éliminer tout excès de mousse et donner au gâteau une finition lisse. À l’aide de papier sulfurisé, créez un col serré, environ 2 cm plus haut que le gâteau. Versez le glaçage au chocolat refroidi sur le dessus, en le lissant jusqu''au bord – le col doit l''empêcher de couler sur les côtés. Réfrigérer encore 30 minutes ou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Retirez délicatement le collier en parchemin. Tenez une planche à découper (ou un autre objet avec un bord droit) sur la moitié du gâteau et saupoudrez la surface exposée de sucre glace. Disposez dessus des cerises fraîches et des fleurs de cerisier ou une autre fleur comestible, si vous le souhaitez, et servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9599,8587,'fr','Petits pains à la cardamome','Ce petit pain suédois épicé dégage un parfum floral intense issu des graines de cardamome, qui se retrouve dans la pâte pendant la cuisson.','["35 gousses de cardamome","350 ml de lait entier","200 g de beurre coupé en cubes","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","huile végétale ou huile de tournesol, pour graisser","1 gros oeuf, battu","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre perlé (disponible sur ocado.com)"]','["Cassez 10 gousses de cardamome avec un pilon et un mortier et versez-les dans une casserole. Ajouter le lait et réchauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fumant mais pas bouillant. Ajoutez 50 g de beurre (laissez le beurre restant à température ambiante pour ramollir) et laissez refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tiède, en remuant la poêle de temps en temps pour faire fondre le beurre.","Mettez la farine, 75 g de sucre, la levure, la cannelle et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol ou dans le bol d''un mixeur sur pied. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Une fois le lait refroidi, passez-le au tamis dans la farine en jetant la cardamome. A l''aide d''une cuillère en bois ou d''un crochet pétrisseur, mélangez pour former une pâte molle. Versez sur un plan de travail et pétrissez pendant 10 minutes, ou faites fonctionner le batteur sur pied pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse et extensible. Nettoyez le bol, graissez légèrement avec de l''huile, puis remettez la pâte dans le bol et retournez-la jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien enrobée d''huile. Couvrez le bol d''un torchon ou d''un film alimentaire et laissez lever 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume (vous pouvez le laisser reposer au réfrigérateur toute la nuit).","Cassez les gousses de cardamome restantes à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Ouvrez-les et remettez les graines dans le mortier, en jetant les gousses. Réduisez les graines en poudre, puis mélangez-les avec 150 g de sucre. Dans un bol, mélangez le reste du beurre avec tout le sucre à la cardamome sauf 2 cuillères à soupe.","Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Frappez la pâte pour chasser l''air, puis roulez-la pour former un rectangle d''environ 35 x 45 cm, avec le bord le plus long face à vous. Étalez le beurre de cardamome sur toute la surface, jusqu''aux bords. Pliez le tiers supérieur vers le milieu et le tiers inférieur vers le haut, comme une enveloppe, de manière à obtenir trois couches de pâte. Entaillez, puis coupez en 12 bandes égales mesurant environ 3,5 x 11 cm chacune. Coupez chaque bande au centre, en la laissant attachée en haut. Tournez chaque bande en l''éloignant du centre deux ou trois fois, puis nouez la pâte et rentrez les extrémités sous le pain. Mettez chacun sur le plateau une fois terminé.","Couvrir les deux plateaux d''une feuille de film alimentaire légèrement huilé et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 30 minutes à 1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils doublent presque de volume. Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.","Découvrez les petits pains et badigeonnez-les d''œuf battu, puis saupoudrez de sucre perlé. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés – échangez les plaques à mi-cuisson si elles dorent de manière inégale.","Versez le sucre de cardamome restant dans une casserole et ajoutez 50 ml d''eau. Porter à ébullition, puis retirer du feu et laisser refroidir en remuant pour dissoudre le sucre. Badigeonnez les petits pains de sirop deux ou trois fois pendant qu''ils refroidissent, laissez-les tremper 20 minutes avant de les déguster. Se conserve 2 jours dans un contenant hermétique ou se congèle 2 mois. Décongeler à température ambiante et réchauffer 5 minutes au four avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9600,8589,'fr','Biscuits au chocolat noir au tahini','Préparez votre propre tahini avec des graines de sésame noires ou blanches, cette recette vous montre comment. Les noirs ont une saveur plus sucrée et plus noisette, ce qui les rend parfaits pour la pâtisserie.','["50 g de beurre salé ramolli","125 g de sucre muscovado brun clair","125 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 œuf battu","200 g de farine autolevante","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","200 g de chocolat au lait cassé en morceaux","100 g de chocolat blanc fondu pour arroser","100 g de graines de sésame noires (disponibles chez Waitrose), plus un supplément pour la décoration","100 g d''huile sans saveur","30g de sirop d''érable"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le tahini noir. Faites griller les graines de sésame dans une petite poêle à feu doux jusqu''à ce que vous sentiez l''arôme du sésame. Transférer dans un mini processeur et blitzer. Versez l''huile progressivement jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte se forme. Ajoutez le sirop d''érable et mixez à nouveau. Verser dans un petit bol jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Dans un grand bol, battre le beurre et les sucres ensemble jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez l''œuf et 80 g de pâte de tahini noire et mélangez. Versez la farine, le cacao et les morceaux de chocolat au lait et battez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement incorporés.","À l''aide d''une cuillère à glace, formez une boule de pâte en 20 morceaux environ et déposez-la sur les plaques à pâtisserie. Appuyez légèrement sur chaque boule pour qu''elle soit un peu plus plate, en laissant beaucoup d''espace entre elles, car elles s''étaleront.","Cuire au four pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient encore tendres au milieu – ils durciront en refroidissant. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes sur les plaques avant de transférer sur des grilles pour refroidir complètement.","Une fois refroidis, versez des zigzags de chocolat blanc sur les biscuits et saupoudrez dessus de quelques graines de sésame noires. Se conserve 3 jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9601,8591,'fr','Tranches de filet de citron','Gâteau britannique classique du juge Bake Off, le filet de citron de Paul Hollywood est un simple plat cuit sur plateau, rendu très spécial avec un glaçage en plumes.','["70 g de beurre doux ramolli","120 g de sucre en poudre","2 œufs moyens","140 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","le zeste finement râpé d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe de crème de citron","2 cuillères à soupe de lait entier","30g de sucre semoule","jus d''1 citron","250 g de sucre glace","3 cuillères à soupe d''eau","une touche de colorant alimentaire jaune"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule carré de 20 x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé.","À l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battre le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles, légers et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs et mélangez à nouveau. Ajouter la farine, la levure chimique, le zeste de citron, la crème de citron et le lait et mélanger avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que tous les ingrédients soient bien mélangés. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent en ressorte propre.","Mélangez le sucre et le jus de citron et versez sur le gâteau chaud. Laisser refroidir dans le moule. Vous pouvez manger le gâteau tel quel, ou pour une finition raffinée, essayez de réaliser ce glaçage en plumes.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec juste assez d’eau pour obtenir un glaçage liquide, mais pas aqueux. Mettez une petite quantité de glaçage dans un bol séparé. Ajoutez quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire au glaçage jusqu''à ce qu''il soit jaune pâle. Verser dans une poche à douille jetable.","Retirez le gâteau du moule et décollez le papier sulfurisé. Posez le gâteau sur une grille au-dessus d''une plaque à pâtisserie. Étalez le glaçage blanc sur le dessus. Étalez de fines lignes de glaçage coloré sur toute la largeur du gâteau. Utilisez un bâton à cocktail pour faire glisser les lignes dans des directions opposées afin de créer un effet de plumes. Laisser reposer avant de couper en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:01:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9602,8593,'fr','Cheesecake aux amandes, bananes et myrtilles au four','Sucré avec des fruits naturels et un peu de sirop d''érable, ce cheesecake combine de la ricotta et du yaourt pour une texture faible en gras, mais riche et crémeuse.','["50 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","1 cuillère à café de sirop d''érable","75 g de galettes d''avoine finement réduites en miettes","40 g d''amande moulue","2 bananes","2 pots de 250 g de ricotta","Pot de 150 g de yaourt nature bio","4 gros œufs, battus","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","140g de myrtilles"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et graisser légèrement un moule à charnière antiadhésif rond de 20 cm. Faire fondre le beurre et le sirop dans une poêle, puis incorporer les flocons d''avoine et les amandes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien mélangés et enrobés. Pressez fermement au fond du moule pour obtenir une couche compacte, puis enfournez pendant 10 minutes. Retirer du four et augmenter à 240C/220C ventilateur/gaz 9.","Pour préparer la garniture, écrasez les bananes dans un grand bol. Ajoutez la ricotta, le yaourt, les œufs, le sirop, la vanille et les amandes, et battez avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Verser sur le fond, répartir sur les myrtilles et enfourner 10 minutes, puis baisser le four à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1/4 et cuire encore 30-35 minutes. Il devrait encore y avoir un peu de vacillement au milieu lorsque vous secouez doucement la boîte. Éteignez le four et laissez le cheesecake refroidir et prendre à l''intérieur. Refroidir avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9603,8595,'fr','Gâteau au lait aux noisettes','Donnez au gâteau au café une amélioration ultime : recouvrez-le de glaçage au chocolat et aux noisettes, ajoutez une garniture crémeuse et saupoudrez de noix concassées.','["100 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","Sachet de 100 g de noisettes grillées concassées","300 g de sucre mou roux clair","6 cuillères à soupe de lait demi-écrémé","1 cuillère à café de café instantané fin en poudre (voir astuce)","6 gros œufs, à température ambiante","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","175 g de farine nature","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café de café instantané en poudre fine","1 cuillère à soupe de liqueur Frangelico (noisette), ou utilisez du Kahlua ou du Tia Maria","400 g de mascarpone","300g de pâte à tartiner au chocolat aux noisettes (le Nutella a la meilleure texture pour cela)","1 cuillère à soupe de café instantané fin en poudre","50 g de noisettes grillées concassées","Pot de 150 ml de crème fraîche","4 cuillères à café de sucre glace","3 cuillères à soupe de lait demi-écrémé","1 cuillère à soupe de café instantané en poudre fine, dissoute dans 1 cuillère à café d''eau bouillante"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer généreusement deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm (idéalement environ 4,5 cm de profondeur ou plus) et tapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé. Mettez les noisettes dans un robot culinaire avec 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre, puis mixez jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement hachées. Ne vous attendez pas à ce qu’elles soient aussi fines que les amandes moulues et évitez une transformation excessive, car cela peut rendre les noix grasses.","Mettez le beurre, le lait et le café en poudre dans une petite casserole et faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu. Annuler.","Maintenant, démarrez l''éponge. Cassez les œufs dans le bol d''un batteur de table, ajoutez le reste du sucre et battez pendant 5 à 10 minutes (ou battez avec un batteur électrique à main dans un grand bol profond pendant 15 à 20 minutes) ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et gonflé, et que le mélange laisse une traînée qui dure quelques secondes. Il est très important que le mélange ait épaissi, presque doublé de volume, afin d''obtenir une éponge légère.","Mélangez la maïzena, la farine ordinaire et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel et tamisez sur le mélange fouetté. À l’aide d’une grande cuillère en métal, incorporez très soigneusement. Saupoudrez les arachides, puis incorporez-les également. Versez le mélange de lait chaud sur le bord du bol et pliez-le. Ne précipitez pas le pliage et continuez avec un léger mouvement de levage et de coupe jusqu''à ce que des rubans de liquide cessent d''apparaître. Répartissez la pâte entre les moules, puis enfournez pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne le milieu et soit dorée.","Détachez les côtés des gâteaux avec une spatule, puis laissez-les refroidir dans les moules sur une grille pendant 20 minutes (les gâteaux vont s''aplanir et éventuellement se froisser un peu, mais c''est normal). Retirer délicatement des moules et laisser refroidir, côté papier vers le bas.","Préparez le sirop et le glaçage en attendant. Mettez le sucre et 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans une petite casserole. Portez à ébullition et laissez reposer 1 min puis retirez du feu. Incorporer le café et l''alcool. Battre le mascarpone, la pâte à tartiner chocolat noisette et le café avec une cuillère en bois, jusqu''à obtenir un mélange soyeux et homogène.","Pour assembler, coupez les gâteaux froids horizontalement au milieu, à l''aide d''un long couteau dentelé. A l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie, humidifiez entièrement les surfaces coupées avec le sirop. Utilisez tout. Placez une couche de gâteau sur une assiette ou un support, côté coupé vers le haut. Verser 3 généreuses cuillerées de glaçage, puis étaler sur les bords avec un couteau à palette. Le glaçage doit avoir une profondeur d''environ 5 mm. Répétez avec les deux couches suivantes. Lorsque vous arrivez à la dernière couche, placez-la côté coupé vers le bas, afin que le dessus du gâteau soit lisse. Versez le reste du glaçage sur le dessus et les côtés du gâteau. La couche supérieure peut être fine. Nettoyez le couteau, puis utilisez-le pour presser un joli anneau de noix dans le glaçage sur le côté du gâteau. Brossez tout excédent.","Pour la garniture, mettez 3 cuillères à soupe de crème, 1 cuillère à café de sucre glace et 1 cuillère à soupe de lait dans un petit bol. Mettez le reste de la crème, du lait et du sucre, ainsi que la majeure partie du café dissous dans un bol plus grand. Fouettez la crème blanche, puis la crème au café, jusqu''à obtenir une mousse de cappuccino moelleuse, épaisse mais encore capable de s''écouler d''une cuillère. Versez la majeure partie de la crème au café sur le gâteau et poussez-la pour en recouvrir le dessus. Incorporez un peu plus de café dans ce qui reste, pour qu''il devienne quelques nuances plus foncées.","Pour décorer avec une forme caractéristique d''arbre au latte, chargez une cuillère à café pointue avec un peu de crème blanche. Commencez à la base de l’arbre, juste à droite du centre du gâteau. Enfoncez la cuillère dans la crème au café et laissez couler lentement la crème blanche. Pendant qu''elle coule, faites glisser la cuillère puis retirez-la doucement pour former une forme de feuille. Répétez avec plus de crème blanche sur la gauche pour faire une autre feuille, puis répétez 3 à 4 fois, en remontant le dessus du gâteau en passant des grandes feuilles aux petites. Utilisez la même technique pour balayer quelques formes d’arc autour du bord du motif.","Utilisez la crème noire pour ajouter des détails à chaque feuille – vous pouvez la peindre avec le bout d’une cuillère à café ou un bâton à cocktail propre. Utilisez un bâton à cocktail pour faire glisser les pointes de chaque feuille vers le haut et vers l''extérieur. Tracez une ligne du haut de « l’arbre » vers le bas pour terminer. Le gâteau se conserve jusqu''à 2 jours. Couvrez légèrement les bords coupés, mais évitez de recouvrir directement le gâteau car vous pourriez endommager la décoration. Servir au réfrigérateur ou à température ambiante fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:01:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9604,8597,'fr','Pain d''épices plus léger','Ce gâteau au gingembre noir et collant est rendu plus sain avec des dattes naturellement sucrées, du babeurre et beaucoup de cannelle et de gingembre frais.','["140 g de dattes entières séchées dénoyautées de préférence Medjool, coupées en petits morceaux","75 ml d''huile de colza, plus quelques gouttes pour graisser","75 g de mélasse noire","50g de sirop d''érable","1 cuillère à café de gingembre frais finement râpé","1 gros œuf","175 ml de babeurre","250 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","50 g de sucre muscovado noir"]','["Mettez les dattes dans un petit bol et versez dessus 125 ml d''eau bouillante. Laisser refroidir 30 mn. Huiler légèrement un moule à tarte de 28 x 19 x 3 cm, puis tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé.","Pendant ce temps, mettez l''huile, la mélasse noire, le sirop d''érable et le gingembre fraîchement râpé dans un bol et battez ensemble à la fourchette pour bien mélanger. Annuler. Battez l''œuf dans un petit bol et incorporez le babeurre. Dans un grand bol, mélangez la farine avec le bicarbonate de soude, le gingembre moulu, la cannelle et le sucre – frottez le mélange entre vos doigts pour décomposer les morceaux de sucre. Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.","Mixez les dattes et leur liquide en purée épaisse dans un petit robot culinaire.\r\nVersez l''œuf, les dattes et le mélange de mélasse dans le bol avec la farine. Mélangez brièvement avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé – le mélange sera mou comme une pâte épaisse. Versez-le dans le moule chemisé, nivelez délicatement le mélange et enfournez pendant 40 à 45 minutes. Pour vérifier si c’est cuit, insérez une brochette au centre – si la brochette ressort propre sans mélange cru dessus et que le gâteau est ferme mais élastique au toucher, cela devrait être cuit.","Laisser dans le moule quelques minutes avant de le déposer sur une grille, de décoller le papier sulfurisé et de laisser refroidir complètement. Si vous pouvez attendre, enveloppez-le bien dans du papier sulfurisé, puis dans du papier d''aluminium. Laissez agir une journée avant de couper, car il deviendra plus collant – il restera humide pendant 3 à 4 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9605,8599,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat végétalien facile','Cette pâtisserie végétalienne gourmande et fondante est surmontée d''un riche glaçage : vous ne devinerez jamais qu''elle est exempte de produits laitiers, d''œufs, de blé et de noix.','["un peu de pâte à tartiner au tournesol sans produits laitiers, pour graisser","1 gros avocat mûr (environ 150 g)","300 g de sucre muscovado léger","350 g de farine nature sans gluten","50 g de cacao en poudre de bonne qualité","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique sans gluten","400 ml de lait de soja non sucré","150 ml d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","85 g de chair d''avocat mûre écrasée","85 g de pâte à tartiner au tournesol sans produits laitiers","200 g de chocolat sans produits laitiers, 70 % de cacao, coupé en morceaux","25g de cacao en poudre","125 ml de lait de soja non sucré","200 g de sucre glace tamisé","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","Des pépites sans gluten et végétaliennes, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer 2 moules à sandwich de 20 cm, puis tapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé. Mettez l''avocat et le sucre dans un robot culinaire et fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez le reste des ingrédients du gâteau dans le bol avec 1/2 cuillère à café de sel fin et transformez à nouveau en une pâte liquide et veloutée. Répartir dans les moules et cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement levés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu des gâteaux en ressorte propre.","Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 5 minutes, puis retourner les gâteaux sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement. Pendant que vous attendez, commencez à préparer le glaçage. Battre ensemble la tartinade d''avocat et de tournesol avec des batteurs électriques jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse et lisse. Passer au tamis et réserver.","Faites fondre le chocolat au-dessus d''un bol d''eau ou au micro-ondes, puis laissez-le refroidir quelques minutes. Tamisez le cacao dans un grand bol. Portez le lait de soja à ébullition, puis incorporez-le progressivement au cacao jusqu''à consistance lisse. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes. Versez le mélange d''avocat, le sucre glace, le chocolat fondu et la vanille et continuez à mélanger pour obtenir un glaçage brillant et épais. Utilisez-le pour prendre en sandwich et garnir le gâteau. Couvrir de pépites ou de votre propre décoration, puis laisser reposer 10 minutes avant de trancher. Peut être préparé 2 jours à l''avance."]','2026-01-11 00:01:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9606,8601,'fr','Cruffins amandes et framboises','Croisez un croissant avec un muffin et vous obtiendrez ces pâtisseries beurrées, feuilletées et fruitées – parfaites pour un brunch ou une gourmandise gourmande','["1 cuillère à café de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","225 g de farine blanche forte, tamisée, plus un peu pour le façonnage","25 g de sucre en poudre doré","140 g de beurre froid non salé, coupé en morceaux de la taille d''un morceau de sucre","50g de beurre doux","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","50g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à café de farine nature","quelques gouttes d''extrait d''amande","1 jaune d''oeuf","quelques cuillères à soupe de confiture de framboises sans pépins","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Pour la pâtisserie, mesurez 75 ml d''eau juste tiède, ajoutez la levure et remuez pour la dissoudre. Mesurez encore 75 ml d''eau glacée et ajoutez-y le jus de citron. Mélangez la farine et le sucre avec 1/2 cuillère à café de sel fin dans un grand bol, puis ajoutez les cubes de beurre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient enrobés de farine. Versez l''eau de levure et l''eau citronnée sur le contenu du bol. À l''aide d''un couteau à lame ronde, travaillez rapidement pour obtenir une pâte grossière contenant des morceaux de beurre.","Déposez sur un plan de travail fariné, façonnez un rectangle trapu sans trop le pétrir, puis enveloppez-le dans du film alimentaire et réservez 15 min au congélateur.","Saupoudrez le plan de travail et la pâte de farine. Rouler la pâte dans un sens jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit 3 fois longue que large, soit environ 45 x 15 cm. Essayez de garder les côtés droits pendant que vous roulez et les bords supérieur et inférieur aussi carrés que possible.","Replier la pâte sur elle-même. Pliez le tiers inférieur vers le haut, puis le tiers supérieur vers le bas, pour former un bloc soigné. Tournez le bloc de manière à ce que son bord ouvert soit tourné vers la droite, comme un livre. Pressez délicatement les bords avec le rouleau à pâtisserie. Étalez et pliez la pâte ainsi 3 fois de plus pour obtenir une pâte lisse, avec quelques traînées de beurre ici et là. S''il est gras à un moment donné ou s''il devient élastique, couvrez et réfrigérez pendant 10 minutes avant de continuer. Enveloppez la pâte finie et réfrigérez pendant au moins 1 heure.","Pour préparer la garniture, battez ensemble tous les ingrédients et assaisonnez avec une pincée de sel. Réserver jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour façonner, déposez la pâte sur un plan de travail fariné. Coupez-le en deux au milieu et remettez une moitié au réfrigérateur. Roulez l''autre en un rectangle de 30 x 20 cm, puis coupez-le en 3 bandes de 10 cm de large chacune. Pour créer encore plus de couches, pliez chaque morceau en deux dans le sens de la longueur. Déposez une généreuse cuillère à café du mélange d''amandes à une extrémité de la pâte, puis enroulez la pâte autour en spirale. Placer, bord coupé vers le haut, dans un moule à muffins antiadhésif. Répétez l’opération pour faire 6 cruffins. Couvrir légèrement d''un film alimentaire. Peut être réfrigéré toute la nuit. (Il vous reste peut-être un peu de garniture, qui peut être congelée.)","Faire lever la pâte à température ambiante fraîche pendant 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte ait rempli les puits du moule. Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Cuire les cruffins pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et bien dorés. Retirer et laisser refroidir un peu sur une grille. Pour remplir de confiture, versez la confiture dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille de 5 mm, ou utilisez une bouteille souple du chef. Poussez la buse au milieu du cruffin et pressez. Saupoudrez les cruffins de sucre glace et dégustez frais ou tièdes le jour de la cuisson."]','2026-01-11 00:01:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9607,8603,'fr','Pain complet aux graines','Ce pain copieux et sain est riche en saveur et regorge de graines – essayez les graines de citrouille, de tournesol, de pavot ou de lin.','["400 g de farine à pain complète forte","100g de farine d''épeautre","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse noire","huile, pour graisser","50 g de graines mélangées (nous avons utilisé des graines de citrouille, de tournesol, de pavot et de lin)","1 jaune d''oeuf détaché à la fourchette"]','["Mélangez les deux farines dans un grand bol avec la levure et 1 cuillère à café de sel fin. Mélangez la mélasse avec 250 ml d’eau tiède jusqu’à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer la farine pour obtenir une pâte légèrement collante. Si vous devez ajouter plus d’eau, versez-la 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois.","Pétrir la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée pendant 10 minutes (ou au batteur sur table pendant 5 à 7 minutes). Votre pâte doit être lisse et élastique une fois prête. Placer la pâte dans un bol légèrement huilé, retourner la pâte\r\npour l''enduire d''huile, puis recouvrir d''une feuille de film alimentaire huilé. Laisser dans un endroit chaud jusqu’à ce que sa taille double – cela prendra environ 1 heure (voir note ci-dessous). Huiler légèrement un moule à cake de 900 g.","Une fois doublée de volume, pétrissez à nouveau la pâte pendant 3 à 5 minutes pour éliminer les bulles d''air – ajoutez la plupart des graines et incorporez-les à la pâte pendant que vous pétrissez. Façonnez la pâte en un ovale à peu près de la même longueur que votre moule. Placer dans le moule et laisser lever, recouvert d''un film alimentaire huilé, pendant 30 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il ait presque doublé de volume. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Enfoncez délicatement un doigt dans le pain pour vérifier s''il a suffisamment levé (voir astuce). Quand c’est prêt, badigeonnez le dessus du pain avec le jaune d’œuf et saupoudrez du reste des graines. Cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Si vous sortez le pain du moule et tapotez le fond, il devrait paraître creux. Laisser refroidir sur une grille au moins 30 minutes avant de trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:01:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9608,8605,'fr','Pain au levain facile','Ne soyez pas intimidé en préparant une entrée de pain au levain à la maison : cette version facile à préparer du jour au lendemain fait un délicieux pain.','["100 g de farine à pain blanche forte","100 g de farine de seigle noir bio","½ sachet de 7g de levure sèche à action rapide","400 g de farine à pain blanche forte","½ sachet de 7g de levure sèche à action rapide"]','["Pour réaliser votre entrée, placez tous les ingrédients dans un bol et ajoutez 250 ml d''eau froide. Mélangez soigneusement avec une cuillère jusqu''à obtenir un mélange spongieux, puis couvrez d''un film alimentaire et laissez à température ambiante au moins une nuit, mais jusqu''à 24 heures si vous avez le temps.","Pour faire la pâte à pain, versez les ingrédients dans un bol propre et ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de sel fin, 200 ml d''eau froide et votre entrée. Rassemblez tous les ingrédients pour obtenir une pâte, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si elle est trop ferme, puis versez-la sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrissez pendant au moins 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse, élastique et élastique (cela prendra 5 à 7 minutes dans un mixeur avec un crochet pétrisseur). Placer la pâte dans un bol propre légèrement huilé, couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser doubler de volume – environ 1 h à température ambiante, 3 h au réfrigérateur (voir conseils ci-dessous).","Versez la pâte sur une surface farinée et formez doucement un rond – vous ne voulez pas faire sortir trop d’air de la pâte. Saupoudrez généreusement un morceau de papier sulfurisé de farine et déposez la pâte dessus. Couvrir d''un torchon et laisser lever 1 h jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Placez une plaque à pâtisserie plate et solide sur la grille centrale du four et une plaque plus petite avec les côtés en dessous. Saupoudrez la pâte de farine et coupez-la avec un couteau tout usage. Faites glisser le pain sur le plateau chaud du dessus et jetez quelques glaçons (ou versez de l''eau froide) sur le plateau du dessous – cela crée un jet de vapeur, qui aide le pain à former une belle croûte. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le pain semble creux lorsqu''on le tape sur le fond. Laissez le pain refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9609,8607,'fr','Tourbillons de fromage et pesto','Ces petits pains à partager aux herbes contiennent de la mozzarella et des tomates séchées au soleil – parfaits pour un pique-nique ou pour tremper dans une soupe.','["450 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un filet","Pot de 150 g de pesto frais","Pot de 240 g de tomates mi-séchées, égouttées et hachées grossièrement","100 g de mozzarella râpée (la mozzarella déjà râpée est préférable car elle est plus sèche que fraîche)","50 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), râpé","une poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Mélangez la farine, la levure, le sucre et 1 1/2 cuillère à café de sel fin dans un grand bol à mélanger ou dans le bol d''un mixeur de table. Mesurez 300 ml d''eau tiède et ajoutez environ 280 ml à la farine, ainsi que l''huile d''olive, et commencez à mélanger jusqu''à ce que les ingrédients commencent à s''agglutiner pour former une pâte. Si la pâte semble un peu sèche, ajoutez le reste d''eau. Une fois mélangé, pétrissez 10 min à la main sur votre plan de travail, ou 5 min à vitesse moyenne dans un mixeur. La pâte est prête lorsqu''elle est molle, élastique et élastique. Nettoyez le bol, arrosez d''un peu d''huile, puis remettez la pâte dedans, en la retournant et en enduisant les parois du bol d''huile. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé et réserver dans un endroit chaud pour doubler de volume – cela prendra 1 à 3 heures, selon la température.","Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Découvrez la pâte et frappez-la plusieurs fois avec votre poing, en éliminant toutes les bulles d''air. Déposez-le sur un plan de travail fariné et saupoudrez également le dessus d''un peu de farine, s''il est collant. Etalez la pâte en un rectangle d''environ 40 x 30 cm. Étalez le pesto sur la pâte, puis répartissez-le sur les tomates, les fromages et le basilic. Rouler la pâte depuis l''un des côtés les plus longs pour former un long boudin.","Utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour couper la pâte en 12 morceaux égaux. Placer sur la plaque à pâtisserie, côté coupé vers le haut, en formation de 3 par 4, en vous assurant que l''extrémité ouverte de chaque rouleau est rentrée vers le centre de la disposition – cela les empêchera de se dérouler pendant la cuisson. Laissez un peu d''espace entre chaque rouleau car ils grandiront et se toucheront au fur et à mesure. Couvrir légèrement d''un film alimentaire huilé et laisser lever pendant 30 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il double à nouveau de volume. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Découvrez le pain lorsqu''il est gonflé. Cuire au four sur la grille du milieu pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et que le centre ait l''air sec et non pâteux. Sortir du four et laisser refroidir au moins 10 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:01:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9610,8609,'fr','Brownies au caramel salé','Faites passer les brownies au chocolat gourmands et fondants au niveau supérieur avec une couche de caramel salé au centre de chaque bouchée.','["200 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","100 g de chocolat, 70% de cacao","100 g de chocolat, 50% de cacao","Boîte de 397 g de caramel aux œillets","1 cuillère à café de sel de mer feuilleté, plus un peu plus pour le dessus","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs moyens, à température ambiante","100 g de farine nature, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","50g de cacao en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer puis tapisser un moule carré de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole moyenne, incorporez tout le chocolat, puis retirez la casserole du feu et attendez que les cubes fondent.","Dans un petit bol, mélangez 175 g de caramel avec 1 cuillère à café de sel marin – il va se détendre. Mettez le reste du caramel dans un grand bol avec le sucre et les œufs, et battez avec un batteur électrique à main ou un fouet ballon jusqu''à consistance homogène.","Incorporer le chocolat et le beurre. Dans un autre bol, mélangez la farine, le cacao et une bonne pincée de sel de table, puis tamisez le tout sur le mélange chocolaté. Battre brièvement jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Versez la moitié de la pâte à brownie dans le moule et nivelez-la avec une spatule. À l''aide d''une cuillère à café, déposez la moitié du caramel salé sur la couche de pâte en 5 bandes épaisses et régulièrement espacées. Versez le reste de la pâte à brownie dessus et lissez-la en essayant de ne pas perturber le caramel en dessous. Garnir avec le reste du caramel de la même façon en rayures. Faites glisser une brochette ou la pointe d''un couteau dans le caramel pour créer un motif de plumes sur le dessus.","Saupoudrez d''un peu plus de sel marin, puis faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il lève jusqu''au milieu avec une croûte ferme sur le dessus. Une fois prêt, le brownie tremblera un peu lorsque vous secouerez le moule. Laissez-le refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis coupez-le en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9611,8611,'fr','Pain de singe','Cette friandise américaine à démonter est collante, épicée et farcie de noix de pécan – un petit-déjeuner, un brunch ou un dessert gourmand à partager.','["200 ml de lait demi-écrémé","85g de beurre doux","2 gros œufs","550 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour pétrir si vous le faites à la main","2½ cuillères à café de levure sèche à action rapide","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","huile, pour graisser","125 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de muscade moulue","225 g de sucre muscovado léger","140 g de noix de pécan grillées puis hachées grossièrement","100 g de sucre glace tamisé","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à soupe de lait demi-écrémé","pincée de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre non salé, fondu"]','["Commencez par la pâte. Mettez le lait et le beurre dans une casserole moyenne et faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le beurre fonde et que le lait mijote. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes, puis incorporer les œufs à la fourchette. Mélangez les ingrédients secs dans un grand bol avec 1 1/2 cuillère à café de sel fin, puis ajoutez le liquide et remuez pour obtenir une pâte collante. Laisser reposer 5 minutes, puis verser sur un plan de travail fariné et pétrir pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et élastique. Utilisez un peu d''huile pour graisser un grand bol, ajoutez la pâte, retournez-la dans l''huile pour l''enrober, puis couvrez le bol de film alimentaire. Laisser dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. Pétrir dans un mixeur de table avec un crochet pétrisseur si vous préférez.","Pour assembler, graissez un moule à gâteau de 25 cm avec du beurre. Faites fondre le reste du beurre dans une poêle. Dans un bol moyen, mélangez les épices et le sucre ainsi qu''une pincée de sel. Versez 2 cuillères à soupe de beurre fondu, 3 cuillères à soupe de sucre épicé et 4 cuillères à soupe de noix de pécan au fond du moule.","Tirez la pâte en 65 petits morceaux environ et roulez-la en boules. Par 4 ou 5 à la fois, plongez les boules de pâte dans le beurre fondu, laissez égoutter l''excédent, puis versez-les dans le sucre épicé. Rouler pour bien enrober, puis mettre au hasard dans le moule. Répétez jusqu’à ce qu’il y ait une couche complète de pâte dans le moule. Parsemer avec le reste des noix hachées, puis continuer à remplir le moule avec les boules de pâte enrobées. Versez les restes de sucre et de beurre sur la pâte. Peut être congelé maintenant jusqu''à 1 mois. Décongeler au réfrigérateur puis laisser lever.","Couvrir la poêle d''un film alimentaire huilé puis laisser lever dans un endroit tiède pendant 1 h, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit levée et que la pâte ne rebondisse plus lorsque vous la piquez.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Cuire le pain de singe pendant 35 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien levé et doré. Laissez la poêle refroidir pendant 5 minutes, puis donnez un coup sec sur le comptoir. Laisser dans le moule jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste chaud.","Fouettez tous les ingrédients ensemble pour réaliser le glaçage. Il épaissira à mesure que le beurre fondu refroidira. Retournez le pain de singe sur une assiette de service, puis arrosez-le de glaçage. Laissez-le reposer, si vous pouvez supporter l’attente."]','2026-01-11 00:01:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9612,8613,'fr','Cheesecake savoureux au citron','Un pud simple mais très impressionnant, suffisamment léger pour avoir une tranche pour terminer un gros repas','["225g de biscuits digestifs","100 g de beurre fondu","250 g de mascarpone en pot","600 g de fromage à pâte molle","2 œufs et 2 jaunes","le zeste de 3 citrons, le jus de 1","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","175 g de sucre en poudre","½ pot de 284 ml de crème sure","3 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","poignée de framboises, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4.\r\nTapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm\r\nmouler avec du papier sulfurisé. Donnez un pourboire au\r\ndes biscuits et du beurre fondu dans un aliment\r\nprocesseur, puis blitz pour bien faire\r\ndes miettes. Presser dans le moule et réfrigérer.","Fouetter tous les autres ingrédients\r\nun grand bol jusqu''à ce que complètement\r\nmélanger, verser dans le moule, puis enfourner\r\npendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le cheesecake\r\na une oscillation uniforme.","Éteignez le four et laissez le gâteau\r\nà l''intérieur jusqu''à refroidissement. Quand c''est complètement\r\nrefroidi, retirer du moule et recouvrir\r\navec de la crème sure. Crème de citron tourbillonnante\r\npar-dessus et décorer avec\r\ndes framboises, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9613,8615,'fr','Petits cupcakes à la rose et aux amandes','Jolie comme image, mais très simple. Ajoutez un drapeau en papier et ceux-ci serviront également de noms de lieux ou de faveurs lors d''un mariage.','["140 g de farines autolevantes","100 g d''amandes moulues","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","175 g de sucre en poudre","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","3 gros œufs","100g de yaourt nature","175g de beurre fondu","100 g de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer et coller le sirop","350 g de glaçage prêt à rouler","175 g de pâte d''amande","colorants alimentaires vert, jaune et rose"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4 et\r\ntapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous avec le cupcake\r\nou des caissettes à muffins. Mélangez la farine, les amandes,\r\nla levure chimique et le sucre ensemble dans un\r\ngrand bol. Battre l''extrait d''amande et\r\nœufs dans le yaourt, puis versez-le dans le\r\ningrédients secs avec le beurre. Fouet\r\nensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient sans grumeaux, puis divisez\r\nentre les cas. Cuire au four pendant 18-22 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette enfoncée en ressorte propre.\r\nLaisser refroidir sur une grille. Les gâteaux vont geler\r\npendant 1 mois maximum.","Étalez la pâte d''amande sur une surface\r\nsaupoudré d''un peu de sucre glace, jusqu''à environ\r\nl''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. En utilisant un 6 cm\r\nemporte-pièce rond, tamponner 12 cercles,\r\nreroulage et estampage des chutes si\r\nnécessaire. Mélangez suffisamment de sucre glace\r\nune tasse d''eau pour obtenir un glaçage sirupeux, puis\r\nbadigeonner le dos des cercles de massepain\r\net coller sur les gâteaux.","Pétrir un peu de colorant alimentaire jaune\r\nun quart du glaçage prêt à rouler, un peu\r\nrose dans un autre quart et vert dans\r\nun autre quart. Enveloppez le glaçage vert\r\net réservez, puis répétez l''étape 2 à l''aide d''un\r\nUn emporte-pièce de 7 cm pour découper 4 cercles chacun dans le glaçage rose, jaune et blanc,\r\ncoller à nouveau avec du sirop.","Mélangez suffisamment d''eau dans les 100 g de glaçage\r\nsucre pour donner un glaçage assez ferme. Diviser en\r\ntrois, laissez-en un blanc et coloriez le\r\nd''autres roses et jaunes – faites-les\r\ncouleurs un peu plus foncées pour que les roses tiennent debout\r\ndehors. Transférez le glaçage dans des petits sacs alimentaires,\r\ntournez le dessus pour sceller et coupez uniquement le\r\nla plus petite pointe d’un coin de chaque sac. Tuyau\r\nspirales sur les gâteaux, mélangeant les couleurs.\r\nPincez de petits morceaux de glaçage vert dans\r\nfeuilles, en marquant la nervure avec un cure-dent\r\nsi tu veux. Ajoutez 1, 2 ou 3 feuilles à chacune\r\nspirale pour qu''elle ressemble à une rose (vous pouvez utiliser\r\nle glaçage sirupeux pour les aider à coller si vous\r\nbesoin). Il est préférable de manger les gâteaux à l''intérieur\r\n2 jours, et une fois décoré se conserve\r\n1 à 2 jours dans des contenants hermétiques."]','2026-01-11 00:01:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9614,8617,'fr','Carrés au chocolat et au fudge à l''orange','Brownies au chocolat riches avec une garniture orange légère façon gâteau aux carottes','["200 g de chocolat noir cassé en cubes (nous avons utilisé du Bournville)","200 g de sucre muscovado noir","175 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","3 œufs, séparés","140 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","le zeste d''1 orange","Pot de 200 g de fromage à pâte molle (j''ai utilisé Philadelphia Extra Light)","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","50g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et chemiser un moule à tarte de 23 x 23 cm.\r\nou à peu près. Mettez le chocolat,\r\nsucre et beurre dans une poêle, puis faites chauffer très\r\ndoucement pendant environ 5 minutes, en remuant toutes les minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le beurre et le chocolat soient\r\nfondu. Laisser refroidir 10 mn. Battre\r\ndans les jaunes d''œufs, la farine, la vanille et la moitié du\r\nzeste d''orange.","Mettez les blancs d''œufs dans un grand récipient très\r\nnettoyer le bol, puis fouetter jusqu''à ce qu''ils tiennent debout\r\nen sommets. Incorporer ¼ des blancs dans le\r\nmélange de chocolat pour le détendre, puis délicatement\r\nincorporer le reste avec une cuillère en métal. Verser\r\nverser le mélange dans le moule, puis enfourner 25 min\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément levé et juste ferme à la\r\ntoucher. Refroidissez dans le moule, puis coupez en carrés.\r\nPeut être congelé jusqu''à 1 mois.","Battre ensemble le fromage, la vanille, le sucre\r\net le zeste restant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Propagation\r\nsur chaque carré de chocolat et servir. Si\r\ntu avances, étale la garniture\r\njuste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9615,8619,'fr','Quiche Lorraine Ultime','La clé pour réaliser une quiche parfaite est la simplicité, comme vous pouvez le constater avec cette savoureuse recette.','["175 g de farine nature","100 g de beurre froid coupé en morceaux","1 jaune d''oeuf","200 g de lardon non fumé ou fumé","50g Gruyère","200ml carton crème fraîche","200 ml de crème fraîche","3 œufs bien battus","pincée de muscade moulue"]','["Pour la pâte, mettez la farine, le beurre, le jaune d''oeuf et 4 cuillères à café d''eau froide dans un robot culinaire. À l’aide du bouton Pulse, mélangez jusqu’à ce que le mélange se lie. Versez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée, rassemblez-la en une boule lisse, puis étalez-la aussi finement que possible. Tapisser un moule à flan cannelé à fond lâche de 23 x 2,5 cm, en glissant la pâte dans le fond. Coupez les bords de la pâte avec des ciseaux (conservez les chutes) pour qu''elle repose légèrement au-dessus du moule (si elle rétrécit, elle ne doit plus descendre en dessous du niveau du moule). Presser la pâte dans les flûtes, piquer légèrement le fond avec une fourchette, puis réfrigérer 10 min. Mettre une plaque à pâtisserie au four et chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.","Tapisser le fond de tarte de papier d''aluminium, côté brillant vers le bas, remplir de haricots secs et enfourner sur la plaque chaude pendant 15 minutes. Retirez le papier d''aluminium et les haricots et faites cuire encore 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit légèrement dorée. Si vous remarquez des petits trous ou fissures, colmatez-les avec des chutes de pâtisserie. Vous pouvez rattraper ce point un jour à l’avance.","Pendant la cuisson de la pâtisserie, préparez la garniture. Faites chauffer une petite poêle, versez-y les lardons et faites revenir quelques minutes. Égouttez le liquide qui en sort, puis poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que les lardons commencent à peine à se colorer mais ne soient plus croustillants. Retirer et égoutter sur du papier absorbant. Coupez les trois quarts du fromage en petits dés et râpez finement le reste. Répartir les dés de fromage et les lardons frits sur le fond du fond de tarte.","A l''aide d''une cuillère, battre la crème fraîche pour la détendre puis incorporer lentement la crème épaisse. Incorporer les œufs battus. Assaisonnez (vous ne devriez pas avoir besoin de beaucoup de sel) et ajoutez la muscade. Versez les trois quarts de la garniture dans le fond de tarte.","Retirez à moitié la grille du four et placez le moule à flan sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Versez rapidement le reste de la garniture dans le fond de tarte – vous l''obtiendrez ainsi jusqu''au sommet. Répartissez le fromage râpé sur le dessus, puis remettez délicatement la grille dans le four. Baissez le four à 190°C/ventilateur 170°C/gaz 5. Cuire au four environ 25 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et légèrement pris (le centre ne doit pas être trop ferme). Laissez reposer la quiche pendant 4 à 5 minutes, puis retirez-la du moule. Servir fraîchement cuit, même s''il est également bon froid."]','2026-01-11 00:01:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9616,4961,'fr','Délicieuse recette de gâteau aux carottes','Faites plaisir à vos amis avec un thé de l''après-midi qui comprend ce gâteau aux carottes facile. Vous pouvez faire cuire le gâteau, le congeler et simplement l''arroser de glaçage le jour même.','["175 g de sucre muscovado léger","175 ml d''huile de tournesol","3 gros œufs légèrement battus","140g de carottes râpées (environ 3 moyennes)","100g de raisins secs","le zeste râpé d''une grosse orange","175 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de muscade râpée (fraîchement râpée vous donnera la meilleure saveur)","175 g de sucre glace","1½-2 cuillères à soupe de jus d''orange"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180C/Gaz 4/ventilateur 160C. Huiler et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à gâteau carré de 18 cm de papier sulfurisé. Le moyen le plus simple de procéder est de couper deux longues bandes de la largeur de la boîte et de placer chaque bande en travers,\r\nrecouvrant le fond et les côtés de la boîte, avec une double couche dans le fond.","Versez le sucre dans un grand bol, versez l''huile et ajoutez les œufs. Mélangez légèrement avec une cuillère en bois. Incorporer les carottes râpées, les raisins secs et le zeste d''orange.","Mélanger la farine, le bicarbonate de\r\nle soda et les épices, puis tamisez-les dans le\r\nbol. Mélangez légèrement tout le\r\ningrédients – quand tout\r\nest uniformément fusionné.\r\nmélanger.\r\nLe mélange sera assez mou\r\net presque coulant.","Versez le mélange dans le\r\nmoule préparé et cuire au four pendant 40-\r\n45 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme\r\net élastique quand on appuie dessus\r\nle centre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5\r\nminutes, puis démoulez, épluchez\r\nretirer du papier et laisser refroidir sur un fil\r\nsupport. (Vous pouvez congeler le gâteau à\r\nce point.)","Battre ensemble le glaçage\r\ningrédients dans un petit bol jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse – vous voulez le glaçage\r\nà peu près aussi liquide qu''une simple crème.\r\nDisposez le gâteau sur une assiette de service\r\net arrosez hardiment le glaçage\r\net en arrière en lignes diagonales sur\r\nle dessus, en le laissant couler sur les côtés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9617,8621,'fr','Cupcakes au citron et aux graines de pavot','Ces cupcakes piquants sont si magnifiques que vous ne voudrez plus les manger, mais une fois que vous aurez commencé, vous ne pourrez plus vous arrêter.','["225 g de farines autolevantes","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","zester 2 citrons","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de pavot, grillées","3 œufs","100g de yaourt nature","175g de beurre fondu et un peu refroidi","225 g de beurre ramolli","400 g de sucre glace tamisé","jus d''1 citron","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire jaune","fleurs en glaçage ou pépites jaunes, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4\r\net tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de cupcake\r\nou des caissettes à muffins. Mélangez la farine, le sucre,\r\nle zeste de citron et les graines de pavot ensemble\r\nun grand bol à mélanger. Battez les œufs dans\r\nle yaourt, puis versez-le dans le sec\r\ningrédients avec le beurre fondu. Mélanger\r\navec une cuillère en bois ou un fouet\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de grumeaux, puis divisez-le entre les\r\ncas. Cuire au four pendant 20-22 minutes jusqu''à l''obtention d''une brochette\r\nune fois enfoncé, il ressort propre – les gâteaux seront\r\nêtre encore assez pâle sur le dessus. Refroidir 5 minutes\r\ndans la boîte, puis soulevez délicatement sur un fil\r\ngrille pour terminer le refroidissement.","Pour glacer, battre le beurre ramolli jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien mou dans un grand bol, puis progressivement\r\nincorporer le sucre glace et le jus de citron.\r\nIncorporer suffisamment de colorant alimentaire pour obtenir une couleur pâle.\r\ncouleur citron, puis versez le glaçage dans\r\nune poche à douille avec une grosse douille étoile.","Glacer un gâteau à la fois, en tenant le\r\npoche à douille presque à la verticale avec la douille\r\nà environ 1 cm de la surface du gâteau.\r\nDisposez une spirale de glaçage sur le pourtour,\r\npuis faites une pause pour interrompre le flux avant\r\ndéplacer la buse vers le centre\r\nlégèrement et sifflant une seconde, plus petite\r\nspirale qui continue jusqu''à ce qu''il y ait\r\npas de vide au centre. Légèrement « point »\r\nla buse dans le glaçage lorsque vous vous arrêtez\r\npresser pour finir proprement. Répétez pour couvrir\r\ntous les gâteaux, puis garnir de sucre\r\ndécorations ou parsemer de pépites."]','2026-01-11 00:01:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9618,8623,'fr','Crumble rhubarbe & poire','Il a une belle garniture croustillante au goût de flapjack, un aliment réconfortant parfait.','["3 poires mûres","600 g de rhubarbe","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","le zeste et le jus finement râpés d''1 orange","200g de farine complète","200 g de beurre froid coupé en dés","140 g de cassonade molle et claire","50 g de muesli ou de porridge d''avoine","25 g de céréales pour petit-déjeuner Raisin-Noix ou Grappes"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Pour le topping, mélanger tous les ingrédients et frotter avec les doigts jusqu''à obtenir une pâte rugueuse, puis réserver au réfrigérateur.","Épluchez les poires et coupez-les en gros morceaux, puis coupez la rhubarbe en bâtonnets de la longueur d''un doigt. Versez dans un grand plat allant au four et mélangez avec le sucre, le zeste et le jus d''orange. Émietter la garniture et cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et bouillonnante sur les côtés. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes avant de verser dans des bols et de servir avec une crème anglaise ou de la glace."]','2026-01-11 00:01:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9619,8625,'fr','Plateau de tarte aux framboises et aux amandes','Un mélange fouetté au robot culinaire constitue la base et la garniture de cette cuisson.','["250 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues","200 g de beurre coupé en dés","280 g de sucre semoule doré","50g de noix de coco desséchée","2 œufs moyens","350-450g/12oz-1lb de framboises fraîches ou surgelées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake oblong (environ 31 x 17 x 3 cm). Versez la farine, la poudre d''amandes, le beurre et le sucre dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit uniformément réparti – ou frottez ensemble à la main. Retirez 85 g du mélange, incorporez la noix de coco et réservez. Ajoutez les œufs au reste du mélange dans le robot culinaire et fouettez rapidement – ​​ou mélangez avec une cuillère en bois. Il n’est pas nécessaire que ce soit très fluide.","Étalez ce mélange sur le fond du moule, puis répartissez la moitié des framboises sur le dessus. Saupoudrer du mélange de noix de coco et enfourner 45 min. Disposez le reste des fruits sur la surface et laissez cuire encore 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes au toucher. Refroidissez dans le moule et coupez en tranches, en carrés, selon la forme souhaitée. Ils se conservent jusqu''à 2 jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:01:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9620,8626,'fr','Gâteaux Banbury','Le gâteau Banbury règne dans les Midlands. Essayez cette recette rapide pour une gâterie à l''heure du thé, délicieuse avec une tasse d''Earl Grey','["50 g de beurre doux, ramolli","1 cuillère à soupe de miel anglais","½ cuillère à café de muscade fraîchement râpée","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","100g de groseilles","50 g d''écorces d''orange confites","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","Paquet de 500 g de pâte feuilletée pur beurre","1 blanc d''oeuf battu","1 à 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre concassé ou de morceaux de sucre concassé"]','["Crémer le beurre et le miel ensemble\r\navec les épices. Ajoutez les groseilles et le\r\nécorces confites et bien mélanger. À la légère\r\nsurface farinée, étalez la pâte jusqu''au\r\népaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £ et découpez 10 x\r\nCercles de 10 cm en reroulant les éventuelles chutes.\r\nRépartissez la garniture entre les cercles.","Remonter les bords de la pâte pour\r\nenfermer la garniture et sertir les bords\r\nde la pâtisserie ensemble pour ressembler à un petit\r\nsacs à main. Retournez les colis, avec le\r\nse plie en dessous. Déroulez chaque parcelle\r\ndoucement jusqu''à obtenir une forme ovale, en prenant soin de ne pas\r\npour exposer le remplissage.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.\r\nDisposez les gâteaux sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée\r\navec du papier antiadhésif. Badigeonner avec l''oeuf\r\nblanc et saupoudrer de sucre. Cuisiner pour\r\n25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits et croustillants. Tourner\r\nbaissez le four si le dessus dore trop vite.","Une fois cuit, transférer sur une grille\r\net laisser refroidir un peu avant de déguster.\r\nLorsqu’ils sont froids, ils sont excellents à tartiner\r\navec un peu de beurre salé."]','2026-01-11 00:01:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9621,8628,'fr','Pain aux courgettes et aux champignons','Un excellent accompagnement pour les soupes et les salades ou tout simplement servi chaud avec un peu de beurre','["3 courgettes moyennes, râpées","2 cuillères à café de sel","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","100 g de champignons châtaignes hachés","350 g de farine nature","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche facile à mélanger","2 cuillères à soupe de basilic frais haché","½ cuillère à soupe de gros sel marin, pour saupoudrer"]','["Mettez les courgettes râpées dans une passoire et saupoudrez d''1 cuillère à café de sel. Laisser reposer 20 minutes, puis, à l''aide de vos mains, essorer le plus d''humidité possible. Rincez soigneusement les courgettes, puis pressez-les à nouveau.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle et faites revenir l''oignon et l''ail pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter les champignons et cuire encore 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et dorés, puis ajouter les courgettes et cuire encore 2 minutes. Bien filtrer et laisser refroidir; jeter le liquide.","Chauffer le four à 220C/ventilateur 200C/gaz 7. Mettre la farine dans un grand bol, incorporer la levure, le reste de l''huile et le sel, le basilic et le mélange de courgettes. Bien mélanger pour combiner. Faites un puits au centre et ajoutez 125 ml d''eau tiède. Bien mélanger pour former une pâte légèrement collante. Pétrir sur une surface farinée pendant environ \r\n10 minutes, puis formez une boule et placez-la sur une plaque à pâtisserie graissée.","Aplatissez très légèrement la boule de pâte avec la paume de la main et recouvrez-la légèrement d''un film alimentaire huilé. Laisser lever dans un endroit tiède pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. Badigeonnez le dessus de la pâte d''un peu d''eau, puis saupoudrez de sel marin et enfournez pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée. Laisser refroidir sur une grille avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9622,9448,'fr','Gâteau brownie au chocolat','Invitez les enfants à cuisiner le week-end en préparant ce délicieux gâteau au brownie, bien meilleur que celui acheté en magasin','["100g de beurre","175 g de sucre en poudre","75 g de sucre roux ou muscovado","125 g de chocolat (nature ou au lait)","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait/essence de vanille","100 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 20 cm.","Mettez le beurre, le sucre en poudre, la cassonade, le chocolat et le sirop doré dans la poêle et faites fondre doucement à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit lisse et sans grumeaux.","Retirez la casserole du feu.","Cassez les œufs dans le bol et fouettez avec la fourchette jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légers et mousseux. 5 Ajoutez les œufs, l''extrait ou l''essence de vanille,\r\najouter la farine, la levure chimique et le cacao en poudre au mélange chocolaté et bien mélanger.","Versez le mélange dans le moule à gâteau beurré et chemisé et placez-le sur la grille du milieu du four. Cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes.","Retirer et laisser refroidir 20 à 30 minutes avant de couper en quartiers et de servir.","Servir avec de la crème ou de la glace et beaucoup de fruits frais."]','2026-01-11 00:01:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9623,8630,'fr','Gâteaux au citron','La version mini et extra merveilleuse de notre recette la plus populaire, le gâteau au citron','["250 g de beurre ramolli","400 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs légèrement battus","250 g de farines autolevantes","le zeste et le jus de 3 citrons"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nTapisser un moule à muffins de 12 caissettes à muffins.\r\nAvec un fouet électrique, fouettez le beurre,\r\n250g de sucre, œufs, farine, zeste de\r\n2 citrons et le jus d''1 citron jusqu''à\r\njuste combiné – ne fouettez pas trop. Diviser\r\nentre les cas (ils seront assez\r\nplein), puis faites cuire sur une grille du milieu pendant\r\n30 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette enfoncée arrive\r\npropre.","Laisser refroidir 10 minutes, puis transférer les gâteaux dans\r\nune grille de refroidissement sur un plateau et piquez chacun un\r\nquelques fois avec une brochette. Verser le reste\r\njus de citron sur les 150 g de sucre restants\r\net zester 1 citron, et aussitôt cuillère\r\nsur les gâteaux. Laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9624,8632,'fr','Pouding au pain','Cette pâtisserie simple est délicieuse avec du thé, de la crème anglaise ou de la glace en dessert.','["500 g de pain blanc ou complet","500 g de fruits secs mélangés","85 g de zestes mélangés","1 ½ cuillère à soupe d''épices mélangées","600 ml de lait","2 gros œufs, battus","140 g de sucre muscovado léger","le zeste d''1 citron (facultatif)","100 g de beurre fondu","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara"]','["Déchirez le pain dans un grand bol à mélanger\r\net ajoutez les fruits, le zeste et les épices. Verser\r\nle lait, puis remuez ou froissez\r\nvos doigts pour bien mélanger le tout et\r\nbriser complètement le pain. Ajoutez les œufs,\r\nmuscovado et zeste de citron si vous en utilisez. Remuer\r\nbien, puis laissez tremper 15 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule de 20 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau carré antiadhésif (pas un avec\r\nune base lâche). Incorporer le beurre fondu\r\nle mélange à pudding, versez-le dans le moule, puis\r\nparsemer de démerara. Enfourner pendant 1h30\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes et dorés, en les recouvrant de papier d''aluminium\r\ns''il commence à trop dorer. Dégagez-vous\r\nde la boîte et retirez le papier. Couper en\r\ncarrés et servir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:01:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9625,8634,'fr','Tarte à la crème avec pâte à la muscade','Il y a quelque chose de si honnête dans une tarte à la crème, simplement garnie d''une râpée de muscade','["Paquet de 500 g de pâte brisée","1 noix de muscade entière, à râper","4 gros œufs","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","300 ml de crème fraîche","300 ml de lait entier","1 gousse de vanille, graines grattées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nEtalez la pâte sur environ 1 cm d''épaisseur,\r\npuis râper sur un saupoudrage de muscade\r\nà l''aide d''une râpe fine. Pliez la pâte en deux,\r\npuis étalez à nouveau, jusqu''à l''épaisseur de\r\n2 pièces de 1 £ et assez grandes pour aligner un\r\nBoîte à sandwich à fond mobile de 20 cm avec\r\nun certain surplomb. Presser la pâte dans le\r\nétain (en laissant l''excédent drapé sur le\r\ncôtés), déposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et réfrigérer\r\npendant 10 minutes. Tapisser la pâte de cuisson\r\npapier sulfurisé et remplir de fèves au four.\r\nEnfourner 20 mn puis retirer les haricots\r\net du papier. Cuire encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré et sablonneux partout. Couper les bords\r\nde la tarte avec un couteau dentelé bien aiguisé.","Baisser le four à 150°C/130°C ventilé/\r\ngaz 2. Battre ensemble les œufs et le sucre\r\ndans un grand bol. Mettez la crème, le lait,\r\ngousse de vanille et graines dans une casserole\r\net porter à ébullition. Verser sur les œufs,\r\nen fouettant au fur et à mesure. Passer dans une cruche. Mettre\r\nla plaque à pâtisserie sur le support retiré\r\ngrille du four, puis versez la crème anglaise, à droite\r\nvers le haut. Vous n''aurez peut-être pas besoin de tout\r\nlaisser tomber. Râper sur une belle couche de muscade,\r\npuis remettez doucement dans le four et\r\ncuire au four pendant 1 h. Quand c''est prêt, la tarte\r\ndoit être pris et doré pâle sur le dessus,\r\net j''ai juste le moindre tremblement dans le\r\ncentre lorsque vous secouez le plateau. Frais\r\ncomplètement, puis servir en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:01:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9626,8636,'fr','Carrés pistaches & chocolat au lait','Essayez quelque chose de différent avec les carrés pistaches et chocolat au lait de Sarah Cook – vous ne pourrez pas vous arrêter à un seul morceau !','["140 g de pistaches décortiquées","200 g de chocolat au lait cassé en morceaux","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g de beurre très mou","3 œufs","200 g de farine autolevante","100 ml de lait","150 ml de crème sure"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nTapisser un moule à cake carré de 20 cm de côté avec du papier sulfurisé\r\nparchemin. Mélangez 125g de pistaches,\r\n75 g de chocolat et environ la moitié du\r\nsucre dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très finement\r\nhaché. Verser dans un bol avec le reste\r\nsucre, beurre, œufs, farine et lait, plus un\r\npincée de sel et battre. Grattez dans le moule\r\net cuire au four pendant 35 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette\r\nenfoncé, il ressort propre. Cool.","Faire fondre le reste du chocolat au lait,\r\nincorporer la crème sure et laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce que\r\ntartinable. Coupez les bords du gâteau,\r\npuis divisé en deux. Étalez un peu de glaçage dessus\r\nla base, prendre en sandwich le dessus de l''éponge\r\nde retour. Étaler le reste du glaçage sur\r\nle dessus, hachez grossièrement le reste\r\npistaches et répartissez-les dessus.\r\nCouper en 16 carrés pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9627,8638,'fr','Le pudding d''Ève','Voici un petit rappel d’un délicieux pudding britannique que vous n’avez probablement pas mangé depuis des années.','["6 grosses pommes Bramley, tranchées finement","200 g de beurre doux","140g de raisins secs","100 g de cassonade molle","4 œufs","200 g de farines autolevantes"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nPeler, épépiner et trancher les pommes. Graisser un\r\ngrand plat de service, environ 2,5 litres/3 litres\r\navec 25 g de beurre et verser dans le\r\npomme. Répartissez les raisins secs sur le dessus.","Dans un plat à part, battre le reste\r\nbeurre et sucre ensemble pendant 10 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le beurre pâlisse et le sucre\r\ncommence à se dissoudre. Incorporez les œufs, puis\r\nincorporer délicatement la farine avec un grand\r\ncuillère. Étalez la pâte sur les pommes,\r\npuis enfourner pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Servir\r\navec la crème anglaise, ci-dessous."]','2026-01-11 00:01:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9628,8640,'fr','Quartiers de pain au fromage et à l''ail','Une version merveilleusement gluante du pain à l''ail au jarlsberg','["85 g de beurre, température ambiante","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","175 g de fromage Jarlsberg, râpé grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","¼ cuillère à café de piments séchés écrasés","1 pain de campagne français rond ou ciabatta"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante\r\n170C/conventionnel 190C/\r\ngaz 5. Battre le beurre et\r\nl''ail, puis incorporer le fromage,\r\npersil et piments. Couper le\r\npain en deux sur la largeur\r\npar le centre.","Répartir le mélange de fromage\r\nsur les côtés coupés des deux pains\r\nmoitiés. Enroulez chaque moitié\r\nlégèrement dans du papier d''aluminium et mettre sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie. Cuire au four pour 20\r\nminutes, déballez le papier d''aluminium et\r\ncuire encore 10-15 minutes\r\njusqu''à commencer à pâlir\r\ndoré. Couper en quartiers\r\net servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9629,8642,'fr','Bakewell au cassis','La cuisson n''a pas besoin d''être compliquée : ce simple plat de cuisson fruité est prêt en 45 minutes.','["250 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","280 g de farines autolevantes","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","4 œufs","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","4 cuillères à soupe de confiture de cassis","25 g d''amandes effilées grillées","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer un moule à pâtisserie ou à rôtir de 20 x 30 cm.\r\nmoule et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. À\r\nfaire la pâte à biscuit, battre le beurre,\r\nfarine, sucre, levure chimique, œufs, yaourt,\r\nextrait de vanille et d''amande dans un grand bol\r\navec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sans grumeaux.\r\nVerser dans le moule et enfourner 10 min.","Parsemez rapidement la confiture, répartissez-la sur le\r\namandes, puis enfourner encore 15-20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés et qu''une brochette soit piquée\r\nl''entrée en ressort propre. Refroidir dans le moule, puis\r\nsaupoudrer de sucre glace."]','2026-01-11 00:01:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9630,8644,'fr','Tarte au chocolat du millionnaire','Une version dîner du favori de l''heure du thé, le sablé du millionnaire. Ce n''est pas trop amer, donc les enfants vont l''adorer aussi','["Paquet de 375 g de pâte brisée dessert","1 cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de vanille","farine, pour saupoudrer","250 g de caramel (nous avons utilisé du caramel Carnation en boîte)","100 g de chocolat noir 70% cassé en morceaux","100 g de chocolat blanc cassé en morceaux","6 cuillères à soupe de beurre fondu","2 œufs et 3 jaunes d''œufs","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","sucre glace et crème liquide, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Cassez la pâte en morceaux et déposez-la\r\ndans un robot culinaire. Arrosez le\r\npâte de vanille et pulser jusqu''à ce que la vanille soit\r\ntacheté à travers la pâte (l''extrait\r\ndoit être complètement absorbé). Pourboire\r\nsur un plan fariné, réunir\r\nen boule, puis étalez-la pour aligner un espace de 23 cm.\r\nmoule à tarte (laisser toute pâte qui dépasse\r\ntu couperas ça quand la tarte sera\r\ncuit). Mettre au frais 30 min.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Ligne\r\nla pâte avec du papier sulfurisé. Remplissez avec\r\nfèves au lard, cuire à blanc pendant 15-20 minutes,\r\npuis retirez le papier et les haricots et\r\ncuire au four encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés.\r\nÉtalez délicatement le caramel sur la base\r\net réservez pendant que vous préparez la garniture.\r\nBaisser le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Faire fondre les chocolats dans un bol à feu\r\nune casserole d''eau à peine frémissante, puis remuez\r\ndans le beurre fondu. Battez les œufs,\r\nles jaunes et le sucre avec un électrique\r\nfouetter dans un grand bol à mélanger pendant 10 minutes,\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et suffisamment épais pour laisser une trace\r\nlorsque les batteurs sont relevés. Pliez\r\nle chocolat fondu avec un gros métal\r\ncuillère, puis grattez dans le moule.","Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes – la surface doit être prise\r\net gonflé mais toujours avec une légère oscillation.\r\nLaisser refroidir, puis réfrigérer pendant au moins 3 heures ou\r\ntoute la nuit, avant de saupoudrer de glaçage\r\nsucre et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9631,8646,'fr','Recette de sablés','Préparez ces biscuits sablés classiques pour épater la foule. Vous n''avez besoin que de quatre ingrédients, mais vous pouvez les mélanger avec du zeste de citron ou d''orange, ou essayer d''ajouter des pistaches hachées.','["300 g de beurre ramolli","140 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus 4 cuillères à soupe","300 g de farine nature","140g de farine de riz"]','["Mettez le beurre et 140 g de sucre dans un\r\nrobot culinaire et fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nAjoutez les farines et une pincée de sel,\r\npuis fouettez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit homogène.","Avec vos mains, étalez grossièrement le\r\nmélanger dans une plaque à pâtisserie de 20 x 30 x 4 cm.\r\nCouvrir d''un film alimentaire et lisser\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de rides. Placer dans le\r\nréfrigérateur, cru, pendant au moins 30 minutes\r\net jusqu''à 2 jours.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nRetirez le film alimentaire, puis marquez légèrement le\r\nsablés partout à la fourchette. Saupoudrer\r\navec le sucre restant, puis enfournez pendant\r\n20-25 minutes. Laisser refroidir dans le moule, puis\r\ncouper en 24 fines tranches. Les sablés se conserveront\r\ndans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 1 semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:01:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9632,8648,'fr','Du pain en quatre étapes faciles','Les enfants peuvent aider avec cette recette de pain ultra simple. Utilisez la farine de votre choix, à grains, complète ou blanche','["500 g de farine de blé complet ou de pain blanc (j''ai utilisé du grenier)","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sel","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair"]','["Versez la farine, la levure et le sel dans un grand bol\r\net mélangez avec vos mains. Remuer 300 ml\r\neau chaude à la main avec l''huile et le miel, puis remuez\r\ndans les ingrédients secs pour obtenir une pâte molle.","Déposez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné\r\nsurface et pétrir pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la pâte\r\nne colle plus, saupoudré d''un peu\r\nplus de farine si vous en avez besoin.","Huiler le moule à cake et mettre la pâte dans le moule,\r\nen appuyant uniformément. Mettre dans un grand aliment en plastique\r\nsac et laisser lever 1 h, jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit bien\r\ns''est levé pour remplir la boîte et elle ne revient plus\r\nlorsque vous appuyez dessus avec votre doigt.","Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Faire\r\nplusieurs entailles sur le dessus du pain avec\r\nun couteau bien aiguisé, puis cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle pain est levé et doré. Versez-le sur un réfrigérateur\r\ngrille et tapotez la base du pain pour le vérifier\r\nest cuit. Cela devrait paraître creux. Laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9633,8650,'fr','Pain soda irlandais','Découvrez le goût de l''Irlande avec ce pain soda frais et sans chichi','["250 g de farine blanche nature","250 g de farine complète nature","100 g de flocons d''avoine","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de sel","25 g de beurre coupé en morceaux","500 ml de babeurre"]','["Préchauffer le four à 200C/gaz 6/chaleur tournante\r\n180°C et saupoudrez une plaque à pâtisserie de farine.\r\nMélangez les ingrédients secs dans un grand bol,\r\npuis frottez-y le beurre. Verser le babeurre\r\net mélangez-le rapidement avec un couteau de table, puis\r\nréunir la pâte très légèrement avec\r\ndu bout des doigts (manipulez-le très, très doucement).\r\nMaintenant, façonnez-le en un pain plat et rond.\r\nmesurant 20 cm/8 pouces de diamètre.","Mettez le pain sur la plaque à pâtisserie et\r\nmarquer une croix profonde dans le haut. (Traditionnellement,\r\ncela laisse sortir les fées, mais cela aide aussi les\r\npain pour bien cuire.) Cuire au four pendant 30-35\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce que le fond du pain sonne\r\ncreux lorsqu''on le tape. Si ce n''est pas prêt après\r\ncette fois, retourne-le sur la cuisson\r\nplaque et cuire encore quelques minutes.","Transférer sur une grille, couvrir d''un\r\nun torchon (cela garde la croûte bien moelleuse)\r\net laisser refroidir. Pour servir, entrez par effraction\r\nquartiers, puis cassez ou coupez chaque quartier en\r\nmoitié pour faire 8 quartiers ou tranches – ou simplement\r\ntrancher. Mangez très frais."]','2026-01-11 00:01:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9634,8652,'fr','Biscuits à la farine de noix de coco','Préparez un lot de biscuits à la noix de coco pour le moule à biscuits. Ils ont une délicate saveur de noix de coco et une texture semblable à celle d’un macaron. Ajoutez aussi des pépites de chocolat si vous le souhaitez','["75g de farine de noix de coco","60 g d''huile de coco fondue","2 œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète","60 g de sucre mou roux clair","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de pépites de chocolat (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mettez le tout dans un bol et mélangez bien jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène et ait une consistance semblable à du sable humide.","Formez 10 à 12 boules de pâte de la taille d''une noix environ et disposez-les sur la plaque à pâtisserie à quelques centimètres les unes des autres. Appuyez pour créer un disque de quelques centimètres d''épaisseur, puis mettez au four et faites cuire au four pendant 12 à 14 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes avant de démouler sur une grille et de laisser refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9635,8654,'fr','Biscuits au moulinet noir et blanc','Les biscuits noirs et blancs sont un classique parmi les biscuits de Noël. Vous pouvez les transformer en un motif en damier ou en une belle spirale comme celle-ci.','["300 g de farine nature","100g de sucre glace","8 g de sucre vanillé ou 8 g de sucre en poudre, plus 1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 œuf, plus 1 blanc d''œuf pour le glaçage","125 g de beurre ramolli","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao","1 cuillère à soupe de lait"]','["Mettez la farine, le sucre glace, le sucre vanillé, une pincée de sel, l''œuf et le beurre mou dans un batteur sur socle et mélangez. Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez brièvement à la main. Coupez la pâte en deux. Envelopper une moitié et réfrigérer pendant une heure. Pétrir le cacao et le lait dans l''autre moitié. Envelopper et réfrigérer pendant une heure.","Abaisser chaque lot de pâte en un rectangle (environ 30 cm x 20 cm) sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné. Enduisez le dessus d''une couche de blanc d''œuf puis soulevez l''autre couleur de pâte par dessus et enduisez le dessus de blanc d''œuf. Roulez fermement comme un petit pain suisse. Filmer et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 175C/chaleur tournante 155C/gaz 3½. Tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Coupez la pâte en tranches d''environ 5 mm d''épaisseur avec un couteau bien aiguisé. Cuire au four par lots pendant 10 à 12 minutes, mais ne laissez pas la pâte pâle foncer car vous souhaitez conserver le contraste. Laisser refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9636,8656,'fr','Biscuits de la nuit du feu de joie','Célébrez la nuit du feu de joie avec ces jolis biscuits. Décorez ces biscuits épicés automnaux avec des motifs de feux d''artifice glacés','["75 g de beurre doux, ramolli","100 g de sucre en poudre","1 gros œuf","250 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre tamisé","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 gros blanc d''oeuf","250 g de sucre glace tamisé","½ cuillère à café de jus de citron","des colorants alimentaires en gel (nous avons utilisé du bleu, du jaune et du rouge)","des paillettes d''étoiles (facultatif)"]','["Battre le beurre et le sucre avec un fouet électrique pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Incorporer l''œuf jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Ajoutez la farine, le cacao en poudre, la cannelle et le gingembre et continuez à battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte. Mettez la pâte entre deux morceaux de papier sulfurisé et étalez-la sur 6 mm d''épaisseur à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Retirez la couche supérieure de papier sulfurisé et découpez les biscuits à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce rond ou étoile de 6 cm. Reroulez les chutes et continuez à découper les biscuits jusqu''à ce que toute la pâte soit utilisée (vous devriez en obtenir 20 à 22 selon l''emporte-pièce).","Disposez les biscuits sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, en les espaçant d''au moins 2 cm (vous aurez peut-être besoin de deux plaques à pâtisserie). Cuire au four pendant 7 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient légèrement dorés. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque à pâtisserie pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Une fois refroidi, préparez le glaçage. Battre le blanc d''œuf au fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à mousser, environ 1 min. Ajoutez le sucre glace, 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois, en fouettant continuellement à vitesse moyenne-élevée jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Ajoutez le jus de citron et fouettez jusqu''à obtenir des pics fermes, environ 5 minutes – le glaçage doit être brillant. Ajoutez plus de sucre glace si nécessaire pour l''aider à se rigidifier.","Pour décorer, répartissez le glaçage dans des bols et colorez avec les colorants alimentaires en gel (nous avons laissé un peu de glaçage en blanc, puis coloré trois bols en bleu, jaune et rouge). Versez le glaçage coloré dans des poches à douille séparées munies de petites douilles rondes (ou coupez les extrémités). Tracez des lignes sur les biscuits pour créer des motifs ou des tourbillons semblables à des feux d''artifice. Pendant que le glaçage est humide, décorez de pépites d''étoiles, si vous le souhaitez. Laisser reposer légèrement, puis servir. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:01:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9637,8658,'fr','Biscuits finlandais à la cuillère','Préparez ces délicats biscuits fourrés à la confiture à Noël. C''est une tradition festive finlandaise et le secret de leur délicieuse saveur de noisette réside dans le beurre noisette.','["200 g de beurre doux","125 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de sucre vanillé ou 1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","300 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","75g de confiture de framboises de bonne qualité ou maison","50 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 195°C/175°C chaleur tournante/gaz 51/2 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé.","Faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole à feu doux et laissez cuire 10 minutes en remuant régulièrement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et sente légèrement la noisette. Gardez un œil sur la couleur car le beurre peut brûler rapidement. Versez immédiatement le beurre dans un grand bol, ajoutez le sucre et la vanille et mélangez bien. Laisser refroidir un peu, puis tamiser la farine et le bicarbonate.","Utilisez une grande cuillère à café pour prélever des morceaux du mélange et façonnez-les, en appuyant légèrement pour aplatir le dessus et en lissant l''excédent sur les côtés avec un doigt. Retirez la cuillère et disposez-la sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée, côté plat vers le bas. Répétez avec le reste du mélange. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Étalez une petite quantité de confiture sur le côté plat de chaque biscuit. Sandwich avec un autre biscuit. Versez le sucre dans une assiette, puis roulez-y chacun des biscuits pour bien les enrober."]','2026-01-11 00:01:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9638,4058,'fr','Farl de soda','Célébrez la Saint-Patrick avec des soda farls – un pain soda irlandais aplati en cercle et divisé en quatre « farls ». A manger tiède avec du beurre','["250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","½ cuillère à café de sel","1 cuillère à café de sucre","1 cuillère à café bombée de bicarbonate de soude","225 ml de babeurre"]','["Versez la farine dans un grand bol et mélangez le sel, le sucre et le bicarbonate. Faites un puits au centre et versez le babeurre, puis remuez rapidement pour combiner. Versez sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrissez brièvement. Roulez sur un cercle d''environ 20 cm et coupez en quartiers.","Faites chauffer une poêle ou une poêle à fond épais à feu doux-moyen. Ajouter les farls et cuire 8 à 10 minutes de chaque côté, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir les farls dans la poêle pendant 10 min. Ouvrir et manger chaud avec du beurre."]','2026-01-11 00:01:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9639,5964,'fr','Biscuits à la cardamome (non consommés)','Dégustez ces biscuits indiens traditionnels à la cardamome avec une tasse de masala chai torride. Les Nan Khatai se distinguent par leur texture friable et leur saveur riche en beurre.','["3 gousses de cardamome verte","40g de sucre glace","100 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","70 g de farine blanche autolevante","25g de farine","25g de semoule","24 amandes avec la peau ou pistaches hachées"]','["Fendez les gousses de cardamome et retirez les graines. Réduisez les graines en poudre dans un pilon et un mortier avec 1 cuillère à café de sucre.","Battre le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, puis ajouter progressivement le reste du sucre glace et la cardamome moulue. Continuez à battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et crémeux, environ 10 minutes.","Tamisez la farine et la farine de pois chiches dans un bol et fouettez la semoule et une pincée de sel. Incorporer le beurre et le sucre en deux fois. Rassemblez délicatement le tout en une pâte molle.","Roulez la pâte en petites boules de la taille d''une bille avec vos mains et disposez-les, espacées, sur des plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé.","Aplatissez légèrement le dessus de chaque boule et pressez une amande entière ou quelques pistaches concassées au milieu de chacune. Mettre au frais 20 min.","Chauffer le four à 160C/140C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Cuire les biscuits pendant environ 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir avant de conserver dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9640,8660,'fr','Florentins','Profitez de ces florentins classiques au moment de Noël. Ornés de cerises et de pistaches et enrobés de chocolat, ces biscuits sont le cadeau de fête idéal','["50g de beurre salé","50 g de sucre muscovado léger","50g de sirop doré","50g de farine nature","50 g de cerises glacées hachées","75 g d''amandes effilées","50 g de pistaches hachées","2 oranges, zestées","175g de chocolat noir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C/gaz 4. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le beurre, le sucre et le sirop doré dans une petite casserole à feu doux en remuant fréquemment. Retirer du feu et fouetter la farine puis ajouter les cerises, les amandes effilées, les pistaches et le zeste d''orange.","Versez 10 cuillères à soupe plates du mélange sur les plaques à pâtisserie, en laissant de la place pour qu''elles s''étalent. Vous devrez les faire par lots. Cuire au four 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Laisser refroidir pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment ferme pour être soulevé sur une grille. Refroidissez complètement. Répétez avec le reste du mélange.","Faire fondre le chocolat dans un bol au dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante ou au micro-ondes en 30 secondes. Retournez les florentins sur la grille. Versez du chocolat sur la base de chaque florentin et étalez-le délicatement sur les bords. Lorsque le chocolat est suffisamment ferme pour conserver sa forme, utilisez une fourchette pour tracer des lignes ondulées sur le chocolat. Laisser prendre puis conserver dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9641,8662,'fr','Biscuits froissés au chocolat et au fudge à l''orange','Essayez de préparer ces simples biscuits froissés au chocolat et au fondant à l''orange avec les enfants. Enrobés de sucre orange, ils sont très amusants à préparer (et à manger !)','["60 g de cacao en poudre tamisé","230 g de sucre en poudre","60 ml d''huile végétale","2 grosses oranges, zestées","2 gros œufs","180 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire orange, ou utilisez du rouge et du jaune","40g de sucre glace"]','["Mélangez le cacao, 200 g de sucre semoule et l''huile avec la majeure partie du zeste d''orange. Incorporer les œufs un à la fois, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement mélangés.","Mélangez la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel dans un autre bol, puis ajoutez-les au mélange de cacao et mélangez jusqu''à former une pâte molle. Si la pâte est très molle, transférez-la au réfrigérateur et laissez-la refroidir pendant 1 heure.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Versez le sucre en poudre restant dans un petit bol. Ajoutez une goutte de colorant alimentaire et mélangez-la au sucre jusqu''à ce que tout soit coloré – ajoutez-en plus si vous voulez une couleur plus forte. Incorporez le sucre glace jusqu''à ce que tout le sucre soit coloré, puis incorporez le reste du zeste d''orange.","Formez une boule avec une cuillère à café bombée de pâte, puis roulez-la dans le sucre pour l''enrober. Vous devrez peut-être appuyer sur le sucre, surtout si vous avez refroidi la pâte. Si le sucre ne colle pas bien, roulez les boules de pâte entre vos mains jusqu''à ce que le mélange se réchauffe un peu. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte, puis déposez-la, régulièrement espacée, sur la plaque à pâtisserie.","Cuire au centre du four pendant 10 minutes – ils se froisseront à la cuisson. Les biscuits vont se raffermir en refroidissant, alors ne les faites pas trop cuire. Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir. Se conserve quatre jours dans une boîte à biscuits."]','2026-01-11 00:01:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9642,8664,'fr','Biscuits saupoudrés de fondant au chocolat','Préparez un lot de ces amusants biscuits froissés au fondant au chocolat. Les enfants adoreront aider – surtout en décorant avec des pépites !','["60 g de cacao en poudre tamisé","200 g de sucre en poudre","60 ml d''huile végétale","2 gros œufs","180 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 petit pot de pépites"]','["Mélangez le cacao, le sucre en poudre et l''huile. Incorporer les œufs un à la fois, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement mélangés.","Mélangez la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel dans un autre bol, puis ajoutez-les au mélange de cacao et mélangez jusqu''à former une pâte molle. Si la pâte est très molle, transférez-la au réfrigérateur et laissez-la refroidir pendant 1 heure.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Versez les pépites dans un plat peu profond. Formez une boule avec une cuillère à café bombée de pâte, puis roulez-y les pépites pour bien les enrober – vous devrez peut-être appuyer sur les pépites, surtout si vous avez refroidi la pâte. Si elles ne collent pas bien, roulez les boules de pâte entre vos mains jusqu''à ce que le mélange se réchauffe un peu. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte, puis déposez-la, régulièrement espacée, sur la plaque à pâtisserie.","Cuire au centre du four pendant 10 minutes – ils se froisseront à la cuisson. Les biscuits vont se raffermir en refroidissant, alors ne les faites pas trop cuire. Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir. Se conserve quatre jours dans une boîte à biscuits."]','2026-01-11 00:01:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9643,8666,'fr','Biscuits froissés au fondant au chocolat','Utilisez les ingrédients du placard pour préparer ces délicieux biscuits froissés au fondant au chocolat. Ils sont le partenaire idéal d''un café comme gâterie de l''après-midi','["60 g de cacao en poudre tamisé","200 g de sucre en poudre","60 ml d''huile végétale","2 gros œufs","180 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","70g de sucre glace"]','["Mélangez le cacao, le sucre en poudre et l''huile. Ajoutez les œufs un à un en fouettant jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Mélangez la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel dans un autre bol, puis ajoutez-les au mélange de cacao et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte molle se forme. S''il est mou, transférez-le au réfrigérateur et laissez-le refroidir pendant 1 heure. Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Versez le sucre glace dans un plat peu profond. Formez une boule avec une cuillère à café bombée de pâte, puis roulez-la dans le sucre pour l''enrober. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte, puis déposez-la, régulièrement espacée, sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé.","Cuire au centre du four pendant 10 minutes – ils durciront en refroidissant. Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir. Se conserve quatre jours dans une boîte à biscuits."]','2026-01-11 00:01:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9644,8668,'fr','Biscuits au beurre de cacahuète double chocolat','Quoi de mieux avec un verre de lait froid qu''un biscuit chaud et gluant au beurre de cacahuète ? Ces friandises aux morceaux de chocolat sont garnies de cacahuètes hachées croquantes','["100 g de beurre doux, ramolli à température ambiante","100 g de sucre roux clair","100 g de sucre en poudre","1 œuf battu","150 g de farine autolevante","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","¼ cuillère à café de sel","200 g de chocolat au lait, 150 g coupé en morceaux et 50 g fondu pour arroser","75 g de beurre de cacahuète (croquant ou onctueux, c''est bien)","une poignée de cacahuètes salées, hachées grossièrement","lait pour servir, facultatif"]','["Chauffer le four à 180c/160 chaleur tournante/thermostat 4 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. À l''aide d''un batteur ou d''un fouet électrique, battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Ajoutez l''œuf et fouettez pour combiner, puis incorporez la farine, la poudre de cacao, le sel et les morceaux de chocolat jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement incorporés. À l''aide d''une cuillère, faites tourner le beurre de cacahuète dans la pâte à biscuits.","Répartissez la pâte en 12 gros biscuits sur les deux plateaux à l''aide d''une cuillère à dessert, en laissant suffisamment d''espace entre chaque biscuit pour qu''ils s''étalent. Cuire au four pendant 9 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit encore tendre et fondant au milieu. Ils auront l’air pas assez cuits mais durciront une fois refroidis. Arroser de chocolat au lait fondu et garnir de quelques cacahuètes hachées et d''une pincée de sel marin feuilleté. Servir avec un verre de lait pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:01:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9645,8670,'fr','Biscuits florentins','Nous avons donné aux florentins classiques une base biscuitée enrobée de chocolat afin qu''ils soient parfaits pour les tremper. Faites-vous plaisir ou offrez en cadeau fait maison','["175g de beurre légèrement salé ramolli","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","225 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","50g de beurre","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","50g de sirop doré","½ cuillère à café de sel","50g de farine nature","75 g de cerises glacées hachées","75 g d''amandes effilées","150 g de chocolat noir haché"]','["Pour faire les biscuits, mettez le beurre, le sucre et la vanille dans un bol et battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse. Ajoutez la farine et la cannelle et mélangez avec une spatule pour obtenir une pâte molle. Formez une boule, enveloppez-la dans du film alimentaire et réservez au frais au moins 1 h.","Dans une casserole, faire fondre le beurre, le sucre, le golden sirop et le sel. Retirer du feu et incorporer la farine, puis les cerises et les amandes. Laisser refroidir et raffermir un peu. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé.","Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail fariné et étalez-la sur l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. A l''aide d''un emporte-pièce cannelé de 6 cm, découpez un maximum de cercles, puis froissez les chutes, re-roulez et tamponnez encore. Transférer sur la plaque à pâtisserie et verser un peu du mélange florentin sur chaque biscuit jusqu''à épuisement. Cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les biscuits soient dorés et que la garniture soit fondue. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque pendant au moins 15 min.","Pendant que les biscuits refroidissent, faites fondre le chocolat dans un petit bol résistant à la chaleur suspendu au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante doucement, ou par petites rafales au micro-ondes. Remuez toutes les 30 secondes environ pour vous assurer que cela ne brûle pas. Tremper chaque biscuit environ au tiers dans le chocolat, puis remettre sur la plaque pour prendre. Vous devrez peut-être verser le chocolat sur les derniers. Se conserve jusqu''à quatre jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9646,8672,'fr','Tourbillons viennois','Ces biscuits élégants au beurre peuvent sembler très impressionnants, mais ils sont étonnamment faciles à préparer. Tremper dans le chocolat pour une gâterie extra sucrée','["200 g de beurre légèrement salé ramolli","50g de sucre glace","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g de beurre ramolli","170 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","50g de confiture de framboise ou confiture de fraise"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mettez le beurre et le sucre glace dans un grand bol et battez avec un fouet électrique pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter l''extrait de vanille et battre à nouveau jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement incorporé.","Tamisez la farine, la maïzena et la levure chimique et incorporez-les au mélange à l''aide d''une spatule jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène (la pâte doit avoir une consistance collante). Versez la pâte dans une poche à douille munie d''une grosse douille en forme d''étoile. Si tout le mélange ne rentre pas, faites-le en 2 fois.","Disposez des cercles tourbillonnants de 5 cm de diamètre sur 2 plaques à pâtisserie en vous assurant qu''il y a un espace de 3 cm entre chaque tourbillon.","Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes, en échangeant les plaques à mi-cuisson pour que les biscuits soient cuits uniformément, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et bien cuits. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes sur les plaques à pâtisserie, puis transférer sur des grilles.","Pendant que les biscuits refroidissent, préparez la garniture. Mettez le beurre ramolli dans un grand bol à mélanger et ajoutez le sucre glace. Mélangez d''abord avec une cuillère en bois puis passez aux batteurs électriques ou au fouet pour obtenir une crème au beurre mousseuse et lisse. Ajouter l''extrait de vanille et battre à nouveau pour combiner. Transférez la crème au beurre dans une poche à douille et coupez le bout.","Retournez les biscuits côté plat vers le haut puis versez de la crème au beurre sur la moitié des biscuits et étalez un peu de confiture sur le reste. Sandwich un biscuit recouvert de confiture avec un autre à la crème au beurre et répétez jusqu''à ce que tous les biscuits soient épuisés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9647,8674,'fr','Biscuits à l''avoine et aux noisettes','Doux et légèrement moelleux, ces biscuits à l''avoine contiennent du sirop de pomme et d''érable au lieu du sucre. Ils regorgent de noisettes qui sont une bonne source de vitamines et de minéraux','["50 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable","1 pomme dessert, non pelée et râpée grossièrement (il vous faut 85g)","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","50g de raisins secs","50 g de flocons d''avoine","50g de farine d''épeautre","40 g de noisettes non blanchies, coupées en grosses tranches","1 oeuf"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et graisser légèrement une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive (ou tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie normale de papier sulfurisé). Versez le beurre et le sirop dans une petite poêle antiadhésive et faites fondre ensemble, puis ajoutez la pomme et faites cuire en remuant à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elle ramollisse, environ 6-7 minutes. Incorporer la cannelle et les raisins secs.","Mélangez les flocons d''avoine, la farine d''épeautre et les noisettes dans un bol, versez le mélange de pommes, puis ajoutez l''œuf et battez bien le tout.","Verser sur la plaque à pâtisserie, bien espacés pour former 9 monticules, puis presser délicatement en disques. Cuire au four pendant 18 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, puis laisser refroidir sur une grille. Se conserve 3 jours dans un contenant hermétique ou 6 semaines au congélateur."]','2026-01-11 00:01:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9648,8676,'fr','Biscuits lapin blanc','Ces adorables biscuits en forme de lapin sortiront de l''assiette plus vite que vous ne pourrez les cuire. Ils constituent une excellente activité de Pâques pour les enfants ou un cadeau spécial supplémentaire','["200 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","400 g de farine nature","280 g de sucre en poudre","1 oeuf","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","une pincée de sel","½ cuillère à café de crème de tartre","600 g de sucre glace","Paquet de 170 g de noix de coco desséchée","gel colorant alimentaire rose","15 mini guimauves","1 x emporte-pièce en forme de tête de lapin","1 emporte-pièce rond de 7 cm","1 emporte-pièce rond de 3 cm"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Frottez légèrement le beurre et la farine du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fraîche.","Mélangez le sucre et l''œuf dans un autre bol avec un fouet et quand c''est bien mélangé et coulant, ajoutez-le au mélange de farine.","Ajoutez tous les autres ingrédients et écrasez-la avec vos mains, continuez à travailler la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse, molle et se rassemble en un seul morceau.","Abaissez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée avec un rouleau à pâtisserie jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne environ un demi-centimètre d''épaisseur. Découpez en formes. Nous avons réalisé 15 têtes de lapin, 15 grands cercles et 30 mini cercles.","Placez vos biscuits sur des plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé et enfournez par lots pendant environ 15 minutes (ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés sur les bords).","Laissez-les refroidir dans le moule pendant quelques minutes avant de les transférer délicatement sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement et deviennent croustillants.","Pendant que les biscuits refroidissent, mélangez suffisamment d''eau froide avec le sucre glace pour obtenir un glaçage épais. Placez un quart du glaçage dans un autre bol et ajoutez une toute petite quantité de colorant alimentaire en gel rose. Transférez le glaçage blanc et le glaçage rose dans des poches à douille jetables et coupez l''extrémité pour faire une très petite douille sur le glaçage rose et une plus large sur le glaçage blanc.","Napper les petits biscuits ronds de glaçage blanc et laisser sécher. Disposez ensuite du glaçage blanc pour recouvrir tous les gros biscuits circulaires et les biscuits lapin (soyez assez parcimonieux et étalez-le avec le dos d''une cuillère, il n''est pas nécessaire que ce soit net sur ceux-là). Une fois que vous avez glacé chacun d’entre eux, saupoudrez généreusement de noix de coco desséchée avant que le glaçage ne sèche.","Prenez le glaçage rose et utilisez-le pour créer des pattes sur les petits cercles, puis collez-en 2 sur chacun des grands cercles en utilisant du glaçage comme de la colle. Avec le glaçage qu''il vous reste, enduisez les guimauves et recouvrez-les également de noix de coco avant de les coller au milieu des plus grands cercles pour créer une queue moelleuse. Laisser reposer complètement pendant environ 15 à 20 minutes puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9649,8678,'fr','Sablés aux fleurs sucrées','Ces sablés délicats constituent un cadeau parfait. Avec une touche florale avec l''eau de rose, vous pouvez également utiliser de l''extrait de fleur d''oranger ou de la lavande séchée.','["250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","140 g de beurre froid légèrement salé coupé en petits cubes","85 g de sucre blanc en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","½ cuillère à café d''eau de rose (facultatif)","assortiment de 15 à 20 fleurs comestibles, non traitées (nous avons utilisé des pensées, des altos, des primevères et des pétales de roses - voir conseil)","50 g de sucre en poudre","1 blanc d''oeuf battu","300g de pâtes colorantes alimentaires sucre glace royal (nous avons utilisé du jaune, du violet et du rose)","poussière chatoyante comestible (facultatif)","pince à épiler","1 petit pinceau","coupe-biscuits de 8 cm","1 poche à douille jetable","1 douille à passepoil pour écriture fine","du papier de soie et une jolie boîte, pour emballer les biscuits","Tout d''abord, vérifiez que toutes les fleurs que vous avez cueillies dans votre jardin sont comestibles (visitrhs.org.uk si vous n''êtes pas sûr.) Si vous achetez les fleurs, vérifiez qu''elles ne sont pas pulvérisées (biologiques) et ne contiennent pas de produits chimiques. Pour acheter des fleurs prêtes à cristalliser, essayez mangermyflowers.co.uk."]','["Retirez les tiges et les feuilles des petites fleurs comme les altos ou les pensées, et séparez soigneusement les roses pour séparer les pétales. Déposez une feuille de papier sulfurisé sur votre plan de travail. Saupoudrez le sucre en poudre sur une soucoupe, puis fouettez légèrement le blanc d''œuf dans un petit bol. En tenant une fleur ou un pétale avec une pince à épiler, utilisez un petit pinceau pour peindre les deux côtés avec du blanc d''œuf. Versez le sucre dessus, puis secouez l''excédent et déposez-le sur le papier sulfurisé. Répétez avec les pétales ou les fleurs restantes. Laissez sécher 3 heures, voire toute la nuit si vous le pouvez. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 1 mois, mais leur couleur peut commencer à s''estomper après quelques semaines.","Versez la farine dans un grand bol et ajoutez le beurre. Utilisez le bout de vos doigts pour frotter le beurre dans la farine jusqu''à obtenir une texture humide et friable. Versez le sucre et mélangez délicatement du bout des doigts. Fouettez ensemble la vanille, l''eau de rose et les jaunes d''œufs dans un petit bol avec une fourchette, puis versez le mélange sur la farine beurrée. Mélangez à nouveau en écrasant les miettes pour former une pâte. Si le mélange est un peu friable, arrosez-le de 1 à 2 cuillères à café d''eau froide, puis mélangez à nouveau. Versez sur votre plan de travail et pétrissez très brièvement jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit homogène, sans traces d''œuf. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire, former un disque rond et réfrigérer 30 min.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur – si elle est très ferme, laissez-la à température ambiante pendant 15 minutes pour qu''elle ramollisse. Saupoudrez légèrement le plan de travail de farine, déballez la pâte et roulez-la jusqu''à obtenir l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Découpez des disques de 8 cm avec le côté cannelé d''un emporte-pièce et transférez-les sur les plaques à pâtisserie. Cuire au four 10 à 12 minutes en intervertissant les plaques à mi-cuisson. Une fois légèrement dorés et fermes, sortez les biscuits du four. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment stable pour transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec suffisamment d''eau pour obtenir un glaçage épais. Répartissez le glaçage dans autant de bols que de couleurs que vous souhaitez utiliser et colorez chacune d''elles d''une teinte pastel avec une goutte de colorant alimentaire. Transférer la moitié d’un des glaçages dans une poche à douille jetable munie d’une douille à écriture fine. Pochez un cercle autour du biscuit et laissez-le sécher. Continuez jusqu''à ce que vous ayez glacé un tiers des biscuits (si vous utilisez trois couleurs), puis passez à la couleur suivante en transférant les restes de glaçage dans son bol d''origine. Laissez sécher les biscuits pendant 10 à 15 minutes.","Ajoutez 2-3 cuillères à café d''eau à chaque glaçage pour le rendre un peu plus liquide. Versez le glaçage sur les biscuits en faisant correspondre la couleur aux anneaux. Encouragez le glaçage à inonder la surface en le faisant glisser vers les bords avec votre cuillère – ne soyez pas trop généreux avec le glaçage car il pourrait déborder lorsque vous ajoutez les fleurs et les pétales. Vous pouvez maintenant saupoudrer la surface de chaque biscuit d''un peu de poudre chatoyante, si vous le souhaitez, puis garnir de fleurs. Laissez les biscuits reposer au moins 1 h avant de les envelopper dans du papier de soie dans une jolie boîte. Se conserve jusqu''à 1 semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9650,8680,'fr','Biscuits de fortune','Remplissez des biscuits de fortune faits maison avec des messages personnalisés pour une gâterie personnalisée – idéal pour toutes les occasions, comme le Nouvel An chinois, Noël, la Saint-Valentin, les anniversaires et les mariages.','["2 blancs d''œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","100 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","100 g de sucre en poudre","1½ cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame noires"]','["Préchauffez le four à 180C/160 chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapissez une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé, ou utilisez une plaque à pâtisserie en silicone. Écrivez ou imprimez des fortunes sur du papier mesurant 6 cm de long sur 1 cm de large.","Mettez les blancs d''œufs, la vanille, l''extrait d''amande, l''huile et 2 cuillères à café d''eau froide dans un bol et fouettez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit mousseux, 20 à 30 secondes. Mesurez la farine, la maïzena, le sucre et une bonne pincée de sel dans un bol, puis tamisez-les dans le mélange de blancs d''œufs. Fouettez le tout jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et semblable à une pâte. Refroidissez le mélange pendant 1 heure.","Ensuite, mettez une cuillère à soupe du mélange sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée. Huilez une cuillère en métal, puis utilisez le dos pour faire tourbillonner le mélange dans un cercle de 8 à 10 cm. Répétez avec une autre cuillère à soupe du mélange pour créer 2 biscuits. Assurez-vous qu''il y a un espace entre chaque biscuit car ils se propageront au four. Il est préférable de ne cuire que 2 à 3 biscuits à la fois, car vous devrez les façonner pendant qu''ils sont chauds. Saupoudrez 1 des biscuits de graines de sésame noires, puis enfournez pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords des biscuits deviennent dorés.","Un à un, retirez les biscuits avec une spatule à la sortie du four. Vous voulez qu’ils soient toujours mous pour pouvoir les façonner afin de travailler rapidement. Retournez le biscuit de manière à ce que les graines de sésame soient face cachée et placez la fortune au milieu du cercle. Pliez le cercle en deux pour sécuriser la fortune et pincez les 2 bords ensemble pour sceller. Placez le biscuit sur le bord d''une tasse ou d''une tasse et tirez très doucement les 2 coins vers le bas pour obtenir la forme du biscuit de fortune. Attendez 10 secondes, puis transférez les biscuits dans des moules à muffins pour qu''ils conservent leur forme tout en refroidissant complètement. Répétez avec le reste du mélange de biscuits."]','2026-01-11 00:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9651,8682,'fr','Noix de coco agréable','Améliorez le biscuit Nice classique avec un glaçage à la crème de noix de coco et une garniture à la noix de coco desséchée – ils sont également végétaliens','["1 cuillère à soupe de graines de lin","400 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","200g d''huile de coco","50g de noix de coco desséchée","280 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 cuillères à soupe de crème de coco","200-225g de sucre glace","50g de noix de coco desséchée"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettez les graines de lin dans un petit bol et ajoutez 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Laisser tremper 5 à 10 minutes. Pendant ce temps, frottez la farine et l''huile de coco dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce que l''huile de coco soit bien répartie et que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fraîche. Incorporer la noix de coco râpée et réserver.","Versez les graines de lin, avec leur eau de trempage, dans le bol d''un mini robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient mousseuses. Ajoutez le sucre et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le mélange de graines de lin et de sucre dans la farine et l''huile de coco et pétrissez ensemble pour former une boule de pâte. Si la pâte semble trop sèche et risque de se fissurer lors de l''étalement, ajoutez un peu d''eau, 1 cuillère à café à la fois.","Transférez la pâte sur une surface farinée et étalez-la jusqu''à obtenir l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Coupez des rectangles de 7 cm x 4 cm et disposez-les sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé – veillez à laisser 2 à 3 cm entre chaque biscuit. Cuire au four par lots pendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords commencent tout juste à devenir dorés. Transférer sur une grille à l''aide d''un couteau à palette ou d''une tranche de poisson et laisser refroidir complètement avant de décorer.","Pour décorer, mélangez la crème de coco et suffisamment de sucre glace pour obtenir une pâte épaisse. Transférer dans une poche à douille et tracer une fine ligne tout autour du bord extérieur d''un biscuit, puis tremper le glaçage dans la noix de coco desséchée. Répétez avec tous les biscuits. Disposez le mot « NICE » au milieu de chaque biscuit, puis laissez prendre."]','2026-01-11 00:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9652,8684,'fr','Dodgers confits au sorbet au citron','Le biscuit à la confiture préféré de tous fait peau neuve : prenez un sandwich avec de la crème au citron et saupoudrez de sorbet pour plus de piquant.','["175 g de beurre froid légèrement salé coupé en cubes","250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","100g de sucre glace","zester 1 citron et 1 à 2 cuillères à café de jus","1 gros jaune d''oeuf","Pack de 23g de sorbet (j''ai utilisé Dip Dab)","75g de beurre légèrement salé, à température ambiante","250 g de sucre glace","100 g de crème de citron"]','["Dans un robot culinaire, fouettez le beurre, la farine et une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine. Ajoutez le sucre et le zeste de citron et fouettez à nouveau. Ajoutez le jus de citron et le jaune d''oeuf et mélangez jusqu''à ce que des grumeaux de pâte se forment autour des lames. Continuez à mélanger à l''aide du bouton Pulse jusqu''à ce que de plus grosses boules de pâte se forment. Versez le mélange sur un plan de travail et pétrissez brièvement pour le rassembler en une boule lisse – ne le travaillez pas trop sinon il sera dur. Coupez la pâte en 2 morceaux égaux et formez des disques plats, puis enveloppez-les dans du film alimentaire et réservez au frais au moins 30 minutes. Tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé.","Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur 15 minutes avant de la rouler. Farinez légèrement votre plan de travail et votre rouleau à pâtisserie. Déballez 1 morceau de pâte et étalez-le sur une épaisseur de\r\nune pièce de 50p. Utilisez un emporte-pièce de 6 cm pour découper des disques (vous devriez en obtenir environ 15) et transférez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie à l''aide d''une spatule.","Déballez et étalez le reste de la pâte sur la même épaisseur. Découpez 15 disques et transférez-les sur la deuxième plaque à pâtisserie. Utilisez un petit emporte-pièce rond (environ 1 cm) ou l''extrémité d''une douille à douille pour percer des trous au milieu de 15 biscuits. Couvrir légèrement les plaques d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer 15 minutes. Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.","Faites cuire les biscuits pendant 15 minutes en intervertissant les plaques à mi-cuisson. Sortir du four, laisser refroidir 5 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Mettez le beurre, le sucre et la moitié de la crème au citron dans un bol. Écrasez ensemble, puis mélangez avec un fouet électrique à main. Transférer dans une poche à douille et couper l''extrémité en faisant une ouverture de 1 cm. Placez le reste de la crème de citron dans une autre poche à douille et coupez l''extrémité pour faire un trou légèrement plus petit. Saupoudrez un peu de sorbet sur les biscuits percés d''un trou au centre.","Disposez des gouttes de garniture au citron en forme d''anneau sur chaque biscuit entier, en laissant un espace au centre pour remplir de crème au citron. Remplissez le milieu, puis placez un biscuit saupoudré de sorbet sur chacun. Conserver dans une boîte à biscuits pendant 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9653,8686,'fr','Biscuits Anzac','Ces biscuits emblématiques étaient à l''origine destinés à être envoyés aux ANZAC (corps d''armée australien et néo-zélandais) servant à Gallipoli.','["85 g de flocons d''avoine","85 g de noix de coco desséchée","100 g de farine nature","100 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de beurre, plus du beurre supplémentaire pour graisser","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4. Mettre les flocons d''avoine, la noix de coco, la farine et le sucre dans un bol. Faire fondre le beurre dans un petit\r\npoêle et incorporer le sirop doré. Ajoutez le bicarbonate de soude à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante, puis incorporez-le au\r\nmélange de sirop doré et de beurre.","Faire un puits au milieu des ingrédients secs et y verser le mélange beurre et sirop doré. Remuer doucement\r\npour incorporer les ingrédients secs.","Mettez des cuillerées à dessert du mélange sur des plaques à pâtisserie beurrées, espacées d''environ 2,5 cm/1 po pour laisser de la place pour l''étalement. Cuire au four par lots pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Transférer sur une grille pour refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9654,8688,'fr','Biscuits aux pistaches et aux canneberges','Ces biscuits croquants aux fruits et aux noix seront certainement les préférés de toute la famille : préparez-les à l''avance et congelez-les, ou emballez-les pour un cadeau fait maison parfait.','["175 g de beurre ramolli","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","225 g de farine nature","75g de pistaches","75 g de canneberges séchées"]','["Mélangez le beurre, le sucre et l''extrait de vanille avec une cuillère en bois. incorporez la farine, puis versez les pistaches et les canneberges – vous devrez peut-être mettre la main à ce stade pour rassembler le mélange sous forme de pâte. Coupez la pâte en deux et façonnez chaque moitié en bûche d''environ 5 cm de diamètre. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire, puis réfrigérer 1 heure ou congeler jusqu''à 3 mois.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Couper les bûches en rondelles de 1 cm d''épaisseur, les déposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et enfourner pendant 12-15 minutes. Refroidir complètement sur la plaque."]','2026-01-11 00:01:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9655,8690,'fr','Biscuits à l''orange, à l''avoine et aux raisins secs','Les cookies ne doivent pas nécessairement être un plaisir coupable : ces délicieuses friandises de la Leiths School of Food and Wine sont super saines.','["100 g de beurre à température ambiante","1 oeuf","50 g de banane mûre écrasée","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de cassonade légère et molle","½ cuillère à café de zeste d''orange râpé","100g de farine complète","¼ cuillère à café de sel","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g de flocons d''avoine","25 g de noix de coco desséchée","50 g de noix concassées","75 g de raisins secs ou pépites de chocolat noir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nCrémer ensemble le beurre et le sucre\r\njusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et lisse.\r\nIncorporer progressivement la banane, la vanille\r\nextrait et œuf. Ajoutez le\r\nzeste. Bien mélanger avec une cuillère en bois\r\njusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Dans un grand bol, mélanger la farine, le sel,\r\nlevure chimique, flocons d''avoine, noix de coco,\r\nnoix et raisins secs ou chocolat\r\nchips. Incorporer les ingrédients secs\r\nle mouillé et bien mélanger jusqu''à ce qu''un\r\nune pâte épaisse se forme. Tapisser une pâtisserie\r\nfeuille de parchemin. Goutte amassée\r\nà soupe sur la feuille en laissant 5 cm\r\n(2 pouces) d''espace autour de chacun, et\r\nappuyez légèrement. Cuire au four pendant 15-20\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Cool."]','2026-01-11 00:01:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9656,8692,'fr','Biscuits d''anniversaire','Ces biscuits en forme d''anneau sont parfaits pour les fêtes et fonctionnent bien sous toutes les formes, demandez l''aide des enfants.','["250 g de farine blanche nature","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","175 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante, coupé en cubes","2 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","250 g de sucre glace blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de confiture de fraises (nous avons utilisé du St Dalfour)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4.  \r\nMettez la farine, le sucre et le beurre dans un aliment \r\nprocesseur. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que le mélange se forme \r\nmiettes, puis pulsez encore un peu jusqu''à ce que  \r\ncela forme une boule.","Etalez une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé \r\nsur le plan de travail et retournez la pâte \r\ndessus. Saupoudrez d''un peu de farine, puis étalez \r\nenviron l''épaisseur de deux pièces de 1 £. Timbre \r\nréaliser 24 tours à l''aide d''un rond cannelé de 5 cm \r\ncutter, puis découpez les milieux avec l''extrémité \r\nd''une buse de tuyauterie. Pelez soigneusement le reste de \r\nle mélange loin des formes estampées. \r\nDéposer sur des plaques à pâtisserie et enfourner 10 minutes \r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Mettez la crème de citron dans un bol avec 2 cuillères à soupe \r\neau bouillante et mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Tamiser \r\n175g de sucre glace ; mélanger pour faire \r\nun glaçage onctueux. Mettez la pâte à tartiner aux fraises \r\ndans un autre bol et ajoutez 2 cuillères à café d''eau bouillante, \r\nmélanger, puis tamiser avec le sucre glace restant.","Versez le glaçage au citron sur les biscuits, \r\npuis arrosez ou versez le glaçage au petit doigt. Partir \r\nlaisser reposer pendant au moins 20 minutes. Se conservera jusqu''à \r\n2 jours dans une boîte hermétique, plus longtemps si laissé sans glace."]','2026-01-11 00:01:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9657,8694,'fr','Biscuits à l''avoine','Biscuits à l''avoine, moelleux et épicés – prêts en moins d''une heure et parfaits pour l''heure du thé','["175g de beurre","175 g de sucre démérara","100 g de sirop doré","85 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","250 g de flocons d''avoine","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","100 g chacun d''abricots secs prêts à consommer, hachés et de gingembre en tige, haché","Paquet de 75 à 80 g de griottes séchées","2 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante","1 œuf moyen, battu"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/ventilateur 160C/gaz 4. Tapisser plusieurs plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé ou de plaques antiadhésives. Faites chauffer le beurre, le sucre et le sirop doré dans une grande casserole à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu. Incorporez la farine, le bicarbonate de soude, les flocons d''avoine, la cannelle, les fruits secs et le gingembre, puis l''eau et enfin l''œuf. Laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit facile à manipuler.","Avec les mains humides, façonnez le mélange en 18 grosses boules, puis aplatissez-les sur les plaques à pâtisserie – en laissant suffisamment d''espace pour l''étaler – et faites cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. (Cela donnera un biscuit moelleux et moelleux. Pour un biscuit plus croustillant, réduisez le feu à 160°C/ventilateur 140°C/gaz 3 et faites cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes.)","Laissez les biscuits refroidir brièvement sur les plateaux, puis placez-les sur une grille de refroidissement. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique, séparé de papier sulfurisé, jusqu''à 1 semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:01:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9658,7690,'fr','Sablés à la vanille saupoudrés de sucre','Idéals pour garder la boîte à biscuits remplie pendant Noël, ces sablés sucrés constituent un régal parfait','["1 quantité de pâte sablée vanille (voir ci-dessous)","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Avec vos mains, faites rouler le\r\npâte sur un plan légèrement fariné\r\nfaire surface en saucisse\r\nforme d''environ 25 cm/9 pouces de long\r\net 5 cm/2½ pouces de diamètre.\r\nEnveloppez le rouleau et réfrigérez pendant au\r\nau moins 1 heure. (Le rouleau peut être\r\ncongelé jusqu''à 6 semaines. À\r\nutiliser, sortir du congélateur\r\net laisser décongeler pendant une\r\nheure à température ambiante donc\r\nque la pâte est assez molle\r\nà couper en biscuits.)","Préchauffer le four à\r\n180C/gaz 4/chaleur tournante 160C et graisser légèrement 2 grands fours\r\nfeuilles. A l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé,\r\ncouper la pâte en tranches,\r\nchacun un généreux 5 mm/¼ po\r\népais, puis disposez-les\r\nsur la pâtisserie graissée\r\nfeuilles en espaçant les biscuits\r\nlégèrement écartés pour qu''ils aient\r\nun peu d''espace pour s''étendre\r\nils cuisinent.","Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles biscuits tournent juste\r\ndoré pâle autour du\r\nbords, puis transférer dans un\r\ngrille pour refroidir. Poussière\r\ngénéreusement avec du sucre glace.\r\nLes biscuits resteront frais\r\npendant une semaine maximum stocké dans\r\nune boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9659,8698,'fr','Biscuits de Hanoukka','Danielle Brown, lectrice de Good Food, partage la recette de sa grand-mère pour les savoureux biscuits Kaak, traditionnellement consommés pendant la fête juive de Hanoukka','["450 g de farine blanche forte","1 cuillère à café de graines de carvi","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","100 g de margarine à base d''huile, fondue","1 œuf battu"]','["Mettez la farine, ½ cuillère à café de sel, les graines de carvi et la levure dans un grand bol. Faites un puits au centre et versez-y la margarine fondue et 200 ml d''eau tiède. Mélangez pour combiner tous les ingrédients, en ajoutant plus d''eau ou de farine si nécessaire, puis pétrissez pendant 2 minutes pour former une pâte molle. Placer dans un bol huilé, couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser lever dans un endroit tiède pendant 1 h.","Une fois doublée de volume, pétrir la pâte pendant 1 min, puis diviser le mélange en 12 boules. Coupez chaque boule en deux et roulez chaque morceau en forme de fine saucisse. Torsadez les 2 pièces ensemble, puis joignez les extrémités pour\r\nformer un cercle. Disposez sur une plaque à pâtisserie légèrement graissée, couvrez d''un torchon et laissez lever à nouveau 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Badigeonner les biscuits d''un peu d''œuf battu et enfourner pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Retirer et laisser refroidir sur une grille, puis baisser le four à 110 °C/90 °C ventilateur/gaz 1 ?4. Une fois refroidis, remettez les biscuits au four et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes, puis éteignez complètement le feu et laissez sécher les biscuits au four pendant 2 heures."]','2026-01-11 00:01:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9660,8700,'fr','Biscottis fruités','Le cadeau parfait à préparer à l''avance, ils se conserveront jusqu''à un mois après la cuisson et seront vraiment impressionnants.','["350 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour rouler","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs battus","le zeste grossièrement râpé d''1 orange","85g de raisins secs","85g de cerises séchées","50 g d''amandes blanchies","50 g de pistaches décortiquées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/ventilateur 160C/gaz 4. Ligne\r\n2 plaques à pâtisserie avec du papier sulfurisé. Mettez le\r\nfarine, levure chimique, épices et sucre dans un grand\r\nbol, puis bien mélanger. Incorporer les œufs et le zeste\r\njusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à former des grumeaux, puis\r\nrassemblez la pâte avec vos mains – elle\r\nsemblera sec au début mais continuez à pétrir jusqu''à ce que non\r\ndes taches farineuses subsistent. Ajoutez les fruits et les noix,\r\npuis travaillez-les jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient uniformément répartis.","Déposez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné\r\nsurface et diviser en 4 morceaux. Avec légèreté\r\nmains farinées, rouler chaque morceau en boudin\r\nenviron 30 cm de long. Placez-en 2 sur chaque plateau, bien\r\nespacés. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla pâte a levé, s''est étalée et est ferme.\r\nIl devrait encore paraître pâle. Supprimer du\r\nau four, transférer sur une grille pendant quelques minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment froid pour être manipulé, puis baissez\r\nle four à 140C/chaleur tournante 120C/gaz 1.","A l''aide d''un couteau à pain, coupez des tranches d''environ 1 cm\r\népaisse en diagonale, puis disposer les tranches à plat\r\nles plaques à pâtisserie. Les biscuits peuvent être refroidis\r\net congelé à plat sur la feuille à ce stade, puis\r\nmis en sac et congelé jusqu’à 2 mois. Cuire au four\r\npendant encore 15 minutes (20 minutes si congelé),\r\nretournez puis enfournez à nouveau pendant 15 minutes supplémentaires\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient secs et dorés. Basculer sur une grille pour\r\nlaisser refroidir complètement, puis conserver dans une boîte hermétique\r\njusqu''à un mois, ou emballer dans des boîtes ou\r\nsacs en cellophane si vous les offrez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9661,8702,'fr','Biscuits aux morceaux de chocolat entièrement américains','Irrésistibles biscuits aux morceaux de chocolat All-American','["300 g de chocolat noir (environ 55 % de cacao)","100 g de tablette de chocolat au lait","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","85 g de beurre à température ambiante","100 g de beurre de cacahuète, le croquant est le meilleur","1 œuf moyen","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de farine autolevante","100 g de grosses cacahuètes grillées salées"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/gaz 4/chaleur tournante 160°C. Rassemblez et pesez tous les ingrédients.","Coupez 200 g de chocolat nature en morceaux grossiers et irréguliers. Hachez le chocolat au lait de la même manière, mais gardez-le à part.","Cassez le reste du chocolat nature dans un grand bol à mélanger résistant à la chaleur. Faire fondre au micro-ondes à feu moyen pendant environ 11 à 2 minutes (ou sur une casserole d''eau frémissante).","Remuez le chocolat jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu, puis ajoutez le sucre, le beurre, le beurre de cacahuète, l''œuf et la vanille et battez avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporez la farine, tous les morceaux de chocolat au lait, les noix (pas besoin de les hacher) et la moitié des morceaux de chocolat noir. Le mélange sera assez mou au toucher et tombera facilement de la cuillère si vous le secouez.","Déposez de grosses cuillerées en 12 tas sur 2 ou 3 plaques à pâtisserie, en laissant de la place pour qu''elles s''étalent (vous devrez peut-être cuire par lots). Collez les morceaux restants dans les biscuits (2-3 morceaux chacun).","Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement plus foncés sur les bords. L''odeur vous fera savoir qu''ils sont prêts. Ils seront mous au milieu, mais croustillants en refroidissant. (Cuisinez plus longtemps et vous obtiendrez des biscuits plus croustillants.) Laissez-les refroidir et raffermir pendant quelques minutes sur la plaque à pâtisserie (ils se briseront si vous les déplacez alors qu''ils sont encore chauds), puis décollez-les avec une large spatule sur une grille de refroidissement. Ils se conserveront croustillants dans une boîte hermétique pendant 3 à 4 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9662,8704,'fr','Macarons noix de coco et chocolat','Un délicieux macaron au goût tropical de noix de coco fraîche','["1 blanc d''oeuf","200 g de sucre en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","200 g de noix de coco fraîche râpée grossièrement (environ 1 noix de coco au total)","150 g de tablette de chocolat noir haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Dans un bol propre, fouetter les blancs d''œufs en neige ferme puis ajouter progressivement le sucre en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient épais et brillants. Tamisez la farine, puis incorporez-la aux blancs d''œufs avec la noix de coco jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","À l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 8 cm, écrasez des cuillerées du mélange sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif ou de feuilles de plastique silicone – vous devrez peut-être le faire en deux fois.  Cuire au four pendant 15 à 18 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés et que le dessus commence tout juste à dorer. Laisser refroidir, puis transférer sur une grille.","Pendant que les macarons refroidissent, faites fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes ou dans une casserole d''eau chaude et laissez refroidir légèrement. Recouvrez le côté lisse de chocolat et laissez prendre au réfrigérateur. Les macarons se conservent 2 jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9663,8706,'fr','Biscuits aux pommes et au caramel','Ce sont vraiment délicieux – croustillants sur les bords, moelleux au centre','["175 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 jaunes d''œufs","50g d''amandes moulues","85 g de caramels mous, hachés grossièrement","85 g de morceaux de pommes séchées prêts à manger, hachés grossièrement","225 g de farine autolevante","2 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante 170C/conventionnel 190C/gaz 5. Utilisation\r\nun fouet électrique, battre ensemble\r\nle beurre et le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils blanchissent\r\net crémeux.","Incorporer les jaunes d''œufs moulus\r\namandes, caramels, pommes séchées et\r\nfarine. Bien mélanger puis rouler\r\nboules de la taille d''une noix.","Placer bien espacés sur deux plaques antiadhésives\r\nou des plaques à pâtisserie tapissées et aplatir\r\nlégèrement avec la main. Badigeonner avec\r\nlait et cuire au four pendant 8 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Laisser raffermir 5\r\nminutes, puis transférer sur une grille\r\net laissez refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9664,8708,'fr','Gruau aux bleuets et aux pacanes','Préparez deux fois la quantité de cette pâte à biscuits fruitée et congelez-la pour que de délicieux biscuits faits maison soient toujours à portée de main.','["175 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","85 g de flocons d''avoine","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","140 g de beurre haché","Paquet de 70 g de myrtilles séchées (ou utilisez des raisins secs ou des canneberges séchées)","50 g de noix de pécan grossièrement cassées","1 œuf battu"]','["Versez la farine, la levure chimique, les flocons d''avoine,\r\nsucre et cannelle dans un bol, puis mélanger\r\nbien avec vos mains. Ajoutez le beurre, puis\r\nfrottez-le dans le mélange jusqu''à ce qu''il disparaisse.","Incorporer les myrtilles et les pacanes,\r\najouter l''œuf, puis bien mélanger avec des couverts\r\ncouteau ou cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que tout vienne\r\nensemble dans un grand bal. Fariner légèrement le travail\r\nsurface, puis rouler la pâte en un gros boudin\r\nenviron 6 cm de diamètre. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire, puis\r\nréfrigérer au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce qu''il soit solide.","Pour cuire, chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante à 160°C/\r\ngaz 4. Déballez la bûche à biscuits, coupez-la en tranches épaisses\r\nen disques, puis disposer sur des plaques à pâtisserie.\r\nEnfourner 15 minutes (ou quelques minutes de plus si\r\ncongelé) jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, laisser sur les plaques\r\ndurcir, puis refroidir complètement sur un fil\r\ngrille avant de ranger."]','2026-01-11 00:01:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9665,8710,'fr','Boutons de crème aux amandes et au citron','Caché à l''intérieur de ces biscuits friables se trouve un cœur de crème au citron, donnant une explosion de saveur inattendue.','["250 g de beurre ramolli","140 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un supplément","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","zester 2 citrons","300 g de farine nature","100 g d''amandes moulues","un peu de lait, pour sceller","environ 3 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","amandes effilées, pour le dessus"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/chaleur tournante 170C/gaz 5.\r\nBattre le beurre, le sucre, l''oeuf, la vanille, le zeste\r\net une pincée de sel dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisser, puis incorporer la farine et le moulu\r\namandes. Former 2 ronds, aplatir\r\npuis enveloppez-les dans du film alimentaire et mettez-les au frais.\r\njusqu''à consistance ferme, environ 30 minutes.","Etalez 1 morceau de pâte sur un plan fariné\r\nsurface jusqu''à environ 1 £ d''épaisseur, puis\r\nDécoupez des ronds avec un emporte-pièce de 7 cm.\r\nBadigeonner le tout de lait, puis verser à la cuillère\r\n20 gouttes de crème au citron dans le\r\nmilieu de la moitié des tours.","Posez soigneusement les tours restants\r\nsur la crème au citron, puis délicatement\r\nappuyez sur les bords avec vos doigts\r\npour sceller. Parsemer d''un peu de sucre en poudre\r\net les amandes effilées. Enfourner 15 mn\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Répétez avec le reste\r\npâtisserie, puis écrasez les chutes ensemble\r\net relancez. Vous pouvez congeler les biscuits\r\navant la cuisson, mais ajoutez jusqu''à 5 minutes de plus\r\nau temps de cuisson."]','2026-01-11 00:01:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9666,8712,'fr','Biscuits gluants au chocolat et aux cerises','Si vous aimez les cookies à l’américaine, vous adorerez ces délices pâles et moelleux. De plus, ils peuvent être cuits surgelés','["200 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","85 g de sucre muscovado léger","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 oeuf","225 g de farine autolevante","50 g de chocolat noir, 50-70 % de cacao, haché grossièrement","50 g de chocolat blanc haché grossièrement","85 g de cerises glacées de couleur naturelle, hachées grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/chaleur tournante 170C/gaz 5.\r\nBattre le beurre, les sucres et l''œuf jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisser, puis incorporer la farine, les chocolats\r\net des morceaux de cerises et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Cuillère\r\nsur des plaques à pâtisserie antiadhésives en grand\r\nblobs bruts – vous en tirerez 20\r\nmélanger. Assurez-vous qu''ils sont bien espacés\r\nles cookies se développent considérablement à mesure qu''ils\r\ncuire. La pâte crue peut être congelée.","Cuire au four pendant 12 à 14 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste dorés,\r\nmais encore assez pâle et doux au milieu.\r\nSi vous cuisez surgelé, donnez-leur quelques\r\nminutes de plus. Laisser refroidir sur les feuilles pendant 5 minutes,\r\npuis soulevez-le sur des grilles avec une tranche de poisson et\r\nlaisser refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9667,8714,'fr','Pain chaud à la citrouille et au miel','Mélangez de la citrouille moelleuse, du miel chaud et un soupçon d’épices pour obtenir ce pain moelleux et savoureux. C''est une pâtisserie d''automne réconfortante, idéale pour le thé de l''après-midi','["175 g de beurre ramolli","140 g de miel chaud ou de miel clair mélangé à une pincée de flocons de piment, plus un peu pour servir","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 oeuf , battu","250 g de potiron pelé et grossièrement râpé","350 g de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","beurre ou crème fraîche, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 1,5kg de papier sulfurisé.","Mélangez le beurre avec le miel chaud, le sucre et l''œuf dans un grand bol. Incorporez le potiron râpé, puis mélangez la farine, la levure chimique et la cannelle.","Versez le mélange dans le moule à pain préparé et nivelez le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés. Arroser le dessus d''1 cuillère à café de miel chaud. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes dans le moule, puis démouler sur une grille.","Servir des tranches épaisses encore chaudes avec du beurre ou de la crème fraîche et du miel encore chaud, ou laisser refroidir complètement et griller les tranches pour servir de la même manière. Se conserve plusieurs jours dans un endroit frais. Vous pouvez trancher une fois refroidi et congeler, puis décongeler si nécessaire."]','2026-01-11 00:01:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9668,3662,'fr','Pain aux olives','Faites cuire un pain parsemé d''olives vertes et noires, à déguster simplement tartiné de beurre, ou à tremper dans une soupe ou un ragoût de style méditerranéen.','["Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","550 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","1 cuillère à soupe d''origan séché","100 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement, plus 1 cuillère à soupe de saumure","100 g d''olives noires dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","semoule, pour saupoudrer"]','["Versez la levure, la farine, le sel, l''origan séché, les olives, la saumure d''olive et l''huile d''olive dans un batteur sur socle équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur, avec 300 ml d''eau tiède. Mélangez à basse vitesse pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et élastique. Tapisser un bol d’un torchon propre. Formez une boule de pâte, puis transférez-la dans le bol, joint vers le haut. Couvrir et réfrigérer pendant au moins quelques heures jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume, ou jusqu''à 24 heures (plus cela dure longtemps, plus la saveur sera profonde).","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à cuire, chauffez le four à 240°C/220°C chaleur tournante/gaz 9 avec une grande cocotte à couvercle à l''intérieur pendant 30 minutes. Retirez le couvercle de la cocotte et saupoudrez un peu de semoule sur une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé. Transférez délicatement la pâte, joint vers le bas, sur le papier sulfurisé. Sortez la cocotte du four et mettez-y la pâte, puis couvrez avec le couvercle. Cuire au four pendant 40 minutes, puis retirer le couvercle et cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le pain soit doré et que le fond soit creux lorsqu''on le tapote. Se conserve couvert à température ambiante jusqu''à trois jours ou réfrigéré jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:01:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9669,8716,'fr','Focaccia chargée de tomates, burrata et jambon','Savourez ces foccacia chargées avec une salade de feuilles en accompagnement pour un déjeuner satisfaisant. Vous pouvez utiliser du pesto frais du commerce si vous n’avez pas le temps de préparer le vôtre','["400 g de farine à pain blanche forte","Sachet de 5 g de levure séchée à action rapide","50 ml d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la plaque à pâtisserie et pour arroser","1 cuillère à soupe de semoule ou de polenta","600 g de tomates mélangées, une variété de couleurs et de tailles fonctionnent bien, les plus grosses coupées en deux ou en quartiers","4 gousses d''ail entières, non pelées","2 boules de burrata de 250g","6 tranches de prosciutto","un petit bouquet de basilic et quelques feuilles pour servir","25 g de pignons de pin grillés","25g de parmesan","1 citron zesté et un filet de jus","1 gousse d''ail","75 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu pour arroser"]','["Préparez la pâte la veille de la cuisson de la focaccia. Mélangez la farine, la levure, 1 cuillère à café de sel et 275 ml d''eau tiède dans un grand bol ou dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle muni d''un crochet pétrisseur. La pâte doit être bien humide et collante. Travaillez-le quelques minutes en l''étirant et en le repliant dans le bol à la main, ou en laissant le crochet pétrisseur faire le travail. Avec les mains mouillées, formez une boule de pâte grossière, puis couvrez le bol, mettez au réfrigérateur et laissez reposer toute la nuit.","Pour préparer le pesto, mélangez tous les ingrédients avec une bonne pincée de sel et un zeste de poivre noir. Transférer dans un bol et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à une semaine ou au congélateur pendant deux mois.","Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et laissez-la à température ambiante pendant 1 à 2 heures, jusqu''à ce qu''elle ait doublé de volume et que l''extérieur du bol ait perdu sa fraîcheur. Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7.","Huiler une plaque à pâtisserie de 22 cm x 32 cm et saupoudrer de semoule. Versez doucement la pâte du bol sur le plateau et, en travaillant avec des mains huilées, étirez-la pour qu''elle s''adapte au plateau. Laisser lever 30 min dans un endroit tiède.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les tomates et les gousses d''ail dans un plat à rôtir. Bien assaisonner et arroser d''un peu d''huile. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes, puis laisser refroidir 10 minutes.","Versez les tomates chaudes sur la pâte à focaccia, en les arrosant du jus huileux contenu dans le bol. Retirez les gousses d''ail de leur peau et pressez-les entre vos doigts en petits morceaux, parsemez l''ail doux sur les tomates. Saupoudrer de sel feuilleté et cuire au four chaud pendant 30 minutes.","Lorsque la focaccia est cuite, laissez-la refroidir pendant au moins 15 à 45 minutes (ou laissez-la refroidir et réchauffez-la avant de servir). Coupez la focaccia en 8 gros rectangles puis déchirez chaque burrata en quatre et déposez un morceau sur chaque morceau. Disposez des rubans de prosciutto sur le dessus, puis versez dessus le pesto frais, parsemez de feuilles de basilic et arrosez d''un peu d''huile d''olive extra vierge."]','2026-01-11 00:01:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9670,8718,'fr','Pain à l''ail cheddar et harissa','Faites passer votre pain à l''ail au niveau supérieur avec ce pain à démonter rempli de fromage fondu et légèrement épicé d''harissa.','["500 g de miche de pain blanc croustillante Morrisons Market Street (une boule au levain fonctionne bien)","100 g de beurre salé ramolli","2-3 cuillères à soupe d''harissa (selon le degré de piquant que vous aimez)","3 grosses gousses d''ail, râpées","75 g de cheddar affiné, râpé grossièrement","75 g de mozzarella râpée"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Couper la miche de pain Morrisons à intervalles de 2 cm en diagonale à l''aide d''un couteau dentelé, en allant presque jusqu''au bout, puis répéter dans le sens opposé pour créer un motif en losange. Disposez le pain sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé.","Mettez le beurre, la harissa et l''ail dans un petit bol et battez ensemble à l''aide d''une spatule ou d''une cuillère en bois. Assaisonner avec un peu de sel et de poivre.","Étalez le beurre dans les coupes du pain, puis saupoudrez les deux fromages dans les coupes et sur le dessus du pain, en vous assurant que chaque espace est rempli de beurre et de fromage. Bien envelopper dans du papier d''aluminium.","Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, puis retirer le papier d''aluminium du dessus et remettre au four encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu, doré et gluant. Servir entier pour que tout le monde puisse déchirer et partager."]','2026-01-11 00:01:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9671,8720,'fr','Petits pains au lait','Utilisez la méthode « tangzhong » (faire une pâte semblable à un roux à ajouter à la pâte) pour donner au pain de ces petits pains au lait une excellente levée et une texture moelleuse et moelleuse.','["125 ml de lait, de préférence du lait entier, plus un peu pour le glaçage","7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","350 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de sucre en poudre","1 oeuf","50 g de beurre doux, ramolli et coupé en cubes","huile au goût neutre, comme le tournesol, pour prouver","20 g de farine à pain blanche forte","60 ml de lait, entier de préférence"]','["Tapisser un moule à pâtisserie à bords hauts de 20 x 30 cm de papier sulfurisé. Pour réaliser le tangzhong, mettez la farine, le lait et 30 ml d''eau dans une petite casserole. Faites chauffer à feu moyen jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse, puis réservez jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit à température ambiante.","Versez le lait dans une casserole et faites chauffer à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste chaud. Vous pouvez également le réchauffer au micro-ondes par tranches de 10 secondes, mais veillez à ne pas le faire bouillir. Incorporer la levure pour bien mélanger. Mélangez la farine, le sucre et 1 cuillère à café de sel marin fin dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle muni d''un crochet pétrisseur. Pendant que le batteur est en marche, ajoutez le mélange d''œufs, de tangzhong et de lait. Pétrir 2 min, puis ajouter le beurre petit à petit. Continuez à pétrir pendant encore 7 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit douce, élastique et légèrement collante. Former une boule et mettre dans un bol propre légèrement huilé. Couvrir et laisser lever pendant environ 2 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. Se conservera au frais toute la nuit. Porter à température ambiante, puis laisser lever jusqu''à doubler avant de poursuivre.","Saupoudrez légèrement un plan de travail propre de farine et remuez la pâte pendant 10 secondes. Divisez-la en huit morceaux (environ 85 g chacun) et formez de petites boules. Mettez les boules dans le moule préparé et couvrez. Laisser lever pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Badigeonner généreusement d''un peu de lait les petits pains pour les glacer et cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 à 20 minutes avant de transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conservera dans un récipient hermétique pendant trois jours ou congelé pendant deux mois."]','2026-01-11 00:01:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9672,7397,'fr','Pittas moelleux','Essayez de préparer ces pittas à la grecque qui sont plus moelleuses que celles que vous trouverez dans la plupart des magasins. Remplissez de poulet ou de porc grillé, de salade et de tzatziki pour un faux kebab satisfaisant','["500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de thym frais (facultatif)","200 ml de lait","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu plus pour la levée et le badigeonnage"]','["Quelques heures avant de manger, préparez la pâte. Mélangez la farine, la levure, le sucre, le thym, le cas échéant, et 2 cuillères à café de sel dans un bol du bout des doigts. Versez dessus le lait, l''huile d''olive et 100 ml d''eau tiède et, toujours avec les doigts, mélangez pour obtenir une pâte. Verser sur un plan de travail et pétrir pendant 8 à 10 minutes (ou passer au batteur sur socle pendant 5 minutes). Nettoyer puis huiler légèrement un bol, mettre la pâte dans le bol et couvrir d''un torchon. Laisser lever pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double presque de volume. Si vous souhaitez vous accorder plus de temps, la pâte mettra plus de temps à lever au réfrigérateur (au moins 2h).","Divisez la pâte en huit morceaux égaux. Un à un, sur une surface légèrement farinée, étalez-les en cercles d''environ 20 cm de large, puis badigeonnez-les d''un peu plus d''huile d''olive et faites cuire sur le côté chaud du barbecue pendant 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient gonflés et cloqués. Vous pouvez également faire chauffer une poêle ou une plaque chauffante (ou deux si vous le pouvez) à feu moyen-vif et cuire une à une dans chaque poêle jusqu''à ce que des bulles apparaissent à la surface après 1 à 2 minutes. Lorsque le dessous est doré, retournez-le et laissez cuire encore 2 à 3 minutes. Continuez jusqu''à ce que tous les pittas soient cuits, en les enveloppant dans du papier d''aluminium au fur et à mesure pour les garder au chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:01:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9673,6203,'fr','Pain à partager à l''ail et aux olives noires','Rassemblez des amis pour un festin et servez ce pain à partager parfumé à l''ail et aux olives noires. Il peut être préparé jusqu''à trois jours à l''avance','["300 ml de lait entier","140 g de beurre doux coupé en cubes","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe de persil finement haché","140 g d''olives noires dénoyautées et hachées finement (les Kalamata fonctionnent bien)","huile végétale, pour lever"]','["Faites chauffer 80 ml de lait dans une petite casserole à feu doux ou au micro-ondes et ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de sel marin. Remuer pour dissoudre et laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, faites fondre dans une casserole à feu moyen la moitié du beurre dans 200 ml de lait avec le sucre et la moitié de l''ail. Laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tiède.","Versez la farine et la levure dans le grand bol du batteur sur socle et mélangez à l''aide du crochet pétrisseur. Incorporez progressivement le mélange beurre fondu et lait. Une fois que la pâte commence à se rassembler, ajoutez le lait salé, le persil et la moitié des olives. Continuez à mélanger pendant 6 minutes à l''aide du crochet pétrisseur, ou démoulez sur un plan légèrement fariné et pétrissez à la main pendant 10 minutes.","Huiler le bol, ajouter la pâte, puis frotter le dessus avec de l''huile. Couvrir d''un torchon et laisser dans un endroit chaud pendant au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste du beurre dans une petite casserole à feu doux et ajoutez le reste de l''ail écrasé et le reste des olives. Faites chauffer l''ail et les olives quelques minutes, puis laissez refroidir.","Une fois la pâte levée, étalez-la sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et remuez-la délicatement. Divisez-le en sept morceaux, entre 130 et 140 g chacun, et roulez-les en boules serrées, en repliant les bords en dessous pour que les boules soient parfaitement lisses avec les coutures sur la face inférieure. Disposer dans un moule à gâteau rond de 20 à 23 cm recouvert de papier sulfurisé, en veillant à ce que les boules de pâte soient également espacées sur le pourtour, avec une au milieu. Couvrir d''un torchon et laisser lever jusqu''à ce qu''il double à nouveau de volume, environ 20 à 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Badigeonner la pâte avec le beurre à l''ail en évitant les olives. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré et bien cuit. Verser sur le reste du beurre à l''ail avec les olives. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours dans un récipient hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9674,4505,'fr','Gory tripes la pizza déchire et partage le pain','Organisez une fête d''Halloween inoubliable avec ce pain sanglant à déchirer et à partager. Préparez une base de sauce tomate et utilisez les garnitures à pizza de votre choix','["500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","250 g de mozzarella ou de cheddar râpé, ou utiliser un mélange","garnitures de pizza de votre choix (nous avons utilisé des olives et du jambon)","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre à l''ail et aux herbes"]','["Versez la farine dans un grand bol. Ajoutez la levure d''un côté du bol et 2 cuillères à café de sel de l''autre. Versez 300 ml d''eau tiède et mélangez avec une cuillère en bois ou dans un batteur sur socle équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle (vous devrez peut-être ajouter jusqu''à 25 ml d''eau supplémentaire si la pâte semble sèche). Pétrir sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné pendant 10 min ou au batteur pendant 5 min jusqu''à obtenir une pâte souple et extensible. Frottez un peu d''huile sur la boule de pâte, puis mettez-la dans un bol propre et couvrez d''un torchon. Laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 2 heures, ou réfrigérer toute la nuit (ou jusqu''à 24 heures).","Faites chauffer le reste de l’huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites grésiller l’ail pendant 30 secondes – ne le laissez pas dorer. Ajoutez les tomates, l''origan et 2 cuillères à café de sucre. Assaisonnez bien. Réduisez le feu à doux-moyen et faites bouillir pendant 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce soit épaisse et riche. Utilisez un presse-purée pour écraser les morceaux de tomates restants dans la sauce. Laisser refroidir jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser. Une fois complètement refroidi, se conserve au réfrigérateur dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à trois jours ou au congélateur pendant six mois.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à assembler, étalez la sauce sur le fond d''un plat allant au four plus grand (le nôtre mesurait 40 x 30 cm). Etalez la pâte sur un plan fariné en un rectangle de 60 x 30 cm. Coupez le rectangle en deux dans le sens de la longueur pour obtenir deux rectangles plus petits mesurant 15 x 30 cm. Empilez le fromage au centre de chaque rectangle et ajoutez les garnitures de pizza de votre choix. Pincez les côtés longs des rectangles ensemble pour enfermer les garnitures – faites-le avec précaution afin de ne pas casser la pâte. Pressez chaque longue saucisse sur toute la longueur pour vous assurer qu''elle est bien scellée et étirez-la doucement pour la rendre légèrement plus longue. Disposez les saucisses de pâte sur la sauce, joint vers le bas, en les remuant en forme d''intestins mais en laissant un peu d''espace entre elles pour que le pain se dilate pendant la cuisson. Couvrir et laisser lever à température ambiante pendant 30 minutes ou réfrigérer jusqu''à 8 heures. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C/gaz 6.","Cuire au four 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que le pain soit bien doré. Badigeonner de beurre à l''ail et aux herbes, puis laisser refroidir au moins 10 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9675,3890,'fr','Pain naan facile','Préparez du pain naan moelleux et moelleux garni de beurre à l''ail et aux herbes. Un plat d’accompagnement parfait à tremper dans les currys, c’est super facile à préparer','["570 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de sucre","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ à 1 cuillère à café de graines au goût prononcé, comme les graines de nigelle ou de cumin (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre fondu","8 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature","huile, pour le bol","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Mettez la farine dans un grand bol, puis ajoutez le sucre, la levure chimique et 1½ cuillère à café de sel. Ajoutez les graines, si vous le souhaitez. Fouetter légèrement pour disperser les ingrédients uniformément dans la farine.","Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre fondu, suivi du yaourt nature. Mélangez avec vos mains. Une fois le yaourt et le beurre absorbés, ajoutez progressivement 180 à 200 ml d''eau, 50 ml à la fois. Mélanger entre les ajouts, jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à former une pâte. La quantité d’eau dépendra de la consistance du yaourt et du beurre – arrêtez d’en ajouter lorsque vous obtenez une boule de pâte.","Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez soigneusement pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Mettre dans un bol à mélanger huilé, couvrir d''un torchon et laisser reposer au moins 1 h. La pâte ne lèvera pas mais il est important de la laisser reposer car cela contribue à rendre les naans moins moelleux et plus moelleux.","Si vous préparez le beurre à l''ail, mélangez l''ail avec 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre fondu restant et la coriandre. Annuler.","Divisez la pâte en huit, 10 ou 12 morceaux de taille égale, selon la taille souhaitée des naans. Rouler en boules rondes, puis remettre dans le bol recouvert d''un torchon.","Abaissez l''une des boules de pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée pour lui donner une forme ronde, ovale ou en forme de larme – roulez-la en effectuant un mouvement en diagonale pour obtenir un ovale. Retournez la pâte et répétez de l''autre côté.","Faites chauffer une poêle. Faites frire la pâte à sec à feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à gonfler et que le dessous brunisse par endroits. Retournez et répétez de l’autre côté. Retirez le naan cuit de la poêle. Versez un peu de beurre à l''ail sur le naan, le cas échéant. Saupoudrez d''un peu de coriandre, si vous le souhaitez. Couvrez d''un torchon pendant que vous répétez l''opération avec les boules de pâte restantes."]','2026-01-11 00:01:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9676,5667,'fr','Sarnies de steak style chimichurri et frites épicées de cheat','Rehaussez un sandwich au steak avec une sauce chimichurri piquante et piquante, de la mayonnaise chipotle et des frites épicées de style cajun en accompagnement.','["2 x 200 g de rumsteck dégraissé","2 longs rouleaux ciabatta","2 poignées de roquette","30 ml d''huile de tournesol","270 g de frites surgelées du commerce","Mélange d''épices cajun","70 g de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à café de pâte de piment chipotle","½ citron vert, zesté et pressé","1 banane échalote, pelée et hachée grossièrement","1 piment rouge, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1½ cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","petit bouquet de persil","petit bouquet de coriandre","50 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Chauffez le four à son réglage le plus élevé. Pour les frites, versez l''huile de tournesol dans une plaque à pâtisserie et enfournez 15 min pour qu''elle soit bien chaude. Réduisez la température à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz. 8. Plongez les frites dans l''huile, retournez-les pour les enrober et laissez cuire 20 minutes. Ajouter le mélange d''épices cajun et remettre au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la mayonnaise en mélangeant tous les ingrédients dans un bol. Annuler.","Pour la sauce style chimichurri, mélangez tous les ingrédients jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse, puis assaisonnez au goût. Annuler.","Chauffer la poêle à feu vif. Frottez les steaks avec du sel uniquement (le poivre va accrocher et brûler), mettre les steaks dans la poêle et cuire 3 minutes de chaque côté (à feu moyen). Retirer de la poêle, couvrir de papier d''aluminium et laisser reposer 10 minutes.","Coupez les rouleaux ciabatta en deux, faites-les griller dans la même poêle à frire dans laquelle vous avez cuit le steak, côté coupé vers le bas, et étalez la moitié de chacun avec la mayonnaise chipotle. Coupez le steak en lanières, répartissez-le entre les ciabattas, arrosez de chimichurri et ajoutez un peu de roquette. Servir avec les frites et les restes de mayonnaise."]','2026-01-11 00:01:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9677,6916,'fr','Steak façon pastrami & mayonnaise à la moutarde','Associez la choucroute et la mayonnaise à la moutarde avec un steak pour créer une combinaison sensationnelle. Servir avec des frites ou de la purée, ou en faire un incroyable sandwich au steak','["2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","2 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise","2 x 250 g de surlonge ou de faux-filet","huile de tournesol ou végétale, pour arroser","50g de beurre","150g de choucroute"]','["Mélangez la mayonnaise avec la moutarde et réservez. Assaisonnez les steaks. Faites chauffer un filet d''huile et le beurre dans une grande poêle à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''ils grésillent et prennent une couleur noisette. Faites cuire les steaks 1 à 2 minutes d''un côté, puis retournez-les et laissez cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes. Retournez à nouveau et continuez ce processus pendant 6 à 7 minutes au total pour une cuisson saignante, 8 à 9 minutes pour une cuisson mi-saignante et 10 minutes pour une cuisson mi-saignante. Retourner les steaks les aide à cuire uniformément et à former une croûte uniforme.","Lorsque les steaks sont cuits à votre goût, transférez-les sur une planche et laissez reposer. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire la choucroute dans la poêle avec le jus de steak collant pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien chaude et dorée. Servir les steaks avec la choucroute et la mayonnaise à la moutarde en accompagnement, ou verser la choucroute sur les steaks."]','2026-01-11 00:01:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9678,7439,'fr','Pains plats rapides et gonflés','Préparez ces pains plats rapides pour un festin à l''indienne. Ils ressemblent à une version trichée du pain naan et sont parfaits pour éponger un curry.','["300 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","150g de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","ghee ou beurre fondu, pour badigeonner","graines de cumin, gousses d''ail hachées, coriandre hachée ou piments hachés (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez la farine, la levure chimique, le yaourt et l''huile avec 1 cuillère à café de sel et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et formez une pâte grossière. Versez sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrissez pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement lisse, puis divisez en quatre à huit morceaux, selon la taille du pain plat souhaité.","Faites chauffer une poêle à fond épais à feu vif. Pour faire des pains plats de base, étalez les pâtons sur une surface légèrement farinée en ovales rugueux, puis faites-les frire pendant 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et légèrement carbonisés par endroits. Vous pouvez également étaler les morceaux de pâte, badigeonner d''un peu de ghee ou de beurre fondu et parsemer de graines de cumin, d''ail, de coriandre ou de piment, si vous le souhaitez. Replier chaque morceau de pâte sur lui-même, puis l''étaler à nouveau en un ovale grossier et cuire de la même manière.","Badigeonnez les pains plats d''un peu de beurre fondu ou de ghee, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9679,8722,'fr','Chapelure maison','Apprenez à faire de la chapelure à la maison avec notre recette et notre méthode ultra simples. Utilisez-les comme enrobage croustillant pour les aliments frits, pour garnir une tarte à la mélasse ou pour garnir des pâtes.','["2 tranches de pain blanc d''un jour (sans croûte, si vous préférez)"]','["Pour faire de la chapelure fraîche, déchirez le pain en morceaux et déposez-le dans un robot culinaire équipé d''une lame. Pulsez jusqu''à obtenir de la chapelure de la taille souhaitée. Si vous souhaitez obtenir une chapelure très homogène, passez-la au tamis grossier. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique à température ambiante jusqu''à une semaine.","Pour faire de la chapelure séchée, déchirez le pain en morceaux et faites cuire à four doux jusqu''à ce que les morceaux soient complètement secs. Passer au robot culinaire comme avant. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux mois ou au congélateur pendant six mois."]','2026-01-11 00:01:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9680,8724,'fr','Cinabon géant','Amenez les tourbillons de cannelle à un nouveau niveau de gourmandise avec cette version géante. Parfait pour une fête, cela demande un peu plus d''effort mais les résultats en valent la peine','["200 ml de lait","50 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","450 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","75 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 œuf battu","huile végétale, pour le bol","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","150 g de beurre ramolli","2 cuillères à soupe de cannelle moulue","100g de sucre glace","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Pour la pâte, faites chauffer doucement le lait et le beurre jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit à peine fondu. Laisser refroidir jusqu’à ce qu’il soit juste tiède au toucher (il ne devrait pas être chaud). Versez la farine dans un grand bol avec la levure, la cannelle, le sucre et une pincée de sel. Versez le mélange tiède de beurre et de lait avec l''œuf, puis mélangez avec vos mains jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte se forme. Versez la pâte sur une surface farinée et pétrissez pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit élastique. Alternativement, vous pouvez le faire dans un batteur sur socle équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur – la pâte ne nécessitera qu''environ 5 minutes de pétrissage avec cette méthode. Formez une boule avec la pâte, puis placez-la dans un bol huilé. Couvrir d''un torchon propre et laisser lever environ 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Pendant ce temps, battez les ingrédients de la garniture avec une petite pincée de sel à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement mélangé. Annuler. Beurrer un moule à charnière ou un moule à cake de 20 cm de diamètre. Versez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrissez brièvement pour chasser l''air. Laissez reposer quelques minutes, puis étalez-le en un rectangle de 30 x 50 cm et posez-le sur le support de manière à ce que le bord court soit face à vous. Étaler sur la garniture pour recouvrir entièrement le rectangle de pâte. Coupez la pâte en quatre bandes sur toute la longueur. Enroulez la première bande en une spirale serrée à partir de l''extrémité courte, puis placez la spirale à l''extrémité courte de la deuxième bande et enroulez-la en spirale autour de la première. Placez cette spirale plus grande à l''extrémité courte de la troisième bande et enroulez-la à nouveau, puis répétez avec la dernière bande de pâte. Vous devriez vous retrouver avec une grosse brioche à la cannelle. Transférer dans le moule préparé, couvrir d''un torchon propre et laisser lever 45 minutes à 1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il ait augmenté d''environ un tiers.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Placer le moule à gâteau sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 50 minutes-1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé, doré et bien cuit. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sucre glace, la vanille et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage lâche que l''on peut arroser en filet. Laissez refroidir le pain dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis démoulez-le, arrosez-le de glaçage et laissez-le refroidir complètement sur une grille. Servir en tranches ou laisser tout le monde le séparer. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9681,5928,'fr','Restes de sandwich de Noël','Faites passer votre sarnie du Boxing Day au niveau supérieur. Évidez une miche de pain et superposez tous vos restes de Noël à l''intérieur pour faire un sandwich qui fera claquer les lèvres.','["400 g de pain blanc rond et croustillant","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","2 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise","3-4 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux canneberges","une poignée de pousses d''épinards","3-4 cuillères à soupe d''oignons croustillants","250 g de restes de dinde rôtie","6 restes de porc cuits dans des couvertures, coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur","150 g de restes de farce cuite"]','["Coupez un couvercle d''environ 3 cm sur le dessus du pain. Retirez la majeure partie du pain de la miche et du couvercle en laissant environ 1 cm de couche (vous pouvez utiliser le pain évidé pour les croûtons ou dans une autre recette).","Mélangez la mayonnaise et la moutarde, puis étalez 2 cuillères à soupe sur l''intérieur du pain et 1 cuillère à soupe à l''intérieur du couvercle. Versez la majeure partie de la sauce aux canneberges dans le couvercle, suivie de la moitié des épinards, des oignons croustillants et de la moitié de la dinde. Disposer le reste de la dinde dans le fond du pain, suivi du reste de la sauce aux canneberges, des cochons en couvertures, de la farce et du reste des épinards. Garnir le pain avec le couvercle farci, appuyer légèrement, puis envelopper hermétiquement et réfrigérer pendant au moins 3 heures. Couper en quatre ou six quartiers pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9682,8726,'fr','Grand-mère orange chocolat','Préparez une babka au chocolat et à l''orange pour une gâterie époustouflante à Noël. La babka est une pâte à pain enrichie généralement préparée dans un moule à pain, mais nous l''avons façonnée en couronne.','["100 ml de lait entier","550 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","100 g de sucre en poudre","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","4 gros œufs, à température ambiante","150 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante, coupé en cubes","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","30g de cacao en poudre","125 g de chocolat noir finement haché","100 g de beurre doux haché","3 oranges, zestées","100 g de sucre en poudre","3 oranges pressées (ou utiliser le jus de 2 oranges mélangé avec 25 ml de triple sec), plus 1 orange, le zeste pelé et coupé finement en lanières"]','["Faites chauffer le lait dans une petite casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tiède, mais pas brûlant. Annuler. Mettez la farine dans le bol du batteur sur socle. Ajoutez ½ cuillère à café de sel d''un côté du bol et le sucre et la levure de l''autre. Mélangez chaque côté dans la farine avec vos mains, puis à l''aide du crochet pétrisseur jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Versez le lait tiède, puis, au batteur à feu moyen, ajoutez les œufs un à un. Continuez à mélanger la pâte pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse, puis ajoutez progressivement le beurre, un ou deux cubes à la fois, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement incorporé, environ 5 à 8 minutes. Raclez les parois du bol – la pâte sera très molle.","Grattez la pâte dans un grand bol, couvrez d''un torchon propre et laissez lever 1h30 à 2h jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. Une fois doublé, réfrigérer 1 h.","Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et réserver. Pour préparer la garniture, mettez tous les ingrédients de la garniture et une grosse pincée de flocons de sel marin dans une petite casserole à feu doux-moyen, en remuant continuellement jusqu''à ce que tout soit fondu. Transférer dans un bol, laisser refroidir complètement, puis transférer au réfrigérateur et réfrigérer pendant 40 minutes, en remuant toutes les 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe mais soit encore tartinable.","Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et étalez-la sur un plan légèrement fariné jusqu''à obtenir un rectangle d''environ 70 x 40 cm. Répartir uniformément la garniture sur la pâte à l''aide d''une spatule ou d''un couteau à palette. Avec une extrémité la plus courte la plus proche de vous, roulez la pâte en un boudin serré. Transférer sur une planche, couture vers le bas, et couper en deux sur toute la longueur pour obtenir deux longs morceaux. Disposez les deux pièces devant vous, parallèlement l''une à l''autre, et croisez-les l''une sur l''autre sur toute la longueur en formant une tresse. Enroulez en cercle et joignez les extrémités pour former une couronne, puis transférez soigneusement sur la feuille doublée.","Couvrir d''un torchon et laisser lever 1 h jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et cuire la babka pendant 35-40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée.","Pour le sirop, laisser mijoter le sucre, le jus d''orange et le zeste à feu vif pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Badigeonner la babka avec le sirop tiède. Égouttez le zeste d''orange confit et répartissez-le sur la babka. Servir chaud ou laisser refroidir complètement, puis conserver emballé. Se conservera emballé à température ambiante jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9683,4024,'fr','Challah','Préparez du pain challah, un pain sucré et enrichi traditionnellement consommé le vendredi soir par les familles juives pour célébrer le sabbat. Les restes font de délicieux pain perdu','["500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","70 g de sucre en poudre","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 oeufs, battus","70 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour le bol","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de pavot ou de graines de sésame (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez la levure, une pincée de sucre et quelques cuillères à soupe d''eau tiède dans un petit bol. Remuer pour dissoudre la levure, puis laisser reposer 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit mousseuse.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez la farine, le reste du sucre et 3 cuillères à café de sel fin dans un grand bol. Faites un puits au centre, puis ajoutez la moitié de l''œuf battu, le mélange de levure et l''huile. Versez 200 ml d''eau tiède (elle doit être légèrement tiède au toucher) et remuez avec une cuillère, puis mélangez d''une main en gardant l''autre propre pendant que vous rassemblez la pâte. S''il y a beaucoup de morceaux très secs, ajoutez progressivement un peu d''eau pour les rassembler – vous ne voulez pas qu''ils deviennent trop humides et collants. La pâte doit être humide mais pas détrempée.","Une fois la pâte rassemblée, étalez-la sur un plan légèrement fariné. Pétrir à deux mains pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et un peu élastique. Si cela devient très collant, ajoutez une très petite quantité de farine – le moins possible. Un grattoir à pâte est utile si la pâte colle au plan de travail. Étirez les côtés de la pâte vers le bas et rassemblez-les pour former une boule. Huilez légèrement un bol, puis roulez légèrement la boule de pâte autour du bol pour qu''elle soit bien enrobée d''huile. Couvrir d''un torchon propre et laisser dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte ait doublé de volume.","Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Étalez la pâte sur une surface de travail propre et divisez-la en trois morceaux égaux, en pesant pour plus de précision, si vous le souhaitez. Roulez chaque morceau en forme de long boudin d''environ 25 cm de long, en les effilant légèrement aux deux extrémités. Disposez les morceaux devant vous, parallèlement les uns aux autres, espacés de quelques centimètres. Rassemblez les saucisses à l''extrémité supérieure, puis tressez-les sur toute la longueur, en rentrant les extrémités lorsque vous atteignez le bas. Transférez délicatement le pain sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée et couvrez-le sans serrer d''un torchon propre. Laisser lever jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé et gonflé, environ 40 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Badigeonnez délicatement le reste de l''œuf battu sur toute la challah, en l''introduisant dans toutes les crevasses, et saupoudrez de graines de pavot ou de sésame, si vous en utilisez. Cuire au milieu du four pendant 25 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le pain soit doré en dessous et sonne creux lorsqu''on le tapote. Vérifiez après environ 15 minutes – si le dessus du pain commence à devenir trop foncé, couvrez-le de papier d''aluminium. Laisser refroidir sur une grille, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9684,4032,'fr','Sauce au pain grillé','Préparez une version végétalienne de la sauce au pain pour la table du dîner de Noël. Préparez-vous à l’avance, si vous le souhaitez, pour gagner du temps – conservez-le au réfrigérateur jusqu’à deux jours','["6 tranches de pain blanc (assurez-vous qu''il est végétalien)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza aromatisée au beurre, plus un peu pour servir","1 oignon, finement haché","1 feuille de laurier","1 brin de thym","600 ml de lait d''amande","pincée de clous de girofle moulus","pincée de muscade moulue","100 ml de crème de soja"]','["Faire griller le pain jusqu''à ce qu''il soit brun foncé, puis laisser refroidir. Passer au robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir des miettes grossières.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une casserole et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste doré et collant. Ajoutez le laurier, le thym et le lait, puis assaisonnez avec les épices, salez et poivrez. Portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter 5 min.","Retirez les herbes, puis incorporez la chapelure sauf une poignée. Cuire à feu doux jusqu''à épaississement. Si vous le souhaitez, mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Se conserve au frais deux jours.","Pendant ce temps, faites revenir le reste des miettes dans le reste de l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées.","Ajoutez la crème à la sauce et faites chauffer, puis versez-la dans un plat et versez-la sur la chapelure frite et un filet d''huile supplémentaire. Se conserve, couverte, au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9685,8728,'fr','petits pains belges','Offrez-vous ces petits pains belges gourmands comme gâterie l''après-midi avec une tasse de thé. Ils sont remplis de crème de citron et garnis de glaçage et d''une cerise glacée','["450 g de farine blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","7g de levure à action rapide","75 g de sucre en poudre","165 ml de lait tiède","1 gros œuf battu plus 1 pour la dorure","50 g de beurre doux fondu, plus un peu pour la barquette","5 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","150 g de raisins secs","250 g de sucre glace","12 glacé cherries"]','["Mélangez la farine, la levure, le sucre en poudre et 1 cuillère à café de sel marin dans un grand bol. Faites un puits au centre et versez-y le lait tiède, l''œuf battu et le beurre fondu. Bien mélanger une pâte molle pour former. S''il est sec, ajoutez un peu d''eau tiède, s''il est trop collant et humide, ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de farine.","Saupoudrez un plan de travail de farine et versez le mélange dessus. Pétrir la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Formez une boule et mettez-la dans un grand bol légèrement fariné. Couvrir et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. Ou laissez lever au réfrigérateur toute la nuit, en retirant 45 minutes avant de continuer.","Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Saupoudrez légèrement un plan de travail et étalez la pâte sur 30 x 45 cm. Étalez uniformément la crème au citron sur la pâte et saupoudrez de raisins secs. Roulez la pâte dans le sens de la longueur à partir du côté le plus court, comme un rouleau suisse, pour former une bûche. Coupez en 12 petits pains de taille égale avec un couteau bien aiguisé, en lavant à l''œuf l''extrémité libre de la pâte et en la pressant pour qu''elle ne se défait pas. Disposer, étaler, sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée, couvrir et laisser lever 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Badigeonner les petits pains d''un peu de dorure à l''œuf. Cuire au four 10 minutes, puis baisser la température à 180 C/160 C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et cuire encore 10 minutes. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, tamisez le sucre glace et mélangez-le avec 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage blanc et épais. Étalez le glaçage sur les petits pains avec le dos d''une cuillère, puis déposez une cerise au milieu de chacun."]','2026-01-11 00:01:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9686,8730,'fr','Plateau de boulettes de viande et de pain à l''ail','Préparez ce plateau de boulettes de viande et de pain à l''ail réconfortant pour un dîner que toute la famille appréciera. Vous pouvez acheter un paquet de boulettes de viande si vous manquez de temps','["350 g de cuisse de dinde hachée","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à café de sucre","150 g de boule de mozzarella déchirée en morceaux","4 gressins à l''ail ou tranches de pain à l''ail, déchirés ou coupés en morceaux","25 g de cheddar râpé","salade verte ou spaghetti, pour servir"]','["Mélangez le hachis, l''origan, les graines de fenouil et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un bol. Prenez des morceaux du mélange de la taille d''une noix et roulez-les en boules. Faites chauffer la moitié de l’huile dans une grande poêle peu profonde allant au four et faites cuire les boulettes de viande jusqu’à ce qu’elles soient entièrement dorées – ne vous inquiétez pas si elles ne sont pas bien cuites. Transférer dans une assiette. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et ajoutez l''oignon. Cuire jusqu''à tendreté, environ 10 à 12 minutes, en remuant régulièrement. Incorporer l''ail encore une minute, puis le concentré de tomates, les tomates concassées et le sucre.","Laisser mijoter 10 à 15 minutes, puis assaisonner selon votre goût. Disposez les boulettes de viande sur la sauce, puis ajoutez la mozzarella, le pain à l''ail et le cheddar par dessus. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants."]','2026-01-11 00:01:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9687,7069,'fr','Gallois rare','Offrez-vous une tranche de pain rare gallois bouillonnant, doré et au fromage pour un déjeuner satisfaisant. Servir bien chaud sur le grill avec beaucoup de ciboulette hachée','["120 ml de bière brune","25g de beurre doux","25g de farine nature","140 g de cheddar affiné, râpé grossièrement","1 cuillère à café bombée de moutarde anglaise en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce Worcestershire","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette hachée","2 grosses tranches de pain au levain"]','["Dans une petite casserole, réchauffez doucement la bière, réservez. Prenez une autre petite casserole et faites fondre à feu moyen le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à mousser, versez la farine et mélangez le tout en laissant cuire 1 min. Incorporer la bière tiède en plusieurs ajouts pour créer une sauce épaisse, puis fouetter le fromage pour créer une pâte épaisse. Incorporer la moutarde, le Worcestershire et la ciboulette à la sauce.","Faites chauffer un gril à son réglage le plus élevé. Placer les tranches de pain sur une plaque à pâtisserie plate et griller d''un côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Retournez les pains et tartinez chacun avec le mélange de fromage. Remettre sous le gril et cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bouillonnants, servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9688,8732,'fr','Boulettes de pâte à l''ail farcies au fromage avec une trempette à la sauce tomate','Impressionnez votre famille et vos amis avec l''entrée de partage ultime : des boules de pâte à l''ail au fromage et gourmandes. Accompagnés d''une trempette à base de tomates, ils constituent un complément idéal à tout menu d''inspiration italienne.','["50 g de beurre coupé en cubes","300 g de farine à pain blanche forte","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","200 g de mozzarella en bloc, coupée en cubes de 1½ cm","65 g de gruyère râpé grossièrement (facultatif)","100g de beurre","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 branche de romarin, feuilles cueillies et hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour le bol et la plaque à pâtisserie","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","250g en purée","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","pincée de flocons de piment","½ petit bouquet de basilic déchiré, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 175 ml d''eau dans une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fumante, puis ajoutez le beurre. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit juste tiède (il ne doit pas être chaud). Mélangez la farine, la levure, le sucre et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol ou un batteur sur socle. Ajouter le mélange de beurre refroidi et mélanger jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois ou du batteur. Pétrir 10 minutes à la main (ou 5 minutes au batteur) jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit souple et lisse. Transférer dans un bol huilé et couvrir d''un torchon propre. Laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 1h30 à 2 heures, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. Alternativement, laissez lever au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Huiler et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Chassez l''air de la pâte, puis pétrissez à nouveau pendant plusieurs minutes. Aplatissez un petit morceau de pâte (environ 20 g) en disque, et déposez un cube de mozzarella et une pincée de gruyère au milieu du disque. Enfermez les fromages avec la pâte, puis roulez en boule. Transférer sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée. Répétez avec le reste du fromage et de la pâte, en plaçant les boules de pâte à ½ cm de distance sur la plaque à pâtisserie – elles doivent juste se toucher après la levée. Couvrir d''un torchon propre et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le beurre à l''ail. Faites fondre le beurre dans une petite poêle à feu doux, puis incorporez l''ail et le romarin. Retirer du feu et réserver jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Badigeonner les boules de pâte levées avec le beurre à l''ail, puis cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les boules de pâte soient bien cuites et que le milieu suinte.","Pendant que les boules de pâte cuisent, préparez la trempette à la sauce tomate. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole et faites revenir l''ail pendant 30 secondes. Ajoutez la passata, le vinaigre, le sucre et les flocons de piment et laissez mijoter pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Assaisonner au goût et incorporer le basilic. Badigeonnez les boules de pâte chaudes avec le reste du beurre à l''ail, puis servez avec la sauce tomate à côté pour les tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:01:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9689,8734,'fr','Pain au levain de seigle','Ce pain de base au levain entièrement au seigle a une saveur maltée profonde qui se marie bien avec le poisson fumé ou les charcuteries. Le seigle contient moins de gluten que le blé et nécessite donc une technique légèrement différente.','["250 g de farine de seigle complète","100 g de levain de seigle actif (voir ci-dessus)","500 g de farine de seigle complète, un peu pour saupoudrer","10g de sel fin","25 g de beurre ramolli pour le moule"]','["Jour 1 : Pour commencer votre entrée, mélangez 50 g de farine avec 50 g d''eau tiède dans un bocal ou, mieux encore, un récipient en plastique. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez, recouverte d''un torchon, à température ambiante pendant 24h.","Jours 2, 3, 4 et 5 : Mélangez 25 g de farine avec 25 g d''eau tiède et incorporez au mélange de la veille. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez, recouverte d''un torchon, à température ambiante pendant 24h.","Jour 6 : Le mélange doit être bien pétillant et dégager une forte odeur d''alcool. Une cuillère à café de levain doit flotter dans l''eau tiède si elle est prête. Sinon, continuez à ajouter quotidiennement 25 g de farine et 25 g d''eau tiède au mélange jusqu''à ce qu''il devienne actif. Si votre pot est plein, retirez la moitié du mélange du pot et continuez. Vous avez maintenant une entrée de seigle, qui est une base aromatisée au malt pour le pain au levain. Conservez-le au réfrigérateur (il restera dormant) et 12 heures avant de l''utiliser, prélevez-en la moitié et nourrissez-le avec 100 g de farine et 100 g d''eau. Laisser couvert à température ambiante.","Versez 100 g de levain dans un bol et ajoutez 400 g d''eau tiède. Fouettez ou frottez les deux ensemble avec vos mains, ne vous inquiétez pas s''il y a quelques grumeaux. Ajoutez la farine et rassemblez (avec une spatule ou votre main) en une pâte épaisse et collante, en vous assurant que toute la farine est mélangée, y compris les morceaux secs sur les parois du bol. Couvrir d''un torchon humide et laisser reposer 2 heures à température ambiante.","Incorporez le sel à la pâte puis laissez reposer à couvert pendant encore 2 heures.","Beurrer généreusement un moule à cake de 900 g. Saupoudrez le plan de travail avec davantage de farine de seigle, puis grattez toute la pâte. Façonnez la pâte en un bloc à peu près de la même taille que le moule et placez-la dans le moule. Appuyez sur la pâte pour qu''elle la remplisse complètement et saupoudrez généreusement le dessus avec plus de farine. Laissez le pain dehors, à découvert, pendant 2 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il lève d''environ un quart et devienne escarpé sur le dessus, ou laissez-le au réfrigérateur, à découvert, toute la nuit. Cela lui donnera une saveur encore plus profonde.","Chauffer le four à 230/210C chaleur tournante/gaz 8 avec une grille au milieu du four et une grille en dessous avec une rôtissoire dessus. Placez le pain sur la plaque du milieu et versez délicatement un petit verre d''eau dans la rôtissoire. Cuire pendant 50 à 55 minutes jusqu''à ce que le son soit creux lorsque vous le tapotez. (Une fois prêt, le milieu du pain indiquera 98 °C sur un thermomètre numérique.) Retirez le moule et laissez-le refroidir sur une grille pendant au moins 4 heures. Se conserve 3 à 4 jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9690,8736,'fr','Pain à la mijoteuse','Préparez un pain facile avec cette recette de pain à la mijoteuse. Ce projet simple est parfait pour les débutants et utilise de la farine complète ou blanche forte.','["500 g de farine complète forte ou de farine blanche forte (ou un mélange de farines, voir astuce), plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1g de sel marin fin"]','["Mélangez la farine, la levure et le sel dans un grand bol et faites un puits au milieu. Mesurez 350 ml d''eau tiède et versez la majeure partie dans le puits. Mélangez la farine et l''eau avec vos doigts ou une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné pour obtenir une pâte légèrement humide, moelleuse et malléable – ajoutez un peu d''eau supplémentaire si nécessaire.","Versez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrissez pendant au moins 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Cela peut également être fait dans un mélangeur de table avec un crochet pétrisseur.","Façonnez la pâte en une grosse boule serrée et posez la boule sur un carré de papier sulfurisé. Utilisez le papier sulfurisé pour soulever la pâte dans votre mijoteuse, couvrez et réglez la mijoteuse à puissance élevée. Laisser poser 2h.","Retirez le pain à l''aide du papier sulfurisé. Le fond doit être croustillant et le dessus doit être élastique et non mou. (Si vous disposez d''un thermomètre de cuisson numérique, le milieu du pain doit être à 90 °C.) S''il n''est pas prêt, remettez-le dans la mijoteuse pendant 15 minutes et testez à nouveau : cela peut prendre jusqu''à 2 h 30 minutes.","Le pain n''aura pas de croûte importante ni de couleur dorée dans la mijoteuse. Une fois cuit, vous pouvez le laisser refroidir ou le mettre au four à 240 C/220 C chaleur tournante/gaz 9 pendant 5 à 10 minutes pour obtenir un peu de couleur."]','2026-01-11 00:01:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9691,8738,'fr','Pains plats','Préparez notre recette de pain plat la plus simple avec seulement une poignée d''ingrédients. Ils sont parfaits pour éponger un curry réchauffant ou une shakshuka en sauce','["110 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","110 g de farine complète nature ou farine atta","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour le bol","petite noix de beurre fondue"]','["Tamisez les farines et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et 150 ml d''eau tiède. Réunissez en une pâte molle mais pas trop collante (vous aurez peut-être besoin de jusqu''à 175 ml d''eau). S''il est trop humide, ajoutez un peu de farine. Si c''est trop sec, ajoutez de l''eau.","Versez sur une surface farinée et pétrissez pendant 4 à 5 minutes ou jusqu''à consistance lisse. Mettez la pâte dans un bol huilé, couvrez et laissez reposer 30 min.","Versez sur une surface farinée. Divisez en six boules et étalez chacune en un cercle fin de 18 à 20 cm de large à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Si vous préférez, vous pouvez diviser à nouveau en douze boules pour obtenir des pains plats plus petits.","Badigeonnez une poêle à fond épais d''huile et faites cuire un pain plat à feu vif pendant 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et commence à gonfler. Mettre sur une assiette et badigeonner de beurre. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte."]','2026-01-11 00:01:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9692,8740,'fr','Petits pains faciles','Préparez ces simples petits pains blancs pour des sandwichs, des pains à hamburger ou pour tremper dans une soupe. En utilisant seulement une poignée d''ingrédients, faire du pain n''a jamais été aussi simple','["500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7g de levure à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sucre blanc en poudre","2 cuillères à café de sel fin","1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour le plan de travail et le bol"]','["Versez la farine, la levure, le sucre, le sel et l''huile dans un bol. Versez dessus 325 ml d''eau tiède, puis mélangez (avec une spatule ou votre main) jusqu''à obtenir une pâte hirsute. Assurez-vous que toute la farine a été incorporée. Couvrir et laisser 10 minutes.","Huilez légèrement votre plan de travail et versez la pâte dessus. Pétrir la pâte pendant au moins 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle devienne plus serrée et élastique – si vous avez un batteur sur socle, vous pouvez le faire avec un crochet pétrisseur pendant 5 minutes. Formez une boule de pâte et mettez-la dans un bol propre et huilé. Laisser reposer 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Versez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée et roulez-la en forme de long boudin. Coupez la pâte en deux, puis divisez chaque moitié en quatre morceaux pour obtenir huit portions de taille égale. Roulez chacun en une boule serrée et placez-la sur une plaque à pâtisserie saupoudrée, en laissant un peu d''espace entre chaque boule pour lever. Couvrir d''un torchon humide et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 40 minutes à 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double presque de volume.","Chauffer le four à 230C/210C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Lorsque la pâte est prête, saupoudrez chaque boule d''un peu plus de farine. (Si vous le souhaitez, vous pouvez glacer les petits pains avec du lait ou de l''œuf battu et garnir de graines.) Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et qu''ils sonnent creux lorsqu''on les tape sur la base. Laisser refroidir sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:01:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9693,8742,'fr','Pain à la farine nature','Ce pain sans levure est préparé avec n''importe quelle farine ordinaire que vous avez à la maison. Il est légèrement plus dense qu''un pain à la levure, mais très satisfaisant tartiné de beurre ou trempé dans une soupe chaude','["500 g de farine blanche nature ou de farine complète, plus un supplément","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","½ cuillère à café de sel fin","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre","350 ml à 400 ml de yaourt nature ou de babeurre","une poignée de flocons d''avoine ou de graines, facultatif"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser un moule à cake de 900g de papier sulfurisé. Mettez une plaque à pâtisserie plate au four pour qu''elle soit bien chaude.","Mélangez la farine, le bicarbe, le sel et le sucre dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient uniformément répartis. Faites un puits au centre et versez-y le yaourt. Réunissez pour obtenir une pâte légèrement collante.","Saupoudrez légèrement la pâte avec un supplément de farine et formez une grosse bûche, à peu près de la même taille que le moule. Mettez dans la boîte. Trempez une cuillère en bois dans la farine et tracez une ligne au centre. Garnir d’une petite poignée de flocons d’avoine ou de graines, si vous le souhaitez.","Cuire au four sur la plaque à pâtisserie chaude pendant 40 à 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir dans le moule puis démouler sur une grille pour refroidir complètement avant de couper en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:01:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9694,8744,'fr','Entrée au levain','Apprenez à préparer une entrée au levain bouillonnant avec de la farine de pain blanc et de l''eau. Après avoir nourri le levain pendant cinq jours, vous pouvez l''utiliser pour faire un pain au levain','["250 g de farine à pain blanche forte, de préférence bio ou moulue sur pierre"]','["Jour 1 : Pour commencer votre entrée, mélangez 50 g de farine avec 50 g d''eau tiède dans un bocal ou, mieux encore, un récipient en plastique. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez à moitié découverte à température ambiante pendant 24 heures.","Jour 2 : Mélanger 50 g de farine avec 50 g d''eau tiède et incorporer au mélange de la veille. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez à moitié découverte à température ambiante pendant encore 24 heures.","Jour 3 : Mélanger 50 g de farine avec 50 g d''eau tiède et incorporer au mélange de la veille. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez à moitié découverte à température ambiante pendant encore 24 heures.","Jour 4 : Vous devriez maintenant commencer à voir une certaine activité dans le mélange ; des bulles devraient se former et bouillonner sur le dessus. Mélangez 50 g de farine avec 50 g d''eau tiède et incorporez-la au mélange de la veille. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez à moitié découverte à température ambiante pendant encore 24 heures.","Jour 5 : Le mélange devrait être très actif maintenant et prêt à préparer votre levain (entrée). S’il ne bouillonne pas, continuez à le nourrir quotidiennement jusqu’à ce que ce soit le cas. Quand c''est prêt, ça devrait sentir le yaourt.","Vous disposez maintenant d''une entrée, qui constitue la base du pain. Vous devrez en prendre soin, mais le nom est facultatif ! Conservez-le au réfrigérateur (il restera dormant) et 24 heures avant de l''utiliser, versez-en la moitié et nourrissez-le avec 100 g de farine et 100 g d''eau. Laissez-le à température ambiante et il devrait redevenir actif. Plus le levain est resté longtemps en dormance, plus il devra être rafraîchi plusieurs fois (le processus consistant à vider la moitié du levain et à le remplacer par de la farine et de l''eau neuves) pour le réactiver. Si votre levain est prêt à l''emploi, une cuillère à café du mélange doit flotter dans l''eau tiède. Le levain peut maintenant être utilisé pour faire du pain au levain blanc."]','2026-01-11 00:01:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9695,8746,'fr','Focaccia','Oubliez la focaccia du commerce et préparez une version simple et maison de ce pain italien classique. Servir avec des plats de pâtes ou déguster avec des salades','["500 g de farine à pain forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","7 g de levure séchée à action rapide","2 cuillères à café de sel marin fin","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour le moule et pour servir","1 cuillère à café de sel marin feuilleté","¼ petit bouquet de romarin, brins cueillis"]','["Versez la farine dans un grand bol à mélanger. Mélangez la levure d''un côté de la farine et le sel fin de l''autre côté. Mélangez ensuite le tout, cette séparation initiale empêche le sel de tuer la levure.","Faites un puits au milieu de la farine et ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile et 350 à 400 ml d''eau tiède, en l''ajoutant progressivement jusqu''à obtenir une pâte légèrement collante (vous n''aurez peut-être pas besoin de toute l''eau). Saupoudrez le plan de travail de farine et versez la pâte dessus en raclant les parois du bol. Pétrissez pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que votre pâte soit molle et moins collante. Mettez la pâte dans un bol propre, couvrez d''un torchon et laissez lever 1 h jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Huiler un moule rectangulaire peu profond (25 x 35 cm). Versez la pâte sur le plan de travail, puis étirez-la pour remplir le moule. Couvrir d''un torchon et laisser lever encore 35 à 45 minutes.","Chauffez le four à 220 C/200 C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Enfoncez vos doigts dans la pâte pour faire des fossettes. Mélangez 1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et le sel feuilleté et arrosez le pain. Poussez des brins de romarin dans les fossettes de la pâte.","Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Pendant que le pain est encore chaud, arrosez-le d''1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive. Coupez-le en carrés et servez-le chaud ou froid avec un supplément d''huile d''olive, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9696,8748,'fr','Pain soda aux petits épeautre','Utilisez de la farine d''engrain – l''une des premières formes de blé consommées par l''humanité – pour préparer ce pain soda. Il offre une belle saveur riche et de noisette','["250 g de farine d''engrain, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","250 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","1½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade molle","370 ml de yaourt nature","1 gros œuf"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Saupoudrer un peu de farine d''épeautre sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis verser les deux farines, le bicarbonate de soude, le sel et le sucre dans un bol et mélanger. Fouettez le yaourt et l''œuf ensemble dans un pichet.","Faire un puits au centre des ingrédients secs et y verser le mélange humide. Mélangez rapidement les ingrédients pour créer une pâte légèrement collante. Former un rond d''environ 4 à 5 cm d''épaisseur et le déposer au milieu de la plaque à pâtisserie. Trempez le manche d''une cuillère en bois dans un peu de farine, puis appuyez légèrement sur le dessus pour créer une croix. Saupoudrez légèrement d’un peu plus de farine d’épeautre.","Cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement levés, sans taches grises non cuites sur la croix. Laisser refroidir, puis servir avec du beurre salé, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9697,7832,'fr','Tortillas','Oubliez le commerce et essayez les tortillas faites maison. Ils se conserveront pendant deux jours ou vous pourrez les congeler pour les utiliser plus tard. Ils sont parfaits pour les wraps','["250 g de farine nature + un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","½ cuillère à café de sel fin"]','["Mélanger la farine, l''huile végétale et le sel dans un bol. Versez plus de 150 ml d''eau tiède et pétrissez pour rassembler le mélange. Retirer du bol et pétrir sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une boule de pâte molle et lisse. Couvrir d''un torchon propre et laisser reposer au moins 15 minutes avant de l''étaler.","Coupez la pâte en 6 morceaux égaux (environ 75 g chacun). Etalez chaque boule de pâte le plus finement possible sur un plan de travail fariné. Ils doivent former des ronds d''environ 20 cm de large et 2 mm d''épaisseur.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif. Cuire les tortillas pendant 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et grillées. Enveloppez-les dans du papier aluminium et couvrez-les d''un torchon pour les garder au chaud pendant que vous faites cuire le reste. Se conserve deux jours bien emballé, ou au frais, emballez et congelez jusqu''à trois mois."]','2026-01-11 00:01:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9698,8750,'fr','Petits pains à l''italienne','Garnissez les rouleaux ciabatta de pesto frais, de mozzarella de bufflonne, d''artichauts, de poivrons rouges rôtis et de feuilles de basilic pour un délicieux sandwich d''inspiration italienne.','["2 petits pains de style ciabatta, grillés","1½ cuillère à soupe de pesto frais","50 g d''artichauts marinés en bocal, égouttés et tranchés","1 gros poivron rouge rôti en bocal, égoutté et tranché","1 boule de mozzarella de bufflonne ou de burrata, déchirée","une poignée de feuilles de basilic frais"]','["Divisez les rouleaux et étalez le pesto sur les bases. Garnir avec les artichauts, le poivre, le fromage, le basilic et les petits pains pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9699,8752,'fr','Levain blanc','Maîtrisez l''art de faire du pain au levain avec notre recette étape par étape. Apprenez à créer une entrée, du levain et le pain lui-même grâce à nos conseils d''experts.','["250 g de farine à pain blanche forte, de préférence bio ou moulue sur pierre","1 cuillère à soupe de levain (voir ci-dessus)","100 g de farine à pain blanche forte, de préférence bio ou moulue sur pierre","levain (voir ci-dessus)","1 kg de farine à pain blanche forte, de préférence biologique ou moulue sur pierre, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","20 g de sel marin fin"]','["Jour 1, lundi : Pour commencer votre entrée, mélangez 50 g de farine avec 50 g d''eau tiède dans un bocal ou, mieux encore, un récipient en plastique. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez à moitié découverte à température ambiante pendant 24 heures.","Jour 2, mardi : Mélanger 50 g de farine avec 50 g d''eau tiède et incorporer au mélange d''hier. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez à moitié découverte à température ambiante pendant encore 24 heures.","Jour 3, mercredi : Mélanger 50 g de farine avec 50 g d''eau tiède et incorporer au mélange d''hier. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez à moitié découverte à température ambiante pendant encore 24 heures.","Jour 4, jeudi : vous devriez commencer à voir une certaine activité dans le mélange maintenant ; des bulles devraient se former et bouillonner sur le dessus. Mélangez 50 g de farine avec 50 g d''eau tiède et incorporez-la au mélange de la veille. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est incorporée et laissez à moitié découverte à température ambiante pendant encore 24 heures.","Jour 5, vendredi : Le mélange devrait être très actif maintenant et prêt à préparer votre levain. S’il ne bouillonne pas, continuez à le nourrir quotidiennement jusqu’à ce que ce soit le cas. Quand c''est prêt, ça devrait sentir le yaourt.","Vous disposez maintenant d''une entrée, qui constitue la base du pain. Vous devrez en prendre soin, mais le nom est facultatif ! Conservez-le au réfrigérateur (il restera dormant) et 24 heures avant de l''utiliser, versez-en la moitié et nourrissez-le avec 100 g de farine et 100 g d''eau. Laissez-le à température ambiante et il devrait redevenir actif. Plus le levain est resté longtemps en dormance, plus il devra être rafraîchi plusieurs fois (le processus consistant à vider la moitié du levain et à le remplacer par de la farine et de l''eau neuves) pour le réactiver. Si votre levain est prêt à l’emploi, une cuillère à café du mélange doit flotter dans l’eau tiède.","Pour le levainMélanger 1 cuillère à soupe de levain avec 100 g de farine et 100 g d''eau (c''est le même processus que pour nourrir le levain, mais vous devez le faire dans un nouveau bol séparé, en gardant le levain d''origine comme sauvegarde, car c''est le mélange que vous utiliserez pour cuire votre pain). Laissez le levain pendant 8 heures à température ambiante jusqu''à ce qu''il devienne actif. Une fois prêt, une cuillère à café du mélange doit flotter dans l’eau tiède.","Pour le painVersez 600 g d''eau tiède dans le levain et remuez avec une spatule en caoutchouc pour mélanger – ne vous inquiétez pas s''il reste des morceaux de levain non mélangés. Versez la farine et mélangez le tout avec une spatule en caoutchouc pour obtenir une pâte grossière, en vous assurant que toute la farine est incorporée uniformément et qu''il n''y a pas de morceaux secs sur les côtés du bol. Couvrir et laisser dans un endroit chaud pendant au moins 30 minutes ou jusqu''à 4 heures.","Saupoudrez de sel et ajoutez 50 g d''eau à la pâte. Pincez et écrasez le sel et l''eau dans la pâte avec vos mains. Si la pâte devient filandreuse (comme un vieux chewing-gum), continuez simplement à la travailler jusqu''à ce qu''elle ait une texture lisse. Laisser encore 15 minutes.","Mouillez-vous les mains, saisissez la pâte d''un côté et étirez-la sur elle-même, puis répétez avec l''autre côté. Cette technique d''étirement permet de développer le gluten. Ramassez la pâte et enroulez-la sur elle-même, puis couvrez et laissez reposer encore 20 à 30 minutes. Répétez ce processus encore deux fois (trois au total), puis laissez la pâte pendant encore 2 à 3 heures jusqu''à ce qu''elle lève d''environ 30 % et paraisse pétillante et molle.","À l''aide d''une spatule en caoutchouc, étalez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et divisez-la en deux. Pliez chaque morceau sur lui-même pour former une boule, puis laissez découvert 30 min. Les boules de pâte vont s''étaler pendant ce temps.","Saupoudrez généreusement deux paniers à pain de farine.  Grattez une des boules de pâte du plan de travail, puis pliez-la sur elle-même pour créer une boule serrée emprisonnée dans tout l''air. Soulevez le ballon dans un panier, couture vers le haut, puis transférez-le au réfrigérateur pour qu''il refroidisse toute la nuit ou jusqu''à 18 heures. Répétez avec l’autre boule de pâte.","Chauffez le four à 240C/220C chaleur tournante/gaz 9 et mettez une cocotte à couvercle dans le four pour chauffer. Découpez une feuille de papier sulfurisé en un carré légèrement plus grand que la base de l''un des pains. Retirez délicatement la cocotte chaude du four et retirez le couvercle. Retournez un pain sur le papier sulfurisé, puis, en travaillant rapidement, marquez le dessus en biais. Utilisez les coins du papier sulfurisé pour soulever le pain dans la cocotte. Couvrir avec le couvercle et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes, puis découvrir délicatement et poursuivre la cuisson pendant encore 10 minutes (ou plus pour une finition plus foncée). Retirez délicatement le pain du plat à l''aide d''une spatule, transférez-le sur une grille et laissez-le refroidir à température ambiante avant de le trancher. Répétez avec le deuxième pain."]','2026-01-11 00:01:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9700,5191,'fr','Pâte à pizza sans gluten','Ne manquez pas vos friandises italiennes préférées, préparez cette pâte à pizza simple et rapide sans gluten, prête à être transformée en pizzas individuelles ou en boules de pâte.','["400 g de farine à pain sans gluten","2 cuillères à café bombées de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique sans gluten","1 cuillère à café de sel fin","1 cuillère à café bombée de gomme xanthane","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Mélangez la farine, le sucre, la levure chimique, le sel et la gomme xanthane dans un grand bol à mélanger. Faites un puits au centre et versez-y 250 ml d''eau tiède et l''huile d''olive. Mélangez rapidement avec vos mains pour créer une texture épaisse, humide et pâteuse, en ajoutant 20 ml d''eau tiède supplémentaire si la pâte est un peu sèche. Conserver dans un récipient hermétique ou un bol couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 24 heures avant utilisation. Utiliser la pâte pour faire une pizza ? Consultez la recette complète de la pizza sans gluten."]','2026-01-11 00:01:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9701,7487,'fr','Roti','Préparez une délicieuse sauce au curry avec un roti chaud. Ces pains plats asiatiques faciles gonflent dans la poêle et sont parfaits pour saisir des poignées d''un masala végétarien copieux.','["115 g de farines autolevantes","115 g de farine complète nature","1½ cuillère à café de sel","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale et un peu pour la friture","2 cuillères à café de beurre, pour la friture"]','["Tamisez les farines et le sel dans un grand bol à mélanger. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et 175 à 200 ml d''eau tiède et mélangez pour obtenir une pâte molle mais pas trop collante. S''il est un peu humide, ajoutez un peu plus de farine.","Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez pendant 4 à 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Réserver dans un bol légèrement huilé pendant 30 minutes.","Divisez la pâte en six morceaux de taille égale (pesez chaque morceau pour plus de précision si vous le souhaitez). À l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie, étalez chacun en un cercle fin d''environ 18 à 20 cm de large.","Faites chauffer un peu du reste de l''huile et du beurre dans une poêle à fond épais à feu vif. Une fois mousseux, ajoutez les roti étalés, un à la fois, et faites cuire 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tachetés de couleur dorée et commencent à gonfler. Réserver sur une assiette chaude jusqu''au moment de manger."]','2026-01-11 00:01:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9702,8754,'fr','Sandwich focaccia au pesto','Les garnitures de vos sandwichs sont cuites dans le pain, ce qui en fait une option de pique-nique végétarienne facile qui ne deviendra pas détrempée.','["500 g de farine blanche forte","7g de levure à action rapide","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu plus","basilic en petit paquet, feuilles cueillies","2 boules de mozzarella de 125 g","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin grillés","3 cuillères à soupe de pesto vert"]','["Mettez la farine, la levure et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol, en vous assurant que la levure et le sel ne se touchent pas. Versez 350 ml d''eau tiède et l''huile d''olive et mélangez à l''aide d''une cuillère pour former une pâte humide et élastique. Si vous utilisez un batteur sur socle, pétrir pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte cesse de coller aux parois du bol. Si vous pétrissez à la main, pétrissez pendant 10 minutes sur une surface légèrement farinée.","Mettez la pâte dans un bol légèrement huilé, couvrez d''un torchon propre et humide et laissez lever 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Tapisser un plat à rôtir de 20 x 30 cm d''un morceau de papier sulfurisé froissé. Coupez la pâte en deux et pressez, le plus légèrement possible, une moitié dans le plat à rôtir, en l''étirant pour remplir le moule. Couvrir de basilic, de mozzarella et de pignons de pin, puis étaler l''autre moitié de la pâte et disposer dessus. Couvrir et laisser lever 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et gonflé.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Une fois levé, appuyez avec vos doigts sur le dessus de la pâte. La pâte est prête si les empreintes restent ; s''ils rebondissent, laissez la pâte plus longtemps. Remplissez les empreintes de pesto, puis saupoudrez d''un peu de sel marin feuilleté et arrosez d''un peu d''huile d''olive.","Cuire au four sur la grille supérieure du four pendant 25 à 30 minutes, sans ouvrir la porte du four, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Emportez-le entier sur votre pique-nique et coupez-le en 10 à 12 sandwichs au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9703,8756,'fr','Épaule d''agneau & pain plat aux aubergines fumées','Ceci est vaguement basé sur le plat turc du lahmacun, mais avec une base de pain plus épaisse semblable à celle de la pizza. Idéale pour utiliser des restes d''agneau, l''aubergine carbonisée donne une profondeur fumée','["7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","200 g de farine ''00''","200 g de farine à pain forte","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 aubergine","½ oignon rouge, finement tranché","150 g de restes d''agneau émincés ou hachés","2 cuillères à soupe de persil finement haché","1 tomate, hachée finement","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","pincée de cumin moulu","pincée de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de pignons de pin","1 cuillère à café de tahin"]','["Pour faire le pain plat, mettez la levure et 250 ml d''eau tiède dans un pichet et mélangez bien. Laissez reposer quelques minutes.","Tamisez les farines dans un bol avec 2 cuillères à café de sel, puis incorporez lentement le mélange de levure en remuant avec une cuillère en bois. Incorporer l''huile et étaler la pâte sur une surface propre. Pétrissez pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et élastique. Remettre dans le bol, couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser gonfler 30 min","Faire griller l''aubergine sur une flamme de gaz ou sous un gril chaud jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fumée et s''effondrer – elle doit être suffisamment molle pour être démontée avec une fourchette. Laisser refroidir.","Versez la pâte et pétrissez encore quelques minutes, puis divisez-la en quatre et roulez chaque morceau en une boule lisse. Enveloppez-en trois dans du film alimentaire et congelez-les pour une utilisation ultérieure.","Chauffer le four à 240°C/220°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 8. Aplatir la boule de pâte avec la paume de la main et l''étaler en un fond large et plat de 25 à 30 cm de long. Placer sur une plaque à pâtisserie huilée et laisser lever un peu pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Versez la chair douce et fumée de l''aubergine carbonisée dans un bol et mélangez-la avec tous les autres ingrédients de la garniture, à l''exception des pignons de pin. Étalez la garniture sur le pain plat, puis répartissez-la sur les pignons de pin. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le pain soit gonflé et doré et que la garniture soit très chaude.","Mélangez le tahini avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour former une vinaigrette lisse. Arroser le pain plat, couper en morceaux et partager."]','2026-01-11 00:01:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9704,8758,'fr','Petits pains bao cuits à la vapeur','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Remplissez ces petits pains chinois cuits à la vapeur avec du porc BBQ et des légumes marinés pour une collation parfaite pour la fête du Nouvel An chinois.','["525 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1½ cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre, plus une pincée","1 cuillère à café de levure sèche à action rapide","50 ml de lait","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour graisser et brosser","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique"]','["Mélangez la farine, le sucre et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol (voir astuce). Dissoudre la levure et une pincée de sel dans 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau tiède, puis l''ajouter à la farine avec le lait, l''huile, le vinaigre et 200 ml d''eau. Mélanger pour obtenir une pâte, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire.","Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à consistance lisse. Placer dans un bol légèrement huilé, couvrir d''un linge humide et laisser lever 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail propre et étalez-la. Aplatissez la pâte avec vos mains, puis saupoudrez-la de levure chimique et pétrissez pendant 5 minutes.","Étalez la pâte en forme de long boudin d''environ 3 cm d''épaisseur, puis coupez-la en morceaux d''environ 3 cm de large – vous devriez en avoir 18.","Dans le creux de la main, formez une boule avec chaque morceau de pâte et laissez reposer 2 à 3 minutes.","Utilisez un rouleau à pâtisserie pour étaler chaque boule, une par une, en forme ovale d''environ 3 à 4 mm d''épaisseur. Frotter la surface des ovales de pâte avec de l''huile et badigeonner un peu d''huile sur une baguette.","Placez la baguette huilée au centre de chaque ovale. Pliez la pâte sur la baguette, puis retirez lentement la baguette.","Transférez les petits pains préparés sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, couvrez d''un torchon propre ou d''un film alimentaire légèrement huilé et laissez lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 h 30 ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils doublent de volume.","Faites chauffer un grand cuiseur vapeur à feu moyen-vif. Faites cuire les petits pains à la vapeur pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient gonflés (vous devrez le faire par lots). Ouvrez chaque petit pain et remplissez-le de porc barbecue et de carottes marinées et de mooli. Mangez pendant qu’ils sont encore chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:01:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9705,6689,'fr','Pain nuage','Léger et moelleux, ce substitut de pain porte bien son nom. Utilisez-le comme option faible en glucides pour les sandwichs','["huile ou beurre pour graisser","4 œufs, séparés","50g de fromage frais","¼ cuillère à café de crème de tartre","½ cuillère à café de graines de nigelle"]','["Chauffer le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2 et tapisser 2 grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé, puis bien graisser avec du beurre ou de l''huile.","Dans un grand bol et à l''aide de batteurs électriques, battre les blancs d''œufs ensemble jusqu''à formation de pics fermes. Vous devriez pouvoir retourner soigneusement le bol sans qu’il ne tombe.","Dans un autre bol, mettez les jaunes d''œufs, le fromage à la crème et la crème de tartre, puis fouettez ensemble (pas besoin de laver les batteurs au préalable) jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse, pâle et mousseuse. Ensuite, incorporez les blancs d''œufs, une cuillerée à la fois, dans le mélange de jaunes d''œufs, en étant aussi doux que possible pour ne pas expulser trop d''air, puis incorporez les graines de nigelle et assaisonnez avec du sel et du poivre.","Versez délicatement le mélange sur les plaques à pâtisserie préparées. Si le mélange est un peu liquide lorsque vous arrivez au fond du bol, n''utilisez pas les dernières cuillerées – utilisez uniquement le mélange vraiment mousseux sur le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit légèrement doré et rugueux. Laisser refroidir quelques instants avant de retirer délicatement du papier à l''aide d''un couteau à palette."]','2026-01-11 00:01:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9706,7992,'fr','Pain à partager à la turque','Cette version à la poêle d''une « pizza » turque classique appelée lahmacun, garnie de viande hachée d''agneau épicée et d''oignon rouge, est coupée en bouchées pour une collation de fête sans tracas mais pleine de saveurs.','["500 g de mélange à pain ciabatta","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, coupé en quartiers","1 gousse d''ail","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à café de cumin","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","une poignée de persil plat","2 cuillères à soupe de concentré de tomates séchées","250 g de viande hachée d''agneau","150 g de bave de ganosch dans un pot","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, coupé en fines rondelles","50 ml de vinaigre de vin rouge","50 g de pignons de pin grillés","1 cuillère à soupe de persil plat haché"]','["Préparez la pâte à pain ciabatta en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Une fois qu''il a levé, renversez-le en chassant un peu d''air et en le pétrissant un peu. Rouler en forme ovale (environ 35 x 25 cm) et déposer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Badigeonner légèrement toute la surface d''huile d''olive et couvrir d''un film alimentaire. Laissez lever 30 minutes pendant que vous préparez le topping.","Mettez tous les ingrédients de la garniture, sauf l''agneau, dans un petit robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement hachés. Versez dans un grand bol, ajoutez l''agneau, assaisonnez bien, puis écrasez le tout avec vos mains jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Dans une petite casserole, faire chauffer les rondelles d''oignon rouge avec le vinaigre et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien tendres, puis laisser refroidir.","Parsemez la surface de la pâte avec la garniture d''agneau – appuyez doucement dessus avec vos doigts pour l''étaler uniformément sur la surface, mais essayez de ne pas faire sortir trop d''air de la pâte. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la base soit levée et dorée et que la viande soit bien cuite et caramélisée sur les bords.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la vinaigrette. Mélangez le baba ganoush, le jus de citron et l''huile d''olive, puis mettez au réfrigérateur jusqu''au moment de servir.","Une fois le pain cuit, transférez-le sur une planche de bois. Égouttez les oignons dans une passoire métallique et répartissez-les sur le pain. Arrosez de vinaigrette baba ganoush, en laissant un peu de côté en guise de trempette, puis saupoudrez de pignons de pin et de persil. Servir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:01:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9707,8760,'fr','Pain soda aux courgettes et au cheddar','Ce pain simple est facile à préparer mais riche en saveur et en texture, avec du fromage affiné, des courgettes râpées, de l''avoine et du thym.','["400 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 courgettes moyennes","50 g de flocons d''avoine","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","75 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","petit bouquet de thym, feuilles seulement","Pot de 284 ml de babeurre","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","1 œuf battu"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et saupoudrer une plaque à pâtisserie d''un peu de farine. Placez une râpe sur un torchon propre et râpez grossièrement les courgettes. Soulevez les coins du torchon et, en le tenant au-dessus de l''évier, tournez-le pour compacter les courgettes et essorez-en le plus de liquide possible.","Mettez la farine, les flocons d''avoine, le bicarbe et 1 cuillère à café de sel fin dans un grand bol. Ajoutez la majeure partie du cheddar (gardez un peu pour le dessus), le thym et la courgette. Mélangez le babeurre et le miel, puis versez dans le mélange de farine. Remuez avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que la pâte commence à s''agglutiner, puis versez-la sur un plan de travail et pétrissez brièvement pour rassembler tous les morceaux – essayez de ne pas trop travailler la pâte sinon le pain sera lourd.","Façonner un pain rond et déposer sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Badigeonner d''œuf et saupoudrer du reste de fromage. Utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour tracer une croix profonde sur le dessus du pain, puis faites cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien doré. Mieux servi chaud, mais les restes se conservent 1 à 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9708,8762,'fr','Thés au gruyer et à l''oignon et rivage','Ces savoureux petits pains blancs sont fourrés au fromage et à l''oignon – chacun peut se servir dans le cadre d''un buffet.','["500 g de farine à pain forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","pincée de sucre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus 2 cuillères à café supplémentaires","noisette de beurre","2 oignons, tranchés finement","140g Gruyère, grated","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym"]','["Dans un grand bol, mélanger la farine, la levure, le sucre et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Faites un puits au centre et versez progressivement 350 ml d''eau tiède en remuant et en mélangeant l''eau à la farine. Si le mélange est un peu humide, ajoutez un peu de farine supplémentaire ; s''il est un peu sec, ajoutez un peu plus d''eau. La pâte doit être molle mais pas trop collante. Étalez la pâte sur un plan de travail fariné et pétrissez pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit élastique mais lisse. Mettre dans un grand bol fariné, couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume (cela prendra 45 min à 1 h).","Pendant que la pâte lève, faites chauffer les 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile et le beurre dans une poêle antiadhésive. Incorporer les oignons et cuire à feu moyen pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et ramollis. Laisser refroidir, puis incorporer le fromage et les feuilles de thym et assaisonner.","Une fois que la pâte a levé et doublé de volume, rabattez-la et divisez-la en 12 boules. Farinez un plan de travail et étalez les boules sur environ 10 cm de diamètre. Versez 1 cuillère à soupe bombée du mélange d''oignons au milieu de la pâte et rassemblez les bords sur la garniture, en pressant ensemble pour sceller. Faites cela avec toutes les boules en réservant un peu de mélange d''oignons. Huiler une plaque à pâtisserie et disposer les boules, joint vers le bas, en rangées. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud encore 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Une fois que les petits pains ont un peu plus levé et commencent à se joindre, retirez le film alimentaire, arrosez du reste d''huile et versez dessus les restes de mélange d''oignons. Cuire au four 10 minutes, puis baisser le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et cuire encore 10 minutes. Les petits pains doivent être dorés et croustillants sur le dessous. Refroidir avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9709,8764,'fr','Pizzas au pain à l''ail','Une collation fraîche et facile à préparer','["500 g de farine blanche forte, plus un peu pour rouler","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sel","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","50 g de beurre ramolli","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","300 g de mozzarella égouttée","4 tomates hachées grossièrement","une poignée de feuilles de basilic hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique"]','["Versez tous les ingrédients de base dans un\r\nbol à mélanger. Versez plus de 300 ml tiède\r\neau – pas trop chaude. Remuez assez fort avec un\r\ncuillère jusqu''à ce que le mélange se rassemble.","Démouler sur une surface légèrement farinée\r\net pétrir 2-3 fois jusqu''à ce que le mélange\r\nforme une boule. Diviser la pâte en 8 de taille égale\r\nmorceaux. Prendre 1 morceau en laissant le\r\nreste légèrement recouvert d''huile\r\nfilm alimentaire. Farinez à nouveau légèrement la surface\r\net utilisez un rouleau à pâtisserie pour étaler la pâte\r\nun rond d''environ 15 cm de diamètre ou aussi fin\r\ncomme vous le pouvez. Mettez la pizza sur une plaque à pâtisserie.","Mélanger le beurre et le concassé\r\nl''ail, puis étalez-en un peu sur la pizza.\r\nDéchirez la mozzarella en fines lanières et\r\ndispersez-vous. Répétez pour le reste\r\nmorceaux de pâte. Vous devriez pouvoir vous adapter\r\n2 pizzas par plaque à pâtisserie ; en fonction\r\ncombien de plaques à pâtisserie avez-vous, vous\r\nil faudra peut-être cuisiner par lots.","Chauffer le four à 240C/chaleur tournante 220C/gaz 9.\r\nCuire les pizzas pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes et\r\nbien cuit. Pendant ce temps, mélangez\r\nle reste des ingrédients, puis assaisonner\r\neh bien. Quand la pizza sort du\r\nfour, garnir du mélange de tomates et\r\nservir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:01:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9710,8766,'fr','Focaccia aux artichauts','Injectez le goût de l''Italie dans vos pique-niques et dîners en plein air avec cette focaccia irrésistiblement gourmande.','["500 g de farine forte","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","1 grosse cuillère à café de sel","gros bouquet de romarin","Pot de 285g d''antipasti d''artichauts à l''huile (nous avons utilisé Sacla)","50 g de parmesan fraîchement râpé (ou alternative végétarienne), plus un peu pour râper"]','["Versez la farine dans un grand bol et faites un puits au centre. Ajoutez la levure et le sel, puis versez progressivement 350 ml d''eau tiède en remuant au fur et à mesure. Rassemblez la pâte avec une cuillère, puis avec vos mains. Il doit être mou, mais pas trop collant ou humide. Si cela ne se produit pas, versez un peu d’eau supplémentaire ; si la pâte est trop humide, ajoutez de la farine supplémentaire. Versez sur un plan de travail fariné et pétrissez pendant environ 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit lisse, mou et reprenne sa forme lorsqu''on le pousse avec le doigt. Laisser lever dans un bol huilé recouvert d''un film alimentaire dans un endroit tiède pendant 1h ou Aux saveurs d''été jusqu''à ce que la pâte ait doublé de volume.","Retirez les feuilles de la moitié du romarin et hachez-le finement. Cassez le reste en petits morceaux. Égouttez les artichauts en réservant l''huile et coupez-les en morceaux.","Une fois levée, versez la pâte sur un plan de travail huilé et étalez-la en un rectangle de 35 x 45 cm. Glissez une plaque à pâtisserie huilée sous la moitié de la pâte. Garnir la moitié d''artichauts, de tout le parmesan et du romarin. Broyer le poivre noir et arroser d''un peu de l''huile réservée. Replier l''autre moitié de la pâte en pressant les bords ensemble et dessous pour sceller. Laisser lever dans un endroit tiède, recouvert du film alimentaire huilé, pendant 30 min. Chauffer le four à 240C/chaleur tournante 220C/gaz 9.","Arrosez d''un peu plus d''huile et faites des bosses sur le dessus avec vos doigts. Insérez les brins de romarin dans les bosses et râpez-y un peu plus de fromage. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés. Laisser refroidir sur une grille pendant 30 minutes, couper en carrés et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9711,8768,'fr','Rouleaux au roquefort et aux noix','Utilisez votre fromage préféré dans ces délicieux petits pains du juge de Great British Bake Off, Paul Hollywood.','["140g de noix","100g de farine complète","400 g de farine à pain blanche forte","Sachet de 14 g de levure à action rapide","25g de beurre","250 g de Roquefort émietté","2 œufs moyens, battus"]','["Mettre les noix dans un robot culinaire\r\net pulser pour hacher finement ; laisser de côté.\r\nMettez les farines, 10g de sel, la levure, le beurre et\r\n300 ml d''eau dans un bol, mélanger et\r\ncommencez à masser les ingrédients pendant\r\nminute. Si le mélange semble sec, ajoutez\r\nplus d''eau, une cuillère à soupe à la fois, pour obtenir un\r\npâte molle mais non collante, puis pétrir\r\nle bol pendant encore quelques minutes\r\npour rassembler la pâte.","Versez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné\r\nplan de travail et bien pétrir pendant 10 minutes\r\navant de retourner dans le bol. Couvrir le\r\nbol avec du film alimentaire et laisser lever\r\nun endroit chaud pendant 1 heure. Pétrissez brièvement le\r\nnoix dans la pâte, puis laisser lever\r\ndans le bol pendant encore 20 minutes.","Versez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné\r\nsurface et étaler en rectangle,\r\nenviron 50 x 20 cm, 1 cm d''épaisseur. Saupoudrer\r\nle Roquefort uniformément sur la pâte et\r\nappuyez légèrement. Placez le rectangle\r\ndans le sens de la largeur devant vous et enroulez le\r\nrectangle comme un petit pain suisse. Couper en 8 de taille égale\r\nmorceaux et placez-les sur une plaque légèrement\r\nplaque à pâtisserie graissée, côté coupé vers le bas. Couverture\r\navec du film alimentaire et laisser lever 1 h.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nBadigeonner chaque rond de pâte avec le\r\noeuf battu et enfourner 20 min. Partir\r\nlaisser refroidir quelques minutes et déguster pendant\r\nencore chaud. Ceux-ci sont délicieux sur leur\r\npropre ou servi avec une soupe ou un chunky\r\nsalade avec des pommes dedans."]','2026-01-11 00:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9712,5101,'fr','Pain aux tomates séchées sans gluten','Une recette de pain rapide et sans gluten – pas besoin de levure, prête en moins d''une heure','["200 g de farine blanche sans gluten (Doves Farm est disponible dans la plupart des supermarchés)","1 cuillère à café de sel","3 cuillères à café de levure chimique sans gluten","284 ml de babeurre (ou la même quantité de lait entier avec un filet de jus de citron)","3 œufs","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","50 g de tomates séchées à l''huile (environ 6-8), hachées grossièrement","25 g de parmesan (ou parmazano végétarien), râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4. Mélanger la farine, le sel et la levure chimique dans un grand bol. Dans\r\ndans un autre bol, fouetter ensemble le babeurre, les œufs, la purée de tomates et l''huile. Incorporez les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs, puis ajoutez les tomates séchées et la moitié du parmesan.","Beurrez un moule à cake de 900 g et versez-y le mélange. Saupoudrer le reste de parmesan et cuire au four pendant 50 à 60 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Démoulez sur une grille pour laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9713,8770,'fr','Focaccia au pesto et mozzarella','Ce pain au pesto fait maison accompagne délicieusement la cuisine italienne','["500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 ½ cuillère à café de sel","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu pour arroser","125 g de boule de mozzarella égouttée","5 cuillères à soupe de pesto (du commerce ou voir la recette ci-dessous)","sel de mer, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez la farine dans un bol et mélangez-la\r\nsel. Mélangez la levure dans 325 ml d''eau tiède.\r\nAjouter l''eau et l''huile à la farine, puis mélanger\r\nbien avec un grattoir en plastique ou avec vos mains.\r\nLorsque la majeure partie du liquide est incorporée,\r\nutilisez vos mains pour apporter tous les ingrédients\r\nensemble pour former une boule de pâte.","Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail\r\nlégèrement saupoudré de farine et travaillez-le en\r\ntirer et étirer pendant au moins 10 minutes.\r\nEssayez d''y faire entrer autant d''air que possible.\r\nMettez la boule de pâte travaillée dans un\r\nbol bien huilé, couvrir avec un peu plus\r\nde l''huile et un torchon ou un film alimentaire. Laisser à\r\nreposez-vous environ 1 heure dans un endroit sans courants d''air\r\npoint chaud, jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Étalez maintenant la pâte sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie jusqu''à ce qu''elle mesure environ 20 x 30 cm.\r\nLaisser lever à nouveau la pâte jusqu''à environ\r\nà nouveau deux fois moins haut, environ 30 à 40 minutes\r\nun endroit chaud, à l''abri des courants d''air, librement\r\nrecouvert d''un torchon.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nLorsque la pâte a levé, appuyez sur votre\r\ndoigts dedans doucement pour faire quelques trous.\r\nEnfourner environ 15 mn puis retirer\r\ndu four. Déchirez la mozzarella,\r\npuis faites cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré et bien cuit. Arroser\r\nle pesto et saupoudrer de sel marin, si vous\r\ncomme. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9714,8772,'fr','Pain aux graines mélangées','Cette recette utilise une méthode de base de pâte à pain, mais le mélange de farines donne une texture et une saveur intéressantes.','["350g de farine complète","100 g de farine de seigle","50g de farine de quinoa ou farine de seigle supplémentaire","2 cuillères à café de sel","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","125 g de graines de tournesol","25 g de graines de carvi","50 g chacun de graines de pavot et de graines de sésame","75 ml de mélasse noire","300 ml d''eau"]','["Mélangez les farines, le sel, la levure, le tournesol, le carvi et les graines de pavot dans un grand bol. Ajoutez la mélasse noire et l''eau, puis mélangez bien. Si la pâte semble un peu ferme, ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe ou plus d''eau supplémentaire. Bien mélanger, puis poser sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrir délicatement la pâte pendant 7 min. Remettez-le dans un bol légèrement huilé pendant environ 2 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Tapisser une plaque de papier sulfurisé. Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et rabattez-la, puis façonnez délicatement la pâte en boule. Roulez la pâte dans les graines de sésame et placez-la sur la plaque à pâtisserie pendant encore une heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/ventilateur 200°C/gaz 7. Couper le dessus en entailles entrecroisées avec un couteau bien aiguisé et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et que le pain sonne creux lorsqu''on le tape en dessous. Laisser refroidir sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9715,8774,'fr','Pain blanc facile','Une excellente recette pour une machine à pain électrique – ou faites-la de manière traditionnelle','["500 g de farine blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à café de sel","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","300 ml d''eau"]','["Mélangez la farine, le sel et la levure dans un grand bol. Faites un puits au centre, puis ajoutez l''huile et l''eau et mélangez bien. Si la pâte semble un peu ferme, ajoutez 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, mélangez bien puis versez-la sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez. Une fois la pâte satinée, placez-la dans un bol légèrement huilé. Laisser lever 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume ou placer au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Battez la pâte, puis façonnez-la délicatement en boule. Placez-le sur le papier sulfurisé pour lever encore une heure jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/ventilateur 200°C/gaz 7. Saupoudrer le pain de farine et couper une croix d''environ 6 cm de long dans le dessus du pain avec un couteau bien aiguisé. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et que le pain sonne creux lorsqu''on le tape en dessous. Frais\r\nsur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9716,8776,'fr','Pain de seigle','Cette recette de pain de seigle contient moins de gluten que votre pain blanc moyen – cette recette utilise de la farine blanche ou complète pour donner une texture légère mais vous pouvez expérimenter avec les ratios','["200 g de farine de seigle, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","200 g de farine blanche ou complète","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","½ cuillère à café de sel fin","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à café de graines de carvi (facultatif)"]','["Versez les farines, la levure et le sel dans un bol. Dans un pichet, mélangez le miel avec 250 ml d''eau tiède, versez le liquide dans le bol et mélangez pour former une pâte. La farine de seigle peut être assez sèche et absorbe beaucoup d''eau. Si la pâte semble trop sèche, ajoutez plus d''eau tiède jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle. Versez sur votre plan de travail et pétrissez pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Le seigle contient moins de gluten que la farine blanche, la pâte ne sera donc pas aussi élastique qu''un pain blanc classique.","Placez la pâte dans un bol bien huilé, couvrez d''un film alimentaire et laissez lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 à 2 heures, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.  Saupoudrez un moule à pain de 900 g de farine.","Renversez la pâte sur votre plan de travail et pétrissez brièvement pour éliminer les bulles d''air. Si vous utilisez des graines de carvi, incorporez-les à la pâte.  Formez un pain ovale lisse et déposez-le dans votre moule.  Couvrir le moule d''un film alimentaire huilé et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant encore 1 à 1,5 heure, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Retirer le film alimentaire et saupoudrer la surface du pain de farine de seigle. Faites quelques incisions en biais, puis faites cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient brun foncé et creuses lorsque vous les tapotez. Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir au moins 20 minutes avant de servir"]','2026-01-11 00:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9717,9449,'fr','Pain blanc classique','Une fois que vous maîtrisez ce pain de base, le monde de la panification est à vous.','["500 g de farine blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sel","jusqu''à 350 ml d''eau tiède","un peu d''huile de tournesol, pour graisser"]','["Préparez la pâte en versant la farine, la levure\r\net le sel dans un grand bol et faire un puits\r\nau milieu. Versez la majeure partie de l''eau et\r\nutilisez vos doigts ou une cuillère en bois pour mélanger\r\nla farine et l''eau ensemble jusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné\r\nen une pâte légèrement humide, moelleuse et ouvrable\r\n- ajoutez un peu d''eau si nécessaire. Astuce\r\nla pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée et\r\npétrir pendant au moins 10 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse et\r\nélastique. Cela peut également être fait sur une table\r\nmélangeur avec un crochet pétrisseur. Placer la pâte\r\ndans un bol propre huilé, couvrir d''un film alimentaire\r\net laisser lever jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7.\r\nFaites reculer la pâte en la renversant\r\nsur une surface farinée et en poussant l''air\r\ndehors. Façonner la pâte en forme de ballon de rugby\r\nqui conviendra à un moule à cake de 900 g et à placer dans le\r\nétain. Couvrir d''un torchon propre et laisser\r\nà lever pendant 30 minutes. Épousseter le dessus du pain\r\navec un peu plus de farine et coupez le dessus avec\r\nun couteau bien aiguisé si vous voulez. Cuire le pain pour\r\n15 min, puis baisser le feu à 190°C/ventilateur\r\n170C/gaz 5 et poursuivre la cuisson 30 min\r\njusqu''à ce que le pain sonne creux une fois retiré\r\nde la boîte et tapoté sur la base. Partir\r\nle pain sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.\r\nLe pain restera frais dans un contenant hermétique\r\npendant 3 jours ou peut être congelé pendant 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9718,7683,'fr','Pain rustique','C''est un pain sicilien traditionnel que vous pouvez préparer le matin pour prendre de l''avance','["250 g de farine à pain blanche forte","1 cuillère à café de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","200 ml d''eau gazeuse","semoule, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)","romarin finement haché et sel de Maldon, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/chaleur tournante 200°C/gaz 7. Mélanger la farine, la levure et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel. Ajoutez l''huile, puis versez l''eau progressivement en ajoutant suffisamment pour obtenir une pâte molle. Pétrir la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée pendant environ 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit ferme, rebondissante et soyeuse.","Coupez la pâte en 8 morceaux, puis étalez-la en ronds grossiers d''environ 16 à 17 cm de diamètre. (Ne les empilez pas les uns sur les autres, sinon ils resteront collés ensemble.)","Saupoudrer une ou deux plaques à pâtisserie de semoule si vous en avez, sinon laisser nature. Disposez les pains sur les plaques et laissez-les reposer 5 minutes, puis parsemez de romarin, salez et poivrez et arrosez d''huile d''olive. Cuire au four par lots pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient gonflés et dorés. Peut être préparé 3 à 4 heures à l''avance."]','2026-01-11 00:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9719,8778,'fr','Pâte à pain de grenier de base (pour petits pains ou gros pain)','Rien ne vaut le pain fait maison directement sorti du four – prêt en seulement 35 minutes','["225 g de farine blanche forte","225 g de farine à pain de grenier maltée","1 cuillère à café de sel","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","Sachet de 7 g de levure facile à mélanger","150 ml de lait tiède","1 œuf battu","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","100-150 ml d''eau tiède"]','["Mélanger les farines et le sel dans un grand bol, puis incorporer le sucre\r\net de la levure. Faites un puits au centre de la farine et versez-y le lait tiède, l''œuf battu, l''huile d''olive et suffisamment d''eau pour former une pâte molle et humide.","Sur une surface légèrement farinée, pétrir la pâte pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse. Mettre\r\nla pâte dans un bol légèrement huilé, couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé, puis laisser lever dans un endroit tiède jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. La pâte est maintenant prête à être façonnée.","Pour faire 12 rouleaux, divisez la pâte en 12 morceaux et formez des rouleaux. Fariner légèrement 3 plaques à pâtisserie. Placer les rouleaux sur les feuilles et couvrir légèrement d''un film alimentaire huilé. Réserver dans un endroit tiède pendant 30 mn\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''ils aient doublé de taille.","Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Badigeonner le pain d''œuf battu et saupoudrer de graines de sésame et de pavot. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés et bien levés.","Pour faire un pain en pot de fleurs, laissez la pâte lever pendant environ 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. Faites tremper un grand ou huit petits pots de fleurs en terre cuite dans de l''eau froide pendant environ 30 minutes. Séchez soigneusement, puis badigeonnez l''intérieur des pots d''huile et tapissez-le de papier sulfurisé. Façonner la pâte en un rond lisse avec une forme grossièrement pointue à une extrémité pour qu''elle remplisse à moitié le pot. Laisser jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/chaleur tournante 170°C/gaz 5. Badigeonner le dessus du pain d''œuf battu, saupoudrer de graines de pavot ou de sésame et cuire au four pendant 45-50 minutes (15-20 minutes pour les petits pains) jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Laissez reposer 5 à 10 minutes, puis sortez du pot et laissez refroidir sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9720,8780,'fr','Pain de feu de joie au fromage','Mieux consommé frais, ce pain savoureux peut également être préparé à l''avance et congelé : parfait pour une soirée feu de joie.','["200g de farine complète","200 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 cuillères à café de crème de tartre","1 cuillère à café de sel","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","25 g de beurre fondu","300 ml de lait, à température ambiante","175 g de cheddar grossièrement râpé","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille","85 g de poivrons grillés en bocal, égouttés et hachés"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/chaleur tournante 170C/gaz 5. Tamiser le\r\nsécher les ingrédients dans un grand bol et faire un grand\r\nbien au milieu. Mélangez le beurre fondu et\r\nlait, puis versez dans le puits. Mélanger jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle.","Saupoudrez le plan de travail de farine. Ajoutez la plupart de\r\nle cheddar, 2 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille et le\r\npoivrons hachés à la pâte. Pétrir doucement pour\r\nmélanger sur la surface farinée. Diviser en 8 morceaux\r\net façonner en rondelles grossières de deux largeurs de doigt de profondeur.","Disposez les morceaux côte à côte sur une plaque à pâtisserie farinée.\r\nplaque, parsemer le reste du cheddar et de la citrouille\r\ngraines sur le dessus et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées\r\ndorer et le fromage bouillonne. Refroidir sur une grille\r\net manger chaud. Le pain peut alors être congelé\r\npoint. Pour réchauffer, enveloppez bien le pain dans du papier aluminium et\r\nenfourner à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6 pendant environ 30 min."]','2026-01-11 00:01:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9721,8782,'fr','Pain au poivre noir concassé et aux figues','Un hit enflammé qui se marie bien avec le fromage','["650 g de farine blanche forte","2 cuillères à café de poivre noir concassé","2 cuillères à café de sel","Sachet de 7 g de levure Easy Blend","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","425-450 ml/¾ pinte-16fl oz d''eau tiède","350 g de figues séchées prêtes à consommer, hachées grossièrement"]','["Dans un grand bol, mélanger la farine, le poivre, le sel et la levure. Incorporer l''huile d''olive et suffisamment d''eau tiède pour former une pâte molle. Démouler sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrir pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse et élastique.","Mettez la pâte dans un grand bol légèrement huilé. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé et laisser dans un endroit chaud pendant environ 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. Chauffer le four à 200°C/chaleur tournante 180°/gaz 6. Lorsque la pâte a levé, pétrir à nouveau pour incorporer les figues, en poussant la pâte et en la pétrissant légèrement. Ne pas trop travailler la pâte ; cela peut paraître assez difficile.","Façonnez la pâte en un ovale grossier et posez-la sur une plaque à pâtisserie légèrement farinée. À l''aide de ciseaux, coupez le dessus du pain et saupoudrez d''un peu de farine. Laissez-le lever à nouveau, à découvert, jusqu''à ce qu''il gonfle légèrement, environ 10 à 15 minutes (si la cuisine est chaude). Cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que le son semble creux lorsque vous le tapotez en dessous, puis laisser refroidir sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:01:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9722,8784,'fr','Focaccia à l''oignon rouge et au romarin','Ce pain simple et rustique accompagne à merveille les salades et les antipasti.','["1 lot de pâte à pain blanc (voir la recette « Se marie bien avec » ci-dessous)","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gros oignons rouges, tranchés","une poignée de brins de romarin","1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin"]','["Préparez la pâte de base en ajoutant 2 cuillères à soupe d''olive\r\nhuile et seulement une pincée de sel. Pendant que la pâte\r\nlève, faites revenir les oignons dans 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive pendant\r\n5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, puis réserver.","Quand la pâte a levé, rabattez-la\r\net étirez-le pour qu''il s''adapte à un moule à pain suisse huilé\r\nenviron 25x35cm. Laisser lever la pâte\r\npendant environ 20 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.\r\nRépartissez les oignons sur la pâte et\r\nparsemer de romarin. Appuyez sur vos doigts\r\ndans la pâte pour faire des fossettes, arroser de\r\nle reste de l''huile et saupoudrer de sel,\r\npuis enfourner pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Partir\r\nrefroidir, puis servir coupé ou déchiré en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9723,8786,'fr','Tourbillons de pain aux olives','Ces délicieux petits pains salés constituent un excellent accompagnement pour un déjeuner','["500 g de farine blanche forte, plus un peu pour rouler","1 cuillère à café de sel","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche facile à mélanger","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu pour badigeonner","petit bouquet de basilic","170 g d''olives noires dénoyautées (environ 200 g de poids non dénoyautées)","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","4 anchois en conserve (facultatif)","50 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées"]','["Dans un grand bol, mélanger la farine, le sel,\r\nlevure, 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive et 300 ml tiède\r\neau, pour faire une pâte molle. Pétrir par\r\nà la main pendant 10 min ou avec le crochet pétrisseur\r\nau robot culinaire ou au mixeur pendant 5 minutes.\r\nRemettez la pâte dans le bac nettoyé\r\nbol à mélanger, puis couvrir le bol avec\r\nfilm alimentaire huilé. Laisser lever une heure\r\ndans un endroit chaud jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Jeter\r\nles tiges de basilic coriaces (laissez les plus tendres)\r\nallumé) et mettez-le dans un mini robot culinaire ou\r\nbol du mixeur plongeant avec les olives noires.\r\nAjoutez 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, l''ail et le\r\nanchois, si vous en utilisez. Whizz jusqu''à obtenir une pâte grossière.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nTapisser un moule peu profond d''environ 30 x 20 cm.\r\navec du papier antiadhésif. Sur un plan de travail fariné,\r\nétaler grossièrement la pâte en rectangle\r\n30x40cm. Répartir la pâte d''olive partout\r\net disposez les olives vertes entières dans un\r\nalignez l’un des bords courts. Rouler\r\npréparer la pâte comme un petit pain suisse, à partir de\r\nle bout court incrusté d''olives pour faire\r\nune forme de saucisse.","Coupez la pâte en 12 tranches, puis\r\nsoulevez soigneusement chacun dans le moule, pour\r\nfaire 4 rangées de 3 formes de tourbillon. Légèrement\r\nbadigeonner le tout avec le reste de l’huile d’olive.\r\nCouvrir légèrement d''un film alimentaire, puis laisser\r\nlever pendant environ 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que légèrement\r\ngonflé et remplissant la boîte. Cuisiner pour\r\n20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis laissez reposer\r\nlaisser refroidir dans le moule."]','2026-01-11 00:01:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9724,4817,'fr','Pain malté aux graines de noix','Avec une bonne texture de pain et une bonne croûte, ce pain sans gluten se tranche bien et a été un succès dans notre cuisine test.','["500 g de farine complète forte (nous avons utilisé de la farine de pain de malterie à grains mélangés Doves Farm)","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sel","jusqu''à 350 ml d''eau tiède","100g de graines mélangées (nous avons utilisé un mélange de graines de lin, de graines de chanvre, de graines de courge et de graines de sésame)","50 g de morceaux de noix","un peu d''huile de tournesol, pour graisser"]','["Faire la pâte avec la farine, la levure, le sel\r\net de l''eau comme indiqué dans la recette « Se marie bien avec » (voir à droite), en ajoutant\r\nla plupart des graines et toutes les noix pendant que vous\r\npétrir la pâte. Laisser lever dans un bol propre\r\ncomme indiqué, puis renversez-le et façonnez-le en un\r\ngrand rond. Rouler le rond dans le reste\r\ngraines, puis soulevez le pain sur un plateau pour prouver\r\npendant environ 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7.\r\nFaites cuire le pain 15 min, puis réduisez\r\nla chaleur à 190C/ventilateur 170C/gaz 5 et\r\npoursuivre la cuisson 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le pain\r\nsonne creux lorsqu''on tape sur la base.\r\nLaisser refroidir le pain sur une grille\r\ncomplètement. Le pain restera frais dans un\r\ncontenant hermétique pendant 3 jours ou peut être\r\ncongelé pendant 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:01:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9725,8788,'fr','Stromboli jambon & tomates','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce pain de style pizza nourrira une foule pour le déjeuner.','["1 lot de pâte à pain blanc (voir la recette « Se marie bien avec » ci-dessous)","6 cuillères à soupe de sauce tomate de bonne qualité","3 tranches de jambon très fines, déchirées","100 g de mozzarella en boule, râpée","poignée de feuille de basilic","1 œuf battu"]','["Préparez la pâte, laissez-la lever et\r\nrepousser comme indiqué. Chauffer le four à\r\n200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6.","Sur un plan légèrement fariné, étalez la pâte\r\njusqu''à obtenir un rectangle approximatif d''environ 40 x 25 cm.\r\nÉtalez la sauce sur la pâte en laissant\r\nune petite bordure, et répartir sur le jambon,\r\nmozzarella et basilic. Rentrez les côtés courts\r\ndedans et enroulez le côté long comme un petit pain suisse.\r\nSoulever sur un plateau, côté joint vers le bas, et brosser\r\navec l''oeuf. Cuire au four 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que ce soit gonflé\r\net doré – ne vous inquiétez pas s’il y a un\r\nquelques fissures. Laisser refroidir légèrement puis servir\r\ndécoupé sur une planche."]','2026-01-11 00:01:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9726,8790,'fr','Brownies à la patate douce','Utilisez les sucres naturels des patates douces pour préparer des brownies fondants. Il est également facile de rendre la recette végétalienne : assurez-vous simplement que le chocolat noir et la poudre de cacao que vous utilisez ne contiennent pas de produits laitiers.','["2 (environ 400 g) patates douces, coupées en deux","125g de beurre d''amande","100g de sirop d''érable","25 g de cacao en poudre tamisé","50g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","25 g d''amandes hachées (facultatif)","100 g de chocolat noir haché grossièrement (sans produits laitiers si nécessaire)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser un moule carré de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé et réserver. Mettez les moitiés de patates douces dans un autre moule ou une autre plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les rôtir pendant 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies. Laisser refroidir, puis passer au robot culinaire et mixer jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Réduisez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Versez le mélange de patates douces dans un bol et mélangez avec tous les ingrédients restants, sauf les amandes et 50 g de chocolat noir. Versez la pâte dans la plaque à pâtisserie préparée. Répartissez dessus les amandes, si vous en utilisez, puis faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette en ressorte avec quelques miettes. Laisser refroidir. Faites fondre le reste du chocolat noir dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au micro-ondes pendant 30 secondes, en remuant, puis par rafales de 10 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. Arroser les brownies, puis laisser refroidir avant de couper en 12 ou 16 morceaux. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9727,8792,'fr','Brownies triple chocolat de niveau supérieur','Régalez-vous avec ces brownies fondants : ils sont denses, gluants et savoureux, parfaits pour Pâques ou chaque fois que vous avez envie de chocolat.','["150g de beurre doux","350g de chocolat noir (au moins 70%), haché","1 expresso ou 30 ml de café très fort","100 g de farine de seigle ou nature","25g de poudre de cacao bio","4 œufs, température ambiante","300 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","100 g de chocolat au lait haché","100 g de chocolat blanc haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 20 x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé en laissant un peu de dépassement. Mettez le chocolat noir, le beurre et le café dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et placez-le sur une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau. Remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis laisser refroidir légèrement. Cela peut également être fait par courtes rafales au micro-ondes, en remuant entre chaque rafale. Dans un autre bol, mélangez la farine de seigle, la poudre de cacao et ½ cuillère à café de sel marin.","À l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou d''un fouet électrique, battre ensemble les œufs, le sucre et la vanille pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais, pâle et double de volume. Incorporez progressivement le mélange de chocolat fondu refroidi, en prenant soin de retenir le plus d''air possible. Tamisez délicatement les ingrédients secs sur la pâte et incorporez-les jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tout juste combinés. Ajouter les deux tiers du chocolat au lait et du chocolat blanc hachés et incorporer brièvement. Versez la pâte dans le moule et lissez le dessus avec une spatule, puis répartissez-la sur le reste des morceaux de chocolat et poussez-les légèrement vers le haut avec la spatule. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient pris mais que le milieu vacille encore légèrement. Retirer du four et parsemer d''un peu de sel marin feuilleté.","Laissez les brownies refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis sortez-les à l''aide du papier. Si vous les voulez super gluants et moelleux au milieu, servez-les à température ambiante, mais si vous les voulez fondants, refroidissez-les au réfrigérateur – dans tous les cas, ils seront coupés en neuf carrés généreux ou en 16 morceaux plus petits. Conserver dans un contenant hermétique à température ambiante jusqu''à trois jours, ou au réfrigérateur pour devenir fondant jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9728,3928,'fr','Blondies faciles','Préparez ces blondies faciles avec des morceaux de chocolat blanc gourmands parsemés partout. Ces carrés gluants et dorés accompagnent parfaitement une tasse de thé ou de café','["175 g de beurre coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille ou de pâte de haricots","200 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","200 g de chocolat blanc haché ou utilisez des pépites de chocolat blanc","175 g de beurre coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille ou de pâte de haricots","200 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","200 g de chocolat blanc haché ou utilisez des pépites de chocolat blanc"]','["Faire fondre le beurre et les deux sucres dans une casserole à feu doux, en ajoutant une pincée de sel si le beurre n''est pas salé. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir 10 minutes – cela empêchera les œufs de cailler une fois ajoutés. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule carré de 23 cm ou un moule à pâtisserie de 25 x 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé.","Battre les œufs et la vanille dans le mélange de beurre et de sucre refroidi jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Tamisez la farine et la levure chimique, puis incorporez délicatement jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Incorporez le chocolat blanc, puis grattez-le dans le moule préparé. Lisser le dessus et cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords se détachent des côtés du moule, que le dessus ait une croûte de papier et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte avec quelques miettes, mais pas de pâte liquide. Les blondies se raffermiront en refroidissant.","Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Les blondies se conservent trois jours dans une boîte hermétique.","Faire fondre le beurre et les deux sucres dans une casserole à feu doux, en ajoutant une pincée de sel si le beurre n''est pas salé. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir 10 minutes – cela empêchera les œufs de cailler une fois ajoutés. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule carré de 23 cm ou un moule à pâtisserie de 25 x 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé.","Battre les œufs et la vanille dans le mélange de beurre et de sucre refroidi jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Tamisez la farine et la levure chimique, puis incorporez délicatement jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Incorporez le chocolat blanc, puis grattez-le dans le moule préparé. Lisser le dessus et cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords se détachent des côtés du moule, que le dessus ait une croûte de papier et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte avec quelques miettes, mais pas de pâte liquide. Les blondies se raffermiront en refroidissant.","Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Les blondies se conservent trois jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9729,3994,'fr','Brownies au pudding de Noël végétaliens','Préparez des brownies fabuleusement festifs en ajoutant du pudding de Noël au mélange. Ils ne contiennent pas de produits laitiers, ils conviennent donc également aux végétaliens.','["1 x 150 g de pudding de Noël","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin moulues ou de graines de lin","200 g de chocolat noir sans produits laitiers, haché","100 g de pâte à tartiner sans produits laitiers","100 ml de lait végétal, comme d''avoine ou d''amande","huile végétale, pour la boîte","125 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues","50g de cacao en poudre","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","¼ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","1 cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de gousse de vanille","un peu de sucre glace mélangé à une pincée de cannelle moulue, pour saupoudrer"]','["Coupez ou émiettez le pudding de Noël sans Asda en petits morceaux et réservez. Mélangez les graines de lin moulues avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans un petit bol, et laissez épaissir et former un gel.","Faites fondre 150 g de chocolat, la pâte à tartiner et le lait dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une petite casserole d''eau frémissante (assurez-vous que le fond du bol ne touche pas l''eau). Remuer jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu et que le mélange soit lisse. Retirer du feu.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler un moule à brownie ou à gâteau carré de 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Fouettez brièvement la farine, la poudre d''amandes, le cacao, les sucres et le sel dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pour briser les grumeaux de sucre. Faites un puits au centre, puis incorporez le mélange de chocolat, ainsi que le mélange de graines de lin et de vanille. Battre jusqu''à consistance lisse et que toute la farine soit incorporée – la pâte doit être épaisse.","Incorporez les morceaux de pudding de Noël et les morceaux de chocolat restants jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste incorporés, puis grattez-les dans le moule préparé. Lisser la surface avec une spatule et cuire au four pendant 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus ait une légère croûte et qu''il y ait une légère oscillation au centre. Une brochette insérée au milieu doit contenir des miettes humides, mais pas de pâte crue. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Coupez les brownies en carrés et servez à température ambiante, ou réfrigérez pour une texture plus fondante. Se conservera dans un récipient hermétique à température ambiante ou au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours, ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois. Saupoudrez de sucre glace à la cannelle juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9730,8794,'fr','Brownies gluants faciles','Connaissez-vous le secret des brownies gluants ? Ne les faites pas trop cuire et parsemez de caramel ou de chocolats fourrés de caramel liquide ou de ganache pour aider à ajouter de l''humidité.','["150g de beurre","75 g de cassonade légère et molle","150 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","3 œufs","125 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","150 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre, et un peu plus pour saupoudrer","4-6 cuillères à soupe de dulce de leche, de pâte à tartiner au caramel ou au chocolat et aux noisettes"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à gâteau carré de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre ensemble le beurre, la cassonade, le chocolat et le sirop doré doucement à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit lisse. Retirez la casserole du feu.","Fouettez ensemble les œufs et le sucre en poudre dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux – cela prendra quelques minutes et mérite d''être fait correctement. Ajoutez l''extrait de vanille, puis tamisez la farine, la levure chimique et le cacao en poudre et ajoutez le mélange chocolaté. Pliez le tout rapidement et versez la moitié du mélange dans le moule. Parsemer de boules de pâte à tartiner au caramel ou au chocolat et aux noisettes, puis verser le reste du mélange de brownie sur le dessus. Ajoutez d''autres boules de caramel ou de pâte à tartiner au chocolat, si vous le souhaitez, et faites cuire au four pendant 30 minutes. Le dessus du mélange doit maintenant être pris et légèrement craquelé, mais le mélange en dessous aura encore une légère oscillation.","Retirer du four et laisser refroidir complètement avant de couper en carrés. Saupoudrez le dessus de cacao ou de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez, ou si vous le servez en dessert, arrosez de plus de caramel. Se conserve 3 jours dans une boite hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9731,6151,'fr','Brookies','Combinez deux pâtisseries populaires, un biscuit moelleux aux pépites de chocolat et un riche brownie, dans cette gâterie inventive. Remplissez le moule à gâteau avec ceux-ci pour les fêtes de fin d''année ou offrez-le en cadeau.','["120 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","120 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de sucre muscovado noir","1 gros œuf et 1 jaune d''œuf","250 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","50 g de morceaux de chocolat au lait","185g de beurre doux","185 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao)","3 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","275 g de sucre en poudre doré","50g de cacao en poudre","130 g de farine nature","50 g de morceaux de chocolat au lait"]','["Beurrer un moule à cake carré de 23 cm de côté et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tout d''abord, réalisez la couche de biscuits. Mettez le beurre et les deux sucres dans un bol et battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Vous pouvez également le faire dans un batteur sur socle. Ajouter l''œuf entier et le jaune d''œuf et battre à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer la farine, ¼ cuillère à café de sel, le bicarbonate de soude et les morceaux de chocolat. Pressez la pâte à biscuits dans le fond du moule préparé à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère, puis mettez au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes.","Pour la couche de brownie, faites fondre le beurre et le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante, en remuant jusqu''à consistance lisse et homogène. Laisser refroidir légèrement, environ 10 min. Fouetter les œufs, la vanille et le sucre dans un grand bol avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe légèrement, environ 3 minutes.","Pliez le mélange de chocolat au beurre, le cacao et la farine pour combiner. Versez le mélange de brownie sur la couche de pâte à biscuits, parsemez de morceaux de chocolat et saupoudrez de flocons de sel marin, si vous le souhaitez. Cuire au centre du four pendant 50 minutes à 1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte avec juste quelques miettes qui s''y accrochent. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule avant de découper en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9732,8796,'fr','Brownies sans farine','Servez ces brownies sans farine chauds avec de la glace en dessert. Ils sont faciles à préparer et ne nécessitent que cinq ingrédients. Ils sont donc parfaits pour les boulangers débutants.','["200 g de beurre haché, plus un peu pour le moule","250 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao), cassé en petits morceaux","225 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs","100 g d''amandes moulues"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake carré de 20 x 20 cm de 4 cm de profondeur et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Faites fondre 200 g de chocolat avec le beurre dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante (veillez à ce que le fond du bol ne touche pas l''eau), en remuant de temps en temps. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir 10 min.","Pendant ce temps, fouettez le sucre, les œufs et une pincée de sel dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux – cela devrait ressembler à un milk-shake mousseux. Cela prendra 2 à 3 minutes avec un fouet électrique, ou environ 5 à 8 minutes avec un fouet ballon. Versez le mélange beurre-chocolat ainsi que les amandes, puis mélangez le tout jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de traces de chocolat. Versez le mélange dans le moule, répartissez sur le reste du chocolat et faites cuire au four pendant 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit avec une légère oscillation au milieu.","Laisser refroidir 10 minutes, puis verser dans des bols et servir chaud pour un pudding. Alternativement, laissez refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis coupez-le en carrés et conservez-le dans une boîte hermétique. Se conserve jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9733,8798,'fr','Brownies au chocolat salé et aux noisettes','La tartinade au chocolat et aux noisettes garantit à ces brownies gourmands un centre fondant. Parsemés de pacanes et de sel marin – ils seront la nouvelle recette de brownie incontournable','["100 g de beurre légèrement salé coupé en petits morceaux, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de chocolat noir 70% cassé en morceaux","150 g de pâte à tartiner chocolat et noisettes","3 œufs battus","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","150 g de farine nature","100 g de noix de pécan grillées et hachées grossièrement","glace et sauce caramel, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule carré de 20 cm. Mettez le beurre, le chocolat et la pâte à tartiner au chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et faites fondre dans une casserole d''eau légèrement frémissante. Une fois fondu, remuez et laissez refroidir un peu.","Dans un autre bol, utilisez un fouet électrique pour battre les œufs et le sucre ensemble pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Versez le mélange de chocolat et fouettez brièvement pour combiner. Tamisez la farine et incorporez délicatement au mélange, puis ajoutez la plupart des pacanes. Versez le mélange dans le moule et étalez-le avec une spatule. Répartir les dernières noix de pécan et une bonne pincée de sel marin.","Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris mais un peu gluant au milieu. Laisser refroidir, puis couper en carrés et servir avec de la glace et une sauce caramel."]','2026-01-11 00:01:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9734,8800,'fr','Brownies aux œufs de Pâques','Rempli d''œufs et de poussins en chocolat, c''est la pièce maîtresse ultime de Pâques : un régal spécial « eggstra » pour le thé de l''après-midi ou le dessert.','["185 g de beurre doux, coupé en petits morceaux, plus un peu pour graisser","185 g de meilleur chocolat noir, cassé en morceaux","3 gros œufs","275 g de sucre en poudre doré","85 g de farine nature","40g de cacao en poudre","5 œufs fourrés au fondant (nous avons utilisé des œufs à la crème Cadbury''s)","150 g de mini œufs (nous avons utilisé un mélange de mini œufs Cadbury''s et Smarties)","Vous aurez également besoin de quelques poussins de Pâques en chenille moelleux pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le beurre et le chocolat dans un bol de taille moyenne résistant à la chaleur et placez-les sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus. Vous pouvez également couvrir le bol sans serrer d''un film alimentaire et passer au micro-ondes à intervalles de 30 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. Laissez le mélange de chocolat fondu refroidir à température ambiante.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule carré de 20 cm de diamètre et le tapisser de 2 longues bandes de papier sulfurisé plié ou de papier d''aluminium – l''une allant de haut en bas, l''autre de gauche à droite puis tapisser le fond d''un morceau de papier sulfurisé. Les bandes vous aideront à le retirer plus tard.","Cassez les œufs dans un grand bol et versez-y le sucre en poudre. Avec un batteur électrique à vitesse maximale, fouettez les œufs et le sucre pendant environ 5 à 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils paraissent épais et crémeux et aient doublé de volume.","Versez le mélange de chocolat refroidi sur le mélange d''œufs, puis mélangez délicatement.","Tamisez la farine et le cacao dans les ingrédients humides, puis continuez à incorporer délicatement le mélange avec une spatule jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé, essayez de ne pas trop mélanger.","Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et nivelez soigneusement le mélange avec la spatule. Mettez au milieu du four et faites cuire 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, coupez les œufs fourrés au fondant en deux et réservez puis placez les mini œufs dans un pilon et un mortier. Écrasez quelques mini-œufs mais laissez-en quelques-uns entiers. Au bout de 20 minutes, sortez le brownie du four et pressez-y les œufs fondants, côté coupé vers le haut. Répartissez également la moitié des mini œufs puis remettez au four encore 5 min.","Une fois cuit, garnir des mini œufs restants, laisser refroidir complètement puis placer au réfrigérateur environ 1h pour raffermir. Sortez-le du moule à l''aide des bandes de papier sulfurisé et coupez-le en carrés pour servir. Décorez avec des petits poussins de Pâques si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9735,8802,'fr','Brownies de la Forêt-Noire','Ces brownies fondants faciles à préparer, dotés d''une décoration rétro, marient une association de saveurs très appréciée de cerise et de chocolat.','["250 g de beurre doux, ramolli à température ambiante, plus un peu pour graisser","1 cuillère à soupe de café instantané en poudre","350 g de sucre mou roux clair","4 œufs moyens","75g de cacao en poudre","100 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café d''essence de cerise (facultatif), disponible chez Lakeland","100 g de griottes séchées, hachées","200 g de chocolat noir (60% de cacao)","25 g de beurre doux, ramolli à température ambiante","50g de sucre glace","gel colorant alimentaire vert","20 cerises glacées, coupées en deux"]','["Beurrer un moule à cake de 30 x 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger le café avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante, puis laisser refroidir.","Crémer le beurre et le sucre ensemble pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légers et mousseux, puis ajouter les œufs, un à la fois, en incorporant bien après chaque ajout. Dans un autre bol, mélanger la poudre de cacao et la farine. Ajoutez l''essence de cerise et le café refroidi au mélange de beurre, suivis des ingrédients secs. Bien mélanger, puis incorporer les cerises.","Verser dans le moule préparé, niveler le dessus avec le dos d''une cuillère et cuire au centre du four pendant 30 à 35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Une fois refroidi, faites fondre le chocolat noir au micro-ondes ou dans une casserole d''eau frémissante, puis étalez-le en couche uniforme sur le dessus des brownies.","Pendant que le chocolat prend, mélangez le beurre avec le sucre glace et quelques gouttes de colorant vert. Mettez la crème au beurre dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille à embout d''écriture. Coupez les brownies en 20 carrés, placez deux moitiés de cerise glacée sur chacun et utilisez la crème au beurre pour créer la tige de cerise."]','2026-01-11 00:01:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9736,8804,'fr','Brownies aux noisettes','Les chocolats Ferrero Rocher apportent une touche finale gourmande à ces carrés de brownie au chocolat fondants parsemés de noix hachées.','["coffret de 16 chocolats Ferrero Rocher","250 g de beurre salé + un peu pour graisser","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","225 g de sucre muscovado léger","100g de cacao en poudre","4 gros œufs","100 g de farines autolevantes","85 g de noisettes déjà concassées","4 cuillères à soupe de liqueur de noisette Frangelico ou Fratello (ou Disaronno)"]','["Déballez les chocolats, placez-les sur un plateau et mettez au congélateur. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Graisser légèrement et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule carré de 21-22 cm de papier sulfurisé.","Mettez le beurre, les sucres et le cacao dans votre plus grande casserole et faites fondre doucement ensemble, en remuant régulièrement pour que le mélange ne colle pas. Une fois les grains de sucre presque disparus, retirez du feu, versez dans un bol et laissez refroidir 5 minutes.","Utilisez un fouet ou une cuillère en bois pour incorporer les œufs un à un au mélange. Lorsqu’elles sont complètement incorporées et que le mélange est lisse et brillant, incorporez la farine, les noisettes et la liqueur. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et enfournez pour 35 minutes.","Retirez le moule du four et utilisez un couteau à couverts pour marquer le dessus des brownies en 16 carrés (ne coupez pas, c''est juste à titre indicatif). Utilisez une cuillère à café pour faire une petite bosse au centre de chaque portion et ajoutez un chocolat Ferrero Rocher surgelé dans chaque trempette. Remettre au four 3 min, puis retirer et laisser refroidir complètement.","Une fois refroidi, coupez en 16 carrés. Se conserve 3 jours dans une boite hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:01:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9737,8806,'fr','Brownies au beurre de cacahuète et à la confiture au micro-ondes','Oubliez les mug cakes au micro-ondes : si vous recherchez une véritable gourmandise en seulement 15 minutes, cette recette facile de brownie au chocolat est sûre de faire mouche.','["75 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","50g de beurre de cacahuète","1 oeuf","25g de cacao en poudre","50g de farine nature","100g de sucre","quelques cuillères à café de confiture"]','["Ajoutez le beurre et le beurre de cacahuète dans un bol allant au micro-ondes et faites cuire à puissance élevée pendant 30 secondes pour les faire fondre. Retirer du micro-ondes et bien mélanger. Laisser refroidir légèrement puis ajouter l''œuf et mélanger. Beurrer et tapisser un deuxième plat rond allant au micro-ondes (environ 15 cm de large) de film alimentaire. Versez le mélange de beurre de cacahuète dans le plat tapissé, puis tamisez la poudre de cacao et la farine et versez le sucre. Mélangez délicatement pour former une pâte épaisse et collante. Lisser le dessus du mélange avec le dos d''une grande cuillère.","À l''aide d''une cuillère à café, faites des trous dans le dessus du mélange de brownies et remplissez-les généreusement de confiture, car elle fondra et bouillonnera une fois cuite. Mettez au micro-ondes pendant 3-4 minutes à puissance élevée. Retirez-le et laissez-le refroidir 15 minutes (il poursuivra la cuisson en refroidissant) puis dégustez !"]','2026-01-11 00:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9738,8808,'fr','Brownies noir et blanc','Améliorez le brownie classique avec une pâte au chocolat gluante surmontée d''un mélange de cheesecake crémeux pour un effet marbré saisissant.','["250 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de chocolat noir","50g de chocolat blanc","375 g de sucre en poudre doré","5 œufs moyens","50 g de farine nature, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","85g de cacao","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","Pot de 200 g de fromage frais"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule de 20 x 30 cm de papier sulfurisé. Hachez finement 150 g de chocolat noir, et hachez grossièrement le reste de chocolat noir et le chocolat blanc. Mettez le chocolat finement haché dans un bol et faites-le fondre dans une petite casserole d''eau frémissante ou au micro-ondes. Laisser refroidir un peu.","Mettez le beurre et 350 g de sucre dans un bol et battez jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Ajoutez 4 œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien entre chaque ajout, puis tamisez la farine, le cacao, la levure chimique et une bonne pincée de sel. Enfin, incorporez le chocolat fondu et les morceaux de chocolat hachés. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et lissez la surface.","En travaillant rapidement, versez le fromage à la crème dans un bol et battez pour le ramollir avec une spatule. Ajouter le reste de l''œuf, la farine et le sucre et mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien combiné. Versez des gouttes du mélange de fromage à la crème sur le brownie jusqu''à épuisement, et utilisez le bout d''un couteau à couverts ou d''une brochette pour mélanger les 2 mélanges ensemble afin de créer un effet marbré. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste pris – il devrait encore vaciller un peu à la sortie du four, et un cure-dent inséré au centre devrait ressortir avec des miettes collantes. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule avant de couper en carrés et de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9739,8810,'fr','Gâteaux pour bébés au brownie aux cerises','Magnifiques gâteaux brownies au chocolat individuels avec une cuillerée de crème légèrement fouettée et des fruits supplémentaires pour la garniture','["175 g de beurre haché, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de chocolat noir haché","250 g de sucre roux clair et mou","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","85 g de farine nature","50 g de cacao en poudre, plus un peu pour servir","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 gros œufs battus","200 g de cerises coupées en deux et dénoyautées, plus 12 avec les tiges attachées, pour servir (facultatif)","crème double, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer 12 trous d''un moule à muffins profond et tapisser chaque trou d''une bande de papier sulfurisé – cela vous aidera à retirer les brownies plus tard (ou tapisser 16 trous de 2 plateaux de moules à muffins). Mettez le beurre, 150 g de chocolat, le sucre et la vanille dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, suspendu au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante. Faites chauffer doucement en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu, puis retirez du feu et laissez refroidir quelques minutes. Pendant ce temps, tamisez ensemble la farine, le cacao, la levure chimique et une bonne pincée de sel dans un grand bol.","Ajoutez le mélange de chocolat chaud et fondu, les œufs, les cerises et les 50 g de chocolat restants aux ingrédients secs, puis mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Répartissez le mélange entre les trous des moules à muffins en veillant à ce que chacun reçoive quelques morceaux de cerise. Cuire au four pendant 18 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits mais encore gluants au centre – ils continueront à cuire un peu en refroidissant. Laisser refroidir 30 minutes dans le moule avant de transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement, ou de manger chaud avec une cuillerée de crème, un saupoudrage de cacao et des cerises supplémentaires sur le dessus, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9740,8812,'fr','Brownies végétaliens aux cerises et aux amandes','Profondément riche et décadente, cette pâtisserie au chocolat sans produits laitiers ni œufs constitue une délicieuse gâterie végétalienne','["80 g de margarine végétalienne, plus un peu pour graisser","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin moulues","120 g de chocolat noir","½ cuillère à café de grains de café","125 g de farines autolevantes","70 g d''amandes moulues","50g de cacao en poudre","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","1½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","70 g de cerises glacées (rincées et coupées en deux)"]','["Chauffer le four à 170C/150C ventilateur/gaz 31?2. Beurrer et tapisser un moule carré de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez les graines de lin avec 6 cuillères à soupe d''eau et laissez reposer au moins 5 minutes.","Dans une casserole, faites fondre le chocolat, le café et la margarine avec 60 ml d''eau à feu doux. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Mettez la farine, les amandes, le cacao, la levure chimique et 1 à 4 cuillères à café de sel dans un bol et remuez pour éliminer les grumeaux. À l''aide d''un fouet à main, mélangez le sucre au mélange de chocolat fondu et battez bien jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et brillante, en vous assurant que tout le sucre est bien dissous. Incorporer le mélange de graines de lin et l''extrait de vanille, les cerises puis le mélange de farine. Ce sera désormais très épais. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et verser dans le moule préparé. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre avec des miettes humides. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis couper en carrés. Conserver dans un contenant hermétique et consommer dans les 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9741,8814,'fr','Barres de brownie au pain d''épices au chocolat et glaçage fondant','Ces barres luxueuses sont basées sur un gâteau sans farine classique, elles sont donc à la fois riches et légères.','["400 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","25g de cacao en poudre","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","250g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","140 g d''amandes moulues","6 gros œufs, séparés","100 g de beurre coupé en cubes","50 g de chocolat noir, utilisez une barre cassée en morceaux ou en pépites","50g de cacao","200 g de sucre glace tamisé","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre moulu","quelques morceaux de gingembre confit, coupé en petits morceaux"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake de 20 x 30 cm, et tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le chocolat, le cacao, le sucre et le beurre dans une casserole à feu très doux. Une fois le chocolat et le beurre fondus et le sucre dissous, retirez du feu et incorporez le gingembre et les amandes, puis les jaunes d''œufs, un à la fois.","Battre les blancs d''oeufs en neige ferme. À l''aide d''une cuillère en métal, incorporez quelques cuillerées de blancs d''œufs au mélange chocolaté pour les détacher avant d''incorporer très délicatement le reste.","Grattez doucement le moule. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit pris et que le centre ne vacille pas trop. Posez le moule à cake sur une grille et laissez-le refroidir complètement.","Une fois refroidi, préparez le glaçage. Mettez le beurre, le chocolat, le cacao, le sucre glace, le gingembre moulu et 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans une casserole. Faites chauffer doucement en remuant jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage lisse. Verser sur le gâteau (toujours dans son moule), laisser refroidir légèrement 1 à 2 minutes, puis parsemer de gingembre. Laisser refroidir complètement (vous pouvez également conserver au réfrigérateur si vous ramenez à température ambiante environ 20 minutes avant de servir) avant de couper en barres."]','2026-01-11 00:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9742,8816,'fr','Carrés de chocolat fondant','Ces carrés de génoise profondément chocolatés sont sans gluten – essayez-les en dessert avec de la glace.','["200 g de beurre haché","200 g de chocolat noir sans gluten haché grossièrement","350 g de sucre en poudre doré","50 g de farines fleuries sans gluten","50g d''amandes moulues","50g de cacao","1 cuillère à café de gomme xanthane","4 gros œufs, battus","50 g de noix cassées ou hachées grossièrement","100 g de beurre haché","2 cuillères à soupe bombées de cacao","200 g de sucre glace tamisé","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","50 g de noix cassées ou hachées grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4\r\net tapissez un moule à brownie de 20 x 30 cm avec\r\npapier sulfurisé. Versez le beurre et\r\nchocolat dans une casserole antiadhésive et\r\nfaire fondre à feu doux en remuant de temps en temps\r\npuis, jusqu''à consistance lisse – veillez à ne pas\r\nsurchauffez-le. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sucre, la farine, le cacao\r\net amandes avec la gomme xanthane. Remuer\r\ndans le mélange de chocolat, puis incorporer\r\nles œufs et ajoutez les noix. Tournez le\r\nmélange dans le moule, niveler avec une spatule\r\net cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et\r\njuste cuit – lorsqu''il est testé avec une brochette,\r\nla mie doit être encore un peu humide.\r\nRefroidir dans le moule.","Pour faire le glaçage, faites fondre le beurre dans un\r\npoêle antiadhésive. Incorporer le cacao et cuire,\r\nen remuant, pendant environ 1 min. Ajouter le glaçage\r\nsucre et lait, et bien battre. Verser dessus\r\ndessus du gâteau refroidi, parsemer de\r\nnoix et pressez-les légèrement.\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris, puis retirez-le délicatement du\r\nmoule, retirer le papier sulfurisé et\r\ncouper en carrés. Se conservera plusieurs\r\njours dans une boîte."]','2026-01-11 00:02:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9743,4973,'fr','Gâteau brownie au chocolat','Le gâteau parfait pour les amateurs de brownies, essayez-en une grosse tranche tiède avec un peu de glace','["175 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","200 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs moyens, séparés","65 g de farine nature","50 g de noix de pécan hachées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake de 20-25 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé.","Placez 175 g de chocolat, plus le beurre et le sucre dans une casserole à fond épais et faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu, en remuant de temps en temps. Laisser refroidir.","Incorporez les jaunes d''œufs au mélange chocolaté, puis ajoutez la farine, les noix et le reste du chocolat.","Battez les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils forment des pics mous, puis incorporez-les délicatement mais soigneusement au mélange chocolaté.","Verser dans le moule préparé et cuire au centre du four pendant environ 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit croustillant. Laisser refroidir, puis passer un couteau sur les côtés et démouler. Saupoudrez de sucre glace et servez tiède avec de la crème anglaise ou de la glace ou froid avec de la crème."]','2026-01-11 00:02:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9744,8818,'fr','Brownies faciles','Une gâterie gluante et délicieuse, ces brownies sont si faciles à préparer. Essayez la riche garniture au chocolat pour une pâtisserie encore plus décadente','["375 g de chocolat noir de bonne qualité","375 g de beurre coupé en morceaux","6 œufs moyens","500 g de sucre en poudre","225 g de farine nature","140 g de chocolat noir de bonne qualité","50 g de beurre coupé en morceaux","sucre glace pour saupoudrer"]','["Beurrer et tapisser un moule de 30 cm x 21 cm. Préchauffer\r\nle four à chaleur tournante 160/conventionnel 180/gaz 4.\r\nCassez le chocolat avec le beurre et\r\nfaire fondre au micro-ondes à puissance moyenne pendant environ\r\n5 minutes en remuant à mi-cuisson.","Battez le sucre et les œufs dans un bol. Incorporer\r\nle chocolat fondu, ajouter la farine et battre\r\neh bien. Verser dans le moule et enfourner 40-45\r\nminutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le dessus ait l''air de papier et\r\nsemble légèrement bancal. Laisser refroidir dans le moule.","Casser le chocolat avec le beurre\r\net faire fondre au micro-ondes à puissance moyenne pendant\r\nenviron 1 minute. Remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis\r\nétaler sur le gâteau. Saupoudrer de sucre glace\r\net coupé en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9745,8820,'fr','Brownies aux canneberges et à la pistache','Moelleux, fruité et noisette – que demander de plus à un brownie ? Prêt en moins d''une heure','["200 g de beurre coupé en dés, plus un peu pour graisser","2 barres de 150 g de chocolat noir (environ 40 % de cacao suffit)","280 g de sucre muscovado léger","4 cuillères à soupe de jus de canneberge ou de lait","4 œufs moyens","200 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 paquet de 75 g de canneberges séchées","100 g de pistaches tranchées","sucre glace pour saupoudrer, facultatif"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule antiadhésif (environ 31 x 17 x 3,5 cm) ou tapisser le fond si vous préférez. Cassez le chocolat dans une casserole, ajoutez le beurre, le sucre et le jus ou le lait, puis réchauffez doucement en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu et uniformément mélangé. Laisser refroidir légèrement, puis incorporer les œufs un à un. Incorporer la farine, la cannelle et les canneberges.","Répartissez la moitié du mélange dans le moule préparé, répartissez-le sur les noix, puis étalez délicatement le reste du mélange dessus. Cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes. Couper en carrés encore chaud. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:02:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9746,8822,'fr','Brownies au beurre de cacahuète','Deux de nos produits préférés – le beurre de cacahuète et les brownies – se combinent pour créer ces friandises irrésistibles.','["225 g de beurre de cacahuète croquant","200 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","280 g de sucre roux clair et mou","3 œufs moyens","100 g de farines autolevantes"]','["Réserver 50 g chacun de beurre de cacahuète\r\net du chocolat. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C\r\nChaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapissez un carré de 20 cm de diamètre\r\nmoule avec du papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre doucement\r\nle reste du beurre de cacahuète, du chocolat et\r\ntout le sucre dans une casserole en remuant de temps en temps,\r\njusqu''à ce que le sucre soit à peu près fondu.\r\nÉteignez le feu et utilisez une cuillère en bois\r\nbattre les œufs un à un. Incorporer le\r\nfariner et gratter dans le moule.","Faire fondre le beurre de cacahuète réservé dans le\r\nmicro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 45 secondes, ou\r\nune poêle, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit liquide, puis arrosez-en un filet\r\nbrownie. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il\r\na une croûte, mais le milieu semble toujours\r\nlégèrement cru.","Faire fondre le chocolat réservé, arroser\r\nle brownie, puis laisser refroidir dans le moule avant\r\ncouper en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9747,8823,'fr','Les meilleurs brownies au chocolat et aux framboises de tous les temps','Squidgy et super gourmands, ces magnifiques pâtisseries au chocolat fruitées à toute épreuve seront arrachées en quelques secondes','["200 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","100 g de chocolat au lait cassé en morceaux","250 g de beurre salé","400 g de sucre roux clair et mou","4 gros œufs","140 g de farine nature","50g de cacao en poudre","200g de framboises"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nTapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 20 x 30 cm avec\r\npapier sulfurisé. Mettez le chocolat,\r\nbeurre et sucre dans une casserole et délicatement\r\nfaire fondre en remuant de temps en temps avec un\r\ncuillère en bois. Retirer du feu.","Incorporez les œufs, un à un, dans le\r\nmélange de chocolat fondu. Passer au tamis\r\nla farine et le cacao et incorporez-les. Remuer\r\ndans la moitié des framboises, grattez-les dans le\r\nplateau, puis répartissez-le sur le reste\r\nframboises. Cuire sur la grille du milieu\r\npendant 30 minutes ou, si vous préférez un goût plus ferme\r\ntexture, pendant 5 minutes supplémentaires. Refroidir avant\r\ncouper en carrés. Conserver dans un contenant hermétique.\r\nconteneur jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9748,8825,'fr','Le relooking ultime : les brownies au chocolat','Angela relooke ces riches gourmandises, avec un ingrédient magique pour réduire la teneur en matières grasses…','["85 g de chocolat noir, 70 % de cacao, coupé en petits morceaux","85 g de farine nature","25g de cacao en poudre","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","50 g de sucre muscovado léger","½ cuillère à café de grains de café","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de babeurre","1 oeuf","100 g de mayonnaise (j''ai utilisé de la Hellman''s)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4.\r\nVersez suffisamment d''eau dans une petite casserole pour\r\nremplissez-en un tiers. Portez à ébullition, puis\r\nretirer la casserole du feu. Mettez le\r\nchocolat haché dans un grand bol\r\nqui s''adaptera parfaitement à la poêle sans\r\ntoucher l''eau. Posez la casserole sur le\r\nl''eau (toujours hors du feu) et laissez le\r\nfaire fondre le chocolat doucement pendant quelques minutes,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu\r\nuniformément. Retirez le bol de la poêle,\r\npuis laissez le chocolat refroidir légèrement.","Pendant ce temps, huilez légèrement et fondez un\r\nMoule à gâteau carré de 19 cm et 5 cm de profondeur.\r\nMélanger la farine, le cacao et le bicarbonate\r\nde soude. A l''aide d''une cuillère en bois, mélangez les deux\r\nles sucres dans le chocolat refroidi\r\navec le café, la vanille et le babeurre.\r\nIncorporer 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau tiède. Casser et battre\r\ndans l''œuf, puis incorporer la mayonnaise\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit lisse et brillant. Passer au crible\r\nle mélange farine et cacao, puis délicatement\r\nincorporer à la spatule sans trop mélanger.","Versez le mélange dans le moule, puis\r\nétalez-le doucement et uniformément dans le\r\ncoins. Cuire au four 30 mn. Quand un\r\nbrochette est insérée au milieu, elle\r\ndevrait sortir avec juste quelques gouttes d''humidité\r\ndes miettes y collent. Si la cuisson est trop longue,\r\nle mélange va sécher ; pas assez longtemps\r\net il peut couler. Laisser dans le moule jusqu''à ce que\r\ncomplètement froid, puis desserrez les côtés\r\navec un couteau à lame ronde. Sortez sur\r\nune planche, décollez le papier de doublure et coupez\r\nen 12 carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9749,8827,'fr','Brownies fondants à la noix de coco','Dense et gluante, ces friandises de placard sont faites avec du cacao plutôt qu''avec des barres de chocolat.','["100g de cacao","250g de beurre","500 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs, battus","100 g de farines autolevantes","100 g de noix de coco desséchée","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nTapisser le fond d''un moule carré de 21 cm avec\r\npapier sulfurisé. Mettez le cacao, le beurre\r\net le sucre dans votre plus grande casserole et\r\nfaire fondre doucement, en remuant pour que le mélange ne fonde pas\r\nattraper. Quand le mélange de cacao est fondu\r\net combiné, laisser refroidir légèrement, puis incorporer\r\nles œufs, petit à petit, suivis des\r\nfarine et noix de coco.","Versez dans le moule et enfournez pour 45 mn\r\nsur une étagère du milieu – vérifiez après 30 minutes\r\net recouvrir d''un autre morceau de pâtisserie\r\npapier sulfurisé si la croûte brunit aussi\r\nbeaucoup. Laisser refroidir dans le moule, puis soulever délicatement\r\net coupez-les en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9750,8829,'fr','Morceaux de brownie au chocolat avec trempette au chocolat','Mettez ces petites tentations dans un four doux pour les réchauffer rapidement avant de servir.','["200 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","100 g de chocolat au lait cassé en morceaux","85g de beurre","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","85 g de sucre muscovado noir","3 œufs, à température ambiante et légèrement battus","140 g de farine nature","140 g de noix hachées grossièrement","200 ml de yaourt nature"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 6 et tapisser\r\nle fond d''un carré peu profond de 20 cm de diamètre\r\nmoule avec du papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre 100g de noir\r\nchocolat, tout le chocolat au lait et le\r\nbeurre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur sur une poêle de\r\neau frémissante. Retirer du feu,\r\npuis incorporez les sucres. Refroidissez-vous un peu pendant que vous\r\npréparez le reste des ingrédients.","Incorporer les œufs au mélange chocolaté,\r\nsuivi de la farine, des noix et d''une pincée\r\nde sel jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le\r\nmélange dans le moule préparé, puis cuire au four pendant\r\n25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette insérée vienne\r\navec des miettes collantes. Refroidir dans le moule.","Pour la trempette, faites fondre délicatement le reste\r\nchocolat comme ci-dessus, puis incorporer au yaourt\r\net détendez-vous. Pour servir, coupez les brownies en\r\nmorceaux, puis versez la trempette dans de petits bols."]','2026-01-11 00:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9751,8831,'fr','Brownies au chocolat, canneberges et macadamia','Des restes de sauce aux canneberges ? Utilisez-le comme excuse pour préparer ces délicieux carrés de gâteau au chocolat et aux noix.','["150 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","200g de beurre","200 g de cassonade molle","150 g de farines autolevantes","40 g de cacao en poudre tamisé","3 gros œufs battus","50 g de canneberges séchées","100 g de noix de macadamia","60 g de sauce aux canneberges"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 20 cm x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le chocolat noir avec le beurre au micro-ondes ou dans un bol résistant à la chaleur sur de l''eau frémissante.","Mélangez le sucre, la farine et le cacao en poudre et incorporez le mélange de chocolat et de beurre fondu, suivi des œufs. Incorporer les canneberges séchées et les noix de macadamia, puis incorporer la sauce aux canneberges.","Versez dans le moule et lissez la surface. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes. Laisser refroidir avant de trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:02:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9752,8833,'fr','Bruine de citron de niveau supérieur','Amenez l''humble filet de citron à de nouveaux sommets avec cette recette de niveau supérieur. Que ce soit pour une vente de pâtisseries ou une célébration, cela plaira à coup sûr à tout le monde.','["350 g de beurre ramolli","350 g de sucre en poudre doré","6 œufs moyens","350 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de gousse de vanille","3 citrons non cirés, zestés et pressés","150 g de sucre semoule, plus un peu pour servir","300 ml de crème fraîche","50 g de sucre glace tamisé","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron"]','["Chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapissez le fond de trois moules de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé – si vous n''en avez pas trois, tapissez-en autant que vous en avez et faites cuire par lots. Battre le beurre et le sucre en poudre ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et mousseuse. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien entre chaque ajout et en raclant les parois du bol. Incorporer la farine et la levure chimique jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis incorporer le lait, la vanille et le zeste de 2½ citrons. Répartissez la pâte entre les moules, puis faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu des génoises en ressorte propre (ou qu''un thermomètre à sonde indique 90 °C).","Pendant ce temps, préparez le filet. Mélangez le jus de citron et le sucre semoule dans un bol. Laissez les génoises refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis retournez-en deux sur une grille posée sur une plaque à pâtisserie, côté plat vers le haut. Placez le troisième sur la grille, côté bombé vers le haut. Versez le filet sur les génoises, puis laissez refroidir complètement.","Pour la garniture, battre ensemble la crème, le sucre glace et la vanille à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et tartinable. Mettez une génoise fraîche, côté plat vers le haut, sur une assiette de service ou un support. Répartir sur la moitié de la garniture, puis arroser de la moitié de la crème au citron. Garnir d''une deuxième génoise, côté plat vers le haut, et répéter avec le reste de la garniture et du caillé. Garnir avec la dernière génoise, côté bombé vers le haut. Saupoudrer du reste du zeste de citron et d''un peu de sucre semoule. Servir aussitôt ou laisser 1 h à température ambiante. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à 24 heures (sortir du réfrigérateur 30 minutes avant de servir)."]','2026-01-11 00:02:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9753,8835,'fr','Crème au beurre meringuée suisse','Remplissez vos gâteaux d''une crème au beurre meringuée onctueuse et soyeuse. Cette recette suffit pour remplir et glacer un gâteau à trois étages, et elle est facilement divisée par deux pour les petites pâtisseries.','["300g de blancs d''œufs","600 g de sucre en poudre","800 g de beurre doux, ramolli","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Mettez les blancs d''œufs et le sucre en poudre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et placez-les sur une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante en veillant à ce que l''eau ne touche pas le fond du bol. Remuez doucement pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que vous ne sentiez plus aucun grain de sucre entre vos doigts lorsque vous le touchez. Transférer dans le bol du batteur sur socle équipé du fouet.","Fouetter à vitesse moyenne jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à une meringue et atteigne des pics fermes, environ 3 minutes. (Vous pouvez utiliser un fouet électrique, mais cela prendra beaucoup plus de temps, environ 35 minutes.) Ajoutez le beurre 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois, en fouettant pour combiner avant le prochain ajout. Il peut paraître caillé et velouté, mais soyez patient et continuez à fouetter jusqu''à ce que vous obteniez une crème au beurre onctueuse et moelleuse. Incorporer la vanille. Si vous utilisez cette crème au beurre pour glacer un gâteau, passez à la palette et réglez-la à basse vitesse pendant quelques minutes – cela aide à éliminer les bulles d''air du glaçage et donne une finition plus lisse à votre gâteau. Si vous le souhaitez, vous pouvez également ajouter du chocolat fondu, de la poudre de fruits lyophilisés, de l''extrait de malt ou d''autres arômes."]','2026-01-11 00:02:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9754,8837,'fr','Gâteau boucle aux groseilles','Vous avez une surabondance de groseilles à maquereau cultivées sur place ? Mettez-les en valeur à leur meilleur dans ce glorieux gâteau, avec une base de génoise, une garniture à la groseille et une garniture crumble.','["200 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 œufs","200 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","50g d''amandes moulues","100 ml de crème sure","60 g de farine nature","50 g de beurre doux froid, coupé en cubes","60 g de sucre en poudre doré","60 g de flocons d''avoine","25g d''amandes effilées","500 g de groseilles fraîches ou surgelées (voir astuce ci-dessous ; un mélange de vert et de rose si disponible)","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre"]','["Pour la garniture, mélanger les groseilles et le sucre dans un bol en écrasant légèrement les baies. Réserver pour macérer.","Pour préparer le crumble, frottez la farine et le beurre dans un petit bol jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Incorporer le sucre, les flocons d''avoine et les amandes et rassembler en une pâte lâche avec vos mains. Réfrigérez pendant au moins 30 minutes, voire jusqu''à une journée.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake à fond amovible de 23 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre, le sucre et la vanille ensemble à l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Incorporer les œufs, un à la fois, en ajoutant une cuillerée de farine entre chaque ajout pour éviter que le mélange ne caille. Incorporer le reste de la farine, la levure chimique, la poudre d''amandes et la crème sure pour mélanger. Verser dans le moule, suivi de la garniture aux groseilles. Répartissez le crumble sur la surface pour recouvrir la garniture et enfournez pendant 1h-1h10 jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Si le gâteau dore trop rapidement, couvrez-le de papier d''aluminium pendant les 15 dernières minutes. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis réfrigérer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste froid pour faciliter le tranchage. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9755,3807,'fr','Gâteau sans lait','Essayez cette simple génoise au chocolat et à la vanille pour une pâtisserie de week-end facile et sans lait. Il utilise une méthode tout-en-un pour gagner du temps en cuisine','["250g de beurre","4 œufs","250g de sucre","250 g de farine nature","80 g de pudding à la vanille (ou maïzena plus 1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille)","5g de levure chimique","5 ml d''extrait de vanille","20g de cacao","sucre glace pour saupoudrer"]','["Commencez par faire fondre le beurre et laissez-le refroidir. Chauffer le four à 180°C/ventilateur 160°C/gaz 4. Battre les œufs avec le sucre dans un mixeur jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux, puis incorporer la farine, le pudding à la vanille, la levure chimique, la vanille et le beurre refroidi pour obtenir une pâte lisse.","Versez les ¾ de la pâte préparée dans un moule à cake de 950 g ou un moule à cake rond chemisé de 20 cm et ajoutez le cacao au reste de pâte. Versez le mélange de chocolat au centre de la pâte pâle. Cuire au four 40 mn. Après la cuisson, refroidissez le gâteau et saupoudrez-le de sucre glace ou recouvrez-le de glaçage au chocolat, si vous préférez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9756,8839,'fr','Gâteau aux myrtilles','Préparez ce simple gâteau aux myrtilles lorsque vous avez envie de quelque chose de sucré. Cette pâtisserie facile et fruitée utilise du yaourt naturel pour garder la génoise humide et moelleuse.','["1 cuillère à café de beurre","400 g de myrtilles surgelées","335 g de farine, plus une cuillerée pour les baies","275 g de sucre en poudre","2 œufs","165 ml d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à soupe de zeste de citron","65 ml de jus de citron","250 ml de yaourt nature épais","4 cuillères à café de levure chimique"]','["Préchauffer le four à 200°C/chaleur tournante 180°/gaz 6. Beurrer un moule à cake de 22 cm, tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé. Mettez de côté un tiers des myrtilles surgelées, saupoudrez le reste de farine, réservez (ne pas décongeler).","Dans un grand bol, battre le sucre et les œufs jusqu''à consistance lisse, ajouter l''huile végétale, le zeste et le jus de citron et le yaourt. Mélangez les ingrédients humides avec la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel à l''aide d''un fouet. Ne vous inquiétez pas s’il reste quelques grumeaux. Ajoutez les myrtilles mélangées à la farine.","Versez le mélange à gâteau dans le moule préparé. Saupoudrer le reste des baies. Mettez le moule au four, réduisez la température à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Enfournez pendant 1h10-1h20 ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré dans le gâteau en ressorte propre. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir. Après le démoulage, saupoudrez le gâteau de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9757,3813,'fr','Gâteau polonais au chocolat et aux noix','Ce gâteau étagé au chocolat délicieusement délicat est une véritable pâtisserie époustouflante. Empilez une génoise au chocolat, un glaçage au chocolat et des noix croquantes','["150 g de farine nature, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","50g de cacao","8 œufs, séparés","200 g de sucre en poudre","5 œufs séparés (garder les jaunes pour la crème anglaise)","200 g de sucre en poudre","250 g de noix, quelques poignées réservées à la décoration et le reste haché","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de fécule de pomme de terre","100 g de crème fraîche","100 g de chocolat haché"]','["Avant de réaliser le gâteau, sortez les œufs et le beurre du réfrigérateur pour les laisser tiédir à température ambiante.","Chauffer le four à 170C/chaleur tournante 150C/gaz 3½. Tamisez la farine et mélangez-la avec le cacao. Battez les blancs d''œufs en neige ferme, puis ajoutez-y le sucre par petites quantités. Ajoutez ensuite les jaunes d''œufs un à un en fouettant constamment. Tamisez la farine mélangée au cacao sur le mélange d''œufs et mélangez délicatement le tout à l''aide d''une spatule. Versez la pâte préparée dans un moule peu profond de 30 cm x 22 cm recouvert de papier sulfurisé et faites-la cuire au four pendant 35 minutes. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes, retirer du moule et regarnir le moule.","Pour faire la meringue, fouettez les blancs en neige ferme en ajoutant progressivement le sucre, une cuillère à soupe à la fois. Lorsque vous obtenez une meringue ferme et brillante, incorporez les noix finement hachées, la farine et la fécule de pomme de terre. Répartissez le mélange dans le moule et laissez cuire 40 min. Retirer délicatement du four et laisser refroidir.","Pour le glaçage au chocolat, faites chauffer la crème à feu doux, puis retirez du feu, versez-y le chocolat haché et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''il se dissolve et que le glaçage devienne brillant et uniforme.","Coupez la génoise au chocolat refroidie en deux couches. Mettez la meringue aux noix sur la couche inférieure de génoise et saupoudrez d''un peu de noix réservées. Ajoutez une autre couche de meringue puis la couche supérieure de génoise au chocolat et recouvrez le dessus de glaçage au chocolat. Décorer de noix. Mettez le gâteau fini au réfrigérateur pendant 1 à 2 heures avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9758,3817,'fr','Éponge Mûre Victoria','Maîtrisez la génoise Victoria avec cette recette destinée aux jeunes cuisiniers, qui présente une méthode facile à suivre. Les enfants peuvent l''adapter avec différentes confitures et fruits','["200 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 œufs moyens","200 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","250 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","250g de mûres","pinceau à pâtisserie","2 moules à gâteau ronds à fond mobile de 20 cm","tissu","grand bol à mélanger","soldes","cuillères à mesurer","fouet à main électrique","petit bol","spatule","gants de cuisine","brochette","grille de refroidissement","pichet doseur","petit tamis ou shaker à glaçage"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. A l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie, badigeonner deux moules à gâteau ronds de 20 cm d''un peu de beurre, puis les tapisser de papier sulfurisé (voir Comment tapisser un moule à gâteau).","Placez un chiffon propre sous un grand bol – cela le maintiendra stable pendant que vous mélangez. Pesez le beurre, le sucre en poudre et l''extrait de vanille dans le bol.","Assurez-vous que les accessoires du fouet sont bien fixés dans votre fouet à main, puis branchez-le. Allumez le fouet à vitesse moyenne et utilisez-le pour fouetter les ingrédients ensemble pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient lisses et crémeux. Assurez-vous de garder vos doigts éloignés du fouet lorsqu''il est allumé.","Cassez les œufs dans un petit bol. Continuez à fouetter le beurre et le sucre et utilisez votre autre main pour y verser les œufs, un à la fois. Mélanger encore 1 min ou jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Pesez la farine et ajoutez-la dans le bol. Utilisez une aspatule pour plier les ingrédients ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de poches de farine et que le mélange à gâteau soit lisse.","Utilisez votre spatule pour répartir uniformément le mélange à gâteau entre les moules à gâteau, puis étalez le mélange sur les bords et lissez la surface.","Utilisez des gants de cuisine pour placer les moules sur la grille centrale du four et réglez une minuterie sur 22 minutes. Lorsque la minuterie sonne, utilisez vos gants de cuisine pour retirer légèrement la grille du four mais laissez les gâteaux à l''intérieur, ils doivent être levés et dorés. Insérez une brochette au centre des gâteaux pour vérifier s''ils sont cuits : si la brochette ressort sèche, ils sont cuits ; S''il y a du mélange à gâteau humide sur la brochette, les gâteaux ont besoin d''un peu plus de temps au four. Si tel est le cas, remettez-les au four et faites cuire encore 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau.","Utilisez vos gants de cuisine pour retirer délicatement les gâteaux du four, placez-les sur une grille de refroidissement et laissez-les refroidir 15 minutes dans le moule. Une fois suffisamment refroidis pour être manipulés, retournez les gâteaux sur la grille et retirez le papier sulfurisé, puis laissez-les refroidir complètement.","Mesurez la crème épaisse dans un pichet et versez-la dans un grand bol à mélanger. Mesurez le sucre glace dans une cuillère doseuse et ajoutez-le à la crème. Utilisez votre fouet électrique à main pour fouetter la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit doucement fouettée, comme des nuages.","Placez l''un des gâteaux sur une assiette ou un support à gâteau, puis utilisez une spatule ou un couteau à palette pour étaler la crème sur le gâteau en une couche uniforme. Disposez les mûres sur la crème, puis posez l''autre gâteau dessus. A l''aide d''une passoire ou d''un shaker à glace, saupoudrez le gâteau d''un peu de sucre glace. Il est préférable de le servir immédiatement, mais il se conserve deux jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:02:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9759,8841,'fr','Gâteau aux carottes classique','Perfectionnez un classique avec notre recette de gâteau aux carottes de niveau supérieur. Il a été minutieusement testé pour que vous puissiez préparer la meilleure version de ce gâteau traditionnel.','["huile végétale, pour les boîtes","200 g de beurre ramolli","200 g de sucre muscovado léger","4 œufs","150 g de farines autolevantes","50 g de farine de seigle ou d''épeautre (facultatif – utilisez au total 200 g de farine autolevante si vous préférez)","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","¼ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","250 g (environ 3 moyennes) de carottes, parées et grossièrement râpées","75 g de raisins secs ou raisins secs","75 g de sucre muscovado léger","100 g de noix de pécan","150 g de beurre ramolli","150g de sucre glace","340 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","½ citron, zesté"]','["Pour le praliné, tapissez une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé, puis versez le sucre dans une casserole avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre commence à caraméliser. Éparpillez les noix de pécan et une pincée de sel marin et remuez jusqu''à ce que les noix soient entièrement enrobées. Grattez délicatement le mélange de noix de pécan chaud sur la plaque et laissez reposer au moins 10 minutes. Cassez environ 12 noix de pécan entières du praliné et réservez-les pour décorer plus tard, puis hachez ou écrasez le reste du praliné en petits éclats. Réserver. Se conserve une journée dans un contenant hermétique.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler deux moules à sandwich ronds de 20 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Versez le beurre et le sucre dans un bol et battez à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux, puis incorporez les œufs, un à la fois, ou faites-le à l''aide d''un batteur sur socle. Lorsque les œufs sont incorporés, incorporez les farines, le bicarbonate, les épices et une pincée de sel, puis les carottes, les raisins secs et la moitié du praliné écrasé.","Répartissez la pâte dans les moules et nivelez la surface avec une spatule. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les génoises soient élastiques et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu de chacune en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis mettre sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conservera emballé toute la nuit.","Pour faire le glaçage, battez le beurre et le sucre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Ajouter la moitié du fromage à pâte molle et le zeste de citron et battre à nouveau, puis ajouter le reste et battre jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Pour assembler, placez une génoise, côté plat vers le haut, sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette et tartinez-la d''un tiers du glaçage. Parsemer avec la majeure partie du praliné écrasé restant, puis recouvrir de l''autre biscuit, également côté plat vers le haut. Étalez le reste du glaçage sur le dessus et les côtés, puis décorez avec les noix de pécan pralinées entières. Réfrigérer 1 heure, puis trancher et servir avec le reste de praliné écrasé pour saupoudrer. Se conserve dans une boîte hermétique pendant trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9760,8843,'fr','Gâteaux de Jaffa','Améliorez la collation classique des gâteaux jaffa en préparant une version maison avec de la gelée d''orange enrichie de marmelade et du riche chocolat noir.','["beurre, pour le moule","1 oeuf","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de farine autolevante","1 orange, zestée","125g de chocolat noir","Paquet de 135 g de gelée d''orange coupée en cubes (prévoir végétarien, si besoin)","1 cuillère à soupe de marmelade d''oranges (facultatif)","1-2 oranges pressées (vous aurez besoin de 50 ml de jus)"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la gelée d’orange. Mettez les cubes de gelée et la marmelade (le cas échéant) dans un bol moyen résistant à la chaleur. Versez le jus d''orange et 100 ml d''eau bouillante, puis remuez jusqu''à ce que les cubes de gelée soient dissous. Versez le mélange dans une plaque à pâtisserie peu profonde (la nôtre mesurait 25 x 20 cm) recouverte de film alimentaire – elle doit arriver à environ ½ cm de côté. Réfrigérer pendant 2 heures ou toute la nuit jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et beurrer un moule à cupcake peu profond de 12 trous. Versez l''œuf et le sucre dans un bol et battez avec un fouet électrique pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ou faites-le dans un batteur sur socle. Tamisez la farine, ajoutez le zeste d''orange et pliez délicatement jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de poches de farine. Versez 1 cuillère à soupe dans chaque trou du moule et étalez délicatement sur les bords à l''aide du dos de la cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 8 à 9 minutes jusqu''à ce que la génoise soit dorée et qu''un cure-dent en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 2 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Retournez la gelée prise sur une planche, retirez le film alimentaire et découpez des disques à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce rond de 5 cm. Retournez les génoises de manière à ce que le côté plat soit vers le haut, puis recouvrez chacune d''elles d''un disque de gelée. Versez le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et faites-le fondre par petits coups au micro-ondes, ou placez le bol sur une casserole d''eau frémissante en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau. Versez 1 à 2 cuillères à café de chocolat fondu sur chaque disque de gelée, en l''étalant délicatement pour couvrir. Laisser reposer 2-3 minutes, puis enfoncer délicatement les dents d''une fourchette dans le chocolat. Laisser reposer 1h avant de servir. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9761,8845,'fr','Plateau de Pâques','Préparez ce plateau facile sur le thème de Pâques avec les enfants. Il comprend une génoise au chocolat recouverte d''un glaçage au fudge puis décorée de bonbons et de friandises de Pâques.','["150 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour la boîte","165 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 œufs","150 ml de lait","165 g de farine autolevante","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","100 g de chocolat au lait ou noir haché (soit une barre de chocolat, soit un œuf de Pâques brisé)","100 g de beurre ramolli","100g de sucre glace","100g de gourmandises de Pâques (œufs en chocolat, bonbons, morceaux de tablette de chocolat)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler et tapisser un moule à tarte d''environ 20 x 30 cm et 5 cm de profondeur. Mettez l''huile, le sucre, les œufs et le lait dans un bol et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Tamisez la farine, le cacao et le bicarbe et remuez brièvement jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le mélange dans le moule et enfournez pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit bien levé et reprenne sa forme lorsqu''il est pressé. Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement.","Faites fondre le chocolat dans un bol posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau, ou par petits coups au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes.","Battre le beurre et le sucre glace ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux, puis arroser de chocolat et battre à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir une couleur lisse et uniforme. Faites tourner le glaçage sur le dessus du gâteau, avec quelques pics et tourbillons pour décorer. Parsemer des friandises de Pâques pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9762,8847,'fr','Cupcakes végétaliens à la vanille','Préparez ces versions végétaliennes de cupcakes à la vanille pour une gâterie sucrée. Ils sont idéaux servis avec une tasse de thé pour une gâterie en milieu de matinée ou pour le thé de l''après-midi','["50 ml d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de cidre","200 ml de lait végétal (nous avons utilisé de l''avoine)","225 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à café de pâte de vanille","200 g de bloc de beurre végétal vegan ramolli","2 cuillères à café de pâte de vanille","400 g de sucre glace"]','["Mélangez l''huile de colza, le vinaigre de cidre et le lait d''avoine dans un pichet. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à cupcakes ou à muffins à 12 trous de caissettes en papier. Versez la farine, la levure chimique et le sucre dans un grand bol. Faites un puits au milieu et versez-y lentement le mélange humide en fouettant constamment. Ajoutez la pâte de vanille et mélangez. Répartissez uniformément entre les caissettes en papier et faites cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu d''un cupcake en ressorte propre. Transférer sur une grille de refroidissement pour refroidir complètement.","Pour le glaçage, battez le bloc de plante et la vanille jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et crémeux, environ 2 minutes. Ajoutez le sucre glace par lots, en battant bien après chaque ajout, et une grosse pincée de sel. Transvaser dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille étoile. Déposez des tourbillons sur chaque cupcake refroidi. Se conservera, glacé, jusqu''à trois jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9763,8849,'fr','Gâteau végétalien aux courgettes','Utilisez une surabondance de courgettes et préparez ce gâteau végétalien avec un filet de citron acidulé. Idéal pour un café le matin ou un thé l''après-midi','["80 g de bloc de beurre vegan ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 citrons zestés, 1 jus","100 ml de lait végétal (nous avons utilisé de l''avoine)","100 g d''amandes moulues","175 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","175 g de courgettes grossièrement râpées","200 g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 900g. Battez ensemble le bloc de beurre végétalien, le sucre et le zeste de citron jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Ajoutez le lait végétal et mélangez doucement. Ajoutez la poudre d''amandes, la farine et la levure chimique, ainsi que la courgette râpée, et mélangez. Versez la pâte dans le moule préparé (elle sera assez épaisse) et nivelez le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 55 à 60 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Pour faire le glaçage, tamisez le sucre glace dans un bol, ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron et mélangez. Ajoutez un peu plus de jus de citron si nécessaire, ½ cuillère à café à la fois, jusqu''à obtenir la consistance désirée. Retirez le gâteau du moule et versez-le sur le glaçage en le laissant couler sur les côtés. Laisser reposer 20 à 30 minutes. Couper en tranches pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9764,8851,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat et à l''orange','Préparez un dessert qui fera parler de vous avec ce cheesecake crémeux et riche au chocolat et à l''orange.','["225g de gingembre ou digestifs","115 g de beurre doux, fondu","1 orange, zestée","tranches d''orange confites, pour servir (facultatif)","600 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","3 œufs, plus 2 jaunes d''œufs (congeler le blanc supplémentaire pour une autre recette)","175 g de crème fraîche","175 g de sucre mou roux clair","350 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao), haché grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir","3 oranges, zestées"]','["Pour la garniture, sortez le fromage à pâte molle, les œufs et la crème fraîche du réfrigérateur à température ambiante 1 h avant de commencer. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé : déclipser le cercle, poser la papier sulfurisé sur le fond et clipser le cercle. Cela garantira qu’il n’y a pas de rebord au fond du cheesecake fini.","Versez les noix de gingembre dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en une fine miette. Ajoutez le beurre fondu et le zeste d''orange, puis mixez brièvement jusqu''à ce que la chapelure soit enrobée. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et pressez-le pour obtenir une couche uniforme à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la base soit légèrement croustillante.","Battre le fromage à pâte molle et la cassonade jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse à l''aide d''un fouet électrique. Incorporer les œufs entiers, les jaunes d''œufs et la crème jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez le chocolat noir dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et faites-le fondre au micro-ondes par rafales de 20 secondes, ou faites-le dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau. Laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud au toucher. Versez lentement le chocolat fondu sur le mélange de fromages à pâte molle, en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer le zeste d''orange en réservant les oranges.","Enveloppez hermétiquement le fond du moule à gâteau dans du papier d''aluminium pour éviter les fuites, puis placez-le dans un plat à rôtir profond. Versez la garniture au cheesecake sur le fond de biscuit. Mettez le plat à rôtir au four, puis versez suffisamment d''eau chaude dans le plat à rôtir pour qu''elle remonte sur 2½ cm des côtés du moule à gâteau. Cuire au four pendant 1 h 1 h 15 jusqu''à ce que le bord du cheesecake soit pris, mais que le centre vacille légèrement (il continuera à prendre au réfrigérateur).","Placez le moule à gâteau sur une grille, puis passez un petit couteau bien aiguisé sur le pourtour pour le détacher. Retirer le papier d''aluminium et laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis réfrigérer au moins 6 heures au réfrigérateur avant de le démouler dans une assiette. Segmentez les oranges réservées en évitant la moelle et utilisez-les pour décorer le dessus avec une râpe de chocolat noir et des tranches d''orange confites, si vous le souhaitez. Se conservera couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9765,3872,'fr','Rouleau suisse au chocolat','Ce dessert nostalgique peut être préparé la veille. Garnir d''une crème vanille, saupoudrer de sucre glace pour finir et servir en tranches.','["60 g de farines autolevantes","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","3 œufs","75 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour disperser","200 ml de crème fraîche","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","50 g de sucre glace tamisé, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tapisser un moule à rouleau suisse de 22 x 32 cm (s''il fait 20 x 30 cm, c''est toujours bien) de papier sulfurisé. Tamisez la farine et le cacao en poudre dans un bol et réservez.","Cassez les œufs dans un autre bol ou dans le bol du batteur sur socle et versez-y le sucre. Utilisez un fouet électrique ou le fouet pour battre les œufs et le sucre ensemble pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et très épais. Utilisez une cuillère ou une spatule pour incorporer délicatement le mélange de farine jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement incorporé et que tout soit de la même couleur, sans traces.","Grattez délicatement le mélange dans le moule et étalez-le dans les coins. Cuire au four pendant 9 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé et élastique au toucher. Pendant que le gâteau cuit, prenez un autre morceau de papier sulfurisé un peu plus grand que le moule et saupoudrez-le de sucre. Lorsque la génoise est cuite, utilisez des gants de cuisine pour la retourner délicatement sur le papier sucré. Soulevez le moule et retirez la couche supérieure de papier sulfurisé. Tracez une ligne à 2 cm de l''un des bords les plus courts, puis utilisez le parchemin pour rouler l''éponge en spirale avec le parchemin qui la traverse. Laissez la génoise roulée refroidir complètement.","Pendant que le gâteau refroidit, préparez la garniture en fouettant tous les ingrédients ensemble jusqu''à ce que la crème se solidifie. Déroulez le biscuit et étalez-le sur la garniture en laissant dégagé le bord rainuré. En partant du bord rainuré, utilisez le papier sulfurisé pour enrouler la génoise autour de la garniture. Déposer sur une planche ou un plat de service et saupoudrer de sucre glace. Peut être servi immédiatement ou réfrigéré jusqu''à 24 heures. Servir en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:02:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9766,8853,'fr','Cheesecake cuit au chocolat blanc et aux framboises','Mélangez une purée de framboises piquante dans une garniture de cheesecake crémeuse au chocolat blanc et à la vanille pour un dessert parfaitement équilibré. C’est idéal pour une occasion spéciale','["225g de biscuits digestifs","15g de framboises lyophilisées (facultatif)","115 g de beurre fondu","250 g de framboises fraîches ou surgelées","½ citron, jus","175 g de sucre en poudre, plus 2 cuillères à café","600 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","3 gros œufs et 2 jaunes d''œufs","175 g de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gousse de vanille","350 g de chocolat blanc"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4, et tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé. Versez les biscuits et les framboises lyophilisées, le cas échéant, dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en miettes fines. Incorporez le beurre pour enrober les miettes, puis versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et pressez-le en une couche uniforme à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour la garniture, mettez les framboises, le jus de citron et 2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre dans une casserole à feu moyen. Cuire pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les baies ramollissent et deviennent juteuses. Transférer dans un robot culinaire et mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez dans un bol et laissez refroidir. Si vous préférez une purée onctueuse, passez le mélange au tamis fin et jetez les pépins.","Battre le fromage à pâte molle au fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''il se détache, puis incorporer 175 g de sucre, les œufs, les jaunes, la crème et la vanille jusqu''à consistance lisse. Faites fondre le chocolat blanc dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au micro-ondes toutes les 20 secondes ou au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le fond du bol ne touche pas l''eau. Versez lentement un tiers du mélange de fromages à pâte molle sucrée dans le chocolat fondu, en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis versez-le dans le reste du mélange de fromages à pâte molle. Fouetter jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement combiné.","Retirez le moule du réfrigérateur et enveloppez hermétiquement le fond du moule avec du papier d''aluminium pour éviter toute fuite. Placez le moule dans un plat à rôtir profond. Versez la préparation au cheesecake sur le fond de biscuit. Versez dessus la purée de framboise et incorporez-la au mélange à cheesecake à l''aide d''une pique à brochette.","Mettez le plat à rôtir au four, puis versez suffisamment d''eau chaude dans le plat à rôtir pour qu''elle remonte sur 2½ cm des côtés du moule à gâteau. Cuire au four pendant 1 h 15 à 1 h 30, ou jusqu''à ce que le bord du cheesecake soit pris, mais que le centre vacille légèrement (il continuera à prendre au réfrigérateur).","Placez le moule sur une grille, puis passez un petit couteau bien aiguisé sur le pourtour. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis réfrigérer au moins 6 heures avant de démouler."]','2026-01-11 00:02:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9767,8855,'fr','Cheesecake à la patate douce','Étalez du sirop d''érable, de la patate douce épicée et du fromage à la crème frais sur une base digestive écrasée pour préparer ce dessert. Faites-nous confiance, ça marche vraiment','["100 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","250g de biscuits digestifs","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","300 g de fromage frais","50g de sucre glace","1 gousse de vanille, graines uniquement","150 ml de crème fraîche","350 g de patate douce, cuite, réduite en purée et refroidie","150 ml de crème fraîche","1-2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable, plus un peu pour servir","pop-corn au caramel, pour servir"]','["Beurrer et tapisser un moule à fond amovible de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Passez les biscuits au robot culinaire avec la cannelle, puis versez le beurre fondu. Bien mélanger pour enrober toutes les miettes de biscuit, puis presser dans le moule tapissé pour créer une base uniforme. Mettre au réfrigérateur pour prendre environ 1 h.","Pour faire la garniture au fromage à la crème, battez le fromage à la crème avec le sucre glace et la vanille jusqu''à consistance légère, puis ajoutez la crème double et battez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et épaissi. Versez-le sur la base du biscuit, en lissant sur toute la surface et en vous assurant qu''il ne reste aucune bulle d''air. Lisser avec le dos d''une cuillère ou d''une spatule et mettre au réfrigérateur pendant 3 heures.","Pour la garniture, battre ensemble la patate douce, la crème et le mélange d''épices jusqu''à épaississement. Versez-le délicatement sur la couche de fromage à la crème, en utilisant à nouveau le dos d''une cuillère ou d''une spatule pour lisser la surface et vous assurer qu''il ne reste aucune bulle d''air. Laisser prendre au réfrigérateur toute la nuit. Arroser de sirop d''érable, puis saupoudrer de pop-corn au caramel et d''une pincée de sel marin."]','2026-01-11 00:02:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9768,8857,'fr','Biscuits Twix','Des biscuits chocolatés et fondants qui sont incroyablement chauds sortis du four ou transformés en sandwichs à la crème glacée. Le plaisir ultime','["100 g de beurre, à température ambiante","120 g de sucre roux clair","1 oeuf","100 g de farines autolevantes","50 g de flocons d''avoine","100 g de pépites de chocolat au lait","1 cuillère à soupe de mini morceaux de fudge","4 paquets de 25 g de barres Twix, hachées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé sulfurisé.","Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble dans un batteur de table jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et légers, puis ajouter l''œuf, la farine, les flocons d''avoine et une pincée de sel, puis battre à nouveau.","Incorporez les pépites de chocolat et les morceaux de fudge, puis déposez des cuillères à dessert arrondies de pâte à biscuits sur vos plaques à pâtisserie préparées – vous devriez en obtenir 12. Pressez doucement des morceaux de Twix sur le dessus de chaque monticule et faites cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés.","Laisser refroidir quelques minutes sur le papier puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Incroyable dans les sandwichs à la crème glacée !"]','2026-01-11 00:02:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9769,8859,'fr','Barres végétaliennes pour millionnaires','Ces friandises chocolatées végétaliennes et sans gluten avec des dattes, des noix de cajou et du sirop d''érable sont tout aussi collantes et gourmandes que les sablés originaux du Millionnaire.','["150 g de noix de cajou","50 g de flocons d''avoine","4 dattes Medjool, dénoyautées","50 g d''huile de coco fondue","350 g de dattes Medjool dénoyautées","125 ml de lait d''amande non sucré","25 ml de sirop d''érable","150g d''huile de coco","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","150g d''huile de coco","5 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à café de sirop d''érable"]','["Beurrer un moule à cake carré de 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Versez les noix de cajou et les flocons d''avoine dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en miettes. Ajoutez les dattes et l''huile de coco et mélangez à nouveau. Transférez dans le moule et utilisez une cuillère pour presser le mélange de noisettes en une couche compacte et uniforme qui recouvre la base. Réfrigérez pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Pour la garniture, ajoutez les dattes, le lait d''amande, le sirop d''érable et l''huile de coco dans une casserole avec une généreuse pincée de sel et portez à ébullition. Faites bouillir pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les dattes soient bien tendres, puis versez-les dans le mixeur, ajoutez l''extrait de vanille et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une purée lisse. Ajoutez un peu plus de sel si le mélange est trop sucré. Versez sur la base de noisette et étalez sur les côtés du moule, pour obtenir une surface aussi lisse que possible. Réfrigérez pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Faites chauffer doucement l''huile de coco dans une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fondue. Retirer du feu et incorporer le cacao et le sirop d''érable jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de grumeaux. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes, verser sur la couche de caramel et remettre au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 3 heures ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien pris. Pour servir, coupez en carrés. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 1 semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:02:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9770,8861,'fr','Biscuits au gâteau aux carottes','Un favori universel, sous forme de cookie ! Améliorez votre gâteau aux carottes standard avec ces bouchées de friandises biscuitées','["140g de fromage frais","140 g de sucre glace, plus 3 cuillères à soupe","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","350 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour vous épousseter les mains","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","140 g de beurre ramolli","140 g de sucre roux clair et mou","1 œuf battu","200 g de carottes finement râpées","le zeste et le jus d''une orange","3 cuillères à soupe de noix finement hachées"]','["Mélangez le cream cheese, 3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace et l''extrait de vanille dans un bol, puis mettez au congélateur pour raffermir pendant 30 min.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez la farine, la levure chimique et les épices dans un bol. Dans un bol plus grand, battre le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse. Incorporer l''œuf, puis la carotte. Versez les ingrédients secs et mélangez pour former une pâte.","Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Saupoudrez vos mains d''un peu de farine, puis divisez la pâte en 14 boules et disposez-la sur la feuille. Utilisez la paume de votre main pour aplatir chacun d’eux en un mince cercle. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à café du mélange de fromage à la crème au centre de chacun, puis enveloppez soigneusement la pâte autour de la garniture pour la sceller, en pinçant le dessus et en la roulant en boule rugueuse pour empêcher toute fuite de garniture.","Lorsque toutes les boules sont façonnées, utilisez votre paume pour les aplatir légèrement, puis mettez au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Faites cuire les biscuits pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Retirez-les du four, laissez-les raffermir sur la plaque pendant 10 à 15 minutes, puis transférez-les sur des grilles pour qu''elles refroidissent complètement.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec le jus d''orange jusqu''à obtention d''un filet. Arroser les biscuits, saupoudrer de noix et de zeste d''orange, puis laisser prendre. Mieux consommés le jour de leur préparation, mais se conservent au réfrigérateur dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9771,8863,'fr','Cupcakes à la noix de coco','Obtenez une triple dose de noix de coco dans ces cupcakes légers et moelleux, garnis de crème de noix de coco fouettée et de noix de coco desséchée enneigée – une délicieuse gâterie sans gluten à l''heure du thé','["400 g de lait de coco entier (sans stabilisants)","140 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","50g de noix de coco desséchée","100g d''huile de coco","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 gros œufs","200 g de farine autolevante sans gluten (le mélange doit inclure de la gomme xanthane – j''ai utilisé Doves Farm)","100 ml de lait de coco","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Réfrigérez la boîte de lait de coco pendant la nuit. Le lendemain, préparez les gâteaux. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de moules à muffins. Mettez l''huile de coco et le sucre dans un grand bol et utilisez un fouet électrique pour battre ensemble pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à consistance légère et crémeuse. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement combinés avant d''en ajouter davantage. En trois fois, ajoutez la farine en alternant avec le lait de coco, puis ajoutez l''extrait de vanille.","Versez la pâte dans le moule à muffins préparé à l''aide d''une cuillère à glace, puis faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 22 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les gâteaux soient dorés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Retirez les cupcakes du moule et laissez-les refroidir sur une grille.","La crème fouettée est mieux préparée quelques heures après avoir été servie. Ouvrez la boîte de lait de coco à l’envers et versez le liquide fin. Versez le lait de coco épais dans un grand bol, ajoutez le sucre glace et la vanille et fouettez pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et mousseux. Étalez ou versez la chantilly sur les cupcakes et saupoudrez de noix de coco râpée. Il est préférable de le conserver au réfrigérateur et de le consommer dans les jours qui suivent."]','2026-01-11 00:02:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9772,8865,'fr','Rouleau fondant aux figues','Les saveurs du biscuit traditionnel sont transformées en un petit pain suisse, avec de la muscade, de la cannelle, de la banane dans la génoise et une touche de confiture de figues.','["140 g de figues séchées tendres, hachées","1 banane moyenne très mûre","noix de beurre, pour graisser","3 gros œufs, séparés","225 g de sucre muscovado léger","120g de farine complète","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","bonne noix de muscade fraîche râpée (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","300 ml de crème fraîche","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace tamisé","environ 250-300g de confiture de figues ou de conserve"]','["Couvrir les figues d''eau bouillante dans un\r\nbol et laisser ramollir pendant 30 minutes.\r\nÉgoutter et bien écraser avec la banane.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nBeurrer un moule à rouleau suisse – environ 34 x 24 cm.\r\nTapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé.","Séparez les œufs en récupérant les\r\nles blancs dans un grand bol propre. Battre avec\r\nun fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que les pics fermes tiennent\r\nle bout de votre fouet, puis ajoutez la moitié du\r\nsucre et battre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et brillant.","Dans un autre bol, battre les jaunes\r\navec le sucre restant jusqu''à pâleur. Fouet\r\ndans le mélange de purée de figues. Pliez ce mélange\r\ndans le mélange de meringue jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien\r\ncombinés. Mélanger la farine, le bicarbonate de\r\nsoda, épices et une pincée de sel. Saupoudrez-le\r\nsur le mélange humide et incorporer très délicatement\r\ndedans, encore une fois jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Grattez doucement\r\net étalez la pâte dans le moule. Cuire au four\r\npendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit élastique au toucher.","Pendant ce temps, posez un torchon propre dessus.\r\nle banc (cela aide à garder le gâteau bien\r\net humide). Répartissez le sucre en poudre dessus\r\nle torchon, retournez le gâteau, décollez le\r\nparchemin, puis rouler du plus court\r\ncôté avec le torchon pour former un rouleau suisse.\r\nSoulever sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Déroulez délicatement le gâteau. Utilisation de l''électricité\r\nbatteurs, fouetter la crème et le sucre glace\r\nensemble jusqu''à des pics doux. Étalez la confiture de figues\r\nsur le gâteau, suivi de la crème.\r\nRouler à nouveau et trancher pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9773,8867,'fr','Tourbillons bouclés','Utilisez une pâte à croissant prête à rouler pour créer ces friandises fourrées au chocolat et au caramel qui sont gluantes et collantes lorsqu''elles sont consommées chaudes.','["140 g de bonbon mou","2 x tubes de 6 croissants prêts à rouler (nous avons utilisé Jus Rol)","100 ml de lait","50 g de gouttes de chocolat noir - ou utilisez un bloc de chocolat et hachez-le grossièrement","sucre glace doré, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMettez les caramels dans une petite casserole avec\r\nle lait et faire fondre à feu très doux,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps pour rassembler\r\nà une sauce onctueuse. Refroidir du feu pendant\r\n1-2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit un peu moins fondu et\r\nlégèrement épaissi.","Couvrir deux plaques à pâtisserie de pâte à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin. Dérouler un tube de croissant\r\npâte. Pincez la diagonale\r\ncoutures perforées, mais divisez la pâte\r\nen trois rectangles le long de la droite\r\ncoutures croisées. Découpez chaque rectangle en\r\n4 bandes longues et fines – vous obtenez donc 12.\r\nVerser un peu de caramel sur toute la longueur\r\nchaque bande, puis parsemer avec un peu\r\ngouttes de chocolat. Dérouler l''autre pâte\r\net coupé en bandes de même taille, puis\r\nsandwich avec le caramel-choc\r\nceux couverts. Tenir les extrémités de chacun\r\ndénuder, tordre fermement et déposer sur le plat préparé\r\nplaques à pâtisserie – elles se dilateront un peu.","Une fois que tout est façonné, enfournez pour 12 à 15 minutes.\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Époussetez avec un peu\r\nsucre glace doré pour servir et déguster\r\nmeilleur, fraîchement sorti du four."]','2026-01-11 00:02:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9774,8869,'fr','Cupcakes au caramel','Ces génoises individuelles ont un centre secret et un glaçage au fromage à la crème. Servies garnies de boutons de caramel faits maison.','["175 g de beurre ramolli","175 g de sucre muscovado léger","2 gros œufs","175 g de farines autolevantes","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","boutons de caramel maison (voir recette dans les conseils ci-dessous)","Boîte de 397 g de caramel aux œillets Nestlé","Pot de 200 g de fromage à la crème entier","100 g de beurre salé ramolli","450 g de sucre glace doré"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4 et\r\nTapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de caissettes. Mettre\r\nle beurre et le sucre dans un bol à mélanger,\r\ncrémer avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse\r\net pâle. Ajoutez les œufs et fouettez à nouveau,\r\npuis ajoutez la farine et le lait, et mélangez avec\r\nune spatule jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Divisez le\r\nmélange entre les moules à muffins. Cuire au four\r\npendant 18-20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient élastiques et une brochette\r\nen ressort propre. Laisser refroidir.","Mélangez 140g de Caramel Carnation avec\r\nle fromage frais, le beurre et le sucre glace\r\navec un fouet électrique à main, jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nMettre au frais 10 min. Découpez un trou au centre\r\nde chaque cupcake (nous avons utilisé un vide-pomme)\r\net remplir avec le reste du Carnation Caramel.\r\nTransférer le glaçage dans une poche à douille munie de\r\nune buse ronde et tourbillonner sur les cupcakes.\r\nSe conserve 3 jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:02:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9775,8871,'fr','Gâteau géant à l''orange de Jaffa','Donnez encore plus d''effet wow à la combinaison de saveurs classique du chocolat et de l''orange dans ce gâteau avec une gelée piquante et une luxueuse ganache au chocolat.','["250 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 gros œufs","100 g de yaourt nature entier","300 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","zester 4 grosses oranges (utiliser les oranges ci-dessous)","jus de 5 grosses oranges (environ 500 ml), conserver le zeste d''1 orange pour finir","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","6 feuilles de gélatine","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","200 g de chocolat au lait finement haché","100 g de chocolat noir finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots","le zeste d''1 orange"]','["Préparez d’abord la gelée. Graisser 20 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau rond et tapisser de film alimentaire\r\n(vous pouvez utiliser le moule de 23 cm que vous\r\nfaites cuire le gâteau, mais vous devrez faire\r\nceci la veille pour que vous puissiez\r\nretirez-le avant de faire le gâteau).\r\nRetirez le zeste de 4 des oranges\r\net réserver pour le gâteau. Inclinez l''orange\r\nle jus et le sucre dans une casserole et délicatement\r\nchauffer pour dissoudre le sucre. Pendant ce temps,\r\ntremper les feuilles de gélatine dans l''eau froide\r\npendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Retirez le\r\ngélatine de l''eau, essorez-la\r\ntout excédent et ajouter au chaud\r\njus d''orange, remuer jusqu''à ce que la gélatine\r\ns''est dissous. Versez le liquide dans le\r\nmoule à gâteau tapissé et réfrigérer au moins 4 heures\r\nou de préférence toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et\r\nTapisser un moule à gâteau rond de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé\r\nparchemin. Inclinez tous les ingrédients du gâteau\r\ndans un grand bol à mélanger et mélanger avec\r\nun fouet électrique à main jusqu''à consistance lisse. Cuillère\r\ndans le moule et lisser la surface.\r\nCuire au centre du four pendant\r\n55 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette soit insérée\r\nen ressort propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant\r\n15 minutes, puis renverser sur une grille\r\net laissez refroidir complètement.","Préparez maintenant la ganache. Chauffer le\r\ncrème dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude. Mettez le\r\nchocolat dans un petit bol et verser dessus\r\nla crème, laisser reposer 10 min, puis mélanger\r\neh bien, vous devriez vous retrouver avec un\r\nsauce au chocolat. Partir dans la chambre\r\ntempérature jusqu''à ce que la ganache refroidisse\r\net épaissit un peu (vous pouvez le mettre dedans\r\nle réfrigérateur pour accélérer le processus, mais gardez\r\nun oeil dessus, car il durcira rapidement).","Pour assembler le gâteau, placez-le sur un\r\nsupport à gâteau et coupez le dessus pour vous donner\r\nune surface plane. Réchauffez la confiture d''abricots\r\nau micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit un peu liquide. Peinture\r\nsur le dessus du gâteau, puis retournez-le\r\nde la gelée d''orange de sa boîte, et positionnez-la\r\nhaut. À l''aide d''un couteau à palette, faites tourner le\r\nganache au chocolat sur la gelée d''orange,\r\nle laisser couler sur les côtés du\r\ngâteau un peu. Servir immédiatement ou\r\ndans les 24 heures."]','2026-01-11 00:02:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9776,8873,'fr','Tartes whoopie','Ces petites friandises amusantes prennent moins d''une heure à préparer et constitueront un ajout sucré à toute vente de pâtisseries.','["300 g de farines autolevantes","50g de cacao","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","175 g de sucre roux clair et mou","1 oeuf","75 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un supplément","150 ml de babeurre","1 pot de glaçage prêt à l''emploi","pépites colorées, pour décorer","100g de sucre glace","50g de cacao","100 ml de crème double"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4 et\r\ntapisser les plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mélanger\r\nfarine, cacao, bicarbonate, sucre et une pincée de\r\nsel. Fouetter l''oeuf, l''huile et le babeurre\r\nensemble, puis mélanger aux ingrédients secs avec\r\n75 ml d''eau bouillante. Cuillère 20 cuillerées\r\nsur des plateaux bien espacés. Enfourner 12 mn\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme au toucher, décollez les plateaux. Cool.","Pour le glaçage, tamiser le sucre glace et le cacao\r\ndans une petite casserole. Incorporer progressivement la crème\r\nsuivi de 100 ml d''eau bouillante. Chaleur\r\ndoucement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sirupeux.","Sandwich 2 gâteaux avec le\r\nglaçage, verser sur un peu de glaçage et\r\ndécorer avec des pépites."]','2026-01-11 00:02:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9777,8875,'fr','Gâteaux de fées glacés','Apprenez aux 8-14 ans à réaliser des gâteaux féeriques et garantissez une activité culinaire ludique','["100 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de beurre très mou","100 g de farines autolevantes","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de beurre très mou","200 g de sucre glace","colorant alimentaire, pépites, guimauves, etc."]','["Demande à un adulte\r\naide à tourner\r\nle four sur\r\n180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nMettez une caisse en papier\r\ndans chaque trou du petit pain.","Mettez le sucre\r\net du beurre (il\r\nça doit être doux sinon tu\r\nje ne pourrai pas mélanger\r\ncorrectement) dans un bol\r\net mélangez-le.\r\nTamisez la farine.","Casser les œufs\r\ndans un séparé\r\nbol (versez-y une cuillère\r\nmorceaux de coquille qui tombent\r\nin) et ajoutez-les\r\nau bol avec\r\nla vanille. Mélanger\r\ntout ensemble.","Diviser entre\r\nles cas utilisant\r\nune cuillère, grattant\r\nl''enlever avec un couteau. Demande à un adulte\r\naide pour mettre le\r\nplaque au four pour\r\n20 minutes.","Mélanger le beurre\r\net sucre glace\r\nfaire une crème\r\nglaçage. Ajouter du colorant,\r\nsi tu veux. Poussez un\r\nbuse de glaçage dans\r\nune poche à douille, alors\r\nverser le glaçage.","Laissez les gâteaux\r\nrefroidir complètement\r\ndans le bac. Tuyau\r\nglaçage sur chaque gâteau\r\net décorer avec\r\nguimauves\r\nou des pépites, ou\r\ntout ce que tu veux."]','2026-01-11 00:02:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9778,8877,'fr','Des biscuits fous','Que vous les partagiez au travail ou que vous les incluiez dans une vente de pâtisseries, ces petits biscuits audacieux égayeront à coup sûr la journée de chacun !','["350 g de farine nature, plus un supplément","200 g de beurre salé coupé en cubes","120 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","2 jaunes d''œufs","2 pots de 300 g de glaçage royal prêt à l''emploi (nous avons utilisé Dr Oetker, Sainsbury''s)","colorants alimentaires rouges et jaunes"]','["Mélangez la farine et le beurre jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Ajoutez le\r\nsucre, vanille et jaunes d''œufs et whisky\r\nà une pâte lisse. Rouler la pâte\r\nune surface légèrement farinée en 2 saucisses\r\nformes d''environ 4 à 5 cm de diamètre. Enveloppement\r\ndans du film alimentaire et mettre au frais au moins 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nCoupez la pâte en tranches de 4 mm d''épaisseur et\r\ndisposer sur des plaques à pâtisserie, légèrement espacées\r\nà part. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pâle\r\ndoré. Transférer sur une grille pour refroidir.","Chauffer le glaçage en suivant les instructions sur l’emballage.\r\nAjoutez un peu de colorant alimentaire dans chaque pot\r\net glacez la moitié des biscuits en jaune, et\r\ndécorer de rouge, puis glacer l''autre moitié\r\nrouge et décorer en jaune. Laisser sécher."]','2026-01-11 00:02:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9779,8879,'fr','Gâteaux collants au chocolat','Cette pâtisserie facile à préparer se conserve au frais dans un moule hermétique jusqu''à deux jours.','["250 g de beurre doux","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs","200 g de farines autolevantes","50g de cacao","100 g de gouttes de chocolat au lait","85g de beurre","85 g de sucre en poudre","200 g de lait concentré léger","50 g de gouttes de chocolat au lait, plus un peu, à disperser"]','["Beurrer et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie ou un petit\r\nplat à rôtir d''environ 20 x 30 cm. Chaleur\r\nfour à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Doucement\r\nfaire fondre le beurre dans une grande casserole,\r\nlaisser refroidir 5 min, ajouter le sucre, la vanille\r\net les œufs, puis battre jusqu''à consistance lisse avec\r\nune cuillère en bois. Incorporer la farine,\r\ncacao et ¼ cuillère à café de sel. Incorporer les gouttes de chocolat au lait et enfourner\r\npendant 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout soit levé et une brochette\r\nil en ressort avec quelques miettes humides.","Pour le dessus, faites chauffer doucement 85 g de beurre\r\net 85 g de sucre en poudre ensemble jusqu''à\r\nles deux sont fondus. Incorporer 200 g léger\r\nlait concentré et porter à ébullition.\r\nLaisser refroidir 5 minutes, puis incorporer 50 g de lait\r\ngouttes de chocolat à fondre. Propagation\r\nsur le gâteau froid, parsemer avec plus\r\ngouttes de chocolat et coupées en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9780,8881,'fr','Gâteaux féeriques à la banane et aux pois','Ces gâteaux sucrés à la banane sont jolis et simples à préparer pour une vente de pâtisseries ou une fête d''enfants.','["100 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de beurre ramolli","140 g de farines autolevantes","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 banane bien mûre","140 g de sucre glace","100 g de glaçage royal prêt à rouler","colorant alimentaire rouge","des centaines et des milliers"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nTapisser un moule à 12 petits pains de caissettes à gâteaux féeriques.\r\nMettez le sucre, le beurre, la farine, les oeufs, la vanille\r\net la banane dans un grand bol ensemble.\r\nBattre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que la banane\r\nest écrasé et le tout mélangé. Diviser\r\nentre les caisses et cuire au four pendant\r\n20-22 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette apparaisse\r\nen ressort propre. Cool.","Pour décorer, mélangez le sucre glace avec\r\nassez d''eau pour être cuillère, mais pas\r\ntrop liquide, sinon il coulera sur les gâteaux.\r\nRépartissez-en un peu sur chaque gâteau. Pétrir\r\nun peu de colorant alimentaire dans le royal\r\nglaçage pour obtenir une couleur rouge vif. Rouler\r\n12 boules de tailles différentes, tremper un côté ou\r\nle dessus de chacun avec quelques pépites et\r\ncollez-en un sur chaque gâteau."]','2026-01-11 00:02:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9781,8883,'fr','Tranches de carottes à la noix de coco','Si vous cherchez une friandise pour le thé de l''après-midi ou quelque chose à préparer pour une vente de gâteaux, essayez ce plateau croustillant.','["250 g de beurre doux","300 g de sucre muscovado léger","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs","200 g de farine autolevante","50g de noix de coco desséchée","200 g de carottes râpées","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","85 g de noix de coco desséchée","25 g de sucre muscovado léger","25 g de beurre fondu"]','["Beurrer et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie ou un petit\r\nplat à rôtir d''environ 20 x 30 cm. Chaleur\r\nfour à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Doucement\r\nfaire fondre le beurre dans une grande casserole,\r\nlaisser refroidir 5 min, ajouter le sucre, la vanille\r\net les œufs, puis battre jusqu''à consistance lisse avec\r\nune cuillère en bois. Incorporer la farine,\r\nnoix de coco et ¼ cuillère à café de sel. Incorporer la carotte et le mélange d''épices au mélange. Cuire au four 30 mn.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez uniformément 85 g supplémentaires\r\nnoix de coco avec 25g de muscovado léger\r\nsucre et 25g de beurre fondu.\r\nLissez-le sur le gâteau, puis enfournez\r\npendant 10 minutes de plus jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et un\r\nla brochette insérée en ressort propre.\r\nLaisser refroidir puis couper en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9782,9450,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat blanc','Faites preuve de créativité avec les garnitures pour préparer un régal pour votre famille et vos amis – ou ajoutez ces petits gâteaux à votre prochaine vente de pâtisseries.','["250 g de beurre ramolli","300 g de farine autolevante","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","4 œufs","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","200 g de chocolat blanc en tablette, haché en deux","300g de fromage à pâte molle, pas froid au réfrigérateur","100 g de sucre glace tamisé","bonbons, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer un moule de 20 x 30 cm, puis le tapisser de\r\npapier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre, la farine,\r\nsucre, levure chimique, œufs, yaourt, lait\r\net la vanille jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit sans grumeaux. Incorporer le\r\nchocolat haché. Verser dans le moule; cuire au four\r\npendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés et\r\nune brochette en ressort propre. Refroidir dans le moule.","Faites fondre le reste du chocolat. Remuer le glaçage\r\nsucre dans le fromage à pâte molle, puis le chocolat\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse. Refroidir, étaler sur le gâteau,\r\npuis coupez en carrés et décorez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9783,8885,'fr','Biscuits à la framboise du Red Nose Day','Collectez de l''argent pour Comic Relief avec ces cookies effrontés.','["1 quantité de Pâte à biscuits de base Voir « Se marie bien avec » ci-dessous","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","6 cuillères à soupe de confiture de framboise","6 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace tamisé","glaçage, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Préparez la pâte à biscuit Basic en tamisant la cannelle lorsque vous ajoutez la farine. Forme\r\nFormez 2 boules, enveloppez-les dans du film alimentaire et réservez au frais 20 à 30 minutes.","Étalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné, puis découpez 28 biscuits avec un emporte-pièce de 7 à 8 cm de large. Disposez-les sur des plaques à pâtisserie antiadhésives. A l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 4 cm, découpez les « nez » de la moitié des biscuits. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés, puis déposer sur une grille de refroidissement.","Mélangez la confiture de framboise avec le sucre glace tamisé. Une fois les biscuits refroidis, versez un peu de confiture sur chaque biscuit entier, puis placez délicatement les autres biscuits dessus. Servir tels quels, ou un glaçage en pipette, réalisé avec un peu d''eau, pour dessiner des grimaces."]','2026-01-11 00:02:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9784,8887,'fr','Sablés double choc','Ces friandises sucrées feront fureur lors de votre prochaine vente de pâtisseries et ne coûteront qu''environ 15 pence chacune à préparer.','["200 g de beurre coupé en cubes","325 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour rouler","100 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 jaunes d''œufs","100 g de pépites de chocolat noir ou au lait","200 g de chocolat blanc fondu en tablette","tube de glaçage d''écriture rouge"]','["Frotter le beurre dans la farine pour obtenir\r\nchapelure, puis incorporer le sucre, la vanille, les jaunes\r\net des pépites de chocolat et réunir\r\npour former une pâte. Déroulez légèrement\r\nsurface farinée et tamponnez un rond de 6 cm\r\nbiscuits. Reroulez les parures et\r\nrépéter. Disposer sur des plateaux recouverts de papier sulfurisé\r\net réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nCuire les biscuits pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.\r\nCool. Tartiner chacun de chocolat blanc\r\net laissez prendre. Décorer ou écrire dessus\r\nnom de l’acheteur avec glaçage rouge sur place,\r\nsi tu veux."]','2026-01-11 00:02:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9785,8889,'fr','Carrés pêche Melba','Ce plat de cuisson peut être mélangé en un rien de temps et est simple à trancher et à transporter.','["250 g de beurre doux","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs","200 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues","2 pêches tout juste mûres, dénoyautées, coupées en deux puis chaque moitié coupée en 3","100g de framboises","une poignée d''amandes effilées","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace, pour finir"]','["Beurrer et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie ou un petit\r\nplat à rôtir d''environ 20 x 30 cm. Chaleur\r\nfour à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Doucement\r\nfaire fondre le beurre dans une grande casserole,\r\nlaisser refroidir 5 min, ajouter le sucre, la vanille\r\net les œufs, puis battre jusqu''à consistance lisse avec\r\nune cuillère en bois. Incorporer la farine,\r\namandes et ¼ cuillère à café de sel.","Versez le mélange dans le moule, puis déposez le\r\ntranches de pêche uniformément sur le dessus – de cette façon\r\nchaque carré de gâteau aura une bouchée de\r\ndes fruits. Répartir les framboises et les amandes\r\npuis enfournez pour 1h-1h10,\r\ncouvrir de papier d''aluminium après 40 minutes. Testez avec\r\nune brochette : le milieu ne devrait avoir qu''un\r\nun petit soupçon de squamosité, qui raffermira\r\nune fois le gâteau refroidi. Refroidir dans la boîte\r\npendant 20 minutes, puis déposez-le sur un réfrigérateur\r\nsupport. Une fois froid, saupoudrer de sucre glace,\r\npuis coupez-le en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9786,8891,'fr','Gâteau aux lignes de faille saupoudré et épicé au caramel','Épatez vos invités avec ce gâteau de fête magique. Des couches de génoise légèrement épicées sont enveloppées dans une crème au beurre moelleuse à la vanille et des paillettes scintillantes – cette pâtisserie est quelque chose de spécial','["200 ml de lait entier","4 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","300 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour les boîtes","500 g de farine nature","4 cuillères à café de levure chimique","500 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","4 petites pincées de clous de girofle moulus","400 ml de babeurre (si vous ne pouvez pas obtenir de babeurre, utilisez 300 g de yaourt grec mélangé à 100 ml de lait)","4 œufs moyens","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","500 g de beurre légèrement salé ramolli","1 kg de sucre glace","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","un peu de lait (facultatif)","150 g de bonbons en conserve","50 g de pépites (nous avons utilisé un mélange d''or, de bronze et de violet métallique, rouge et turquoise – un mélange de différentes couleurs et formes donnera le meilleur résultat), plus un peu pour le dessus (facultatif)","stylo de décoration en or comestible ou lustre en or comestible mélangé à quelques gouttes d''alcool clair (comme la vodka)"]','["Mettez la moitié du lait et la moitié du sirop doré dans une casserole et portez à légère ébullition. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis retirer du feu et laisser refroidir. Ou faites chauffer le mélange dans un pichet résistant à la chaleur au micro-ondes pendant 1 min. Pendant ce temps, huilez deux moules à gâteau à fond amovible de 20 cm et tapissez les fonds de papier sulfurisé (si les moules ont moins de 4 cm de profondeur, tapissez également les côtés d''un grand anneau de papier sulfurisé). Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Pour les génoises, vous devrez utiliser la moitié des ingrédients de la première fournée de gâteaux, puis le reste des ingrédients pour une autre fournée, pour faire quatre génoises au total. Pour le premier lot, versez 250 g de farine, 2 cuillères à café de levure chimique, 250 g de sucre, 1 cuillère à café de cannelle et 2 pincées de clous de girofle moulus dans un grand bol avec ¼ de cuillère à café de sel fin. Mélangez ensemble, en brisant les gros morceaux de sucre pour créer un mélange homogène et sableux.","Fouetter ensemble 150 ml d''huile, 200 ml de babeurre, 2 œufs et 1 cuillère à café de vanille dans un grand pichet. Ajoutez le mélange de lait et de sirop refroidi et fouettez à nouveau. Incorporer progressivement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs jusqu''à consistance lisse. Répartir entre les moules. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu de chaque génoise en ressorte propre.","Laissez refroidir les génoises dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis retournez-les sur une grille (pour que les bases deviennent les dessus), décollez le papier sulfurisé et laissez refroidir complètement. Nettoyez, huilez et tapissez à nouveau les moules comme décrit à l''étape 1, et répétez les étapes 1 à 3 pour faire deux autres éponges. Laissez les quatre éponges refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidies, les éponges peuvent être emballées et conservées dans un endroit frais jusqu''à trois jours, ou congelées jusqu''à deux mois.","Pour réaliser le glaçage à la crème au beurre, mettez le beurre et la moitié du sucre glace dans un grand bol. Écrasez grossièrement avec une spatule, puis battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et pâle. Ajoutez le reste du sucre, la vanille et le lait pour assouplir le mélange jusqu''à obtenir une consistance tartinable, si nécessaire. Battre à nouveau jusqu''à consistance lisse. Transférer la moitié de la crème au beurre dans un deuxième bol et réserver.","En travaillant avec le premier bol de crème au beurre, étalez quelques cuillères à soupe au centre d''un plateau ou d''un support à gâteau de 20 cm et posez une des génoises dessus, à l''envers, de manière à ce que la base plate soit au dessus. Répartir sur un quart de la crème au beurre, suivi d''un tiers du caramel. Garnir d''une autre génoise, puis d''une autre couche de crème au beurre et de caramel, puis répéter l''opération avec une troisième génoise. Placez la dernière éponge dessus, à l''envers, pour obtenir une surface plane. Couvrez tout le gâteau d''une très fine couche de crème au beurre, en utilisant ce qui reste du premier bol – ne vous inquiétez pas de le rendre propre, car les miettes coincées dans le glaçage seront recouvertes de la couche finale. Refroidissez le gâteau pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le glaçage soit ferme.","","","","","",""]','2026-01-11 00:02:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9787,8893,'fr','Couronne de profiteroles spéculoos','Abandonnez le dessert acheté en magasin à Noël pour cette superbe pièce maîtresse de choux. Fabriqué avec des biscuits au spéculoos, il est garni d''un succulent caramel au beurre salé','["100 g de farine nature","85g de beurre doux","3 œufs, à température ambiante","4-5 biscuits spéculoos émiettés","des pépites d''or, pour décorer (facultatif)","400 ml de crème fraîche","250 g de pâte à tartiner spéculoos","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","râpe de muscade","130g de sucre semoule","20g de beurre doux","6 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","¼ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées"]','["Tamisez la farine et ¼ cuillère à café de sel dans un bol. Portez à ébullition le beurre et 225 ml d''eau dans une casserole, puis laissez mijoter jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu. Versez le mélange de farine et battez rapidement avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le tout se rassemble en une pâte lisse et brillante qui se détache des côtés du moule. Versez la pâte dans un bol propre et étalez-la sur les côtés avec la cuillère pour l''aider à refroidir un peu rapidement (vous ne voulez pas qu''elle refroidisse complètement – ​​il est plus facile d''incorporer les œufs lorsqu''elle est encore un peu chaude). Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Annuler.","Pendant que la pâte est encore légèrement tiède, cassez les œufs un à un en battant bien avec la cuillère en bois entre chaque ajout jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse (vous n''aurez peut-être pas besoin d''utiliser tous les œufs). Une fois prête, la pâte doit tomber lentement de la cuillère en forme de V – si le mélange est trop liquide, vous ne pourrez pas le canaliser ; s’il est trop épais, il ne gonflera pas au four. Versez la pâte dans une poche à douille et coupez l''extrémité pour qu''elle ait une ouverture de 1 cm.","En tenant la poche à douille à un angle de 90 degrés par rapport à la plaque à pâtisserie, déposez des boules de pâte de la taille d''une noix sur les deux feuilles – vous devriez en obtenir 18 à 20 au total. Trempez votre doigt dans un peu d''eau et tapotez doucement les pics au-dessus des boules. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes, en échangeant les plaques après 20 minutes. Les choux doivent être gonflés et croustillants à la cuisson. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Pour réaliser la garniture, battre la crème avec le biscuit à tartiner et les épices dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit doucement fouettée.","Pour la sauce caramel, versez le sucre dans une casserole sur feu moyen, ajoutez 6 cuillères à soupe d''eau et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Augmentez légèrement le feu et laissez mijoter en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée (ne remuez pas sinon le sucre cristallisera). Retirer du feu, ajouter le beurre et faire tourner la poêle jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu et mélangé au sirop. Incorporer rapidement la crème, la vanille, la cannelle, le mélange d''épices et une pincée de sel marin. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Coupez chaque choux refroidi en deux jusqu''au milieu. Versez la garniture dans une poche à douille, coupez l''extrémité et déposez-la sur la base des petits pains. Placez-les en sandwich avec le dessus, puis disposez-les en forme de couronne ronde d''environ 27 cm sur une grande assiette ou une planche de service. Arroser le tout de sauce caramel, puis parsemer de biscuits émiettés et de pépites dorées, le cas échéant. A consommer de préférence immédiatement. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à 24 heures."]','2026-01-11 00:02:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9788,8895,'fr','Fondant au caramel salé','Sortez votre thermomètre à sucre pour réaliser ce fudge. Cela demande un peu de précision, mais le résultat est fabuleux, avec un joli goût de caramel salé.','["450 g de sucre en poudre doré","400 g de crème fraîche","50g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop de glucose","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gousse de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de caramel en conserve","450 g de sucre en poudre doré","400 g de crème fraîche","50g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop de glucose","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gousse de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de caramel en conserve"]','["Tapisser un moule à cake de 20 x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Versez le sucre, la crème, le beurre et le sirop de glucose dans une grande casserole. Chauffer à feu doux pour dissoudre le sucre et faire fondre le beurre en remuant de temps en temps.","Une fois le sucre dissous, placez un thermomètre à sucre dans le mélange en vous assurant que l''extrémité est entièrement recouverte par le sirop. Si ce n''est pas le cas, transférez le mélange dans une casserole plus petite mais suffisamment grande pour que le sirop bouillonne. Augmentez le feu à moyen-vif et portez le sirop à ébullition en remuant de temps en temps pour l''empêcher de prendre. Lorsque le thermomètre atteint 116 °C – ou stade « boule molle », retirez la casserole du feu.","Laisser reposer le mélange pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la température descende à 110°C, puis incorporer la pâte de gousse de vanille et une bonne pincée de sel.","Retirez le thermomètre, puis battez vigoureusement le mélange avec une cuillère en bois, en vérifiant la température toutes les minutes environ jusqu''à ce qu''elle retombe à environ 60°C. À ce stade, le mélange sera très épais et aura perdu son éclat brillant. Retirez le thermomètre et continuez à battre le mélange pendant encore quelques minutes. Cette partie est cruciale car elle contribue à créer de petits cristaux de sucre qui donnent au fudge sa texture onctueuse et crémeuse.","Versez rapidement le mélange de fudge dans le moule préparé et lissez la surface à l''aide d''une spatule. Disposez le caramel sur le dessus et faites-le tourner dans le fudge à l''aide d''une brochette. Saupoudrez d’1 cuillère à café de sel marin, puis laissez refroidir toute la nuit à température ambiante – ne le mettez pas au réfrigérateur, car il deviendra collant et ne durcira pas correctement. Couper en 36 bouchées. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique à température ambiante jusqu''à deux mois.","Tapisser un moule à cake de 20 x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Versez le sucre, la crème, le beurre et le sirop de glucose dans une grande casserole. Chauffer à feu doux pour dissoudre le sucre et faire fondre le beurre en remuant de temps en temps.","Une fois le sucre dissous, placez un thermomètre à sucre dans le mélange en vous assurant que l''extrémité est entièrement recouverte par le sirop. Si ce n''est pas le cas, transférez le mélange dans une casserole plus petite mais suffisamment grande pour que le sirop bouillonne. Augmentez le feu à moyen-vif et portez le sirop à ébullition en remuant de temps en temps pour l''empêcher de prendre. Lorsque le thermomètre atteint 116 °C – ou stade « boule molle », retirez la casserole du feu.","Laisser reposer le mélange pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la température descende à 110°C, puis incorporer la pâte de gousse de vanille et une bonne pincée de sel.","Retirez le thermomètre, puis battez vigoureusement le mélange avec une cuillère en bois, en vérifiant la température toutes les minutes environ jusqu''à ce qu''elle retombe à environ 60°C. À ce stade, le mélange sera très épais et aura perdu son éclat brillant. Retirez le thermomètre et continuez à battre le mélange pendant encore quelques minutes. Cette partie est cruciale car elle contribue à créer de petits cristaux de sucre qui donnent au fudge sa texture onctueuse et crémeuse.","Versez rapidement le mélange de fudge dans le moule préparé et lissez la surface à l''aide d''une spatule. Disposez le caramel sur le dessus et faites-le tourner dans le fudge à l''aide d''une brochette. Saupoudrez d’1 cuillère à café de sel marin, puis laissez refroidir toute la nuit à température ambiante – ne le mettez pas au réfrigérateur, car il deviendra collant et ne durcira pas correctement. Couper en 36 bouchées. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique à température ambiante jusqu''à deux mois."]','2026-01-11 00:02:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9789,8897,'fr','Terrine chocolat-caramel','Préparez cette terrine décadente au chocolat et au caramel pour un dessert de dîner sophistiqué. Saupoudrer généreusement de cacao en poudre avant de couper en tranches','["huile de tournesol, pour la boîte","200 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","300 g de caramel en pot ou en boîte","100 g de chocolat noir finement haché","200 g de mascarpone","7 à 8 gaufrettes au caramel (selon la taille du moule), coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur"]','["Huiler un moule à cake de 900 g et le tapisser d''une double couche de papier sulfurisé. Mettez la crème, le cacao, 200 g de caramel et une pincée de sel dans une casserole sur feu moyen et portez à ébullition en fouettant de temps en temps pour bien mélanger. Versez le chocolat dans un bol moyen résistant à la chaleur et versez sur le mélange de crème chaude. Laisser reposer 1 min, puis mélanger le tout jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu et lisse. Laisser refroidir légèrement pendant 5 à 10 minutes.","Battre le mascarpone dans le mélange de chocolat refroidi à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et brillant et que le fouet laisse une trace dans le mélange.","Pour assembler la terrine, pressez les moitiés supérieures des gaufrettes au caramel dans le fond du moule, côté coupé vers le haut, en les coupant si nécessaire.","Battez le reste du caramel au fouet pour le décoller, puis étalez-en la moitié sur les gaufrettes du moule. Versez la moitié du mélange de chocolat sur le dessus, puis disposez les moitiés de gaufrette restantes sur la couche de chocolat. Couvrir avec le reste du caramel en veillant à ce que le tout soit bien recouvert, puis garnir du reste du mélange de chocolat. Couvrir la terrine d''une bande de papier sulfurisé, puis congeler au moins 6 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Sortez la terrine du congélateur 10 minutes avant de servir, puis démoulez-la sur un plat ou une assiette de service réfrigérée. Saupoudrez généreusement de cacao en poudre avant de couper en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:02:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9790,8899,'fr','Éclairs au caramel salé et popcorn','Donnez à la pâtisserie française classique une cure de jouvence moderne ! Versez une délicieuse garniture au caramel salé dans des petits pains à choux légers et parsemez-les de morceaux croquants de pop-corn au caramel.','["1 quantity eclairs and crème pâtissière recipe - see link in method","1 boîte de 397 g Nestlé Carnation Caramel","600 g de sucre glace fondant","flocons de sel marin","600 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","100 g de pop-corn au caramel haché"]','["Make the eclairs and crème pâtissière using our classic recipe.","Mélangez 150 g de Carnation Caramel avec le sucre glace fondant. Mélanger dans un glaçage épais mais en filet, en ajoutant un peu d''eau s''il est trop épais. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire.","Transférez encore 200 g de Carnation Caramel dans une poche à douille et tracez une ligne le long de la moitié inférieure des éclairs fendus, puis saupoudrez de quelques flocons de sel marin.","Versez la crème double dans un bol avec le reste de caramel et la pâte de gousse de vanille. Battre avec un fouet électrique à main pour épaissir la crème jusqu''à obtenir des pics fermes. Incorporer la crème pâtissière, puis transférer dans une poche à douille. Versez de généreuses gouttes de crème sur la base, puis saupoudrez de 50 g de pop-corn au caramel haché.","Étalez délicatement le glaçage sur le dessus des éclairs, puis placez-le sur la crème. Tous les quatre ou cinq éclairs, décorez le dessus, pendant que le glaçage est encore humide, avec 50 g de pop-corn au caramel haché et une pincée de flocons de sel marin. Pour plus d''aide, regardez notre vidéo comment faire de la pâte à choux et des éclairs."]','2026-01-11 00:02:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9791,8901,'fr','Ailes de poulet asiatiques au caramel','L''utilisation du caramel noir dans les plats salés est courante dans la cuisine asiatique : elle ajoute de la profondeur à la saveur et contraste bien avec les notes aigres et épicées.','["100 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson sans gluten","1 piment vert, coupé en deux (facultatif)","petit morceau d''écorce de cannelle","petit morceau de gingembre, finement haché","jus d''1 gros citron vert, plus un peu pour le presser","1 kg d''aile de poulet, pointes retirées et coupées en deux","petit bouquet d''oignon nouveau, coupé en tronçons de 1 cm","gros morceau de gingembre, coupé en allumettes","1 piment vert (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant), coupé en rondelles","une poignée de brins de coriandre","riz blanc bouilli, pour servir"]','["Mettez le sucre dans une sauteuse moyenne avec suffisamment d''eau pour le rendre boueux. Placer sur feu doux et porter à ébullition, puis cuire jusqu''à l''obtention d''un caramel ambré foncé (voir astuce ci-dessous).","À bout de bras, ajoutez les autres ingrédients, à l’exception du poulet et de la garniture, et portez à ébullition – faites attention car cela va cracher. Une fois qu''il s''est un peu calmé et que vous avez une sauce épaisse, incorporez les ailes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien enrobées. Versez dessus 100 ml d''eau et laissez mijoter à feu moyen pendant environ 30 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait une consistance plus épaisse – ajoutez un peu d''eau si nécessaire.","Baissez le feu et poursuivez la cuisson à couvert pendant encore 15 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les ailes soient laquées et tendres et que la sauce soit très épaisse. Éteignez le feu et mélangez rapidement la moitié de l''oignon nouveau, du gingembre et du piment. Versez les ailes et la sauce sur une assiette. Parsemer du reste de la garniture et de la coriandre et servir avec du citron vert et du riz supplémentaires."]','2026-01-11 00:02:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9792,8903,'fr','S''mores au caramel salé et au beurre de cacahuète','Quoi de plus délicieux qu’une guimauve américaine classique et un cracker s’more ? Notre version dessert de luxe avec des biscuits au caramel, au chocolat, aux noix et aux gaufres','["16 biscuits gaufrés","8 tasses de beurre de cacahuète","8 cuillères à café de caramel (nous avons utilisé Carnation)","flocons de sel marin, pour saupoudrer"]','["Préchauffer le gril à feu vif et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mettez 8 biscuits gaufrés sur le plateau avec une tasse de beurre de cacahuète sur chacun et faites griller jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à fondre.","Mettez une cuillère à café de caramel sur les 8 autres gaufres et saupoudrez chacune de quelques flocons de sel.","Prenez les biscuits gaufrés ensemble et dégustez-les avec un cappuccino."]','2026-01-11 00:02:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9793,8905,'fr','Crêpes à la citrouille et caramel au beurre de noix de pécan salé','La purée de citrouille est un délicieux ajout à une pile de crêpes grasses et moelleuses – le brunch parfait pour commencer le week-end en douceur','["250 g de potirons ou courges, pelées, épépinées et coupées en gros morceaux","2 œufs","3 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","25 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour la cuisson","125 ml de babeurre (ou utiliser la même quantité de lait, avec un filet de jus de citron)","200 g de farine nature","2½ cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","un filet d''huile sans saveur, comme celle de tournesol ou d''arachide, pour la friture","glace, pour servir, ou yaourt ou crème fraîche","50 g de noix de pécan hachées grossièrement","50g de beurre","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin","100 ml de crème double"]','["Mettez la citrouille ou la courge dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur, ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau, couvrez d''un film alimentaire et mettez au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 5 à 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient vraiment tendres – différents types prendront un temps variable. Bien égoutter le potiron et laisser refroidir complètement. Si vous souhaitez manger les crêpes au petit-déjeuner, il est préférable de faire cette étape la veille.","Une fois refroidi, mettez le potiron dans un robot culinaire avec le reste des ingrédients de la crêpe et ajoutez une bonne pincée de sel. Mélangez jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé pour obtenir une pâte lisse et épaisse (vous pouvez également bien écraser la citrouille, puis incorporer le reste des ingrédients en fouettant). Transférer dans un pichet ou une poche à douille et réserver pendant que vous préparez la sauce au caramel au beurre.","Faire griller les pacanes dans une casserole pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient plus foncées. Démoulez et réservez. Ajoutez le beurre, le sucre, le sel et la crème dans la poêle. Portez à ébullition, puis bouillonnez doucement pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à obtenir une sauce brillante. Incorporer les noix de pécan et laisser refroidir un peu.","Faites chauffer une noix de beurre et un filet d''huile dans une grande poêle. Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1, pour garder les crêpes au chaud pendant que vous les faites cuire par lots – ayez une plaque à pâtisserie à portée de main. Lorsque le beurre mousse, faites-le tourner autour de la poêle, puis versez des quantités de pâte de la taille d''une balle de tennis dans la poêle (voir astuce ci-dessous) – elles s''étaleront un peu pendant la cuisson, alors laissez un peu d''espace entre chaque crêpe et ne surchargez pas la poêle. Cuire à feu moyen-doux. Ne touchez pas les crêpes jusqu''à ce que quelques bulles apparaissent à la surface, regardez en dessous et, si les crêpes sont dorées, retournez-les et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes de l''autre côté. Transférez les crêpes cuites sur la plaque à pâtisserie et réservez au chaud au four pendant que vous poursuivez la cuisson.","Une fois cuites, disposez les crêpes dans des assiettes, garnissez de glace, de yaourt ou de crème fraîche et versez dessus la sauce caramel au beurre de noix de pécan salée."]','2026-01-11 00:02:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9794,8907,'fr','Bonbons de vente','Ces bonbons de triche constituent un excellent ajout à une tartinade de fête ou à un panier-cadeau. Utilisez des caramels au chocolat et recouvrez d''or comestible','["caramels enrobés de chocolat (nous avons utilisé du Rolos)","lustre doré comestible (nous avons acheté le nôtre chez Waitrose)","flocons de sel marin"]','["Déballez les caramels enrobés de chocolat et utilisez un petit pinceau pour saupoudrer l''extérieur d''un éclat doré. Ajoutez quelques flocons de sel marin sur le dessus de chacun, puis disposez-les sur une assiette de service (les empiler en tour leur donne un aspect très spécial). Mettre au frais au moins 1 h avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9795,8909,'fr','Choux crumble au caramel salé et popcorn','Edd Kimber donne une nouvelle tournure à la pâte à choux française classique avec ces petits pains au caramel salé fourrés à la crème pop-corn et terminés par un dessus de craquelin croustillant.','["125 g de pop-corn au caramel (pour remplir les petits pains)","sucre glace, pour servir","feuille d''or comestible, pour décorer (facultatif)","50g de farine nature","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","40 g de beurre doux, froid et coupé en petits morceaux","150g de sucre semoule","125 ml de crème fraîche","10g de beurre doux","grosse pincée de sel marin en flocons","600 ml de crème double, plus un peu pour compléter","125 g de popcorn au caramel","grosse pincée de sel marin en flocons","60 g de beurre doux coupé en petits cubes","¼ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","85 g de farine nature","2-3 gros œufs"]','["Pour la garniture du crumble, mélanger la farine et le sucre dans un bol moyen. Ajoutez le beurre et frottez jusqu''à obtenir une texture de chapelure. Avec vos mains, pressez ce mélange pour former une pâte uniforme. Placez-le entre 2 feuilles de papier sulfurisé et étalez-le jusqu''à obtenir une épaisseur de quelques millimètres. Mettez au congélateur sur une plaque à pâtisserie jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour le caramel au beurre salé, mettez le sucre dans une casserole de taille moyenne et faites chauffer à feu moyen. Laissez fondre et caraméliser le sucre en remuant de temps en temps. Une fois que le sucre a pris une couleur caramel cuivré foncé, ajoutez la moitié de la crème double. Lorsque le bouillonnement s''est calmé, ajoutez le reste de la crème, le beurre et le sel et mélangez. S''il reste des grumeaux, remettez sur le feu et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus et lisses. Retirer du feu, verser dans un petit bol, couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour la crème pop-corn, mettre tous les ingrédients dans une casserole moyenne sur feu moyen-vif et porter à ébullition. Retirer du feu, couvrir la casserole et laisser infuser 1 heure. Passer la crème au tamis dans un verre doseur, en appuyant sur le pop-corn ramolli pour en extraire le plus de crème possible. Complétez la crème pour avoir encore 600 ml. Presser un morceau de film alimentaire sur la surface de la crème et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Peut être préparé la veille jusqu’à présent.","Pour la pâte à choux, chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. A l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 5 cm de diamètre, dessinez 5 cercles sur chaque morceau de papier sulfurisé et retournez-les. Mettez 140 ml d''eau, le beurre, ¼ de cuillère à café de sel et le sucre dans une casserole moyenne et, à feu moyen-vif, portez le mélange à ébullition complète. Une fois le beurre fondu, retirez du feu, versez la farine et mélangez immédiatement avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Remettez sur le feu et battez pendant 1 à 2 minutes pour sécher un peu. Versez la pâte dans un grand bol et battez pendant quelques minutes pour qu''elle refroidisse légèrement.","Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement combinés avant d''en ajouter un autre – ajoutez le dernier œuf petit à petit car vous n''aurez peut-être pas besoin de tout. Arrêtez-vous lorsque les choux onctueux tombent de votre cuillère en forme de V. Mettez la pâte dans une poche à douille munie d''une grande douille ronde, puis déposez des ronds de pâte sur les plaques à pâtisserie préparées, en utilisant les cercles comme gabarit. Sortez la garniture du crumble du congélateur et décollez la couche supérieure de papier sulfurisé. A l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 5 cm, découpez 10 disques de crumble et placez-en un sur chaque rond de pâte. Cuire au four 40 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les choux soient bien levés et que le crumble soit doré. Éteignez le four mais laissez les choux dedans jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement refroidis.","Pour assembler les petits pains, utilisez un grand couteau dentelé pour les couper soigneusement en deux. Placez quelques morceaux de pop-corn au fond de chaque pain et versez également un peu de caramel (si vous avez préparé le caramel à l''avance, il aura raffermi, placez-le donc au-dessus d''un bol d''eau frémissante pour le détendre). Pour la garniture, sortez la crème du réfrigérateur et fouettez-la jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous, puis mettez-la dans une poche à douille munie d''une grosse douille en étoile et formez un tourbillon sur la base de chaque petit pain. Pour finir, replacez le dessus des choux sur la crème et saupoudrez légèrement de sucre glace. J''ai terminé le mien avec un morceau de feuille d''or comestible."]','2026-01-11 00:02:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9796,8911,'fr','Panais au caramel salé','Ne réservez pas le caramel salé aux desserts : il se marie également parfaitement avec les légumes-racines rôtis.','["1 kg de panais pelés","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","grosse noix de beurre","1 cuillère à café de sel marin"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Couper les panais en deux, puis couper l''extrémité la plus épaisse en deux dans le sens de la longueur. Faire bouillir 5 minutes, puis bien égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur quelques minutes. Pendant ce temps, versez l''huile dans un plat à rôtir peu profond ou une plaque à pâtisserie et faites chauffer au four pendant 3 minutes.","Retirez le moule du four et ajoutez délicatement les panais à l''huile chaude. Retournez-les pour les enrober et assurez-vous qu’ils ne sont pas surpeuplés (sinon ils ne seront pas croustillants). Rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants, en les retournant à mi-cuisson.","Environ 10 minutes avant que les panais ne soient prêts, versez le sucre et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans une petite poêle. Chauffer très doucement jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Augmentez le feu et portez le liquide à ébullition. Mesurez 3½ cuillères à soupe d’eau froide dans une carafe. Continuez à faire tourner la casserole jusqu''à ce que le sucre atteigne une riche couleur caramel rougeâtre foncé, puis retirez du feu. Reculez bien et ajoutez l’eau (elle va cracher !). Remettez sur le feu, ajoutez le beurre et le sel et remuez pour éliminer les grumeaux. Le caramel doit être coulant, alors ajoutez un peu d''eau si nécessaire. Empilez les panais dans un plat de service, puis arrosez-les de caramel au beurre salé."]','2026-01-11 00:02:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9797,8913,'fr','Gâteau étagé au caramel absolument fou','La garniture aux noix de caramel donne un avantage à cette génoise : nous avons utilisé des noix du Brésil, des noisettes, des pacanes et des amandes.','["250 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de noix mélangées, nous avons utilisé des noix du Brésil, des noisettes, des noix de pécan et des amandes hachées grossièrement","250 g de sucre roux clair et mou","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","4 gros œufs","140 g de farines autolevantes","75g d''amandes moulues","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","200 ml de crème fraîche","5 cuillères à soupe de caramel, en boîte (nous avons utilisé Carnation)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser 2 moules à gâteau sandwich Victoria à fond libre de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé, puis graisser l''un des moules sur le dessus du papier sulfurisé (cela aidera à empêcher la garniture aux noix de caramel de coller lorsque vous le démoulez).\r\nVersez les noix dans une poêle et faites-les griller à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Ajoutez 50g de beurre, 50g de sucre, le golden sirop et une bonne pincée de sel. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu, puis faire bouillir pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce au beurre soit dorée – ne la laissez pas bouillonner trop longtemps sinon la garniture durcira une fois refroidie. Versez dans le moule à gâteau avec le papier sulfurisé graissé et lissez. Laissez refroidir pendant que vous préparez le gâteau.","Versez le reste du beurre et du sucre dans un grand bol et battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en mélangeant bien entre chaque ajout. Ajoutez la farine, les amandes, la levure chimique, 1 à 2 cuillères à café de sel, l''extrait d''amande et le lait, et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien combiné. Répartissez le mélange à gâteau dans les moules et lissez la surface. Cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille et retirer le papier sulfurisé. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Fouetter la crème et 2 cuillères à soupe de caramel jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient doucement fouettés et tiennent tout juste leur forme. Pour assembler le gâteau, placez le gâteau nature sur une assiette ou un support. Garnir de crème fouettée en la faisant tourbillonner vers les bords. Arroser du caramel restant (mélangez-le d''abord pour le desserrer), en le laissant couler sur les côtés. Garnir avec le reste de la génoise, côté noisette vers le haut. Servir dans la journée ou conserver au réfrigérateur pendant 3 jours en le sortant du réfrigérateur 10 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9798,8915,'fr','Crème brûlée tartlets','Nous combinons un dessert français classique onctueux et crémeux avec une pâtisserie dorée croustillante dans ces puds au caramel décadents.','["175 g de farine nature","100 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","le zeste d''une demi-orange","1 jaune d''œuf battu avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide","Carton de 300 ml de crème double","1 gousse de vanille, coupée en deux dans le sens de la longueur","3 jaunes d''œufs et 1 œuf entier","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","huile de tournesol, pour graisser","85 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Mettez la farine, une pincée de sel et le beurre dans un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une chapelure fine. Ajoutez le sucre et le zeste d''orange et mélangez à nouveau brièvement. Versez 2 cuillères à soupe du mélange d''œufs et mélangez jusqu''à ce que la pâte se rassemble, en ajoutant plus de liquide si nécessaire.","Étalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné et garnissez-en quatre moules à tartelettes cannelés (8 x 3 cm). Placez les boîtes sur\r\nun plateau et réfrigérer 30 minutes. Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser chaque fond de tarte de papier sulfurisé et remplir de fèves au four. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les côtés soient pris. Retirez le papier sulfurisé et les haricots et laissez cuire 5 à 10 minutes. Laisser refroidir. Peut être préparé jusqu''à 1 jour à l''avance à ce stade et conservé dans un contenant hermétique. Baissez le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2.","Versez la crème dans une casserole à fond épais, grattez les graines de la gousse de vanille, puis jetez-y les 2 moitiés.\r\nde la cosse. Faites chauffer jusqu''à ce que de petites bulles commencent à se former sur les parois de la casserole, puis laissez infuser 5 minutes. Retirez la cosse. Dans un bol, battre ensemble les jaunes d''œufs, l''œuf entier et le sucre. Continuez à remuer, puis versez la crème en mélangeant jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Passer au tamis dans une carafe. Versez la crème anglaise dans les fonds de tarte, puis enfournez pendant 18 à 22 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit presque prise (elles doivent être assez bancales au centre mais se raffermiront en refroidissant). Laisser refroidir complètement, puis réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le nappage au caramel. Graisser une plaque à pâtisserie en métal avec\r\nun peu d''huile. Versez le sucre en poudre dans une poêle avec 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le sucre commence à fondre. Ne soyez pas tenté de remuer le sucre, car cela pourrait favoriser la cristallisation du caramel. Cependant, vous pouvez incliner la casserole pour la déplacer. Une fois le sucre presque fondu, augmentez le feu et faites bouillonner le caramel jusqu''à ce qu''il prenne une couleur brun doré profond. Versez rapidement sur la plaque graissée et laissez refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidi, retournez la plaque et tapotez pour libérer le caramel. Cassez-le en morceaux, puis passez-le au robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir de fins cristaux.","Faites chauffer le gril. Éparpillez une épaisse couche de cristaux de caramel sur la surface de chaque tarte et placez un collier de papier d''aluminium autour du bord supérieur de la pâte. Placez-le sous le grill, pas trop près de la source de chaleur, et laissez fondre le caramel – surveillez bien car il brûlera facilement. Laisser refroidir, puis réfrigérer 30 minutes ou jusqu''au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9799,8917,'fr','Tatin d''échalote','Cette variante d''un dessert aux pommes classique met en vedette les échalotes, souvent négligées, et constitue un superbe plat principal végétarien.','["450 g d''échalotes","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara","50g de beurre","1 cuillère à café de feuille de thym frais","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique ou quelques grains de poivre noir concassé","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","Un paquet de 500 g de pâte feuilletée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez de l''eau bouillante sur les échalotes et laissez-les jusqu''à ce que l''eau refroidisse. (Cela facilite le retrait de la peau.) Épluchez et coupez les échalotes en deux, puis réservez. Mettez le sucre dans une poêle allant au four de 23 cm et faites chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il se dissolve et que vous obteniez un caramel collant. Ajoutez le beurre, le thym et un peu de vinaigre balsamique ou de poivre noir concassé – faites attention car cela va cracher.","Retirez la casserole du feu et mettez toutes les échalotes dans la poêle, côté coupé vers le bas. Sur un plan légèrement fariné, étalez la pâte et découpez un rond de 2 cm plus grand que le moule. Étalez la pâte sur les échalotes et rentrez les bords pour qu''elle « épouse » les échalotes. Mettez la poêle au four et laissez cuire 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit gonflée et dorée. Laisser reposer 1 min, puis retourner la tarte sur une assiette. Servir avec une salade punchy de roquette et de chèvre."]','2026-01-11 00:02:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9800,8919,'fr','Flapjacks aux canneberges, graines de citrouille et caramel','Le beurre salé équilibre la douceur du caramel et des fruits secs dans ce gourmand plateau à base de flocons d''avoine.','["250 g de beurre salé","6 cuillères à soupe de caramel, provenant d''une boîte de 397 g de caramel Carnation (utiliser le reste pour la garniture, voir ci-dessous)","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","350 g de flocons d''avoine","85 g de farines autolevantes","reste du caramel","50g de beurre salé","25g de graines de citrouille","50 g de canneberges séchées","25 g de pépites de chocolat noir"]','["Chauffer le four à 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 3\r\net tapisser un moule à cake carré de 22 cm de diamètre\r\npapier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le beurre,\r\ncaramel et sucre dans une grande casserole,\r\npuis ajoutez les flocons d''avoine et la farine. Remuez bien,\r\nen s''assurant que chaque avoine est recouverte\r\nle mélange de beurre, puis versez-le dans votre\r\nmoule à gâteau et appuyez fermement avec le\r\ndos d''une cuillère pour niveler la surface.\r\nCuire au four 40 mn.","Versez le reste du caramel et du beurre\r\ndans une petite casserole et faire bouillonner pendant\r\n5 minutes, en remuant continuellement, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle mélange devient brun doré foncé et\r\ns''épaissit un peu. Quand les flapjacks ont\r\nla cuisson terminée, retirez-les du feu.\r\nfour et verser sur le caramel chaud.\r\nLaisser refroidir 5 mn puis répartir\r\navec les graines, les canneberges et\r\npépites de chocolat. Laisser refroidir complètement\r\ndans le moule avant de couper en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9801,8922,'fr','Chocolat, caramel salé et banane','Remplacez les baies d''un gâchis d''Eton par de la banane et transformez le dessert à la crème traditionnel en une friandise semblable à un banoffee.','["½ gousse de vanille, grattée des graines","150 ml de crème fraîche","2 nids de meringue prêts à l''emploi, émiettés en morceaux","2 bananes, tranchées","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","3 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","pincée de flocons de sel marin","2 cuillères à soupe de lait entier","1 cuillère à soupe de crème fraîche","50 g de chocolat noir cassé en petits morceaux"]','["Pour réaliser le caramel au beurre salé, mettez le\r\nsucre et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans un petit\r\ncasserole à fond épais. Placer sur un\r\nfeu doux et remuez doucement jusqu''à ce que le sucre\r\na fondu. Augmentez le feu et laissez le\r\nfaire des bulles de sucre et caraméliser en noisette\r\nmarron. Retirez du feu et versez le\r\ncrème, beurre et flocons de sel – faites ceci\r\navec précaution, car il pourrait cracher. Remuer doucement\r\nensemble jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et brillant.","Pour la sauce au chocolat, apportez le\r\nle lait et la crème à ébullition dans une petite\r\ncasserole. Mettez les morceaux de chocolat dans un\r\nbol. Versez les deux tiers du lait\r\net le mélange de crème, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu\r\net lisse. Ajustez la consistance avec\r\nle reste du mélange de lait chaud.","Mettez les graines de vanille dans la crème\r\net fouettez jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous.\r\nPliez les meringues et les tranches de banane\r\ndans la crème en laissant quelques tranches\r\npour la garniture. Disposez dans les plats de service et\r\narroser des deux sauces. Haut\r\navec les tranches de banane restantes.\r\nServir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:02:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9802,8924,'fr','Puddings aux pommes au gingembre et au caramel','Des ingrédients typiquement britanniques composent les puds réconfortants de Frances Auger, impressionnant les juges du Best Pud de Grande-Bretagne','["50 g de beurre, plus un peu pour les ramequins","1 grosse pomme à cuire, pelée, épépinée et hachée finement","75 g de sucre brun clair muscovado","140 g de beurre ramolli","100 g de sucre brun clair muscovado","1 oeuf","125 ml de babeurre","2 boules de gingembre confit, finement hachées, plus 1 cuillère à soupe de sirop du pot","100 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1½ cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","crème ou crème anglaise, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer légèrement et fariner sur 6 x 8 cm de profondeur\r\nramequins, en ôtant l''excédent de farine. Chaleur\r\nle beurre dans une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''il mousse, ajoutez le\r\npomme et cuire 1 min à feu moyen\r\nchaleur. Ajouter le sucre et cuire jusqu''à ce que\r\ndissous. Répartissez dans les ramequins.","Pour les puddings, battre le beurre\r\net le sucre avec un électrique\r\nfouetter jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Dans un séparé\r\ndans un bol, mélangez l''œuf, le babeurre,\r\ngingembre haché et sirop de gingembre, puis\r\nincorporez-le au mélange de beurre. Plier\r\ndans la farine, gingembre moulu, cuisson\r\nen poudre, du bicarbonate de soude et une pincée\r\nde sel. Répartir dans les ramequins\r\nils sont donc remplis jusqu''à 1 cm en dessous du sommet.\r\nDisposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie et enfournez\r\npendant 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés.","Servir tiède, saupoudré de sucre glace.\r\nAccompagner de crème ou de crème anglaise."]','2026-01-11 00:02:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9803,8926,'fr','Gâteau aux pommes caramélisées avec garniture streusel','Ce gâteau moelleux avec une garniture croquante aux noix deviendra certainement un favori à l''heure du thé.','["100 g de beurre, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","175 g de sucre muscovado brun clair, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","2 pommes de table pelées et coupées en morceaux de 1½ cm","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","100 ml de lait","25g de farine","85 g de sucre demerara, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","50 g de beurre froid","3 cuillères à soupe de noisettes grillées et concassées"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre et 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre dans une\r\ngrande poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle sucre commence à fondre. Ajouter les pommes, puis cuire\r\npendant environ 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés et\r\nla sauce est un caramel riche. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant que les pommes refroidissent, préparez la garniture.\r\nAu robot culinaire ou en utilisant les pointes de\r\nvos doigts, mélangez la farine, 85 g de sucre,\r\ncannelle et beurre froid jusqu''à ce que le mélange\r\nest friable et seuls des morceaux de la taille d''un pois\r\nil reste du beurre. Incorporez 2 cuillères à soupe de noisettes.\r\nRéserver dans un endroit frais.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nPour faire le gâteau, placez le reste\r\nbeurre et sucre dans un bol ou un mixeur\r\net battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et crémeux. Ajoutez le\r\nœufs un à la fois, suivis du\r\nextrait de vanille. Ajouter la farine, cuire au four\r\npoudre, cannelle et lait en deux\r\nva, en alternant entre sec et humide\r\ningrédients. Quand le mélange est bien\r\ncombiné, incorporer les pommes.","Beurrer un moule à cake de 20 cm avec fond amovible\r\nbase et tapissez la base avec un cercle de\r\npapier sulfurisé. Verser le mélange à gâteau,\r\nlisser le dessus avec une cuillère, puis\r\nsaupoudrer sur la garniture streusel. Dispersion\r\navec 1 cuillère à soupe de demerara restante\r\nsucre et noisettes. Cuire au four\r\npendant 50 minutes à 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette soit insérée\r\ndans le gâteau en ressort propre. Laisser à\r\nlaisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler\r\nsur une grille à pâtisserie, retirer le papier et laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9804,8928,'fr','Gâteau au fromage et au caramel','Saveur de mélasse issue des sucres muscovado et garniture de fudge finement tranché… ce pud préparé à l''avance est un pur plaisir','["50g de beurre doux","140 g de biscuits digestifs nature","4 feuilles de gélatine (j''ai utilisé Supercook), coupées en larges lanières (ou 1 sachet de 11g, voir Savoir-faire, ci-dessous)","400g crème fraîche","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","50 g de sucre muscovado noir","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","400 g de ricotta","50 g de fudge finement tranché","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Faire fondre doucement le beurre dans une petite poêle\r\nà feu doux. Placez les digestifs dans\r\nun sac en plastique et écraser en fines miettes\r\nà l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie ; vous pouvez également le faire dans\r\nun robot culinaire. Versez-les dans la poêle\r\navec le beurre fondu, remuer pour bien enrober, puis\r\ntransférer dans un moule à charnière de 20 cm\r\n(9 cm de profondeur). A l''aide du dos d''une cuillère,\r\nenfoncez-les dans la base, en vous assurant\r\nvous scellez les bords. Placer au réfrigérateur\r\npendant que vous préparez la prochaine étape.","Si vous utilisez de la gélatine en feuilles, placez-la dans un bol,\r\ncouvrir d''eau froide, laisser tremper 5 minutes,\r\npuis égouttez. Versez 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante dessus\r\nla gélatine trempée et remuer pour la dissoudre.\r\nSi vous utilisez un sachet, voir savoir-faire ci-dessous.","Mettez la crème fraîche dans une petite casserole\r\navec les sucres muscovado et une pincée\r\nde sel marin, puis chauffer doucement en remuant\r\nconstamment avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce\r\nle mélange se liquéfie et le sucre a\r\ndissous. Donnez un coup de fouet rapide au mélange\r\npour se débarrasser des grumeaux. Il devrait faire chaud,\r\nà peu près la même température que\r\nsolution de gélatine. Mélangez la gélatine et\r\nextrait de vanille dans la crème fraîche\r\nmélange, transférer dans un bol et laisser refroidir.","Placer la ricotta dans un robot culinaire\r\net fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis ajoutez le\r\nmélange de crème fraîche et fouettez à nouveau.\r\nVersez-le sur la base du cheesecake.\r\nCouvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Passez un couteau sur les côtés de la boîte,\r\npuis défaites le clip et retirez-le. Transfert\r\ndans une assiette ou laissez le cheesecake sur le\r\nbase pour faciliter le service. Empilez le fudge\r\nflocons au centre et saupoudrer de glaçage\r\nsucre. Couvrir et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin."]','2026-01-11 00:02:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9805,8930,'fr','Tatins de banane au caramel salé et glace à la crème fraîche','La combinaison du caramel salé tendance avec un classique français donne un pudding individuel élégant qui pourrait orner n''importe quel menu de restaurant élégant.','["1 gousse de vanille","200 ml de crème fraîche","100 ml de lait","3 jaunes d''œufs","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","300 ml de crème fraîche entière","250 g de pâte feuilletée","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","1 banane, pelée","50 g de sucre roux clair et mou","50g de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche"]','["Pour faire la glace, fendez la vanille\r\ngousse en deux dans le sens de la longueur et grattez-la\r\nles graines. Mettez la gousse et les graines dans un\r\nune casserole avec la crème et le lait, et\r\nporter lentement à ébullition. Pendant ce temps, dans\r\nun bol, fouetter les jaunes d''oeufs et le sucre\r\nensemble jusqu''à pâle. Versez la crème chaude\r\nmélange sur l''œuf et le sucre, en fouettant\r\nen continu. Remettez dans la poêle, réservez\r\nà feu doux et remuez avec un bâton en bois\r\ncuillère. Chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que la crème anglaise\r\nle mélange épaissit suffisamment pour recouvrir le dos\r\nde la cuillère, puis retirer du feu.","Versez la crème fraîche dans un bol et\r\nfouetter pour desserrer. Versez lentement le chaud\r\nmélange de crème anglaise, en fouettant au fur et à mesure. Verser\r\nle mélange dans une sorbetière\r\net remuer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement congelé. Transférer à\r\nun récipient, puis congeler pendant 2 heures pour raffermir.","Pour réaliser les Tatins, étalez la pâte\r\nsur une surface farinée sur l''épaisseur d''une\r\nPièce de 1 £. En utilisant la banane comme guide, coupez\r\nsortir 2 couvercles à pâtisserie suffisamment grands pour tenir sur le\r\nbanane, en laissant une bordure de 1 cm autour du\r\nbord. Disposez la pâte sur une plaque allant au four\r\net mettre au réfrigérateur.","Placez un plat à fond épais allant au four.\r\npoêle à feu moyen. Ajoutez le\r\nsucre, beurre et crème, et laissez cuire\r\n5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit fondu et\r\nle caramel bouillonne. Ajouter ½ cuillère à café de mer\r\nflocons de sel. Coupez la banane en deux\r\ndans le sens de la longueur et placez les 2 moitiés,\r\ncôté coupé vers le bas, dans le caramel.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nPlacer un couvercle à pâtisserie sur chaque banane\r\nmoitié, en rentrant chacun fermement autour du\r\nbords. Cela peut être fait 1 heure à l''avance.\r\nTransférer la poêle au four et cuire\r\npendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit levée et\r\ndoré. Démoulez rapidement et soigneusement le\r\nTatins, parsemer de quelques flocons de mer\r\nsaler et servir avec des boules de crème\r\nglace fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:02:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9806,8932,'fr','Tartelette chocolat, noisettes & caramel au beurre salé','Un fond de pâtisserie au beurre avec une couche de caramel et juste un soupçon de sel, parsemé de noix et terminé par une garniture au fudge','["50 g de noisettes blanchies","200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","140 g de beurre froid coupé en dés","1 jaune d''oeuf","farine, pour saupoudrer","75 g de sucre en poudre","25g de beurre","100 ml de crème double","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","grosse pincée de flocons de sel marin","50 g de noisettes blanchies, grillées et hachées grossièrement","100g de chocolat noir (70%)","75g de beurre","2 gros œufs et 1 jaune","50 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao"]','["Pour réaliser la pâte, fouettez le\r\nnoisettes dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement\r\nsol. Ajoutez la farine, le sucre glace et\r\nbeurre et mélanger jusqu''à ce que le mélange\r\nressemble à de la chapelure. Ajouter l''oeuf\r\njaune et 1-2 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide, et le pouls\r\njusqu''à ce que la pâte se rassemble. Donnez un pourboire au\r\nétaler la pâte et l''aplatir en disque, puis\r\nenvelopper dans du film alimentaire et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nSur un plan fariné, étalez la pâte\r\npour tapisser un fond ample de 23 cm, profond\r\nmoule à tarte. Coupez les bords et piquez le\r\nbaser avec une fourchette, puis tapisser de cuisson\r\npapier sulfurisé et remplir de fèves au four.\r\nEnfourner 20 mn puis retirer délicatement\r\nles fèves au four et le papier sulfurisé et\r\ncuire encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger\r\ndoré. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le caramel au beurre salé.\r\nVersez le sucre dans une petite casserole, ajoutez\r\n1-2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et chauffer doucement pour dissoudre\r\nle sucre. Augmentez le feu et faites cuire\r\njusqu''à ce que le sucre prenne une couleur ambrée\r\ncaramel. Réduisez le feu et\r\najouter le beurre, la crème et le golden sirop,\r\net remuez jusqu''à ce que la sauce soit lisse et\r\népaissi. Retirer du feu et\r\najoutez le sel. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes,\r\npuis étalez-la sur le fond de tarte. Dispersion\r\navec les noisettes concassées et réserver.","Pour le fourrage au chocolat, faites fondre le\r\nchocolat et beurre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur\r\ndéposer sur une casserole d’eau frémissante. Remuer\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse, puis retirer du feu\r\net laisser refroidir légèrement. Dans un séparé\r\nbol, fouetter les œufs, le jaune d''œuf et la roulette\r\nsucre pendant environ 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et\r\npâle. Incorporer le chocolat fondu et\r\ncacao, puis verser dans le fond de tarte.\r\nTransférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire pendant\r\n20-25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit pris et que le dessus soit\r\nformait une croûte. Laisser refroidir dans la pièce\r\ntempérature avant de servir en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:02:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9807,8934,'fr','Tranche de milliardaire au caramel salé et beurre de cacahuète','Cette pâtisserie sablée populaire est placée dans une toute nouvelle ligue avec l''ajout d''une couche supplémentaire de gourmandise et d''une garniture au caramel salé.','["225 g de beurre coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour graisser","140 g de cacahuètes non salées, grillées et refroidies","225 g de farine nature","50g de farine de maïs","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","140g de beurre","225 g de beurre de cacahuète onctueux","140 g de sucre glace","2 boîtes de 397 g Carnation Carnation","1½ cuillère à café de sel de mer feuilleté ou ½ cuillère à café de sel de mer fin","3 barres de 100 g de chocolat noir brisées en petits morceaux","140 g de caramels mous au lait","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","½ cuillère à café de sel de mer feuilleté"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un rectangle de 20 x 30 cm.\r\nmoule à gâteau avec du papier sulfurisé – le\r\nla meilleure façon de le faire est d''utiliser 2 longues bandes\r\nde parchemin. Mettez les ingrédients pour\r\nla base dans un robot culinaire et blitz\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il commence à s''agglutiner – ne le faites pas\r\nt''inquiète si les cacahuètes sont encore un peu\r\ngros, ils ajouteront une belle texture.\r\nVersez sur votre plan de travail et pétrissez\r\nbrièvement pour former une pâte.\r\nPressez la pâte dans la base de votre\r\nétain en une couche uniforme. Enfourner 25 mn\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis laisser refroidir.","Pour faire la couche de beurre de cacahuète, faire fondre\r\nle beurre et le beurre de cacahuète dans un petit\r\ncasserole et mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Tamisez le\r\nsucre glace dans un bol, puis versez-y le\r\nmélange de beurre chaud et remuer pour combiner.\r\nPendant que le mélange est encore chaud, versez dessus\r\nla base et lisser avec une spatule.\r\nRéfrigérer pendant 2 heures jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris.","Pour réaliser la couche de caramel, mettez le\r\ncaramel et sel dans une casserole, porter à température\r\nfaire bouillir et laisser mijoter vigoureusement pendant 2-3 minutes,\r\nen fouettant continuellement, jusqu''à ce que la couleur\r\nassombrit une nuance ou deux et le caramel\r\ns''épaissit légèrement. Laisser le caramel\r\nlaisser refroidir pendant 20 minutes (voir conseils ci-dessous).\r\nUne fois refroidi, versez-le sur la cacahuète\r\ncouche de beurre et remettre au réfrigérateur pendant\r\nencore 2 heures.","Faire fondre le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur\r\ndéposer sur une casserole d’eau à peine frémissante.\r\nPendant ce temps, mettez les caramels et le lait\r\ndans une petite casserole et chauffer doucement. Ils\r\nva s''agglutiner et avoir du mal à fondre\r\nau début, mais continuez à chauffer et finalement\r\nils se transformeront en une sauce au caramel qui coule.","Sortez le moule du réfrigérateur et\r\nverser le chocolat sur le salé\r\ncouche de caramel, en inclinant le moule pour l''étaler\r\nle chocolat sur la surface. Utilisez un\r\ncuillère pour arroser rapidement le caramel\r\nle chocolat en un fin motif bouclé (ou\r\nvoir le conseil ci-dessous). Si le caramel commence à devenir\r\ntrop épais, ajoutez un peu plus de lait ou\r\ncrème et remettez-la sur le feu jusqu''à ce que\r\ncoulant. Saupoudrer de flocons de sel marin\r\net remettez la boîte au réfrigérateur pour qu''elle refroidisse\r\npendant 2 heures avant de trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:02:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9808,7931,'fr','Gâteau au caramel Chocca Mocca','Un délice à toute heure, mais surtout parsemé d''œufs en chocolat pour Pâques','["2 cuillères à café de grains/poudre de café instantané","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude","175g de beurre ramolli","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","200 g de farines autolevantes","4 cuillères à soupe de lait","0 2 x 50 g/2 x 2 oz de barres chocolat-caramel","100 g de tablettes chocolat-caramel","50g de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","100 g de sucre glace tamisé"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/Gaz 4/four ventilé 160°C. Beurrer un moule à gâteau rond de 20 cm et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé.","Mesurez le café et le cacao dans une tasse, ajoutez l''eau chaude et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Mettez le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, le sirop, la farine, le lait et la pâte de cacao dans un grand bol et battez avec une cuillère en bois ou un batteur électrique pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse.  Cassez les barres de caramel en tronçons et incorporez-les au mélange.","Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et lissez le dessus.  Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le dessus rebondisse lorsque vous appuyez légèrement dessus. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5 minutes, puis démouler, retirer le papier de doublure et laisser refroidir.","Pour faire le glaçage, cassez les barres de caramel et mettez-les dans une petite casserole avec le beurre et le lait.  Chauffer doucement jusqu''à consistance lisse, en remuant tout le temps, puis retirer du feu et incorporer le sucre glace (ne vous inquiétez pas s''il ne se dissout pas immédiatement, continuez simplement de remuer). Laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il épaississe suffisamment pour laisser une trace\r\nquand vous soulevez la cuillère. Disposez le gâteau sur une assiette de service, étalez le glaçage dessus en le laissant retomber doucement sur les côtés, puis laissez prendre."]','2026-01-11 00:02:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9809,8938,'fr','Cheesecakes à la crème et au caramel à l''orange','Il est préférable de préparer ces cheesecakes individuels quelques jours à l''avance afin que le caramel du ramequin se dissolve dans une sauce collante.','["Pot de 284 ml de crème double","éplucher 1 orange","225 g de sucre en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe de liqueur d''orange","Pot de 200 g de fromage frais","4 œufs","250g de biscuits digestifs","85 g de beurre fondu","100 g de sucre en poudre","huile de tournesol"]','["Chauffer le four à 150°C/chaleur tournante 130°/gaz 2. Dans une petite casserole, porter à ébullition la crème avec le zeste d''orange, puis laisser infuser. Versez 140 g de sucre dans une autre casserole avec juste assez d''eau pour le rendre boueux. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter pour obtenir un caramel foncé. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe de liqueur d''orange (attention, elle éclabousse). Laissez légèrement reposer, puis versez le caramel sur le fond de 6 ramequins de 250 ml et réservez.","Battre ensemble le fromage à la crème et les 85 g de sucre restants. \r\ndans un grand bol, puis incorporer les œufs et le reste de la liqueur d''orange. Filtrez la crème infusée, puis battez le tout pour obtenir une crème anglaise. Écumez toute mousse et réservez.","Faites bouillir la bouilloire. Placez les ramequins dans un plat à rôtir profond. Répartissez la crème anglaise entre eux – elle n''arrivera qu''à moitié – puis mettez le moule au four et remplissez-le d''eau chaude de \r\nla bouilloire pour qu''elle arrive à mi-hauteur de l''extérieur des plats du ramequin. Cuire les cheesecakes pendant 40 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient à peine pris, puis retirer du four et du moule. Laisser refroidir, puis mettre au frais \r\nau moins pendant la nuit. Ceux-ci peuvent être préparés jusqu’à 2 jours à l’avance et laissés au frais.","Jusqu''à 2 jours avant de servir, réalisez les bases. Émiettez les biscuits dans \r\nun robot culinaire, puis réduire en miettes fines. Ajoutez le beurre fondu et mélangez jusqu''à ce que tout soit mélangé. Ligne \r\nune plaque à pâtisserie plate recouverte de papier sulfurisé, versez dessus le mélange de base, puis recouvrez d''une autre feuille de papier sulfurisé. Étalez délicatement le mélange jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment grand pour en découper 6 fonds de la même taille que les ramequins. Froideur.","Pour réaliser les gribouillis au caramel, \r\nfaites chauffer le sucre avec un peu d''eau dans une casserole et faites bouillir pour obtenir un caramel, puis laissez refroidir légèrement. Ligne \r\nune plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé et graisser avec un peu d''huile. Versez le caramel de haut en bas pour que tout \r\nles brins de caramel collent ensemble \r\npour créer des étoiles, puis laissez reposer.","Pour servir, utilisez un emporte-pièce du même diamètre que le ramequin pour découper \r\n6 bases du mélange à biscuits. Ascenseur \r\nles bases sur 6 assiettes. Démoulez les cheesecakes en gardant la sauce caramel dans le ramequin. Garnir les fonds de crème caramels, arroser de sauce sur et autour des assiettes, décorer d''une étoile et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9810,8940,'fr','Profiteroles glacées à la vanille et au caramel','Remplies d''une riche glace à la vanille et nappées de sauce au caramel, ces profiteroles au caramel décadentes constituent un dessert spectaculaire.','["50g de beurre","60 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","2 oeufs, battus","200 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche","éclabousser du cognac","300g de glace vanille de bonne qualité, achetée ou faite maison (voir ci-dessous)","250 ml de lait","250 ml de crème fraîche","50g de sucre","6 jaunes d''œufs","graines de 2 gousses de vanille"]','["Mettez 150 ml d''eau, le beurre et une pincée de sel dans une poêle moyenne et faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le beurre fonde. Augmentez la chaleur\r\net porter à ébullition. Dès l’ébullition, versez la farine d’un seul coup. Battez rapidement pour combiner. CONSEIL : Il est important d’y verser la farine dès que l’eau bout, car perdre trop de liquide par évaporation nuirait à votre pâtisserie.","L’amidon contenu dans la farine doit être cuit maintenant. Bien battre, sur le feu, jusqu''à ce que le mélange devienne lisse et brillant et commence à se détacher du bord de la casserole. Versez le mélange dans un bol et laissez refroidir un peu.","Battez rapidement le mélange, puis commencez à ajouter les œufs petit à petit, à l''aide d''un fouet, d''une cuillère en bois ou de batteurs électriques. Vous n’aurez peut-être pas besoin d’ajouter tout l’œuf – arrêtez une fois que la pâte est lisse et élastique et qu’elle tombe facilement d’une cuillère.","Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7. Déposez une douille moyenne dans une grande poche à douille et versez-y la pâte. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier antiadhésif et déposer 15 boules de pâte de taille 10p sur chacune. Utilisez un doigt mouillé pour lisser le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et très fermes. Transférer sur une grille, retourner chacun d’eux, puis laisser refroidir. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 2 jours. CONSEIL : Les petits pains tout juste sortis du four ont un dessus pointu qui peut rapidement brûler. Tapotez-les doucement avec un doigt mouillé avant de les mettre au four.","Pour la sauce, faites chauffer le sucre dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Faites-le fondre doucement, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à dissolution. Augmentez un peu le feu, puis faites bouillonner jusqu''à obtenir un caramel doré foncé, environ 5 minutes au total. Gardez la casserole sur le feu et incorporez délicatement la crème pour obtenir une sauce soyeuse. Ajoutez le Cognac et remuez à nouveau. Verser dans un pichet de service. Peut être\r\npréparé jusqu''à 2 jours à l''avance – réchauffer au micro-ondes pendant quelques secondes et remuer pour détacher.","Si vous préparez votre propre glace, placez le lait et la crème double dans une casserole. Prenez 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre et ajoutez-la également à la poêle. Fouettez le sucre restant avec les jaunes d''oeufs et les graines de gousses de vanille. Faites chauffer le lait jusqu''à ébullition, puis versez-le sur le mélange d''œufs en fouettant constamment. Remettez dans la casserole et faites chauffer doucement en remuant avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que la crème épaississe et nappe le dos d''une cuillère. Passer au tamis et laisser refroidir. Maintenant, barattez le mélange dans une sorbetière ou congelez-le dans un récipient peu profond, en battant soigneusement au moins trois fois, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit congelé et lisse. Se conserve au congélateur jusqu''à 1 mois. Pour environ 500 ml, 5 min de préparation, 20 min de cuisson et congélation.","Laissez la glace ramollir légèrement au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes. Versez ensuite dans une poche à douille en tenant la poche avec\r\nun torchon, enfoncez la buse dans le fond de l''un des petits pains. Pocher la glace jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit complètement remplie (voir astuces). Travaillez le plus vite possible : vous devez remettre les profiteroles au congélateur avant que la glace ne commence à fondre. Se conserve bien emballé au congélateur jusqu''à 1 semaine. REMARQUE : Enrouler un torchon autour de la poche à douille isole la crème glacée de la chaleur de vos mains. Si le montage de la glace vous semble trop compliqué, coupez simplement les petits pains avec un couteau dentelé et remplissez-les de boules de glace de la taille d''une cuillère à café."]','2026-01-11 00:02:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9811,8942,'fr','Coupes de cheesecake ondulées au caramel','Pots à pudding individuels aux saveurs d''amande provenant de biscuits amaretti croquants associés à de la crème onctueuse et du caramel','["100 g de biscuits amaretti (environ 20)","400 g de fromage à pâte molle","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","6 cuillères à soupe de sauce caramel, nous avons utilisé Carnation, battu jusqu''à consistance lisse"]','["Écrasez les biscuits en grosses miettes et répartissez-les dans 4 ramequins ou petits verres.","Dans un bol, battez le fromage avec le sucre et la vanille puis ajoutez 4 cuillères à soupe de sauce et battez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque entièrement incorporé mais toujours légèrement strié. Versez délicatement sur les biscuits et lissez le dessus.","Versez le reste du caramel sur le dessus et utilisez une cuillère à café pour faire tourbillonner le dessus de la couche de fromage avec le caramel. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 2 heures mais jusqu''à 2 jours avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9812,8944,'fr','Sauce caramel','Cette sauce classique n''utilise que trois ingrédients. Arroser de poudings au chocolat ou de votre glace préférée','["250 g de sucre en poudre","Pot de 142 ml de crème double","50g de beurre"]','["Versez le sucre dans une friture à fond épais\r\ncasserole, incorporer 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau, puis placer dessus\r\nà feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous.\r\nAugmentez le feu et faites bouillonner pendant 4 à 5 minutes\r\njusqu''à obtenir du caramel. Retirez du feu,\r\npuis incorporez délicatement la crème et le beurre.\r\nLaissez refroidir la sauce, puis versez-la dans un\r\nbouteille pressable."]','2026-01-11 00:02:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9813,7941,'fr','Rayonne Miel','Faire votre propre caramel cendré nécessite un peu de soin et d’attention, mais cela en vaut la peine. Casser en éclats et disperser sur la glace et autres desserts','["beurre, pour graisser","200 g de sucre en poudre","5 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude"]','["Beurrer un moule carré de 20 cm de côté avec le beurre. Mélangez le sucre en poudre et le sirop dans une casserole profonde et remuez à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit fondu. Essayez de ne pas laisser bouillonner le mélange jusqu''à ce que les grains de sucre aient disparu. Une fois complètement fondu, augmentez un peu le feu et laissez mijoter jusqu''à l''obtention d''un caramel ambré (cela ne prendra pas longtemps), puis dès que possible, éteignez le feu, versez le bicarbonate et battez avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que tout disparaisse et que le mélange mousse. Versez immédiatement dans le moule, mais soyez prudent car le mélange sera très chaud.","Le mélange continuera à bouillonner dans le moule, laissez-le simplement et dans environ 1 h à 1 h 30, le nid d''abeille sera dur et prêt à s''effriter ou à se briser en morceaux."]','2026-01-11 00:02:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9814,8946,'fr','Coupes glacées au caramel et au chocolat','Accédez à votre placard et à votre congélateur pour créer ce somptueux mélange de crème glacée avec des cacahuètes salées, des biscuits et du caramel.','["100 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","200 ml de lait","300 g de caramel (nous avons utilisé Carnation)","85 g de beurre de cacahuète croquant","4 biscuits croquants, émiettés en morceaux (nous avons utilisé des biscuits croquants froissés au beurre Fox''s)","50 g de cacahuètes grillées salées et hachées","6 grosses boules de glace vanille","6 grosses boules de glace au chocolat"]','["Mettez le chocolat et 100 ml de lait dans un\r\npetite casserole, et mettez le caramel, la cacahuète\r\nbeurre et 100 ml de lait dans une autre casserole.\r\nFaire fondre doucement les deux, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants.\r\nLaisser refroidir.","Remuez bien les sauces pour les détendre,\r\npuis superposez les 2 sauces, les morceaux de biscuit,\r\ncacahuètes et glace dans 6 coupes glacées\r\ndes verres ou des bols et mangez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:02:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9815,8947,'fr','Caramel soufflés with caramel sauce','Les soufflés sont toujours un gagnant après le dîner, et ces friandises au caramel ne font pas exception.','["100 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de cassonade légère et molle, plus 4 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires","200 ml de crème fouettée","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 jaunes d''œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","3 blancs d''œufs"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nBeurrer 5 plats à soufflé individuels de 150 ml\r\nou des ramequins et saupoudrer le tout de\r\n2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade molle. Placer sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie. Faire fondre le beurre dans un\r\ncasserole, puis ajouter le sucre, la crème, la vanille\r\net une bonne pincée de sel. Quand le sucre est\r\nfondu, bouillonner pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce que cela ressemble à\r\nune sauce. Versez 200 ml dans un pichet pour servir.","Incorporer les jaunes d''œufs et la farine au reste\r\ncaramel dans la casserole. Fouetter constamment\r\nà feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe,\r\nenviron 3 minutes. Passer dans un bol et laisser refroidir\r\npendant 15 minutes. Battre les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol\r\njusqu''à consistance mousseuse, puis incorporer progressivement\r\n2 cuillères à soupe de sucre restant jusqu''à ce que les blancs soient\r\nraide mais pas sec. Pliez un tiers des blancs\r\ndans le mélange de caramel dans la poêle, puis incorporer\r\ncela revient dans les blancs. Diviser entre\r\nvaisselle et utilisez un couteau à palette pour gratter\r\nniveau supérieur. Cuire au four jusqu''à ce que les soufflés soient gonflés\r\net doré – environ 11 minutes. Les soufflés\r\ndevrait encore être un peu instable au milieu,\r\nmais pas liquide, donc si vous en servez quatre,\r\nEntrez dans votre testeur pour vérifier. Retour\r\nle reste au four pendant 2 minutes s''il n''est pas assez cuit.\r\nServir aussitôt avec une sauce caramel,\r\nréchauffé un peu pendant la cuisson des soufflés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9816,8948,'fr','Gâteau aux pommes et au caramel','Un gâteau moelleux surmonté d''une garniture collante et croustillante incitera vos invités à revenir pour en savoir plus','["175 g de beurre mou, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 œufs","225 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","4 cuillères à soupe rondes de yaourt grec","2 manger des pommes","50 g de noix hachées très grossièrement, plus 1 cuillère à soupe supplémentaire hachée","50 g de caramels mous (nous avons utilisé les caramels moelleux Werther''s)","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer un moule à pain de 2 lb et tapisser le fond et\r\nse termine par une longue bande de papier sulfurisé.","Battre ensemble le beurre, le sucre et\r\nvanille jusqu''à ce que pâle, puis incorporer les œufs,\r\nun par un. Verser la farine, la cannelle\r\net du yaourt. Peler, épépiner et hacher les pommes\r\nen petits morceaux, puis ajoutez-les au bol\r\net mélangez le tout avec un\r\ncuillère en bois.","Grattez dans le moule, lissez le dessus et\r\nrépartissez les noix au milieu.\r\nCuire au milieu du four pendant 1 h 20 à 30 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette enfoncée en ressorte propre.\r\nRefroidir dans le moule.","Pour décorer, mettez les caramels dans un petit\r\ncasserole avec la crème double. Doucement\r\nchauffer en remuant jusqu''à ce que les caramels soient fondus\r\ndans une sauce caramel onctueuse. Cool pour\r\nenviron 1 minute pendant que vous éteignez doucement le\r\ngâteau. Verser lentement la sauce au caramel\r\nle dessus du gâteau. Disperser immédiatement\r\navec les noix supplémentaires – elles devraient coller\r\noù ils ont frappé du caramel. Laisser poser 10 min\r\navant de servir. Meilleur frais mais se conserve\r\ndans une boîte hermétique pendant 3-4 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9817,8949,'fr','Gâteau Forêt-Noire de niveau supérieur','Retravaillez ce grand plaisir rétro avec une garniture plus épaisse et plus crémeuse et plus de chocolat pour un pur plaisir. C''est le dessert central parfait','["200 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour les moules","200 g de chocolat noir haché","300 g de farine nature","50 g de cacao en poudre tamisé, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","400 g de sucre mou roux clair","300 ml de yaourt nature","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","3 œufs","100 ml de sirop de cerises en pot (voir ci-dessous), complété avec de l''eau si nécessaire","2 cuillères à soupe de kirsch (facultatif)","150 g de chocolat noir réfrigéré","500 g de mascarpone","600 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","8 cuillères à soupe de confiture de cerises","2 x 370 pots de cerises noires égouttées et réservées au sirop (vous n''aurez peut-être pas besoin de toutes les cerises)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer le fond de deux moules à charnière de 20 cm de profondeur et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Faites fondre le beurre et le chocolat ensemble dans un bol résistant à la chaleur par petites rafales au micro-ondes ou sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau. Remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis réserver.","Mélangez la farine, le cacao, la levure chimique, le bicarbe, le sucre et ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol. Fouetter le yaourt, la vanille et les œufs dans un pichet jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez le mélange de yaourt et le mélange de chocolat fondu dans les ingrédients secs, puis mélangez pour obtenir une pâte épaisse.","Répartissez la pâte entre les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle lève et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Se conserve au frais et emballé jusqu''à trois jours ou congelé pendant trois mois. Coupez le dessus des éponges pour qu''elles reposent à plat.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sirop de cerise avec le kirsch, si vous en utilisez, et réservez. Se conserve au frais pendant trois jours. (Si vous préférez ne pas utiliser de kirsch, réservez le sirop de cerise tel quel.) Rasez le chocolat réfrigéré à l''aide d''un éplucheur de légumes et refroidissez à nouveau les flocons ou congelez-les sur une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser. Pour la garniture, battre ensemble le mascarpone, la crème, le sucre et la vanille jusqu''à obtenir des pics fermes à l''aide d''un fouet électrique.","Pour assembler, coupez chaque éponge en deux en passant par l''équateur afin d''avoir quatre couches égales. Fixez une couche sur une assiette de service ou un support à gâteau en utilisant un peu de crème fouettée. Badigeonner généreusement d''un peu de sirop, puis étaler sur la moitié de la confiture de cerises. Garnir d''une deuxième couche de génoise, badigeonner de sirop, puis étaler sur environ un quart de la crème fouettée. Disposez suffisamment de cerises dessus pour recouvrir juste la crème (en réservant 12 à 14 pour décorer), puis versez un peu plus de crème pour recouvrir les cerises. Garnir avec la troisième génoise, badigeonner de sirop et étaler sur le reste de la confiture, puis prendre en sandwich avec la dernière génoise, côté coupé vers le bas. Badigeonner du reste du sirop.","Verser environ un quart de la crème restante dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille étoile et réserver. Étalez le reste sur le dessus et les côtés du gâteau en le lissant avec une spatule. Placez le gâteau sur une assiette de service ou placez-le sur un grand plateau ou un plat, et pressez la plupart des copeaux de chocolat froids sur tout le côté du gâteau, en pressant à nouveau ceux qui tombent sur le plateau sur le gâteau pour qu''il soit entièrement enrobé. Répartissez dessus les copeaux de chocolat restants. Disposez 12 à 14 tourbillons de crème autour du bord supérieur, puis mettez une cerise sur chaque tourbillon. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à une journée."]','2026-01-11 00:02:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9818,8950,'fr','Gâteau aux cerises','Réunissez toutes les saveurs bien-aimées de la tarte Bakewell classique dans un gâteau époustouflant. C''est exactement ce qu''il vous faut pour une fête ou un thé l''après-midi','["300 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à café d''extrait d''amande","4 œufs moyens, à température ambiante (utilisez des œufs « jaune d''or » pour une génoise jaune plus riche)","75 ml de lait","150 g de farines autolevantes","150 g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","quelques amandes effilées grillées","380 g de beurre ramolli","650 g de sucre glace","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","2-3 cuillères à soupe de lait (facultatif)","goutte de colorant alimentaire rose","400 g de cerises, 12 avec les tiges attachées","300 g de confiture ou de confiture de cerises noires"]','["Beurrer trois moules à cake de 20 cm de diamètre et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Peser le beurre, le sucre et l''extrait d''amande dans un grand bol ou le bol d''un batteur sur socle, et battre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique (ou du batteur) pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse.","Fouettez les œufs et le lait dans un pichet et pesez la farine, la poudre d''amandes et la levure chimique dans un bol. Pendant que le moteur tourne, ajoutez le mélange d''œufs au mélange de beurre, petit à petit, en ajoutant une cuillerée de mélange de farine entre chaque ajout pour éviter qu''il ne se fende. Lorsque tout est incorporé, mélangez encore une minute jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse sans poches de farine.","Répartissez la pâte uniformément entre les moules. Cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. S''il reste des miettes humides, faites cuire encore 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 30 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille, retirer le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir complètement.","Pour la crème au beurre, battez le beurre, le sucre et l''extrait d''amande dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse et mousseuse, en ajoutant une goutte de lait s''il est trop ferme – il doit être tartinable (ou faites-le à l''aide d''un batteur sur socle). Verser environ un quart de la crème au beurre nature dans une poche à douille munie d''une grosse douille étoile. Ajoutez une goutte de colorant alimentaire rose au reste et battez jusqu''à obtenir une nuance de rose uniforme. Versez environ un autre quart de crème au beurre rose dans une poche à douille et coupez le bout.","Choisissez les 12 meilleures cerises avec leurs queues et réservez. Retirez les noyaux des cerises restantes, puis coupez-les en quartiers. Mélanger avec la confiture ou la confiture. Annuler.","Étalez un peu de crème au beurre rose sur une assiette de service ou un support à gâteau (cela permettra de maintenir le gâteau en place) et posez la première génoise dessus. Étalez dessus un peu de crème au beurre rose, puis dressez-en un cercle sur le pourtour (cela évitera que la confiture ne coule sur le côté). Versez la moitié du mélange de confiture au milieu. Répétez avec la deuxième génoise, plus de crème au beurre et le reste de la confiture. Sandwich avec la génoise finale. Réfrigérer pendant au moins 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme.","Lorsque le gâteau est ferme, recouvrez le dessus et les côtés d''une fine couche de crème au beurre rose, en le lissant à l''aide d''un couteau à palette ou d''une spatule – il s''agit d''une couche de miettes qui emprisonne les miettes. Réfrigérer encore 20 minutes.","Étalez le reste de crème au beurre rose sur le gâteau. Vous pouvez réchauffer le couteau à palette sous l''eau chaude, puis le sécher avant de le passer sur la crème au beurre pour une finition plus soignée, si vous le souhaitez. Disposez 10 à 12 rosaces sur le dessus du gâteau en cercle sur le pourtour à l''aide de la crème au beurre nature, puis décorez avec les cerises entières et les amandes effilées. Se conserve quatre jours dans un moule à cake."]','2026-01-11 00:02:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9819,8951,'fr','Gâteau maltais','Faites plaisir à l''enfant qui sommeille en vous avec ce riche gâteau au chocolat et au malt recouvert d''un glaçage au mascarpone. Décorer avec des copeaux de chocolat au lait, des pépites et des Maltesers','["80 g de beurre demi-sel coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","100 g de chocolat noir, au moins 70 % de cacao, haché grossièrement","50g de cacao en poudre","80 g de poudre de boisson au chocolat malté","250 g de farine nature","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 œufs , battus","250 ml de babeurre","200 ml de café infusé","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","400 g de chocolat noir, au moins 70 % de cacao, haché grossièrement","50 g de poudre de boisson au chocolat malté","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","50g de beurre salé","400 ml de crème fraîche","150 g de mascarpone","copeaux de chocolat au lait","pépites","Maltesers"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond et les côtés de 2 moules à cake ronds de 20 cm. Versez le beurre et le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Placez le bol au-dessus d''une casserole remplie d''eau frémissante en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau. Remuer régulièrement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu puis retirer du feu. Alternativement, vous pouvez faire fondre au micro-ondes par rafales de 20 secondes, en remuant régulièrement.","Tamisez la poudre de cacao et la poudre de boisson au chocolat maltée dans un grand bol. Ajoutez la farine, le sucre, le bicarbonate et la levure chimique ainsi qu''une grosse pincée de sel et fouettez ensemble. Dans un pichet, fouettez ensemble les œufs, le babeurre, le café et la vanille, puis versez dans les ingrédients secs. Bien fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis verser le chocolat fondu et mélanger pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Répartir dans les moules et cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Réserver sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à deux jours.","Pour faire le glaçage, versez le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et réservez. Versez la poudre de boisson maltée, le sucre, le beurre et la crème dans une casserole et faites chauffer à feu moyen-doux. Faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le sucre et le beurre soient fondus, puis versez le tout sur le chocolat en fouettant bien. Si le chocolat n''a pas fondu, remplissez la casserole avec l''eau chaude de la bouilloire et placez le bol sur le dessus, puis fouettez à nouveau. À l''aide de batteurs électriques, battre le mélange jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et brillant, puis ajouter le mascarpone et continuer de battre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Laisser refroidir à température ambiante (il épaissira en refroidissant).","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à assembler, placez l''un des gâteaux sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette de service, puis versez-y un peu de glaçage refroidi, en l''étalant uniformément sur le gâteau. Sandwich avec l''autre génoise, puis recouvrez-en le reste du glaçage, en l''étalant abondamment sur le dessus et les côtés du gâteau. Éparpillez quelques copeaux de chocolat au lait, des pépites et des Maltesers® pour décorer. Restera couvert jusqu’à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9820,8952,'fr','Tarte au cheesecake à la citrouille et aux pacanes','Régalez-vous avec notre tarte au cheesecake avec une pâtisserie maison, une garniture à la citrouille et une garniture aux pacanes. C''est un dessert parfait pour l''automne','["250 g de farine nature + un peu pour saupoudrer","125 g de beurre froid coupé en morceaux","50 g de sucre en poudre","1 noix de muscade entière, à râper","2 œufs, plus 1 jaune d''œuf (congelez le blanc supplémentaire pour l''utiliser dans une autre recette)","Boîte de 425 g de purée de potiron","150 g de sucre mou roux clair","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","250 g de fromage à pâte molle","125 g de moitiés de noix de pécan","50 ml de sirop d''érable"]','["Mélangez la farine et le beurre dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine, puis incorporez le sucre en poudre et quelques râpées de muscade. Incorporez le jaune d’œuf et suffisamment d’eau froide (environ 1 cuillère à soupe) pour créer une pâte ferme. Verser dans un bol, couvrir et réfrigérer au moins 20 minutes. Vous pouvez également frotter le beurre dans la farine dans un grand bol du bout des doigts, puis incorporer le sucre, la muscade, le jaune d''œuf et l''eau.","Étalez la pâte réfrigérée sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement plus grande qu''un moule à tarte cannelé à fond libre de 22 cm, puis utilisez-la pour tapisser le moule. Piquer le fond partout à l''aide d''une fourchette, puis mettre au frais 20 min.","Environ 5 minutes avant que la pâte ait fini de refroidir, chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur, puis tapissez-la d''un morceau de papier sulfurisé et remplissez-la de fèves au four ou de riz ou de lentilles non cuites. Cuire au four pendant 12 minutes, puis retirer les haricots et le papier sulfurisé et cuire encore 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit légèrement dorée.","Pendant ce temps, mélanger la purée de potiron, 2 œufs, la cassonade légère, la cannelle, le gingembre et le fromage à pâte molle. Râpez environ ½ cuillère à café de muscade, mélangez bien, puis versez la garniture dans le fond de tarte. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit légèrement prise avec une légère oscillation au milieu. Disposez les pacanes sur la garniture en cercles concentriques, puis badigeonnez-les de sirop d''érable. Remettre au four encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les noix de pécan soient légèrement dorées et que la garniture soit prise. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule avant de démouler et de servir. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9821,8953,'fr','Gâteau aux pistaches','Essayez ce gâteau à la pistache léger et moelleux, garni de crème de pistache sucrée, de framboises fraîches, de noix concassées et de zeste de citron vert.','["250 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de pistaches hachées grossièrement","80 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","225 g de sucre en poudre","4 œufs , à température ambiante","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100g de sucre glace","250 g de mascarpone","200 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de pâte de pistache","400g de framboises","1 citron vert non ciré, zesté"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à charnière de 23 cm. Versez 150 g de pistaches dans un robot culinaire et mixez-les jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement moulues. Versez dans un bol et mélangez la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel. Battre le beurre et le sucre dans un autre bol jusqu''à consistance mousseuse et pâle, environ 5 minutes. Cassez les œufs un à un en battant bien pendant 1 min après chaque ajout, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tous ajoutés. Incorporer la vanille, puis incorporer délicatement le mélange de farine. Verser délicatement dans le moule préparé et cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille dans le moule.","Pendant ce temps, tamisez le sucre glace dans un bol, puis versez-y le mascarpone, la crème fraîche et la pâte de pistache. Battre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis réserver au réfrigérateur pendant 20 à 30 minutes pour épaissir jusqu''à obtenir une consistance de cuillère.","Coupez le gâteau refroidi en deux horizontalement à l''aide d''un couteau dentelé, vous obtenez ainsi deux couches. Disposez la couche inférieure sur une assiette ou un support à gâteau et étalez dessus une généreuse cuillerée de crème à la pistache. Garnir d’une généreuse poignée de framboises pour recouvrir le gâteau. Garnir avec l''autre moitié de génoise, puis recouvrir le dessus et les côtés du gâteau avec le reste de crème. Répartir le reste des framboises, le reste des pistaches et le zeste de citron vert pour servir. Se conservera au frais dans un récipient hermétique pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9822,8954,'fr','Tarte à la boue Tahini Mississippi','Essayez notre version de ce dessert classique des États-Unis : il est idéal à préparer à l''avance, garni de cassants au sésame pour un superbe pud central','["300 g de biscuits au bourbon","100 g de beurre fondu","125 g de chocolat noir (70 % de cacao), cassé en petits morceaux","125g de beurre doux","175 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 œufs","100 g de tahin","75 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre","250 g de crème anglaise à la vanille","75 g de chocolat noir (70 % de cacao), cassé en petits morceaux","350 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de tahin","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","cassant au sésame, pour décorer"]','["Mettez les biscuits dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en miettes, ou versez-les dans un bol et écrasez-les doucement avec le bout d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Incorporer le beurre fondu. Versez dans un moule à tarte cannelé profond de 26 cm et utilisez une cuillère pour presser les miettes dans le fond et sur les côtés du moule à tarte en vous assurant qu''il est compact et qu''il n''y a pas d''espace. Laisser refroidir au réfrigérateur.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Faire fondre le chocolat et le beurre dans un bol au micro-ondes par rafales de 30 secondes, en remuant régulièrement jusqu''à consistance lisse, ou dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante (en veillant à ce que le bol ne touche pas l''eau). Dans un autre bol, battre le sucre et les œufs avec un fouet électrique pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse.","Versez le mélange de chocolat et le tahini dans le mélange de sucre et d''œufs. Tamisez la farine, le cacao en poudre et ½ cuillère à café de sel sur les ingrédients humides, puis mélangez délicatement le tout en faisant attention de ne pas faire sortir trop d''air. Versez le mélange de brownies dans le fond de tarte et disposez-le sur une plaque allant au four (un peu de beurre pourrait suinter du moule). Cuire au milieu du four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit à peine pris – il doit encore vaciller au centre. Laisser refroidir à température ambiante pendant environ 2 heures.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Mettez la crème anglaise et le chocolat dans une casserole et faites cuire à feu moyen en remuant jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Étalez la crème au chocolat sur la couche de brownie. Réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme.","Fouettez ensemble la crème, 1 cuillère à soupe de tahini et le sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''elle forme des pics mous. Empilez-les sur la tarte et décorez-les avec le croustillant au sésame. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9823,8955,'fr','Gâteau aux carottes et à l''ananas','Préparez ce gâteau tropical économique avec de l''ananas frais ou en conserve. Si vous utilisez du frais, décorez avec des « fleurs » d’ananas pour un effet wow.','["175 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour la boîte","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","300 g de sucre mou roux clair","3 œufs","100 ml de lait","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de carottes râpées","200 g d''ananas en boîte et égoutté ou frais, jus réservé, haché finement","75 g de noix hachées (facultatif)","fleurs d''ananas, pour servir (facultatif ; voir la recette ci-dessous)","100g de beurre","275 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","150 g de fromage à pâte molle entière"]','["Huiler un moule à cake de 23 cm sur au moins 7 cm de profondeur, puis tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger la farine, le bicarbonate de soude, les épices et le sucre dans un grand bol avec ¼ de cuillère à café de sel. Du bout des doigts, frottez le mélange farineux pendant quelques minutes pour éliminer les morceaux de sucre dans la farine.","Fouetter l''huile, les œufs, le lait et l''extrait de vanille dans un pichet et verser dans les ingrédients secs. Ajoutez la carotte râpée, l''ananas haché et les noix (si vous en utilisez), puis pliez le tout à l''aide d''une aspatule.","Versez le mélange dans le moule et nivelez le dessus avec la spatule. Cuire au four pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Si du mélange à gâteau cru colle dessus, remettez au four pendant 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille et verser 1 cuillère à soupe de jus d''ananas (si vous utilisez de l''ananas en conserve) sur la génoise. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Pour réaliser le glaçage, battez ensemble le beurre et la moitié du sucre glace, à la main ou à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Ajoutez le reste du sucre glace et la vanille et battez encore quelques minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez le fromage à pâte molle. Mettez le gâteau sur une assiette ou un support à gâteau et empilez le glaçage dessus. Disposez les fleurs d''ananas dessus, si vous en utilisez (voir ci-dessous pour la recette). Se conservera dans un récipient hermétique dans un endroit frais pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9824,8956,'fr','Gâteau tres leches au pain d''épices','Donnez à ce gâteau d''inspiration mexicaine une touche festive en utilisant du gingembre et de la cannelle. Le gâteau est trempé dans un trio de laits sucrés, puis garni de chantilly','["huile sans saveur, pour la boîte","4 œufs , séparés","200 g de sucre muscovado","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, plus une pincée","100 ml de lait","410 g de lait concentré","200 ml de lait concentré sucré, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","300 ml de crème fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler un moule à charnière de 23 cm de diamètre et d''au moins 6 cm de profondeur et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé. Mettez les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol avec une pincée de sel et battez à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient mousseux, environ 3 minutes. Ajoutez lentement 150 g de sucre, une cuillerée à la fois, en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et brillant.","Mélangez les jaunes d''œufs, le reste du sucre et la vanille dans un deuxième bol pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter la farine, la levure chimique, les épices et le lait, puis mélanger à l''aide d''une spatule.","Ajoutez une grande cuillerée de blancs d''œufs battus à la pâte à gâteau, battez pour desserrer, puis incorporez le reste des blancs d''œufs à l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal (ne mélangez pas trop, sinon vous éliminerez l''air) jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Versez le tout dans le moule, lissez la surface et enfournez pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Mélangez les laits concentrés et concentrés avec 50 ml de crème double.","Laissez le gâteau refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 à 15 minutes, puis retournez-le délicatement sur une assiette de service ou un support à gâteau et retirez le papier sulfurisé. (Assurez-vous d''utiliser une assiette ou un support avec un léger rebord pour récupérer l''excès de lait.) Laisser refroidir encore 10 minutes.","Percez des trous sur le gâteau avec un cure-dent et, pendant qu''il est encore chaud, versez lentement dessus environ un quart du mélange de lait. Laissez le gâteau absorber cela avant d''en ajouter davantage, puis répétez jusqu''à ce que tout le mélange de lait soit épuisé – si le gâteau devient saturé avant d''avoir utilisé tout le lait, versez ce qui reste dans un pichet et servez-le plus tard avec le gâteau pour le verser. Ce processus peut prendre quelques heures, mais dès que le gâteau est refroidi, vous devez le transférer au réfrigérateur. Une fois que tout le lait a été absorbé, réfrigérez encore 2 heures, ou toute la nuit, pour refroidir et améliorer la texture.","Fouettez le reste de la crème et les 2 cuillères à soupe de lait concentré jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous. Verser sur le gâteau refroidi, puis saupoudrer d''une pincée de cannelle. Se conservera au frais pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9825,8957,'fr','Gâteau glacé aux pommes de pin','Créez cette superbe pâtisserie pour la table de Noël. Décoré de pommes de pin aux amandes, c''est une pièce maîtresse parfaite si vous n''êtes pas fan du gâteau aux fruits traditionnel.','["250 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de yaourt nature","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","4 œufs","300 g de farines autolevantes","150g de confiture d''abricots","150 g de pâte d''amande","100 g d''amandes effilées grillées","poudre de cacao, pour saupoudrer","200g de beurre","500 g de sucre glace","75 ml de lait","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","1 blanc d''oeuf","100 g de sucre en poudre","8 brins de romarin","50 g de canneberges"]','["Beurrer deux moules à gâteau rond à fond meuble de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse, environ 2 minutes.","Mélangez le yaourt, l''huile, la vanille et les œufs dans un pichet. Ajouter la farine et les ingrédients humides au mélange de beurre, ainsi qu''une pincée de sel. Mélangez le tout pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse.","Répartissez la pâte dans les moules et nivelez les surfaces avec une spatule. Cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. S''il y a du mélange humide, remettez les génoises au four pendant encore 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 15 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidies, les génoises se conservent dans une boîte hermétique pendant cinq jours ou bien emballées et congelées pendant trois mois.","Faites ensuite les décorations. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Fouettez légèrement le blanc d''oeuf et mettez le sucre semoule dans un plat. Pliez les brins de romarin en courbes – cela les aidera à s’asseoir autour de la base du gâteau. Badigeonnez ou trempez les brins de romarin et les canneberges dans le blanc d''œuf, puis enrobez-les de sucre. Secouez l''excédent, puis posez sur la plaque et laissez sécher au moins 1 h.","Pour faire les pommes de pin aux amandes, divisez la pâte d''amande en cinq morceaux et roulez chacun en forme d''œuf. En commençant par l’extrémité la plus large, pressez les amandes effilées dans la pâte d’amande en biais pour les faire ressembler à une pomme de pin. Couvrez ainsi un côté de chaque boule de pâte d''amande en prenant soin de ne pas casser les éclats d''amandes. Disposez les pommes de pin en pâte d''amande sur une plaque et saupoudrez légèrement de cacao en poudre.","Pour faire la crème au beurre, battre le beurre, le sucre glace, le lait, la vanille et l''extrait d''amande dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou au batteur sur socle jusqu''à consistance lisse et crémeuse, environ 3 minutes.","Placez un gâteau sur une assiette à gâteau et étalez-le sur environ 6 cuillères à soupe de crème au beurre à l''aide d''un couteau à palette. Garnir de confiture d''abricots, puis prendre en sandwich le deuxième gâteau dessus.","Empilez le reste de la crème au beurre sur le gâteau et étalez-la sur le dessus et les côtés. Ce gâteau est plus beau avec un glaçage de style « nu ». Pour créer cela, grattez la majeure partie de la crème au beurre sur les côtés à l''aide d''un couteau à palette afin que le gâteau soit légèrement visible à travers une fine couche de crème au beurre. Nettoyer l''assiette sur le pourtour du gâteau à l''aide d''une feuille de papier absorbant.","Disposez les brins de romarin givrés autour de la base du gâteau et recouvrez de pommes de pin et de canneberges givrées. Se conserve dans une boîte hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9826,8958,'fr','Gâteau au spéculoos facile','Vous aimez les biscuits au spéculoos ? Transformez-les dans ce gâteau qui profite également des spéculoos tartinés dans le glaçage. Ce sera certainement un favori de la famille !','["175 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","175 g de sucre mou roux clair","150 g de pâte à tartiner spéculoos","50g de yaourt nature","4 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","175 g de farines autolevantes","4 cuillères à soupe de caramel ou de dulce de leche","6 biscuits spéculoos grossièrement écrasés","200 g de beurre doux","400 g de sucre glace","100 g de pâte à tartiner spéculoos"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser le fond de deux moules à cake de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse, environ 2 minutes. Ajouter la pâte à tartiner et battre à nouveau pour combiner.","Mélangez le yaourt, les œufs et la vanille dans un pichet, puis ajoutez-le avec la cannelle, la farine et une pincée de sel. Battre pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné. Répartissez entre les moules, nivelez le dessus à l''aide d''une spatule et faites cuire au milieu du four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et doré, ou qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre - s''il reste de la pâte humide, faites cuire encore 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser reposer 15 minutes dans les moules, puis démouler sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pour le glaçage, battre le beurre, la moitié du sucre et toute la pâte à tartiner ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez le reste du sucre et battez à nouveau. Réchauffez le caramel au micro-ondes pendant 30 secondes pour le détendre. Sandwichez les deux génoises ensemble en utilisant la moitié du glaçage et un filet de caramel, puis étalez le reste du glaçage sur le dessus et les côtés. Arroser du reste de caramel et saupoudrer de biscuits écrasés. Se conserve dans un moule à cake jusqu''à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9827,8959,'fr','Gâteau au cidre de pomme épicé','Ajoutez du piment de la Jamaïque, des clous de girofle et de la muscade à ce gâteau au cidre de pomme pour un peu de chaleur automnale. Des pommes Bramley sont ajoutées au mélange de génoise et le tout est garni de pacanes croquantes.','["125 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","250 ml de cidre de pomme","1 cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","1 cuillère à café de muscade moulue","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","grosse pincée de clous de girofle moulus","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","75 ml de yaourt nature à la grecque","250 g de pommes Bramley pelées, évidées et hachées","125 g de sucre glace tamisé","30 g de noix de pécan hachées"]','["Beurrer un moule à cake rond de 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Versez le cidre dans une casserole, portez à ébullition et laissez bouillir rapidement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit réduit à environ 100 ml, soit de moitié environ. Cool. Mélangez les épices en réservant 1 cuillère à café du mélange pour le glaçage. Mélangez le reste avec la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble dans un batteur sur socle ou à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien entre chaque ajout. Incorporer la vanille, le yaourt et 75 ml de cidre réduit. Enfin, incorporez le mélange de farine et les pommes jusqu''à ce qu''il ne reste plus de traces de farine. Verser dans le moule préparé et lisser la surface. Cuire au four pendant 55 minutes à 1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 20 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Une fois complètement refroidi, le gâteau peut être emballé et congelé jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler complètement avant de glacer et de servir comme ci-dessous.","Une fois le gâteau refroidi, fouettez les 25 ml de cidre réduit restant avec le sucre glace et le mélange d''épices réservé jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire pour obtenir un glaçage épais et en filet. Versez-le sur le gâteau en le laissant couler sur le côté. Saupoudrez les noix de pécan hachées, en forme d''anneau si vous le souhaitez, et laissez le glaçage prendre avant de servir. Se conservera dans un récipient hermétique dans un endroit frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9828,8960,'fr','Cheesecake à la pistache','Savourez une version persane du cheesecake de la lectrice de Good Food, Amani Al-Sitrawi, qui partage cette recette de dessert inspirée d''un cadeau de son frère.','["500 g de fromage à pâte molle","225 g de sucre en poudre","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de crème sure","3 œufs","40 g de pistaches hachées","4 cuillères à soupe de crème de pistache fondue","40 g de pistaches moulues","400 g de biscuits digestifs écrasés","140g de beurre fondu"]','["Chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et placez un plat allant au four à moitié rempli d''eau sur la grille du bas. Pour la base, mélangez les digestifs et le beurre fondu dans un bol, puis versez dans un moule à charnière profond de 23 cm. Appuyez sur la base et sur les côtés à l''aide d''une spatule. Réserver sur une plaque à pâtisserie.","Fouetter ensemble le fromage, le sucre, la maïzena, la vanille et la crème sure, puis ajouter les œufs, un à la fois, en battant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse. Incorporez les pistaches concassées, puis versez la garniture sur le fond. Cuire au four sur la grille du milieu pendant 10 minutes, puis réduire le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2 et cuire encore 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris avec une légère oscillation au milieu. Éteignez le four et laissez le cheesecake à l''intérieur avec la porte entrouverte pendant 30 minutes (pour éviter les fissures). Laisser refroidir complètement, puis réfrigérer 24 heures. Verser sur la crème de pistaches et saupoudrer de pistaches moulues pour servir. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9829,8961,'fr','Gâteau à la limonade aux fraises','Épatez vos invités avec ce gâteau de célébration époustouflant. Il a un goût de limonade à la fraise, avec des génoises imbibées de sirop de citron, un glaçage au cheesecake, des citrons confits et des bonbons éclatants.','["225 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","225 g de sucre en poudre","4 œufs moyens","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","75g de yaourt nature","2 citrons non cirés","500g de fraises","1 cuillère à soupe de bonbons éclatants (facultatif)","1 citron non ciré","75 g de sucre en poudre","250 g de beurre ramolli","600 g de sucre glace","180 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","10 g de poudre de fraise ou de framboise lyophilisée (voir astuce ci-dessous)"]','["Beurrer deux moules à gâteau à fond amovible de 20 cm et tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Versez le beurre et le sucre en poudre dans un batteur sur socle et battez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ou faites-le à l’aide d’un fouet électrique. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant entre chaque ajout.","Ajoutez la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel et mélangez à nouveau, puis le yaourt. Zestez les deux citrons, ajoutez-les et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Vous devrez peut-être gratter les parois du bol au fur et à mesure.","Répartissez la pâte à gâteau entre les moules préparés et lissez les surfaces avec une aspatule. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidis, les gâteaux peuvent être emballés et congelés jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler toute la nuit avant de glacer.","Pour le zeste de citron confit, utilisez un épluche-légumes pour retirer le zeste du citron restant en longues et fines lanières. Utilisez un petit couteau bien aiguisé pour couper la peau blanche de la peau, puis coupez-la en lanières plus fines. Mettez 50 g de sucre semoule dans une petite casserole avec 100 ml d''eau. Pressez les trois citrons et versez-les dans la poêle. Portez le mélange à ébullition, réduisez le feu et laissez cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Versez les lanières de zeste de citron, puis remettez à ébullition, réduisez à nouveau le feu et laissez mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le zeste soit tendre. Versez les 25 g de sucre restant dans un bol. Retirez le zeste de citron du sirop à l''aide d''une fourchette et ajoutez-le au bol de sucre. Secouez doucement le bol pour enrober les lanières de zeste, puis secouez l''excédent et disposez les zestes confits sur une assiette ou une plaque à pâtisserie en une seule couche pour qu''ils sèchent, environ 30 minutes. Une fois pris, les écorces confites se conserveront dans un récipient hermétique dans un endroit frais pendant six mois.","Versez 3 cuillères à soupe de sirop de citron sur chacune des génoises refroidies. Pour le glaçage, battez le beurre au batteur sur socle jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et crémeux, ou faites-le à l''aide d''un fouet électrique. Ajoutez la moitié du sucre glace et la moitié du fromage à pâte molle, puis battez à nouveau. Ajoutez le reste du sucre glace et du fromage à pâte molle ainsi que la majeure partie de la poudre de fraise lyophilisée (en réservant 1 cuillère à café pour la décoration plus tard) et battez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Décortiquez et hachez finement 200 g de fraises. Placez l''une des génoises sur une assiette à gâteau et étalez-la généreusement sur le glaçage. Répartir uniformément quelques fraises hachées et déposer la deuxième génoise dessus. Versez le reste du glaçage sur le dessus et utilisez un couteau à palette pour l''étaler sur tout le dessus et les côtés, en le lissant et en le faisant tourbillonner au fur et à mesure. Tranchez finement cinq ou six fraises de taille similaire, puis disposez-les autour de la base du gâteau, les extrémités pointues vers le haut. Coupez la moitié des fraises restantes en deux, en laissant le reste entier avec leurs tiges intactes, et empilez le tout sur le gâteau. Répartir sur le zeste de citron confit, la poudre de fraise lyophilisée réservée et les bonbons éclatants, le cas échéant. Mieux consommé dans la journée, mais se conserve au frais jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9830,8962,'fr','Gâteau de fête au chocolat et à la vanille','Terminez le week-end de Pâques avec ce superbe gâteau époustouflant. Les génoises ont encore meilleur goût après un jour ou deux, c''est donc une excellente recette pour prendre de l''avance','["225 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour les boîtes","300 g de farine nature","100g de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","400 g de sucre mou roux clair","300 ml de lait","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin blanc","100 ml de café fort ou expresso, refroidi","2 cuillères à café d''extrait ou de pâte de vanille","3 œufs moyens","400 g de beurre, à température ambiante","800 g de sucre glace","2 cuillères à café d''extrait ou de pâte de vanille","4-5 cuillères à soupe de lait","pâtes colorantes alimentaires","fleurs comestibles, dragées pastel ou œufs en chocolat"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler trois moules à cake de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Peser la farine, le cacao en poudre, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate et le sucre dans un grand bol, ajouter une pincée de sel et fouetter délicatement pour mélanger. Secouez le bol pour faire remonter les morceaux de sucre à la surface et pressez-les du bout des doigts.","Mesurez l''huile, le lait, le vinaigre, le café et la vanille dans un pichet, puis ajoutez les œufs et fouettez pour mélanger. Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs et remuez avec un fouet jusqu''à consistance lisse, en vous assurant qu''il n''y a pas de poches de farine au fond du bol – le mélange sera assez liquide. Répartissez la pâte uniformément entre les moules préparés, puis faites cuire sur la grille du milieu du four (ou au milieu et en haut s''ils ne tiennent pas tous sur une seule grille) pendant 25 minutes. Échangez les moules et faites cuire encore 5 minutes.","Vérifiez que les gâteaux sont cuits en insérant une brochette au centre de chacun – si de la pâte humide adhère à la brochette, remettez les moules au four pendant encore 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 30 minutes, puis retourner les génoises sur des grilles pour qu''elles refroidissent complètement. Si vous les préparez à l''avance, enveloppez bien les génoises refroidies et conservez-les dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à trois jours, ou au congélateur jusqu''à deux mois.","Pour la crème au beurre, battre le beurre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou au batteur sur socle pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse. Ajoutez la moitié du sucre glace et mélangez à nouveau. Ajoutez le reste du sucre glace, la vanille et 4 cuillères à soupe de lait et battez à nouveau pour combiner, en ajoutant un peu de lait si nécessaire pour obtenir une crème au beurre onctueuse et moelleuse. Répartir dans trois bols. Ajoutez quelques gouttes de pâte colorante alimentaire différente dans chaque bol, puis mélangez bien – nous avons utilisé du rose pastel, du violet et du jaune.","Versez les mélanges de crème au beurre colorée dans trois poches à douille séparées et coupez les pointes. Versez un point de crème au beurre sur un support à gâteau ou une planche et placez une éponge dessus pour aider à la maintenir en place. Déposez de petites gouttes de crème au beurre violette sur tout le dessus de la génoise en tenant la poche à douille directement au-dessus du gâteau, à environ ½ cm de la surface, et en pressant la poche tout en tirant vers le haut pour créer un petit pic.","Posez la deuxième génoise dessus, puis répétez l''opération avec la crème au beurre rose. Ajoutez la troisième génoise par-dessus, puis déposez soigneusement des gouttes de crème au beurre jaune sur la surface. Décorez avec des fleurs comestibles, des dragées ou des mini œufs en chocolat, si vous le souhaitez. Se conserve dans une boîte à température ambiante jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9831,8963,'fr','Fenêtre Gâteau Rose & Pistache (« Gâteau Fenêtre »)','Impressionnez vos amis avec ce gâteau coloré de style Battenberg à la rose et à la pistache. Non seulement il a un goût délicieux, mais il est également merveilleux dans le cadre d''un thé à tartiner l''après-midi.','["175 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","175 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs","175 g de farines autolevantes","50 g de pistaches moulues au mixeur","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire vert et rose","2-4 cuillères à soupe de lait","50g d''amandes moulues","quelques gouttes d''essence de rose","100-150g de confiture d''abricots","sucre glace et sucre en poudre, pour saupoudrer","400 g de pâte d''amande","quelques pistaches concassées et pétales de roses séchées, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule carré de 20 cm. Découpez une feuille de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif en rectangle de 40 x 20 cm. Pliez en deux pour que les extrémités courtes se rejoignent, puis abaissez-les au milieu de la boîte, en vous assurant que le pli dépasse pour diviser la boîte en deux parties égales, mesurant chacune 20 x 10 cm. Le parchemin doit dépasser légèrement des deux côtés.","Battre le beurre et le sucre au batteur sur socle ou dans un bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs un à un, en ajoutant une cuillère à soupe de farine avec le dernier œuf pour éviter qu''il ne caille. Incorporez délicatement le reste de la farine à l’aide d’une cuillère en métal.","Grattez la moitié du mélange à gâteau dans un bol séparé. Ajoutez les pistaches moulues dans l''un des bols avec le colorant alimentaire vert et 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe de lait et mélangez. Le mélange doit former une consistance goutte à goutte. S''il est trop ferme, ajoutez une goutte de lait supplémentaire. Ajoutez les amandes moulues dans l’autre bol de mélange avec 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe de lait, le colorant alimentaire rose et l’essence de rose (n’ajoutez pas plus de ¼ de cuillère à café sinon la saveur de rose sera trop forte). Le mélange rose doit avoir la même consistance que le vert.","Versez les différents mélanges dans les différentes sections du moule à cake et égalisez le dessus à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu de chaque gâteau en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement avant de démouler à l''aide du papier sulfurisé.","Nivelez le dessus des deux gâteaux à l''aide d''un couteau dentelé et coupez les bords pour que les deux aient la même taille. Coupez les deux gâteaux en deux dans le sens de la longueur pour obtenir deux longs morceaux de gâteau rose et deux de vert.","Étalez de la confiture d''abricots sur toute la longueur d''un morceau vert et d''un rose, puis collez-les ensemble. Étalez davantage de confiture d''abricots dessus et sur un côté long de chacun des morceaux restants. Placez le morceau vert sur le rose et le rose sur le vert, en utilisant à nouveau la confiture comme colle. Badigeonner le dessus du gâteau avec plus de confiture.","Saupoudrez de sucre glace sur un plan de travail propre et étalez la pâte d''amande en un rectangle suffisamment grand pour enfermer le gâteau (environ 20 x 35 cm). Utilisez le rouleau à pâtisserie pour décoller la pâte d''amande, puis brossez le sucre glace et saupoudrez de sucre en poudre sur votre plan de travail. Posez la pâte d''amande sur le sucre en poudre avec l''une des extrémités les plus longues la plus proche de vous.","Placez délicatement le gâteau, côté confiture vers le bas, au milieu de la pâte d''amande, dans le sens de la longueur, et badigeonnez les côtés et le dessus de confiture. Pliez la pâte d''amande autour du gâteau, en coupant les bords les plus longs si nécessaire. Pincez les bords de la pâte d''amande et lissez-les à l''aide d''un couteau. Rangez chaque extrémité en coupant une fine tranche. Retournez délicatement le gâteau dans le bon sens sur une assiette de service et décorez-le de pistaches et de pétales de rose, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:02:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9832,8964,'fr','Bara Brith au chocolat noir, orange et gingembre','Essayez une variante du bara brith – le gâteau au thé gallois classique – à base de chocolat, d''orange et de gingembre. C''est parfait pour célébrer la Saint-David','["3 sachets de thé noir fort","300 g de fruits secs mélangés","beurre, pour le moule","180 g de cassonade foncée","4-5 boules de gingembre tige, hachées grossièrement","100 g de chocolat noir haché","2 cuillères à café de marmelade","2 gouttes d''essence d''orange, ou utiliser 1 orange zestée","1 œuf moyen, battu","230 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","pincée de gingembre moulu","50g de chocolat noir","2 oranges (facultatif)"]','["Déposez les sachets de thé dans une verseuse résistante à la chaleur, versez dessus 350 ml d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire et laissez infuser 5 minutes. Versez les fruits secs dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur et versez dessus le thé chaud. Couvrir et laisser tremper toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 170C/150C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer un moule à pain de 2 lb et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Répartissez le sucre sur les fruits trempés et remuez pour le dissoudre. Ajoutez le gingembre, le chocolat, la marmelade, l''essence d''orange, l''œuf, la farine, une pincée de sel et toutes les épices, puis mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse.","Versez dans le moule et enfournez pour 1h15. Laissez reposer 10 min dans le moule, puis démoulez sur une grille pour laisser refroidir.","Pour décorer, faites fondre le chocolat par petits coups au micro-ondes ou dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en veillant à ce que le bol ne touche pas l''eau. Si vous préparez la peau séchée, épluchez les oranges et coupez la peau en lanières. Séchez avec un torchon, puis répartissez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four à 90 °C ou au réglage le plus bas de votre four pendant 3 heures, en vérifiant toutes les 45 minutes. Laisser refroidir. Versez le chocolat sur le pain et parsemez de zeste."]','2026-01-11 00:02:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9833,8965,'fr','Gâteau Tottenham','Offrez-vous un gâteau nostalgique à la vanille et à la framboise, cuit pour la première fois dans le quartier éponyme du nord de Londres à la fin des années 1800, et toujours un favori des Britanniques.','["250 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","250 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","4 œufs","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","4 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 citron, zesté","noix de coco desséchée ou pépites, pour décorer","150 g de framboises ou de myrtilles","1 citron pressé (vous aurez besoin de 30 ml)","300g de sucre glace","gel colorant alimentaire rose (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake de 20 x 30 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Versez le beurre, le sucre et la vanille dans un grand bol et battez avec un fouet électrique pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ou faites-le dans un mixeur sur socle. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien entre chaque ajout. Incorporer la farine, la levure chimique, le lait et le zeste de citron à l''aide d''une spatule en caoutchouc jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Versez la pâte dans le moule préparé et nivelez le dessus avec le dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. S’il n’est pas prêt, vérifiez toutes les 5 minutes pour vous assurer qu’il ne cuit pas trop. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes dans le moule, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. Mettez les framboises ou les myrtilles dans un petit bol résistant à la chaleur avec le jus de citron. Mettez au micro-ondes pendant 1 min, en remuant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''elles ramollissent. Ou faites-le dans une petite casserole à feu doux. Cassez grossièrement les baies avec une fourchette pour libérer le jus, puis pressez les baies écrasées à travers un tamis dans un petit bol pour récupérer le jus sans pépins.","Versez le sucre glace dans un grand bol et versez dessus le jus de baies. Fouettez bien jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage épais mais tartinable – s''il est trop épais, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café d''eau à la fois jusqu''à obtenir la consistance désirée. Ajoutez une goutte de gel colorant alimentaire rose pour une couleur plus vive, si vous le souhaitez. Étalez le glaçage sur le gâteau refroidi, puis répartissez immédiatement sur la noix de coco ou les pépites. Laisser reposer 30 minutes, puis trancher et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9834,8966,'fr','Gâteau Licorne','Arrêtez les gens dans leur élan avec un superbe gâteau licorne. Avec une génoise légère et une crème au beurre au caramel salé, il est fabuleux et a aussi un goût divin.','["300 g de fondant blanc","poussière de lustre d''or comestible","des pépites multicolores, pour décorer (facultatif)","10 g de fondant noir","325 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","325 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","6 oeufs","325 g de farines autolevantes","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","4 cuillères à soupe de lait","450 g de beurre doux, ramolli","900 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","200 g de caramel au beurre salé (facultatif)","colorants alimentaires en gel violet, rose et bleu"]','["Commencez par fabriquer la corne et les oreilles de la licorne : elles devront sécher complètement avant utilisation. Rouler 225 g de fondant blanc en forme de long boudin, avec une extrémité légèrement plus épaisse que l''autre. En commençant par l’extrémité la plus épaisse, tordez la saucisse en une bobine serrée jusqu’à obtenir une forme de corne. Pincez la petite extrémité vers le haut pour former une pointe pointue. Ensuite, divisez le fondant blanc restant en deux morceaux. Étalez chacun en un ovale grossier sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé, puis pincez l''extrémité supérieure de chaque ovale vers le haut pour faire un point. Réservez les oreilles avec la corne et laissez sécher pendant que vous préparez le gâteau.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer le fond de trois moules à sandwich de 20 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre, le sucre et la vanille dans un grand bol avec un fouet électrique pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien après chaque ajout. Tamisez la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel et incorporez à l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal. Ajoutez juste assez de lait pour créer une consistance molle.","Répartissez la pâte dans les moules préparés et lissez le dessus avec une aspatule. Cuire au milieu du four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et fermes au toucher. Laisser refroidir légèrement dans les moules, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pendant que le gâteau refroidit, préparez la crème au beurre. Battre le beurre, le sucre glace et la vanille jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux, en ajoutant 4 à 6 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude pour détendre le mélange si nécessaire.","Placez l''une des génoises refroidies sur un plateau à gâteau ou un support et étalez un peu de crème au beurre dessus à l''aide d''une spatule. Étalez délicatement sur la moitié du caramel salé, si vous en utilisez, puis prenez une autre génoise en sandwich. Répétez l''opération avec un peu plus de crème au beurre, le reste du caramel salé (si utilisé) et la troisième génoise. Étalez l’extérieur du gâteau avec une fine couche de crème au beurre – il n’est pas nécessaire que ce soit soigné. Mettre au frais 30 min.","Étalez une couche épaisse et uniforme de crème au beurre sur le gâteau refroidi à l''aide d''un couteau à palette. Répartissez le reste de crème au beurre dans trois bols et colorez chacun différemment à l''aide du colorant alimentaire en gel. Les nôtres étaient rose clair, violet et rose foncé.","Mettez un peu de poudre de lustre doré dans un bol, ajoutez une goutte d''eau et remuez pour obtenir une pâte dorée. A l''aide d''un petit pinceau, peignez en or la corne de licorne avec la pâte, ainsi que l''intérieur des oreilles, si vous le souhaitez. Placez délicatement la corne dorée au milieu du gâteau glacé, les oreilles de chaque côté.","Installez trois poches à douille avec trois douilles différentes (nous avons utilisé une douille ronde et deux douilles en étoile de tailles différentes) et remplissez chacune d''elles avec une couleur différente de crème au beurre. Passez chaque couleur autour des oreilles et de la corne et sur tout le dessus du gâteau, en descendant d''un côté et sur le bord du devant – c''est la crinière de la licorne. Décorez avec quelques pépites, si vous en utilisez.","Divisez le fondant noir en deux morceaux et roulez chacun en une fine forme de boudin. Formez chacun en arche, puis appuyez sur le devant du gâteau pour faire les yeux. Si vous le souhaitez, courbez les bords extérieurs des yeux vers le haut pour créer des cils. Couper en tranches et servir. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9835,3952,'fr','Gâteaux de fées au chocolat','Faites sourire votre famille et vos amis avec des gâteaux de fée au chocolat faciles à réaliser : ils ont une belle génoise légère et un glaçage au beurre.','["100 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de beurre doux, ramolli","2 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","80 g de farines autolevantes","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","75g de beurre ramolli","150g de sucre glace","40g de cacao en poudre","2-3 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à pain à 12 trous de caissettes en papier. Mettez le sucre et le beurre dans un bol et battez ensemble jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Incorporer progressivement les œufs et la vanille jusqu''à homogénéité.","Ajoutez la farine, le cacao en poudre et la levure chimique dans le bol et mélangez pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Pliez le lait pour le détendre. Répartissez le mélange entre les caissettes à l''aide d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un bâton à cocktail enfoncé au centre de l''un des gâteaux de la rangée du milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5 à 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pendant que les gâteaux refroidissent, préparez le glaçage. Battez ensemble le beurre, le sucre glace et le cacao en poudre dans un bol pendant 5 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse. Ajoutez le lait pour détendre si nécessaire. Pipe ou étalez sur les cupcakes refroidis."]','2026-01-11 00:02:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9836,8967,'fr','Gâteau au miel juif','Ce simple gâteau au miel, également connu sous le nom de « lekach », est une friandise sucrée incontournable lors de la célébration du Nouvel An juif, ou Roch Hachana. Il est préférable de le préparer quelques jours à l’avance, car les épices et la texture s’améliorent à mesure qu’il mûrit.','["100 ml d''huile de tournesol","175g de sirop doré","50g de miel liquide","50 g de sucre brun foncé mou","150 ml de thé fort, refroidi","2 gros œufs, battus","225 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à café de gingembre","½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","amandes effilées, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule carré de 20 cm de diamètre. Faites chauffer l''huile, le sirop doré, le miel et le sucre dans une petite casserole pour dissoudre le sucre. Remuer pour combiner, puis laisser refroidir. Ajoutez le thé et les œufs battus.","Fouetter légèrement la farine, la levure chimique, les épices et une pincée de sel dans un grand bol pour mélanger. Faites un puits avec les ingrédients secs et mélangez-y les ingrédients humides, à l''aide d''un fouet ou d''une cuillère en bois, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et sans grumeaux.","Versez la pâte dans le moule chemisé et saupoudrez d''amandes si vous le souhaitez. Cuire au four pendant 50 à 55 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le gâteau reprenne sa forme lorsqu''on le presse doucement et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. N''ouvrez pas le four pendant les 45 premières minutes de cuisson.","Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule sur une grille. Bien envelopper et conserver trois à quatre jours avant de manger, afin que la saveur puisse s''améliorer. Couper en neuf carrés pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9837,8968,'fr','Gâteau enneigé à la noix de coco','Demandez aux enfants de vous aider à préparer ce gâteau enneigé à la noix de coco. Décorez avec des copeaux de noix de coco, des « boules de neige » et tout ce que vous aimez','["185 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","185 g de lait de coco fouetté","250 g de sucre en poudre","250 g de farines autolevantes","3 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de noix de coco (facultatif)","25 g de noix de coco desséchée","100 g de beurre ramolli","250 g de sucre glace","2 cuillères à soupe de lait de coco","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de noix de coco (facultatif)","25 g de chips de noix de coco ou de noix de coco râpée","truffes au chocolat blanc ou grosses pépites blanches, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake de 900 g (le nôtre mesure 10 x 21 x 5 cm) et tapisser le fond d''une longue bande de papier sulfurisé qui surplombe les côtés.","Mettez le beurre, le lait de coco, le sucre, la farine, les œufs, l''extrait de noix de coco (le cas échéant) et la noix de coco desséchée dans un grand bol et battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Grattez dans le moule préparé et nivelez le dessus avec une spatule ou le dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 55 minutes à 1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit levé et doré et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Si du mélange à gâteau humide adhère à la brochette, faites cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir dans le moule 10 min, puis démouler le gâteau sur une grille en vous aidant du papier sulfurisé. Laisser refroidir complètement. Le gâteau refroidi se conserve au congélateur, bien emballé, jusqu''à deux mois.","Pour faire le glaçage, battez le beurre, le sucre, le lait de coco et l''extrait de noix de coco, le cas échéant, dans un bol jusqu''à consistance lisse et crémeuse. Étalez sur le dessus du gâteau à l''aide d''une spatule ou du dos d''une cuillère, puis répartissez sur une généreuse couche de chips de noix de coco. Décorez avec des « boules de neige » aux truffes au chocolat blanc ou de grosses pépites blanches, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9838,8969,'fr','Pain d''épices et pain au miel','Préparez notre gâteau multifonctionnel au gingembre et au miel. À déguster avec du yaourt et des compotes de fruits pour un brunch festif, ou à déguster à l''heure du thé avec du beurre.','["100 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","100g de miel","125 g de sucre Demerara brun foncé","4 cuillères à soupe de lait","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farines autolevantes","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","grosse pincée de muscade râpée","grosse pincée de clous de girofle moulus","grosse pincée de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","1 œuf battu"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 900g. Mettez le miel, le beurre et le sucre dans une casserole et faites chauffer à feu doux en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu et le sucre dissous. Retirer du feu et verser le lait et la vanille, puis laisser refroidir.","Versez la farine dans un bol avec la levure chimique, les épices et une pincée de sel. Ajouter l''œuf, puis incorporer délicatement au mélange de beurre fondu. Une fois combiné, verser dans le moule préparé, placer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit élastique au toucher et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes dans le moule, puis placer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Se conserve dans une boîte hermétique jusqu''à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9839,6867,'fr','Gâteau rôti à la courge et aux noix au miel','Épatez vos invités avec ce superbe gâteau rôti à la courge et aux noix au miel. C’est une pièce maîtresse végétarienne qui plaira à tous pour une célébration – parfaite pour Noël','["300 g de noix mélangées (noix du Brésil, noix de pécan, noisettes, noix et amandes fonctionnent toutes bien)","1 grosse carotte, râpée","1 branche de céleri, râpé","1 oignon, râpé","400-500 g (½ moyenne) de courge musquée, pelée, coupée en deux sur la largeur juste au-dessus de l''extrémité du bulbe","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la boîte","3 cuillères à soupe de miel ou de sirop d''érable","180 g de marrons cuits sous vide","50 g de beurre d''amande, de cajou ou de cacahuète","petit bouquet de sauge, feuilles cueillies"]','["Mettez les noix mélangées dans le bol d''un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement hachées, puis versez-les dans un bol. Vous pouvez également le hacher grossièrement à l''aide d''un couteau. Mettez la carotte, le céleri et l''oignon dans une poêle. Coupez la moitié longue et fine de la courge en deux dans le sens de la longueur ou en quatre (selon sa largeur) et coupez-la en tranches longues et fines à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé ou d''une mandoline (réservez la moitié bulbe la plus épaisse de la courge pour une autre recette).","Versez l''huile sur les légumes dans la poêle, puis faites-les frire pendant 15 à 20 minutes à feu moyen-doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et tendres. Grattez le mélange dans les noix hachées et incorporez 2 cuillères à soupe de miel, les châtaignes et le beurre de noix. Mélangez le tout, puis assaisonnez.","Huiler un moule à charnière de 20 cm et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé. Disposez 3 à 5 feuilles de sauge dans le moule, face vers le bas. Hachez finement le reste des feuilles de sauge et ajoutez-les au mélange de noix. Disposez quelques tranches de courge dans le fond du moule, en les posant soigneusement de manière à ce que les couches se chevauchent légèrement pour former un motif en spirale. Arroser de ½ cuillère à soupe du miel restant. Versez la moitié du mélange de noix en le pressant fermement dans le moule avec le dos d''une cuillère, puis recouvrez d''une autre couche de courge, cette fois en une seule couche plutôt qu''en la chevauchant – cela facilitera la coupe plus tard. Arroser du reste du miel. Versez le reste du mélange de noix et appuyez fermement avec le dos d''une cuillère. La courge restante se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours pour être utilisée dans des tartes et des quiches, ou pour être grillée pour des salades.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Couvrir le moule de papier d''aluminium et rôtir pendant 30 minutes, puis découvrir et rôtir encore 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré et croustillant. Laisser reposer 15 minutes, puis retourner sur une assiette et couper en quartiers pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9840,7991,'fr','Cheesecake arc-en-ciel','Notre cheesecake arc-en-ciel époustouflant égayera à coup sûr n''importe quelle fête. Ce dessert facile a une délicieuse base de biscuit et des couches vibrantes et colorées','["170g de beurre","140g de biscuits Oreo (ou similaire) crème retirée","140 g de biscuits digestifs réduits en fines miettes","600 g de fromage à pâte molle entière (nous avons utilisé du Philadelphia)","170 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 ½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 gros œufs","200 g de crème sure","colorants alimentaires en gel","crème double, fouettée pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm en plaçant un morceau carré de papier sulfurisé ou de papier d''aluminium sur le dessus de la base du moule, puis en coupant le côté pour que le papier ou le papier d''aluminium soit emprisonné et que tout excès dépasse du fond.","Pour la croûte, faites fondre 85 g de beurre dans une poêle moyenne. Incorporer les miettes de biscuits les plus foncées pour que le mélange soit uniformément humide. Presser le mélange au fond du moule. Faire fondre le beurre restant et incorporer les miettes digestives comme avant. Faites une couche par-dessus la première, tassez bien le tout et enfournez pour 10 minutes. Laisser refroidir pendant la préparation de la garniture.","Augmentez la température du four à 220°C/ventilateur 200°C/gaz 7. Fouettez le fromage à pâte molle avec le sucre en poudre, la farine nature, une pincée de sel et l''extrait de vanille. Incorporez les œufs et la crème sure, mais ne battez pas trop. La pâte doit être lisse et bien épaisse. Répartissez la pâte à parts égales dans 6 bols et colorez chacun en violet, bleu, vert, jaune, orange et rouge.","Badigeonnez les côtés du moule de beurre fondu et déposez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Versez la garniture, en commençant par le rouge, puis l''orange, le jaune, etc. Le mélange doit être suffisamment épais pour pouvoir être versé et étalé soigneusement chaque couche les unes sur les autres. Cuire au four 10 minutes.","Réduisez la température du four à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼ et faites cuire encore 35 à 40 minutes. Si vous secouez doucement le moule, la garniture doit avoir une très légère oscillation au centre, si elle semble liquide, laissez cuire encore un peu et vérifiez à nouveau. Éteignez le four et laissez refroidir avec la porte très légèrement entrouverte. Réfrigérez le cheesecake refroidi jusqu''à ce que vous souhaitiez le servir. Décorer juste avant de servir.","Pour servir, fouettez la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit suffisamment épaisse pour être canalisée. Verser la crème et dresser des gouttes ou des rosaces sur le dessus du cheesecake. Pour les rosettes arc-en-ciel, à l''aide d''un pinceau, faites des rayures arc-en-ciel de colorant alimentaire à l''intérieur d''une poche à douille munie d''une douille avant d''y verser la crème."]','2026-01-11 00:02:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9841,8971,'fr','Gâteau d''anniversaire végétalien','Préparez une version végétale d''un gâteau au fondant au chocolat pour une fête d''anniversaire. Tout le monde peut en profiter, y compris les invités souffrant d''intolérances aux produits laitiers ou d''allergies aux œufs.','["320 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour les boîtes","450 ml de lait de soja, d''amande ou de coco (la variété à verser, pas une boîte)","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre de pomme","500 g de sucre muscovado léger","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille ou de pâte de gousse de vanille","260 g de yaourt nature au soja ou à la noix de coco","450 g de farines autolevantes","160g de cacao en poudre","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","200 g de chocolat noir sans produits laitiers","400g de pâte à tartiner vegan, à température ambiante","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille ou de pâte de gousse de vanille","800 g de sucre glace tamisé","des pépites colorées (assurez-vous qu''elles conviennent aux végétaliens)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler trois moules à cake ronds de 20 cm et tapisser les fonds et les côtés de papier sulfurisé (si vous n''avez pas trois moules, faites cuire la pâte par lots). Fouettez le lait et le vinaigre dans un pichet – le lait doit cailler légèrement. Annuler.","Fouettez le sucre, l''huile et l''extrait de vanille dans un bol, puis ajoutez le yaourt en fouettant, en veillant à éliminer les grumeaux de sucre. Versez le lait caillé et mélangez bien.","Tamisez la farine, le cacao en poudre, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude et ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un autre bol et mélangez bien. Incorporez progressivement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse, mais veillez à ne pas trop mélanger.","Répartissez la pâte uniformément entre les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien levée et élastique, et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte presque propre. Quelques miettes collantes suffisent, mais le mélange ne doit pas être mouillé.","Laissez les gâteaux refroidir dans leur moule pendant 20 minutes, puis démoulez-les délicatement sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement. Ils seront délicats alors soyez doux (un lève-gâteau est utile). Les éponges se conserveront, couvertes, à température ambiante jusqu’à deux jours.","Pour la crème au beurre vegan, faites fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes ou dans un bol posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante. Laisser refroidir. Battre la pâte à tartiner et la vanille à haute vitesse dans un batteur sur socle pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez progressivement le sucre glace, en commençant lentement, puis en augmentant la vitesse au maximum jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et crémeux. Versez le chocolat refroidi et mélangez bien. Réfrigérez la crème au beurre pendant au moins 30 minutes avant de l''utiliser.","Pour assembler le gâteau, utilisez d’abord un couteau bien aiguisé pour couper le dessus des génoises afin de les rendre de niveau. Placez l''une des génoises sur une assiette de service, un support à gâteau ou un tambour à gâteau rond de 20 cm (l''utilisation d''un tambour à gâteau permet de bien glacer le gâteau et de le déplacer plus tard sur un support ou une assiette). Étalez sur une couche de crème au beurre à l''aide d''un couteau à palette pour obtenir une finition uniforme et soignée. Garnir avec la deuxième génoise et étaler sur une autre couche de crème au beurre.","Garnir avec la dernière génoise à l''envers, de sorte que le bas du gâteau devienne le dessus (cela aidera à garder le glaçage net et relativement sans miettes). Tartiner les côtés du gâteau de crème au beurre. Tenez fermement la génoise supérieure avec une paume si vous avez besoin de stabiliser le gâteau. Une fois que vous avez recouvert les côtés aussi proprement que possible, recouvrez le dessus d’une fine couche de crème au beurre. Utilisez votre couteau à palette pour nettoyer le dessus et les côtés. Si vous disposez d''un grattoir latéral, utilisez-le pour balayer les côtés et le dessus pour affûter le revêtement. (Il s''agit d''une couche de miettes qui emprisonne les miettes pour vous donner une base nette et ferme.) Mettez le gâteau au réfrigérateur pour le raffermir et laissez-le refroidir pendant 1 à 2 heures.","Pour finir, recouvrez les côtés et le dessus du gâteau de la même manière, en utilisant la majeure partie du reste de crème au beurre. Appuyez les pépites contre le fond du gâteau, environ un quart à un tiers de la hauteur. Vous pouvez habiller le dessus du gâteau avec un cercle de pépites, ou pour une finition plus raffinée, faire de petits tourbillons autour du bord supérieur du gâteau en utilisant le reste de crème au beurre gratté dans une poche à douille équipée d''une grande buse étoile ouverte, puis terminer avec plus de pépites.","Conservez le gâteau au réfrigérateur pour qu''il reste ferme, puis retirez-le 1 h avant de servir. Se conserve, couvert, au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9842,8972,'fr','Gâteau étagé d''anniversaire au chocolat et aux framboises','Qui pourrait résister à notre gâteau au chocolat et aux framboises ? Comme une éponge Victoria mais en mieux, essayez des framboises surgelées économiques pour la crème','["225 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour les boîtes","250 g de sucre en poudre","3 gros œufs","225 ml de lait","250 g de farine autolevante","4 cuillères à soupe de cacao","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","150g de confiture de framboise","100 g de framboises surgelées, décongelées","300 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler et tapisser deux moules à gâteau ronds à charnière de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Fouetter l''huile, le sucre, les œufs et le lait dans un bol jusqu''à consistance lisse. Tamisez la farine, le cacao et le bicarbe dans un autre grand bol, puis incorporez progressivement les ingrédients humides.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que les gâteaux soient levés et reprennent leur forme lorsqu''ils sont pressés. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pour la couche de framboises, mélangez la confiture et les framboises décongelées. Une fois les gâteaux refroidis, fouettez la crème avec le sucre jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous, puis incorporez délicatement la moitié du mélange de framboises à la crème pour créer un effet d''ondulation.","Versez la majeure partie du mélange de framboises réservé sur l''un des gâteaux, puis versez la moitié de la crème. Lisser avec une spatule, puis déposer l''autre éponge par dessus. Versez le reste de la crème et versez-y le reste du mélange de framboises. Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9843,8973,'fr','Gâteau zèbre arc-en-ciel','Célébrez notre 30e anniversaire avec nous – ou votre propre occasion spéciale – avec cette impressionnante éponge arc-en-ciel. Glacé avec de la crème au beurre et garni de pépites colorées, c''est un gâteau qui a un effet wow.','["375 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","375 g de sucre en poudre doré","6 gros œufs, à température ambiante","375 g de farines autolevantes","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","150 ml de lait","du colorant alimentaire bleu et rose (voir astuce ci-dessous)","pépites, pour décorer","250 g de beurre salé ramolli","400 g de sucre glace tamisé","gousse de vanille, graines grattées","100 g de fromage frais entier"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser trois moules à sandwich à fond amovible de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé.","Pour faire la génoise, battez le beurre et le sucre ensemble dans un batteur sur socle ou à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 5 à 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Incorporer les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien après chaque ajout. Incorporer la farine, la levure chimique et le lait pour décoller. Répartissez le mélange dans trois bols à mélanger, en pesant pour plus de précision si vous le souhaitez. Colorez une des pâtes en bleu et une autre en rose, en commençant par un peu de colorant, puis en en ajoutant davantage pour une finition plus profonde. Laissez l’un des bols de pâte incolore.","Préparez devant vous les trois moules à gâteau et les bols de pâte. Versez une cuillère à soupe bombée de pâte bleue au centre du premier moule, puis rose dans le deuxième et nature dans le troisième. En travaillant rapidement pour qu''il ne s''étale pas trop, ajoutez une autre cuillerée de pâte de couleur différente sur chacun d''entre eux. N''attendez pas que la pâte se dépose ou s''étale, continuez simplement à alterner les couleurs jusqu''à épuisement. Le poids de chaque couche fera s''étaler la pâte au fur et à mesure, alors tapotez et secouez très doucement les moules à gâteau pour uniformiser le mélange, puis faites cuire au centre du four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme au toucher. Démoulez immédiatement sur une grille, puis laissez refroidir complètement.","Pour le glaçage, mettez le beurre, le sucre glace et les graines de vanille dans un batteur sur socle équipé de la palette ou mettez dans un bol et utilisez un fouet électrique. Battre pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit mousseux et aéré. Ajouter le fromage à la crème et battre brièvement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tout juste combiné.","Placez l''un des gâteaux sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette de service et étalez dessus 2 cuillères à soupe de crème au beurre, puis répétez avec les autres génoises. Étalez une couche lisse de glaçage sur le dessus et les côtés du gâteau, à l''aide d''un grand couteau à palette, en laissant quelques taches légèrement moins glacées pour une finition « nue ». Garnir de pépites et de bougies, si vous le souhaitez. Se conserve trois jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:02:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9844,8974,'fr','Gâteau à la rhubarbe et aux fleurs de sureau','Profitez au maximum de la rhubarbe rose vibrante avec un gâteau qui combine ses délicieuses saveurs acidulées et son sirop de fleur de sureau sucré : une pièce maîtresse époustouflante !','["400 g de rhubarbe parée, coupée en tranches de 4 à 5 cm","110 g de sucre en poudre","½ citron, zesté et pressé","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau","115 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante, plus un peu pour les moules","95 g d''amandes entières avec la peau (ou utiliser des amandes blanchies ou moulues)","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 citron, zesté","3 œufs, 2 entiers et 1 blanc seulement","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau, plus un peu pour le brossage","100 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","130 g de yaourt nature entier","fleurs de sureau, rincées et essorées, pour garnir (ou pétales de rose, lilas, géranium ou pivoine)","300 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau","100 g de yaourt nature entier"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Beurrer les côtés de deux moules à cake ronds de 20 cm et tapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé.","Pour rôtir la rhubarbe, tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie à bords hauts de papier sulfurisé, ajouter la rhubarbe, puis garnir de sucre, de jus de citron, de zeste et de cordial. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et rôtir au four pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Sortir du four et baisser la température à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 5. Égouttez la rhubarbe du jus de pochage en réservant le sirop.","Versez les amandes dans le bol d''un robot culinaire et mixez-les jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient moulues (si vous utilisez des amandes entières), tout en conservant une certaine texture.","Mettez le beurre dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle équipé d''un fouet (ou utilisez un fouet électrique) et crémez-le à vitesse moyenne pendant 2 minutes, puis à l''aide d''une spatule en caoutchouc, raclez le beurre sur les parois du bol, puis versez-y le sucre et le zeste de citron. Augmentez légèrement la vitesse du batteur et continuez à fouetter pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Réduisez légèrement la vitesse du batteur, puis ajoutez les œufs, le blanc d''œuf, l''extrait de vanille et le sirop et mélangez.","Mélangez la farine, les amandes, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude et une pincée de sel dans un bol. Raclez le mélange de beurre sur les parois du bol du batteur sur socle, tournez le batteur à basse vitesse – pour qu''il ne fasse que remuer – puis versez le mélange de farine et d''amandes en quatre lots, en alternant avec des cuillerées de yaourt et en terminant par un lot du mélange de farine et d''amandes. Mélangez jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé, sans laisser de traces, puis ajoutez la moitié de la rhubarbe rôtie et 1 cuillère à soupe de son sirop à la pâte et incorporez-la.","Répartissez la pâte uniformément dans les moules à gâteau et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré dans chaque gâteau en ressorte propre. Sortez les gâteaux du four, laissez-les refroidir complètement dans les moules sur une grille, puis retirez-les délicatement des moules.","Pour la garniture, fouettez la crème jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous dans un bol et incorporez les trois quarts de la rhubarbe rôtie restante, ainsi que le sirop de fleur de sureau et le yaourt.","Posez l''un des gâteaux, côté plat vers le bas, sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette, piquez-le partout avec une pique à brochette et, à l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie, badigeonnez le gâteau d''un peu de sirop de fleur de sureau. Versez la moitié du mélange de crème, recouvrez de l''autre gâteau et badigeonnez également ce gâteau de cordial. Verser le reste du mélange de crème, garnir du reste de rhubarbe et verser un peu de sirop de pochage. Décorer de fleurs de sureau ou de fleurs de saison."]','2026-01-11 00:02:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9845,8975,'fr','Gâteau étagé triple chocolat et beurre de cacahuète','Préparez un gâteau époustouflant à Pâques. Garnir une génoise au chocolat avec un glaçage au beurre de cacahuète, un filet de ganache, de l''écorce de bretzel et des œufs en chocolat pour un dessert divin.','["225 ml d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour les boîtes","250 g de farine autolevante","4 cuillères à soupe de cacao","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","225 g de sucre en poudre","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","3 gros œufs battus","225 ml de lait","200 g de chocolat noir haché","2 cuillères à soupe de pépites de chocolat","une petite poignée de morceaux de bretzel","2 cuillères à soupe de morceaux de nid d''abeille","65g de chocolat noir","250 g de beurre mou salé","500 g de sucre glace","45 g de beurre de cacahuète onctueux","1-2 cuillères à soupe de cacao","200 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de chocolat noir finement haché","un mélange d''œufs en chocolat de différentes tailles, certains creux, d''autres fourrés, dorés, du pop-corn au caramel et des bretzels"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler et tapisser le fond de trois moules à sandwich de 19 cm. Mélangez la farine, le cacao, le bicarbonate et le sucre dans un bol. Faites un puits au centre et incorporez le sirop, les œufs, l''huile et le lait avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules et enfournez pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les gâteaux soient levés et fermes au toucher. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes avant de démouler sur une grille et de laisser refroidir complètement. À ce stade, ils peuvent être congelés, bien emballés, jusqu’à huit semaines.","Préparez l''écorce pendant que le gâteau refroidit. Faire fondre le chocolat par petites touches au micro-ondes, en remuant toutes les 20 secondes, jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et lisser avec une spatule pour obtenir une fine couche d''environ 35 x 20 cm. Saupoudrer les pépites de chocolat ainsi que les morceaux de bretzel et de nid d''abeille, puis réfrigérer jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient solides. Sortez l''écorce du réfrigérateur et laissez-la revenir une minute à température ambiante avant d''utiliser un couteau bien aiguisé pour la couper en éclats (s''il fait froid, le chocolat se cassera plutôt que de se couper). Réfrigérez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que vous soyez prêt à décorer le gâteau.","Pour réaliser le glaçage, faites fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes en remuant entre petits coups, puis laissez refroidir un peu. Pendant ce temps, battez lentement le beurre, le sucre glace et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau bouillante avec un fouet électrique ou un batteur sur socle, puis augmentez la vitesse et battez jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage pâle et mousseux. Versez un tiers du mélange dans un bol séparé et incorporez le beurre de cacahuète. Incorporez le chocolat fondu au reste du glaçage, puis incorporez le cacao si vous souhaitez un glaçage plus foncé et plus chocolaté.","Sandwichez les trois gâteaux avec le glaçage au beurre de cacahuète. Utilisez la moitié du glaçage au chocolat pour enrober les côtés et le dessus du gâteau et remplissez les bords entre les couches en grattant tout excédent. Mettre au frais 20 min. C''est ce qu''on appelle un enrobage de miettes, qui vous permet d''obtenir une finition vraiment lisse en ce qui concerne le glaçage final.","Étalez le reste du glaçage au chocolat sur le gâteau légèrement refroidi, en lissant les côtés et le dessus pour obtenir une finition soignée. Refroidissez à nouveau pendant 20 minutes.","Pour réaliser la ganache, faites chauffer la crème dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fumante. Versez le chocolat noir dans un bol, puis versez dessus la crème. Bien mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse et brillante. Transférer dans une poche à douille et laisser refroidir quelques minutes à température ambiante.","Disposez la ganache sur le dessus du gâteau, en la poussant sur le bord et en la laissant s''égoutter proprement. Faites cela tout autour du gâteau, puis remplissez le centre avec plus de ganache. Lisser le dessus avec un couteau. Mettre au frais 1h pour que la ganache prenne.","Enfoncez les éclats d''écorce dans le gâteau en les faisant ressortir. Ajoutez beaucoup d''œufs en chocolat, de pop-corn et de bretzels dans et autour des éclats. Couper en tranches pour servir. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours au frais dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:02:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9846,8976,'fr','Le gâteau de Pimm','Oui, vous avez bien lu, Pimm''s sous forme de gâteau. La crème au beurre onctueuse à la fraise et au citron associée à l''essence de concombre en font le goût ultime de l''été.','["1 concombre","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","300 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","400 g de farines autolevantes","1 ½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","200 g de beurre ramolli","500 g de sucre glace","80 g de fraises décortiquées","200 g de beurre ramolli","400 g de sucre glace","jus et zeste d''1 citron","100 g de fraises décortiquées et tranchées plus 3 fraises coupées en deux (avec les tiges)","3 cuillères à soupe de Pimm''s","¼ concombre, tranché"]','["Mettez les fraises tranchées et coupées en deux pour la garniture et la décoration dans un petit bol et versez sur les Pimm''s. Laisser agir au moins une heure ou toute la nuit. Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser 3 moules à sandwich de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé et graisser avec du beurre.","Coupez le concombre entier en deux dans le sens de la longueur et, à l''aide d''une cuillère à café, grattez et jetez les graines. Hachez grossièrement le reste du concombre et réduisez-le en purée dans un mixeur avec le jus de citron.","Dans un grand bol et à l''aide de batteurs électriques, fouettez le beurre ramolli avec le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et léger. Continuez à fouetter pendant que vous ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en fouettant entre les ajouts. Une fois tous les œufs ajoutés, versez la purée de concombre, le zeste de citron et l''extrait de vanille. Ne vous inquiétez pas si le mélange se brise : il se reformera lorsque vous ajouterez la farine.","Incorporez la farine et la levure chimique et fouettez à nouveau brièvement jusqu''à ce qu''il ne reste plus de grumeaux de farine, puis répartissez le mélange dans les trois moules. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent enfoncé au milieu des gâteaux en ressorte propre. Sortez les gâteaux du four et laissez-les refroidir dans leur moule pendant cinq minutes puis démoulez-les sur des grilles pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement.","Pendant que les gâteaux cuisent et refroidissent, préparez les crèmes au beurre. Pour faire la crème au beurre aux fraises, écrasez les fraises dans un petit bol avec une fourchette jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient pâteuses. Dans un bol plus grand, fouettez le beurre et la moitié du sucre glace jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez la purée de fraises suivie du reste du sucre glace. Fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse et rose pâle et placer au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Répétez le processus avec la crème au beurre au citron.","Une fois les gâteaux complètement froids, placez l''un des gâteaux sur un plateau tournant et ajoutez environ un tiers de la crème au beurre au citron, répartis uniformément sur la surface, puis recouvrez de la moitié des tranches de fraises trempées. Ensuite, étalez un tiers de la crème au beurre à la fraise sur un autre gâteau et recouvrez des tranches de fraises restantes. Empilez soigneusement les deux couches remplies avec le gâteau final dessus.","Transférez le reste des crèmes au beurre dans des poches à douille jetables et coupez les extrémités. Disposez la crème au beurre à la fraise en anneaux autour de l''extérieur du gâteau, en commençant par la base. Une fois arrivé aux trois quarts de la hauteur, passez à la crème au beurre citronnée et continuez à napper le dessus du gâteau. Lisser le dessus à l''aide d''une spatule puis lisser les côtés soit avec une grande spatule, soit mieux encore avec un grattoir à pâtisserie. Utilisez de longs mouvements de balayage et tournez doucement le plateau tournant pour obtenir une finition lisse mais un subtil effet dégradé à la rencontre des deux couleurs. Grattez tout excès de glaçage dans un bol.","Pour finir, garnissez avec les moitiés de fraises trempées restantes et les tranches de concombre."]','2026-01-11 00:02:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9847,8977,'fr','Gâteau de fête d''été','Ce gâteau généreux est assez grand pour nourrir une foule et est une combinaison de tous nos ingrédients d''été préférés : fraises, génoise Victoria, meringues, crème fraîche, chocolat blanc et sablés au beurre.','["300g de beurre demi-sel, à température ambiante","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gousse de vanille (ou les graines de 2 gousses de vanille avec 2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille)","6 œufs moyens, légèrement battus","300 g de farines autolevantes","900 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de sucre glace","2 cuillères à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","300g de confiture de fraises de bonne qualité ou maison (voir astuce)","1 kg de fraises, coupées en tranches égales pour des couches nettes (en garder 8 pour décorer)","paquet de feuilles d''or (facultatif)","bisous de meringue, écorce de chocolat & fraises enrobées de chocolat (voir recettes dans ''va bien avec'')","biscuits sablés (voir recette, ou utiliser des biscuits du commerce)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser deux moules de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre, le sucre et la vanille dans un batteur de table (ou avec un batteur à main ou une cuillère en bois) jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit très léger, pâle et mousseux.","Incorporer progressivement les œufs battus, en raclant les parois du bol après chaque ajout, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Si vous utilisez un mixeur, à vitesse lente, ajoutez la farine jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste combinée - ne battez pas trop car cela pourrait alourdir la génoise. Si vous n''utilisez pas de mixeur, incorporez la farine avec une grande cuillère en métal.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les gâteaux se détachent des côtés et que le cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Retirer et laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5 minutes. Démoulez sur une grille et retirez le papier sulfurisé pour permettre à la vapeur de s''échapper et aux gâteaux de refroidir. Pendant ce temps, réalisez les décorations.","Assemblez maintenant votre gâteau. Avant de fendre les génoises, coupez le dessus bombé de chaque gâteau avec un couteau à pain. Utilisez le même couteau ou un fil à gâteau pour diviser chaque génoise horizontalement, de sorte qu''il vous reste quatre couches de génoise. Une bonne astuce est de tracer un trait de repère sur chaque biscuit à l''aide d''un couteau à pain, afin qu''une fois les biscuit coupés et remplis, vous puissiez utiliser le trait pour les remonter au bon endroit. De cette façon, si votre coupe est un peu bancale, le gâteau ne sera pas inégal.","Fouettez la crème double avec le sucre glace et la vanille jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légère et mousseuse et qu''elle tienne juste sa forme. Placez la couche inférieure sur un support à gâteau ou une planche. Tartinez d''une fine couche de confiture, puis étalez ou pochez sur une bonne couche de crème. Disposez soigneusement une couche uniforme de fraises sur le pourtour, puis parsemez le milieu de la génoise avec plus de fruits. Répétez avec deux autres couches de gâteau.","Pour la couche supérieure, ajoutez le biscuit et la confiture, mais nappez délicatement de crème. Pressez délicatement la feuille d''or sur le chocolat sur les fraises, quelques meringues et un peu d''écorce.","Disposez les fraises enrobées de chocolat sur le biscuit crémeux, puis nichez-les dans les éclats d''écorce, les meringues et le biscuit. Terminez par une pincée de meringue écrasée et un peu plus de fraises lyophilisées (de la recette des écorces de chocolat). Servir et déguster en quelques heures."]','2026-01-11 00:02:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9848,8978,'fr','Gâteau Funfetti','Parfait pour une fête, ce gâteau moucheté d''arc-en-ciel crie « célébrez » ! Déposez un glaçage crémeux à la vanille et répartissez-le sur des pépites pour un gâteau époustouflant que les adultes et les enfants adoreront.','["300 g de sucre en poudre doré","450 g de beurre ramolli","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gousse de vanille","8 œufs battus","450 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","4 cuillères à soupe de lait entier","200 g de pépites arc-en-ciel, plus un peu pour décorer","150g de beurre ramolli","450 g de sucre glace tamisé","Pot de 180 g de fromage à la crème entier","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de vanille"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/160° chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et graisser et tapisser 4 moules à cake de 20 cm. Si vous n’en avez pas 4, réduisez de moitié la recette de génoise et faites cuire en 2 fournées.","Mettez le sucre, le beurre et la pâte de vanille dans un grand bol et battez avec un fouet électrique (ou dans un batteur de table) jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs progressivement en battant entre chaque ajout jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement incorporés. Ajoutez une cuillère à soupe ou 2 de farine si le mélange semble cailler.","Tamisez la farine et la levure chimique avec une cuillère à café de sel et incorporez-les à la pâte à gâteau. Versez le lait et battez pour détendre le mélange. Répartir sur les pépites et répartir dans la pâte à gâteau avant de la répartir entre chaque moule à gâteau. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et que la génoise reprenne sa forme lorsque vous appuyez légèrement dessus. Remplacez les moules dans le four après 15 minutes pour vous assurer qu''ils cuisent uniformément. Laisser refroidir complètement sur des grilles avant de glacer.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage en battant le beurre avec la moitié du sucre glace jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène et mousseux. Ajouter le fromage à la crème et le reste du sucre glace en battant à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Arroser de pâte de vanille et battre jusqu''à incorporation. Mettez une grosse douille ronde dans une poche à douille et versez-y le glaçage.","Une fois les gâteaux refroidis, déposez une goutte de glaçage sur un plateau à gâteau et posez 1 des génoises dessus. Disposez des gouttes de glaçage vanille en cercle recouvrant toute la base de la génoise, puis recouvrez avec la génoise suivante. Répétez avec les 3 couches, en saupoudrant quelques pépites supplémentaires sur le dessus. Servir en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:02:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9849,6871,'fr','Génoise à l''eau de rose et aux framboises','Eloise Shardlow crée une touche florale délicate à la génoise classique. Pétales de roses séchés, glaçage à la rose et framboises pour une décoration époustouflante.','["225 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs moyens, battus","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","225 g de farine autolevante tamisée","150 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à café d''eau de rose","4 cuillères à soupe de confiture de framboise","150 g de framboises légèrement écrasées","175 g de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","½ cuillère à café d''eau de rose","pétales de roses séchées","poignée de framboises"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer légèrement deux moules à cake de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Dans un grand bol à mélanger, battre le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Ajoutez progressivement les œufs petit à petit, en raclant les parois du bol après chaque ajout. Si le mélange commence à cailler, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de farine. Ajouter l''extrait de vanille, incorporer la moitié de la farine, puis incorporer le reste.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules à cake et enfournez pendant 20 à 25 minutes – un cure-dent inséré au milieu des gâteaux doit en ressortir propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Montez la crème au fouet en ajoutant l''eau de rose au fur et à mesure, puis incorporez la confiture en prenant soin de ne pas trop mélanger.","Placer une des génoises sur une assiette de service et garnir du mélange de crème. Parsemer de framboises, puis recouvrir de l''autre génoise.","Pour le glaçage, mélangez le sucre glace, 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et l''eau de rose et incorporez le jus de quelques framboises concassées. Arrosez le gâteau, disposez dessus les pétales de roses et le reste des framboises et saupoudrez de sucre glace."]','2026-01-11 00:02:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9850,8979,'fr','Gâteau de mariage – gâteau aux fruits léger','Cela constitue le niveau supérieur d''un gâteau de mariage à trois niveaux, ou faites-le seul pour les baptêmes, Noël ou chaque fois que vous avez besoin d''un bon gâteau aux fruits plus léger.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''eau de fleur d''oranger","le zeste et le jus d''une orange","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","140 g de beurre doux, ramolli","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 gros œufs battus","175 g de farine nature","100 g de cerises glacées non teintes, coupées en deux","100 g d''abricots secs hachés grossièrement","100 g de zestes mélangés, hachés (nous avons utilisé Sundora)","100 g de sultane dorée","50 g de pistaches décortiquées, laissées entières","50 g (3 boules) de tige de gingembre en pot"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/chaleur tournante 140°C/gaz 3. Beurrer et doubler le fond et les côtés d''un moule à cake profond de 15 cm. Enroulez également une double couche de papier sulfurisé ou brun autour de l''extérieur de la boîte, puis fixez-la avec de la ficelle.","À l’aide d’un fouet électrique ou d’un batteur de table, crémer ensemble le beurre et le sucre jusqu’à consistance mousseuse et légère. Incorporez les œufs progressivement. Dans un petit bol, mélangez l''eau de fleur d''oranger avec le zeste et le jus de l''orange et du citron. Incorporez la farine, puis les fruits secs, les pistaches et le gingembre au mélange crémeux, suivi du mélange jus et zestes.","Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 30 minutes, puis baissez le four à 150C/ventilateur 130C/gaz 2 et faites cuire encore 1 h 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé, doré et qu''une brochette insérée en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir 15 minutes avant de transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Le gâteau se conserve bien emballé dans un endroit frais jusqu''à 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:02:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9851,8980,'fr','Black Forest gâteau','Impressionnez vos invités avec ce gâteau à la crème étagé au chocolat et aux cerises – une version revisitée d''un classique rétro','["175 g de beurre salé, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de tablette de chocolat noir","300 g de farine nature","375 g de sucre en poudre doré","25g de cacao","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 œufs moyens","200 g de babeurre ou yaourt nature","Boîte de 425 g de cerises dénoyautées, 2 cuillères à soupe de jus réservées, reste égoutté","100 g de confiture de griottes","4 cuillères à soupe de kirsch (ou plus de jus en canette si vous voulez qu''il soit sans alcool)","Pot de 500 ml de crème double","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","1 petite barquette de cerises fraîches (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond de 3 moules à cake de 20 cm. Faites bouillir la bouilloire. Mettez le beurre et 75 g de chocolat cassé en morceaux dans une petite casserole et faites chauffer doucement en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement fondus.","Mélangez la farine, le sucre, le cacao et le bicarbonate de soude avec une pincée de sel dans un bol. Fouetter ensemble les œufs et le babeurre ou le yaourt. Grattez le mélange de chocolat fondu et le mélange d''œufs dans les ingrédients secs, ajoutez 100 ml d''eau bouillante et fouettez brièvement avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que la pâte à gâteau soit sans grumeaux.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules et enfournez pendant 25 minutes, en échangeant les moules après 20 minutes s''ils se trouvent sur des étagères différentes. Pour vérifier qu''ils sont cuits, enfoncez une brochette et vérifiez qu''elle ressort propre.","Piquez les gâteaux plusieurs fois avec une pique à brochette. Mélangez les 2 cuillères à soupe de jus de cerise réservé et le kirsch (ou plus de jus) et arrosez les gâteaux. Refroidissez les gâteaux.","Mélangez le reste des cerises égouttées et la confiture. Versez 200 ml de crème dans une petite casserole et faites chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste en dessous du point de ébullition. Hachez le reste du chocolat et mettez-le dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, versez dessus la crème chaude et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. Réserver jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tartinable.","Une fois les gâteaux refroidis, fouettez ensemble le reste de la crème et le sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient doucement fouettés. Étalez sur deux des gâteaux, puis versez sur les cerises confiturées. Empilez les gâteaux ensemble. Étalez la crème au chocolat sur le troisième gâteau et posez-la sur les autres gâteaux. Empilez les cerises fraîches dans et autour du gâteau et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9852,8981,'fr','Gâteau étagé au miel et aux amandes','April opte pour le style de décoration « nu » afin que le gâteau ne soit pas inondé de glaçage, mais plutôt délicatement fini avec des amandes confites et de la crème au beurre à la meringue suisse.','["280 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de sucre muscovado léger","140 g de miel clair, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","3 œufs moyens, plus 4 jaunes d''œufs moyens (réserver les blancs pour la crème au beurre)","280 g de farine nature","100 g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","125 ml de lait","140 g de sucre blanc en poudre","75 g d''amandes blanchies","350 g de beurre doux, ramolli","4 blancs d''œufs moyens","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair"]','["Tout d’abord, réalisez les génoises au miel et aux amandes. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer deux moules à cake de 15 cm et tapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé. À l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou d''un batteur électrique à main, battez le beurre, le sucre muscovado et 140 g de miel jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter les œufs et les jaunes, un à la fois, en battant après chaque ajout jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien incorporés. Dans un bol propre, fouetter ensemble la farine, les amandes, la levure chimique et 1/4 cuillère à café de sel. Ajouter la moitié du mélange de farine au mélange de beurre et battre jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien combiné. Ajouter la vanille et le lait en continuant de battre, puis ajouter le reste du mélange de farine en battant jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien combiné. Répartissez le mélange uniformément entre les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 45 à 55 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre de chaque gâteau en ressorte propre. Laissez les gâteaux refroidir 10 minutes dans leur moule, puis démoulez-les sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement. Laissez le four allumé pour les amandes confites.","Pour faire un sirop de miel, mettez 2 cuillères à soupe de miel et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans une petite casserole et faites chauffer pendant 1 à 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le miel soit dissous. Annuler.","Préparez les amandes confites en faisant chauffer 150 ml d''eau et le sucre dans une casserole moyenne à fond épais munie d''un thermomètre à sucre, et remuez jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Pendant ce temps, étalez les amandes sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Faites chauffer le sirop de sucre à 119°C, éteignez le feu et incorporez les amandes tièdes. Continuez à remuer jusqu''à ce que le sirop recouvre les noix et devienne blanche et croquante. Renversez les amandes sur la plaque à pâtisserie et hachez-en grossièrement la moitié.","Préparez ensuite la crème au beurre meringuée suisse. À l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou d''un batteur électrique à main, battre le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et mousseux. Mettez les blancs d''œufs et le sucre dans un bol propre résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante. Fouettez à l''aide d''un batteur à main électrique propre et faites chauffer le mélange jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous (vous pouvez vérifier cela en palpant un peu de blanc d''œuf entre vos doigts pour vérifier qu''il n''est pas granuleux). Retirez le bol du feu et, à l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou électrique, fouettez pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme des pics fermes et refroidisse à température ambiante. Ajouter le beurre, 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe à la fois, et battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et crémeux. Incorporer le miel et transférer dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille de 1 cm.","Pour assembler le gâteau, nivelez les génoises en coupant les dessus en forme de dôme et divisez chaque génoise en deux pour créer quatre couches. Fixez la couche inférieure sur un plateau à gâteau ou posez-la avec une touche de crème au beurre, badigeonnez de sirop de miel et déposez une couche de crème au beurre sur le dessus. Appuyez doucement sur la deuxième couche sur le dessus et répétez avec les couches restantes. Couvrir le gâteau d''une fine couche de crème au beurre, puis utiliser un couteau à palette pour gratter les côtés. Disposez un anneau de gouttes de crème au beurre autour du dessus ou étalez une couche épaisse avec un couteau à palette. Décorer avec les amandes confites."]','2026-01-11 00:02:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9853,8982,'fr','Cupcakes à l''orange et aux amandes','De délicats petits cupcakes recouverts d''un glaçage à la crème au beurre d''amande. Si vous vous sentez ambitieux, suivez notre guide pour créer un bouquet comestible.','["300 g de beurre ramolli","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 gros œufs","250 g de farine nature","100 g d''amandes moulues","2½ cuillères à café de levure chimique","le zeste d''une orange et 2 cuillères à soupe de jus","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","200 g de beurre ramolli","450 g de sucre glace, plus un peu","200 g de fromage frais","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","1 cuillère à soupe de jus d''orange","pâte colorante alimentaire de votre choix (nous avons utilisé un mélange de rose et de jaune pour créer du corail)","Paquet de 250 g de pâte à sucre verte (ou glaçage fondant mélangé à du colorant alimentaire vert)","24 caissettes à muffins (nous avons utilisé des vertes)","grande poche à douille","grande buse de tuyauterie à pointe étoile incurvée","Boule de polystyrène de 15 cm/6 pouces","Pot de fleurs de 15 cm/6 pouces (mesuré sur le dessus)","papier de soie vert","ruban adhésif","24 brochettes courtes en bois (ou longues coupées en deux)","ruban, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 170C/150C ventilateur/gaz 3½.\r\nTapisser 2 moules à muffins à 12 trous avec du muffin\r\ncas. Mettez le beurre et le sucre en poudre\r\ndans un grand bol et mélanger au batteur électrique\r\nfouetter à la main jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter\r\nles œufs, un à la fois, en fouettant bien\r\nentre chaque ajout. Ajoutez la farine,\r\namandes, levure chimique et une pincée\r\nde sel. Mélangez à nouveau, puis ajoutez l''orange\r\nle zeste et le jus et l''extrait d''amande.\r\nDonnez un mix final pour combiner le tout.","Utilisez 2 cuillères à dessert pour diviser le\r\nmélange entre les cas. Cuire au four pour\r\n22-25 minutes, en changeant les moules après\r\n15 minutes. Sortir du four, laisser reposer\r\nlaisser refroidir 10 minutes dans les moules, puis transférer\r\nsur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Peut\r\nmaintenant être congelé jusqu''à 3 mois.","Pour faire le glaçage, versez le beurre dans\r\nun grand bol et mélanger avec un électrique\r\nfouetter à la main jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajouter le glaçage\r\nsucre, fromage à la crème, extrait d''amande et\r\njus d''orange. Écrasez d''abord le tout avec une spatule (pour éviter les dégâts),\r\npuis rentrez avec le fouet électrique\r\net mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez votre\r\ncolorant alimentaire et mélanger à nouveau jusqu''à ce que\r\nvous avez une couleur uniforme. (Si vous êtes\r\nen utilisant du colorant alimentaire liquide, il\r\nrendre le glaçage coulant, alors ajoutez-en un peu\r\nplus de sucre glace.)","Ajustez la poche à douille avec une grande douille courbée \r\nbuse de tuyauterie à point étoile, puis remplissez le \r\nsachet avec la moitié du glaçage et twist \r\nla fin fermée. Pour canaliser, maintenez le \r\npoche à douille directement au-dessus du centre de \r\nle gâteau et, en appliquant une pression constante, \r\ntuyau dans un tourbillon, se dirigeant vers le \r\nbord du cupcake. Quand tu atteindras \r\nle bord, faites glisser la buse pour créer un \r\nfinition lisse – vous pouvez toujours couvrir \r\nce morceau avec des feuilles, alors ne t''inquiète pas non plus \r\nbeaucoup si ça a l''air compliqué. Quand tu as \r\ngarnir 12 cupcakes, vider le glaçage restant du\r\nremettre le sac dans le bol avec le contenu réservé\r\nglaçage. Ajoutez un peu plus de colorant à\r\ncréer une teinte plus profonde (et un peu plus\r\nsucre glace tamisé si le glaçage devient trop\r\ncoulant). Fouettez à nouveau, puis remplissez votre\r\npoche à douille et glacer les gâteaux restants.\r\nPeut être conservé dans un endroit frais jusqu''à\r\n1 jour (le réfrigérateur va bien, assurez-vous juste\r\nque l''on retire 30 minutes avant de manger).","Avant de servir, ajoutez quelques feuilles, si vous\r\ncomme : pincer des petits morceaux de sucre vert\r\npâte ou glaçage fondant et façonner en\r\nfeuilles. Utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour ajouter des détails,\r\npuis collez-le sur les cupcakes. Voir les conseils en bas à gauche,\r\npour savoir comment construire votre bouquet."]','2026-01-11 00:02:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9854,8983,'fr','Gâteau tiramisu au chocolat','Ce gâteau étagé crémeux au chocolat et au café a un véritable effet wow et est idéal pour une fête.','["50 g de beurre, plus un peu pour les moules","4 gros œufs","140 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de farine nature","25g de cacao","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre demerara","75 ml d''espresso chaud ou de café fort et riche","4 gros jaunes d''œufs","75 g de sucre en poudre","125 ml de Marsala","200 g de chocolat blanc moitié haché moitié râpé","500 g de mascarpone en casserole","200 g de chocolat noir râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao"]','["Pour les gâteaux, chauffer le four à 180C/\r\n160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Beurrer et filer 2 x 20cm\r\nboîtes à sandwichs. Faire fondre le beurre et laisser\r\nrefroidir légèrement. Mettez les œufs, le sucre et\r\nvanille dans un bol et fouetter pendant environ\r\n8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et épais\r\net a triplé de volume.","Tamisez la farine, le cacao, la levure chimique\r\net une pincée de sel sur l''œuf\r\nmélange, puis incorporer délicatement.\r\nVersez le beurre refroidi autour du\r\nbord du bol et incorporer jusqu''à ce que\r\nentièrement incorporé. Divisez la pâte\r\nentre les moules préparés et cuire au four\r\npendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette soit insérée\r\nau milieu des gâteaux vient\r\npropre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules\r\npendant quelques minutes, puis transférer sur un fil\r\ngrille pour refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Dissoudre\r\nle sucre dans le café et réserver.\r\nMettez les jaunes d''œufs, le sucre et le Marsala dans\r\nun bol résistant à la chaleur, puis placez-le sur un grand\r\ncasserole d''eau frémissante. Fouetter pendant 5 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et ait triplé\r\nen volume – assurez-vous que le mélange est\r\nvraiment épais. Retirer du feu et\r\nretirez le bol de la poêle. Continuez à fouetter\r\njusqu''à ce que le mélange soit refroidi.","Faire fondre le chocolat blanc haché\r\nau micro-ondes à basse température et laisser\r\nrefroidir légèrement. Pendant ce temps, battez le\r\nmascarpone jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis plier\r\ndans le mélange d''œufs avec le refroidi\r\nchocolat blanc.","Coupez les gâteaux en deux horizontalement.\r\nPlacer une couche au fond d''un 20 cm\r\nmoule à charnière. Badigeonner de café\r\nsirop et tartiner de 3 cuillères à soupe de\r\nmélange de mascarpone. Disperser avec\r\n1 cuillère à soupe de chocolat noir râpé, puis répéter\r\njusqu''à ce que vous terminiez avec la quatrième couche de\r\ngâteau. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer pendant\r\nau moins 2 heures avec le reste\r\nmélange de mascarpone.","Retirez le moule et mettez le gâteau\r\nsur une assiette de service, puis recouvrir avec le\r\nreste du mélange de mascarpone. Mélanger\r\nle chocolat noir restant avec le\r\nchocolat blanc râpé et presse\r\nsoigneusement sur les côtés du gâteau.\r\nSaupoudrez le dessus de cacao."]','2026-01-11 00:02:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9855,8984,'fr','Gâteau ombré Bakewell d''Edd Kimber','Inspirées de la tarte Bakewell classique, les saveurs de confiture de framboise et d''amande de cette éponge à sandwich complètent le superbe glaçage gradué rose.','["325 g de farine nature","25g de maïzena","4½ cuillères à café de levure chimique","225 g de beurre à température ambiante","400 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à café d''extrait d''amande","5 blancs d''œufs moyens, légèrement battus","300 ml de lait entier","300 g de beurre, à température ambiante","625 g de sucre glace","450 g de fromage frais entier","300 g de confiture de framboises sans pépins","colorant alimentaire en pâte rouge"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer 3 moules à gâteau ronds de 20 cm et\r\ntapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé,\r\ngraisser le parchemin aussi.","Dans un bol moyen, mélanger le\r\nfarine, maïzena, levure chimique et ½ cuillère à café\r\nsalez, puis réservez. Mettez le beurre dans un\r\ngrand bol et battre pendant environ 3 minutes\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse et crémeuse. Ajouter le lanceur\r\nsucre et battre pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nléger et moelleux. Ajoutez les extraits et\r\nmélanger pour combiner.","Ajoutez le blanc d''œuf petit à petit,\r\nbattre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement combiné. Filtrer\r\nle mélange de farine en 3 ajouts,\r\nen alternant avec le lait, mais en commençant\r\net finir avec la farine.","Répartissez le mélange à parts égales entre les\r\nmoules préparés, en nivelant doucement. Cuire au four\r\npendant 25-30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le gâteau ressorte\r\nen arrière lorsqu''on le touche légèrement. Autoriser le\r\nlaisser refroidir les gâteaux dans les moules pendant 10 minutes\r\navant de le retourner sur une grille pour\r\nrefroidir complètement. L''éponge est tout à fait\r\ndélicat, alors faites attention lorsque vous travaillez\r\navec le gâteau refroidi.","Pour le glaçage, battez le beurre pendant\r\nenviron 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et crémeux. Ajouter\r\nle sucre glace, petit à petit, jusqu''à ce que\r\nentièrement combiné. Battre le glaçage jusqu''à ce\r\nléger et onctueux, puis ajouter la crème\r\nfromage et la moitié de la confiture. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que juste\r\nlisse – ne pas trop mélanger car cela deviendra\r\nplus vous remuez.","Disposez le premier gâteau sur une assiette de service et\r\nétalez une couche de glaçage sur le dessus.\r\nRépartissez ensuite uniformément la moitié de la confiture restante.\r\nsur le glaçage. Répétez avec le deuxième\r\ngâteau et enfin placer le troisième gâteau dessus\r\nhaut. Couvrir l''extérieur de tout le gâteau\r\navec une fine couche de glaçage à l''aide d''une palette\r\ncouteau et mettez-le au réfrigérateur pendant que vous\r\npréparez le glaçage pour la décoration.","Répartissez le reste du glaçage entre\r\n3 petits bols. Ajouter environ ½ cuillère à café de rouge\r\ncoller le colorant dans l''un des bols et\r\nenviron 1 cuillère à café de colorant dans un autre bol,\r\nlaissant le troisième bol tel quel. Tu veux\r\navoir trois bols de glaçage avec\r\ncouleurs clairement différentes.","Pour décorer les gâteaux, mettez chacun\r\nglaçage dans une poche à douille munie d''un\r\npetit embout passepoil rond. Pipe 6 points de\r\nglacer le gâteau, 2 de chaque couleur,\r\navec le plus foncé à la base du gâteau.\r\nUtilisez une cuillère à café ou un petit couteau à palette pour\r\nétalez le glaçage vers la droite. Répéter\r\nle processus de tuyauterie, en déplaçant les points vers le haut\r\nun pour que pendant que vous faites le tour du gâteau\r\nla couleur sera graduée dans un tourbillon. Pour\r\nle haut, passer 2 anneaux du rose le plus foncé\r\npoints autour de l''extérieur, répartissant le\r\nglaçage de la même manière, suivi\r\npar 2 anneaux de pois rose moyen, et\r\nterminer avec le glaçage plus léger dans le\r\nmilieu. Se conserve jusqu''à 3 jours, au frais."]','2026-01-11 00:02:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9856,8985,'fr','Gâteau mousseline au chocolat de John Whaite et crème au beurre au caramel salé','Donnez à cette génoise de célébration une finition époustouflante en garnissant des pointes de ganache et en la remplissant de glaçage au beurre de caramel salé.','["Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","7 gros œufs, séparés","2 cuillères à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","375 g de sucre en poudre doré","50g de cacao en poudre","300 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","250 g de cassonade légère et molle","150 ml de crème fraîche","140 g de beurre ramolli","½ cuillère à café de sel","250 ml de crème fraîche","250 g de chocolat noir finement haché ou râpé","cristaux de sel marin, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un gâteau rond de 25 cm de profondeur\r\nmoule avec du papier sulfurisé. Dans un grand\r\nbol, mélanger l''huile, les jaunes d''œufs, la pâte de vanille,\r\nsucre en poudre et 200 ml d''eau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien\r\ncombinés. Tamisez le cacao en poudre et\r\nfouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Tamisez la farine, le bicarbonate et 1 cuillère à café de sel.\r\nDans un autre bol, fouettez les blancs d''œufs\r\naux sommets raides. Incorporer à la pâte avec\r\nune grande cuillère en métal et mélanger jusqu''à ce que\r\ntout est bien combiné.","Versez délicatement le mélange dans votre gâteau\r\nboîte de conserve, puis frappez-la deux fois sur la surface de travail\r\npour expulser les grosses poches d''air. Cuire au four pour\r\n1h10 ou jusqu''à ce que le gâteau reprenne sa forme\r\nlorsqu''on le pousse doucement et qu''on l''insère\r\nla brochette en ressort propre. (Couvrir de papier d''aluminium\r\naprès 1 heure si le gâteau commence à durcir aussi\r\nsombre.) Sortir du four, laisser refroidir au\r\nmoule pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer dans un grand\r\ngrille et décollez le papier sulfurisé.\r\nLaisser jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit complètement refroidi.","Préparez le glaçage au caramel salé pendant\r\nle gâteau cuit. Faites chauffer la cassonade,\r\n½ cuillère à café de sel et de crème dans une casserole\r\njusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Bulle\r\nquelques minutes puis laisser refroidir\r\ncomplètement. Battre le beurre jusqu''à consistance lisse,\r\nverser le mélange de crème refroidi et\r\ncontinuer à mélanger jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit doucement fouetté.\r\nRéfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour réaliser la ganache, faites chauffer la crème\r\njusqu''à ébullition. Retirer du feu\r\net versez sur le chocolat. Laisser à\r\nlaisser reposer quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le chocolat\r\na fondu et vous avez une sauce onctueuse\r\ncohérence. Laisser refroidir à pièce\r\ntempérature jusqu''à ce que la ganache soit une\r\népaisseur canalisable, puis transférer dans un\r\npoche à douille munie d''une douille étoile. À\r\nterminer le gâteau, le couper en deux et le remplir de\r\nla crème au beurre au caramel salé. Pipe haute\r\ndes pointes de ganache au chocolat sur le dessus et\r\ndécorer avec les cristaux de sel marin. Volonté\r\nconserver jusqu''à 2 jours dans un endroit frais."]','2026-01-11 00:02:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9857,8986,'fr','Gâteau velours rouge framboise','La purée de fruits donne une grande partie de la couleur à ce gâteau aux teintes rosées, qui combine des framboises, du cacao et une bonne dose de glaçage au fromage à la crème.','["280 g de sucre en poudre doré","175 g de beurre ramolli","3 gros œufs","280 g de farines autolevantes","75g de cacao en poudre","150 ml de babeurre","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin blanc","85 g de fromage frais entier","75 g de framboises en purée, tamisées pour enlever les pépins","¼ cuillère à café de gel alimentaire rouge","150 g de framboises barquette, facultatif","200 g de sucre glace","50 g de beurre ramolli","140g de fromage frais"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser les socles de 2 x 20 cm\r\nmoules à sandwich avec du papier sulfurisé.\r\nA l''aide d''un fouet électrique à main, battre\r\nensemble le sucre en poudre et le beurre jusqu''à ce que\r\nléger et moelleux. Ajoutez les œufs un à un\r\ntemps, en battant bien entre chaque ajout.","Tamiser la farine et le cacao en poudre\r\ndans un bol. Ajouter la moitié au mélange d''œufs\r\net pliez-le soigneusement. Mélangez ensemble le\r\nbabeurre, vinaigre, fromage à la crème,\r\npurée de framboise et gel alimentaire. Pliez la moitié\r\nle mélange de babeurre dans le gâteau\r\npâte et répétez le processus avec les deux\r\nle mélange de farine et le mélange de babeurre.","Verser les mélanges combinés dans\r\nvos moules préparés et laissez cuire environ\r\n25-30 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette insérée\r\nen ressort propre. Laisser refroidir 10 mn\r\navant de le démouler sur une grille.","Pour le glaçage, mélangez le glaçage\r\nsucre et beurre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et crémeux,\r\npuis incorporez le fromage à la crème. Sandwich\r\nles gâteaux refroidis avec la moitié du\r\nglaçage, en ajoutant 150 g de framboises fraîches si\r\nvous aimez, puis étalez le reste\r\nglaçage sur le dessus. Se conservera jusqu''à\r\nà 3 jours dans un endroit frais."]','2026-01-11 00:02:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9858,8987,'fr','Gâteau meringué aux mûres et aux amandes','Impressionnez vos amis et votre famille avec ce fabuleux gâteau de fête','["200 g de beurre ramolli","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues","2 œufs et 2 jaunes d''œufs battus","2-4 cuillères à soupe de lait","150 g de mûres barquette","2 blancs d''œufs","100 g de sucre en poudre doré et une pincée","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées","200 ml de crème fraîche légèrement fouettée","4 cuillères à soupe de gelée de ronce"]','["Tapisser le fond de deux moules à sandwich antiadhésifs à fond amovible de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 160C/chaleur tournante 140C/gaz 3.","Mettez tous les ingrédients du gâteau (sauf les mûres et en utilisant seulement la moitié du lait) dans un bol, puis battez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit crémeux et bien mélangé. Incorporez 100 g de mûres, ainsi que le lait supplémentaire si vous en avez besoin pour assouplir un peu le mélange. Répartir entre les moules à sandwich et niveler le dessus.","Battez rapidement les blancs d''œufs dans un bol propre, en ajoutant les 100 g de sucre, une cuillerée à la fois, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien épais et brillants. Étalez légèrement sur l''un des gâteaux, puis saupoudrez d''amandes effilées et d''une pincée supplémentaire de sucre. Faites cuire les deux gâteaux pendant 40 minutes, puis sortez le gâteau sans la meringue du four et réservez. Cuire le reste du gâteau encore 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré dans le gâteau en ressorte propre. Retirez délicatement les gâteaux des moules et laissez-les refroidir sur une grille. Lorsque les gâteaux sont froids, décollez le papier.","Au moment de servir, étalez la crème sur le gâteau nature jusqu''aux bords. Napper de gelée de ronce, puis sandwicher avec le gâteau meringué et décorer avec le reste de mûres."]','2026-01-11 00:02:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9859,8988,'fr','Plateau de drapeau fruité','Une éponge infaillible et plus simple qu''il n''y paraît : les amandes et le yaourt la maintiennent humide tandis que sa décoration fruitée est convenablement patriotique.','["100 g de beurre ou de pâte à tartiner (Cigogne pour gâteaux), ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","175 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","4 gros œufs","225 g de sucre en poudre","125 ml de yaourt grec entier","zester 2 citrons","175 g de beurre ramolli","350 g de sucre glace tamisé","300g de framboises","175g de myrtilles"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 30 x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mesurez tout le\r\néponger les ingrédients dans un bol à mélanger\r\net mélanger à l''aide d''une main électrique\r\nfouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser dans le moule\r\net niveler la surface.","Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés\r\net le dessus du gâteau rebondit\r\nlorsque vous appuyez avec votre doigt, et le\r\nles côtés de l''éponge rétrécissent\r\ndes côtés de la boîte. Soulever avec précaution\r\nsortir le biscuit du moule, puis transférer\r\nsur une grille pour refroidir. Retirez le\r\npapier sulfurisé.","Pour faire le glaçage, versez le beurre dans\r\nun bol et fouetter à l''aide d''une main électrique\r\nfouetter jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Ajouter la moitié\r\nle sucre glace et fouettez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que\r\nincorporé. Ajouter le sucre restant\r\net fouettez à nouveau jusqu''à consistance lisse. Propagation\r\nle glaçage sur le dessus du gâteau froid.","Pour décorer, disposez une double rangée de\r\nframboises au centre et vers le bas\r\nla longueur du gâteau pour faire une croix.\r\nEnsuite, placez une seule rangée en diagonale à partir de\r\nchaque coin vers le milieu. Maintenant, remplissez\r\nles espaces vides avec des myrtilles. Couper\r\nen carrés pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9860,8989,'fr','Gâteau aux épices et aux framboises','Un gâteau étagé époustouflant composé d''une génoise moelleuse au babeurre, de confiture, de baies et de glaçage au fromage à la crème - une véritable pièce maîtresse','["250 g de beurre ramolli","450 g de farine nature","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","140 g de cassonade légère et molle","5 gros œufs","4 cuillères à soupe de miel","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","½ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","¼ cuillère à café de sel","4 cuillères à soupe de babeurre","200 g de confiture de framboise","200 g de framboises, plus un peu pour décorer (facultatif)","200 g de beurre ramolli","200 g de fromage à pâte molle","200 g de sucre glace tamisé, plus un peu pour saupoudrer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser 3 moules à cake de 20 cm de\r\npapier sulfurisé. Donnez un pourboire à tout le gâteau\r\ningrédients dans un grand bol et battre\r\navec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nRépartir dans les moules et enfourner 25 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette enfoncée en ressorte propre.\r\nDémouler sur des grilles pour laisser refroidir.","Divisez chaque gâteau en deux. Purée\r\nla confiture et les framboises ensemble, puis\r\nétaler sur 5 moitiés de gâteau en laissant 1 dessus\r\nà moitié gratuit. Sandwich ensemble, avec le\r\ngâteau nature sur le dessus. Mettre sur une assiette et accrocher\r\nfilmer soigneusement. Retourner un moule à cake dessus\r\ncomme un chapeau et garnir de 3 x 400 g de nourriture\r\ncanettes. Partez toute la nuit.","Pour finir, battez le beurre, le fromage et\r\nsucre glace ensemble, puis étalé dessus\r\nle gâteau. Décorer avec des framboises supplémentaires\r\net un saupoudrage de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9861,8031,'fr','Gâteau de mariage simple et élégant','Pour réaliser un gâteau de mariage à trois étages, il suffit de multiplier les mélanges à gâteau et les glaçages de base, et de prendre son temps.','["5 x ingrédients pour un gâteau à la vanille facile (voir la recette « Se marie bien avec » ci-dessous)","5 x ingrédients pour la crème au beurre basique à la vanille (voir recette ci-dessous)","Pot de 340 g de confiture de fraises, facultatif (j''ai utilisé Tiptree Fraise & Champagne)","Pot de 340 g de confiture d''abricots, réchauffée et tamisée","4kg de glaçage blanc prêt à rouler (j''ai utilisé Regalice)","Planches à gâteaux rondes fines de 15 cm, 23 cm et 30 cm","Planche à gâteau ronde de 40 cm d''épaisseur","bâtons de cocktail","couteau à palette","un rouleau de papier sulfurisé","une plaque à pâtisserie plate ou un lève-gâteau","sucre glace, pour étaler","ficelle, pour mesurer","8 x chevilles longues en plastique","ciseaux de cuisine","Ruban de satin blanc de 3½ m x 1½ cm","tube de colle UHU, ou similaire","Sucettes à gâteau en polystyrène 12cm et 15cm","Fil de fleuriste de calibre 18, coupé en longueurs d''environ 20 x 10 cm","15 à 20 têtes d''hortensias blanches et vert pâle (prenez-en des plus petites, d''autres plus grosses, si vous le pouvez) ; votre fleuriste peut vous conseiller","Boîtes à gâteaux de 40 cm, 30 cm et 18 cm avec couvercles, si vous transportez le gâteau"]','["PRÉPARATION DES GÂTEAUX : Réalisez la recette de base du gâteau à la vanille facile (voir « Se marie bien avec »), en suivant les instructions ci-dessous pour chaque étage, puis laissez refroidir et arrosez de sirop. Les gâteaux peuvent être congelés à l''avance, sans glaçage. Cependant, si vous les faites cuire trois jours avant le mariage, le gâteau ira bien jusqu''au grand jour.","Pour l''étage inférieur, triplez les quantités du mélange à gâteau de base, puis versez-le dans un moule à gâteau rond profond de 30 cm déjà tapissé. Cuire au four pendant 2 h 15 à mi-hauteur jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et cuits comme avant. Pendant la cuisson, préparez une quadruple quantité de sirop – cela suffira pour les trois gâteaux. Laisser refroidir et arroser le gâteau de sirop comme avant.","Pour les niveaux intermédiaire et supérieur, doublez les quantités de préparation à gâteau de base, puis versez-la dans des moules à gâteau de 15 cm et 23 cm déjà garnis, en remplissant chacun aux deux tiers environ. Faites-les cuire ensemble sur la grille du milieu, en retirant le petit gâteau au bout de 1h15 et en laissant cuire le plus gros gâteau pendant 1h30 au total. Si vous savez que votre four présente des points chauds, déplacez rapidement les gâteaux au bout de 50 minutes. Laisser refroidir et arroser de sirop comme avant.","SUPERPOSER ET RECOUVRIR LES GÂTEAUX : Réalisez la crème au beurre comme dans la recette de base. Vous aurez besoin de 5 fois la quantité de base - c''est beaucoup, alors divisez vos quantités pesées en deux avant de commencer à mélanger. Il vous en reste peut-être un peu, mais mieux vaut trop que pas assez. Pesez la crème au beurre : il vous faudra environ 400 g pour le gâteau de 15 cm, 600 g pour le gâteau de 23 cm et 1,3 kg pour le gâteau de 30 cm. Étalez un peu de crème au beurre sur le plateau à gâteau de 15 cm. Nivelez le dessus du gâteau si nécessaire, puis retournez le gâteau de 15 cm dessus. Divisez-la en trois à l''aide d''un couteau à pain. J''aime marquer le devant du gâteau sur chaque couche avant de le décoller, à l''aide de cure-dents, afin de pouvoir le réassembler exactement de la bonne manière. Retirez d''abord le tiers supérieur (ce qui était le bas du gâteau) et réservez. Coupez soigneusement la couche intermédiaire et mettez-la également de côté. Une plaque à pâtisserie plate ou un lève-gâteau peut être très utile ici pour faire glisser les couches de gâteau puis les remettre les unes sur les autres.","Étalez une couche de crème au beurre sur le gâteau sur la planche. Remettez la couche intermédiaire en alignant les marques de cure-dent, puis étalez une autre couche de crème au beurre par-dessus. Ajoutez un peu de confiture si vous le souhaitez, parsemez-la puis étalez-la uniformément. Garnir du dernier morceau de gâteau, puis dépoussiérer les miettes sur ou autour du gâteau. Badigeonnez maintenant tout le gâteau d’une fine couche de confiture d’abricots. Cela devrait vous éviter de mettre trop de miettes dans la crème au beurre. Disposez le gâteau entier sur une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé.","Étalez le reste de la crème au beurre dessus, en commençant par le dessus, puis lissez-la et pagayez-la sur les côtés jusqu''à la planche. Répétez l''ensemble du processus avec les gâteaux restants, en utilisant les planches correspondantes et les différentes quantités de crème au beurre. Les gâteaux sont maintenant prêts à être glacés. Vous pouvez les laisser toute la nuit si nécessaire, légèrement recouverts d''un film alimentaire.","RECOUVRIR LE GÂTEAU DE GLAÇAGE : Il vous faudra environ 500 g de glaçage pour le gâteau de 15 cm, 1 kg pour le gâteau de 23 cm et 1,7 kg pour le gâteau de 30 cm. Saupoudrez le plan de travail de sucre glace, pétrissez le glaçage jusqu''à ce qu''il soit souple, puis utilisez votre rouleau à pâtisserie pour l''enrouler en un cercle suffisamment grand pour recouvrir les côtés et le dessus du gâteau, avec un peu de reste. Utilisez une chaîne pour vérifier la taille. Utilisez votre rouleau à pâtisserie pour vous aider à soulever le glaçage sur le gâteau.","Lissez le glaçage autour du gâteau avec vos mains, en le faisant glisser sur les bords et jusqu''au plateau. Coupez ensuite l''excédent avec un couteau bien aiguisé, au ras du fond du plateau à gâteau. Lissez les marques avec le plat de vos mains, en polissant le glaçage pour lui donner un léger éclat.","Une fois que vous avez glacé tous les gâteaux, recouvrez la planche de base épaisse. Badigeonner légèrement d''eau bouillie refroidie, puis déposer le glaçage dessus. Coupez jusqu''au bord de la planche avec un couteau (j''ai tendance à faire cela comme je le ferais pour une croûte à tarte, en tenant la planche dans ma main gauche et le couteau dans ma droite), puis laissez la planche et les gâteaux sécher toute la nuit.","EMPILAGE DES GÂTEAUX : Les chevilles, qui sont essentiellement des bâtons en plastique, assurent stabilité et résistance aux gâteaux étagés, et les blocs de polystyrène vous permettent d''ajouter une couche de fleurs « flottantes ». En mesurant et en coupant les chevilles à la même longueur que le polystyrène, vous fournirez une plate-forme uniforme sur laquelle le prochain gâteau pourra reposer, même si le gâteau en dessous est un peu bancal.","Placez le mannequin de 15 cm au centre du plus gros gâteau. Insérez quatre des chevilles dans le gâteau, autour de l''extérieur du mannequin, en forme carrée. Poussez-les vers le bas jusqu''à ce qu''ils rencontrent le plateau à gâteau. Marquez avec un stylo l''endroit où arrive le haut du mannequin.","Retirez délicatement les chevilles ; puis, à l''aide de ciseaux, marquez autour de chaque cheville là où vous l''avez marquée. Cassez le plastique proprement. Réinsérez les chevilles dans leurs trous d''origine, extrémité arrondie vers le bas. Répétez le processus avec le gâteau de 23 cm et le mannequin de 12 cm.","Placez le plus gros gâteau au milieu du plateau couvert. Appliquez une fine ligne de colle autour de la planche de base et fixez le ruban autour. Fixez le ruban autour de chaque gâteau, en utilisant un peu de colle sur le ruban pour le fixer sur lui-même. Si vous déplacez le gâteau dans un lieu, mettez-le maintenant dans ses boîtes. Préparez un petit kit à emporter avec vous - colle, ciseaux, etc. - au cas où vous deviez refaire quelque chose.","LE JOUR - EMPILER ET DÉCORER LE GÂTEAU AVEC DES FLEURS : J''ai utilisé des hortensias - ils sont magnifiques, en saison et vous pouvez obtenir un effet dramatique avec relativement peu de fleurs. \r\nLe jour même, évitez de mettre les fleurs sur le gâteau le plus tard possible. Coupez les tiges des hortensias à environ 2-3 cm. Divisez vos fleurs les moins préférées en morceaux plus petits - cela vous aidera à combler les lacunes gênantes plus tard. Assurez-vous de conserver une belle fleur pour le sommet.","Insérez une longueur de fil de fer fleuri dans chaque tige (ou enroulez-la autour de la tige), en laissant une pointe de fil d''environ 3 cm de long. Poussez-le dans le mannequin en polystyrène. Répétez jusqu''à ce que les deux mannequins soient entourés d''un halo de fleurs. Le gâteau du bas devrait maintenant être dans sa position permanente – à l’abri de la lumière directe et de tout radiateur. Soulevez le gâteau de 23 cm sur le mannequin en polystyrène inférieur, en prenant soin de ne pas écraser les pétales, puis répétez avec le gâteau du haut. Remplissez les espaces vides avec le capitule cassé que vous avez réservé plus tôt. Posez la floraison finale sur le gâteau et le tour est joué !","COUPER LE GÂTEAU : Coupez le gâteau en travers, en forme de grille, plutôt qu''en quartiers. Vous devriez pouvoir obtenir 50 portions du gros gâteau, 30 du milieu et 12 du haut, une fois coupé en morceaux de 2,5 x 5 cm."]','2026-01-11 00:02:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9862,8991,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat double amour','Une simple crème au beurre au chocolat blanc est superbe lorsqu''elle est tourbillonnée sur ce magnifique gâteau de mariage – quelle que soit la façon dont vous le faites.','["400g de beurre","200 g de chocolat nature","700 g de farine nature","800 g de sucre en poudre","100g de cacao","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","4 gros œufs","400 ml de babeurre","2 tablettes de 200 g de chocolat blanc","550g de beurre ramolli","550 g de sucre glace","2-3 sachets de 80 g de boutons, fleurs et rubans en chocolat blanc, en option"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nGraisser et tapisser la base et les côtés de\r\nmoules à cake profonds et ronds de 20 cm et 15 cm\r\navec du papier sulfurisé – en veillant à ce que\r\nle papier arrive quelques cm au-dessus des côtés.","Faites bouillir la bouilloire. Mettez la moitié du beurre et\r\nle chocolat dans une casserole et faire fondre délicatement,\r\nen remuant. Mélangez la moitié de la farine,\r\nsucre, cacao et bicarbe avec une pincée\r\nde sel. Fouetter 2 œufs et 200 ml\r\nle babeurre ensemble. Grattez le fondu\r\nle mélange de chocolat et le mélange d''œufs dans\r\nles ingrédients secs. Ajouter 150 ml bouillant\r\narroser et mélanger le tout ensemble\r\navec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sans grumeaux.\r\nRépartir dans les moules et enfourner pendant\r\n40-45 minutes, en échangeant ensuite\r\n30 minutes s''ils sont sur des étagères différentes\r\n(celui de 15 cm doit être fait après\r\n40 mn). Pour vérifier qu''ils sont cuits, appuyez dedans\r\nune brochette et vérifiez qu''elle ressorte propre.\r\nRefroidissez les gâteaux dans leurs moules.","Répétez les étapes 1 et 2 pour que vous puissiez\r\nse retrouver avec 2 gâteaux de 20 cm et\r\n2 gâteaux de 15 cm.","Faire fondre le chocolat blanc dans un bol\r\nune casserole d''eau à peine frémissante. Battre\r\nensemble le beurre et le sucre glace, puis\r\nincorporer le chocolat blanc. Quand le\r\nles gâteaux sont refroidis, divisés chacun en deux.\r\nUtilisez le glaçage pour reconstituer le sandwich\r\ndonc vous vous retrouvez avec 2 x quatre couches\r\ndes gâteaux. Posez le gâteau de 20 cm sur votre portion\r\nassiette et étalez un peu plus de glaçage dessus\r\nle sommet. Posez le petit gâteau dessus\r\ncela et recouvrir complètement de glaçage.\r\nDécorez avec les boutons en chocolat.","Si vous voulez ajouter des fleurs\r\nchoisissez quelque chose de comestible, comme des roses.\r\nFaites un bouquet en enveloppant les tiges\r\nun peu de papier absorbant humide puis un peu\r\nfilm alimentaire, ajoutez un ruban et ajoutez au\r\ngâteau le jour du mariage."]','2026-01-11 00:02:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9863,8992,'fr','Gâteau des passions','Préparez le délicieux gâteau triple couche de Sarah Cook pour quelqu''un que vous aimez pour la Saint-Valentin','["150 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour la boîte","300 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","300 g de sucre en poudre","50g de noix de coco desséchée","2 œufs, plus 2 blancs d''œufs, œufs entiers battus","2 bananes trop mûres, écrasées","140 g de carottes râpées","Boîte de 432 g d''ananas concassés dans le jus, égouttés au tamis, en réservant le jus (ou fouettez brièvement une boîte de morceaux d''ananas, puis passez au tamis)","100 ml de lait","4 fruits de la passion mûrs, coupés en deux","25g de sucre en poudre","Pot de 200 g de fromage à pâte molle","100g de beurre ramolli","85g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nHuiler et tapisser les bases de 3 x 20 cm\r\nmoules à sandwich avec du papier sulfurisé.\r\nMélangez la farine, la cannelle, la levure chimique,\r\nla moitié du sucre et la noix de coco dans un grand\r\nbol à mélanger. Dans un autre bol, mélangez le\r\nœufs entiers battus, purée de bananes,\r\ncarotte râpée, ananas concassé égoutté,\r\nlait et huile. Battre les blancs d''oeufs jusqu''à\r\nferme, puis ajoutez le reste du sucre et\r\nbattre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit à nouveau ferme et brillant.","Incorporer le mélange humide au sec jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse et sans grumeaux, puis à l''aide d''un\r\ngrande cuillère ou spatule en métal, incorporer\r\nle mélange de blancs d''œufs. Diviser uniformément\r\nentre les moules et enfourner 25 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et qu''une brochette en sorte\r\npropre. Vous devrez peut-être échanger le\r\nposition des moules après 20 minutes.","Pour le filet, évider les fruits de la passion\r\nla pulpe dans une petite casserole. Ajouter l''ananas\r\njus et le sucre en poudre et chauffer jusqu''à ce que\r\nbouillonnant, puis bouillonnant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sirupeux. Pour\r\nle glaçage, battre le fromage et le beurre\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de grumeaux, puis incorporer le sucre glace\r\net vanille. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de l''assemblage.","Piquez les gâteaux partout avec une brochette,\r\narroser d''un filet de sirop de passion,\r\npuis refroidissez. Une fois refroidi, étalez le glaçage\r\nsur deux des éponges. Sandwich\r\nensemble et garnir avec le troisième, non glacé,\r\néponge. Arroser du sirop restant."]','2026-01-11 00:02:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9864,8993,'fr','Gâteau de mariage – citron piquant','Deuxième niveau de notre gâteau de mariage à trois niveaux, cela donne une véritable touche d''agrumes et le trempage du sirop de citron le maintient magnifiquement moelleux.','["350 g de beurre doux, ramolli","350 g de sucre en poudre doré","6 œufs battus","140 g de farine nature","280 g de farines autolevantes","le zeste de 4 citrons, le jus de 3 (environ 100 ml/3½fl oz)","le zeste et le jus de 2 citrons","100 g de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/chaleur tournante 140°C/gaz 3. Préparez l''intérieur et l''extérieur d''un moule de 23 cm, comme précédemment. Battez le beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux, puis incorporez progressivement les œufs, petit à petit. Ajoutez une cuillère à soupe de farine ordinaire si elle commence à se fendre. Incorporez les farines et une pincée de sel, suivis du zeste et du jus de citron.","Versez le mélange dans le moule et enfournez pendant 1 h 15 jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien levé et doré et qu''un cure-dent inséré en ressorte propre. Pendant ce temps, préparez le sirop en faisant chauffer le sucre, le zeste et le jus de citron dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve. Annuler.","Une fois le gâteau sorti du four, laissez-le refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste chaud, puis utilisez un cure-dent pour percer des trous jusqu''au fond du gâteau. Versez le sirop dessus en le laissant pénétrer complètement après chaque ajout. Laisser refroidir complètement, puis envelopper ou remplir et glacer le gâteau. Le gâteau non fourré se conservera bien si vous l''enveloppez dans du papier sulfurisé et un film alimentaire jusqu''à 4 jours, ou au congélateur jusqu''à un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:02:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9865,8994,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat','Nous savons que vous aimez tous autant le gâteau au café que le gâteau au chocolat, alors pourquoi ne pas combiner les deux ?','["200 g de beurre mou, plus un peu pour graisser","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","85 g de cacao en poudre de bonne qualité, comme Cafédirect ou Green & Black''s","140 g de farine autolevante","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","2 pots de 250 g de mascarpone","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 cuillères à soupe de café très fort (voir astuce ci-dessous)","50 g de chocolat noir, à râper"]','["Faites chauffer le four, tapissez les moules et réalisez le biscuit comme décrit dans la recette \"va bien avec\", en tamisant le cacao en poudre avec la farine et la levure chimique.","Pour la garniture, battez ensemble le mascarpone et le sucre, puis incorporez le café. Utilisez la moitié du mélange pour prendre les gâteaux en sandwich et étalez l''autre moitié sur le dessus, en remuant avec le dos d''une cuillère pour former des boucles pointues. Râpez finement le chocolat par-dessus, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9866,8995,'fr','Gâteau Battenberg coucou-a-boo','Une superbe génoise à la rose et aux amandes au motif à carreaux distinctif, cachée dans un glaçage sucré à la pâte d''amande','["225g de beurre salé très mou, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","225 g de farines autolevantes","85g d''amandes moulues","3 gros œufs","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","225g de beurre salé très doux","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","225 g de farines autolevantes","85g d''amandes moulues","3 gros œufs","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à café d''eau de rose","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","un peu de colorant alimentaire rose artificiel (voir astuce ci-dessous)","pot de confiture d''abricots","1 cuillère à café d''eau de rose","un peu de sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","2 paquets de 500 g de pâte d''amande blanche (vous aurez des parures, mais mieux vaut avoir des restes que de vous laisser court)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser le fond de 2 ronds de 18 cm\r\nmoules à sandwich avec du papier sulfurisé.","Commencez par le biscuit aux amandes : mettez le tout\r\nles ingrédients dans un bol et battre avec\r\nun fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange arrive\r\nensemble en douceur. Peser le mélange et\r\nétaler exactement la moitié dans chaque moule. Cuire au four pour\r\n30 minutes – lorsque vous enfoncez une brochette\r\nau milieu, il devrait ressortir propre. Frais\r\ndans les moules pendant 15 min, puis retournez délicatement\r\nsur des grilles pour finir de refroidir pendant que\r\nvous faites la deuxième éponge.","Nettoyer les moules, puis graisser et tapisser\r\ncomme ci-dessus. Battre ensemble le beurre,\r\nsucre, farine, poudre d''amandes, œufs,\r\nvanille, eau de rose et lait comme ci-dessus.\r\nUne fois lisse, incorporer un peu de rose\r\ncolorant alimentaire, petit à petit, jusqu''à obtenir\r\nune belle couleur – elle s''estompera un peu pendant\r\ncuisson, pour que vous puissiez aller un peu plus fort\r\nque vous voulez l''éponge finie.\r\nPeser, répartir dans les boîtes et\r\ncuire comme ci-dessus. Refroidissez de la même manière.","Une fois les génoises refroidies, couvrez\r\ndoucement et réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes – cela va\r\nrendre leur coupe plus facile et plus nette.","Déballez les éponges et, si elles ont\r\nbombé au centre, couper pour aplatir. Couper\r\nun cercle de 6 cm de diamètre à partir du centre de\r\nchaque génoise (un emporte-pièce de 6 cm est idéal,\r\nou fabriquez-vous un modèle en papier) et définissez\r\nde côté. Découpez ensuite un cercle de 12 cm de diamètre\r\ndu centre de chaque éponge en traçant un\r\ncouteau autour d''une assiette du même diamètre\r\n(ou utilisez un autre modèle papier). Donc de\r\nchaque éponge, vous devriez vous retrouver avec un 6 cm\r\ncercle, un anneau de 12 cm et un anneau de 18 cm.","Intervertissez les anneaux du milieu de l''amande\r\néponges avec les anneaux du milieu du\r\néponges roses et replacez les morceaux coupés\r\nensemble. Manipulez les éponges très doucement,\r\npour éviter de craqueler ou de s''effriter\r\nbords trop. Tu devrais finir\r\navec 4 éponges qui ressemblent à des cibles.","Faites fondre la confiture d''abricots, puis tamisez-la\r\net incorporez l''eau de rose. Brossez-en un peu\r\nsur le dessus de l''une des éponges et\r\ngarnir d''une éponge en alternance. Répéter\r\npour empiler toutes les couches. Asseyez le gâteau dessus\r\nune assiette de service ou un support à gâteau.","Époussetez votre plan de travail avec un peu\r\nsucre glace et étalez votre pâte d''amande\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment grand pour recouvrir le gâteau (utilisez\r\nun morceau de ficelle pour mesurer le gâteau ; voir\r\nastuce ci-dessous). Badigeonnez un peu plus de confiture partout\r\nle dessus et les côtés du gâteau. Utilisez votre roulement\r\népingle pour soulever la pâte d''amande sur le gâteau,\r\npuis faites-le descendre sur les côtés, en appuyant pour\r\nbâton. Coupez la pâte d''amande de la base,\r\npuis décorez le gâteau à votre guise. Couper\r\nen quartiers et servir avec du thé. Gardera\r\npendant 3 jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:02:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9867,8996,'fr','Gâteau de fête d''été','Ce gâteau fruité est impressionnant mais facile à réaliser – parfait pour les anniversaires ou en dessert','["Mélange à gâteau à la vanille facile (voir recette ci-dessous – vous n''aurez pas besoin du sirop)","2 x 170g barquettes de framboises","225 g de barquette de myrtilles","225g tub crème fraîche","sucre glace (facultatif)"]','["Beurrer et tapisser la base et les côtés d''un moule rond à fond ample.\r\nMoule à cake de 23 cm avec papier sulfurisé antiadhésif.\r\nRéalisez la pâte à gâteau vanille Easy (voir \"S''accorde bien avec\"), étalez-en la moitié dans le moule,\r\npuis mélangez la moitié des baies avec ce qui est\r\nà gauche. Versez-le sur la première couche et\r\nlisser le dessus. Enfourner 1h30 ;\r\nvérifiez avec une brochette – elle devrait ressortir propre.","Laisser refroidir 30 minutes, puis retirer du\r\nle moule et laisser refroidir sur une grille.\r\nUne fois bien froid, dressez sur une assiette,\r\nlisser la crème fraîche et empiler\r\nles baies restantes sur le dessus. Poussière\r\navec du sucre glace, si vous en utilisez. Le gâteau est le meilleur\r\nconsommé frais, mais se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant\r\njusqu''à 2 jours ; retour à température ambiante\r\navant de garnir de crème et de fruits\r\net servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9868,8997,'fr','Gâteau de mariage – riche gâteau au chocolat noir','Cette recette constitue la couche inférieure de notre gâteau de mariage à trois étages ou un simple et délicieux gâteau au chocolat, parfait avec une touche de crème.','["650 g de beurre doux","650 g de chocolat noir (70 % de cacao)","100 ml de café très fort – un expresso est idéal","3 cuillères à café d''essence de vanille","650 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","950 g de cassonade légère et molle","10 œufs","2 x 284 ml/9½ fl oz de crème sure"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/chaleur tournante 140°C/gaz 3. Beurrer, doubler et envelopper les côtés du moule à cake rond de 30 cm de profondeur comme auparavant. Mettez le beurre et le chocolat dans une casserole moyenne, puis remuez à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus et lisses. Incorporer le café et la vanille.","Tamisez la farine, la levure chimique et le bicarbonate de soude dans le plus grand bol dont vous disposez. Ajoutez le sucre en décomposant les grumeaux du bout des doigts si nécessaire. Battez les œufs et la crème sure dans un pichet ou un bol et versez-les dans le mélange de farine. Versez également le mélange de chocolat fondu, puis remuez avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à obtenir une pâte chocolatée épaisse et homogène.","Verser dans le moule préparé et cuire au four pendant 2h30 – n''ouvrez pas la porte du four avant 2 heures, car cela ferait couler le gâteau. Une fois cuit, laissez-le refroidir complètement dans le moule. Le gâteau non fourré se conserve jusqu''à quatre jours, emballé comme avant, ou\r\ncongelé pendant un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:02:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9869,8998,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat de Dubaï','Inspirez-vous de la tendance chocolat de Dubaï dans ce cheesecake cuit au four. Avec une base de pâtisserie kataifi, une garniture à la pistache et une ganache au chocolat, c''est un incontournable','["100 g de beurre fondu + un peu pour le moule","200g de biscuits digestifs","50 g de pistaches décortiquées, plus un peu pour décorer","50 g de pâte kataifi grillée, plus un peu pour décorer","800 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","200 g de crème de pistache ou de beurre","200 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","4 œufs","200 ml de crème sure","150 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de chocolat noir finement haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Beurrer un moule à charnière de 23 cm et tapisser le côté de papier sulfurisé. Réduisez les biscuits et les pistaches en fines miettes au robot culinaire. Versez le mélange dans un bol, puis ajoutez la pâte et le beurre fondu et mélangez bien. Versez le mélange au fond du moule et enfournez pendant 10 minutes. Laissez refroidir pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Rincez le robot culinaire, puis versez le fromage à pâte molle, la crème à la pistache, le sucre, la vanille, la farine, les œufs et la crème sure. Mixez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et ait une consistance semblable à celle de la crème double. Placez la base du cheesecake sur une plaque à pâtisserie pour récupérer les gouttes indésirables qui s''échappent du moule et versez délicatement le mélange de cheesecake sur la base.","Réduisez la température du four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et placez le cheesecake sur la grille du milieu, puis enfournez encore 45 minutes. Après cette deuxième cuisson, éteignez le four et laissez le cheesecake refroidir à l’intérieur avec la porte fermée pendant 1 heure – ne soyez pas tenté de jeter un coup d’œil, sinon le cheesecake pourrait se fissurer. Après ce délai, ouvrez la porte du four et laissez-la entrouverte pendant encore une heure (vous pouvez utiliser une cuillère en bois calée dans la porte pour la maintenir légèrement ouverte). Laisser refroidir une troisième heure à température ambiante, puis couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Pour faire la garniture, faites chauffer la crème double dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au micro-ondes par petites rafales ou dans une petite casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste fumante. Mettez le chocolat noir dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, versez sur la crème chaude et laissez reposer quelques minutes, puis remuez pour obtenir une ganache onctueuse. Versez-le délicatement sur la couche de cheesecake et étalez-le rapidement jusqu''au bord avant qu''il ne durcisse. Saupoudrer les pistaches supplémentaires et la pâte kataifi sur le pourtour. Réfrigérez-le pendant au moins 30 minutes, puis retirez-le du moule et décollez soigneusement le papier sulfurisé avant de servir. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9870,8999,'fr','Cheesecake japonais (chizu keki)','Essayez ce cheesecake de style japonais avec sa texture moelleuse et onctueuse caractéristique. Décorer de baies et de feuilles de menthe pour servir','["250 g de fromage à pâte molle, à température ambiante","35 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","60 ml de lait","3 œufs , séparés","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de yuzu","20 g de maïzena tamisée","15 g de farine ordinaire tamisée","75 g de sucre en poudre doré","des fraises, des myrtilles et quelques feuilles de menthe, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à charnière de 18 cm de papier sulfurisé. Enveloppez l’extérieur du moule avec du papier d’aluminium pour le rendre étanche.","Remplissez un petit bol ou une casserole résistant à la chaleur avec de l''eau juste bouillie. Mettez le fromage à pâte molle, le beurre et le lait dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur et placez-le sur la casserole d''eau chaude. Laisser fondre le beurre quelques minutes, puis remuer avec une spatule jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement fondu et que le mélange soit lisse. Retirer du feu. Ajoutez les jaunes d''œufs et le jus de yuzu, puis incorporez délicatement les farines tamisées jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Passer le mélange au tamis dans un autre bol pour garantir une pâte lisse. Mettez au réfrigérateur pendant que vous préparez le reste du cheesecake.","Dans un bol propre, fouettez les blancs d''œufs en ajoutant progressivement le sucre jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous (en prenant soin de ne pas trop fouetter). Incorporer un tiers au mélange de fromage pour le détendre, puis incorporer délicatement les deux tiers restants en deux lots, créant ainsi une pâte légère et aérée. Verser dans le moule à cake préparé.","Placez le moule à gâteau dans un plat à rôtir moyen et remplissez le plat à rôtir à moitié avec de l''eau juste bouillie pour créer un bain-marie. Cuire au four 20 minutes, puis baisser la température du four à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼. Continuez à cuire pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré.","Sortez le gâteau du four et sortez immédiatement le moule à gâteau du bain-marie. Retirez délicatement le papier d''aluminium et laissez le cheesecake refroidir dans le moule. Cette étape est cruciale pour éviter que l’éponge ne rétrécisse. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à cinq jours. Une fois refroidi, décorez de fraises, de myrtilles et de quelques feuilles de menthe."]','2026-01-11 00:02:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9871,9000,'fr','Cheesecake aux fraises cuit au four de niveau supérieur','Rehaussez le cheesecake aux fraises avec une croûte beurrée et une garniture cuite au four qui est veloutée et riche tout en étant légère. C''est un superbe dessert d''été','["120 g de beurre doux fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","300g de biscuits digestifs","25 g de sucre en poudre doré","750 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs","200 ml de crème sure","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 citron , zesté","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","400 g de fraises coupées en deux","25 g de sucre en poudre doré","100g de confiture de fraises","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer un moule à charnière de 20 cm et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé. Réduisez les biscuits en fines miettes dans un robot culinaire, ou mettez-les dans un sac alimentaire et écrasez-les avec un rouleau à pâtisserie. Versez dans un bol. Incorporer le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à du sable humide. Pressez fermement le mélange dans le fond du moule, puis utilisez le dos d''une cuillère ou d''un verre pour presser les miettes sur les côtés en une couche uniforme. Mettre au frais 20 minutes pour raffermir.","Pendant ce temps, pour la garniture, battre le fromage à pâte molle et le sucre dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en fouettant bien après chaque ajout. Incorporer la crème sure, la vanille et le zeste de citron, puis tamiser la farine et incorporer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Grattez la garniture sur le fond biscuité et lissez la surface à l''aide d''une spatule.","Mettez le cheesecake sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant environ 1 h 10, ou jusqu''à ce que le centre soit juste pris avec une très légère oscillation. Éteignez le four et laissez le cheesecake refroidir à l''intérieur avec la porte du four entrouverte pendant 1 heure. (Cela aide à éviter les fissures.) Une fois refroidi, transférez-le au réfrigérateur et réfrigérez pendant au moins 4 heures, ou toute la nuit.","Pendant ce temps, pour la garniture, mettez les fraises dans une passoire placée au-dessus d''un bol, puis saupoudrez-les de sucre et mélangez. Laissez macérer les fraises pendant environ 1 h. Versez le jus de fraise du bol dans une petite casserole avec la confiture et le jus de citron, et faites chauffer à feu doux jusqu''à ce que la confiture soit fondue et que le mélange soit brillant. Mélangez les fraises dans le mélange de confiture, puis empilez-les sur le cheesecake réfrigéré. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à deux jours. Retirez délicatement le cheesecake du moule, transférez-le dans une assiette de service et coupez-le en quartiers pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9872,9001,'fr','Cheesecake à la gelée de terrazzo','Essayez ce dessert lumineux et ludique. Des cubes de gelée sont suspendus dans un cheesecake crémeux pour créer un contraste de textures et un joli effet terrazzo','["Paquet de 135 g de gelée d''orange","135g de gelée de framboise","300g de biscuits digestifs","100 g de beurre doux, fondu","4 feuilles de gélatine","300 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de sucre en poudre","500 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la gelée d’orange. Faites bouillir la bouilloire, brisez les cubes de gelée d''orange et versez-les dans un pichet ou un bol. Versez sur 250 ml d''eau bouillante et remuez jusqu''à dissolution, ajoutez encore 100 ml d''eau froide et mélangez bien. Verser dans un petit récipient ou un plateau (le nôtre mesurait 20 x 30 cm) et laisser refroidir à température ambiante, puis réfrigérer pendant au moins 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris.","Répétez le même processus avec la gelée de framboise.","Tapisser les côtés d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé. Passez les biscuits au robot culinaire ou versez-les dans un sac alimentaire et réduisez-les en miettes fines à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Transférer dans un bol et incorporer le beurre fondu jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à du sable humide. Versez dans le moule préparé et appuyez sur le fond à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère jusqu''à obtenir une couche lisse et uniforme. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Remplissez un grand bol d''eau froide, ajoutez les feuilles de gélatine une à une pour éviter qu''elles ne collent entre elles et assurez-vous qu''elles soient complètement immergées. Laisser reposer 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Pendant ce temps, dans une casserole, faites chauffer doucement la crème et le sucre pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve et que la crème soit fumante. Retirer du feu. Retirez chaque feuille de gélatine de l''eau, essorez l''excès d''eau et incorporez-la à la crème chaude jusqu''à ce que toute la gélatine soit ajoutée et dissoute. Laisser refroidir à température ambiante, environ 30 min.","Versez le fromage à pâte molle, la vanille et la crème refroidie dans un bol et battez ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et crémeuse.","Coupez les gelées en petits cubes d''environ 1 cm, puis incorporez-les très délicatement au mélange crémeux en essayant de ne pas les briser. Versez le mélange dans le moule à charnière et lissez le dessus à l''aide d''une spatule. Mettre au frais au moins 3 heures.","Sortez le cheesecake du moule et transférez-le délicatement dans une assiette, puis coupez-le en tranches pour servir. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9873,9002,'fr','Cheesecake au cassis','Utilisez des cassis récoltés pour préparer ce cheesecake gourmand, avec une base de biscuit digestif classique et une garniture crémeuse. Cela fait un magnifique dessert d''été','["140 g de beurre doux fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","300g de biscuits digestifs","275 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de cassis frais ou surgelés (portés à température ambiante 1 h avant utilisation, s''ils sont surgelés)","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","900 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","3 œufs","200 ml de crème sure"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Beurrer le côté d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mettez les biscuits dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une fine miette, puis ajoutez le beurre et mixez à nouveau pour combiner. Versez dans le moule, puis appuyez fermement pour obtenir une couche uniforme et enfournez pendant 10 minutes. Annuler.","Versez 25 g de sucre et le cassis dans une petite casserole. Mélangez la maïzena avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau froide, puis ajoutez-la dans la poêle. Réchauffer à feu moyen-doux pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous, puis augmenter le feu à moyen et faire bouillonner pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit croustillant. Annuler.","Fouetter le fromage à pâte molle dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez le reste du sucre et fouettez à nouveau, puis ajoutez la farine, la vanille, les œufs et la crème sure, puis fouettez une troisième fois jusqu''à consistance lisse et bien mélangée.","Versez la moitié du mélange cheesecake sur le fond biscuité refroidi, puis parsemez la moitié de la sauce cassis refroidie. Versez sur le reste de la préparation au cheesecake et lissez soigneusement la surface à l''aide d''une spatule. Arroser du reste de sauce au cassis, puis l''étaler délicatement sur le mélange de cheesecake à l''aide d''une brochette ou du bout d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 10 minutes, puis réduire la température du four à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼ et cuire encore 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris avec une légère oscillation au milieu. Éteignez le four et laissez le cheesecake à l''intérieur porte fermée pendant 1 h, puis ouvrez légèrement la porte et laissez reposer encore 1 h. Enfin, laissez refroidir complètement à température ambiante, puis réfrigérez pendant au moins 3 heures ou toute la nuit avant de trancher. Se conserve au frais pendant cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9874,9003,'fr','Cheesecake aux mûres','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis ce dessert crémeux à la fin de l''été et au début de l''automne. Il est garni de mûres fraîches – ou utilisez des framboises pendant les mois d’été','["150g de biscuits digestifs","50g d''amandes moulues","100 g de beurre fondu","700 g de fromage à pâte molle","220 g de sucre semoule","1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait de vanille, plus 1 cuillère à café","3 œufs","250 g de mûres, plus une poignée pour servir","250 g de crème sure","quelques feuilles de menthe, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger les biscuits concassés avec les amandes et le beurre, puis presser le mélange au fond d''un moule à cake de 18-20 cm recouvert de papier sulfurisé. Cuire au four 15 minutes, puis laisser refroidir complètement jusqu''à ce que la croûte se raffermisse. Réduisez la température du four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1 et placez une plaque à pâtisserie remplie d''eau au fond du four.","Battez le fromage à pâte molle avec 200 g de sucre. Une fois le tout mélangé, incorporez l''extrait de vanille et battez tous les œufs, un à la fois. Enfin, incorporez la crème sure.","Mixez les mûres dans un mixeur et passez-les au tamis fin en jetant les graines. Il devrait vous rester environ 60 ml de purée de mûres. Incorporer 1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille et le reste du sucre, puis réserver. Verser la moitié du mélange cheesecake sur le fond de biscuit écrasé et arroser de la moitié de la purée de mûres. Utilisez une brochette pour créer un « tourbillon de mûres ». Répéter avec la moitié restante du mélange et la purée de mûres.","Cuire le cheesecake pendant 50 minutes à 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient fermes et que le centre vacille encore. Éteignez le four, ouvrez légèrement la porte et laissez le cheesecake refroidir à l''intérieur jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque froid. Sortez-le ensuite, laissez-le refroidir complètement et mettez-le au réfrigérateur toute la nuit. Répartir sur une poignée de mûres fraîches et quelques feuilles de menthe pour servir. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9875,9004,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat et à l''orange','Riche et gourmand, ce cheesecake fruité au chocolat et à l''orange ne prend pas longtemps à préparer. Vous pouvez également le préparer la veille, c''est donc parfait pour les journées chargées à venir.','["100g de beurre","200g de biscuits digestifs","300g de chocolat à l''orange 275g cassé en morceaux","400 g de fromage frais","300 ml de crème fraîche","75g de sucre glace","2 oranges"]','["Tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à cake à fond amovible de 20 cm. Écrasez les biscuits soit en les pulsant dans un robot culinaire, soit en les mettant dans un sac alimentaire et en les écrasant avec un rouleau à pâtisserie. Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle ou au micro-ondes puis incorporer les biscuits écrasés. Presser en une couche uniforme au fond du moule et réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes.","Faites fondre les 275 g de chocolat au micro-ondes ou dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante. Fouettez la crème jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous, puis incorporez le fromage à la crème. Tamisez le sucre glace et mélangez bien puis versez le chocolat fondu et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le mélange dans le moule et égalisez le dessus avec le dos de la cuillère. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant 4 heures ou toute la nuit.","Au moment de servir, coupez le haut et le bas des oranges à l''aide d''un petit couteau bien aiguisé puis coupez la peau en suivant la courbe de l''orange. En tenant l''orange d''une main au-dessus d''un bol, découpez soigneusement chaque segment et égouttez-le dans une passoire. Retirez le cheesecake du moule et disposez les segments dessus puis râpez-le sur le reste du chocolat."]','2026-01-11 00:02:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9876,5177,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat blanc et framboise sans gluten','Préparez une version de cheesecake sans gluten en utilisant des biscuits digestifs sans biscuits pour la base. Garnir d''une garniture soyeuse au chocolat blanc et à la framboise','["200 g de chocolat blanc, plus un peu pour décorer (facultatif)","275g de biscuits digestifs sans gluten","100 g de beurre doux, fondu","500 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","300 ml de crème fraîche","300 g de framboises fraîches"]','["Une heure avant de commencer, sortez tous les ingrédients du réfrigérateur et ramenez-les à température ambiante. Tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le chocolat blanc dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au micro-ondes pendant 1 min en remuant à mi-cuisson. Si nécessaire, remettez-le pendant 10 secondes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu. Vous pouvez également faire fondre le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d’une casserole d’eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le fond du bol ne rencontre pas l’eau. Laissez refroidir pendant que vous préparez la base.","Mixez les digestifs au robot culinaire, puis versez-les dans un bol ou écrasez-les dans le bol à l''aide du bout d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Versez le beurre fondu et mélangez jusqu''à ce que la texture ressemble à du sable humide. Versez dans le moule préparé et appuyez pour former une couche uniforme. Gardez au frais pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Battre ensemble le fromage à pâte molle, l''extrait de vanille et la crème double dans un bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et crémeuse. Incorporez le chocolat blanc fondu – s’il grippe, vous pouvez mettre le bol au micro-ondes pendant 10 secondes avant de fouetter pour le rassembler. Incorporez 250 g de framboises en veillant à ce qu''elles soient un peu brisées pour vous donner un peu d''ondulation.","Verser le mélange à cheesecake sur la base de biscuit et lisser jusqu''à obtenir une couche uniforme. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 6 heures, voire toute la nuit. Se conservera au frais pendant deux jours. Pour servir, retirez délicatement du moule et répartissez sur le reste des framboises, puis râpez-les sur un peu de chocolat blanc, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9877,9005,'fr','Cheesecake à la groseille','Associez des groseilles à maquereau piquantes avec du sirop de fleur de sureau sucré et du mascarpone crémeux dans ce cheesecake léger. C''est un magnifique dessert d''été – parfait pour une fête','["750 g de groseilles","4 cuillères à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau","1 orange, zestée et pressée","125 g de biscuits au gingembre","125g de biscuits digestifs","125g de beurre doux","500 g de fromage à pâte molle","250 g de mascarpone","125g de sucre glace"]','["Versez les groseilles à maquereau, 2 cuillères à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau et le jus d''orange dans une casserole. Cuire à feu moyen pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les groseilles soient ramollies mais pas complètement décomposées. Annuler.","Tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm de profondeur de papier sulfurisé. Mixez tous les biscuits au robot culinaire en miettes fines, puis versez-les dans un bol. Faites fondre le beurre à feu doux et incorporez-le aux miettes de biscuits pour bien mélanger. Versez dans le moule et appuyez sur une base uniforme. Réfrigérer pendant au moins 30 minutes ou jusqu''à 1 heure.","Mettez le fromage à pâte molle, le mascarpone, le reste du cordial et le zeste d''orange dans un bol et mélangez bien. Tamisez le sucre glace et mélangez le tout. Incorporez les trois quarts des groseilles cuites avec 1 cuillère à soupe de leur liquide de cuisson, puis versez le tout sur le fond biscuité. Réfrigérer au moins 4 heures ou toute la nuit.","Juste avant de servir, retirez le cheesecake du moule et déposez-le sur une assiette à gâteau ou un support. Verser les groseilles restantes au milieu du cheesecake, accompagnées d''un filet de liquide de cuisson."]','2026-01-11 00:02:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9878,9006,'fr','Carrés de cheesecake PB&J sans cuisson','Essayez ces carrés de cheesecake au beurre de cacahuète et à la confiture. Nous avons choisi une garniture aux fruits, mais vous pouvez opter pour du chocolat, en le transformant en une tasse géante de beurre de cacahuète.','["100g de beurre","250 g de biscuits digestifs réduits en fines miettes","500 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","100g de sucre glace","237 g de beurre de cacahuète croquant","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","300 ml de crème fraîche","4 cubes de gelée de framboise, coupés en petits morceaux","200 g de framboises surgelées, décongelées","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre"]','["Tapisser un moule carré de 18 à 20 cm d''une bande de papier sulfurisé en laissant les extrémités dépasser – cela vous aidera à retirer le cheesecake plus tard. Mettez le beurre dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur doté d''un large rebord et placez-le sur un petit bol résistant à la chaleur rempli d''eau bouillante provenant de la bouilloire. Laisser reposer une minute, puis remuer jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse. Incorporez les biscuits écrasés, puis versez le mélange dans le moule préparé en appuyant dessus avec le dos d''une cuillère.","Battre le fromage à pâte molle, le sucre glace, le beurre de cacahuète et la vanille dans un bol jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Fouetter la crème double dans un autre bol jusqu''à ce qu''elle tienne juste sa forme. Incorporez-le délicatement au mélange de beurre de cacahuète, puis étalez-le sur le fond de biscuit et lissez la surface à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère. Réfrigérer pendant au moins 1 heure pour prendre. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à une journée.","Pendant ce temps, versez les cubes de gelée dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et versez dessus 100 ml d''eau bouillante. Remuer pour dissoudre, puis ajouter les framboises et le sucre et remuer en écrasant les baies avec la cuillère. Passez au tamis dans un pichet, puis versez-le sur le cheesecake pris. Réfrigérer pendant au moins 4 heures. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux jours. Passez un couteau sur les côtés, puis utilisez le papier sulfurisé qui dépasse pour soulever le cheesecake sur une planche. Couper en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9879,9007,'fr','Cheesecake aux pêches','Ce superbe cheesecake utilise des pêches en conserve, de la meringue et un dessus de pâtisserie en treillis pour créer un dessert à partager appétissant.','["5 œufs séparés, plus 7 jaunes","375 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre vanillé","1 orange","450 g de farine nature","80g de farine de pomme de terre","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","500 g de beurre froid","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 kg de fromage blanc, à température ambiante","50 g de pudding à la vanille (ou maïzena plus 1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille)","3 gouttes d''extrait d''orange","1 boîte de pêches"]','["Fouettez 4 jaunes d''œufs avec 125 g de sucre glace et le sucre vanillé jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Ébouillantez l''orange avec de l''eau chaude et râpez le zeste.","Tamisez la farine nature et la fécule de pomme de terre et versez-les sur une planche à pâtisserie ou un plan de travail légèrement fariné, avec la levure chimique. Râpez plus de 250 g de beurre et hachez-le dans la farine avec un couteau, puis frottez-le pour que le mélange ressemble davantage à des miettes. Versez le mélange de jaunes et le zeste d''orange et rassemblez le mélange, puis pétrissez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle.","Coupez un tiers de la pâte, enveloppez-la bien et mettez-la au réfrigérateur. Abaissez le reste de pâte et tapissez-le le fond et les côtés d''un moule à charnière de 26 cm que vous aurez déjà tapissé d''un cercle de papier sulfurisé beurré. Mettez le moule au réfrigérateur pendant 20 minutes. Chauffer le four à 180°C/ventilateur 160°C/gaz 4. Tapisser la pâte de papier sulfurisé et remplir de billes de cuisson pour maintenir les côtés en place, puis cuire le fond pendant 10-15 minutes.","Pour préparer la garniture, passez le fromage blanc dans une passoire en métal. Battez le reste du beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit léger et mousseux, ajoutez le fromage, 8 jaunes d''œufs, 80 g de sucre glace, la poudre à pudding et l''extrait d''orange. Mélanger pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à consistance mousseuse. Battre 2 blancs d''œufs avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes et incorporer le reste du sucre glace pour obtenir une meringue ferme. Incorporez les blancs d''œufs au mélange de caillé.","Battez les 3 blancs d''œufs restants avec le sucre en poudre jusqu''à obtenir une meringue. Déballez la pâte crue et râpez-la sur une râpe à grosses dents. Étalez le mélange de fromage sur la base cuite. Égoutter les pêches, les couper en petits morceaux et les déposer sur la garniture au fromage. Couvrir la pâte de meringue, puis saupoudrer dessus un peu de pâte râpée. Pétrissez le reste de la pâte, étalez-la, découpez de fines bandes et disposez-les en forme de treillis. Cuire au four pendant 50 minutes à 1 heure. Laisser refroidir au four éteint pendant 40 minutes avant de démouler. Refroidissez complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:02:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9880,9008,'fr','Œufs de Pâques fourrés au cheesecake','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis ce succulent dessert de Pâques composé de biscuits écrasés et d''une garniture de cheesecake crémeuse emballée dans des œufs en chocolat creux.','["1 œuf de Pâques creux en chocolat","75g de biscuits digestifs","25 g de beurre fondu","75 g de mascarpone","100g de fromage à pâte molle","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace tamisé","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre, tamisé","100 g de crème fraîche","Des friandises de Pâques, comme des mini œufs en chocolat ou des chocolats émiettés","sauce caramel ou chocolat fondu refroidi"]','["Séparez soigneusement l''œuf de Pâques en deux le long de la couture. (Utilisez un couteau trempé dans un bol d''eau chaude pour couper à travers la couture plutôt que de trancher, car cela pourrait casser le chocolat.)","Versez les biscuits digestifs dans un bol ou un sac alimentaire et réduisez-les en miettes avec le bout d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Incorporer le beurre fondu jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à du sable humide. Versez-le dans les moitiés d’œufs de Pâques et tassez-les délicatement à l’aide du dos de la cuillère. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Mélanger le mascarpone, le fromage à pâte molle, le sucre glace et le cacao dans un bol moyen avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à consistance lisse. Dans un autre bol, battre la crème épaisse jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous à l''aide d''un fouet électrique. Incorporez délicatement la chantilly au mélange de mascarpone, puis versez délicatement la garniture au cheesecake sur les fonds de biscuits réfrigérés dans les œufs de Pâques. Nivelez doucement les surfaces avec un couteau à palette ou une spatule, puis réfrigérez pendant au moins 2 heures ou toute la nuit jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient fermes et prises. Il se peut que vous vous retrouviez avec une garniture de cheesecake supplémentaire, en fonction de la taille de vos œufs de Pâques – cela peut être versé dans des verres sur des miettes digestives supplémentaires pour une autre gâterie.","Répartissez les œufs remplis de cheesecake avec des mini œufs en chocolat ou d''autres friandises de Pâques, puis arrosez de caramel ou de chocolat fondu pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9881,9009,'fr','Cheesecake végétalien au four avec framboises et clémentine','Savourez un cheesecake cuit au four à base de noix de cajou pour une version végétalienne d''un dessert classique. Avec des clémentines, des framboises et des pistaches, c''est parfait pour Noël','["100 g de noix de cajou non salées","175g de crème de coco","150 g de fromage à pâte molle végétalien","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","70 ml de sirop d''érable","50 g d''huile de coco fondue","½ citron, jus","200g de framboises","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","50 g de pistaches décortiquées, hachées grossièrement","50 g d''écorces de clémentines confites","200 g de flocons d''avoine","75 g de sucre en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de coco fondue"]','["Mettez les noix de cajou dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur et couvrez d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Laisser ramollir 1 h.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser le fond d''un moule à gâteau rond de 20 cm (4 cm de profondeur) de papier sulfurisé. Pour faire la base, mettez les flocons d''avoine, le sucre et une pincée de sel dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en poudre fine. Incorporez l''huile de noix de coco jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène, puis ajoutez progressivement 3 à 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau jusqu''à obtenir une pâte – elle doit être friable et non collante.","Presser la pâte dans le fond et sur les côtés du moule à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir.","Réduisez le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Égouttez les noix de cajou, puis transférez-les dans l''ablenda avec la crème de coco, le fromage à pâte molle, la maïzena, la vanille, le sirop d''érable, l''huile de coco, le jus de citron et une pincée de sel. Mixez à grande vitesse jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit crémeux et lisse.","Versez le mélange de noix de cajou et de fromage à pâte molle sur la base et faites cuire au four pendant 1 h à 1 h 15 jusqu''à ce que le bord soit juste coloré et que le centre soit en grande partie pris avec juste une légère oscillation. Laisser refroidir complètement (il coulera légèrement en refroidissant), puis réfrigérer pendant au moins 3 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Mettez les framboises et le sucre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et passez au micro-ondes pendant 1 min 30 secondes à puissance maximale. Remuer et laisser refroidir complètement, puis verser le tout sur le cheesecake. Répartir sur les pistaches et les écorces de clémentines confites. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9882,9010,'fr','Cheesecake à la citrouille','Célébrez l''automne avec ce cheesecake de saison cuit au four. Avec une garniture crémeuse et légèrement épicée et une base de gingembre croquant, cela en vaut la peine.','["80 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","275g de biscuits digestifs ou au gingembre","1 gros blanc d''œuf (utiliser le jaune d''œuf dans la garniture ci-dessous)","800 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","Boîte de 425 g de purée de potiron","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","50g de farine nature","5 gros œufs et 1 gros jaune","400 ml de crème fouettée","cannelle moulue ou épices de citrouille, pour saupoudrer","25 g de noix de pécan hachées","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce caramel"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Beurrer un moule à cake profond de 22 cm de diamètre et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Enveloppez le fond et les côtés du moule avec trois couches de film alimentaire, suivies de trois couches de papier d''aluminium (cela permet de le garder imperméable pendant la cuisson). Pliez un torchon propre et placez-le au fond d''un plus grand plat à rôtir.","Réduisez les biscuits en miettes dans un robot culinaire. Ajouter le beurre fondu et mélanger pour enrober les miettes. Versez le mélange dans le moule à gâteau préparé, en l''étalant sur le côté et en appuyant avec le dos d''une cuillère. Enfourner 10 mn. À la sortie du four, badigeonnez de blanc d''œuf et enfournez encore 3 minutes (cela évitera que le fond ne soit détrempé).","Pour faire la garniture, mettez le fromage à pâte molle dans un bol ou dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle et battez avec un fouet électrique ou un batteur jusqu''à ce qu''il se détache. Ajouter la purée de potiron, le sucre et la farine et battre à nouveau jusqu''à homogénéité. Pendant que le moteur tourne, ajoutez progressivement les œufs et le jaune d''œuf jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et crémeux. Versez la garniture sur le fond de biscuit cuit, puis posez le moule à gâteau sur le torchon dans le plat à rôtir. Versez une bouilloire d''eau juste bouillie dans le plat à rôtir de manière à ce que l''eau atteigne la moitié du côté du moule à gâteau.","Cuire au four 10 minutes, puis baisser la température du four à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼. Cuire au four encore 1 h 30 jusqu''à ce que le cheesecake soit pris avec juste une légère oscillation au milieu lorsque vous secouez doucement le moule. Éteignez le four, puis ouvrez légèrement la porte du four et laissez le cheesecake refroidir à l''intérieur pendant 2 heures jusqu''à refroidissement complet. Retirer du four et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Retirez délicatement le cheesecake froid du moule et transférez-le sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette de service. Fouettez la crème jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous à l''aide d''un fouet électrique et versez-en de grosses cuillerées sur le cheesecake. Saupoudrez d''un peu de cannelle ou d''épices de citrouille, saupoudrez de pacanes hachées et arrosez de sauce caramel avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9883,9011,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat blanc, mascarpone et pistache','Essayez ce cheesecake cuit au four avec une différence. Avec une saveur légèrement acidulée, ainsi que des saveurs de chocolat blanc et de pistache, c''est un dessert paradisiaque.','["beurre, pour le moule","100g de chocolat blanc","200 g de biscuits digestifs écrasés","500 g de mascarpone","200 g de yaourt entier","3 œufs","100 g de sucre en poudre","1 citron, zesté, ½ jus","½ cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","50 g de pistaches décortiquées, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace (facultatif)","petits fruits mélangés, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm de profondeur de papier sulfurisé et beurrer le fond et les côtés. Faites fondre le chocolat blanc dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d’eau frémissante (assurez-vous que le fond du bol ne touche pas l’eau). Vous pouvez également faire fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes par petites rafales. Lorsque le chocolat est bien lisse, incorporez les biscuits et une petite pincée de sel. Appuyez sur le fond du moule, jusqu''aux bords, en vous assurant que le fond est uniforme. Mettre au réfrigérateur pour refroidir au moins 20 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1. Battre le mascarpone, le yaourt, les œufs, le sucre semoule, le zeste et le jus de citron et la pâte de gousse de vanille jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse, puis renverser le fond de biscuit. Transférez le moule sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque pris, avec juste une légère oscillation au milieu. Éteignez le four avec le cheesecake à l''intérieur et laissez la porte entrouverte. Laissez le cheesecake refroidir complètement.","Une fois complètement refroidi et pris, desserrez les côtés et le fond du moule avec un couteau et transférez délicatement le cheesecake dans une assiette de service. Répartir les pistaches et saupoudrer de sucre glace, puis servir avec les baies à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:02:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9884,9012,'fr','Cheesecake à la pâte à biscuits','Célébrez Pâques avec notre cheesecake crémeux au chocolat : il a une base riche parsemée de pâte à biscuits et le tout est garni d''une ganache soyeuse. Décorer avec des mini œufs et des biscuits','["huile de tournesol ou végétale, pour la boîte","200 g de chocolat au lait haché","100 g de chocolat noir haché","500 g de fromage à pâte molle","3 gros œufs, à température ambiante","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 ml de crème sure","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","225 g de sucre mou roux clair","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","250 g de beurre salé ramolli","2 jaunes d''œufs (congeler les blancs pour une autre recette)","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de vanille","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","225 g de farine nature","225 g de farine autolevante","200 g de pépites de chocolat noir","100 g de chocolat noir haché","100 g de chocolat au lait haché","300 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","mini œufs en chocolat, nids en chocolat et boutons en chocolat blanc (voir conseils ci-dessous)"]','["Tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake de 20 cm de profondeur avec du papier sulfurisé, puis tapisser les côtés à l''aide d''une bande de papier sulfurisé qui dépasse d''environ 7 cm du moule (car le cheesecake va monter au four). Huiler légèrement le papier sulfurisé.","Préparez la pâte à biscuits en battant les sucres et le beurre dans un batteur sur socle pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légère et mousseuse. Ajoutez les jaunes d''œufs, la pâte de vanille et le lait, puis battez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Répartissez le mélange dans deux bols à mélanger, puis battez la farine nature dans une moitié du mélange et la farine auto-levante dans l''autre. Répartissez les pépites de chocolat entre les deux bols et battez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que les pépites de chocolat soient uniformément réparties. Se conserve couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours.","Mettez le mélange de farine autolevante au réfrigérateur pendant que vous pressez la pâte à biscuits à la farine nature dans le fond de votre moule à gâteau préparé. Conservez au frais au réfrigérateur pendant que vous préparez le reste du cheesecake.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé, puis sortir du réfrigérateur la pâte à biscuits réalisée avec la farine autolevante. Pincez des morceaux de pâte et roulez-les en boules de la taille d''une bille jusqu''à ce que vous ayez utilisé toute la pâte. Espacez-les sur les plaques à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 5 à 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Pour préparer la partie principale du cheesecake, faites fondre les morceaux de chocolat au lait et le chocolat noir dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante, puis laissez refroidir un peu. Battez le fromage à pâte molle dans un grand bol pour le détendre, puis incorporez un œuf à la fois. Incorporer le sucre, la crème sure, la farine et la vanille pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Laisser reposer 20 minutes à température ambiante, puis verser lentement le chocolat et incorporer délicatement jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit de couleur homogène.","Chauffer le four à 170°C/150°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3½. Sortez le moule à cake du réfrigérateur et versez le mélange chocolat et fromage sur le fond de pâte à biscuits. Cuire au four pendant 40 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit pris avec une légère oscillation au centre, puis éteignez le four et laissez le cheesecake à l''intérieur refroidir lentement pendant 3 heures (il plongera légèrement au milieu). Mettre au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement froid.","Pour la ganache, mettez le chocolat noir et le chocolat au lait dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Mettez la crème et le sucre dans une casserole et faites chauffer sur feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fumants (ne laissez pas bouillir), puis versez sur le chocolat. Fouettez pour faire fondre le chocolat et créer un mélange onctueux et brillant. Réfrigérer au réfrigérateur pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que la ganache soit épaisse et utilisable à la cuillère.","Lorsque le cheesecake est froid, déposez-le sur une assiette de service ou un support à gâteau, puis tourbillonnez sur la ganache. Décorez avec les biscuits aux pépites de chocolat et quelques mini œufs en chocolat, des nids en chocolat et des boutons en chocolat blanc, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9885,9013,'fr','Gâteau au fromage Funfetti','Mettez toute la famille à la cuisine avec ce simple gâteau au fromage « funfetti ». Il n''utilise que sept ingrédients et ne nécessite aucune cuisson : parfait à préparer avec les enfants','["75 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","200g de biscuits digestifs","600 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","75g de sucre glace","300 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait de vanille","6 cuillères à soupe de pépites"]','["Beurrer et chemiser un moule à cake à fond amovible de 20 cm. Mettez les biscuits dans un sac alimentaire et réduisez-les en miettes avec un rouleau à pâtisserie ou passez-les au robot culinaire. Transférer dans un bol et incorporer le beurre. Versez dans le moule préparé et appuyez fermement pour obtenir une couche uniforme. Réfrigérer au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris.","Battre le fromage à pâte molle et le sucre glace avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez la crème et la vanille, puis continuez à battre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer 4 cuillères à soupe de pépites et verser le mélange sur la base de biscuit. Tapotez le moule sur un plan de travail pour vous assurer qu''il n''y a pas de bulles d''air, puis lissez la surface avec une spatule ou le dos d''une cuillère. Réfrigérer au moins 5 heures ou toute la nuit.","Sortez le cheesecake du réfrigérateur à température ambiante 30 minutes avant de servir. Placez la boîte sur une boîte de conserve, puis tirez les côtés de la boîte vers le bas. Glissez délicatement le cheesecake sur une assiette de service, puis retirez le papier sulfurisé et le fond du moule. Décorez avec les pépites restantes."]','2026-01-11 00:02:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9886,9014,'fr','Coulis de framboise','Préparez une fournée de coulis de framboise à utiliser comme garniture fruitée pour un cheesecake, comme sauce pour les desserts, à incorporer dans un yaourt ou à verser sur de la crème glacée.','["450g de framboises","½ petit citron, jus","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un petit robot culinaire ou utilisez un mixeur plongeant pour mixer jusqu''à obtenir une consistance très lisse.","Placez un tamis sur une cruche. Versez le mélange dans le tamis et faites passer le liquide à l''aide d''une spatule. Jetez les graines. Le coulis est prêt à l''emploi. Se conserve au réfrigérateur dans un bocal hermétique jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9887,9015,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis ce dessert au chocolat décadent. C''est une fin gourmande pour un dîner ou un repas de famille le week-end.','["150g de biscuits digestifs (environ 10)","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","45 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","150g de chocolat noir","120 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à café de cacao en poudre","200 g de fromage frais entier","115 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Pour réaliser la base biscuitée, écrasez les biscuits digestifs avec un rouleau à pâtisserie ou passez-les au robot culinaire, puis versez-les dans un bol avec le sucre et le beurre et mélangez. Beurrez et chemisez un moule à charnière de 18 cm et versez-y le mélange biscuité en l''enfonçant avec le dos d''une cuillère. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes.","Pour réaliser le cheesecake, faites fondre le chocolat par petits coups au micro-ondes, puis laissez refroidir légèrement. Fouettez la crème dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à formation de pics mous, puis incorporez la poudre de cacao. Battez le fromage à la crème et le sucre ensemble, puis incorporez le mélange de crème et le chocolat refroidi.","Verser le mélange de cheesecake sur la base de biscuit en l''égalisant avec le dos d''une cuillère. Transférer au congélateur et congeler pendant 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris. Retirer du moule et laisser ramollir à température ambiante pendant environ 20 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9888,9016,'fr','Cheesecake au yaourt et abricots rôtis au miel','Transformez vos desserts avec un filet de nectar doré. Garnissez ce cheesecake au miel d''abricots rôtis au miel ou remplacez-le par des fruits rouges ou de la rhubarbe.','["75 g de beurre salé fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de biscuits à la crème anglaise","250 ml de crème fraîche","150 g de yaourt grec entier","500 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","3 cuillères à soupe de miel liquide","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gousse de vanille","6 abricots mûrs, coupés en deux et dénoyautés (environ 240g)","50 g de miel liquide, plus 2 cuillères à soupe pour servir","1 petite orange, le zeste coupé en lanières","½ gousse de vanille, coupée en deux dans le sens de la longueur"]','["Beurrer le fond d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm et le tapisser d''un cercle de papier sulfurisé. Réduisez les biscuits en fines miettes dans un robot culinaire, puis versez-les dans un bol et mélangez avec le beurre. Versez le mélange au fond du moule et laissez refroidir 10 minutes.","Fouettez la crème double jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous. Dans un autre bol, fouetter ensemble le yaourt, le fromage à pâte molle, le miel et la vanille jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer la crème et verser sur la base. Lisser le dessus avec une spatule et couvrir. Réfrigérer au moins 4 heures ou toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger les abricots avec les 50g de miel, le zeste d''orange et la vanille sur une plaque allant au four. Rôtir sur la grille du milieu pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les abricots soient tendres mais conservent leur forme. Mélangez le tout à mi-cuisson, en ajoutant 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau si le miel commence à s''accrocher. Laisser refroidir en jetant l''orange et la gousse de vanille.","Utilisez un couteau pour détacher les côtés du cheesecake et retirez-le du moule. Verser sur les abricots avec le jus de torréfaction. Versez un peu de miel supplémentaire sur le dessus, en lui permettant de couler sur les côtés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9889,9017,'fr','Gâteau au fromage et au pudding de Noël','Croisez un pudding de Noël avec un cheesecake et qu''obtenez-vous ? Une fantastique alternative au dessert festif avec une base de gingembre croquant et une garniture crémeuse','["200 g de biscuits au gingembre et aux noix écrasés","30 g de sucre muscovado léger","1 cuillère à café de sel marin feuilleté","110 g de beurre doux, fondu","240 g de pudding de Noël","30 ml de cognac","30 ml de bière brune","1 orange, zestée","2 pots de 280 g de fromage à la crème entier","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","200 g de sucre muscovado léger","2 gousses de vanille fendues et graines grattées","2 clémentines","sucre muscovado léger, pour saupoudrer"]','["Pour faire la base, mélangez les noix de gingembre et le sucre dans un grand bol et saupoudrez de sel feuilleté. Versez le beurre fondu et mélangez avec une cuillère en bois pour former un mélange semblable à des miettes de biscuit. Presser dans un moule à charnière rond de 20 cm en étalant le mélange en une couche uniforme jusqu''aux coins. Réfrigérer au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris.","Mettez le pudding de Noël, le brandy, la stout et le zeste d''orange dans un mixeur et réduisez en purée.","A l''aide d''un fouet électrique à main, battre le cream cheese avec la crème double, le sucre et les graines de vanille, puis incorporer à la purée. Étalez le mélange sur le fond de biscuit et laissez reposer une nuit au réfrigérateur.","Le lendemain, épluchez les clémentines, coupez-les en rondelles et disposez-les sur une plaque allant au four. Saupoudrez-les de sucre, puis chalumez-les jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient caramélisés et laissez-les refroidir. Démoulez le cheesecake et disposez les clémentines dessus. Se conserve trois jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:02:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9890,9018,'fr','Cheesecake muscovado à la mijoteuse, noisettes et mûres','Ce cheesecake incroyablement crémeux contient un somptueux sirop de baies et le croquant de noisettes grillées pour couronner le tout : idéal pour nourrir une foule.','["50 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de biscuits à l''avoine (type Hobnobs)","100 g de noisettes blanchies","250 g de sucre muscovado léger","4 cuillères à soupe de lait entier","750 g de fromage frais entier","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs","200 ml de crème sure en pot","1 cuillère à soupe de Frangelico (facultatif)","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","200g de mûres"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire et préparez votre mijoteuse (au moins 22 cm de large). Faites un dessous de plat pour votre cheesecake en froissant un long morceau de papier d''aluminium pour en faire une saucisse. Rouler en une bobine lâche et placer au fond de la mijoteuse. Allumez la mijoteuse et versez suffisamment d''eau chaude pour atteindre 4 cm sur les côtés. Enveloppez l''extérieur d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm de côté avec deux couches de film alimentaire puis de papier d''aluminium – assurez-vous qu''il n''y a pas d''espace permettant à l''eau de s''infiltrer. Beurrez l''intérieur, recouvrez de film alimentaire et graissez à nouveau, puis tapissez le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé.","Versez les biscuits et 50 g de noisettes dans un robot culinaire et mixez-les en miettes fines. Ajouter le beurre et mélanger à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez les miettes dans le moule – utilisez une cuillère pour enfoncer dans le fond. Mettre au frais 10 min.","Dans une casserole, faites chauffer le muscovado et le lait jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Laisser refroidir. Dans un bol, battre le fromage à la crème, la farine, la vanille et les œufs jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer la crème sure, le Frangelico (le cas échéant) et le mélange de sucre refroidi jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez dans le moule et mettez-le délicatement dans la mijoteuse. Enveloppez le couvercle dans un torchon pour éviter que la condensation ne coule sur le cheesecake. Couvrez et laissez cuire 2 heures, puis éteignez la mijoteuse. Laissez le cheesecake à l''intérieur sans l''ouvrir pendant encore 2 heures. Retirer de la mijoteuse et laisser refroidir à température ambiante pendant encore 1 heure, puis réfrigérer pendant 4 heures ou toute la nuit.","Mettez la maïzena, le sucre semoule et la moitié des mûres dans une casserole et faites chauffer sur feu vif. Cuire 3-4 minutes en écrasant un peu les mûres jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient sirupeuses. Ajoutez les baies restantes, faites chauffer, puis retirez du feu et laissez refroidir jusqu''au moment de servir. Hachez grossièrement le reste des noix et faites-les griller dans une poêle.","Pour servir, retirez délicatement le cheesecake du moule, retirez le papier sulfurisé et transférez-le sur une assiette ou un support à gâteau. Garnir de baies et de noisettes et servir avec un shot de Frangelico, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9891,9019,'fr','Barres de cheesecake tropicales','De la mangue fraîche, une base de biscuit croquant et une garniture onctueuse au fromage à la crème constituent un dessert d''été léger que tout le monde adorera. Garnir de fruits de la passion, d''ananas et de crème au citron crémeuse.','["200 g de biscuits au gingembre","200g de biscuits digestifs","200 g de beurre fondu","3 x 280 g de fromage frais","200 g de sucre en poudre","50g de farine nature","le zeste d''1 citron","3 gros œufs battus","200 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de mangue fraîche coupée en petits cubes","4 fruits de la passion","3 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","50 g de tranches de mangue et d''ananas","feuilles de menthe"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule rectangulaire de 20 x 30 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mettez les biscuits dans un grand sac alimentaire et écrasez-les avec quelque chose de lourd comme un rouleau à pâtisserie, ou passez-les au robot culinaire. Mettez les miettes de biscuits dans un grand bol et versez sur le beurre fondu, mélangez bien, puis versez dans votre moule préparé. Pressez bien le mélange avec le dos d''une cuillère pour former une couche compressée. Cuire au four préchauffé pendant 10 min. Sortez-le du four pour qu''il refroidisse et baissez le four à 120°C/100°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1/2.","Dans un autre grand bol, fouettez ensemble le reste des ingrédients du cheesecake jusqu''à consistance lisse, vous pouvez le faire avec des batteurs électriques ou avec un fouet ballon. Versez sur le fond biscuité puis répartissez ici et là les morceaux de mangue en enfonçant certains dans le cheesecake et en laissant d''autres trôner fièrement à la surface. Cuire au four pendant 1h puis ouvrir la porte du four et laisser refroidir encore 30 minutes. Une fois froid, placez le cheesecake entier au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Au moment de servir, passez la chair du fruit de la passion au tamis pour éliminer les pépins puis mélangez la pulpe obtenue avec la crème au citron. Verser le mélange sur le cheesecake et décorer de feuilles de mangue fraîche, d''ananas et de menthe."]','2026-01-11 00:02:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9892,9020,'fr','Cheesecake glacé au chocolat et aux noisettes','Personne ne devinera que ce cheesecake facile, riche et crémeux, sans cuisson et préparé à l''avance, n''utilise que 4 ingrédients : idéal pour un dîner.','["200 g de cornflakes au miel et aux noix","2 pots de 400g de pâte à tartiner chocolat noisette","2 pots de 180 g de fromage à la crème entier","1 cuillère à soupe de noisettes grillées et concassées"]','["Mettez les cornflakes et un demi-pot de pâte à tartiner au chocolat et aux noisettes dans un bol et battez pour combiner – ne vous inquiétez pas de briser les cornflakes. Pressez le mélange dans le fond d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm.","Dans un autre bol, battre le fromage à la crème jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporer le reste de la pâte à tartiner au chocolat et aux noisettes. Lisser sur la base des cornflakes, envelopper hermétiquement dans un film alimentaire et congeler toute la nuit.","Retirer du congélateur 30 minutes avant de servir ou jusqu''à ce que vous puissiez le couper facilement avec un couteau bien aiguisé. Servir en tranches saupoudrées de noisettes. Se conserve au congélateur jusqu''à 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:02:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9893,9021,'fr','Cheesecakes au pain croisé chaud','Un dessert crémeux qui a exactement le goût de votre pâtisserie de Pâques préférée : le petit pain chaud. Garnir de zeste d''orange, de jus et d''un filet de glaçage pour la croix caractéristique','["150 g de biscuits au gingembre","25 g de raisins secs","25 g de zestes mélangés","50g de beurre","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","280 g de fromage frais en paquet","25g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","100 g de mascarpone","2 œufs légèrement battus","150g de sucre glace","½ orange, le zeste et le jus"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer 6 ramequins d''une capacité de 150 ml. Placez les biscuits au gingembre dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient coupés en très petits morceaux, puis ajoutez les raisins secs et les écorces mélangées et mixez à nouveau une ou deux fois pour combiner.","Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle, puis incorporer la cannelle puis le mélange biscuité. Répartissez équitablement dans les ramequins afin que le fond de chacun soit recouvert d''une couche d''environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Appuyez un peu avec le dos d''une cuillère à café puis faites-les cuire sur une plaque au four pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés. Laisser refroidir, puis baisser le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2.","Fouetter ensemble tous les ingrédients de la garniture du cheesecake jusqu''à consistance lisse. Disposez les ramequins sur une plaque à pâtisserie et versez un peu du mélange dans chacun d''eux en remplissant jusqu''à environ 1 cm sous le bord. Glissez-les délicatement dans le four et faites cuire pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste pris. Le mélange doit être encore légèrement bancal lorsqu’on le tapote doucement. Ne vous inquiétez pas s’il plonge un peu ou se fissure. Sortir du four et laisser refroidir complètement avant de recouvrir d''un film alimentaire et de mettre au réfrigérateur. Vous pouvez vous y rendre jusqu''à 2 jours à l''avance.","Pour réaliser la décoration, placez le sucre glace dans un grand bol et ajoutez suffisamment de jus d''orange pour obtenir une pâte ferme. Transférer dans une poche à douille jetable et couper l’extrémité. Passez un petit couteau sur le pourtour des cheesecakes et démoulez-les sur une planche de façon à ce que la couche de biscuit soit tournée vers le haut. Utilisez le mélange de glaçage à l''orange pour former une croix sur le dessus de chacun, puis utilisez une tranche de gâteau ou un couteau à palette pour placer sur des assiettes, puis saupoudrez de zeste d''orange avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9894,9451,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat et à l''orange','Ce dessert décadent à préparer à l''avance est parfait pour un dîner ou un buffet festif, avec une garniture au fromage à la crème piquante et une base de biscuit au chocolat noir.','["200 g de biscuits digestifs au chocolat noir cassés grossièrement","75 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour graisser","4 gros œufs","2 gros jaunes d''oeuf","2 pots de 280 g de fromage à la crème entier","Pot de 150 ml de crème double","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","le zeste finement râpé de 1½ orange","4 cuillères à soupe de liqueur d''orange type Cointreau","50 g de chocolat au lait orange râpé","50 g de chocolat au lait d''amande râpé"]','["Beurrer légèrement et tapisser un moule à charnière de 20 cm. Pour faire la base, mettez les biscuits et le beurre dans un robot culinaire, réduisez-les en fines miettes, puis versez-les dans le moule. Répartir uniformément sur le fond et appuyer fermement avec le dos d''une cuillère. Mettez le moule au congélateur et laissez reposer 30 minutes.","Placez un grand morceau de papier d''aluminium (extra-large si possible) sur le plan de travail ou entrecroisez deux petits morceaux de papier d''aluminium. Placez le moule à gâteau au centre du papier d''aluminium et remontez les côtés pour créer un bol en aluminium autour du cheesecake. Placer dans un plat à rôtir de taille moyenne.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Pour préparer la garniture, mettez les œufs et les jaunes d''œufs dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Ajoutez le fromage, la crème, le sucre, le zeste d''orange et la liqueur d''orange dans le robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit tout juste combiné. Versez délicatement la garniture au cheesecake sur le fond refroidi.","Ajoutez suffisamment d''eau juste bouillie dans le plat à rôtir pour qu''elle monte d''environ 2 cm sur les côtés. Placez délicatement le plat à rôtir au centre du four et enfournez pendant environ 1 h 15 min. Le cheesecake est prêt lorsqu''il est très légèrement doré et à peine pris.","Sortez du four et saupoudrez de chocolat râpé. Laisser refroidir au bain-marie pendant 15 min. Sortez le moule à gâteau de l''eau et laissez-le refroidir encore 1 heure. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer le cheesecake toute la nuit avant de servir.","Pour servir, passez un couteau à lame ronde autour du cheesecake et démoulez-le délicatement. À l''aide d''un couteau à palette, faites glisser le cheesecake sur une assiette de service plate ou un support à gâteau et coupez-le en quartiers pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9895,9022,'fr','Pots de cheesecake aux airelles et au gingembre','Superposez des snaps au gingembre, un fromage à la crème piquant et de la confiture d''airelles dans des verres pour ces superbes desserts individuels pour terminer un dîner suédois pour deux.','["50 g de fromage frais entier","75 ml de crème fraîche","le zeste râpé d''une demi-orange","4 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''airelles sauvages (nous avons utilisé de la confiture d''airelles sauvages Félix) ou de gelée de canneberges, plus un petit supplément pour servir","8 morceaux de gingembre pepparkakor suédois ou 4 noix de gingembre écrasées, plus 1 supplémentaire pour servir","noix de beurre fondue"]','["Fouetter le fromage à la crème, la crème double et le zeste d''orange dans un bol moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient épais et conservent leur forme. Faites attention à ne pas trop fouetter, sinon le fromage à la crème deviendra liquide. Répartir doucement la confiture d''airelles.","Mélangez les biscuits concassés et le beurre et versez dans 2 verres. Répartissez le mélange d''airelles dans les verres et réfrigérez jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin – au moins 30 minutes. Les cheesecakes peuvent être préparés jusque-là la veille.","Pour servir, mélangez un peu de confiture avec 1 cuillère à café d''eau et arrosez les cheesecakes. Émietter le reste du biscuit et saupoudrer dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:02:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9896,9023,'fr','Cheesecake au citron meringué','Servez une tranche de cette friandise sucrée et retrouvez-vous au paradis des doubles desserts : la tarte au citron meringuée rencontre le cheesecake crémeux aux agrumes.','["huile de colza, pour graisser","Paquet de 300 g de noix de gingembre réduites en miettes","100 g de beurre fondu","3 pots de 280 g de fromage à la crème entier","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","le zeste de 3 citrons, le jus de 1","3 gros œufs, plus 1 jaune (garder le blanc)","300 ml de crème sure","2 pots de 312 g de crème de citron (nous avons utilisé Tiptree)","1 gros œuf, plus 3 gros jaunes (garder les blancs)","jus d''1 citron","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","4 gros blancs d''œufs (d''en haut)","300 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de glucose liquide"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer un moule rond à fond libre ou à charnière de 25 cm avec un peu d''huile, et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''une double couche de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la chapelure de biscuit et le beurre fondu, puis pressez-la au fond du moule. Enfourner 10 mn.","Pour préparer la garniture, battez le fromage à la crème pendant 1 à 2 minutes avec un fouet électrique dans votre plus grand bol jusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux. Ajoutez le sucre, la farine, la vanille, le zeste et le jus de citron avec une pincée de sel. Enfin, incorporez les œufs et la crème sure jusqu''à homogénéité. Versez la garniture dans le moule et tapotez plusieurs fois brusquement sur le comptoir pour éliminer les bulles. Cuire au four 40 mn.","Mélangez ensemble les ingrédients de la couche de citron. Versez délicatement le mélange sur le cheesecake et remettez au four pendant 40 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce que les bords soient fermes mais encore un peu bancal au milieu. Éteignez le four et laissez le cheesecake jusqu''à ce qu''il soit froid, puis réfrigérez pendant au moins 2 heures ou toute la nuit.","Quelques heures avant de servir, préparez la meringue. Mettez les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol et mettez le sucre dans une petite casserole avec 100 ml d''eau et le glucose liquide. Placer sur feu doux-moyen jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit fondu, puis augmenter le feu et faire bouillir avec un thermomètre à sucre dans la casserole. Lorsque le thermomètre atteint 100°C, battez les blancs avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à formation de pics fermes. Continuez à faire bouillir le sirop de sucre jusqu''à ce qu''il atteigne le stade de boule molle – 113 °C sur le thermomètre. Retirez du feu et, tout en battant les blancs, versez le sirop en filet lent et régulier – évitez de heurter les lames du fouet. Continuez à battre jusqu''à ce que la meringue soit ferme. Empilez-la avec une grande cuillère sur le cheesecake, puis utilisez un chalumeau pour caraméliser la meringue, ou enfournez à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 pendant environ 5 minutes. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9897,9024,'fr','Cheesecake mascarpone & ananas','Ce cheesecake astucieux utilise des gâteaux d''avoine écrasés et de la noix de coco desséchée pour la base et de l''ananas naturellement sucré pour un dessert à faible teneur en sucre.','["40g de beurre","100 g de galettes d''avoine, réduites en miettes","25 g de noix de coco desséchée grillée","Boîte de 425 g d''ananas au jus naturel, égoutté","5 feuilles de gélatine","Pot de 250 g de mascarpone allégé","500 g de fromage frais en pot (version entière)","Boîte de 160 g de crème de coco","le zeste râpé d''un demi citron"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle et incorporer la chapelure de biscuits et tout sauf 1 cuillère à soupe de noix de coco. Bien mélanger puis presser très fermement sur le fond d''un moule à charnière de 21 cm légèrement huilé pour former une couche ferme. Froideur.","Hachez finement une tranche d''ananas puis réduisez le reste en pulpe dans un robot culinaire ou avec un mixeur plongeant. Faites tremper la gélatine dans de l''eau froide pour la ramollir. Dans un bol, battre ensemble le mascarpone et le fromage frais.","Faites chauffer très doucement la crème de coco dans une petite casserole. Pressez l''excès d''humidité de la gélatine, ajoutez-la à la noix de coco chaude et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fondue. Incorporer au mélange mascarpone avec l''ananas et le zeste de citron écrasés et hachés puis verser sur le fond de biscuit et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris.","Retirer délicatement du moule, glisser sur une assiette et décorer avec la noix de coco réservée sur le pourtour."]','2026-01-11 00:02:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9898,9025,'fr','Cheesecake semi-freddo au citron vert','Ce joli dessert glacé peut être préparé à l''avance et congelé jusqu''à 3 mois – parfait pour un dîner de Noël.','["140 g de biscuits digestifs grossièrement cassés","75 g de beurre fondu","300g de lait concentré","200 g de fromage frais entier","150 ml de crème fraîche","le zeste finement râpé de 3 citrons verts, plus un peu pour servir","3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert (à partir de 2 citrons verts)","200 g de canneberges fraîches ou surgelées","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe d''arrow-root moulu ou de farine de maïs"]','["Tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g d''un grand morceau de papier d''aluminium. Appuyez bien sur le fond et les côtés du moule et laissez dépasser les bords. Mettez les biscuits dans un sac de congélation et réduisez-les en miettes avec un rouleau à pâtisserie. Mélangez avec le beurre fondu et versez les miettes dans le moule préparé – appuyez fermement sur le fond pour créer une couche uniforme. Réfrigérer pendant que la garniture est préparée.","Utilisez un fouet électrique à puissance moyenne pour battre le lait concentré, le fromage et la crème ensemble jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et épaissie – cela prendra environ 2 minutes. Ajoutez le zeste et le jus râpés et battez lentement jusqu''à ce que le mélange de fromage forme des pics mous.","Verser le mélange de citron vert sur la base de biscuit. Couvrir légèrement avec le papier d’aluminium qui dépasse et sceller fermement pour empêcher autant d’air que possible d’entrer. Envelopper dans une deuxième couche de papier d''aluminium, mettre dans un grand sac de congélation et congeler toute la nuit.","Pour réaliser la compote de canneberges, mettez les canneberges, le sucre et 150 ml d''eau froide dans une casserole et portez à ébullition. Cuire 5 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les canneberges soient ramollies mais conservent leur forme. Mélangez l''arrow-root ou la maïzena avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez-les aux fruits. Cuire encore 2 minutes en remuant régulièrement. Laisser refroidir, puis couvrir et réfrigérer. Peut être congelé à ce stade.","Démoulez le cheesecake surgelé sur un plat ou une planche et laissez-le décongeler pendant 30 minutes, puis retirez délicatement le papier d''aluminium. Réchauffez doucement la compote de canneberges et servez avec le semifreddo tranché."]','2026-01-11 00:02:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9899,9026,'fr','Barres de cheesecake épicées à l''érable et aux pacanes','Ce riche gâteau au fromage est épicé avec des saveurs chaleureuses de gingembre, de cannelle et de muscade – garni de sirop d''érable et de noix.','["Paquet de 250 g de biscuits au gingembre et aux noix","140 g de beurre salé fondu","200 g de noix de pécan","3 pots de 250 g de fromage à la crème","300 ml de crème sure en pot","150 ml de sirop d''érable (acheter une bouteille de 330 ml)","85 g de sucre muscovado léger","3 œufs moyens","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","½ noix de muscade entière, râpée","sirop d''érable restant (environ 175 ml)","100g de beurre salé","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre muscovado léger","100 g de noix de pécan grossièrement cassées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser un moule à brownie de 20 x 30 cm de papier sulfurisé – si vous utilisez un moule à fond lâche, assurez-vous de bien le tapisser, car le mélange de cheesecake est très liquide (cette recette fonctionnera également dans un moule à gâteau profond de 23 cm). Mettez les biscuits dans un robot culinaire et mixez en miettes fines, ajoutez le beurre et les pacanes, et mixez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et que les pacanes soient finement hachées mais aient encore un peu de texture. Verser dans le moule et presser pour obtenir une couche uniforme et compacte avec le dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four 10 minutes, puis sortir du four et laisser refroidir.","Battre le fromage à la crème et la crème sure dans un grand bol jusqu''à consistance lisse et homogène. Ajouter le sirop d''érable, le sucre, les œufs, la vanille, la farine et les épices, et mélanger à nouveau jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser sur le fond biscuité, mettre au centre du four et enfourner 15 min.","Baissez le feu à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1/2 et poursuivez la cuisson encore 30 mn. Éteignez le four et laissez le cheesecake à l''intérieur pendant 1 h, puis laissez reposer encore 1 h avec la porte entrouverte. Enfin, laissez à température ambiante jusqu''à refroidissement complet, puis mettez au frais au moins 3 heures ou, mieux encore, toute la nuit.","Pour réaliser le topping, faites fondre le reste du sirop d''érable avec le beurre, le sucre et une bonne pincée de sel. Faites bouillir pendant 2-3 minutes, puis incorporez les noix de pécan et laissez refroidir et épaissir un peu. Avant de servir, retirez le cheesecake du moule, versez le caramel érable-noix de pécan sur le dessus du cheesecake (réchauffez-le s''il commence à trop prendre), puis coupez-le en barres. Les restes se conservent au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9900,9027,'fr','Plage de biscuits au cheesecake','Si vous vous sentez créatif, cette scène de plage en biscuits fourrée au cheesecake à la vanille sera non seulement brillante, mais aussi délicieuse.','["375g de beurre légèrement salé","huile, pour graisser","500 g de fromage frais entier","1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait de vanille","200 g de sucre glace","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","100 g de beurre légèrement salé ramolli","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 oeufs, battus","150 g de framboises barquette","des centaines et des milliers, pour décorer","500 g de biscuits assortis","glace, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Préparez d’abord votre glaçage pour château de sable et cheesecake. Faites chauffer doucement le beurre dans une casserole. Pendant ce temps, versez les biscuits dans un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir des miettes fines et semblables à du sable. Ajouter le beurre et mélanger à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Réservez pendant que vous préparez le glaçage du cheesecake.","Mettez le fromage à la crème dans un grand bol et, à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battez pendant quelques secondes jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez l''extrait de vanille, tamisez sur le sucre glace et mélangez bien. Versez la crème et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et suffisamment épais pour être gonflé. Transvaser dans une poche à douille munie d''une grosse douille étoile.","Badigeonnez votre moule à châteaux de sable d''un peu d''huile, puis tapissez le fond d''un cercle de papier sulfurisé. Remplissez avec un peu de sable à biscuit beurré, de manière à ce qu''il remonte de 2,5 cm sur le côté, et tassez. Pour créer un trou dans lequel insérer le centre de glaçage du cheesecake, trouvez un verre qui reposera sur le sable à biscuit dans votre moule et laissez un espace d''environ 1,5 cm autour du bord. Graisser le verre avec un peu d''huile et le mettre dans le récipient du château de sable. Mettez davantage de sable à biscuit autour du verre jusqu''à ce que le moule soit plein, puis réservez les restes de sable. Mettre au frais 1h. Remuez le verre et démoulez-le. S''il ne se démoule pas facilement, remplissez-le d''eau chaude et laissez reposer quelques minutes. Faites glisser le verre et faites tomber l''eau. Versez le glaçage dans la cavité, en déposant quelques poignées de framboises au fur et à mesure – assurez-vous de réserver environ 20 framboises pour décorer les cupcakes et remplir tout le cornet. Conservez le reste du glaçage dans la poche à douille et mettez au frais. Ajoutez un peu plus de sable beurré pour recouvrir le glaçage, en emballant fermement le mélange dans le récipient, puis laissez refroidir pendant au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris.","Préparez les gâteaux coniques. Pour réaliser les mini cornets et les caissettes à cupcakes gaufrés, placez un torchon plié sur votre plan de travail et posez un cornet gaufré dessus. Utilisez le torchon pour soutenir le cône et, avec un couteau dentelé, marquez doucement autour du milieu du cône. Répétez avec 8 autres cônes (vous devez garder 1 cône entier pour le sommet du château de sable). Coupez très soigneusement chaque cône en deux le long de la ligne rainurée, en essayant de ne pas les casser ou les briser. Vous vous retrouverez avec 9 mini cornets du bas du cornet et 9 caissettes à cupcakes gaufrées du haut du cornet. Si l''un des cônes se brise, ajoutez-le simplement au mélange de sable à l''étape 7.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Pour réaliser les mini gâteaux en cornet, tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous avec 9 nids de papier d''aluminium froissés. Placez les mini-cônes au centre des nids en aluminium et moulez le papier d''aluminium autour des pointes pour les soutenir et les maintenir droits. Mettez 25 g de beurre, 25 g de sucre, 25 g de farine, 1,4 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille et 25 g d''œuf battu dans un grand bol. À l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battre ensemble jusqu''à ce que tout soit combiné. Transférez le mélange dans une poche à douille jetable et coupez à 1 cm de l''extrémité. Versez le mélange dans les mini cornets en veillant à ne les remplir qu''aux trois quarts, car la génoise va monter dans le four – il se peut qu''il vous reste un peu de mélange. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Partir\r\nrefroidir.","Pour préparer les cupcakes en cornet gaufré, tapissez un moule à mini muffins à 12 trous de cercles de papier sulfurisé. Placez les 9 caissettes à cupcakes gaufrés dans le moule. Mettez les 75 g de beurre restants, 75 g de sucre, 75 g de farine, 3 à 4 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille et le reste de l''œuf battu dans un grand bol et battez ensemble avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Transférer dans une poche à douille et utiliser pour remplir les plus grands cônes, encore une fois en ne remplissant qu''aux trois quarts. Cuire au four pendant 18 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir en n''oubliant pas de décoller les disques de papier sulfurisé avant de glacer.","Préparez ensuite le sable à biscuit. Maintenant, préparez le sable pour votre plage. Mélangez les biscuits et les cônes cassés dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''ils ressemblent à de fines miettes, puis réservez. Coupez 3 flocons à la bonne taille pour avoir un demi-flocon pour la glace retournée, 9 morceaux moyens de flocon pour les cupcakes et des mini morceaux de flocon pour les cornets. Certains flocons peuvent se briser, il y en a donc de rechange – ils sont plus faciles à couper lorsqu’ils sont à température ambiante.","Assemblez votre scène de plage. Une fois les gâteaux refroidis et le château de sable pris, vous serez prêt à assembler la scène de plage. Retournez délicatement le château de sable sur une surface ou un plateau propre et entourez-le de sable à biscuits. Vous devrez frapper le fond du récipient avec un rouleau à pâtisserie (ou voir astuce ci-contre) si votre château de sable ne sort pas facilement.","Mettez une framboise sur chaque cupcake et déposez un peu de glaçage sur le dessus. Saupoudrez de centaines et de milliers et insérez un morceau de flocon de taille moyenne. Versez du glaçage sur les mini cornets, parsemez-en des centaines et des milliers et recouvrez d''un mini flocon. Insérez les mini cornets et les cupcakes dans le sable, dans et autour du château de sable principal, en utilisant le sable pour les soutenir.","Pour faire le cornet renversé, versez un peu de glaçage dans votre cornet de gaufre entier réservé, en y déposant les framboises restantes au fur et à mesure. Placez le cône à l’envers sur le dessus du château de sable et placez du glaçage autour pour créer l’effet d’une glace tombée. Saupoudrez de Centaines & Milliers et insérez le demi-morceau de Flocon. Servez la plage de biscuits avec des boules de votre glace préférée, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9901,9028,'fr','Maracuja (Passion fruit mousse traybake)','Nous avons transformé ce pouding mousse brésilien piquant en un cheesecake cuit sur plateau avec une base de biscuit et de la gélatine pour faciliter le tranchage.','["2 fruits de la passion, chair évidée","250 ml de jus de fruit de la passion en brique","4 feuilles de gélatine","2 boîtes de 400 g de lait concentré sucré","500 ml de crème fraîche légèrement fouettée","250g de biscuits digestifs","100 g de beurre fondu","2 mangues","jus 1 citron vert","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","2 fruits de la passion, chair évidée et hachée"]','["Pour la base, écrasez les biscuits dans un sachet avec un rouleau à pâtisserie ou mixez-les au robot culinaire. Ajoutez le beurre et remuez. Tapisser un moule à cake de 20 x 30 cm de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Versez le mélange de biscuits et appuyez fermement. Froideur.","Mélangez la chair du fruit de la passion avec le jus. Placez la gélatine dans un petit bol d''eau froide pour la faire tremper. Versez la chair et le jus dans une casserole et faites chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient chauds. Pressez l''eau de la gélatine, ajoutez-la à la casserole et remuez jusqu''à dissolution, puis retirez-la et versez-la dans un bol.","Ajouter le lait et la crème légèrement fouettée et mélanger. Verser dans le moule et réfrigérer jusqu''à consistance ferme, environ 2 heures.","Pour le coulis, réduire en purée 1 mangue avec le jus de citron vert et le sucre au robot culinaire, puis remuer pour dissoudre le sucre. Hachez l''autre mangue.","Pour servir, coupez le plat de cuisson en carrés. Garnissez chacun avec le coulis, un peu de mangue hachée et des fruits de la passion."]','2026-01-11 00:02:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9902,9029,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat et aux noisettes sans cuisson','La lectrice Jessica Creed partage son dessert au chocolat spectaculaire et incontournable – il est parfait pour recevoir','["140g de beurre doux","300 g de biscuits digestifs brisés","500 g de fromage frais ramolli","85g de sucre glace","300 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","15 chocolats noisettes (nous avons utilisé Ferrero Rocher), 5 hachés grossièrement, reste réservé, pour décorer","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte à tartiner au chocolat et aux noisettes","25 g de noisettes grossièrement hachées"]','["Préparez le fond du cheesecake : faites fondre le beurre dans une petite poêle à feu moyen. Passez les biscuits au robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir une fine miette, ajoutez le beurre fondu et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez dans un moule à charnière de 23 cm et appuyez fermement sur le fond. Réfrigérez pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Battez le fromage à la crème et le sucre glace dans un bol pour ramollir. Fouetter la crème et la vanille dans un autre bol jusqu''à formation de pics mous, puis incorporer au fromage à la crème. Incorporer les chocolats hachés. Verser sur le fond biscuité et lisser à la spatule. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer au moins 6 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Une fois prise, placez la pâte à tartiner chocolat-noisettes dans une casserole et faites fondre à feu doux pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit coulante. laisser refroidir légèrement avant de l''étaler sur le dessus du cheesecake. Décorer avec le reste des chocolats et quelques noisettes concassées. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9903,9030,'fr','Cheesecake tourbillonné aux bleuets','La texture crémeuse et sucrée de ce pouding à la vanille cuit au four est complétée par une sauce aux fruits vibrante','["300g de biscuits digestifs","140 g de beurre fondu","275 g de sucre en poudre doré","100g de myrtilles","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","3 paquets de 300 g de fromage frais entier","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs","200 ml de crème sure en pot"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nTapisser un moule rectangulaire de 20 x 30 cm avec\r\npapier sulfurisé. Mettez les biscuits dans un\r\nrobot culinaire et réduire en miettes fines.\r\nAjoutez le beurre et mélangez à nouveau.\r\nVersez dans le moule, appuyez fermement avec\r\nle dos d''une cuillère pour recouvrir le fond,\r\npuis enfournez pour 10 min. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, versez 25 g de sucre et le\r\nbleuets dans une petite poêle. Mélangez le\r\nmaïzena avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau froide et ajouter\r\nceci à la poêle. Chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le sucre\r\nse dissout. Augmentez la chaleur et faites des bulles\r\npendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que ce soit savoureux. Laisser refroidir.","Dans un grand bol, fouettez la crème\r\nfromage avec un fouet électrique à main\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajouter le sucre restant\r\net fouettez à nouveau. Ajouter la farine, la vanille,\r\nles œufs et la crème sure, et fouetter jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse et bien combiné.","Versez dessus la moitié du mélange de cheesecake\r\nle fond de biscuit, puis en verser la moitié\r\nsauce aux bleuets sur le dessus en petites gouttes.\r\nCouvrir avec le reste du cheesecake\r\nmélanger et lisser la surface avec un\r\nspatule. Arrosez le reste de myrtille\r\nsauce sur le dessus, puis utilisez la fin\r\nde la cuillère pour la faire onduler dans le\r\ngâteau au fromage. Enfourner 10 mn puis\r\nbaisser le feu à 110°C/90°C ventilateur/gaz ¼\r\net cuire encore 30 minutes. Éteindre\r\nle four et laisser le cheesecake à l''intérieur\r\npendant 1 h, puis laisser reposer encore 1 h avec\r\nla porte entrouverte. Enfin, partez dans la chambre\r\ntempérature jusqu''à refroidissement complet, puis\r\nréfrigérer pendant au moins 3 heures ou, mieux encore,\r\npendant la nuit. Couper en 14 barres. Se conservera\r\nau réfrigérateur jusqu''à 5 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9904,9031,'fr','Cheesecake au beurre de cacahuète','Cet irrésistible cheesecake est le plaisir parfait pour les amateurs de beurre de cacahuète : congelez-le jusqu''à deux mois et servez-le comme dessert à couper le souffle lors d''un dîner.','["50g de beurre","Paquet de 175 g de biscuits aux cacahuètes","5 feuilles de gélatine","Pot de 500 g de ricotta","175 g de beurre de cacahuète onctueux","175g de sirop doré","150 ml de lait","Pot de 270 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade molle","1 barre de cacahuètes cassantes, concassées"]','["Huiler et tapisser un moule à cake rond à fond mobile de 20 cm de film alimentaire pour le rendre le plus lisse possible. Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle. Écrasez les biscuits en les frappant dans un sachet avec un rouleau à pâtisserie, puis incorporez-les au beurre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien enrobés. Presser fermement le mélange au fond du moule et réfrigérer.","Faites tremper la gélatine dans l''eau pendant que vous préparez la garniture. Versez la ricotta dans un bol, puis incorporez le beurre de cacahuète et le sirop. La ricotta a une texture légèrement granuleuse, alors mixez-la jusqu''à consistance lisse avec un mixeur plongeant pour une texture plus lisse si vous préférez.","Retirez la gélatine trempée de l''eau et essorez-la. Mettez-le dans une casserole\r\navec le lait et chauffer très doucement jusqu''à ce que la gélatine soit dissoute. Incorporer au mélange de cacahuètes, puis verser sur le fond de biscuit. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris.","Pour congeler, laisser dans le moule et dès qu''il est solide, recouvrir la surface d''un film alimentaire, puis envelopper le moule d''un film alimentaire et de papier d''aluminium.","Pour décongeler, décongeler au réfrigérateur pendant la nuit.","Pour servir, retirez délicatement du moule. Fouettez la crème avec le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''elle conserve sa forme, puis étalez-la sur le cheesecake et parsemez de cassant aux cacahuètes."]','2026-01-11 00:02:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9905,9032,'fr','Cheesecake glacé aux marrons ondulés','Avec une base digestive au chocolat noir et une garniture de fromage à la crème aux noisettes, ce dessert glacé a une touche hivernale','["10 biscuits digestifs au chocolat noir","50 g de beurre fondu","huile de tournesol, pour graisser","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de morceaux de marrons hachés grossièrement","Boîte de 435 g de purée de marrons","200 g de sucre glace","3 cuillères à soupe de rhum brun","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","Pot de 300 g de fromage à pâte molle, battu jusqu''à consistance lisse"]','["Pour la base, mixez les biscuits\r\nun robot culinaire ou un sac dans un sac\r\nfaire des miettes. Incorporer le beurre,\r\npuis appuyez dans la base d''un 22 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau à charnière. Froideur.","Pour le praliné, tapisser une plaque de cuisson\r\npapier sulfurisé et huilez-le légèrement. Inclinez le lanceur\r\nsucre dans une poêle et placez-le dessus\r\nune chaleur élevée. Cuire 5 min, sans\r\nen remuant, jusqu''à dissolution et vous avez\r\nun caramel ambré foncé. Jetez-y le\r\nmorceaux de châtaignes, puis les renverser rapidement\r\nle papier sulfurisé et laisser reposer\r\ndurcir. Casser ou hacher en petits morceaux\r\net mettre de côté.","Pour la garniture, mixez la purée de marrons\r\nau robot culinaire avec le sucre glace\r\net 1 cuillère à soupe de rhum. Mettre 3 cuillères à soupe de\r\nmélanger de côté. Dans un grand bol, fouettez le\r\ncrème avec le sucre semoule et la vanille\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il conserve sa forme, puis incorporez le\r\nfromage à pâte molle. Incorporer les morceaux de praliné,\r\npuis pliez délicatement la châtaigne\r\nréduire en purée pour faire onduler la crème. Cuillère\r\nsur le fond biscuité. Frappez le moule à gâteau\r\ndoucement sur la surface de travail pour niveler et\r\nlisser sur le dessus. Couvrir de film alimentaire\r\nfilmer et congeler au moins 12 heures ou plus\r\nà 1 mois.","Pour le filet, mélanger le reste du rhum\r\navec la purée de marrons réservée et\r\nassez d''eau pour le rendre liquide. Si\r\nservir le gâteau dans les 2 jours, réfrigérer le\r\nbruine; si vous les conservez plus longtemps, congelez-les et\r\ndécongeler si nécessaire.","Mettez le cheesecake au réfrigérateur pour décongeler\r\nun peu 30 minutes avant de servir. Utiliser un\r\nsac à sandwich avec un coin coupé,\r\nverser un filet sur le dessus du gâteau\r\ndans un motif en zigzag. Retirez délicatement de\r\nle moule et servir en petits quartiers – avec un\r\nun verre de rhum si vous en avez envie."]','2026-01-11 00:02:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9906,6885,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat blanc et compote de rhubarbe','Ce cheesecake moelleux et crémeux constitue une fin tout à fait impressionnante et gourmande à un dîner.','["200 g de biscuits à l''avoine","85 g de beurre fondu","450 g de chocolat blanc","Pot de 284 ml de crème double","400 g de fromage à pâte molle entière, type Philadelphia","4 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''essence de vanille","600 g de rhubarbe (poids paré), coupée en morceaux de 2½ cm","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ gousse de vanille fendue en deux dans le sens de la longueur","100 ml de vin de dessert muscat à la fleur d''oranger (nous avons utilisé Brown Brothers)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mixez les biscuits au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''ils ressemblent à de la chapelure. Versez le beurre, fouettez à nouveau brièvement, puis versez le mélange dans le moule et appuyez fermement. Enfourner 10 mn puis laisser refroidir.","Réduire la température du four à 140°C/ventilateur 120°C/gaz 1. Enroulez une double couche de papier d''aluminium, recouverte d''un film alimentaire, autour du fond et des côtés du moule pour le rendre étanche. Cassez 400 g de chocolat dans une casserole, puis versez la crème et faites chauffer jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu. Laisser refroidir légèrement. Rincez le bol du robot, puis mélangez le fromage à la crème, les œufs et l''essence de vanille avec le chocolat fondu et la crème jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Mettez le moule dans une lèchefrite profonde, puis versez la garniture. Remplissez à moitié la lèchefrite avec de l''eau bouillante, enfournez pendant 1 h, puis éteignez le four. Laisser refroidir au four avec la porte légèrement entrouverte pendant 1 à 2 heures. Sortez le cheesecake de l''eau, jetez le papier d''aluminium, puis couvrez d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérez. Le cheesecake peut être préparé jusqu''à 3 jours à l''avance. Râpez le reste du chocolat sur le cheesecake avant de servir.","Pour la compote, chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°/gaz 4. Mélanger la rhubarbe et le sucre dans un plat allant au four. Grattez les graines de la gousse de vanille sur la rhubarbe, puis déposez-y également la gousse. Versez le muscat dessus, couvrez de papier d''aluminium, puis enfournez 30 à 40 minutes en remuant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce que la rhubarbe soit cuite. Laissez refroidir, puis retirez la dosette. Servir la compote avec le cheesecake. La compote peut être conservée au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 4 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9907,6955,'fr','Gâteau au fromage new-yorkais','Cet authentique dessert crémeux ajoutera une touche new-yorkaise à n''importe quelle table à manger.','["85 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","140 g de biscuits digestifs réduits en chapelure fine","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre granulé ou doré","3 paquets de 300 g/11 oz de fromage Philadelphia ou autre fromage à pâte molle entier","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","le zeste finement râpé d''un citron (environ 2 cuillères à café)","1½ cuillère à café de jus de citron","3 gros œufs et 1 jaune","284 ml de crème sure","142 ml de crème sure","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à café de jus de citron"]','["Placez une grille de four au milieu du four. Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante 160°C/conventionnel 180°C/gaz 4. Tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 23 cm de papier sulfurisé. Pour la croûte, faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle moyenne. Incorporer la chapelure de biscuits et le sucre pour que le mélange soit uniformément humidifié. Versez le mélange au fond du moule et enfournez pour 10 minutes. Laisser refroidir sur une grille pendant la préparation de la garniture.","Pour la garniture, augmentez la température du four à 200 °C/ventilateur 240 °C/gaz 9. Dans un batteur de table équipé de la palette, battez le fromage à pâte molle à vitesse moyenne-basse jusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux, environ 2 minutes. Avec le batteur à feu doux, ajoutez progressivement le sucre, puis la farine et une pincée de sel en raclant deux fois les parois du bol et la palette.","Remplacez l''accessoire de palette par le fouet. Continuez en ajoutant la vanille, le zeste et le jus de citron. Incorporer les œufs et le jaune, un à la fois, en raclant le bol et en fouettant au moins deux fois. Remuez le carton de 284 ml de crème sure jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis mesurez 200 ml/7 fl oz (un peu plus de 3,4 du carton). Continuez à basse vitesse en ajoutant la crème sure mesurée (réservez le reste). Fouettez pour mélanger, mais ne battez pas trop. La pâte doit être lisse, légère et légèrement aérée.","Badigeonnez les côtés du moule à charnière de beurre fondu et déposez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Versez la garniture - s''il y a des grumeaux, enfoncez-les à l''aide d''un couteau - le dessus doit être le plus lisse possible. Cuire au four 10 minutes. Réduisez la température du four à 90 °C ventilé/conventionnel 110 °C/gaz 1 ? 4 et faites cuire encore 25 minutes. Si vous secouez doucement le moule, la garniture devrait légèrement trembler. Éteignez le four et ouvrez la porte du four pour un cheesecake crémeux au centre, ou laissez-la fermée si vous préférez une texture plus sèche. Laisser refroidir au four pendant 2 heures. Le dessus du cheesecake peut se fissurer légèrement en refroidissant.","Mélangez la crème sure réservée avec le carton de 142 ml, le sucre et le jus de citron pour le topping. Étaler sur le cheesecake jusqu''aux bords. Couvrir légèrement de papier d''aluminium et réfrigérer pendant au moins 8 heures ou toute la nuit.","Passez un couteau à lame ronde sur les côtés du moule pour desserrer les bords coincés. Déverrouillez le côté, faites glisser le cheesecake du fond du moule sur une assiette, puis faites glisser le papier sulfurisé par le dessous."]','2026-01-11 00:02:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9908,9033,'fr','Gâteau au fromage Tia Maria','Parfait pour une occasion spéciale, ce dessert à l''américaine a vraiment un effet époustouflant','["85 g de beurre fondu chaud, plus du beurre supplémentaire pour graisser","14 biscuits digestifs au chocolat nature, finement écrasés","3 paquets de 300 g de fromage Philadelphia entier","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de Tia Maria","3 gros œufs","285 ml de crème sure","142 ml de crème sure","2 cuillères à soupe de Tia Maria","cacao, pour saupoudrer","8 chocolats Ferrero Rocher, non emballés"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 25 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mélanger le beurre et le biscuit\r\ndes miettes. Presser sur le fond du moule, enfourner 10 min, puis laisser refroidir.","Augmentez la température du four à 240C/ventilateur 200C/gaz 9. Battez le fromage et le sucre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez en fouettant la farine, la vanille, 2 cuillères à soupe de Tia Maria, les œufs et 285 ml de crème sure.","Beurrer les côtés du moule à cake. Versez le mélange et lissez. Cuire au four 10 min, puis baisser le four à 110°C/chaleur tournante 90°/gaz ¼ pendant 25 min. Éteignez le four, puis ouvrez la porte et laissez refroidir à l''intérieur du four pendant 2 heures. Ne vous inquiétez pas s''il craque un peu.","Mélangez 142 ml de crème sure et le Tia Maria, puis lissez le dessus du cheesecake. Froideur."]','2026-01-11 00:02:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9909,9034,'fr','Petits cheesecakes aux fraises','Les portions individuelles éviteront les combats pour la plus grosse tranche de ce pud crémeux à la ricotta et à la compote fruitée','["50g de beurre","6 biscuits digestifs finement écrasés","Pot de 250 g de ricotta","50g de sucre glace","le zeste d''1 citron, le jus de ½","1 œuf et 1 jaune","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","150 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de confiture de fraises, fondue","3 fraises, coupées en deux"]','["Chauffer le four à 150C/130C ventilateur/gaz 2\r\net tapisser 6 trous de moules à muffins avec le muffin\r\ncaisses en papier. Faire fondre le beurre, incorporer le\r\nchapelure de biscuit jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien mélangée, puis\r\nappuyez aussi fermement que possible dans les bases\r\nde chaque caisse en papier. Refroidissez-les pendant\r\nvous faites la garniture.","Battre la ricotta avec le sucre, le citron\r\nle zeste et le jus, l''œuf entier, le jaune d''œuf et\r\nvanille. Dans un autre bol, fouettez le\r\ncrème jusqu''à ce qu''elle garde sa forme, puis\r\nincorporer au mélange de fromage. Cuillère\r\nuniformément dans les caisses en papier, jusqu''au\r\nvers le haut, puis tapotez la boîte sur l''ouvrage\r\nsurface pour aplatir la garniture. Cuire au four pour\r\n30 minutes, puis éteignez le four et laissez\r\nrefroidir complètement à l’intérieur.","Pour décorer, garnir chaque cheesecake\r\navec 1 cuillère à café de confiture et une moitié de fraise."]','2026-01-11 00:02:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9910,9035,'fr','Le relooking ultime : le cheesecake new-yorkais','Angela Nilsen relève le défi ultime : garder un cheesecake crémeux et décadent tout en le rendant plus sain et plus léger.','["35g de beurre","85 g de biscuits digestifs allégés finement concassés","2 pots de 300 g de fromage à pâte molle léger, nous avons utilisé du fromage Philadelphia, à température ambiante","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","1½ cuillère à café de zeste de citron finement râpé, de préférence avec une râpe Microplane","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 œufs, température ambiante, battus","150g fromage frais","25 g de sucre en poudre doré","225 g de barquette de myrtilles","½ cuillère à café de zeste de citron vert finement râpé","100g fromage frais"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à fond amovible ou à charnière de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé et le poser sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Faire fondre le beurre et incorporer les miettes de biscuits. Versez le mélange au fond du moule, puis enfournez pour 10 min. Sortir du four et monter la température à 240C/ventilateur 220C/gaz 9.","Pour la garniture, battez le fromage à pâte molle jusqu''à consistance lisse avec un batteur électrique à basse vitesse. Ajoutez progressivement le sucre, également à petite vitesse, puis la maïzena sans trop battre. Grattez les parois du bol. Incorporez lentement le zeste et le jus de citron, la vanille, puis les œufs. Raclez les parois du bol, puis fouettez enfin le fromage frais. Le mélange doit être lisse et assez liquide.","Versez la garniture sur la base de chapelure. Secouez le moule pour niveler le mélange et écrasez les bulles à la surface avec le dos d''une cuillère à café. Enfourner 10 min, puis baisser le feu à 110C/ventilateur 90C/gaz ¼. Cuire encore 25 minutes et, si vous utilisez un four électrique, laisser la porte du four légèrement entrouverte pendant les 3 premières minutes. Après 25 minutes, secouez le moule et il devrait y avoir une oscillation au centre de la garniture. S''il est laissé plus ferme, il est plus susceptible de se fissurer plus tard. Éteignez le four, laissez la porte fermée et laissez le gâteau dedans pendant 2 heures. Ouvrez la porte, desserrez les bords supérieurs du gâteau avec un couteau à lame ronde, puis laissez refroidir doucement au four pendant encore 1h à 1h30.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le sucre pour la garniture dans une petite casserole avec 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Portez à ébullition en remuant pour dissoudre le sucre, puis laissez bouillonner pendant 1 à 2 minutes pour obtenir un sirop fin. Versez les myrtilles, remuez délicatement et laissez cuire environ 1 min, juste pour faire éclater légèrement les fruits et libérer les jus violets. Remuer\r\ndans le zeste de citron vert, puis laisser refroidir.","Étalez le fromage frais sur le cheesecake refroidi. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et réfrigérer pendant au moins 4 heures (ou toute la nuit). Sortez du réfrigérateur 1 h avant de servir, détachez complètement les côtés du cheesecake, démoulez-le, puis glissez-le sur une assiette en décollant le papier au fur et à mesure. Trancher avec un couteau bien aiguisé et servir chaque quartier garni d''une cuillerée de myrtilles sirupeuses."]','2026-01-11 00:02:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9911,8123,'fr','Cheesecake au chocolat Kahlúa','Cheesecake au chocolat décadent et alléchant au goût de liqueur de café','["50g de beurre","225 g de biscuits digestifs au chocolat nature, écrasés","225 g de chocolat noir (au moins 50 % de cacao), cassé","2 x 200 g de fromage à pâte molle entière, à température ambiante","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs moyens","0 carton de 284 ml de crème double","5 cuillères à soupe de Kahlúa","200ml tub crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de Kahlúa","poudre de cacao, pour saupoudrer","Kahlúa supplémentaire pour servir"]','["Huiler légèrement la base d''un 23 cm\r\nboîte à charnière. Faire fondre le beurre dans un\r\npoêle, incorporer les biscuits écrasés et\r\nappuyer sur le fond du moule avec\r\nle dos d''une cuillère. Détendez-vous pendant que vous\r\nfaire la garniture.","Faire fondre le chocolat dans un bol\r\nune casserole d''eau légèrement frémissante,\r\nen remuant à mi-cuisson. Supprimer\r\nle bol de la poêle. Préchauffer le\r\nfour à 160C/gaz 3/chaleur tournante 140C.","Battre le fromage et le sucre\r\navec un batteur électrique à main\r\njusqu''à consistance mousseuse. Ajoutez les oeufs, un à la fois\r\ntemps, mais n’en faites pas trop. Avec le\r\nbatteur à basse vitesse, incorporer le\r\nle chocolat fondu, la crème et\r\nle Kahlúa. Verser sur le biscuit\r\nbase et cuire au four sur une plaque à pâtisserie pendant\r\n55 minutes à 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris. Tester\r\nen touchant la surface, ce qui\r\ndevrait être brillant et un peu bancal\r\net plus foncé au centre. Desserrez le\r\ncheesecake du moule avec un\r\ncouteau à lame ronde et laisser reposer\r\ncool. Réfrigérer 3 heures ou toute la nuit.","Sortez le cheesecake du moule.\r\nPour le topping, mélanger la crème\r\nfraîche avec le Kahlúa et tartinade\r\npar-dessus. Saupoudrer légèrement de cacao\r\npoudrer et servir en quartiers avec un\r\nle petit Kahlúa versé sur chaque tranche."]','2026-01-11 00:02:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9912,9037,'fr','Cheesecake au citron et au fromage blanc','Ce cheesecake au citron léger et succulent est aussi bon qu''il en a l''air','["80g de biscuits digestifs","50g de beurre fondu","200 g de fromage à pâte molle légère","500 g de fromage blanc","200 g de sucre glace","zeste de 2 citrons, jus de 3","4 feuilles de gélatine"]','["Écrasez les biscuits digestifs et mélangez\r\navec le beurre fondu. Appuyez dans le\r\nfond d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm. Détendez-vous pour\r\nferme.","Fouetter le fromage à pâte molle légère avec\r\nle fromage blanc et le sucre glace, puis incorporer le zeste\r\n2 citrons.","Faire tremper les feuilles de gélatine dans l''eau froide, puis faire fondre\r\ndans le jus de 3 citrons à feu doux. Incorporer le fromage\r\nmélanger, puis verser sur le fond de biscuit. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris."]','2026-01-11 00:02:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9913,9038,'fr','Cheesecake aux baies et au chocolat blanc','Un superbe pudding sans cuisson débordant de saveurs estivales – idéal pour recevoir en toute décontraction','["2 tablettes de 150 g de chocolat blanc","2 pots de 300 g de fromage à pâte molle (nous avons utilisé du Philadelphia)","Pot de 284 ml de crème double","50 g de sucre en poudre","170 g de framboises barquette","5 cuillères à soupe de confiture de framboise","85 g de biscuits amaretti","200 g de petites fraises","quelques myrtilles (facultatif)"]','["Cassez le chocolat dans un bol en verre,\r\npuis mettez-le sur une casserole en train de mijoter\r\nfaire fondre l''eau, en veillant à ce que le fond\r\ndu bol ne touche pas l’eau. Ligne\r\nun moule à cake de 900 g légèrement huilé et recouvert d''un film alimentaire.","Fouetter le fromage, la crème et le sucre\r\nensemble, de préférence avec des batteurs électriques,\r\npuis incorporez-le au mélange fondu presque froid\r\nchocolat blanc jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Mélangez 50 g de framboises avec 2 cuillères à soupe de\r\nconfiture. Verser la moitié du mélange de fromage dans\r\nle moule à pain, puis versez la confiture\r\nframboises au centre. Garnir de\r\nle reste du mélange de fromage, niveler le\r\ndessus, puis enfoncez les biscuits. Couvrir et\r\nréfrigérer pendant 6 heures ou toute la nuit.","Réservez environ 6 fraises. Réduire de moitié\r\nle reste, puis réchauffer dans une poêle avec le\r\nconfiture restante jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Whizz dans un aliment\r\nrobot ou avec un mixeur plongeant, puis\r\npasser au tamis pour retirer les graines\r\net faire une sauce. Ajouter une goutte d''eau\r\nsi la sauce est trop épaisse.","Pour servir, retournez délicatement le moule sur\r\nune assiette, soulevez-la et retirez le film alimentaire\r\nfilmer. Coupez en deux les fraises restantes,\r\npuis disposer sur le dessus du gâteau avec le\r\nrestes de framboises et de bleuets (si\r\nutilisation). Verser un peu de sauce et servir\r\nle reste séparément pour arroser."]','2026-01-11 00:02:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9914,9039,'fr','Cheesecake aux pêches Melba','Un favori de fête sans cuisson et préparé à l''avance avec une garniture épaisse au fromage à la crème, une base de biscuit au beurre et fini avec un coulis de framboise.','["100 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","200g de biscuits croquants (nous avons utilisé des biscuits au beurre Fox''s)","600 g de fromage à pâte molle","100 g de sucre glace, plus un peu selon votre goût","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","450g de framboises","3 pêches bien mûres, pelées si vous le souhaitez, ou 6 moitiés de pêches en conserve (jus conservé), coupées en dés de la taille d''une framboise"]','["Tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un papier de 20 cm\r\nun moule à fond mobile ou à charnière\r\navec du papier sulfurisé – utilisez des taches\r\nde beurre pour aider le papier à rester en place\r\nsur les côtés. Mettez les biscuits dans un\r\nsac de nourriture en plastique et écraser en miettes\r\nà l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie, puis bien mélanger\r\navec le beurre fondu. Basculez dans le\r\nmoule préparé et appuyez fermement\r\npour créer une base uniforme. Détendez-vous pendant\r\nvous préparez la garniture.","Mettez le fromage à pâte molle, le sucre glace et\r\nvanille dans un bol, puis battre avec un\r\nbatteur électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse. Pourboire\r\nla crème et continuer à battre jusqu''à ce que\r\nle mélange est combiné. Disperser\r\n100g de framboises et la moitié de\r\nles morceaux de pêches. A l''aide d''une spatule,\r\npliez-le en quelques plis seulement – comme vous le souhaitez.\r\nils assembleront le cheesecake\r\nse répercutent davantage.","Versez le mélange de crème sur le\r\nfond de biscuit, en travaillant à partir des bords\r\nvers l''intérieur. Lisser le dessus du cheesecake\r\nvers le bas avec le dos d''une cuillère à dessert ou\r\nspatule. Laisser prendre au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Au robot culinaire, mixez 250 g de\r\nreste des framboises, tamiser, remuer\r\ndans 1 cuillère à café de graines, si vous le souhaitez, et\r\nsucrer au goût avec du sucre glace. Ajouter\r\nsuffisamment d''eau ou de jus de pêche en conserve pour\r\nrendez-le en sauce et réfrigérez jusqu''au moment de servir.","Apportez le cheesecake dans la chambre\r\ntempérature environ 30 minutes avant\r\nservir. Si vous utilisez un moule à fond mobile,\r\ndémouler en plaçant sur une boîte de conserve,\r\npuis abaissez progressivement les côtés du\r\nétain. Glissez le cheesecake sur une portion\r\nplaque, en retirant le papier de doublure et\r\nsocle. Répartissez les framboises restantes\r\net des morceaux de pêches sur le cheesecake,\r\narroser d''un peu de sauce et\r\nservir le reste à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:02:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9915,9040,'fr','Cheesecake aux framboises et au citron au four','Un cheesecake cuit au four riche et crémeux qui constitue un excellent dessert pour un dîner','["200g de biscuits digestifs","75 g de beurre fondu","600 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","Pot de 150 g de yaourt nature","3 œufs moyens","le zeste finement râpé de 2 citrons, le jus d''1","50g de farine nature","200g de framboises","sucre glace, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 120°C/100°C chaleur tournante/gaz et tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière rond de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé.  Écrasez les biscuits au robot culinaire ou dans un sac alimentaire à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Versez dans un bol avec le beurre fondu et mélangez bien. Poussez les biscuits en une couche uniforme dans le fond du moule à gâteau et laissez-les refroidir jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Dans un autre bol, utilisez un fouet électrique pour battre le fromage à pâte molle avec le sucre. Incorporez ensuite le yaourt puis les œufs un à un. Incorporez enfin le zeste de citron, le jus de citron et la farine. Incorporez les deux tiers des framboises en les écrasant très légèrement pour qu''elles commencent à dégorger dans le mélange puis versez le mélange sur le fond biscuité et lissez le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes puis éteindre le four, laisser le gâteau à l''intérieur encore une heure puis laisser refroidir à température ambiante. Réfrigérer toute la nuit. Pour servir, démouler, parsemer du reste des framboises et saupoudrer généreusement de sucre glace."]','2026-01-11 00:02:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9916,9041,'fr','Gâteau au fromage Bakewell','Ce cheesecake cuit aux amandes et aux cerises est un mariage paradisiaque de deux desserts étonnants','["200 g de biscuits aux amandes","100 g d''amandes effilées grillées","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","100 g de beurre fondu","3 paquets de 300 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","250 g de sucre en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs","Pot de 200 ml de crème sure","un peu plus d''un demi pot de confiture de cerises de 300 g","sucre glace et crème, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nTapisser la base et les côtés d''un papier de 23 cm\r\nmoule à charnière avec du papier sulfurisé.\r\nÉcrasez les biscuits et 75g de flocons\r\namandes en miettes – essayez le double ensachage\r\ndans des sacs alimentaires et écraser avec un rouleau à pâtisserie. Mélanger avec l''extrait d''amande et\r\nbeurre fondu, puis presser dans le\r\nfond du moule préparé et enfourner pendant\r\n10 minutes. Laisser refroidir pendant que vous\r\nfaire la garniture.","Dans votre plus grand bol, fouettez le fromage\r\navec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance crémeuse. Ajouter\r\nle sucre et fouetter pour combiner. Fouet\r\ndans la farine, puis la vanille, les œufs, un\r\nà la fois, et enfin la crème sure.","Versez des cuillerées de mélange dans le moule,\r\nparsemer de cuillères à soupe de confiture au fur et à mesure. Lisse\r\nle dessus aussi doucement que possible.","Placez soigneusement la boîte sur l''étagère du milieu\r\ndu four et enfourner 10 min. Dispersion\r\navec le reste des amandes. Diminuer le four\r\nà 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼ et enfourner pendant\r\nencore 35 minutes. Éteignez le four, gardez\r\nla porte fermée et laisser le cheesecake\r\nlaisser refroidir 1h. Ouvrez la porte du four et\r\nlaissez-le entrouvert pendant encore une heure (vous pouvez utiliser votre\r\ndes gants de cuisine pour l''ouvrir). Frais\r\npendant une troisième heure à température ambiante, puis couvrir\r\net réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Retirer du moule et peler soigneusement\r\ndu parchemin. Saupoudrer de sucre glace\r\net servir avec de la crème."]','2026-01-11 00:02:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9917,9042,'fr','Cheesecake aux baies dans un verre','Le mascarpone est un excellent substitut pour préparer un dessert presque instantané. Ici, sa richesse crémeuse est coupée par le piquant des mûres.','["150 g de mûres barquette","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 citron, le zeste et le jus finement râpés","4 biscuits au gingembre, écrasés","noix de beurre fondue","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","½ pot de 250 g de mascarpone ou de ricotta"]','["Mélangez les mûres, le sucre en poudre et 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron dans une petite casserole. Chauffer doucement pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les baies commencent à éclater. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les biscuits concassés et le beurre fondu. Verser dans 2 verres. Incorporez délicatement le reste du jus de citron, le zeste de citron et le sucre glace au mascarpone ou à la ricotta. Répartissez le fromage citronné dans les verres, puis versez-le sur les mûres et leur jus sirupeux."]','2026-01-11 00:02:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9918,9043,'fr','Pizza au chocolat','Réalisez ce projet amusant de cuisson de pizza au chocolat avec les enfants. Aux côtés des guimauves, les bananes, les bretzels et la sauce caramel conviennent également comme garnitures.','["40g de beurre doux","200 ml de lait, plus un peu pour le brossage","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","300 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre doré","40 g de pépites de chocolat au lait","5 cuillères à soupe de pâte à tartiner chocolat-noisettes","mini guimauves (facultatif)"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une casserole à feu moyen, puis réserver 1 cuillère à soupe dans un petit bol. Versez le lait et la vanille dans la casserole et laissez mijoter jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien chauds. Mélangez la farine, la levure, le sucre et une pincée de sel dans un grand bol. Versez le mélange de lait dans le bol et mélangez avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez sur un plan de travail et pétrissez pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et élastique. Roulez la pâte en boule serrée, placez-la dans un bol propre et couvrez. Laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 2 à 3 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume, ou réfrigérer jusqu''à 48 heures.","Étalez la pâte sur une surface farinée et éliminez les bulles d''air. Roulez-la sur un fond de pizza rond d''environ 40 cm de large. Saupoudrez une grande plaque à pâtisserie d’un peu plus de farine et déposez la pâte dessus. Utilisez les pépites de chocolat pour créer un cercle autour de l''extérieur du fond de pizza, à ½ cm du bord. Badigeonnez un peu de lait à l''intérieur du cercle aux pépites de chocolat, puis repliez le bord extérieur pour enfermer le chocolat et créer une croûte farcie, en appuyant très fort pour coller la pâte en place. Peut être préparé jusqu''à 1 heure à l''avance et réservé pour gonfler.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Badigeonner le milieu de la pâte avec le beurre fondu réservé et enfourner 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée. Retirer du four et étaler sur la pâte à tartiner au chocolat et répartir sur les guimauves, le cas échéant, et toute autre garniture de votre choix. Remettez la pizza au four pendant 4 à 5 minutes pour qu''elle soit bien chaude grâce à la garniture. Laisser reposer une minute avant de trancher et de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9919,9044,'fr','Pain aux bananes et aux pépites de chocolat','Préparez un délicieux pain aux bananes et aux pépites de chocolat : c''est une excellente façon d''utiliser les bananes mûres qui traînent dans le bol de fruits.','["140 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 oeufs, battus","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","140 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 bananes mûres, pelées et écrasées","100 g de pépites de chocolat"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake de 900g et tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre ramolli et le sucre ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Mélangez l''œuf et l''extrait de vanille et versez-le petit à petit en mélangeant entre chaque ajout. Incorporez la farine, une pincée de sel, la levure chimique, la purée de banane et presque une poignée de pépites de chocolat.","Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et répartissez-le sur le reste des pépites de chocolat. Cuire au four environ 50 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le pain soit gonflé et bien cuit – un cure-dent inséré au milieu du pain devrait en ressortir propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Trancher avant de servir. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9920,3803,'fr','Biscuits de Noël au chocolat','Ces biscuits au chocolat faciles sont la gâterie de Noël parfaite que les enfants et les adultes adoreront. Impliquez toute la famille dans la décoration','["270 g de farine nature","50g de cacao en poudre","120 g de sucre glace","150g de beurre","2 œufs","chocolat fondu ou glaçage à douille, perles de sucre, pépites"]','["Mélangez la farine, le cacao, le sucre glace et une pincée de sel dans un bol. Incorporer le beurre puis incorporer les œufs. Pétrir rapidement avec les mains jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Envelopper dans du papier d''aluminium, presser en un disque plat et réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Tapisser quelques plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Etalez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné sur une épaisseur d''environ 3 mm. Découpez des formes dans la pâte. Placez les biscuits sur les plaques à pâtisserie – il est préférable de rassembler des biscuits de taille similaire. Cuire au four pendant 7 à 10 minutes, selon la taille des biscuits.","Pétrir les chutes de pâte ensemble et réfrigérer à nouveau pendant 15 minutes. Rouler, couper et cuire comme avant. Refroidissez complètement.","Une fois refroidis, les biscuits peuvent être décorés de chocolat ou de glaçage et de perles et pépites de sucre."]','2026-01-11 00:02:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9921,4781,'fr','Avoine au four','Savourez des flocons d''avoine cuits au four au petit-déjeuner avec des bananes, un mélange d''épices et votre choix de pépites de chocolat, de myrtilles ou de framboises. Servir chaud avec plus de fruits pour le rendre encore plus spécial','["100 g de flocons d''avoine","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 banane, pelée et hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable ou de miel","2 œufs","pincée d''épices mélangées ou de cannelle moulue","100 g de pépites de chocolat, de myrtilles ou de framboises, plus un peu pour servir","huile sans saveur, pour les ramequins"]','["Chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettez les flocons d''avoine dans l''Ablender et pulsez plusieurs fois jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ressembler à de la farine. Ajouter la levure chimique, la banane hachée, le sirop d''érable ou le miel, les œufs et le mélange d''épices ou de cannelle, et fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer les pépites de chocolat ou les baies.","Huiler légèrement quatre ramequins résistants à la chaleur, puis répartir la pâte entre eux. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les flocons d''avoine soient bien levés et qu''ils reprennent leur forme lorsqu''ils sont légèrement pressés. Parsemez de pépites de chocolat ou de baies avant de servir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9922,9045,'fr','Muffins de Noël','Préparez ces muffins piquants et épicés avant le jour de Noël, puis commencez les festivités en les distribuant pendant que tout le monde ouvre ses cadeaux sous le sapin.','["125g de beurre doux","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à café de cannelle","¼ de muscade fraîchement râpée","150g de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 œufs moyens","1 orange, zestée et pressée","150 g de chocolat (blanc, au lait ou noir), haché","50 g de canneberges séchées","50g de sucre glace","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre perlé (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de moules à muffins en papier.","Faire fondre le beurre au micro-ondes ou dans une petite casserole à feu doux, puis laisser refroidir 10 min. Pendant ce temps, mélangez la farine, le bicarbonate, le sucre, la cannelle et la muscade dans un grand bol avec une pincée de sel.","Ajouter le yaourt, la vanille et les œufs au beurre refroidi et bien mélanger. Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs ainsi que le zeste d''orange, le chocolat et les canneberges séchées. Bien mélanger jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de poches de farine.","Répartissez le mélange uniformément entre les caissettes en papier, puis enfournez pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et doré. Vérifiez qu''ils sont cuits en insérant un bâton à cocktail au centre d''un des muffins (choisissez-en un au centre du plateau). Si de la pâte à gâteau humide adhère à la brochette, remettez au four pendant 5 minutes.","Sortez les muffins du four et laissez-les refroidir dans le moule pendant au moins 10 minutes. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sucre glace avec suffisamment de jus d''orange pour obtenir un glaçage lâche. Badigeonnez chaque muffin du glaçage à l''orange, puis saupoudrez d''un peu de sucre perlé, le cas échéant. Laisser refroidir avant de manger. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours, ou congelé jusqu''à deux mois."]','2026-01-11 00:02:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9923,5123,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat et aux amandes sans farine','Ce gâteau dense et moelleux au chocolat et aux amandes est parfait pour le dessert. Il est sans gluten – assurez-vous simplement que votre cacao en poudre et votre chocolat le sont aussi','["200g de chocolat noir à cuisiner, coupé en petits morceaux","200g de beurre, coupé en petits morceaux","3 oeufs","175g de sucre en poudre doré","100g de mascarpone ou fromage à la crème","¼ c. à café d''extrait de vanille","100g d''amandes en poudre","30g de cacao en poudre, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser la base d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le chocolat et le beurre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, ou au micro-ondes par tranches de 20 secondes. Remuer, puis laisser refroidir légèrement.","Pendant ce temps, mettre les œufs et le sucre dans un deuxième bol et battre avec un fouet électrique pendant 4-5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et crémeux. Ajouter le mascarpone ou le fromage à la crème et la vanille, et continuer à battre jusqu''à ce que tout soit combiné. Incorporer délicatement le mélange de chocolat fondu refroidi jusqu''à obtenir une couleur uniforme, puis incorporer les amandes. Tamiser le cacao en poudre et une petite pincée de sel, et incorporer pour combiner.","Verser la pâte à gâteau dans le moule préparé. Mettre le moule sur une plaque de cuisson et cuire pendant 35-40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit gonflé et craquelé sur le dessus. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 30-40 minutes – il va retomber en refroidissant. Servir tiède comme un pudding au chocolat, ou laisser refroidir complètement et déguster comme un gâteau brownie fondant. Saupoudrer de cacao en poudre supplémentaire avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9924,3910,'fr','Muffins framboises et chocolat blanc','Offrez-vous ces muffins aux framboises et aux pépites de chocolat blanc pour une gourmandise sucrée. Fabriqués avec des framboises fraîches ou surgelées, ils sont parfaits servis avec une tasse de thé','["100 g de beurre doux, ramolli","65 g de sucre en poudre","65 g de sucre roux clair","2 gros œufs, température ambiante","125 g de yaourt grec","1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","5 cuillères à soupe de lait","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","200 g de framboises (fraîches ou surgelées)","75 g de pépites de chocolat blanc"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de caissettes en papier.","Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter les œufs progressivement et battre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer le yaourt, la vanille et le lait. Incorporez la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel fin jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Incorporez enfin 150 g de framboises et les pépites de chocolat blanc et remplissez les moules à muffins aux trois quarts.","Poussez 2 framboises sur le dessus de chaque muffin pour qu''elles dépassent légèrement. Cuire au four pendant 8 minutes, puis réduire le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et cuire encore 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et doré, et qu''un bâton à cocktail inséré au centre en ressorte propre."]','2026-01-11 00:02:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9925,9046,'fr','Tartelette chocolat noir & fruit de la passion','Associez le chocolat aux fruits de la passion pour préparer ce dessert délicieusement décadent. Le caillé de fruits acidulé se marie à merveille avec la riche ganache','["180 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","85g de sucre glace","50 g de cacao en poudre, plus 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe pour saupoudrer","140 g de beurre doux froid, coupé en cubes","2 jaunes d''œufs","éclats de cacao, pour décorer (facultatif)","crème fraîche, to serve","200 g de pulpe de fruit de la passion (environ 8 à 10 fruits de la passion)","1 feuille de gélatine","3 œufs moyens","70g de beurre doux","50 g de sucre en poudre","1½ cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","150 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao)","150 ml de crème fraîche","150 g de sucre mou roux clair"]','["Tamisez la farine, le sucre glace, le cacao et ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un bol. Frottez le beurre avec vos doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Ajoutez les jaunes d''œufs ainsi que 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau glacée et continuez à mélanger avec vos mains jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte molle se forme. Vous pouvez également mélanger les ingrédients ensemble dans un robot culinaire. Enveloppez la pâte et réfrigérez pendant au moins 1 heure. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux jours.","Tapisser le fond d''un moule à tarte de 23 cm de diamètre de papier sulfurisé. Étalez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £, puis utilisez-la pour tapisser le moule à tarte, en la pressant sur le côté et en laissant un peu de débordement. Couvrir et réfrigérer encore 1 h.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser la pâte de papier sulfurisé et remplir de fèves au four. Enfourner 20 mn. Retirez les haricots et le papier sulfurisé et faites cuire encore 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants. Laisser refroidir complètement, puis utiliser un couteau bien aiguisé pour découper l''excédent de pâte.","Pour faire le caillé, mettez la pulpe du fruit de la passion dans un robot culinaire et mixez pour séparer les graines et la chair. Passer au tamis au-dessus d''une casserole moyenne, puis jeter les graines. Versez le reste des ingrédients et mettez la casserole sur feu doux. Fouettez jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu, puis à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois, remuez jusqu''à ce que le caillé épaississe, environ 10 minutes. (N''augmentez pas le feu pour accélérer le processus, car les œufs cailleraient.) Remuez bien, surtout au bord, car c''est là que le caillé peut s''accrocher. Tamisez dans un bol, laissez refroidir, puis versez dans le moule. Refroidissez la tarte fourrée pendant 30 minutes.","Pour faire la ganache, faites fondre le chocolat, la crème, le sucre et une pincée de sel marin dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante, en veillant à ce que le bol ne touche pas l''eau, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit brillant et épais. Retirer du feu, laisser refroidir 15 minutes, puis verser sur la couche de caillé. Répartir sur les grains de cacao, le cas échéant, puis réfrigérer pendant au moins 4 heures, voire toute la nuit. Saupoudrez de cacao, puis tranchez et servez avec de la crème fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:02:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9926,4016,'fr','Pain au chocolat à déchirer et à partager','Commencez votre week-end avec ce pain au chocolat à déchirer et à partager pour le brunch. Servir avec des framboises ou tout simplement seul avec une tasse de chocolat chaud','["Paquet de 275 g de pâte à pains au chocolat Jus-Rol™","6 cuillères à café de confiture de framboises, de marmelade ou de raisins secs","25 g de chocolat noir haché","sucre glace et framboises pour servir"]','["Tapisser un moule à cake (environ 900 g de volume) d''une bande de papier sulfurisé surplombant les côtés. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Ouvrez le paquet de pâte Jus-Rol™ Pains Au Chocolat en tournant la boîte pour retirer la pâte. Déroulez sur un plan de travail et séparez chaque morceau perforé, puis coupez chaque morceau en deux au milieu pour obtenir 12 carrés. Ajoutez une bande de chocolat sur chacun des carrés, ajoutez ½ cuillère à café de confiture, de marmelade ou quelques raisins secs sur chacun (ou laissez nature si vous préférez) et enveloppez-les dans la pâte, comme un rouleau de saucisse.","Placez les rouleaux de chocolat dans le moule sur leurs extrémités afin que le chocolat soit exposé en haut, et placez les rouleaux uniformément espacés pour qu''il y ait beaucoup d''espace pour se dilater. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien levés.","Faites fondre le chocolat dans un bol au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu, ou faites-le fondre par petits coups au micro-ondes. Laissez les pâtisseries 10 min dans le moule, puis utilisez le papier sulfurisé pour les démouler. Transférer dans une assiette de service. Arroser de chocolat fondu et saupoudrer d''un peu de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez. Servir tiède ou à température ambiante avec des framboises, ou simplement seul avec une tasse de chocolat chaud. Mieux mangé le jour même."]','2026-01-11 00:02:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9927,9047,'fr','Tarte au brownie au chocolat et à l''orange','Épatez votre famille et vos amis avec cette tarte au brownie au chocolat et à l''orange. Avec une base de pâte friable, c''est un dessert délicieusement décadent ou une gâterie à tout moment.','["Paquet de 320 g de feuille de pâte brisée Jus-Rol™","120 g de chocolat noir haché","120 g de beurre coupé en cubes","2 œufs","80 g de sucre en poudre doré","80 g de sucre mou roux clair","80 g de farine nature","1 orange, zestée et pressée et plus de zeste pour servir","crème fraîche to serve"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Déroulez la feuille de pâte brisée Jus-Rol™ et utilisez-la pour tapisser un moule à tarte de 20 cm. Appuyez sur les côtés du moule et coupez légèrement sur les bords, en laissant un peu dépasser. Tapisser la pâte d''un morceau de papier sulfurisé froissé et remplir de riz cru ou de fèves au four. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, retirer le papier et cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sec.","Pendant que la pâte cuit, mettez le beurre et le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante et faites fondre ensemble en remuant souvent. Une fois fondu, retirez du feu et laissez refroidir légèrement. Ajoutez une pincée de sel si votre beurre n''est pas salé.","Fouettez brièvement les œufs et les sucres dans un bol jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis incorporez le chocolat fondu et le beurre. Tamisez la farine et incorporez-la jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste combinée. Incorporer le jus et le zeste d''orange.","Coupez les bords de la tarte pâtissière avec un couteau dentelé pour les nettoyer et versez le mélange de brownie au milieu. Lisser avec le dos d''une cuillère ou d''une spatule et cuire encore 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus forme une croûte et que la garniture ne soit plus humide mais légèrement bancale.","Laisser refroidir 15 minutes avant de démouler si vous servez chaud, ou servir à température ambiante. Servir avec une cuillerée de crème fraîche et un peu de zeste d''orange râpé. Se conserve 3 jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:02:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9928,9048,'fr','Pavlova au chocolat et au beurre de cacahuète','Combinez des cacahuètes sucrées et salées, de la meringue croustillante et un crémeux au chocolat crémeux mélangé à une riche crème au beurre de cacahuète dans ce dessert. C''est un délice sensoriel','["75g de lait entier","115 ml de crème fouettée","2 jaunes d''œufs, en réservant les blancs pour la meringue","50 g de sucre en poudre","150 g de chocolat noir finement haché","60 g de beurre salé ramolli","3 gros blancs d''œufs","200 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin blanc","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","50 g de chocolat noir fondu et refroidi","100 g de cacahuètes décortiquées, régulières ou grillées","60g de sucre semoule","100 g de chocolat blanc haché grossièrement","100 g de beurre de cacahuète onctueux","25 g de beurre salé froid coupé en cubes","225 ml de crème fraîche","copeaux de chocolat noir, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le crémeux. Portez à ébullition le lait et la crème dans une petite casserole en fouettant de temps en temps. Fouettez les jaunes d''œufs et le sucre dans un bol moyen résistant à la chaleur jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez le mélange de crème chaude en un filet constant, en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Remettre dans la casserole et laisser mijoter à feu doux pendant 3-4 minutes, en remuant continuellement jusqu''à épaississement d''une crème anglaise.","Mettez le chocolat noir dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur et filtrez la crème chaude dessus à travers un tamis à mailles fines, en fouettant jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu et que le mélange soit lisse. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste chaud. Ajouter le beurre et mixer à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Couvrir et laisser à température ambiante jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Chauffer le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Pour la meringue, battez les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol propre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou au batteur sur socle jusqu''à formation de pics mous, puis incorporez progressivement le sucre, 1 cuillère à café à la fois, jusqu''à ce que la meringue soit épaisse et brillante. Incorporer le vinaigre et la maïzena.","Versez la moitié du mélange de meringue au milieu d''une des plaques à pâtisserie préparées et étalez-la en un cercle d''environ 20 à 25 cm. Répétez avec le reste du mélange de meringue sur la deuxième plaque à pâtisserie. Versez uniformément le chocolat fondu sur les deux cercles, puis remuez-le délicatement à l''aide d''un couteau à couverts ou d''une brochette jusqu''à obtenir un effet marbré. Enfournez 1 h, éteignez le four et laissez les meringues refroidir complètement à l''intérieur.","Pendant ce temps, préparez les cacahuètes confites. Versez les cacahuètes, le sucre et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau dans une casserole à fond épais et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 3-4 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce que les cacahuètes commencent à cristalliser et à blanchir. Continuez à cuire en remuant pendant encore 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les cacahuètes deviennent brun foncé. Saupoudrer d''une pincée de flocons de sel marin, puis gratter sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé. Étalez à l''aide d''une spatule et laissez refroidir complètement.","Pour la crème au beurre de cacahuète, faire fondre le chocolat blanc, le beurre de cacahuète, le beurre et 25 ml de crème dans une petite casserole à feu doux en remuant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Transférer dans un bol et laisser refroidir 10 minutes. Fouettez le reste de la crème jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous, puis incorporez le mélange de beurre de cacahuète jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et gonflé.","Pour le montage, déposez un cercle de meringue sur une assiette de service, versez dessus la moitié du crémeux suivi de la moitié de la crème au beurre de cacahuète, puis saupoudrez de la moitié des cacahuètes confites. Garnir du deuxième cercle de meringue, puis du reste de crémeux et de crème au beurre de cacahuète, et du reste de cacahuètes confites. Éparpillez-y quelques copeaux de chocolat noir, si vous le souhaitez. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9929,9049,'fr','Bûche de Noël vegan','Préparez cette bûche de Noël végétalienne au chocolat à l''avance pour un dessert festif sans stress – une excellente alternative au pudding de Noël','["50 g de margarine sans produits laitiers, fondue, plus un peu pour la boîte","250 ml de lait de soja","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de cidre","250 g de farines autolevantes","50 g de sucre en poudre, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre","90 g de margarine sans produits laitiers","200 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de chocolat noir","1½ cuillère à soupe de cassonade","130 g de tofu soyeux","mélange de baies, de houx ou de sucre glace, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la ganache. Faites fondre le chocolat et le sucre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante doucement, en vous assurant que le fond du bol ne touche pas l''eau. Laisser refroidir légèrement. Battre le tofu dans un bol moyen avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajouter le mélange de chocolat fondu et battre encore 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à épaississement et consistance lisse. Réserver dans un endroit frais.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à rouleau suisse de 33 x 23 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez le lait et le vinaigre dans un pichet, puis laissez épaissir légèrement. Fouetter ensemble la farine, 50 g de sucre, la levure chimique et le cacao en poudre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporez la margarine fondue au mélange de lait et versez-la progressivement dans les ingrédients secs, en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez dans le moule, lissez la surface et enfournez pour 20 min. Laisser refroidir dans le moule 5 min.","Saupoudrer les 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre sur une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé. Retournez le biscuit tiède sur le papier sulfurisé sucré, puis décollez le papier sulfurisé utilisé pour tapisser le moule. Enroulez le biscuit à partir d''une des extrémités courtes en vous aidant du papier sulfurisé sucré. Une fois enroulée, couvrez d''un torchon et laissez refroidir complètement (rouler l''éponge tiède permet d''éviter les grosses fissures). Ne vous inquiétez pas s’il y a des petites fissures, elles seront masquées par la ganache.","Préparez le glaçage en fouettant ensemble la margarine, le sucre glace et la vanille jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Déroulez délicatement le biscuit refroidi, puis étalez le glaçage dessus à l''aide d''une spatule en gardant une bordure d''environ 5 cm sur l''extrémité courte du rouleau. Roulez à nouveau l''éponge.","Remuez la ganache pour la décoller, puis étalez-la sur la bûche à l''aide d''une spatule. Faites glisser une fourchette plusieurs fois sur toute la longueur de la bûche pour créer un motif semblable à une écorce. Réfrigérer 30 minutes. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours. Décorer avec des baies et du houx, ou saupoudrer de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9930,4078,'fr','Biscuits aux pépites de chocolat et à la menthe','Dégustez ces biscuits pendant la période de Noël et partagez-les avec vos proches. Ils sont faits de petits morceaux de cannes de bonbon à la menthe poivrée pour une touche extra-festive.','["125g de beurre salé","125 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de sucre en poudre","1 gros œuf","225 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 gouttes d''extrait de menthe poivrée","100 g de pépites de chocolat noir","100 g de chocolat noir haché grossièrement","3 cannes de bonbon à la menthe poivrée, finement hachées ou écrasées"]','["Faites fondre le beurre dans une poêle, laissez-le refroidir quelques minutes, puis versez-le dans un grand bol. Fouettez les deux sucres et l''œuf jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Utilisez une cuillère en bois pour mélanger la farine et la levure chimique jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte. Incorporer l’extrait de menthe poivrée, puis incorporer les pépites de chocolat. Bien envelopper et réfrigérer 1 h.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Divisez la pâte à biscuits en 16 morceaux (environ 45 g chacun) et roulez chaque morceau en boule avec vos mains. Disposez les boules de pâte sur deux plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé, bien espacées, et pressez-les légèrement. Enfournez 10 min, puis sortez les plaques du four et tapotez vivement sur un plan de travail pour aplatir les biscuits. Remettez au four et répétez cette opération après 2 minutes, puis à nouveau après 2 minutes supplémentaires (ils doivent cuire 14 minutes au total). Laisser refroidir complètement sur les plaques.","Faites fondre le chocolat haché dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante, ou par tranches de 15 secondes au micro-ondes, en remuant entre chaque éclat. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Trempez la moitié de chaque biscuit dans le chocolat fondu, placez-le sur le plateau tapissé et saupoudrez de morceaux de canne en bonbon. Transférez le plateau au réfrigérateur et laissez-le prendre au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:02:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9931,9050,'fr','Écorce de chocolat maison facile','Faites de notre écorce de chocolat un cadeau attentionné au moment de Noël. La recette est adaptable, alors utilisez les biscuits que vous avez ou les favoris de votre cadeau','["400 g de chocolat au lait ou noir cassé en morceaux","100 g de chocolat blanc cassé en morceaux","75 g de biscuits au choix, cassés en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe de pépites, de noix hachées ou de bonbons"]','["Faire fondre le chocolat au lait ou noir dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante. Retirez du feu puis faites fondre le chocolat blanc de la même manière. Ou faites fondre les chocolats au micro-ondes par petites rafales.","Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie ou une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Utilisez une plaque à pâtisserie si vous voulez des fragments d''écorce plus fins, ou un plateau plus petit pour des morceaux moins nombreux et plus gros.","Versez le chocolat au lait ou noir fondu sur la feuille ou le plateau préparé, puis basculez-le d''un côté à l''autre pour étaler le chocolat selon la forme et l''épaisseur souhaitées. Versez des cuillères à café de chocolat blanc, en réservant un peu, puis utilisez la pointe d''un couteau ou d''une brochette pour faire tourner le chocolat blanc dans le lait ou le noir.","Répartir sur les morceaux de biscuit, puis arroser du reste de chocolat blanc en spirale. Répartissez-le sur les pépites, les noix ou les bonbons, puis laissez-le prendre complètement dans un endroit frais. Couper ou casser en morceaux et envelopper."]','2026-01-11 00:02:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9932,9051,'fr','Tarte au brownie au chocolat du millionnaire','Imaginez un fond de pâte sablée au chocolat fourré au brownie fondant qui cache des poches de caramel suinttant… C''est le dessert de rêve de tout amateur de chocolat.','["175 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","85g de sucre glace","50g de cacao en poudre","140 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","2 jaunes d''œufs légèrement battus","150 g de beurre haché","200 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","2 œufs","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","75 g de cacao en poudre, plus un peu pour servir","18 chocolats fourrés au caramel"]','["Pour réaliser la pâte, tamisez ensemble la farine, le sucre glace et le cacao dans un bol. Ajoutez le beurre et frottez-le avec les doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Ajoutez les jaunes d''œufs et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau glacée et continuez à mélanger avec les doigts jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle. Vous pouvez également le faire dans un robot culinaire en mélangeant les ingrédients ensemble. Enveloppez la pâte et réfrigérez pendant au moins 1 heure. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux jours.","Abaissez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné jusqu''à l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £, puis utilisez-la pour tapisser un moule à tarte à fond amovible de 23 cm, en travaillant la pâte jusqu''au bord et en laissant un peu de débordement. Couvrir et mettre au réfrigérateur pendant encore une heure.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser le moule de papier sulfurisé, puis remplir de fèves au four. Enfourner 20 mn. Retirez les haricots secs et le papier sulfurisé et faites cuire encore 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la base soit croustillante. Laisser refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidi, utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour couper l''excédent de pâte et créer un bord lisse.","Pour la garniture, faites fondre le beurre et le chocolat noir ensemble dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau. Remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse, retirer du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement. Battre les œufs et le sucre avec un fouet électrique dans un autre bol pendant 5 à 6 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et pâle. Incorporez le chocolat, puis tamisez le cacao.","Répartissez les chocolats au caramel sur le fond du fond de tarte, puis versez sur la garniture. Transférer la tarte sur une plaque à pâtisserie et mettre au four (toujours réglé à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5) pendant 20-25 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit pris et que le dessus ait formé une croûte. Laisser refroidir à température ambiante, puis démouler délicatement et disposer sur une assiette de service. Saupoudrez avec le cacao supplémentaire et saupoudrez d''un peu de sel marin, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9933,9052,'fr','Plateau double chocolat & noix de coco','Associez du chocolat au lait crémeux à de la noix de coco pour un mariage paradisiaque, puis décorez avec plus de noix de coco et un filet de chocolat blanc.','["200 g de beurre doux, ramolli","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","3 gros œufs","60 g de noix de coco desséchée","200 g de farines autolevantes","100 g de yaourt grec","½ cuillère à café d''arôme noix de coco (facultatif, voir conseil ci-dessous)","200 g de chocolat au lait ou noir coupé en petits morceaux","200 ml de crème fraîche","40 g de chocolat blanc fondu","poignée de flocons de noix de coco, de noix de coco grillée ou desséchée ou de pépites"]','["Tapisser un moule à cake rectangulaire de 22 x 28 cm de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Tout d’abord, préparez la garniture. Mettez les morceaux de chocolat au lait ou noir dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur. Faites chauffer la crème double dans une poêle moyenne jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste fumante, puis versez-la lentement sur le chocolat en fouettant jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu et que le mélange soit lisse. Laisser refroidir légèrement, puis réfrigérer 1 h 30 jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, mais encore cuillère.","Battre le beurre, les sucres et ¼ de cuillère à café de sel ensemble dans un batteur sur socle ou à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs un à un en battant bien après chaque ajout. Ajoutez la noix de coco desséchée, la farine, le yaourt et l''arôme de noix de coco, le cas échéant, et battez brièvement jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le mélange dans le moule, lissez la surface avec le dos d''une cuillère, puis enfournez pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et ferme au toucher. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Une fois complètement refroidi, étalez sur la garniture au chocolat, puis arrosez de chocolat blanc et répartissez sur les flocons de noix de coco grillés. Réfrigérer environ 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit prise. Coupez en 12 carrés, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9934,6869,'fr','Plateau de fête au chocolat végétalien','Préparez un délicieux plateau de chocolat végétalien que toute la famille adorera. Cette pâtisserie simple est parfaite à partager lors de fêtes ou d''une occasion spéciale','["215 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour la boîte","300 ml de lait de soja, d''amande ou de coco","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de cidre de pomme","335 g de sucre muscovado léger","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille ou de pâte de gousse de vanille","175 g de yaourt au soja ou yaourt à la noix de coco","300 g de farines autolevantes","105g de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","¼ cuillère à café de sel","100 g de chocolat noir sans produits laitiers","140g de pâte à tartiner vegan, à température ambiante","1 cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de gousse de vanille","265 g de sucre glace tamisé","½ à 1 cuillère à soupe de lait végétal (ce que vous avez utilisé dans l''éponge)","des pépites colorées (assurez-vous qu''elles conviennent aux végétaliens), pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler un moule à pâtisserie de 23 x 33 cm (au moins 4 cm de profondeur) et tapisser les fonds et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Fouettez le lait et le vinaigre dans un pichet – le lait doit cailler légèrement. Annuler.","Fouettez le sucre, l''huile et l''extrait de vanille dans un bol, puis ajoutez le yaourt en fouettant, en veillant à éliminer les grumeaux de sucre. Versez le lait caillé et mélangez bien.","Tamisez la farine, le cacao en poudre, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude et le sel dans un autre bol et mélangez bien. Incorporez progressivement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse, mais veillez à ne pas trop mélanger.","Versez la pâte dans le moule et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien levée et élastique, et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte presque propre. Quelques miettes collantes suffisent, mais le mélange ne doit pas être mouillé.","Laissez le gâteau refroidir dans son moule pendant 20 minutes, puis démoulez-le délicatement sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement. Ce sera délicat alors soyez doux. L’éponge se conservera, couverte, à température ambiante jusqu’à deux jours.","Pour la crème au beurre vegan, faites fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes ou dans un bol posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante. Laisser refroidir. Battre la pâte à tartiner et la vanille à haute vitesse dans un batteur sur socle pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez progressivement le sucre glace, en commençant lentement, puis en augmentant la vitesse au maximum jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et crémeux. Versez le chocolat refroidi et mélangez bien, ajoutez un peu de lait végétal si le glaçage est très ferme. Réfrigérez la crème au beurre pendant au moins 30 minutes avant de l''utiliser.","Lorsque le gâteau est complètement refroidi, étalez le glaçage sur le dessus et décorez avec les pépites, si vous le souhaitez. Conservez le gâteau au réfrigérateur pour qu''il reste ferme, puis retirez-le 1 h avant de servir. Se conserve, couvert, au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9935,5181,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat sans farine','Offrez à quelqu''un ce gâteau au chocolat sans farine. Il est idéal pour tous ceux qui suivent un régime sans gluten et constitue un dessert irrésistible avec des baies fraîches.','["225 g de beurre salé coupé en cubes, et un peu pour le moule","300 g de chocolat noir haché grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de café en poudre","6 gros œufs, blancs et jaunes séparés","100 g de sucre roux clair et mou","200 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de pâte de vanille","30g de cacao en poudre","baies, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer un moule à charnière de 23 cm et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé.","Faire fondre le beurre et le chocolat dans un bol moyen résistant à la chaleur au micro-ondes ou sur une casserole d''eau frémissante. Mélangez la poudre de café avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude jusqu''à dissolution. Incorporer le café au chocolat et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Battre les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol pendant 2 minutes avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à formation de pics mous. Dans un autre grand bol, fouetter les sucres, la vanille et les jaunes d''œufs pendant 5 à 8 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Tamisez la poudre de cacao dans le mélange de jaunes d''œufs et mélangez délicatement pour combiner.","Incorporer le chocolat refroidi au mélange de jaunes d''œufs, puis incorporer délicatement les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à consistance lisse. Transférer dans le moule et cuire au four pendant 1h à 1h20, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu du gâteau en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir, démouler et servir avec des baies fraîches, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:02:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9936,9053,'fr','Plateau financier framboise & chocolat blanc','Pensez aux financiers comme les pâtisseries chics à base de beurre noisette. Tom Kerridge les transforme ici en plateau, en utilisant des framboises et du chocolat blanc','["200 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de farine nature","100 g d''amandes moulues","petite pincée de cannelle moulue","6 gros blancs d''œufs (congeler les jaunes d''œufs pour une autre recette)","150g de framboises","100 g de pépites ou de morceaux de chocolat blanc","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","Pot de 227 g de crème caillée, pour servir"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une petite poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille. Surveillez-le attentivement : le beurre moussera et, lorsque la mousse disparaîtra, il passera du jaune au brun noisette. Retirez du feu, versez dans un bol pour arrêter la cuisson et laissez refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à pâtisserie de 20 x 25 cm sur au moins 4 cm de profondeur et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez le sucre, la farine, les amandes et la cannelle. Battre les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol séparé à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous. Incorporez les blancs d''œufs battus au mélange de farine à l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal. Versez lentement le beurre noisette en l''incorporant jusqu''à ce que tout soit combiné et que la pâte soit légère. Grattez dans le moule préparé. Répartir sur les framboises et le chocolat.","Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme. Laisser refroidir dans le moule, puis saupoudrer de sucre glace et couper en carrés ou en barres. Se conserve, bien emballé, jusqu''à trois jours à température ambiante. Servir avec de la crème caillée."]','2026-01-11 00:02:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9937,9054,'fr','Pudding cuit à la vapeur au chocolat et à la marmelade avec crème de marmelade','Associez le chocolat et la marmelade pour un dessert paradisiaque. La crème – qui fonctionne également avec de nombreux autres desserts – va encore plus loin.','["175g de beurre, plus un peu pour la bassine","45g de cacao en poudre","175 g de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 orange, zestée","3 gros œufs légèrement battus","115 g de marmelade molle, battue pour la décoller","100 g de chocolat noir haché","300 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de sucre glace","125 g de marmelade molle, battue pour la décoller, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Beurrer une bassine à pudding de 1,2 litre et déposer un cercle de papier sulfurisé beurré au fond.","Tamisez ensemble le cacao, la farine, le bicarbonate, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel. Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble au batteur électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux, puis ajouter le zeste d''orange. Ajoutez progressivement les œufs, petit à petit, en battant bien après chaque ajout. Incorporer la marmelade. Incorporez les ingrédients tamisés suivis des morceaux de chocolat noir. Versez la pâte dans le bassin à pudding préparé.","Placez un morceau de papier sulfurisé sur une feuille de papier d''aluminium (les deux doivent être suffisamment grands pour recouvrir la bassine et dépasser les bords). Pliez un pli au milieu, puis placez-le, côté parchemin vers le bas, sur le pudding. Le pli doit traverser le centre. Attachez fermement le bassin avec de la ficelle et utilisez-la pour faire une poignée. Coupez l''excédent de papier sulfurisé et de papier d''aluminium.","Mettez le pudding dans une grande casserole sur un dessous de plat ou une soucoupe retournée. Ajoutez suffisamment d’eau bouillante pour atteindre un tiers de la hauteur des parois du bassin. Portez l''eau à ébullition, baissez le feu à ébullition, couvrez la casserole et faites cuire le pudding à la vapeur pendant 2h-2h15. Continuez à faire l''appoint avec de l''eau chaude.","Sortez le pudding de la poêle, laissez reposer 10 min, puis passez un couteau entre la bassine et le bord du pudding. Renverser sur une assiette – le pudding doit glisser. Retirez le parchemin.","Fouettez la crème et le sucre glace en pics mous, puis incorporez la marmelade. Servir le pudding avec une cuillerée de crème et un peu de marmelade dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:02:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9938,9055,'fr','Coupes de chocolat Banoffee','Préparez-les pour les offrir comme cadeau de Noël comestible. Fabriqués avec du chocolat, du dulce de leche et des chips de banane, ils ont tout le goût d''une tarte au banoffee en une petite bouchée','["150 g de chocolat noir haché","150 g de chocolat au lait haché","12 mini biscuits digestifs (ou quelques biscuits digestifs écrasés)","40 g de chips de banane finement émiettées","100 g de dulce de leche","des copeaux de chocolat, des pépites d''or ou des feuilles d''or comestibles, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Tapisser un moule à cupcakes à 12 trous de caissettes en papier ou en silicone. Faites fondre le chocolat noir et le chocolat au lait ensemble pendant 1 à 2 minutes au micro-ondes. Répartissez les biscuits digestifs dans les caissettes et mettez les chips de banane dans chacune. Versez suffisamment de chocolat fondu dans les caissettes pour recouvrir les biscuits, en réservant le reste. Transférez le moule au congélateur pour qu''il refroidisse pendant 15 minutes.","Remuez le dulce de leche pour le détacher, puis versez ou déposez un petit point au centre de chaque tasse. Versez sur le chocolat réservé pour recouvrir la garniture, puis décorez avec des copeaux de chocolat, des pépites d''or ou des feuilles d''or comestibles, si vous le souhaitez. Mettez au réfrigérateur pendant 2 heures, puis retirez les caissettes et emballez-les dans des coffrets cadeaux. Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9939,9056,'fr','Route rocailleuse de Noël','Adaptez cette route rocailleuse festive comme bon vous semble. C''est idéal pour utiliser les restes de bonbons et de biscuits de Noël, et vous pouvez également impliquer les enfants dans leur préparation.','["100 g de beurre coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","250g de biscuits de Noël, type sablés ou biscuits au chocolat","75 g de noix décortiquées (utilisez un sac de noix entières ou des morceaux du placard de cuisson)","100 g de fruits secs mélangés (comme des raisins secs, des cerises ou du gingembre glacé)","75g de bonbons de Noël (cannes de bonbon, guimauves ou bonbons à la gelée)","400 g de chocolat au lait ou nature (ou un mélange des deux), haché","140 g de sirop doré (pesez-le directement dans la poêle que vous utiliserez pour faire fondre)","2 cuillères à soupe de pépites ou plus de bonbons pour décorer"]','["Beurrer et tapisser un moule carré de 20 cm, ou utiliser un moule en silicone carré de 20 cm. Cassez les biscuits en morceaux – ils ne doivent pas être plus petits qu’un pois, mais pas trop gros, sinon votre route rocailleuse ne tiendra pas.","Coupez en deux les noix plus grosses en les cassant ou en les coupant soigneusement avec un couteau, puis combinez-les avec les biscuits. Coupez en deux tous les gros morceaux de fruits secs et hachez ou cassez les bonbons en petits morceaux, puis ajoutez-les dans le bol.","Faites fondre délicatement 300 g de chocolat, le beurre et le sirop doré dans une casserole sur feu doux en remuant de temps en temps, puis versez-le sur le mélange biscuit-noix et mélangez pour que le chocolat recouvre le tout.","Versez le mélange dans le moule, puis nivelez le dessus – il n’est pas nécessaire qu’il soit complètement lisse. Faites fondre le reste du chocolat au micro-ondes par petits coups ou dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une petite casserole d''eau frémissante, puis versez-en un filet sur le dessus et saupoudrez de décorations. Réfrigérer au moins 3 heures ou toute la nuit avant de couper en carrés. Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant trois à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:02:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9940,9057,'fr','Fondant au chocolat de niveau supérieur','Épatez les convives avec notre fondant au chocolat ultime. Son cœur fondu fait rêver les desserts – et nous y avons également ajouté des arômes de caramel et de café.','["200 g de beurre fondu","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre, pour saupoudrer","50 g de sauce bonbon","200 g de chocolat noir haché","4 cuillères à soupe de café en poudre très fort (l''expresso est idéal)","6 œufs, trois entiers, plus les jaunes de 3 (congeler les restes de blancs d''œufs pour une autre recette)","75 g de sucre en poudre doré","50g de farine nature","6 petites bassines à pudding en métal"]','["Utilisez 50 g de beurre pour badigeonner l''intérieur des bassines à pudding. Mettez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie et transférez-les au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce que le beurre prenne. Badigeonner d''une autre couche de beurre, puis saupoudrer généreusement de cacao. Remettre au réfrigérateur pour prendre. Mélangez la sauce caramel avec une bonne pincée de flocons de sel marin, puis réservez au réfrigérateur jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser.","Versez le reste du beurre, le chocolat et le café en poudre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Placez le bol sur une casserole d’eau frémissante doucement, en vous assurant que le fond du bol ne touche pas l’eau. Remuer le mélange jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant une autre petite pincée de sel marin. Versez les œufs entiers, les jaunes d''œufs et le sucre dans un autre bol et battez ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit très pâle – le fouet doit laisser une trace dans le mélange lorsqu''il est soulevé. Tamisez la farine, puis incorporez délicatement le mélange de chocolat fondu.","Versez le mélange de fondant dans les bassines préparées jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient à moitié pleines, puis transférez-les au congélateur sur une plaque à pâtisserie pendant environ 20 à 25 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit à peine pris. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de sauce caramel salé au milieu de chaque fondant, puis complétez avec le reste du mélange fondant. Remettre au congélateur jusqu''à ce qu''il soit congelé. Peut être préparé jusqu''à deux semaines à l''avance.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettez les fondants sur une plaque à pâtisserie et enfournez pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus ait formé une croûte et qu''il commence à se décoller des parois des bassines. Sortir du four, puis laisser reposer 1 min avant de démouler sur des assiettes chaudes. Saupoudrer de sel marin supplémentaire, puis servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:02:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9941,9058,'fr','Béton au chocolat sauce caramel','Mettez à jour une recette classique de dîner scolaire en utilisant de la sauce au caramel au lieu de la crème anglaise rose pour accompagner des carrés de chocolat. Les enfants (et les grands enfants) vont adorer','["175 g de farine nature","50g d''amandes moulues","60g de cacao","115 g de sucre en poudre doré","145 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","sucre demerara, pour saupoudrer","4 cuillères à soupe de caramel","50 ml de crème liquide"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Mettre la farine, les amandes, le cacao, le sucre semoule et une grosse pincée de sel dans un robot culinaire et fouetter brièvement. Ajouter le beurre et fouetter jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à du sable humide.","Beurrer généreusement le fond et les côtés d''un petit moule à pâtisserie (15 x 25 cm). Versez le mélange dans le moule et appuyez dessus. Cuire au four 30 mn. À la sortie du four, saupoudrez d''un peu de sucre demerara et coupez en carrés à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé pendant qu''il est encore mou.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le caramel et la crème ensemble dans une poêle. Servir le béton tiède avec la sauce caramel. Vous pouvez refroidir les restes et les manger froids : ils durciront comme des sablés."]','2026-01-11 00:02:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9942,9059,'fr','Petits pains croisés double chocolat','Une version gourmande d''une friandise traditionnelle de Pâques. Si vous êtes fan d''orange chocolat, ajoutez un peu de zeste à la pâte sèche et trempez les raisins secs dans le jus d''orange.','["300 ml de lait","400 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50g de cacao en poudre","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 gros oeuf, battu","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100g de raisins secs","100 g de pépites de chocolat au lait","50g de chocolat blanc","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","50g de farine nature"]','["Pour la pâte, faites chauffer 275 ml de lait quelques minutes dans une petite casserole ou 1 minute au micro-ondes à puissance élevée. Mélangez la farine, le cacao, la levure, le sucre et la cannelle dans un grand bol et fouettez l''œuf et l''extrait de vanille dans le lait chaud. Versez le liquide dans les ingrédients secs et remuez pour obtenir une pâte molle. Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail propre et pétrissez pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Remettez la pâte dans le bol nettoyé, couvrez d''un film alimentaire huilé et laissez lever jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume – environ 1 heure.","Retournez la pâte sur un plan de travail, répartissez-la sur les raisins secs et les pépites de chocolat et pétrissez-les.","Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Divisez la pâte en 12 morceaux égaux et formez chacun une boule lisse. Disposez les boules sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée en formation de 4 x 3, en laissant un peu d''espace entre les deux pour lever. Faites une croix sur le dessus de chaque petit pain, couvrez-le légèrement d''un film alimentaire huilé et laissez lever jusqu''à ce que les petits pains aient presque doublé de volume.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Pour les croix en chocolat blanc, faire fondre le chocolat blanc avec le lait dans une petite casserole ou au micro-ondes, puis incorporer la farine, 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois, pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Verser dans une poche à douille jetable ou un sac alimentaire et couper le bout du coin.","Glacez les petits pains avec le reste de lait et enfournez 15 min, puis dressez les croix là où vous avez marqué la pâte et enfournez encore 5 min. Laisser refroidir sur une grille avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:02:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9943,9060,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat, orange et noisettes','Vous ne devinerez jamais que ce dessert spectaculaire est sans produits laitiers, décoré d''une ganache piquante utilisant du jus d''orange au lieu de la crème.','["175 ml d''huile d''olive claire, plus un peu pour le graissage","140 g de noisettes blanchies","100 ml de jus d''orange, plus le zeste d''1 orange","140 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","50g de cacao en poudre","3 gros œufs","175 g de sucre brun clair muscovado","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 grosse orange, coupée en tranches de 3 mm/1/8 po","75 ml de jus d''orange","100 g de chocolat noir sans produits laitiers","50 g de noisettes blanchies et grillées","1 cuillère à café de poudre d''or comestible (voir astuce)"]','["Préparez les tranches d''orange confites la veille si vous le pouvez. Mettez le sucre et 300 ml d''eau dans une casserole moyenne et portez à ébullition. Réduire à feu doux, ajouter les tranches d''orange et cuire 1h-1h10 ou jusqu''à ce que la peau soit translucide, en retournant de temps en temps. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Retirez délicatement les tranches du sirop, placez-les sur la plaque préparée et laissez sécher (au moins 8 heures) avant de les couper en deux. Réservez le sirop.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Graisser légèrement un moule à cake (le mien faisait 900g) avec de l''huile d''olive et le tapisser d''une bande de papier sulfurisé.","Broyez les noisettes au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''elles ressemblent à de la chapelure grossière (ne les mixez pas trop sinon elles deviendront grasses), puis ajoutez-les dans un bol avec le zeste d''orange, une pincée de sel et le reste des ingrédients secs. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène.","Versez l''huile et le jus d''orange dans un pichet et mélangez. Mettez les œufs et le sucre dans un mixeur de table ou un grand bol et fouettez ensemble pendant 5 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange ait triplé de volume et tienne un ruban à la surface lorsque les batteurs sont retirés. Versez lentement le mélange d''huile dans le mélange d''œufs et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Ajouter le mélange de farine au mélange d''œufs en 3 ou 4 ajouts, en pliant jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Vous ne pouvez pas tamiser ce mélange sur les œufs à cause des noisettes, mais essayez de ne pas jeter la farine au même endroit – il faut être prudent et plier la pâte pour conserver sa légèreté. Une fois le tout bien mélangé, versez la pâte dans le moule à pain préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 50 à 55 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre du gâteau en ressorte propre.","Piquer tout le dessus du gâteau, puis verser dessus 5 cuillères à soupe du sirop d''orange réservé. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement. Coupez le dessus du gâteau (conservez-le pour une mini bagatelle) et démoulez-le, côté coupé vers le bas, sur un plat de service.","Pour décorer, versez le jus d''orange dans une petite casserole et portez à ébullition. Mettez le chocolat dans un petit bol, versez le jus d''orange dessus et mélangez pour former une ganache lisse. Réserver au réfrigérateur jusqu''à épaississement, environ 20-25 minutes. Versez les noisettes dans un petit bol et ajoutez la poudre d''or avec un filet d''eau en remuant pour bien les enrober. Mettez la ganache dans une poche à douille munie d''une petite douille ronde. Dressez des pics sur le dessus du gâteau en décorant avec les noisettes dorées et les tranches d''orange. Se conserve jusqu''à 3 jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:02:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9944,9061,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat malté','Ce gâteau en couches est recouvert d''un glaçage au fromage à la crème et arrosé d''une ganache au chocolat noir - une superbe pièce maîtresse pour une grande occasion.','["200 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 gros œufs","225 g de farine nature","25 g de boisson maltée en poudre","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","100g de yaourt nature","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","175 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 gros œufs","225 g de farine nature","25g de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","50g de yaourt nature","100 g de chocolat noir fondu et un peu refroidi","beurre ou huile sans saveur, pour graisser","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","5 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","Paquet de 37 g de Malteasers","250 g de beurre légèrement salé ramolli","750 g de sucre glace","3 cuillères à soupe de boisson maltée en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","Pot de 280 g de fromage à la crème entier","100 g de chocolat noir finement haché","75 ml de crème fraîche"]','["Préparez d’abord les éponges au malt. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond de 2 moules à cake de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mettez le beurre et le sucre dans un grand bol et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en fouettant bien entre chaque ajout. Versez la farine, le malt et la levure chimique dans le bol avec 1/4 cuillère à café de sel et mélangez, puis ajoutez le yaourt et la vanille et remuez le tout une dernière fois. Répartissez le mélange à gâteau entre les 2 moules, nivelez le dessus et faites cuire au four sur la grille du milieu pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent enfoncé au centre des gâteaux en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes, puis démouler, retirer le papier sulfurisé et transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Lavez les boîtes.","Préparez maintenant les génoises au chocolat. Beurrer et tapisser le fond des moules comme avant et faire bouillir la bouilloire. Dans le même bol (ne vous souciez pas du lavage), crémer le beurre et le sucre comme avant, en ajoutant les œufs, un à la fois, et en mélangeant jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Tamisez la farine, le cacao et la levure chimique avec 1/4 cuillère à café de sel. Pliez le mélange, puis ajoutez le yaourt, le chocolat fondu et 100 ml d''eau bouillante. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis répartir dans les moules. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes en testant avec une brochette comme auparavant. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler, retirer le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir complètement. Les génoises peuvent être préparées jusqu''à 2 jours avant d''être glacées, refroidies et bien emballées dans un film alimentaire.","Fabriquez le nid d''abeille. Beurrer une plaque à pâtisserie avec un peu de beurre ou d''huile. Mettez le sucre et le sirop doré dans une grande casserole. Chauffer à feu moyen et laisser bouillonner jusqu’à obtenir un caramel liquide, mais ne remuez pas. Lorsque vous êtes satisfait de la couleur (plus elle devient foncée, plus la saveur sera intense), ajoutez le bicarbonate de soude et incorporez rapidement au sirop. Avant que les bulles ne disparaissent, versez le mélange moussant sur la plaque à pâtisserie, puis laissez reposer 30 minutes pour qu''il refroidisse et raffermisse.","Préparez le glaçage. Dans votre plus grand bol, battez le beurre avec la moitié du sucre glace, le malt et la vanille jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez le reste du sucre glace et le fromage à la crème et battez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé – ne pas trop mélanger sinon le glaçage pourrait devenir liquide.","Vous êtes maintenant prêt à assembler. Placez l''une des génoises sur un support à gâteau ou une planche à gâteau, en la collant avec une petite goutte de glaçage. Utilisez 1/4 du glaçage pour empiler les gâteaux en alternant les génoises au malt et au chocolat. Placez la dernière génoise dessus, côté plat vers le haut. Une fois assemblé, utilisez un couteau à palette pour recouvrir tout le gâteau d''une fine couche de glaçage, en comblant les espaces entre les génoises, mais ne vous inquiétez pas de recouvrir complètement les génoises à ce stade. C''est ce qu''on appelle une couche de miettes et garantit que votre couche finale est sans miettes. Faites de la place dans votre réfrigérateur et refroidissez le gâteau pendant 30 minutes pour raffermir le glaçage.","Une fois le glaçage refroidi, utilisez le reste du glaçage pour recouvrir complètement le gâteau. C''est plus simple si vous empilez le glaçage sur le gâteau, puis utilisez un couteau à palette pour le faire passer sur le bord et sur les côtés. Vous pouvez le rendre aussi lisse ou rugueux que vous le souhaitez. Réfrigérer encore 30 minutes.","Faites la bruine. Pendant ce temps, mettez le chocolat noir dans un bol et faites chauffer la crème dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste fumante. Versez la crème sur le chocolat et laissez fondre 5 à 10 minutes. Remuer pour obtenir une ganache brillante, puis réserver pour qu''elle raffermisse un peu – vous voulez que la ganache soit versable mais pas trop liquide, pour former des gouttelettes bruines sur le côté du gâteau.","Lorsque la ganache a la bonne consistance, sortez le gâteau du réfrigérateur et versez la ganache sur le bord supérieur du gâteau, en l''encourageant à arroser le côté avec votre cuillère – commencez par l''arrière du gâteau pour bien comprendre. Remplissez également le milieu du dessus du gâteau avec du chocolat.","Cassez le nid d''abeilles en grands éclats et empilez-les sur le gâteau. Terminez avec des Maltesers entiers et coupés en deux, en ajoutant quelques-uns autour de la base, ainsi que quelques miettes de nid d''abeilles. Le gâteau est mieux servi dans les 2 à 3 heures suivant son assemblage, mais il restera délicieux jusqu''à 3 jours. Conservez les restes au réfrigérateur et laissez-les revenir à température ambiante avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:02:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9945,9062,'fr','Muffins aux pépites de chocolat Flowerpot','Les enfants adoreront préparer ces délicieux gâteaux aux pépites de chocolat surmontés de fleurs en papier de riz – parfaits pour un projet de pâtisserie de Pâques pour enfants.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","125 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","25g de cacao en poudre","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 gros œuf","100 ml de lait","150 g de pépites de chocolat au lait","25 g de décorations pour gâteaux au chocolat telles que des vermicelles ou des bonbons éclatants enrobés de chocolat","20 marguerites en gaufrettes en papier de riz (elles sont livrées en paquets de 12, alors achetez-en 2)","10 mini pots en terre cuite (voir astuce)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler légèrement l''intérieur des pots en terre cuite avec un peu d''huile végétale et les disposer sur une plaque allant au four. Placez un moule à mini muffins en papier au fond de chaque pot.","Mettez la farine, la levure chimique et le cacao dans un bol et incorporez le sucre.","Cassez l''œuf dans un pichet et fouettez-le avec le lait et le reste de l''huile. Versez-le sur le mélange farine-cacao et incorporez-le à 50 g de pépites de chocolat. Faites attention à ne pas trop mélanger – vous voulez un mélange lâche mais toujours assez grumeleux. Verser dans les pots remplis aux trois quarts. Placer au milieu du four et cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et ferme. Transférer sur une grille (toujours dans les pots) et laisser refroidir.","Mettez le reste des pépites de chocolat dans un petit bol et faites-les fondre dans une petite casserole d''eau frémissante (ne laissez pas l''eau toucher le bol), ou mettez dans un bol allant au micro-ondes et faites chauffer à puissance élevée pendant 1 minute jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient fondues.","Tartinez le dessus des muffins avec le chocolat fondu. Saupoudrer de décorations en chocolat et ajouter 2 marguerites en papier de riz dans chaque pot pour servir. Se conserve 2 jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:02:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9946,9063,'fr','Biscuits aux morceaux de chocolat, noix de cajou et canneberges','Ces biscuits aux noisettes sont remplis de morceaux de chocolat et de fruits secs moelleux – remplacez les noix de cajou par des cacahuètes si vous préférez','["Paquet de 100 g de noix de cajou, ou plus si vous le souhaitez","140 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","200 g de sucre blanc en poudre","100 g de beurre de noix de cajou croquant, ou utilisez du beurre de cacahuète","1 gros oeuf, battu","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","200 g de chocolat en barre, 50 % de cacao, coupé en morceaux de 1 cm","50 g de canneberges séchées (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Répartir les noix de cajou sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faire griller pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Laisser refroidir, puis hacher grossièrement.","Pendant ce temps, graisser et tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Tamisez la farine, la levure chimique et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol, puis incorporez le sucre. Coupez le beurre en cubes grossiers et ajoutez-le ainsi que le beurre de noix dans le bol. Frotter ensemble jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure humide.","À l''aide d''un couteau à couverts, travaillez l''œuf et le sirop dans le bol pour obtenir une pâte molle. Versez le chocolat, les noix et les canneberges (le cas échéant) et mélangez. Essayez de ne pas trop travailler la pâte à ce stade.","Roulez des cuillères à soupe de pâte légèrement bombées en boules et placez-les sur chaque plaque à pâtisserie, en laissant suffisamment d''espace pour que les biscuits s''étalent. Cuire au four pendant 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés et levés au milieu. Laissez-les refroidir pendant 5 minutes, puis placez-les sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement. Répétez jusqu''à ce que toute la pâte soit façonnée et cuite. Pour préparer à l''avance, congelez les biscuits crus sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis transférez-les dans un sac ou une boîte de congélation une fois solides. Cuire au four congelé, en ajoutant 5 minutes au temps de cuisson."]','2026-01-11 00:02:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9947,9064,'fr','Tarte tourbillonnante à la cardamome, chocolat noir et blanc','Superposez deux types de ganache au chocolat sur un fond de biscuit pour réaliser une superbe tarte marbrée – parfaite comme dessert lors d''un dîner','["7 gousses de cardamome","400 g de crème fraîche","100 g de sucre blanc en poudre","Tablette de 200 g de chocolat blanc belge","Paquet de 180 g Willie''s Cacao Venezuelan Black 100 % cacao Carenero, ou essayez Lindt 99 % cacao (tous deux disponibles chez Waitrose)","25 g de beurre doux coupé en petits morceaux et ramolli","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","150 ml de lait entier","200g dark chocolate digestives","75 g de beurre doux fondu, plus un peu pour graisser","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre (blanc ou doré)"]','["Écrasez les gousses de cardamome avec un pilon et un mortier, puis mettez les graines et les coques dans une poêle moyenne. Versez la crème et le sucre, remuez, puis faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que la crème commence à frémir. Retirez la casserole du feu et laissez infuser 30 min.","Pendant ce temps, hachez finement le chocolat blanc dans un robot culinaire, puis versez-le dans un bol moyen. Répétez avec le cacao, versez-le dans un autre bol et ajoutez le beurre. Assaisonnez chaque chocolat avec une pincée de sel.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et graisser légèrement un moule à tarte cannelé ou un moule à charnière de 23 cm. Sans nettoyer le robot, versez les digestifs et mixez en fines miettes. Incorporez le beurre fondu et le sucre jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à du sable humide, puis appuyez fermement sur le fond du moule. Glissez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie, enfournez 10 minutes, puis laissez refroidir complètement.","Lorsque le fond est froid, réchauffez la crème infusée jusqu''à ébullition. Filtrer la moitié de la crème sur le chocolat blanc et remuer. Ajoutez le lait à ce qui reste dans la casserole, réchauffez, puis filtrez-le sur le cacao et le beurre hachés et remuez. Il faudra quelques minutes avant que chaque chocolat fonde complètement.","Versez la totalité de la ganache au cacao sauf environ 3 cuillères à soupe sur la base de biscuit et réfrigérez pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste prise. Inondez maintenant le dessus avec la ganache au chocolat blanc. Terminez avec le mélange de cacao réservé,\r\ndéposer 6 cuillerées sur le dessus comme un cadran d''horloge et une au milieu. Utilisez une brochette pour mélanger les couleurs ensemble. Mettez au frais au moins 4 heures ou idéalement toute une nuit pour que la ganache durcisse, puis sortez-la du réfrigérateur 30 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9948,9065,'fr','Pains croisés chauds au chocolat et aux épices','Parsemés de chocolat noir, de cannelle, de zeste d''orange et de raisins secs dodus, ces petits pains constituent un régal de Pâques très spécial.','["le zeste et le jus d''une grosse orange","huile de tournesol, pour graisser","225 ml de lait demi-écrémé","50 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","1 gros œuf","450 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à café de levure à action rapide","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","140g de raisins secs","100 g de chocolat, 70% de cacao","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de farine nature"]','["Préparez d''abord la pâte. Faites chauffer le lait dans une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fumant. Retirer du feu et déposer le beurre. Après quelques minutes, incorporez l''œuf et la moitié du zeste d''orange.\r\nLe liquide doit être juste tiède pour l''étape 2.","Mélangez la farine forte, la levure, 1 cuillère à café de sel et le sucre dans un grand bol, puis versez le liquide et remuez pour obtenir une pâte molle sans zones sèches. Farinez le plan de travail et vos mains, puis pétrissez la pâte pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Utilisez un batteur sur socle ou un robot si vous le souhaitez. Huiler un grand bol, y déposer la pâte, puis couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé. Lever dans un endroit chaud pendant environ 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Mettez les raisins secs et la moitié du jus d''orange dans une petite casserole ou un bol couvert, et laissez mijoter pendant quelques minutes ou faites chauffer au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 1 minute. Refroidissez complètement. Cassez le chocolat dans un robot culinaire avec la cannelle et 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre, puis mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit haché très finement. Incorporer le reste du zeste. Si vous n’avez pas de robot, hachez-le à la main ou râpez-le, puis mélangez-le aux autres ingrédients.","Retournez la pâte levée sur une surface farinée et étalez-la en un grand rectangle, un peu plus grand qu''un papier A4. Répartissez-le uniformément avec le mélange chocolaté et les raisins secs qui doivent avoir absorbé tout le jus (égouttez-les sinon). Roulez la pâte autour de la garniture, puis pétrissez-la bien pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le chocolat et les fruits soient uniformément répartis. Certains raisins secs et le chocolat tenteront de s''échapper, mais continuez à les pétrir.","Beurrer puis tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Divisez la pâte en 12 morceaux égaux. Formez des petits pains en pinçant chaque boule de pâte en forme de sac à main, en vous concentrant sur le fait de rendre le dessous de la boule (qui sera le dessus) aussi lisse que possible. Placez les petits pains, côté lisse vers le haut, sur la plaque à pâtisserie, en laissant de la place pour lever. Couvrir légèrement d''un film alimentaire huilé et lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 30 à 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte ait levé et ne rebondisse pas rapidement lorsqu''on la pousse doucement.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Pour préparer la pâte pour les croix, incorporez progressivement 6 à 7 cuillères à soupe d''eau à la farine ordinaire pour obtenir une pâte lisse et épaisse, puis mettez-la dans un sac alimentaire et coupez l''extrémité à environ 5 mm. Pochez les croix, puis faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les petits pains soient levés et bien dorés.","Mélangez le reste du jus d''orange avec le sucre restant et laissez-le se dissoudre. Badigeonnez les petits pains de sirop pendant qu''ils sont chauds, puis laissez-les refroidir. Mangez le jour de la cuisson ou portez un toast le lendemain."]','2026-01-11 00:03:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9949,9066,'fr','Gâteau occultant de Brooklyn','Cette génoise riche et foncée est fourrée et enrobée d''une épaisse crème au chocolat, puis finie avec un gâteau émietté – à déguster frais.','["140 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","100 ml d''huile végétale","140g de babeurre","100 ml de café, préparé avec 1 cuillère à café de poudre d''espresso","2 gros œufs, à température ambiante","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de sucre muscovado léger","250 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","50g de cacao en poudre","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","500 ml de lait entier","140 g de chocolat, 85 % de cacao, coupé en cubes","50g de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à café de poudre d''espresso","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Préparez d''abord la crème anglaise car elle doit refroidir. Mettez tous les ingrédients, sauf la vanille, dans une grande casserole et portez doucement à ébullition en fouettant tout le temps, jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu et que vous obteniez une crème anglaise soyeuse et épaisse. Cela prendra 5 à 7 minutes à froid. Incorporez la vanille et une généreuse pincée de sel, puis grattez la crème anglaise dans un bol large et peu profond. Couvrir la surface d''un film alimentaire, laisser refroidir, puis réfrigérer pendant au moins 3 heures ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit froid et pris.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer puis tapisser le fond de 2 moules à sandwich de 20 cm. Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle, puis retirer du feu et incorporer l''huile, le babeurre, le café et les œufs. Dans un grand bol, fouettez ensemble les ingrédients secs plus 1/4 cuillère à café de sel (évite le tamisage) et écrasez les morceaux de sucre résistants avec vos doigts. Versez les ingrédients humides et fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Répartissez la pâte dans les moules préparés et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle lève et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu des gâteaux en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement, côté papier vers le bas.","Retirez les doublures en papier sulfurisé des gâteaux. Si les gâteaux sont bombés, coupez-les à plat. Maintenant, coupez chaque gâteau au milieu à l’aide d’un grand couteau dentelé. Mettez votre couche la moins réussie et tous les parures dans un robot et réduisez-la en miettes. Verser dans un grand bol.","Disposez une couche sur une assiette à gâteau et tartinez-la avec un quart de la crème anglaise. Placez la couche suivante en sandwich sur le dessus, ajoutez un autre quart de la crème anglaise, puis recouvrez de la dernière couche de gâteau. Versez le reste de la crème anglaise sur le gâteau, puis étalez-la sur le dessus et sur les côtés jusqu''à consistance lisse. Mettre au réfrigérateur 15 minutes pour raffermir à nouveau la crème.","Tenez le gâteau au-dessus du bol contenant les miettes, puis saupoudrez et pressez doucement une couche de miettes sur tout le gâteau. Brossez tout excédent de la plaque. Il vous restera quelques miettes. Réfrigérez pendant 2 heures ou plus avant de servir et mangez-le froid. Peut être préparé jusqu''à 2 jours à l''avance. Le gâteau devient plus fondant et plus attrayant à mesure que vous le laissez longtemps."]','2026-01-11 00:03:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9950,9067,'fr','Gâteau Mont Blanc chocolat meringué','Ce gâteau imposant est composé de couches de génoise au chocolat, de meringue et de crème de marrons : une superbe pièce maîtresse pour un dîner de fête.','["300 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de chocolat noir finement haché","2 gros œufs et 3 jaunes","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","140 g de sucre mou roux clair","200 g de purée de marrons en boîte de 415 g (réserver le reste pour la garniture ci-dessous)","175 g de farine nature","50g de cacao en poudre","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 gros blancs d''œufs","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","215 g de purée de marrons (en boîte, ci-dessus)","100 g de sucre glace + un peu pour saupoudrer","copeaux de chocolat (facultatif)"]','["Beurrer 2 moules à cake de 20 cm de profondeur et tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 3. Faire fondre le chocolat et le beurre dans un bol au dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante, puis laisser refroidir un peu.","Dans un grand bol, fouettez les œufs entiers, les jaunes et les sucres avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''ils doublent de volume – cela prendra environ 5 minutes. Tamisez la farine, le cacao et la levure chimique avec une pincée de sel. Incorporez la purée de marrons au mélange chocolat-beurre, puis ajoutez-la dans l''autre bol et mélangez délicatement le tout. Répartir uniformément entre les moules.","En travaillant rapidement, nettoyez les fouets et votre grand bol, mettez les blancs d''œufs dans le bol et fouettez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes. Ajoutez le sucre, une cuillerée à la fois, en fouettant continuellement, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et capable de maintenir des pics fermes. Utilisez une cuillère pour parsemer la meringue sur le mélange à gâteau dans les deux moules, puis utilisez le dos de la cuillère pour étaler le mélange. Remplissez les espaces pour toucher les bords des moules – faites de jolis creux et pics tourbillonnants au fur et à mesure que vous étalez. Enfourner pendant 1h15 jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu du gâteau en ressorte moelleux.\r\nmais mettez des miettes. Refroidissez complètement.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à servir, préparez la garniture. Mettez la crème, la purée de marrons et le sucre glace dans un bol et fouettez doucement. Retirez les gâteaux de leurs moules et placez-en 1 sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette (conservez celui avec le plus joli dessus pour la couche finale). Versez une cuillerée de crème et faites tourner vers les bords (ne vous inquiétez pas si vous écrasez un peu la meringue). Placez la génoise suivante dessus, saupoudrez de sucre glace, puis recouvrez de copeaux de chocolat, si vous en utilisez. Meilleur servi immédiatement, mais se conserve au réfrigérateur\r\npendant 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9951,9068,'fr','Pouding aux poires et au chocolat','Ce pud au chocolat chaud et gluant, avec du chocolat noir et des poires en conserve, peut être préparé à l''avance et congelé – un dessert parfait et sans chichi pour un dîner.','["200 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 gros œufs","75 g de farine nature","50g de cacao en poudre","Boîte de 410 g de moitiés de poires dans leur jus, égouttées","100 g de chocolat noir nature (70 % de cacao)","25 g d''amandes effilées (facultatif)","crème ou glace, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5. Légèrement\r\ngraisser environ 20 x 30 cm peu profond\r\nplat allant au four. Mettez le beurre dans un grand\r\ncasserole et placez-la sur feu doux jusqu''à ce que\r\nfondu. Retirez le beurre du feu\r\net incorporer le sucre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Battez les œufs ensemble dans un grand bol. Ajoutez progressivement les œufs au beurre et\r\nsucre, en battant bien avec une cuillère en bois\r\nentre chaque ajout. Tamisez la farine et\r\npoudre de cacao sur le mélange d''œufs,\r\npuis battez fort avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que\r\nsoigneusement combinés.","Verser dans le moule ou le plat préparé et\r\nincorporer les poires dans la pâte au chocolat.\r\nMettez le chocolat sur une planche et coupez-le en\r\ngros morceaux d''environ 1,5 cm avec un grand\r\ncouteau. Répartissez les morceaux de chocolat sur le\r\nBattre et saupoudrer d''amandes, si vous le souhaitez.\r\nPeut être congelé à ce stade.","Cuire au centre du four pendant 30 mn\r\nou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit croustillant en surface\r\net légèrement cuit à l''intérieur. Ne laissez pas\r\ntrop cuire, car le gâteau deviendra spongieux\r\nplutôt que gluant au centre. Servir chaud\r\navec de la crème ou de la glace"]','2026-01-11 00:03:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9952,9069,'fr','Gâteau étoilé aux truffes et au chocolat','Assez glamour pour servir de dessert, cela constitue une superbe pièce maîtresse. Et le bonus est que vous pouvez tout préparer à l''avance et le geler jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.','["140 g de chocolat noir, 70 % de cacao, cassé en morceaux","140 g de beurre coupé en morceaux","2 cuillères à café de grains de café","50 g de farine autolevante","50g de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","140 g de sucre muscovado léger","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","1½ cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre","2 œufs moyens","3 cuillères à soupe de crème sure","100g de chocolat blanc","25g de chocolat noir","5-6 petites truffes au chocolat","100 ml de crème double","50 g de chocolat blanc haché très finement","1 cuillère à soupe d''eau bouillante","100 ml de crème double","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre doré","50 g de chocolat noir haché très finement","1½ cuillère à soupe d''eau bouillante"]','["Il est préférable de préparer le gâteau et les étoiles la veille (le gâteau est plus facile à trancher et à remplir, et les étoiles ont le temps de prendre). Chauffer le four à 160°C/chaleur tournante 140°C/gaz 3. Beurrer et fondre un moule à cake profond (22 x 11 x 6 cm). Mettez le chocolat et le beurre pour le gâteau dans une casserole. Mélangez le café avec 50 ml d''eau, puis versez dans la casserole. Réchauffer à feu doux, juste pour fondre – attention à ne pas surchauffer.","Pendant que le chocolat fond, mélangez les deux farines avec le bicarbonate de soude, les deux sucres et le cacao. Décomposez les grumeaux du sucre avec vos doigts. Battez les œufs, puis remuez \r\ndans la crème sure. Versez ceci et \r\nVersez le chocolat fondu sur le mélange de farine, puis mélangez le tout – le mélange sera très mou. Versez-le dans le moule, puis faites cuire au four pendant environ 1h30 ou jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit ferme. Laissez refroidir le gâteau dans le moule (il risque de se fissurer si vous le démoulez trop tôt), puis desserrez les côtés et démoulez-le délicatement sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pour faire les étoiles, tapissez une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Faites fondre les deux chocolats séparément. Versez et étalez le chocolat blanc en fine couche en rectangle sur le papier sulfurisé. Versez le chocolat noir au bout d''une cuillère à café en gros gribouillis sur le dessus. Laisser dans un endroit frais et sec (pas au réfrigérateur) jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque pris mais pas dur, puis appuyer légèrement avec un emporte-pièce en étoile, d''environ 5,5 cm de diamètre, pour faire au moins 6 contours d''étoiles. (Faites-en quelques-uns supplémentaires en cas de casse et essuyez l''emporte-pièce chaque fois que vous appuyez sur une forme d''étoile.) Une fois complètement pris, coupez les contours des étoiles avec un petit couteau bien aiguisé, puis soulevez-les délicatement sur du papier sulfurisé.","Pour le glaçage au chocolat blanc, faites chauffer la crème jusqu''à ébullition. Retirez du feu, versez le chocolat et remuez pour qu''il commence à fondre, puis versez l''eau bouillante et remuez pour faire fondre complètement. Verser dans un petit bol et mettre au réfrigérateur pendant environ 1 heure pour refroidir et épaissir légèrement. Battre avec un batteur électrique à main jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et brillant.","Lorsque le gâteau est complètement froid, placez-le au réfrigérateur pour qu''il refroidisse (cela facilitera le découpage). Sortez le gâteau du réfrigérateur et retournez-le pour que le fond plat devienne le dessus du gâteau. Coupez le gâteau horizontalement en trois. Remontez le sandwich avec le glaçage au chocolat blanc, pas tout à fait jusqu''aux bords. (Cela peut être fait la veille et réfrigéré.)","Pour le glaçage au chocolat noir, faites chauffer la crème avec le sucre jusqu''à ébullition. Retirer du feu, verser le chocolat, puis incorporer l''eau bouillante. Laisser refroidir et épaissir un peu. Mettez le gâteau sur une grille avec du papier sulfurisé en dessous (pour récupérer les gouttes). Versez et étalez le glaçage sur tout le gâteau. Laissez reposer légèrement, puis disposez les truffes au centre et posez dessus 5 ou 6 de vos plus belles étoiles."]','2026-01-11 00:03:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9953,7296,'fr','Soufflés au chocolat chaud avec sauce à la crème au chocolat','Légers comme une plume, ces soufflés chocolatés et fondants sauront plaire à coup sûr','["Pot de 142 ml de crème liquide","25g de sucre en poudre","100 g de chocolat noir (70 % de cacao), cassé en morceaux","25g de beurre","beurre fondu, pour graisser","50 g de sucre en poudre, plus 2 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires","175 g de chocolat noir (70 % de cacao), cassé en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche","4 jaunes d''œufs","5 blancs d''œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche","sucre glace, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7 et placer une plaque à pâtisserie sur la grille supérieure. Pour la sauce, faites chauffer la crème et le sucre jusqu''à ébullition. Retirer du feu, incorporer le chocolat et le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus, puis réserver au chaud.","Badigeonnez 6 ramequins de 150 ml de beurre fondu, saupoudrez de 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre, puis versez l''excédent. Faire fondre le chocolat et la crème dans un bol au dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante, laisser refroidir, puis incorporer les jaunes d''œufs. Battez les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils tiennent leur forme, puis ajoutez le sucre, 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois, en fouettant jusqu''à obtenir la même consistance. Mélangez une cuillerée\r\ndans le chocolat, puis incorporez délicatement le reste.","En travaillant rapidement, remplissez les ramequins, essuyez les bords et passez votre pouce sur les bords. Baissez le four à 200°C/ventilateur 180°/gaz 6, placez les ramequins sur la plaque à pâtisserie, puis faites cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils gonflent légèrement. N''ouvrez pas la porte du four trop tôt car cela pourrait les faire s''effondrer.","Une fois les soufflés prêts, saupoudrez de sucre glace, faites un petit trou sur leur dessus, puis versez un peu de sauce chocolat chaud. Remettez les couvercles et servez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:03:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9954,9070,'fr','La tarte au chocolat plus légère d''Angela','Une tarte au chocolat au goût riche et à la texture mousseuse – mais avec deux tiers de matière grasse en moins que la version classique','["140 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de beurre coupé en morceaux","2 cuillères à café de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 jaune d''oeuf moyen","crème fraîche demi-écrémée, pour servir (facultatif)","100 g de chocolat noir, 70% de cacao, haché très finement","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de cacao, plus ½ cuillère à café supplémentaire pour tamiser","¾ cuillère à café de grains de café","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de lait demi-écrémé","2 blancs d''œufs moyens","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre muscovado noir","85 g de crème fraîche demi-élevée"]','["Versez la farine dans un bol à mélanger et\r\nretirer 2 cuillères à café (le cacao remplacera\r\nplus tard). Ajouter le beurre et frotter\r\nfariner jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit fin\r\nchapelure. Tamisez le cacao et le glaçage\r\nsucre, puis à l''aide d''un couteau à lame ronde,\r\nincorporer l''huile, le jaune d''œuf et 1½ à 2 cuillères à soupe froides\r\neau, jusqu''à ce que la pâte se rassemble.\r\nRassemblez-vous doucement en boule, puis roulez-le\r\nune surface légèrement farinée, suffisamment grande pour\r\nadapter un fond ample rond de 20 cm x 3,5 cm de profondeur\r\nboîte à flan. Incorporer la pâte\r\nla boîte en laissant un léger surplomb. Légèrement\r\npiquer le fond avec une fourchette, puis mettre au frais\r\nenviron 10 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5. Asseyez-vous\r\nmoule sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Tapisser la pâte de\r\npapier d''aluminium et remplir de fèves au four. Cuisson à l''aveugle\r\npendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris. Retirez délicatement\r\nles haricots et le papier, puis faites cuire le\r\nfond de tarte pendant encore 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nla base est cuite. Retirez soigneusement\r\ncouper la pâte qui dépasse avec un\r\nun couteau bien aiguisé, pour donner un bord plat à la pâte,\r\npuis laissez refroidir complètement.","Pour faire la garniture, mettez le chocolat\r\ndans un grand bol qui s''adaptera sur une casserole de\r\nfaire frémir de l''eau sans y toucher. Mélanger\r\nle cacao, le café et la vanille avec le lait.\r\nVersez sur le chocolat. Asseyez le bol dessus\r\nune casserole d''eau frémissante, remuez, puis\r\nretirer immédiatement la casserole du feu,\r\navec le bol de chocolat toujours au-dessus\r\nl''eau, en remuant de temps en temps, pour vérifier quand\r\nfondu. Remuez le chocolat fondu – ce sera le cas\r\nêtre assez épais. Incorporer 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante\r\net le chocolat va immédiatement s''éclaircir\r\nvers le bas et devenir soyeux. Prenez le\r\nretirer le bol de la poêle et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Montez les blancs d''oeufs en neige ferme, puis\r\nincorporer le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et brillant.\r\nIncorporez la crème fraîche dans le\r\nchocolat. Pliez un tiers de l''œuf\r\nles blancs dans le mélange de chocolat en utilisant\r\nune grande cuillère en métal, puis pliez très délicatement\r\ndans les blancs restants, un tiers à la fois,\r\njusqu''à ce que le mélange soit homogène. Retirez la pâte\r\nsortir la boîte de la boîte et la déposer sur une portion\r\nassiette. Versez la garniture dans le moule, puis\r\nétaler doucement et uniformément. Détendez-vous pendant\r\nenviron 3 heures, ou toute la nuit, avant\r\nservir. Servir avec un tamis de cacao\r\net de la crème fraîche demi-grasse, si vous le souhaitez. Attention, femmes enceintes, le\r\nles personnes âgées, les bébés et les tout-petits, ainsi que les personnes\r\nqui sont généralement malades, devraient éviter\r\nmanger des œufs crus ou partiellement cuits."]','2026-01-11 00:03:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9955,9071,'fr','Éclairs maison','Les éclairs faits maison sont un travail d''amour, mais la récompense sera une bouchée décadente de pâtisserie croustillante suintante de crème anglaise à la vanille.','["140 g de farine nature","pincée de sucre","125 ml de lait","100g de beurre","4 œufs","300 ml de lait","50 g de sucre en poudre","2 jaunes d''œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 cuillères à café de farine nature et de maïzena","300 ml de crème fraîche"]','["Commencez par préparer la garniture à la crème anglaise.\r\nFaites chauffer le lait jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque bouillant dans un\r\ncasserole. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le\r\nsucre, jaunes d''œufs et vanille dans un bol,\r\npuis incorporez les farines, quelques cuillères à café à la fois.\r\ntemps, jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Fouetter progressivement\r\ndans le lait chaud, remettre le tout dans\r\nla casserole et faites cuire à feu vif,\r\nen remuant constamment, pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\népais – il deviendra grumeleux de manière alarmante mais\r\nne t''inquiète pas, continue de remuer\r\nvigoureusement avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce\r\nlisse. Poser directement une feuille de film alimentaire\r\nsur la surface de la crème anglaise, puis laisser refroidir et\r\nréfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous soyez prêt à remplir les petits pains.","Pour faire les choux, chauffer le four à\r\n220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7. Tamisez la farine avec\r\nle sucre et une pincée de sel dans un petit\r\nbol. Mettez le lait et le beurre dans un\r\ncasserole moyenne avec 125 ml d''eau et\r\nchauffer doucement pour que le beurre fonde mais que le\r\nle liquide ne bouillonne pas. Une fois le beurre\r\na complètement fondu, augmentez le feu\r\njusqu''à ce que le liquide atteigne une ébullition rapide.\r\nÉteignez immédiatement le feu, versez le\r\ntamiser la farine et battre vigoureusement avec un\r\ncuillère en bois jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse\r\npâte qui se détache des côtés de\r\nla poêle (voir photo 1). Réparti sur un grand\r\nassiette à dîner pour refroidir à la température des mains.","Une fois la pâte refroidie, grattez\r\nremettez-le dans votre poêle. Utiliser votre bois\r\ncuillère, incorporer chaque œuf, un par un, jusqu''à ce que\r\nvous obtenez un mélange lisse et brillant.","Coupez 2 grandes feuilles de papier sulfurisé.\r\nSur chacun, tracez 2 séries de lignes « piste »\r\navec un espace de 10 cm – ce seront vos\r\ndirectives pour que vos éclairs soient tous\r\nà peu près la même taille (voir photo 2). Utilisez le\r\npapier pour tapisser 2 grandes plaques à pâtisserie – penside\r\nvers le bas. Versez votre préparation à choux\r\ndans une poche à douille munie d''une douille de 1 cm de large,\r\nou dans une poche à douille jetable avec un\r\ntrou de taille similaire coupé pour la tuyauterie.\r\nPipez 2 rangées de feuilles bien espacées et écrasées.\r\nDes formes en « S » sur chaque feuille entre les\r\nlignes directrices (voir photo 3). Cuire au four, un plateau à la fois\r\ntemps, sur une étagère haute pendant 25 minutes,\r\nréduisant la température à 200C/180C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 6 dès leur passage au four.","Après 25 minutes, percez un trou au bout de\r\nchaque petit pain, ou à l''aide d''un petit couteau dentelé,\r\ndivisez-vous au milieu et revenez au\r\nfour, à l''envers, pour sécher pendant 5 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant que les petits pains refroidissent, terminez votre\r\nremplissage. Fouetter la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit épaisse, puis\r\nutilisez votre fouet électrique pour battre le\r\nrefroidi, mettre la crème anglaise jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste lisse\r\nencore une fois. Incorporer la crème. Cuillère votre\r\nremplir dans une poche à douille – utiliser une petite\r\nbuse si vous remplissez les petits pains\r\nles trous que vous avez percés, ou un grand\r\nbuse si vous avez divisé les petits pains en deux.\r\nVersez délicatement la crème anglaise dans chaque\r\npetit pain refroidi – ils devraient être lourds une fois\r\nplein. Disposez les petits pains sur une grille et\r\nétalez chacun avec un peu de votre choix\r\nglaçage (voir ci-dessous). Si tu ne peux pas\r\ndécider, c''est vraiment\r\nfacile à diviser votre\r\nlot de choux\r\npetits pains, coupés en deux\r\nquantités de glaçage,\r\net faire un\r\nsélection à conserver\r\ntout le monde est content."]','2026-01-11 00:03:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9956,8193,'fr','Danois de Pâques double chocolat','Tout le monde aime une pâtisserie danoise, surtout lorsqu''elle est chocolatée et assez grande pour être partagée','["175 ml de lait tiède","1 œuf battu","450 g de farine blanche forte","1 sachet de levure sèche à action rapide","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","250 g de bloc de beurre froid, tranché","200 g d''amandes effilées grillées","50g de sucre glace","25g de cacao en poudre","50 g de beurre ramolli","1 blanc d''oeuf","50 g de chocolat noir coupé en petits morceaux","1 jaune d''oeuf","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","sucre en poudre doré, pour saupoudrer","50g de sucre glace"]','["Préparez la pâte la veille si vous avez le temps. Battez le lait et l''œuf dans un pichet. Mettez la farine, la levure, le sucre et le beurre dans un robot culinaire avec une pincée de sel. Pulser jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à se rassembler, mais soit encore tacheté de morceaux de beurre. Versez dans un bol et utilisez vos mains pour travailler le contenu du pichet. Étalez la pâte sur une surface farinée, pétrissez légèrement, puis étalez-la en rectangle et repliez les deux côtés courts pour que les bords se rejoignent au milieu, puis repliez-la à nouveau au milieu. Étalez et pliez encore deux fois, en farinant la surface pendant que vous travaillez. Couvrez la pâte d''un film alimentaire, puis laissez-la reposer au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 4 heures ou toute la nuit.","Pour la garniture, versez 150 g d''amandes dans un robot culinaire avec le sucre glace et le cacao en poudre et mixez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Ajouter le beurre et le blanc d''œuf, réduire en pâte, puis incorporer le chocolat et réserver.","Divisez la pâte en deux et pressez-en une moitié dans le fond d''un moule à charnière antiadhésif de 23 cm. Étalez la garniture au milieu de la pâte en laissant un bord et recouvrez avec le reste de pâte. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser reposer environ une heure dans un endroit tiède.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Battre le jaune d''oeuf avec le lait et badigeonner le dessus pour glacer. Saupoudrer du reste des amandes et d''un peu de sucre en poudre et enfourner pendant 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient gonflées et dorées. Laisser refroidir une heure. Mélangez le sucre glace avec quelques gouttes d''eau froide pour obtenir un glaçage qui coule et versez-en un filet sur le gâteau. Servir en quartiers avec du café ou avec de la glace en dessert."]','2026-01-11 00:03:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9957,7316,'fr','White chocolate crème brûlée','Servez ce dessert au chocolat super crémeux seul ou dans le cadre d''un « assiete » de mini puddings au chocolat.','["Pot de 568 ml de crème double","100 g de chocolat blanc Green & Black''s cassé en morceaux","1 gousse de vanille fendue ou 1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","6 jaunes d''œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour la garniture"]','["Faites chauffer la crème, le chocolat et la gousse de vanille\r\ndans une casserole jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu. Prendre\r\nhors du feu et laissez infuser 10 mn,\r\ngratter les graines des gousses dans la crème. Si\r\nà l''aide de l''extrait de vanille, ajoutez aussitôt.\r\nChauffer le four à 160C/chaleur tournante 140C/gaz 3.","Battre les jaunes et le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles. incorporer le\r\ncrème au chocolat. Filtrer dans un pichet et verser\r\ndans des ramequins. Placer dans une plaque à rôtir profonde\r\net versez de l''eau bouillante à mi-hauteur des côtés.\r\nCuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste pris et bancal.\r\ncentre. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 4 heures.","Pour servir, saupoudrez un peu de sucre sur le dessus.\r\nbrûlées et caramélisées au chalumeau ou\r\nbrièvement sous un grill chaud. Laisser le caramel\r\ndurcir, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9958,9073,'fr','Tarte au brownie et au fudge','Ce dessert au chocolat gluant reçoit une touche épicée avec de la cannelle dans la pâtisserie. Il se congèle bien pour un dessert facile lors d''un dîner','["175 g de farine nature","85 g de beurre coupé en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","3 gros œufs","300 g de sucre brun clair muscovado","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","175 g de beurre fondu","50g de farine nature","50 g de cacao, plus un peu pour servir","50 g de noix de macadamia hachées","50 g de chocolat noir haché","glace à servir"]','["Versez la farine, le beurre, le sucre glace et la cannelle dans un robot culinaire et mélangez pour obtenir des miettes. Ajoutez 2 1,2 à 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le mélange se rassemble. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire et réfrigérer 20 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Abaisser la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné et tapisser un moule à tarte profond de 23 cm de diamètre. Laissez l''excédent de pâte dépasser des bords du moule. Tapisser de papier sulfurisé, remplir de fèves au four et réfrigérer pendant 15 minutes.","Enfournez 15 min, retirez le papier et les haricots, puis enfournez encore 5 min jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit croustillante et légèrement dorée.","Battez les œufs et le sucre ensemble pour créer une texture semblable à une mousse. Incorporer la vanille et le beurre fondu, puis incorporer la farine et le cacao. Répartissez les noix et le chocolat sur le fond de tarte et versez la garniture dessus. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme avec une légère oscillation. Coupez l''excédent de pâte et laissez refroidir. En cas de congélation, envelopper dans du film alimentaire et du papier d''aluminium. Pour décongeler, déballer et décongeler.","Servir à température ambiante ou tiède, avec une boule de glace et saupoudrer de cacao."]','2026-01-11 00:03:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9959,9074,'fr','Fondant au chocolat','Un dessert gluant à préparer à l''avance, parfait pour recevoir – tout est une question de timing…','["50 g de beurre fondu, pour badigeonner","poudre de cacao, pour saupoudrer","200 g de chocolat noir de bonne qualité coupé en petits morceaux","200 g de beurre en petits morceaux","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs et 4 jaunes","200 g de farine nature","Sauce caramel (voir ''Se marie bien avec'') et glace vanille ou sorbet orange, pour servir"]','["Préparez d’abord vos moules. En effectuant des mouvements vers le haut, brossez fortement le fond fondu.\r\nbeurrer tout l''intérieur du moule à pudding.\r\nPlacez le moule au réfrigérateur ou au congélateur. Badigeonner davantage de beurre fondu sur le\r\nbeurre, puis ajoutez une bonne cuillerée de cacao\r\npoudre dans le moule. Inclinez le moule pour que la poudre recouvre complètement\r\nle beurre. Remettez tout excès de cacao dans le pot,\r\npuis répéter avec 1 le moule suivant.","Placez un bol sur une casserole de\r\nl''eau à peine frémissante, puis faire fondre lentement le\r\nchocolat et beurre ensemble. Retirer le bol\r\ndu feu et remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse. Laisser à\r\nlaisser refroidir environ 10 minutes.","Dans un autre bol, fouettez les œufs\r\net les jaunes avec le sucre jusqu''à ce que\r\népais et pâle et les feuilles du fouet\r\nun sentier; utilisez un fouet électrique si vous le souhaitez. Tamiser\r\nla farine dans les œufs, puis battre ensemble.","Versez le chocolat fondu dans l''œuf\r\nmélange en tiers, en battant bien entre\r\nchaque ajout, jusqu''à ce que tout le chocolat\r\nest ajouté et le mélange est complètement\r\ncombiné à une pâte à gâteau en vrac.","Versez la pâte à fondant dans un pichet, puis\r\nrépartir uniformément entre les moules.\r\nLes fondants peuvent maintenant être congelés pendant\r\njusqu''à un mois et cuit surgelé. Refroidir\r\npendant au moins 20 minutes ou jusqu''à la veille. Pour cuire surgelé, continuez simplement comme indiqué, en ajoutant 5 minutes supplémentaires à la cuisson.\r\ntemps de cuisson.","Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.\r\nDisposez les fondants sur une plaque allant au four,\r\npuis laissez cuire 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles dessus ont formé une croûte et ils sont\r\ncommencent à s''éloigner des côtés de leur\r\nmoules. Retirer du four, puis laisser\r\nreposer 1 min avant de démouler.","Détachez les fondants en déplaçant le\r\ndessus très doucement pour qu''ils se détachent\r\ndes côtés, en les faisant sortir du\r\nmoules. Inclinez légèrement chaque fondant sur votre\r\nmain pour que tu saches qu''elle est partie, alors\r\nremettre dans le moule, prêt à servir.","En commençant au milieu de chaque assiette, pressez\r\nune spirale de sauce caramel – faites toutes les assiettes que vous\r\ndont vous avez besoin avant de passer à l''étape suivante.","Disposez un fondant au milieu de chaque assiette.\r\nÀ l''aide d''une grande cuillère trempée dans l''eau chaude, prélevez\r\nune quenelle de glace.","Placez délicatement la glace sur le\r\nfondant, puis servir immédiatement. Répétez avec\r\nle reste des fondants."]','2026-01-11 00:03:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9960,9075,'fr','Tartelette chocolat & noix de pécan','Tarte aux pacanes croisée avec une tarte au chocolat avec un soupçon de sirop d''érable – nous ne pouvons pas contester cela','["Paquet de 375 g de pâte brisée","un peu de farine, pour saupoudrer","185g de chocolat noir","50g de beurre salé","4 œufs, battus","200 ml de sirop d''érable","200 g de noix de pécan entières"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Rouler\r\nla pâte étalée sur un plan légèrement fariné\r\net utiliser pour tapisser un fond ample de 20 cm\r\nmoule à tarte. Remplissez la tarte de papier sulfurisé et\r\nfèves au lard, enfourner 25 minutes, puis\r\nretirez le papier sulfurisé et les haricots.\r\nContinuez la cuisson encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir.","Faire fondre le chocolat et le beurre ensemble\r\ndans un grand bol sur une poêle à frire\r\nl''eau. Battre les oeufs et le sirop d''érable\r\nensemble, puis incorporer au chocolat avec\r\nla plupart des noix. Verser dans le fond de tarte,\r\ngarnir avec le reste des noix et cuire au four pendant\r\n30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris. Refroidir et servir avec\r\nglace vanille ou double crème."]','2026-01-11 00:03:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9961,9076,'fr','Sablés double chocolat','Vous n’êtes qu’à cinq ingrédients d’un délice double chocolat fondant dans la bouche','["175 g de beurre ramolli","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","100 g de pépites de chocolat, lait ou noir"]','["Mélangez le beurre et le sucre avec\r\nune cuillère en bois. Incorporer la farine et\r\ncacao, suivi des pépites de chocolat\r\n– vous devrez probablement le mélanger\r\navec vos mains à ce stade. Réduisez de moitié le\r\npâte et rouler chaque morceau en bûche\r\nenviron 5 cm d''épaisseur. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire et\r\nréfrigérer 1h ou plusieurs jours. Peut être\r\ncongelé jusqu''à 1 mois.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nCouper les bûches en rondelles de 1 cm d''épaisseur, transférer\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de cuisson\r\npapier sulfurisé et cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes.\r\nRefroidir sur le plateau."]','2026-01-11 00:03:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9962,9077,'fr','Tourte au chocolat et Earl Grey','Il n''a jamais été aussi facile d''impressionner : cette tourte au centre moelleux peut être préparée à l''avance et congelée ou cuite à partir de zéro en seulement une heure.','["feuilles de 2 sachets de thé Earl Grey","100 ml de lait chaud","250g de bon chocolat noir (nous avons utilisé une barre à 78%)","200 g de beurre coupé en dés","140 g d''amandes moulues","6 œufs, séparés","200 g de sucre en poudre","cacao, sucre glace et crème fraîche ou crème, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nGraisser et tapisser la base et les côtés de\r\nune boîte à fond amovible de 22 cm de profondeur avec\r\npapier sulfurisé, donc le papier vient\r\nenviron 2,5 cm au dessus des côtés. Remuez le comte\r\nThé gris dans le lait chaud.","Faire fondre le chocolat, le beurre et une pincée\r\nde sel ensemble dans un bol sur une casserole de\r\neau à peine frémissante. Incorporez ensuite le\r\nla poudre d''amandes, suivie de l''œuf\r\njaunes et thé au lait, y compris les feuilles.\r\nBattre les blancs d''œufs en neige ferme, puis battre\r\ndans le sucre en poudre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit à nouveau ferme.\r\nIncorporer les blancs dans le chocolat\r\nmélanger et gratter dans le moule. Cuire au four pour\r\n30-35 minutes – il devrait encore y avoir un léger\r\nvaciller. Refroidissez ensuite complètement dans le moule.","Retirez délicatement du moule et soulevez\r\nsur une assiette de service. Saupoudrer partout avec\r\ncacao et sucre glace, puis servir dans\r\ntranches de crème fraîche ou de crème."]','2026-01-11 00:03:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9963,9078,'fr','Biscuits aux morceaux de chocolat et aux pacanes','Il n’y a rien de mieux que des cookies à l’américaine avec de gros morceaux de chocolat et de noix. Le biscuit parfait des grands','["200 g de chocolat noir cassé en carrés (on aime bien le Green & Black''s)","100 g de beurre haché","50 g de sucre muscovado léger","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 œuf battu","100 g de noix de pécan entières","100 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Faire fondre 85g de chocolat au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 1 min ou au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante.","Incorporer le beurre, les sucres, la vanille et l''œuf jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporer les trois quarts des noix et du reste du chocolat, puis la farine et le bicarbonate de soude.","Disposez 12 cuillerées espacées sur 2 plaques à pâtisserie (ne pas étaler le mélange), puis piquez les noix et le chocolat réservés. Cuire au four 12 minutes jusqu''à consistance ferme, puis laisser refroidir sur les plaques. Peut être conservé dans une boîte jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9964,9079,'fr','Pavlova au chocolat et cerise','Terminez votre repas avec cet impressionnant dessert, avec de la crème onctueuse et des fruits frais d''été.','["6 gros blancs d''œufs","300 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin blanc","25g de cacao en poudre","50 g de chocolat noir finement haché","Pot de 284 ml de crème double","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","½ pot de 600g de compote de cerises dénoyautées (j''ai utilisé Bonne Maman)","cerises fraîches, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 140°C/chaleur tournante 120°C/gaz 1.\r\nBattre les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils se forment\r\npics raides. Incorporer progressivement le sucre, un\r\nquelques cuillères à soupe à la fois, en vous assurant\r\nfouettez très bien entre chaque ajout.\r\nQuand tout le sucre a été ajouté, réservez\r\nen fouettant pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle mélange est vraiment épais et brillant et semble\r\nun peu comme de la mousse à raser. Incorporer délicatement\r\nla farine de maïs, le vinaigre, la poudre de cacao et\r\nchocolat avec une grande cuillère en métal, juste\r\njusqu''à incorporation.","Déchirez une feuille de papier sulfurisé\r\net utiliser pour couvrir une plaque à pâtisserie. Marquer un\r\nCercle de 25 cm sur le papier. Verser sur le\r\nmélange de meringue, tourbillonnant dans le cercle,\r\nen construisant un peu les côtés, prêt à garder\r\nla garniture. Cuire 1h30. Laisser refroidir.","Au moment de servir, fouettez le double\r\nla crème et le sucre glace ensemble dans un grand\r\nbol jusqu''à ce que des pics mous se forment. Verser le\r\ncompote de cerises sur la meringue, cuillerée\r\nsur la crème, puis tourbillonnez. Organiser\r\nquelques cerises fraîches sur le dessus pour finir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9965,9080,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat et aux cerises et au cola','Préparez ce plat qui plaira à tout le monde à base de cola, puis décorez-le avec des pépites arc-en-ciel, des cerises cocktail et des bonbons en bouteille de cola pour un régal nostalgique.','["200 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour la boîte","275 g de farine nature","100g de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","150 ml de yaourt nature","250 ml de cola cerise ou nature","3 œufs","50g de beurre","250 g de sucre glace","2-3 cuillères à soupe de lait","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire rose","pépites arc-en-ciel, cerises cocktail et bonbons en bouteille de cola (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler le fond et les côtés d''un moule à rôtir ou à gâteau de 34 x 25 cm (au moins 2½ cm de profondeur) et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la farine, le cacao, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate, le sucre et une bonne pincée de sel dans un grand bol. Cassez les morceaux de sucre en frottant entre vos doigts et en secouant le bol pour les faire remonter à la surface.","Fouettez l''huile, le yaourt, le cola et les œufs dans un pichet, puis versez les ingrédients humides dans le sec. Remuez bien en veillant à ce qu''il ne reste pas de poches de farine, puis versez dans le moule et enfournez pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Si du mélange humide adhère à la brochette, faites cuire encore 5 minutes. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant au moins 20 minutes.","Pour le glaçage, faites fondre le beurre dans une poêle à feu doux. Retirer du feu et incorporer le sucre, le lait et le colorant alimentaire. Étalez le glaçage sur le gâteau, puis décorez avec les pépites, les cerises et les bonbons, le cas échéant. Laisser prendre, puis couper en carrés. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9966,9081,'fr','Roulade au chocolat','Préparez notre roulade au chocolat de niveau supérieur, avec une meringue au chocolat spectaculaire enrobant une garniture au chocolat et à la crème et une sauce au caramel','["huile végétale, pour la boîte","5 blancs d''œufs","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","225 g de sucre en poudre","60 g de cacao en poudre, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","100 g de chocolat noir, plus un peu pour servir","100 ml de crème double","150 ml de crème fraîche","25g de sucre en poudre","100 g de sauce caramel (en boîte ou en pot), agitée jusqu''à consistance lisse","pincée de flocons de sel marin"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler le fond et les côtés d''une plaque à pâtisserie de 23 x 32 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battre ensemble les blancs d''œufs, le jus de citron et une pincée de sel à l''aide d''un batteur sur socle ou d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très fermes. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre et battez en pics fermes, puis ajoutez le reste du sucre, une cuillerée à la fois, jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et brillant. Tamisez le cacao et la maïzena, puis incorporez-les délicatement avec une spatule jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement mélangé. Répartir uniformément le mélange dans le moule préparé, puis cuire au four pendant 14 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste croustillant au toucher. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Pendant ce temps, préparez les garnitures. Pour la garniture au chocolat, versez le chocolat et la crème dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante et remuez jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu et que le mélange soit brillant et lisse. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir à température ambiante. Pour la garniture à la crème, fouettez la crème et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à obtenir des pics fermes à l''aide d''un fouet électrique.","Saupoudrez une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé de cacao en poudre, puis retournez délicatement la meringue dessus. Retirez le moule et décollez délicatement le papier sulfurisé. Avec une extrémité courte face à vous, tracez un trait sur la meringue, à 2 cm du bord. Répartir sur le fourrage au chocolat suivi de la crème, puis arroser de l''essentiel de la sauce caramel. Saupoudrez de flocons de sel marin et faites glisser une palette ou un couteau à couverts dans les garnitures pour les faire tourner doucement. Roulez la roulade en une bûche serrée, en commençant par l''extrémité rainurée et en utilisant le papier sulfurisé en dessous pour vous aider. Soulever sur un plateau ou une planche. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à une journée. Arroser du reste de la sauce caramel, puis râper finement sur du chocolat supplémentaire pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9967,9082,'fr','Gâteau au réfrigérateur Forêt-Noire','Préparez une version facile du « gâteau au réfrigérateur » du gâteau Forêt-Noire en superposant des cerises, de la crème chocolatée et des biscuits au chocolat. C''est un dessert plus gourmand pour terminer un repas','["huile végétale, pour la boîte","300g de chocolat noir","400 ml de crème fraîche","250 g de crème sure entière","80g de sucre glace","½ cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","Pot de 460 g de cerises au kirsch (disponibles en ligne ou au rayon pâtisserie des grandes surfaces)","700 g de biscuits au bourbon","50 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Huiler légèrement un moule à charnière de 20 x 25 cm, le tapisser de film alimentaire, puis huiler légèrement à nouveau. Annuler.","Mettez 200 g de chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et faites fondre au micro-ondes par rafales de 20 secondes, en remuant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Vous pouvez également faire fondre le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d’eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l’eau. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes. Fouetter ensemble la crème épaisse, la crème aigre, le sucre glace et la pâte de gousse de vanille jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre mais cuillère (elle doit être assez lâche à ce stade mais se raffermira plus tard au réfrigérateur). Transférez la moitié du mélange dans un deuxième bol, puis incorporez le chocolat fondu.","Versez la moitié des cerises et tout le kirsch dans une casserole. Hachez les cerises restantes et réservez. Tapisser le fond du moule préparé d''une couche de biscuits au bourbon, puis verser sur la moitié de la crème au chocolat, la moitié des cerises hachées et la moitié de la crème vanille. Répéter avec une deuxième couche de biscuits et le reste de la crème au chocolat, les cerises hachées et la crème vanille. Couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Versez le sucre semoule dans la casserole avec le reste des cerises entières et du kirsch. Cuire à feu doux pendant environ 5 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Augmentez le feu, portez à ébullition et poursuivez la cuisson à feu vif pendant 8 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait réduit jusqu''à obtenir une consistance sirupeuse qui recouvre le dos d''une cuillère. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Retirez délicatement le gâteau du moule et retirez le film alimentaire. Laisser à température ambiante pendant 30 minutes pour ramollir légèrement. Hachez grossièrement le chocolat noir restant. Versez les cerises refroidies et le sirop sur le gâteau et répartissez sur le chocolat. Couper en 12 carrés pour servir. Se conserve, couvert au réfrigérateur, jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9968,9083,'fr','Gâteau aux biscuits au chocolat et au caramel salé','Préparez ce gâteau au chocolat époustouflant garni de caramel salé décadent et de biscuits. Parfait pour célébrer une occasion spéciale','["150 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour les boîtes","200 g de farine autolevante","50g de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","250 g de cassonade","150 ml de yaourt grec","50 ml de lait","100 ml de café fort, froid","2 gros œufs","100 g de pépites de chocolat blanc","150 g de beurre salé ramolli","300g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre","50g de chocolat noir","200g de biscuits","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce caramel au beurre salé","½ cuillère à soupe de lait","chocolat noir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Huiler deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm et tapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Tamisez la farine, le cacao et la levure chimique dans un grand bol, puis incorporez le sucre. Fouetter ensemble le yaourt, le lait, le café et les œufs dans un pichet jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporez progressivement les ingrédients humides au mélange de farine jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Incorporez les pépites de chocolat.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre de chaque génoise en ressorte propre. Retirer des moules et mettre sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la crème au beurre. Battre ensemble le beurre, le sucre glace et le cacao pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse. Faites fondre le chocolat noir dans un bol au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau bouillante ou en 30 secondes au micro-ondes. Incorporer le chocolat fondu à la crème au beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement incorporé. Mettez-en les trois quarts dans une poche à douille munie d''une grosse douille ronde.","Placez l''une des génoises sur une assiette et déposez de la crème au beurre sur son bord, en faisant des points sur toute la circonférence. Étalez 2 cuillères à soupe du reste de crème au beurre au centre du gâteau à l''aide d''une cuillère ou d''un couteau à palette.","Mélangez le caramel et le lait avec une pincée de sel. Étalez la moitié du caramel au centre pour recouvrir la couche de crème au beurre. Émiettez la moitié des cookies par-dessus. Réfrigérer 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la crème au beurre ait légèrement durci.","Posez la deuxième éponge sur la première. Répétez le passepoil des points autour du dessus du gâteau, mais cette fois, remplissez tout le cercle de points de crème au beurre. Versez le caramel au beurre salé sur les points de crème au beurre. Cassez les biscuits restants en moitiés ou quarts et disposez-les sur le gâteau, puis râpez-les sur un peu de chocolat noir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9969,9084,'fr','Cupcakes au chocolat et à l''orange','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis ces cupcakes décadents avec une génoise au chocolat et à l''orange et une garniture à la crème au beurre. Décorer de zeste d''orange et de chocolat','["140 g de sucre roux clair","100 g de farines autolevantes","50g de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 gros œufs","135 ml d''huile végétale","4 cuillères à soupe de lait","50 g de chocolat noir finement haché, plus un peu pour la décoration","2 grosses oranges, zestées","300g de glaçage","150 g de beurre doux, ramolli","1 orange, zestée, plus un zeste supplémentaire pour décorer","25g de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","colorant alimentaire en gel orange"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettre le sucre, la farine, le cacao, la pincée de sel et la levure chimique dans un grand bol. Fouetter ensemble les œufs, l''huile végétale et le lait. Incorporez progressivement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs jusqu''à obtenir un mélange lisse. Incorporez le chocolat noir. Mettez 12 caissettes à cupcakes dans un moule à 12 trous. Répartissez le mélange dans les caissettes, puis enfournez 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. Battre le sucre glace et le beurre ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Incorporer 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude pour détacher et incorporer le zeste d''orange. Répartissez le glaçage uniformément dans deux bols. Ajoutez quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire orange dans un bol et remuez jusqu''à ce que le glaçage devienne orange vif. Dans l''autre bol, ajoutez la poudre de cacao et 2 cuillères à soupe de lait, puis battez jusqu''à homogénéité.","Remplissez un côté d''une poche à douille (utilisez-en une avec une grosse douille ronde) avec le glaçage à l''orange, puis remplissez l''autre côté avec la crème au beurre au chocolat. Garnir chaque cupcake. Décorez avec un peu de zeste d''orange supplémentaire et un râpé de chocolat noir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9970,9085,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat et au sésame','Le tahini donne à ce gâteau une subtile saveur de noisette qui se marie parfaitement avec un chocolat riche. Cette recette donne 2 gâteaux, alors pourquoi ne pas en congeler un pour le régaler un autre jour !','["200 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de chocolat noir haché","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 ml d''espresso fort","100 ml de crème sure","2 œufs","200 g de farine autolevante","5 cuillères à café de cacao en poudre","250 g de farine autolevante","150 g de tahin","1 cuillère à café bombée de levure chimique","150 ml de café noir fort","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","200 ml de crème fraîche","40g de beurre","200 g de chocolat noir haché","4 sachets de 30 g de snaps au sésame"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer deux moules à cake de 900 g (8,5 cm de profondeur) et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé.","Tout d’abord, préparez le mélange à gâteau au chocolat. Mettez le beurre et le chocolat dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en remuant de temps en temps. Mettez tous les autres ingrédients dans un grand bol et, lorsque le chocolat et le beurre sont fondus, versez dessus et mélangez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et homogène. Réserver et rincer les batteurs.","Dans un autre grand bol, ajouter tous les ingrédients du gâteau au sésame, puis mélanger avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse.","En alternant avec des cuillerées de chaque mélange, répartissez entre les deux moules. Nivelez le dessus, puis faites tourner une brochette dans le mélange pour créer un effet marbré. Cuire au milieu du four pendant 45 à 50 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laissez les gâteaux refroidir complètement sur une grille pendant que vous préparez la garniture (il y en a assez pour les deux gâteaux mais la recette de garniture est facilement réduite de moitié si vous souhaitez en congeler un et le glacer plus tard)","Faites chauffer doucement la crème double et le beurre dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ébullition, puis retirez du feu et ajoutez le chocolat. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse, puis placer au réfrigérateur pendant 20 minutes pour raffermir.","Bien battre avec une cuillère en bois, puis transférer dans une poche à douille jetable. Coupez l''extrémité pour faire une large ouverture, puis tracez des zigzags épais et superposés sur les gâteaux. Coupez les boutons de sésame en éclats et disposez-les dessus en les saupoudrant de miettes, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9971,6831,'fr','Gâteau sandwich au chocolat faible en sucre','Moelleux et moelleux, qui croirait que ce magnifique gâteau au chocolat ne contient que 2 g de sucre par tranche ? La garniture au chocolat crémeuse est également faible en sucre mais riche en délices','["150 ml d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour le graissage","250 g de betterave cuite","50g de cacao","140 g de farine complète nature","100 g de farine blanche nature","50g d''amandes moulues","200 g de xylitol, comme Total Sweet","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 gros œufs","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","50 ml de lait écrémé","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt bio naturel","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao","100 g de xylitol tel que Total Sweet","Pot de 150 ml de crème fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C/gaz 3 et graisser puis tapisser le fond de deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Pour commencer à préparer la crème au chocolat, mélangez le yaourt avec le cacao et le xylitol jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement mélangé, puis réservez pendant que vous préparez le gâteau. Cela aide à dissoudre les granules de xylitol.","Pour faire le gâteau, passez d’abord la betterave rouge au robot culinaire jusqu’à ce qu’elle ressemble à une purée épaisse. Ajoutez le cacao, les farines, la poudre d''amandes, le xylitol, la levure chimique et le soda et mélangez brièvement les ingrédients.","Ajoutez maintenant les œufs, les 150 ml d''huile de colza, l''extrait de vanille et le lait, et mixez à nouveau pour obtenir une pâte liquide lisse.","Répartissez le mélange uniformément dans les moules en travaillant rapidement, car la levure chimique s''active au contact des ingrédients liquides, puis enfournez pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent enfoncé au milieu du gâteau en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes puis démouler et terminer de refroidir sur une grille. Une fois froid, retirez soigneusement le papier de doublure.","Pour finir la crème au chocolat, fouettez la crème double jusqu''à ce qu''elle conserve sa forme. Incorporer le mélange de cacao, puis incorporer tout sauf 2 c. Étalez un tiers sur l''une des génoises froides, recouvrez avec le reste de la génoise et étalez avec le reste de la crème au chocolat pour créer une finition tourbillonnante. Parsemer du mélange de cacao réservé et plumer délicatement avec le bout d''une cuillère à café. Le gâteau se conservera au réfrigérateur pendant quelques jours, mais reviendra à température ambiante avant de manger pour un goût et une texture optimaux."]','2026-01-11 00:03:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9972,9086,'fr','Gâteau de fête biscuits et crème','Empilez nos meilleures génoises au chocolat et étouffez-les dans un glaçage aux biscuits Oreo pour réaliser cet imposant gâteau de fête.','["300 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour graisser","400 g de farine nature","130g de cacao en poudre","4 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","560 g de sucre mou roux clair","400 ml de babeurre","200 ml de café fort ou expresso","4 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","4 gros œufs","250 g de beurre légèrement salé ramolli","600 g de sucre glace","Pot de 280 g de fromage à la crème entier","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","10 biscuits Oreo (environ ¾ d''un paquet)","Biscuits Oreo, autant que nécessaire pour les lettres du dessus (certains peuvent se casser lorsque vous insérez les brochettes, alors achetez-en un supplément)","fines brochettes en bois","100 g de chocolat blanc finement haché","un glaçage fondant prêt à rouler, coloré (nous avons utilisé un mélange de colorant alimentaire bleu et vert), ou un stylo pour glaçage"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser deux moules à gâteau de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé – si vos moules à gâteau sont assez peu profonds, tapissez les côtés sur une profondeur d''au moins 5 cm. Mettez 200 g de farine, 8 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre, 2 cuillères à café de levure chimique, 1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude, 280 g de cassonade claire et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un bol et mélangez bien. S''il y a des grumeaux dans le sucre, pressez-les entre vos doigts pour les briser.","Mesurez 200 ml de babeurre, 100 ml de café, 150 ml d''huile et 2 cuillères à café de vanille dans un pichet. Ajouter 2 œufs et fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez uniformément le mélange à gâteau dans les deux moules et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille, retirer le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir.","Répétez les étapes 1 et 2 pour obtenir 4 génoises au total. Ces éponges peuvent être préparées jusqu''à trois jours à l''avance et resteront humides si elles sont enveloppées dans un film alimentaire, ou vous pouvez bien les emballer et les congeler jusqu''à deux mois.","Pour faire le glaçage, mettez le beurre dans un grand bol et tamisez-y la moitié du sucre glace. Écrasez grossièrement avec une spatule, puis fouettez avec un batteur à main jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez le fromage frais et tamisez avec le sucre glace restant, écrasez à nouveau, puis mixez à nouveau au batteur à main. Mettez les Oreos dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en miettes fines. Ajoutez les miettes de biscuit au glaçage et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à homogénéité.","Ensuite, préparez les décorations pour gâteaux aux biscuits. Vous aurez besoin d''un Oreo pour chaque lettre du mot que vous souhaitez écrire – le nom de quelqu''un ou, comme nous l''avons fait, « WOW ! » Insérez délicatement une brochette dans la garniture crémeuse au milieu de chaque Oreo – certains biscuits peuvent se casser, alors gardez-les pour plus tard. Faites fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes en remuant toutes les 20 secondes environ, ou dans un bol résistant à la chaleur suspendu au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante. Étalez un peu de chocolat sur la surface d''un côté de chaque biscuit. Étalez le glaçage fondant sur l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 50 pence, découpez vos lettres, puis collez-les sur les biscuits et laissez sécher. Vous pouvez également laisser sécher le chocolat, puis utiliser un stylo à glaçage pour écrire le nom ou le mot directement sur la surface.","Pour assembler le gâteau, collez une de vos génoises sur un support à gâteau ou une planche avec un peu de glaçage au fromage à la crème. Utilisez environ la moitié du glaçage pour empiler les gâteaux restants sur le dessus, en étalant une quantité généreuse entre chaque couche. Empilez le reste du glaçage sur le gâteau assemblé et utilisez un couteau à palette pour le faire passer sur les bords, couvrant ainsi toute la surface du gâteau. Rangez l''assiette avec un morceau de papier absorbant.","S''il vous reste des Oreos, cassez-les en morceaux et poussez-les autour de la base du gâteau. Insérez les décorations de gâteau aux biscuits séchés sur le dessus du gâteau et servez. Conservez les restes au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 2 jours, mais ramenez-les à température ambiante pendant environ une heure avant de les manger."]','2026-01-11 00:03:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9973,9087,'fr','Gâteau chéri défiant la gravité','Les gâteaux anti-gravité sont la tendance incontournable de cette année pour les anniversaires ou les fêtes – ce superbe gâteau Smartie ravira les enfants et les adultes','["150 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de farine nature","8 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","280 g de sucre mou roux clair","200 ml de babeurre","100 ml de café fort ou d''espresso","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","2 gros œufs","2½ sachets de 114 g de bâtonnets en chocolat au lait","8 tubes de Smarties, ou autres friandises","100 g de chocolat au lait coupé en petits morceaux, plus 50 g pour la décoration","200 g de beurre légèrement salé ramolli","400 g de sucre glace, divisé","4 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 paille courbée","2 brochettes en bois","1 sac en papier ou sachet de bonbons (voir astuce)","ruban adhésif"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser deux moules à gâteau de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé – si vos moules à gâteau sont assez peu profonds, tapissez les côtés sur une profondeur d''au moins 5 cm. Mettez la farine, le cacao en poudre, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude, le sucre et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un bol et mélangez bien. S''il y a des grumeaux dans le sucre, pressez-les entre vos doigts pour les briser.","Mesurez le babeurre, le café, l''huile et la vanille dans un pichet. Ajouter l''œuf et fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez uniformément le mélange à gâteau dans les deux moules et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille, retirer le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir. Ces éponges peuvent être préparées jusqu''à trois jours à l''avance et resteront humides si elles sont enveloppées dans un film alimentaire, ou vous pouvez bien les emballer et les congeler jusqu''à deux mois.","Pour réaliser le glaçage au fondant au chocolat, mettez le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, suspendu au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante. Remuer de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. (Vous pouvez également faire fondre au micro-ondes en remuant le chocolat toutes les 20 secondes pour qu''il ne brûle pas.) Retirez le bol du feu et laissez refroidir un peu. Pendant ce temps, mettez le beurre et le sucre glace dans un autre grand bol et écrasez-les avec une spatule pour mélanger (cela vous évitera de recouvrir le plan de travail de sucre glace), puis fouettez avec un batteur à main jusqu''à consistance lisse. Tamisez le cacao et versez le chocolat fondu et le lait, puis mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Utilisez environ la moitié du glaçage pour prendre les gâteaux ensemble sur un support à gâteau ou une planche. Utilisez un couteau à palette pour recouvrir tout le gâteau avec le glaçage restant – ne vous inquiétez pas d’être trop soigné. Utilisez les doigts en chocolat pour recouvrir les côtés des gâteaux – faites-le juste après le glaçage, car le glaçage prendra après un certain temps et les doigts en chocolat ne colleront pas.","Faites fondre les 50 g de chocolat restants au micro-ondes ou dans un petit bol suspendu au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante. Laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce que le chocolat ait une consistance tartinable. Vous pouvez accélérer le processus en le mettant au réfrigérateur – il suffit de le remuer toutes les 5 minutes environ pour empêcher le chocolat de prendre.","Enfoncez un cure-dent au centre du gâteau et glissez la paille sur le dessus – cela lui donnera plus de stabilité. Enfoncez 1 à 2 cm de paille dans le gâteau. Utilisez un couteau à couverts pour étaler une goutte de chocolat sur un Smartie et, en commençant par la base, collez les Smarties sur la paille. Vous devrez procéder par étapes pour permettre au chocolat de prendre un peu avant d''ajouter une autre couche de Smarties. Progressez sur la paille jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit complètement recouverte. Si le chocolat dans votre bol devient trop ferme, réchauffez-le simplement jusqu''à ce qu''il ait la bonne consistance. Arrêtez-vous lorsque vous atteignez le coude de la paille.","Collez le reste de la brochette dans le haut de la paille afin qu''elle ressorte en biais. Placez le sac en papier dessus – vous devrez peut-être utiliser un peu de ruban adhésif pour le maintenir en place. Si une partie de la paille est exposée, recouvrez-la avec plus de Smarties.","Versez les Smarties restants sur le gâteau pour inonder la surface. Se conserve bien dans une boîte hermétique pendant 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9974,9088,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat plus léger avec glaçage au chocolat','Vous ne devinerez jamais que cette génoise au goût riche et à la texture légère est plus faible en gras, en calories et en sucre grâce à la poudre d''amandes et au yaourt.','["25g de beurre","140 g de farine autolevante","25 g de cacao en poudre tamisé","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","50 g de sucre muscovado léger","75 g de sucre en poudre doré","25g d''amandes moulues","175g de yaourt nature","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 gros œufs, battus","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","25 g de chocolat noir (de préférence 70 % de cacao), haché finement","50g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre tamisé","25 g de beurre, température ambiante","1 cuillère à café de lait demi-écrémé","100 g de fromage frais léger sorti du réfrigérateur","100 g de fromage blanc","10 dragées (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser le fond de 2 moules à sandwich ronds de 18 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le beurre et laisser refroidir. Mélangez la farine dans un grand bol avec la poudre de cacao, la levure chimique, les sucres et la poudre d''amandes. Incorporer le yaourt et la vanille aux œufs battus. Versez-le dans le mélange sec avec le beurre fondu et l''huile. Remuer brièvement jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit juste mélangé, crémeux et lisse. N''en faites pas trop.","Répartissez le mélange uniformément entre les deux moules et nivelez les surfaces. Enfourner 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il lève et commence à se détacher des parois du moule. Retirer des moules, décoller le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir les gâteaux sur une grille.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. Faire fondre le chocolat dans un bol posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante. Retirez le bol de la poêle et laissez le chocolat refroidir. Tamisez le sucre glace et le cacao dans un autre bol. Ajouter le beurre et le lait et battre jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer le fromage à la crème et le fromage blanc, puis incorporer le chocolat fondu et refroidi.","Lorsque les gâteaux sont froids, utilisez la moitié du glaçage pour prendre les deux gâteaux ensemble. Étalez le reste du glaçage dessus en plis moelleux, puis décorez de dragées, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9975,9089,'fr','Gâteau expresso, chocolat et piment avec crème au café','La chaleur du café et du piment se marie à merveille avec le chocolat dans cet impressionnant dessert de dîner, terminé par une double crème.','["3 cuillères à soupe de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour le moule","250 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","250 g de beurre salé ramolli et haché, plus un peu pour graisser","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre d''espresso instantané","2 piments rouges, épépinés et finement hachés","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment (facultatif)","6 œufs moyens, séparés","4 cuillères à soupe de cassonade","175 g de sucre en poudre","½ cuillère à café de crème de tartre","4 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","cacao en poudre, pour servir","300 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre d''espresso instantané"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à charnière de 22 cm de beurre mou et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé. Secouez un peu de farine sur les bords beurrés.","Faire fondre le chocolat et le beurre ensemble dans une casserole d''eau frémissante ou au micro-ondes. Une fois fondu, fouettez ensemble jusqu''à consistance lisse et ajoutez la poudre d''espresso, les piments et la poudre de piment, le cas échéant. Fouetter les jaunes d''œufs avec la cassonade et le sucre en poudre, soit au batteur électrique, soit avec un fouet électrique à main, pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient épais et pâles. Dans un autre bol, à l''aide d''un fouet propre, battre les blancs d''œufs et la crème de tartre jusqu''à formation de pics mous et arrondis.","Versez le mélange chocolaté sur les jaunes battus et le sucre et mélangez délicatement jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Ajoutez les amandes et la farine et mélangez à nouveau. Verser les blancs d''œufs dans le mélange chocolaté et incorporer délicatement. Versez la pâte dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit pris mais avec un léger tremblement au centre. (Si le gâteau commence à dorer trop vite, recouvrez-le d''un morceau de papier sulfurisé.)","Laisser refroidir dans le moule – il coulera un peu en refroidissant. Passer un couteau à l''intérieur du moule à gâteau pour le détacher. Retirez le papier sulfurisé et placez-le sur un support à gâteau. Fouetter la crème et la poudre d''espresso jusqu''à formation de pics mous. Servir à part ou à la cuillère sur le gâteau saupoudré d''un peu de cacao en poudre."]','2026-01-11 00:03:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9976,9090,'fr','Gâteau étagé au chocolat et glaçage aux fruits de la passion','Jo Wheatley, grande gagnante du British Bake Off, partage sa recette de génoise infaillible dans ce gâteau en couches avec un glaçage au beurre piquant','["175 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 gros œufs battus","75 g de farine autolevante","200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","75g de cacao","200 ml de crème sure, à température ambiante","50 g de fromage frais entier, à température ambiante","250 g de beurre doux, ramolli","500 g de sucre glace","150 g de fromage frais entier","3 fruits de la passion bien mûrs"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Battez le beurre et le sucre en poudre ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles, légers et mousseux – c''est plus facile à l''aide d''une machine sur pied ou d''un batteur électrique à main. Ajoutez progressivement l''œuf, petit à petit, en battant bien entre chaque ajout.","Tamisez les deux farines, le bicarbonate de soude et le cacao dans un bol. Ajouter la moitié des ingrédients secs tamisés au mélange d''œufs et incorporer à l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal. Dans un autre bol, mélanger la crème sure et le fromage à la crème jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez la moitié à la pâte à gâteau et incorporez. Répétez ce processus avec le reste de la farine et de la crème sure et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser dans le moule à cake. Cuire au four sur la grille du milieu pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu du gâteau en ressorte propre. Laissez le gâteau refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes avant de le démouler sur une grille et de retirer le papier sulfurisé.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. À l''aide d''un batteur électrique, battre le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et légèrement fouetté. Ajoutez le sucre glace et fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis ajoutez le fromage à la crème et fouettez à nouveau. Tamisez le jus des fruits de la passion en réservant la pulpe et les graines. Ajoutez le jus au glaçage.","Pour assembler, divisez le gâteau en 3 couches égales et placez la couche inférieure sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette. Étalez un tiers du glaçage sur la couche inférieure, en tourbillonnant vers les bords. Répétez avec les 2 couches restantes de gâteau et de glaçage, en terminant par une couche de glaçage. Garnir de pulpe et de graines de fruit de la passion. Servir immédiatement. Se conserve 3 jours au frais – mais ramène à température ambiante avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9977,9091,'fr','Gâteau fondant au chocolat noir','Génoise fondante au chocolat noir, le gâteau de fête parfait, le gâteau pour le thé de l''après-midi ou le gâteau pour toute excuse','["200 g de sucre en poudre","200g de beurre ramolli","4 œufs, battus","200 g de farine autolevante - remplacez 2 cuillères à soupe de farine par 2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de cacao tamisée (nous avons utilisé du Green & Black''s)","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","200 ml de crème fraîche","50g de beurre","3 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","200 g de chocolat noir (utilisez 70 % de cacao si vous le pouvez), cassé en morceaux","garnir de chocolat râpé ou râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/chaleur tournante 170°/gaz 5. Beurrer deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Dans un grand bol, battre tous les ingrédients du gâteau ensemble jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et molle.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules, lissez la surface avec une spatule ou le dos d''une cuillère, puis enfournez environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et que le gâteau reprenne sa forme lorsqu''on le presse. Mettez sur une grille de refroidissement et laissez refroidir complètement.","Pour le glaçage au fudge, faites chauffer la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à bouillir. Retirez du feu et ajoutez le beurre, le miel et le chocolat (cassé en morceaux).","Laisser fondre 5 minutes, puis remuer brièvement pour combiner – ne pas trop mélanger sinon il perdra son éclat. Sandwichez les gâteaux avec un tiers du glaçage juste chaud et étalez le reste sur le dessus et les côtés. Garnir de chocolat râpé ou râpé, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9978,9092,'fr','Gâteau d''anniversaire au chocolat','Nous avons utilisé des bougies colorées plutôt que des bonbons artificiels pour égayer ce délicieux gâteau d''anniversaire.','["140 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 œufs","225 g de farine complète autolevante","50g de cacao en poudre","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","250 g de yaourt nature","300 g de sucre glace doré tamisé","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre, tamisé","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre fondu","3-4 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante","50 g chacun de chocolat blanc, nature et au lait, divisés en carrés"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4. Beurre \r\net tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake de 18 x 28 cm  \r\nou un plateau. Mettez le beurre et le sucre dans un bol ; \r\nbattre ensemble avec des batteurs électriques à main jusqu''à ce que \r\nléger et moelleux. ajoutez les œufs petit à petit, \r\nbien battre entre chaque ajout.","Tamisez la farine, le cacao et le bicarbonate  \r\nde soda dans le bol, puis versez-y n''importe quel  \r\nle son laissé dans le tamis. Versez le naturel \r\nyaourt. Mélangez le tout jusqu''à obtenir un mélange lisse \r\net verser dans le moule préparé. Cuire au four pour \r\n20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste fermes et rétrécissent  \r\nloin des côtés de la boîte. Refroidir dans le  \r\nmouler pendant 5 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille  \r\nrefroidir complètement.","Pour le glaçage, tamisez le sucre glace et \r\nle cacao dans un bol, puis versez le beurre \r\net 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau juste bouillie. Mélanger  \r\njusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et tartinable. si c''est \r\ntrop raide, ajoutez-en très soigneusement un peu plus \r\neau bouillante, goutte à goutte.","Étalez le glaçage sur le dessus du gâteau, \r\nà l''aide d''une spatule trempée dans l''eau chaude. Volonté \r\nconserver dans un contenant hermétique jusqu’à 1 semaine.","Faire fondre les chocolats dans trois \r\nbols au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 1 min  \r\nou dans une casserole d''eau frémissante. Cuillère  \r\nles chocolats fondus dans trois plastiques \r\npoches à douille jetables. Coupez les extrémités \r\net placez 12 formes simples sur le dessus du \r\ngâteau. Laisser prendre. Juste avant de servir,  \r\ncoupez le gâteau en 12 carrés et poussez  \r\ndans les bougies."]','2026-01-11 00:03:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9979,8235,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat noir et à l''orange','Un gâteau dense, sombre et diablement délicieux, qui sera parti avant que vous vous en rendiez compte','["1 orange de Séville","un peu de beurre fondu, pour graisser","100 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","3 œufs","280 g de sucre en poudre","240 ml d''huile de tournesol","25g de cacao en poudre","250 g de farine nature","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","écorces d''orange confites, pour décorer","200 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux","225 ml de crème fraîche"]','["Percez l''orange avec une pique à brochette (de part en part). Cuire dans l''eau bouillante pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Battre l''orange entière dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à consistance lisse; laisser refroidir.","Préchauffer le four à 180°C/gaz 4/chaleur tournante 160°C. Beurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake rond de 23 cm. Faites fondre le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante ou au micro-ondes pendant 2 minutes à puissance élevée, en remuant après 1 minute. Laissez refroidir.","Dans un grand bol, battre légèrement les œufs, le sucre et l''huile. Incorporez progressivement la purée d''orange, en éliminant les pépins, puis incorporez le chocolat fondu refroidi. Tamisez le cacao, la farine et la levure chimique. Mélangez bien et versez dans le moule. Cuire au centre du four pendant 55 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le gâteau reprenne sa forme lorsqu''il est légèrement pressé au milieu. (Vérifiez après 45 minutes et couvrez de papier d''aluminium s''il brunit trop.) Laisser refroidir 10 minutes dans le moule, puis démouler sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Réalisez la ganache au chocolat : mettez le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Portez la crème à ébullition et versez-la sur le chocolat. Laisser agir 2 minutes, puis remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse. Réserver jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment ferme pour s''étaler sur le gâteau – jusqu''à 1h30.","Transférer le gâteau dans une assiette de service. À l''aide d''un couteau à palette, faites tourner la ganache sur le dessus. Décorer de lanières d''écorces d''orange confites."]','2026-01-11 00:03:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9980,9094,'fr','Gâteau aux cerises enrobé de chocolat','Faites cuire votre gâteau aux cerises enrobé de chocolat et mangez-le','["150 g de chocolat au lait de bonne qualité","175 g de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","140g de beurre très mou légèrement salé","3 gros œufs","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 banane moyenne, écrasée","200 g de chocolat blanc","400g de cerises","150ml crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de kirsch (facultatif)"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante 160C/\r\nconventionnel180C/gaz 4. Beurre et ligne\r\nle fond de deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm.\r\nRâper grossièrement les deux tiers du\r\nchocolat et hachez le reste. Annuler.","Mettez la farine, la levure chimique et le sucre\r\ndans un grand bol à mélanger. Faire un puits\r\nau centre et ajoutez le beurre, les œufs et\r\ndu lait (le beurre doit être bien mou pour cela\r\ntravailler). Battre ensemble avec une main tenue\r\nfouet électrique pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nléger et moelleux (ou utilisez une cuillère en bois\r\net battez bien pendant 3 minutes). Pliez légèrement\r\ndans le chocolat râpé et haché et\r\npurée de banane.","Répartissez le mélange uniformément entre les\r\nboîtes de conserve. Nivelez doucement la surface avec le\r\nle dos d''une cuillère ou d''une spatule en métal. Cuire au four\r\ncôte à côte sur l''étagère du milieu pendant 25 à 30\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit élastique au toucher et\r\ncommence à rétrécir sur les côtés.","Sortir du four, laisser refroidir\r\nles moules pendant 5 minutes. Étendre sur un fil\r\ngrille, retirez le papier de doublure et laissez\r\nlaisser refroidir environ 1 heure avant de glacer.","Pour le glaçage et la garniture, cassez le chocolat blanc dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et faites fondre doucement.\r\nsur une poêle chaude, pas tout à fait frémissante\r\nl''eau jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste fondue. Supprimer du\r\npoêle et laisser reposer 5 à 6 minutes.","Couvrir une plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium ou cirée\r\npapier. Trempez les cerises, une à une,\r\ndans le chocolat pour les enrober à moitié, puis\r\nmettez-les sur la plaque à pâtisserie pour qu''ils prennent.","Incorporer la crème fraîche au\r\nreste du chocolat fondu jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse et brillant. Puis laisse refroidir\r\net épaissir (environ 5 minutes). Maintenant\r\ntransférer la moitié de ce mélange dans un autre\r\nbol. Dénoyautez encore 200 g/8 oz\r\ncerises, coupez-les en deux puis ajoutez-les à une\r\ndes bols avec 2 cuillères à soupe de kirsch (facultatif)\r\net remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit mélangé. Mettez une génoise\r\nsur une assiette de service et étaler la surface\r\navec le mélange de cerises, puis sandwich\r\navec la deuxième éponge. Répartissez le reste\r\ndu mélange de chocolat sur le dessus et\r\ndécorer avec les cerises entières trempées.\r\nCe gâteau est meilleur mangé le jour où il est\r\nété faite."]','2026-01-11 00:03:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9981,9095,'fr','Pain au chocolat blanc et aux cerises','Ce gâteau gourmand est parfait pour le thé dans le jardin','["225 g de beurre ramolli","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs, battus","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","225 g de farine autolevante, tamisée, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","375 g de cerises fraîches dénoyautées","175 g de chocolat blanc coupé en petits morceaux","100 g de chocolat blanc cassé en petits morceaux","140 g de mascarpone demi-gras","copeaux de chocolat blanc ou cerises fraîches, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à cake de 1 kg de papier sulfurisé en veillant à ce que le papier dépasse plus haut que les côtés. Battez le beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à consistance mousseuse, puis ajoutez les œufs petit à petit ainsi que la vanille. Incorporez la farine jusqu''à obtenir un mélange lisse.","Saupoudrez les cerises d''un peu de farine, puis incorporez délicatement la moitié des fruits et du chocolat au mélange. Verser dans le moule préparé, puis répartir le reste des cerises et du chocolat dessus en les pressant légèrement. Cuire au four pendant 1 h 10 à 1 h 15 jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Assurez-vous de ne pas confondre le chocolat fondu avec le mélange à gâteau cru. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes dans le moule, puis démouler sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Celui-ci peut maintenant être enveloppé hermétiquement dans un film alimentaire et conservé au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 3 jours.","Sortez le marscapone du réfrigérateur pour qu''il revienne à température ambiante. Faire fondre le chocolat blanc dans un bol au dessus d''une casserole d''eau chaude. Incorporez rapidement 1 cuillère à soupe de marscapone, puis incorporez le reste (veillez à ne pas trop battre le mélange sinon il deviendra granuleux). Répartir sur le dessus du pain et terminer par des copeaux de chocolat blanc ou des cerises fraîches."]','2026-01-11 00:03:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9982,9096,'fr','Tourte au chocolat et au gingembre','Ce dessert décadent avec une touche triple de gingembre est le rêve de tout accro au chocolat.','["250 g de beurre doux coupé en dés, plus un peu pour le moule","cacao, pour saupoudrer","350 g de chocolat noir haché","2 cuillères à soupe de vin de gingembre Stone''s","140 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","5 œufs, séparés","75g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de confiture de gingembre","140 g de chocolat noir finement haché","150 ml de crème fraîche","25g de beurre doux","2 cuillères à soupe de vin de gingembre Stone''s"]','["Chauffer le four à 170C/150C ventilateur/gaz 3-4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à charnière rond de 23 cm\r\nmoule avec un disque de pâtisserie beurré\r\nparchemin. Époussetez légèrement l''intérieur\r\nde la boîte avec le cacao et versez l''excédent.","Mettez le chocolat et le beurre dans un\r\nbol résistant à la chaleur de taille moyenne, ajoutez le\r\nvin de gingembre et placez le bol sur une poêle\r\nd''eau à peine frémissante. Remuer de temps en temps\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu et lisse. Supprimer de\r\nle feu et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Versez les deux sucres dans un grand mélange\r\nbol ou le bol d''un batteur électrique et\r\najoutez les jaunes d''œufs. Fouetter jusqu''à ce que pâle et\r\nlumière. Versez le chocolat fondu et\r\nbeurre dans les jaunes et remuer jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse. Avec un autre grand, impeccablement\r\nnettoyer le bol et fouetter, battre l''œuf\r\nles blancs avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce qu''ils\r\ntenez juste un pic raide.","Tamisez les amandes et le gingembre dans le\r\nmélange de chocolat et incorporer à l''aide\r\nune grande cuillère en métal. Ajoutez un tiers de\r\nles blancs d''œufs et incorporez-les pour les décoller\r\nle mélange. Incorporer le reste\r\nles blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient combinés.","Verser la moitié du mélange dans le\r\nmoule préparé et étalez délicatement le niveau\r\nà l''aide d''un couteau à palette. Réchauffez doucement le\r\nconfiture de gingembre jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste tartinable\r\net versez délicatement sur le gâteau\r\npetites cuillerées. Verser sur le reste\r\nmélange de chocolat, niveau de pâte à tartiner et\r\ncuire juste en dessous de la grille du milieu de\r\nau four pendant 50 minutes-1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''un bois\r\nbrochette insérée au milieu de\r\nle gâteau ressort avec une mie moelleuse\r\nci-joint. Laissez le gâteau refroidir dans le\r\nétain et ne soyez pas consterné si le dessus\r\néviers et fissures.","Pour réaliser la ganache, inclinez le\r\nchocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Puis\r\najoutez la crème, le beurre et le vin de gingembre.\r\nPlacez le bol sur une casserole d''à peine\r\neau frémissante et remuer jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fondue\r\net velouté. Supprimer de\r\nle feu et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Passez soigneusement un couteau à palette autour du\r\nbord du gâteau pour le détacher, puis mettre\r\nune assiette de service. Étalez la ganache dessus\r\nle dessus et laisser reposer avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9983,9097,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat blanc et noir','Pour les grandes fêtes, ce gâteau est un incontournable, quatre couches de génoise moelleuse, des morceaux de ganache au chocolat et le croquant des Maltesers.','["175 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","100g de chocolat blanc (on aime les M&S ou les Green & Black''s avec de la vraie vanille)","100g de chocolat noir (70% de cacao)","3 œufs","100 ml de lait entier ou demi-écrémé","175 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","200 g de farine autolevante","2 cuillères à soupe de café très fort (instantané, c''est bien)","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","Pot de 284 ml de crème double","200g de chocolat noir (70% de cacao)","50 g de chocolat blanc fondu","petit sachet de Maltesers au chocolat blanc (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer et fondre 2 moules à sandwich de 20 cm. Pour le gâteau, cassez le chocolat blanc et le chocolat noir dans deux petits bols, puis faites fondre au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 1 min ou au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante. Mettez tout le reste, sauf le café et la vanille, dans un grand bol, puis battez jusqu''à consistance crémeuse.","Divisez le mélange en deux, puis ajoutez dans un bol le café et le chocolat noir fondu, ainsi que la vanille et le blanc fondu.\r\nchocolat à l''autre. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis verser dans les moules. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et légèrement rétréci sur les côtés des moules. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes dans les moules, puis démouler sur une grille.","Pour la ganache, faites chauffer la crème dans une poêle, puis cassez le chocolat noir dans un grand bol. Une fois la crème bouillante, versez-la sur le chocolat, puis laissez reposer 5 min. Remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis laisser épaissir et refroidir. Divisez les gâteaux en deux au milieu (un couteau à pain fonctionne bien), superposez les morceaux, en alternant les couches blanches et foncées, et mettez-les en sandwich, puis garnissez-les de ganache.","Pour décorer, versez le chocolat blanc fondu dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille fine (ou utilisez un sac à sandwich et coupez plutôt l''extrémité). Zigzaguez le chocolat blanc sur le gâteau, puis terminez par un parsemé de Maltesers blancs. Servir seul ou en dessert avec de la crème liquide. Mieux consommé le jour même, mais se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9984,9098,'fr','Gâteau au fondant au chocolat et glaçage aux anges','Le summum de la gourmandise, ce gâteau au fondant au chocolat ressemble à une étoile avec un glaçage à l''américaine et cuit dans un seul moule.','["250 g de chocolat noir, cassé en morceaux – le chocolat standard du supermarché convient","300 g de farine autolevante","300 g de cassonade légère et molle, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","50g de cacao","200 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour graisser","284 ml de crème sure","3 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''essence de vanille","500 g de sucre blanc en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à soupe de glucose liquide","2 blancs d''œufs","25 g de sucre glace tamisé"]','["Chauffer le four à 160C/chaleur tournante 140C/gaz 4\r\net graisser et tapisser un rond profond de 20 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau. Whizz le chocolat dans un aliment\r\nrobot jusqu''à ce que les miettes. Versez la farine,\r\nsucre, cacao, huile, 150 ml de crème sure,\r\nœufs, vanille et 150 ml d''eau dans le\r\nle plus grand bol à mélanger que vous ayez. Fouet\r\navec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis\r\nincorporez rapidement 150 g de votre préparation\r\nmorceaux de chocolat. Versez dans un moule et enfournez\r\nsur la grille du milieu pendant 1h20-1h30\r\nminutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette insérée dans le\r\nle centre ressort propre. Refroidir dans le moule.","Pendant que le gâteau cuit, préparez le\r\nglaçage. Mélanger les morceaux de chocolat restants\r\net crème sure avec 2 cuillères à soupe de brun tendre\r\nsucre dans une petite casserole et faire chauffer,\r\nen remuant, jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu et\r\nvous avez un glaçage onctueux. Laisser refroidir.","Une fois le gâteau refroidi, coupez-le en\r\n3 couches égales. Étalez 2 couches avec\r\nglaçage au chocolat.","Pour faire le glaçage des anges, mettez le\r\nsucre, vanille et glucose liquide dans une casserole\r\navec 125 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition et\r\ncuire jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit fondu et\r\nle sirop devient clair. Retirez du feu.\r\nPendant ce temps, battez les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce que\r\nraide, puis continuez à battre, progressivement\r\nverser le sirop de sucre chaud de façon régulière\r\ncouler, jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit mousseux et\r\nassez épais pour s''étaler – cela peut prendre\r\nquelques minutes pendant que le mélange refroidit. Battre\r\nle sucre glace. Travaillez rapidement et diffusez\r\nun tout petit peu sur chaque enrobé de chocolat\r\ncouche. Assembler le gâteau et mélanger le reste\r\nglaçage sur tout le gâteau."]','2026-01-11 00:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9985,9099,'fr','Gâteau ombré au chocolat et au caramel','Pour le plaisir ultime, ne cherchez pas plus loin que l''extravagance chocolat-caramel à quatre étages de Sarah Cook.','["225 g de beurre très mou, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","175 g de farine autolevante","85g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 œufs","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","5 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","225 g de beurre très mou, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre muscovado léger","50 g de sucre muscovado noir","175 g de farine autolevante","85g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 œufs","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao","Boîte de 397g de caramel (stocké à proximité du lait concentré en magasin)","140g de chocolat noir","140 g de chocolat au lait","300 ml de crème fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBases de graisse et de cordage de 2 x 20 cm\r\nmoules à sandwich avec du papier sulfurisé.\r\nPour les génoises vanille & chocolat, mélanger\r\ntous les ingrédients, sauf le cacao,\r\navec un fouet électrique. Gratter\r\nla moitié du mélange dans un deuxième bol et\r\nIncorporer le cacao. Grattez dans les moules\r\net cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette\r\nenfoncé, il ressort propre.","Répétez l''étape 1 pour le Caramel &\r\ngénoises caramel-choc, repartant\r\ncacao issu du premier mélange, puis\r\ndiviser le mélange en deux et fouetter le\r\ncacao en un seul lot. Cuire comme ci-dessus.","Pendant que les éponges refroidissent, faites fondre le\r\nchocolat noir et lait ensemble dans un\r\nbol sur une casserole à peine frémissante\r\nl''eau. Retirer du feu, incorporer le\r\ncrème et laisser refroidir ou réfrigérer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tartinable.","Lorsque les éponges sont froides, étalez\r\nun tiers du caramel sur la vanille\r\ngénoise et recouvrir de génoise Caramel.\r\nRépartir sur un autre tiers du caramel\r\net garnir de génoise Caramel-choc,\r\npuis le dernier tiers de caramel et dessus\r\navec le biscuit Chocolat (pas de panique\r\nsi vous mélangez les couches, le gâteau restera toujours\r\nfière allure lorsque vous coupez). Répandre le\r\nglaçage au chocolat sur tout le gâteau pour\r\nservir. Il se conservera au frais dans un\r\ncontenant hermétique jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9986,9100,'fr','Pain au chocolat dense et noir','Ce gâteau est mélangé et préparé dans une casserole – comme c''est simple ! Il est préférable de le manger le jour même ou dans les deux heures.','["200 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","100 g de chocolat noir (utilisez-en un à 70 % de cacao), cassé en morceaux","Pot de 150 g de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs","250 g de farine autolevante","175 g de sucre muscovado noir","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","100 ml de crème double","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","100 g de chocolat noir haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/chaleur tournante 170C/gaz 5 et\r\nassurez-vous qu''il y a une étagère prête au milieu\r\ndu four. Beurrer un grand moule à cake (environ 20 cm\r\nlong, mesuré à partir du bord supérieur), puis coupez\r\nune bande de papier sulfurisé plus longue de quelques centimètres\r\nque la longueur totale de la base et des deux\r\ncôtés les plus courts. Pressez-le dans le moule. (Quand votre\r\nle gâteau est prêt, vous pouvez utiliser les « ailes » en papier\r\nà chaque extrémité pour aider à le soulever.)","Mettez le beurre et le chocolat dans un grand\r\ncasserole et chauffer très doucement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes, puis\r\nutilisez un fouet pour mélanger le yaourt et la vanille,\r\npuis les œufs et une pincée de sel.","Mélanger la farine, le sucre et le bicarbonate de soude\r\ndans un grand bol, en écrasant les gros morceaux de\r\nsucre avec les doigts, puis incorporez-le au\r\nmélanger le chocolat dans la casserole jusqu''à consistance homogène. Verser\r\nou verser dans le moule, puis enfourner pendant 45 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et brillant (et probablement avec une belle\r\nfissure sur la longueur). Testez s''il est prêt d''ici\r\nenfoncer une brochette au milieu du gâteau\r\n(voir conseil ci-dessous). Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes, puis\r\ndémouler et laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Mettez la crème dans une petite casserole, apportez\r\nà ébullition, puis ajoutez le beurre et la moitié du\r\nchocolat haché. Retirez du feu et\r\nlaisser fondre. Remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse et brillante,\r\npuis versez sur le gâteau. Dispersez-vous avec le\r\nreste du chocolat haché et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9987,9101,'fr','Biscuit au chocolat blanc et orange','Un superbe gâteau qui deviendra rapidement une option infaillible pour tout événement.','["175 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","le zeste finement râpé de 4 oranges et le jus d''1","4 œufs, séparés","100 g de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g d''amandes moulues","200 g de chocolat blanc","200ml crème fraîche","100 g de chocolat blanc, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4. Beurre\r\ndeux moules à sandwich ronds de 20 cm et tapissez-les\r\nbases avec du papier sulfurisé. Versez le sucre\r\ndans un bol à mélanger et ajouter le ramolli\r\nbeurre et zeste d''orange. Battre 1 min ou\r\njusqu''à ce que ce soit pâle et mousseux, puis incorporer l''œuf\r\nles jaunes. Tamisez la farine et la levure chimique dessus\r\nle mélange à gâteau et incorporer légèrement. Enfin,\r\nincorporer les amandes et le jus d''orange. Fouet\r\nles blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils tiennent juste leur\r\nforme. Incorporez un tiers du blanc d''œuf dans\r\nle mélange à gâteau, à l''aide du fouet. Répétez avec\r\nun autre tiers, puis le dernier tiers. Prends soin de toi\r\nne pas trop mélanger sinon vous perdrez la légèreté\r\ndes blancs d''œufs.","Répartissez le mélange à gâteau entre les préparations\r\nmoules et cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes. Refroidir dans la boîte\r\npendant 5 minutes, puis démoulez sur une grille,\r\ndécollez le papier de doublure et laissez refroidir.","Pour faire le glaçage, faites fondre le chocolat dessus\r\nune casserole d''eau à peine frémissante ou dans le\r\nmicro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 1½ minutes, en remuant\r\ntoutes les 30 secondes, puis laisser refroidir. Fouetter le\r\ncrème fraîche jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit épaisse, puis incorporez-la\r\nchocolat blanc. Placer un gâteau sur une portion\r\nassiette ou support à gâteau. Versez la moitié du glaçage dessus\r\nle gâteau et garnir de l''autre gâteau. Propagation\r\navec le reste du glaçage, puis laissez prendre\r\nau réfrigérateur pendant au moins 1 h.","Si vous souhaitez réaliser des boucles décoratives,\r\nfaire fondre le chocolat dans un bol à feu doux\r\nde l''eau ou au micro-ondes et étaler finement\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie. Laissez le plateau au réfrigérateur\r\npour que le chocolat durcisse un peu, puis utilisez\r\nune tranche de poisson ou une lame de couteau coudée pour gratter\r\nboucles de chocolat. Empilez les boucles au milieu\r\ndu gâteau et servir coupé en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9988,9102,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat ultime','Faites-vous plaisir avec cette recette ultime de gâteau au chocolat, magnifiquement moelleux, riche et fondant. Parfait pour une fête ou un thé l''après-midi','["200 g de chocolat noir de bonne qualité, environ 60 % de cacao","200g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de grains de café instantané","85 g de farine autolevante","85 g de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","200 g de sucre muscovado léger","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","25g de cacao en poudre","3 œufs moyens","75 ml de babeurre (5 cuillères à soupe)","chocolat râpé ou boucles, pour décorer","200 g de chocolat noir de bonne qualité, comme ci-dessus","Carton de 284 ml de crème double (type verseur)","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Beurrer un moule à cake rond de 20 cm (7,5 cm\r\nprofonde) et tapissez la base. Préchauffer le\r\nfour à chaleur tournante 140C/conventionnel 160C/\r\ngaz 3. Cassez 200 g de chocolat noir de bonne qualité en morceaux\r\nune poêle moyenne à fond épais. Coupez 200 g de beurre en morceaux et versez-le avec le chocolat, puis mélangez 1 cuillère à soupe de grains de café instantané dans 125 ml d''eau froide et versez dans le\r\ncasserole. Réchauffer à feu doux juste\r\njusqu''à ce que tout soit fondu – ne surchauffez pas.\r\nOu faire fondre au micro-ondes à puissance moyenne pendant\r\nenviron 5 minutes, en remuant à mi-cuisson.","Pendant que le chocolat fond, mélangez 85g de farine autolevante, 85g de farine nature, ¼ de bicarbonate de soude,\r\n200 g de sucre muscovado léger, 200 g de sucre en poudre doré et 25 g de cacao en poudre dans un grand bol,\r\nmélanger avec les mains pour éliminer\r\ndes grumeaux. Battre 3 œufs moyens dans un bol\r\net incorporer 75 ml (5 cuillères à soupe) de babeurre.","Maintenant, versez le chocolat fondu\r\nmélange et le mélange d''œufs dans la farine\r\nmélange, en remuant jusqu''à ce que tout soit\r\nbien mélangé et vous obtenez un onctueux,\r\nconsistance assez coulante. Versez ceci dans\r\ndémouler et enfourner pendant 1 heure 25-\r\n1 heure 30 minutes – si vous poussez un\r\nbrochette au centre, cela devrait\r\nressortez propre et le dessus\r\ndevrait être ferme (ne vous inquiétez pas s''il craque\r\npeu). Laisser refroidir dans le moule (ne vous inquiétez pas si\r\nil plonge légèrement), puis se démoule sur un fil\r\ngrille pour refroidir complètement.","Quand le gâteau est froid, coupez-le horizontalement\r\nen trois. Réaliser la ganache : hacher 200 g de noir de bonne qualité\r\nchocolat en petits morceaux et versez-le dans un\r\nbol. Versez un carton de 284 ml de crème double dans une casserole, ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré et faites chauffer jusqu''à ébullition.\r\nRetirez du feu et versez-le sur le\r\nchocolat. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit\r\nfondu et le mélange est lisse.","Sandwich les couches ensemble avec juste\r\nun peu de ganache. Versez le reste dessus\r\nle gâteau en le laissant tomber sur les côtés et\r\nlissage à recouvrir avec un couteau à palette.\r\nDécorez avec du chocolat râpé ou un tas de \r\nboucles de chocolat. Le gâteau reste moelleux et \r\ngluant pendant 3-4 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9989,9103,'fr','Gâteau aux courgettes et au chocolat','La courgette râpée donne à ce gâteau une belle texture moelleuse – une excellente façon d''utiliser les surplus de votre jardin.','["350 g de farines autolevantes","50g de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","175 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","375 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","500 ml de courgettes râpées (mesurer en volume dans un verre doseur, mais il s''agit d''environ 2 courgettes moyennes ; si vous en utilisez 1 trop grosse, épluchez-la d''abord et retirez les graines)","140 g de noisettes grillées, hachées grossièrement","200 g de chocolat noir haché","100 ml de crème double"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.\r\nDans un grand bol, mélanger la farine, le cacao\r\npoudre, mélange d''épices et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Dans\r\nun autre bol, mélanger l''huile d''olive,\r\nsucre, œufs, essence de vanille et râpé\r\ncourgette. Mélanger le mélange sec et humide\r\njusqu''à ce que tout soit bien combiné, puis incorporez le\r\nnoisettes grillées. Tapisser un gâteau de 24 cm\r\nmouler avec du papier sulfurisé, puis verser\r\nvotre mélange. Cuire au four environ 40 à 50 minutes,\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''un couteau soit inséré au milieu\r\nen ressort propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant\r\n10 minutes, puis démoulez sur un fil\r\ngriller et laisser refroidir.","Pour faire le glaçage, placez le chocolat\r\ndans un bol et porter à ébullition la crème\r\nune casserole. Versez la crème chaude dessus\r\nle chocolat et remuer jusqu''à ce que complètement\r\nlisse et fondu. Laissez le glaçage\r\nrefroidir légèrement et épaissir, puis étaler\r\nsur le gâteau pour qu''il soit couvert et\r\nle glaçage commence à couler sur les côtés.\r\nServir avec une tasse de thé ou déguster comme un pud\r\navec une cuillerée de quelque chose de crémeux."]','2026-01-11 00:03:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9990,9104,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat vraiment riche','Sombre, riche et délicieux – le dessert parfait','["100 g de beurre coupé en dés, plus un peu pour graisser","farine, pour saupoudrer","140 g de chocolat noir de la meilleure qualité, à 70 % de cacao, brisé en morceaux","6 gros œufs, séparés","140 g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à soupe de kirsch ou de Cointreau (facultatif)","pincée de sel","85 g de sucre en poudre","cacao en poudre et crème fraîche, pour servir"]','["Préchauffer le four à 170C/Gaz 3/four ventilé 150C. Beurrer un moule à charnière de 23 cm et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé ou de papier sulfurisé. Saupoudrez les côtés d''un peu de farine. Mettez le chocolat et le beurre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante doucement. Chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu, puis retirer le bol de la poêle et remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse. Laisser refroidir légèrement environ 5 minutes.","Incorporer les jaunes d''œufs, la poudre d''amandes et la liqueur, le cas échéant. Mettez les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol, ajoutez une pincée de sel et fouettez jusqu''à formation de pics mous. Continuez à fouetter, en saupoudrant le sucre petit à petit, jusqu''à ce que des pics fermes se forment. Incorporer 2 cuillères à soupe de blancs au mélange chocolaté, puis incorporer délicatement le reste jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de blancs.\r\ndes traces de blanc subsistent.","Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien levé et juste ferme au toucher. Laisser refroidir dans le moule (ne vous inquiétez pas si le gâteau coule et se fissure légèrement, tout ira toujours bien). Vous pouvez préparer le gâteau jusqu''à ce stade jusqu''à quatre jours à l''avance et le conserver dans un récipient hermétique dans un endroit frais. Il se congèle également bien jusqu''à un mois.","Pour servir, démoulez le gâteau et retirez le papier de doublure. Tamisez généreusement le cacao en poudre sur le dessus et coupez-le en tranches. Servir avec de la crème fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:03:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9991,9105,'fr','Gâteau à la betterave et au chocolat','La betterave est en fait très sucrée et garde ce riche pain au chocolat merveilleusement moelleux.','["1 grosse betterave cuite, d''environ 175 g, hachée grossièrement","200 g de farine nature","100g de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","200 ml d''huile de tournesol","100 g de chocolat noir (pas trop amer), coupé en morceaux","crème fraîche ou crème caillée, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/chaleur tournante 170C/gaz 5.  \r\nVersez la betterave dans un robot culinaire et mixez  \r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient hachés. Ajoutez une pincée de sel et le \r\nle reste des ingrédients, à l''exception de l''huile et \r\nchocolat. Une fois complètement mélangé (vous  \r\nil faudra peut-être gratter les côtés une fois \r\nou deux fois), ajoutez l''huile en filet constant, \r\ncomme si tu faisais de la mayonnaise.","Lorsque toute l''huile a été ajoutée, incorporez  \r\nle chocolat, puis versez le mélange dans un moule tapissé \r\nMoule à cake de 900 g. Cuire pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''un \r\nla brochette en ressort pratiquement propre. partir \r\nlaisser refroidir le pain sur une grille. Servir en tranches  \r\navec la crème fraîche ou la crème caillée."]','2026-01-11 00:03:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9992,9106,'fr','Gâteau marbré au chocolat','Le gâteau marbré est un souvenir culinaire classique de l’enfance. Qu''il s''agisse d''utiliser des couleurs criardes pour une finition psychédélique, ou simplement du chocolat et de la vanille, c''est un régal à l''heure du thé.','["225 g de beurre ramolli","225 g de sucre en poudre","4 œufs","225 g de farines autolevantes","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/gaz 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake de 20 cm et tapisser le fond d''un cercle de papier sulfurisé. Si vous voulez vous faciliter la vie, mettez simplement tous les ingrédients (sauf la poudre de cacao) dans un robot culinaire et mixez pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse. Si vous préférez mélanger à la main, battez le beurre et le sucre ensemble, puis ajoutez les œufs, un à un, en mélangeant bien après chaque ajout. Incorporer la farine, le lait et l''extrait de vanille jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse.","Répartissez le mélange dans 2 bols. Incorporer la poudre de cacao au mélange dans l''un des bols. Prenez 2 cuillères et utilisez-les pour verser alternativement les mélanges à gâteau au chocolat et à la vanille dans le moule. Lorsque tout le mélange est épuisé (et si de jeunes enfants font cela, vous devrez vous assurer que le fond du moule est recouvert de manière assez uniforme), tapotez le fond de votre plan de travail pour vous assurer qu''il n''y a pas de bulles d''air. Prenez une brochette et faites-la tourner plusieurs fois autour du mélange dans le moule pour créer un effet marbré.","Faites cuire le gâteau pendant 45 à 55 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Démoulez sur une grille et laissez refroidir. Se conserve 3 jours dans un contenant hermétique ou se congèle jusqu''à 3 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:03:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9993,5235,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat et aux poires sans farine','Un gâteau léger mais savoureux à base de noisettes – servez-en une tranche en dessert avec une cuillerée de crème fraîche','["85 g de beurre, plus 1 cuillère à soupe supplémentaire pour le moule","85 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour la boîte","85 g de chocolat noir sans gluten, cassé en morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de cognac","3 œufs, séparés","85 g de noisettes grillées et moulues au robot culinaire","4 poires bien mûres, pelées, coupées en deux et évidées","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Découpez un cercle de papier sulfurisé pour l''ajuster au\r\nfond d''un moule à fond amovible de 25 cm. Fondre\r\n1 cuillère à soupe de beurre et badigeonner l''intérieur du moule,\r\npuis tapissez la base avec le parchemin et\r\nbadigeonner à nouveau avec plus de beurre. Verser à la cuillère\r\n2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre, faites-le tourner pour bien l''enrober\r\nla base et les côtés, puis renversez tout excédent.","Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4. Faire fondre le\r\nchocolat et beurre dans un bol sur une casserole de\r\neau chaude, retirer du feu, incorporer le\r\ncognac et laisser refroidir. Battre les jaunes d''œufs\r\navec le sucre dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et\r\népais; incorporer au chocolat avec les noisettes.","Dans un autre bol, avec un fouet propre,\r\nbattre les blancs jusqu''à ce qu''ils atteignent un pic mou\r\n(essayez de ne pas les fouetter trop fort sinon vous aurez\r\ndifficulté à les plier). Mélangez une cuillerée de\r\nles blancs dans le mélange chocolaté,\r\npuis pliez soigneusement le reste\r\nen 2 ajouts. Verser dans le préparé\r\nétain. Nivelez, puis disposez les poires dessus.\r\nmélange, côté coupé vers le bas. Enfourner 40 mn\r\njusqu''à ce que les poires soient tendres et que le gâteau soit\r\ncuit jusqu''au bout. Laisser refroidir\r\nlégèrement dans le moule avant de le démouler, puis\r\nplacer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Épousseter avec\r\nsucre glace et servir avec de la crème fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:03:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9994,9107,'fr','Gâteau double pain au chocolat','Le chocolat et les gâteaux sont deux de nos choses préférées, alors pourquoi ne pas aimer ce gâteau gourmand ?','["175 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs","140 g de farines autolevantes","85g d''amandes moulues","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 ml de lait","4 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","50 g de pépites ou de morceaux de chocolat nature","quelques morceaux supplémentaires de chocolat blanc, nature et au lait, pour la décoration"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à pain de 2 lb/900 g de\r\nune longue bande de papier sulfurisé. À\r\nfaire la pâte à cake, battre le beurre\r\net le sucre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que\r\nléger et moelleux. Incorporer les œufs, la farine,\r\namandes, levure chimique, lait et cacao\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporez les pépites de chocolat,\r\npuis grattez dans le moule. Cuire au four pendant 45-50\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, levés et une brochette\r\npiqué au centre en ressort propre.","Laisser refroidir dans le moule, puis démouler sur un fil\r\nétaler sur du papier absorbant. Faire fondre le\r\nmorceaux de chocolat supplémentaires séparément dans\r\ndes casseroles sur de l''eau à peine frémissante, ou\r\ndans des bols au micro-ondes, puis utilisez un\r\ncuillère pour arroser chacun tour à tour sur le\r\ngâteau. Laisser reposer avant de trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:03:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9995,9108,'fr','Gâteau au chocolat et au caramel','Ce riche gâteau constitue une pièce maîtresse impressionnante pour tout goûter d''été','["300 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","300 g de sucre muscovado léger","3 gros œufs","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","85g de cacao en poudre","225 g de farine nature","225 ml de crème sure","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","5 cuillères à soupe de dulce de leche ou de sauce caramel","25 g de chocolat au caramel, finement haché (nous avons utilisé du Lindt)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nGraisser légèrement 2 x 23 cm à fond libre\r\nmoules à gâteau et tapisser d''un cercle de cuisson\r\nparchemin. Battre ensemble le beurre et\r\nsucre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et crémeux. Ajoutez le\r\nœufs, un à la fois, en battant bien entre\r\nchaque ajout, puis ajoutez la cuisson\r\npoudre, cacao et un tiers de la farine.\r\nBien mélanger, puis incorporer la moitié du\r\ncrème sure. En alternance entre\r\najouter la farine et la crème sure, mélanger\r\ntout jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste combiné. Cuillère\r\ndans les moules préparés, puis lisser\r\nla surface avec une cuillère.","Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les gâteaux soient\r\nferme au toucher et une brochette insérée dans\r\nles centres ressortent propres. Laisser à\r\nlaisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 5 minutes, puis démouler\r\nsur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement.","Au moment de servir, fouettez le\r\ncrème double avec 2 cuillères à soupe de Dulce de leche\r\njusqu''à ce que des pics mous se forment. Placer 1 gâteau sur un\r\nassiette de service et tartiner avec la moitié du\r\ncrème, puis arroser du reste\r\nDulce de lait. Garnir de l''autre gâteau,\r\npuis étalez le reste de crème dessus.\r\nSaupoudrer de chocolat. Réfrigérer jusqu''à\r\nprêt à servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9996,9109,'fr','Biscuits à empreintes digitales au beurre de cacahuète de renne','Préparez un lot de ces biscuits sucrés au renne la veille de Noël pour les laisser au Père Noël. Les enfants adoreront aider et ajouter le nez rouge confit de Rudolph !','["100 g de beurre de cacahuète onctueux","2 œufs","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","225 g de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ pot de confiture de framboises ou de fraises sans pépins","22 petits bretzels","22 paires de décorations pour les yeux comestibles","stylo à glaçage blanc ou mélanger un peu de sucre glace avec une goutte d''eau"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez le beurre de cacahuète, les œufs, le sucre, la vanille, la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et agglomérante.","Roulez la pâte en boules de la taille d''une noix et disposez-la sur les plaques. Poussez un pouce au milieu de chacun pour faire un retrait et remplissez chacun avec ½ cuillère à café de confiture pour le nez.","Coupez les bretzels en deux et poussez-les sur le dessus des biscuits pour créer des « bois ». Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils paraissent secs. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques. Décorez avec les yeux en les collant avec le glaçage. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9997,9452,'fr','Biscuits au pain d''épice','Levez les pieds et dégustez ces biscuits au pain d''épices épicés avec une boisson chaude – ils sont faits de clous de girofle, de gingembre, de cannelle et de mélasse noire.','["1 bâtonnet plus 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre doux, ramolli","1½ cuillère à soupe de mélasse noire","1⅓ tasse de sucre mou brun clair","½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","1 oeuf","1¾ tasses plus 1 cuillère à soupe de farine tout usage","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","¼ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","1½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","¼ tasse de sucre cristallisé"]','["Battre ensemble le beurre, la mélasse, la cassonade et le sel dans un grand bol à mélanger. Ajoutez l''œuf, puis incorporez tous les ingrédients secs restants, sauf le sucre. Réfrigérer 1 h.","Chauffer le four à 400F/gaz 6. Tapisser deux plaques à biscuits de papier parchemin. Étalez la pâte à biscuits en 20 boules de taille égale (en pesant pour plus de précision, si vous le souhaitez). Versez le sucre dans une petite assiette, puis roulez chaque boule dedans pour bien l''enrober. Espacez chaque boule sur les plaques à biscuits, puis faites cuire au four pendant 9 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:03:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9998,9110,'fr','Biscuits au tahini aux pépites de chocolat salé','Ceux-ci ont une saveur sucrée et salée avec des bords parfaitement croustillants et un centre moelleux – ils deviendront votre recette de biscuits préférée.','["120 g de beurre salé ramolli","120 g de tahini bien mélangé","90 g de sucre en poudre doré","110 g de sucre roux clair et mou","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","1 œuf fermier Morrisons The Best White Golden Yolk, plus un jaune (conservez le blanc pour une autre recette)","175 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","100 g de chocolat au lait haché grossièrement","125 g de chocolat noir haché grossièrement","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame blanches","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame noires"]','["Dans un grand bol ou le bol d''un batteur sur socle, mettez le beurre salé, le tahini, le sucre semoule doré, la cassonade, la pâte de gousse de vanille et une petite pincée de sel. Fouetter à l''aide de batteurs électriques jusqu''à consistance mousseuse, environ 5 à 6 minutes.","Cassez l''œuf fermier Morrisons The Best White Golden Yolk et ajoutez le jaune supplémentaire, puis battez pour combiner, environ 2 minutes. Tamisez la farine et le bicarbe en mélangeant délicatement jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien combiné, puis mélangez les deux chocolats. Refroidissez la pâte au réfrigérateur pendant au moins deux heures.","Chauffez le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Utilisez une cuillère à glace ou à biscuits pour mesurer 12 boules de pâte – environ 65 g chacune. Versez les graines de sésame dans un bol peu profond et mélangez-les délicatement. Roulez chaque boule de pâte à biscuits dans les graines de sésame. Disposez-les sur deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie tapissées, bien espacées car elles s''étaleront.","Cuire au four pendant 13 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés, puis retirer du four et donner un bon coup sur la plaque du côté de la cuisine. Cela aide à créer une texture croustillante et moelleuse. Laisser refroidir complètement sur la plaque avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(9999,9111,'fr','Biscuits glacés au chocolat','Conservez un lot de boules de pâte à biscuits non cuites au congélateur, prêtes à être frites à l''air libre pour des invités inattendus à Noël. Ils sont idéaux pour la boîte à biscuits festive','["2 œufs","175 g de sucre en poudre","75 g de beurre salé fondu","150 g de farine autolevante","50g de cacao en poudre","65 g de pépites de chocolat au lait","50g de sucre glace"]','["Fouetter les œufs et le sucre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et volumineuse. Incorporer le beurre fondu. Tamisez la farine et le cacao en poudre, ajoutez les pépites de chocolat et mélangez. Couvrir et réfrigérer 1 h. La pâte se conserve au frais dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à une semaine.","Faites chauffer la friteuse à 170°C et mettez un carré de papier sulfurisé dans le panier. Façonner des cuillères à café bombées du mélange en boules. Si vous cuisinez immédiatement, roulez les boules dans le sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien enrobées. Mettez le parchemin en laissant suffisamment d''espace pour qu''ils s''étalent. Les boules de biscuits non saupoudrées peuvent être congelées jusqu''à deux mois.","Faites frire à l''air libre par lots pendant 8 à 10 minutes (ou 10 à 12 minutes après congélation), puis laissez refroidir et raffermissez pendant quelques minutes avant de transférer soigneusement sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conserve cinq jours en boîte."]','2026-01-11 00:03:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10000,9112,'fr','Biscuits gluants s''mores','Combinez des biscuits avec des s''mores, une friandise américaine sur un feu de camp composée de chocolat, de guimauve et de craquelins.','["150 g de beurre salé ramolli","160 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","1 oeuf , battu","225 g de farine nature","5 grosses guimauves, coupées en deux sur la largeur","10 carrés de chocolat (environ 100g)","20 crackers salés"]','["Versez le beurre dans un grand bol et incorporez le sucre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Ajouter la vanille, l''extrait d''amande et l''œuf et fouetter jusqu''à ce que le tout soit mélangé et épaissi.","Tamisez la farine et mélangez pour former une pâte. Divisez la pâte en 10 morceaux d''environ 55 g chacun, puis roulez-la en boules (humidifiez légèrement vos mains pour éviter qu''elles ne collent, si besoin). Aplatissez délicatement chaque boule de pâte entre vos paumes, puis mettez une moitié de guimauve et un morceau de chocolat au milieu, et faites remonter la pâte pour enfermer les garnitures, en vous assurant qu''elles sont complètement enfermées. Enfoncez doucement un cracker dans la base et le dessus de chaque boule de pâte remplie. Mettez au réfrigérateur pendant 1 heure pour qu''ils raffermissent légèrement avant la cuisson.","Environ 10 minutes avant de cuire, sortez du réfrigérateur. Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et tapisser deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Disposez les boules de pâte sur les plateaux, bien espacées (on en met cinq sur chaque plateau). Cuire au four 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir légèrement sur les plaques avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10001,9113,'fr','Biscuits à la cannelle','Laissez de côté quelques-uns de ces biscuits épicés à la cannelle pour le Père Noël la veille de Noël. Parfait pour la boîte à biscuits festive, vous pouvez également ajouter des raisins secs','["120 g de beurre salé ramolli","50 g de sucre muscovado brun clair","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","1 œuf légèrement battu","220 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","50 g de raisins secs (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Battre le beurre, le sucre muscovado, le sucre en poudre et 2 cuillères à café de cannelle avec un fouet électrique pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Ajoutez l''œuf, la farine, la levure chimique et les raisins secs, le cas échéant, et continuez à battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange devienne une pâte uniforme. Roulez des cuillères à soupe de pâte en boules entre les paumes de vos mains (vous devriez en avoir 12 à 15). Réfrigérer au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 2 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme, ou toute la nuit. Les boules de pâte non cuites se conservent dans un récipient hermétique au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois (voir astuce ci-dessous).","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Placez les boules de pâte à 3-4 cm de distance sur les plaques à pâtisserie préparées pour permettre au mélange de s''étaler sans se toucher. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient légèrement dorés mais encore tendres et gluants au centre. Laisser refroidir complètement sur les plaques à pâtisserie.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec le reste de cannelle, puis saupoudrez-en les biscuits. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10002,9114,'fr','Biscuits au beurre','Ces biscuits à six ingrédients sont magnifiquement beurrés. Trempez-les dans du chocolat et ajoutez une touche de paillettes comestibles pour plus d''éclat si vous le souhaitez.','["165g de beurre","100g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café de zeste de citron","250 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","100g de chocolat noir, chocolat au lait ou chocolat blanc"]','["Battre le beurre avec le sucre glace, une pincée de sel et le zeste de citron jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse.","Tamisez la farine et ajoutez le lait, mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte puis pétrissez brièvement. Envelopper et réfrigérer pendant 1 à 2 heures.","Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Abaissez la pâte sur un plan de travail fariné sur 2 mm et découpez différentes formes. Disposez les biscuits sur les plaques à pâtisserie en regroupant tous les mêmes tailles. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis laisser refroidir complètement.","Faire fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes ou dans un bol posé sur de l''eau frémissante. Trempez un côté de chaque biscuit dans le chocolat et laissez refroidir et prendre."]','2026-01-11 00:03:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10003,9115,'fr','Biscuits sans sucre','Ces simples biscuits au beurre sont préparés avec du sirop d''agave comme alternative astucieuse au sucre. Préparez un lot en seulement 25 minutes avec seulement cinq ingrédients','["150 g de farine nature","80g de beurre","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''agave","2 jaunes d''œufs","1 gousse de vanille"]','["Battre la farine, le beurre, le sirop d''agave, les jaunes d''œufs, les graines de la gousse de vanille et une pincée de sel au batteur sur socle pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Enveloppez la pâte et laissez-la au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes.","Étalez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et découpez 36 biscuits à l''aide d''emporte-pièces.","Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4. Couvrir 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Soulevez les biscuits sur les plaques à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir complètement. Conserver dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:03:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10004,4020,'fr','Biscuits au sucre','Décorez nos biscuits au sucre beurrés et fondants avec du glaçage passepoilé et des pépites pour des biscuits festifs très spéciaux. Ils font de jolis cadeaux de Noël','["100 g de beurre doux, ramolli","100 g de sucre en poudre","2 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","25g de maïzena","250 g de farine nature"]','["Battre le beurre et le sucre avec un fouet électrique pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Battez les œufs un à un, puis ajoutez la vanille. Incorporer la maïzena et la farine ordinaire jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte. Mettez la pâte entre deux morceaux de papier sulfurisé et étalez-la sur 6 mm d''épaisseur à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Mettre au frais 30 min.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Décollez la couche supérieure de papier sulfurisé de la pâte et découpez des cercles à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce rond de 6 cm (ou de la forme de votre choix). Reroulez les chutes et continuez à découper les ronds jusqu''à ce que toute la pâte soit utilisée. Transférez les biscuits sur une deuxième grande plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, en les espaçant de 2 cm (vous aurez peut-être besoin de deux feuilles). Cuire au four pendant 7 à 10 minutes. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque pendant 15 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conservera dans une boîte hermétique pendant une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:03:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10005,4082,'fr','Biscuits boule à neige','Faites de ces boules à neige comestibles de jolies décorations pour votre sapin de Noël – vos guirlandes lumineuses brilleront au milieu, ce qui les rendra magiques !','["175 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","100 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","50 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","huile végétale, pour le parchemin","30 (environ 160 g) de menthes des glaciers ou d''autres bonbons bouillis à la menthe claire","200 g de sucre glace royal","6 cuillères à soupe de pépites"]','["Mélangez la farine, le beurre et le sucre en poudre dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Ajoutez la vanille et le lait et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir des miettes plus grosses. Pétrir brièvement sur une surface légèrement farinée pour obtenir une boule lisse, puis envelopper et réfrigérer pendant au moins 30 minutes. Tapisser deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé, puis huiler légèrement le papier sulfurisé.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Abaisser la pâte réfrigérée sur un plan de travail fariné jusqu''à l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Découpez des ronds à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 8 cm, puis découpez des trous au milieu à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 5 cm. Découpez de petits trous sur le dessus des biscuits à l’aide de la pointe d’une douille ronde ou d’une paille – c’est là que vous enfilerez le ruban pour le suspendre. Reroulez les chutes et continuez à découper les biscuits jusqu''à ce que toute la pâte soit utilisée – vous aurez besoin d''une quantité égale, car vous prendrez les biscuits ensemble en sandwich (vous devriez en obtenir environ 20). Transférer délicatement sur les feuilles préparées.","Cuire au four pendant 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient juste dorés. Pendant ce temps, mettez les menthes ou les bonbons dans un robot culinaire ou un pilon et un mortier, et mixez ou écrasez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement brisés. Au bout de 6 minutes, sortez les biscuits du four et versez la menthe écrasée dans les centres découpés (utilisez environ 1 cuillère à café bombée par biscuit). Cuire au four encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les menthes soient juste fondues, mais n''aient pas commencé à se colorer (elles deviendront dorées si elles sont laissées trop longtemps). Le milieu aura l’air pétillant, mais se stabilisera en refroidissant. Si les menthes fondues n’ont pas atteint les bords, utilisez une brochette en métal pour faire délicatement glisser le milieu fondu sur les côtés. Laisser durcir les feuilles, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pour faire le glaçage, mélangez le sucre glace avec 5 à 6 cuillères à café d''eau jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage épais et utilisable. Verser dans une poche à douille munie d''une petite douille ronde. Décorez le fond des biscuits (les menthes fondues affleureront le fond, cela laissera donc plus de place aux pépites) en les inondant de glaçage, ou en passepoilant de motifs ou de flocons de neige. Laisser sécher complètement en réservant les restes de glaçage dans la poche à douille.","Une fois les biscuits secs, retournez-en délicatement un sur un torchon propre pour ne pas endommager le glaçage. Versez un peu du glaçage réservé autour du biscuit, en prenant soin de ne pas vous approcher trop près du milieu ou des bords – le glaçage s''étalera lorsque vous prendrez les biscuits ensemble. Versez une cuillère à café de pépites au milieu transparent, en veillant à ne pas toucher le glaçage, puis prenez un autre biscuit en faisant correspondre les trous du ruban. Laisser sécher complètement avant de secouer, car les pépites colleront à tout glaçage humide. Répétez avec le reste des biscuits, du glaçage et des pépites. Enfilez les rubans dans les trous et suspendez-les pour les décorations, ou conservez-les dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:03:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10006,4143,'fr','Biscuits petit-déjeuner aux framboises, aux amandes et à l''avoine','Prenez quelques-uns de ces biscuits énergisants pour un petit-déjeuner rapide ou offrez-les comme collations pour combler le manque de faim avant le dîner. A déguster avec du yaourt et des fruits','["2 bananes mûres, écrasées","150 g de flocons d''avoine","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","1⁄2 cuillère à café de cannelle","100 g de framboises (fraîches ou surgelées)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la banane, les flocons d''avoine, les amandes, la cannelle et une pincée de sel dans un bol pour obtenir une pâte collante. Incorporez délicatement les framboises en essayant de ne pas les briser. Prélevez des cuillères à soupe du mélange et roulez-les en boules, puis placez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie et aplatissez-les avec la main.","Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les biscuits soient fermes sur les bords et soient dorés. Laisser refroidir. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10007,9116,'fr','Biscuits au miel caramélisé et au tahini','Utilisez ce pot de pâte de sésame au fond de votre placard pour cuire ces biscuits décadents au miel et au tahini. Ils sont sucrés, salés et totalement addictifs','["150g de miel","150 g de beurre salé coupé en cubes","75 g de cassonade foncée","75 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de tahin","1 gros œuf et 1 gros jaune","250 g de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin","1 cuillère à soupe de mélange de graines de sésame noir et blanc"]','["Portez le miel à ébullition dans une petite casserole sur feu moyen-vif. Faites bouillir pendant 5 minutes jusqu’à ce qu’il noircisse et sente la noisette – ne vous inquiétez pas s’il semble assez foncé, cela ajoutera de la saveur. Fouettez brièvement, puis retirez du feu et incorporez délicatement le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. Transférer dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et laisser refroidir.","Versez les sucres, le tahini, l''œuf et le jaune dans le bol avec le mélange de miel, puis battez pour combiner. Dans un autre bol, mélangez la farine et le bicarbe, puis versez progressivement les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte. Réfrigérer 3 heures ou toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Roulez la pâte en 18 boules égales (pesez pour plus de précision, si vous le souhaitez – elles doivent peser environ 45 g chacune) et disposez-les sur des plaques espacées de 5 cm. Appuyez doucement avec le dos d''une cuillère pour aplatir légèrement le dessus, puis saupoudrez de flocons de sel marin et de graines de sésame et enfournez pendant 10 à 12 minutes.","Tapotez le plateau sur un plan de travail pour aplatir légèrement les cookies. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10008,9117,'fr','Biscuits moelleux aux pépites de chocolat','Dégustez ces biscuits moelleux aux pépites de chocolat avec une tasse de thé. Si vous avez le temps, laissez la pâte toute la nuit pour obtenir la meilleure saveur et texture','["150 g de beurre ramolli","150 g de cassonade, de sucre en poudre doré ou idéalement la moitié de chaque","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","180-200g de farine nature (voir astuce ci-dessous)","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","200 g de pépites de chocolat ou de chocolat haché"]','["Mélangez le beurre et le sucre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou d''un fouet à main jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit très léger et mousseux, puis incorporez l''œuf et la vanille. Incorporez la farine, la levure chimique, le chocolat et ¼ cuillère à café de sel aussi rapidement que possible. Ne travaillez pas trop la pâte car cela durcirait les biscuits.","Pour un meilleur goût, laissez le mélange toute la nuit : soit couvrez le bol et mettez au frais, soit roulez le mélange en boules et mettez au frais.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Divisez le mélange en boules, plus les boules sont rugueuses, plus les biscuits auront l''air rugueux. Si vous souhaitez donner plus de texture à la pâte, déchirez les boules en deux et remuez-les légèrement ensemble. Espacez uniformément sur les plaques à pâtisserie, en laissant suffisamment d''espace entre chacune pour permettre l''étalement.","Cuire les biscuits frais pendant 8 à 10 minutes et ceux réfrigérés pendant 10 à 12 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et un peu croustillants sur les bords mais encore très mous au milieu – ils durciront un peu en refroidissant. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque quelques minutes avant de déguster chaud, ou transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conserve trois jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:03:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10009,9118,'fr','Biscuits sablés doublement trempés','Quoi de mieux que des sablés ? Sablés doublement trempés dans du chocolat au lait et blanc ! Ils sont sûrs de subir une tempête avec leur famille et leurs amis','["200 g de beurre salé ramolli","100g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de lait, plus un peu si nécessaire","50 g de chocolat blanc haché","50 g de chocolat au lait haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Battre le beurre avec le sucre glace à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Incorporer la vanille et la farine (le mélange durcira et ressemblera à un crumble au fur et à mesure que la farine sera ajoutée). Ajoutez le lait et continuez à battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange ramollisse et colle (ajoutez un peu plus de lait si nécessaire).","Versez la pâte dans une poche à douille munie d''une grande douille étoile et déposez des anneaux tourbillonnants sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Si le mélange est trop ferme pour être étalé facilement, vous pouvez rouler la pâte en boules et les déposer sur la feuille. Les biscuits se répandront pendant la cuisson, alors ne vous inquiétez pas s''il y a un petit espace au centre des tourbillons, mais assurez-vous qu''il y a suffisamment d''espace entre chaque biscuit pour qu''ils ne collent pas ensemble pendant la cuisson. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir.","Mettez le chocolat blanc et le chocolat au lait dans des bols séparés et passez-les au micro-ondes chacun par rafales de 20 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus. Trempez les biscuits dans chaque chocolat, lait à une extrémité et blanc à l''autre, puis laissez égoutter l''excédent avant de les remettre sur la grille pour qu''ils prennent. Se conserve dans une boîte hermétique jusqu''à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10010,9119,'fr','Sandwichs aux biscuits aux noisettes et au chocolat','Comment rendre les cookies aux pépites de chocolat encore meilleurs ? Farcissez-les de chocolat ! Ces sandwichs aux biscuits aux noisettes et au chocolat sont le plaisir ultime','["120 g de beurre doux, ramolli","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","75 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","1 œuf moyen, légèrement battu","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","100 g de chocolat au lait haché grossièrement","70 g de noisettes sans peau, hachées grossièrement et grillées","120 g de pâte à tartiner chocolat-noisettes"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et réserver.","Crémer le beurre avec les deux sucres dans un grand bol à mélanger à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, puis incorporer le sel, l''œuf et la vanille. Incorporer la farine, le bicarbonate de soude, le chocolat et les noisettes à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Étalez la pâte sur les plaques à pâtisserie en 24 tas bien espacés. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient légèrement dorés. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir complètement sur les plaques à pâtisserie. Étalez 1 cuillère à café de pâte à tartiner au chocolat sur le fond de la moitié des biscuits, puis prenez les autres moitiés en sandwich. Se conserve dans un moule à gâteau ou un contenant hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10011,9120,'fr','Pizza à la pâte à biscuits','Nous avons vu des pizzas de toutes sortes, mais celle-ci doit être notre préférée. Garnissez votre base de pizza en pâte à biscuits avec toutes les friandises qui vous plaisent','["185 g de beurre ramolli","185 g de sucre en poudre doré","150 g de sucre roux clair et mou","2 œufs moyens, battus","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","335 g de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à café de sel","200 g de pépites de chocolat","200 g de chocolat noir fondu","25 g de boutons géants en chocolat blanc","25 g de mini guimauves","25 g de fraises décortiquées et tranchées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160° chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Battre le beurre et les sucres ensemble dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou d''un batteur de table. Versez les œufs battus et la vanille en battant bien jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Tamisez la farine et le sel et pliez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène. Répartissez les pépites de chocolat et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ondulées sur toute la pâte.","Former un gros biscuit rond et déposer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Cuire au four préchauffé pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés et encore un peu bancal au milieu. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes avant de garnir. Étalez le chocolat fondu sur le biscuit, parsemez de boutons géants en chocolat, de mini guimauves et de fraises. Coupez-le en 15 tranches environ et servez-le encore un peu tiède."]','2026-01-11 00:03:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10012,9121,'fr','Biscuits empreintes de chocolat et noisettes','Le robot culinaire fait l''essentiel du travail dans cette recette de biscuits, mais les plus jeunes enfants apprécieront de rouler la pâte en boules et de faire des empreintes de pouce. Les enfants plus âgés peuvent les fabriquer eux-mêmes','["180 g de noisettes grillées","100 g de farine nature","90g de farine de sarrasin","60 g de sucre en poudre doré","180g de beurre doux","100 g de chocolat noir haché grossièrement","1 cuillère à café d''huile de coco (ou utilisez n''importe quelle huile sans saveur)"]','["Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Versez les noisettes dans le bol d''un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement hachées. Ajoutez les farines, le sucre et une pincée de sel de mer en flocons et mélangez pendant 20 à 30 secondes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Ajoutez le beurre et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à se rassembler. Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail et pétrissez-la à la main jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse.","Roulez la pâte en 25 petites boules, puis transférez-la sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée. À l’aide de votre pouce ou du manche d’une cuillère en bois, faites une entaille au centre de chaque morceau de pâte. Mettez la plaque au réfrigérateur et laissez-la refroidir 30 minutes avant la cuisson. Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.","Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Mettez le chocolat et l''huile dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et placez-les sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement fondus. Utilisez une cuillère à café pour garnir chaque biscuit d''un peu de chocolat fondu. Réserver jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit pris."]','2026-01-11 00:03:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10013,9122,'fr','Biscuits au beurre de cacahuète','Avec seulement trois ingrédients, ces simples biscuits au beurre de cacahuète raviront les enfants et les adultes – et ils sont également sans gluten.','["200 g de beurre de cacahuète (croquant ou onctueux, c''est bien)","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","¼ cuillère à café de sel de table fin","1 gros œuf"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser 2 grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mesurez le beurre de cacahuète et le sucre dans un bol. Ajoutez ¼ cuillère à café de sel de table fin et mélangez bien avec une cuillère en bois. Ajoutez l''œuf et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte.","Cassez des morceaux de pâte de la taille d''une tomate cerise et disposez-les, bien espacés, sur les plaques. Appuyez sur les biscuits avec le dos d''une fourchette pour les écraser un peu. Les biscuits peuvent maintenant être congelés pendant 2 mois, cuits surgelés en ajoutant une ou deux minutes supplémentaires au temps de cuisson. Cuire au four pendant 12 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés et plus pâles au centre. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Conserver dans un pot à biscuits jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10014,9123,'fr','Biscuits doubles au gingembre','Si vous aimez les noix de gingembre, vous adorerez ces biscuits épicés à l''américaine avec des morceaux de tige de gingembre, trempés dans du chocolat noir.','["350 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","175 g de sucre muscovado léger","100 g de beurre haché","8 morceaux de tige de gingembre, hachés (pas trop finement), plus de fines tranches, pour décorer (facultatif)","1 gros œuf","4 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","200 g de tablette de chocolat noir haché"]','["Mélangez la farine, le gingembre moulu, le bicarbonate de soude, 1/2 cuillère à café de sel et le sucre dans un bol, puis incorporez le beurre pour obtenir des miettes. Incorporer la tige de gingembre hachée.","Battez ensemble l''œuf et le sirop, versez sur les ingrédients secs et remuez, puis pétrissez avec les mains pour obtenir une pâte. Coupez la pâte en deux et façonnez chaque morceau en un boudin épais d''environ 6 cm de diamètre, en veillant à ce que les extrémités soient bien droites. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire et réfrigérer 20 minutes. Vous pouvez désormais congeler tout ou partie de la pâte pendant 2 mois.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Coupez chaque saucisse en 12 tranches épaisses et disposez les tranches sur les plaques à pâtisserie en les espaçant bien et en les remodelant, si nécessaire, pour former des ronds. Cuire au four 12 minutes, puis laisser refroidir quelques minutes pour durcir avant de transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Faites fondre le chocolat dans un bol au-dessus d’une casserole d’eau frémissante, en veillant à ce que l’eau ne touche pas le fond du bol. Trempez la moitié de chaque biscuit dans le chocolat – vous devrez peut-être en verser une cuillère lorsque vous arriverez aux derniers. Décorez avec une tranche de gingembre, si vous le souhaitez, et laissez prendre. Se conserve 1 semaine dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:03:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10015,9124,'fr','Biscuits à l''avoine et aux raisins','Remplissez le moule à biscuits avec ces biscuits rustiques. Le trempage des raisins secs donne un coup de fouet à la texture et évite qu''ils ne brûlent pendant la cuisson.','["100g de raisins secs","150 ml d''huile végétale","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 gros oeuf, battu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","140 g de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","300g de flocons d''avoine"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Versez 50 ml d''eau bouillante sur les raisins secs et laissez-les tremper pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dodus. Égoutter en réservant le liquide.","Pendant ce temps, dans un grand bol, mélangez l’huile et le sucre. Incorporer progressivement l''œuf, ainsi que l''eau réservée des raisins secs, la cannelle et l''extrait de vanille. Tamisez la farine, le bicarbonate de soude et une pincée de sel dans le bol, puis ajoutez les flocons d''avoine. Enfin, incorporez les raisins secs.","Déposez de grosses cuillères à soupe de pâte à biscuits sur les plaques à pâtisserie, bien espacées car elles s''étaleront à la cuisson. Cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques pendant 10 minutes avant de ranger, ou transférer sur une grille de refroidissement pour refroidir complètement. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10016,9125,'fr','Biscuits visage à la citrouille orange','Des biscuits très amusants pour les friandises ou les friandises : préparez-les un jour ou deux à l''avance, puis remplissez-les avant l''arrivée de vos invités effrayants.','["140 g de beurre ramolli","175 g de farine nature","50g de sucre glace","le zeste finement râpé d''une orange moyenne","100 g de mascarpone","1 cuillère à café de sucre glace","25 g de chocolat noir (55 % de cacao, c''est bien), fondu","50g de sucre glace","environ 1 cuillère à soupe de jus d''orange"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante 160C/\r\nconventionnel 180C/gaz 4. Mettez le beurre dans\r\nun bol et battre avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse. Ajoutez la farine, le sucre glace et\r\nle zeste d''orange et battre ensemble pour obtenir un\r\npâte molle. Pétrir en boule et envelopper\r\ndans du film alimentaire. Mettre au frais 1 heure.","Étalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné\r\nsurface jusqu''à une épaisseur d''environ 3 mm. Couper\r\n24 cercles avec un emporte-pièce rond uni de 7,5 cm.\r\nMettez-les sur quelques plaques à pâtisserie.","A l''aide d''un petit couteau bien aiguisé, découpez\r\nLes visages d’Halloween sont représentés sur 12 des cercles.\r\nRassemblez le reste de pâte à biscuits et\r\npresser en forme de tige de citrouille, en coupant\r\navec un couteau bien aiguisé. Appuyez en haut de chacun \r\nbiscuit avec un couteau pour rejoindre. Faire des lignes sur\r\nle visage biscuits avec le dos d''une lame ronde\r\ncouteau, pour ressembler aux marques sur un\r\ncitrouille. Cuire tous les biscuits pendant environ 15\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Laisser prendre pendant un\r\npendant ce temps, puis laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Mélangez les ingrédients du glaçage pour obtenir un\r\nglaçage lisse et coulant, en ajoutant un peu plus de jus\r\nsi nécessaire, réservez. Pour le remplissage,\r\nbattre le mascarpone avec le sucre glace,\r\npuis incorporez le chocolat fondu refroidi.","Répartir la garniture sur le plat refroidi\r\nbiscuits, puis appuyez sur ceux « visage » sur le dessus\r\n– faites-le juste avant de vouloir les manger,\r\nsinon ils deviennent mous. Badigeonner avec le\r\nglaçage, à l''aide d''un pinceau propre ou d''une pâtisserie\r\npinceau. Mangez le même jour."]','2026-01-11 00:03:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10017,9126,'fr','Biscuits de Noël pétillants à la vanille','Accrochez-les à un arbre de Noël ou emballez-les dans des boîtes comme cadeaux de fin d''année pour les enseignants et les amis.','["140 g de sucre glace tamisé","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 jaune d''oeuf","250 g de beurre coupé en petits cubes","375 g de farine nature, tamisée","200 g de sucre glace tamisé","colorant alimentaire comestible, facultatif","boules d''or et d''argent comestibles","environ 2 m de ruban fin coupé en longueurs de 10 cm"]','["Versez le sucre glace, l''extrait de vanille, le jaune d''œuf et le beurre dans un bol à mélanger, puis mélangez avec une cuillère en bois (ou passez au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé). Ajouter la farine et mélanger jusqu''à obtenir une pâte ferme. Façonnez la pâte en deux disques plats et enveloppez-les dans du film alimentaire. Réfrigérez pendant 20 à 30 minutes. Chauffer le four à 190°C/chaleur tournante 170°/gaz 5 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif.","Étalez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à environ l''épaisseur de deux pièces de 1 £. Découpez des formes de Noël (utilisez un emporte-pièce si vous le souhaitez) et placez-les sur les plaques à pâtisserie. À l''aide de la pointe d''une pique à brochette, découpez un petit trou sur le dessus de chaque biscuit. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés.","Soulevez les biscuits sur une grille pour les laisser refroidir. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sucre glace avec quelques gouttes d''eau froide pour obtenir un glaçage épais mais toujours coulant. Colorez avec du colorant alimentaire comestible, si vous le souhaitez. Étalez-le sur les biscuits refroidis, décorez de boules comestibles et enfilez un ruban une fois sec."]','2026-01-11 00:03:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10018,9127,'fr','Montrez vos sandwichs aux biscuits','Ces petits biscuits, remplis de crème au beurre et garnis de Smarties, sont parfaits pour vendre des pâtisseries et cuisiner avec les enfants.','["200 g de beurre ramolli","140 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 gros œufs, 1 battu pour le glaçage","350 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 147g Smarties","4 cuillères à soupe de centaines et de milliers","100 g de beurre ramolli","140 g de sucre glace","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Au robot culinaire, fouettez le beurre,\r\nsucre glace et vanille jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nAjoutez 1 œuf et mélangez, puis\r\najoutez la farine et mélangez à nouveau.\r\nFormez une boule de pâte et enveloppez-la\r\ndans du film alimentaire. Mettre au frais 30 min.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nSaupoudrez 2 grandes plaques à pâtisserie de farine. Pause\r\nla pâte en gros morceaux de la taille d''une cerise.\r\nRouler en boules et mettre sur la cuisson\r\nplateaux, un peu espacés. Écrasez\r\nles boules légèrement avec 3 doigts. Cuire (dans\r\nlots, si nécessaire) pendant 8 minutes – le\r\nles cookies seront encore très pâles à ce stade.","Sortez les biscuits du four.\r\nPendant qu''il est encore chaud, brossez rapidement le dessus\r\navec l''œuf battu, puis trempez-en la moitié dans le\r\ndes centaines et des milliers, et appuyez sur quelques-uns\r\nSmarties sur chacun des autres\r\nbiscuits – faites-le pendant que l’œuf est encore\r\nmouillé, donc les garnitures colleront une fois\r\ncuit. Cuire encore 4 minutes.\r\nLaisser refroidir sur des grilles.","Pour faire le glaçage, battez ensemble le\r\nbeurre, sucre glace et vanille. Une fois le\r\nles cookies sont complètement cool, utilisez le glaçage\r\nprendre en sandwich les 2 différents\r\ncookies. Des cookies non glacés peuvent être préparés\r\njusqu''à 4 jours à l''avance et conservé dans un\r\nrécipient hermétique. Vous pouvez remplir avec\r\nle glaçage jusqu''à 1 jour à l''avance."]','2026-01-11 00:03:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10019,9128,'fr','Biscuits au congélateur','Tout le monde a besoin d''une friandise de temps en temps, et ces biscuits sont remplis d''avoine, ce qui enlève une partie de la culpabilité.','["200 g de beurre ramolli","200 g de cassonade molle","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farine autolevante","140g de flocons d''avoine","50 g de noix hachées comme des noix de pécan, des noisettes ou des amandes","50g de noix de coco desséchée","50 g de raisins secs ou un mélange de fruits"]','["Lorsque le beurre est bien mou, versez-le dans un bol avec le sucre. À l’aide d’un fouet électrique ou en exerçant certains muscles du bras, battez ensemble jusqu’à ce que le sucre soit bien mélangé. Incorporez les œufs un à un, suivis de l''extrait de vanille et d''une pincée de sel, si vous le souhaitez. Incorporer la farine et les flocons d''avoine. Le mélange sera assez ferme à ce stade. Décidez maintenant de ce que vous souhaitez ajouter d’autre – une ou toutes les saveurs sont délicieuses – et mélangez.","Détachez une feuille de papier sulfurisé au format A4. Empilez la moitié du mélange au milieu de la feuille, puis utilisez une cuillère pour étaler épaissement le mélange au centre du papier. Tirez sur un bord du papier et enroulez-le jusqu''à obtenir un cylindre serré. Si vous avez du mal à le lisser, roulez-le comme vous le feriez avec un rouleau à pâtisserie sur une surface de cuisine. Vous en aurez besoin pour avoir à peu près la largeur d’une tasse de thé. Lorsqu''il est bien emballé, tordez les extrémités puis placez-le au congélateur. Peut être congelé jusqu''à 3 mois.","Pour cuire, chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4 et déballer le mélange à biscuits surgelé. A l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, découpez un disque d''environ\r\n½ cm de large. Si vous avez du mal à trancher, plongez le couteau dans une tasse d’eau chaude. Coupez autant de biscuits que vous\r\nbesoin, puis remettez le mélange au congélateur pour une autre fois. Disposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie en les espaçant largement\r\ncar le mélange s''étalera à la cuisson, puis laissez cuire 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré. Laisser refroidir au moins\r\n5 minutes avant de manger."]','2026-01-11 00:03:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10020,9129,'fr','Biscuits au caramel','Les choux de riz cachés donnent un bon croquant aux biscuits aux pépites de chocolat et au caramel de la lectrice Pamela Johnson','["100 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour la plaque à pâtisserie","100 g de cassonade légère et molle","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","175 g de farine autolevante","25 g de céréales de riz soufflé, type Rice Krispies","pépites de chocolat noir, pour la décoration"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nDans un grand bol, battre ensemble le beurre,\r\nsucre et sirop doré jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Tamisez la farine et mélangez,\r\npuis incorporez les céréales de riz soufflé.\r\nRouler en boules de la taille d''une noix et déposer,\r\nbien espacés, sur une plaque à pâtisserie légèrement beurrée\r\nfeuille. Décorez chaque boule avec quelques\r\npépites de chocolat.","Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.\r\nLaisser sur la plaque à pâtisserie pendant 1 min\r\navant de le déposer sur une grille pour le laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10021,9130,'fr','Biscuits fruités','Cette recette facile mais délicieuse a été concoctée par les élèves de 7e année de l''école du Prieuré de Suffolk.','["200g de beurre","175 g de cassonade molle","2 cuillères à soupe de marmelade finement coupée","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées moulues","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","175 g de flocons d''avoine","200 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","175 g de fruits secs – essayez des cerises glacées, des abricots et des raisins secs hachés","100 g de noix hachées (nous avons utilisé des noisettes)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nCrémer le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à consistance légère\r\net moelleux. Mélangez la marmelade avec 2 cuillères à soupe\r\nde l''eau bouillante. Incorporer au mélange crémeux,\r\npuis ajoutez les épices, les flocons d''avoine, la farine et\r\nlevure chimique. Incorporer les fruits et les noix.","Saupoudrez vos mains et la surface de farine\r\net rouler la pâte en un long boudin\r\nforme. Coupez environ 20 disques. Placer sur\r\nune plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé,\r\nespacés à mesure qu''ils se propageront. Cuire au four\r\npendant environ 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:03:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10022,9131,'fr','Florentins cerises & coco','De jolies bouchées moelleuses. Créez une version géante, puis tamponnez les formes d''étoiles – laissant ainsi beaucoup de morceaux à grignoter !','["140 g de sucre muscovado léger","100g de miel clair","200g de beurre salé","100 g de noix de coco desséchée","140 g d''amandes effilées","300g glacé cherries, sliced","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","250 g de chocolat noir, au lait ou blanc, ou un mélange"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Mettre\r\nle sucre, le miel et le beurre dans une grande casserole\r\net fondre doucement ensemble. Quand tout le\r\nle sucre est dissous, incorporez la noix de coco,\r\namandes effilées, cerises tranchées et farine.","Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé (environ 40 x 30 cm) et\r\nétaler grossièrement le mélange florentin\r\nen une fine couche – ne vous inquiétez pas si vous\r\navoir de petits espaces, il devrait fondre ensemble\r\nau four. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nune riche couleur dorée, puis réserver\r\nrefroidir et raffermir.","Faire fondre le(s) chocolat(s) séparément\r\nbols résistants à la chaleur et laissant mijoter doucement\r\nl''eau. Tapisser un deuxième grand plateau ou planche\r\navec du papier sulfurisé et retourner délicatement\r\nla cuisson florentine refroidie dessus. Peler\r\ndu papier sulfurisé. Répandre le\r\nchocolat fondu, si vous utilisez un\r\nquelques types laissent juste un espace entre chacun.","Laissez de côté jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris, puis découpez des formes à l''aide d''emporte-pièces en forme d''étoile. Si l''emporte-pièce s''enfonce dans vos mains (car le mélange florentin peut être un peu dur), posez une petite assiette ou un moule dessus et appuyez dessus à la place."]','2026-01-11 00:03:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10023,9132,'fr','Biscuits oubliés','Qu''y a-t-il dans un nom ? Mettez-les au four, oubliez-les pendant la nuit et vous aurez des biscuits friables le matin','["2 gros blancs d''œufs","120 g de sucre en poudre doré","120 g de noix de pécan, hachées grossièrement","150 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao), haché grossièrement","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/gaz\r\n4/ventilateur 160C. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie\r\navec du papier d''aluminium pour couvrir. Dans un grand nettoyage\r\nbol, fouettez les blancs d''œufs avec\r\nune pincée de sel jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et sec.\r\nIncorporer progressivement le sucre en fouettant un peu\r\nà la fois pour faire un épais et brillant\r\nmeringue. Ajoutez les noix de pécan\r\net du chocolat, puis la vanille\r\nextraire et incorporer délicatement dans le\r\nmeringue avec une grande cuillère en métal.","Cuiller des cuillerées à café bombées de\r\nle mélange de meringue, espacé\r\nà part, sur la cuisson tapissée\r\nfeuilles. Mettez les feuilles au four,\r\npuis éteignez-le et laissez le\r\ndes cookies pendant au moins 3 heures,\r\ntoute la nuit ou jusqu''à ce que le four soit froid.","Décollez délicatement les biscuits\r\nle papier d''aluminium. Conserver dans une boîte hermétique\r\noù ils se conserveront pendant 3-4 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10024,9133,'fr','Biscuits au sucre et aux clous de girofle','Ces biscuits sucrés, aux noisettes et épicés peuvent être servis après le dîner ou emballés comme cadeaux pour la famille et les amis.','["250 g de beurre ramolli","100g de noisettes","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de sucre glace","1½ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","350 g de farine nature"]','["Mettez le beurre, les noisettes, l''extrait de vanille et 85 g de sucre glace dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus et la farine et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte se forme.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser quelques plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Roulez la pâte en boules de la taille d''une noix et disposez-la sur les plaques à pâtisserie. Utilisez le dos d''une fourchette pour écraser légèrement chaque boule, puis enfournez pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles prennent une couleur biscuit pâle – si elles deviennent trop brunes, elles deviendront sèches.","Mélangez le reste du sucre glace et les clous de girofle moulus, puis tamisez épaissement sur les biscuits chauds. Laisser refroidir légèrement avant de déguster tiède ou frais."]','2026-01-11 00:03:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10025,9134,'fr','Biscuits aux pépites de chocolat vintage','Une recette facile de biscuits aux pépites de chocolat pour des biscuits moelleux avec un milieu moelleux qui impressionnera la famille et les amis. Faites-en beaucoup car ils seront certainement un succès','["150 g de beurre salé ramolli","80 g de sucre muscovado brun clair","80g de sucre semoule","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","1 gros œuf","225 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","¼ cuillère à café de sel","200 g de pépites ou de morceaux de chocolat nature"]','["Préchauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif.","Mettez le beurre et les sucres dans un bol et battez jusqu''à consistance crémeuse. Incorporer l''extrait de vanille et l''œuf. Tamisez la farine, le bicarbonate de soude et le sel sur le mélange et mélangez avec une cuillère en bois. Ajoutez les pépites de chocolat et mélangez bien.","À l''aide d''une cuillère à café, disposez des petits tas du mélange bien espacés sur les plaques à pâtisserie. Cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient légèrement dorés et encore légèrement tendres au centre.","Laisser sur la plaque pendant quelques minutes pour raffermir, puis transférer sur une grille de refroidissement."]','2026-01-11 00:03:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10026,9135,'fr','Biscuits aux trois chocolats','Toutes les bases sont recouvertes de chocolat blanc, au lait et noir dans ces biscuits à l''américaine, à déguster tièdes avec un verre de lait froid.','["100 g de cassonade molle","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de beurre ramolli","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","225 g de farine nature","140 g de chocolat au lait fondu","85 g de chocolat blanc en pépites ou coupé en morceaux","85 g de chocolat nature, en pépites ou coupé en morceaux"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nTapisser 1 à 2 plaques à pâtisserie de pâte à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin. Mélanger les sucres et le beurre\r\navec une cuillère en bois, puis ajoutez\r\nl''oeuf, la vanille, la farine et la moitié du fondant\r\nchocolat au lait et mélanger. Incorporer\r\nles pépites de chocolat blanc et nature ou\r\nmorceaux, puis utilisez une cuillère à glace ou\r\ncuillère à soupe ronde (comme une cuillère doseuse)\r\névider des boules de pâte à biscuits et\r\ndéposez-les directement sur les plateaux.","Cuire au four par lots pendant 8 à 9 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle\r\ndorés et encore doux au toucher – ils le seront\r\nraffermir en refroidissant. Transférer soigneusement vers\r\nune grille dès qu''ils peuvent être soulevés\r\nvers le haut, puis arrosez avec le reste\r\nchocolat fondu."]','2026-01-11 00:03:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10027,9136,'fr','Biscuits arc-en-ciel','Ces biscuits colorés connaîtront certainement un grand succès auprès des enfants et des adultes.','["175g de beurre ramolli","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","50g de sucre glace","2 jaunes d''œufs","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","300 g de farine nature","le zeste et le jus d''une orange","140 g de sucre glace tamisé","pépites, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMélangez le beurre, les sucres, les jaunes d''œufs et\r\nvanille avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce\r\ncrémeux, puis incorporer la farine dans\r\n2 lots. Incorporer le zeste d''orange.\r\nAbaisser la pâte en 22 noix environ\r\nboules et posez-les sur des plaques à pâtisserie. Cuire au four pour\r\n15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, puis laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sucre glace avec\r\nassez de jus d''orange pour faire un épais,\r\nglaçage qui coule. Trempez chaque moitié de biscuit dans\r\nle glaçage, puis directement dans les pépites.\r\nSécher sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:03:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10028,4102,'fr','Cupcakes aux fraises','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis ces magnifiques cupcakes aux fraises. Ils sont préparés avec des morceaux de fraises fraîches dans la génoise et un glaçage à la crème au beurre rose vif.','["175 g de farines autolevantes","115 g de sucre en poudre","2 œufs","100 g de yaourt grec","115 g de beurre fondu et légèrement refroidi","100 g de fraises décortiquées et hachées finement","300 g de sucre glace tamisé","150 g de beurre ramolli","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire rose","6 fraises coupées en deux ou 12 petites fraises entières"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de caissettes à cupcakes. Mélangez la farine et le sucre dans un grand bol. Dans un grand pichet, battez ensemble les œufs, le yaourt et le beurre fondu. Mélangez progressivement les ingrédients humides avec les ingrédients secs jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse, puis incorporez les fraises.","Remplissez les caisses préparées pour qu''elles soient remplies aux trois quarts environ. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. Battez le sucre et le beurre ensemble jusqu''à consistance lisse et pâle, puis ajoutez le lait, la vanille et un peu de colorant alimentaire rose et battez jusqu''à ce que le glaçage soit d''une teinte rose pâle uniforme. Versez le glaçage dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille étoile, puis déposez-le en tourbillons sur les cupcakes refroidis. Décorez chacun avec une moitié de fraise ou une petite fraise, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10029,9137,'fr','Petits gâteaux arc-en-ciel','Faites sourire quelqu''un avec ces joyeux cupcakes arc-en-ciel. La génoise rayée et la garniture à la crème au beurre égayeront à coup sûr la journée de chacun.','["110 g de beurre doux, ramolli","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","110 g de sucre en poudre","2 gros œufs","110 g de farines autolevantes","colorant alimentaire en gel rouge, bleu et jaune","des pépites (facultatif)","150 g de beurre ramolli","300g de sucre glace","3 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et remplir un plateau à cupcakes de 10 caissettes.","Battre le beurre, la vanille et le sucre en poudre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Incorporez progressivement les œufs en raclant les parois du bol après chaque ajout.","Incorporer la farine et une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Répartissez dans cinq bols et colorez chacun d''une teinte différente avec une goutte de colorant alimentaire. Nous avons choisi le rouge, le jaune, le vert, le bleu et le violet.","En commençant par la fin de l’arc-en-ciel (dans notre cas violet), étalez uniformément 1 cuillère à café du mélange dans chaque caissette à cupcakes à l’aide d’une poche à douille ou du dos d’une cuillère à café. Complétez avec 1 cuillère à café de la couleur suivante et étalez – veillez à ne pas mélanger les couleurs entre elles tout en amenant le mélange jusqu''au bord de l''étui. Répétez jusqu’à ce que toutes les couleurs soient épuisées et qu’il vous reste une couche uniforme de rouge sur le dessus.","Enfourner 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu de chaque gâteau en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Pour faire la crème au beurre, battez le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très mou. Ajoutez le sucre glace, l''extrait de vanille et une pincée de sel et fouettez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse (commencez lentement pour éviter un nuage de sucre glace). Incorporer le lait jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Versez la crème au beurre sur les cupcakes à l''aide d''une buse circulaire ou étalez-la avec une spatule. Garnir de pépites, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10030,9138,'fr','Cupcakes papillons','Ces jolis cupcakes sont parfaits pour une occasion spéciale. Le sirop aromatisé aide les gâteaux à rester moelleux, vous pouvez donc les préparer la veille et les décorer le lendemain.','["300 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs","300 g de beurre fondu et refroidi","300 g de farines autolevantes","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de fleurs de lavande séchées (voir astuce)","400 g de beurre ramolli","550 g de sucre glace","3 gels colorants alimentaires (nous avons utilisé du violet, du jaune et du rose)","400 g de chocolat blanc","3 gels colorants alimentaires (nous avons utilisé du violet, du jaune et du rose)","2 biscuits au chocolat écrasés (nous avons utilisé des Oreos mais avons retiré la garniture blanche)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser deux moules à cupcakes à 12 trous de moules à muffins en papier. Mettez tous les ingrédients du gâteau dans un grand bol et fouettez avec un fouet électrique pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et légers. Répartissez le mélange uniformément entre les 24 caissettes et faites cuire au four pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre d''un gâteau en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Pendant que les cupcakes cuisent, préparez le sirop. Mettez le sucre, la lavande et 300 ml d''eau dans une casserole moyenne à feu doux. Portez progressivement à ébullition, laissez cuire 2 min, puis éteignez le feu et laissez infuser. Une fois froid, passer au tamis dans une petite carafe.","Pour réaliser le glaçage, mettez le beurre, le sucre glace et 100 ml de sirop dans un grand bol. Mélangez avec une cuillère en bois, puis passez au fouet électrique et fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse et mousseuse. Répartissez le mélange dans trois bols. Ajoutez un petit point de gel colorant alimentaire dans chaque bol pour obtenir trois couleurs différentes de crème au beurre – remuez pour mélanger, puis transférez la moitié de chaque couleur dans des poches à douille jetables.","Utilisez un bâton à cocktail pour percer quelques petits trous sur le dessus des cupcakes, puis arrosez chacun d''1 cuillère à café de sirop. Mettez 1 cuillère à café bombée de glaçage sur chaque gâteau (faites-en huit de chaque couleur) et faites-le tourner avec le dos de la cuillère pour recouvrir complètement le dessus. Ensuite, utilisez la poche à douille assortie pour tracer une ligne droite d''environ 2 à 3 cm de long au milieu de chaque gâteau.","Pour réaliser les ailes, faites fondre le chocolat blanc dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante. Répartissez dans trois bols plus petits et ajoutez les mêmes couleurs de gel qu''auparavant. Découpez des carrés de 8 cm de papier sulfurisé et, à l''aide d''un stylo, dessinez une paire d''ailes de papillon sur chaque carré afin que le motif transparaît de l''autre côté ou, si vous préférez, tracez le motif ci-dessous. Retournez le papier et, en utilisant le trait comme guide, peignez sur le chocolat fondu. Saupoudrez des biscuits écrasés sur les bords pour créer des motifs, puis laissez prendre. Une fois pris, poussez doucement les ailes dans les cupcakes à un angle de 45 degrés."]','2026-01-11 00:03:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10031,9139,'fr','Cupcakes du cycle lunaire','Amateurs d''étoiles en herbe, parcourez le cycle lunaire avec nos délicieux cupcakes au chocolat. Disposez-les dans le bon ordre pour créer une magnifique exposition et tester vos compétences scientifiques','["175 g de beurre doux ramolli","175 g de sucre en poudre","3 gros œufs","150 g de farines autolevantes","50g de cacao en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","100 g de glaçage fondant bleu prêt à l''emploi","100 g de glaçage fondant noir prêt à l''emploi","140 g de glaçage fondant blanc","paillettes comestibles dorées (facultatif)"]','["Tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous avec 12 caissettes à muffins marron foncé ou noires. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un grand bol et à l''aide d''un fouet électrique à main, battez pendant 2-3 minutes, jusqu''à consistance mousseuse.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules à muffins, puis faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et élastique au toucher – demandez à un adulte de vous aider avec ce morceau. Lorsque les gâteaux sont cuits, sortez-les du four et transférez-les sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement – ​​demandez également à un adulte de vous aider avec ce morceau. Vous aurez besoin de 8 gâteaux pour réaliser un cycle complet de la lune. Si nécessaire, vous pouvez couper le dessus des gâteaux pour qu''ils soient plats.","Mélangez 3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace avec suffisamment d''eau pour obtenir une pâte à tartiner et réservez. Pétrissez le glaçage fondant bleu et noir ensemble jusqu''à ce que les couleurs soient presque mélangées, laissant quelques stries de bleu traverser.","Saupoudrez un plan de travail d''un peu de sucre glace et étalez le glaçage coloré de manière à ce qu''il soit suffisamment grand pour découper des ronds de 12 x 7 cm. Étalez un peu de pâte à sucre glace sur chaque gâteau et collez un rond de glaçage dessus.","Étalez le glaçage blanc sur environ 0,5 cm d''épaisseur. À l’aide d’un petit couteau bien aiguisé, découpez 2 fines formes de croissant pour former le croissant croissant et décroissant. A l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 7 cm, découpez 4 ronds. Coupez un rond en deux pour former le premier et le troisième quartier de la lune. Laissez un tour tel quel pour faire la pleine lune et coupez un petit croissant dans les 2 tours restants, pour faire la lune gibbeuse croissante et décroissante. A l''aide d''un peu de pâte à glacer, collez chaque forme sur un gâteau. Laissez un gâteau sans rien – ce sera la nouvelle lune. Utilisez un emporte-pièce en forme d''étoile pour décorer les 4 cupcakes non inclus dans le cycle avec les restes de glaçage blanc.","À l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie, appliquez un tout petit peu d''eau sur le glaçage plus foncé, puis saupoudrez un peu de paillettes sur le dessus : l''eau l''aide à tenir en place. Amusez-vous à disposer vos gâteaux selon un cycle lunaire !"]','2026-01-11 00:03:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10032,9140,'fr','Cupcakes nid de Pâques à la noix de coco et au chocolat blanc','Essayez de dire non à ces petites éponges au glaçage et à l''astucieuse décoration d''oiseaux à base d''œufs en chocolat.','["3 œufs moyens, battus","100 ml de lait","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de noix de coco desséchée","200 g de farines autolevantes","50g de beurre fondu","100 g de chocolat blanc fondu","100 g de chocolat blanc fondu","200 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","225 g de sucre glace tamisé","environ 25 g de noix de coco râpée","36 mini-œufs","glaçage orange ou jaune pour les becs","tube de glaçage d''écriture noir"]','["Tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de caissettes en papier et chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Fouetter ensemble les œufs, le lait et la vanille. Mélangez le sucre avec la noix de coco dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient moulus très finement. Versez dans un grand bol à mélanger avec la farine et mélangez. Ajoutez le mélange d''œufs battus, le beurre fondu et le chocolat, puis mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Verser dans les caissettes (elles seront bien pleines) et cuire au four pendant 18 à 20 minutes sur une grille du milieu jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et qu''une brochette enfoncée au milieu en ressorte propre. Refroidissez les gâteaux sur une grille (laissez le four allumé).","Étalez la noix de coco râpée sur une plaque à pâtisserie et mettez au four environ 10 minutes pour la faire griller légèrement – ​​remuez à mi-cuisson. Cool. Pour faire le glaçage, mettez le chocolat, le beurre et le sucre glace dans un grand bol et battez ensemble avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Étalez généreusement un peu de glaçage sur le dessus des gâteaux refroidis – vous n’êtes pas obligé d’aller jusqu’aux bords. Une fois que vous avez fait les 12, grattez le reste du glaçage dans une poche à douille équipée d''une douille de 1 à 2 cm et passez un anneau autour du bord supérieur pour faire un nid. Rouler dans la noix de coco refroidie pour l''enrober grossièrement.","Transformez chaque mini œuf en poussin en moulant des petits becs à partir du glaçage orange ou jaune et en les collant avec un peu de glaçage noir qui coule lorsque vous ajoutez les yeux. Collez des poussins au milieu de chaque gâteau et dégustez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10033,9141,'fr','Cupcakes aux petits pains chauds','Ces gâteaux ont tous les fruits et les épices du petit pain traditionnel mais sont plus rapides à préparer. Terminer avec des croix de glaçage au fromage à la crème épicées','["1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","100 ml de lait entier","175g de beurre doux","175 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","175 g de cassonade légère et molle","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","100 g d''amandes moulues","3 gros œufs battus à température ambiante","le zeste de ¾ d''orange","100 g de raisins secs, de raisins secs ou un mélange des deux","1 pomme de consommation moyenne, pelée puis râpée","1 cuillère à soupe de confiture d''abricots, réchauffée avec un peu d''eau","le zeste d''un quart d''orange","50 g de fromage frais entier","50g de sucre glace","25 g de beurre ramolli","¼ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées"]','["Mélangez le jus de citron et le lait dans un grand pichet et laissez reposer 5 minutes. Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole. Utilisez un peu de beurre pour graisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous.","Mettez la farine, la levure chimique, le sucre, les épices, les amandes et une pincée de sel dans un grand bol, puis tamisez-le avec vos doigts pour écraser les grumeaux de sucre. Battez les œufs, le zeste et le beurre fondu dans le lait épaissi. Versez-le dans les ingrédients secs, puis battez avec un fouet ballon jusqu''à consistance homogène. Incorporez les fruits secs et la pomme, versez le mélange dans le moule (les trous seront pleins ; voir conseil ci-dessous), puis enfournez pendant 18 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien levés. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes dans le moule, puis retirer sur une grille.","Lorsque les petits pains sont froids, coupez une croix sur le dessus de chacun à l''aide d''un couteau dentelé, puis badigeonnez le dessus de confiture d''abricots. Pour la crème au beurre épicée, battez le tout jusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux et pâle. Versez la crème au beurre dans les croix. Vous pouvez également glacer simplement les petits pains et les croix sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:03:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10034,9142,'fr','Petits gâteaux de célébration','Préparez ces éponges de fête individuelles à l''avance, puis suivez nos suggestions de décoration et de glaçage.','["3 gros œufs","200 g de yaourt nature","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de sucre en poudre","280 g de farines autolevantes","140 g d''amandes moulues","250 g de beurre ramolli","250 g de beurre ramolli","300 g de sucre glace tamisé, plus un peu pour rouler","Paquet de 500g de glaçage prêt à rouler, pour le dessus","quelques colorants alimentaires différents","glaçage supplémentaire et décorations de votre choix (voir la section méthode pour des idées)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Tapisser 2 moules à muffins 12 trous de caissettes en papier. Mettez les œufs, le yaourt, la vanille, le sucre, la farine, les amandes et le beurre dans votre plus grand bol et battez jusqu''à consistance lisse et sans grumeaux. Répartissez dans les caissettes en papier et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes (en échangeant les plaques après 15 minutes si vous devez utiliser 2 grilles) jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent enfoncé au centre des gâteaux en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir sur une grille. Ils peuvent être congelés jusqu’à 1 mois ou conservés dans un contenant hermétique toute la nuit.","Pour décorer, battre ensemble le beurre et le sucre glace jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et légère. Utilisez une cuillère à café pour déposer une cuillerée bombée au centre de chaque gâteau ou, pour plus de rapidité, versez-la dans un sac de nourriture, coupez environ 2 cm du coin et déposez une cuillerée sur chacun.","Divisez le glaçage en autant de couleurs que vous le souhaitez – plus un morceau laissé blanc ou à badigeonner de paillettes, si vous le souhaitez. Pétrissez un peu de colorant dans chaque morceau jusqu''à obtenir une belle couleur, puis étalez-le sur une surface légèrement saupoudrée de sucre glace. Utilisez un emporte-pièce cannelé de 6,5 cm pour découper des ronds et appuyez sur le glaçage pour l''aplatir un peu. Répétez avec les autres couleurs pour couvrir tous les gâteaux. Décorez maintenant comme vous le souhaitez ou consultez nos idées ci-dessous."]','2026-01-11 00:03:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10035,9143,'fr','Cupcakes aux fraises et à la polenta','Ces cupcakes sont de petites portions parfaites et sont parfaits à partager entre amis.','["140 g de beurre doux, ramolli","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","le zeste râpé d''un demi citron","85 g de polenta","3 œufs battus","140 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","140 g de fraises décortiquées et coupées en morceaux","140 g de sucre glace","3 fraises équeutées et hachées grossièrement, plus 6 coupées en deux, pour la décoration","jus de citron"]','["Tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de caissettes en papier et chauffer le four à 180°C/ventilateur 160°C/gaz 4. Dans un grand bol, battre ensemble le beurre, le sucre et le zeste de citron jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Ajoutez la polenta et continuez à fouetter jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer les œufs, petit à petit.","Tamisez la farine et la levure chimique, puis incorporez-les rapidement avec une grande cuillère ou une spatule jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse (le mélange peut paraître grumeleux à cause de la polenta). Incorporer le lait pour le détendre, puis incorporer délicatement les fraises hachées. Répartissez le mélange dans les caissettes en papier, puis faites cuire au four pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, levé et élastique au toucher. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes, puis placer les gâteaux sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement. Les gâteaux peuvent désormais être conservés dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à deux jours.","Décollez soigneusement les coques des gâteaux. Tamisez le sucre glace dans un grand bol. Placez les fraises hachées dans un bol avec 1 cuillère à café de jus de citron et écrasez-les à la fourchette jusqu''à obtenir une consistance pulpeuse. Passer le sucre glace au tamis (il suffit de quelques gouttes de jus pour colorer le glaçage d''un rose rosé). Incorporez davantage de jus de citron, goutte à goutte à la fois, jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse mais fluide. Tremper le dessus de chaque gâteau dans le glaçage, puis garnir aussitôt d''une moitié de fraise. Laissez prendre, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10036,9144,'fr','Cupcakes alimentaires du diable','Ces génoises nappées de fromage à la crème sont légères mais merveilleusement chocolatées','["50g de cacao en poudre","2 gros œufs, à température ambiante","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","175 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de sel","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","225 g de sucre en poudre","175 g de beurre doux, ramolli","4 cuillères à soupe de beurre non salé, ramolli","200 g de fromage frais ramolli","1 cuillère à café de vanille","400 g de sucre glace tamisé","une petite poignée de boules ou de pépites d''argent, pour la décoration"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser 2 moules à muffins de 16 caissettes à muffins en papier. Fouetter ensemble 175 ml d''eau bouillante avec la poudre de cacao dans un bol de taille moyenne jusqu''à consistance lisse. Laissez le mélange refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il atteigne la température ambiante (mettez-le au congélateur pour accélérer), puis fouettez-le avec les œufs et la vanille.","Au batteur électrique, mélanger la farine, le sel, le bicarbonate de soude et le sucre. Mélangez à basse vitesse pendant 30 secondes, puis ajoutez un tiers du cacao liquide et du beurre ramolli. Continuez à mélanger à basse vitesse, puis augmentez à vitesse moyenne et battez pendant 1 min. Ajouter le reste du liquide en 3 fois, en battant chacun\r\npendant 30 secondes. Raclez les parois et le fond du bol avec une spatule et mélangez encore une fois. Remplissez les moules à cupcakes aux trois quarts et enfournez pendant 20 minutes, puis retirez-les et laissez-les refroidir dans le moule.","Pour faire le glaçage, battez le beurre et le fromage à la crème pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse, puis ajoutez la vanille. Tout en mélangeant, versez le sucre en 4 fois, en battant à chaque fois pour bien mélanger. Battre encore 1 minute, puis réfrigérer 2 heures.","Faites tourner le glaçage sur les cupcakes refroidis et décorez avec des boules d''argent ou ce que vous voulez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10037,9145,'fr','Cupcakes passion à la citrouille','Utilisez de la citrouille ou de la courge musquée râpée pour ces magnifiques cupcakes épicés','["175 ml d''huile de tournesol","175 g de sucre muscovado léger","3 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de chair de potiron ou de courge butternut grossièrement râpée","100 g de raisins secs","le zeste râpé d''une orange","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","Pot de 200 g de fromage à la crème entier","85g de sucre glace","pacanes hachées grillées pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nTapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de papier\r\ncas. Versez l''huile dans un grand bol et\r\najoutez le sucre, les œufs et la vanille. Battre\r\nensemble, puis ajoutez le potiron râpé,\r\nraisins secs et zeste d''orange.","Incorporer la cannelle, la farine et\r\nbicarbonate de soude, le mélange sera\r\nassez humide. Verser dans les caissettes. Cuire au four\r\npendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et élastique à la\r\ntoucher et une brochette insérée dans le\r\nle centre d''un cupcake en ressort propre.\r\nLaisser refroidir complètement sur une grille. À ce\r\nétape vous pouvez congeler les gâteaux pendant 4 mois.","Pour faire le glaçage, battez la crème\r\nfromage et sucre ensemble jusqu''à consistance lisse\r\npuis étalez-la sur les cupcakes.\r\nLaisser nature ou décorer avec du pain grillé\r\nnoix de pécan. Conserver au réfrigérateur, mais remettre au\r\ntempérature ambiante pour servir au mieux\r\nsaveur et texture."]','2026-01-11 00:03:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10038,8341,'fr','Cupcakes de Pâques aux cerises et aux amandes','Ces petits gâteaux Simnel sont vraiment aux amandes, avec des morceaux de pâte d''amande dans le mélange – et ils sont magnifiques','["250 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","5 œufs battus","250 g de farine autolevante, plus 2 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","le zeste d''une orange et 2 cuillères à soupe de jus","250 g de pâte d''amande naturelle, râpée grossièrement (plus facile si elle est préalablement réfrigérée)","½ cuillère à café d''essence d''amande, facultatif","200 g de cerises glacées, coupées en deux","environ 100 g de sucre glace tamisé","mini œufs en chocolat, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/ventilateur 160°C/gaz 4 et placer 24 caissettes à cupcakes dans des moules à cupcakes. Battre le beurre et le sucre avec un batteur électrique ou un batteur de table jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Ajouter les œufs, 250 g de farine, la levure chimique, le zeste et le jus d''orange et bien battre jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse, crémeuse et homogène.","Mélanger les cerises dans les 2 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires de farine et incorporer à la pâte avec la pâte d''amande râpée et l''essence d''amande (le cas échéant). Verser dans les moules à cupcakes et cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien levés et dorés. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis placer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec environ 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour obtenir un glaçage fluide mais pas trop liquide. Glacez le dessus des cupcakes et garnissez chacun d''eux d''environ 3 mini œufs en chocolat."]','2026-01-11 00:03:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10039,9147,'fr','Cupcakes au fondant au chocolat','Ces cupcakes lumineux et amusants sont parfaits pour les fêtes d''enfants','["200g de beurre","200 g de chocolat noir, moins de 70 % de cacao, c''est bien","200 g de cassonade légère et molle","2 oeufs, battus","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de farines autolevantes","Smarties, bonbons et pépites, pour décorer","200 g de chocolat nature","100 ml de crème fraîche, pas froide au réfrigérateur","50g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 3\r\net tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de caissettes.\r\nFaire fondre délicatement le beurre, le chocolat, le sucre\r\net 100 ml d''eau chaude ensemble dans un grand\r\ncasserole, en remuant de temps en temps, puis mettre\r\nlaisser refroidir un peu pendant que vous pesez le\r\nd''autres ingrédients.","Incorporer les œufs et la vanille dans le\r\nmélange de chocolat. Mettez la farine dans\r\nun grand bol à mélanger, puis incorporez le\r\nmélange de chocolat jusqu''à consistance lisse. Cuillère\r\ndans des caisses jusqu''à un peu plus des trois quarts\r\nplein (il peut rester un peu de mélange),\r\npuis laissez reposer 5 min avant de mettre\r\nsur une grille basse du four et cuire pendant\r\n20-22 minutes. Laisser refroidir.","Pour le glaçage, faites fondre le chocolat dans un\r\nbol résistant à la chaleur sur une casserole d''à peine\r\neau frémissante. Une fois fondu, éteignez\r\nle feu, incorporez la crème épaisse et tamisez\r\ndans le sucre glace. Lorsqu''il est tartinable, dessus\r\nchaque gâteau avec un peu et décorer avec\r\nvos pépites et bonbons préférés."]','2026-01-11 00:03:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10040,9148,'fr','Cupcakes à la crème au café et aux noix','Gâteau rétro au café et aux noix préféré dans une version cupcake, avec un choix de garniture luxueuse au mascarpone ou de crème au beurre classique','["100 g de beurre bien ramolli","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","100 g de farines autolevantes","2 gros œufs","2 cuillères à café de café instantané, mélangées à 100 ml/3½fl oz d''eau bouillante, puis refroidies","25 g de moitiés de noix hachées, plus 12 autres pour le dessus","Pot de 200 ml de mascarpone (vous le trouverez avec les fromages à pâte molle)","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre muscovado léger"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4 et\r\nassurez-vous qu''il y a une étagère prête au milieu.\r\nTapisser un moule à pain à 12 trous de caissettes à gâteaux féeriques.\r\nBattre le beurre, le sucre, la farine et les œufs avec\r\n4 cuillères à café de café et une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce que\r\ncrémeux. Incorporez les noix hachées.","Versez le mélange dans les caissettes (commencez par\r\nen ajoutant 1 cuillère à café bien remplie à chacun, puis revenez en arrière\r\net rechargez-les – de cette façon, ils devraient tous\r\nêtre de taille égale), puis enfourner pendant 18 à 20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et élastiques. Cool pour quelques-uns\r\nminutes dans le moule, puis retirez les gâteaux et\r\nlaisser refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Mettez le mascarpone, 3 cuillères à café supplémentaires\r\nle café et le sucre dans un grand bol, puis\r\nbattre ensemble. Étalez une cuillerée de café\r\ncrème sur le dessus de chaque gâteau, puis terminez\r\navec une moitié de noix. Les gâteaux sont meilleurs si\r\nils sont glacés assez près du moment de manger,\r\ndonc si vous avancez, préparez le\r\nmélange mascarpone, conserver au réfrigérateur, battre\r\nà nouveau, puis versez-le sur les gâteaux juste\r\navant de servir. Les gâteaux non glacés suivront\r\nà 2 jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:03:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10041,9149,'fr','Cupcakes à la pistache','Transformez n''importe quelle réunion en une occasion spéciale avec ces cupcakes glamour pour adultes','["100g de pistaches","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","140 g de beurre très mou","2 œufs","140 g de farines autolevantes","5 cuillères à soupe de lait","paillettes comestibles, pour décorer","250 g de sucre glace tamisé","colorant alimentaire vert menthe"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et\r\nTapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de caissettes. Mettre\r\n85 g de pistaches dans un robot culinaire avec\r\nenviron la moitié du sucre, puis fouettez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit très\r\nfinement haché. Verser dans un grand mélange\r\nun bol avec le reste du sucre, du beurre,\r\nles œufs, la farine et le lait et battre jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nRépartir entre les caisses, puis cuire à feu doux\r\nétagère pendant 22-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette pique\r\nl''entrée en ressort propre. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Pour le glaçage, mélangez juste assez d''eau\r\ndans le sucre glace pour obtenir un mélange très épais mais\r\nglaçage encore liquide – ajoutez simplement 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau\r\nà la fois. Incorporer suffisamment de colorant alimentaire\r\npour donner une jolie couleur vert pâle. Le cas échéant\r\nles gâteaux dépassent du haut des caisses,\r\ncouper avec un petit couteau ou évider avec\r\nune cuillère à café – en faisant très attention à ne pas\r\nlibérer l''un des boîtiers des côtés de\r\nle gâteau. Mettez une généreuse cuillerée de glaçage\r\nsur chaque gâteau et laissez-le s''étendre doucement sur\r\ncouverture. Hachez les pistaches restantes et\r\nparsemez-les d''une pincée de comestible\r\ndes paillettes. Réglez, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10042,9150,'fr','Petits gâteaux de Noël','Amusez-vous avec les enfants pendant les vacances de Noël en préparant et en décorant ces gâteaux faciles','["200 g de sucre muscovado noir","175 g de beurre haché","700 g de mélange de noix de luxe","50g glacé cherries","2 cuillères à café de gingembre frais râpé","le zeste et le jus d''une orange","100 ml de rhum brun, de brandy ou de jus d''orange","85 g de noix de pécan, hachées grossièrement","3 gros œufs battus","85g d''amandes moulues","200 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","Paquet de 400 g de pâte d''amande roulée (nous avons utilisé Dr Oetker)","4 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots tiède ou de marmelade sans râpé","500 g de sucre glace fondant","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","6 caissettes à muffins dorées et 6 argentées","6 dragées or et 6 dragées argent","flocons de neige"]','["Versez le sucre, le beurre, les fruits secs, entiers\r\ncerises, gingembre, zeste et jus d''orange\r\ndans une grande poêle. Versez dessus le rhum,\r\nbrandy ou jus, puis mettez sur le feu et\r\nporter lentement à ébullition en remuant fréquemment\r\nfaire fondre le beurre. Réduisez le feu et\r\nbouillonner doucement à découvert pendant 10 min,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps pour être sûr\r\nle mélange n''accroche pas au fond\r\nde la poêle. Laisser refroidir 30 minutes.","Mélanger les noix, les œufs et la poudre d''amandes\r\ndans les fruits, puis tamisez la farine et faites cuire\r\npoudre et épices. Remuez le tout\r\nensemble doucement mais complètement. Votre\r\nla pâte est prête.","Chauffer le four à 150C/130C ventilateur/gaz 2.\r\nVerser le mélange à gâteau dans 12 muffins profonds\r\ncas (une cuillère à glace fonctionne bien),\r\npuis nivelez le dessus avec une cuillère trempée dans de l''eau chaude\r\nl''eau. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré\r\net juste ferme au toucher. Une brochette insérée\r\ndevrait ressortir propre. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Dérouler la pâte d''amande sur une œuvre\r\nsurface légèrement saupoudrée de sucre glace.\r\nDécoupez 12 ronds de 6 cm de diamètre. Brosse\r\nles dessus de gâteau avec de la confiture d''abricots, garnir de\r\nun rond de pâte d''amande et presser légèrement.","Préparez le glaçage fondant à un\r\nétaler la consistance, puis tourbillonner sur le dessus\r\nde chaque petit gâteau. Décorer avec du sucré\r\namandes et flocons de neige, puis laisser reposer\r\nensemble. Se conserve 3 semaines en boîte."]','2026-01-11 00:03:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10043,9151,'fr','Cupcakes chauds aux framboises avec un filet de sucre à l''orange','Ces merveilleuses gourmandises acidulées sont parfaites avec une cuillerée de crème fraîche.','["200 g de farines autolevantes","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","200 g de beurre doux, ramolli","4 œufs","200 g de sucre en poudre","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","50g d''amandes moulues","le zeste d''une orange moyenne","150 g de framboises barquette légèrement écrasées, plus un peu pour décorer","jus d''1 orange moyenne","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de caissettes à muffins en papier. Versez les 8 premiers ingrédients dans un grand bol et battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporez les framboises écrasées dans la pâte.","Répartissez la pâte entre les caissettes (elles doivent être à moitié pleines) et faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et juste fermes. Préparez la garniture en mélangeant le jus d''orange et le sucre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Sortez les cupcakes du four et laissez-les refroidir un peu. Arrosez chacun avec le mélange à croûte d''orange et de sucre. Garnir avec les framboises supplémentaires pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10044,9152,'fr','Cupcakes au fromage et aux canneberges','Ces puds en une portion ont une forte ondulation de canneberge pour couper la douceur','["250g de biscuits digestifs","100 g de beurre fondu","600 g de fromage à pâte molle","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","175 g de sucre en poudre","un trait d''extrait de vanille","2 œufs et 1 jaune","400 g de canneberges fraîches ou surgelées","100 g de sucre glace + un peu pour saupoudrer"]','["Faites d''abord l''ondulation en mettant le\r\ncanneberges et sucre glace dans un plat peu profond\r\npoêle et cuire à feu moyen-vif\r\nchauffer pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les baies\r\nse réduire en une sauce épaisse et collante.\r\nÉteignez le feu et laissez refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nTapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous avec 12 muffins\r\ncas. Écrasez les biscuits dans un sac plastique\r\nou passer au robot culinaire, puis mélanger\r\navec le beurre fondu. Diviser entre\r\nles moules à muffins et appuyez avec\r\nvos doigts. Dans un autre bol, mélanger le\r\nfromage à pâte molle avec la farine, le sucre et\r\nl''extrait de vanille, puis incorporer progressivement le\r\nles œufs et le jaune jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ondule le\r\nmélange de baies à travers le fromage, étant\r\nattention à ne pas trop mélanger. Verser le mélange\r\ndans les caisses et lisser les dessus avec\r\nle dos de la cuillère. Enfourner 30 mn,\r\nlaisser refroidir, puis réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que\r\ncomplètement froid.","Pour servir, décollez les coques des gâteaux,\r\nsi vous le souhaitez, saupoudrez de sucre glace.\r\nServir empilé sur un joli plat pour\r\nà chacun de s''aider."]','2026-01-11 00:03:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10045,9153,'fr','Cupcakes aux carottes et au fromage à la crème','Cette recette qui plaira à tous transforme le thé préféré de l''après-midi en délicieux cupcakes.','["175 g de sucre roux muscovado","100 g de farine complète autolevante","100 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","le zeste d''1 orange","2 œufs","150 ml d''huile de tournesol","200 g de carottes râpées","pépites de couleur orange, pour décorer","100 g de beurre ramolli","300 g de fromage à pâte molle","100 g de sucre glace tamisé","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4 et\r\nTapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de caissettes. Dans\r\ndans un grand bol, mélanger le sucre, les farines,\r\nbicarbonate de soude, mélange d''épices et\r\nzeste d''orange. Battre ensemble les œufs\r\net l''huile, puis incorporer aux ingrédients secs\r\navec la carotte râpée. Divisez le mélange\r\nentre les caissettes et cuire au four pendant 20-22 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette enfoncée en ressorte propre.\r\nLaisser refroidir sur une grille avant de glacer.","Pour le glaçage, battez le beurre jusqu''à ce que\r\nmou, puis incorporer le fromage à pâte molle, le glaçage\r\nsucre et vanille. Utilisez une palette ou des couverts\r\ncouteau pour faire tourbillonner le glaçage sur le\r\ngâteaux, puis saupoudrer de décorations."]','2026-01-11 00:03:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10046,9154,'fr','Cupcakes au chocolat faciles','Ces gâteaux légers sont parfaits à congeler – il suffit de les passer rapidement au micro-ondes pour leur redonner vie.','["300 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux – n''en utilisez pas à haute teneur en cacao","200 g de farines autolevantes","200 g de sucre muscovado léger, plus 3 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires","6 cuillères à soupe de cacao","150 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour graisser","284 ml de crème sure en pot","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4\r\net tapisser un moule à muffins à 10 trous de papier\r\ncas. Réduisez le chocolat en petits\r\nmorceaux dans un robot culinaire. Dans le\r\nle plus grand bol à mélanger que vous ayez, conseil\r\ndans la farine, sucre, cacao, huile, 100ml\r\ncrème sure, œufs, vanille et 100 ml\r\nl''eau. Fouettez le tout avec\r\nbatteurs électriques jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis\r\nincorporez rapidement 100 g de mélange fouetté\r\nmorceaux de chocolat. Diviser entre les\r\n10 caissettes, puis enfourner 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nune brochette insérée en ressort propre\r\n(assurez-vous de ne pas l''enfoncer dans un\r\nun morceau de pépites de chocolat). Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Pour faire le glaçage, mettez le reste\r\nmorceaux de chocolat, crème sure et 3 cuillères à soupe\r\nsucre dans une petite casserole. Chauffer doucement,\r\nen remuant, jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu\r\net vous avez un glaçage onctueux. Détendez-vous\r\nle réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment ferme pour tourbillonner\r\nsur les muffins, puis rentrez-les."]','2026-01-11 00:03:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10047,9155,'fr','Cupcakes au citron meringué','Ces mini meringues apporteront une touche de piquant à votre fête et peuvent être préparées la veille pour plus de facilité.','["200 g de sucre en poudre","100g de beurre ramolli","2 œufs, plus 2 blancs d''œufs","zester 2 citrons et 2-3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","100 g de farines autolevantes","4 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBattre la moitié du sucre et tout le beurre jusqu''à ce que\r\npâle, puis ajoutez les œufs entiers, un à un,\r\nen battant bien à chaque fois. Incorporer le zeste\r\net un filet de jus de citron, puis incorporer\r\nfarine. Vérifiez la consistance de la pâte ; il\r\ndevrait tomber doucement du bout d’une cuillère.\r\nAjoutez plus de jus de citron s''il est un peu ferme.","Tapisser un moule à pain à 12 trous de caissettes à gâteaux\r\net mettez 1 grosse cuillère à soupe de mélange dans chacun. Lisse\r\npuis faites un petit plongeon au centre. Cuillère\r\n1 cuillère à café de crème de citron dans chaque trempette et couvrir\r\navec 1 cuillère à soupe de mélange à gâteau. Enfourner 10 mn.","Pendant ce temps, déposez les blancs d''œufs dans\r\nun bol propre, fouetter jusqu''à formation de pics fermes,\r\npuis incorporez le reste du sucre, une cuillère à soupe\r\nà la fois. Continuez à fouetter jusqu''à ce que le mélange\r\nsemble brillant et s''est un peu épaissi,\r\ncomme de la mousse à raser. Verser le mélange dans\r\nun sac de congélation et coupez l''extrémité pour\r\nlaissez un trou de 1,5 cm de diamètre.","Sortez les gâteaux du four – dessus\r\ndevrait être très pâle et juste ferme – alors\r\ndéposer de la meringue sur tous les gâteaux. Retour\r\nau four pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les gâteaux\r\nsont bien cuits et meringués légèrement\r\ndoré. Peut être préparé 1 jour à l''avance."]','2026-01-11 00:03:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10048,9156,'fr','Petits gâteaux Louise','Ces cupcakes apportent de doux éclats de joie à chaque bouchée, parfaits pour une célébration ou une fête.','["175 g de beurre ramolli","350 g de sucre en poudre doré ou blanc","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","5 œufs, 4 séparés","175 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","150 ml de lait","12 cuillères à café de confiture de framboises – utilisez une confiture ferme, nous avons utilisé de la confiture de framboises Waitrose Essential","85 g de noix de coco desséchée"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4\r\net tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de caissettes.\r\nDans un grand bol à mélanger, battre ensemble le\r\nbeurre, 175g de sucre et la vanille\r\nextraire jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Battre dans le\r\nl''œuf entier, suivi des 4 jaunes,\r\navant d''incorporer brièvement la farine, de cuire au four\r\npoudre et lait jusqu''à consistance lisse. Diviser\r\nles deux tiers du mélange uniformément entre\r\nles étuis, puis recouvrez le centre de chacun\r\navec 1 cuillère à café de confiture. Diviser le reste du gâteau\r\nmélanger sur le dessus, en utilisant un doigt mouillé pour\r\nlissez-le en place pour qu’aucun bourrage ne soit visible.\r\nCuire au four pendant 18 à 22 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette pique\r\nau centre en ressort propre. Attends\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment froid pour être manipulé, puis transférer\r\nles gâteaux sur une plaque à pâtisserie plate.","Baisser le four à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼.\r\nÀ l''aide d''un grand bol propre, battez les 4 œufs\r\nMontez les blancs en neige puis continuez à fouetter\r\npendant que vous ajoutez progressivement le reste\r\n175g de sucre. Battre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et brillant,\r\npuis incorporez la noix de coco et utilisez\r\ncuillerées du mélange pour garnir chacun\r\ngâteau. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nl''extérieur de la meringue est croustillant, alors\r\nlaisser refroidir avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10049,8363,'fr','Roses au sucre simple','Ces jolies roses peuvent être utilisées sur des gâteaux et cupcakes pour donner une finition romantique et sophistiquée','["pâte colorante alimentaire comestible (nous avons utilisé Claret et Party Green)","200 g de glaçage prêt à rouler","un peu de graisse végétale solide, pour rouler (voir savoir-faire ci-dessous)","lustre comestible (nous avons utilisé un rose chatoyant), facultatif","paillettes comestibles (nous avons utilisé du rose vif), facultatif"]','["Commencez par les roses. Pétrir un peu de pâte colorante dans 150 g de glaçage jusqu''à ce que\r\npâle et uniforme. Divisez-les en trois boules, puis ajoutez un peu plus de colorant à deux, pour obtenir trois profondeurs de couleur différentes. Conserver sous film alimentaire. Frottez une très fine couche de graisse sur une surface de travail lisse. Déployez l''un des\r\nboules de glaçage finement, d''environ 1 à 2 mm, puis coupez en un rectangle d''environ 8 x 20 cm. Coupez une bande de glaçage de 1 cm dans le sens de la largeur en gardant le reste couvert.","Roulez délicatement le glaçage sur lui-même. Pour un aspect de rose plus réaliste, commencez à rouler légèrement en biais pour que le\r\nle bord extérieur de la rose finie dépasse plus loin que le milieu. Avec environ 2 cm à parcourir, commencez à guider l’extrémité du glaçage vers le bas et le dessous pour obtenir un joli bouton de rose. Pincez pour façonner, puis coupez ou pincez le fond. Réserver pendant au\r\nau moins 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme. Répétez avec le reste du glaçage.","Pour les feuilles, colorez le reste du glaçage en vert. Pincez des petits morceaux de la taille d''un pois, roulez-les en boules, puis aplatissez-les un peu. Pincez une extrémité pour former une feuille. Laisser sécher.","Une fois que les roses sont sèches et fermes, saupoudrez un peu de lustre sur chaque rose à l''aide d''un pinceau ou du bout du doigt. Saupoudrer de paillettes, si vous en utilisez. Disposez les roses sur les cupcakes en grappes de trois, suivies de trois feuilles. Vous aurez besoin de 36 feuilles et roses pour 12 gâteaux."]','2026-01-11 00:03:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10050,9158,'fr','Muffins salés aux épinards','Préparez ces muffins super verts comme premier aliment de sevrage. À base d''épinards, de fromage et de farine complète, ils constituent un bon premier aliment pour les bébés à partir de six mois','["200 g d''épinards frais","100 g de cheddar râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de thym séché","2 œufs","150 ml de yaourt grec","2-3 cuillères à soupe de lait","150 g de farine nature","150g de farine complète","3 cuillères à café de levure chimique","beurre, pour le moule"]','["Réglez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettez les épinards dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient râpés (pas réduits en purée). Mettre dans un bol avec le fromage râpé et le thym séché.","Cassez les œufs dans un bol et mélangez-les avec le yaourt. Incorporer 2 cuillères à soupe de lait, en ajoutant une autre cuillère à soupe si nécessaire.","Tamisez la farine et la levure chimique dans le bol, puis mélangez bien.","Beurrer un moule à muffins, puis y verser la pâte et enfourner 20 à 25 minutes. Cool."]','2026-01-11 00:03:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10051,9159,'fr','Focaccia fraises et chocolat','Présentez les fraises sucrées de Morrisons Market Street dans cette cuisson facile – la focaccia n’a pas toujours besoin d’être savoureuse','["2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","100 g de chocolat noir haché grossièrement","150 g de fraises Morrisons Market Street, coupées en deux","1½ cuillère à soupe de sucre demerara"]','["Versez le sucre dans un bol et versez 350 ml d''eau tiède. Bien mélanger pour dissoudre le sucre, puis incorporer la levure. Ajoutez la farine, le sel, 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et le chocolat. Bien mélanger pour former une boule et la verser sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrir pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit élastique, douce et moins collante. Transférer dans un bol propre, couvrir et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 à 2 heures, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 25 x 35 cm de papier sulfurisé et verser 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile sur le fond. Versez délicatement la focaccia dans le moule préparé, en l''étirant légèrement pour qu''elle pénètre dans les côtés, puis couvrez et réservez dans un endroit chaud pendant 30 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit levée et gonflée.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Arroser du reste d''huile d''olive puis, à l''aide de vos mains, plaquer la pâte partout. Répartissez-les sur les fraises en les pressant légèrement dans les fossettes. Saupoudrer de sucre Demerara et cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout soit doré. Retirer et réserver jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste chaud avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10052,9160,'fr','Galette aux myrtilles et aux amandes','Donnez aux meilleures myrtilles une chance de briller dans cette galette aux amandes. Servir coupé en quartiers avec de la glace à la vanille pour un dessert familial facile','["400 g de myrtilles","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","1 citron, jus","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées","1 oeuf , battu","1½ cuillère à soupe de sucre demerara","glace vanille, pour servir","200 g de farine nature + un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","150 g de beurre coupé en cubes","3-4 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Pour réaliser la pâte, versez la farine, le sucre, la vanille, le beurre et une pincée de sel dans un robot culinaire. Mélangez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine, puis versez 3 cuillères à soupe de lait et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à se rassembler, en ajoutant un peu plus de lait si nécessaire. Réunissez en boule, puis répartissez en disque. Bien envelopper et réfrigérer 30 minutes. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et mettre une grande plaque à pâtisserie à l''intérieur pour chauffer. Saupoudrez légèrement un plan de travail propre de farine et étalez la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle mesure 30 cm de circonférence. Transférer sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé. Versez les myrtilles, la maïzena, le jus de citron, la cannelle et le sucre dans un bol et remuez bien.","Saupoudrez la poudre d''amandes sur le fond de pâte en laissant un bord de 4 cm, puis versez dessus le mélange aux myrtilles et étalez-le. Répartissez dessus les amandes effilées puis repliez le bord de la pâte en faisant légèrement chevaucher la garniture. Badigeonner un peu d''œuf sur le bord et saupoudrer de sucre Demerara.","Glissez délicatement la galette sur la plaque à pâtisserie chaude et enfournez pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée. Laisser prendre et refroidir sur la plaque jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud. Servir coupé en quartiers avec de la glace vanille."]','2026-01-11 00:03:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10053,9161,'fr','Gâteau au gingembre jamaïcain','Préparez ce gâteau collant et épicé en utilisant des ingrédients qui prospéraient historiquement en Jamaïque – à déguster de préférence avec une tasse de thé l''après-midi.','["120 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","285 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 œufs","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","80 ml de sirop de gingembre tige (provenant d''un pot de gingembre tige), plus un peu pour le dessus","50 ml de miel","110 ml de lait de coco"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à pain de 900 g (2 lb) de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la farine, le bicarbe, la levure chimique, le mélange d''épices, le gingembre et ½ cuillère à café de sel fin dans un bol.","Dans un autre bol, verser le beurre et le sucre et battre ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse et mousseuse, 3 à 5 minutes. Ajouter les œufs, la vanille, le sirop de gingembre, le miel et le lait de coco et battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit homogène.","Versez les ingrédients secs et pliez délicatement la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''il ne reste plus de traces de farine, en prenant soin de ne pas trop mélanger. Versez la pâte dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au milieu du four pendant 45 à 55 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Retirer et badigeonner d''un peu de sirop de tige de gingembre. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis servir en tranches. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:03:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10054,9162,'fr','Pain butternut aux pépites de chocolat et aux pacanes','Vous aimez le pain aux bananes ? Vous allez adorer ce pain au butternut, qui ressemble plutôt à un gâteau. La courge apporte de la douceur tout en gardant la texture dense et moelleuse','["250 g de courge musquée","2 œufs","125 ml d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 ml de lait","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","¼ cuillère à café de muscade moulue","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g de chocolat noir haché","75 g de noix de pécan, hachées grossièrement"]','["Coupez la courge en cubes de 2 cm, versez-la dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, puis ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, couvrez avec une assiette ou un couvercle résistant à la chaleur et passez au micro-ondes à puissance maximale pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. (Ou rôtir ou frire à l''air libre pendant 15 à 20 minutes à 200 °C/180 °C ventilateur/gaz 6.) Laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser un moule à cake de 900g de papier sulfurisé. Écrasez la courge à l''aide d''une fourchette, puis ajoutez les œufs, l''huile, le sucre, le lait, l''extrait de vanille, les épices et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis ajouter la farine et la levure chimique. Mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à consistance lisse et qu''il ne reste plus de poches de farine.","Incorporer la majeure partie du chocolat haché et des pacanes. Versez la pâte dans le moule préparé et répartissez-la sur le reste du chocolat et des pacanes.","Cuire au centre du four pendant 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et doré, et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre du gâteau en ressorte propre. Si de la pâte humide adhère à la brochette, remettez au four encore 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Une fois cuit, laissez refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes, puis transférez sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique à température ambiante jusqu''à cinq jours, ou congelé jusqu''à trois mois."]','2026-01-11 00:03:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10055,9163,'fr','Biscuits à la fourchette','Remplissez votre moule à biscuits avec ces friandises faciles qui tirent leur nom du retrait à la fourchette ajouté avant la cuisson. Trempez-les dans du chocolat, si vous le souhaitez, pour plus de gourmandise','["100 g de beurre salé ramolli","50 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","150 g de farines autolevantes","100 g de chocolat noir, pour garnir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Versez le beurre et le sucre dans un bol et battez, à l''aide de batteurs électriques ou d''un batteur sur socle, pendant 3 à 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient vraiment tendres et crémeux. Versez la vanille et battez pendant 20 secondes, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien incorporée. Ajoutez la farine et mélangez à l''aide d''une spatule. Une fois presque mélangé, rassemblez avec vos mains.","Divisez la pâte en 18 à 20 boules pesant environ 15 g chacune et roulez-la en boules. Disposez les boules sur les plaques à pâtisserie préparées, bien espacées. À l''aide d''une fourchette trempée dans l''eau, appuyez doucement pour aplatir les boules et laissez un creux pour la fourchette. Cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les bords soient légèrement dorés. Laisser refroidir complètement sur les plaques.","Pour recouvrir les biscuits de chocolat, faites fondre le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, placé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante doucement. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Une fois les biscuits refroidis, trempez la moitié de chaque biscuit dans le chocolat, puis transférez délicatement sur la grille pour prendre."]','2026-01-11 00:03:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10056,9164,'fr','Gâteau au pain de gingembre collant','Savourez une tranche de gâteau au gingembre gluant avec une tasse de thé l''après-midi ou emportez-la avec un café le matin : c''est toujours un plaisir pour tout le monde.','["200 g de beurre + un peu pour le moule","100g de miel","100 g de mélasse noire","2 boules de gingembre tige d''un pot, hachées, plus 2 cuillères à soupe de sirop","225 ml de lait","275 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de muscade fraîchement râpée","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","1 oeuf"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 2 litres. Mettez le beurre, le miel, la mélasse, le gingembre haché et le sirop de gingembre dans une petite casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu. Laissez refroidir quelques minutes, puis versez le lait et laissez refroidir environ 15 minutes.","Tamisez la farine, le bicarbonate et les épices dans un grand bol, puis versez le mélange de lait en remuant pour bien mélanger. Incorporez l''œuf, puis versez le mélange dans le moule préparé. Cuire au four pendant 1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit bien cuit et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes, puis démouler complètement sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:03:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10057,6175,'fr','Chou crémeux, brioche et laurier','Créez cette pâtisserie au fromage et au chou-fleur crémeuse avec des morceaux de brioche ajoutés pour un accompagnement réconfortant de Noël ou du rôti du dimanche.','["750 ml de lait entier","3 feuilles de laurier","1 gros chou-fleur (environ 750g), coupé en morceaux, feuilles et tout","75g de beurre","75 g de farine nature","75 ml de crème fraîche","râpe de muscade","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon","75 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne","50 g de brioche coupée en cubes de 1 cm"]','["Faites chauffer le lait et le laurier dans une casserole à feu doux pendant quelques minutes. Une fois cuit à la vapeur, éteignez le feu. Laisser infuser 10 mn. Pendant ce temps, mettez le chou dans une autre casserole, couvrez d''eau chaude et faites bouillir pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur dans la passoire.","Faites fondre le beurre dans la poêle à chou-fleur (pas besoin de le laver) à feu moyen. Incorporer la farine et cuire une minute ou deux en remuant pour obtenir une pâte sableuse. Ajoutez une louche de lait tiède en remuant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Continuez à ajouter le lait en remuant bien jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse. Ajoutez la crème, la muscade, la moutarde et la moitié du fromage. Assaisonnez bien.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 si vous cuisinez immédiatement. Versez le chou-fleur dans un plat allant au four (le nôtre mesurait 20 x 30 cm), en faisant ressortir les feuilles pour qu''elles soient bien croustillantes. Verser sur la sauce en veillant à ce que le chou-fleur soit entièrement enrobé. Répartir sur la brioche et le reste du fromage. Se conservera au frais pendant deux jours. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:03:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10058,9165,'fr','Mug cake à la banane','Préparez ce mug cake à la banane facile au micro-ondes pour un dessert rapide pour une personne. Ajoutez des pacanes hachées ou des pépites de chocolat, si vous le souhaitez, et arrosez de sirop d''érable.','["1 banane, pelée","1 œuf battu","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable, plus un peu pour arroser (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à soupe de pacanes hachées ou de pépites de chocolat (facultatif)"]','["Coupez 2 fines tranches de banane au centre du fruit, réservez, puis écrasez le reste.","Versez la purée de banane dans une tasse allant au micro-ondes, puis incorporez le reste des ingrédients, à l''exception des tranches de banane. Passez au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 1 min 30 secondes à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien cuite et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir 1 min, puis garnir de tranches de banane et arroser de sirop d''érable, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10059,9166,'fr','Beignets sucrés','Évoquez des souvenirs de journées à la plage avec ces beignets faits maison de style bord de mer, avec un extérieur croustillant et sucré et un cœur chaud et moelleux – essayez-les avec des trempettes','["2 œufs","300 ml de crème sure","400 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 citron zesté (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre, plus 75 g pour saupoudrer","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","40 g de beurre coupé en cubes et légèrement ramolli","huile végétale, pour friture"]','["Fouetter les œufs et la crème sure dans un pichet et réserver. Versez la farine, le zeste de citron (le cas échéant), 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre, le bicarbe et une pincée de sel dans un bol moyen, remuez brièvement pour combiner, puis incorporez le beurre du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure grossière. Versez le mélange de crème sure et rassemblez en une pâte à l''aide d''un couteau à couverts.","Étalez la pâte sur une surface farinée. Pétrir brièvement jusqu''à obtenir une pâte homogène sans traces sèches de farine. Farinez légèrement le dessus de la pâte, puis tapotez délicatement jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne environ 2,5 cm d''épaisseur. Découpez les beignets à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce rond de 3,5 cm en reroulant les chutes jusqu''à obtenir environ 40 beignets.","Remplissez une casserole moyenne au maximum au tiers d’huile. Chauffer à feu doux à 180°C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain tombé grésille et dore dans les 30 secondes. Versez les 75 g de sucre dans un bol peu profond. Annuler.","Plongez délicatement les beignets dans l''huile chaude et faites-les frire pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits, en les déplaçant doucement à l''aide d''une tranche de poisson ou d''une écumoire pour qu''ils soient uniformément colorés. Transférer sur une grille placée au-dessus d''une feuille de papier absorbant pour égoutter, puis, pendant qu''il est encore chaud, mélanger dans le bol de sucre pour enrober. Si vous le souhaitez, répartissez-les dans des sacs en papier avant de servir. Meilleur servi le jour de leur préparation."]','2026-01-11 00:03:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10060,9167,'fr','Côtelettes de porc au four','Dégustez des côtelettes de porc cuites au four dans un glaçage au miel et à la moutarde complète avec des pommes de terre nouvelles pour un dîner délicieusement facile, ajoutez simplement vos légumes préférés','["1 kg de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","6 gousses d''ail, écrasées","une petite poignée de thym","6 cuillères à soupe de miel","6 cuillères à soupe de moutarde complète","4 côtelettes de porc épaisses avec os (environ 250 g chacune)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/ventilateur 180°C/gaz 6. Mélanger les pommes de terre, l''huile, l''ail et le thym sur une plaque à rôtir peu profonde et mélanger avec vos mains pour enrober d''huile. Assaisonnez bien. Rôtir pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre deviennent tendres lorsqu''on les perce avec un couteau.","Fouetter le miel et la moutarde ensemble dans un petit bol. Assaisonner les côtelettes de porc avec du sel et du poivre, puis badigeonner de la moitié de la marinade. Placez-les dans les pommes de terre sur la plaque et faites cuire encore 10 minutes avant de retourner les côtelettes et de les verser sur le reste du glaçage. Continuez à cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit."]','2026-01-11 00:03:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10061,9168,'fr','Rouleaux de pizza au pepperoni','Préparez ces rouleaux de pizza au pepperoni adaptés aux familles. Vous pouvez accélérer le processus si vous le souhaitez en utilisant de la pâte à pizza et de la sauce à pizza toutes prêtes.','["450 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","5g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour lever","1 cuillère à soupe de polenta fine ou de semoule de maïs","175 g de sauce à pizza","100 g de mozzarella râpée","75 g de pepperoni","petit bouquet de basilic haché"]','["Mettez la farine et la levure dans un grand bol. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de sucre et 1½ cuillère à café de sel et mélangez. Ajoutez 300 ml d''eau tiède et 2 cuillères à café d''huile et mélangez avec vos mains ou le crochet pétrisseur du batteur sur socle jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte se forme. Si vous la préparez à la main, versez la pâte sur un plan de travail et pétrissez pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse et élastique, ou pétrissez à l''aide du batteur pendant 5 minutes.","Nettoyer et huiler légèrement le bol, y verser la pâte et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 2 heures, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double à peu près de volume. Vous pouvez également le mettre au réfrigérateur toute la nuit – il suffit de le porter à température ambiante avant de le façonner.","Tapisser légèrement un moule à gâteau de 22 cm ou une poêle allant au four avec un disque de papier sulfurisé et saupoudrer 1 cuillère à café de polenta sur le fond. Répartissez le reste de la polenta sur un plan de travail avec un peu de farine (ajoutez-en davantage si elle commence à coller) et versez la pâte dessus. Abaisser et étirer la pâte en un rectangle d''environ 35 x 45 cm. Étalez dessus la sauce à pizza, puis répartissez-la sur le fromage, le pepperoni et le basilic. Du côté le plus long, enroulez fermement le. pâte pour faire une forme de saucisse. Utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour le couper en huit morceaux et disposez-le, côté coupé vers le haut, dans le moule ou le moule. Couvrir légèrement et laisser lever encore 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les rouleaux paraissent légers et gonflés.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Cuire les petits pains pendant 30-35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et que le fromage suinte. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes avant de servir. Mieux consommer dans les 24 heures."]','2026-01-11 00:03:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10062,9169,'fr','Tarte au jambon, fromage et pommes de terre','Envie de nourriture réconfortante ? Essayez cette tarte facile au jambon, au fromage et aux pommes de terre, que vous pouvez préparer avec seulement cinq ingrédients. Faites-en un repas en famille en le servant avec une salade verte','["350 g de pommes de terre nouvelles","375 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","100g crème fraîche","50 g de jambon émincé","125 g de brie ou de camembert, coupés en deux et tranchés","salade verte, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre dans de l''eau salée pendant 8 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres mais encore fermes. Laisser refroidir, puis trancher.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Dérouler la pâte avec son papier sulfurisé sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Réservez 1 cuillère à soupe de crème fraîche, puis étalez le reste sur la pâte en laissant une bordure de 2 cm sur le pourtour. Saison. Étalez les pommes de terre, le jambon et le fromage sur la moitié de la pâte, en assaisonnant les pommes de terre au fur et à mesure.","Replier l''autre moitié de la pâte et sceller les bords à l''aide d''une fourchette. Coupez avec un couteau pour une finition soignée – la tarte doit ressembler à un gros rouleau de saucisse. Mélangez un peu d''eau à la crème fraîche réservée, puis badigeonnez toute la pâte. Faites quelques coupes sur la longueur, puis enfournez pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes, puis servir avec une salade si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10063,9170,'fr','Tarte à la crème filo','Préparez notre délicieuse tarte à la crème filo. Une tarte à la crème peut être difficile à réaliser, mais cette version est tout aussi impressionnante mais beaucoup plus facile à réaliser.','["250 ml de lait","150 ml de crème fraîche","2 jaunes d''œufs (congeler les blancs pour une autre recette)","50 g de sucre blanc en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de crème anglaise instantanée","40 g de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","40 g de beurre fondu","5 grandes feuilles de pâte filo"]','["Versez le lait et la crème dans une casserole, faites chauffer à feu doux jusqu''à ébullition, puis retirez du feu. Pendant ce temps, versez les jaunes d''œufs dans un bol, ajoutez le sucre et la poudre de crème anglaise et fouettez ensemble jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez dessus le mélange de crème tiède, remuez bien, puis reversez dans la casserole. Cuire à feu moyen environ 5 minutes en remuant constamment jusqu''à l''obtention d''une crème anglaise épaisse. Couvrir la surface de papier sulfurisé ou de film de cire afin qu''elle ne forme pas de peau. Elle se conservera couverte et réfrigérée jusqu''à trois jours.","Pour assembler la tarte, mélangez le sucre glace et la cannelle dans un bol et réservez. Badigeonnez un moule à cake de 22 cm de diamètre avec un peu de beurre. Déroulez la pâte filo et placez-en une feuille dans le moule à gâteau avec un peu de dépassement. Badigeonner avec plus de beurre et saupoudrer d''un peu de sucre à la cannelle. Répétez avec une autre feuille de pâte en la retournant d''environ 45 degrés par rapport à la première, puis faites de même avec les trois dernières feuilles de pâte, toujours en badigeonnant de beurre et en saupoudrant de sucre. Verser et lisser la garniture à la crème, puis tirer la pâte qui dépasse vers le haut et vers le centre, en la froissant pour enfermer la garniture. Arroser du reste de beurre et saupoudrer de tout le mélange de sucre, sauf environ 1 cuillère à soupe.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Placer le moule sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 30-35 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit croustillante et dorée. Laisser refroidir un peu, puis démouler délicatement et transférer dans une assiette de service. Laisser refroidir complètement à température ambiante. Se conserve une journée, couvert, à température ambiante. Saupoudrez d''un peu de sucre glace et coupez en quartiers pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10064,9171,'fr','Pain soda aux graines','Préparez notre pain complet facile sans levure, qui ne nécessite ni pétrissage ni levée. Nous avons utilisé du lait d''avoine végétalien, mais vous pouvez utiliser du lait ordinaire si vous préférez.','["520 g de farine complète nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de mélange de quatre graines (graines de tournesol, de citrouille, de sésame et de lin doré), plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","400 ml de lait d''avoine enrichi","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron"]','["Chauffez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélangez la farine, les graines et le bicarbe dans un bol, puis mélangez le lait et le jus de citron dans un petit pichet et versez-le dans les ingrédients secs. Remuer avec un couteau jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte collante.","Versez sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et façonnez légèrement une boule avec les mains mouillées ou farinées, car elle sera collante à manipuler. Placez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie farinée, remodelez-le si nécessaire, puis saupoudrez-le d''autres graines et pressez-les légèrement. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et doré. Laisser refroidir sur une grille, puis envelopper dans du papier d''aluminium jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à quatre jours ou au congélateur jusqu''à un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:03:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10065,9172,'fr','Lasagne Nduja','Mettez à jour une lasagne classique avec l''aide du nduja qui apporte une richesse supplémentaire à un plat préféré de la famille. A déguster avec une salade verte fraîche en accompagnement','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","3 gousses d''ail, finement hachées ou râpées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates séchées ou régulières","500 g de bœuf haché","4 cuillères à soupe de nduja","2 grosses tomates hachées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 brin de basilic, feuilles cueillies et déchirées","9 feuilles de lasagnes séchées","200 g de mozzarella ou de cheddar","125 g de boule de mozzarella déchirée","200g crème fraîche","250 g de mascarpone","50 g de parmesan râpé, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons et l''ail pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement ramollis. Ajoutez le concentré de tomates et remuez. Ajoutez le bœuf haché en le brisant avec le dos d''une cuillère et faites revenir quelques minutes. Incorporer le nduja, les tomates fraîches et en conserve et le bouillon. Assaisonner avec du sel, du poivre noir et 1 cuillère à café de sucre. Ajoutez le basilic, puis portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 45 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement réduit.","Pour réaliser la sauce blanche, mélangez dans un bol la crème fraîche, le mascarpone, le parmesan et une bonne mouture de poivre noir.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Étaler un tiers du ragoût de bœuf sur le fond d''un plat allant au four rectangulaire (le nôtre faisait 25 x 18 cm), puis disposer trois feuilles de lasagnes. Versez un tiers de la sauce blanche, puis ajoutez une poignée de mozzarella ou de cheddar râpé. Répétez l’opération pour faire trois couches de chacune, en terminant avec le reste de la sauce blanche. Garnir de mozzarella et de parmesan râpé, si vous le souhaitez.","Couvrir et cuire au four pendant 45 minutes, puis découvrir, réduire la température du four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et cuire encore 15-20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage bouillonne et soit doré."]','2026-01-11 00:03:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10066,3791,'fr','Pain céto','Essayez ce pain aux amandes céto pour un substitut de pain sain à base de noix et de graines. Le pain sera légèrement humide mais vous pouvez sécher les tranches au four ou les griller','["60 g d''huile de coco fondue, plus un peu pour la boîte","100g de farine d''amande","12g de psyllium souviens-toi","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","100 g de graines moulues (nous avons utilisé 50 g de graines de tournesol et 50 g de graines de citrouille)","20g de farine de noix de coco","12 g de graines de lin moulues","3g de sel","3 œufs battus","1 courgette moyenne, râpée","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre de pomme"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Huiler et tapisser un moule à cake de 900g de papier sulfurisé. Annuler.","Mettez tous les ingrédients secs dans un grand bol à mélanger, mélangez et réservez.","Mettez l''huile de coco, les œufs, la courgette et 115 ml d''eau chaude dans un grand bol à mélanger séparé, puis versez dans le bol avec les ingrédients secs et mélangez. Incorporer le vinaigre de cidre de pomme en mélangeant délicatement – ​​essayez de ne pas trop mélanger la pâte.","Transférez le mélange dans le moule à cake. Mouillez vos doigts pour lisser le dessus du pain ou utilisez le dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four 20 minutes, puis réduire le four à 150C/130C chaleur tournante/gaz 2 et cuire encore 30 minutes. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille de refroidissement. Tranchez le pain et faites griller les tranches dans une poêle ou au four."]','2026-01-11 00:03:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10067,9173,'fr','Gâteau renversé aux prunes','Dégustez notre gâteau renversé aux prunes comme une délicieuse friandise avec une tasse de thé, ou comme un merveilleux pudding servi avec une cuillerée de crème anglaise ou un filet de crème double.','["150 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour la boîte","50 g de beurre ramolli","300 g de sucre mou roux clair","6 prunes dénoyautées et coupées en 8 quartiers","Pot de 284 ml de babeurre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 œufs","325 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler et tapisser le fond d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm de profondeur. Mélanger le beurre avec 50 g de cassonade claire et étaler sur le fond du moule chemisé. Disposez les quartiers de prunes dessus en cercles concentriques.","Versez le babeurre, la vanille, l''huile, le reste du sucre et les œufs dans un grand bol et battez pendant 1 à 2 minutes à l''aide d''une fourchette ou d''un fouet pour casser les œufs. Versez la farine et le bicarbonate de soude et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Versez-le délicatement sur les prunes, puis enfournez pendant 45 minutes à 1 h jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis retirer du moule et renverser sur une planche ou une assiette de service."]','2026-01-11 00:03:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10068,9174,'fr','Snickerdoodles','Le biscuit de vos rêves est-il croustillant à l’extérieur et moelleux au milieu ? Si oui, ces biscuits à la cannelle sont faits pour vous. Une pâtisserie américaine classique, elle est populaire pour une raison','["200 g de beurre doux, ramolli","150 g de sucre en poudre","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 cuillères à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","300 g de farine nature","1½ cuillère à café de crème de tartre","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle moulue"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre et les deux sucres dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse et mousseuse.","Ajouter la vanille et battre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, en raclant les côtés une fois. Ajouter la farine, la crème de tartre, le bicarbonate de soude et ¼ cuillère à café de sel, et mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien combiné. Incorporer le lait pour assouplir le mélange.","Pour la garniture, mélangez le sucre et la cannelle dans un bol peu profond. Roulez 40 g de pâte en boule. Roulez la boule de pâte dans le mélange cannelle-sucre, puis placez-la sur le plateau préparé et appuyez légèrement. Répéter avec le reste de la pâte et la garniture, en espaçant les boules d''environ 5 cm.","Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et gonflés. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque pendant 5 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Se conserve dans une boîte hermétique jusqu''à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10069,9175,'fr','Raspberry frangipane croissant bake','Vous aimez les croissants aux amandes ? Vous adorerez ce plat de brunch luxueux. C''est une excellente façon d''utiliser les restes de pâtisseries et vous pouvez également le servir en dessert.','["100 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le plat","100 g de sucre en poudre, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","150 g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à soupe de farine autolevante","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","3 œufs","100g crème fraîche, plus extra to serve","300 ml de lait entier","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 croissants","150 g de framboises fraîches ou surgelées","25g d''amandes effilées","yaourt, crème ou glace, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Beurrer un plat allant au four (le nôtre mesurait 18 x 26 cm) et réserver. Mettez le beurre, 100 g de sucre semoule, la poudre d''amandes, la farine et l''extrait d''amande dans un bol, puis cassez 1 œuf. Battez le mélange au fouet électrique jusqu''à l''obtention d''une frangipane lisse, environ 2 min.","Cassez les œufs restants dans un grand pichet et fouettez avec la crème fraîche, le lait, la vanille et 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre pour obtenir une crème anglaise onctueuse.","Déchirez chaque croissant et remplissez-le de 2-3 cuillères à soupe de frangipane et de quelques framboises. Disposer dans le plat, côté coupé vers le haut. Versez sur la crème anglaise en veillant à ce que chaque croissant soit saturé, puis versez sur le reste de frangipane. Laisser tremper à température ambiante pendant 1 h. A ce stade, le croissant cuit peut être réfrigéré toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Répartir sur les amandes effilées et cuire au milieu du four pendant 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que la crème anglaise soit juste prise et que les amandes soient grillées. Servir avec de la crème fraîche, du yaourt, de la crème ou de la glace, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10070,9176,'fr','Gâteau aux framboises','Réalisez ce gâteau estival avec des framboises fraîches de saison. Un saupoudrage de sucre glace compense le rouge des framboises, mais vous pouvez également servir avec un glaçage.','["125 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour la boîte","175 g de farines autolevantes","175 g de sucre en poudre","125 ml de yaourt grec 10 % de matière grasse","3 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 citron, zesté","200g de framboises","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","100 g de framboises (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler un moule à cake profond de 20 cm à fond amovible et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la farine et le sucre dans un bol. Annuler.","Mélangez l''huile, le yaourt, les œufs, l''extrait de vanille et le zeste de citron dans un autre bol. Versez le mélange de farine et de sucre et incorporez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporez délicatement les framboises et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes dans le moule, puis refroidir complètement sur une grille. Saupoudrez légèrement de sucre glace et servez garni de framboises supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:03:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10071,9177,'fr','Mini éponges Victoria','Préparez ces petites éponges Victoria pour un thé spécial l''après-midi ou une fête d''anniversaire. Choisissez votre confiture préférée pour la garniture, puis ajoutez de la chantilly','["150 g de beurre doux, ramolli","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","150 g de farines autolevantes","250 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","185g de confiture au choix (fraise ou framboise fonctionnent bien)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de caissettes en papier. Battez le beurre et le sucre en poudre ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux, puis incorporez les œufs, un à la fois, en raclant les parois du bol après chaque ajout.","Ajouter le lait, la vanille, la farine et une pincée de sel, puis battre à nouveau jusqu''à consistance lisse. Répartissez la pâte uniformément entre les caissettes en papier – cela peut être facilement fait à l''aide d''une cuillère à glace. Cuire au four pendant 17 à 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les génoises soient dorées, levées et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Une fois complètement refroidies, les génoises peuvent être congelées jusqu''à trois mois.","Retirez les caissettes en papier des éponges, puis divisez les éponges en deux à travers l''équateur à l''aide d''un petit couteau dentelé. Annuler.","Fouettez ensemble la crème et le sucre glace jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous à l''aide d''un fouet électrique. Étalez un peu de confiture sur la base de chaque génoise, puis versez ou déposez une cuillerée de crème fouettée et mettez en sandwich avec le dessus des génoises. Saupoudrer d''un peu de sucre glace avant de servir. A consommer de préférence le jour même."]','2026-01-11 00:03:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10072,5441,'fr','Quiche aux asperges, feta et aneth','Tirez le meilleur parti des œufs dans cette quiche végétarienne polyvalente. Cuit avec de la feta et des asperges, il est enrobé dans une pâte au fromage et constitue un complément parfait pour un pique-nique.','["½ cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","500 g d''asperges (environ deux bottes), tiges ligneuses enlevées","100 ml de crème double","300ml crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt nature","3 œufs","¼ cuillère à café de poivre blanc","¼ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","une petite poignée d''aneth","200 g de feta coupée en cubes de 1 cm","250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de fromage à pâte dure végétarien à l''italienne, râpé","130 g de beurre salé froid coupé en cubes"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit tendre mais pas doré. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée et faites cuire les asperges 3 min. Égouttez-les puis plongez-les dans un bol d''eau froide pour stopper la cuisson. Égoutter à nouveau. Mettez huit lances de côté, puis coupez le reste en tronçons de 3 cm.","Pour la pâte, mélanger la farine et le fromage dans un bol, puis incorporer le beurre avec les doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau froide à la fois jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte – vous aurez peut-être besoin de 3 à 6 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Envelopper et réfrigérer au congélateur pendant 5 minutes pour raffermir légèrement.","Étalez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit suffisamment grande pour tapisser un moule à flan profond de 23 cm avec un léger chevauchement. A l''aide du rouleau à pâtisserie, déroulez la pâte sur le moule et poussez délicatement la pâte dans le bord. Coupez la pâte qui dépasse de manière à ce qu''elle dépasse de 2 cm du bord du moule. Piquer délicatement le fond de tarte partout à l''aide d''une fourchette, puis remettre au congélateur pendant 15 min. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Froissez un carré de papier sulfurisé, puis utilisez-le pour tapisser le fond de tarte réfrigéré. Remplissez de fèves au bicarbonate de soude et enfournez pendant 15 minutes. Retirez les haricots secs et le papier sulfurisé et faites cuire encore 5 minutes. Laisser refroidir. Pendant ce temps, mélangez la crème, la crème fraîche, le yaourt et les œufs dans un bol, mais ne remuez pas trop fort, évitez de créer des bulles. Incorporer le mélange d''oignons frits, le poivron et le paprika, puis incorporer l''aneth, la majeure partie de la feta et les asperges cuites.","Disposez le fond de tarte sur une plaque allant au four. Versez la garniture en veillant à ce que la feta et les asperges hachées soient uniformément réparties, puis ajoutez les pointes d''asperges entières et le reste de la feta.","Mettre au four et réduire immédiatement la température à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris avec une légère oscillation au milieu. Laisser refroidir avant de trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:03:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10073,3845,'fr','Tarte cheesecake au citron et aux myrtilles','Combinez les saveurs classiques du citron et des myrtilles avec une garniture crémeuse inspirée du cheesecake pour cette tarte. La cuisson ne prend que 20 minutes','["320 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","1 œuf battu","225 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","2 citrons zestés et 1 jus","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace tamisé","3 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","100g de myrtilles"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C/gaz 6 avec une plaque à pâtisserie à l''intérieur pour chauffer. Déroulez la pâte feuilletée sur son papier sulfurisé et incisez légèrement une bordure à environ 2 cm du bord tout autour de la pâte. Badigeonnez un peu d''œuf battu sur le pourtour, puis réservez.","Fouetter le fromage à pâte molle, la majeure partie du zeste et tout le jus de citron, 3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace et le reste de l''œuf battu dans un bol moyen pendant 1 min jusqu''à consistance lisse et légèrement épaissie.","Verser la préparation au cheesecake au milieu du fond de tarte en l''étalant jusqu''au bord du bord à l''aide d''une spatule ou du dos de la cuillère. Déposez des cuillères à café de crème au citron sur le dessus et, à l''aide de couverts ou d''un couteau à palette, incorporez délicatement la crème au mélange de cheesecake pour créer un effet marbré. Saupoudrez uniformément les myrtilles, puis glissez délicatement la tarte sur la plaque à pâtisserie chaude à l''intérieur du four et faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée et croustillante sur les bords.","Laissez la tarte refroidir complètement ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste chaude. Saupoudrez du reste de sucre glace et saupoudrez du reste de zeste de citron, puis coupez en rectangles et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10074,5453,'fr','Chou rouge rôti à la mélasse de grenade','Servez ce chou rouge rôti caramélisé avec des graines de grenade rubis comme accompagnement végétarien spécial ce Noël.','["½ chou rouge, toutes les feuilles extérieures endommagées enlevées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","50g de graines de grenade"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Couper le chou en quatre quartiers en laissant le noyau intact (cela maintiendra les morceaux ensemble). Disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie, frotter l''huile sur les quartiers de chou et bien assaisonner. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes.","Arroser de mélasse de grenade et remettre au four encore 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la mélasse caramélise. Parsemer de graines de grenade avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10075,6339,'fr','Pâtés faciles au poulet et aux poireaux','Préparez ces pâtés au poulet et aux poireaux crémeux et au fromage à l''avance et congelez-les, prêts pour les froides nuits d''hiver où vous n''avez pas envie de cuisiner.','["25g de beurre","3 poireaux lavés et tranchés","Pot de 350 g de sauce au fromage frais","½ bouquet de ciboulette, ciselée","200 g de poulet cuit, déchiré","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","Paquet de 320 g de pâte brisée","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","1 gros oeuf, battu","légumes verts, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une grande poêle, puis ajouter les poireaux et cuire à couvert pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien tendres. Retirer du feu et incorporer la sauce au fromage, la ciboulette, le poulet, le lait et la moutarde. Bien mélanger et verser dans des petits plats ou des ramequins.","Déroulez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné. Utilisez une soucoupe pour découper des cercles pour le dessus, placez-les dessus, coupez-les pour les ajuster, sertissez les bords et glacez avec de l''œuf. Se conservera, couvert et congelé, jusqu''à deux mois.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5 et cuire au four pendant 45 minutes, ou, pour cuire surgelé, chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et mettre sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Cuire au four 15 mn. Réduire le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5 et cuire au four pendant 45 minutes en retirant le papier d''aluminium pendant les 30 dernières minutes. Servir avec des légumes verts, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10076,5820,'fr','Pâtes aux boulettes de viande','Servez une cuisson de pâtes végétaliennes bouillonnantes à base de boulettes sans viande Tesco Plant Chef dans une riche sauce tomate. Ce dîner réconfortant et faible en calories deviendra certainement un favori de toute la famille.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","12 boulettes sans viande Tesco Plant Chef","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","pincée de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","500 ml en purée","1 cuillère à café de sucre","petit bouquet de basilic, feuilles cueillies et déchirées, tiges finement hachées","350g de formes de pâtes au choix","100 g de levain réduit en fines miettes au robot culinaire","20 g d''olives noires dénoyautées et coupées en deux (facultatif)","salade verte, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites frire les boulettes sans viande Tesco Plant Chef pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes, en les retournant souvent. Retirer dans une assiette à l''aide d''une écumoire.","Faites chauffer encore 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans la même poêle et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et translucide. Incorporez la moitié de l''ail et des flocons de piment et faites revenir encore 2 minutes, puis incorporez la purée de tomates et la moitié de l''origan séché. Cuire encore une minute jusqu''à ce que la purée noircisse légèrement, puis ajouter le vinaigre, la passata, le sucre, les tiges de basilic et quelques feuilles de basilic. Versez 200 ml d''eau et laissez mijoter à découvert pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe légèrement.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient à peine tendres, mais encore insuffisamment cuites au milieu. Vidange. Mélanger la chapelure au levain et le reste de l''ail, de l''origan et de l''huile dans un bol et assaisonner. Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7.","Versez les pâtes cuites, les boulettes de viande et les olives (le cas échéant) dans la poêle avec la sauce et remuez délicatement pour combiner. Versez le tout dans un plat à lasagnes, puis répartissez-le sur la chapelure à l''ail et faites cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit dorée et croustillante et que les pâtes soient al dente. Parsemer du reste des feuilles de basilic et servir avec une salade verte en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:03:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10077,9178,'fr','Coupes à biscuits au beurre de cacahuète','Associez la combinaison gagnante de beurre de cacahuète et de chocolat noir dans ces moules à biscuits. Ils sont parfaits pour un pique-nique ou un remontant pour toute la famille','["175 g de beurre ramolli","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait de vanille","1 gros œuf","250 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","150 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao)","240 g de beurre de cacahuète"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Versez le beurre, les sucres et la vanille dans un bol et battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance pâle et mousseuse. Incorporer l''œuf. Ajoutez la farine, le bicarbonate et une pincée de sel et mélangez le tout à l''aide d''une aspatule.","Cassez des morceaux de pâte de la taille d''une balle de golf (environ 65 g chacun) et pressez-les dans les trous d''un moule à muffins à 12 trous, en vous assurant qu''ils remontent sur les côtés. Si vous utilisez un moule à muffins profond, la pâte doit arriver à mi-hauteur de chaque trou. Cuire au four 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. La pâte coulera au fur et à mesure de la cuisson, alors laissez-la refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulée, puis appuyez à nouveau sur les côtés des trous. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Cassez le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et faites-le fondre jusqu''à consistance lisse au micro-ondes en rafales de 20 secondes, ou placez-le sur une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau. Retirez les moules à biscuits du moule (vous aurez peut-être besoin d''un couteau à couverts pour vous aider à le faire). Versez 1 cuillère à café de beurre de noix au centre de chacun, puis recouvrez de chocolat fondu. Laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce que le chocolat prenne, environ 1 heure. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10078,6036,'fr','Tomates au four avec feta et dukkah','Préparez votre propre mélange d''épices dukkah à saupoudrer sur les tomates et la feta, ou achetez une version toute prête si vous préférez. Servir avec des pains plats au sésame','["1 kg de mélange de tomates mûres moyennes et grosses","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","150 g de feta émiettée","4 cuillères à soupe de dukkah (voir ci-dessous)","persil et feuilles de menthe, pour servir","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de sel marin fin","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","25 g de pistaches décortiquées et hachées grossièrement","25 g de noisettes pelées et hachées grossièrement","4 cuillères à café de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de graines de carvi"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le dukkah, mélangez les ingrédients et réservez. Pour les pains plats, mélangez la farine, la levure, le sucre et le sel dans un grand bol. Ajoutez 300 ml d''eau tiède et mélangez pour former une pâte molle et collante. Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse. Remettez la pâte dans le bol, couvrez et laissez lever dans un endroit chaud jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume, environ 1 heure.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Versez la pâte levée sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et divisez-la en quatre morceaux. Roulez chaque morceau en boule, puis étalez chaque boule en un ovale grossier d''environ 4 mm d''épaisseur. Transférez délicatement les ovales de pâte sur deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie antiadhésives. Badigeonner d''huile d''olive et saupoudrer uniformément de graines de sésame. Cuire au four 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et fermes au toucher. Transférer les pains plats cuits sur une grille et laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Couper les tomates en deux par l''équateur et les disposer dans un grand plat allant au four, côté coupé vers le haut. Assaisonnez avec une pincée de sel marin, du poivre noir et du sucre, si nécessaire. Arroser d''huile et saupoudrer de feta et de dukkah.","Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient tendres et juteuses et que la feta soit dorée, mais pas trop foncée. Laisser reposer 5 min, puis répartir sur les herbes fraîches. Servir chaud avec les pains plats à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:03:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10079,9179,'fr','Tarte feuilletée au chausson aux pommes et au caramel','Pensez au chausson aux pommes transformé en une grosse tarte dans ce pudding ultra simple avec un centre de pomme caramélisé. Servir avec une boule de glace ou une crème double','["6 pommes de table (environ 800 g), pelées, évidées et coupées en quartiers","25g de beurre","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","320 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","1 jaune d''oeuf battu"]','["Coupez les pommes en petits morceaux. Faites chauffer le beurre dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille, puis saupoudrez-le de la majeure partie du sucre en réservant environ 1 cuillère à café. Faites bouillir jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous et que le mélange soit collant. Versez les pommes et remuez pour bien les enrober. Assaisonnez avec une petite pincée de flocons de sel marin et laissez cuire 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes ramollissent et commencent à caraméliser et que le jus qu''elles ont libéré se soit évaporé. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidi, il se conservera au frais jusqu''à une journée.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 avec une plaque à pâtisserie à l''intérieur sur la grille du milieu. Déroulez la pâte sur son papier sulfurisé. Versez le mélange de pommes sur le côté droit de la pâte en laissant environ 1 à 2 cm de bordure sur le pourtour, puis badigeonnez la bordure tout autour de la pâte avec un peu de jaune d''œuf battu. Pliez le côté gauche de la pâte sur la garniture aux pommes pour l''enfermer. Sertissez ou pincez le bord, ou utilisez une fourchette pour sceller. Utilisez le dos d''un couteau pour marquer six triangles sur le dessus de la tarte et faites quelques petites fentes au centre de chacun. Badigeonner le tout avec le reste du jaune d''œuf, puis parsemer avec 1 cuillère à café de sucre réservée.","Soulevez délicatement la tarte, toujours sur son papier sulfurisé, sur la plaque à pâtisserie chaude du four. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient gonflés et bien dorés. Laisser refroidir 10 min, puis couper en quartiers en vous aidant des triangles délimités."]','2026-01-11 00:03:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10080,9180,'fr','Pouding au caramel salé et aux pommes','Préparez ce dessert chaleureux et familial en moins d''une heure avec des pommes et du caramel doré. Servir chaud à la sortie du four avec une boule de glace.','["1 cuillère à soupe de beurre ramolli","3 gros œufs et 2 jaunes d''œufs","50 g de cassonade foncée","200 ml de lait entier","300 ml de crème fraîche","Boîte de 375 g de caramel battu jusqu''à consistance lisse","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","75 g de farine nature","3 pommes (nous avons utilisé Pink Lady)","glace, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un plat allant au four de 30 x 20 x 4 cm. Mettez les œufs, les jaunes supplémentaires, le sucre, le lait, la crème, 200 g de caramel, la vanille et une grosse pincée de sel marin dans un grand bol, puis fouettez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer la farine jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse.","Coupez les pommes en deux, épépinez-les et coupez-les en tranches de 1 cm – il n''est pas nécessaire de les éplucher. Disposer dans le plat allant au four et verser sur la pâte. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit prise au centre, dorée et légèrement levée.","Arroser du reste du caramel, puis saupoudrer d''un peu de sel marin supplémentaire. Laisser reposer 5 à 10 minutes (il va se dégonfler un peu). Servir chaud avec de la glace à la vanille ou au beurre de cacahuète, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10081,9181,'fr','Gâteau étagé au citron avec glaçage au fromage à pâte molle','Offrez-vous une tranche de gâteau au citron pour le thé de l''après-midi. Avec de belles couches de génoise légères, un zeste d’agrumes compense le glaçage riche et crémeux au fromage à pâte molle.','["225 g de beurre doux, ramolli","225 g de sucre en poudre","4 gros œufs","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","75g de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de gousse de vanille","3 citrons, zestés","150g de sucre semoule","3 citrons, le zeste de 2 coupés en lanières, pressés (vous aurez besoin de 60 ml)","150 g de beurre doux, ramolli","150 g de sucre glace tamisé","1 cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de gousse de vanille","300 g de fromage à pâte molle entière"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser le fond de deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble pendant 3 minutes à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et mousseuse. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien entre chaque ajout et en raclant les parois du bol. Incorporez la farine et la levure chimique jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien incorporées, puis incorporez le yaourt, la vanille et le zeste de citron. Répartir dans les moules et cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le filet. Versez le sucre, le jus de citron et 100 ml d''eau dans une petite casserole sur feu moyen et remuez jusqu''à dissolution. Ajouter le zeste de citron, porter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le zeste ait ramolli et que le liquide soit sirupeux. Retirez le zeste sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé à l''aide d''une écumoire et retirez le sirop du feu.","Laissez refroidir les génoises 10 min dans les moules, puis versez dessus le filet tiède. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Pour le glaçage, battez le beurre et le sucre glace ensemble à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse, en raclant les parois du bol au fur et à mesure. Ajouter la vanille et le fromage à pâte molle et battre encore 4 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et crémeuse. Ne vous inquiétez pas s’il n’a pas l’air épais au début – il se détachera, puis s’épaissira à nouveau au fur et à mesure que vous le battrez.","Retirez les génoises refroidies des moules. Versez le glaçage dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille étoile. Placez une génoise sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette de service et déposez un peu moins de la moitié du glaçage sur le pourtour en effectuant un mouvement circulaire pour un effet ondulé. Versez un peu plus de glaçage sur le milieu vide (cela n''a pas besoin d''être soigné) et lissez avec le dos d''une cuillère. Réfrigérer pendant 45 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris. Garnir avec la deuxième génoise, puis déposer huit gouttes de glaçage sur le pourtour à intervalles réguliers, en laissant un espace entre chacune. Versez le zeste de citron confit dans chaque interstice, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:03:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10082,6533,'fr','Pains plats à l''oignon grillé et à la feta fouettée','Garnissez les pains plats faits maison de feta fouettée et d''oignons carbonisés pour un déjeuner ou un dîner sensationnel. Terminez avec une touche d''harissa, de thym et de miel.','["300 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","70 ml d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour lever","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","3 oignons bruns, coupés en gros quartiers","5 brins de thym, plus des feuilles supplémentaires pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de miel, plus un peu pour servir","100 g de féta","50 g de yaourt grec.","1-2 cuillères à soupe de harissa à la rose"]','["Mélangez la farine, 1 cuillère à café de sel et la levure dans un grand bol. Faites un puits au centre et versez-y 150 ml d''eau tiède et l''huile d''olive. Mélanger jusqu''à homogénéité, puis pétrir sur une surface légèrement farinée pendant 10 minutes. Versez dans un bol légèrement huilé, couvrez et laissez lever pendant au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive extra vierge dans une poêle à feu vif et faites revenir les oignons pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à carboniser, en remuant de temps en temps. Versez les oignons dans un plat à rôtir avec le thym et le miel. Rôtir pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Émiettez la feta dans un bol avec le yaourt, puis fouettez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse.","Faites chauffer une poêle sèche à feu moyen. Divisez la pâte en quatre à six boules et étalez chacune en un cercle de 1 cm d''épaisseur sur une surface légèrement farinée. Faire frire, un à la fois, pendant 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits et légèrement carbonisés. Garnir de yaourt feta, d''harissa, d''oignons rôtis, d''un peu de thym et de miel supplémentaires et d''une pincée de sel marin."]','2026-01-11 00:03:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10083,4319,'fr','Croûtons maison','Apprenez à préparer des croûtons à la maison grâce à notre recette simple, notre méthode et nos meilleurs conseils. Ceux-ci feront des garnitures croustillantes pour les soupes, les salades et les plats de pâtes réchauffants.','["1 gousse d''ail","2 tranches épaisses de pain au levain","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile","1 cuillère à soupe de graines mélangées","1 cuillère à soupe de persil"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Frotter la gousse d''ail entière sur les deux faces du levain. Déchirez-le en gros morceaux et mélangez-le avec l''huile, une bonne pincée de sel et les graines.","Étalez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Mélangez avec le persil haché. Saupoudrer sur une soupe ou une salade pour plus de croquant."]','2026-01-11 00:03:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10084,4321,'fr','Pommes de terre duchesse','Impressionnez vos convives avec une portion de pommes de terre duchesse. Fabriqués avec des œufs, du beurre et du Grana Padano et disposés en tourbillons, ils constituent un plat d''accompagnement gourmand','["500 g de pommes de terre farineuses hachées","1 gros œuf, séparé","30g de beurre mou","30 g de Grana Padano finement râpé","râpe de muscade","huile végétale, pour le plateau"]','["Faites cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien tendres lorsqu''elles sont pressées contre les parois de la casserole. Bien égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur dans la poêle pendant 2 min. Écrasez les pommes de terre jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très lisses – utilisez un presse-purée si vous en avez un, ou utilisez un presse-purée, puis pressez les pommes de terre à travers un tamis métallique pour vous assurer qu''elles sont complètement sans grumeaux.","Mélangez le jaune d''œuf, le beurre et le fromage dans un grand bol, puis ajoutez la purée, la muscade et un peu d''assaisonnement. Bien mélanger avec l''aspatule jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu et bien incorporé. Il se détachera des parois du bol, comme une pâte à choux.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Verser la purée dans une poche à douille munie d''une large douille étoile. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et badigeonner d''un peu d''huile végétale. Déposez 20 monticules de la taille d''une noix sur le plateau préparé, comme si vous glaciez un cupcake. Battez le blanc d''oeuf avec une pincée de sel et badigeonnez délicatement les mottes de pommes de terre, pour conserver le cannelage.","Cuire les pommes de terre au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes."]','2026-01-11 00:03:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10085,5259,'fr','Pain aux bananes et à la viande hachée','Commencez le jour de Noël avec un délicieux petit-déjeuner que vous pouvez préparer à l''avance. Le pain aux bananes est un favori de la famille, et la viande hachée va encore plus loin.','["150 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","90 g de sucre en poudre","2 gros œufs, battus","150 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","2 bananes mûres (200g), pelées et écrasées","150 g de viande hachée (assurez-vous qu''elle soit végétarienne, si nécessaire)","100 g de beurre salé ramolli","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake de 900g et tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Annuler.","Battre le beurre et le sucre au fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse, puis incorporer lentement l''œuf battu, suivi de la moitié de la farine. Incorporez le reste de la farine, la levure chimique, le mélange d''épices, la purée de bananes et la viande hachée.","Verser dans le moule et enfourner 1 h jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre (couvrir de papier aluminium s''il noircit trop vite). Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement.","Pour faire le beurre fouetté, battez le beurre, le miel et la cannelle à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Si vous le souhaitez, faites griller des tranches de pain et tartinez-les de beurre pendant qu''elles sont chaudes. Le pain se conservera dans un récipient hermétique pendant trois jours et le beurre réfrigéré jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10086,4329,'fr','Rouleaux de kimchi, fromage et oignons nouveaux','Associez l’acidité du kimchi au cheddar affiné dans ces fabuleux moulins à vent. Ils font d''excellents canapés pour des célébrations comme le réveillon du Nouvel An.','["150 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","70 g de kimchi haché grossièrement","320 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","1 œuf légèrement battu","togarashi, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez le fromage, les oignons nouveaux et le kimchi dans un petit bol.","Déroulez la pâte, tartinez-la du mélange de fromage et de kimchi, puis enroulez-la en un boudin serré sur l''un des côtés longs. Coupez-le en 14 morceaux.","Disposez les rouleaux de pâte, côté spirale vers le haut, sur les plaques à pâtisserie, bien espacés. Badigeonner d''un peu d''œuf battu et cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et gonflés. Saupoudrer d''un peu de togarashi, le cas échéant, et laisser refroidir 5 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10087,9182,'fr','Tarte fine à la viande hachée, massepain et pommes','Servez cette tarte festive à la viande hachée, à la pâte d''amande et aux pommes d''inspiration française avec de la crème fraîche pour couper en douceur. C''est un fabuleux dessert de Noël','["320 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","5 cuillères à soupe de viande hachée (vérifiez qu''elle est végétarienne, si nécessaire)","200 g de pâte d''amande prête à rouler","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","4 pommes Granny Smith moyennes","25 g de beurre froid coupé en petits cubes","25 g de sucre en poudre doré","crème fraîche, to serve"]','["Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et dérouler la pâte dessus. Piquez partout avec une fourchette, puis étalez la viande hachée sur la pâte pour qu''elle soit recouverte d''une fine couche en laissant une bordure de 1 cm sur les bords. Mettre au frais 20 min.","Étalez la pâte d''amande sur un plan de travail saupoudré de sucre glace jusqu''à obtenir un rectangle d''environ 30 x 21 cm et environ 2 mm d''épaisseur. Drapez-le sur le rouleau à pâtisserie et déposez-le sur la pâte, au-dessus de la couche de viande hachée. Il doit être parfaitement placé au milieu de la pâte, à l''intérieur du bord. Réfrigérer encore 20 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 avec une plaque à pâtisserie à l''intérieur. Épluchez et épépinez les pommes, mais conservez-les entières. À l''aide d''une mandoline ou d''un couteau bien aiguisé, coupez finement les pommes sur la largeur pour obtenir de fines rondelles de pomme. Disposez les rondelles de pomme sur la pâte d''amande en forme de spirale serrée et superposée qui va de l''extérieur vers le centre, ou en lignes superposées soignées. Parsemer de beurre et saupoudrer de sucre.","Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes soient dorées et caramélisées et que la pâte soit bien cuite. Servir en petites tranches avec de la crème fraîche. Se conserve, couvert, au réfrigérateur, jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:03:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10088,5179,'fr','Pain d''épices sans gluten','Profitez de notre version sans gluten du pain d''épices. Nous l''avons façonné en étoiles pour une friandise de Noël qui peut être offerte en cadeau ou utilisée pour décorer votre sapin.','["100g de beurre salé","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","100 g de sucre muscovado noir","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1½ cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","225 g de farine nature sans gluten","50g de sucre glace"]','["Dans une petite poêle, faites chauffer le beurre, le sirop et le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus, en remuant de temps en temps. Mettre de côté pour refroidir légèrement. Dans un grand bol, mélangez le bicarbonate, le gingembre, la cannelle et la farine. Versez le mélange de beurre fondu, mélangez et, à l''aide de vos mains, rassemblez pour former une pâte. Ce sera mou mais prendra au réfrigérateur.","Prenez 2 feuilles de papier sulfurisé, déposez la pâte sur l''une, façonnez-la en rectangle et placez l''autre feuille dessus. Abaissez la pâte sur 1/2 cm d''épaisseur et mettez à plat au réfrigérateur pendant 1 heure pour qu''elle prenne et raffermisse.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5 et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Sortez la pâte roulée du réfrigérateur et découpez-y des formes. Nous avons fait des étoiles de 9 cm, mais vous pouvez également choisir n''importe quelle forme, selon la taille il faudra quelques minutes de moins/plus au four. Nous en avons également fait avec des étoiles plus petites découpées au centre.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage, mélangez le sucre glace avec 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et fluide mais pas assez fin pour qu''il coule. Décorez les biscuits refroidis avec n''importe quel motif"]','2026-01-11 00:03:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10089,4046,'fr','Tarte aux oignons nouveaux, petits pois et pancetta','Essayez notre version salée d''une tarte feuilletée, composée de petits pois, d''œufs, d''herbes et de pancetta. Rapide et facile, il deviendra certainement un favori de toute la famille','["320 g de pâte feuilletée tout beurre déjà roulée","8 oignons nouveaux","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","100 g de pancetta fumée, coupée en cubes","200 g de fromage à pâte molle","une poignée de menthe, basilic, persil ou ciboulette (ou utilisez un mélange), hachés, plus des feuilles entières supplémentaires pour servir","1 jaune d''oeuf","25 g de parmesan finement râpé","1 grosse cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","100 g de petits pois surgelés, décongelés"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Dérouler la feuille de pâte feuilletée sur son papier sulfurisé et la glisser sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Tracez une bordure à environ 1 cm du bord tout autour de la pâte en prenant soin de ne pas couper complètement. Piquez le milieu partout avec une fourchette, puis enfournez pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé et doré. Versez les oignons nouveaux sur une petite plaque à pâtisserie, arrosez d''huile et assaisonnez. Faites-les rôtir à côté de la pâte pendant les 5 dernières minutes de cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire la pancetta dans une petite poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Mélangez le fromage à pâte molle, les herbes hachées, le jaune d''oeuf, la moitié du parmesan et la moutarde et assaisonnez bien. Écrasez délicatement le milieu du fond de tarte à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère, puis étalez-le sur le mélange de fromages à pâte molle. Répartir les petits pois décongelés et la pancetta sur le mélange de fromages à pâte molle, puis disposer les oignons nouveaux rôtis dessus. Saupoudrer du reste de parmesan et remettre au four 10 min. Parsemer du reste des herbes à feuilles entières, puis trancher et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10090,4066,'fr','Croquant au chocolat','Offrez-vous ces carrés croquants au chocolat chaque fois que vous avez besoin d''une friandise sucrée. Ils sont délicieux avec une tasse de thé ou de café','["170 g de beurre doux fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","170 g de sucre en poudre","225 g de farines autolevantes","25g de cacao en poudre","1 gros oeuf, battu","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre cristallisé"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule carré de 20 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mélanger le beurre fondu et la vanille dans un bol. Mélangez le sucre en poudre, la farine et le cacao dans un autre bol.","Versez le bol d''ingrédients humides dans le bol d''ingrédients secs et battez ensemble, puis ajoutez l''œuf et battez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Presser dans le moule préparé. Badigeonner le dessus d''eau et saupoudrer de sucre semoule.","Cuire au four pendant 30-35 minutes. Laisser refroidir légèrement dans le moule pendant 5 minutes avant de le couper en carrés et de le transférer sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:03:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10091,9183,'fr','Souris de sucre','Préparez ces souris en sucre au moins un jour avant de servir, afin qu''elles aient le temps de sécher. La recette donne 12 souris – assez pour une pour chacun des membres de votre famille et de vos amis !','["1 blanc d''oeuf","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","400-500 g de sucre glace tamisé","colorant alimentaire en gel ou en pâte rose","petites pépites de chocolat","ficelle de cuisine","bâton à cocktail","1 plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé"]','["Mettez le blanc d''œuf dans un grand bol et fouettez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit mousseux. Incorporer le jus de citron.","Incorporez progressivement le sucre glace avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien ferme, comme une pâte. Vous pouvez également saupoudrer le plan de travail d''un peu de sucre glace et pétrir le sucre dans le mélange jusqu''à obtenir la bonne consistance.","Divisez le mélange en deux. Ajoutez un point de colorant alimentaire rose sur une moitié, puis pétrissez pour répartir uniformément la couleur. Ajoutez un peu plus de colorant si vous souhaitez une couleur plus forte. Laissez la seconde moitié unie.","Cassez un morceau du mélange de la taille d''une noix et roulez-le en forme de cône arrondi, puis aplatissez un côté pour que la souris puisse s''asseoir sur une surface plane sans basculer. Pincez les petites oreilles au-dessus de l''extrémité étroite, puis pressez la même extrémité dans un nez. Pressez des pépites de chocolat sur le visage, sous les oreilles, pour faire les yeux. Coupez une longueur de ficelle de cuisine d''environ 4 cm de long et enfoncez-la dans l''extrémité ronde de la souris pour faire une queue.","Utilisez un bâton à cocktail pour tamponner une petite quantité de colorant alimentaire rose sur le nez, puis placez la souris sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé.","Répétez le processus avec les mélanges roses et blancs restants, puis laissez sécher les souris pendant au moins 12 heures."]','2026-01-11 00:03:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10092,9184,'fr','Biscuits au beurre norvégiens','Dégustez ces biscuits au beurre norvégiens traditionnels à Noël pour régaler votre famille et vos amis. Ils sont rapides à préparer et ont un goût délicieux','["300 g de farine ordinaire tamisée","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","200 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","125 g de sucre glace, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","2 cuillères à café de sucre infusé à la vanille ou de sucre en poudre doré","1 œuf, plus 1 blanc d''œuf légèrement battu pour le badigeonnage","sucre perlé, ou amandes effilées ou hachées, pour saupoudrer"]','["Mélangez la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel. Ajoutez le beurre et frottez avec les doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de grosses miettes. Incorporez tout le sucre glace et le sucre vanillé, puis ajoutez l''œuf entier et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, mais veillez à ne pas trop mélanger.","Transférez la pâte dans un sac alimentaire et mettez au réfrigérateur pendant environ 1 heure.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Rouler la pâte réfrigérée en environ 40 boules égales (environ 15 g chacune). Disposez les boules de pâte sur deux plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé, en laissant un espace entre chacune pour pouvoir les étaler. À l''aide du dos d''une fourchette, appuyez doucement sur les boules au milieu pour qu''elles s''étalent sur un diamètre d''environ 3 cm (elles s''étaleront davantage au fur et à mesure de la cuisson). Si vous préférez les cookies plats, utilisez le fond d''un verre.","Badigeonner les biscuits avec le blanc d''œuf battu et saupoudrer de sucre perlé ou d''amandes. Cuire au four pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste cuits (les biscuits ne doivent pas être entièrement dorés, juste légèrement dorés sur les bords). Retirer du four et transférer sur des grilles pour refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:03:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10093,5966,'fr','Muffins à la citrouille','Essayez ces muffins à la citrouille et aux épices à la cannelle faciles à préparer comme collation en milieu de matinée. Ils sont également idéaux pour Halloween et la nuit du feu de joie','["225 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle moulue (ou 2 cuillères à café d''épices de citrouille)","100 g de sucre en poudre","50 g de sucre roux clair et mou","200 g de purée de potiron (en conserve ou maison – voir « se marie bien avec » ci-dessous)","2 gros œufs","125 g de beurre légèrement salé fondu"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de moules à muffins. Mélangez la farine, la levure chimique, la cannelle et les deux sucres dans un grand bol. Brisez les morceaux de cassonade en les frottant entre vos doigts.","Fouetter la purée et les œufs dans un pichet, puis ajouter aux ingrédients secs avec le beurre fondu. Fouetter pendant 1 à 2 minutes avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés et qu''un cure-dent inséré en ressorte propre. Soulever sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conserve trois jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:03:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10094,6149,'fr','Chaussons aux pommes','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis ces chaussons aux pommes savoureux. Garnies de pommes et de cannelle enrobées de pâte feuilletée, elles sont délicieuses servies avec de la glace.','["2 pommes Bramley de taille moyenne, pelées, évidées et hachées grossièrement","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 pomme Gala ou pomme dessert sucrée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en dés de 1 cm","Paquet de 320 g de feuille de pâte feuilletée Jus-Rol™","2 cuillères à soupe de lait pour glacer","2 cuillères à café de sucre demerara"]','["Mettez la pomme Bramley, le sucre et la cannelle dans une petite casserole avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Couvrir avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter à feu doux pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pomme se décompose et se transforme en compote.","Incorporer le beurre et la pomme Gala et cuire encore 5 minutes, à découvert, jusqu''à ce que la pomme Gala soit juste tendre mais conservant sa forme et que l''excès d''eau se soit évaporé pour former une compote épaisse autour des morceaux de Gala. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Déroulez la feuille de pâte feuilletée Jus-Rol™ sur un plan de travail et coupez-la en 4 rectangles égaux. Répartissez la garniture aux pommes sur un côté de chacun des rectangles de pâte feuilletée en laissant une bordure de 1 cm. Badigeonner le bord de lait et rabattre le côté vide de la pâte sur la garniture et sertir ensemble. Badigeonner avec plus de lait et saupoudrer de sucre. Faites un petit trou de vapeur au milieu des chaussons.","Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier sulfurisé et cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et gonflés. Laisser refroidir 10 mn sur une grille (la garniture sera fondue à la sortie du four) avant de servir tiède avec une boule de glace vanille, ou de servir à température ambiante. Se conserve 2 jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:03:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10095,9185,'fr','Pain d''épices facile par excellence','Fabriquez des étoiles en pain d''épices à accrocher à votre sapin de Noël. Cette pâte à biscuits est extrêmement indulgente si elle est trop travaillée, elle est donc parfaite pour cuisiner avec des enfants','["100g de beurre salé","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","100 g de sucre muscovado noir","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","225 g de farine nature","50g de sucre glace"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre, le sirop et le sucre dans une petite poêle jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus, en remuant de temps en temps. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Mélangez le bicarbe, le gingembre, la cannelle et la farine dans un grand bol. Versez le mélange de sirop de beurre et mélangez, puis utilisez vos mains pour former une pâte. La pâte sera molle à ce stade, mais elle se raffermira au réfrigérateur.","Étalez la pâte sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé, formez un rectangle et posez une autre feuille de papier sulfurisé dessus. Etalez la pâte sur ½ cm d''épaisseur. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie pour le garder à plat, en laissant le papier sulfurisé en place, puis réfrigérer au réfrigérateur pendant 1 heure.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5 et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé supplémentaire. Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et découpez des formes à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce. Nous avons utilisé des étoiles de 9 cm, mais vous pouvez choisir n''importe quelle forme. Nous en avons également fabriqué avec des étoiles plus petites découpées au centre pour y passer un ruban et les suspendre à un sapin de Noël.","Disposez les formes étalées sur la plaque à pâtisserie tapissée et enfournez pendant 10 à 12 minutes. (Selon la taille des emporte-pièces que vous utilisez, ils peuvent nécessiter quelques minutes de plus ou moins de cuisson au four). Laisser refroidir complètement sur la plaque à pâtisserie.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sucre glace avec 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d’eau – vous voulez créer une consistance épaisse et fluide, et pas trop fine sinon elle coulera. Décorez les biscuits refroidis avec le glaçage à l''aide d''une poche à douille munie d''une douille fine. Découvrez comment réaliser une poche à douille."]','2026-01-11 00:03:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10096,4117,'fr','Muffins au citron faciles','Préparez une fournée de ces muffins faciles, arrosés d''un glaçage acidulé au citron, en utilisant une méthode tout-en-un. Ils sont parfaits pour les onze ou chaque fois que vous avez besoin d''une friandise sucrée','["100 g de beurre doux, ramolli","100 g de sucre en poudre","2 oeufs, battus","115 g de farines autolevantes","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 citrons, zestés et pressés","100g de yaourt","150g de sucre glace","1 citron, jus"]','["Tapisser un moule à muffins de grands moules à muffins. Chauffer le four à 180 C/160 C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Versez tous les ingrédients dans un grand bol et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois ou d''un fouet électrique. Versez des cuillères à soupe de pâte dans les moules à muffins jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient remplis aux trois quarts (vous pouvez en préparer jusqu''à 8, selon la taille du moule). Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. Tamisez le sucre glace dans un bol et ajoutez progressivement le jus de citron jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage épais mais versable – vous n''aurez peut-être pas besoin de tout le jus. Arroser les muffins refroidis et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10097,9186,'fr','Muffins aux œufs faciles','Préparez ces mini muffins aux œufs pour un petit-déjeuner ou un déjeuner facile avec les enfants. Ajoutez du jambon haché, du bacon ou du saumon fumé, si vous en avez envie','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","150 g de brocoli finement haché","1 poivron rouge, finement haché","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","6 gros œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","grosse pincée de paprika fumé","50 g de cheddar ou de gruyère râpé","une petite poignée de ciboulette hachée (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Badigeonner la moitié de l''huile dans un moule à muffins 8 trous. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle et ajoutez le brocoli, le poivron et les oignons nouveaux. Faire revenir 5 min. Laisser refroidir.","Battez les œufs avec le lait, le paprika fumé et la moitié du fromage dans un bol. Ajoutez les légumes cuits. Versez le mélange d''œufs dans les trous des muffins et garnissez chacun avec le reste du fromage et quelques ciboulette, si vous le souhaitez. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 17 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits."]','2026-01-11 00:03:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10098,9187,'fr','Crumble à la rhubarbe et aux pommes','Utilisez une surabondance de rhubarbe et de pommes pour ce simple crumble. Le gingembre moulu ajoute une belle épice à la garniture, mais laissez-le de côté si vous préférez','["450 g de rhubarbe coupée en tranches de 3 cm","350 g de pommes (Bramley ou Granny Smith fonctionnent bien), pelées et coupées en morceaux de 3 cm","1 gousse de vanille fendue ou 1 cuillère à café de pâte ou d''extrait de vanille","120 g de sucre en poudre doré","glace ou crème anglaise, pour servir","200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu (facultatif)","100 g de beurre salé froid haché","70 g de cassonade légère et molle"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger la rhubarbe, les pommes, la vanille et le sucre dans un plat allant au four et rôtir pendant 10 minutes.","Mélangez la farine et le gingembre, le cas échéant, ensemble dans un grand bol. Frottez le beurre du bout des doigts pour créer un mélange texturé de chapelure épaisse. Incorporer le sucre. Saupoudrer la garniture de crumble sur les fruits et cuire encore 30 à 35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit légèrement dorée. Servir avec de la glace ou de la crème anglaise."]','2026-01-11 00:03:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10099,9188,'fr','Mélanger et assortir les muffins aux crêpes','Oubliez de rester debout devant une plaque de cuisson à retourner des crêpes le jour des crêpes : préparez plutôt ces muffins aux crêpes moelleux. Ils sont simples à réaliser et les enfants adoreront aider','["huile de tournesol ou végétale, pour la boîte","350 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","50g de beurre","350 ml de lait","2 œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable, plus un peu pour servir","une poignée de framboises ou de myrtilles, ou un peu de chaque","½ banane, tranchée","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Huiler généreusement un moule à muffins de 12 trous en veillant à bien recouvrir tous les coins et les côtés à l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger la farine, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel dans un bol.","Faire fondre le beurre dans un bol au micro-ondes. Ajouter le lait, puis les œufs et le sirop d''érable, fouetter ensemble, puis verser dans les ingrédients secs et fouetter à nouveau pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Répartissez uniformément entre les trous de votre moule.","Garnir chaque muffin de quelques baies ou de tranches de banane. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Testez si les muffins sont cuits en enfonçant une brochette au centre de l''un d''entre eux. S’il ressort propre, ils sont prêts. Sinon, poursuivez la cuisson encore quelques minutes. Une fois cuit, laisser refroidir 5 minutes, puis démouler à l''aide d''un couteau à couverts. Empilez-le sur une assiette, saupoudrez de sucre glace et servez encore chaud avec beaucoup de sirop d''érable supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:03:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10100,9189,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits ultra simple','Ce gâteau aux fruits facile réalisé par l''une de nos plus jeunes lectrices, Bree Hamilton, est simple, utilise des ingrédients du placard et est parfait pour un remontant hivernal rapide.','["175 ml d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour graisser","100 g de sucre muscovado brun clair","2 oeufs, battus","225 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque","½ orange, jus","½ citron, jus","200 g de fruits secs mélangés","200g de confiture d''abricots","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer et tapisser le fond de deux moules à charnière de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé.","Mélangez l''huile et le sucre, ajoutez les œufs, la farine, la levure chimique, les épices et les jus, et mélangez soigneusement avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit versable et raisonnablement liquide. Incorporez délicatement les fruits, puis répartissez la pâte uniformément entre les moules. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre, puis laisser refroidir.","Une fois refroidis, démoulez les gâteaux et prenez-les en sandwich avec la confiture. Tamisez un peu de sucre glace dessus pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10101,9190,'fr','Gâteau bonhomme de neige fondant au lait malté','Tout le monde aime un Noël blanc et ce gâteau bonhomme de neige évoque ce sentiment de fête. Les enfants peuvent aider à décorer avec des boutons, du glaçage et des bâtonnets de chocolat.','["500 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","500 g de sucre en poudre doré","10 œufs","200 g de farine nature","200 g de yaourt nature entier","460 g de farines autolevantes","4 cuillères à soupe d''extrait de malt (ou 2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de vanille) (voir astuce ci-dessous)","1 cuillère à soupe de lait entier (ou 2 cuillères à soupe si vous utilisez de la pâte de vanille)","400 g de beurre doux, ramolli","700 g de sucre glace","2 cuillères à soupe d''extrait de malt (ou 1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de vanille)","1 cuillère à soupe de lait entier","100g de chocolat blanc","½ cuillère à café d''huile végétale","30 g de fondant noir","30 g de fondant orange vif","1 cheville en bois, coupée à la même longueur que le nez","2-3 boutons géants en chocolat","2 bâtonnets Mikado au chocolat blanc, pour les bras","2 moules à gâteau de 20 cm","Moule à cake hémisphère de 16 cm (voir astuce ci-dessous)","plateau à gâteau de 23 cm","plateau à gâteau de 16 cm","bouteille souple"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer deux moules à cake ronds de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Beurrez généreusement un moule à cake hémisphère de 16 cm et posez-le sur un ramequin posé sur une plaque à pâtisserie pour le maintenir stable.","Tout d’abord, fabriquez les éponges. À l''aide de batteurs électriques ou d''un batteur de table, battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Versez les œufs un à un en battant bien le mélange avant d''ajouter le suivant. Si le mélange commence à cailler, ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe de farine ordinaire. Incorporer le yaourt.","Mélangez les deux farines ensemble, en ajoutant 1/2 cuillère à café de sel et incorporez lentement à la pâte, suivi de l''extrait de malt (ou de la pâte de vanille) et du lait. Versez la moitié du mélange dans l''un des moules de 20 cm et répartissez la moitié restante entre l''autre moule de 20 cm et l''hémisphère de 16 cm. Cuire la plus petite quantité de pâte à gâteau dans le moule de 20 cm et le moule de 16 cm pendant 1 h, et la plus grande quantité pendant 1 h 20 ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent en ressorte propre lorsqu''il est inséré au milieu des gâteaux. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes avant de le démouler sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement. Peut être congelé à ce stade jusqu''à trois mois.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la crème au beurre en battant ensemble tout le beurre et la moitié du sucre glace à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou d''un batteur de table. Ajouter le reste du sucre glace une fois incorporé, suivi de l''extrait de malt (ou pâte de vanille) et du lait. Réserver jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser.","Pour assembler, coupez en deux le plus grand gâteau de 20 cm horizontalement afin de vous retrouver avec deux génoises de taille égale de la même taille que le gâteau de 20 cm restant. Déposez une goutte de crème au beurre sur un plateau à gâteau de 23 cm (ou un support à gâteau) et étalez-la à l''aide d''un couteau à palette. Collez une des éponges sur la planche. Étalez une épaisse couche de crème au beurre sur le gâteau et placez une autre génoise dessus. Étalez sur une autre couche épaisse et posez la dernière génoise dessus. À l''aide d''un couteau à palette, enduisez l''ensemble du gâteau d''une fine couche de crème au beurre et lissez soigneusement les côtés et le dessus, en travaillant tout autour du gâteau, en grattant tout excès de glaçage. Mettre au congélateur pendant 10 minutes ou au réfrigérateur pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris.","Pendant ce temps, placez la génoise hémisphère sur le petit plateau à gâteau et coupez-la en deux horizontalement. Remplissez le milieu avec un peu de crème au beurre, prenez en sandwich avec le dessus et enduisez tout le gâteau d''une fine couche de crème au beurre. Mettre au congélateur pendant 5 minutes ou au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes.","Sortez le plus gros gâteau du réfrigérateur/congélateur et enduisez-le d’une autre couche de crème au beurre. Faites attention lorsque vous couvrez cette fois, car vous voulez une finition lisse pour le gâteau. Passer le couteau à palette sous l''eau chaude permet de lisser les côtés une fois qu''il est complètement enduit. Refroidissez à nouveau 5 minutes au congélateur.","Recouvrir l''hémisphère de crème au beurre et lisser avec le couteau à palette. Soulevez délicatement l''hémisphère au centre du gâteau (le biscuit étant congelé, il ne faut pas laisser de traces de doigts). Appuyez légèrement pour fixer la crème au beurre. S''il y a un espace autour du bord, utilisez un petit couteau à palette pour combler le reste de crème au beurre. Réfrigérer 10 à 15 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, réalisez les yeux et le nez avec du fondant coloré. Roulez le fondant noir en deux boules pour les yeux et cinq boules plus petites pour la bouche. Roulez le fondant à l''orange en forme de carotte. Laissez prendre et durcir légèrement pendant que vous préparez la ganache qui coule.","Préparez la ganache en mélangeant le chocolat et l''huile et en passant au micro-ondes pendant 30 secondes, en remuant puis en lui laissant encore 30 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fondue. Transférer dans une bouteille souple, puis verser sur les bords du gâteau rond pour créer l''effet neige fondante.","Pour finir le gâteau, collez les yeux sur la tête avec un peu de crème au beurre restante. Enfoncez la cheville en bois dans le nez de la carotte, en laissant un peu dépasser pour la coller au visage. Collez les cinq petites boules de fondant noir pour la bouche et les boutons en chocolat sur le devant du gâteau pour les boutons. Insérez les bâtons Mikado de chaque côté pour les bras. Amener le gâteau à température ambiante avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:03:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10102,9191,'fr','Tartes pop aux pêches et melba','Ces tartes aux pois faciles sont remplies de saveurs et sont très amusantes à décorer pour les petits doigts.','["200g de framboises","Boîte de 410 g de tranches de pêches dans du jus de fruit, égouttées et hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","2 feuilles de pâte brisée de 320 g","1 œuf battu","150g de sucre glace","framboises ou pépites lyophilisées, facultatif"]','["Réservez 6 framboises charnues et versez le reste dans un bol. Ajouter les pêches et mélanger. Dans un petit bol, mélangez la maïzena et le miel pour obtenir une pâte, versez sur les fruits et mélangez.","Déroulez les feuilles de pâte et à l''aide d''une roulette à pizza, découpez 6 rectangles dans chacune d''entre elles. Retournez un morceau de pâte de manière à ce que le côté long soit le plus proche de vous et pliez-le en deux comme un livre, pour créer un pli au milieu. Ouvrez la pâte et déposez la garniture aux fruits sur un côté en laissant une bordure d''environ 1 cm sur le pourtour. Badigeonner l''œuf battu sur les bords et replier la pâte pour envelopper la garniture. Utilisez une fourchette pour sceller les bords tout autour, puis badigeonnez le tout avec plus d''œuf. Percez quelques trous d’aération sur le dessus avec la fourchette. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte et de la garniture. Disposez les tartes pop sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et réfrigérez pendant au moins 30 minutes ou jusqu''à 24 heures. Vous pouvez également le congeler jusqu''à 2 mois.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Cuire les tartes pop pendant 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée et que la garniture bouillonne à travers les trous. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir au moins 20 minutes. Si vous cuisinez surgelé, faites cuire au four pendant 5 minutes supplémentaires. Pendant ce temps, écrasez les framboises restantes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juteuses et mélangez-les avec le sucre glace pour obtenir un glaçage épais. Étalez finement sur les tartes et saupoudrez de framboises lyophilisées ou de pépites, si vous le souhaitez. Mangez tiède ou froid au petit-déjeuner ou arrosez de crème ou de crème pâtissière pour le dessert."]','2026-01-11 00:03:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10103,9192,'fr','Tarte PBJ Bakewell','Nous avons pris tout ce que nous aimons dans une tarte Bakewell et y avons ajouté une touche américaine avec du beurre de cacahuète et de la confiture ou de la « gelée », comme on l''appelle aux États-Unis !','["80 g de cacahuètes grillées non salées, plus 2 cuillères à soupe pour servir","100g de beurre de cacahuète","75 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","120 g de beurre ramolli","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 œuf, plus 1 blanc d''œuf (utiliser le jaune dans la pâte)","50 g de confiture de framboises, plus 2 cuillères à café pour servir","200 g de farine nature","4 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","130 g de beurre froid coupé en petits morceaux","1 jaune d''oeuf","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace, plus 5 cuillères à soupe pour le filet"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la pâte. Versez la farine, le cacao, le beurre et une pincée de sel dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine. Ajoutez le jaune d''œuf, le sucre glace et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide et mixez à nouveau jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent tout juste à s''agglutiner. Versez sur votre plan de travail (ne vous souciez pas du lavage du bol), pétrissez brièvement pour obtenir une boule de pâte lisse, puis aplatissez-la pour obtenir un disque épais, enveloppez-la dans du film alimentaire et placez-la au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes.","Ajoutez le reste des ingrédients – à l’exception de la confiture et des cacahuètes pour servir – au robot culinaire et mixez jusqu’à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse. Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.","Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et étalez-la jusqu''à obtenir l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Soulevez la pâte feuilletée dans un moule à tarte cannelé de 22 cm et pressez-la dans les coins en prenant soin de ne pas la déchirer. Coupez l''excédent de pâte avec des ciseaux en laissant un dépassement d''environ 1 cm. Tapisser de papier sulfurisé et de fèves au four et cuire au four pendant 15 minutes.","Retirez le papier sulfurisé et les haricots et remettez au four 5 minutes supplémentaires, jusqu''à ce qu''ils aient un aspect biscuité. Sortez du four et utilisez un petit couteau dentelé pour couper la pâte à la hauteur du moule. Jetez (ou grignotez) les chutes.","Versez la confiture sur le fond de la tarte et étalez-la jusqu''aux bords. Garnir avec le mélange d''arachides, en l''étalant sur les bords pour recouvrir la confiture. Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que la génoise soit cuite et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Écrasez le reste du sucre glace et de la confiture pour obtenir un glaçage lisse et arrosez-le en filet. Hachez grossièrement les cacahuètes restantes et répartissez-les. Les restes se conserveront dans un contenant hermétique pendant 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10104,9193,'fr','Muffins patate douce, avocat & feta','Utilisez des avocats très mûrs dans cette pâtisserie savoureuse, garnie de fromage friable, de morceaux de patate douce et d''un mélange de graines.','["1 patate douce (environ 200 g), pelée et coupée en petits morceaux","un filet d''huile sans saveur, comme de l''huile végétale ou de tournesol","1 gros avocat, pelé et dénoyauté, haché grossièrement (environ 150 g de poids préparé)","100 g d''amandes moulues","100 g de polenta fine","80 ml de sirop d''érable","3 gros œufs","1 ½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","100 ml de lait demi-écrémé","50 g de feta, émiettée, facultatif","2 cuillères à soupe de graines mélangées","1/4 cuillère à café de paprika doux"]','["Placez la patate douce dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, couvrez d''un film alimentaire et mettez au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très tendre. Laisser refroidir complètement. Graisser 9 trous d''un moule à muffins avec un peu d''huile (ou tapisser chaque trou d''un carré de papier sulfurisé.)","Coupez 1/4 de la patate douce en morceaux encore plus petits et réservez. Placez la patate douce, l''avocat, les amandes, la polenta, le sirop d''érable, les œufs, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude, le lait et 1/4 cuillère à café de sel dans le bol d''un robot culinaire. Mélanger jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement lisse. Répartir le mélange uniformément entre les trous des moules à muffins, puis garnir de patate douce hachée réservée, de feta, de graines et d''un saupoudrage de paprika. Cuire au four pendant 22 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé, doré sur le dessus et bien cuit – vérifiez en insérant un cure-dent au centre, il doit ressortir sec. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Conserver dans un récipient scellé jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10105,9194,'fr','Boucle rhubarbe','Cette boucle à la vanille et à la rhubarbe, un cousin plus brillant du traditionnel teatime cake américain, est parfaite pour les mois froids où la rhubarbe forcée brille','["50g de farine nature","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","50 g de beurre doux, réfrigéré","25 g de flocons d''avoine","225 g de rhubarbe finement écrasée, parée, rincée et coupée en morceaux de 2½ cm/1 po de long","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","le zeste d''1 orange","100 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","le zeste d''1 orange","2 gros œufs","200 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","125 ml de crème sure"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à gâteau rond de 20 cm de profondeur et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé.","Pour réaliser le crumble, mettez la farine, le sucre et le gingembre dans un bol et mélangez. Ajouter le beurre et frotter jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Incorporer les flocons d''avoine et, à l''aide de vos mains, former une pâte, envelopper dans un film alimentaire et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Mettez les morceaux de rhubarbe dans un bol avec le sucre et le zeste d''orange et mélangez. Réservez pendant que vous préparez la pâte à gâteau.","Mettez le beurre, le sucre et le zeste d''orange dans un grand bol et, à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battez ensemble jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse, environ 5 minutes. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant ensemble jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène avant d''ajouter le suivant.","Dans un autre bol, mélanger la farine, la levure chimique, la pâte de vanille et une pincée de sel et, en deux fois, incorporer au mélange de beurre en alternant avec la crème sure. Versez dans votre moule à cake et nivelez avec une spatule. Garnir du mélange de rhubarbe et terminer en cassant le crumble réfrigéré en morceaux de taille irrégulière et en le répartissant sur la rhubarbe. Cuire au four environ 1 h 10 ou jusqu''à ce que le crumble soit doré et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu du gâteau en ressorte propre. Vérifiez le gâteau après 1 heure – s''il colore trop rapidement, couvrez légèrement de papier d''aluminium pendant les 10 dernières minutes.","Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes avant de transférer délicatement sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conserve jusqu''à 3 jours dans un contenant hermétique, mais le crumble perdra un peu de sa texture après le premier jour."]','2026-01-11 00:04:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10106,9195,'fr','Plateau de chai à la noix de coco','Ce plateau simple est inspiré de l’une de nos bières préférées : le chai. Épicée de cannelle, de muscade et de cardamome, cette génoise moelleuse à la noix de coco accompagne parfaitement une tasse de thé.','["100 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour graisser","300 ml de lait de coco (non écrémé) – si la crème s''est séparée dans la boîte, mélangez-la bien avant de mesurer","4 gros œufs","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","280 g de sucre mou roux clair","250 g de farines autolevantes","75 g de noix de coco desséchée","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","¼ de muscade, finement râpée","¼ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","10 gousses de cardamome, graines enlevées et écrasées à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier","4 cuillères à soupe de sirop de gingembre","3-4 cuillères à soupe de lait de coco","140 g de sucre glace","2 boules de gingembre tige finement hachées","pistaches hachées et flocons de noix de coco (facultatif)"]','["Beurrer un moule à pâtisserie de 20 x 30 cm avec un peu d''huile et tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mesurer le lait de coco et l''huile dans un pichet. Cassez les œufs, ajoutez la vanille et fouettez à la fourchette pour mélanger.","Dans un grand bol, mélangez le sucre, la farine, la noix de coco, les épices et une pincée de sel. Pressez les morceaux de sucre entre vos doigts, en secouant le bol plusieurs fois pour qu''ils remontent à la surface. Versez les ingrédients humides et utilisez un grand fouet pour mélanger jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Verser dans le moule en grattant chaque goutte du mélange du bol avec une spatule.","Cuire au milieu du four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. S''il y a du mélange humide qui s''y accroche, faites cuire encore 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir 15 minutes dans le moule, puis transférer sur une grille et arroser de sirop de gingembre.","Pour faire le glaçage, mélangez le lait de coco avec le sucre glace jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Versez le glaçage sur le gâteau en gribouillis, puis parsemez de gingembre haché, de pistaches et de flocons de noix de coco, le cas échéant. A manger tiède ou froid. Se conserve 3 jours dans une boite hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:04:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10107,9196,'fr','Muffins Bakewell aux bleuets','Ces muffins aux myrtilles faciles à préparer ont un centre délicieusement confituré et une garniture croustillante en crumble : une délicieuse gâterie pour l''heure du thé ou un panier-repas.','["100 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus 1 cuillère à soupe fondue pour graisser","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 gros œufs","140g de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","250 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","125 g de myrtilles en paquet (ou surgelées)","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara","1/4 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","3 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées, hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre froid coupé en dés","12 cuillères à café de confiture de myrtilles sauvages (j''ai utilisé de la confiture de myrtilles sauvages Felix, disponible sur ocado.com)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6 et tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de caissettes en papier. Mettez tous les ingrédients de la garniture, sauf la confiture, dans un bol et frottez ensemble.","Battre le beurre et le sucre en poudre ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Ajouter les œufs et battre pendant 1 min, puis incorporer le yaourt, les extraits et le lait. Mélangez la farine, la levure chimique et le bicarbe dans un bol avec 1/4 cuillère à café de sel fin, puis versez-le dans les ingrédients humides et incorporez. Enfin, incorporez les myrtilles et répartissez le mélange dans les moules à muffins. Garnir chaque muffin d''1 cuillère à café de confiture de myrtilles, puis répartir sur le mélange de crumble.","Cuire au four pendant 5 minutes, puis réduire le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et cuire encore 15 à 18 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et doré, et qu''un bâton à cocktail inséré en ressorte avec juste de la confiture dessus – pas de mélange de gâteau humide.","Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis retirer délicatement sur une grille pour terminer le refroidissement. Se conserve 3 à 4 jours dans un contenant hermétique – après un jour ou deux, mettez-les au micro-ondes pendant 10 à 15 secondes à puissance élevée pour les rafraîchir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10108,9197,'fr','Sandwichs aux biscuits au gingembre et au mascarpone au citron','Sandwich aux biscuits au gingembre avec une garniture crémeuse et piquante pour préparer ces friandises sans gluten à l''heure du thé, aromatiques avec des épices hivernales – clous de girofle, muscade et cardamome.','["100 g de beurre doux, fondu","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","25 g de mélasse noire","1 gros œuf","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","175 g de mélange de farine sans gluten (j''ai utilisé Doves Farm)","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","½ cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu","¼ cuillère à café de muscade moulue","¼ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","¼ cuillère à café de cardamome moulue (les graines de 3 gousses écrasées – voir astuce)","75 g de sucre Demerara, pour enrober","175 g de mascarpone","Error 504 (Server Error)!!1504.That’s an error.There was an error. Please try again later.That’s all we know."]','["Pour faire les biscuits, mettez le beurre, les sucres, la mélasse, l''œuf et la vanille dans un grand bol et mélangez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse et homogène. Dans un autre bol, mélanger le reste des ingrédients sauf le demerara. Ajouter les ingrédients secs au mélange d''œufs et mélanger jusqu''à l''obtention d''une pâte très collante. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer au moins 4 heures.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Roulez la pâte à biscuits en boules d''environ une cuillère à soupe, puis roulez-les dans le sucre demerara. Placer sur les plaques tapissées en laissant un espace d''environ 2,5 cm entre les biscuits.","Cuire au four environ 14 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient légèrement dorés, en échangeant les plaques à mi-cuisson. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques pendant 10 minutes avant de transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pour préparer la garniture, battez ensemble le mascarpone et la crème de citron dans un bol jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse. Transférer dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille ronde unie. Versez une couche de crème sur la base de la moitié des biscuits et sandwichez-la avec l''autre moitié. Se conserve 3 à 4 jours dans un récipient fermé au réfrigérateur – la texture deviendra douce et pâteuse (ce n’est pas une mauvaise chose)."]','2026-01-11 00:04:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10109,9198,'fr','Gâteau à l''orange et à la coriandre','Cette pâtisserie fruitée contient une orange entière fouettée et ajoutée à la pâte pour une gâterie piquante à l''heure du thé.','["1 grosse orange","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de coriandre","50 g de polenta","175 g de beurre ramolli","150 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 œufs","1 orange","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","100g de sucre glace"]','["Pour faire le gâteau, mettez l''orange dans une casserole, couvrez d''eau, portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que vous puissiez facilement percer l''orange avec un couteau.","Égoutter, laisser refroidir, puis couper l''orange en quartiers. Coupez chaque quartier en deux pour obtenir 8 morceaux et retirez les pépins. Mettez 75 g de sucre dans une petite casserole et ajoutez 100 ml d''eau et les morceaux d''orange. Faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous, puis augmentez le feu et laissez mijoter 10 minutes. Laissez l''orange refroidir légèrement, puis mixez-la avec un mixeur plongeant ou liquéfiez-la en pulpe. Écrasez les graines de coriandre à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier ou d''un moulin à épices, puis ajoutez-les à la pulpe d''orange tiède avec la polenta. Remuer pour combiner, puis laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Beurrer et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à cake à fond mobile de 22 cm. Mettez le beurre, la farine, la levure chimique, les œufs et les 100 g de sucre en poudre restant dans un grand bol avec la pulpe d''orange refroidie. Mélanger jusqu''à homogénéité à l''aide d''un batteur électrique à main. Verser dans le moule préparé et cuire au four pendant 35 à 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit élastique au toucher – un cure-dent inséré au centre doit en ressortir propre. Le gâteau doit être de couleur pâle et dépasser à peine des parois du moule. Transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la décoration. À l''aide d''un épluche-pomme de terre, épluchez la moitié du zeste de l''orange en grosses lanières, puis coupez-le très finement pour avoir beaucoup de lambeaux de zeste d''orange (comme vous le feriez pour une marmelade). Mettez le sucre en poudre et 100 ml d''eau dans une petite casserole sur feu doux jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous, puis ajoutez les morceaux d''orange. Portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lambeaux soient bien tendres. Retirer à l''aide d''une écumoire et réserver sur une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé.","Une fois le gâteau refroidi, tamisez le sucre glace dans un petit bol. Pressez l''orange et ajoutez-en suffisamment au sucre glace pour obtenir un glaçage qui coule. Versez le glaçage sur le gâteau refroidi et répartissez les lamelles d''orange dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10110,9199,'fr','Flapjacks à la cannelle et aux noix de cajou','Préparez un lot de ces flapjacks moelleux à l''avoine, remplis de noix, de graines et de noix de coco desséchée – parfaits comme remontant l''après-midi','["140 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","140 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle moulue","140 g de flocons d''avoine","85 g de noix de coco desséchée","85g de graines de sésame","50g de graines de tournesol","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","85 g de noix de cajou ou de noix de pécan"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 20 x 30 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faites fondre le beurre dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez le sucre, le miel et la cannelle et remuez avec une cuillère en bois à feu doux pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve.","Retirer du feu et incorporer tous les ingrédients restants jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien enrobés du mélange d''épices au beurre. Versez dans le moule et appuyez pour obtenir une couche uniforme. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laissez refroidir pendant 5 minutes, puis marquez des carrés – ne les retirez pas encore du moule car ils ne tiendront pas ensemble tant qu''ils ne seront pas froids. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique pendant quelques jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10111,6155,'fr','Pouding à la cannelle, aux pommes et aux pacanes','Cela peut avoir un goût indulgent, mais cette pâtisserie fruitée à faible teneur en sucre est sucrée au xylitol et garnie de pacanes croquantes.','["85g de beurre ramolli","85 g de xylitol (nous avons utilisé Total Sweet)","125 g de farines autolevantes","25g de flocons d''avoine","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café bombée de levure chimique","2 gros œufs","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 pomme Bramley (environ 280 g), pelée, épépinée, un quart râpé, le reste coupé en dés","25 g de noix de pécan, hachées grossièrement ou cassées","Yaourt grec ou crème, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et graisser légèrement une tarte ou un plat à four de 1 litre (20 x 16 cm). Versez le beurre et le xylitol dans un bol avec la farine, les flocons d''avoine, la cannelle et la levure chimique. Cassez les œufs, ajoutez le lait, puis battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit homogène et lisse. Incorporer toute la pomme, puis gratter dans le plat, niveler le dessus et parsemer de noix de pécan.","Cuire au four pendant 35 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Servir avec du yaourt grec ou de la crème."]','2026-01-11 00:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10112,9200,'fr','Cookies aux pépites de chocolat malté','Essayez ces biscuits aux pépites de chocolat faciles et moelleux avec du lait malté – placez-les dans la boîte à biscuits ou le pot à biscuits jusqu''à 5 jours','["140 g de beurre ramolli","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de sucre roux clair et mou","2 œufs moyens","200 g de farine nature","175 g de poudre de boisson lactée maltée (nous avons utilisé Horlicks)","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g de tablette de chocolat noir haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre et les sucres dans un bol jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse, puis incorporer les œufs un à la fois.","Ajoutez la farine, la poudre de boisson lactée maltée, la levure chimique et une bonne pincée de sel, puis remuez avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte. Versez sur le plan de travail et pétrissez délicatement le chocolat. Divisez le mélange en 20 morceaux, à peu près de la taille d''une noix entière. Roulez chaque morceau en boule et placez-le sur les plaques à pâtisserie, en laissant suffisamment d''espace pour que les biscuits s''étalent. Aplatissez légèrement chaque boule avec la main.","Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords commencent à devenir dorés. Retirer du four, laisser refroidir légèrement sur la plaque à pâtisserie pendant 5 minutes puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. Se conserve dans un moule à gâteau ou un pot à biscuits jusqu''à 5 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10113,9201,'fr','Gâteau aux pommes et aux noix avec glaçage à la mélasse','Ce gâteau tout-en-un facile est parfait si vous avez des amis qui viennent prendre un café ou un thé l''après-midi','["300 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","140 g de cassonade foncée","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","250 ml d''huile de colza ou de tournesol","4 œufs","3 pommes non pelées, grossièrement râpées","100 g de noix hachées grossièrement","100 g de beurre ramolli","50 g de cassonade foncée et molle","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse noire","Pot de 200 g de fromage à pâte molle entière"]','["Chauffer le four à 150C/130C ventilateur/gaz 2. Ligne\r\ndeux moules à cake de 20 cm. Mettez la farine,\r\ncannelle et bicarbonate de soude dans un\r\ngrand bol, puis incorporer les sucres, en faisant\r\nbien sûr, il n''y a pas de grumeaux de sucre. Ajoutez le\r\nl''huile, les œufs et les pommes, et battez le tout\r\nensemble. Incorporer les noix puis diviser\r\nle mélange entre les moules et enfourner\r\npendant 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette en ressorte\r\npropre. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes au\r\npuis retirer et laisser refroidir complètement sur un\r\ngrille.","Pour le glaçage, battez tous les ingrédients\r\nensemble puis réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit\r\népais mais tartinable. Étalez la moitié du\r\ncerise sur un gâteau, un sandwich\r\navec l''autre et répartissez le reste\r\ncerise sur le dessus"]','2026-01-11 00:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10114,9202,'fr','Gâteau croquant aux fleurs de sureau','Capturez l''essence de l''été dans ce simple gâteau avec un filet de fleurs de sureau','["175 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs","140 g de farines autolevantes","85g d''amandes moulues","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 ml de lait","4 cuillères à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre cristallisé blanc ou doré"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à pain de 2 lb/900 g de\r\nune longue bande de papier sulfurisé. Faire\r\nla pâte à gâteau, battre le beurre et\r\nsucre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère\r\net moelleux. Incorporer les œufs, la farine,\r\namandes, levure chimique et lait\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser dans le moule et\r\ncuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés\r\net une brochette enfoncée au centre vient\r\npropre.","Dès que le gâteau est sorti\r\nau four, piquez le tout avec une pique à brochette.\r\nMélangez le cordial et le sucre supplémentaire,\r\npuis versez partout sur le gâteau. Refroidir dans le\r\nboîte de conserve, puis retirez-le délicatement pour le trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:04:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10115,9453,'fr','Gâteau Bakewell aux cerises','Si vous connaissez quelqu''un qui aime la Bakewelltart, alors il adorera ce gâteau : il est plein de saveur d''amande et pris en sandwich avec de la confiture de cerises.','["200 g de beurre bien ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g d''amandes moulues","100 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café d''extrait ou d''essence d''amande","4 gros œufs","½ pot de 340 g de confiture de griottes","175 g de sucre glace","5-6 cuillères à café d''eau ou de jus de citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''amandes effilées déjà grillées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4 et\r\nassurez-vous qu''il y a une étagère prête au milieu.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser les fonds de 2 ronds de 20 cm.\r\nmoules à sandwich avec du papier sulfurisé.","A l''aide de batteurs électriques, battre ensemble tous les\r\ningrédients du gâteau avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisser, puis verser dans les moules et niveler\r\nles sommets. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré\r\net élastique. N''ouvrez pas le four avant\r\n25 minutes de cuisson se sont écoulées.","Quand elles sont prêtes, laissez refroidir les éponges pendant\r\nquelques minutes, puis démoulez et laissez refroidir\r\ncomplètement sur une grille. Assurez-vous que le haut\r\nde l''un des gâteaux est tourné vers le haut comme vous le souhaitez\r\nune surface lisse pour le glaçage plus tard.","Une fois refroidi, déposez une génoise sur une portion\r\nassiette, puis tartiner de confiture. Sandwich le\r\ndeuxième éponge par dessus. Tamisez le sucre glace\r\ndans un grand bol. Ajouter l''eau ou le citron\r\njus, puis remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse et épaisse. Propagation\r\nuniformément sur le dessus et laissez-le couler sur le\r\ncôtés. Parsemer de noix et laisser prendre\r\npendant quelques minutes avant de couper."]','2026-01-11 00:04:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10116,9203,'fr','Plateau de cuisson cerises, chocolat et noix de coco','Conservez ces cinq ingrédients dans votre placard afin de pouvoir préparer un délicieux plat lorsque des amis passent à l''improviste.','["200 g de noix de coco desséchée","85 g de sucre en poudre","2 oeufs, battus","200 g de chocolat blanc en barre haché grossièrement","85 g de cerises glacées, coupées en deux"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nTapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de 20 x 30 cm de papier sulfurisé\r\nparchemin. Dans un grand bol, mélangez le\r\nnoix de coco desséchée, sucre, œufs,\r\nchocolat blanc et cerises glacées\r\njusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné. Cuire 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré et pris, puis refroidissez-le\r\nle moule avant de le couper en barres."]','2026-01-11 00:04:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10117,9204,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits d''été','Le délicieux gâteau de Sarah Cook est vraiment simple et polyvalent : utilisez le fruit de votre choix et vous le ferez encore et encore.','["2 gros œufs","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","175 g de fruits dénoyautés et coupés en dés","140g de sucre semoule","1-2 cuillères à soupe de jus d''agrumes - citron, citron vert ou orange","175 g de beurre très mou, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","250 g de farines autolevantes"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer un moule à pain de 900 g/2 lb et tapisser le\r\nbase et se termine par une longue bande de cuisson\r\nparchemin. Mettez le beurre, le sucre, la farine,\r\nœufs et extrait de vanille dans un grand bol\r\net battre avec un batteur électrique à main\r\npendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et crémeux – le\r\nle mélange sera très épais.","Étalez un tiers du mélange à gâteau dans\r\nle moule, puis répartissez-le sur 50 g de fruits.\r\nPointez soigneusement et étalez un autre tiers de\r\nle mélange à gâteau sur le dessus et parsemer de\r\nencore 50 g de fruit. Enfin, parsemez le reste de\r\nle mélange à gâteau et étalé délicatement avec\r\nle dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 1 heure, jusqu''à ce que\r\nune brochette insérée en ressort propre.","Piquez le gâteau partout avec une pique à brochette.\r\nMettez les 75 g de fruits restants dans un bol avec\r\nle sucre semoule. Incorporer 1 cuillère à soupe de\r\njus d''agrumes d''abord avec une fourchette, en écrasant un\r\nun peu de fruit au fur et à mesure. Si c''est un peu sec,\r\najoutez un peu plus de jus et versez dessus\r\nle gâteau. Laisser dans le moule jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit\r\nrefroidir et la garniture est prise et croustillante."]','2026-01-11 00:04:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10118,9205,'fr','Plateau de tarte aux framboises et au chocolat blanc','Le pud d''été parfait pour un déjeuner ou pour accompagner le thé de l''après-midi','["Paquet de 375 g de pâte brisée toute roulée","500 g de mascarpone","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g d''amandes moulues","2 gros œufs","250 g de framboises fraîches","100 g de chocolat blanc haché grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 160c/chaleur tournante 140c/gaz 4. étaler un peu plus la pâte sur un\r\nplan de travail fariné et utilisez-le pour tapisser un moule de 30 x 20 cm ou un moule à rouleau suisse. Ligne avec\r\npapier sulfurisé, remplir de fèves au bicarbonate de soude et cuire 10 min. Sortez le\r\nharicots et papier, puis remettre au four encore 5 minutes.","Fouetter ensemble le mascarpone, le sucre, les amandes et les œufs jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.\r\nmélangé. Incorporez les framboises et le chocolat, puis versez dans le moule. Cuire au four\r\npendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste pris et légèrement dorés. Éteignez le four, ouvrez le\r\nporte et laissez la plaque refroidir progressivement. Pour de meilleurs résultats, détendez-vous pendant\r\nau moins 1 heure avant de trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:04:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10119,8269,'fr','Gâteau aux noix, dattes et miel','Un régal à l’heure du thé – rempli de miel sucré. Une excellente façon d’utiliser aussi ces bananes mûres','["225 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","175g de beurre ramolli","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","3 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","2 oeufs, battus","2 bananes moyennes mûres, environ 250 g/9 oz de poids total dans leur peau","100 g de dattes dénoyautées","50 g de morceaux de noix"]','["Préchauffer le four à 160°C/Gaz 3/four ventilé 140°C. Tapisser le fond et les côtés longs d''un moule à pain de 900 g/2 lb de papier sulfurisé, en beurrant le moule et le papier.","Versez la farine, la cannelle, le beurre, le sucre, 2 cuillères à soupe de miel et les œufs dans un grand bol à mélanger. Écrasez les bananes, hachez les dattes (les ciseaux de cuisine sont le moyen le plus simple pour cela) et ajoutez-les au bol. Battre le mélange pendant 2-3 minutes, à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois ou d''un batteur à main, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Verser dans le moule préparé et niveler le dessus. Répartissez les morceaux de noix dessus. Cuire au four pendant 1 heure, puis appuyer légèrement sur le dessus – il sera ferme une fois cuit. Sinon, laissez cuire encore 10 minutes.","Laisser refroidir 15 minutes, puis démouler à l''aide du papier. Une fois froid, arrosez-le du reste de miel. Couper en tranches épaisses."]','2026-01-11 00:04:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10120,9206,'fr','Coupe glacée au chocolat et au beurre de cacahuète','Gagnez du temps et utilisez de la glace à la vanille du commerce pour préparer une superbe coupe glacée parfumée au beurre de cacahuète croquant et au chocolat noir.','["175 g de chocolat noir brisé","200 ml de crème fraîche","125 g de beurre de cacahuète croquant, fondu et refroidi","1kg de glace vanille","une poignée de cacahuètes grillées non salées, hachées, pour garnir"]','["Faites fondre ensemble 100 g de chocolat noir avec la crème et 75 g de beurre de cacahuète dans une petite casserole à feu doux en remuant jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et que la sauce épaississe. Si la sauce vous semble trop épaisse, vous pouvez ajouter un peu plus de crème double.","Faites fondre le reste du chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au micro-ondes par petites rafales. Ou faites-le sur une casserole d’eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l’eau.","Versez un peu de glace dans quatre verres à coupe glacée, puis arrosez de la moitié de la sauce. Répétez cette opération, puis garnissez chacun d’une autre boule de glace. Arroser de chocolat fondu qui doit prendre sur la glace froide. Répartir sur les cacahuètes hachées et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10121,7912,'fr','Ragoût de haricots au curry avec filet de noix de coco et coriandre','Tirez le meilleur parti d’un aliment de base du garde-manger – les haricots beurre – dans ce ragoût copieux et parfumé. Ils sont copieux, riches en protéines et peu coûteux également','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale, plus un filet","1 oignon , finement haché","2 cuillères à café de graines de moutarde noire ou brune","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","15 g de gingembre râpé","700 ml de lait de coco","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés","200 g de chou frisé, feuilles arrachées","20 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement","1 piment vert haché grossièrement (facultatif)","1 citron vert , zesté et pressé"]','["Mettez une grande casserole profonde avec un couvercle sur feu moyen. Une fois chaud, versez l’huile. Répartir l''oignon et cuire 8 à 10 minutes pour le ramollir. Ajoutez les graines de moutarde, les graines de coriandre, la poudre de curry, l''ail et le gingembre et faites cuire pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le parfum soit parfumé et que les graines commencent à grésiller et à éclater.","Versez 600 ml de lait de coco et portez à ébullition. Réduisez le feu à ébullition, puis versez les haricots. Laissez bouillonner 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C/gaz 4. Arroser la moitié du chou frisé d''huile et bien assaisonner de sel. Étaler sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit noirci et croustillant.","Pendant ce temps, mettez la coriandre, le reste du lait de coco, le piment vert, la moitié du jus de citron vert et une bonne pincée de sel dans le bol d''un petit robot culinaire, ou dans un bol profond si vous utilisez un mixeur plongeant. Blitz jusqu''à obtenir une consistance légère, puis réserver.","Incorporez le reste des feuilles de chou frisé aux haricots beurre, mettez un couvercle et laissez cuire 5 minutes. Une fois qu’ils sont tendres, ajoutez le reste du jus de citron vert. Répartir dans quatre bols, garnir de chou frisé croustillant, puis arroser de chutney de coriandre et d''une pincée de zeste de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:04:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10122,7914,'fr','Curry de courge au beurre de cacahuète','Préparez ce curry végétalien facile avec de la courge musquée et toute la saveur de la sauce satay. Garnir de coriandre, de piment et de cacahuètes et servir avec du riz','["6 gousses d''ail","3 tiges de citronnelle, écrasées et hachées grossièrement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de curcuma moulu","2 piments rouges, 1 haché grossièrement et 1 tranché pour servir (facultatif)","1 petit oignon , haché grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 courge butternut pelée, épépinée et coupée en morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","100 g de beurre de cacahuète onctueux","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","440 ml de lait de coco en boîte","250 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 citron vert, jus","coriandre , hachée","cacahuètes, hachées grossièrement (facultatif)","riz cuit"]','["Mélangez l''ail, la citronnelle, le gingembre, les épices, les piments, l''oignon et un grand peu d''eau dans un robot culinaire avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites cuire la pâte pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle se fend. Incorporer la courge pour l''enrober de pâte, puis incorporer le sucre, le beurre de cacahuète et la sauce soja et cuire jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Versez le lait de coco et le bouillon, portez à ébullition, assaisonnez et laissez mijoter pendant 30-35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre (continuez à vérifier car cela dépend de la courge – certaines mettent 15 minutes et d''autres 45 minutes) en remuant souvent. Éteignez le feu, ajoutez le jus de citron vert, puis parsemez de coriandre fraîche, de tranches de piment et de cacahuètes, si vous le souhaitez, et servez avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10123,7916,'fr','Lentilles Schmaltzy au poulet, olives et citron','La graisse de poulet dorée (schmaltz) ajoute de la saveur à la base de lentilles et de chou frisé de ce plat copieux. Cela fait un repas plus savoureux en milieu de semaine','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 poitrines de poulet avec la peau","1 oignon rouge, émincé finement","2 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","1 cuillère à café de sumac","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","500 ml de bouillon de poulet faible en sel","500 g de lentilles cuites, parfumées à la tomate si vous pouvez vous en procurer","125 g de chou frisé finement haché","1 citron, moitié tranché et moitié jus","50 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées et hachées grossièrement","une petite poignée de persil finement haché pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une cocotte ou une poêle à feu moyen-vif. Assaisonnez le poulet partout et ajoutez-le à la poêle, côté peau vers le bas. Cuire pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés et dorés, puis retourner et cuire pendant 2 à 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste dorés, ils n''ont pas besoin d''être bien cuits à ce stade. Retirer le poulet dans une assiette.","Incorporer l''oignon et l''ail dans la poêle à poulet. Cuire 2-3 minutes avant d''incorporer les épices. Cuire pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que ce soit parfumé, puis ajouter le bouillon de poulet en raclant le fond pour éliminer les morceaux dorés. Incorporer les lentilles, le chou frisé, les tranches de citron et les olives. Portez à ébullition, remettez les poitrines de poulet dedans, peau vers le haut et laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient réduites et que le poulet soit bien cuit. Assaisonner avec le jus de citron et un peu de poivre noir, puis garnir de persil pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10124,7918,'fr','Pâtes et brocolis violets aux anchois, ail et citron confit','Vous aimez les anchois ? Ce plat de pâtes est fait pour vous : la saveur salée se marie bien avec le brocoli violet riche en fer et est relevée par le piquant du citron.','["8 filets d''anchois finement hachés, plus 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile du bocal","100g de beurre","2 oignons rouges, coupés en deux et tranchés finement","4 gousses d''ail , tranchées finement","3 petits citrons confits, pépins et chair enlevés, peau finement hachée","400 g de pâtes trofie (ou autre petite forme de pâtes)","300 g de brocoli à germes violets","1 citron, jus","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive ou de colza","150 g de chapelure fraîche","1 citron , zesté","2 bonnes pincées de flocons de piment séchés"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire. Versez l''huile du pot d''anchois dans une grande poêle, faites chauffer à feu moyen. Ajoutez les anchois et remuez pendant quelques minutes pour les briser. Ajoutez le beurre dans la poêle en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu et mousseux, puis incorporez les oignons. Faites grésiller doucement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient tendres, puis ajoutez l''ail et le citron confit et remuez encore une minute.","Remplissez une grande casserole d''eau bouillante, salez et portez à ébullition. Ajouter les pâtes, cuire 5 minutes, puis verser le brocoli et cuire encore 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les pâtes soient cuites mais encore un peu croquantes. Prenez une tasse d''eau pour pâtes et réservez-la, puis égouttez les pâtes et le brocoli dans une passoire.","Pendant la cuisson des pâtes, faites chauffer l''huile pour la chapelure de piment dans une poêle et versez-y la chapelure. Remuez régulièrement jusqu''à ce que la chapelure soit dorée et croustillante, puis ajoutez le zeste de citron et les flocons de piment.","Versez les pâtes et le brocoli dans la sauce aux anchois et ajoutez un bon filet d''eau pour pâtes réservée et un filet de citron. Cuire quelques minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit soyeux et recouvre les pâtes. Vérifiez et rectifiez l''assaisonnement si nécessaire. Servir les pâtes parsemées de chapelure croustillante au piment."]','2026-01-11 00:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10125,7920,'fr','Tarte filo au curry','Préparez un lot de lentilles épicées puis utilisez-les comme base pour faire la garniture de cette tarte filo au curry et au chou-fleur. Parsemer de graines de nigelle pour servir','["1 petit chou-fleur, environ 800g","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","700 g de restes de lentilles en sauce noix de coco, feuille de curry et curcuma (voir étape 2)","2 cuillères à soupe de cornichon au citron vert","100 ml de crème double","150 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","270 g de pâte filo","25 g de beurre fondu","1 cuillère à café de graines de nigelle"]','["Jetez toutes les feuilles extérieures défraîchies du chou-fleur, puis coupez le chou-fleur en petits bouquets. Tranchez finement la tige et les feuilles également. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif. Incorporez tout le chou-fleur haché et les oignons nouveaux avec 100 ml d''eau chaude. Cuire pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et que l''eau se soit évaporée.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Incorporer les restes de lentilles, le cornichon au citron vert et la crème double. Portez à légère ébullition, puis retirez du feu et incorporez le fromage. Versez dans un plat allant au four (le nôtre faisait 20 x 30 cm) et étalez-le. Prenez chaque feuille de filo, déchirez et froissez légèrement un peu et parsemez le dessus de la garniture, en vous assurant que tout le dessus est couvert. Badigeonner de beurre fondu puis parsemer de graines de nigelle. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants."]','2026-01-11 00:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10126,7922,'fr','Queue de bœuf jamaïcaine','Faites cuire la queue de bœuf lentement et lentement dans cette recette pour qu''elle devienne magnifiquement tendre et qu''elle se détache des os. La saveur riche est rehaussée par les herbes et les épices','["2 oignons , hachés grossièrement","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés grossièrement","4 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre finement haché","12g de brins de thym, feuilles cueillies (voir astuce ci-dessous)","90 ml de sole de soja","1 kg de queue de bœuf, demandez à votre boucher de la couper en morceaux de 1 pouce d''épaisseur","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 piments Scotch Bonnet (ajoutez-en plus si vous préférez plus de piquant)","riz blanc cuit, ou riz et petits pois"]','["Versez les oignons, les oignons nouveaux, l''ail, le gingembre, le thym, la sauce soja, une grosse pincée de sel et 1 cuillère à café de poivre noir fraîchement moulu dans un bol. Bien mélanger et ajouter la queue de bœuf en la retournant pour l''enrober. Conserver au frais toute la nuit ou au moins 12 heures.","Au moment de cuire, retirez la queue de bœuf de la marinade (réservez la marinade), disposez-la dans une assiette et saupoudrez légèrement de maïzena. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole profonde ou une cocotte et saisissez chaque morceau de queue de bœuf des deux côtés, environ 2-3 minutes de chaque côté, en travaillant par lots. Réserver la queue de bœuf dans une assiette, puis verser la marinade réservée dans la casserole et cuire 2-3 minutes en raclant le fond avec une cuillère en bois pour libérer les morceaux dorés.","Remettez la queue de bœuf dans la poêle puis ajoutez suffisamment d''eau pour recouvrir juste la viande, environ 800 ml devraient suffire. Incorporer les scotch bonnets, puis porter à ébullition. Couvrir et cuire à feu doux pendant 2h30 – 3h jusqu''à ce que la viande se détache des os. Assaisonner au goût et servir avec du riz blanc cuit ou du riz et des petits pois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10127,7924,'fr','Boeuf d''intimidation jamaïcain','Savourez ce classique jamaïcain, également connu sous le nom de corned-beef. Le corned-beef est devenu un aliment de base en temps de guerre en raison de son prix abordable et de sa longue durée de conservation.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol, pour la friture","1 oignon , finement haché","1 oignon nouveau, émincé finement","2 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","2 branches entières de thym","½ piment scotch bonnet, épépiné et finement haché (vous pouvez l''ajuster en fonction de votre niveau d''épices)","1 grosse tomate, hachée","1 poivron , épépiné et finement haché","Boîte de 240 g de corned-beef","2 cuillères à soupe de ketchup","riz blanc cuit"]','["Dans une poêle, chauffer l''huile à feu moyen-doux. Une fois chaud, incorporez l''oignon, la ciboule, l''ail, le thym et le scotch bonnet. Cuire 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient légèrement ramollis. Ajoutez la tomate et le poivron et laissez cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout soit tendre.","Augmentez le feu à moyen-vif et ajoutez le corned-beef, en le brisant dans la poêle avec une cuillère en bois avant d''incorporer le ketchup et ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Cuire encore 6 minutes en remuant de temps en temps et servir avec du riz blanc cuit à la vapeur et des feuilles de thym pour garnir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10128,7926,'fr','Bol de riz aux pois chiches et aux arachides','Réalisez un bol de riz plein de texture grâce aux pois chiches et aux cacahuètes. Il peut être cuit au four ou à la friteuse et les restes conservés pour le déjeuner du lendemain','["2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés et séchés avec du papier absorbant","petit bouquet de coriandre finement hachée (conservez quelques feuilles entières supplémentaires pour servir, facultatif)","1 carotte coupée en allumettes (pas besoin de la peler)","½ concombre, les graines vidées et coupées en demi-lunes","½ chou rouge , finement râpé","400 g de riz brun, cuit","graines de sésame, oignons croustillants ou piment rouge tranché, pour servir","4 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète croquant","3 cuillères à café de sauce soja réduite en sel","1 citron vert, jus","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de piment (facultatif)","½ cuillère à café de sirop d''érable ou de miel au goût doux"]','["Chauffer le four ou la friteuse à 200C/190C ventilateur/gaz 6. Préparez la vinaigrette en mélangeant tous les ingrédients ensemble et assaisonnez légèrement. Versez les pois chiches sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée et mélangez-les avec la moitié de la vinaigrette. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés. Laisser refroidir 5 min.","Mélangez le reste de la vinaigrette avec suffisamment d''eau pour obtenir une consistance versable. Mélangez la coriandre hachée, la carotte, le concombre et le chou rouge dans un petit bol et assaisonnez légèrement.","Répartissez le riz dans des bols, garnissez du mélange de légumes et des pois chiches croustillants, puis répartissez-le sur les feuilles de coriandre, les graines de sésame, les oignons croustillants et les tranches de piment, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10129,7928,'fr','Cuisses de poulet à l''ail et couscous géant en une seule casserole','N''hésitez pas à remplacer le cavolo nero par du chou frisé dans ce plat de poulet, si vous le souhaitez. Il est accompagné d''une vinaigrette légère au persil, au zeste de citron et à l''huile d''olive.','["4 grosses cuisses de poulet avec la peau et l''os","1 oignon , tranché finement","200 g de cavolo nero, tiges finement hachées, feuilles grossièrement hachées","5 gousses d''ail, râpées","250 g de couscous géant","petit bouquet de persil finement haché","1 citron , zesté et pressé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Assaisonnez le poulet, puis déposez-le côté peau vers le bas dans une large poêle allant au four, d''environ 30 cm de large. Portez à feu moyen-doux, puis laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la peau soit dorée.","Transférez les cuisses de poulet dans une assiette (vous finirez de les cuire plus tard). Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Mettez les tiges d''oignon et de cavolo dans la poêle, assaisonnez et laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Incorporer l''ail et les feuilles de cavolo nero et cuire encore 3-4 minutes. Incorporer le couscous géant.","Versez 675 ml d''eau froide en remuant bien. Assaisonner, porter à ébullition, puis réduire le feu et remettre les cuisses de poulet dedans, peau vers le haut. Mettez au four pendant 18-20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le persil avec le zeste de citron, le jus et l''huile d''olive. Saison.","Sortez le poulet du four, laissez reposer 5 minutes, puis arrosez de vinaigrette et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10130,7930,'fr','Spaghettis aux tomates et aux sardines avec chapelure croustillante','Préparez ce plat rapide et plein de saveurs à base d''ingrédients du commerce','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","30 g de chapelure panko","1 oignon , finement tranché","300 g de spaghettis","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","2 boîtes de 120 g de sardines à la sauce tomate","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment (facultatif)","Boîte de 200 g de tomates concassées","25 g d''olives noires hachées grossièrement","1 citron, jus et zesté","petit bouquet de persil plat haché grossièrement"]','["Mettez une grande poêle sur feu moyen et versez-y 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive. Répartir la chapelure et cuire 4 à 5 minutes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et croustillante. Assaisonner et transférer dans un petit bol recouvert de papier absorbant.","Essuyez la poêle, versez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile restante, puis parsemez l''oignon et une pincée de sel. Cuire pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils ramollissent et soient dorés sur les bords. Faites cuire les spaghettis en suivant les instructions du paquet et égouttez-les en réservant un peu d''eau de cuisson.","Ajouter l''ail dans la poêle, cuire 1 min, puis verser les sardines et les flocons de piment, le cas échéant. Écrasez délicatement avec une cuillère en bois pour obtenir une sauce épaisse. Répartir les olives, le jus de citron et les spaghettis cuits, ainsi qu''un bon filet d''eau de cuisson des pâtes. Mélanger très soigneusement pour bien enrober.","Incorporer le persil haché, répartir dans les bols, puis saupoudrer de chapelure croustillante et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10131,7932,'fr','Boulettes de viande, pain à l''ail et pudding au beurre','Préparez vos propres boulettes de viande et faites-les cuire dans une riche sauce tomate avec des couches de pain au fromage et à l''ail. Une délicieuse version de la nourriture réconfortante classique','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café d''origan","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic hachées finement (réservez-en quelques-unes entières pour servir, si vous le souhaitez)","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 baguette à l''ail (environ 210 g), tranchée","125 g de boule de mozzerella de bufflonne, égouttée et déchirée en morceaux","salade verte, pour servir","50g de chapelure séchée","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","500 g de bœuf haché","1 petit oignon , finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées"]','["Pour préparer la sauce tomate, faites chauffer la moitié de l’huile dans un plat allant au four ou dans une poêle allant au four à feu moyen. Incorporer l''ail et laisser grésiller pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé, puis incorporer l''origan, le sucre, le basilic et les tomates hachées. Rincez les canettes avec un peu d''eau chacune, puis versez dans la casserole. Portez à ébullition, puis laissez bouillonner pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à épaississement et réduction. Assaisonner au goût.","Pendant ce temps, pour les boulettes de viande, mélangez la chapelure et le lait dans un grand bol et laissez reposer 5 minutes. Incorporer le bœuf haché, l''oignon, l''ail, l''œuf, le mélange d''herbes, ½ cuillère à café de sel et un peu de poivre. Façonner 20 boules, de la taille d''une balle de golf.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une deuxième poêle à feu moyen-vif. Ajouter les boulettes de viande et faire dorer partout. Une fois dorés, retirez-les dans une assiette (ils n’ont pas besoin d’être bien cuits à ce stade).","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez la moitié de la sauce tomate dans un plat allant au four, puis ajoutez le pain à l''ail en couches avec les boulettes de viande. Arroser du reste de sauce avec une cuillère et parsemer les morceaux de mozzarella. Arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive et assaisonner de poivre. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bouillonnant. Parsemer de quelques feuilles de basilic entières, si vous le souhaitez, et servir avec une grande salade verte bien garnie."]','2026-01-11 00:04:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10132,7934,'fr','Riz sauté au crabe au piment parfumé et poireaux croustillants','Transformez un dîner de semaine en quelque chose de plus spécial en utilisant du crabe provenant de sources durables et des poireaux frits croustillants. Arroser de sauce chili sriracha pour servir','["3 poireaux","huile de tournesol ou végétale, pour la friture","4 gousses d''ail, râpées","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre pelé et râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","1½ cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson","1½ cuillère à soupe de sriracha, plus un peu pour servir","500g de riz basmati ou au jasmin cuit","2 œufs , battus","100 g de chair de crabe blanche","1 citron vert, ½ pressé, ½ coupé en quartiers ou en joues pour servir","une petite poignée de coriandre, pour servir"]','["Coupez les poireaux en deux au centre, rincez-les sous l''eau froide pour éliminer toute saleté coincée entre les couches, puis émincez-les finement.","Faites chauffer suffisamment d''huile dans un wok ou une poêle à frire pour qu''elle remonte de quelques centimètres sur le côté. Faites chauffer l''huile à feu moyen pendant quelques minutes, puis déposez les extrémités vertes des poireaux dans l''huile chaude en prenant soin de ne pas éclabousser. Faites frire les poireaux pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants, puis utilisez une écumoire pour les transférer sur une feuille de papier absorbant. Assaisonner les poireaux croustillants avec du sel et réserver jusqu''au moment de servir.","Jetez toute l’huile de la poêle sauf 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe (conservez-la pour les futurs sautés). Ajoutez le reste des poireaux, l''ail et le gingembre et faites sauter à feu moyen pendant quelques minutes pour ramollir.","Mélangez le sucre, le soja, la sauce de poisson et la sriracha dans un bol. Ajouter à la poêle avec le riz cuit et faire revenir quelques minutes, jusqu''à ce que le riz soit brisé. Créez un espace au centre et ajoutez les œufs. Laisser reposer une minute, puis incorporer le riz.","Ajoutez la chair de crabe et le jus de citron vert. Servir parsemé de coriandre et de poireaux croustillants, avec des quartiers de citron vert et un supplément de sriracha en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:04:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10133,7938,'fr','Escalopes de poulet au kimchi','Servez ces escalopes de poulet savoureuses avec notre mayonnaise au kimchi percutante et du chou croustillant en accompagnement, ainsi que des quartiers de citron à presser dessus.','["4 poitrines de poulet","150 g de kimchi finement haché, plus 3 cuillères à soupe de saumure","2 œufs","50g de farine nature","150 g de chapelure fine blanche séchée","½ chou blanc , tranché finement","1,5 litre d''huile végétale","150 g de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","quartiers de citron, pour servir"]','["Papillonnez les poitrines de poulet en coupant la partie la plus épaisse de la poitrine, en vous arrêtant 1 cm avant le bord, puis en les ouvrant comme un livre. Couvrir d''une feuille de papier sulfurisé et, à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie, écraser chaque poitrine de poulet le plus finement possible. Transférer dans un récipient et verser sur la saumure de kimchi en retournant pour enrober. Réfrigérer pendant au moins 2 heures ou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Retirez les poitrines de poulet de la saumure et déposez-les sur une planche à découper propre. Salez légèrement les deux côtés du poulet et réservez. Versez la saumure dans un bol peu profond et incorporez les œufs en fouettant. Versez la farine et la chapelure dans deux bols peu profonds séparés. Tremper chaque poitrine de poulet d''abord dans la farine en pressant pour bien l''enrober, puis dans le mélange d''œufs et enfin dans la chapelure, puis bien presser à nouveau. Transférer sur une grille recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Pour congeler les escalopes, placez soigneusement la grille à plat au congélateur et congelez-la jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit solide, environ 5 heures. Transférer dans un récipient avec du papier sulfurisé entre chaque escalope. Se conserve congelé jusqu''à trois mois.","Le jour du service, mettez le chou dans un bol d''eau glacée et laissez reposer 10 min. Juste avant de servir, égouttez-le et séchez-le dans une essoreuse à salade pour le rendre croustillant, ou mettez-le dans un torchon propre et faites-le tourner pour l''essorer de la même manière.","Versez l''huile dans une casserole large et profonde (assurez-vous qu''elle n''est pas remplie à plus d''un tiers), faites chauffer à feu moyen et faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que quelques chapelure saupoudrées de grésillement et brunissent en 30 secondes environ. Déposez délicatement les escalopes dans l''huile chaude, une ou deux à la fois, selon la largeur de la poêle, et faites-les frire pendant 2 à 3 minutes de chaque côté ou 5 minutes de chaque côté lorsqu''elles sont congelées. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et réserver au chaud à four doux.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le kimchi, la mayonnaise et le vinaigre et assaisonnez au goût. Servir les escalopes avec la mayonnaise au kimchi et le chou croustillant en accompagnement, avec des quartiers de citron à presser dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:04:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10134,7940,'fr','Pud auto-sauce à la mijoteuse','Créez un régal pour votre famille et vos amis dans votre mijoteuse. La sauce au gingembre ajoutée signifie qu''elle promet d''être délicieusement moelleuse, mais vous pouvez la servir avec de la crème pour plus de gourmandise.','["100 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour la bassine","125 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 œufs","200 ml de lait","275 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1½ cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","crème double, pour servir (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","175 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu"]','["Faites chauffer la mijoteuse à puissance élevée pendant 20 minutes. Frottez soigneusement le bassin de votre mijoteuse avec du beurre. Réalisez le biscuit en mélangeant le beurre fondu avec les deux sucres, les œufs et le lait, puis incorporez la farine, la levure chimique, le gingembre et la cannelle. Fouettez pour éliminer les grumeaux si nécessaire, puis versez dans votre mijoteuse.","Pour la sauce, mélangez la maïzena avec 1 cuillère à café d''eau, puis réservez. Mélangez le sucre et le gingembre avec 350 ml d''eau bouillante jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Incorporer la pâte de maïzena, puis verser sur la pâte.","Cuire à puissance élevée pendant 1 h 30 à 2 h 30 (cela varie en fonction de votre mijoteuse), jusqu''à ce que l''éponge soit prise et ferme au toucher. Pour servir, versez un peu de crème fraîche, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10135,7942,'fr','Curry de noix de coco aux crevettes, pois et épinards avec riz au quinoa au micro-ondes','Essayez ce curry simple pour un dîner en famille. Il fournit sept points de plantes, beaucoup de fibres et deux de vos cinq par jour','["150 g de quinoa","150 g de riz basmati","1 petit oignon rouge , haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de gingembre finement haché","1 cuillère à café d''ail finement haché","3 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","300g de crème de coco","300 g de petits pois surgelés","300 g de cuisses","200 g de pousses d''épinards","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 citron vert, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Rincez et égouttez le quinoa et le riz dans une passoire trois fois pour éliminer l''excès d''amidon. Versez dans un très grand bol (pour éviter tout débordement au micro-ondes), puis versez 300 ml d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire, couvrez d''une assiette épaisse et mettez au micro-ondes à puissance maximale pendant 15 minutes. Laisser reposer encore couvert 5 min avant de remuer à la fourchette.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le curry. Dans une poêle à feu moyen, faire revenir l''oignon dans l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer. Ajoutez le cumin, le gingembre et l''ail et remuez pendant une minute. Incorporer la purée de tomates et cuire encore une minute.","Ajoutez la crème de coco, les petits pois, les crevettes, les épinards, le curcuma et le sel. Couvrir et cuire jusqu''à ce que les crevettes deviennent opaques et roses et que les épinards soient fanés, environ 5 minutes. Ajoutez un peu d''eau pour ajuster la consistance si nécessaire. Servir le curry sur le riz au quinoa avec un filet de citron vert frais, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10136,7944,'fr','Poulet orange','Servir les filets de poulet croustillants dans une sauce rapide à l''orange, sur un lit de laitue iceberg râpée','["1 oeuf , battu","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau","pincée de poivre blanc moulu","6 cuillères à soupe bombées de farine autolevante","4 cuillères à soupe bombées de maïzena","2-3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 orange, tranchée puis coupée en quartiers ou en deux","laitue iceberg râpée, riz basmati cuit à la vapeur et oignons nouveaux finement hachés, pour servir","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","4 cuillères à soupe de cordial orange double concentration"]','["Mélangez l''œuf battu avec une pincée de sel et le poivre blanc dans un bol. Coupez les poitrines de poulet en deux pour obtenir deux filets fins par poitrine, puis versez-les dans le bol et mélangez pour les enrober d''œuf.","Mélangez les deux farines avec une pincée de sel et versez sur une assiette. Retirez les filets de poulet de l''œuf, en laissant l''excédent s''égoutter, et plongez-les dans le mélange de farine jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement enrobés. Réserver dans une assiette.","Faites chauffer l''huile végétale dans une grande poêle à feu moyen (vous devrez ajouter suffisamment d''huile pour recouvrir le fond de la poêle) jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit scintillante, et faites revenir les filets de poulet enrobés pendant 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. (Vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots.) Mettez les filets de poulet cuits sur une grille posée sur du papier absorbant pour les égoutter. Les filets de poulet peuvent être frits jusqu''à la veille, refroidis et réfrigérés. Croustiller à nouveau dans un four ventilé/gaz 6 à 200°C/180°C pendant 8 à 10 minutes.","Pour préparer la sauce, mélangez la maïzena avec 2 cuillères à café d''eau. Versez le cordial et 150 ml d''eau dans une casserole moyenne, puis incorporez la pâte de maïzena en fouettant. Portez lentement à ébullition à feu doux en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à ce que le mélange devienne translucide et commence à épaissir. Si le goût est trop fort ou si la sauce est trop épaisse, ajoutez jusqu''à 50 ml d''eau supplémentaire. Ou, si vous souhaitez que la saveur soit plus intense, ajoutez plus de sirop d''orange, 1 cuillère à café à la fois.","Coupez les filets de poulet en lanières d''environ 1,5 à 2 cm de large, puis répartissez-les sur de la laitue iceberg râpée. Garnir de morceaux d''orange et verser sur la sauce, puis garnir d''oignons nouveaux et servir avec du riz basmati chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:04:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10137,7946,'fr','Poulet crémeux à la Marmite','Vous aimez la Marmite ? Essayez de le mélanger avec de la crème fraîche et du bouillon de poulet pour obtenir une sauce crémeuse pour les poitrines de poulet. Servir avec des légumes de saison et du quinoa ou de la purée','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 poitrines de poulet avec la peau","1 oignon , finement haché","3 gousses d''ail, râpées","½ cuillère à soupe de Marmite","200 ml de bouillon de poulet faible en sel","100g crème fraîche","10 g de parmesan finement râpé","Sachet de 240 g de légumes au micro-ondes","10 g de ciboulette finement hachée","quinoa ou purée, pour servir"]','["Versez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle à frire à feu moyen. Une fois chatoyantes, assaisonnez légèrement les poitrines de poulet, puis déposez-les dans la poêle, côté peau vers le bas. Cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la peau soit bien dorée, puis retourner et cuire de l''autre côté jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit presque cuite (elle sera cuite plus tard). Retirer de la poêle et réserver sur une assiette.","Versez le reste de l''huile dans la poêle, versez l''oignon et faites cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir. Ajouter l''ail et cuire 3 minutes.","Incorporez la Marmite, puis ajoutez le bouillon de volaille, la crème fraîche et le parmesan en mélangeant bien. Portez à ébullition, puis mettez le poulet dans la sauce, peau vers le haut. Cuire pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit.","Faites cuire les légumes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis saupoudrez de ciboulette sur le poulet et servez avec du quinoa ou de la purée et les légumes."]','2026-01-11 00:04:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10138,7948,'fr','Boulettes de viande et purée Stroganoff','Préparez une sauce stroganoff avec des champignons comme base et servez-la avec des boulettes de viande, de la purée et des épinards. Cela plaira certainement à tout le monde','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''ail, plus un peu pour le plateau","500 g de bœuf haché","1 oeuf","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature sans gluten","150 g de champignons , hachés","1½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1½ cuillère à café de moutarde complète ou de Dijon","½ cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","250 ml de bouillon de légumes sans gluten","80 g de crème sure","purée de pommes de terre et épinards fanés, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et huiler une plaque à pâtisserie. Mélangez le bœuf haché, l''œuf, 1 cuillère à soupe de farine et une pincée de sel et de poivre noir moulu dans un grand bol. Mettez autant de boulettes de viande que possible sur le plateau à l''aide d''une cuillère à glace, puis faites cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que les boulettes de viande soient uniformément dorées.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce. Faites chauffer l''huile d''ail dans une petite poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les champignons quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Incorporez le reste de la farine, le paprika, la moutarde et le concentré de tomates, puis mélangez pour bien enrober les champignons. Versez le bouillon, assaisonnez, puis laissez mijoter 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il épaississe légèrement. Réduisez le feu à doux et incorporez la crème sure. Cuire encore 1 minute, puis ajouter les boulettes de viande et remuer pour les enrober de sauce. Une fois complètement refroidies, elles se conserveront au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler toute la nuit au réfrigérateur, puis réchauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Servir les boulettes de viande et la sauce avec de la purée et des épinards flétris."]','2026-01-11 00:04:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10139,9207,'fr','Sandwichs à la crème glacée au beurre de cacahuète et à la gelée de beignets','Transformez un PB&J classique en un délicieux sandwich à la crème glacée au beignet : c''est amusant à préparer et fera le bonheur de tous','["200 ml de glace au beurre de cacahuète","4 beignets à la confiture du commerce","50 g de beurre de cacahuète onctueux","150 g de framboises, les plus grosses coupées en deux","30 g de mini coupes de beurre de cacahuète enrobées de chocolat, hachées grossièrement"]','["Sortez la glace du congélateur pour la ramollir pendant que vous préparez les beignets. Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Divisez les beignets en deux dans le sens de l''équateur et disposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie, côté coupé vers le haut. Faire griller sous le grill chaud pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le beurre de cacahuète dans une petite casserole à feu doux, en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu et détaché. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir 5 minutes.","Versez la glace ramollie sur les bases de beignets grillés, arrosez de beurre de cacahuète chaud, puis répartissez-la sur les framboises et les coupes de beurre de cacahuète hachées. Sandwich avec les beignets et servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:04:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10140,9208,'fr','Glace à la noix de coco','Préparez une glace végétalienne à la noix de coco crémeuse et rafraîchissante. Il peut être servi dans des cornets ou des bols et est excellent garni d''encore plus de noix de coco.','["400 g de lait de coco en boîte","400 g de crème de coco en boîte","150 g de sucre en poudre","50 g de glucose liquide","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","noix de coco râpée ou flocons de noix de coco grillés, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Versez tous les ingrédients, à l''exception des flocons de noix de coco, dans une casserole à feu doux-moyen et portez à ébullition. Cuire 1 min, puis retirer du feu et laisser refroidir complètement, environ 1 h.","Versez le mélange refroidi dans une machine à glace et barattez pendant 30 minutes à 1 heure, selon les instructions du fabricant. A ce stade, ce sera encore mou. Grattez la crème glacée barattée dans un récipient allant au congélateur ou dans un moule à pain et congelez-la pendant au moins 4 heures ou toute la nuit jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit suffisamment ferme pour être récupérée. Elle se conservera congelée jusqu''à trois mois. Servir dans des cornets ou des bols garnis de noix de coco râpée ou de flocons de noix de coco grillés, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10141,9209,'fr','Semifreddo fraise et fleur de sureau','Terminez votre menu d''été avec le parfait pudding en plein air – ce semifreddo est incroyablement facile à préparer mais a l''air si impressionnant','["500 g de fraises décortiquées et coupées en quartiers","50 g de sucre en poudre, plus 2 cuillères à soupe (facultatif)","6 cuillères à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau","300 ml de crème fraîche","300 ml de yaourt grec entier"]','["Tapisser un moule à cake d''1 litre de film alimentaire. Faites cuire 300 g de fraises avec les 50 g de sucre et 4 cuillères à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau pendant 8 à 10 minutes dans une petite poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que les fraises aient libéré un peu de leur liquide et qu''il ait un peu réduit. Laisser refroidir.","Fouetter la crème double jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous, puis incorporer le yaourt grec jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporez délicatement les fraises cuites au mélange de crème et de yaourt pour créer un effet d''entraînement. Versez le mélange dans le moule chemisé, puis égalisez délicatement avec le dos d''une cuillère. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et congeler pendant au moins 5 heures ou toute la nuit. Se conservera au congélateur jusqu''à un mois.","Pour servir, sortir du congélateur, démouler sur une assiette de service, retirer le film alimentaire et décongeler 20 minutes. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le reste des fraises avec le sirop de fleur de sureau restant, saupoudrez de 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre, le cas échéant, et empilez-les sur le semifreddo."]','2026-01-11 00:04:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10142,9210,'fr','Sauce caramel','Cette sauce caramel riche et crémeuse est une excellente façon de rehausser vos desserts préférés. C’est facile à préparer et c’est délicieux – essayez-le arrosé de glace à la vanille.','["50g de sucre semoule","50 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes","75 ml de lait entier","1 boîte de 397 g de lait concentré"]','["Mettez le sucre dans une grande casserole. Baissez le feu à température moyenne et faites fondre délicatement le sucre. Inclinez doucement la casserole pendant que le sucre fond, plutôt que de remuer, car il adhérerait à une cuillère ou une spatule.","Lorsque le sucre est fondu, ajoutez le beurre et incorporez-le au sucre. Cela va bouillonner, alors faites attention. Ajoutez ensuite le lait petit à petit en remuant continuellement.","Enfin, ajoutez la boîte de lait concentré et remuez bien jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement incorporé. Continuez à remuer pendant que le dulce de leche bouillonne et épaissit à feu moyen. Il faudra encore 5 à 10 minutes de cuisson. Il deviendra brun plus foncé et prendra une légère teinte rouge orangé à mesure qu''il s''assombrit. Il doit être suffisamment épais pour laisser un canal clair dans la poêle lorsqu''on y passe une cuillère, puis ajouter une pincée de sel. Il se raffermira en refroidissant. Le dulce de leche peut être conservé dans un bocal au réfrigérateur et se conservera jusqu''à un mois. Si vous ne le conservez pas dans un bocal, assurez-vous qu''il est couvert pour éviter la formation d''une peau."]','2026-01-11 00:04:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10143,9211,'fr','Glace au chocolat','Oubliez les ennuis des sorbetières et de la crème anglaise : cette glace au chocolat fondant n''a pas seulement un goût divin, elle est aussi facile à préparer à la maison.','["200 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao), coupé en petits morceaux","500 ml de crème fraîche","340 g de lait concentré sucré en boîte","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 cuillères à soupe de poudre de cacao biologique tamisée","50 g de pépites de chocolat au lait","flocons de sel marin, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites fondre le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau juste frémissante, en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau, ou faites-le au micro-ondes par rafales de 20 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit lisse et brillant. Laisser refroidir légèrement. Versez la crème, le lait concentré et la vanille dans un deuxième bol et battez pendant 3 minutes à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe légèrement et que les batteurs laissent une trace dans le mélange lorsqu''ils sont soulevés à travers le bol. Attention à ne pas trop fouetter, car vous ne voulez pas que le mélange soit trop ferme : dès que les batteurs laissent une trace, c''est prêt.","Incorporez délicatement le chocolat fondu et la poudre de cacao au mélange de crème jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, en veillant à ce que la spatule atteigne le fond du bol pour que tout le chocolat soit mélangé. Incorporez la plupart des pépites de chocolat en réservant une petite poignée. Versez le mélange dans un récipient allant au congélateur d''1 litre, puis répartissez-le sur les pépites de chocolat réservées. Couvrir et congeler pendant au moins 6 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme mais facile à ramasser. Se conservera au congélateur jusqu''à un mois. Pour servir, versez la glace dans des bols ou des cornets de glace réfrigérés et saupoudrez d''une pincée de sel marin, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10144,9212,'fr','Terrine de glace cheat''s framboise & chocolat noir','Essayez cette terrine facile pour le dessert, recouverte de glace, de chocolat noir et marbrée d''une purée de framboise piquante. Préparez-le à l''avance pour épater vos invités','["225g de framboises","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","½ citron, jus","400 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de vanille","275 g de lait concentré","200 g de chocolat noir fondu et légèrement refroidi, plus un peu pour le topping"]','["Tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g (le nôtre mesurait 9 x 20 x 7 cm) de deux feuilles de papier sulfurisé superposées, en laissant un peu dépasser de tous les côtés du moule. Mettez 175 g de framboises, le sucre semoule et le jus de citron dans une casserole sur feu moyen et laissez mijoter 3 min jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement ramollis. Versez dans un robot culinaire ou utilisez un mixeur plongeant pour mixer jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Fouetter la crème épaisse, la vanille et le lait concentré à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à formation de pics mous. Versez la purée de framboise, puis remuez délicatement plusieurs fois pour marbrer la framboise dans la crème.","Versez les framboises restantes dans le fond du moule tapissé. Couvrir avec un tiers du mélange de crème en l''étalant uniformément. Tapotez le moule sur une surface pour que le mélange recouvre les framboises. A l''aide d''une cuillère, arroser la moitié du chocolat fondu pour recouvrir la crème. Ajoutez un autre tiers du mélange de crème et étalez-le. Arroser du reste de chocolat et garnir du reste de crème.","Utilisez le papier sulfurisé qui dépasse pour recouvrir le dessus du moule, en utilisant davantage de papier sulfurisé s''il ne recouvre pas complètement la terrine, et congelez-le pendant au moins 8 heures, voire toute la nuit. Avant de servir, laissez reposer la glace à température ambiante pendant 10 minutes. Renversez et retirez du moule, puis arrosez d''un peu plus de chocolat fondu pour décorer. Faites couler de l''eau bouillante sur votre couteau, essuyez-le et coupez-le en tranches pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10145,6094,'fr','Yaourt glacé','Préparez ce yogourt glacé à déguster lors des chaudes journées d''été : il est faible en calories et plein de saveurs. Nous avons utilisé des fraises, mais vous pouvez l''essayer avec d''autres fruits.','["200-300 g de fraises (selon le fruité souhaité), décortiquées","300 g de yaourt grec ou à la grecque","3 cuillères à soupe de lait concentré"]','["Utilisez un robot culinaire ou un mixeur pour mixer les fraises pour un résultat final plus lisse, ou écrasez-les dans un bol à l''aide d''une fourchette pour obtenir des morceaux plus gros.","Versez le yaourt et le lait concentré dans le robot culinaire ou le mixeur avec les fraises et mélangez à nouveau.","Verser dans un récipient allant au congélateur et mettre au congélateur en remuant toutes les heures pour briser les cristaux de glace, puis laisser à nouveau congeler toute la nuit. Sortir du congélateur 10 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10146,9213,'fr','Barres « cheesecake » glacées aux bleuets et à la noix de coco','Ces friandises sucrées à la crème de noix de coco et aux baies sans gluten ni produits laitiers de Jenna Hope, lectrice du magazine BBC Good Food, sont entièrement crues.','["280 g de noix de cajou non salées","huile sans saveur, pour graisser","140 g d''amandes non salées","140 g de dattes dénoyautées","100g de crème de coco","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de coco fondue","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","jus ½ citron","140 g de myrtilles, plus une poignée","5 dattes dénoyautées"]','["Faites tremper les noix de cajou dans l’eau bouillante pendant 10 minutes, ou toute la nuit dans l’eau froide si vous avez le temps. Huiler légèrement un moule à cake carré de 20 x 20 cm.","Pour réaliser la base, mixez les amandes et les dattes au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient hachées très finement. Versez dans votre moule préparé et appuyez sur le mélange, en lissant avec le dos d''une cuillère jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément réparti sur la base. Mettez le moule au congélateur pour qu''il se raffermisse pendant que vous préparez la couche de « cheesecake ».","Égouttez les noix de cajou et mettez-en la moitié dans le robot culinaire. Ajoutez les ingrédients de la couche de « cheesecake » et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse. Sortez le moule du congélateur et étalez le mélange crémeux sur le fond. Remettre au congélateur pendant 30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme.","Pour réaliser le topping, mixez les 140 g de myrtilles et les dattes avec le reste des noix de cajou au robot culinaire. Sortez le moule du congélateur et versez-y la garniture, puis répartissez-la sur une poignée de myrtilles. Remettre au congélateur au moins 1 h pour raffermir. Peut être conservé au congélateur jusqu''à 2 mois. Sortez du congélateur 10 minutes avant de servir, puis coupez en 10 à 12 barres et dégustez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10147,9214,'fr','Yaourt glacé sablé aux fraises','Vous n''avez pas besoin de sorbetière pour préparer ce dessert glacé facile, garni de fraises lyophilisées et de biscuits écrasés.','["550 g de fraises décortiquées","Pot de 500 g de yaourt grec","397 g de lait concentré","2 cuillères à café de pâte ou d''extrait de gousse de vanille","200 ml de crème fraîche","8 biscuits sablés écrasés (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de morceaux de fraises lyophilisées (facultatif, disponible chez Waitrose, Sainsbury''s ou en ligne)"]','["Mettez 400 g de fraises dans un robot culinaire et mixez-les pour obtenir une purée lisse. Coupez les fraises restantes en petits morceaux et réservez. Ajoutez le yaourt, le lait concentré et la vanille dans le robot et mélangez à nouveau.","Versez la crème dans un bol et fouettez légèrement jusqu''à ce qu''elle tienne tout juste sa forme. Ajoutez environ un tiers du mélange de fraises, mélangez à l''aide d''une spatule, puis ajoutez le reste du mélange de fraises et les fraises hachées et mélangez à nouveau.","Versez la moitié dans un récipient allant au congélateur, répartissez sur la moitié des morceaux de sablés éventuellement et la moitié des fraises lyophilisées, puis recouvrez du reste du mélange yaourt, des sablés écrasés et des fraises lyophilisées. Congeler pendant au moins 4 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il soit solide. Retirer du congélateur 10 à 15 minutes avant de servir. Congeler jusqu''à 2 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10148,9215,'fr','Fantômes de banane congelés','Les bananes ont un goût effrayant de crème glacée crémeuse lorsqu''elles sont congelées dans des robes fantomatiques de chocolat blanc – rapide et facile, avec seulement 4 ingrédients','["200 g de chocolat blanc en barre (la marque belge du supermarché est bonne), brisée en morceaux","4 bananes mûres de taille moyenne","85 g de noix de coco desséchée (vous n''utiliserez pas tout)","une poignée de gouttes de chocolat noir"]','["Dans un petit bol, faites fondre doucement le chocolat au micro-ondes – par petites rafales à puissance élevée ou au-dessus d’une casserole d’eau frémissante (assurez-vous que le bol ne touche pas l’eau). Réservez un instant pendant que vous préparez les bananes.","Épluchez les bananes, coupez-les en deux et enfoncez un bâton de sucette au milieu de chaque morceau. Étalez la noix de coco dans un bol peu profond. Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et assurez-vous qu''il y a de la place pour la plaque dans le congélateur.","À l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie, enduisez une moitié de banane de chocolat en laissant égoutter l''excédent. Saupoudrez généreusement de noix de coco jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit enrobée, puis déposez-la sur la feuille préparée. Ajoutez maintenant deux yeux et une bouche en chocolat, et si vous le souhaitez, coupez également quelques petits sourcils avec les gouttes de chocolat. Congelez les sucettes pendant au moins 4 heures et jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:04:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10149,9216,'fr','Gâteau au yaourt glacé aux mûres et aux pommes','Des couches de yaourt glacé contrastent avec une base de biscuit à l''avoine dans cet impressionnant pud - une excellente alternative au cheesecake','["85 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre muscovado léger","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","200 g de biscuits Hobnob finement écrasés","1 grosse pomme Bramley (environ 350 g), pelée et hachée pour donner 250 g","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","450 g de mûres, plus quelques autres pour servir","2 boîtes de 400 g de lait concentré","750 g de yaourt grec entier (nous avons utilisé Total)","600 ml de crème fraîche","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre muscovado léger","1 cuillère à café de poudre d''arrow-root mélangée à 1 cuillère à café d''eau (facultatif)"]','["Beurrer et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à gâteau rond de 20 cm de profondeur avec du papier sulfurisé, en laissant 2,5 cm de papier sulfurisé dépasser au-dessus du bord, comme un collier. Dans une grande poêle, faire fondre le beurre avec le sucre. Mélangez la cannelle et les miettes de biscuits, puis incorporez-les au beurre et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à du sable humide. Pressez les miettes dans la base en une couche uniforme, puis congelez.","Mettez la pomme, le jus de citron et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau dans une grande casserole. Porter à ébullition, puis couvrir et cuire 3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient totalement tendres. Passer ce mélange pulpeux au tamis dans un grand bol. Laisser refroidir. Écrasez les mûres avec une fourchette, puis tamisez-les dans un autre bol – une spatule en caoutchouc est préférable pour presser jusqu''au dernier morceau de fruit des graines.","Mélangez le lait concentré, 500 g de yaourt et 300 ml de crème jusqu''à obtenir un mélange homogène. Versez-en 450 g sur la purée de pommes, ajoutez 1 à 4 cuillères à café de cannelle, puis fouettez avec un fouet ballon jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe légèrement. Verser sur la couche de biscuit, niveler, puis congeler pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à consistance ferme. Refroidissez le reste du mélange de yaourt au réfrigérateur.","Incorporer environ 3 cuillères à soupe de purée de mûres au reste du mélange de yaourt jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit rose pâle. Versez-en un tiers sur la couche de pomme, puis congelez jusqu''à consistance ferme. Répétez deux fois, en ajoutant suffisamment de fruits au mélange de yaourt pour rendre chaque couche légèrement plus rose que la précédente. Congeler toute la nuit ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit totalement solide. Peut être préparé 1 mois à l’avance, bien emballé au congélateur.","Au moment de servir, décongelez le reste de la purée de mûres, si elle est congelée. Portez à ébullition la purée, 1 à 4 cuillères à café de cannelle et 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre. Incorporer le mélange d''arrow-root jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement épaissi et brillant. (Arrowroot ne se congèle pas bien, alors ne congelez pas après ce point.) Laisser refroidir.","Sortez le gâteau du congélateur 10 minutes avant de servir. Retirer du moule après 5 minutes, retirer le papier et transférer dans une assiette. Fouettez ensemble les 300 ml de crème restants, 250 g de yaourt et 3 cuillères à soupe de sucre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit gonflé mais pas ferme. Verser sur le gâteau en pics et parsemer de quelques baies supplémentaires. Ajoutez un filet de sauce juste avant de servir et faites circuler le reste dans un pichet."]','2026-01-11 00:04:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10150,9217,'fr','Tarte alvéolée aux framboises surgelée','Une friandise sucrée remplie de glace, de nid d''abeille et de framboises pour satisfaire toutes les gourmandes.','["85 g de beurre fondu","Pot de 500 g de glace vanille","400g de framboises","150 g de nid d''abeille brisé","Pot de 150 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de sucre muscovado","75g de beurre"]','["Mettez les biscuits au caramel dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en miettes. Ajouter le beurre fondu et mélanger à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Utilisez les miettes de biscuit pour tapisser un moule à tarte cannelé profond de 22 cm, en pressant les miettes dans le fond et sur les côtés avec le dos d''une cuillère jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien compactes. Réfrigérez 30 minutes pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Sortez la glace du congélateur 20 minutes avant de l’utiliser. Versez les framboises dans un bol, en réservant une poignée, et écrasez-en légèrement environ la moitié avec le dos d''une fourchette jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juteuses. Une fois la glace ramollie, versez-la dans un autre bol et écrasez-la avec le dos d''une cuillère jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit souple mais pas totalement décongelée. Ajouter les framboises et la moitié du Honeycomb, puis onduler ensemble.","Sortez le fond de tarte du réfrigérateur et versez le mélange de glace à la framboise au centre en lissant jusqu''aux bords. Garnir avec les framboises et le nid d''abeilles réservés, en les enfonçant un peu dans la couche de crème glacée, puis congeler pendant 4 heures jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien congelés.","Pour réaliser une sauce caramel, mettez la crème, le sucre et le beurre dans une casserole avec une bonne pincée de sel et portez à ébullition. Faire bouillir 5 min jusqu''à obtenir la consistance du caramel, puis laisser refroidir 2 min avant de servir avec des tranches de tarte. Se conservera 1 semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:04:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10151,9218,'fr','Sucettes glacées au yogourt aux baies et au gingembre','Ces sucettes sont vraiment cool pour les clients – elles sont un croisement entre le cheesecake, le yaourt glacé et la glace aux fruits.','["100 g de biscuits au gingembre et aux noix","Boîte de 405 g de lait concentré léger","250g de fruits rouges, nous avons utilisé des fraises, des framboises et des groseilles","Pot de 500 g de yaourt grec nature 0 % de matière grasse","250g de baies violettes, nous avons utilisé des myrtilles, des mûres et du cassis","8 gobelets en papier","8 bâtonnets de sucettes en bois"]','["Placez les biscuits dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en miettes. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe de lait concentré et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que les miettes commencent à s''agglutiner. Répartissez les miettes de biscuit dans 8 gobelets en papier en appuyant avec le dos d''une cuillère. Assurez-vous de gratter jusqu''à la dernière miette, vous n''aurez alors pas à laver le processeur avant l''étape suivante.","Hachez grossièrement les grosses baies. Mettez la moitié des fruits rouges, la moitié du lait concentré restant et la moitié\r\nle yaourt dans le robot culinaire et mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Retirez la lame du robot et incorporez le reste des fruits rouges hachés. Répartissez le mélange dans 4 gobelets en papier. Répétez avec les baies violettes et le reste des ingrédients.","Placez un bâton de sucette dans chaque tasse, en poussant vers le bas dans la base du biscuit pour l''aider à tenir droit. Congeler au moins 4 heures avant de servir. Pour retirer les sucettes des tasses, renversez-les et pressez doucement la tasse jusqu''à ce que la sucette glisse."]','2026-01-11 00:04:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10152,9219,'fr','Yaourt glacé à la banane','Ce dessert glacé sans baratte est une excellente alternative à la crème glacée. Servir garni de chips de banane croquantes','["4 bananes trop mûres - plus elles sont noires, mieux c''est - environ 375 après pelage","Pot de 500 g de yaourt grec entier","175 g de lait concentré","grosse poignée de chips de banane"]','["Mélangez la chair des bananes, du yaourt et du lait concentré dans un robot culinaire ou un mélangeur jusqu''à consistance lisse. Grattez dans un récipient à crème glacée ou un moule à pain, ou répartissez-le dans des pots individuels.","Écrasez les chips de banane, si vous en utilisez, en les versant dans un sac alimentaire et en les frappant avec le bout d''un rouleau à pâtisserie – comme vous le feriez avec des biscuits pour une base de cheesecake. Mélangez le mélange de yaourt glacé, puis couvrez bien le ou les récipients d''un film alimentaire et congelez toute la nuit jusqu''à ce qu''il soit solide. Se conserve 3 mois au congélateur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10153,9220,'fr','Cheesecake glacé aux framboises et au chocolat blanc','Avec sa base biscuitée et son nappage crémeux, le cheesecake est toujours gagnant. Cette version glacée fruitée est un dessert parfait à préparer à l''avance pour recevoir','["200 ml de crème double","200 g de chocolat blanc en barre, cassé en morceaux, plus un peu pour servir","300 g de framboises, plus un peu pour servir","500 g de fromage frais","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","300 g de glace à la vanille ou au chocolat blanc – tout sera bon au goût, mais les glaces sans trop de morceaux sont préférables","175 g de biscuits croquants au beurre – nous avons utilisé Fox''s Butter Crinkle Crunch","140 g de noix de gingembre","140 g de beurre fondu"]','["Badigeonner un moule à pâtisserie de 20 x 30 cm avec un\r\nun peu d''huile, puis bien tapisser de deux couches de\r\nfilm alimentaire, laissant un surplomb pour le retrait\r\n– ou utilisez un moule à fond amovible. Mettez le\r\nbiscuits dans un robot culinaire et fouettez\r\nen miettes, puis verser le beurre fondu\r\net mélangez à nouveau. Pressez fermement les miettes\r\ndans le fond du moule préparé, puis\r\nréfrigérer pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Mettez la crème et le chocolat dans un petit\r\ncasserole. Faire fondre très doucement, en remuant, jusqu''à ce que non\r\nil reste des morceaux de chocolat. Nettoyer le\r\nrobot culinaire et ajoutez les framboises\r\net mélange crémeux au chocolat. Fouettez ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus rien\r\nplus lisse, puis passer au tamis pour\r\ndébarrassez-vous des graines de framboise.","Mettez le fromage frais dans un mixeur\r\nbol avec le sucre et le tamis\r\nmélange de framboises. Battre avec un\r\nfouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Laissez la glace ramollir dans un grand bol,\r\nmais pas fondre, puis incorporer la crème\r\nmélange de fromage petit à petit jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien mélangé et sans grumeaux de glace\r\nvisible. Grattez dans le moule préparé et nivelez le dessus. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire, non\r\nen le laissant toucher le dessus du cheesecake,\r\npuis congeler au moins toute la nuit ou plus\r\nà 3 mois avant de servir.","Pour servir, retirez le film alimentaire\r\nfilmer, retirer le cheesecake ou le faire glisser\r\nsi c''est dans une boîte à fond lâche. Supprimez tout\r\nfilm alimentaire restant. Décorer le dessus\r\navec des framboises fraîches et arroser de\r\nun peu plus de chocolat blanc fondu."]','2026-01-11 00:04:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10154,5986,'fr','Bâtonnets de fruits surgelés aux fruits de la passion et filet de citron vert','Par une journée chaude, vous serez heureux de cette collation fruitée et glacée, faible en gras et une excellente source de vitamine C - parfaite pour les enfants.','["100 g de fraises équeutées et coupées en deux","8 raisins sans pépins","100 g de morceaux de mangue","100 g de morceaux de melon","2 kiwis pelés et coupés en morceaux","100 g de morceaux d''ananas","jus de 2 citrons verts","4 fruits de la passion coupés en deux et les graines grattées","1 cuillère à café de sucre glace"]','["Mélanger les ingrédients du filet dans un\r\npetit bol, en remuant jusqu''à ce que le sucre\r\ns''est dissous. Si tu veux la sauce\r\npour qu''il soit lisse, passez-le dans un\r\ntamiser pour retirer les graines, ou laisser\r\nsi vous préférez.","Embrocher les fruits sur du bois\r\nbrochettes et arroser de sauce\r\ndessus, en réservant un peu pour tremper.\r\nMettez les brochettes au congélateur pendant\r\n45 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il commence tout juste à geler.\r\nServir avec le filet restant."]','2026-01-11 00:04:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10155,7721,'fr','Yaourt glacé au thé vert et éclats cassants de sésame','Le yaourt glacé est très facile à préparer et moins gras que la crème glacée. Vous pouvez trouver de la poudre de thé vert « matcha » dans les magasins de produits naturels.','["2 pots de 500 g de yaourt grec 2%","200 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de thé vert matcha","200 g de sucre en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Dans un grand bol à mélanger, fouettez le\r\nyaourt, sucre et poudre de matcha\r\njusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Couvrir et\r\nréfrigérer pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit très\r\nfroid. Verser dans une sorbetière\r\nen suivant les instructions du fabricant.\r\nGrattez dans un récipient congelable et\r\ncongeler pendant 4 à 5 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme.","Pour rendre le sésame cassant, tapissez un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie avec du papier sulfurisé.\r\nFaites chauffer le sucre dans une casserole moyenne.\r\nLaisser fondre, sans remuer, pendant environ\r\n5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il bouillonne et soit doré. Remuez le\r\ngraines de sésame dans le caramel léger,\r\nfaire bouillir quelques secondes, puis verser le mélange\r\nsur la plaque à pâtisserie, en l''étalant comme\r\nmince que possible. Une fois durci, frappez\r\nle cassant sur le comptoir pour craquer\r\nmorceaux. Peut être préparé 1 semaine à l''avance\r\net conservé dans une boîte hermétique.","Retirez le yaourt glacé du\r\ncongélateur 1 heure environ avant de servir, pour\r\nramollir légèrement. Verser dans des petits bols\r\navec le sésame cassant parsemé."]','2026-01-11 00:04:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10156,9221,'fr','Parfait glacé banane & praliné','Ce dessert de fête surgelé a un véritable effet époustouflant, il ne vous reste donc plus qu''à le présenter dans un style époustouflant.','["200 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de noisettes entières émondées","huile de tournesol, pour graisser","2 bananes mûres (la peau doit être très tachetée, mais ni meurtrie ni noire)","2 cuillères à café de jus de citron","300 ml de crème fraîche","2 blancs d''œufs","100 g de sucre en poudre","4 bananes mûres mais fermes","100 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Pour faire le praliné, mettez le sucre\r\ndans une poêle à fond épais avec 3 cuillères à soupe\r\nl''eau. Placer sur feu doux jusqu''à ce que\r\nle sucre est dissous et est clair. Ne remuez pas, sinon il cristallisera. Augmentation\r\nla chaleur et les bulles jusqu''à obtenir un caramel noir\r\n(voir technique vidéo), à propos\r\n5 minutes. Retirer du feu, remuer\r\nà travers les écrous, puis basculez-le légèrement\r\nplaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive graissée. Se propager à\r\nniveler et laisser refroidir. Soyez prudent car le\r\nle plateau deviendra très chaud.","Lorsque le praliné est froid et cassant,\r\ncassez-le en morceaux. Ensuite, en utilisant la fin\r\nd''un rouleau à pâtisserie, écrasez-le jusqu''à ce qu''il soit assez bien\r\nécrasé. Si cela s''avère un travail difficile, donnez un pourboire\r\ndans un robot culinaire et mélanger jusqu''à ce qu''il soit\r\nla texture d''une chapelure grossière.","Tapisser un moule à cake de 1,2 litre d''une bande de\r\npapier sulfurisé (ce moule de taille donne une forme soignée, mais vous pouvez placer le parfait dans n''importe quelle forme de moule, ou dans des bassines à pudding individuelles ou des ramequins). Dans un bol, écrasez le\r\nbananes avec la moitié du jus de citron jusqu''à ce que\r\nvous obtenez une purée grossière, puis réservez.","Mettez la crème dans un bol et fouettez\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il garde sa forme mais soit encore un peu\r\ndoux. Dans un autre bol très propre et\r\nà l''aide d''un fouet électrique bien propre, battre\r\nles blancs d''œufs en les pressant davantage\r\njus de citron jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme. Ajoutez lentement le\r\nsucre jusqu''à obtenir une consistance ferme et brillante\r\nmeringue.","Incorporez délicatement la chantilly et\r\nmeringue ensemble, puis ajoutez la banane\r\net la majeure partie du praliné, en laissant environ\r\n4 cuillères à soupe pour servir. Verser dans le moule à cake,\r\nlisser le dessus et congeler jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme,\r\nde préférence toute la nuit.","Pour servir, retirez le parfait du\r\ncongeler 10 min avant de servir et laisser\r\nau réfrigérateur pour ramollir légèrement. Pendant ce temps,\r\ntrancher les bananes en biais, en laissant\r\n3 tranches pour chaque portion. Disposez les tranches\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie posée sur une planche de bois\r\net saupoudrer généreusement de sucre. Utilisez un\r\nau chalumeau pour caraméliser la banane, puis réserver. Soyez très\r\nsoyez prudent car le plateau sera extrêmement chaud. Si vous n''avez pas de chalumeau, placez les tranches dans une poêle chaude et sèche et saisissez les côtés enrobés de sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient caramélisés. Soulevez-les et retournez-les sur un plateau.","Pour dresser l''assiette, saupoudrez d''un joli trait de praliné\r\njuste décentré sur chaque assiette. Disposez les tranches de caramélisées\r\nbanane sous des angles opposés. Démoulez le parfait, puis utilisez un\r\ncouteau réchauffé pour nettoyer les côtés\r\net coupez-le en tranches de l''épaisseur d''un doigt. Poser la tranche à l''opposé\r\ncôté de l''assiette à la banane\r\net servez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:04:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10157,5998,'fr','Yaourt glacé instantané aux petits fruits','Trois ingrédients et deux minutes suffisent pour préparer ce yaourt faible en gras et en calories, idéal à manger après l''exercice ou une longue journée d''apprentissage à l''école.','["250 g de baies mélangées surgelées","250 g de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","1 cuillère à soupe de miel ou de sirop d''agave"]','["Mélangez les baies, le yaourt et le miel ou le sirop d''agave dans un robot culinaire pendant 20 secondes, jusqu''à obtenir une texture de crème glacée onctueuse. Verser dans des bols et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10158,5547,'fr','Yaourt glacé aux fraises','Le magnifique yaourt glacé de Sarah Cook est intensément fruité et vraiment crémeux… mais totalement sans gras !','["140g de fraises","½ boîte de 405 g de lait concentré léger","Pot de 500 g de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse"]','["Hachez grossièrement la moitié des fraises et réduisez le reste en purée au robot culinaire ou au mixeur plongeant.","Dans un grand bol, incorporez le lait concentré à la purée de fraises, puis incorporez délicatement le yaourt jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporez les fraises hachées.","Grattez le mélange dans un moule à pain ou un récipient, mettez le couvercle ou bien enveloppez-le dans un film alimentaire et congelez toute la nuit, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit solide. Sortez du congélateur environ 10 à 15 minutes avant de servir le yaourt glacé. Peut être congelé jusqu''à 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10159,9222,'fr','Fou de mûres congelées','Se situant quelque part entre une glace et un syllabub, ce dessert aux baies est saisonnier et spectaculaire.','["300g de mûres","jus d''1 citron","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","300 ml de crème fraîche","biscuits sablés, pour servir"]','["Écrasez la plupart des mûres avec le\r\nle jus de citron et la moitié du sucre. Fouet\r\nla crème avec le sucre restant.\r\nIncorporer la chantilly et la mûre\r\nmélanger pour obtenir une crème mauve,\r\npuis versez-le dans un récipient de congélation et\r\ncongeler jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris. Servir en boules dans\r\nverres, avec les sablés et\r\nles mûres restantes à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:04:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10160,9223,'fr','Cheesecake surgelé à la banane et au beurre de cacahuète','Un excellent dessert d''attente qui fonctionne bien et impressionnera les enfants et les adultes.','["3 petites bananes","50 g de beurre fondu","10 biscuits digestifs réduits en miettes","Pot de 142 ml de crème double","140 g de sucre glace","Pot de 400 g de fromage à pâte molle","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","237 g de beurre de cacahuète croquant en pot"]','["Quelques heures avant, placez 2 bananes au congélateur jusqu''à ce que la peau noircisse, puis retirez-les et décongelez-les. Tu seras laissé\r\navec des bananes bien moelleuses. Peler, puis bien écraser et réserver.","Mélangez le beurre et les biscuits, puis pressez-les dans un moule à charnière de 22 cm. Fouettez la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle tienne à peine\r\nforme. Dans un autre bol, battre le sucre, le fromage à pâte molle et la vanille jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement mélangé. Dans un autre bol, battez le beurre de cacahuète pour le détendre.","Incorporez le mélange de fromage au beurre de cacahuète, puis versez la purée de banane et incorporez délicatement la crème. Étalez la préparation sur le fond biscuité et lissez le dessus. Congeler pendant plusieurs heures ou de préférence toute la nuit. Pour servir, laissez le gâteau au réfrigérateur pendant 20 minutes, puis passez un couteau sur les côtés et retirez les parois du moule. Tranchez la banane restante et utilisez-la pour décorer le cheesecake."]','2026-01-11 00:04:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10161,9224,'fr','Gâteau lumineux de Noël','Épatez vos invités avec notre garniture de gâteau de Noël lumineuse, composée de glaçage fondant et de dragées. Vous pouvez également utiliser des bonbons à la gelée, si vous le souhaitez.','["100 g de confiture d''abricots onctueuse","1 gâteau aux fruits de 20 cm","300 g de sucre glace + un peu pour saupoudrer","600 g de pâte d''amande","gel colorant alimentaire bleu","1 kg de glaçage fondant blanc prêt à rouler","gel colorant alimentaire vert","500 g de dragées colorées (voir astuce ci-dessous)"]','["Faites chauffer la confiture dans une petite casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''elle se détache. Badigeonner entièrement le gâteau aux fruits avec la moitié de la confiture. Saupoudrez légèrement un plan de travail de sucre glace, puis étalez la pâte d''amande en un cercle suffisamment grand pour recouvrir le dessus et les côtés du gâteau – elle doit avoir environ ½ cm d''épaisseur. Soulevez la pâte d''amande sur le gâteau à l''aide du rouleau à pâtisserie, puis lissez la pâte d''amande sur le côté et coupez tout excédent.","Ajoutez quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire bleu au glaçage fondant, puis pétrissez jusqu''à ce que le fondant soit mou et bleu pâle (voir astuce ci-dessous).","Badigeonner entièrement le gâteau recouvert de pâte d''amande avec le reste de la confiture. Étalez le fondant bleu en un cercle suffisamment grand pour couvrir le dessus et les côtés du gâteau, puis soulevez dessus à l''aide du rouleau à pâtisserie et lissez le côté. Coupez tout excès de fondant et lissez les marques avec la paume de votre main. Annuler.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau à la fois jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage épais et coulable (vous pouvez utiliser jusqu''à 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau). Répartissez le glaçage dans deux bols. Ajoutez quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire vert dans l''un des bols (en laissant un bol nature), mélangez, puis transférez dans un sac à douille équipé d''une buse ronde moyenne.","Tracez plusieurs fois des lignes ondulées de glaçage vert tout autour du dessus et des côtés du gâteau – ce sera le « fil » pour les guirlandes lumineuses. Utilisez la pointe d''un couteau ou d''une cuillère à café pour déposer une petite quantité de glaçage nature sur le dos des dragées, puis disposez-les le long du fil vert passepoilé de manière à ce que les amandes ressemblent à une guirlande lumineuse."]','2026-01-11 00:04:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10162,9225,'fr','Gâteau aux canneberges et aux noisettes','Un gâteau aux fruits polyvalent et léger avec une touche épicée et beaucoup de canneberges et de cerises juteuses – de la glace à volonté !','["200 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","100g de raisins secs","200g pot glacé cherry, halved","100 g de canneberges séchées","200 g de canneberges fraîches ou surgelées","le zeste et le jus d''une orange","50 ml de sherry, brandy, Disaronno ou Frangelico","250 g de cassonade légère et molle","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 gros œufs","200 g de farine autolevante","100 g d''amande moulue","100 g de noisettes grillées et hachées","1 cuillère à soupe d''épices mélangées"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. graisser un moule à gâteau profond de 20 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé – suffisamment haut pour arriver à 2,5 cm au-dessus du haut du moule. Mettez les raisins secs, les cerises, toutes les canneberges, le zeste et le jus d''orange et l''alcool dans une petite casserole. Porter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 3 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les canneberges aient un peu ramolli et que la majeure partie du liquide se soit évaporée. Laisser refroidir.","Mettez le sucre, le beurre et la vanille dans un bol et battez au batteur électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter les œufs, la farine, les amandes, les noisettes et le mélange d''épices. Fouettez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé, puis incorporez les fruits trempés et le jus restant. Versez la préparation à gâteau dans le moule et nivelez le dessus, puis enfournez pendant 1 h 20, jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent enfoncé au centre du gâteau en ressorte propre. Si la brochette contient du mélange à gâteau non cuit, remettez-la au four pendant 10 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir dans le moule. Se congèlera pendant 4 mois enveloppé dans du film alimentaire puis du papier aluminium."]','2026-01-11 00:04:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10163,9226,'fr','Gâteau de Noël qui convient à tous','Relookez le gâteau aux fruits de Noël classique avec de la cannelle, de la rose, de la fleur d''oranger et de la mangue tropicale pour un gâteau fruité et parfumé.','["zester 1 orange ou 2 clémentines, plus 100 m de jus","zester 2 citrons et 100 ml de jus","1 cuillère à soupe d''eau de fleur d''oranger","1 cuillère à café d''eau de rose","3 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","200g glacé cherries","200 g de zestes mélangés","200 g d''abricots secs coupés en dés","175 g de raisins secs dorés","140 g de canneberges séchées ou de griottes, ou un mélange","100 g de mangues séchées coupées en dés","280 g de beurre à température ambiante, plus un peu pour graisser","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","140 g de sucre muscovado léger","4 gros œufs, battus","250 g de farine nature","100 g d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''eau de fleur d''oranger","50 ml de jus d''orange"]','["Mélangez les zestes et jus d''orange et de citron, l''eau de fleur d''oranger, l''eau de rose et le miel dans un grand bol. Incorporer tous les fruits secs, couvrir et laisser tremper toute la nuit.","Le lendemain, chauffez le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrez et tapissez un moule à cake rond ou carré de 22 cm (pour un gâteau plus plat) ou un moule rond ou carré de 20 cm (pour un gâteau plus profond) de papier sulfurisé. Dans un autre grand bol, battre le beurre et les sucres avec un batteur électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Battez les œufs un à un, puis incorporez la farine, les amandes et la cannelle.","Versez les fruits trempés et le jus restant dans le bol et remuez. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et nivelez le dessus. Si vous souhaitez que votre gâteau soit plat plutôt que légèrement arrondi, plongez progressivement le centre du mélange avec le dos d''une cuillère en bois. Cuire au four 1h30, puis baisser le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1 et cuire encore 1h30 pour des gâteaux de 22 cm, ou 1h50 pour des gâteaux de 20 cm, jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent enfoncé au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule, posé sur une grille.","Pendant que le gâteau est encore chaud, mélangez les ingrédients de l''alimentation, poivrez le gâteau troué à l''aide d''une fine pique à brochette et versez-le dessus avec le liquide. Si vous préparez le gâteau à l’avance, nourrissez-le une fois par semaine pendant 4 semaines maximum. Conserver bien enveloppé dans du papier sulfurisé, dans un contenant hermétique, jusqu''à 1 mois. Si vous n’y parvenez pas, ce gâteau est tout aussi délicieux un jour ou deux après la cuisson."]','2026-01-11 00:04:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10164,5215,'fr','Gâteau aux clémentines fourré aux fruits','Un beau gâteau moelleux sans gluten, rempli de saveurs piquantes d''agrumes, merveilleux pour Noël','["4 petites clémentines","200 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","140g de raisins secs","140 g de raisins secs","140g de groseilles","100 g de cerises glacées, coupées en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe de cognac","200 g de cassonade foncée","3 œufs battus","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","pincer des clous de girofle moulus","140 g de polenta","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique (nous avons utilisé Fiddes Payne, qui est sans gluten)","sucre glace, pour décorer (la plupart sont sans gluten, mais vérifiez l''emballage)","100 g d''amandes moulues","4 clémentines","140 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Pour réaliser le gâteau, placez les clémentines dans une petite casserole, couvrez d''eau et portez à ébullition. Réduire le feu et laisser mijoter pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter et laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à charnière de 20 cm et tapisser le fond d''un disque de papier sulfurisé beurré. Coupez les clémentines cuites en deux et retirez les pépins. Placer dans le bol d''un robot culinaire et mélanger jusqu''à ce qu''il soit finement haché mais pas réduit en purée.","Mélanger les raisins secs, les raisins secs, les groseilles, les cerises et le cognac dans un bol. Ajoutez la pulpe de clémentine et mélangez bien. Crémer le\r\nle beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à pâleur. Ajoutez les œufs battus, petit à petit, en mélangeant bien entre chaque ajout. Dans un autre\r\nDans un bol, mélanger les épices, la poudre d''amandes, la polenta et la levure chimique. Incorporer au mélange crémeux avec les fruits secs et la pulpe de clémentine.","Verser dans le moule préparé et lisser le dessus. Cuire au milieu du four pendant 30 minutes. Réduisez la température du four à 160C/chaleur tournante 140C/gaz 3 et poursuivez la cuisson encore 40 mn. Vous devrez peut-être recouvrir le dessus du gâteau d''une feuille de papier sulfurisé pendant les 20 dernières minutes pour éviter qu''il ne brunisse trop rapidement. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 30 minutes avant de démouler sur une grille de refroidissement.","Pour réaliser le topping, coupez les clémentines en tranches sur 5 mm d''épaisseur. Versez le sucre dans une casserole avec 140 ml d''eau et faites cuire à feu doux en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Mettez les tranches de clémentines dans la poêle et remuez. Pour que les clémentines restent immergées dans le sirop, découpez un cercle de papier sulfurisé qui rentre dans la poêle et placez-le sur les fruits. Cuire à feu doux pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit brillant et translucide. Retirer et étaler sur du papier sulfurisé pour laisser refroidir.","Pour servir, saupoudrez tout le gâteau de sucre glace, puis disposez les tranches de clémentines en les superposant sur le dessus du gâteau."]','2026-01-11 00:04:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10165,9227,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits, aux noix et aux graines','Si vous n''aimez pas le glaçage et la pâte d''amande, faites plutôt cuire une couronne de noix grillées, de graines et de cerises juteuses sur votre gâteau.','["1 lot de mélange à gâteau aux fruits Hot Grog non cuit (voir lien ci-dessous)","Un plateau à gâteau fin de 20 cm (facultatif)","ruban large d''environ 65 cm de longueur","50g de beurre","50g de sirop doré","2 cuillères à soupe de grosses noix de cajou non salées","3 cuillères à soupe d''amandes entières blanchies","5 cuillères à soupe de pistaches décortiquées","25 g de noix du Brésil","85ml glacé cherries","50 g de canneberges séchées","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille"]','["Préparez le gâteau Hot Grog (voir lien à droite) dans un moule à fond amovible, en gardant environ 2 cuillères à soupe du mélange pour plus tard. Pendant la cuisson, faites cuire la garniture aux fruits et aux noix. Faire fondre le beurre et le sirop doré ensemble, puis mélanger avec les noix, les fruits secs et les graines. Annuler; le mélange de beurre commencera à refroidir et à épaissir.","Sortez le gâteau du four 30 min avant la fin de la cuisson, puis étalez délicatement sur le reste de la préparation à gâteau avec\r\nle dos d''une cuillère. Le gâteau sera encore assez mou mais prendra du poids, ne craignez pas qu’il coule. Répartissez le mélange de fruits et de noix sur le dessus en une couche uniforme. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes restantes jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit cuit et les noix dorées. Testez la cuisson en enfonçant une brochette dans la garniture et dans le gâteau. Si c''est pas assez cuit, mais que les noix sont dorées, couvrez simplement de papier d''aluminium et laissez reposer encore 10 minutes ; puis testez à nouveau.","Laissez le gâteau refroidir complètement dans le moule pour que la garniture aux noisettes se raffermisse. Détachez les bords visiblement collants, puis poussez le gâteau hors du moule par le bas. Transférer sur un plateau ou une assiette à gâteau et fixer le ruban autour de la base avant de servir. Peut être conservé dans une boîte hermétique jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:04:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10166,8505,'fr','Gâteau élégant avec couronne de baies','Simple, intelligent, mais toujours rassurant et traditionnel','["Paquet de 500 g de pâte d''amande naturelle","3 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots réchauffée et tamisée","400 g de sucre glace","2 blancs d''œufs","1 blanc d''oeuf","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","plusieurs brins d''eucalyptus (les variétés à feuilles plus petites sont plus belles)","beaucoup de feuilles de laurier fraîches, en brins si possible","100 g de canneberges, décongelées si congelées"]','["RÉALISER UN GÂTEAU EN FORME D''ANNEAU : Préparez la préparation à gâteau aux fruits Hot Grog (recette ci-contre), puis beurrez et doublez un moule à gâteau rond et profond de 23 cm. Décollez l’étiquette d’une boîte vide de 400 g et lavez-la bien. Beurrer l''extérieur de la boîte et\r\nenvelopper dans du papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Remplissez la boîte au tiers avec des fèves au four, du riz ou des légumineuses séchées (pour peser\r\nvers le bas), puis positionnez-le au milieu de la boîte. Versez la préparation à gâteau autour de « l’anneau », puis lissez le dessus. Cuire au four à 160C/chaleur tournante 140C/gaz 3 pendant 1h30, puis baisser à 140C/chaleur tournante 120C/gaz 1 et cuire encore une heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette vienne\r\npropre.","Pendant que le gâteau est encore chaud, utilisez la brochette\r\npoivrer le gâteau avec des trous, en piquant tout\r\nle chemin vers le bas. Dissoudre le sucre dans le thé,\r\najouter le whisky ou le jus d''orange, puis cuillère\r\nsur la surface. Si tu fais le gâteau\r\nà l''avance, nourrissez-le avec une nouvelle gorgée de\r\ngrog chaque semaine, mais attention à ne pas en faire\r\nle gâteau détrempé. Se conserve un mois\r\nbien emballé dans un contenant hermétique dans un\r\nendroit frais et sec. Si le temps manque, le gâteau peut\r\nêtre réalisé le jour même où vous le décorez.","Pour décorer, battez légèrement le blanc d''oeuf,\r\npuis mettez le sucre en poudre sur une assiette plate ou\r\nplateau. Trempez le bout des feuilles dans l''œuf\r\nblanc, secouez l''excédent, puis plongez-le dans le\r\nsucre pour enrober. Laisser sécher pendant que vous couvrez\r\nle gâteau à la pâte d''amande. Si vos canneberges\r\nsont congelés, laissez-les sur quelques feuilles de\r\ntorchon de cuisine à ce stade pour décongeler et sécher\r\nsinon le jus coulera dans le glaçage.","Rouler la pâte d''amande en un cercle de 23 cm, en façonnant\r\nfaites-le en rond avec vos mains. Alternativement,\r\nroulez la pâte d''amande un peu plus grosse que nécessaire,\r\npuis découpez un rond en utilisant le fond du moule à cake comme\r\nun guide. Retournez la pâte d''amande. Brossez le\r\ndessus du gâteau avec de la confiture, puis le déposer, côté confiture\r\nvers le bas, sur la pâte d''amande.","Faites le trou au milieu. En utilisant la canette,\r\npoussez à travers le trou au centre du\r\ngâteau et retirez l''excédent de pâte d''amande - c''est\r\nle moyen le plus simple de s''assurer que le trou dans le\r\nrecouvrir le trou du gâteau. Retourner le gâteau\r\nà l’endroit et asseyez-vous sur une assiette à gâteau.","Tamisez le sucre glace, puis battez avec le\r\nblanc d''œuf jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et lisse. Propagation\r\nsur la pâte d''amande avec un couteau à palette, puis\r\ndécorer le dessus avec des canneberges, des feuilles de laurier\r\net les brins d''eucalyptus givrés. Partir\r\nreposer toute la nuit avant de couper. Peut être\r\ndécoré jusqu''à un jour à l''avance. Garder le gâteau\r\nenveloppé dans du papier d''aluminium jusqu''au glaçage."]','2026-01-11 00:04:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10167,9229,'fr','Gâteau Dundee','Un célèbre gâteau aux fruits écossais traditionnel avec des cerises, des raisins secs et des amandes, et un glaçage sucré','["100 g d''amandes blanchies","180 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","180 g de sucre muscovado léger","le zeste d''une grosse orange","3 cuillères à soupe de confiture ou marmelade d''abricots","225 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 gros œufs battus","100 g d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","500 g de fruits secs mélangés","100 g de cerises entières glacées","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre"]','["Mettez les amandes dans un petit bol et versez-les sur de l''eau bouillante pour couvrir. Laisser poser 5 min puis égoutter dans une passoire et laisser sécher.","Préchauffer le four à 170°C/150°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser un moule à gâteau profond de 20 cm de diamètre avec du papier sulfurisé.","Mettez le beurre dans un grand bol et battez bien jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter le sucre et battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Incorporer le zeste d''orange et la confiture d''abricots.","Tamisez ensemble la farine et la levure chimique. Ajoutez les œufs à la crème de beurre et au sucre, petit à petit, en battant bien entre chaque ajout. Si le mélange commence à cailler, ajoutez un peu de farine.","Ajouter le reste de la farine et la poudre d''amandes et bien mélanger. Incorporer le lait puis ajouter les fruits secs et les cerises et mélanger délicatement.","Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et étalez-le à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère. Disposez les amandes entières rapprochées en cercles bien nets sur le dessus du gâteau. Cuire au four pendant 45 mn.","Baissez la température du four à 160 C/130 C chaleur tournante/gaz 2 et laissez cuire encore 60 à 80 minutes. Vérifiez le gâteau au bout de 50 minutes en insérant une pique à brochette en bois ou en métal dans le gâteau. Une fois terminé, il ne devrait y avoir que quelques miettes. Vérifiez toutes les 10 minutes – il est important de ne pas trop cuire ce gâteau afin que le centre soit un peu mou.","Une fois cuit, sortez brièvement le gâteau du four, mettez le lait et le sucre dans une petite casserole et faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Badigeonner le dessus du gâteau et remettre le gâteau au four pendant 2-3 minutes. Retirer et laisser refroidir le gâteau dans le moule. Lorsqu''il est assez froid, retirer du moule, envelopper dans du papier aluminium et conserver au moins 2 jours avant de couper."]','2026-01-11 00:04:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10168,9230,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits riche au gingembre','Ce gâteau traditionnel a été agrémenté de beaucoup de gingembre – vous ne sauriez jamais qu’il est sans gluten et sans produits laitiers. Parfait pour les mariages et Noël','["huile, pour graisser","100 g chacun de groseilles séchées, de raisins secs et de raisins secs","225 g chacun de figues et de pruneaux mi-séchés, hachés grossièrement","Pot de 200 g de gingembre confit","100 g de gingembre en tige, en pot, haché","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop de gingembre","4 cuillères à soupe de Cointreau","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu et 1 mélange d''épices","zester 2 citrons","150 ml d''huile d''olive","175 g de sucre muscovado léger","4 œufs","225g de gluten sans farine","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten","4 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots","1 cuillère à soupe de Cointreau","450 g de fruits mélangés, dont figues, pruneaux, dattes et abricots"]','["Chauffer le four à 140°C/chaleur tournante 120°C/gaz 1. Huiler légèrement un moule à cake rond de 71,2 cm de profondeur et 25 cm de diamètre, et le tapisser d''une double couche de papier sulfurisé.","Mélangez les fruits secs, le gingembre et le sirop, le Cointreau, les épices et le zeste de citron. Mettez l''huile d''olive, le sucre et les œufs dans un bol, fouettez ensemble jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Tamisez la farine et la levure chimique dans le mélange et versez les fruits. Pliez et mélangez bien.","Versez le mélange dans le moule à cake. Cuire au centre du four pendant 2 à 21,2 heures, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium si le gâteau commence à trop dorer. Sortir du four et laisser refroidir dans le moule. Retirer en laissant le papier sulfurisé en place jusqu''à la décoration.","Pour le topping : réchauffer ensemble la confiture et le Cointreau jusqu''à ce que la confiture soit liquide, laisser refroidir. Disposez les fruits sur le gâteau et badigeonnez-les de confiture."]','2026-01-11 00:04:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10169,9231,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits avec glaçage au beurre d''abricot','Cette délicieuse éponge aux fruits légers regorge de produits de base comme les noix et les fruits secs, elle est également économique.','["200 g de beurre ramolli","100 g d''amandes entières","200 g de farine nature","200 g de sucre glace","4 œufs moyens","700 g de fruits secs mélangés","25 ml de cognac","150 g de beurre ramolli","150g de confiture d''abricots","275 g de sucre glace tamisé"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer un moule à gâteau rond de 20 cm de profondeur avec\r\nun peu de beurre, puis tapisser de\r\npapier sulfurisé ou papier sulfurisé.\r\nEnveloppez quelques feuilles de papier journal\r\nautour de l''extérieur de la boîte, puis\r\nsécuriser avec une ficelle.","Au robot culinaire, fouettez les amandes\r\navec la farine jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble\r\ndes miettes. Battre le beurre et le sucre glace\r\njusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Incorporer les œufs,\r\nun par un, puis incorporez la farine et\r\namandes, fruits secs et cognac. Gratter\r\ndans le moule, niveler la surface et cuire au four\r\npendant 1 h 15, jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette s''y enfonce\r\nen ressort propre. Refroidir dans le moule.","Lorsque le gâteau est complètement froid,\r\nréaliser le glaçage rapidement en battant le\r\nbeurre, confiture et sucre glace jusqu''à pâleur.\r\nNe laissez pas le beurre devenir trop chaud\r\nou trop battre car le glaçage pourrait se fendre.\r\nRemuer partout sur le gâteau, puis laisser agir\r\nun endroit frais pour s''installer (mais pas le réfrigérateur)."]','2026-01-11 00:04:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10170,9232,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits chaud au grog','Ce fabuleux gâteau de Noël peut être réalisé et décoré de quatre manières très différentes. Choisissez simplement votre favori','["200 ml de thé noir fort et chaud (utilisez n''importe quel type)","3 cuillères à soupe de whisky","3 cuillères à soupe de marmelade d''orange de bonne qualité, râpée finement ou moyennement","700 g de fruits secs mélangés","100 g de zestes mélangés","100g de cerises glacées (colorant naturel)","225g de beurre","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs, battus","225 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées moulues","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","le zeste finement râpé d''1 citron","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","50 ml de thé noir chaud","1 cuillère à soupe de whisky (ou utilisez du jus d''orange si vous préférez)"]','["Mélangez le thé chaud, le whisky et la marmelade\r\ndans un grand bol jusqu''à ce que la marmelade fonde.\r\nIncorporer tous les fruits secs, les zestes et les cerises,\r\npuis couvrez et laissez tremper toute la nuit.","Le lendemain, chauffer le four à 160°C/chaleur tournante 140°C/gaz 3\r\net graisser et doubler un rond de 20 cm,\r\nmoule à gâteau profond recouvert de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif.\r\nÀ l''aide de batteurs électriques, crémer ensemble le\r\nle beurre et le sucre jusqu''à consistance mousseuse. Ajouter les oeufs\r\npetit à petit, en battant bien après chaque\r\najouter, puis incorporer la farine et les épices,\r\nsuivi du zeste de citron et des fruits trempés.\r\nAjoutez tout liquide qui n’a pas été absorbé par\r\nles fruits aussi. Verser dans le moule préparé,\r\nniveler le dessus, puis enfourner pendant 1h30. Tournez le\r\nfour jusqu''à 140C/chaleur tournante 120C/gaz 1 et\r\ncuire encore 1h30 ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette\r\ninséré au centre du gâteau vient\r\npropre. Laisser refroidir sur une grille dans le moule.","Pendant que le gâteau est encore chaud, utilisez la brochette\r\npoivrer le gâteau avec des trous, en piquant tout\r\nle chemin vers le bas. Dissoudre le sucre dans le thé,\r\najouter le whisky ou le jus d''orange, puis cuillère\r\nsur la surface. Si tu fais le gâteau\r\nà l''avance, nourrissez-le avec une nouvelle gorgée de\r\ngrog chaque semaine, mais veillez à ne pas détremper le gâteau. Se conserve un mois \r\nbien emballé dans un contenant hermétique dans un\r\nendroit frais et sec. Si le temps manque, le gâteau peut\r\nêtre réalisé le jour même où vous le décorez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10171,8515,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits d''hiver classique','Ce glaçage festif est facile à utiliser, est superbe et permet de terminer un repas plus léger. La pièce maîtresse parfaite pour le thé de Noël','["1 blanc d''oeuf","50 g de sucre en poudre","petite grappe de raisins noirs","feuilles de houx ou de laurier","Gâteau aux fruits rond de 20 cm/8 pouces","1-2 clémentines","1-2 figues juste mûres","quelques kumquats","quelques physalis (groseille du Cap)","environ 65 cm de ruban rouge ou doré","2 blancs d''œufs","175 g de sucre glace"]','["Battez légèrement le blanc d''œuf dans un bol peu profond et étalez le sucre en poudre sur une plaque à pâtisserie ou une plaque. Trempez les raisins et\r\nles feuilles de houx ou de laurier dans le blanc d''œuf, ou utilisez un pinceau. Secouez l''excédent, puis enduisez-le de sucre. Laisser sécher au moins 10 minutes, idéalement environ 30 minutes.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à décorer, préparez le glaçage. Placez un grand bol sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le fond du bol ne touche pas l''eau. Mettez les blancs d''œufs et le sucre glace dans le bol et fouettez pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage épais et très brillant. Utilisez une spatule pour nettoyer les bords du bol de temps en temps pendant que vous fouettez. Versez le glaçage sur le dessus du gâteau et étalez-le avec un couteau à bord plat, en tournant au fur et à mesure pour créer un effet enneigé (voir Knowhow ci-dessous).","Coupez en deux les clémentines, les figues et les kumquats, puis disposez sur le gâteau glacé le physalis, les raisins glacés et les feuilles. Fixez un ruban autour de la base et laissez le gâteau dans un endroit frais – mais pas dans le réfrigérateur – jusqu''à l''arrivée de vos invités."]','2026-01-11 00:04:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10172,9234,'fr','Gâteau festif aux fruits et aux noix','Ce gâteau de Noël fabuleusement moelleux et aux noisettes est cuit avec une garniture au sirop et aux noix – un peu comme un biscuit florentin.','["250 g de beurre à température ambiante","140 g de sucre muscovado léger","6 gros œufs battus","280 g de farine nature","85g d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à café de gingembre moulu","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","700 g de fruits mélangés de luxe (y compris raisins secs, groseilles, raisins secs, écorces mélangées et cerises glacées)","3 cuillères à soupe de rhum brun","140 g de pâte d''amande blanche coupée en dés","50 g chacun de noisettes entières pelées et d''amandes émondées","85 g chacun de noix du Brésil et d''amandes effilées","140 g de cerises entières glacées","100 g de sirop doré","1 mètre de ruban large"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/gaz\r\n4/ventilateur 160C et graisser légèrement\r\net tapissez la base et les côtés d''un\r\nprofond 22-23cm rond à base libre\r\nmoule à gâteau avec Bake-o-Glide ou\r\npapier sulfurisé (voir au verso).\r\nBattre le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, la farine,\r\namandes moulues et épices jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien mélangé et crémeux,\r\nde préférence avec un batteur électrique\r\nou dans un mixeur.","Mesurez 100 g/4 oz de\r\nmélange à gâteau, mettre dans un bol et\r\nmettre de côté. Pliez les fruits et le rhum\r\ndans le reste du mélange, puis\r\nincorporer délicatement la pâte d''amande. Cuillère\r\nce mélange dans le préparé\r\nmoule à cake et aplatir avec une spatule\r\npour créer une surface lisse et uniforme,\r\npuis faites un léger creux au centre\r\ndu gâteau. Cette astuce simple va\r\ndonne un joli plat au gâteau fini\r\nhaut. Cuire au four pendant 11 à 4 heures.","Pendant que le gâteau est au four,\r\npréparer la garniture aux fruits et aux noix. Mélanger\r\ntoutes les noix, les cerises et le sirop dans\r\nle reste de la préparation à gâteau (voir conseil\r\nau verso). Verser le mélange dessus\r\ndu gâteau partiellement cuit (une fois qu''il\r\na eu ses 11 à 4 heures), uniformément\r\ndistribuer le mélange de noix et\r\ncerises sur la surface du\r\ngâteau. Couvrez légèrement le haut du\r\nétain avec du papier d''aluminium.","Remettre au four 40 minutes\r\nplus, puis retirez le film et\r\ncuire encore 10-15 minutes,\r\npour que les noix puissent devenir dorées. Garder\r\nun oeil sur eux, pour qu''ils n''aient pas\r\ntrop sombre. Pour vérifier que le mélange à gâteau est cuit, insérez une fine brochette dans\r\nle gâteau – s''il ressort propre\r\nalors c''est prêt. Refroidissez dans le moule puis\r\ndémouler, en gardant la doublure, et\r\nenvelopper de papier d''aluminium. (Le gâteau sera\r\nse conserve jusqu''à 2 semaines ou peut être\r\ncongelé jusqu''à 2 mois.)","Pour servir, retirez le gâteau de\r\nle film et enlevez la doublure.\r\nDisposer sur une planche ou une assiette de service\r\net attachez-le avec un ruban décoratif."]','2026-01-11 00:04:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10173,9235,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits croquant au sucre','Des fruits moelleux et une garniture sucrée croquante signifient qu''il est impossible de manger une seule tranche de ce délicieux gâteau.','["100 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","2 œufs","85 g de sucre en poudre","50 g de farine autolevante","50g d''amandes moulues","le zeste d''un demi citron","2 portions Compote de pommes, poires et cerises (voir « Se marie bien avec »)","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara"]','["Préparez d''abord la compote de pommes, poires et cerises (voir \"Se marie bien avec\"). Vous aurez besoin de 2 des 12 portions de compote pour ce gâteau.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4 et\r\nBeurrer un moule à cake de 20 cm. Battre ensemble\r\nle beurre, les oeufs, le sucre semoule, la farine,\r\namandes et zeste de citron pour obtenir une consistance lisse\r\nmélange. Grattez dans le moule, versez dessus\r\nla compote, puis enfourner 25-30 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien levé. Répartir sur le sucre\r\net remettre au four 10-15 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit bien cuit.","Supprimer\r\nde la boîte et manger tiède ou à température ambiante\r\ntempérature avec de la crème ou de la crème anglaise."]','2026-01-11 00:04:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10174,9236,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits abricots et amandes','Cette pâtisserie est plus légère que le riche gâteau aux fruits traditionnel et constitue une toile vierge à glacer et à décorer à votre guise.','["140 g de raisins secs dorés","4 cuillères à soupe de Xérès","250 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de cassonade légère et molle","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs battus","200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g d''amandes moulues","50 g d''amandes effilées grillées","140 g d''abricots secs hachés","140 g de zestes mélangés","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","le zeste et le jus d''une orange"]','["Mélangez les raisins secs et le xérès et laissez tremper 1 heure.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer un moule à gâteau profond de 23 cm à fond meuble et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''une double couche de papier sulfurisé qui dépasse environ 2,5 cm au-dessus des côtés du moule. Dans votre plus grand bol à mélanger, battez ensemble le beurre, le sucre et la vanille jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Incorporez les œufs un à un.","Incorporer la farine, la levure chimique et les amandes moulues et effilées. Ajoutez ensuite les raisins secs trempés avec le sherry restant, les abricots secs, les zestes mélangés et tout le zeste et le jus. Verser dans le moule à cake en lissant la surface.","Cuire au milieu du four pendant 1 h 25 min. Piquez avec une brochette au centre pour vérifier qu''elle est cuite – si la brochette ressort avec un mélange non cuit collé dessus, faites cuire encore 10 minutes avant de vérifier à nouveau. Refroidir dans le moule. Décoré ou enveloppé dans du papier sulfurisé et du papier aluminium, le gâteau se conservera jusqu''à un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10175,9237,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits au chocolat','Si un membre de votre famille n’aime pas le gâteau aux fruits traditionnel, c’est peut-être le compromis que vous recherchiez.','["200g de beurre","200 g de cassonade foncée","100 g de chocolat noir (nous en avons utilisé 80 %) cassé en morceaux","75 ml de cognac","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250g de raisins secs","250g de groseilles","100 g de canneberges séchées","100 g de griottes séchées","100 g de zestes mélangés","200 g de farine autolevante","100 g d''amandes moulues","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","3 œufs battus à la fourchette"]','["Mettez le beurre, le sucre, le chocolat, le cognac,\r\nvanille et fruits secs dans un grand\r\ncasserole. Chauffer doucement en remuant de temps en temps\r\njusqu''à ce que tout soit fondu.\r\nRetirer du feu.","Chauffer le four à 150C/130C ventilateur/gaz 2.\r\nTapisser un moule à cake profond de 20 cm de diamètre ou\r\nCarré de 18 cm, avec une double couche de\r\npapier sulfurisé. Enroulez quelques couches\r\nde journaux à l''extérieur et\r\nsécuriser avec une ficelle.","Mélanger la farine, les amandes, le cacao et les épices\r\nensemble. Incorporer légèrement les œufs\r\nmélange de chocolat refroidi dans la casserole,\r\nsuivi du mélange de farine. Grattez dans\r\nvotre moule préparé et enfournez pendant 1h30-\r\n1 h 45 min ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette apparaisse\r\nen ressort propre. Refroidir dans le moule, puis\r\ndécorer (voir « Se marie bien avec », à droite, pour des idées de décoration). Le gâteau enveloppé dans un film sulfurisé\r\nse conserve 2 mois dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:04:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10176,9238,'fr','Gâteau aux fruits aux noisettes','Dégustez ce gâteau « gluten et noix », fait avec un excès de courgettes et de pommes, avec une tasse de thé','["225 g de beurre mou non salé, plus un peu pour le moule","Sachet de 100 g de noisettes émondées, hachées très grossièrement en deux","225 g de sucre muscovado léger","225 g de farine autolevante","3 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées ou de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","175 g de courgettes grossièrement râpées","1 pomme à manger, râpée (environ 85 g de chair)","250 g de fruits secs mélangés"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer un moule à cake rond de 20 cm de diamètre\r\net tapisser le fond et les côtés de pâte à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin. Mettez les noisettes entières, plus\r\n1 cuillère à soupe de sucre et de farine, dans\r\nun robot culinaire et fouettez jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles noisettes sont aussi fines que possible.","Ajouter le beurre, le reste du sucre et\r\nœufs au robot, puis versez-les dans le\r\nvanille, épices, ¼ cuillère à café de sel, reste de la farine\r\net la levure chimique. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nRetirez la lame, puis incorporez le\r\ncourgettes, pommes et fruits secs.","Versez le mélange dans le moule, lissez\r\nle dessus, puis parsemer avec le haché\r\nnoisettes en les pressant dans la pâte\r\nun peu. Enfourner pendant 1h10 (voir astuce,\r\nci-dessous), en recouvrant le dessus sans serrer de papier d''aluminium\r\naprès 45 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit levé et\r\ndoré. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 20 minutes, puis\r\nretirer et laisser refroidir sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:04:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10177,9239,'fr','Gâteau aux pommes et aux fruits facile','Ce gâteau a toutes les saveurs de Noël, mais ne prendra pas longtemps à réaliser : vous pouvez le décorer comme vous le souhaitez. Idéal aussi pour un gâteau de mariage','["200 g de beurre ramolli et un peu pour graisser","200 g de sucre muscovado noir","3 œufs battus","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse noire","200 g de farines autolevantes","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 pommes de table, râpées (environ 100 g chacune)","300 g de mélange de raisins secs et raisins secs"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake rond et profond de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Battez les sept premiers ingrédients ensemble dans un grand bol (électrique à main).\r\nles batteurs sont les meilleurs pour cela), jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et épais. À l’aide d’une grande cuillère en métal, incorporez délicatement les fruits jusqu’à ce que le tout soit homogène.","Versez la pâte dans le moule et faites cuire au four pendant 50 minutes à 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit doré foncé, élastique au toucher et ait légèrement rétréci du moule. Une brochette insérée au centre en ressortira propre lorsqu’elle sera prête. Laisser refroidir complètement avant de décorer. Se conserve, emballé dans un contenant hermétique ou glacé, jusqu''à une semaine, ou peut être congelé sans glace jusqu''à un mois – décongelez complètement avant de décorer."]','2026-01-11 00:04:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10178,9240,'fr','Petits gâteaux de Noël glacés','Ces délicieux mini-gâteaux aux fruits constituent des cadeaux parfaits pour les amis et les voisins','["beurre, pour graisser","1 quantité de Gâteau aux pommes et aux fruits facile, non cuit (voir lien ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots","Paquet de 500 g de pâte d''amande naturelle","Paquet de 500 g de glaçage blanc prêt à rouler","16 canneberges fraîches","bouquet de romarin, brisé en petites feuilles","50 g de sucre en poudre","1 blanc d''oeuf","50g de sucre glace","environ 1 m de ruban doré"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°/gaz 4. Beurrer huit ramequins de 150 ml et tapisser le fond de cercles de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Répartir la préparation à gâteau dans les ramequins, transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et glisser au four. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient élastiques et dorés foncés. Laisser refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulé, puis passer un couteau à bords ronds sur le pourtour de chaque gâteau. Démouler et laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille.","Si les gâteaux ont atteint des sommets, aplatissez-les en coupant le dessus avec un couteau dentelé. Faire fondre la confiture avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et badigeonner le dessus des gâteaux. Pétrir légèrement la pâte d''amande et façonner huit boules de la taille d''une balle de golf. (Il vous en restera – enveloppez bien pour une autre fois.) À l’aide d’un rouleau à pâtisserie, roulez délicatement les boules en cercles plats, d’environ 1 cm d’épaisseur et du même diamètre que les gâteaux. Disposez la pâte d''amande sur le côté confit des gâteaux. Faites de même avec le glaçage en badigeonnant la pâte d''amande d''un peu d''eau bouillie et refroidie pour l''aider à coller.","Battre le blanc d''œuf jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste mousseux et brisé. Répartissez le sucre en poudre sur une assiette. Tremper les canneberges et le romarin dans le blanc d''œuf, secouer l''excédent et rouler dans le sucre semoule pour créer un effet givré. Laisser sécher 15 min. Retirez tout le blanc d''œuf sauf 2 cuillères à café et mélangez-le avec le sucre glace pour créer une pâte épaisse. Utilisez-le pour fixer deux canneberges et une branche de romarin sur le dessus de chaque gâteau. Décorez avec du ruban doré. Les gâteaux se conservent dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:04:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10179,9241,'fr','Gâteau renversé à l''orange sanguine','Profitez au maximum de la saveur et de la belle couleur des oranges sanguines dans ce superbe gâteau renversé. C''est un gâteau parfait à déguster avec une tasse de thé','["2 oranges sanguines, zestées","200 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre mou roux clair","4 œufs","125 g de farine nature","75 g de polenta ou de semoule de maïs","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","100g de yaourt nature","2-3 cuillères à soupe de lait (facultatif)"]','["Retirez délicatement la peau des oranges zestées, en prenant soin de les conserver entières. Coupez-les en fines rondelles, en retirant et en jetant les pépins. Annuler.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake de 23 cm de diamètre avec du papier sulfurisé. Posez le moule sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis disposez les tranches d''orange dans le fond en les superposant légèrement pour en recouvrir le plus possible.","Battre le beurre, le sucre et le zeste ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Incorporer les œufs, un à la fois, en incorporant quelques cuillerées de farine entre chaque ajout pour éviter que le mélange ne caille. Incorporez le reste de la farine, la polenta et la levure chimique, suivis du yaourt. Si le mélange semble un peu sec, ajoutez 2-3 cuillères à soupe de lait. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent en ressorte propre. Servir en tranches. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10180,3805,'fr','Petits pains crumble aux fraises','Célébrez la saison des fraises avec ces petits pains crumble gourmands. Ces desserts accrocheurs sont parfaits pour l''été et constituent une gâterie sucrée impressionnante','["120 g de beurre, 70 g à température ambiante et 50 g frais et coupés en cubes","370 g de farine nature","2 œufs","135 g de sucre en poudre","7 g de levure séchée à action rapide","100 ml de lait tiède","250 g de fraises coupées en deux"]','["Faites fondre les 70 g de beurre et laissez-le refroidir. Tamisez 300 g de farine dans un bol, ajoutez les œufs, 75 g de sucre et la levure et mélangez le tout à la cuillère. Ajoutez lentement le lait tiède et le beurre refroidi. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que tous les ingrédients soient bien combinés pour obtenir une pâte très molle et collante. Couvrir le bol avec un chiffon propre et mettre dans un endroit chaud pour lever pendant 40 à 60 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Pour réaliser le crumble, mélangez le reste de la farine avec le reste du sucre et du beurre réfrigéré. Frottez le beurre dans la farine jusqu''à obtenir une texture semblable à de la chapelure. Froideur.","Lorsque la pâte a levé, divisez-la en six portions en l''écrasant légèrement puis façonnez chacune en boule sur un plan de travail fariné – la pâte peut encore être collante, alors saupoudrez-la de farine et travaillez rapidement. Aplatissez délicatement les boules avec la main pour qu''elles ressemblent à des petits pains. Disposez sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé.","Répartissez les fraises entre les petits pains en les plaçant au centre de chacun et saupoudrez de crumble. Chauffer le four à 180C/ventilateur 160C/gaz 4. Cuire les petits pains pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient gonflés et cuits. Laisser refroidir puis saupoudrer de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10181,9242,'fr','Bagatelle royale d''été','Épatez tout le monde avec cette bagatelle fruitée. Il sert 10 personnes, ce qui le rend idéal comme dessert à partager lors d''une fête en plein air marquant le jubilé de platine de la Reine.','["500 ml de crème anglaise à la vanille fraîche du commerce","400 g de gâteau madère coupé en morceaux","70 ml de sirop de baies de votre choix","150g de framboises","300 ml de crème fraîche","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","250g de fraises","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe, pour garnir","1 orange, coupée en deux et tranchée","6 feuilles de gélatine","100 g de sucre en poudre","1 citron, le zeste coupé en lanières, pressé","500 g de fraises décortiquées","une goutte de colorant alimentaire rouge (facultatif)","600 ml de crème fraîche","200 ml de sucre en poudre","2 oranges, zestées et pressées"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la gelée. Mettez la gélatine dans un petit bol, couvrez d''eau et laissez tremper. Pendant ce temps, versez le sucre, le zeste et le jus de citron et 400 ml d''eau dans une casserole à feu doux et laissez mijoter en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Ajoutez les fraises et portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les fraises soient décomposées. Versez le mélange au tamis dans un pichet. Pressez l''excès d''eau de la gélatine et mélangez-le au mélange de fraises jusqu''à dissolution, puis ajoutez une goutte de colorant alimentaire rouge, le cas échéant.","Versez la crème anglaise dans le fond d''un bol à bagatelle de 3 litres et recouvrez de morceaux de gâteau. Arroser de sirop de baies et parsemer de framboises. Versez lentement et délicatement sur le mélange de gelée et laissez refroidir pendant 5 heures jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris.","Lorsque la couche de gelée est prise, réalisez la couche de crème orange. Mettez la crème, le sucre et le zeste d''orange dans une casserole sur feu doux et portez à ébullition. Montez le feu à moyen et faites bouillonner pendant 3 minutes exactement, puis retirez immédiatement du feu et incorporez le jus d''orange. Verser le mélange au tamis sur la couche de gelée prise et réfrigérer pendant 4 heures.","Fouettez la crème double, le sucre glace et la pâte de gousse de vanille en pics mous à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, puis versez la chantilly sur la bagatelle à l''aide d''une grande cuillère. Réfrigérer pendant au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''au moment de servir. Coupez la plupart des fraises en deux par la tige et répartissez-les sur la bagatelle avec les feuilles de menthe. Servir les tranches d''orange et le reste des fraises entières dans un bol à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:04:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10182,9243,'fr','Gâteau à la confiture de groseille, muscat et mascarpone','Impressionnez vos invités avec ce superbe gâteau au muscat et au mascarpone, composé d''un luxueux centre de confiture de groseille. Ce dessert pour adultes est parfait pour le thé de l''après-midi','["215 g de beurre à température ambiante, plus un peu pour les moules","285 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","½ citron, zesté","250 g de farines autolevantes","150 g d''amandes moulues","165 g de yaourt nature","3 œufs moyens, à température ambiante, légèrement battus","200 g de mascarpone","150 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de vin de dessert muscat","2-3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace, au goût, plus un peu pour servir","250 g de confiture de groseille","fleurs comestibles ou amandes effilées légèrement grillées, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et beurrer deux moules à cake de 23 cm, puis tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, puis incorporer l''extrait d''amande et le zeste de citron. Mélangez la farine, les amandes et une pincée de sel dans un autre bol. Avec le fouet à basse vitesse, ajoutez progressivement le yaourt et les œufs dans le bol avec le mélange de beurre et de sucre, en alternant avec des cuillerées du mélange de farine et d''amandes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Versez la pâte dans les moules préparés, en la divisant uniformément. Cuire au four 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laissez refroidir les gâteaux dans le moule pendant 5 minutes, puis démoulez-les sur une grille, retirez le papier sulfurisé et laissez refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Fouettez ensemble le mascarpone, la crème, le vin et le sucre glace à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous.","Disposez l''un des gâteaux refroidis sur une assiette de service. Étalez délicatement sur la confiture (il est facile de casser la génoise donc soyez doux), puis étalez délicatement la crème mascarpone sur la confiture. Mettez la deuxième éponge par dessus. Tamisez un peu de sucre glace et décorez de fleurs comestibles, si vous le souhaitez. Les fleurs blanches ou crème sont ravissantes, mais si vous ne les trouvez pas, optez pour une seule couleur. Vous pouvez également saupoudrer de quelques amandes effilées légèrement grillées avant de tamiser le sucre glace supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:04:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10183,9244,'fr','Éponge Victoria abricot d''été','Essayez une nouvelle version d''une génoise Victoria classique avec une couche de compote d''abricots et de thym citronné. Pris en sandwich avec de la crème fouettée à la vanille, c''est incroyablement délicieux','["225 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 gros œufs, à température ambiante","225 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","200 g de confiture d''abricots","3-4 moitiés d''abricots en conserve, égouttées et hachées","6 brins de citron ou de thym ordinaire, feuilles cueillies sur 1, le reste laissé entier","300 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 gousse de vanille fendue et graines grattées ou 1 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond et les côtés de deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm.","Battre le beurre et le sucre dans un grand bol avec un fouet électrique pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs un à un en battant bien après chaque ajout. Tamisez la farine, la levure chimique et le sel et incorporez-les à l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal. Ajoutez juste assez de lait pour créer une consistance goutte à goutte.","Répartissez la pâte dans les moules préparés et lissez le dessus avec une spatule. Cuire au milieu du four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et fermes au toucher. Laisser refroidir légèrement dans les moules, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Versez la confiture dans une petite casserole et incorporez les abricots et les brins de thym entiers. Réchauffer à feu doux pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il se détache, puis transférer dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, laisser refroidir et infuser pendant 1 à 2 heures.","Fouettez la crème avec le sucre glace et la vanille jusqu''à ce que le mélange tienne juste sa forme (attention à ne pas trop fouetter – voir astuce ci-dessous).","Retirez et jetez le thym entier du mélange de conserves et incorporez les feuilles de thym. Étalez le mélange sur l''une des génoises, puis recouvrez de chantilly vanille et sandwichez avec le reste de génoise. Saupoudrez le gâteau d''un peu de sucre glace. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10184,9245,'fr','Gâteau Bundt à l''orange sanguine et à l''huile d''olive','À l''aide d''un moule à gâteau, donnez un effet époustouflant à ce gâteau piquant avec une génoise légère à l''huile d''olive et un glaçage décadent au chocolat blanc et à l''orange sanguine.','["spray de démoulage de gâteau (disponible chez Lakeland et amazon.co.uk) ou beurre fondu, pour graisser","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","5 gros œufs","le zeste et le jus de 3 oranges sanguines (environ 150 ml de jus)","150 g d''huile d''olive légère","280 g de farines autolevantes","140 g de chocolat blanc haché grossièrement","le zeste d''une orange sanguine et le jus de 1 ½ (environ 75 ml de jus)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et graisser un moule à gâteau de 2,5 litres avec le spray démoulant à gâteau ou du beurre.","Mettez le sucre, les œufs et le zeste dans un grand bol et fouettez avec un fouet électrique pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et pâle. Avec le mélangeur à vitesse moyenne-basse, versez le jus et l''huile en mélangeant jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Tamisez la farine dans le bol et fouettez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Verser dans le moule préparé, placer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré dans le gâteau en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes avant de démouler délicatement sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pour faire le glaçage, mettez le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante, en remuant de temps en temps. Une fois le chocolat fondu, versez le jus d’orange sanguine et mélangez. Retirez le bol du feu et laissez refroidir, puis réfrigérez jusqu''à ce que le glaçage soit épais mais toujours versable. Une fois que le glaçage a atteint la consistance désirée, versez-le sur le gâteau en le laissant couler sur les côtés. Saupoudrez le zeste d''orange pour terminer. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique pendant 3 à 4 jours ; peut être congelé jusqu''à 3 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10185,9246,'fr','Gâteau aux pommes et au caramel','Cette pâtisserie époustouflante est une célébration des desserts aux pommes classiques avec une génoise épicée, un glaçage à la vanille et une garniture collante aux pommes au caramel.','["150 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de cassonade foncée","2 gros œufs","250 g de pommes de table (poids préparé – environ 3 pommes), pelées, évidées et râpées grossièrement","200 g de farines autolevantes","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","25 g de flocons d''avoine","50g d''amandes moulues","100 g de raisins secs","le zeste d''1 citron","jus d''1 citron","4 manger des pommes (j''ai utilisé Pink Lady)","25g de beurre","50 g de cassonade foncée","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop doré","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle","100 g de sucre blanc en poudre (facultatif, pour les petites pommes au caramel)","75 g de cassonade foncée","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe de cognac ou d''eau","50g de beurre","100g de chocolat blanc","Pot de 280 g de fromage à la crème","1 gousse de vanille, graines uniquement","Pot de 170 g de yaourt grec","8 longues brochettes en bois (facultatif, pour les petites pommes au caramel)"]','["Commencez par réaliser les gâteaux. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser 2 moules à gâteau à charnière de 18 cm de papier sulfurisé et badigeonner d''un peu d''huile. Mettez le sucre et les œufs dans un grand bol et fouettez avec des batteurs électriques jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit brillant et pâle. Gardez les batteurs en marche pendant que vous versez l''huile.","Incorporez la pomme râpée, puis incorporez tous les autres ingrédients du gâteau. Répartissez le mélange dans les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre.","Pendant que les gâteaux cuisent, préparez la garniture aux pommes. Versez le jus de citron dans\r\nun grand bol et remplissez-le à moitié d’eau froide. Épluchez les pommes, puis coupez-les en sphères à l''aide d''une cuillère à melon – mettez-les au fur et à mesure dans le bol d''eau citronnée pour éviter qu''elles ne se décolorent. Dans une casserole moyenne, mélanger le beurre, la cassonade, le sirop doré, la cannelle et 200 ml d''eau, et chauffer jusqu''à ébullition. Sortez les boules de pommes de l''eau et mettez-les dans la casserole. Si vous souhaitez préparer les petites pommes au caramel pour le dessus, gardez 8 boules de pommes dans l''eau jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Portez à nouveau le mélange dans la casserole à ébullition pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les pommes soient tendres mais ne perdent pas leur forme et qu''un sirop épais commence à se former. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir complètement, puis réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Mélanger tous les ingrédients du sirop dans un bol. Lorsque les gâteaux sont cuits, conservez-les dans le moule mais percez des trous sur toute la surface avec un pique à brochette et arrosez-les de sirop. Laissez les gâteaux refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Pendant que les gâteaux refroidissent, préparez le glaçage. Dans un petit bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, faire fondre ensemble le beurre et le chocolat blanc. Une fois fondu et brillant, versez dans un grand bol. Ajouter le fromage à la crème, fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis\r\najoutez la vanille. Enfin, incorporez le yaourt. Lorsque le mélange est refroidi,\r\nréfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour assembler le gâteau, sortez les génoises refroidies de leur moule et posez-en une sur un support à gâteau. Garnir de la moitié du glaçage au chocolat blanc – à l’aide d’une cuillère ou avec une très grosse douille ronde. Répartissez les morceaux de pommes cuits, accompagnés d''un filet de sirop, sur le glaçage, puis placez au réfrigérateur pour raffermir pendant 15 minutes. Ajoutez la couche supérieure du gâteau, puis décorez avec le reste du glaçage en le dressant de nombreux petits monticules réguliers sur tout le dessus à l''aide d''une grosse douille ronde. Mettez le gâteau entier au réfrigérateur jusqu''au moment de servir. Se conserve 2 jours au réfrigérateur.","Pour une finition époustouflante, mais facultative, réalisez de belles pommes au caramel miniatures. Leur effet est époustouflant mais éphémère, alors préparez-les juste avant de servir votre gâteau, car le caramel se dissoudra rapidement à cause de l''humidité de l''air. Badigeonner une plaque à pâtisserie d''un peu d''huile végétale et réserver. Séchez très soigneusement les boules de pommes réservées à l''étape 3 du gâteau avec du papier absorbant ou un torchon propre et insérez une longue brochette en bois dans chacune d''elles.","Mettez le sucre en poudre dans une petite casserole à feu moyen, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que le sucre fonde. Continuez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que le sucre devienne un caramel liquide doré, puis retirez du feu. S’il semble qu’il fait trop chaud, placez le fond de la casserole dans un plat résistant à la chaleur rempli d’eau froide.","Inclinez la casserole et, en travaillant rapidement (car le sucre va continuer à cuire), tenez les boules de pommes par la brochette et plongez-les tour à tour dans le caramel et tournez.\r\nautour pour l''enduire. Il est très important que les boules de pommes soient bien séchées et qu’on ne les retourne pas plus de deux fois dans le caramel chaud, sinon la pomme va cuire et libérer du liquide, ce qui empêchera le caramel de coller. Dès qu''ils sont enduits, soulevez-les lentement verticalement. Tenez la pomme hors de la poêle et faites une pause avant de la transférer sur le plateau huilé sur le côté. En le tenant ainsi, une longue goutte de caramel durcira et créera une belle et longue pointe. Répétez l''opération avec le reste des pommes, en travaillant rapidement pour que le caramel ne durcisse pas complètement avant que toutes les pommes soient enrobées. Cependant, ne vous inquiétez pas trop, vous pouvez toujours le réchauffer doucement à feu doux avant de continuer – faites juste attention à ne pas le brûler, sinon il aura un goût amer.","Après quelques minutes, les pommes devraient avoir pris. Lorsqu''ils sont suffisamment froids pour être manipulés, retirez les brochettes. Placez les pommes sur le gâteau de manière à ce que la pointe pointe vers le haut et que la base de la pomme (là où se trouvait la brochette) soit enfoncée dans le glaçage. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:04:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10186,9247,'fr','Gâteau crumble aux prunes','Cette somptueuse pâtisserie de saison est garnie de moitiés de prunes ou d''abricots et d''une garniture de crumble au beurre – à servir de pudding ou de gâteau.','["175g de beurre, à température ambiante","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 gros œufs","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g d''amandes moulues","85 g de crème sure","5-6 prunes mûres, coupées en deux et dénoyautées","50g d''amandes moulues","50g de farine nature","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","50 g de beurre coupé en morceaux","crème sure ou yaourt, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à gâteau rond de 22 cm de profondeur (de préférence avec un fond amovible) de papier sulfurisé.","Préparez d’abord la garniture : mettez tous les ingrédients du crumble dans un bol et frottez ensemble jusqu’à ce qu’ils soient friables.","Pour le gâteau, mettez le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, la farine, la levure chimique, la vanille, la poudre d''amandes et la crème sure dans un grand bol. Battre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis verser dans le moule et niveler le dessus. Disposez les prunes, côté coupé vers le haut, sur le mélange, puis répartissez-les sur le crumble.","Cuire au four pendant 50 minutes à 1 heure sur une grille du milieu jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent enfoncé dans le mélange à gâteau en ressorte propre (les prunes resteront cependant collantes). Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 20 minutes, puis terminer le refroidissement sur une grille. Servir nature ou avec de la crème sure ou du yaourt. Se conserve 3 à 4 jours dans un moule à cake hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:04:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10187,9248,'fr','Cake épicé aux figues, café et noisettes','Ce gâteau sophistiqué est délicatement épicé et plein de saveurs de figues séchées et de sucre muscovado, terminé par un glaçage au fromage à la crème.','["4 figues séchées coupées en petits morceaux","75 ml de café fort ou d''espresso chaud","100 g de noisettes blanchies","200g de beurre légèrement salé, très mou, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de sucre muscovado léger","200 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","50g de yaourt nature","4 gros œufs","250g de beurre légèrement salé, très mou","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille ou de pâte de haricots","400 g de sucre glace","Pot de 250 g de fromage à la crème entier","6 cuillères à soupe de confiture de figues ou de conserve","10-12 figues, coupées en deux ou en quartiers","200g de caramel (Carnation ou Bon Maman fonctionnent bien)"]','["Tout d’abord, fabriquez l’éponge. Mettez les figues séchées dans un bol et versez dessus le café. Laisser tremper 30 mn. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Versez les noisettes sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les griller au four pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et aromatiques. Versez 75 g de noix dans un robot culinaire (réservez le reste pour plus tard) et laissez refroidir 10 minutes. Pendant ce temps, beurrez le fond et les côtés d''un moule à gâteau rectangulaire de 20 x 30 cm et tapissez-le de papier sulfurisé.","Mélangez les noix refroidies jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement hachées. Ajoutez les figues trempées et le café restant et mixez à nouveau pour obtenir une pâte. Ajoutez le reste des ingrédients de la génoise au robot avec une bonne pincée de sel. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, en raclant les côtés une ou deux fois et en mélangeant à nouveau. Grattez dans votre moule à gâteau, nivelez la surface et enfournez pendant 25 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre du gâteau en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis retourner sur une grille, décoller le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir.","Pendant que le gâteau refroidit, préparez le glaçage. Mettez le beurre, la vanille et la moitié du sucre dans un grand bol. Écrasez grossièrement avec une spatule, puis mélangez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Ajouter le fromage frais et le reste du sucre glace, écraser, puis mélanger à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Divisez le glaçage en 2 lots, un pour la superposition et une couche de chapelure, et un pour une couche finale. Vous pouvez refroidir le glaçage pendant que le gâteau refroidit, mais sortez-le du réfrigérateur 15 minutes avant de l''utiliser pour le ramener à température ambiante.","Assemblez maintenant le gâteau. Transférez le gâteau refroidi sur une planche à découper. Marquez la génoise à intervalles de 10 cm sur toute la longueur du gâteau, en délimitant 3 sections de 20 x 10 cm chacune. Coupez puis empilez les gâteaux les uns sur les autres pour vérifier qu''ils ont la même taille. Coupez les bords inégaux, puis dépilez.","Mettez 1 génoise sur un plateau à gâteau ou une assiette. Tartiner d''un peu de glaçage et de 3 cuillères à soupe de confiture de figues en gardant la confiture à environ 1 cm des bords. Garnir avec une autre génoise, plus de glaçage et de confiture, puis prendre en sandwich avec la dernière génoise. Utilisez un couteau à palette pour recouvrir tout le gâteau avec le premier lot de glaçage restant (la couche de miettes) – ne vous inquiétez pas si c''est un peu salissant. Assurez-vous de combler les espaces entre les couches avec du glaçage. Une fois couvert, réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes pour raffermir le glaçage. Refroidissez également le reste du glaçage, mais sortez-le du réfrigérateur 10 à 15 minutes avant le gâteau pour qu''il soit prêt à être tartiné.","Décorez le gâteau. Sortez-le du réfrigérateur et recouvrez-le du reste de glaçage. Utilisez un couteau à palette pour créer des bords lisses ou laissez-le assez rugueux, si vous le souhaitez. Garnir le gâteau avec les figues, les extrémités pointues. Mettez le caramel dans une petite poche à douille, coupez le coin et versez-en un filet sur le dessus du gâteau en l''encourageant sur les côtés (ou arrosez-le simplement avec une cuillère). Hachez grossièrement le reste des noix grillées et répartissez-les sur le dessus. Servir en tranches avec des figues supplémentaires en accompagnement, si vous le souhaitez. Conservez les restes au réfrigérateur pendant 3 jours, mais ramenez-les à température ambiante avant de les déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:04:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10188,9249,'fr','Gâteau au citron meringué','Faites passer la meringue au citron à un nouveau niveau avec cette génoise infusée au caramel remplie de crème au citron et garnie de meringue italienne','["75 g de beurre doux, ramolli","225 g de sucre en poudre","zester 3 citrons","100 ml de jus de citron tamisé pour éliminer les pépins et la moelle","3 gros œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","85 g de sucre en poudre","300 g de beurre doux, ramolli","200 g de sucre en poudre","75 g de sucre muscovado léger","300 g de farines autolevantes","5 œufs moyens, battus","25g de maïzena","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","zester 4 citrons","1 citron","175 g de sucre en poudre","300 g de sucre en poudre","6 blancs d''œufs moyens","½ cuillère à café de crème de tartre"]','["Commencez par préparer le caillé. Mettez tous les ingrédients dans une casserole et fouettez ensemble. On dirait qu''il a caillé, mais ne vous inquiétez pas : mettez simplement la casserole sur feu doux et remuez constamment jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit suffisamment lisse et épaisse pour recouvrir le dos d''une cuillère. Passer le mélange au tamis dans un bol. Laisser refroidir, recouvert d''un film alimentaire. Mettre au réfrigérateur jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser, de préférence toute la nuit.","Pour le sirop de sucre caramel, faites chauffer le sucre en poudre dans une casserole à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il fonde et commence à caraméliser. Remuer jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et une couleur dorée profonde. Retirer du feu et verser délicatement 50 ml d''eau bouillante. Il va cuire à la vapeur et cracher un peu, alors faites attention. (Si le sucre durcit, remettez la casserole sur le feu pendant 1 à 2 minutes pour fondre à nouveau.) Remuez, versez immédiatement dans un pichet résistant à la chaleur et complétez avec un peu d''eau bouillante supplémentaire (environ 10 ml) pour obtenir 100 ml de liquide au total. Laisser refroidir d''un côté.","Pour réaliser le gâteau, chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer 3 moules à sandwich de 20 cm en tapissant les fonds et les côtés de papier sulfurisé.","Dans un grand bol, battre ensemble le beurre et les sucres avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Incorporer 1 cuillère à soupe de farine, puis ajouter les œufs, petit à petit, en battant après chaque ajout jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Mélangez le reste des ingrédients secs, le zeste de citron et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel, puis incorporez au mélange de beurre avec le sirop de sucre caramel. Répartissez la pâte entre les moules et nivelez le dessus avec le dos d''une cuillère humide. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laissez les gâteaux refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis démoulez-les sur une grille en décollant le papier sulfurisé. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Réalisez les tranches de citron caramélisées pendant la cuisson des gâteaux. Coupez le citron en tranches de 5 mm d''épaisseur en jetant les extrémités. Dans une poêle antiadhésive peu profonde, portez à ébullition 350 ml d''eau et le sucre. Ajoutez les tranches de citron, faites bouillir pendant 10 minutes, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide se soit évaporé et que les tranches soient caramélisées. Retirer de la poêle et déposer sur un tapis en silicone antiadhésif ou du papier sulfurisé pour refroidir.","Pour assembler le gâteau. Placez une génoise à l''endroit sur un plateau à gâteau ou une assiette de présentation. Garnir d''une couche uniforme de caillé mais ne pas aller jusqu''au bord, laisser environ 1 cm découvert. Placez délicatement la prochaine éponge sur le dessus et répétez le processus en plaçant la dernière éponge à l''envers sur le dessus.","Pour faire la meringue italienne, mettez le sucre et 175 ml d''eau dans une casserole et portez à ébullition sur feu vif. Continuez à faire bouillir jusqu''à ce qu''il atteigne 115°C sur un thermomètre à sucre. Pendant ce temps, mettez les blancs d''œufs et la crème de tartre dans un grand bol à mélanger (un mixeur de table est idéal si vous en avez un). Montez les blancs d''œufs en neige ferme (lorsque vous soulevez le fouet, les pics doivent lentement disparaître dans le mélange). Montez les blancs d''œufs à grande vitesse et versez-y très lentement le sirop chaud. La meringue commencera à épaissir et à devenir brillante au bout d''environ 10 minutes. Continuez à fouetter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit encore chaud. Utilisez la meringue immédiatement, car elle est plus facile à travailler lorsqu''elle est tiède.","À l''aide d''une spatule, étalez une fine couche de meringue sur le côté du gâteau pour l''égaliser et l''équarrir, puis étalez une couche uniforme d''environ 3 mm d''épaisseur sur le dessus du gâteau (voir étape par étape pour obtenir des conseils). Mettez le reste de meringue dans une grande poche à douille munie d''une petite douille étoile et dressez des colonnes verticales sur le côté du gâteau, au niveau du dessus. Enfin, déposez des petites étoiles de meringue sur le dessus des colonnes. C''est plus facile de faire cela avec le gâteau sur un plateau tournant.","Faire dorer la meringue à l''aide d''un chalumeau de cuisine. Enfin, coupez les tranches de citron caramélisées en deux et utilisez-les pour décorer le dessus du gâteau. Se conserve 3 jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10189,9250,'fr','Plateau de griottes et amandes','Ce gâteau fruité utilise du riz moulu et de l''extrait d''amande pour une cuisson moins chère – parfait pour une vente de gâteaux ou comme gâterie à l''heure du thé.','["300 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","375 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","zestez 1 citron (conservez le jus pour le glaçage)","85g de riz moulu ou d''amandes moulues","4 œufs légèrement battus","25 g de massepain, refroidi jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme, puis râpé","2 cuillères à café d''extrait d''amande","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 cuillères à soupe de lait entier","200 g de griottes glacées lavées, séchées et coupées en quartiers","500 g de sucre glace fondant","jus d''1 citron (du citron ci-dessus)","50 g de pâte d''amande","des gels de colorants alimentaires rouges et verts (nous avons utilisé le Dr Oetker)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un grand moule carré d''environ 28 x 28 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mettez tous les ingrédients du gâteau (à l''exception des cerises) dans un grand bol à mélanger ou un batteur de table et battez ensemble jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Mélangez les cerises dans un peu de farine, puis incorporez-les au mélange à gâteau à l''aide d''une spatule. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit doré, élastique au toucher et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Pour réaliser le glaçage, tamisez le sucre glace dans un bol, puis ajoutez le jus de citron et suffisamment d''eau pour obtenir un glaçage épais mais assez fluide. Transférez 3 cuillères à soupe de glaçage dans un petit bol et réservez. Versez le reste du glaçage sur le gâteau refroidi – il doit être suffisamment liquide pour se stabiliser ; sinon, utilisez un couteau pour le lisser. Pétrissez la pâte d''amande pour la ramollir, puis incorporez suffisamment de colorant alimentaire rouge pour la rendre rouge vif. Rouler en 48 boules de cerises.","Lorsque le glaçage est presque pris, placez 2 boules l''une à côté de l''autre sur le glaçage, en rangées de 4, avec suffisamment d''espace entre chacune pour couper 24 morceaux égaux. Colorez le glaçage réservé avec du colorant alimentaire vert, puis transvasez-le dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille très fine, ou coupez simplement l''extrémité et dressez des queues de cerises à côté des boules de pâte d''amande. Lorsque tout le glaçage est bien pris, sortez le gâteau du moule et coupez-le en 24 morceaux."]','2026-01-11 00:04:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10190,6157,'fr','Gâteau marocain à l''orange et à la cardamome','Remplacez le sucre par du xylitol et troquez le beurre et l''huile contre une purée d''orange entière dans ce gâteau léger et piquant, avec de la poudre d''amandes et de la polenta.','["2 oranges, lavées","graines de 6 gousses de cardamome verte, écrasées","Pack de 225 g de xylitol (nous avons utilisé Total Sweet)","6 gros œufs","200 g de poudre d''amandes","50 g de polenta","25 g de farines autolevantes","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à soupe d''amandes effilées","Yaourt grec ou crème, pour servir"]','["Mettez les oranges entières dans une casserole, couvrez d''eau et faites bouillir à couvert pendant 1 h jusqu''à ce qu''un couteau les perce facilement. Si les oranges ne restent pas sous l’eau, placez un petit couvercle de casserole directement dessus pour les maintenir immergées. Retirez les oranges de l''eau et laissez-les refroidir, puis coupez-les en quartiers et retirez les graines et la moelle évidente là où se trouvait la tige. Réduisez les oranges en purée grossière avec un mixeur plongeant ou au robot culinaire et mettez-les dans un grand bol.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à cake à fond amovible de 21 cm de papier sulfurisé. Battre la cardamome, le xylitol et les œufs dans la purée d''orange, puis mélanger la poudre d''amandes avec la polenta, la farine et la levure chimique et incorporer jusqu''à consistance homogène. Versez le mélange dans le moule, nivelez le dessus et enfournez pour 40 minutes.","Au bout de 40 minutes, parsemez les amandes, remettez rapidement au four et enfournez encore 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Retirer du moule et laisser refroidir. Servir en tranches comme gâteau, ou avec du yaourt grec ou de la crème comme dessert."]','2026-01-11 00:04:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10191,9251,'fr','Tourte à la passion','Préparez-vous pour un dîner ou une fête avec ce gâteau gourmand et fruité qui peut être congelé jusqu''à 2 mois.','["225 g de beurre ramolli, coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de sucre en poudre","4 gros œufs","225 g de farines autolevantes","50g de noix de coco desséchée","le zeste finement râpé d''une orange","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","5 gros fruits de la passion","225 g de beurre ramolli, coupé en cubes","375 g de sucre glace tamisé","280 g de fromage frais entier","75 g de chocolat blanc"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Graisser 2\r\nBoîtes à sandwich en vrac de 20 cm et ligne\r\nles fonds avec des disques de papier sulfurisé.\r\nMettez le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, la farine, la noix de coco,\r\nzeste d''orange et levure chimique dans un aliment\r\nrobot ou mixeur et mélanger ou battre\r\njusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, épais et crémeux. Ne\r\ntrop mélanger sinon le gâteau sera plutôt dur\r\nque la lumière. Si vous n''avez pas de mixeur, mettez\r\ntous les ingrédients dans un bol et battre fort\r\navec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre et crémeuse.","Verser le mélange uniformément dans le\r\nmoules préparés et lisser la surface. Cuire au four\r\nsur la même grille au centre du four\r\npendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien levés et juste\r\ncommence à reculer des côtés de\r\nl''étain. Sortez les moules du four et\r\nlaisser refroidir 5 minutes avant de lancer un\r\ncouteau sur le pourtour des gâteaux et\r\ndémouler sur une grille. Décollez le\r\npapier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir complètement.","Lorsque les gâteaux sont complètement froids, très\r\ncoupez soigneusement horizontalement chacun d''eux\r\navec un couteau dentelé pour en faire 4 fines\r\ndes éponges. Pour faire le glaçage, coupez le\r\nles fruits de la passion en deux et les passer au tamis.\r\nPasser au tamis pour filtrer le jus\r\n– vous devriez avoir 4 cuillères à soupe. Mettre de côté et\r\nréservez les graines. Mettez le beurre, le sucre glace\r\net le fromage dans un robot culinaire ou un mixeur et\r\nmélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. N''en faites pas trop, sinon cela le fera\r\ndevenir liquide. Ajoutez petit à petit le fruit de la passion\r\njus et mélanger jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien combiné.","Placez une des éponges, côté coupé vers le bas,\r\nsur le fond métallique du moule à sandwich et\r\ndéposer un bol retourné sur un plateau. Cela va\r\naider à rendre le glaçage du gâteau plus facile. Propagation\r\navec environ un cinquième du glaçage – juste\r\nassez pour couvrir l''éponge. Utiliser une pagaie\r\nmouvement avec un couteau à palette ou une spatule souple pour\r\nle meilleur résultat, en essayant de garder le contact avec\r\nle gâteau pour éviter que la génoise ne se soulève.","Couvrir d''un deuxième gâteau, tartiner de\r\nglaçage et répéter les couches une fois de plus,\r\nen terminant par la dernière éponge, côté coupé vers le bas.\r\nÀ ce stade, vous devriez avoir superposé 4\r\ngâteaux avec glaçage aux fruits de la passion entre\r\n3 d''entre eux. Utilisez le reste du glaçage pour\r\nétaler sur le dessus et les côtés des gâteaux\r\npour couvrir complètement. Ne vous inquiétez pas si les côtés\r\nsont un peu salissants, comme le chocolat râpé\r\ndevrait couvrir toutes les imperfections.","Mettez le gâteau au réfrigérateur pendant 30 à 60 minutes\r\npour permettre au glaçage de prendre un peu. Grossièrement\r\nrâper le chocolat. Travailler à votre façon\r\nlentement autour du gâteau, cuillère râpée\r\nchocolat sur un couteau à palette et balayer\r\nsur les côtés du gâteau, en appuyant dessus\r\nle glaçage moelleux.","Retirez le gâteau du bol, faites glisser le\r\ncouteau à palette entre le gâteau et le\r\nbase en métal et transférer délicatement dans une assiette ou\r\nsupport à gâteau. (Si le glaçage est trop mou pour cela,\r\nmettez le gâteau au congélateur pendant 30 minutes et\r\npuis réessayez.) Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir.\r\nAvant de servir, arrosez d''1 cuillère à café de\r\ngraines de fruit de la passion réservées sur le dessus\r\nle gâteau. Si vous préparez un jour à l''avance, couvrez de\r\nun moule à gâteau ou un bol assez grand pour couvrir\r\nle gâteau sans le toucher, donc le gâteau\r\nne s’abîme pas au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10192,9252,'fr','Gâteau croquant aux framboises et amaretti','Délicieux gâteau croquant aux framboises et amaretti','["175 g de beurre mou","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs","140 g de farines autolevantes","85g d''amandes moulues","140 g de biscuits amaretti grossièrement cassés","250 g de framboises barquette","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","Carton de 142 ml de crème liquide"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante 140°C/conventionnel 160°C/gaz 3. Beurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake rond de 20 cm à fond meuble. Mettez le beurre, le sucre en poudre, les œufs, la farine et la poudre d''amandes dans un grand bol. Battre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que tous les ingrédients soient bien mélangés.","Étalez la moitié du mélange à gâteau dans le moule tapissé. Répartir la moitié des biscuits amaretti puis un tiers des framboises. Presser très légèrement sur le mélange à gâteau.","Verser des cuillerées à dessert du reste du mélange à gâteau sur les amaretti et les framboises et répartir uniformément. Répartissez le reste des amaretti et la moitié des framboises restantes sur le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 55 à 60 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre.","Laisser refroidir 15 minutes dans le moule. Passez un couteau sur le pourtour et démoulez. Il se conserve dans un récipient couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 2 jours.","Pour servir, sortir du réfrigérateur une heure avant de servir et saupoudrer légèrement de sucre glace avant de servir. Servir avec le reste de framboises et un peu de crème liquide."]','2026-01-11 00:04:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10193,9253,'fr','Gâteau mousse glacé aux baies','Un dessert glacé comme celui-ci est toujours utile pour recevoir… et la mousse rose vif fera parler d''elle !','["100 g de beurre ramolli","100 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de farines autolevantes","¾ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 œufs","500 g de baies mélangées (fraîches ou surgelées)","sucre glace, pour sucrer","3 feuilles de gélatine","3 blancs d''œufs","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","300 ml de crème fraîche fouettée"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBattez le beurre avec le sucre, puis battez\r\ndans la farine, la levure chimique, la vanille et\r\nœufs. Versez la pâte dans un moule chemisé de 24 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau à base lâche et enfournez pendant\r\n30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et bien cuits.","Retirez le gâteau du moule et\r\nlaisser refroidir sur une grille en laissant le fond\r\npapier au fond du gâteau. Quand\r\nle gâteau est complètement refroidi, coupe-le en deux\r\nhorizontalement. Nettoyez le moule et tapissez-le de\r\nfilm alimentaire. Mettez le dessus du gâteau dans\r\nla base de la boîte.","Pour faire la mousse, mettez les baies\r\nune casserole sur feu doux et portez-la délicatement à\r\nlaissez mijoter, vous ne devriez pas avoir besoin de plus\r\nliquide en libérant du jus. Sucrer à\r\ngoûter avec du sucre glace – vous voulez un\r\nsaveur légèrement acidulée comme ils le seront plus tard\r\nmélangé à une meringue sucrée. Génial\r\navec un mixeur plongeant ou dans un mixeur\r\net réduire en purée, puis passer au tamis. Tu devrais finir\r\ncompléter avec environ 250 ml de purée. Faire tremper le\r\ngélatine dans l''eau jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit souple, incorporer au\r\npurée de baies chaude et laisser refroidir.","Monter les blancs d''oeufs en neige ferme,\r\npuis incorporez le sucre en poudre en 4 fois.\r\nContinuez à fouetter jusqu''à obtenir une consistance ferme,\r\nmeringue brillante. Incorporer la purée de baies\r\nsuivi de la crème. Verser sur le\r\nbase en éponge, puis posez délicatement l''autre\r\nmorceau d''éponge sur le dessus, côté papier vers le haut.\r\nCongeler jusqu''à 40 minutes à 1 heure avant d''en avoir besoin\r\npuis retirez-le du congélateur et épluchez-le\r\nhors du papier. Retirez le moule et accrochez-le\r\nfilmer. Lorsque vous êtes prêt à servir, époussetez\r\nle dessus avec du sucre glace."]','2026-01-11 00:04:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10194,9254,'fr','Gâteau à l''orange et aux amandes au mascarpone aux agrumes','Un dessert incroyablement moelleux et délicieux','["3 grosses oranges","un morceau de beurre non salé","140 g de polenta, plus 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe","200 g d''amandes effilées","1 petite cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","7 gros œufs","2 gros jaunes d''œufs","350 g de sucre en poudre doré","500 g de mascarpone en casserole","3-4 cuillères à soupe de Cointreau ou autre liqueur d''orange, au goût","3-4 cuillères à soupe bombées de marmelade de citron vert maison (ou artisanale), au goût"]','["Faire bouillir deux oranges (entières) dans l''eau, avec\r\nle couvercle sur la casserole, pendant environ 1 heure ou jusqu''à\r\nsquidgy. Égoutter et laisser refroidir.","Beurrer un moule à charnière de 23 cm de large\r\net 7 cm/23 ?4 pouces de profondeur. Ajoutez 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe de\r\npolenta, renversez les grains jusqu''à ce que le moule soit\r\nenduit, puis éliminer l''excédent. Annuler.","Mélangez les amandes effilées en poudre granuleuse dans\r\nun robot culinaire, puis mélanger dans un bol avec le\r\npolenta et levure chimique. Annuler.","Coupez les oranges cuites en deux et retirez tout\r\npépins. Retirez le zeste de la troisième orange. Génial\r\nle zeste et les moitiés d''orange (avec la peau) à un\r\nlisser la purée au robot culinaire. Annuler.","Préchauffer le four à 180C/Gaz 4/four ventilé\r\n160C. A l''aide d''un batteur ou d''un batteur électrique, battre\r\nles œufs, les jaunes et le sucre pendant 5 à 7 bonnes minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte ressemble à un milk-shake très épais.","Incorporer rapidement le mélange d''amandes, puis le\r\nréduire en purée jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez la pâte dans le\r\nétain, en laissant au moins 1,5 cm/5?8 pouces en haut.","Cuire le gâteau au milieu du four. Après\r\n10 minutes, baissez la température à 150C/\r\nFour gaz 2/chaleur tournante 130C, enfourner 30 minutes,\r\npuis baisser la température à 140C/four ventilé\r\n120°C pendant encore 30 minutes (si vous disposez d''un gaz\r\nfour, cuire à gaz 4 pendant 10 minutes, puis à gaz\r\n2 pendant 11 à 4 heures jusqu''à cuisson complète sans réduire le\r\ntempérature plus loin). Le gâteau est prêt quand il\r\nest levé, est brun doré et le centre est juste\r\nferme – ne paniquez pas, il semble encore fragile.","Laissez refroidir le gâteau dans son moule (il coulera un\r\npeu), puis passez un couteau à palette sur le pourtour\r\navant de libérer les côtés. Essayez seulement de\r\ntransférez-le de la base métallique à un support décoratif\r\nassiette ou support si vous avez un lève-gâteau approprié.","Incorporer la liqueur et la marmelade dans le\r\nmascarpone. Servir le gâteau en quartiers épais\r\navec le mascarpone déposé dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:04:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10195,9255,'fr','Gâteau aux framboises et aux bleuets et au citron vert','Le régal parfait à l''heure du thé, ce gâteau moelleux et fruité est facile à préparer à son meilleur.','["225 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs moyens","2 citrons verts, zeste et jus râpés","250 g de farine autolevante, tamisée avec une pincée de sel, plus un peu de farine","25g d''amandes moulues","100g chacun de myrtilles et de framboises","8 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert (environ 4 citrons verts)","1 citron vert, zeste râpé","140 g de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à gâteau carré de 20 cm (pas à fond libre) de papier sulfurisé et beurrer le papier. Régler le four à 180°C/Gaz 4/four ventilé 160°C.","Crémer le beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à consistance légère. Incorporez progressivement les œufs en ajoutant un peu de farine vers la fin pour éviter le caillage. Incorporer le zeste de citron vert, puis incorporer la farine et les amandes. Incorporez suffisamment de jus de citron vert – environ 3 cuillères à soupe – pour obtenir une bonne consistance (le mélange devrait tomber facilement de la cuillère lorsque vous le tapotez).","Incorporez les trois quarts des myrtilles et des framboises et versez-les dans le moule préparé. Lissez la surface, puis répartissez le reste des fruits dessus – ils couleront à mesure que le gâteau lèvera.","Cuire au four pendant environ 1 heure (couvrir de papier d''aluminium si cela commence à trop dorer) ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement poussé au centre. Une brochette enfoncée au centre doit être propre une fois retirée.","Pendant ce temps préparez le sirop : mettez le jus de citron vert, le zeste et le sucre dans une petite casserole. Mettez sur feu doux et remuez sans laisser bouillonner. Le sucre doit se dissoudre un peu. Dès la sortie du four, piquez le tout avec une pique à brochette puis versez dessus le sirop. Pour conserver, laisser refroidir avant de l''emballer dans du papier et/ou du papier d''aluminium.","Retirez délicatement le gâteau du moule, jetez le papier de doublure et coupez-le en 12 morceaux pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10196,9256,'fr','Gâteau aux cerises et aux amandes','Pas seulement pour Pâques, ce délicieux gâteau constitue une bonne pièce maîtresse toute l''année','["250 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","5 œufs battus","250 g de farine autolevante, plus 2 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","le zeste d''une orange et 2 cuillères à soupe de jus","250 g de pâte d''amande naturelle, râpée grossièrement (plus facile si elle est préalablement réfrigérée)","½ cuillère à café d''essence d''amande, facultatif","200 g de cerises glacées, coupées en deux","100 g de sucre glace tamisé","50 g d''amandes effilées grillées","12 natural glacé cherries","le zeste d''1 orange"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/ventilateur 140°/gaz 3 et beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake rond et profond de 20 cm de diamètre. Battre le beurre et le sucre avec un batteur électrique ou un batteur de table jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse. Ajouter les œufs, 250 g de farine, la levure chimique, le zeste et le jus d''orange et bien battre jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse, crémeuse et homogène.","Mélanger les cerises dans les 2 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires de farine et incorporer à la pâte avec la pâte d''amande râpée et l''essence d''amande (le cas échéant). Verser dans le moule préparé, niveler et cuire au four pendant 1 h 30 ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien levé et doré. Une brochette en ressortira propre une fois prête. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis retourner sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec un peu plus d''1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour obtenir un glaçage lâche mais pas trop coulant. Répartissez les amandes sur le dessus\r\ndu gâteau et positionner les 12 cerises glacées sur le pourtour en utilisant un point de glaçage pour fixer. Versez le glaçage sur le gâteau et terminez par un peu de zeste d''orange."]','2026-01-11 00:04:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10197,9257,'fr','Gâteau à la crème sure aux bleuets et glaçage au cheesecake','Les myrtilles de cette recette éclateront dans votre bouche lorsque vous croquerez dans votre tranche. Le gâteau est délicieux avec une tasse de thé ou servi comme un dessert impressionnant','["175 g de beurre mou","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 gros œufs","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","142 ml de crème sure","3 x 125g barquettes de myrtilles","Pot de 200 g de fromage Philadelphia","100g de sucre glace"]','["Préchauffer le four à 160°C/ventilateur\r\nconventionnel 180C/gaz 4 et\r\nbeurrer et tapisser le fond d''un\r\ngâteau rond de 22 cm à base mobile\r\nmoule avec du papier sulfurisé antiadhésif\r\nou Bake-o-glide réutilisable.","Mettez le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, la farine, la levure chimique et\r\nvanille dans un bol. Battre avec\r\nune cuillère en bois pour 2-3\r\nminutes, ou avec une main électrique\r\nbatteur pendant 1 à 2 minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\nde couleur plus claire et bien\r\nmixte. Incorporer 4 cuillères à soupe d''aigre\r\ncrème, puis incorporez la moitié du\r\nbleuets avec une grande cuillère.","Versez le mélange dans le moule\r\net étalez-le à niveau. Cuire au four pendant 50\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé, se sent\r\nferme au toucher et ressorts\r\nen arrière lorsqu''on appuie légèrement.\r\nLaisser refroidir 10 minutes, puis prendre\r\nhors de la boîte et décollez le\r\npapier ou doublure. Laisser finir\r\nrefroidir sur une grille.","Pour faire le glaçage, battez\r\nle fromage à pâte molle avec le glaçage\r\nsucre et le reste\r\ncrème sure dans un bol jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse et crémeux. Propagation\r\nsur le dessus du refroidi\r\ngâteau (ne soyez pas impatient car\r\nle glaçage fondra si le\r\nle gâteau est trop chaud) et dispersez\r\navec le reste\r\nmyrtilles. Le gâteau sera\r\nconserver au réfrigérateur pendant quelques minutes\r\nde jours. Apportez-le dans la chambre\r\ntempérature pendant environ une heure\r\navant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10198,9258,'fr','Gâteau crumble aux abricots et myrtilles','Ce gâteau crumble est idéal pour un pique-nique, un pudding ou pour un thé l''après-midi entre amis.','["200 g de beurre ramolli","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 œufs battus","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","150 g de yaourt à la vanille en pot","300 g d''abricots pelés, coupés en deux et dénoyautés, ou utilisez plutôt une boîte de 410 g égouttée","225 g de barquette de myrtilles","25g de beurre","3 cuillères à soupe bombées de farine autolevante","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue"]','["Tapisser un moule oblong (21 x 30 cm) de papier sulfurisé et chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Battre le beurre, le sucre, la farine, la levure chimique, les œufs et le lait ensemble jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse. Verser dans le moule, niveler le dessus, puis cuire au four pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque pris.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le yaourt et les fruits et réalisez le crumble en frottant tous les ingrédients ensemble.","Lorsque le gâteau a cuit pendant 25 minutes, sortez-le du four. En travaillant rapidement, versez sur le yaourt, répartissez sur les fruits, puis recouvrez de crumble. Remettre au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette en ressorte propre. Servir chaud comme un pudding ou refroidi et coupé en carrés avec du thé."]','2026-01-11 00:04:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10199,9259,'fr','Gâteau à l''orange amère et aux graines de pavot','Ce gâteau tout-en-un facile est fait avec du yaourt pour une texture légère.','["3 cuillères à soupe de marmelade épaisse de bonne qualité (nous avons utilisé la marmelade Oxford Thick Cut de Frank Cooper)","Pot de 150 g de yaourt nature bio","3 œufs","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","175 g de beurre ramolli","le zeste d''1 orange","2 cuillères à café de graines de pavot, grillées","jus ½ orange","5 cuillères à soupe de marmelade"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/chaleur tournante 140°C/gaz 3. Beurrer un moule à cake profond et de taille moyenne (environ 20 x 10 cm mesurés à partir du haut), puis tapisser le fond d''un rectangle de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Mettez la marmelade dans une petite casserole, faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fondue (ou utilisez un pichet ou un bol allant au micro-ondes, puis faites cuire à puissance élevée pendant 30 secondes). Incorporez le yaourt, puis laissez refroidir quelques minutes.","Mettez le reste des ingrédients du gâteau dans un grand bol et battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse. Battez rapidement le\r\nmélanger le yaourt et la marmelade, puis verser dans le moule préparé. Ce sera assez liquide. Laissez le mélange en forme de monticule au milieu du moule plutôt que de niveler le dessus, pour l''aider à monter et à craquer au milieu.","Cuire au four pendant 1 h à 1 h 10 jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bien levé ; une brochette doit ressortir propre. Jetez un œil au gâteau après 45 minutes ; s''il a pris beaucoup de couleur, recouvrez-le légèrement de papier sulfurisé.  Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le jus d''orange et\r\nmarmelade dans une petite casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce que la marmelade fonde (ou utilisez le micro-ondes comme avant). Laisser refroidir, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage épais mais toujours coulant. Lorsque le gâteau est prêt, laissez-le refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis retournez-le sur une grille. Versez la garniture sur le gâteau pendant qu’il est juste chaud. Le gâteau est mieux servi le\r\njour où il est préparé, mais se conserve jusqu''à 3 jours bien emballé dans un contenant hermétique. Se congèlera jusqu''à 1 mois, non glacé."]','2026-01-11 00:04:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10200,9260,'fr','Gâteau étagé aux framboises','Essayez ce gâteau aux framboises léger et crémeux pour une douce gâterie estivale','["200 g de sucre en poudre","200g de beurre ramolli","4 œufs, battus","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","sucre glace, pour décorer","85 g de sucre en poudre","50 ml de liqueur Disaronno","Pot de 284 ml de crème double","250 g de mascarpone en casserole","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","150 g de framboises barquette"]','["Chauffer le four à 190c/ventilateur 170c/gaz 5. Beurre\r\n2 moules à sandwich de 20 cm et tapisser chacun d''un cercle\r\nde papier sulfurisé. Dans un grand bol, battre\r\nensemble tous les ingrédients du gâteau jusqu''à obtenir un\r\nmélange lisse et doux. Verser le mélange de manière égale\r\ndans les deux moules, en lissant le dessus de chacun\r\navec le dos de la cuillère. Cuire au four pendant\r\n20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et que le gâteau reprenne sa forme\r\nlorsqu''on appuie doucement. Retournez les gâteaux sur un\r\ngrille de refroidissement.","Faites chauffer le sucre, 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et le Disaronno\r\nensemble jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Laisser à\r\nlaisser refroidir, environ 10 minutes. Utilisez un grand couteau dentelé\r\ncouper chaque gâteau en deux. Badigeonner le sirop partout\r\nles quatre morceaux de gâteau avec un pinceau à pâtisserie.","Pour la garniture, fouettez la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle devienne molle\r\ndes sommets. Battez le mascarpone et le sucre en poudre\r\nun grand bol pour détacher, puis incorporer la crème et\r\nmélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Verser un tiers du mélange de crème sur l''un des\r\nles moitiés du gâteau. Répartir sur quelques fruits\r\n(tu ne veux pas couvrir le gâteau), puis sandwich\r\nune autre moitié par-dessus. Tartiner de crème et de fruits\r\ncomme avant et garnir d''une autre moitié du gâteau et\r\nplus de crème et de baies. Posez la moitié du gâteau final dessus\r\nhaut. Appuyez doucement, puis enveloppez-le fermement dans du film alimentaire.\r\nfilmer et laisser au réfrigérateur toute la nuit. Pour arrêter\r\nla crème de fondre, ce gâteau doit être\r\ntransporté au pique-nique dans une glacière. Au\r\npique-nique, retirez soigneusement le film alimentaire et la poussière avec\r\nsucre glace pour décorer, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10201,9261,'fr','Gâteau à l''orange et aux graines de pavot, sauce au chocolat','Un gâteau léger et piquant avec un filet de chocolat et des zestes confits pour une touche finale particulière','["250 g de beurre à température ambiante, plus 1 cuillère à soupe supplémentaire","200 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus 25 g","3 œufs","250 g de farine ordinaire tamisée","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","jus de 2 oranges, zeste de 4","50 g de graines de pavot grillées","100 ml de crème double","100 g de chocolat haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer un moule à charnière de 20 cm ou tapisser un\r\nmoule à gâteau de taille similaire avec du papier sulfurisé. Utilisation\r\nau batteur électrique, mélanger 200 g de beurre et\r\n200 g de sucre dans un grand bol. Battre jusqu''à ce que la lumière soit légère\r\net crémeux, environ 2 minutes, puis ajoutez le\r\nles œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien après vous\r\najoutez chacun. Versez la farine et la cuisson\r\npoudre, mélanger quelques secondes, puis ajouter le\r\njus d''orange, zeste de 2 oranges et pavot\r\ngraines. Mélangez le tout, puis versez dans\r\nle moule à gâteau. Enfourner 50 mn puis retirer\r\ndu four. Refroidir complètement dans le moule.","Pendant ce temps, préparez l''orange confite\r\nzeste en mélangeant le reste du zeste (finement tranché), 25g\r\nsucre et 100 ml d''eau dans une petite casserole. Apportez\r\nporter à ébullition et cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à épaississement.\r\nRetirez le zeste avec une écumoire sur\r\nune feuille de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif.","Pour la sauce, faites chauffer la crème dans un petit\r\ncasserole jusqu''à ébullition presque. Mettez le chocolat\r\net le reste du beurre dans un bol, puis versez\r\nla crème chaude dessus et laisser reposer 1 min pour\r\nfondre. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis laisser reposer\r\njusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit refroidi (s''il durcit, réchauffez-le simplement)\r\ndoucement). Verser la sauce sur le gâteau,\r\nsaupoudrer de zestes confits et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10202,9262,'fr','Gâteau crumble aux poires et à la viande hachée','Avec un soupçon d''épices et de petites poches de viande hachée, c''est un délicieux gâteau d''après Noël, excellent avec une crème anglaise chaude.','["4 poires fermes, pelées, évidées et coupées en morceaux de la taille d''un pouce","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","250 g de beurre salé ramolli (en utiliser un tout petit peu pour graisser)","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille ou de pâte de vanille","5 gros œufs","200 g de farines autolevantes","100 g d''amandes moulues","7 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","6 cuillères à soupe de viande hachée"]','["Mettez les poires dans une poêle antiadhésive\r\navec 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Couverture,\r\npuis faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 10 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres, en remuant de temps en temps.\r\nIl ne devrait pas y avoir de jus une fois les poires\r\nsont cuits. Ajoutez les épices; laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer puis tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un\r\nMoule à gâteau rond et profond de 20 cm. Mettez du beurre,\r\nsucre, vanille et ¼ cuillère à café de sel dans un grand\r\nbol. Battre avec un fouet électrique à main\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Ajouter les œufs et la farine,\r\nbattre jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporer les amandes\r\navec une cuillère. Retirer 85g de pâte et mettre\r\ndans un petit bol. À cela, ajoutez la plaine\r\nfariner et hacher dans le mélange avec des couverts\r\ncouteau pour obtenir un mélange moelleux et friable.","Versez la moitié de la préparation à gâteau dans le moule,\r\ngarnir avec la moitié des poires, parsemer sur la moitié\r\nviande hachée, puis versez le reste de la viande\r\nle mélange à gâteau sur le dessus. Disperser avec le reste\r\npoires, viande hachée, puis le mélange à crumble.\r\nSaupoudrer de 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre. Cuire au four pour\r\n1h30, en couvrant de papier d''aluminium après 1h, jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré, levé et une brochette insérée dans\r\nle milieu ressort propre. Refroidir dans le\r\nmouler 10 minutes, puis laisser refroidir sur une grille. Garder\r\ndans le papier de doublure, car cela l''aidera\r\nreste humide. Se conservera bien enveloppé dans un\r\nboîte hermétique, pendant 5 jours. Congeler 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10203,9263,'fr','Gâteau à la crème norvégien','Le lecteur de Good Food, Per Kind, partage sa recette d''un énorme gâteau fourré aux fruits, parfait pour un grand buffet de Pâques','["10 œufs","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","300 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de confiture de myrtilles ou de fraises","1l de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","100 ml de lait","3 paquets de myrtilles de 180 g"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 20 cm x 30 cm.\r\n– le papier de doublure doit remonter au moins\r\n2,5 cm au-dessus du bord de la boîte. Dans votre\r\nle plus grand bol, fouetter les œufs et le sucre\r\npendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle\r\net épaissi.","Tamisez la farine et la levure chimique\r\nle mélange d''œufs, puis utilisez une cuillère en métal\r\nincorporer délicatement. Versez-le dans le plat de cuisson.\r\nmoule et cuire au four pendant 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette\r\ninséré au centre en ressort propre\r\n– le gâteau doit être doré et printanier\r\nen arrière lorsqu''on le touche. Supprimer du\r\nfour et laisser reposer 5 minutes avant\r\ndémouler sur une grille pour laisser refroidir.","Une fois refroidi, prenez un couteau bien aiguisé et divisez\r\nen 3. Mélangez la confiture avec 1 cuillère à soupe tiède\r\nl''eau et fouettez la crème avec le\r\nl''essence de vanille et le sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''il\r\nconserve sa forme. Transférer une couche sur un\r\nassiette de service puis arroser de ¹/³ de\r\nle lait. Tartiner d''une fine couche de confiture,\r\npuis la crème, puis répartir sur 1 paquet de\r\nmyrtilles. Couvrir avec la deuxième couche\r\nde génoise puis répéter avec ¹/³ du\r\nle lait, une couche de confiture, la crème et 2ème\r\npaquet de myrtilles. Mettez la troisième couche de\r\néponger dessus, arroser du reste\r\nlait, puis recouvrir de crème et parsemer le\r\nle paquet de myrtilles restant sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:04:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10204,9264,'fr','Gâteau aux poires d''Anjou','Ce gâteau fruité est à son meilleur lorsqu''il est réalisé avec des poires fondantes et beurrées.','["50 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","500 g de poires mûres au beurre, pelées, évidées et hachées grossièrement","jus d''1 citron","1 tbsp poire William liqueur (optional)","75 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café bombée de levure chimique","75 g de sucre en poudre","2 oeufs, battus","2 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots, pour le glaçage","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","crème fraîche, to serve"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Ligne\r\nun moule à cake à fond amovible de 20 cm avec\r\npapier sulfurisé et badigeonner de beurre.","Mettez les poires préparées dans un bol avec\r\nle jus de citron et la Poire William, si\r\nutilisation, pour éviter qu’ils ne se décolorent.\r\nTamisez la farine et la levure chimique dans\r\nun bol, en ajoutant une pincée de sel et le\r\nsucre en poudre. Incorporez ensuite les œufs et\r\nbeurre fondu. Enfin, incorporez les poires\r\navec leurs jus. Versez le mélange à gâteau\r\ndans la boîte. Cuire au four environ 50 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette en ressorte propre. Lieu\r\nsur une grille et laisser refroidir légèrement\r\navant de démouler, doucement\r\nen retirant le parchemin.","Pour réaliser le glaçage, faire fondre la confiture d''abricots\r\navec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et passer au\r\ntamiser pour éliminer les grumeaux. Brossez le\r\ngâteau avec le glaçage, saupoudrer de sucre glace\r\net servir chaud avec de la crème fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:04:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10205,9265,'fr','Pain de thé aux pommes et aux épices','Parfait avec une théière fraîche, ce produit est aussi bon qu''un achat sur un marché de producteurs.','["175 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre muscovado léger, plus 1 cuillère à café","3 gros œufs battus","1 mangeant une pomme","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de fruits de vigne séchés mélangés","85g d''amandes moulues","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","175 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","½ cuillère à café de muscade moulue","arroser de jus de citron ou d''orange","1 cuillère à soupe de marmelade ou de confiture d''abricots"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer un moule à pain de 900 g/2 lb et le tapisser de\r\nune bande de papier sulfurisé ou un moule à cake\r\ndoublure (voir conseil ci-dessous). Battre ensemble le\r\nbeurre et sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et crémeux,\r\npuis incorporez les œufs un à un. Grille\r\nla moitié de la pomme et mélangez-la à la pâte\r\navec la vanille, les fruits secs et moulus\r\namandes. Mélanger la levure chimique, la farine\r\net des épices avec une pincée de sel,\r\npuis incorporer au mélange jusqu''à consistance homogène. Cuillère\r\ndans le moule et nivelez le dessus.","Tranchez finement la moitié de pomme restante,\r\nmélanger avec le jus de citron ou d''orange, piquer\r\nles tranches un peu dans la pâte, puis\r\nsaupoudrer d''1 cuillère à café de sucre supplémentaire. Cuire au four pour\r\n45 minutes, puis baissez le four à\r\n140C/ventilateur 120C/gaz 1. Couvrir le gâteau\r\navec du papier d''aluminium, puis cuire encore 45 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette soit insérée au milieu\r\nen ressort propre. Refroidir dans le moule.","Pour finir le gâteau, faire fondre la marmelade\r\nou de la confiture dans une petite casserole, tamiser pour retirer\r\ndes grumeaux, puis badigeonnez-en le gâteau pour\r\nglacer le dessus. Servir coupé en tranches épaisses,\r\net tartiner d''un peu de beurre, si vous le souhaitez. Se congèlera jusqu''à 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10206,9266,'fr','Gâteau Bakewell aux framboises','Ce simple gâteau aux amandes est une excellente façon d''utiliser les framboises cueillies vous-même.','["140 g d''amandes moulues","140 g de beurre ramolli","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","140 g de farines autolevantes","2 œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250g de framboises","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées","sucre glace, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4\r\net une ligne de base et graisser à 20 cm de profondeur\r\nmoule à gâteau à fond amovible. Blitzer le sol\r\namandes, beurre, sucre, farine, œufs et\r\nl''extrait de vanille dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce\r\nbien combiné.","Répartir la moitié du mélange sur le moule à cake\r\net lisser sur le dessus. Dispersez le\r\nframboises, puis versez-y une cuillerée\r\nle reste du mélange à gâteau sur le dessus et\r\ngrossièrement répandu – vous pourriez trouver ceci\r\nplus facile à faire avec les doigts. Dispersion\r\navec des amandes effilées et enfourner pendant\r\n50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir, retirer de\r\nle moule et saupoudrer de sucre glace pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10207,9267,'fr','Gâteau au citron et aux myrtilles','Les enfants peuvent aider à préparer cette gâterie printanière simple – délicieuse avec de la crème de citron et du yaourt supplémentaires comme pud, ou servie avec une tasse de thé.','["175 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","Pot de 500 ml de yaourt grec (il vous en faut 100 ml dans le gâteau, le reste pour servir)","Pot de 300g de bon lemon curd (il en faut 2 cuillères à soupe dans le gâteau, le reste pour servir)","3 œufs","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron, plus un zeste supplémentaire pour servir, si vous le souhaitez","200 g de farines autolevantes","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g de barquette de myrtilles (il en faut 85 g dans le gâteau, le reste pour servir)","140 g de sucre glace","fleurs comestibles, comme des primevères violettes ou jaunes, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer un moule à pain de 2 lb et tapisser d''un long\r\nbande de papier sulfurisé. Mettez 100g\r\nyaourt, 2 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron, le ramolli\r\nbeurre, œufs, zeste de citron, farine et semoule\r\nsucre dans un grand bol à mélanger. Rapidement\r\nmélanger avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que la pâte\r\nvient juste de se réunir. Grattez la moitié dans le\r\nboîte préparée. Pesez 85 g de myrtilles de\r\nla barquette et en saupoudrer la moitié dans le moule,\r\ngrattez le reste de la pâte dessus, puis\r\nrépartissez l''autre moitié des 85 g de baies\r\nen haut. Enfourner pendant 1h10 à 1h15\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, et une brochette enfoncée dans le\r\nle centre ressort propre.","Laisser refroidir dans le moule, puis soulever délicatement dessus\r\nune assiette de service à glacer. Tamisez le sucre glace\r\ndans un bol et incorporer suffisamment de jus de citron\r\npour faire un glaçage épais et lisse. Propagation\r\nsur le dessus du gâteau, puis décorer\r\navec du zeste de citron et des fleurs comestibles, si\r\ntu aimes. Servir en tranches avec du citron supplémentaire\r\ncaillé, yaourt grec et myrtilles."]','2026-01-11 00:04:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10208,9268,'fr','Génoise collante aux agrumes','Un excellent dessert pour nourrir une foule à la fin d’un déjeuner dominical – c’est comme une version cuite au four d’une génoise au sirop cuite à la vapeur.','["4 oranges moyennes","6 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré, plus un peu pour servir, facultatif","200 g de beurre à température ambiante, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de cassonade molle","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g d''amandes moulues","4 gros œufs"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nRâpez finement le zeste de 2 oranges dans\r\nun grand bol. Coupez la peau et la moelle de\r\ntoutes les oranges avec un couteau dentelé, et\r\ntrancher assez épaissement.","Verser uniformément le sirop doré sur\r\nla base d''un gâteau rond de 23 cm graissé\r\nétain. Il n''est pas nécessaire de tapisser la boîte et\r\nil ne devrait pas avoir un fond lâche\r\nsinon le sirop bouillonnera.\r\nDisposez dessus les meilleures tranches d''orange\r\ndu sirop et hachez finement celui-ci\r\nne rentre pas.","Mettez tous les ingrédients restants dans le\r\nbol avec le zeste et l''orange hachée.\r\nBattre avec un batteur électrique à main jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse. Verser sur les oranges,\r\nétaler légèrement et faire un creux profond\r\nau centre du mix avec l''arrière\r\nd''une cuillère – cela garantira que le gâteau\r\nmonte uniformément.","Cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme lorsque\r\npressé. Laisser reposer 5 minutes avant\r\nse révéler. Arroser de sirop doré\r\nsi vous le souhaitez, et servez avec de la crème anglaise ou\r\nglace."]','2026-01-11 00:04:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10209,9269,'fr','Cake poire, noisettes & chocolat','Gâteau moelleux et fruité à la poire, aux noisettes et au chocolat – essayez-le tiède avec de la crème à l''heure du thé','["100 g de noisettes blanchies","140 g de farines autolevantes","175 g de beurre coupé en petits morceaux","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 gros œufs, battus","5 petites poires Conférence mûres","50 g de chocolat noir coupé en petits morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante 140C/\r\nconventionnel 160C/gaz 3. Beurre et ligne\r\nle fond d''un moule à cake rond de 20 cm. Broyer\r\nles noisettes dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce\r\nassez bien. Ajouter la farine et mélanger brièvement.\r\nAjouter le beurre et mélanger jusqu''à ce qu''il se forme\r\ndes miettes. Ajoutez le sucre et les œufs et mélangez\r\nbrièvement. Épluchez, épépinez et hachez deux poires. \r\nMélanger les poires et le chocolat\r\nlégèrement dans le mélange à gâteau.","Verser le mélange dans le moule préparé\r\net lisser le dessus. Peler, épépiner et trancher\r\nles poires restantes et répartissez-les sur le\r\ndessus du gâteau. Appuyez légèrement et\r\ncuire au four pendant 50 à 60 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme à la\r\ntoucher. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis\r\ndémouler et laisser refroidir sur une grille. Réchauffez le\r\nconfiture et badigeonner le dessus. Servir chaud\r\nou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:04:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10210,9270,'fr','Cake courgettes, citron & thym','Inspirée du jardin familial, cette pâtisserie parfumée et moderne tire le meilleur parti d''une récolte de courgettes de fin d''été.','["350 g de beurre doux, ramolli à température ambiante, plus un peu pour graisser","350 g de sucre en poudre doré","zester 2 citrons non cirés","6 gros œufs","400 g de farine autolevante","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","4 courgettes (environ 600 g), râpées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de thym hachées","250 g de mascarpone","250 g de beurre doux, ramolli à température ambiante","zester 2 citrons non cirés","900 g de sucre glace","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","12 brins de thym (utilisez une combinaison de brins plus fins et plus épais)","1 blanc d''oeuf légèrement battu","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 citrons non cirés, tranchés finement en rondelles","peinture dorée et feuille d''or (facultatif)"]','["Commencez par réaliser les décorations. Pour le thym confit, mettez le sucre dans une assiette, badigeonnez le thym de blanc d''œuf, puis roulez-le dans le sucre. Secouez une partie de l''excédent, puis laissez sécher complètement les brins sur un morceau de papier sulfurisé.","Pour les tranches de citron confit, versez le sucre dans une casserole avec 200 ml d''eau. Faites chauffer doucement pour dissoudre le sucre, puis portez le sirop à ébullition. Déposez les tranches de citron et laissez cuire 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Retirez délicatement les tranches du sirop et placez-les sur un morceau de papier sulfurisé pour les faire sécher. (Soulevez-les doucement car ils seront assez délicats et vous souhaitez les conserver en rondes si possible.) Gardez le sirop restant pour badigeonner le gâteau.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160° chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond de deux moules à charnière de 20 cm. Préparez les quatre génoises en deux lots. Pour préparer la première fournée, dans un batteur sur socle ou dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battre 175 g de beurre avec 175 g de sucre et le zeste d''1 citron jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse. Battez doucement trois œufs ensemble dans un pichet. Ajoutez progressivement l''œuf au mélange, en raclant les côtés et en fouettant bien après chaque ajout. Dans un autre bol, mélangez 200 g de farine autolevante, 1 cuillère à café de levure chimique et une pincée de sel, et incorporez le tout à la préparation à gâteau. Incorporez enfin 300 g de courgettes et 1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym. Répartissez le mélange dans les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre.","Pendant que les génoises sont encore chaudes, piquez-les partout avec une pique à brochette et badigeonnez-les d''un peu du sirop de citron réservé. Une fois suffisamment refroidi pour être manipulé, retirez-le des moules et placez-le sur une grille. Préparez et cuisez la deuxième fournée de gâteaux avec le reste des ingrédients – vous pouvez utiliser le même papier sulfurisé, il suffit de regraisser le papier sulfurisé et les parois des moules.","Lorsque les gâteaux sont refroidis, préparez le glaçage. Fouetter tous les ingrédients avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et mousseuse.","À l''aide d''un plateau tournant à gâteau, si vous en avez un, prenez les gâteaux en sandwich avec un peu de glaçage. À l''aide d''une spatule, étalez une fine couche de glaçage tout autour du gâteau et laissez prendre au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes. (Cette couche est connue sous le nom de « couche de miettes » car elle emprisonne les miettes détachées à la surface du gâteau – ainsi lorsque vous appliquez une deuxième couche de glaçage, le gâteau sera bien lisse.) Si vous manquez de temps, mettez-le au congélateur pendant 5 minutes.","Une fois refroidi, recouvrez complètement le gâteau d''une deuxième couche de glaçage pour obtenir une finition lisse. Collez les tranches de thym confit et de citron confit sur un côté du gâteau et recouvrez-les comme s''ils étaient en cascade.","Remettez le gâteau au réfrigérateur ou au congélateur jusqu''à ce que le glaçage soit complètement pris. Pour plus de reflets, utilisez un pinceau fin pour appliquer un peu de peinture dorée sur les tranches de citron pour un effet bruni et automnal, et parsemez des morceaux de feuille d''or au fur et à mesure, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10211,9271,'fr','Gâteau d''attribution','Le gâteau aux carottes rencontre la courgette dans cette pâtisserie de légumes ultime de la lectrice de Good Food Katie Ready – nappez de glaçage au fromage à la crème et terminez avec des noix hachées.','["200 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 oeufs, battus","200 ml d''huile de tournesol","200g de farine d''épeautre","¾ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","¾ cuillère à café de levure chimique","¾ cuillère à café de cannelle","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","200 g de carottes râpées","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 oeufs, battus","125 ml d''huile de tournesol","225g de farine d''épeautre","¾ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","¾ cuillère à café de levure chimique","¾ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","250 g de courgettes râpées","50 g de beurre ramolli","250 g de fromage frais","600 g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser 4 moules à cake de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé (ou en utiliser 2 et réaliser d''abord les génoises aux carottes, puis les couches de courgettes).","Commencez par réaliser les couches de carottes. Mettez le sucre, les œufs et l''huile dans un grand bol à mélanger. À l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battre jusqu''à incorporation. Tamisez la farine et tous les ingrédients secs dans le même bol, puis incorporez délicatement avant d''ajouter la carotte, une pincée de sel et l''extrait de vanille. Remuer pour combiner.","Répartissez le mélange de gâteau aux carottes entre 2 moules à gâteau préparés et faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et ferme au toucher. Laissez les gâteaux refroidir dans les moules pendant quelques minutes, puis démoulez-les sur des grilles lorsqu''ils sont suffisamment refroidis pour être manipulés.","Pendant ce temps, préparez les couches de courgettes. Mettez le sucre, les œufs et l''huile dans un grand bol et mélangez à l''aide d''un fouet à main. Tamisez les ingrédients secs et incorporez-les, puis ajoutez les courgettes et mélangez.","Versez le mélange à gâteau aux courgettes dans les 2 moules à gâteau restants et faites cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir dans les moules, puis démouler sur des grilles pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pour faire le glaçage, versez le beurre dans un grand bol et battez avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez le fromage à la crème et battez à nouveau. Tamisez le sucre glace et battez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Superposez les gâteaux en alternant, en étalant un peu de glaçage entre chaque couche au fur et à mesure. Couvrir tout le gâteau avec le reste du glaçage et servir. Se conserve 2 jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:04:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10212,9272,'fr','Cake pistache, courgette & citron','Grande en saveur mais légère en texture, cette pâtisserie facile est tout aussi bonne emballée dans une boîte pour un pique-nique ou servie avec du yaourt grec pour le dessert.','["175 g de pistaches décortiquées","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g de beurre à température ambiante, plus un peu pour graisser","280 g de farine nature","1¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","3 gros œufs","140 g de yaourt entier à la grecque (achetez un grand pot et gardez le reste pour servir à côté)","le zeste et le jus de 3 citrons","140 g de courgettes grossièrement râpées","175 g de sucre glace","2 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron (facultatif)"]','["Mettez 150 g de pistaches et le sucre dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce que les noix soient moulues très finement.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4, beurrer un moule à cake de 20 x 30 cm et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé. Versez le sucre pistache dans un grand bol à mélanger avec le beurre, la farine, la levure chimique et le bicarbe, les œufs, le yaourt ainsi que le zeste et le jus de 2 citrons. Battre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance lisse et homogène.","Incorporez la courgette jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé, puis grattez-la dans le moule préparé. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit levé et doré et qu''un cure-dent enfoncé au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir.","Une fois le gâteau complètement refroidi, démoulez-le et retirez le papier sulfurisé. Tamisez le sucre glace dans un bol et incorporez progressivement suffisamment de jus de citron pour obtenir une consistance plutôt liquide. Si vous manquez de jus, continuez à mélanger avec de l''eau. Arrosez abondamment le gâteau et répétez avec de la crème au citron, si vous le souhaitez. Hachez grossièrement les pistaches restantes et répartissez-les sur le glaçage avec le reste du zeste de citron. Laisser reposer 10 minutes, puis couper en carrés et servir avec du yaourt grec. Se conserve 3 jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:04:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10213,9273,'fr','Gâteau aux courgettes et à l''orange avec glaçage au fromage à la crème','Oubliez le gâteau aux carottes, ce gâteau aux courgettes léger et moelleux est plein de saveurs et il accompagne parfaitement une tasse de thé.','["350 g de courgettes (pas besoin de les éplucher)","200 g de cassonade molle","125 ml d''huile de tournesol","3 gros œufs légèrement battus","le zeste râpé d''une orange","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de raisins secs","300 g de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","200 g de fromage frais entier","100 g de sucre glace tamisé"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler légèrement et tapisser un moule à cake de 1 kg d''une bande de papier sulfurisé. Râpez finement les courgettes, puis essorez-en le plus de liquide possible avec vos mains (trop de liquide rendra le gâteau détrempé).","Mélangez les courgettes avec le sucre, l''huile de tournesol, les œufs, le zeste d''orange, la vanille et les raisins secs, puis incorporez la farine et la levure chimique jusqu''à disparition, mais sans trop mélanger.","Versez le mélange dans le moule et enfournez pendant 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré dans le gâteau en ressorte propre. Retirer du moule et laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Pendant ce temps, battez le cream cheese avec le sucre glace (ne pas trop battre car cela pourrait rendre le mélange trop mou), puis mettez au frais. Répartir sur le gâteau refroidi, parsemer de zeste et réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir. Se conserve une semaine au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10214,9274,'fr','Gâteau à la moelle et aux pacanes, glaçage à l''érable','L''utilisation de moelle râpée dans ce gâteau simple lui donne une excellente texture - garnir de glaçage au fromage à la crème','["250 ml d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour le graissage","300 g de farine autolevante","3 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","250 g de cassonade légère et molle","4 gros œufs","le zeste et le jus finement râpés d''1 orange","300 g de chair à moelle, grossièrement râpée et essorée de tout liquide","200 g de noix de pécan hachées grossièrement","50 g de beurre ramolli","250 g de fromage frais","4 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à charnière rond de 22 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau avec du papier sulfurisé. Tamisez le\r\nla farine, les épices et la levure chimique dans\r\nun bol et émiettez-le avec le sucre. Dans un\r\ndans un autre bol, battez les œufs avec le\r\nle zeste et le jus d''orange, puis versez-y le\r\nhuile. Ajoutez la moelle et 150 g de\r\nnoix de pécan au mélange d''huile, puis battre\r\ndans la farine jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Astuce dans\r\nle moule à cake, lisser le dessus et enfourner\r\npendant 1h20, ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette arrive\r\npropre. Laisser refroidir 30 mn\r\nle moule avant de le retirer et de le placer\r\nune grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pendant que le gâteau refroidit, préparez le\r\nglaçage en battant tous les ingrédients\r\nensemble. Une fois le gâteau refroidi,\r\nutiliser une spatule pour étaler le glaçage\r\nle sommet. Saupoudrer le reste du\r\nnoix de pécan pour décorer et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10215,9275,'fr','Gâteau à la citrouille d''Halloween','Comme un gâteau aux carottes ? Alors essayez d''utiliser vos restes de citrouille dans ce plat de cuisson astucieux pour Halloween.','["300 g de farine autolevante","300 g de sucre muscovado léger","3 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","175 g de raisins secs","½ cuillère à café de sel","4 œufs, battus","200 g de beurre fondu","le zeste d''1 orange","1 cuillère à soupe de jus d''orange","500 g (poids pelé) de chair de potiron ou de courge musquée, râpée","200 g de fromage à pâte molle","85 g de beurre ramolli","100 g de sucre glace tamisé","le zeste d''1 orange et le jus de la moitié"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 30 x 20 cm ou un petit\r\nplat à rôtir avec du papier sulfurisé. Mettre\r\nla farine, le sucre, les épices, le bicarbonate de soude,\r\nles raisins secs et le sel dans un grand bol et remuer\r\ncombiner. Battre les oeufs dans le fondu\r\nbeurre, incorporer le zeste et le jus d''orange, puis\r\nmélanger avec les ingrédients secs jusqu''à homogénéité.\r\nIncorporer le potiron. Versez la pâte dans le\r\nmouler et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et\r\nélastique au toucher.","Pour faire le glaçage, battez ensemble le\r\nfromage, beurre, sucre glace, zeste d''orange\r\net 1 cuillère à café de jus jusqu''à consistance lisse et crémeuse,\r\npuis réserver au réfrigérateur. Quand le gâteau\r\nest cuit, laissez refroidir 5 minutes puis retournez-le sur un\r\ngrille de refroidissement. Piquez le tout avec une brochette\r\net arroser du reste du jus d''orange\r\nalors qu''il est encore chaud. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Si vous le souhaitez, coupez les bords du gâteau.\r\nDonnez un coup rapide au glaçage pour le détacher,\r\npuis, à l''aide d''un couteau à palette, étalez sur le\r\ndessus du gâteau en pics et en tourbillons. Si tu es\r\npréparer le gâteau à l''avance, le conserver au réfrigérateur\r\npuis retire autant de morceaux que tu veux\r\n30 minutes environ avant de servir. Gardera,\r\ncouvert, jusqu''à 3 jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10216,9276,'fr','Gâteau aux panais et au sirop d''érable de Catherine Berwick','Gagnant du concours de gâteaux du 20e anniversaire de Good Food, nous pensons que c''est le nouveau gâteau aux carottes','["175 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de sucre démérara","100 ml de sirop d''érable","3 gros œufs","250 g de farine autolevante","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","250 g de panais pelés et râpés","1 pomme moyenne, pelée, épépinée et râpée","50 g de noix de pécan hachées grossièrement","le zeste et le jus d''une petite orange","sucre glace, pour servir","250 g de mascarpone en pot","3-4 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer 2 moules à sandwich de 20 cm et tapisser\r\nles bases avec du papier sulfurisé.\r\nFaire fondre le beurre, le sucre et le sirop d''érable dans un\r\nfaire chauffer à feu doux, puis laisser refroidir légèrement.\r\nIncorporez les œufs à ce mélange, puis remuez\r\ndans la farine, la levure chimique et mélangée\r\nd''épices, suivi du panais râpé,\r\npomme, pacanes hachées, zeste d''orange et\r\njus. Répartir dans les moules, puis enfourner\r\npendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les sommets reprennent leur forme\r\nlorsqu''on appuie légèrement.","Refroidissez légèrement les gâteaux dans les moules\r\navant de le démouler sur une grille pour\r\nrefroidir complètement. Juste avant de servir, mélangez\r\nensemble le mascarpone et l''érable\r\nsirop. Répartir sur un gâteau et un sandwich\r\navec l''autre. Saupoudrer de sucre glace juste\r\navant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10217,9277,'fr','Le relooking ultime : le gâteau aux carottes','Angela Nilsen repense les ingrédients traditionnels et les techniques de cuisson pour créer une version plus saine d''un classique','["1 orange moyenne","140g de raisins secs","125 ml d''huile de colza","115 g de farine complète nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique, plus une pincée","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café bombée de cannelle moulue","140 g de sucre muscovado noir","280 g de carottes finement râpées (environ 375 à 400 g de carottes avant épluchage)","2 œufs","115 g de farines autolevantes","100 g de fromage à pâte molle léger, directement sorti du réfrigérateur","100 g de fromage blanc","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace tamisé","½ cuillère à café de zeste d''orange finement râpé","1 ½ cuillère à café de jus de citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/chaleur tournante 140°/gaz 3. Pour le gâteau, râper finement le zeste de l''orange et presser 3 cuillères à soupe de jus. Versez le jus sur les raisins secs dans un bol, incorporez le zeste, puis laissez tremper pendant que vous préparez le gâteau. Huiler légèrement et tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake carré de 20 cm de profondeur. Mélangez les farines avec 1 cuillère à café de levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude et la cannelle.","Séparez l''un des œufs. Mettez le blanc dans un petit bol et le jaune dans un grand. Cassez l''œuf entier restant avec le jaune, puis versez le sucre. Fouetter ensemble pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et mousseux. Versez lentement l''huile et continuez à fouetter à basse vitesse jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le mélange de farine, moitié à la fois, et incorporez-le délicatement au mélange d''œufs avec une spatule en caoutchouc ou une grande cuillère. Le mélange sera assez ferme. Mettez la pincée supplémentaire de levure chimique avec le blanc d''œuf et fouettez jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous.","Incorporez la carotte, les raisins secs (et tout liquide) dans le mélange de farine. Incorporez délicatement le blanc d''oeuf battu, puis versez dans le moule. Secouez le moule pour niveler le mélange. Cuire au four pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et ferme ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule 5 min, démouler sur une grille, retirer le papier, puis laisser refroidir.","Pour faire le glaçage, mélangez le fromage à pâte molle, le fromage blanc, le sucre glace et le zeste d''orange – ne battez pas trop. Incorporer le jus de citron. Faites tourner le glaçage sur le gâteau et coupez-le en 16 carrés. Ce gâteau est encore meilleur s''il est bien emballé pendant un jour ou deux avant de le glacer et de le manger. Se conserve jusqu''à 5 jours non glacé dans une boîte hermétique, ou au réfrigérateur s''il est glacé."]','2026-01-11 00:04:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10218,5141,'fr','Gâteau au citron sans gluten','Grâce à un ingrédient surprise spécial, ce gâteau sans gluten reste magnifiquement moelleux. À la grande surprise de tous, c''est de la purée de pomme de terre !','["200 g de beurre ramolli","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs","175g d''amandes moulues (pour qu''elles soient sans noix, voir ci-dessous)","250 g de purée de pommes de terre","zester 3 citrons","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique sans gluten (Supercook en fait une)","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre cristallisé","jus d''1 citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake rond de 20 cm de profondeur. Battre le sucre et le beurre ensemble jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse, puis ajouter progressivement l''œuf,\r\nbattre après chaque ajout. Incorporer les amandes, la purée de pomme de terre froide, le zeste de citron\r\net la levure chimique.","Versez dans le moule, nivelez le dessus, puis faites cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu du gâteau en ressorte propre. Démoulez sur une grille après 10 minutes de refroidissement. Mélangez le sucre cristallisé et le jus de citron, puis versez-le sur le dessus du gâteau en le laissant couler sur les côtés. Laissez le gâteau refroidir\r\ncomplètement avant de le trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:04:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10219,9278,'fr','Gâteau aux courgettes','Utilisez une surabondance de jardin dans ce pain éponge sucré et épicé : les légumes cachés le gardent moelleux et les noix ajoutent du croquant.','["beurre, pour le moule","2 gros œufs","125 ml d''huile végétale","85 g de cassonade molle","350 g de courgettes grossièrement râpées","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","300 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de cannelle","¼ cuillère à café de muscade","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","85 g de noix hachées grossièrement","140 g de raisins secs"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à pain de 2 lb de pâte à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin. Dans un grand bol, fouetter\r\nles œufs, l''huile et le sucre, puis ajoutez le\r\ncourgettes et vanille.","Dans un autre bol, mélanger le reste\r\ningrédients avec une pincée de sel.","Incorporer les ingrédients secs dans le liquide humide\r\nmélange, puis versez dans le moule. Cuire au four pour\r\n1 h, ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette insérée dans le\r\nle centre ressort propre. Laisser refroidir,\r\npuis servir ou congeler jusqu''à 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10220,9279,'fr','Pain à la citrouille et au gingembre','Un pain à gâteau moelleux à servir en tranches épaisses et beurré - il est bon pour les boîtes à lunch et avec une tasse de thé','["175 g de beurre fondu","140g de miel clair","1 gros oeuf, battu","250 g de citrouille crue pelée ou de courge musquée, grossièrement râpée (environ 500 g/1 lb 2 oz avant de la peler et de l''épépiner)","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","350 g de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180C/gaz 4/\r\nventilateur 160C. Beurrer et tapisser le fond\r\net deux côtés longs d''un pain de 1,5 kg\r\nmoule avec une bande de papier sulfurisé.","Mélangez le beurre, le miel et l''œuf et incorporez le potiron ou la courge. Incorporez ensuite le sucre, la farine et le gingembre.","Verser dans le moule préparé et saupoudrer le dessus de sucre demerara. Cuire au four pendant 50 à 60 minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\nlevé et brun doré. Laisser reposer 5 minutes dans le moule, puis démouler et laisser refroidir sur une grille. Servir\r\nen tranches épaisses et beurrées."]','2026-01-11 00:04:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10221,9280,'fr','Gâteau glacé aux courgettes et au citron','Ce gâteau succulent est citronné et léger, avec une touche d''agrumes supplémentaire provenant du filet de sirop de citron.','["Paquet de 250 g de beurre doux, très mou, plus un peu pour le moule","3 citrons non cirés","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs","2 courgettes moyennes, râpées grossièrement (vous aurez besoin de 300 g de chair)","1 cuillère à café de graines de pavot, plus un peu pour décorer","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g de farine autolevante","100 g de farine complète nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","85g de sucre glace","Paquet de 200 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","4 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer 2 moules à sandwich de 20 cm et tapisser\r\nles bases avec du papier sulfurisé. Zeste\r\n2 citrons, puis pressez leur jus dans un\r\nbol séparé. Mettez 200g de beurre, la roulette\r\nsucre, œufs, courgettes, graines de pavot,\r\nla vanille et le zeste de citron dans un bol à mélanger.\r\nBattre jusqu''à obtenir une pâte crémeuse. Incorporer 1 cuillère à soupe\r\nle jus de citron, les farines, la levure chimique\r\net ¼ cuillère à café de sel. Versez le mélange dans le\r\nmoules, puis cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés,\r\ndoré et élastique au milieu.","Faites un filet en mélangeant une autre cuillère à soupe\r\njus de citron avec 25 g de sucre glace. Mettez le\r\nle reste du sucre glace et du beurre dans un\r\nbol, ajoutez le fromage à pâte molle, le reste\r\njus de citron (environ 2 cuillères à soupe) et râper\r\nle zeste du citron final. Battre pour faire un\r\nglaçage crémeux et lisse.","Lorsque les gâteaux sont prêts, laissez-les refroidir pendant\r\n15 minutes dans leurs moules, puis retournez sur un\r\ngrille de refroidissement. Piquez plusieurs fois avec\r\nun bâton à cocktail, verser sur la bruine\r\net laisser refroidir complètement. Peut être congelé à\r\ncette étape pendant 1 mois maximum. Mettez un gâteau\r\nsur une assiette de service et tartiner avec juste\r\nsous la moitié du glaçage. Réparti sur le\r\ncrème de citron, si vous en utilisez. Top avec le deuxième\r\ngâteau, étaler le reste du glaçage dessus\r\nle dessus et saupoudrer de graines de pavot."]','2026-01-11 00:04:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10222,9281,'fr','Pain piquant aux carottes et au gingembre','Les amateurs de gâteau au gingembre et de gâteau aux carottes devraient apprécier celui-ci. Il s''adoucit et s''améliore en quelques jours','["100 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour le moule","100 g de sucre muscovado noir","50 g de mélasse noire","50 g de sirop doré (ou utilisez plus de mélasse noire si vous aimez votre gâteau au gingembre très foncé)","le zeste d''1 orange","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","1 grosse carotte râpée (vous aurez besoin de 140 g de chair)","5 boules de gingembre provenant d''un pot, hachées finement","175 g de farine autolevante","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 cuillères à café de gingembre moulu","¼ cuillère à café de poivre noir fraîchement moulu","2 œufs","140 g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer puis tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g d''un\r\nbande de papier sulfurisé. Mettez le beurre,\r\nsucre, mélasse, sirop et la moitié des zestes\r\ndans une grande casserole. Chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que\r\ntout a fondu ensemble.","Ajouter la carotte, les ¾ de la carotte hachée\r\ngingembre, toute la farine, bicarbe, ¼ cuillère à café de sel,\r\nle gingembre moulu, le poivre et les œufs au\r\ncasserole et remuez bien jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse\r\npâte. Verser dans le moule et enfourner pendant\r\n45 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient brun foncé et levés\r\net une brochette insérée au milieu\r\nen ressort propre. Laisser refroidir 20 minutes\r\nle moule, puis démoulez-le sur une grille.","Tamisez le sucre glace dans un bol, ajoutez\r\nles zestes restants, puis incorporez-les suffisamment\r\njus de citron (environ 4 cuillères à café devraient suffire) pour\r\nfaire un glaçage lisse et épais. Couvrir le\r\nsurface du glaçage avec un film alimentaire jusqu''à ce\r\nprêt à décorer le gâteau.","Lorsque le gâteau est complètement refroidi,\r\nétalez le glaçage sur le dessus et laissez-le\r\ncouler sur les côtés. Dispersez-vous avec le\r\ngingembre haché réservé. Autoriser à définir,\r\npuis coupez-le en tranches et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10223,9282,'fr','Brownies à la betterave','Avec environ la moitié de la graisse des brownies ordinaires, ils constituent un plaisir légèrement moins coupable, mais ont toujours cette intense saveur chocolatée.','["500 g de betteraves crues entières (3-4 betteraves moyennes)","100 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de tablette de chocolat noir (70% de cacao)","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs","100 g de farine nature","25g de cacao en poudre"]','["Portez une paire de gants en caoutchouc pour arrêter\r\nvos mains ne se tachent pas, puis le haut, la queue\r\net épluchez la betterave – il vous en faudra environ\r\n400g de chair. Hacher grossièrement et mettre dans un\r\ngrand bol. Ajoutez un peu d''eau, couvrez\r\navec du film alimentaire, puis micro-ondes à puissance élevée\r\npendant 12 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nPendant que la betterave cuit, beurrer ensuite\r\ntapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de 20 x 30 cm ou une petite\r\nplat à rôtir. Hachez grossièrement le chocolat\r\net coupez le beurre en cubes. Donnez un pourboire au\r\nbetterave cuite dans une passoire, égouttez-la\r\néliminer tout excès de liquide, puis mettre dans un aliment\r\nrobot ou mixeur avec le chocolat,\r\nbeurre et vanille. Whizz jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit\r\naussi doux que possible. Le chocolat\r\net le beurre fondra en faisant cela.","Mettez le sucre et les œufs dans un grand\r\nbol, puis battre à l''aide d''une main électrique\r\nfouetter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais, pâle et mousseux, environ\r\n2 minutes. Versez le mélange de betterave rouge dans le\r\nbol (ça ne sera pas très joli à voir comme ça\r\nscène, mais soyez indulgents avec moi), puis utilisez un grand\r\ncuillère en métal pour l''incorporer au fouet\r\nœufs. Essayez de conserver autant d''air dans le\r\nmélange autant que vous le pouvez. Tamisez la farine et\r\npoudre de cacao, puis incorporez-les délicatement\r\npour faire une pâte lisse.","Verser dans le moule préparé et enfourner\r\npendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement levé, avec\r\njuste le moindre frémissement sous le centre\r\nde la croûte lorsque vous secouez la poêle.\r\nRefroidissez complètement dans le moule, puis coupez\r\nen carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:04:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10224,9283,'fr','Pommes au chocolat','Préparez ces pommes au chocolat comme friandise pour une fête d''enfants. Idéal pour une soirée de feu de joie ou pour Halloween, recouvrez de noix hachées, de pépites et de morceaux de nid d''abeilles.','["200 g de chocolat au lait finement haché","4 petites pommes à manger","brins de sucre, noix finement hachées, pépites, morceaux de nid d''abeilles","50 g de chaque chocolat blanc et noir hachés (facultatif)","4 brochettes, baguettes en bois ou gros bâtonnets de sucettes"]','["Mettez le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d’eau frémissante, en faisant attention à ce que le bol ne touche pas l’eau. Remuer fréquemment pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement fondu, lisse et brillant. Retirer du feu. Vous pouvez également chauffer le chocolat par petites rafales au micro-ondes, en remuant entre chaque rafale, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu.","Mettez les pommes dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et versez-y l''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Égouttez soigneusement et lavez sous l’eau chaude pour éliminer tout résidu de cire sur la peau. Cela aide le chocolat à mieux coller. Séchez avec du papier absorbant, retirez les tiges et poussez un bâton de sucette ou une brochette à sa place.","Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie ou une grande planche de papier sulfurisé. Tenez les pommes par leurs bâtonnets et plongez-les dans le chocolat fondu. Utilisez une cuillère pour enrober le dessus des pommes si vous le souhaitez. Une fois que les pommes sont complètement enrobées, maintenez le bol pendant quelques secondes pour que l''excédent de chocolat s''y égoutte, puis placez-le, bâton vers le haut, sur le plateau préparé. Laisser reposer une minute ou deux.","Versez les décorations dans des bols séparés. Lorsque le chocolat sur les pommes commence tout juste à prendre mais pas complètement ferme, saupoudrez les décorations sur les pommes. Tenez-les sur le côté et faites-les pivoter à l’aide du bâton pour les recouvrir complètement. Remettez-le sur le plateau et laissez-le jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement pris.","Si vous utilisez le chocolat blanc et le chocolat noir pour la décoration, chauffez chacun séparément, comme vous l''avez fait pour le chocolat au lait à l''étape 1, puis laissez refroidir légèrement. Faites d''abord fondre le chocolat noir, puis lorsque les pommes en chocolat sont dures, utilisez une cuillère à café pour en verser dessus, en tenant à nouveau le bâton de manière à ce que la pomme soit sur le côté et en la faisant tourner. Disposez une feuille de papier sulfurisé en dessous pour récupérer les éventuelles gouttes. Remettez sur la plaque et laissez prendre, puis répétez l''opération avec le chocolat blanc. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique au frais pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10225,9284,'fr','Pavlova d''Halloween','Le gâteau pavlova d''Halloween ultime, pris en sandwich avec de la crème et surmonté de décorations macabres et mignonnes. Cette pâtisserie époustouflante est parfaite pour une fête','["500 g de sucre en poudre","250g de blancs d''œufs","1 cuillère à café de crème de tartre","600 ml de crème fraîche","300g de mûres","300g de framboises","100 g de baies surgelées","un filet de miel","un filet de citron","stylo d''écriture alimentaire noir, pour les yeux fantômes","fleurs comestibles","macarons noirs ou blancs","un filet de chocolat noir","feuille d''or comestible","morceaux de framboises lyophilisés"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettre le sucre semoule dans une petite plaque à rôtir recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Secouez pour niveler le sucre et faites chauffer au four pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud mais pas fondant (cela permet de stabiliser les blancs d''œufs et de donner une meringue onctueuse et brillante).","Battre les blancs d''œufs au batteur sur socle avec la crème de tartre. Fouettez d''abord lentement, en augmentant progressivement la vitesse jusqu''à ce que les blancs d''œufs soient au stade de pointe ferme, environ 5 minutes. Il est important de ne pas trop fouetter les blancs d’œufs. Sortez le sucre du four dès que les blancs sont fermes.","Baissez le four à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼ en laissant la porte entrouverte pour permettre un refroidissement rapide – vos meringues doivent être cuites à basse température.","Tournez le mixeur à pleine vitesse et commencez à ajouter le sucre une cuillère à soupe à la fois. Vos blancs d’œufs doivent conserver leur volume au fur et à mesure que vous ajoutez du sucre – si vous voyez qu’il commence à s’effondrer, arrêtez d’ajouter du sucre et laissez le mélange durcir et lever avant d’ajouter le reste, une cuillerée à la fois.","Tapisser trois plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et placer les gabarits « B''B », « O''O » « O''''O » en dessous pour pouvoir les tracer. Remplissez votre poche à douille avec la meringue, aux deux tiers environ. Évitez de trop remplir le sac, sinon vous aurez du mal à le passer – vous pourrez en ajouter davantage dans le sac plus tard.","Découpez un trou au bout du sac, d''environ 1 cm de large, et tenez le sac près du fond pendant que votre autre main tient le haut, en gardant le haut du sac fermé pour qu''il n''y ait pas de déversement de meringue.","Commencez avec la poche à douille directement à la verticale et pressez délicatement avec la main inférieure pour tracer le contour des lettres afin de réaliser un bord meringué ; une fois que vous avez la forme, vous pouvez la remplir. Lissez les lignes et les bords rugueux avec le dos d''une cuillère ou d''un mini couteau à palette.","Pour former les fantômes, maintenez le sac fermement à environ 1 cm au-dessus du plateau et pressez le sac par le haut pour commencer à former le corps de votre fantôme. Gardez le sac complètement immobile tout en le pressant, en utilisant le bas de votre main pour maintenir le sac stable. Arrêtez de presser une fois que la meringue atteint le plateau. Soulevez légèrement la poche à douille, sans créer de cassure entre la meringue posée sur la plaque et la meringue laissée dans la poche à douille. Reposez la poche à douille et pressez-la doucement pour former la partie supérieure du corps du fantôme. Soulevez la poche à douille vers le haut pour laisser une jolie pointe sur le dessus de la tête de vos fantômes. Cela demandera un peu de pratique, alors ne vous inquiétez pas si vous ne réussissez pas du premier coup, continuez simplement et ayez une idée.","Placez vos six lettres et les mini fantômes au four pendant 2h jusqu''à ce que la meringue soit croustillante à l''extérieur et mauve au milieu. Éteignez le four et laissez la pavlova refroidir dans le four. Si au bout de 2 heures votre meringue est trop fondante au milieu, enfournez encore 30 minutes, puis laissez-la refroidir à nouveau au four. Se conserve une semaine sans serrer dans un moule dans un endroit frais et sec.","Pour réaliser le coulis « sang » de framboise, mettez les baies surgelées dans une casserole sur feu moyen, puis ajoutez une cuillère à soupe de miel et un filet de jus de citron. Cuire 5 min. Pour une sauce onctueuse, passer au tamis fin, puis laisser refroidir. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours au réfrigérateur.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à servir, placez les lettres du bas sur le tableau pour épeler « BOO » sur un joli plat ou une planche de service. Si vous avez assez de mélange pour faire des mini fantômes meringués, ajoutez leurs visages. Nous aimons dessiner sur deux grands yeux tombants et une bouche ouverte pour que vous puissiez vraiment les imaginer émettre des sons effrayants et fantomatiques. Si vous n’avez pas de stylo comestible, vous pouvez faire fondre délicatement 50 g de chocolat noir au micro-ondes et utiliser un petit pinceau pour peindre les visages.","Fouetter la crème double jusqu''à formation de pics mous. Remplissez votre deuxième poche à douille avec votre chantilly et découpez un petit trou d''environ 2 cm au bout. Disposez des gouttes partout sur les lettres – vous pouvez ajouter quelques baies tranchées sur la crème à ce stade. Placez soigneusement les deuxièmes lettres par-dessus. Répétez les gouttes de crème sur la couche supérieure. Décorez avec les mûres, les framboises, les fleurs comestibles et les meringues fantômes. Arrosez d’un peu de coulis « sang » de framboise. N''hésitez pas à y ajouter des pépites, des macarons, des friandises d''Halloween, un filet de chocolat noir, des feuilles d''or comestibles ou des morceaux de framboises lyophilisées : partez en ville avec ce que vous avez ! Nous vous conseillons de le consommer le jour même, mais il se conserve une journée au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10226,9285,'fr','Monstres meringués','Créez un ensemble coloré et créatif de monstres meringués pour compléter votre fête d''Halloween. Mélangez les couleurs et les motifs pour créer différents designs','["500 g de sucre en poudre","250 g de blancs d''oeufs fermiers","1 cuillère à café de crème de tartre","colorant alimentaire vert et violet (le colorant alimentaire naturel PME fonctionne bien)","3 poches à douille","100 g de glaçage royal (préparé selon les instructions sur l''emballage)","colorant alimentaire en gel noir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettre le sucre semoule dans une petite plaque à rôtir recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Secouez pour niveler le sucre et faites chauffer au four pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud mais pas fondant. Cela permet de stabiliser les blancs d''œufs et de donner une meringue onctueuse et brillante.","Mettez les blancs d''œufs et la crème de tartre dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle. Fouettez d''abord lentement, en augmentant progressivement la vitesse jusqu''à ce que les blancs d''œufs soient au stade de pointe ferme, environ 5 minutes. Il est important de ne pas trop fouetter les blancs d’œufs. Sortez le sucre du four dès que les blancs d''œufs sont fermes.","Baissez le four à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼, en laissant la porte entrouverte pour permettre un refroidissement rapide – les meringues doivent être cuites à une température plus basse.","Tournez le mixeur à pleine vitesse et commencez à ajouter le sucre une cuillère à soupe à la fois. Vous voulez que les blancs d''œufs conservent leur volume au fur et à mesure que vous ajoutez du sucre, donc si vous voyez qu''il commence à s''effondrer, arrêtez d''ajouter du sucre et laissez le mélange durcir et lever avant d''ajouter le reste, une cuillerée à la fois.","Une fois tout le sucre ajouté, continuez à fouetter jusqu''à obtenir un mélange ferme et brillant. Il est prêt à être utilisé lorsqu’il conserve sa forme, environ 2 à 5 minutes après avoir ajouté le reste du sucre. Vous devriez également pouvoir voir des pics dans le mélange lorsque vous retirez et retournez le fouet.","Pour ajouter de la couleur à vos monstres, vous devrez peindre vos poches à douille. Ce mélange suffira pour deux poches à douille – une verte et une violette – mais n''hésitez pas à choisir vos propres couleurs de monstre, et même à les mélanger en peignant des rayures. Retournez vos poches à douille. Placez les sacs sur des pichets ou des bouteilles afin qu''ils tiennent debout. Peignez une épaisse couche de colorant alimentaire depuis le bout de la poche à douille jusqu''à la moitié du sac. Retournez les sacs, puis versez délicatement votre meringue dans des poches à douille – un lot devrait remplir deux sacs, en secouant le mélange jusqu''au fond du sac. Essayez de vous débarrasser des grosses bulles d''air que vous pouvez voir à ce stade, mais ne soyez pas trop brutal avec le mélange.","Découpez du papier sulfurisé à la taille de vos plaques à pâtisserie. Coupez le pouce inférieur de la poche à douille (environ un trou de la taille de 50p) et pressez de petites cuillerées sur le coin de vos plaques à pâtisserie pour coller le papier sulfurisé.","Tenez la poche à douille à deux mains, en plaçant votre main dominante en haut de la poche et votre autre main à mi-hauteur du sac. Tenez le sac fermement, environ 2 cm au-dessus du plateau et pressez le sac par le haut pour commencer à former le corps de vos monstres. Arrêtez de presser une fois que la meringue atteint le plateau. Soulevez un peu la poche à douille sans créer de cassure entre la meringue posée sur la plaque et la meringue laissée dans la poche à douille. Reposez le sac et pressez-le doucement pour former la partie supérieure du corps du monstre.","Répétez jusqu''à ce que vous ayez versé tout votre mélange, en travaillant rapidement car le mélange se détachera avec le temps. Cuire au four pendant 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant à l''extérieur et tendre au milieu. Laisser refroidir sur les plaques à pâtisserie.","Si vous souhaitez créer vos propres yeux écarquillés, faites-le au moins 24 heures à l''avance. Réalisez 100 g de glaçage royal ferme en colorant un quart de ce noir avec du colorant gel noir. Mettez le glaçage blanc et noir dans deux poches à douille séparées. Utilisez des ciseaux pour couper un petit trou au bout. Disposez délicatement des points blancs sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier sulfurisé, puis laissez-les prendre. Une fois sec, utilisez le glaçage noir pour les pupilles. Pipez des yeux de formes différentes – certains grands, d’autres petits, ou peut-être trois adjacents. Laisser reposer toute la nuit jusqu''à ce qu''ils se décollent facilement du papier sulfurisé. Utilisez plus de glaçage pour coller les yeux sur les meringues. Une fois prises, elles se conservent deux semaines dans un endroit frais et sec dans un récipient légèrement couvert."]','2026-01-11 00:04:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10227,9286,'fr','Brownies d''Halloween','Oubliez les paquets de bonbons : si vous voulez un vrai régal à Halloween, ces brownies effrayants et décadents feront l''affaire. Les enfants et les adultes les adoreront','["200g de beurre","200 g de chocolat noir haché grossièrement","4 gros œufs","350 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de farine nature","poudre de cacao","chocolat au lait, haché","chocolat blanc, haché","créme-filled chocolate sandwich cookies","chocolats enrobés de sucre","stylos à glaçage"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à brownie de 24 x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le beurre et le chocolat noir dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une petite casserole d''eau frémissante. Remuer jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse, puis laisser refroidir 10 minutes.","Battre les œufs et le sucre au fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient épais et pâles – le mélange doit doubler de volume et laisser une trace lorsque les batteurs sont soulevés. Versez le mélange de chocolat noir refroidi sur le pourtour du bol. Tamisez la farine et le cacao, ajoutez le chocolat au lait et mélangez délicatement le tout à l''aide d''une spatule ou d''une grande cuillère en métal. Versez dans le moule préparé et enfournez pendant 35 à 40 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, réalisez les « globes oculaires ». Faire fondre le chocolat blanc dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante. Remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse. Trempez chaque biscuit dans le chocolat pour couvrir un côté. Collez un chocolat enrobé de sucre au centre de chacun, puis laissez prendre. Lorsque le chocolat est complètement sec, tracez une pupille et des veines rouges sur chaque globe oculaire à l''aide des stylos à glaçage.","Retirez la plaque du four et poussez immédiatement les globes oculaires dans la surface en rangées égales – faites-le doucement, de sorte qu’ils soient simplement enfoncés légèrement. Laisser refroidir complètement. Découper en 12 carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:04:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10228,9287,'fr','Gâteau slash d''Halloween','Qu''est-ce qui dit plus « fête d''Halloween » que ce gâteau ? Le glaçage fondant, la confiture de fraises et le colorant alimentaire rouge sont les secrets de la garniture et de la garniture « sang ».','["140 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour le moule","100 ml d''huile de pépins de raisin ou une autre huile sans saveur","200 ml de lait","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 gros œufs, à température ambiante","250 g de sucre muscovado léger","250 g de farine nature","3 cuillères à café de levure chimique","50g de cacao en poudre","¾ pot de 340g de confiture de fraises","1¼ kg de glaçage fondant blanc prêt à rouler","600 g de sucre glace tamisé, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","300 g de beurre ramolli","colorant alimentaire rouge"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond de deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm. Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle, puis retirer du feu et incorporer l''huile, le lait, le yaourt, la vanille et les œufs. Fouettez les ingrédients secs avec une grosse pincée de sel, en écrasant les morceaux de sucre avec vos doigts. Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs, puis fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Répartissez la pâte dans les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes sur la même grille du four jusqu''à ce qu''elle lève et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes dans les moules, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pour faire la crème au beurre, battez ensemble le sucre, le beurre et quelques gouttes de colorant rouge. Ajoutez 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante si nécessaire pour ramollir le mélange, jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage lisse et tartinable.","Coupez les gâteaux à plat si nécessaire, puis coupez-les en deux chacun au milieu à l''aide d''un grand couteau dentelé. Disposez une couche de gâteau sur une planche ou une assiette, étalez-la sur une fine couche de crème au beurre et parsemez-la sur un tiers de la confiture. Garnir d''une autre couche de gâteau et répéter avec la crème au beurre, la confiture et le gâteau, en terminant par une couche de gâteau. Utilisez la majeure partie de la crème au beurre restante pour glacer le gâteau partout, en réservant une petite quantité.","Étalez le glaçage fondant sur une surface saupoudrée de sucre glace jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment grand pour recouvrir le dessus et les côtés du gâteau. Soulevez-le délicatement sur le gâteau et lissez-le pour l''aider à coller. Utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour couper des entailles dans le glaçage, puis versez un peu de crème au beurre réservée mélangée à un peu d''eau dans chacune pour ressembler à du sang."]','2026-01-11 00:04:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10229,9288,'fr','Gâteau fantôme','Soyez saisonnier et effrayant avec ce gâteau fantôme simple mais efficace – la pâtisserie parfaite pour une fête d''Halloween entre amis','["300 ml d''huile de colza et un peu pour les boîtes","325 g de farines autolevantes","5 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","300 g de sucre en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","4 gros œufs battus","300 ml de lait","750 g de glaçage fondant blanc","colorant alimentaire noir (ou glaçage fondant noir)","100 g de beurre très mou","225 g de sucre glace, et un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler et tapisser le fond de deux moules à sandwich de 16 cm (ou moins) et d''une bassine à pudding de 1,2 L. Mélangez la farine autolevante, le cacao en poudre, le bicarbonate de soude et le sucre dans un bol. Faites un puits au centre et incorporez le sirop doré, les œufs, l''huile et le lait avec un fouet électrique, jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Versez le mélange dans le bassin à pudding jusqu''à ce qu''il soit rempli aux ¾, puis répartissez le reste entre les deux moules à sandwich et enfournez pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les gâteaux soient levés et fermes au toucher. L''éponge dans le bassin à pudding peut prendre plus de temps selon que le bassin est en métal ou en céramique. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes avant de démouler sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, pour faire le glaçage, battre le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux, incorporer le sucre glace petit à petit, incorporer le cacao en poudre et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau.","Coupez le gâteau au pudding en deux horizontalement et remettez-le en sandwich avec un peu de glaçage. Déposez un biscuit rond sur un plateau ou une assiette à gâteau, placez le suivant en sandwich dessus avec un peu de glaçage. Placez le gâteau au pudding sur le dessus du gâteau rond. Si le gâteau inférieur dépasse du fond du gâteau au pudding, coupez le bord supérieur du gâteau inférieur en biais pour rendre les côtés plus plats. Glacez l''extérieur du gâteau avec une fine couche de glaçage au chocolat et utilisez le tout.","Étalez le fondant sur une surface saupoudrée de sucre glace pour obtenir une forme de feuille suffisamment grande pour recouvrir tout le gâteau. Drapez-le soigneusement sur le gâteau glacé et appuyez dessus sur le dessus pour créer votre fantôme, avec des volants sur les bords, en coupant l''excédent autour de la base. Colorez une partie de l''excédent de glaçage en noir en pétrissant le colorant alimentaire ou utilisez le glaçage fondant noir. Etalez-le sur quelques mm d''épaisseur. Découpez des yeux et une bouche et collez-les."]','2026-01-11 00:04:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10230,9289,'fr','Gâteau à la citrouille et au caramel','Ce gâteau utilise quelques raccourcis mais le résultat final est une génoise délicieusement impressionnante fourrée aux épices de citrouille.','["80 ml d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour graisser","Paquet de 450 g de préparation à gâteau vanille ou blanche (ou faites votre propre préparation à gâteau, voir conseil ci-dessous)","½ boîte de 425 g de purée de potiron","125 ml de lait entier","4 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café d''épices pour tarte à la citrouille (disponible sur uk.iherb.com, ou mélangez-la vous-même en combinant ½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, ¼ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu, ¼ cuillère à café de muscade et une pincée de clous de girofle moulus)","4 cuillères à soupe de dulce de leche en pot","225 g de fromage frais entier","125 g de sucre glace tamisé","1 cuillère à café d''épices pour tarte à la citrouille","½ boîte de 425 g de purée de potiron","440 ml de crème fraîche","70 g de noix de pécan grillées et hachées grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond de deux moules à cake de 23 cm. Dans un grand bol, battre l''huile, le mélange à gâteau, la purée de citrouille, le lait, les œufs et le mélange d''épices jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez le mélange dans les moules à cake et enfournez pendant 22 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Battre brièvement le fromage à la crème dans un bol moyen jusqu''à consistance mousseuse, puis ajouter le sucre glace, les épices et la purée de citrouille et battre jusqu''à consistance lisse. Faites attention à ne pas trop battre, sinon cela deviendra liquide. Dans un autre bol, fouettez la crème et incorporez-la délicatement au mélange de fromage à la crème.","Une fois les gâteaux refroidis, coupez-les chacun en deux horizontalement pour obtenir quatre génoises fines. Disposez la couche inférieure sur une assiette, tartinez-la d''1 cuillère à soupe de dulce de leche, puis lissez sur un quart de la garniture. Ajoutez la couche suivante et répétez jusqu''à ce que vous obteniez une incroyable tour de citrouille, de gâteau, de caramel et de crème, puis saupoudrez les pacanes dessus. Boom."]','2026-01-11 00:04:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10231,9290,'fr','Gâteau à la toile d''araignée','Glaçage à la crème au beurre à la meringue suisse transformé en un produit effrayant pour Halloween : cette riche génoise au chocolat sera l''invité d''honneur de toute fête d''Halloween.','["110 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","140 ml de stout au chocolat (nous avons utilisé la Young''s Double Chocolate Stout, disponible chez Tesco)","170 g de sucre blanc en poudre","170 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs légèrement battus","100 g de chocolat noir fondu et refroidi","280 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","3 gros blancs d''œufs","240 g de sucre en poudre","360 g de beurre doux, température ambiante","200 g de chocolat blanc fondu et refroidi","100 g de mini guimauves blanches","25 g de pâte à sucre noire"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer trois moules à cake ronds de 20 cm et tapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé. Pour faire le gâteau, mettez le cacao dans un bol, ajoutez 280 ml d''eau bouillante et fouettez jusqu''à dissolution. Versez la stout, mélangez, puis laissez refroidir.","Dans un batteur sur socle ou un grand bol, à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battre ensemble le beurre, les sucres et l''extrait de vanille jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse (environ 5 minutes). Ajoutez les œufs petit à petit en mélangeant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement incorporés avant d''en ajouter davantage. Une fois que tout l’œuf a été ajouté, versez le chocolat fondu et mélangez.","Dans un autre bol, mélangez la farine, le bicarbonate et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel. Ajoutez ce mélange au mélange de beurre en trois temps, en alternant avec le mélange de stout (qui sera très liquide). Versez la pâte également dans les moules préparés et enfournez pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré dans le gâteau en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse complètement.","Pour faire la crème au beurre, mettez les blancs d’œufs et le sucre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et mettez-les au-dessus d’une casserole d’eau frémissante. Remuer avec un fouet jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous et que le mélange soit chaud au toucher. Retirez le bol du feu et battez avec un fouet électrique à grande vitesse jusqu''à ce que le mélange triple de volume et refroidisse. Ajoutez lentement le beurre 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois tout en continuant de fouetter. Une fois que tout le beurre a été ajouté, le mélange doit paraître brillant et épais. Si ce n''est pas le cas, continuez à fouetter jusqu''à ce que ce soit le cas, ou si le bol est encore chaud, réfrigérez pendant 10 minutes avant de fouetter à nouveau. Une fois prêt, incorporez le chocolat blanc fondu.","Pour assembler le gâteau, placez l''une des couches de gâteau sur un support à gâteau et recouvrez d''une couche de crème au beurre. Répétez avec les deux autres couches. Étalez le reste de crème au beurre sur tout le gâteau en utilisant une spatule ou un couteau à palette pour lisser les côtés. Réfrigérer pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que la crème au beurre soit ferme (voir conseil ci-dessous).","Pour décorer, faites fondre les guimauves dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en remuant de temps en temps. Retirer du feu et mettre de côté pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit suffisamment froid pour être manipulé. Utilisez vos doigts pour saisir une petite quantité de guimauve et étirez-la pour former de longs brins (tremper vos doigts dans de l''huile végétale ou de tournesol vous aidera !). Drapez les brins sur le gâteau selon un motif aléatoire, afin qu''il soit complètement recouvert. Réalisez une araignée à l''aide de la pâte à sucre (roulez deux boules, une plus grosse que l''autre, pour le corps et des brins fins pour les pattes) et placez-la sur le gâteau. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:04:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10232,9291,'fr','Cupcakes Frankenstein','Créez vos propres monstres cet Halloween avec notre recette de pâtisserie facile : décorez avec du glaçage vert et noir et des mini guimauves.','["200 g de beurre mou","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","¼ cuillère à café de sel","3 gros œufs, à température ambiante ?","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 ml de lait, à température ambiante","300 g de sucre glace tamisé","2-3 cuillères à soupe de lait","du colorant alimentaire vert en pâte (nous avons utilisé Party Green de Sugarflair) ?","36 mini guimauves, 12 coupées en deux (pour les yeux)","tube de glaçage ou de gel noir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de moules à muffins profonds. Crémer le beurre avec le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter le reste des ingrédients du gâteau et battre jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser dans les moules à muffins et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et qu''un cure-dent inséré dans l''un des gâteaux du milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes dans le moule, puis complètement sur une grille.?","À l''aide d''un petit couteau dentelé bien aiguisé, coupez un morceau de gâteau en demi-cercle à gauche et à droite de chaque gâteau, pour former des bords étagés, au niveau du moule à cupcakes. Ensuite, faites ? une découpe dans le sens de la largeur à environ 3 cm du haut du gâteau, sur environ 1 cm de profondeur. Coupez un morceau de 5 mm sur la surface du gâteau pour correspondre à cette coupe, afin d''obtenir un visage plat et surélevé et un front proéminent. Réfrigérer 10 minutes pour raffermir les miettes.?","Mélangez le sucre glace, le lait et le colorant vert pour obtenir un glaçage très épais qui s''écoule lentement de la cuillère. Versez 1 cuillère à soupe sur un gâteau et laissez-la commencer à s''étaler sur la forme découpée. Facilitez-le ici et là avec un couteau à palette pour enduire. Ajoutez des boulons et des yeux de guimauve. Répétez l’opération pour chaque cupcake. Laisser poser, puis appliquer sur les visages et les cheveux."]','2026-01-11 00:04:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10233,9292,'fr','Gâteau de velours rouge au doigt bizarre','Terrifiez et ravissez cet Halloween avec un spectaculaire gâteau velours rouge chocolat, pris en sandwich avec un glaçage au fromage à la crème facile.','["175 g de beurre mou, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de sucre blanc en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs, à température ambiante","1 cuillère à soupe de colorant alimentaire rouge (nous avons utilisé le rouge de Noël de Sugarflair)","200 g de farine nature","50 g de cacao en poudre (nous avons utilisé du Green & Black''s)","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude ?","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","¼ cuillère à café de sel","Pot de 150 g de yaourt nature allégé, délayé avec 2 cuillères à soupe de lait","environ 3 boîtes de 114 g de bâtonnets de chocolat blanc (nous les avons trouvés chez Tesco)","140 g de sucre glace","2 cuillères à café de lait","petite goutte de pâte colorante alimentaire rouge","100 g de beurre mou","300 g de fromage frais entier, froid au réfrigérateur (nous avons utilisé du Philadelphia car il a la texture la plus ferme)","le zeste d''1 orange (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Pour le gâteau, graisser 2 moules à sandwich de 20 cm et tapisser les fonds de papier sulfurisé. Crémer ensemble le beurre, le sucre et la vanille, puis ajouter les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien après chaque œuf, jusqu''à consistance mousseuse et légère. Incorporer le colorant.","Mélangez les ingrédients secs du gâteau et tamisez la moitié sur le mélange crémeux. Incorporer à la spatule, puis la moitié du yaourt dilué. Répétez, puis versez la pâte lisse dans les moules et nivelez. Cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et élastique lorsqu''on appuie légèrement au centre. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement.","Pour les doigts, tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Coupez une extrémité de chaque doigt en chocolat. Mélangez 50 g de sucre glace, le lait et une petite goutte de colorant pour obtenir un glaçage rouge et épais. Le glaçage doit être épais pour rester en place ; ajoutez un peu plus de sucre si nécessaire. Trempez les extrémités coupées du biscuit dans le glaçage, laissez l''excédent s''égoutter, puis peignez un ongle rouge sur l''autre extrémité à l''aide d''un petit pinceau. Laisser sécher sur le parchemin.?","Pour le glaçage, utilisez un batteur électrique pour bien battre le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très lisse, puis incorporez le fromage à la crème et le zeste (le cas échéant) jusqu''à consistance uniforme. Tamisez le reste du sucre glace, puis incorporez-le au mélange de fromage à l''aide d''une spatule jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. N’en faites pas trop. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Sandwicher et couvrir le dessus et les côtés ? du gâteau avec le glaçage – vous n''aurez besoin que d''une fine couche sur les côtés du gâteau pour coller les doigts en chocolat. Placez les doigts coupés autour du gâteau dans un collier soigné, en les pressant légèrement dans le glaçage. Il vous en restera quelques-uns à mettre sur le dessus. Conservez le gâteau au réfrigérateur mais dégustez-le à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:04:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10234,9293,'fr','Gâteau cimetière hanté','Pièce maîtresse parfaite pour une célébration d''Halloween, ce gâteau rendra votre fête encore plus effrayante.','["1 blanc d''oeuf","50g de sucre glace","200 ml de crème liquide","200 g de chocolat noir finement haché","125 g de biscuits au thé riches","100 g de biscuits double chocolat","25g de chocolat blanc","boules d''argent, pour décorer","85g de cacao en poudre","200 g de farines autolevantes","375 g de sucre brun clair muscovado","4 œufs","200 ml de lait","175 ml d''huile végétale"]','["Pour faire les fantômes, chauffez le four à\r\n110C/90C ventilateur/gaz ¼. Fouetter l''oeuf\r\nblanc dans un bol propre jusqu''à ce que les pics soient fermes\r\nforme. Incorporer le sucre une cuillère à soupe à la fois\r\net continuez à fouetter pendant quelques minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et ressemble\r\nmousse à raser. Verser délicatement le mélange\r\ndans un grand sac de congélation, puis coupez un morceau de 1,5 cm\r\ntrou dans un des coins. Couvrir une pâtisserie\r\nplaque avec du papier sulfurisé.\r\nPressez soigneusement un petit cercle de\r\nfouetter le blanc d''œuf du sac en le tirant\r\nvers le haut comme tu le fais pour faire un fantôme\r\nforme. Répétez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit utilisé\r\nvers le haut – vous devriez avoir environ 15 fantômes.\r\nCuire au four pendant 1h30 jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Peut être stocké\r\ndans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 2 jours.","Maintenant, préparez le gâteau. Chauffer le four à\r\n180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Versez le cacao\r\npoudre, farine autolevante et sucre\r\ndans un grand bol, en brisant tout\r\ndes morceaux de sucre. Mélangez les œufs,\r\nle lait et l''huile dans une tasse à mesurer ou un bol,\r\npuis versez sur les ingrédients secs et\r\nmélanger le tout jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un plat allant au four\r\n(20 x 30 x 5 cm) avec du papier sulfurisé.\r\nVersez le mélange à gâteau et enfournez pendant\r\n30 minutes. Laisser refroidir puis démouler\r\nsur une assiette de service. Vous pouvez également envelopper\r\nbien et conserver jusqu’à 2 jours.","Terminer la décoration du gâteau : chauffer la crème\r\ndans une casserole jusqu''à ébullition. Placez le\r\nchocolat noir dans un grand bol et\r\nverser sur la crème chaude. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle chocolat fond. Utilisez une brosse propre pour\r\npeindre une couche de chocolat sur 7 riches\r\nbiscuits aux doigts de thé, puis laisser refroidir.\r\nVersez le reste du mélange chocolaté\r\nsur le gâteau et lisser avec un\r\ncouteau. Whizz les biscuits au chocolat, ou\r\nmettre dans un sac de congélation avec un rouleau à pâtisserie,\r\njusqu''à ce que de petites miettes se forment. Saupoudrer\r\nle dessus du gâteau.","Placez le chocolat blanc dans un petit\r\nbol, posé sur une casserole d’eau frémissante.\r\nLaisser reposer 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu, puis\r\nverser dans un petit sac de congélation. Attendre\r\n10 min pour que le mélange ne soit pas trop liquide,\r\npuis découpez un petit trou dans un coin du\r\nsac. Disposez 2 petites gouttes sur chacune\r\nfantôme, placez une boule d''argent sur chacune pour faire\r\nyeux, puis prononcez les mots appropriés et\r\nformes sur les pierres tombales. Partir pour\r\n30 min de prise, puis poussez le biscuit\r\npierres tombales dans le gâteau et disposez-les\r\nles fantômes autour. Pour amener les fantômes\r\n\"voler\", poussez un fil fin (vous pouvez obtenir ces\r\nchez un fleuriste – n''oubliez pas de\r\nretirer avant de manger) au fond de\r\nle fantôme, puis placez-le dans le gâteau, en le cachant\r\nle fil derrière une pierre tombale."]','2026-01-11 00:04:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10235,9294,'fr','Des globes oculaires étranges éclatent','Ces boules de gâteau au chocolat effrayantes seront un succès auprès des enfants à Halloween – elles peuvent aussi aider à les décorer','["100 g de gâteau Madère","100 g de biscuits Oréo","100 g de tablette de chocolat au lait fondu","200 g de chocolat blanc fondu en tablette","quelques Smarties et stylos à glaçage, pour décorer","10 brochettes en bois","½ petite citrouille\n ou courge musquée, épépinée, à poser"]','["Cassez le gâteau et les biscuits de Madère\r\ndans le bol d''un robot culinaire,\r\nverser le chocolat au lait fondu\r\net fouettez pour combiner.","Versez le mélange dans un bol, puis\r\nutilisez vos mains pour rouler\r\n10 boules de la taille d''une noix. Mettre au frais 2h\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit vraiment ferme.","Enfoncez une brochette dans chaque boule, puis\r\nverser délicatement le chocolat blanc\r\nsur les boules de gâteau pour les recouvrir complètement.\r\nPlacez les cake pops dans la citrouille,\r\npuis appuyez un Smartie sur la surface\r\nlorsqu''il est mouillé. Refroidir à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le chocolat\r\na réglé. Avant de servir, utiliser le glaçage\r\nstylos, ajoutez un élève à chaque Smartie et\r\nveines rouges ondulées jusqu''aux globes oculaires."]','2026-01-11 00:04:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10236,9295,'fr','Hululement des hiboux d''Halloween','Des cup cakes au chocolat délicieux et simples à préparer avec les enfants à Halloween – de véritables régals pour tout le monde','["280 g de beurre ramolli","280 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g de farine autolevante, moins 1 cuillère à soupe bombée","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de cacao en poudre","6 œufs moyens","200 g de beurre ramolli","280 g de sucre glace tamisé","1 tube de glaçage orange prêt à l''emploi","1 petit sachet Maltesers","1 tube de chocolat M&Ms minis (utilisez uniquement les bonbons bruns) ou des mini boutons Cadbury''s","1 pot de diamants en gelée (juste les oranges)"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/ventilateur 170°C/gaz 5. Tapisser un moule à muffins de 12 tasses de caissettes à muffins brunes. Battez les 5 premiers ingrédients pour obtenir une pâte lisse et versez-la entre les caissettes, en les remplissant presque jusqu''au sommet. Il vous en reste peut-être un peu. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et spongieux. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Battre le beurre et le sucre glace jusqu''à consistance lisse. Coupez le dessus des gâteaux et coupez chaque morceau en deux. Étalez une généreuse couche de glaçage sur chaque gâteau.","En travaillant sur un gâteau à la fois, versez une goutte de glaçage orange de la taille d''un pois sur deux Maltesers et utilisez-la pour fixer un M&M marron sur chacun. Posez les yeux, deux morceaux de gâteau (bord incurvé vers le haut) et un diamant en gelée sur le glaçage pour faire un hibou."]','2026-01-11 00:04:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10237,9296,'fr','Gâteaux d''araignées effrayants','Les enfants s''amuseront beaucoup à les décorer lors des fêtes d''Halloween.','["200 g de beurre, à température ambiante","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g de farines autolevantes","4 œufs","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","6 cuillères à soupe de pépites de chocolat ou de chocolat haché","2 paquets de meules Catherine à la réglisse","12 cuillères à soupe de Nutella ou autre pâte à tartiner au chocolat","toutes sortes de réglisse (les noires avec le centre blanc)","tube noir écriture glaçage","1 lacet rouge de longueur"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4 et\r\nTapisser un moule à muffins de 12 caissettes, de préférence\r\nles marrons. Mettez le beurre, le sucre et la farine\r\ndans un bol à mélanger. Cassez les œufs dans un\r\nbol plus petit, en prenant soin de ne pas mettre de coquille\r\ndedans, puis versez sur le mélange de beurre.","Ajouter la levure chimique et la vanille au\r\nbol plus grand, puis battre avec une main électrique\r\nfouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse et crémeuse. Incorporer le\r\ngouttes de chocolat ou chocolat. Verser le\r\nrépartir uniformément le mélange à gâteau dans les moules et cuire au four\r\npendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés – un bâton à cocktail\r\npoussé au milieu d''un des gâteaux\r\ndevrait ressortir propre. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Pour décorer les gâteaux, démêlez la réglisse\r\nroues et coupé en longueurs avec des ciseaux\r\npour faire des jambes pendantes. Collez 8 dans le haut de\r\nchaque gâteau en faisant de petites entailles avec la pointe\r\nun couteau bien aiguisé pour qu''ils s''enfoncent vraiment en toute sécurité.","Verser la pâte à tartiner au chocolat dessus et\r\nétaler légèrement dans les pattes de réglisse pour\r\nfaire un corps d’araignée rond. Maintenant, coupez le\r\nTout pour faire les yeux et les lacets rouges\r\nfaire des bouches, puis collez-les sur le\r\ngâteaux et pointez sur le glaçage pour faire des globes oculaires.\r\nSe conserve jusqu''à 2 jours dans un endroit frais."]','2026-01-11 00:04:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10238,9297,'fr','Muffins au fondant au chocolat et toile d''araignée','Des pâtisseries chocolatées spéciales d''Halloween pour les bonbons ou les friandises – vous pouvez préparer à l''avance et congeler','["50 g de chocolat noir (55 % de cacao, c''est bien)","85g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de lait, d''eau ou de café","200 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","85 g de sucre muscovado léger","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 oeuf","142 ml de crème sure","100 g de chocolat noir (comme ci-dessus)","100g de chocolat blanc"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante 170C/\r\nconventionnel 190C/gaz 5 et ligne a\r\nmoule à muffins avec 10 caissettes à muffins en papier.\r\nCasser le chocolat dans un moule résistant à la chaleur\r\nbol, ajoutez le beurre et le liquide. Fondre\r\nau micro-ondes à puissance moyenne pendant 30 à 45 secondes (ou placez le bol sur une \r\ncasserole d''eau frémissante doucement). Remuer\r\net laissez refroidir le mélange.","Mélanger la farine, le bicarbonate de soude\r\net les deux sucres dans un bol. Battre le\r\nl''œuf dans un autre bol et incorporer le\r\ncrème aigre, puis versez-la sur le\r\nmélange de farine et ajouter le mélange refroidi\r\nchocolat. Remuer juste pour combiner –\r\nne mélangez pas trop, sinon cela deviendra dur.","Versez le mélange dans les caissettes pour\r\nenviron aux trois quarts plein. Cuire au four pour 20\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien levés. Desserrez le\r\nbords avec un couteau à lame ronde, laissez\r\nils reposent dans les boîtes pendant quelques minutes,\r\npuis retirez-le et laissez-le refroidir sur une grille.","Pour le topping, réalisez deux douilles\r\nsacs en papier sulfurisé (ou\r\ncoupez les extrémités de deux morceaux de plastique propres\r\nsacs). Briser le noir et le blanc\r\nchocolat dans des bols séparés et\r\nfaire fondre au micro-ondes à puissance moyenne pendant\r\n2 minutes (ou sur une poêle comme à l''étape 1).\r\nMettez 2 cuillères à soupe de chocolat noir\r\nun sac et le même en blanc\r\ndu chocolat dans l''autre.","Travailler avec un muffin à la fois,\r\ntartiner de chocolat noir du\r\nbol, en le laissant couler un peu, puis\r\ntuyau quatre cercles concentriques de blanc\r\nchocolat sur le dessus. En utilisant un petit\r\nbrochette, faites glisser à travers les cercles à\r\nintervalles réguliers, du centre vers\r\nle bord, pour créer un effet toile d''araignée.\r\nRépétez avec quatre autres muffins. Sur\r\nles cinq autres, répartis sur\r\nchocolat blanc et décorer avec\r\nl''obscurité. Mieux mangé le jour même\r\nfait - encore mieux pendant que le\r\nle chocolat est doux."]','2026-01-11 00:04:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10239,9298,'fr','Fantômes de mauve','Fabriqués avec des guimauves fondues, ces petits gâteaux d''Halloween effrayants sont à la fois moelleux et croustillants','["100 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour le moule","300 g de guimauves roses et blanches","200 g de céréales de riz (essayez les Rice Krispies)","300 g de chocolat blanc fondu pour enrober","un peu de chocolat noir fondu ou de glaçage noir pour décorer","des bâtons de sucettes en bois ou des agitateurs à café (les agitateurs sont un peu plus souples)"]','["Beurrer puis tapisser un rouleau suisse de 30 x 20 cm.\r\nmoule avec du papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le\r\nbeurre dans une grande casserole antiadhésive.\r\nVersez les guimauves, puis faites fondre très\r\ndoucement pendant environ 10 minutes en remuant régulièrement\r\npour être sûr qu''ils ne collent pas.","Une fois lisse, incorporez les céréales jusqu''à ce que tout\r\ndes grains sont enrobés. Verser le mélange\r\ndans le moule, puis appuyez pour faire\r\nil est plat et lisse. Réfrigérer jusqu''à refroidissement et prise.\r\nPeut être préparé jusqu''à 2 jours à l''avance.","Créez les formes fantômes de deux manières.\r\nCoupez le gâteau en rectangles, puis utilisez\r\nun couteau bien aiguisé pour arrondir les sommets et\r\nzigzaguez les bas. Ou, pour faire voler\r\nfantômes, estampez des cercles d''environ 9 cm\r\nà travers et utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour diviser\r\nen fantômes en forme de larme. Morceaux coupés\r\ndes restes de gâteau pour faire des armes, si vous le souhaitez.","Enfoncez délicatement un bâton de sucette dans le\r\nbas de chaque fantôme. Mettre au frais\r\nsupport. Si tu as fabriqué des armes, colle-les\r\nen utilisant un peu de chocolat blanc, puis à la cuillère\r\nsur plus de chocolat et peignez-le dessus\r\net sur les côtés des fantômes avec un\r\npinceau à pâtisserie. Laisser prendre. Pipe sur les yeux\r\navec le chocolat nature ou le glaçage."]','2026-01-11 00:04:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10240,9299,'fr','Des carrés délicats','Ceux-ci seront un grand succès à Halloween – collants, croquants et moelleux en une seule bouchée.','["150 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux (70 % de cacao c''est bien)","100g de beurre doux","4 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","100 g de céréales Rice Krispies","50 g de myrtilles séchées","50 g de canneberges séchées","100 g de mini guimauves","50 g de chocolat blanc cassé en morceaux","serpents et insectes en gelée, pour décorer"]','["Tapisser un moule carré de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé\r\nparchemin ou film alimentaire. Placez l''obscurité\r\nchocolat, beurre et sirop doré dans une casserole à feu doux et remuer jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus.","Mettez les Rice Krispies dans un grand bol et\r\nincorporer les myrtilles, les canneberges et\r\nguimauves. Incorporer le chocolat fondu\r\nmélange jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien enrobé. Cuillère\r\nverser le mélange dans le moule et étaler\r\nuniformément. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant une heure jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris\r\n(ou préparer la veille et réfrigérer toute la nuit).","Retirer du moule et décoller le papier\r\nou du film alimentaire. À l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, coupez en\r\n16 carrés ou 32 bouchées. Faire fondre le\r\nchocolat blanc dans un petit bol au-dessus d''une poêle\r\nd''eau à peine frémissante, ou dans le\r\nmicro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 1 min, en remuant\r\nà mi-chemin. À l''aide d''une cuillère à café, arrosez le\r\nchocolat blanc sur les carrés. Dispersion\r\navec les bonbons à la gelée, puis laisser prendre\r\navant de l''empiler sur une assiette de service.\r\nConserver dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10241,6159,'fr','Génoise fruitée','La lectrice Sue McGann a conçu cette délicieuse recette de gâteau faible en gras','["beurre ou huile, pour graisser","50g de farine nature","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","4 œufs, séparés","175 g de sucre en poudre","Boîte de 295 g de quartiers de mandarine, égouttés","200g tub low-fat fromage frais","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4.\r\nGraisser puis tapisser le fond et les côtés de 2 x\r\nMoules à sandwich de 20 cm avec papier sulfurisé.\r\nTamisez ensemble les farines et la levure chimique.","Utilisez des batteurs électriques à main pour fouetter le\r\nblancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes, puis incorporez-les brièvement au fouet.\r\nsucre. Battez rapidement les jaunes d''œufs, puis fouettez\r\ndans les blancs. Incorporer les ingrédients secs\r\nà l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal, puis versez le\r\nmélange dans les moules et niveler le dessus. Cuire au four\r\npendant 18 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé, légèrement doré et\r\nune brochette insérée au milieu vient\r\npropre. Laisser refroidir dans les moules 10 min, puis\r\nretirer délicatement et laisser refroidir complètement.","Mélanger les mandarines et le fromage frais\r\nensemble. Retirez le papier sulfurisé,\r\nsandwicher les gâteaux avec le mélange à la mandarine,\r\npuis saupoudrez de sucre glace pour servir.\r\nMieux mangé le jour même de sa préparation."]','2026-01-11 00:04:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10242,9300,'fr','Muffins au chocolat avec crème au chocolat chaud','Ces puddings au cacao classiques avec une sauce au chocolat chaud ne contiennent que 215 calories chacun. Il existe également une version au citron.','["1 cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre","100 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 ml de lait écrémé","1 oeuf","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour graisser","2 pots de 150 g de crème anglaise allégée","25 g de chocolat noir haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 170°C/chaleur tournante 150°C/gaz 5. Badigeonner 6 trous d''un moule à muffins avec une goutte d''huile. Tamisez le cacao dans un grand bol, puis ajoutez le reste des ingrédients secs. Mélangez, puis faites un puits au centre.","Battez le lait, l''œuf et l''huile dans un pichet, versez dans le puits, puis remuez rapidement pour obtenir une pâte. Verser dans le moule à muffins, puis cuire au four pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et ferme au toucher. Faites chauffer la crème anglaise au micro-ondes selon les instructions, ou dans une poêle, puis versez le chocolat haché et remuez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Mettez les puddings dans des bols et versez la crème anglaise dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:04:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10243,9301,'fr','Mango & passion fruit roulade','Inutile de dire « non » à cette roulade fruitée, les génoises fouettées sont réputées faibles en gras, surtout si vous utilisez du yaourt à la place de la crème.','["3 œufs","85 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","85 g de farine ordinaire tamisée","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique tamisée","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","chair de 2 gros fruits de la passion mûrs","2 mangues pelées et coupées en petits morceaux","250 g de framboises surgelées, décongelées","Pot de 200 g de yaourt grec 2% ou de fromage frais très allégé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Graisser\r\net tapisser un moule à rouleau suisse de 30 x 24 cm d''antiadhésif\r\npapier. Mettez les œufs et le sucre dans un\r\ngrand bol et battre avec des batteurs électriques\r\njusqu''à consistance épaisse et légère, environ 5 minutes. Pliez dans le\r\nla farine et la levure chimique, puis la vanille. Astuce\r\ndans le moule, inclinez-le pour niveler le mélange, puis enfournez pendant\r\n12-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et juste élastiques. Tourner\r\nsur une autre feuille de papier, saupoudrée de\r\n1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre. Enroulez le papier à l''intérieur\r\nle biscuit, puis laissez-le refroidir complètement.\r\nL''éponge peut être congelée jusqu''à 1 mois.","Incorporer le sucre, la pulpe de fruit de la passion et un tiers\r\nde la mangue et des framboises dans le yaourt.\r\nDéroulez le biscuit, tartinez-le de garniture, puis\r\nrouler. Servir avec le reste des fruits sur le\r\ncôté. La Roulade peut être remplie et roulée jusqu''à\r\n2 heures avant de servir et conservé au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10244,9302,'fr','Le relooking ultime : la bûche au chocolat','La version allégée de cette gourmandise festive tant appréciée conserve toute la richesse chocolatée','["1 cuillère à café de grains de café instantané","4 œufs, à température ambiante","85 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour rouler","50 g de sucre muscovado léger","120 g de farines autolevantes","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","50 g de chocolat noir, à 70 % de cacao ou plus, haché très finement","250 g de mascarpone léger","140 g de fromage blanc","50g de sucre glace","1 ½ cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre","1 cuillère à café de grains de café instantané","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","brins de houx"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nHuiler légèrement et tapisser un rouleau suisse de 23 x 32 cm.\r\nmoule avec du papier sulfurisé. Mélangez le café avec\r\n1 cuillère à soupe d''eau tiède. Battre les œufs, les deux\r\nles sucres et le café se mélangent dans un\r\ngrand bol à mélanger avec un fouet électrique\r\npendant environ 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit\r\népais et aéré comme une meringue et tient\r\nune trace lorsque vous soulevez les batteurs.","Tamisez la farine et le cacao en poudre\r\nle mélange d''œufs moelleux, puis incorporer très délicatement\r\nà l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal. Versez le\r\nmélanger uniformément dans le moule tapissé et\r\ninclinez-le soigneusement pour qu''il s''étale uniformément\r\nsans être dégonflé. Utilisez un couteau si\r\nnécessaire de le taquiner très doucement dans le\r\ncoins. Cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nle gâteau est spongieux mais ferme au toucher.","Posez une feuille de papier sulfurisé sur le\r\nplan de travail et saupoudrer d''un peu\r\nsucre en poudre. Renversez la boîte\r\nsur le papier et laissez tomber le gâteau.\r\nDécollez soigneusement le papier. Enroulez le\r\ngâteau dans le sens de la longueur de l''un des courts\r\nse termine à l''aide du papier en le roulant\r\nà l''intérieur pour que le gâteau ne colle pas. Cool.\r\nLe gâteau devient encore plus moelleux\r\nsi on le laisse toute la nuit emballé, puis glacé\r\nle lendemain.","Pour le glaçage au chocolat, mettez le\r\nchocolat haché dans un bol moyen.\r\nFaites chauffer une petite casserole d’eau (remplie au tiers)\r\njusqu''à ébullition, retirez-le du feu,\r\npuis posez le bol de chocolat sur le\r\nhaut. Laisser quelques minutes hors du feu\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu. Retirez le bol du\r\ncasserole, puis laissez le chocolat jusqu''à ce qu''il soit\r\nfroid au toucher. Battre le mascarpone\r\net le fromage blanc ensemble, puis tamisez et incorporez\r\nle sucre glace et le cacao en poudre. Remuer\r\ndans le chocolat fondu refroidi (en gardant\r\nquelques cuillères à café pour arroser), puis\r\nle café mélangé à l''extrait de vanille.","Déroulez soigneusement le gâteau, ne\r\nvous inquiétez s''il se fissure un peu et jetez le\r\npapier. Étalez la moitié du glaçage sur\r\ngâteau déroulé, puis roulez-le à nouveau pour terminer\r\navec la jointure en dessous. Placez le gâteau\r\nsur une assiette de service. Faites tourner le reste du\r\nmettre du glaçage sur tout le gâteau pour le recouvrir, puis\r\narroser du fondant réservé\r\nchocolat. Décorer d''un brin de houx."]','2026-01-11 00:04:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10245,9303,'fr','Cake au citron et à la violette','Un gâteau tout-en-un simple et sucré – idéal pour le dimanche des mères','["100g de beurre ramolli","175 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 gros œufs","6 cuillères à soupe de lait","le zeste finement râpé d''un gros citron","le jus d''1 gros citron (il vous faut 3 cuillères à soupe)","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","boules de mimosa et violettes confites, pour décorer"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/Gaz 4/four ventilé 160°C.  Beurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule oblong peu profond (environ 18x28cm/7x11in) de papier sulfurisé.  Versez tous les ingrédients du gâteau dans un grand bol et battez pendant 2-3 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le mélange baisse.\r\nfacilement de la cuillère.","Versez le mélange dans le moule et lissez la surface avec le dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et fermes au toucher.  Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage : battez ensemble le jus de citron et le sucre, versez le mélange uniformément sur le gâteau encore chaud, puis laissez refroidir.","Coupez le gâteau en 15 carrés. Garnir chacun d’une boule de violette confite et de mimosa."]','2026-01-11 00:04:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10246,9304,'fr','Le relooking ultime : Gâteau au café et aux noix','Une version délicieuse mais plus légère du gâteau au café et aux noix, favori de l''heure du thé.','["1 cuillère à soupe de grains de café, plus 1 cuillère à café","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","50g d''amandes moulues","85 g de sucre muscovado léger","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","25 g de noix concassées","2 oeufs, battus","250 g de yaourt nature","75 ml d''huile de noix","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à café de grains de café","140 g de mascarpone léger","100 g de fromage blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","140 g de sucre glace fondant","1 cuillère à café de grains de café","1 cuillère à soupe de noix finement hachées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nHuiler et égoutter un rond de 20 cm (6 cm\r\nprofonde) boîte à fond mobile. Pour le gâteau,\r\nmélanger le café avec 2 cuillères à café d''eau tiède\r\net mettre de côté. Versez la farine dans un grand\r\nbol à mélanger. Incorporer la levure chimique,\r\namandes moulues, les deux sucres (utiliser\r\ndoigts pour éliminer les grumeaux du\r\nmuscovado) et les noix, puis préparez\r\nun plongeon au centre. Mettez les œufs, le yaourt,\r\nmélanger l''huile et le café dans la trempette et remuer\r\nle mélange avec une cuillère en bois afin\r\ntout est uniformément mélangé. Verser le\r\nmélange dans le moule, lisser le dessus pour\r\nnivelez-le, puis faites cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nune brochette insérée au centre du\r\nle gâteau en ressort propre. Laissez le gâteau refroidir\r\ndans le moule brièvement, puis démoulez-le et décollez-le\r\nle papier de doublure. Laisser refroidir complètement\r\npendant que vous préparez la garniture et le glaçage.","Préparez le sirop pour la garniture : mettez le\r\nsucre en poudre et café dans un petit verre,\r\ncasserole à fond épais, puis versez-y\r\n3 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Chauffer doucement en remuant pour\r\naider le sucre à se dissoudre. Une fois dissous,\r\naugmenter le feu, puis faire bouillir à feu vif\r\nfaire bouillir pendant environ 2½-3 minutes jusqu''à épaississement\r\net sirupeux. Verser dans un petit récipient résistant à la chaleur\r\nbol et laisser refroidir. Quand il fait froid\r\ndevrait avoir la consistance de la mélasse.","Pendant ce temps, terminez la garniture et\r\nfaire le glaçage. Battez le mascarpone,\r\nfromage blanc, sucre glace et vanille ensemble\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporer le café froid\r\nsirop. Annuler. Pour le glaçage, tamisez le\r\nsucre glace fondant dans un bol. Mélangez le\r\nà café avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau tiède, remuez-le\r\ndans le sucre glace fondant avec environ\r\n1 cuillère à café d''eau supplémentaire pour donner une consistance lisse et épaisse\r\nmais un glaçage tartinable. Divisez le gâteau en\r\n3, puis reprenez en sandwich avec\r\nla garniture. Étalez le glaçage sur le dessus,\r\nrépartir sur les noix hachées et\r\nlaisser prendre. Conserver au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10247,9305,'fr','Pudding d''été','Ce pud typiquement britannique, rempli de baies d''été juteuses, est tellement plus facile qu''il n''y paraît, parfait pour les débutants','["300g de fraises","250g de mûres","100g de groseilles","500g de framboises","OU 1¼kg/2lb 12oz de mélange de baies et de groseilles de votre choix","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","7 tranches de pain blanc d''un jour, d''un pain carré de taille moyenne"]','["Faites ressortir les jus : Lavez les fruits et séchez-les délicatement sur du papier absorbant – gardez les fraises séparées. Mettez le sucre et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans une grande casserole. Chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous – remuer plusieurs fois. Portez à ébullition 1 min, puis versez les fruits (pas les fraises). Cuire 3 minutes à feu doux en remuant 2 à 3 fois. Le fruit sera ramolli, pour la plupart intact et entouré de jus rouge foncé. Mettez une passoire au-dessus d''un bol et versez les fruits et le jus.","Préparez le pain : Tapissez la bassine de 1,25 litre de film alimentaire car cela facilitera le démoulage du pudding. superposez deux morceaux au milieu du bol car c''est plus facile que d''essayer de faire adhérer une feuille à toutes les courbes.  Laissez les bords dépasser d''environ 15 cm. Coupez les croûtes du pain. Coupez 4 morceaux de pain en deux, un peu en biais, pour obtenir 2 rectangles de travers par morceau. Coupez 2 tranches en 4 triangles chacune et laissez le dernier morceau entier.","Préparez le pud : trempez le morceau de pain entier dans le jus pendant quelques secondes, juste pour l''enrober. Poussez-le dans le fond du bassin. Maintenant, plongez les pièces rectangulaires bancales une à la fois et appuyez sur les côtés du bassin pour qu''elles s''emboîtent parfaitement, en plaçant alternativement les extrémités larges et étroites. Si vous ne parvenez pas à y insérer le dernier morceau de pain, cela n''a pas d''importance, coupez-le simplement en triangle, trempez-le dans le jus et insérez-le. Maintenant, versez les fruits ramollis, en ajoutant les fraises ici et là au fur et à mesure.","Laissez les saveurs se mélanger puis servez : trempez les triangles de pain dans le jus et placez-les dessus – coupez le surplus avec des ciseaux. Gardez les restes de jus pour plus tard. Apportez du film alimentaire et scellez sans serrer. Placez une assiette latérale sur le dessus et alourdissez-la avec des canettes. Réfrigérer 6 heures ou toute la nuit. Pour servir, ouvrez le film alimentaire puis posez une assiette de service à l''envers dessus et retournez-la. servir avec \r\nles restes de jus, les baies supplémentaires et la crème."]','2026-01-11 00:04:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10248,4347,'fr','Muffins aux fruits','Commencez la matinée avec un muffin de petit-déjeuner faible en gras rempli de myrtilles, de canneberges, de raisins secs et d''abricots.','["225 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 gros œufs","50 g de beurre fondu","175 ml de lait écrémé","100 ml de miel clair","140 g de myrtilles fraîches","85 g de canneberges séchées","140 g de raisins secs sans pépins","140 g d''abricots secs hachés","1 cuillère à café de zeste d''orange râpé","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue"]','["Préchauffer le four à 200C/gaz 6/\r\nventilateur 180C et beurrer très légèrement un\r\nMoule à muffins 12 trous. Tamisez la farine et\r\nla levure chimique dans un bol. Dans\r\ndans un autre bol, battez légèrement les œufs,\r\npuis incorporez le beurre fondu, le lait\r\net chérie. Ajouter à la farine avec le\r\ningrédients restants. Combiner\r\nrapidement sans trop travailler (c''est\r\ntrès bien s''il reste quelques grumeaux –\r\nvous le voulez gluant plutôt que fluide).\r\nVerser le mélange dans le muffin\r\nétain. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien levé et doré pâle sur le dessus.","Laisser dans le moule quelques minutes\r\navant de sortir. Une fois refroidis, ils le feront\r\nconserver dans une boîte hermétique pendant deux jours.\r\n(Peut être congelé jusqu''à 1 mois.)"]','2026-01-11 00:04:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10249,9306,'fr','Puds au caramel collant sans culpabilité','Une version plus légère du pudding classique, pleine de dattes collantes et de sirop d''érable. Miam','["175 g de dattes séchées dénoyautées","150 ml de sirop d''érable","1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait de vanille","2 gros œufs, séparés","85 g de farines autolevantes","Yogourt grec 0% et sirop d''érable supplémentaire, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/Gaz 4/four ventilé 160°C. Mettez les dattes et 175 ml d''eau dans une casserole et laissez mijoter pendant 5 minutes.  Versez dans un robot culinaire, ajoutez 6 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable et l''extrait de vanille et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Transférer dans un bol et incorporer les jaunes d''œufs, suivis de la farine. Dans un autre bol, fouetter les blancs d''œufs en neige ferme et les incorporer au mélange de dattes.","Mettez 1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable dans chacun des quatre moules à pudding de 200 ml/7 fl oz et ajoutez le mélange. Couvrir hermétiquement chacun d''un papier d''aluminium, disposer dans un plat allant au four et verser de l''eau chaude jusqu''à mi-hauteur des moules. Cuire 1 heure, jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre.","Découvrez, passez un couteau sur les bords et retournez sur des assiettes. Arroser de yogourt et de sirop d''érable pour servir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10250,9307,'fr','Cuisson aux petits fruits avec un filet de fruits de la passion','Un pud familial fruité pour l’été – et en prime, il est également faible en gras','["100 g de pâte à tartiner faible en gras","85 g de sucre en poudre","le zeste et le jus râpés d''1 citron","1 oeuf","140 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature faible en gras, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","200 g de compote de pommes","140g de framboises, myrtilles ou mûres (ou un mélange)","50 g de sucre démérara","2 fruits de la passion coupés en deux et la pulpe retirée"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.\r\nGraisser légèrement un plat allant au four de taille moyenne avec\r\n1 cuillère à café de pâte à tartiner. Mettez le reste\r\npâte à tartiner, sucre semoule, zeste de citron, œuf,\r\nfarine, levure chimique et yaourt dans un\r\nbol à mélanger. Fouetter ensemble pendant 2 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Incorporer la pomme\r\nsauce – cela pourrait donner au mélange un aspect\r\ncaillé, mais ne vous inquiétez pas. Incorporer délicatement\r\nles baies, puis versez la pâte dans le\r\nplat préparé et niveler la surface. Cuire au four\r\npendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la génoise soit dorée\r\nbrun et ferme au centre.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le jus de citron, le demerara\r\nsucre et pulpe de fruit de la passion ensemble.\r\nRetirer le pudding du four, légèrement\r\npiquer la surface avec une fourchette et arroser\r\nsur le mélange de fruits de la passion. Servir chaud\r\navec de la glace vanille allégée ou du yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:04:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10251,9308,'fr','Petit gâteau aux pommes et au caramel','Inspirez les enfants âgés de 8 à 14 ans dans la cuisine en préparant un thé l''après-midi','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol, et un peu plus pour la boîte","1 grosse pomme","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","110 g de farines autolevantes","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 caramels mous"]','["Demandez à votre\r\naide adulte pour allumer le four\r\nsur ventilateur 190C/170C/\r\ngaz 5. Badigeonner un petit moule à pain (500 g/ 1 lb)\r\navec un peu d''huile.","Peler la pomme\r\navec une pomme de terre\r\néplucheur, puis coupez-le\r\nen quartiers et\r\nDécoupez les noyaux.Demandez à un adulte\r\naider si vous en avez besoin.","Râper la pomme\r\nà l''aide d''un rotatif ou\r\nrâpe à boîte et mettez-la\r\ndans un grand bol.","Casser l''œuf\r\ndans un petit bol.\r\nSi des morceaux de coquille\r\ntomber, les sortir\r\navec une cuillère. Ajouter\r\nà la pomme, alors\r\najoutez 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile et\r\nla vanille. Bien mélanger.","Ajouter la farine\r\net du sucre et\r\nmélanger. Le\r\nle mélange est assez ferme\r\nalors continue jusqu''à ce que\r\ntoute la farine est\r\nmélangé. Grattez\r\ndans le moule préparé.","Poussez 3 caramels\r\ndans le mélange\r\nd''affilée. Demandez à un\r\nadulte pour mettre le\r\nboîte au four pendant\r\n30-40 minutes ou jusqu''à\r\nbien cuit.\r\nLaisser refroidir avant de basculer\r\nsortir et trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:04:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10252,4583,'fr','Le relooking ultime : les muffins aux bleuets','Nous avons créé une version délicieusement légère de ce muffin classique qui ne contient pratiquement aucune graisse saturée.','["5 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","225 g de farines autolevantes","115g de farine complète","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","le zeste d''½ citron et 1 cuillère à café de jus","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","50 g de sucre muscovado léger","1 petite banane bien mûre à peau noire (poids pelé environ 85g)","1 oeuf","Pot de 284 ml de babeurre","225 g de myrtilles fraîches"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nUtilisez 1 cuillère à café d''huile pour huiler légèrement un muffin à 12 trous.\r\nétain (ou utilisez des caisses en papier). Mélanger les deux farines\r\navec la levure chimique et le zeste de citron.\r\nRéservez 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre, puis remuez le\r\nreposer dans la farine avec le muscovado.","Écrasez bien la banane. Dans un autre bol\r\nbattre l''œuf, puis incorporer la banane,\r\nbabeurre et huile. Utiliser un gros métal\r\ncuillère, incorporer très légèrement au mélange de farine,\r\njuste pour combiner. Un mélange excessif fera\r\nles muffins sont durs. Incorporer les myrtilles\r\net donnez juste quelques tours de cuillère à\r\nIncorporez-les délicatement sans les écraser.","Versez le mélange dans le moule –\r\nchaque trou doit être très plein. Cuire au four pour\r\n20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés.","Mélangez le sucre en poudre réservé avec\r\nle jus de citron. Quand les muffins sont\r\nc''est fait, retirer du four, puis badigeonner\r\navec le mélange sucre et citron pendant que\r\nils sont encore chauds. Desserrez doucement les bords\r\nde chaque muffin avec un couteau, puis laisser\r\ndans le moule pendant 15 minutes pour refroidir un peu\r\nils sont très délicats lorsqu’ils sont chauds. Supprimer\r\nsur une grille. Mieux mangé le jour même\r\npréparation, mais se conserve jusqu''à 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10253,6167,'fr','Gâteau au thé fruité','Parfait avec une tasse de thé revigorante, ce gâteau se conserve et restera volontiers dans une boîte pendant environ une semaine.','["300 g de mélange de baies et cerises séchées","225 ml de thé chaud","jus 1 orange (environ 75 ml/2½fl oz) plus le zeste","50g de beurre","100 g de sucre roux clair","1 oeuf","225 g de farines autolevantes","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara"]','["Mettez les fruits secs dans un bol et\r\nverser dessus le thé chaud, le jus d''orange et\r\nzeste. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire, puis laisser reposer\r\nau moins 4 heures ou mieux encore toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule à pain de 2 lb.\r\nBattre ensemble le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à ce que\r\ncrémeux, puis incorporer l''œuf suivi de\r\nla farine. Incorporer délicatement les fruits\r\nmélange. Versez le mélange dans le moule,\r\npuis lisser la surface avec le\r\ndos d''une cuillère. Saupoudrer le tout d''un\r\népaisse couche de sucre demerara.","Cuire au four pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent soit inséré\r\nau centre en ressort propre. Laisser à\r\nlaisser refroidir dans le moule, puis démouler, couper en\r\ntranches et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10254,6169,'fr','Muffins bananes et myrtilles','Un muffin faible en gras qui a aussi bon goût qu''il en a l''air – ils se conservent dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 3 jours ou se congèlent jusqu''à un mois','["300 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","50 g de flocons d''avoine, plus 1 cuillère à soupe pour la garniture","2 bananes moyennes, plus elles sont mûres, mieux c''est","284 ml de babeurre en carton","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive légère","2 blancs d''œufs","150 g de barquette de myrtilles"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de caissettes à muffins en papier. Versez la farine et le bicarbonate de soude dans un grand bol. Retenez 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre, puis mélangez le reste avec la farine et 50 g de flocons d''avoine. Faites un puits au centre. Dans un autre bol, écrasez les bananes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient presque lisses. Incorporer le babeurre, l''huile et les blancs d''œufs dans la purée de banane jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène.","Versez le mélange liquide dans le puits et remuez rapidement et avec parcimonie avec une cuillère en bois. Le mélange aura l’air grumeleux et peut avoir quelques taches de farine encore visibles, mais ne soyez pas tenté de trop mélanger. Ajoutez les myrtilles et remuez encore une fois. Répartissez le mélange dans les moules à muffins – ils seront bien remplis – puis saupoudrez le dessus avec la dernière cuillère à soupe de flocons d''avoine et le reste de sucre. Cuire au four pendant 18 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés foncés. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes dans la plaque avant de la déposer sur une grille pour qu''elle refroidisse complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:04:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10255,9309,'fr','Muffins aux poires et au caramel','Ces muffins gluants sont délicieux tièdes lorsque le caramel est encore fondant – vous pouvez les réchauffer au micro-ondes','["300 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","250 ml de lait","2 oeufs, battus","100 g de beurre fondu","2 poires mûres, pelées et coupées en petits morceaux","100 g de caramels mous, coupés en morceaux","25g d''amandes effilées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.\r\nTapisser un moule à muffins profond de 12 trous avec\r\ncaisses en papier. Versez la farine, la levure chimique,\r\ncannelle et une pincée de sel dans un grand\r\nbol, puis incorporez le sucre. Mélangez ensemble le\r\nlait, œufs et beurre fondu dans un grand pichet\r\net verser d''un seul coup dans le mélange sec, en même temps\r\navec les poires et un tiers du caramel\r\nmorceaux. Remuer brièvement jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence tout juste à\r\nmélanger – la pâte doit encore être assez\r\ngrumeleux et présentent des traînées de farine.","Répartissez le mélange dans les caisses,\r\npuis saupoudrer du reste de caramel et\r\nles amandes effilées. Cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les muffins soient levés, dorés et se sentent\r\nferme une fois pressé (le caramel fondu sera\r\nextrêmement chaud donc faites attention à ne pas le toucher).\r\nRetirer du moule sur une grille pour laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10256,5237,'fr','Pain aux dattes, bananes et rhum','Un gâteau savoureux sans matières grasses ni sucre ajoutés – essayez-le, croyez-le. De plus, il est facile à préparer sans gluten','["Paquet de 250 g de dattes dénoyautées et prêtes à manger","2 petites ou 1 grosse banane (140 g/5 oz)","100 g de noix de pécan, 85 g/3 oz hachées grossièrement, le reste entier","200g raisins","200 g de raisins secs","100 g de polenta fine","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique (utiliser sans gluten si nécessaire)","3 cuillères à soupe de rhum brun","2 blancs d''œufs","quelques chips de banane et 1 cuillère à café de sucre (facultatif), pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/ventilateur 160C/gaz 4. Ligne\r\nun moule à cake de 900 g avec cuisson antiadhésive\r\npapier, en utilisant un peu d''huile pour le faire coller. Mettre\r\nles dattes dans une petite casserole avec 200ml\r\neau bouillante et laisser mijoter 5 minutes. Vidanger\r\nle liquide dans un pichet, puis mettez les dattes dans un\r\nrobot culinaire. Ajouter les bananes et 100 ml\r\nà soupe de datte liquide et fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nMélangez les noix, les fruits secs, la polenta, les épices et\r\nla levure chimique dans un bol, puis ajoutez la datte\r\nréduire en purée et le rhum, et remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Montez les blancs d''oeufs en neige ferme et\r\nincorporer au mélange à gâteau. Versez dans le moule (cela\r\nêtre bien rempli), puis compléter avec le reste\r\nles noix de pécan et les chips de banane et le sucre,\r\nsi vous l''utilisez. Cuire au four pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et\r\ncroustillant et une brochette en ressort propre.\r\nLaisser refroidir complètement avant de couper en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:04:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10257,6171,'fr','Muffins aux pêches et aux amandes','Ces délicieuses friandises faibles en gras sont parfaites pour une gâterie estivale et peuvent être servies chaudes ou froides.','["3 gros œufs","100 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","quelques gouttes d''extrait d''amande","25 g de beurre fondu","100 g de farines autolevantes","25g d''amandes moulues","2 petites pêches","2 cuillères à café de confiture de pêches ou de confiture d''abricots","1 cuillère à soupe d''amandes effilées","crème fraîche demi-écrémée, pour servir"]','["Préchauffer le four à 220°C/ventilateur 200°C/gaz 7. Dans un grand bol, utilisez un fouet à main pour mélanger les œufs, le sucre et l''extrait d''amande pendant une minute jusqu''à obtenir une mousse. Versez le beurre fondu et continuez de battre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporez délicatement la farine, la poudre d''amandes et une pincée de sel.","Coupez les pêches en deux, dénoyautez et tranchez-les en tranches. Répartir le mélange à muffins entre les 6 trous d''un moule à muffins antiadhésif. Garnir chacun d’une goutte de confiture ou de confiture et disposer dessus quelques tranches de pêche. Répartissez les amandes et un peu de sucre supplémentaire, puis faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient gonflées et dorées. Servir tiède avec une cuillerée de crème fraîche demi-élevée, ou laisser refroidir. Il est préférable de les consommer le jour même de leur préparation ou de les congeler, encore légèrement chauds, jusqu''à 1 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10258,9310,'fr','Muffins aux carottes et aux noix de pécan','Basés sur les saveurs du gâteau aux carottes, ceux-ci ont un ingrédient surprise : des haricots cannellini ! Ils ajoutent une belle texture et aident à fournir 1 de vos 5 fruits et légumes par jour','["2 boîtes de 400g de haricots cannellini dans l''eau, égouttés","2 c. à café de cannelle moulue","100g de flocons d''avoine","4 gros oeufs","2 c. à soupe d''huile de colza","4 c. à soupe de sirop d''érable","2 c. à café d''extrait de vanille","zeste de 1 grosse orange","170g de carotte, grossièrement râpée","100g de raisins secs","80g de cerneaux de noix de pécan, 12 réservés, le reste grossièrement haché","2 c. à café de levure chimique"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à 12 muffins de caissettes en papier. Mettre les haricots dans un bol et ajouter la cannelle, l''avoine, les œufs, l''huile, le sirop d''érable, l''extrait de vanille et le zeste d''orange. Mixer avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance très lisse – les haricots et l''avoine doivent être broyés autant que possible.","Incorporer la carotte, les raisins secs, les noix de pécan hachées et la levure chimique, et bien mélanger. Répartir dans les caissettes à muffins – utiliser une grande cuillère à glace si vous en avez une, pour obtenir des muffins bien réguliers.","Garnir chaque muffin d''une noix de pécan réservée et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pris et légèrement dorés. Laisser refroidir sur une grille. Se conservent au réfrigérateur quelques jours, ou congeler pendant 6 semaines ; décongeler à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:04:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10259,9311,'fr','Recette de base de muffins','Charlotte Hilsdon, lectrice de Good Food, partage sa recette simple de muffins aux pépites de chocolat, à laquelle vous pouvez ajouter des fruits, du chocolat ou des noix.','["2 œufs moyens","125 ml d''huile végétale","250 ml de lait demi-écrémé","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","400 g de farine autolevante (ou même quantité de farine nature et 3 cuillères à café de levure chimique)","1 cuillère à café de sel","100 g de pépites de chocolat (voir astuce) ou de fruits secs comme des raisins secs ou des cerises séchées (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser 2 moules à muffins de moules à muffins en papier. Dans un grand bol, battez légèrement les œufs avec un batteur électrique à main pendant 1 min. Ajoutez l''huile et le lait et battez jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé, puis ajoutez le sucre et fouettez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Tamisez la farine et le sel (et la levure chimique si vous en utilisez), puis mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Attention à ne pas trop mélanger la pâte car cela rendrait les muffins plus durs. Incorporer les pépites de chocolat ou les fruits secs si vous en utilisez.","Remplissez les moules à muffins aux deux tiers et faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés, fermes au toucher et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Si les plateaux ne tiennent pas sur 1 grille, échangez les grilles après 15 minutes de cuisson. Laissez les muffins dans le moule refroidir pendant quelques minutes et transférez-les sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:04:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10260,9312,'fr','Muffins aux bleuets glacés à l''érable','Donnez une nouvelle jeunesse au muffin aux bleuets classique en ajoutant un glaçage croustillant au sucre d''érable, qui forme une croûte craquelée.','["250 g de farine nature","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","140g de sucre semoule","100 g de beurre doux, fondu","50g de babeurre","2 gros œufs","50 g de sirop d''érable, plus 1½ cuillère à soupe pour la garniture","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","175 g de myrtilles, plus un peu pour le dessus","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Placer les moules à muffins dans un moule à muffins. Dans un grand bol, mélanger la farine, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate, le sucre et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel. Fouetter le beurre, le babeurre, les œufs, le sirop d''érable et l''extrait de vanille dans un pichet. Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs et ajoutez la plupart des myrtilles. Remuer brièvement pour bien combiner, mais ne pas trop mélanger sinon les muffins seront lourds.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules à muffins (utilisez une cuillère à glace si vous en avez une) et enfournez pendant 22-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien levé et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Transférer sur une grille.","Mélangez le reste du sirop d''érable et le sucre glace avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Badigeonnez chaque muffin de glaçage pendant qu''ils sont encore chauds. Disposez quelques myrtilles sur chacune d’elles. Mieux mangé dans un jour ou deux."]','2026-01-11 00:04:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10261,9313,'fr','Muffins à l''orange sanguine et au pavot','Ces muffins aux agrumes sont délicieux et légers et constituent un délicieux pudding servi avec de la glace ou du yaourt grec épais.','["5 cuillères à soupe d''huile légère de colza ou de tournesol, plus un peu pour graisser","300 g de farine autolevante","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de pavot","200 ml de lait","1 gros œuf","zeste de 2 oranges sanguines, jus 2½","140g de sucre semoule"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et graisser légèrement un moule à muffins à 12 trous. Mélangez la farine, le sucre en poudre, la levure chimique et les graines de pavot dans un grand bol à mélanger. Dans un autre bol, fouetter ensemble l’huile, le lait, l’œuf, ainsi que le zeste et le jus d’une des oranges.","En travaillant très rapidement, versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs et mélangez à peine avec une fourchette – le mélange doit être grumeleux, alors ne le travaillez pas trop. Versez le mélange dans les moules et faites cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et doré.","Pendant que les muffins cuisent, mélangez le reste du zeste avec le sucre semoule dans un petit bol. Préparez également le reste du jus d’orange sanguine.","Laissez les muffins refroidir pendant 2 minutes, puis transférez-les sur une grille. En travaillant à nouveau rapidement, versez le jus dans le mélange de sucre et versez-en un peu sur chaque muffin, en répétant jusqu''à ce qu''il\r\nest tout épuisé. Laisser reposer 5 minutes avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:04:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10262,8677,'fr','Muffin Coffee Time aux Framboises','Le régal parfait pour la pause café','["2 cuillères à soupe de café finement moulu","100g de beurre","50g de pignons de pin","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","400 g de farine autolevante","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 gros œufs","284 ml de babeurre ou de crème sure","225 g de framboises fraîches"]','["Incorporez 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante au café. Réserver quelques minutes. Chauffer le four à 200°C/chaleur tournante 180°C/gaz 6. Découpez des carrés de 12 x 10 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faites fondre le beurre, utilisez-en un peu pour badigeonner l''intérieur d''un moule à muffins profond à 12 trous et laissez le reste refroidir légèrement. Tapisser le moule avec les carrés de papier pour qu''ils dépassent un peu. (Ou utilisez des caissettes en papier.) Faites griller la moitié des pignons de pin. Filtrez et mélangez le café avec le lait.","Mélangez la farine, les pignons de pin grillés, le sucre et le bicarbonate de soude dans un grand bol. Dans un autre bol, battez les œufs, puis mélangez le babeurre, le beurre refroidi et le café. Incorporez-le au mélange de farine jusqu''à ce que le tout soit presque combiné – il suffira de quelques brasses et le mélange sera léger et aéré. Ajoutez les framboises, remuez encore quelques instants pour terminer le mélange, mais ne battez pas trop, sinon le mélange durcira. Versez le mélange dans les moules à muffins, ils seront bien remplis.","Répartissez le reste des pignons de pin dessus et enfournez pendant environ 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés. Laissez-les refroidir dans le moule quelques minutes, puis placez-les sur une grille de refroidissement. Mangez dans les 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10263,8679,'fr','Mélange à muffins de Noël','Une gourmandise festive à offrir ou à recevoir','["300 g de farine autolevante","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées moulues","100 g de noix de pécan ou de noix","140 g de mélange de fruits secs tropicaux","100 g de sucre muscovado léger"]','["Disposez tous les ingrédients dans un bocal en verre ou en plastique d''un litre dans l''ordre dans lequel les ingrédients sont répertoriés.","Écrivez la méthode suivante sur une étiquette cadeau : « Versez le contenu du pot dans un grand bol à mélanger. Faites un puits au centre et ajoutez 2 œufs battus, 300 ml de lait et 100 g de beurre fondu. Mélanger rapidement et légèrement pour obtenir une pâte molle. Répartir dans 12 moules à muffins. Cuire au four à 190C/ventilateur 170C/gaz 5 pendant 18-20 minutes. À utiliser dans les 4 semaines. » Fixez l’étiquette et une cuillère en bois sur le dessus du pot avec du raphia ou un ruban de couleur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10264,7609,'fr','Caponata avec polenta et fromage','Préparez quelque chose de différent pour le dîner avec une caponata riche en légumes et une polenta au fromage. C''est sain, sans gluten, plein de nutriments et sûr de satisfaire','["1-2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, coupé en fines tranches","1 courgette, coupée en rondelles","1 aubergine, coupée en morceaux","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","¼ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","30 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées, coupées en deux","½ cuillère à soupe de câpres, égouttées et rincées","½ petit bouquet de basilic finement haché, plus un peu pour servir","100 g de polenta instantanée","un peu de lait, pour détendre (facultatif)","40 g de parmesan ou de fromage à pâte dure végétarien à l''italienne, râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle moyenne à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon, la courgette et l''aubergine pendant 5 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Incorporer l''ail, l''origan et les flocons de piment, suivis des tomates, des olives et des câpres. Assaisonner au goût, puis laisser mijoter à couvert pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que tous les légumes soient tendres et bien cuits. Incorporer le basilic et goûter pour l''assaisonnement.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire la polenta en suivant les instructions sur l’emballage – vous devrez peut-être la détendre avec un peu d’eau ou de lait si elle est trop épaisse. Mélangez avec le parmesan, puis versez et répartissez sur deux assiettes. Garnir de caponata et de basilic supplémentaire. Saison."]','2026-01-11 00:04:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10265,9316,'fr','Gâteau sans farine au citron et à la polenta','Ce gâteau aux agrumes sans gluten a un côté amer adulte. Servir avec du mascarpone crémeux et du café noir','["2 citrons","140 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","3 œufs","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g d''amandes moulues","175 g de polenta ou de semoule de maïs fine","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten","mascarpone, pour servir","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","jus d''1 citron"]','["Beurrer un moule à cake de 23 cm et chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Mettre les citrons dans une casserole et couvrir d''eau froide. Porter à ébullition, égoutter, verser davantage d''eau froide, puis laisser mijoter 1 heure jusqu''à ce que les citrons soient bien tendres, en ajoutant de l''eau si nécessaire. Bien égoutter les citrons. Une fois refroidis, coupez-les en deux, retirez les pépins et passez-les au robot culinaire pour obtenir une purée.","Ajoutez tous les autres ingrédients du gâteau et continuez à mélanger jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lâche. Versez la pâte dans le moule à gâteau et faites cuire au four pendant 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et commence à rétrécir sur les côtés. Pendant la cuisson du gâteau, réalisez le filet en mélangeant le sucre avec le jus de citron. Lorsque le gâteau est prêt, sortez-le du four et laissez-le refroidir un peu. Pendant qu’il est encore chaud, versez dessus et laissez refroidir complètement. Servir avec du mascarpone."]','2026-01-11 00:04:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10266,9317,'fr','Gâteau aux fleurs de cerisier','Une pâtisserie légère sans gluten qui utilise de la polenta à la place de la farine et de la fleur d''oranger pour parfumer un filet de sirop','["300 g de cerises dénoyautées et hachées grossièrement","250 g de polenta","250 g de beurre ramolli","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 gros œufs","100 g d''amandes moulues","2½ cuillères à café de levure chimique","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à café d''eau de fleur d''oranger","jus ½ orange","jus 1 orange","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","½ cuillère à café d''eau de fleur d''oranger","50 g de cerises dénoyautées, plus des cerises supplémentaires sur tiges pour servir","175 g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nUtilisez un peu de beurre pour graisser un\r\nmoule à gâteau profond de 23 cm et tapisser de cuisson\r\nparchemin. Mélangez les cerises et 50g de\r\nla polenta, puis réserver.","Dans un grand bol, mélanger le beurre et\r\nsucre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et\r\nmoelleux. Ajouter les oeufs, un à un, en mélangeant\r\nbien entre chaque ajout. Ajoutez le\r\npolenta restante, les amandes, cuisson\r\npoudre, yaourt, eau de fleur d''oranger,\r\njus d''orange et mélange de cerises, et remuer\r\ntout jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste combiné. Astuce dans\r\ndémouler, lisser le dessus et enfourner 45 min\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette en ressorte propre.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le sirop. Faire bouillir le\r\nle jus d''orange et le sucre pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle sucre est dissous. Supprimer du\r\nchauffer, ajouter l''eau de fleur d''oranger et\r\nlaisser refroidir. Lorsque le gâteau est cuit, retirez-le\r\ndu four et verser sur le sirop.\r\nLaisser refroidir dans le moule 20 mn puis\r\ntransférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pour faire le glaçage aux cerises, mettez le\r\ncerises et sucre glace dans un petit aliment\r\nrobot et mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nVerser sur tout le gâteau, puis garnir de\r\ncerises entières. Se conservera jusqu''à\r\n5 jours dans un moule à cake."]','2026-01-11 00:04:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10267,9318,'fr','Gâteau polenta à l''orange','Donnez à votre dessert une saveur italienne avec ce gâteau à la polenta moelleux et fruité','["250 g de beurre doux","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 gros œufs","140 g de polenta","200 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","le zeste et le jus de 2 oranges (moins 100 ml de jus pour le glaçage)","100 ml de jus d''orange","100 g de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Chauffer le four à 160C/140C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un gâteau rond de 23 cm.\r\nmoule avec du papier sulfurisé. Crémer le\r\nbeurre et sucre ensemble jusqu''à consistance légère et\r\nmoelleux. Ajoutez les œufs un à un et\r\nbien mélanger. Une fois le mélange obtenu\r\ncombiné, ajouter tous les ingrédients secs\r\net le zeste et le jus après avoir mangé\r\nmesuré 100 ml pour le glaçage.","Transférer le mélange dans le moule, étaler\r\nuniformément, puis cuire environ 45 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette soit insérée au centre\r\ndu gâteau ressort propre. Supprimer\r\ndu four et démoulez sur un fil\r\ngrille pour refroidir.","Pour faire le glaçage, mettez le jus et\r\nsucre dans une casserole moyenne et apporter\r\nà ébullition. Laissez mijoter 5 minutes, puis\r\nretirer du feu et laisser refroidir.\r\nVerser le glaçage à l''orange sur le dessus de\r\nle gâteau refroidi. Servir avec de la glace au citron, ci-dessous."]','2026-01-11 00:04:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10268,9319,'fr','Gâteau à la crème de coco','Un gâteau sans œufs alléchant avec un goût exotique','["le jus d''1 citron","50g de noix de coco desséchée","200 ml de crème de coco en carton","85g de polenta fine ou moyenne","2 cuillères à café rases de levure chimique","140 g de beurre à température ambiante","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","le zeste finement râpé d''un demi citron","140 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de noix de coco desséchée grillée","140 g de sucre glace tamisé"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/gaz 4/chaleur tournante\r\nfour 160C. Tapisser un rond de 18 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau avec du papier sulfurisé.\r\nCrémer ensemble le beurre et\r\nsucre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter 150 ml/1?4 pinte\r\nde la crème de coco et du\r\nle reste des ingrédients du gâteau et\r\nbattre légèrement pour obtenir une consistance douce et\r\nmélange légèrement humide.","Versez les ingrédients dans le\r\nmouler et cuire au four pendant 50 à 55 minutes,\r\njusqu''à ce que le dessus du gâteau soit doré\r\net une brochette insérée vient\r\npropre. Retirer du four\r\nlaisser refroidir dans le moule à cake.","Une fois froid, retirez le gâteau\r\nde la boîte, retirez le\r\npapier et posez le gâteau sur un\r\nassiette. Mettez le sucre glace dans un\r\nbol et ajoutez suffisamment de\r\ncrème de coco réservée à\r\nmélanger jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse mais fluide\r\ncohérence. Étalez le glaçage\r\nsur le gâteau, en lui permettant de\r\ndribbler sur les côtés, puis\r\nsaupoudrer de noix de coco grillée\r\nautour du bord supérieur."]','2026-01-11 00:04:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10269,9320,'fr','Gâteau léger au citron','Angela Nilsen donne à l''un des gâteaux les plus populaires de notre site une cure de jouvence saine en réduisant les graisses.','["75 ml d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour la boîte","175 g de farines autolevantes","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","50g d''amandes moulues","50 g de polenta","le zeste finement râpé de 2 citrons","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 gros œufs","225g de yaourt nature","85 g de sucre en poudre","jus de 2 citrons (environ 5 cuillères à soupe)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nHuiler légèrement un gâteau rond de 20 cm x 5 cm de profondeur\r\nmoule et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé.\r\nPour le gâteau, mettre la farine, la levure chimique,\r\namandes moulues et polenta dans un grand\r\nbol à mélanger. Incorporer le zeste de citron et\r\nsucre, puis faire un plongeon au centre. Battre\r\nles œufs dans un bol, puis incorporez le yaourt.\r\nVersez ce mélange avec l''huile dans le\r\ntremper (voir étape par étape numéro 1), puis remuer brièvement et doucement avec un\r\ngrande cuillère en métal pour que tout soit juste\r\ncombinés, sans trop mélanger.","Versez le mélange dans le moule et nivelez\r\nle haut (étape 2). Cuire au four pendant 40 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un\r\nbrochette insérée au centre du\r\nle gâteau en ressort propre. Couvrir légèrement avec\r\npapier d''aluminium pendant les 5 à 10 dernières minutes s''il commence à\r\ndorer trop vite.","Pendant la cuisson du gâteau, préparez le citron\r\nsirop. Versez le sucre en poudre dans un petit\r\nune casserole avec le jus de citron et\r\n75 ml d''eau. Chauffer à feu moyen,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit bien\r\ndissous. Augmentez le feu, faites bouillir pendant 4 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement réduit et sirupeux, puis\r\nretirer du feu.","Sortez le gâteau du four et\r\nlaissez-le refroidir brièvement dans le moule. Alors qu''il est encore\r\ntiède, démoulez-le, retirez le\r\npapier de doublure et posez le gâteau sur un fil\r\ngrille posée sur une plaque à pâtisserie ou similaire.\r\nUtilisez une pique à brochette pour faire plein de petits trous\r\nsur tout le dessus du gâteau (étape 3). Lentement\r\nverser sur la moitié du sirop de citron (étape 4) et\r\nlaissez-le pénétrer. Versez le reste dans le\r\nde la même manière, en brossant les bords et les côtés\r\ndu gâteau également avec le reste du sirop."]','2026-01-11 00:04:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10270,9321,'fr','Gâteau polenta aux framboises et au citron','Donnez à votre génoise une touche italienne avec le gâteau à la polenta facile à préparer de Jane Hornby','["225g de beurre très mou","225 g de sucre en poudre, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","4 œufs, battus","175 g de polenta fine","50g de farine nature","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","le zeste finement râpé de 1½ citron","200 g de framboises surgelées, laissées surgelées","sucre glace, ou plus au goût (facultatif)","100g de fromage à pâte molle à température ambiante (nous avons utilisé du Philadelphia)","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace, ou plus selon votre goût","le zeste finement râpé d''un demi-citron et un filet de jus","Pot de 142 ml de crème double","100 g de framboises surgelées, décongelées"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/chaleur tournante 170°/gaz 5 et beurrer deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm. Tapisser le fond des moules de papier sulfurisé. Dans\r\ndans un grand bol, battre ensemble le beurre et 225 g de sucre en poudre jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse et légère. Ajoutez progressivement l''œuf, petit à petit, jusqu''à ce que tout l''œuf soit incorporé et que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Si le mélange semble commencer à se diviser, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de farine, puis continuez.","Mettez la polenta dans un autre bol, puis incorporez la farine et la levure chimique. Battre l''extrait et le zeste de vanille dans le mélange aux œufs, puis incorporer les ingrédients secs. Versez la moitié de la pâte dans chaque moule et nivelez le dessus. Répartissez toutes les framboises sauf une poignée sur le mélange et piquez-les doucement. Saupoudrer l''une des génoises avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre. Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé et doré, mais toujours avec un peu de tremblement sous la croûte.","Ouvrez le four, fouettez le biscuit en croûte de sucre et enfoncez rapidement le reste des framboises surgelées sur le dessus. Cuire les deux génoises encore 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient élastiques au milieu. Si cela vous semble trop compliqué, laissez simplement les génoises cuire pendant 30 minutes – le gâteau n’aura pas l’air aussi glamour, mais aura toujours bon goût (vous pouvez plutôt ajouter les restes de baies à la garniture).\r\nLaisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille. Soyez prudent lorsque vous retournez le biscuit garni de framboise et faites-le glisser hors de sa base plutôt que de le retourner.","Lorsque les génoises sont froides, battez le fromage à pâte molle avec le sucre glace, le zeste de citron et un peu de jus pour le détendre si besoin. Fouettez très légèrement la crème pour qu''elle garde juste sa forme, puis incorporez-la au fromage. Incorporez les framboises décongelées. Utilisez-le pour prendre les génoises ensemble, recouvertes d''une croûte de sucre, et servez-les saupoudrées de sucre glace."]','2026-01-11 00:04:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10271,9322,'fr','Doigts tourbillonnants de bruine de citron','La polenta (parfois appelée semoule de maïs fine) donne à ce gâteau sa couleur jaune et sa texture douce','["200 g de beurre bien ramolli, plus un peu","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 gros œufs","100 g de polenta fine ou de semoule de maïs fine","140 g de farines autolevantes","zester 3 citrons","4 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","5 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré ou blanc","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4 et\r\nassurez-vous qu''il y a une étagère prête au milieu\r\ndu four. Beurrer une plaque à pâtisserie rectangulaire\r\nou un petit plat à rôtir d''environ 20 cm x 30 cm.\r\nDécoupez une feuille de papier sulfurisé un peu plus grande\r\nque le moule, puis poussez-le et lissez-le\r\nsortez-le avec vos mains pour qu''il colle au beurre.\r\nCoupez les coins avec une paire de ciseaux\r\npour que le papier repose proprement.","Mettez tous les ingrédients du gâteau et une pincée de\r\nsalez dans un grand bol, puis utilisez des batteurs électriques\r\nbattre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux et lisse. Plongez dans\r\nle moule, puis nivelez le dessus. Verser le citron\r\ncaillé sur la pâte en bandes épaisses. Utiliser\r\nle manche de la cuillère pour faire tourner le caillé\r\ndans le gâteau – pas trop sinon vous ne le ferez pas\r\nvoir les tourbillons une fois cuits. Cuire au four pour\r\nenviron 35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés. Il\r\naurait dû reculer des côtés de\r\nla boîte très légèrement et semble élastique. Ne\r\nouvrir le four avant la fin des 30 minutes de cuisson.","Laissez le gâteau dans le moule pendant 10 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste assez froid pour être manipulé. Soulever avec précaution\r\nsortir du moule et le mettre sur une grille de refroidissement,\r\nassis sur un plateau ou quelque chose de similaire pour attraper\r\ndes gouttes de bruine. Pour faire le filet, mélangez\r\n4 cuillères à soupe de sucre et le jus de citron ensemble\r\net verser sur le gâteau. Mélangez le citron\r\nzestez avec la dernière cuillère à soupe de sucre et saupoudrez\r\npar-dessus. Laissez le gâteau refroidir complètement,\r\npuis soulevez-le sur une planche, décollez les côtés\r\ndu papier sulfurisé et coupez le gâteau en\r\ndoigts. Se conserve 3 jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:04:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10272,7936,'fr','Koftas de bœuf, olives vertes et sumac','Empilez ces koftas épicés sur une assiette et laissez tout le monde déguster. Un dîner de partage idéal, à servir avec de la salade, des piments marinés et des pains plats.','["800 g de bœuf haché 12 % de matière grasse","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","100 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées et hachées grossièrement","50 g de pistaches hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de sumac","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la friture","1 oignon rouge , tranché","1 citron, jus","1 concombre entier épépiné et tranché finement","2 grosses poignées de feuilles de persil (voir astuce ci-dessous)","50g de graines de grenade","pincée de sumac","1 cuillère à soupe de miel, pour le glaçage","houmous, piments marinés et pains plats"]','["Si vous préparez à l’avance, tapissez un récipient allant au congélateur de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la kofta dans un grand bol, avec 1 cuillère à café de sel et une grosse pincée de poivre noir. Formez grossièrement des koftas avec vos mains (en utilisant environ 40 g pour chaque kofta) – vous devriez en avoir 24 au total. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à quatre jours ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois. Remplissez le récipient préparé avec les koftas, en plaçant une autre feuille de papier sulfurisé entre elles si vous devez faire une deuxième couche.","Pour préparer la salade, mélangez l''oignon rouge et le jus de citron avec une pincée de sel. Laisser mariner 10 minutes, puis incorporer les graines de concombre, de persil et de grenade. Assaisonner au goût. Verser dans un bol de service et saupoudrer de sumac.","Pour cuisiner surgelé, badigeonnez d''huile d''olive une grande poêle ou une plaque chauffante si vous en avez une et faites chauffer à feu moyen-vif. Faites frire le kofta par lots, en le retournant souvent pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré. Versez 200 ml d''eau et couvrez avec un couvercle. Augmentez le feu et laissez cuire 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit et que l''eau se soit évaporée. Retirer du feu et incorporer le miel en remuant pour bien enrober. Si vous cuisinez réfrigéré, faites cuire pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit.","Étalez le houmous sur un plat de service et empilez-le sur les koftas. Servir avec la salade, les piments marinés et les pains plats."]','2026-01-11 00:04:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10273,9323,'fr','Rouleau arctique classique','Suivez notre guide étape par étape pour découvrir ce dessert glacé rétro composé de glace vanille enveloppée dans une génoise légère, avec de la confiture de fraises maison.','["2 œufs, séparés","50g de sucre glace","1 gousse de vanille, graines uniquement","150 ml de crème fraîche","200 g de fraises coupées en quartiers, plus quelques fraises supplémentaires pour la décoration","jus ½ citron","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","noix de beurre, pour graisser","3 œufs","100 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","100 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Pour faire la glace, fouettez les blancs d''œufs dans un bol avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes. Dans un autre bol, fouettez les jaunes, le sucre glace et les graines de vanille jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et gonflés. Dans un troisième bol, fouettez la crème double jusqu''à ce qu''elle conserve sa forme.","Incorporez le mélange de jaunes d''œufs à la crème, puis incorporez les blancs d''œufs. Versez dans un moule à cake de 900 g recouvert d''une feuille de papier sulfurisé plus grande que ce dont vous aurez besoin, cela vous aidera plus tard. Congeler pendant 2 heures.","Retirez la crème glacée du congélateur et de la boîte lorsqu''elle est prise mais molle. Utilisez une spatule pour façonner le mélange en forme de saucisse grossière, puis utilisez le papier sulfurisé pour rouler le mélange fermement en un cylindre d''environ 35 cm de long.","Torsadez les extrémités du papier sulfurisé comme un cracker et remettez au congélateur pendant encore 1 heure.","Pour faire la confiture, mettez d''abord une soucoupe au congélateur. Mettez les fraises, le jus de citron et le sucre dans une casserole à fond épais sur feu vif. Portez à ébullition en remuant de temps en temps. Faire bouillir rapidement pendant 5 minutes, puis retirer du feu.","Mettez 1/4 cuillère à café de confiture sur la soucoupe froide – si elle se froisse lorsqu''on la pousse avec le doigt, la confiture est prête. S''il est encore liquide, remettez-le sur le feu et faites bouillir à nouveau pendant encore 2-3 minutes, puis testez à nouveau. Une fois la confiture prise, laissez-la refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser un moule à rouleau suisse de 24 x 32 cm de papier sulfurisé (avec beaucoup d''excédent) et bien graisser. Fouetter les œufs et le sucre avec un fouet électrique pendant 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à épaississement et pâle.","Incorporez la farine, la levure chimique et l''extrait de vanille au mélange d''œufs avec une grande cuillère en métal jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de poches de farine visibles.","Versez délicatement le mélange dans votre moule à rouleaux suisses préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré et élastique au toucher.","Retirer du four, laisser refroidir 1 à 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment froid pour être manipulé, puis enrouler délicatement la génoise pendant qu''elle est encore chaude (en gardant le papier sulfurisé attaché). Laisser refroidir complètement sous sa forme enroulée.","Déroulez le biscuit et étalez la confiture à l''intérieur. En travaillant rapidement, déballer la glace et la déposer sur la confiture. Roulez le gâteau autour.","Enveloppez le rouleau arctique dans une nouvelle feuille de papier sulfurisé et une couche de papier d''aluminium également. Retour au\r\ncongeler pendant 20 à 30 minutes supplémentaires, puis déballer, trancher et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:04:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10274,9324,'fr','Gâteaux de fées glamour','Une touche rétro à un favori de l''enfance : apprenez à préparer des gâteaux féeriques, puis à les décorer pour toutes les occasions.','["140g de beurre bien ramolli","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs moyens","100 g de farines autolevantes","25 g de poudre de crème pâtissière ou de maïzena","600 g de sucre glace tamisé","6 cuillères à soupe d''eau, ou moitié eau et moitié jus de citron, égouttées","colorants alimentaires comestibles verts et roses","violettes confites","roses ou pétales de roses cristallisés","fleurs en gaufrettes comestibles"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/chaleur tournante 170C/gaz 5. Disposer les caissettes en papier dans des moules à petits pains. Mettez tous les ingrédients du gâteau dans un grand bol et battez pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse. Répartissez le mélange entre les caissettes pour qu''elles soient à moitié remplies et faites cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient levées et dorées. Laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Mélangez le sucre glace et l''eau jusqu''à consistance lisse et utilisez-en un tiers sur huit des gâteaux. Divisez le reste en deux et colorez une moitié en vert pâle et l''autre moitié en rose pâle. Décorez les blanches avec des violettes confites, les roses avec les roses et les vertes avec les fleurs en azyme. Laisser prendre. Se conserve jusqu''à 2-3 jours dans un contenant hermétique dans un endroit frais."]','2026-01-11 00:04:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10275,9325,'fr','Carrés Simnel fruités','Cette variante facile de la génoise aux fruits classique permet de réaliser de nombreux carrés, tous décorés d''œufs en pâte d''amande.','["250 g de fruits secs mélangés","100 g d''abricots secs hachés","85 g de cerises glacées hachées","zester 2 oranges, jus d''1 orange (utiliser la seconde dans le topping)","200 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre muscovado léger","4 gros œufs","200 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de muscade fraîchement râpée","500 g de massepain, 200 g coupés en morceaux de 2 cm, le reste pour la garniture","50g de beurre","50 g de sucre muscovado léger","100 g de farine nature","100 g d''amandes effilées","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","85 g de sucre glace tamisé","2-3 cuillères à café de jus d''orange"]','["Faire tremper tous les fruits secs dans l''orange\r\njus pendant 2 heures ou toute la nuit.","Beurrer et chemiser un moule de 20 x 30 cm avec\r\npapier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 160°C/\r\n140C ventilateur/gaz 3. Dans un grand bol, battez le\r\nbeurre et sucre avec un fouet électrique\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs un à un\r\nun temps; bien mélanger entre chaque ajout.","Tamisez la farine dans le bol et mélangez\r\ndans la poudre d''amandes et les épices.\r\nAjouter les morceaux de massepain, le zeste et le séché\r\nfruits avec le jus restant, et donnez\r\ntout est bon à combiner.","Versez le mélange à gâteau dans le moule préparé,\r\nniveler la surface et enfourner pendant 45 minutes\r\n– le gâteau est peut-être encore un peu gluant\r\nle centre à ce stade. Supprimer de\r\nle four et augmentez la chaleur à 200C/\r\n180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Préparez la garniture. Frottez le beurre, le sucre\r\net farinez avec vos doigts jusqu''à obtenir un\r\ntexture de chapelure friable. Râper\r\n200g de pâte d''amande réservée, ajouter les flocons\r\namandes et sirop doré. Mélanger\r\ntout avec une fourchette, en s''assurant que\r\nreste friable et ne s''agglutine pas. Saupoudrer\r\nsur le gâteau et remettre au four pendant\r\n12-15 minutes. Pendant ce temps, divisez le reste de\r\nle massepain en 11 et rouler en boules.","Sortez le gâteau du four une fois\r\nbien cuit, disposer la pâte d''amande\r\nboules dessus et laisser refroidir dans le moule.\r\nMélangez le sucre glace avec suffisamment d''orange\r\njus pour donner un glaçage qui coule, arroser le tout\r\nsur le gâteau, puis laissez-le reposer un peu avant\r\nle trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:04:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10276,9326,'fr','Rouleau arctique à la crème caillée et aux ondulations de framboise','Une version époustouflante du classique rétro, accompagnée de baies de saison, de glace barattée maison et d''une génoise légère','["2 gros œufs","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","Pot de 227 g de crème crémeuse","350 ml de lait entier","les graines d''une gousse de vanille","100 g de framboises barquette","Pot de 300 g de confiture de framboises","4 gros œufs","125 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","125 g de farines autolevantes"]','["Refroidissez le bol de votre sorbetière,\r\nsi vous en utilisez un. Dans un grand bol, fouettez le\r\ndes œufs (à noter que cette recette contient\r\nœufs crus) et le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux.\r\nAjouter la crème caillée, le lait et la vanille\r\ngraines et fouetter à nouveau jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nVersez dans votre sorbetière et\r\nbaratter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit congelé. Alternativement, vous pouvez\r\nverser le mélange dans une cuve et congeler pendant\r\n2 heures, puis passer au robot culinaire\r\net faites un blitz pour éliminer les cristaux de glace.","Tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g (environ 20 cm de long)\r\navec du film alimentaire. À ce stade – alors que votre\r\nla glace est assez souple – écrasez-la\r\nframboises avec 2 cuillères à soupe de confiture\r\n(en laissant quelques gros morceaux), puis\r\nondule à travers la glace. Transfert\r\ndans votre moule à pain et congelez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que\r\nsolide – environ 6 heures ou toute la nuit.","Maintenant, fabriquez l''éponge. Chauffer le four à\r\n190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5. Graisse et conduite\r\nun moule à roulette suisse de 25 x 35 cm avec cuisson\r\nparchemin. Mettez les œufs et le sucre dans un\r\ngrand bol et fouetter jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux\r\n– cela prendra environ 5 minutes. Passer au crible\r\nfariner et mélanger jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de\r\nmorceaux de farine visibles. Verser délicatement dans\r\nle moule et lisser le dessus. Cuire au four\r\npendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit élastique au toucher.","Pendant que la génoise cuit, posez une feuille\r\nde papier sulfurisé, plus grand que votre moule,\r\nsur votre surface et saupoudrez de roulette\r\nsucre. Lorsque la génoise est cuite, retournez-la\r\nsur le parchemin sucré, roulez-le sans serrer\r\nvers le haut à partir de l''une des extrémités les plus courtes et tournez\r\nle parchemin à sécuriser. Laisser refroidir.","Sortez la glace du congélateur\r\net laisser ramollir 10 min. Transfert\r\nla glace sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin, roulez le parchemin autour de la glace comme un cracker, puis roulez et\r\npressez la glace avec vos mains pour\r\nfaçonnez-le en cylindre d’environ 25 cm de long.","Déballez et déroulez l''éponge, puis\r\nétalez la surface intérieure avec le\r\nconfiture restante. Placez la glace non emballée\r\ncrème au centre et envelopper le biscuit\r\nautour pour former votre rouleau arctique. Roulez le\r\nle tout remis en cuisson\r\nparchemin, tordez fermement les extrémités pour\r\nsécuriser, puis recongeler pendant 2 heures supplémentaires.\r\nAvant de servir, déballer le rouleau arctique et\r\ncouper chaque extrémité avec un couteau dentelé\r\npour lui donner un aspect soigné. (Votre chance d''obtenir\r\nun goût sournois !)Peut être conservé au\r\ncongélateur jusqu''à 1 semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:04:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10277,9327,'fr','Pain de malt aux dattes et au gingembre','Un gâteau sombre, collant et légèrement épicé qui fusionne un gâteau au gingembre jamaïcain avec un pudding au caramel collant et un pain de malt','["200 g de beurre coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour graisser","140 g de dattes dénoyautées, hachées","410 ml de lait concentré","100 g de sucre brun foncé mou","225 g de farine nature","3 cuillères à soupe de lait en poudre malté (nous avons utilisé Horlicks)","2 cuillères à café de gingembre moulu","50 g de gingembre en tige grossièrement haché (réserver le sirop)","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 gros œufs","50 g de gingembre en tige haché","5 cuillères à soupe de sirop de gingembre (du pot de gingembre en tige)","5 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g/2 lb\r\navec du papier sulfurisé. Mettez les dates,\r\nle lait concentré et le sucre dans un petit\r\ncasserole, porter à ébullition et cuire pendant\r\n5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les dattes soient tendres et que le\r\nle sucre est dissous. Laisser refroidir.","Mettez la farine, le lait malté en poudre,\r\ngingembre moulu, tige de gingembre, bicarbe\r\net le beurre dans un robot culinaire,\r\net mixez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble\r\nchapelure. Versez la datte refroidie\r\nmélange et les œufs, et pulser brièvement\r\njusqu''à ce que le mélange soit combiné. Astuce dans\r\nvotre moule préparé et enfournez pendant 1h15\r\njusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré en ressorte propre.\r\nLaisser refroidir 10 min dans le moule, puis\r\ntransférer sur une grille. Combinez tous les\r\ningrédients pour le filet et verser dessus\r\nle gâteau. Laisser prendre avant de servir. Ce gâteau est délicieux s''il est mangé le jour même.\r\nc''est fait, mais s''améliorera au bout d''une journée\r\nou 2 dans le moule à cake."]','2026-01-11 00:04:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10278,9328,'fr','Fantaisie fondante citron & lavande','Des carrés de génoise élégants, petits et jolis comme une image – impressionnent par leurs saveurs légères et leur glaçage au beurre soyeux.','["175 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de sucre en poudre","3 gros œufs","100 g de yaourt nature entier","275 g de farine nature","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de lavande séchée, plus un peu pour décorer","100g de beurre","100g de sucre glace","zester 1 citron, plus un peu pour décorer","8 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots tamisée et chauffée au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''elle coule","1 kg de sucre glace fondant","colorant alimentaire jaune et violet"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule carré de 20 cm de\r\npapier sulfurisé. Mettez le beurre, le sucre,\r\noeufs, yaourt, farine et levure chimique dans\r\nun grand bol et battre avec un électrique\r\nfouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser dans votre moule à cake\r\net lisser le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 45-50 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés, et une brochette\r\ninséré en ressort propre. Laisser refroidir\r\n10 min dans le moule, puis démoulez\r\nune grille pour refroidir complètement.","Broyer la lavande en poudre à l''aide\r\nun pilon et un mortier. Pour faire le beurre\r\nglaçage, battre le beurre et le sucre glace\r\nensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Divisez le\r\nmélange dans 2 bols, ajouter le citron\r\nle zeste pour un lot et la lavande pour\r\nl''autre, puis mélangez chacun pour combiner.\r\nTransférez les glaçages dans 2 poches à douille.","Lorsque l''éponge est complètement\r\nrefroidi, utilisez un grand couteau dentelé pour\r\nenlève le dessus et te donne un appartement\r\nsurface. Retournez le gâteau pour que\r\nle côté le plus plat devient le dessus. Coupez soigneusement les bords, puis coupez l''éponge\r\nen 16 carrés. Utilisez une règle si vous le souhaitez\r\nqu''ils soient de la même taille. Brossez le dessus\r\net les côtés de chaque carré de génoise avec un\r\npetite confiture. Pocher un petit dôme de beurre\r\nglaçage sur chaque génoise, 8 à la lavande\r\nglaçage et 8 au citron. Refroidissez les gâteaux\r\npendant au moins 1 heure.","Tamisez le sucre glace fondant dans un grand\r\nbol et ajoutez suffisamment d''eau pour faire un\r\nglaçage épais mais versable. Cuiller un peu\r\nglaçage blanc dans un sac à sandwich ou une douille\r\nsac à utiliser plus tard. Divisez le reste\r\nglaçage dans 2 bols, teindre un lot de citron\r\njaune et l''autre lilas pâle.","Sortez les génoises du réfrigérateur\r\net transférer sur une grille, en plaçant le\r\ngrille sur un plateau pour récupérer les gouttes. Cuillère\r\nun peu de glaçage sur chaque génoise, du lilas pour\r\nles fantaisies à la lavande et\r\njaune pour le citron. Utilisez une petite palette\r\ncouteau pour étaler le glaçage sur les côtés\r\nde l''éponge pour recouvrir complètement chaque\r\nun. Laisser reposer 30 mn puis couvrir\r\nles gâteaux avec une deuxième couche de glaçage\r\npour donner une surface lisse. Arroser le\r\nglaçage blanc sur les gâteaux et décorer\r\navec un peu de zeste de citron et de lavande\r\nbourgeons. Laisser poser 1h à chambre\r\ntempérature avant de servir. Durera\r\n2-3 jours en boîte."]','2026-01-11 00:04:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10279,9329,'fr','Gâteau Battenberg','Le gâteau traditionnel Battenberg de Sarah Cook est un délicieux projet pour un après-midi en cuisine','["175g de beurre très mou","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","140 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","3 œufs moyens","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","1 x ingrédients pour biscuit aux amandes","colorant alimentaire rose, nous avons utilisé ½ cuillère à café de pâte alimentaire Squires rose","200g de confiture d''abricots","2 blocs de 500 g de pâte d''amande blanche","un peu de sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4 et\r\ntapisser la base et les côtés d''un carré de 20 cm\r\nmoule avec du papier sulfurisé (le plus simple\r\nLa méthode consiste à croiser 2 bandes de 20 cm de long\r\nle socle). Pour réaliser le biscuit aux amandes,\r\nmettre le beurre, le sucre, la farine moulue\r\namandes, levure chimique, œufs, vanille\r\net l''extrait d''amande dans un grand bol. Battre\r\navec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange\r\ns''assemble en douceur. Grattez dans\r\nla boîte en s''étendant jusqu''aux coins, et\r\ncuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes – lorsque vous enfoncez\r\nune brochette, elle doit ressortir propre.\r\nLaisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 10 minutes, puis transférer\r\nsur une grille pour finir de refroidir pendant que vous\r\nfaire la deuxième éponge.","Pour la génoise rose, tapissez le moule comme\r\nci-dessus. Mélanger tous les ingrédients ensemble\r\ncomme ci-dessus, mais n''ajoutez pas l''amande\r\nextrait. Incorporez un peu de colorant alimentaire rose.\r\nPuis grattez le tout dans le moule et enfournez\r\ncomme avant. Cool.","Pour assembler, faites chauffer la confiture dans un petit\r\npoêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit liquide, puis tamiser. À peine coupé\r\ndeux bords opposés de l''amande\r\néponge, puis bien tailler un troisième bord.\r\nMesurez grossièrement la hauteur du\r\néponge, puis en coupant du\r\nbord bien coupé, utilisez une règle pour vous aider\r\nvous coupez 4 tranches chacune de la même largeur que\r\nla hauteur de l''éponge. Jeter ou grignoter\r\nrestes d''éponge. Répétez avec le gâteau rose.","Prenez 2 x tranches d''amandes et 2 x roses\r\ntranches et coupez pour qu''elles soient toutes identiques\r\nlongueur. Étalez un bloc de massepain sur\r\nune surface légèrement saupoudrée de sucre glace\r\nà un peu plus de 20 cm de large, puis gardez\r\nrouler dans le sens de la longueur jusqu''à obtenir la pâte d''amande\r\nfait environ 0,5 cm d''épaisseur. Badigeonner avec\r\nconfiture d''abricots, puis déposez une rose et une\r\ntranche d''amande côte à côte à une extrémité de\r\nla pâte d''amande, en badigeonnant de confiture entre les deux\r\npour coller les éponges, en laissant 4 cm d''espace libre\r\npâte d''amande à la fin. Badigeonner davantage de confiture\r\nsur les éponges, puis\r\nsandwich restant 2 tranches dessus,\r\nalterner les couleurs pour donner un damier\r\neffet. Coupez le massepain à la hauteur\r\nlongueur des gâteaux.","Soulevez délicatement la pâte d''amande et\r\nlisser le gâteau avec les mains,\r\nmais laissez un petit pli de pâte d''amande le long du\r\nbord inférieur avant de le coller sur le\r\npremier côté. Couper le côté opposé pour qu''il corresponde\r\ntaille du pli, puis sertissez les bords à l''aide\r\ndoigts et pouce (ou, plus simplement,\r\nappuyer avec les dents d''une fourchette). Si tu veux,\r\nmarquez les 10 tranches à l''aide des pointes du\r\nune fourchette.","Assemblez le deuxième Battenberg et\r\nconserver dans une boîte hermétique ou bien emballé\r\ndans un film alimentaire jusqu''à 3 jours. Peut être\r\ncongelé jusqu''à un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:04:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10280,9330,'fr','Gâteau Eccles','Une nouvelle version de la pâtisserie traditionnelle, ce gâteau conviendra à toutes les occasions','["250 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de sucre roux clair et mou","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","4 gros œufs","100 g de farine nature","250 g de farines autolevantes","100g de babeurre","2 pommes de table, pelées, épépinées et coupées en dés d''environ 1 cm","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","¼ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","le zeste d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre fondu","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre brun clair et mou","85g de groseilles","85g de raisins secs","50 g de zestes mélangés","85 g de sucre glace tamisé","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","quelques morceaux de sucre grossièrement écrasés"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 20 cm de profondeur\r\navec du papier sulfurisé. Mélanger\r\nles ingrédients de la garniture et réserver.","Mettre le beurre, le sucre et la vanille dans un bol\r\net fouetter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle. Incorporez les œufs, puis\r\nincorporer les farines, le babeurre et les pommes.\r\nVersez la moitié du mélange dans le moule. Dispersion\r\ntrop de remplissage, laissant une bordure claire de 2,5 cm\r\ntout autour du bord. Cuillère restante\r\nmélange sur le dessus, en commençant par une cuillerée de rond\r\nles bords, puis en se déplaçant vers le milieu.\r\nCuire au four pendant 1 h 25 ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette\r\nenfoncé, il ressort propre. Refroidir dans le moule.","Mélangez le sucre glace avec suffisamment de citron\r\njus pour faire un glaçage qui coule. Supprimer\r\ngâteau du moule, arroser de glaçage,\r\npuis parsemer de morceaux de sucre concassé\r\net le zeste de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:04:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10281,9331,'fr','Gâteau renversé à l''ananas','Des roches rétro. Ce gâteau renversé à l''ananas classique constitue une pièce maîtresse amusante pour le thé de l''après-midi et rappelle de nombreux souvenirs d''enfance.','["50g de beurre ramolli","50 g de cassonade légère et molle","7 rondelles d''ananas au sirop, égouttées et sirop","glacé cherry","100g de beurre ramolli","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 œufs"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Pour le\r\ngarniture, battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux. Réparti sur la base et un\r\nquart de la hauteur des côtés d''un 20-21 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau rond. Disposez dessus les rondelles d''ananas,\r\npuis placez les cerises au centre des anneaux.","Placer les ingrédients du gâteau dans un bol le long\r\navec 2 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''ananas et, en utilisant\r\nun fouet électrique, battre jusqu''à obtenir une consistance molle.\r\nVerser dans le moule au-dessus de l''ananas et\r\nlissez-le pour qu''il soit de niveau. Enfourner 35 mn.\r\nLaisser reposer 5 mn puis démouler\r\nune assiette. Servir chaud avec une boule de glace."]','2026-01-11 00:04:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10282,9332,'fr','Reine des gâteaux au pudding','Super rapides à préparer, ces petits gâteaux meringués sont faits pour être partagés','["200 g de beurre mou, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs","140 g de farines autolevantes","50 g de poudre de crème anglaise","5-6 cuillères à soupe de confiture de framboise","16 mini-meringues","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule carré de 20 cm de côté.\r\nMélanger le beurre, le sucre, les oeufs,\r\nfarine et poudre de crème anglaise jusqu''à ce que ce soit bien\r\ncombiné et moelleux. Répartir dans le moule\r\net cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et\r\nressuscité. Refroidir dans le moule.","Retirer le gâteau refroidi du moule et\r\ntartiner avec la confiture. Coupez les bords,\r\npuis coupez en 16 carrés. Ajouter une meringue\r\nà chacun juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10283,9333,'fr','Pouding aux myrtilles et à la noix de coco','La combinaison de myrtilles et de noix de coco rend ce dessert gourmand incroyablement gourmand.','["50 g de sucre en poudre","50g de beurre mou","1 gros œuf","50 g de farines autolevantes","50 g de noix de coco desséchée, plus 2 cuillères à café","50 g de crème fraîche, plus un peu pour servir","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","180 g de barquette de myrtilles"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Battre le sucre et le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et crémeux, puis incorporer l''œuf. Incorporer la farine, la noix de coco, la crème fraîche et le zeste de citron.","Mettez la plupart des myrtilles dans un plat allant au four (environ 18 cm carrés) et pressez le jus de la moitié du citron. Versez une cuillerée sur le mélange à gâteau et répartissez sur le reste des myrtilles et 2 cuillères à café de noix de coco. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, levé et que la génoise soit cuite. Servir avec une cuillerée supplémentaire de crème fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:04:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10284,9334,'fr','Petits pains glacés faciles','Les enfants adoreront ces petits pains glacés à l’ancienne, demandez-leur également de vous aider à les décorer !','["500 g de mélange à pain blanc (nous avons utilisé celui de Wright)","100 g de sucre en poudre","1 oeuf","350 g de sucre glace","des pépites (plus du colorant alimentaire, si vous le souhaitez)"]','["Mélangez le mélange à pain et le sucre\r\ndans un robot culinaire ou un mixeur de table.\r\nPendant que le moteur tourne, ajoutez l''œuf\r\net environ 250 à 300 ml d''eau tiède,\r\njusqu''à formation d''une pâte molle. Pétrir\r\nune surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à consistance lisse, environ 5 à 10 minutes. Laisser dans un bol huilé,\r\nrecouvert d''un film alimentaire huilé, dans un endroit tiède\r\nplacer jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume – environ 1 heure.","Faites reculer la pâte en l''écrasant avec\r\nvotre poing et divisez-le en 20 de taille égale\r\nmorceaux – garder recouverts d’un thé propre\r\nserviette pour qu’ils ne sèchent pas. Façonner chacun\r\ndans une saucisse et placez-la sur une plaque huilée\r\nplaque à pâtisserie. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé\r\net lever jusqu''à ce qu''elle double à nouveau de volume.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nRetirer le film et cuire les petits pains sur l''étagère du haut\r\npendant 8 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Refroidir sur un fil\r\nsupport. Pour décorer, mélangez le sucre glace avec un\r\nun peu d''eau jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ferme mais tartinable – ajouter\r\ndu colorant alimentaire, si vous le souhaitez. Tremper dans le dessus de\r\nchaque petit pain et parsemer de pépites."]','2026-01-11 00:04:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10285,9335,'fr','Gâteaux gallois','Pice ar y maen, une friandise galloise à l''heure du thé transmise de génération en génération et toujours aussi populaire. Idéal à réaliser avec les enfants','["225 g de farine nature","85 g de sucre en poudre","½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","50 g de beurre coupé en petits morceaux","50 g de saindoux coupé en petits morceaux, plus un peu pour la friture","50g de groseilles","1 œuf battu","éclabousser le lait"]','["Versez la farine, le sucre, le mélange d''épices, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel dans un bol. Ensuite, avec vos doigts, incorporez le beurre et le saindoux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient friables. Incorporer les groseilles. Incorporez l''œuf au mélange jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle, en ajoutant un peu de lait si elle semble un peu sèche – elle doit avoir la même consistance qu''une pâte brisée.","Abaissez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné jusqu''à l''épaisseur de votre petit doigt. Découpez des ronds à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 6 cm en reroulant les éventuelles chutes. Graisser une poêle plate ou une poêle à frire épaisse avec du saindoux et placer sur feu moyen. Faites cuire les gâteaux gallois par lots, pendant environ 3 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, croustillants et bien cuits. Délicieux servi tiède avec du beurre et de la confiture, ou simplement saupoudré de sucre en poudre. Les gâteaux resteront frais dans un moule pendant 1 semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:04:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10286,9336,'fr','Confiture roly-poly','Ce roly-poly à la confiture est simple à préparer, réconfortant et rappellera à coup sûr des souvenirs des dîners scolaires traditionnels.','["50 g de beurre demi-sel, froid et coupé en morceaux, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour rouler","1 gousse de vanille, graines grattées","50 g de suif râpé","150 ml de lait, plus une goutte de plus si besoin","100 g de confiture de framboises ou de prunes, ou un mélange","crème anglaise, pour servir"]','["Mettez un plat à rôtir profond au fond\r\ngrille du four et assurez-vous que\r\nil y a une autre étagère juste au-dessus.\r\nRetirez le plat à rôtir sur sa grille, remplissez-le\r\nles deux tiers avec de l''eau bouillante du\r\nbouilloire, puis remettez-la délicatement à l''intérieur.\r\nfour à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Déchirez un\r\nune grande feuille de papier aluminium et du papier sulfurisé\r\n(environ 30 x 40 cm). Posez le sulfurisé dessus\r\ndessus du papier d''aluminium et beurrez-le.","Versez le beurre, la farine et les graines de vanille dans un\r\nrobot culinaire; pulser jusqu''à ce que le beurre ait\r\ndisparu. Versez dans un bol à mélanger. Remuer\r\nà travers le suif, versez le lait et\r\ntravailler ensemble avec un couteau à couverts jusqu''à ce que\r\nvous obtenez une pâte collante. Vous aurez peut-être besoin d''un\r\ndéposez plus de lait, en fonction de votre farine.","Versez la pâte sur un plan fariné\r\nsurface, tapotez rapidement ensemble pour lisser,\r\npuis étalez-le en carré d''environ 25 x\r\n25cm. Étalez la confiture partout en laissant un\r\nespace le long d''un bord, puis enroulez-le à partir du\r\nbord opposé. Pincez le bord sans bourrage\r\ndans la pâte là où elle se rencontre, et pincez\r\nles extrémités à peu près aussi. Soulevez délicatement sur le\r\npapier graissé, joint vers le bas (vous pourriez\r\ntrouver une plaque à pâtisserie plate utile pour cela),\r\nfaites remonter sans serrer le papier et le papier d''aluminium\r\npuis froissez-le le long des bords\r\net se termine à sceller. Le roly-poly va gonfler\r\nun peu pendant la cuisson donc ne pas envelopper\r\nbien. Soulevez le colis directement sur le\r\ngriller au-dessus du moule et cuire 1 h.","Laissez le pudding reposer 5 minutes avant\r\ndéballer, puis ouvrir soigneusement le film\r\net du papier, puis trancher en tranches épaisses pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:04:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10287,9337,'fr','Gâteau marbré chocolat-orange','Pour un gâteau délicieusement nostalgique, combinez une combinaison de saveurs classique d''orange et de chocolat dans cette pâtisserie rétro bicolore.','["225 g de beurre très mou, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de sucre en poudre","225 g de farines autolevantes","4 gros œufs, battus","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre tamisé","1 grosse orange, son zeste et 1 cuillère à soupe de jus d''orange","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire orange (facultatif)","50 g de chocolat orange (nous avons utilisé Maya Gold de Green & Black), cassé en morceaux"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake (8 x 21 cm/ 2 lb) de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre, le sucre, les œufs et la farine dans un grand bol avec un fouet électrique ou au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient sans grumeaux.","Répartissez le mélange dans deux bols, battez le lait, suivi de la poudre de cacao en un seul. Battez le jus d''orange, le zeste et le colorant alimentaire orange, le cas échéant, dans l''autre.","Versez des cuillerées alternées du mélange dans le moule à gâteau, puis utilisez une brochette pour créer un motif marbré en le faisant glisser dans le mélange en tourbillonnant. Assurez-vous de ne pas trop mélanger, sinon vous ne verrez pas le motif. Lisser la surface si nécessaire.","Cuire le gâteau pendant 45 à 55 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et levé, et qu''un cure-dent enfoncé en ressorte propre.","Laissez refroidir le gâteau dans le moule, puis démoulez. Faire fondre le chocolat dans un bol sur de l''eau à peine frémissante ou doucement au micro-ondes. Utilisez une cuillère pour verser le chocolat sur le gâteau."]','2026-01-11 00:04:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10288,9338,'fr','Gâteau au madère','Une génoise anglaise classique, délicatement parfumée au citron et à l''amande – parfaite pour le thé de l''après-midi','["175 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 gros œufs","le zeste râpé d''1 citron","quelques gouttes d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farines autolevantes","50g d''amandes moulues"]','["1 Chauffer le four à 170°C/150°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 3. Beurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake de 900g de papier sulfurisé. À l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battez ensemble le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à obtenir une consistance légère et crémeuse, puis incorporez les œufs un à un. Ajoutez le zeste de citron et la vanille. Incorporez maintenant la farine et les amandes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse. La pâte doit être suffisamment lâche pour tomber d''une cuillère en bois, si elle est trop épaisse, mélanger avec un peu de lait.","Versez la pâte dans le moule et lissez le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 55 minutes – 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Sortir du four puis laisser refroidir 15 minutes puis démouler, retirer le papier et laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille avant de trancher. Le pain se conserve trois jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:04:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10289,9339,'fr','Scones de désordre d''Eton','Prenez le combo classique fraise, crème caillée et meringue et servez-le sur des scones faciles à préparer - irrésistible','["400 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","¼ cuillère à café de sel","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g de beurre coupé en cubes","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","200 ml de babeurre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","5 cuillères à soupe de lait, plus un peu pour le brossage","une bonne poignée de petites fraises coupées en deux","petit pot de bonne confiture de fraises","2 nids de meringue émiettés en morceaux","Pot de 200 ml de crème caillée"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nMélanger la farine, le sel et la levure chimique\r\nensemble dans un grand bol. Frotter avec le beurre\r\nou mixez le tout dans un robot culinaire pour\r\nchapelure fine, puis incorporer le sucre.","Réchauffer le babeurre, la vanille et le lait\r\nà température des mains, puis remuez-le rapidement\r\ndans le mélange de farine avec un couteau. Utilisation\r\nvos mains, rassemblez la pâte,\r\nen faisant attention à ne pas surcharger le mix.","Déposez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné\r\nplan de travail et tapotez jusqu''à obtenir une épaisseur de 2,5 cm.\r\nrond. Découpez des ronds de 12 x 5 cm,\r\nsaupoudrez le couteau de farine pendant que vous\r\ntampon – vous devrez retaper les garnitures\r\npour en faire 12. Placer les rondelles sur un fond fariné.\r\nplaques à pâtisserie, badigeonner le dessus de lait\r\net saupoudrer d''un peu plus de sucre.\r\nCuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Pour servir, écrasez légèrement le\r\nfraises avec la confiture, et pliez\r\nles meringues dans la crème caillée.\r\nVersez un peu de mélange de fraises sur\r\nchaque scone fendu et garnir d''une cuillerée\r\nde crème meringuée."]','2026-01-11 00:04:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10290,7115,'fr','Tartelettes cerises et amandes','Ces mini bouchées Bakewell combinent pâtisserie et gâteau sont conçues pour être préparées par lots et cuites surgelées.','["Paquet de 375 g de pâte feuilletée pur beurre","75 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","12 cuillères à café bombées de confiture de griottes","75 g de génoise nature ou de gâteaux de Madère","100 g de beurre ramolli","75g d''amandes moulues","75 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 œufs moyens","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","25g d''amandes effilées","100 g de sucre glace tamisé pour décorer"]','["Étalez très finement la pâte\r\nune surface légèrement farinée. Éradiquer\r\nCercles de 12 x 9 cm avec un emporte-pièce cannelé, si\r\nvous en avez un et utilisez-le pour tapisser un moule à petits pains.\r\nÉtalez 1 cuillère à café bombée de confiture de cerises\r\nau fond de chaque tarte.","Réduisez le gâteau en miettes dans un\r\nrobot culinaire, puis versez-le dans un mixeur\r\nbol et ajouter la farine, le beurre moulu\r\namandes, sucre semoule, oeufs et amande\r\nextrait. Battre ensemble jusqu''à consistance lisse,\r\npuis répartissez entre les tartelettes,\r\ns''étalant un peu avec le dos d''un\r\ncuillère à café pour recouvrir la confiture. Dispersion\r\nsur les amandes effilées et congeler\r\npendant 2 heures, puis bien envelopper dans du film alimentaire\r\nfilmer et congeler jusqu''à 2 mois.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4\r\navec une plaque à pâtisserie dedans. Déballez le\r\ntartelettes du congélateur et dessus sans serrer\r\navec une feuille de papier d''aluminium. Cuire sur le feu chauffé\r\nplaque à pâtisserie pendant 30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré, en retirant le papier d''aluminium à moitié.\r\nRefroidissez un peu les tartelettes, puis ajoutez-en un peu\r\nd''eau dans le sucre glace pour faire\r\nun glaçage qui coule. Arroser les tartelettes\r\net laissez prendre."]','2026-01-11 00:04:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10291,9340,'fr','Parking','Parkin est une génoise traditionnelle du nord de l''Angleterre aromatisée à la mélasse sirupeuse, aux flocons d''avoine et au gingembre. Un joli régal à l''heure du thé !','["200 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","1 gros œuf","4 cuillères à soupe de lait","200 g de sirop doré","85g de mélasse","85 g de cassonade légère et molle","100 g de flocons d''avoine moyens","250 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre moulu"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Beurrer un moule à gâteau carré profond de 22 cm/9 pouces et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battez l''œuf et le lait avec une fourchette.","Faites fondre doucement le sirop, la mélasse, le sucre et le beurre dans une grande casserole jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Retirer du feu. Mélangez les flocons d''avoine, la farine et le gingembre et incorporez-les au mélange de sirop, suivis de l''œuf et du lait.","Versez le mélange dans le moule et enfournez pendant 50 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit ferme et un peu croustillant sur le dessus. Refroidissez dans le moule, puis enveloppez-le dans du papier sulfurisé et du papier d''aluminium et conservez-le pendant 3 à 5 jours avant de le manger si vous le pouvez. Il deviendra plus mou et plus collant au fur et à mesure que vous le laisserez longtemps, jusqu''à 2 semaines."]','2026-01-11 00:04:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10292,9341,'fr','Gâteau bruine de Pimm','Utilisez les saveurs d’une tasse Pimm’s estivale dans cette cuisson simple. Un cocktail sous forme de gâteau, garni de fraises et de feuilles de menthe pour un superbe dessert d''été','["225 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","225 g de fraises coupées en quartiers","100 ml de Pimm''s","1 orange , zestée et pressée","275 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs","225 g de farines autolevantes","125g de sucre glace","une poignée de feuilles de menthe"]','["Beurrer un moule à cake de 2 litres et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettez les fraises dans un bol et incorporez la moitié des Pimm''s, la moitié du jus d''orange et 25g de sucre semoule. Laisser macérer pendant que vous préparez le gâteau.","Battre ensemble le beurre, 225 g du sucre semoule restant et le zeste d''orange à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais, crémeux et de couleur plus claire. Incorporer les œufs, un à la fois, en ajoutant une cuillerée de farine entre chacun pour éviter le caillage. Incorporez le reste de la farine, versez dans le moule et faites cuire au four pendant 45 minutes à 1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre.","Pendant ce temps, versez le reste du jus d’orange, le Pimm’s et le sucre en poudre dans une petite casserole. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à l''obtention d''un sirop léger. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Laissez le gâteau refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 minutes. Pendant que le gâteau refroidit, passez les fraises au tamis placé au-dessus d''un bol. Piquez tout le dessus du gâteau à l''aide d''un pique à brochette, puis versez dessus le sirop Pimm''s. Une fois le gâteau complètement refroidi, mélangez le sucre glace avec suffisamment du liquide de macération réservé pour créer un glaçage qui coule (il vous faudra environ 1 cuillère à soupe de liquide). Versez-en un filet sur le gâteau, puis garnissez de fraises égouttées et de feuilles de menthe."]','2026-01-11 00:04:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10293,9342,'fr','Sandwich Victoria au citron, framboise et amande','Préparez un gâteau central pour une réunion d''été. Cette version du sandwich Victoria est revisitée sous la forme d''une génoise aux amandes et à la framboise.','["225 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","amandes grillées","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille ou d''amande","2 citrons , zestés","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","4 œufs moyens, à température ambiante (utilisez des œufs « jaune d''or » pour une éponge jaune riche)","125 g de farines autolevantes","100 g d''amandes moulues","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","250 framboises","250 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de mascarpone","2-3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille ou d''amande"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer deux moules à cake de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Répartissez la moitié des amandes grillées sur le fond de l''un des moules, en vous assurant qu''elles sont bien réparties.","Versez le beurre et le sucre en poudre dans un grand bol avec l''extrait de vanille ou d''amande et le zeste de citron, et battez à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère, lisse et crémeuse, environ 3-4 minutes. Ajoutez le lait, puis les œufs, un à un, en battant bien entre chaque ajout. Incorporez la farine, la poudre d''amandes, la levure chimique et une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce qu''il ne reste plus de traces de farine.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules préparés, en prenant soin de ne pas trop déranger les amandes grillées lorsque vous l''étalez. Nivelez les dessus, puis poussez la moitié des framboises dans le mélange. Cuire au centre du four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés, et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Si un mélange humide adhère à la brochette, remettez au four pendant encore 5 minutes, puis testez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 30 minutes, puis déposer sur une grille, retirer le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir complètement – ​​les génoises seront assez délicates. Une fois refroidies, les éponges se conservent emballées et congelées jusqu''à trois mois.","Pour la garniture, versez la crème, le mascarpone, le sucre glace et l''extrait de vanille ou d''amande dans un grand bol. Fouettez quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que la crème tienne tout juste sa forme.","Disposez le biscuit nature sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette. Verser sur la garniture à la crème en l''étalant jusqu''au bord. Répartir sur le reste des baies et des amandes grillées. Sandwicher avec le deuxième biscuit, côté amande vers le haut, puis saupoudrer de sucre glace. Se conserve au frais dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:04:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10294,9343,'fr','Tarte tatin aux pêches','Ce pudding donne l’impression que vous avez passé un été en France à apprendre l’art du pâtissier, mais c’est simplement de la pâte feuilletée et des pêches du commerce.','["320 g de pâte feuilletée du commerce","30g de beurre doux","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","2 pêches, dénoyautées et coupées en 16 quartiers chacune","glace à la vanille, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Utiliser une poêle allant au four de 18 cm comme gabarit pour découper un cercle de pâte feuilletée. Faites fondre le beurre dans la poêle à feu doux, incorporez le sucre quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit dissous, puis ajoutez les pêches. Cuire à feu moyen-vif pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce bouillonne et épaississe.","Retirez la casserole du feu, puis déposez dessus le cercle de pâte feuilletée. Rentrez soigneusement les bords à l''aide d''une cuillère à soupe. Cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée. Laisser reposer 2 minutes avant de démouler sur une assiette. Servir avec de la glace, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:04:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10295,9344,'fr','Gâteau à la marmelade','Utilisez toute la marmelade dont vous disposez pour préparer cette pâtisserie ensoleillée, peut-être avec de la glace à côté.','["200 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","2 oranges non cirées","325-350 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs","80g de marmelade","200 g de farines autolevantes","crème double ou glace, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et beurrer un moule à cake de 23 cm. Zester les oranges, puis retirer la peau et la peau à l''aide d''un petit couteau dentelé. Annuler. Coupez les oranges le long de l''équateur en tranches de 1 cm d''épaisseur. Saupoudrez 25 g de sucre au fond du moule et disposez les tranches d''orange dessus. Réservez pendant que vous préparez le sirop et la pâte à gâteau.","Pesez les écorces d''orange dans une casserole avec la peau et ajoutez la même quantité de sucre et d''eau (environ 100 g). Portez à ébullition, puis faites bouillir pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à réduction et épaississement. Laisser infuser jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin, puis filtrer.","Battre le beurre et 200 g de sucre ensemble au batteur sur socle ou à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère et mousseuse, environ 5 minutes. Cassez les œufs, un à un, en battant bien après chaque ajout. Enfin, incorporez le zeste d''orange et la marmelade avant d''incorporer délicatement la farine et une pincée de sel. Versez la pâte sur les tranches d''orange et nivelez soigneusement la surface. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre.","Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 15 à 20 minutes avant de retourner délicatement sur une assiette. Badigeonnez le dessus d''un peu de sirop d''orange amère (les restes de sirop peuvent être utilisés pour des cocktails). Le sirop se conserve au frais pendant deux semaines. Servir chaud avec de la crème ou de la glace. Une fois complètement refroidi, le gâteau se conserve trois jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:04:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10296,9345,'fr','Gâteau frigo biscuits & crème','Préparez ce gâteau aux biscuits et à la crème sans cuisson à l''aide de votre réfrigérateur – il est idéal pour les soirées d''été lorsqu''il fait trop chaud pour allumer le four.','["huile sans saveur (comme végétale), pour la boîte","600 ml de crème fraîche","200 ml de mascarpone ou de fromage à pâte molle","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","4 sachets de 154 g de biscuits sandwich fourrés à la crème au chocolat, plus un supplément pour servir","200 g de chocolat noir cassé en petits morceaux"]','["Huiler un moule à gâteau à fond amovible ou à charnière de 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé en veillant à ce que l''intérieur du moule soit entièrement recouvert. Fouetter ensemble la crème, le mascarpone, la vanille et le sucre glace dans un grand bol jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et en pics mous.","Tapisser le fond du moule avec une seule couche de biscuits (ne vous inquiétez pas s''il y a de petits espaces, car ceux-ci seront remplis avec le mélange de crème). Verser sur un tiers du mélange de crème et lisser à l''aspatule en l''étalant jusqu''au bord. Répétez deux fois avec le reste des biscuits et le mélange de crème. Couvrez et réfrigérez pendant au moins 24 heures ou jusqu''à deux jours.","Faites fondre le chocolat par tranches de 20 secondes au micro-ondes ou dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en vous assurant que la base du bol ne touche pas l''eau. Laisser refroidir 10 mn. Déballez le gâteau, retirez-le du moule et décollez le papier sulfurisé. Arrosez le chocolat fondu en le laissant couler sur les côtés et émiettez-le sur les biscuits supplémentaires. Servir ou réfrigérer jusqu''à 1 heure."]','2026-01-11 00:04:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10297,9346,'fr','Éponge Victoria traditionnelle ultime','Améliorez la génoise Victoria classique en utilisant de la crème diplomate à la place de la crème fouettée standard et des baies sucrées macérées.','["225 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 gros œufs, à température ambiante","225 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","½ citron, jus","1 gousse de vanille fendue et graines grattées (gousse réservée, voir ci-dessous)","½ petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies et écrasées grossièrement","200 g de fraises équeutées et coupées en deux","125g de framboises","500 g de crème anglaise fraîche","1 gousse de vanille, gousse uniquement","50 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de crème anglaise","300 ml de crème fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser le fond et les côtés de deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm.","Battre le beurre et le sucre dans un grand bol avec un fouet électrique pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs un à un en battant bien après chaque ajout. Tamisez la farine, la levure chimique et le sel et incorporez-les à l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal. Ajoutez juste assez de lait pour créer une consistance goutte à goutte.","Répartissez la pâte dans les moules préparés et lissez le dessus avec une spatule. Cuire au milieu du four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et fermes au toucher. Laisser refroidir légèrement dans les moules, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez les baies macérées. Mélangez le sucre, le jus de citron, la vanille et la menthe jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Incorporer délicatement les fraises et les framboises jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient enrobées du mélange. Transférer au réfrigérateur et réfrigérer pendant 30 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Pour réaliser la crème diplomate, mettez la crème anglaise, la gousse de vanille et le sucre dans une casserole sur feu moyen et portez à ébullition en remuant de temps en temps. Mélangez la poudre de crème anglaise avec 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour diluer et remuez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer la crème anglaise bouillante, puis réduire le feu pour laisser mijoter et continuer à fouetter pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Mettre dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et laisser refroidir légèrement, puis réfrigérer jusqu''à refroidissement complet. Fouettez la crème double jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous, et lorsque la crème est froide, retirez la gousse de vanille et incorporez la crème en fouettant jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit suffisamment épais pour être gonflé.","Égoutter les baies macérées en réservant le liquide. Pour le montage, étalez la moitié de la crème diplomate sur l''une des génoises, puis recouvrez des trois quarts des baies. Retournez la deuxième génoise sur le dessus, de sorte que la base plate de la génoise soit tournée vers le haut, et saupoudrez d''un peu de sucre glace. Mettez le reste de crème diplomate dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille étoile et de rosaces en forme de poche sur le pourtour du gâteau. Disposez le reste des baies entre les rosettes de crème et servez avec le liquide de macération réservé à côté – ne versez pas dessus avant de servir car cela diviserait la crème diplomate. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:05:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10298,9347,'fr','Gâteau au thé aux framboises et aux pistaches','Ajoutez un glaçage à la framboise à ce gâteau au thé à la pistache et vous obtiendrez non seulement une jolie touche de couleur, mais aussi une saveur fabuleuse. C''est parfait pour le thé de l''après-midi','["150 g de pistaches décortiquées","275 g de sucre en poudre doré","250 g de beurre ramolli","3 œufs","275 g de farines autolevantes","75 g de yaourt grec","un peu de lait si besoin","fleurs en sucre, sucre perlé ou pépites, pour décorer (facultatif)","150g de framboises","300g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à cake de 15 x 25 cm. Mettez les pistaches dans un robot culinaire avec la moitié du sucre et mixez jusqu''à ce que les noix soient finement hachées. Versez dans un bol, ajoutez le reste du sucre et le beurre et battez au fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse. Ajoutez les œufs un à un, puis incorporez la farine et le yaourt jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant un peu de lait s''il est trop épais.","Versez la pâte dans le moule, nivelez et faites cuire au four pendant 50 à 55 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule 15 min, puis démouler le gâteau sur une planche. Retirez et jetez le papier sulfurisé, puis laissez refroidir complètement. Couper en carrés bien nets.","Pour faire le glaçage, mettez les framboises dans une casserole avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et faites cuire brièvement jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres et juteuses. Passez le mélange au tamis et jetez les pépins. Incorporer le sucre jusqu''à obtenir un glaçage rose et lisse.","Versez le glaçage sur le gâteau refroidi, puis décorez avec les fleurs en sucre, le sucre perlé ou les pépites, si vous le souhaitez. Laisser prendre avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10299,9348,'fr','Cheesecake aux baies à trois étages','Préparez ce cheesecake époustouflant pour les réceptions estivales. Garnir de fraises ou d''un mélange de baies fraîches, ainsi que d''un filet de chocolat pour plus de gourmandise.','["100 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","200g de biscuits digestifs","2 feuilles de gélatine","50g de framboises","50 g de sucre en poudre, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","350g de fraises","500 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","250 ml de crème fraîche","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire rouge ou rose","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gousse de vanille","50 g de chocolat blanc fondu","quelques gouttes d''extrait de citron (facultatif)"]','["Beurrer et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à charnière de 20 cm. Passez les digestifs au robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir une chapelure fine, ou écrasez-les dans un sac à sandwich avec un rouleau à pâtisserie. Transférer dans un bol et incorporer le beurre fondu jusqu''à ce qu''il ressemble à du sable humide. Versez dans le moule préparé et lissez le mélange avec le dos d''une cuillère pour obtenir une base uniforme, puis laissez refroidir.","Faire tremper les feuilles de gélatine dans de l''eau froide. Mettez les framboises dans un robot culinaire ou dans un pichet à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une purée lisse. Tamisez les graines. Faites chauffer le coulis de framboises dans une petite casserole avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à fumer, puis versez sur 1 feuille de gélatine égouttée dans un bol et remuez pour dissoudre.","Mixez 3 (environ 65 g) de fraises dans un robot culinaire et réchauffez-les avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre de la même manière. Versez dans un bol et incorporez l’autre feuille de gélatine égouttée.","Fouettez le fromage à pâte molle, la crème et le sucre en poudre jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à peine à épaissir. Répartir dans trois bols (environ 260 g par bol). Incorporez la purée de fraise dans un autre avec quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire pour qu''elle soit rose clair, le mélange de framboise avec la gélatine dans un autre avec plus de colorant alimentaire pour qu''il soit rose foncé, et la pâte de gousse de vanille dans le troisième.","Versez la garniture aux framboises sur la base de biscuit, en lissant la surface pour qu''elle soit plate. Ensuite, ajoutez la garniture aux fraises, en lissant doucement sans perturber la couche inférieure, puis répétez avec le mélange de vanille, en utilisant une cuillère propre pour niveler le dessus. Une spatule ou un couteau peut aider à éviter de faire glisser les couches inférieures. Réfrigérer 4 heures ou toute la nuit.","Passez un couteau sur les côtés du moule à gâteau entre le cheesecake et le papier sulfurisé et desserrez le fond. Transférer sur un support à gâteau et lisser les côtés à l''aide d''un couteau à palette pour égaliser les couches. Mélangez le chocolat avec quelques gouttes d''extrait de citron, si vous en utilisez. Empilez les fraises restantes, certaines tranchées, d''autres entières, sur le dessus et arrosez de chocolat pour finir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10300,9349,'fr','Gâteau à l''huile d''olive aux fraises et aux pistaches','Essayez ce gâteau polyvalent aux fraises et aux pistaches à base d''huile d''olive et de polenta ou de semoule de maïs. Parfait pour le thé de l''après-midi ou le dessert, il est également sans gluten','["200 ml d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la boîte","225 g de pistaches décortiquées","200 g de sucre en poudre","3 gros œufs","150 g de semoule de maïs fine ou polenta","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten","200 g de fraises hachées, plus un peu pour servir","sucre glace et crème fraîche ou yaourt, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler et tapisser le fond d''un moule à cake de 23 cm. Mettez 200 g de pistaches dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''elles ressemblent à de la poudre d''amandes.","Fouettez le sucre et les œufs avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux – cela devrait prendre environ 5 minutes. Ajoutez l''huile d''olive en fouettant continuellement, puis incorporez les pistaches moulues, la semoule de maïs ou la polenta et la levure chimique avec une pincée de sel. Incorporez les fraises, puis grattez-les dans le moule. Hachez grossièrement les pistaches restantes et répartissez-les sur le dessus.","Cuire au four pendant 50 à 55 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés. Laisser refroidir dans le moule à température ambiante avant de transférer sur un support à gâteau ou une assiette. Saupoudrez de sucre glace et servez avec de la crème fraîche ou du yaourt et des fraises supplémentaires."]','2026-01-11 00:05:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10301,9350,'fr','Tarte tropicale','Créez un superbe motif géométrique sur cette tarte aux fruits tropicaux en utilisant des triangles de mangue et de kiwi ou de fruit du dragon et d''ananas – ou imaginez le vôtre','["100 g de mascarpone","140g de fromage frais","30g de sucre glace","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de noix de coco (facultatif)","50 ml de crème de coco en boîte, secouée au préalable (conservez le reste pour une autre recette)","1 caissette de pâtisserie sucrée","fruit tropical de votre choix, tranché, puis chaque tranche coupée en triangles ou selon les formes requises pour votre design (nous avons utilisé des mangues, des kiwis, des ananas et des fruits du dragon)"]','["À l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battre le mascarpone, le fromage à la crème, le sucre, la vanille, l''extrait de noix de coco, le cas échéant, et une pincée de sel jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer la crème de coco.","Versez la garniture dans le fond de tarte, lissez le dessus et remettez au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 2 heures ou toute la nuit. Une fois pris, utilisez les fruits tropicaux pour décorer le dessus de la tarte selon le motif géométrique souhaité."]','2026-01-11 00:05:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10302,9351,'fr','Gâteau aux myrtilles et pistaches, crème à la cardamome','La lectrice Janine Watkins partage sa recette d''une éponge à sandwich légère et noisette avec des notes florales et des baies éclatantes','["4 gros œufs","225 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","175 g de beurre fondu et refroidi","200 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","85 g de pistaches moulues","50g de myrtilles","100 g de beurre ramolli","200 g de sucre glace","graines de 6 gousses de cardamome, moulues","200 ml de crème fraîche","85 g de pistaches hachées grossièrement","200 g de myrtilles"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nGraisser légèrement et tapisser la base de\r\n2 moules à sandwich de 20 cm avec cuisson\r\nparchemin. Graissez à nouveau les moules,\r\nsaupoudrer d''un peu de sucre en poudre et d''un\r\nun peu de farine, puis tapotez l''excédent.","Mettez les œufs et le sucre dans un récipient résistant à la chaleur\r\nbol et, à l''aide d''un fouet électrique, mélangez\r\nbrièvement pour combiner. Placez le bol dessus \r\nune casserole d''eau bouillante et continuez à\r\nfouetter jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et épais\r\n– lorsque le fouet est soulevé, le mélange\r\ndevrait laisser une trace durable à la surface\r\nenviron 5 secondes. Retirez le bol du\r\ncasserole et continuez à battre pendant 2 minutes.","Continuez à fouetter le mélange pendant que\r\nfaire couler le beurre fondu autour du\r\nbord du bol. Tamisez la farine et\r\npistaches moulues, donnez très doucement le\r\nmélange 2-3 fois, puis ajoutez les myrtilles\r\net pliez à nouveau en faisant attention à ne pas cogner\r\ndehors tout l''air. Répartissez le mélange entre\r\nles moules et cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''un\r\nla brochette insérée en ressort propre.","Pour faire la garniture, battez le beurre et\r\nsucrer ensemble jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajouter\r\nla cardamome, puis arrosez de crème.\r\nContinuez à battre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et aéré.","Refroidissez les gâteaux dans leur moule pendant 10 minutes, puis\r\ndémouler sur une grille. Retirer la doublure\r\npapier une fois complètement refroidi. Sandwich\r\nles gâteaux avec la cardamome\r\ncrème, garnir d''un peu, puis\r\ndécorer de pistaches et de myrtilles."]','2026-01-11 00:05:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10303,9352,'fr','Gâteau tacheté aux bleuets et à la crème caillée','Biscuit à la myrtille tachetée et à la crème caillée, le gâteau de fête fruité parfait','["200 g de sucre en poudre","200g de beurre ramolli","4 œufs, battus","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","150g de myrtilles","50 g de sucre en poudre","Pot de 227 g de crème crémeuse","4 cuillères à soupe de confiture de myrtilles","une poignée de myrtilles, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/chaleur tournante 170°/gaz 5. Beurrer deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Dans un grand bol, battre tous les ingrédients du gâteau ensemble jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et molle. Incorporez les myrtilles dans la pâte crue avant la cuisson.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules, lissez\r\nla surface avec une spatule ou le dos d''une cuillère, puis enfourner environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et que le gâteau reprenne sa forme lorsqu''on le presse. Mettez sur une grille de refroidissement et laissez refroidir complètement.","Pour préparer la garniture, battez le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit lisse et crémeux, puis incorporez progressivement le sucre glace. Incorporez l’extrait de vanille si vous l’utilisez. Étalez la crème au beurre sur le fond d''un des biscuit, recouvrez-le de confiture et placez le deuxième biscuit dessus. Saupoudrez d''un peu de sucre glace avant de servir. Conserver dans un contenant hermétique et consommer dans les 2 jours.","Pour une garniture simple, incorporez le sucre en poudre à la crème caillée.  Sandwicher les génoises avec la confiture de myrtilles et un tiers de la garniture à la crème caillée. Garnir du reste de crème et décorer de myrtilles."]','2026-01-11 00:05:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10304,9353,'fr','Gâteau à la rhubarbe et au citron','Une génoise au citron parsemée de tendres morceaux de rhubarbe rose et garnie d''un glaçage à la crème décadent','["225 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","225 g de sucre en poudre","le zeste d''1 citron","4 œufs moyens à température ambiante, battus","75g d''amandes moulues","200 g de farines autolevantes","140 g de rhubarbe écrasée, lavée et coupée en petits morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre demerara","75 ml de crème fraîche","3 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron, plus un peu pour arroser"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer légèrement un gâteau rond et profond de 20 cm\r\nétain et tapisser la base d''un cercle de\r\npapier sulfurisé antiadhésif.","Mettez le beurre dans un grand bol et\r\nbattre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance légère\r\net mousseux, puis ajoutez le sucre en poudre et\r\nle zeste de citron et battre à nouveau. Ajouter progressivement\r\nles œufs au mélange, en battant bien avec\r\nchaque ajout, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement combiné. Le\r\nle mélange commencera à paraître brillant – si à\r\nà chaque étape, le mélange caille, battez dans un\r\ncuillerée de poudre d''amandes et continuer\r\najouter l''oeuf jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tout amalgamé.","Incorporez la poudre d''amandes, puis le\r\nfariner et plier le tout soigneusement\r\nensemble à l’aide d’une grande cuillère. Plier\r\ndans la moitié de la rhubarbe, puis transférez\r\nle mélange dans le moule à gâteau préparé\r\net parsemer du reste de rhubarbe.\r\nTerminer avec le sucre demerara saupoudré\r\nen haut. Faites cuire le gâteau pendant 45 minutes, ou\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette soit insérée au milieu\r\nen ressort propre. Transférer sur une grille\r\nlaisser refroidir légèrement dans le moule, puis retirer\r\nde l''étain. Quand le gâteau est froid,\r\nfaire la garniture.","Fouettez la crème dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce qu''elle\r\nforme des pics mous. Dans un petit bol, détacher\r\nla crème de citron avec environ 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau\r\net incorporez-le délicatement à la crème,\r\nsans surmenage. Réparti sur le\r\ngâteau, arroser d''un peu plus de citron\r\ncaillé et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:05:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10305,9354,'fr','Gâteau aux fraises et aux graines de pavot','Une génoise légère à la vanille parsemée de graines et prise en sandwich avec un glaçage à l''orange et des fraises fraîches – divin','["4 cuillères à soupe de graines de pavot","200 g de beurre doux fondu, plus un peu pour graisser","225 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","4 gros œufs, à température ambiante","225 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","le zeste et le jus d''une grosse orange","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de liqueur d''orange (facultatif)","Pot de 170 g de yaourt grec entier","Pot de 500 ml de crème fraîche entière","350 g de fraises tranchées, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites frire à sec les graines de pavot dans une poêle\r\nfeu doux pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit aromatique.\r\nLaissez refroidir. Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser 2 moules à sandwich de 20 cm.","Mélanger la farine et la pâte à pâtisserie\r\npoudre, puis réserver. Mettez les œufs\r\net le sucre dans un grand bol à mélanger. Utilisation\r\nbatteurs électriques, fouetter jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et pâle.\r\net mousseux. Versez le beurre refroidi et\r\nl''extrait de vanille et fouettez à nouveau brièvement.\r\nTamisez le mélange de farine, ajoutez 3 cuillères à soupe de pavot\r\ngraines puis, à l''aide d''une grande cuillère en métal,\r\nincorporer délicatement au mélange à gâteau jusqu''à ce que\r\nmême. Versez le mélange dans les moules et\r\ncuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et\r\nélastique au toucher. Refroidir dans les boîtes\r\npendant 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille.","Pour faire le sirop, réchauffer l''orange\r\njus et 50g de sucre dans le\r\nmicro-ondes pendant 30 secondes. Incorporer la liqueur,\r\nsi vous l''utilisez. A l''aide d''un grand couteau dentelé, coupez\r\nchaque gâteau en deux horizontalement pour faire un\r\ntotal de 4 cercles. Brossez le côté coupé et\r\nbords de chaque cercle avec beaucoup de\r\nsirop d''orange tiède.","Pour faire la garniture, battre ensemble\r\nle yaourt, la crème fraîche, le reste\r\nsucre et zeste d''orange jusqu''à consistance épaisse et\r\ntartinable. Empilez les gâteaux avec le\r\ngarniture crémeuse et fraises, finition\r\navec une couche crémeuse dessus. Saupoudrer le\r\nle reste des graines de pavot par-dessus, puis\r\nlaissez le gâteau reposer 30 minutes avant de le trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:05:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10306,9355,'fr','Gâteau anglais à la rose','Un superbe gâteau étagé floral, parfumé à l''eau de rose et recouvert de crème à la vanille, de glaçage à la framboise et de pétales cristallisés.','["350 g de beurre ramolli","500 g de sucre en poudre doré","6 gros œufs","200 g de yaourt nature entier","500 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à café d''eau de rose","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 à 2 cuillères à café d''eau de rose (selon votre goût)","85 g de framboises décongelées si congelées, plus 100 g pour décorer","250 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","300 ml de crème fraîche","morceaux de pétales de rose et pétales de roses cristallisés (voir étape par étape ci-dessus), pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nGraisser et tapisser la base et les côtés de\r\nGâteau rond à fond souple de 3 x 20 cm\r\nmoules avec du papier sulfurisé. Pourboire à tous\r\ningrédients pour le gâteau dans un grand bol\r\net battre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que bien\r\ncombinés. Répartissez le mélange entre\r\nles 3 moules à cake et lisser le dessus. Cuire au four\r\npendant 45 minutes en échangeant les moules à mi-cuisson\r\nà travers pour qu''ils cuisent uniformément. Laisser refroidir\r\npendant 10 minutes dans les moules, puis retirez et\r\ntransférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pour faire le sirop de rose, mettez le sucre\r\ndans une casserole avec 100 ml d''eau et chauffer jusqu''à ce\r\nle sucre est dissous. Augmentez la chaleur\r\net bouillonner pendant 1 à 2 minutes, puis retirer\r\nde la chaleur. Ajoutez l''eau de rose : commencez\r\navec 1 cuillère à café et goûter, comme certaines variétés\r\nsont beaucoup plus forts que les autres – soyez simplement\r\nfaites attention car le sirop sera très chaud.\r\nVerser la moitié du sirop sur les 3 génoises\r\net mettre de côté.","Ajouter 2 cuillères à soupe de sirop aux framboises\r\net écrasez-les avec une fourchette. Poussez le\r\nframboises au tamis dans un bol et\r\njetez les graines. Tamisez le sucre glace\r\net mélanger pour obtenir un glaçage lisse. Dans une seconde\r\nbol, ajoutez encore 2 cuillères à soupe de sirop\r\net la vanille à la crème et fouetter\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il tienne des pics mous. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour assembler, placez un gâteau, côté plat\r\nvers le haut, sur une assiette ou un support à gâteau, et dessus\r\navec la moitié de la crème et un tiers du\r\nframboises restantes (voir conseils,\r\nci-dessous). Sandwich un autre gâteau dessus\r\net ajoutez le reste de crème, un autre\r\nun tiers des framboises, puis le dernier\r\ngâteau. Lisser le glaçage à la framboise\r\npar-dessus, en le laissant tomber en bruine\r\nles côtés. Pour décorer, nous avons utilisé un\r\nmélange de morceaux de pétales de rose (disponible\r\nen cuisine ou en ligne), fait maison\r\npétales de rose cristallisés (voir étape par étape ci-dessus) et\r\nles framboises réservées."]','2026-01-11 00:05:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10307,9356,'fr','Quatre-quarts pêches, pistaches et chocolat blanc','Une génoise dense et gourmande de style salon de thé avec un glaçage au chocolat blanc et au fromage à la crème','["250 g de beurre ramolli","200 g de sucre en poudre","300 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","3 gros œufs","200 g de yaourt grec entier","200 g de chocolat blanc en tablette, 50 g râpé, le reste cassé en morceaux","2 pêches, dénoyautées et coupées en morceaux de 1 cm ou moins","morceaux de chocolat blanc (voir ci-dessus)","Pot de 200 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","200 g de yaourt grec","3 cuillères à soupe de pistaches finement hachées"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser le fond et les côtés\r\nd''un moule à cake profond de 22 cm avec cuisson\r\nparchemin, puis battez le reste du\r\nle beurre et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles.\r\nAjouter la farine, la levure chimique, la vanille,\r\nœufs, yaourt et chocolat râpé.\r\nBattez ensemble, puis incorporez les pêches.","Versez dans le moule et enfournez pendant 1 h,\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette insérée sorte\r\npropre. Refroidir dans le moule.","Pour faire le glaçage, faites fondre le chocolat\r\nmorceaux dans un bol sur une poêle à peine\r\neau frémissante, puis retirer du\r\nla chaleur. Battre le fromage à pâte molle dans un\r\nmélanger le bol jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporer\r\nle yaourt jusqu''à consistance lisse. Grattez dans le\r\nchocolat fondu et battre à nouveau. Refroidir\r\njusqu''au moment de l''utiliser.","Faites tourner le glaçage sur le dessus du\r\ngâteau et répartir sur les pistaches."]','2026-01-11 00:05:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10308,9357,'fr','Gâteau au pamplemousse et aux graines de pavot','Un moule à gâteau donne une jolie finition à cette génoise aux agrumes, arrosée d''un glaçage au beurre piquant.','["175 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","300 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","300 g de sucre en poudre","3 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","225 ml de crème sure","le zeste de 2 pamplemousses et 3 cuillères à soupe de jus","4 cuillères à café de graines de pavot, grillées","100 g de sucre en poudre","25g de beurre","le zeste d''un pamplemousse et 4 cuillères à soupe de jus"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer puis fariner un Bundt ou un rond de 1,5 litre.\r\nétain. Battre ensemble le beurre et le sucre\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Incorporer les œufs, un\r\nà la fois, suivi de la vanille, de la farine,\r\nlevure chimique, crème sure, pamplemousse\r\nle zeste et le jus, et les graines de pavot grillées.\r\nGrattez dans le moule et nivelez-le. Cuire au four\r\npendant 40 à 55 minutes selon la forme\r\nde votre boîte, jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette enfoncée vienne\r\npropre. Laisser refroidir un peu dans le moule\r\npendant que vous préparez le glaçage.","Faites chauffer doucement le sucre en poudre, le beurre et\r\njus de pamplemousse pour faire fondre le beurre. Apportez\r\nporter à ébullition, puis baisser le feu et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 3 minutes. Retirer du feu, incorporer\r\nle zeste et laisser refroidir environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\népaissi et sirupeux.","Retournez le gâteau tiède sur une plaque refroidissante\r\ngrille et badigeonner la moitié du glaçage sur le\r\ngâteau. Versez le reste, petit à petit,\r\ndonc ça s''enfonce."]','2026-01-11 00:05:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10309,9358,'fr','Tranche glacée de noix de coco et de citron vert avec fruits d''été','Ce dessert sans cuisson est servi directement du congélateur, pour un véritable avant-goût de gourmandise estivale.','["300 ml de crème fraîche","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","250 ml de crème de coco","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","800g de fruits rouges mélangés (nous avons utilisé des fraises, des framboises et des groseilles)","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","jus 1 citron vert"]','["Tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g d''assez de colle\r\nfilm pour vous permettre d''enrouler les côtés\r\nle dessus de la boîte plus tard. Fouetter la crème\r\navec le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''il atteigne des pics. Fouet\r\ndans la crème de coco et le jus de citron vert et\r\nzester jusqu''à ce qu''il reprenne sa forme. Astuce dans\r\nmouler et lisser le dessus, envelopper le film alimentaire\r\nFilmer à nouveau et placer au congélateur pendant\r\nau moins 4 heures mais de préférence toute la nuit.\r\nPeut être préparé jusqu''à 2 semaines à l''avance.","Avant de servir, mélangez tous les fruits avec\r\nle sucre et le citron vert et réserver. Au moment de servir, sortez la tranche du congélateur (ne la sortez pas plus tôt comme vous le feriez pour la plupart des autres desserts glacés).\r\nDémoulez la tranche sur une plaque longue et réfrigérée.\r\nassiette, puis utilisez un couteau trempé très\r\neau chaude pour couper des portions épaisses. Servir\r\nsur des assiettes de service réfrigérées avec le\r\ndes fruits répartis à la cuillère."]','2026-01-11 00:05:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10310,9359,'fr','Gâteau aux mûres et aux pommes','Une génoise aux fruits moelleuse, remplie des meilleurs produits de saison avec une touche d''amande et de cannelle également','["125 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","125 g de sucre en poudre","3 gros œufs battus","50g d''amandes moulues","100 g de farines autolevantes","2 pommes Discovery, Russet ou Worcester, pelées et évidées, chacune coupée en 12 segments","100g de mûres","1 grosse pincée de cannelle","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara","25 g de beurre coupé en petits flocons","25 g de noisettes pelées et grillées, hachées grossièrement","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer un rond à fond libre de 22 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau et tapisser le fond de pâte à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin. Battre le beurre et la roulette\r\nsucre ensemble dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce qu''il\r\nest léger et moelleux. Versez progressivement et\r\nbattre les œufs, petit à petit, jusqu''à ce que\r\nvous en avez utilisé les deux tiers en ajoutant de la farine\r\nsi ça caille. Incorporez l''œuf restant,\r\nla poudre d''amandes et enfin la farine,\r\net mélangez le tout délicatement.","Ajoutez les deux tiers des pommes au\r\nle mélange à gâteau et toutes les mûres.\r\nVersez le mélange dans le moule préparé\r\net lissez-le uniformément. Dispersez le\r\npommes restantes sur la surface du\r\ngâteau. Pour la garniture, saupoudrer sur le\r\ncannelle, sucre demerara et beurre.\r\nCuire au four pendant 50 à 55 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette\r\nen ressort propre. Retirez le gâteau de\r\nle four et répartir sur les toasts\r\nnoisettes. Quand le gâteau est froid, saupoudrez\r\nlégèrement avec du sucre glace. Servir en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:05:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10311,7665,'fr','Gâteau glacé tiramisu','Offrez à vos invités ce superbe dessert d''été, parfait pour les dîners en plein air','["2 pots de 250 g de mascarpone","115 g de sucre en poudre","6 cuillères à soupe de marsala","50 g de chocolat noir haché","Pot de 142 ml de crème fraîche légèrement fouettée","5 cuillères à soupe de café fraîchement moulu","85 g de sucre en poudre","3 cuillères à soupe de cognac","Sachet de 200g de biscuits italiens, nous avons utilisé des biscuits Savoiardi Boudoir","cacao, pour saupoudrer","Pot de 142 ml de crème fraîche légèrement fouettée","copeaux ou boucles de chocolat"]','["Tapisser un moule à cake d''1 kg de film alimentaire. Battre ensemble le mascarpone, le sucre et le marsala \r\npuis incorporez le chocolat et la crème.","Préparez le café avec 600 ml d''eau bouillante, laissez reposer 5 min puis filtrez dans un \r\nbol et incorporer le sucre et le cognac.","Réservez 2 biscuits puis trempez rapidement le reste au fur et à mesure de votre utilisation dans le café \r\nmélange et tapissez-les le long de la base et sur les côtés longs du moule (ils tiendront \r\nau-dessus de la jante).","Verser la moitié du mélange crémeux. Trempez les derniers biscuits dans le café et disposez-les dessus bout à bout. Versez le reste du mélange crémeux sur le dessus, puis repliez les doigts éponge au-dessus du bord et appuyez légèrement sur la garniture. Couvrir et congeler. Pour servir, démoulez sur une assiette, retirez le film alimentaire et saupoudrez généreusement de cacao. Versez la crème au centre et décorez avec le chocolat."]','2026-01-11 00:05:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10312,9360,'fr','Gâteau aux groseilles et à l''orange','Utilisez une surabondance de jardin dans cette adaptation simple et fruitée d''un classique – servez avec de la crème anglaise pour un pudding gagnant','["225 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","225 g de sucre en poudre","225 g de farines autolevantes","4 gros œufs","le zeste et le jus râpés d''1 orange","225 g de groseilles à maquereau, garnies et équeutées","140g de sucre semoule"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et chemiser un moule à tarte de 20 x 30 cm.\r\navec du papier sulfurisé.","Mettez le beurre, le sucre semoule, la farine,\r\noeufs et zeste d''orange dans un bol. Battre\r\nsoigneusement avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que\r\ncrémeux et onctueux. Incorporer le\r\ngroseilles à maquereau, puis verser dans le moule\r\net niveler la surface. Enfourner 35 mn\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une pique à brochette soit insérée dans le gâteau\r\nen ressort propre.","Incorporer le jus d''orange et les granulés\r\nsucrer ensemble, verser sur la surface\r\ndu gâteau chaud et laisser refroidir et\r\nensemble. Couper en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10313,9361,'fr','Recette classique de sandwich Victoria','Le gâteau de fête parfait, une génoise Victoria est une pâtisserie traditionnelle que tout le monde adorera. C''est aussi un gâteau de mariage facile','["200 g de sucre en poudre","200g de beurre ramolli","4 œufs, battus","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","100 g de beurre ramolli","140 g de sucre glace tamisé","déposer de l''extrait de vanille (facultatif)","un demi pot de 340 g de confiture de fraises de bonne qualité","sucre glace, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/chaleur tournante 170°/gaz 5. Beurrer deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif.","Dans un grand bol, battre ensemble 200 g de sucre en poudre, 200 g de beurre ramolli, 4 œufs battus, 200 g de farine auto-levante, 1 cuillère à café de levure chimique et 2 cuillères à soupe de lait jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et molle.","Répartissez le mélange dans les moules, lissez la surface avec une spatule ou le dos d''une cuillère.","Cuire au four environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et que le gâteau reprenne sa forme lorsqu''on le presse.","Mettez sur une grille et laissez refroidir complètement.","Pour réaliser la garniture, battez les 100 g de beurre ramolli jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et crémeuse, puis incorporez progressivement 140 g de sucre glace tamisé et une goutte d''extrait de vanille (si vous l''utilisez).","Étalez la crème au beurre sur le fond d''une des génoises. Garnissez-le de 170 g de confiture de fraises et placez la deuxième génoise dessus.","Saupoudrez d''un peu de sucre glace avant de servir. Conserver dans un contenant hermétique et consommer dans les 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:05:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10314,9454,'fr','Gâteau de mariage simple et élégant','Pour réaliser un gâteau de mariage à trois étages, il vous suffit de multiplier les préparations à gâteau et les glaçages de base – et de prendre votre temps !','["Pot de 340 g de confiture de fraises (facultatif)","Pot de 340 g de confiture d''abricots réchauffée et tamisée","4 kg de glaçage blanc prêt à rouler","Planche à gâteau ronde fine de 15 cm, 23 cm et 30 cm","Planche à gâteau ronde de 40 cm d''épaisseur","bâtons de cocktail","couteau à palette","un rouleau de papier sulfurisé","une plaque à pâtisserie plate ou un lève-gâteau","sucre glace, pour étaler","ficelle, pour mesurer","8 x longues tiges de cheville en plastique","ciseaux de cuisine","Ruban de satin blanc de 3½ m x 1½ cm","tube de colle UHU, ou similaire","Sucettes à gâteau en polystyrène 12cm et 15cm","Fil de fleuriste de calibre 18, coupé en longueurs d''environ 20 x 10 cm","15 à 20 têtes d''hortensias blanches et vert pâle (prenez-en des plus petites, d''autres plus grosses, si vous le pouvez) ; votre fleuriste peut vous conseiller","Boîtes à gâteaux de 40 cm, 30 cm et 18 cm avec couvercles, si vous transportez le gâteau"]','["Pour l''étage inférieur, triplez les quantités pour la recette facile de gâteau à la vanille, puis versez-la dans un moule à gâteau rond profond de 30 cm déjà tapissé. Cuire au four 2 h 15 à mi-hauteur à la même température, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et bien cuits. Pendant la cuisson, préparez une quadruple quantité de sirop de la même recette – cela suffira pour les trois gâteaux. Laisser refroidir et arroser le gâteau de sirop comme avant.","Pour les niveaux intermédiaire et supérieur, doublez les quantités pour la recette facile de gâteau à la vanille, puis versez-la dans des moules à gâteau de 15 cm et 23 cm déjà garnis, en les remplissant chacun aux deux tiers environ. Faites-les cuire ensemble sur la grille du milieu, en retirant le petit gâteau au bout de 1h15 et en laissant cuire le plus gros gâteau pendant 1h30 au total. Si vous savez que votre four présente des points chauds, déplacez rapidement les gâteaux au bout de 50 minutes. Laisser refroidir et arroser de sirop comme avant.","Maintenant, superposez et couvrez les gâteaux. Préparez la crème au beurre comme dans la recette facile du gâteau à la vanille. Vous aurez besoin de 5 fois la quantité de base – c’est beaucoup, alors divisez vos quantités pesées en deux avant de commencer à mélanger. Il vous en reste peut-être un peu, mais mieux vaut trop que pas assez. Pesez la crème au beurre – il vous faudra environ 400 g pour le gâteau de 15 cm, 600 g pour le gâteau de 23 cm et 1,3 kg pour le gâteau de 30 cm. Étalez un peu de crème au beurre sur le plateau à gâteau de 15 cm. Nivelez le dessus du gâteau si nécessaire, puis retournez le gâteau de 15 cm dessus. Divisez-la en trois à l''aide d''un couteau à pain. Nous aimons marquer le devant du gâteau sur chaque couche avant de le décoller, à l''aide de cure-dents, afin de pouvoir le réassembler exactement de la bonne manière. Retirez d''abord le tiers supérieur (ce qui était le bas du gâteau) et réservez. Coupez soigneusement la couche intermédiaire et mettez-la également de côté. Une plaque à pâtisserie plate ou un lève-gâteau peut être très utile ici pour faire glisser les couches de gâteau puis les remettre les unes sur les autres.","Étalez une couche de crème au beurre sur le gâteau sur la planche. Remettez la couche intermédiaire en alignant les marques de cure-dent, puis étalez une autre couche de crème au beurre par-dessus. Ajoutez un peu de confiture si vous le souhaitez, parsemez-la puis étalez-la uniformément. Garnir du dernier morceau de gâteau, puis dépoussiérer les miettes sur ou autour du gâteau. Badigeonnez maintenant tout le gâteau d’une fine couche de confiture d’abricots. Cela devrait vous éviter de mettre trop de miettes dans la crème au beurre. Disposez le gâteau entier sur une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé.","Étalez le reste de la crème au beurre dessus, en commençant par le dessus, puis lissez-la et pagayez-la sur les côtés jusqu''à la planche. Répétez l''ensemble du processus avec les gâteaux restants, en utilisant les planches correspondantes et les différentes quantités de crème au beurre. Les gâteaux sont maintenant prêts à être glacés. Vous pouvez les laisser toute la nuit si nécessaire, légèrement recouverts d''un film alimentaire.","Couvrir le gâteau. Il vous faudra environ 500 g de glaçage pour le gâteau de 15 cm, 1 kg pour le gâteau de 23 cm et 1,7 kg pour le gâteau de 30 cm. Saupoudrez le plan de travail de sucre glace, pétrissez le glaçage jusqu''à ce qu''il soit souple, puis utilisez votre rouleau à pâtisserie pour l''enrouler en un cercle suffisamment grand pour recouvrir les côtés et le dessus du gâteau, avec un peu de reste. Utilisez une chaîne pour vérifier la taille. Utilisez votre rouleau à pâtisserie pour vous aider à soulever le glaçage sur le gâteau.","Lissez le glaçage autour du gâteau avec vos mains, en le faisant glisser sur les bords et jusqu''au plateau. Coupez ensuite l''excédent avec un couteau bien aiguisé, au ras du fond du plateau à gâteau. Lissez les marques avec le plat de vos mains, en polissant le glaçage pour lui donner un léger éclat.","Une fois que vous avez glacé tous les gâteaux, recouvrez la planche de base épaisse. Badigeonner légèrement d''eau bouillie refroidie, puis déposer le glaçage dessus. Coupez jusqu''au bord de la planche avec un couteau (nous faisons cela comme vous le feriez avec une croûte à tarte, en tenant la planche dans votre main gauche et le couteau dans votre droite), puis laissez la planche et les gâteaux sécher toute la nuit.","Empilez les gâteaux. Les chevilles, qui sont essentiellement des bâtons en plastique, assurent stabilité et résistance aux gâteaux étagés, et les blocs de polystyrène vous permettent d''ajouter une couche de fleurs « flottantes ». En mesurant et en coupant les chevilles à la même longueur que le polystyrène, vous fournirez une plate-forme uniforme sur laquelle le prochain gâteau pourra reposer, même si le gâteau en dessous est un peu bancal.","Placez le mannequin de 15 cm au centre du plus gros gâteau. Insérez quatre des chevilles dans le gâteau, autour de l''extérieur du mannequin, en forme carrée. Poussez-les vers le bas jusqu''à ce qu''ils rencontrent le plateau à gâteau. Marquez avec un stylo l''endroit où arrive le haut du mannequin.","Retirez délicatement les chevilles ; puis, à l''aide de ciseaux, marquez autour de chaque cheville là où vous l''avez marquée. Cassez le plastique proprement. Réinsérez les chevilles dans leurs trous d''origine, extrémité arrondie vers le bas. Répétez le processus avec le gâteau de 23 cm et le mannequin de 12 cm.","Placez le plus gros gâteau au milieu du plateau couvert. Appliquez une fine ligne de colle autour de la planche de base et fixez le ruban autour. Fixez le ruban autour de chaque gâteau, en utilisant un peu de colle sur le ruban pour le fixer sur lui-même. Si vous déplacez le gâteau dans un lieu, mettez-le maintenant dans ses boîtes. Préparez un petit kit à emporter avec vous – colle, ciseaux, etc. – au cas où vous auriez à refaire quelque chose.","Un jour, empilez et décorez. Nous avons utilisé des hortensias : ils sont magnifiques et vous pouvez obtenir un effet spectaculaire avec relativement peu de fleurs.","Le jour même, évitez de mettre les fleurs sur le gâteau le plus tard possible. Coupez les tiges des hortensias à environ 2-3 cm. Divisez vos fleurs les moins préférées en morceaux plus petits – cela vous aidera à combler les lacunes gênantes plus tard. Assurez-vous de conserver une belle fleur pour le sommet.","Insérez une longueur de fil de fer fleuri dans chaque tige (ou enroulez-la autour de la tige), en laissant une pointe de fil d''environ 3 cm de long. Poussez-le dans le mannequin en polystyrène. Répétez jusqu''à ce que les deux mannequins soient entourés d''un halo de fleurs. Le gâteau du bas devrait maintenant être dans sa position permanente – à l’abri de la lumière directe et de tout radiateur. Soulevez le gâteau de 23 cm sur le mannequin en polystyrène inférieur, en prenant soin de ne pas écraser les pétales, puis répétez avec le gâteau du haut. Remplissez les espaces vides avec le capitule cassé que vous avez réservé plus tôt. Posez la fleur finale sur le gâteau et le tour est joué ! Les gâteaux peuvent être congelés à l''avance, sans glaçage. Cependant, si vous les faites cuire trois jours avant le mariage, le gâteau ira bien jusqu''au grand jour.","Coupez le gâteau en travers, en grille, plutôt qu''en quartiers. Vous devriez pouvoir obtenir 50 portions du gros gâteau, 30 du milieu et 12 du haut, une fois coupé en morceaux de 2,5 x 5 cm."]','2026-01-11 00:05:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10315,9362,'fr','Le gâteau de mariage d''été de Frances Quinn','Frances crée sa propre version de la dernière tendance nuptiale : le gâteau « nu ». Elle abandonne le glaçage fondant traditionnel pour les baies de saison au mascarpone.','["1,375 kg de beurre légèrement salé, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser (acheter 6 paquets de 250 g)","1,375 kg de sucre en poudre doré","21 gros œufs","2 cuillères à soupe d''extrait de vanille","1 375 kg de farines autolevantes","210 g d''amandes moulues","zester 21 gros citrons et 10 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","600 g de sucre en poudre doré","700 ml de jus de citron (utiliser les citrons du mélange à gâteau)","gros bouquet de menthe fraîche, feuilles arrachées","2 kg de mascarpone","2 x 325 pots de crème de citron de bonne qualité","1kg de framboises","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","environ 1,2 kg de mélange de baies et de cerises (nous avons utilisé des fraises, des cerises, des myrtilles, des mûres et des groseilles)","quelques feuilles de menthe","assortiment de fleurs non traitées (voir conseil ci-dessous)","Moule à cake de 30 cm de profondeur","Moule à cake de 20 cm de profondeur","Moule à cake de 10 cm de profondeur","coton à coudre, pour couper le gâteau","Planches à gâteaux fines de 20 cm et 10 cm","palette à gâteau (facultatif, mais très utile)","environ 20 pailles en plastique","2 grandes grilles","grand support ou planche à gâteau","du ruban adhésif fleuri ou du papier d''aluminium de cuisine"]','["Pour réaliser les gâteaux. Chauffer le four à 170°C/150°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Pour le niveau inférieur, graisser un moule à cake profond de 30 cm avec du beurre, puis tapisser le fond et les côtés d''une double couche de papier sulfurisé.","A l''aide d''un fouet électrique, battre 400 g de beurre avec 400 g de sucre semoule. Battez 6 œufs dans un pichet avec ½ cuillère à soupe de vanille, puis ajoutez-les progressivement à la crème au beurre en battant entre les ajouts. Une fois combiné, tamisez 400 g de farine, incorporez 60 g de poudre d''amandes et ajoutez le zeste de 6 citrons. Incorporer délicatement 3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron.","Verser dans le moule à gâteau préparé et niveler le dessus avec une spatule. Cuire au milieu du four pendant 1 h. Ne vous inquiétez pas si le dessus semble un peu sombre, car cela deviendra la base. Le gâteau est prêt lorsque la surface est élastique au toucher et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressort propre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 30 minutes, puis démouler sur une grande grille ou utiliser 2 grilles plus petites rapprochées.","Pour réaliser un étage intermédiaire, tapissez un moule à gâteau de 20 cm de profondeur comme avant et réalisez le gâteau en suivant la méthode de l''étape 2, en utilisant 4 œufs et 250 g chacun de sucre, de farine et de beurre. Ajoutez le zeste de 4 citrons, 40 g de poudre d''amandes, 1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille et 1½ cuillère à soupe de jus de citron. Cuire au four 50 minutes en testant comme avant.","Pour le niveau supérieur, utilisez un moule à cake profond de 10 cm et réalisez le gâteau en suivant la méthode comme précédemment, en utilisant 1 œuf, 75 g chacun de sucre, 75 g de farine et de beurre, 10 g de poudre d''amandes, le zeste d''1 citron, 1 cuillère à café de vanille et ½ cuillère à café de jus de citron. Cuire au four 30 mn.","Répétez les étapes 1 à 4 pour avoir 2 niveaux inférieurs, 2 niveaux intermédiaires et 1 niveau supérieur. Laisser jusqu''à ce que tous les gâteaux soient complètement refroidis. Une fois refroidis, les gâteaux peuvent être enveloppés dans une double couche de film alimentaire et conservés dans un endroit frais jusqu''à 4 jours, ou congelés jusqu''à 1 mois. Pour décongeler, laissez les gâteaux à température ambiante toute la nuit.","Pour faire le sirop. Mettez le sucre et le jus de citron dans une casserole sur feu moyen-vif. Laisser mijoter environ 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Retirer du feu, incorporer la menthe, puis laisser refroidir et infuser jusqu''à 5 heures. Passer dans un pichet ou un bol, puis couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser. Le sirop se conservera désormais jusqu''à 1 semaine.","Pour réaliser la crème au mascarpone. Videz le mascarpone dans un grand bol. Battez avec un fouet électrique pour ramollir légèrement, puis incorporez 300 ml de sirop de citron et de menthe refroidi jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé (conservez le reste du sirop pour l''assemblage). Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser, mais laisser à température ambiante pendant 20 minutes pour ramollir avant utilisation. Peut être préparé 1 jour avant l’assemblage.","Pour assembler le gâteau. Divisez les deux gâteaux de 30 cm et les deux gâteaux de 20 cm en deux par le centre, et le gâteau de 10 cm en 4 couches. Utilisez la palette à gâteau ou une grande planche à découper pour aider à déplacer les génoises et retournez l''une des plus grandes couches sur une assiette de service ou un support à gâteau, de sorte que le haut du gâteau devienne maintenant le bas. Verser un peu du sirop réservé, puis tartiner d''un peu de garniture au citron mascarpone à l''aide d''une petite spatule coudée ou d''un couteau. Arroser d''un peu de crème au citron, puis parsemer de framboises. Garnissez maintenant avec la couche restante, de sorte que le bas du gâteau devienne maintenant le dessus, en réalignant les bâtonnets à cocktail pour vous assurer que le gâteau est de niveau. Ensuite, superposez davantage de sirop, de mascarpone, de crème de citron et de framboises avec les 30 cm de génoises restantes.","Poussez 6 pailles au milieu du gâteau en formant un cercle, d''un diamètre maximum de 20 cm – elles soutiendront le niveau suivant. Coupez les pailles là où elles dépassent du gâteau, afin qu''elles affleurent le dessus. Répétez l''assemblage avec les deux gâteaux de 20 cm, en les plaçant sur de fines planches à gâteaux avant de les poser sur les gâteaux plus gros, puis enfoncez plus de pailles pour soutenir l''attache supérieure. Enfin, assemblez la couche supérieure en utilisant la même méthode. Étalez dessus le reste de mascarpone, puis saupoudrez légèrement les étages de sucre glace. Décorez avec un assortiment de baies mélangées, de brins de menthe et de fleurs (voir astuce à gauche)."]','2026-01-11 00:05:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10316,9363,'fr','Profiteroles gourmandes au moka','Une recette de profiterole classique avec un petit plus pour les amateurs de café – empilez-en un lot comme un gâteau de mariage moderne !','["100 g de farine nature","85g de beurre doux","3 œufs battus","4 cuillères à soupe de poudre de crème anglaise aux oiseaux","6 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","600 ml de lait","2 cuillères à soupe d''essence de café (dissoudre 2 cuillères à soupe de grains de café instantané dans 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude - nous avons utilisé le mélange Nescafé Partners)","284 ml de crème fraîche","100g de sucre glace","100 g de chocolat noir en morceaux","50g de beurre","50 ml de café","1-2 cuillères à soupe de liqueur de café comme le Kahlúa"]','["Tamisez la farine dans un bol et ajoutez une pincée de sel. Mettez le beurre et 200 ml d''eau froide dans une casserole, portez à ébullition puis retirez du feu. Ajoutez la farine et le sel et remuez pour former une pâte lisse. Battez maintenant le mélange jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à se détacher des parois de la casserole, puis versez-le sur une assiette et laissez refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Remettre la pâte dans la poêle, puis incorporer progressivement les œufs en mélangeant bien. Déposez des boules de la taille d''une noix sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. À la sortie du four, piquez le dessous avec une cuillère à café, retournez-le, puis enfournez 5 minutes pour le faire sécher. Laisser refroidir sur une grille avant de garnir.","Pour la garniture, mélangez la poudre de crème anglaise et le sucre avec un peu de lait jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Faites chauffer le reste du lait, puis incorporez-le à la pâte. Versez le mélange dans une casserole et portez à ébullition en remuant. Cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une crème anglaise épaisse. Incorporer le café, puis laisser refroidir. Fouettez doucement la crème, tamisez le sucre glace et mélangez, puis incorporez-la au\r\ncrème anglaise. Versez la crème dans chaque choux.","Pour la sauce, faire fondre le chocolat et le beurre avec le café dans un bol au micro-ondes à puissance moyenne pendant 1 à 2 minutes. Versez la liqueur, mélangez bien, puis versez sur les petits pains fourrés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10317,9364,'fr','Gâteau à la vanille facile','Un gâteau moelleux arrosé de sirop de vanille. Utiliser comme base pour une gamme de fabuleux gâteaux de fête','["Paquet de 250 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","graines grattées d''1 gousse de vanille ou 1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","5 gros œufs, cassés dans un pichet","85 g de farine nature","100 g de yaourt grec entier (j''ai utilisé Total)","250 g de farines autolevantes","3 cuillères à soupe de lait demi-écrémé","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","graines ½ gousse de vanille ou ½ cuillère à café de pâte de vanille"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrez un moule rond et profond de 20 cm, puis\r\ntapisser la base et les côtés d''un revêtement antiadhésif\r\npapier sulfurisé.","Utiliser des batteurs électriques ou une table\r\nbatteur, battre le beurre, le sucre, la vanille et\r\n¼ cuillère à café de sel ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et mousseux,\r\npuis versez les œufs, un à un,\r\ndonner un très bon coup au mix\r\navant d''ajouter le suivant. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de\r\nfarine ordinaire si le mélange commence à paraître gluant\r\nplutôt que moelleux. Incorporer le yaourt.","Mélangez les farines; puis, à l''aide d''un gros métal\r\ncuillère, incorporez-les à la pâte, suivi\r\npar le lait. Versez le mélange dans le moule\r\net cuire au four pendant 1 h 20 ou jusqu''à ce que ce soit bien\r\nlevé et doré – une brochette insérée dans\r\nle milieu devrait ressortir propre.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le sirop en le faisant délicatement\r\nfaire chauffer 50 ml d''eau avec le sucre et\r\nvanille dans une casserole jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve.\r\nAnnuler. Une fois le gâteau sorti du\r\nfour, laisser refroidir 30 min au four\r\nétain, puis utilisez une brochette pour percer des trous\r\nsur le gâteau, en allant jusqu''au fond.\r\nVersez le sirop dessus en le laissant complètement\r\ntremper après chaque ajout. Laisser refroidir\r\ncomplètement, puis enveloppez le gâteau\r\nbien ou remplissez-le et glacez-le. Si vous l''enveloppez avec\r\npapier sulfurisé et film alimentaire, le\r\nle gâteau non fourré se conserve bien jusqu''à 3\r\njours, ou au congélateur jusqu''à un mois.","Pour des idées sur la façon de décorer le gâteau et pour essayer quelques variantes de ce mélange de gâteau de base, jetez un œil aux recettes « Se marie bien avec » pour le gâteau de mariage simple et élégant, le gâteau anti-insectes d''anniversaire et le gâteau de célébration d''été."]','2026-01-11 00:05:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10318,9365,'fr','Cupcakes romantiques à la rose','Ces cupcakes décoratifs constituent la pièce maîtresse parfaite pour un mariage ou un baptême, ou un joli cadeau','["Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature","3 œufs battus","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","140 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g d''amandes moulues","175 g de beurre doux, fondu","100g de chocolat blanc","140g de beurre doux","140 g de sucre glace"]','["Tapisser un moule à muffins 12 trous de caissettes en papier et chauffer le four à 190C/ventilateur 170C/gaz 5. Dans un pichet, mélanger le yaourt, les œufs et l''extrait de vanille. Mettez les ingrédients secs ainsi qu''une pincée de sel dans un grand bol et faites un puits au milieu.","Ajoutez le mélange de yaourt et le beurre fondu, et incorporez rapidement avec une spatule ou une cuillère en métal – ne travaillez pas trop. Verser dans le\r\ncaissettes (elles seront bien pleines) et cuire au four pendant 18 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, levées et élastiques au toucher. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes, puis soulever les gâteaux sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement. Conserver dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à 3 jours ou congeler dès que possible.","Glaçage au chocolat blanc : Faire fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 1½ minute en remuant à mi-cuisson. Laisser refroidir. Battre le beurre et le sucre glace dans un grand bol jusqu''à consistance crémeuse.  Incorporer le chocolat. Couvrir et réfrigérer jusqu''à un mois.","Jusqu''à 48h avant de servir (ou la veille s''il fait très chaud), ramenez le glaçage à température ambiante, puis étalez-le sur les gâteaux. Mettez le ruban autour des gâteaux maintenant si vous le souhaitez, en l''attachant ou en le collant. Conserver au frais, à l''abri de la lumière directe du soleil."]','2026-01-11 00:05:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10319,8781,'fr','Création de votre gâteau de mariage','Le gâteau de mariage de Jane Hornby est le plus simple de tous les temps. Et chaque niveau est aromatisé différemment, donc il y en a pour tous les goûts…','["1 x niveau supérieur, voir « Se marie bien avec »","1 x niveau intermédiaire, voir « Se marie bien avec »","1 x niveau inférieur, voir « Se marie bien avec »","un demi pot de confiture d''abricots de 454 g, vous utiliserez le reste plus tard","Paquet de 500 g de pâte d''amande naturelle","500 g de beurre doux, ramolli","1 kg de sucre glace tamisé","pot de crème de citron de bonne qualité","Carton de 142 ml de crème double","200 g de chocolat noir (70 % de cacao) cassé en morceaux","GÂTEAU AUX FRUITS - glaçage blanc prêt à rouler 500g, pâte colorante alimentaire crème","GÂTEAU AU CITRON - glaçage blanc prêt à rouler 1kg/2lb4oz, pâte colorante alimentaire rose poudré","GÂTEAU AU CHOCOLAT - 1,7kg/3lb 10oz glaçage blanc prêt à rouler, pâte colorante alimentaire ivoire","POUR LA PLAQUE - 800g de glaçage blanc prêt à rouler, pâte colorante alimentaire ivoire","200 g de sucre glace","1 blanc d''oeuf","tiges de cheville","Moule à gâteau rond de 15 cm, 23 cm et 30 cm de profondeur","beaucoup de papier sulfurisé","Tambour à gâteau en argent épais de 35 cm de diamètre (base)","plateau à gâteau argenté fin de 15 cm, 23 cm et 30 cm de diamètre","couteau long dentelé","couteau à palette","pâtes colorantes alimentaires crème, ivoire et rose","long rouleau à pâtisserie","6 tiges de chevilles en plastique standard","ciseaux de cuisine solides","Ruban ivoire de 1 m, largeur 15 mm","pinceau d''artiste médium","grille de refroidissement","ficelle pour mesurer","Boîtes à gâteaux de 20 cm, 25 cm, 33 cm avec couvercles (si transport du gâteau)"]','["RECOUVRIR LE GÂTEAU AUX FRUITS AVEC LE MASSEPAIN : Comment faire : \r\nFaites bouillir la confiture d''abricots avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et tamisez-la dans un bol. Badigeonnez le plateau à gâteau de 15 cm d''un peu de confiture d''abricots. Coupez le dessus arrondi du gâteau et retournez-le sur la planche. Mesurez le dessus et les côtés du gâteau avec de la ficelle, coupez à longueur et mettez la ficelle de côté. Badigeonner le gâteau d''une fine couche de confiture d''abricots.","Saupoudrez le plan de travail de sucre glace et roulez la pâte d''amande en un cercle suffisamment grand pour recouvrir le dessus et les côtés du gâteau, en utilisant la ficelle coupée comme guide. Soulevez le gâteau et lissez avec vos mains. Coupez la pâte d''amande jusqu''à la base du gâteau (pour ne pas voir la planche) et laissez sécher une journée si le temps le permet. Sinon, le gâteau peut être glacé immédiatement.","REMPLISSEZ ET COUVREZ LES GÂTEAUX AU CHOCOLAT ET AU CITRON AVEC DE LA CRÈME AU BEURRE : L''ajout de crème au citron de bonne qualité ou d''une ganache au chocolat soyeuse transforme une simple crème au beurre en une garniture gourmande.","Comment procéder : Préparez d’abord la crème au beurre. Battre le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux, puis incorporer progressivement le beurre tamisé.\r\nsucre glace. Pesez 600 g/1 lb 5 oz du mélange et incorporez-y 5 cuillères à soupe de crème au citron.","Dans une petite casserole, portez la crème juste à ébullition, puis versez-la sur le chocolat. Laisser reposer 2 minutes, puis remuer jusqu''à consistance lisse. Une fois refroidi mais encore liquide, incorporez-le au reste de la crème au beurre de base.","Une fois chaque gâteau complètement refroidi, nivelez le dessus à l’aide d’un long couteau dentelé. Étalez un peu de la crème au beurre correspondante sur le plat à gâteau fin assorti. Retournez le gâteau sur la planche et badigeonnez-le d''une fine couche de confiture d''abricots tamisée – cela permet d''éviter que des miettes perdues ne pénètrent dans la crème au beurre.","Coupez en trois couches horizontalement. Ne vous inquiétez pas si vous coupez les couches de manière inégale, car cela n''affectera pas le gâteau fini. S’il fait chaud ou s’il fait chaud dans votre cuisine, réfrigérez les gâteaux pendant un moment – ​​cela les raffermira et facilitera grandement leur découpe et leur levage. Soulevez chaque couche au fur et à mesure que vous la coupez et mettez-la de côté afin que lorsque vous réempilez les couches, elles soient dans le bon ordre.","Si vous avez préparé la crème au beurre à l''avance et qu''elle a légèrement durci, réchauffez-la au micro-ondes en mode décongélation pendant 10 secondes et battez bien. À l''aide d''un couteau à palette, étalez environ 1/4 de la crème au beurre sur la première couche du gâteau. Pour le gâteau au citron, versez environ une autre cuillère à soupe de crème de citron sur le glaçage. Empilez les couches restantes de cette façon, en étalant tout le glaçage restant sur le dessus et les côtés du gâteau, en le lissant pour qu''il rencontre la base du gâteau en carton. Lissez le tout avec votre couteau à palette et réservez. Les gâteaux sont maintenant prêts à être recouverts d''un glaçage prêt à rouler. Remplis de crème au beurre et glacés, les gâteaux se conservent jusqu''à 3 jours.","RECOUVREZ TOUS LES GÂTEAUX DE GLAÇAGE PRÊT À DÉROULER : L''étape suivante consiste à colorer subtilement les différents étages avec les pâtes colorantes ivoire, vieux rose et crème.","Comment faire : Pour le gâteau aux fruits en pâte d''amande uniquement, badigeonnez-le d''abord légèrement d''eau bouillie et refroidie pour aider le glaçage.\r\nbâton. Pour tous les gâteaux, saupoudrez le plan de travail de sucre glace et pétrissez le glaçage jusqu''à ce qu''il soit souple. Ajoutez quelques grains de colorant alimentaire avec un cure-dent ou le bout d''une brochette – soyez très parcimonieux, car une petite quantité suffit. Travaillez la couleur jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et uniformément colorée. Ajoutez-en davantage et pétrissez à nouveau si vous souhaitez que la couleur soit plus intense.","Saupoudrez à nouveau légèrement le plan de travail et étalez le glaçage en un cercle suffisamment grand pour recouvrir les côtés et le dessus du gâteau, avec un peu d''excédent. Utilisez une ficelle pour mesurer comme avant. Soulevez le glaçage sur le gâteau en vous aidant de votre rouleau à pâtisserie.","Lissez le glaçage autour du gâteau avec vos mains, puis coupez l''excédent avec un couteau bien aiguisé. Laisser sécher toute la nuit. Une fois glacé, se conserve 3 jours.","Une fois les gâteaux glacés, recouvrez le fond de 35 cm. Badigeonner légèrement d’eau bouillie refroidie et recouvrir de glaçage de couleur ivoire. Coupez et laissez sécher toute la nuit.","EMPILER LES GÂTEAUX : Les chevilles donnent stabilité et résistance aux gâteaux étagés. En mesurant et en coupant\r\nles chevilles de la même longueur, vous fournissez une plate-forme uniforme sur laquelle le prochain gâteau peut s''asseoir, même si votre gâteau est un peu bancal. Pour ce gâteau, les étages sont empilés comme des marches, juste décentrées.","Comment procéder : Dans un grand bol, battre progressivement le sucre glace dans le blanc d''œuf jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et lisse. Couvrir avec\r\nfilm alimentaire jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser.","En commençant par le gâteau au chocolat, insérez trois tiges de chevilles en triangle, légèrement décalées sur un côté et pas plus larges que la base du gâteau au citron qui va reposer dessus. Avec un stylo permanent, marquez légèrement l''endroit où le haut du glaçage arrive sur la cheville.","Retirez délicatement les chevilles et alignez-les sur la surface de travail. À l''aide d''une règle, remarquez chaque tige jusqu''au point le plus élevé. Marquez les chevilles avec des ciseaux autour des nouvelles marques et cassez le plastique proprement.","Réinsérez les tiges dans leurs trous d''origine, extrémité arrondie vers le bas. Coupez le fin ruban ivoire pour l''ajuster autour de la planche de base épaisse, en le fixant à l''arrière avec de la colle ou du ruban adhésif double face. Pour empiler les gâteaux, versez un peu de glaçage royal sur chacun des trous des chevilles. Soulevez délicatement le gâteau au chocolat sur la planche couverte, puis empilez les gâteaux sur l''un d''entre eux.\r\nun autre, en positionnant chaque gâteau et en abaissant doucement un côté sur la base ou le gâteau en dessous. Glissez votre couteau à palette en dessous à ce stade et abaissez doucement le gâteau. Retirez le couteau à la dernière minute. (Si vous déplacez le gâteau sur place, mettez les gâteaux dans leurs boîtes et emportez le glaçage avec vous.)","LE TEMPS : JUSQU''À UN MOIS À L''AVANCE : 1. Réaliser le gâteau aux fruits et recouvrir de pâte d''amande.  2. Préparez les gâteaux au chocolat et au citron s''ils sont congelés – ils se congèleront jusqu''à 1 mois (bien qu''il soit préférable de les préparer frais si vous le pouvez).","JUSQU''À 4 JOURS À L''AVANCE : 1. Réalisez les gâteaux au chocolat et au citron s''ils sont frais – conservez-les bien rapés dans du papier sulfurisé et du film alimentaire au frais. 2. Réalisez la crème au beurre chocolat et citron et réservez au réfrigérateur. 3. Préparez les gâteaux au chocolat et au citron si vous les préparez frais – conservez-les bien enveloppés dans du papier sulfurisé et du film alimentaire dans un endroit frais. 4. Réalisez la crème au beurre chocolat et citron et réservez au réfrigérateur.","JUSQU''À 3 JOURS À L''AVANCE : 1. Remplissez et recouvrez les gâteaux au chocolat et au citron de crème au beurre et recouvrez tous les gâteaux et le plateau de glaçage. 2. Insérez les tiges de chevilles.","JUSQU''À 2 JOURS À L''AVANCE : 1. Givrez les pétales de rose.","LE JOUR : 1. Empilez les gâteaux et décorez de pétales une fois les gâteaux en place."]','2026-01-11 00:05:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10320,3710,'fr','Salade Waldorf','Hachez des pommes, du céleri et des noix pour réaliser cette salade américaine classique, pleine de fraîcheur et de croquant. Vous pouvez préparer le dressing jusqu''à deux jours à l''avance','["50 g de noix grillées et hachées grossièrement","2 pommes (nous avons utilisé Granny Smith), hachées grossièrement","1 citron, jus","100 g de mayonnaise","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt à la grecque","½ cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","150 g de raisins rouges coupés en deux","3 branches de céleri, finement tranchées","1 laitue romaine ou Little Gem, feuilles séparées et déchirées si grosses"]','["Faites chauffer une poêle sèche à feu moyen-vif et faites griller les noix pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement dorées et aromatiques. Versez dans un bol et laissez refroidir.","Mélangez les pommes avec un peu de jus de citron pour éviter qu''elles ne se décolorent. Mélanger la mayonnaise, le yogourt, la moutarde et le reste du jus de citron dans un grand bol et bien assaisonner. La vinaigrette se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux jours. Mélangez les pommes, les raisins et le céleri avec la vinaigrette et mélangez bien dans un grand bol pour vous assurer que le tout est uniformément enrobé. Disposez les feuilles de laitue sur un plat de service et versez-les sur le mélange de pommes et le reste de la vinaigrette du bol. Répartir sur les noix grillées avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10321,6909,'fr','Corndogs','Préparez des corndogs d''inspiration américaine en enrobant des saucisses de Francfort dans une pâte à base de semoule de maïs, puis en les faisant frire et en les servant avec du ketchup et de la moutarde jaune.','["100 ml de semoule de maïs","100 g de farine nature","1 œuf légèrement battu","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","150 ml de lait entier","8 saucisses de Francfort","huile végétale, pour frire","ketchup et moutarde américaine, pour servir"]','["Versez la semoule de maïs, la farine, l''œuf, le sucre en poudre, le sel, la levure chimique et le lait dans un bol et fouettez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et sans grumeaux. Versez délicatement la pâte dans un grand pichet ou un verre.","Enfoncez une brochette en bois sur toute la longueur de chaque saucisse de Francfort, de manière à ce qu''elle couvre environ les trois quarts de sa longueur. Remplissez une poêle au maximum au tiers d''huile et faites-la chauffer à 180 °C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain brunisse dans les 30 secondes.","En travaillant avec un francfort à la fois, plongez-le dans la pâte et retournez-le délicatement pour l''enrober – il doit être complètement recouvert. Plongez délicatement dans l''huile et faites frire pendant 2-3 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit croustillante et dorée. Égoutter sur une feuille de papier absorbant. Répétez avec les saucisses de Francfort restantes. Servir avec du ketchup et de la moutarde américaine pour tremper ou arroser."]','2026-01-11 00:05:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10322,6911,'fr','Boeuf salé simple','Préparer du bœuf salé juteux et tendre est plus facile que vous ne le pensez. Servir en sandwich avec du pain de seigle façon new-yorkaise, des concombres marinés, de la moutarde et de la choucroute','["1,6 kg de morceau plat de poitrine de bœuf marinée","2 feuilles de laurier","4 grosses carottes, pelées mais laissées entières","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir","4 baies de genièvre","1-2 cuillères à café de sucre (facultatif)"]','["Si vous le pouvez, laissez le bœuf mariné revenir à température ambiante avant de commencer en le laissant sur le comptoir de la cuisine pendant une heure. Cela accélérera le temps de cuisson. Mettez le bœuf dans une grande casserole et couvrez d''eau froide. Porter à ébullition en écumant toute écume mousseuse qui remonte à la surface. Une fois la mousse en grande partie retirée, ajoutez tous les autres ingrédients. Les ajouter maintenant signifie qu’ils ne gênent pas l’écrémage.","Réduisez le feu, couvrez et laissez mijoter doucement pendant 2 h 30 à 3 h 30 ou jusqu''à ce qu''une fourchette enfoncée dans la viande glisse facilement – ​​elle doit être bien tendre. Commencez à vérifier après 2 heures – il ne devrait y avoir aucune résistance lorsque vous retirez la fourchette de la viande. Vous pouvez également utiliser une brochette pour faire le test – assurez-vous de l’enfoncer dans la partie la plus épaisse de la viande.","Une fois que le bœuf est tendre, éteignez le feu. Soit laissez-la reposer dans la liqueur de cuisson si vous n''êtes pas prêt à manger (elle peut rester ainsi pendant jusqu''à une heure), soit utilisez deux fourchettes pour soulever la viande, laissez l''eau s''écouler, puis posez-la sur une planche. Conservez la liqueur si vous prévoyez de réchauffer ou de congeler le bœuf salé. Couvrir légèrement de papier d''aluminium et laisser reposer 10 à 15 minutes. Pour servir, coupez la viande en tranches épaisses dans le sens inverse des fibres, sinon elle s''effritera. Servir chaud ou froid. Les restes se conservent au réfrigérateur pendant trois jours et au congélateur jusqu''à six semaines. Avant de le congeler, il est préférable de le trancher et de l’envelopper d’abord dans du papier sulfurisé, puis dans du papier d’aluminium. Assurez-vous de congeler également la marmite de liqueur de cuisson. Lorsque vous voulez le manger, décongelez-le puis mettez-le (avec les tranches disposées en forme de poitrine entière) dans un plat allant au four avec la liqueur décongelée. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et réchauffer à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 pendant 20 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:05:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10323,6913,'fr','Gigot d''agneau glacé à l''érable et au piment','Préparez un délicieux glaçage à l''érable et au piment pour badigeonner un gigot d''agneau, prêt à cuire au barbecue – un excellent choix lorsque vous n''avez pas le temps de mariner.','["2,5 kg de gigot d''agneau en papillon (demandez à votre boucher de le faire)","1 bouquet de romarin coupé en tronçons de 2 cm","100 ml de sirop d''érable","50 g de moutarde de Dijon","2 cuillères à soupe d''extrait de levure","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","3 piments verts moyens, tranchés"]','["Posez le gigot d''agneau en forme de papillon sur une planche et, à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, percez environ 20 trous sur tout le côté peau. Enfoncez profondément les brins de romarin dans les trous, puis assaisonnez le tout.","Pour faire le glaçage, versez tous les ingrédients dans une petite casserole, en réservant quelques tranches de piments et portez à ébullition. Remuer pour combiner, puis retirer du feu et réserver. Allumez le barbecue. C’est prêt lorsque les braises sont cendrées et que vous pouvez tenir votre main à 5 cm au-dessus du gril pendant au moins 5 secondes.","Posez l''agneau côté peau sur le gril et laissez cuire 10 minutes. Retournez à l''aide de pinces et laissez cuire encore 10 min. Répétez cette opération encore deux fois pendant 5 minutes de chaque côté pour que l''agneau cuise pendant 30 minutes au total. Badigeonnez de glaçage, retournez à nouveau l''agneau et continuez à arroser pendant encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit brun foncé et collant. Retirer sur une planche, couvrir légèrement et laisser reposer 20 minutes. Couper en fines tranches pour servir, puis répartir sur les piments tranchés réservés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10324,4515,'fr','Burgers de bœuf de niveau supérieur','Cet été, offrez-vous nos ultimes hamburgers au bœuf et nos petits pains faits maison. Ils en valent bien la peine et sont parfaits pour un week-end divertissant.','["250 g de farine blanche nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","20 g de sucre en poudre doré","5g de levure sèche à action rapide","150 ml de lait","1 œuf battu","50 g de beurre ramolli","graines de sésame, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)","600 g de steak de paleron vieilli à sec, coupé en gros morceaux","garnitures de votre choix, comme du fromage, des oignons, des tomates ou de la laitue","3 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","2 cuillères à soupe de ketchup ou de sriracha (ou utilisez 1 cuillère à soupe de chacun)","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde américaine","1 petit cornichon, finement haché, et un peu pour servir","grosse pincée de granules d''ail"]','["Pour faire vos propres petits pains, versez la farine, le sucre, la levure et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans le bol du batteur sur socle équipé d''une palette. Avec le moteur tournant à vitesse moyenne, ajoutez progressivement le lait, puis la moitié de l''œuf. Laisser mélanger quelques minutes, puis ajouter le beurre petit à petit jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit élastique et brillante – environ 5 minutes. Vous pouvez également le faire dans un bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique.","Divisez la pâte en quatre et roulez chaque morceau en rond sur une surface légèrement farinée. Disposer bien espacés sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier sulfurisé. Appuyez doucement pour les étaler un peu et laissez-les dans un endroit tiède pendant 2 heures, ou au réfrigérateur toute la nuit, jusqu''à ce qu''elles doublent de volume.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Badigeonner les petits pains du reste d''œuf et parsemer de graines de sésame, le cas échéant. Cuire au four pendant 13 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés. Laisser refroidir. Peut être préparé jusqu''à la veille.","Pour la sauce, mélanger tous les ingrédients et réserver. Peut être préparée jusqu''à la veille et conservée au frais.","Pour préparer les hamburgers, refroidissez le steak de paleron au congélateur à côté de la lame et, si cela convient, du bol d''un robot culinaire pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la viande soit ferme mais pas congelée. En travaillant rapidement, versez la moitié du bœuf réfrigéré dans le robot culinaire et mélangez huit à dix fois jusqu''à ce que la viande soit hachée, en prenant soin de ne pas trop la travailler. Versez le hachis sur un plateau et répétez avec le steak restant, puis mélangez les deux lots avec ½ cuillère à café de sel. Divisez en quatre portions et formez délicatement chacune d''elles en une galette lâche un peu plus large que les petits pains. Ne le surchargez pas.","Faites cuire les burgers dès que possible après leur formage. Mettez une grande poêle à frire à fond épais sur feu moyen. Divisez les petits pains et les toasts, côté coupé vers le bas, dans la poêle (vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots). Retirer dans une assiette, puis saisir les burgers en les pressant avec une spatule pendant la cuisson, pendant 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté pour une cuisson mi-saignante ou 6-7 minutes pour une cuisson moyenne. Garnir de fromage, si vous le souhaitez, après les avoir retournés. Lorsque les burgers sont cuits, assemblez selon vos préférences avec les petits pains, les garnitures de votre choix et la sauce burger."]','2026-01-11 00:05:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10325,6917,'fr','Chips frites à l''air libre','Tirez le meilleur parti d’une friteuse à air avec cette recette de chips super croustillantes. Ils sont simples à préparer et la friture à l’air signifie que vous utiliserez moins d’huile que la friture, c’est donc une alternative plus saine.','["4-5 grosses pommes de terre, environ 1 kg","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou d''olive"]','["Pour obtenir des chips droites et nettes, épluchez les pommes de terre et coupez tous les bords arrondis pour qu''elles deviennent des blocs rectangulaires. Coupez les blocs en bâtonnets : ils doivent se situer quelque part entre les frites et les chips épaisses, car s''ils étaient trop fins, ils pourraient se casser ; trop épais et ils ne cuiront pas bien (si vous le souhaitez, conservez les chutes pour faire de la purée ou ajoutez-les aux soupes). Vous pouvez également couper les pommes de terre non pelées en chips sans les couper, si la propreté ne vous dérange pas. Rincez les chips et séchez-les avec un torchon propre.","Versez les chips au fond d''une friteuse à air (la partie avec la palette), ajoutez l''huile et jetez les chips dans l''huile pour qu''elles soient uniformément enrobées. Programmez la friteuse pour cuire 30 minutes à l''aide de la palette. Passé ce temps, vérifiez que les chips sont tendres et bien cuites. Si ce n''est pas le cas, laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Assaisonnez bien."]','2026-01-11 00:05:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10326,3986,'fr','Saumon au pastrami','Servez ce saumon façon gravadlax le matin de Noël avec des bagels ou pour des canapés festifs. Il est inspiré d''un petit-déjeuner de charcuterie new-yorkais','["800 g de saumon (le plus frais possible)","250 g de gros sel marin","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de carvi","1 cuillère à soupe de grains de poivre noir","1 feuille de laurier","1 cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","½ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse noire","fromage à pâte molle, pain de seigle ou bagels, cornichons à l''aneth et aneth haché"]','["Trois jours avant de servir le saumon, déposez-le, peau vers le bas, dans un plat à rebords. Mélangez le sel et le sucre, puis réservez.","Faites revenir les graines de coriandre, la coriandre moulue, les graines de carvi et les grains de poivre dans une petite poêle sèche à feu moyen pendant 2-3 minutes. Versez-le dans un moulin à épices ou un petit robot culinaire avec la baie et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit finement moulu. Incorporer le mélange d''épices au mélange de sel et de sucre. Tapotez le mélange de sel épicé partout et autour du saumon pour qu''il soit bien emballé sur la chair. Enveloppez-le hermétiquement dans un film alimentaire, puis placez une assiette ou une planche et quelque chose de lourd (comme quelques boîtes de conserve) dessus pour alourdir le poisson. Mettre au frais 48h.","Faites chauffer le paprika, le poivre de Cayenne et la mélasse noire dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''ils se détachent, puis retirez du feu et laissez refroidir légèrement jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste chauds. Enlevez l''excès de sel du saumon et rincez le poisson sous l''eau froide courante. Séchez avec du papier absorbant, puis transférez dans un plat propre. Badigeonner avec le mélange de mélasse chaud jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien enrobé (vous devrez peut-être badigeonner généreusement le poisson plusieurs fois avant que l''enrobage ne recouvre bien le poisson), puis envelopper dans une nouvelle feuille de film alimentaire. Réfrigérer encore 24 heures.","Au moment de servir, déposez le saumon sur une planche et tranchez-le finement avec un couteau bien aiguisé, en évitant la couche de peau au fond. Servir avec du fromage à pâte molle, du pain de seigle ou des bagels, des cornichons et de l''aneth haché pour que chacun puisse se servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10327,6919,'fr','Toasts fondants aux galettes','Savourez ces toasts fondants pour un repas réconfortant du vendredi soir. Ils sont parfaits lorsque vous n’arrivez pas à choisir entre un burger de bœuf juteux ou un toastie au fromage fondu…','["3 cuillères à soupe de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, finement tranché","200 g de bœuf haché","½ cuillère à café de granulés d''ail","2 cuillères à café de sauce Worcestershire","4 tranches de pain bloomer ou de pain blanc","100 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","100 g de fromage suisse râpé","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre et la moitié de l''huile dans une grande poêle à fond épais à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon avec une pincée de sel pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et collant.","Versez le hachis dans un bol avec les granules d''ail, la sauce Worcestershire et un peu d''assaisonnement, et mélangez avec vos mains – mélangez jusqu''à ce que le hachis ait une texture fine. Divisez-les en deux boules, puis aplatissez-les en galettes, en gardant à l''esprit la forme du pain (vous souhaiterez peut-être les rendre plus oblongues si vous utilisez un pain bloomer).","Grattez les oignons caramélisés sur une assiette et faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle à feu vif. Faites frire les galettes de burger en les pressant avec le dos d''une spatule pendant 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et bien cuites. Transférer dans une assiette en grattant les morceaux de la poêle par-dessus.","Réduisez le feu à moyen-doux et faites fondre ½ cuillère à soupe de beurre dans la poêle en le faisant tourner autour de la base. Faites frire les quatre tranches de pain d''un côté, en les alourdissant avec une presse-grill ou en appuyant avec le dos de la spatule pour qu''elles soient uniformément dorées et croustillantes. Faites cela en deux fois, en ajoutant encore ½ cuillère à soupe de beurre pour les deux dernières tranches. Mélangez les deux fromages dans un bol.","Disposez deux tranches de pain, côté grillé vers le haut, sur une planche et étalez-les sur la moutarde. Ajouter la moitié du fromage et répartir uniformément sur les oignons. Garnir avec les hamburgers, puis parsemer du reste du fromage. Garnir avec les tranches de pain restantes, côté grillé vers le bas, de sorte que les côtés non grillés soient à l''extérieur des sandwichs. Bien appuyer pour sceller. Faites chauffer la majeure partie du beurre restant dans la poêle et faites frire les sandwichs pendant 2-3 minutes, en les pressant tout le temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et grillés. Retournez délicatement et faites frire à nouveau, en ajoutant le reste de beurre dans la poêle autour des toasts. Cuire jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu et suintant et que le pain soit doré et croustillant des deux côtés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10328,4034,'fr','Chou-fleur de buffle','Préparez du « chou-fleur de buffle » pour une version végétarienne du classique américain épicé. Servi avec une trempette ranch, c''est un excellent régal à partager le vendredi soir.','["1 cuillère à soupe de paprika doux fumé","1⁄2 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de poudre d''ail","100 g de farine nature","200 ml de babeurre ou de kéfir","1 tête de chou-fleur (500 g), coupée en bouquets","80 g de sauce piquante","1½ cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","branches de céleri, pour servir","100 g de yaourt grec","3 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","2 cuillères à soupe de ciboulette hachée","1-2 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez le paprika, le cumin, la poudre d''ail, la farine et ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol. Faites un puits au centre et incorporez le babeurre en fouettant. Ajoutez le chou-fleur et mélangez pour enrober. Étalez le chou-fleur sur la plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire pendant 20 à 25 minutes, en le retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant sur les bords.","Faites chauffer la sauce piquante, le sirop d''érable et le beurre dans une petite poêle à feu doux pendant 2-3 minutes. Badigeonnez généreusement le chou-fleur et remettez au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes.","Pour la trempette ranch, mélangez le yaourt, la mayonnaise, la ciboulette, le lait et une pincée de sel dans un bol. Servir avec le chou-fleur et quelques branches de céleri pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:05:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10329,6921,'fr','Crêpes farcies au brie et bacon croustillant','Savourez nos crêpes moelleuses à l''américaine avec une garniture au fromage suintante et une garniture au bacon croustillant. Ils sont parfaits pour le Pancake Day ou un brunch le week-end','["10 tranches de bacon fumé","300 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","pincée de sucre en poudre","2 œufs moyens, légèrement battus","300 ml de lait demi-écrémé","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","25 g de beurre salé, plus un peu pour servir","150 g de brie tranché finement","50 g de cheddar râpé"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif et faire griller le bacon pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant, en le retournant à mi-cuisson. Réserver et réserver au chaud. Versez la farine, la levure chimique, le sucre et une grosse pincée de sel dans un grand bol, puis fouettez progressivement les œufs et le lait jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et épaisse.","Faites chauffer un peu d''huile et une petite noix de beurre dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils grésillent. Versez 1 cuillère à soupe de pâte et étalez-la sur un cercle grossier de 10 cm avec le dos de la cuillère. Garnir de quelques tranches de brie, d’une pincée de cheddar râpé et de 1½ cuillère à soupe supplémentaire de pâte à crêpes – la pâte doit recouvrir tout le fromage. Ne vous inquiétez pas si la pâte commence à s''étaler : vous pouvez la façonner en repoussant le fromage vers le centre à l''aide d''une spatule. Cuire pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que des bulles commencent à se former à la surface, puis retourner délicatement et cuire encore 2 minutes. Gardez au chaud tout en répétant l''opération avec le reste de l''huile, du beurre, de la pâte et du fromage. Servir garni d''un peu de beurre salé et de bacon croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:05:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10330,4945,'fr','Gelée de pomme de crabe','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis une gelée de pomme sauvage faite maison – préparez des bocaux et dégustez-la avec de la viande et du gibier, ou dans des garnitures de gâteaux.','["1½ kg de pommettes","1 citron, le zeste paré et la moitié du jus","environ 450 g de sucre blanc en poudre ou semoule","Sac de gelée"]','["Lavez et égouttez les fruits, puis coupez les pommes en deux et mettez-les dans une grande casserole à fond épais avec une quantité égale d''eau et le zeste de citron épluché. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes soient pulpeuses. Remuez de temps en temps avec le dos d''une cuillère en bois pour aider à décomposer les fruits.","Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir un peu. Placez la pulpe du fruit dans un sac de gelée et laissez le jus s''égoutter dans un grand bol (cela prendra plusieurs heures, il est donc idéal de le faire toute la nuit). Si vous forcez le fruit à passer, cela créera une gelée trouble.","Mettez deux petites soucoupes stérilisées au congélateur, vous les utiliserez pour tester le point de prise de la confiture. Vous pouvez stériliser les soucoupes en les lavant dans un liquide chaud savonneux, en les rinçant et en les mettant au four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4 pendant 5 minutes. Retirer délicatement et laisser refroidir.","Pesez le liquide fruité et remettez-le dans une grande casserole. Pesez les trois quarts de sucre par rapport à votre quantité totale de liquide (par exemple, si vous avez 400 g de liquide, ajoutez 300 g de sucre).","Ajoutez le sucre au jus avec le jus de citron et remuez à feu moyen jusqu''à dissolution complète. Augmentez le feu et portez les fruits à ébullition. Remuer de temps en temps et laisser bouillir fortement pendant environ 8 minutes, en éliminant toute écume avec une cuillère. Si vous utilisez un thermomètre, vous cherchez à atteindre 105°C. Sinon, vérifiez le point de prise du liquide au bout de 8 minutes en sortant une soucoupe du congélateur et en ajoutant une cuillère à café de liquide dans l''assiette. Laissez reposer une minute, puis passez votre doigt dans le liquide. Si elle commence à se froisser, la gelée est prête. Sinon, remettez à ébullition et réessayez après une minute supplémentaire.","Verser dans des bocaux stérilisés et laisser refroidir complètement. Conserver dans un endroit frais et sombre."]','2026-01-11 00:05:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10331,6923,'fr','Beignets','Savourez ces beignets croustillants et dorés à la Nouvelle-Orléans. Fabriqués avec du lait concentré, ils sont meilleurs servis chauds avec un généreux saupoudrage de sucre glace.','["4 g de levure sèche à action rapide","250 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","25g de sucre en poudre","125 g de lait concentré","1 œuf moyen","25 g de beurre doux, fondu","1,5 l d''huile de colza ou végétale, pour le bol et la friture","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Mélangez la levure, la farine, le sucre et 1 cuillère à café de sel marin dans le bol du batteur sur socle. Fouettez ensemble le lait concentré et l''œuf et versez-les dans le bol avec le beurre fondu et 60 ml d''eau juste bouillie. Pétrir à vitesse moyenne pendant 2 minutes au batteur sur socle, ou pendant 5 minutes sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné, jusqu''à consistance lisse. Formez une boule avec la pâte et mettez-la dans un grand bol légèrement huilé. Couvrir d''un torchon humide et réfrigérer pendant 8 à 24 heures.","Abaisser la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné en un rectangle d''environ 20 x 25 cm et environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Coupez en carrés de 20 x 5 cm.","Versez l''huile dans une marmite profonde ou une casserole, de sorte qu''elle ne soit pas plus profonde qu''un tiers. Ou utilisez une friteuse. Chauffer l''huile à 175°C. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier absorbant. Faites frire les beignets par lots pendant 3 minutes, en les retournant de temps en temps avec des pinces, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient gonflés et dorés. Soulevez les beignets sur le papier pour les égoutter, puis placez-les sur une grille, saupoudrez généreusement de sucre glace et servez chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:05:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10332,6925,'fr','Steak frit au poulet','Essayez un plat classique du Deep South américain qui fusionne un steak avec du poulet frit du sud. Le steak est enrobé d''un mélange d''épices et frit pour un dîner gourmand','["2 steaks de queue de filet (environ 200 g chacun) ou 2 steaks de surlonge, parés de gras","2 oeufs, battus","1⁄2 cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","légumes verts et épis de maïs cuits à la vapeur, pour servir (facultatif)","huile végétale, pour la friture","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de poudre d''ail","1 cuillère à café de thym séché","1⁄2 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1⁄2 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1⁄2 cuillère à café de poivre noir","1 cuillère à soupe de farine","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","275 ml de lait","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym","un filet de jus de citron"]','["Mettez les steaks sur une planche et écrasez-les avec un rouleau à pâtisserie jusqu''à environ la moitié de leur épaisseur d''origine. Mélangez les œufs avec le poivre de Cayenne dans un bol. Mélangez les ingrédients du mélange d''épices avec une grosse pincée de sel dans un plat peu profond séparé.","Trempez les steaks dans l''œuf, puis dans le mélange d''épices en les retournant pour les enrober. Versez l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive jusqu''à ce que le fond de la poêle soit recouvert. Faites frire les steaks à feu vif pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants, puis retournez-les et faites-les frire encore 2 minutes. Transférer dans une assiette et réserver au chaud.","Si vous préparez la sauce, jetez toute l''huile de la poêle sauf 1 cuillère à soupe et incorporez la farine et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée. Émietter dans le cube de bouillon. Versez lentement le lait en fouettant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit lisse et complètement incorporé. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 4 à 5 minutes. Saison. Ajoutez le thym et beaucoup de poivre noir, puis pressez le jus de citron au goût. Servir les steaks avec la sauce, ainsi que les légumes verts et le maïs, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10333,6929,'fr','Steak au fromage de Philadelphie','Empilez le steak, l''oignon, les poivrons, le fromage, le ketchup et la moutarde en rouleaux pour préparer ces cheesesteaks Philly à l''américaine. Juste la nourriture pour une soirée cinéma à','["2 x 150 g de faux-filet","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 oignon, tranché","1 poivron rouge, tranché","1 poivron vert, tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","8 tranches de fromage","50 g de mozzarella râpée","4 sous-rouleaux blancs doux","Moutarde américaine et ketchup, pour servir"]','["Coupez et jetez le long morceau de graisse qui coule sur le côté des steaks. Coupez chaque steak en deux et disposez-le sur une plaque allant au four, puis transférez au congélateur et congelez pendant 40 minutes.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à fond épais ou une cocotte à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''oignon et les poivrons avec une bonne pincée de sel et faites revenir pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient dorés et collants. Ajoutez le vinaigre et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Assaisonner au goût.","À l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, tranchez le steak le plus finement possible et empilez les tranches en quatre portions. Faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit presque fumante. Mettez une portion de tranches de steak dans la poêle en tas qui fait à peu près la longueur de vos petits pains. Faire revenir 3 minutes à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''une partie du steak soit bien cuite, avec des morceaux roses restants. Empilez dessus un quart du mélange d''oignons, ainsi qu''un quart de chacune des tranches de fromage et de la mozzarella. Continuez à cuire sans être dérangé à feu moyen pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la viande soit brune et croustillante sur les bords et que les fromages soient fondus. Ouvrez l''un des rouleaux et versez-y délicatement le mélange de viande et de fromage. Répétez avec le reste de la viande, les oignons, le fromage et les petits pains."]','2026-01-11 00:05:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10334,6931,'fr','Tarte à la citrouille','Remplissez un fond de tarte en pâte brisée sucrée avec de la courge légèrement épicée pour en faire une friandise traditionnelle.','["750 g de citrouille ou de courge musquée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en morceaux","350 g de pâte brisée sucrée","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","140 g de sucre en poudre","½ cuillère à café de sel","½ cuillère à café de muscade fraîche, râpée","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","2 oeufs, battus","25 g de beurre fondu","175 ml de lait","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Mettez le potiron dans une grande casserole, couvrez d''eau et portez à ébullition. Couvrir avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter la citrouille; laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Étalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné et tapissez-la d''un moule à tarte à fond amovible de 22 cm. Mettre au frais 15 min. Tapisser la pâte de papier sulfurisé et de billes de cuisson, puis enfourner pendant 15 minutes. Retirez les haricots et le papier et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la base soit dorée pâle et biscuitée. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Augmentez le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Poussez la citrouille refroidie à travers un tamis dans un grand bol. Dans un autre bol, mélanger le sucre, le sel, la muscade et la moitié de la cannelle. Incorporer les œufs battus, le beurre fondu et le lait, puis ajouter à la purée de potiron et mélanger. Verser dans le fond de tarte et cuire 10 min, puis baisser la température à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Poursuivre la cuisson 35-40 min jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit juste prise.","Laissez refroidir, puis démoulez la tarte. Mélangez le reste de cannelle avec le sucre glace et saupoudrez-en la tarte. Servir frais."]','2026-01-11 00:05:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10335,6933,'fr','Poulet frit de niveau supérieur','Choisissez des cuisses désossées pour préparer le poulet frit ultime. Pour l''enrobage, nous avons mis au point une méthode qui permet d''obtenir la finition la plus croustillante jamais vue.','["8 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","2 cuillères à soupe de paprika","2 cuillères à café de grains d''ail","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","500 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre ou de vin blanc","1 oeuf","100 g de farines autolevantes","100g de farine de maïs","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma"]','["Pour préparer le mélange d''épices, mélangez tous les ingrédients. Fouettez le lait avec le vinaigre, l''œuf, ½ cuillère à café de sel et 1 cuillère à soupe de mélange d''épices dans un bol ou un récipient en plastique profond pour faire la marinade au babeurre. Ouvrez les cuisses de poulet et placez-les entre deux morceaux de papier sulfurisé, puis aplatissez-les à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Transférer dans la marinade, puis couvrir et réfrigérer pendant 4 heures ou toute la nuit.","Préparez l''enrobage en combinant les farines et le curcuma avec la majeure partie du mélange d''épices restant (en réservant 1 cuillère à café) et une généreuse pincée de sel. Égouttez les cuisses de poulet en réservant la marinade. Une à une, draguez chaque cuisse dans la farine, puis trempez-la dans la marinade réservée, puis draguez à nouveau dans la farine en appuyant le plus possible pour bien l''enrober. Transférer les cuisses enrobées dans une grande assiette.","Faites chauffer 10 cm d''huile dans une casserole peu profonde ou une friteuse jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne 175°C. Abaissez deux ou trois cuisses à la fois et faites frire sans les déranger pendant 3 minutes, en vous assurant que la température ne descende pas en dessous de 160°C (elle doit rester à environ 170°C). Retournez les cuisses, puis faites-les frire encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient profondément dorées et croustillantes des deux côtés. Retirez le poulet et transférez-le sur une plaque recouverte de papier absorbant pour l''égoutter, puis placez-le sur une grille et gardez-le au chaud à four doux pendant que vous faites frire le reste des cuisses.","Lorsque tout le poulet est frit, mélangez le mélange d''épices réservé avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sel marin feuilleté et saupoudrez sur le poulet pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10336,6935,'fr','Cheeseburger aux nachos','Empilez des hamburgers avec du fromage, du guacamole, du chipotle, de la salsa et des nachos pour une touche piquante et piquante sur un cheeseburger. Les nachos donnent du croquant supplémentaire','["2 burgers de boeuf","2 tranches de cheddar","2 pains burger aux graines de sésame","2 cuillères à soupe de guacamole","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise chipotle ou chili","2 cuillères à soupe de salsa","une petite poignée de nachos salés","½ petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles arrachées"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen-vif. Placez les hamburgers sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les griller pendant 5 à 8 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits. Pendant la dernière minute, garnissez les burgers de tranches de fromage et faites-les griller jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus. Faire griller légèrement les pains à burger. Répartir le guacamole, les hamburgers, la mayonnaise chipotle ou chili, la salsa et les nachos, brisés, entre chaque petit pain. Terminez par une pincée de coriandre déchirée."]','2026-01-11 00:05:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10337,6937,'fr','Trempette américaine à l''oignon brûlé','Une délicieuse trempette végétarienne à base de mayonnaise et de crème sure, idéale pour les légumes crus ou le pain pitta grillé','["1 oignon","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","150 ml de crème sure","50 g de mayonnaise","crudités, pour servir"]','["Tranchez 1 oignon et mélangez-le avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive. Étalez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites griller à feu vif pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien carbonisée, puis laissez refroidir. Hachez et mélangez avec 150 ml de crème sure et 50 g de mayonnaise. Bien assaisonner et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Servir avec des légumes crus, en trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:05:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10338,6939,'fr','tarte aux pacanes et aux pépites de chocolat','Une gourmandise au chocolat et aux noix de pécan avec une pâte au beurre et une garniture gluante dans laquelle tout le monde peut se plonger','["300 g de farine nature","75 g de beurre salé coupé en cubes","100g de fromage frais","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","150g de beurre salé","200 ml de sirop d''érable","250 g de sucre mou roux clair","100 g de cassonade foncée","4 œufs, battus","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","400 g de noix de pécan finement hachées","200 g de pépites de chocolat noir ou une barre hachées"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la pâte. Versez les ingrédients dans un robot culinaire avec 1/4 cuillère à café de sel. Mélangez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Versez 2 à 3 cuillères à café d''eau froide dans l''entonnoir pendant que la lame tourne – le mélange devrait commencer à s''agglutiner. Versez sur un plan de travail et rassemblez en pétrissant brièvement pour former une boule. Formez un disque, enveloppez-le dans du film alimentaire et réservez au frais au moins 20 minutes. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et laissez-la à température ambiante pendant 5 minutes pour qu''elle ramollisse. Farinez le plan de travail, puis déballez la pâte et étalez-la en un cercle de l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Utilisez la pâte pour tapisser un moule rond cannelé profond de 23 cm – le mien mesurait environ 3 cm de profondeur. Pressez la pâte dans les coins et sur les côtés en vous assurant qu''il n''y a pas d''espace. Laisser dépasser 1 cm de pâte (conserver quelques chutes de pâte pour plus tard). Tapisser de papier sulfurisé (le froisser d''abord pour le rendre plus souple) et remplir de fèves au four. Cuire à blanc pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les côtés soient pris, puis retirer le papier sulfurisé et les haricots et remettre au four pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Coupez la pâte de manière à ce qu''elle affleure le dessus du moule – un petit couteau dentelé est préférable pour cela. S''il y a des fissures, colmatez-les avec les chutes de pâte.","Pendant ce temps, pesez le beurre, le sirop et les sucres dans une casserole et ajoutez 1/4 cuillère à café de sel. Chauffer jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu et le sucre dissous, en remuant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir 10 minutes. Réduire le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.","Battez les œufs dans un bol. Ajouter le mélange de sirop, la vanille et les pacanes et mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez la moitié du mélange dans le fond de tarte, répartissez sur la moitié des pépites de chocolat, puis recouvrez avec le reste de la garniture et les pépites de chocolat. Cuire au four sur la grille du milieu pendant 50 à 55 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir, puis réfrigérer au moins 2 heures avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10339,6941,'fr','Mélange de barbecue texan','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une fois que vous aurez essayé de fumer et de cuire lentement votre poulet, vous serez totalement converti. La saumure sèche assaisonne la viande jusqu''aux os et la garde succulente pendant la cuisson','["1 gros poulet","5 côtes de bœuf (environ 3 kg), côtes séparées","2 kg d''épaule de porc désossée, sans la couenne","Sauce barbecue texane","oignons blancs doux tranchés et cornichons tranchés, pour servir","8 cuillères à soupe de sel de mer feuilleté de bonne qualité","2 cuillères à café de graines de fenouil","1 cuillère à soupe de grains de poivre noir","3 feuilles de laurier","2 cuillères à café de poivre de Cayenne","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à café de sel d''ail","150 g de sucre roux clair et mou","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","copeaux de bois (facultatif)"]','["Vous devrez saumurer la viande au moins 24 heures avant votre barbecue. Tout d’abord, spatchockez le poulet. Retournez le poulet de manière à ce que la colonne vertébrale soit face à vous. Utilisez une solide paire de ciseaux de cuisine ou de volaille pour couper chaque côté de la colonne vertébrale, puis jetez-la. Retournez le poulet et appuyez fermement sur le sternum pour aplatir l''oiseau. Faites quelques entailles dans chaque articulation de la jambe. (Regardez une vidéo montrant comment spatchcock un poulet sur bbcgoodfood.com/videos/spatchcock.)","Mettez chaque morceau de viande dans un grand sac séparé et refermable. Saupoudrez 1 cuillère à soupe de sel dans chaque sac et massez-la sur toute la viande. Pressez l''air des sacs, fermez hermétiquement et mettez au réfrigérateur pendant 24 heures.","Versez le reste du sel, les graines de fenouil et les grains de poivre dans un mortier. Déchirez la baie en petits morceaux et ajoutez-la également. Écrasez les ingrédients avec le pilon jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement moulus. Ajouter le poivre de Cayenne, le paprika, le sel d''ail et les sucres et bien mélanger. Retirez la viande des sacs et séchez-la avec du papier absorbant. Couvrez chaque coupure avec le frottement, en vous assurant d''entrer dans tous les recoins. Remettez au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 1 à 2 heures pendant que vous préparez le barbecue, ou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Vous devrez démarrer le barbecue 7 à 8 heures avant de vouloir manger. Faites chauffer les charbons et laissez-les jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cendrés. Ajoutez vos copeaux de bois, si vous en utilisez. Lorsque les flammes se sont éteintes et qu''il vous reste des cendres fumées, poussez les braises et les copeaux de bois d''un côté de la fosse du barbecue, puis replacez le gril et ajoutez le bœuf et le porc, en les plaçant au-dessus du côté vide de la fosse – cela garantira que la viande fume mais ne brûle pas. Baissez le couvercle et faites cuire la viande pendant 30 à 40 minutes, en la retournant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''une croûte sombre se forme autour de la viande. N''ayez pas peur d''aller assez loin, la croûte doit être presque noire (mais caramélisée plutôt que brûlée). Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1.","Transférez la viande dans des plats à rôtir, enveloppez-la bien dans du papier d''aluminium et faites cuire au four pendant 5 à 6 heures jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit vraiment tendre.","Lorsqu''il reste 1 h à 1 h 30 à la viande, réchauffez le barbecue et attendez que les braises deviennent cendrées avant d''ajouter d''autres copeaux de bois. Lorsque les flammes se sont éteintes, poussez d''un côté comme avant. Mettez le poulet sur le BBQ, côté os vers le bas, au-dessus du côté vide de la fosse. Cuire 20 à 25 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit – vérifiez en perçant une jambe pour voir si le jus est clair, ou utilisez un thermomètre à viande pour vérifier que la température interne a atteint 70 °C. Envelopper hermétiquement dans du papier d''aluminium et laisser reposer.","Au bout de 5 à 6 heures, le bœuf et le porc devraient être bien tendres. Sortir du four et laisser reposer 15 min. Si vous avez préparé une sauce barbecue (voir la recette de la sauce barbecue Texas ici), badigeonnez-en la viande pour une finition brillante. Retirez toute ficelle du porc et effilochez la viande. Coupez le poulet en portions et servez le tout sur une grande assiette avec les oignons doux émincés, les cornichons et les accompagnements."]','2026-01-11 00:05:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10340,6943,'fr','Dîner sloppy joes','Un incontournable américain simple dans lequel toute la famille peut se retrouver. Ajoutez une pincée de chipotle épicé ou de sauce barbecue fumée pour apporter un peu de piquant','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, finement haché","2 petits poivrons rouges ou jaunes, hachés finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","400 g de bœuf haché","2 boîtes de 400 ml de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce barbecue chipotle ou fumée","4 tranches de fromage","6 pains à burger","oignons croustillants, pour servir","laitue iceberg, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis faites revenir l''oignon, le poivron et l''ail pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez le hachis en le brisant avec une cuillère en bois au fur et à mesure et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré. Versez les tomates et le chipotle, ou la sauce barbecue, et ajoutez un peu d''assaisonnement. Laisser mijoter 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe.","Mettez les tranches de fromage sur le hachis et couvrez avec un couvercle pendant 2 minutes pour le laisser fondre dans la sauce. Empilez-les dans les petits pains avec les oignons croustillants et la laitue à côté pour récupérer le surplus de sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:05:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10341,6945,'fr','Pain de maïs','Vous pouvez préparer ce pain de maïs à l''avance pour un brunch gratuit à déguster en quelques minutes. Garnir d''œufs à la diable et d''avocat ou de chili con carne pour un déjeuner copieux','["50 g de beurre légèrement salé fondu, un peu pour graisser","250 g de polenta fine ou de semoule de maïs, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Boîte de 325 g de maïs doux égoutté","250 ml de babeurre","4 gros œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et badigeonner un moule à cake de 900 g de beurre fondu, puis saupoudrer de polenta et secouer l''excédent. Versez 175 g de maïs doux dans un robot culinaire avec le reste des ingrédients et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis retirez la lame et incorporez la majeure partie du maïs doux restant.","Versez la pâte dans le moule, répartissez le reste de maïs doux et faites cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit levée et dorée. Insérez une brochette au centre – elle doit ressortir avec quelques miettes humides, mais le mélange ne doit pas être mouillé. Remettez au four encore 5 à 10 minutes si nécessaire, puis testez à nouveau.","Refroidissez le pain dans son moule pendant 10 minutes, puis transférez-le sur une grille pour qu''il refroidisse. Se conserve, enveloppé dans un film alimentaire, jusqu''à 3 jours, ou se congèle en tranches jusqu''à 2 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:05:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10342,6947,'fr','Pâte à biscuits non cuite, sans danger pour la consommation','Qui n’aime pas la pâte à biscuits et celle-ci ne prend que quelques minutes à préparer. Conservez-en un lot au réfrigérateur, mangez-le à la cuillère, servez-le avec de la glace, ou moulez-le, façonnez-le et colorez-le avec un colorant alimentaire comme un Play-Doh comestible !','["100 g de beurre ramolli à température ambiante","175 g de cassonade molle","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","140 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de lait entier"]','["Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble, de préférence au batteur. Ajoutez la vanille, 1/2 cuillère à café de sel et la farine, puis mélangez jusqu''à obtenir de la chapelure. Continuez à mélanger pendant que vous ajoutez le lait et vous avez terminé – une pâte à biscuits crue délicieuse et sûre. Si ce n’est pas assez étonnant comme ça, alors devenez fou avec ces arômes :","Pâte au caramel salé : faites tourner 1 cuillère à soupe de dulce de leche dans la pâte, plus 1/2 cuillère à café de sel et une poignée de pépites de chocolat noir.","Pâte à biscuits S''more : ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de Nutella, 2 biscuits digestifs émiettés et quelques mini guimauves.","Pâte aux pommes et à la cannelle : ajoutez quelques petits morceaux de pomme séchée et une pincée de sucre à la cannelle (1 cuillère à café de cannelle mélangée à 1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade molle).","Pâte paradisiaque aux cacahuètes : Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre de cacahuète et une poignée de M&Ms aux cacahuètes."]','2026-01-11 00:05:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10343,6949,'fr','T-bone entièrement américain','Pour un souper spécial, essayez cette coupe américaine classique de surlonge. Le steak a un os en forme de T avec de la viande de chaque côté, parfait pour partager','["700 g de steak T-bone","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ petit paquet de thym","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","50g de beurre"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettez une plaque chauffante allant au four sur feu vif. Assaisonnez le steak des deux côtés, puis frottez les deux côtés avec les gousses d''ail, le thym et l''huile d''olive. Mettez le steak dans la poêle chaude et carbonisez le dessous pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que des lignes de plaque apparaissent. Retournez le steak pour dorer l''autre face, frottez à nouveau le dessus avec le thym, puis déposez le thym et l''ail sur la viande.","Une fois uniformément dorés avec les lignes de la plaque chauffante, mettez le thym et l''ail de côté, tenez le steak avec une paire de pinces pour cuire son côté gras et faites-le fondre pour qu''il soit moelleux plutôt que grumeleux. Cela prendra quelques minutes. Reposez le steak à plat, mettez le thym, l''ail et le beurre dessus et transférez la poêle au four pour terminer la cuisson pendant 4-5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la viande atteigne 62-65°C sur un thermomètre à sonde (ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit cuite à votre goût).","Laissez reposer la viande pendant 5 à 6 minutes. Servir sur une planche ou une grande assiette au milieu de la table."]','2026-01-11 00:05:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10344,6951,'fr','S''mores au chocolat chaud au malt','Essayez une variante des s''mores à la guimauve et au chocolat à l''américaine en remplaçant les crackers traditionnels par des biscuits maltés','["16 biscuits au lait malté","8 carrés de chocolat au lait","8 guimauves (de marque végétarienne, si nécessaire)"]','["Préchauffer le gril à feu vif et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Disposez les 16 laits maltés sur le plateau avec un carré de chocolat au lait sur 8 et une guimauve sur les 8 restants. Grillez jusqu''à ce que les deux soient fondus.","Sandwichez les deux types différents l''un sur l''autre jusqu''à ce qu''ils suintent sur les bords et mangez chauds ou trempés dans un chocolat chaud pour une saveur chocolatée supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:05:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10345,6953,'fr','Salade César au poulet croustillant','Il vous reste du poulet du dîner ? Utilisez-le dans une salade croustillante avec une vinaigrette César crémeuse','["4 cuisses de poulet croustillantes, tranchées (voir Astuce)","125 ml de mayonnaise légère","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce Worcestershire","50 g de parmesan râpé, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","50g croûtons","1 grosse laitue Cos ou 4 Little Gem, coupées en morceaux"]','["Dans un grand bol, mélanger la mayonnaise,\r\njus de citron, sauce Worcestershire,\r\nParmesan râpé et ail, puis assaisonner.\r\nAu moment de manger, ajoutez le poulet\r\ntranches, croûtons et laitue. Bien mélanger et\r\nsaupoudrer de parmesan supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10346,5722,'fr','Salade Cobb avec vinaigrette ranch au babeurre','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Obtenez trois de vos cinq par jour avec cette salade de poulet et de bacon, qui peut être adaptée pour utiliser des restes de dinde et regorge de protéines et de vitamines.','["2 laitues Baby Gem, feuilles séparées","1 avocat, dénoyauté et tranché","2 tomates italiennes, hachées","3 tranches de bacon croustillant cuit","140 g de poitrine de dinde ou de poulet cuit, coupé en bouchées","2 œufs durs, coupés en morceaux","75 ml de babeurre","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise légère","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth haché","½ gousse d''ail, écrasée"]','["Dans un petit bol, fouetter la vinaigrette\r\ningrédients avec un peu de sel.\r\nDisposer les ingrédients de la salade séparément\r\nsur 2 assiettes ou un plateau, et servir avec\r\nle dressing sur le côté."]','2026-01-11 00:05:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10347,6957,'fr','Club de bœuf salé et frites cajun','Un délicieux dîner solo composé d''un sandwich étagé avec des tranches de bœuf, une vinaigrette crémeuse et des frites maison','["1 grosse pomme de terre, coupée en fines chips","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","½ cuillère à café d''assaisonnement cajun","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à café de ciboulette hachée","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","3 tranches de pain blanc ou brun, légèrement grillées","2 radis, tranchés finement","1 bébé ou ½ avocat, tranché","2 tranches de bœuf salé","quelques feuilles de laitue Little Gem"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nPlacer les chips sur une plaque antiadhésive\r\nplaque à pâtisserie, mélanger avec l''huile et le cajun\r\nassaisonner, puis étaler dans un\r\nune seule couche. Mettez au four et\r\ncuire au four, en retournant une fois, pendant 20-25 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Saison.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez la mayonnaise,\r\nciboulette et moutarde dans un petit\r\nbol et assaisonner. Étalez le mélange sur 2 tranches de pain.\r\nCouche 1 tranche à tartiner avec des radis\r\net avocat. Placez l''autre tranche,\r\ncôté tartiné vers le haut, sur le dessus et ajouter\r\nle bœuf salé et la laitue. Haut\r\navec la tranche finale.","Découpé et sécurisé avec un cocktail\r\ndes bâtonnets si vous le souhaitez, puis servez\r\nà côté des frites."]','2026-01-11 00:05:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10348,6495,'fr','Chaudrée de fruits de mer simple','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une soupe épaisse et crémeuse au saumon et à l''aiglefin fumé, un mélange de crustacés et de pommes de terre – un repas copieux.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 gros oignon, haché","100 g de bacon tranché, haché","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","600 ml de bouillon de poisson, préparé à partir d''un cube de bouillon de poisson","225 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux","pincer la masse","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","300 ml de lait","Paquet de 320 g de préparation pour tarte au poisson (saumon, aiglefin et aiglefin fumé)","4 cuillères à soupe de crème liquide","Paquet de 250 g de coquillages mélangés cuits","petit bouquet de persil haché","pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole\r\nfeu moyen, puis ajoutez l''oignon et\r\nbacon. Cuire 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon\r\nest mou et le bacon est cuit. Incorporer\r\nla farine, puis laissez cuire encore 2 min.","Versez le bouillon de poisson et faites monter\r\nà feu doux. Ajoutez les pommes de terre,\r\ncouvrir, puis laisser mijoter 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles pommes de terre sont bien cuites.","Ajouter le macis, le poivre de Cayenne et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement, puis incorporer le lait.","Versez le mélange pour tarte au poisson dans la poêle,\r\nlaisser mijoter doucement pendant 4 minutes. Ajoutez le\r\ncrème et crustacés, puis laisser mijoter\r\npendant 1 minute de plus. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement.\r\nSaupoudrer de persil et servir\r\navec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:05:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10349,9455,'fr','Tarte à la citrouille','Remplissez un fond de tarte en pâte brisée sucrée avec de la courge légèrement épicée pour préparer une friandise américaine traditionnelle.','["750 g de citrouille ou de courge musquée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en morceaux","350 g de pâte brisée sucrée","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","140 g de sucre en poudre","½ cuillère à café de sel","½ cuillère à café de muscade fraîche, râpée","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","2 oeufs, battus","25 g de beurre fondu","175 ml de lait","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace"]','["Mettez le potiron dans une grande casserole, couvrez d''eau et portez à ébullition. Couvrir avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter la citrouille; laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Étalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné et tapissez-la d''un moule à tarte à fond amovible de 22 cm. Mettre au frais 15 min. Tapisser la pâte de papier sulfurisé et de billes de cuisson, puis enfourner pendant 15 minutes. Retirez les haricots et le papier et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la base soit dorée pâle et biscuitée. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Augmentez le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Poussez la citrouille refroidie à travers un tamis dans un grand bol. Dans un autre bol, mélanger le sucre, le sel, la muscade et la moitié de la cannelle. Incorporez les œufs battus, le beurre fondu et le lait, puis ajoutez à la purée de potiron et mélangez. Verser dans le fond de tarte et cuire 10 min, puis baisser la température à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Poursuivre la cuisson 35-40 min jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit juste prise.","Laissez refroidir, puis démoulez la tarte. Mélangez le reste de cannelle avec le sucre glace et saupoudrez-en la tarte. Servir frais."]','2026-01-11 00:05:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10350,6959,'fr','Salade de poulet grillé et épis de maïs','Grillez du maïs doux entier et servez-le avec du poulet épicé au paprika et du Little Gem croustillant pour une salade saine et rapide.','["4 petites poitrines de poulet sans peau","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika","jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 épis de maïs","4 laitues Little Gem, coupées en quartiers dans le sens de la longueur","½ concombre, coupé en dés"]','["Couper les poitrines de poulet en deux\r\ndans le sens de la longueur pour qu''il vous reste\r\n8 lanières de poulet. Mélangez l''ail,\r\npaprika, jus de citron et 1 cuillère à soupe\r\nhuile avec un peu d''assaisonnement et\r\nmélanger avec le poulet. Laisser à\r\nlaisser mariner au moins 15 minutes.","Faites chauffer une poêle et un pinceau\r\navec la moitié de l''huile restante et\r\ncuire le poulet pendant 3-4 minutes chacun\r\ncôté jusqu’à ce qu’il soit bien cuit. Brosser\r\nle reste de l''huile et faire griller le maïs\r\népis, en les retournant pour cuire uniformément, pendant environ\r\n5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement carbonisés. Supprimer\r\net coupez les grains.","Mélangez la laitue et le concombre, dessus\r\navec le maïs et le poulet, et arroser\r\nsur votre choix de tenue vestimentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:05:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10351,6961,'fr','Tarte au citron vert','Ce dessert crémeux sans produits laitiers est naturellement sucré et utilise entièrement des ingrédients crus, avec une croûte de dattes, de noix et de noix de coco et une garniture crémeuse à l''avocat et aux noix de cajou.','["300 g de nobs de cuisine","150 g de beurre fondu","1 boîte de 397 g de lait concentré (nous avons utilisé Nestlé)","3 jaunes d''œufs moyens","le zeste finement râpé et le jus de 4 citrons verts","300 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","zeste de citron vert supplémentaire, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/ventilateur 140°C/gaz 3. Réduisez les biscuits en miettes au robot culinaire (ou mettez-les dans un sac en plastique solide et écrasez-les avec un rouleau à pâtisserie). Mélanger avec le beurre fondu et presser dans le fond et sur les côtés d''un moule à tarte à fond libre de 22 cm. Cuire au four pendant 10 minutes. Retirer et laisser refroidir.","Mettez les jaunes d''œufs dans un grand bol et fouettez pendant une minute avec des batteurs électriques. Ajoutez le lait concentré et fouettez pendant 3 minutes puis ajoutez le zeste et le jus et fouettez à nouveau pendant 3 minutes.\r\nVersez la garniture dans le fond refroidi puis remettez au four pendant 15 minutes. Laisser refroidir puis réfrigérer pendant au moins 3 heures ou toute la nuit si vous le souhaitez.","Au moment de servir, retirez délicatement la tarte du moule et disposez-la sur une assiette de service. Pour décorer, fouettez délicatement la crème et le sucre glace. Versez ou déposez la crème sur le dessus de la tarte et terminez avec du zeste de citron vert supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:05:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10352,6963,'fr','Nouilles épicées au porc et au gingembre','Combinez du porc épicé, des champignons, du bok choy et des nouilles au gingembre pour un repas rapide en milieu de semaine en seulement 25 minutes. Facile et rapide, il est idéal pour les jours de semaine chargés','["250 g de nouilles aux œufs moyennes","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","400 g de porc haché","300 g de champignons émincés finement","30 g de gingembre finement râpé","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment rouge, finement haché","4 oignons nouveaux, finement tranchés, parties vertes et blanches séparées","3 bok choy, feuilles séparées, parties blanches finement tranchées et sommités feuillues laissées entières","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe de vin de riz Shaoxing"]','["Faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les bien et réservez. Faites chauffer les deux huiles dans une grande poêle à frire à feu moyen-vif. Incorporez le hachis de porc en le brisant à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère en bois. Cuire pendant 2-3 minutes, jusqu''à ce que l''eau se soit évaporée. Incorporer les champignons et cuire encore 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporer le gingembre, l''ail, le piment et les parties blanches des oignons nouveaux et du bok choy. Cuire pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé et ramolli.","Incorporer les parties vertes du bok choy avec la sauce soja, le vin de riz et les nouilles cuites. Mélangez le tout pour enrober, puis servez parsemé du reste des parties vertes des oignons nouveaux."]','2026-01-11 00:05:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10353,6965,'fr','Boulettes de papier de riz','Dégustez ces boulettes de porc et de champignons en entrée ou en accompagnement dans le cadre d''un festin d''inspiration vietnamienne. Servir avec notre trempette soja et sésame','["¼ petit chou blanc épépiné et haché grossièrement","1 carotte, râpée","100 g de champignons shiitake finement hachés","400 g de porc haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","20 g de gingembre pelé et râpé","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","20 à 40 rouleaux de printemps vietnamiens ou feuilles de papier de riz","75 ml d''huile végétale, plus un supplément pour la planche","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","½ cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame grillées","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement"]','["Versez le chou dans un robot culinaire et mixez-le jusqu''à ce qu''il soit finement haché. Assaisonner avec ½ cuillère à café de sel, bien mélanger et réserver 15 minutes. Versez dans un torchon propre et essorez autant d’eau que possible. Verser dans un bol avec la carotte, les champignons, le hachis de porc, l''ail, le gingembre, la sauce soja, l''huile de sésame et les oignons nouveaux. Assaisonner de poivre noir. Frottez le tout avec vos mains, en mélangeant bien jusqu''à ce que tout soit combiné.","Faites tremper les feuilles de rouleaux de printemps pendant quelques secondes dans un plat peu profond rempli d''eau tiède, puis transférez-les sur une planche à découper huilée. En travaillant avec une feuille à la fois, versez 1 cuillère à soupe bombée de garniture au milieu, puis repliez le fond vers le haut et sur la garniture. Rabattez le haut de la feuille, puis les côtés pour l''envelopper complètement et former un carré soigné. Si la boulette vous semble un peu fragile, trempez une autre feuille et enveloppez-la à nouveau. Répétez avec les feuilles restantes et la garniture, en transférant les boulettes sur une assiette huilée au fur et à mesure.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive (en vous assurant qu''elle n''est pas remplie à plus d''un tiers) à feu moyen-vif et faites frire les raviolis pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Utilisez une écumoire ou une araignée pour les retourner, puis couvrez avec un couvercle et laissez cuire encore 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Retirez le couvercle et laissez cuire 1 à 2 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez tous les ingrédients de la trempette dans un petit bol. Servir les raviolis avec la trempette à part."]','2026-01-11 00:05:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10354,6967,'fr','Kimchi maison','Le kimchi existe dans des dizaines de versions et celles-ci peuvent être encore plus variées. La sauce aux crevettes ou au poisson est également traditionnellement utilisée pour préparer le kimchi, nous vous proposons une version simplifiée qui convient également aux végétaliens.','["40,00 g de sel de mer finement moulu","1,20 kg de chou chinois coupé en carrés d''environ 5 x 5 cm","370,00 g d''oignon nouveau coupé en morceaux de 5 cm","49,00 g de gingembre (frais) morceau de 9 cm finement râpé","10h00 gousse d''ail écrasée ou hachée","30,00 g de poudre de piment coréen fine séchée (kochukaru), peut être remplacée par une autre poudre de piment séchée","1,50 cuillère à soupe de sucre semoule"]','["Dissoudre 30 g de sel dans 2 litres d''eau froide dans une carafe.","Versez le chou dans un récipient d''au moins 2,5 litres en matériau inerte (verre, porcelaine, faïence...). Versez de l''eau salée pour que le chou soit immergé. Couvrir d''une assiette et laisser à température ambiante pour permettre au chou de commencer à fermenter (cela prend environ 12 heures, des bulles apparaîtront dans le liquide et le chou deviendra légèrement aigre).","Égoutter le chou et conserver le cornichon. Dans un bol, mélangez le chou avec l''oignon nouveau, le gingembre, l''ail, l''assaisonnement chili, le sucre et le reste du sel.","Transférer dans un pot stérilisé de 2 litres et recouvrir du vernis réservé pour maintenir le chou immergé.","Versez un peu du reste de la marinade dans un sac en plastique, fermez-le bien et placez-le sur le chou pour qu''il reste immergé dans le vernis.","Placer dans une pièce où la température ne dépasse pas 20°C pour fermenter (levain) à votre convenance. Cela prendra probablement 4 à 6 jours.","Retirez le sachet, fermez le pot et conservez au réfrigérateur. Cela dure même 3 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:05:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10355,6969,'fr','Poulet doré avec nouilles de riz et échalotes croustillantes','Servez ces nouilles directement du plat pour que les gens puissent les déguster et se servir. La star du spectacle est le poulet, avec un fabuleux mélange de saveurs','["400 ml de lait de coco (bien fouetter pour mélanger la crème et l''eau, si elle s''est séparée dans la boîte)","2 cuillères à café de curcuma moulu","15 g de gingembre en morceau finement râpé","2 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 citrons verts, 1 zesté et pressé, 1 coupé en quartiers pour servir","½ gros piment rouge, surgelé et finement râpé (voir astuce ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","2 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson","6 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","huile végétale, pour la friture","4 échalotes , finement tranchées en rondelles","180 g de nouilles de riz larges (4 nids)","2 carottes , coupées en allumettes","6 petits concombres, tranchés ou ½ concombre, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur et tranché","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","petit bouquet de basilic thaï, feuilles cueillies","100 g de cacahuètes salées hachées grossièrement"]','["Dans un grand bol, mélanger le lait de coco, le curcuma, le gingembre, l''ail, le zeste et le jus de citron vert, le piment, le sucre, la sauce de poisson et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Ajouter les cuisses de poulet en remuant pour bien les enrober, puis laisser mariner au réfrigérateur toute la nuit. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à deux jours.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Transférer le poulet dans un grand plat à rôtir à bords hauts. Rôtir pendant 30 minutes, en versant la sauce sur le poulet plusieurs fois pendant la cuisson, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit et un peu carbonisé et que la sauce ait réduit. A la fin, si le poulet a besoin de plus de couleur, faites-le griller quelques minutes, si vous le souhaitez.","Pendant la cuisson du poulet, faites chauffer suffisamment d''huile végétale pour couvrir le fond d''une grande poêle à frire, séparez les rondelles d''échalotes et faites cuire en une seule couche pendant 6 à 8 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées (vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots). Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et assaisonner généreusement de sel.","Faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage (ou portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition, ajoutez les nouilles, retirez du feu et laissez reposer 5 minutes, puis égouttez et rincez à l''eau froide).","Retirez le poulet du moule et coupez-le en morceaux. Mélangez les nouilles égouttées dans la sauce dans le plat à rôtir. Garnir de poulet, de légumes, d''échalotes croustillantes, d''herbes et de cacahuètes. Servir avec des quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:05:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10356,6971,'fr','Sauté de porc au basilic thaï','Cette recette est inspirée du pad kra pao, le favori thaïlandais épicé et savoureux. Vous pouvez ajuster la quantité de piments selon vos goûts','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 grosse échalote, tranchée","1 tige de citronnelle, tranchée finement","2 piments rouges, finement tranchés, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","3 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","½ cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","500 g de porc haché","200 g de haricots verts coupés en trois","25 g de basilic thaï, les plus grosses feuilles arrachées","riz au jasmin cuit, pour servir"]','["Ce plat se prépare assez rapidement, alors ayez tous les ingrédients à portée de main. Versez l''huile végétale dans une grande poêle ou un wok à feu vif. Une fois chatoyant, ajoutez l''échalote, la citronnelle, les piments et l''ail. Cuire 5 à 6 minutes, en remuant, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et que les bords soient dorés. Versez la sauce soja, la sauce aux huîtres, la sauce de poisson et le sucre dans un petit bol ou un pichet et ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour combiner.","Incorporez le porc dans la poêle, puis versez la sauce et les haricots verts. Cuire encore 5 à 6 minutes en remuant tout le temps. Lorsque les haricots sont tendres et légèrement croquants, incorporez le basilic thaï.","Servir immédiatement avec le riz, garni de plus de piments si vous souhaitez plus de piquant."]','2026-01-11 00:05:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10357,6973,'fr','Asperges et brocolis grillés avec vinaigrette au piment blister','Ces légumes verts carbonisés, arrosés d''une vinaigrette piquante et piquante, constituent un accompagnement parfait pour un barbecue – à déguster avec notre poulet à la spatchcock glacé à l''érable et à la moutarde.','["300 g d''asperges, les extrémités ligneuses parées","300 g de brocoli à longues tiges","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et un filet","1 piment rouge","1 cuillère à café de sirop d''érable","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","½ citron , zesté et pressé"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée. Y déposer les asperges et le brocoli, faire bouillir 1 min, puis bien égoutter, laisser refroidir et sécher.","Lorsque le barbecue est chaud, versez un peu d''huile sur le piment et laissez cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit carbonisé et ramolli. Retirer du BBQ, laisser refroidir un peu, puis hacher finement et mélanger avec le sirop d''érable, l''huile d''olive, le zeste et le jus de citron. Assaisonner au goût et réserver.","Mélangez les asperges et le brocoli dans l''huile d''olive et faites-les griller directement sur le barbecue pendant 3 à 4 minutes, en les retournant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement carbonisés et fumés. Transférer les légumes dans une assiette de service et assaisonner de sel marin feuilleté. Servir la vinaigrette au piment cloqué à côté pour la napper."]','2026-01-11 00:05:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10358,6975,'fr','Adobo au poulet','Laissez ce ragoût philippin poivré dans la casserole toute la nuit pour encore plus de saveur. Dégustez-le avec du riz au jasmin cuit à la vapeur','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale, plus un peu si nécessaire","2 cuisses de poulet (environ 600g)","2 cuisses de poulet avec peau et os (environ 300 g)","65 g d''ail finement haché (environ 1½ bulbe)","1 petit oignon , finement haché","90 ml de vinaigre de coco ou de cidre","90 ml de sauce soja légère","2 feuilles de laurier","10 grains de poivre noir entiers","petite pincée de sucre mou roux clair","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","riz au jasmin cuit à la vapeur, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu vif et saisissez tout le poulet, peau vers le bas, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit caramélisé, environ 3 à 5 minutes. Retourner et saisir l''autre face pendant 2-3 minutes, puis retirer de la poêle et réserver sur une assiette. (Le poulet n’a pas besoin d’être bien cuit à ce stade.)","Réduisez le feu à moyen et ajoutez un peu d’huile si la poêle semble sèche. Faites frire l''ail jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer et devienne parfumé, environ 2-3 minutes. Incorporer l''oignon, puis couvrir et cuire 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli, en remuant de temps en temps. Remettez le poulet dans la poêle, côté peau vers le bas, et augmentez le feu à vif. Ajoutez le vinaigre, puis portez à ébullition et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait réduit d''un quart, environ 4 à 5 minutes. Le vinaigre doit avoir une odeur parfumée et légèrement sucrée, plutôt que crue et âcre.","Ajoutez la sauce soja, faites bouillir pendant 2-3 minutes, puis ajoutez les feuilles de laurier, les grains de poivre noir et le sucre. Couvrir et laisser mijoter à feu doux pendant 10 à 12 minutes. Remuez doucement, retournez le poulet et poursuivez la cuisson pendant 6 à 10 minutes, à couvert, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre et bien cuit. Laissez l''adobo reposer dans la casserole pendant au moins 5 minutes avant de l''assaisonner de poivre noir et de le servir garni d''oignons nouveaux avec du riz au jasmin cuit à la vapeur. Les restes de poulet adobo se conservent au frais jusqu’à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:05:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10359,6977,'fr','Nihari','Savourez ce ragoût d''agneau épicé mijoté du Pakistan. Il est particulièrement populaire pendant le Ramadan et constitue un incontournable lors des mariages et des célébrations.','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à soupe de ghee","Morceau de gingembre de 2,5 cm, finement râpé","2-3 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","4 jarrets d''agneau","1½ cuillère à soupe de poudre de piment rouge du Cachemire","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de blé complet","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de fenouil","1 bâton de cannelle","2 gousses de cardamome noire","2 anis étoilés entiers","1½ cuillère à soupe de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","2 lames de masse ou ½ cuillère à café de masse moulue","½ cuillère à café de muscade moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de pavot bleu (pas noires)","15 clous de girofle entiers","¾ cuillère à soupe de grains de poivre noir ou 2-3 poivrons longs pippali","une grosse poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées grossièrement","Morceau de gingembre de 5 cm, coupé en julienne","2 piments verts , finement hachés","6 cuillères à soupe d''oignons frits croustillants","4 citrons , coupés en quartiers","naan"]','["Dans un moulin à épices ou un mini robot culinaire, ajoutez tous les ingrédients du nihari masala avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte fine. Réservez 3 cuillères à café du mélange d''épices nihari masala pour servir.","Faites chauffer l''huile et le ghee dans une grande poêle à fond épais à feu moyen. Faites revenir le gingembre et l''ail jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés, environ 2 minutes. Ajouter l''agneau et faire revenir pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien doré. Incorporer la poudre de piment rouge du Cachemire, le reste du nihari masala et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Faire frire jusqu''à ce que les épices soient parfumées, 1 à 2 minutes, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire pour éviter de coller. Ajoutez 1,5 litre d''eau, ou juste assez pour submerger la viande.","Portez à ébullition, puis laissez cuire à couvert à feu moyen-doux pendant 45 min à 1 h. Retirez 150 ml de liquide de cuisson et fouettez avec les deux farines jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Remettre dans la poêle et bien mélanger. Couvrir et cuire à feu doux pendant encore 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre.","Servir garni de coriandre, de gingembre, de piments, d''oignons frits, de quartiers de citron et du mélange d''épices réservé, et de naan à part, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10360,6979,'fr','Bonjour, bonjour','Savourez un dessert philippin traditionnel qui se traduit par « mix-mix ». C''est un mélange coloré et rafraîchissant de saveurs et de textures, idéal pour les journées chaudes.','["410 ml de lait concentré","50 g de grosses perles de tapioca","200 g de cassonade foncée","100 g de petites perles de tapioca","huile au goût neutre, comme végétale, pour le récipient","100 g de sucre en poudre","7g d''agar-agar","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de pandan vert","100 g de nata de coco égouttée","100 g de jacquier égoutté et tranché","200 g de koong (graines de palmier)","200 g de haricots mungo rouges égouttés","200 g de piments Halaya"]','["Tapisser un moule à gâteau carré de 20 cm de côté de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez le lait concentré avec 820 ml d''eau dans un grand bol en remuant bien. Versez le mélange dans le moule préparé et congelez pendant 2 heures, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à geler sur les bords. Retirer du congélateur et, à l''aide d''une fourchette, gratter le mélange partiellement congelé pour créer des cristaux moelleux et glacés. Remettre au congélateur. Répétez ce processus toutes les 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout le mélange soit complètement congelé et ait une texture semblable à celle d''un granité ; cela prendra quelques heures. Une fois prêt, conservez-le au congélateur jusqu''au moment de servir, en remuant avec une fourchette si nécessaire avant de le faire.","Portez à ébullition 750 ml d''eau et faites cuire les grosses perles de tapioca pendant 30 min. Couvrir, éteindre le feu et laisser refroidir complètement.","Mélangez la cassonade avec 100 ml d''eau dans une casserole et faites chauffer à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 2 à 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe légèrement. Retirer du feu et répartir dans deux pichets. Laisser refroidir.","Égouttez les grosses perles de tapioca et versez-les dans l''un des pots de sirop de cassonade. Portez à ébullition 1 litre d''eau dans une casserole à part et faites cuire les petites perles de tapioca pendant 20 min. Égoutter immédiatement et transférer dans le deuxième pot de sirop de cassonade.","Pour la gelée, huilez d’abord un récipient réutilisable (environ 15 x 10 cm). Portez à ébullition 570 ml d''eau dans une casserole et ajoutez le sucre en poudre jusqu''à dissolution, puis l''agar agar jusqu''à ce qu''il soit également dissous. Incorporer l''extrait de pandan, puis verser le mélange dans le récipient préparé et laisser reposer environ 1 heure. Une fois pris, coupez-le en cubes.","Pour assembler le halo-halo, répartissez la nata de coco, les tranches de jacquier, le kaong, les haricots mungo rouges, l''ube halaya et la plupart des cubes de gelée de pandan entre quatre grands verres à dessert. Verser dessus les grosses perles de tapioca, suivies des petites perles de tapioca. Versez généreusement sur la glace au lait évaporée façon granité, puis répartissez quelques cubes supplémentaires de gelée de pandan sur le dessus, ainsi que toute garniture supplémentaire si vous le souhaitez (comme un filet de sirop brun supplémentaire ou une boule d''ube halaya). Servir immédiatement et laisser les invités « mélanger » le tout pendant qu''ils mangent."]','2026-01-11 00:05:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10361,6981,'fr','Bol de riz au saumon avec friteuse à air gluant','Faites frire les morceaux de saumon dans une sauce à base de soja, de miel, de gingembre et de sriracha, puis servez-les sur du riz brun et garnissez de légumes frais marinés pour un repas rapide et facile en milieu de semaine.','["500 g de morceau de filet de saumon","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","15 g de gingembre râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à soupe de Sriracha","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","150 g de haricots edamame surgelés","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre de pomme","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","½ concombre , coupé en deux et tranché finement","200 g de radis finement tranchés","riz brun cuit, pour servir","15 g de gingembre rose mariné","4 grandes feuilles de nori"]','["Faites chauffer votre friteuse à air à 175°C. Retirez la peau du saumon et coupez-le en cubes de 2 cm. Mélangez 2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja, le gingembre, le miel, l''huile de sésame, la sriracha et la moitié des graines de sésame dans un bol. Incorporer les cubes de saumon et bien mélanger. Laisser mariner 10 min. Disposer en une couche uniforme dans le panier de la friteuse, en arrosant du reste de sauce et cuire à 175 °C pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien cuite et collante.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les edamames en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les bien et laissez-les refroidir légèrement. Mélangez le reste des graines de sésame avec le vinaigre, le sucre et une grosse pincée de sel. Incorporer le concombre et l''edamame refroidi et réserver.  Mélangez les radis avec le reste de sauce soja.","Versez le saumon sur le riz brun cuit pour servir, en arrosant des restes de sauce de la friteuse à air. Ajoutez les edamames et le concombre, les radis et un peu de gingembre mariné à côté. Émietter sur le nori pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10362,6983,'fr','Galettes de poisson à la thaïlandaise avec nouilles au concombre','Égayez un dîner de semaine avec ces petites galettes de poisson préparées dans une friteuse à air et servies avec du riz et des concombres frappés. Ils peuvent également servir de collation épicée','["250 g de filets de truite ou de saumon sans peau","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","10 g de coriandre finement hachée","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","1 citron vert , zesté et pressé","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de citronnelle","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","50 g de chapelure panko","2 sachets de 250 g de riz brun prêt à l''emploi, coriandre et sriracha, pour servir","1 concombre","1 gousse d''ail, râpée","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin de riz","2 cuillères à café d''huile de piment"]','["Mettez le poisson et les autres ingrédients sauf la farine et le panko dans le bol d''un robot culinaire. Pulser pour former une pâte épaisse, puis transférer dans un bol et incorporer la farine.","Avec les mains légèrement mouillées, façonnez-les en petites galettes, environ 8 à 10. Versez la chapelure dans une assiette et roulez les croquettes de poisson pour bien les enrober. Se conserve au frais pendant deux jours","Chauffez la friteuse à air à 180°C. Cuire pendant 10 à 15 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits.","Pendant ce temps, pour le concombre claqué, écrasez légèrement le concombre sur toute la longueur à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie en cassant un peu la chair sans la réduire en pulpe. Coupez le concombre en deux et retirez les graines, puis coupez la chair en petits morceaux. Saupoudrer d''1/2 cuillère à café de sel, laisser reposer 10 minutes, puis bien rincer à l''eau froide et égoutter.","Mélanger le reste des ingrédients dans un bol moyen et mélanger le concombre.","Faites chauffer le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis servez avec les galettes de poisson, le concombre claqué, la coriandre saupoudrée et un peu de sriracha pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:05:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10363,6985,'fr','Bol de déesse verte avec tofu croustillant au sésame','Utilisez votre friteuse à air pour préparer ces bâtonnets de tofu enrobés de graines de sésame – ils sont servis avec du quinoa, ainsi qu''une salade d''edamames, de chou blanc et de pommes.','["1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 oeuf , battu","3 cuillères à soupe de farine","75 g de graines de sésame noires et blanches","450 g de tofu soigneusement séché avec du papier absorbant et coupé en lanières","2 sachets de 250 g de quinoa prêt à l''emploi","½ chou blanc , râpé","160 g d''edamames","1 pomme verte, coupée en allumettes","flocons de piment, pour servir (facultatif)","1 avocat, pelé et haché","15g de coriandre","15g de basilic","100 g de yaourt grec.","1 citron vert , zesté et pressé"]','["Versez la sauce soja et l''œuf battu dans un petit bol et mélangez au fouet. Mettez la farine dans un autre bol et assaisonnez, puis mettez les graines de sésame dans un troisième bol. A l''aide de pinces, trempez les morceaux de tofu d''abord dans la farine, puis dans l''œuf, puis dans les graines de sésame, et retournez-les pour les enrober de tous les côtés.","Transférer dans le panier tapissé de papier d’aluminium d’une friteuse à air. Cuire 10 à 15 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la vinaigrette en mélangeant tous les ingrédients dans un mélangeur jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Assaisonner, puis détendre avec un peu d''eau jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse mais versable. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à deux jours.","Faites chauffer le quinoa en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis répartissez-le dans quatre bols. Mettez le chou, l''edamame et la pomme dans un grand bol et mélangez avec la vinaigrette. Servir sur le quinoa avec le tofu croustillant. Parsemez de flocons de piment, si vous le souhaitez, et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10364,6987,'fr','Wraps de laitue au porc gluant et aux nouilles de riz','Assemblez ces wraps collants au porc et aux nouilles de riz à table pour une façon amusante et festive de manger. Cuire dans une friteuse à air et servir avec votre huile de piment préférée','["450 g de lanières de poitrine de porc coupées en morceaux de 3 cm","150 g de nouilles de riz, cuites selon les instructions du paquet","½ cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","2 citrons verts, 1 pressé, 1 coupé en quartiers, pour servir","5 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir","1 laitue iceberg ou 2 laitue Little Gem, feuilles séparées","1 carotte coupée en fines lanières (utilisez une mandoline si vous en avez une) 1/2 concombre coupé en fines lanières (utilisez une mandoline si vous en avez une)","huile de piment, pour servir (facultatif)","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable","½ cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","5g de gingembre pelé et râpé"]','["Mélanger tous les ingrédients de la sauce dans un bol moyen en fouettant pour combiner. Versez la majeure partie de la sauce sur la poitrine de porc en vous assurant qu''elle est bien enrobée. Réservez le reste de la sauce pour l''arroser plus tard.","Tapisser le panier de la friteuse à air de papier d''aluminium et chauffer à 200 °C. Une fois chaude, versez la poitrine de porc dans le panier en espaçant au mieux les morceaux. Cuire 15 à 20 minutes en retournant toutes les 7 minutes. Au dernier tour, arrosez avec le reste du glaçage.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les nouilles avec l''huile de sésame, le jus de citron vert et la coriandre. Assaisonner au goût.","Lorsque le porc est cuit, apportez le tout à table et laissez chacun remplir ses coupes de laitue de nouilles, de porc et de légumes. Saupoudrez de coriandre et servez avec du citron vert à presser et de l''huile de piment pour arroser, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10365,6989,'fr','Riz au poulet du Hainan','Préparez ce dîner de poulet hainanais facile inspiré du plat national de Singapour. C’est réconfortant, nourrissant et guérissant pour l’âme','["1 poulet entier d''environ 1,2 kg ou des cuisses pour une cuisson plus rapide","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées ou hachées","150 g de gingembre frais tranché","1 ½ oignons nouveaux, tranchés","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","210 g de riz lavé","petite poignée de coriandre hachée","tranches de concombre, pour servir","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement haché ou finement râpé","1 oignon nouveau, tranché finement","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","pincée de sucre","½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de poulet","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 piments rouges , hachés","1 gousse d''ail , hachée ou écrasée","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson (facultatif)","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja légère","un peu de vinaigre, de citron ou de citron vert frais (préférence personnelle)","graisse de poulet, préparée à partir du poulet entier"]','["Coupez tout excès de graisse et les lambeaux de peau du poulet (sinon, gardez la peau sur le poulet), puis réservez. Réservez également les chutes. Salez tout le poulet avec du gros sel, puis pochez-le dans une casserole d''eau frémissante en l''immergeant bien, avec les deux tiers du gingembre, les trois quarts de l''ail écrasé, 1 oignon nouveau et le curcuma pendant 25 à 40 min selon la taille du poulet.","Mettez le poulet cuit dans un bol d''eau glacée pendant 15 minutes pour arrêter la cuisson. Versez le bouillon de poulet dans un pichet et réservez.","Pour la sauce gingembre & ciboule, mélanger l''ail, le gingembre, la ciboule et la poudre de bouillon de poulet dans un plat de service et ajouter une bonne pincée de sel et de sucre. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une petite poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude puis versez-la sur les autres ingrédients.","Pour préparer la sauce au piment rouge, mélangez tous les ingrédients dans une petite casserole avec 100 ml du bouillon de poulet réservé, portez à ébullition, puis retirez du feu et versez dans un plat de service.","Préparez le riz en faisant chauffer une poêle ou une casserole à feu moyen et en ajoutant la peau et la graisse de poulet réservées à l''étape 1. Une fois qu''il est fondu (un peu fondu), ajoutez le reste de l''ail, du gingembre et de l''oignon nouveau et laissez cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer. Incorporez le riz lavé et 1 litre de bouillon de poulet réservé. S’il n’en reste pas assez, complétez avec de l’eau ou du bouillon de poulet. Laissez le riz cuire pendant environ 10 à 15 minutes ou selon les instructions sur l''emballage. Retirez les os du poulet, coupez-le en tranches puis servez-le avec le riz et les sauces. Garnir de coriandre et de concombre."]','2026-01-11 00:05:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10366,6991,'fr','Sauce barbecue coréenne','Préparez une sauce barbecue avec une touche coréenne en ajoutant du gochujang, une pâte de poivron rouge qui crée une chaleur légèrement fumée. Utilisez la sauce comme glaçage pour les côtes collantes ou versez-la sur des hamburgers.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à soupe d''ail râpé","500g en purée","125 g de cassonade foncée","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre de pomme ou de vinaigre de riz","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","1½ cuillère à café de gochujang"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile végétale dans une casserole à feu doux et faites revenir l''ail pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez le reste des ingrédients avec ¼ cuillère à café de sel et portez à ébullition. Réduire le feu et laisser mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement, en remuant de temps en temps. Se conserve dans un bocal ou une bouteille en verre stérilisé au réfrigérateur jusqu''à un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:05:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10367,6993,'fr','Kimchi jjigae','Préparez ce plat réconfortant coréen épicé et chaleureux en utilisant de la poitrine de porc et du kimchi mûr pour un maximum de saveur.','["400 g de kimchi mûr","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","¼ petit oignon brun, tranché finement","200 g de poitrine de porc finement tranchée","1½ cuillère à café de gochugaru (flocons de piment rouge coréen)","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","150 g de tofu ferme, égoutté","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés finement"]','["Égouttez le kimchi dans une passoire au-dessus d''un verre doseur (vous aurez besoin d''environ 100 ml de saumure, alors complétez avec davantage du pot si nécessaire). Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu vif et faites revenir le kimchi égoutté, l''oignon brun et la poitrine de porc pendant 5 minutes. Incorporez le gochugaru et le sucre, puis faites revenir encore 2 minutes. Versez 800 ml d''eau et la saumure de kimchi réservée, puis portez à ébullition. Laisser mijoter à découvert à feu vif pendant 15 minutes.","Coupez le tofu en carrés de 5 cm d''environ 1 cm d''épaisseur, puis disposez-les sur le kimchi jjigae. Couvrir la poêle avec un couvercle et cuire 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le tofu soit bien chaud. Répartir sur les oignons nouveaux pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10368,6995,'fr','Kimbap','Adaptez ces rouleaux de riz à la coréenne avec presque tout ce que vous voulez – nous avons utilisé des bâtonnets de fruits de mer et des hot-dogs, mais la mayonnaise épicée au porc ou au thon fonctionne également bien.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","1 carotte , coupée en fines allumettes","2 œufs","100 g de danmuji (daikon mariné coréen), ou utilisez des cornichons ou du concombre","60 g de bâtonnets de fruits de mer, coupés en fines longueurs","2 hot-dogs , coupés en quartiers dans le sens de la longueur","6 feuilles d''algues gim ou nori","100 g de bébés épinards","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame, plus un peu pour le brossage","½ cuillère à café de graines de sésame, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","500 g de riz à sushi cuit","1½ cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez les épinards. Mettez les épinards dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et versez-les sur l''eau bouillante de la bouilloire, en poussant les feuilles sous l''eau à l''aide d''une cuillère pour vous assurer qu''elles flétrissent toutes. Égoutter, puis rincer sous l''eau froide courante et essorer tout excès de liquide. Remettez les épinards dans le bol et ajoutez l''huile de sésame, une pincée de sel et les graines de sésame. Mélanger et réserver.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile végétale dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les carottes pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement ramollies. Retirer dans une assiette et réserver.","Essuyez la poêle et faites chauffer le reste de l''huile à feu vif. Cassez les œufs dans un bol et fouettez légèrement, puis versez dans la poêle et remuez la poêle pour enrober la base. Cuire brièvement jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste prise, puis transférer l''omelette sur une planche à découper et la couper en lanières d''environ ½ cm d''épaisseur. Mettez tous les ingrédients de la garniture – le danmuji, les bâtonnets de fruits de mer, les hot-dogs, les carottes, les tranches d''omelette et les épinards – sur le même plateau. Mélangez tous les ingrédients du riz avec ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol.","Posez une feuille d''algues, côté brillant vers le bas, sur une planche et étalez un quart du riz sur les trois quarts de la feuille en une couche uniforme, en laissant le quart supérieur de la feuille nu. Coupez une autre feuille d''algue en deux et posez-la au milieu du riz. (Cela formera la couche de base pour toutes les garnitures.) Disposez quelques pincées de chacune des garnitures sur toute la longueur de cette feuille d''algues. Soulevez le bas de la plus grande feuille d''algues vers le haut et par-dessus les garnitures, puis enroulez-la fermement en rentrant le tout avec vos doigts au fur et à mesure. Au bout de la feuille, ajoutez quelques grains de riz sur le dessus pour servir de colle pour sceller. Badigeonner légèrement d''huile de sésame et saupoudrer de graines de sésame, puis répéter pour faire les rouleaux restants.","Coupez des cercles de 1 cm d''épaisseur à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé. Si le couteau commence à coller, essuyez-le avec un morceau de papier absorbant et de l''huile de sésame pour créer des tranches nettes. Vous pouvez également couper les bords s’ils sont un peu rugueux."]','2026-01-11 00:05:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10369,6997,'fr','Bibimbap coréen','Utilisez vos restes dans un bibimbap coréen signifiant « riz mélangé ». Remplacez les légumes par ceux que vous avez au réfrigérateur, puis servez-les sur du riz avec un œuf au plat et nappez-les d''une sauce gochujang sucrée et épicée.','["1 champignon châtaigne , tranché finement","½ courgette, coupée en deux et finement tranchée","¼ de carotte, coupée en allumettes","40 g de germes de soja","30g d''épinards","¼ cuillère à café d''huile de sésame, plus un peu pour servir","½ cuillère à café de graines de sésame, plus un peu pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oeuf","150 g de riz à sushi cuit","2 cuillères à soupe de gochujang (pâte de poivron rouge coréen)","1 cuillère à café de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","½ cuillère à café d''huile de sésame"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients de la sauce bibimbap dans un petit bol avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et réservez.","Mettez les tranches de champignons, de courgettes, de carottes et de germes de soja dans une assiette. Mettez un petit bol ou un ramequin résistant à la chaleur à l''envers au milieu d''une casserole moyenne à couvercle. Ajoutez suffisamment d''eau jusqu''à mi-hauteur du ramequin et portez à ébullition. Posez délicatement l''assiette de légumes sur le ramequin et posez un couvercle sur la casserole. Faites cuire les légumes à la vapeur pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les épinards dans un bol et versez de l’eau bouillante dessus. Remuer pour flétrir les feuilles, puis égoutter et rincer à l''eau froide. Pressez l''excédent d''eau des épinards, puis mélangez-les dans un bol avec l''huile de sésame, une pincée de sel et les graines de sésame. Annuler.","Faites chauffer l''huile végétale dans une poêle à feu vif. Cassez l''œuf et faites-le frire à votre convenance.","Remplissez un bol avec le riz. Garnir avec l''œuf au plat, puis utiliser des pinces pour ajouter les légumes cuits à la vapeur autour. Servir avec la sauce bibimbap, un peu d''huile de sésame supplémentaire et des graines de sésame. Mélangez le tout avant de manger. Les restes de sauce bibimbap se conservent au frais jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:05:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10370,6999,'fr','Bœuf au chili super facile dans une poêle','Préparez cette version super facile dans une poêle de votre bœuf croustillant au piment préféré à emporter en seulement 30 minutes.','["320 g de bifteck de bœuf britannique Morrisons, tranché","4 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","1 oignon , tranché finement","2 poivrons rouges , tranchés","8 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","1 piment rouge , tranché","3 gousses d''ail écrasées ou finement râpées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","2 cuillères à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc ou de vin de riz","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja noire","600 g de nouilles directement au wok","graines de sésame grillées, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le bœuf dans un grand bol et mélangez-le avec la maïzena et ½ cuillère à café de sel et de poivre noir moulu. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou un wok à feu moyen et faites revenir le bœuf jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Retirer de la poêle et réserver (vous n''êtes pas obligé de le retirer de la poêle, mais cela garantit que le bœuf ne cuit pas trop et reste aussi croustillant que possible). Réservez l''huile dans la poêle.","Incorporer l''oignon et le poivron rouge et faire revenir quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis, puis ajouter les oignons nouveaux, le piment, l''ail et le gingembre et cuire encore quelques minutes avant d''ajouter la sauce chili, le ketchup, le vinaigre et la sauce soja. Mélangez le tout, faites cuire 1 minute, puis incorporez les nouilles et le bœuf croustillant. Cuire 2 minutes, puis servir dans des bols avec un peu de graines de sésame, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10371,7001,'fr','Sauté de crevettes chaud au miel, orange et sésame','Ce sauté parfumé regorge de crevettes, de poivrons et de pak choi. Servir avec du riz ou des nouilles pour une victoire facile en milieu de semaine','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","2 grosses oranges zestées et pressées (environ 150 ml)","4 cuillères à soupe de miel","généreuse pincée de flocons de piment","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","½ cuillère à café de cinq épices chinoises","400 g de crevettes royales décortiquées crues Morrisons Market Street","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","4 oignons nouveaux, coupés en morceaux de 2 cm","2 poivrons rouges coupés en morceaux de 3 cm","2 pak choi , tranchés","riz ou nouilles, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Pour préparer la sauce, mélangez l''huile, le zeste et le jus d''orange, le miel, le piment, le soja et le vinaigre dans un bol. Mélangez la maïzena, les graines de sésame, les cinq épices et une pincée de sel dans un autre bol. Passez un petit couteau sur le dos de chaque crevette royale décortiquée crue de Morrisons Market Street, afin qu''elles papillonnent pendant la cuisson.","Mélanger les crevettes dans le mélange de farine de maïs. Faites chauffer l''huile végétale dans un grand wok ou une poêle à feu moyen-vif. Quand il fait chaud, ajoutez l’ail et le gingembre. Faites grésiller pendant 10 secondes, mais ne le laissez pas dorer. Ajoutez les crevettes et la farine et les graines restantes dans le bol. Faites sauter à feu vif pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient roses et les graines de sésame dorées.","Versez les crevettes dans une assiette. Ajoutez un filet d''huile végétale et les oignons nouveaux, les poivrons et le pak choi. Faire sauter pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit tout en conservant un peu de croquant.","Versez la sauce dans le wok. Faites bouillir pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à épaississement, puis remettez les crevettes dans le wok et remuez pour les enrober de sauce. Faites chauffer encore 30 secondes, puis servez avec du riz ou des nouilles, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10372,7003,'fr','Curry de poisson de Julie (curry de poisson malaisien)','Offrez-vous ce curry de poisson un vendredi soir. Léger et frais, mais riche et épicé, à déguster avec un grand bol de riz cuit à la vapeur – idéalement avec vos mains !','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 échalotes bananes pelées et hachées finement","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","Morceau de gingembre de 2,5 cm, pelé et râpé","2 piments rouges moyennement séchés, réhydratés puis hachés finement","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry (poudre de curry de poisson malaisien ou toute poudre de curry moyenne, plus 1 cuillère à café de poudre de fenugrec)","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 grosse tomate, hachée","200 ml de lait de coco","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tamarin","2 tiges de citronnelle meurtries","2 feuilles de tilleul","1 aubergine coupée en morceaux de 3 cm","5 gombos, coupés en morceaux","500 g de filets de poisson (maquereau, vivaneau ou tout poisson blanc ferme), nettoyés et coupés en 3-4 morceaux chacun","petite poignée de coriandre et riz au jasmin cuit à la vapeur, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à frire ou une cocotte anti-flamme à feu moyen et faites revenir les échalotes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient translucides, environ 3-4 minutes. Ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre et le piment et faites revenir encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés et légèrement dorés.","Incorporer la poudre de curry et le curcuma. Cuire environ 1 min en remuant continuellement pour éviter que les épices ne brûlent. Ajouter la tomate et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie, environ 2-3 minutes.","Versez le lait de coco et 200 ml d''eau en remuant pour combiner. Ajouter la pâte de tamarin, la citronnelle et les feuilles de citron vert et porter à ébullition. Ajoutez l''aubergine et le gombo et laissez mijoter environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si la sauce curry a réduit.","Réduisez le feu et plongez délicatement les morceaux de poisson. Couvrir et laisser mijoter pendant 5 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit bien cuit et se défasse facilement lorsqu''on le presse doucement avec une fourchette. Assaisonner avec du sel au goût. Retirez les tiges de citronnelle et les feuilles de citron vert, puis décorez de coriandre et servez chaud avec du riz vapeur."]','2026-01-11 00:05:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10373,7005,'fr','Restes de riz sauté aux crevettes','Préparez ce riz frit avec les restes de notre riz cuit aux crevettes, au chorizo ​​et aux courgettes. C''est un souper facile le lendemain, idéal pour les jours de semaine chargés.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","100 g de brocoli à longue tige, paré","450g de restes de riz aux crevettes (voir recette ci-dessous)","Boîte de 220 g de châtaignes d''eau égouttées","une petite poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement","25g de noix de cajou","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif et versez-y le brocoli. Faire frire pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis transférer dans une assiette. Pendant ce temps, sortez les crevettes du riz et réservez. Mélangez les ingrédients de la sauce dans un bol.","Versez le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et incorporez les restes de riz. Laisser reposer 5 minutes, puis mélanger à nouveau les crevettes avec le brocoli et les châtaignes d''eau. Cuire 1 à 2 minutes, puis incorporer la sauce et la coriandre et servir avec les noix de cajou éparpillées sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:05:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10374,7007,'fr','Ramen au poulet classique','Préparez ce ramen au poulet rapide rempli de légumes. Il est prêt en moins de 20 minutes et parfait pour un déjeuner savoureux','["2 poitrines de poulet sans peau","2 poignées de légumes sautés (environ 200g)","200 g de nouilles ramen","1 oeuf","500 ml de bouillon de poulet ramen","ciboulette finement hachée, pour servir","flocons de piment, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer une plaque chauffante ou une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites cuire les poitrines de poulet pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Retourner et cuire encore 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Trancher finement et réserver. Faites revenir les légumes sautés dans la poêle pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement ramollis.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les nouilles dans une casserole d''eau bouillante en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, en ajoutant l''œuf dans la casserole pendant 5 à 6 minutes (selon le goût du jaune). Égoutter et réserver. Épluchez l''œuf, coupez-le en deux et réservez.","Faites chauffer le bouillon dans une casserole à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud, en prenant soin de ne pas le laisser bouillir.","Répartissez les nouilles dans deux bols profonds, puis garnissez avec les légumes sautés, les tranches de poulet, les moitiés d''œufs et le bouillon. Répartir sur la ciboulette et les flocons de piment pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10375,7009,'fr','Dumplings faciles au porc et à la ciboulette','Essayez ces raviolis chinois fourrés au porc juteux et à la ciboulette chinoise fraîche. Ils sont plus faciles à réaliser que vous ne le pensez et amusants à assembler en tant qu’activité de groupe','["500 g de viande hachée de porc 20 % de matière grasse","200 g de ciboulette chinoise ou de coriandre ou de feuilles chinoises si vous n''en trouvez pas, hachées finement","1 ½ cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","1 cuillère à café de poivre blanc","1 cuillère à café de sucre","1½ cuillère à café de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","40 emballages de boulettes pré-faits décongelés","huile végétale, pour la friture","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre noir chinois","1 cuillère à café d''huile de piment","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","1 petit oignon nouveau, émincé finement"]','["Versez le porc et la ciboulette dans un bol. Ajoutez la sauce soja légère, la sauce d''huîtres, le poivre blanc, 1 cuillère à café de sel, le sucre, la maïzena et l''huile de sésame, puis mélangez bien. Couvrir et laisser mariner 1 h au réfrigérateur. Pendant ce temps, mélangez les ingrédients de la sauce aux boulettes dans un bol et mettez au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Trempez un doigt dans l''eau froide, mouillez la moitié inférieure des bords d''un emballage de boulette, puis ajoutez ½ cuillère à soupe de garniture au centre.","Pliez la boulette de bas en haut et pincez fermement au milieu, puis commencez à plier chaque côté de la droite vers le centre, en pinçant fermement au fur et à mesure. Rentrez les côtés et répétez avec le côté gauche. Pincez fermement le dessus de la boulette pour assurer une fermeture hermétique. Répétez l’opération pour faire 40 boulettes.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau et faites cuire les raviolis par lots, environ 10 à la fois. Cuire pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''eau commence à frémir ou que les boulettes flottent à la surface. Retirer avec une écumoire et réserver. Répétez jusqu''à ce que toutes les boulettes soient cuites.","Ajoutez un peu d''huile dans une poêle et faites chauffer à feu moyen-vif. Faites frire les raviolis bouillis de chaque côté pendant 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis servez-les avec la sauce pour raviolis, arrosée ou en trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:05:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10376,3724,'fr','Tofu teriyaki','Faites mariner le tofu avec la sauce teriyaki et servez-le avec du brocoli et des nouilles ou du riz pour préparer ce repas végétarien facile en milieu de semaine. Cela prend moins de 30 minutes à faire','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","400 g de tofu ferme, coupé en petits cubes","1 grosse tête de brocoli, coupée en fleurons, tiges pelées et tranchées finement","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, séparés en parties blanches et vertes et tranchés finement","8 à 10 cuillères à soupe de sauce teriyaki","riz ou nouilles cuits, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites frire le tofu pendant environ 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant et doré. Retirer de la poêle et réserver.","Dans la même poêle, ajoutez les fleurons de brocoli et les parties blanches des oignons nouveaux et faites cuire environ 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, mais pas complètement cuits. Incorporer la sauce teriyaki et bien assaisonner.","Remettez le tofu cuit dans la poêle avec le brocoli et remuez bien pour enrober. Cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes pour que les saveurs se mélangent. Saupoudrer les parties vertes réservées des oignons nouveaux, retirer du feu et servir avec du riz cuit ou des nouilles."]','2026-01-11 00:05:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10377,7011,'fr','Curry de poulet rouge thaï','Envie d''un plat thaïlandais simple et rapide ? Ce doit être un curry rouge. Les saveurs sont si bien équilibrées que vous tomberez encore plus amoureux de la cuisine thaïlandaise.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","400 ml de lait de coco","4 cuisses de poulet désossées (environ 250 g), coupées en morceaux ou en tranches","1 courgette , coupée en rondelles de 1,5 cm ou hachée grossièrement","1 aubergine , hachée grossièrement","100 g de pousses de bambou tranchées","1 cuillère à café de sucre","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","½ cuillère à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","½ cuillère à café de jus de citron","riz au jasmin cuit et 1 piment rouge tranché, pour servir","3 piments arbol séchés trempés dans l''eau pendant 10 minutes, épépinés","½ piment rouge , tranché","10 g de coriandre, tiges tranchées, feuilles cueillies et réservées pour servir","1 tige de citronnelle, tranchée finement","½ citron vert , zeste paré","5 g de galanga pelé et haché grossièrement","1 échalote , hachée grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","½ cuillère à soupe de paprika","1 cuillère à café de pâte de crevettes (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la pâte de curry dans un robot culinaire avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et ¼ cuillère à café de sel jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Faites chauffer l''huile végétale dans une casserole moyenne à feu moyen et faites frire la pâte de curry pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit parfumée. Verser 3 cuillères à soupe de lait de coco et verser le poulet. Cuire en remuant jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit doré mais pas complètement cuit. Incorporez le reste du lait de coco, la courgette, l''aubergine et les pousses de bambou. Portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter 15 mn. Incorporer le sucre, la sauce de poisson, la sauce aux huîtres et le jus de citron. Servir avec du riz au jasmin moelleux et parsemer de feuilles de coriandre et de tranches de piment rouge."]','2026-01-11 00:05:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10378,7013,'fr','Ajwain puri','Dégustez ces pains plats lors d''un festin indien. Le puri est une pâte frite qui gonfle une fois immergée dans l''huile chaude. Ici, ils sont parfumés aux graines de carambole','["300 g de farine de chapatti","½ cuillère à café d''ajwain ou de graines de cumin","huile de tournesol, pour la friture"]','["Mettez la farine, ½ cuillère à café de sel et l''ajwain dans un bol et mélangez bien. Ajoutez lentement 160 ml d''eau en mélangeant jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle. (Vous aurez peut-être besoin de toute l''eau, voire d''un peu plus.) Pétrir la pâte pendant quelques minutes, puis couvrir et laisser reposer 15 minutes.","Divisez la pâte en 20 morceaux, roulez chacun en boule, puis aplatissez en cercles d''environ 10 cm.","Faites chauffer 5 cm d''huile dans une friteuse ou une poêle large et profonde à 180 °C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''une pincée du mélange de puri grésille immédiatement lorsqu''elle y est déposée. Faites frire les puris un à la fois pendant 1 min de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Servir bien chaud avec notre alu tamatar masala (voir ci-dessous)."]','2026-01-11 00:05:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10379,5349,'fr','Brochettes de poulet gluantes au gingembre et au miel avec salade de nouilles','Ces brochettes de poulet au gingembre et au miel sont parfaites pour un dîner d''été, servies sur un lit de nouilles marinées.','["6 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en gros morceaux","5 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame","3 cuillères à soupe de miel","6 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","3 citrons verts, pressés, plus des quartiers supplémentaires pour servir","100g de mange-tout","275 g de nouilles aux œufs cuites","1 grosse carotte, pelée et coupée en fines lanières ou râpée grossièrement","½ bouquet de coriandre hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le poulet dans un bol. Dans un autre bol, fouetter ensemble l''ail, le gingembre, l''huile de sésame, le miel, la sauce soja et le jus de citron vert. Ajoutez-en un tiers au poulet et gardez le reste pour les nouilles. Mélangez le tout et réservez au frais une nuit ou quelques heures.","Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition. Ajouter le mangetout et cuire 1 min, puis égoutter et rincer sous l''eau froide. Mélangez les nouilles cuites avec le mangetout, la carotte, le reste de la marinade, la coriandre et les graines de sésame.","Chauffer le gril à feu moyen. Enfiler le poulet sur trois ou quatre longues brochettes, disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie plate et faire griller pendant 12 minutes en retournant les brochettes à mi-cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient cuites. Servir les brochettes sur un plateau de nouilles avec des quartiers de citron vert supplémentaires à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:05:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10380,6201,'fr','Lahori chanay ki daal','Essayez cette version du chanay ki daal pour goûter aux stands de nourriture de rue de Lahore au Pakistan – la cardamome noire aide à imiter le goût du charbon fumé.','["350 Chana Dal","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à soupe de ghee (ou de beurre non salé)","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin entières","1 cardamome noire (facultatif)","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1⁄2 po de morceau de gingembre, pelé","4 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1⁄2 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1⁄2 poudre de piment rouge ou poudre de piment du Cachemire","1 cuillère à soupe de kasuri methi (fenugrec séché) (facultatif)","1 piment vert, finement haché","petit bouquet de feuilles de coriandre hachées","1⁄2 po de morceau de gingembre, pelé et coupé en julienne","1 cuillère à café de chaat masala (facultatif)"]','["Lavez et faites tremper le chana daal pendant environ 30 minutes. Versez dans une grande casserole, versez dessus 2 litres d''eau et faites bouillir à feu moyen pendant 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres mais sans se défaire ni pâteux. Ajoutez un peu plus d''eau si elle sèche. Égoutter toute eau restante.","Faites chauffer l''huile et le ghee dans une casserole à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus. Ajoutez les graines de cumin et la cardamome noire et faites cuire brièvement pendant environ 15 à 20 secondes. Ajoutez l''oignon et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il devienne doré, puis baissez le feu à doux-moyen et continuez à remuer pendant 5 minutes.","Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre, faites revenir environ 30 secondes, en remuant constamment pour éviter de coller.","Ajoutez le concentré de tomates, un peu d''eau, le curcuma, une bonne pincée de sel et la poudre de piment rouge. Faire revenir environ 2 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce que l''eau ait complètement réduit.","Versez les lentilles cuites et versez 150 ml d''eau. Baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes en remuant régulièrement pour éviter de brûler le fond.","Incorporez le kasuri methi si vous en utilisez, puis couvrez et laissez cuire environ 2-3 minutes de plus. Servir avec le piment haché, la coriandre, le gingembre en julienne et le chaat masala parsemés, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10381,3849,'fr','Crevettes aigre-douce','Transformez des crevettes en une friandise à emporter – des crevettes aigre-douces – en moins de temps qu''il n''en faudrait pour les faire livrer. Alternativement, essayez avec du poulet si vous préférez','["300 g de crevettes crues","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","40g de farine de maïs","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées grossièrement","riz cuit, pour servir","1 oignon rouge, haché grossièrement","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et hachés grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","100 ml de vinaigre de malt","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe de ketchup aux tomates"]','["Versez les crevettes dans un bol et mélangez-les avec le soja, puis laissez reposer quelques minutes. Incorporer la maïzena.","Faites chauffer l''huile à feu vif jusqu''à une profondeur de 3 à 4 cm. Lorsqu''elles brillent ou qu''un thermomètre de cuisson indique 170°C, faites frire les crevettes par lots pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes et dorées, en les retournant avec une écumoire à mi-cuisson. Soulever délicatement sur une assiette à l''aide de l''écumoire. Éteignez le feu. Laissez la poêle refroidir quelques minutes.","Versez délicatement tout l''huile du wok sauf 1 cuillère à soupe – conservez le reste pour l''utiliser dans une autre recette ou jetez-le.","Remettez le wok sur feu vif. Lorsque l''huile brille, ajoutez délicatement l''oignon et les poivrons et faites sauter pendant 1 min. Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et poursuivez la cuisson 30 secondes, puis saupoudrez de sucre et versez le vinaigre. Augmentez le feu et faites bouillir pendant 2 minutes. Incorporer le soja et le ketchup pour obtenir une sauce épaisse et brillante. Lorsque vous êtes prêt à servir, remettez les crevettes dans la poêle et remuez pour les enrober de sauce. Répartir sur la coriandre hachée et servir avec du riz cuit à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:05:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10382,3851,'fr','Riz frit au chou frisé et au kimchi','Donnez vie au riz frit dans ce souper rapide avec du kimchi fermenté et percutant. Si vous n''avez pas de chou frisé, vous pouvez utiliser du pak choi ou les légumes verts de votre choix.','["100g de chou frisé","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","100 g de riz basmati cuit","120 grammes de Kimchi","2 gros œufs","quelques feuilles de coriandre, pour servir","shichimi togarashi et huile de piment, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Portez à ébullition une casserole d''eau salée, ajoutez le chou frisé et laissez cuire 1 min. Égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen. Ajouter les oignons nouveaux et l''ail et cuire 1 min. Augmentez le feu, incorporez le riz et laissez cuire 3 minutes. Ajoutez le kimchi et le chou frisé et remuez jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien chaud.","Faites chauffer le reste de l’huile dans une poêle séparée à feu vif. Cassez les œufs et faites cuire sans les déranger pendant plusieurs minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés sur les bords et que les jaunes soient encore un peu coulants.","Répartir le riz dans deux bols peu profonds, garnir des œufs au plat, de la coriandre, puis du shichimi togarashi et de l''huile de piment, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10383,3855,'fr','Crevettes frites avec sauce aux piments forts à l''ail','Essayez ce plat coréen-chinois classique ; une touche de crevettes aigre-douces. Les crevettes sont panées, frites et enrobées d''une sauce épicée à l''ail.','["huile végétale, pour la friture","700 g de grosses crevettes décortiquées, déveinées et épongées","65g de maïzena","95 g de fécule de pomme de terre","50g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 blanc d''oeuf","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","4½ cuillères à café de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","1 cuillère à café de gochujang","1-2 cuillères à café de sriracha, de sauce chili ou de sauce chili-ail, selon la saveur piquante que vous aimez","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame grillé","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","3 cuillères à soupe d''oignon coupé en dés","6 gousses d''ail, râpées ou hachées finement","1 piment rouge coréen frais, ou piment Fresno, coupé en dés","1 piment vert coréen frais ou jalapeño, coupé en dés","une poignée d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés en biais","riz blanc cuit"]','["Dans une grande poêle large à fond épais d''au moins 13 cm de profondeur, faites chauffer 5 cm d''huile végétale à feu moyen-vif (assurez-vous que la poêle n''est pas remplie à plus des deux tiers) jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne 190°C. Pendant que l''huile chauffe, préparez la pâte. Dans un bol, mélangez la maïzena, la fécule de pomme de terre, la farine et le bicarbonate de soude avec une pincée de sel. Ajoutez le blanc d''œuf, l''huile végétale et 120 ml d''eau et fouettez pour former une pâte épaisse.","En travaillant par lots, enduisez les crevettes dans la pâte, en laissant l''excédent s''égoutter dans le bol. Plongez délicatement les crevettes dans l''huile chaude, une à la fois, et faites-les frire, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, environ 1½ minutes. Transférer sur une grille ou une assiette recouverte de papier pour égoutter. Répétez avec les crevettes restantes, en laissant l''huile revenir à 190 °C entre les lots.","Laissez l''huile revenir à 190°C, puis remettez délicatement les crevettes dans l''huile et faites-les frire une seconde fois pendant 1½ à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très croustillantes. Transférer sur une grille ou une assiette tapissée de papier pour égoutter. Annuler.","Pour faire la sauce, fouettez ensemble le sucre, la purée de tomates, la sauce soja, le vinaigre, le gochujang, la sriracha et l''huile de sésame dans un bol avec le reste de maïzena et 60 ml d''eau jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Annuler.","Faites chauffer l''huile végétale dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif et ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail, les piments rouges et verts. Cuire environ 30 secondes, en remuant, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste parfumé. Ajouter le mélange de sauce et cuire environ 45 secondes en remuant jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe et devienne brillante. Ajouter les crevettes frites, mélanger rapidement pour enrober et transférer dans une assiette. Répartir les oignons nouveaux et servir immédiatement avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10384,7015,'fr','Huile d''arachide, de piment et d''ail','Versez cette huile d''arachide, de piment et d''ail piquante sur des nouilles instantanées, des ramen, des œufs au plat croustillants sur du pain grillé et une salade de steak. Les cacahuètes ajoutent un joli croquant','["2 grosses gousses d''ail","200 ml d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","1-2 cuillères à café de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","40 g de cacahuètes finement hachées"]','["Tranchez finement les gousses d''ail. Faites chauffer l''huile de sésame dans une poêle et faites grésiller l''ail jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré. Laisser refroidir. Incorporer le vinaigre de vin de riz, les flocons de piment, la sauce soja et les cacahuètes. Versez dans un pot de 200 ml, assaisonnez et secouez bien."]','2026-01-11 00:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10385,4295,'fr','Bol de légumes teriyaki rôtis','Savourez un bol de légumes végétalien équilibré composé de riz brun garni de légumes colorés et de pois chiches cuits dans une sauce teriyaki. Il livre quatre de vos 5 par jour','["300 g de brocoli à longues tiges","2 bébés pak choi, coupés en quartiers","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers de 3 cm","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché","4 carottes, coupées en quartiers","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame ou d''olive","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce teriyaki","1 gros morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","400 g de riz brun cuit","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame noir et blanc grillées"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Hachez les tiges de brocoli en laissant les fleurons entiers et mettez le tout dans un grand bol. Ajouter le pak choi, les oignons rouges, les poivrons, les carottes, les pois chiches (épongés avec du papier absorbant), l''huile, 3 cuillères à soupe de sauce teriyaki et le gingembre. Remuer jusqu''à ce que tout soit enrobé et assaisonner légèrement. Verser sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive en une seule couche uniforme, en utilisant deux plaques si nécessaire.","Cuire les légumes pendant 35 à 40 minutes, en remuant à mi-cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Lorsqu’il reste 5 minutes de cuisson, faites chauffer le riz. Répartir le riz dans les bols et garnir de légumes rôtis. Arroser de la sauce teriyaki réservée et parsemer d''oignons nouveaux et de graines de sésame."]','2026-01-11 00:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10386,5471,'fr','Nouilles udon au sésame et au kimchi','Savourez des nouilles udon avec du kimchi, du radis et de la ciboule pour un repas rapide en milieu de semaine qui fournit trois de vos 5 par jour. Garnir d''un œuf au plat et de flocons de piment','["200 g de nouilles udon directement au wok","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","1 oignon, coupé en deux et finement tranché","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","200 g de brocoli à longues tiges, tiges tranchées","75 g de kimchi finement haché","100 g de radis finement tranchés","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","½ cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","2 gros œufs","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame noir","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment (facultatif)"]','["Mettez les nouilles dans une passoire au-dessus de l''évier et versez-y une bouilloire d''eau bouillante. Remuer pour séparer, puis laisser égoutter.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame dans une grande poêle à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''oignon et le gingembre et faites revenir pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement ramollis. Ajoutez le brocoli, le kimchi et le radis et poursuivez la cuisson 5 minutes. Incorporer les nouilles égouttées, les oignons nouveaux et la sauce soja.","Pendant ce temps, mettez la ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile restante dans une petite poêle et faites revenir les œufs pendant 3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits à votre goût. Servez les nouilles dans des bols avec un œuf dessus et saupoudrez de graines de sésame et de quelques flocons de piment, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10387,3926,'fr','Curry de tomates et de noix de coco','Célébrez les tomates – encore mieux si elles sont cultivées sur place – avec ce curry juteux à la noix de coco, qui apporte beaucoup de couleur et de saveur à votre assiette','["1 cuillère à café bombée de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café bombée de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à café bombée de graines de fenouil","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou de colza","10 feuilles de curry","3 gros oignons, tranchés finement","1 cuillère à café bombée de graines de moutarde noire","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment vert, finement haché","1 kg de grosses tomates mûres, coupées en quartiers","250 g de tomates cerises ou de petites tomates italiennes","400 ml de lait de coco en boîte","2 cuillères à café bombées de pâte de tamarin","2 cuillères à café bombées de sucre roux ou de palme","riz cuit, pour servir"]','["Versez les graines de cumin, de coriandre et de fenouil dans une grande poêle à frire sèche à feu moyen-vif et faites-les griller jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées et légèrement dorées. Retirer immédiatement du feu, puis broyer grossièrement à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier ou d''un moulin à épices.","Versez l''huile dans la poêle. Ajoutez les feuilles de curry et faites grésiller une minute, puis ajoutez les oignons. Faire frire environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Ajoutez les graines de moutarde, le mélange d''épices moulues, le curcuma, le sel, l''ail et le piment, et faites revenir encore quelques minutes. Ajoutez toutes les tomates et faites revenir encore une minute avant d''ajouter le lait de coco, le tamarin et le sucre.","Laisser mijoter le curry pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient bien tendres et que le liquide épaississe un peu. Goûtez pour l’assaisonnement et ajoutez un peu plus de sel ou de sucre si nécessaire. Servir chaud avec le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10388,3962,'fr','Nouilles aux œufs croustillants à l''huile de piment','Préparez votre propre huile de piment croustillant et utilisez-la pour assaisonner les nouilles et le pak choi. Garnissez d’œufs au plat pour un plat réconfortant ultime.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","2 têtes de pak choi, chacune coupée en deux jusqu''au cœur","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre noir chinois","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","pincée de sucre","200 g de nouilles cuites (j''utilise des nouilles directement au wok, des nouilles aux œufs, udon ou ramen)","2 gros œufs","4 petites échalotes, coupées en deux et émincées","1 tête d''ail (environ 8 à 10 gousses) tranchée finement","1 bâton de cannelle de 10 cm","Anis 4 étoiles","500 ml d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de grains de poivre du Sichuan","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché finement","30 g de flocons de piment rouge écrasés","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre"]','["Pour faire l''huile de piment, versez les échalotes, l''ail, le bâton de cannelle, l''anis étoilé et l''huile dans une grande poêle (une poêle à frire est bonne), puis portez à grésillement doux. Cuire 15 à 20 minutes à feu doux-moyen, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les échalotes et l''ail soient croustillants et dorés. Ils brûleront facilement si la chaleur est trop élevée, alors surveillez la poêle.","Pendant ce temps, faites griller les graines de sésame dans une poêle sèche jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, puis versez-les dans un bol et réservez. Mettez les graines de cumin et les grains de poivre du Sichuan dans la poêle et faites griller pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient aromatiques. Verser dans un pilon et un mortier ou dans un moulin à épices et réduire en poudre. Mélangez avec les graines de sésame grillées.","Ajoutez le gingembre, les flocons de piment, le soja et le sucre dans le bol avec les épices grillées et moulues. Lorsque les échalotes et l''ail sont croustillants, filtrez l''huile sur le bol à l''aide d''une passoire. Laissez refroidir les morceaux croustillants d''ail et d''échalote dans la passoire et devenez encore plus croustillants. Jetez la cannelle et l’anis étoilé.","Incorporer les échalotes et l''ail refroidis au mélange d''huile épicée. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux semaines dans un bocal hermétique et stérilisé.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à préparer les nouilles, faites chauffer l''huile végétale dans l''awok. Ajoutez le pak choi et faites sauter pendant une minute avec un peu d''eau et une pincée de sel. Couvrez avec un couvercle (ou une plaque à pâtisserie si vous n''en avez pas). Faites cuire à la vapeur pendant une minute, puis retirez les légumes du wok en laissant le liquide s''égoutter. Réserver dans une assiette. Mettez le vinaigre, la sauce soja, l''huile de sésame et le sucre dans la poêle avec 2 cuillères à café d''huile de piment croustillant. Portez à bulle, puis ajoutez les nouilles et mélangez quelques minutes à feu vif jusqu''à ce que la sauce adhère aux nouilles et qu''elles soient molles et glissantes. Répartissez les nouilles dans deux bols et déposez le pak choi dessus.","Essuyez la poêle. Ajoutez un autre filet d’huile de piment croustillant avec environ 2 cuillères à café de sédiments du pot. Lorsqu''ils grésillent, cassez les œufs et faites-les frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants sur le pourtour, en les arrosant d''huile pendant la cuisson. Faites glisser les œufs au plat sur les nouilles, en ajoutant des morceaux plus croustillants du pot, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10389,3988,'fr','Mme Curry à la Singapourienne','Suzanne Bloor, membre de GF, partage son plat préféré du vendredi soir : un curry de poulet simplifié aux influences de l''Asie du Sud-Est. Idéal pour une famille de quatre personnes','["80 g de pâte de curry nyonya (disponible en ligne et chez Waitrose & Partners, ou voir le conseil ci-dessous)","500 g de cuisses de poulet avec os, sans la peau","200 g de pommes de terre coupées en cubes de 3 cm","150 g de carottes coupées en cubes de 3 cm","1 gros oignon, haché grossièrement","100 ml de lait de coco","riz cuit et pains naan (facultatif), pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettre 200 ml d''eau et la pâte de curry dans une grande casserole allant au four. Remuer et laisser mijoter doucement à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit parfumé.","Ajouter le poulet, les pommes de terre, les carottes et l''oignon, assaisonner et bien mélanger. Augmentez le feu à moyen et portez à ébullition, incorporez le lait de coco, puis ramenez à ébullition. Retirer du feu, couvrir la casserole et transférer au four pour cuire pendant 1 h 15, en retirant le couvercle après 45 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres mais ne se désagrègent pas complètement et que le poulet soit bien cuit. Le curry doit avoir la consistance d''un bouillon. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement.","Servir dans des bols peu profonds sur du riz, avec quelques pains naan à côté, si vous le souhaitez. Se conservera couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:05:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10390,7017,'fr','Curry vert thaï','Oubliez l''achat d''un pot de sauce toute prête et préparez un curry vert thaïlandais aromatique à partir de rien. Cette recette donne plus de pâte de curry que nécessaire, mais vous pouvez congeler le reste pour la prochaine fois.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2-3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry vert (voir ci-dessous)","200 g de cuisses de poulet décortiquées, désossées et coupées en morceaux","400 g de lait de coco en boîte","2 aubergines thaïlandaises","50 g d''aubergines aux petits pois","2 petits maïs, tranchés en biais","50 g de pois mange-tout","2-4 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","2-4 cuillères à café de sucre ou de sucre de palme","2 feuilles de tilleul, tiges enlevées","¼ bouquet de basilic thaï","1 piment rouge, tranché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","8 piments verts, finement tranchés","5g de racine de curcuma fraîche","1 tige de citronnelle, meurtrie et finement hachée","25 g de galanga finement haché","2 tiges de racine de coriandre, finement hachées","2 feuilles de citron vert, hachées grossièrement","4 échalotes thaïlandaises, pelées et tranchées finement","10 g de gingembre finement haché (facultatif)","½ cuillère à café de pâte de crevettes"]','["Pour faire la pâte de curry, mélanger progressivement tous les ingrédients, sauf la pâte de crevettes, à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Ajouter les ingrédients un à un et piler vigoureusement après chacun pour former une pâte grossière. Ajoutez la pâte de crevettes et continuez à piler jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. La pâte est prête lorsque vous ne parvenez plus à identifier aucun des ingrédients. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique au réfrigérateur pendant 3 à 5 jours ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois.","Pour faire le curry, faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole à feu doux. Ajoutez la pâte de curry vert et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit parfumée – vous n''aurez pas besoin de toute la pâte. Increase the heat to medium and add in the chicken pieces, coating with the paste. Lorsque le poulet est doré, versez la moitié du lait de coco en évitant d’ajouter de l’eau au fond du moule – cela diviserait le curry. Stir continuously for 10 mins or until the chicken is fully cooked and the sauce is simmering.","Versez le reste du lait de coco, jetez l''eau, augmentez le feu pour porter à ébullition, puis remettez le feu à moyen. Ajoutez les aubergines thaïlandaises et aux petits pois avec les petits maïs et les pois mange-tout et laissez mijoter, en remuant de temps en temps, pendant environ 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les saveurs se mélangent, que la sauce épaississe légèrement et que les légumes soient tendres.","Ajoutez progressivement la sauce de poisson et le sucre de palme, en remuant et en goûtant après chaque ajout jusqu''à ce que vous soyez satisfait. Ajoutez les feuilles de citron vert et la majeure partie du basilic thaï, puis laissez cuire encore 5 minutes pour laisser infuser leurs arômes. Pour servir, versez le curry dans des plats de service individuels et parsemez-le de tranches de piment et du reste des feuilles de basilic thaï."]','2026-01-11 00:05:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10391,6863,'fr','gulab jamun','Préparez l''un des desserts de festival les plus appréciés de l''Inde, le gulab jamun. Ces dumplings frits sont parfumés à la cardamome et imprégnés de sirop de rose et de safran','["4 gousses de cardamome verte, percées","600 g de sucre en poudre","quelques gouttes d''eau de rose","¼ cuillère à café de brins de safran, trempés dans 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau tiède pendant une heure","2 cuillères à café de pistaches hachées","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","6 gousses de cardamome verte, graines retirées","100 g de lait entier en poudre","40g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","50 g de ghee maison (voir ci-dessous) ou de beurre non salé ramolli","1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt nature entier","un filet de jus de citron","4-5 cuillères à soupe de lait entier","l''huile de tournesol, pour vos mains","1 kg de ghee du commerce, pour la friture"]','["Pour faire le sirop, faites chauffer la cardamome, le sucre et 500 ml d''eau dans une casserole, sans laisser bouillir l''eau avant que le sucre ne soit dissous. Laissez mijoter 10 min, puis laissez refroidir.","Ajoutez l''eau de rose, le safran et un peu de son eau de trempage, en ajoutant progressivement pour donner une saveur subtile. Réserver dans la poêle.","Pour faire le gulab jamun, broyez la cardamome et le sucre avec un pilon et un mortier.","Tamisez le lait en poudre, la farine et la levure chimique dans un bol et incorporez la cardamome moulue. Frottez le ghee ou le beurre maison du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à des miettes grossières.","Ajoutez le yaourt, le jus de citron et suffisamment de lait pour former une pâte molle – veillez à ne pas trop travailler le mélange.","Huilez vos mains avec un peu d''huile de tournesol et façonnez des petites portions de pâte en boules de la taille d''une petite noix, d''environ 3 cm de diamètre et de 20 g chacune. Vous devriez avoir 16 balles. Veillez à ce que les boulettes soient lisses et ne présentent ni fissures ni plis.","Réchauffez le sirop. Une fois à ébullition, éteignez le feu et couvrez avec un couvercle.","Faites chauffer le ghee dans un wok ou un karahi à 130°C. Lorsqu''un petit morceau de pâte tombé dans l''huile devient doré en 40 secondes environ, faites frire les boules par lots à feu moyen, en les déplaçant jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient d''un brun uniforme et foncé, environ 5 à 7 minutes. Retirer de la poêle à l''aide d''une écumoire, puis égoutter sur du papier absorbant. Ajoutez-les au sirop chaud et laissez-les tremper pendant 2-3 heures ou de préférence toute la nuit.","Au moment de manger, réchauffez le gulab jamun dans une grande poêle, en versant dessus le sirop. Servir bien chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:05:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10392,7019,'fr','Atchara','Servez de l''atchara – papaye marinée – avec notre inasal de poulet d''inspiration philippine pour un fabuleux festin du week-end. Utilisez du mooli comme substitut si vous ne parvenez pas à vous procurer de la papaye verte. Cette salade se conserve cinq jours au réfrigérateur','["50 g de papaye verte ou mooli, pelée et coupée en très fines lanières","40 g de carottes pelées et coupées en très fines lanières","20 g d''échalotes banane coupées en très fines lanières","1 piment rouge, coupé en fines lanières","Morceau de gingembre de 2,5 cm, pelé et coupé en fines lanières","1 gousse d''ail, pelée et laissée entière","300 ml de vinaigre de cidre","210 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Mélangez la papaye, les carottes, les échalotes, le piment, le gingembre et l''ail avec une bonne pincée de sel marin et laissez égoutter dans une passoire pendant 10 minutes. Rincez le mélange de légumes et égouttez-le bien.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition le vinaigre de cidre, le sucre semoule et 90 ml d''eau, puis éteignez le feu. Mettez les légumes dans deux bocaux stérilisés de 330 ml ou dans un récipient hermétique et versez dessus le liquide de marinade. Servir avec le poulet inasal (voir « se marie bien avec » ci-dessous). Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:05:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10393,4052,'fr','Boulettes de patates douces','Préparez une collation taïwanaise préférée, des boulettes de patates douces. Ils sont faits de patate douce et de fécule de tapioca, roulés en boules et frits jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.','["175 g de patate douce pelée et hachée grossièrement (poids préparé)","35g de sucre en poudre","125 g de fécule de tapioca","huile végétale, pour frire"]','["Faites cuire la patate douce à la vapeur à feu moyen pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit suffisamment tendre pour y insérer un couteau. Écrasez la patate douce à l''aide d''un presse-purée ou d''une fourchette jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Ajoutez le sucre, la fécule de tapioca et une bonne pincée d''assaisonnement, puis mélangez bien avec les mains. Versez progressivement 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, puis mélangez bien jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte souple se forme.","Divisez la pâte en quatre et roulez chaque morceau en forme de long boudin d''environ 2 cm de diamètre. Coupez chaque longueur de pâte en morceaux de 2 cm et roulez-les en boules dans le creux de votre main. Ne vous inquiétez pas s’ils s’effritent, continuez simplement à les écraser jusqu’à ce qu’ils forment une boule.","Remplissez à moitié une grande casserole à fond épais avec l''huile. Chauffer à température moyenne jusqu''à ce qu''un thermomètre de cuisson indique 120°C. Abaissez des lots de boules dans l''huile (vous devrez peut-être les faire cuire en deux ou trois lots) et faites-les frire pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à flotter. Lorsqu''ils flottent, baissez légèrement le feu. Retournez les boules dans l''huile à l''aide d''une écumoire jusqu''à ce qu''elles grossissent, toutes les minutes, pendant environ 3-4 minutes. Remontez le feu et continuez à faire frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Transférez les boules sur du papier absorbant à l’aide d’une écumoire. Laisser égoutter et refroidir un peu, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10394,7021,'fr','Ramen au poulet végétalien','Utilisez les restes de légumes pour préparer ce ramen végétalien facile. Vous pouvez également ajouter du maïs doux, des edamames ou des légumes verts surgelés pour un savoureux repas en milieu de semaine.','["2 nids de nouilles ramen","1 marmite ou cube de légumes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","Paquet de 160 g de morceaux de style poulet Cluck","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre râpé ou de gingembre râpé surgelé","2 cuillères à soupe de maïs doux, d''edamame ou de petits pois surgelés","une poignée de légumes verts de printemps ou quelques feuilles de chou, râpées","½-1 carotte, râpée","huile de piment ou sauce soja, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, égouttez-les bien et réservez. Mélangez la marmite de légumes dans une casserole avec 300 ml d''eau et portez à ébullition. Gardez au chaud à feu doux.","Faites chauffer ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame dans une poêle, puis faites frire les morceaux de style poulet What the Cluck jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Réserver dans une assiette.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et faites revenir le gingembre et le maïs doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à se colorer. Mettez les légumes verts dans le bouillon pour les réchauffer, en ajoutant la carotte râpée si vous la préférez plus tendre. Ramenez le bouillon à ébullition.","Répartissez les nouilles dans deux bols, disposez les légumes et les morceaux de style poulet Cluck dessus, puis versez sur le bouillon. Arroser d''huile de piment ou de sauce soja, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10395,6614,'fr','Filet de porc hoisin collant avec feuilles de sésame et nouilles','Savourez un filet de porc hoisin collant avec des feuilles de sésame et des nouilles pour un souper facile les soirs de semaine chargés. Il est faible en calories et en matières grasses, mais plein de saveur','["4 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin, plus un peu pour servir","1 filet de porc (environ 400 g), gras et tendons parés","4 nids de nouilles aux œufs","3 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","300 g de chou frisé, de verdure printanière ou de bette à carde, haché","100 g d''oignons nouveaux, émincés","200 g de haricots ou de petits pois edamame écossés surgelés, décongelés","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja faible en sel","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Badigeonner le hoisin sur tout le porc et transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier d''aluminium. Rôtir, en arrosant toutes les 10 minutes, pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Sortir du four et laisser reposer 5 min.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les nouilles aux œufs en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, égouttez-les, puis mélangez-les avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame pour les empêcher de coller ensemble. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile de sésame dans un wok ou une grande poêle et faites frire les légumes verts pendant 4 minutes, en ajoutant un peu d''eau pour aider à ramollir les tiges. Ajoutez la plupart des oignons nouveaux et tous les haricots edamame. Faites frire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes verts soient tendres, puis incorporez les graines de sésame, la sauce soja et le vinaigre de riz. Mélangez le tout pour bien enrober.","Coupez le porc en tranches épaisses et servez-le avec les nouilles, les feuilles de sésame et le reste des oignons nouveaux saupoudrés sur le dessus. Servir avec plus de sauce hoisin, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10396,7023,'fr','Aloo Tikki','Dégustez ces galettes de pommes de terre indiennes, fourrées aux petits pois épicés à la poudre de mangue fruitée, accompagnées d''une sauce au tamarin et d''une relish à la coriandre fraîche.','["500 g de pommes de terre Maris Piper ou King Edwards, coupées en morceaux égaux","3 cuillères à soupe de chapelure fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour la friture","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","20 g de gingembre frais pelé et finement râpé","1 piment vert épépiné et finement haché","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","½ cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de poudre de mangue (amchoor) ou le jus d''un ½ citron","75 g de petits pois surgelés","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée et faites cuire les pommes de terre jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres lorsqu''on les perce avec un couteau. Égoutter les pommes de terre, puis les écraser et laisser refroidir avant d''incorporer la chapelure et la farine.","Maintenant, préparez la garniture. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir l''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Incorporer le gingembre, le piment vert, les épices et la poudre de mangue, puis ajouter les petits pois surgelés.","Cuire à feu moyen, en remuant constamment, jusqu''à ce que les pois soient décongelés et tendres. Retirer du feu, puis écraser grossièrement les petits pois à la fourchette et incorporer la coriandre hachée. Laisser refroidir.","Divisez le mélange de pommes de terre en neuf portions avec les mains mouillées. Aplatissez une portion en un disque de 5 cm de diamètre et 1 cm d''épaisseur dans votre paume. Mettez une cuillère à café de garniture aux pois épicés au centre du disque, puis amenez délicatement la purée autour de la garniture pour qu''elle soit complètement enfermée. Aplatissez le « tikki » pour qu’il ressemble à une galette. Répétez avec le reste de la pomme de terre et la garniture, puis disposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie et réfrigérez pendant 20 à 30 minutes pour raffermir.","Faites chauffer 6 à 8 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle ou sur une plaque chauffante et faites cuire les tikkis par lots à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Servir immédiatement avec une sauce au tamarin et aux dattes et une relish à la coriandre (voir « se marie bien avec » ci-dessous)."]','2026-01-11 00:05:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10397,4080,'fr','Siu Mai (dim sum)','Préparez l''un des types de dim sum les plus populaires, le siu mai. Ils sont traditionnellement garnis d''œufs de poisson, mais nous avons opté pour des baies de goji pour une touche de couleur.','["40 g de châtaignes d''eau égouttées et hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre, râpé","1 oignon nouveau, finement haché","1½ cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère Lee Kum Kee Premium","¾ cuillère à soupe de vin de riz Shaoxing ou de sherry sec","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame pure Lee Kum Kee","120 g de crevettes hachées finement","200 g de porc haché","1 blanc d''oeuf","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de pomme de terre ou de maïzena","20 feuilles de wonton d''environ 8 cm de diamètre","20 baies de goji, pour le dessus (facultatif)","Sauce soja sucrée Lee Kum Kee mélangée avec un peu de gingembre râpé et de l''huile de piment Lee Kum Kee Chiu Chow (facultatif), pour tremper"]','["Mettez les châtaignes d''eau, le gingembre, la ciboule, la sauce soja légère Premium, le vin de riz, l''huile de sésame pure, les crevettes, le porc, le blanc d''œuf et la farine de pomme de terre dans un bol et mélangez bien avec vos mains. Laisser mariner 20 à 30 minutes pour que les saveurs se mélangent.","Empilez les emballages sur un plan de travail recouvert d''un chiffon humide et tapissez une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Mettez une feuille dans le creux de votre main et ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de garniture au centre. Relevez les côtés de l’emballage autour de la garniture pour former un panier, mais ne serrez pas le dessus – vous devriez toujours pouvoir voir la garniture.","Ajoutez plus de garniture si nécessaire jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne le haut de l''espace, en appuyant doucement avec un doigt humide jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit à plat. Tapotez la boulette sur le banc pour aplatir la base et posez-la sur le plateau préparé. Ajoutez une baie de goji, si vous le souhaitez. Répétez avec les emballages restants et la garniture jusqu''à ce que vous ayez environ 20 boulettes.","Mettez un disque de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif dans un cuiseur vapeur et remplissez-le de quelques boulettes en laissant un peu d''espace entre chacune. Couvrir et cuire à la vapeur au-dessus d''un wokof d''eau frémissante pendant 8 à 10 minutes, ou utiliser un cuiseur vapeur électrique. Répétez avec les boulettes restantes. Servir avec la trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:05:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10398,7025,'fr','char siu cantonais','Savourez ce délicieux porc glacé au miel avec du riz au jasmin, du pak choi et des oignons nouveaux pour un souper facile. Choisissez des steaks de porc plus gras pour plus de saveur','["3 steaks d''épaule de porc (choisissez des steaks plus gras, si possible)","riz au jasmin cuit et pak choi cuit à la vapeur, pour servir","1 oignon nouveau, finement tranché, pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin (vous pouvez aussi utiliser de la sauce aux huîtres, mais vous aurez besoin de plus de miel car elle est moins sucrée)","1⁄2 cube de tofu rouge en boîte, plus 3 cuillères à café de sauce en boîte","1⁄2 cuillère à café de sauce soja légère","1⁄2 cuillère à café de sauce soja noire","1 cuillère à café de vin de riz Shaohsing (vin de cuisine chinois)","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","6 cuillères à soupe de miel"]','["Commencez par préparer la marinade. Fouettez ensemble la sauce hoisin, le tofu rouge (avec la sauce de la boîte), les sauces soja, le vin de riz, l''ail et 3 cuillères à soupe de miel. Versez la moitié dans un grand bol avec le porc, en réservant le reste de la marinade pour l''arroser plus tard. Assaisonner le porc, remuer pour bien l''enrober et réfrigérer pendant 5 heures pour mariner.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Transférer le porc dans un plat à rôtir et rôtir pendant 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le reste de la marinade avec le reste du miel. Badigeonnez le porc toutes les 10 minutes pour qu''il soit uniformément coloré. Servir avec le riz et le pak choi et les oignons nouveaux parsemés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10399,7029,'fr','Rouleaux de papier de riz arc-en-ciel','Évadez-vous de l''ornière des sandwichs à l''heure du déjeuner avec ces rouleaux de papier de riz. Le chou rouge et les radis ajoutent une jolie touche de couleur, ou essayez la laitue iceberg ou Little Gem','["50 g de vermicelles fins de nouilles de riz","12 wraps et papier de riz","une poignée de feuilles de menthe ou de coriandre, ou de ciboulette ciselée (ou un mélange)","200 g de crevettes cuites ou poulet cuit et émincé","¼ de concombre, paré et finement tranché en allumettes","1 carotte, parée et finement tranchée en allumettes","40 g de chou rouge émincé très finement","une petite poignée de radis, parés et tranchés finement","½ mangue dénoyautée, coupée en deux et finement tranchée","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","1 cuillère à soupe de tahin","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame, plus un peu pour arroser","½ citron vert, jus"]','["Faites tremper les nouilles dans l''eau bouillante de la bouilloire, en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Égouttez-les et rincez-les sous l''eau froide pour les refroidir, puis ajoutez un peu d''huile de sésame pour éviter qu''ils ne collent ensemble.","Ensuite, préparez la trempette en mélangeant tous les ingrédients ensemble. Annuler.","Remplissez un plat large et peu profond de quelques centimètres de profondeur avec de l''eau tiède. En travaillant avec une feuille de riz à la fois, faites-la tremper pendant quelques secondes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit flexible, puis posez-la sur une planche à découper. Répartissez quelques herbes au centre, puis garnissez de quelques crevettes ou d''un peu de poulet, puis de quelques morceaux de légumes et de mangue, et d''un petit paquet de nouilles. Essayez de garder les garnitures au centre et ne remplissez pas trop. Rentrez les extrémités du film sur les ingrédients pour les enfermer légèrement, puis enroulez-les sur les côtés, en gardant le tout aussi serré que possible. Placez les rouleaux finis sur une assiette recouverte d''une feuille de papier absorbant humide jusqu''à ce que vous ayez fini d''assembler tous les rouleaux. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 24 heures. Servir avec la trempette au sésame."]','2026-01-11 00:05:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10400,4125,'fr','Œufs brouillés au kimchi','Préparez un brunch respectueux des intestins avec des œufs brouillés et du kimchi servis sur du pain complet grillé. Saupoudrer d''oignons nouveaux et d''une pincée de togarashi pour finir','["2 œufs moyens","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","40 grammes de Kimchi","1 tranche de pain complet, grillée","1 oignon nouveau, tranché finement","pincée de togarashi, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Battez les œufs et le lait avec une pincée de sel. Versez dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu doux. Laissez reposer 30 secondes, puis soulevez un peu la poêle et faites tourner les œufs. Cuire encore 2 minutes, puis incorporer le kimchi en cassant les œufs pour les brouiller.","Servir les œufs brouillés au kimchi sur le pain grillé et garnir de ciboule et de tograshi, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:05:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10401,4139,'fr','Salade de nouilles au sésame, edamame et poulet','Préparez un pique-nique pour la famille avec ce déjeuner sain de nouilles de blé entier avec du poulet, des edamames, du brocoli et des graines de sésame. Préparez-le en seulement 20 minutes','["2 cuisses de poulet, cuites","1½ cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","4 nids de nouilles de blé complet","160 g de haricots edamame surgelés","160 g de brocoli à longues tiges, coupé en petits bouquets","1 cuillère à soupe de tahin","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à café de miel","1½ cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sodium","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire. Retirez la peau du poulet, puis effilochez la viande et jetez les os. Annuler. Dans une grande poêle, faire griller les graines de sésame pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, puis verser dans un grand bol (assez grand pour contenir les nouilles).","Remplissez la casserole avec l''eau de la bouilloire et portez à nouveau à ébullition. Ajoutez les nouilles et faites cuire en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Ajoutez les haricots et le brocoli pendant les 2 dernières minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le tahini, l''huile de sésame, le miel, la sauce soja et le vinaigre aux graines de sésame. Égouttez les nouilles en réservant une tasse d''eau de cuisson et passez-les sous l''eau froide pour les refroidir. Égoutter à nouveau et mélanger avec la sauce avec le poulet. Ajoutez un peu d''eau de cuisson pour rendre la sauce suffisamment fine pour enrober les nouilles (elle épaissira en refroidissant). Transférer dans des récipients et réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de manger, si ce n''est pas manger immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:05:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10402,4147,'fr','Poulet au gingembre et nouilles aux haricots verts','Essayez ce poulet au gingembre rapide dans une poêle avec des nouilles et des haricots verts comme repas rapide et facile en milieu de semaine. C’est sain, faible en gras et en calories aussi','["½ cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau, tranchées","200 g de haricots verts, parés et coupés en deux sur la largeur","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et coupé en allumettes","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 boule de gingembre, finement tranchée, plus 1 cuillère à café de sirop du pot","1 cuillère à café de maïzena mélangée à 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja noire, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de riz","200 g de nouilles aux œufs cuites"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok à feu vif et faites revenir le poulet pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez les haricots verts et faites sauter pendant 4 à 5 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce que les haricots verts soient juste tendres et que le poulet soit bien cuit.","Incorporer le gingembre frais et l''ail et faire sauter pendant 2 minutes, puis ajouter la tige de gingembre et le sirop, le mélange de maïzena, la sauce soja et le vinaigre. Faites sauter pendant 1 min, puis ajoutez les nouilles. Cuire jusqu''à ce que tout soit chaud et que la sauce recouvre les nouilles. Arrosez de soja, si vous le souhaitez, et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10403,7031,'fr','Canard en croûte de coriandre, prunes rôties et verdure','Dégustez ce canard en croûte de coriandre avec des prunes rôties sucrées et du pak choi dans le cadre d''un menu d''été. C’est simple et rapide, et vous n’aurez pas besoin de trouver d’ingrédients spéciaux dans les magasins','["2 cuillères à soupe de graines de coriandre légèrement écrasées","2 petits magrets de canard","2 prunes dénoyautées, coupées en deux et coupées en quartiers","2 pak choi, coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur","100 ml de bouillon de poulet","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","¼ cuillère à café de flocons de piment, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et mettre les graines de coriandre dans une assiette. Entaillez la peau des magrets de canard autant de fois que possible avec un petit couteau bien aiguisé, puis assaisonnez de sel et pressez la peau dans les graines de coriandre. Faites chauffer une poêle allant au four et ajoutez les magrets, peau vers le bas. Mettez une poêle épaisse dessus pour les alourdir et laissez cuire 7 à 8 minutes pour faire fondre le gras, en égouttant de temps en temps l''excédent.","Ajoutez les prunes et le pak choi dans la poêle, retournez les poitrines et ajoutez la moitié du bouillon. Transférer au four et cuire 4 à 5 minutes. Retirez les magrets de canard de la poêle et transférez-les dans une assiette pour qu''ils reposent avec le pak choi.","Remettez la casserole avec les prunes sur le feu et ajoutez le miel, le soja, le vinaigre et le reste du bouillon. Portez à ébullition et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit sirupeux. Découpez chaque magret de canard en quatre morceaux. Disposez deux moitiés de pak choi sur chaque assiette et placez les morceaux de magret de canard et les prunes parmi les légumes verts. Arrosez de sauce, puis saupoudrez de flocons de piment."]','2026-01-11 00:05:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10404,7033,'fr','Sauce chili douce','Préparez votre propre sauce chili douce pour cuisiner. Ce condiment thaï contient souvent de la sauce de poisson mais nous avons gardé notre version veggie','["20 piments rouges, tiges enlevées, épépinés pour une sauce plus douce","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un doigt, pelé et haché grossièrement","5 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","100 ml de vinaigre de vin blanc ou de cidre","200 g de sucre blanc en poudre"]','["Versez tous les ingrédients sauf le sucre dans un mini hachoir ou un mixeur et mélangez pour obtenir une sauce épaisse. Versez le contenu dans une casserole peu profonde avec le sucre et 100 ml d''eau et portez à ébullition.","Laisser mijoter 15 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le mélange devienne sirupeux. En le surveillant de près, continuez à laisser mijoter et remuez encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il recouvre facilement le dos de la cuillère et que vous voyiez le fond de la casserole lorsque vous remuez. Laisser refroidir et infuser 1 à 2 heures. Se conserve dans un petit pot stérilisé jusqu''à un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:05:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10405,5583,'fr','Bâtonnets de poisson aux herbes et riz à la chinoise','Ce déjeuner ou dîner sain et sans gluten fournit un équilibre de glucides et de protéines, ce qui le rend parfait pour faire le plein après l''exercice.','["100 g de riz basmati brun","160 g de petits pois surgelés","50 g de haricots verts","3 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment séchés","une bonne poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de tamari","quelques gouttes d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","2 gros œufs","Paquet de 280 g de longes de cabillaud sans peau coupées en grosses lanières (coupées en 4 lanières par longe)"]','["Faites cuire le riz dans une casserole d''eau pendant 25 minutes, en ajoutant les petits pois et les haricots pendant les 6 dernières minutes. Égoutter, puis remettre dans la poêle et incorporer les oignons nouveaux, les flocons de piment, le tout sauf 1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre hachée, le tamari et l''huile de sésame. Couverture.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive avec l''huile de colza. Battez les œufs avec 1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre restante. Coupez le poisson en grosses lanières, puis enrobez-le d''œuf et faites-le frire dans l''huile pendant quelques minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Retirez le poisson de la poêle, ajoutez le riz avec l''œuf restant et remuez. Servir dans des bols, garni de poisson."]','2026-01-11 00:05:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10406,4185,'fr','Pho à la dinde à la mijoteuse','Réduisez le gaspillage alimentaire en utilisant vos restes de dinde de Noël pour faire du bouillon – c''est excellent dans notre soupe de nouilles pho d''inspiration asiatique, pleine de saveurs fraîches','["50 g de gingembre tranché épaisse","2 oignons, coupés en deux","Anis 3 étoiles","2 bâtons de cannelle","½ cuillère à soupe de graines de coriandre","2 clous de girofle","1 carcasse de dinde ou de poulet, toute la viande retirée","2-3 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre","200 g de nouilles de riz plates","400 g de dinde ou de poulet cuit et tranché","100 g de germes de soja, carottes, mooli ou pousses blanchies ou râpées","une poignée de feuilles de basilic thaï, de menthe et de coriandre","2 piments rouges, finement tranchés","1 citron vert, coupé en quartiers","sauce hoisin et sauce sriracha, pour servir"]','["Faites revenir le gingembre et l''oignon dans une poêle sèche à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien colorés. Transférer dans la mijoteuse et chauffer à feu doux. Faites frire les épices entières pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées, puis versez-les dans la mijoteuse. Si vous êtes pressé par le temps, mettez simplement dans la mijoteuse sans faire frire.","Ajoutez la carcasse, puis versez 3 à 4 litres d''eau bouillante dans la cocotte afin que les os soient recouverts, en veillant à ne pas trop la remplir. Couvrir et cuire pendant 8 à 10 heures, selon la durée pendant laquelle vous pouvez le laisser.","Filtrer le bouillon en jetant les os et les épices. Assaisonner avec la sauce de poisson et le sucre. Pour congeler pour plus tard, laissez-le refroidir complètement et congelez-le dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à trois mois. Gardez au chaud dans la mijoteuse si vous servez immédiatement.","Faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, égouttez-les et répartissez-les dans les bols. Garnissez de dinde et de germes de soja ou de légumes, puis transférez le bouillon dans un pichet et versez-en suffisamment pour remplir les bols (vous en aurez un supplément, que vous pourrez congeler comme ci-dessus). Répartir les herbes et le piment, puis servir avec les quartiers de citron vert et les sauces."]','2026-01-11 00:05:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10407,7035,'fr','Larb de saucisse de Cheat','Essayez notre version du larb, un plat thaïlandais traditionnellement préparé à partir de viande hachée. Ici, nous avons utilisé des saucisses pour rendre les choses un peu plus simples, mais c''est quand même plein de saveurs d''inspiration asiatique.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame","2 citrons verts, jus","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce chili","½ cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","3 saucisses de porc","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés et râpés","½ bouquet de coriandre hachée","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies et déchirées","2 laitues Little Gem, feuilles séparées","1 petit concombre, coupé en allumettes"]','["Mélangez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame, le jus de citron vert, la sauce chili et la sauce de poisson. Annuler.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans un wok ou une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen. Pressez la chair des saucisses hors des peaux et dans la poêle, en la brisant avec une cuillère en bois, et faites-la frire pendant 5 à 6 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée. Incorporer la pâte de curry et faire revenir 1 min. Mélangez la moitié des oignons nouveaux et la moitié des herbes.","Disposez la laitue et le concombre dans deux bols, ajoutez le mélange de saucisses et arrosez de vinaigrette épicée. Terminez avec le reste des herbes."]','2026-01-11 00:05:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10408,7037,'fr','Soupe crémeuse au poulet et au riz au curry','Utilisez les restes de poulet pour préparer cette soupe d''inspiration asiatique avec du riz. Simple à préparer, c''est un bol copieux pour les soirées plus froides','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","2 boîtes de 400 g de lait de coco","400 ml de bouillon de poulet","100 g de riz pour risotto","4 gros œufs","environ 200 à 300 g de restes de poulet rôti, émincés","Boîte de 340 g de maïs doux égoutté","2-3 citrons verts, pressés","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole à feu moyen. Ajouter l''oignon et faire revenir pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et devienne translucide. Ajoutez la pâte de curry et laissez cuire 1 min. Incorporer le lait de coco, le bouillon de poulet et le riz pour risotto et porter à ébullition. Cuire 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre.","Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition, ajoutez les œufs et laissez cuire 7 minutes. Incorporer le poulet et le maïs doux à la soupe et cuire 5 minutes pour bien réchauffer le tout. Assaisonner selon votre goût et terminer avec le jus de citron vert. Retirez délicatement les coquilles des œufs et coupez-les en deux. Garnir la soupe avec les œufs et les oignons nouveaux."]','2026-01-11 00:05:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10409,7039,'fr','Riz sauté aux crevettes','Préparez ce plat facile d’inspiration asiatique en seulement 30 minutes. Il est sain et faible en calories mais riche en saveur, ce qui le rend parfait pour un souper rapide en famille.','["250 g de riz brun à grains longs","150 g de petits pois surgelés","100g de mange-tout","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","150 g de crevettes crues","3 œufs moyens, battus","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","½ cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz ou de vin blanc","4 oignons nouveaux, parés et tranchés"]','["Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Faites bouillir une autre casserole d''eau et blanchissez les petits pois et le mange-tout pendant 1 min, puis égouttez-les et réservez-les avec le riz.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive ou un wok à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et faites revenir encore une minute. Ajoutez les légumes blanchis et faites revenir 5 minutes, puis les crevettes et faites revenir encore 2 minutes. Incorporez le riz dans la poêle puis mettez le tout de côté. Versez les œufs battus dans le côté vide de la poêle et remuez pour les brouiller. Mélangez le tout avec les graines de sésame, le soja et le vinaigre, puis terminez par les oignons nouveaux parsemés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10410,7041,'fr','Cocktails de crevettes arc-en-ciel','Servez cette version d''inspiration asiatique du cocktail de crevettes classique en entrée ou en canapés de fête pendant la période des fêtes.','["7 cuillères à soupe bombées de mayonnaise","1 citron vert, jus","3 cuillères à café de sriracha ou autre sauce chili","15 g de gingembre mariné, haché finement","3 laitues Little Gem, feuilles séparées","300 g de gambas cuites","3 oignons nouveaux, émincés","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame noir","une poignée de craquelins de crevettes, écrasés","100 ml de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 grosse carotte, pelée et coupée en julienne","½ gros concombre, pelé en rubans","6 radis, tranchés finement"]','["Pour les cornichons, mettez le vinaigre, 50 ml d''eau, le sucre et 2 cuillères à café de sel marin dans une casserole et laissez mijoter 5 minutes à feu moyen en remuant jusqu''à ce que le sucre et le sel soient dissous. Laissez refroidir un peu. Mettez les légumes dans un bol et versez dessus le liquide de marinade. Laisser au réfrigérateur au moins 1 h.","Mélangez la mayonnaise, le jus de citron vert, la sriracha et le gingembre mariné. Disposez les feuilles de laitue dans six bols, puis garnissez de légumes marinés, de crevettes et de sauce. Terminez avec des oignons nouveaux, des graines de sésame et des crackers aux crevettes."]','2026-01-11 00:05:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10411,7043,'fr','Raviolis bah-tzang taïwanais','Essayez ces raviolis taïwanais traditionnels – le bah-tzang. Enveloppés dans des feuilles de bambou aromatiques, ils sont accompagnés d''une délicieuse garniture au porc, aux crevettes et aux champignons.','["500 g de riz à sushi","150 g de cacahuètes entières à peau rouge","20 feuilles de bambou fraîches, environ 50 g (voir astuce ci-dessous)","100 g de champignons shiitake séchés","20 g de crevettes séchées","150 g d''épaule de porc maigre, coupée en dés de 1 cm","150 g de poitrine de porc grasse, coupée en dés de 1 cm","huile végétale, si nécessaire","3 échalotes, tranchées","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","40 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 cuillères à soupe d''échalotes frites croustillantes","50g de jaune d''oeuf de canard salé (facultatif)","piment ou radis mariné et trempette sucrée et salée à base de soja, pour servir"]','["La veille du service, remplissez une grande casserole d’eau et portez à ébullition. Ajoutez les cacahuètes et laissez mijoter 25 min. Retirez les cacahuètes, égouttez-les et laissez-les tremper toute la nuit dans de l''eau fraîche et tiède. Rincer le riz dans une passoire sous l''eau froide courante et laisser tremper toute la nuit.","Pour préparer la garniture, mettez les champignons shiitake séchés et les crevettes séchées dans deux bols séparés et couvrez d''eau bouillante. Laisser reposer 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement ramolli. Retirez les champignons du liquide avec une écumoire et remettez l''excès d''eau dans le bol. Hachez grossièrement les champignons pour obtenir une taille similaire à celle des crevettes. Égoutter les crevettes et réserver.","Faites cuire les feuilles de bambou pour les rendre souples. Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau, ajoutez les feuilles et faites cuire à feu vif pendant 5 min. Éteignez le feu et laissez les feuilles dans l''eau pendant 20 minutes. L''eau devrait devenir un peu brune. Rincer et égoutter les feuilles. Égoutter le riz et les cacahuètes et mélanger dans un grand bol.","Pendant ce temps, pour la garniture, mettez les dés de porc dans une casserole d''eau bouillante. Laisser mijoter jusqu''à 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre et se désagrège facilement. Égoutter et réserver. Faites chauffer un grand wok à feu moyen-vif et ajoutez le porc. Comme une partie est assez grasse, vous ne devriez pas avoir besoin d’ajouter plus d’huile, mais si elle commence à coller, ajoutez un peu d’huile végétale.","Une fois le porc doré, ajoutez les échalotes tranchées, les crevettes et les champignons. Ajoutez la sauce soja et le sucre. Cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que la viande soit légèrement caramélisée. Retirez le porc du feu et ajoutez les échalotes croustillantes. À l''aide d''une microplane ou d''une râpe, râpez le jaune d''œuf salé, le cas échéant, dans le mélange et mélangez. Saison.","Pour envelopper le bah-tzang, coupez environ 10 longueurs de ficelle de boucher à environ 50 cm.","Posez une feuille de bambou cuite sur une autre pour obtenir une double épaisseur. Pliez les feuilles en deux et utilisez vos mains pour former un cône pointu. Tenez le cornet dans votre main, la pointe vers le bas, comme un rouleau de sushi ou un cornet de crème glacée.","Emballez le mélange de riz et d''arachides autour de l''extérieur et du bas du cône-feuille pour former une couche de riz sur toute la surface. Continuez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit rempli aux deux tiers environ. Versez le mélange de porc, de crevettes et de champignons au centre du riz et tassez-le bien. Ajoutez une autre cuillerée de riz par-dessus pour que la garniture soit complètement recouverte.","Pour fermer le bah-tzang, repliez le bord supérieur des feuilles de bambou sur le riz et rentrez-le pour sceller l''espace. Tirez fermement sur les feuilles pour qu''elles enserrent le riz et le porc, en rentrant les bords lâches. Utilisez une longueur de ficelle pour sécuriser le colis, en l''enroulant dans la ficelle et en laissant une longueur en haut. Assurez-vous de faire les nœuds aussi étroitement que possible afin qu''aucun remplissage ne s''échappe. Remplissez les feuilles de bambou restantes et attachez-les toutes ensemble.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau, plongez-y le bah-tzang et laissez cuire 45 min à 1 h, puis retirez-les de l''eau, égouttez-les et servez aussitôt. Détachez la ficelle et épluchez les feuilles (ne les mangez pas) pour révéler le riz gluant et le porc tendre. Servir avec du piment ou du radis mariné et une trempette sucrée et salée à base de soja. Nous avons ouvert nos bah-tzang afin que vous puissiez voir la section transversale à l''intérieur, mais vous les serviriez normalement sans emballage."]','2026-01-11 00:05:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10412,7045,'fr','Bar à la vapeur','Essayez ce bar cuit à la vapeur avec des ingrédients asiatiques parfumés comme pièce maîtresse d''un menu chinois. La cuisson à la vapeur garantit que le poisson reste humide et s''écaille','["30 g de gingembre pelé et coupé en allumettes (utilisez un éplucheur à julienne si vous en avez un)","1 gros bar entier (environ 800g), vidé et nettoyé (demandez à votre poissonnier de le faire), ou 4 filets de bar","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja noire","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de sucre de palme","1 oignon nouveau, tranché en diagonale","½ petit paquet de coriandre, parée mais avec la plupart des tiges dessus","½ piment rouge, finement tranché en diagonale"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Mettez la moitié du gingembre dans la cavité du poisson, puis déposez-le sur du papier d''aluminium. Tirez les côtés du papier d''aluminium autour du poisson pour créer un bol en aluminium, puis ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau (cela fera cuire le poisson à la vapeur), scellez et faites cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou dans un grand cuiseur vapeur en bambou jusqu''à ce que le poisson se défasse.","Transférer dans un plat de service en laissant le jus dans le papier d''aluminium. Faites chauffer les sauces soja, l''huile et le sucre de palme dans une casserole avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau jusqu''à ébullition et bouillonnement. Garnir le poisson avec l''oignon nouveau, le piment, la majeure partie de la coriandre et le reste du gingembre. Versez le liquide chaud sur le poisson pour « cuire » les aromates dessus. Répartissez les restes de tiges de coriandre pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10413,7048,'fr','Crêpes au maquereau hoisin','Besoin d’un repas familial rapide et fait maison ? Essayez ces crêpes au maquereau. Utiliser des ingrédients sucrés avec des poissons au goût plus fort comme le maquereau incite les enfants à les essayer','["3 filets de maquereau, désossés, coupés en lanières de la longueur d''un doigt","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin, plus un peu pour tremper","4 oignons nouveaux","½ concombre","2 laitues Little Gem","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","10 crêpes chinoises (disponibles chez la Serveuse, les supermarchés asiatiques ou les plats à emporter chinois)"]','["Faites mariner le maquereau dans la sauce hoisin pendant que vous préparez les légumes. Coupez les oignons nouveaux et le concombre en fines allumettes et séparez les feuilles de laitue.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen. Ajoutez le maquereau et faites-le frire pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit collant et caramélisé. Faites chauffer les crêpes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Servez le tout au milieu de la table et laissez chacun se servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10414,7049,'fr','Haricots verts sautés à l''ail','Ces haricots verts à l''ail faciles et sains accompagnent parfaitement un festin chinois, et ils sont préparés avec seulement 4 ingrédients en 15 minutes.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","200 g de haricots verts parés","3 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","1 cuillère à café de sauce d''huîtres ou de sauce soja"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok, puis faites revenir les haricots verts pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Ajoutez l''ail et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste teinté de brun, puis arrosez de sauce aux huîtres et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10415,7051,'fr','Soupe piquante aux crevettes et au maïs doux','L''entrée réchauffante parfaite pour vos célébrations du Nouvel An chinois. Nous avons ajouté du piment pour réchauffer et utilisé de l''œuf à la place de la farine de maïs traditionnelle.','["1½ l de bouillon de poulet chaud","1 cuillère à café de sucre blanc en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz noir chinois, de vinaigre de cidre ou de vin blanc","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement tranché en allumettes","½ piment rouge, tranché","½ paquet de tofu soyeux, coupé en dés","poignée de maïs doux surgelé","150 g de crevettes cuites","2 œufs battus avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","150 g de germes de soja rhincé","oignons nouveaux émincés, pour servir"]','["Mettez le bouillon dans une casserole sur feu doux, ajoutez le sucre, le vinaigre, le gingembre et le piment et portez à légère ébullition. Ajoutez le tofu, le maïs doux et les crevettes, laissez mijoter doucement pendant 2 minutes, puis versez le mélange d''œufs en filet constant en remuant pour former des brins d''œufs.","Empilez quelques germes de soja dans chaque bol et versez la soupe dessus. Répartir sur les oignons nouveaux et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10416,7053,'fr','Choux de char sui','Nous avons combiné des rouleaux de saucisses avec les saveurs du porc omble chinois – doublement délicieux !','["225 g de farine nature","125 g de beurre légèrement salé, enveloppé dans du papier aluminium et réfrigéré","400 g de saucisses de porc","2 cuillères à café de poudre de cinq épices","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","un peu de farine, pour saupoudrer","1 œuf battu","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame noires et blanches"]','["Vous pouvez préparer la pâte jusqu''à 2 jours avant. Pesez la farine dans un bol et ajoutez 1/2 cuillère à café de sel. En tenant le beurre par le papier d''aluminium (pour éviter qu''il ne devienne trop chaud), râpez-le directement dans la farine du côté grossier de la râpe. Trempez de temps en temps le bloc de beurre dans la farine et mélangez le beurre râpé à la farine avec un couteau à couverts pour éviter qu''il ne s''agglutine dans le bol. Lorsque le beurre est bien réparti dans la farine, versez 100 g d''eau froide. Mélangez avec le couteau à couverts jusqu''à ce que le tout s''agglutine. Versez sur votre plan de travail et pétrissez brièvement pour rassembler la pâte – ne travaillez pas trop ou vous perdrez les poches de beurre qui créeront les couches. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire et réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Pressez la chair des saucisses des peaux dans un bol. Ajouter la sauce aux huîtres aux cinq épices, le hoisin et le gingembre. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement combiné.","Farinez légèrement votre plan de travail. Abaissez la pâte sur l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 50p, puis utilisez un emporte-pièce de 10 cm pour découper un maximum de cercles. Repliez les chutes sur elles-mêmes, mais ne froissez pas la pâte, sinon vous perdrez les couches. Relancez et supprimez-en quelques autres si vous le pouvez – vous devriez en faire 18-20.","Formez avec une cuillère le mélange de saucisses en boules (de la taille d''une tomate cerise) et placez-les au milieu de chaque cercle de pâtisserie. Badigeonnez la pâte d''un peu d''œuf battu, puis pliez trois côtés pour recouvrir partiellement le saucisson et créer une forme de triangle en pinçant les coins ensemble. Badigeonner davantage d''œuf sur le dessus de la pâte et saupoudrer de graines de sésame. Disposez sur les plaques et enfournez 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Refroidissez sur les plateaux, prêts à être emballés pour un pique-nique – ou servez chaud. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:05:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10417,7055,'fr','Muffins anglais','Servez ces muffins anglais traditionnels chauds, coupés en deux et tartinés de beurre, ou grillés dans un œuf poché et un brunch hollandais.','["400 g de farine blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","5g de levure à action rapide","250 ml de lait entier réchauffé","semoule fine, pour saupoudrer"]','["Pour faire la pâte, mélangez la farine, le sucre, la levure et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol. Ajoutez progressivement le lait en mélangeant avec les mains jusqu''à ce que la pâte se rassemble. Pétrir pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et élastique. Cela peut également être fait dans un mélangeur de table avec un crochet pétrisseur.","Retournez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné et étalez-la sur 1 cm d''épaisseur. Découpez 8 cercles à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 7,5 cm en roulant à nouveau la pâte si besoin. Disposer sur des plaques à pâtisserie saupoudrées de semoule. Saupoudrez le dessus avec plus de semoule, couvrez légèrement et laissez lever dans un endroit chaud pendant environ 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume, ou pour une meilleure saveur, laissez reposer toute la nuit au réfrigérateur.","Pour cuire les muffins, placez une poêle à fond épais ou une plaque chauffante à feu moyen pendant 6 à 7 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Faites cela par lots. Si les muffins dorent trop vite, baissez le feu et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits. Laisser refroidir légèrement sur une grille. Meilleur servi chaud. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours. Laissez d’abord refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10418,7057,'fr','Fish & chips à la friteuse','Utilisez votre friteuse à air pour préparer ce classique britannique. Choisissez du poisson blanc comme la morue, l''aiglefin ou le basa et servez-le avec de la purée de pois et une sauce tartare.','["60g de maïzena","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées séchées","2 filets de poisson blanc, comme la morue, l''aiglefin ou le basa","3 pommes de terre moyennes, type Désirée ou Maris Piper","6-8 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","purée de pois et sauce tartare, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez la maïzena, le paprika et le mélange d''herbes avec 1 cuillère à café de sel et ¼ cuillère à café de poivre noir fraîchement moulu et étalez-les sur une grande assiette. Enrober les filets de poisson du mélange de farine des deux côtés. Si vous préférez cuisiner sur la table de cuisson, suivez le conseil ci-dessous : les filets de poisson sont maintenant prêts à être frits.","Coupez les pommes de terre en chips de 1 cm d''épaisseur à l''aide d''un grand couteau bien aiguisé. Laissez la peau ou épluchez-la si vous le souhaitez.","Mettez les chips dans un grand bol à mélanger, puis ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale et une bonne pincée de sel et de poivre. Remuer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien enrobé. Réglez la friteuse à air à 200 °C et faites cuire les frites pendant environ 18 à 22 minutes, en les retournant à mi-cuisson (ou en secouant le panier de la friteuse à air) jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes et cuites. Alternativement, vous pouvez les cuire au four (voir conseil ci-dessous). Gardez au chaud pendant que vous faites cuire le poisson ou faites-le cuire dans le deuxième panier de la friteuse, si vous en avez un.","Étalez 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale sur une grande assiette et draguez le poisson enrobé dans l''huile pour le couvrir. Réglez la friteuse à 200°C et laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes (selon la taille de vos filets de poisson), en les retournant délicatement à mi-cuisson. Servir avec de la purée de pois et de la sauce tartare, si vous le souhaitez. Si vous congelez le fish and chips, décongelez-le complètement au réfrigérateur, puis réchauffez-le au four jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:05:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10419,7059,'fr','Reine des puddings','Préparez un délicieux pudding britannique classique, préparé en trempant de la chapelure dans du lait chaud et en ajoutant de la meringue et de la confiture. C''est le dessert réconfortant parfait','["550 ml de lait","25 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le plat","1 citron, zesté","100 g de chapelure blanche fraîche","240 g de sucre en poudre","4 œufs, jaunes et blancs séparés","6-8 cuillères à soupe de confiture de framboises"]','["Faites chauffer le lait dans une petite casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ébullition, puis retirez du feu et incorporez le beurre, le zeste de citron, la chapelure et 40 g de sucre semoule. Laisser tremper 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les miettes aient absorbé le liquide et refroidi.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un plat allant au four ou à tarte de taille moyenne (le nôtre mesurait 22 cm). Une fois le mélange de chapelure refroidi, incorporez les jaunes d''œufs et versez dans le plat allant au four. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris, semblable à une crème anglaise. Faites chauffer la confiture dans une petite casserole à feu doux pour la décoller, puis étalez-la sur le fond. Il doit s''agir d''une fine couche, vous aurez donc peut-être besoin de moins de confiture si votre plat est plus profond. Réduisez la température du four à 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 2.","Montez les blancs d''œufs en neige ferme dans un bol propre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou d''un batteur sur socle. Incorporez petit à petit les 200 g de sucre en poudre restants jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous et que la meringue soit brillante et verticale. Verser ou déposer la meringue sur la couche de confiture et cuire encore 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la meringue soit dorée et prise. Meilleur servi chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:05:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10420,7061,'fr','Scones à la rhubarbe et à la crème anglaise','Ces délicieux scones présentent l’une des combinaisons de saveurs les plus appréciées de Grande-Bretagne : la rhubarbe et la crème anglaise. Servir avec de la crème caillée pour un agréable thé l''après-midi dans le jardin','["300 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de poudre de crème anglaise","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","50 g de sucre en poudre","95 g de beurre doux froid, coupé en cubes","150-175 ml de lait entier","1 œuf battu","crème caillée, pour servir","250 g de rhubarbe hachée grossièrement (ou utilisez de la rhubarbe surgelée hachée)","100 g de sucre semoule ou semoule","1 citron, zesté","½ cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille","goutte de gel colorant alimentaire rouge (facultatif)"]','["Mélanger la farine, la poudre à crème anglaise, ¼ de cuillère à café de sel fin, la levure chimique et le sucre dans un grand bol. Frottez le beurre dans les ingrédients secs du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine.","Incorporez progressivement le lait avec vos mains jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse – vous n''aurez peut-être pas besoin de tout. Abaisser délicatement la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée sur une épaisseur de 2 cm. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, couvrir et réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes pour raffermir, ou jusqu''à 1 heure si vous voulez aller de l''avant.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la compote de rhubarbe. Versez tous les ingrédients dans une grande casserole avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau (omettez l''eau si vous utilisez de la rhubarbe surgelée). Laisser mijoter à feu moyen pendant 10 à 15 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que la rhubarbe ait ramolli et s''effondre presque, et que le mélange ait épaissi. Si vous utilisez de la rhubarbe surgelée, vous aimerez peut-être y ajouter une goutte de colorant alimentaire rouge pour rehausser la couleur rose. Transférez la compote dans un bol et laissez refroidir complètement.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et sortir la pâte du réfrigérateur. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Découpez trois ou quatre scones sur la pâte à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce rond de 7 cm (voir astuce ci-dessous). Disposez les scones sur le plateau préparé en laissant un espace de 2 cm entre chacun.","Étalez à nouveau le reste de la pâte comme à la deuxième étape, puis découpez autant de scones que possible (vous devriez en obtenir environ six au total). Transférez-les également sur le plateau, puis badigeonnez tous les scones avec l''œuf battu (voir astuce ci-dessous). Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré, puis laisser refroidir complètement sur la plaque. Servir avec la compote de rhubarbe et la crème caillée. À consommer de préférence le jour même."]','2026-01-11 00:05:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10421,7063,'fr','Quiche du couronnement','Une quiche profonde avec une pâte croustillante, et des saveurs délicates d''épinards, de fèves et d''estragon frais. La pâtisserie comprend du saindoux, mais vous pouvez l''échanger contre du beurre pour la rendre végétarienne. Mangez chaud ou froid avec une salade verte et des pommes de terre nouvelles bouillies – parfait pour un Coronation Big Lunch !','["250 g de farine ordinaire + un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de beurre froid coupé en dés","50 g de saindoux (ou utilisez du beurre si vous préférez)","4 cuillères à soupe de lait, plus un peu","Ou 250g de pâte brisée toute prête","125 ml de lait","175 ml de crème fraîche","2 œufs moyens","1 cuillère à soupe d''estragon frais haché","100 g de cheddar râpé","180 g d''épinards cuits, essorés et légèrement hachés","60 g de fèves ou de soja cuites (doublez les fèves si vous le souhaitez)"]','["Tamisez la farine dans un bol avec ½ cuillère à café de sel. Ajoutez le beurre et le saindoux et frottez le mélange du bout des doigts jusqu''à obtenir une texture sableuse semblable à de la chapelure. Ajoutez le lait, petit à petit, et à l''aide d''un couteau à couverts, commencez à rassembler la pâte, avec vos mains, en vous assurant qu''elle n''a pas de zones sèches et qu''elle est lisse. Couvrir et laisser reposer au réfrigérateur pendant 30 à 45 minutes.","Disposez un moule à tarte à fond amovible de 20 cm ou un cercle à pâtisserie de 20 cm sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Farinez légèrement le plan de travail et étalez la pâte en un cercle un peu plus grand que le dessus du moule et d''environ 5 mm d''épaisseur. Soulevez délicatement la pâte dans le moule et appuyez doucement dans les coins, en prenant soin de ne pas faire de trous, sinon le mélange pourrait couler. Couvrir et laisser reposer encore 30 minutes au réfrigérateur. Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.","Tapissez le fond de tarte de papier sulfurisé – pour cela coupez un disque de papier sulfurisé plus grand que le moule, écrasez-le en boule (cela le rend plus souple), puis déballer et placez-le dans le fond de tarte. Il doit arriver au-dessus des côtés. Remplissez de haricots secs ou de riz non cuit et faites cuire à blanc pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés et secs. Retirez délicatement le papier sulfurisé et les billes de cuisson, puis remettez au four 5 minutes pour sécher le fond. Réduisez la température du four à 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 3.","Battez le lait, la crème, les œufs et les herbes avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Répartir la moitié du fromage râpé dans le fond cuit à blanc, garnir d''épinards et de haricots hachés, puis verser sur le mélange liquide. Si nécessaire, remuez délicatement le mélange pour vous assurer que la garniture est uniformément dispersée, mais veillez à ne pas endommager le fond de tarte. Saupoudrer du reste de fromage. Mettre au four et cuire au four pendant 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris et très légèrement doré."]','2026-01-11 00:05:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10422,7065,'fr','Fish & chips classique','Évitez les plats à emporter et consacrez un peu d''effort à perfectionner le fish & chips à la maison – vous serez récompensé par un poisson croustillant et profondément doré et des chips gourmandes.','["environ 1 litre d''huile de tournesol, pour la friture","2 filets épais sans peau de merlan, lingue, goberge, aiglefin ou cabillaud (environ 150 g chacun)","2 grosses pommes de terre Maris Piper","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de malt, plus un peu pour servir","75 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","25g de maïzena","petite pincée de curcuma moulu","125 g de bière blonde froide ou d''eau gazeuse","4 cornichons","1 cuillère à café de câpres","1 échalote","une poignée de feuilles de persil hachées","5 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise"]','["Coupez les pommes de terre en chips et faites-les tremper dans l''eau froide pendant 5 minutes, puis lavez-les jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire. Versez dans une casserole d''eau froide avec une pincée de sel et 1 cuillère à café de vinaigre. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter doucement pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit mais ne se désagrège pas. Égoutter délicatement, puis placer sur un plateau en une seule couche et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Peut être préparé la veille.","Pour faire la sauce tartare, hachez les cornichons, les câpres et l''échalote (hachez-les finement si vous préférez une sauce onctueuse), puis mélangez-les avec le persil, la mayonnaise et une pincée de sel. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à 24 heures.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à frire, préparez la pâte. Versez les farines et le curcuma dans un bol avec une pincée de sel, versez dessus la bière ou l''eau gazeuse et mélangez rapidement jusqu''à ce que le tout ait la consistance d''une crème double – ne battez pas trop, quelques grumeaux suffisent. Gardez au frais.","Versez l''huile dans une poêle large et profonde comme un awok, ou faites chauffer une friteuse à 180°C. Si vous utilisez une poêle ou un wok, assurez-vous qu’elle n’est pas remplie d’huile à plus des deux tiers. Faites chauffer l’huile jusqu’à ce qu’elle brille et plongez-y délicatement les chips à l’aide d’une écumoire. Faites frire pendant 8 à 10 minutes, en remuant doucement de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes. Transférer sur du papier absorbant pour égoutter.","Mettez un peu de farine dans un plat, puis portez l''huile que vous avez utilisée pour cuire les chips à 185°C, si vous avez un thermomètre, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un filet de pâte grésille et croustillante en moins d''une minute. En travaillant rapidement, saupoudrez le poisson de farine, puis passez-le dans la pâte. Tenez le filet au-dessus de la pâte pour laisser l''excédent s''égoutter dans le bol, puis plongez-le délicatement dans l''huile. Faites frire les filets pendant une minute jusqu''à ce que la pâte commence tout juste à prendre, puis prenez une cuillère et arrosez les filets de pâte supplémentaire pour créer un enrobage encore plus croustillant et vaporeux. Faites frire le poisson pendant environ 4 minutes, en le retournant une fois, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien doré et croustillant. Soulever sur du papier absorbant pour égoutter pendant une minute, puis servir avec les chips, la sauce tartare et beaucoup de sel et de vinaigre."]','2026-01-11 00:05:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10423,5561,'fr','Chaudrée de fruits de mer facile','Préparez cette chaudrée de fruits de mer crémeuse pour une personne en utilisant les restes que vous pourriez avoir au réfrigérateur ou au congélateur. Garnir de persil et servir avec du pain croustillant','["1 petite pomme de terre (environ 150 g), coupée en cubes de 2 cm","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 branche de céleri, finement hachée","1 échalote pelée et hachée finement","1 gousse d''ail, râpée","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","200 ml de lait demi-écrémé ou entier","100 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poisson","80 g de crevettes surgelées ou de poisson fumé","75 g de maïs doux ou de petits pois frais ou surgelés (ou utiliser un mélange)","1 petit citron, zesté et pressé","½ cuillère à soupe de persil plat haché grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","pain croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Versez les pommes de terre dans une petite casserole et couvrez d''eau froide salée. Portez à ébullition à feu moyen, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient à peine ramollis. Égoutter et réserver.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne à feu moyen et faites revenir le céleri et l''échalote pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajouter l''ail et faire revenir encore 30 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé.","Incorporer la farine et cuire 1 min. Réduisez le feu à doux et versez lentement le lait en fouettant jusqu''à obtenir une sauce épaisse. Incorporer le bouillon et laisser mijoter 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe à nouveau légèrement.","Ajoutez le poisson, les légumes et les pommes de terre cuites et laissez mijoter pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient décongelés (s''ils sont congelés) et que le poisson soit bien cuit. Lorsque le mélange est crémeux et recouvre le dos d''une cuillère, ajoutez le zeste et le jus de citron et jusqu''à 50 ml d''eau si la chaudrée est trop épaisse. Assaisonner avec du poivre noir, du sel et du persil.","Versez la chaudrée dans un bol, ajoutez plus de poivre noir, du persil supplémentaire et servez avec du pain croustillant, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10424,3864,'fr','Dîner rôti sain','Cuisinez une version saine et faible en gras de rosbif pour deux, composée de steak maigre et juteux et de légumes rôtis, ainsi que de la sauce en accompagnement.','["285 g de pommes de terre moyennes, tranchées épaisses","4 petites carottes (160 g), coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","2 x 80 g d''oignons rouges coupés en quartiers","170 g de gros choux de Bruxelles (environ 8 à 10), parés","2½ cuillères à café d''huile de colza","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de thym","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre balsamique","1 grosse gousse d''ail, finement râpée","2 pincées de moutarde anglaise en poudre","170 g de steak de filet épais et maigre","½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau et faites cuire les pommes de terre pendant 5 min. Égoutter en réservant l''eau.","Mélanger les pommes de terre, les carottes, les oignons et les pousses avec 2 cuillères à café d''huile pour enrober. Disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive, espacés. Parsemer d''1 cuillère à café de thym, broyer avec un peu de poivre noir, puis rôtir pendant 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez 1 cuillère à café de vinaigre avec l''ail, le reste du thym et de l''huile, la moutarde et beaucoup de poivre noir. Frottez-le sur le steak, mettez-le dans un plat peu profond et réservez. Mélangez le reste du vinaigre avec le bouillon et 125 ml de l''eau réservée de l''étape 1, puis réservez. Au bout de 30 minutes, retournez les légumes et faites-les rôtir encore 15 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une petite poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-vif. Sortez le steak de la marinade, secouez l''excédent et faites-le frire 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût. Retirer sur une planche et laisser reposer. Versez les restes de marinade dans la poêle et faites bouillonner jusqu''à ce qu''ils épaississent légèrement pour faire une sauce. Trancher le steak et servir avec les légumes rôtis et la sauce à part."]','2026-01-11 00:05:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10425,3874,'fr','Confiture de pommes','Préparez des pots de confiture de pommes maison et offrez-les à vos amis et à votre famille. C''est délicieux à tartiner simplement sur du pain grillé ou comme garniture dans vos gâteaux et pâtisseries préférés.','["1 kg de pommes Bramley, pelées, évidées et hachées","250 g de sucre en poudre","½ citron, jus","1 bâton de cannelle"]','["Mettez une petite assiette au congélateur. Versez la pomme hachée et le sucre en poudre dans une grande casserole avec 350 ml d''eau et portez à ébullition en remuant pour dissoudre le sucre.","Cuire doucement, en remuant régulièrement, pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes soient effondrées.","Incorporer le jus de citron, ajouter le bâton de cannelle et laisser mijoter doucement encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et brillant.","Sortez la petite assiette du congélateur et déposez-y un peu du mélange. Laisser agir quelques secondes – il doit être assez ferme. Si le mélange est encore un peu liquide, remettez la casserole du feu et laissez mijoter encore 10 à 15 minutes. Remettez l''assiette au congélateur et testez à nouveau, elle devrait maintenant être prête.","Répartir dans des bocaux propres et stérilisés et fermer hermétiquement. Se conserve trois mois dans un endroit frais et sec. Une fois ouvert, réfrigérer et utiliser dans un délai d''un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:05:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10426,6825,'fr','Scones aux raisins secs faciles','La pâtisserie parfaite du week-end, un lot de ces scones moelleux aux raisins secs ne durera pas longtemps. Servir avec beaucoup de beurre et de confiture pour une gâterie l''après-midi','["500 g de farine autolevante, tamisée, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","175 g de beurre ramolli coupé en petits morceaux","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","150 g de raisins secs","2 œufs légèrement battus","un peu de lait, plus un peu pour le brossage","crème caillée et confiture, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Versez la farine et le beurre dans un grand bol. Commencez doucement à frotter le beurre dans la farine du bout des doigts, en le laissant tomber d''une courte hauteur au-dessus du bol. Cela incorporera de l''air dans les scones, les rendant magnifiquement légers. Continuez ainsi jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine.","Ajoutez une pincée de sel, le sucre, les raisins secs, les œufs et suffisamment de lait pour obtenir une pâte molle. La quantité de lait variera en fonction de la taille des œufs, de la douceur du beurre et de la température de la pièce. Faites attention à ne pas surmener les durs, sinon cela deviendra dur.","Étalez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée. Farinez généreusement un rouleau à pâtisserie et étalez la pâte sur 2 cm d''épaisseur. Coupez en carrés ou en triangles à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, puis transférez les scones sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée, en les espaçant pour laisser de la place à l''étalement. Badigeonnez le dessus d''un peu de lait, puis enfournez pour 10 min. Laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tiède, puis servir avec de la crème caillée ou du beurre et de la confiture, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10427,6345,'fr','Galettes de cabillaud à l''estragon et petits pois à la menthe','Ces galettes de poisson de grande taille regorgent de poisson blanc riche en protéines et sont servies sur un savoureux mélange de pois et de poireaux à la menthe.','["huile de colza, pour la boîte","900 g de pommes de terre (nous avons utilisé Maris Piper), pelées et coupées en morceaux moyens","2 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","4 anchois (10g), finement hachés","5 oignons nouveaux, hachés très finement","2 cuillères à café de câpres (10g)","1 ½ cuillère à soupe d''estragon haché","2 paquets de 280 g de longe de cabillaud sans peau, coupée en cubes","8 cuillères à café de farine complète","2 œufs","90g d''amandes moulues","320 g de petits pois surgelés","320 g de poireaux coupés en deux et finement tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe finement hachée","4 fusée","2 cuillères à café de jus de citron","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et huiler une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive. Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition, puis faites cuire les pommes de terre pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Bien égoutter, puis remettre dans la poêle et écraser avec la moutarde, les anchois, les oignons nouveaux, les câpres et l''estragon jusqu''à homogénéité. Incorporer la morue crue.","Façonner en 8 gâteaux, puis enrober légèrement de farine – environ 1 à 2 cuillères à café chacun. Battez les œufs dans un bol peu profond. Enrober les gâteaux dans l''œuf, puis saupoudrer 1/2 cuillère à soupe d''amandes sur chacun et déposer sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Enfourner 20 min en retournant chacun à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les petits pois et les poireaux dans une casserole, plongez-les dans l''eau, puis couvrez et faites bouillir 10 min. Égoutter et incorporer la menthe. Répartir la moitié du mélange de pois et poireaux dans deux assiettes avec 2 galettes de poisson dessus pour chacune. Mélangez la moitié de la roquette avec la moitié du jus de citron et de l''huile d''olive, puis empilez-la sur les croquettes de poisson. Réfrigérez 4 galettes de poisson et la moitié du mélange de pois et de poireaux, séparément, pour les consommer un autre jour. Se conserveront au frais jusqu''à deux jours. Réchauffez les galettes de poisson sur une plaque allant au four à 200 °C/180 °C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 pendant 15 à 20 minutes. Réchauffer les petits pois et les poireaux au micro-ondes. Dresser le reste de roquette juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10428,4643,'fr','Galettes de poisson au saumon et patate douce enrobées de quinoa','Préparez des galettes de saumon rapides et faciles avec un joli enrobage de quinoa. Parfait servi avec des petits pois et des légumes ou une salade d''accompagnement','["750 g de patates douces (environ 4 de taille moyenne)","65g de quinoa (mélange rouge et noir, si possible)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile, plus un peu pour le brossage","240 g de filets de saumon sans peau et désossés","petit bouquet de ciboulette hachée","90g de cresson","200 g de petits pois surgelés, cuits"]','["Lavez les patates douces, piquez-les plusieurs fois avec une fourchette et faites-les cuire au micro-ondes pendant environ 10 minutes – le temps varie en fonction de la taille. Vous pouvez également cuire au four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 pendant environ 45 minutes. Versez la chair dans un bol. Réservez les peaux pour faire des chips, si vous le souhaitez (voir astuce ci-dessous).","Versez le quinoa dans une casserole et versez dessus 150 ml d''eau bouillante, couvrez avec un couvercle et laissez mijoter environ 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit absorbée. Bien égoutter, étaler sur une assiette et réserver.","Versez un peu d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen, puis faites revenir les filets de saumon quelques minutes de chaque côté. Versez dans le bol avec la patate douce, puis ajoutez la ciboulette. Bien mélanger pour briser le poisson et assaisonner au goût.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Former avec le mélange huit galettes de poisson de taille égale. Tremper chaque croquette de poisson dans l''assiette de quinoa et bien l''enrober en appuyant pour l''aider à coller. Badigeonner d''un peu d''huile d''olive et déposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Cuire au four environ 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Servir avec du cresson et des petits pois, et des chips de patates douces, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10429,4056,'fr','Gâteaux gallois végétaliens','Préparez une version végétalienne des gâteaux gallois, avec toute la saveur de la recette traditionnelle mais sans produits laitiers. Saupoudrer de sucre pour finir et servir tiède ou froid','["225 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","¼ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","½ cuillère à café de muscade, râpée","100 g de beurre sans produits laitiers","50 g de sucre en poudre, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50g de groseilles","3-4 cuillères à soupe de lait sans produits laitiers"]','["Versez la farine dans un grand bol et mélangez-la avec le sel et la muscade. Ajoutez le beurre et frottez-le du bout des doigts pour obtenir une consistance fine de chapelure. Ajoutez le sucre et les groseilles et incorporez 3 cuillères à soupe de lait jusqu''à ce que le tout soit homogène, ajoutez encore 1 cuillère à soupe si la pâte est un peu sèche. Formez une boule en essayant de ne pas trop travailler la pâte car cela la rendrait dure.","Abaisser la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné sur 5 mm d''épaisseur et découper des ronds à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 6 ou 7 cm. Reroulez les restes et découpez-en davantage jusqu''à ce que vous ayez épuisé toute la pâte.","Placez une poêle en fonte ou une poêle à fond épais sur feu moyen pour qu''elle soit bien chaude. Cuire 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Vous devrez baisser légèrement le feu s''ils commencent à prendre. Ajoutez immédiatement le sucre et laissez refroidir sur une grille pendant 15 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:05:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10430,7071,'fr','Pâte de pois facile','Savourez le meilleur des plats réconfortants avec des purées de pois maison. Leur saveur subtile de menthe et de citron les rend parfaits avec le fish and chips','["250 g de petits pois secs à la courge","2 cuillères à soupe de levure chimique","25 g de beurre salé coupé en cubes","¼ petit bouquet de menthe finement hachée","½ citron, jus"]','["Mettez les petits pois et le bicarbonate de soude dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur et couvrez d''eau bouillante. Laisser tremper 12 heures ou toute la nuit.","Égouttez les petits pois et rincez-les deux fois à l''eau froide pour éliminer le bicarbonate de soude. Mettez les haricots dans une casserole et couvrez de 650 ml d''eau froide. Porter à ébullition, baisser le feu et laisser mijoter 30 minutes jusqu''à tendreté, en remuant de temps en temps.","Écrasez brièvement et incorporez le beurre, la menthe et le citron, assaisonnez au goût."]','2026-01-11 00:05:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10431,7073,'fr','Oeufs écossais','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Utilisez quelques astuces du chef pour créer la parfaite collation aux saucisses et aux œufs avec cette recette étape par étape.','["12 gros œufs","800 g de saucisses Cumberland ou Lincolnshire de bonne qualité, pelées","5 cuillères à soupe de persil frisé finement haché","2 cuillères à café de sauce Worcestershire","2 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","2 cuillères à café de macis moulu","12 tranches de bacon fumé","85 g de farine nature","140-200 g de chapelure séchée","environ 1 litre d''huile de tournesol ou végétale, pour la friture","des morceaux de pain, pour tester l''huile"]','["Mettez 9 œufs dans une grande casserole. Couvrir d''eau froide et porter à ébullition. Une fois l''ébullition terminée, réglez le minuteur sur 5 minutes. Au bout de 5 minutes, retirez rapidement les œufs avec une écumoire et plongez-les dans un grand bol d''eau froide.","Mettez la chair à saucisse, le persil, la sauce Worcestershire, la moutarde en poudre et le macis dans un bol bien assaisonné. Cassez 1 des œufs restants et mélangez le tout.","Cassez les 2 œufs restants dans un bol, battez-les à la fourchette, puis tamisez-les dans une assiette. Versez la farine dans une autre assiette et assaisonnez bien. Enfin, versez la chapelure dans une troisième assiette.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau. Déposez les tranches de bacon, éteignez la poêle et récupérez le bacon avec une paire de pinces – il doit être juste cuit.","Lorsque les œufs sont refroidis, tapotez légèrement sur une surface dure pour casser la coquille, puis pelez-les (photo A). Si vous tenez les œufs au-dessus du bol d''eau pendant que vous les épluchez, tous les morceaux de coquille s''y rassembleront et vous pourrez les tremper dans l''œuf pour éliminer les fragments. Enroulez une tranche de bacon autour du milieu de chaque œuf, en la chevauchant, comme une ceinture (image B).","Finissez maintenant d’enrober les œufs. J''ai disposé les ingrédients le long de mon banc comme un tapis roulant : des œufs, puis de la farine, de la viande hachée, de l''œuf battu et enfin de la chapelure, plus une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé au bout pour y déposer les œufs écossais finis.","Roulez vos œufs enrobés de bacon dans la farine en secouant l''excédent. Prenez un bon morceau de viande hachée et étalez-le pour couvrir finement une main. Posez l''œuf sur la viande (image C), puis moulez-le sur le hachis pour le couvrir, en le pressant et en le tapotant pour obtenir une épaisseur uniforme. Vous aurez probablement un écart (en fonction de la taille de vos mains – il suffit de patcher et de tapoter avec un peu plus de viande hachée). Trempez-y l''œuf en secouant l''excédent, puis roulez-le dans la chapelure pour l''enrober et transférez-le sur votre plateau. Répétez l’opération pour couvrir les 9 œufs, puis couvrez d’un film alimentaire et réfrigérez pendant 4 heures ou toute la nuit.","Pour cuire, versez l''huile dans une grande casserole profonde jusqu''à environ 4 cm de profondeur. Chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''un petit morceau de pain dore en 1 min environ. Plongez délicatement dans un œuf écossais et faites frire pendant environ 5 minutes, en retournant doucement, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément doré. En fonction de votre poêle, vous pouvez probablement en faire 2 ou 3 à la fois, mais ne surchargez pas. Soulever sur un plateau tapissé de papier de cuisine. (Si vous aimez vos œufs écossais chauds, mettez-les dans un four doux pendant que vous faites frire le reste.) Gardez un œil sur l''huile – si les œufs écossais commencent à dorer trop rapidement, l''huile peut être trop chaude et vous risquez que le porc ne soit pas cuit avant que l''œuf écossais ne soit doré. Si l''huile devient trop froide, l''œuf écossais risque de trop cuire avant d''être doré. déguster tiède ou froid ; mieux consommé dans les 24 heures suivant la friture."]','2026-01-11 00:05:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10432,7075,'fr','Le relooking ultime : petit-déjeuner anglais complet','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Angela Nilsen prépare une version plus saine d''un repas anglais emblématique – sans perdre la nostalgie.','["4 tranches de bacon maigre non fumé de bonne qualité","4 champignons portabello à tête brune","12-16 tomates cerises sur vigne, température ambiante","6 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 tranches de pain de campagne ou de pain complet, coupées en diagonale","2 saucissons de porc fermier de bonne qualité, minimum 86% de porc","2 œufs fermiers riches en oméga-3, température ambiante","quelques gouttes de vinaigre de cidre","2 verres de 100 ml de jus d''orange fraîchement pressé, plus 1 orange coupée en quartiers","une poignée de myrtilles fraîches (environ 50 g/2 oz)"]','["Disposez le bacon, les champignons et les tomates sur une plaque recouverte de papier d''aluminium. Badigeonner le dessus des champignons avec 3 cuillères à café d''huile et les deux côtés du pain avec le reste de l''huile. Annuler. Chauffer le gril à très chaud. Disposez les saucisses sur un petit plateau recouvert de papier d''aluminium (il est préférable de ne pas piquer les saucisses de bonne qualité, sinon elles pourraient perdre de l''humidité). Griller environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit, en retournant de temps en temps.","Pendant ce temps, remplissez aux trois quarts une petite casserole et une sauteuse large et profonde d’eau. Portez les deux à ébullition. Abaissez un œuf dans la petite poêle et retirez-le après 30 secondes. Cassez l''œuf dans une tasse. Ajoutez le vinaigre dans la plus grande casserole puis, à l''aide d''un fouet métallique, faites tourner l''eau pour créer un tourbillon. Retirez le fouet et versez lentement l''œuf au centre du bain à remous (voir photo du haut). Lorsque l''eau revient à ébullition, retirez la casserole du feu, couvrez et laissez reposer 3 minutes, puis retirez l''œuf. Placez-le dans un bol d''eau tiède pendant que vous faites cuire l''autre œuf – ou faites cuire les deux œufs une heure à l''avance, laissez-les dans un bol d''eau glacée, puis réchauffez 1 ½ min dans de l''eau frémissante avant de servir.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une poêle à frire très chaude. Placer les tomates, les lardons et les champignons sous le grill pendant 3 à 4 min sans les retourner. En même temps, déposez le pain sur la plaque chauffante, faites-le cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant, environ 1 min de chaque côté. Égoutter le tout sur du papier absorbant.","Retirez les œufs avec une écumoire et égouttez-les brièvement sur un torchon. Disposez le tout dans une assiette et servez avec le jus et les fruits."]','2026-01-11 00:05:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10433,6073,'fr','Mini tourtes au porc et piccalilli','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. L''Hoel Levieil du restaurant londonien Frizzante partage cette recette de tourte au porc adaptée aux pique-niques, qui a été élue idée de recette préférée du Jubilé par nos utilisateurs.','["quelques points de beurre","600g de pâte brisée du commerce ou maison","un peu de farine, pour saupoudrer","85 g de chapelure blanche séchée","400g de bonnes saucisses de Cumberland (environ 6)","200 g de lardons de lard fumé","¼ cuillère à café de chaque macis moulu, poivre moulu et sauge séchée","1 oeuf battu à la fourchette","quelques pincées de graines de sésame","piccalilli, fait maison ou acheté, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser chaque trou d''un moule à muffins à 12 trous d''une fine bande de papier sulfurisé au milieu, suffisamment longue pour que les extrémités dépassent d''un centimètre ou deux - utilisez une noisette de beurre pour coller en place. Étalez les deux tiers de la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné et découpez des cercles de 12 x 10 cm (vous devrez peut-être enrouler à nouveau les parures). Enfoncez un cercle dans chaque trou pour aligner.","Saupoudrer 1 cuillère à café de chapelure dans le fond de chaque tarte. Versez le reste de la chapelure dans un bol à mélanger. Pressez la chair à saucisse en jetant les peaux, ainsi que le bacon, le macis, le poivre, la sauge et juste un peu de sel. Mettez vos mains dedans, écrasez et écrasez le tout jusqu''à ce que la chapelure ait presque disparu. Répartissez le mélange entre les trous, en tassant fermement et en formant un dôme au milieu.","Étalez le reste de pâte et découpez des cercles de 12 x 7 cm. Badigeonner d''un peu d''œuf et ajouter un dessus sur chaque tarte, le côté œuf vers le bas pour coller, en pressant soigneusement les bords de la pâte l''un contre l''autre pour sceller. Badigeonnez avec plus d’œuf (ne jetez pas les restes) et saupoudrez de graines de sésame. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées puis retirer délicatement les tartes du moule en utilisant les extrémités du papier sulfurisé pour vous aider à les décoller. Disposez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier sulfurisé, badigeonnez tout le tour avec davantage d''œuf et remettez au four pendant 8 minutes. Refroidissez complètement puis mangez avec des piccalilli ou votre cornichon préféré."]','2026-01-11 00:05:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10434,7079,'fr','Potée plus légère du Lancashire','Ce pot d''agneau facile prend la nourriture réconfortante classique et la rend plus saine, sans compromettre la saveur.','["650 g d''épaule d''agneau désossée, sans excès de gras","4 cuillères à café de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons moyens, coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur et tranchés finement","3 carottes (poids total 350 g), coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur et coupées en bouchées","225 g de rutabagas, coupé en petits morceaux","3 brins de thym, plus des feuilles supplémentaires pour garnir","2 feuilles de laurier","200 ml de bouillon de poulet, composé d''un ½ cube de bouillon de poulet","1½ cuillère à café de sauce Worcestershire","750 g de pommes de terre type Maris Piper ou Désirée, tranchées très finement"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Couper l''agneau en gros morceaux de 5 à 6 cm. Versez la farine sur une grande assiette, assaisonnez avec du poivre et un peu de sel, et mélangez l''agneau dans la farine pour qu''il soit bien enrobé uniformément. Annuler.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une grande poêle à frire ou une sauteuse. Mettez les oignons, les carottes, le rutabaga, les brins de thym et les feuilles de laurier dans la poêle et assaisonnez de poivre. Cuire à feu moyen-vif pendant 6 à 8 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps pour que ça ne colle pas, jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à dorer sur les bords – le fond de la casserole doit être légèrement doré et caramélisé également. Versez le bouillon; il doit grésiller puis bouillonner dans la poêle. Retirez immédiatement la casserole du feu pour que le bouillon ne diminue pas de volume. Incorporer la sauce Worcestershire.","Superposez une seule couche de tranches de pomme de terre au fond d''une cocotte de 2 litres (environ 20 cm de diamètre x 10 cm de profondeur). Disposez la moitié de l''agneau sur les pommes de terre, puis versez la moitié du mélange de légumes sur la viande. Assaisonner de poivre. Posez le reste de l''agneau dessus, puis versez le reste des légumes, les herbes et tout le liquide sur l''agneau. Appuyez si nécessaire avec le dos d''une cuillère pour laisser de la place aux pommes de terre restantes. Commencez à superposer les tranches de pomme de terre en 3 couches qui se chevauchent étroitement, en assaisonnant chaque couche avec du poivre et en badigeonnant d''huile au fur et à mesure – gardez un peu d''huile pour la couche supérieure. Couvrez le plat avec un couvercle hermétique et enfournez pour 10 minutes.","Réduire le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Cuire encore 2 heures jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit bien tendre et que les pommes de terre soient cuites. Retirez le couvercle et passez sous le gril pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient dorées et croustillantes sur les bords. Retirez et laissez reposer la fondue pendant 5 à 10 minutes, puis servez parsemée de feuilles de thym."]','2026-01-11 00:05:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10435,7081,'fr','La tarte de St Clément','Une version très britannique de la tarte au citron vert – une tarte gourmande et crémeuse aux oranges et citrons acidulés','["250g de biscuits digestifs légers","100 g de cornflakes","85 g de beurre fondu","140 g de sucre en poudre","1 gros œuf et 4 gros jaunes d''œufs","Boîte de 397 g de lait concentré léger","le zeste et le jus de 3 citrons","le zeste et le jus de 2 oranges","Pot de 150 ml de crème double extra épaisse","100 g de yaourt grec 0% de matière grasse","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","plus de zeste de citron et d''orange, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Asseyez-vous\r\nune boîte ronde cannelée à fond mobile de 20 cm\r\n(environ 5 cm de profondeur, ou un peu moins profond\r\nmoule de 22 cm) sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Briser le\r\nbiscuits dans un grand bol ou un double sac\r\nmettez-les dans des sacs de nourriture et frappez-les trop fort\r\nmiettes avec le bout d''un rouleau à pâtisserie ou\r\npetite casserole. Ajoutez les cornflakes et\r\nréduire un peu plus en miettes. Mélanger avec le\r\nbeurre fondu et sucre et presser dessus\r\nle fond et les côtés de la boîte. Cuire au four pour\r\n15 min, puis retirer et réduire le four\r\ntempérature à 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 3.","Fouetter l''œuf et les jaunes dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce que\r\npâle et mousseux. Incorporer le condensé\r\nle lait, suivi des zestes et des jus.\r\nVersez dans le moule et enfournez 20 min.\r\nLaisser refroidir dans le moule, puis réfrigérer au moins\r\n5 heures ou toute la nuit.","Fouetter la crème, le yaourt et le sucre glace\r\nensemble. Verser une cuillerée sur la tarte et disperser\r\navec du zeste pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10436,7083,'fr','Rôti d''agneau aux miettes d''herbes printanières','Ce plat riche en fer est idéal pour un week-end en famille ou entre amis','["100 g de pain blanc de bonne qualité","2 gousses d''ail","le zeste d''1 citron","1 cuillère à café de feuille de thym hachée","petit bouquet de persil haché","3-4 filets d''anchois, hachés (facultatif)","5 carottes, coupées en morceaux","2 oignons, coupés en morceaux","4 feuilles de laurier","petit bouquet de romarin","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","gros gigot d''agneau, environ 3 kg/6 lb 8 oz","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées épaisses, plus un bulbe entier, coupé en deux","5 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","200 ml de vin blanc, plus un peu","600 ml de bouillon d''agneau"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nPour l''agneau, parsemer les légumes, le laurier\r\nfeuilles et quelques brins de romarin dans un\r\ngrand plat à rôtir et arroser avec le\r\nhuile d''olive. Utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour faire un peu\r\ndes fentes partout sur l''agneau. Piquez une tranche de\r\nl''ail et une petite branche de romarin dans\r\nchacun. Asseyez l''agneau sur les légumes\r\ndans le plat à rôtir, ajoutez un peu de vin,\r\npuis faites cuire 2h si vous l''aimez rose, ou\r\n2h15 pour une cuisson complète. Supprimer\r\ndu four, transférer sur une planche et\r\ncouvrir de papier d''aluminium, puis laisser reposer 45 minutes à 1 heure.","Pour faire la sauce, versez la majeure partie du\r\ngraisse de la boîte mais laissez les légumes et tout\r\njus de viande. Mettez le moule sur le feu pour\r\ncaraméliser les légumes, puis incorporer la farine\r\net cuire jusqu''à obtenir une pâte. Incorporez progressivement le\r\nvin, cuire une minute, puis incorporer le\r\nbouillon et laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que vous ayez\r\nune sauce savoureuse. Passez la sauce dans un\r\ntamiser dans une petite casserole et réserver au chaud.","Allumez le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nPour les miettes, mixez le tout dans un aliment\r\nprocesseur et répartir sur un plateau. Cuire au four\r\nau four pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants,\r\npuis relancez le blitz ou rompez avec vos doigts\r\nà nouveau en miettes. Ceux-ci peuvent être réalisés en\r\navance et conservé dans un contenant hermétique\r\npendant 2 jours. Servir l''agneau découpé\r\ntranches, saupoudrées de chapelure et d''un pichet\r\nde sauce à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:05:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10437,7085,'fr','Rôti de bœuf avec sauce aux oignons caramélisés','Le dessus du rôti saignant est la pièce maîtresse ultime – rendez-le encore plus spécial avec de la marmite et de la sauce à l''oignon doux','["1 cuillère à soupe de poivre noir","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de moutarde anglaise","1 cuillère à soupe de thym séché","1 cuillère à café de graines de céleri","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","environ 2 kg/4 lb 8 oz de rôti de bœuf","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","2 cubes de bouillon de boeuf","3 cuillères à soupe de chutney d''oignons caramélisés ou de marmelade","2-3 cuillères à café de Marmite"]','["Concassez les grains de poivre, la moutarde\r\npoudre, graines de thym et de céleri ensemble\r\navec un peu de sel, à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier.\r\nIncorporez l''huile, puis frottez-la sur tout le bœuf.\r\n(Si vous avez le temps, couvrez et refroidissez le rôti\r\ntoute la nuit pour mariner. Sortez le bœuf\r\ndu réfrigérateur 1 heure avant le rôtissage.)","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5\r\net placez le joint dans un plat à rôtir bien ajusté.\r\nRôtir pendant 12 minutes pour 450 g/1 lb (environ\r\n55 minutes pour un joint de 2 kg/4 lb 8 oz) pour\r\nmi-saignant, ou 15 minutes par 450 g/1 lb\r\n(environ 1 h 10 min) pour un puits moyen.","Retirer du four, soulever sur une\r\nassiette, couvrir de papier d''aluminium et laisser reposer 30\r\nminutes. Si vous préparez les Yorkies (p90),\r\naugmenter le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.","Pour la sauce, versez le jus de\r\nle plat à rôtir dans une cruche. Laissez les jus\r\nséparer, puis verser 2 cuillères à soupe de graisse\r\nremettre dans le moule – s’il n’y a pas de graisse, utilisez\r\n2 cuillères à soupe de beurre à la place. Jetez tout autre\r\ngraisse. Posez le plat à rôtir sur la plaque de cuisson et remuez\r\ndans la farine, les cubes de bouillon, le chutney d''oignons ou\r\nmarmelade et Marmite. Cuire 1 min,\r\nbien mélanger pour gratter les morceaux de bœuf\r\ncollé au moule, puis incorporez progressivement\r\n750 ml d''eau chaude de la bouilloire. Bulle\r\népaissir jusqu''à obtenir une belle consistance, puis\r\nréserver délicatement au chaud jusqu''au moment de servir\r\navec le bœuf découpé en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:05:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10438,7087,'fr','Pouding au bœuf, à la bière et aux panais','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une tarte traditionnelle au steak et à la bière avec une pâte au suif. Préparez la garniture la veille puis faites cuire le pudding à la vapeur le lendemain matin pour un délicieux déjeuner dominical.','["1 gros oignon, haché","100 g de lardons de lard fumé","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g de bœuf maigre à ragoût, coupé en cubes","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","3 panais, coupés en cubes","500 ml de bière brune","300 ml de bouillon de bœuf","2 cuillères à soupe de gelée de canneberges ou de groseilles","4 brins de thym","légumes verts, pour servir (facultatif)","beurre, pour graisser","300 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","140 g de suif râpé"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon\r\net les lardons ensemble pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Évider avec une écumoire\r\net mettre de côté. Ajouter l''huile dans la poêle,\r\nsaupoudrer le bœuf de farine, puis uniformément\r\nfaire dorer à feu vif.","Ajouter les panais, la bière, le bouillon, la gelée,\r\nverser le mélange de thym et de lardon dans la poêle.\r\nPortez à ébullition, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter\r\npendant 1h30 jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre.","Beurrer généreusement un pouding de 1,5 litre\r\nbassin. Pour faire la pâte, mélanger\r\nla farine, la poudre de moutarde, le suif et\r\n½ cuillère à café de sel de table. Ajoutez suffisamment d''eau froide,\r\nenviron 150 ml, pour obtenir une pâte molle.\r\nRetirer un quart de la pâte et mettre\r\nd''un côté. Sur une surface très farinée,\r\nétalez le reste de la pâte pour obtenir un\r\ngrand rond, assez grand pour tapisser le bassin.","Disposez délicatement la pâte dans la bassine\r\n(essayer d''avoir 1 cm de pâte qui dépasse\r\nla jante), puis appuyez sur les bords du joint\r\nensemble pour sceller. Déployez le reste\r\nun quart dans un cercle assez grand pour\r\ncouvrir le dessus.","Videz le liquide de cuisson du\r\nverser dans une petite casserole et réserver.\r\nJetez les tiges de thym. Verser le\r\nremplir dans le bassin tapissé et verser dessus\r\n100 ml de liquide de cuisson. Repliez le\r\nla pâte qui dépasse et badigeonner d''eau.\r\nPlacez le couvercle dessus en appuyant fermement\r\nsur les bords pour sceller.","Beurrer une feuille de papier sulfurisé,\r\nplier en un grand pli et déposer, côté beurre\r\nvers le bas, sur le pudding. Couvrir avec\r\nune couche de papier d''aluminium plissée et enfin nouez avec\r\nficelle, en faisant une boucle pour la poignée afin\r\nvous pouvez soulever le pudding facilement.","Asseyez-vous sur un petit dessous de plat ou un grand emporte-pièce\r\nau fond d''une casserole profonde c''est\r\nassez grand pour prendre le bassin facilement.\r\nRemplissez à moitié la casserole d''eau et portez à\r\nl''ébullition. Abaisser le pudding, couvrir et\r\nlaisser mijoter 2 heures en complétant avec l''ébullition\r\narroser si nécessaire.","Réchauffer le liquide de cuisson en le faisant bouillonner\r\nvers le bas un peu pour qu''il se réduise en un savoureux\r\nsauce. Retirez délicatement le pudding. Courir\r\nun couteau autour du bord, puis démoulez et\r\nservir avec de la sauce et des légumes verts, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10439,7089,'fr','Pâtés chinois aux panais épicés','Pour le pâté chinois – mais pas tel que vous le connaissez – essayez de cuisiner ces tartes individuelles épicées','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 gros oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","petite noix de gingembre, pelée et accordée","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","500 g de bœuf ou d''agneau haché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","100 g de petits pois surgelés","600 g de panais pelés et coupés en gros morceaux","grosse pomme de terre, pelée et coupée en gros morceaux","1 piment vert épépiné et haché","gros bouquet de coriandre, hachée","2 cuillères à café de curcuma","le jus d''1 citron","50g de beurre"]','["Pour la sauce, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et ajoutez l''oignon. Cuire jusqu''à tendreté, ajouter l''ail, le gingembre et la poudre de curry, puis cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient aromatiques. Augmentez le feu, ajoutez le hachis, faites revenir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, puis ajoutez les tomates et laissez mijoter pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Quelques minutes avant la fin, ajoutez les petits pois.","Pendant ce temps, versez les panais et les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau froide, portez à ébullition puis laissez cuire 10 min. Égoutter, assaisonner et écraser avec le reste des ingrédients.","Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 8. Assembler les tartes dans des plats individuels (ou un grand) en y déposant un peu de sauce à la viande.\r\nau fond et garnir de purée. Ébouriffez le dessus avec une fourchette, puis enfournez pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bouillonnant."]','2026-01-11 00:05:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10440,7091,'fr','Bœuf Wellington','Mettez à jour le centre de table d''un dîner de célébration en utilisant du prosciutto au lieu de crêpes pour envelopper la farce au bœuf et aux cèpes.','["1 kg de filet de bœuf - demandez à votre boucher de le couper à partir du milieu du filet et dites que vous ne voulez pas de la queue ni de la tête (chateaubriand) du filet","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour graisser","5 à 6 fines tranches de prosciutto","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","Paquet de 500 g de pâte feuilletée pur beurre","1 œuf battu","20 g de cèpes séchés","400 g de châtaignes ou de champignons de Paris émincés grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de feuille de thym frais","50g de beurre","1 grosse échalote, hachée finement","un peu de sauce Worcestershire","2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan fraîchement râpé","25g de beurre","1 échalote, hachée finement","brin de thym","1 feuille de laurier","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","un peu de cognac (facultatif)","verre de vin rouge","1 cube de bouillon de boeuf"]','["Faites d’abord tremper les cèpes séchés dans 400 ml d’eau bouillante et réservez. Tapotez le filet de bœuf avec du papier absorbant pour le sécher, puis assaisonnez avec du sel puis abondamment avec du poivre noir. Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude, puis passez 8 à 10 minutes à saisir et à retourner le filet avec des pinces jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien doré de tous les côtés. Tenez-le pour saisir également les deux extrémités. Mettez le bœuf de côté sur un plateau pour récupérer le jus et éteignez le feu de la poêle, mais ne la nettoyez pas.","Égouttez et essorez les cèpes séchés mais réservez le jus et passez les cèpes dans un robot culinaire avec les autres champignons et le thym. Assaisonnez le tout avec du sel et du poivre et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit finement haché mais pas complètement lisse. Remettez la poêle de bœuf sur le feu avec le beurre et quand elle commence à grésiller ajoutez l''échalote et laissez cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Augmentez le feu et versez les champignons, ajoutez un peu de sauce Worcestershire et faites cuire le tout pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que vous obteniez une pâte qui se détache des côtés de la poêle. Verser dans un bol pour refroidir, incorporer le parmesan si vous en utilisez et réserver. Éteignez le feu de la poêle mais ne la nettoyez pas.  Le bœuf peut être saisi et le mélange de champignons peut être préparé plusieurs heures à l''avance.","Pour la première étape du montage, munissez-vous d''une grande feuille de film alimentaire et superposez dessus les tranches de prosciutto en rangée, versez le mélange de champignons dessus puis recouvrez d''une autre feuille de film alimentaire. Soit avec vos mains, soit avec un rouleau à pâtisserie, tapotez-le ou étalez-le en une fine couche qui recouvre juste le prosciutto. Retirez la feuille supérieure de film alimentaire et déposez le filet au centre des champignons. A l''aide du bord du film alimentaire, soulevez et roulez le prosciutto et les champignons pour envelopper le bœuf puis utilisez le film alimentaire pour rouler le tout en un boudin bien serré. Pour de meilleurs résultats, placez maintenant la saucisse au congélateur pendant 30 minutes pour la raffermir – ne la laissez pas plus longtemps, car les temps de cuisson seront affectés.","Sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné, étalez la pâte en un rectangle un peu plus grand qu''un magazine, coupez les bords pour plus net et conservez les parures. Badigeonnez légèrement la pâte d’œuf battu. Déballez délicatement le paquet de prosciutto et déposez-le au milieu de la pâte. Comme pour emballer un colis ou faire un rouleau de printemps, pliez les bords les plus courts sur le filet, puis enroulez le tout autour du filet pour l''envelopper. Pour une finition vraiment soignée, procurez-vous une autre feuille de film alimentaire propre et roulez à nouveau le Wellington pour en faire une saucisse bien serrée. Placer au réfrigérateur et réfrigérer pendant au moins 30 minutes ou jusqu''à une journée.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 avec une plaque à pâtisserie solide et légèrement huilée. Reroulez les parures de pâte et utilisez-les pour réaliser 6 feuilles. Déballez le Wellington, badigeonnez le tout d''œuf puis décorez avec les feuilles. Badigeonner les feuilles avec plus d''œuf. Saupoudrer de sel marin feuilleté et transférer, côté scellé vers le bas, sur la plaque à pâtisserie chauffée. Enfournez 10 min puis baissez la chaleur du four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et poursuivez la cuisson 25 min pour une viande saignante, 30 min pour une viande saignante, 35 min pour une viande mi-saignante et environ 45 min pour une bien cuite, en veillant à ce que la pâte ne brûle pas (vous pouvez la recouvrir de papier aluminium si elle commence à devenir trop foncée. Sortez du four et laissez reposer 10 min.","Pour faire la sauce, faites chauffer le beurre dans la poêle à champignons et faites revenir l''échalote, le thym et le laurier en grattant les morceaux croustillants de la poêle avec une cuillère en bois. Répartir sur la farine et faire dorer puis ajouter le cognac, grésiller pendant une minute, puis ajouter le vin rouge et faire bouillir jusqu''à l''obtention d''une pâte violette. Versez le liquide de trempage des champignons en évitant les morceaux granuleux au fond, émiettez-le avec le cube de bouillon et le jus de bœuf au repos et laissez mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une sauce savoureuse, assaisonnez au goût.","À l''aide d''un couteau très tranchant, découpez soigneusement le Wellington en 6 tranches épaisses. Vous pouvez couper les extrémités de la pâte et les servir séparément. Servir sur des assiettes chauffées avec un pichet de sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:05:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10441,7093,'fr','Le relooking ultime : tarte au steak et aux rognons','Le plat réconfortant ultime fait peau neuve','["200 g de rognons d''agneau coupés en deux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons moyens, hachés","2 feuilles de laurier","4 brins de thym","600 g de steaks à ragoût maigres, coupés en morceaux","100 ml de vin rouge","2 cuillères à café de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 grosse carotte, hachée","4 champignons plats, en quartiers ou coupés en deux s''ils sont petits","3 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","140 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de feuilles de thym (facultatif)","25g de beurre très froid (ou surgelé)","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec 2 % de matière grasse","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Découpez et jetez les tubes fins de\r\nles reins. Rincer les reins à froid\r\narrosez jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire, puis\r\ncoupez-les en petits morceaux. Chauffer le\r\nhuile dans une grande casserole ou faire sauter profondément\r\ncasserole. Ajouter les oignons, le laurier et le thym\r\nbrins et faire revenir à feu moyen pendant\r\n8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient vraiment\r\ndoré, en remuant souvent. Mettez la bouilloire en marche.","Ajouter le steak et les rognons dans la poêle\r\net faites sauter brièvement, jusqu''à ce qu''il perde son\r\ncouleur rose. Augmentez le feu, versez le\r\nvin, remuer pour déglacer le fond du\r\ncasserole, puis laissez bouillir à feu vif pendant\r\n2-3 minutes jusqu''à réduction et absorption\r\nla viande. Incorporer la purée de tomates et\r\npoudre de moutarde. Tamisez la farine en remuant,\r\npuis remuez pendant quelques minutes. Verser\r\n400 ml d''eau bouillante et continuez de remuer\r\njusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à bouillir et soit\r\népaissi. Ajoutez la carotte et les deux\r\nchampignons, baisser le feu, couvrir avec\r\nun couvercle, puis laissez mijoter doucement pendant\r\nenviron 1 heure en remuant de temps en temps. Supprimer\r\nle couvercle et laisser mijoter encore 25-30 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce que la viande soit très tendre et que le\r\nla sauce a légèrement épaissi.","Retirer du feu et retirer le\r\nfeuilles de laurier et brins de thym. Incorporer le\r\npersil, assaisonner au goût, puis transférer\r\nsur une tarte ou un plat allant au four (22-23 cm de diamètre).\r\ndiamètre, profondeur 6 cm, capacité 1,7 litre\r\nou similaire), puis laisser refroidir légèrement.\r\nChauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Pendant que la viande refroidit, préparez le\r\npâtisserie. Mettez la farine, et le thym si vous en utilisez,\r\ndans un bol. Râper au froid ou surgelé\r\nbeurre, faites un puits au centre, puis\r\najoutez le yaourt, l''huile d''olive, une pincée de sel\r\net une bonne mouture de poivre noir.\r\nA l''aide d''un couteau à lame ronde, mélanger\r\navec 2 cuillères à café d''eau froide, puis recueillir délicatement\r\navec vos mains pour former un\r\npâte. Retirer du bol et pétrir\r\nbrièvement jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Étalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné\r\nsurface donc elle est légèrement plus grande que le haut\r\ndu plat à tarte. Étalez la pâte sur\r\nviande et coupez les bords avec des ciseaux pour\r\nil dépasse légèrement du bord du plat.\r\nFaites 2 petites fentes au centre. Flûte le\r\nbords, puis étalez les garnitures et\r\ndécoupez 6 feuilles en forme de losange. Amortir\r\nd''un côté et déposez-les sur le couvercle à pâtisserie.\r\nDisposez le plat sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis\r\ncuire au four environ 25 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:05:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10442,7095,'fr','Poulet rôti et sauce au beurre de citron et de thym','Lisser le beurre sous la peau de l''oiseau aide à arroser le poulet et les herbes ajoutent une délicieuse saveur à la sauce.','["50 g de beurre ramolli","bouquet de thym frais ou de thym citronné, feuilles cueillies, tiges réservées, plus un peu pour servir","4 gousses d''ail, 1 écrasée, les 3 autres laissées entières mais écrasées","2 citrons, coupés en deux","1 poulet, environ 1½ kg","2 carottes, hachées grossièrement","1 oignon, haché grossièrement","2 feuilles de laurier","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","250 ml de bouillon de poulet","un peu de sauce soja (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDans un petit bol, écrasez le beurre avec\r\nun tiers des feuilles de thym, le\r\npurée d''ail et le jus d''un demi\r\ncitron. Mélangez le tout avec\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement et réserver.","Utilisez votre main pour détacher le poulet\r\npeau loin du sein, puis poussez\r\nla majeure partie du beurre se mélange dans l''espace.\r\nFrottez le reste du beurre partout\r\nà l''extérieur du poulet, puis farcissez le\r\ncavité avec les moitiés de citron restantes\r\nles feuilles et les tiges de thym et l''ail.","Répartissez la carotte hachée, l''oignon\r\net des feuilles de laurier sur la base d''un petit\r\nplat à rôtir. Posez le poulet dessus,\r\nla poitrine vers le haut et rôtir au milieu\r\nréserver 1h30 en arrosant avec le\r\njus de beurre après environ 40 minutes. Quand\r\nle poulet est doré foncé, à la peau croustillante\r\net que le jus soit clair, retirez-le du\r\nfour et laisser dans le moule pendant 5 minutes. Utiliser\r\nune paire de pinces pour arracher les citrons, l''ail\r\net le thym hors de la cavité et dans le\r\nétain. Soulevez le poulet en laissant le jus\r\nverser dans le moule et transférer le\r\npoulet dans un plat de service pour qu''il repose\r\nau moins encore 15 minutes.","Pour faire la sauce, pressez le jus\r\ndes moitiés de citron cuites et\r\njeter les peaux. Placez la boîte à feu doux\r\nchauffer, incorporer la farine et grésiller jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger\r\nmarron. Versez progressivement le bouillon et\r\ncuire quelques minutes. Si vous aimez un plus sombre\r\nsauce, ajoutez un peu de sauce soja à la\r\nétain. Filtrer la sauce dans un pichet et servir\r\navec le poulet."]','2026-01-11 00:05:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10443,7097,'fr','Pâté chinois sans chichi','Nous avons quelques belles variantes du pâté chinois sur le site, mais il nous manquait une version définitive de cette recette familiale classique – la voici !','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 gros oignon, haché","2-3 carottes moyennes, hachées","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","une grosse touche de sauce Worcestershire","500 ml de bouillon de bœuf","900 g de pommes de terre coupées en morceaux","85g de beurre","3 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne,\r\npuis attendrissez l''oignon et les carottes pendant\r\nquelques minutes. Une fois tendre, augmentez le feu,\r\némietter l''agneau et le faire dorer en renversant\r\néliminer tout excès de graisse. Ajouter la tomate\r\npurée et sauce Worcestershire, puis\r\nfaire revenir quelques minutes. Versez sur le bouillon,\r\nporter à ébullition, puis couvrir et\r\ncuire 40 minutes en découvrant à mi-cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 180°C/\r\nventilateur 160C/gaz 4, puis faire la purée.\r\nFaire bouillir les pommes de terre dans de l''eau salée pendant\r\n10-15 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter, puis\r\nécraser avec le beurre et le lait.","Mettez le hachis dans un plat allant au four,\r\ngarnir de purée et ébouriffer avec une fourchette.\r\nLa tarte peut maintenant être réfrigérée et congelée\r\npendant un mois maximum. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le dessus commence à se colorer et\r\nle hachis bouillonne à la\r\nbords. (Pour cuire surgelé, cuire à\r\n160C/ventilateur 140C/gaz 3 pendant 1h-1h20\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud au centre. Flash\r\nsous le gril pour dorer, si vous le souhaitez.)\r\nLaisser reposer 5 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10444,7099,'fr','Crapaud aux herbes dans le trou','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce favori de la famille marie des saucisses de viande avec des herbes robustes et un pudding traditionnel et réconfortant du Yorkshire.','["140 g de farine nature","3 œufs","300 ml de lait","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","8 saucisses de Cumberland","8 feuilles de sauge","4 brins de romarin"]','["Chauffer le four à 240C/220C chaleur tournante/gaz 9. Dans un robot culinaire, mélanger la farine, les œufs, le lait, la moutarde et un peu de sel et de poivre, mixer jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis laisser reposer 30 minutes.","Versez l''huile dans une rôtissoire en métal d''environ 30 x 23 cm et 7,5 cm de profondeur. Badigeonnez d''huile tous les côtés et le fond, puis placez au four. Lorsque le plat à rôtir est très chaud et fumant, placez-y les saucisses, bien étalées, et laissez cuire 5 minutes.","Remuez la pâte reposée et versez-la dans le moule bien chaud – faites attention car elle pourrait cracher. Saupoudrez rapidement de feuilles de sauge et de romarin, puis placez au milieu du four. N''ouvrez pas la porte pendant 25 minutes, puis vérifiez – si nécessaire, laissez cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes. Cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé et doré et que la pâte soit complètement cuite. Servir directement du plat."]','2026-01-11 00:05:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10445,6899,'fr','Programme de citron','Un dessert rapide qui peut être aussi gourmand ou aussi sain que vous le souhaitez, expérimentez avec vos favoris','["284 pots de crème fouettée","50 g de sucre en poudre","50 ml de vin blanc","le zeste et le jus d''un ½ citron","fines amandes ou baies, pour servir"]','["Fouetter la crème et le sucre ensemble jusqu''à formation de pics mous. Incorporer le vin, la majeure partie\r\nle zeste de citron et le jus. Verser dans des verres ou des bols, saupoudrer du reste de zeste et servir avec des fines amandes ou des baies."]','2026-01-11 00:05:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10446,7101,'fr','Tarte au poisson – en quatre étapes','Délicieuse et facile – une tarte au poisson que tout le monde peut préparer. Vous apprendrez à pocher du poisson et à préparer une sauce blanche.','["400 g de filet de poisson blanc sans peau","400 g de filet d''aiglefin fumé sans peau","600 ml de lait entier","1 petit oignon, coupé en quartiers","4 clous de girofle","2 feuilles de laurier","4 œufs","petit bouquet de persil, feuilles seulement, hachées","100g de beurre","50g de farine nature","pincée de muscade fraîchement râpée","1 kg de pommes de terre farineuses, épluchées et coupées en morceaux égaux","50 g de cheddar râpé"]','["Pochez le poisson. Mettez le poisson dans la poêle et versez dessus 500 ml de lait. Piquer chaque quartier d''oignon avec un clou de girofle,\r\npuis ajoutez-le au lait, avec les feuilles de laurier. Portez le lait à ébullition – vous verrez quelques petites bulles. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter 8 minutes. Soulevez le poisson sur une assiette et filtrez le lait dans un pichet pour qu''il refroidisse. Écaillez le poisson en gros morceaux dans le plat allant au four.","Faites bouillir les œufs durs. Portez une petite casserole d''eau à ébullition douce, puis plongez-y délicatement les œufs à l''aide d''une écumoire. Apportez\r\nl''eau revient à ébullition douce, avec seulement quelques bulles remontant à la surface. Réglez le minuteur sur 8 minutes, faites cuire, puis égouttez et laissez refroidir dans un bol d''eau froide. Peler, couper en quartiers et disposer sur le poisson, puis parsemer de persil haché.","Préparez la sauce. Faire fondre la moitié du beurre dans une poêle, incorporer la farine et cuire 1 min à feu moyen. Retirez du feu,\r\nversez un peu de lait poché froid, puis remuez jusqu''à homogénéité. Continuez à ajouter le lait progressivement en mélangeant bien jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse. Remettez sur le feu, portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 5 minutes en remuant continuellement jusqu''à ce que le mélange nappe le dos d''une cuillère. Retirer du feu, assaisonner de sel, poivre et muscade, puis verser sur le poisson.","Assembler et cuire au four. Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Faire bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 20 min. Égoutter, assaisonner et écraser avec le\r\nle reste du beurre et du lait. Utilisez-le pour garnir la tarte, en commençant par le bord du plat et en progressant vers l''intérieur – poussez la purée jusqu''aux bords pour la sceller. Remuez le dessus avec une fourchette, saupoudrez de fromage, puis enfournez pour 30 min. Préparez la veille, mettez au frais puis enfournez pour 40 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:05:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10447,7103,'fr','Saucisses à la purée de pommes','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Donnez à vos bangers une cure de jouvence printanière avec l''ajout de purée de pommes, il n''y a pas beaucoup de nourriture réconfortante que cela.','["700 g de pommes de terre farineuses coupées en morceaux","8 saucisses de Cumberland","25g de beurre","1 oignon, tranché finement","2 cuillères à café de farine nature","250 ml de bouillon de bœuf","2 pommes (environ 280 g/10 oz), pelées et coupées en petits morceaux","3 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre à ébullition,\r\neau salée pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à tendreté.\r\nPendant ce temps, faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive\r\net ajoutez les saucisses. Cuire sur un\r\nà feu moyen pendant 15 à 20 minutes, en retournant\r\nde temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits.\r\nRetirer de la poêle et réserver au chaud.","Ajouter une noix de beurre et l''oignon\r\ndans la poêle, puis cuire 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoux. Incorporer la farine, puis ajouter progressivement\r\nle bouillon, en remuant pour faire une sauce.\r\nLaisser mijoter 2 minutes puis verser dans une carafe\r\net garder au chaud.","Cuire les pommes dans la moitié du reste\r\nbeurre pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Vidanger\r\nles pommes de terre et bien les écraser avec le\r\nreste du beurre et du lait. Pliez\r\nla pomme, puis servir avec les saucisses\r\net sauce à l''oignon."]','2026-01-11 00:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10448,7105,'fr','Yorkies sans échec','Parfaits pour éponger la sauce, ces puddings du Yorkshire, doux mais croustillants, lèveront à chaque fois grâce à une excellente pâte.','["450 ml de lait","4 gros œufs","250 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale"]','["Jusqu''à 3-4 heures avant la cuisson, mélangez\r\nensemble le lait, les œufs, la farine et 2 cuillères à café\r\nsaler dans un robot culinaire ou un mélangeur jusqu''à ce que\r\nvous avez une pâte lisse. Si tu ne le fais pas\r\navoir un robot culinaire ou un mixeur, fouetter\r\nles œufs dans la farine et le sel, puis\r\nincorporer progressivement le lait jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nTransférer dans un pichet, couvrir et laisser reposer\r\ntempérature ambiante pendant au moins 15 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et badigeonner 12 trous d''un muffin\r\nl''étain avec l''huile. Chauffer le moule au four\r\npendant 5 minutes, puis retirez-le délicatement et\r\nversez rapidement la pâte dans les trous.\r\nCuire au four 5 min, puis réduire\r\ntempérature du four à 200C/180C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 6 et cuire encore 30 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient gonflés, levés et dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10449,7107,'fr','Tartelettes Eccles au massepain','Cette variante amusante des gâteaux aux fruits traditionnels du Lancashire utilise les restes de pâte d''amande pour préparer d''irrésistibles tartes individuelles.','["300 g de restes de fruits secs, comme des raisins secs, des raisins secs, des groseilles","2 pommes ou poires à manger, évidées et râpées","50 g de sucre Demerara, plus un peu pour décorer","Il reste 100 g de masspain,","½ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","500 g de bloc de pâte feuilletée","un peu de farine, pour rouler","1 œuf battu"]','["Mélangez les fruits secs, la pomme ou la poire râpée, le sucre Demerara, la pâte d''amande, les clous de girofle et la cannelle.","Divisez la pâte en 6. Assemblez ensuite les tartelettes une à une. Coupez un morceau de pâte en deux et étalez chaque moitié en un cercle d''environ l''épaisseur d''un morceau de 50p sur une surface farinée. Versez un sixième de la garniture au centre d''un cercle en tas. Badigeonnez les bords d''œuf et soulevez le deuxième cercle de pâte par-dessus. Appuyez doucement sur le fruit pour expulser autant d''air que possible. Appuyez sur les bords de la pâte pour sceller. Utilisez un bol, un verre, etc. de taille appropriée pour vous aider à couper les bords en un cercle net. A ce stade, vous pouvez couvrir et réfrigérer les tartelettes toute la nuit, ou les congeler 1 mois. Décongelez avant de continuer. Badigeonner d''oeuf battu, puis faire trois petites entailles avec un couteau d''affilée. Répéter avec le reste de la pâte et la garniture.","Mettez les tartelettes au réfrigérateur pendant que vous chauffez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Lorsque le four est bien chaud, badigeonnez les tartelettes d''œuf partout et saupoudrez chacune d''un peu plus de sucre. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis déguster chaud avec de la glace ou de la crème anglaise."]','2026-01-11 00:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10450,7109,'fr','Tarte feuilletée au poulet et aux champignons','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. C''est exactement ce dont vous avez besoin par une nuit froide. Servir avec une purée de pommes de terre crémeuse','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","8 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","8 tranches de bacon fumé, coupées en gros morceaux","1 oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","Pack de 250 g de petits champignons de Paris","une poignée de brins de thym","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","400 ml de bouillon de poulet","200 ml de lait","Paquet de 500 g de pâte feuilletée fraîche ou surgelée et décongelée","1 œuf battu"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Assaisonnez le poulet au goût et faites-le frire pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, en le retournant de temps en temps. Vous devrez peut-être le faire en deux lots, selon la taille de votre poêle. Soulevez le poulet sur une assiette et versez le bacon dans la poêle. Faire revenir 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Ajoutez l''oignon, les champignons et le thym, puis faites revenir à feu vif pendant encore 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons commencent à colorer.","Versez la farine dans la poêle et faites cuire en remuant pendant 1 min. Avec la casserole hors du feu, remuez ou incorporez progressivement le bouillon, suivi du lait, puis remettez le poulet dans la poêle. Portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 30 mn. Versez la garniture dans un grand plat à tarte ou allant au four (environ 20 x 30 cm) avec un rebord et laissez refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/chaleur tournante 200°/gaz 7. Sur un plan fariné, étaler la pâte sur l''épaisseur de deux pièces de 1€. Découpez une longue bande aussi large que le bord du plat à tarte et, avec un peu d''œuf, fixez-la sur le bord du plat à tarte. Badigeonnez d''œuf, puis remontez le reste de la pâte sur la tarte en vous aidant du rouleau à pâtisserie. Appuyez doucement sur les bords avec vos doigts et coupez avec un couteau bien aiguisé. Badigeonner légèrement d''œuf pour glacer, puis cuire au four pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit levée et bien dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10451,7111,'fr','Scones sucrés','Une recette de scone simple et rapide avec une superbe finale sucrée – le dessus en sucre croquant ajoute également de la texture.','["85 g de beurre coupé en dés","350 g de farines autolevantes","¼ cuillère à café de sel","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","200 ml de lait, réchauffé à température ambiante, plus un peu en plus","morceaux de sucre concassé, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Incorporer le beurre\r\nfarine. Verser dans un bol et incorporer le sel avec le bicarbonate de soude\r\net du sucre. Utiliser des couverts\r\ncouteau, incorporer rapidement le lait –\r\nne mélangez pas trop.","Verser sur une surface légèrement farinée\r\net retournez-le plusieurs fois à très\r\nrassemblez délicatement avec vos mains.\r\nTapotez doucement jusqu''à environ 1 pouce d''épaisseur, puis tamponnez\r\nétaler des rondelles avec un emporte-pièce fariné. Pat\r\nensemble les parures pour en éliminer davantage.\r\nBadigeonnez davantage le dessus avec un peu de\r\nlait, puis saupoudrer de sucre concassé\r\ncubes. Cuire sur une plaque à pâtisserie pendant\r\n10-12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10452,7113,'fr','Légumes d''automne rôtis au fromage Lancashire','Un plat de souper végétarien coloré et copieux pour l''automne – préparé dans un plat à rôtir, de Roz Denny','["1 grosse courge musquée (environ 600-700 g/1 lb 5 oz - 1 lb 9 oz)","1 oignon rouge moyen","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros brin de sauge fraîche","1 grosse courgette","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique ou de Xérès","100 g de fromage Lancashire"]','["Préchauffer le four à\r\nventilateur180C/conventionnel 200C/\r\ngaz 6. À l’aide d’un couteau bien aiguisé, coupez\r\nla courge en deux et cuillère\r\nsortir les graines. Couper les moitiés\r\nen petits morceaux pour que vous puissiez\r\népluchez-les plus facilement. Hacher\r\nla chair en grosses bouchées\r\nmorceaux – ils ne sont pas obligés de le faire\r\nsoyez soigné.","Coupez l''oignon en deux et coupez-le\r\nracine en laissant un peu sur\r\nmaintenir les segments ensemble.\r\nPeler puis couper chaque moitié\r\nen quatre quartiers. Dispersez le\r\ncourge et oignon dans un grand\r\nplat à rôtir pour qu''ils aient\r\nbeaucoup d''espace pour rôtir, arroser\r\nplus de 5 cuillères à soupe d''huile et mélanger\r\nensemble. Effeuiller les feuilles de sauge\r\nde la tige et environ\r\nhacher – vous devriez avoir environ\r\n2 cuillères à soupe. Dispersez-vous sur le\r\nlégumes et assaisonner.\r\nRôtir pendant 20 minutes en remuant\r\nune fois à mi-parcours.","Pendant ce temps, coupez le\r\ncourgette épaisse et mélanger\r\navec le reste de l''huile.\r\nRetirez le plat à rôtir de\r\nle four et poussez le partiellement\r\ncourge et oignon cuits\r\nle côté. Mettez la courgette\r\ntranches à plat sur la base et\r\nsaison. Rôtir encore\r\n10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que tout\r\nles légumes sont tendres.","Sortez le moule du four,\r\nsaupoudrer le vinaigre sur\r\nlégumes et mélanger. Émietter\r\nsur le fromage Lancashire.\r\nRemuer légèrement pour que le fromage\r\nfondre un peu et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10453,7117,'fr','Éponge à la mélasse facile','Une version simple cuite au four de ce pudding classique de l''enfance, avec une sauce piquante à la mélasse formant une flaque irrésistible au fond','["250 g de sirop doré","le zeste d''1 citron et le jus de ½ citron","5 cuillères à soupe de chapelure","200 g de beurre ramolli","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","3 œufs moyens","200 g de farines autolevantes","5 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Mélanger le sirop, le zeste de citron, le jus et la chapelure et étaler sur le fond d''un plat allant au four de 1,5 litre.","Battre le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux, puis incorporer les œufs un à un. Incorporer la farine et le lait et verser sur le sirop. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés, et qu''un cure-dent enfoncé dans l''éponge en ressorte propre. Mangez avec beaucoup de crème anglaise, de crème ou de glace et un filet supplémentaire de sirop."]','2026-01-11 00:05:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10454,3866,'fr','Crevettes au curry','Savourez ces crevettes au curry d''inspiration jamaïcaine à base de lait de coco, de tomates, de piment et de nombreuses épices pour un dîner plein de saveurs. Servir avec du riz','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale ou de coco","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","Morceau de gingembre de 1 pouce, râpé","2 tomates hachées","½ piment scotch bonnet (facultatif)","24 à 36 gambas entières, ou achetez-les décortiquées","1½ cuillère à café de poudre de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","5 clous de girofle moulus","½ cuillère à café de fenugrec moulu","1 cuillère à café de paprika","½ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","1 cuillère à café de pâte de tamarin","400 ml de lait de coco","riz cuit, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l’huile dans une poêle à feu doux-moyen. Ajouter l''oignon et cuire 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et commence à caraméliser, en remuant régulièrement. Ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre, les tomates et le piment, si vous en utilisez. Augmentez le feu à moyen et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, si vous utilisez des crevettes décortiquées, préparez-les maintenant. Retirez la tête et, à l’aide d’une paire de ciseaux, coupez l’arrière de la coquille jusqu’à atteindre le dernier segment de coquille attaché à la queue. Coupez la couche supérieure de chair sur le dos de chaque crevette pour pouvoir retirer facilement la veine – détachez-la du corps, puis avec vos doigts aussi près que possible de la queue, tirez doucement pour retirer complètement la veine. Vous pouvez conserver les têtes et les coquilles pour constituer un stock.","Mélangez les épices moulues et la pâte de tamarin avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, puis ajoutez-les au mélange d''oignons. Cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les épices soient parfumées et que la majeure partie de l''eau se soit évaporée.","Incorporer le lait de coco et cuire pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une sauce épaisse, puis ajouter les crevettes. Cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste roses, puis retirer du feu. Servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:05:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10455,5663,'fr','Galettes de patates douces et de maïs avec bacon de tamarin et avocat','Savourez des gâteaux dorés à la patate douce et au maïs d''inspiration jamaïcaine avec du bacon sucré et collant et de l''avocat écrasé au piment.','["2 patates douces (500g)","1 pomme de terre (325g)","2 avocats mûrs, pelés et dénoyautés","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","¼-½ piment scotch bonnet, finement haché (facultatif)","1 citron vert, jus","2 épis de maïs (ou 300 g de maïs doux en conserve égoutté)","100 g de farine de manioc","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de tamarin","½ cuillère à café de miel","8 tranches de bacon épais","100 ml d''huile végétale","8 cuillères à soupe de crème sure, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Piquer les patates douces et la pomme de terre avec un couteau et les rôtir jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres – environ 45 min-1 h pour la pomme de terre et 40-50 min pour la patate douce, en les retournant à mi-cuisson. Retirer du four, laisser refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulé, puis retirer la chair de pomme de terre de la peau et l''écraser légèrement, mais pas pour qu''elle soit lisse – gardez-la en gros morceaux.","Pendant que les pommes de terre cuisent, versez l''avocat dans un bol et écrasez-le légèrement. Ajoutez la moitié des oignons nouveaux, le scotch bonnet, le cas échéant, le jus de citron vert et une pincée de sel et de poivre. Conserver au frais jusqu''au moment de servir.","Si vous utilisez du maïs frais, coupez les grains de l''épi et faites-les bouillir dans une casserole d''eau salée pendant 3 minutes. Rincer à l''eau froide pour refroidir. Ajoutez le maïs doux au mélange de pommes de terre, avec le reste des oignons nouveaux et un peu de sel et de poivre. Mélangez délicatement, puis prélevez une poignée de la taille d''une tomate. Roulez sur votre plan de travail, puis aplatissez légèrement jusqu''à ce qu''il atteigne environ 1 pouce d''épaisseur. Répétez jusqu’à épuisement du mélange, vous devriez avoir environ 12 à 14 gâteaux. Mettez la farine de manioc dans un bol peu profond et déposez-y délicatement les gâteaux un à un, puis roulez légèrement pour les enrober de farine.","Mélangez le tamarin et le miel avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau tiède jusqu''à dissolution complète. Faites chauffer une poêle à feu moyen et ajoutez les lardons. Après 1 minute, badigeonnez le dessus du mélange de tamarin et retournez-le en badigeonnant l''autre côté avec un peu plus du mélange. Au début, le bacon aura l''air de bouillir, mais continuez à ajouter le mélange et à le retourner encore deux fois, et il commencera à caraméliser. Une fois bien doré des deux côtés, retirez-le de la poêle et réservez au chaud.","Mettez l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive, suffisamment pour que l''huile remonte à mi-hauteur des gâteaux. Chauffer à feu moyen-vif et faire frire les gâteaux pendant 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et réserver au chaud pendant la cuisson des gâteaux restants. Pour servir, empilez deux ou trois gâteaux dans chaque assiette avec de la purée d''avocat et déposez dessus deux tranches de bacon. Servir 2 cuillères à soupe de crème sure à côté, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10456,5673,'fr','Ackee et poisson salé','Cuisinez un plat traditionnel jamaïcain, de l''ackee et de la morue salée, pour un brunch copieux. Avec des poivrons, des tomates et de l''ail aux côtés du fruit ackee, c''est plein de saveur','["600 g de morue salée désossée","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon moyen, finement haché","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 piment Scotch Bonnet, épépiné et finement haché","1 cuillère à café de thym séché","1 cuillère à café de piment moulu (piment de la Jamaïque)","½ poivron rouge épépiné et finement haché","½ poivron vert épépiné et finement haché","1 grosse tomate, hachée","2 boîtes de 540 g d''ackee, égouttées"]','["Mettez la morue salée dans un pan et couvrez d''eau froide. Portez à ébullition, puis faites bouillir pendant 5 minutes, égouttez et ajoutez de l''eau fraîche et froide pour couvrir.","Répétez ce processus jusqu''à ce que vous soyez satisfait du goût salé; nous recommandons de faire bouillir le poisson trois fois au total pour un équilibre parfait de sel dans le poisson. Égoutter et laisser refroidir. Utilisez une fourchette pour déchiqueter la morue salée en morceaux et réservez.","Vous aurez maintenant besoin d''une grande poêle à frire. Versez l''huile végétale dans la poêle et placez sur feu vif. Une fois que l’huile est très chaude, baissez le feu à doux-moyen. Ajouter l''oignon, l''ail, les oignons nouveaux et le scotch bonnet, puis cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, pendant environ 5 à 7 minutes.","Ajoutez ensuite les poivrons rouges et verts, ainsi que votre tomate. Mélangez et laissez cuire 2-3 minutes pour ramollir un peu les poivrons. Ces ingrédients aident à équilibrer la chaleur, donc ce n’est pas trop épicé."]','2026-01-11 00:05:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10457,7119,'fr','Chèvre au curry','Savourez ce curry de chèvre d''inspiration jamaïcaine regorgeant de saveurs pour un festin en famille. Apportez la marmite à table et laissez chacun se servir','["1 kg de viande de chèvre, coupée en cubes (nous avons la nôtre chez Cabrito Goat Meat)","4 cuillères à soupe de curry en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir","1 cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque (piment moulu)","3 cuillères à café de sel, au goût","1 oignon moyen, tranché","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement, plus un peu pour servir","2 cuillères à café d''ail émincé","6-7 brins de thym","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile (végétale ou de coco)","1 carotte moyenne, coupée en cubes","1 pomme de terre moyenne, coupée en cubes de 2 cm","1 piment Scotch Bonnet, laissé entier"]','["Mettez le chèvre dans un grand bol à mélanger et ajoutez tous les ingrédients sauf l''huile, la carotte, la pomme de terre et le piment. Frottez le tout dans la viande jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien enrobée. Mettre au réfrigérateur pour mariner pendant au moins 1 heure ou toute la nuit.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à fond épais à feu moyen-vif et ajoutez la viande. Remuer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré de tous les côtés. Versez suffisamment d''eau chaude pour recouvrir la viande (environ 800 ml). Mettez le couvercle et laissez mijoter à feu doux pendant 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre et tendre. Continuez à vérifier et à remuer toutes les 30 minutes et ajoutez un peu plus d''eau si elle réduit trop, pour éviter que la casserole ne se dessèche.","Pendant les 30 dernières minutes de cuisson, ajoutez les carottes, les pommes de terre et le piment. Retirez le couvercle et laissez mijoter encore un peu pour épaissir, si vous le souhaitez. Remuer et assaisonner au goût, puis parsemer d''un peu d''oignon nouveau supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:05:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10458,7121,'fr','Riz et petits pois','Servir du riz et des pois en accompagnement avec du poulet jerk à la caribéenne ou d''autres viandes grillées. Les « pois » sont en réalité des haricots rouges','["Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges rincés et égouttés","400 ml de lait de coco écrémé en boîte","½ cuillère à café de thym séché","½ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","6 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","200 g de riz à grains longs"]','["Mettez les haricots, le lait de coco, le thym, le piment de la Jamaïque, 4 oignons nouveaux et 100 ml d''eau dans une casserole, et portez à ébullition. Assaisonner avec beaucoup de sel et de poivre noir.","Rincez le riz plusieurs fois dans une passoire jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire. Versez dans la casserole et laissez mijoter 10 minutes à feu moyen en remuant de temps en temps avant de baisser le feu. Mettez le couvercle et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les grains soient tendres et que le liquide soit absorbé. Remuez le riz avec une fourchette avant de servir et parsemez avec les oignons nouveaux réservés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10459,7123,'fr','Porc effiloché jerk avec salsa à la banane','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Le plat parfait à partager pour une fête est épicé avec des assaisonnements caribéens et servi avec une salsa fruitée grossière.','["200g de sel marin","300 g de sucre muscovado noir","2 kg d''épaule de porc désossée, débarrassée de la couenne, mais sans gras","4 cuillères à soupe d''assaisonnement jerk (nous avons utilisé Bart), mélangées avec 2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","150 ml de jus d''ananas","50g de mélasse","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et bien rincés","beaucoup de tortillas molles à la farine (2-3 par personne selon la taille et l''appétit)","grand pot de yaourt nature et laitue râpée, pour servir (facultatif)","3 bananes moyennes, fermes à mûres, pelées et coupées en cubes de 1 cm","1 oignon rouge, coupé finement","2 avocats juste mûrs","jus d''1 citron","jus de 2 citrons verts","1-2 piments rouges épépinés et coupés en dés","petit paquet de coriandre, tiges finement hachées, feuilles grossièrement hachées"]','["La veille, mélangez le sel marin et 200 g de sucre dans un grand sachet alimentaire. Ajoutez le porc et enrobez-le bien, puis laissez-le au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Le lendemain, retirez le porc et essuyez la viande avec du papier absorbant pour éliminer tout excès de sucre ou de sel. Frottez 3 cuillères à soupe d''épices jerk partout et placez la viande sur une grille, dans un plat à rôtir. Laissez mariner un peu au réfrigérateur, puis 30 min avant de commencer la cuisson, ressortez à température ambiante.","Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1. Mélanger les 100 g de sucre restants avec le jus d''ananas, le reste des épices jerk et de la mélasse, et frotter la moitié sur le porc. Versez l''autre moitié dans le moule et faites rôtir pendant 6 heures. Arrosez la viande avec le jus et faites rôtir encore 1 heure jusqu''à ce que l''extérieur soit carbonisé et l''intérieur tendre. Laissez reposer le porc sur une assiette pendant 20 minutes et versez le jus du moule dans un pichet séparateur de graisse.","Mettez la banane coupée en dés dans un bol avec l''oignon. Dénoyautez, épluchez et coupez les avocats en dés et ajoutez-les également. Incorporer le jus de citron et de lime, les piments, les tiges et les feuilles de coriandre et un peu d''assaisonnement.","Faites chauffer les haricots noirs au micro-ondes et réchauffez les tortillas en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Ajoutez quelques fourchettes au porc pour le déchiqueter, jetez la graisse des jus de conserve et servez le reste à côté pour verser. Servir le porc avec les wraps, les haricots, la salsa à la banane, le yaourt et la laitue râpée, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10460,7125,'fr','Côtes levées collantes à la jerk et à la cassonade avec riz à l''ananas','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Des piles de côtes de porc constituent une alternative au poulet dans ce festin caribéen avec une marinade collante et un accompagnement basmati fruité.','["2 carrés de côtes de porc de 500 g","3 cuillères à soupe d''assaisonnement jerk","600 ml de jus d''ananas","5 cuillères à soupe de cassonade molle et foncée","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","jus 1 citron vert","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 grosse échalote banane, tranchée finement","1 poivron vert épépiné et coupé finement en dés","Paquet de 200 g de morceaux d''ananas frais, coupés finement en dés","2 cuillères à café de cassonade","200 g de riz basmati cuit et refroidi","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée"]','["Disposez les côtes levées dans un plat à rôtir et frottez-les avec 2 cuillères à soupe du mélange d''épices jerk. Laisser mariner au moins 2 heures, ou de préférence toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Mettez les côtes levées dans un plat à rôtir propre, assaisonnez et versez dessus 500 ml de jus d''ananas. Couvrir le moule de papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 2 heures.","Mélangez le reste du mélange d''épices jerk, le jus d''ananas, le sucre, le vinaigre, le jus de citron vert et une bonne pincée de sel dans une casserole. Chauffer jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve, puis faire bouillonner jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et collant.","Pour préparer le riz, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou un wok. Ajouter l''échalote et le poivre et faire sauter jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez l''ananas, la cassonade et beaucoup d''assaisonnement et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que l''ananas commence à caraméliser.","Sortez les côtes levées du four et versez le liquide de cuisson. Augmentez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Séchez les côtes avec du papier absorbant, puis badigeonnez-les de sauce jerk partout. Remettre au four pendant 20 minutes, en badigeonnant du reste de sauce toutes les 5 minutes environ, jusqu''à ce que les côtes soient vraiment collantes.","Ajoutez le riz cuit dans la poêle avec l''ananas et les légumes, faites sauter encore 2 minutes en remuant de temps en temps, puis ajoutez la coriandre. Servir avec les côtes collantes – et quelques serviettes !"]','2026-01-11 00:05:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10461,7127,'fr','Porc jerk avec riz et haricots','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une version rapide d''un favori du porc jerk jamaïcain – plein de saveur, pas trop épicé.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce jerk jamaïcaine","4 petits steaks longs de porc disposés d''environ 500 g/1 lb 2 oz au total","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","50 g de crème de noix de coco (en bloc)","1 botte d''oignons à salade","2 sachets de 250 g de riz basmati pur Rizzazz (riz prêt à l''emploi sous vide)","Boîte de 410 g de haricots rouges égouttés"]','["Remplissez la bouilloire à moitié et portez à ébullition. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu doux pendant que vous versez la sauce jerk dans un plat peu profond et utilisez-la pour enrober les steaks de porc des deux côtés. Placez-les dans l''huile chaude (réservez la sauce laissée dans le bol) et augmentez le feu. Faire frire 4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits et richement glacés.","Pendant que le porc frit, versez 150 ml d''eau bouillante dans une casserole moyenne à feu vif et émiettez-le avec le cube de bouillon et la crème de noix de coco. Coupez et tranchez les oignons nouveaux, en les tenant ensemble pour pouvoir les hacher tous en une seule fois. Ajoutez à la poêle, remuez rapidement, puis versez le riz et les haricots. Remuer et chauffer doucement, en brisant les mottes de riz avec une cuillère. Si le riz semble un peu sec, ajoutez un peu d''eau supplémentaire.","Versez le reste de la sauce dans la poêle pour la réchauffer avec le porc. Empilez le riz dans des assiettes, garnissez de porc et versez le jus de cuisson dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:05:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10462,7129,'fr','Galettes de bœuf des Caraïbes','Rehaussez la viande hachée de bœuf avec une sauce au curcuma, au thym et au piment fort avant de l''incorporer dans une pâte brisée pour un dîner ou un déjeuner savoureux.','["filet d''huile","1 petit oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","250 g de bœuf haché","1 pomme de terre, coupée en cubes de 1 cm/½","2 cuillères à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","quelques brins de thym","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce au piment fort","500 g de bloc de pâte brisée","1 œuf battu","salade verte, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez l''oignon et faites cuire 5 minutes. Ajoutez l''ail et le bœuf, augmentez le feu et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que la viande soit dorée. Ajoutez la pomme de terre, la moitié du curcuma, la purée et le thym ainsi que 200 ml d''eau. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 15 minutes, puis retirer le couvercle et cuire encore 5 minutes. Ajouter la sauce au piment fort et laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Abaisser la pâte jusqu''à obtenir l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1€. Découpez des cercles de 6 x 15 cm en vous servant d''une petite assiette comme guide. Répartissez le hachis entre les cercles en l''empilant sur un côté. Mélangez l''œuf avec le reste du curcuma, badigeonnez le pourtour de chaque cercle, puis repliez et scellez les bords à l''aide d''une fourchette. Disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, badigeonner d''un peu d''œuf et enfourner pendant 20-25 minutes. Servir avec une salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:05:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10463,7131,'fr','Saumon jerk collant avec salade de mangue','Servir de gros filets de saumon avec un glaçage épicé au miel des Caraïbes sur une salade de chou maison avec du chou, du poivron rouge, de la mangue et de la coriandre.','["2 cuillères à soupe bombées de pâte de jerk jamaïcaine","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","4 filets de saumon","jus de 2 citrons verts","½ chou rouge, cœur retiré, tranché finement","1 mangue ferme mais mûre, sans la peau, tranchée finement","1 poivron rouge, tranché finement","6 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement en biais","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen-vif. Mélangez la pâte jerk et 1 cuillère à soupe de miel dans un bol. Placer les filets de saumon sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier d''aluminium et badigeonner le tout de sauce. Cuire sur l''étagère du haut pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tout juste cuit (déplacez la plaque vers le bas si le saumon commence à trop caraméliser).","Pendant ce temps, mettez le reste du miel, le jus de citron vert et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un grand bol et mélangez. Ajouter le chou rouge, la mangue, le poivron, les oignons nouveaux et la coriandre et mélanger avec la vinaigrette. Servir le saumon sur un tas de salade de chou."]','2026-01-11 00:05:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10464,6547,'fr','Tacos épicés aux crevettes jerk et à la mangue avec vinaigrette à la noix de coco','Utilisez de la pâte jerk à la caribéenne pour faire mariner les crustacés, puis servez-la dans des tacos de maïs croquants avec une salade texturée et une sauce légère.','["300 g de gambas crues décortiquées","1½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de jerk jamaïcaine","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","1 grosse mangue, dénoyautée, pelée et coupée en dés","½ oignon rouge, tranché","½ concombre, haché","bouquet de coriandre, feuilles hachées grossièrement","8 coquilles à tacos","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 laitues Little Gem, râpées","165 ml de lait de coco en boîte","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","2 pincées de sucre"]','["Mélanger les crevettes et la pâte jerk ensemble\r\ndans un bol et réserver. Mélangez ensemble le\r\ningrédients de la vinaigrette.","Versez les haricots dans un bol avec\r\nla mangue, l''oignon, le concombre, la plupart\r\nde la coriandre, de la vinaigrette et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement. Réchauffer les coquilles de tacos\r\nen suivant les instructions de l''emballage.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle,\r\najouter les crevettes et cuire 2-3 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit.","Pour construire les tacos, commencez par une poignée\r\nde laitue, suivi de la salade de haricots,\r\npuis garnir de crevettes. Saupoudrer\r\nle reste de coriandre et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10465,7133,'fr','Poulet jerk facile avec riz et petits pois','Un classique des Caraïbes, cette recette constitue un repas de semaine délicieux et satisfaisant','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 kg de cuisses et pilons de poulet","1 boulons à la sauce barbecue jerk (Levi Roots old Walkerwood the Waitrose)","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","200 g de riz basmati","2 boîtes de 410 g de haricots rouges","400 g de lait de coco en boîte","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, hachés","1 brin de thym","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans une rôtissoire, puis\r\najoutez délicatement les morceaux de poulet.\r\nFaites-les dorer légèrement sur toutes les faces\r\n– cela prendra environ 6 à 8 minutes. Verser\r\nsur la sauce jerk, parsemer\r\nles oignons nouveaux tranchés, puis mélangez\r\npour enrober chaque morceau de poulet.","Rôtir le poulet pendant 30 minutes,\r\ntourner de temps en temps pour s''assurer\r\nça devient agréable et collant.","Pendant que le poulet cuit,\r\npréparez le riz et les petits pois. Rincer le\r\nriz dans une passoire jusqu''à ce que l''eau coule\r\nclair. Apportez une casserole d''eau au\r\nfaire bouillir avec le liquide uniquement du\r\nles haricots rouges, le lait de coco,\r\noignons nouveaux, thym, ail, piment de la Jamaïque\r\net du sel, puis laisser mijoter pendant\r\n10 minutes. Ajoutez les haricots, puis\r\nlaisser mijoter encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle riz est tendre. Égoutter et servir\r\ntout de suite avec le poulet."]','2026-01-11 00:05:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10466,7135,'fr','Beefburger Jerk avec relish et chips d''ananas','Aromatisez votre viande hachée avec des épices jamaïcaines et servez-la avec un chutney tropical contrastant et des frites.','["4 très grosses pommes de terre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon rouge, ½ râpé et ½ finement haché","1 carotte, râpée","400 g de bœuf haché","2 cuillères à café d''assaisonnement jerk (nous avons utilisé Bart)","200 g d''ananas frais (nous avons utilisé un sachet prédécoupé), finement haché","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","une petite poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement","jus 1 citron vert","laitue et pains à burger, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nFrottez les pommes de terre et coupez-les en chips.\r\nDisposez les chips en une seule couche sur une plaque allant au four\r\nplateau, arroser d''huile, assaisonner et mélanger\r\nmanteau. Cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant.","Mélangez l''oignon râpé, la carotte,\r\nhacher et assaisonner dans un grand bol,\r\npuis façonner 4 galettes de taille égale.","Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude, puis\r\nfaites cuire les burgers 5 à 6 minutes de chaque côté.","Pour faire la relish, mélangez le haché\r\noignon, ananas, piment, coriandre et\r\njus de citron vert. Pour servir, disposez les burgers\r\ndans des petits pains fendus avec un peu de laitue et le\r\nrelish épicée. Servir avec les chips croustillantes."]','2026-01-11 00:05:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10467,7137,'fr','Patates douces piquantes et épicées','Ravissez vos papilles avec des patates douces piquantes et épicées','["2 grosses patates douces (environ 500 g/1 lb 4 oz chacune)","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de thym frais, plus 2 brins de thym frais","1 piment rouge scotch bonnet, épépiné et finement haché"]','["Épluchez les patates douces et coupez-les transversalement en tranches de 2,5 cm d''épaisseur. Disposez chaque pomme de terre sur une grande feuille de papier d''aluminium, en gardant les tranches ensemble.","Arroser chaque pomme de terre d''huile d''olive, saupoudrer de feuilles de thym, d''environ la moitié du piment haché et assaisonner avec beaucoup de sel et de poivre. Avec vos mains, massez les arômes dans chaque tranche. Remettez les tranches dans leurs positions d''origine. Déposez une branche de thym sur chaque pomme de terre et saupoudrez du piment restant. Enroulez solidement le papier d''aluminium autour des pommes de terre pour former deux paquets. (Vous pouvez vous préparer à cette étape jusqu''à 24 heures à l''avance.)","Placez les papillotes sur la grille au-dessus de la partie la plus chaude du barbecue et laissez cuire 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient beurrées et ramollies. (Déballez et testez avec la pointe d’un couteau pour vérifier s’ils sont prêts)."]','2026-01-11 00:05:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10468,7139,'fr','Salade d''avocat exotique','Savourez des saveurs piquantes et sucrées dans cette salade d''avocat exotique','["3 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille","2 papayes mûres","3 avocats mûrs","Sachet de 85 g de cresson paré et lavé","Paquet de 20 g de menthe fraîche","le jus d''1 citron vert","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Faites frire à sec les graines de citrouille dans une poêle pendant quelques minutes, en les remuant et en les retournant jusqu''à ce qu''elles paraissent grillées. Sortez-les de la poêle et laissez-les refroidir. Épluchez les papayes, coupez-les en deux dans le sens de la longueur et retirez les graines. Coupez la chair en tranches longues et fines. Coupez les avocats en deux et retirez les noyaux, puis retirez la peau et coupez la chair en fines tranches dans le sens de la longueur.","Mettez les papayes, les avocats, les graines de citrouille et le cresson dans un grand bol. Hachez environ 1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de menthe et réservez. Retirez les feuilles restantes des tiges et déchirez-les dans le bol.","Mélangez le jus de citron vert et l''huile d''olive avec le reste de la menthe hachée pour obtenir une vinaigrette, puis assaisonnez avec du sel et du poivre au goût. Versez sur la salade et mélangez délicatement tous les ingrédients avec vos mains. Goûtez et ajoutez plus de sel et de poivre si vous pensez que cela en a besoin, puis transférez dans un plat de service."]','2026-01-11 00:05:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10469,7141,'fr','Ananas glacé aux épices et fromage frais à la cannelle','Essayez cette gourmandise tropicale lorsque vous souhaitez terminer un repas sur une note sucrée sans trop d''effort ni trop de calories.','["le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","2 pincées de cannelle moulue","quelques râpées de noix de muscade entière","2 cuillères à café de sucre glace tamisé","200 g de fromage frais allégé","2 cuillères à café de beurre","1 ananas frais, coupé en 8 longs quartiers, peau et noyau enlevés"]','["Mélanger le jus de citron vert et la moitié du zeste de citron vert\r\navec 1 cuillère à soupe de miel, une pincée de cannelle\r\net muscade. Réservez cette sauce. Remuez le\r\nsucre glace et une pincée de cannelle dans\r\nle fromage frais.","Faire chauffer le beurre et le miel restant\r\ndans une poêle antiadhésive jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu.\r\nAjouter l''ananas et cuire à feu vif\r\nchauffer pendant 8 minutes en retournant régulièrement jusqu''à ce que\r\ncaramélisé. Verser le citron vert épicé\r\nsauce et faire bouillonner pendant quelques secondes, en remuant\r\nl''ananas à glacer dans la sauce.","Servir aussitôt, saupoudré de\r\nle zeste de citron vert restant et accompagné de\r\nune cuillerée de fromage frais à la cannelle"]','2026-01-11 00:05:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10470,7143,'fr','Ragoût de poisson trinidadien de Natalie','Ce plat au soleil des Caraïbes est parfait à partager entre amis – assurez-vous de faire mariner le poisson dans du citron et du citron vert pour obtenir un goût vraiment piquant.','["2 citrons verts, le jus et le zeste râpé de 1, l''autre coupé en deux pour servir","1 filet de poisson blanc sans peau, comme la morue ou le hoki, environ 175-200 g/6-8 oz chacun","2 citrons, jus seulement","2 sachets de 15 g de thym frais (il en faut beaucoup pour l''arôme)","¼ cuillère à café de poivre blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de rhum brun","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, coupé en fines rondelles","une poignée de coriandre fraîche hachée","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 steak de bœuf ou 3 tomates normales, tranchées","2 cuillères à café de sucre muscovado noir","shake d''Angostura bitters, facultatif","riz basmati ou pommes de terre bouillies et légumes vapeur, pour servir"]','["Versez le jus et répartissez le zeste du premier citron vert dans un plat peu profond suffisamment grand pour contenir le poisson en une seule couche. Faites tourner le jus pour qu''il recouvre toute la surface du plat. Disposez le poisson dessus et versez dessus le jus de citron.","Retirez les feuilles de thym des tiges et écrasez-les avec une pincée de sel et le poivre blanc à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier pour obtenir une pâte grossière. Versez la pâte de thym sur le poisson et massez-la doucement en prenant soin de ne pas briser la chair. Versez le rhum dessus et frottez-le une dernière fois. Couvrir et laisser mariner hors du réfrigérateur pendant environ 1 heure.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle peu profonde avec un couvercle. Ajoutez les rondelles d''oignon et faites cuire pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Versez la coriandre, l''ail, les tranches de tomates et le sucre avec les oignons, remuez et laissez cuire environ 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates commencent à libérer leur jus et que tout sente bon.","Sortez le poisson de sa marinade et placez-le dans la poêle parmi les oignons et les tomates. Versez dessus la marinade, 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et le bitter Angostura, si vous l''utilisez.","Couvrir la poêle et cuire doucement pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson se défasse facilement et que les oignons soient ramollis mais aient encore un peu de mordant. Assaisonner de sel et de poivre. Le plat trinidadien authentique est piquant-doux avec beaucoup de saveur de thym et très citronné, alors goûtez la sauce et si vous voulez plus de piquant, pressez-y le reste du citron vert. Servir avec du riz basmati ou des pommes de terre bouillies et des légumes cuits à la vapeur."]','2026-01-11 00:05:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10471,7145,'fr','Plantains grillés','Cuisinez des plantains parfaits en les enveloppant dans du papier d''aluminium et en les faisant griller. Ce parent latino-américain de la banane est délicieux dans les plats sucrés et salés.','["2 plantains mûrs – la peau doit être noire","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara","8 cuillères à soupe de jus d''orange fraîchement pressé"]','["Épluchez les plantains et coupez-les transversalement en tranches de 2,5 cm d''épaisseur. Disposez chaque plantain sur une grande feuille de papier d''aluminium, en gardant les tranches ensemble pour qu''elles conservent leur forme originale.","Enduisez chaque plaintain de beurre (ou parsemez-le s''il est dur) et saupoudrez de sucre. Formez une gondole autour de chaque plantain avec le papier d''aluminium, puis versez dessus le jus d''orange et salez et poivrez dessus. Enroulez complètement le papier d’aluminium autour des plantains afin qu’ils soient bien scellés à l’intérieur. (Vous pouvez vous préparer à cette étape jusqu''à 24 heures à l''avance.)","Placez les papillotes sur la grille du barbecue et laissez cuire 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bananes plantains soient tendres (pour vérifier si elles sont prêtes, ouvrez une papillote et testez avec la pointe d''un couteau)."]','2026-01-11 00:05:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10472,6144,'fr','Mélange d''épices Jerk','Cette combinaison d''épices des Caraïbes crée une saveur douce et piquante – vous pouvez ajouter du piment Scotch Bonnet pour le rendre super épicé.','["2 cuillères à soupe de cannelle moulue ou 2 bâtons de cannelle","2 cuillères à soupe de grains de poivre noir","1 cuillère à soupe de thym séché","2 cuillères à café de baies de piment de la Jamaïque","1½ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","½ noix de muscade"]','["Faire griller les épices entières dans une petite poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elles\r\nsont aromatiques et ont pris une teinte ou\r\ndeux plus sombres. Ne soyez pas tenté de sauter ça\r\nétape, car cela rehausse vraiment les saveurs.","Versez dans un moulin à épices (ou utilisez un pilon)\r\net mortier), puis ajouter le mélange prêt à l''emploi\r\ndes épices et des herbes séchées si nécessaire, et\r\nécraser en poudre fine. Conserver dans un endroit scellé\r\npot jusqu’à six mois."]','2026-01-11 00:05:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10473,7149,'fr','Poulet à la mangue, haricots et riz','Les pilons sont idéaux pour un plat de cuisson tout-en-un : le riz, les haricots et l''assaisonnement épicé en font un peu le poulet jerk des Caraïbes.','["petit bouquet d''oignons nouveaux, hachés","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché","3 gousses d''ail","1 piment rouge épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant","une petite poignée de coriandre, tiges grossièrement hachées et feuilles cueillies","1 cuillère à soupe de feuille de thym","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert, plus 1 citron vert coupé en quartiers pour servir","1½ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","8 pilons de poulet","300 g de riz à grains longs","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges rincés et égouttés","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 mangue mûre, pelée, dénoyautée et coupée en bouchées","200 g de chutney de mangue, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez les oignons nouveaux, le gingembre, l''ail,\r\npiment, tiges de coriandre, thym, zeste de citron vert\r\net du jus, du piment de la Jamaïque et de l''huile dans un aliment\r\nrobot, puis mélanger en une pâte. Verser\r\nsur les pilons de poulet et laisser\r\nlaisser mariner au moins 1 h, ou de préférence\r\njusqu''à 1 jour.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nVersez le riz et les haricots dans un grand\r\nplat à rôtir à parois profondes. Supprimer\r\nle poulet de la marinade et mettre\r\nde côté. Mélangez le bouillon à la marinade\r\ndans le bol et remuez bien. Versez le bouillon\r\nsur le riz et les haricots, puis mettez le\r\npilons de poulet et mangue\r\nmorceaux sur le dessus. Couvrir hermétiquement le plateau\r\navec du papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes.","Sortez la plaque du four et\r\nretirez le papier d''aluminium. Augmentez la température à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7. Versez le\r\nchutney de mangue sur les pilons\r\net remettre au four, à découvert, pendant\r\n35-40 minutes, pour dorer les morceaux de poulet\r\net laissez le riz absorber tout le liquide.\r\nAvant de servir, gonflez un peu le riz\r\navec une fourchette et parsemer de coriandre\r\nfeuilles. Servir avec des quartiers de citron vert et plus\r\nchutney de mangue, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10474,7151,'fr','Soupe simple à la noix de coco et aux haricots','Ce repas végétarien dans un bol montre comment quelque chose de délicieux peut être préparé à partir d''ingrédients principalement stockés.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","½ botte d''oignons nouveaux, blancs et verts séparés et tranchés","1 poivron rouge, coupé en dés","1 piment Scotch Bonnet, épépiné et réduit en pâte","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à café de thym séché","1 cuillère à café de poudre de curry moyenne","1 cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque","3 tomates italiennes, hachées","1 cube de bouillon de légumes","Boîte de 410 g de haricots rouges rincés et égouttés","Boîte de 410 g de haricots pinto, rincés et égouttés","Boîte de 410 g de haricots à yeux noirs, rincés et égouttés","2 boîtes de 400 g de lait de coco","jus de 2 citrons verts"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole.\r\nFaire grésiller les blancs d''oignons nouveaux,\r\npoivre, pâte de piment et ail pour\r\n5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et parfumés.\r\nAjoutez le thym, la poudre de curry et\r\népices, puis cuire encore 1 min,\r\nIncorporer les tomates, puis cuire pendant\r\n2 minutes pour ramollir légèrement.","Émietter dans le cube de bouillon, puis\r\nverser tous les haricots et la noix de coco\r\ndu lait. Laisser mijoter 10 mn. Éteindre\r\nle feu et incorporez la majeure partie du\r\nles feuilles d''oignons verts, le jus de citron vert\r\net un peu d''assaisonnement. Verser dans\r\nbols et parsemer du reste\r\noignons nouveaux juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10475,4813,'fr','Smoothie tropical pour le petit-déjeuner','Commencez votre journée avec ce mélange fruité de fruits de la passion, de mangue, d''orange et de banane. C''est une bonne source de vitamine C et fournit également 1 de vos 5 par jour','["3 fruits","1 banane, hachée","1 petite mangue pelée, dénoyautée et hachée","300 ml de jus d''orange","glaçons"]','["Versez la pulpe des fruits de la passion dans un mixeur et ajoutez le jus de banane, de mangue et d''orange. Réduire en purée lisse et boire immédiatement, garni de glaçons."]','2026-01-11 00:05:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10476,7153,'fr','Nachos reggae reggae','Ces nachos plairont à tout le monde, parfaits pour les partager entre amis autour d''un cocktail','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, coupé en dés","½ piment Scotch Bonnet, épépiné et finement haché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","½ bouteille de 295 g de sauce tomate Levi Roots Love Apple ou de sauce tomate avec une bonne touche de Tabasco","½ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque","2 sachets de 200 g de chips tortilla","Pot de 200 g de piments jalapeno tranchés","2 boules de 125 g de mozzarella déchirées","une petite poignée de coriandre hachée","Pot de 230 g de guacamole frais","½ pot de 300 ml de crème sure"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis\r\nattendrir quelques instants l''oignon et le piment\r\nminutes. Incorporer les tomates, la tomate\r\nsauce et piment de la Jamaïque. Bulle pendant 1 min,\r\npuis retirez du feu.","Prenez un grand plat allant au four ou\r\nassiette et empiler les chips tortilla.\r\nNappez de sauce tomate, puis\r\nsaupoudrer de jalapeños tranchés\r\net mozzarella.","Mettre au four environ 15 min\r\njusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu. Disperser avec\r\ncoriandre. Servir avec du guacamole\r\net crème sure à part."]','2026-01-11 00:05:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10477,4363,'fr','Jerk patate douce & curry de haricots noirs','Servez votre curry de légumes à la façon des Caraïbes, parfumé au thym, à l''assaisonnement jerk et aux poivrons rouges – excellent avec du riz et des petits pois','["2 oignons, 1 coupé en dés, 1 haché grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","50 g de gingembre haché grossièrement","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles et tiges séparées","3 cuillères à soupe d''assaisonnement jerk","2 brins de thym","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre demerara","2 cubes de bouillon de légumes émiettés","1 kg de patates douces pelées et coupées en morceaux","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs rincés et égouttés","Pot de 450 g de poivrons rouges rôtis, coupés en tranches épaisses"]','["Ramollir délicatement l''oignon coupé en dés dans le\r\nhuile de tournesol dans une grande poêle ou une cocotte.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez grossièrement\r\noignon haché, gingembre, tiges de coriandre\r\net assaisonnement jerk avec un appareil à main\r\nmixeur. Ajouter à l''oignon ramolli et faire revenir\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé. Incorporer le thym haché\r\ntomates, vinaigre, sucre et cubes de bouillon\r\navec 600 ml d''eau et porter à ébullition.\r\nLaisser mijoter 10 minutes, puis verser le\r\npatates douces et laisser mijoter 10 min\r\nplus. Incorporer les haricots, les poivrons et un peu\r\nassaisonner et laisser mijoter encore 5 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient presque tendres. Frais\r\net réfrigérer jusqu''à 2 jours.","Pour servir, faites chauffer doucement sur le\r\ntable de cuisson. Hachez grossièrement la majeure partie de la coriandre\r\nfeuilles et incorporer, puis servir dispersé\r\navec les feuilles restantes."]','2026-01-11 00:05:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10478,7155,'fr','Poulet aigre-doux','Essayez une version authentique de ce plat chinois classique à emporter, avec une douceur naturelle et une saveur chaude de piment pour pimenter les choses.','["huile de tournesol ou végétale, pour la friture","100 ml d''eau gazeuse, réfrigérée","140 g de farines autolevantes","25g de maïzena","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en morceaux","oignons nouveaux, finement émincés, pour servir","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en morceaux","3 piments rouges, 1 coupé en morceaux, 2 coupés en deux et épépinés","Boîte de 425 g de morceaux d''ananas égouttés et jus réservé","Anis 4 étoiles","50 g de pâte de tamarin","100 g de sucre en poudre","100 ml de vinaigre de vin de riz ou de vinaigre chinois"]','["Pour la sauce, mettez le poivron rouge, les morceaux de piment et le jus d''ananas dans une casserole et portez à ébullition. Couvrir et cuire 10 min, puis réduire en purée au robot culinaire.","Remettre dans la poêle avec les morceaux d''ananas, les moitiés de piment, l''anis étoilé, le tamarin, le sucre et le vinaigre. Laisser mijoter doucement pendant 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit réduit et collant. Gardez au chaud ou réchauffez pour servir.","Remplissez une grande poêle de 1 cm de profondeur avec de l''huile et faites chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''elle brille. Incorporez l''eau gazeuse et 100 ml d''eau froide à la farine autolevante avec un peu de sel. Bien mélanger la pâte.","Versez la maïzena sur une assiette, tapissez une plaque de papier absorbant et allumez le four à feu doux. Saupoudrez le poulet de maïzena, puis plongez-le dans la pâte.","Un à la fois, plongez-les dans l''huile chaude (environ 5 à 6 fois par lot). Augmentez le feu pour que le poulet continue de frire, si nécessaire, et laissez cuire 5 à 6 minutes, en retournant une fois.","Une fois cuit, égouttez-le sur la plaque et réservez au chaud au four. Répétez avec le poulet restant.","Empiler sur une assiette avec la sauce chaude à côté et parsemer d''oignons nouveaux émincés."]','2026-01-11 00:05:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10479,7157,'fr','Sauce Kung Pao','Préparez cette sauce originaire du Sichuan, en Chine. Épicé-doux et piquant avec une touche d''épices engourdissantes provenant des grains de poivre du Sichuan, il est délicieux accompagné de poulet ou de crevettes.','["1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à soupe d''ail, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","½ cuillère à café de grains de poivre du Sichuan, grillés et moulus","2 piments séchés « chao tian jiao »","1 cuillère à café de sauce aux haricots chili","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce hoisin","1 cuillère à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz noir Chinkiang","200 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet chaud"]','["Mélangez la maïzena avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans un bol et réservez. Faites chauffer un wok à feu moyen. Une fois chaud, ajoutez l''huile, puis mélangez l''ail, le gingembre, le piment, les grains de poivre du Sichuan et le piment séché. Faites frire pendant quelques secondes avant d''incorporer la sauce aux haricots chili, le hoisin et le ketchup. Une fois mélangés, versez la sauce soja, le vinaigre et le bouillon. Porter à ébullition puis arroser du mélange de maïzena et bien mélanger. Retirer du feu et verser dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Laisser refroidir puis réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:05:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10480,7159,'fr','Sauce bang-bang','Utilisez cette sauce chinoise classique sucrée et épicée pour l''incorporer à des nouilles au poulet ou à vos plats chinois préférés. Cela fonctionne bien avec des crevettes, des légumes frits ou du tofu','["1 gousse d''ail, râpée","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","1 gros piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 grosse pincée de grains de poivre du Sichuan moulus","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète croquant","½ cuillère à café de sauce soja noire","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère faible en sodium","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz noir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame grillé","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients dans un grand bol et remuez. Versez 80 ml d''eau chaude et mélangez bien. Assaisonner au goût, en ajoutant un peu de sucre ou de sauce soja si nécessaire. Utiliser pour assaisonner du poulet, des crevettes, des légumes ou du tofu."]','2026-01-11 00:05:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10481,7161,'fr','Tanghulu','Essayez ce dessert chinois classique composé de baies d''aubépine ou de fruits trempés dans du sucre. C''est croustillant, juteux et facile à préparer','["300 g de fraises équeutées","150 g de raisins retirés des vignes","350 g de sucre blanc semoule","Brochettes de bambou de 18 cm ou moins"]','["Lavez les fruits et séchez-les soigneusement. Enfiler sur la brochette en alternant fraises et raisins, avec un raisin à chaque extrémité. Répétez avec les fruits restants et réservez.","Versez de l''eau froide et de la glace dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, huilez légèrement une assiette ou un plateau avec une huile neutre (comme le tournesol) et mettez de côté. Versez le sucre dans une grande casserole avec 700 ml d''eau. Portez lentement à ébullition à feu moyen-doux pendant 5 à 6 minutes, en faisant tourner la casserole pour vous assurer que le sucre fond uniformément, mais ne remuez pas. Une fois fondu, laissez bouillonner pendant 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le sirop épaississe et réduise. Pour tester, trempez une brochette nue dans le sirop et plongez-la immédiatement dans l’eau glacée, si elle durcit et se fissure – c’est prêt.","Trempez les brochettes de fruits préparées dans le sirop à l''aide de pinces, puis immédiatement dans l''eau glacée jusqu''à ce que la coque extérieure durcisse. Transférer dans une assiette ou un plateau légèrement huilé. Assurez-vous de reconstituer la glace une fois fondue. Répétez avec les brochettes restantes. Si le sirop de sucre commence à durcir dans la poêle, réchauffez-le à nouveau doucement – ​​le tout est d''agir rapidement."]','2026-01-11 00:05:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10482,7163,'fr','Potée à la chinoise','Remplissez une marmite de bouillon épicé avec du poivre du Sichuan et du piment, puis invitez les invités à y pocher les ingrédients de leur choix – les crevettes, le steak, le tofu et le poulet fonctionnent tous bien.','["300 g de crevettes tigrées décortiquées et déveinées, la tête et la queue laissées","250 g de surlonge de bœuf, l''excédent de gras retiré et tranché finement","300 g de tofu fumé, égoutté et coupé en cubes de 1 pouce","300 g de filet de porc, tendon retiré, tranché finement","4 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en lanières","300g de fruits de mer assortis (nous avons utilisé des coquilles Saint-Jacques, des boulettes de poisson et des rondelles de calamar)","400 g de légumes assortis (nous avons utilisé du pak choi, du chou chinois, du brocoli à longue tige, des carottes et du poivron rouge), hachés","300 g de champignons assortis (nous avons utilisé des pleurotes, des châtaignes, des champignons de Paris, des shiitake et des épis de bois), coupés en deux ou déchirés en gros morceaux","200 g de peau de tofu","400g de nouilles assorties (nous avons utilisé des haricots mungo, des vermicelles de riz, des nouilles aux œufs)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","3-4 piments longs séchés « chao tian jiao »","30 g de dus de pauvreté","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce aux haricots chili","1,7 l de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes, chaud","6 champignons chinois séchés","1 anis étoilé","une petite poignée de zestes de mandarine séchés (facultatif)","50 ml d''huile de piment","5 cm de gingembre pelé et tranché","½ chou chinois lavé, feuilles séparées, tranché en morceaux de 2,5 cm d''épaisseur","3 oignons nouveaux , tranchés en biais","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère faible en sodium","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce satay","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz noir","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame grillé","1 cuillère à café d''ail, écrasé","1 cuillère à café de gingembre râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre finement hachée","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 jaune d''oeuf (facultatif)","1 cuillère à café de graines de sésame blanc grillées","1 cuillère à café d''ail, écrasé","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés finement","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère faible en sodium","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz noir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame grillé"]','["Pour préparer la base de soupe, faites chauffer un grand wok de 2 litres ou une casserole large et profonde à feu vif et ajoutez l''huile. Ajoutez les piments et les grains de poivre du Sichuan et mélangez pendant 5 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés.","Ajoutez la sauce aux haricots chili et versez le bouillon. Ajoutez les champignons chinois séchés et l''anis étoilé, le zeste de mandarine séché (le cas échéant), puis versez l''huile de piment, ajoutez le gingembre et portez à ébullition. Ajoutez le chou chinois et faites bouillir pendant 2 minutes avant d''incorporer les oignons nouveaux.","Mélangez les ingrédients des deux sauces dans des bols séparés et réservez.","Installez une plaque à induction électrique au centre de votre table à manger et entourez-la d''assiettes contenant les matières premières de votre choix. Mettez le wok rempli de bouillon à mijoter sur le feu.","Chaque personne peut ajouter ses ingrédients à cuire dans le bouillon et utiliser une cuillère en métal pour les repêcher. Cuire les fruits de mer, le poulet et le porc jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement opaques et les légumes peuvent être cuits au goût. Servir avec les trempettes."]','2026-01-11 00:05:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10483,7165,'fr','Riz frit aux œufs dorés et à l''oignon','La teinte dorée de l''œuf brouillé et de l''oignon carbonisé de ce plat symbolise la richesse du Nouvel An lunaire. Garnir d''huile de piment croustillant pour plus de saveur','["300 g de riz à grains longs cuit","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame grillé","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","3 œufs , battus","1 petit oignon , haché grossièrement","½ cuillère à café de sauce soja noire","pincée de poivre blanc moulu","1 oignon nouveau, émincé finement","1 cuillère à café d''huile de piment croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Versez le riz cuit dans un bol et incorporez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame. Mettez le piment dans un petit bol et incorporez 2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère.","Faites chauffer un wok à feu vif et ajoutez la moitié de l''huile de colza. Ajoutez une pincée de sel puis versez les œufs en remuant rapidement pour brouiller pendant environ 30 secondes. Retirer à l''aide d''une écumoire et réserver.","Remettez le wok sur le feu et ajoutez le reste de l''huile de colza, faites chauffer pendant 20 secondes. Ajoutez l''oignon et remuez constamment pendant un peu moins d''une minute jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Incorporer le riz jusqu''à ce qu''il soit décomposé. Assaisonner de sauce soja noire et bien mélanger. Remettez les morceaux d''œufs brouillés dans le wok et mélangez. Versez le reste de sauce soja légère, l''huile de sésame et le poivre blanc. Saupoudrer d''oignons nouveaux. Pour servir, garnir de piment rouge assaisonné et d''huile de piment croustillant, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10484,7167,'fr','C''est de la nourriture aux œufs','Dégustez une version d''œufs brouillés chinois. La préparation ne prend que 10 minutes et vous pouvez ajouter votre choix de protéines : crevettes, poulet, tofu ou porc char siu.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","150 g de protéines au choix, comme des gambas crues (décortiquées et déveinées) ou du poulet cuit, du porc char siu cuit ou du tofu pré-frit, coupé en bouchées","1 petit oignon blanc, coupé en lanières","40 g de champignons émincés","40g de petits pois","¼ cuillère à café de poivre blanc","4 oeufs, battus"]','["Chauffer à feu moyen-vif. Une fois chaude, versez l’huile, puis ajoutez la protéine de votre choix et étalez-la au fond du wok. Lorsqu''il commence à dorer, ajoutez l''oignon émincé et poursuivez la cuisson 1 à 2 minutes en remuant régulièrement pour le ramollir légèrement. Ajoutez les champignons et remuez.","Lorsque les champignons commencent à ramollir, ajoutez les petits pois avec le poivre blanc et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Faites sauter 1 min, puis ajoutez les œufs fouettés. Essayez de ne pas remuer les œufs – prenez plutôt le wok et faites tourner les œufs autour du reste des ingrédients. Une fois qu''ils commencent à prendre, incorporez-les lentement au reste du plat. Retirer du feu dès que les œufs sont presque complètement cuits."]','2026-01-11 00:05:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10485,5445,'fr','Chow mein au bœuf santé','Remplacez vos plats à emporter hebdomadaires par ce chow mein au bœuf sain : il est rapide à cuisiner et faible en gras et en calories.','["2 nids de nouilles complètes (85g)","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza ou de sésame","200 g de filet de bœuf maigre, dégraissé et coupé en lanières","1 petit oignon rouge (100g), finement haché","15 g de gingembre pelé et finement haché","160 g de champignons de Paris tranchés grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","160 g de germes de soja prêts à consommer","1½ cuillère à café de tamari","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz brun","4 oignons nouveaux (65 g), coupés en diagonale"]','["Faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans un wok et faites sauter le bœuf à feu vif pendant 30 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Versez sur une assiette, réservez, puis ajoutez le reste d''huile dans le wok. Faire revenir l''oignon et le gingembre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez une goutte d''eau pour éviter de brûler, si nécessaire et laissez cuire à couvert pendant 2-3 minutes.","Incorporer les champignons et l''ail et faire revenir jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir (environ 3 minutes), puis ajouter les germes de soja et cuire encore une minute ou deux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très chauds.","Mélangez le tamari et le vinaigre dans un petit bol avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Ajoutez les nouilles égouttées dans le wok, mélangez bien, puis ajoutez le mélange de tamari, les oignons nouveaux et le bœuf. Faire sauter pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien chaud. Assaisonner avec beaucoup de poivre noir et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10486,4527,'fr','Riz frit au réfrigérateur','Emballez des légumes avec ce riz frit au poulet sain, qui utilise des aliments de tous les jours que vous trouverez dans le réfrigérateur pour un souper familial rapide et facile.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon blanc, finement haché","1 carotte, hachée finement","100 g de haricots verts hachés","1 poivron rouge ou jaune, haché finement","½ brocoli moyen, coupé en petits bouquets","150 g de poulet cuit (ou toute autre viande), haché grossièrement","300 g de riz cuit froid","2 oeufs, battus","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","1 oignon nouveau, tranché finement","1 cuillère à café de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile végétale dans une poêle awokor à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir les oignons, les carottes et les haricots verts pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez les poivrons, le brocoli et le poulet et faites sauter encore 3 minutes.","Versez le riz et faites sauter encore 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que tous les grains de riz se soient séparés. Poussez le riz et les légumes sur le côté, puis ajoutez le reste de l''huile végétale dans l''autre. Cassez l''œuf et brouillez-le brièvement avant de l''incorporer au mélange de légumes et de poulet.","Incorporer l''huile de sésame et la sauce d''huître pour enrober, puis garnir d''oignons nouveaux et de graines de sésame."]','2026-01-11 00:05:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10487,5780,'fr','Fondue aux côtes collantes','Combinez des côtes levées collantes et une marmite pour préparer cette fabuleuse cocotte familiale. C''est plein de saveurs, avec des côtes de porc, patate douce, poivrons rouges et mangetout','["3 cuillères à soupe de sauce Hoisin Lee Kum Kee","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja noire Lee Kum Kee Premium","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz assaisonné Lee Kum Kee","3 cuillères à soupe de bouillon de volaille sans sel ou d''eau (facultatif, voir astuce)","500-600 g de côtes de porc, coupées en côtes individuelles","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame pour wok Lee Kum Kee","1 gousse d''ail, finement tranchée","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","4 oignons nouveaux, coupés en longueurs, le dessus vert finement tranché pour servir","1 poivron rouge, coupé en morceaux","1 petite patate douce, coupée en morceaux","100 g de mangetout coupé en lanières"]','["Mélangez la sauce hoisin, la sauce soja noire de qualité supérieure, le vinaigre de riz assaisonné et le bouillon de poulet ou l''eau dans un bol, puis ajoutez les côtes levées. Laissez mariner au moins 30 minutes – vous pouvez mettre les côtes levées au réfrigérateur toute la nuit, si vous le souhaitez.","Chauffer le four à 150C/130C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Bien égoutter les côtes levées (réserver la marinade éventuelle) et incorporer la maïzena. Faites chauffer l''huile de sésame pour wok dans l''awok, puis ajoutez les côtes levées, l''ail, le gingembre et l''oignon nouveau et faites revenir jusqu''à ce que les côtes soient dorées, en prenant soin de ne pas brûler l''ail. Assaisonnez bien. Ajouter le reste de la marinade ainsi que 100 ml d''eau et porter à ébullition. Versez le mélange dans une cocotte, puis incorporez le poivron rouge et la patate douce. Couvrir avec un couvercle hermétique. Mettez un morceau de papier sulfurisé sous le couvercle s’il n’est pas bien ajusté – cela aidera à sceller la vapeur.","Cuire au four pendant 50 min, puis incorporer le mangetout et cuire encore 10 min. Saupoudrer du reste de la ciboule pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10488,7169,'fr','Riz sauté à l''ananas','Ajoutez des morceaux d''ananas frais au riz frit pour le transformer en quelque chose de spécial. Servir seul pour un dîner en famille ou dans le cadre d''un banquet chinois','["1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","2 oeufs, battus","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","petit bouquet d''oignons nouveaux, hachés","1⁄2 cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","400 g de riz à grains longs cuit","85 g de petits pois surgelés","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","400 g d''ananas frais, coupé grossièrement en morceaux (environ 1⁄2 ananas moyen)"]','["1 Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un wok. Ajoutez les œufs en les remuant sur les côtés pour obtenir une fine omelette. Une fois cuite, roulez l''omelette sur une planche à découper et coupez-la en rubans.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile. Ajouter l''ail, les oignons et les cinq épices. Faites sauter jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille, puis ajoutez le riz (si vous utilisez des sachets, pressez-les d''abord pour séparer les grains), les petits pois, l''huile de sésame et le soja. Cuire à feu vif jusqu''à ce que le riz soit chaud, puis incorporer les rubans d''ananas et d''omelette."]','2026-01-11 00:05:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10489,7171,'fr','Boeuf au mangetout & noix de cajou','Allumez votre wok pour préparer ce bœuf chinois rapide au mangetout et aux noix de cajou. Un plat savoureux pour toute la famille, il ne faut que 15 minutes pour le préparer','["50 g de noix de cajou non salées","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","1½ cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","280 g de rumsteck tranché finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et coupé en allumettes"]','["Faire griller les noix de cajou dans un wok sec ou une poêle à frire, en remuant, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Verser sur une assiette et réserver. Mélangez la maïzena avec la sauce soja pour obtenir une pâte, puis ajoutez la sauce aux huîtres, le vinaigre et le miel. Lorsque vous êtes prêt à cuisiner, préparez tous les ingrédients et à portée de main – cela ne prendra que 5 minutes.","Faites chauffer le wok jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Ajoutez l''huile, faites-la tourner pour couvrir le fond de la poêle, puis utilisez des pinces pour placer les morceaux de steak dans le wok en une seule couche. Cuire sans retourner pendant 30 secondes-1 min, jusqu''à ce qu''une croûte foncée commence à se former sur la viande. Ajoutez le gingembre et l''ail, remuez le tout rapidement, puis ajoutez le mangetout et la sauce. Cuire encore 30 secondes à 1 minute jusqu''à ce que le bœuf soit bien cuit et que la sauce soit épaisse et brillante. Saupoudrer de noix de cajou et servir avec du riz ou des nouilles."]','2026-01-11 00:05:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10490,7173,'fr','Tofu sel et poivre','Utilisez les deux types de grains de poivre pour notre tofu sel et poivre si vous le pouvez, pour un picotement sur la langue et une chaleur épicée. Le plat est idéal pour un banquet chinois','["396 g de tofu ferme","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café de grains de poivre de Sichuan ou noir (ou un mélange des deux), réduits en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","2 poivrons rouges, tranchés","¼ tête de brocoli, coupée en très petits fleurons","100 g de germes de soja","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja faible en sel","huile de sésame, pour arroser","une poignée de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Égoutter le tofu, l''envelopper sans serrer dans du papier absorbant et le déposer sur une assiette. Posez une planche à découper dessus. Si vous utilisez une planche à découper légère, alourdissez-la avec quelques canettes – une planche à découper plus lourde suffira à elle seule. Laisser agir 10 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chiffon soit mouillé par l''excès de liquide. Presser ainsi le tofu permet de lui donner une texture plus ferme une fois cuit.","Coupez le tofu en deux au centre comme un livre. Coupez chaque morceau en quatre triangles, comme vous le feriez pour un morceau de pain grillé, puis à nouveau en deux pour obtenir 16 morceaux au total. Mélangez la maïzena, le poivre moulu et 1 cuillère à café de sel marin feuilleté dans une assiette. Retournez délicatement chaque morceau de tofu dans le mélange de farine de maïs pour bien l''enrober.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un wok. Faites sauter les poivrons et le brocoli pendant quelques minutes pour les ramollir un peu. Ajoutez les germes de soja et la sauce soja. Cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes, en vous assurant que les légumes sont toujours bien croquants. Arroser d''un peu d''huile de sésame.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile de tournesol dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir le tofu enrobé pendant 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Servir sur les légumes, parsemés de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:05:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10491,7175,'fr','Gambas au miel, sésame & orange','Dégustez nos gambas au miel, au sésame et à l''orange dans le cadre d''un festin chinois que toute la famille adorera. Garnir d''oignons nouveaux et servir avec du riz','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","1 grosse orange, zestée et pressée","3 cuillères à soupe de miel","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","généreuse pincée de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","300 g de crevettes crues","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée finement","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","200 g de riz à grains longs, cuit, pour servir"]','["Mélangez l''huile, le zeste et le jus d''orange, le miel, le soja et le vinaigre dans un bol, puis mélangez la maïzena, les graines de sésame, les cinq épices et une pincée de sel dans un autre bol. Passez un petit couteau sur le dos de chaque crevette pour qu''elles sortent pendant la cuisson, aidant ainsi davantage de sauce à y adhérer.","Mélanger les crevettes dans le mélange de farine de maïs. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand wok ou une poêle. Quand il fait très chaud, ajoutez l’ail. Faites grésiller pendant 10 secondes, mais ne le laissez pas dorer. Ajoutez les crevettes et la farine et les graines restantes dans le bol. Faites sauter à feu vif pendant quelques minutes, jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient roses et les graines de sésame dorées. Versez les crevettes dans une assiette et versez le mélange de sauce dans le wok. Faire bouillonner pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Remettez les crevettes dans le wok et remuez pour les enrober de sauce. Chauffer encore 30 secondes. Garnir d''oignons nouveaux et servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:05:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10492,7177,'fr','Biscuits chinois au chocolat blanc','Préparez ces biscuits de fortune faits maison pour le réveillon du Nouvel An. Même s''ils nécessitent un peu d''effort, ils divertiront les cuisiniers passionnés de la famille, et les résultats sont vraiment impressionnants.','["2 blancs d''œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de pépins de raisin","100 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","150 g de chocolat blanc haché","pépites, pour décorer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie d''une plaque à pâtisserie en silicone. Écrivez des fortunes sur des morceaux de papier blanc mesurant 6 cm de long sur 1 cm de large.","À l''aide d''un fouet électrique, fouettez les blancs d''œufs, la vanille et l''huile avec ½ cuillère à soupe d''eau froide jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient mousseux, environ 30 secondes. Mettez la farine, la maïzena, le sucre et une bonne pincée de sel dans un bol, puis versez dans une passoire et incorporez le mélange de blancs d''œufs. Fouetter pour obtenir une pâte lisse et réfrigérer pendant 1 heure.","Mettez ½ cuillère à soupe du mélange sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée. À l''aide d''un petit couteau à palette, étalez le mélange en un cercle fin de 8 cm. Répétez avec encore ½ cuillère à soupe du mélange pour faire deux biscuits, en les espaçant bien au fur et à mesure qu''ils s''étalent. Faites cuire deux biscuits à la fois, car vous devrez les façonner pendant qu''ils sont chauds. Cuire au four 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés.","À l''aide d''un couteau à palette, soulevez les biscuits un à un sur une planche en les retournant. Mettez une fortune au milieu du cercle, puis pliez le cercle en deux, en pinçant les deux bords ensemble pour sceller. Soulevez le biscuit sur le bord d''une tasse ou d''un moule et tirez très doucement les deux coins vers le bas pour lui donner forme. Maintenez 10 secondes, puis transférez les biscuits dans des moules à muffins afin qu''ils conservent leur forme pendant le refroidissement et la prise. Répétez avec le reste du mélange de biscuits.","Faire fondre le chocolat blanc au micro-ondes ou dans un bol posé sur une casserole d''eau frémissante. Versez les pépites dans de petits bols profonds. Trempez les deux extrémités de chaque biscuit dans le chocolat, secouez l''excédent, puis plongez-les dans les pépites. Laisser sécher sur une planche. Se conserve trois jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:05:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10493,4211,'fr','Bœuf facile à la sauce aux haricots noirs','Essayez ce simple sauté en utilisant du rumsteck tendre, des poivrons, du gingembre, du piment et de l''ail. Optez pour une sauce aux haricots noirs de bonne qualité : elle fera toute la différence','["2 x 250g de rhum","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame","1 gros oignon blanc, coupé en fines tranches","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché","1 poivron vert, épépiné et tranché","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé","1-2 piments rouges, finement hachés","5 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux haricots noirs","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","2 cuillères à café de sucre","riz gluant, pour servir","feuilles de coriandre, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Retirez l''épaisse couche de graisse qui coule sur les côtés des steaks et jetez-la. Coupez le steak en lanières longues de 1 cm d''épaisseur et mélangez-le avec la fécule de maïs et un peu d''assaisonnement.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou un wok à feu vif, puis ajoutez le steak et faites-le frire pendant 3 à 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré à l''extérieur. Retirer avec une écumoire et transférer dans une assiette.","Ajoutez l''oignon et les poivrons dans la poêle et faites-les revenir pendant 6 à 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Incorporer l''ail, le gingembre et le piment et cuire encore 1 min. Remettez le bœuf dans la poêle et mélangez la sauce aux haricots noirs, le vinaigre de vin de riz, le sucre et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour détendre un peu. Portez à ébullition puis retirez du feu.","Servir le sauté dans des bols profonds avec des monticules de riz gluant et garnir de coriandre, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10494,7179,'fr','Huile de gingembre et piment','Nous avons ajouté du piment à cet accompagnement traditionnel pour un peu plus de piquant. Servir avec des légumes chinois sautés et notre poulet cristal en une seule casserole','["parties blanches d''un bouquet d''oignons nouveaux","un gros morceau de gingembre","piment rouge entier","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale"]','["Hachez finement les oignons nouveaux, un gros morceau de gingembre et un piment rouge entier et versez-les dans un petit plat. Faites chauffer 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude, puis versez dans le plat et laissez grésiller. Peut être préparé la veille recouvert d''un film alimentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:05:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10495,7181,'fr','Sauté de porc pimenté et poivré','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un plat frais et simple avec une touche rafraîchissante de citron vert, et il est également super sain – alors pourquoi ne pas aimer ?','["100 g de riz thaï au jasmin","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol","250 g de filet de porc, coupé en lanières de la largeur d''un doigt","1 poivron rouge et 1 jaune, épépinés et tranchés","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja","jus 1 citron vert","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","½ piment rouge, tranché"]','["Mettez le riz dans une casserole avec 300 ml d''eau bouillante. Portez à ébullition, remuez une fois, couvrez avec un couvercle et réduisez le feu à doux. Cuire 15 minutes, temps à lequel le riz doit avoir absorbé tout le liquide et être parfaitement cuit. Faites frire à sec les graines de sésame jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, puis versez-les dans un petit bol et réservez.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive ou un wok, ajoutez le porc et les poivrons et faites sauter pendant 5 à 6 minutes à feu vif jusqu''à ce que le porc soit légèrement doré et bien cuit. Mélangez la maïzena et la sauce soja dans un bol, puis ajoutez le jus de citron vert, le miel, le piment et les graines de sésame, ainsi que 6 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide. Verser dans le wok et cuire jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe légèrement, en remuant la poêle pour enrober le porc et les poivrons. Servir avec le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:05:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10496,7183,'fr','Porc sauté au gingembre et au miel','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce plat de nouilles sain est délicieusement faible en gras avec un excellent mélange de saveurs asiatiques – le souper parfait en milieu de semaine.','["2 nids de nouilles aux œufs de taille moyenne","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","250 g de filet de porc, coupé en bouchées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché finement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 poivron vert, épépiné et tranché","100g mange tout","1 cuillère à café de graines de sésame"]','["Portez à ébullition une casserole d''eau salée et faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, mélangez la maïzena avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau, puis incorporez la sauce soja et le miel et réservez.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok à feu vif. Ajouter le porc et cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré. Ajoutez le gingembre, l''ail, le poivre et le mangetout, et laissez cuire encore 2 min. Réduisez le feu, puis ajoutez le mélange de soja et de miel, en remuant et en cuisant jusqu''à ce que la sauce bouillonne et épaississe. Répartissez les nouilles égouttées dans 2 bols. Garnir de porc et de légumes et terminer par une pincée de graines de sésame."]','2026-01-11 00:05:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10497,7185,'fr','chou frisé à la chinoise','Donnez à un bon vieux favori britannique une touche asiatique avec quelques simples shakes des bonnes sauces','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 grosse gousse d''ail, tranchée","Sachet de chou frisé de 200 g","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce aux huîtres"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand wok ou une poêle, puis versez l''ail et laissez cuire quelques secondes. Ajoutez le chou frisé et mélangez autour de la poêle pour l''enrober d''huile d''ail.","Versez dessus 100 ml d’eau bouillante et laissez cuire encore 7 minutes jusqu’à ce que le chou frisé soit fané et bien cuit.","Incorporer les sauces soja et d''huîtres et réchauffer pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10498,7187,'fr','Poitrine de porc braisée au gingembre rouge et piments marinés','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Le vinaigre noir chinois malté constitue une excellente base pour un one-pot mijoté avec du gingembre, du piment et une coupe de viande économe.','["2½ kg de poitrine de porc sans la couenne, coupée en morceaux de 5 cm","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja noire","200 ml de vin de riz Shaohsing","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, coupé en allumettes","pincée de flocons de piment","100 ml de vinaigre noir chinois (disponible chez Waitrose)","140 g de cassonade molle","700 ml de bouillon de légumes","graines de sésame grillées","oignons nouveaux tranchés","2 piments rouges tranchés et trempés dans du vinaigre de vin de riz pendant 1 h, puis égouttés","riz blanc cuit à la vapeur"]','["Mélangez le porc avec le soja et 1 cuillère à soupe de vin de riz. Laisser reposer 1h ou mieux toute une nuit au réfrigérateur.","Faites chauffer un peu d’huile dans une casserole moyenne à fond épais. Faire dorer la viande, par lots, des deux côtés et réserver. Ajoutez un peu plus d''huile et faites cuire l''ail, le gingembre et le piment pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Versez le vinaigre, le reste du vin de riz, le sucre et le bouillon dans la casserole et portez à ébullition. Ajoutez le porc, puis baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez mijoter pendant 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre. Pendant les 30 dernières minutes, retirez le couvercle, augmentez le feu et laissez le liquide réduire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais et sirupeux. Servir parsemé de graines de sésame, d''oignons nouveaux et de piments tranchés, avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:05:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10499,7189,'fr','Porc hoisin à l''ail et au gingembre','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Faites mariner les steaks de longe maigre avec une sauce chinoise, puis servez-les avec beaucoup de chou bok choi pour un souper sain.','["500 g de steak de porc coupé en tranches de 2 cm d''épaisseur","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère, plus un trait","350 g de brocoli à tige fine","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","5 cm de gingembre râpé","1 botte d''oignon nouveau, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur","350 g de bok choi, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur","riz ou nouilles, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le porc, le hoisin et la sauce soja dans un bol et laissez reposer 10 minutes. Chauffez le gril à feu vif, secouez l''excédent de sauce, puis déposez le porc sur un plateau. Griller pendant 5 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits. Retirer et laisser reposer 5 min dans un endroit tiède.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le brocoli dans un bol allant au micro-ondes avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau, couvrez d''un film alimentaire, puis mettez au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 3 minutes. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok, ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et faites sauter pendant 1 min. Ajoutez les oignons nouveaux et le bok choi, puis faites sauter encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez le brocoli avec un filet de sauce soja et faites sauter pendant 1 à 2 minutes de plus jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient bien chauds. Servir le porc avec les légumes verts, un filet de jus de porc au repos et du riz ou des nouilles, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10500,7191,'fr','Boulettes de porc orientales au bouillon hoisin','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Faibles en calories et peu coûteuses à préparer, ces boulettes de viande aux saveurs chinoises sont servies dans un bouillon clair et nourrissant avec beaucoup de légumes.','["500 g de viande hachée de porc maigre","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","Boîte de 225 g de châtaigne d''eau égouttée, moitié hachée finement, moitié tranchée","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","2 grosses carottes, coupées en lanières avec un éplucheur de pommes de terre","8 feuilles chinoises, partie épaisse tranchée, feuilles déchiquetées","300 g de germes de soja","un bouquet d''oignons nouveaux, coupés en longueurs, ainsi que quelques fanes hachées pour servir"]','["Versez le hachis dans un bol avec le soja, la maïzena, les cinq épices, les châtaignes d''eau hachées et un peu de poivre noir. Travaillez le tout ensemble, puis façonnez 12 boulettes de viande.","Versez le bouillon dans une casserole large et profonde et incorporez le hoisin et le gingembre. Ajoutez les boulettes de viande, puis couvrez et pochez 5 min. Déposez les carottes, les feuilles de Chine, les germes de soja, les oignons nouveaux et les châtaignes tranchées, puis mettez le couvercle et laissez mijoter 5 min. Verser dans des bols, puis servir parsemé de ciboules."]','2026-01-11 00:05:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10501,7193,'fr','Sauté de porc, haricots verts et huîtres','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un riche plat asiatique de nouilles ou de riz prêt en 20 minutes – un souper sain en famille en milieu de semaine.','["1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de haricots chili ou de sauce chili","75 ml de sauce aux huîtres","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","400 g de filet de porc coupé en fines tranches","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 oignon rouge, coupé en gros morceaux","140 g de haricots verts coupés en deux","riz ou nouilles cuits à la vapeur, pour servir"]','["Dans un petit bol, mélanger le jus de citron vert, la pâte de piment, la sauce aux huîtres et la moitié de la sauce soja. Annuler. Faites chauffer un grand wok avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Assaisonner le porc et mélanger avec le reste de la sauce soja. Saisir rapidement la viande, puis la retirer de la poêle.","Ajoutez le reste de l''huile et faites revenir l''ail, l''oignon et les haricots pendant 2 minutes. Remettez la viande dans la poêle avec la sauce et faites sauter encore 3 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe. Servir avec du riz cuit à la vapeur ou des nouilles."]','2026-01-11 00:05:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10502,7195,'fr','Porc braisé chinois aux doubles oignons nouveaux','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Utilisez les oignons nouveaux comme légume à part entière dans ce plat de porc mijoté.','["4 morceaux d''osso buco de porc (environ 850 kg/1 lb 14 oz) ou l''équivalent d''une épaule de porc","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 ml de vin de riz Shaohsing ou de xérès sec","100 g de gingembre finement tranché","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","12 oignons nouveaux, 8 gros et 4 plus fins","1 piment rouge séché (recherchez les piments du Cachemire pour une bonne saveur)","500 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte miso (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","riz cuit à la vapeur et bok choi, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nFaire dorer le porc des deux côtés dans l''huile,\r\npuis transférez-le dans une grande cocotte.\r\nDéglacez la poêle que vous avez utilisée pour dorer\r\navec le vin de riz ou le Sherry et ajoutez-le à\r\nla cocotte. Ajoutez le gingembre et l''ail.\r\nCoupez les extrémités des 8 gros oignons nouveaux\r\net ajoutez-les à la poêle en entier\r\navec le piment, le bouillon, la pâte miso (si utilisée)\r\net sauce soja. Amenez tout dans un\r\nlaisser mijoter, puis couvrir et mettre la cocotte\r\nau four pendant 2 heures.","Retirez le couvercle de la cocotte et\r\ncuire encore 20 minutes. Hachez le\r\n4 oignons nouveaux plus fins et ajoutez-les à\r\nla cocotte juste avant de servir avec\r\nriz cuit à la vapeur et bok choi."]','2026-01-11 00:05:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10503,7198,'fr','Porc braisé aux prunes','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Viande fondante et tendre dans une sauce épicée et fruitée, ce repas impressionnera à coup sûr.','["environ 1,6 kg/3 lb 8 oz d''épaule de porc","5 cuillères à soupe de vin de riz","5 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja claire pour la saveur, 1 cuillère à soupe foncée pour la couleur","morceau généreux de racine de gingembre frais de la taille d''un pouce","5 gousses d''ail","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","Anis étoilé 2","1 ½ cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices","1 bâton de cannelle","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre, n''importe quel type","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","6 prunes mûres, coupées en deux et dénoyautées"]','["Coupez le porc en gros morceaux de la longueur de votre pouce et deux fois plus larges. Mettez dans un bol ou un sac alimentaire et ajoutez le vin, les sauces soja, la moitié du gingembre, la moitié de l''ail et la moitié du piment. Laisser mariner au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3, puis faire chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte. Ajoutez la moitié des oignons nouveaux, le reste du gingembre et de l''ail, l''anis étoilé, la poudre de cinq épices et la cannelle. Frire doucement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé et tendre. Incorporez le sucre, augmentez le feu, puis retirez le porc de la marinade et incorporez le mélange d''oignons pendant environ 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que la viande soit juste scellée mais pas dorée. Versez la marinade, le concentré de tomates et le bouillon, remuez, couvrez puis braisez au four pendant 2 heures.","Une fois la première heure écoulée, ajoutez les prunes dans la poêle. Retirez le couvercle et poursuivez la cuisson à découvert. La viande doit être complètement tendre, devenant dorée là où elle brise la surface de la sauce. Retirez tout excès de graisse de la surface, puis retirez délicatement la viande et les prunes de la poêle avec une écumoire. Augmentez le feu et faites bouillir la sauce pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit réduite et légèrement sirupeuse. Remettez le tout dans la poêle, réchauffez doucement, puis répartissez le reste des oignons nouveaux sur le dessus et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10504,7200,'fr','Porc chinois croustillant','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans uniquement. Belly est le rôti de porc le moins cher et, comme il est riche, une petite quantité suffit, ce qui le rend parfait pour les dimanches et les dîners.','["Morceau de poitrine de porc désossée de 1,3 kg, avec la peau et entaillée, demandez le bout fin au boucher","2 cuillères à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja (nous avons utilisé du Kikkoman)","petite noix de gingembre frais, râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce chili douce thaïlandaise","1 oignon nouveau, finement haché"]','["Frotter le porc avec les cinq épices et 2 cuillères à café de sel marin puis laisser, à découvert, au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 2 heures, mais de préférence toute la nuit. Au moment de cuisiner, chauffez le four à son réglage maximum. Disposez le porc sur une grille au-dessus d''un plat à rôtir, en vous assurant que la peau est exposée. Rôtir 10 min avant de baisser le feu à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4, puis laisser cuire encore 1h30. Jetez un œil au porc – si la peau n''est pas croustillante, augmentez le feu à 220°C/ventilateur 200°C/gaz 7, puis laissez cuire encore 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Laisser reposer sur une planche pendant au moins 10 min.","Pour préparer la trempette, mélangez tous les ingrédients avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Coupez le porc en petits morceaux, puis servez-le avec la sauce, ainsi que du riz bouilli et des légumes verts cuits à la vapeur, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10505,7202,'fr','Wontons au porc et aux crevettes cuits à la vapeur','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Faible en gras mais si impressionnant – vous pouvez trouver les emballages dans les congélateurs des magasins d''alimentation asiatiques ou des halls d''alimentation spécialisés.','["175 g de porc haché","85 g de crevettes décortiquées, décongelées si congelées et hachées finement","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés petit","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de racine de gingembre râpée ou en purée","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","5 châtaignes d''eau (en boîte), égouttées et hachées finement","environ 36 feuilles de wonton, carrées de 9 cm, décongelées si congelées","de grosses feuilles de laitue ou du papier sulfurisé pour cuire à la vapeur","2 cuillères à soupe de saule de soja","2 cuillères à soupe de xérès sec","2 cuillères à café de gingembre frais râpé ou en purée","lambeaux d''oignon nouveau ou de graines de sésame, pour garnir"]','["Mélangez le porc, les crevettes, les oignons nouveaux, l''ail, le gingembre, la sauce d''huîtres, l''huile et les châtaignes d''eau.","Décollez une feuille de wonton et, à l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie, badigeonnez légèrement l''extérieur d''eau froide. Placez 1 cuillère à café du mélange au centre et froissez-la dans un sachet en pressant pour sceller. Ne remplissez pas trop. Répétez jusqu’à ce que vous en ayez environ 35 à 40. (Ceux-ci peuvent être réfrigérés jusqu''à 1 heure sur une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé.)","Pour la sauce, mélangez la sauce soja, le xérès et le gingembre dans un petit bol. Pour cuire à la vapeur, portez à ébullition une grande casserole d’eau. Tapisser un panier vapeur en bambou ou en métal avec des feuilles de laitue adaptées.","Disposez la moitié des sachets dans le panier (sans qu''ils se touchent), couvrez et faites cuire à la vapeur 5 min. Retirer avec des pinces dans une assiette et cuire le reste à la vapeur – vérifier le niveau d’eau. Servir, saupoudré d''oignons nouveaux ou de graines de sésame, avec le bol de sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:05:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10506,7204,'fr','Bœuf sauté à la sauce d''huîtres','Faites mariner des tranches de steak de bœuf maigre puis poêlez-les avec des morceaux de poivron rouge et une sauce savoureuse dans ce plat chinois classique.','["450 g de boulons illégaux","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe de vin de riz Shaoxing ou de Xérès sec","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","1 poivron rouge, coupé en gros dés","1 poivron vert, coupé en gros dés","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","2 oignons nouveaux, finement émincés, pour garnir"]','["Coupez le bœuf en tranches de 5 cm de long et 5 mm d''épaisseur, en coupant à contre-courant de la viande. Mettez-les dans un bol. Incorporer la sauce soja, l''huile de sésame, le vin de riz ou le Xérès et la farine de maïs. Laisser mariner 20 mn.","Faites chauffer un wok jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud, puis ajoutez l''huile d''arachide. Lorsqu''il fume légèrement, ajoutez les tranches de bœuf et faites sauter pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement dorées. Retirez la viande du wok et égouttez-la bien dans une passoire placée dans un bol. Jetez l’huile vidangée.","Essuyez le wok et réchauffez-le à feu vif. Ajouter les poivrons et cuire 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez la sauce aux huîtres et portez à ébullition. Remettez les tranches de bœuf égouttées dans le wok et mélangez-les soigneusement avec la sauce aux huîtres. Versez le mélange sur un plat de service, garnissez de ciboules et servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:05:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10507,7206,'fr','Chow-moi','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un plat chinois classique composé de nouilles aux œufs sautées avec de la poitrine de poulet râpée – expérimentez avec différents poissons, viandes ou légumes.','["225 g de nouilles aux œufs séchées ou fraîches","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame, plus 1 cuillère à café","100 g de poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en fines lanières","2½ cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","50 g de mangetout finement râpé","50 g de jambon de Parme ou jambon cuit finement râpé","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja légère","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja noire","1 cuillère à soupe de vin de riz Shaoxing ou de Xérès sec","½ cuillère à café de poivre blanc fraîchement moulu","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","2 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja légère","2 cuillères à café de vin de riz Shaoxing ou de Xérès sec","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","½ cuillère à café de poivre blanc fraîchement moulu"]','["Faites cuire les nouilles dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 3 à 5 minutes, puis égouttez-les et mettez-les dans l''eau froide. Égouttez-les soigneusement, mélangez-les avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame et réservez.","Mélangez le poulet avec tous les ingrédients de la marinade et ½ cuillère à café de sel, mélangez bien puis laissez mariner environ 10 minutes.","Faites chauffer un wok à feu vif. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide et, lorsqu''elle est bien chaude et légèrement fumante, ajoutez les lanières de poulet. Faites sauter pendant environ 2 minutes, puis transférez dans une assiette. Essuyez le wok. Réchauffez le wok jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud, puis ajoutez le reste de l''huile d''arachide. Lorsque l''huile fume légèrement, ajoutez l''ail et faites sauter pendant 10 secondes. Ajoutez ensuite le mangetout et le jambon, et faites sauter environ 1 min.","Ajoutez les nouilles, les sauces soja, le vin de riz ou le Xérès, le poivre, le sucre, les oignons nouveaux et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Faites sauter pendant 2 minutes. Remettez le poulet et son jus dans le mélange de nouilles. Faire sauter pendant environ 3-4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame et remuez le mélange quelques dernières fois. Disposez sur une assiette chaude et servez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:05:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10508,7208,'fr','Crevettes épicées à la Sichuan','Coquillages sautés avec une sauce épicée aux tomates, au gingembre et aux haricots chili pour un plat de fruits de mer chinois classique','["1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide","2 cm de gingembre finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","1 oignon nouveau, finement haché","450 g de crevettes crues, décortiquées et déveinées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","3 cuillères à café de sauce aux haricots chili","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre noir chinois ou de vinaigre de cidre","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre, pour servir","oignon nouveau tranché, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer un wok à feu vif. Ajoutez l''huile d''arachide et, lorsqu''elle est très chaude et légèrement fumante, ajoutez le gingembre, l''ail et les oignons nouveaux. Faites sauter pendant 20 secondes, puis ajoutez les crevettes. Faites sauter pendant environ 1 min, puis ajoutez tous les ingrédients de la sauce, ainsi que ½ cuillère à café de sel et ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu. Continuez à faire sauter encore 3 minutes à feu vif. Servir aussitôt, parsemé de coriandre et d''oignon nouveau."]','2026-01-11 00:05:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10509,7210,'fr','Poulet aux noix de cajou','De tendres morceaux de poitrine de poulet sont sautés avec des noix de cajou croquantes et sucrées dans ce plat chinois classique','["450 g de poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en gros morceaux","1 blanc d''oeuf","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","300 ml d''huile d''arachide ou d''eau, plus 2 cuillères à café d''huile d''arachide","100 g de noix de cajou","1 cuillère à soupe de vin de riz Shaoxing ou de Xérès sec","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère","1 oignon nouveau émincé, pour garnir"]','["Mettez le poulet dans un bol avec le blanc d''œuf, l''huile de sésame, la maïzena et 1 cuillère à café de sel, et mélangez bien. Mettre au frais 20 min.","Si vous utilisez de l''huile pour velouter le poulet, faites chauffer un wok jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud puis ajoutez l''huile. Lorsqu''il est très chaud, retirez le wok du feu et ajoutez immédiatement le poulet en remuant vigoureusement pour éviter qu''il ne colle. Au bout d''environ 2 minutes, lorsque le poulet devient blanc, égouttez-le rapidement ainsi que toute l''huile dans une passoire en acier inoxydable posée au-dessus d''un bol. Jetez l’huile. Si vous utilisez de l''eau à la place de l''huile, faites exactement la même chose mais portez l''eau à ébullition dans une casserole avant d''ajouter le poulet. Il faudra environ 4 minutes pour que le poulet blanchisse dans l''eau.","Si vous avez utilisé un wok, essuyez-le. Faites-le chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud, puis ajoutez les 2 cuillères à café d''huile d''arachide. Ajoutez les noix de cajou et faites revenir 1 min. Ajoutez le vin de riz ou le Xérès sec et la sauce soja. Remettez le poulet dans le wok et faites-le revenir pendant 2 minutes. Répartir sur les oignons nouveaux et servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:05:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10510,7212,'fr','Bœuf braisé chinois au gingembre','Le tibia ou la poitrine de bœuf à cuisson lente aux épices aromatiques asiatiques donne un plat principal fondant en bouche, délicieux avec du riz cuit à la vapeur et des légumes sautés croquants.','["2 à 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","1¼kg de jarret ou de poitrine de bœuf, coupé en très gros morceaux","2 oignons","50g de gingembre","3 gousses d''ail","petit bouquet de coriandre","2 cuillères à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","6 anis étoilés entiers","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir","100 g de sucre muscovado brun foncé","50 ml de sauce soja légère","50 ml de sauce soja noire","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","bouillon de boeuf","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé en allumettes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","riz au jasmin cuit"]','["Faites chauffer un peu d''huile dans un grand plat ignifuge. Ajoutez les morceaux de bœuf, par lots, et faites-les frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Lorsque chaque lot est doré, transférez le bœuf dans un autre plat. Hachez très grossièrement les oignons, le gingembre, l''ail et les tiges de coriandre. Mettre dans un robot culinaire et réduire en pâte.","Essuyez toute huile du plat dans lequel vous avez fait dorer le bœuf. Ajoutez la pâte avec un bon filet d''eau et faites frire doucement, en grattant les morceaux de bœuf, jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit parfumée et ramollie (ajoutez plus d''eau si la pâte colle). Incorporez les cinq épices, la badiane et le poivre, laissez cuire 1 min, puis ajoutez le sucre, les sauces soja et le concentré de tomates. Remettez le bœuf et son jus dans le plat, puis ajoutez suffisamment de bouillon pour couvrir à peu près. Portez à légère ébullition. Chauffer le four à 160C/140C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Couvrir le plat, mettre au four et cuire 21h30 jusqu''à ce que le bœuf soit bien tendre.","Sortez le bœuf de la sauce dans un plat et gardez-le au chaud. Faire bouillir la sauce jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit réduite de moitié environ et épaissie. Pendant ce temps, faites revenir le gingembre dans l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant. Remettez le bœuf dans la sauce. servir le bœuf déposé sur du riz et parsemé de gingembre croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:05:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10511,9456,'fr','Poulet aigre-doux','Cette sauce aigre-douce maison est bien meilleure qu''un plat à emporter. Excellent avec du riz ou des nouilles','["2-3 grosses poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées (environ 400 g/14 oz de poids total)","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","huile d''arachide ou de tournesol, pour la friture, plus un peu pour les sautés","pâte tempura (voir ci-dessous)","1 petit poivron rouge, épépiné, épépiné et haché grossièrement","1 carotte moyenne, tranchée finement en diagonale","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées","2 cuillères à café de gingembre frais finement haché","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","3 cuillères à soupe de Xérès","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère et molle","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs"]','["Coupez le poulet en petits morceaux et mélangez-le avec la sauce soja et l''huile de sésame. Dans un pichet ou un bol, mélangez les ingrédients de la sauce avec 100 ml d''eau froide. Tapisser une grande assiette de papier absorbant.","Faites chauffer l''huile d''arachide dans une friteuse à environ 180°C. Trempez ensuite quelques morceaux de poulet à la fois dans la pâte, puis placez-les dans l''huile chaude à l''aide de pinces ou d''une écumoire, mais ne surchargez pas la poêle. Faire frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés – environ 2 minutes. Vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots, alors réchauffez l''huile à chaque fois. Pendant que les morceaux cuisent, retirez-les avec une pince/une cuillère sur l''assiette tapissée de papier pour les égoutter.","Faites chauffer un wok, ajoutez environ 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile et faites revenir les légumes avec l''ail et le gingembre pendant environ 3 minutes. Remuez rapidement la sauce et versez-la dans le wok, en mélangeant pendant la cuisson pour obtenir une sauce légèrement brillante. Faites bouillonner pendant 1 min, puis versez sur le poulet et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10512,7214,'fr','Rouleaux de printemps à emballer soi-même','Une recette super saine, idéale pour cuisiner avec de jeunes enfants','["Paquet de 300 g de nouilles de riz cuites sorties du réfrigérateur (voir conseils)","environ 400 g de légumes mélangés, tranchés finement et mis dans des bols séparés, comme des poivrons rouges, des germes de soja, des carottes, du chou chinois râpé, des oignons nouveaux","140 g de crevettes cuites","100 g de poulet ou de canard cuit, émincé","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","petit morceau de gingembre, finement haché","éclabousser de sauce soja légère","Poudre de cinq épices chinoises, à saupoudrer","8 à 10 feuilles de brick ou de pâte filo (voir conseils)","1 œuf battu","graines de sésame, pour saupoudrer si vous voulez","100 g de ketchup réduit en sel et sucre","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","petit morceau de gingembre, râpé","pincée de sucre en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C ventilateur/gaz 6. Avant de faire cuisiner les enfants, mettez les nouilles, les légumes, les crevettes et le poulet dans des bols individuels pour que chacun puisse se servir. Lavez-vous les mains, mettez des tabliers, asseyez les enfants et donnez-leur leur propre bol à mélanger et leur cuillère. Laissez-les choisir les ingrédients qu’ils veulent (les nouilles sont essentielles) dans leurs petits pains et s’ils veulent brouter comme bon leur semble, c’est très bien – tous les ingrédients sont cuits ou peuvent être consommés crus. Ajoutez un peu d''ail et de gingembre, une petite pincée de soja et une pincée de cinq épices dans chaque bol et laissez-les mélanger le tout.","Écartez le bol et disposez une feuille de pâte devant chaque enfant. Demandez-leur de verser la garniture sur un côté de chaque feuille, puis donnez-leur l''œuf battu et un pinceau pour qu''ils puissent badigeonner les bords. Aidez-les ensuite à les enrouler proprement en repliant les deux côtés sur la garniture, puis en les enroulant.","Placez les rouleaux de printemps sur une plaque à pâtisserie, joint vers le bas, badigeonnez-les d''un peu d''œuf supplémentaire et saupoudrez de graines de sésame, si vous le souhaitez. Essayez de vous rappeler quel enfant a fait quel jet pour sauvegarder les arguments à la fin ! Cuire les petits pains pendant 20 à 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Pendant que les petits pains sont au four, préparez la trempette. Demandez aux enfants de mélanger tous les ingrédients jusqu’à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Lorsque les rouleaux de printemps sont dorés et croustillants, sortez-les du four. Laisser refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulé, couper en morceaux pour les plus petits, puis laisser-les manger en trempant les rouleaux dans la sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:05:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10513,7216,'fr','Chow mein aux crevettes','Cette recette de sautés faibles en gras regorge de légumes croquants et de sauce aux huîtres piquante.','["3 nids de nouilles aux œufs de taille moyenne","140 g de brocoli coupé en petits bouquets","140 g de maïs miniature, coupé en deux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 poivron rouge, tranché","300 g de crevettes","3 cuillères à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres"]','["Cuire les nouilles, le brocoli et le maïs dans l''eau bouillante pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Égoutter et réserver. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou un wok et faites revenir le poivron pendant 3 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir.","Ajoutez les nouilles et les légumes avec les crevettes et mélangez. Ajoutez les ingrédients de la sauce et faites chauffer le tout pendant 2-3 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:05:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10514,7218,'fr','Bar à la vapeur avec sauce aux haricots noirs','Les plats chinois n''ont pas besoin d''être consommés dans un carton à emporter : ce plat de poisson spécial constitue un dîner intelligent pour deux','["1 bar, tête, vidé","2 cm de gingembre, tranché finement","2 cuillères à soupe de vin de riz Shaohsing","riz au jasmin cuit, pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide","2 gousses d''ail","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de haricots noirs fermentés, rincés et écrasés avec le dos d''une cuillère (ou utilisez plutôt 100 g de sauce aux haricots noirs)","1 cuillère à soupe de vin de riz Shaohsing","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame grillé","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","2 oignons nouveaux, émincés","1 petite poignée de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Lavez le poisson à l''eau froide courante.\r\nSéchez avec du papier absorbant, puis coupez\r\n3-4 fentes dans la peau des deux côtés.\r\nAssaisonner le tout avec du sel et du poivre\r\npoivre blanc. Placez les tranches de gingembre dans le\r\nfentes du poisson et à l''intérieur de la cavité.","Placer le poisson dans une assiette qui rentre à l''intérieur\r\nvotre wok. Dans ton wok place un pudding\r\nbol à l''envers et versez de l''eau\r\narrive à mi-hauteur. Placez le wok dessus\r\nle feu et porter l''eau à ébullition.","Versez le vin de riz sur le poisson, mettez\r\nl''assiette sur le bol renversé et\r\nplacez le couvercle du wok dessus. Vapeur allumée\r\nfeu vif pendant 8 à 9 minutes, puis laisser reposer.","Pendant que le poisson cuit, préparez le\r\nsauce aux haricots noirs. Ajouter l''arachide\r\nhuile dans un wok chaud ou une poêle à frire. Quand il\r\ncommence à fumer, ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre\r\net des haricots (ou utilisez 100 g de\r\nsauce aux haricots noirs) et faire sauter quelques\r\nsecondes. Ajouter le vin de riz, l''huile de sésame et\r\nsauce soja légère, puis porter à bulle.","Retirez délicatement le poisson (vous pouvez le conserver\r\nsur l''assiette sur laquelle vous l''avez cuit).\r\nGarnir avec les oignons nouveaux et\r\ncoriandre, puis arroser de noir\r\nsauce aux haricots et servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:05:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10515,7220,'fr','Crevettes sel et poivre','Utilisez des grains de poivre du Sichuan pour aromatiser les crustacés avec un goût de céleri, puis créez une trempette au piment et à l''ail à la chinoise.','["2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","huile végétale, pour la friture","24 grosses gambas décortiquées et déveinées, avec queues","pousses de pois ou jeunes feuilles de salade, pour servir (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de poivre du Sichuan","4 grains de poivre noir","2 cuillères à soupe de flocons de sel marin","grosse pincée de flocons de piment","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de coriandre hachées","1 petit piment rouge finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","jus de 3 citrons verts","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la trempette. Écraser\r\nl''ail, la coriandre et le piment à l''aide d''un\r\npilon et mortier. (Si vous n''avez pas\r\nun, hachez-le finement.) Incorporez le sucre\r\njusqu''à dissolution, puis ajoutez le jus de citron vert\r\net sauce de poisson. Il devrait avoir un goût sucré,\r\nsalé et épicé.","Pour préparer le mélange d''épices, faites griller le\r\nSichuan et grains de poivre noir dans une friture\r\npoêle à feu moyen pendant 1 min ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nparfumé. Broyer finement dans un moulin à épices ou\r\nà l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier, puis ajoutez le\r\nsel et flocons de piment et mélanger.\r\nTransférer dans un bol.","Mélangez le mélange d''épices avec le\r\nfarine de maïs. Faites chauffer 7,5 cm d''huile dans un grand wok\r\nou une casserole profonde à fond épais. Vous pouvez\r\ntestez la température en faisant frire une petite\r\nmorceau de pain – il devrait grésiller instantanément\r\net prenez 20 secondes pour qu''il devienne doré. Jetez le\r\ncrevettes avec le mélange d''épices, secouez-les\r\nl''excédent et faire frire, par lots, pendant\r\n1 à 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient croustillants et\r\ncommence à friser. Retirer avec une fente\r\ncuillère, égoutter sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de\r\ndu papier essuie-tout et gardez-le au chaud pendant que vous\r\ncuire les crevettes restantes. Disperser\r\nles pousses de pois ou les feuilles de salade, si vous préférez,\r\net servir avec la trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:05:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10516,7222,'fr','Poulet à la poudre avec piments rouges séchés et cacahuètes','Ce plat classique de la province chinoise du Sichuan n''est pas aussi épicé si vous enlevez les graines de piment – ​​accompagné d''une sauce collante, sucrée et riche.','["12 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau (environ 900 g), coupées en morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja noire","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","15 piments oiseaux entiers séchés","1 cuillère à café de poivre du Sichuan, moulu","botte d''oignons nouveaux, coupés en morceaux de 2½ cm","50 g de cacahuètes entières grillées","5 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja noire","2 cuillères à soupe de vin de riz Shaohsing","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre noir chinois","4 cuillères à soupe de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de maïzena mélangée à 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau"]','["Faire mariner le poulet avec le soja et\r\nlaisser reposer 1h. Si tu n''as pas le temps\r\npour mariner, ne vous inquiétez pas – mais cela ajoute\r\nsaveur supplémentaire. Mélangez les ingrédients de la sauce\r\nun petit bol et réserver.","À l''aide d''un wok et d''une petite quantité de\r\nhuile, saisir le poulet par lots. Quand c''est\r\ntout doré, retirer de la poêle et\r\nmettre de côté. Coupez les tiges des piments\r\net secouez les graines. Ajoutez le\r\nle reste de l''huile et cuire les piments pendant\r\n1 min en secouant constamment la poêle pour\r\néviter qu''ils ne brûlent. Ajouter le poulet\r\nje reviens avec les grains de poivre, le printemps\r\noignons et cacahuètes, puis faire sauter pendant\r\n1 minute de plus. Ajouter la sauce et remuer pendant\r\nquelques minutes de plus jusqu''à épaississement."]','2026-01-11 00:05:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10517,7224,'fr','Tofu sucré au gingembre et pak choi','Si vous pensiez que le tofu était fade, voici la recette pour vous convaincre du contraire','["250 g de tofu frais ferme, égoutté","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","1 cm de gingembre, tranché","200 g de pak choi, feuilles séparées","1 cuillère à soupe de vin de riz Shaohsing","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment séchés","riz au jasmin cuit, pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja noire","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade"]','["Piquez délicatement quelques trous dans le tofu avec\r\nun cure-dent (cela aidera la marinade à\r\ntremper dedans, donnant une meilleure saveur), puis\r\ncouper en petits cubes.","Mélanger les ingrédients de la marinade ensemble\r\ndans un bol et incorporer les morceaux de tofu.\r\nLaisser mariner 10 à 15 minutes.","Faites chauffer un wok à feu vif et ajoutez-en la moitié\r\nl''huile d''arachide. Quand l''huile commence à couler\r\nfumer, ajouter les tranches de gingembre et faire sauter\r\npendant quelques secondes. Ajouter les feuilles de pak choy\r\net faire sauter pendant 1 à 2 minutes. Ajoutez un petit\r\nun peu d''eau pour créer de la vapeur\r\net laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Quand le\r\nles feuilles sont fanées et les tiges sont\r\ncuit mais encore un peu croquant, assaisonner\r\navec du sel et transférer dans un plat de service.","Rincez le wok sous l''eau froide, puis\r\nréchauffez-le et ajoutez le reste de l''huile. Quand\r\nça commence à fumer, ajoute les morceaux de tofu\r\n(en conservant le liquide de la marinade) et faire sauter\r\npendant 5 à 10 minutes. Faites attention à ne pas rompre\r\nle tofu pendant que vous le mélangez pour le faire dorer\r\nuniformément de tous les côtés. Assaisonner avec le riz\r\nvinaigre de vin et de riz. Ajoutez le reste\r\nliquide de marinade, porter à bulle et\r\nlaissez le liquide réduire. Saupoudrer sur le\r\nflocons de piment et mélangez bien. Verser sur\r\nle pak choy et servir aussitôt\r\navec du riz au jasmin, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:05:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10518,7226,'fr','Poulet doré aux cinq épices festif','Les cinq épices chinoises donnent à ce poulet une saveur merveilleusement chaude et aromatique que les adultes et les enfants adoreront.','["8 cuisses de poulet et 8 pilons, avec la peau","3 oignons nouveaux, émincés, pour finir","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","6 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","morceau de gingembre frais de la longueur d''un doigt, râpé","4 cuillères à soupe de vin de riz Shaohsing ou de xérès sec","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","4 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","4 cuillères à café de poudre de cinq épices"]','["Mélangez ensemble les ingrédients de la marinade,\r\nmettre le poulet dans un plat, puis verser dessus\r\nla marinade, en mélangeant pour enrober. Couvrir, alors\r\nréfrigérer pendant au moins 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à une journée si\r\ntu as le temps.","Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4, et\r\nsortez le poulet de la marinade dans un\r\nplat à rôtir. Faire rôtir 40 minutes, verser dessus\r\nle reste de la marinade, puis laissez cuire pendant\r\nencore 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et collantes.\r\nSaupoudrer d''oignon nouveau, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:05:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10519,7228,'fr','Riz sauté spécial aux crevettes et chorizo','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un plat fusion qui fusionne la paella espagnole avec du riz frit asiatique aux œufs – une excellente façon d''inciter les enfants à manger des légumes.','["100 g de riz basmati ou riz long grain","85 g de petits pois surgelés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 œuf battu","50 g de chorizo, lardons ou jambon finement coupés","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés en biais","½ poivron rouge, épépiné et haché","bonne pincée de poudre de cinq épices","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja","100 g de germes de soja (facultatif)","50 g de crevettes décortiquées"]','["Faire bouillir le riz suivant le pack\r\ninstructions, en ajoutant les petits pois pour\r\nla dernière minute. Vidange.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans un wok. Verser\r\nl''œuf et faire sauter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit brouillé.\r\nVerser sur une assiette et réserver.","Essuyez le wok avec du papier absorbant,\r\npuis faites chauffer le reste de l''huile. Ajouter\r\nla viande, l''ail, les oignons nouveaux et\r\npoivrer et faire sauter jusqu''à ce que le poivre\r\ncommence à ramollir. Ajoutez les cinq épices,\r\nriz, pois et soja, puis faire sauter pendant\r\n5 minutes de plus. Ajoutez enfin le\r\nles germes de soja, le cas échéant, l''œuf et\r\ncrevettes et faire sauter pour bien réchauffer."]','2026-01-11 00:05:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10520,7230,'fr','Nouilles chinoises au tofu et noisettes','Des saveurs passionnantes imprègnent cette recette végétarienne facile','["250 g de nouilles aux œufs moyennes en sachet","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","une poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement","300g de mange-tout","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","une poignée de noisettes grillées, hachées grossièrement","Paquet de 349 g de tofu soyeux, coupé en cubes","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce chinoise aux haricots jaunes"]','["Plongez les nouilles dans une casserole d''eau bouillante, faites cuire 4 minutes, puis égouttez-les. Arrosez d''un peu d''huile et mélangez la moitié de la coriandre.","Faites chauffer un wok à feu moyen. Versez le reste de l''huile, puis jetez le mangetout et faites sauter 2 min. Ajoutez le piment et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les haricots soient juste tendres.","Versez la sauce aux noisettes, au tofu et aux haricots jaunes dans le wok et remuez pour bien réchauffer. Enfin, ajoutez le reste de coriandre, assaisonnez si vous le souhaitez et servez avec les nouilles."]','2026-01-11 00:06:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10521,7232,'fr','Sauté de boeuf','Essayez ce sauté rapide et facile en utilisant de la citronnelle, du gingembre et du piment pour donner du punch. Faites cuire le tout dans une seule poêle et dégustez-le comme repas en milieu de semaine','["500 g de croupe de bœuf parée et coupée en fines lanières","1 cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","Paquet de 300 g de nouilles de riz prêtes à l''emploi","1 gros piment rouge","1 grosse gousse d''ail, hachée","Morceau de 4 cm de gingembre pelé et coupé en allumettes","1 bâton de citronnelle, paré et tranché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","100 g de pois mange-tout, coupés en fines lanières","8 petits maïs, tranchés en diagonale","6 oignons nouveaux, parés et tranchés en diagonale","½ citron vert","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","2 cuillères à soupe de cacahuètes grillées","coriandre grossièrement hachée, pour servir"]','["Mélangez le bœuf et les cinq épices dans un bol,\r\npuis laisser mariner. Adoucir le\r\nnouilles dans l''eau bouillante paquet suivant\r\ninstructions, égoutter puis réserver. finement\r\ntrancher le piment rouge en laissant les graines si\r\nvous préférez un peu de chaleur supplémentaire. Mélanger avec\r\nl''ail, le gingembre et la citronnelle dans\r\nun petit bol. Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans un wok,\r\najouter le mélange de piment et faire sauter pendant 1 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis mais non colorés. Supprimer\r\navec une écumoire et réserver pendant que\r\nvous faites cuire le bœuf.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile, ajoutez le bœuf\r\net faire sauter à feu vif pendant 1 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et juste cuits.","Remettez le mélange de piment dans la poêle avec\r\nles snaps au sucre, les petits maïs et la moitié du\r\noignons nouveaux. Faire sauter encore 1 min\r\navant d''ajouter les nouilles égouttées. Mélanger\r\npour bien mélanger, retirer du feu\r\net ajoutez un filet de jus de citron vert, le soja\r\nsauce et sauce de poisson.","Répartir dans quatre assiettes. Dispersion\r\navec les cacahuètes, garnir du reste\r\noignons nouveaux et coriandre hachée."]','2026-01-11 00:06:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10522,7234,'fr','Bar chinois vapeur au chou','Plein de saveur et dénué de culpabilité, ce plat de poisson faible en gras regorge d''oméga 3 et compte pour 1 de vos 5 par jour. Un repas parfait en milieu de semaine','["2 filets de bar ou autre poisson blanc","1 piment vert ou rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 cuillère à café de gingembre frais","300 g de choux verts finement émincés","2 cuillères à café d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja faible en sel"]','["Saupoudrer le poisson de piment, de gingembre et\r\nun peu de sel. Faites cuire le chou à la vapeur pendant 5 minutes.\r\nDéposer le poisson sur le chou et cuire à la vapeur\r\npendant encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer les huiles dans une petite poêle,\r\najouter l''ail et cuire rapidement en remuant jusqu''à ce que\r\nlégèrement doré. Transférez le chou et\r\npoisson dans des assiettes de service, saupoudrer chacune de 1 cuillère à café\r\nde sauce soja, puis versez dessus l''huile d''ail."]','2026-01-11 00:06:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10523,7236,'fr','Ailes chinoises collantes et concombre','Ailes de poulet à la chinoise avec une touche américaine avec seulement 5 ingrédients','["16 grosses ailes de poulet","125 ml de sauce soja réduite en sel","140 g de cassonade foncée et molle","5 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","demi-concombre, pelé en fins rubans"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7. Dans un\r\nplaque à rôtir, mélanger les ailes avec le soja\r\nsauce, 125 g de sucre, 2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre\r\net du poivre noir concassé. Rôti pour\r\n40 minutes, en retournant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''il soit laqué.","Pendant ce temps, apportez le sucre restant et\r\nvinaigre à ébullition pendant environ 1 minute, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle sucre se dissout. Laisser refroidir, puis mélanger avec\r\nles rubans de concombre. Servir les ailes collantes\r\navec le concombre et du riz bouilli."]','2026-01-11 00:06:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10524,6234,'fr','Légumes sautés à la sauce d''huîtres','Un excellent plat d''accompagnement pour un plat chinois à emporter fait maison ou un repas rapide et copieux.','["100 g de nouilles de riz vermicelles","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","4 oignons nouveaux hachés","3 gousses d''ail hachées","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","100 g de champignons shiitake ou châtaignes émincés","200 g de fleurons de brocoli","2 têtes de pak choi hachées grossièrement"]','["Faire tremper les vermicelles de riz dans l''eau bouillante pendant 4 minutes. Égoutter, rafraîchir sous l''eau froide, égoutter à nouveau et réserver.","Mélangez le soja, la sauce de poisson et la sauce d''huîtres dans un bol. Faites chauffer l''huile de tournesol dans un grand wok, ajoutez les oignons nouveaux, les gousses d''ail hachées et le piment épépiné et haché.","Faites sauter pendant 20 secondes avant d''ajouter les champignons shiitake ou châtaignes émincés et les fleurons de brocoli. Faites sauter pendant 1 minute, puis ajoutez le pak choi et le mélange de sauce. Remuer et cuire environ 2 minutes à feu vif, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si la sauce devient trop épaisse.","Versez les nouilles, retirez du feu et mélangez bien. Servir dans des bols chauds et ranger avec vos baguettes."]','2026-01-11 00:06:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10525,7240,'fr','Canard rôti chinois avec crêpes','Disposez tous les éléments de cette recette chinoise classique sur la table et laissez vos invités se servir eux-mêmes.','["1 canard prêt au four","2 cuillères à café de cinq épices chinoises","Anis étoilé 2","1 orange, pelée coupée en lanières, puis orange coupée en deux","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre noir chinois (nous avons utilisé Merchant Gourmet) (facultatif)","75 ml de vin de riz Shaohsing ou de Xérès sec","100 ml de bouillon de poulet","30 crêpes chinoises (achetées en magasin ou voir « Se marie bien avec » pour une recette)","6 oignons nouveaux, coupés en longueurs de doigts et râpés, ½ concombre coupé en allumettes, sauce hoisin, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1.\r\nDétachez la peau du canard en le tortillant\r\nd''abord tes doigts, puis ta main\r\nentre lui et la chair jusqu''à ce qu''il tire\r\nloin – veillez à ne pas casser la peau.\r\nCoupez tout excès de graisse de la cavité et\r\npeau autour du cou. Frottez toute la peau\r\nfini avec les cinq épices plus un bon\r\nsaupoudrer de sel. Mettez le canard dans un\r\nrôtissoire et pousser l''anis étoilé,\r\nzeste d''orange et moitiés d''orange à l''intérieur.\r\nVerser le vinaigre, le vin de riz et le bouillon\r\ndans la cavité, ne vous inquiétez pas s''il déborde\r\nencore une fois. Couvrir le plat à rôtir avec une tente\r\nde papier d''aluminium et cuire 2 heures.","Allumez le four à 240C/220C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nRetirez le papier d''aluminium, versez le jus éventuel (conservez-le pendant\r\nles nouilles, voir « Se marie bien avec ») et\r\nremettre le canard au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce que la peau soit dorée et croustillante.","Une fois cuit, laissez-le reposer 10 minutes. Tranche\r\nretirer les poitrines et déchiqueter la viande et la peau.\r\nEmpiler sur une assiette en gardant la viande et la peau\r\nséparer. Garder au chaud à four doux en couvrant\r\nviande avec du papier d''aluminium pour l''empêcher de se dessécher mais avec la peau\r\ndécouvert pour le rendre encore plus croustillant. (Retirez le\r\nreste de la viande en morceaux pour les nouilles - voir « Se marie bien avec ».)","Chauffer les crêpes et servir le canard\r\navec accompagnements."]','2026-01-11 00:06:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10526,7242,'fr','Bouillon aigre-piquant aux crevettes','Cette entrée saine ne prend que 15 minutes à préparer et constitue une façon nettoyante de démarrer un repas chinois.','["3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz ou de vinaigre de vin blanc","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1-2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et tranché finement","2 petits piments rouges forts, tranchés finement","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","300 g de petites crevettes crues décortiquées, issues de sources durables"]','["Mettez le vinaigre, le bouillon, la sauce soja, le sucre\r\n(commencez par 1 cuillère à soupe et ajoutez la seconde à\r\nla fin si tu veux la soupe plus sucrée),\r\ngingembre, piments et oignons nouveaux dans un\r\ncasserole et porter à ébullition. Cuisinier\r\npendant 1 min, puis ajoutez les crevettes à chauffer\r\nà travers. Servir dans des petits bols ou des tasses."]','2026-01-11 00:06:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10527,6240,'fr','Riz frit aux œufs à l''orientale','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Le riz frit rapide et facile de Sara Buenfeld constitue un délicieux souper chinois.','["une tasse de riz américain à grains longs","une tasse de petits pois surgelés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 tranches de bacon de dos, hachées grossièrement","1 petit poivron rouge, haché","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","2 gros œufs","1 cuillère à café bombée de poudre de cinq épices chinoises"]','["Remplissez une grande casserole d''eau, portez à ébullition et versez-y une cuillère à café de sel : l''eau bouillonnera furieusement. Versez le riz, remuez une fois et remettez à ébullition, puis baissez un peu le feu pour que l''eau bout régulièrement, mais pas vigoureusement.","Faire bouillir à découvert, sans remuer (cela donne du riz gluant) pendant 10 minutes.  Après 8\r\nminutes, jetez-y le surgelé\r\npetits pois, faire bouillir\r\npendant 2 minutes et égouttez (ne rincez pas).","Faites chauffer l''huile de tournesol dans un wok et remuez\r\nfaire revenir le bacon pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Pourboire \r\nle poivron rouge et les gousses d''ail et faire sauter pendant 2\r\nminutes.","Battez les œufs, versez-y\r\nla poêle et faire sauter jusqu''à ce que l''œuf soit juste\r\nensembles. Incorporer les 5 épices chinoises"]','2026-01-11 00:06:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10528,7246,'fr','Si c''est des crevettes','Préparez ce favori chinois économique en seulement 20 minutes','["1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","400 g de grosses crevettes crues, surgelées, c''est bien, en papillon (voir astuce ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz chinois","1 grosse cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou d''arachide","85 g de cacahuètes grillées non salées","6 petits ou 3 gros piments entiers séchés","2 boîtes de 225 g de châtaignes d''eau égouttées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement"]','["Mélangez la maïzena et 1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja, ajoutez les crevettes et réservez 10 minutes. Mélangez le vinaigre, le reste de la sauce soja, la purée de tomates, le sucre et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour obtenir une sauce.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à cuisiner, faites chauffer une grande poêle ou un wok jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud, puis ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Faites frire les crevettes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées par endroits et ouvertes, puis sortez-les de la poêle.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile et ajoutez les cacahuètes, les piments et les châtaignes d''eau. Faites sauter pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les cacahuètes commencent à colorer, puis ajoutez le gingembre et l''ail et faites revenir encore 1 minute. Versez les crevettes et la sauce et laissez mijoter pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe légèrement. Servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:06:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10529,7248,'fr','Bar au gingembre grésillé, piment et oignons nouveaux','Les arômes dégagés lors de la cuisson de ce plat feront que tout le monde se lèchera les lèvres avec impatience','["6 x filets de bar, environ 140 g/5 oz chacun, avec peau et écaillé","environ 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","grosse noix de gingembre, pelée et râpée en allumettes","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","3 gros piments rouges frais épépinés et finement râpés","botte d''oignon nouveau, émincé en long","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja"]','["Assaisonnez le poisson avec du sel et du poivre, puis coupez la peau 3 fois. Faites chauffer une poêle à fond épais et ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Une fois chaud, faites frire le poisson, peau vers le bas, pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la peau soit très croustillante et dorée. Le poisson sera presque cuit. Retourner, cuire encore 30 secondes à 1 minute, puis transférer dans une assiette de service et réserver au chaud. Vous devrez faire frire le poisson en 2 lots.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile, puis faites revenir le gingembre, l''ail et le piment pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Retirez du feu et ajoutez les oignons nouveaux. Arrosez le poisson d''un peu de sauce soja et versez-le sur le contenu de la poêle."]','2026-01-11 00:06:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10530,7250,'fr','Effiloché de canard, cresson & salade d''orange','Une salade d''influence chinoise composée de canard moelleux, de radis croquants, de chicorée et d''orange douce - un souper décontracté','["2 cuisses de canard","1 cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices","5 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","5 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 grosses oranges, segmentées, jus réservé","2 sachets de 100 g de cresson","200 g de radis émincés","Paquet de 140 g de chicorée, feuilles séparées","petit bouquet d''oignon nouveau, tranché en diagonale"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Pat\r\nles cuisses de canard séchées avec du papier absorbant\r\net frottez-y les cinq épices et un peu\r\nassaisonnement. Versez le vinaigre, le soja et\r\njus d''orange dans un petit plat à rôtir et\r\nmettez le canard dessus. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et\r\ncuire 30 minutes, puis retirer le papier d''aluminium\r\net augmentez le four à 240C/220C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 9, ou mettre sous le grill et cuire\r\njusqu''à ce que la peau soit croustillante. Retirer et filtrer\r\nle liquide au tamis. Laisse le canard\r\nlaisser refroidir jusqu''à ce que vous puissiez déchiqueter la viande\r\nles os. Écumez le gras du liquide.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez délicatement le\r\noranges, cresson, radis, chicorée\r\net oignons nouveaux. Verser sur réservé\r\nliquide de cuisson, puis ajoutez le canard et\r\ndisposer sur un plateau."]','2026-01-11 00:06:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10531,7252,'fr','One-pot de bœuf braisé à la chinoise','Idéal pour les réceptions décontractées, lorsque vous avez envie d''un ragoût de bœuf réchauffant mais avec des saveurs plus vibrantes','["3-4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","6 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","bon morceau de racine de gingembre frais de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","1 piment rouge épépiné et tranché finement","1½ kg de bœuf braisé, coupé en gros morceaux (nous avons utilisé de la joue de bœuf)","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature, bien assaisonnée","1 cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","2 anis étoilé (facultatif)","2 cuillères à café de sucre muscovado léger (ou utilisez ce que vous avez)","3 cuillères à soupe de vin de cuisine chinois ou de xérès sec","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja noire, et un peu plus pour servir","500 ml de bouillon de bœuf (nous avons utilisé Knorr Touch of Taste)","Bok Choi cuit à la vapeur et riz basmati cuit à la vapeur, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle,\r\ncocotte peu profonde. Faire revenir l''ail, le gingembre,\r\noignons et piment pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres\r\net parfumé. Verser sur une assiette. Jetez le\r\nboeuf dans la farine, ajouter 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile supplémentaire\r\ndans la poêle, puis y faire dorer la viande\r\nlots, en ajoutant la dernière cuillère à soupe d''huile si vous\r\nbesoin de. Cela devrait prendre environ 5 minutes\r\npour bien dorer chaque lot.","Ajoutez les cinq épices et l''anis étoilé (si\r\nen utilisant) dans la poêle, verser le mélange de gingembre,\r\npuis faire revenir 1 min jusqu''à ce que les épices soient\r\nparfumé. Ajouter le sucre, puis le bœuf\r\net remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Gardez la chaleur\r\nélevé, puis ajoutez le vin ou le sherry,\r\ngratter les morceaux de viande. Chauffer le four\r\nà 150C/ventilateur 130C/gaz 2.","Versez le soja et le bouillon (cela ne sera pas\r\ncouvrir complètement la viande), porter à\r\nlaisser mijoter, puis couvrir hermétiquement, transférer\r\nau four et cuire 1h30 à 2h,\r\nen remuant la viande à mi-cuisson.\r\nLa viande doit être très molle et toute\r\nles morceaux nerveux auraient dû fondre.\r\nAssaisonnez avec plus de soja. Cela peut maintenant\r\nêtre réfrigéré et congelé jusqu''à 1 mois.","Placez le bok choi cuit dans le\r\npoêle, puis apporter à table avec le\r\nriz basmati immédiatement et rentrez-le."]','2026-01-11 00:06:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10532,7254,'fr','Soupe poulet et nouilles aigre-douce rapide et facile','Continuez à goûter le bouillon et ajoutez autant de piment et de vinaigre de riz que vous le souhaitez pour obtenir le bon équilibre des saveurs.','["140 g de nouilles complètes séchées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre râpé","1 piment rouge moyen, épépiné et finement haché","4 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en petits morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de vin de riz Shaohsing","700 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","4 champignons châtaignes, tranchés","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja noire","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de maïzena mélangée à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide pour obtenir une pâte","1 poignée de germes de soja","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés"]','["Portez à ébullition une petite casserole d''eau\r\net faites cuire les nouilles suivant le pack\r\ninstructions. Égoutter, rincer à froid\r\nde l''eau courante pour arrêter la cuisson\r\nplus loin, puis arrosez d''un peu d''huile pour\r\néviter qu''ils ne se collent les uns aux autres. Diviser\r\nentre 2 bols profonds.","Faites chauffer un wok à feu vif et ajoutez-y le\r\nreste de l''huile. Quand ça commence à fumer,\r\najoutez le gingembre et le piment, puis faites sauter pendant\r\nquelques secondes. Ajouter le poulet et faire sauter\r\npendant 2 minutes. Alors que la viande commence à tourner\r\nfaire dorer, ajouter le vin de riz et cuire\r\npendant 3 minutes de plus. Ajouter le légume\r\nbouillon, porter à ébullition, puis ajouter le\r\nchampignons. Assaisonner avec le soja noir,\r\nvinaigre de soja et de riz léger.","Ramenez à\r\nlaisser mijoter, puis ajouter la pâte de maïzena.\r\nLaisser mijoter et remuer jusqu''à épaississement. Incorporer\r\nles germes de soja et la majeure partie du printemps\r\noignons, puis versez la soupe sur le\r\nnouilles. Servir immédiatement, dispersé\r\navec les oignons nouveaux restants."]','2026-01-11 00:06:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10533,7256,'fr','Soupe de nouilles au poulet et aux œufs','Ces nouilles rapides et saines constituent l''aliment de base idéal en milieu de semaine','["2 poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en dés","1,2 l de bouillon de poulet faible en sel","140 g de nouilles complètes","140 g de maïs miniature, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur, ou du maïs doux surgelé","2 oeufs, battus","presser le jus de citron","½ cuillère à café de vinaigre de Xérès","2 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés"]','["Placer le poulet et le bouillon dans un grand\r\npoêle et porter à ébullition pendant 5 minutes.\r\nPendant ce temps, faites cuire les nouilles suivantes\r\ninstructions sur l''emballage.","Ajouter le maïs au bouillon et cuire\r\npendant 2 minutes. Remuez vigoureusement le bouillon, puis\r\npendant qu''il tourbillonne encore, tenez une fourchette au-dessus du\r\ncasserole. Versez les œufs sur les dents dans un\r\nflux lent. Remuer à nouveau dans le même\r\ndirection puis éteignez le feu. Ajouter un\r\nun filet de jus de citron et du vinaigre.","Égoutter les nouilles et les répartir entre\r\nquatre bols. Verser sur la goutte d''œuf\r\nbouillon, parsemer d''oignons et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10534,7258,'fr','Bananes caramel et sésame','Les bananes au caramel traditionnelles sont frites, mais il s''agit d''une version plus légère, servie avec une sauce au caramel','["6 grosses bananes, pelées et coupées en quartiers","8 cuillères à soupe de sucre muscovado léger","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre","200 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame grillées","glace vanille de bonne qualité, pour servir"]','["Mélangez les bananes dans 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre.\r\nChauffer une plaque chauffante à feu moyen, puis cuire le\r\nbananes, quelques morceaux à la fois, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient collantes\r\net montrant des marques de plaque chauffante. Garder au chaud\r\nà four doux.","Pour la sauce, mettre le reste du sucre,\r\nle beurre et la crème dans une casserole et\r\nremuez à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit bien\r\nfondu. Incorporer les graines de sésame. Peut être\r\npréparé jusqu''à un jour à l''avance. Pour servir, mettez un\r\nquelques morceaux de banane dans 8 plats de service,\r\nverser un peu de caramel, puis garnir\r\navec une boule de glace."]','2026-01-11 00:06:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10535,7260,'fr','Bœuf croustillant au piment','Abandonnez les plats à emporter et préparez ce steak chinois frit avec une sauce sucrée au gingembre et aux poivrons rouges','["350 g de steak minute coupé finement, tranché très finement en lanières","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","100 ml d''huile végétale","1 poivron rouge, tranché finement","1 piment rouge, tranché finement","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés, parties vertes et blanches séparées","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, coupé en allumettes","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz ou de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","2 cuillères à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","nouilles cuites, pour servir (facultatif)","crackers aux crevettes, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le bœuf dans un bol et mélangez-le\r\nfarine de maïs et cinq épices. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un\r\nwok ou une grande poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud, puis ajoutez\r\nle bœuf et faites-le frire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant.\r\nRetirez le bœuf et égouttez-le dans la cuisine\r\npapier. Jetez tout sauf 1 cuillère à soupe d’huile.","Ajouter le poivre, la moitié du piment, le blanc\r\nextrémités des oignons nouveaux, de l''ail et\r\ngingembre dans la poêle. Faire sauter pendant 3 minutes pour\r\nramollir, mais ne laissez pas l’ail et le gingembre brûler. Mélanger le vinaigre, le soja, la sauce chili\r\net du ketchup dans un pichet avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau,\r\npuis versez sur les légumes. Bulle pour\r\n2 minutes, puis remettez le bœuf dans la poêle\r\net bien mélanger pour enrober. Servir le bœuf sur\r\nnouilles aux crackers de crevettes, si vous aimez,\r\nparsemé du piment restant et\r\nles parties vertes des oignons nouveaux."]','2026-01-11 00:06:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10536,7262,'fr','Comté gougères','Remplissez ces gougères avec le crèmeux de comté en option et transformez-les d''une collation ou d''une boisson en entrée - elles constituent un excellent début pour un menu français.','["100 ml de lait","50g de beurre","125 g de farine nature","4 œufs","150g de comté râpé","35g de beurre","20g de farine nature","100 ml de lait entier","100 ml de crème double","200g comté , grated, plus extra finely grated comté to serve"]','["Heat the oven to 220/200C fan/gas 8. Put the milk, 100ml water and the butter in a medium pan over a low heat and warm until the butter has melted and the liquid is simmering. Incorporer la farine et poursuivre la cuisson en remuant jusqu''à ce que le mélange se détache proprement des parois de la casserole. Transférer dans un bol et incorporer les œufs, un à la fois, puis incorporer le fromage et un peu d''assaisonnement.","Versez le mélange dans une poche à douille, coupez l''extrémité et dressez environ 20 tours sur deux plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé. Utilisez un doigt ou une fourchette trempée dans l’eau pour appuyer doucement sur les pics. Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les gougères soient gonflées, bien dorées et croustillantes. Laisser refroidir.","Si vous préparez la garniture, faites fondre le beurre dans une poêle à feu moyen-doux. Incorporer la farine pour former une pâte sableuse. Incorporez lentement le lait et la crème et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe. Incorporer le fromage pour le faire fondre, assaisonner, puis retirer du feu et laisser refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidi, transférer dans une deuxième poche à douille. Snip off the end.","À l''aide d''une pique à brochette, percez le fond des gougères avec des trous suffisamment grands pour accueillir l''extrémité de la poche à douille. Versez la garniture, puis disposez-en quatre dans chaque assiette et parsemez-les de fromage râpé."]','2026-01-11 00:06:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10537,7264,'fr','Pain au chocolat','Essayez-vous à la préparation de ces populaires pâtisseries françaises fourrées au chocolat pour le petit-déjeuner. Ils sont parfaits servis avec une tasse de café ou comme gâterie en milieu de matinée','["420 g de farine nature","8g de sel marin","60 g de sucre en poudre","220 g de beurre doux (au moins 82 % de matière grasse convient mieux), 20 g ramolli","20 g de levure fraîche ou 10 g de levure sèche","1 oeuf , battu","Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","16 bâtons de chocolat noir"]','["Préparez la pâte au batteur sur socle. Mélangez la farine, le sel, le sucre et 20 g de beurre ramolli. Dissoudre la levure dans environ 80 ml d''eau tiède, à environ 38°C, pas trop chaude sinon cela tuerait la levure. Ajoutez 20 g d''œuf battu et le lait dans le bol du batteur. Versez le mélange levure-eau et allumez à basse vitesse avec un crochet pétrisseur pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte se rassemble pour former une boule rugueuse. Augmentez la vitesse à moyenne-élevée et pétrissez encore 6 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse. L''heure exacte dépendra de votre batteur sur socle.","Enveloppez bien la pâte et laissez-la reposer à température ambiante pendant 10 minutes. Déballez et étalez la pâte dans un rectangle d''environ 4 mm d''épaisseur, environ 40 x 30 cm. Envelopper le rectangle de pâte et mettre au congélateur 1h pour reposer ou au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Pendant ce temps, sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé, façonnez avec les 200 g de beurre restant un rectangle plat (environ 20 x 30 cm) à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. Il doit faire environ la moitié de la longueur de votre rectangle de pâte, mais la même largeur. Mettez au réfrigérateur jusqu’à ce que vous en ayez besoin – vous voulez qu’il soit froid mais flexible.","Sortez la pâte réfrigérée du réfrigérateur ou du congélateur et déposez le beurre au centre. Pliez les bords de la pâte pour qu''ils se rejoignent au centre, en recouvrant le beurre. Faites pivoter la pâte de 90 degrés et étalez-la sur environ 40 cm de longueur en gardant la même largeur. Manipulez doucement la pâte et remettez-la au réfrigérateur pendant 10 à 20 minutes si elle commence à devenir trop chaude.","Répétez le processus de pliage des bords de la pâte vers le milieu, puis repliez-la à nouveau sur elle-même comme un livre (c''est ce qu''on appelle un double tour). Mettre au frais 30 min.","Faites à nouveau pivoter la pâte de 90 degrés. Étalez-le à nouveau et repliez les bords pour qu''ils se rejoignent au milieu. Réfrigérer encore 30 minutes.","Abaissez la pâte à 32 x 30 cm et découpez 8 rectangles de 8 x 15 cm chacun. Mettez un bâton de chocolat sur un bord long de chaque rectangle, pliez la pâte vers l''intérieur, puis placez le deuxième bâton de chocolat à côté de la pâte pliée et roulez la pâte autour de l''enveloppe du chocolat, avec les coutures de la pâte maintenant vers le bas.","Faire lever le pain au chocolat à 26-29°C (c''est très important car une température plus élevée fera fondre le beurre entre les couches) pendant environ 2-3 heures, jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Heat the oven to 175C/155C fan/gas 4, brush the pain au chocolat with the remaining egg and bake for 15-18 mins until golden brown and cooked through. A consommer de préférence dans la journée mais se conserve deux jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:06:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10538,6262,'fr','Vanilla crème brûlée','Qui de mieux que Michel Roux Jr pour nous apprendre à créer ce dessert français classique ?','["250 ml de crème fraîche","75 ml de lait entier","Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","4 jaunes d''œufs","Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","feuille de pâte feuilletée","½ oeuf, battu","amandes finement hachées","sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 1. Mettre la crème, le lait et la gousse de vanille dans une casserole et porter à ébullition. Couvrir et laisser infuser 10 min. Fouetter ensemble les jaunes d''œufs et 3 cuillères à soupe de sucre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et épais. Ajoutez l''extrait de vanille et versez la crème bouillante sur le mélange. Bien mélanger, puis verser dans deux ramequins. Placer les ramequins au bain marie et cuire au four environ 40 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste pris. Laisser refroidir.","Faites chauffer le gril. Saupoudrer la brûlée froide d''une fine couche homogène de sucre et caraméliser sous le grill très chaud (ou au chalumeau). Répétez plusieurs fois jusqu’à obtenir une garniture crépitante dorée. Laisser refroidir et servir dans les 2 heures avec des bâtonnets de pâte feuilletée aux amandes tièdes (voir ci-dessous)."]','2026-01-11 00:06:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10539,7268,'fr','Ultimate crème brûlée','Avec une crème anglaise riche et crémeuse à la vanille et une garniture croquante et caramélisée, notre crème brûlée est le dessert gourmand par excellence. Suivez nos conseils de pro pour maîtriser ce classique sucré français','["2 cartons de crème double, 1 grand (284 ml) plus 1 petit (142 ml)","100 ml de lait entier","1 gousse de vanille","5 jaunes d''œufs","50 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour le topping"]','["Chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Placez quatre ramequins de 175 ml dans un plat à rôtir d''au moins 7,5 cm de profondeur (ou un grand moule à gâteau profond), un moule qui permettra à un plateau de cuisson de reposer bien au-dessus des ramequins lorsqu''il est posé sur le dessus du moule.","Versez les grands et petits pots de crème double dans une casserole moyenne avec le lait.","Posez la gousse de vanille sur une planche et coupez-la dans le sens de la longueur jusqu''au milieu avec un couteau bien aiguisé pour la diviser en deux. Utilisez la pointe du couteau pour gratter toutes les petites graines du mélange de crème. Déposez également la gousse de vanille et réservez.","Mettez les jaunes d''œufs et le sucre dans un bol et fouettez pendant 1 min avec un fouet électrique à main jusqu''à ce que la couleur soit plus pâle et un peu mousseuse.","Mettez la casserole avec la crème sur feu moyen et portez presque à ébullition. Dès que des bulles apparaissent sur le pourtour, retirez la casserole du feu.","Versez la crème chaude dans les jaunes d''œufs battus en remuant avec un fouet et en grattant les graines de la poêle.","Placez un tamis fin sur un grand pichet ou un bol et versez le mélange chaud pour le filtrer, en encourageant les graines de vanille égarées à la fin.","À l’aide d’une grande cuillère, retirez toute la mousse pâle qui se trouve à la surface du liquide (ce sera plusieurs cuillerées) et jetez-la. Remuez le mélange.","Versez suffisamment d''eau chaude (du robinet) dans le plat à rôtir jusqu''à environ 1,5 cm des côtés des ramequins. Versez la crème chaude dans les ramequins de manière à les remplir jusqu''en haut, c''est plus facile d''en verser le dernier petit peu.","Mettez-les au four et posez une plaque à pâtisserie sur le dessus du moule afin qu''elle repose bien au-dessus des ramequins et les recouvre complètement, mais pas tout le moule, en laissant un petit espace sur un côté pour permettre à l''air de circuler.","Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit légèrement pris. Pour vérifier, balancez doucement le plat à rôtir et si les crèmes brûlées sont prêtes, elles vacilleront un peu comme une gelée au milieu. Ne les laissez pas devenir trop fermes.","Sortez les ramequins du plat à rôtir avec des gants de cuisine et placez-les sur une grille pour qu''ils refroidissent pendant quelques minutes seulement, puis mettez-les au réfrigérateur pour qu''ils refroidissent complètement. Cela peut être fait pendant la nuit sans affecter la texture.","Au moment de servir, essuyez le bord supérieur des plats, saupoudrez 1½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre sur chaque ramequin et étalez-le avec le dos d''une cuillère pour couvrir complètement.","Pulvérisez un peu d''eau à l''aide d''un spray fin (comme on en trouve dans les magasins de bricolage) pour juste humidifier le sucre, puis utilisez un chalumeau pour le caraméliser. Maintenez la flamme juste au-dessus du sucre et continuez à la déplacer en rond jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit caramélisée. Servir lorsque la brûlée est ferme, ou dans une heure ou deux."]','2026-01-11 00:06:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10540,7270,'fr','Flamenco','Essayez ce plat français à mi-chemin entre une pizza et une quiche. La crème fraîche mélangée au fromage et aux œufs constitue une garniture savoureuse avec de délicieux poireaux au beurre','["250 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","5g de sel","5g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, pour le bol","20g de beurre","500 g de poireaux, partie blanche et vert pâle uniquement, émincés","2 oeufs, battus","150 g de crème fraîche ou de crème sure","80g de comté, gruyère ou cheddar (utiliser du cheddar pour les végétariens), râpé","1 grosse branche de thym ou de romarin, feuilles cueillies","¼ de muscade entière, râpée","20 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé","salade, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez la farine et le sel dans un grand bol. Mélangez la levure avec 175 ml d''eau tiède et laissez mousser un peu 5 minutes, puis ajoutez à la farine et mélangez vigoureusement avec une cuillère en métal. Pétrir la pâte dès qu''elle se rassemble sur une surface légèrement farinée pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse. Alternativement, utilisez un mixeur équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur, travaillez la pâte pendant environ 5 minutes à vitesse moyenne, puis ajoutez le sel vers la fin du temps de pétrissage. Laisser dans un bol légèrement huilé recouvert d''un torchon propre et humide jusqu''à ce qu''il double presque de volume, environ 1 heure.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le beurre dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites cuire les fuites jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies, environ 8 minutes. Ne les laissez pas colorer. Lorsqu''il est tendre, retirez du feu et laissez refroidir. Battez ensemble les œufs, la crème fraîche, le fromage râpé, les herbes et la muscade et assaisonnez bien avec beaucoup de poivre et un peu de sel. Incorporer les poireaux.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de 40 x 30 cm de papier sulfurisé. Farinez légèrement le plan de travail et étalez la pâte pour qu''elle s''adapte à la plaque à pâtisserie (elle doit avoir environ 5 mm d''épaisseur). Faites un petit rebord sur le pourtour de la pâte en repliant la pâte vers l''intérieur. Répartir uniformément le mélange de poireaux sur la pâte en laissant une bordure de 1 cm. Saupoudrer de parmesan.","Cuire la flamiche au four pendant environ 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit légèrement doré et que le fond soit croustillant. Retirer du four, couper en carrés et servir avec de la salade, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10541,7272,'fr','Canapés aux figues, burrata et jambon','Utilisez de plus grosses tranches de levain pour nos tartines aux figues, burrata et prosciutto pour un déjeuner ou une entrée impressionnante et d''une simplicité trompeuse.','["4 tranches de levain","huile d''olive, pour arroser","2 cuillères à soupe de chutney de figues","2 boules de 100g de burrata égouttées","8 tranches de prosciutto ou de jambon de Parme","4 à 6 figues mûres, grossièrement déchirées ou coupées en deux","une poignée de thym ou d''origan, feuilles cueillies","vinaigre balsamique, pour servir"]','["Chauffer la poêle à feu vif ou chauffer le gril à feu vif. Arrosez chaque côté du pain d''un peu d''huile d''olive, puis faites-le griller à la poêle ou sous le grill pendant 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré.","Étalez le chutney de figues sur le pain grillé. Déchirez ou coupez la burrata en gros morceaux et disposez-les sur les toasts, créez des petits nids de prosciutto dessus, puis ajoutez les morceaux de figues. Saupoudrer de thym, puis arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive et d''un peu de vinaigre balsamique."]','2026-01-11 00:06:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10542,7274,'fr','Tarte aux pommes française','À la recherche d’un dessert époustouflant pour un dîner ? Si vous avez le temps, cela vaut la peine de réaliser une tarte aux pommes française, une pâtisserie classique de vitrine.','["125 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","200 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 œuf battu","1 ¾ kg (environ 12) mangeant des pommes, comme Cox''s, Russet ou Granny Smith","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de calvados, de cognac ou de brandy (facultatif)","25 g de beurre fondu","3 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots","sucre glace, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Pour la pâte, mélangez le beurre avec la farine, le sucre et une pincée de sel dans un bol jusqu''à ce qu''il soit friable. Incorporer l''œuf jusqu''à ce qu''il forme une pâte, puis former une rondelle. Couvrir et réfrigérer pendant au moins 30 minutes. Se conservera au frais pendant deux jours.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 6. Abaisser la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à environ l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £, et l''utiliser pour tapisser un moule à tarte cannelé de 23 cm en laissant un peu de surplomb. Tapisser d''un disque de papier sulfurisé suffisamment grand pour recouvrir les bords et remplir de quelques fèves au four pour l''alourdir (utilisez du riz séché ou des lentilles si vous n''avez pas de fèves au four). Enfournez 15 minutes, puis retirez le papier sulfurisé et les haricots et enfournez encore 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit biscuitée. Coupez toute pâte qui dépasse avec un couteau dentelé. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, réservez quatre pommes, puis épluchez, épépinez et hachez grossièrement le reste. Mettez-les dans une casserole peu profonde avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, le tout sauf 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre et d''alcool, le cas échéant. Couvrir et cuire à feu doux pendant 25 à 30 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps et en ajoutant de l''eau si nécessaire, jusqu''à ce que les pommes soient réduites en purée. Goûtez le mélange et sucrez avec plus de sucre, si nécessaire.","Allumez le four à 210C/190C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Épluchez, épépinez et coupez en deux les pommes réservées, puis coupez-les en tranches de taille égale. Étalez la purée de pomme sur le fond du fond de tarte, puis disposez les tranches de pomme en cercles bien nets et concentriques, en commençant par l''extérieur. Badigeonnez les pommes de beurre, puis saupoudrez-les du sucre réservé et faites cuire encore 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées.","Mélangez la confiture avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau chaude provenant d''une bouilloire fraîchement bouillie. Lorsque la tarte a fini de cuire, badigeonner généreusement de confiture, puis laisser refroidir un peu. Servir tiède ou froid, saupoudré de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10543,7276,'fr','Salade de lotissement','Profitez au maximum des asperges et des radis de la nouvelle saison dans une salade vibrante avec une vinaigrette à la française. Idéal pour un barbecue','["8 pointes d''asperges, coupées en deux","250 g de haricots verts coupés en deux","250 g de brocoli à tige longue, coupé en tronçons de 2 cm","200 g de petits pois frais ou surgelés","8 radis, tranchés","1 chou pointu, râpé","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","une poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","1 citron, jus"]','["Pour préparer la vinaigrette, mélanger tous les ingrédients dans un bol et bien assaisonner.","Portez à ébullition une casserole d''eau salée et remplissez un bol d''eau glacée. Faites cuire les asperges pendant 2 minutes, puis transférez-les dans l''eau glacée à l''aide d''une écumoire. Faites cuire les haricots pendant 4 min et répétez, puis faites de même avec le brocoli (cuisez 2 ½ min) et les petits pois (cuisez 1 min). Égoutter et sécher avec du papier absorbant.","Versez dans un bol avec les radis, le chou, les oignons nouveaux et la menthe. Servir la vinaigrette à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:06:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10544,7278,'fr','Madeleines au moka','Donnez au dessert français classique une touche moderne avec ces jolies mini madeleines au moka. Ces gâteaux faciles sont le régal parfait pour le thé de l''après-midi','["100 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","85 g de farine nature","15g de cacao en poudre","2 œufs, séparés","2 cuillères à café de miel","1 ½ cuillère à soupe de café en grains","80 g de sucre en poudre","15 g de sucre démérara","25g de chocolat blanc"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et beurrer un moule à madeleine 12 trous ou un moule à mini madeleine 24 trous. Dans une petite poêle, chauffer le beurre à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit mousseux et doré avec un arôme de noisette. Laisser refroidir.","Tamisez la farine et le cacao dans un grand bol, puis incorporez les jaunes d''œufs, le miel, le café, le beurre fondu et les deux sucres. Battre les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à formation de pics fermes, puis les incorporer au mélange de cacao.","Versez le mélange dans le moule en remplissant à moitié chacun des trous de la madeleine. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant 1 h.","Enfourner 7 min si vous utilisez un moule à mini madeleines 24 trous, ou 10 à 12 min si vous utilisez un moule 12 trous. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir.","Faire fondre le chocolat blanc au micro-ondes par petits coups, puis en napper les madeleines."]','2026-01-11 00:06:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10545,7280,'fr','Steak haché with pommes frites & cheat’s Béarnaise sauce','Une recette française classique de burger & chips sans pain, que l''on retrouve dans toutes les brasseries et bistrots. Les enfants vont adorer et c''est facile de créer ensemble à la maison.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","4 échalotes hachées très finement","600 g de bœuf fraîchement haché (demandez au boucher quelque chose avec environ 15 % de matière grasse - nous avons utilisé du paleron)","8 brins de thym, feuilles cueillies et hachées","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","200ml crème fraîche","1 jaune d''oeuf","6 brins d''estragon, feuilles cueillies et hachées finement","salade verte garnie, pour servir","4 grosses pommes de terre au four (comme Maris Piper ou Russet), pelées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et ajoutez environ 3/4 des échalotes. Cuire pendant 5 à 10 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à caraméliser par endroits. Laisser refroidir.","Dans un grand bol, mélanger le bœuf, le thym, 1 cuillère à café de Dijon et les échalotes refroidies. Assaisonnez avec du poivre noir mais pas de sel à ce stade (cela pourrait dessécher la viande). Façonner quatre galettes et saupoudrer de farine. Dresser dans une assiette, couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes (ou jusqu''à 2 heures).","Pendant ce temps, préparez les frites. Coupez les pommes de terre en chips fines et versez-les dans un grand bol d''eau froide au fur et à mesure. Égoutter, puis transférer dans une grande casserole et couvrir d''eau fraîche en assaisonnant de sel. Portez à ébullition rapide, faites bouillir 1 min, puis bien égouttez. Versez les chips sur un torchon propre ou du papier absorbant, étalez-les en une seule couche pour qu''elles sèchent et refroidissent rapidement. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Versez les chips dans un bol avec l''huile végétale et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Remuer pour bien enrober, puis étaler sur deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie. Cuire pendant 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés.","Lorsque les chips sont cuites à environ 15 minutes, faites chauffer une grande poêle avec un filet d''huile. Assaisonnez les galettes de sel des deux côtés et faites cuire 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles aient une croûte brun foncé mais soient encore légèrement roses à l''intérieur (ou faites-les cuire un peu plus longtemps si vous préférez qu''elles soient bien cuites). Transférer dans une assiette, couvrir de papier d''aluminium et réserver au chaud pendant que vous préparez la sauce.","Remettez la poêle sur le feu et versez-y les échalotes restantes. Faites revenir 1 à 2 minutes pour ramollir, puis retirez la casserole du feu et incorporez la crème fraîche, le reste de Dijon, le jaune d''œuf et l''estragon, ainsi que le jus restant des galettes de bœuf. Assaisonnez bien. Servir le steak avec les pommes frites et une salade verte, avec la sauce béarnaise en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10546,5511,'fr','Lighter Cassoulet','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Cette cocotte française traditionnellement riche et cuite lentement est rendue plus saine avec du steak de jambon maigre et de l''épaule de porc pour un repas copieux et chaleureux.','["500 g de haricots secs","7 gousses d''ail","5 brins de thym","3 brins de romarin","200 g de steak de jambon fumé, sans la couenne et le gras","1 feuille de laurier","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon moyen, haché","1 grosse carotte (poids total de 200 g), coupée en morceaux de 1 cm","2 cuillères à café de beurre","500 g d''épaule de porc coupée en dés de 4 à 5 cm, sans excès de gras","125 ml de vin blanc","230 g de tomates italiennes en boîte","3 saucisses de Toulouse","25 g de panko ou de chapelure grossièrement séchée","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 cuillère à café de zeste de citron finement râpé","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza"]','["Mettez les haricots dans un très grand bol. Versez plus de 3 fois leur volume d''eau pour qu''ils soient bien recouverts car ils vont beaucoup s''imprégner. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser tremper toute la nuit.","Versez les haricots dans une grande passoire pour les égoutter, en jetant l''eau. Mettez-les dans une grande casserole profonde et couvrez d''eau fraîche et froide (environ 2 litres), de manière à ce qu''elle soit à environ 3 cm au-dessus des haricots. Ajoutez 3 gousses d''ail, 2 brins de thym et 1 brin de romarin. Portez à ébullition, couvrez à moitié la casserole avec son couvercle et laissez mijoter très doucement pendant 1h30 en vérifiant de temps en temps le niveau de l''eau. Coupez le jambon en morceaux de la taille d''un lardon. Mettez les lardons avec les haricots en vérifiant qu''il reste encore assez d''eau pour recouvrir le tout. Laisser mijoter encore 30 minutes.","Enroulez les brins de thym et de romarin restants dans la feuille de laurier et attachez-les avec de la ficelle pour former un bouquet garni. Faites chauffer l’huile dans une grande sauteuse profonde allant au four ou dans une cocotte ignifuge. Mettez l''oignon et la carotte dans la poêle et faites-les revenir doucement à feu moyen pendant 5 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Hachez finement les 4 gousses d''ail restantes. Faire fondre le beurre dans la poêle, ajouter l''ail et faire revenir 2 minutes. Augmentez le feu, ajoutez l''épaule de porc et faites revenir 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle ne soit plus rose. Versez le vin et laissez-le bouillonner 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement réduit. Incorporer les tomates, rentrer le bouquet garni et laisser mijoter 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites. Bien assaisonner avec du poivre et 2 pincées de sel. Retirer et réserver.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Égouttez les haricots dans une grande passoire posée au-dessus d''un grand bol afin de pouvoir réserver le liquide de cuisson (vous devriez avoir environ 850 ml). Retirez et jetez les tiges d''herbes. Écrasez les gousses d''ail ramollies avec une cuillère, puis incorporez les haricots et les lardons. Versez ce mélange dans la poêle avec l''épaule de porc, puis versez 600 ml du liquide de cuisson réservé. Laisser mijoter doucement, à découvert, pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance moelleuse et onctueuse.","Pendant ce temps, déposez les saucisses sur une petite plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive et faites-les rôtir pendant 20 minutes, en les retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Retirer, couper en tranches de 1 cm d''épaisseur en diagonale et baisser le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.","Rentrez les tranches de saucisses dans les haricots, transférez le cassoulet au four et enfournez 1h30 à découvert. Pendant ce temps, mélangez la chapelure de panko, l''ail, le zeste de citron, l''huile et un peu de poivre. La viande doit maintenant être presque tendre et le cassoulet moelleux et juteux, pas sec. (Si nécessaire, versez un peu du liquide de cuisson réservé.) Répartissez le mélange de chapelure et remettez au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:06:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10547,7282,'fr','Porc one-pot à l''orange, aux olives et au laurier','Contient du porc – recette réservée aux non-musulmansUne cocotte de porc à la provençale aux saveurs vibrantes d''agrumes, d''échalotes douces, de pommes de terre nouvelles et de tomates séchées','["85 g de tomates séchées dans l''huile, hachées grossièrement, plus 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''huile du pot","1 kg d''épaule de porc coupée en gros cubes","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature, assaisonnée","400 g d''échalote (voir astuce ci-dessous)","1 oignon, tranché finement","3 feuilles de laurier","quelques brins de thym","5 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","400 ml de vin rouge","lanière de zeste et de jus d''1 orange","350 ml de bouillon de poulet","Boîte de 400 g de tomates italiennes hachées","800 g de grosses pommes de terre nouvelles, pelées et coupées en deux ou coupées en grosses tranches, selon la taille","70 g d''olives noires sèches"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d’huile de tomates séchées dans une grande cocotte ignifuge. Mélangez le porc dans la farine, retirez tout excédent, puis faites-le dorer en 2 fois, en le transférant dans un grand bol une fois doré et en croûte. Utilisez un peu plus d''huile pour le deuxième lot si nécessaire.","Versez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile, les échalotes, l''oignon, les feuilles de laurier et le thym dans la poêle et faites revenir 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés ici et là. Incorporer l''ail et les tomates séchées, cuire encore 1 min, puis verser sur le porc.","Versez le vin et le jus d''orange dans le plat, ajoutez le zeste d''orange et faites bouillir fort pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez à nouveau la viande et les oignons.","Au moment de cuire, chauffez le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Incorporez le bouillon, les tomates en conserve, les pommes de terre et les olives dans la cocotte, puis portez à ébullition. Poussez les pommes de terre aussi loin que possible sous la surface du liquide. Couvrir en laissant un léger espace sur le côté, puis cuire au four pendant 2h30 ou jusqu''à ce que la viande soit suffisamment tendre pour être coupée avec une cuillère. Éliminez tout excès de graisse et laissez le ragoût reposer quelques minutes avant de le verser dans des bols peu profonds."]','2026-01-11 00:06:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10548,6280,'fr','Raymond Blanc’s cassoulet','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Le cassoulet rustique de Raymond Blanc est riche et chaleureux – la cuisson lente à son meilleur.','["140 g de couenne de porc","140 g de lard fumé","300 g de saucisse à l''ail","600 g de haricots secs, trempés une nuit dans 3 fois leur volume d''eau","1 branche de céleri","1 petit oignon, de préférence un oignon doux à peau blanche","1 grosse carotte","6 gousses d''ail","2 tomates italiennes mûres","25 g de graisse d''oie ou 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 bouquet garni","8 pincées de sel marin","2 pincées de poivre noir fraîchement moulu","1 clou de girofle, légèrement écrasé","2 cuillères à café de jus de citron","4 cuisses de canard confites","60 g de graisse d''oie ou 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","40 g de chapelure séchée","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","une poignée de persil plat frais, haché grossièrement"]','["Pour découper les viandes, enroulez la couenne de porc comme un petit pain suisse. Avec la couture en dessous, utilisez un couteau très tranchant pour couper le rouleau en fines tranches, puis coupez les tranches enroulées en dés. Coupez les lardons en petits cubes (lardons). Coupez le saucisson à l''ail en tranches de 1 cm d''épaisseur.","Égoutter les haricots trempés et jeter l''eau de trempage. Versez les haricots dans une grande casserole, ajoutez les dés de couenne de porc et les lardons et recouvrez d''eau fraîche et froide. Porter à ébullition et blanchir pendant 15 à 20 minutes. Égouttez les haricots, leur écorce et leurs lardons dans une passoire et jetez l''eau de cuisson.","Hachez grossièrement le céleri, l''oignon et la carotte. Épluchez les gousses d''ail mais laissez-les entières. Coupez chaque tomate en huit quartiers. (On ne voit jamais de tomates dans un cassoulet traditionnel, mais le chef Raymond Blanc les aime pour leur couleur et leur douceur, alors il en met quelques-unes.) Préchauffer le four à 120°C/chaleur tournante 100°C. (Si vous cuisinez dans un four à gaz, utilisez le repère 2.)","Faites chauffer la graisse d''oie ou l''huile d''olive dans une cocotte anti-flamme de 26 cm ou une sauteuse profonde à feu doux et faites suer le céleri, l''oignon, la carotte et l''ail pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez les tomates et le bouquet garni et faites cuire doucement pour obtenir une caramélisation sucrée (environ 5 minutes). Ajoutez les saucisses, les haricots, la couenne de porc et les lardons et versez 1,2 litre d''eau. Portez à ébullition, écumez, puis ajoutez le sel, le poivre, le clou de girofle et le jus de citron.","Transférer la cocotte au four et cuire à découvert pendant 2 heures en remuant toutes les heures. À la fin de ce temps, les haricots auront une texture douce et crémeuse et les jus devraient avoir épaissi. Vous devrez peut-être le faire cuire pendant plus de 2 heures (disons jusqu''à 2 heures et demie) pour arriver à ce stade – cela dépend","Sortez le cassoulet du four. Enterrez les cuisses de canard dans les haricots et saupoudrez-les de graisse d''oie ou d''huile d''olive, de chapelure et d''ail. Remettre au four et cuire encore 2 heures. Servir le cassoulet dans des bols, parsemé de persil haché."]','2026-01-11 00:06:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10549,7286,'fr','Madeleines à l''orange sanguine et au chocolat noir','À déguster fraîches du four, ces délicates madeleines trempées dans du chocolat noir et saupoudrées de poudre d''orange sanguine constituent un dessert délicieux.','["100 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","2 gros œufs","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","zestez 2 oranges sanguines et le jus de ½ (environ 2 cuillères à soupe)","100 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","140 g de chocolat noir (60-70 % de cacao), finement haché","poussière d''orange sanguine (facultatif - voir ci-dessous)"]','["Mettez le beurre dans une petite casserole à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il mousse et prenne une couleur noisette – surveillez attentivement la poêle, car le beurre peut brûler rapidement. Verser dans un bol et laisser refroidir.","Battre les œufs, le sucre et le zeste dans un grand bol avec un fouet électrique pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et pâle. Ajouter le jus et mélanger pour combiner. Mélangez la farine et la levure chimique, puis tamisez le mélange de pâte, un tiers à la fois, et incorporez.","Ajouter une grande cuillerée de pâte au beurre, en mélangeant jusqu''à consistance lisse et homogène. Versez-le dans la pâte et pliez délicatement jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Presser une feuille de film alimentaire sur la surface du mélange et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Environ 30 minutes avant de cuire les madeleines, graissez un moule à madeleines à 12 trous avec un peu de beurre supplémentaire et saupoudrez d''un peu de farine. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6 et mettre le moule au congélateur pour qu''il refroidisse pendant 30 minutes. Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et ajoutez environ 1 cuillère à soupe bombée dans chaque trou de madeleine – veillez à ne pas trop remplir car elles cuiront au-delà des bords et ne formeront pas la bosse caractéristique. Selon la taille de votre moule, il vous restera un peu de pâte – soit faites cuire par lots, soit remettez le reste au réfrigérateur et faites cuire dans les trois jours.","Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés. Démoulez immédiatement les madeleines sur une grille et laissez-les refroidir complètement. Mettez le chocolat dans un bol allant au micro-ondes et faites chauffer au micro-ondes à puissance élevée par rafales de 30 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''environ les trois quarts du chocolat aient fondu. Retirez du micro-ondes et remuez vigoureusement jusqu''à ce que le chocolat restant soit fondu (il s''agit d''une méthode simple de tempérage qui garantit simplement que le chocolat prendra correctement à température ambiante). Trempez chaque madeleine à moitié dans le chocolat fondu en laissant égoutter l''excédent, puis déposez-la sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé. Lorsque le chocolat commence à prendre, mais bien qu''il soit encore un peu collant, saupoudrez d''un peu de poussière d''orange sanguine (ci-dessous), si vous en utilisez, et laissez refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10550,7288,'fr','Sautéed potatoes with bacon lardons & persillade','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce fabuleux plat d''accompagnement français composé de pommes de terre poêlées et de bacon fumé salé est agrémenté d''ail et d''herbes et se marie parfaitement avec les viandes rôties et la volaille.','["1 kg de pommes de terre, coupées en morceaux de 2 cm","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","300 g de lardons de lard fumé","25g de beurre doux","petit paquet de persil plat, haché","2 cuillères à café de cerfeuil haché","1 brin d''estragon, feuilles hachées","1 échalote banane, hachée finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées"]','["Dans une grande casserole à feu vif, faites mijoter les pommes de terre 5 min dans suffisamment d''eau pour les recouvrir, puis égouttez-les dans une passoire et laissez reposer 1 min pour que la vapeur s''échappe.","Dans un petit bol, mélanger tous les ingrédients de la persillade et réserver. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu vif, ajoutez les lardons et laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement caramélisés. Ajoutez les pommes de terre, puis le beurre.","Assaisonner avec du sel et du poivre noir fraîchement moulu et cuire 10 minutes en remuant régulièrement jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient entièrement dorés. Retirez tout excès de graisse et incorporez la persillade. Goûtez et rectifiez l''assaisonnement si nécessaire."]','2026-01-11 00:06:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10551,7290,'fr','Chinon apple tarts','Ces petites tartelettes françaises sont merveilleusement beurrées et croustillantes, glacées avec une gelée de vin rouge – la fin parfaite d''un dîner spécial pour deux.','["375 ml de vin rouge, type Chinon","200 g de sucre à confiture","1 anis étoilé","1 clou de girofle","2½ cm de bâton de cannelle","pincée de piment de la Jamaïque","½ gousse de vanille fendue, graines grattées","Paquet de 320 g de pâte feuilletée tout beurre déjà roulée","4 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","2-3 manger des pommes (j''ai utilisé Pink Lady)","3 cuillères à soupe de gelée de vin rouge (voir recette ci-dessus)","100ml crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","3 gousses de cardamome, gousses jetées et graines moulues"]','["Pour faire la gelée de vin rouge, mettez le vin rouge, le sucre de confiture, l''anis étoilé, le clou de girofle, le bâton de cannelle, le piment de la Jamaïque, la gousse de vanille fendue et les graines dans une casserole moyenne. Mélangez puis chauffez doucement pour dissoudre le sucre. Augmentez le feu et faites bouillir pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit réduit et sirupeux. Filtrer dans un petit pot de confiture stérilisé et laisser refroidir complètement. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 1 mois.","Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et laissez-la à température ambiante pendant 10 min, puis déroulez-la. Chauffez le gril à feu vif et faites chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Découpez 2 cercles de pâte de 13 cm en vous aidant d''une assiette comme guide et placez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive. Saupoudrez chaque cercle avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre et faites griller 5 minutes pour caraméliser en surveillant bien pour que le sucre ne brûle pas. Retirer du gril. Peut être préparé quelques heures à l’avance et laissé couvert hors du réfrigérateur.","Épluchez, coupez en quartiers et épépinez les pommes, coupez-les en tranches de 2 mm d''épaisseur et disposez-les sur la pâte. Saupoudrer du reste de sucre et mettre au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit bien cuite et dorée et que les pommes soient ramollies. Retirer et laisser refroidir légèrement. Faites chauffer 3 cuillères à soupe de gelée de vin rouge dans une petite casserole à feu doux avec 1 cuillère à café d''eau pour la rendre un peu plus liquide, puis badigeonnez-en le dessus des tartelettes.","Versez la crème fraîche dans un bol, tamisez le sucre glace et la cardamome et mélangez. Déposez délicatement les tartelettes chaudes sur les assiettes de service et servez avec la crème fraîche à la cardamome."]','2026-01-11 00:06:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10552,4675,'fr','Summer pistou','À mi-chemin entre une soupe et un ragoût, ce plat français sain regorge de légumes et de haricots – parfait comme déjeuner léger. Si vous le préparez à l’avance, il se conservera au réfrigérateur pendant quelques jours.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 poireaux, finement tranchés","1 grosse courgette, coupée en petits dés","1 l de bouillon de légumes bouillant (fait maison ou avec un bouillon réduit en sel)","Boîte de 400 g de cannellini ou de haricots blancs égouttés","200 g de haricots verts hachés","3 tomates hachées","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","basilic en petit paquet","40 g de parmesan fraîchement râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir les poireaux et la courgette pendant 5 minutes pour les ramollir. Versez le bouillon, ajoutez les trois quarts des haricots avec les haricots verts, la moitié des tomates et laissez mijoter 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, mixez le reste des haricots et des tomates, l''ail et le basilic dans un robot culinaire (ou dans un bol avec un mixeur plongeant) jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez le parmesan. Incorporer la sauce à la soupe, cuire 1 min, puis en verser la moitié dans des bols ou verser dans un flacon pour un panier-repas. Refroidissez le reste. Se conservera quelques jours."]','2026-01-11 00:06:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10553,7292,'fr','Fennel Dauphinoise','Le gratin de pommes de terre est un classique du bistro français et cette version crémeuse pour deux a une légère saveur anisée grâce au fenouil ajouté.','["225 g de pommes de terre de taille moyenne, tranchées très finement","1 petit bulbe de fenouil, tranché, frondes réservées","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","75 ml de lait entier","100 ml de crème double","beurre, pour les ramequins","2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan finement râpé (ou alternative végétarienne)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Mettre\r\npommes de terre, fenouil et ail dans une poêle antiadhésive moyenne.\r\nVerser le lait et la crème fraîche, bien assaisonner et laisser mijoter\r\ndoucement, à couvert, pendant 10 minutes, en remuant à mi-cuisson\r\njusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient juste tendres.","Répartissez le mélange entre 2 petits\r\n(environ 150 ml) de ramequins beurrés et\r\nparsemer de parmesan. Cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient\r\ndoré et tendre lorsqu''on le perce avec un\r\ncouteau. Coupez les feuilles de fenouil réservées\r\navant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10554,7294,'fr','Lighter crème brûlée','Le secret de ce pud français plus sain est de rendre la crème anglaise très épaisse au début car contrairement à votre recette normale, elle n''est pas cuite ensuite.','["4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de crème anglaise","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","200 ml de lait demi-écrémé","2 gros jaunes d''œufs","125 ml de crème liquide","1 gousse de vanille","140 g de crème fraîche demi-élevée"]','["Incorporer 2 cuillères à soupe de sucre, la crème anglaise\r\npoudre et maïzena dans un bol moyen\r\navec 2 cuillères à soupe de lait pour obtenir une consistance lisse\r\ncoller. Incorporer les jaunes d''œufs à la fourchette\r\njusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez le reste\r\nle lait dans une casserole, de préférence antiadhésive, puis\r\nverser la crème. Fendez la gousse de vanille\r\ndans le sens de la longueur et grattez les graines\r\nle lait. Déposez la dosette dans la poêle et\r\nporter le lait crémeux à ébullition –\r\ndès que tu vois quelques bulles monter\r\nà la surface, retirer du feu.","Versez lentement et remuez le lait chaud\r\ndans le mélange de farine de maïs, y compris le\r\ngousse de vanille en veillant à ce que les jaunes\r\nsont bien mélangés. Transférer dans un endroit propre\r\ncasserole. Cuire à feu doux en remuant\r\ncontinuellement avec une cuillère en bois, pendant\r\nenviron 15-20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit très\r\népais – lorsque vous faites glisser la cuillère dessus\r\nle fond de la casserole, il doit sortir\r\nune ligne épurée. Il faudrait\r\nêtre beaucoup plus épais après environ 10 minutes,\r\nmais continuez à remuer jusqu''à ce que le mélange ait\r\nsuffisamment épaissi pour ressembler à doucement\r\ncrème fouettée ou mayonnaise. Continuez à ajuster la chaleur\r\npour que le mélange ne vienne pas\r\nà ébullition ou surchauffer, car il pourrait cailler et devenir grumeleux. Si ceci\r\ncela arrive, battez le mélange en douceur\r\navec un fouet métallique.","Retirer du feu, transférer dans un\r\nbol et laisser refroidir 15-20 minutes,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps pour éviter une peau\r\nde se former. Retirez la gousse de vanille.\r\nIncorporer la crème fraîche et diviser\r\nle mélange entre 4 petits ramequins\r\n(capacité d''environ 125 à 150 ml chacun). Propagation\r\nles mélanges niveler, puis réfrigérer, à découvert,\r\npendant la nuit. En ne les couvrant pas, une mince\r\nde la peau peut se former sur les brûlées,\r\nce qui aidera à soutenir la couche de caramel.","Avant de servir, versez le reste\r\nsucre sur le dessus de chaque brûlée\r\n(prévoir 1½ cuillère à café par ramequin) et lisser\r\navec le dos de la cuillère. À\r\ncaraméliser, utiliser un chalumeau. Tenir\r\nla flamme juste au dessus du sucre et réservez\r\nil bouge jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément caramélisé (ne pas\r\nprenez trop de temps sinon vous chaufferez le\r\ntrop de crème anglaise). Si la crème a l''air\r\ncomme s''il s''était légèrement ramolli, mettez\r\nles ramequins au réfrigérateur pendant 5 à 10 minutes\r\npour le raffermir à nouveau. Servir pendant que le\r\nle caramel est encore cassant."]','2026-01-11 00:06:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10555,7298,'fr','Ragoût de poisson d''été à la rouille','Évoquez des vacances méditerranéennes avec ce repas léger mais gourmand pour deux','["6 grosses crevettes crues décortiquées","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive douce","150 ml de vin blanc sec","200 ml de bouillon de poisson (un cube suffit)","1 petit bulbe de fenouil (environ 140 g/5 oz) coupé en deux et tranché finement","1 petit oignon, tranché finement","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 grosse pomme de terre, environ 200 g/8 oz (j''ai utilisé King Edward)","1 orange","1 anis étoilé","1 feuille de laurier","1½ cuillère à café de pâte d''harissa (j''ai utilisé Belazu)","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","une poignée de moules ou de palourdes","200 g de poisson blanc sans peau, pêché de manière durable (j''ai utilisé de la longe de cabillaud), coupé en gros morceaux","quelques feuilles de thym","3 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise à l''huile d''olive achetée","pain croustillant de bonne qualité"]','["Tordez les têtes des crevettes, puis\r\nenlevez les cuisses et les coquilles, mais laissez\r\nles queues intactes. Déveinez chaque crevette. Faire frire les coquilles dans 1 cuillère à soupe\r\nhuile pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit rose foncé et dorée\r\nen patchs. Ajouter le vin, faire bouillir\r\ndeux tiers, puis versez le bouillon. Souche\r\ndans un pichet, en jetant les coquilles.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une friteuse\r\nune poêle ou une cocotte. Ajouter le fenouil, l''oignon\r\net l''ail, assaisonner, puis couvrir et\r\ncuire doucement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.\r\nPendant ce temps, épluchez la pomme de terre et coupez-la en\r\nDes morceaux d''environ 2 cm. Mettre dans une poêle froide\r\neau, porter à ébullition et cuire 5 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque tendre. Égoutter dans une passoire.","Pelez une bande de zeste de l''orange.\r\nMettez le zeste, l''anis étoilé, le laurier et ½ cuillère à café\r\nharissa dans la poêle. Faire frire doucement, à découvert,\r\npendant 5 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient\r\ndoux, sucré et doré.","Incorporer le concentré de tomates, cuire 2 min,\r\npuis ajoutez les tomates et le bouillon. Laisser mijoter\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe\r\nlégèrement. Assaisonner au goût. La sauce peut\r\nêtre préparé à l''avance, puis réchauffé plus tard\r\nla journée. Pendant ce temps, frottez les moules ou\r\npalourdes et retirez les barbes filandreuses.\r\nCeux qui sont ouverts doivent être exploités\r\nbrusquement sur le plan de travail – si ce n’est pas le cas\r\nfermez après quelques secondes, jetez-les.","Réchauffez la sauce si nécessaire, puis remuez\r\nla pomme de terre, les morceaux de poisson et les crevettes\r\ntrès doucement dans le ragoût. Ramenez à\r\nporter à ébullition, puis couvrir et laisser mijoter doucement\r\npendant 3 minutes. Répartissez les moules ou les palourdes\r\nsur le ragoût, puis couvrir et cuire pendant\r\n2 minutes de plus ou jusqu''à ce que les coquilles soient\r\nouvert en grand. Jetez tout ce qui reste\r\nfermé. Les morceaux de poisson doivent s''écailler\r\nfacilement et les crevettes doivent être roses\r\nà travers. Parsemer de feuilles de thym.","Pour faire la rouille rapide, remuez le reste\r\nde la harissa à travers la mayonnaise.\r\nServir le ragoût dans des bols, garni de\r\ncuillerées de rouille, qui va fondre dans\r\nla sauce et l''enrichir. Ayez du bon\r\nle pain est prêt, comme vous en aurez certainement envie\r\néponger les jus."]','2026-01-11 00:06:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10556,7300,'fr','Niçoise stuffed baguette','Pour le sandwich transportable ultime, évidez un bâtonnet et remplissez-le de thon, d''olives, d''anchois et d''œufs.','["3 gros œufs","Boîte de 130g de thon à l''huile d''olive, huile réservée","1 grande flûte ou baguette mesurant environ 54 cm","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","3 tomates, extrémités parées, tranchées épaisses","12 à 24 feuilles de basilic (selon l''herbe que vous aimez)","12 olives Kalamata dénoyautées","8 filets d''anchois","1 échalote, hachée finement","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","½ cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon"]','["Portez à ébullition une petite casserole d''eau.\r\nAjoutez les œufs et faites bouillir 10 min. Égoutter,\r\npuis faites couler les œufs sous le robinet froid pour\r\nrefroidir rapidement. Décortiquez et coupez soigneusement le\r\nles œufs en quartiers en forme de coin.\r\nPendant ce temps, mélangez tous les ingrédients pour\r\nla vinaigrette à l''échalote avec l''assaisonnement\r\net incorporer l''huile du thon.","Coupez le pain en deux dans le sens de la longueur, mais pas\r\ntout au long, donc ça s''ouvre comme un\r\nlivre. Utilisez vos doigts pour retirer tout\r\npain qui se détache facilement du\r\nmoitié supérieure pour creuser un peu le pain.","Sur la moitié inférieure du pain, arroser\r\nsur la vinaigrette. Remuer la mayonnaise\r\ndans le thon et étalé dessus. Maintenant\r\najouter les tomates, le basilic, les olives,\r\nœufs et anchois.","Rouler serré dans du papier sulfurisé\r\net fixez-le sur toute la longueur avec un élastique\r\nbandes ou ficelle. Appuyez très bien tous\r\ntout le long du pain, puis détendez-vous\r\npendant la nuit. Couper en tranches si vous nourrissez\r\nune foule, ou en 4 longueurs."]','2026-01-11 00:06:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10557,7302,'fr','Tarte Tatin tomates & oignons caramélisés','Une version végétarienne et salée de la tarte tatin – parfaite pour un dîner léger','["50g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, coupé en fines tranches","1 cuillère à café de sucre","85g de beurre","175 g de farines autolevantes","50 g de parmesan finement râpé","une petite poignée de feuilles de thym frais","1 gros jaune d''oeuf fermier","25g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de sucre","1 grosse gousse d''ail, tranchée finement","5 tomates italiennes, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","quelques brins de thym","300 g de tomates cerises en paquet"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre et l''huile dans une poêle\r\npoêle jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu.\r\nCuire l''oignon à feu moyen\r\nchauffer pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\njoliment doré, en remuant souvent.\r\nIncorporer le sucre et cuire pendant\r\nencore quelques minutes. Astuce\r\nl''oignon et le jus dans un bol\r\net mettre de côté. Préchauffer le four à\r\n200C/gaz 6/ventilateur 180C.","Pour la pâte, incorporez le beurre à la farine pour obtenir une chapelure fine. Remuer\r\ndans le parmesan, le thym et un\r\npincée de sel. Ajoutez le jaune d''oeuf et\r\n2 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide, puis mélanger pour obtenir\r\nune pâte. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire.","Pour les tomates, faites chauffer le beurre\r\net huiler dans un moule à tarte tatin de 20 cm de diamètre\r\ncuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud. Incorporer le sucre\r\net l''ail, puis mettre la prune\r\ntomates coupées vers le bas avec quelques\r\nbrins de thym, et grésiller sans plus\r\nque 1 minute. Disperser dans l''ensemble\r\ntomates cerises et rentrez-les un peu\r\nplus de thym. Retirez du feu et\r\nétalez les oignons dessus. Saison\r\navec du sel et du poivre.","Étalez la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement plus grande que le dessus du moule. Posez-le sur les oignons et repliez l''excédent sur les côtés.","Cuire au four sur une plaque à pâtisserie pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes, retourner une assiette sur le dessus et retourner la tarte dessus. Saupoudrer de thym supplémentaire et de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10558,7304,'fr','Mini-éclairs','Le thé de l''après-midi devient glamour avec ces doigts de pâte à choux façon pâtisserie parisienne fourrés à la crème de liqueur de baies','["150 ml de lait","100 g de beurre coupé en dés","200 g de farine nature, tamisée","4 gros œufs, battus","200 ml de lait","1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille ou 1 gousse de vanille fendue au milieu","2 gros jaunes d''œufs","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","200 ml de crème fraîche","500 g de sucre glace fondant tamisé","colorant alimentaire","pépites et décoration de gâteau comestible (nous avons utilisé des Smarties et des Mini Smarties)"]','["Pour faire les petits pains, faites chauffer le lait,\r\nbeurre et 150 ml d''eau très doucement dans\r\nune casserole de taille moyenne jusqu''à ce que tout\r\nle beurre a fondu. Obtenez la farine et\r\nun peu de sel prêt, puis augmentez le feu\r\net portez le liquide à ébullition. Dès\r\npendant qu''il bout, retirez du feu et\r\nincorporer la farine et une pincée de sel avec\r\nune cuillère en bois. Continuez à battre jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle mélange est lisse et se détache\r\nles côtés de la poêle. Refroidir 5 minutes.","Incorporer les œufs, petit à petit, jusqu''à obtenir une\r\npâte lisse et brillante. Verser dans une douille\r\nun sac avec une douille unie de 1,5 à 2 cm et un ensemble\r\nréserver jusqu''au moment de cuire.","Pour faire la garniture, apportez le lait juste\r\nporter à ébullition dans une casserole avec la vanille\r\ncoller ou diviser la gousse. Pendant ce temps, fouettez\r\nensemble les jaunes d''œufs, le sucre et les farines\r\ndans un bol à mélanger. Versez le lait chaud\r\ntout en fouettant continuellement l''oeuf\r\nmélange. Jetez le pod (si vous l''utilisez) et\r\nremettre le mélange dans une casserole essuyée.\r\nCuire à feu doux en remuant jusqu''à ce que\r\nle mélange est plus épais qu''une crème anglaise – il deviendra\r\ngrumeleux, mais continuez simplement à remuer et à battre\r\nles grumeaux. Transférer vers un autre mixage\r\nbol et posez du film alimentaire directement sur le\r\nsurface. Laisser refroidir, puis réfrigérer.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nTapisser quelques plaques à pâtisserie avec\r\npapier sulfurisé. Tuyau de 8 à 10 cm de long\r\nlongueurs de pâte, environ 2 cm de large\r\n– laisser de l’espace pour s’étendre entre chacun\r\nun. Mettre au four 5 mn puis\r\nréduire la chaleur à 200C/200C ventilateur/gaz 6\r\net cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré,\r\ngonflé et croustillant. A l''aide d''une brochette, piquez\r\n3 petits trous le long de la base de chacun\r\nchignon. Remettre sur les plaques à pâtisserie, base\r\nvers le haut et remettez au four pour un autre\r\n8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement plus croustillants. Cool. Peut\r\nêtre congelé jusqu’à un mois ou conservé dans un contenant hermétique jusqu’à 3 jours –\r\nil suffit de le faire revenir dans un four chaud quand\r\nprêt à remplir.","Ajouter la crème à la crème anglaise épaisse\r\nremplir et battre avec un fouet électrique\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il retrouve sa propre forme. Mettre dans\r\nune poche à douille avec une petite douille, puis une poche à douille\r\nun peu de garniture au fond des petits pains\r\nen utilisant les trous pour brochettes que vous avez faits auparavant\r\n(voir Les secrets du succès ci-dessous). Quand il\r\njaillit, ce morceau est probablement plein.","Mélangez le sucre glace et juste assez d''eau pour obtenir un glaçage assez épais. Répartissez dans autant de bols que vous le souhaitez et colorez chaque lot à votre guise. (En fonction de votre coloration, vous devrez peut-être ajouter une goutte d''eau supplémentaire aux glaçages pour qu''ils soient épais mais coulants.)","Trempez le dessus de chaque éclair dans le glaçage pour le recouvrir, ou utilisez une cuillère à café pour en étaler un peu – utilisez-en moins au début et attendez qu''il s''étale et se dépose. Ajoutez des pépites et des décorations, puis posez doucement sur des grilles pour prendre. Il est préférable de manger les éclairs le jour où ils sont remplis et décorés, avant qu''ils ne deviennent détrempés."]','2026-01-11 00:06:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10559,7306,'fr','Brie enveloppé de prosciutto et de brioche','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Cette pâtisserie décadente de Paul Hollywood combine du pain français légèrement sucré avec une garniture crémeuse au jambon et au fromage.','["375 g de farine à pain blanche forte","50 g de sucre en poudre","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","75 ml de lait","3 gros œufs, plus 2 œufs battus pour le glaçage","185 g de beurre doux, ramolli","250 g de brie rond","8 tranches de jambon"]','["Mélangez la farine, 1 cuillère à café de sel, le sucre en poudre, la levure, le lait et les œufs dans un mixeur à l''aide de l''accessoire pâte pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse. Ajoutez le beurre et mélangez encore 4 minutes à vitesse moyenne. Raclez le bol de pâte et mélangez à nouveau pendant 1 min. Placer la pâte dans un récipient, couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser au réfrigérateur au moins 6 heures avant utilisation.","Enveloppez le Brie dans le prosciutto et réservez. Déposez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée. Rouler en un cercle de 25 cm. Placez le Brie enveloppé au milieu du cercle et repliez soigneusement les bords. Disposez le paquet sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et badigeonnez d''œuf battu. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes, puis badigeonner à nouveau d''œuf battu et réfrigérer encore 30 minutes. Laisser lever 1 h à température ambiante. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6, puis enfourner pendant 22 minutes. Servir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:06:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10560,7308,'fr','Le relooking ultime : la soupe à l''oignon française','Angela Nilsen relooke le classique français, perdant le beurre et le bouillon de bœuf pour créer une soupe plus légère mais toujours pleine de saveur','["4 gros oignons espagnols (environ 900 g/2 lb)","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza extra vierge","4 brins de thym","2 feuilles de laurier","300 ml de vin blanc sec","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de bouillon de légumes suisse","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza extra vierge","4 longues tranches de baguette","25 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé grossièrement","50 g de Gruyère râpé grossièrement"]','["Coupez les oignons en deux dans le sens de la longueur, puis émincez-les\r\nen tranches très fines. Chauffer un très grand\r\npoêle, ajouter l''huile lorsqu''elle est chaude, incorporer les oignons,\r\n3 brins de thym et les feuilles de laurier, puis\r\nassaisonner avec un peu de sel. Cela semblera beaucoup\r\nd''oignons, mais ils réduisent tout de suite. Cuisinier\r\nà feu vif pendant 5 minutes en remuant souvent. Le\r\nles oignons ne devraient pas encore dorer, ils commencent juste à ramollir.\r\nBaissez le feu, puis laissez cuire doucement pendant 35 minutes,\r\nà découvert, en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient\r\nréduits jusqu''en bas et sont très doux.","Pendant que les oignons cuisent, apportez le vin\r\nporter à ébullition dans une petite casserole, puis faire bouillonner pendant\r\n30 secondes. Retirer et laisser refroidir. Versez la farine\r\ndans une petite poêle épaisse et faire griller à feu moyen\r\nchauffer quelques minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que\r\nde couleur marron clair. Annuler.","Quand les oignons sont bien mous et réduits,\r\naugmentez le feu pour qu''ils caramélisent, puis faites cuire\r\npendant encore 12 à 15 minutes, en remuant le long du\r\nfond de la casserole de temps en temps pour mélanger le\r\nmorceaux collants bruns. Lorsque le fond de la casserole\r\net tous les oignons sont collants et d''un brun riche\r\ncouleur, incorporer la farine. Avec la chaleur toujours forte,\r\nverser progressivement le vin, en remuant à nouveau\r\nmorceaux du bas. Versez 1,2 litre de froid\r\nl''eau. Incorporer le bouillon, puis amener lentement\r\nle tout à ébullition. Écumez toute mousse de\r\nla surface. Laisser mijoter 15 minutes pour que tout\r\nles saveurs peuvent se mélanger.","Pendant que la soupe mijote, préparez la garniture.\r\nChauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Mélanger le\r\nl''ail et l''huile ensemble. Brossez partout\r\ntranches de pain, puis coupez chacune en cubes.\r\nRépartir sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis cuire au four pendant\r\n8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Annuler. Ligne a\r\nplaque à pâtisserie avec du papier sulfurisé ou un\r\nfeuille de silicone antiadhésive. Retirez les feuilles\r\nde la branche de thym restante, puis mélangez\r\navec le parmesan râpé. Dispersion et propagation\r\nsur la plaque à pâtisserie tapissée en un format de 13 x 8 cm\r\nrectangle. Cuire au four environ 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu\r\net devenant doré. Retirer, laisser raffermir,\r\npuis cassez-les en morceaux irréguliers.","Pour servir, retirez et jetez les herbes du\r\nla soupe. Versez la soupe dans des bols – dispersez\r\nsur quelques croûtons, le Gruyère et un broyage\r\nde poivre, puis perchez un croustillant de parmesan dessus\r\nhaut. Servir les croûtons restants séparément."]','2026-01-11 00:06:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10561,7310,'fr','Omelette française ultime','L''omelette est l''un des plats les plus fondamentaux de l''arsenal de tout cuisinier, et cette recette vous apprendra comment la réussir à chaque fois.','["3 œufs, le plus frais possible, de préférence bio et fermiers, température ambiante","2 noix de beurre doux","1 cuillère à café de parmesan finement râpé (ou alternative végétarienne)","2-3 feuilles d''estragon hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette ciselée et de cerfeuil ou de persil haché","3 cuillères à soupe bombées de Gruyère finement râpé"]','["Préparez tout. Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive de 20 cm (mesurée sur le dessus) à feu moyen. Cassez les œufs dans un bol et battez-les avec une fourchette pour qu''ils se brisent et se mélangent, mais pas aussi complètement que pour un œuf brouillé. Sur feu moyen-vif, déposez une noix de beurre dans la poêle. Il doit bouillonner et grésiller, mais pas brunir. Assaisonnez les œufs avec le parmesan, un peu de sel et de poivre et versez dans la poêle.","Laissez les œufs bouillonner légèrement pendant quelques secondes, puis prenez une fourchette ou une spatule en bois et aspirez délicatement le mélange depuis les côtés de la casserole plusieurs fois, afin qu''il se rassemble en plis au centre. Laisser agir quelques secondes, puis remuer à nouveau pour mélanger légèrement l''œuf cru avec l''œuf cuit. Remettez à nouveau brièvement, et une fois partiellement cuit, remuez un peu plus vite, en arrêtant lorsqu''il reste un œuf à peine cuit. Avec la casserole à plat sur le feu, secouez-la plusieurs fois pour décanter le mélange. Il doit glisser facilement dans la poêle et paraître doux et humide sur le dessus. Un rapide coup de chaleur fera dorer le dessous.","Saisissez la poignée en dessous. Inclinez la poêle loin de vous et laissez l''omelette tomber jusqu''au bord. Pliez d’un tiers le côté le plus proche de vous avec votre fourchette et continuez à le rouler pour que l’omelette bascule sur une assiette – ou pliez-la en deux, si c’est plus facile. Pour une finition soignée, recouvrez l''omelette d''un morceau de papier absorbant et repulpez-la un peu avec vos doigts. Frotter l''autre noix de beurre pour glacer. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10562,7312,'fr','Bisque de crevettes et fenouil','Une soupe de fruits de mer luxueuse, riche en saveurs, parfaite pour les réceptions formelles et également faible en calories','["450 g de crevettes tigrées crues dans leur carapace","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","1 gros bulbe de fenouil, haché, frondes réservées","2 carottes, hachées","150 ml de vin blanc sec","1 cuillère à soupe de cognac","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1l de bouillon de poisson","2 généreuses pincées de paprika","Pot de 150 ml de crème fraîche","8 crevettes tigrées, décortiquées, mais le bout de la queue laissé (facultatif)","feuilles de fenouil (facultatif)"]','["Décortiquez les crevettes, puis faites revenir les carapaces dans l''huile dans une grande poêle pendant environ 5 minutes. Ajouter l''oignon, le fenouil et les carottes et cuire environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à ramollir. Versez le vin et le cognac, faites bouillonner fort pendant environ 1 min pour chasser l''alcool, puis ajoutez les tomates, le bouillon et le paprika. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 30 mn. Pendant ce temps, hachez les crevettes.","Mixez la soupe aussi finement que possible avec un mixeur plongeant ou un robot culinaire, puis passez-la au tamis dans un bol. Passez un peu de temps à bien passer le mélange au tamis car cela donnera à la soupe sa texture veloutée.","Remettez dans une poêle propre, ajoutez les crevettes et faites cuire 10 minutes, puis mixez à nouveau jusqu''à consistance lisse. Vous pouvez le préparer et le réfrigérer la veille ou le congeler pendant 1 mois. Décongeler une nuit au réfrigérateur. Au moment de servir, réchauffez doucement dans une poêle avec la crème. En garniture, faites cuire les 8 gambas dans un peu de beurre. Verser dans des petits bols et garnir de crevettes et de feuilles de fenouil ciselées."]','2026-01-11 00:06:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10563,7314,'fr','Pistachio & raspberry pithiviers','Feuilletés individuels frangipane et baies – pour une touche spéciale, décorez avec les initiales de vos invités','["140 g de pistaches décortiquées non salées","100 g de sucre en poudre","100 g de beurre coupé en dés","2 œufs moyens","3 cuillères à soupe de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Un paquet de 500 g de pâte feuilletée","24 framboises, décongelées si congelées","paillettes comestibles rouges et spray doré pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez ensemble les pistaches,\r\nle sucre, le beurre, 1 œuf et la farine\r\ndans un robot culinaire à presque\r\nfrangipane onctueuse.","Rouler la pâte en boule (pour la casser\r\ncertaines couches), puis déroulez\r\ntrès finement sur une surface saupoudrée de farine.\r\nDécoupez 4 cercles de 11 cm et 4 cercles de 13 cm.\r\ncercles – vous devrez probablement relancer\r\nune fois. Enregistrez tous les parures.","Mettez 6 framboises au centre de chacune\r\ndes 4 petits cercles, puis déposez-y une cuillerée\r\nun peu de frangipane pistache. En utilisant un petit\r\npalette ou couteau à lame ronde, étaler et\r\nlisser le mélange en un dôme, en couvrant\r\net enfermant les framboises – laissez un\r\nbien 1 cm de pâte bien dégagée sur le pourtour.\r\nBattre le deuxième œuf et badigeonner un peu\r\nsur les bords de la pâte. Posez soigneusement le\r\ncercles de pâte plus grands sur le dessus, en soulevant et\r\nen les pressant petit à petit sur la garniture,\r\ntout autour, pour éliminer tout\r\nl''air. Remodeler les pithiviers pour donner un joli\r\nforme de dôme rond, appuyez sur les bords pour\r\nsceller, puis couper tout excédent de pâte autour\r\nles bords si nécessaire. Badigeonner l''œuf\r\ntous les pithiviers.","Décorez les dessus en marquant légèrement\r\nun motif avec la pointe d''un couteau bien aiguisé.\r\nPincez les bords pour sceller, puis sertissez pour\r\ndonner un bord cannelé. Si vous le souhaitez, badigeonnez l''œuf\r\nsur certaines des garnitures déployées,\r\npuis badigeonnez de paillettes comestibles. Utiliser une lettre\r\ndes cutters pour découper les initiales de votre\r\ninvités, ou toute autre forme que vous aimez.\r\nVaporisez les autres garnitures avec un spray doré.\r\net tamponnez plus de formes. Décorer\r\navec les formes et recouvrir légèrement avec\r\nfilm alimentaire. Réfrigérer au moins 2 heures, mais plus\r\nsi tu peux. Peut être préparé 1 jour à l''avance.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nCuire les pithiviers pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré et croustillant. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10564,7318,'fr','Pain doré aux abricots','Ajoutez une touche sucrée au pain aux œufs avec cette recette gourmande pour le brunch','["50g de beurre","6 abricots, coupés en deux et dénoyautés","200g/8oz caramel sauce (we used Bonne Maman confiture de caramel)","350g de crème anglaise vanille toute prête","8 petites tranches épaisses de brioche ou de pain blanc, ou 4 grosses tranches coupées en diagonale"]','["Faire fondre 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre dans un\r\npoêle à frire. Mettez les abricots, côté coupé\r\nvers le bas et faites frire doucement pendant 2-3 minutes. Retourner\r\net cuire encore 1 minute jusqu''à ce que légèrement\r\ndoré. Ajoutez le caramel dans la poêle et\r\nfaire fondre jusqu''à obtenir une sauce - si c''est encore trop épais pour être enrobé\r\nle fruit, ajoutez un peu d''eau. Gardez au chaud.","Mélangez la crème anglaise avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau\r\npour décoller, puis tremper dans les tranches de pain,\r\nretourner pour bien enrober. Faire fondre la moitié\r\nle reste du beurre dans un grand plat antiadhésif\r\npoêle à frire. Secouez légèrement tout excédent\r\nmélange de crème anglaise de la moitié du pain\r\ntranches et faire revenir dans le beurre pendant 2 minutes\r\nchaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Répétez avec\r\nle reste du beurre et du pain, puis servir\r\nchaud avec les abricots au caramel."]','2026-01-11 00:06:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10565,7320,'fr','Poulet à la française aux petits pois et bacon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce plat de poulet crémeux en une seule casserole est une façon économique de nourrir toute la famille.','["6 tranches de bacon fumé, hachées","8 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, hachés grossièrement","300 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","250 g de petits pois surgelés","1 laitue Little Gem, râpée grossièrement","2 tbsp crème fraîche"]','["Dans une grande poêle, faire revenir à sec les lardons\r\nà feu moyen pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla graisse se libère et le bacon est doré.\r\nTransférer le bacon dans un petit bol,\r\nen laissant la graisse dans la poêle. Ajoutez le\r\npoulet et faire dorer 4 minutes de chaque côté.","Poussez le poulet d''un côté de la poêle\r\net ajoutez l''ail et les oignons nouveaux,\r\ncuire environ 30 secondes, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles tiges de ciboule sont vert vif. Verser\r\ndans le bouillon de volaille, remettre les lardons dans\r\nla poêle, couvrir et laisser mijoter 15 minutes.","Augmentez le feu sous la poêle. Donnez un pourboire au\r\nles petits pois et la laitue dans la sauce et cuire\r\npendant 4 minutes, à couvert, jusqu''à ce que les petits pois soient\r\ntendre et la laitue vient de faner.\r\nVérifiez que le poulet est bien cuit. Remuer\r\ndans la crème fraîche juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10566,6711,'fr','Poulet Marengo','Essayez une cocotte de poulet différente et préparez cette version avec des champignons, des olives, des tomates et du persil.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","300 g de champignons coupés en deux","4 cuisses de poulet, la peau retirée","Pot de 500 g de passata à l''ail et aux herbes","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","100 g d''olives noires Kalamata dénoyautées","persil haché, pour servir (facultatif)","des pâtes et une salade, ou de la purée et des légumes verts, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand récipient antidéflagrant\r\ncocotte et faites sauter le\r\nchampignons jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir.\r\nAjouter les cuisses de poulet et cuire brièvement\r\nde chaque côté pour les colorer un peu.","Versez la passata, émiettez-la\r\ncube de bouillon et incorporer les olives. Saison\r\navec du poivre noir – vous ne devriez pas avoir besoin\r\nsel. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle poulet est tendre. Saupoudrer de\r\npersil et servir avec des pâtes et une salade,\r\nou de la purée et des légumes verts, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10567,7322,'fr','Three-cheese soufflés','Avec une double couche de fromage de chèvre et un enrobage de crème, ces pâtisseries de style bistro sont authentiquement riches.','["50 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","25 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), finement râpé","300 ml de lait entier","2 feuilles de laurier","5 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","140 g de Gruyère (ou alternative végétarienne), râpé","3 œufs, séparés","8 tranches de fromage de chèvre (voir « Essayer » ci-dessous)","150 ml de crème fraîche","feuilles de salade, pour servir (voir « Essayer », ci-dessous)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 6 et beurre 4 petit (environ\r\n200 ml) de ramequins. Saupoudrer le\r\nParmesan dans les ramequins, en retournant\r\njusqu''à ce que tous les côtés soient couverts. Lieu\r\nle lait et les feuilles de laurier dans un grand\r\ncasserole à feu doux et\r\nporter à ébullition. Éteignez le feu\r\net laissez infuser 15 min.","Jetez les feuilles de laurier, ajoutez le\r\nbeurre et farine, et retourner dans un\r\nfeu doux. Laisser mijoter très doucement,\r\nen remuant continuellement avec un ballon\r\nfouetter, pendant environ 6 minutes jusqu''à obtenir\r\nune sauce blanche onctueuse et épaisse. Faire\r\nsûr d''entrer directement dans le\r\ncoins de la poêle pour arrêter la sauce\r\nd''attraper ou de devenir grumeleux.","Une fois épaissi, transférez le\r\nsauce dans un grand bol et\r\nincorporer la moutarde en poudre,\r\npoivre de Cayenne, Gruyère et œuf\r\njaunes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement combinés.","Dans un bol impeccablement propre\r\net avec un fouet propre,\r\nbattre les blancs d''œufs juste\r\njusqu''à ce que des pics commencent à se former.","Pliez délicatement les blancs d''œufs\r\ndans la sauce au fromage en trois\r\nétapes en vous assurant de vous coucher,\r\nplutôt que de remuer, pour garder l''œuf\r\ndes blancs légers et aérés. Remplissez le préparé\r\nramequins avec le mélange à soufflé.","Garnir chaque soufflé d''une tranche\r\nde fromage de chèvre, puis déposez\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie. Cuire au four pour\r\n20-25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient élastiques et bien\r\nlevé mais bien cuit.","Laisser refroidir puis passer un couteau\r\nsur le pourtour de chaque plat\r\net retirez les soufflés. Si vous préparez à l''avance, placez les soufflés\r\nà l''envers (pour une présentation soignée), sur\r\nun plateau. Couvrir la plaque d''un film alimentaire. Détendez-vous pendant\r\nquelques jours ou congeler jusqu''à 1 mois.","Au moment de re-cuire, chauffer\r\nfour à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6.\r\nPlacez le à l''envers\r\nsoufflés dans un plat peu profond,\r\ngarnir du reste de fromage de chèvre\r\ntranches et verser sur la crème (cette\r\nles empêche de sécher quand\r\ncuit pour la deuxième fois). Cuisinier\r\npendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Servir\r\nimmédiatement à côté de certains\r\nsalade simplement habillée."]','2026-01-11 00:06:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10568,7324,'fr','Rôti d''agneau à l''ail et aux herbes sur pommes de terre boulangères','Cuire ensemble un succulent agneau et des pommes de terre aux herbes signifie que les pommes de terre absorbent tous les délicieux jus.','["2 kg de gigot d''agneau","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées","quelques brins de romarin","quelques brins de thym","2 kg de grosses pommes de terre, type King Edwards","2 oignons, tranchés finement","600 ml de bouillon de poulet","50g de beurre"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nDécoupez de petites poches dans la peau et la chair\r\nde l''agneau en le perçant avec la pointe de\r\nun couteau bien aiguisé. Remplissez chaque poche avec un\r\nune tranche d''ail et quelques feuilles de romarin,\r\nou parsemer de thym. Mettre dans un rôtissoire\r\nboîte de conserve, bien assaisonner de sel et fraîchement\r\npoivre noir moulu, puis couvrir de papier d''aluminium.","Eplucher et trancher finement les pommes de terre, rincer\r\nsous le robinet d''eau froide et empiler dans un grand\r\nplat allant au four ou plat à rôtir. Mélanger avec\r\nles oignons, les tranches d''ail restantes et\r\nune bonne dispersion d''herbes.","Faites chauffer le bouillon et le beurre ensemble, puis\r\nverser sur les pommes de terre. Couvrir le plat\r\navec du papier d''aluminium et cuire au four avec le\r\nagneau pendant 1 heure. Découvrez, mettez l''agneau\r\ndessus des pommes de terre et rôties à découvert\r\npendant 45 minutes de plus. Laisser l''agneau se reposer\r\navant de découper, pendant environ 15 minutes. Partir\r\nles pommes de terre au four (couvertes, si\r\ncommence à trop dorer) jusqu''à ce que vous soyez prêt\r\nservir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10569,3674,'fr','Haricots à la grecque','Préparez un ragoût de haricots beurre, de tomates et de feta pour un repas rapide et sain en milieu de semaine. Dégustez avec du levain grillé à part pour éponger toute la sauce','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon rouge, finement haché","3 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","1½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","300 ml de bouillon de légumes faible en sel","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés et rincés","½ citron, jus","50 g de feta émiettée","une petite poignée d''aneth finement haché","levain grillé, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif. Ajouter les oignons avec une pincée de sel et cuire 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir et que les bords soient dorés. Incorporer l''ail, l''origan et la purée de tomates. Réduire le feu à moyen et cuire 3-4 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce que la purée devienne rouge foncé.","Incorporer les tomates, le bouillon et le sucre. Faites couler la boîte avec un peu d''eau, puis versez-la également dans la casserole. Laissez mijoter 10 à 12 minutes à feu doux-moyen, puis incorporez les haricots. Bien mélanger, puis laisser mijoter 2-3 minutes avant d''assaisonner selon votre goût avec du sel, du poivre et un peu de jus de citron. Servir avec la feta et l''aneth parsemés sur le dessus, avec du levain grillé à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:06:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10570,7325,'fr','Moussaka de niveau supérieur','Évoquez des souvenirs de vacances grecques avec cette merveilleuse moussaka préparée à l''avance, idéale pour nourrir une foule, servie avec une simple salade d''accompagnement.','["100 ml d''huile d''olive","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau","1 oignon , finement haché","3 grosses gousses d''ail écrasées","½ cuillère à café de cassonade légère","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","200 ml de vin rouge","1 cuillère à soupe d''origan séché","1 bâton de cannelle","2 feuilles de laurier","3 aubergines","feuilles de salade composée, pour servir","500 ml de yaourt grec","1 œuf et 1 jaune légèrement battus (congeler le blanc pour une autre recette)","50 g de parmesan râpé","pincée de muscade râpée","100 g de feta émiettée"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle à feu moyen-doux, émiettez-la avec le hachis et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes. Il libérera un peu de liquide mais une fois que celui-ci aura bouillonné, le hachis grésillera dans sa propre graisse et commencera à dorer et à caraméliser. A ce stade, remuez le hachis avec une cuillère en bois.","Incorporer l''oignon et poursuivre la cuisson 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore une minute. Répartissez le sucre dessus, puis incorporez la purée de tomates et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit grillée et commence à coller à la poêle. Versez le vinaigre et laissez mijoter une minute. Versez les tomates en conserve, puis utilisez le vin pour faire sortir la boîte et versez-la dans la sauce. Assaisonner de sel et de poivre, parsemer d''origan, nicher dans le bâton de cannelle et les feuilles de laurier, porter à ébullition et cuire doucement, en remuant de temps en temps, pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à obtenir un ragoût épais. Retirer du feu, pêcher le laurier et la cannelle et incorporer encore 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive.","Pendant que le ragoût cuit, coupez le dessus des aubergines, puis coupez-les en tranches de 1 cm d''épaisseur dans le sens de la longueur. Mettez dans un bol, salez légèrement et laissez reposer 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils ramollissent et tombent. Arroser généreusement du reste de l''huile d''olive et bien mélanger. Faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif et faites cuire les tranches des deux côtés pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres et légèrement carbonisées. Vous devrez le faire par lots. Laisser refroidir légèrement dans une assiette. (Cela peut également être fait sur un barbecue si vous avez le temps.)","Pour la garniture, versez le yaourt dans un bol avec l''œuf entier et le jaune, la moitié du parmesan, la muscade et un peu de sel et de poivre, puis fouettez jusqu''à homogénéité. Versez un tiers de la viande dans un grand plat rectangulaire allant au four (le nôtre faisait environ 20 x 30 cm) et étalez-le uniformément, déposez dessus la moitié de l''aubergine, puis un autre tiers de la sauce à la viande suivi des tranches d''aubergine restantes. Versez le reste de la sauce d''agneau, puis versez sur le mélange de yaourt en lissant jusqu''aux bords. Répartissez la feta avec le reste du parmesan. Se conserve au frais pendant deux jours.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180 chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Cuire la moussaka pendant 50 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien dorée. Laisser refroidir au moins 10 minutes avant de servir avec une salade d''accompagnement, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10571,7327,'fr','Gyros de poulet BBQ avec salade d''aneth et de chou','Impressionnez lors de votre prochain barbecue avec ces brochettes de poulet marinées d''inspiration grecque et cette salade croquante d''aneth et de chou blanc, ou faites simplement griller à l''intérieur s''il pleut.','["½ chou blanc, cœur retiré, finement râpé","10 g d''aneth haché grossièrement","1 citron , zesté et pressé","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 tomates, coupées en deux et tranchées","1 oignon rouge , finement tranché","500 g de yaourt grec entier","125 ml d''huile d''olive","1 gros citron, zesté et pressé","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir concassé","1 kg de filets de cuisse de poulet Morrisons","chips, pitta ou pains plats et tzatziki"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients du poulet, sauf le poulet, dans un bol avec 1 cuillère à café de sel. Incorporer le poulet et bien mélanger pour bien l''enrober, puis laisser mariner au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 24 heures, ou pendant au moins 2 heures.","Une fois mariné, enfilez le poulet Morrisons sur 2 grosses brochettes métalliques, de manière à ce que les deux brochettes traversent la viande. Jetez toute marinade restante. Mélanger tous les ingrédients de la salade dans un grand bol et assaisonner au goût.","Chauffez votre barbecue à feu moyen-vif si vous utilisez du gaz, ou pour les barbecues au charbon de bois, allumez et laissez les flammes s''éteindre et les charbons devenir blancs. Mettez les brochettes de poulet sur le BBQ, couvrez avec le couvercle et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes en les retournant jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient carbonisées de tous les côtés ou jusqu''à ce qu''un thermomètre de cuisson inséré dans la partie la plus épaisse indique 70°C. Retirer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et laisser reposer, couvert, pendant 15 à 20 minutes. Alternativement, placez-le sur une plaque recouverte de papier d''aluminium et faites-le griller pendant 15 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit carbonisé et bien cuit.","Une fois reposés, soulevez et coupez les brochettes en fines tranches et servez-les avec la salade. Pour servir, empilez-les dans des pittas avec la salade, des chips et du tzatziki, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10572,5649,'fr','Sandwichs ouverts à la salade grecque','Dégustez ces sandwichs ouverts à la salade grecque avec de la feta, des olives et des tomates pour le déjeuner ou une collation. Ils sont parfaits pour les repas en plein air en été','["125 g de féta","120 g de yaourt nature épais","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 tomates moyennes, épépinées, hachées finement","200 g de concombre finement haché","10 olives noires dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","½ oignon rouge, tranché finement","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe finement hachée, plus des feuilles supplémentaires pour garnir","½ citron, jus","8 tranches épaisses de levain"]','["Mettez la feta, le yaourt et l''ail dans un mini robot culinaire. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance épaisse et lisse, puis assaisonner avec un peu de poivre noir.","Mélanger les tomates, le concombre, les olives, l''oignon rouge et la menthe dans un grand bol avec le jus de citron. Assaisonner au goût.","Étalez la feta fouettée sur les tranches de levain et empilez chacune avec la salade. Garnir du reste des feuilles de menthe et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10573,6189,'fr','Pastitsio végétarien','Dans notre version végétarienne de ce plat de pâtes grecques, des lentilles économiques remplacent la viande et nous avons utilisé un peu de vinaigre balsamique à la place du raisin.','["2 gros oignons (330 g), coupés en deux et tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","2 feuilles de laurier","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","250 g de pennes","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","4 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 boîtes de 400 g de lentilles vertes","salade de tomates, oignons et aneth agrémentés de citron et d''olives, pour servir","500 ml de lait ou de lait végétal","50g de farine complète","1 œuf, séparé","40 g de feta végétarienne, émiettée","½ cuillère à café d''origan"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Mettre les oignons et l''huile dans une grande casserole avec le bouillon, les feuilles de laurier, le vinaigre, l''ail, l''origan et la cannelle. Ajoutez une tasse d''eau (environ 250 ml), puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Découvrez et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes en remuant fréquemment. L''eau devrait s''évaporer après ce temps et les oignons devraient être tendres.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage ou pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente. Égoutter et réserver.","Incorporer les tomates, la purée de tomates et les lentilles, ainsi que leur liquide, aux oignons. Bien mélanger, puis couvrir et laisser mijoter 5 minutes. Retirez les feuilles de laurier.","Pour faire la sauce blanche, versez le lait et 200 ml d''eau dans une casserole avec la farine, fouettez bien pour éviter la formation de grumeaux et continuez à remuer jusqu''à épaississement, pendant environ 8 à 10 minutes.","Incorporer le blanc d''œuf aux pâtes et verser sur le fond d''un plat allant au four. Garnir du mélange de lentilles. Incorporer le jaune d''œuf à la sauce blanche, puis verser sur les lentilles, parsemer de feta et d''origan, puis cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il bouillonne.","Servir la moitié avec la salade de tomates et d''oignons et réfrigérer le reste pendant un autre jour. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux jours. Réchauffer au micro-ondes dans des assiettes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:06:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10574,3892,'fr','Gâteaux feta avec salade grecque','Apportez un peu de soleil d''été à votre cuisine avec ces galettes de pommes de terre et de feta servies avec une salade grecque. Les herbes ajoutent beaucoup de saveur et des nutriments précieux, comme la vitamine C et le fer.','["une goutte d''huile de colza, pour la plaque à pâtisserie","700 g de pommes de terre pelées et coupées en morceaux","1 citron, zesté et à moitié pressé","6 oignons nouveaux, hachés très finement","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée","3 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","100 g de feta émiettée","1 gros œuf","6 cuillères à soupe de farine complète","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","320 g de tomates coupées en quartiers","1 concombre (environ 320 g), coupé en dés","1 oignon rouge finement haché","12 olives Kalamata, coupées en quartiers","1-2 cuillères à soupe de menthe finement hachée","2 cuillères à café de jus de citron","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et huiler une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive. Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition, ajoutez les pommes de terre et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Bien égoutter, puis remettre dans la poêle et écraser avec beaucoup de poivre noir, le zeste et le jus de citron, les oignons nouveaux, la menthe et 2 cuillères à soupe de persil. Incorporer la feta.","Battez l''œuf dans un bol peu profond, puis mélangez la farine, le paprika et 1 cuillère à soupe de persil restante dans un autre. Formez huit galettes avec le mélange de pommes de terre, puis enrobez-les délicatement d''œuf, puis de mélange de farine, en les remodelant si nécessaire. Disposez les gâteaux sur la plaque à pâtisserie et enfournez pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Utilisez un couteau à palette pour retourner soigneusement chacun d''eux et cuire encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez la moitié de la salade avec la moitié du citron et de l''huile. Servir avec quatre gâteaux et réfrigérer le reste pendant un autre jour, en mélangeant le reste de la salade avec le reste du citron et de l''huile juste avant de servir. Se conservera, couvert, jusqu''à deux jours au réfrigérateur. Pour réchauffer les gâteaux, faites cuire sur une plaque allant au four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 pendant 15-20 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:06:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10575,5467,'fr','Macaroni à la ratatouille et à la ricotta','Il s''agit d''une version déconstruite du macaroni au fromage avec une couche de légumes méditerranéens à base de ricotta italienne, pour que vous n''ayez pas besoin de préparer une sauce traditionnelle.','["400 g de tomates concassées","3 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","4 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","12 olives Kalamata, coupées en quartiers","1 cuillère à café de bouillon en poudre","1 grosse aubergine (350 g), coupée en dés","2 courgettes (325 g), coupées en deux et tranchées","200 g de gazon","20 g de basilic, petites feuilles réservées pour la garniture, le reste haché","400 g de pennes complètes","20 g de parmesan finement râpé"]','["Versez les tomates dans une casserole avec un bidon d''eau, le concentré de tomates, l''ail, les olives et le bouillon. Ajoutez l''aubergine et les courgettes, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez la ricotta et le basilic dans un petit bol avec beaucoup de poivre noir.","Faire bouillir la moitié des pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égoutter en réservant un peu d''eau de cuisson. Versez dans un bol et mélangez avec la moitié du mélange de ricotta et quelques cuillerées d''eau pour pâtes, en ajoutant davantage pour détendre si nécessaire. Versez la moitié de la ratatouille et les penne dans deux bols à pâtes et saupoudrez de la moitié des feuilles de parmesan et de basilic. Couvrir et réfrigérer le reste de la ratatouille, le basilic et la ricotta pendant une autre nuit. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Au moment de servir à nouveau, réchauffez la ratatouille dans une poêle à feu doux et poursuivez la méthode à partir de l''étape 3."]','2026-01-11 00:06:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10576,3916,'fr','Tarte spirale filo aux épinards','Ces impressionnantes spirales de filo aux épinards sont d’une simplicité trompeuse à réaliser. Une version de la spanakopita grecque, à servir avec une salade d''accompagnement pour un déjeuner de week-end','["300 g de pousses d''épinards","50 g de beurre salé fondu, plus une noix pour la friture","1 gros oignon, finement haché","200 g de feta émiettée","7 feuilles filo du commerce","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de nigelle"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen. Ajoutez les épinards et faites cuire en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient flétris (vous n''aurez pas besoin d''huile ni d''eau car ils vapeurront dans leur propre humidité). Laisser refroidir un peu, puis verser dans un torchon propre et essorer le plus d''eau possible. Hachez et mettez dans un bol.","Faites chauffer la noix de beurre dans une poêle antiadhésive. Ajouter l''oignon et cuire environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Versez dans le bol avec les épinards, puis incorporez la feta à l''aide d''une fourchette jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Goûtez pour l’assaisonnement.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Badigeonner un plat à tarte en métal de 24 x 4 cm de profondeur avec un peu de beurre.","Posez une feuille de filo sur votre plan de travail. Badigeonner d''un peu de beurre fondu, puis étaler environ 2 cuillères à soupe de garniture en ligne le long du bord le plus long de la pâte. Roulez-le sans serrer en un long boudin (ne le roulez pas trop serré car cela pourrait fendre la pâte), puis enroulez la pâte et placez-la au centre du moule.","Répétez avec le reste de la pâte et de la garniture, en disposant les spirales autour de celle centrale. Badigeonnez le dessus de beurre, puis saupoudrez de graines de nigelle. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants."]','2026-01-11 00:06:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10577,5483,'fr','Côtelettes d''agneau au thym, piment et htipiti grec','Servez des côtelettes d''agneau avec du htipiti pour un délicieux plat d''inspiration grecque aux saveurs fabuleuses. Des pommes de terre grelots rôties à l''huile d''olive font un excellent accompagnement','["12 côtelettes d''agneau","3 brins de thym, feuilles cueillies","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","235 g de poivrons rouges rôtis en bocal, égouttés","175 g de feta émiettée","2 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","2 gousses d''ail hachées très finement","2 brins de thym, feuilles cueillies","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","un filet de jus de citron (facultatif)"]','["Mettez les escalopes d''agneau dans un bol avec le thym, les flocons de piment et l''huile. Mélanger pour bien enrober, puis laisser mariner au réfrigérateur pendant 30 min à 1 h.","Pour le htipiti, coupez les poivrons en petits morceaux. Mettez dans un bol et ajoutez tous les autres ingrédients. Laisser reposer environ 15 minutes pour que la saveur s''imprègne.","Faites chauffer une poêle ou une poêle. Quand il fait bien chaud, sortez les côtelettes de la marinade. Faites-les cuire quelques-unes à la fois pendant 3 minutes de chaque côté, en assaisonnant au fur et à mesure. Servir les côtelettes avec la sauce et quelques pommes de terre grelots, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10578,7329,'fr','Spanakopita à l''agneau et aux épinards','Préparez cette superbe spanakopita – « tarte aux épinards ». Traditionnellement préparé avec de la pâte filo, de la feta et des épinards, nous avons ajouté ici de l''agneau mijoté en bouillon.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","800 g de cou ou d''épaule d''agneau coupé en morceaux","500 ml de bouillon d''agneau ou de poulet","1 bâton de cannelle","1 feuille de laurier","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 oignon, finement tranché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café bombée de cannelle moulue","500g d''épinards","150 g de feta émiettée","1⁄2 petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées finement","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin grillés","1 œuf légèrement battu","100 g de beurre fondu","270 g de pâte filo","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une cocotte à feu moyen-vif et faites frire l''agneau pendant 5 à 7 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré. Couvrir avec le bouillon, puis ajouter le bâton de cannelle et la feuille de laurier et porter à ébullition. Couvrir et cuire pendant 1 h 30 ou jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit tendre et se désagrège.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile et le beurre dans une poêle, puis faites revenir les oignons avec une grosse pincée de sel pendant 15 à 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et collants. Ajoutez l''ail et les épices et laissez cuire encore 3 minutes. Retirez l''agneau de son liquide de cuisson (en réservant le liquide), transférez-le sur une planche à découper et émincez-le à l''aide de deux fourchettes. Incorporer la viande râpée au mélange d''oignons, avec 50 ml du liquide réservé.","Mettez les épinards dans une casserole avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et faites cuire pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés. Enveloppez-le dans un torchon propre et essorez-le pour éliminer l''excédent de liquide, ou mettez-le dans une passoire fine et essorez-le à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère en bois. Hachez grossièrement les épinards, puis incorporez-les au mélange d''agneau et d''oignon avec la feta, la menthe, les pignons de pin et l''œuf. Saison.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6, et badigeonner un moule à charnière rond de 22 cm d''un peu de beurre fondu. Étalez quatre feuilles de pâte filo sur le moule, puis badigeonnez-les de beurre fondu. Verser la garniture et replier la pâte qui dépasse sur le dessus. Frottez les feuilles de pâte restantes, déposez-les sur la tarte et badigeonnez-les du reste de beurre fondu. Saupoudrer de graines de sésame. Cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:06:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10579,4131,'fr','bouyiourdi grec','Dégustez cette feta cuite au four avec des tomates, de l''ail et du piment dans le cadre d''un déjeuner meze. Il est parfait pour accompagner des pains pitta chauds accompagnés d''une salade grecque.','["3 grosses tomates mûres","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","200 g de bloc de feta","1 gros piment vert doux ou 1 poivron vert, tranché","1 cuillère à café de feuilles d''origan grossièrement hachées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","pains pitta réchauffés, pour servir"]','["Coupez 1 tomate au milieu, puis coupez deux tranches à partir du centre et réservez. Retirez les graines du reste de la tomate, puis râpez la chair en jetant la peau. Épépinez et râpez le reste des tomates de la même manière, puis mélangez la chair râpée avec l''ail. Assaisonner et verser dans un plat allant au four de 16 cm.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Placer le bloc de feta dans les tomates à l''ail, puis garnir avec les tranches de tomates, le piment, l''origan, l''huile d''olive et une pincée de sel marin. Couvrez le plat et enfournez 15 min, puis découvrez et enfournez encore 15 min. Servir chaud avec les pains pitta à part pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:06:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10580,4161,'fr','Plateau de feta grecque','Préparez ce plateau d''inspiration grecque avec de la feta, des olives, du pain pitta et des tomates pour un repas facile en milieu de semaine, puis utilisez les restes pour le déjeuner du lendemain.','["2 douleurs pitta","3 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 oignon rouge, coupé en fines tranches","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre, égouttés et rincés","2 courgettes coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur et tranchées en biais","100 g de tomates cerises sur vigne","20 g d''olives Kalamata dénoyautées et coupées en deux","100 g de feta, coupée en petits morceaux","1 citron, coupé en quartiers"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Couper ou déchirer les pains pitta en morceaux ou en triangles et disposer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Arroser d''1 cuillère à café d''huile et parsemer de la moitié de l''origan et d''un peu de poivre noir, puis mélanger. Disposez les morceaux de pitta en une seule couche et faites cuire au four pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants.","Retirez les chips pitta du plateau, puis ajoutez les quartiers d''oignons, les haricots et les courgettes. Enduisez-les du reste d''huile et d''origan, assaisonnez et faites rôtir 10 minutes.","Incorporer les tomates et les olives, puis répartir la feta sur le dessus. Rôtir encore 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres et que la feta commence à devenir dorée. Répartissez les chips de pitta sur le dessus ou sur les côtés du plateau et pressez-les sur les quartiers de citron avant de servir la moitié du plateau. Laissez le reste du plat de cuisson refroidir pour l''utiliser dans les boîtes à lunch, voir conseil ci-dessous."]','2026-01-11 00:06:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10581,7331,'fr','Tarte aux poireaux et artichauts','Préparez cette tarte d''inspiration grecque comme plat central pour une occasion spéciale. Enrobé dans une fabuleuse pâte filo, il regorge de poireaux, d''artichauts et de fromage.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 poireaux parés, lavés et coupés en fines rondelles","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","255 g de cœurs d''artichauts cuits (égouttés de l''huile), tranchés","250 g de ricotta égouttée","55 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé","1 œuf moyen","½ petit bouquet d''aneth haché","½ petit bouquet de persil haché","Paquet de 250 g de pâte filo (10-12 feuilles)","85 g de beurre fondu","½ cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle à fond épais et ajoutez les poireaux et l''oignon. Assaisonner et cuire à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que les poireaux et l''oignon soient tendres, en remuant fréquemment. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore 2 minutes. Assurez-vous que le mélange n’est pas trop « humide », sinon votre tarte sera détrempée. Si c’est le cas, augmentez le feu pour éliminer l’excès d’humidité. Ajoutez l''artichaut, puis laissez refroidir.","Mélangez la ricotta, le parmesan, l''œuf et les herbes dans un grand bol, puis versez les légumes refroidis. Assaisonner et mélanger à la fourchette.","Dégagez un grand espace sur votre plan de travail ou sur la table de votre cuisine : vous allez réaliser une pâtisserie d’un mètre de large. Prenez un morceau de filo, posez-le sur le plan de travail avec le côté long face à vous et badigeonnez-le de beurre. Mettez deux autres morceaux dessus, en badigeonnant chacun de beurre. Maintenant, faites à nouveau la même chose avec trois couches, en superposant les feuilles précédentes sur le côté gauche d''environ 3 cm. Continuez ainsi jusqu''à obtenir un mètre de feuilles de pâte beurrées qui se chevauchent.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et mettre sur une plaque à pâtisserie pour réchauffer. Versez la garniture en fine couche sur la pâte, à environ 2,5 cm du bord. Continuez jusqu''à ce que vous ayez rempli toute la longueur. Enroulez-le soigneusement, en partant du bord le plus proche de vous, jusqu''à obtenir une longue forme de saucisse. Vous devez être ferme, mais ne roulez pas trop fort sinon le filo se divisera. Il devrait vous rester quelques feuilles de filo inutilisées, alors utilisez-les pour réparer les choses, si vous en avez besoin.","En partant d''une extrémité du boudin, enroulez la pâte, puis transférez-la délicatement sur une plaque à pâtisserie (à peu près de la même taille que celle réchauffée au four).","Badigeonner la tarte de beurre, saupoudrer de graines de sésame, puis glisser la plaque à pâtisserie sur celle déjà au four (cela permet d''assurer une cuisson homogène). Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Laissez la tarte refroidir un peu avant de la déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:06:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10582,7333,'fr','Boulettes de viande d''agneau à la grecque','Préparez ces réconfortantes boulettes de viande d''agneau grecques avec des légumes grillés et des pommes de terre en seulement cinq minutes. Un favori familial garanti, parfait pour les soirs de semaine chargés','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g de boulettes d''agneau","300 g de pommes de terre nouvelles grelots, tranchées épaisses","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","185 g de légumes grillés, égouttés s''ils sont dans l''huile","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées aux herbes","2 cuillères à café de cassonade légère","100 g d''olives noires","40 g de feta émiettée","½ petit bouquet de menthe finement râpée","1 citron, zesté"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande cocotte peu profonde ou une poêle à frire à feu moyen. Ajouter les boulettes de viande et faire frire pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Réserver dans une assiette.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la même poêle et faites revenir les pommes de terre à feu moyen pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à devenir dorées.","Ajouter l''ail dans la poêle et faire revenir 1 min. Incorporer les légumes grillés, les tomates et le sucre, ainsi que les olives. Saison. Remettez les boulettes de viande dans la poêle, couvrez et faites cuire à feu moyen-doux pendant 30 à 35 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Retirez le couvercle à mi-cuisson, les pommes de terre doivent être à peine cuites avec le liquide légèrement réduit.","Retirez la casserole du feu et servez à table avec la feta, la menthe et le zeste de citron parsemés."]','2026-01-11 00:06:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10583,7335,'fr','Artichoke, aubergine & lamb moussaka','Un rôti d''agneau légèrement épicé avec des cœurs d''artichauts, un ragoût de tomates cerises et des couches d''aubergines et de pommes de terre frites','["huile d''olive, pour la friture","1kg d''agneau haché","2 gros oignons, finement hachés","3 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 boîtes de 395 g de tomates cerises au jus épais","2 feuilles de laurier","1 bâton de cannelle","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","pincée de sucre","2 aubergines moyennes","700 g de grosses pommes de terre","2 boîtes de 390 g de cœurs d''artichauts bien égouttés (voir astuce)","100g de beurre","100 g de farine nature","900 ml de lait","râpe très généreuse de muscade","125g grated Gruyère","25 g de parmesan râpé","3 œufs moyens, légèrement battus"]','["Faites chauffer 1 1/2 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une large poêle à fond épais jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude, puis faites frire l''agneau jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré, environ 10 minutes (il est important que l''huile soit chaude, sinon vous finirez par cuire l''agneau à la vapeur au lieu de le faire frire). Retirer avec une écumoire et réserver dans un grand bol. Versez tout l''huile dans la poêle sauf 2 cuillères à soupe (l''agneau en libérera un peu). Faites chauffer le tout et faites revenir les oignons à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore quelques minutes, puis ajouter les tomates, le laurier, la cannelle, l''origan, le sucre et l''assaisonnement. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu à ébullition. Remettez la viande dans la poêle, couvrez et laissez cuire 40 minutes à feu doux. Retirez le couvercle et faites cuire jusqu’à obtenir une sauce épaisse (elle ne doit pas être trop « veloutée »).","Pendant que la viande cuit, coupez les aubergines en rondelles. Coupez les pommes de terre en fines tranches. Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle et faites cuire les aubergines par lots jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées des deux côtés (prenez deux poêles à emporter si vous en avez), puis baissez le feu et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Assaisonner et retirer de la poêle. Ajoutez un peu plus d''huile et faites cuire les pommes de terre par lots, des deux côtés, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, en les retirant au fur et à mesure. Vous devrez ajouter plus d’huile dans la poêle lorsque vous ferez frire chaque lot. Assaisonner et réserver.","Faites revenir les cœurs d''artichauts dans l''huile d''olive à feu vif pour leur donner un peu de couleur, mais attention à ce qu''ils ne se désagrègent pas. Saison.","Retirez les feuilles de laurier et le bâton de cannelle de la viande et goûtez pour l''assaisonnement. Disposez la moussaka dans un plat mesurant environ 32 x 23 x 6 cm. Commencez par mettre toutes les pommes de terre au fond, puis ajoutez la moitié de la viande. Disposez dessus une couche d''aubergine, puis le reste de la viande. Déposez dessus les cœurs d''artichauts.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Pour préparer la sauce, faire fondre le beurre dans une casserole à fond épais et incorporer la farine jusqu''à ce qu''elle devienne légèrement sèche et de couleur sable. Retirez du feu et commencez à ajouter le lait petit à petit. Bien battre après chaque ajout et garder le mélange lisse. Continuez à ajouter jusqu''à ce que vous ayez épuisé tout le lait. Remettez la casserole sur feu moyen et portez à ébullition en remuant continuellement jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe pour former une sauce. Ajoutez beaucoup de muscade, du sel et du poivre. Baissez le feu et laissez cuire doucement pendant environ 5 minutes – cela aide simplement à cuire la farine dans la sauce. Ajoutez les trois quarts du fromage et remuez pour le faire fondre. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement – ​​il a besoin d''un assaisonnement affirmé. Laisser refroidir un peu, puis incorporer les œufs.","Versez-le sur les couches du plat et répartissez le reste du fromage dessus. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré et bouillonnant. Laisser refroidir environ 10 minutes – les Grecs ne le mangent jamais très chaud – puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10584,4225,'fr','Poisson rôti à la grecque','Filets de poisson blanc au four avec pommes de terre, tomates et herbes pour un dîner de semaine sain et sans gluten','["5 petites pommes de terre (environ 400 g), lavées et coupées en quartiers","1 oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché ou ½ cuillère à soupe d''origan frais haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ citron, coupé en quartiers","2 grosses tomates, coupées en quartiers","2 filets de goberge frais sans peau (environ 200g)","une petite poignée de persil haché grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez les pommes de terre, l''oignon, l''ail, l''origan et l''huile d''olive dans une rôtissoire, assaisonnez, puis mélangez avec les mains pour bien enrober le tout d''huile. Rôtir 15 min, retourner le tout et enfourner encore 15 min.","Ajouter le citron et les tomates, rôtir 10 minutes, puis garnir de filets de poisson et cuire encore 10 minutes. Servir avec du persil parsemé."]','2026-01-11 00:06:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10585,7337,'fr','d''agneau de Klefti','Scellez un gigot d''agneau dans un paquet puis faites-le rôtir longuement et lentement avec de l''ail, du citron, des herbes et des pommes de terre pour s''imprégner des délicieux jus.','["6 gousses d''ail","3 cuillères à soupe d''origan grossièrement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de romarin grossièrement haché","le zeste d''1 citron et le jus de 2","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 kg de gigot d''agneau","1 kg de pommes de terre Désirée, coupées en deux ou en quartiers","5 feuilles de laurier","250 g de yaourt grec","jus ½ citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","une poignée de menthe, râpée","1½ cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","100 g de bébés épinards","petit bouquet de persil, haché grossièrement","½ oignon rouge, finement tranché","175 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","½ concombre, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur, épépiné et tranché","75 g d''olives noires Kalamata, dénoyautées et coupées en quartiers"]','["Écrasez ensemble les gousses d''ail\r\net 1 cuillère à café de sel à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier.\r\nAjoutez les herbes, le zeste de citron, la cannelle,\r\nun peu de poivre noir, écraser un peu plus,\r\npuis incorporez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive.\r\nÀ l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, créez de nombreux trous\r\npartout sur l''agneau, et frottez-y la pâte,\r\nen l''enfonçant profondément dans les trous. Transfert\r\nl''agneau dans un grand sac de nourriture, versez-y le\r\njus de citron et laisser mariner toute la nuit.","Le lendemain, sortez l''agneau du\r\nau réfrigérateur 1h avant de vouloir le cuisiner.\r\nChauffer le four à 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 3. Poser\r\n2 longs morceaux de papier sulfurisé sur le dessus\r\nde 2 longs morceaux de papier d''aluminium – un dans le sens de la largeur,\r\nl''autre dans le sens de la longueur pour former une croix.\r\nMettez les pommes de terre au centre du\r\nparchemin et mélanger avec le reste\r\nde l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement. Apportez le\r\ncôtés du papier d''aluminium, puis versez la marinade\r\nde l''agneau sur les pommes de terre et ajoutez les feuilles de laurier. Mettez l''agneau sur\r\ndessus des pommes de terre et écraser le papier d''aluminium\r\nensemble étroitement pour enfermer complètement\r\nl''agneau. Mettre dans un plat à rôtir et rôtir\r\nau four pendant 4h30 jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très tendres.","Retirer le moule du four et augmenter\r\nla température à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nDéballez le colis et froissez le papier d''aluminium\r\net du parchemin sous le bord de la boîte,\r\narroser l''agneau avec le jus et remettre\r\nau four encore 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Retirez l''agneau du moule,\r\nenvelopper dans du papier d''aluminium et reposer. Retourner les pommes de terre\r\nrecommencer et remettre au four 30 mn,\r\npuis assaisonnez avec du sel.","Pendant que les pommes de terre cuisent, remuez\r\nensemble tous les ingrédients pour le\r\nyaourt. Mélangez le vinaigre de vin rouge, l''huile\r\net un peu d''assaisonnement pour faire une vinaigrette\r\npour la salade. Mélangez le reste\r\ningrédients de la salade, ajout de la vinaigrette\r\nquand vous êtes prêt à manger. Servir l''agneau\r\navec les pommes de terre et les jus de viande, avec\r\nla salade et le yaourt à part."]','2026-01-11 00:06:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10586,6553,'fr','Brochettes d''agneau épicées et feta avec salade de riz brun grec','Brochettes façon kofta avec feta, harissa et oignon, servies avec un riz basmati sain parfumé au persil et à la menthe','["300 g de riz basmati brun","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa","Passe de 50 g de fromage","1 gros oignon rouge, ½ tranché finement, ½ râpé","une grosse poignée de persil, haché grossièrement","une grosse poignée de menthe hachée grossièrement","85 g d''olives noires Kalamata dénoyautées, coupées en quartiers","1 concombre, coupé en dés","300 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","jus d''1 citron"]','["Faire tremper 12 brochettes de bois dans l''eau\r\npendant 30 minutes. Cuire le riz suivant le pack\r\ninstructions, puis rincer sous l''eau froide\r\net égouttez-les soigneusement.","Faites chauffer le gril. Mélangez le hachis avec le\r\nharissa, feta, oignon râpé et assaisonnement.\r\nFormer 12 formes de boudin et enfiler\r\nsur les brochettes. Poser sur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive\r\nplaque et griller pendant 6 à 8 minutes, en retournant jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien cuit et légèrement doré.","Mélangez le riz brun avec le reste\r\ningrédients et quelques assaisonnements. Servir\r\naux côtés des brochettes chaudes."]','2026-01-11 00:06:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10587,7339,'fr','Burgers d''agneau au tzatziki','Les hamburgers faits maison sont toujours gagnants : essayez cette version grecque faible en calories avec du yaourt au concombre et à la menthe et des galettes épicées.','["25g de boulgar de blé","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau extra maigre","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 gousse d''ail écrasée très finement (facultatif)","huile, pour le brossage","gros pains à burger, tranches de tomate et oignon rouge, pour servir","Morceau de concombre de 5 cm, épépiné et râpé grossièrement","Pot de 200 g de yaourt grec.","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée, plus une poignée de feuilles pour servir"]','["Versez le boulghar dans une casserole, couvrez\r\navec de l''eau et faire bouillir pendant 10 minutes. Vidanger\r\ntrès bien dans une passoire, en éliminant tout\r\nexcès d''eau.","Pour faire le tzatziki, pressez et\r\njeter le jus du concombre,\r\npuis mélangez-le au yaourt avec le\r\nmenthe hachée et un peu de sel.","Travaillez le boulghar dans l''agneau avec\r\nles épices, l''ail (si utilisé) et l''assaisonnement,\r\npuis façonnez 4 burgers. Badigeonner avec\r\nun peu d''huile et faire frire ou griller pendant environ\r\n5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement cuit\r\nà travers. Servir dans les petits pains (grillés si vous\r\ngenre) avec le tzatziki, tomates, oignon\r\net quelques feuilles de menthe."]','2026-01-11 00:06:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10588,5109,'fr','Poulet grillé avec salade grecque au quinoa','Un plat léger de filets de poulet grillés et une salade authentique aux olives de Kalamata, fromage feta, tomate et menthe','["225 g de quinoa","25g de beurre","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","400 g de mini-filets de poulet","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","300 g de tomates grappes hachées grossièrement","poignée d''olives noires Kalamata dénoyautées","1 oignon rouge, finement tranché","100 g de fromage feta émietté","petit bouquet de feuilles de menthe, hachées","jus et zeste d''un demi citron"]','["Cuire le quinoa en suivant\r\nemballer les instructions, puis rincer\r\neau froide et égouttez-les soigneusement.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le beurre,\r\nle piment et l''ail en une pâte. Lancer\r\nles filets de poulet dans 2 cuillères à café de\r\nhuile d''olive avec un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nDisposer dans une poêle bien chaude et cuire\r\npendant 3-4 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien cuit. Transférer dans une assiette, parsemer de beurre épicé\r\net laisser fondre.","Ensuite, renversez les tomates, les olives,\r\nl''oignon, la feta et la menthe dans un bol.\r\nIncorporer le quinoa cuit. Remuer\r\nà travers le reste de l''huile d''olive,\r\njus et zeste de citron et assaisonner\r\neh bien. Servir avec le poulet\r\nfilets sur le dessus, arrosés de tout\r\njus de poulet au beurre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10589,7341,'fr','Agneau grec et macaroni au four','Un croisement entre la moussaka et le macaroni au fromage, ces pâtes méditerranéennes économiques constituent un repas copieux','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau maigre","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cube de bouillon de boeuf ou d''agneau","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe d''origan séché","400 g de macaronis","Pot de 250 g de ricotta","50 g de parmesan râpé","50 ml de lait","pain à l''ail, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez le\r\nl''oignon et cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.\r\nAjouter l''ail et cuire encore 1 min,\r\npuis versez le hachis d''agneau, montez le\r\nchauffer et faire dorer, en brisant le hachis\r\navec une cuillère en bois.","Une fois l''agneau doré, ajoutez\r\nla cannelle, le cube de bouillon émietté,\r\ntomates et origan. Remuez bien et\r\nlaisser mijoter 15 min à couvert, puis pendant\r\n15 minutes, à découvert, jusqu''à ce que la sauce\r\na épaissi et les tomates ont\r\ncuit.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les macaronis\r\nen suivant les instructions de l''emballage. Bien égoutter.\r\nChauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Mélangez la ricotta, la majeure partie\r\nDu parmesan et du lait avec beaucoup de\r\nassaisonner et incorporer aux macaronis.\r\nVersez le hachis dans un grand plat allant au four, dessus\r\navec le mélange de macaronis et parsemer\r\nsur le parmesan restant. Cuire au four pour\r\n30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bouillonnants. Servir\r\nchaud avec du pain à l''ail, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10590,7343,'fr','Agneau grec avec pommes de terre et olives','Recevoir en toute simplicité avec ce plat rustique rapide à préparer – il suffit de le servir avec du pain croustillant.','["800 g de pommes de terre de taille moyenne, avec la peau, tranchées finement","4 grosses tomates, tranchées finement","1 aubergine, tranchée finement","4 gousses d''ail, hachées","3 cuillères à soupe de feuilles d''origan, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","85 g d''olives Kalamata dénoyautées, coupées en deux","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un filet","100 g de fromage feta émietté","4 steaks d''agneau"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nSuperposez la moitié de la pomme de terre, de la tomate et\r\naubergine dans un plat allant au four, parsemée\r\navec de l''ail, de l''origan et des olives, et\r\narroser d''huile et assaisonner au fur et à mesure.","Répartissez sur la feta, puis répétez l''opération.\r\ncouches jusqu''à ce que tous les ingrédients soient utilisés\r\nvers le haut. Terminez avec des pommes de terre et un peu d''huile.","Cuire au four pendant 50 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient\r\ntendres (couvrir de papier d’aluminium s’ils deviennent tendres)\r\ntrop marron). Garnir avec les steaks d''agneau,\r\nfrotter avec un peu plus d''huile et\r\nassaisonnement. Cuire au four encore 15 à 20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit cuit. Laisser reposer\r\net laisser refroidir un peu avant de parsemer de\r\norigan et servir avec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:06:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10591,7345,'fr','Lucknowi masala paneer pulao','Faites mariner le paneer avec de l''ail et du piment pour obtenir un pulao aromatique aux épices entières – une recette facile idéale pour nourrir une foule à Diwali','["80 ml d''huile végétale, plus 3 cuillères à soupe","2 oignons moyens, hachés","4 grosses gousses d''ail , hachées grossièrement","Morceau de gingembre de 2 pouces, haché grossièrement","400 g de paner coupé en cubes","2 piments verts piqués, fendus dans le sens de la longueur","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","5 gousses de cardamome verte","2 feuilles de laurier séchées","1 bâton de cannelle","1 cuillère à café de poudre de curcuma","250 g de riz basmati","20 g de beurre fondu","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","1 citron vert, jus","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de coriandre finement hachées","raita, servir","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de gramme","1½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","½ cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à soupe de kasoori methi séché (feuilles de fenugrec)"]','["Faites chauffer 80 ml d''huile végétale dans une poêle à feu doux et faites revenir les oignons pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Retirer de la poêle à l''aide d''une écumoire, égoutter sur du papier absorbant et réserver.","Broyer l''ail et le gingembre en une pâte lisse avec un peu d''eau à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier.","Mettez tous les ingrédients de la marinade dans un bol à mélanger avec la moitié de la pâte d''ail et de gingembre. Bien mélanger et ajouter les cubes de paneer en remuant pour bien enrober. Laisser mariner 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, faites chauffer 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile à feu moyen. Ajoutez les piments verts, les graines de cumin, la cardamome, les feuilles de laurier et la cannelle, puis faites revenir quelques secondes. Incorporez le reste de la pâte d''ail et de gingembre, faites revenir 1 min et ajoutez le curcuma, la moitié des oignons frits et le riz basmati. Bien mélanger et assaisonner au goût. Versez 500 ml d''eau, portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter à feu doux avec un couvercle pendant 17 à 18 minutes. Éteignez le feu et laissez reposer avec le couvercle pendant 15 minutes.","Disposez les cubes de paneer sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée. Chauffer le gril à feu moyen-vif et cuire le paneer pendant 3 à 4 minutes, puis mélanger avec le beurre fondu et poursuivre la cuisson encore 4 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et légèrement carbonisé.","Ajoutez le paner grillé au riz et remuez bien. Garnir du reste des oignons frits, du garam masala, du jus de citron vert et de la coriandre. Servir avec de la raita, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10592,7347,'fr','Rasmalai','Savourez ce dessert indien crémeux à base de lait, de safran, de cardamome, de pistaches et d''amandes. C''est un plat fabuleux à servir à la fin d''un festin indien','["1,5 litre de lait","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre blanc","700 ml de lait","pincée de brins de safran","20 g d''amandes effilées","20 g de pistaches décortiquées et concassées","½ cuillère à café de cardamome moulue","100 g de sucre en poudre","200 g de sucre en poudre","4 gousses de cardamome verte","20 g de pistaches finement hachées","20 g d''amandes finement hachées"]','["Mettez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau dans une casserole (cela évitera que le lait ne brûle), puis versez le lait et portez à ébullition sur feu moyen. Le lait va mousser ; continuez à mélanger le film qu’il crée sur le dessus et sur les côtés. Lorsqu''il arrive à ébullition, éteignez le feu.","Mélangez 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans le vinaigre, puis ajoutez-le au lait en remuant doucement entre chaque. Laisser reposer 10 minutes, sans déranger, pour que le vinaigre commence à cailler le lait (cela donnera de plus gros morceaux de lait caillé). Si vous ne voyez pas le mélange se séparer, remettez sur feu doux pendant encore 5 minutes.","Tapisser une grande passoire de gaze, de mousseline ou d''un torchon propre et y verser le lait caillé. Une fois que tout le lactosérum est filtré et qu''il ne reste plus que le lait caillé, rincez le caillé sous l''eau froide pour éliminer tout arôme de vinaigre. Laisser égoutter.","Lorsque la majeure partie de l''eau s''est écoulée à travers le caillé, soulevez le chiffon et essorez-le jusqu''à ce que vous ayez éliminé la majeure partie de l''humidité. Attachez le chiffon sur votre robinet et laissez-le pendre pour qu''il s''écoule complètement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le rabidi. Versez le lait dans une casserole et portez à ébullition sur feu moyen. Réduisez le feu, remuez et ajoutez le safran, les amandes, les pistaches et la cardamome. Continuez à remuer doucement et, une fois que le lait commence à bouillonner, ajoutez le sucre. Cuire encore 5 minutes environ jusqu''à ébullition. Retirer du feu et réserver.","À ce stade, le lait caillé doit être complètement vidé de l''excès d''humidité. Retirez-le de l''étamine et versez-le sur une surface de travail propre. Cassez-le en petites miettes et, en utilisant le talon de votre main, pétrissez le caillé comme vous le feriez pour du pain pendant environ 7 à 8 minutes pour le rassembler, en veillant à ne pas trop le travailler.","Pour façonner le rasmalai, étalez le lait caillé en forme de bûche et divisez-le en 10 à 14 morceaux de taille égale. Roulez chaque morceau entre la paume de votre main jusqu''à obtenir une boule lisse et sans fissures. Aplatissez délicatement chaque boule (ne vous inquiétez pas s''il y a quelques fissures sur le bord une fois aplatie).","Pour faire le sirop de sucre, mettez le sucre, la cardamome et 950 ml d''eau dans une grande casserole profonde à feu moyen-vif et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit fondu. Augmentez le feu et portez à ébullition, puis retirez les gousses de cardamome et déposez délicatement le rasmalai. Couvrez avec un couvercle et laissez cuire 10 minutes, puis réduisez le feu à moyen-vif et laissez cuire encore 2-3 minutes. Retirez la casserole du feu, retirez le couvercle et laissez refroidir complètement le rasmalai dans le sirop.","Réchauffez légèrement le rabdi, puis versez-le dans un bol. Sortez les rasmalai cuits du sirop de sucre et pressez-les délicatement entre les paumes de vos mains pour égoutter le sirop de sucre, en prenant soin de ne pas les casser. Ajoutez le rasmalai au rabdi chaud, puis couvrez et laissez reposer dans le lait à température ambiante pendant 5 à 6 heures avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10593,7349,'fr','Chat au poulet','Préparez un plat indien facile avec du poulet, des légumes et des épices. Servir dans le cadre d''une plus grande tartinade ou déguster seul comme plat principal','["2 cuillères à soupe de ghee ou d''huile végétale","4 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en bouchées","1 oignon , finement haché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 piments verts , finement hachés","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tamarin","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","2 cuillères à café de chaat masala","1 grosse tomate, hachée finement","¼ de concombre , haché finement","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée","1 oignon nouveau, émincé finement","quartiers de citron, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans un grand wok ou une poêle à feu vif. Ajouter le poulet et cuire 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré. Il n’est pas nécessaire qu’il soit cuit à ce stade. Retirer dans une assiette à l''aide d''une écumoire et réserver.","Versez le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et faites chauffer à feu moyen. Incorporer l''oignon et faire revenir pendant 2-3 minutes, puis incorporer l''ail et les piments. Cuire encore 7 à 9 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient ramollis et translucides. Remettez le poulet dans la poêle, avec la pâte de tamarin, le garam masala et le chaat masala. Assaisonner et bien mélanger pour bien enrober. Couvrir et cuire 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit.","Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir 2 minutes avant d''incorporer la tomate et le concombre. Garnir de coriandre et d''oignon nouveau et servir avec des quartiers de citron à côté pour les presser."]','2026-01-11 00:06:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10594,7351,'fr','Chargha de poulet Kadhai','Savourez cette recette facile de chargha au poulet kadhai, composée de poulet tendre mariné cuit avec des épices réchauffantes et servi avec une raita à la menthe rafraîchissante.','["6-8 gousses d''ail","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","¼ cuillère à café de garam masala","700 g de poulet avec os, sans peau, coupé en morceaux moyens","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2-3 piments rouges du Cachemire séchés","Morceau de 1½ pouce de gingembre grossièrement râpé","1 piment rouge , tranché finement","coriandre, pour garnir","naans, pour servir","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","200 g de yaourt nature","40 g de feuilles de menthe","10 g de feuilles de coriandre","1 gousse d''ail"]','["Ajoutez l''ail et 1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt dans un mélangeur et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Versez la pâte dans un bol avec la poudre de piment, la coriandre moulue, le curcuma moulu, le garam masala et une pincée de sel et mélangez. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt restante et le poulet et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit enrobé. Laissez mariner le poulet au réfrigérateur pendant 2 à 3 heures ou de préférence toute la nuit.","Dans un wok ou une poêle, faites chauffer l''huile végétale à feu moyen. Ajoutez les graines de cumin et les piments séchés et laissez-les grésiller et parfumer l''huile pendant 10 secondes. Versez les morceaux de poulet marinés et faites frire pendant 5 à 7 minutes en remuant continuellement. Baissez le feu et laissez cuire encore 20 minutes avec un couvercle pour aider à créer de la vapeur dans le wok.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la raita. Ajoutez les graines de cumin et 1/2 cuillère à café de poivre noir dans un pilon et un mortier et réduisez-les en poudre fine. Ajoutez maintenant 2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt avec les autres ingrédients dans un mélangeur et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Versez dans un bol de service et mélangez avec le reste du yaourt. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir.","Une fois que le poulet est bien cuit et tendre, ajoutez le gingembre grossier et les piments tranchés et saupoudrez de coriandre. Bien mélanger et servir chaud avec la raita à la menthe et le naan."]','2026-01-11 00:06:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10595,7353,'fr','Planche de bhaji à l''oignon','Dégustez cette planche à partager en famille et entre amis, avec un mélange de bhajis à l''oignon, de chutney vert, de raita de concombre, de salade de grenade et de mini poppadoms.','["2 oignons , tranchés","1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin","100g de farine","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique, sans gluten si besoin","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 piment vert , finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","huile végétale, pour la friture","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","un petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement","1 cuillère à café de cumin","1 cuillère à café de sucre","1 piment vert , haché","1 citron, jus","½ concombre , râpé grossièrement","150g de yaourt nature","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe finement hachée","4 cuillères à soupe de graines de grenade","½ concombre , coupé en dés","2 tomates grappes d''hiver ou de saison, hachées (facultatif)","1 petit oignon rouge , finement haché","une poignée de coriandre hachée","½ citron, jus","mini poppadoms","chutney sucré (nous avons utilisé de la mangue)","cornichon au citron vert"]','["Mélanger les oignons dans un bol avec le sel et laisser reposer 5 minutes. Pendant ce temps, fouettez la farine, la levure chimique et les épices dans un autre bol. Ajoutez 100 ml d''eau pour obtenir une pâte épaisse. Incorporer les oignons, le piment et la coriandre.","Versez l’huile végétale dans une casserole profonde, en vous assurant qu’elle n’est pas pleine à plus d’un tiers. Chauffer à 180 °C ou jusqu''à ce qu''un morceau d''oignon grésille lorsqu''on y tombe et dore dans les 20 secondes. Incorporez quelques cuillères à soupe du mélange à la fois et faites frire pendant 3 à 4 minutes, puis retournez à l''aide d''une araignée et laissez cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et assaisonner. Gardez au chaud à four doux pendant que vous continuez la cuisson ou réchauffez plus tard dans une friteuse à air.","Mixez les ingrédients du chutney vert avec une pincée de sel et un peu d''eau dans un petit mixeur jusqu''à consistance lisse. Transférer dans un petit bol de service.","Mélangez les ingrédients de la raita dans un autre bol et assaisonnez. Mélanger les ingrédients de la salade dans un troisième bol. 5 Servez les bhajis au milieu d''un grand plat ou d''une planche de service avec les bols de chutney vert, de salade et de raita, ainsi que des extras comme des mini poppadoms, du chutney de mangue et des cornichons au citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:06:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10596,7355,'fr','Biryani d''agneau sur la cuisinière','Préparez un plat qui rassemble les gens avec un biriyani classique. Il est idéal comme pièce maîtresse d''un festin lorsque vous recevez votre famille et vos amis pour un dîner.','["5 gousses de cardamome verte","5 clous de girofle","bâton de cannelle de 2 cm","450 g de croupe d''agneau coupée en cubes de 2 cm","250 g de tomates hachées grossièrement","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","1 gros oignon , haché grossièrement","3 gousses d''ail , hachées grossièrement","10 g de gingembre pelé et haché grossièrement","1 piment vert épépiné et haché grossièrement","une petite poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement","2½ cuillères à café de ghee","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","200 g de riz basmati","3 gousses de cardamome verte","Feuille de pandan de 2 cm (facultatif)","75 g de noix de cajou crues","2 brins de feuilles de curry, feuilles cueillies","4 œufs froids au réfrigérateur"]','["Versez les gousses de cardamome, les clous de girofle et la cannelle dans une petite poêle à feu moyen et faites-les griller pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées. Réduire en poudre grossière à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier, en jetant les coques de cardamome. Mettez l''agneau dans un grand bol avec les tomates, le yaourt et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel marin fin. Ajoutez les épices concassées et mélangez bien. Laisser mariner au moins 2 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Pour le biryani, mixez la moitié de l''oignon avec l''ail, le gingembre, le piment et la coriandre dans un petit robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement hachés. Annuler. Faites fondre 11/2 cuillère à café de ghee dans une casserole à couvercle profond à feu moyen et faites cuire les oignons restants pendant 7 à 9 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et que les bords soient dorés. Ajoutez la poudre de piment, le curcuma, le mélange d''oignons blitzés et une pincée de sel. Remuez bien, puis ajoutez l''agneau et les restes de marinade. Bien mélanger, couvrir avec le couvercle, baisser le feu et laisser mijoter 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition une casserole de 300 ml d’eau. Ajoutez le riz, les gousses de cardamome et la feuille de pandan, le cas échéant, et faites bouillir pendant 4 à 5 minutes. Égouttez et retirez les gousses de cardamome et la feuille de pandan. Annuler.","Faites fondre le ghee restant dans une petite poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites frire les noix de cajou pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Versez dans un petit bol et réservez. Ajouter les feuilles de curry dans la poêle et cuire une minute, puis réserver avec les noix de cajou.","Découvrez l''agneau. Répartir sur le riz, les noix de cajou et les feuilles de curry. Couvrir à nouveau et cuire à feu doux pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et mousseux.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition une petite casserole d’eau, déposez-y délicatement les œufs et laissez cuire 6 à 7 minutes. Bien égoutter, peler puis couper en deux. Incorporer le riz, les noix de cajou et les feuilles de curry à la viande, puis verser sur un plat de service et servir avec les œufs durs dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:06:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10597,7357,'fr','King kebab au poulet tandoori avec biryani au curcuma et aux haricots verts','Préparez une version maison d''un plat à emporter préféré en utilisant des cuisses de poulet économiques, en les transformant en un grand kebab tandoori à partager','["3 cuillères à soupe de pâte tandoori","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature","petit bouquet de coriandre","600 g de filets de cuisse de poulet désossés Morrisons","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","25g de beurre","1 oignon , finement tranché","300 g de riz basmati trempé 30 min dans l''eau froide puis égoutté","3 gousses de cardamome légèrement écrasées","1 bâton de cannelle","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","750 ml de bouillon de poulet","200 g de haricots verts parés","2 citrons , coupés en joues"]','["Mélangez la pâte tandoori et le yaourt dans un grand bol. Hachez finement la moitié de la coriandre et remuez-la, puis ajoutez le poulet et mélangez pour enrober. Couvrir et réserver. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à une journée.","Faites chauffer l''huile et le beurre dans une casserole moyenne à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et doré. Ajoutez le riz, puis incorporez la cardamome, la cannelle et le curcuma et assaisonnez de sel.","Versez dessus le bouillon de volaille, parsemez de haricots verts et portez à ébullition. Couvrez avec un couvercle, puis réduisez le feu à doux et laissez cuire 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, alignez les cuisses de poulet sur une planche avec les côtés les plus longs les uns contre les autres, en repliant chaque cuisse pour lui donner une forme oblongue soignée. Poussez deux longues brochettes en métal parallèlement à travers la ligne de filets pour qu''elles soient maintenues ensemble et formez une grande brochette. (Si vous n’avez pas de longues brochettes, vous pouvez en utiliser des plus courtes et faire deux brochettes distinctes.)","Chauffez le gril à feu vif et faites griller le kebab pendant 20 minutes, en le retournant de temps en temps pour vous assurer qu''il dore uniformément. (Ou faites-le dans une poêle chaude.) Vérifiez que le poulet est bien cuit en regardant les espaces où les cuisses reposent les unes contre les autres – s''il est encore cru, continuez la cuisson en vérifiant toutes les quelques minutes, puis enfoncez un couteau dans la partie la plus grasse pour vous assurer que le jus est clair. Verser le biryani sur un plat de service et garnir de kebab. Hachez le reste de coriandre et répartissez-le dessus, puis servez avec les joues de citron à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:06:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10598,7359,'fr','Tarte jalfrezi aux champignons','Laissez-vous inspirer par le curry indien classique et préparez cette tarte pleine de saveurs, rendue très spéciale en incorporant des épices à la pâtisserie. C''est sûr de plaire à une foule','["1 kg de champignons , tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","1 oignon , tranché","1 poivron rouge, haché","3 gousses d''ail écrasées ou finement râpées","1-2 piments verts, finement hachés (épépinés, si vous le souhaitez)","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","120g d''épinards","200 g de farine nature + un peu pour saupoudrer","100 g de farine complète nature (ou utilisez plus de farine nature)","150 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de carvi","1 jaune d''œuf ou ½ cuillère à soupe de lait végétal (si vous utilisez du jaune d''œuf, congelez le blanc pour l''utiliser dans une autre recette), plus un peu pour le badigeonnage"]','["Pour la pâte, mettre les farines et le beurre dans un robot culinaire. Mixez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine (vous pouvez également les frotter ensemble avec vos doigts). Ajoutez les graines de carvi et mélangez par impulsions. Ajoutez le jaune d''œuf ou le lait végétal et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle. Si nécessaire, ajoutez plus de lait végétal ou d''eau, ½ cuillère à café à la fois, juste pour rassembler la pâte. Mettre au frais 20 min.","Versez les champignons dans une grande poêle. Cuire à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le liquide soit libéré et évaporé, environ 15 minutes. Arroser d''huile, puis ajouter les oignons et les poivrons. Faites frire pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les champignons soient dorés et que les légumes aient ramolli.","Incorporer l''ail et les piments et cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Ajoutez les épices, remuez et laissez cuire 1 min avant d''ajouter les tomates et une demi-boîte d''eau. Remuer, puis cuire 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement léger, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire pour le détendre. Ajouter les épinards et cuire quelques minutes pour les faire flétrir.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Verser le mélange dans un plat à tarte. Étalez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à ce qu''elle ait ½ cm d''épaisseur et soit suffisamment grande pour recouvrir le plat. Posez-le dessus et sertissez les bords pour sceller. Percez quelques trous sur le dessus pour que la vapeur s''échappe, puis badigeonnez-la de jaune d''œuf ou de lait végétal. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:06:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10599,7361,'fr','Hara Bhara Kabab','Savourez ces galettes végétaliennes qui sont une collation populaire en Inde du Nord, avec une teinte verte provenant des épinards. Servir avec votre chutney préféré – nous avons opté pour la mangue','["500 g de pommes de terre Maris Piper, coupées en quartiers","130 ml d''huile de tournesol","2 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","50 g de chou frisé finement haché","50 g d''épinards finement hachés","50 g de petits pois surgelés","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café d''amchur (poudre de mangue)","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","chutney, pour servir"]','["Versez les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau froide. Salez bien et portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Bien égoutter et laisser refroidir.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et ajoutez les gousses d''ail. Après quelques secondes, ajoutez le chou frisé, couvrez et réduisez le feu à doux pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez les épinards et les petits pois, couvrez et laissez cuire à feu doux encore 5 minutes. Retirer du feu et verser dans un robot culinaire. Blitz jusqu''à obtenir une pâte grossière.","Versez la pâte dans un bol avec les pommes de terre bouillies, les épices, la maïzena et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Bien écraser et diviser en 12 boules légèrement aplaties.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle et faites cuire les brochettes 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Servir avec un chutney de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:06:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10600,7363,'fr','Dhal de noix de coco au four avec chou-fleur et paneer épicés','Laissez le four faire le travail dans ce dhal à la noix de coco, au chou-fleur et au paneer, où le curcuma donne une belle couleur dorée. Dégustez avec nos oignons marinés maison','["1 gros oignon rouge, haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","2 boîtes de 400 g de lait de coco","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de purée d''ail (environ 6 gousses d''ail)","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry (nous avons utilisé de la pâte de korma)","2 cuillères à café de curcuma moulu","2 cuillères à café de graines de nigelle","100 g de lentilles rouges","150 g de chana dhal ou pois cassés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 citron, jus","½ gros chou-fleur (environ 500 g), cassé en fleurons, tiges et feuilles grossièrement hachées","225 g de paner coupé en cubes","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et émincé","1 piment vert , finement tranché","une petite poignée de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faire revenir les oignons dans un grand plat à rôtir avec l''huile. Rôtir pendant 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Versez 3 cuillères à soupe de crème de coco sur le lait de coco et réservez. Incorporer le gingembre, l''ail, 1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry, 1 cuillère à café de curcuma, les graines de nigelle, les lentilles, le chana dhal, les tomates et le reste du lait de coco aux oignons. Remplissez la boîte vide avec 400 ml d''eau, faites-la tourner et versez-la dans le plat à rôtir. Assaisonner et bien mélanger, puis envelopper la plaque dans du papier aluminium et remettre au four pour cuire 50 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le reste de la pâte de curry et le curcuma à la crème de coco réservée. Ajoutez un filet de citron et assaisonnez, puis mélangez le chou-fleur et le paner jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien enrobés.","Déballez le dhal, remuez et ajoutez un peu d’eau s’il semble trop sec. Répartissez dessus les morceaux de chou-fleur et de paneer et remettez au four 40 minutes à découvert. Pendant ce temps, mélangez l''oignon rouge et le piment tranché avec un filet de jus de citron et une pincée de sel. Réserver pour mariner.","Lorsque le dhal est cuit, les lentilles doivent être tendres et le chou-fleur et le paner doivent être carbonisés. Laisser reposer 10 minutes, puis servir avec l''oignon mariné et le piment, parsemé de feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10601,7365,'fr','Saag de haricots beurre','Savourez cette version du saag, remplie d''épinards et d''épices. C''est parfait comme accompagnement dans un festin indien ou comme plat seul servi avec des chapatis.','["25 g de ghee ou de beurre","1 oignon , finement haché","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","20 g de gingembre râpé","3 gousses d''ail, râpées","1 piment vert (épépiné si vous préférez moins de piquant), haché finement","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de feuilles de fenugrec séchées (facultatif)","400 g d''épinards surgelés","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre, égouttés et rincés","½ citron, jus","chapatis et chutney de mangue, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer le ghee ou le beurre dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif. Incorporer l''oignon et les graines de moutarde et faire revenir pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés et que les graines de moutarde éclatent. Incorporer le gingembre, l''ail, le piment vert et la purée de tomates. Cuire pendant 4 à 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé et caramélisé.","Incorporer le reste des épices, les feuilles de fenugrec, le cas échéant, et les épinards surgelés avec un peu d''eau. Laisser mijoter 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient complètement décongelés et que le liquide ait épaissi et réduit. Incorporer les haricots et le jus de citron, puis assaisonner au goût. Servir avec des chapatis et un chutney de mangue."]','2026-01-11 00:06:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10602,7367,'fr','Rasgulla','Préparez ce dessert indien traditionnel à partir de fromage cottage fait maison roulé en boules, puis imbibé de sirop parfumé à la rose : le résultat est sucré, spongieux et léger.','["2 litres de lait entier","2-3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre distillé","fils de safran ou pistaches hachées, pour servir","200g de sucre semoule","4 gousses de cardamome","1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait d''eau de rose (ou au goût, selon la marque)"]','["Tapisser un grand tamis à mailles fines d''un linge en mousseline et placer sur un grand bol. Portez le lait à ébullition dans une grande casserole à feu moyen en remuant pour éviter qu''il ne colle ou ne brûle. Ajoutez lentement 2-3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre en remuant jusqu''à ce que le lait ait caillé. Retirer immédiatement du feu et laisser reposer jusqu''à ce que les solides du lait se soient séparés du lactosérum. Filtrez le mélange à l''aide du tamis préparé, puis rincez les solides du lait dans le chiffon sous l''eau froide courante (cela éliminera tout arôme persistant de vinaigre). Rassemblez les bords du chiffon pour enfermer les solides du lait et pressez doucement pour éliminer l''excès de liquide. Faites un nœud dans le tissu, accrochez-le au-dessus du robinet de l''évier et laissez filtrer 1 heure.","Versez les solides du lait égoutté dans un bol et pétrissez doucement jusqu''à ce qu''ils forment une pâte molle, environ 5 minutes. Faites attention à ne pas trop pétrir, sinon cela pourrait devenir dur. Roulez une petite partie de la pâte en une boule lisse à l''aide de vos paumes (la boule doit mesurer environ 2-3 cm et environ 25 g). Répétez avec le reste de la pâte.","Pour faire le sirop, mettez dans une casserole le sucre, 1 litre d''eau, les gousses de cardamome et juste ce qu''il faut d''extrait d''eau de rose pour donner un léger goût floral, sans être trop fort (vous n''aurez peut-être pas besoin de la pleine cuillère à soupe). Chauffer à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous, puis porter à ébullition et cuire environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe et donne un sirop collant.","Ajoutez délicatement les boules de pâte au sirop, puis couvrez avec un couvercle et laissez cuire encore 10 min jusqu''à ce que les rasgullas aient doublé de volume. Retirer dans une assiette à l''aide d''une écumoire et laisser refroidir complètement, puis saupoudrer de fils de safran ou de pistaches hachées. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris et froid, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10603,7369,'fr','Gobi Mandchourien','Offrez à vos amis ou à votre famille cette entrée indochinoise populaire où des fleurons de chou-fleur croustillants sont mélangés à une sauce piquante aigre-douce.','["1 chou-fleur , coupé en bouquets","huile neutre comme celle de tournesol ou végétale, pour la friture","2 gousses d''ail , hachées","1 piment vert , haché","1 oignon rouge, coupé en dés","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement, plus un peu pour servir","½ poivron rouge, coupé en dés","½ poivron vert, coupé en dés","2 cuillères à soupe de ketchup","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à soupe de poivre noir moulu","100 g de farine nature","20g de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire"]','["Faites cuire les fleurons de chou-fleur dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 8 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, puis égouttez-les dans une passoire et réservez.","Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la pâte dans un grand bol avec 1 cuillère à café de sel, puis versez lentement 200 ml d''eau, en remuant tout le temps pour obtenir une pâte lisse suffisamment épaisse pour enrober le chou-fleur.","Déposez les fleurons dans la pâte et remuez doucement pour les enrober. Versez suffisamment d''huile dans une grande casserole pour remplir la poêle à moitié puis mettez sur feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne 180°C, soit un cube de pain déposé dans les bruns en 30 secondes. Faites frire les fleurons de chou-fleur par lots pendant environ 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants, puis laissez-les égoutter dans une passoire.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un grand wok à feu doux, puis ajoutez l''ail, le piment haché, l''oignon rouge, la ciboule, les poivrons rouges et verts et faites cuire en remuant pendant 2 minutes.","Incorporer le ketchup, la sauce chili, la sauce soja, le vinaigre de riz, les flocons de piment, le poivre noir et 1 cuillère à café de sel et de poivre et faire chauffer pendant 1 min. Mélanger les fleurons frits dans la sauce pour les enrober. Servir dans un bol, parsemé d''oignons nouveaux hachés, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10604,7371,'fr','Dum aussi','Évitez la viande avec ce curry de pommes de terre indien. Aromatique et plein de saveur, il peut servir de plat d''accompagnement ou de plat principal végétarien avec vos accompagnements préférés.','["500 g de pommes de terre grenailles pelées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","1 oignon , finement haché","3 gousses de cardamome","3 feuilles de laurier","2 bâtons de cannelle","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de graines de kalonji (graines de nigelle), plus un peu pour servir","1 tomate moyenne, hachée","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gingembre et d''ail","1 cuillère à café de fenugrec","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de pois chiches (farine de pois chiches)","250 g de yaourt grec","coriandre hachée, garam masala et noix de cajou, pour servir"]','["Mettez les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau salée, portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste tendres. Égoutter et réserver.","Versez un filet d''huile dans la poêle et faites revenir les pommes de terre pendant 3 à 4 minutes à feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement dorées. Retirer de la poêle et réserver.","Incorporer l''oignon, les gousses de cardamome, le laurier, le bâton de cannelle, les graines de cumin et les graines de kalonji (nigelle). Faire frire pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Incorporer la tomate hachée, la pâte de gingembre et d''ail, le fenugrec, la poudre de piment, le curcuma, la coriandre moulue et le cumin. Cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que la tomate ramollisse.","Mélangez la farine de pois chiches et le yaourt grec jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez-les au mélange masala. Versez 100 ml d''eau, laissez mijoter 1 min, puis incorporez les pommes de terre pour les enrober de sauce masala. Couvrir et cuire à la vapeur 8 à 10 minutes à feu doux. Saupoudrer de graines de kalonji, de coriandre hachée, de garam masala et de noix de cajou pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10605,7373,'fr','Nom','Préparez une version végétalienne du naan à déguster avec vos plats indiens sans viande préférés en utilisant un bloc sans produits laitiers à base de plantes au lieu du ghee.','["Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour le bol","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","500 g de farine nature + un peu pour saupoudrer","50g de bloc de beurre végétal salé vegan","4 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée"]','["Mélangez la levure, le sucre, l''huile et 300 ml d''eau tiède dans un pichet. Mélangez la levure chimique, la farine et 1 cuillère à café de sel marin fin dans un grand bol, faites un puits au centre et versez le mélange de levure. Bien mélanger, puis démouler sur une surface légèrement farinée. Pétrir pendant 5 à 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit élastique et lisse. Transférer dans un bol légèrement huilé, couvrir d''un torchon et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 45 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail propre et remuez-la plusieurs fois. Divisez-le en huit ou 10 morceaux (environ 75 g chacun) et roulez en boules. Couvrir et laisser lever 30 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il double à nouveau de volume.","Faites chauffer une poêle sèche en fonte ou à fond épais à feu moyen-vif. Abaisser une boule de pâte à la fois en forme ovale sur une surface légèrement farinée, en laissant le reste couvert. Badigeonner légèrement le dessus avec de l''eau et mettre dans la poêle chaude, côté humidifié vers le bas. Badigeonner l''autre côté d''eau et cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé et cloqué. Retourner et cuire de l''autre côté, puis envelopper dans un torchon pour garder au chaud. Répétez avec les boules de pâte restantes.","Mélangez le beurre végétal et l''ail dans une petite casserole et faites chauffer à feu doux pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu et que l''ail soit grésillant, brun clair et parfumé. Retirer du feu et incorporer la coriandre. Badigeonnez-en les naans chauds et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10606,7375,'fr','Dhansk au poulet','Faites aller le poulet plus loin avec ce curry Parsi où les lentilles créent une texture copieuse et crémeuse. Il a également des notes aigre-douces','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile au goût neutre (comme le colza) ou de ghee","1 gros oignon , finement haché","1 bâton de cannelle","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ courge musquée, pelée et coupée en cubes","1 cuillère à café d''ail finement haché","400 g de blanc ou de cuisse de poulet coupé en cubes","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 150 g de lentilles rouges égouttées et rincées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1-2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tamarin, ou au goût","1 cuillère à café de feuilles de fenugrec séchées","un filet de jus de citron, pour servir","une poignée de coriandre hachée, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile ou le ghee dans une grande poêle à fond épais à feu moyen et faites cuire les oignons et le bâton de cannelle pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons commencent à dorer. Ajoutez les graines de cumin et mélangez bien.","Versez la courge et poursuivez la cuisson encore quelques minutes, puis ajoutez l''ail et laissez cuire 1 min. Incorporer le poulet et faire dorer pendant quelques minutes, puis ajouter le curcuma, la coriandre moulue, la poudre de piment et la purée de tomates, en remuant pour enrober le poulet d''épices.","Ajoutez les lentilles et les tomates en conserve, en versant deux fois la boîte de tomates avec de l''eau et en l''ajoutant également. Assaisonner avec du sel au goût et porter à ébullition.","Ajoutez le tamarin au goût, émiettez-le dans les feuilles de fenugrec et mélangez. Couvrir et laisser cuire encore 20 minutes en remuant à mi-cuisson.","Découvrez et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le curry ait réduit à la consistance désirée – plus il cuit longtemps, plus il deviendra épais, à mesure que les lentilles se décomposeront dans la sauce. Pressez un peu de jus de citron et saupoudrez de coriandre fraîche pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10607,7377,'fr','Poulet de Mandchourie','Savourez ce populaire plat de poulet frit peu profond Hakka (indochinois) avec un peu de piment et un peu de douceur','["1 blanc d''oeuf (conserver le jaune pour une autre recette)","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","350 g de cuisses de poulet désossées, coupées en lanières","huile neutre, pour friture peu profonde","nouilles aux œufs cuites, pour servir (facultatif)","6 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile neutre","2 cuillères à café de gingembre râpé","2 gousses d''ail , hachées finement ou écrasées","3 oignons nouveaux, hachés","2 cuillères à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce chili sucrée ou à l''ail (ajoutez ½ cuillère à café de sucre si votre sauce chili n''est pas sucrée)","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs"]','["Mélangez le blanc d''œuf avec la sauce soja et la maïzena dans un grand bol. Ajouter le poulet et bien mélanger pour bien l''enrober.","Mélangez tous les ingrédients de l''enrobage avec ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un bol et réservez.","Préparez la sauce en faisant chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et en faisant revenir le gingembre, l''ail et la plupart des oignons nouveaux (en garder un peu pour servir) à feu moyen pendant 1 min. Incorporer le ketchup, la sauce soja et la sauce chili ainsi que 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et cuire 1 min. Incorporez la maïzena dans 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau froide pour obtenir une pâte et ajoutez-la à la sauce. Baissez le feu et laissez cuire environ une minute – la sauce devrait immédiatement épaissir. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Mettez quelques cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle peu profonde à feu moyen. Trempez les morceaux de poulet, en secouant tout excès de marinade, dans le bol d''enrobage et mélangez pour enrober. Secouez l''excédent de farine et plongez le poulet dans l''huile chaude. Répétez cette opération jusqu''à ce que vous ayez une seule couche de poulet dans la poêle. Faites frire les morceaux de poulet pendant environ 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants des deux côtés et légèrement dorés. Ils doivent être croustillants et bien cuits. Mettez-les dans une passoire posée au-dessus d''un bol pour récupérer tout excès de graisse. Répétez avec le poulet restant.","Pendant ce temps, réchauffez la sauce à feu doux. Ajoutez tout le poulet frit à la sauce et mélangez-le délicatement pour l''enrober. Saupoudrer du reste des oignons nouveaux pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10608,7379,'fr','Bhaji aux champignons','Rôtissez lentement l''ail dans ce plat avec de la cardamome pour le rendre fumé et caramélisé, et dégustez avec du riz ou du naan','["1 gros bulbe d''ail","2 gousses de cardamome noire","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","400 g de mélange de champignons exotiques, gros champignons arrachés","1 petit oignon , haché grossièrement","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de gingembre finement râpé ou haché","1 piment vert, tranché (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1-2 cuillères à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","½ citron, jus","30 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement","riz cuit ou naan, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Couper le bulbe d''ail en deux horizontalement par son centre et le déposer sur une feuille de papier d''aluminium. Mettez 1 gousse de cardamome sur chaque moitié et arrosez de 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive. Envelopper dans le papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes, ou dans une friteuse à air pendant 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, confituré et commence tout juste à caraméliser le dessus.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif, ajoutez les champignons et faites-les revenir jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés, cela prendra 3-4 minutes. Retirer de la poêle et réserver.","Ajoutez l''oignon dans la même poêle avec une cuillère à soupe d''huile supplémentaire et une pincée de sel et faites cuire à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et commence tout juste à dorer, ajoutez les gousses de cardamome (de l''ail) et les graines de cumin, mélangez bien et ajoutez le gingembre et le piment vert, si vous en utilisez. Remuer pendant 30 secondes.","Pressez les gousses d''ail du bulbe dans la poêle. Écrasez-les légèrement avec le dos d''une cuillère.","Ajoutez ensuite le concentré de tomates, les épices moulues et le sel selon votre goût et laissez cuire quelques minutes à feu moyen. Ajoutez un peu d''eau si nécessaire pour éviter que ça colle.","Enfin, ajoutez le jus de citron, la coriandre hachée et les champignons cuits. Servir immédiatement avec du riz ou du naan, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10609,7381,'fr','Dhal de chou-fleur rôti avec naan maison sans gluten','Emportez-en quatre sur vos 5 par jour avec un bol de ces lentilles végétariennes épicées. Préparez votre propre naan sans gluten pour le récupérer, ou utilisez-le du commerce','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''ail","½ poireau (environ 100 g) de poireau finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gingembre","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment séchés","2 cuillères à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à café de curry en poudre","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 ml de lait de coco en boîte","500 ml de bouillon de légumes sans gluten","200 g de lentilles rouges séchées, non cuites (assurer sans gluten si besoin)","2 poignées d''épinards frais (environ 120 g), lavés","250 g de farine auto-levante sans gluten","260 g de yaourt grec (ou n''importe quel yaourt nature épais)","1 chou-fleur , coupé en bouquets","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à café de garam masala"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Pour préparer le naan, mettez la farine, le yaourt grec (remuez bien avant utilisation) et une pincée de sel dans un grand bol à mélanger. Mélangez à l''aide d''une spatule et, au fur et à mesure que le mélange commence à se rassembler, utilisez vos mains pour le rassembler en une boule légèrement collante. Couvrir et réserver.","Pour faire le chou-fleur rôti, versez le chou-fleur sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie, arrosez d''huile, puis saupoudrez de garam masala et d''une pincée de sel et de poivre. Mélangez pour que le chou-fleur soit bien enrobé et réservez.","Pour préparer le dhal, placez une grande poêle avec un couvercle sur feu moyen et ajoutez l''huile. Ajoutez le poireau et laissez cuire quelques minutes pour le ramollir. Incorporer la pâte de gingembre, les flocons de piment, le curcuma, la poudre de curry et le garam masala et cuire 1 min. Versez les tomates concassées, le lait de coco, le bouillon et les lentilles, puis incorporez. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 20 minutes en remuant de temps en temps pour que ça ne colle pas.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le chou-fleur au four et faites-le rôtir pendant environ 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit plus tendre et commence à colorer, en le retournant à mi-cuisson.","Pour faire le naan, pétrissez brièvement la pâte sur une surface bien farinée jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse, homogène et non collante. Divisez la pâte en quatre portions égales. A l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie légèrement fariné, étalez une portion de pâte en un ovale de 3 mm d''épaisseur. Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu vif. Plus la chaleur est élevée, plus vous obtiendrez de bulles dans le naan. Une fois chauffé, transférez délicatement le naan dans la poêle sèche à l’aide d’une tranche de poisson. Laisser cuire d''un côté pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés, puis retourner et cuire 1 minute. Après l’avoir retourné, appuyez fermement sur le naan à l’aide d’une spatule – cela l’encourage à gonfler un peu. Répétez en utilisant le reste de la pâte.","Une fois le dhal prêt, les lentilles seront tendres. Incorporer les épinards pour les faire flétrir et assaisonner au goût. Garnir le dhal de chou-fleur rôti et servir avec un naan à côté. Pour congeler, congelez le dhal et le naan séparément. Réchauffez le dhal au micro-ondes et le naan au four."]','2026-01-11 00:06:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10610,7383,'fr','Dhal crémeux à la noix de coco et aux épinards','"Ce repas est un véritable câlin dans un bol. Remplacer la moitié du riz par du quinoa ajoute non seulement des bienfaits supplémentaires aux grains entiers, mais augmente également la teneur en fibres et en protéines du repas. Alternativement, le riz brun complet constitue une excellente alternative. Un filet de jus de citron est un excellent moyen d''inclure de la vitamine C, facilitant l''absorption du fer des lentilles et des épinards. " —Dr Chintal Patel','["300 g de lentilles rouges","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","2 grosses tomates (environ 225 g), hachées grossièrement","400 ml de lait de coco en boîte","100 g de quinoa","320 g de pousses d''épinards","100 g de riz basmati","25 g de feuilles de coriandre hachées pour servir","½ concombre épépiné et haché finement","2 tomates, hachées finement","½ oignon rouge, finement coupé","½ citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 piments verts, coupés en deux","6 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment (facultatif)"]','["Rincez et égouttez soigneusement les lentilles rouges au moins trois fois et faites-les tremper dans l''eau froide jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande casserole à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''oignon et faites-le revenir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et commence tout juste à dorer, environ 5 à 6 minutes. Incorporer les graines de cumin et faire revenir 1 min.","Ajoutez une pincée de sel et le curcuma, mélangez bien, puis versez les tomates. Égouttez les lentilles et ajoutez-les dans la poêle avec 350 ml d''eau et le lait de coco. Remuer pour combiner et porter à ébullition. Couvrir et laisser mijoter à feu moyen-doux pendant 15 minutes.","Rincez et égouttez le quinoa et le riz au moins trois fois pour éliminer l''excès d''amidon. Versez dans une grande casserole avec 1,5 litre d''eau bouillante salée. Ramenez à ébullition, laissez mijoter 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à tendreté, puis égouttez.","Mélangez tous les ingrédients du kachumber dans un bol et assaisonnez au goût. Annuler.","Retirez le dhal du feu, découvrez et incorporez les épinards en les laissant flétrir. Assaisonner au goût.","Pour faire le tadka, faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole à feu moyen-vif, ajoutez les piments et l''ail. Juste avant que l''ail ne commence à dorer, 1 à 2 minutes, ajoutez la poudre de piment, si vous en utilisez. Remuer quelques secondes et retirer du feu. Annuler.","Servez le quinoa et le riz dans des bols garnis du dhal, du tadka et de la coriandre hachée, ainsi que du kachumber à part, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10611,7385,'fr','roues','Constitue un pilier de nombreux plats de l''Inde du Nord. Les rotis – ou chapatis – sont disponibles dans toutes les tailles et épaisseurs et sont excellents servis chauds avec du beurre ou du ghee maison.','["250 g de farine de chapati (chapati atta), ou 125 g de farine complète et 125 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer et rouler","1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre salé ou de ghee, pour servir"]','["Mélangez la farine, l''huile et ½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin dans un bol à mélanger. Ajoutez progressivement suffisamment d''eau froide (environ 120 ml) pour obtenir une pâte ferme mais pas sèche.","Déposez la pâte sur une surface farinée et pétrissez-la bien pendant environ 7 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse. Remettez la pâte dans un bol propre et sec, couvrez d''une assiette ou d''un torchon retourné et laissez reposer 30 minutes.","Pétrissez un peu plus de chapati ou de farine ordinaire si la pâte semble collante, puis divisez-la en 12 boules de taille égale. Saupoudrer chacun de farine.","Faites chauffer une plaque chauffante sèche sur la cuisinière à feu moyen. Mettez 3 cuillères à soupe de farine dans un petit bol. Avec la paume de vos mains, aplatissez une des boules de pâte en un disque circulaire et trempez les deux faces dans la farine. Maintenant, roulez-le avec un mouvement circulaire pour former un cercle de 12 à 14 cm de diamètre avec l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Il peut être plus facile d’utiliser pour cela un mince rouleau à pâtisserie en bois – du type utilisé pour étaler les pâtes.","Mettez la pâte sur la plaque chauffante et faites cuire pendant 1 minute ou jusqu''à ce que de petites poches d''air commencent à se former à sa surface. Retournez le chapati avec un couteau à palette ou des pinces et poursuivez la cuisson pendant environ 90 secondes supplémentaires, jusqu''à ce que le chapati prenne des taches de couleur.","Appuyez délicatement sur le pain avec un chiffon propre pendant qu''il cuit sur la plaque chauffante – le chapati devrait gonfler avec l''air chaud. Continuez à retourner le pain pendant la cuisson. Ces rotis sont mieux servis immédiatement avec une cuillerée de beurre ou de ghee au milieu, mais vous pouvez également les envelopper dans du papier d''aluminium et apporter le paquet à table."]','2026-01-11 00:06:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10612,7387,'fr','Curry de tofu crémeux et roti maison','Préparez un curry de tofu trompeusement riche et nourrissant, entièrement végétalien. Le roti ne prendra que 10 minutes à préparer pendant que le curry mijote','["400 g de tofu ferme","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","5 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tikka ou de madras","2 oignons blancs, tranchés finement","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","500 g de purée de tomates","200 g de crème de coco","15 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement (facultatif)","100 g de farine nature ou complète, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale"]','["Chauffer le four à 230°C/210°C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Égouttez le tofu sur du papier absorbant et coupez-le en deux horizontalement en le tapotant au fur et à mesure pour absorber le plus d''humidité possible. Déchirez le tofu en morceaux, versez-le dans un bol et mélangez-le pour l''enrober de maïzena, 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Étalez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 25 minutes.","Dans le même bol, préparez le roti. Mélangez la farine, une pincée de sel et l''huile avec suffisamment d''eau (environ 65 ml) pour obtenir une pâte molle et non collante. Pétrissez sur un plan fariné pendant 3 min, puis couvrez et laissez reposer le temps de préparer la sauce.","Faites chauffer les 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile restantes dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites cuire la pâte tikka jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit parfumée, environ 1 min. Ajouter les oignons et cuire pendant 4 à 5 minutes, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire pour éviter qu''ils ne collent, puis couvrir et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement ramollis (environ 8 à 10 minutes de plus), en remuant de temps en temps.","Ajoutez le concentré de tomates, la passata et une pincée de sel. Laisser mijoter encore 5 minutes avant d''ajouter la crème de coco. Réduisez le feu à doux pendant que vous préparez le roti. Détendez la sauce de temps en temps avec un peu d’eau si elle commence à paraître trop épaisse.","Divisez le mélange de roti en quatre boules égales. Roulez les boules sur une surface farinée à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie fariné jusqu''à ce qu''elles aient une épaisseur de 2 à 3 mm. Faites chauffer une poêle à sec jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude, puis faites cuire chaque roti 1 min de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit carbonisé par endroits. Enveloppez-les dans un torchon dès qu''ils sortent du feu pour les garder moelleux.","Retirez le tofu de la plaque à pâtisserie et incorporez-le à la sauce pour l''enrober avant de saupoudrer de coriandre et de servir avec le roti."]','2026-01-11 00:06:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10613,7389,'fr','Vindaloo au poulet','Augmentez la chaleur avec cette recette de poulet vindaloo maison faite avec de nombreuses épices aromatiques. Servir avec des pains plats chauds pour un souper simple et satisfaisant','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 bâton de cannelle légèrement meurtri ou écrasé","2 cuillères à café de flocons de piment","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","1 oignon, finement haché","1 boîte de tomates concassées (400g)","feuilles de coriandre, oignons croustillants, piment frais et pains plats ou riz réchauffés, pour servir (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","4 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en dés","1 cuillère à café d''ail écrasé ou râpé, environ 2-3 grosses gousses d''ail","2 cuillères à café de gingembre finement râpé","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","poivre de Cayenne","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire"]','["Pour préparer le poulet, mélangez le jus de citron, les dés de poulet, l''ail et le gingembre dans un grand bol avec les épices séchées et 2 cuillères à café de sel. Couvrir et laisser mariner au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 3 à 4 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen-vif. Ajoutez une cuillère à café de curcuma pour un éclat de couleur et de saveur, suivi de purée de tomates pour rehausser la richesse du plat. Saupoudrer de flocons de piment au goût pour un soupçon de piquant. Retirer de la poêle et réserver sur une assiette, il ne sera pas bien cuit à ce stade. Ajouter le reste de l''huile et l''oignon coupé en dés, cuire 10 à 15 minutes à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et translucide. Ajoutez le reste des épices et laissez cuire 2 minutes. Incorporez les tomates hachées et 200 ml d''eau, remettez le poulet dans la poêle, couvrez et laissez mijoter pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement.","Garnir de coriandre, de piment frais et d''oignons croustillants et servir avec des pains plats ou du riz, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10614,7391,'fr','Cornichon au citron vert','Associez ce cornichon au citron vert acidulé, piquant et rafraîchissant à un repas simple composé de dhal et de riz bouilli. La recette fait un pot de 500g et se conservera trois mois','["500 g de citrons verts (environ 7)","8 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 cuillères à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","30 g de sel marin fin","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","½ cuillère à café de graines de fenugrec","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 anis étoilé","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","125 ml d''huile végétale, plus 30 à 50 ml supplémentaires, si nécessaire","30 g de racine de gingembre pelée et finement hachée","3 piments verts épépinés et hachés","50 ml de vinaigre de vin blanc","70g de sucre semoule"]','["Mettez les citrons verts dans une casserole et couvrez d''eau. Placez une petite assiette résistante à la chaleur sur les fruits pour les maintenir immergés, puis portez à ébullition à feu moyen et laissez mijoter pendant 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les citrons verts soient tendres. Retirez les citrons verts, séchez-les avec du papier absorbant et jetez l''eau de cuisson.","Une fois que les citrons verts sont suffisamment froids pour être manipulés, coupez-les (écorce et moelle incluses) en morceaux de 3 cm et versez le tout, y compris le jus, dans un bol à mélanger. Incorporer l''ail haché, la poudre de piment, le curcuma et le sel et laisser de côté pendant 1 heure.","Faites chauffer une poêle solide et sèche à feu moyen-doux et ajoutez les graines de moutarde, le fenugrec, le cumin et l''anis étoilé. Remuez et faites griller les épices pendant environ 40 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient aromatiques. Versez-les dans un mortier, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de sucre et réduisez-la en poudre avec un pilon – vous pouvez également utiliser un moulin à épices électrique pour cela.","Ajoutez ce mélange d''épices moulues aux citrons verts, remuez bien, versez le tout dans un pot stérilisé puis fermez. Laissez le cornichon dans un endroit chaud ou sur un rebord de fenêtre ensoleillé pendant 2-3 jours afin que les saveurs mûrissent. Remuez les citrons verts une fois par jour avec une cuillère en métal pour vous assurer qu''ils sont uniformément enrobés du mélange d''épices.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans l''awkor karahi à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir le gingembre et les piments verts pendant 2-3 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le gingembre commence à devenir doré. Ajoutez le vinaigre et le sucre et laissez mijoter à feu moyen-doux jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous, puis faites bouillir 2 minutes.","Éteignez le feu et ajoutez les citrons verts infusés et le masala. Laisser refroidir d’un côté, puis remettre le cornichon dans le même pot. À l’aide d’une cuillère en métal, poussez les citrons verts dans le pot afin qu’ils soient recouverts d’huile épicée – vous devrez peut-être ajouter un peu d’huile supplémentaire. Fermez le pot et laissez reposer le cornichon 3 à 4 jours avant de le déguster. Il se conservera 3 mois à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:06:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10615,3754,'fr','Khichdi','Savourez ce dhal indien classique. Connue pour ses propriétés ayurvédiques, notre version est facile à préparer et pleine de saveurs','["1½ cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","250 sur 250","250 g de riz à grains moyens ou courts (le basmati convient également)","1½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 tomate de taille moyenne, coupée en cubes de 1 cm","150 g de petits pois surgelés","½ cuillère à café d''asafoetida","1 cuillère à café de sucre","2½ cuillères à soupe de ghee","1 feuille de laurier","1 piment rouge séché","3 gousses de cardamome, graines enlevées et écrasées, coques jetées","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé"]','["Faites griller 1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin dans une petite poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que les arômes se libèrent. Laisser refroidir puis mettre dans un moulin à café ou à épices et réduire en poudre fine. Cela fera environ 4 cuillères à café de cumin moulu, dont ½ cuillère à café sera utilisée à la fin du plat. Le reste se conservera dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à une semaine pour être utilisé dans un autre plat.","Faire griller à sec le moong dhal dans une poêle à feu moyen pendant environ 5 minutes. Continuez à remuer la poêle pour que le dhal ne brûle pas. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Lavez délicatement le riz sous l’eau froide deux à trois fois pour éliminer l’amidon. Ajoutez le moong dhal rôti à sec au riz et lavez à nouveau. Mettez les deux dans une grande casserole allant au four et remplissez-les de suffisamment d''eau pour arriver à 1½ pouces au-dessus du mélange de riz. Portez à ébullition à feu moyen. Retirez toute écume qui se forme à la surface de l''eau et jetez-la.","Incorporer le curcuma moulu et la tomate, remettre à ébullition, puis verser 500 ml d''eau. Remettez sur feu doux, réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter encore 20 minutes avec le couvercle. Vérifiez que le dhal et le riz sont cuits – ils devraient avoir fusionné pour former une consistance semblable à une bouillie. Ajoutez plus d''eau si nécessaire et laissez mijoter plus longtemps. Une fois cuit, maintenez sur feu doux et ajoutez les petits pois surgelés, l''asafoetida, 1 cuillère à café de sel et le sucre. Bien mélanger et laisser mijoter doucement.","Pendant ce temps, mettez une petite poêle sur feu moyen. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe de ghee, le reste des graines de cumin, la feuille de laurier, le piment séché et les graines de cardamome écrasées, et laissez les arômes se libérer en prenant soin de ne pas brûler les épices, environ 2-3 minutes. Ajoutez le gingembre et faites cuire 2 minutes à feu moyen en remuant constamment pour qu''il ne colle pas au fond de la casserole. Incorporer le mélange de gingembre et de cumin au khichdi et laisser mijoter encore 2 minutes avant de retirer du feu. Déposez la dernière ½ cuillère à soupe de ghee sur le dessus et saupoudrez de ½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin grillées et moulues (également connues sous le nom de bhaja moshla). Close the lid until ready to serve. Juste avant de servir, remuez encore une fois et le khichdi est prêt à être servi chaud. Servir avec des poppadoms et du chutney de mangue, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10616,7393,'fr','Pâtés au poulet tikka','Préparez ces pâtés gourmands pour un pique-nique. Ils sont faciles à emballer et à emporter avec vous et s''inspirent des saveurs d''une tranche de poulet tikka.','["½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées ou écrasées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","4 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en petits morceaux","5 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry tikka","Boîte de 227 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à café de cassonade légère","100 ml de crème double","350 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","175 g de beurre doux froid, coupé en cubes","1 cuillère à café de graines de carvi (facultatif)","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin (facultatif)","1 jaune d''œuf (congeler le blanc pour une autre recette), plus 1 œuf battu"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli, environ 6 à 8 minutes. Incorporer l''ail et le gingembre et cuire encore 1 min avant d''incorporer les morceaux de poulet. Cuire 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit entièrement doré. Ajoutez la pâte de curry, remuez, puis incorporez les tomates concassées et la cassonade. Cuire 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait réduit et que vous obteniez un curry bien sec. Incorporez la crème double et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle ait légèrement réduit – vous voulez une sauce épaisse, pour qu''elle ne s''échappe pas de la pâte finie. Laisser refroidir.","Pour faire la pâte, versez la farine dans un robot culinaire avec le beurre, les graines de carvi et de cumin si vous en utilisez et mélangez en miettes fines. (Vous pouvez également le faire dans un bol en frottant le tout du bout des doigts.) Incorporez le jaune d''œuf et un peu d''eau froide, si nécessaire, pour transformer le mélange en une pâte. Envelopper et réserver au frais 20 minutes le temps que la garniture refroidisse.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6.Abaisser la pâte refroidie sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à ce qu''elle fasse environ ½ cm d''épaisseur. Découpez des disques à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 10 à 12 cm, ou utilisez une petite assiette comme gabarit et découpez-les au couteau. (Vous devriez en obtenir environ huit au total.) Mettez quelques cuillerées de garniture sur chaque cercle de pâte, juste décentré, puis badigeonnez la garniture d''œuf battu et repliez la pâte pour que les bords se rejoignent. Sertir les bords ou sceller avec une fourchette. Mettez sur une plaque à pâtisserie, coupez quelques petites entailles sur le dessus de chaque pâte, badigeonnez le reste d''œuf battu et faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes et dorées. Laisser refroidir légèrement, puis servir. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:06:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10617,7395,'fr','Paneer & pulao aux pois chiches','Préparez du pulao – un plat de riz simple et rapide – encore plus spécial en ajoutant du paneer et des pois chiches','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde","8 feuilles de curry (facultatif)","2 piments verts, finement hachés","2 oignons moyens, tranchés finement","5 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 tomates hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment (assurer sans gluten, si nécessaire)","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","225 g de paner coupé en petits rectangles","300 g de riz basmati","10 g de feuilles de coriandre finement hachées","yaourt (pour servir)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle munie d''un couvercle. Ajoutez le cumin et les graines de moutarde et laissez-les grésiller jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Ajoutez ensuite les feuilles de curry, les piments et les oignons et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore une minute avant d''y verser les tomates. Cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates commencent à ramollir.","Ajouter les épices et 1½ cuillère à café de sel et cuire 1 min. Incorporez les pois chiches et le paneer, puis le riz, puis versez 700 ml d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Portez le mélange à ébullition en couvrant la casserole avec le couvercle.","Cuire à feu doux pendant 12 min puis, avant de retirer le couvercle, laisser reposer 10 min. Servir avec une pincée de coriandre et une cuillerée de yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:06:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10618,7399,'fr','Kitchari','Préparez un lot de kitchari, un plat apaisant semblable à un dhal lié aux nettoyages ayurvédiques (un ancien système de médecine alternative de l''Inde) pour un souper sain.','["1 cuillère à soupe de ghee","1 petit chou-fleur, tiges et fleurons finement hachés","2 carottes, hachées finement","15 g de gingembre pelé et râpé","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","½ cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","150g de moong dal rincé et égoutté (disponible dans les magasins spécialisés et grandes surfaces)","100 g de riz basmati rincé et égoutté","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée","1 citron vert, coupé en quartiers"]','["Faites fondre le ghee dans une grande casserole ou une casserole résistante aux flammes à feu moyen. Incorporer tout le chou-fleur et les carottes et assaisonner légèrement. Faites revenir doucement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient ramollis et prennent un peu de couleur.","Ajoutez toutes les épices et faites frire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées. Versez le moong dal et le riz et remuez pour bien enrober les épices. Salez et versez 1,25 litre d''eau. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 45 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que les haricots et le riz soient bien tendres et décomposés. La texture doit ressembler à une bouillie. Assaisonner selon votre goût et saupoudrer de coriandre. Servir avec les quartiers de citron vert à côté pour les presser."]','2026-01-11 00:06:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10619,7401,'fr','Paner croustillant, curry d''épinards et de noix de coco','Préparez ce curry végétarien facile pour un repas rapide en milieu de semaine. Vous pouvez ajouter plus ou moins de piments selon le degré de piquant de votre nourriture.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","200 g de paner, en cubes","1 oignon, coupé en dés","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 piments frais, épépinés si vous préférez moins de piquant","1 poivron rouge, tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry","400 ml de lait de coco","80 g de brocoli à longue tige, cuit à la vapeur ou au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre","100 g de bébés épinards","naan, riz, poppadoms et quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen. Faites frire les cubes de paneer 2 minutes de chaque côté, en les retournant avec une pince, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Retirer de la poêle et réserver sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant pour égoutter.","Versez l''oignon dans le reste d''huile dans la poêle et faites-le revenir 5 minutes à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez l''ail et les piments, faites frire pendant 2 minutes, puis ajoutez le poivron tranché et faites frire pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis.","Faites un puits au milieu du mélange d''oignons et de poivrons et ajoutez la pâte de curry en remuant pendant 2 minutes pour bien chauffer avant d''y verser le lait de coco et de mélanger. Laisser mijoter pendant 5 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à épaississement, puis ajouter le paneer frit, le brocoli et les épinards. Bien mélanger et laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés.","Servir avec votre choix de naans, de riz ou de poppadoms et de quartiers de lime à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:06:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10620,7403,'fr','Bavarder','Essayez cette façon fantastique de servir des samosas pour un repas plus copieux. C''est une bonne entrée pour un dîner et pour célébrer des festivals tels que Holi.','["1 petit oignon rouge, finement tranché","1 gros citron, jus","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale, de tournesol ou de colza","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin, plus une pincée pour tester l''huile","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","¾ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 ½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 sachet de thé","4 samosas végétariens (utiliser du commerce ou voir ci-dessous)","200-300 ml de yaourt grec fouetté","3-4 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","une poignée de sev fin ou de mélange Bombay (facultatif)"]','["Mettez l''oignon rouge émincé dans un bol résistant à la chaleur rempli d''eau juste bouillie. Laisser reposer 10 min, égoutter, puis arroser avec le jus de citron et une pincée de sel. Annuler. Les oignons prendront une merveilleuse couleur magenta.","Pour préparer les pois chiches épicés, faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole à feu moyen. Pour vérifier que c''est prêt, ajoutez quelques graines de cumin – si elles commencent à grésiller, ajoutez le reste, suivi des pois chiches égouttés. Répartir dans 1 cuillère à café de sel et le curcuma, la poudre de piment, le cumin moulu et 60 ml d''eau. Incorporez le contenu du sachet de thé et remuez le tout. Couvrir et laisser mijoter à feu doux pendant environ 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que toutes les saveurs soient infuses. Écrasez délicatement quelques pois chiches dans la poêle pour faire une sauce – vous devrez peut-être ajouter un peu plus d''eau.","Versez les pois chiches épicés sur un plat de service. Coupez les samosas en morceaux et superposez-les dessus. Arroser de yaourt, puis garnir d''oignons marinés tranchés. Saupoudrer d''oignons nouveaux hachés et du mélange sev ou Bombay."]','2026-01-11 00:06:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10621,7405,'fr','Paner dhal épicé','Omettez le piment si vous préférez moins de piquant ou si vous préparez ce paneer dhal épicé pour les enfants. C''est un repas équilibré et savoureux en milieu de semaine pour la famille','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","150 g de paner coupé en cubes de 1 cm","5 gousses de cardamome, écrasées","1 bâton de cannelle","1 gros oignon, finement tranché","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","15 g de gingembre pelé et râpé","1 piment vert finement haché et épépiné (facultatif)","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","300 g de lentilles rouges rincées","850 ml de bouillon de légumes","une petite poignée de coriandre, feuilles cueillies","naan ou chapati et yaourt à la noix de coco, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole à feu moyen. Faites frire le paner jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, environ 5 à 7 minutes. Transférer dans un bol et réserver. Mettez la cardamome et la cannelle dans la poêle et faites frire pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées. Ajouter l''oignon, l''ail, le gingembre, le piment et le curcuma. Cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à tendreté avant d''ajouter les lentilles et le bouillon. Assaisonner et porter à ébullition, puis cuire à feu moyen pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres et épaissies.","Assaisonnez le dhal et versez-le dans le paneer. Servir avec de la coriandre saupoudrée et du chapati ou du naan et du yaourt à la noix de coco, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10622,7407,'fr','Oeufs pochés Dhal avec raita aux herbes','Essayez cette nouvelle version du dhal avec des œufs pochés pour un repas sain et riche en nutriments. Servi avec une raita aux herbes, il livre quatre de vos 5 par jour','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons (320 g), coupés en deux et émincés","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin et de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde","2 cuillères à soupe de garam masala","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 piment rouge épépiné et tranché","175g de lentilles rouges","400 g de pois chiches en boîte","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre, mélangées à 700 ml d''eau bouillante","320 g de pousses d''épinards","8 gros œufs","150g de yaourt nature bio","1 gousse d''ail","fine tranche de gingembre pelé","20 g de feuilles de coriandre, plus quelques feuilles supplémentaires pour servir (facultatif)","10 g de feuilles de menthe"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à colorer. Incorporer les épices, l''ail et le piment et cuire encore quelques secondes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient aromatiques.","Ajouter les lentilles, les pois chiches et le bouillon, puis cuire à découvert pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres. Incorporer les épinards jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés.","Retirez la moitié du dhal de la poêle et laissez-le refroidir. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Cassez 4 œufs espacés dans les lentilles restées dans la poêle, couvrez et laissez cuire à feu moyen pendant 8 à 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mettez tous les ingrédients de la raita dans un bol et mixez-les à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant.","Servez les œufs et le dhal avec la moitié de la raita et parsemez-les de quelques feuilles de coriandre supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez. La raita restante se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffez le reste du dhal dans une poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il bouillonne. Ajoutez une goutte d''eau si elle semble sèche, puis faites cuire les œufs dans le dhal chaud comme décrit à l''étape 3 et servez avec le reste de raita."]','2026-01-11 00:06:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10623,7409,'fr','Dhal de pois chiches et de noix de coco rapide et facile','Essayez cette version rapide et facile de Dhal. Il regorge d''ingrédients bons pour la santé, notamment des pois chiches, des lentilles et des épinards.','["huile, pour la cuisson","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","petit morceau de gingembre pelé et finement haché","5 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","10 tomates cerises, 5 hachées","½ bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies, tiges finement hachées","400 g de lait de coco en boîte","Boîte de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","Boîte de 400 g de lentilles cuites, égouttées et rincées","2 cuillères à soupe de curry en poudre","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 citron vert, jus","une poignée d''épinards","pittas complets, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer un filet d''huile dans une grande casserole ou une poêle antiadhésive à feu vif. Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre, réduisez le feu à moyen et laissez cuire 3 à 5 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Ajoutez les oignons nouveaux, toutes les tomates cerises, les feuilles et tiges de coriandre et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Cuire encore 3 minutes.","Ajoutez le lait de coco, les pois chiches et les lentilles et remuez bien, puis ajoutez la poudre de curry, le curcuma, le cumin, ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir et le jus de citron vert. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez cuire 5 minutes. Ajoutez les épinards et laissez-les tomber quelques minutes. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement, puis servez avec des pittas."]','2026-01-11 00:06:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10624,7411,'fr','Curry épicé de poulet et de pois chiches','Essayez notre curry de poulet et de pois chiches pour un plat au goût percutant mais qui ne nécessite pas beaucoup d''efforts à préparer. C''est génial de congeler pour les journées chargées','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 oignons, tranchés finement","6 gousses d''ail","2 piments verts, finement hachés","3 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","8 cuisses de poulet sans peau, avec l''os","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre","riz cuit ou naans, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole et ajoutez les oignons. Cuire à feu moyen pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis ajouter l''ail et les piments et cuire 1 minute jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Ajouter le concentré de tomates et cuire 1 min. Déplacez le mélange sur le côté de la poêle, puis ajoutez les cuisses de poulet. Étalez le mélange de tomates sur le poulet et faites cuire à feu vif pendant 5 minutes.","Ajoutez les épices, 1 cuillère à café de sel et 150 ml d''eau juste bouillie et mélangez bien. Couvrir et laisser cuire à feu doux pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit. Ajoutez les pois chiches et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Pour congeler des portions, répartissez-les dans des récipients congelables et laissez-les d''abord refroidir. Se conserve congelé jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler toute la nuit au réfrigérateur, puis réchauffer dans une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Répartir sur la coriandre et servir avec du riz ou des naans chauds, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10625,7413,'fr','Paner au piment','Savourez ce paner au chili plein de saveurs avec du riz et vos accompagnements végétariens préférés pour un délicieux dîner légèrement épicé pour deux.','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","226 g de paner, coupé en cubes de 1 cm","1 oignon nouveau, tranché finement","riz cuit, pour servir","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja noire","1½ à 2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili piquante, au goût","1½ cuillère à soupe de ketchup","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de riz","1 cuillère à café de miel","25 g de gingembre pelé et finement râpé","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment vert finement haché (épépiné si vous le souhaitez)","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","1 oignon rouge, haché grossièrement","1 poivron vert épépiné et haché grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile végétale dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen. Mélangez la maïzena, la farine ordinaire, la poudre de piment, 1 cuillère à café de sel marin fin, ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir fraîchement moulu et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans un bol jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si elle est trop épaisse. Ajouter les cubes de paneer et mélanger pour bien enrober. Versez délicatement le paneer enrobé dans l''huile chaude de la poêle et faites-le frire en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant et doré de tous les côtés. Transférer dans une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant et réserver.","Pour préparer la sauce, versez la maïzena dans un pichet et fouettez progressivement la sauce soja jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez la sauce chili, le ketchup, le vinaigre de riz, le miel et 90 ml d''eau, puis fouettez à nouveau et réservez. Égoutter la majeure partie de l’excès d’huile de la poêle et remettre sur feu moyen. Faites revenir le gingembre, l''ail et le piment haché pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Incorporer la poudre de piment, l''oignon et le poivron, augmenter le feu à moyen-vif et faire revenir jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Versez le mélange de sauce soja jusqu''à ce qu''il épaississe légèrement.","Retirer du feu et incorporer le paneer, en veillant à ce qu''il soit bien enrobé de sauce. Ajoutez un peu d''eau si nécessaire et assaisonnez au goût. Saupoudrer d''oignon nouveau et servir avec du riz, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10626,6413,'fr','Couper le poulet','Créez une version faible en gras du saag de poulet. Ce plat est non seulement plein de saveurs, mais il contient trois de vos 5 par jour et peut également être congelé pour les journées chargées.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 oignon (200 g), finement haché","10 g de gingembre pelé et finement haché","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées finement","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","2 filets de poitrine de poulet sans peau (300 g), débarrassés de tout gras et coupés en morceaux","2 tomates hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","160 g de pousses d''épinards hachées","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt bio","120 g de riz basmati brun","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","3 gousses de cardamome, écrasées et épépinées"]','["Mettez le riz, le curcuma et les graines de cardamome dans une casserole avec une pincée de sel et suffisamment d''eau pour recouvrir généreusement le riz. Mettez le couvercle et laissez mijoter 20 minutes. Éteignez le feu et réservez.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l’huile dans une grande poêle à feu doux-moyen et ajoutez-y l’oignon, le gingembre et l’ail. Couvrir et cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer. Remuez bien, puis ajoutez les épices et poursuivez la cuisson brièvement jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient grillées et parfumées.","Versez le poulet et faites-le revenir quelques minutes. Ajouter les tomates concassées, la purée de tomates et les épinards. Cuire en remuant pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés. À ce stade, vous pouvez retirer le curry du feu, le laisser refroidir complètement et le congeler jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler complètement avant de réchauffer. Incorporez le yaourt, puis faites chauffer 1 min. Égoutter le riz, si nécessaire, et servir avec le poulet."]','2026-01-11 00:06:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10627,7415,'fr','Panir Makhani','Vous organisez un dîner? Aucun repas ou célébration sur le thème indien n''est complet sans paneer, et ce délice au fromage est exactement ce qu''il vous faut.','["2 cuillères à café de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","4 tomates concassées, ou utilisez une boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates","6-7 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","4 à 5 gousses de cardamome, grossièrement écrasées","1 petit bâton de cannelle","1 feuille de laurier","4 noix de cajou, hachées finement et trempées dans l''eau jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres","1 cm de gingembre pelé et finement râpé","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment rouge, comme le mirch du Cachemire","1 piment, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur (facultatif)","250 g de paner, coupé en cubes moyens","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de fenugrec","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","80 ml de crème liquide, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites fondre 1 cuillère à café de beurre et 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu doux-moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elle grésille (surveillez attentivement pour que le beurre ne brûle pas). Ajouter les tomates, la purée de tomates, l''ail, les gousses de cardamome, le bâton de cannelle et le laurier. Couvrir avec un couvercle et laisser cuire 10 minutes à feu moyen en remuant de temps en temps. Au bout de 10 minutes, retirez du feu, laissez refroidir, puis retirez le laurier, le bâton de cannelle et les gousses de cardamome.","Une fois refroidi, versez le mélange et les noix de cajou dans l''Ablender et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Annuler.","Remettez la poêle sur feu moyen, ajoutez le reste du beurre et de l''huile et faites revenir le gingembre une minute. Réduisez le feu à doux, ajoutez la poudre de piment et remuez pendant 2 minutes. Versez la pâte de tomates et de noix de cajou et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes.","Ajoutez le piment tranché, le cas échéant, 1½ cuillère à café de sucre et le paneer. Bien mélanger et cuire encore quelques minutes. Ajoutez les feuilles de fenugrec et le garam masala. Bien mélanger. Incorporez jusqu''à 100 ml d''eau pour détendre, puis retirez du feu, incorporez la crème, le cas échéant, et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10628,7417,'fr','Curry de champignons simple','Servez ces champignons à l''ail dans un riche masala aux tomates épicé avec du gingembre moulu, des graines de fenouil et du cumin pour un souper automnal. Déguster avec du riz ou du naan','["50g de beurre doux","500 g de champignons châtaignes coupés en quartiers","4-6 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","1 gros oignon, finement haché","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","½ cuillère à café de garam masala","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec entier et épais","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","riz cuit ou naan, pour servir"]','["Faites fondre le beurre dans un grand wok, un karahi ou une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire les champignons pendant 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que toute l''humidité se soit évaporée et qu''ils commencent à dorer. Transférer dans un bol et réserver.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans la même poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir les graines de cumin et de fenouil en remuant continuellement pendant environ 30 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''elles dégagent un arôme de noisette. Incorporer l''oignon et cuire 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Réduisez le feu à moyen, puis ajoutez l''ail et poursuivez la friture pendant 1 min. Ajoutez le gingembre, le curcuma, la poudre de piment et le garam masala, suivis des tomates et du sucre. Cuire à découvert pendant 5 à 7 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le masala épaississe et qu''une couche d''huile se forme sur le bord de la poêle.","Versez le yaourt dans un petit bol, ajoutez une petite louche de masala chaud et mélangez bien avant de mélanger le yaourt dans la poêle de masala. Versez 100 ml d''eau chaude et laissez mijoter 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que le curry ait la consistance d''une double crème. Assaisonnez au goût, puis remettez les champignons dans la poêle et remuez pour bien réchauffer. Parsemer de coriandre hachée et servir avec du riz bouilli ou du naan, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10629,7421,'fr','Poulet au beurre classique','Remplacez vos plats à emporter habituels par du poulet au beurre fait maison. Le plat est composé de deux parties, combinant du poulet tandoori avec une riche sauce au beurre','["3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","2-3 cuillères à soupe de poudre de chili du Cachemire ou de paprika","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau ou 8 filets de cuisse, coupés en cubes de 5 cm","3 cuillères à soupe de beurre fondu ou de ghee, pour arroser les brochettes","200 ml de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à soupe d''ail écrasé","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de poudre d''amchoor (poudre de mangue séchée)","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de fenugrec séchées, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de menthe séchées","½ cuillère à café de sel noir (facultatif, voir ci-dessous)","½ cuillère à café de sel nature (utilisez 1 cuillère à café si vous n''avez pas de sel noir)","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","4 à 8 piments verts forts, tranchés","90 g de beurre ou de ghee","2 oignons moyens, finement hachés","4 gousses de cardamome verte concassées","½ cuillère à soupe d''ail écrasé","½ cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de fenugrec séchées, écrasées","500 ml de passata dilué avec 150 ml d''eau","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","100 ml de crème liquide","grosse pincée de feuilles de coriandre, pour garnir"]','["Frottez le jus de citron et la poudre de piment ou le paprika dans le poulet avec une pincée de sel, puis réfrigérez pendant 1 heure. Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la marinade dans un bol, goûtez l''assaisonnement, puis ajoutez le poulet réfrigéré. Bien mélanger et laisser au frais encore 2 heures.","Enfilez les morceaux de poulet marinés sur des brochettes en métal en réservant les restes de marinade. Griller sur un barbecue chaud pendant 5 minutes, en retournant de temps en temps et en arrosant de beurre fondu ou de ghee. Vous pouvez également cuire sous un grill chaud pendant 8 à 10 minutes, en retournant de temps en temps. Ne vous inquiétez pas si le poulet est un peu sous-cuit, car il finira de cuire dans la sauce. Retirez les brochettes sur une planche.","Pour préparer la sauce, faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale dans une grande poêle awokor et déposez-y quelques graines de cumin. Lorsqu''elles commencent à grésiller, versez le reste des graines. Faites tourner la poêle, réduisez le feu et ajoutez les piments verts. Remuez une ou deux fois jusqu''à ce que la peau des piments soit boursouflée, puis ajoutez le beurre ou le ghee. Augmentez le feu et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que tout le beurre ou le ghee ait fondu. Ajoutez les oignons et faites-les revenir pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient brun clair et tendres. Si vous préférez une sauce onctueuse, versez le mélange dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Vous pouvez également gratter dans un bol et réserver.","Essuyez la poêle avec du papier absorbant et faites chauffer le reste de l''huile. Déposez les gousses de cardamome écrasées. Lorsqu''ils ont gonflé et blanchi, baissez le feu, ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et faites revenir pendant 30 secondes en remuant continuellement jusqu''à ce que vous ne sentiez plus l''odeur de l''ail et du gingembre crus. Remettez le mélange d''oignons cuits dans la poêle et mélangez bien. Ajoutez le curcuma et la moitié des feuilles de fenugrec. Assaisonner de sel. Goûtez et rectifiez l’assaisonnement si nécessaire – si vous le souhaitez, vous pouvez ajouter un peu de poudre de piment. Versez la passata diluée, mélangez bien et portez à ébullition. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter, à couvert et en remuant de temps en temps, pendant environ 20 minutes. L''huile finira par remonter à la surface lorsque la sauce sera cuite.","Retirez les morceaux de poulet des brochettes et coupez-les en bouchées. Ajoutez-les à la sauce avec les jus de repos. Versez environ 125 ml d''eau tiède dans le bol avec la marinade réservée, remuez pour détacher, puis incorporez à la sauce. Portez la sauce à ébullition et réduisez le feu pour laisser mijoter. Saupoudrer de garam masala et poursuivre la cuisson pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Si vous le souhaitez, ajoutez un peu d''eau bouillante pour détendre la sauce, puis goûtez pour l''assaisonnement. Versez la moitié de la crème et mélangez bien.","Transférer le poulet au beurre dans un bol de service, arroser du reste de crème, saupoudrer du reste de feuilles de fenugrec et garnir de feuilles de coriandre fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:06:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10630,7423,'fr','Curry kofta d''agneau parfumé','Préparez notre curry de boulettes de viande d''agneau dans une poêle qui utilise notre propre mélange d''épices spécialement créé. C’est idéal pour une gourmandise du vendredi soir à partager en famille','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau","1 piment vert ou rouge, tranché, pour servir (facultatif)","riz basmati, pour servir","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","1½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment rouge","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 piment vert finement haché (facultatif)","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles et tiges séparées, tiges finement hachées, feuilles réservées","400 g de tomates hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","300 ml de bouillon d''agneau","200 ml de crème de coco en boîte"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre mais pas doré. Retirer dans un bol et laisser refroidir. Versez le hachis d''agneau et la moitié du mélange d''épices dans un bol moyen avec 1/2 cuillère à café de sel et de poivre noir et les oignons refroidis. Pétrissez avec vos mains pour combiner uniformément, puis formez 16 boulettes de viande égales. Remettez la poêle sur feu moyen et faites dorer les boulettes de viande partout. Retirer dans une assiette à l''aide d''une écumoire.","Pour faire la sauce, faites revenir l''oignon dans la poêle pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir, puis ajoutez le gingembre, l''ail, le piment haché (si utilisé) et les tiges de coriandre, et laissez cuire encore 3 minutes. Répartir le reste du mélange d''épices et laisser cuire 1 min, puis verser les tomates, le concentré de tomates, le bouillon et les trois quarts de la crème de coco. Mélangez, portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait réduit d''un quart.","Remettez les boulettes de viande dans la poêle et laissez cuire encore 15 minutes, en arrosant les boulettes de viande avec la sauce toutes les quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait réduit d''un quart supplémentaire et que les boulettes de viande soient bien cuites. Arroser du reste de crème de coco, puis parsemer de feuilles de coriandre et de tranches de piment et servir avec du riz basmati cuit."]','2026-01-11 00:06:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10631,6849,'fr','Chana daal halva infusée de safran, clous de girofle et cardamome','Préparez du halva en utilisant du chana daal (petits pois chiches cassés). Infusé d''arômes de safran, de clou de girofle et de cardamome et parsemé de noix, c''est une gâterie sucrée plus gourmande','["400 g de chana daal, trempé toute la nuit","750 ml de lait entier (ou utilisez du lait de soja ou d''amande)","2 cuillères à soupe de ghee ou 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre non salé et 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","6 gousses de cardamome verte légèrement écrasées","6 clous de girofle","340 g de sucre en poudre doré","petite pincée de safran","2 cuillères à soupe de pistaches hachées","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes hachées"]','["Mettez le chana daal dans un grand bol, versez-le sur de l''eau pour couvrir et laissez reposer toute la nuit. Égoutter puis verser dans une grande casserole. Versez dessus le lait et portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu à moyen et laissez mijoter en remuant fréquemment pendant 25 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le lait soit complètement absorbé.","Laisser refroidir pendant 20 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il revienne à température ambiante. Versez-la dans le bol d''un robot culinaire et fouettez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Vous devrez peut-être la détacher avec un peu d''eau si elle est trop épaisse.","Faites chauffer le ghee (ou l''huile et le beurre) dans une casserole à feu moyen-doux. Lorsqu''elle est chaude, ajoutez la cardamome et les clous de girofle et faites revenir quelques secondes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées.","Ajoutez la pâte de lentilles mixée et laissez cuire 15 minutes en remuant constamment jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à sentir la noisette et prenne une couleur brun clair. Retirez la casserole du feu.","Dans une autre casserole (ou vous pouvez laver la casserole utilisée pour le lait), faites chauffer le sucre et 100 ml d''eau à feu moyen pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve et atteigne une température de 104 °C sur un thermomètre à sucre. Cela devrait avoir l''air sirupeux. Retirer du feu.","Verser dans le mélange de lentilles, ajouter le safran et bien mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Laissez le halva refroidir dans la poêle pendant environ 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment froid pour être manipulé.","Façonnez des cuillerées à soupe de halva en formes cylindriques à l''aide de vos mains, puis disposez-les sur une assiette et répartissez-les sur les noix hachées. Servir immédiatement ou laisser refroidir complètement et conserver au frais jusqu''à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:06:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10632,5355,'fr','Pilons de poulet aux noix de cajou et curcuma (kalmi kebab)','Préparez ce favori du nord de l''Inde : des cuisses de poulet marinées dans du yaourt à l''ail, de la crème et de la pâte de noix de cajou et épicées au curcuma et au gingembre.','["75 g de noix de cajou","1 citron, jus, plus des quartiers supplémentaires pour servir","150 g de yaourt grec égoutté (utilisez du yaourt grec ordinaire si vous n''en trouvez pas égoutté)","50 g de gingembre pelé et finement râpé","8 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ cuillère à café de poudre de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","½ cuillère à café de graines de carambole (ajwain), facultatif","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","¾ cuillère à café de grains de poivre noir concassés","50 ml de crème double","12 pilons de poulet, pelés","50 g de ghee ou 75 ml d''huile de tournesol","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en rondelles"]','["Mettez les noix de cajou dans un bol et couvrez avec suffisamment d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire pour couvrir. Laisser reposer au moins 2 heures pour ramollir. Égoutter les noix, puis mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse dans un petit robot culinaire avec le jus de citron.","Mélangez la pâte de noix avec le yaourt dans un grand bol et ajoutez le citron, le gingembre, l''ail, le curcuma, la poudre de piment, les graines de carambole (le cas échéant), le garam masala, le cumin, le poivre noir et la crème.","À l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, faites 2 à 3 entailles sur chaque pilon de poulet et enduisez-les de yaourt épicé. Couvrez le bol et laissez mariner le poulet au réfrigérateur pendant 1 à 2 heures, ou toute la nuit si vous en avez le temps.","Chauffez le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Mettez le ghee ou l''huile dans un plat à rôtir plus grand et faites-le chauffer au four jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud.","Disposez le poulet en une seule couche dans le plat à rôtir. Versez la moitié de la marinade sur les cuisses et remettez le moule au four.","Au bout de 15 minutes, retournez les cuisses et étalez-les avec le reste de marinade. Mettre au four encore 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le jus du poulet soit clair lorsqu''on le pique avec un couteau.","Préchauffez le gril à son réglage le plus chaud et faites griller le poulet pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Transférer dans un plat de service, parsemer de rondelles d''oignon rouge et servir avec des quartiers de citron en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10633,5661,'fr','Wraps de paneer grillés (rouleaux kathi paneer)','Dégustez ces petits pains chapati enrobés d''omelette comme collation ou gâterie à Diwali. Ils sont tartinés de relish à la coriandre et farcis de paneer assaisonné à la mangue','["Paner 300g","150 ml de yaourt grec entier","30 g de gingembre pelé et finement râpé","6 gousses d''ail, écrasées","¼ cuillère à café de graines de carambole (ajwain ; facultatif)","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","¾ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à café de poudre de mangue (amchoor)","1 citron vert, jus","3-4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 petit oignon rouge, finement tranché","1 carotte, râpée grossièrement","1 piment vert épépiné et finement haché","1 citron vert, jus","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de menthe râpées","6-8 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou de ghee fondu","8 chapatis","4 œufs légèrement battus","relish à la coriandre, pour servir (voir « Se marie bien avec » ci-dessous)"]','["Versez le paneer dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, couvrez-le d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire et laissez tremper 10 minutes pour le ramollir. Égouttez et jetez l''eau, puis coupez le fromage en trois rectangles de 2 cm.","Mélangez le yaourt avec le gingembre, l''ail, les graines de carambole (le cas échéant), le curcuma, la poudre de piment, le garam masala, la poudre de mangue et le jus de citron vert. Mélangez délicatement le yaourt épicé avec le paneer et laissez mariner à température ambiante pendant 30 min. Pour la salade, mélangez l''oignon émincé avec la carotte râpée, le piment vert, le jus de citron vert, le sucre et la menthe. Annuler.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à fond épais à feu moyen et faites revenir le paneer pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli, en retournant les morceaux de temps en temps avec une tranche de poisson. Retirer du feu, couvrir avec un couvercle et réserver.","Pour le pain, faites chauffer une poêle à frire ou une poêle à fond épais à feu moyen et ajoutez 1 cuillère à café d''huile ou de ghee. Mettez un chapati sur la plaque chauffante et versez-y 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''œuf battu. Versez encore 1 cuillère à café d''huile ou de ghee sur le pourtour du pain et, à l''aide d''une tranche de poisson, retournez rapidement le chapati de manière à ce que le côté œuf soit tourné vers le bas. Une partie de l''œuf se répandra lorsque vous le retournerez et pourra être raclée sous le chapati pendant la cuisson. Faites cuire une minute, puis retirez les chapatis de la poêle et faites cuire les chapatis restants de la même manière. Empilez le pain, côté omelette vers le haut, et enveloppez-le sans serrer dans du papier d''aluminium pour le garder au chaud.","Disposez l''omelette-chapatis sur le plan de travail et étalez généreusement un peu de relish à la coriandre sur l''œuf. Disposez quatre ou cinq morceaux de paneer en rangée au centre de chaque chapati et garnissez de 1 cuillère à soupe de salade. Roulez le « roti » autour de la garniture et servez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:06:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10634,7425,'fr','Galettes d''agneau haché et de lentilles (shami kebab)','Cuisinez des brochettes indiennes populaires pour Diwali à base d''agneau haché et de lentilles, assaisonnées d''épices et agrémentées de coriandre fraîche, de gingembre et de piments.','["80 g de gramme de Bengale fendu (chana dal)","30g de ghee","1 oignon, finement haché","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau","10 gousses d''ail","50 g de gingembre pelé et finement haché","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin noir (shahi jeera) ou ½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 œuf légèrement battu","1 citron vert, jus","4 cuillères à soupe de coriandre grossièrement hachée","2 piments verts, finement hachés","50 ml d''huile de tournesol","150 ml de yaourt grec entier","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de menthe râpées","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","jus de citron vert, pour l''assaisonnement"]','["Mettez le gramme de Bengale fendu dans un petit bol résistant à la chaleur, couvrez d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire et laissez tremper pendant 3 heures ou idéalement toute la nuit, si vous en avez le temps.","Faites fondre le ghee dans une cocotte ignifuge à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 7 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Ajoutez le hachis d''agneau. Épluchez les gousses d''ail entières et versez-les dans le plat avec le gingembre et faites cuire, en remuant souvent, pendant 10 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce que le liquide de l''agneau s''évapore. Égouttez le gramme de Bengale trempé et ajoutez-le au plat avec la poudre de piment, le garam masala et les graines de cumin noir ou le cumin moulu.","Versez 300 ml d''eau chaude pour couvrir à peine le hachis, couvrez avec un couvercle, réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le hachis soit tendre. Retirez le couvercle et poursuivez la cuisson en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce que toute l''eau se soit évaporée et que le gramme de Bengale soit tendre. À présent, le hachis sera sec et de texture friable. Étalez le mélange sur une plaque à pâtisserie et laissez-le refroidir complètement avant de le transférer dans un grand robot culinaire.","Ajouter l''œuf battu, le jus de citron vert, la coriandre et les piments verts au robot et mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Avec les mains humides, rouler le mélange d''agneau en environ 20 boules de la taille d''une noix. Aplatissez chaque boule dans votre paume en une galette de 4 cm (sur 1 cm d''épaisseur) à l''aide de vos doigts. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Pour la raita à la menthe, mélangez le yaourt avec l''ail, la menthe, le cumin et le sucre et ajoutez suffisamment de jus de citron vert pour accentuer la saveur. Goûtez pour l’assaisonnement, puis réservez.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une poêle à fond épais à feu moyen et faites frire les brochettes par lots pendant 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Retirez l''excès d''huile entre les lots et essuyez la poêle avec un torchon avant d''ajouter de l''huile fraîche. Égoutter les brochettes sur du papier absorbant et servir tiède avec la raita à la menthe."]','2026-01-11 00:06:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10635,6855,'fr','Pièce Shahi','Savourez un dessert moghol classique composé de tranches de pain frit, trempées dans du lait de cardamome sucré, parfumées au safran et à l''eau de rose et garnies de noix hachées.','["¼ cuillère à café de safran","7 gousses de cardamome, épépinées, plus 1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","4 tranches de pain blanc d''épaisseur moyenne, âgées de 2 jours","huile de tournesol, pour une friture peu profonde","1 litre de lait entier","75 g de sucre en poudre","125 ml de crème fraîche","quelques gouttes d''eau de rose","1 cuillère à soupe d''amandes hachées","feuille d''argent (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le safran dans un petit bol avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau tiède et laissez reposer 1 h. Pendant ce temps, réduisez en poudre les graines de cardamome avec le sucre en poudre à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier.","Retirez la croûte du pain et coupez les tranches en deux en diagonale.","Versez l''huile dans une poêle à bords hauts, jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne 2 cm de profondeur, et faites chauffer à feu moyen. Une fois que l''huile atteint 180°C, ou lorsqu''un cube de pain brunit en 30 secondes, ajoutez délicatement les tranches de pain par lots et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées des deux côtés. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et réserver.","Faites chauffer le mélange de lait et de cardamome moulue dans l''awkor karahi à feu moyen-vif, en remuant de temps en temps. Une fois à ébullition, baissez le feu à moyen et poursuivez la cuisson du lait pendant environ 15 minutes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit réduit de moitié.","Mélangez une louche de lait chaud avec la crème dans un bol, puis remettez-la dans la casserole. Incorporez le safran et son eau de trempage, ainsi que suffisamment d’eau de rose pour donner une douce saveur florale.","Ajoutez le pain frit en une seule couche au lait crémeux – vous devrez probablement le faire en deux fois. Faites ramollir le pain à feu doux pendant 2-3 minutes, puis retirez-le à l''aide d''une écumoire et disposez-le en une seule couche sur une assiette de service.","Baissez le feu à moyen et faites réduire le lait resté dans la casserole pendant quelques minutes, en remuant tout le temps jusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux – il doit avoir la consistance d''une double crème.","Laissez le lait refroidir et épaissir pendant 15 minutes, puis versez-le sur le pain. Réfrigérer toute la nuit pour que le pain ramollisse.","Saupoudrer d''amandes hachées et de feuille d''argent, le cas échéant, pour une occasion spéciale. Servir frais."]','2026-01-11 00:06:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10636,3858,'fr','Kalakand','Préparez cette friandise indienne aromatique pour un régal. Il a une texture douce et granuleuse et est infusé de cardamome et d''eau de rose.','["6 gousses de cardamome, graines retirées","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","250 g de paner maison, grossièrement émietté (voir recettes associées ci-dessous)","Boîte de 397 g de lait concentré","quelques gouttes d''eau de rose","3 cuillères à soupe de pistaches hachées"]','["Réduisez les graines de cardamome en poudre avec le sucre à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier.","Faites chauffer le mélange de paneer, de lait concentré et de cardamome dans l''awkor karahi à feu moyen, en remuant souvent pour éviter qu''il ne colle. Une fois à ébullition, baissez le feu et laissez cuire, en remuant continuellement, pendant 5 à 7 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe et quitte les parois de la casserole. Visez une consistance douce et tombante avec une texture granuleuse.","Éteignez le feu et ajoutez suffisamment d’eau de rose pour donner une saveur subtile. Laisser refroidir et épaissir dans la poêle pendant 10 min.","Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Étalez le kalakand sur un rectangle de 2 cm d''épaisseur. Pressez les pistaches sur la surface et laissez-les refroidir avant de les mettre au réfrigérateur.","Une fois le kalakand ferme, coupez-le en carrés de 3 cm et servez-le à température ambiante. Se conserve jusqu''à quatre jours dans un récipient hermétique au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:06:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10637,6857,'fr','Boondi Laddu','Célébrez Diwali avec le boondi laddu, une friandise indienne traditionnelle, faite avec des gouttelettes de farine de pois chiches frites imbibées de cardamome et de sirop de safran.','["¼ cuillère à café de brins de safran","8 gousses de cardamome verte, graines uniquement","225 g de sucre en poudre, plus 1 cuillère à café","125g de farine","1 litre d''huile de tournesol ou 500 g de ghee pour la friture, plus un peu pour vos mains","2 cuillères à soupe de pistaches hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de pignons de pin hachés ou de graines de melon séchées (char magaz)","225 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Broyer les brins de safran à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier, puis transférer dans un petit bol et laisser tremper dans 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau tiède pendant 1 heure.","Pendant ce temps, à l''aide du même pilon et du même mortier, réduisez les graines de cardamome en poudre avec 1 cuillère à café de sucre.","Tamisez la farine de pois chiches dans un grand bol et ajoutez-y suffisamment d''eau pour obtenir une pâte ayant la consistance d''une crème double.","Remplissez à moitié l''awkor karahi d''huile et faites-le chauffer à 180°C. C''est prêt lorsqu''un cube de pain brunit en 30 secondes.","Pour les gouttelettes de farine de gramme, vous aurez besoin d''une écumoire ou d''un tamis métallique grossier, bien que les gouttelettes de farine de gramme n''auront pas une forme ronde une fois frites. Tenez la cuillère ou le tamis métallique à 2 cm au-dessus de l''huile chaude. A l''aide d''une louche, versez délicatement une louche de pâte sur la cuillère en poussant délicatement la pâte à travers les trous de la cuillère ou tamisez en effectuant un mouvement circulaire avec le fond arrondi de la louche.","Si la pâte est trop fine, les gouttelettes s''aplatiront, ajoutez donc un peu plus de farine de pois chiches tamisée si nécessaire. Si elle est trop épaisse, les gouttelettes seront allongées et auront des queues vaporeuses – une cuillerée d''eau ramollira la pâte.","Faites frire les gouttelettes de farine par lots pendant 30 à 40 secondes sans brunir, puis égouttez-les sur du papier absorbant. Si vous utilisez une écumoire, essuyez-la avec du papier absorbant entre chaque lot.","Une fois les gouttelettes refroidies, brisez les grumeaux avec vos doigts et transférez-les dans un grand bol. Incorporer la cardamome moulue, les pistaches et les pignons de pin (ou les graines de melon) et réserver.","Pour le sirop, dissolvez le sucre dans 225 ml d''eau et faites bouillir environ 10 minutes à feu moyen, jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à épaissir. La température doit atteindre 110°C sur un thermomètre à sucre.","Incorporez le safran et son eau de trempage et faites bouillir le sirop encore 1 minute. Retirer du feu et verser le sirop chaud sur les gouttelettes de farine de pois chiches. À l’aide du dos d’une cuillère en bois, écrasez grossièrement un tiers des gouttelettes dans le sirop. Couvrir le bol et laisser refroidir avant de refroidir le mélange pendant 1 à 2 heures. Cela épaissira le sirop et facilitera la mise en forme du laddus.","Huilez légèrement vos mains, pressez fermement et façonnez des portions du mélange en 14 à 16 boules, de la taille d''une noix. Disposez-les sur un plateau recouvert de papier sulfurisé et conservez les laddus dans une boîte hermétique au réfrigérateur. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à une semaine. Servir à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:06:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10638,6861,'fr','Vermicelles épicés à la cardamome (semiya payasam)','Offrez-vous un dessert indien populaire à base de brins de vermicelles frits mijotés dans du lait de cardamome. Un régal parfait pour les festivités, il est crémeux, sucré et doré','["10 gousses de cardamome verte, graines retirées","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 litre de lait entier","75g de ghee","75 g de vermicelles fins grossièrement écrasés","Les 100 g de jargy gaggery sont un giggery.","250 ml de lait de coco","50 g de raisins secs trempés dans l''eau chaude pendant 10 min puis égouttés","50 g de noix de cajou, frites jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées dans 1 cuillère à café de ghee"]','["Réduisez en poudre les graines de cardamome avec le sucre en poudre à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Versez le lait dans une casserole et portez à ébullition sur feu moyen en remuant de temps en temps.","Faites chauffer le ghee dans l''awkor karahi à feu moyen et faites frire les vermicelles pendant 3 à 5 minutes, en remuant continuellement, jusqu''à ce qu''ils noircissent.","Versez le lait bouillant sur les vermicelles et poursuivez la cuisson en remuant constamment pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe. Incorporer le jaggery ou le sucre muscovado et cuire encore 2-3 minutes.","Fouettez le lait de coco pour éliminer les grumeaux et versez-le dans la casserole. Portez à ébullition, puis incorporez les raisins secs. Verser dans des petits bols et répartir sur les noix de cajou frites avant de servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10639,3860,'fr','Chat aussi','Savourez une collation populaire lors d’un festival indien. Ces pommes de terre frites citronnées sont assaisonnées de cumin et de chaat masala, avec du piment vert, de l''oignon rouge et de la grenade.','["750 g de pommes de terre (Maris Piper ou King Edward)","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé finement","30 g de gingembre pelé et finement râpé","2 piments verts épépinés et finement hachés","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de chaat masala","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","½ cuillère à café de grains de poivre noir grossièrement moulus","1 citron, jus","1 litre d''huile de tournesol, pour la friture","2 cuillères à soupe de relish à la coriandre (voir « va bien avec » ci-dessous)","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux dattes et au tamarin (voir « va bien avec » ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre grossièrement hachée","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de grenade"]','["Épluchez les pommes de terre, coupez-les en morceaux de 3 cm et rincez-les sous l''eau froide pendant 2 minutes. Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée, ajoutez les pommes de terre et laissez mijoter à découvert jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Égouttez et versez les pommes de terre sur une grille de refroidissement. Laissez refroidir, puis réfrigérez-les pendant 30 minutes – cela séchera la surface.","Mélangez l''oignon avec le gingembre, les piments verts, le cumin, le chaat masala, la poudre de piment et le poivre noir. Ajoutez le jus de citron et réservez.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans l''awkor karahi à 180°C, soit lorsqu''un cube de pain brunit en 30 secondes. Faites frire les pommes de terre par lots jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, égouttez-les sur du papier absorbant et assaisonnez de sel.","Mélangez les pommes de terre chaudes avec le mélange d''oignons et de piment. Arroser de sauce aux dattes et au tamarin, verser sur la relish à la coriandre et saupoudrer de graines de coriandre et de grenade. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10640,4297,'fr','Dhal à la noix de coco en une seule poêle','Préparez un dhal à la noix de coco polyvalent. C’est le repas végétalien le plus réconfortant, le tout préparé dans une seule poêle, et il peut également être utilisé comme base pour préparer d’autres currys.','["300 g de lentilles rouges","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour arroser","2 oignons, finement tranchés","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées ou hachées finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché finement","5 feuilles de curry (facultatif)","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de coriandre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 piment rouge séché, laissé entier","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","400 g de lait de coco en boîte","feuilles de coriandre, gingembre tranché et piment vert tranché, pour servir"]','["Rincez les lentilles jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire, puis égouttez-les. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle peu profonde et faites revenir les oignons à feu doux pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer, en ajoutant plus d''huile si la poêle semble sèche. Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et laissez cuire encore 30 secondes. Éparpillez les feuilles de curry, le cas échéant, et toutes les épices et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes, puis incorporez la purée de tomates et laissez cuire encore une minute.","Incorporez les lentilles en vous assurant qu''elles sont bien enrobées d''épices, puis versez dessus le lait de coco et 850 ml d''eau. Porter à ébullition en remuant de temps en temps, puis laisser mijoter environ 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres et onctueuses. Retirez le piment entier et jetez-le, puis assaisonnez généreusement de sel. Le dhal peut maintenant être laissé refroidir, puis congelé en portions ou en un seul lot dans un grand récipient en plastique. Décongeler complètement avant de réchauffer dans une poêle à feu doux, en ajoutant un peu d''eau pour détendre si nécessaire.","Servir avec une pincée de coriandre, de gingembre tranché et de piment et arroser d''un peu plus d''huile."]','2026-01-11 00:06:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10641,4513,'fr','Poulet et riz au curry en une seule casserole','Préparez ce dîner familial simple en une seule casserole, avec du poulet, du chou-fleur, des haricots et des pois aux douces saveurs de curry. Servir avec du yaourt et du chutney de mangue en accompagnement','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de ghee","2 gros oignons, finement tranchés","4 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché finement","4 cuillères à soupe bombées de pâte de curry douce","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","4 gousses de cardamome, écrasées","1 bâton de cannelle","4 petites poitrines de poulet sans peau ou 8 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées (environ 600 g), coupées en bouchées","250 g de riz basmati rincé","600 ml de bouillon de poulet","200 ml de lait de coco","75 g de petits pois surgelés","150 g de haricots verts, cerclés et coupés en deux","½ chou-fleur (environ 225 g) cassé en petits bouquets","50 g de raisins secs ou raisins secs","feuilles de coriandre, amandes effilées, yaourt nature et chutney de mangue, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte (avec couvercle) à feu moyen, puis faites revenir l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et parfumés, environ 10 minutes. Incorporez la pâte de curry, le curcuma, la cardamome et la cannelle et remuez pendant quelques minutes. Ajouter le poulet et cuire encore quelques minutes en remuant pour colorer de tous les côtés.","Ajoutez le riz, remuez bien, puis incorporez le bouillon, le lait de coco, une généreuse pincée d''assaisonnement, les légumes et les raisins secs. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu, mettez le couvercle et laissez cuire environ 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit absorbée, que le poulet et le riz soient bien cuits et que les légumes soient tendres. Assaisonner au goût. Retirez la cardamome et le bâton de cannelle, puis répartissez-les sur les amandes et la coriandre. Servir avec du yaourt et du chutney de mangue en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10642,7429,'fr','Choleh bhature ''naan''','Savourez un savoureux plat punjabi de pois chiches épicés servis avec du bhature – ici, ils sont frits à sec, ce qui en fait plutôt un naan, et accompagnés de raita et d''une salade de kachumber.','["¼ de concombre, coupé en dés","3 tomates, coupées en dés","1 gros oignon rouge, coupé en dés","2 cuillères à café de sauce à la menthe","1 citron, jus","175 g de concombre râpé","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","500 ml de yaourt nature","500 ml de lait","10 g de coriandre finement hachée","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 oignons moyens, finement hachés","5 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","4 piments verts, finement hachés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","2 cuillères à café de paprika","1 cuillère à café de methi (fenugrec séché)","4 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches rincés et égouttés","une poignée de coriandre hachée pour servir","1kg de farine autolevante","250 ml de yaourt nature","2 cuillères à soupe de pomme de terre en poudre (Smash ou alternative)","100 ml d''huile sans saveur, plus un peu plus","1 cuillère à café de sucre","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café d''ajwain","50g de beurre salé","4 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre fraîche hachée","2 cuillères à café de calonge (graines de nigelle)"]','["Pour préparer la salade kachumber, mélangez tous les ingrédients dans un grand bol et réservez.","Pour préparer la raita, mélangez tous les ingrédients dans un grand bol et réservez. Au moment de servir, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de sel si nécessaire et mélangez bien (si vous ajoutez le sel avant cela, cela fera sortir l''eau, donc ne l''ajoutez que juste avant de servir).","Pour faire le choleh, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole, puis ajoutez les oignons et faites cuire 8 à 10 minutes à feu moyen-doux, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre et le piment et laissez cuire encore 2-3 minutes. Ajoutez un peu d''eau dans la casserole si le mélange colle au fond. Ajoutez les tomates et un autre peu d''eau, poursuivez la cuisson pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons et les tomates soient bien mélangés. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à café de sel et les épices et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit bien incorporé et que l''huile se sépare. Ajoutez un peu d''eau si nécessaire pour éviter qu''elle ne colle au fond de la casserole.","Ajoutez les pois chiches et 500 ml d''eau. Cuire à feu moyen pendant 10 minutes. Une fois ramollis, à l''aide d''un presse-purée, écrasez les pois chiches jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient partiellement brisés (cela aide à épaissir la sauce), puis laissez mijoter encore 10 minutes. Parsemer de coriandre, pour servir.","Pour faire le bhature, mélangez tous les ingrédients avec une cuillère en métal dans un grand bol, jusqu''à former une pâte hirsute. Huilez un grand bol et votre main avec un peu d’huile sans saveur. Ensuite, pétrissez jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit élastique et bien mélangée. Si la pâte semble sèche, ajoutez de l''eau tiède au fur et à mesure. Étalez un peu d''huile sur la surface de la pâte, transférez-la dans le bol huilé et couvrez-la d''un torchon humide. Laisser reposer 2 à 3 heures.","Pendant ce temps, si vous préparez le beurre, faites fondre le beurre dans une petite poêle et ajoutez l''ail. Faites frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient aromatiques, ajoutez les graines de coriandre et de nigelle hachées et réservez jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Divisez la pâte en 16 portions égales. Prenez un morceau de pâte, formez une boule et, à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie, roulez jusqu''à ce qu''elle fasse environ 1 cm d''épaisseur et de forme ovale. Faites chauffer une poêle à frire/thava jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude et déposez-y la pâte. Des bulles apparaîtront à la surface après environ une minute. Retournez-le et faites cuire de l''autre côté pendant 2 minutes. Étalez un peu de beurre dessus et servez avec tous les accompagnements."]','2026-01-11 00:06:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10643,6481,'fr','Pakoras au poulet','Préparez un lot de ces pakoras dorés croustillants comme collation ou dans le cadre d''un repas indien. Servir chaud avec une sauce chili douce ou un chutney vert','["700 g de poulet désossé, coupé en bouchées","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","50g de farine de riz","40 g de farine tamisée","3 piments séchés écrasés ou 3 piments verts finement hachés","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","½ cuillère à café de curry en poudre","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de cumin","2 petits oignons, hachés","un petit bouquet de coriandre finement hachée","huile végétale, pour frire","sauce chili douce ou chutney vert, pour servir"]','["Mettez le poulet dans un grand bol, puis utilisez vos mains pour enrober les morceaux de maïzena. Incorporer la farine de riz, suivie de la farine de pois chiches. Ajoutez les piments, les épices, l''oignon, la coriandre et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Mélangez bien avec vos mains.","Ajoutez progressivement environ 150 ml d''eau jusqu''à ce que les ingrédients soient devenus humides et légèrement mouillés. Vous n’aurez peut-être pas besoin de toute l’eau (en ajouter trop empêchera le mélange de pakora de se lier).","Remplissez une poêle profonde au maximum au tiers avec de l''huile végétale et faites chauffer à 180°C. Pressez une petite quantité du mélange de pakora avant de le plonger délicatement dans l''huile chaude avec une cuillère. Faire frire pendant 8 à 10 minutes, en retournant régulièrement, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites et dorées de partout. Réserver sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant pendant que vous répétez avec le reste du mélange, en faisant frire par petites quantités. Servir chaud avec une sauce chili douce ou un chutney vert."]','2026-01-11 00:06:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10644,3886,'fr','Poulet rôti bengali','Servez ce poulet épicé dans un masala aromatique en entrée lors d''un festin de famille. Plein de saveurs, c''est un plat bengali populaire que vous êtes sûr de cuisiner encore et encore.','["4 à 6 cuisses ou pilons de poulet avec os, chair coupée","1 cuillère à café de curry doux en poudre","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","5 cuillères à soupe de ghee ou d''huile","3 feuilles de laurier","2 gros bâtons de cannelle","3 gousses de cardamome","2 gros oignons, finement tranchés","6 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","1 cuillère à café de gingembre râpé","2 cuillères à café de curry doux en poudre","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","5 piments verts, tranchés, pour servir","coriandre hachée, pour servir"]','["Mettez le poulet dans un bol, ajoutez les épices de la marinade et le yaourt avec ½ cuillère à café de sel et mélangez bien. Le poulet peut être laissé mariner quelques heures ou cuit immédiatement – ​​le laisser mariner le rendra plus tendre.","Faites fondre le ghee dans une poêle antiadhésive. Faites frire le poulet 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Retirer de la poêle et transférer dans le bol, en laissant le ghee dans la poêle.","Gardez la casserole sur le feu et grattez-la pour libérer les morceaux caramélisés collés au fond. Ajoutez les feuilles de laurier, la cannelle et les gousses de cardamome et faites frire jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à sentir aromatique. Ajoutez les oignons et l''ail, suivis du gingembre et de 1 à 1½ cuillère à café de sel. Remuer, couvrir et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et translucide, environ 8 à 10 minutes.","Incorporez le reste des épices et faites revenir à feu doux pendant 5 à 8 minutes. Ajoutez 200 ml d''eau, couvrez et laissez cuire encore 3 à 4 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le ghee se sépare du masala (il doit bouillonner sur les bords de la casserole).","Remettez le poulet dans la poêle, y compris le jus de viande éventuel. Versez un peu de masala sur le poulet et couvrez. Cuire encore 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Incorporer les piments verts tranchés et la coriandre hachée et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10645,7431,'fr','Halwa','Essayez de préparer du halwa, un dessert indien traditionnel à base de semoule ou de carottes, ainsi que de noix et de cardamome. Le nôtre est fait avec de la semoule','["100 g de sucre en poudre","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire orange (facultatif)","6 gousses de cardamome","100g de ghee","50 g de pistaches hachées","175g de semoule (grossière ou fine)","puris ou parathas, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer 250 ml d''eau dans une casserole jusqu''à ébullition, puis ajoutez le sucre et le colorant alimentaire, le cas échéant.","Retirez les graines des gousses de cardamome et jetez-les, puis ajoutez 3 coques de cardamome dans la poêle. Faire bouillir pendant plusieurs minutes, puis transférer dans un pichet ou un bol résistant à la chaleur.","Faites chauffer le ghee dans la même poêle, puis ajoutez les cosses de cardamome restantes et les pistaches. Faites frire 1 min, puis ajoutez la semoule. Faire griller quelques minutes en remuant fréquemment pour éviter de brûler. Remettez le sirop de sucre chaud dans la casserole en remuant continuellement pour éviter les grumeaux jusqu''à ce que tout le liquide soit absorbé. Le halwa cuit devrait se mouler facilement. Retirez les coques de cardamome et servez chaud avec des puris ou des parathas, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10646,3888,'fr','Handesh','Préparez un lot de handesh sucré et doré, une collation bengali frite à base de farine et de mélasse de dattes. Délicieux avec une tasse de thé ou mangé avec du lait chaud comme des céréales','["320g de farine de riz","145 g de farine nature","320 g de mélasse de dattes (morsa gur)","50 g de sucre blanc semoule","huile végétale, pour la friture"]','["Mélanger les farines, la mélasse et le sucre dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Ajoutez progressivement jusqu''à 150 ml d''eau tiède pour obtenir une pâte très épaisse, en mélangeant avec les mains propres. Émiettez les gros morceaux de farine, de mélasse ou de sucre avec vos doigts. Ajoutez encore 250 ml d''eau, petit à petit, jusqu''à obtenir une pâte qui se verse en un jet constant sans se casser – la quantité d''eau variera en fonction de la consistance de la mélasse. Si la pâte vous semble encore trop épaisse, ajoutez un peu d''eau jusqu''à obtenir la bonne consistance. Si vous ajoutez trop d''eau, ajoutez plus de farine jusqu''à obtenir la bonne consistance. Couvrir le bol et laisser reposer à température ambiante pendant 4 à 5 heures ou toute la nuit.","Faites chauffer une généreuse quantité d''huile dans un grand wok à feu vif (environ 200°C si vous utilisez un thermomètre). Lorsqu''il fait très chaud, réduisez le feu à moyen – cela garantira que l''huile est suffisamment chaude pour que le handesh gonfle immédiatement sans brûler. Versez un peu de pâte directement au centre du wok à l''aide d''un pichet ou d''une louche et attendez quelques secondes qu''elle gonfle lentement et remonte à la surface de l''huile. Éloignez-le du centre de la casserole avec une cuillère et faites cuire 25 à 30 secondes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré et cuit à l''intérieur – vous pouvez en ouvrir un pour vérifier qu''il est bien cuit. Retirer du wok à l''aide d''une écumoire et déposer sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte. Dégustez chaud avec une tasse de thé ou déchirez-le en petits morceaux et recouvrez-le de lait chaud pour le manger comme des céréales."]','2026-01-11 00:06:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10647,7433,'fr','Curry de chou-fleur et haricots verts','Essayez ce curry aromatique en utilisant deux mélanges d''épices : le garam masala et la poudre de cinq épices chinoises. Le yaourt à la noix de coco donne une texture crémeuse sans calories supplémentaires','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce (environ 30 g), tranché finement en lanières","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de curry","320 g de courge butternut coupée en dés (poids préparé)","250 g de pommes de terre grelots, coupées en deux ou en quartiers","225 g de riz basmati brun","piments rouges épépinés et finement hachés","4 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","1 cuillère à café de cinq épices chinoises (vérifiez l''étiquette pour vous assurer qu''il n''y a pas de sel ajouté)","4 tomates, hachées","400 g de chou-fleur, gros bouquets et feuilles hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","320 g de haricots verts, parés et coupés en longueurs","150 g de yaourt à la noix de coco","15 g de coriandre fraîche hachée","½ citron vert, jus"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu doux. Ajoutez le gingembre et les feuilles de curry et faites revenir en remuant pendant environ une minute. Ajoutez la courge et les pommes de terre, augmentez le feu à moyen et faites frire encore 5 minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir le riz pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.","Répartissez le piment sur la courge et les pommes de terre avec l''ail, le garam masala et les cinq épices. Remuer brièvement, puis ajouter les tomates, le chou-fleur, 400 ml d''eau et la poudre de bouillon. Portez à ébullition, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 10 min. Ajoutez les haricots et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que tous les légumes soient tendres, mais conservent leur forme.","Éteignez le feu et incorporez le yaourt, la coriandre et le jus de citron vert. Servir la moitié avec la moitié du riz. Réfrigérez les deux portions restantes de curry et de riz pendant une autre nuit. Se conserveront couvertes au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours. Réchauffer le riz au micro-ondes et le curry dans une poêle sur feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:06:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10648,3936,'fr','Raviolis aux lentilles au yaourt (dahi bhalla)','Préparez ces boulettes moelleuses aux lentilles comme collation ou comme plat d''accompagnement. Ils sont enrobés de yaourt et servis avec une relish à la coriandre, ainsi que notre sauce au tamarin et aux dattes','["65 g d''urad dal blanc pelé (dhuli urad), trempé toute la nuit","65 g de dal mungo jaune, trempé toute la nuit","¾ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","¼ cuillère à café de grains de poivre noir grossièrement moulus","40 g de gingembre pelé et haché grossièrement","2 piments verts épépinés et hachés grossièrement","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","huile végétale ou de tournesol pour la friture","1 carton de 268 ml de babeurre","300 ml de yaourt grec ou nature","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","3-4 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","2 cuillères à soupe de relish à la coriandre","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux dattes et au tamarin","quelques feuilles de coriandre"]','["Égouttez les deux lots de lentilles à l’aide d’une passoire et jetez l’eau de trempage. Versez dans un robot culinaire et ajoutez le cumin moulu, les grains de poivre, le gingembre et les piments verts. Réduire en une pâte molle, en ajoutant 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau si nécessaire.","Versez le mélange de lentilles dans un bol et battez vigoureusement pendant 5 à 7 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange devienne léger et mousseux. Il est plus facile de le faire dans un mixeur équipé d''un batteur.","Faites chauffer l’huile dans l’awkor karahi à feu moyen, en vous assurant qu’elle n’est pas pleine aux deux tiers. Incorporez le bicarbonate de soude au mélange de lentilles, puis utilisez deux cuillères à dessert pour ramasser et façonner délicatement des boulettes de la taille d''une petite noix. En travaillant par lots, plongez les boulettes dans l''huile à l''aide d''une écumoire.","Faites frire les raviolis 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté, en les retournant avec une écumoire, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Retirer et égoutter sur du papier absorbant. Vous devriez avoir 22 à 24 boulettes lorsque toute la pâte est épuisée. Annuler.","Fouetter le babeurre avec une quantité égale d''eau froide dans un grand plat peu profond allant au four. Enrober les boulettes du mélange de babeurre et laisser toute la nuit au réfrigérateur (elles ramolliront en trempant).","Le lendemain, pressez délicatement les raviolis pour éliminer tout excès de babeurre et disposez-les sur une assiette de service.","Pour servir, fouettez le yaourt avec le sucre et suffisamment de lait pour créer une consistance juste assez épaisse pour enrober les raviolis. Enrober les raviolis de yaourt et saupoudrer de cumin moulu et de poudre de piment. Arroser de sauce à la coriandre et aux dattes et au tamarin, puis saupoudrer de feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10649,7435,'fr','Crêpes indiennes à la crème de safran et eau de rose (malpua & rabri)','Dégustez des crêpes frites indiennes comme gâterie sucrée. Souvent servis lors du festival Holi, ils sont trempés dans un sirop de safran et de cardamome et nappés d''une crème à l''eau de rose.','["1l de lait Jersey entier","25g de sucre en poudre","¼ cuillère à café de brins de safran trempés dans 1 cuillère à soupe de lait","1 cuillère à café d''eau de rose","75 g de farine nature","¼ cuillère à café de sel fin","75 g de lait entier en poudre","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","250 ml de lait entier","ghee, pour une friture peu profonde","250 g de sucre en poudre","6 gousses de cardamome verte, percées","½ cuillère à café de brins de safran, trempés dans 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau tiède pendant 1 heure","25 g de pistaches hachées","pétales de roses séchées (facultatif)"]','["Pour faire le rabri, faites chauffer le lait à feu moyen, puis faites bouillir jusqu''à ce qu''il réduise en crème. Il est préférable d’utiliser du awok, du karahi ou une cocotte solide pour cela – vous voulez que le lait réduise rapidement afin qu’il conserve sa couleur crémeuse sans brunir. Remuer continuellement en raclant les parois de la poêle pendant la cuisson.","Au bout d''environ 20 minutes, le lait aura réduit des deux tiers et aura la consistance d''une crème double. Incorporez le sucre en poudre et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Ajoutez les brins de safran ainsi que le lait de trempage et l''eau de rose. Versez la crème dans un bol et laissez-la refroidir avant de la transférer au réfrigérateur.","Pour préparer la pâte au malpua, tamisez la farine et le sel dans un bol moyen et mélangez-y le lait en poudre et les graines de fenouil. Faites un puits au milieu de la farine et incorporez suffisamment de lait pour obtenir une pâte lisse – visez la consistance d''une crème double. Couvrez et laissez reposer 20 min à température ambiante.","Pour faire le sirop, mettez le sucre dans une casserole avec 300 ml d''eau, faites chauffer doucement en remuant pour dissoudre (ne pas laisser bouillir l''eau). Ajoutez les gousses de cardamome, puis laissez mijoter 5 min. Éteignez le feu et incorporez progressivement le safran avec son eau de trempage. Couvrez la poêle et gardez le sirop au chaud pendant que vous préparez les crêpes.","Faites chauffer suffisamment de ghee dans une poêle à frire profonde pour créer une profondeur de 3 cm une fois fondu. Fouettez la pâte – elle aura légèrement épaissi et devrait maintenant avoir une consistance enrobée. Ajoutez un peu plus de lait si nécessaire.","Une fois que le ghee atteint 130°C, ou lorsqu''un cube de pain est tombé en brun en 1 minute, déposez délicatement des cuillères à soupe de pâte, en laissant de la place pour qu''elles se propagent. Chaque crêpe doit mesurer environ 7 cm de diamètre lorsqu''elle s''étale. Attention à ne pas surcharger la poêle.","Faites cuire les crêpes par lots pendant 2-3 minutes. Une fois la pâte prise, augmentez légèrement le feu et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que les crêpes soient dorées. Retirer de l''huile à l''aide d''une tranche de poisson et égoutter sur du papier absorbant.","Ajoutez les crêpes chaudes au sirop chaud par lots, en les laissant infuser pendant 2-3 minutes. Égouttez les crêpes, puis transférez-les dans une assiette de service et couvrez pour les garder au chaud. Répétez le processus avec le reste de la pâte et du sirop – il devrait y avoir 14 à 16 petites crêpes.","Versez tout surplus de sirop de safran et de cardamome autour des crêpes et garnissez chacune d''une généreuse portion de rabri réfrigéré. Pour servir, parsemez de pistaches hachées et de pétales de roses, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10650,3938,'fr','Brocoli rôti au cumin et yaourt au citron confit','Savourez ce brocoli rôti au cumin avec du yaourt au citron confit comme accompagnement vibrant. C''est une belle combinaison d''épices, de textures et de couleurs','["500 g de brocoli à germes violets, paré","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","2 petites tranches de pain blanc rassis","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","1⁄2 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1⁄2 cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","1 citron confit, haché finement, les graines jetées","100 g de yaourt entier","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de coriandre finement hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de persil finement hachées","1⁄2 gousse d''ail, finement râpée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Vérifiez que les tiges du brocoli ont à peu près la même épaisseur, sinon, coupez en deux les plus grosses tiges du brocoli dans le sens de la longueur. Frottez le brocoli avec l''huile, puis saupoudrez-le de cumin et d''un peu d''assaisonnement. Versez sur une plaque à pâtisserie en une seule couche et faites rôtir pendant environ 15 à 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres avec juste un peu de légère carbonisation, en les retournant à mi-cuisson.","Pour la chapelure, chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Déchirez le pain en petits morceaux et faites cuire au four pendant 5 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant, puis versez-le dans un robot culinaire et mixez-le dans la chapelure.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu doux, puis ajoutez l''ail, les épices, la chapelure et un peu d''assaisonnement. Faire revenir en remuant régulièrement pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Transférer dans une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant pour absorber tout excès d''huile.","Pour le yaourt, mélanger tous les ingrédients et assaisonner selon votre goût. Servir le brocoli avec la chapelure parsemée et le yaourt à côté pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:06:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10651,7437,'fr','rôti d''agneau','Préparez cet époustouflant bhuna d''agneau un jour ou deux avant un grand festin de famille : les currys mijotés sont meilleurs lorsque les saveurs ont le temps de se développer.','["600 g de filet ou d''épaule d''agneau coupé en gros morceaux","6 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de malt","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu si besoin","2 oignons, finement hachés","10 feuilles de curry","2 piments séchés ou ½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de graines de fenugrec ou de fenugrec moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café de garam masala"]','["Pour préparer la marinade, mélangez les ingrédients avec une grosse pincée de sel dans un grand bol. Incorporer l''agneau, couvrir et laisser mariner 1 heure à température ambiante ou réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Pour la sauce, faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte résistante au feu et faites revenir les oignons pendant 10 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés. Versez plus d''huile si la poêle devient sèche. Ajoutez les feuilles de curry et les piments et faites revenir quelques minutes, puis ajoutez les épices et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons commencent à caraméliser.","Versez l''agneau avec la marinade et augmentez le feu. Cuire en remuant pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit doré. Ajouter le concentré de tomates et cuire 1 min, puis incorporer les tomates et 100 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition, baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez cuire en remuant de temps en temps pendant 1 h 20 jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit tendre.","Découvrir et cuire encore 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait réduit et épaissi. Retirer du feu, incorporer le garam marsala et assaisonner. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours ou au congélateur pendant deux mois."]','2026-01-11 00:06:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10652,5680,'fr','Nous sommes','Envie d''épices après le traditionnel déjeuner de Noël ? Vous voulez transformer vos restes de dinde en un tout nouveau plat ? Cette savoureuse dinde tikka masala est faite pour vous','["huile de tournesol","oignon, finement haché","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées ou finement râpées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de paprika","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","400 g de boîte de passata ou de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de chutney de mangue","100 ml de crème double","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature (facultatif)","environ 600 g de restes de dinde rôtie, coupés en gros morceaux","coriandre hachée, amandes effilées grillées, riz cuit à la vapeur et pains naan à l''ail, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte ou une poêle peu profonde à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporer l''ail, le gingembre, le piment et toutes les épices, et cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à une pâte. Incorporer la purée de tomates, la passata ou les tomates hachées et le chutney de mangue et porter à ébullition. Cuire encore 10 minutes.","Incorporer la majeure partie de la crème et du yaourt, le cas échéant, et remettre le mélange à ébullition. Ajouter la dinde et continuer à laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude. Retirer du feu, arroser du reste de crème et mélanger brièvement. Parsemer de coriandre et d''amandes effilées et servir avec le riz et les pains naan en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10653,6219,'fr','Pilaf de carottes au chutney de coriandre','Essayez ce pilaf sain fourré pour un repas facile en milieu de semaine. Avec des noix de cajou, des légumes et des épices, c’est non seulement savoureux mais aussi économique. Garnir de chutney de coriandre','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","1 gros oignon, finement tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre râpé","2 piments verts, tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de graines de coriandre écrasées","4 gousses de cardamome, meurtries","½ bâton de cannelle","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","400 g de carottes pelées et ½ râpées grossièrement, ½ tranchées en biais","300 g de riz basmati bien rincé","600 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","gros bouquet de coriandre finement hachée (tiges incluses)","60 g de noix de cajou grillées et hachées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","1 gros oignon, finement tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre râpé","2 piments verts, tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de graines de coriandre écrasées","4 gousses de cardamome, meurtries","½ bâton de cannelle","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","400 g de carottes pelées et ½ râpées grossièrement, ½ tranchées en biais","300 g de riz basmati bien rincé","600 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","gros bouquet de coriandre finement hachée (tiges incluses)","60 g de noix de cajou grillées et hachées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle munie d''un couvercle hermétique. Faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel à feu moyen pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Retirer de la poêle avec une écumoire et égoutter sur du papier absorbant en laissant l''huile dans la poêle.","Ajoutez la moitié du gingembre, la moitié du piment, tout l''ail, les épices et les deux types de carottes dans la poêle et faites frire pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tranches de carottes commencent à devenir dorées. Ajoutez le riz, remuez brièvement, puis ajoutez le bouillon, une poignée de coriandre, une bonne pincée de sel et du poivre noir moulu. Portez à ébullition et dès que l''ébullition commence, baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez cuire 12 à 15 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le reste du gingembre et du piment vert, la plupart des noix de cajou et la majeure partie de la coriandre restante dans un petit mixeur avec 50 ml d''eau. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant encore 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau, si nécessaire, pour faire une sauce à la cuillère.","Lorsque tout le liquide a été absorbé dans le pilaf et que le riz est tendre, gonflez les grains avec une fourchette. Verser sur le chutney de coriandre et saupoudrer d''oignons frits, de coriandre réservée et de noix de cajou restantes pour servir.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle munie d''un couvercle hermétique. Faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel à feu moyen pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Retirer de la poêle avec une écumoire et égoutter sur du papier absorbant en laissant l''huile dans la poêle.","Ajoutez la moitié du gingembre, la moitié du piment, tout l''ail, les épices et les deux types de carottes dans la poêle et faites frire pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tranches de carottes commencent à devenir dorées. Ajoutez le riz, remuez brièvement, puis ajoutez le bouillon, une poignée de coriandre, une bonne pincée de sel et du poivre noir moulu. Portez à ébullition et dès que l''ébullition commence, baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez cuire 12 à 15 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le reste du gingembre et du piment vert, la plupart des noix de cajou et la majeure partie de la coriandre restante dans un petit mixeur avec 50 ml d''eau. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant encore 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau, si nécessaire, pour faire une sauce à la cuillère.","Lorsque tout le liquide a été absorbé dans le pilaf et que le riz est tendre, gonflez les grains avec une fourchette. Verser sur le chutney de coriandre et saupoudrer d''oignons frits, de coriandre réservée et de noix de cajou restantes pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10654,4006,'fr','Barfi aux pistaches','Savourez cette friandise indienne traditionnelle lors d''occasions spéciales telles que Diwali. Avec la texture du massepain doux, il est richement gourmand et magnifiquement épicé.','["75 g de pistaches décortiquées","6 gousses de cardamome verte","1 litre de lait entier Jersey","75 g de sucre en poudre","feuille d''argent ou pistaches hachées supplémentaires, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Mixez les pistaches dans un petit robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement hachées. Faites attention à ne pas les surmener, sinon ils deviendront gras. Annuler.","Fendez les gousses de cardamome et retirez les graines. Réduisez les graines en poudre dans un pilon et un mortier avec 1 cuillère à café de sucre.","Faites chauffer le lait dans un grand wokor karahi à feu moyen et faites bouillir, en remuant tout le temps avec une cuillère en métal, jusqu''à ce qu''il réduise en une crème épaisse – vous voulez que le lait réduise rapidement pour qu''il conserve sa couleur crémeuse sans brunir, environ 20-30 minutes. Continuez à racler les parois de la poêle pour éviter les brûlures. Le lait doit avoir quitté les parois de la casserole et avoir la consistance d''œufs brouillés.","Versez cette pâte épaisse dans un bol et laissez refroidir avant de réfrigérer pendant 2-3 heures. Vous devriez maintenant avoir 225 à 250 g de matière sèche réduite du lait, connue sous le nom de « khoya ».","Râpez grossièrement le khoya sur une râpe et mettez-le dans une cocotte solide ou un wok. Ajoutez la poudre de cardamome et le reste du sucre en poudre et faites cuire à feu doux en remuant constamment jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous et que le mélange épaississe, environ 10 minutes.","Retirez la casserole du feu, ajoutez les noix hachées et mélangez bien. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et transférer le mélange de barfi chaud sur le papier en l''étalant en un rectangle. Couvrir d''une autre feuille de papier sulfurisé et rouler délicatement le barfi en un rectangle de 16 x 19 cm d''environ ½ cm d''épaisseur avec un rouleau à pâtisserie. Laisser poser 3 à 4 heures. Si votre cuisine est très chaude, mettez la plaque au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes.","Retirez la feuille de papier supérieure. Posez une feuille de feuille d''argent, si vous en utilisez, sur le barfi, côté argent tourné vers le bas. Frottez doucement le dos du papier avec vos doigts, la feuille d''argent devrait se transférer sur le mélange – essayez de ne pas toucher la feuille d''argent avec vos doigts car elle y collerait. Ou encore, pressez les pistaches hachées sur le mélange encore chaudes, si vous le souhaitez.","Coupez le barfi ferme en losanges de 3 x 4 cm. Se conserve à température ambiante dans une boîte hermétique pendant 3 à 4 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:06:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10655,7441,'fr','Riz au lait indien (kheer)','Célébrez Diwali avec ce délicieux riz au lait indien cuit lentement. Parsemé de fruits secs, il présente une saveur florale légèrement épicée et une belle onctuosité.','["½ cuillère à café de brins de safran","2 litres de lait entier","20 gousses de cardamome verte, percées avec la pointe d''un couteau","100 g de riz basmati ou à grains longs","100 g de sucre en poudre","100 ml de crème double","2 cuillères à café d''eau de rose pure","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes blanchies, râpées","50 g de raisins secs trempés dans l''eau chaude"]','["Mettez les brins de safran dans un petit bol et trempez-les dans 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau tiède. Écrasez les tiges avec le dos d’une cuillère à café – cela aidera à libérer la saveur et la couleur.","Faites chauffer le lait avec les gousses de cardamome verte percées dans une poêle solide. Quand arrive le point d''ébullition, répartissez le riz dans le lait, baissez le feu et laissez mijoter jusqu''à ce que le riz se décompose et soit vraiment tendre, environ 40 minutes. Remuez souvent pour éviter que le riz ne brûle au fond de la casserole.","Ajoutez le sucre au riz cuit et faites chauffer jusqu''à dissolution. Vous pouvez retirer les gousses de cardamome si vous le souhaitez.","Incorporer la crème et ajouter progressivement l''eau de rose et suffisamment de safran et son liquide de trempage pour parfumer légèrement le kheer. Incorporer les amandes râpées et les raisins secs égouttés et servir très chaud ou frais."]','2026-01-11 00:06:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10656,4008,'fr','Ladoo de farine de gramme épicé (besan ladoo)','Essayez ce bonbon indien classique à Diwali. Besan ladoo est fait de farine de pois chiches frits aux noisettes enrichie de safran parfumé, de noix de cajou hachées et de ghee maison.','["6 gousses de cardamome verte","100 g de sucre glace tamisé","50 g de noix de cajou non salées","125 g de ghee (voir conseil ci-dessous)","200 g de farine tamisée","¼ cuillère à café de safran, trempé dans 1 cuillère à soupe de lait chaud","1 cuillère à soupe de pistaches hachées"]','["Fendez les gousses de cardamome et retirez les graines. Broyer les graines en poudre avec 1 cuillère à café de sucre glace à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Annuler.","Faites chauffer une petite poêle solide et faites rôtir les noix de cajou à feu moyen, en remuant constamment, jusqu''à ce qu''elles prennent des taches de couleur. Transférer sur une planche à découper et, une fois refroidi, hacher finement.","Faites fondre le ghee dans l''awkor karahi à feu doux, ajoutez la farine de pois chiches tamisée et faites frire, en remuant tout le temps, jusqu''à ce qu''elle noircisse et libère un arôme grillé, environ 15-20 minutes. Incorporer les noix de cajou grillées et transférer dans un bol à mélanger. Laisser jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment chaud pour être manipulé.","Ajoutez le reste du sucre, la cardamome moulue et le safran avec son liquide de trempage. Pétrir la pâte jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse, puis laisser refroidir à température ambiante.","Façonnez avec vos mains le mélange de farine de pois chiches en petites boules (ladoos) d''environ 3 cm de diamètre. Disposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Si les ladoos sont un peu mous, réfrigérez 10 minutes pour qu''ils se raffermissent. Pour servir, pressez quelques pistaches hachées sur le dessus de chacune. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique à température ambiante pendant 7 à 10 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:06:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10657,7443,'fr','Curry de crevettes au tamarin','Notre curry de crevettes au tamarin deviendra rapidement un favori de la famille. C’est rapide, sain et faible en gras et en calories','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, haché","1 piment rouge, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","1 à 2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tamarin (voir astuce ci-dessous)","250 g de crevettes crues","250 g de riz basmati cuit","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré. Incorporer le piment, l''ail et le gingembre et faire revenir encore une minute avant d''ajouter les épices. Versez les tomates cerises, faites tourner la boîte avec un peu d''eau et mélangez-la également dans la poêle.","Laisser mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates éclatent et que la sauce épaississe. Incorporer le tamarin et les crevettes et laisser mijoter pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient cuites. Servir le curry sur le riz, en parsemant de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10658,4036,'fr','Jalebi','Préparez ces friandises indiennes en faisant frire la pâte en tourbillons croustillants, puis en les trempant dans un sirop sucré à base de cardamome et de safran.','["1 litre d''huile végétale, pour la friture","amandes effilées ou pistaches finement hachées, pour servir","200 g de sucre en poudre","petite pincée de safran","1⁄4 cuillère à café de poudre de cardamome verte, ou utilisez de la cardamome moulue ordinaire","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","125 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","1⁄2 cuillère à café de jus de citron","2 cuillères à café de yaourt nature","1⁄2 cuillère à café de curcuma ou quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire jaune naturel","1 cuillère à soupe de ghee","1⁄4 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1⁄4 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le sirop. Mettez le sucre et 100 ml d''eau dans une casserole sur feu moyen. Une fois le sucre dissous, ajoutez le safran et portez à ébullition. Continuez à faire bouillir pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe et soit sirupeux – la consistance doit ressembler à celle du miel. Retirez du feu et ajoutez la cardamome et le jus de citron – le jus de citron empêche le sucre de cristalliser. Annuler.","Pour la pâte, mettre tous les ingrédients sauf la levure chimique et le bicarbe, dans un grand bol. Ajoutez lentement 150 ml d''eau et fouettez pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis ajoutez la levure chimique et le bicarbe et remuez bien – cela doit être aussi épais qu''une pâte à crêpes. Versez dans un flacon souple à embout étroit, ou versez dans une poche à douille et coupez l''embout pour avoir une petite ouverture. Versez l’huile dans une grande casserole à fond épais jusqu’à ce qu’elle ne soit pas pleine aux deux tiers et chauffez à 170-180°C, ou jusqu’à ce qu’une goutte de pâte grésille lorsqu’elle est ajoutée.","Pressez soigneusement ou faites des tourbillons de pâte directement dans l''huile chaude – faites-le par lots (vous devriez pouvoir en faire frire quatre ou cinq à la fois). Faire revenir 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Retirez le jalebi à l''aide d''une écumoire dans une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant pour l''égoutter, puis, encore chaud, plongez-le dans le sirop à l''aide d''une pince ou d''une fourchette en le retournant pour l''enrober. Saupoudrer d''amandes effilées ou de pistaches concassées. Servir aussitôt ou laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10659,7445,'fr','Bhajis cuits au four','Offrez de la saveur avec ces bhajis cuits au four servis avec du riz au citron et une salade de pois chiches. C’est un dîner sain pour quatre personnes, faible en gras et en calories.','["80 g de farine de pois chiches (gramme)","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 œufs","1 grosse carotte râpée grossièrement (environ 150g)","2-3 oignons (320 g), coupés en deux et émincés","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre haché","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour la boîte","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","150 g de riz brun facile à cuire","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","400 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud, préparé avec ½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon","2 lanières épaisses de zeste de citron (du citron dans la salade, ci-dessous)","70 g de yaourt à la noix de coco","½ citron, jus","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","⅓ paquet de coriandre hachée","4 tomates, hachées","170 g de carottes coupées en fines lanières ou râpées grossièrement","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger la farine avec les épices et le bouillon, et le concentré de tomates avec les œufs. Mélanger la carotte, l''oignon et le gingembre dans le mélange de farine. Versez les œufs, mélangez bien et incorporez l''huile.","Huiler une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Verser 12 tas de pâte bien nets. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Pour le riz, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir le riz et les épices pendant 1 min. Ajoutez le bouillon et épluchez. Laisser mijoter pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et que le liquide soit absorbé.","Mélangez les ingrédients de la salade et servez avec les hajis et le riz. Si vous suivez un régime alimentaire sain, servez la moitié des bhajis et du riz avec la moitié de la salade. Refroidissez les bhajis et le riz restants et conservez-les au frais avec le reste de la salade jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffez les bhajis à 180°C/160°C ventilateur/gaz 4 pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très chauds. Réchauffez le riz au micro-ondes. Servir avec la salade. Cette recette fait partie de notre plan d''alimentation saine gratuit de 7 jours. Pour accéder au plan de repas complet, cliquez ici."]','2026-01-11 00:06:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10660,6612,'fr','Crevettes tikka masala','Oubliez les plats à emporter et savourez un repas en milieu de semaine qui plaira à toute la famille avec notre tikka masala aux crevettes facile et faible en calories. Servir avec des pains naan','["1 gros oignon , haché grossièrement","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé","2 grosses gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2-3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry tikka","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","½ cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","3 gousses de cardamome, écrasées","200 g de riz basmati brun","3 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","300 g de crevettes crues","1 cuillère à soupe de crème fraîche","½ bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement","pains naan, réchauffés, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez l''oignon, le gingembre et l''ail dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Faites chauffer l’huile dans une grande cocotte ignifuge à feu moyen. Ajouter la pâte d''oignon et faire revenir pendant 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement dorée. Incorporer la pâte de curry et faire revenir encore 1 min. Ajouter les tomates, le concentré de tomates, le sucre et les gousses de cardamome. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire à couvert pendant encore 10 minutes.","Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Retirez la cardamome de la sauce au curry et jetez-la, puis mixez-la avec un mixeur plongeant ou dans un robot culinaire propre. Remettez dans la poêle, ajoutez les amandes et les crevettes et laissez cuire 5 min. Assaisonner selon votre goût et incorporer la crème et la coriandre. Servir avec du riz et des pains naan, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10661,7447,'fr','Boondi raita','Essayez cet accompagnement indien simple composé de boondi – petites boules de farine de pois chiches frites – dans du yaourt à la menthe et au cumin.','["300g de yaourt nature","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu, plus une pincée","60g de boondi (disponible dans de nombreux supermarchés indiens ou en ligne)","quelques feuilles de menthe, ½ hachées finement, ½ laissées entières"]','["Fouettez le yaourt avec 100 ml d''eau jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer le cumin, ¼ cuillère à café de sel et une pincée de poivre noir moulu.","Ajouter le boondi et bien mélanger. Laisser reposer 10 minutes ou jusqu''à 2 heures jusqu''à ce que le boondi ait absorbé une partie du liquide et légèrement ramolli (pas plus, car le boondi deviendra trop mou). Saupoudrer de feuilles de menthe hachées et entières et d''une pincée de cumin."]','2026-01-11 00:06:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10662,5263,'fr','Pain plat au safran fourré aux lentilles et au jaggery (puran poli)','Remplissez les pains plats indiens de lentilles sucrées et épicées pour une collation souvent servie pendant le festival Holi en Inde.','["100 g de lentilles jaunes cassées (bengal gram ou chana dhal)","125 g d''un jargy gaggery sont un ganger.","2 cuillères à café de graines de fenouil","¼ cuillère à café de muscade râpée","½ cuillère à café de cardamome moulue","250 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de sel fin","1 cuillère à soupe de ghee fondu, plus un peu pour rouler et cuire","¼ cuillère à café de brins de safran, trempés dans 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau tiède"]','["Lavez les lentilles et couvrez-les d''eau froide dans un bol. Laisser tremper toute la nuit.","Égoutter les lentilles et les mettre dans une cocotte minute. Versez suffisamment d''eau pour les recouvrir d''environ 3 cm. Cuire pendant 20 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement tendres. Vous pouvez également les faire cuire dans une poêle moyenne pendant environ 1 à 1 h 30 jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, en ajoutant de l''eau supplémentaire si nécessaire pour éviter qu''ils ne s''accrochent. Égoutter et laisser refroidir.","Versez les lentilles refroidies dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en une pâte. Transférez la pâte dans une poêle à fond épais et ajoutez le jaggery, les graines de fenouil, la muscade et la cardamome. Cuire à feu moyen pendant 5 à 7 minutes en remuant constamment jusqu''à ce que la pâte épaississe. Laisser refroidir.","Pour faire la pâte, tamisez la farine et le sel dans un bol à mélanger. Frottez le ghee dans la farine du bout des doigts, puis ajoutez le safran et son eau de trempage suivi de suffisamment d''eau froide (environ 100-125 ml) pour obtenir une pâte molle, mais non collante. Pétrir dans le bol jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis couvrir et laisser reposer 30 minutes.","Pétrir la pâte pendant 1 min, puis la diviser en neuf portions de 40 g. Façonnez chacun en boule de 4 cm de diamètre avec vos mains. Façonnez la pâte de lentilles en boules légèrement plus petites de 3 cm de la même manière.","Faites une empreinte au milieu de l''une des boules de pâte avec vos doigts, en la pressant pour lui donner la forme d''un bol. Mettez l''une des boules de lentilles dans la cavité et enroulez la pâte autour, en pinçant les bords pour que la boule de lentilles soit complètement enfermée. Aplatissez-le en un disque de 2 cm d''épaisseur et étalez-le sur une surface légèrement huilée jusqu''à obtenir un cercle de 17 cm de diamètre. Visez l’épaisseur d’une pièce de 1 £.","Faites chauffer une plaque chauffante ou une poêle à frire à feu moyen et soulevez délicatement le disque sur la plaque chauffante. Versez 1 cuillère à café de ghee fondu sur les bords et faites cuire d''un côté pendant 2-3 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à colorer. Retournez à l''aide d''une tranche de poisson et versez encore 1 à 2 cuillères à café de ghee fondu sur les bords. Cuire encore 2 à 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Répétez ce processus avec les boules de pâte restantes. Servir aussitôt avec un verre de lait frais ou du masala chai."]','2026-01-11 00:06:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10663,4531,'fr','Puris aux pommes de terre masala (alu puri)','Essayez de préparer ce plat indien traditionnel, un déjeuner populaire lors des festivités de Holi au printemps.','["500 g de pommes de terre Maris Piper ou King Edwards, coupées en quartiers","2 tomates blanchies, hachées grossièrement","2 oignons, coupés en dés","4 gousses d''ail","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour rouler","1½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","3 feuilles de laurier indien (tez patta) ou 4 cm de bâton de cannelle","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre fraîche hachée","125g de farine de chapati (chapati atta) ou farine complète","125 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de sel fin","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour la friture"]','["Pour faire l''alu masala, mettez les pommes de terre dans une poêle avec les tomates hachées, l''oignon et l''ail. Versez suffisamment d''eau froide pour couvrir les pommes de terre sur 3 cm et faites bouillir jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres.","Retirez les pommes de terre et écrasez-les légèrement avec une fourchette – essayez de garder la texture rugueuse et épaisse. Filtrez le liquide de cuisson dans un pichet en réservant le liquide et le mélange d''oignons laissés dans la passoire.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans l''awkor karahi à feu moyen et faites revenir les graines de cumin et les feuilles de laurier indien ou la cannelle pendant quelques secondes, jusqu''à ce que le cumin libère son arôme.","Ajoutez le mélange d''oignons réservé et poursuivez la friture pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient dorés. Baissez le feu, ajoutez le curcuma, la poudre de piment et la coriandre moulue et laissez cuire encore 1 minute en remuant tout le temps.","Ajoutez les pommes de terre ainsi que le liquide de cuisson réservé. Laisser mijoter 5 minutes, puis éteindre le feu et incorporer la coriandre hachée. Couvrez et laissez infuser les arômes pendant que vous préparez les puris.","Pour faire les puris, tamisez les farines et le sel dans un bol. Incorporez l''huile à la farine avec vos doigts, puis ajoutez suffisamment d''eau froide pour obtenir une pâte très ferme. Pétrissez pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis formez une boule. Mettre dans un bol légèrement huilé, couvrir et réserver au moins 30 minutes.","Pétrissez à nouveau la pâte pendant 1 min, puis divisez-la également en 20 à 22 boules d''environ 2,5 cm de diamètre chacune. Aplatissez légèrement le dessus de chaque boule et roulez-la sur une surface huilée jusqu''à obtenir des disques de 11 cm de diamètre environ de l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Vous pouvez retourner la pâte une ou deux fois pendant que vous la roulez.","Remplissez un karahi ou un wok d''huile jusqu''à ce qu''il ne soit pas rempli à plus des deux tiers et chauffez à 180 °C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain brunisse en 30 secondes. Abaissez doucement un puri dans l’huile. Il grésillera et remontera au sommet en quelques secondes. Appuyez légèrement dessus avec une tranche de poisson pour qu''il gonfle à la cuisson. Faites frire pendant 1 min, puis retournez-le et faites frire de l''autre côté pendant 1 min supplémentaire. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et répéter avec les boules de pâte restantes.","Pour servir, réchauffez la pomme de terre masala et mangez-la avec les puris à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:06:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10664,4533,'fr','Chole avec riz au cumin et raita','Préparez un curry de pois chiches accompagné de raita pour un excellent repas familial à petit budget. En plus d’être rapide et facile, c’est aussi sain','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","4 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de gingembre finement râpé","4 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 cuillères à café de curry en poudre","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches","100 g de purée de tomates","30 g de coriandre fraîche hachée","300 g de riz basmati","¼ de concombre","200 g de yaourt à la grecque","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin, grillées et écrasées","une petite poignée de menthe fraîche hachée","une poignée de graines de grenade, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir les oignons à feu doux pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Ajoutez 3 cuillères à café de cumin, le gingembre, l''ail et la poudre de curry. Remuer pendant une minute pour empêcher les épices de brûler.","Versez les pois chiches et le liquide de la boîte, ainsi que le concentré de tomates, 20 g de coriandre et un peu d''assaisonnement. Laisser mijoter à feu doux environ 10 min. Ajoutez un peu d''eau s''il semble trop sec.","Pendant ce temps, rincez et égouttez le riz, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin restante, 2 litres d''eau bouillante et l''assaisonnement. Cuire environ 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre. Vidange.","Pour la raita, râpez le concombre et mélangez-le au yaourt avec le cumin, la menthe et le reste de coriandre. Assaisonner, parsemer de graines de grenade, puis servir avec le chole et le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:06:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10665,7449,'fr','Paneer et frites de pois chiches','Savourez ce paneer parfumé et ces frites de pois chiches garnies de cornichons à l''oignon dans le cadre d''un festin d''inspiration indienne.','["2 cuillères à soupe de ghee (ou utilisez de l''huile de tournesol ou du beurre)","250 g de paner haché","1 oignon, tranché","3 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","½ cuillère à café de graines de cardamome","1 piment rouge, tranché","5 feuilles de curry","1 poivron vert, coupé en gros morceaux","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","½ bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement","½ citron, jus","½ oignon rouge, tranché"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le cornichon. Mélangez le jus de citron, l''oignon et la pincée de sel dans un petit bol. Annuler.","Faites chauffer la moitié du ghee dans une poêle et faites frire le paneer pendant 10 minutes, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré et croustillant de tous les côtés. Répartir sur une assiette à l''aide d''une écumoire.","Faites chauffer le reste du ghee dans la poêle à feu vif et faites revenir les oignons pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer sur les bords. Ajoutez l''ail, le curcuma, la poudre de piment, les graines de cardamome, le piment, les feuilles de curry et le poivre, et faites sauter pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient caramélisés.","Remettez le paneer dans la poêle avec les pois chiches et un grand filet d''eau, et laissez mijoter le tout pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide se soit évaporé et que le mélange soit collant. Assaisonner de sel, puis verser dans un plat et garnir de coriandre et d''oignons marinés."]','2026-01-11 00:06:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10666,4068,'fr','Ghee','Préparez du ghee maison à utiliser dans vos plats préférés. Le ghee confère une richesse et une saveur beurrée et peut être chauffé à haute température sans brûler.','["250 g de beurre doux"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre dans une petite poêle solide et faites cuire à feu doux sans remuer pendant 15 à 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les solides du lait commencent à dorer et que le beurre soit doré. Éteignez le feu et laissez la casserole tranquille pendant quelques minutes.","Tapisser un tamis en métal de mousseline ou de papier absorbant résistant et placer sur un bol résistant à la chaleur. Versez le beurre fondu en prenant soin de laisser les solides du lait dorés dans la poêle. Laisser couler quelques minutes dans le bol, puis transférer dans un pot. Comme le ghee ne contient ni humidité ni matières solides du lait, il se conservera jusqu''à trois mois à température ambiante, mais peut également être conservé au réfrigérateur pour plus de longévité."]','2026-01-11 00:06:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10667,6865,'fr','La carotte n''est pas bonne.','Préparez du gajar halwa indulgent, un dessert populaire en Inde du Nord. Souvent servi à Diwali pour marquer le changement de saison, sa texture est presque fondante','["500 g de carottes grossièrement râpées","8 gousses de cardamome verte, percées au couteau","500 ml de lait entier","125g de beurre doux","100 g de sucre en poudre","25g raisins","25 g d''amandes blanchies ou de pistaches concassées grossièrement hachées"]','["Mettez les carottes, les gousses de cardamome percées et le lait dans une casserole à fond épais et portez à ébullition. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter 1 heure en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce que le lait soit évaporé.","Faites chauffer le beurre dans une poêle profonde et faites sauter le mélange de carottes pendant environ 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il noircisse et qu''il ait perdu son aspect humide et laiteux.","Ajoutez le sucre, les raisins secs et les amandes ou les pistaches et faites sauter le halwa pendant encore 5 minutes. Servir chaud. Se conserve couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à une semaine ou au congélateur jusqu''à six mois."]','2026-01-11 00:06:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10668,4072,'fr','Sauce aux dattes et au tamarin (le fils)','Servez cette sauce piquante aux dattes et au tamarin avec tout, des samosas et pakoras aux collations de rue croquantes et aux salades.','["150 g de tamarin humide, de préférence sans pépins","125 g de dattes dénoyautées","175 g de jaggery, sucre de palmier dattier ou sucre muscovado léger","1 cuillère à café de gingembre en poudre","½ cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu"]','["Cassez le tamarin et les dattes et mettez-les dans une casserole avec le jaggery et suffisamment d''eau pour les recouvrir, environ 500 ml. Porter à ébullition et cuire 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le tamarin soit bien tendre.","Retirez la casserole du feu et passez la pulpe au tamis pour éliminer les fibres. La sauce doit avoir une consistance enrobée – ajoutez un peu d’eau si elle est trop épaisse.","Incorporer la poudre de gingembre, le garam masala et le cumin moulu. La sauce doit avoir un goût sucré et acidulé – ajoutez un peu plus de jaggery si elle n’a pas un goût assez sucré. Réfrigérer avant de servir. Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant trois à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:06:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10669,7453,'fr','Halwa de semoule punjabi (suji halwa)','Servez ce dessert indien lors d''occasions spéciales telles que Diwali. Aux amandes, à la cardamome et aux raisins secs, il a une saveur riche et beurrée et un arôme de semoule grillée.','["6 gousses de cardamome verte","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","125g de ghee","125g de semoule, farine de chapati ou farine de blé complet","25 g de raisins secs trempés dans l''eau chaude","25 g d''amandes tranchées avec la peau"]','["Fendez les gousses de cardamome avec un couteau bien aiguisé et retirez les graines. Broyer les graines en poudre avec 1 cuillère à café de sucre à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Gardez les dosettes vides pour le sirop.","Faites chauffer le sucre restant dans une casserole à feu moyen avec 600 ml d''eau jusqu''à dissolution. Ajoutez les gousses de cardamome vides et laissez mijoter à découvert pendant 5 minutes. Éteignez le feu, couvrez la casserole et réservez.","Faites chauffer le ghee dans un wok ou un karahi à feu moyen, puis ajoutez la semoule ou la farine. Réduire le feu à doux et cuire, en remuant tout le temps, jusqu''à ce qu''il dégage un arôme grillé et prenne une couleur dorée et biscuitée, environ 10 minutes.","Retirez la casserole du feu. Jetez les gousses de cardamome vides du sirop chaud et versez-les sur la semoule en un mince filet régulier, en remuant constamment. Faites attention, cela va cracher. Remettre la poêle sur feu moyen et cuire en remuant constamment jusqu''à ce que la semoule épaississe. Il doit avoir la consistance d’une purée de pommes de terre crémeuse. Incorporer la cardamome moulue, les raisins secs égouttés et la plupart des amandes tranchées. Servir bien chaud avec le reste des amandes parsemées."]','2026-01-11 00:06:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10670,7455,'fr','Pintade rôtie tandoori','Réalisez un rôti différent avec cette pintade rôtie au tandoori. Délicieux servi avec des pains plats et de la raita, dégustez les restes enveloppés dans un pain naan','["1 pintade","pains plats et raita, pour servir (facultatif)","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","5 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 citron, jus","1 cuillère à café de paprika","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","150 ml de yaourt nature","100 ml de crème double","un filet de jus de citron"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la marinade. Mélangez tous les ingrédients avec 1 cuillère à café de sel et une généreuse quantité de poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Placez la pintade dans un grand bol ou un récipient et frottez la marinade partout, y compris sous la peau de la poitrine. Transférer au réfrigérateur pour mariner pendant au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Mettre la pintade marinée dans un petit plat à rôtir et verser dessus les restes de marinade éventuels. Versez un petit verre d''eau dans le moule autour de la pintade et faites-la rôtir pendant 50 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien cuite et légèrement carbonisée. Soulevez délicatement la pintade sur une planche, en égouttant le jus de cuisson de la cavité dans le moule, et laissez reposer environ 10 minutes le temps de préparer la sauce.","Ajoutez un peu d''eau dans le plat à rôtir. Si le moule est ignifuge, mettez-le sur feu moyen et portez à ébullition. Si le moule n''est pas ignifuge, grattez le tout dans une casserole et portez à ébullition. Ajouter la crème et porter à ébullition. Assaisonner au goût, en ajoutant un peu de jus de citron si nécessaire. Versez la sauce dans un plat de service, ou passez au tamis dans un plat si vous préférez une sauce plus onctueuse. Découpez la pintade et servez-la avec la sauce, quelques pains plats et de la raita, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10671,5573,'fr','Curry de poisson à la noix de coco et au chou frisé','Faites cuire par lots ce curry facile de chou frisé, de morue et de gambas et congelez-le en portions pour les soirs de semaine chargés. A base de lait de coco et d''épices, c''est plein de saveur','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon, tranché","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, coupé en allumettes","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","3-4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry douce (le Keralan fonctionne bien)","150 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","150 g de chou frisé haché","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux","325 ml de lait de coco faible en gras","300 ml de bouillon faible en sel","250 g de riz brun","100 g de gambas surgelées","2 filets de cabillaud, coupés en morceaux","2 citrons verts, jus","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","une poignée de flocons de noix de coco grillés (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte. Faites revenir l''oignon avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 min jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à caraméliser. Incorporer le gingembre, le curcuma et la pâte de curry et cuire 2 minutes.","Ajoutez les tomates, le chou frisé et le piment, puis versez le lait de coco et le bouillon. Laisser mijoter pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les tomates commencent à ramollir. Retirez le piment et jetez-le.","Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Incorporer délicatement les crevettes et la morue au curry, puis cuire encore 3 à 5 minutes. Pressez le citron vert et incorporez la moitié de la coriandre. Pour servir, parsemez le reste de coriandre et les flocons de noix de coco, si vous le souhaitez. Servir avec le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:06:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10672,7457,'fr','Bethrot Birian du tricheur','Faites cuire ce biriyani à la betterave et congelez les restes pour les soirs de semaine chargés. Avec la betterave colorée au centre de la scène, elle est pleine d''épices et constitue un plat savoureux.','["3 grosses betteraves crues (500 g, non préparées), pelées et coupées en cubes de 2 cm","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","1 gros oignon, finement tranché","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","2 petites gousses d''ail écrasées","1 feuille de laurier","4 gousses de cardamome","2 cuillères à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à soupe de garam masala","250 g de riz basmati rincé","500 ml de bouillon de légumes faible en sel","100 ml de yaourt sans gras","petit bouquet de coriandre","votre chutney ou cornichon préféré, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger la betterave avec la moitié de l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis la verser dans un plat à rôtir et cuire pendant 25-30 minutes, en remuant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste de l’huile dans une grande cocotte peu profonde ou une poêle allant au four. Faites revenir l''oignon à feu moyen pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ajouter le gingembre et la moitié de l''ail et cuire 1 min. Incorporer le laurier, les gousses de cardamome, le curcuma et le garam masala, puis cuire 2 minutes. Incorporer le riz et la betterave, puis assaisonner. Versez le bouillon et portez à ébullition.","Mettre au four, à découvert, et cuire 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit bien cuit. Remuez à la sortie du four.","Mettez le yaourt, la coriandre et le reste de l''ail dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Assaisonner au goût. Servir le biriyani avec le yaourt à la coriandre et le cornichon."]','2026-01-11 00:06:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10673,7459,'fr','Poulet rôti et riz épicé','Préparez ce plat de poulet sain pour la famille, légèrement épicé avec un peu de pâte de curry, avec seulement 15 minutes de préparation. Le chutney de mangue ajoute une saveur fruitée','["1 cube de bouillon de poulet","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry douce ou moyenne (nous avons utilisé du korma)","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre ou d''huile, plus un peu pour la friture","350 g de riz basmati","1 bâton de cannelle","6-8 cuisses de poulet, avec os, avec la peau","1 oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","20 g d''amandes grillées","350 g de haricots verts","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre","chutney de mangue, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez 800 ml d''eau juste bouillie dans un pichet résistant à la chaleur, émiettez-le dans le cube de bouillon et incorporez-le avec la moitié de la pâte de curry et le beurre ou l''huile. Versez le mélange dans un grand plat allant au four ou dans un plat à rôtir (le nôtre mesurait 25 x 35 cm et 5 cm de profondeur), et versez-y le riz et le bâton de cannelle. Assaisonner et bien mélanger.","Coupez quelques entailles profondes dans chaque cuisse de poulet, puis frottez-les avec le reste de pâte de curry et un peu d''assaisonnement. Disposer sur le mélange de riz, puis couvrir le plat ou le moule de papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer un filet d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 à 15 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et caramélisé.","Découvrez le poulet et le riz. Le riz doit être encore humide, sinon ajoutez 50 à 100 ml d''eau supplémentaire. Répartir sur les amandes et cuire au four, à découvert, pendant 10 à 15 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit doré, que tout le liquide ait été absorbé et que le riz soit bien cuit et croustillant sur les bords. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les haricots verts dans l''eau bouillante pendant 2 à 3 minutes, puis égouttez-les. Répartissez la coriandre et les oignons frits sur le poulet et le riz, versez quelques cuillerées de chutney sur le plat et servez avec les haricots verts."]','2026-01-11 00:06:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10674,4104,'fr','Curry de crevettes et d''aubergines','Savourez ce curry vibrant de crevettes et d''aubergines avec des pains plats pour un repas rapide et facile en milieu de semaine pour deux. C’est idéal les nuits chargées où vous manquez de temps','["1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","1 aubergine coupée en morceaux de 1 cm","1-2 piments rouges ou verts, tranchés","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises ou de tomates concassées","150 g de crevettes crues","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt à la noix de coco sans produits laitiers","1 citron vert, jus","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","2 rotis ou pains plats, réchauffés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir l''aubergine avec une pincée de sel pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement dorée. Incorporer le piment, le gingembre, le curcuma et le cumin, cuire encore une minute, puis verser les tomates cerises. Laisser mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement.","Incorporer les crevettes et laisser mijoter pendant 2 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient roses. Retirer du feu, incorporer le yaourt à la noix de coco, le jus de citron vert et la coriandre, puis servir avec les rotis réchauffés."]','2026-01-11 00:06:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10675,7461,'fr','Pilaf facile aux saucisses et courgettes','Préparez ce plat rapide de saucisses, de courgettes et de riz en seulement 20 minutes. Plein de saveur, il est idéal lorsque vous souhaitez quelque chose de rapide et facile','["100 g de riz basmati","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","3 saucisses, viande extraite des peaux","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil, de graines d''oignon noir ou de graines de coriandre écrasées","1 courgette coupée en demi-lunes","100 g de petits pois surgelés","200 ml de bouillon de légumes","½ petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées finement","½ petit bouquet d''aneth finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt sans gras"]','["Rincez le riz plusieurs fois jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire, puis laissez-le tremper. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne avec un couvercle hermétique et faites frire la chair de saucisse pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit croustillante et dorée. Incorporez les graines et la courgette et faites revenir encore 2 minutes à feu vif pour que l''eau de la courgette s''évapore.","Incorporez le riz égoutté, les petits pois, le bouillon et la moitié des herbes hachées. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu à doux et couvrez avec un couvercle. Cuire 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre.","Incorporez la plupart des herbes restantes au riz. Servir avec le reste des herbes sur le dessus et le yaourt à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:06:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10676,6267,'fr','Paneer jalfrezi avec riz au cumin','Pimentez votre semaine avec ce curry végétarien satisfaisant, sain et faible en calories. Il fournit du calcium, du fer, de la vitamine C et des fibres, ainsi que trois de vos 5 apports quotidiens.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza pressée à froid","1 gros et 1 oignon moyen, un gros haché finement et un moyen coupé en quartiers","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées","50 g de gingembre pelé et râpé","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon de légumes","135 g de paner haché","2 gros poivrons épépinés et hachés","1 piment rouge ou vert, épépiné et tranché","25 g de coriandre hachée","260 g de riz basmati brun","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir les oignons émincés, l''ail et la moitié du gingembre pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez la coriandre moulue et les graines de cumin et laissez cuire encore 1 min, puis versez les tomates, une demi-boîte d''eau et le bouillon. Mixez le tout avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance très lisse, puis portez à ébullition. Couvrir et cuire 15 min.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le riz et les graines de cumin dans une casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans un wok antiadhésif et faites revenir le paneer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement coloré. Retirer de la poêle et réserver. Ajoutez les poivrons, les quartiers d''oignon et le piment dans la poêle et faites sauter jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres, mais conservent encore un peu de mordant. Mélangez les légumes sautés et le paneer à la sauce avec la coriandre hachée, puis servez avec le riz. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, mangez deux portions de curry et de riz, puis réfrigérez le reste pour un autre jour. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours, couvert, au réfrigérateur. Pour servir le deuxième soir, réchauffez les portions restantes au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très chaudes."]','2026-01-11 00:06:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10677,7463,'fr','Jalfrezi d''agneau avec riz au cumin','Comblez vos envies de curry avec cette version saine d''un plat à emporter populaire, servi avec du riz brun. Il contient trois de vos 5 par jour ainsi que du fer, de la vitamine C et des fibres.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza pressée à froid","600 g de steak de gigot d''agneau maigre, débarrassé de tout gras visible, coupé en dés","1 gros oignon, finement haché","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées","50 g de gingembre râpé","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon de légumes","2 gros poivrons épépinés et coupés en dés","1 oignon moyen, coupé en quartiers","1 piment rouge ou vert, épépiné et tranché","25 g de coriandre fraîche hachée","250 g de riz basmati brun","1-2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir l''agneau pendant environ 4 minutes, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Retirer de la poêle et réserver.","Ajoutez l''oignon haché, l''ail et la moitié du gingembre râpé dans la poêle et faites revenir pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Si les oignons commencent à accrocher, ajoutez un peu d''eau. Ajoutez les épices et laissez cuire encore une minute. Versez les tomates et une demi-boîte d''eau avec le bouillon, puis mixez le tout dans la poêle avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance bien lisse. Incorporer l''agneau, puis couvrir et laisser mijoter à feu doux-moyen pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.","Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir le riz avec les graines de cumin dans une casserole d''eau pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Vidange.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans un wok antiadhésif. Ajoutez les poivrons, les quartiers d''oignon, le piment et le reste du gingembre, et faites sauter le tout pendant environ 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, mais toujours avec un peu de mordant. Incorporer au curry avec la coriandre et servir avec le riz. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, mangez maintenant deux portions de curry et de riz, puis réfrigérez le reste pour un autre jour. Pour servir le deuxième soir, il suffit de réchauffer les portions au micro-ondes dans des assiettes."]','2026-01-11 00:06:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10678,7465,'fr','Baath na bhajia (pakoras de riz)','Dégustez ces pakoras de riz gourmandes en entrée d''un festin indien ou seules en collation. Servir sur un plateau à partager avec beaucoup de ketchup pour tremper','["400 g de riz basmati cuit","1 oignon rouge moyen, haché finement","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2-3 piments verts, finement hachés","1½ cuillère à café de sucre","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","150g de farine","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature","gros bouquet de coriandre, finement hachée","huile végétale ou de tournesol, pour la friture","ketchup, pour servir"]','["Mélanger le riz cuit, l''oignon, l''ail, les piments, le sucre, le curcuma, la farine et le yaourt dans un grand bol. Incorporez la coriandre, 1 à 1½ cuillère à café de sel (au goût) et 100 ml d''eau, puis laissez reposer le mélange pendant 15 minutes.","Faites chauffer une poêle profonde remplie aux deux tiers au maximum d''huile à 180°C. Si vous n’avez pas de thermomètre, versez une petite cuillerée du mélange dans l’huile – c’est prêt lorsqu’il devient doré en 1 minute. Déposez des cuillères à café bombées du mélange dans l''huile par lots et faites cuire pendant 2-3 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient uniformément dorées et croustillantes. Transférer sur du papier absorbant pour égoutter.","Verser sur une assiette et servir avec beaucoup de ketchup pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:06:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10679,7467,'fr','Curry de bœuf à la cocotte minute','Préparez ce curry de bœuf dans une cocotte minute pour un repas facile en milieu de semaine. Servir avec du riz ou du pain naan pour éponger le jus','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","500 g de steak de bœuf, à l''étouffée ou braisé","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 gros oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","3 gousses de cardamome, écrasées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","500 ml de bouillon de bœuf","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche (facultatif)","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement","pain naan ou riz, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d’huile dans une cocotte minute. Assaisonnez le bœuf et faites-le frire par lots pendant 5 à 8 minutes, en le retournant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément doré. Réserver dans une assiette.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile et du beurre dans la poêle et faites revenir doucement l''oignon pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et caramélisé. Ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre, le piment, le curcuma, la coriandre et la cardamome et faites revenir 2 minutes. Incorporer le bœuf et cuire 1 min pour bien l''enrober d''épices.","Versez les tomates, le bouillon et le sucre et portez à ébullition. Verrouillez le couvercle sur la cuisinière et portez à haute pression. Cuire 15 minutes, puis éteindre le feu et laisser la pression retomber naturellement. Remuez bien le tout et ajoutez plus d''eau si la sauce est déjà épaisse.","Remettez le couvercle en place et laissez-le encore 10 minutes, puis laissez la pression chuter naturellement. Vérifiez que la viande est tendre – selon la coupe, cela peut prendre 5 minutes de plus.","Retirez du feu, incorporez le garam masala et la crème, si vous le souhaitez. Assaisonner au goût. Parsemer de coriandre et servir avec du pain naan ou du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:06:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10680,7469,'fr','Curry de boeuf','Préparez notre curry de bœuf facile et servez-le avec un morceau de pain naan pour éponger les délicieux jus. Si vous le préférez moins épicé, ajoutez simplement moins de poudre de piment.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile","500 g de steak braisé coupé en dés","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 gros oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","3 gousses de cardamome, écrasées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","300 ml de bouillon de bœuf","1 cuillère à café de sucre","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche (facultatif)","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement","pain naan ou riz, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer une cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une cocotte à feu moyen-vif. Assaisonnez le bœuf et faites-le frire dans la casserole pendant 5 à 8 minutes, en le retournant avec une paire de pinces à mi-cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément doré. Réserver dans une assiette.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile et du beurre dans la poêle et ajoutez les oignons. Faire frire doucement pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et caramélisés. Ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre, le piment, le curcuma, la coriandre moulue et la cardamome et faites revenir pendant deux minutes. Ajoutez les tomates, le bouillon et le sucre et portez à ébullition.","Ajoutez le bœuf, mettez un couvercle sur le curry et faites cuire à feu doux pendant 1 ½ à 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre et se désagrège. Retirez le couvercle pour les 20 dernières minutes de cuisson.","Incorporer le garam masala et la crème (le cas échéant) et assaisonner au goût. Parsemer de coriandre et servir avec des pains naan ou du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:06:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10681,7471,'fr','Curry d''aubergines aux épices antillaises','Profitez au maximum des aubergines avec ce curry végétalien. Faible en gras mais plein de saveur, vous pouvez le servir avec du riz ou du roti','["1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 grosse aubergine","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","½ piment vert, finement haché","1 cm de gingembre pelé et finement haché","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","½-1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","3 oignons nouveaux, hachés","½ bouquet de coriandre râpée","riz cuit, yaourt nature, roti et quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Mélangez les épices sèches et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un bol et réservez.","Coupez l''aubergine en rondelles de 1 cm, puis incisez les deux côtés de chaque rondelle avec la pointe d''un couteau bien aiguisé. Frotter avec le mélange d''épices jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien enrobé (vous devez utiliser tout le mélange), puis transférer sur une planche. Mettez 150 ml d''eau dans le bol à épices vide avec le concentré de tomates, le piment, le gingembre et le sucre. Annuler.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et disposez les aubergines dans la poêle en superposant les ronds si nécessaire. Faire frire 5 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajoutez le mélange liquide du bol, portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes en retournant l''aubergine de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien cuite. S''il semble sec, vous devrez peut-être ajouter jusqu''à 100 ml d''eau supplémentaire pour le rendre plus savoureux. Saison.","Répartir les oignons nouveaux et la coriandre et servir avec du riz, du yaourt, du roti et des quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:06:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10682,4151,'fr','Curry d''agneau restant','Tirez le meilleur parti des restes d’agneau rôti avec ce curry de restes d’agneau plein de saveurs. Servir avec du pain naan et du riz basmati pour un festin indien','["2 oignons, hachés grossièrement","1 grosse gousse d''ail, hachée","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry moyenne","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux et épépiné","1 bâton de cannelle","200 ml de bouillon d''agneau","500 à 700 g de restes d''agneau rôti, coupés en gros morceaux","1 petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement","riz basmati cuit, pain naan et yaourt nature, pour servir"]','["Mélangez l''oignon, l''ail, le gingembre et 200 ml d''eau dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte et faites revenir le mélange d''oignons pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que tout le liquide soit absorbé et que l''oignon commence à devenir doré. Ajoutez la pâte de curry et faites revenir encore 1 min. Incorporer les tomates, la cannelle et le piment. Versez le bouillon et portez à ébullition. Ajouter l''agneau et cuire à couvert pendant 1 h.","Retirez le couvercle et laissez mijoter à découvert pendant 15 minutes pour réduire légèrement. Assaisonner au goût et incorporer la coriandre. Servir avec du riz basmati moelleux, du pain naan et du yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:06:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10683,4171,'fr','Omelette aux pommes de terre à Bombay','Faites le plein de saveurs avec cette frittata d''inspiration indienne. Parfait pour un déjeuner sain, il est faible en calories et en matières grasses et regorge de nutriments','["4 pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en rondelles de 5 mm","100 g de pousses d''épinards hachées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, finement râpée","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","¼ cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma","3 tomates hachées grossièrement","2 gros œufs","½ piment vert épépiné et finement haché","1 petit bouquet de coriandre finement hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de chutney de mangue","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec sans gras"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 6 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur. Pendant ce temps, mettez les épinards dans un bol résistant à la chaleur avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Couvrir et mettre au micro-ondes pendant 3 minutes à puissance maximale ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient flétris.","Faites chauffer l''huile de colza dans une poêle antiadhésive moyenne. Ajoutez l''oignon et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et collant. Incorporer l''ail, la coriandre moulue, le cumin moulu, les graines de moutarde et le curcuma et cuire encore 1 min. Ajouter les tomates et les épinards fanés et cuire encore 3 minutes, puis ajouter les pommes de terre.","Chauffer le gril à feu moyen. Battez légèrement les œufs avec le piment et la majeure partie de la coriandre fraîche et versez sur le mélange de pommes de terre. Griller pendant 4 à 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et juste pris, avec une très légère oscillation au milieu.","Laissez refroidir, puis coupez en quartiers. Mélangez le chutney de mangue, le yaourt et le reste de coriandre fraîche. Servir avec les quartiers de frittata."]','2026-01-11 00:06:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10684,7473,'fr','Dhal makhani de niveau supérieur','Ne vous excusez pas pour la richesse de ce délicieux dhal noir : ce plat de lentilles au beurre est destiné à être dégusté comme un plat de fête réconfortant.','["200 g d''urad dhal entier (également appelé haricots urad, urid dhal ou lentilles noires)","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, ⅓ finement tranché, ⅓ râpé, ⅓ coupé en fines allumettes","2 piments verts, 1 entier, 1 haché","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","100g de beurre","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de fenugrec séchées","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","5 gousses d''ail, écrasées","100 g de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges non égouttés","¼ cuillère à café de garam marsala","50 ml de crème double"]','["Versez le dhal dans une passoire et rincez-le plusieurs fois sous l''eau froide jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire. Mettre dans un grand bol ou une casserole et couvrir du double de leur volume d''eau tiède. Incorporer le bicarbonate de soude et laisser tremper à température ambiante pendant au moins 12 heures.","Égouttez le dhal (mais ne rincez pas), versez-le dans une casserole et recouvrez de 1,5 litre d''eau. Ajoutez le gingembre tranché, le piment entier et le curcuma, puis portez à ébullition, écumez l''écume qui remonte à la surface et réduisez le feu. Laisser mijoter 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très tendres, ou cuire à la cocotte minute pendant 20 minutes. Retirez le gingembre et le piment.","Faites chauffer le beurre dans une autre poêle à feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce qu''il mousse et devienne brun noisette. Versez la moitié dans un petit récipient et réservez. Remettez la poêle et le reste du beurre sur le feu et ajoutez les graines de cumin, les feuilles de fenugrec, la coriandre moulue, l''ail, le gingembre râpé et la purée de tomates et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Incorporez le mélange d''épices au dhal cuit, puis ajoutez les haricots rouges ainsi que le liquide de la boîte.","Écrasez grossièrement le mélange de dhal avec un presse-purée jusqu''à ce que certaines légumineuses soient écrasées. Cuire en remuant à feu très doux pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dhal soit épais et crémeux. Incorporer la majeure partie du beurre noisette réservé, le garam marsala et la moitié de la crème. Versez le dhal dans un plat de service et arrosez-le du reste de crème et de beurre noisette. Répartir sur les allumettes de piment et de gingembre hachés et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10685,7475,'fr','Paner Korma','Cuisinez cette recette inspirée du saag paneer en seulement 30 minutes. Il s''agit d''un curry végétarien savoureux, agrémenté de gingembre frais et de cardamome. Servir avec du riz ou des pains naan','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","Bloc de 225 g de paner coupé en cubes de 2 cm","1 gros oignon, haché grossièrement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé","2 grosses gousses d''ail","5 cuillères à soupe de pâte de korma","3 gousses de cardamome, écrasées","70 g d''amandes moulues","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","150g d''épinards","100 g de yaourt grec","pains de riz ou naan, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle à frire à feu moyen-vif. Ajoutez les cubes de paneer et faites revenir 5 minutes en les retournant régulièrement pour que chaque face soit bien dorée. Retirer avec des pinces et déposer sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant.","Mettez l''oignon, le gingembre et l''ail dans un robot culinaire avec un peu d''eau et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle à feu moyen-doux. Ajoutez le mélange d''oignons et une pincée de sel et faites revenir pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Ajoutez la pâte de korma et la cardamome et faites revenir 1 min. Incorporer la poudre d''amandes et faire revenir 1 min pour obtenir une pâte épaisse.","Ajouter le bouillon, porter à ébullition et cuire 5 à 10 minutes à découvert ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit un peu réduit. Ajouter les épinards à la sauce et cuire 5 minutes. Incorporer le yaourt et le paner et assaisonner généreusement. Servir avec du riz ou des pains naan chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:06:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10686,7477,'fr','Brocoli épicé, paneer et petits pois avec noix de cajou au garam masala','Servez ce plat de brocoli et de paneer subtilement épicé avec des pains naan ou des rotis. Un plat principal sans viande et riche en légumes, parfait pour le vendredi soir','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala, plus 1 cuillère à café supplémentaire","225 g de bloc de paneer, coupé en cubes de 2 cm","un petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","100 g de yaourt nature sans gras","50g de noix de cajou","1 grosse tête de brocoli, coupée en fleurons et la tige coupée en morceaux de 2 cm","400 g de choux de Bruxelles, coupés en deux ou en quartiers","250 g de petits pois décongelés","1 citron vert, jus, plus des quartiers pour servir","chutney de mangue et pains naan ou rotis, réchauffés, pour servir"]','["Fouettez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile avec le gingembre, l''ail, le cumin, le curcuma, 1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un bol. Ajoutez le paneer et incorporez le mélange pour l''enrober, puis laissez mariner au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 2 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Mélangez la coriandre et le yaourt avec un mixeur plongeant ou dans un petit robot culinaire avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à obtenir une sauce verte. Conserver au réfrigérateur pour servir plus tard.","Chauffer le gril à feu moyen. Versez les noix de cajou dans une plaque à pâtisserie peu profonde, puis mélangez-les avec 1 cuillère à café de garam masala et ½ cuillère à café de sel marin. Griller pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient grillés et dorés, en remuant à nouveau à mi-cuisson. Versez dans un bol et réservez.","Mélanger le brocoli et les pousses avec le reste de l''huile. Assaisonnez et étalez sur le plateau que vous avez utilisé pour les noix de cajou et faites griller pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à devenir tendres, en remuant à mi-cuisson. Incorporer le paneer avec sa marinade et griller à nouveau pendant 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et légèrement carbonisé. Répartissez sur les petits pois et mélangez bien le tout. Réchauffer 1 à 2 minutes sous le grill (ne pas laisser trop longtemps car les petits pois vont se ratatiner).","Répartir sur les noix de cajou épicées, puis presser sur le jus de citron vert. Arrosez de vinaigrette au yaourt et servez avec le chutney, les pains naan ou les rotis et les quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:06:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10687,7479,'fr','Poulet à la broche Kolhapuri (poulet rôti kala masala)','Ce poulet rôti aux épices indiennes constitue une excellente alternative au rôti traditionnel du dimanche. Essayez-le avec des quartiers de patates douces au poivre noir et à l''ail.','["1 poulet entier (environ 1,4 kg)","50 ml d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour la boîte, si nécessaire","100 g de yaourt égoutté","quartiers de lime, pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de gingembre","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 citron vert, jus","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale, pour la friture","1 petit piment rouge entier séché","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir","½ petit bâton de cannelle","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à café de macis","1 cuillère à café de clous de girofle entiers","1 gousse de cardamome noire, graines retirées","1 cuillère à café de graines de carvi","1 feuille de laurier","1 petite anis étoilé","½ cuillère à café de muscade râpée","2 gousses de cardamome verte, graines retirées","½ cuillère à café de grains de poivre du Sichuan"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la marinade avec 1 cuillère à café de sel, frottez tout le poulet pour couvrir, puis réfrigérez pendant au moins 4 heures ou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Pour préparer le mélange d''épices, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et ajoutez toutes les épices. Faire frire pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il sente le grillé, puis égoutter au tamis et laisser refroidir en jetant l''huile. Réduire en poudre fine dans un mélangeur à épices ou à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier, et conserver dans un bocal hermétique.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium ou huiler légèrement un plat à rôtir. Séchez le poulet avec du papier absorbant en enlevant l''excès de marinade. Mélangez le yaourt, l''huile et tout le mélange d''épices, puis frottez le poulet et sous la peau. Ne vous inquiétez pas si le mélange se divise un peu.","Disposez le poulet, poitrine vers le haut, sur la plaque ou dans le moule. Rôtir pendant 1 h 30 à 1 h 40, en arrosant à mi-cuisson et en recouvrant de papier d''aluminium s''il fait trop foncé, jusqu''à ce que le jus soit clair lorsqu''une cuisse est percée avec une brochette.","Retirer du four, couvrir de papier d''aluminium et laisser reposer 10 minutes avant de servir. Arrosez de jus de cuisson et servez avec des quartiers de citron vert et des quartiers de patate douce, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10688,7481,'fr','Aloo masala du sud de l''Inde (farce dosa)','Dégustez ces pommes de terre indiennes épicées comme garniture pour les dosa (crêpes à base de farine de riz) pour un souper végétalien réconfortant, ou servez-les comme plat d''accompagnement.','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde","10-15 feuilles de curry","¼ cuillère à café d''asafoetida","1 oignon, tranché finement","1 grosse cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","3 cuillères à café de sambar masala mélangées à ¼ tasse d''eau","4 grosses pommes de terre bouillies et coupées en bouchées","une poignée de coriandre fraîche, hachée finement"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen. Faites frire les graines de moutarde, les feuilles de curry et l''asafoetida jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à crépiter, puis ajoutez les oignons. Cuire 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient légèrement dorés.","Incorporer la purée de tomates avec le sambar masala dilué. Ajoutez les pommes de terre, 1¼ cuillère à café de sel et mélangez bien. Écrasez légèrement les pommes de terre avec une cuillère en bois et faites cuire encore 3 à 4 minutes. Goûtez pour l’assaisonnement. Servir garni de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10689,7483,'fr','Dosa','Préparez votre propre dosa : des crêpes de riz indiennes à base de pâte fermentée. Ils demandent un peu d''effort, mais sont délicieux servis avec du aloo masala et d''autres garnitures','["50 g de lentilles urad cassées, lavées","1 cuillère à soupe de channa dal/gramme de bengale","190 g de riz basmati","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de fenugrec (facultatif)","huile végétale, pour la friture"]','["Lavez tous les ingrédients, à l''exception de l''huile, trois ou quatre fois, puis égouttez-les. Laisser tremper dans l''eau froide dans un bol toute la nuit.","Égouttez l''eau des ingrédients, mais conservez-la et réservez. Transférez les ingrédients trempés dans un robot culinaire et broyez-les pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Assurez-vous que la pâte n''a pas l''air granuleuse : vous pouvez utiliser un peu d''eau de trempage si nécessaire. Cela devrait ressembler à une pâte à crêpes épaisse et lisse et devrait recouvrir le dos d’une cuillère. Videz dans un grand bol et couvrez. Conservez-le dans un endroit chaud toute la nuit pour permettre à la pâte de fermenter (voir conseil ci-dessous). Il aura doublé de quantité et aura l''air pétillant. Si vous n''utilisez pas la pâte tout de suite, réservez au frais pour plus tard. Il se conservera jusqu''à cinq jours.","Remuez très doucement la pâte. Sa consistance aura épaissi, vous pouvez donc ajouter un peu d''eau pour lui donner une consistance épaisse mais versable.","Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive à feu doux à moyen pendant 5 minutes. Versez quelques gouttes d''huile, puis essuyez la poêle avec du papier absorbant pour éliminer tout excès d''huile.","Versez une poignée d''eau sur la poêle chaude pour la refroidir, puis séchez-la avec du papier absorbant. Versez une louche de pâte dosa au milieu de la poêle. A l''aide du fond de la louche, déplacez-la rapidement dans un mouvement circulaire, en laissant la pâte s''étaler vers l''extérieur du milieu vers le bord de la poêle, pour former une crêpe ronde et fine.","Versez quelques gouttes d’huile sur tout le dosa et augmentez la température à feu vif. Lorsqu''il devient légèrement doré et que les bords commencent à se soulever, ajoutez la farce (comme la farce aux pommes de terre dosa masala) au milieu. Continuez à cuire jusqu''à ce que le dessous soit complètement doré et croustillant. Utilisez une spatule plate pour détacher les bords, puis roulez sur la farce aux pommes de terre et soulevez-la sur une assiette.","Avant de préparer la dose suivante, réduisez la température de la casserole à feu moyen et répétez les étapes ci-dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:06:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10690,5509,'fr','Tikka masala que j''ai','Savourez les saveurs riches et épicées du tikka masala avec cette version familiale plus légère, à la fois saine et sans gluten. C''est un plaisir garanti pour le public','["1 gros oignon, haché","4 grosses gousses d''ail","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","4 petites poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre d''épices tikka","1 cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","40g d''amandes moulues","200g d''épinards","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature sans gras","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","riz basmati brun, pour servir"]','["Mettez l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une cocotte anti-flamme à feu moyen. Ajoutez le mélange d''oignons et faites revenir 15 minutes. Versez dans un bol et essuyez la poêle.","Ajoutez le reste de l''huile et le poulet et faites frire pendant 5 à 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Incorporer les épices tikka et le poivre de Cayenne et faire revenir encore une minute. Remettez le mélange d''oignons dans la poêle, avec les tomates et 1 boîte pleine d''eau. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez cuire à découvert pendant 15 minutes. Incorporez les amandes et les épinards et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes. Assaisonnez puis mélangez le yaourt et la coriandre. Servir avec du riz brun."]','2026-01-11 00:06:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10691,7485,'fr','Crevettes du couronnement sur naan grillé','Créez un souper rapide et riche en saveurs avec des gambas au curry et des pois chiches servis sur un naan à l''ail. Vous pouvez le préparer en seulement 11 minutes, c''est donc parfait pour les journées chargées','["2 cuillères à café de curry doux en poudre","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ boîte de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés","60 g de gambas cuites","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec sans gras","1 cuillère à soupe de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à soupe de chutney de mangue","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","1⁄2 grosse pause Naan à l''ail","15 g d''amandes effilées, grillées"]','["Faites chauffer une petite poêle à feu vif, ajoutez la poudre de curry et le curcuma et faites griller pendant 1 minute. Rincez les pois chiches sous l''eau froide, puis séchez-les avec du papier absorbant. Mettre dans un bol avec les crevettes, le yaourt, la mayonnaise, le chutney de mangue, les épices grillées et la coriandre. Mélangez le tout jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et assaisonnez au goût.","Coupez le pain naan en deux et faites-le griller au grille-pain ou sous le grill pendant 1 à 2 minutes. Garnir du mélange de crevettes et de pois chiches, puis terminer par les amandes effilées."]','2026-01-11 00:06:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10692,6486,'fr','Épicé et sucré fatigué','Le Lassi est une boisson indienne rafraîchissante sans alcool, idéale pour accompagner n''importe quel menu de dîner indien.','["yaourt faible en gras","eau","quelques graines de cumin grillées","un peu de coriandre fraîche hachée","sucre, au goût","quelques gouttes d''eau de rose, au goût"]','["Pour le lassi épicé, fouettez des quantités égales de yaourt faible en gras avec de l''eau à l''aide d''un fouet ballon pour créer une mousse mousseuse, puis servez saupoudré de quelques graines de cumin grillées et d''un peu de coriandre fraîche hachée. Pour une version sucrée, fouettez le yaourt et l''eau avec un peu de sucre selon votre goût et quelques gouttes d''eau de rose."]','2026-01-11 00:06:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10693,7491,'fr','Korma végétarien crémeux','Crémeux et sain, une combinaison gagnante pour ce curry, qui s''adapte facilement à toute la famille si certains souhaitent y ajouter de la viande.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, finement haché","3 gousses de cardamome, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de cumin et de coriandre moulus chacun","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 piment vert épépiné (si désiré) et finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché finement","800 g de légumes mélangés, comme des carottes, du chou-fleur, des pommes de terre et des courgettes, hachés","300 à 500 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","200 g de petits pois surgelés","200 ml de yaourt","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues (facultatif)","½ petite poitrine de poulet crue par portion","amandes effilées grillées, coriandre hachée, riz basmati ou pain naan"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Cuire l''oignon\r\navec les épices sèches à feu doux pendant\r\n5-6 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit légèrement doré.\r\nAjouter le piment, l''ail et le gingembre et cuire\r\npendant 1 min, puis jetez-y le mélange\r\nles légumes et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes.","Répartissez convenablement le mélange\r\nentre deux casseroles si vous servez des végétariens\r\net les mangeurs de viande. Coupez le poulet en\r\npetits morceaux et incorporer dans une casserole. Ajouter\r\nle bouillon, en le répartissant entre les casseroles\r\nde manière appropriée et laisser mijoter pendant 10 minutes (si vous cuisinez uniquement la version végétarienne dans une poêle, utilisez 300 ml de bouillon ; si vous divisez entre deux poêles, ajoutez 250 ml dans chacune).\r\nDivisez les petits pois, si nécessaire, et ajoutez-y,\r\ncuire encore 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient\r\ntendre et le poulet est bien cuit.","Retirer du feu et remuer\r\nle yaourt et la poudre d''amandes, le cas échéant.\r\nServir parsemé d''amandes grillées\r\net coriandre, avec riz basmati ou naan\r\npain à part."]','2026-01-11 00:06:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10694,7493,'fr','Paner épicé','Le paneer au fromage indien est un excellent plat végétarien car il conserve sa forme : saveur de fenugrec et de garam masala.','["huile végétale, pour la friture","400 g de paner coupé en bouchées","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre","noix de gingembre, pelée et hachée","1 oignon moyen, haché","4 grosses tomates mûres, hachées","1½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenugrec","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","une petite poignée de coriandre fraîche hachée","petite noix de gingembre pelée et râpée en allumettes","1 petit poivron rouge et 1 petit poivron vert, épépinés et finement hachés","3 oignons nouveaux, finement émincés"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cm d''huile dans une grande poêle\r\net faites frire le paneer par lots jusqu''à ce que\r\nbrun doré – attention à l''huile\r\ncrache. Mettez-le sur du papier absorbant.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle et\r\nfaire revenir délicatement les graines de coriandre,\r\ngingembre, piment et oignon pendant environ 8-\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Astuce dans le\r\ntomates et cuire encore 5\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir.\r\nAjoutez les autres épices et le miel,\r\nremuer et laisser mijoter quelques minutes.","Versez le paner dans la sauce et\r\nremuer. Laissez mijoter quelques minutes, puis\r\najoutez la coriandre hachée et\r\ngingembre râpé. Servir saupoudré\r\navec poivrons et oignons nouveaux."]','2026-01-11 00:06:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10695,7495,'fr','Daurade aux épices tandoori','Simple à préparer mais avec des résultats assez spéciaux, ce menu d''inspiration indienne du gagnant de MasterChef Dhruv Baker constitue un repas romantique pour deux.','["un filet d''huile d''olive, pour la friture","2 filets de daurade","1 cuillère à café de pâte d''ail (mélangez beaucoup d''ail épluché avec un peu d''huile végétale, puis congelez dans des bacs à glaçons)","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gingembre (faite comme ci-dessus)","2 piments verts","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment rouge","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","½ cuillère à café de garam masala","jus ½ citron vert","100g de beurre doux"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients du beurre tandoori,\r\nplus un peu d''assaisonnement, dans un petit aliment\r\nrobot ou avec un mixeur plongeant\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse. Grattez sur du film alimentaire, puis\r\nutilisez le film alimentaire pour vous aider à l''enrouler\r\nun cylindre. Tournez les extrémités pour sceller le\r\nbeurre et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme. Le beurre va\r\ndurer une semaine au réfrigérateur ou au\r\ncongélateur jusqu''à 3 mois.","Faites chauffer une poêle à fond épais avec\r\nun filet d''huile jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien chaude. Saison\r\nle poisson, puis le déposer dans la poêle, côté peau\r\nvers le bas et cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants\r\net presque cuit. Soigneusement\r\nretournez, ajoutez une bonne cuillère à soupe de tandoori\r\nbeurre dans la poêle et versez-le sur le\r\npoisson à mesure qu''il fond. Servir aussitôt avec\r\nl''Écrasé de Pommes de Terre Safran et Vert\r\nharicots à la noix de coco (recettes ci-dessous),\r\navec le jus de cuisson versé dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:06:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10696,7497,'fr','Brochettes de poulet masala','Ces brochettes sont délicieuses avec une cuillerée de chutney de mangue ou de raita, et peuvent également être cuites au barbecue pour les chaudes journées d''été.','["150 ml de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte masala","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées et des feuilles supplémentaires pour servir","jus d''1 citron vert, une pincée de zeste et des quartiers pour servir","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées, chacune coupée en 6 morceaux","chapatis complets, pour servir","250 g de tomates cerises décortiquées ou coupées en quartiers","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 concombre, coupé en morceaux"]','["Dans un grand bol mélanger le yaourt, la pâte,\r\nla moitié de la coriandre hachée, la moitié du citron vert\r\nle jus et tout le zeste. Versez le poulet,\r\nremuer pour enrober et laisser au réfrigérateur pour\r\nlaissez mariner 30 minutes si vous avez le temps.","Enfiler le poulet sur 8 brochettes\r\net cuire par lots sur une plaque chauffante\r\npoêle, poêle ou barbecue pendant environ\r\n10-12 minutes, en retournant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les ingrédients de la salade\r\navec le jus de citron vert restant et la coriandre\r\ndans un bol et assaisonner. Saupoudrer de supplément\r\ncoriandre et servir avec les brochettes\r\navec des chapatis complets réchauffés."]','2026-01-11 00:06:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10697,7499,'fr','Malai kofta avec sauce épicée','Ce plat du nord de l''Inde est souvent servi à Diwali et constitue le plat parfait pour un dîner.','["800 g de pommes de terre pelées","5 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","2 oeufs, battus","100 g de chapelure fine","huile pour frire","2 cuillères à soupe bombées de fromage paneer râpé","5 noix de cajou, hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de raisins secs","2-3 piments verts, finement hachés","¼ cuillère à café de sucre","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue, de cumin et de poudre de piment","½ cuillère à café de poudre de cardamome","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de ghee","2 oignons moyens, hachés","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","gros morceau de gingembre, râpé","2 cuillères à café de graines de pavot, réduites en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de cacahuètes ou de noix de cajou","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","3 grosses tomates, en purée","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment","½ cuillère à café de chaque garam masala, coriandre moulue, cumin et sucre","amandes effilées et crème liquide, pour servir"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres, puis\r\négoutter, remettre dans la casserole et mettre sur un\r\nfeu doux pour sécher à la vapeur pendant quelques minutes.\r\nÉcraser avec un peu d''assaisonnement et laisser refroidir.","Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la garniture ensemble.\r\nPréparez 12 boules de pomme de terre. Prenez-en un, appuyez sur\r\nvotre doigt dedans pour faire un petit trou,\r\npuis déposez un peu du mélange de garniture\r\nau centre. Pincez la pomme de terre\r\npour sceller et façonner en rond.\r\nRépétez avec les boulettes de pommes de terre restantes et\r\nremplissage. Rouler chaque kofta dans la farine, tremper dans le\r\nœuf battu, puis rouler dans la chapelure.\r\nRemplissez une casserole profonde à moitié avec de l''huile et\r\nchauffer jusqu''à ce qu''un petit morceau de pain soit doré\r\nen 20 secondes. Faites frire les koftas par lots pendant\r\nquelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis réserver\r\nsur du papier absorbant.","Pour la sauce, mélangez le\r\noignons, ail, gingembre, graines de pavot et\r\nréduire en purée les noix au robot culinaire. Chaleur\r\nl''huile, puis faire revenir la purée d''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste\r\nvirant au brun. Ajoutez la purée de tomates,\r\népices et sucre. La sauce devrait être\r\nassez épais, mais si vous voulez l''affiner\r\nun peu, ajoutez un peu d''eau.","Lorsque la sauce bout, ajoutez\r\nles koftas. Chauffer et servir avec\r\nun filet de crème liquide et quelques flocons\r\namandes éparpillées dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:06:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10698,7501,'fr','Agneau grillé aux épices indiennes','Les marinades à base de yaourt créent une délicieuse croûte fine lorsqu''elles carbonisent, elles sont donc idéales pour les barbecues','["1 gigot d''agneau papillon, environ 2½ kg/5lb 8oz (demandez à votre boucher de le faire pour vous)","morceau de gingembre de la longueur d''un doigt, haché","4 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de curcuma, de garam masala et de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de paprika","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre et des brins supplémentaires pour servir","jus d''1 citron","150 ml de yaourt nature"]','["Utiliser un mixeur plongeant ou un mini-aliment\r\nprocesseur, ingrédients de la marinade whiz\r\njusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse, puis assaisonner de sel.\r\nDisposez l''agneau dans un plat en céramique et enrobez-le\r\navec la marinade. Couvrir de film alimentaire\r\net laisser mariner au réfrigérateur pendant\r\nau moins 4 heures ou de préférence toute la nuit.","Si vous utilisez un barbecue au charbon de bois,\r\nattendez que les charbons deviennent blancs et\r\nrougeoyant (allumez le barbecue environ une heure avant de vouloir cuire l''agneau). Si vous utilisez un barbecue à gaz, faites cuire l''agneau à feu moyen. Sortir l''agneau de la marinade\r\net faire griller, côté chair vers le bas, pendant environ\r\n25 minutes. Retournez-le et donnez le côté gras\r\nenviron 15 minutes. Quand l''agneau a le noir\r\ncroûte brune et cuite à votre goût,\r\nlaissez-le reposer sur une planche pendant 15 minutes. (Si le temps vous oblige à rester à l''intérieur, l''agneau peut être rôti à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 pendant environ une heure pour une viande rosée ; les pains peuvent être cuits sur une plaque chauffante très chaude).","Pour servir, découpez l''agneau en tranches épaisses\r\ntranches et parsemer de coriandre\r\net un peu d''oignon rouge mariné (voir\r\nci-dessous). Servir l''oignon restant dans\r\nun plat à côté de la raita et des pains\r\n(voir recettes ci-dessous)."]','2026-01-11 00:06:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10699,7503,'fr','Biryani parfumé aux légumes et noix de cajou','Un délicieux plat principal végétarien ou en accompagnement d''un autre curry, idéal pour un buffet de curry ou un festin épicé','["500 g de riz basmati","2 gros oignons, coupés en deux et tranchés finement","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","morceau de gingembre frais de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","65 g de pâte de curry korma en sachet (nous avons utilisé celle de Sharwood)","2 bâtons de cannelle","6 gousses de cardamome verte","Anis 3 étoiles","250 g de pommes de terre en dés","1 petit chou-fleur, coupé en petits bouquets","250 g de yaourt grec","225 g de petits pois surgelés","2 bonnes pincées de safran","½ cuillère à café d''eau de rose","beurre, pour graisser","100 g de noix de cajou grillées et salées","2 oignons, coupés en deux et tranchés très finement","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","une bonne poignée de coriandre"]','["Rincer le riz dans plusieurs changements d''eau\r\npour éliminer l''excès d''amidon, puis mettre dans un bol\r\nd''eau froide et laisser tremper 30 min.","Pendant ce temps, faites revenir les oignons dans l''huile pendant\r\n8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à se colorer. Ajouter\r\nle gingembre, puis laissez cuire encore 2 min. Incorporer\r\nla pâte de curry suivie des épices entières,\r\ncuire encore 1 min, puis verser les pommes de terre\r\net du chou-fleur. Versez 300 ml d''eau, couvrez\r\net faites bouillir pendant environ 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient\r\njuste tendre, mais a encore un peu de résistance.\r\nIncorporer le yaourt et les petits pois avec 1 cuillère à café de sel.","Mélangez le safran, l''eau de rose et 3 cuillères à soupe\r\nfaire bouillir l''eau ensemble et bien mélanger. Égoutter le\r\nle riz, versez-le dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée,\r\npuis cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque tendre.\r\nÉgoutter à nouveau. Sortez un grand plat allant au four\r\navec un couvercle et beurrer le fond. Inclinez le curry\r\nsauce dans le fond, répartir sur les noix,\r\npuis versez sur le riz. Arrosez le\r\nmélange d''eau de rose, puis couvrir de papier d''aluminium\r\nsuivi du couvercle. Peut être réfrigéré toute la nuit\r\njusqu''au moment de cuire.","Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4. Mettre\r\nle biryani au four pendant 45 minutes-1 heure jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien chauffé. Pour vérifier c''est\r\nprêt, essayez une cuillerée du centre du\r\ndu riz. Pour la garniture, faites revenir lentement les oignons dans\r\nl''huile jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit vraiment dorée et croustillante (cela peut\r\nêtre fait à l''avance). Quand le biryani est chaud\r\net prêt à servir, mélanger délicatement dans le\r\noignons et coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10700,6806,'fr','Tartes aux pommes de terre et aux épinards Bombay','Ces tartes filo épicées sont idéales pour un déjeuner accompagné d''une salade ou dans le cadre d''un buffet','["1¼kg de grosses pommes de terre à chair ferme comme Charlotte, coupées en deux","85g de beurre","2 oignons, hachés","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de moutarde noire","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre finement haché","2 piments rouges, coupés en deux, épépinés et tranchés","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte Korma","400 g d''épinards frais","4 tomates, hachées","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","Paquet de 270 g de pâte filo (6 grandes feuilles)","50g de beurre fondu","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nPour faire la garniture, faites chauffer une poêle de sel\r\nl''eau. A ébullition, ajoutez les pommes de terre et\r\nfaire bouillir pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Faire fondre le\r\nbeurre puis faites revenir les oignons quelques minutes.\r\nAjouter le cumin, les graines de moutarde, le gingembre et\r\npiments et faire frire, en remuant de temps en temps, pendant\r\nenviron 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Incorporer la pâte de curry.","Cuire les épinards au micro-ondes à\r\nHaut pendant 5 minutes. Égoutter et essorer\r\nautant de liquide que possible, puis hachez-le.\r\nÉgouttez les pommes de terre et versez-les dans le\r\nmélange d''épices. Écraser légèrement pour casser\r\ncoupez-les en morceaux plutôt que de les écraser.\r\nIncorporer le mélange d''épices avec beaucoup de\r\nsalez pour les enrober, puis ajoutez les épinards,\r\ntomates et coriandre.","Déroulez délicatement la pâte et badigeonnez-la\r\n2 moules à sandwich à fond mobile de 20 cm\r\navec un peu de beurre. Badigeonnez la première feuille de\r\npâte et posez-la dans et sur le moule de manière à\r\nqu''il pend sur le côté. Faites de même\r\navec une autre feuille de pâte pour recouvrir le\r\nl''autre côté de la boîte (les deux forment donc un\r\ncroix), beurrer et plier la dernière feuille\r\nmoitié et déposez-la au fond du moule pour\r\ncréer une base solide. Faites de même avec le\r\nl''autre boîte et le reste de la pâte.","Versez la garniture dans le moule et pliez\r\nla pâtisserie qui dépasse pour qu''elle\r\nrecouvre la garniture. Badigeonner généreusement de\r\nle reste du beurre et saupoudrer de\r\ngraines. Cuire au four pendant 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et\r\ncroustillant. Servir avec une salade et de la mangue\r\nchutney, ou une raita préparée en mélangeant nature\r\nyaourt avec sauce à la menthe ou gelée, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10701,7505,'fr','Naans au poulet Coronation avec salade de chou indienne','Garnir du pain indien de viande râpée, d''une sauce au curry douce et fruitée et d''une salade de carottes et de choux.','["1 poulet rôti, environ 950 g","2 x paquets de 4 mini pains naan à la coriandre et à l''ail","150 ml de yaourt","150 ml de mayonnaise légère","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry doux","4 cuillères à soupe de chutney de mangue","petit bouquet de coriandre, haché grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir","2 grosses carottes, râpées","1 chou rouge, râpé","2 cuillères à café de graines de moutarde noire"]','["Râpez la viande du poulet\r\net mettre de côté. Pour faire la sauce,\r\nmélanger le yaourt, la mayonnaise,\r\npoudre de curry, chutney et un peu\r\nassaisonner avec la moitié de la coriandre.\r\nMélangez-le dans le poulet.","Pour faire la salade, mélangez le\r\ncarottes, choux et graines de moutarde dans un grand bol avec le\r\ncoriandre restante, puis assaisonner.","Faites chauffer les pains naan dans le\r\ngrille-pain. Comptez 2 par personne et\r\ngarnir d''un peu de salade de chou, puis du\r\nmélange de poulet. Servir saupoudré\r\nà la coriandre, avec salade de chou supplémentaire\r\nsur le côté."]','2026-01-11 00:06:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10702,7507,'fr','Curry de crevettes de Goa et noix de coco avec riz au cumin','Pimentez vos repas de semaine avec un curry pressé – ajoutez une poignée d''épices avec des crustacés, des tomates et des épinards','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 oignon, tranché finement","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre fraîchement râpé","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment rouge épépiné et tranché","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","10 feuilles de curry","1 grosse pomme de terre, coupée en dés","400 ml de lait de coco demi-écrémé en boîte","8 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","Un paquet de 200 g de crevettes crues décortiquées","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","175 g de riz basmati"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile et faites revenir l''oignon, le gingembre,\r\nail et piment pendant 5 minutes jusqu''au début\r\npour ramollir. Ajouter les épices, les feuilles de curry\r\net la pomme de terre, puis cuire encore 1 min.\r\nIncorporer le lait de coco et les tomates,\r\ncouvrir et laisser mijoter 10 mn\r\njusqu''à ce que la pomme de terre soit tendre.","Ajoutez les épinards et les crevettes. Cuisinier\r\nencore 1 min jusqu''à ce que les épinards fanent\r\net les crevettes deviennent roses.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le riz. Donnez un pourboire au\r\ncumin dans une poêle et faire griller sur un feu sec\r\nchauffer pendant 30 secondes. Ajouter le riz, le sel\r\ngoûter et 400 ml d''eau, puis couvrir\r\net laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit\r\ntendre et l''eau a été absorbée.\r\nServir avec le curry."]','2026-01-11 00:06:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10703,7509,'fr','Poulet rôti tandoori','Servez cet oiseau épicé indien avec du riz, des pommes de terre et des légumes pour un dîner rôti alternatif.','["1,8 kg de poulet","2 oignons, tranchés épaissement","1 citron, coupé en deux","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et tranché épaissement","400 g de lait de coco en boîte","petit bouquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort, de curcuma, de coriandre moulue, de cumin moulu, de garam masala et de cannelle moulue","6 gousses d''ail, réduites en pâte avec le gingembre","½ morceau de gingembre de la longueur d''un doigt, réduit en pâte avec l''ail","quelques gouttes de colorant alimentaire rouge (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients de la marinade avec\r\n2 cuillères à café de sel et 1 cuillère à café de poivre noir. Barre oblique\r\nles cuisses de poulet plusieurs fois, puis\r\nfrottez la marinade partout, y compris sous\r\nla peau du sein. Faire mariner dans le\r\nréfrigérateur jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Mettre\r\nles oignons, les moitiés de citron et le gingembre\r\nun plat à rôtir. Posez le poulet dessus et\r\nrôtir pendant 1h30 ou jusqu''à ce que le jus de cuisse\r\ncouler clairement lorsqu''il est testé avec une brochette.","Lorsque le poulet est cuit, retirez-le du\r\nle moule, posez-le dans un nouveau plat, couvrez sans serrer\r\navec du papier d''aluminium et laisser reposer. Pêcher le\r\nle gingembre de la boîte et jetez-le. Gratter\r\nretirer les milieux rôtis des citrons\r\ndans un robot culinaire, ajoutez les oignons\r\net le jus de cuisson, et réduire en purée.\r\nRemettez la purée dans le moule et\r\nasseyez-vous sur la plaque de cuisson. Incorporer le lait de coco\r\net faites des bulles doucement, en grattant tout\r\nmorceaux de poulet restés coincés. Vous pouvez\r\najouter un peu d''eau si la sauce est\r\ntrop épais. Incorporer la coriandre et\r\nservir avec le poulet."]','2026-01-11 00:06:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10704,7511,'fr','Kedgerée ultime','Il existe un million de versions de Kedgeree, mais nous pensons que celle-ci est la meilleure et la plus simple du lot.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","2 oignons moyens, coupés en deux et tranchés très finement","350 g d''aiglefin fumé non teint","175 g de filet de saumon légèrement fumé","1 piment rouge séché (Angela a utilisé du Cachemire)","½ pinte de lait entier","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","1 oignon moyen, haché","environ 14 feuilles de curry fraîches ou lyophilisées","4 gousses de cardamome, fendues","1 bâton de cannelle, cassé en morceaux","280 g de riz basmati","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","50g de beurre","2 œufs","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre et quelques quartiers de citron vert, pour servir"]','["Pour les oignons croustillants, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez les oignons avec une pincée de sel (ce qui aide à éviter qu''ils brûlent), puis faites cuire à feu moyen, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés, environ 20-25 minutes. Une fois terminé, étalez-le sur du papier absorbant et laissez-le croustillant. Pendant que les oignons cuisent, mettez les deux poissons dans une poêle avec le piment. Versez le lait dessus, couvrez et laissez mijoter 4 min. Retirez du feu et laissez reposer 10 min à couvert pour finir de cuire doucement le poisson.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer les 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une poêle ou une sauteuse (avec un couvercle). Ajoutez l''oignon, les feuilles de curry, la cardamome et la cannelle et faites revenir jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit tendre et doré, environ 7 à 8 minutes, en remuant souvent. Retirez le poisson du lait avec une écumoire, jetez la peau et les arêtes, couvrez pour garder au chaud et réservez. Préparez le lait jusqu''à 600 ml/1 pt avec de l''eau. Rincez le riz à l''eau tiède dans une passoire, égouttez-le, puis incorporez-le à l''oignon. Continuez à remuer pendant 1 minute pour que le riz soit enrobé. Versez le mélange de lait et incorporez le curcuma. Portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 10 min à couvert en baissant le feu si ça commence à coller au fond.","Lorsque le riz est tendre, retirez du feu, déposez le beurre dessus pour qu''il fonde, puis déposez les morceaux de poisson entiers sur le riz. Couvrir et laisser les saveurs se mélanger. Pendant ce temps, mettez les œufs dans une casserole, couvrez d''eau froide et portez à ébullition, puis laissez bouillir 6 min (pour des œufs légèrement bouillis). Retirer du feu et plonger dans l''eau froide en faisant craquer les coquilles contre les parois de la casserole. Retirez les coquilles et coupez les œufs en quartiers.","Pour servir, cassez le poisson en gros morceaux à la fourchette, jetez-y la coriandre et remuez délicatement pour mélanger sans casser le poisson, en ajoutant les œufs à la fin. Assaisonner, parsemer d''oignons croustillants et servir avec des quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:06:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10705,7513,'fr','Poulet au beurre de cardamome','Un curry maison qui rivalisera avec vos plats à emporter indiens préférés : un riche mélange d''épices mélangé à du ghee crémeux','["2 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché","2 piments verts hachés (laissez les graines si vous l''aimez piquant)","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies, tiges grossièrement hachées","3 cuillères à soupe de ghee ou d''huile végétale","2 oignons, tranchés","2 cuillères à café de curcuma, de garam masala et de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de fenugrec moulu","4 poitrines de poulet, coupées en cubes de 2½ cm","4 clous de girofle","12 gousses de cardamome, graines retirées","1 bâton de cannelle","400 g de tomates en conserve","150 ml de yaourt par pot","50 ml de crème double","chapatis et riz, pour servir"]','["Placez l''ail, le gingembre, les piments et\r\ntiges de coriandre dans le petit bol de\r\nun robot culinaire avec une bonne pincée de\r\nsalez et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte fine – ou réduisez-la en une pâte à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe de ghee ou d''huile dans un\r\ngrande poêle, ajouter les oignons et cuire\r\nlentement pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et\r\ncaramélisé. Incorporer l''ail-gingembre\r\npâte, augmentez le feu et laissez cuire pendant\r\nencore 5 minutes. Ajouter le sol\r\népices et cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nparfumé. Verser le mélange d''oignons épicé\r\nhors de la poêle dans un bol.","Ajoutez le reste de ghee ou d''huile au\r\npoêle et cuire le poulet sur une\r\nfeu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce que tout soit doré.\r\nVersez dans un bol, couvrez et réservez.","Remettre le mélange d''oignons dans la poêle\r\navec les épices entières, les tomates\r\net une canette pleine d''eau (400 ml). Apportez\r\nporter à ébullition, puis couvrir et laisser mijoter\r\ndoucement pendant 40 minutes.","Remettez le poulet dans la poêle et\r\ncuire à découvert encore 10 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe et\r\nle poulet est bien cuit. Remuer\r\ndans le yaourt et la crème, bien assaisonner\r\net parsemer de feuilles de coriandre.\r\nServir avec des chapatis et du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:06:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10706,7515,'fr','Pain plat','Les pains plats indiens (naan) peuvent être frits peu profonds ou cuits au four et ils n''ont besoin que de 15 minutes de cuisson. Parfait pour éponger la sauce d''un délicieux curry maison','["500 g de farine blanche forte","2 cuillères à café de sel","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","300 ml d''eau"]','["Mélangez la farine, le sel, la levure et l''huile dans un grand bol et ajoutez suffisamment d''eau pour obtenir une pâte molle, mais pas bâclée. Bien pétrir. Mettre dans un bol légèrement huilé et laisser lever pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Divisez la pâte en 8 morceaux d''environ 250 g chacun et aplatissez chacun d''entre eux à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie en un cercle de 15 cm de diamètre et d''environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Laissez ensuite lever les morceaux sur une plaque à pâtisserie légèrement farinée pendant 5 minutes. Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites frire chaque morceau jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré des deux côtés, environ 5 minutes au total. Laisser refroidir légèrement avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10707,7517,'fr','Wraps de pommes de terre indiens épicés','Les patates douces sont un légume polyvalent et bien plus sain que votre patate douce de tous les jours','["4 patates douces, coupées en gros quartiers","1 piment rouge, finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","1 oignon rouge, tranché finement","jus 1 citron vert","2 cuillères à café de sucre","6-9 chapatis","150 ml de yaourt nature","gros bouquet de coriandre"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMélanger les patates douces avec le piment,\r\n1 cuillère à café d''huile, graines de cumin, garam masala\r\net beaucoup d''assaisonnement sur un rôti\r\nplateau. Rôtir pendant 25 à 35 minutes en retournant\r\nles quartiers à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés.","Pendant ce temps, faire revenir l''oignon dans le reste de l''huile\r\npendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit partiellement ramolli, remuez\r\ndans le jus de citron vert et le sucre avec un peu\r\nassaisonner, puis éteindre le feu.","Chapatis chauds suivant le pack\r\ninstructions, puis assemblez en ajoutant\r\nquelques quartiers de patate douce pour\r\nchacun, suivi d''une pincée d''oignons,\r\nune cuillerée de yaourt et une petite poignée de\r\nfeuilles de coriandre. Roulez-vous et mangez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10708,7519,'fr','Balti de poulet épicé','Les compliments ont afflué à ce sujet presque aussitôt que le magazine a été mis en vente. Essayez-le et faites-nous part de vos commentaires','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 gros oignons, tranchés épaissement","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry Balti","200 g de quinoa","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1l de bouillon de poulet","50 g de noix de cajou grillées et salées","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles hachées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, faites revenir les oignons\r\npendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et ramollis, puis\r\nverser sur une assiette. Ajoutez les poitrines de poulet,\r\nfaire dorer quelques minutes de chaque côté, puis\r\nincorporer la pâte balti, le quinoa et les oignons.\r\nFaites grésiller quelques minutes, puis versez le\r\ntomates et bouillon et tout donner\r\nun bon mélange. Faire bouillonner pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle quinoa est tendre et savoureux.","Incorporer les noix de cajou et la majeure partie\r\ncoriandre avec un peu d''assaisonnement, puis empiler\r\ndans des bols et répartir sur le reste du\r\ncoriandre pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10709,5992,'fr','Crèmes fruitées à la noix de coco','Un pud rapide faible en gras, facile à préparer et à adapter','["1 sachet de 50 g de crème de coco","500 g de yaourt grec 0 % ou de fromage blanc en pot","85 g de sucre glace tamisé","quelques gouttes d''extrait de vanille","2 kiwis","Boîte de 400 g de morceaux d''ananas"]','["Dissoudre la crème de coco dans 50 ml bouillante\r\neau, puis laisser refroidir. Verser le fromage blanc ou\r\nyaourt dans un bol à mélanger, puis incorporer le glaçage\r\nsucre et vanille. Mélanger avec la noix de coco\r\nmélanger, puis verser dans des verres individuels. Refroidir\r\njusqu''au moment de servir.","Épluchez et coupez les kiwis en petits morceaux.\r\nÉgouttez l''ananas, puis coupez-le en morceaux.\r\npetits morceaux. Mélangez les fruits ensemble, puis versez-les à la cuillère\r\nsur les crèmes de noix de coco pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10710,7521,'fr','Poulet tikka avec riz épicé','La cuisine indienne ne doit pas nécessairement être un plaisir coupable : ce poulet sain cuit au four avec du riz frais parfumé est nutritif et savoureux.','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","Pot de 150 g de yaourt nature allégé","50 g de pâte tikka","100 g de concombre coupé en dés","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de menthe grossièrement hachées","1 oignon rouge, coupé en fines tranches","140 g de riz à grains longs facile à cuire","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","50 g de petits pois surgelés","1 petit poivron rouge, coupé en dés"]','["Coupez profondément chaque poitrine de poulet avec\r\nun couteau 3 à 4 fois d''un côté. Mettez dans un\r\nbol et ajoutez 50 g de yaourt et le\r\npâte tikka. Bien mélanger, couvrir et laisser mariner\r\nau réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes. Faire la raita\r\nen remuant le concombre et la majeure partie\r\nmenthe dans le reste du yaourt. Saison\r\navec du poivre noir, couvrir et réfrigérer.","Chauffer le four à 240C/220C ventilateur/gaz 9.\r\nRépartissez les quartiers d''oignon sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier d''aluminium. Retirez le\r\npoulet de la marinade, secouez-le\r\ntout excédent et placez-le sur le\r\nquartiers d''oignon. Cuire 20 min.","Pendant ce temps, versez le riz, la poudre de curry,\r\npetits pois et poivre dans une casserole bouillante\r\neau et laisser mijoter pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nle riz est juste tendre. Bien égoutter et\r\nrépartissez le riz dans 4 assiettes.\r\nAjouter le poulet, l''oignon rôti et\r\nmenthe restante. Servir avec le\r\nraïta de concombre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10711,7523,'fr','Riz pilaf aux pistaches','Ce plat d''accompagnement légèrement épicé et vibrant accompagne parfaitement le curry.','["1 oignon, tranché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","300 g de riz basmati","600 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","50 g de pistaches hachées grossièrement"]','["Faire revenir l''oignon dans l''huile dans une grande poêle\r\npoêle ou une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie. Incorporer\r\nle curcuma, puis le riz, et gardez\r\nen remuant jusqu''à ce que les grains soient dorés.","Versez le bouillon chaud, portez à ébullition,\r\npuis baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez cuire\r\n15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre. Supprimer\r\nde la chaleur et remuer jusqu''au printemps\r\noignons, pistaches et quelques assaisonnements\r\navant de servir chaud ou de laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10712,7525,'fr','Curry crémeux de betterave','Essayez une approche originale pour servir des betteraves tranchées épaisses en les combinant avec des épices Madras, des graines de moutarde et du piment vert.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 oignons, hachés très finement","2 cuillères à café de graines de moutarde jaune","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry Madras","1 kg (poids pelé) de betterave crue, pelée, coupée en deux et en tranches épaisses","1 piment vert, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","3 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature faible en gras, plus un peu pour servir","riz basmati, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à couvercle, remuez\r\ndans les oignons et cuire 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoux. Versez les graines de moutarde et faites cuire\r\npendant 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''il soit grillé. Remuer à travers le\r\npâte de curry et faire grésiller pendant 3 min.","Mélangez la betterave avec le piquant\r\noignons, puis ajoutez le piment, les tomates\r\net 2 bidons d''eau. Couvrir et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 30 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que\r\nla betterave est tendre. Retirez le couvercle,\r\naugmentez le feu et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que le\r\nla sauce est épaisse.","Retirez du feu, puis mélangez\r\nles amandes, le yaourt et un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nGarnir de yaourt et servir avec du basmati\r\ndu riz, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10713,7527,'fr','Pois chiches au curry','Servez cet accompagnement dans le cadre d''un repas indien pour un peu d''épices saines.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1-2 piments rouges épépinés et hachés","1 clou de girofle","1 petit bâton de cannelle","1 feuille de laurier","1 oignon, finement haché","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, rincés et égouttés","1 cuillère à café de paprika","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","2 petites tomates hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre hachée"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à fond épais.\r\nFaire frire le cumin, les piments, le clou de girofle, la cannelle\r\net la feuille de laurier ensemble jusqu''à ce que le cumin\r\ncommence à crépiter. Ajouter l''oignon, le curcuma\r\net une pincée de sel. Cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ncommence à ramollir, puis ajoutez l''ail.","Poursuivez la cuisson 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nl''oignon est tendre, puis ajoutez les pois chiches, le paprika,\r\npoivre noir et coriandre moulue. Donner\r\ntout est bien remué donc les pois chiches\r\nsont bien enrobés d’épices.","Ajoutez les tomates et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau.\r\nCuire à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que les tomates\r\nsont tendres et la sauce est épaisse et\r\npulpeux. Retirer du feu et saupoudrer\r\nsur la coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10714,7529,'fr','Escalopes d''agneau indiennes','Ce plat aromatique saura mettre l’eau à la bouche à tous','["50 g de parmesan finement râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry (nous avons utilisé de la poudre de curry doux Schwartz)","4 côtelettes d''agneau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","chutney de tomates, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Mélanger\r\nle parmesan et la poudre de curry ensemble.\r\nAssaisonnez l''agneau, puis pressez la viande dans\r\nle mélange de fromage pour enrober. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un\r\nune poêle allant au four ou une plaque à pâtisserie épaisse\r\net faire revenir les escalopes 2 min de chaque côté\r\ndorer.","Transférer au four pendant 5 minutes à feu moyen,\r\nou plus pour bien cuit. Délicieux servi\r\navec une cuillerée de chutney de tomates et quelques\r\npurée parfumée à la coriandre hachée."]','2026-01-11 00:06:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10715,7531,'fr','Hachis indien avec salade de tomates fraîches','Ce plat plein de saveurs est très bon marché et rapide à préparer, le repas familial parfait','["1 oignon rouge, tranché","300 g de bœuf haché","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyen ou doux","100 g de lentilles rouges séchées","700 ml de bouillon de bœuf chaud","3 tomates","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre","4 mini pains naan"]','["Dans une poêle antiadhésive, faire revenir l''oignon à sec\r\net hachez à feu vif pendant 2 min,\r\nbriser le hachis au fur et à mesure. Incorporer\r\nla poudre de curry et les lentilles, verser\r\nbouillon, puis laisser mijoter vivement 10 min.","Pendant que le hachis cuit, coupez en dés\r\nles tomates et hachez grossièrement les\r\ncoriandre, puis mélanger dans un petit\r\nbol. Mettez brièvement les naans dans un grille-pain\r\npour réchauffer, puis mettez-en un sur chacun\r\nassiette. Verser un quart de la viande hachée dessus\r\nchaque naan, puis garnir d''une cuillerée de\r\nla salade de tomates fraîches et coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10716,7533,'fr','Poisson frit et curry de tomates','Utilisez un poisson blanc durable comme la goberge dans ce curry de noix de coco et de tomates du sud de l''Inde avec de la coriandre fraîche','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale, plus 2 cuillères à café","2 oignons, tranchés finement","8 grosses tomates en grappe, hachées grossièrement","4 gousses d''ail","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché grossièrement","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry Madras","165 ml de lait de coco en boîte","une grosse poignée de coriandre finement hachée et des brins supplémentaires pour servir","500 g de filets de lieu jaune, pelés","6 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","riz basmati, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une poêle. Ajouter les oignons\r\net une pincée de sel. Cuire environ 8 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés.","Pendant ce temps, mixez les tomates, l''ail\r\net le gingembre dans un robot culinaire à un\r\npurée onctueuse. Ajouter la pâte de curry\r\naux oignons et faire revenir encore 3 minutes.\r\nIncorporer le mélange de tomates et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Ajoutez le\r\nlait de coco et coriandre hachée.\r\nLaisser mijoter à nouveau pour épaissir.","Saupoudrez les filets de poisson d''un peu d''assaisonnement\r\nfarine. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans un poêle antiadhésive\r\npoêle à frire. Cuire les filets, par lots,\r\nà feu vif pendant environ 1 min à chaque fois\r\ncôté, jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Soigneusement\r\nplacer le poisson dans le mélange de tomates et\r\nlaisser mijoter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste cuit. Dispersion\r\nsur des brins de coriandre et servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:06:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10717,7535,'fr','Dhal de lentilles aigre-douce et aubergines grillées','Pimentez votre souper avec cette recette ultrasaine, riche en fibres, riche en fer et qui compte pour 4 sur 5 par jour – elle est aussi bon marché !','["100 g de lentilles rouges rincées","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tamarin (nous avons utilisé du Bart)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon moyen, tranché finement","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","Morceau de gingembre de 3 cm/1¼ pouce, râpé","1 cuillère à café de curry en poudre","1 aubergine moyenne, coupée en tranches de 2 cm","riz basmati cuit, chutney de citron vert ou de mangue et quelques feuilles de coriandre, pour servir, si vous le souhaitez"]','["Couvrir les lentilles, le curcuma et la pâte de tamarin avec 500 ml d''eau. Ajoutez un peu de sel et faites bouillir pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très tendre. Écumez toute mousse qui se forme sur le dessus. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et faites revenir l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, environ 5 minutes.","Ajoutez le curry et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Versez le mélange de lentilles et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude. Frottez le reste de l''huile sur les tranches d''aubergine et assaisonnez. Cuire 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits et carbonisés. Mangez avec du riz basmati, du chutney de citron vert ou de mangue et une pincée de coriandre, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10718,7537,'fr','Paneer au brocoli et sésame','Servez ce plat végétarien à base de fromage indien, de paneer, dans le cadre d''une soirée au curry ou avec du riz comme dîner en milieu de semaine.','["200 g de brocoli germé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","pince l''asafoetida","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","1 gros piment vert, finement haché","½ cuillère à café de graines de moutarde brune","6 feuilles de curry","1 oignon moyen, tranché","140 g de paneer coupé en lanières","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","½ cuillère à café de macis moulu"]','["Coupez le brocoli et faites-le bouillir ou cuire à la vapeur\r\npendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres mais fermes à souhait.\r\nmordre. Égoutter et laisser refroidir à froid\r\nl''eau. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok ou une grande poêle\r\npoêle, puis ajoutez l''asafoetida, le cumin\r\ngraines, graines de sésame, piment, moutarde\r\nles graines et les feuilles de curry. Cuisiner pour\r\n1 min jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé, puis ajoutez l''oignon\r\net laissez cuire encore 2 min.","Ajoutez le paner, le gingembre et l''ail,\r\net la saison. Cuire à feu moyen pendant\r\n4-5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le paneer devienne doré.\r\nAjouter le brocoli et mélanger avec le\r\npaneer et les épices, puis ajouter le jus de citron,\r\nmacis et zeste de poivre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10719,7539,'fr','Pilaf de chou-fleur et pois chiches','Délicieux servi seul ou en accompagnement de poitrines de poulet grillées frottées d''un peu de pâte de curry','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 gros oignons, tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry de votre choix","200 g de riz basmati","350 g de fleurons de chou-fleur","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, rincés et égouttés","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","50 g d''amandes effilées grillées","une poignée de coriandre hachée"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive\r\net ajoutez les oignons. Cuire à feu moyen\r\nchauffer 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à tourner\r\ndoré. Incorporer la pâte de curry et cuire\r\npendant 1 min. Ajouter le riz, le chou-fleur et\r\npois chiches, en remuant pour les enrober de pâte.","Versez le bouillon et remuez. Couvrir et\r\nlaisser mijoter pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz et\r\nle chou-fleur est tendre et tout le liquide\r\na été absorbé. Incorporer les amandes\r\net la coriandre, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10720,7541,'fr','Curry de légumes pour une foule','Ce curry végétarien est idéal pour nourrir un groupe de copains avec un budget limité, ou pour préparer un lot à congeler.','["1 grosse pomme de terre, coupée en dés","1 petite courge musquée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en dés","1 aubergine, coupée en dés","6 cuillères à soupe de pâte tikka masala","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 oignons, tranchés","Pot de 680 à 700 g de purée de tomates","400 g de lait de coco en boîte","2 poivrons rouges, tranchés","2 courgettes, coupées en dés","quelques brins de coriandre, pour servir","riz ou pain naan, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMélanger la pomme de terre, la courge et\r\naubergine avec 2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry\r\net 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans un grand plat à rôtir.\r\nAssaisonner puis rôtir 30 min.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce. Frire\r\nles oignons dans le reste de l''huile\r\nune grande casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie et\r\ndoré – ajoutez un peu d’eau\r\ns''ils commencent à sécher. Incorporer le\r\nreste de pâte de curry, cuire pendant\r\n3 minutes, puis ajoutez la passata,\r\nlait de coco et 100 ml d''eau.\r\nLaisser mijoter quelques minutes.","Quand les légumes sont rôtis,\r\nversez-les dans la sauce avec le\r\npoivrons et courgettes. Laisser mijoter\r\npendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Dispersion\r\navec de la coriandre et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10721,7543,'fr','Poulet biryani au four','Conservez ce biryani au congélateur pour un coup de pouce santé facile en milieu de semaine','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en morceaux","4 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en morceaux","2 oignons, tranchés","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry (nous utilisons du Korma et du Tikka Masala)","300 g de chou-fleur coupé en petits bouquets","700 ml de bouillon de poulet","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, rincés et égouttés","200 g de yaourt nature","300g d''épinards","400 g de riz basmati, cuit selon les instructions du paquet","5 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées"]','["Commencez par préparer le curry. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe\r\nde l''huile dans une grande poêle à frire profonde. Saison\r\nle poulet et faire revenir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, puis\r\nretirer et réserver. Faire revenir l''oignon dans\r\nle reste de l''huile pendant 10-12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre\r\net commence à caraméliser.","Ajouter la pâte et le chou-fleur en remuant\r\npour bien enrober le tout, puis remettre le poulet.\r\nVersez le bouillon, les tomates et les pois chiches\r\net laissez mijoter le tout pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle chou-fleur est presque tendre. Là\r\ndevrait être juste assez de liquide pour couvrir\r\ntout, alors ajoute un peu d''eau\r\nou du stock si vous en avez besoin. Supprimer du\r\nchauffer et incorporer le yaourt.","Assemblez le plat de cuisson en 1 grand ou\r\n2 plats petits et profonds allant au four. Commencer\r\navec un ¹/³ de feuilles d''épinards, assaisonner,\r\npuis garnir avec un ¹/³ du curry. Terminer\r\navec un ¹/³ du riz puis répéter deux fois\r\nplus. Parsemer sur les amandes et soit\r\nlaisser refroidir complètement pour congeler ou chauffer le four\r\nà 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7 et laissez cuire\r\n20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit croustillante\r\net le plat est très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:06:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10722,7545,'fr','Repas familiaux : Curry de poulet doux','Un curry légèrement épicé avec une riche sauce au yaourt qui plaira aux adultes comme aux enfants.','["1-1½ cuillère à café d''huile de noix de coco (nous avons utilisé du Fushi) ou d''huile de tournesol","1 gros oignon, finement haché","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cm de gingembre frais, râpé ou finement haché","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde jaune","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 paquet de 500 g de morceaux de poulet (cuisses et pilons) ou cuisses","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","1 bâton de cannelle","250 g de yaourt grec, à température ambiante","2 cuillères à soupe de raisins secs","poignée de coriandre hachée, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à fond épais. Faites revenir les oignons doucement pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter l''ail, le gingembre, la coriandre, les graines de moutarde, le garam masala et le cumin et cuire 1 à 2 minutes en laissant les arômes se libérer.","Ajoutez le poulet et laissez cuire 10 min à feu doux en retournant de temps en temps et en veillant à ce que les épices ne s''accrochent pas. Versez environ 300 ml d''eau bouillante jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit presque recouverte. Incorporer le cube de bouillon et le bâton de cannelle. Laisser mijoter environ 45 minutes à 1 heure sans le couvercle pour qu''il y ait une petite quantité de sauce épaissie au fond de la casserole. Retirez le bâton de cannelle.","Incorporer le yaourt et les raisins secs, chauffer doucement et servir. Parsemer de coriandre, si vous en utilisez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10723,6066,'fr','Dis bonjour','Les épinards nutritifs constituent la base de ce plat d''accompagnement indien traditionnel et sain, combinés avec des pommes de terre et des épices.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre haché","500 g de pommes de terre coupées en morceaux de 2 cm","1 gros piment rouge, coupé en deux, épépiné et finement tranché","½ cuillère à café de chaque graines de moutarde noire, graines de cumin, curcuma","250 g de feuilles d''épinards"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre et faites revenir environ 3 minutes. Incorporez les pommes de terre, le piment, les épices et une demi-cuillère à café de sel et poursuivez la cuisson en remuant encore 5 minutes. Ajoutez un peu d''eau, couvrez et laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes.","Vérifiez que les pommes de terre sont prêtes en les piquant avec la pointe d''un couteau, et si c''est le cas, ajoutez les épinards et laissez-les flétrir dans la poêle. Retirez du feu et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10724,4847,'fr','Balti de poulet plus sain','Une version plus légère du classique indien à emporter d''Angela Nilsen, ce curry à base de tomates regorge d''épinards et de poivrons supplémentaires.','["450 g de poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en bouchées","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert","1 cuillère à café de paprika","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou d''arachide","1 bâton de cannelle","3 gousses de cardamome, fendues","1 piment vert petit à moyen","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 oignon moyen, grossièrement râpé","2 gousses d''ail, hachées très finement","2½ cm de gingembre râpé","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","250 ml de purée bio","1 poivron rouge épépiné, coupé en petits morceaux","1 tomate moyenne, hachée","85 g de pousses d''épinards","une poignée de coriandre fraîche hachée","chapatis ou riz basmati, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le poulet dans un bol moyen. Mélanger\r\ndans le jus de citron vert, paprika, poudre de piment\r\net une mouture de poivre noir (étape 1), puis\r\nlaisser mariner au moins 15 mn,\r\nde préférence un peu plus longtemps.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande\r\nwok antiadhésif ou sauteuse. Pourboire\r\nle bâton de cannelle, les gousses de cardamome,\r\ngraines entières de piment et de cumin, et\r\nfaire sauter brièvement juste pour colorer et libérer\r\nleur parfum (étape 2). Incorporer l''oignon,\r\nl''ail et le gingembre et faire revenir sur une\r\nfeu moyen-vif pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nl''oignon commence à brunir. Ajoutez le\r\nle reste de l''huile, puis ajoutez le poulet\r\net faire sauter pendant 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus\r\nn''a plus l''air brut. Mélangez le curcuma, le cumin, la coriandre moulue et le garam\r\nmasala ensemble. Verser dans la poêle, baisser\r\nle feu à moyen et laissez cuire 2 minutes\r\n(étape 3). Versez la passata et 150 ml\r\neau, puis déposez-y les morceaux de\r\npoivre. Lorsque vous commencez à bouillonner, abaissez\r\nle feu et laisser mijoter pendant 15-20 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre.","Incorporer la tomate, laisser mijoter 2-3\r\nminutes, puis ajoutez les épinards et retournez\r\ndans la poêle pour qu''il flétrisse. Saison\r\navec un peu de sel. Si tu veux maigrir\r\nVerser la sauce, ajouter un peu plus\r\nl''eau. Retirez le bâton de cannelle, le piment\r\net les gousses de cardamome, si vous le souhaitez, avant\r\nservir. Parsemer de coriandre fraîche\r\net servir avec des chapatis chauds ou\r\ndu riz basmati, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10725,7547,'fr','Curry de poulet maison','Un pot indien rapide et authentique, rustique et authentique, rempli de tonnes d''épices asiatiques piquantes et de coriandre parfumée.','["1 gros oignon","6 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","50 g de gingembre haché grossièrement","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","bâton de cannelle de 5 cm","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","8 cuisses de poulet, décortiquées et désossées (environ 800g)","250 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée"]','["Hachez grossièrement l''oignon, transférez-le dans un petit robot culinaire et ajoutez 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau - transformez en une pâte molle. Vous pouvez utiliser un mixeur plongeant pour cela ou râper grossièrement l''oignon dans un bol – il n''est pas nécessaire d''ajouter de l''eau si vous râpez l''oignon. Versez dans un petit bol et laissez de côté.","Mettez l''ail et le gingembre hachés dans le même robot culinaire et ajoutez 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau – mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse et versez dans un autre petit bol. Vous pouvez également écraser l’ail en pâte avec un couteau ou un presse-ail et râper finement le gingembre.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok ou une poêle solide à feu moyen. Mélangez les graines de cumin et de fenouil avec la cannelle et les flocons de piment et ajoutez-les à la poêle en une seule fois. Remuez le tout pendant environ 30 secondes jusqu''à ce que les épices libèrent un arôme parfumé.","Ajoutez la pâte d’oignon – elle va cracher au début.  Faites frire jusqu''à ce que l''eau s''évapore et que les oignons deviennent bien dorés - cela devrait prendre environ 7 à 8 minutes.  Ajoutez la pâte d''ail et de gingembre et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes en remuant constamment.","Incorporer le garam masala, le curcuma et le sucre et poursuivre la cuisson pendant 20 secondes avant d''y verser les tomates. Poursuivez la cuisson à feu moyen environ 10 minutes sans couvercle jusqu''à ce que les tomates réduisent et noircissent.","Coupez les cuisses de poulet en morceaux de 3 cm et ajoutez-les à la poêle une fois que les tomates ont épaissi pour former une pâte. Cuire pendant 5 minutes pour enrober le poulet de masala et sceller le jus, puis verser sur le bouillon de poulet chaud. Laisser mijoter pendant 8 à 10 minutes sans couvercle jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre et que le masala épaississe légèrement – ​​vous devrez peut-être ajouter une louche supplémentaire de bouillon ou d''eau si le curry en a besoin. Saupoudrer de coriandre hachée et servir avec des pains plats indiens ou du riz basmati moelleux et un pot de yaourt en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:06:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10726,4849,'fr','Paquets de poisson au curry et à la noix de coco','Faites cuire à la vapeur du poisson durable comme le tilapia dans des papillotes avec de la pâte de curry, de la noix de coco et du citron vert, puis servez-le avec du riz pour un dîner sain.','["2 gros filets de tilapia, environ 125 g/4½ oz chacun","2 cuillères à café de pâte de curry jaune ou rouge","2 cuillères à café de noix de coco desséchée","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert, plus les quartiers pour servir","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja","140 g de riz basmati","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","1 piment rouge, tranché","200 g de brocoli cuit à tige fine, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDéchirez 4 gros morceaux de papier d''aluminium, doublez-les\r\nversez-les, puis placez un filet de poisson dans le\r\nmilieu de chacun. Répartir sur le curry\r\ncoller. Divisez la noix de coco, le zeste de citron vert\r\net du jus, et du soja entre chacun\r\nfilet. Relevez les côtés du papier d''aluminium,\r\npuis froissez les bords et les côtés\r\nensemble pour faire 2 colis scellés.","Disposez les paquets sur une plaque allant au four et\r\ncuire au four pendant 10-15 minutes. Versez le riz dans\r\nune casserole avec beaucoup d''eau et faire bouillir pendant\r\n12-15 minutes ou jusqu''à cuisson. Bien égoutter.\r\nServir le poisson sur le riz, arroser de\r\nsauce chili et parsemer de tranches de piment.\r\nServir avec du brocoli et des quartiers de lime."]','2026-01-11 00:06:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10727,6325,'fr','Chou gujarati à la noix de coco et aux pommes de terre','Cet accompagnement super sain et sauté constitue un délicieux dîner végétarien servi avec du riz et du dhal.','["500 g de Charlotte ou autres pommes de terre nouvelles, non pelées et coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 pincée d''asafoetida (disponible chez Bart ou steenbergs.co.uk, voir conseil)","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 piments rouges séchés","1 piment rouge ou vert frais, épépiné et tranché finement","1 chou pointu (chéri), ​​finement râpé","jus ½ citron","2 cuillères à soupe de noix de coco fraîche desséchée ou râpée, grillée","un bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole bouillante salée\r\narroser pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Bien égoutter\r\net remettre dans la poêle. Écrasez légèrement avec le\r\nle dos d''une fourchette, juste pour casser, pas pour écraser.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et\r\npuis ajoutez l''asafoetida, les épices et le séché\r\npiments. Cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles épices éclatent et les piments noircissent.","Ajoutez le piment frais, le chou et un peu\r\nsalez et faites sauter pendant 3-4 minutes. Ajouter le chaud\r\nmettre les pommes de terre dans la poêle et cuire 2-3 minutes\r\nplus jusqu''à ce que le chou soit tendre, mais quand même\r\na du mordant. Incorporer le jus de citron,\r\nnoix de coco et coriandre, et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10728,7549,'fr','Côté de saumon rôti épicé','Servir le saumon glacé au paprika, au gingembre et à la moutarde au miel pour un rôti original d''inspiration indienne.','["1½ kg de côté de saumon, avec la peau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour le badigeonnage","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de paprika","½ cuillère à café de grains de poivre noir grossièrement moulus","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète","1 cuillère à café de miel","1 citron coupé en quartiers pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nTapisser un grand plat à rôtir de pâte à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin ou papier d''aluminium – cela aide à prévenir\r\nle poisson ne colle pas à la boîte car il\r\ncuisiniers. Badigeonner la peau du saumon d''huile et\r\nplacez-le, côté peau vers le bas, sur le papier.","Mélangez le gingembre moulu avec le paprika,\r\npoivre, moutarde, miel et 1 cuillère à soupe d''olive\r\nhuile. Répartissez-le uniformément sur le côté charnu\r\ndu poisson.","Rôtir à découvert pendant environ 20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le saumon soit bien cuit –\r\nvérifier en enfonçant un couteau dans le filet\r\net en veillant à ce que le poisson se défasse facilement.","Servir directement du moule ou utiliser\r\nquelques tranches de poisson à soulever soigneusement\r\nle saumon dans une grande assiette. Trancher en\r\nportions et servir avec des quartiers de citron\r\nsur le côté."]','2026-01-11 00:06:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10729,7551,'fr','Salade de pommes de terre nouvelles et tamarin','Le tamarin est couramment utilisé pour aromatiser les pommes de terre en Inde et rend cette salade faible en gras authentique et percutante.','["1½ cuillère à soupe de pulpe ou de pâte de tamarin","50 g de sucre muscovado doré","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché","1,2 kg de pommes de terre nouvelles","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature faible en gras","4 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée"]','["Pour faire la vinaigrette, mettez le tamarin\r\nla pulpe dans une petite casserole, verser dessus 75 ml\r\neau bouillante et ajouter le sucre, le cumin\r\net du gingembre. Laisser mijoter, sans couvercle, jusqu''à ce que\r\nle pansement s''épaissit et devient\r\nsirupeux, environ 10-15 minutes. Il devrait avoir un\r\nsaveur agréable – ajoutez du sucre supplémentaire si nécessaire.","Pendant que le tamarin cuit, apportez un\r\nporter à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée et\r\najoutez les pommes de terre. Remettre à ébullition et\r\ncuire 15 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter, puis\r\nlaissez-les refroidir légèrement avant de les couper en deux. Transfert\r\ndans un grand bol à mélanger et verser sur le\r\nvinaigrette, en remuant doucement pour vous assurer que\r\nles pommes de terre sont bien enrobées. Arrosez le\r\nyaourt, parsemer de coriandre et\r\nservir tiède ou à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:06:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10730,7553,'fr','Un bon curry de poulet','Impressionnez avec ce plat indien épicé au tandoori masala avec des poivrons, de la noix de coco et de la coriandre fraîche','["6 cuillères à soupe de poudre de tandoori masala","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de gingembre","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte d''ail","500 g de yaourt à la noix de coco en pot, plus un peu pour servir","4 oignons, 2 coupés en quartiers, 2 hachés","2 poivrons, coupés en gros morceaux","1¼kg de cuisses de poulet sans peau, coupées en gros morceaux","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","gros bouquet de coriandre, tiges hachées","2-3 cuillères à café de poudre de piment fort","Pot de purée de 680 ml","Boîte de 160 ml de crème de coco","riz et pain naan, pour servir"]','["Dans un très grand bol, mélanger la moitié du\r\nmélange d''épices, 1 cuillère à soupe de chacune des pâtes,\r\nles trois quarts du yaourt et\r\nun peu de sel. Incorporer les quartiers d''oignons,\r\npoivrons et poulet, puis laisser reposer\r\nlaisser mariner toute la nuit au réfrigérateur.","Faire revenir les oignons émincés dans l''huile\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit vraiment mou. Ajoutez le reste\r\nmélange et pâtes d''épices, la coriandre\r\ntiges et poudre de piment. Cuisiner pour\r\n1 min, puis incorporez 100 ml d''eau et\r\nla passata. Laisser mijoter 15 mn,\r\npuis ajoutez la crème de coco et\r\nyaourt restant. Laisser gros\r\nou mixez avec un mixeur.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nÉtalez le poulet et les légumes sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie. Rôtir pendant 15 à 20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits et légèrement carbonisés. Astuce\r\ndans la sauce. Servir avec du riz, du naan,\r\nyaourt supplémentaire et feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10731,5774,'fr','Soupe indienne aux pois chiches et légumes','Saine, savoureuse et peu coûteuse, cette soupe est idéale à emporter au travail pour le déjeuner','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 gros oignon, haché","1 cuillère à café de gingembre frais finement râpé","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","850 ml de bouillon de légumes","2 grosses carottes, coupées en quartiers dans le sens de la longueur et hachées","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","100 g de haricots verts hachés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne, puis ajoutez\r\nl''oignon, le gingembre et l''ail. Faire frire 2 minutes,\r\npuis ajoutez le garam masala, laissez-le 1 min\r\nplus, puis ajoutez le bouillon et les carottes. Laisser mijoter\r\npendant 10 min, puis ajoutez les pois chiches. Utilisez un bâton\r\nmixeur pour mixer un peu la soupe. Incorporer le\r\nharicots et laisser mijoter 3 minutes. Emballé dans un flacon\r\nou, si vous avez un micro-ondes au travail, détendez-vous et\r\nréchauffez-vous pour le déjeuner. Excellent avec du pain naan."]','2026-01-11 00:06:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10732,6552,'fr','Riz indien épicé','Le délicieux riz épicé de Sara Buenfeld est parfait servi avec votre curry préféré','["une tasse de riz américain à grains longs","2 oignons, tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 bâton de cannelle","6 gousses de cardamome","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","une grosse poignée de raisins secs et de noix de cajou grillées"]','["Faire revenir les oignons dans l''huile de tournesol\r\ndans une grande poêle pendant 10-12\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Remplissez une grande casserole d''eau, portez à ébullition et versez-y une cuillère à café de sel : l''eau bouillonnera furieusement. Ajouter le curcuma et\r\nle bâton de cannelle dans l''eau. Versez le riz, remuez une fois et remettez à ébullition, puis baissez un peu le feu pour que l''eau bout régulièrement, mais pas vigoureusement.\r\nFaire bouillir à découvert, sans remuer (cela donne du riz gluant) pendant 10 minutes. Retirez-en un peu avec une écumoire et grignotez un grain ou deux. S''ils sont trop croustillants, laissez cuire encore une minute et goûtez à nouveau. Ils doivent être tendres mais avec un peu de mordant.\r\nÉgoutter le riz dans une grande passoire et rincer en versant sur une bouilloire d''eau très chaude","Remuer les graines concassées\r\ndes gousses de cardamome dans les oignons avec\r\nles graines de cumin et faire revenir brièvement.","Ajoutez une grande poignée de raisins secs et\r\nnoix de cajou grillées, puis les chaudes\r\nriz égoutté. c''est super avec du curry\r\net donnera également une touche exotique aux viandes ou poissons grillés."]','2026-01-11 00:06:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10733,7557,'fr','Galettes de poisson aux épices indiennes','Pimentez les restes de saumon cuit dans ces galettes de poisson simples et congelables avec de la raita rafraîchissante','["600 g de pommes de terre, coupées en quartiers si grosses","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","1 œuf battu","100 g de restes de saumon cuits, émiettés en gros morceaux","farine nature, pour enrober","25 g de beurre et 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","restes de mayonnaise à l''avocat, de raita ou de chutney de mangue, pour servir"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre. Pendant ce temps, faites frire à sec le\r\ngraines de cumin pendant quelques secondes dans un grand\r\npoêle antiadhésive. Lorsqu''il est tendre, égouttez-le\r\npommes de terre, remettre dans la casserole, ajouter les\r\ncumin, oignons, piment et coriandre avec\r\nbeaucoup d''assaisonnement, puis bien écraser.\r\nUne fois un peu refroidi, incorporer 2 cuillères à soupe de\r\nl''œuf, puis remuez délicatement dans le\r\nsaumon. Façonner 4 galettes grossières, puis\r\nenrober de farine. En cas de congélation, congeler sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit solide, puis emballez-la.","Dans la poêle, faire fondre le beurre avec\r\nl''huile. Faites frire les gâteaux pendant environ 2 minutes\r\nchaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Servir avec le\r\nmayonnaise, raita (recette ci-dessous) ou mangue\r\nchutney et quelques feuilles de salade."]','2026-01-11 00:06:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10734,7559,'fr','Légumes épicés indiens','Cette recette convient à tous les légumes verts que vous avez sous la main – du chou frisé râpé aux choux de Bruxelles. Pour les moins aventureux, moins de piment peut être utilisé','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de graines de moutarde","4 piments verts, finement hachés","gros morceau de gingembre frais, râpé","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","500 g de légumes verts râpés, comme du chou frisé, des choux de Bruxelles ou tout autre","100g de petits pois","jus d''1 citron","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","petit bouquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de noix de coco desséchée non sucrée"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive ou un wok,\r\nfaire grésiller le cumin et les graines de moutarde pendant 1 min,\r\npuis ajoutez le piment, le gingembre et le curcuma. Frire\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit aromatique, puis ajoutez les légumes verts, une pincée\r\nde sel, un peu d''eau et les petits pois.","Couvrir la poêle et cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes verts\r\nse sont flétris. Ajouter le jus de citron moulu\r\ncoriandre, la moitié de la coriandre fraîche et la moitié\r\nla noix de coco desséchée, puis mélangez le tout\r\nensemble. Empilez dans un plat de service et répartissez\r\navec le reste de la noix de coco et de la coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:06:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10735,7561,'fr','Kulfi à l''eau de rose et aux pistaches et mangues grillées','Le kulfi est généralement fabriqué à partir de lait bouilli pendant plusieurs heures. Cette version sournoise est faite avec du lait concentré, donc tout le travail acharné a été fait pour vous.','["450 g de lait concentré en boîte","2 cuillères à soupe d''eau de rose","50 g de pistaches hachées très finement, plus des pistaches hachées grossièrement pour servir","Pot de 284 ml de crème double","3 petites mangues mûres"]','["Pressez le lait concentré dans un bol\r\net incorporer l''eau de rose et les pistaches.\r\nFouettez légèrement la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle tienne bien\r\nfaçonner, puis incorporer au mélange de pistaches.","Verser dans 6 petits ramequins ou pyramide\r\nmoules. Congeler, puis couvrir d''un film alimentaire.","Pour servir : Coupez chaque mangue de chaque côté du noyau pour former 6 moitiés, mais ne la pelez pas. Score\r\nfaire un croisement dans la chair, mais ne pas trancher la peau. Vous pouvez le faire plusieurs heures à l''avance. Cuire au barbecue côté chair vers le bas jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à caraméliser. Laissez tel quel ou retournez-le pour que les segments soient fiers. Servir avec le kulfi parsemé de pistaches (et d''un filet de citron vert,\r\nsi tu veux)."]','2026-01-11 00:06:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10736,7563,'fr','Chutney de tomates fraîches','Un accompagnement indien frais qui se marie bien avec des trempettes de pain naan ou des poppadums – idéal pour un buffet du Nouvel An ou de Diwali','["6 grosses tomates mûries sur vigne","1 gros oignon rouge, finement haché","2 poignées de coriandre fraîche hachée finement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin"]','["Coupez les tomates en deux, retirez les graines, hachez la chair et placez-la dans une passoire au-dessus d''un bol pour que l''excès de jus puisse s''écouler.","Mettez l''oignon et la coriandre dans un bol. Faites chauffer l''huile et faites frire les graines de cumin pendant environ 30 secondes, puis versez-les dans le bol. Incorporer les tomates, couvrir et réfrigérer.","Pour servir, ajoutez un peu de sel (voir astuce ci-dessous) et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:06:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10737,7565,'fr','Carbonara authentique','Cette recette de carbonara authentique et infaillible vous montre comment obtenir une sauce soyeuse et parfaite à chaque fois, sans œufs brouillés ni stress.','["340 g de lardons","2 œufs, plus 5-6 jaunes d''œufs (congelez les blancs supplémentaires pour les utiliser dans une autre recette)","150 g de pecorino romano râpé, plus un peu pour servir","400 g d''eau demi-queectons"]','["Retirez la croûte de la guanciale et jetez-la. Coupez la guanciale en tranches de ½ cm d''épaisseur, puis en lanières épaisses. Faites frire la guanciale dans une poêle à feu doux pendant 10 à 15 minutes pour faire fondre lentement la graisse – une fois prête, la guanciale sera croustillante et dorée. Retirez le guanciale de la graisse à l''aide d''une écumoire et séchez-le sur du papier absorbant. Jetez la moitié de la graisse dans la poêle et réservez le reste – ne rincez pas la poêle.","Pour le sabayon, fouettez les œufs, les jaunes et le fromage râpé dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur avec un bon zeste de poivre noir et la graisse guanciale réservée. Placez le bol sur une casserole d''eau frémissante, en vous assurant que le bol ne touche pas l''eau, et laissez cuire 2-3 minutes en fouettant jusqu''à ce que le mélange ait une consistance épaisse, semblable à celle d''une crème anglaise (si vous avez un thermomètre de cuisine, le sabayon sera prêt lorsqu''il atteindra 64°C). Ne laissez pas l’eau bouillir, sinon les œufs seront brouillés.","Faites cuire les pâtes dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante salée en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente. Égoutter en réservant une tasse d''eau de cuisson.","Mettez les pâtes cuites dans la poêle que vous avez utilisée pour cuire la guanciale et mélangez bien les résidus de graisse à feu doux. Retirer du feu et ajouter le sabayon, suivi d''un peu d''eau de cuisson des pâtes réservée pour les détendre et créer une consistance crémeuse et onctueuse. Remuer et mélanger les pâtes dans la sauce pour vous assurer qu''elles sont bien enrobées.","Ajoutez la guanciale croustillante et beaucoup de poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Servir dans de grands bols de pâtes et garnir de fromage râpé supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:06:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10738,7567,'fr','Muffuletta farcie italienne','Essayez notre version du sandwich italo-américain classique de la Nouvelle-Orléans. Emballez-le pour un pique-nique : la saveur et la texture s''améliorent lorsqu''on les laisse refroidir toute la nuit.','["400 g de pain rond","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","300 g de cornichons de légumes mélangés, hachés grossièrement","60 g d''olives piment-ail dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","2 filets d''anchois , hachés finement","10 g de basilic haché grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","9 tranches d''emmental","85 g de tranches de salami","150 g de mortadelle Morrisons The Best"]','["Découpez délicatement un cercle de 15 cm sur le dessus de la miche de pain et réservez-le. Retirez la majeure partie du pain à l''intérieur du pain jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque creux, laissant une coque d''environ 1 à 2 cm d''épaisseur (vous pouvez congeler le pain retiré pour faire de la chapelure ou des croûtons pour une autre recette).","Arroser l''intérieur du pain avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive. Mélanger les cornichons, les olives, les anchois, le basilic, le vinaigre et le reste de l''huile dans un bol moyen. Assaisonnez de sel et de poivre, puis versez quelques cuillères à soupe du mélange sur le fond du pain évidé.","Couvrir la base de 3 tranches d''emmental, de 4 à 5 tranches de salami et de 3 tranches de mortadelle avant de garnir avec davantage de mélange de légumes. Répétez l’opération en superposant les ingrédients jusqu’à ce que tous les légumes, la viande et le fromage aient été utilisés. Remettez le « couvercle » tranché sur le dessus du pain, puis enveloppez-le bien.","Mettez le pain sur une assiette, puis alourdissez-le en empilant une autre assiette avec quelques boîtes de conserve dessus. Réfrigérez pendant 1 à 2 heures (ou toute la nuit, si vous avez le temps) avant de trancher et de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:06:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10739,7569,'fr','Caponata de niveau supérieur','Préparez ce classique italien à l’avance et servez-le pour célébrer les ingrédients d’été de saison. Servir à température ambiante en entrée ou en accompagnement','["2 grosses ou 3 petites aubergines coupées en petits morceaux","200 ml d''huile d''olive, ou selon vos besoins","1 gousse d''ail (utilisez-la d''abord pour les crostini, si vous les préparez)","4 branches de céleri, feuilles cueillies et grossièrement râpées, branches coupées en petits morceaux","1 oignon , finement haché","pincée de flocons de piment (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge (assurez-vous d''être végétalien, si nécessaire)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates finement hachées (ou utilisez-les façon passata)","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, hachées grossièrement","une grosse poignée d''olives vertes dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","petite poignée de feuilles de basilic feuilles cueillies et grossièrement déchirées, tiges liées ensemble","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin grillés","1 petite baguette ou pain ciabatta, coupé en rondelles de 1 cm d''épaisseur"]','["Versez les morceaux d''aubergine dans une passoire, assaisonnez généreusement de sel, puis mélangez pour bien enrober. Placez la passoire dans l''évier ou au-dessus d''un bol, puis placez une soucoupe ou une petite assiette dessus et alourdissez-la avec quelques canettes (cela aidera à extraire l''excès d''humidité, vous aurez donc besoin de moins d''huile lors de la friture). Laisser reposer au moins 30 minutes ou jusqu''à 1 heure.","Séchez l''aubergine avec du papier absorbant, puis faites chauffer 3 à 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif. Faites frire l''aubergine en deux fois pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et tendre, en ajoutant plus d''huile si nécessaire pour que la poêle ne soit jamais sèche. Versez l''aubergine cuite dans un bol et réservez.","Pour les crostini, chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Disposer les tranches de baguette sur une plaque allant au four en une seule couche, puis arroser généreusement d''un peu d''huile d''olive. Cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Pendant qu''ils sont encore chauds, frottez la gousse d''ail sur les tranches. Laisser refroidir à température ambiante. Les crostini peuvent être préparés la veille et conservés dans un contenant hermétique. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer un autre filet d''huile dans la poêle utilisée pour l''aubergine et faites revenir le céleri haché pendant environ 6 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir. Répartir l''oignon et cuire encore 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et doré. Hachez finement la gousse d''ail que vous avez utilisée pour les crostini et dispersez-la avec les flocons de piment, le cas échéant. Laissez cuire encore une minute, puis ajoutez le sucre et le concentré de tomates. Cuire 2 minutes, puis ajouter le vinaigre et faire bouillonner pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à épaississement et réduction.","Incorporer les tomates en conserve et porter à ébullition, puis ajouter les aubergines, les câpres, les olives et les tiges de basilic en bottes. Laisser mijoter encore 10 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais, riche et brillant. Éteignez le feu et ajoutez encore 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, puis goûtez et rectifiez l''assaisonnement – ​​vous voulez un équilibre de saveurs aigre-douces, avec une touche salée des olives et des câpres. Laisser refroidir à température ambiante avant de retirer et de jeter les tiges de basilic. Incorporer la majeure partie du basilic déchiré. Se conserve au frais pendant trois jours, ou s''il est servi le lendemain, laisse dans un contenant hermétique à température ambiante. (La Caponata est mieux servie à température ambiante.)"]','2026-01-11 00:06:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10740,6381,'fr','Tagliatelles d''épinards aux crevettes à l''ail','Vous aurez besoin d’une machine à pâtes pour préparer les tagliatelles de Matty qui contiennent des épinards pour un apport nutritif. Une sauce légère aux tomates et aux crevettes crée un plat vibrant','["100g d''épinards","2 gros œufs","300 g de farine pour pâtes ''00'', plus un peu pour saupoudrer","250 g de tomates cerises","6 gousses d''ail, 4 avec la peau, 2 pelées","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 citron , zesté et pressé","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","165 g de crevettes crues","une petite poignée de persil finement haché"]','["Pour préparer les pâtes, ajoutez les épinards et les œufs dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient finement hachés. Versez la farine sur un plan de travail propre et faites un puits au centre. Versez le mélange d''épinards et d''œufs dans le puits et utilisez une fourchette pour mélanger les ingrédients. Lorsqu''une pâte commence à se former, utilisez vos mains pour la façonner en boule et pétrissez pendant 5 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte devienne lisse. Formez une boule bien nette, couvrez et laissez reposer 30 minutes.","Pour faire la sauce tomate, chauffez le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Mettez les tomates dans un petit plat allant au four. Écrasez légèrement les gousses d''ail non pelées avec le dos de votre couteau et ajoutez-les au plat. Mélanger avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis rôtir pendant 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les tomates éclatent.","Pendant ce temps, écrasez les gousses d''ail pelées restantes, ajoutez le zeste de citron et la moitié du jus, les flocons de piment et un peu d''assaisonnement. Incorporez les crevettes, puis laissez mariner au réfrigérateur pendant 10 à 15 minutes pendant que vous étalez les pâtes.","Saupoudrez un plan de travail propre de farine. Divisez la pâte à pâtes reposée en trois et aplatissez légèrement avec la paume de la main. Prenez un morceau de pâte et laissez les deux autres couverts. Commencez par le réglage le plus épais de votre machine à pâtes et étalez la pâte. Parcourez les réglages, en réduisant d''un à chaque fois, et en saupoudrant la pâte de farine supplémentaire si nécessaire pour éviter tout collage, jusqu''à ce que vous atteigniez l''épaisseur souhaitée. Saupoudrez d''un peu plus de farine, pliez très légèrement en rectangle et coupez en bandes de 1 cm d''épaisseur. Mélangez chaque bande dans un peu plus de farine, puis réservez sur une plaque à pâtisserie saupoudrée. Répétez avec les morceaux de pâte restants.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée et ajoutez les pâtes. Cuire 3 minutes al dente, puis bien égoutter en réservant une tasse d''eau pour pâtes. Pendant que les pâtes cuisent, mettez une grande poêle sur feu moyen. Versez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans la poêle et, une fois chaude, ajoutez les crevettes. Faire frire pendant 3-4 minutes, en remuant bien, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient roses et bien cuits. Incorporer les tomates rôties, les pâtes cuites, la moitié du persil et un peu d''eau de cuisson. Mélanger et assaisonner au goût avec du sel, du poivre et du jus de citron restant. Garnir avec le reste du persil et un peu de poivre noir pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10741,7571,'fr','Raviolis aux épinards et ricotta au beurre de sauge','Matty remplit ces raviolis simples d''épinards crémeux et de ricotta, puis les mélange dans une sauce au beurre parfumée. (Vous aurez besoin d''une machine à pâtes pour cela)','["400 g de farine pour pâtes ''00'', plus un peu pour saupoudrer","4 gros œufs","200g d''épinards","500 g de gazon","1⁄2 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1⁄4 cuillère à café","50 g de parmesan râpé","100g de beurre","12 feuilles de sauge","50 g de parmesan finement râpé"]','["Versez la farine sur un plan de travail propre et faites un puits au centre. Cassez les œufs dans le puits et utilisez une fourchette pour mélanger les ingrédients. Lorsqu''une pâte commence à se former, utilisez vos mains pour la façonner en boule et pétrissez pendant 5 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte devienne lisse. Formez une boule bien nette, couvrez et laissez reposer 30 minutes.","Faites bouillir une bouilloire pleine d’eau. Pour faire la garniture, ajoutez les épinards dans une passoire et versez dessus l''eau bouillie pour les faire flétrir. Laissez refroidir légèrement, puis versez sur une serviette propre et utilisez-la pour presser les épinards au-dessus d''un évier afin d''éliminer l''excès d''eau. Versez sur une planche à découper et hachez finement. Ajoutez la ricotta dans un bol avec les flocons de piment, la muscade et le parmesan, puis assaisonnez de sel et de poivre. Mélangez à la fourchette, puis incorporez les épinards. Couvrir et réserver au réfrigérateur.","Une fois la pâte reposée, divisez-la en quatre et aplatissez légèrement chacun d''eux avec la paume de la main. Prenez un des morceaux de pâte et laissez les trois autres couverts. Commencez par le réglage le plus épais de votre machine à pâtes et étalez la pâte. Parcourez les réglages, en réduisant d''un à chaque fois, et en saupoudrant la pâte de farine supplémentaire si nécessaire pour éviter tout collage, jusqu''à ce que vous atteigniez le réglage le plus fin. Répétez avec les morceaux de pâte restants.","Saupoudrez un plan de travail propre de farine et étalez toutes les feuilles de pâtes. Prenez une feuille et déposez des cuillères à café de garniture au centre en laissant 2 cm entre chacune. Badigeonnez les bords des pâtes avec un peu d''eau, puis posez une autre feuille dessus. Commencez par une extrémité et appuyez autour de chaque cuillère à café de garniture pour éliminer l''air et sceller les pâtes. Répétez avec le reste de la garniture et les feuilles de pâtes. Utilisez un couteau ou un coupe-pâtes pour couper les bords des pâtes, puis découpez chaque ravioli. Saupoudrez une grande plaque à pâtisserie de farine et disposez les raviolis sur la plaque.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée. Réduisez le feu, ajoutez délicatement les raviolis et laissez cuire 4 à 5 minutes. Ajouter le beurre dans une grande poêle à feu moyen. Une fois fondu et moussant, ajoutez la sauge et faites cuire jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit légèrement doré. À l''aide d''une écumoire, ajoutez les raviolis cuits dans la poêle de beurre et mélangez délicatement pour bien les enrober. Servir avec du parmesan parsemé sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:07:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10742,7573,'fr','Spaghetti à l''ail et à l''huile avec bacon croustillant','Savourez ce souper spaghetti ultra simple et ultra rapide, avec de l''ail, du persil et du bacon mélangés à des pâtes. C’est idéal les jours où votre réfrigérateur est vide','["75 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","4 morceaux de bacon","400 g de spaghettis","6 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","25 g de persil frais finement haché"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites cuire le bacon à feu moyen pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Retirer du feu en laissant l''huile derrière. Laisser égoutter sur du papier absorbant, puis, une fois suffisamment refroidi pour être manipulé, hacher finement.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée et faites cuire les spaghettis en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Quelques minutes avant que les pâtes ne soient prêtes, versez le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et faites cuire l''ail à feu moyen-doux pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé et commence à dorer (ne le laissez pas brûler sinon il aura un goût amer).","Égouttez les pâtes en réservant un peu d''eau et versez-les dans l''huile d''ail. Éparpillez le persil et pliez ensemble, en ajoutant un peu d''eau pour pâtes pour desserrer, si nécessaire. Verser dans des bols et répartir sur le bacon."]','2026-01-11 00:07:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10743,7575,'fr','Aubergines milanaises','Donnez aux aubergines douces une touche de saveur supplémentaire avec des câpres, du piment et beaucoup de fromage dans ce milanais. Servir avec nos spaghettis aux tomates et aux câpres','["2 grosses aubergines, tiges retirées, coupées en quartiers dans le sens de la longueur","huile d''olive, pour la friture","4 cuillères à soupe de farine","2 œufs","100 g de chapelure séchée, type panko","½ cuillère à café de granulés d''ail","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","20 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé, plus des copeaux supplémentaires pour servir","350 g de spaghettis","poignée de basilic, pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 grosses gousses d''ail écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","2 cuillères à café de sucre","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres","grosse pincée de flocons de piment"]','["Saupoudrez 1 cuillère à café de sel fin sur les côtés charnus des aubergines, puis laissez reposer 1 h.","Séchez les aubergines à l''aide d''une feuille de papier absorbant. Faites chauffer 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les aubergines quelques minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Transférer dans une assiette à l''aide de pinces et laisser refroidir.","Pour la sauce tomate, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans la même poêle à feu moyen (pas besoin de la nettoyer au préalable) et faites revenir l''ail pendant une minute. Incorporer la purée de tomates, les tomates en conserve, l''origan, le sucre, les câpres, les flocons de piment et une petite pincée de sel. Faites bouillonner, recouvert d''un couvercle, pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit riche et savoureux.","Versez la farine dans une assiette et assaisonnez. Battez les œufs avec un peu d''eau dans un bol peu profond, puis mélangez la chapelure, les granules d''ail, l''origan et le parmesan dans une autre assiette ou un bol peu profond. Trempez les aubergines dans la farine, puis secouez l''excédent et plongez-les dans l''œuf, puis dans la chapelure. S’il vous reste de la chapelure, vous pouvez répéter le processus avec juste l’œuf et la chapelure. A ce stade, les aubergines peuvent être réfrigérées jusqu''à une journée.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C/gaz 4. Remplissez le fond d''une grande poêle d''huile et faites chauffer à feu moyen. Faites frire les aubergines pendant 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes et dorées, puis transférez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les spaghettis dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante salée en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient al dente. Soulevez les spaghettis directement dans la sauce à l''aide de pinces, afin que quelques éclaboussures d''eau des pâtes tombent dans la casserole. Cuire 1 à 2 minutes dans la sauce pour bien l''enrober, puis répartir dans les assiettes et garnir d''aubergines, de basilic et de copeaux de parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:07:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10744,7577,'fr','Focaccia de niveau supérieur','Réservez du temps pour un peu de thérapie culinaire et préparez ce pain italien classique pour une gâterie salée. Il se déguste de préférence tout de suite, mais se conserve deux jours','["200 g de farine à pain blanche forte","½ sachet de 7g de levure sèche à action rapide","400 g de farine à pain blanche forte","½ sachet de 7g de levure sèche à action rapide","10g l''aileron","100 ml d''huile d''olive","1 bulbe d''ail","2 brins de romarin, feuilles cueillies","1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin"]','["Pour faire la préférence, mélangez la farine avec la levure et 200 g d''eau à température ambiante dans un petit bol. Couvrez le bol et laissez fermenter 12 à 24 heures. Ne vous inquiétez pas si cela bouillonne et redescend – il s’agit simplement de créer de la saveur.","Pour la pâte, versez le ferment dans un grand bol et versez dessus 225 g d''eau tiède. Remuer avec une spatule pour combiner. Versez la farine et le reste de la levure et mélangez le tout pour obtenir une pâte grossière. Assurez-vous que toute la farine est mélangée et qu''il n''y a pas de morceaux secs sur les côtés du bol. Couvrir et laisser reposer au moins 30 minutes ou jusqu''à 1 heure.","Répartissez le sel fin sur la pâte, plongez une main dans l''eau et écrasez le sel dans la pâte pour bien le mélanger. Couvrir à nouveau et laisser reposer 20 à 30 minutes.","Mouillez-vous les mains, saisissez la pâte par un côté et étirez-la sur elle-même. Répétez avec l’autre côté – il doit être très élastique. Enroulez la pâte sur elle-même pour qu''elle soit lisse et tendue, puis couvrez et laissez reposer encore 20 à 30 minutes. Répétez ce processus deux fois de plus, puis couvrez et laissez lever pendant 2-3 heures jusqu''à ce qu''elle lève d''environ 40 pour cent – ​​la pâte doit être bouillonnante et molle.","Arroser une plaque à pâtisserie profonde d''environ 20 x 30 cm avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et gratter la pâte sur la plaque. Incorporer l''huile à la pâte en l''étirant et en la repliant sur la plaque. Ne vous inquiétez pas s’il est un peu filandreux au début, continuez à l’étirer et à le ramener sur lui-même. Lorsque la pâte est homogène et grasse, couvrir et laisser lever à température ambiante pendant 2 heures, ou pour un meilleur goût, jusqu''à 48 heures au réfrigérateur. Sortir du réfrigérateur 1 h avant la cuisson.","Chauffer le four à 230C/210C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Pendant ce temps, coupez le dessus de la tête d''ail pour exposer les gousses. Posez l''ail sur un morceau de papier d''aluminium, arrosez d''1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive et assaisonnez de sel. Enveloppez l''ampoule dans du papier d''aluminium pour créer une boule, placez-la sur une plaque et faites-la rôtir pendant 25 minutes. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulé, puis retirer les gousses d''ail de leur peau – elles n''ont pas besoin d''être complètement molles à ce stade.","Utilisez vos doigts pour étirer la pâte afin qu''elle s''insère uniformément dans le plateau, puis creusez la surface du bout des doigts. Enfoncez profondément les gousses d''ail et les feuilles de romarin dans la pâte, uniformément espacées. Arrosez d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive et creusez encore quelques fois pour créer des flaques d''huile à la surface. Répartissez sur 1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin, donnez un dernier coup à la pâte et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit gonflée et bien dorée. A la sortie du four, arrosez du reste d''huile d''olive puis laissez refroidir au moins 40 minutes avant de découper et de servir. A consommer de préférence immédiatement, mais se conserve deux jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:07:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10745,7579,'fr','Arancini dans la friteuse à air','Utilisez votre friteuse pour préparer ces boulettes de riz croustillantes et dorées – elles constituent un accompagnement idéal pour un festin d''inspiration italienne','["15g de beurre doux","1 oignon , finement haché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","200 g de riz pour risotto","700 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes chaud","50 g de parmesan finement râpé, plus un peu pour servir","125 g de mozzarella","100 g de farine nature","2 œufs , battus","100 g de chapelure séchée (nous avons utilisé du panko)","spray d''huile d''olive, pour brumisation"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une grande casserole à feu moyen et faire revenir l''oignon et l''ail pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Incorporer le riz et cuire 1 min, puis ajouter la moitié du bouillon en remuant bien.","Continuez à cuire le risotto pendant 20 minutes, en remuant fréquemment et en ajoutant du bouillon au fur et à mesure qu''il est absorbé, jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et crémeux. Incorporer le parmesan, puis assaisonner selon votre goût. Étalez sur une plaque et laissez refroidir à température ambiante.","Coupez la mozzarella en 12 morceaux et séchez-la avec du papier absorbant.","Façonnez le risotto en 12 boules de taille égale. Aplatissez une des boules dans le creux de votre main et ajoutez un morceau de mozzarella. Relevez les bords pour l''enfermer, puis roulez-le en une boule bien nette. Répétez l’opération pour faire 12 boules.","Rouler chaque boule de risotto dans la farine, suivi de l''œuf et enfin de la chapelure jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit uniformément enrobée. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de frire à l''air libre, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pris et conservent bien leur forme.","Chauffer la friteuse à 190°C. Vaporisez les arancini avec un spray d''huile d''olive et faites cuire par lots pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés. Saupoudrer de parmesan avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10746,7581,'fr','Spaghettis à l''ail et à l''huile','Mélangez de l''ail doré et de l''huile d''olive soyeuse dans des spaghettis pour préparer ce plat italien classique – prêt dans le temps qu''il faut pour faire bouillir les pâtes. C''est simple, savoureux et parfait pour les journées chargées','["200 g de spaghettis","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","3-4 gousses d''ail, finement hachées","1/2 petit piment rouge finement haché (facultatif)","une petite poignée de persil finement haché"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau bien salée et faites cuire les spaghettis pendant environ 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient al dente – ils doivent conserver un peu de mordant.","Lorsque les pâtes sont presque prêtes, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites grésiller l''ail et le piment, le cas échéant, pendant 1 minute jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés et que l''ail soit légèrement doré mais pas brun (l''ail aura un goût amer s''il devient trop foncé).","Égouttez les spaghettis et ajoutez-les à l''huile d''ail avec le persil. Assaisonner et mélanger, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10747,7583,'fr','Focaccia aux olives, tomates cerises et feta','Préparez cette focaccia gourmande aux saveurs de la Méditerranée : elle est idéale pour un pique-nique. Ou essayez-le sans les olives, les tomates et la feta pour une focaccia nature très fiable','["500 g de farine à pain forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la boîte","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux (un mélange de couleurs est sympa)","petit bouquet d''origan, feuilles cueillies, ou utilisez 1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","150 g d''olives Kalamata dénoyautées","100 g de feta émiettée"]','["Versez la farine dans un grand bol avec la levure et 2 cuillères à café de sel et mélangez. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, puis versez lentement 350 ml d''eau tiède en continuant de mélanger jusqu''à obtenir une pâte légèrement collante. Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné, en raclant les parois du bol. Pétrir pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit molle et moins collante, puis mettre dans un bol propre, couvrir d''un torchon et laisser lever 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Huiler généreusement un moule rectangulaire peu profond (le nôtre mesurait 20 x 30 cm). Versez la pâte, puis utilisez vos mains pour l''étirer jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne les coins du moule. Couvrir d''un torchon propre et laisser lever encore 35 à 45 minutes. Pendant ce temps, versez les tomates dans un bol, assaisonnez, ajoutez l''origan et arrosez d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive. Mélanger et réserver.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Presser uniformément les moitiés de tomates dans la pâte, puis faire de même avec les olives. Émiettez la feta, puis appuyez à nouveau légèrement sur le tout du bout des doigts. Arrosez d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive et saupoudrez de sel marin, puis faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés et gonflés. Pendant que le pain est encore chaud, arrosez-le d’une cuillère à soupe d’huile d’olive restante. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le moule, puis trancher. Vous pouvez l''emballer dans la boîte pour l''emporter lors d''un pique-nique, ou emballer des carrés individuels. Il se conservera emballé ou dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:07:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10748,7585,'fr','Biscuits Ricciarelli','Préparez ces biscuits aux amandes d’inspiration italienne. Offrez-le à votre famille et à vos amis à Noël, ou préparez-en un lot pour votre propre boîte à biscuits pour vous faire plaisir','["2 blancs d''œufs (utiliser les jaunes dans une autre recette, comme du riz frit)","½ cuillère à café d''extrait d''amande","1 citron, zesté","200 g de sucre glace + un peu pour saupoudrer","260 g d''amandes moulues"]','["Battez les blancs d''œufs en neige ferme dans un bol propre, puis incorporez l''extrait d''amande et le zeste de citron.","Dans un autre bol, tamisez ensemble le sucre glace, la poudre d''amandes et une pincée de sel. Incorporez-le délicatement aux blancs d''œufs battus jusqu''à ce que le tout forme une pâte. Couvrir et réfrigérer pendant au moins 4 heures, ou idéalement toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Démoulez la pâte sur un plan de travail généreusement saupoudré de sucre glace. Rouler en un boudin long et gras (environ 40 cm de long) et couper des tranches de 2 cm d''épaisseur sur toute la longueur (vous devriez en obtenir environ 20). Façonnez chaque tranche en ovale et tapotez un peu le dessus – les biscuits doivent mesurer environ 4 à 5 cm de large et 5 à 6 cm de long. Disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et saupoudrer de sucre glace.","Cuire au four pendant 20 à 23 minutes jusqu''à ce que les biscuits commencent à dorer. Ils seront mous, mais se raffermiront en refroidissant. Laisser refroidir complètement sur la plaque. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:07:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10749,7587,'fr','Quartiers de chou rôti à l''italienne aux lentilles tomates','Chou rôti pour une pièce maîtresse végétarienne, avec des feuilles croquantes et caramélisées à l''extérieur et un centre moelleux et sucré. Servir avec nos lentilles d''inspiration italienne et nos pommes de terre nouvelles rôties dorées','["100 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 petits choux verts d''hiver, feuilles extérieures enlevées, coupés chacun en 6 quartiers","750 g de petites pommes de terre nouvelles","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 citrons , zestés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons , finement hachés","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","250 g de lentilles rouges","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cubes de bouillon de légumes","3 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates séchées","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","un petit bouquet de basilic finement haché, plus quelques feuilles entières pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ à 1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","3 tranches épaisses de pain rassis croustillant ou de levain, croûtes retirées puis réduites en chapelure (environ 120 g)","1 citron , zesté","100 g d''olives Kalamata dénoyautées et hachées grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Porter une grande casserole d''eau à ébullition et blanchir les pommes de terre pendant 10-12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres, puis égoutter et laisser refroidir.","Pour le chou, mélanger l''huile et l''ail, frotter les quartiers, assaisonner puis étaler sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Rôtir sur l''étagère du haut pendant 15 minutes.","Pendant que le chou cuit, déposez les pommes de terre nouvelles sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie et écrasez-les délicatement avec le dos d''une cuillère ou d''un presse-purée pour qu''elles s''ouvrent légèrement. Arroser d''huile et d''un peu d''assaisonnement, puis incorporer le zeste de citron. Une fois que le chou a cuit 15 minutes, placez les pommes de terre sur la grille supérieure du four et déplacez le chou vers le bas. Cuire 45 min en retournant le tout à mi-cuisson.","Pour les lentilles, faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne et faites revenir les oignons et le céleri jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et translucides, environ 10 à 15 minutes. Versez les lentilles, les tomates, 450 ml d''eau, les cubes de bouillon, la purée de tomates et le vinaigre, portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter à découvert pendant 30 à 35 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres et bien cuites. Si le mélange devient un peu sec, ajoutez un peu d''eau pour éviter qu''il ne colle. Incorporer le basilic et 50 ml d''eau bouillante supplémentaire pour assouplir le mélange. Assaisonnez bien.","Pendant que les lentilles cuisent, préparez le pangrattato. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, faites revenir l''ail et le piment pendant 30 secondes, puis ajoutez la chapelure. Faire griller jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croquants, puis ajouter le zeste de citron et les olives et faire revenir encore 3 minutes. Laisser refroidir.","Pour servir, déposer les lentilles dans chaque assiette, déposer un quartier de chou dessus et saupoudrer de pangrattato. Garnir avec le basilic supplémentaire et servir les pommes de terre à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:07:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10750,7589,'fr','Lasagne aux aubergines parmigiana','Combinez deux classiques italiens – la parmigiana et les lasagnes – dans cette pâtisserie végétarienne. Il est idéal pour la cuisson par lots car vous pouvez le congeler avant ou après la cuisson','["3 grosses aubergines, parées et tranchées finement dans le sens de la longueur","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de mozzarella végétarienne, égouttée et râpée grossièrement","50 g de fromage à pâte dure végétarien à l''italienne, râpé","1 bouquet de basilic, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir","8 feuilles de lasagnes séchées (les feuilles de lasagnes aux œufs sont les meilleures pour cela)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","6 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","¼ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","3 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées"]','["Pour la sauce, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''ail pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ajoutez le sucre et le vinaigre, laissez mijoter 30 secondes, puis ajoutez les tomates. Assaisonner de sel et remettre à ébullition. Faire bouillir pendant 10 minutes, puis retirer du feu et réserver. Peut être préparé jusqu''à deux jours à l''avance et réfrigéré.","Chauffer une plaque chauffante ou une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif. Badigeonnez les tranches d''aubergine des deux côtés avec l''huile d''olive et assaisonnez avec un peu de sel, puis faites-les griller par lots jusqu''à ce que les tranches soient ramollies et légèrement carbonisées (assurez-vous que la chaleur n''est pas trop élevée sinon l''aubergine se carbonisera avant de ramollir). Transférez les tranches cuites dans une assiette au fur et à mesure.","Pour le montage, disposez un tiers des tranches d''aubergines sur le fond d''un plat à gratin rectangulaire ou carré, puis versez dessus un tiers de la sauce. Parsemer d''une petite poignée des deux fromages (vous devez conserver la majeure partie du fromage pour le dessus) et de la moitié du basilic, puis garnir de la moitié des feuilles de lasagnes. Répétez encore une fois, puis terminez par une dernière couche d''aubergines nappée du reste de la sauce. Répartir sur le reste du fromage. Après avoir laissé refroidir complètement, le plat peut être couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à deux jours ou congelé jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler complètement avant la cuisson.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Placer le plat sur une plaque allant au four et enfourner pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit doré et que la sauce bouillonne sur les bords. Laisser refroidir au moins 10 minutes, puis parsemer du basilic réservé et servir. Les lasagnes cuites se conservent au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois, recouvertes de papier d''aluminium. Décongelez soigneusement, découvrez et faites cuire comme indiqué ci-dessus. Ou pour cuisiner surgelé, cuire au four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 pendant 40 minutes. Retirez le papier d''aluminium, allumez le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et faites cuire encore 30 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:07:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10751,6525,'fr','Ribollita toscane','Économisez du pain rassis et transformez-le en ce ragoût épais, volumineux et délicieux, faible en gras et en calories, et mettant en valeur les tomates, les haricots et le cavolo nero.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","1 oignon, finement haché","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","1 carotte, hachée","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","pincée de flocons de piment","1 brin de romarin","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","500 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes chaud","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés et rincés","1 croûte de parmesan (facultatif)","250 g de chou frisé ou chou frisé haché","150 g de pain rassis croustillant coupé en morceaux (voir astuce ci-dessous)","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","quelques feuilles de basilic (facultatif) et du parmesan râpé ou une alternative végétarienne, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole ou une cocotte ignifuge à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon, le céleri et la carotte avec une pincée de sel pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter l''ail et les flocons de piment et cuire 1 min.","Incorporer le brin de romarin, les tomates, le bouillon, les haricots et le zeste de parmesan, le cas échéant, et porter à ébullition. Ajouter le cavolo et cuire à couvert pendant 10 minutes. Incorporer le pain et cuire encore quelques minutes pour le réchauffer, puis ajouter le vinaigre et assaisonner. Verser dans des bols, arroser d''un peu plus d''huile et saupoudrer de basilic, le cas échéant, et de fromage râpé."]','2026-01-11 00:07:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10752,5427,'fr','Lasagnes saines','Profitez de notre version plus légère du classique familial : les lasagnes. Il a beaucoup de saveur, mais contient moins de 500 calories par portion et contient quatre de vos cinq calories par jour.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon (250 g), finement haché","320 g de carottes finement hachées","2 branches de céleri (140 g), finement hachées","2 feuilles de laurier","500 g de bœuf haché 5%","3 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","400 ml de lait demi-écrémé","30g de farine complète","généreuse pincée de muscade","6 feuilles de lasagnes complètes (125g)","25 g de parmesan finement râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon, les carottes, le céleri et une feuille de laurier pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes ramollissent et commencent à dorer. Ajoutez le hachis et l''ail et faites sauter jusqu''à ce que le bœuf soit doré, environ 5 minutes. Versez les tomates et une canette d''eau, le concentré de tomates et le bouillon, portez à ébullition, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 20 mn en retirant le couvercle au bout de 10 mn pour réduire légèrement le mélange.","Pendant ce temps, versez le lait dans une casserole moyenne avec la farine et fouettez à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit sans grumeaux. Ajoutez la deuxième feuille de laurier et une bonne pincée de muscade et poursuivez la cuisson en fouettant pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement.","Retirez la baie du hachis et de la sauce blanche et jetez-la. Versez un tiers du hachis au fond d''un plat allant au four de 19 x 24 cm et recouvrez de deux feuilles de lasagnes. Verser la moitié du hachis restant, puis garnir de deux autres feuilles de lasagnes, du reste du hachis et des feuilles de lasagnes restantes. Napper de sauce blanche et saupoudrer de fromage. Cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il bouillonne et soit doré."]','2026-01-11 00:07:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10753,5039,'fr','Pâtes au saumon sans gluten','Utilisez des pâtes sans gluten pour préparer ces pâtes crémeuses au saumon et aux haricots verts de la lectrice de GF Aimee Vivian. C’est idéal pour les personnes cœliaques ou intolérantes au gluten.','["1 cube de bouillon de légumes sans gluten","200 g de pâtes sans gluten, comme des penne ou des fusilli","100 g de haricots verts parés","100 g de saumon fumé haché grossièrement","50 g de pousses d''épinards","1 oignon nouveau, tranché finement","50 g de fromage à pâte molle (assurez-vous qu''il est sans gluten)","½-1 citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe de parmesan râpé"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée, émiettez-la avec le cube de bouillon et remuez pour dissoudre. Versez les pâtes et faites cuire selon les instructions sur l''emballage, environ 8 à 10 minutes. Ajoutez les haricots verts 1 min avant la fin de la cuisson.","Égoutter les pâtes et les haricots verts en réservant un peu d''eau de cuisson. Remettez les pâtes et les haricots dans la poêle, puis incorporez le saumon fumé, les épinards, l''oignon nouveau et le fromage à pâte molle. Ajoutez un peu d''eau des pâtes pour détacher le fromage et créer une sauce, puis assaisonnez avec du sel et du poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Pressez le jus de citron selon votre goût et remuez bien. Servir garni de parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:07:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10754,4497,'fr','Bruschetta aux tomates et nduja','Utilisez des tomates mûres pour préparer ces bouchées de bruschetta sucrées et épicées. Ils sont idéaux pour une garden-party, quand peu importe si vous faites un peu de désordre','["1 grosse baguette, parée et coupée en 16 tranches","300 g de tomates mûres hachées grossièrement","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés et rincés","une petite poignée de persil haché","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge","8-10 heures"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Disposer les tranches de baguette sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes et légèrement dorées. (Vous devrez peut-être le faire en deux fois.) Retirer du four et laisser refroidir.","Mélanger les tomates, les haricots, le persil, le vinaigre et l''huile dans un bol, bien assaisonner et réserver.","Étalez environ ½ cuillère à café de nduja sur chaque tranche de baguette et disposez-la sur un plat de service. Verser le mélange de tomates et de haricots sur les tranches de baguette et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10755,7591,'fr','Sauce en colère','Préparez notre version d''une sauce pour pâtes italienne classique, remplie de tomates, de piment rouge et d''ail. Incorporez-le à des spaghettis ou des linguines pour un souper facile et délicieux','["2 petites gousses d''ail pelées et écrasées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées"]','["Versez l''huile dans une casserole et faites revenir l''ail à feu moyen pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé, mais pas doré. Ajoutez le piment, faites frire encore une minute, puis ajoutez les tomates avec 1 cuillère à café de sel et ½ cuillère à café de sucre. Bien mélanger pour combiner les ingrédients et laisser mijoter doucement pendant 20 minutes en remuant régulièrement. La sauce épaissira petit à petit au fur et à mesure de la cuisson.","Goûtez et rectifiez l''assaisonnement si besoin. Servir mélangé à des pâtes, ou mélangé d''abord pour créer une sauce plus onctueuse si vous préférez. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:07:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10756,7593,'fr','Pesto rouge','Mélangez les pignons de pin, les tomates séchées, le parmesan et l''huile d''olive pour obtenir un pesto rouge, parfait à incorporer aux pâtes ou pour parfumer les plats de poulet.','["50g de pignons de pin","200 g de tomates séchées mi-tendres, égouttées","125 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","25 g de parmesan râpé","1 grosse gousse d''ail, pelée et écrasée","1 citron pressé (facultatif)"]','["Commencez par griller les pignons de pin. Versez-les dans une poêle à frire à feu moyen. Secouez la poêle ou remuez doucement les noix pour qu''elles grillent uniformément. Lorsque les noix sont dorées, retirez du feu et réservez.","Mettez tous les ingrédients restants dans un mixeur avec ½ cuillère à café de sel marin et les pignons de pin grillés, puis mélangez jusqu''à ce que la sauce soit assez lisse mais conserve une certaine texture. Si nécessaire, vous pouvez ajouter 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide et mélanger pour desserrer légèrement. Goûtez, rectifiez l''assaisonnement si besoin et servez aussitôt. Se conserve une semaine dans un bocal au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:07:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10757,3831,'fr','Pesto facile','Mélangez des pignons de pin ou des noix de cajou, du basilic, du parmesan, de l''ail et de l''huile d''olive pour faire votre propre pesto. C''est parfait pour les pizzas, les pâtes et les sandwichs','["50 g de pignons de pin ou de noix de cajou","gros bouquet de basilic, feuilles cueillies","50 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","100 ml d''huile d''olive"]','["Faites griller les noix dans une poêle à feu doux. Versez-le dans un mini-hachoir avec le reste des ingrédients, ou utilisez un grand pilon et un mortier, puis mixez ou écrasez-le dans une sauce grossière. Se conserve trois jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:07:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10758,5245,'fr','Œufs au four avec épinards, tomates, ricotta et basilic','Servez cette version d''inspiration italienne d''une shakshuka pour un brunch facile. Si vous n''êtes pas végétarien, vous pouvez également ajouter du chorizo','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","pincée de flocons de piment","3 boîtes de 400 g de tomates hachées finement (ou mixez des tomates hachées en conserve ordinaires à l''aide d''un robot culinaire ou d''un mixeur plongeant)","3 cuillères à soupe de pesto de tomates séchées (assurez-vous d''être végétarien, si nécessaire)","200 g d''épinards hachés grossièrement","8 oeufs","100 g de gazon","40 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, finement râpé","une poignée de feuilles de basilic","pain croustillant ou focaccia, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte ou une poêle peu profonde et résistante aux flammes à feu moyen-doux et faites revenir l''oignon avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et translucide. Ajoutez l''ail et les flocons de piment et faites revenir encore 1 min. Ajoutez les tomates, 1 cuillère à café de sucre et le pesto. Assaisonner et laisser mijoter à découvert pendant 10 minutes en remuant souvent. Ajoutez les épinards et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Faites huit trous dans la sauce avec le dos d''une cuillère et cassez un œuf dans chacun. Parsemer de ricotta et parsemer de parmesan. Couvrez et laissez cuire 5 min, puis glissez sous le grill chaud quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que les blancs d''œufs soient pris et les jaunes coulants. Parsemer de basilic et servir avec du pain croustillant pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:07:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10759,7595,'fr','Spaghetti aux poivrons rouges et aux anchois','Tirez le meilleur parti des anchois en les combinant avec des poivrons rouges dans ce plat de pâtes rapide. La douceur des poivrons complète si bien les anchois umami','["300 g de spaghettis","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées","4 anchois","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","Pot de 300 g de poivrons rouges rôtis, égouttés et tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","une poignée de basilic, finement tranché"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée, puis incorporez les spaghettis. Cuire 1 min de moins que les instructions sur l''emballage. Versez l''huile, l''ail, les anchois et les flocons de piment dans une autre casserole ou une poêle à frire à bords hauts sur feu moyen. Cuire environ 1 min, jusqu''à ce que l''huile soit chaude et que l''ail commence à grésiller légèrement.","Ajouter les poivrons rôtis et la purée de tomates. Remuez bien. Continuez à cuire le mélange d''anchois et de poivrons jusqu''à ce que les spaghettis soient prêts, en ajoutant une louche d''eau de cuisson des pâtes pendant la cuisson pour les détendre et faire une sauce.","Lorsque les spaghettis sont prêts, utilisez des pinces pour les transférer directement de leur eau de cuisson dans la sauce, en ajoutant un peu plus d''eau pour les détendre si nécessaire. Faites cuire les spaghettis dans la sauce pendant 30 secondes, en remuant pour bien les enrober, puis retirez du feu et mélangez-les au basilic. Servir aussitôt, arrosé d''un peu d''huile d''olive."]','2026-01-11 00:07:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10760,4305,'fr','Minestrone de boulettes de viande au pesto','Combinez les boulettes de viande avec la soupe minestrone pour rendre cela facile, en remplissant une casserole. Cela ne prend que 25 minutes de la préparation à l''assiette, ce qui en fait un repas idéal en milieu de semaine.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","12 boulettes de boeuf","1 carotte, hachée","1 branche de céleri, hachée","1 oignon, haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1⁄2 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 feuille de laurier","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots cannellini rincés et égouttés","100 g de formes de pâtes ou de riz","800 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet faible en sel","un peu de vinaigre ou une pincée de sucre (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe de pesto","1⁄2 petit bouquet de basilic, feuilles cueillies (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole et faites frire les boulettes de viande jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Retirer et réserver dans une assiette. Ajoutez la carotte, le céleri et l''oignon dans la poêle et faites revenir 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Incorporer l''ail, l''origan et le laurier. Versez les tomates, les haricots, les pâtes et le bouillon. Portez à ébullition.","Remettez les boulettes de viande dans la poêle et faites cuire jusqu''à ce que les pâtes soient tendres et que les boulettes de viande soient bien cuites. Assaisonnez et ajoutez un filet de vinaigre ou une pincée de sucre pour équilibrer l''acidité des tomates, si vous le souhaitez. Versez dans quatre bols, puis versez une cuillère de pesto dans chacun. Garnir de basilic pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10761,5361,'fr','Pesto de chou frisé et gnocchis de poulet','Passez au vert avec notre pesto de chou frisé et nos gnocchis de poulet, pleins d''ingrédients nutritifs. Un plat équilibré et facile, idéal pour les journées chargées et ne prend que 20 minutes','["65 g de chou frisé, lavé et haché grossièrement","100g d''épinards","1 petite gousse d''ail, hachée grossièrement","1 citron, zesté et pressé","½ petit bouquet de basilic, plus des feuilles supplémentaires pour servir","15g de pignons de pin","1 cuillère à soupe de parmesan, plus un peu pour servir","25 ml d''huile d''olive","250 g de blanc de poulet cuit, émincé","200 g de petits pois surgelés","50 g de crème fraîche légère","150 ml de bouillon de légumes","300g de raviolis"]','["Portez à ébullition une casserole moyenne d''eau et réservez un bol d''eau glacée. Mettez le chou frisé et les épinards dans l''eau bouillante et faites cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Retirer avec une écumoire et plonger dans l''eau froide. Égoutter, puis essorer l''excès d''eau.","Versez les légumes verts dans un robot culinaire avec l''ail, le jus et le zeste de citron, le basilic, les pignons de pin, le parmesan et l''huile d''olive, puis mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Assaisonner légèrement.","Versez le pesto dans une casserole avec le poulet, les petits pois, la crème fraîche et le bouillon et portez à ébullition. Versez les gnocchis et laissez cuire 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits. Répartir sur les feuilles de basilic supplémentaires et râper sur un peu de parmesan pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10762,3924,'fr','Malfatti','Découvrez notre version des malfatti toscans – des raviolis aux épinards et à la ricotta qui ressemblent un peu à de gros gnocchis grossièrement formés. Servir recouvert d''un beurre de sauge aromatique et de beaucoup de fromage','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g d''épinards frais ou surgelés (voir astuce ci-dessous)","250 g de gazon","50 g de chapelure fraîche","50 g de parmesan finement râpé ou alternative végétarienne, plus un peu pour servir","2 gros œufs, battus","1 cuillère à soupe de semoule ou de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","muscade, pour râper","60g de beurre","25 g de feuilles de sauge"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu vif et faites revenir les épinards environ 2-3 minutes. Versez les épinards dans une passoire et essorez tout excès de liquide à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère. Laisser refroidir complètement. Essorez le liquide restant avec vos mains, puis hachez finement les épinards.","Versez les épinards hachés dans un bol avec la ricotta, la chapelure et le parmesan. Ajoutez l''œuf et la semoule ou la farine. Assaisonner et râper avec un peu de muscade. Remuer pour former un mélange collant et homogène.","Mettez quelques cuillères à soupe de farine sur un grand plateau et secouez doucement pour étaler la farine. Verser environ ½ cuillère à soupe du mélange d''épinards sur le plateau fariné et rouler en boule. Répétez avec le reste du mélange d''épinards, en transférant les boules sur un deuxième plateau de cuisson propre au fur et à mesure.","Chauffer le four à 140C/120C chaleur tournante/gaz 1. Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée. Ajoutez les malfatti (vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots) et laissez mijoter pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils flottent à la surface. Retirez les malfatti avec une écumoire et égouttez-les bien. Transférer dans un plat de service allant au four et réserver au chaud au four.","Préparez le beurre de sauge en faisant fondre le beurre dans une petite casserole. Ajoutez les feuilles de sauge et faites-les revenir doucement en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes. Versez le beurre de sauge sur les malfatti et recouvrez de fromage râpé."]','2026-01-11 00:07:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10763,5669,'fr','Orecchiette aux brocolis violets et pesto calabrais','Préparez du pesto maison et servez avec des orecchiette et du brocoli. Celui-ci n''est pas seulement bon avec des pâtes : vous pouvez également le servir avec du poulet ou du poisson et le verser sur une focaccia chaude.','["400 g de brocoli à germes violets","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","375g d''orecchiette ou autres formes de pâtes","parmesan ou pecorino râpé (ou alternative végétarienne), pour servir","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","½ petit oignon rouge, haché","1 tomate italienne, hachée","75 g d''aubergines coupées en petits morceaux","125 g de poivrons rôtis en bocal, égouttés","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux, épépiné et haché (laissez les graines si vous voulez un pesto plus piquant)","40 g d''amandes blanchies légèrement grillées à la poêle à sec","60 g de gazon","10 g de feuilles de basilic ou de persil"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la base du pesto. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle et ajoutez l''oignon, la tomate et l''aubergine. Faire revenir à feu moyen-doux pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit doré pâle et que les tomates et l''aubergine soient tendres. Ajouter les poivrons et cuire quelques minutes, puis ajouter l''ail et le piment et cuire encore 2 minutes. Transférer dans une assiette et laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Coupez le brocoli à la base, puis coupez les gros morceaux en deux dans le sens de la longueur. Mettre dans un plat à rôtir, arroser d''huile d''olive et assaisonner. Ajoutez l''ail et retournez le tout avec vos mains – assurez-vous que l''ail est sous le brocoli pour qu''il grille sans brûler. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes (vérifier la cuisson pendant la cuisson).","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes dans de l''eau bouillante salée jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente. Cela prend généralement un peu moins de temps que ce qui est indiqué sur le paquet.","Pour le pesto, versez le tout dans l''assiette dans un robot culinaire avec les amandes et les 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge restantes. Assaisonner et pulser pour mélanger le tout. Incorporer la ricotta et goûter pour l''assaisonnement. Déchirez le basilic et incorporez-le également.","Égouttez les pâtes et mélangez-les avec le brocoli (y compris le jus d''ail du plat à rôtir), puis utilisez autant de pesto que nécessaire pour enrober les pâtes et servez le reste à côté. Broyez un peu de poivre noir et servez immédiatement avec le fromage râpé."]','2026-01-11 00:07:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10764,5671,'fr','Fromage et poivre noir','Préparez un simple cacio e pepe pour un déjeuner rapide. Avec quatre ingrédients simples – spaghetti, poivre, parmesan et beurre – c''est l''un des favoris des magasins.','["200 g de bottes de spaghettis","25g de beurre","2 cuillères à café de poivre noir entier moulu ou 1 cuillère à café de poivre noir fraîchement moulu","50 g de pecorino ou de parmesan finement râpé"]','["Cuire les pâtes 2 minutes de moins que ce qui est indiqué sur l''emballage, dans de l''eau bouillante salée. Pendant ce temps, faites fondre le beurre dans une poêle moyenne à feu doux, puis ajoutez le poivre noir moulu et faites griller quelques minutes.","Égouttez les pâtes en gardant 200 ml d''eau pour pâtes. Versez les pâtes et 100 ml d''eau pour pâtes dans la poêle avec le beurre et le poivre. Mélangez brièvement, puis répartissez uniformément sur le parmesan, mais ne remuez pas – attendez que le fromage fonde pendant 30 secondes, puis une fois fondu, mélangez bien le tout et mélangez. Cela empêche le fromage de s''agglutiner ou de devenir filandreux et donne une sauce onctueuse et brillante. Ajoutez un peu d''eau pour pâtes si nécessaire, pour détendre la sauce et enrober les pâtes. Servir aussitôt avec une bonne râpée de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10765,4004,'fr','Biscottis faciles','Préparez ces biscotti faciles à servir avec du café, ou trempez-les dans du chocolat et présentez-les dans une boîte en métal pour les offrir à la famille et aux amis.','["300 g de farine nature","100 g de sucre en poudre","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","80g d''huile végétale","1 gros œuf","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","chocolat au lait ou noir, fondu, pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mettez la farine, les sucres, la levure chimique et une grosse pincée de sel dans un grand bol et mélangez.","Dans un autre bol, fouettez ensemble l''huile, l''œuf, la vanille et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude. Mélangez progressivement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte. Pétrissez doucement la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse – elle sera assez sèche, alors ajoutez encore 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau si elle est trop difficile à pétrir après quelques minutes. Divisez la pâte en deux morceaux égaux, en façonnant chacun une bûche de 25 x 8 cm. Mettez les bûches sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée et faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes. Sortir du four et laisser refroidir sur la plaque pendant environ 15 minutes.","À l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, coupez les bûches légèrement refroidies en tranches de 1 à 2 cm d''épaisseur sur la largeur. Remettez les biscotti sur la plaque à pâtisserie tapissée et faites cuire encore 15 à 20 minutes (le four doit encore être à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4), en retournant la plaque à mi-cuisson. Laisser légèrement refroidir sur la plaque, puis transférer les biscotti sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Si vous le souhaitez, trempez une extrémité de chaque biscotti dans du chocolat fondu, puis laissez-le reposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Se conservera dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:07:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10766,7597,'fr','Cannellonis aux saucisses et légumes d''hiver','Étirez un paquet de saucisses et nourrissez toute la famille avec ces cannellonis. La sauce ragoût à la viande est agrémentée de légumes verts d''hiver riches en nutriments.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons rouges, coupés en deux et tranchés","6 saucisses de porc","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","petit bouquet de thym, feuilles cueillies","pincée de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","400 g de tomates italiennes en boîte","200g de cavolo nero ou autres légumes verts d''hiver","75g de beurre","75 g de farine nature","850 ml de lait","muscade, pour râper","50 g de parmesan râpé","12 feuilles de lasagnes","salade verte, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte ignifuge à feu moyen et faites cuire les oignons pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et commencent à caraméliser. Pendant ce temps, pressez la chair des saucisses pour retirer les peaux.","Poussez les oignons d''un côté de la cocotte, puis ajoutez la chair à saucisse de l''autre. Écrasez-le en petits morceaux à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois, en remuant de temps en temps pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit et commence à dorer par endroits. Mélangez à nouveau les oignons, puis ajoutez l''ail, le thym, les flocons de piment et la purée de tomates. Cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes. Versez les tomates italiennes en les écrasant avec le dos de la cuillère. Assaisonner et faire bouillir pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient décomposées et que la sauce soit réduite en un ragoût épais.","Mettez la bouilloire à ébullition. Si vous utilisez du cavolo nero, retirez et jetez les tiges dures et hachez grossièrement les feuilles. Pour les légumes plus tendres comme les épinards ou les blettes, vous pouvez laisser les tiges. Mettez une passoire au-dessus de l''évier et versez sur une bouilloire d''eau juste bouillie, puis rincez les feuilles sous l''eau froide courante jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient suffisamment froides pour être manipulées. Essorez autant d''eau que possible, transférez-la sur une planche et hachez-la finement. Incorporer les légumes verts au ragoût de saucisses, cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout excès de liquide se soit évaporé (le mélange doit être assez sec), retirer du feu et laisser refroidir un peu.","Faire fondre le beurre dans une autre casserole à feu moyen. Lorsqu''elle grésille, incorporer la farine pour obtenir une pâte sableuse. Fouetter le lait, une goutte à la fois, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement incorporé. Lorsque la sauce est onctueuse et a la consistance d''une crème anglaise, assaisonnez bien, râpez une bonne quantité de muscade et incorporez la moitié du parmesan. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Déposez les feuilles de lasagnes une à la fois dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante salée pour éviter qu''elles ne collent ensemble, puis faites cuire pendant 5 à 6 minutes, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient suffisamment tendres pour être enroulées mais pas complètement cuites. Égoutter et plonger dans un bol d''eau froide pour arrêter la cuisson.","Si la sauce béchamel a épaissi en refroidissant, ajoutez un peu plus de lait. Versez un tiers de la sauce sur le fond d''un plat allant au four d''environ 25 x 35 cm. Sortez une feuille de lasagne du bol d’eau froide et posez-la sur une planche avec l’une des extrémités courtes face à vous. Versez une généreuse cuillère à soupe de ragoût de saucisse sur une extrémité, puis roulez-la pour enfermer la garniture, formant ainsi un court cannelloni – il y aura un peu de pâtes qui se chevaucheront. Placez-le dans le plat allant au four, puis continuez avec les feuilles de ragoût et de lasagnes restantes, en les disposant dans le plat allant au four en deux rangées de six cannellonis. Versez le reste du ragoût sur le dessus, puis versez sur la sauce béchamel pour recouvrir tous les rouleaux de cannelloni. Saupoudrer du reste de parmesan. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à deux jours ou congelé jusqu''à deux mois. Broyez un peu de poivre noir, si vous le souhaitez, et servez avec une salade verte croquante."]','2026-01-11 00:07:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10767,7599,'fr','Cuisson des pâtes aux saucisses','Un classique italo-américain, ce plat de pâtes aux saucisses congelable est un plat familial idéal à préparer à l''avance pour les journées bien remplies.','["400 g rangs rangs","125 g de boule de mozzarella coupée en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","6 saucisses de porc","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées","pincée de flocons de piment (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","350 ml de lait","50 g de parmesan râpé, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Pour préparer le ragoût, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle peu profonde ou une cocotte ignifuge. Pressez la chair de saucisse de sa peau en petites boules directement dans la poêle. Faire grésiller pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré (ne vous inquiétez pas si la viande se brise). Ajoutez l''ail et faites grésiller encore une minute jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à devenir doré, puis incorporez les flocons de piment, le cas échéant, la purée de tomates et le vinaigre. Versez les tomates et portez à ébullition. Réduisez le feu à doux et faites bouillonner pendant 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce blanche. Faire fondre le beurre dans une casserole et incorporer la farine pour obtenir une pâte lâche. Faites grésiller une minute, puis fouettez progressivement le lait. Laisser mijoter doucement pendant 10 minutes en fouettant de temps en temps pour que la sauce reste onctueuse. Assaisonner et incorporer le parmesan. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Faites cuire les pâtes dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 9 minutes, soit une minute de moins que les instructions sur l''emballage. Égoutter et remettre dans la poêle. Versez la majeure partie de la sauce blanche dans les pâtes et remuez pour bien les enrober. Versez la majeure partie du ragoût et la majeure partie de la mozzarella et remuez jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien combiné. Versez le mélange de pâtes dans un grand plat allant au four et versez-y le reste de la sauce blanche et du ragoût. Parsemer du reste de mozzarella et saupoudrer de parmesan supplémentaire. Laisser refroidir complètement, puis envelopper et réfrigérer jusqu''à une journée, ou congeler jusqu''à deux mois. Décongeler au réfrigérateur pendant 24 heures avant la cuisson.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit légèrement croustillant sur les bords et que le fromage soit fondu. Laisser reposer 5 à 10 minutes, puis apporter le plat de cuisson directement à table pour que les gens puissent le verser dans leurs assiettes."]','2026-01-11 00:07:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10768,7601,'fr','Pâtes au poulet et bacon','Mélangez le poulet et le bacon avec des rubans de tagliatelles dans une sauce délicieusement crémeuse pour préparer ce plat de pâtes facile. Servir avec une salade verte pour un souper facile','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 oignon, finement haché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, finement râpée","200 ml de crème fraîche","100 g de mascarpone","75 g de parmesan finement râpé","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","2 poitrines de poulet cuites (environ 210 g), émincées","8 tranches de bacon cuit (environ 25 g), hachées grossièrement","300g de nouilles","¼ petit bouquet de persil finement haché","salade verte, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile et le beurre dans une casserole moyenne à feu doux et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et translucide. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez la crème, le mascarpone, le parmesan et le cube de bouillon. Remuez et ajoutez le poulet cuit et le bacon pour bien réchauffer.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions du paquet. Réservez 100 ml d''eau pour pâtes. Mélangez les pâtes dans la sauce crémeuse et suffisamment d''eau réservée pour les détacher. Assaisonner de poivre noir. Garnir de persil et servir avec une salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:07:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10769,7603,'fr','Risotto de courgettes et fèves au pesto de basilic','Préparez ce risotto vibrant aux courgettes et aux fèves pour profiter au maximum des légumes d''été. Mélangez du pesto maison pour une entrée ou un plat principal fabuleux','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de beurre","2 courgettes moyennes (environ 350 g), coupées en dés de 1 à 2 cm","pincée de flocons de piment ou de pul biber","pincée de muscade râpée","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","½ citron, zesté","150 g de riz pour risotto","75 ml de vin blanc sec ou de vermouth","750 g de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet chaud","80 g de fèves blanchies et pelées","fleurs de courgettes, étamines enlevées et pétales arrachés (facultatif)","20 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé, plus un peu pour servir","1 gousse d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe de pignons de pin grillés","une grosse poignée de feuilles de basilic, plus un peu pour servir","une poignée de feuilles de menthe","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de parmesan râpé ou alternative végétarienne"]','["Pour faire le pesto, écrasez l''ail en pâte avec une pincée de sel à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Ajoutez les pignons de pin et réduisez-les en une pâte grossière, puis déchirez le basilic et la menthe en les pilonnant à nouveau jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient décomposés. Incorporez l''huile et le fromage, puis goûtez pour l''assaisonnement – ​​ajoutez plus de fromage si vous le souhaitez.","Faites chauffer l''huile et le beurre dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen. Ajouter les courgettes, saupoudrer de flocons de piment et de muscade, et assaisonner de sel et de poivre. Faites frire pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les courgettes soient dorées et ramollies. Ajoutez les oignons nouveaux et le zeste de citron et remuez pendant une minute ou deux. Versez le riz et remuez pour bien l''enrober d''huile jusqu''à ce qu''il soit translucide, environ 2 minutes.","Versez le vin, puis laissez cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque entièrement évaporé. Ajoutez une louche de bouillon et remuez quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit absorbé. Continuez à ajouter une louche à la fois pendant 20 à 30 minutes, en remuant continuellement, jusqu''à ce que tout le bouillon soit absorbé.","Incorporer les fèves et les fleurs blanchies, le cas échéant, et réchauffer pendant 2 minutes. Retirer du feu et incorporer le parmesan. Laisser reposer environ 5 minutes, puis mélanger la moitié du pesto. Tout pesto restant se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux jours.","Répartissez le risotto dans les bols et parsemez-le de feuilles de basilic supplémentaires, de fromage supplémentaire et d''une autre cuillerée de pesto, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10770,7605,'fr','Panzanelle','Préparez votre propre version de l’un des plats les plus célèbres de Toscane, la panzanella. C''est une bonne façon d''utiliser les restes, car il est fait avec du pain rassis – il suffit de le mélanger avec des tomates mûres et une vinaigrette à l''huile d''olive.','["1 kg de tomates mélangées mûres, coupées en deux si petites, en quartiers si grosses","300 g de levain ou ciabatta d''un jour, déchiré en gros morceaux","100 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","50 ml de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 petite échalote, hachée finement","50 g d''anchois en boîte, égouttés et hachés grossièrement","100 g d''olives noires dénoyautées","une grosse poignée de feuilles de basilic déchirées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettez les tomates dans une passoire et saupoudrez d''1 cuillère à café de sel marin, puis laissez reposer 15 minutes.","Étalez les morceaux de pain sur une plaque à pâtisserie et mélangez-les avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement grillés.","Dans un bol, mélanger le reste de l''huile, le vinaigre et l''échalote. Assaisonner au goût. Mélanger les anchois avec les tomates, les croûtons, la vinaigrette à l''huile d''olive, les olives et la moitié du basilic dans un grand bol. Verser la panzanella sur une assiette de service et garnir du basilic restant."]','2026-01-11 00:07:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10771,7607,'fr','Risotto aux asperges','Mettez les asperges au centre de ce risotto satisfaisant. Garnir d''une pincée de parmesan pour un repas facile en milieu de semaine pour deux','["1 botte d''asperges (environ 200g)","800 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","25g de beurre","1 petit oignon, finement haché","175 g de riz pour risotto","100 ml de vin blanc ou de vermouth (facultatif)","25 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, finement râpé"]','["Cassez les extrémités ligneuses des tiges d''asperges et versez-les dans une casserole avec le bouillon. Mettez sur feu doux pour laisser mijoter très doucement. Pendant ce temps, coupez les pointes des asperges, ajoutez-les au bouillon pendant exactement 1 min. Retirer avec une écumoire et réserver. Coupez finement le reste des tiges en rondelles.","Faites chauffer l''huile et la moitié du beurre dans une poêle large et épaisse. Faites revenir les oignons doucement pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, en remuant souvent. Ajoutez les tiges d''asperges hachées et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez le riz et remuez continuellement pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il devienne semi-transparent et émette un sifflement.","Incorporez le vin, si vous en utilisez – il s’évaporera presque immédiatement. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter doucement. Ajoutez le bouillon, une louche à la fois, en remuant entre chaque ajout jusqu''à ce qu''il soit absorbé, environ 15 minutes.","Essayez le riz – il devrait être juste cuit avec une légère bouchée. Incorporez les pointes d''asperges et le reste du bouillon et laissez cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes. Retirer du feu et garnir du reste du beurre et de la majeure partie du parmesan. Assaisonner généreusement, couvrir et laisser reposer quelques minutes.","Remuez bien le risotto pour incorporer le beurre et le fromage et servez aussitôt avec le reste de parmesan pour saupoudrer."]','2026-01-11 00:07:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10772,7611,'fr','Calzone mozzarella, poivrons et aubergines','Essayez ces calzones saines à la mozzarella, au poivre et à l''aubergine d''inspiration italienne pour un déjeuner de travail, ou faites vos valises et mangez dehors par une journée chaude.','["400 g de farine à pain complète forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","⅛ cuillère à café de sel (facultatif)","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour la plaque à pâtisserie","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 poivron rouge et 1 jaune, épépinés et coupés en petits morceaux","1 grosse aubergine, coupée en deux dans le sens de la longueur et tranchée finement","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","petit bouquet de basilic, grossièrement déchiré","8 olives Kalamata dénoyautées, coupées en deux","125 g de boule de mozzarella (poids égoutté), coupée en quartiers","lait ou œuf battu, pour badigeonner"]','["Mettez la farine, le sel (le cas échéant), la levure, l''huile et 300 ml d''eau tiède dans un bol et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Pétrir en boule (essayez de ne pas ajouter de farine supplémentaire) – elle sera collante mais la farine absorbera un peu d''humidité. Remettez dans le bol, couvrez et laissez dans un endroit chaud.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, puis faites revenir les poivrons pendant environ 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez l''aubergine et l''ail et poursuivez la cuisson à feu moyen pendant 8 à 10 minutes, en appuyant doucement sur le légume avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce qu''il se décompose un peu. Si ce n’est pas le cas, faites frire, à couvert, pendant quelques minutes supplémentaires.","Incorporer la purée de tomates, le vinaigre et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Lorsque les légumes sont tendres, retirez la casserole du feu et incorporez le basilic.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Couper la pâte levée en quatre et étaler chaque morceau en un cercle de 20 cm sur un plan légèrement fariné. Versez un quart de la garniture sur un côté, parsemez un quart des olives, recouvrez d''un quart du fromage et badigeonnez les bords de lait ou d''œuf battu. Pliez la pâte sur la garniture et pincez les bords sur le côté, un peu comme si vous faisiez une pâte de Cornouailles. Déposez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie légèrement huilée et badigeonnez-le de lait ou d''œuf battu. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte et la garniture pour faire quatre calzones, puis faites cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Laisser refroidir légèrement et servir à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:07:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10773,7613,'fr','Cuisson aux boulettes de viande Puttanesca','Ces pâtes rapides à préparer aux câpres, aux flocons de piment, aux olives et aux courgettes sont le repas idéal en milieu de semaine. Savoureux et copieux, il satisfera toute la famille','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","24 boulettes de viande prêtes à l''emploi","2 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","pincée de flocons de piment séchés (facultatif)","2 anchois hachés (facultatif)","2 petites courgettes (environ 250 g), râpées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres, rincées, égouttées et hachées grossièrement","70 g d''olives noires dénoyautées, coupées en deux","500 ml en purée","300 g de penne (ou autres formes de pâtes)","2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir doucement les boulettes de viande jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient entièrement dorées, puis versez-les dans un plat. Ajoutez l''ail et le piment, le cas échéant, aux restes d''huile dans la poêle et faites-les cuire brièvement avec les anchois, le cas échéant. Faites frire jusqu''à ce que les anchois soient presque fondus, puis ajoutez les courgettes et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que le liquide qu''elles dégagent se soit évaporé. Incorporer les câpres, les olives et la passata et porter à ébullition. Ajoutez les boulettes de viande et laissez cuire encore 5 min, puis assaisonnez si besoin.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, égouttez-les bien, puis versez-les dans un plat allant au four d''environ 25 cm de large. Verser sur le mélange de boulettes de viande, incorporer aux pâtes et niveler la surface autant que possible. Saupoudrer de parmesan et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit un peu doré et que la sauce bouillonne. Reposez-vous 5 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10774,7615,'fr','Gnudi à la ricotta et aux épinards','Essayez ces quenelles légères à la ricotta et aux herbes de Lina Stores pour un plat italien classique. Servez vos gnudi avec beaucoup de sauce et de parmesan','["500 g d''épinards, extrémités parées","500 g de ricotta (doit être sèche, donc égoutter toute la nuit si elle est humide)","75 g de jaunes d''œufs","75 g de chapelure séchée","50g de farine nature","muscade entière, à râper","125 g de Grana Padano râpé, plus un peu pour la sauce et pour servir","50g de beurre","20 g de sauge, tranchée si les feuilles sont grandes"]','["Versez de l''eau bouillante sur les épinards, puis laissez-les refroidir un peu avant d''essorer l''excédent de liquide. Hachez finement les épinards. Égouttez et essorez à nouveau l’excès d’eau. Mettez les épinards dans un bol avec la ricotta, les jaunes d''œufs, la chapelure, la farine, une râpe de muscade, une pincée de sel et le fromage. Bien mélanger.","Prélevez 24 morceaux de taille égale du mélange, à l''aide d''une cuillère à glace si vous en avez une, et façonnez chacun en bûche en la roulant entre vos mains. Disposez chaque bûche sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis réfrigérez pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée. Plongez les gnudi dans l''eau, baissez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 3 à 4 minutes (faites-le par lots si nécessaire). Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le beurre dans une grande poêle, ajoutez la sauge et faites-la revenir jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit croustillante. Bien égoutter les gnudi, puis les verser dans la poêle avec la sauge, accompagnée d''une bonne râpe de fromage. Mélangez le tout, en le faisant par lots si c''est plus facile. Disposez quatre gnudi sur chaque assiette de service, versez davantage de sauce et parsemez de fromage râpé."]','2026-01-11 00:07:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10775,7617,'fr','Raviolis aux noix, fromage de chèvre et sauce cavolo nero','Réalisez ce plat de pâtes en utilisant des feuilles de lasagnes et une pâte de chèvre maison. Si vous avez le temps, cela vaut la peine d''utiliser des noix fraîchement décortiquées pour une saveur plus sucrée.','["200 g de chou noir","75 ml d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour mélanger les pâtes","1 petite gousse d''ail","1 citron, jus","8 à 12 feuilles de lasagnes fraîches ou séchées, selon la taille","pecorino finement râpé, parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, pour servir","140g de noix","une poignée de feuilles de sauge hachées","120g de fromage de chèvre","jus de citron, au goût","50 ml d''huile d''olive"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau légèrement salée, puis ajoutez le cavolo nero. Cuire pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chou frisé devienne vert vif et ramollisse. Sortez avec une pince dans une passoire en gardant l''eau de cuisson pour faire bouillir les pâtes. Faites couler de l''eau froide sur le chou frisé, essorez tout excès d''eau, puis transférez-le dans un robot culinaire. Ajoutez l''huile, l''ail, le jus de citron et 1 cuillère à café de sel, puis mixez jusqu''à obtenir un pesto fin. Assaisonner au goût et transférer dans une petite casserole. Réchauffer doucement à feu moyen-doux.","Nettoyez le robot culinaire. Pour la pâte de chèvre, ajoutez les noix, la sauge, le fromage de chèvre, un bon filet de jus de citron et l''huile, puis mixez pour obtenir une pâte. Assaisonner, puis réchauffer dans une autre petite poêle à feu moyen-doux, en remuant de temps en temps.","Portez à nouveau la casserole d''eau de cavolo à ébullition, en ajoutant plus d''eau si nécessaire. Ajouter les feuilles de pâtes et laisser mijoter en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Égoutter en gardant une tasse d''eau des pâtes pour l''ajouter à la sauce (environ 400 ml). Coupez les feuilles de pâtes en deux et ajoutez un peu d''huile d''olive.","Incorporer l''eau des pâtes réservée à la sauce cavolo et maintenir à feu doux. Si la sauce semble épaisse, diluez-la avec un peu plus d''eau ou augmentez un peu le feu si elle est trop fine ; il devrait être versable comme une double crème. Verser une mare de sauce dans chaque assiette. Superposez les feuilles de lasagnes avec des cuillerées de pâte de fromage de chèvre entre chaque couche. Garnir de la dernière feuille de pâtes et verser un peu plus de sauce, puis répartir sur le fromage."]','2026-01-11 00:07:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10776,7619,'fr','Burger de porc italien avec salsa de tomates fraîches','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Aromatisez le porc haché avec du fenouil, du piment et de l''origan et servez-le dans des petits pains ciabatta avec du mascarpone et une vinaigrette aux tomates et aux olives.','["500 g de porc haché","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","un filet d''huile d''olive","2 grosses tomates hachées","6 olives noires hachées","un filet de vinaigre balsamique","4 petits pains ciabatta, fendus et grillés","4 cuillères à soupe de mascarpone","poignée de pousses d''épinards"]','["Mélangez le porc haché avec les graines de fenouil, les flocons de piment, l''origan et un peu d''assaisonnement. Mélangez bien avec vos mains jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis façonnez 4 burgers. Faites chauffer un filet d''huile dans une grande poêle – ou allumez le barbecue et badigeonnez les burgers d''un peu d''huile – et faites cuire les burgers 5 à 7 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les tomates, les olives, le vinaigre balsamique et un filet d''huile avec un peu d''assaisonnement pour faire une salsa. Garnir la base de chaque petit pain avec 1 cuillère à soupe de mascarpone, quelques feuilles d''épinards, un burger et une cuillerée de salsa, puis prendre le tout en sandwich avec le couvercle."]','2026-01-11 00:07:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10777,7621,'fr','Gnocchi au persil, beurre & salicorne','Oubliez les pâtes et essayez de préparer vos propres gnocchis de pommes de terre – recherchez la salicorne pour préparer un plat principal frais et frugal sans viande.','["900 g de pommes de terre farineuses, à peu près de la même taille ou coupées en deux si grosses, non pelées","50g de beurre salé","1 œuf moyen, battu","225-280 g de farine blanche nature","100g de beurre salé","6 échalotes, finement tranchées","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","200 g de salicorne","2 petits paquets de persil haché"]','["Pour faire les gnocchis, faites cuire les pommes de terre dans l''eau bouillante pendant 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très tendres, puis égouttez-les bien. Retirez la peau et passez-la au tamis ou au presse-purée dans un bol.","Pendant que les pommes de terre sont encore chaudes, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de sel, le beurre, l''œuf et la moitié de la farine. Mélangez légèrement et démoulez sur une planche farinée. Incorporer progressivement le reste de la farine pour obtenir une pâte lisse, molle mais légèrement collante.","Etalez la pâte en boudins de 2,5 cm de diamètre. Coupez-les en morceaux d''environ 2 cm et déposez-les sur un torchon fariné pour éviter que les gnocchis ne collent entre eux.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau. Plongez les gnocchis dans l''eau par lots et laissez cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils flottent à la surface. Retirez-les à l''aide d''une écumoire et réservez au chaud le temps de cuire le reste.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer doucement le beurre dans une grande poêle à fond épais, ajoutez les échalotes et l''ail et laissez ramollir doucement pendant 5 à 6 minutes. Ajoutez la salicorne et laissez cuire encore 4 à 6 minutes.","Ajoutez les gnocchis dans la poêle avec la majeure partie du persil. Mélangez délicatement le tout et assaisonnez. Servir aussitôt, parsemé du reste de persil."]','2026-01-11 00:07:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10778,7623,'fr','Tarte Taleggio avec pâte aux noix','Une pâtisserie délicate au goût de noisette constitue une toile de fond parfaite pour la garniture crémeuse de ce plat principal alléchant sans viande.','["200 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de noix (poids décortiqué)","50 g de beurre froid coupé en petits morceaux","25 g de fromage à pâte dure végétarien (ou parmesan si vous ne faites pas une version strictement végétarienne), râpé","1 œuf moyen, battu","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","6 échalotes, tranchées","3 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 œuf entier et 2 jaunes d''œufs","200 ml de crème fraîche","140 g de Taleggio végétarien, sans la croûte, coupé en morceaux de 1 cm","1 barquette de cresson","zester 1 citron, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Pour réaliser la pâte, fouettez la farine et les noix au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce que les noix soient très fines. Ajoutez le beurre et le fromage et fouettez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Ajoutez l''œuf battu et 1 cuillère à café d''eau froide. Pulser jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme une pâte, en ajoutant un peu plus d''eau si nécessaire. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Sur un plan légèrement fariné, étaler la pâte sur l''épaisseur d''un morceau de 50p et l''utiliser pour tapisser un moule à tarte de 23cm. Piquer plusieurs fois le fond avec une fourchette et remettre au réfrigérateur pour encore 15 minutes. (Ne soyez pas tenté de sauter cette étape – cela aidera à éviter tout rétrécissement.)","Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle à feu moyen et ajoutez les échalotes et l''ail. Faites frire pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les échalotes soient ramollies et dorées. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Tapissez votre pâte de papier sulfurisé, remplissez-la de billes de cuisson et enfournez pour 15 minutes. Retirez le papier sulfurisé et remettez au four encore 10 minutes – cela permettra au fond de sécher avant d''ajouter la garniture. Réduire le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.","Cassez l''œuf dans un bol à mélanger de taille moyenne et ajoutez les jaunes. Battre légèrement à la fourchette avant de verser la crème. Incorporez les échalotes et l''ail, ainsi que les trois quarts du Talegio, les trois quarts du cresson et le zeste de citron. Saison.","Versez le mélange dans le fond de tarte, ajoutez le reste de fromage et assaisonnez de poivre.","Cuire au four pendant 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit prise et ferme au toucher. Sortir du four et laisser refroidir 10 min. Répartir sur le reste du cresson et du zeste de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:07:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10779,7625,'fr','Gnudi d''orties au pesto sauvage','Ces raviolis italiens ressemblent à des boules légères de gnocchis à la ricotta ou à la garniture des raviolis : utilisez des orties fraîchement récoltées pour une sauce simple.','["2 pots de 250 g de ricotta de bonne qualité","200g de jeunes feuilles d''ortie (cueillies - voir astuce)","50 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), plus un peu pour servir","2 jaunes d''œufs","muscade, pour râper","350g de farine de semoule ou semoule fine","6 cuillères à soupe de pesto sauvage (voir recette dans Accompagnements)"]','["Tapisser une passoire d''un morceau de mousseline et déposer au-dessus d''un bol. Versez la ricotta, rassemblez les extrémités de la mousseline et nouez délicatement ensemble. Laisser égoutter 4 heures ou de préférence toute la nuit.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition une casserole d’eau. Blanchissez rapidement les feuilles d''ortie, puis égouttez-les et placez-les au frais sous le robinet froid. Égouttez à nouveau soigneusement et essorez autant d''eau que possible des feuilles, puis hachez-les très finement et réfrigérez jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour préparer les gnudi, transférez la ricotta égouttée dans un grand bol. Battez un peu, puis ajoutez quelques cuillères à soupe de parmesan, les jaunes d''œufs, les orties, une bonne râpe de muscade et beaucoup d''assaisonnement. Remuez bien pour combiner. Versez la semoule dans une grande plaque à pâtisserie (elle devra rentrer dans votre réfrigérateur plus tard). Mouillez-vous les mains, trempez-les dans la semoule et, en travaillant rapidement, versez 1 cuillère à café bien remplie du mélange de ricotta dans vos mains et roulez délicatement en boule. Placez la boule sur le plateau de semoule et roulez-la pour qu''elle soit entièrement enrobée. Ramassez-le et roulez-le entre les paumes de vos mains pour créer une boule lisse, puis remettez-y la semoule. Continuez avec le reste du mélange – vous devriez avoir environ 28 boules au total. En laissant les boules dans la semoule, veillez à ce qu''elles soient bien espacées, puis recouvrez légèrement d''un film alimentaire. Réfrigérer pendant 12 à 24 heures – le plus longtemps sera le mieux – jusqu''à ce qu''une peau se forme sur les gnudi.","Pour cuire, portez à ébullition une grande casserole d’eau. Pendant ce temps, versez le pesto dans une poêle. Une fois l''eau bouillante, déposez les gnudi par lots et laissez mijoter pendant 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils remontent à la surface. Retirer avec une écumoire et transférer dans une passoire. Répétez avec les gnudi restants. Faites chauffer le pesto dans la poêle avec quelques cuillères à soupe d''eau de cuisson des gnudi, pour le détendre. Versez les gnudi cuits dans la poêle et retournez délicatement les boules dans le pesto. Répartir dans les assiettes et parsemer du reste de parmesan et d''un bon moulin à poivre noir avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10780,7627,'fr','Beurre d''ail des ours sur pain de papier à musique','Ce pain délicat et ultra fin s''inspire d''un classique sarde, la carta di musica – à servir avec du beurre aromatisé pour une entrée ou un accompagnement spécial.','["200 g de farine ''00'', plus un peu pour saupoudrer","100g de farine de semoule ou semoule fine","huile d''olive, pour badigeonner","8 tranches de beurre d''ail des ours (voir recette dans Se marie bien avec), pour servir","sel de mer feuilleté, pour servir"]','["Dans un bol, mélanger les farines et 1/2 cuillère à café de sel. Versez 175 ml d''eau et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle. Versez sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrissez pendant environ 5 minutes ou jusqu''à consistance lisse. Enveloppez dans du film alimentaire et laissez reposer 30 min. Pendant ce temps, placez une pierre à pizza ou une ou deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie dans le four, puis chauffez-le à 240°C/220°C chaleur tournante/gaz 9 ou aussi haut que possible.","Divisez la pâte en 8 et formez des boules. Sur une surface farinée, étalez les boules très finement en cercles grossiers d''environ 20 à 22 cm de diamètre.","Découpez 8 carrés de papier sulfurisé un peu plus grands que les cercles de pâte. Déposer les cercles de pâte dessus et badigeonner d''huile d''olive. Cuire les pains, 1 ou 2 à la fois, sur la pierre à pizza chaude ou sur la plaque à pâtisserie (toujours sur le papier sulfurisé) pendant 6 à 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils bouillonnent par endroits, soient dorés et croustillants. Retirer et laisser refroidir sur une grille pendant que vous cuisez le reste. Remettez tous les pains au four pendant 1 min pour qu''ils soient bien chauds. Retirer et garnir d''une tranche de beurre à l''ail (voir Se marie bien avec) et de sel marin."]','2026-01-11 00:07:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10781,7629,'fr','Focaccia aux pommes de terre nouvelles et au romarin','Ce pain de style italien facile s''inspire du classique chips buttie - parfait comme alternative à une corbeille à pain pour un dîner','["250 g de pommes de terre nouvelles (nous avons utilisé des Jersey Royals)","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","8 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour graisser","500 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour pétrir et saupoudrer","petit paquet de romarin"]','["Faites cuire les pommes de terre dans l''eau bouillante pendant 15 minutes, puis égouttez-les et laissez-les refroidir complètement. Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir la bouilloire.","Versez 175 ml d''eau bouillante et 100 ml d''eau froide dans un grand bol. Saupoudrer de levure, 1 cuillère à café de sel et 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive. Mélangez bien, puis incorporez la farine, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si le mélange semble trop sec.","Déposez la pâte sur un plan de travail propre et pétrissez pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique (saupoudrez la surface d''un peu de farine si la pâte est collante), puis formez une boule. Graisser l''intérieur d''un grand bol avec de l''huile d''olive, puis ajouter la pâte dans le bol et retourner plusieurs fois pour bien l''enrober d''huile. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Graisser un grand plat à rôtir (environ 26 cm x 35 cm) avec de l''huile d''olive et saupoudrer d''un peu de farine. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Étalez délicatement la pâte pour qu''elle s''adapte au moule, en la pressant dans les coins. Coupez les pommes de terre cuites en quartiers et incorporez-les à intervalles réguliers à la pâte, accompagnées de brins de romarin et parsemez-en quelques brins. Couvrir le moule d''un film alimentaire et laisser lever encore 45 minutes. Retirez le film alimentaire, versez 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et saupoudrez d''un peu de sel. Cuire au four\r\npendant 30 à 35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le pain soit doré et que les pommes de terre soient légèrement dorées.","Lorsque le pain est cuit, sortez-le du four et arrosez-le rapidement de 3 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires d''huile d''olive pendant qu''il est encore chaud. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes, puis démouler sur une planche, trancher et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10782,7631,'fr','Culotte artichaut & olive','Ces colis italiens constituent un excellent dîner végétarien en semaine – utilisez un mélange de pain du commerce pour gagner du temps','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","Boîte de 390 g de cœurs d''artichauts dans l''eau, égouttés et tranchés","4 brins de romarin, feuilles seulement, hachés","½ pot de 250 g de ricotta","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","300 g de mélange à pain","75 g d''olives vertes tranchées","125 g de boule de mozzarella coupée en dés","feuilles mélangées, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites cuire les artichauts et le romarin quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que les artichauts soient un peu dorés. Mélanger la ricotta et l''ail et assaisonner.","Videz le mélange à pain dans un bol et préparez-le en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Divisez en 4 boules et étalez chacune en un cercle de 20 cm. Tartiner un côté de chacun avec la ricotta, parsemer d''olives, d''artichauts et de romarin, puis garnir de mozzarella. Badigeonner les bords de la pâte d''eau et replier la moitié découverte sur la garniture. Pressez les bords ensemble pour sceller. Placer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé et doré, puis servir avec des feuilles mélangées."]','2026-01-11 00:07:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10783,7633,'fr','Pappardelle au lapin et ragoût de marrons','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. C''est le meilleur plat réconfortant pour les jours de pluie – des lanières de pâtes plates mélangées à un riche ragoût charnu, des châtaignes crémeuses et un zeste d''orange parfumé.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza ou d''olive","1 lapin démonté (demandez à votre boucher de le faire pour vous)","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","200 g de lardons de lard fumé","1 oignon, finement haché","1 carotte, hachée finement","1 branche de céleri, finement hachée","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de baies de genièvre, écrasées au pilon et au mortier","3 feuilles de laurier froissées dans la main pour libérer la saveur","2 brins de romarin, feuilles cueillies et hachées","200 ml de vin rouge","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","200 g de châtaignes cuites hachées grossièrement","400 g de pappardelles","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","le zeste d''une ½ orange ou d''une clémentine","petit bouquet de persil haché","Parmesan, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle large ou une cocotte ignifuge avec un couvercle. Assaisonner le lapin et incorporer la farine. Ajoutez à l’huile chaude et faites dorer de tous les côtés – vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots. Lorsqu''il est entièrement doré, transférez-le dans une assiette. Ajouter le reste de l''huile et les lardons dans la poêle et cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés. Ajoutez l''oignon, la carotte et le céleri et remuez pendant 10 minutes, en grattant les morceaux croustillants du fond, jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient ramollis. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore 1 min.","Incorporez ensuite la cannelle, le genièvre, les feuilles de laurier et le romarin. Au bout d''1 min, versez le vin et émiettez-le dans le cube de bouillon. Laisser mijoter 5 min, puis ajouter les tomates et remettre le lapin dans la poêle. Placer le lapin dans la sauce, couvrir avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter doucement pendant 2 heures en remuant une à deux fois.","Retirez le lapin, remuez bien la sauce, puis couvrez à nouveau. Continuez à mijoter la sauce pendant que vous effilochez la viande des os à l''aide de 2 fourchettes. Jetez les os et remettez la viande dans la poêle, ainsi que la moitié des châtaignes. Cuire à découvert pendant encore 30 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une sauce épaisse et riche. Ajoutez les marrons restants. Peut maintenant être refroidi et réfrigéré pendant la nuit, ou congelé jusqu''à 2 mois.","Faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Incorporer le lait, le zeste d''orange et le persil à la sauce et réchauffer si refroidi. Lorsque les pâtes sont cuites, ajoutez-les à la sauce et laissez cuire encore 1 min. Servir avec du parmesan, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10784,7635,'fr','Le gâteau de grand-mère','Donnez à cette tarte toscane une délicieuse touche en ajoutant du chocolat noir à la garniture à la crème anglaise traditionnelle et à la délicate pâtisserie sucrée.','["280 g de farine nature","175 g de beurre doux froid, coupé en cubes","75 g de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 jaunes d''œufs légèrement battus","1l de lait entier","1 gousse de vanille, fendue","8 gros jaunes d''œufs","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","85 g de farine ''00''","100 g de gazon","zester 2 oranges","200 g de chocolat noir en tablette râpé","75 g de pignons de pin"]','["Pour faire la pâte, mettez la farine, le beurre et le sucre glace dans un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''elle ressemble à de la chapelure. Pendant que le moteur tourne, ajoutez lentement les jaunes d’œufs. Si le mélange semble trop sec, versez 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d’eau froide. Versez-le sur votre plan de travail et pétrissez doucement. Aplatissez la pâte en un disque, enveloppez-la dans du film alimentaire et réservez au frais 20 min.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Versez le lait dans une casserole. Grattez les graines de vanille de la gousse fendue dans le lait et ajoutez également la gousse. Faites chauffer le lait\r\nà feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à bouillonner sur les bords. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir un peu.","Battre les jaunes d''œufs, le sucre et la farine avec un fouet électrique pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Retirez la gousse de vanille du lait refroidi et versez-la régulièrement sur les jaunes d''œufs battus en fouettant constamment.","Versez le mélange de crème anglaise dans une casserole propre. Chauffer à feu moyen-doux en fouettant tout le temps. Faites cuire la crème anglaise pendant 10 minutes, toujours en fouettant, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien épaisse. Retirer du feu et passer au tamis dans un plat large. Couvrir la surface d''un film alimentaire pour éviter que la crème anglaise ne forme une peau. Laisser refroidir pendant que vous préparez le fond de tarte.","Étalez la pâte entre 2 morceaux de papier sulfurisé pour tapisser un moule à tarte cannelé à fond lâche de 24 cm. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer 30 min. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser le fond de tarte de papier d''aluminium ou de papier sulfurisé et remplir de fèves au four. Cuire au four 15 mn. Retirez délicatement les haricots et le papier d''aluminium, puis remettez au four pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée. Laisser refroidir dans le moule sur une grille le temps de terminer la garniture.","Réduire le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Battre délicatement la crème anglaise avec la ricotta, le zeste d''orange et le chocolat râpé jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé, et répartir uniformément dans le fond de tarte. Saupoudrer de pignons de pin et cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes – la garniture sera encore assez bancale mais elle se raffermira en refroidissant. Réfrigérer au moins 3 heures, voire toute la nuit. Saupoudrer de sucre glace au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10785,4369,'fr','Aquacotta','Cette soupe toscane traditionnelle, qui signifie « eau cuite », est servie avec un œuf poché pour plus de richesse – une entrée parfaite ou un déjeuner léger.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 branches de céleri, hachées","2 petites carottes hachées","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de thym, plus un peu pour servir","50 g de cèpes séchés","225 g de tomates italiennes épépinées et hachées","850 ml de bouillon de poulet","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","3 tranches de bon pain croustillant, grillées et déchirées en morceaux","6 oeufs"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande casserole et faites revenir doucement le céleri, les carottes, l''oignon, l''ail et le thym pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Pendant ce temps, couvrez les cèpes d''eau chaude et laissez-les tremper pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et gonflés. Égouttez les champignons en réservant le liquide de trempage et hachez-les grossièrement. Ajouter aux légumes ramollis avec le liquide de trempage et cuire encore 5 minutes.","Incorporez les tomates et laissez cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à se décomposer, puis versez le bouillon et portez à douce ébullition.","Pochez les 6 œufs dans une grande casserole d''eau frémissante pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pris, puis retirez-les avec une écumoire. Ajoutez le persil et un peu d''assaisonnement à la soupe et incorporez le pain grillé déchiré. Répartissez la soupe dans 6 bols et placez un œuf sur chacun. Servir parsemé de thym supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:07:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10786,7637,'fr','Spaghetti aux crevettes pimentées, salami et chapelure gremolata','Faites sauter des piments rouges avec de l''ail, des graines de fenouil et des tomates pour une base de sauce pour pâtes délicieuse et facile – terminez avec de la chapelure croustillante au persil','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 piments rouges de la taille d''un pouce, tranchés et la plupart des graines enlevées","3 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","10 tranches de salami au fenouil, hachées","140 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","400 g de spaghettis ou de pâtes bucatini","300 g de grosses crevettes crues, décortiquées","2 tranches de pain croustillant, réduites en miettes","une grosse poignée de persil plat, haché","le zeste d''1 citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Dans une grande poêle, faire chauffer 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile. Ajoutez les piments et la majeure partie de l''ail (gardez 1 cuillère à café pour la chapelure) et faites revenir jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, environ 2-3 minutes. Ajoutez les graines de fenouil et le salami et remuez pendant 1 min. Ajoutez les tomates et une pincée de sel, puis faites revenir encore 10 minutes.","Versez la chapelure sur une plaque à pâtisserie, versez dessus le reste d''huile, assaisonnez et enfournez pour 7 min. Mélangez l''ail restant dans la chapelure et faites cuire encore 3 minutes. Retirez et ajoutez le persil et le zeste de citron.","Cuire les pâtes dans de l''eau bouillante salée selon les instructions du paquet, environ 9 minutes. Faites chauffer la sauce et juste avant que les pâtes soient prêtes, incorporez les crevettes pour qu''elles soient bien cuites. Égouttez les pâtes et mélangez-les à la sauce, puis saupoudrez de chapelure."]','2026-01-11 00:07:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10787,5533,'fr','Panzanella à l''avocat','Avec seulement 20 minutes de préparation et aucun temps de cuisson, vous pourrez préparer cette salade colorée d''avocat et de pain en un rien de temps.','["1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1½ cuillère à soupe de câpres, égouttées et rincées","1 avocat mûr, dénoyauté, pelé et haché","1 petit oignon rouge, tranché très finement","175 g de ciabatta ou de pain croustillant","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Coupez en deux ou hachez grossièrement les tomates (selon la taille) et mettez-les dans un bol. Assaisonnez bien et ajoutez l''ail, les câpres, l''avocat et l''oignon et mélangez bien. Réserver 10 min.","Pendant ce temps, déchirez ou coupez la ciabatta en morceaux de 3 cm et placez-la dans un grand bol de service ou sur une assiette. Arroser de la moitié de l''huile d''olive, de la moitié du vinaigre et ajouter un peu d''assaisonnement. Au moment de servir, verser sur les tomates et leur jus éventuel. Parsemer de feuilles de basilic et arroser du reste d''huile et de vinaigre. Remuez une dernière fois et servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:07:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10788,7639,'fr','Panna cotta aux fraises','Servez ce dessert italien crémeux avec une couche supérieure de sauce aux fraises fraîches et nos snaps aux amandes salées maison en accompagnement.','["3 feuilles de gélatine","450 ml de crème fraîche","200 ml de lait entier","100 g de sucre blanc en poudre","1 gousse de vanille","400 g de fraises, décortiquées et coupées en deux ou en quartiers si elles sont très grosses","1½ cuillère à café de farine de maïs","50 g de sucre blanc en poudre"]','["Pour la panna cotta, mettez les feuilles de gélatine dans un petit bol d’eau froide pour les ramollir – cela prendra environ 5 minutes. Pendant ce temps, versez la crème, le lait et le sucre dans une casserole, fendez la gousse de vanille, grattez les graines et ajoutez-la avec la gousse au mélange de crème. Chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud, mais sans bouillonner. Retirez les feuilles de gélatine de l''eau, essorez l''excédent de liquide puis ajoutez-les une à une à la crème chaude. Remuer jusqu''à dissolution. Laisser reposer 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à refroidissement – ​​les gousses de vanille doivent alors être en suspension dans le liquide. Passer le mélange au tamis dans 6 verres de service, puis réfrigérer au moins 3 heures.","Mélangez les fraises avec la maïzena et le sucre dans une casserole. Placer sur feu moyen et cuire 4 à 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le jus libéré épaississe et que les fraises ramollissent. Laisser refroidir. Une fois complètement refroidies, garnissez les panna cottas avec le mélange de fraises. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10789,7641,'fr','Tagliolini aux aubergines et au piment','Les taglioni sont des pâtes fines et plates, semblables aux tagliatelles. Si vous ne les trouvez pas, utilisez plutôt des linguines pour ce plat de pâtes végétariennes','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 grosse aubergine, coupée en petits cubes","1 petit oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","400 g de tomates fraîches hachées grossièrement ou 400 g de tomates concassées en boîte","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","400 g de pâtes taglioni ou linguines séchées","petit bouquet de basilic, haché grossièrement","50 g de pecorino, râpé ou alternative végétarienne"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande casserole et faites cuire les aubergines pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à dorer et à ramollir.","Ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail, le piment et l''origan et laissez cuire quelques minutes. Ajoutez les tomates, le vinaigre balsamique et environ 200 ml d''eau, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter doucement pendant environ 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient réduites et bien ramollies et que la sauce épaississe.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau et faites cuire les tagliolini en suivant les instructions du paquet. Égouttez les pâtes et remettez-les dans la poêle. Ajouter la sauce et bien mélanger aux pâtes avec le basilic. Servir avec le pecorino râpé."]','2026-01-11 00:07:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10790,7643,'fr','Aubergines au parmesan','Essayez une version charnue de la pâtisserie italienne traditionnelle aux aubergines en ajoutant un riche ragoût de bœuf. Garnir de mascarpone, de mozzarella et de parmesan','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour le badigeonnage","800 g de bœuf haché","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","3 brins de thym","3 brins de romarin","3 feuilles de laurier","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","verre de vin rouge","1 cube de bouillon de boeuf","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre","5 aubergines coupées en tranches de 5 mm dans le sens de la longueur","2 boules de 125 g de mozzarella coupées en petits morceaux","50 g de parmesan râpé","250 g de mascarpone en casserole"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou une cocotte ignifuge. Ajoutez le hachis et faites-le revenir à feu vif en le défaisant avec une cuillère en bois au fur et à mesure. (Vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots.) Une fois bien doré, versez-le sur une assiette.","Ajouter le reste de l''huile, l''ail et les herbes dans la poêle et cuire doucement 1 min. Versez les tomates et le vin rouge et portez à ébullition en remuant les morceaux de viande collés au fond de la casserole. Remettez le hachis dans la poêle, émiettez-le dans le cube de bouillon, ajoutez le sucre et l''assaisonnement. Laisser mijoter doucement pendant au moins 1 heure, en remuant de temps en temps, en ajoutant plus d''eau pour garder la sauce si nécessaire. Si vous avez le temps de mijoter plus longtemps, foncez : plus c''est long, mieux c''est. Pêchez les tiges d''herbes et les feuilles de laurier.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une plaque chauffante ou une poêle. Badigeonnez les tranches d''aubergines des deux côtés d''huile d''olive, puis faites-les griller par lots. Vous voulez que chaque tranche soit ramollie et légèrement carbonisée, alors n’utilisez pas une chaleur trop élevée, sinon l’aubergine se carbonisera avant de ramollir. Retirer dans une assiette au fur et à mesure.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Réserver un peu de chaque fromage pour le dessus. Dans un grand plat allant au four, étalez une cuillerée de sauce hachée sur le fond puis recouvrez d''une couche d''aubergines et assaisonnez bien. Versez un peu plus de sauce hachée, puis saupoudrez de mozzarella, de parmesan et de gouttes de mascarpone. Ajoutez une autre couche d''aubergines et un peu d''assaisonnement. Répétez l’opération en superposant le tout et terminez par une couche de sauce à la viande. Garnissez avec le fromage réservé et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit croustillant et doré et que la viande hachée bouillonne."]','2026-01-11 00:07:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10791,7645,'fr','Polenta crémeuse et ragoût de champignons','La polenta au parmesan garnie d''un riche mélange de champignons et de fromage Taleggio fondant en fait un plat végétarien différent','["une petite poignée de cèpes séchés","25g de beurre","1 échalote, finement tranchée","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","5 brins de thym, feuilles cueillies","500 g de gros champignons des champs, tranchés","200 g de champignons châtaignes émincés","petit verre de vin rouge","125 ml de bouillon de légumes","100 g de fromage taleggio (ou alternative végétarienne), tranché","500 ml de lait","1 feuille de laurier","3 brins de thym","250 g de polenta instantanée","50g de beurre","75 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), râpé"]','["Faites tremper les champignons séchés dans 150 ml d''eau tiède. Laissez reposer 20 minutes, puis égouttez et pressez en réservant le liquide de trempage. Faites chauffer le beurre dans une grande poêle. Lorsqu''elle grésille, ajoutez l''échalote et laissez cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Ajoutez l''ail et les feuilles de thym, laissez cuire encore 1 min, puis augmentez le feu et ajoutez les champignons trempés. Au bout d''1 min, ajoutez tous les autres champignons et faites revenir à feu très vif pendant 5 min jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Arroser de vin rouge et faire bouillir rapidement pendant 1 min. Versez le bouillon et le liquide de champignons réservé et laissez mijoter pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à obtenir un ragoût épaissi. Éteignez le feu.","Pour la polenta, porter à ébullition le lait avec 500 ml d''eau, le laurier et le thym. Éteignez le feu et laissez infuser 20 min, puis récupérez les herbes et portez à nouveau à ébullition. Ajoutez la polenta en filet constant en fouettant régulièrement. Cuire 1 min jusqu''à épaississement, puis incorporer le beurre et le parmesan. Versez un « cratère » de polenta sur une plaque à pâtisserie et remplissez-la de ragoût. Garnir de tranches de Taleggio, placer sous un gril chaud jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondant et suintant, puis laisser chacun se servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10792,7647,'fr','Orecchiette aux anchois & brocolis violets','Cet humble plat du sud de l''Italie agrémenté de piment et de jus de citron est garni de chapelure frite pour plus de croquant.','["200 g d''orecchiettes","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","6 filets d''anchois dans l''huile, hachés (réserver 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile)","4 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 piment rouge, tranché finement","le zeste d''1 citron et le jus ½","50 g de chapelure fraîche","200 g de brocoli à germes violets"]','["Faites cuire les orecchiette en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''anchois dans une poêle. Ajoutez l''ail et le piment et faites grésiller pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''ail commence tout juste à devenir doré. Ajouter les anchois et le jus de citron et cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les anchois fondent dans la sauce. Mettez le reste de l''huile d''olive, la chapelure et le zeste de citron dans une autre poêle, mélangez et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants.","Lorsqu’il reste 4 à 5 minutes aux pâtes, ajoutez le brocoli dans la poêle. Une fois cuits, égouttez-les en réservant une tasse d''eau des pâtes, puis ajoutez-les à la poêle avec l''ail et les anchois. Remuer et cuire à feu doux pendant encore 2 minutes, en ajoutant un peu d''eau pour pâtes si elle semble sèche. Assaisonner, puis servir dans des bols à pâtes avec les miettes citronnées saupoudrées sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:07:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10793,7648,'fr','Conchiglioni au four avec saucisses, sauge et courge musquée','Du fromage fontina fondant, de l''huile de truffe riche et une sauce crémeuse à la courge et au parmesan transforment ces coquilles de pâtes farcies en un dîner gourmand','["1 petite courge musquée, pelée, graines jetées, chair coupée en petits cubes","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","petit paquet de sauge, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement","8 saucisses de bonne qualité","bonne noix de muscade râpée, environ ¼ d''une noix entière","350g de conchiglioni, voir ci-dessous","50g de beurre","50g de farine nature","850 ml de lait","50 g de parmesan râpé et un peu pour saupoudrer","100 g de fontina râpée ou 125 g de boule de mozzarella hachée","un filet d''huile de truffe"]','["Placez la courge dans un bol allant au micro-ondes avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Cuire au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez les feuilles de sauge et faites grésiller 1 min. Retirez les saucisses de leur peau et divisez-les en petites boules de la taille d''une noisette non décortiquée. Ajouter à la poêle et faire revenir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ajoutez la moitié de la courge et réservez. Écrasez le reste de la courge avec le liquide du bol, la muscade et l''assaisonnement.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7. Cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole, puis ajoutez la farine et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte. Cuire 1 à 2 minutes en remuant tout le temps, puis incorporer progressivement le lait jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse. Ajoutez la purée de courge, le parmesan et beaucoup d''assaisonnement. Ajoutez 3-4 cuillères à soupe de sauce au mélange à saucisses pour l''humidifier un peu.","Étalez le reste de la sauce à la courge sur le fond d''un grand plat peu profond allant au four. Égoutter les pâtes, mais garder un peu de liquide dans la poêle pour éviter que les coquilles ne collent entre elles. Sortez les morceaux de pâtes cassés de la poêle et répartissez-les sur la sauce. Alignez les coquilles sur le dessus, en les enfonçant dans la sauce de manière à ce que seul le dessus des coquilles dépasse. Remplissez chaque coquille avec le mélange de saucisses. Parsemez de fontina ou de mozzarella, râpez un peu de parmesan supplémentaire et arrosez d''un peu d''huile de truffe, si vous le souhaitez. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:07:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10794,7650,'fr','Ragoût de canard vénitien','La cannelle ajoute de la complexité à cette sauce pour pâtes mijotée, qui accompagne parfaitement les grosses pâtes tubulaires paccheri ou les rubans de pappardelle.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 cuisses de canard","2 oignons, finement hachés","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à café de farine nature","250 ml de vin rouge","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cube de bouillon de volaille, composé à 250 ml","3 brins de romarin, feuilles cueillies et hachées","2 feuilles de laurier","1 cuillère à café de sucre","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","600 g de pâtes paccheri ou pappardelle","Parmesan, râpé, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajoutez les cuisses de canard et faites-les dorer sur toutes les faces pendant environ 10 min. Retirer dans une assiette et réserver. Ajouter les oignons dans la poêle et cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore 1 minute, puis incorporer la cannelle et la farine et cuire encore 1 minute. Remettez le canard dans la poêle, ajoutez le vin, les tomates, le bouillon, les herbes, le sucre et l''assaisonnement. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez cuire 2 heures en remuant de temps en temps.","Retirez délicatement les cuisses de canard de la sauce et placez-les sur une assiette – elles seront très tendres alors essayez de ne rien perdre de la viande. Retirez et jetez la graisse, puis effilochez la viande avec 2 fourchettes et jetez les os. Remettez la viande dans la sauce avec le lait et laissez mijoter à découvert encore 10 à 15 minutes pendant la cuisson des pâtes.","Faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les en réservant une tasse d''eau pour les pâtes et ajoutez les pâtes au ragoût. Remuer pour enrober toutes les pâtes de sauce et cuire encore 1 min en ajoutant un peu de liquide de cuisson si elle semble sèche. Servir avec du parmesan râpé, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10795,7653,'fr','Saucisses italiennes et pâtes aux marrons','Un mélange de chair de saucisse et de morceaux de châtaignes crée une sauce pour pâtes riche et noisette, la faisant passer d''un plat de tous les jours à quelque chose de spécial.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, finement haché","Paquet de 450 g de saucisses Lincolnshire, viande essorée","200 g de châtaignes sous vide, en boîte ou en bocal, hachées très grossièrement (voir astuce ci-dessous)","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à café de romarin haché","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","1 verre de vin rouge corsé","500 g de purée en carton","500 g de grosses coquilles de pâtes ou pappardelles","petit paquet de persil frisé, finement haché","Personnalisez votre Payano Great, pour le service"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et\r\nfaire revenir l''oignon pendant 5 min. Une fois démarré\r\npour ramollir, ajoutez la chair à saucisse et\r\nchâtaignes et faire revenir encore 10-12 minutes,\r\ncasser la viande avec un bois\r\nspatule ou cuillère pendant que vous le faites frire. Gardez le\r\nchauffer assez fort et remuer souvent.","Quand la viande et les châtaignes sont\r\nbien doré, ajouter l''ail, le romarin\r\net les graines de fenouil, et laissez cuire 2 min\r\nplus. Plongez dans le vin, laissez-en la majeure partie\r\nfaire bouillir, puis verser la passata. Couverture\r\net laissez mijoter la sauce 10 minutes pendant\r\ntu fais bouillir les pâtes dans beaucoup de sel\r\neau, en suivant les instructions sur l’emballage.","Réservez une tasse de cuisson des pâtes\r\nl''eau, puis bien égoutter les pâtes. Lancer\r\nles pâtes, 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau, le ragoût\r\net la plupart du persil ensemble, puis\r\nassaisonner au goût. Partager entre les bols,\r\najoutez une mouture de poivre noir, le\r\nle persil restant, puis une poignée de\r\nCopeaux de parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:07:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10796,7655,'fr','Salade de poires effilées, fromage et bresaola','Une salade rustique avec du bœuf salé, du fromage bleu et de la chicorée associée à des poires douces et assaisonnée d''une vinaigrette au vin rouge','["100 g de moitiés de noix","2 poires croquantes, rose vif si possible","2 têtes de chicorée rouge ou radicchio, brisées en feuilles","100 g de bresaola (bœuf salé tranché finement)","140 g de dolcelatte ou votre fromage bleu à pâte molle local préféré, tranché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive vierge ou de colza","2 cuillères à soupe de vin rouge ou de porto","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Faire griller les noix et préparer la vinaigrette\r\nd’abord car ils devront refroidir. Chaleur\r\nfour à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettez le\r\nnoix sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faire griller pendant\r\n5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Cool. Mettez le\r\nvin ou Porto dans une petite casserole avec\r\nle vinaigre et le sucre. Faire bouillir 3 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement sirupeux (il épaissira au fur et à mesure\r\nça refroidit, alors ne vous emballez pas), alors\r\nretirer du feu et réserver.","Au moment de servir, raser de fines tranches\r\ndes poires à l''aide d''un grand couteau bien aiguisé,\r\nmandoline ou éplucheur de pommes de terre. Mélangez-les\r\navec les feuilles, la bresaola,\r\nfromage et noix sur un grand plateau.\r\nAssaisonner la vinaigrette, puis arroser\r\nla salade, suivie de l''huile. Profitez\r\ntout de suite."]','2026-01-11 00:07:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10797,7657,'fr','Boulettes de risotto à la margherita','Ces galettes d''arancini frites, à base de riz arborio aux tomates, ont un milieu de fromage mozzarella plus fondant.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","500 ml en purée","850 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","300 g de riz arborio","petit verre de vin blanc","25 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), râpé","noisette de beurre","3 cuillères à soupe de basilic haché grossièrement","125 g de boule de mozzarella coupée en 12 morceaux","75g de farine assaisonnée","2 oeufs, battus","125 g de chapelure séchée","1½ l d''huile pour la friture","fusée, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle à fond épais\r\ncasserole. Ajouter l''oignon, couvrir et faire suer\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Dans une autre poêle, mélangez la passata\r\net le bouillon, et réchauffer à feu doux.","Ajouter l''ail à l''oignon, cuire pendant\r\n30 secondes, puis versez le riz et remuez pour\r\nenrober d’huile. Augmentez le feu, versez\r\nle vin et laissez-le mijoter jusqu''à absorption.\r\nEn gardant la poêle sur feu moyen,\r\ncommencez à ajouter le mélange de bouillon de tomates\r\nau riz, une louche à la fois, en laissant le\r\nle riz absorbe la majeure partie du liquide après chaque\r\najout. Continuez à remuer au fur et à mesure, en ajoutant\r\nliquide jusqu''à ce que le riz soit al dente – vous pouvez\r\npas besoin de tout le liquide. Tu ne veux pas\r\nque ce soit aussi humide qu''un risotto normal,\r\nalors continuez à cuisiner jusqu''à ce que votre bois\r\nla cuillère peut y tenir debout. Éteignez le\r\nchauffer, incorporer le parmesan,\r\nbeurre et basilic, puis couvrir 5 min.\r\nAssaisonner et verser sur un plateau pour refroidir\r\ncomplètement, puis réfrigérer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme.","Façonnez le risotto en 12 grosses boules.\r\nFaites un trou au centre avec votre doigt\r\net farcir un morceau de mozzarella, puis\r\ntransformer en boule. Maintenant, commence un peu\r\nchaîne de production, trempant les boules dans le\r\nfarine, puis l''oeuf et enrober avec le\r\nchapelure – puis réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Chauffer l''huile à 160°C dans une grande poêle\r\ncasserole et chauffer le four à 180C/160 chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Faire frire les boules de risotto\r\npendant 8 à 10 minutes – vous devrez le faire dans\r\nlots. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant, puis\r\ntransférer sur un plateau et mettre au four pendant\r\n6 à 8 minutes pour être sûr que la mozzarella est\r\ncomplètement fondu. Saupoudrer de sel,\r\npuis laisser refroidir quelques instants\r\navant de déguster. Servir avec un peu\r\nfusée habillée."]','2026-01-11 00:07:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10798,4483,'fr','Amatriciana à la moelle au four','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. La moelle a une saveur douce, alors rehaussez-la avec une sauce tomate italienne piquante avec du bacon, du piment et du thym.','["1 courgette coupée en tranches de 6 cm d''épaisseur","125 g de boule de mozzarella râpée","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","Paquet de 125 g de cubes de bacon","1 gros oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","gros brin de thym","1 feuille de laurier","saupoudrer de sucre en poudre doré","2-3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","grand verre de vin rouge","pincée de flocons de piment séchés"]','["Pour la sauce, faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle\r\net faire grésiller la pancetta pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\ncommence tout juste à être croustillant. Ajoutez ensuite l''oignon,\r\nl''ail, le thym, le laurier et le sucre, et cuire\r\njusqu''à ce que les oignons soient dorés. Splash dans le\r\nvinaigre, grésiller un instant puis verser\r\nles tomates. Faites circuler le vin\r\nles boîtes de tomates à laver jusqu''au bout\r\nmordez et versez dans la sauce. Assaisonner avec\r\npiment et une pincée de sel et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit riche et épaisse.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à\r\n200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Retirez le\r\nmilieu de la moelle, en laissant un peu\r\nau fond pour former une base. Arrosez un plat allant au four d''un\r\nun peu d''huile, disposez la moelle dans le\r\nplat et rôtir pendant 30 minutes.","Verser la sauce au milieu de\r\nchaque tranche de moelle, couvrir de papier d''aluminium et\r\ncuire au four 30 mn. Retirez le papier d''aluminium, dispersez\r\nsur la mozzarella et remettre dans le\r\nfour pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit bien\r\nfondu et la moelle est tendre."]','2026-01-11 00:07:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10799,7659,'fr','Pizza Margherita en 4 étapes faciles','Même un cuisinier débutant peut maîtriser l''art de la pizza grâce à notre guide simple, étape par étape. Bellissimo','["300 g de farine à pain forte","1 cuillère à café de levure instantanée (en sachet ou en pot)","1 cuillère à café de sel","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","100 ml en purée","poignée de basilic frais ou 1 cuillère à café séchée","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","125 g de boule de mozzarella, tranchée","une poignée de parmesan râpé ou râpé","une poignée de tomates cerises, coupées en deux","une poignée de feuilles de basilic (facultatif)"]','["Préparez la base : mettez la farine dans un grand bol, puis incorporez la levure et le sel. Faites un puits, versez-y 200 ml d''eau tiède et l''huile d''olive et mélangez avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle et assez humide. Retourner sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrir pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse. Couvrir d''un torchon et réserver. Vous pouvez laisser lever la pâte si vous le souhaitez, mais ce n’est pas indispensable pour une croûte fine.","Préparez la sauce : mélangez la passata, le basilic et l''ail écrasé, puis assaisonnez au goût. Laisser reposer à\r\ntempérature ambiante pendant que vous façonnez la base.","Étalez la pâte : Si vous avez laissé lever la pâte, pétrissez-la rapidement, puis divisez-la en deux boules. Sur un plan fariné, étalez la pâte en gros ronds d''environ 25 cm de diamètre à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie. La pâte doit être très fine car elle va lever au four. Soulevez les ronds sur deux plaques à pâtisserie farinées.","Garnir et cuire : Chauffer le four à 240°C/chaleur tournante 220°C/gaz 8. Mettre une autre plaque à pâtisserie ou une plaque à pâtisserie retournée dans le four\r\nsur l''étagère du haut. Lisser la sauce sur les fonds avec le dos d''une cuillère. Parsemer de fromage et de tomates, arroser d''huile d''olive et assaisonner. Déposez une pizza, toujours sur sa plaque à pâtisserie, sur la plaque ou la plaque préchauffée. Cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ncroustillant. Servir avec un peu plus d''huile d''olive et des feuilles de basilic si vous en utilisez. Répétez l’étape pour le reste de la pizza."]','2026-01-11 00:07:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10800,7661,'fr','Pizzettas figues et jambon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Impressionnez lorsque vous recevez avec ces mini pizzas garnies de mozzarella crémeuse, de fruits sucrés et de jambon italien salé.','["noisette de beurre","3 échalotes, hachées finement","250 g de crème fraîche entière","50 g de parmesan finement râpé","4 figues mûres, coupées en morceaux","125 g de mozzarella de bufflonne de bonne qualité, grossièrement déchirée","2 poignées de fusée","6 tranches de prosciutto, déchirées en lanières","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à soupe de bon vinaigre balsamique","400 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sel","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Pour faire la pâte, mélangez la farine,\r\nlevure et sel dans un bol. Mesurer\r\n250 ml d''eau tiède dans une carafe, ajoutez\r\nl''huile, puis verser dans le mélange de farine. Mélanger\r\navec une cuillère en bois, suivi\r\npar vos mains, pour faire une pâte humide –\r\najoutez un peu d''eau tiède si nécessaire.\r\nCouvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé et laisser\r\ndans un endroit chaud pour se lever pendant 1 heure\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume. Faites chauffer le beurre,\r\npuis ramollissez les échalotes et réservez.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nVersez la pâte sur un plan fariné,\r\npétrir brièvement pour lisser, puis diviser en\r\n6-8 balles. Étalez chacun en un mince cercle,\r\npuis disposer sur une cuisson saupoudrée de farine\r\nfeuilles. Mélanger la crème fraîche, le parmesan\r\net échalotes avec un peu de sel et beaucoup\r\nde poivre noir. Répartir sur la pâte et enfourner pendant\r\n10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient croustillants\r\net légèrement gonflé.","Mélangez les figues et la mozzarella avec le\r\nfusée. Saupoudrer les pizzettas de\r\nle prosciutto. Mélangez l''huile et le vinaigre,\r\narroser les pizzettas et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10801,7663,'fr','Raviolis patates douces & chèvre','Les pâtes fraîches sont incroyablement satisfaisantes à préparer et bien plus faciles que vous ne le pensez','["2 patates douces","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille, plus un peu pour servir","125 g de fromage de chèvre émietté","semoule, pour saupoudrer","huile de piment, parmesan râpé, pour servir","300 g de farine pour pâtes ''00'', plus un peu pour pétrir et saupoudrer","3 gros œufs"]','["Pour la garniture, cuire au four, à la vapeur ou au micro-ondes.\r\npommes de terre, puis écrasez-les grossièrement. Mélanger avec\r\nles graines de courge et le fromage de chèvre.","Pour les pâtes, mettez la farine et une pincée de sel dans\r\nun robot culinaire et cassez les œufs.\r\nPulser jusqu''à ce que le mélange forme un aspect collant\r\ndes miettes. Versez le mélange sur un\r\nsurface légèrement farinée et réunir\r\npour former une pâte ferme. Pétrir 5 mn\r\njusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse, enveloppez-la dans du film alimentaire\r\nfilmer et réfrigérer 30 min. A réaliser à la main,\r\nfaçonner la farine en « anneau » sur un plan de travail,\r\ncasser les œufs au milieu, puis progressivement\r\nIncorporez la farine dans les œufs avec vos doigts.","Coupez les pâtes en quartiers, puis roulez-les\r\nsortir chaque morceau à l''aide d''une machine à pâtes.\r\nSaupoudrez de farine au fur et à mesure et déplacez-le\r\ndescendre d''un cran sur un réglage plus fin\r\nun rouleau sur deux. Continuez jusqu''à ce que vous obteniez\r\nà l’avant-dernier réglage. Si vous aimez votre\r\npâtes très fines et délicates, vous pouvez y aller\r\npour le réglage le plus fin. Si vous n''avez pas\r\nune machine, utilisez un rouleau à pâtisserie épais pour rouler\r\nla pâte le plus finement possible.","Découpez des ronds à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce à raviolis ou\r\nun emporte-pièce de 6 cm – travaillez vite donc\r\nles pâtes ne sèchent pas. Posez les cercles\r\nsur une surface saupoudrée de semoule et couvrir\r\navec du film alimentaire pendant que vous coupez le reste.","Déposez une petite cuillère à café de farce au centre\r\nde chaque tour. Amortir les bords\r\navec de l''eau, puis prenez un autre tour en sandwich\r\nen haut. Utilisez vos doigts pour sceller le\r\nbords, en essayant d''expulser tout l''air au fur et à mesure.\r\nDisposez les raviolis sur une plaque saupoudrée de semoule\r\nfaire sécher le torchon pendant quelques minutes.","Cuire doucement les raviolis dans une grande poêle\r\nfaire bouillir de l''eau salée pendant 4 à 5 minutes. Ne\r\nutilisez une ébullition complète car cela risque de faire\r\nraviolis fendus. Égoutter et servir avec un peu\r\nhuile de piment, parmesan et graines de citrouille."]','2026-01-11 00:07:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10802,7667,'fr','Chocolat, pistache & nougat mi-froid','Cette barre de glace italienne traditionnelle est la solution parfaite pour un dessert glacé et crémeux sans effort.','["beurre, pour le moule","75 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs moyens","250 g de chocolat noir finement haché","450 ml de crème fraîche","140 g de nougat dur ou de torrone, coupé en morceaux de ½ cm","50 g de pistaches hachées grossièrement"]','["Beurrer et tapisser un moule à pain de 900 g/2 lb de\r\nfilm alimentaire. Portez une casserole d''eau à feu doux\r\nlaisser mijoter. Mettez le sucre et les œufs dans un\r\nbol résistant à la chaleur, puis placez-le sur le\r\neau frémissante et fouetter jusqu''à pâleur,\r\népais et doublé de volume. Supprimer\r\nde la chaleur, plongez le fond de\r\nle bol dans l''eau froide et continuez\r\nen fouettant jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit refroidi.","Faire fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes\r\nBas, remuer, puis incorporer au mélange d''œufs.\r\nFouetter la crème en pics mous et plier\r\ndans le mélange d''œufs au chocolat avec le\r\nnougat et pistaches.","Versez le mélange dans le moule à cake,\r\nlisser la surface avec une cuillère, puis\r\ncouvrir et congeler jusqu''à consistance ferme. Cela peut être\r\nfait jusqu''à 2 semaines à l''avance. Pour servir,\r\ndémouler sur un plat de service, retirer\r\nle film alimentaire et laisser au réfrigérateur pendant\r\n15 minutes pour ramollir légèrement avant de trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:07:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10803,7669,'fr','Chasseur de lapin','« Cacciatore » signifie chasseur en italien et, même si nous le considérons désormais comme un plat de poulet, c''est une façon particulièrement bonne de cuisiner le lapin.','["900 g de morceaux de lapin","2 cuillères à soupe de farine assaisonnée de sel et de poivre","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, hachés","3 gousses d''ail, hachées","gros bouquet de persil, haché","300 ml de vin blanc","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates cerises","environ 20 grosses olives vertes","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre"]','["Mélangez le lapin dans la farine. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe\r\nhuile d''olive dans une grande poêle peu profonde et faire revenir\r\nle lapin en 3 lots, en ajoutant un autre\r\nà soupe d''huile pour chaque lot. Retirez tous les\r\nle lapin dans une assiette et réserver. Ajouter\r\nles oignons et l''ail dans la poêle avec le\r\nle reste de l''huile, puis cuire doucement 15 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajouter la majeure partie du persil\r\net laissez cuire encore quelques minutes. Renvoyez le\r\nlapin dans la poêle et verser le vin.\r\nAugmentez le feu et faites bouillonner le vin\r\njusqu''à moitié réduit, puis incorporer la cerise\r\ntomates. Si le lapin n''est pas complètement\r\ncouvert, ajoutez un peu d’eau.","Couvrir la poêle et laisser mijoter 40 mn\r\njusqu''à ce que le lapin soit tendre – le timing peut\r\nvarier, mais si c''est toujours difficile, continuez à\r\ncuire, en ajoutant plus d''eau si nécessaire, et\r\nla viande finira par arriver\r\nloin de l''os. Quand la viande est\r\nprêt, jetez les olives, couvrez et\r\nlaisser mijoter encore 5 à 10 minutes. Assaisonner avec\r\nsucre, sel et poivre, puis parsemer\r\navec le persil restant pour servir.\r\nServir avec de la polenta, de la purée ou un beurré,\r\npâtes plates, comme les tagliatelles"]','2026-01-11 00:07:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10804,7671,'fr','Soupe de légumes italienne','Réchauffez votre semaine avec cette soupe aux légumes bonne pour la santé et facile à congeler à l''avance','["2 oignons et 2 carottes de chaque, hachés","4 branches de céleri, hachées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 feuilles de laurier","quelques brins de thym","3 courgettes hachées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1,2 l de bouillon de légumes","100 g de parmesan ou équivalent végétarien, râpé","140 g de petites formes de pâtes","petit bouquet de basilic, râpé"]','["Cuire doucement l''oignon, les carottes et\r\ncéleri dans l''huile dans une grande casserole pendant\r\n20 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Splash dans l''eau s''ils\r\nbâton. Ajouter le sucre, l''ail, la purée, les herbes\r\net courgettes et cuire 4-5 minutes à feu vif\r\nà feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils dorent un peu.","Versez les haricots, les tomates et le bouillon,\r\npuis laissez mijoter 20 minutes. Si tu gèles\r\nlaissez-le refroidir et faites-le maintenant (congelez-le jusqu''à trois mois). Sinon, ajoutez la moitié du\r\nle parmesan et les pâtes et laisser mijoter pendant\r\n6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pâtes soient cuites. Saupoudrer de\r\nbasilic et le reste du parmesan pour servir.\r\nS''il est congelé, décongelez-le puis réchauffez-le avant\r\najouter les pâtes et le fromage et continuer\r\ncomme ci-dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:07:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10805,7673,'fr','Semifreddo aux pruneaux et amaretti','Une ondulation de purée de prune sucrée et des morceaux de biscuit aux amandes transforment cette glace italienne en un dessert tout-en-un','["450 g de prunes violettes mûres, coupées en deux et dénoyautées","350 g de sucre en poudre","2 gros blancs d''œufs","300 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de liqueur Disaronno","85 g de biscuits amaretti moelleux, grossièrement brisés"]','["Tapisser une plaque de 30 x 20 cm de film alimentaire.\r\nMettez les prunes dans une casserole avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau\r\net 110g de sucre. Couvrir avec un couvercle et\r\nfaire mijoter à feu moyen pendant 10 mn\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Laisser refroidir légèrement, puis mixer\r\navec un mixeur plongeant. Passer au tamis\r\npour retirer les peaux de prunes. Laisser refroidir.","Mettez le sucre restant dans une casserole avec\r\n150 ml d''eau et dissoudre à feu doux\r\nchaleur. Faire bouillir pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange\r\natteint 120°C sur un thermomètre de cuisson.","Pour réaliser le fond de meringue, fouettez\r\nles blancs d''oeufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes. Avec le\r\nbatteurs en marche, versez délicatement le\r\nmélange de sucre sur le blanc d''oeuf,\r\nen fouettant jusqu''à épaississement. Dans un autre bol,\r\nfouettez doucement la crème, puis pliez délicatement\r\ndans la liqueur, la pulpe de prune, les biscuits et\r\nla meringue. Verser dans le moule, couvrir\r\navec du film alimentaire et congeler quelques heures\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris. Pour servir, retirez du\r\ncongeler 5 minutes avant de former des boules."]','2026-01-11 00:07:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10806,7675,'fr','Tarte cottage italienne','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ajoutez un peu de « mamma mia » à un ragoût de bœuf avec de la pancetta et de l''origan, et une garniture croustillante de pommes de terre enrobées de parmesan.','["700 g de pommes de terre farineuses, tranchées","25g de beurre","50 g de parmesan râpé","140 g de pancetta ou lardons coupés en lanières","2 brins d''origan, feuilles pelées, ou 2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","½ quantité de bœuf au vin rouge et carottes (voir « Se marie bien avec »)"]','["Préparez d''abord le bœuf au vin rouge et aux carottes (voir « Se marie bien avec »). Vous aurez besoin de la moitié du ragoût fini pour cette recette.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nCuire les pommes de terre à l''ébullition, salées\r\narroser pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque cuit.\r\nBien égoutter, puis mélanger avec le beurre\r\net la moitié du parmesan.","Dans une grande casserole, faire revenir la pancetta\r\nou du bacon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Incorporer le frais\r\nfeuilles d''origan ou origan séché, puis\r\najouter le ragoût de bœuf et faire chauffer. Astuce\r\ndans un plat allant au four et garnir de\r\npommes de terre au fromage, en se chevauchant. Saupoudrer\r\navec le reste de parmesan et enfourner\r\npendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré et croustillant.\r\nServir avec une salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:07:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10807,5844,'fr','Cannellonis aux épinards et à la feta','Un plat faible en gras et riche en fer qui constitue un excellent repas en milieu de semaine pour toute la famille','["4 grandes feuilles de lasagnes sans précuisson (nous avons utilisé des lasagnes aux œufs frais Sainsbury''s en paquet de 250 g)","1 kg d''épinards surgelés, décongelés","Paquet de 200 g de fromage feta allégé","noix de muscade râpée généreusement","une grosse poignée d''olives dénoyautées et hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, rincées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","25 g de parmesan râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Mettre les feuilles de lasagnes dans un grand bol et couvrir d''eau bouillante. Faire tremper pendant 5 minutes ou préparer selon les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, pressez le plus d''eau possible des épinards, puis mélangez-les avec la feta, la muscade et un peu d''assaisonnement. Égouttez les pâtes, puis coupez chaque feuille en deux verticalement. Versez 4 cuillères à soupe de garniture au centre de chaque moitié, puis roulez pour enfermer. Placer dans un plat allant au four légèrement huilé.","Mélangez les olives, les câpres et les tomates dans un bol, assaisonnez, puis versez sur les cannellonis. Saupoudrer de parmesan,\r\ncouvrir de papier d''aluminium, puis enfourner pendant 20 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:07:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10808,7677,'fr','Haricots beurre italiens','Ce plat d''accompagnement sain donne une saveur méditerranéenne au poulet ou aux côtelettes grillées.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","400 g de tomates concassées en boîte","2 cuillères à café de sucre","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre rincés et égouttés","petit bouquet de basilic, haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne.\r\nFaites revenir l''ail pendant 1 min, puis ajoutez le\r\ntomates, sucre et un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nVersez les haricots et un peu d’eau.\r\nCouvrir et laisser mijoter 5 minutes, puis remuer\r\ndans le basilic et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10809,7679,'fr','Rouleaux d''aubergines aux épinards et à la ricotta','Cette variante de la « melanzane alla Parmigiana » italienne est rapide à préparer et constitue une pâtisserie végétarienne délicieusement crémeuse.','["2 aubergines coupées en fines tranches dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","500g d''épinards","Pot de 250 g de ricotta","râpe de muscade","Pot de 350 g de sauce tomate","4 cuillères à soupe de chapelure fraîche","4 cuillères à soupe de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne)"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7. Brosser\r\nles deux côtés des tranches d''aubergine avec\r\nhuile, puis déposer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Cuire au four\r\npendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à tendreté, en les retournant une fois.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les épinards dans un grand\r\npassoire et verser sur une bouilloire bouillante\r\nl''eau pour flétrir. Laisser refroidir, puis essorer le\r\nl''excès d''eau, pour qu''il soit sec. Mélanger avec le\r\nricotta, muscade et beaucoup d''assaisonnement.","Versez une cuillerée d''épinards au fromage\r\nmélanger au centre de chaque aubergine\r\ntrancher, replier pour former un paquet et déposer,\r\ncôté scellé vers le bas, dans un plat allant au four.\r\nVerser sur la sauce tomate, saupoudrer de\r\nchapelure et fromage, et enfournez pendant\r\n20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et très chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:07:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10810,7681,'fr','Tagliata d''agneau au cresson et tomates','Traditionnellement, ce plat italien utilise du bœuf tranché finement, de la roquette et du parmesan, mais cette version est revisitée simplement avec des produits de saison britanniques.','["une poignée de romarin frais, aiguilles hachées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","4 steaks épais de gigot d''agneau britannique désossé ou des steaks coupés dans des croupes d''agneau (environ 450 g/1 lb au total)","250 g de petites tomates italiennes britanniques","1 cuillère à soupe de gelée de groseille","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres, égouttées et rincées","Sachet de 100 g de cresson britannique, tiges épaisses retirées","100 g de fromage feta émietté","du bon pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Frottez le romarin et 1 cuillère à soupe de\r\nhuiler l''agneau et laisser mariner\r\npendant 30 minutes à température ambiante.","Faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude. Essuyer\r\nla majeure partie du romarin de l''agneau,\r\npuis assaisonnez abondamment les steaks\r\nde sel feuilleté et de noir fraîchement moulu\r\npoivre. Ajoutez les steaks et le\r\ntomates dans la poêle. Saisir la viande pour\r\n2 minutes d''un côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, puis\r\nretourner et cuire encore 2 minutes. Cela va\r\ndonne de l''agneau rose. Transférez la viande et\r\ntomates dans une assiette et laisser reposer.","Retirez la casserole du feu. Verser à la cuillère\r\nla gelée de groseille, verser le vinaigre\r\net le reste de l''huile, puis fouetter pour obtenir\r\nun pansement chaud. Ajoutez les câpres, plus\r\nle jus de l''assiette d''agneau.","Coupez l''agneau en tranches épaisses en biais.\r\nRépartir sur une grande assiette avec le\r\ncresson et tomates, puis terminer\r\navec un émiettage de fromage. Verser dessus\r\nla vinaigrette chaude et profite directement\r\navec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:07:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10811,7685,'fr','Zabaglione aux mûres','Le sabayon italien est délicieux, agrémenté de quelques baies écrasées pour un dessert rapide et exceptionnel.','["400g de mûres","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","6 jaunes d''œufs","1 gousse de vanille","3 cuillères à soupe de marsala ou de vin doux"]','["Dans un bol, écrasez légèrement les baies avec\r\n25g de sucre. Ajoutez-en une cuillerée à\r\nfond de 6 petits verres, puis réglez le\r\nréserver le reste du mélange de baies.","Portez un peu d''eau à ébullition douce\r\nune casserole de taille moyenne et versez l''œuf\r\njaunes dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur. Réduire de moitié\r\net grattez les graines de la vanille\r\ngousse dans les jaunes d''œufs et ajoutez le\r\nsucre restant. A l''aide d''un fouet électrique,\r\nbattre jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et aéré. Splash dans le\r\nMarsala, placez le bol sur la poêle de\r\neau frémissante, puis fouettez votre cœur\r\nlaisser dehors pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que les jaunes d''œufs soient\r\népais et mousseux et le fouet laisse un\r\nsentier défini. Égoutter une partie du jus,\r\npuis faites passer les baies restantes à travers\r\nla mousse et la verser dans les verres."]','2026-01-11 00:07:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10812,7687,'fr','Café affogato (Glace vanille & café)','Cette combinaison paradisiaque est si simple – mais impressionnante','["12 boules de glace vanille de bonne qualité","6 shots de café expresso chaud"]','["Plusieurs heures à l''avance, déposez la glace\r\nun plateau allant au congélateur et placez le plateau\r\nremettre au congélateur.","Pour servir, déposez des boules de glace dans\r\n6 petits verres ou bols, et versez-en un\r\nune dose de café expresso chaud\r\nchacun. Servir aussitôt en remuant le\r\nglace à la vanille dans le café chaud\r\npour qu''il fonde un peu."]','2026-01-11 00:07:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10813,7689,'fr','Génoise abricot & ratafia','Un gâteau aux fruits simple parfumé aux amandes et aux biscuits Amaretti – parfait avec du thé ou en dessert servi avec de la crème ou de la crème anglaise','["200 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de sucre en poudre","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","4 gros œufs","½-1 cuillère à café d''essence d''amande (facultatif)","Boîte de 410 g de moitiés d''abricots au jus naturel, égouttées, 100 g hachées grossièrement, le reste coupé en deux","85g de biscuits ratafia ou amaretti (conserver les rats entiers ou casser les bitters)","25g d''amandes effilées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer le fond et les côtés d''un 22 cm\r\nmoule à gâteau à fond mobile et tapisser de\r\npapier sulfurisé.","Mettez le beurre, le sucre, la farine et la pâtisserie\r\npoudre dans un grand bol. Pause dans le\r\nles œufs, ajouter l''essence d''amande, si vous en utilisez,\r\npuis battre avec un batteur électrique jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse et crémeux. Réservez un quart\r\ndu mélange, puis remuez le haché\r\nabricots et 25 g de biscuits dans le\r\nreste. Verser dans le moule et légèrement\r\nlisser avec le dos de la cuillère. Cuire au four\r\npendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit presque pris.\r\nPendant ce temps, remuez les moitiés d''abricots,\r\nreste de biscuits et amandes effilées\r\ndans le mélange à gâteau réservé jusqu''à ce que ce soit bien\r\nmixte. Parsemez rapidement le mélange à gâteau supplémentaire\r\nsur le gâteau précuit, puis remettez-le\r\nau four pendant 20 minutes supplémentaires ou jusqu''à ce qu''une\r\nbrochette insérée au centre du\r\nle gâteau en ressort propre."]','2026-01-11 00:07:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10814,7691,'fr','Poulet farci à l''italienne','Les recettes de poulet sont toujours parmi les plus recherchées sur bbcgoodfood.com, c''est pourquoi l''équipe de cuisine a spécialement imaginé ce plat de souper rapide et facile.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''olives hachées ou de tomates séchées - tout ce que vous avez","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées séchées","Pot de 200 g de fromage à pâte molle entière","4 poitrines de poulet dodues, désossées et sans peau","4 tomates mûres, tranchées","huile d''olive, pour arroser"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7.\r\nBattre les olives ou les tomates séchées,\r\nl''ail et presque toutes les herbes dans le\r\nfromage, puis assaisonner. Découpez une fente le long du\r\ncôté de chaque poitrine de poulet, puis utilisez\r\nvotre couteau pour l’ouvrir dans une poche.","Farcir chaque poitrine avec un quart de\r\nle mélange de fromages, puis appuyer pour fermer. Ascenseur\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie graissée. Assaisonner le\r\ndessus du poulet, puis superposer la tomate\r\ntranches sur le dessus de chaque morceau de\r\npoulet. Assaisonner, puis parsemer de\r\nherbes restantes. Arroser d''huile d''olive.","Rôtir pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet\r\nest doré sur les bords et le\r\nles tomates ont l''air un peu ratatinées. Servir\r\navec une salade verte et du pain croustillant\r\npour éponger les jus."]','2026-01-11 00:07:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10815,7693,'fr','Salade de riz rapide à la japonaise','Utilisez les restes de riz pour préparer une salade remplie de crevettes, de haricots edamame, de radis, de concombre, d''avocat et d''oignons nouveaux, le tout mélangé à une vinaigrette au mirin et au gingembre.','["250 g de riz basmati cuit","150 g de gambas cuites et décortiquées","¼ de concombre , coupé en dés","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés","50 g de haricots edamame, décongelés s''ils sont congelés","6 radis , hachés","½ avocat, coupé en dés","graines de sésame noir, pour servir (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame grillé","1 cuillère à soupe de mirin","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre mariné"]','["Fouetter les ingrédients de la vinaigrette ensemble dans un petit bol.","Si vous utilisez un sachet, faites chauffer le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis versez-le dans un bol, cassez-le et laissez-le refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste chaud. Vous pouvez également utiliser des restes de riz froids. Remuez-le, puis ajoutez la moitié de la vinaigrette et mélangez.","Ajoutez les crevettes et les légumes et mélangez à nouveau. Répartir dans deux assiettes et verser sur le reste de la vinaigrette. Saupoudrer de graines de sésame noires pour garnir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10816,7695,'fr','Curry de poulet à la japonaise','Associez une sauce au curry facile et réconfortante à notre poulet en saumure tendre et juteux pour préparer un curry de poulet à la japonaise – servez avec du riz blanc et des cornichons japonais','["1 poulet rôti préparé (voir recette ci-dessous)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 oignons, tranchés épaissement","2 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","25 g de gingembre pelé et râpé","45g de beurre doux","30g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","½ cuillère à café de garam masala","850 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin de riz","500 g de pommes de terre Maris Piper, coupées en huitièmes","3 grosses carottes, tranchées en diagonale","riz blanc à grains courts cuit","oignons nouveaux tranchés","cornichons japonais (facultatif)"]','["Pour la sauce, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte ou une poêle anti-flamme à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Incorporer l''ail et le gingembre et cuire doucement pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Ajouter le beurre et, une fois grésillant, incorporer la farine, la poudre de curry et le garam masala. Cuire pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange ait une couleur foncée. Versez progressivement le bouillon en remuant bien après chaque ajout.","Portez à légère ébullition et ajoutez la sauce soja, le miel et le vinaigre. Incorporer les pommes de terre et les carottes, puis couvrir et laisser mijoter environ 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe et que les légumes soient cuits. Assaisonnez au goût, en ajoutant un peu de bouillon s’il est trop épais. Trancher le poulet et servir avec le riz. Verser la sauce et parsemer d''oignons nouveaux. Servir avec des cornichons japonais, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10817,7697,'fr','Glace au matcha mochi','Préparez une glace végétalienne avec du tofu, de la crème de coco et du matcha, puis enveloppez-la dans une pâte mochi moelleuse pour cette gourmandise sucrée venue du Japon.','["300 g de tofu doux et soyeux bio, égoutté","320 g de crème de coco","1 cuillère à café de pâte de vanille","1 cuillère à café de poudre d''arrow-root (facultatif)","60 ml de sirop d''érable","35 g de maïzena, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de poudre de matcha","100 g de farine de riz blanc sucré gluant","80 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Pour faire la glace, mettez tous les ingrédients dans un blender et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Refroidissez le mélange pendant au moins 1 heure ou toute la nuit. Sortez du réfrigérateur, remuez et versez dans une sorbetière et barattez pendant 45 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit épaisse et congelée. Vous pouvez également verser dans un récipient congelable et congeler pendant 90 minutes. Sortir du congélateur et fouetter le mélange, congeler encore 45 minutes, puis fouetter à nouveau le mélange. Remettez-le au congélateur pendant encore 30 minutes. Répétez cette opération 2 à 3 fois de plus, en congelant pendant 30 minutes à chaque fois. Ensuite, congelez pendant 2-3 heures finales.","Sortez la glace du congélateur pour la ramollir légèrement, puis utilisez une cuillère à glace de 5 cm pour réaliser 8 boules. Disposez-les sur une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé, puis congelez-les au moins 30 minutes ou toute la nuit. Si elles sont difficiles à ramasser, laissez la glace ramollir quelques minutes ou utilisez vos mains pour façonner les boules.","Saupoudrez une plaque à pâtisserie de 30 x 20 cm avec la moitié de la maïzena. Versez 200 ml d''eau dans une casserole de 1 litre avec la poudre de matcha. Mélangez bien, puis ajoutez la farine de riz et le sucre semoule et faites chauffer sur feu moyen. Utilisez un fouet pour briser les grumeaux, puis passez à l''aspatule lorsqu''elle commence à épaissir après 2-3 minutes. Remuer rapidement pendant encore 30 secondes jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à se former comme une boule de pâte collante.","Transférez la pâte sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée et aplatissez-la soigneusement avec la spatule. Une fois suffisamment refroidi au toucher, saupoudrez le reste de farine de maïs et utilisez vos mains pour aplatir à peu près la taille du plateau. Laisser refroidir, couvrir et conserver au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à trois jours.","Étalez la pâte à mochi sur une planche à découper sèche saupoudrée d''un peu de maïzena supplémentaire jusqu''à obtenir une épaisseur de 5 mm. Découpez des cercles de 10 cm à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce ou d''une tasse. Placez une boule de glace sur un cercle de pâte, puis repliez délicatement la pâte autour de la glace en pinçant le haut pour sceller, puis retournez pour que le haut devienne le bas. (Ce sera plus facile si vous saupoudrez vos mains de farine de maïs.) Répétez jusqu''à ce que toute la crème glacée et la pâte soient utilisées, puis congelez-les pendant au moins 2 heures avant de servir. Se conservera congelé jusqu''à un mois. Sortez le mochi du congélateur et laissez-le ramollir à température ambiante pendant environ 3 à 5 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10818,7699,'fr','Riz à sushi parfait','Apprenez à préparer un riz à sushi parfait avec cette recette simple étape par étape. Préparez un lot et créez votre propre plateau de sélection de sushis pour vous divertir','["120 ml de vinaigre de riz ou de vinaigre de riz brun","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre","450g de riz japonais (3 tasses japonaises)"]','["Pour faire le riz, lavez-le d''abord soigneusement dans une passoire pendant 4 minutes en le retournant délicatement à la main jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire. Égouttez le riz et mettez-le dans une casserole avec 540 ml d''eau.","Laissez reposer minimum 30 minutes. Il peut être laissé toute la nuit, mais pour de meilleurs résultats, laissez-le pendant 30 minutes à 1 heure. Laissez l''eau de trempage dans la casserole avec le riz et portez à ébullition, mettez le couvercle, réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter 8 à 9 minutes. Éteignez le feu et laissez reposer avec le couvercle pendant encore 5 minutes. Ne soulevez pas le couvercle.","Pendant que le riz cuit, pour préparer le sushi-su, mettez le vinaigre de riz, le sucre et 1 cuillère à soupe de sel dans une casserole et laissez sur feu doux jusqu''à ce que le sucre et le sel soient dissous. Faites attention à ne pas le laisser bouillir, sinon la saveur se gâterait. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Mettez le riz dans un plat large et plat comme un sushi oke, un plat allant au four ou une plaque à rôtir. Versez le sushi-su sur le riz et incorporez-le délicatement au riz avec une cuillère en bois pendant qu''il refroidit, en faisant attention de ne pas endommager les grains. Vous pouvez utiliser un ventilateur ou un sèche-cheveux sur le réglage le plus froid pour accélérer le processus de refroidissement, en le dirigeant vers le riz. Le sushi-su donne au riz plus de saveur et cet aspect glacé collant familier.","Si vous ne souhaitez pas utiliser le riz immédiatement, couvrez-le d''un chiffon humide pour qu''il ne sèche pas. Laisser dans un endroit frais, mais ne pas réfrigérer. Le réfrigérateur rendra le riz dur et sec, et le sushi-su aidera à conserver le riz sans réfrigération. Se conservera une journée."]','2026-01-11 00:07:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10819,7701,'fr','Riz à sushi','Préparez du riz à sushi pour accompagner vos plats d''inspiration japonaise préférés, des boîtes à bento aux sushis et au curry katsu. Le secret réside dans le rapport riz/eau','["1 tasse de riz à sushi (environ 220 g)","assaisonnement pour riz à sushi, au goût (facultatif)"]','["La chose la plus importante à prendre en compte lors de la cuisson du riz à sushi est le rapport riz/eau. Il est préférable d’utiliser une mesure de volume plutôt que de peser. Utilisez une tasse à mesurer de 250 ml d''un cuisinier si vous en avez une, ou un petit verre, une tasse à thé ou une petite tasse. Une fois que vous aurez préparé un lot, vous saurez quelle quantité de riz cuit cette mesure donne – elle devrait être d’environ 2½ tasses.","Mesurez 1 tasse de riz dans une casserole, rincez le riz en le faisant tourner autour de la casserole, puis égouttez l''eau. Essayez de ne rien perdre du riz. Ajoutez 1½ tasse d''eau (environ 375 ml).","Portez rapidement le riz à ébullition, mettez un couvercle hermétique et réduisez le feu à doux. Cuire 13 minutes – ne pas retirer le couvercle.","Vérifiez quelques grains en haut – le riz doit être presque cuit et l’eau s’est évaporée. Sinon, continuez la cuisson et vérifiez toutes les 2 minutes, chaque marque de riz sera différente. Éteignez le feu et laissez le riz reposer avec le couvercle pendant 10 minutes afin que toute l''humidité soit absorbée. Ajoutez l''assaisonnement pour riz à sushi, si vous le souhaitez, et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10820,7703,'fr','Curry katsu végétalien','Savourez une version végétalienne du curry katsu, avec du tofu croustillant et doré. Servir avec du riz, des herbes fraîches et des rubans de concombre et de carotte','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza ou d''huile végétale","200g de riz cuit (nous avons utilisé du basmati)","¼ gros concombre, pelé en rubans","1 carotte, pelée en rubans","une poignée de feuilles de menthe ou de feuilles de coriandre, ou les deux","quartiers de lime, pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza ou d''huile végétale","1 oignon, haché","1 grosse carotte, hachée","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cm de gingembre pelé et râpé ou finement haché","½ cuillère à soupe de curry en poudre, doux ou moyen","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","200 ml de lait de coco","2 cuillères à café de sirop d''érable (ou de miel si vous ne cuisinez pas pour les végétaliens)","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","280-300 g de tofu ferme en bloc","200g de chapelure séchée, nous avons utilisé du panko (sans gluten si nécessaire)"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la sauce curry. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir l''oignon et la carotte jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à caraméliser, environ 8 minutes. Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et faites grésiller pendant environ une minute, puis incorporez la poudre de curry et le curcuma. Une fois les épices bien chaudes, ajoutez le lait de coco, le sirop d''érable et 100 ml d''eau. Assaisonnez bien, couvrez et laissez mijoter à feu doux pendant 20 minutes, en ajoutant de l''eau si le mélange devient trop épais.","Pendant ce temps, coupez le tofu en deux au centre. Coupez soigneusement chaque morceau en quatre triangles. Dans un grand bol, mélangez la maïzena avec 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et un peu d''assaisonnement jusqu''à homogénéité. Mettez la chapelure dans un deuxième bol. Trempez un morceau de tofu dans le mélange de farine, puis dans la chapelure en retournant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien enrobé. Si les miettes ne collent pas bien, épaississez un peu le mélange de maïzena et réessayez. Appuyez fermement.","Lorsque la carotte dans la sauce au curry est tendre, mixez-la à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant ou d''un mixeur de table. Si la sauce est trop épaisse, ajoutez un peu d''eau. Goûtez et ajoutez plus de sel, de sirop d''érable ou du jus de citron vert, si vous le souhaitez. Gardez au chaud.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites cuire le tofu 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bien chaud. Pour servir, mettre le riz dans des bols et garnir de sauce au curry, de tofu croustillant, de rubans de concombre et de carotte, d''herbes et de quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:07:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10821,5700,'fr','Salade de riz au poulet et au wasabi','Utilisez les restes de poulet pour préparer ce bol de riz facile pour le déjeuner. Avec une vinaigrette percutante au wasabi, au citron vert et au yaourt, c''est plein de saveur et sain aussi','["70 g d''edamames surgelés","½ cuillère à café de pâte de wasabi","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature sans gras","1 citron vert, jus","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","70g de riz cuit","3 radis, coupés en quartiers","1 cuillère à café de graines de sésame","1 poitrine de poulet cuite, désossée et sans peau, tranchée","¼ feuille d''algues séchées, coupées en lanières"]','["Mettez les edamames dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et couvrez d''eau bouillante. Laissez reposer 10 min, puis égouttez. Mélangez la pâte de wasabi avec le yaourt, le jus de citron vert et l''huile de sésame.","Mélangez le riz avec les edamames et les radis. Garnir de graines de sésame, de poulet et d''algues, puis arroser de vinaigrette pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10822,4173,'fr','Soupe de nouilles aux champignons miso et au tofu','Préparez cette soupe de nouilles miso, champignons et tofu avec seulement six ingrédients simples. Sain et faible en calories, il constitue un délicieux déjeuner ou dîner léger.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","70 g de champignons mélangés, tranchés","50 g de tofu fumé coupé en petits cubes","½ cuillère à soupe de pâte miso de riz brun","50 g de sarrasin séché ou de nouilles aux œufs","2 oignons nouveaux, émincés"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen. Ajouter les champignons et faire revenir pendant 5 à 6 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Transférer dans un bol à l’aide d’une écumoire et réserver. Ajoutez le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et faites frire le tofu pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément doré.","Mélangez la pâte miso avec 325 ml d''eau bouillante dans un pichet. Faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les et transférez-les dans un bol. Garnir de champignons et de tofu, puis verser sur le bouillon miso. Répartir les oignons nouveaux juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10823,7705,'fr','Oeufs farcis au furikake','Essayez le furikake, un assaisonnement japonais, dans ce canapé rétro simple avec un soupçon de wasabi et de gingembre mariné. L''assaisonnement est traditionnellement saupoudré sur le riz','["6 gros œufs","2 oignons nouveaux, parés","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise Kewpie (disponible chez Sainsbury''s, Waitrose et en ligne) ou de crème à salade","2 cuillères à café de pâte de wasabi","½ cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre à sushi mariné, finement tranché, plus 1 cuillère à café de vinaigre du pot","3 cuillères à soupe de furikake (disponible en ligne), plus une pincée"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d’eau, puis plongez-y délicatement les œufs. Laisser mijoter 10 minutes, puis transférer dans un bol d''eau glacée pour refroidir. Pendant ce temps, coupez finement les oignons nouveaux en brins longs et fins et ajoutez-les à l''eau glacée avec les œufs. Ils tourneront en spirale et se recroquevilleront dans le froid.","Épluchez les œufs et coupez-les en deux dans le sens de la longueur. À l''aide d''une cuillère à café, versez les jaunes d''œufs dans un bol, ajoutez la mayonnaise, le wasabi, l''huile de sésame, le vinaigre de gingembre et un peu de sel et de poivre, et écrasez-les avec une fourchette jusqu''à consistance lisse. Pour une texture plus onctueuse, mixez à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir un mélange fluide.","Mettez le furikake dans une petite assiette et plongez les moitiés d''œufs, côté arrondi vers le bas, dans l''assaisonnement pour qu''elles collent au blanc de l''œuf. Versez ou versez le mélange de jaune d''œuf au milieu, puis garnissez de gingembre mariné. Séchez l''oignon nouveau avec du papier absorbant, puis utilisez-le pour décorer les œufs avec une pincée de furikake supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:07:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10824,7707,'fr','Soupe miso','Préparez votre propre soupe miso avec des cubes de tofu moelleux, des boucles d''algues croquantes et des oignons nouveaux aromatiques. Dégustez-le en entrée ou en collation','["5 g d''algues wakame séchées","1l de dashi (acheté en magasin ou voir conseil)","200 g de tofu frais soyeux, ou ferme si vous préférez, coupé en cubes de 1 cm","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso blanche","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso rouge","oignon nouveau, finement haché, pour servir"]','["Mettez le wakame dans un petit bol et couvrez d''eau froide, puis laissez-le reposer 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les feuilles soient complètement développées.","Préparez le dashi (voir conseil ci-dessous) ou faites chauffer jusqu''à ébullition. Ajoutez le tofu et laissez cuire 1 min avant d''ajouter les algues.","Réduisez le feu. Mettez les deux types de miso dans une louche ou une passoire et plongez-les dans la casserole. Détendez lentement le miso avec une cuillère à l''intérieur de la louche ou de la passoire ; la pâte fondra lentement dans le dashi. Une fois que tout le miso est dissous dans la soupe, éteignez immédiatement le feu. Saupoudrer d''oignons nouveaux hachés pour ajouter de la couleur et du parfum."]','2026-01-11 00:07:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10825,7709,'fr','Curry de poulet katsu de niveau supérieur','Préparez ce plat d''inspiration japonaise composé de poulet croquant et d''une sauce riche et chaleureusement épicée. Notre version ultime est facile à préparer mais regorge de saveurs','["2 grosses poitrines de poulet","400 ml de lait","100 g de farine nature","2 oeufs, battus","150 g de chapelure panko ou de chapelure grossièrement séchée","saupoudrer de shichimi togarashi ou de chili power, et un peu plus pour servir","un peu de sauce soja","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","50g de beurre","1 grosse carotte, hachée","1 oignon, haché","4 gousses d''ail, hachées","gros morceau de gingembre, haché","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry doux","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à soupe de ketchup","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte miso rouge ou brune","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","chou blanc râpé, nori râpé, graines de sésame et riz cuit, pour servir"]','["Coupez chaque poitrine de poulet en deux dans le sens de la longueur, créant ainsi quatre filets. Disposez chaque filet entre deux feuilles de papier sulfurisé et battez avec un rouleau à pâtisserie pour égaliser l''épaisseur.","Versez le lait dans un bol et assaisonnez avec une grosse pincée de sel, puis ajoutez les filets de poulet. Couvrir et laisser au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 20 minutes ou jusqu''à 24 heures (plus vous laissez le poulet dans le lait longtemps, plus il sera succulent).","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à enrober le poulet, versez la farine, les œufs et la chapelure dans trois bols séparés, puis assaisonnez la farine avec le togarashi et incorporez la sauce soja aux œufs. Retirer un filet de poulet du lait et l''enrober du mélange de farine, puis le tremper dans le mélange d''œufs et l''enrober de chapelure. Dresser sur une assiette et répéter avec le reste des filets de poulet. Peut être préparé jusqu''à un jour à l''avance et congelé jusqu''à un mois.","Pour faire la sauce curry, faites chauffer le beurre dans une casserole et faites grésiller la carotte et l''oignon pendant 5 minutes, puis ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes. Répartir la poudre de curry et cuire 1 min, puis incorporer le miel, le ketchup, la pâte miso et la sauce soja pour créer une pâte collante. Cuire encore 1 min, puis verser 700 ml d''eau bouillante et émietter dans le cube de bouillon. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la carotte soit tendre. Versez la sauce dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit complètement lisse (vous pouvez également utiliser un mixeur plongeant). Assaisonner au goût. Peut être préparé jusqu''à trois jours à l''avance et réfrigéré ou congelé jusqu''à trois mois.","Pour cuire le katsu, faites chauffer une bonne couche d''huile dans une grande poêle, puis ajoutez autant de filets de poulet que possible et faites-les frire pendant 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés et croustillants. Transférer sur une plaque et réserver au chaud à four doux pendant que vous cuisez les filets restants.","Mélangez le chou et les algues et saupoudrez de quelques graines de sésame, si vous en utilisez. Garnir le katsu de sauce au curry et servir avec du riz et de la salade, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10826,7711,'fr','Porc Katsu au riz gluant','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Panez votre filet de porc avec du panko, à la japonaise, puis servez-le avec une sauce au curry légère, sucrée et épicée et du riz à sushi.','["200 g de riz à grains courts ou à sushi, rincé","100 g de chapelure panko","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 blanc d''oeuf","450 g de filet de porc paré et coupé en 8 morceaux","brins de coriandre, pour garnir (facultatif)","gingembre mariné, pour servir (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, haché","1 carotte moyenne, râpée","2 pommes à manger, comme Braeburn, pelées, évidées et hachées grossièrement","2 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées","2 cuillères à café de poudre de curry moyenne","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à café de miel clair","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","350 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame"]','["Pour faire la sauce, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et ajoutez l''oignon, la carotte et les pommes. Couvrir et cuire doucement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli, en remuant plusieurs fois. Découvrez la poêle, augmentez le feu, ajoutez l''ail et laissez cuire 1 min.","Incorporer la poudre de curry et le gingembre. Cuire encore 1 min, puis incorporer le concentré de tomates, le miel, le soja et la maïzena. Incorporer progressivement le bouillon et laisser mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient totalement tendres et que la sauce épaississe. Mixez au mixeur ou au mixeur jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis assaisonnez au goût avec l''huile de sésame, le sel et le poivre. La sauce peut être préparée jusqu''à 3 jours à l''avance.","Pendant que la sauce cuit, mettez le porc entre 2 feuilles de film alimentaire et écrasez-le avec un rouleau à pâtisserie jusqu''à ce que la viande atteigne environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Dans un bol peu profond, frottez ensemble la chapelure, le curcuma et l''huile avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Battez le blanc d''œuf à la fourchette jusqu''à ce qu''il soit un peu mousseux et préparez une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive.","Mettez le riz dans une casserole avec 400 ml d''eau froide et une pincée de sel. Portez à ébullition, couvrez, puis laissez mijoter 10 min. Retirer du feu et réserver jusqu''au moment de servir le porc.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tremper chaque morceau de porc dans l''œuf, puis dans la chapelure en les pressant sur la surface avant de transférer la viande dans la plaque. Cuire le porc au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant, en le retournant une fois si nécessaire. Servir avec le riz et la sauce katsu, garnis de coriandre, le cas échéant, et de gingembre mariné, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10827,7713,'fr','Riz brun à la japonaise','Un accompagnement simple et sain de riz brun servi avec du gingembre, de l''ail, des oignons nouveaux, de la sauce soja et des graines de soja','["250 g de riz brun","175 g de graines de soja surgelées","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à café de gingembre finement râpé","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement en diagonale"]','["Cuire le riz brun suivant le pack\r\ninstructions, en ajoutant les graines de soja pour\r\nles 2 dernières minutes de cuisson. Pendant ce temps,\r\nmélanger la sauce soja, l''huile d''olive,\r\ngingembre et ail.","Égouttez le riz et les haricots cuits,\r\ntransférer dans un bol de service et remuer\r\ndans le mélange de sauce soja. Dispersion\r\navec les oignons nouveaux et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10828,7715,'fr','Boîte à bento de style japonais','Cette boîte à lunch d''inspiration asiatique avec des sushis au maquereau, des haricots edamame et des fruits frais vous tiendra en haleine tout l''après-midi','["100 g d''edamame frais dans les cosses (ou de graines de soja surgelées)","une poignée de votre fruit préféré, comme de l''ananas frais, des myrtilles ou des fraises","100 g de riz à sushi","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","1 feuille de nori","1 filet de maquereau fumé d''environ 75g, émietté","1 cuillère à soupe de mayonnaise légère","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés","une goutte de wasabi de la taille d''un pois (facultatif)","¼ poivron rouge, tranché finement dans le sens de la longueur, environ 6 tranches"]','["Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition et faites cuire le\r\nedamame pendant 3-4 minutes (ou 1-2 minutes si vous utilisez du surgelé)\r\ngraines de soja) jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Égoutter, saupoudrer de sel\r\net mettre de côté.","Bien rincer le riz à l''eau froide jusqu''à ce que l''eau\r\nest clair. Mettez le riz dans une poêle à fond épais avec\r\nun couvercle hermétique et couvrir de 200 ml d’eau.\r\nPortez juste à ébullition, puis mettez le couvercle, tournez le\r\nchauffer au minimum et cuire 15 à 20 minutes,\r\njusqu''à ce que le liquide soit absorbé. Supprimer du\r\nchauffer et laisser avec le couvercle pendant encore 10 minutes.","Verser le riz cuit dans un grand bol et\r\nlaisser refroidir un peu. Mélangez le vinaigre de riz,\r\nsucre et une petite pincée de sel, jusqu''à ce que le sucre\r\net le sel se dissout. Mélangez-le au riz refroidi.\r\nPosez la feuille de nori sur un tapis ou une feuille à rouler à sushi\r\nde film alimentaire. Avec les mains humides, étalez le riz\r\nsur les deux tiers de la feuille de nori.","Mélangez le maquereau fumé, la mayonnaise et\r\noignons nouveaux, assaisonnez bien avec du poivre noir.\r\nÉtalez une ligne de wasabi au milieu du\r\ndu riz, le cas échéant, et une couche sur les morceaux de poivron rouge,\r\npuis le mélange de poisson. Roulez les sushis en commençant\r\nde la fin recouverte de riz. Humidifiez le\r\nextrémité découverte pour l’aider à coller. Couper en environ\r\nPièces de 6 x 3 cm d''épaisseur.","Mettez les rouleaux de sushi dans une boîte à bento ou\r\nboîte à lunch, en ajoutant les edamames et les fruits\r\nvers les autres compartiments."]','2026-01-11 00:07:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10829,7717,'fr','Tempura de légumes avec sauce soja et trempette','Ces friandises croustillantes de style japonais sont parfaites pour les amuse-gueules ou un plat principal végétarien.','["100 g (environ) chacun d''un mélange de légumes fermes, coupés en bouchées, comme l''aubergine, le brocoli, la courgette, les champignons, le poivron rouge et les patates douces","pâte tempura (voir ci-dessous)","huile d''arachide ou de tournesol, pour la friture","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","3 cuillères à soupe de xérès sec","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre","1 citron, le zeste seulement"]','["Chauffer le four à 150°C/chaleur tournante 130°C/gaz 2. Mélanger les ingrédients de la sauce dans un petit bol. Préparez la pâte (voir à droite). Couvrir une plaque à pâtisserie de feuilles de papier absorbant. Commencez à faire chauffer une poêle ou un grand wok rempli au tiers d''huile et ayez le panier à friture ou l''écumoire à portée de main.","Lorsque l''huile atteint 190°C, plongez brièvement une partie des légumes préparés dans la pâte, secouez l''excédent, puis plongez-les directement dans l''huile chaude. Ne remplissez pas le panier à friture. Faire revenir environ 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et croustillants, puis égoutter sur du papier absorbant.","Répétez l''opération avec les légumes restants par lots, en les plongeant dans la pâte juste avant de les faire frire et n''oubliez pas de laisser l''huile chauffer à nouveau entre chaque lot. Gardez les tempura au chaud dans le four en laissant la porte légèrement entrouverte pour qu''elles restent croustillantes. Il est préférable de les servir immédiatement sur une assiette chaude avec la sauce pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:07:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10830,4597,'fr','Salade de riz brun miso et poulet','Faible en gras et excellente source de fer, ce repas d''inspiration japonaise porte le label « supersain »','["120 g de riz basmati brun","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau","140 g de brocoli germé","4 oignons nouveaux, coupés en tranches diagonales","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame grillées","2 cuillères à café de pâte miso","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de mirin","1 cuillère à café de gingembre râpé"]','["Cuire le riz en suivant le paquet\r\ninstructions, puis égouttez et gardez au chaud.\r\nPendant la cuisson, déposez le poulet\r\npoitrines dans une casserole d''eau bouillante afin\r\nils sont entièrement couverts. Faire bouillir pendant\r\n1 min, puis éteignez le feu, placez\r\ncouvrir et laisser reposer 15 minutes. Quand\r\nbien cuit, coupé en tranches.","Faire bouillir le brocoli jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Égoutter,\r\nrincer à l''eau froide et égoutter à nouveau.","Pour la vinaigrette, mélanger le miso, le riz\r\nvinaigre, mirin et gingembre ensemble.","Répartissez le riz dans deux assiettes\r\net parsemer les oignons nouveaux et\r\ngraines de sésame. Placez le brocoli et\r\ntranches de poulet par dessus. Pour finir, arrosez\r\nsur la vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:07:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10831,4827,'fr','Salade de nouilles soba et edamame au tofu grillé','Ce souper faible en gras et ultrasain vous fera vous sentir vertueux toute la semaine. Si vous ne pouvez pas obtenir de haricots edamame, utilisez plutôt des fèves','["140 g de nouilles soba","300 g de haricots edamame (soja) écossés frais ou surgelés","4 oignons nouveaux, émincés","300 g de germes de soja","1 concombre pelé, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur, épépiné avec une cuillère à café et tranché","250 g de tofu ferme en bloc, épongé et tranché épaissement","1 cuillère à café d''huile","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre, pour servir","3 cuillères à soupe de mirin","2 cuillères à café de tamari","2 cuillères à soupe de jus d''orange","1 piment rouge, épépiné, si vous le souhaitez, et finement haché"]','["Faites chauffer les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans votre\r\ndans la plus petite casserole, laisser mijoter 30 secondes,\r\npuis mettre de côté.","Faire bouillir les nouilles en suivant le paquet\r\ninstructions, ajout des haricots edamame\r\npour les 2 dernières minutes de cuisson. Rincer\r\nsous l''eau très froide, égouttez-les soigneusement\r\net versez dans un grand bol avec le ressort\r\noignons, germes de soja, concombre, sésame\r\nhuile et vinaigrette chaude. Assaisonnez si vous le souhaitez.","Badigeonner le tofu d''huile végétale, assaisonner et\r\nplaque chauffante ou grill pendant 2-3 minutes de chaque côté –\r\nle tofu est très délicat alors retournez-le soigneusement.\r\nGarnir la salade de tofu, parsemer de\r\ncoriandre et servir"]','2026-01-11 00:07:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10832,6804,'fr','Rouleaux de sushi au saumon et au concombre','Suivez notre guide simple, étape par étape, pour rouler vos propres sushis japonais, faibles en gras et sains.','["2 feuilles de nori","100 g de filets de saumon sans peau (utiliser bien frais), tranchés finement dans le sens de la longueur","¼ de concombre épépiné, tranché finement dans le sens de la longueur","presser du wasabi, et un peu plus pour servir","gingembre à sushi mariné, pour servir","sauce soja légère, pour servir","œufs de saumon, pour servir (facultatif)","100 g de riz à sushi","2 tsp saké or mirin (optional)","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre (omettre si vous utilisez du mirin)","25 ml de vinaigre de riz"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le riz. Rincer les sushis\r\nriz dans une passoire en le massant avec votre\r\nmains jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire. Partir\r\négoutter pendant 15 min.","Mettez le riz dans une casserole avec 200 ml\r\nde l''eau et du saké ou du mirin, si vous en utilisez.\r\nPortez à ébullition, puis couvrez avec un couvercle,\r\nbaisser le feu à doux et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide soit absorbé.\r\nRetirer du feu. Mettre de côté,\r\ncouvert, pendant 15 à 20 minutes.","Transférer dans un grand bol. Dissoudre le\r\nsucre, le cas échéant, dans le vinaigre avec un bon\r\npincée de sel, verser sur le riz et mélanger.\r\nCouvrir d''un torchon humide et réserver\r\nà température ambiante jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser.","Mettez 1 feuille de nori sur une natte de bambou et\r\ncouvrir la surface avec la moitié du liquide refroidi\r\ndu riz. Disposez la moitié du saumon et du concombre\r\ntranches sur toute la longueur du riz dans un\r\nbande en prenant soin de ne pas trop la remplir. Courir\r\nune goutte de wasabi de la taille d''un pois (plus si vous\r\ncomme si c''était très chaud) le long du bord de la garniture avec le doigt.","Rouler fermement et presser pour sceller\r\nquand tu arriveras à la fin. Répétez avec le\r\nle reste de nori, le saumon et le concombre,\r\net plus de wasabi. Coupez chaque rouleau en\r\n6 morceaux, et servir avec du wasabi supplémentaire,\r\ngingembre, sauce soja et œufs de saumon, si vous\r\nlike.Se conservera au réfrigérateur pendant 1 jour."]','2026-01-11 00:07:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10833,7719,'fr','Saumon mariné au miso','Vous êtes-vous déjà demandé quoi faire avec la pâte miso japonaise ? Cette variante d''un plat de poisson Nobu classique est un excellent point de départ.','["3 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso pâle (shiro)","2 cuillères à soupe de mirin","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre","1 tbsp saké (optional)","2 x 100 g de filets de saumon","un demi concombre","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","pincée de sucre en poudre"]','["Mélangez le miso, le mirin, le sucre et\r\nsaké, si vous l''utilisez. Disposez les filets de saumon sur un\r\nassiette ou dans un sac alimentaire moyen et couvrir\r\navec la marinade miso. Laisser au réfrigérateur\r\npendant au moins 30 minutes ou, mieux encore, toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Légèrement\r\nhuiler une plaque à pâtisserie. Utilisez du papier absorbant pour essuyer\r\nde la marinade (ne soyez pas tenté de laver\r\ncoupez-le car vous perdrez un peu de saveur).\r\nDisposez les filets sur la plaque à pâtisserie, côté peau\r\nvers le bas. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle poisson se défasse facilement et est bien cuit.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la salade de concombre.\r\nÀ l''aide d''un épluche-légumes, rasez les\r\nconcombre en longs et fins rubans. Fouet\r\nensemble le vinaigre de vin de riz, l''huile et le sucre.\r\nMélangez les rubans de concombre dans la vinaigrette,\r\npuis enroulez-les sur deux assiettes. Servir\r\navec le saumon et du blanc nature\r\nriz saupoudré de graines de sésame grillées."]','2026-01-11 00:07:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10834,7723,'fr','Teriyaki de saumon grillé avec salade de concombre','Les filets de saumon sont cuits directement congelés pour plus de commodité – le glaçage collant aide à garder le poisson humide pendant la cuisson.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","5 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","5 cuillères à soupe de mirin ou de sherry sec","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 morceau de gingembre frais, pelé et finement râpé","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées en pâte","4 filets de saumon désossés et sans peau surgelés","1 petit concombre","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Chauffez le gril à feu vif et badigeonnez-le d''un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie avec de l''huile. Dans un grand bol, mélanger\r\nle soja, le mirin, le sucre, le gingembre et l''ail\r\nensemble jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous,\r\npuis jetez le saumon congelé dans le soja\r\nmélanger jusqu''à ce qu''il soit enrobé. Donnez un pourboire au reste\r\nfaire mariner dans une petite casserole et\r\nporter à ébullition.","Placez le plateau à environ 4 pouces du\r\nchauffer, puis griller pendant 20 minutes. Badigeonner le poisson\r\ntoutes les quelques minutes avec le mijotage\r\nfaire mariner jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit et\r\nvitré. Si les filets sont épais, vous pouvez\r\nil faut les retourner sur le côté pour qu''ils\r\ncuire uniformément. Retirer du gril.\r\nLaisser mijoter la marinade jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit collante, puis\r\nversez-le sur le saumon cuit.","Pour la salade de concombre, utilisez un émerillon\r\néplucheur à lame pour éplucher le concombre\r\ntranches. Préparez la vinaigrette en mélangeant le\r\nvinaigre avec la sauce soja, le sucre et\r\ngraines de sésame. Mélangez le concombre avec\r\nla vinaigrette et servir avec le saumon\r\net du riz bouilli."]','2026-01-11 00:07:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10835,7725,'fr','Légumes japonais en sauce avec riz gluant au sésame','Servir du brocoli à longues tiges et du pak choi asiatique avec du riz à sushi au sésame et une vinaigrette miso au gingembre','["1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","140 g de riz à sushi","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame grillées","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","250 g de brocoli à longues tiges, comme des tiges tendres ou des pousses violettes","Paquet de 90 g de bébé pak choi, chacun coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur","6 oignons nouveaux, coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso brune","1 cuillère à soupe de mirin","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade molle","2 cuillères à café de gingembre finement râpé","1 piment rouge épépiné et coupé en dés"]','["Mélanger tous les ingrédients de la sauce\r\navec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Annuler.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau\r\navec le sucre en poudre et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Ajouter\r\nle riz et faire bouillir pendant 15 minutes (ou après\r\ninstructions sur l''emballage) jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste cuites. Vidanger\r\nbien et remettre dans la poêle. Saupoudrer\r\nles graines de sésame et l''huile de sésame, puis\r\ncouvrir et réserver au chaud.","Faites chauffer l''huile de tournesol dans un wok jusqu''à ce que\r\ntrès chaud, puis ajoutez le brocoli et\r\nfaire sauter pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque tendre,\r\najouter des éclaboussures d''eau de temps en temps\r\npour créer de la vapeur. Ajoutez le pak choi et\r\noignons nouveaux et faire sauter pendant 30 secondes,\r\npuis incorporez la sauce et laissez cuire pendant\r\nencore 1 à 2 minutes en remuant constamment.","Répartir le riz sur 2 assiettes, diviser\r\nsur le sauté et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:07:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10836,7727,'fr','Crevettes à l''avocat et vinaigrette au wasabi','Le wasabi, la pâte qui ajoute une touche poivrée aux sushis, donne du peps à ce combo crémeux d''avocat et de crevettes.','["2 cuillères à café de pâte de wasabi","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert, plus 6 quartiers, pour servir","1 cuillère à café de miel clair","2 gros avocats mûrs mais fermes","Paquet de 250 g de grosses crevettes décortiquées réfrigérées","2 têtes de chicorée, rouges si possible, séparées en feuilles","quelques brins de cresson","crackers aux crevettes, pour servir"]','["Dans un grand bol, mélanger les ingrédients de la vinaigrette jusqu''à homogénéité. Assaisonner de sel, puis réserver.","Pour servir, coupez les avocats en deux et dénoyautez-les. Coupez la chair en dés pendant qu''elle est encore dans la peau puis versez-la dans un bol. Ajouter les crevettes et mélanger avec la vinaigrette. Tapisser six petits bols ou gobelets de service de deux ou trois feuilles de chicorée. Incorporer le mélange d’avocat et de crevettes. Garnir de cresson et de quartiers de citron vert. Servir avec des crackers aux crevettes."]','2026-01-11 00:07:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10837,7729,'fr','Salade japonaise avec vinaigrette soja et gingembre','Servez cette salade avec du thon ou un steak grillé ou intégrez-la comme déjeuner super sain.','["4 petites laitues gemmes, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","200 g de haricots edamame (soja) décortiqués surgelés, décongelés","4 carottes, coupées en longues allumettes","140 g de radis émincés","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja réduite en sel","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","½ petit oignon, haché","2 cuillères à café de gingembre haché","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale"]','["Placer tous les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un\r\nmélangeur ou robot culinaire et ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe\r\nl''eau. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Organiser le\r\nlaitue coupée en deux, edamame, carottes et\r\nradis sur 4 assiettes ou 1 grande assiette.\r\nAu moment de servir, arrosez de\r\ns''habiller."]','2026-01-11 00:07:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10838,7731,'fr','Thon au soja et purée de wasabi','Savourez ce plat d''inspiration japonaise avec quelqu''un de spécial','["3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","2 steaks de thon, chacun d''environ 140 g/5 oz","500g de pommes de terre","100 ml de lait demi-écrémé","2 cuillères à café de pâte de wasabi (voir Savoir-faire)","1 oignon nouveau, tranché finement","fèves ou graines de soja surgelées, pour servir"]','["Mélangez la sauce soja, le vinaigre et\r\nsucre. Verser sur le thon et laisser mariner pendant\r\nau moins 20 minutes ou jusqu''à 2 heures au réfrigérateur.\r\nMettez les pommes de terre dans une poêle légèrement salée\r\nl''eau bouillante, puis cuire 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoux. Bien égoutter. Faites chauffer le lait dans la casserole et\r\nincorporer le wasabi, remettre les pommes de terre dans le\r\npoêle, puis écraser jusqu''à consistance lisse. Remuer\r\nl''oignon nouveau et réserver au chaud.","Chauffer une poêle antiadhésive jusqu''à ce qu''elle fume\r\nchaud. Retirez le thon de la marinade.\r\nCuire sur la plaque chauffante pendant 2-3 minutes chacun\r\ncôté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit saisi à l''extérieur, mais quand même\r\nrose à l''intérieur. Cuire les fèves ou les fèves de soja\r\nselon les instructions sur l''emballage, puis servir\r\naux côtés du thon et de la purée."]','2026-01-11 00:07:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10839,4743,'fr','Nouilles soba au poulet','Rapide et facile à préparer, que vous les emballiez pour le travail ou que vous preniez une bouchée à la maison','["85 g de nouilles soba ou de sarrasin","un filet d''huile de sésame","8 mangetout","1 petite carotte","½ piment rouge","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame grillées","une poignée de poulet cuit émincé","je suis saule"]','["Cuire les nouilles, bien les égoutter, puis\r\nmélanger avec un filet d''huile de sésame.","Finement\r\ntrancher le mangetout, couper la carotte\r\nen allumettes, épépiner et trancher\r\nle piment rouge.","Ajouter aux nouilles avec\r\nles graines de sésame grillées et quelques\r\npoulet cuit émincé, si vous en avez\r\nça. Emballez avec une petite portion de sauce soja."]','2026-01-11 00:07:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10840,6567,'fr','Crevettes Teriyaki et nouilles au brocoli','Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.','["50 ml de sauce soja faible en sodium","50 ml de morts","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","1½ cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","200 g de nouilles soba","140 g de brocoli à tige fine","140 g de crevettes cuites","1 petit piment rouge, tranché finement"]','["Dans une petite casserole, faites chauffer le soja\r\nsauce, mirin, jus de citron et sucre.\r\nLaisser mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que ce soit sirupeux, puis\r\nretirer du feu. Apportez un grand\r\nune casserole d''eau salée à ébullition,\r\npuis faites cuire les nouilles et le brocoli\r\npendant environ 3 minutes, en ajoutant les crevettes\r\nquelques secondes avant de les égoutter. Divisez le\r\nmélange entre 2 assiettes, versez le\r\nsauce teriyaki tiède sur le dessus,\r\nsaupoudrer de piment rouge et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10841,4884,'fr','Steak miso','Le steak ne doit pas nécessairement être un repas copieux : donnez-lui une marinade de style japonais pour un souper faible en gras.','["2 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso brune","1 cuillère à soupe de sherry sec ou de saké","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","2 gousses d''ail écrasées","300 g de steak maigre","bébés épinards, tranches de concombre, céleri, radis et graines de sésame grillées, pour servir"]','["Versez la pâte miso, le Sherry ou le saké,\r\nsucre et ail dans un sac alimentaire scellable.\r\nAssaisonner avec un généreux broyage de noir\r\npoivrer, puis écraser le tout jusqu''à ce que\r\ncomplètement mélangé. Ajouter le steak, délicatement\r\nmasser la marinade dans le steak\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement recouvert, puis scellez le\r\nsac. Mettez le sac au réfrigérateur et partez\r\npendant au moins 1 heure, mais jusqu''à 2 jours, c''est bien.","Pour cuire, faites chauffer une poêle à fond épais,\r\npoêle ou barbecue jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud.\r\nEssuyez l''excédent de marinade du steak,\r\npuis saisir 3 min de chaque côté pendant\r\nmi-saignant ou quelques minutes de plus si vous\r\npréférez la viande plus cuite. Mettre de côté\r\npendant 1 min pour se reposer. Découpez le bœuf dans\r\ntranches épaisses et servir avec un croustillant\r\nsalade composée d''épinards, concombre,\r\ncéleri, radis et graines de sésame."]','2026-01-11 00:07:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10842,7733,'fr','Nouilles au sésame et à la truite fumée et au concombre','Devenant rapidement aussi populaire que le saumon, la truite est depuis longtemps un joyau oublié. Profitez-en au maximum dans cette salade fraîche','["1,2 l de bouillon de légumes","noix de gingembre frais, pelée et râpée","100 g de nouilles soba","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja réduite en sel, plus un peu pour servir si vous le souhaitez","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tahini ou de beurre de cacahuète","Paquet de 125 g de filets de truite fumée, émiettés","½ gros concombre, tranché","6 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","graines de sésame, pour servir","huile de sésame, pour servir"]','["Apportez le bouillon et le gingembre râpé à\r\nfaire bouillir dans une grande casserole, ajouter les nouilles,\r\npuis laisser mijoter 4 minutes jusqu''à tendreté.","Égoutter, puis refroidir sous l''eau froide courante. \r\nMélangez le soja, le tahini et 2 cuillères à soupe\r\nd''eau (ou plus si vous en avez besoin) pour faire un\r\nvinaigrette ayant la consistance d''une crème liquide.\r\nMélangez les nouilles et le poisson refroidis avec le\r\nvinaigrette et concombre. Dispersez-vous avec le\r\noignons nouveaux et graines de sésame, puis\r\narroser d''un peu d''huile de sésame, si vous en utilisez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10843,7735,'fr','Soupe miso facile','Une soupe faible en gras prête en moins de 5 minutes','["sachet de soupe miso japonaise","un trait de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de tofu soyeux coupé en dés","un bon brin de cresson"]','["Dissoudre un sachet de mélange à soupe miso japonaise dans un bol avec de l''eau bouillante. Ajoutez un trait de sauce soja, des dés de tofu soyeux et un bon brin de cresson."]','2026-01-11 00:07:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10844,7737,'fr','Tempura de chou-fleur','Une collation saine à la japonaise','["1 petit chou-fleur, coupé en fleurons de taille moyenne","100 g de farine nature","2 œufs, séparés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","huile végétale pour la friture"]','["Faites cuire le chou-fleur dans l''eau bouillante pendant 2 minutes. Verser dans une passoire, rincer \r\nsous le robinet froid, bien égoutter et réserver.","Mettez la farine dans un grand bol avec une pincée  \r\nde sel. Fouetter les jaunes d''œufs et 175 ml de glace  \r\nl''eau ensemble, puis incorporer la farine avec le \r\nhuile pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Dans un endroit séparé et propre \r\ndans un bol, fouettez les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes, puis pliez \r\ndans la pâte.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une friteuse ou un grand wok pour \r\n190C. Enrober une partie du chou-fleur dans la pâte \r\npuis utilisez une écumoire pour soulever délicatement dans le \r\nhuile chaude. Faites frire le chou-fleur pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit \r\ndoré et gonflé.  Égoutter sur un torchon et \r\ncontinuez avec le reste par lots. Saupoudrer le \r\nchou-fleur avec du sel et servir avec un bol de  \r\naïoli ou mayonnaise."]','2026-01-11 00:07:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10845,4585,'fr','Sushi saumon fumé & avocat','Envie de faire des sushis à la maison ? Cette recette simple donne 32 petites bouchées saines, idéales pour le déjeuner ou servies en canapés','["300 g de riz à sushi","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz ou de vin blanc","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 gros avocat","jus ½ citron","4 feuilles d''algues nori","4 grosses tranches de saumon fumé","1 bouquet de ciboulette","sauce soja sucrée (sauce soja sucrée), pour servir"]','["Mettez le riz dans une petite casserole avec 600 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit absorbée et que le riz soit tendre. Incorporer le vinaigre et le sucre, couvrir et laisser refroidir.","Pelez, dénoyautez et coupez l''avocat en tranches. Mettez dans un bol et pressez le jus de citron, en retournant l''avocat pour vous assurer que les morceaux sont bien recouverts.","Répartissez le riz entre les feuilles de nori et étalez-le uniformément en laissant une bordure de 1 cm en haut et en bas. Disposez le saumon sur le riz, suivi de la ciboulette et enfin positionnez l''avocat au centre.","Repliez le bord inférieur de l''algue sur la garniture, puis enroulez-la fermement. Humidifiez la bordure supérieure avec un peu d''eau pour l''aider à sceller le rouleau. Répétez l’opération pour faire 4 rouleaux. À ce stade, les rouleaux peuvent être emballés individuellement dans un film alimentaire et réfrigérés jusqu''au moment de servir.","À l''aide d''un couteau dentelé, coupez chaque rouleau en 8 rondelles. Servir avec de la sauce soja sucrée pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:07:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10846,6734,'fr','Nouilles soba aux agrumes','Simple, piquant et rapide. Ajoutez vos légumes préférés ou un peu de poulet pour en faire un repas, ou servez-le comme accompagnement simple à des repas d''inspiration asiatique.','["250g de nouilles soba (voir savoir-faire ci-dessous)","4 oignons nouveaux, émincés","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja"]','["Cuire les nouilles dans l''eau bouillante selon les instructions sur l''emballage, environ 7 minutes,\r\npuis rincer sous l''eau froide courante jusqu''à ce que\r\ncool. Bien égoutter.","Verser dans un bol et mélanger avec les oignons nouveaux, le zeste et le jus de citron vert et la sauce soja."]','2026-01-11 00:07:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10847,4589,'fr','Katsu au poulet','Le Katsu est une méthode japonaise pour paner le poulet. Cette version est servie avec une riche sauce au curry.','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","1 gros oeuf, battu","8 cuillères à soupe de cornflakes ou de chapelure de panko finement broyés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1-2 cuillères à soupe de pâte Korma","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","4 cuillères à soupe de ketchup","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Tremper\r\nla poule dans l''œuf, puis enrobez-la de\r\ncornflakes ou miettes. Espacer le poulet\r\ndéposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive et cuire\r\npendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits.","Mettez le reste des ingrédients dans une casserole.\r\nVersez 500 ml d''eau et faites chauffer en remuant,\r\njusqu''à ébullition et épaississement. Couvrir et\r\nlaisser mijoter 5 mn.","Verser un peu de sauce dans 4 assiettes, trancher\r\nles poitrines de poulet et les déposer dessus.\r\nExcellent servi avec du riz et du soja\r\nharicots avec du piment rouge finement tranché."]','2026-01-11 00:07:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10848,7741,'fr','Riz japonais au saumon et à l''avocat','Ce plat contient les bienfaits des sushis mais vous évite le roulage et le façonnage minutieux.','["300 g de riz à sushi","350 g de filets de saumon sans peau","2 petits avocats mûrs, tranchés","jus d''1 citron","4 cuillères à café de sauce soja légère","4 cuillères à café de graines de sésame grillées","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 piment rouge épépiné et tranché finement","une petite poignée de feuilles de coriandre"]','["Rincer le riz dans une passoire jusqu''à ce que l''eau\r\nest clair. Égoutter et mettre dans une grande casserole\r\navec 400 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition, retournez\r\nbaissez le feu, couvrez et laissez cuire\r\n10-12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit presque\r\ncuit. Retirer du feu, puis\r\nlaisser, couvert, pendant encore 10 minutes.","Tranchez finement le saumon et disposez-le\r\nune assiette avec les tranches d''avocat. Bruine\r\nsur le jus de citron et le soja, en faisant\r\nassurez-vous que tout est uniformément couvert. Partir\r\nau réfrigérateur pour mariner 10 minutes.","Versez délicatement le jus du saumon\r\nassiette dans le riz, puis incorporer avec un\r\npeu de sel. Répartissez le riz dans 4 bols.\r\nRépartissez les graines de sésame, les oignons nouveaux,\r\npiment et coriandre sur le saumon et\r\navocat, puis servir avec le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:07:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10849,7743,'fr','Brochettes de thon teriyaki','Colorées et rapides, ces brochettes simples sont aussi bonnes qu''elles en ont l''air !','["30 ml de sole de soja","50ml de mirin (Voir savoir-faire ci-dessous)","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","1 mangue, pelée","3 oignons nouveaux","250 g de steaks de thon"]','["Préparez une sauce teriyaki en mélangeant la sauce soja, le mirin et le sucre dans un plat peu profond. Mettez les steaks de thon dans le plat, retournez-les plusieurs fois pour les enrober de sauce, puis laissez mariner au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 1h et jusqu''à 2h.","Pour cuisiner, faites chauffer une grande poêle. Sortez les steaks de thon de la marinade et séchez-les, puis frottez-les avec l''huile. Faites frire le thon 2 min de chaque côté pour qu''il soit encore rose au milieu. Retirer de la poêle, puis verser la marinade et 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire quelques minutes pour bien réchauffer. Passer au tamis dans un petit bol à trempette.","Pour servir, coupez le thon cuit, la mangue et l''oignon nouveau en bouchées. Enfiler sur des brochettes en bois, puis servir tiède ou froid avec la trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:07:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10850,7745,'fr','Goberge miso avec salade de concombre et oignons nouveaux','Remplacez la morue par un poisson blanc durable comme la goberge et servez-la avec des saveurs japonaises pour un souper faible en calories qui vous fera du bien.','["2 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso blanche","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja faible en sodium","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","2 x 125 g de filets de lieu jaune","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés en diagonale","½ concombre pelé en lanières avec un épluche-pomme de terre","140 g de germes de soja","100 g de radis, tranchés","1 piment rouge haché (épépiné si vous le souhaitez)","3 citrons verts, 2 en jus, 1 coupé en quartiers","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame"]','["Mélanger la pâte miso, la sauce soja\r\net la moitié du vinaigre. Couvrir le poisson dans le\r\nfaire mariner et laisser reposer au moins 15 minutes,\r\nou idéalement une nuit au réfrigérateur.","Mélangez les oignons nouveaux, le concombre,\r\ngermes de soja et radis. Faire un\r\nvinaigrette avec le piment, le jus de citron vert et\r\nvinaigre restant. Verser sur la salade\r\net réservez pendant la cuisson du poisson.","Faites chauffer l''huile de sésame dans une poêle\r\net faites cuire le poisson 3-4 minutes de chaque côté.\r\nRetirer et transférer dans une assiette. Donnez un pourboire au\r\nmarinade dans la poêle, porter à ébullition\r\net faire bouillir rapidement pour réduire de moitié. Verser\r\nsur le poisson et servir avec la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:07:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10851,7747,'fr','Steak de piment miso et patates douces croustillantes','Essayez cette version asiatique du steak-frites : servez du bœuf grillé avec une sauce miso au piment et des patates douces parsemées de sésame.','["2 grosses patates douces, coupées en quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale, plus un peu plus","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte miso","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce chili piquante (la sriracha est bonne)","1 cuillère à soupe de mirin","2 bavettes ou autres steaks maigres (environ 200g chacun)","une grosse poignée de feuilles de cresson, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDisposez les quartiers de pommes de terre sur une plaque allant au four\r\net frottez avec l''huile. Saupoudrer de sésame\r\ngraines et un peu d''assaisonnement. Cuire au four\r\npendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient croustillants.","Dans un petit bol, mélanger le miso,\r\njus de citron, sauce chili et mirin. Frotter\r\nles steaks avec un tout petit peu d''huile et un peu\r\nassaisonnement. Verser 1 cuillère à soupe de sauce\r\nsur chaque steak et frotter des deux côtés.","Faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien chaude, faites cuire\r\nles steaks pendant 2 minutes de chaque côté, ou plus\r\nsi vous préférez que ce soit bien cuit. Brossez davantage\r\nde la sauce après les avoir retournés.\r\nTransférer dans une assiette, couvrir légèrement avec\r\npapier d''aluminium et laisser reposer 5 minutes. Servir\r\nles steaks tranchés, avec un supplément de sauce, le\r\npommes de terre et cresson."]','2026-01-11 00:07:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10852,7749,'fr','Boulettes de poulet teriyaki avec riz et légumes verts','Essayez un souper familial différent avec ces galettes de poulet servies dans une sauce japonaise sucrée et basmati','["2 échalotes","1 carotte, coupée en morceaux","500 g de poitrines ou de cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en morceaux","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","un peu d''huile","200 g de riz basmati","200 g de verdure printanière hachée","La mort en 100 ml","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMixez les échalotes et les carottes dans un aliment\r\nrobot jusqu''à ce qu''il soit finement haché. Ajoutez le\r\npoulet, zeste de citron et un peu d''assaisonnement,\r\net pulsez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit mélangé. Utiliser de l''huile\r\nmains, façonner de petites boulettes de viande.\r\nDisposez sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier sulfurisé\r\npapier sulfurisé et cuire au four pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndorés et bien cuits.","Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir le riz suivant le pack\r\ninstructions, en ajoutant les légumes verts de printemps pour\r\nles 4 dernières minutes. Bien égoutter.","Ajoutez le mirin, le soja, le jus de citron et\r\nsucre dans une casserole. Portez à ébullition,\r\npuis laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que ce soit sauce. Supprimer de\r\nle feu, ajoutez les boulettes de viande dans la poêle\r\net roulez-les dans la sauce. Diviser\r\nle riz et les légumes verts entre les assiettes ou\r\nbols et déposer les boulettes de viande dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:07:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10853,6745,'fr','Salade croquante de concombre et radis','Ajoutez du croquant et de la fraîcheur à n''importe quel repas d''inspiration asiatique avec ce plat d''accompagnement simple','["1?2 concombre","1 à 2 bottes de radis","2g d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin de riz"]','["Tranchez finement le concombre et les radis et disposez-les dans une assiette.","Fouetter ensemble l''huile végétale et le vinaigre de vin de riz et arroser les légumes pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10854,7753,'fr','Wraps de bœuf au sésame','Le parfait apéritif d''inspiration asiatique, parfait pour une réunion de Noël entre amis','["1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","175 g de steak de bœuf coupé en fines lanières","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché finement","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","2 cm de gingembre frais, tranché finement et coupé en allumettes","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 laitues Baby Gem","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Lorsque la casserole est\r\nbien chaud, versez le bœuf et le poivre, puis faites cuire\r\npendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et que le\r\nle bœuf est bien cuit. Incorporer l''ail, le gingembre\r\net les graines de sésame, puis cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes,\r\nen remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à devenir dorés.","Versez dessus la sauce soja et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, laissez\r\nça bouillonne un peu jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à paraître sirupeux,\r\npuis arroser d''huile de sésame. Séparez le\r\nfeuilles de laitue et disposer sur une assiette.\r\nVersez un peu du mélange de bœuf dans chaque feuille,\r\narroser du jus de cuisson et servir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:07:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10855,7755,'fr','Ajiaco','Cette soupe classique colombienne est servie avec de la crème, des câpres, de l''avocat, du mote (maïs bouilli) et de la poitrine de poulet effilochée, le tout mélangé juste avant de manger','["2 poitrines de poulet sans peau","2 épis de maïs choclo (une variété de maïs jaune à gros grains) ou épis de maïs ordinaires","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées","½ oignon blanc, coupé en dés","1 poivron jaune, coupé en dés","4 pommes de terre moyennes (rouges ou blanches), épluchées et coupées en dés","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés","6 brins de coriandre, hachés, plus un peu pour servir","12 papas criollas (petites pommes de terre jaunes), coupées en deux","8 c. à soupe de guascas","100ml de crème liquide ou crème épaisse","4 c. à soupe de câpres, égouttées","1 avocat, épluché, dénoyauté et coupé en petits cubes"]','["Mettre le poulet, les épis de maïs, l''ail, l''oignon, le poivron, les pommes de terre, les oignons nouveaux et la coriandre dans une casserole avec 2 litres d''eau et porter à ébullition, bien assaisonner, puis laisser mijoter environ 45 minutes à feu moyen.","Retirer le maïs et le poulet et les transférer sur une assiette. Mixer les ingrédients restants dans la casserole avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse.","Ajouter les papas criollas et les guascas dans la casserole et cuire à feu moyen environ 10-12 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les papas criollas commencent à ramollir mais ne se désintègrent pas.","Pendant ce temps, effilocher finement les poitrines de poulet avec les mains, et couper les épis de maïs en tranches épaisses. Mettre dans de petits bols séparés.","Mettre également la crème, les câpres, l''avocat et le supplément de coriandre hachée dans de petits bols, pour que chacun puisse se servir selon ses envies. Verser la soupe dans quatre bols à soupe et servir avec les autres ingrédients à côté. N''oubliez pas les serviettes pour manger les tranches de maïs."]','2026-01-11 00:07:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10856,7757,'fr','Plateau de merlu Puttanesca','Achetez du merlu durable pour cuisiner ce plat de style méditerranéen avec des olives vertes et des tomates','["1 oignon , tranché","500 g de pommes de terre grelots, coupées en gros morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 gousses d''ail légèrement écrasées mais toujours dans leur peau","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","60 g d''olives dénoyautées, nous avons utilisé de la nocellara, tranchées","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres , égouttées et hachées grossièrement","3 filets d''anchois finement hachés","4 filets de merlu d''environ 100 g chacun","10 g de persil haché grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/190C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettre l''oignon et les pommes de terre dans une rôtissoire, arroser d''huile et garnir d''ail. Bien assaisonner avec du sel et du poivre. Rôtir pendant 25 à 30 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits. Retirez l''ail de leur peau et pressez-le sur les pommes de terre.","Lorsque les pommes de terre sont cuites, mélangez les tomates concassées en conserve avec une bonne pincée de sel et de poivre. Répartir les olives, les flocons de piment, les câpres et les anchois sur les pommes de terre et bien mélanger. Verser sur les tomates en conserve assaisonnées. Déposez dessus les filets de merlu.","Couvrir de papier d''aluminium, puis remettre au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit cuit. Il doit être opaque et s''écailler facilement lorsqu''on le pousse légèrement avec une fourchette.","Parsemer de persil et servir directement du plateau."]','2026-01-11 00:07:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10857,7759,'fr','Salade méditerranéenne avec vinaigrette au houmous','Égayez votre salade habituelle avec des courgettes rôties, des artichauts, des pois chiches et de la feta dans une vinaigrette crémeuse au houmous','["2 courgettes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées séchées","100 g d''artichauts grillés, hachés grossièrement","½ concombre , haché grossièrement","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","300 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","100 g d''olives dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","100 g de feta émiettée","une petite poignée de persil finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 citron, jus","100g de houmous"]','["Coupez les courgettes, puis coupez-les en deux dans le sens de la longueur pour obtenir deux longues moitiés. Incisez la chair des courgettes en entrecroisant. Saupoudrez une grosse pincée de sel sur le côté coupé des courgettes et réservez 10 min. Séchez puis badigeonnez d''huile d''olive et saupoudrez du mélange d''herbes sur le côté coupé.","Faites chauffer une poêle sèche à feu moyen-vif. Mettez les courgettes, côté marqué vers le bas, dans la poêle et faites cuire pendant 8 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien dorées. Retourner et cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les courgettes soient complètement tendres.","Pendant ce temps, mélanger les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un grand bol de service peu profond et assaisonner au goût. Ajouter le reste des ingrédients, en réservant un peu de persil, et bien mélanger. Garnir de courgettes et saupoudrer du reste de persil pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10858,7761,'fr','Packs de collations au houmous','Conservez le liquide d’une boîte de pois chiches pour faire un houmous crémeux. Nous l''avons servi avec des crudités de légumes pour une collation saine qui contribue à vos 5 par jour','["Boîte de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés, liquide réservé","1 gousse d''ail","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1-2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 sachets de 200 g de carottes arc-en-ciel ou 4 carottes normales","2 sachets de 200 g de mini concombres ou 4 concombres réguliers"]','["Versez les pois chiches et l''ail dans un bol avec le cumin, la coriandre, 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron et l''huile. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe du liquide réservé des pois chiches, puis mixez à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Si le mixeur a du mal, ajoutez un autre peu de liquide. Assaisonnez et ajoutez un peu plus de jus de citron si nécessaire.","Versez le houmous dans quatre petits récipients. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à trois jours. Coupez les carottes et le concombre en bâtonnets lorsque vous êtes prêt à manger et servez avec le houmous."]','2026-01-11 00:07:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10859,5353,'fr','Pâtes au poulet saines','Essayez ces pâtes au poulet saines avec des poivrons, des courgettes et de la ricotta pour un dîner nutritif en milieu de semaine. Ce sera certainement un succès auprès de tout le monde','["300 g de pennes complètes","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 poivrons (nous avons utilisé 1 jaune et 1 orange), épépinés et hachés","1 grosse courgette (160 g), râpée grossièrement","3 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","500 g de purée en carton","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","1½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment (facultatif)","25 g d''olives Kalamata (environ 8), tranchées","400 g de poitrines de poulet (2 grosses), coupées en morceaux","une grosse poignée de basilic haché, plus un peu pour servir","100 g de gazon","20 g de cheddar affiné finement râpé"]','["Faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les poivrons pendant 8 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez la courgette et l''ail, remuez encore quelques minutes, puis versez la passata et incorporez le paprika fumé, le bouillon, le piment, le cas échéant, et les olives. Laisser mijoter 3-4 minutes.","Égouttez les pâtes en réservant l''eau des pâtes. Versez les pâtes dans le mélange de passata avec le poulet, une demi-tasse d''eau pour pâtes et le basilic. Bien mélanger, puis verser dans un plat allant au four.","Mélangez la ricotta dans un bol avec 5 cuillères à soupe d''eau des pâtes et étalez-la sur le dessus des pâtes. Saupoudrer de cheddar, puis enfourner 35 min. Parsemez de quelques feuilles de basilic supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez, et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10860,3914,'fr','Salade de couscous géant et tomates avec vinaigrette façon zhoug','Préparez cette salade de couscous géant et de tomates comme accompagnement estival. Le zhoug est une sauce verte épicée du Moyen-Orient qui donne vie à ce plat','["4 grosses tomates grappe, coupées en dés","½ oignon rouge, finement haché","150g de couscous géant ou fregola","½ petit bouquet de coriandre, grossièrement haché","poignée de feuilles de persil, grossièrement hachées","1 citron, pressé","2 piments verts, hachés","1 gousse d''ail, grossièrement hachée","½ c. à café de cumin moulu","½ c. à café de sucre en poudre","3 c. à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Mettre les tomates et l''oignon dans un grand bol avec ½ c. à café de sel de mer. Mélanger et laisser reposer.","Cuire le couscous dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 8-10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre (ne pas trop cuire – on le veut un peu ferme pour qu''il puisse absorber les jus de la tomate), puis bien égoutter. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes puis mélanger avec le mélange de tomates et d''oignons.","Mixer tous les ingrédients de la vinaigrette avec 1 c. à soupe d''eau et ½ c. à café de sel de mer jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser un peu sur le couscous, puis servir le reste à côté pour que les gens se servent eux-mêmes."]','2026-01-11 00:07:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10861,3918,'fr','Épinards aux pois chiches, pignons de pin et raisins secs','Savourez ce simple plat d''accompagnement aux épinards avec des plats de poulet à l''espagnole. Les amandes grillées fonctionnent aussi bien','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un filet","1 grosse échalote longue, tranchée","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","4 cuillères à soupe de raisins secs dorés ou flambés","200g d''épinards","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin grillés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Ajouter l''échalote et l''ail et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez les épices, les pois chiches et les raisins secs et laissez cuire 2 min.","Ajoutez les épinards et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste flétris. Incorporer les pignons de pin et servir avec un filet d''huile supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:07:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10862,4539,'fr','Sabich','Habillez ce sandwich de sauces tahini et amba pour un avant-goût d''Israël. C''est plein de saveurs, avec de l''aubergine, du houmous, des œufs, des cornichons et plus encore','["2 tomates, coupées en dés","½ petit concombre, coupé en dés","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la friture","un filet de jus de citron","2 aubergines parées et coupées en rondelles de 1 cm","4 douleurs pitta","4 œufs durs moyens, pelés et tranchés","200g de houmous","150 g de radis, parés et coupés en deux s''ils sont gros","250 g de carottes coupées en tranches en diagonale","4 échalotes, finement tranchées","250 g de petits bouquets de chou-fleur","500 ml de vinaigre de vin blanc ou de cidre","3½ cuillères à soupe de sucre cristallisé","¾ cuillère à soupe de flocons de sel marin","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde jaune","2 cuillères à café de graines de carvi","1 cuillère à café de grains de poivre noir, meurtris","½ cuillère à soupe de graines de coriandre écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux, épépiné et haché","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","½ cuillère à café de graines de fenugrec","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","2 mangues fermes, pelées et chair hachée (environ 375g)","50 ml de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","un filet de jus de citron vert","100 g de tahin"]','["Pour faire les cornichons, mettez tous les légumes dans un pot stérilisé de 1 litre. Mettez le vinaigre, le sucre, le sel et les épices dans une casserole avec 400 ml d''eau et portez à ébullition. Laissez refroidir, puis versez sur les légumes. Fermez et laissez mariner à température ambiante pendant 48 heures. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à quatre semaines.","Pour préparer la sauce amba, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen, puis faites cuire l''ail et le piment jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres. Ajoutez les épices et laissez cuire 1 min, ajoutez la mangue et remuez pour bien l''enrober, puis ajoutez le vinaigre, le sucre et 100 ml d''eau. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la mangue soit tendre. Assaisonner au goût et presser le jus de citron vert. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à une semaine.","Pour la sauce tahini, mélanger les ingrédients avec 80 ml d''eau et assaisonner selon votre goût. Cela devrait avoir la consistance d’une double crème.","Mélanger les tomates, le concombre et les oignons nouveaux avec l''huile, assaisonner et presser dessus le jus de citron.","Faites chauffer un peu d''huile d''olive dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire les aubergines par lots pendant 5 à 8 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste dorées. Assaisonner, puis réduire le feu et poursuivre la cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre.","Faire griller et ouvrir les pittas, puis farcir avec les tranches d''aubergines, les œufs, le houmous, la salade, les cornichons et la sauce amba. Arroser de sauce tahini pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10863,5696,'fr','Boîte à lunch Falafels','Rendez cette salade de falafel amusante avec une boîte à lunch de style bento. C’est idéal pour les tout-petits et les jeunes enfants qui préfèrent les déjeuners contenant de nombreux éléments individuels. Utilisez des falafels du commerce ou préparez nos falafels Edamame','["Sachet de 250 g de céréales ou de lentilles cuites (nous avons utilisé du quinoa rouge et blanc)","une poignée de pousses d''épinards","¼ de concombre, haché","une poignée de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 carottes, râpées","1 grenade, graines seulement","10 olives (facultatif)","12 falafels","4 cuillères à soupe de houmous","un filet d''huile d''olive (facultatif)","½ citron, coupé en quartiers"]','["Répartissez les grains entre les boîtes à lunch. Garnissez chacun avec les légumes, les falafels, une cuillerée de houmous et un filet d''huile, le cas échéant, ou répartissez les ingrédients entre les compartiments d''une boîte à lunch de style bento. Mettez un citron dans chaque boîte et pressez-le juste avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:07:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10864,6247,'fr','Wraps arc-en-ciel au houmous','Préparez ces wraps arc-en-ciel colorés, avec du houmous, de la betterave rouge, de la carotte, de la feta et des pousses d''épinards pour un déjeuner végétarien rapide et facile pour toute la famille.','["3-4 enveloppements (½ enveloppement suffira pour un enfant plus petit)","6 cuillères à soupe de houmous","2 carottes, râpées","4 betteraves cuites, râpées","une grosse poignée de pousses d''épinards","100 g de feta émiettée (facultatif)"]','["Tartinez les wraps avec le houmous, puis remplissez-les de carottes, de betteraves, d''épinards et de feta, pour ceux qui le souhaitent. Emballez et conservez pour le déjeuner ou mangez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:07:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10865,4145,'fr','Wrap falafel farci style charcuterie','Préparez ce roulé de falafel de style charcuterie farci d''épinards, de cornichons, de concombre et de chou rouge en seulement 10 minutes pour un souper rapide et facile pour une personne.','["½ petite gousse d''ail","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt sans gras","¼ citron, jus","1 pain plat ou wrap","une grosse poignée d''épinards ou de laitue, râpés","2-3 falafels prêts à manger","¼ petit concombre, coupé en deux sur la longueur, épépiné et tranché","1 tomate, coupée en deux, épépinée et tranchée","1 cornichon ou piment mariné, coupé en deux","1 cuillère à soupe de chou rouge mariné, sauce chili égouttée, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez l’ail, le yaourt et le jus de citron dans un bol. Assaisonnez, puis détendez avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau froide si elle semble trop épaisse. Réchauffez le pain plat au grille-pain, si vous le souhaitez.","Placez le pain plat sur un morceau de papier sulfurisé et recouvrez-le d''épinards ou de laitue. Disposez les falafels en ligne au centre, puis garnissez-les de tranches de concombre et de tomate. Ajouter le cornichon, le chou et un filet de sauce chili, le cas échéant. Verser sur le mélange de yaourt.","Utilisez le papier sulfurisé pour vous aider à plier les deux extrémités du wrap, puis roulez-le fermement en forme de burrito. Coupez le papier sulfurisé en deux à l''aide d''un couteau à pain et déchirez-le pour le déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:07:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10866,7763,'fr','Calamars croustillants à la caponata','Le calmar est bon marché, abondant, rapide à cuisiner et délicieux avec le plat de légumes italien classique, la caponata.','["800 g de tubes de calamars nettoyés (environ 3 gros tubes)","150 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de poivre de Cayenne ou de poudre de piment","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","1 grosse aubergine","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 oignon, haché","3 branches de céleri, tranchées","250 g de tomates cerises","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","150 g d''olive verte dénoyautée","30 g de câpres, rincées si salées","une poignée de feuilles de basilic, émincées"]','["Pour préparer les calamars, disposez-les à plat sur une planche. Insérez un couteau long et fin dans l''ouverture et coupez-le soigneusement sur un côté. Ouvrez-le sur une feuille plate et grattez les restes de membrane. Utilisez la pointe du couteau pour entailler légèrement la chair en forme de losange, en prenant soin de ne pas couper complètement le calmar. Coupez les calamars en gros triangles prêts à être farinés et frits.","Pour la caponata, l''aubergine doit être coupée en dés uniformes : coupez-la dans le sens de la longueur sur environ 1 cm d''épaisseur, coupez de longues lanières de même taille, puis coupez-les en carrés.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une grande sauteuse. Faites revenir les oignons pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir, ajoutez l''aubergine, puis poursuivez la cuisson pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et tendres. Versez dans une passoire au-dessus d''un bol.","Versez l''huile du bol dans la poêle et complétez avec un peu d''huile fraîche. Faites revenir ensemble le céleri, les tomates et l''ail écrasé. Saupoudrez de sucre, arrosez de vinaigre, puis laissez cuire 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates commencent à libérer leur jus.","Remettez l''aubergine et l''oignon avec le céleri. Répartissez les olives, les câpres et le basilic, puis remuez bien le tout. Cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ébullition, puis assaisonner selon votre goût. Éteignez le feu, versez le reste de l’huile, puis réservez.","Juste avant la cuisson, versez les calamars dans un grand bol. Tamisez ensemble la farine et le poivre de Cayenne sur les calamars, puis mélangez bien et assaisonnez de sel. Remettez les calamars dans la passoire et secouez tout l''excès de farine.","Versez suffisamment d’huile de tournesol dans une grande poêle pour qu’elle atteigne environ 1 cm de profondeur. Faites chauffer l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''elle grésille lorsqu''on la saupoudre d''un peu de farine. Par lots, faites frire les calamars pendant 2 à 3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Une fois cuits, utilisez des pinces pour soulever les calamars sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant. Vous êtes maintenant prêt à servir.","Versez la caponata dans un anneau métallique de 10 cm de large (ou faites simplement une pile soignée) au milieu d''une assiette moyenne. Utilisez le dos de la cuillère pour appuyer légèrement sur la caponata et niveler le haut du tas. Soulevez délicatement l''anneau en gardant la tour de caponata circulaire. Déposez cinq ou six morceaux de calamar autour de la caponata comme les pétales d''une fleur, puis servez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:07:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10867,7765,'fr','Polenta, légumes rôtis & chips de parmesan poivré','Emma Booth a remporté notre concours du Mois de la cuisine maison avec ce somptueux plat de polenta crémeuse, garni de courge et de betterave rôties vibrantes.','["1 petite courge butternut (environ 450 g), pelée et coupée en cubes de 2 cm","3 betteraves crues (environ 200 g), coupées en cubes de 2 cm","2 petits oignons rouges, coupés en fins quartiers","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","jus de ½ citron","200 g de polenta fine","½ cuillère à café de sel","50g de beurre","60 g de fromage râpé (nous avons utilisé un mélange 50/50 de parmesan et de taleggio)","une grosse poignée de roquette, pour servir","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de thym fraîchement cueillies","50 g de parmesan râpé"]','["Pour faire les chips, baissez le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/thermostat 6. Assaisonnez le parmesan râpé avec une grosse pincée de poivre noir et répartissez-le uniformément sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte d''une feuille de silicone ou de papier sulfurisé légèrement huilé et enfournez pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré mais pas doré.  Après cinq minutes de refroidissement, cassez-le en morceaux croustillants avec vos doigts.","Allumez le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/thermostat 7. Mélangez les morceaux de courge et de betterave rouge dans le jus de citron et l''huile, assaisonnez légèrement de sel et de poivre et faites cuire au four dans un plat à rôtir pendant 20 minutes. Ajoutez les quartiers d''oignons et poursuivez la cuisson encore 25 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites mijoter un litre d''eau, le sel et la moitié du beurre dans une grande casserole, puis ajoutez lentement la polenta en un fin filet en remuant constamment.  Continuez à laisser mijoter à feu doux pendant 35 minutes (ou selon les instructions si vous utilisez de la polenta à cuisson rapide), en remuant souvent pour éviter qu''elle ne colle au fond.  La polenta doit être épaissie mais encore molle à ce stade.  S''il commence à trop sécher, ajoutez une tasse d''eau.  Une fois cuit, incorporez le reste du beurre, le parmesan et le taleggio ainsi qu''une pincée de poivre blanc.","Pour servir, répartissez la polenta sur une planche ou dans des assiettes, parsemez-la de légumes et du jus de torréfaction, puis de roquette et de thym.  Placez les chips de parmesan entre les légumes et mangez chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:07:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10868,7767,'fr','Figues au four épicées avec mascarpone au gingembre','Ce plat constitue la fin parfaite d''un dîner détendu, spécial mais sans stress.','["8 figues, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de jus d''orange","Anis étoilé 2","doigts sablés, pour servir","1 boule de gingembre haché très finement","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop de gingembre du pot","½ pot de 250 g de mascarpone"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Poser\r\nles figues dans un plat à rôtir allant au four, parsemez\r\nsur le beurre et arroser de miel.\r\nSaupoudrer de sucre et de cannelle,\r\npuis versez dessus le jus d''orange et mélangez légèrement. Placez l''anis étoilé parmi les figues et faites-les rôtir pendant 15 à 20 minutes.","Au moment de servir, mélangez le gingembre\r\net le sirop dans le mascarpone.\r\nDisposez 4 moitiés de figues arrosées de sirop,\r\nsur une assiette avec une cuillerée de mascarpone\r\net quelques doigts de sablés."]','2026-01-11 00:07:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10869,7769,'fr','Salade de pastèque et feta avec pain croustillant','Un combo cool et rafraîchissant pour les chaudes soirées d''été','["½ pastèque (environ 1½ kg), pelée, épépinée et coupée en morceaux","200 g de fromage feta en bloc, en cubes","une grosse poignée d''olives noires","une poignée de persil plat et de feuilles de menthe, hachées grossièrement","1 oignon rouge, finement tranché en rondelles","huile d''olive et vinaigre balsamique, pour servir","½ paquet de 500 g de mélange à pain blanc","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","1 blanc d''oeuf battu","un mélange de graines de sésame, de pavot et de fenouil, pour parsemer"]','["Préparez le pain selon le paquet\r\ninstructions avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive. Partir\r\nlever dans un endroit tiède pendant environ 1 h\r\njusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. Chauffer le four à\r\n220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7. Frappez le pain\r\ndoser et diviser en 6 morceaux. Sur un\r\nsurface farinée, étalez les pains comme\r\nfinement possible, puis transférer au four\r\nplateaux. Badigeonner de blanc d''oeuf et\r\nparsemer du mélange de graines. Cuire au four pour\r\nenviron 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés; si\r\nils gonflent, c''est encore mieux. Vous pourriez avoir besoin\r\npour le faire par lots. Les pains peuvent être\r\npréparé la veille et conservé dans un\r\nrécipient hermétique.","Dans un grand bol de service, mélanger légèrement\r\nle melon avec la feta et les olives.\r\nRépartir sur les herbes et les rondelles d''oignon,\r\npuis servir avec l''huile d''olive et le balsamique\r\npour arroser. Servir le tas de\r\npains croustillants à côté pour les casser\r\net utiliser pour ramasser la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:07:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10870,5093,'fr','Salade feta méditerranéenne avec vinaigrette à la grenade','La mélasse de grenade du Moyen-Orient donne à cette salade une délicieuse saveur','["2 poivrons rouges","3 aubergines moyennes coupées en morceaux ou 15 petites aubergines coupées en deux","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","cuillère à café de cannelle","200 g de haricots verts blanchis (utilisez-les surgelés si vous le pouvez)","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en demi-lunes","200 g de feta égouttée et émiettée","graines 1 grenade","une poignée de persil haché grossièrement","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Chauffer\r\nle gril à son réglage le plus élevé. Couper les poivrons\r\nen quartiers, puis placez-les, peau vers le haut,\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie. Griller jusqu''à ce qu''il soit noirci.\r\nPlacer dans un sac en plastique, fermer hermétiquement, puis laisser reposer\r\n5 minutes. Une fois suffisamment refroidi pour être manipulé, grattez\r\nretirez la peau, jetez-la, puis réservez les poivrons.","Disposez les aubergines sur une plaque allant au four,\r\narroser d''huile d''olive et de cannelle, puis\r\nassaisonner de sel et de poivre. Rôtir jusqu''à\r\ndoré et ramolli – environ 25 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez toute la vinaigrette\r\ningrédients et bien mélanger. Pour servir, placez le\r\naubergines, haricots verts, oignons et poivrons\r\nsur une grande assiette de service. Parsemer de feta\r\net des graines de grenade. Versez la vinaigrette\r\nterminer, puis terminer par le persil."]','2026-01-11 00:07:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10871,7771,'fr','Aïoli','Une touche crémeuse à l''ail, une trempette parfaite pour les légumes printaniers cuits à la vapeur','["une petite pincée de brins de safran","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 jaunes d''œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","300 ml d''huile d''olive"]','["Dans un petit bol, versez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau bouillante dessus \r\nle safran et réserver. Mettez l''ail, les jaunes d''œufs \r\net la moutarde dans un robot culinaire ou un mélangeur. Blitz \r\nen une pâte et arroser très lentement d''huile d''olive \r\npour faire une sauce épaisse façon mayonnaise. Quand \r\ntout est réuni, ajoute le safran, safran \r\neau et jus de citron, puis assaisonner au goût. Le \r\nL''aïoli se conserve couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 2 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:07:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10872,4865,'fr','Salade de pommes de terre méditerranéenne','Évitez la mayonnaise et optez pour une vinaigrette à l''huile d''olive à l''italienne pour des pommes de terre nouvelles chaudes. Égayez-les avec du basilic, du parmesan et des tomates séchées','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon, tranché finement","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à café d''origan, frais ou séché","½ boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","100 g de poivrons rouges rôtis, en bocal, tranchés","300 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux si elles sont grosses","25 g d''olives noires tranchées","poignée de feuilles de basilic déchirées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole, ajoutez l''oignon\r\net cuire 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez le\r\nl''ail et l''origan et cuire 1 min. Ajouter\r\nles tomates et les poivrons, assaisonnez bien\r\net laissez mijoter doucement pendant 10 min.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pommes de terre dans une poêle\r\nd''eau bouillante salée pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ntendre. Bien égoutter, mélanger avec la sauce et\r\nservir chaud, parsemé d''olives et de basilic."]','2026-01-11 00:07:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10873,7773,'fr','Pilaf au chorizo','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Se situant quelque part entre une paella et un risotto, ce pot de riz basmati mijoté a de profondes saveurs de paprika.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, tranché finement","250 g de chorizo ​​à cuire pour bébé, tranché","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","250 g de riz basmati","Bouillon de 600 ml","1 citron, le zeste pelé en lanières épaisses, plus des quartiers pour servir","2 feuilles de laurier fraîches","petit bouquet de persil haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle avec un couvercle.\r\nAjouter l''oignon et cuire 5 à 8 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés. Poussez sur le côté de\r\nla poêle et ajoutez le chorizo. Cuire jusqu''à\r\nlégèrement doré et certaines huiles sont\r\nlibéré dans la poêle.","Ajoutez l''ail et le paprika, puis le\r\ntomates. Faire bouillir à feu moyen\r\npendant 5 minutes, puis ajoutez le riz, le bouillon,\r\nle zeste de citron et les feuilles de laurier. Remuer\r\ntout bien ensemble et amener à\r\nl''ébullition. Mettez le couvercle et faites cuire\r\nà feu très doux pendant 12 min.","Éteignez le feu et laissez reposer et\r\ncuire à la vapeur pendant 10 à 15 minutes. Remuer à travers le\r\npersil et servir avec des quartiers de citron\r\npour presser."]','2026-01-11 00:07:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10874,7775,'fr','Épinards aux miettes de piment et de citron','Faites flétrir les légumes verts frais, puis servez-les avec de la chapelure croustillante, du piment et de l''ail pour un plat d''accompagnement sain et faible en gras.','["25g de beurre","100 g de chapelure fraîche","le zeste d''1 citron","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment rouge, finement haché","500g d''épinards"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une grande poêle,\r\npuis quand il commence à mousser, versez le\r\nchapelure, zeste, ail et piment.\r\nCuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Supprimer\r\nde la poêle, assaisonner et réserver.","Ajouter les épinards dans la poêle et les flétrir,\r\nen remuant. Assaisonner et servir avec le\r\nchapelure croustillante saupoudrée sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:07:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10875,7777,'fr','Plateau de poulet méditerranéen au four','Une pâtisserie tout-en-un colorée aux saveurs estivales','["2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en morceaux","1 oignon rouge, coupé en quartiers","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","4 poitrines de poulet avec la peau","½ paquet de 150 g de fromage à pâte molle entier à l''ail et aux herbes","200 g de tomates cerises","poignée d''olives noires"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger\r\nles poivrons et l''oignon sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie\r\nplateau avec la moitié de l’huile. Transférer au four\r\net faites cuire sur l''étagère du haut pendant 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites soigneusement une poche\r\nentre la peau et la chair de chacun\r\npoitrine de poulet, mais sans retirer la peau\r\ncomplètement. Poussez des quantités égales de\r\nfromage sous la peau, lisser la peau\r\nredescendez, badigeonnez-le avec le reste du\r\nhuile, assaisonner, puis ajouter dans le plateau le long\r\navec les tomates et les olives. Retour à\r\nle four et cuire encore 25-30 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le poulet soit doré et cuit.\r\nServir avec des pommes de terre au four, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10876,6837,'fr','Moules aux tomates et piment','Cette recette de fruits de mer épicés constitue un repas fantastique pour deux, mais peut être facilement augmentée pour une entrée élégante pour un dîner.','["2 tomates mûres","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 échalote, hachée finement","1 piment rouge ou vert épépiné et finement haché","petit verre de vin blanc sec","1 cuillère à café de concentré de tomate","pincée de sucre","1 kg de moules nettoyées","une bonne poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Mettez les tomates dans un bol résistant à la chaleur.\r\nCouvrir d''eau bouillante, laisser reposer 3 min,\r\npuis égouttez et pelez. Couper les tomates en quatre\r\net retirez et jetez les graines à l''aide\r\nune cuillère à café. Hachez grossièrement la chair des tomates.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle avec un couvercle hermétique.\r\ncouvercle adapté. Ajouter l''ail, l''échalote et le piment,\r\npuis faites frire doucement pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies.\r\nVersez le vin et ajoutez les tomates,\r\npâte, sucre et assaisonnement (moules\r\nsont naturellement salés, alors faites attention aux\r\nsel). Bien mélanger et laisser mijoter 2 minutes.","Versez les moules et remuez-les.\r\nCouvrir hermétiquement et cuire à la vapeur pendant 3 à 4 minutes,\r\nsecouer la poêle à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles coquilles se sont ouvertes.","Jetez toutes les coquilles qui restent fermées, puis\r\nrépartissez les moules dans deux bols et\r\najoutez les feuilles de basilic. Prévoir un grand bol pour\r\nles coquilles vides."]','2026-01-11 00:07:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10877,7779,'fr','Poulet méditerranéen aux légumes rôtis','Un plat sain, plein de saveurs du soleil','["250 g de pommes de terre nouvelles grelots, tranchées finement","1 grosse courgette, tranchée en diagonale","1 oignon rouge, coupé en quartiers","1 poivron jaune épépiné et coupé en morceaux","6 tomates italiennes fermes, coupées en deux","12 olives noires dénoyautées","2 filets de poitrine de poulet désossés et sans peau, environ 150 g/5 oz chacun","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de pesto vert"]','["Préchauffer le four à 200°C/\r\nFour gaz 6/chaleur tournante 180C.\r\nÉtalez les pommes de terre,\r\ncourgette, oignon, poivron\r\net les tomates dans un plat peu profond\r\nplat à rôtir et\r\nrépartir sur les olives.\r\nAssaisonner de sel et\r\nnoir grossièrement moulu\r\npoivre.","Coupez la chair de chacun\r\npoitrine de poulet 3-4 fois\r\nà l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, puis\r\ndéposer le poulet dessus\r\nles légumes.","Mélanger l''huile d''olive et le pesto\r\nensemble jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé\r\net répartir uniformément sur le\r\npoulet. Couvrir le moule avec\r\npapier d''aluminium et cuire 30\r\nminutes.","Retirez le papier d''aluminium du\r\nétain. Remettre au four et\r\ncuire encore 10 minutes\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles légumes sont juteux et\r\navoir l''air tentant de manger et le\r\nle poulet est bien cuit\r\n(le jus doit être clair lorsqu''on le pique avec une brochette)."]','2026-01-11 00:07:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10878,5061,'fr','Poivrons farcis aux courgettes et au quinoa','Prenez seulement 5 ingrédients et créez cette pâtisserie végétarienne saine de style méditerranéen pour un souper faible en calories et en gras.','["4 poivrons rouges","1 courgette coupée en quartiers dans le sens de la longueur et tranchée finement","2 paquets de 250 g de quinoa prêt à consommer","85 g de fromage feta finement émietté","une poignée de persil haché grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nCoupez chaque poivron en deux à travers le\r\ntige et retirez les graines. Mettez le\r\npoivrons, côté coupé vers le haut, sur une plaque à pâtisserie,\r\narroser d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive et assaisonner\r\neh bien. Rôtir pendant 15 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive\r\nune petite poêle, ajoutez la courgette\r\net cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Supprimer du\r\nchauffer, puis incorporer le quinoa,\r\nfeta et persil. Assaisonner de poivre.","Répartissez le mélange de quinoa entre\r\nles moitiés de poivron, puis retournez dans le\r\nfour pendant 5 minutes pour bien réchauffer. Servir\r\navec une salade verte, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10879,7781,'fr','Poisson enveloppé de pancetta et pommes de terre citronnées','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Enveloppez du poisson blanc durable dans du bacon croustillant et servez-le comme plat tout-en-un avec des pommes de terre.','["300 g de pommes de terre nouvelles","100 g de haricots verts","petite poignée d''olives noires Kalamata","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gros filets de lieu jaune ou un autre poisson blanc durable","4 tranches de pancetta ou de lard fumé tranché finement","quelques brins d''estragon, feuilles cueillies"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMettez les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau et\r\nfaire bouillir pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Ajoutez le\r\nharicots pendant les 2-3 dernières minutes. Bien égoutter\r\net coupez les pommes de terre en deux. Astuce dans\r\nun plat allant au four spacieux et mélanger avec le\r\nolives, zeste de citron et huile. Assaisonnez bien.","Assaisonner le poisson et l''envelopper avec le\r\npancetta ou bacon. Placer au-dessus de\r\nles pommes de terre. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien cuit, puis ajoutez un peu de jus\r\nde jus de citron et saupoudrer de\r\nestragon avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10880,7783,'fr','Escalopes d''agneau aux herbes et légumes rôtis','Un plateau sain de style méditerranéen avec des patates douces, des poivrons, des courgettes et des gros oignons.','["2 poivrons de n''importe quelle couleur, épépinés et coupés en gros morceaux","1 grosse patate douce, pelée et coupée en gros morceaux","2 courgettes coupées en morceaux","1 oignon rouge, coupé en quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 côtelettes d''agneau maigres","1 cuillère à soupe de feuille de thym hachée","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de menthe hachées"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7. Mettre\r\nles poivrons, patate douce, courgettes\r\net l''oignon sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie et\r\narroser d''huile. Assaisonner avec beaucoup de\r\npoivre noir moulu. Rôtir pendant 25 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, parez l''agneau d''autant\r\ngras que possible. Mélangez les herbes avec quelques\r\ntorsades de poivre noir moulu et tapotez\r\npartout dans l''agneau.","Sortez les légumes du four,\r\nretournez-le et poussez-le d''un côté du\r\nplateau. Disposez les escalopes sur le plateau chaud\r\net remettre au four 10 min.","Retourner les escalopes et cuire encore\r\n10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les légumes et l''agneau\r\nsont tendres et légèrement carbonisés. Mélanger\r\nle tout sur le plateau et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10881,7785,'fr','Toasts aux fèves et au fromage feta','Tranchez une baguette, faites-la griller, puis utilisez-la comme base de bruschetta pour des haricots et du fromage grec salé pour une bouchée saine.','["350 g de fèves, fraîches ou surgelées","100 g de fromage feta (ou alternative végétarienne), égoutté","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de menthe hachées ou râpées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","Sachet de 50 g de feuilles de salade mélangées","10 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","4 fines tranches de baguettes (blanches ou brunes)"]','["Portez à ébullition une petite casserole d''eau.\r\nAjouter les haricots, remettre à ébullition et\r\ncuire 4 min. Égoutter dans une passoire\r\nsous l''eau courante jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit froide. Presse\r\nchaque haricot retiré de sa peau dans un bol.","Émietter sur la feta et disperser\r\nsur les feuilles de menthe. Assaisonner avec un\r\nbonne mouture de poivre noir et un filet\r\navec 2 cuillères à café d''huile. Mélangez ensemble.","Mélanger les feuilles de salade et les tomates\r\navec le reste d''huile d''olive et de citron\r\njus. Répartir dans 2 assiettes. Toast\r\nle pain sous le grill ou au grille-pain\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants des deux côtés.\r\nPour servir, versez les haricots et le fromage\r\nmélange sur les toasts chauds et déposer\r\nà côté de la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:07:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10882,7787,'fr','Poivrons farcis faciles','Un souper de quinze minutes qui ne vous laissera pas rassasié','["4 poivrons rouges","2 sachets de 250 g de riz aux tomates cuit (nous avons utilisé de la tomate méditerranéenne Tilda Rizazz)","2 cuillères à soupe de pesto","une poignée d''olives noires dénoyautées, hachées","200 g de fromage de chèvre tranché"]','["Utilisez un petit couteau pour couper le dessus\r\nles poivrons, puis retirez les graines. Asseyez-vous le\r\npoivrons dans une assiette, côté coupé vers le haut, et cuire\r\nau micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nils se sont fanés et ramollis.","Pendant que les poivrons cuisent, mélangez le\r\nle riz avec le pesto et les olives et\r\nles deux tiers du fromage. Versez le riz dans\r\nles poivrons, garnir du reste de chèvre\r\nfromage et poursuivre la cuisson 8 à 10 minutes"]','2026-01-11 00:07:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10883,7789,'fr','Tranches méditerranéennes','Conservez les tranches de poivrons rôtis, la pâte feuilletée et les artichauts au congélateur et vous ne serez plus jamais à court d''une entrée intelligente.','["Paquet de 375 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","4 cuillères à soupe de pesto vert","140 g de poivrons rôtis tranchés surgelés","140 g d''artichauts surgelés (environ 3 quartiers par portion)","125 g de boule de mozzarella ou 85 g de cheddar kidnappé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.  \r\nDéroulez la pâte et coupez-la en 4 rectangles. \r\nPrenez un couteau bien aiguisé et marquez un bord de 1 cm \r\nà l''intérieur de chaque rectangle, en prenant soin de \r\nne coupez pas complètement la pâte. \r\nPlacer sur une plaque à pâtisserie.","Étalez 1 cuillère à soupe de pesto sur chaque tranche, \r\nrester à l''intérieur de la frontière, puis entasser les \r\npoivrons et artichauts. Cuire au four pendant \r\n15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte commence à dorer.","Déchirez la boule de mozzarella en petits morceaux, \r\npuis dispersez-le (ou utilisez du cheddar, si vous préférez) \r\nsur les légumes. Remettre au four 5 à 7 minutes \r\njusqu''à ce que la pâte soit croustillante et que le fromage soit bien \r\nfondu. Servir avec une salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:07:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10884,7790,'fr','Scones méditerranéens','De nouvelles saveurs dans un vieux favori – idéal pour les matins de café ou une collation l''après-midi','["350 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","¼ cuillère à café de sel","50 g de beurre coupé en morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 moitiés de tomates séchées italiennes, hachées grossièrement","100 g de fromage feta en cubes","10 olives noires dénoyautées et coupées en deux","300 ml de lait entier","1 œuf battu pour glacer"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7. Beurrer une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Dans un grand bol, mélanger la farine, la levure chimique et le sel. Frottez le beurre avec l''huile jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de fines miettes, puis ajoutez les tomates, le fromage et les olives. Faites un puits au centre, versez le lait et mélangez avec un couteau, en effectuant un mouvement de coupe, jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle « collante ». (Utilisez tout le lait – cela donne une texture légère.) Ne manipulez pas trop la pâte.","Farinez bien vos mains et le plan de travail et façonnez la pâte en rond d''environ 3 à 4 cm d''épaisseur. Coupez-les en huit quartiers et disposez-les bien espacés sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Badigeonner d''œuf battu et cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé, doré et élastique au toucher. Transférer sur une grille et couvrir d''un torchon propre pour les garder moelleux. Ceux-ci sont meilleurs servis chauds et beurrés. Se conserve 2 à 3 jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:07:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10885,7792,'fr','Salade méditerranéenne de figues et mozzarella','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Si vous souhaitez rendre cela plus substantiel, vous pouvez servir du prosciutto ou du jambon Serrano avec.','["200 g de haricots verts fins, parés","6 petites figues, coupées en quartiers","1 échalote, tranchée finement","1 boule de 125 g de mozzarella, égouttée et coupée en morceaux","50 g de noisettes grillées et hachées","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic déchirées","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","1 cuillère à soupe de confiture de figues ou de relish","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Dans une grande casserole d''eau salée,\r\nblanchir les haricots pendant 2-3 minutes. Égoutter, rincer\r\ndans l''eau froide, puis égouttez-les sur du papier absorbant.\r\nDisposer sur un plateau. Garnir de figues,\r\néchalotes, mozzarella, noisettes et basilic.","Dans un petit bol ou un pot de confiture avec couvercle,\r\najoutez le vinaigre, la confiture de figues, l''huile d''olive et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement. Bien agiter et verser\r\nsur la salade juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10886,7794,'fr','Poivrons rôtis aux tomates et anchois','Ce plat vibrant a toutes les saveurs de la Méditerranée pour les repas de fêtes à la maison','["4 poivrons rouges, coupés en deux et épépinés","50g boîte d''anchois à l''huile égouttés","8 petites tomates, coupées en deux","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","2 brins de romarin","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nMettez les poivrons dans un grand plat allant au four\r\nplat, mélanger avec un peu d''huile du\r\nboîte d''anchois, puis retourner le côté coupé vers le haut. Rôti\r\npendant 40 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit mou mais pas effondré.","Coupez 8 anchois le long de leur\r\nlongueur. Mettez 2 moitiés de tomate, plusieurs\r\ntranches d''ail, quelques petites branches de romarin\r\net deux morceaux d''anchois dans le creux\r\nde chaque poivron. Arroser d''huile d''olive,\r\npuis rôtissez à nouveau pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles tomates sont tendres et les poivrons sont\r\nrempli de flaques de jus savoureux. Laisser refroidir\r\net servir tiède ou à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:07:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10887,7796,'fr','Cuisson de pâtes Elote (maïs de rue mexicain)','Essayez cette variante de pâtes au four, inspirée des saveurs de l''elote préférée de la cuisine de rue mexicaine : des épis de maïs carbonisés garnis de mayonnaise, de fromage, d''herbes et de piments.','["50g de beurre salé","1 cuillère à café de moutarde en poudre","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","20g de farine nature","350 ml de lait entier","175 g de cheddar doux râpé","100g de crème sure","25 g de jalapeños marinés, finement hachés","250 g de pâtes (nous avons utilisé des spirali)","Morrisons 2 épis de maïs doux","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","125 g de mozzarella râpée"]','["Faites fondre 20 g de beurre dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et, une fois mousseux, ajoutez la moutarde en poudre et les épices et faites griller pendant 30 secondes. Saupoudrer de farine et cuire 2 minutes en remuant continuellement. Versez lentement le lait en remuant continuellement jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse. Porter à ébullition, puis réduire le feu et laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe légèrement.","Retirer du feu et incorporer le cheddar et la crème sure jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu et que tout soit incorporé. Ajouter les jalapeños et bien assaisonner de sel et de poivre. Faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les bien.","Pendant ce temps, faites fondre les 30 g de beurre restant dans une poêle à feu moyen et, une fois mousseux, faites cuire le maïs doux pendant 5 à 6 minutes, en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et carbonisé. Versez la majeure partie du maïs doux dans la sauce au fromage avec les pâtes cuites et les oignons nouveaux. Bien mélanger et assaisonner au goût.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Versez les pâtes dans un grand plat allant au four et saupoudrez de mozzarella et du reste de maïs doux carbonisé. Glisser sous le gril pendant 5 à 6 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bouillonnant. Laissez reposer 10 min, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10888,7798,'fr','Flan','Préparez ce flan crémeux et délicieux inspiré de la recette mexicaine classique : il est facile à préparer et peut être préparé la veille.','["120 g de sucre en poudre","5 œufs moyens, à température ambiante","½-1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","397 g de lait concentré","400 ml de lait concentré","150 ml de lait entier"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Versez le sucre semoule dans une grande casserole avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et faites cuire à feu vif sans remuer jusqu''à ce que le sucre commence à se dissoudre. Une fois que le sucre a commencé à se dissoudre, vous pouvez faire tourner la casserole de temps en temps jusqu''à obtenir un caramel doré et de couleur uniforme, environ 5 minutes. (Il est crucial que le sucre se dissolve complètement pour y parvenir.) Dès que le mélange s''est transformé en caramel, versez-le dans un moule à flan de 20 cm (il ne doit pas s''agir d''un moule à fond amovible), en inclinant le moule d''avant en arrière pour bien enrober le fond. Laisser refroidir.","Fouetter les œufs et la vanille dans un grand bol, puis incorporer vigoureusement les laits concentré, évaporé et entier jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez la crème anglaise dans le moule et couvrez de papier d''aluminium en scellant bien le bord. Placez le moule dans une plaque à pâtisserie à bords hauts (environ 5 cm de profondeur) et versez l''eau bouillante de la bouilloire dans la plaque de manière à ce qu''elle atteigne environ la moitié du côté du moule. Transférer la plaque au four et cuire au four pendant 50 minutes.","Retirez délicatement le moule du plateau et retirez le papier d''aluminium. Posez le moule sur un plan de travail et laissez refroidir environ 30 minutes. Une fois juste chaud, couvrez et réfrigérez pendant au moins 6 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Au moment de servir, passez un couteau à couverts sur le pourtour du moule, puis posez une grande assiette de service (utilisez une assiette avec un rebord, car le caramel va s''écouler) sur le moule et retournez-le rapidement. Couper en quartiers pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10889,7800,'fr','couloir de taupe','Préparez l''une des recettes les plus emblématiques du Mexique, le mole, une sauce à base de piments, d''épices et de chocolat noir. Utiliser comme garniture sur les enchiladas et la viande','["4 piments pasilla séchés, graines et tiges enlevées","3 piments guajillo séchés, graines et tiges enlevées","2 tomates moyennes","1 oignon , coupé en quartiers","1 poire, coupée en deux mais le cœur reste dedans","2 gousses d''ail","40g de graines de sésame","60 g de cacahuètes blanchies","5g de bâton de cannelle","3 clous de girofle","½ cuillère à café d''origan","½ cuillère à café de coriandre","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","10 grains de poivre noir","3 cuillères à soupe de saindoux de porc ou d''huile de tournesol","300 à 400 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","45g de chocolat noir"]','["Allumez le gril à puissance élevée. Disposez les piments séchés sur une plaque et faites-les griller 1 min de chaque côté pour les carboniser. Transférez-les dans un pichet ou un bol et couvrez d''eau chaude pour réhydrater pendant 10 minutes.","Mettez les tomates, l''oignon, la poire et l''ail sur une plaque et faites-les noircir sous le grill pendant environ 10 minutes en retournant les tomates à mi-cuisson. Cela peut prendre plus ou moins de temps, selon votre gril, alors gardez un œil sur eux. Sortez-les et réservez.","Pendant que les légumes carbonisent, faites griller les graines de sésame et les cacahuètes dans une poêle sèche à feu moyen. Retirer de la poêle et réserver.","Dans la même poêle, ajoutez toutes les épices et faites griller 1 min. Retirez-les du feu et réservez avec les noix.","Mettez les piments trempés (en réservant le liquide), les légumes carbonisés, la poire, les noix et les épices dans un mixeur à grande vitesse en ajoutant environ 200 ml d''eau des piments et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très lisses.","Dans une grande marmite en fonte ou une poêle à couvercle, faire fondre le saindoux de porc ou l''huile de tournesol à feu vif. Versez le mole et faites revenir 3 minutes en remuant continuellement. Ajoutez environ 100 ml de bouillon de légumes et baissez le feu en laissant mijoter doucement quelques minutes.","Incorporer la purée de tomates, le chocolat et ½ cuillère à soupe de sel marin, mélanger pour bien combiner le tout. Ajoutez un peu plus de bouillon (50-100 ml) et mélangez. Faites cuire la taupe pendant 1 h en l''incorporant de temps en temps au bouillon de légumes pour éviter qu''elle ne brûle ou ne sèche. Vous voulez que ce soit la consistance d''une pâte lâche. La taupe est prête lorsqu''une couche d''huile apparaît à la surface. Servir sur de la viande avec du riz ou utiliser pour garnir des enchiladas."]','2026-01-11 00:07:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10890,7802,'fr','Cassé au boeuf','Servez des enchiladas pour un festin familial d''inspiration mexicaine. Farcis de bœuf haché et de haricots noirs et garnis de fromage fondu, ils plairont à coup sûr à tout le monde.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive ou de colza","1 oignon , finement haché","400 g de bœuf haché","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées ou finement râpées","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","½-1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 g de haricots noirs en boîte","1 cube de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet","8 tortillas moyennes","100 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","feuilles de coriandre, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou une casserole à feu moyen-doux et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli mais pas doré. Versez le bœuf haché et continuez à faire frire jusqu''à ce que le bœuf soit doré, environ 5 minutes. Incorporer l''ail et cuire 1 à 2 minutes avant d''incorporer l''origan, le cumin, le paprika et la poudre de piment, le cas échéant. Cuire encore 1 min.","Ajouter le concentré de tomates, les tomates et les haricots noirs, y compris le liquide de la boîte de haricots. Émietter dans le cube de bouillon. Remuez bien, puis ajoutez une demi-boîte d''eau et portez à ébullition. Laisser mijoter 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe. Retirer du feu.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Verser un huitième du mélange de bœuf au centre de l''une des tortillas, puis replier les côtés pour enfermer la garniture. Disposez le côté joint vers le bas dans un grand plat allant au four et répétez jusqu''à ce que toute la garniture et les tortillas aient été utilisées, en plaçant les enchiladas les unes à côté des autres. Répartissez le fromage sur le dessus et faites cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu et que les tortillas soient dorées. Répartir sur les feuilles de coriandre pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10891,7804,'fr','Tacos tinga au poulet','Essayez un plat mexicain classique ; un délicieux ragoût de poulet râpé avec une touche de chipotle. Il peut être consommé sur des tostadas de maïs ou dans des tacos.','["3 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau (environ 650 g)","3 tomates italiennes coupées en deux (environ 300 g)","1 oignon, coupé en deux","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2-3 piments chipotle en sauce adobo, émincés","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","12 tortillas de pain de maïs de 12 cm","oignons rouges marinés (voir recette ci-dessous)","200 g de queso fresco ou feta émiette","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre","4 citrons verts, coupés en quartiers"]','["Mettez le poulet dans une casserole moyenne, ajoutez les tomates, une des moitiés d''oignon, l''ail, 1 cuillère à café de sel et 500 ml d''eau. Porter à ébullition à feu vif, puis baisser le feu pour laisser mijoter. Mettez le couvercle et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Éteignez le feu et laissez refroidir légèrement.","Tranchez finement l’oignon restant. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-doux et faites revenir les tranches d''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient translucides et légèrement dorées, environ 5 minutes. Pendant ce temps, émincez le poulet cuit à l''aide de deux fourchettes ou de vos mains, en réservant le bouillon et les légumes cuits. Annuler.","Mettez les tomates cuites, la compote d''oignons et l''ail dans un mixeur avec les piments chipotle et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Mélangez la sauce, 150 ml du bouillon de poulet réservé et l''origan séché dans la poêle avec les oignons frits. Mélangez bien et réduisez le feu à doux, couvrez la casserole et laissez mijoter pendant 15 minutes pour que les saveurs se mélangent. Incorporer le poulet émincé pour le réchauffer, environ 1 à 2 minutes. Retirer la casserole du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement pendant environ 3 à 5 minutes. Servez le poulet tinga sur des tortillas chaudes ou des tostadas de maïs ou saupoudrez-le de vos garnitures préférées (nous avons utilisé de la feta émiettée, des oignons rouges marinés et de la coriandre). Servir les quartiers de citron vert à côté pour les presser."]','2026-01-11 00:07:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10892,3760,'fr','Salade de tacos aux tomates et haricots noirs','Savourez cette salade de tacos rafraîchissante lors d''une soirée chaude lorsque vous avez envie de quelque chose de rapide, frais et croquant, ou en accompagnement d''un festin à la mexicaine.','["1 citron vert, jus","12 g de coriandre finement hachée","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 piment jalapeño (épépiné si vous préférez moins de piquant), finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","1 laitue romaine , hachée","Boîte de 198 g de maïs doux égoutté","1 poivron rouge, finement haché","4 coquilles à tacos croustillantes","25g de graines de citrouille"]','["Mélangez le jus de citron vert, la coriandre, le cumin, le jalapeño et l''huile dans un bol. Assaisonnez bien.","Ajoutez les haricots, les tomates, la laitue, le maïs et le poivron rouge. Mélanger pour combiner. Émietter les coquilles de tacos et mélanger pour bien enrober le tout de vinaigrette. Répartissez dessus les graines de citrouille et servez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:07:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10893,7806,'fr','Poivrons farcis à la mexicaine','Farcir les poivrons de riz et de haricots noirs, puis garnir de fromage chili et de guacamole frais pour un repas familial végétarien facile. Si les enfants n''aiment pas les épices, utilisez plutôt un fromage doux','["3 gros poivrons mélangés, coupés en deux","huile, pour arroser","2 sachets de 250 g de riz citron vert & coriandre, cuit","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","6 tranches de fromage chili à la mexicaine (utilisez du cheddar ordinaire ou du monterey jack, si vous le souhaitez)","150 g de guacamole frais"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Retirez les graines et la peau blanche des poivrons et disposez-les, côté coupé vers le haut, dans un plat à rôtir. Arrosez d''huile et assaisonnez, puis enfournez pour 20 min.","Mélangez le riz et les haricots. Sortez les poivrons du four et remplissez-les du mélange de riz. Garnir chacun d''une tranche de fromage et cuire au four encore 10 à 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le riz soit fondu et que la garniture soit chaude. Garnir de cuillerées de guacamole."]','2026-01-11 00:07:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10894,5655,'fr','Bol de tacos au bœuf épicé','Obtenez cinq de vos cinq par jour dans ce bol à tacos au bœuf épicé d''inspiration mexicaine. Plein de textures et de saveurs, il peut être en partie préparé à l''avance','["1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 gros poivron rouge, épépiné et coupé finement en dés","500 g de bœuf haché 5 % de matière grasse","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","Boîte de 200 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","20 g de coriandre, tiges hachées, feuilles réservées","2 oignons rouges, tranchés finement","2 citrons verts, jus","2 sachets de 250 g de riz basmati complet cuit au micro-ondes","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","Boîte de 198 g de maïs doux (sans sel ni sucre)","2 petits avocats, tranchés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir le poivron pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir. Ajouter le bœuf, la pâte chipotle et les épices et cuire en remuant pour décomposer la viande pendant quelques minutes. Incorporer les tomates, la purée de tomates, les tiges de coriandre, 150 ml d''eau et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis couvrir. Laisser mijoter 20 minutes pour bien cuire et réduire un peu. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours, ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler soigneusement et réchauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les oignons dans le jus de citron vert dans un bol et laissez mariner.","Lorsque le hachis est prêt, réchauffez le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Versez le riz cuit dans quatre bols de service, puis ajoutez le bœuf et garnissez chacun d''eux avec un quart des haricots noirs, des tomates cerises et du maïs, un demi-avocat (étalez les tranches, si vous le souhaitez) et les feuilles de coriandre. Versez dessus les oignons marinés avec le jus de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:07:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10895,3868,'fr','Chocolat chaud mexicain','Assurez-vous d''ajouter une finition mousseuse à ce chocolat chaud mexicain, réchauffant et épicé de cannelle, de vanille et de piment.','["500 ml de lait entier","2 bâtons de cannelle (utilisez des bâtons de cannelle mexicains pour un goût nettement floral et plus sucré), plus un peu pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de cacao noir (voir astuce ci-dessous)","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade"]','["Versez le lait dans une casserole moyenne, ajoutez les bâtons de cannelle et remuez fréquemment à feu moyen (ne laissez pas bouillir) jusqu''à ce que le lait soit parfumé, environ 5 minutes.","Retirez et jetez les bâtons de cannelle, puis ajoutez le cacao, la vanille, la poudre de piment et le sucre. Retirer du feu et fouetter jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et mousseux – cela ne prendra que quelques minutes. Répartir dans deux tasses et garnir de bâtons de cannelle fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:07:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10896,4311,'fr','Enchiladas au poulet','Utilisez des pains plats complets faits maison au lieu des tortillas du commerce dans cette recette – parfaits pour envelopper notre poulet maigre et épicé. Cela compte aussi pour 3 de vos 5 par jour','["90 g de farine complète, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","3 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","120g de yaourt bio","2 cuillères à café de poudre de piment doux","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","1 citron vert, zesté et à moitié jus","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau, tranchées (300 g)","1 petit avocat","15 g de coriandre fraîche hachée"]','["Versez la farine dans un petit bol. Mélangez 1 cuillère à café d''huile avec 60 ml d''eau, ajoutez à la farine et remuez avec la lame d''un couteau à couverts jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à se rassembler. Utilisez vos mains pour former une boule avec le mélange, puis coupez-la en deux et couvrez-la d''un torchon.","Mélangez 2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt avec la poudre de piment, l''ail et le zeste de citron vert, puis ajoutez l''oignon, le poivre et le poulet et remuez bien pour enrober. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen, ajoutez le mélange de poulet et faites cuire en remuant de temps en temps pendant environ 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, farinez légèrement le plan de travail et faites chauffer une très grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen, sans ajouter d’huile. Abaissez l''une des boules de pâte en un cercle rugueux d''environ 25 cm de diamètre jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fine comme du papier, puis décollez délicatement le plan de travail et placez-la dans la poêle. La pâte va cuire en une minute, puis se retourner et cuire encore quelques secondes. Soulever sur une assiette et cuire l''autre boule de pâte de la même manière.","Écrasez grossièrement l''avocat avec le jus de citron vert et étalez-le sur les pains plats, recouvrez du mélange de poulet et du reste du yaourt et parsemez de coriandre. Roulez les enchiladas et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10897,6215,'fr','Burritos de riz épicés','Les wraps complets faits maison farcis de riz épicé aux tomates et à l''avocat constituent l''amuse-gueule parfait','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza, plus 2 cuillères à café","2 oignons (320 g), finement hachés","150 g de riz basmati brun","2-3 cuillères à café de poudre de piment doux","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue et de cumin","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","180 g de farine complète d''épeautre, plus un peu pour saupoudrer et un peu pour saupoudrer","2 avocats","1 citron vert, jus","4 grosses feuilles de laitue iceberg (environ 120g)","Boîte de 198 g de maïs doux égoutté","120 g de yaourt bio en pot","15 g de coriandre finement hachée","12 olives Kalamata, coupées en deux"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez les oignons et faites cuire 10 minutes à feu moyen. Incorporez le riz et les épices, versez les tomates avec un bidon d''eau et le concentré de tomates, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 25 min. Incorporez les haricots, retirez le couvercle, ramenez à ébullition et laissez cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, versez la farine dans un petit bol. Mélangez les 2 cuillères à café d''huile avec 115 ml d''eau froide, puis dans la farine et remuez avec la lame d''un couteau à couverts jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à former une pâte molle. Utilisez vos mains pour former une boule avec le mélange, puis coupez-la en quatre et couvrez-la d''un torchon en attendant que le riz cuise et refroidisse.","Farinez légèrement le plan de travail et faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen, sans ajouter d''huile. Étalez l''une des boules de pâte en un cercle rugueux d''environ 25 cm, fin comme du papier. Décollez délicatement le plan de travail et glissez-le dans la poêle. La pâte va cuire en une minute, puis se retourner et cuire encore quelques secondes. Poser sur une assiette et cuire le reste de pâte de la même manière. Couvrez les wraps jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Écrasez grossièrement les avocats avec le jus de citron vert. Disposez les feuilles de laitue entières sur les wraps, puis ajoutez une couche de riz, parsemez de maïs doux, puis garnissez d''avocat, de yaourt, de coriandre et d''olives. Roulez soigneusement en burritos. Enveloppez deux des burritos dans du papier sulfurisé et conservez-les au réfrigérateur pendant la nuit. Ils se conserveront au frais jusqu''à une journée. Si vous les mettez dans une boîte à lunch, utilisez un sac de glace pour les garder au frais."]','2026-01-11 00:07:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10898,5359,'fr','Poulet effiloché et chili aux haricots noirs','Préparez un lot de poulet effiloché d''inspiration mexicaine et de piment aux haricots noirs, qui peut être facilement doublé et conservé au congélateur. Servir avec du riz ou des tortillas','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 oignons, tranchés","4 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe d''origan","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","3 cuillères à soupe de chipotle en adobo ou 1 cuillère à café de pâte de chipotle","350g en purée","1⁄2 bouillon de poulet shot ou cube","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés mais non rincés","1⁄2 citron vert, jus","riz ou tortillas cuits, coriandre, feta, quartiers de lime et oignon rouge haché, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole peu profonde ou une cocotte avec un couvercle. Ajoutez les oignons et faites cuire à feu moyen-doux pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez le poulet et augmentez le feu à moyen. Incorporer l''ail, une petite pincée de sucre, l''origan, les graines de cumin et un peu d''assaisonnement. Cuire quelques minutes, puis ajouter le chipotle et cuire encore quelques minutes. Versez la passata, 100 ml d''eau et ajoutez le bouillon. Assaisonner et porter à ébullition.","Couvrir avec un couvercle et cuire 40 à 50 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre. Râpez le poulet dans la sauce à l''aide de deux fourchettes, puis incorporez les haricots. Laissez mijoter encore 5 minutes, puis éteignez le feu. Pressez le jus de citron vert. Peut être conservé au frais pendant trois jours et congelé jusqu''à deux mois. Décongeler soigneusement et réchauffer. Servir avec du riz ou des tortillas et un peu de coriandre, de feta, de quartiers de lime et d''oignon rouge en accompagnement, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10899,7808,'fr','Enchiladas au chou','Emballez la saveur avec ces enchiladas au bœuf plus légères et épicées. Délicieuses et sans gluten, elles sont faites avec des feuilles de chou au lieu des tortillas habituelles','["1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive ou de colza","2 poivrons épépinés et finement hachés","500 g de steak haché 5 % de matière grasse","2 cuillères à soupe de paprika fumé, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon de légumes (assurez-vous qu''il est sans gluten si nécessaire)","3 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché, plus un peu pour servir","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs non égouttés","1 gros chou chéri, feuilles pelées (il vous faudra 12 feuilles)","150 g de yaourt bio","25 g de cheddar affiné finement râpé","une poignée de coriandre hachée et des quartiers de citron vert, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive profonde et faites revenir brièvement les poivrons jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez le bœuf et continuez à frire en le brisant avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce qu''il brunisse, puis incorporez les épices et laissez cuire encore 1 min. Versez les tomates, la purée de tomates, le bouillon, la poudre, l''ail, le piment et les haricots (avec le liquide des boîtes) et laissez mijoter à découvert pendant 15 minutes, en remuant jusqu''à ce que le bœuf soit cuit et que le mélange soit épais.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition une grande casserole d’eau. Ajouter les feuilles de chou et cuire immergées pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies. Rincer sous l''eau froide courante pour refroidir. Vidange.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. En travaillant avec une feuille de chou à la fois, versez un peu du mélange de viande au centre. Enroulez pour que la garniture soit enfermée. Disposer la couture vers le bas dans un grand plat peu profond allant au four. Répétez avec le reste des feuilles et la garniture, en plaçant les rouleaux les uns contre les autres dans le plat.","Mélangez le yaourt et le fromage. Répartir sur les rouleaux. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le bouillon bouillonne. Saupoudrer de coriandre, de piment supplémentaire et de paprika. Servir avec des quartiers de citron vert en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:07:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10900,6535,'fr','Tarte tamale au pain de maïs','Essayez ce chili d''inspiration mexicaine avec une garniture au pain de maïs. Cela demande un peu d''effort, mais il peut être congelé pendant des jours lorsque vous avez besoin d''un souper réconfortant rapide.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou d''arachide","900 g de bœuf haché","200 g de chorizo ​​à cuire haché","2 oignons, hachés grossièrement","2 poivrons rouges, coupés en deux, épépinés et tranchés","2 piments épépinés et finement hachés","3 gousses d''ail, râpées","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","500 ml de bouillon de bœuf ou de poulet","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à café de cassonade foncée","½ citron vert, jus","10 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement","1-2 cuillères à café de sauce piquante Buffalo, ou une autre sauce piquante, au goût","150 g de semoule de maïs ou polenta","130 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","3 piments verts, coupés en deux, épépinés et finement tranchés","3 oignons nouveaux, parés et hachés","3 cuillères à soupe de coriandre finement hachée","155 ml de lait","45 g de beurre fondu et refroidi","2 gros œufs, légèrement battus","100g de maïs doux","115 g de cheddar extra-fort, râpé","2 avocats mûrs, dénoyautés, pelés, coupés en deux et hachés","1 citron vert, jus","15g de coriandre, feuilles cueillies","crème sure ou yaourt grec"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir le bœuf haché jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré – vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots. Transférer le hachis doré dans un bol à l''aide d''une écumoire. Ajoutez le chorizo ​​dans la poêle et faites-le dorer pendant quelques minutes, puis ajoutez-le au bol avec le hachis.","Ajouter les oignons et les poivrons dans la poêle et faire revenir à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient dorés et les poivrons tendres, environ 15 minutes. Ajoutez les piments, l''ail, le cumin et la cannelle et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes.","Remettez le bœuf et le chorizo ​​dans la poêle, puis versez-y les tomates en conserve, les haricots noirs égouttés, le bouillon et le concentré de tomates. Porter juste sous l’ébullition, puis réduire le feu pour laisser mijoter. Ajoutez le sucre, le jus de citron vert et un peu d''assaisonnement. Couvrez légèrement en laissant juste une petite ouverture sur un côté pour que la vapeur puisse s''échapper et laissez cuire 50 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Au cours des 10 dernières minutes de cuisson, incorporez la coriandre et la sauce piquante, ainsi qu''un peu plus d''assaisonnement. Le piment doit être épais mais pas sec – s’il est trop sec, ajoutez-y un peu d’eau. Verser dans un plat à tarte d''environ 1,5 litre ou un plat allant au four. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Pour faire la garniture au pain de maïs, mélangez la semoule de maïs ou la polenta, la farine, une grosse pincée de sel, le sucre, les piments, les oignons nouveaux et la coriandre. Mélangez le lait, le beurre et les œufs dans un bol. Versez les ingrédients humides sur les ingrédients secs, puis ajoutez le maïs doux et le fromage. Remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, en prenant soin de ne pas trop mélanger, puis verser des cuillerées sur la surface du piment. À ce stade, la tarte peut être congelée. Laisser d''abord refroidir complètement, puis envelopper dans une couche de papier sulfurisé puis une double couche de papier d''aluminium. Se conserve au congélateur jusqu''à deux mois.","Cuire au four pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré dans le pain de maïs (en prenant soin de ne pas pénétrer jusqu''au piment) en ressorte propre. Pour cuire du surgelé, chauffez le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Déballez la tarte et faites cuire au four pendant 1 h à 1 h 10 min, ou jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit très chaude et que la garniture soit bien cuite. Si le dessus commence à devenir trop foncé, couvrez de papier d''aluminium.","Lorsque vous êtes presque prêt à servir, mettez l''avocat dans un bol de service, pressez-le avec le jus de citron vert, puis ajoutez les feuilles de coriandre et mélangez délicatement. Servir avec la tarte avec de la crème sure ou du yaourt grec, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10901,7810,'fr','Brochettes de fajita halloumi barbecue','Vous aimez les fajitas ? Ces versions halloumi grillées seront gagnantes. La cuisson du fromage, des poivrons et des oignons au barbecue confère une saveur fumée','["3 poivrons (de n''importe quelle couleur), coupés en quartiers","2 gros oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","2 blocs de halloumi de 250 g, coupés en deux puis en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 avocats mûrs, coupés en deux et dénoyautés","1 gros citron vert, jus","8 tortillas moelleuses","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies","120 g de crème sure","sauce chili chipotle, pour servir (facultatif)","1 ½ cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","½ cuillère à café de poudre d''ail","4 brochettes en métal"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients du mélange d''épices. Allumez le barbecue et attendez que les braises soient cendrées.","Mettez les poivrons, les oignons et le halloumi dans un bol, arrosez d''huile, saupoudrez du mélange d''épices et assaisonnez de sel et de poivre. Mélangez délicatement pour enrober les légumes et le fromage, en prenant soin de ne pas briser le halloumi. Enfiler alternativement les poivrons, les oignons et le fromage sur les brochettes.","Versez la chair de l''avocat dans un bol avec le jus de citron vert et une pincée de sel. Écrasez le tout avec une fourchette et réservez jusqu''à ce que vous soyez prêt à manger.","Cuire les brochettes au barbecue 5 à 8 min de chaque côté (cela dépend de la chaleur du barbecue). Les poivrons, oignons et halloumi doivent être tendres et carbonisés par endroits. Pendant ce temps, réchauffez les tortillas sur le barbecue, puis enveloppez-les dans un torchon propre pour les garder au chaud.","Servez les brochettes avec les tortillas, l''avocat écrasé, la coriandre et la crème sure, ainsi qu''un peu de sauce chili chipotle, si vous le souhaitez, puis laissez chacun creuser pour assembler ses propres fajitas."]','2026-01-11 00:07:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10902,7812,'fr','Chili con carne au poulet','Vous n''aimez pas trop la viande rouge ? Essayez notre version au poulet du chili con carne, avec toute la richesse du plat classique. C''est le dîner parfait sur le canapé pendant les nuits froides','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, tranché","2 poivrons mélangés, tranchés (utilisez des poivrons rouges, jaunes ou orange)","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges finement hachées et feuilles grossièrement hachées","½ cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1-2 cuillères à café de pâte de chipotle","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","300 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 petit bâton de cannelle","4 cuisses de poulet, avec os","400 g de haricots noirs en boîte","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","20 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao)","riz cuit ou chips tortilla","guacamole et crème sure (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon et les poivrons pendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez l''ail, les tiges de coriandre, la coriandre moulue, le cumin et la pâte de chipotle, et faites revenir encore 2 minutes. Versez les tomates, le concentré de tomates et le bouillon, puis ajoutez le bâton de cannelle. Incorporez les cuisses de poulet dans le mélange, puis réduisez le feu à doux et laissez mijoter à couvert pendant 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre. Retirez le poulet de la cocotte et transférez-le sur une planche à découper, puis effilochez la viande des os à l''aide de deux fourchettes.","Remettez le poulet émincé dans la poêle, puis versez-y les haricots noirs ainsi que le liquide de la boîte, les haricots rouges égouttés, le vinaigre et le chocolat. Bien mélanger pour combiner tous les ingrédients et faire fondre le chocolat, puis augmenter le feu à moyen et laisser mijoter à découvert pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange ait légèrement épaissi.","Retirez le bâton de cannelle, assaisonnez selon votre goût et remuez la plupart ou la totalité des feuilles de coriandre (vous pouvez réserver quelques feuilles pour les disperser à la fin, si vous le souhaitez). Servir le piment avec du riz ou des chips tortilla, garni de guacamole et de crème sure, le cas échéant, et parsemer du reste de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:07:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10903,7814,'fr','Chili con carne fumé','Ajoutez du chipotle et faites d''abord dorer le hachis pour un chili con carne hors du commun. Avec des tonnes de saveurs, cela deviendra bientôt votre recette de chili préférée…','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","400 g de bœuf haché","1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","1-2 cuillères à café de pâte de chipotle","1 cuillère à soupe de concentré de tomate","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de levure","1 cube de bouillon de boeuf","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs ou rouges","riz cuit","crème sure","jalapeños tranchés dans un bocal, égouttés","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre","1 petit oignon, haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte ou une casserole peu profonde à feu moyen, puis faites frire le bœuf pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que toute la graisse soit libérée et que le bœuf commence à dorer. Ajoutez l''oignon et faites-le revenir encore 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et commence à dorer légèrement. Ajoutez l''ail et remuez pendant encore une minute.","Incorporez les graines de cumin, la coriandre moulue, l''origan et une bonne mouture de poivre noir, et continuez à faire frire le mélange pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé. Ajoutez le vinaigre, puis les concentrés de chipotle et de tomates et mélangez le tout. Versez les tomates et un bidon d''eau, puis ajoutez l''extrait de levure et émiettez-le dans le cube de bouillon. Bien mélanger et porter le mélange à ébullition. Cuire 20 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Lorsque le piment a épaissi, versez-y les haricots et la moitié du liquide de la boîte. Laisser mijoter encore 20 minutes, goûter l''assaisonnement, puis servir avec du riz et garnir de crème sure, de jalapeños, de feuilles de coriandre et d''oignon."]','2026-01-11 00:07:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10904,7816,'fr','Tacos croustillants au poulet et à l''ananas','Offrez-vous un vendredi soir une tournée de tacos au poulet croustillants et épicés avec une salsa percutante à l''ananas et au piment.','["6 cuisses de poulet désossées avec la peau","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2½ cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","100 ml de crème sure","½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","1 gros avocat mûr","1 citron vert, jus","8 petites tortillas de farine","½ ananas moyen","½ petit oignon rouge, finement haché","1 piment rouge, finement haché","un petit bouquet de coriandre finement hachée","1 citron vert, jus"]','["Retirez la peau du poulet et réservez-la. Coupez le poulet en lanières. Mélanger dans un bol avec le paprika, la coriandre moulue, 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et une bonne pincée de sel. Couvrir et laisser mariner au moins 1 h ou jusqu''à 24 h.","Pour la salsa, coupez l''ananas dans le sens de la longueur, retirez le cœur, puis coupez la chair en petits cubes. Mélanger dans un bol avec l''oignon rouge, le piment, la coriandre et le jus de citron vert.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive. Assaisonnez la peau de poulet avec du sel et faites-la frire à feu vif pendant 3 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et croustillante. Réserver sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant. Versez le poulet mariné dans la poêle et faites-le frire à feu moyen-vif pendant 10 à 12 minutes, en le retournant à mi-cuisson.","Mélangez la mayonnaise, la crème sure et la pâte de chipotle dans un bol. Écrasez l''avocat avec le jus de citron vert et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un autre bol.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et réchauffer les tortillas sur une plaque à pâtisserie pendant 5 à 7 minutes, ou au micro-ondes pendant 1 à 2 minutes. Laissez chacun remplir son assiette de crème sure épicée, d''avocat, de poulet, de salsa et de peau de poulet émiettée."]','2026-01-11 00:07:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10905,7818,'fr','Tacos au bœuf effiloché Barbacoa','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis ces savoureux tacos au bœuf effiloché marinés dans une sauce piquante avec du chipotle, du jus de lime et de l''ail. C''est un excellent plat à partager','["100 ml de vinaigre de cidre","2 citrons verts, jus","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","6 gousses d''ail, écrasées","pincée de clous de girofle moulus","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","2 feuilles de laurier émiettées","1 cuillère à café de cassonade légère","1 kg de jarret de bœuf désossé, coupé en gros morceaux","300 ml de bouillon de bœuf","6 gros ou 12 petits tacos moelleux","une petite poignée de coriandre hachée","oignon rouge mariné, radis tranchés ou feta émiettée"]','["Versez le vinaigre et le jus de citron vert dans un grand bol (il doit pouvoir contenir tout le bœuf). Incorporer la pâte chipotle, l''ail, les épices, les herbes, le sucre et un peu d''assaisonnement. Incorporer le bœuf en vous assurant qu''il est bien enrobé, puis couvrir et laisser mariner pendant 1 à 2 heures, ou réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 3. Mettez le bœuf dans une assiette, puis versez la marinade dans une cocotte allant au four, ainsi que les morceaux collés au bol. Versez le bouillon et portez à ébullition. Ajouter le bœuf et laisser mijoter 1 min, puis couvrir et cuire au four pendant 2 h.","Si le bœuf n’est pas assez tendre pour être déchiqueté, faites cuire encore 15 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Laisser refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulé, puis soulever sur une planche à l''aide d''une écumoire. Portez la sauce à ébullition et réduisez-la à environ 300 ml. Pendant ce temps, déchiquetez grossièrement le bœuf, en éliminant toute graisse ou cartilage. Incorporez-le à la sauce pour réchauffer, puis servez dans la cocotte avec les tacos, la coriandre et les garnitures à part pour que chacun puisse se servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10906,6237,'fr','Fajitas au halloumi','Essayez ces tortillas halloumi à l''avocat pour un repas après l''école rapide et facile. Servir avec une sauce chili ou de la crème sure','["2 blocs de 225 g de halloumi léger","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché","2 poivrons mélangés, tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 citron vert, jus","8 petits ou 4 grands tortillas (utilisez du maïs ou de la farine)","1 avocat, dénoyauté, pelé et tranché","une petite poignée de feuilles de coriandre","sauce chili ou crème sure, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Divisez chaque bloc de halloumi au milieu dans le sens de la longueur (ils doivent avoir une couture naturelle). Coupez chaque moitié en quatre bandes. Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les lanières de halloumi quelques minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Transférer dans une assiette et réserver.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle à feu vif et faites revenir l''oignon et les poivrons pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à carboniser. Ajouter l''ail, le paprika et la coriandre avec un peu d''assaisonnement et cuire encore 1 min. Versez le jus de citron vert et le halloumi frit et remuez très doucement pour que le halloumi ne se brise pas. Se conserve à température ambiante pendant quelques heures. Réchauffer à feu doux avec un peu d''eau.","Réchauffez les wraps dans un four doux enveloppé dans du papier d''aluminium. Vous pouvez également en réchauffer deux à la fois pendant 10 secondes au micro-ondes (sans les envelopper dans du papier d''aluminium) ou en les tenant directement au-dessus d''une flamme de gaz avec une paire de pinces (cela vous donnera de savoureux bords carbonisés).","Empilez la garniture halloumi dans les wraps chauds, avec quelques tranches d''avocat chacune, quelques feuilles de coriandre et des cuillerées de sauce chili ou de crème sure, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10907,7820,'fr','Fajitas végétaliennes','Préparez une version végétalienne des fajitas avec toutes les saveurs du plat mexicain classique. C''est un excellent plat à partager où chacun peut se servir','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 poivrons rouges ou jaunes, coupés en lanières","1 oignon rouge, tranché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment ou de flocons de piment","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 citron vert, jus","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs rincés et égouttés","petit bouquet de coriandre finement hachée","4 grosses ou 8-12 petites tortillas","1 avocat, tranché","yaourt sans produits laitiers, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir les poivrons et les oignons à feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à devenir dorés, environ 6 à 8 minutes. Ajouter l''ail et les épices et faire revenir encore 1 minute jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Ajoutez la moitié du jus de citron vert et assaisonnez. Transférer dans un plat de service et réserver au chaud pendant que vous réchauffez les haricots.","Versez les haricots noirs dans la même poêle et ajoutez le reste du jus de citron vert. Assaisonnez bien et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud et enrobé des épices restantes de la poêle. Incorporer la majeure partie de la coriandre.","Réchauffez les tortillas au micro-ondes ou enveloppées dans du papier d''aluminium dans un four doux, puis couvrez d''un torchon pour les garder au chaud. Servez les wraps avec les poivrons, les haricots, l''avocat, le yaourt sans produits laitiers, la coriandre supplémentaire et les quartiers de citron vert supplémentaires à presser, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10908,7822,'fr','Tacos au porc effiloché avec salsa d''ananas','Mettez le porc pour ces tacos au porc effiloché dans la mijoteuse le matin et vous aurez un festin de famille pour le dîner. Servir avec du chou, de l''avocat et de la salsa','["1½ kg d''épaule de porc désossée, sans la couenne et coupée en 6 morceaux","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","1 orange, jus","2 citrons verts, jus","Boîte de 432 g d''ananas, jus uniquement (conservez les morceaux pour la salsa ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","râpé de muscade fraîche","Boîte de 432 g d''ananas égoutté","½ oignon rouge, finement haché","une poignée de coriandre hachée","1 citron vert, jus","1 piment rouge haché (facultatif)","8 à 10 coquilles ou wraps à tacos","½ chou rouge finement râpé","1 avocat, tranché","100 ml de crème sure (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le porc dans un grand plat allant au four avec le reste des ingrédients et mélangez bien pour bien l''enrober. Si vous le pouvez, réfrigérez et laissez mariner toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 140C/120C chaleur tournante/gaz 1. Mettre le couvercle sur le plat et cuire sur la grille du milieu pendant 4 heures. Vérifiez après 2 heures et versez dessus le jus. Vérifiez que la viande est tendre en la séparant avec deux fourchettes. S''il résiste, laissez cuire encore 1 à 2 heures.","Mélangez les ingrédients de la salsa dans un bol et réchauffez les tacos. Râpez le porc et retirez tout gras ou tendon. Servir avec le chou, l''avocat, la crème sure et la salsa."]','2026-01-11 00:07:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10909,6245,'fr','Tortilla de patate douce, épinards et feta','Préparez cette tortilla la veille pour un pique-nique rapide et facile pour la famille. Avec de la patate douce, des épinards et de la feta, c''est plein de saveurs','["3 patates douces","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","100 g de bébés épinards","6 gros œufs","100 g de feta émiettée"]','["Percez les pommes de terre plusieurs fois de chaque côté. Cuire au micro-ondes à puissance maximale pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, puis laisser refroidir un peu.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle allant au four de 20 cm et faites revenir les épinards pendant une minute ou deux (vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots). Coupez chaque pomme de terre en deux dans le sens de la longueur et utilisez une cuillère pour retirer la chair en la gardant en gros morceaux. Fouettez les œufs.","Ajoutez la patate douce dans la poêle et mélangez-la avec les épinards – ne la cassez pas trop. Versez l''œuf et remuez pour qu''il comble les vides de la poêle. Répartir sur la feta et cuire 4 à 5 minutes à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le fond et les côtés soient pris.","Placer sous le gril pendant 1 à 2 minutes pour cuire le dessus – enfoncer un couteau au centre pour vous assurer qu''il est bien cuit. Laisser refroidir avant de couper en quartiers. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à une journée."]','2026-01-11 00:07:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10910,7824,'fr','Beignets de maïs doux à la morue chipotle','Préparez des beignets de maïs doux à déguster avec de la morue dans une sauce tomate épicée pour un repas rapide en milieu de semaine. C''est prêt en seulement 20 minutes','["3 gros œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","200 g de boîte de maïs doux","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 gousse d''ail, finement tranchée","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","1-2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili chipotle","1 citron vert, zesté et pressé","2 filets de cabillaud sans peau","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée"]','["Battre les œufs et la farine ensemble jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer le maïs, l''oignon nouveau et un peu d''assaisonnement.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive moyenne. Versez la pâte et faites revenir à feu moyen pendant 3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir l''ail et les tomates pendant 5 minutes. Incorporer le chipotle, le jus et le zeste de citron vert.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le poisson sur une plaque allant au four, sous le grill, réglé sur feu moyen-vif et laissez cuire 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté.","Coupez le beignet de maïs en quatre et répartissez-le dans deux assiettes. Saupoudrer de coriandre et servir avec le poisson et les tomates chipotle."]','2026-01-11 00:07:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10911,7826,'fr','Escalopes d''agneau marinées à la Barbacoa','Frottez les escalopes d''agneau avec cette marinade traditionnelle du nord du Mexique à base de piments ancho, d''ail et de piment chipotle. La marinade donne une délicieuse saveur à l''agneau','["2 piments ancho séchés","1 piment chipotle séché","6 gousses d''ail","1⁄2 oignon","100 ml d''huile d''olive","8 côtelettes d''agneau","micro herbes, pour décorer"]','["La veille, retirez les graines et les tiges des piments ancho et chipotle. Mettez la peau vers le bas dans une poêle sèche à feu moyen, en la retournant jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie et grillée sans brûler.","Dans la même poêle, faites revenir l''ail et les oignons à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement noircis. Une fois refroidi, placez-le dans un mixeur avec les piments, l''huile d''olive et une pincée de sel. Réduisez en pâte.","Frotter les escalopes d''agneau avec la marinade au moins 12 heures avant la cuisson, de préférence toute la nuit, et conserver au réfrigérateur. Retirez-les au moins une heure avant la cuisson pour qu''ils reviennent à température ambiante.","Faites chauffer une poêle ou une plaque chauffante à feu moyen. Faites cuire les escalopes d''agneau jusqu''à ce que la graisse brunisse et commence à fondre (environ 7 minutes), puis faites cuire l''autre côté pendant au moins 5 minutes supplémentaires – cela nécessitera au moins deux fournées, selon la taille de votre poêle. Nous aimons les servir roses, saupoudrés de sel marin et d''herbes."]','2026-01-11 00:07:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10912,7828,'fr','Guacamole classique','Dégustez un guacamole d''inspiration mexicaine du chef Edson Diaz-Fuentes, avec des jalapeños verts, de la coriandre et du citron vert. C''est parfait pour servir avec des chips tortilla','["1⁄4 d''oignon rouge","2 tomates mûres","quelques brins de coriandre","2 jalapenos verts","2 avocats mûrs, coupés en deux","1 citron vert, jus","chips tortilla, pour servir"]','["Hachez finement l''oignon rouge, les tomates, la coriandre et les jalapeños séparément. Mélangez l''oignon, les tomates, la coriandre et une pincée de sel. Gardez les jalapeños de côté.","Versez toute la chair de l''avocat dans un bol et écrasez-la avec une fourchette en la laissant en morceaux – elle ne doit pas être réduite en purée. Ajouter le mélange de jus de citron vert et d’oignon en mélangeant délicatement.","Ajoutez des jalapeños, au goût, et plus de sel marin si nécessaire. Servir avec les chips tortilla."]','2026-01-11 00:07:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10913,7830,'fr','Cocktail de fruits de mer mexicain','Préparez cette entrée classique de la côte Pacifique du Mexique. Des crevettes et des pétoncles sont utilisés ici, mais n''importe quel fruit de mer ou poisson fera l''affaire.','["300 g de crevettes cuites","200 g de coquilles Saint-Jacques crues (vous pouvez les cuire si vous préférez)","20 g de ketchup aux tomates","1 cuillère à café de sauce Tabasco (ajoutez-en plus si vous le souhaitez)","1 cuillère à café de sauce Worcestershire","50 ml de jus de tomate","25 ml de jus de citron vert","50 ml de jus d''orange","1 avocat mûr, coupé en dés","quelques brins de coriandre hachés","cresson de coriandre ou micro coriandre (facultatif)","tortillas de maïs ou craquelins"]','["Épluchez toutes les crevettes et hachez les coquilles Saint-Jacques crues. Mélangez le ketchup, la sauce Tabasco, la sauce Worcestershire, le jus de tomate, le jus de citron vert et le jus d''orange dans un bol à mélanger. Assaisonnez en ajoutant plus de Tabasco si vous le préférez épicé. Incorporez les fruits de mer et quelques cubes d’avocat en prenant soin de les mélanger délicatement pour qu’ils ne deviennent pas pâteux.","Verser dans des bols ou des verres et ajouter un peu de coriandre hachée. Servir avec du cresson à la coriandre sur le dessus, le cas échéant, et des tortillas de maïs ou des craquelins à servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10914,7834,'fr','Frites végétaliennes aux haricots et au piment','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis des frites chargées d''inspiration mexicaine. Ce plat à base de plantes est idéal pour recevoir, que ce soit pour une soirée cinéma ou une fête','["400 g de frites surgelées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon finement haché","1 avocat mûr","½ citron vert, jus, plus des quartiers pour servir","½ petit oignon rouge finement haché","1 tomate finement hachée","1 gousse d''ail écrasée","½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","Boîte de 400 g de haricots mélangés, égouttés","½ boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche sans produits laitiers","2 cuillères à soupe d''oignons frits croustillants"]','["Faites cuire les frites en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 min. Préparez le guacamole en écrasant l''avocat et en mélangeant le jus de citron vert, l''oignon rouge et la tomate hachée.","Ajoutez l''ail, la pâte de chipotle, le cumin moulu et la coriandre moulue aux oignons qui doivent être ramollis et translucides. Faites revenir 1 min, puis versez le mélange de haricots et les tomates concassées. Laisser mijoter 10 minutes, puis incorporer la majeure partie de la coriandre et assaisonner. Versez les frites dans un bol et garnissez de haricots chili, de guacamole, de crème fraîche et d''oignons frits croustillants. Parsemer du reste de coriandre et servir avec des quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:07:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10915,7836,'fr','Tacos aux aubergines effilochées fumées et aux haricots noirs','Ces tacos végétariens estivaux sont remplis d''aubergines carbonisées et fumées et de haricots noirs, garnis de feta crémeuse et d''oignons marinés roses croquants. Ils contiennent également quatre de vos 5 par jour – bonus !','["2 aubergines","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 feuille de laurier","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 oignon rouge, coupé en dés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","400 g de tomates fraîches hachées","pincée d''origan ou de thym séché","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","pincée de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs dont 1 égoutté et rincé","½ citron vert, jus, plus des quartiers pour servir","8 petites tortillas, réchauffées","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies","50 g de fromage feta émietté","½ laitue iceberg, râpée","oignons roses marinés, pour servir (voir conseil ci-dessous)"]','["Piquez les aubergines partout avec une fourchette, puis placez-les sur un feu moyen de gaz (ou sur les braises d''un barbecue ou sous le grill) et faites cuire, en les retournant de temps en temps avec des pinces, jusqu''à ce qu''elles noircissent et s''effondrent, environ 20-25 minutes. Transférer dans une assiette et laisser refroidir. Épluchez la peau des aubergines refroidies ou retirez la chair à l''aide d''une cuillère. Essayez d’enlever la majeure partie de la peau, mais ne vous inquiétez pas s’il reste quelques taches.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle allant au four avec le laurier et les graines de cumin. Lorsqu''ils commencent à grésiller, ajoutez l''oignon et l''ail. Faites frire environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées mais non colorées, puis incorporez la purée de tomates et faites-la cuire pendant quelques minutes.","Ajoutez les tomates et l''origan séché et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus dans la sauce. Ajoutez la chair d''aubergine, la poudre de piment, les flocons de piment et le vinaigre, et faites cuire en remuant pendant 1 min, puis versez les boîtes de haricots noirs, un égoutté et un encore avec son liquide. Pressez un peu de jus de citron vert et faites cuire pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit réduit et bouillonnant, puis transférez au four et faites rôtir pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit profond, foncé et complètement réduit.","Assaisonnez avec plus de jus de citron vert, si vous le souhaitez, et versez le mélange d''aubergines dans les tortillas chaudes avec la coriandre, la feta émiettée, la laitue et les oignons roses marinés pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10916,7838,'fr','Gâteau aux trois laits','Préparez un gâteau tres leches mexicain classique pour une gâterie l''après-midi ou un café le matin : il tire son nom des trois types de lait utilisés.','["huile sans saveur, pour la boîte","4 œufs, séparés","200 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 ml de lait","410 g de lait concentré","200 ml de lait concentré sucré","300 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","pincée de cannelle"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Huiler légèrement et tapisser le fond et les côtés d''un moule à cake carré de 20 cm.","Mettez les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol avec une pincée de sel. Battre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''il soit mousseux, environ 3 minutes. Continuez à mélanger pendant que vous ajoutez 150 g de sucre, une cuillerée à la fois, jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et brillante.","Dans un autre bol, mélanger les jaunes d''œufs, le reste du sucre et la vanille (pas besoin de nettoyer les batteurs au préalable) pendant 2 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez la farine, la levure chimique et le lait aux jaunes d''œufs et utilisez une spatule pour mélanger le tout.","Ajoutez une grosse cuillerée de blanc d''œuf au mélange à gâteau, battez ensemble pour détendre le mélange, puis incorporez délicatement le reste des blancs d''œufs avec une grande cuillère en métal (en faisant attention de ne pas trop remuer pour ne pas expulser trop d''air), jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse.","Verser dans le moule, lisser le dessus et enfourner pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre. Mélangez le lait concentré, le lait concentré et 3 cuillères à soupe de crème.","Laissez le gâteau refroidir 10 minutes dans le moule, puis passez un couteau sur les côtés. Percez des trous sur la surface avec un cure-dent, puis versez dessus la moitié du mélange de lait. Après environ 5 minutes, la majeure partie devrait avoir pénétré dans le gâteau. Laissez reposer encore 5 minutes, puis transférez dans une assiette et versez dessus un peu du lait restant jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à couler un peu. (Les restes de lait qui ne pénètrent pas dans le gâteau peuvent être servis à côté.) Laisser refroidir.","Fouetter le reste de la crème et le sucre glace jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous. Étalez la crème sur le gâteau et saupoudrez d''un peu de cannelle. Peut être préparé et réfrigéré la veille. Servir en carrés avec le reste du lait de trempage."]','2026-01-11 00:07:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10917,7840,'fr','Tacos au thon séché aux épices','Utilisez le poisson le plus frais possible dans ces tacos. Au lieu du thon, vous pouvez utiliser du saumon frais ou fumé, des tranches de pétoncles, de la chair de crabe blanc cueillie ou des gambas cuites hachées.','["400 g de thon frais de ligne","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 citrons verts, zestés, 1 en jus","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de coriandre","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","3 avocats mûrs, dénoyautés et pelés","3 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de coriandre","1 cuillère à soupe de liqueur de cornichon provenant des piments jalapeño marinés","8 petits tacos à la farine molle","huile végétale, pour badigeonner et arroser","piments jalapeño marinés","50g de graines de grenade","1 bouquet de coriandre hachée avec quelques feuilles entières","4 oignons nouveaux émincés","2 citrons verts, coupés en quartiers"]','["Coupez le thon en lanières de 1 cm, puis coupez-le en cubes grossiers de 1 cm. Arroser d''huile d''olive et parsemer de zeste de citron vert, remuer et mettre au réfrigérateur pendant environ 20 minutes. Faites griller doucement le cumin et la coriandre dans une petite poêle, puis versez-les dans un pilon et un mortier avec une pincée de sel et les flocons de piment et écrasez-les en poudre grossière. Incorporez le mélange d''épices au thon avec le jus de citron vert et remettez le bol au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 10 minutes ou jusqu''à 1 heure.","Pour faire la purée d''avocat, mettez tous les ingrédients dans un robot culinaire avec une pincée de sel et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une purée lisse, en ajoutant un peu d''huile si elle est trop épaisse pour mixer. Versez le mélange dans un récipient.","Si vous aimez vos tacos croustillants, chauffez le four à 180 C/160 C chaleur tournante/gaz 4, badigeonnez-les d''un peu d''huile, placez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie et laissez cuire 10 à 15 minutes. Pour construire chaque taco, versez un peu de purée d''avocat et étalez jusqu''au bord. Verser le thon épicé et saupoudrer de piments, de graines de grenade, de coriandre et d''oignons nouveaux, arroser de plus d''huile et ajouter un quartier de citron vert dans l''assiette. Mangez avec vos mains, si elles sont molles, ou avec un couteau et une fourchette si elles sont croustillantes."]','2026-01-11 00:07:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10918,7842,'fr','Tacos au porc fumé et aux haricots noirs','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Piment de porc mexicain au goût fumé de barbecue, servi dans des coquilles de tortilla croustillantes avec de l''avocat mûr.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","½ oignon rouge, haché","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé et de cumin moulu","500 g de viande hachée de porc maigre","300 ml en purée","5 cuillères à soupe de sauce barbecue","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","1 avocat mûr, pelé et tranché","½ laitue iceberg, finement râpée","crème sure, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez l''oignon et faites cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Saupoudrer d''épices et cuire encore 1 min. Ajoutez le hachis en le brisant avec le dos d''une cuillère en bois et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit.","Incorporer la passata et la sauce barbecue dans la poêle avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Augmentez le feu et laissez la sauce bouillonner et réduire jusqu''à ce qu''elle adhère à la viande. Ajoutez les haricots, assaisonnez et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes, puis incorporez la coriandre. Faites chauffer les tacos en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Utilisez le mélange de porc et de haricots pour remplir les tacos, garnissez de tranches d''avocat, de laitue iceberg râpée et d''une cuillerée de crème sure, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10919,7844,'fr','Porc effiloché avec sauce taupe aux amandes mexicaine','Contient du porc – recette réservée aux non-musulmansPopulaire dans la cuisine mexicaine, le mole est une sauce épaisse aux saveurs complexes. Excellente nourriture de fête à faire soi-même','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","750 g d''épaule de porc parée, coupée en gros morceaux","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates","200 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","lanières de zeste et de jus 1 orange","1 bâton de cannelle","2 brins de thym","2 oignons, coupés en morceaux","2 gousses d''ail","250 g de tomates cerises","2-3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 paquets de 335 g de tortillas de maïs","50 g d''amandes effilées","50g de raisins secs","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue et de cumin","1-2 cuillères à café de pâte de chipotle","25 g de chocolat noir finement haché","200 g de radis parés et tranchés finement","2 avocats, hachés","jus de 2 citrons verts","bouquet de coriandre, feuilles seulement","1-2 piments verts, finement hachés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte. Faire revenir le porc environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré, incorporer le concentré de tomates et cuire 1 minute. Versez sur le bouillon de volaille, puis ajoutez les lanières de zeste et de jus d''orange, la cannelle et le thym. Portez à ébullition, baissez le feu, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 1h30.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce. Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir à sec les oignons et les gousses d''ail entières pendant environ 5 minutes, en les retournant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et légèrement carbonisés. Versez dans un mixeur. Ajoutez les tomates dans la poêle. Cuire pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à cloquer et à carboniser, puis verser dans le mixeur. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans la poêle. Faites frire 1 des tortillas pendant 1 min de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Déchirez-le en morceaux et versez-le dans le mixeur. En ajoutant plus d''huile si nécessaire, faites frire les amandes pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Ajouter au mixeur. Ajoutez enfin les raisins secs, la coriandre et le cumin dans la poêle et laissez cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les raisins secs soient charnus. Ajoutez-les au mixeur avec la pâte de chipotle et le chocolat finement haché. Mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte grossière se forme.","À l''aide d''une écumoire, retirez la viande de la poêle sur une planche, laissez-la refroidir un peu, puis utilisez des fourchettes ou vos doigts pour la déchirer en lambeaux. Retirez la cannelle, le zeste d''orange et les brins de thym de la poêle et jetez-les. Versez un peu du liquide de cuisson dans le mixeur, puis mixez délicatement avec la sauce taupe. Versez la sauce dans la poêle avec le reste du jus de cuisson du porc. Laisser mijoter sur le feu pendant 10 à 15 minutes, puis remettre le porc émincé dans la poêle et cuire encore 20 minutes. Assaisonner au goût. Peut être préparé jusqu''à présent jusqu''à 2 jours à l''avance et conservé au réfrigérateur ou congelé jusqu''à 3 mois.","Juste avant de servir, passez les tortillas au micro-ondes pendant 1 min pour les réchauffer. Mélanger tous les ingrédients de la salsa et bien assaisonner. Mettez tout sur la table. Pour servir, versez un peu de taupe de porc sur une tortilla, garnissez de salsa, puis roulez et mangez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10920,7846,'fr','Filet de porc avec sauce chipotle et oignons rouges marinés','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Plat ultime du vendredi soir, ces wraps au goût fumé apporteront le goût du Mexique à votre table.','["2 oignons rouges, un épais et un finement tranché","jus de 2 citrons verts","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","8 grosses gousses d''ail, non pelées","6 tomates italiennes moyennes, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de chipotle (nous avons utilisé Discovery, disponible chez Waitrose)","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de piment","3 cuillères à soupe de cassonade molle","2 filets de porc d''environ 500 g chacun","brins de coriandre et tortillas moelleuses chaudes (farine ou maïs), pour servir"]','["Placez l''oignon émincé dans un bol avec le jus d''un citron vert, la moitié de l''origan et une pincée de sel et de poivre. Annuler.","Faites revenir à sec l''ail entier dans une poêle antiadhésive jusqu''à ce qu''il soit noirci des deux côtés, environ 8 minutes, puis épluchez-le. Faites chauffer le gril. Disposez l''oignon émincé en grosses tranches sur une plaque à pâtisserie avec les tomates, côté coupé vers le haut. Assaisonner et griller jusqu''à ce qu''il noircisse, environ 8 minutes. Verser dans un bol avec l''ail, la pâte de chipotle, 1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment, 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre et le reste du jus de citron vert. Assaisonner et passer au mixeur jusqu''à consistance lisse. Faites chauffer doucement dans une poêle.","Frottez le porc avec le reste de la poudre de piment, l''origan, le sucre et l''assaisonnement. Griller 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit. Servir tranché dans des tortillas chaudes avec un peu de sauce, les oignons marinés et la coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:07:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10921,7848,'fr','Souper mexicain','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Aidez vos enfants à apprendre à cuisiner avec ce repas simple et savoureux – servez-le avec des chips tortilla pour un repas pratique.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","1 oignon, haché","450 g de viande hachée de porc (ou de dinde)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","3 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 sachets de 250 g de riz mexicain prêt à l''emploi (voir astuce)","une poignée de persil frais haché grossièrement","chips tortilla nature, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude, ajoutez l''oignon et laissez-le grésiller et dorer (4-5 minutes) en remuant de temps en temps. Ajoutez le hachis et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il ne soit plus rose, en remuant pour le briser et en raclant le fond de la casserole pour qu''il ne colle pas. Si c''est le cas, ajoutez un peu d''huile.","Versez les tomates dans le hachis, puis remplissez la boîte d''eau et versez-y. Ajoutez le concentré de tomates, remuez bien et laissez bouillir. Laisser mijoter à couvert pendant 25 minutes pour bien cuire le hachis.","Incorporez le riz des deux sachets et laissez-le chauffer doucement, puis incorporez le persil. Servir avec des chips tortillas."]','2026-01-11 00:07:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10922,7850,'fr','Steak mexicain aux haricots frits maison','Toutes les saveurs d''un bon chili con carne de bœuf en une fraction du temps, cuisez-le à la poêle ou au barbecue','["2 petits steaks de surlonge ou de rumsteck, ou 1 gros","2 cuillères à café d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à café de pâte chipotle (nous avons utilisé Discovery)","environ 2 poivrons rouges entiers rôtis en pot, coupés en quartiers","1 petit avocat mûr, dénoyauté et coupé en gros dés","1 citron vert, coupé en quartiers","quelques brins de coriandre, feuilles cueillies","quelques cuillerées de crème sure","1 oignon, haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de paprika fort, plus une pincée supplémentaire (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à café de chaque pâte de chipotle, cassonade et vinaigre de vin (rouge ou blanc)","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","Boîte de 400 g de haricots pinto ou rouges, égouttés et rincés"]','["Mettez les steaks dans une assiette et frottez-les tous\r\nrecouvrir avec l''huile, la pâte de chipotle et ½ cuillère à café\r\npoivre noir fraîchement moulu. Partir dans la chambre\r\ntempérature pendant que vous démarrez les haricots.","Pour les haricots, attendrir l''oignon dans le\r\nhuile dans une poêle. Une fois ramolli, remuez\r\ndans les épices pendant 2 minutes, puis\r\nla purée de tomates, le chipotle, le sucre et\r\nvinaigre. Versez tous les haricots avec 1 cuillère à café\r\ndu sel, du poivre et une demi-boîte de\r\nl''eau. Faites bouillonner doucement jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit\r\npresque évaporé.","Faites chauffer une plaque chauffante ou une poêle antiadhésive (ou\r\nun barbecue). Assaisonnez les steaks avec du sel.\r\nFaire frire, avec les poivrons à côté, pendant environ\r\n2 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce que les steaks soient\r\ncuits à votre goût et les poivrons sont\r\ncarbonisé. Soulever les steaks sur une assiette propre\r\nreposer quelques minutes pendant que vous écrasez\r\nles deux tiers des haricots. Incorporer le tout\r\nharicots et vérifier l''assaisonnement.","Tranchez les steaks. Étalez une bonne pile de\r\nharicots sur 2 assiettes et garnir de tranches\r\nsteak et poivrons. Ajoutez l''avocat, un\r\nun gros filet de jus de citron vert, un peu de coriandre\r\nfeuilles, une bonne cuillerée de crème aigre\r\net une pincée de paprika supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:07:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10923,7852,'fr','Tacos au saumon grillé avec yaourt au citron vert chipotle','Griller du poisson sain avec des épices chipotle, puis servir avec une salade de chou, de la coriandre et du piment dans des tortillas moelleuses.','["1 cuillère à café de sel d''ail","2 cuillères à soupe de paprika fumé","une bonne pincée de sucre","500 g de filets de saumon","200 ml de yaourt sans gras","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte chipotle ou de sauce piment fort","jus 1 citron vert","8 petites tortillas molles à la farine, réchauffées","¼ petit chou vert, finement râpé","petit bouquet de coriandre, cueillie en brins","quelques piments jalapeno marinés, tranchés","quartiers de lime, pour servir","sauce chili piquante pour servir, (facultatif)"]','["Frottez l''ail, le sel, le paprika, le sucre\r\net un peu d''assaisonnement dans la chair\r\ndu filet de saumon. Chauffer le gril à feu vif.","Mélangez le yaourt, la pâte chipotle ou chaude\r\nsauce et jus de citron vert ensemble dans un bol\r\navec un peu d''assaisonnement et réserver.\r\nDisposez le saumon sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée\r\navec du papier d''aluminium et du gril, côté peau vers le bas, pour\r\n7 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits. Supprimer\r\ndu gril et décollez-le soigneusement\r\net jetez la peau.","Écaillez le saumon en gros morceaux et\r\nservir avec les tortillas réchauffées, chipotle\r\nyaourt, chou râpé, coriandre,\r\njalapeños et quartiers de lime. Ajouter un shake\r\nde sauce piquante, si vous l''aimez épicée."]','2026-01-11 00:07:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10924,7854,'fr','Fajitas au poulet avec avocat et vinaigrette César','Un dîner familial amusant, léger et sain auquel les enfants peuvent également participer','["4 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau","1 petit citron vert","2 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment (facultatif)","1 gros poivron rouge","15g de coriandre fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 coeur de laitue romaine","2 avocats mûrs","8 tortillas à la farine","Vinaigrette César"]','["Trancher le poulet sur une planche\r\navec un couteau bien aiguisé, puis mettez-y un\r\ngrand bol. Râper avec le zeste de citron vert\r\net pressez le jus. Écraser\r\nl''ail, puis l''ajouter au poulet\r\navec la coriandre moulue, le piment\r\npoudre (si utilisée) et assaisonnement\r\nau goût. Bien mélanger, couvrir, puis réfrigérer\r\njusqu''au moment de cuire. Tu pourrais faire\r\nça la veille au soir.","Sur une planche à découper propre,\r\net à l''aide d''un couteau propre, coupez le\r\navocat en quartiers. Faciliter le\r\nà distance de la pierre,\r\npuis décollez la peau. Trancher ou\r\nhachez la chair. Tranchez finement le\r\nlaitue. Coupez le poivron en deux, retirez-le\r\nles graines et la tige, puis trancher ou hacher\r\nla chair.","Hachez la coriandre fraîche, puis remuez\r\ndans le poulet. Faites chauffer l''huile dans\r\nun wok ou une grande poêle. Ajouter\r\nle poivre, puis remuez, continuellement,\r\nà feu vif pendant 2 min. C''est\r\nappelé sauté. Ajoutez le poulet,\r\npuis faire sauter à feu vif pendant\r\n5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle à sec\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud, puis ajoutez les tortillas\r\nà la fois pour chauffer et dorer un peu.\r\nRetournez-les avec des pinces pour que\r\nles deux côtés sont réchauffés.","Prenez une tortilla chaude et\r\ntartiné de César\r\ns''habiller. Ajoutez un peu de laitue\r\net avocat, puis une partie du\r\nmélange de poulet et de poivrons\r\net un peu plus de vinaigrette César\r\nsi tu veux.","Pliez les côtés du\r\ntortilla, puis rouler délicatement\r\npour que le remplissage soit complètement\r\nci-joint. Alternativement, mettez le\r\nplats de salade, poulet\r\net des tortillas sur la table pour\r\nla famille de constituer la sienne."]','2026-01-11 00:07:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10925,7856,'fr','Poulet au piment mexicain','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un excellent souper épicé qui peut être préparé à l''avance.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","2 cuillères à café de poudre de piment et de cumin moulu","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates italiennes pelées","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","200 g de chorizo ​​en morceau, pelé et coupé en dés","8 cuisses de poulet, sans la peau","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en morceaux","2 boîtes de 300 g de haricots cannellini égouttés","1 gros avocat, dénoyauté, pelé et tranché","jus de citron vert","une poignée de coriandre fraîche","4 grosses cuillerées de crème sure"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Incorporer les épices et cuire quelques secondes. Versez les tomates et 2 bidons d''eau, puis émiettez-les dans le cube de bouillon. Portez à ébullition et ajoutez le chorizo ​​et les cuisses de poulet. Poussez le poulet sous le liquide, couvrez et laissez mijoter 20 min.","Incorporez les poivrons dans la poêle, puis laissez cuire encore 20 minutes. Versez les haricots cannellini.","A manger maintenant : Réchauffer pour réchauffer les haricots. Mélangez l''avocat avec le citron vert et un peu de sel et servez sur la cocotte avec une pincée de coriandre. Garnir chaque portion de crème sure. Servir avec du riz, des pommes de terre en veste ou une poignée de chips tortilla épicées.","Pour manger plus tard : Laisser refroidir et conserver au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 48 heures. Réchauffer sur le feu jusqu''à bouillonnement et servir comme ci-dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:07:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10926,4837,'fr','Ragoût de poulet mexicain','Apportez une touche de saveur mexicaine à votre repas en milieu de semaine avec ce souper faible en gras dans une poêle','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon moyen, finement haché","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","½ cuillère à café de cassonade foncée","1 cuillère à café de pâte chipotle (nous avons utilisé Discovery)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en rondelles","quelques feuilles de coriandre","tortillas de maïs ou riz pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne. Ajouter\r\nl''oignon et cuire 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nramolli et commençant à devenir doré,\r\najouter l''ail pour la dernière minute. Incorporer\r\nle sucre, la pâte chipotle et les tomates.\r\nMettez le poulet dans la poêle, versez dessus\r\nla sauce et laisser mijoter doucement pendant 20 min\r\njusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit (ajoutez un\r\nun peu d''eau si la sauce devient trop sèche).","Retirez le poulet de la poêle et\r\nrâper avec 2 fourchettes, puis remettre dans le\r\nsauce. Parsemer d''un peu d''oignon rouge, le\r\ncoriandre et servir avec le reste du rouge\r\noignon, tortillas ou riz."]','2026-01-11 00:07:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10927,6632,'fr','Burgers de haricots mexicains avec yaourt au citron vert et salsa','Ces hamburgers végétariens sont un jeu d''enfant à préparer et les garnitures les rendent merveilleusement moelleux – cuisinez surgelés pour gagner du temps.','["2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots rouges, rincés et égouttés","100g de chapelure","2 cuillères à café de poudre de piment doux","petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges et feuilles hachées","1 oeuf","Pot de 200 g de salsa fraîche","150 ml de yaourt nature faible en gras","jus ½ citron vert","6 pains burger complets, tranches d''avocat, oignon rouge tranché et feuilles de salade, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Versez les haricots dans\r\nun grand bol, puis écraser grossièrement avec un\r\npresse-purée. Ajoutez la chapelure,\r\npoudre de piment, tiges de coriandre et ½ du\r\nfeuilles, œuf et 2 cuillères à soupe de salsa, assaisonner pour\r\ngoûter, puis bien mélanger à la fourchette.","Divisez le mélange en 6, puis mouillez votre\r\nmains et façonner des hamburgers. Les hamburgers\r\npeut maintenant être congelé. Placer sur une plaque antiadhésive\r\nplaque à pâtisserie, puis griller pendant 4 à 5 minutes sur chaque\r\ncôté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Pour cuisiner à partir de\r\nsurgelé, cuire au four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6\r\npendant 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud.","Pendant que les burgers cuisent, mélangez\r\nla coriandre restante part avec le\r\nyaourt, jus de citron vert et une bonne mouture de\r\npoivre noir. Divisez les petits pains en deux et\r\nétalez les bases avec un peu de\r\nyaourt. Garnir chacun de feuilles, d''avocat,\r\noignon, un hamburger, une autre cuillerée de\r\ndu yaourt au citron vert et de la salsa, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:07:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10928,5556,'fr','Poulet mexicain au citron vert','Une recette pleine de saveurs piquantes','["2 poitrines de poulet","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre concassées","1 cuillère à café de zeste de citron vert râpé","½ cuillère à café de paprika","½ cuillère à café de sucre muscovado","1 citron vert","6 gousses d''ail non pelées","2 piments rouges frais"]','["Mélangez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive avec 1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre broyées et de zeste de citron vert râpé et 1 à 2 cuillères à café de paprika et de sucre muscovado léger.","Mettez 2 poitrines de poulet dans un plat allant au four, versez la marinade dessus, puis pressez dessus un peu de jus de citron vert. Couvrir et laisser mariner 30 minutes.","Glissez 1 à 2 tranches de citron vert sous la peau de chaque poitrine et assaisonnez. Placez 6 gousses d''ail non pelées et 2 piments rouges frais autour du poulet.","Rôtir les poitrines de poulet dans un plat allant au four, à découvert, pendant 30-35 minutes dans un four préchauffé (190°C/gaz 5/four ventilé 170°C).  Pour vérifier s''ils sont cuits, poussez le poulet avec votre doigt. S''il est encore un peu mou, laissez-le un peu plus longtemps.","Servir avec de la salade et de la salsa."]','2026-01-11 00:07:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10929,7858,'fr','Saumon grillé avec glaçage au piment et crème fraîche au citron vert','Pimentez votre repas en milieu de semaine avec cette recette mexicaine parfumée','["6 gousses d''ail, non pelées","1 petit oignon, coupé en tranches épaisses","1 piment ancho ou gros piment rouge séché, épépiné et paré","4 cuillères à soupe de cassonade molle","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","4 x 150 g de filets de saumon sans peau","1 citron vert, zesté puis coupé en quartiers","200 g de crème fraîche ou de crème sure","coriandre hachée, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Noircir l''ail entier et l''oignon\r\ntranches de tous les côtés dans un grand plat antiadhésif sec\r\npoêle à frire. Retirer, laisser refroidir brièvement, puis\r\népluchez les gousses d''ail. Faire tremper l''ancho\r\npimenter dans l''eau bouillante pendant 15 minutes, égoutter,\r\npuis mettre dans un mixeur avec le sucre,\r\nvinaigre de cidre, ail, oignon et un peu de sel\r\net du poivre. Mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse.","Faites chauffer le gril. Badigeonner chaque filet de saumon\r\ngénéreusement avec la sauce et conservez-en\r\nrestant. Griller 8 min. Pendant ce temps,\r\nmélangez le zeste de citron vert avec la crème fraîche.\r\nServir le poisson avec une sauce chili supplémentaire,\r\nune cuillerée de crème fraîche et de citron vert\r\ncales pour presser. Saupoudrer de\r\ncoriandre, si vous le souhaitez, et servir avec\r\ndes haricots verts ou du riz et une salade."]','2026-01-11 00:07:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10930,7860,'fr','Pommes de terre mexicaines','Pommes de terre sautées épicées avec de la crème sure pour tremper, idéales dans le cadre d''un repas tex-mex','["800 g de pommes de terre coupées en cubes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","½ cuillère à café de paprika","1 cuillère à café de cumin","½ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","crème sure, pour servir"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 5 minutes.\r\nPendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle\r\net faites revenir doucement l''oignon pendant 8 minutes.\r\nAjouter l''ail et les épices, puis faire revenir pendant\r\n2 minutes de plus.","Égoutter les pommes de terre et les verser dans le\r\nmélange d''oignons. Augmentez le feu et secouez\r\nles pommes de terre autour pour qu''elles soient toutes\r\ncouvert. Cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ntendre, puis servir avec de la crème sure,\r\nsaupoudré d''un peu de poivre de Cayenne."]','2026-01-11 00:07:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10931,7862,'fr','Piment aux haricots noirs','Ce piment est idéal pour les réceptions décontractées : il suffit de tout disposer et de laisser les gens ajouter leurs propres garnitures.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 gros oignons, hachés","3 cuillères à soupe de pimenton doux (paprika espagnol) ou de poudre de piment doux","3 cuillères à soupe de cumin moulu","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade","2 boîtes de 400 g (2 x 14 oz) de tomates hachées","2 boîtes de 400 g (2 x 14 oz) de haricots noirs, rincés et égouttés","quelques-uns ou un des éléments suivants pour servir : fromage feta émietté, oignons nouveaux hachés, radis tranchés, morceaux d''avocat, crème sure"]','["Dans une grande casserole, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive et faites revenir\r\nl''ail et les oignons pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\npresque ramolli. Ajoutez le piment et\r\ncumin, laissez cuire quelques minutes, puis ajoutez le\r\nvinaigre, sucre, tomates et un peu\r\nassaisonnement. Cuire 10 min.","Versez le\r\nharicots et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes.\r\nServir avec du riz et les accompagnements\r\nde votre choix dans des petits bols."]','2026-01-11 00:07:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10932,6770,'fr','Haricots épicés et avocat grillé','Impliquez les enfants dans la préparation de ce buffet mexicain végétarien facile avec des haricots sains et de l''avocat','["4 tortillas à la farine","400 g de haricots frits en boîte","grosse pincée de poivre de Cayenne","200 g de haricots rouges dans l''eau, rincés","2 poignées de tomates cerises, coupées en quartiers","50 g de cheddar végétarien","1 piment vert, tranché finement","1 avocat, coupé en deux, dénoyauté et tranché","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen-vif. Disposez 2 tortillas sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie, puis faites griller 2 minutes. Dans un bol, mélanger les haricots frits, le poivre de Cayenne, les haricots rouges et les tomates cerises, puis répartir la moitié du mélange entre les tortillas. Parsemer de la moitié du fromage et de la moitié des tranches de piment, puis griller à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le fromage fonde. Soulever sur des assiettes et garnir de la moitié de l''avocat et de la coriandre pour servir. Répétez avec les tortillas restantes."]','2026-01-11 00:07:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10933,7864,'fr','Chili de bœuf mexicain','Un délicieux one-pot de bœuf braisé épicé est une excellente façon, sans stress, de rassasier une foule affamée.','["jusqu''à 6 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","4 kg de bœuf à ragoût","4 oignons blancs, tranchés","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de chipotle","8 gousses d''ail, écrasées","50 g de gingembre râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","2l de bouillon de boeuf","3 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe d''origan séché","5 boîtes de 400 g de haricots pinto ou rouges égouttés"]','["Faites chauffer un petit filet d''huile dans une\r\nplat ignifuge extra-large. Marron\r\nla viande par lots, en ajoutant une goutte\r\nplus d''huile, retirer du plat et réserver\r\nde côté. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans le plat, puis\r\nles oignons et cuire 7 à 10 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à caramélisation.","Incorporer la pâte de chipotle, l''ail, le gingembre,\r\nle cumin, la cannelle et la farine avec le\r\noignons et cuire quelques minutes.\r\nAjoutez progressivement le bouillon en remuant le tout.\r\ntemps, donc il est complètement mélangé aux autres\r\ningrédients. Ajoutez les tomates et\r\norigan, assaisonner et laisser mijoter 10 min.","Maintenant, versez le bœuf, couvrez et laissez mijoter.\r\ntrès doucement pendant environ 1h45 jusqu''à ce que\r\ntendre, en retirant le couvercle et en ajoutant le\r\nharicots pendant les 15 dernières minutes. Si la sauce\r\nest mince, laissez-le bouillir encore 5 à 10\r\nminutes avec le couvercle retiré. Avant de servir,\r\nrectifiez l''assaisonnement. Servir avec le\r\npain à l''ail et salsa."]','2026-01-11 00:07:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10934,7866,'fr','Ragoût de boulettes de viande mexicaines fumées','Une recette simple de boulettes de viande épicées qui constitue une excellente alternative au chili de bœuf','["1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, finement haché","400 g de bœuf haché","50 g de chapelure blanche fraîche","1 cuillère à café de cumin et de coriandre moulus chacun","1½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","200 g de riz basmati","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés et rincés","une petite poignée de coriandre, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande\r\npoêle à frire. Cuire l''oignon\r\npendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, puis\r\nretirer de la poêle.","Pendant ce temps, déposez le hachis,\r\nchapelure, épices et chipotle\r\nmettre dans un bol, assaisonner généreusement\r\net bien mélanger. Mélange de rouleaux\r\nen 20 boulettes de viande de la taille d''une noix.\r\nAjouter le reste de l''huile dans le\r\npoêler et faire frire les boulettes de viande pendant\r\nenviron 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout soit doré.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le riz\r\nen suivant les instructions de l''emballage. Retour\r\nl''oignon dans la poêle, en ajoutant le\r\ntomates, ainsi qu''une boîte pleine de\r\nl''eau. Laisser mijoter 5 minutes, puis ajouter\r\nles haricots rouges et laissez-les cuire pendant\r\nencore 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la sauce\r\na épaissi et les boulettes de viande\r\nsont bien cuits. Assaisonner le\r\nboulettes de viande, parsemées de coriandre\r\net servir avec le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:07:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10935,7868,'fr','Filets de poisson tex-mex','Une bonne façon de relever le poisson. Si les enfants ne sont pas très friands, demandez-leur de vous aider à cuisiner.','["4 filets de poisson blanc désossés, comme l''aiglefin, le hoki, la goberge (environ 140 g/5 oz chacun)","2 cuillères à soupe d''assaisonnement pour fajita ou d''assaisonnement Tex-Mex","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","200 g de guacamole en pot","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées grossièrement","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Saupoudrez le poisson d''assaisonnement, puis réservez.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle peu profonde, puis faites revenir\r\npendant 3-4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants. Servir\r\nchaque morceau de poisson avec une cuillerée de\r\nguacamole dessus, une pincée de haché\r\ncoriandre et un quartier de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:08:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10936,7870,'fr','Wraps végétariens mexicains','Rassemblez vos amis pour un souper à monter soi-même. Ces fajitas sans viande sont également très saines','["½ courge musquée, pelée et coupée en gros quartiers","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","1 cuillère à soupe de mélange d''assaisonnement cajun","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","400 g de haricots frits en boîte","2 tomates hachées","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","Fusée en sachet de 50g","8 tortillas à la farine"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Dans\r\nune plaque à rôtir, mélanger la courge avec\r\nle piment, les épices, l''huile et l''assaisonnement, puis\r\nrôtir pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Chauffer doucement\r\nles haricots frits avec les hachés\r\ntomates jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien chaudes. Mélanger\r\nle yaourt avec le zeste et le jus de citron vert.","Enveloppements chauds selon pack\r\ninstructions et étaler avec une fine couche\r\nde haricots. Garnir de courge, de roquette,\r\net une cuillerée de yaourt au citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:08:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10937,7872,'fr','Nachos au poulet maison','Une collation mexicaine ultra-rapide à déguster le jour du match','["200 g de chips tortilla de maïs nature","2 poitrines de poulet cuites, coupées en petits morceaux","6 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","140 g de fromage Red Leicester, râpé","1 petit pot de piments jalapeño marinés rouges ou verts tranchés","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles grossièrement hachées","votre choix de salsa, sauce aux piments forts (comme Chipolte Tabasco), crème fraîche, guacamole ou jalapeños extra, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Couche\r\ndéposer les chips tortilla dans un plat allant au four\r\nou une plaque à pâtisserie avec le poulet haché,\r\noignons nouveaux, fromage et marinés\r\njalapeños. Cuire au four pendant 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nle fromage est fondu.","Pour servir, saupoudrer de\r\nla coriandre et mange avec ton préféré\r\naccompagnements."]','2026-01-11 00:08:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10938,4989,'fr','la recette du Chili con carne','Cette excellente recette de chili doit être l’un des meilleurs plats à servir à des amis lors d’une réunion décontractée. Un favori facile à partager qui utilise les ingrédients du placard.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","1 gros oignon","1 poivron rouge","2 gousses d''ail, pelées","1 cuillère à café bombée de poudre de piment fort (ou 1 cuillère à soupe rase si vous n''avez que du piment doux)","1 cuillère à café de paprika","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","500 g de bœuf haché maigre","1 cube de bouillon de boeuf","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","½ cuillère à café de marjolaine séchée","1 cuillère à café de sucre","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 410 g de haricots rouges","riz à grains longs bouilli nature, pour servir","crème sure, pour servir"]','["Préparez vos légumes. Coupez 1 gros oignon en petits dés,\r\nenviron 5 mm carrés. Le plus simple\r\nune façon de faire c''est de couper l''oignon\r\nen deux de la racine aux pointes, épluchez-le\r\net coupez chaque moitié en tranches épaisses\r\nallumettes dans le sens de la longueur, non\r\nassez tranchant jusqu''au\r\nextrémité racine pour qu''ils soient toujours tenus\r\nensemble. Trancher à travers le\r\nallumettes en dés soignés. Couper 1 poivron rouge en deux\r\ndans le sens de la longueur, retirez la tige et\r\nlaver les graines, puis les hacher. Épluchez et hachez finement 2 gousses d''ail.","Commencez à cuisiner. Mettez votre poêle\r\nla plaque de cuisson à feu moyen. Ajouter\r\nl''huile et laissez-la pendant 1-2\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud (un peu\r\nplus long pour une plaque électrique). Ajouter\r\nles oignons et cuire en remuant\r\nassez fréquemment, pendant environ\r\n5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les oignons\r\nsont mous, spongieux et légèrement\r\ntranslucide. Ajoutez l''ail, le poivron rouge, 1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort ou 1 cuillère à soupe rase de poudre de piment doux, 1 cuillère à café de paprika et 1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu. Remuez bien, alors\r\nlaisser cuire encore 5 minutes\r\nminutes, en remuant de temps en temps.","Faites dorer 500 g de bœuf haché maigre. Baissez le feu.\r\nlever un peu, ajouter la viande dans la poêle\r\net brise-le avec ta cuillère\r\nou une spatule. Le mélange devrait\r\ngrésille un peu quand on ajoute le\r\nhacher. Continuez à remuer et\r\nen poussant pendant au moins 5 minutes,\r\njusqu''à ce que tout le hachis soit dedans\r\ngrumeaux uniformes de la taille d''une viande hachée\r\net il n''y a plus de morceaux roses.\r\nAssurez-vous de garder la chaleur chaude\r\nassez pour que la viande frire et\r\ndevenir brun, plutôt que simplement\r\nragoût.","Faire la sauce. Émietter 1 cube de bouillon de bœuf dans 300 ml d''eau chaude. Versez-le dans la poêle avec le mélange de viande hachée. Ouvrez 1 boîte de tomates concassées (boîte de 400 g) et ajoutez-les également. Ajoutez ½ cuillère à café de marjolaine séchée et 1 cuillère à café de sucre, si vous en utilisez (voir astuce en bas), et ajoutez une bonne dose de sel et de poivre. Injecter environ 2 cuillères à soupe de tomate\r\nréduire en purée et bien mélanger la sauce.","Faites-le mijoter doucement. Apportez le\r\nle tout à ébullition, donnez-lui un\r\nbien remuer et mettre un couvercle sur la casserole.\r\nBaissez le feu jusqu''à ce qu''il soit\r\nbouillonnant doucement et laissez-le pendant\r\n20 minutes. Tu devrais vérifier\r\nsur la poêle de temps en temps pour la remuer\r\net assurez-vous que la sauce ne\r\nattraper au fond de la casserole ou\r\nne se dessèche pas. Si c''est le cas, ajoutez un\r\nquelques cuillères à soupe d''eau\r\net assurez-vous que la chaleur\r\nest vraiment assez bas. Après\r\nmijotant doucement, la sauce\r\nle mélange de viande hachée devrait avoir l''air\r\népais, moelleux et juteux.","Apportez les haricots. Égoutter et\r\nrincer 1 boîte de haricots rouges (boîte de 410 g) dans une passoire et\r\nmélangez-les dans la marmite à chili.\r\nPortez à nouveau à ébullition et\r\nbouillonner doucement sans le couvercle pendant\r\nencore 10 minutes, en ajoutant un\r\nun peu plus d''eau si ça a l''air trop\r\nsec. Goûtez un peu de piment et\r\nsaison. Cela prendra probablement un\r\nbeaucoup plus d''assaisonnement que toi\r\npense. Maintenant, replacez le couvercle, tournez\r\nhors du feu et laisse ton chili\r\nreposer 10 minutes avant\r\nservir et se détendre. Partir\r\nton chili à supporter est vraiment\r\nimportant car il permet\r\nles saveurs se mélangent ainsi que la viande.","Servir avec de la crème sure et du riz à grains longs bouilli nature."]','2026-01-11 00:08:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10939,7874,'fr','Salade épicée de poulet, mangue et jalapeño','Aromatisez les poitrines de poulet avec de la coriandre, du piment et du citron vert, puis servez-les avec des chips de maïs mexicaines et une salade fraîche et croquante.','["250 g de tomates cerises coupées en tranches ou en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe de jalapeños finement hachés","une petite poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement","jus d''1 citron vert, plus les moitiés pour servir","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","4 poitrines de poulet cuites, coupées en lambeaux","2 laitues Little Gem, déchirées en bouchées","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché","1 mangue mûre, dénoyautée, pelée et coupée en dés","une poignée de chips tortilla, légèrement brisées"]','["Mettez les tomates cerises, les jalapeños,\r\ncoriandre, jus de citron vert, oignon et huile\r\nun grand bol avec un peu d''assaisonnement.","Faites éclater le reste des ingrédients, sauf\r\nles chips tortilla, sur la vinaigrette.\r\nMélangez délicatement la salade pour bien l''enrober.","Saupoudrer les chips tortilla sur le dessus\r\net servir immédiatement avec des moitiés de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:08:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10940,7876,'fr','Trempette chaude aux haricots mexicains avec chips tortilla','Une trempette de fête rapide et facile qui est super saine, peut être congelée et compte pour vos cinq par jour – que demander de plus ?','["1 oignon, haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de cassonade molle","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin","1 cuillère à café d''assaisonnement cajun","400 g de haricots mélangés en boîte, rincés et égouttés","400 g de tomates concassées en boîte, à l''ail","une poignée de cheddar râpé","100 g de chips tortillas","servir avec de l''avocat haché (facultatif)"]','["Faire revenir l''oignon émincé dans l''huile d''olive\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter du brun doux\r\nsucre, vinaigre de vin et assaisonnement cajun.\r\nCuire 1 min puis ajouter le mélange\r\nharicots et tomates concassées\r\navec de l''ail. Laisser mijoter 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla sauce a épaissi puis assaisonner.","Répartir une poignée de cheddar râpé dessus\r\nchips tortillas. Micro-ondes à puissance élevée\r\npendant 1 min jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu.\r\nServir avec la trempette (garnir avec un peu\r\navocat haché si vous le souhaitez). Prendre de l''avance\r\net réchauffez la trempette avant l’arrivée des invités."]','2026-01-11 00:08:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10941,7878,'fr','Grillades de nachos au poulet','Une façon amusante de servir des poitrines de poulet et de garder les enfants intéressés – pourquoi ne pas leur demander de l''aide ?','["40 g de chips tortillas","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","Pot de 200 g de salsa aux tomates épicées","142 ml de crème sure","une poignée de cheddar fort râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Écraser\r\nles chips tortillas. Mettez les poitrines de poulet dessus\r\nune plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive, assaisonner puis couper\r\nchacun 3 fois avec un couteau. Verser 1 cuillère à soupe de\r\nsalsa sur chacun, puis 1 cuillère à soupe de crème sure.","Saupoudrez les chips sur le poulet, puis\r\nle fromage. Rôtir pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla garniture est dorée et fondante."]','2026-01-11 00:08:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10942,7880,'fr','Galettes de maïs avec salsa d''avocat','Une collation-souper légère et facile à préparer aux saveurs mexicaines','["50 g de farines autolevantes","1 œuf battu","200 g de maïs doux en conserve ou surgelé","botte d''oignons nouveaux, parés et finement hachés","1 avocat, coupé en petits morceaux","1 citron vert, ½ jus et le reste coupé en 4","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées","1-2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","haricots frits, pour servir"]','["Dans un bol, mélanger la farine, l''oeuf, le maïs\r\net la moitié des oignons avec un peu d''assaisonnement,\r\npuis mélangez bien. Mélangez l''avocat avec le\r\nreste d''oignons, jus de citron vert, coriandre\r\net l''assaisonnement, puis réserver.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive.\r\nDéposez des cuillères à soupe du mélange de maïs dans le\r\npoêle, en les lissant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient\r\nformer des gâteaux. Cuire environ 2-3 minutes à feu vif\r\nde chaque côté à feu moyen, en ajoutant le\r\nl’huile restante si nécessaire. Servir chaud\r\navec la salsa d''avocat, les quartiers de citron vert et quelques haricots frits chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:08:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10943,7882,'fr','Salade de haricots mexicaine','Pas du genre à laisser votre ventre gronder, cette salade copieuse fait vraiment mouche et a une touche épicée','["4 œufs","2 avocats, pelés et dénoyautés","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots (nous avons utilisé des haricots pinto et des haricots rouges, rincés et égouttés)","petit oignon rouge, finement tranché","gros bouquet de coriandre, feuilles seulement, hachées grossièrement","250 g de tomates cerises barquette, coupées en deux","bouteille achetée de vinaigrette de bonne qualité (nous avons utilisé la vinaigrette Lime & Coriander de l''English Provender Company)","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement tranché","½ cuillère à café de cumin"]','["Plongez les œufs dans l''eau bouillante et faites bouillir\r\npendant 6½ minutes, puis mettre dans un bol de froid\r\neau pour refroidir. Coupez les avocats en tranches et placez-les\r\nun grand bol avec les haricots, l''oignon, la coriandre\r\net des tomates. Mesurer 3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigrette\r\ndans un petit bol, puis incorporer le piment et\r\nle cumin. Une fois que les œufs ont refroidi mais sont\r\nencore tiède, décollez les coquilles et coupez-les en\r\nquarts. Mélanger la salade avec la vinaigrette\r\net se nicher dans les œufs. Servir immédiatement\r\n– délicieux avec des tortillas grillées."]','2026-01-11 00:08:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10944,7884,'fr','Wraps de poisson mexicains','Les enfants peuvent déguster un de ces délicieux wraps au poisson sur le pouce, une excellente collation faible en gras','["le zeste finement râpé et le jus d''1 citron vert","700 g de filet de poisson blanc sans peau, coupé en lanières","2 blancs d''œufs battus à la fourchette","100 g de chapelure fraîche grossière","4 jets d''huile en spray","200 g de tzatziki en pot","8 petites tortillas moelleuses à la farine","petit quartier de laitue iceberg ou de chou blanc, râpé"]','["Saupoudrer le zeste de citron vert sur les morceaux de poisson, puis assaisonner. Trempez le poisson dans les blancs d''œufs, puis enduisez-le de chapelure et déposez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Arrosez le poisson de 2 jets d''huile, puis faites-le griller 2 min. Retournez-les, arrosez-les d''huile, puis faites griller encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit cuit et que la chapelure soit dorée et croustillante.","Pressez le jus de citron vert dans le tzatziki et remuez. Réchauffez les tortillas selon les instructions sur l''emballage. Pour assembler les wraps, placez une poignée de chou ou de laitue sur les deux tiers supérieurs d''une tortilla, puis posez 3 bâtonnets de poisson dessus avec une bonne cuillerée de tzatziki au citron vert. Relevez le tiers inférieur de la tortilla et repliez les côtés pour envelopper la garniture."]','2026-01-11 00:08:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10945,7886,'fr','Fajitas à rouler soi-même','C''est toujours amusant de préparer des fajitas à table, et cela permet également aux gens de choisir plus facilement les ingrédients en fonction de leurs besoins alimentaires.','["2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","3 poivrons rouges, coupés en lanières","300 g de rumstecks, tranchés","une petite poignée de feuilles de coriandre fraîche","8 tortillas roulées","100 g de fromage cheddar râpé","pots de guacamole et de crème sure"]','["Mélangez le cumin, la coriandre et le poivre de Cayenne avec\r\nun peu de sel et de poivre, puis réserver. Chauffer la moitié\r\nl''huile dans une poêle, puis jetez-y l''oignon,\r\npoivrons et la moitié du mélange d''épices. Cuire environ 3\r\nminutes. Versez les légumes dans un bol.","Remettez la poêle sur le feu avec le reste de l''huile,\r\npuis faites frire le steak et le reste du mélange d''épices\r\nensemble pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits. Donnez un pourboire au\r\nsteak dans un bol séparé, en garnissant de\r\ncoriandre. Chauffez les wraps. Apportez tout à\r\nla table et que chacun se serve."]','2026-01-11 00:08:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10946,7888,'fr','Fajitas aux légumes épicés','Voici un plat épicé, végétarien, à faire soi-même, idéal pour les adolescents affamés','["8 crêpes (voir lien recette ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","1 petit chou-fleur, coupé en petits bouquets","Boîte de 410 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","Pot de 400 g de sauce tomate arrabbiata (nous avons utilisé Loyd Grossman)","3 cuillères à soupe de coriandre fraîche hachée","Pot de 150 g de yaourt nature allégé","50 g de pousses d''épinards"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/gaz 4/chaleur tournante\r\n160C. Envelopper les crêpes dans du papier aluminium\r\net réchauffez-les au four\r\npendant 10 minutes. Vous pouvez également envelopper\r\ndans du film alimentaire et réchauffer au\r\nmicro-ondes à puissance moyenne (750 W) pendant\r\n2-3 minutes.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole, ajoutez\r\nl''oignon et faire revenir pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce\r\nramolli. Astuce dans le chou-fleur\r\nfleurons et faire frire brièvement jusqu''à ce qu''ils prennent\r\nsur un peu de couleur. Verser 5 cuillères à soupe\r\neau, couvrez la casserole et laissez cuire pendant\r\n5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chou-fleur soit\r\njuste tendre.","Incorporer les pois chiches dans la poêle\r\navec la sauce arrabbiata et apporter\r\nà ébullition. Laisser mijoter 2-3 minutes,\r\npuis incorporez la coriandre et\r\nretirer du feu.","Transférer la sauce dans une portion\r\nbol et posez-le sur la table avec le\r\ncrêpes chaudes, yaourt et\r\nfeuilles d''épinards. Que tout le monde mette un\r\nquelques feuilles d''épinards au centre\r\nchaque crêpe, verser la garniture\r\nrecouvrir et garnir d''un peu de yaourt. Le\r\nles côtés peuvent ensuite être pliés dans le\r\nmilieu et les crêpes mangées\r\navec un couteau et une fourchette."]','2026-01-11 00:08:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10947,7890,'fr','Soupe mexicaine au poulet','Toutes ces saveurs typiquement mexicaines – citron vert, coriandre, piment – ​​réunies dans une soupe au croquant des chips tortilla','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 ancho ou autre gros piment séché, épépiné et ramolli dans l''eau bouillante pendant environ 10 minutes","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","400 g de tomates italiennes en boîte","1½ l de bouillon de poulet","2 poitrines de poulet, tranchées","jus de 2 citrons verts","chips de tortilla ou lanières de tortilla maison (voir ci-dessous), avocat haché, quartiers de lime, oignon rouge et coriandre, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez le\r\nl''oignon et l''ail, ramollir pendant 5 minutes, puis remuer\r\ndans le piment séché, le cumin, les tomates et le poulet\r\nstocks. Blitz dans un robot culinaire par lots, ou\r\nutiliser un mélangeur à main pour réduire en purée jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Remettre dans la casserole, puis porter à ébullition.\r\nAjouter le poulet, baisser le feu, puis laisser mijoter\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Incorporer le\r\njus de citron vert et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis une louche\r\ndans des bols. Mettez les garnitures au milieu\r\nde la table pour que chacun puisse se servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10948,7892,'fr','Fajitas de crevettes à la crème d''avocat','Les saveurs mexicaines de citron vert, d''ail, de piment et de coriandre infusent ces savoureux tortillas servis avec du guacamole crémeux','["jus de 2 citrons verts, plus des quartiers pour servir","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","225 g de grosses crevettes crues décortiquées","1 avocat, dénoyauté et pelé","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de crème sure, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché","4 tortillas de farine et une bonne poignée de feuilles de salade mélangée, pour servir"]','["Mélangez la moitié du jus de citron vert, la moitié du piment,\r\nla moitié de l''ail et la moitié de la coriandre\r\navec un peu d''assaisonnement dans un plat peu profond\r\nplat. Ajouter les crevettes et mélanger pour enrober\r\neux tous. Laissez mariner pendant que vous\r\npréparez l''avocat.","Hachez grossièrement l''avocat et faites-le éclater\r\ndans un petit robot culinaire avec le\r\njus de citron vert restant, piment, ail, le\r\ncrème sure et un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nMélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez le\r\ncoriandre restante. (Vous pouvez également utiliser\r\nun mixeur plongeant pour cela.)","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et\r\ncuire le poivron quelques minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\ncommence à ramollir. Ajoutez les crevettes et\r\nfaire frire, en une seule couche, pendant 1 à 2 minutes chacun\r\ncôté – vous saurez qu’ils sont cuits\r\nquand ils deviennent roses et se sentent fermes\r\nle toucher. Servir dans des tortillas chaudes avec\r\nfeuilles de salade, si vous le souhaitez, à côté du\r\ncrème d''avocat, crème sure et\r\nquelques quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:08:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10949,7894,'fr','Enchiladas au poulet avec sauce taupe rouge','Essayez un plat mexicain traditionnel avec cette recette épicée et variée','["4 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau","4 piments ancho","2 tomates italiennes, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile ou de saindoux","1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail","3 cuillères à soupe d''amandes blanchies, plus un peu pour servir","2 cuillères à café de raisins secs","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","petit morceau de chocolat noir","Paquet de 375 g de tortillas fraîches"]','["Mettez le poulet dans la poêle, puis versez 300 ml d''eau froide. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter 20 minutes en retournant une fois jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Retirez le poulet de l''eau (en gardant le liquide) et lorsqu''il est suffisamment froid pour être manipulé, déchiquetez-le avec vos doigts ou une fourchette.","Coupez les piments en deux, retirez les graines et jetez-les. Placer dans un petit bol et couvrir d''eau bouillante. Laisser tremper 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis, puis jeter l''eau, hacher grossièrement les piments puis les passer au mixeur.","Faites chauffer une poêle et versez-y la tomate. Cuire 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la peau des tomates commence à cloquer et à brunir. Ajouter au mixeur. Faites chauffer l''huile ou le saindoux dans la même poêle et faites revenir l''oignon, l''ail et les amandes pendant 5 min. Incorporer les raisins secs, l''origan, le cumin et la cannelle, puis cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit ramolli, les amandes dorées et les raisins secs gonflés. Versez dans le mixeur 100 ml de liquide de pochage du poulet et mixez bien.","Remettez le mélange dans la casserole, incorporez 350 ml de liquide de pochage et le chocolat et laissez mijoter 20 minutes. Pour servir, ramollir les tortillas au micro-ondes pendant 30 secondes, puis empiler le poulet dessus, napper de sauce et rouler. Servir parsemé de feuilles de coriandre, de citrons verts et d''amandes hachées."]','2026-01-11 00:08:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10950,7896,'fr','Toasts au crabe et à l''avocat','Utilisez une tortilla de maïs comme base, puis garnissez de chair de crabe, de trempette mexicaine façon guacamole et de salade.','["1 petit oignon rouge, tranché en fines rondelles","jus de 2 citrons verts, plus des quartiers pour servir","pincée de sucre en poudre","Boîte de 170 g de chair de crabe blanche en saumure, égouttée","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","1 avocat bien mûr, pelé, dénoyauté et haché","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 tortillas de maïs","une poignée de feuilles de salade mélangée"]','["Mettez l''oignon dans un bol et couvrez\r\navec la moitié du jus de citron vert et un bon\r\npincer chacun de sucre et de sel. Partir\r\npour s''adoucir pendant que tu comprends tout\r\nsinon prêt.","Mélangez la chair de crabe,\r\noignons nouveaux et la moitié du piment.\r\nAssaisonner de poivre noir\r\net mettre de côté. Écrasez l''avocat avec le\r\nle reste du jus de citron vert, l''ail et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement. Tu peux partir\r\nc''est assez gros ou écrasez-le jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse. Incorporer le reste du piment.","Pliez chaque tortilla en deux et\r\nfaire griller au grille-pain pendant 1 min. Mettre\r\nsur 2 assiettes et garnir de salade\r\nfeuilles, puis purée d''avocat.\r\nTerminez avec la chair de crabe et\r\noignon mariné égoutté. Servir avec\r\nquartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:08:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10951,7898,'fr','Salade mexicaine avec croûtons de tortilla','Les haricots noirs constituent une excellente base de salade – mélangez-les avec de l''avocat, des tomates et de la coriandre à la manière latino-américaine','["3 tortillas de farine, coupées en morceaux de la taille d''un croûton","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de mélange d''assaisonnement cajun ou mexicain","1 laitue iceberg, râpée","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs rincés et égouttés","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 avocats dénoyautés, pelés et tranchés","jus 1 citron vert","½ bouquet de coriandre, feuilles seulement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDisposez les morceaux de tortilla sur une plaque allant au four,\r\nmélanger avec l''huile et le mélange d''assaisonnements,\r\npuis cuire 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants. Dans\r\nun grand bol, jetez l''iceberg, les haricots\r\net des tomates. Mélangez l''avocat dans le\r\njus de citron vert et ajouter au bol.","Arroser de la vinaigrette de votre choix et\r\nremuer pour enrober tous les ingrédients. Garnir de\r\nles croûtons et la coriandre, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10952,7900,'fr','Petits biscuits aux amandes','Ces délicats biscuits mexicains saupoudrés de neige sont riches, friables et fondants en bouche','["50g d''amandes entières","100 g de beurre mou","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de rhum brun","140 à 175 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour l''étaler","sucre glace, pour servir (environ 100g)"]','["Chauffer le four à 170C/150C ventilateur/gaz 3\r\net rôtir les amandes pendant 5 à 10 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils prennent une couleur dorée pâle.\r\nCrémer ensemble le beurre, le sucre, le rhum\r\net une pincée de sel, puis ajoutez la farine\r\njusqu''à ce que la pâte se rassemble –\r\nce sera doux. Hachez grossièrement les amandes\r\net ajoutez-les à la pâte. Soigneusement\r\nétaler la pâte sur un plan bien fariné\r\nsurfacer sur une épaisseur de 4 à 5 mm et couper\r\nsortez des petits biscuits d''environ 3 à 4 cm de diamètre.\r\nCongelez les cookies sur une plaque à pâtisserie\r\npendant 20 minutes pour durcir.","Cuire les biscuits au four pendant\r\nenviron 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste pris – ils le feront\r\nêtre encore très pâle. Disposer sur une grille\r\net saupoudrer de sucre glace des deux côtés pendant que\r\nils sont encore chauds, en faisant attention à ne pas\r\ncassez-les en les tournant. Le glaçage\r\nle sucre va fondre. Quand ils sont cool,\r\nsaupoudrez-les extrêmement généreusement\r\navec plus de sucre glace pour qu''ils soient\r\ncomplètement blanc. Conserver dans un endroit hermétique\r\nrécipient jusqu''à 2 jours, ou congeler\r\njusqu''à 2 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:08:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10953,7902,'fr','Riz au lait au sirop de raisins secs et de cannelle','Connu sous le nom d''Arroz con Leche au Mexique, il est parfait servi dans de petits verres.','["200 g de riz au lait","le zeste d''1 citron","le zeste d''1 orange","1l de lait entier","100 g de sucre en poudre","85 g de raisins secs ou raisins secs","1 bâton de cannelle","100 g de sucre brun clair muscovado","3 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche"]','["Mettez le riz dans une grande casserole avec 500 ml\r\nl''eau et les zestes de citron et d''orange.\r\nPortez à ébullition, couvrez, baissez le feu,\r\npuis laissez cuire environ 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout\r\nl''eau a été absorbée. Découvrir, incorporer\r\nle lait et le sucre, puis laisser mijoter 20-25\r\nminutes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que le riz soit\r\ntendre et la sauce épaissie. Cool,\r\npuis laisser à température ambiante.","Mettez les raisins secs dans une petite casserole\r\navec la cannelle, muscovado\r\net 100 ml d''eau. Chauffer doucement\r\njusqu''à ce que le sucre soit fondu,\r\npuis bouillonnez pendant une minute jusqu''à ce que\r\nsirupeux. Incorporer la crème,\r\npuis laissez refroidir dans la poêle.","Préparez le plat à la dernière minute – ajoutez un peu de lait au mélange de riz s''il est devenu « solide » après un certain temps de repos. Pour servir, divisez le riz\r\npudding entre 8 verres\r\nou des petits bols et garnir d''un\r\ncuillerée de raisins secs sirupeux."]','2026-01-11 00:08:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10954,7904,'fr','Enchiladas au poulet','Légèrement épicées et satisfaisantes, ces enchiladas faciles farcies de haricots frits, d''oignons et de poivron rouge seront populaires auprès de toute la famille.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons rouges, tranchés","2 poivrons rouges, tranchés","3 piments rouges, 2 épépinés et hachés, 1 tranché","petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges finement hachées, feuilles grossièrement hachées - plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","6 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en petits morceaux","Boîte de 415 g de haricots frits (nous avons utilisé Discovery)","Boîte de 198 g de maïs doux égoutté","Bouteille de 700 ml en purée","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","10 tortillas","2 pots de 142 ml de crème sure","200 g de cheddar râpé"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans votre plus grand\r\npoêle, puis faire revenir les oignons, les poivrons hachés\r\ntiges de piment et de coriandre avec la moitié du\r\nl''ail pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Incorporer 2 cuillères à café\r\ncoriandre moulue et 2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin,\r\npuis faites frire encore 1 min. Pendant ce temps, dans\r\ndans une autre poêle, faites revenir le poulet dans la\r\nle reste de l''huile, par lots, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée\r\n– ajoutez-le à la poêle de légumes au fur et à mesure.","Incorporer les haricots, le maïs doux, la coriandre\r\nfeuilles et 150 ml de passata dans le\r\nlégumes et poulet. Dans un bol, mélangez le reste\r\nde la passata avec l''autre écrasée\r\ngousse d''ail, le reste des épices et le\r\nsucre, puis réserver.","Pour assembler, déposez les tortillas sur\r\nune planche et diviser le mélange de poulet\r\nentre eux, repliant les extrémités\r\net rouler pour sceller. Divisez la passata\r\nsauce dans les plats que vous utilisez, puis\r\ngarnir avec les enchiladas. Pointez sur le\r\ncrème sure, saupoudrer de râpé\r\nfromage et parsemer de tranches de piment.","Laisser refroidir et congeler (voir les conseils de congélation ci-dessous)\r\nou, si vous mangez immédiatement, chauffez le four\r\nà 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6, puis enfourner pendant\r\n30 minutes, en parsemant de coriandre\r\ndes feuilles pour servir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10955,7906,'fr','Labné','Préparez le fromage maison le plus simple en quelques minutes. C''est un ajout courant aux plateaux de meze comme trempette','["900 g de yaourt entier (régulier ou grec)","huile d''olive, pour arroser","za''atar, pour saupoudrer"]','["Mélangez le yaourt avec ½ cuillère à café de gros sel marin. Placez un tamis sur un grand pichet ou un bol doseur et tapissez-le d''un linge en mousseline. Versez le yaourt, rapprochez les côtés du tissu et attachez-le fermement avec de la ficelle de cuisine, en laissant suffisamment de ficelle pour vous permettre de le suspendre. Faites une boucle avec l''excédent et suspendez le paquet de mousseline au robinet de l''évier de la cuisine, en plaçant le bol ou la verseuse en dessous. Laisser agir 12 à 24 heures jusqu''à ce que tout le liquide se soit écoulé. (S’il fait chaud, refroidissez-le plutôt dans une passoire au-dessus d’un bol.)","Lorsque le labneh est prêt, il sera ferme – plus vous le laissez longtemps, plus il deviendra ferme, alors égouttez-le un peu moins longtemps si vous souhaitez le manger en trempette. Grattez le labneh dans un bol ou un récipient et servez-le arrosé d’huile d’olive et assaisonné de za’atar."]','2026-01-11 00:08:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10956,7908,'fr','Za’atar & feta croissants','Utilisez une pâtisserie toute prête pour créer des croissants feuilletés aux épices du Moyen-Orient. Le zaatar aux herbes et la feta crémeuse se combinent pour une bouchée délicieusement savoureuse.','["350 g de pâte à croissant","100 g de feta émiettée","1 cuillère à soupe de zaatar","1 oeuf , battu"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Déroulez la pâte à croissant et utilisez un couteau pour séparer les triangles de pâte. Répartissez la feta et ½ cuillère à soupe de zaatar sur les triangles de pâte en pressant le tout avec vos mains.","En partant de la base d’un triangle, roulez la pâte vers le haut vers le point étroit. Pliez légèrement chaque extrémité pour former une forme de croissant. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte. Disposez les croissants sur la plaque à pâtisserie tapissée, badigeonnez chacun d’œuf battu et saupoudrez du reste de za’atar. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:08:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10957,7910,'fr','Pains plats aux asperges rôties et au labneh avec dukkah aux amandes salées','Laissez-vous inspirer par les saveurs du Moyen-Orient : ces pains plats sont garnis d''asperges rôties et de dukkah aux amandes salées. Conservez les restes de dukkah pour d’autres recettes','["250 g de yaourt grec.","70 g d''amandes grillées salées","50g de graines mélangées","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","350 g d''asperges, extrémités ligneuses cassées","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","25g de beurre salé","10 g d''aneth, feuilles cueillies, plus des brins supplémentaires pour servir","4 pains plats à la grecque"]','["Commencez par réaliser le labné. Mélangez le yaourt grec avec 1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin, puis versez dans une passoire recouverte d''un torchon propre et posez sur un bol. Mettre au frais au moins 1 h. Se conservera au frais toute la nuit.","Pour le dukkah, chauffez le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Mélangez les amandes avec les graines sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée. Assaisonner de sel et de poivre, puis enfourner 6 à 8 minutes. Laisser refroidir complètement sur la plaque.","Mettez une grande poêle sur feu moyen-vif. Arroser d''huile d''olive et parsemer d''asperges. Cuire pendant 5 à 6 minutes, en remuant, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient carbonisés et commencent à ramollir. Ajouter l''ail, le beurre et l''aneth. Remuez bien et éteignez le feu lorsque le beurre commence à dorer et à sentir la noisette.","Pour assembler, étalez le labneh sur un pain plat chaud, garnissez d''asperges, d''une pincée de dukkah et de brins d''aneth supplémentaires."]','2026-01-11 00:08:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10958,7950,'fr','Écouter','Essayez ce maqlooba d''inspiration irakienne. Signifiant « à l''envers », c''est un plat spécial combinant côtelettes d''agneau, aubergines, tomates, riz basmati et pommes de terre.','["4-6 côtelettes d''agneau","2-3 cuillères à café de pul biber (flocons de piment turc)","3 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de dattes ou de sirop de dattes (voir conseil ci-dessous)","2 aubergines moyennes, coupées en tranches de 1 cm","300 g de riz basmati","2 cuillères à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de mélange d''épices baharat","6½ cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","5 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","2 oignons moyens, coupés en rondelles de 1 cm","4 pommes de terre moyennes, coupées en tranches de 1 cm","4-5 tomates (assez pour couvrir le fond de la poêle), coupées en tranches de 1 cm","quartiers de citron, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez les côtelettes d''agneau dans un bol. Mélangez 2 cuillères à café de sel, ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir, le pul biber (au goût) et 2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de dattes ou de sirop de dattes, le cas échéant. Frotter partout l''agneau, couvrir et laisser mariner à température ambiante pendant 1 h. Se conservera au frais toute la nuit.","Pendant ce temps, faites tremper les tranches d''aubergines dans un bol d''eau salée pendant 20 minutes. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Faites chauffer une cocotte anti-flamme de 23 cm à feu moyen. Ajoutez le riz, puis versez 700 ml d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Ajoutez une pincée de sel avec 1 cuillère à café de curcuma, l''épice baharat et ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir. Cuire pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz commence à ramollir, puis égoutter et réserver.","Égoutter et rincer l''aubergine, puis mélanger avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, une pincée de sel et 2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade. Versez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à dorer. De plus, mettez les oignons sur une plaque à pâtisserie séparée, mélangez-les avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, 2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade et une pincée de sel, et faites cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Mettez les pommes de terre sur une troisième plaque à pâtisserie et mélangez-les avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, le reste du curcuma et une pincée de sel. Cuire au four 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés.","Pendant ce temps, retirez les côtelettes d''agneau de la marinade et secouez-les délicatement pour éliminer l''excédent. Faites chauffer la ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive restante dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir les côtelettes pendant 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées mais encore roses au milieu.","Tapisser le fond de la cocotte d''un cercle de papier sulfurisé. Disposez les tranches de tomates légèrement superposées en cercles concentriques sur le papier sulfurisé, suivies des rondelles d''oignon, puis des côtelettes d''agneau, des pommes de terre et des aubergines. Versez le riz dessus et aplatissez doucement la surface pour obtenir une couche uniforme.","Mettez la cocotte sur feu moyen. Dissolvez 1 cuillère à café de sel dans 150 ml d''eau et versez-la sur le riz, puis 1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de dattes restante et 1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade. Couvrir et cuire 5 à 10 minutes, puis réduire le feu et laisser mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit bien cuit et que les légumes soient légèrement caramélisés.","Retirez du feu, placez un torchon propre sur la casserole et couvrez avec le couvercle (pour éviter que la condensation ne revienne dans le riz). Laisser reposer 10 mn. Retirez le couvercle, posez une grande assiette sur la poêle et retournez-la rapidement. Tapotez la base et soulevez le moule avec précaution pour garder les couches empilées. Retirez le papier sulfurisé et servez avec des quartiers de citron, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10959,7952,'fr','Tajine d''agneau aux pois chiches','Préparez ce tajine d''agneau un jour ou deux à l''avance pour bien développer les saveurs. Cela rend les réceptions un peu plus faciles, car tout ce que vous aurez à faire est de le réchauffer','["1 kg de filet de cou d''agneau coupé en gros morceaux","3 cuillères à soupe de ras el hanout","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un filet facultatif","2 oignons, hachés","4 carottes, coupées en gros morceaux","6 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de harissa à la rose, plus 1 cuillère à café pour servir","½ citron confit finement haché ou une lamelle de zeste de citron pelée","1 bâton de cannelle","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","600 ml de bouillon de poulet ou d''agneau","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés mais non rincés","100 g d''abricots secs hachés grossièrement (facultatif)","150g de yaourt nature","un petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement","une petite poignée d''amandes effilées, grillées","couscous cuit"]','["Mélangez les morceaux d''agneau avec le ras el hanout et une grosse pincée de sel pour les enrober. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à 4 heures. Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte antidéflagrante à feu moyen et faites dorer l''agneau de tous les côtés. (Vous devrez le faire par lots.) Versez-le dans une assiette à l''aide d''une écumoire et réservez, puis faites cuire les oignons et les carottes dans la poêle pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés, en ajoutant un filet d''huile supplémentaire si la poêle est sèche. Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes, puis incorporez les 2 cuillères à soupe d''harissa et le citron confit. Cuire encore une minute jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient enrobés du mélange et collants. Ajoutez la cannelle, puis versez les tomates et portez à ébullition.","Cuire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse. Remettez l''agneau et son jus de repos dans la poêle et versez dessus le bouillon. Assaisonner et remettre à ébullition. Mettez le couvercle sur la cocotte et transférez au four pour cuire 1 heure.","Incorporer les pois chiches et les abricots, le cas échéant, couvrir à nouveau et remettre au four pendant 1 h jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit tendre. Assaisonnez, puis laissez reposer le tajine 10 minutes. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours ou au congélateur pendant trois mois. Laissez d’abord refroidir. Décongeler au réfrigérateur toute la nuit avant de réchauffer à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Mélangez 1 cuillère à café d''harissa dans le yaourt, puis parsemez le tajine de coriandre et d''amandes effilées. Servir avec le couscous et le yaourt épicé en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:08:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10960,4855,'fr','Brochettes végétaliennes','Farcies de galettes de tempeh marinées et de chou mariné, ces brochettes végétaliennes sont prêtes en seulement 16 minutes. Ils sont sains, pleins de fibres et font partie de vos cinq par jour','["100 g de tempé","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe d''origan séché","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise végétalienne","½ petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 douleurs place","4 cuillères à soupe de chou rouge mariné, égoutté","150 g de feuilles de salade"]','["Coupez le tempeh en tranches de 1⁄2 cm d''épaisseur. Mélangez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans un bol avec le paprika, l''origan, une pincée de sel, du poivre noir et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Ajouter le tempeh et remuer pour bien enrober. Couvrir et laisser au réfrigérateur toute la nuit si vous le pouvez, ou réserver à température ambiante pendant que vous poursuivez la recette.","Battez la mayonnaise avec 1⁄2 cuillère à soupe d''eau et l''ail écrasé dans un petit bol. Faites chauffer les pains plats dans une poêle sèche à feu moyen pendant 30 secondes de chaque côté. Badigeonner de mayonnaise à l''ail les deux pains plats et garnir de chou mariné et de la moitié des feuilles de salade.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile restante dans une grande poêle à feu vif. Faites frire le tempeh mariné pendant 2-3 minutes de chaque côté à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant et doré. Empilez-les sur les pains plats, repliez-les et servez-les avec le reste de la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:08:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10961,7954,'fr','Boulettes de viande meze','Essayez notre meze aux boulettes de viande avec houmous, tzatziki, oignon, concombre et tomates. C’est idéal comme plateau familial en semaine si les gens mangent à des heures différentes','["100g de chapelure","50 ml de lait","400 g de bœuf ou d''agneau haché","1 oeuf","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","petit bouquet de persil plat finement haché","1 oignon, grossièrement râpé","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ concombre, coupé en morceaux","12 tomates cerises, coupées en quartiers","1 oignon rouge, finement tranché","houmous","tzatziki","4 pitas"]','["Mettez la chapelure dans un bol et ajoutez le lait. Laisser agir 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le lait soit absorbé. Ajouter le reste des ingrédients des boulettes de viande, sauf la farine et l''huile. Assaisonnez bien avec du sel et du poivre et mélangez bien le tout avec les mains, puis façonnez des boulettes de viande un peu plus grosses qu''une tomate cerise. Vous devriez en avoir environ 24. Couvrez et réfrigérez les boulettes de viande pendant au moins 30 minutes. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à 24 heures.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à cuisiner, versez la farine dans un bol peu profond. Roulez les boulettes de viande dans la farine pour les enrober, puis faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen. Faites frire les boulettes de viande pendant 10 à 12 minutes, en les roulant autour de la poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien dorées de tous les côtés et bien cuites. Pour servir, disposez sur une assiette un peu de salade hachée à base de concombre, de tomates et d''oignon rouge, ainsi que des bols de houmous et de tzatziki. Faites griller les pittas et laissez chacun préparer son propre kebab de boulettes de viande, en farcissant les boulettes de viande, la salade et les trempettes dans les pittas."]','2026-01-11 00:08:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10962,7956,'fr','Fatteh makdous (bébés d''aubergines farcies à l''agneau, sauce tomate et tahini)','Dégustez ces délicieuses petites aubergines farcies à l''agneau avec une sauce tomate et tahini dans le cadre d''un menu d''inspiration moyen-orientale. Garnir de noix de cajou pour servir','["huile, pour la friture","8 petites aubergines","2 gros pains plats ronds, coupés en carrés","noix de cajou, pour servir","huile, pour la friture","¼ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de concentré de tomate","½ cuillère à café de poudre de madras douce","½ cuillère à café de poivre noir","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de poudre de sept épices (voir conseil ci-dessous)","100 g de viande hachée d''agneau","huile d''olive, pour la friture","25g de pignons de pin","200 ml de yaourt grec","4 cuillères à soupe de tahin","½ citron, jus","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée"]','["Préparez d’abord la sauce rouge. Faites chauffer un peu d''huile dans une poêle, puis ajoutez les graines de cumin et faites-les revenir jusqu''à ce qu''elles sentent bon. Ajoutez le reste des ingrédients avec ½ cuillère à café de sel et 200 ml d''eau et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe un peu – elle doit avoir la consistance d''une crème liquide.","Coupez le dessus des jeunes aubergines, puis retirez la peau en bandes et évidez le noyau avec un petit couteau bien aiguisé ou le bout d''une cuillère à café. Faites tremper les aubergines dans de l''eau froide salée pour qu''elles gardent leur couleur, puis égouttez-les bien, essorez-les légèrement et séchez-les.","Remplissez une poêle au tiers d''huile et faites chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain brunisse en 30 secondes. Faites frire les morceaux de pain plat jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés mais pas brûlés, environ 30 à 40 secondes. Bien égoutter. Faites frire les aubergines par lots pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et tendres, puis égouttez-les sur du papier absorbant.","Faites revenir l''agneau haché dans une poêle avec un peu d''huile d''olive jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bien cuit, puis ajoutez les pignons de pin et assaisonnez. Farcir les aubergines avec le mélange de hachis d''agneau – vous pouvez soit fourrer le hachis dans le trou à chaque extrémité, soit diviser les aubergines puis ajouter la farce (de cette façon, vous pourrez mettre plus d''agneau dedans). Mettez les aubergines farcies dans une poêle avec 6 cuillères à soupe de sauce rouge et laissez cuire 5 min.","Mettez le yaourt grec, le tahini, le jus de citron, l''ail et un peu de sel dans un bol et mélangez bien. S''il est un peu épais, ajoutez un peu d''eau froide. Vous pouvez le préparer à l''avance et le mettre au réfrigérateur jusqu''au moment de servir.","Pour servir, versez le yaourt au tahini dans un grand bol. Garnir d''une poignée de chips de pain plat, des aubergines et de toute la sauce rouge. Terminez par une pincée de noix de cajou, puis servez le reste des chips à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:08:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10963,5455,'fr','Muhammara (trempette aux poivrons rouges et aux noix)','Servez une trempette aux poivrons rouges et aux noix d''inspiration syrienne en accompagnement d''un festin du Moyen-Orient. Garnir de noix entières et de coriandre et déguster avec des pains plats','["3 poivrons rouges","70 g de moitiés de noix","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment fort","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de concentré de tomate","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","une poignée de chapelure","¾ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","huile d''olive, pour servir","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Rôtir les poivrons pendant 25-30 minutes, en les retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à cloquer (s''ils ne cloquent pas, faites-les griller quelques minutes). Laisser refroidir un peu, puis peler et jeter les peaux. Jetez les graines et hachez finement la chair. Faire griller les noix pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement dorées.","Broyez toutes les moitiés de noix sauf quatre dans un moulin à épices jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient assez fines mais aient encore une certaine texture. Mélangez les noix moulues avec les poivrons, puis ajoutez la mélasse, les épices, le concentré de tomate, l''ail, la chapelure et le sel marin, mélangez bien et assaisonnez.","Servir le muhammara sur une petite assiette, arrosé d''un peu d''huile d''olive. Ajoutez les noix entières au centre et un peu de coriandre sur le pourtour."]','2026-01-11 00:08:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10964,6851,'fr','Nids d''oiseaux pistaches','Réalisez ces « nids d''oiseaux » à la pistache, à base de pâte kataifi (une pâte filo très finement râpée disponible en ligne) et d''un sirop de sucre citronné pour une gourmandise sucrée.','["40g de pistaches","400g de sucre","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","300 g de pâte kataifi","375 g de beurre fondu"]','["Faire tremper les pistaches dans l''eau pendant 30 minutes. Dissoudre le sucre dans 500 ml d''eau dans une casserole à feu moyen, puis porter à ébullition et faire bouillonner pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit réduit et légèrement sirupeux. Incorporer le citron et faire bouillir encore une minute.","Couvrez le kataifi avec un chiffon humide pour qu''il ne sèche pas. Prenez une longueur de 30 cm de pâte finement torsadée et enroulez-la dans un mouvement circulaire autour de deux doigts pour former un nid. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis répéter avec le reste de la pâte.","Égouttez les pistaches et pressez-en délicatement quatre ou cinq au milieu de chaque nid. Couvrez les nids d''une couche de papier sulfurisé, puis posez une autre plaque à pâtisserie dessus et posez dessus un poids de 1 kg. Laisser à température ambiante pendant 1 h, puis retirer le papier sulfurisé et laisser sécher encore une heure.","Chauffez le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Versez le beurre sur et autour des nids, afin qu''ils reposent dans une couche de beurre fondu. Cuire 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, en retournant la plaque de temps en temps pour vous assurer que les nids sont uniformément colorés. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes, puis transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie propre et verser dessus le sirop. Laisser refroidir complètement dans le sirop, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10965,7958,'fr','Marinade harissa-miel','Essayez cette marinade harissa-miel sur des brochettes de poulet ou de halloumi et utilisez-la comme glaçage. L''harissa est une pâte de piment fort tunisienne à base de poivrons rouges et d''épices.','["2 cuillères à soupe de harissa à la rose","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail écrasée","3 cuillères à soupe de miel"]','["Mélangez la rose harissa, l''huile d''olive, la gousse d''ail et le miel. Assaisonner de sel."]','2026-01-11 00:08:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10966,4293,'fr','Bol de falafel aux épinards et houmous','Préparez ce bol à salade végétalien facile, avec des falafels aux épinards faits maison et du houmous servis avec de la pitta et de la salade. Il regorge de nutriments pour un souper sain','["150 g de bébés épinards","1⁄2 concombre, tranché","1 oignon rouge, finement tranché","4 pittas complets, grillés, pour servir","150 g de bébés épinards","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1⁄2 petit bouquet de persil finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour rouler","400 g de pois chiches égouttés","40 ml d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour servir","1 gousse d''ail, hachée grossièrement","1 citron pressé, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé antiadhésif. Mettez tous les ingrédients des falafels, sauf l''huile, dans un robot culinaire et assaisonnez légèrement. Pulsez jusqu''à obtenir un mélange grossier.","Huilez légèrement vos mains, puis prenez des cuillères à soupe du mélange de falafel, roulez en 16 boules environ et disposez-les sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Appuyez légèrement sur chacun d’eux avec la paume de votre main. Badigeonner avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et doré, en le retournant à mi-cuisson.","Pendant que les falafels cuisent, préparez le houmous. Mettez tous les ingrédients du houmous dans un robot culinaire avec 50 ml d''eau et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et soyeuse.","Mettez les épinards, le concombre, l''oignon rouge et les falafels dans différentes sections de chaque bol, avec un peu de houmous, puis arrosez d''un filet d''huile d''olive supplémentaire. Broyer avec du poivre noir. Servir avec les pittas à part et plus de citron à presser, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10967,6217,'fr','Poêlée d''aubergines, halloumi et harissa','Préparez cette poêle végétarienne spéciale à base d''aubergines, de halloumi, de tomates et de harissa pour un repas en milieu de semaine pour deux. C''est un dîner facile à partager','["2 à 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un filet","1 grosse aubergine coupée en rondelles d''environ ½ cm d''épaisseur","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte d''harissa","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","225 g de halloumi en bloc, coupé en 8 à 9 morceaux","pincée de menthe séchée","pains plats, riz ou couscous, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle ou une poêle allant au four d''environ 22 cm, puis ajoutez les tranches d''aubergine en une seule couche (vous devrez le faire par lots). Cuire 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste dorés et ramollis, en ajoutant encore 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile entre chaque lot. Transférer dans une assiette.","Si la poêle est sèche, ajoutez encore 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Faire revenir l''ail jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille mais pas coloré. Incorporer les tomates, la harissa, le sucre et une pincée de sel. Faites bouillonner pendant une minute en écrasant les tomates. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Pendant ce temps, coupez chaque morceau de halloumi en deux (ne vous inquiétez pas s’ils se désagrègent). Disposez les tranches d''aubergine et de halloumi en cercles concentriques superposés sur le mélange de tomates, en vous assurant qu''il y a un ou deux morceaux de halloumi entre chaque tranche d''aubergine. Arroser d''un peu d''huile et saupoudrer de menthe. Couvrir le moule de papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4, puis retirer le papier d''aluminium et cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le halloumi commence à dorer. Servir avec des pains plats chauds, du riz ou du couscous."]','2026-01-11 00:08:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10968,6084,'fr','Pois chiches chipotle aux aubergines et pitta','Donnez une touche épicée aux pois chiches et aux aubergines avec le chipotle. Servir sur des pittas avec du tahini et de la crème fraîche et terminer avec des quartiers de citron vert et de la coriandre.','["4 pittas complets, coupés en triangles","150 g de crème fraîche légère","3 cuillères à soupe de tahin","2 citrons verts zestés et pressés, plus du zeste et des quartiers supplémentaires pour servir","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon, finement haché","2 petites aubergines, tranchées finement","400 g de pois chiches égouttés","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Disposez les pittas en une seule couche sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les griller pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon et l''aubergine à feu moyen pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez les pois chiches et la pâte chipotle et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Retirer du feu et incorporer la coriandre et un peu d''assaisonnement.","Fouetter ensemble la crème fraîche, le tahini, le jus et le zeste de citron vert et l''ail dans un bol, ainsi que 50 ml d''eau pour détendre.","Pour servir, garnissez les pittas grillées de la sauce tahini au citron vert, ajoutez l''aubergine et les pois chiches et terminez par une pincée de coriandre, le zeste de citron vert supplémentaire et les quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:08:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10969,3922,'fr','Salade de courgettes grillées et halloumi avec vinaigrette aux câpres et au citron','Dressez cette salade de courgettes et halloumi pendant que le tout est encore assez chaud, les courgettes s''imprégneront alors des saveurs de la vinaigrette aux câpres et au citron.','["10 à 12 petites courgettes, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","Bloc de 225 g de halloumi, tranché finement (environ 16 tranches)","1 longue échalote, hachée finement","1 piment rouge, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 citron, zesté et pressé","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un bol avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau froide et assaisonnez avec une pincée de sel. Mélanger et réserver.","Mettez les courgettes dans un grand bol et arrosez d''huile. Ajoutez une pincée de sel, puis mélangez.","Faites chauffer la plaque chauffante Panto à feu vif et ajoutez les courgettes, côté coupé vers le bas (il est préférable de le faire par lots). Cuire pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que des marques de charbon apparaissent et que la chair ramollisse, puis retourner et cuire encore 3 minutes. Retirer dans un bol peu profond et couvrir de papier d''aluminium pour garder au chaud.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive et ajoutez le halloumi. Cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés des deux côtés.","Disposez les courgettes et le halloumi dans une grande assiette ou un plat, puis versez-y la vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:08:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10970,3940,'fr','Falafel aux herbes congelable','Préparez ces délicieux falafels en utilisant des pois chiches séchés, plutôt qu''en conserve, pour obtenir les meilleurs falafels. Farcir des pittas ou du pain plat, ou mettre dans une boîte à lunch','["250 g de petits pois poussins secs","2 cuillères à café de graines de coriandre écrasées","3 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment (facultatif)","pincée de piment de la Jamaïque","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","petit bouquet de persil, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement","¾ cuillère à café de levure chimique","30 g de graines de sésame (facultatif)","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","pains plats réchauffés, houmous, cornichons, radis tranchés, menthe, coriandre, tahini, zaatar ou flocons de piment et sauce chili, pour servir"]','["Mettez les pois chiches dans un bol, couvrez d''eau froide et laissez tremper au moins 12 heures.","Le lendemain, égouttez les pois chiches et séchez-les avec du papier absorbant. Versez-les dans un robot culinaire et mélangez-les jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à se décomposer. Faire griller toutes les épices dans une petite poêle sèche pendant 1 à 2 minutes. Versez-les dans le robot culinaire avec l''ail, les herbes et 1½ cuillère à café de sel marin. Blitz jusqu''à ce qu''il soit lisse et souple (vérifiez cela en serrant une touffe dans votre main ; une fois prêt, il devrait rester ensemble). Versez le mélange dans un bol, incorporez la levure chimique, couvrez et laissez refroidir 30 minutes.","Former 12 petits disques, puis enrober chacun légèrement de graines de sésame, le cas échéant. Réfrigérer encore 15 minutes. Les falafels peuvent maintenant être congelés jusqu''à trois mois (voir ci-dessous).","Faites chauffer 1 cm d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que de petites bulles se forment à la surface. Faites frire les falafels par lots pendant 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés, en les retournant à mi-cuisson à l''aide d''une spatule ou d''une écumoire. Transférer dans une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant. Laisser égoutter. Une fois refroidis, les falafels peuvent être congelés jusqu''à trois mois (voir ci-dessous). Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Mettre les falafels sur une plaque à pâtisserie légèrement huilée et badigeonner d''un peu d''huile. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants. Servir dans les pains plats avec les garnitures de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:08:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10971,7960,'fr','Pilaf de poulet croustillant au zaatar et à la grenade','Nestlé des morceaux de poulet croustillants au zaatar parmi du riz pilaf à la pistache pour un souper irrésistible. C''est une explosion de couleurs, de textures et de saveurs','["8 cuisses de poulet avec la peau","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 citron, jus","3 cuillères à soupe de zaatar","70 g de graines de grenade","½ petit bouquet de persil finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","50g de beurre","2 gros oignons, tranchés","220 g de riz basmati","350 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","70 g de pistaches hachées","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment"]','["Mélanger l''huile de cuisses de poulet, 1 cuillère à café de sel, l''ail et le jus de citron dans un grand bol. Couvrir et réfrigérer pendant au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''à 12 heures.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4, et faire chauffer une poêle à feu vif. Faites frire le poulet, peau vers le bas, pendant 5 à 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et saupoudrer de zaatar, puis rôtir pendant 10 minutes.","Pour le riz, faites chauffer l’huile et le beurre dans une grande cocotte peu profonde ou une poêle à feu doux-moyen. Faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient caramélisés et collants. Incorporer le riz, le bouillon, les pistaches et les flocons de piment. Saison. Disposez les cuisses de poulet rôties sur le riz et versez dessus le jus de rôtissage du plateau. Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre. Retirer du four, couvrir et laisser reposer 5 minutes.","Parsemez le poulet pilaf avec les graines de grenade et le persil, puis servez dans des bols peu profonds."]','2026-01-11 00:08:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10972,7962,'fr','Pilaf de chou-fleur harissa','Évoquez le Moyen-Orient avec notre pilaf de chou-fleur harissa végétarien avec une combinaison enivrante de fruits, de noix et d''épices. Faites-le cuire au four pour un délicieux riz moelleux','["300 g de riz basmati","1 oignon rouge, finement tranché","2 citrons, 1 pressé, 1 coupé en quartiers","2 cuillères à café de sucre","4 cuillères à soupe de harissa","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros ou 2 choux-fleurs moyens, cassés en gros fleurons, tige hachée, grandes feuilles hachées grossièrement","pincée de safran","2 feuilles de laurier","700 ml de bouillon de légumes végétalien chaud","100 g de raisins secs","100 g d''amandes effilées, grillées jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées","½ petit bouquet d''aneth haché, plus un peu pour servir","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","50 g de graines de grenade (facultatif)"]','["Lavez bien le riz, puis laissez-le tremper dans l''eau froide pendant 1 h. Mettez l''oignon dans un petit bol et mélangez-le avec le jus de citron, le sucre et une pincée de sel. Laissez mariner pendant que vous préparez le pilaf.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Fouetter 2 cuillères à soupe d''harissa, l''ail et l''huile dans un grand bol, puis ajouter le chou-fleur et mélanger pour bien l''enrober de sauce. Assaisonner, puis verser dans un plat à rôtir et rôtir pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et doré.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le safran, les feuilles de laurier, le bouillon et 2 cuillères à soupe d''harissa dans une poêle à feu très doux pour garder au chaud pendant que les choux rôtissent.","Sortez le chou du four, versez-le dans un plat et pressez-y le jus d''un quartier de citron. Égouttez le riz et versez-le dans le plat à rôtir. Versez sur le bouillon infusé et mélangez bien. Incorporer les raisins secs, la moitié des amandes, l''aneth, les pois chiches et la moitié du chou-fleur. Couvrir le moule d''une double couche de papier d''aluminium en scellant bien, puis cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et que le bouillon soit absorbé.","Remuez le riz avec une fourchette, puis incorporez le reste du chou-fleur (cela crée un contraste de textures de chou). Répartir l''aneth supplémentaire, les amandes restantes, les graines de grenade, le cas échéant, les oignons rouges marinés et les quartiers de citron restants à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:08:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10973,7964,'fr','Chou-fleur rôti avec sauce harissa et pois chiches','Profitez au maximum du chou-fleur de saison avec ce plat principal d''inspiration moyen-orientale. Les légumes rôtis sont servis avec une sauce aux pois chiches épicée à base d''oignons, de tomates et de harissa.','["1 gros chou-fleur","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu pour la boîte","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 gros oignon, tranché","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa à la rose","35g de beurre","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, rincés et égouttés","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées, grillées","salade, pour servir (facultatif)","200 g de yaourt nature","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de granulés d''oignon","pincée de feuilles de thym séchées ou fraîches","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature nature"]','["Préparez la marinade en mélangeant tous les ingrédients avec 1½ cuillère à café de sel marin dans un bol à mélanger et en remuant jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Retirez toutes les feuilles du chou-fleur et coupez-les dans le sens de la longueur. Mettez les tranches de feuilles de chou-fleur dans un bol avec une pincée de sel. Réservez pour plus tard.","Coupez le chou-fleur en tranches épaisses d’environ 1½ cm à 2 cm d’épaisseur – ne vous inquiétez pas si certains fleurons se détachent, tout est en train de rôtir. Huiler une grande plaque à rôtir et y déposer les tranches et les fleurons de chou-fleur. Versez dessus la marinade et remuez pour enrober, puis couvrez de papier d''aluminium et laissez mariner pendant au moins 2 heures, mais vous pouvez la laisser au réfrigérateur toute la journée ou toute la nuit si vous le souhaitez.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Rôtir le chou-fleur recouvert de papier d''aluminium pendant 40-45 minutes. Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce. Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive avec les graines de cumin dans une poêle à fond épais à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''oignon et une pincée de sel et faites revenir en remuant pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à caraméliser. Ajoutez les tomates hachées et un peu d''assaisonnement. Augmentez légèrement le feu et faites cuire, en continuant de remuer, pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à réduction, puis ajoutez l''ail, l''harissa et le beurre et mélangez. Passer au robot culinaire jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis reverser dans la poêle, ajouter les pois chiches et les feuilles de chou-fleur et réchauffer pendant une minute ou deux.","Retirez le papier d''aluminium du chou-fleur et remettez la plaque au four pendant 10 minutes pour caraméliser. Incorporer le tahini et l''huile d''olive au yaourt dans un bol et assaisonner. Une fois le chou-fleur prêt, répartissez la sauce tiède dans les assiettes, puis garnissez de tranches de chou-fleur et de yaourt au tahini. Répartir sur les amandes. Servir avec une salade bien garnie de feuilles croquantes."]','2026-01-11 00:08:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10974,7966,'fr','Poulet aux pois chiches harissa écrasés','Besoin de quelque chose de rapide pour le dîner ? Essayez ce poulet enrobé de zaatar savoureux et servi avec des pois chiches épicés. C''est simple, mais vraiment délicieux','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon, haché","1 poivron rouge, finement tranché","1 poivron jaune, finement tranché","4 poitrines de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe de zaatar","400 g de pois chiches en boîte","1½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de harissa rouge","150 g de bébés épinards","½ petit bouquet de persil finement haché","quartiers de citron, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons et les poivrons pendant 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et dorés.","Pendant ce temps, placez le poulet entre deux feuilles de papier sulfurisé et écrasez-le légèrement jusqu''à ce qu''il ait environ 2 cm d''épaisseur. Mélangez le reste de l''huile et le za''atar, puis frottez le poulet. Assaisonner au goût.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Placez le poulet sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier d''aluminium et faites-le griller pendant 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bien cuit.","Faites chauffer les pois chiches dans une poêle avec la pâte d''harissa et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien chauds, puis écrasez-les grossièrement avec un presse-purée. Faites revenir les épinards dans une casserole avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau ou au micro-ondes dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Incorporer le mélange de poivrons et d''oignons, les épinards et le persil aux pois chiches. Servir avec les tranches de poulet et les quartiers de citron à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:08:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10975,7968,'fr','Manti de bœuf et griottes au beurre tomate-piment','Offrez-vous un festin turc et mettez ces manti (raviolis) au bœuf et aux griottes au centre de la scène. Vous pouvez pré-préparer les manti et les congeler pour plus de facilité','["300 g de farine inci turque ou de farine pour pâtes « 00 », plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de sel fin","1 gros oeuf, battu","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","semoule fine, pour saupoudrer","pignons de pin grillés, pour servir","feuilles de thym, pour servir","125 g de bœuf haché","30 g d''oignon (½ petit), haché très finement","20 g de persil haché très finement","20 g de griottes séchées, hachées","½ cuillère à café de graines de fenouil, moulues à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier","200 g de beurre doux","pincée d''origan séché","1½ cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","500 g de purée de tomates","vinaigre de Xérès, pour assaisonner","sucre en poudre, pour assaisonner","1 cuillère à soupe de pul biber (flocons de piment turc)","125 g de yaourt grec","½ petite gousse d''ail, finement râpée","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","une machine à pâtes"]','["Pour faire la pâte, mettez la farine et le sel dans un batteur sur socle muni d''un crochet pétrisseur. Ajoutez l''œuf et l''huile, puis mélangez à basse vitesse. Ajoutez progressivement environ 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Une fois que le mélange commence à s''agglutiner, versez-le sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte ferme et lisse. Coupez en quatre portions, enveloppez chacune et laissez reposer au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes.","Pour faire la garniture, combinez tous les ingrédients avec un peu de sel et mélangez bien à la main. Faites frire une petite quantité pour vérifier l''assaisonnement.","Faites passer un morceau de pâte dans le réglage le plus grand d''une machine à pâtes, puis pliez-le en deux avant de le rouler à nouveau. Continuez jusqu''à atteindre le réglage 2/3. Étalez la pâte sur un plan de travail saupoudré de semoule et coupez-la en carrés d''environ 6 x 6 cm. Versez 1 cuillère à café de garniture au centre de chacun. Badigeonnez un peu d’eau sur les bords et rassemblez-la au centre pour former une forme de manti (voir image du haut). Continuez jusqu''à épuisement de la garniture, en plaçant le manti fini sur un plateau fortement saupoudré de semoule. Gardez les pâtes restantes enveloppées pendant que vous travaillez. Vous en aurez plus que ce dont vous avez besoin (voir le conseil ci-dessous). Refroidissez la manti jusqu''à 24 heures.","Pour faire le beurre tomate-piment, faites fondre la moitié du beurre dans une poêle, ajoutez l''origan et le concentré de tomates et laissez cuire brièvement avant de verser la passata avec une pincée de sel. Cuire à feu doux pendant environ 20 min. Terminez avec un peu de vinaigre de Xérès et une pincée de sucre en poudre. Faites chauffer le reste du beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, versez-le au tamis fin, laissez refroidir 2 min, puis ajoutez le pul biber. Mélanger la sauce et le beurre pimenté et réserver au chaud. Préparez le yaourt à l''ail en fouettant les ingrédients avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau.","Faites cuire les manti dans l''eau bouillante pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et que la viande soit cuite. Égouttez et servez les manti avec la sauce au yaourt et le beurre de piment, et saupoudrez de pignons de pin et de thym."]','2026-01-11 00:08:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10976,7970,'fr','Baklava pistache, amande, citron & rose','Terminez un menu d''inspiration moyen-orientale ou turque avec du baklava maison parfumé pour le dessert. La recette de Diana Henry présente des saveurs de pistache, d''amande, de rose et de citron','["125g d''amandes moulues","300 g de pistaches hachées au robot culinaire (certaines grossièrement, d''autres finement)","1 citron finement zesté et pressé, plus 4 larges lanières de zeste","500 g de sucre semoule, plus 3 cuillères à soupe","200 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour le moule","2 paquets de pâte filo de 250 g (vous n''utiliserez pas toutes les feuilles)","environ 2 cuillères à café d''eau de rose (ajouter au goût car les marques varient en force)","une poignée de pétales de roses roses, non vaporisés (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez la poudre d''amandes et les pistaches concassées dans un bol en réservant 3 cuillères à soupe de pistaches pour la garniture. Incorporez le zeste de citron finement râpé, les 3 cuillères à soupe de sucre et 5 cuillères à soupe de beurre fondu. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Badigeonner l''intérieur d''un plat à rôtir ou à pâtisserie (30 x 20 cm) avec le beurre.","Quelle que soit la taille de vos feuilles de filo, coupez-les pour les adapter à la boîte. Déposez-y une feuille de filo, beurrez-la et continuez jusqu''à obtenir 6 feuilles de filo. Versez dessus le mélange de noix et appuyez avec le dos d''une cuillère, comme pour faire un fond de biscuit, puis posez 8 feuilles de filo sur le dessus en beurrant à nouveau chacune d''entre elles. A l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, découpez un treillis en losanges sur le dessus, puis enfournez 1 h jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré.","Préparez le sirop en mettant le sucre, le jus de citron et les lanières de zeste dans une casserole avec 250 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition en remuant pour bien dissoudre le sucre, puis baissez un peu le feu et laissez mijoter 10 min. Le mélange aura l''air assez sirupeux. Retirez le zeste du citron et ajoutez l''eau de rose selon votre goût.","Pendant que le baklava et le sirop sont encore chauds, versez délicatement le sirop sur la pâte. Remettez le baklava au four encore 5 minutes.","Saupoudrez le reste des pistaches sur le baklava, puis laissez-le refroidir toute la nuit afin que le baklava puisse absorber tout le sirop. Si vous préparez ce plat pour une occasion spéciale, il est bon de parsemer quelques pétales de roses déchirés (ils doivent être en petits morceaux) juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10977,6429,'fr','Maquereau aux dattes, aubergines et relish de citron confit','Dégustez des filets de maquereau accompagnés d''une délicieuse relish aux dattes, aubergines et citron confit pour un avant-goût du Maroc. Servir avec du riz, du couscous ou du boulgour','["½ cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à soupe de graines de coriandre","8 filets de maquereau","½ citron, jus","2 aubergines (environ 550g)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la friture","1 petit oignon, finement haché","2 tomates italiennes, hachées finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de miel liquide","1 citron confit, plus 4 cuillères à café de jus du pot","8 dattes dénoyautées et hachées finement","8 brins de menthe, feuilles arrachées","couscous ou boulgour et brins de coriandre, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la relish. Coupez les tiges des aubergines, puis coupez la chair en cubes de 1 cm. Faites chauffer 1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir les aubergines par lots à feu moyen pendant 8 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies et dorées. Vous devrez peut-être ajouter plus d''huile. Transférer dans une assiette et réserver.","Ajoutez encore ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile dans la poêle et faites revenir l''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et doré, environ 10 minutes. Versez la tomate et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit effondrée, puis ajoutez l''ail, le piment, le cumin et le gingembre et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Remettez l''aubergine dans la poêle, ajoutez le miel, le jus du pot de citrons confits et les dattes. Saison. Baissez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant environ 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais mais pas ferme – ajoutez un peu d''eau si nécessaire. Hachez le citron confit – la pulpe ainsi que la peau – en éliminant les pépins, puis ajoutez-en la moitié à la relish. Goûtez pour voir si vous avez besoin de plus – il doit être affirmé, sucré et salé. Vous voudrez peut-être aussi plus de miel. Laisser refroidir, puis incorporer la menthe.","Faites griller les graines de cumin et de coriandre dans une poêle sèche à feu doux jusqu''à ce que les graines commencent à crépiter et à sauter dans la poêle. Transférer dans un pilon et un mortier et écraser jusqu''à obtenir un mélange grossier. Ajoutez du sel et du poivre.","Badigeonnez d''huile d''olive les filets de maquereau, puis saupoudrez-les du mélange d''épices. Faites chauffer une poêle ou une plancha et, lorsqu''elle est bien chaude, ajoutez les filets de poisson, peau vers le bas. Cuire 2-3 minutes. Retournez-les et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Pressez le jus de citron sur tous les filets et servez-les avec la relish. Servir avec du boulgour ou du couscous et de la coriandre, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10978,7972,'fr','Pâtisseries feta, dattes et épinards','Profitez au maximum des dattes avec ces pâtisseries filo sucrées et salées d''inspiration moyen-orientale. Remplis de feta, de dattes et d''épinards, ils constituent un excellent plat d''accompagnement','["500 g d''épinards, les grosses tiges retirées","115g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ petit oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","4 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","8 dattes dénoyautées et hachées finement","½ petit bouquet de persil, feuilles finement hachées","8 brins de menthe, feuilles arrachées","25 g de pignons de pin grillés","150 g de feta émiettée","1 œuf moyen, légèrement battu","Paquet de 250 g de feuilles de pâte filo","graines de sésame noir, pour saupoudrer"]','["Mettez les épinards dans une casserole avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau sur feu doux-moyen et couvrez. Remuez les épinards plusieurs fois jusqu''à ce qu''ils tombent, environ 4 minutes, puis égouttez-les. Une fois suffisamment refroidis pour être manipulés, pressez fermement l’excès d’eau des épinards avec vos mains, puis hachez-les grossièrement.","Faites chauffer 10 g de beurre et toute l''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajouter l''oignon et cuire à feu moyen-doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et ramolli. Ajouter les épinards et l''ail égouttés, assaisonner et cuire environ 5 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Laisser refroidir.","Transférer le mélange d''épinards dans un bol, puis incorporer les oignons nouveaux, les dattes, le persil, la menthe, les pignons de pin, la feta et l''œuf. Saison.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Dérouler la pâte filo et la couper en bandes de 9 à 10 cm de large. Faites fondre le reste du beurre, puis badigeonnez-en une partie avant de mettre une autre bande dessus et de la badigeonner également. Gardez le reste de pâte recouvert d''un torchon pendant que vous travaillez. Mettez deux cuillères à café bombées de garniture à l’extrémité de la bande la plus proche de vous. Pliez le coin inférieur de la pâte en diagonale sur la garniture, de sorte que le bord inférieur rejoigne maintenant le bord droit de la pâte. Repliez le triangle rempli et continuez ainsi avec toute la bande, en badigeonnant de beurre au fur et à mesure, jusqu''à ce que vous obteniez un joli paquet de filo triangulaire. Répétez le processus avec toute la pâte et la garniture. Badigeonner le dessus de chacun de beurre, puis déposer sur des plaques à pâtisserie. Saupoudrer de graines de sésame noires et cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:08:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10979,7974,'fr','Rouleaux de chou à la mode du Moyen-Orient','Ajoutez ce plat végétalien à votre répertoire. Nous avons rempli les feuilles de chou de riz brun et de lentilles, ainsi que de menthe, de citron, de tahini et de pignons de pin.','["16 grosses feuilles de chou de Milan, tiges parées (poids préparé 430g)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 gros oignons (360 g), finement hachés","40 g de pignons de pin","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1½ cuillère à café de cannelle","150 g de riz basmati brun","1½ cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon de légumes","Boîte de 390 g de lentilles vertes égouttées","1 citron, zesté et pressé","4 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","6 tomates, tranchées","¼ concombre (150 g), tranché","12 olives Kalamata, dénoyautées et tranchées","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe hachée"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau, ajoutez les feuilles de chou et mettez une grosse louche dessus pour les maintenir immergées. Faire bouillir 4 min, puis égoutter en réservant l''eau.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive. Réservez 2 cuillères à soupe d''oignon, puis faites revenir le reste pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste doré. Incorporer les pignons de pin et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à colorer. Ajoutez les épices et le riz, puis versez 450 ml de l''eau réservée. Incorporer la poudre de bouillon, couvrir et cuire 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit presque tendre et que le liquide soit absorbé. Incorporer le zeste et la menthe.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettre une cuillerée de riz au centre d''une feuille de chou, rouler et mettre dans une cocotte peu profonde. Répétez avec le reste du riz et des feuilles. Couvrir et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit bien tendre.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le tahini, le jus de citron, l''ail et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau, puis mélangez les ingrédients de la salade avec l''oignon réservé. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, servez la moitié des petits pains avec la moitié de la sauce et la moitié de la salade. Couvrir et réfrigérer le reste pour le manger un autre jour. Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant deux à trois jours. Réchauffer au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:08:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10980,7976,'fr','Boulettes de viande à la libanaise avec mujadara','Le riz brun, les lentilles et les oignons constituent une délicieuse base pour ce dîner sain. Nous avons utilisé de la viande hachée d''agneau maigre et beaucoup d''herbes et d''épices pour ajouter de la saveur.','["250 g de viande hachée d''agneau (10 % de matière grasse ou moins)","2 gros oignons (320 g), 1 haché très finement, 1 coupé en deux et émincé","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","3 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 citron, moitié zesté et jus, moitié coupé en quatre quartiers pour servir","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","200 g de riz basmati brun","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon","Boîte de 390 g de lentilles vertes égouttées","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","4 tomates, coupées en quartiers","¼ de concombre (environ 150 g), tranché","12 olives Kalamata, coupées en quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe hachée, plus quelques petites feuilles pour servir"]','["Versez l''agneau dans un bol avec ¼ de l''oignon haché, l''ail, ½ cuillère à café de cumin, le zeste de citron et un peu de poivre noir. Mélangez bien avec vos mains, puis façonnez 16 petites boulettes de viande. Réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-vif. Réservez la majeure partie de l''oignon haché restant pour la salade, puis faites frire le reste pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Incorporez le reste du cumin, puis versez le riz, la poudre de bouillon, 500 ml d''eau et un peu de poivre noir. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter, puis couvrez et laissez cuire à feu moyen pendant 30 minutes. Ajoutez les lentilles, couvrez à nouveau et laissez cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et que toute l''eau ait été absorbée.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste de l’huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-vif. Ajoutez les boulettes de viande et l''oignon émincé, couvrez et laissez cuire 5 minutes. Remuer, puis cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les boulettes de viande soient bien cuites et que les oignons soient dorés. Mélangez le tahini et le jus de citron avec 3-4 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour faire une sauce.","Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la salade avec l''oignon émincé réservé. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, répartissez la moitié de la mujadara entre deux assiettes et garnissez de la moitié des boulettes de viande et des oignons. Verser la moitié de la sauce tahini et servir avec la moitié de la salade, deux quartiers de citron et quelques feuilles de menthe. Couvrir et réfrigérer les portions restantes pour les manger un autre jour. Se conserve deux à trois jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:08:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10981,7980,'fr','Calamars grillés, lentilles, poivrons rôtis et citron confit au tahini','Associez la sauce tahini maison aux calamars grillés, aux lentilles et aux poivrons pour un souper savoureux. La sauce se marie également bien avec des légumes rôtis ou du poisson','["3 gros poivrons rouges, coupés en deux et épépinés","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu plus pour rôtir et frire","½ petit oignon, finement haché","1 branche de céleri, coupée en dés","225 g de lentilles du Puy","1 citron, jus","½ petit bouquet de persil haché","600g de calamars nettoyés et préparés","2 piments verts et 2 piments rouges, coupés en deux, épépinés et finement tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","1 citron confit, chair enlevée et jetée, zeste tranché très finement","4 cuillères à soupe de tahin","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ citron, jus","½ petit bouquet de coriandre finement hachée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettre les poivrons sur une plaque allant au four et badigeonner d''un peu d''huile d''olive. Rôtir pendant 25 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et cloqués. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Pour faire la vinaigrette, mélanger le tout jusqu''à obtenir la consistance d''une double crème. Si c''est trop épais, ajoutez un peu d''eau et rectifiez l''assaisonnement selon votre goût. Annuler. Coupez les poivrons en lanières.","Faites chauffer un peu d''huile d''olive dans une poêle moyenne et faites revenir l''oignon et le céleri pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres mais non colorés. Versez les lentilles et couvrez d’eau. Porter à ébullition, puis baisser le feu et laisser mijoter 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres, en ajoutant de l''eau si nécessaire.","Égouttez les lentilles, puis versez-les dans un bol de service. Assaisonnez bien, puis ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, la moitié du jus de citron et le persil. Laissez refroidir un peu, puis ajoutez les poivrons.","Coupez les « ailes » du calmar et mettez-les de côté avec les tentacules. Coupez les corps d''un côté pour qu''ils s''ouvrent, puis nettoyez l''intérieur en passant fermement la lame d''un couteau sur la chair. Marquez la chair à l’intérieur, en vous assurant de ne pas la couper complètement. Séchez avec du papier absorbant, puis transférez dans un bol avec juste assez d''huile d''olive pour humidifier les morceaux (environ 2 cuillères à soupe). Faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude.","Assaisonnez les calamars et la plaque chauffante par lots pendant 20 à 30 secondes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste dorés. Couper en bouchées, puis mélanger avec la salade de lentilles et arroser du jus de citron restant.","Dans une petite poêle, faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et faites revenir les piments et l''ail jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Versez sur les calamars, puis mélangez le citron confit. Servir avec la vinaigrette dessus ou à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:08:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10982,7982,'fr','Côtelettes d''agneau au houmous et tomates rôties','Introduisez un peu de soleil dans votre journée quelle que soit la météo avec des côtelettes d''agneau à la méditerranéenne servies sur un lit d''houmous, de tomates rôties, d''olives et de feta.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","8 côtelettes d''agneau","200 g de tomates cerises mélangées sur vigne","40 g de pignons de pin","poignée de cresson","12 olives noires dénoyautées et coupées en deux","50 g de feta émiettée","une poignée de menthe fraîche, finement hachée, pour servir","2 pains plats, réchauffés, pour servir","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","½ citron, jus","1 petite gousse d''ail, hachée grossièrement","1½ cuillère à café de tahini","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Mélangez l’huile et l’ail, puis frottez-en la moitié sur les côtelettes d’agneau. Assaisonnez bien, puis laissez mariner. Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.","Mettez les tomates sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis arrosez-les du reste du mélange d''huile et assaisonnez. Cuire pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, en ajoutant les pignons de pin pendant les 2-3 dernières minutes pour les faire griller.","Préparez le houmous en mélangeant tous les ingrédients avec 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Faites chauffer une poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire l''agneau pendant 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût. Maintenez le côté gras de la viande contre la poêle pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit croustillante. Couvrir et laisser reposer 5 min.","Répartir le houmous sur une assiette ou quatre assiettes et garnir de tomates, d''un filet d''huile d''olive, de l''agneau et du cresson. Répartir sur les olives, les pignons de pin, la feta et la menthe et servir avec les pains plats."]','2026-01-11 00:08:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10983,5714,'fr','Rompre','Dégustez cette salade de boulgour comme plat principal végétalien ou comme plat d''accompagnement à servir avec un gigot d''agneau, des côtelettes ou des aubergines rôties.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon rouge tranché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées très finement","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux, épépiné et coupé en fines lanières","1 piment vert, coupé en deux, épépiné et coupé en fines lanières","1¾ cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","250 g de boulgour","4 tomates italiennes, hachées","15 g de noix hachées grossièrement","graines de grenade d''une ½ grenade (environ 60g)","30 g de bouquet de persil plat finement haché","une grosse poignée de feuilles de menthe déchirées","1 gros citron, jus","85 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1¾ cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole de taille moyenne et faites revenir l''oignon pour enlever juste le bord brut. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore 30 secondes environ. Ajoutez le cumin et les piments et laissez cuire encore 1 min. Incorporer la purée de tomates et 175 ml d''eau bouillante. Ajoutez le boulgour, assaisonnez, mélangez le tout, retirez du feu, couvrez et laissez reposer environ 15 min. L''eau aurait dû être absorbée.","Fourchez les grains pour les séparer et les aérer, puis ajoutez les tomates, les noix, les graines de grenade et les herbes et passez-les à la fourchette. Mélangez le jus de citron, l''huile d''olive extra vierge et la mélasse de grenade dans un petit bol. Ajoutez-en les trois quarts, puis goûtez pour voir s''il en faut plus (s''il semble bien parfumé et suffisamment moelleux, laissez-le).","Le kisir peut reposer à température ambiante pendant quelques heures, ou couvert au réfrigérateur – mais laissez-le revenir à température ambiante avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10984,7984,'fr','Baba Ganousch','Une délicieuse trempette aux aubergines fumées, parfaite avec des pains plats ou des pittas chauds, ou à servir avec d''autres plats du Moyen-Orient dans le cadre d''un repas à partager','["2 aubergines moyennes","40 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","¼ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","1 gros citron, jus","½ petit bouquet de persil finement haché","pains plats ou pain pitta, pour servir"]','["Chauffez le gril à son réglage le plus élevé. Mettez les aubergines sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les griller pendant 35 à 40 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient complètement ramollies, noircies et cloquées, en les retournant à mi-cuisson avec une paire de pinces. Réserver et laisser refroidir complètement.","Une fois que vos aubergines sont suffisamment froides pour être manipulées, retirez délicatement la peau carbonisée et jetez-la. Transférez la chair dans le grand bol d''un robot culinaire avec 30 ml d''huile, la coriandre, le cumin, le tahini, le citron et la moitié du persil. Assaisonnez et pulsez la chair trois ou quatre fois pour créer une trempette texturée et épaisse.","Transférer la trempette dans un bol et arroser du reste de l''huile, parsemer des restes de persil et servir avec des pains plats chauds ou du pitta."]','2026-01-11 00:08:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10985,7986,'fr','Oeufs turcs','Vous cherchez un bol chauffant de nourriture réconfortante pour deux ? Ces œufs pochés turcs végétariens faciles peuvent être prêts en seulement 20 minutes','["1 piment rouge, finement tranché","50g de beurre","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","200 g de yaourt grec","½ citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","2 œufs moyens","2 cuillères à café de sumac","coriandre en petit paquet, feuilles cueillies","toasts, pour servir"]','["Mettez le piment et le beurre dans une petite casserole et faites fondre à feu très doux pour que la saveur du piment s''imprègne pendant que vous préparez le reste du plat.","Incorporer l''ail dans le yaourt. Assaisonnez bien et ajoutez le jus de citron. Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d’eau. Ajoutez le vinaigre, faites un tourbillon avec une grande cuillère, puis cassez chaque œuf dans l''eau. Pocher 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris, puis égoutter sur du papier absorbant.","Pour servir, mettez la moitié du yaourt dans chaque bol, ajoutez un œuf poché dans chacun, puis arrosez de beurre de piment fondu. Assaisonner, garnir de sumac et de feuilles de coriandre et servir avec du pain grillé."]','2026-01-11 00:08:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10986,7988,'fr','Brochettes turques à la sauce tomate et chili','Ces brochettes de poulet épicées peuvent être marinées la veille pour plus de saveur. Envelopper dans un pain plat chaud et garnir de piment mariné et de yaourt rafraîchissant.','["2 gousses d''ail","200 g de yaourt grec","1 citron, jus","2 cuillères à café de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à café de flocons de piment (Alep c''est sympa)","2 cuillères à café de sumac","4 poitrines de poulet, coupées en morceaux","300 g de petites tomates italiennes","1 piment rouge de la taille d''un pouce, tige retirée","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 petit oignon rouge, tranché","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade","4 pains plats du Moyen-Orient","piments longs marinés (guindillas)","une poignée de coriandre fraîche","une poignée de persil plat frais"]','["Écrasez 1 gousse d''ail et mélangez-la avec 3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt, le jus de citron, 1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates, la moitié des épices et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un bol moyen. Ajouter le poulet, mélanger, couvrir et réfrigérer au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 1 heure ou toute la nuit.","Préparez la sauce chili. Mettez 100 g de tomates, le piment rouge entier, le reste des épices, la gousse d''ail et le concentré de tomates, ainsi que 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, la moitié de l''oignon rouge et la mélasse de grenade dans un robot culinaire. Ajoutez un peu d’assaisonnement et mélangez jusqu’à obtenir une purée, puis réservez.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6 et faire chauffer une plaque chauffante. Enfilez le poulet sur des brochettes en métal ou en bois trempées, puis essuyez l''excédent de marinade. Embrocher les tomates restantes sur une autre brochette. Huilez légèrement la plaque chauffante avec le reste de l''huile d''olive et faites dorer le poulet des deux côtés, puis transférez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Pendant ce temps, faites griller les tomates pendant 1 à 2 minutes, en les retournant à mi-cuisson pour qu''elles aient des marques de cuisson des deux côtés.","Servir le poulet et les tomates sur des pains plats avec le reste de l''oignon rouge, les piments marinés, le reste du yaourt grec, le persil et la coriandre avec la sauce chili arrosée."]','2026-01-11 00:08:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10987,7990,'fr','Pain plat d''agneau turc','Un amuse-gueule parfait pour une fête, préparez ce pain plat d''agneau épicé, coupé en carrés et regardez-le disparaître en quelques minutes.','["1 cuillère à café de levure séchée","400 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de sel","un peu d''huile","semoule, pour saupoudrer","500 g de viande de cuisse d''agneau maigre, hachée finement (ou viande hachée maigre)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 cuillères à café de flocons de piment turc ou 1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","4 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de tomates italiennes égouttées","4 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade, plus un peu pour arroser","2 petits oignons rouges, tranchés finement en demi-lunes","50g de pignons de pin","100 g de feta émiettée","2 cuillères à soupe de persil plat haché","50g de graines de grenade"]','["Mélangez la levure et 250 ml d''eau tiède dans un petit bol et laissez reposer 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit mousseuse – cela signifie que la levure agit. Mettez la farine et le sel dans un grand bol à mélanger (ou utilisez un batteur de table équipé d''un crochet pétrisseur et réglé à basse vitesse). Ajoutez le mélange de levure et mélangez à la main ou au robot jusqu''à ce que la pâte forme une boule. Si le mélange est trop collant pour former une boule, ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe de farine et mélangez à nouveau. Pétrir 12 minutes à la main, ou 8 à 10 minutes à vitesse élevée au batteur, jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis mettre dans un bol légèrement huilé. Retourner pour enrober la pâte d''huile, couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser dans un endroit chaud pendant 2 à 4 heures jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. (Vous pouvez également le mettre au réfrigérateur toute la nuit, le puncher et le laisser lever à nouveau à température ambiante.)","Chauffez le four à 240C/220C/gaz 9. Placez une plaque à pâtisserie ou une pierre à pizza sur la grille du milieu. Si vous utilisez de la viande de gigot d''agneau, passez-la au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit finement hachée. Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude. Ajouter l''oignon et l''ail et cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajouter l''agneau et cuire pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, en brisant les grumeaux avec une cuillère, puis vider l''excès d''huile. Ajoutez les épices, un peu d''assaisonnement, le concentré de tomates, les tomates et la mélasse de grenade, et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes en mélangeant bien le tout et en cassant les tomates avec une cuillère. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir complètement. Peut être fait un ou deux jours à l’avance.","Etalez la pâte sur un plan fariné en un grand rectangle d''environ 30 x 40 cm. Saupoudrer environ 1 cuillère à café de semoule sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Mettez la pâte dessus et assurez-vous qu''elle peut bouger. Ajoutez d''abord l''agneau épicé, puis garnissez avec les oignons rouges, les pignons de pin et la feta. Glisser sur la plaque à pâtisserie chauffée ou sur la pierre à pizza et cuire pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fond soit croustillant.","Retirer et arroser d''un peu de mélasse de grenade supplémentaire, puis parsemer de persil et de graines de grenade. Transférer sur une grande planche et couper en diamants pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10988,7994,'fr','Pilaf turc au safran et baies de goji','Nous avons élaboré la recette ultime pour la santé du cerveau, riche en nutriments stimulant le cerveau comme la cannelle, les amandes et les baies de goji.','["2 grosses gousses d''ail","généreuse pincée de safran","3 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","200 g de cuisse de dinde sans peau coupée en dés","85 g de riz basmati complet","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de bouillon de légumes","3 branches de céleri, hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym frais","1 cuillère à soupe de baies de goji séchées","1 oignon moyen, coupé en deux et tranché très finement","100 g de pousses d''épinards","25g d''amandes effilées"]','["Hachez finement l''ail et réservez-le pour l''activer (voir astuce). Pendant ce temps, versez 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante sur le safran et laissez infuser. Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une grande sauteuse antiadhésive avec couvercle, puis ajoutez la dinde et faites-la revenir 5 minutes en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à dorer.","Incorporez le riz et la cannelle dans la casserole, puis versez 400 ml d''eau bouillante et le bouillon et remuez bien. Ajoutez le céleri, le thym, les baies de goji et beaucoup de poivre noir moulu. Couvrez bien la poêle pour éviter que la vapeur ne s''échappe et laissez cuire à feu doux pendant 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et ajoutez l''oignon. Lorsqu''il commence à ramollir, couvrez la poêle pendant 5 minutes pour le faire cuire un peu plus à la vapeur. Retirez le couvercle et faites frire lentement pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, en remuant fréquemment.","Après 20 minutes de cuisson du riz, vérifiez le niveau d''eau. Si le riz est encore trop noisette et que tout le liquide a été absorbé, ajoutez jusqu''à 100 ml d''eau supplémentaire. Incorporez le safran, couvrez à nouveau et laissez cuire 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre.","Ajoutez l''ail et les épinards, faites cuire brièvement pour flétrir les feuilles, puis éteignez le feu. Incorporer les oignons frits et les amandes. Couvrir la poêle et laisser reposer 5 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10989,7996,'fr','Oeufs du Moyen-Orient aux merguez et pistaches','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans Apportez des saveurs audacieuses à ce brunch pour deux avec de l''harissa, du sumac et des pistaches – remplacez-les par des chipolatas ou du chorizo ​​si vous préférez','["un filet d''huile d''olive ou de colza","1 petit oignon rouge, haché","4 merguez sausages","15 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","pincée de sucre (n''importe lequel fera l''affaire)","2 cuillères à café de pâte d''harissa (de préférence de l''harissa à la rose, car elle est parfumée et pas trop piquante)","2 œufs","2 pains pitta complets","pincée de sumac ou de paprika (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","quelques brins de persil hachés","1 cuillère à soupe de pistaches décortiquées, hachées grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer un filet d’huile dans une petite poêle à fond épais – une poêle en fonte est parfaite. Ajoutez l''oignon et faites-le cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, puis poussez-le sur un côté de la poêle. Ajoutez les saucisses et faites-les frire pendant 5 à 10 minutes, en les roulant dans la poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Ajoutez les tomates, le sucre et la harissa, assaisonnez bien et ajoutez un peu d''eau. Cuire pendant 5 à 10 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient cuites pour obtenir une sauce épaisse et épaisse.","Écartez les saucisses dans la poêle afin de pouvoir créer 2 gros trous dans la sauce à l''aide d''une cuillère. Cassez les œufs dans les trous et laissez cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les blancs soient juste pris et que le jaune soit encore coulant. Pendant ce temps, faites griller les pains pitta.","Saupoudrer chaque œuf d''un peu de sumac, ajouter une cuillerée de yaourt, puis saupoudrer de persil et de pistaches. Coupez chaque pain pitta en deux et servez-le à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:08:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10990,7998,'fr','Burgers de falafels','Mélangez des pois chiches avec de l''ail, des épices et des herbes pour préparer de délicieuses galettes végétariennes pour le déjeuner ou le dîner.','["250 g de pois chiches en boîte","1 oignon moyen, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","petit paquet de persil plat, haché","2 cuillères à soupe rondes de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","100g d''houmous","4 pains à burger, coupés en deux","cresson, pour servir"]','["Égouttez, rincez et séchez soigneusement les pois chiches, puis versez-les dans le bol d''un robot culinaire. Pulser jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement brisé en miettes grossières.","Ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail, les épices, le persil, la farine et un peu d''assaisonnement, et continuez à mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Avec vos mains, formez délicatement avec le mélange 4 galettes d''environ 10 cm de diamètre et 2 cm d''épaisseur.","Dans une grande poêle, faites chauffer l''huile et faites revenir les falafels de chaque côté pendant 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés (vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots). Faites légèrement griller les pains à burger côté coupé dans une poêle ou faites-les griller sous le gril.","Tartinez un côté de chaque pain avec de l''houmous, garnissez d''un burger de falafel, ajoutez une poignée de cresson, puis posez la moitié du pain restant sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:08:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10991,4545,'fr','Falafels aux petits pois et salade de couscous à la menthe','Donnez une nouvelle jeunesse aux falafels en utilisant un mélange de pois chiches et de pois surgelés, servez-les avec du couscous et une cuillerée de yaourt pour un repas bon marché mais savoureux.','["400 g de petits pois surgelés","400 g de pois chiches égouttés","3 cuillères à soupe de farine, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète crémeux ou de tahini","petit bouquet de persil haché","petit bouquet de menthe hachée","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","200 g de couscous","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 grosses tomates hachées","100 ml de yaourt nature"]','["Mettez les petits pois dans une passoire et passez-les sous le robinet d''eau chaude pour les décongeler. Bien égoutter, alors\r\nmettre la moitié dans un robot culinaire. Ajoutez les pois chiches, la farine, l''ail, les graines de cumin, le beurre de cacahuète ou le tahini, le persil, le zeste de citron et beaucoup d''assaisonnement. Mélangez les ingrédients\r\nen pâte, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si elle semble trop friable. Avec les mains mouillées, façonnez le mélange en 8 galettes, saupoudrez de farine, puis placez-les sur une assiette et réfrigérez pendant 10 minutes, ou plus si vous avez le temps. Faites bouillir la bouilloire.","Placez le couscous dans un grand bol, assaisonnez, puis versez suffisamment d''eau bouillante pour couvrir. Réserver 5 min.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle. Faites cuire les falafels pendant 2 à 3 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés. Vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots, alors gardez-les au chaud dans un four doux pendant que vous le faites. Ajouter le reste de l''huile, le jus de citron, la menthe, les tomates et les petits pois au couscous. Servir la salade et les falafels avec une cuillerée de yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:08:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10992,8000,'fr','Wraps au poulet libanais','Faites mariner le poulet dans du yaourt, du citron et du piment de la Jamaïque avant de le griller et de l''envelopper dans du pain plat avec de la salade pour un repas léger et délicieux en milieu de semaine.','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","200 g de yaourt grec","le jus et le zeste d''1 citron","1 cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","25 g de pignons de pin grillés","petit bouquet de persil, finement haché","2 tomates, coupées en dés","½ concombre, coupé en dés","4 gros tortillas ou gros pains plats","salade composée, pour servir"]','["Disposez les poitrines de poulet sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé, recouvrez d''une autre feuille de papier sulfurisé, puis aplatissez-les en les frappant avec un rouleau à pâtisserie. Mélangez la moitié du yaourt dans un grand bol avec la moitié du jus de citron, le zeste de citron, le piment de la Jamaïque, l''huile d''olive, l''ail et une pincée de sel. Mélangez bien, puis incorporez le poulet en vous assurant qu''il est bien enrobé du mélange. Couvrir et réfrigérer 30 minutes pour mariner.","Faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif et faites cuire le poulet pendant 5 à 6 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit (vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots). Transférer sur une planche et trancher. Étalez le reste du yaourt sur les wraps et remplissez-les de pignons de pin, de poulet cuit, de persil, de tomates et de concombre. Arroser du reste de jus de citron et rouler. Remettez les wraps sur la plaque chauffante pendant 30 secondes de chaque côté pour les faire légèrement griller, puis servez avec une salade composée."]','2026-01-11 00:08:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10993,4740,'fr','Falafels au houmous et taboulé','Préparez vos propres beignets de pois chiches et de haricots beurre et servez-les avec une salade de couscous aux herbes – la recette suffit pour deux repas.','["1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés","jus ½ citron","coriandre en petit paquet, tiges comprises","¼ de piment rouge épépiné et haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 jaune d''oeuf battu","petit paquet de persil","4 cuillères à soupe de farine complète","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tahini","pincée de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","jus ½ citron","50 g de couscous d''orge","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","jus d''1 citron","petit paquet de persil, finement haché","petit paquet de menthe, hachée finement","petit paquet de coriandre, hachée finement","2 oignons nouveaux, parties blanches seulement, tranchés finement","½ concombre épépiné et coupé en petits morceaux","3 tomates coupées en quartiers, épépinées et coupées en petits morceaux"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et mettre une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive à l''intérieur. Pour les falafels, faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez les graines de cumin et de coriandre et faites-les frire à sec jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées (1 à 2 minutes), en remuant de temps en temps pour éviter de brûler. Retirer de la poêle.","Mettez les graines, le reste des ingrédients des falafels et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse. S''il semble trop sec, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café d''eau et mixez à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir la consistance d''un sable humide. À l’aide de vos mains, divisez le mélange en 12 boules de falafel et réservez au frais 30 minutes.","Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive. Lorsqu''elles sont chaudes, ajoutez les boules de falafel en les pressant dans la poêle pour en faire des galettes. Laissez cuire 2 à 3 minutes sans les retourner, puis vérifiez qu''ils sont dorés et croustillants. Retourner et cuire l''autre face encore 2 min. Retirer du moule, transférer sur la plaque à pâtisserie du four et cuire encore 10 minutes. Pendant ce temps, préparez le couscous d''orge en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Pour le houmous, mettez tous les ingrédients, sauf le citron, dans un robot culinaire et mixez pour former une pâte ferme. Pendant que le moteur tourne, ajoutez lentement le jus de citron et jusqu''à 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour obtenir la consistance de votre choix.","Pour le taboulé, mélangez l''huile d''olive, le jus de citron et un peu de poivre noir dans un petit bol. Dans un bol plus grand, mélanger le reste des ingrédients du taboulé, ainsi que le couscous cuit, et ajouter la vinaigrette. Bien mélanger.","Mettez de côté 4 falafels et 4 cuillères à soupe d''houmous au réfrigérateur pour les pittas marocaines farcies (voir « va bien avec », à droite). Servir les falafels restants avec le reste d''houmous et le taboulé."]','2026-01-11 00:08:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10994,8002,'fr','Falafels avec sauce épicée aux tomates et noix de cajou et légumes printaniers pochés','Un festin de pois chiches végétalien et sans gluten avec une délicieuse trempette et des asperges, carottes, radis et fèves pochées','["200 g de petits pois poussins secs","25g de persil, feuilles cueillies, tiges réservées au bouillon","2 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","1 échalote banane, hachée grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1½ cuillère à café de curcuma","¼ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten","huile de tournesol ou de colza, pour la friture","un peu de vin blanc (végétalien si nécessaire, facultatif)","1 feuille de laurier","1 échalote banane, hachée grossièrement","1 cœur de céleri ou 2 branches coupées en morceaux","pincée de poivre entier","200 g de mini carottes parées (si les parties vertes sont intactes, laisser une tige courte)","1 bulbe de fenouil, paré et coupé en fines tranches","20 pointes d''asperges (environ 200g)","12 radis roses (environ 100 g), coupés en deux","100 g de fèves fraîches ou surgelées, écosées et pelées","100 g de graines de grenade en pot","25g de noix de cajou","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment, ou au goût","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza ou de tournesol pressée à froid","300 g de tomates coupées en morceaux","4 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''agave ou de cassonade foncée"]','["Préparez les pois chiches. Mettez-les dans un grand bol et couvrez d''au moins 3 fois leur volume d''eau froide. Couvrir et laisser tremper pendant au moins 8 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Pour préparer le mélange de falafels, égouttez les pois chiches puis mettez-les dans un robot culinaire avec un peu d''assaisonnement. (Ne vous inquiétez pas si les pois chiches sont encore assez fermes à ce stade – c''est comme ça qu''ils devraient l''être. Ajoutez les feuilles de persil au robot culinaire avec le reste des ingrédients des falafels. Mélangez à haute vitesse, en ajoutant 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau, jusqu''à ce qu''un mélange lisse mais assez solide se forme. Grattez dans un bol et couvrez.","Mettez tous les ingrédients du bouillon de pochage, plus 1 cuillère à café de sel, 800 ml d''eau et les tiges de persil réservées, dans une casserole moyenne et portez à ébullition. Laisser mijoter 20 minutes et réserver.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce. Mettez les noix de cajou, les graines de sésame, le cumin et les flocons de piment dans une poêle sèche à feu moyen. Faire griller, en remuant fréquemment, jusqu''à ce que les graines de sésame commencent à devenir dorées. Retirer dans une assiette pour refroidir. Ajouter l''huile dans la poêle et remettre sur le feu en ajoutant les tomates et l''ail. Cuire à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que les tomates s''effondrent, environ 5 minutes. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes, puis passer dans un mixeur avec les noix et les épices grillées, l''agave ou le sucre et une généreuse pincée de sel. Fouetter à haute vitesse jusqu''à consistance lisse. Passer au mixeur et réserver.","Pendant ce temps, préparez les boules de falafel. Utilisez vos mains mouillées pour former des boules de la taille de grosses cerises et placez-les sur un plateau – vous devriez en avoir suffisamment pour faire 20 à 24 boules. Les boules peuvent être préparées la veille et réfrigérées.","Environ 15 minutes avant de servir, filtrez le liquide de pochage, puis remettez le liquide dans la casserole et portez à ébullition. Faites chauffer 5 cm d''huile de friture dans une grande poêle à fond épais à feu moyen. Lorsque l''huile est suffisamment chaude, un petit morceau de pain qui y est déposé devrait brunir en 20 à 30 secondes. Abaissez délicatement les boules de falafel dans l''huile, en les cuisant par lots de 6 à la fois. Faire frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient entièrement dorés, environ 3 minutes. Retirer avec une écumoire et égoutter sur du papier absorbant, et garder au chaud au four pendant que vous faites cuire les lots restants. Mettez de côté l’huile en toute sécurité.","Enfin, pochez les légumes. Ajouter les carottes au liquide de pochage et cuire 3 à 5 minutes selon la taille, puis ajouter le reste des légumes. Remettre à ébullition et laisser mijoter encore 3 minutes. Égoutter les légumes en jetant le liquide.","Pour servir, fouettez d''abord à nouveau la sauce (elle a tendance à se séparer). Déposez des cuillerées de sauce sur chaque assiette chauffée (une cuillerée pour chaque falafel, c''est joli). Répartir les falafels et les légumes printaniers dans les assiettes, parsemer de graines de grenade et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:08:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10995,8004,'fr','Salade de carottes et feta du Moyen-Orient','Une simple salade d''accompagnement remplie de saveurs ensoleillées, du cumin, de la cannelle et de la coriandre aux citrons, raisins secs et fromage.','["1 kg de carottes pelées, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur et coupées en morceaux","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de miel liquide","jus de 2 citrons","50 g de raisins secs ou raisins secs","200 g de feta en paquet","½ petit paquet de coriandre ou de persil plat, haché grossièrement"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau. Ajouter les carottes et cuire environ 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Pendant ce temps, dans un grand bol, mélanger les graines de cumin, les épices moulues, le miel et le jus de citron avec un peu d''assaisonnement, à l''aide d''un petit fouet ou d''une fourchette.","Égouttez les carottes, laissez-les sécher à la vapeur quelques minutes dans la passoire, puis mélangez-les à la vinaigrette avec les raisins secs ou les raisins secs. Laisser à température ambiante.","Pour servir, émietter sur la feta et parsemer d''herbes. Mélangez doucement."]','2026-01-11 00:08:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10996,6118,'fr','Oeufs écossais Falafel','Combinez deux plats gagnants dans cette recette de pique-nique composée d''œufs enrobés de pois chiches épicés aux fines herbes.','["9 gros œufs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour rouler","2 gros oignons, hachés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","½ petit paquet de coriandre, feuilles seulement","200 g de chapelure complète","5 cuillères à soupe de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","25 g de panko ou de chapelure séchée","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","huile de tournesol ou végétale, pour la friture"]','["Mettez 8 œufs dans une casserole d’eau froide. Portez à ébullition, laissez cuire 5 min, puis sortez rapidement de la casserole et plongez dans un grand bol d''eau froide pour refroidir. Une fois suffisamment refroidi pour être manipulé, pelez-le.","Pendant que les œufs refroidissent, mettez l''huile, les oignons et l''ail dans une poêle. Faire frire très doucement jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient vraiment tendres et commencent tout juste à devenir dorés. Ajoutez les épices et faites revenir encore quelques minutes. Versez dans un robot culinaire et réduisez en une pâte, puis ajoutez les pois chiches et les feuilles de coriandre et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement hachés mais pas pâteux. Incorporer la chapelure complète, la farine et le dernier œuf, d''abord battus à la fourchette, avec une bonne quantité d''assaisonnement.","Divisez le mélange en 8. Prenez une portion à la fois et aplatissez-la entre vos mains (frottez-vous les mains avec un peu plus d''huile si elle colle trop aux doigts). Roulez 1 de vos œufs écalés dans un peu de farine, secouez pour enlever l''excédent, puis enroulez le mélange de falafel autour, en le moulant pour recouvrir complètement l''œuf et en l''écrasant au niveau des joints pour sceller. Répétez l’opération pour couvrir tous les œufs. Versez le panko ou la chapelure séchée dans une assiette et mélangez-y les graines de sésame. Roulez chaque œuf dedans pour bien l''enrober. Peut être préparé 1 jour à l’avance, légèrement recouvert d’un film alimentaire et réfrigéré.","Procurez-vous une grande casserole profonde et remplissez-la à moitié d''huile, ou utilisez une friteuse. Chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''un peu de pain dore en 30 secondes environ. Ajoutez quelques œufs à la fois et faites frire en retournant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés et croustillants, environ 2 minutes. Soulever sur du papier absorbant pour égoutter pendant que vous faites cuire le reste des œufs par lots. Assaisonner avec un peu plus de sel et déguster chaud ou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:08:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10997,8006,'fr','Falafel aux canneberges et aux marrons','Ajoutez un peu d''esprit de saison à vos bouchées de pois chiches avec des fruits et des noix. Servir avec une trempette crémeuse au yaourt et de la coriandre fraîche','["1 patate douce, pelée et coupée en gros morceaux","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","200 g de marrons prêts à cuire sous vide","1 gros œuf","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","1 gousse d''ail","petit paquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement, et un peu plus pour servir","85 g de canneberges, décongelées si congelées et coupées en deux si vous avez le temps","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","150 g de yaourt crémeux à la grecque, pour servir"]','["Mettez la patate douce dans un bol allant au micro-ondes, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café d''eau et faites cuire à puissance élevée pendant 2 minutes. Écraser dans un grand bol.","Mettez les pois chiches et les châtaignes dans un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien hachés mais pas pâteux. Versez dessus la patate douce, puis ajoutez l''œuf, les épices, l''ail et la coriandre. Assaisonner généreusement et bien mélanger avec les mains. Ajoutez les canneberges. Façonner des boules de la taille d''une cuillère à dessert en une vingtaine de galettes. Peut être préparé à l’avance et réfrigéré jusqu’à 3 jours.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Faites revenir la moitié des falafels 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Soulever sur du papier absorbant pour égoutter. Répétez avec le deuxième lot. Peut être préparé jusqu''à 2 jours à l''avance et réchauffé. Laissez les falafels refroidir quelques minutes avant de les servir avec le yaourt et un peu de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:08:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10998,8008,'fr','Salade de carottes du Moyen-Orient','Une salade râpée légère et vibrante parfumée à l''eau de fleur d''oranger, au cumin et à la menthe - à servir avec des viandes épicées','["½ cuillère à café d''eau de fleur d''oranger","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","jus ½ citron","500 g de carottes râpées ou râpées","une grosse poignée de petites feuilles de menthe"]','["Mettez l''eau de fleur d''oranger, le cumin,\r\nde l''huile, du jus de citron et un peu d''assaisonnement\r\ndans un pot. Visser le couvercle et secouer\r\nbien combiner.","Versez les carottes et la menthe dans un bol.\r\nVerser sur la vinaigrette, assaisonner et mélanger\r\ntout ensemble."]','2026-01-11 00:08:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(10999,4481,'fr','Poussin libanais au pilaf d''aubergines épicé','Ce repas de style moyen-oriental constitue un souper décadent pour deux. Servez vos jeunes poulets avec un accompagnement de riz épicé et aromatique.','["1 aubergine, coupée en gros dés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, et un peu plus","2 petits poussins","¼ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque, plus 2 bonnes pincées","2 feuilles de laurier","1 oignon, coupé en deux et émincé","100 g de riz basmati","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","une bonne pincée de clous de girofle moulus","200 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud (ou alternative sans gluten)","2 cuillères à soupe de groseilles","1 grosse tomate, hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe hachée, plus quelques feuilles et brins pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth haché, plus quelques feuilles et brins pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","du sumac, pour saupoudrer (facultatif - nous avons utilisé Bart)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 4. Remuer\r\nl''aubergine dans 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien\r\nenduit. Versez dans un grand plat à rôtir, puis\r\npousser sur les côtés du moule pour faire un\r\nespace pour les poussins. Frottez un peu d''huile sur\r\nla peau des poussins, saupoudrer de\r\ndes pincées de piment de la Jamaïque, du sel et beaucoup de noir\r\npoivrez, mettez une feuille de laurier à l''intérieur de chaque oiseau,\r\npuis rôtir pendant 35 minutes. (Laisser cuire\r\nenviron 10 minutes avant de commencer le pilaf\r\ndonc ils sont prêts en même temps.)","Pour faire le pilaf, faites chauffer le\r\n1 cuillère à soupe d''huile restante dans une poêle moyenne\r\net faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Versez le riz et les pignons de pin,\r\nremuer pendant environ 1 min, puis ajouter les épices,\r\ny compris ¼ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque. Versez le\r\nbouillon, incorporer les groseilles, puis couvrir\r\nla poêle et laissez cuire 7 min.","Retirez le couvercle de la casserole, ajoutez le\r\ntomate, menthe et aneth, puis couvrir et\r\ncuire encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le bouillon soit bien\r\nété absorbé et le riz est tendre.\r\nRéserver, couvert, pour garder au chaud.","Pendant ce temps, une fois les poussins\r\nont eu leurs 35 minutes, arrosez le\r\nde la mélasse de grenade dessus et\r\nremettez-les au four encore 10 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''elles et les aubergines soient tendres.","Laisser reposer les poussins quelques instants\r\nminutes pendant que vous jetez l''aubergine dedans\r\nle pilaf. Servir les poussins entiers, ou\r\nportion et servir sur le pilaf.\r\nParsemer d''aneth et de feuilles de menthe, et\r\nsaupoudrer d''un peu de sumac, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11000,8010,'fr','Halloumi avec taboulé de brocoli et vinaigrette miel-harissa','Le couscous constitue une excellente base pour une salade rapide. Aromatisez avec de l''harissa fumée, du miel sucré et des herbes, puis garnissez de tranches de fromage frites.','["140 g de couscous","300 g de fleurons de brocoli","6 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","150 g de tomates cerises coupées en quartiers","gros bouquet de persil, finement haché","petit bouquet de menthe, hachée finement","jus de 2 citrons, zeste de ½ citron","2½ cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1½ cuillère à soupe de harissa","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","2 paquets de 250 g de fromage halloumi, coupé en tranches de 1 cm d''épaisseur","25 g d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Mettez le couscous dans un bol et\r\ncouvrir d''eau bouillante. Couvrir avec\r\nfilm alimentaire et réserver 5 min.","Faites blanchir le brocoli pendant 2 minutes, puis\r\nbien égoutter. Coupez-le en petits morceaux ou faites un blitz\r\nle dans un robot culinaire.","Fourcher le brocoli, les oignons nouveaux,\r\ntomates, herbes, zeste de citron, le jus\r\nde 1½ citrons et 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans le\r\ncouscous. Assaisonner et bien mélanger.","Pour réaliser la vinaigrette, mélangez le\r\nharissa, miel, jus de citron restant\r\net de l''huile, et un peu d''assaisonnement.","Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive et faites cuire\r\nle halloumi pendant 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Divisez le couscous\r\nentre les assiettes, garnir avec le\r\ntranches de halloumi et vinaigrette, puis\r\nrépartir sur les amandes."]','2026-01-11 00:08:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11001,8012,'fr','Pizza turque au bœuf épicé à la grenade et à la feta','Les pizzas faites maison l''emportent toujours sur les plats à emporter - essayez cette nouvelle idée de garniture composée de viande hachée épicée, de poivrons doux Peppadew, de fromage feta et de pignons de pin.','["500 g de mélange à pain","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la pâte","2 oignons moyens, hachés","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","250 g de bœuf haché extra maigre","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de flocons de piment rouge","5 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","6 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","Pot de 400 g de poivrons Peppadews doux marinés, hachés grossièrement","50 g de fromage feta émietté","1 cuillère à soupe de pignons de pin"]','["Mélanger la pâte suivant le pack\r\ninstructions (laisser environ 2 cuillères à soupe de\r\nmélange à pain dans le sac pour saupoudrer et\r\ndéploiement ultérieur). Pétrir pendant 8 à 10 minutes,\r\npuis enduisez la pâte d''huile, placez-la dans un\r\ngrand bol et couvercle. Laisser lever jusqu''à\r\ndoublé de taille. Plus votre cuisine est chaude\r\nc''est-à-dire que plus il augmentera vite, mais en général il\r\ncela devrait prendre 1 à 2 heures.","Chauffer le four à 240C/220C ventilateur/gaz 9 (ou\r\nle réglage le plus élevé). Saupoudrer 2 plaques à pâtisserie avec un peu de farine réservée\r\net mettre au four pour réchauffer.","Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle jusqu''à ce\r\nchaud. Ajouter les oignons et l''ail et cuire pendant\r\nquelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez le bœuf et\r\nlaisser dorer environ 5 minutes en brisant\r\nle hachis pendant la cuisson. Jetez tout excédent\r\nhuile. Ajouter les épices, le piment, 2 cuillères à soupe de\r\npurée de tomates, 5 cuillères à soupe de grenade\r\nmélasse et un peu d''assaisonnement. Cuisinier\r\npendant 1 min, puis retirez du feu.","Divisez la pâte en 6 boules. Saupoudrer le\r\nle reste de la farine sur un plan de travail et rouler\r\nétaler la pâte, chacun sur environ 25 cm de diamètre.\r\nSortez les plaques du four et placez-les\r\n2 fonds de pizza sur chacun (il faudra cuisiner\r\npar lots). Répartir le reste de tomate\r\nréduire en purée sur chaque base. Garnir de viande\r\nmélange, poivrons, feta et pignons de pin.\r\nCuire 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bases soient\r\nbien cuit et doré autour\r\nles bords. Arroser du reste\r\nmélasse de grenade et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11002,8014,'fr','Taboulé','Cette salade fraîche et saine utilise principalement des herbes avec un peu de boulgour.','["50g de blé boulghar","50 g de persil plat haché","50 g de menthe hachée","200 g de tomates mûres épépinées et coupées en dés","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","jus d''1 citron","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Rincer le boulghar dans une passoire\r\njusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire. Bien égoutter,\r\npuis transférer dans un bol. Versez plus de 200 ml\r\neau bouillante, couvrir d''un film alimentaire et\r\nlaisser tremper environ 30 minutes pendant que\r\nvous préparez le reste des ingrédients.","En gardant le persil en bouquet, hachez-le\r\nles feuilles grossièrement. Ne vous inquiétez pas du\r\ninclusion de certaines tiges; tout cela ajoute\r\nà la saveur. Maintenant, faites de même avec le\r\nmenthe. Mettez les herbes hachées dans un grand\r\nbol et ajoutez la tomate et l’oignon nouveau.","Égoutter soigneusement le boulghar, puis l''ajouter au\r\nmélange d''herbes, avec du jus de citron et de l''olive\r\nhuile. Mélangez soigneusement, assaisonnez et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11003,8016,'fr','Poches de falafels à la citrouille','Faites de la magie dans votre micro-ondes avec ces pochettes de citrouille ou de courge musquée faciles à préparer','["1 kg de potirons ou de courges musquées, épépinées et coupées en quartiers","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés, rincés et séchés","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","petit bouquet de persil, haché grossièrement","2 tranches de pain blanc réduites en miettes","2 carottes, grossièrement râpées","½ petit oignon rouge, finement tranché","100 g de fromage feta émietté","4 pains pitta complets pour servir"]','["Mettez la citrouille au micro-ondes\r\nbol et couvrir d''un film alimentaire. Cuire sur\r\nÉlevé pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Donnez un pourboire au\r\npois chiches, ail, flocons de piment, cumin et\r\nla moitié du persil dans un robot culinaire,\r\npuis fouettez jusqu''à ce que les pois chiches soient finement\r\nhaché mais pas lisse.","Laissez le potiron refroidir légèrement, puis\r\nretirer la chair de la peau et l''ajouter à\r\nle mélange de pois chiches avec un peu d''assaisonnement\r\net la chapelure. Donnez à tout un\r\nbien mélanger, puis façonner 12 petites galettes\r\navec vos mains. Mettez les falafels sur un\r\nassiette et réfrigérer pendant 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le persil restant\r\navec la carotte râpée, l''oignon et la feta\r\nfromage, puis réserver. Chauffer le gril à\r\nÀ feu moyen, puis cuire les falafels sur une\r\nplaque à pâtisserie pendant 3 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Divisez les pains pitta dans le sens de la longueur\r\net remplissez avec les falafels chauds et quelques\r\nde la salade feta."]','2026-01-11 00:08:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11004,4602,'fr','Falafels de patates douces et salade de chou','Les pittas regorgeant de falafels faits maison et de salade constituent un déjeuner ou un dîner léger faible en gras pour moins d''une livre par portion.','["1 grosse ou 2 petites patates douces, environ 700 g/1 lb 9 oz au total","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées","jus ½ citron","100 g de farine nature ou de gramme","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 pains pitta complets","4 cuillères à soupe d''houmous allégé","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 petit oignon, finement tranché","1 carotte moyenne, râpée","¼ de chaque chou blanc et rouge, râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nPatate douce entière au micro-ondes pendant\r\n8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Laisser refroidir\r\nun peu, puis pelez. Mettez la pomme de terre, le cumin,\r\nail, coriandre moulue et fraîche, citron\r\nle jus et la farine dans un grand bol. Saison,\r\npuis écrasez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Utiliser un\r\nà soupe, façonner le mélange et former 20 boules.\r\nDisposez sur une plaque à pâtisserie huilée, enfournez pendant\r\nenviron 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bases soient\r\ndoré, puis retourner et cuire au four pendant\r\n15 minutes de plus jusqu''à ce que tout soit doré.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le vinaigre et le sucre\r\nensemble dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce que le sucre\r\nest dissous, passez-le dans l''oignon,\r\ncarotte et chou, puis laisser reposer\r\nlaisser mariner 15 min. Pour servir, faites griller le\r\npittas, puis divisés. Remplir de salade, une cuillerée\r\ndu houmous et des falafels."]','2026-01-11 00:08:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11005,8018,'fr','Falafel à la betterave','Égayez un favori végétarien de tous les temps en ajoutant de la betterave rouge vibrante – servez avec une trempette au yaourt au tahini et des betteraves marinées','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, hachés","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés","500 g de betterave crue, pelée, parée et grossièrement râpée","100 g de chapelure fraîche","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tahini","huile végétale, pour badigeonner ou frire","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tahini","2 pots de yaourt nature de 150 ml","pincée de sucre","le lieu de la douleur","quelques betteraves dorées marinées, coupées en dés (voir « Se marie bien avec »)","3 poignées de feuilles de betterave ou un sachet de salade de betterave"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle et\r\nfaire revenir les oignons jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis mais pas\r\ncoloré. Ajouter le cumin et laisser cuire\r\n1 min, puis grattez le mélange dans\r\nun robot culinaire avec les pois chiches,\r\nles deux tiers de la betterave râpée, le\r\nchapelure, œuf et tahini. Génial\r\njusqu''à obtenir une pâte rugueuse, puis grattez-la\r\nbol et incorporer le reste râpé\r\nbetterave rouge avec beaucoup d''assaisonnement.","Avec les mains humides, façonner\r\nenviron 20 boules et espace sur la cuisson\r\nplaques à pâtisserie tapissées de papier sulfurisé. Refroidir\r\njusqu''au moment de servir.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nBadigeonner les falafels d''un peu de légume\r\nhuiler et cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant\r\net chaud de part en part. Alternativement, chauffer\r\n2,5 cm d''huile dans un wok profond et faire revenir\r\nlots, en les retournant, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et chauds.","Pour servir, mélangez le tahini avec le yaourt,\r\nsucre et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis une cuillerée\r\nsur les pains plats avec le chaud ou\r\nfalafels à température ambiante, coupés en dés\r\nbetteraves et feuilles de betterave ou salade."]','2026-01-11 00:08:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11006,8020,'fr','Salade de couscous et falafels au yaourt à la menthe','Ce plat de style mezze sans cuisson peut être préparé en un rien de temps en utilisant des ingrédients de supermarché ou de charcuterie.','["300 g de couscous","300 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet chaud","250 g d''olives et de feta à l''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de pâte d''harissa","2 paquets de falafels de 200 g","Pot de 290 g de poivrons rouges rôtis, égouttés et tranchés finement","300 g de yaourt sans matière grasse","un bouquet de menthe, hachée grossièrement"]','["Mettez le couscous dans un grand bol\r\net verser sur le bouillon. Couverture\r\navec du film alimentaire et laisser reposer 5 minutes\r\ngonfler. Égouttez les olives et la feta,\r\nen réservant une partie de l''huile. Remuer le plus\r\nde la harissa dans le couscous\r\navec l''huile réservée, puis assaisonner.","Versez le couscous sur une assiette\r\net répartissez sur les falafels. Pile\r\nles poivrons, les olives et la feta en un\r\ncôté. Mélangez le yaourt et le plus\r\nde menthe avec un peu d''assaisonnement dans un petit bol, faire couler\r\nle reste de la harissa, et dispersez-vous\r\nsur le reste de menthe. Servir\r\navec la salade de couscous et falafel."]','2026-01-11 00:08:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11007,8022,'fr','Boulgour aux carottes et noisettes','Donnez une belle texture à votre salade en ajoutant des graines de citrouille, des raisins secs et des noisettes au blé cuit au bouillon.','["600 g de blé boulghar","140 g de raisins secs","1l de légumes chauds ou de bouillon de poulet","4 carottes moyennes, grossièrement râpées","100 g de graines de citrouille","100 g de noisettes grillées et hachées","le jus d''1 gros citron","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza"]','["Mettez le boulghar et les raisins secs dans un bol\r\net verser sur le bouillon chaud. Couvrir avec\r\nfilm alimentaire et laisser reposer 20 à 30 minutes\r\nle liquide à absorber. Une fois\r\nabsorbé, passer une fourchette dans les grains\r\nse séparer. Laisser refroidir.","Ajoutez les carottes, les graines de citrouille,\r\nnoisettes, jus de citron et colza\r\nhuile et assaisonner. Bien mélanger et transférer\r\ndans un grand bol de service."]','2026-01-11 00:08:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11008,8024,'fr','Bouchées de falafel aux épinards et à la feta','Ces canapés simples peuvent être préparés à l''avance et servis lors de votre fête de Noël.','["200 g de bébés épinards","400 g de pois chiches égouttés en boîte","Passe de 100 g de fromage","2 cuillères à café de cumin","100 g de farine nature","huile végétale, pour la friture","tzatziki, servir"]','["Versez une bouilloire d''eau bouillante dessus\r\nbébés épinards dans une passoire.\r\nUne fois suffisamment refroidi pour être manipulé, pressez\r\nsortir de l''eau - faites-le très bien ou\r\nvos falafels seront trop mous. Pulser dans un\r\nrobot culinaire avec égoutté\r\npois chiches, feta, cumin et\r\nfarine ordinaire jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste combinée.\r\nRouler en boules de la taille d''une cuillère à soupe avec du beurre bien fariné.\r\nmains, puis aplatir en galettes.","Faire frire par lots dans de l''huile végétale pendant 2-3\r\nminutes de chaque côté, puis laisser refroidir. Lieu\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie, couvrir d''un film alimentaire\r\net congeler. Pour servir, décongeler au réfrigérateur\r\ntoute la nuit et cuire à 180C/160C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 4 pendant 5 à 10 minutes. Servir avec du tzatziki."]','2026-01-11 00:08:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11009,8026,'fr','Agneau à la turque','Apportez le goût de la dinde à votre cuisine avec ces pittas d''agneau amusantes, d''excellents plats à emporter','["4 steaks de gigot d''agneau","2 cuillères à café d''assaisonnement (nous avons utilisé l''assaisonnement Schwartz Lamb Simply Shake)","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché ou un mélange d''herbes ferait l''affaire","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles seulement, hachées","2 pots de 150 g de yaourt nature allégé","4 pains pitta, blancs ou complets","½ laitue iceberg, râpée","1 oignon rouge, tranché finement","1 citron, coupé en quartiers pour le presser, facultatif"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Assaisonnez l''agneau, puis faites-le griller 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, mais toujours très saignant. Pendant ce temps,\r\nmélangez l''assaisonnement, l''origan et la moitié de la menthe dans l''un des pots de yaourt, étouffez-le sur l''agneau, puis remettez sur le gril pendant encore 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le yaourt soit cloqué et que la viande soit cuite à votre goût.","Laissez la viande reposer sur une planche pendant quelques minutes pendant que vous faites griller les pittas, râpez la laitue et émincez l''oignon rouge. Incorporez le reste de la menthe dans le deuxième pot de yaourt. Tranchez la viande en tranches épaisses et farcissez-la dans le pain pitta avec la salade et le yaourt à la menthe. Pressez le jus de citron avant de rentrer, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11010,4403,'fr','Œufs et poivrons turcs dans une poêle (Menemen)','Ce plat courageux est une véritable cuisine de rue et un excellent plat familial pour le brunch, le déjeuner ou le dîner.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, tranchés","1 poivron rouge ou vert, coupé en deux épépiné et tranché","1-2 piments rouges épépinés et tranchés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1-2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","4 œufs","petit bouquet de persil, haché grossièrement","6 cuillères à soupe de yaourt épais et crémeux","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à frire à fond épais\r\ncasserole. Incorporer les oignons, le poivre et\r\npiments. Cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir.\r\nAjouter les tomates et le sucre en mélangeant bien.\r\nCuire jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait réduit, assaisonner.","A l''aide d''une cuillère en bois, créez 4 poches\r\ndans le mélange de tomates et casser les œufs\r\nen eux. Couvrez la poêle et faites cuire le\r\nles œufs à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste pris.","Battre le yaourt avec l''ail et\r\nsaison. Saupoudrer les menemen avec\r\npersil et servir dans la poêle\r\navec une cuillerée de yaourt à l''ail."]','2026-01-11 00:08:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11011,8028,'fr','Pilau d''agneau turc','Servir un pot de riz basmati parfumé à la cannelle, à la menthe et à l''abricot, parsemé d''agneau tendre','["une petite poignée de pignons de pin ou d''amandes effilées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","2 bâtons de cannelle, cassés en deux","500 g de filet de cou d''agneau maigre, coupé en cubes","250 g de riz basmati","1 cube de bouillon d''agneau ou de légumes","12 abricots secs prêts à consommer","une poignée de feuilles de menthe fraîche, hachées grossièrement"]','["Faites frire à sec les pignons de pin ou les amandes dans une grande poêle jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement grillés, puis versez-les sur une assiette. Ajoutez l''huile dans la poêle, puis faites revenir l''oignon et la cannelle ensemble jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Montez le feu, incorporez l''agneau, faites-le frire jusqu''à ce que la viande change de couleur, puis versez le riz et laissez cuire 1 min en remuant tout le temps.","Versez 500 ml d''eau bouillante, émiettez-la dans le cube de bouillon, ajoutez les abricots, puis assaisonnez selon votre goût. Baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez mijoter 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et que le bouillon soit absorbé. Ajoutez les pignons de pin et la menthe et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11012,8030,'fr','Taboulé de falafel au yaourt au citron','Une assiette de salades parfaite à partager en famille','["16 falafels prêts à l''emploi","200 g de couscous","2 gros citrons, 1 zesté, jus des deux","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 concombre, coupé en deux et tranché","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles grossièrement hachées","gros bouquet de persil, feuilles grossièrement hachées","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature"]','["Cuire les falafels selon le paquet\r\ninstructions et faites bouillir la bouilloire. Donnez un pourboire au\r\ncouscous dans un grand bol, verser dessus\r\n325 ml d''eau bouillante, couvrir, puis laisser\r\nlaisser reposer 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que toute l''eau\r\nest absorbé.","Remuez le couscous avec une fourchette, puis\r\nincorporer le zeste de citron, le jus de\r\n1½ citrons, huile d''olive, oignons nouveaux,\r\nconcombre, menthe et trois quarts\r\nde persil avec beaucoup d''assaisonnement.\r\nVerser sur une grande assiette.","Mélangez le jus de citron restant et\r\npersil dans le yaourt, puis verser dans\r\nun petit bol. Répartir les falafels chauds dessus\r\nla salade de couscous, puis servez le\r\nsauce au yaourt à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:08:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11013,6461,'fr','Falafels épicés','Bon marché et très faciles à préparer – farcissez-les dans des pittas avec de la salade ou servez-les avec du couscous et du houmous','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","1 petit oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","400 g de pois chiches en boîte lavés et égouttés","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue (ou utilisez plus de cumin)","une poignée de persil haché ou 1 cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées séchées","1 œuf battu"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle, puis faites revenir le \r\nl''oignon et l''ail à feu doux pendant 5 minutes \r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Verser dans un grand bol à mélanger \r\navec les pois chiches et les épices, puis écraser \r\navec une fourchette ou un presse-purée jusqu''à ce que \r\nles pois chiches sont totalement décomposés. Remuer \r\ndans le persil ou les herbes séchées, avec l''assaisonnement \r\nau goût. Ajoutez l''oeuf, puis écrasez le \r\nmélange avec vos mains.","Formez 6 boules avec la préparation, puis aplatissez-les. \r\ngalettes. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle, \r\npuis faites revenir les falafels à feu moyen pendant \r\n3 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et \r\nferme. Servir chaud ou froid avec du couscous, pitta \r\ndu pain ou de la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:08:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11014,8032,'fr','Pain du Moyen-Orient et salade de chèvre','La version Barney du fattoush – une salade de pain classique du Moyen-Orient. Le fattoush ne contient normalement pas de fromage de chèvre, mais il en fait plutôt un plat principal','["2 douleurs pitta","1 gousse d''ail","jus d''1 citron","3 tomates italiennes mûres, coupées en morceaux","1 à 2 concombres, coupés en morceaux","6 radis, tranchés","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché","une grosse poignée de feuilles de menthe, hachées très grossièrement","1 petite laitue Cos hachée grossièrement","1 laitue Baby Gem, hachée grossièrement","2 grosses poignées de fusée","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","200 g de fromage de chèvre à pâte ferme, émietté en gros morceaux"]','["Cuire le pain pitta sur une plaque chauffante ou dans\r\nun grille-pain jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Quand il fait froid\r\nassez pour être manipulé, déchirer en bouchées.","Écrasez la gousse d''ail avec une pincée de sel,\r\nthen tip into a large bowl and stir in the\r\njus de citron. Inclinez tous les autres ingrédients,\r\nsauf l''huile d''olive et le fromage de chèvre, dans\r\nle bol, puis arroser d''huile. Doucement\r\nmélanger le tout jusqu''à ce que le tout soit mélangé et\r\nhabillé. Serve the salad in piles with goat’s\r\nfromage émietté sur chaque portion."]','2026-01-11 00:08:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11015,8034,'fr','Crème de rose & gelées de framboise','Avec toutes les saveurs des délices turcs, ces puddings parfumés de style moyen-oriental complètent en légèreté un menu divertissant.','["135g de gelée de framboise","500 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à café d''eau de rose","12 framboises, coupées en deux","un filet de miel clair","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe","1 cuillère à soupe de pistache hachée"]','["Faites bouillir une bouilloire. Cassez les cubes de gelée en\r\nune carafe, versez dessus 100 ml d''eau bouillante et\r\nremuer pour dissoudre. Réchauffez délicatement la crème\r\nune petite casserole, puis retirer du feu\r\net versez le mélange de gelée. Incorporer le\r\neau de rose, puis versez le mélange dans\r\nta cruche. Répartissez la gelée entre 6 petits\r\nverres et réfrigérer pendant 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris. Peut être préparé 1 jour à l''avance.","Sortez les gelées du réfrigérateur\r\nenviron 20 minutes avant de servir. Divisez le\r\nframboises entre elles, puis ajoutez un\r\nun filet de miel, quelques feuilles de menthe et\r\nune pincée de pistaches sur chacun."]','2026-01-11 00:08:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11016,8036,'fr','Trempette épaisse au yaourt et aux herbes','Essayez cette trempette d''inspiration moyen-orientale, également connue sous le nom de labneh, avec des bâtonnets de carottes croquants.','["400 g de yaourt grec","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth et de menthe, hachées","huile d''olive extra vierge, pour arroser"]','["Versez le yaourt dans une passoire fine posée sur un\r\nbol, puis laisser égoutter au réfrigérateur pendant\r\n1 heure. Jetez tout liquide qui s’est écoulé.\r\nGrattez dans un bol à mélanger, puis incorporez le\r\nles oignons et la plupart des herbes. Quand tu es prêt\r\npour servir, arroser d''un peu d''olive extra vierge\r\nhuiler et saupoudrer du reste des herbes\r\net un peu de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11017,8038,'fr','Côtelettes d''agneau au piment et au gingembre','Faites mariner vos côtelettes avec du gingembre, du citron, du piment et du cumin, puis faites-les griller jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juteuses au milieu.','["4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à café de cumin","8 côtelettes d''agneau"]','["Mettez l''ail dans un bol avec le gingembre,\r\njus de citron, huile, épices et assaisonnement.\r\nMixez avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse,\r\npuis utilisez-le pour enrober les côtelettes d''agneau des deux côtés.\r\ncôtés. Laisser mariner au réfrigérateur pendant\r\nquelques heures ou toute la nuit.","Faites chauffer un barbecue jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud. Barbecues\r\nles côtelettes sur la braise pendant 3 minutes\r\nchaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit mais encore rose et\r\njuteux au centre."]','2026-01-11 00:08:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11018,8040,'fr','Désordre d''abricots et de délices turcs','Essayez une version moyen-orientale du classique britannique Eton Mess, servi avec du thé à la menthe fraîche','["100 g de mascarpone","50 g de yaourt grec","25 g de sucre glace tamisé","2 cuillères à soupe d''eau de fleur d''oranger","1 nid de meringue brisé en morceaux grossiers","3 abricots dénoyautés et hachés","2 cubes de délices turcs, aromatisés à l''orange si disponible, hachés","25 g d''amandes avec la peau, hachées grossièrement","4 feuilles de menthe, râpées, plus un peu pour décorer (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le mascarpone, le yaourt, le sucre et\r\nl''eau de fleur d''oranger dans un grand bol et\r\nfouetter jusqu''à épaississement. Pliez le reste\r\ningrédients, puis divisez le mélange\r\nentre 2 verres ou bols à dessert et\r\ndécorez avec de la menthe supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11019,8042,'fr','Poulet à la marocaine aux griottes et olives','En ajoutant des fruits secs, Tom Kerridge apporte une subtile douceur à ce tajine de poulet nord-africain. De plus, vous pouvez doubler et en congeler la moitié pour plus tard','["8 cuisses de poulet fermier, avec la peau et avec os","2 cuillères à soupe de ras el hanout","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un filet","2 oignons, hachés","2 carottes, coupées en gros morceaux","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de harissa (voir astuce ci-dessous)","½ citron confit finement haché ou 1 lamelle de zeste de citron","1 bâton de cannelle","2 feuilles de laurier","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","300 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées, égouttées","100 g de griottes séchées ou tout autre fruit séché (comme les canneberges, les abricots, les raisins secs ou les raisins secs)","coriandre hachée et couscous cuit (voir conseils ci-dessous), pour servir"]','["Assaisonnez bien le poulet et mélangez-le avec le ras el hanout pour l''enrober. Cela peut être préparé la veille et conservé au frais. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte ou une poêle à frire à feu moyen et faites dorer le poulet de tous les côtés pendant 15 à 20 minutes. (Vous pouvez le faire par lots pour éviter de surcharger la poêle.) Transférez le poulet dans une assiette à l''aide d''une écumoire et réservez.","Faites cuire les oignons et les carottes dans la poêle pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés, en ajoutant un filet d''huile si la poêle est sèche. Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Incorporer la harissa et le citron confit. Cuire encore une minute jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient bien enrobés et collants. Ajoutez la cannelle et les feuilles de laurier, puis versez les tomates et portez à ébullition.","Cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide soit réduit en une pâte épaisse. Remettez le poulet et son jus au repos dans la poêle et versez dessus le bouillon. Incorporer les olives et les cerises et remettre à ébullition. Mettez le couvercle et laissez mijoter doucement pendant 45 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit et tendre.","Répartir sur la coriandre hachée et servir avec du couscous. Une fois complètement refroidi, se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours ou au congélateur pendant trois mois. Décongeler au réfrigérateur toute la nuit avant de réchauffer à feu doux ou au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:08:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11020,5345,'fr','Potée de poulet épicée','Ajoutez des épices douces et des abricots pour élever cette cocotte de poulet à un plat rappelant un tajine marocain. C''est sain aussi, avec quatre de vos 5 par jour','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 oignons (400 g), coupés en deux et tranchés épaisses","2 aubergines, coupées en deux et tranchées épaisses","40 g de gingembre coupé en fines tranches","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","40 g de curcuma frais râpé ou 1 cuillère à café moulue","¼ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","400 g de pois chiches en boîte","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en dés","2 cuillères à café de bouillon en poudre","50 g d''abricots secs coupés en deux","Paquet de 600 g de filets de cuisse de poulet sans peau, débarrassés de tout le gras visible, coupés en gros morceaux","20 g de coriandre hachée","560 g de grosses pommes de terre, tranchées très finement (pas besoin de les éplucher)"]','["Chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4, puis faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive dans une grande cocotte profonde et antidéflagrante avec un fond épais et un couvercle. Ajoutez les oignons et un peu d''eau, puis couvrez et laissez cuire à feu moyen pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils ramollissent un peu. Bien mélanger, puis ajouter les tranches d''aubergines et cuire à couvert pendant 5 minutes pour les ramollir.","Ajoutez le gingembre, l''ail, le curcuma et les épices sèches. Bien mélanger et verser les pois chiches avec leur eau, puis les poivrons, le bouillon, les abricots, le poulet et une canette pleine d''eau (400 ml). Incorporez la coriandre, puis superposez les pommes de terre en les superposant légèrement en spirale. Appuyez doucement pour les compacter et badigeonnez-les avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile restante. Cuire au four pendant 1 à 1 h 30 avec le couvercle. Retirez le couvercle à mi-cuisson et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres et que le jus bouillonne."]','2026-01-11 00:08:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11021,8044,'fr','Agneau ras el hanout rôti lentement et couscous','Laissez votre four faire tout le travail avec cette épaule d''agneau. C''est capiteux avec les épices d''Afrique du Nord et le couscous est trempé dans le jus de poêle','["5 gousses d''ail","1 citron, jus","6 cuillères à soupe de mélange d''épices ras el hanout (du commerce ou voir conseil ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","petite épaule d''agneau (environ 2kg)","2 oignons rouges, coupés en gros quartiers","400 g de couscous","100g de raisins secs","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","petit bouquet de persil haché","un petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","1 citron confit haché finement ou le jus d''un ½ citron"]','["À l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier ou d''un mini hachoir, écrasez ou hachez l''ail avec une généreuse pincée de sel, puis ajoutez le jus de citron, le mélange d''épices ras el hanout et l''huile d''olive, puis pilez ou hachez-le en une pâte grossière. Utilisez un petit couteau pour faire de petites incisions sur tout l''agneau. Placez l''agneau dans une grande cocotte peu profonde ou dans un plat à rôtir profond, puis frottez la pâte sur tout l''agneau et dans les coupes. Laisser à température ambiante pendant 1 heure, ou mieux couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Au moment de cuire, chauffez le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Répartissez les quartiers d''oignon autour de l''agneau, puis couvrez le plat avec un couvercle ou bien avec du papier d''aluminium et faites rôtir pendant 3 heures. Retirer du four et découvrir. Remuez les oignons et arrosez l''agneau dans le jus, puis allumez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et continuez à rôtir l''agneau, à découvert, pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré.","Soulevez l''agneau et les oignons sur une planche pour les reposer et mettez la bouilloire. Incorporer le couscous et les raisins secs dans le plat d''agneau pour qu''ils soient enrobés du jus de torréfaction. Versez suffisamment d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire pour recouvrir juste le couscous, puis couvrez le plat et laissez reposer 5 minutes. Découvrez et gonflez le couscous avec une cuillère en bois, puis incorporez les pois chiches, les herbes hachées et le citron confit ou le jus de citron, et assaisonnez au goût. Apporter l''agneau, les oignons et le couscous à table pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11022,4511,'fr','au fil','Préparez un bol chauffant de harira, la soupe marocaine pleine de légumineuses, de tomates, de bœuf et d''épices. C’est copieux, satisfaisant et plein de saveur – parfait pour les journées froides','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","300 g de bœuf braisé ou désossé, débarrassé de l''excès de gras, coupé en morceaux de 3 cm","1 petit oignon, finement haché","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu","¼ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de persil frais haché","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","pincée de safran","70 g de pois chiches secs, trempés toute une nuit et égouttés (ou 140 g de pois chiches en conserve, égouttés)","6 grosses tomates, râpées ou mixées au robot culinaire","100 g de céleri (2 branches), finement haché","80 g de lentilles vertes séchées","3 cuillères à soupe de maïzena ou farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre fraîche hachée et de quartiers de citron, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande cocotte ignifuge à feu moyen. Ajoutez la viande, l''oignon et les épices avec 1½ cuillère à café de sel. Laisser reposer 5 à 10 minutes pour dorer légèrement la viande, en remuant de temps en temps. Ajouter le reste des ingrédients sauf les lentilles, la maïzena, la coriandre et les quartiers de citron. Ajoutez 1 litre d''eau bouillante, portez à ébullition, couvrez et réduisez le feu à doux. Laisser mijoter 1h.","Ajoutez les lentilles dans la cocotte, couvrez et laissez cuire encore 20 minutes. Lorsque les pois chiches, la viande et les lentilles sont cuits, mélangez la maïzena dans un petit bol avec 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et remuez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer le mélange de farine de maïs dans la cocotte. Laisser mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la harira épaississe et prenne une texture veloutée.","Répartir sur la coriandre, puis servir chaud avec des quartiers de citron à côté pour les presser."]','2026-01-11 00:08:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11023,8046,'fr','Ragoût d''agneau marocain à la mijoteuse','Réchauffez-vous avec notre ragoût d''agneau facile à la mijoteuse, avec des épices aromatiques et des tonnes de saveurs. Ce plat simple et apprécié de tous ne prend que 10 minutes à préparer','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive ou d''huile de colza","1 kg d''épaule d''agneau coupée en dés","2 oignons, coupés en deux et tranchés","5 gousses d''ail, écrasées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé ou finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","une pincée de safran (ou de curcuma, pour ajouter de la couleur)","½ gros ou 1 petit citron confit, avec la peau seulement, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","600 ml de bouillon de bœuf chaud ou de bouillon d''agneau","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 citron testé et un filet de jus","80 g d''olives Kalamata dénoyautées","une poignée de menthe, de coriandre ou de persil hachés (ou une combinaison)","couscous ou riz, pour servir"]','["Réglez la mijoteuse à basse température. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle et faites dorer l''agneau par lots, en le transférant dans la mijoteuse au fur et à mesure. Ajouter le reste de l''huile et les oignons dans la poêle et cuire 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et remuez pendant 1 à 2 minutes, puis ajoutez les épices, le citron confit et la purée de tomates. Réchauffez, puis versez dans la mijoteuse. Faites tourner un peu d''eau autour de la casserole, puis versez-la dans la mijoteuse avec le bouillon. Assaisonner, couvrir et cuire 6 à 8 heures.","Une fois que la viande est bien tendre, augmentez le feu. Ajoutez le miel, le citron et les olives et laissez cuire 20 à 30 minutes. Garnir d''herbes et servir avec du couscous ou du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:08:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11024,8048,'fr','Ragoût de saucisses marocain','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Le ras el hanout est une épice parfumée d’Afrique du Nord. Il s''accorde parfaitement avec des saucisses de porc dans une sauce tomate aux dattes et aux oignons.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","8 saucisses de porc de bonne qualité","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à soupe de mélange d''épices marocain ou ras el hanout","100 g de dattes molles dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","175 ml de bouillon de bœuf chaud","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","purée de pommes de terre, pour servir"]','["Dans une grande casserole ou une cocotte anti-flamme, faites chauffer l''huile et faites revenir les saucisses avec les oignons pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Ajoutez le mélange d''ail et d''épices avec 75 ml d''eau pour éviter qu''ils ne brûlent et laissez cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Ajoutez les dattes et les tomates, mélangez bien, puis étalez sur 2 assiettes pour refroidir avant de verser dans un sac de congélation et de congeler jusqu''à 3 mois.","Pour cuire surgelé, mettez le ragoût dans une grande casserole ou une cocotte ignifuge avec tout sauf 2 cuillères à soupe de bouillon. Couvrir avec un couvercle et chauffer doucement pour décongeler pendant 25 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps.","Une fois le ragoût entièrement décongelé, mélangez la maïzena avec le bouillon réservé et versez dans la poêle. Porter à ébullition et laisser mijoter à découvert pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à épaississement et très chaud. Servir avec une purée de pommes de terre."]','2026-01-11 00:08:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11025,8050,'fr','Pitta marocaine farcie','Farcir du pain sans blé de falafels, de houmous, de poivron rouge et de feuilles de roquette pour un déjeuner sain et copieux','["2 pochettes de pains pitta sans blé","4 falafels, coupés en deux (des Falafels avec recette d''houmous, dans ''va bien avec'')","4 cuillères à soupe d''houmous (de Falafels avec recette d''houmous, voir \"va bien avec\")","½ poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché","poignée de feuilles de roquette"]','["Étalez le houmous à l''intérieur de chaque pitta, puis recouvrez-le de falafels, de poivre et de roquette."]','2026-01-11 00:08:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11026,8052,'fr','Tajine d''agneau, abricots et échalotes','Adapté du poisson d''agneau rôti marocain « méchoui », ce plat mijoté possède une marinade aromatique et une sauce irrésistiblement fruitée.','["1 gros gigot d''agneau avec os (environ 2 kg)","600 g d''échalotes, coupées en deux si elles sont particulièrement grosses","400 g de petits abricots coupés en deux et dénoyautés","85 g d''amandes entières sans peau","2 citrons confits, chair jetée, zeste et moelle finement hachés","1 cuillère à soupe de ras el hanout","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","150 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","coriandre en petit paquet, feuilles cueillies","couscous et yaourt nature, pour servir","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à café de gingembre moulu","2 cuillères à café de graines de coriandre","pincée de brins de safran"]','["Coupez le gigot d''agneau partout et mettez-le dans un grand sac alimentaire ou dans une grande cocotte. Écrasez les ingrédients de la marinade ensemble à l’aide d’un pilon et d’un mortier. Ajoutez un peu de poivre noir et frottez tout l''agneau. Laisser mariner toute la nuit ou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1. Placez l''agneau dans un grand plat à rôtir, en grattant les restes de marinade sur le dessus. Couvrir le moule de papier d''aluminium en pinçant les bords pour sceller. Cuire pendant 6 à 7 heures, en arrosant toutes les heures environ, jusqu''à ce que la viande soit incroyablement tendre.","Sortez le plat à rôtir du four et augmentez le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez le jus de l''agneau dans un verre doseur, laissez refroidir légèrement et écumez le gras. Mettez les échalotes dans le moule avec l''agneau et mélangez pour les enrober d''un peu de jus. Rôtissez 15 min, puis ajoutez les abricots et les amandes. Fouettez le jus de cuisson avec le citron, le ras el hanout, le miel et le bouillon, puis versez sur l''agneau et faites rôtir encore 20 min.","Laisser reposer 10 minutes, puis parsemer d''herbes et servir avec du couscous et du yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:08:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11027,8054,'fr','Harira marocaine et soupe au poulet','Cette soupe d''inspiration nord-africaine est parfumée à l''harissa et aux épices. Servir avec des toasts au houmous et du yaourt rafraîchissant','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","4 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","1 poireau lavé et tranché finement","4 grosses branches de céleri, coupées en petits morceaux","3 grosses carottes coupées en petits morceaux","2 gros panais, pelés et coupés en petits morceaux","petit paquet de coriandre, tiges finement hachées, feuilles réservées pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à café de curcuma moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de harissa (nous avons utilisé du Belazu)","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cubes de bouillon de poulet, émiettés","85 g de lentilles vertes crues","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","yaourt nature, pain grillé et houmous, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle, assaisonnez les cuisses et faites-les bien dorer des deux côtés. Retirer dans une assiette. Versez une tasse d''eau dans la casserole et laissez mijoter en grattant tous les morceaux dorés. Versez ce liquide dans un verre doseur pour plus tard.","Mettez le reste de l''huile, les légumes et les tiges de coriandre dans une grande casserole. Cuire doucement jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient ramollis – environ 5 minutes. Incorporez les épices, augmentez le feu et laissez cuire quelques minutes. Incorporer la harissa, puis les tomates, le poulet, les cubes de bouillon et les lentilles. Complétez votre pichet de jus de poulet à 500 ml avec de l''eau, puis ajoutez-le également. Portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez cuire 30 min.","Retirez le poulet de la soupe et émincez-le finement à l''aide de quelques fourchettes. Remettre dans la soupe avec le zeste et le jus de citron, le sucre et assaisonner au goût. Verser dans des bols avec une cuillerée de yaourt et les feuilles de coriandre, et servir avec des toasts, tartinés d''houmous et arrosés d''huile."]','2026-01-11 00:08:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11028,4750,'fr','Oeufs marocains épicés','Ce plat de brunch rapide et épicé regorge de courgettes, de pois chiches, de tomates et d''épinards sains. Aromatisez votre sauce avec de la harissa à la rose','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 gros oignon, coupé en deux et tranché finement","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa à la rose","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","150 ml de bouillon de légumes","400 g de pois chiches en boîte","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates cerises","2 courgettes, coupées en petits dés","Sachet de 200 g de bébés épinards","4 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","4 gros œufs"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à frire et faites revenir l''oignon et l''ail pendant environ 8 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Ajoutez la harissa et la coriandre moulue, remuez bien, puis versez le bouillon et les pois chiches avec leur liquide. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 5 minutes, puis écraser environ un tiers des pois chiches pour épaissir un peu le bouillon.","Versez les tomates et les courgettes dans la poêle et faites cuire doucement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les courgettes soient tendres. Incorporez les épinards pour qu’ils se fanent dans la poêle.","Incorporez la coriandre hachée, puis faites 4 creux dans le mélange et cassez les œufs. Couvrez et laissez cuire 2 minutes, puis retirez du feu et laissez reposer 2 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11029,4465,'fr','Salade marocaine de grenades et légumes rôtis','Remplie de bienfaits végétaux, cette salade arc-en-ciel faible en gras avec patate douce, oignon rouge, panais et carottes est un régal pour les yeux','["2 petites patates douces, coupées en morceaux","2 oignons rouges, racines conservées intactes, coupés en quartiers","1 gros panais, pelé et coupé en morceaux","2 grosses carottes, pelées et coupées en morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de ras-el-hanout","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","Sachet de 100 g de bébés épinards","110 g de graines de grenade","50 g de fromage feta léger, émietté","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6, tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Dans un grand bol, mélanger tous les légumes avec le ras el hanout, l''huile d''olive, le sel et le poivre. Disposer en une seule couche sur la plaque à pâtisserie. rôtir, en retournant une fois, pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et commence à carboniser.","Une fois cuit, laissez refroidir 10 minutes puis mélangez avec les feuilles d''épinards, les graines de grenade, la feta et le vinaigre."]','2026-01-11 00:08:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11030,6024,'fr','Soupe marocaine de légumes rôtis','Les racines rôties sont parfaites pour faire de la soupe - nous avons utilisé des panais, de la courge musquée et des carottes, aromatisés au mélange d''épices ras el hanout','["1 oignon rouge, coupé en 8 quartiers","300 g de carottes coupées en morceaux de 2 cm","300 g de panais coupés en morceaux de 2 cm","300 g de courge butternut pelée, coupée en morceaux de 2 cm","1 petite pomme de terre, coupée en morceaux de 2 cm","2 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe de ras el hanout","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1,3 l de bouillon de légumes chaud","6 cuillères à soupe de yaourt à la grecque et 1 cuillère à soupe de menthe finement hachée, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez tous les légumes et l''ail dans un plat à rôtir. Saupoudrer de ras el hanout et d''un peu d''assaisonnement, arroser d''huile et bien mélanger le tout. Rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes en retournant les légumes à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à caraméliser un peu.","Transférez les légumes rôtis dans une grande casserole, versez dessus le bouillon chaud et laissez mijoter 5 minutes. Réduisez la soupe en purée au robot culinaire ou dans la poêle avec un mixeur plongeant, jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis versez-la dans un flacon pour le travail. Si vous mangez à la maison, servez avec une cuillerée de yaourt, un peu de menthe et un peu de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11031,8056,'fr','Jarret d''agneau aux épices douces et aux coings','Croisement entre un ragoût persan et un tajine marocain, les épices de ce one-pot cuit lentement sont douces. Servir avec du riz, du couscous ou des pains plats','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 jarrets d''agneau","grosse noix de beurre","2 gros oignons, coupés en deux puis coupés en quartiers","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","4 lanières de zeste d''1 citron non ciré, plus le jus","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","une bonne pincée de brins de safran (facultatif)","1 grosse cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","400 ml de bon bouillon d''agneau ou de bœuf","2 coings pelés, coupés en quartiers et épépinés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Saison\r\nles jarrets, puis les faire dorer dans l''huile pendant\r\n10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient entièrement dorés.","Pendant ce temps, dans une cocotte ou un grand\r\npoêle, faire fondre le beurre. Ramollir les oignons\r\npendant 10 minutes à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient\r\ndevenant doré, puis ajoutez l''ail. Chaleur\r\nfour à 160C/140C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.","Ajouter les lanières de zeste de citron et les épices\r\nà la poêle à oignons. Cuire 1 min, puis remuer\r\ndans le concentré de tomates, le miel, le bouillon et la moitié\r\nle jus de citron. Posez les jarrets dans la poêle,\r\npuis enfoncez les quartiers de coings et\r\nautour de la viande. (Cela pourrait être assez serré\r\nrentre, mais la viande rétrécira à mesure qu''elle cuit.)\r\nPortez à ébullition, puis couvrez avec un couvercle\r\net braiser au four pendant 2 heures.","Retirez le couvercle et laissez cuire 30 minutes\r\nplus. Éliminez tout excès de graisse. Le\r\nla sauce sera assez fine, donc si vous préférez un\r\nragoût plus épais, retirer l''agneau et les coings\r\ndans une assiette de service, puis faites bouillir la cuisson\r\njus jusqu''à épaississement. Assaisonner, ajouter le\r\njus de citron et servir avec l''agneau."]','2026-01-11 00:08:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11032,4477,'fr','Soupe marocaine aux pois chiches','Cette soupe faible en gras regorge de légumineuses du magasin, de céréales saines et d''épices d''Afrique du Nord - utilisez du cumin, du ras el hanout, du gingembre et de la cannelle.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre frais râpé","1 cuillère à café de cumin","1 cuillère à café de sp-eux","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle","200 g de poivrons rouges rôtis, en pot","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 ml de bouillon de légumes","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","2 citrons confits, zeste haché (jeter la pulpe et les graines)","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","50 g de couscous complet"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à couvercle. Ajoutez le\r\nl''oignon et l''ail, mettre le couvercle et cuire pendant\r\n5 minutes en remuant à mi-cuisson. Remuez le piment,\r\ngingembre, cumin, ras el hanout et cannelle dans\r\nla poêle et laissez cuire 1 min. Ajoutez les poivrons,\r\ntomates et bouillon. Porter à ébullition, baisser\r\nPortez à ébullition, mettez le couvercle et laissez cuire 10 min.","Mixez la soupe avec un mixeur plongeant ou dans un aliment\r\nprocesseur jusqu''à consistance lisse. Remettez dans la casserole et\r\najoutez plus de liquide pour fluidifier la soupe, si vous le souhaitez. Remuer\r\ndans les pois chiches, citrons confits, miel et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement. Si vous mangez tout de suite, ajoutez le\r\ncouscous et réchauffer pendant 5 minutes. (Si vous prenez\r\npour travailler, ajoutez le couscous juste avant de réchauffer)."]','2026-01-11 00:08:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11033,8058,'fr','Tajine de poisson au safran et aux amandes','Un ragoût de poisson marocain faible en calories, parfumé au safran, aux amandes, à la cannelle, au gingembre et plus encore. C’est idéal pour recevoir – préparez-en un lot à l’avance et congelez-le','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","une bonne pincée de safran","600 ml de bouillon de poisson ou de poulet chaud","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé","½ piment vert (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant), tranché finement","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","10 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","zeste d''1 orange, jus de ½","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","700 g de poisson blanc coupé en gros morceaux","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","poignée d''amandes effilées, grillées","½ piment vert (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant), pour servir","couscous et yaourt nature, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajoutez le\r\nl''oignon et cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.\r\nPendant ce temps, mettez le safran au chaud\r\nbouillon et laisser infuser. Ajoutez l''ail,\r\nle gingembre et le piment dans la poêle et cuire pendant\r\nencore quelques minutes. Ajoutez les épices et\r\npurée de tomates, remuer quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nparfumé, puis ajoutez les tomates moulues\r\namandes, zeste et jus d''orange, miel et\r\nbouillon parfumé au safran, en veillant à ce que\r\nvous utilisez tous les brins de safran.\r\nLaisser mijoter à découvert pendant 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\nles tomates sont tombées en panne et le\r\nla sauce a un peu épaissi.","Ajoutez le poisson dans la poêle en vous assurant\r\nles pièces sont toutes nichées sous le\r\nsauce. Couvrir avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter sur un\r\nfeu doux pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste cuit.\r\nVérifiez l''assaisonnement, ajoutez la coriandre\r\net parsemer d''amandes grillées.\r\nServir parsemé de piment, accompagné\r\navec du couscous et une goutte de\r\nyaourt nature, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11034,8060,'fr','Poulet rôti marocain aux abricots','Qu''il pleuve ou qu''il fasse beau, servez cette volaille marinée au sumac, qui peut être grillée ou cuite au four, avec un accompagnement sucré et fruité.','["2 petits poulets","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","petit bouquet de coriandre","2 cuillères à soupe de sumac (voir conseil ci-dessous)","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de fenouil","2 cuillères à café de flocons de piment","2 gousses d''ail","le zeste et le jus de 2 citrons","4 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","250 g de yaourt nature, mélangé avec 1 à 2 pincées de safran, pour servir","12 abricots, coupés en deux et dénoyautés","2 citrons confits, rincés, épépinés, hachés finement","3 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","1 cuillère à soupe d''eau de fleur d''oranger","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc"]','["Spatchcock les poules – voir\r\nconseil ci-dessous ou demandez à votre boucher de\r\nfais-le pour toi. Mettez l''huile d''olive, la coriandre,\r\nsumac, cumin, fenouil, piment, ail, citron\r\nzeste et jus, mélasse de grenade\r\net du poivre noir moulu dans un\r\nrobot culinaire ou mixeur, et passez à un\r\ncoller. Répartissez dans 2 grands sacs de nourriture,\r\najoutez un poulet à chacun, puis essorez-le\r\nl''air et sceller avant de tout donner\r\nun bon silencieux pour bien enrober.\r\nLaisser mariner 24 à 48 heures au réfrigérateur,\r\nse retourner et s''écraser de temps en temps.","Allumez un barbecue et laissez les flammes\r\nmourir ou chauffer le four à 220C/200C\r\nventilateur/gaz 7. Sortez le poulet des sacs\r\net bien assaisonner avec du sel. Barbecue ou\r\nrôtir le poulet pendant 25 à 30 minutes chacun\r\ncôté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et bien cuits. Ensemble\r\nréserver sur une assiette, couvrir légèrement de papier d''aluminium,\r\npour te reposer pendant que tu fais les abricots. Si vous\r\nrôti plutôt que grillé, conservez le\r\njus de conserve tièdes pour servir.","Mettez les abricots dans un petit endroit bien\r\nplat à rôtir. Fouettez le citron confit,\r\nmiel, fleur d''oranger et vinaigre\r\navec un peu d''assaisonnement. Verser sur le\r\nabricots et rôtis, ou asseyez-vous sur le\r\nbarbecue, pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.","Servir le poulet avec n''importe quelle cuisson\r\njus, les abricots et le yaourt au safran."]','2026-01-11 00:08:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11035,6367,'fr','One-pot de poulet marocain','Vous n''avez pas besoin d''un pot en argile pour préparer un tajine parfumé d''Afrique du Nord : jetez le tout dans une cocotte et garnissez de feta, de menthe et de citron.','["4 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, 1 haché grossièrement, 1 tranché","100g de tomates","100 g de gingembre haché grossièrement","3 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu, de coriandre et de cannelle","1 grosse courge musquée épépinée et coupée en gros morceaux","600 ml de bouillon de poulet","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","100 g de cerises séchées","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","le zeste d''1 citron","une poignée de feuilles de menthe","100 g de fromage feta émietté","couscous et yaourt nature"]','["Assaisonnez le poulet. Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe de\r\nl''huile dans un plat résistant aux flammes, puis faire dorer le\r\npoulet de tous les côtés. Retirer le poulet\r\ndans une assiette. Mixez l''oignon haché,\r\ntomates, gingembre et ail dans un brouillon\r\ncoller. Faire revenir l''oignon émincé dans le\r\nle reste de l''huile dans le plat jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie,\r\npuis ajoutez les épices et faites revenir 1 min\r\nplus jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé. Ajoutez la pâte et\r\nfaire frire encore quelques minutes pour ramollir.","Remettez le poulet dans le plat avec le\r\ncourge, bouillon, sucre et vinaigre. Apportez\r\nlaisser mijoter, puis cuire 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle poulet est bien cuit. Soulevez le\r\nsortir le poulet et incorporer les cerises,\r\npuis continuez à mijoter la sauce\r\npour épaissir pendant que vous déchiquetez le poulet\r\nen petits morceaux. Remuer le poulet\r\nremettre dans la sauce et assaisonner.","Mélangez l''oignon rouge, le zeste de citron, la menthe et\r\nfeta. Répartir sur le plat, puis servir\r\navec du couscous et du yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:08:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11036,8062,'fr','Tarte épicée marocaine','La pièce maîtresse parfaite pour votre repas du jour de Noël – et elle convient aux légumes','["2 cuillères à café de graines de coriandre et de cumin","1 cuillère à café de paprika, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","150 ml d''huile d''olive","900 g de courge pelée et coupée en petits morceaux (environ 2 cm)","12 échalotes, coupées en quartiers","4 cm de racine de gingembre finement hachée","140 g d''amandes entières blanchies","140 g de pistaches décortiquées","75 g de canneberges séchées","6 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","225 g d''épinards frais","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","2 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","4 cuillères à soupe de coriandre fraîche hachée","100g de beurre","8 grandes feuilles de pâte filo","quartiers de citron pour servir","Carton de 200 g de yaourt grec","6 cuillères à soupe de lait","3 gros brins de menthe, feuilles hachées","2-3 cuillères à soupe de pâte d''harissa"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante 180C/\r\nconventionnel 200C/gaz 6. Frire à sec\r\nles graines brièvement dans une petite poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient grillées – ne le faites pas\r\nlaissez-les brûler. Broyer grossièrement à l''aide\r\nun pilon et un mortier (ou un bol et\r\nle bout d''un rouleau à pâtisserie), puis mélangez\r\nle paprika, la cannelle, 1,2 cuillère à café de sel\r\net 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile. Versez la courge dans un\r\nplat à rôtir, verser dessus l''huile épicée\r\net lancer. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une\r\npoêle, ajoutez les échalotes et\r\ncuire en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à\r\nmarron. Incorporer le gingembre et\r\n100g/4oz chacun d''amandes et\r\npistaches. Lorsqu''elles sont dorées, ajoutez-les\r\ncanneberges, 2 cuillères à soupe de miel et le\r\nles épinards pour qu''ils se fanent. Retirez du feu\r\net incorporez-le à la courge, quand elle\r\nsort du four. Annuler.","Dans un robot culinaire, mixez le\r\npois chiches avec l''ail, le cumin,\r\nreste d''huile, jus de citron, 2 cuillères à soupe\r\neau et sel et poivre pour faire\r\nhoumeux. Incorporer la coriandre.","Faire fondre le beurre dans une petite poêle. Mettre\r\nun moule à quiche à fond amovible de 28 cm\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie et badigeonner de\r\nun peu de beurre. Garder le filo couvert\r\navec un chiffon humide pour ne pas sécher\r\nétalez une feuille sur la moitié du\r\nde manière à ce qu''il dépasse du bord\r\nenviron 10 cm. Posez une autre feuille dessus\r\nl''autre côté, de sorte qu''il chevauche le\r\nd''abord au centre et surplombe\r\nle bord opposé. Badigeonner avec\r\nbeurre. Posez deux autres feuilles de filo dans\r\ndans le sens opposé de la même manière et badigeonnez avec plus de beurre.","Construisez deux couches supplémentaires dans ce\r\nfaçon, vous utilisez donc un total de huit\r\nfeuilles de filo. Empilez la moitié de la courge\r\nmélange au centre de la pâte.\r\nRépartir sur l''houmous et ensuite\r\nle reste du mélange de courge.Un\r\nà la fois, apportez le bord de chacun\r\nfeuille filo jusqu''au centre pour couvrir\r\nle remplissage, créant des plis voluptueux\r\nau fur et à mesure. Badigeonner soigneusement avec\r\nplus de beurre. (Si vous préparez un jour à l''avance,\r\ncouvrir maintenant d''un film alimentaire et\r\nse détendre. Pour réchauffer, retirez la tarte\r\ndu réfrigérateur, faites chauffer le four, puis\r\ncuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes.)","Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant\r\net doré. Juste avant que la tarte soit\r\nprêt, réchauffez le reste du beurre\r\ndans la poêle, verser le reste des noix\r\net faire frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Verser dans le\r\n4 cuillères à soupe restantes de\r\nchérie et, quand ça\r\nfond, enlevez le\r\nchauffer et verser dessus\r\nla tarte. Servir avec\r\nSauce au yaourt harissa (mélanger le yaourt et le lait pour obtenir une sauce fine, incorporer les herbes et assaisonner. Incorporer l''harissa au goût) et des quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:08:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11037,8064,'fr','Riz marocain épicé','Pimentez le vieux poulet nature avec un goût exotique','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en dés","1 cuillère à soupe d''assaisonnement aux épices marocaines","1 oignon, finement tranché","50g de beurre","300g de riz","12 abricots secs, coupés en deux","cube de bouillon de poulet","Boîte de 410 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","15 g de persil plat haché"]','["Enrober le poulet d’épices marocaines. Faire revenir l''oignon dans le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.","Versez le poulet, puis laissez cuire encore quelques minutes. Incorporez le riz et les abricots, puis versez le cube de bouillon avec 700 ml d''eau bouillante et les pois chiches.","Couvrir la casserole et laisser mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et ait absorbé la majeure partie du liquide. Incorporer le persil plat haché et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11038,8066,'fr','Carottes aux épices marocaines','Créez une sensation de carotte avec cette idée simple de vinaigrette et expérimentez avec votre légume préféré','["500 g de carottes coupées en deux et coupées en fines rondelles","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","Pâte d''harissa","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","une poignée de coriandre hachée, plus un peu"]','["Placer les carottes dans un cuiseur vapeur\r\nune casserole d''eau bouillante et laissez cuire 7 à 10 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre. Mélangez le reste\r\ningrédients, puis mélangez les carottes chaudes\r\nà travers le pansement.","Saupoudrer de coriandre hachée supplémentaire pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11039,5057,'fr','Poisson épicé marocain avec purée de gingembre','Assaisonnez les filets de poisson blanc avec un beurre aromatisé et servez-les avec une purée de patates douces moelleuse.','["2 grosses patates douces, pelées et coupées en morceaux","2 cuillères à café de beurre ramolli","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ -1 cuillère à café de harissa (Belazu est bon)","le zeste d''1 citron","une petite poignée de coriandre, hachée en grande partie, le reste entier","morceau de gingembre frais de la taille d''un doigt, finement râpé","2 filets de poisson blanc sans peau (cherchez ceux pêchés de manière durable)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.\r\nCuire les patates douces à l''ébullition, salées\r\narroser pendant environ 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre\r\nlorsqu''on le perce avec un couteau. Pendant ce temps, mélangez\r\nensemble le beurre avec l''ail, la harissa,\r\nle zeste de citron, la coriandre hachée et un peu\r\nassaisonnement. Quand les pommes de terre sont prêtes,\r\nbien égoutter, écraser avec le gingembre et\r\nassaisonner, puis réserver au chaud.","Disposez le poisson dans un plat à rôtir, assaisonnez,\r\npuis étalez la moitié du beurre aromatisé dessus\r\nchaque filet. Rôtir pendant environ 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien cuit. Servir avec la purée de gingembre\r\net quelques légumes verts."]','2026-01-11 00:08:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11040,4567,'fr','Soupe marocaine épicée au chou-fleur et aux amandes','Une soupe satisfaisante et réconfortante est le repas ultime dans un bol, comme ce mélange nord-africain onctueux et épicé','["1 gros chou-fleur","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, de cumin et de coriandre","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte d''harissa, plus un filet supplémentaire","1l de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet chaud","50 g d''amandes effilées grillées, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Coupez le chou-fleur en petits bouquets.\r\nFaire revenir l''huile d''olive, la cannelle moulue, le cumin et la coriandre\r\net la pâte de harissa pendant 2 minutes\r\nune grande casserole. Ajouter le chou-fleur, le bouillon et les amandes. Couvrir et cuire 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle chou-fleur est tendre. Mélanger la soupe\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse, puis servir avec un supplément\r\nun filet de harissa et une pincée de\r\namandes grillées."]','2026-01-11 00:08:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11041,8068,'fr','Agneau aromatique aux dattes','Un one-pot réchauffant aux accents marocains, parfait servi avec du couscous','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","500 g de dés d''agneau maigre désossé, de préférence du gigot","300 g de patates douces coupées en petits morceaux","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","50 g de dattes dénoyautées","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez l''oignon\r\net l''agneau, puis faites-les frire rapidement jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit\r\nlégèrement doré.","Ajoutez les patates douces et\r\népices, puis bien mélanger. Versez 425 ml bouillants\r\nl''eau et le concentré de tomates, puis porter à\r\nl''ébullition.","Couvrir et laisser mijoter 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles patates douces et l''agneau sont tendres, en ajoutant\r\nles dates des 10 dernières minutes. Saupoudrer de\r\ncoriandre et servir avec du couscous."]','2026-01-11 00:08:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11042,7066,'fr','Trempette polyvalente','Utilisez de la harissa épicée pour préparer une trempette rapide et facile pour les légumes et les peaux de pommes de terre.','["225 g de yaourt nature épais et crémeux, égoutté","3-4 cuillères à soupe d''harissa (selon le goût)","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée","une petite poignée de menthe fraîche, hachée finement"]','["Versez le yaourt dans un bol et incorporez autant de harissa que vous le souhaitez. Incorporez la majeure partie de la coriandre et de la menthe et assaisonnez si vous le souhaitez. Verser dans un bol de service, garnir du reste des herbes et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11043,8072,'fr','Tajine de poulet facile','Les casseroles simples sont parfaites pour le cuisinier occupé. Ce tajine de poulet est excellent avec du couscous pour quelque chose d''un peu plus copieux.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 cuisses de poulet désossées, sans peau, coupées en deux si elles sont grosses","1 oignon, haché","2 cuillères à café de gingembre frais râpé","pincée de safran ou de curcuma","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","400 g de carottes coupées en bâtonnets","petit bouquet de persil, haché grossièrement","quartiers de citron, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle avec un couvercle, ajoutez le poulet, puis faites-le revenir rapidement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement coloré. Ajoutez l''oignon et le gingembre, puis faites revenir encore 2 minutes.","Ajoutez 150 ml d''eau, le safran, le miel et les carottes, assaisonnez puis remuez bien. Portez à ébullition, couvrez hermétiquement, puis laissez mijoter 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre. Découvrez et augmentez le feu pendant environ 5 minutes pour réduire un peu la sauce. Saupoudrer de persil et servir avec du citron\r\ncales pour presser."]','2026-01-11 00:08:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11044,8074,'fr','Tajine d''agneau, courge et abricot','Incontournable du Maroc, cette cocotte mijotée est parfumée à la coriandre et aux épices ras-el-hanout','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile","1 gros oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de ras-el-hanout","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","600 g de gigot d''agneau coupé en morceaux de 2 cm, sans excès de gras","200 g de courge butternut coupée en dés","200 g d''abricots secs tendres","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","500 ml de bouillon d''agneau ou de bœuf","le zeste d''1 citron","petit bouquet de coriandre","couscous et yaourt nature, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte anti-flamme\r\nplat, ajoutez l''oignon et laissez cuire 5 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajouter l''ail et les épices\r\net laissez cuire encore quelques minutes,\r\nen remuant pour éviter qu''ils ne s''accrochent et\r\nbrûlant.","Ajouter l''agneau, la courge et les abricots\r\ndans la cocotte, verser dessus\r\ntomates et bouillon, bien assaisonner\r\net porter à ébullition. Mettez le couvercle\r\net transférer au four. Après 1 heure,\r\nremuez le tajine et retournez au\r\nfour, découvert, pendant encore 30\r\nminutes.","Vérifiez l''assaisonnement. Saupoudrer\r\nle zeste et la coriandre, et servir dans\r\nbols chauds avec du couscous et\r\nyaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:08:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11045,6642,'fr','Tajine de boulettes de viande marocaines au citron et aux olives','Une cocotte d''agneau d''Afrique du Nord merveilleusement aromatique avec une saveur d''agrumes – idéale pour les dîners','["3 oignons, pelés","500 g d''agneau haché","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron non traité, coupé en quartiers","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","petit bouquet de persil plat, haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","pincer des brins de safran","250 ml de bouillon d''agneau","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","100 g d''olives noires Kalamata dénoyautées","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","couscous ou pain frais croustillant, pour servir"]','["Mettez les oignons dans un robot culinaire et\r\nmixer jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement hachés. Mettez l''agneau,\r\nle zeste de citron, les épices, le persil et la moitié du\r\noignons dans un grand bol et assaisonner. Utilisation\r\nvos mains, mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé,\r\npuis façonnez des boules de la taille d''une noix.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand plat ignifuge, ou\r\ntajine avec un couvercle, puis ajoutez le reste\r\noignons, gingembre, piment et safran. Cuisiner pour\r\n5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit ramolli et\r\ncommence à se colorer. Ajoutez le jus de citron,\r\nbouillon, purée de tomates et olives, puis\r\nporter à ébullition. Ajoutez les boulettes de viande, une\r\nà la fois, puis baissez le feu, couvrez\r\navec le couvercle et laissez cuire 20 min en retournant\r\nles boulettes de viande plusieurs fois.","Retirez le couvercle, puis ajoutez la coriandre et\r\nquartiers de citron, en les plaçant entre les deux\r\nles boulettes de viande. Cuire à découvert pendant une\r\nencore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait\r\nréduit et légèrement épaissi. Servir chaud\r\navec du couscous ou du pain frais croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:08:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11046,8076,'fr','Salade de couscous piquante','Préparez une salade de couscous délicieusement piquante et super saine en seulement 10 minutes','["300g de couscous ou de boulghar","bouillon de légumes","2 courgettes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","100 g de fromage feta émietté","20 g de persil haché","jus d''1 citron"]','["Cuire le couscous ou le boulghar dans le bouillon de légumes selon les instructions sur l''emballage. Coupez les extrémités des courgettes, puis coupez-les en tranches.","Faites chauffer une poêle ou un grill. Arroser les tranches de courgettes d''huile, puis assaisonner. Cuire 2 minutes, puis retourner et cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et dorés. Versez dans un grand bol avec le couscous cuit ou le boulghar, puis mélangez avec le reste des ingrédients. Servir à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:08:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11047,4886,'fr','Salade de dinde marocaine','Utilisez de la viande rôtie en abondance dans une salade saine avec des aubergines, des tomates, de la grenade et de la menthe.','["2 douleurs pitta","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 aubergine coupée en dés","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa","250 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","500 g de restes de poitrine de dinde émincés","100g de roquette","graines 1 grenade ou pot de 110 g de graines de grenade","quelques feuilles de menthe"]','["Déchirez le pitta en morceaux et faites-le revenir dans l''huile d''olive jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Versez dans un bol, puis faites revenir l''aubergine pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Ajouter au pitta avec la harissa, les tomates, la dinde et la roquette. Mélangez bien. Répartir sur les graines de grenade et les feuilles de menthe."]','2026-01-11 00:08:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11048,8078,'fr','Boulettes de viande marocaines rapides','Une délicieuse version des boulettes de viande pour un souper rapide et savoureux','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","Paquet de 350 g de boulettes de bœuf ou de poulet prêtes à l''emploi (environ 16)","1 gros oignon, tranché","100 g d''abricots secs coupés en deux","1 petit bâton de cannelle","400 g de tomates concassées à l''ail en boîte","25 g d''amandes effilées grillées","une poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, puis faites revenir les boulettes de viande pendant 10 minutes en les retournant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites. Retirer de la poêle et réserver, puis cuire l''oignon pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Ajoutez les abricots secs, le bâton de cannelle, les tomates et une demi-boîte d''eau dans la casserole, puis portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter 10 minutes. Retirez le bâton de cannelle. Remettre les boulettes de viande dans la poêle et bien les enrober de sauce tomate. Servir parsemé d''amandes et de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:08:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11049,8080,'fr','Poêlée de blettes et d''agneau à la marocaine','Un plat rapide et exotique dans une poêle','["1 botte de blettes","1 once d''huile d''olive","600 g d''épaule d''agneau coupée en dés","1 oignon, tranché","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 cuillère à café de chacun : curcuma moulu, graines de cumin et graines de coriandre","pincée de flocons de piment","400 ml de bouillon d''agneau ou de poulet","une poignée de raisins secs","une poignée de pignons de pin grillés"]','["Retirez les feuilles de blettes de la tige. Couper le \r\ncouper en bâtons et déchiqueter grossièrement les feuilles. \r\nRéserver séparément.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une sauteuse et faites revenir l''agneau pendant \r\n5-6 minutes à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajoutez le \r\nl''oignon, l''ail, les tiges de blettes et les épices et continuer \r\ncuire pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Verser sur le \r\nbouillon et parsemer de raisins secs, puis laisser mijoter pendant  \r\n4-5 minutes pour faire une sauce. Faire flétrir les feuilles de blettes \r\nle bouillon, assaisonner et servir parsemé de pignons de pin."]','2026-01-11 00:08:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11050,8082,'fr','Boulgour épicé aux poivrons grillés','Cette salade végétarienne copieuse a les saveurs épicées du cumin et de la cannelle réchauffante.','["200 g de boulgar de blé","250 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","½ cuillère à café de mélange d''épices marocaines, ou une grosse pincée de cumin moulu et de cannelle moulue","le zeste d''1 citron, le jus d''1/2 citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ oignon rouge, finement tranché","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","Pot de 210 g de poivrons rôtis, égouttés et coupés en lambeaux","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles seulement"]','["Dans un grand bol allant au micro-ondes, couvrir le boulghar de bouillon. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et mettre au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 4 minutes. Réserver, couvert; il absorbera le stock dans 5 minutes supplémentaires. Préparez une vinaigrette avec le mélange d''épices, le zeste et le jus de citron et l''huile d''olive, puis assaisonnez au goût. Ajoutez l''oignon, les pois chiches, les poivrons et la coriandre, mélangez le boulghar cuit et servez chaud ou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:08:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11051,6815,'fr','Soupe marocaine aux tomates et pois chiches avec couscous','Cette soupe nourrissante est saine et regorge de saveurs d''Afrique du Nord : harissa, gingembre, citron et coriandre.','["75 g de couscous","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","750 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","1 gros oignon, finement haché","1 carotte coupée en petits cubes","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","un demi-doigt de gingembre pelé et finement haché","1-2 cuillères à soupe de ras-el-hanout","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte d''harissa, plus un peu pour servir","400 g de tomates concassées en boîte","400 g de pois chiches en boîte","jus ½ citron","coriandre grossièrement hachée, pour servir"]','["Versez le couscous dans un bol, assaisonnez de sel et de poivre et incorporez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Versez suffisamment de bouillon chaud juste pour couvrir et couvrez le bol d''un film alimentaire et réservez.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une casserole et faites revenir doucement l''oignon et la carotte pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter l''ail et le gingembre et cuire encore 2 minutes puis incorporer le ras el hanout et la harissa et cuire encore une minute. Versez les tomates et le bouillon et remuez bien le tout. Assaisonnez, ajoutez les pois chiches et laissez mijoter le tout doucement pendant 20 min jusqu''à ce qu''ils épaississent légèrement puis pressez dessus le citron.","Découvrez le couscous et gonflez-le avec une fourchette. Versez la soupe dans des bols, garnissez chacun d''un tas de couscous, parsemez de coriandre et servez avec de l''harissa supplémentaire pour ceux qui le souhaitent."]','2026-01-11 00:08:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11052,4933,'fr','Houmous à la butternut et à l''harissa','Citrouille rôtie avec beaucoup d''ail, puis mixée dans une trempette à la marocaine avec de la harissa épicée et de la pâte de sésame','["½ courge butternut (environ 400 g), pelée et coupée en morceaux de 2 cm","3 gousses d''ail, non pelées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tahini","1 cuillère à soupe d''harissa, plus un peu plus pour arroser","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMettez la courge butternut et l''ail\r\nclous de girofle dans une rôtissoire, bien assaisonner\r\net ajoutez 100 ml d''eau. Couvrir la boîte\r\navec du papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 45 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nla courge est vraiment tendre. Laisser refroidir.","Versez la courge dans un robot culinaire\r\navec le jus de la boîte. Ajoutez le\r\ngousses d''ail, pressées de leur\r\npeaux. Ajoutez le reste des ingrédients,\r\nassaisonner de sel et mélanger jusqu''à obtenir une pâte.","Grattez le houmous dans un bol.\r\nArroser d''harissa supplémentaire avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11053,8084,'fr','Tajine de pintade aux pois chiches, courges et abricots','Ce gibier à plumes ressemble beaucoup au poulet, il peut donc être cuit de la même manière – faites-le tourner dans cette cocotte parfumée aux épices marocaines.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 pintades, rôties comme un poulet (demandez à votre boucher de le faire ou regardez notre vidéo sur la façon de rôtir un poulet, dans \"Essayer\", ci-dessous)","2 oignons, hachés grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 courge musquée ou petite citrouille, pelée, épépinée et coupée en gros morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de ras-el-hanout","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","¼ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 gros bâton de cannelle","un petit filet de miel clair","grosse pincée de safran trempé dans 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau bouillante","jus d''1 citron","850 ml de bouillon de poulet","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","200 g d''abricots secs","petit bouquet de coriandre","couscous ou riz, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand récipient ignifuge peu profond\r\ncocotte. Assaisonner la pintade\r\nmorceaux et faites-les dorer – par lots, si\r\nnécessaire – puis retirer dans une assiette.","Faire revenir les oignons dans le même plat jusqu''à ce\r\nramolli, puis ajoutez l''ail et la courge,\r\ncuire 1 à 2 minutes. Astuce dans les épices\r\net laissez cuire quelques minutes avant d''ajouter\r\nle miel, le safran et le jus de citron. Verser\r\ndans le bouillon de poulet et les pois chiches.","Plongez les morceaux de pintade dans\r\nle bouillon et ajoutez les abricots. Couvrir le\r\nplat et laisser mijoter le tout très doucement\r\npendant 50 min à 1 h, jusqu''à ce que la volaille et la courge\r\nsont tous deux tendres. Incorporer la coriandre\r\net servir avec du couscous ou du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:08:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11054,8086,'fr','Couscous marocain au poulet et aux dattes','Les grains de blé entier vous rassasient plus longtemps – saveur avec des dattes, du citron, du cumin et de la cannelle','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g de cuisses de poulet sans peau","140 g de couscous complet","2 oignons, tranchés","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées","le zeste de 2 citrons, le jus de 1","350 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","6 grosses dattes dénoyautées et hachées (les Medjool sont sympas)","50g d''amandes effilées","petit bouquet de persil haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C ventilé/\r\ngaz 4. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un\r\ngrande poêle à feu vif.\r\nAssaisonner le poulet, puis cuire pendant\r\n10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les deux soient dorés\r\ncôtés. Retirer et mettre dans un grand\r\nplat allant au four avec le couscous sec.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans le\r\npoêle, ajoutez les oignons et l''ail, et\r\ncuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajouter\r\nle zeste et le jus d''1 citron accompagné\r\navec le bouillon, cumin, cannelle\r\net les dattes, puis porter à ébullition.","Versez le mélange de dattes sur le\r\npoulet et couscous, saupoudrer\r\nsur les amandes, couvrir avec\r\npapier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes. Servir\r\nsaupoudré du reste\r\nle zeste et le persil."]','2026-01-11 00:08:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11055,5119,'fr','Salade mentholée de carottes, pistaches et feta','Une salade végétarienne avec des carottes rôties au cumin, des pois chiches, de la menthe, des noix, des épinards et du fromage salé – idéale avec la cuisine marocaine','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","500 g de carottes coupées en deux et coupées en morceaux","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","jus ½ citron","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","petit bouquet de menthe hachée","2 grosses poignées d''épinards","100 g de pistaches décortiquées hachées grossièrement","200 g de fromage feta émietté"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nVersez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile, les carottes,\r\npois chiches et cumin sur une plaque à pâtisserie\r\nplateau, assaisonner et mélanger pour enrober. Rôti\r\npendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les carottes soient tendres.","Mélanger le jus de citron, le miel\r\net le reste de l''huile, puis versez partout dans le\r\ncarottes et pois chiches rôtis. Laisser à\r\nrefroidir. Vous pouvez refroidir la salade à ce stade,\r\njusqu''à 1 jour ; il suffit de le sortir du\r\nréfrigérateur 1 h avant de servir.","Mélanger la menthe et les feuilles d''épinards\r\net les pistaches, et vérifiez l''assaisonnement.\r\nRépartir la feta dessus et arroser d''un\r\nun peu d''huile supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:08:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11056,8088,'fr','Crevettes à l''ail','Préparez ce plat de tapas en un rien de temps, évoquant les bars décontractés de la côte espagnole. Traditionnellement, il est cuit dans un plat en terre cuite ignifuge','["12 grosses crevettes crues","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","100 ml d''huile d''olive","3 piments de Cayenne séchés (ou autre piment séché)","1 cuillère à soupe de persil plat haché"]','["Épluchez les crevettes en laissant les queues intactes et, à l''aide d''un pique à cocktail, retirez le tube digestif. Ou encore, si vous utilisez une poêle plutôt qu''une marmite en terre cuite, vous pouvez cuire les crevettes dans leur carapace. Assaisonner avec un peu de sel marin.","Mettez l''ail, l''huile d''olive et les piments dans une casserole ou une poêle en terre cuite ignifuge et faites chauffer à feu vif. Lorsque l''ail commence à dorer, ajoutez les crevettes et faites cuire 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste roses. Saupoudrez de persil haché et de poivre noir fraîchement concassé et servez immédiatement. Si vous utilisez un pot en terre cuite, vous pouvez le porter directement à table, mais soyez prudent car l''huile et la terre cuite resteront chaudes pendant plusieurs minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:08:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11057,8090,'fr','Crème catalane','Ce sont les agrumes de la crème anglaise qui distinguent ce dessert espagnol classique, garni de sucre doré et caramélisé. La façon idéale de compléter un menu de tapas','["400 ml de lait entier","150 ml de crème fraîche","1 bâton de cannelle","1 orange, le zeste coupé en lanières","1 citron , le zeste coupé en lamelles","7 jaunes d''œufs (congeler les blancs pour les utiliser dans une autre recette)","100 g de sucre en poudre, plus 6 cuillères à soupe pour le topping","45g de maïzena"]','["Mettez le lait, la crème, le bâton de cannelle et tous les zestes d''agrumes dans une casserole sur feu moyen. Cuire en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce que le lait soit juste fumant mais pas bouillant, environ 3 à 5 minutes. Retirer du feu, couvrir d''une assiette et laisser infuser au moins 30 min.","Une fois le mélange de crème infusé, fouettez les jaunes d''œufs, le sucre et la maïzena dans un autre bol pendant 3 à 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que leur couleur soit claire et pâle. Versez le lait infusé au tamis dans le mélange d''œufs en fouettant continuellement. Remettez le mélange dans la casserole.","Mettez la casserole sur feu moyen-vif et fouettez pendant environ 10 à 12 minutes. Le mélange devrait commencer à épaissir jusqu’à obtenir une consistance semblable à celle d’une crème anglaise – vous pouvez savoir qu’il est prêt en trempant une cuillère en bois dans le mélange, puis en passant un doigt dans le mélange sur le dos de la cuillère. Si la ligne tient, c''est prêt. Tamisez le mélange dans un pichet pour éliminer toute mousse.","Répartir la crème anglaise dans six ramequins ou petits plats en terre cuite de 150 ml, puis laisser refroidir 1 h à température ambiante jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit prise avec un léger tremblement. Réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Juste avant de servir, saupoudrez 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre sur le dessus de chaque ramequin et caramélisez à l''aide d''un chalumeau de cuisine. Vous pouvez également glisser les ramequins sous un gril chaud jusqu''à ce que le sucre devienne doré et commence à bouillonner. Servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:08:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11058,8092,'fr','ensaimada','Essayez cette pâtisserie espagnole pour un petit-déjeuner ou une gâterie l''après-midi à déguster avec un café ou comme collation salée. Sa forme en spirale est emblématique, tout comme sa texture légère comme une plume','["5 g de levure sèche (ou 16 g de levure fraîche)","200 g de sucre en poudre","2 œufs fermiers moyens","600 g de farine à pain blanche forte","huile végétale, pour le plan de travail et le rouleau à pâtisserie","100 g de saindoux ramolli (ou 50 g si vous utilisez de la sobrasada comme garniture)","50 g de sobrasada de Majorque (saucisse salée à tartiner)","200 ml de crème fouettée","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace (facultatif)"]','["Versez 230 ml d''eau tiède dans un bol et ajoutez la levure. Laisser reposer 3 minutes, puis ajouter le sucre semoule, les œufs, la farine et 1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin. Mélangez pour former une pâte, puis pétrissez pendant 10 minutes au batteur sur socle à l''aide d''un crochet pétrisseur (ou 15 minutes à la main) jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit suffisamment élastique pour être presque transparente une fois étirée. Couvrir et laisser reposer 30 min, puis couper en quatre morceaux égaux. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Laisser reposer encore 30 min.","Huiler le plan de travail et un rouleau à pâtisserie avec de l''huile végétale. En travaillant une portion de pâte à la fois, aplatissez-la contre la surface avec la paume de la main, puis étalez-la en un rectangle fin d''environ 30 x 50 cm. Laissez reposer 2 minutes pendant que vous étalez un quart du saindoux dessus. (Si vous souhaitez garnir votre pâtisserie de sobrasada de Majorque, mélangez 50 g de saindoux avec la sobrasada, et étalez-le plutôt sur la pâte.) Tirez un coin de la pâte aplatie et étirez-la au maximum sans la casser. Répétez tous les 10 cm environ autour du rectangle de pâte dans toutes les directions jusqu''à ce qu''il atteigne environ 50 x 70 cm.","Découpez une bande sur chacun des côtés les plus courts et posez-les les unes à côté des autres le long de l''un des côtés les plus longs du rectangle ; c''est ce que nous appelons le cœur de l''ensaimada. À partir de là, commencez à rouler la pâte jusqu’à obtenir un long serpent pâtissier. Répétez avec les portions de pâte restantes.","Prenez le premier rouleau de pâte et étirez-le jusqu''à ce qu''il mesure plus d''un mètre de long. Ensuite, enroulez-la en spirale en laissant 1 cm entre chaque tour de spirale pour que la pâte puisse gonfler. Aplatir un peu et transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte. Laisser lever dans un endroit tiède au moins 12h, idéalement 24h.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettre les ensaimadas dans le tiers supérieur du four et réduire immédiatement la température à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Cuire au four pendant 18 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien dorées. Laisser refroidir sur une grille. Pour remplir votre ensaimada de chantilly, tranchez et ouvrez, puis étalez sur la crème et fermez. Saupoudrez d''une généreuse quantité de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11059,8094,'fr','Paella de triche au micro-ondes','Essayez cette version raccourcie de la paella classique espagnole, avec du poulet et du chorizo ​​pour un repas en milieu de semaine. La recette est basée sur un micro-ondes d''une puissance de 750W','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées ou finement râpées","700 ml de bouillon de poulet","pincée de safran (facultatif)","½ cuillère à soupe de paprika doux fumé","300 g de riz paëlla","200 g de poulet tranché finement","200 g de chorizo ​​haché","150 g de petits pois surgelés","½ citron, jus, plus des quartiers pour servir","une petite poignée de persil haché grossièrement"]','["Mettez l''huile d''olive, l''oignon, l''ail et une pincée de sel dans un grand plat allant au micro-ondes, mélangez bien et faites chauffer à feu vif pendant 3 minutes. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le bouillon de volaille et le safran dans un pichet et laissez infuser quelques minutes.","Incorporez le paprika, le riz, le poulet et le chorizo ​​aux oignons et à l''ail, puis versez le bouillon de poulet et le safran avant de bien assaisonner. Couvrir et cuire à feu vif pendant 15 minutes. Remuer, couvrir et cuire encore 5 minutes.","Découvrez en faisant attention à la vapeur, puis ajoutez les petits pois surgelés et encore 100 ml d''eau si le mélange semble un peu sec. Cuire à découvert pendant 3 minutes avant d''arroser de jus de citron et de parsemer de persil. Servir avec des quartiers de citron à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:08:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11060,6409,'fr','Paëlla végétalienne','Réalisez quatre de vos 5 par jour avec cette paella végétalienne – c''est un souper satisfaisant mais faible en calories. Nous avons inclus des fèves, une source précieuse de protéines végétales','["2 généreuses pincées de safran","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons (320 g), finement hachés","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en dés","3 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de thym tendre","200 g de riz basmati brun","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","320 g de fèves surgelées","320 g de courgettes coupées en deux et tranchées","15 g de persil plat haché","1 citron, coupé en quartiers"]','["Mettez la bouilloire à ébullition. Versez le safran, le concentré de tomates et la poudre de bouillon dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur, puis versez dessus 1 litre d''eau bouillante et réservez.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à paella à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir. Ajoutez les poivrons, l''ail et le thym et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes. Ajoutez le riz et le paprika et poursuivez la cuisson en remuant pendant environ une minute. Versez le bouillon de safran, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 10 min.","Découvrez et remuez délicatement, puis ajoutez les haricots et les courgettes surgelés. Remettre à ébullition, puis couvrir et cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et ait absorbé le bouillon. Laisser reposer 5 minutes, puis incorporer le persil. Servir immédiatement la moitié de la paella avec des quartiers de citron à presser. L''autre moitié se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Pour déguster un autre jour, réchauffez-le au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:08:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11061,8096,'fr','Poulet espagnol facile','Savourez notre recette de poulet espagnol – un ragoût classique et réconfortant à base de cuisses de poulet nichées dans une sauce tomate et paprika fumé avec du chorizo ​​et des haricots beurre.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 oignon, tranché finement","150 g de chorizo ​​coupé en rondelles","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en lanières","1 poivron jaune épépiné et coupé en lanières","1 cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","150 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre, égouttés et rincés","8 cuisses de poulet avec os et peau","une petite poignée de persil plat haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle allant au four à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon, le chorizo ​​et les poivrons avec une pincée de sel et de poivre pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient ramollis et que le chorizo ​​ait libéré ses huiles. Ajouter le paprika et l''ail et cuire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés.","Ajoutez les tomates hachées, les olives et les haricots beurre, mélangez et assaisonnez. Placer dans les cuisses de poulet et bien assaisonner. Transférer au four et cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que la peau du poulet soit croustillante et la viande bien cuite et tendre. Parsemer de persil et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11062,4301,'fr','Ragoût d''été au chorizo ​​et pois chiches','Mélangez des tomates, des pois chiches, des poivrons rouges et des épinards avec du chorizo ​​et du paprika fumé pour obtenir ce ragoût familial riche en nutriments, riche en vitamine C et en fibres.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 brins de thym","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","200 g de rondelles de chorizo ​​coupées en fines tranches","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","600 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","Pot de 450 g de poivrons rouges rôtis, égouttés et coupés en grosses lanières","100g d''épinards","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés","un filet d''huile d''olive extra vierge et du pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen, ajoutez l''ail, le thym et le paprika fumé, et remuez pendant quelques minutes, puis versez le chorizo ​​et remuez encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que son huile se libère. Ajoutez le vinaigre de Xérès et laissez-le bouillonner pendant environ une minute.","Ajoutez les tomates, les poivrons, les épinards et les pois chiches ainsi que 100 ml d''eau et une pincée d''assaisonnement. Porter à ébullition, puis réduire le feu et laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient ramollies et qu''il y ait une sauce épaissie, environ 15 minutes. Ajustez l''assaisonnement et terminez avec un filet d''huile d''olive extra vierge. Servir avec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:08:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11063,8098,'fr','Boulettes de viande Patatas bravas','Inspirez-vous du plat de tapas classique patatas bravas avec cette recette. L''ajout de boulettes de viande de porc maison en fait le régal familial idéal du vendredi soir.','["3½ cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1½-2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé à chaud (selon le degré de piquant que vous aimez)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à café de sucre","100 g d''olives noires dénoyautées","400 g de porc haché","70 g de chapelure fraîche","1 jaune d''oeuf","pincée de flocons de piment","petit bouquet de persil finement haché","1 kg de pommes de terre blanches, coupées en cubes de 3 cm","aïoli, pour servir (facultatif ; voir le conseil ci-dessous)"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une casserole et faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Incorporer les deux tiers de l''ail et cuire encore 1 min. Ajoutez le paprika et laissez cuire encore une minute, puis incorporez les tomates et le sucre. Assaisonner au goût. Cuire 15 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Retirer du feu, incorporer les olives et réserver.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Mettez le hachis dans un grand bol avec la chapelure, le reste de l''ail, le jaune d''œuf, les flocons de piment et la moitié du persil. Saison. Mélangez avec vos mains jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Divisez-le en 12 morceaux, en pesant pour plus de précision si vous le souhaitez, puis roulez-le en boulettes de viande. Couvrir et mettre au réfrigérateur pendant que vous préparez les pommes de terre.","Mélanger les pommes de terre dans un plat à rôtir avec 1½ cuillère à soupe du reste d''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement. Rôtir pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, en remuant à mi-cuisson. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir les boulettes de viande pendant 5 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient uniformément dorées. Ajoutez les boulettes de viande dans le moule avec les pommes de terre et faites rôtir encore 10 minutes. Réchauffez la sauce tomate, si nécessaire, puis versez-la sur les boulettes de viande et les pommes de terre. Garnir du reste de persil haché et servir avec un peu d''aïoli, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11064,8100,'fr','Paëlla mixte','Essayez notre version de paella, composée d''une combinaison de viande et de fruits de mer. Avec des gambas, des moules, du chorizo ​​et du poulet, chaque bouchée est un régal qui rappelle les vacances espagnoles.','["Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","600 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à café bombée de paprika fumé","2 pincées de safran","1 oignon, haché","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées ou hachées finement","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","300 g de riz paëlla","4 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en deux","200 g de chorizo ​​tranché","85 g de petits pois surgelés","150 g de gambas crues, décortiquées si vous le souhaitez","250 g de moules nettoyées","1 citron coupé en quartiers (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Mélanger les tomates, le bouillon, le paprika et le safran dans un grand pichet résistant à la chaleur, puis mettre au micro-ondes pendant 5 minutes à puissance maximale ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient chauds. Ou faites-le chauffer dans une poêle sur la cuisinière.","Mettez l''oignon et l''ail dans une grande poêle ou un plat à rôtir allant au four, arrosez d''huile d''olive et remuez pour bien enrober. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à dorer.","Incorporer le riz, le poulet, le chorizo ​​et le bouillon chaud. Assaisonner et enfourner 20 minutes (ne pas couvrir la poêle).","Incorporez délicatement les petits pois, parsemez les crevettes et pressez les moules, le côté charnière vers le bas, pour qu''elles soient debout. Disposez les quartiers de citron sur le pourtour, si vous en utilisez. Cuire au four encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz, le poulet et les crevettes soient cuits et que les moules soient ouvertes (jetez celles qui restent fermées). Vérifiez l''assaisonnement et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11065,6827,'fr','La paella la plus simple de tous les temps','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Vous pensez que la paella est trop difficile ? Détrompez-vous, cette recette facile la rend infaillible et pleine de saveurs fantastiques','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 poireau ou oignon, tranché","Paquet de 110 g de chorizo ​​haché","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","300 g de riz à grains longs","1l de bouillon de poisson ou de poulet chaud","200 g de petits pois surgelés","400 g de mélange de fruits de mer surgelés, décongelés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis attendrissez le poireau pendant 5 min sans le colorer. Ajouter le chorizo ​​et faire revenir jusqu''à ce qu''il libère ses huiles. Incorporer le curcuma et le riz jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient enrobés d''huiles, puis verser le bouillon. Portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 15 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Ajoutez les petits pois et laissez cuire 5 minutes, puis incorporez les fruits de mer pour bien réchauffer pendant 1 à 2 minutes de cuisson finale ou jusqu''à ce que le riz soit cuit. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement et servez aussitôt avec des quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:08:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11066,8102,'fr','Morue rôtie à la paella et à l''huile d''olive au safran','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Impressionnez vos amis avec le luxueux riz aux crustacés de Jason Atherton, garni de morue juteuse et arrosé de safran.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","200 g de chorizo ​​cru coupé en dés","3 grosses échalotes, tranchées finement","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de paprika doux fumé (pimenton)","300 g de riz paëlla","1l de bouillon de poisson","noix de beurre doux","300 g de crevettes coupées en petits morceaux","une poignée de moules cuites et décortiquées, plus 18 dans leur coquille","jus d''½ citron (facultatif)","petit bouquet de persil haché","75 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","jus ½ citron","pincer des fils de safran","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","noix de beurre doux","6 filets de cabillaud de 175 g/6 oz, avec la peau","presser le jus de citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nPour faire la paella, mettez l''huile d''olive,\r\nchorizo, échalotes et ail dans un grand\r\npoêler et faire frire pendant 7 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chorizo\r\nlibère son huile et les échalotes ont\r\nramolli. Ajoutez le paprika et faites cuire,\r\nen remuant pendant 5 minutes, puis ajoutez le riz,\r\nbien mélanger et laisser cuire encore quelques minutes.","Versez 600 ml de bouillon, assaisonnez et\r\nbien mélanger pour combiner. Couvrir et mettre dedans\r\nau four pendant 15 mn. Découvrez, donnez\r\ntout remue bien, puis retournez au\r\nau four pendant 10 mn. Lorsqu''il est presque cuit,\r\nsortir du four et étaler sur\r\nun plateau pour refroidir. Mettez au frais et réservez pour plus tard. Vous pouvez le préparer la veille.","Pour faire l''huile de safran, fouettez le\r\nl''huile d''olive et le jus de citron ensemble dans\r\nune petite casserole. Ajoutez le safran et\r\nchauffer doucement pendant 5 minutes, puis retirer du\r\nChauffer et laisser infuser et refroidir. Vous pouvez le préparer la veille.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nPour le cabillaud, mettre l''huile d''olive et le beurre\r\ndans une poêle allant au four à feu vif\r\nchauffer, mais ne le laissez pas brûler. Assaisonner le\r\ncabillaud avec sel de mer et poivre noir, puis\r\ncuire, peau vers le bas, dans la poêle chaude, pendant\r\n4 min, puis retournez délicatement le poisson\r\net mettez le plat au four encore\r\n3 min, pour finir avec un peu plus de mer\r\ndu sel et un filet de jus de citron.","Pendant ce temps, remettez la paella dans le\r\npoêle, incorporer le reste du bouillon de poisson et\r\ncuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement chaud\r\nà travers. Incorporez une noix de beurre, les crevettes et les moules décortiquées. Goût,\r\nassaisonner avec du jus de citron, du sel et du poivre\r\nsi nécessaire, et terminer par le haché\r\npersil. Servir avec la morue rôtie,\r\nmoules dans leur coquille et cuites à la vapeur\r\ndu brocoli violet ou un légume vert,\r\nsi tu veux. Enfin, arrosez le tout\r\navec la vinaigrette au safran."]','2026-01-11 00:08:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11067,8104,'fr','Churros avec trempette au chocolat','Essayez une nouvelle version des beignets en les préparant à la manière espagnole et en les servant avec une sauce au chocolat noir épaisse et gourmande.','["50 g de beurre fondu","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","environ 1 litre d''huile de tournesol","quelques morceaux de pain","200 g de chocolat noir pas trop amer, cassé en morceaux","100 ml de crème double","100 ml de lait entier","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille, si vous en avez","100 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de cannelle"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire, puis mesurez 350 ml d''eau bouillante dans une carafe et ajoutez le beurre fondu et l''extrait de vanille. Tamisez la farine et la levure chimique dans un grand bol à mélanger avec une grosse pincée de sel. Faites un puits au centre, puis versez le contenu du pichet et incorporez très rapidement la farine avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit sans grumeaux. Reposez-vous 10 à 15 minutes pendant que vous préparez la sauce.","Mettez tous les ingrédients de la sauce dans une casserole et faites fondre doucement ensemble, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse et brillante. Gardez au chaud à feu doux.","Remplissez une grande casserole profonde au tiers d’huile. Chauffer jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain brunisse en 45 secondes – 1 min. Couvrir une plaque de papier absorbant et mélanger le sucre en poudre et la cannelle.","Installez une douille étoile sur une poche à douille, une largeur de 1,5 à 2 cm est une bonne taille. Remplissez avec la pâte reposée, puis déposez 2-3 bandes directement dans le moule, en coupant chaque bande de pâte avec une paire de ciseaux de cuisine. Faire frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants, puis retirer avec une écumoire et égoutter sur le plateau tapissé de papier absorbant. Poursuivez la cuisson du reste de la pâte par lots, en saupoudrant au fur et à mesure les churros cuits d''un peu de sucre à la cannelle. Une fois que vous avez cuit tous les churros, mélangez-les avec le reste du sucre à la cannelle et servez avec la sauce au chocolat, comme trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:08:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11068,8106,'fr','Salade tiède de foies de volaille, paprika fumé & Xérès','Une délicieuse salade tiède, pleine de saveurs fumées et aillées','["Sachet de 100 g de noisettes blanchies, moins 3 cuillères à soupe pour la sauce, ci-dessous","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","petite noix de beurre","450 g de foies de volaille coupés en bouchées","125 ml de verre de xérès Oloroso","jus ½ citron","120 g de salade de roquette","vinaigre de Xérès, pour habiller les feuilles","2 gousses d''ail","20 g de persil plat, feuilles uniquement","3 cuillères à soupe de noisettes blanchies","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé à chaud","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients de la sauce\r\ndans un robot culinaire, puis passez à un\r\npâte grossière. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 6. Mettez les noisettes restantes sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie, rôtir pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que légèrement\r\ngrillé, hachez-le grossièrement, puis réservez.","Maintenant, préparez la salade – ajoutez l''huile d''olive\r\net beurrer dans une grande poêle à frire sur un\r\nfeu moyen-vif. Faire revenir rapidement les foies\r\nen 2 lots jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, environ 2 minutes\r\npar lot. Ajoutez le Sherry, puis faites bouillonner pendant\r\nquelques minutes à feu vif. Incorporer le\r\nsauce et laissez-la épaissir et chauffer\r\nà travers. Arroser de jus de citron, puis\r\nassaisonner au goût. Habillez les feuilles de salade\r\navec un peu de vinaigre de Xérès. Verser le\r\nfoies et sauce dans des assiettes de service,\r\nsaupoudrer de tranches grillées\r\nnoisettes, puis parsemer sur la sauce\r\nfeuilles de salade et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:08:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11069,8108,'fr','Tarte au poulet espagnole','Les poivrons rôtis, les olives et le paprika donnent à cette pâtisserie des tonnes de saveurs. C’est aussi une excellente façon d’utiliser les restes de poulet cuit.','["1 kg de pommes de terre hachées","3 cuillères à café de paprika (utilisez du paprika fumé si vous en avez)","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","300 g de poulet cuit, émincé","140 g de poivrons rôtis en bocal, tranchés (on aime les Karyatis)","une poignée d''olives Kalamata, coupées en deux"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Faire bouillir\r\nles pommes de terre pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres.\r\nÉgoutter, remettre dans la casserole, puis écraser avec\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement et 2 cuillères à café de paprika.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle,\r\npuis faites revenir les oignons et l''ail quelques instants\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer le reste\r\npaprika pendant 1 min, ajoutez les tomates,\r\npuis portez à ébullition. Verser dans un grand\r\nplat allant au four, puis incorporez le poulet,\r\npoivrons, olives et quelques assaisonnements.","Verser sur la purée, puis enfourner pendant\r\n15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la purée soit dorée\r\ndessus et la sauce bouillonne."]','2026-01-11 00:08:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11070,4833,'fr','Riz espagnol aux fruits de mer','Cette version rapide de la paella est super saine, et en plus, tout est cuit dans une seule poêle, donc il y a un minimum de vaisselle.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","1 poivron rouge et 1 jaune, épépinés et tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","250 g de riz paëlla","850 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud (nous avons utilisé du bouillon Kallo à très faible teneur en sel)","pincée de safran","400 g de mélange de fruits de mer (nous avons utilisé un sachet de mélange de fruits de mer surgelés, décongelés avant utilisation)","jus ½ petit citron","une petite poignée de persil plat, haché grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole et\r\nramollir l''oignon pendant 6 à 7 minutes. Ajoutez le\r\npoivre et ail, cuire 2 min\r\nplus, puis incorporez le riz à paella et\r\ncuire 1 min en remuant pour bien enrober.","Versez le bouillon, ajoutez le safran et\r\nporter à ébullition. Cuire à découvert à\r\nune douce bulle, pendant 20 minutes, en remuant\r\nde temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre.","Incorporer les fruits de mer et le jus de citron et\r\ncuire pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud et\r\ncomplètement cuit. Servir dans\r\nbols chauds parsemés de persil."]','2026-01-11 00:08:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11071,8110,'fr','Crevettes à l''ail et au xérès','Les amateurs de fruits de mer adoreront cette recette simple façon tapas, faible en gras et rapide à préparer.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","400 g de grosses crevettes, non cuites","2 cuillères à soupe de xérès sec (fino)","poignée de persil haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle. Ajoutez les tranches d''ail et faites cuire quelques secondes.\r\nIncorporez ensuite les crevettes et faites cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à devenir roses.","Versez dessus le sherry et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes, jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient cuites.\r\nà travers. Saupoudrer de persil avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11072,8112,'fr','Tortilla épicée','Parfaite pour les dîners, les déjeuners et les collations, cette tortilla épicée est idéale au réfrigérateur pour de nombreuses occasions.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 oignon, tranché","1 piment rouge épépiné et râpé","2 cuillères à café d''épices pour curry (nous avons utilisé de la coriandre, du cumin et du curcuma)","300 g de tomates cerises","500 g de pommes de terre cuites, tranchées","bouquet de coriandre, tiges finement hachées, feuilles grossièrement hachées","8 œufs battus"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Faites revenir l''oignon et la moitié du piment pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez les épices, faites revenir 1 min\r\nplus, puis ajoutez les tomates cerises, les pommes de terre et les tiges de coriandre dans la poêle. Assaisonnez bien les œufs, versez-les sur les légumes et laissez cuire doucement pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient presque pris.","Faites chauffer le gril et faites clignoter la tortilla en dessous pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit pris. Éparpillez les feuilles de coriandre et le reste\r\nchili sur le dessus, coupez-le en quartiers et\r\nservir avec une salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:08:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11073,8114,'fr','Boules espagnoles aux figues et aux amandes','Une version festive du Pan deHigo, un gâteau aux figues séchées que les Espagnols mangent traditionnellement avec du fromage et un filet de miel.','["100 g d''amandes entières grillées","Paquet de 500 g de figues entières séchées, tige dure et centre de la base retirés","85 g d''abricots secs coupés en petits morceaux","50 g de canneberges séchées","1 cuillère à soupe de cognac","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","1 cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","100 g de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Mélangez les amandes au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce que la plupart soient finement hachées, puis versez-les dans un grand bol. Hachez grossièrement les figues, puis mixez-les \r\nune pâte lisse et collante. Grattez sur les amandes puis, à l''aide de vos mains, mélangez bien avec les fruits secs, l''eau-de-vie, le miel et les clous de girofle.","Divisez le mélange en 6 et roulez en boules. Versez les graines de sésame sur un plateau, puis roulez-y les boules jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient recouvertes. Couvrez légèrement le plateau avec un torchon propre, puis laissez sécher les boules de figues pendant une semaine avant de les emballer. Se conserve 2 mois au frais."]','2026-01-11 00:08:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11074,5796,'fr','One-pot espagnol de riz et de crevettes','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un repas rapide et facile rempli de saveurs des fêtes méditerranéennes.','["1 oignon, tranché","1 poivron rouge et 1 vert, épépinés et tranchés","50 g de chorizo ​​tranché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de riz basmati facile à cuire (nous avons utilisé du Tilda)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","200 g de crevettes crues décortiquées, décongelées si congelées"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire. Dans une friture antiadhésive ou\r\npoêle peu profonde avec un couvercle, faites revenir l''oignon,\r\npoivrons, chorizo et ail dans l''huile\r\nà feu vif pendant 3 min. Incorporer le riz et\r\ntomates concassées avec 500 ml d''ébullition\r\neau, couvrir, puis cuire à feu vif\r\npendant 12 minutes.","Découvrez, puis remuez – le riz doit être\r\npresque tendre. Incorporer les crevettes, avec un\r\narrosez plus d''eau si le riz a l''air\r\nsécher, puis cuire encore une minute jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles crevettes sont juste roses et tendres comme du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:08:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11075,8116,'fr','Soupe chorizo ​​et pois chiches','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmansSoupe grésillante au chorizo ​​et aux pois chiches','["Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","Pack de 110 g de chorizo ​​(non connu)","140 g de quartiers de choux de Milan","saupoudrer de flocons de piment séchés","Boîte de 410 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","1 cube de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes","pain croustillant ou pain à l''ail, pour servir"]','["Mettez une poêle moyenne sur le feu et versez  \r\ndans les tomates, suivi d''un bidon d''eau. \r\nPendant que les tomates chauffent, rapidement  \r\ncouper le chorizo en gros morceaux \r\n(en enlevant la peau) et râpez le chou.","Empilez le chorizo et le chou dans la poêle \r\navec les flocons de piment et les pois chiches, puis \r\némietter dans le cube de bouillon. Bien mélanger, couvrir \r\net laisser bouillonner à feu vif pendant \r\n6 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le chou soit juste tendre. \r\nVerser dans des bols et manger avec du croustillant ou  \r\npain à l''ail."]','2026-01-11 00:08:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11076,4917,'fr','Sardines espagnoles sur toast','Savourez le goût de la Méditerranée avec ce souper frais et sain à base d''un poisson gras riche en oméga-3 et d''un bon aliment de base bon marché.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","1 citron, le zeste et le jus","2 boîtes de 120 g de sardines à l''huile de tournesol égouttées","4 tranches de pain brun","un demi-petit bouquet de persil haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans un\r\npoêle, puis grésiller\r\nla gousse d''ail et le piment rouge. Ajoutez le zeste de citron.","Ajoutez le\r\nsardines et chaleur\r\nlaisser cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud.","Faire griller le pain brun. Incorporer le persil dans le\r\nsardines, ajoutez un filet de jus de citron,\r\npuis répartissez sur les toasts et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11077,8118,'fr','Salade de chorizo ​​et œufs mollets','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Cette salade d''été sera sur la table en seulement 30 minutes.','["500 g de pommes de terre nouvelles grelots coupées en deux","4 œufs","225 g de haricots verts parés","225 g de rondelles de chorizo, tranchées","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre dans une grande poêle\r\nfaire bouillir de l''eau salée pendant 12 minutes, en ajoutant\r\nles œufs au bout de 6 minutes, et les haricots\r\npour les 2 dernières minutes. Égoutter tout et\r\nrefroidir les œufs sous l''eau froide courante.","Pendant ce temps, faites revenir les tranches de chorizo pendant\r\n1 à 2 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à devenir croustillantes. Supprimer\r\nde la poêle avec une écumoire et\r\nréserver en laissant l''huile du chorizo\r\ndans la poêle. Ajouter l''ail dans la poêle et\r\ncuire doucement 1 min.","Retirez la casserole du feu, remuez\r\ndans le vinaigre et le persil, puis mélanger\r\navec les pommes de terre, haricots, chorizo\r\net l''assaisonnement. Décortiquez les œufs, coupés en\r\nquartiers et ajouter à la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:08:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11078,8120,'fr','Omelette au chorizo, pommes de terre et fromage','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Battez vos œufs avec des saucisses espagnoles et des pommes de terre pour préparer une omelette décadente pour une personne.','["1 petite pomme de terre coupée en dés de 2 cm","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","50 g de chorizo ​​haché","2-3 oeufs","persil haché","25 g de cheddar râpé"]','["Cuire la pomme de terre dans l''eau bouillante pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à omelette, ajoutez le chorizo ​​et laissez cuire 2 min. Ajoutez la pomme de terre et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à devenir croustillante. Versez le contenu de la poêle, essuyez la poêle et faites cuire une omelette de 2 ou 3 œufs dans la même poêle. Lorsqu''il est presque cuit, parsemez de chorizo ​​et de pomme de terre, de persil et de fromage. Pliez l''omelette dans la poêle et laissez cuire encore 1 min pour faire fondre le fromage."]','2026-01-11 00:08:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11079,8122,'fr','Poulet espagnol','Pour un maximum de saveur et un minimum de vaisselle, essayez ce savoureux one-pot','["8 cuisses de poulet, avec la peau et l''os","3 oignons, tranchés finement","2 cuillères à café de paprika","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","une bonne poignée de persil haché grossièrement","150 ml de bouillon","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nMettez tous les ingrédients dans un grand et large\r\nplat allant au four. Mélangez le tout ensemble\r\navec vos mains et assaisonnez.","Enfourner 45 mn en remuant les oignons\r\naprès 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit doré\r\net les oignons tendres. Servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:08:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11080,5758,'fr','Salade de chorizo ​​et tomates','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. La combinaison de tomates sucrées et acides avec du chorizo ​​salé et épicé et du vinaigre de Xérès piquant est un mariage paradisiaque.','["3 tomates de bœuf mûres, coupées en quartiers","½ oignon rouge, tranché finement","quelques brins de thym, feuilles cueillies","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","100 g de chorizo ​​tranché en diagonale"]','["Mettez les tomates dans un bol avec le\r\noignon et thym. Assaisonner puis arroser\r\navec le vinaigre et l''huile. Laissez les saveurs\r\nmélangez pendant que vous faites cuire le chorizo.","Dans une poêle chaude et sèche, faire revenir les tranches de chorizo\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés des deux côtés. Servir le\r\ntomates au chorizo frit, arrosées\r\navec un peu d''huile de poêle."]','2026-01-11 00:08:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11081,8124,'fr','Gaspacho rapide','Riche en vitamine C, faible en gras et compte pour deux sur cinq par jour : cela devrait être au menu chaque semaine !','["250g en purée","1 poivron rouge épépiné et haché","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de Xérès","jus ½ citron vert"]','["Au mixeur (ou avec un mixeur plongeant), mixez \r\nensemble la passata, le poivron rouge, le piment, l''ail, \r\nvinaigre de Xérès et jus de citron vert jusqu''à consistance lisse. \r\nAssaisonner selon votre goût, puis servir avec des glaçons."]','2026-01-11 00:08:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11082,7122,'fr','Crevettes à la sauce Romesco','De succulentes crevettes tigrées sont relevées de piment et de poivrons dans ce plat de tapas à l''espagnole','["1 poivron rouge, de préférence de type romano à peau longue et fine","3 grosses gousses d''ail","1 gros piment rouge frais","1 grosse tomate mûre","10 noisettes décortiquées","10 amandes blanchies","3 brins de persil","petite tranche de pain d''un jour","8 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","Paquet de 400 g de grosses crevettes tigrées cuites et décortiquées, décongelées si congelées"]','["Préparez-vous à l''avance : coupez le poivron en deux dans le sens de la longueur et retirez les graines et la tige. Tapisser une lèchefrite de papier d''aluminium et déposer les moitiés de poivron, peau vers le haut, sur la lèchefrite avec les gousses d''ail entières, le piment et la tomate. Griller 2 minutes, retourner la tomate, puis griller encore 2 minutes. Retirez la tomate avec une grande cuillère, puis pelez-la, coupez-la en quatre et retirez les graines. Hachez ensuite grossièrement la tomate.","Continuez à griller le poivron, le piment et l''ail pendant 4 à 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les peaux du poivron et du piment soient noircies et que l''ail commence à ramollir (la peau de l''ail commencera à se fendre lorsqu''elle sera prête). Une fois suffisamment refroidi pour être manipulé, épluchez et coupez le piment en deux, puis grattez et jetez les graines. Épluchez le poivron et hachez grossièrement le poivron et le piment.","Étalez les noix sur le papier d''aluminium et faites-les griller jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient grillées. Hachez finement les noix et le persil dans un robot culinaire. Versez dans un petit bol.","Faites chauffer 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez le poivre, l''ail et le piment et faites revenir 3 minutes. Déchirez le pain et ajoutez-le à la poêle en le tournant dans l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré. Passer au robot culinaire les tomates, le sel, le vinaigre et l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient grossièrement hachés. Versez dans un bol. Laisser refroidir et conserver au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 3 jours.","Le jour même, ajoutez les noix et le persil à la sauce et mélangez. Servir dans un petit bol sur une assiette avec les crevettes décortiquées. Fournissez des bâtonnets à cocktail pour harponner les crevettes."]','2026-01-11 00:08:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11083,8128,'fr','Ragoût de pois chiches, chorizo ​​et épinards','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Pour un souper sain et chaud qui demande peu d''effort ou de temps, rien de mieux que ce simple plat dans une seule poêle.','["3-4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 oignon, haché","1 carotte, coupée en petits dés","1 branche de céleri, hachée finement","quelques brins de thym","2 feuilles de laurier","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","200 g de chorizo ​​coupé en dés","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé à chaud","2 boîtes de 410 g de pois chiches, rincés et égouttés","1-2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","Sachet de 400 g de feuilles d''épinards lavées et égouttées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, puis doucement\r\nfaire revenir l''oignon pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence\r\npour ramollir. Incorporer la carotte, le céleri, le thym\r\net des feuilles de laurier. Assaisonner, puis cuire pendant\r\n2-3 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Ajoutez le\r\nail, chorizo, cannelle et fumé\r\npaprika. Faire frire doucement jusqu''à ce que les légumes\r\nramollir et le chorizo commence à se libérer\r\nses huiles et croustillant.","Incorporer les pois chiches, le vinaigre et\r\n150 ml d''eau, puis porter à ébullition pendant\r\n1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pois chiches soient chauds\r\nvers le haut. Ajoutez les épinards, puis remuez dans le\r\npois chiches jusqu''à ce qu''ils se fanent un peu. Supprimer\r\ndu feu, assaisonner selon votre goût, puis\r\nservir chaud avec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:08:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11084,8130,'fr','Calamars croustillants aux câpres','Un soupçon de mayonnaise à l''ail rend tout un peu plus délicieux, et ces calamars croustillants ne font pas exception.','["300 g de petits calamars, nettoyés","200 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres, égouttées et hachées finement","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","5 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","huile végétale ou de tournesol, pour la friture","quartiers de citron, pour servir"]','["Coupez les calamars en rondelles d''environ ½ cm d''épaisseur. Versez la farine dans un sac de congélation et assaisonnez bien. Ajoutez les câpres, puis secouez bien le tout pour bien mélanger. Versez les calamars dans le sac, puis secouez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que tous les anneaux soient bien enrobés. Mélangez l''ail et la mayonnaise, puis placez-les dans un bol de service.","Versez un peu d''huile dans une grande poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne environ 7 cm des côtés, mais la poêle n''est pas remplie à plus d''un tiers. Placer sur feu moyen et laisser l''huile se réchauffer. Pour vérifier que l''huile est prête, placez un petit morceau de pain dans la poêle – il devrait grésiller au contact de l''huile.","Retirez une poignée de calamars de la farine et secouez l''excédent. Plongez doucement dans\r\nl''huile, puis cuire environ 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit croustillante. Retirer avec une écumoire et\r\ndéposer sur du papier absorbant. Répétez avec le calmar restant. Servir aussitôt avec\r\nla mayonnaise et les quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:08:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11085,8132,'fr','Poulet au safran, raisins secs et pignons de pin','Ce plat espagnol savoureux est idéal pour la famille ou pour recevoir des amis en milieu de semaine.','["1¼kg de poulet désossé et désossé (demandez à votre boucher de le faire pour vous ou voir Savoir-faire)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, hachés","3 gousses d''ail, hachées","une bonne pincée de safran (environ 20 brins)","125 ml de verre de sherry sec (comme Fino ou Manzanilla)","200 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym","50g de raisins secs","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin","une poignée de persil plat haché, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu vif\r\net assaisonner le poulet. Ajouter l''huile d''olive\r\nà la poêle, puis le poulet. Marron pour\r\nenviron 5 minutes de chaque côté, retirer sur\r\nune assiette, puis réserver.","Baisser le feu à moyen. Dans le\r\nreste de graisse, faire revenir les oignons pendant\r\n3 minutes, puis ajoutez l''ail et le safran.\r\nCuire encore 3 à 4 minutes. Ajoutez le Xérès,\r\npuis laisser mijoter pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sirupeux.","Remettez les morceaux de cuisse de poulet dans\r\nla poêle, versez le bouillon, le thym et\r\nraisins secs, couvrir, puis cuire doucement à feu doux\r\nchauffer pendant 20 minutes. Ajouter la viande de poitrine\r\net le jus restant dans l''assiette, laisser mijoter\r\npendant 10 minutes de plus jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit\r\net la sauce dans la poêle a réduit.","Pendant que le poulet cuit, faites chauffer le four\r\nà 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Dispersez le pin\r\nnoix sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis rôtir pendant\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et grillés. Une fois\r\nle poulet est bien cuit, assaisonner\r\nau goût, parsemer de pignons de pin et\r\npersil, puis servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:08:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11086,7130,'fr','pommes de terre bravas','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un plat de tapas classique – des cubes de pomme de terre dans une sauce tomate épicée.','["175 g de chorizo​​en tranches","350 g de pommes de terre nouvelles tranchées","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin, 1 épépinée","piment rouge frais tranché","1 gousse d''ail hachée","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées"]','["Coupez le chorizo ​​en tranches et faites-le revenir à sec dans une grande poêle pendant une minute. Ajouter les tranches de pommes de terre nouvelles et cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Ajoutez ensuite les graines de cumin, 1 piment rouge frais épépiné et tranché et la gousse d''ail hachée et laissez cuire 2 minutes. Versez la boîte de tomates hachées et laissez mijoter pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres."]','2026-01-11 00:08:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11087,7132,'fr','Pain espagnol aux tomates et au jambon Serrano','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ces délicieuses tapas sont prêtes en seulement 5 minutes, l''accompagnement parfait pour un apéritif.','["4 tomates mûres, hachées","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","sel","poivre","20 tranches de baguette","5-6 tranches de jambon serrano"]','["Mélangez les tomates concassées, la gousse d''ail, l''huile d''olive, le sel et le poivre. Conserver au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour servir, faites griller 20 tranches de baguette. Versez un peu de garniture aux tomates sur chaque morceau de pain grillé. Déchirez 5 à 6 tranches de jambon serrano en morceaux et mettez-en un morceau sur chaque tranche de pain."]','2026-01-11 00:08:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11088,8138,'fr','Spaghetti aux saveurs espagnoles','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un plat de 10 minutes qui infuse les spaghettis aux saveurs d''Espagne – vous pouvez également en faire une version végétarienne.','["Paquet de 80 g de chorizo ​​tranché","300 g de spaghettis frais","20 g de persil plat (une bonne poignée)","2 poivrons rouges en bocal, en saumure ou dans l''huile","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","50 g de parmesan frais finement râpé, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Mettez une casserole d''eau à feu vif\r\nchauffer à ébullition. Pendant ce temps, coupez le\r\nle chorizo en lamelles avec des ciseaux,\r\net hachez le persil et les poivrons\r\n(vérifiez d''abord les graines égarées).","Quand l''eau bout vivement,\r\najoutez les spaghettis avec un bon\r\nmesure de sel, remuer et remettre dans\r\nl''ébullition. Cuire 3 minutes.","Dans une grande poêle, faites chauffer l''huile,\r\najoutez le chorizo et les poivrons et\r\nbeaucoup de poivre noir. Cuisinez pendant un\r\nminute environ, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien chaud\r\net les jus sont tachés de rouge par\r\nle paprika dans le chorizo. Scoop\r\nune demi-tasse d''eau pour pâtes\r\nla casserole, égouttez le reste et\r\nversez les spaghettis dans la poêle.","Ajoutez le persil et le parmesan,\r\nbien mélanger et arroser les pâtes\r\nde l''eau, pour humidifier. Tour à main supplémentaire\r\nparmesan à table."]','2026-01-11 00:08:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11089,8140,'fr','Thé thaïlandais','Essayez si possible de trouver un authentique mélange de thé thaïlandais pour cette recette. Mélange de thé et de lait concentré et servi avec de la glace, c''est une boisson sucrée et gourmande','["90g de feuilles de thé thaïlandais (nous avons utilisé ChaTraMue)","Boîte de 397 g de lait concentré (ou de lait de coco concentré pour une option végétalienne)","410 g de lait concentré (ou lait d''avoine)","glace, pour servir"]','["Fouettez délicatement le thé en vrac et 1,5 litre d’eau bouillante dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur. Laisser infuser 8 min. Pendant ce temps, placez un tamis sur un grand pichet et tapissez-le de mousseline.","Au bout de 8 minutes, versez délicatement le thé à travers le tamis doublé et pressez-le pour en extraire toute la saveur (il sera chaud, alors soyez prudent). Incorporer les laits concentrés et évaporés, puis réfrigérer 1 heure. Remplissez un pichet de service de glace, versez le thé, puis servez dans de grands verres sur de la glace avec des pailles réutilisables."]','2026-01-11 00:08:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11090,8142,'fr','Salade de pommes râpées à la thaïlandaise','La mangue verte est un élément plus traditionnel des salades thaïlandaises, mais lorsqu''elle n''est pas disponible, les pommes Granny Smith fonctionnent bien comme substitut.','["90g de nouilles de riz (environ 2 nids)","2 grosses carottes, râpées","100 g de mangetout , râpé","petit bouquet d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","25 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir","50 g de cacahuètes grillées, hachées grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir","2 pommes Granny Smith , évidées et coupées en allumettes","100 g de radis finement tranchés","50 g de beurre de cacahuète onctueux","2 citrons verts, zestés et pressés, plus des quartiers supplémentaires pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja ou tamari","1 cuillère à café de gingembre finement râpé"]','["Mettez les nouilles de riz dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, couvrez d''eau bouillante et laissez reposer 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles ramollissent légèrement, puis égouttez-les. Fouetter tous les ingrédients de la vinaigrette ensemble jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Mettez les nouilles cuites, les carottes, le mangetout, les oignons nouveaux, la coriandre, les cacahuètes, les pommes et les radis dans un bol et mélangez avec la vinaigrette jusqu''à ce que le tout soit enrobé. Servir garni de coriandre supplémentaire et d''arachides, avec des quartiers de citron vert en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:08:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11091,8144,'fr','Nouilles ivres (pad kee mao)','Épicées, savoureuses et pleines de punch, ces « nouilles ivres » thaïlandaises sont le fast food ultime, prêtes en seulement 20 minutes.','["200 g de nouilles de riz plates (choisissez des nouilles larges si possible)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile au goût neutre (comme une huile végétale)","3 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","3 piments oiseaux, finement hachés","225 g de steak de surlonge, tranché finement","100 g de brocoli à longues tiges, coupé en morceaux de 3 à 4 cm","une grosse poignée de feuilles de basilic thaï","3½ cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","3½ cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre"]','["Préparez les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les et réservez. Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la sauce dans un petit bol ou un pichet et réservez.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand wok ou une poêle à feu vif et faites revenir l''ail et le piment pendant 20 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent tout juste à dorer. Ajouter le steak et faire sauter pendant 1 minute jusqu''à ce qu''il soit saisi et commence à dorer. Ajoutez le brocoli et faites sauter pendant encore une minute, puis versez les nouilles et ajoutez la sauce. Faire sauter encore 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé et très chaud.","Incorporer le basilic et éteindre le feu. Servir immédiatement pour éviter de trop cuire."]','2026-01-11 00:08:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11092,8146,'fr','Galettes de poisson au saumon à la thaïlandaise avec trempette à la mayonnaise au citron vert','Préparez ces galettes de poisson faciles pour le dîner. Ils constituent également une excellente collation à emporter pour le déjeuner pendant la Pâque juive. Utilisez la meilleure mayonnaise que vous puissiez trouver pour la trempette','["2 boîtes de 220 g de saumon rouge","4 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre fraîche, hachée grossièrement","1 citron vert , zesté et pressé","2 œufs , battus","75 g de pain azyme moyen","1 cuillère à soupe de noix de coco desséchée (facultatif)","1-2 cuillères à soupe d''huile neutre","100 g de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à café de zeste de citron vert râpé (environ 1 citron vert)","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert (environ ½ citron vert)"]','["Égouttez le saumon et écrasez-le dans un bol de taille moyenne. Ajoutez les oignons nouveaux, la coriandre, le zeste et le jus de citron vert, les œufs, la farine de matzo et la noix de coco, le cas échéant. Assaisonner généreusement de sel et de poivre et mélanger jusqu''à obtenir un mélange homogène.","Faites chauffer votre friteuse à air à 180°C. Pendant ce temps, badigeonnez le dessus des croquettes de poisson d''un peu d''huile.","Placez les croquettes de poisson en une seule couche, côté huilé vers le bas, et badigeonnez légèrement l''autre côté de chacune. Si vous ne pouvez pas tous les installer en une seule fois, vous pouvez le faire par lots. Faites frire à l''air libre à 180 °C pendant 8 minutes, puis retournez et faites frire pendant encore 7 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et croustillants.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez la mayonnaise avec le zeste et le jus du citron vert. Goûtez pour l’assaisonnement. Servir les croquettes de poisson chaudes avec la trempette ou à température ambiante. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:08:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11093,8148,'fr','Tempeh pad thaï','Ajoutez du tempeh riche en protéines à ce pad thaï pour un repas familial facile en milieu de semaine. Échangez contre du tofu, du poulet ou des crevettes, si vous le souhaitez','["150 g de nouilles de riz","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","200 g de tempeh, en cubes","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","300 g de germes de soja","3 petits poivrons de couleurs différentes idéalement, tranchés","3 œufs","une poignée de cacahuètes grillées et salées, hachées grossièrement","1 piment rouge tranché, quelques feuilles de coriandre et 1 citron vert coupé en quartiers pour servir (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre de palme ou de cassonade","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tamarin","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à café d''ail finement haché (environ 4 gousses)"]','["Faire tremper les nouilles dans l''eau selon les instructions sur l''emballage. Une fois ramolli, égouttez et réservez.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir le tempeh pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Retirer et réserver dans une assiette.","Dans la même poêle, faites revenir quelques minutes les oignons nouveaux, les germes de soja et les poivrons en veillant à ce que les légumes restent croquants.","Cassez les œufs dans un bol et fouettez légèrement avec une fourchette. Poussez les légumes d''un côté de la poêle, puis versez les œufs. Brouillez délicatement les œufs, puis ajoutez les nouilles et le tempeh. Mélangez le tout jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Dans une autre casserole, mélangez tous les ingrédients de la sauce avec 100 ml d''eau. Cuire à feu moyen en remuant constamment jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve et que la sauce épaississe légèrement. Versez la sauce sur les nouilles et les légumes et mélangez bien pour vous assurer que tous les ingrédients sont uniformément enrobés. Pour servir, saupoudrez de cacahuètes, de tranches de piment rouge et de coriandre, ainsi que de quartiers de citron vert sur le côté pour les presser, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11094,8150,'fr','Sauté de poulet parfumé à la citronnelle et à la noix de coco','Préparez un dîner rapide et sain lors des journées chargées : ce sauté de poulet d''inspiration thaïlandaise en fournit deux sur cinq par jour','["1 bâton de citronnelle, sans la coque extérieure, haché finement (voir astuce ci-dessous)","15 g de gingembre pelé et râpé","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 citron vert, jus","2 cuillères à café de cassonade légère","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère réduite en sel","60 ml d''eau de coco (ou utiliser de l''eau)","1 piment oiseau, finement haché (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 courgette , hachée","2 poitrines de poulet, tranchées finement","200 g de pois mange-tout, parés","15g de noix de coco desséchée","Sachet de 250 g de riz complet au micro-ondes"]','["Mélangez la citronnelle, le gingembre, l''ail, le jus de citron vert, le sucre, la sauce soja, l''eau de coco et le piment, le cas échéant, et réservez. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle awokor à bords hauts à feu vif et faites revenir la courgette et le poulet pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporer les petits pois et la noix de coco et cuire 1 à 2 minutes en remuant bien pour éviter que la noix de coco ne brûle.","Versez le mélange de citronnelle sur le pourtour de la poêle, puis mélangez. Continuez à cuire à feu vif pendant environ 1 à 2 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit et que la sauce ait réduit. Assaisonner au goût. Réchauffez le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis servez-le avec le sauté."]','2026-01-11 00:08:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11095,8152,'fr','Soupe Tom Yum aux crevettes','Savourez une impressionnante soupe tom yum thaïlandaise faite maison, saine et facile à préparer : elle est vibrante, fraîche et pleine de saveur','["200 g d''oignons hachés grossièrement","150 g de tomates hachées grossièrement","20 g de piment rouge tranché","15 g de galanga pelé et tranché","2 tiges de citronnelle, écrasées","270 g de gambas crues entières, décortiquées et déveinées, les têtes enlevées et réservées","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","120 g de pleurotes tranchés","8 feuilles de tilleul","5 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson","5 cuillères à café de jus de citron vert","70 ml de lait de coco thaïlandais","1 cuillère à soupe de confiture de piment thaï (facultatif)","une petite poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement (facultatif)"]','["Versez 1,3 litre d''eau dans une grande casserole à feu vif. Ajouter l''oignon, la tomate, le piment, le galanga, la citronnelle, les têtes de crevettes et le cube de bouillon de poulet. Remuer et porter à ébullition, puis réduire le feu à moyen et laisser mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait réduit.","Filtrez délicatement le bouillon chaud dans un grand bol ou un pichet résistant à la chaleur, puis jetez les têtes de crevettes. Remettez le mélange de légumes et d''herbes égoutté dans la casserole et versez sur le bouillon. Incorporer les champignons et les feuilles de citron vert, puis cuire 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les champignons soient tendres.","Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre, la sauce de poisson, le jus de citron vert, le lait de coco et les crevettes. Porter à ébullition et cuire jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient bien cuites, environ 1 à 2 minutes. Retirer du feu. Retirez la citronnelle, puis incorporez la confiture de piment thaïlandais, le cas échéant. Parsemez de coriandre pour finir, si vous le souhaitez, et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:08:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11096,8154,'fr','Nouilles végétariennes faciles au curry rouge','Essayez nos nouilles végétariennes au curry rouge thaïlandais pour un repas copieux en milieu de semaine chargé de poivrons rouges, de mangetout et de mini-maïs.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","½ pot de 170 g de pâte de curry rouge thaï Blue Dragon","200 ml de lait de coco","1 cuillère à café de cassonade","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché","250 g de petits légumes mélangés (manget-out, mini-maïs, brocoli, etc.), les gros morceaux coupés en deux","100 g de nouilles aux œufs séchées de taille moyenne"]','["Placez une poêle large et profonde ou un wok sur feu moyen et ajoutez l''huile végétale.","Ajoutez la pâte de curry rouge thaï Blue Dragon à l''huile et faites cuire pendant 1 min, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte sente bon. Ajoutez le lait de coco et portez à ébullition. Ajoutez le sucre, puis réduisez le feu et laissez cuire 1 min.","Ajoutez les légumes (si vous utilisez du mangetout, conservez-les) et augmentez le feu à moyen, en cuisant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres mais en gardant une bouchée, environ 6 à 8 minutes. 2 min avant la fin de la cuisson, ajoutez le mangetout.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions du paquet et répartissez-les dans deux bols. Ajoutez quelques légumes dans les bols et nappez de sauce curry."]','2026-01-11 00:08:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11097,8156,'fr','Curry thaï facile de poulet vert et de champignons','Rempli de poulet tendre, de champignons copieux et de légumes frais, ce curry thaïlandais se prépare en un éclair lors des journées chargées','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","½ pot de 170 g de pâte de curry vert thaï Blue Dragon","1 grosse ou 2 petites poitrines de poulet, tranchées","½ oignon rouge , tranché","200 g de champignons de Paris coupés en deux ou en quartiers","200 ml de lait de coco","50 g de mangetout coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur ou 50 g de petits fleurons de brocoli","riz cuit pour servir"]','["Mettez l''huile végétale dans une poêle et faites chauffer à feu vif. Assaisonnez les tranches de poulet avec du sel et faites-les revenir à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste dorées, puis retirez-les de la poêle et réservez. Vous n’avez pas besoin de cuire le poulet jusqu’au bout, il suffit de le rendre bien doré.","Ajoutez la pâte de curry vert Blue Dragon Thai, faites sauter pendant 1 minute puis ajoutez l''oignon et réduisez le feu à moyen. Faire sauter pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit ramolli.","Ajouter les champignons et cuire à feu moyen-vif pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez le lait de coco et portez à ébullition. Baissez le feu puis laissez mijoter à couvert pendant 5 min, ajoutez les lanières de poulet. Cuire encore 3 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit et que la sauce soit très chaude, puis ajouter le mange-tout et cuire 1 minute.","Répartissez le riz cuit dans deux bols. Verser sur le mélange de poulet et de curry pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:08:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11098,5559,'fr','Curry doré de pommes de terre nouvelles et petits pois','Adaptez notre curry de pommes de terre et petits pois à votre goût – vous pouvez par exemple ajouter des crevettes ou des morceaux de lotte quelques minutes en fin de cuisson.','["3 échalotes bananes, pelées et hachées","5 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées","4 piments rouges thaïlandais","Morceau de 5 cm de galanga pelé et haché, ou 1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de galanga","Morceau de gingembre de 5 cm, pelé et finement haché","1 tige de citronnelle, les feuilles extérieures enlevées et les extrémités taillées","2 cuillères à café de poudre de curry moyenne","2 cuillères à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de coriandre","900 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux (voir conseil ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza ou végétale","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson (facultatif)","2 boîtes de 400 g de lait de coco entier","3 feuilles de tilleul","200 g de petits pois frais","2-3 citrons verts, pressés","riz gluant au jasmin, pour servir"]','["Versez les échalotes, l''ail, la moitié des piments, le galanga, le gingembre, la citronnelle et les épices dans un robot culinaire avec 50 ml d''eau et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Faites cuire les pommes de terre nouvelles dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient à peine ramollies, puis égouttez-les.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen, puis versez-y la pâte et faites-la revenir 10 min en remuant régulièrement avec une cuillère en bois. Ajouter les pommes de terre, la sauce de poisson (le cas échéant), le lait de coco et les feuilles de citron vert. Coupez les piments restants en deux et ajoutez-les avec 100 ml d''eau. Portez le mélange à ébullition, couvrez avec un couvercle et laissez cuire 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres mais conservent leur forme. Ajoutez les petits pois et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes.","Assaisonnez au goût avec du sel, du poivre et du jus de citron vert, puis servez le curry sur un bol de riz gluant."]','2026-01-11 00:08:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11099,3904,'fr','Pilons de poulet gluants au citron vert et à la noix de coco','Ces pilons de poulet collants sont parfaits pour un pique-nique ou une fête. Vous pouvez les servir tièdes ou les laisser refroidir avant de les mettre dans un récipient','["400 g de crème de coco en boîte","1-2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry vert thaï (selon le piquant que vous aimez)","1 citron vert, zesté et pressé","3 cuillères à soupe de miel","6 pilons de poulet"]','["Mélangez la crème de coco, la pâte de curry, le zeste et le jus de citron vert et 1 cuillère à soupe de miel dans un grand bol, puis versez un quart de la marinade dans un deuxième bol plus petit et réservez. Ajoutez le poulet dans le grand bol et laissez mariner au moins 2 heures ou réfrigérez jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium. Disposez le poulet sur la plaque et enfournez pendant 30 minutes en retournant le poulet à mi-cuisson.","Mélangez le reste du miel dans le petit bol de marinade réservé. Badigeonnez-en la moitié sur le poulet, puis remettez au four 10 minutes supplémentaires. Retourner le poulet et badigeonner du reste de marinade, puis enfourner encore 10 min. Servir chaud ou laisser refroidir complètement avant de conditionner dans un récipient pour un pique-nique."]','2026-01-11 00:08:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11100,5481,'fr','Salade croustillante de crevettes à la noix de coco et à la mangue','Ajoutez du piquant à votre journée avec cette salade fraîche et fruitée de crevettes croustillantes à la noix de coco et à la mangue. Plein de saveurs et de couleurs, il égayera à coup sûr le déjeuner','["160 g de gambas crues, décortiquées","200 ml de lait de coco","1 gros citron vert, ½ pressé, ½ coupé en quartiers pour servir","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre ou de miel","2 grosses poignées de cresson ou de pousses d''épinards (ou utiliser un mélange)","½ mangue, dénoyautée, pelée et tranchée ou coupée en morceaux","1 petit avocat dénoyauté, pelé et tranché","½ petit oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché finement","½ petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","1 gros piment rouge, épépiné et tranché finement","huile végétale, pour la friture","2 cuillères à soupe de noix de coco desséchée","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs"]','["Passez un couteau bien aiguisé sur le dos de chaque crevette et retirez la ligne grise qui va de la tête à la queue. Fouettez le lait de coco jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis versez-en la moitié dans un bol avec les crevettes. Ajoutez la moitié du jus de citron vert et une pincée de sel, mélangez bien et laissez reposer 15 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le reste du lait de coco avec le reste du jus de citron vert, l''huile de sésame, le sucre ou le miel et une pincée de sel.","Répartir le cresson ou les épinards dans deux assiettes, puis garnir de tranches de mangue, d''avocat et d''oignon rouge, de menthe et de piments tranchés.","Versez 1 à 2 cm d''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen. Mélangez la noix de coco desséchée avec la fécule de maïs et un peu d''assaisonnement. Égoutter les crevettes et incorporer le mélange de farine de maïs pour les enrober, en secouant tout excès.","Déposez une crevette dans l''huile; s’il grésille, ajoutez-en un peu plus, mais ne surchargez pas la poêle. Faire frire 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés, puis transférer dans une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant. Lorsque toutes les crevettes sont frites, répartissez-les sur la salade et arrosez de vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:08:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11101,5365,'fr','Cuisses de poulet au four à la noix de coco et au curcuma','Savourez ces cuisses de poulet cuites au four à la noix de coco et au curcuma avec des légumes verts printaniers et du riz pour un repas familial équilibré sur le plan nutritionnel et riche en saveurs.','["6-8 cuisses de poulet, avec la peau","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de cumin","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","200 ml de lait de coco","1 oignon, finement tranché","250 g de verdure printanière ou d''épinards, hachés grossièrement","1 cuillère à café de sirop d''érable ou de miel","400 g de riz cuit, pour servir"]','["Mettez les cuisses de poulet dans un bol et ajoutez le curcuma, le cumin, l''ail, le gingembre et 3 cuillères à soupe de lait de coco. Frottez la marinade et laissez reposer au moins 15 minutes, ou plus si vous avez le temps.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Répartir l''oignon et la verdure printanière dans une plaque à pâtisserie, ajouter le reste du lait de coco, le sirop d''érable et 150 ml d''eau. Cuire au four pendant 10 minutes en remuant régulièrement pour flétrir les légumes verts. Placez les cuisses de poulet dessus, puis remettez au four pendant 20 minutes en remuant de temps en temps les légumes verts du dessous.","Faites chauffer le gril et laissez cuire encore 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la peau soit croustillante. Servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:08:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11102,8158,'fr','Plateau de cuisson parfumé à la noix de coco, au saumon et aux crevettes','Inspirez-vous des saveurs thaïlandaises avec ce « fakeaway » parfumé à la noix de coco, au saumon et aux crevettes. C’est simplifié grâce à une méthode tout-en-un – et cela fonctionne également avec la morue','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","5 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","2 boîtes de 400 ml de lait de coco","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","3 feuilles de citron vert (facultatif)","4 filets de saumon épais, avec la peau","4 bébés pak choi, coupés en quartiers","150g de mange-tout","150 g de crevettes crues","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement","2-3 citrons verts, coupés en quartiers pour servir","riz au jasmin cuit, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle ou un wok, et faites revenir la pâte de curry, l''ail et le gingembre pendant 1 min. Incorporer le lait de coco et le piment et porter à ébullition. Ajoutez la sauce de poisson et les feuilles de citron vert, si vous en utilisez.","Versez le mélange dans un plat à rôtir moyen et déposez-y le saumon, le pak choi et le mangetout. Couvrir et cuire au four 15 min. Répartir les crevettes et cuire encore 10 minutes. Garnir de coriandre et servir avec les quartiers de citron vert et le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:08:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11103,8160,'fr','Pad thaï au poulet','Savourez notre version du plat de nouilles classique avec des oignons nouveaux, des œufs, des germes de soja et des cacahuètes. Ajoutez du piment selon votre goût et servez avec des quartiers de citron vert.','["150 g de nouilles de riz plates séchées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment rouge, finement haché","2 poitrines de poulet, tranchées finement","½ petit paquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies et tiges finement hachées","60 g d''oignons nouveaux émincés (en réserver pour servir)","2 cuillères à soupe de navet mariné haché (facultatif)","50 ml de bouillon de poulet","100 g de germes de soja","2 œufs","60 g de cacahuètes grillées non salées, hachées","sauce soja, pour servir","piment rouge frais, tranché, pour servir (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tamarin","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","1 citron vert, moitié jus, moitié coupé en quartiers pour servir","½ cuillère à soupe de siracha","pincée de poudre de chili (facultatif)"]','["Faites tremper les nouilles dans de l''eau tiède pendant environ 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente, puis égouttez-les. Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce en mélangeant la pâte de tamarin, la sauce de poisson, le sucre, le citron vert et la siracha jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle ou un wok à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''ail et le piment et faites frire pendant 30 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Versez le poulet et faites cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ajoutez les tiges de coriandre, les oignons nouveaux et le navet (le cas échéant) et faites revenir 1 minute. Ajoutez les nouilles trempées, 50 ml de bouillon de poulet et la sauce préparée. Continuez à faire sauter les nouilles jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à sécher, puis ajoutez la sauce. Mélangez le tout et faites cuire à feu vif pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les nouilles soient à peine cuites. Ajoutez un peu d’eau si nécessaire.","Lorsque la sauce a réduit, répartissez-la sur les germes de soja et incorporez-les aux nouilles. Poussez le tout sur un côté de la poêle, puis versez le reste de l''huile sur le côté vide et cassez les œufs. Faites frire pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le blanc soit à peine pris et commence à devenir croustillant sur les bords, puis mélangez grossièrement les jaunes qui coulent avec les blancs. Lorsque les œufs viennent de prendre, mélangez-les avec les nouilles.","Répartissez la moitié des cacahuètes et mélangez rapidement. Répartir dans deux assiettes avec le reste des cacahuètes et de l''oignon nouveau, les quartiers de citron vert et la sauce soja à part."]','2026-01-11 00:08:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11104,6281,'fr','Nouilles thaïlandaises au tofu vert','Préparez un bol de nouilles vertes thaïlandaises avec du tofu en seulement 30 minutes. Il est faible en calories et contient un équilibre de nutriments pour vous rassasier et vous faire du bien.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","280 g de tofu ferme, coupé en cubes","Sachet de 300 g de légumes sautés","150 g de maïs miniature, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur","150g de mange-tout","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry vert thaï","1-2 piments verts, tranchés finement","250 ml de lait de coco léger","250 g de nouilles fraîches aux œufs","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive ou un wok. Ajoutez le tofu et faites-le frire, en le retournant régulièrement, à feu vif pendant 6 à 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Retirer avec une écumoire et réserver.","Versez les légumes sautés, le maïs et le mangetout dans la poêle et laissez cuire 5 minutes. Incorporer la pâte de curry, le piment, le lait de coco et les nouilles, puis porter à ébullition et cuire 5 minutes. Remettez le tofu dans la poêle. Répartir dans les bols et garnir de ciboule. Servir avec les quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:08:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11105,8162,'fr','Curry rouge thaï avec concombre mariné rapide','Préparez-en trois sur vos 5 par jour avec ce curry rouge thaïlandais végétalien. C''est un plat parfumé et copieux à base de courge musquée, d''un soupçon de piment et de noix de coco crémeuse.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","1 échalote, hachée finement","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaïlandaise végétalienne","400 ml de boisson à la noix de coco Alpro, non sucrée","400 ml de bouillon de légumes végétalien","300 g de courge butternut coupée en cubes de 2 cm","150 g de pommes de terre grelots, coupées en deux","150 g de haricots verts parés","60 g de pousses d''épinards","100 g de haricots edamame décortiqués","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja ou de tamari faible en sodium","2 citrons verts, jus","feuilles de coriandre ou de basilic thaï, pour servir (facultatif)","riz brun cuit, pour servir","1 gros concombre","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","pincée de flocons de piment"]','["Pour faire le concombre mariné, divisez le concombre en deux, retirez le noyau avec une cuillère à café et jetez-le. Coupez les moitiés de concombre en fins demi-cercles, puis mélangez-les dans un bol avec le vinaigre, le piment et une pincée de sel. Laissez mariner pendant que vous préparez le curry.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à frire à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''échalote et faites-la revenir pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre, puis incorporez la pâte de curry et faites cuire pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit parfumée. Versez le lait de coco et le bouillon et portez à ébullition.","Ajouter la courge et les pommes de terre et cuire à découvert pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres et que la sauce ait légèrement réduit et épaissi.","Incorporer les haricots verts, les épinards et les edamames et cuire encore 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Assaisonner avec le jus de soja et de citron vert et saupoudrer de coriandre ou de basilic thaï, le cas échéant. Servir dans des bols sur le riz avec le concombre mariné à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:08:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11106,8164,'fr','Pad thaï de niveau supérieur','Améliorez le pad thaï classique en y ajoutant des gambas et du tofu, des navets marinés et de la pâte de tamarin : un plat pour deux plein de saveurs.','["200 g de nouilles de riz plates séchées","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tamarin","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","1 citron vert, moitié jus, moitié coupé en quartiers pour servir","pincée de poudre de chili (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","100 g de tofu ferme, coupé en dés","200 g de crevettes crues, en papillon","100 g de germes de soja","2 œufs","100 g de cacahuètes grillées salées et hachées","2 oignons nouveaux, émincés","2 cuillères à soupe de navet mariné haché (radis confit)","sauce soja, pour servir"]','["Faire tremper les nouilles dans de l''eau tiède pendant environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies mais avec beaucoup de mordant, puis égouttez-les. Pendant ce temps, mélangez la pâte de tamarin, la sauce de poisson, le sucre et le jus de citron vert jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve. Assaisonnez avec une pincée de poudre de piment si vous l''aimez épicé. Peut être préparé jusqu''à deux semaines à l''avance et conservé au réfrigérateur. Si vous préparez régulièrement du pad thaï, doublez la quantité et gardez-en la moitié.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle et faites cuire le tofu de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ajoutez les crevettes et faites-les revenir jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à devenir roses. Versez les nouilles dans la poêle et arrosez le mélange de tamarin avec environ 5 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Mélangez le tout et faites cuire à feu vif pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les nouilles soient à peine cuites. Ajoutez un peu d’eau si nécessaire.","Lorsque la sauce a réduit, répartissez-la sur les germes de soja et incorporez-les aux nouilles. Poussez le tout sur un côté de la poêle, puis versez le reste de l''huile sur le côté vide et cassez les œufs. Faites frire pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le blanc soit à peine pris et commence à devenir croustillant sur les bords, puis mélangez grossièrement les jaunes qui coulent avec les blancs. Lorsque les œufs viennent de prendre, mélangez-les avec les nouilles.","Répartissez la moitié des cacahuètes, la moitié de l''oignon vert et tous les navets et mélangez rapidement. Répartir dans deux assiettes avec le reste des cacahuètes, l''oignon nouveau, la poudre de chili, les quartiers de citron vert et la sauce soja à part, pour garnir selon vos préférences."]','2026-01-11 00:08:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11107,8166,'fr','Burgers thaïlandais maigres avec chips de patates douces et salsa d''ananas','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un burger de bœuf sain d''inspiration asiatique avec des frites de patates douces et une relish fruitée – une version vibrante d''un classique.','["4 patates douces, non pelées et coupées en grosses chips","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","400-500 g de porc ou de bœuf haché extra maigre","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","6 oignons nouveaux, hachés","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","200 g de morceaux d''ananas coupés en dés","jus ½ citron vert","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce, plus un peu pour tremper les chips","1 laitue Petit Bijou","4 petits pains grillés"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger les chips de patate douce avec l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Rôtir pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant.","Mélangez le hachis avec la pâte de curry, la moitié des oignons nouveaux, la moitié de la coriandre et un peu d''assaisonnement. Façonner 4 burgers.","Mélanger le reste des oignons nouveaux et de la coriandre avec l''ananas, le jus de citron vert, le piment rouge et la sauce chili douce.","Lorsqu''il reste 10 minutes aux chips, faites chauffer une poêle ou une plaque chauffante antiadhésive et faites cuire les burgers pendant 3 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits. Servir les hamburgers dans les petits pains avec les feuilles de laitue et la salsa empilées dessus, les chips de patates douces et une sauce chili supplémentaire pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:08:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11108,8168,'fr','Curry thaï de porc et de cacahuètes','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Utilisez de la pâte de curry rouge piquante et parfumée comme base pour ce plat de curry à la noix de coco avec du maïs doux, de la coriandre et du soja.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges finement hachées, feuilles cueillies","400 g de filet de porc tranché","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","4 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade molle","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","400 ml de lait de coco léger en boîte","Paquet de 175 g de maïs miniature","jus 1 citron vert","riz au jasmin cuit à la vapeur, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole ou une cocotte ignifuge. Ajouter les oignons nouveaux et les tiges de coriandre et cuire 1 min. Ajouter les tranches de porc et cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à dorer.","Incorporer la pâte de curry et le beurre de cacahuète. Après 30 secondes, ajoutez le sucre, le lait de soja et de coco, ainsi que ½ boîte d''eau. Mélangez bien, mettez un couvercle et laissez mijoter 15 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Retirez le couvercle, ajoutez les petits maïs et augmentez le feu. Faire bouillir pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le maïs soit cuit et que la sauce épaississe un peu. Incorporer le jus de citron vert et vérifier l''assaisonnement. Peut maintenant être congelé jusqu''à 2 mois. Pour cuisiner surgelé : décongelez soigneusement, puis faites chauffer dans une poêle sur la plaque de cuisson jusqu''à ce que le curry soit bien chaud. Servir parsemé de feuilles de coriandre et de riz."]','2026-01-11 00:08:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11109,8170,'fr','Nouilles au curry de Chiang Mai (khao soi gai)','Ce curry crémeux et piquant du nord de la Thaïlande, au lait de coco et aux cuisses de poulet juteuses, est garni d''échalotes marinées et de nouilles croustillantes.','["400 ml d''huile végétale, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge ou jaune thaï","2 cuillères à café de curry doux en poudre","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment rouge","400 ml de lait de coco en boîte","150 ml de crème de coco","200 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","jus de 2 citrons verts","500 g de cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","300 g de nouilles chinoises séchées aux œufs (moyennes ou fines)","1 long piment rouge (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant), tranché","3 petites échalotes, coupées en quartiers","150 ml de vinaigre de vin de riz","petit paquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","100 g de germes de soja, parés","3 oignons nouveaux hachés","huile de piment"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le piment et les échalotes marinés : mettez le piment et les échalotes dans un petit bol et versez le vinaigre dessus. Ajoutez un peu de sel et laissez mariner pendant que vous préparez le curry.","Dans une grande casserole, faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale. Ajoutez la pâte de curry et baissez le feu à moyen. Cuire 5 minutes, puis ajouter la poudre de curry et les flocons de piment. Cuire encore 1 min, puis ajouter le lait de coco, la crème de coco, le bouillon, la sauce poisson et le jus de citron vert. Portez à ébullition.","Coupez le poulet en morceaux et ajoutez-le au curry. Cuire 15 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté.","Faites bouillir de l''eau dans une grande casserole pour les nouilles. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l’huile végétale dans un petit wok – elle est prête lorsqu’un petit morceau de pain grésille lorsqu’on y tombe. Ajoutez 75 g de nouilles dans le wok en 4 fois jusqu’à ce qu’elles bouillonnent et deviennent croustillantes. Utilisez une louche en treillis métallique ou une écumoire pour les retirer et égouttez-les sur du papier absorbant.","Faites bouillir le reste des nouilles pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente, puis égouttez-les. Répartissez les nouilles dans 4 bols. Versez le curry sur chacun et garnissez de coriandre, de germes de soja, de piment et d''échalotes marinés égouttés, d''oignons nouveaux et d''un filet d''huile de piment. Garnir de nouilles croustillantes et dévorer pendant qu’elles sont chaudes."]','2026-01-11 00:08:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11110,8172,'fr','Rouleaux de printemps aux pois, feta et quinoa avec nam prik aux tomates rôties','Servez ces canapés végétariens en pâte filo avec du nam prik – une pâte de piment thaïlandais que nous avons mélangée à des tomates rôties au four pour en faire une trempette.','["50g de quinoa","200 g de petits pois surgelés","85 g de fromage feta émietté","petit bouquet de feuilles de menthe, hachées","3 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","6 feuilles de pâte filo (paquet de 270g)","1 œuf battu","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","6 grosses tomates, coupées en deux","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","½ piment rouge, haché","2 cuillères à café de gingembre râpé","½ bouquet de coriandre avec les tiges, hachées grossièrement","¼ bouquet de feuilles de menthe, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tamarin","1 cuillère à café de sucre de palme"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nPour faire le nom prik, placez le\r\ntomates, côté coupé vers le haut, sur une plaque allant au four\r\nfeuille. Arroser d''1 cuillère à soupe d''olive\r\nhuile, assaisonner, puis rôtir 1h30 à 2h\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit à moitié séché. Retirer du four,\r\nlaissez refroidir, puis versez dans un robot culinaire\r\navec le reste des ingrédients et\r\nréduire en purée moyenne.","Cuire le quinoa dans une casserole bouillante\r\neau salée en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.\r\nVersez dans un bol et laissez refroidir.\r\nCuire les petits pois 1 min dans l''eau bouillante,\r\npuis égouttez-le et passez-le sous l''eau froide pendant\r\nquelques minutes. Bien égoutter, verser dans un\r\nrobot culinaire et pulser en un gros morceau\r\npurée. Ajoutez-le au quinoa refroidi\r\navec la feta, la menthe, les oignons nouveaux\r\net le zeste et le jus de citron. Bien mélanger pour\r\nmélanger et assaisonner au goût, en ajoutant\r\nplus de jus de citron si nécessaire.","Déposez une feuille de filo dedans\r\ndevant vous, en gardant le reste\r\nrecouvert d''un torchon humide. Couper\r\nle filo en deux sur toute la largeur pour faire\r\n2 carrés. Avec un coin pointant\r\nvers vous (vous regardez donc un\r\nforme de losange plutôt que de carré),\r\nverser 2 cuillères à soupe de garniture juste en dessous du\r\nligne centrale et façonner en bûche. Brosse\r\nles bords de la pâte avec l''œuf, puis incorporez-les\r\nles 2 coins latéraux. Garder ses doigts\r\nsur les coins, ramener le coin inférieur\r\nsur la garniture vers le centre,\r\npuis enroulez-le fermement vers le coin supérieur.\r\nIl est important de rouler le plus serré possible,\r\npour que les rouleaux de printemps cuisent uniformément. Répéter\r\navec les feuilles de filo restantes et la garniture.","Faites chauffer environ 3 cm d''huile de tournesol dans une grande\r\npoêle ou au wok et faire revenir les rouleaux de printemps, dans\r\npar lots, pendant 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés\r\nmarron. Retirer avec une écumoire\r\net égouttez-les sur du papier absorbant. Transfert\r\nles rouleaux de printemps dans une assiette et servir\r\navec le nom prik."]','2026-01-11 00:09:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11111,8174,'fr','Salade thaïe de poulet haché','Connu sous le nom de larb gai en Thaïlande, le piquant piquant de cette recette de salade de poulet se marie très bien avec les légumes croquants, créant un équilibre parfait entre saveur et piquant.','["2 citronnelles","4 feuilles de tilleul, tiges enlevées","2 piments rouges épépinés","3 gousses d''ail","morceau de gingembre frais de la longueur du bout du doigt","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment","50 ml de sauce de poisson","1 oignon rouge, haché","3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert","une poignée de feuilles de menthe, de basilic et de coriandre, hachées grossièrement","3 laitues Baby Gem, feuilles séparées","1 concombre épépiné et coupé en lanières dans le sens de la longueur","200 g de germes de soja","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Hachez grossièrement la citronnelle, les feuilles de tilleul,\r\npiments rouges, ail et gingembre, puis jetez\r\nmettez-les tous dans un processeur et mixez-les jusqu''à ce que\r\nle tout est haché très finement.\r\nHachez les poitrines de poulet en petits morceaux.","Faites chauffer un wok à feu vif et ajoutez-y le\r\nl''huile végétale et l''huile de sésame. Jeter\r\nle mélange de citronnelle et faire revenir brièvement avant\r\najouter le poulet haché et le piment\r\npoudre. Faites sauter le poulet pendant 4 minutes puis\r\najouter la sauce de poisson. Baissez le feu\r\nun peu et laissez la sauce poulet et poisson\r\nbouillonner ensemble pendant encore 4 minutes,\r\nen remuant, puis ajoutez l''oignon rouge haché\r\net laissez cuire encore min.","Retirer du feu, verser dessus le citron vert\r\njus et incorporer les herbes. Servir avec le\r\ndes légumes à salade et un quartier de citron vert à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:09:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11112,8177,'fr','Salade thaïe de nouilles de riz','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Cette salade est pleine de saveur et est également saine, car elle est servie avec une vinaigrette sans huile.','["½ paquet de 250 g de nouilles de riz vermicelles fines","200 g de germes de soja","le zeste et le jus de 2 citrons verts","2-3 cuillères à soupe de poisson ou de sauce soja, au goût","1 cuillère à café de sucre muscovado ou de cassonade molle","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et émincé","2 cœurs de laitue Little Gem, feuilles séparées et grossièrement déchirées","500 g de porc haché","petite noix de gingembre râpé","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à café d''huile","4 steaks le surloge les 175 g","1 piment rouge épépiné et râpé"]','["Placez les nouilles et les germes de soja dans un\r\nbol résistant à la chaleur et couvrir d’eau bouillante.\r\nLaisser reposer 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les nouilles soient\r\ntendre. Égoutter, puis laisser refroidir à froid\r\narroser et égoutter à nouveau. Retournez dans le bol.","Mélanger le zeste et le jus de citron vert, le poisson\r\nou sauce soja et sucre. Incorporer aux nouilles\r\navec l''oignon rouge et la laitue.","Pour réaliser avec du hachis, faire chauffer un peu\r\nhuile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faire sauter 500g\r\nporc haché, une petite noix de gingembre râpé\r\net une pincée de poivre de Cayenne ou de poudre de piment\r\npendant 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le hachis soit doré et\r\nbien cuit. Mélanger aux nouilles, diviser\r\nentre quatre bols et servir chaud.","Pour accompagner un steak, préparez la salade de nouilles de riz. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café\r\nhuile de tournesol dans une poêle. Astuce 2 cuillères à soupe de sésame\r\ngraines dans une assiette. Frotter 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans 4 x 175 g\r\nsteaks de surlonge et presser les graines de sésame. Frire\r\npendant 5 minutes pour une cuisson mi-saignante, en retournant à mi-cuisson.\r\nLaisser reposer 5 min, puis trancher finement. Lancer 1\r\npiment rouge épépiné et râpé, et une poignée\r\nfeuilles de menthe en nouilles. Garnir de steak pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11113,8179,'fr','Pad thaï facile','Presque un plat national de la Thaïlande, la version simplifiée de Mary Cadogan facilite son achat et sa dégustation très authentique.','["125 g (un demi-paquet de 250 g) de nouilles de riz","3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert environ 2 citrons verts","½ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","2 cuillères à café de sucre muscovado léger","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson (nam pla)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","200 g de crevettes tigrées cuites et décortiquées, avec la queue laissée","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","140 g de germes de soja","25 g de cacahuètes salées finement hachées","une petite poignée de feuilles de coriandre","1 ou 2 citrons verts, coupés en quartiers","sauce chili douce"]','["Mettez les nouilles dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur, versez dessus de l''eau bouillante et laissez reposer 4 minutes, puis égouttez-les et rafraîchissez-les sous l''eau froide courante.","Mettez le jus de citron vert, le poivre de Cayenne, le sucre et la sauce de poisson dans un bol et mélangez bien. Préparez tous les autres ingrédients près de la cuisinière.","Faites chauffer l''huile et faites frire les crevettes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien chaudes. Ajoutez les oignons nouveaux et les nouilles et mélangez. Versez le mélange de jus de citron vert, puis incorporez les germes de soja et la moitié des cacahuètes et de la coriandre. Cuire 1 minute jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien chaud.","Empilez dans un grand plat, parsemez du reste des cacahuètes et de la coriandre et servez avec des quartiers de citron vert et une sauce chili douce."]','2026-01-11 00:09:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11114,8181,'fr','Salade thaïlandaise de poulet effiloché et de haricots d''Espagne','Cette salade faible en gras mais satisfaisante regorge de saveurs asiatiques authentiques et ajoutera beaucoup de piquant à vos repas en plein air.','["200 g de haricots verts (ou tout autre haricot vert), garnis et équeutés","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux et finement tranché, utilisez un piment oiseau pour plus de piquant","2 échalotes, finement tranchées","1 citronnelle, tranchée finement","2 cm de gingembre râpé","2 poitrines de poulet cuites sans peau","petit bouquet de feuilles de menthe","gros bouquet de basilic thaï ou de coriandre","1 citron vert coupé en quartiers ou en joues, pour servir","riz au jasmin cuit à la vapeur, pour servir","100 ml de crème de coco","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à café de sucre","jus 1 citron vert","1 piment oiseau, finement coupé"]','["Passez un éplucheur de pommes de terre de chaque côté de\r\nles haricots pour enlever les morceaux filandreux. Couper\r\nen lanières à l''aide d''un coupe-haricots, ou sur le\r\ndiagonale en morceaux de 2 cm. Cuire les haricots\r\ndans de l''eau frémissante salée pendant 4 min ou\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres mais toujours vert vif. Vidanger\r\net mettre dans un bol avec le piment, les échalotes,\r\ncitronnelle et gingembre. Tirez le poulet\r\nseins en lambeaux avec vos doigts\r\net ajoutez-le au bol.","Préparez la vinaigrette. Mélangez la noix de coco\r\navec l''ail, la sauce de poisson, le sucre, le citron vert\r\net du piment. Arrachez la menthe et le basilic thaï\r\nsur le poulet et mélangez le tout\r\nensemble. Empiler dans une assiette et verser dessus\r\nle pansement. Servir avec le citron vert pour\r\npresser dessus et riz au jasmin."]','2026-01-11 00:09:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11115,8184,'fr','Pad Thaï aux crevettes','Ce sauté de nouilles udon a une sauce aux arachides et au tamarin – il est sur la table en seulement 20 minutes','["250 g de nouilles udon","2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","100 g de crevettes crues décortiquées","4 oignons nouveaux, hachés","2 oeufs, battus","2 cuillères à soupe de cacahuètes grillées, hachées","une petite poignée de feuilles de coriandre","quartiers de lime, pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tamarin","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","jus 1 citron vert","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade molle"]','["Faire bouillir les nouilles dans de l''eau salée pendant\r\n3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Égoutter et rincer à froid\r\nl''eau. Pour faire la sauce, mélangez tout\r\ningrédients ensemble dans un petit bol.","Faites chauffer un wok avec la moitié de l''huile. Ajoutez le\r\ncrevettes et oignons nouveaux, et faites cuire,\r\nen remuant rapidement, pendant 1 min ou jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles crevettes deviennent roses. Poussez sur le côté et\r\najouter le reste de l''huile. Ajoutez l''oeuf et\r\nlaisser reposer 30 secondes, puis brouiller jusqu''à ce que\r\ncuit. Ajouter les nouilles et la sauce, et\r\ncuire en remuant continuellement pendant 3 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce que tout soit chaud.","Servir les nouilles avec les cacahuètes\r\net de la coriandre saupoudrée dessus, et\r\nquartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11116,8186,'fr','Le relooking ultime : curry de poulet vert thaï','Ce curry normalement très riche peut être transformé en un curry plus sain mais toujours crémeux.','["20 g de coriandre en bouquet, tiges et feuilles séparées","2 échalotes, hachées finement","1 citronnelle, hachée finement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cm de gingembre frais, finement haché","3 petits piments verts forts, finement hachés (y compris les graines)","1 gros piment vert doux à moyen, haché finement (y compris les graines)","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu et de coriandre","¼ cuillère à café de poivre noir","1 cuillère à café de feuilles de combava lyophilisées émiettées","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert","1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","400 ml/14 fl oz peuvent contenir du lait de coco allégé","3 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau (450 g/1 lb de poids total), coupées en bouchées","2 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson","½ cuillère à café de sucre de palme granulé ou de sucre muscovado léger","4 feuilles de tilleul lyophilisées","100 g de mange tout tranché finement dans le sens de la longueur","100 g de haricots verts coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur","2 oignons nouveaux, finement émincés","250 g de riz parfumé thaïlandais, cuit","quartiers de citron vert"]','["Pour la pâte de curry, hachez finement le\r\ntiges de coriandre et mettez-les dans un mini\r\nmixeur ou petit robot culinaire\r\navec les échalotes, la citronnelle, l''ail et\r\ngingembre. Pulser jusqu''à ce qu''il soit aussi lisse que possible\r\nobtenez-le. Ajouter les piments, le basilic, les trois quarts\r\ndes feuilles de coriandre, le\r\ncumin moulu, coriandre, poivre, citron vert\r\nles feuilles et le jus de citron vert, puis pulser à nouveau.\r\nIncorporer l’huile et réserver. Vous ferez seulement\r\nutiliser la moitié de cette pâte, le reste peut\r\nêtre réfrigéré pendant quelques jours ou congelé\r\npendant un mois maximum.","Pour le curry, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive\r\nwok ou une sauteuse, incorporer la moitié du\r\npâte de curry, puis faire revenir 1 min. Secouer\r\nle lait de coco dans sa canette, ouvrez, puis\r\nverser les deux tiers dans la poêle. Laisse-le bouillonner\r\nlaisser reposer 4 à 5 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps,\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit réduit et légèrement épaissi.","Versez le poulet, puis faites-le sauter pendant\r\n1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il ne soit plus rose. Incorporer le\r\nla sauce de poisson et le sucre, puis versez le\r\nreste du lait de coco pour fluidifier,\r\nsauce crémeuse. Baissez le feu, ajoutez le\r\nfeuilles de tilleul, puis laisser mijoter 5 minutes pour\r\nterminer délicatement la cuisson du poulet. Peut être\r\ncongelé à ce stade pendant 1 mois maximum.","Pendant que le poulet mijote, faites cuire à la vapeur\r\nmangetout et haricots pour quelques\r\nminutes. Servir le curry dans des bols avec un peu\r\nde légumes empilés dessus (servir le reste\r\nséparément) avec les oignons nouveaux\r\net le reste des feuilles de coriandre.\r\nServir avec un bol de riz parfumé thaï\r\net des quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11117,8188,'fr','Plateau de poulet thaïlandais pané à la noix de coco','Poulet pané contrasté avec courge, tomates et aubergines parfumées à la pâte de curry rouge thaïlandais épicée','["1 courge musquée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en cubes","1 grosse aubergine, coupée en cubes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","3 cuillères à soupe de noix de coco desséchée","4 cuillères à soupe de chapelure fraîche","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","1 œuf battu","300 g de tomates cerises","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées grossièrement","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDans un grand plat à rôtir peu profond, mélanger le\r\ncourge et aubergine dans l''huile, puis\r\nassaisonner et étaler en une seule couche.\r\nRôtir pendant 30 minutes en retournant une fois.","Dans une assiette, mélangez la noix de coco et\r\nchapelure avec un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nTrempez les blancs de poulet dans l''œuf, puis\r\npresser les miettes pour les enrober, en secouant\r\nde tout excédent.","Mélangez les tomates et la pâte de curry\r\navec les légumes rôtis et donne tout\r\nune bonne agitation. Nestlé les poitrines de poulet\r\ndans les légumes et remettez au four pendant\r\nencore 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet\r\nest bien cuit, en secouant la poêle une fois\r\nou deux fois. Saupoudrer de coriandre et\r\nservir avec des quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11118,4979,'fr','Sauté thaï de crevettes, gingembre et oignons nouveaux','Ce sauté a une touche épicée bienvenue. Une fois la pâte préparée, la cuisson ne prend que 10 minutes','["200 g de crevettes tigrées crues et décortiquées provenant d''une source durable","1 piment vert thaïlandais, haché","3 gousses d''ail, 1 écrasée et 2 finement tranchées","1 bouquet de coriandre, feuilles et tiges séparées","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","jus 1 citron vert","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","Morceau de 3 cm de gingembre, finement tranché puis râpé","8 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 poivron rouge, tranché finement","85 g de châtaignes d''eau tranchées","100 g de germes de soja","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","nouilles aux œufs ou au riz, pour servir","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Mettez les crevettes dans un bol. Mettez le piment,\r\nail écrasé, tiges de coriandre (coupée\r\nposez-les d''abord à l''aide de ciseaux) et d''une roulette\r\nsucre dans un moulin à épices ou petit aliment\r\nprocesseur et fouettez ensemble. Ajouter la moitié\r\ndu jus de citron vert et de la sauce de poisson, puis\r\nversez-le sur les crevettes.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un wok, ajoutez le gingembre\r\net les oignons nouveaux et faire revenir 1 min. Ajouter\r\nle poivron rouge et faire revenir 1 min, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle poivre commence à ramollir. Ajouter l''eau\r\nchâtaignes et germes de soja, et mélanger\r\nensemble jusqu''à ce que les germes de soja commencent à\r\nse flétrir. Ajoutez la sauce soja et un très bon\r\nmoudre du poivre noir, puis verser le tout dans\r\nun plat de service.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans le wok et\r\najoutez les crevettes en les sortant de leur\r\njus. Remuer pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils tournent\r\nrose, ajoutez la marinade et faites tourner le wok\r\nrapidement, puis versez le tout sur les légumes. Couper\r\nsur les feuilles de coriandre et saupoudrer\r\nle reste du citron vert. Servi sur des nouilles\r\navec du citron vert supplémentaire pour presser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11119,8190,'fr','Nouilles thaïlandaises au saumon','Ce plat rapide, parfumé et copieux est exactement ce dont vous avez besoin après une dure journée de travail','["200 g de nouilles aux œufs ou au riz","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","2-3 cuillères à café de pâte de curry rouge thaïlandaise","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés","1 patate douce, en cubes","200 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet","100 ml de lait écrémé","2 filets de saumon sans peau, coupés en deux puis en fines lanières","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Cuire les nouilles en suivant le paquet\r\ninstructions, rincez et égouttez. Chauffer l''huile\r\ndans une casserole profonde et faire revenir le curry\r\ncoller pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé. Ajoutez le\r\noignons nouveaux, en réservant 1 cuillère à soupe, le\r\npatate douce, bouillon et lait, apporter\r\nporter à ébullition rapidement et laisser mijoter 5 mn\r\njusqu''à ce que la pomme de terre soit tendre. Ajouter le saumon\r\nmorceaux et cuire 2 minutes, puis incorporer\r\nla moitié de la coriandre.","Répartissez les nouilles dans 4 bols\r\net verser sur le saumon et la sauce.\r\nSaupoudrer du reste de coriandre\r\net oignons nouveaux."]','2026-01-11 00:09:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11120,6736,'fr','Colis de poulet et patates douces à la thaïlandaise','Un plat de poulet individuel enveloppé de papier sulfurisé, parfumé d''épices asiatiques et de noix de coco crémeuse','["25 g de crème de noix de coco (en bloc)","2 cuillères à café de cassonade molle","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","2 cuillères à café de pâte de curry vert thaï","½ patate douce, pelée et coupée en petits cubes","1 petit poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en petits cubes","1 poitrine de poulet sans peau","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre et quelques quartiers de citron vert, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDissoudre la crème de coco\r\navec 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante et mélanger\r\nen une pâte lisse. Incorporer le\r\nsucre, sauce de poisson et pâte de curry.","Disposez un gros morceau de pâtisserie\r\npapier sulfurisé sur une plaque à pâtisserie.\r\nDisposez la patate douce et\r\npoivrer au milieu du papier,\r\ndégager un espace au centre. Disposez la poitrine de poulet dans l''espace\r\net verser sur la sauce. Replier\r\nles bords supérieurs du parchemin pour\r\nformez un sceau et froissez le\r\nse termine comme un emballage de bonbon.","Cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit\r\nà travers et les légumes sont\r\ntendre. Asseyez le colis lors d''un dîner\r\nassiette ou un bol peu profond et soigneusement\r\nouvert. Saupoudrer de coriandre\r\net pressez un peu de citron vert\r\njus, au goût."]','2026-01-11 00:09:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11121,6638,'fr','Sauté de bœuf thaï','Une liste de courses simple et ultra rapide à préparer, le parfait repas d''après travail','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","400 g de lanières de bœuf ou steak coupé en fines lanières","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","une poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Faites chauffer un wok ou une grande poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il fume \r\nchaud. Versez l''huile et faites tourner autour de la poêle, \r\npuis ajoutez les lanières de bœuf et le piment. Cuisinier, \r\nen remuant tout le temps, jusqu''à ce que la viande soit légèrement \r\ndoré, environ 3 minutes, puis verser dessus \r\nla sauce aux huîtres. Cuire jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien chaud \r\net la sauce enrobe la viande. incorporer le \r\nfeuilles de basilic et servir avec du riz nature."]','2026-01-11 00:09:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11122,8192,'fr','Bouillon de poisson à la thaïlandaise avec légumes verts','Une soupe de nouilles façon ramen avec de la goberge durable, des crevettes et des légumes sains – un bol faible en gras et en calories','["100 g de nouilles de riz brun","500 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de poisson","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","4 feuilles de combava séchées ou fraîches","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","200 g de poisson blanc durable sans peau, comme le lieu jaune","100 g de crevettes crues","2 pak choi, feuilles séparées","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre"]','["Cuire les nouilles suivant le pack\r\ninstructions. Rafraîchir à l''eau froide\r\net bien égoutter.","Mettez le bouillon dans une grande casserole et\r\nincorporer la pâte de curry, les feuilles de citron vert, le poisson\r\nsauce et 250 ml d''eau froide. Apporter à\r\nlaissez mijoter et laissez cuire 5 min.","Coupez le poisson en cubes d''environ 3 cm\r\net ajouter à la poêle. Remettre à ébullition,\r\npuis laissez cuire 2 minutes à découvert.","Incorporer les nouilles, les crevettes et le pak\r\nchoi et laisser mijoter pendant 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nle poisson et les crevettes sont juste cuits.\r\nServir dans des bols parsemés de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:09:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11123,8194,'fr','Bouillon thaï à la noix de coco et aux légumes','Goûtez à la cuisine thaïlandaise avec cette soupe de nouilles rapide et facile cuite dans une seule poêle.','["1½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","1l de bouillon de légumes","400 ml de lait de coco demi-écrémé en boîte","2 cuillères à café de cassonade","175 g de nouilles aux œufs moyennes","2 carottes, coupées en allumettes","½ tête de feuille de Chine, tranchée","½ sachet de 300 g de germes de soja","6 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","jus 1 citron vert","3 oignons nouveaux, coupés en deux puis finement tranchés dans le sens de la longueur","une poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Mettez la pâte de curry dans un grand\r\nune casserole ou un wok avec l''huile. Frire\r\npendant 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé. Astuce dans le\r\nbouillon de légumes, lait de coco et\r\ncassonade. Laisser mijoter 3 mn.","Ajouter les nouilles, les carottes et\r\nFeuille chinoise et laisser mijoter pendant\r\n4 à 6 minutes, jusqu''à ce que tout soit tendre. Mélanger\r\ndans les germes de soja et les tomates. Ajouter\r\njus de citron vert au goût et un peu en supplément\r\nassaisonnement, si vous le souhaitez. Verser dans\r\nbols et saupoudrer de printemps\r\noignons et coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:09:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11124,6565,'fr','Curry de crevettes thaï facile','Plat parfait du vendredi soir, un curry de crevettes réchauffant et faible en gras prêt en seulement 20 minutes','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, haché","1 cuillère à café de gingembre frais","1-2 cuillères à café de pâte de curry rouge thaïlandais (nous avons utilisé celle de Sharwood)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","50 g de crème de coco en sachet","400 g de crevettes crues surgelées","coriandre hachée, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne. Astuce  \r\ndans l''oignon et le gingembre, puis cuire quelques instants \r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer la pâte de curry, \r\npuis laissez cuire encore 1 min. Verser sur le \r\ntomates concassées et crème de coco.  \r\nPortez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter pendant  \r\n5 minutes en ajoutant un peu d''eau bouillante si le \r\nle mélange devient trop épais.","Ajoutez les crevettes, puis laissez cuire 5 à 10 minutes. \r\nplus, selon leur taille. \r\nServir avec du riz nature et saupoudrer \r\navec un peu de coriandre hachée, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11125,6046,'fr','Soupe thaïlandaise à la courge','Augmentez votre consommation de légumes avec cette soupe de citrouille parfumée aux saveurs asiatiques','["1 oignon, haché","1 tige de citronnelle, écrasée et râpée","1-2 piments rouges, hachés grossièrement","1 kg de courge butternut, pelée et coupée en dés","jus 1 citron vert","125 ml de lait de coco","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Faire revenir l''oignon, la citronnelle et la majeure partie\r\nle piment dans une grande poêle avec un peu de\r\neau pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie – ajouter\r\nplus d''eau si elle commence à prendre. Astuce dans le\r\nécraser et remuer. Couvrir d''1 litre d''eau,\r\nporter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 15 mn\r\njusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre. Ajouter le jus de citron vert,\r\nretirer du feu et mélanger avec un\r\nmélangeur à main jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Versez le lait de coco, assaisonnez, puis\r\nremettre sur le feu pour réchauffer doucement.\r\nVerser dans des bols et servir avec de la coriandre\r\net le piment restant."]','2026-01-11 00:09:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11126,6839,'fr','Galettes de dinde aux épices thaïlandaises avec salade de nouilles','Régalez-vous avec ce plat thaïlandais faible en gras et sain après une dure journée de travail, c''est rapide et facile à préparer','["400 g de poitrine ou de filet de dinde haché grossièrement","1 tige de citronnelle, hachée finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja faible en sodium","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","2 nids de nouilles de blé moyennes","Paquet de 300 g de légumes sautés de poivrons mélangés","sauce chili douce, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen. Mettez le\r\ndinde dans un robot culinaire et pulser\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit haché. Ajoutez la citronnelle,\r\nl''ail et le zeste de citron vert, et la moitié du soja\r\nsauce, coriandre et piment, puis pulser\r\nencore une fois jusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné. Versez le mélange dans\r\nun bol et ajoutez un peu de poivre noir.\r\nFaçonner 8 galettes, puis transférer dans\r\nune plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive et un grill pour 3-4 personnes\r\nminutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites.","Pendant ce temps, faites tremper les nouilles suivantes\r\nemballer les instructions, puis égoutter et ajouter\r\nles légumes, le reste de sauce soja\r\net le jus de citron vert. Bien mélanger, diviser\r\nentre les assiettes et saupoudrer de\r\nle reste de coriandre et de piment. Servir avec\r\nles galettes de dinde et du piment doux\r\nsauce pour tremper, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11127,8196,'fr','Curry de poulet vert thaï','Faire votre propre pâte de curry parfumée demande des ingrédients asiatiques spéciaux et un peu de temps, mais vous goûterez la différence.','["225 g de pommes de terre nouvelles coupées en morceaux","100 g de haricots verts parés et coupés en deux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à soupe bombée ou 4 cuillères à café de pâte de curry vert thaïlandais (vous ne pouvez pas mettre la cuillère à soupe dans certains pots)","400 ml de lait de coco en boîte","2 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson thaïlandaise","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","450 g de poulet désossé et sans peau (poitrines ou cuisses), coupé en bouchées","2 feuilles de combava fraîches finement râpées, ou 3 larges lanières de zeste de citron vert, plus un peu pour garnir","une bonne poignée de feuilles de basilic","riz bouilli, pour servir"]','["Mettez les pommes de terre dans une poêle de\r\nl''eau bouillante et cuire pendant\r\n5 minutes. Jetez les haricots\r\net laissez cuire encore 3\r\nminutes, moment auquel les deux\r\ndevrait être juste tendre mais pas trop\r\ndoux. Égoutter et mettre de côté.","Dans un wok ou une grande poêle,\r\nfaites chauffer l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude, puis\r\ndéposer l''ail et cuire jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré, cela ne devrait prendre qu''un\r\nquelques secondes. Ne le laisse pas aller très\r\nsombre, sinon cela gâcherait le goût.\r\nVerser la pâte de curry et\r\nremuez-le pendant quelques secondes\r\ncommencer à cuire les épices et\r\nlibérer toutes les saveurs. Ensuite,\r\nverser le lait de coco et laisser\r\nça arrive à une bulle.","Incorporer la sauce de poisson et\r\nsucre, puis les morceaux de\r\npoulet. Baissez le feu à un\r\nlaisser mijoter et cuire à couvert pendant\r\nenviron 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle poulet est cuit.","Ajoutez les pommes de terre et les haricots\r\net laissez-les se réchauffer dedans\r\nle lait de coco chaud, puis ajoutez un\r\nbelle saveur d''agrumes par\r\nen remuant avec le citron vert râpé\r\nfeuilles (ou zeste de citron vert). Le basilic\r\nles feuilles entrent ensuite, mais partent seulement\r\nles mettre brièvement sur le feu ou ils\r\nperdront rapidement leur\r\nluminosité. Dispersez-vous avec le\r\ngarnir de citron vert et servir\r\nimmédiatement avec du riz bouilli."]','2026-01-11 00:09:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11128,8198,'fr','Pad Thaï ultra-rapide','Ce plat thaïlandais classique de la lectrice de Good Food Emily Cramer est préparé principalement à partir d''ingrédients du commerce, et il est sur la table en moins de 15 minutes.','["200 g de nouilles de riz","140 g de petits pois surgelés","200 g de crevettes surgelées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","100 g de germes de soja","petit bouquet d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","2 oeufs battus","3 cuillères à soupe de cacahuètes grillées","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles seulement"]','["Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition, ajoutez le\r\nnouilles et cuire 3 minutes en ajoutant le\r\npetits pois et crevettes pour la dernière minute. Égoutter,\r\net réservez pendant que vous faites chauffer l''huile dans un\r\ngrande poêle à frire.","Faire frire les nouilles, les crevettes,\r\npetits pois, germes de soja et oignons nouveaux,\r\nmélanger pour bien enrober d''huile pendant quelques minutes.\r\nPoussez le tout d''un côté de la poêle\r\net versez l''œuf. Remuer jusqu''à cuisson,\r\npuis mélangez bien le tout. Passer à travers\r\nles cacahuètes, la sauce soja et le chili doux\r\ndonc tout est combiné. Disperser avec\r\nla coriandre et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11129,6459,'fr','Poisson cuit à la vapeur à la thaïlandaise','Servir avec du riz au jasmin thaïlandais pour un repas savoureux et faible en gras','["2 filets de truite pesant chacun environ 140 g/5 oz","une petite noix de racine de gingembre fraîche, pelée et hachée","1 petite gousse d''ail, hachée","1 petit piment rouge (pas d''oeil d''oiseau), épépiné et finement haché","le zeste râpé et le jus d''1 citron vert","3 bébés pak choi, chacun coupé en quartiers dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja"]','["Nestlé le côté des filets de poisson\r\ncôte à côte sur un grand carré de papier aluminium\r\net parsemez le gingembre, l''ail,\r\ndu piment et du zeste de citron vert dessus.\r\nVersez dessus le jus de citron vert et\r\npuis dispersez les morceaux de pak choi\r\nautour et au-dessus du poisson.\r\nVersez la sauce soja dessus\r\nle pak choi et scellez sans serrer le\r\npapier d''aluminium pour faire un paquet, fabrication\r\nassurez-vous de laisser de l''espace à\r\nle dessus pour que la vapeur circule\r\npendant la cuisson du poisson.","Cuire à la vapeur pendant 15 minutes. (Si vous n’avez pas de cuiseur vapeur, mettez le\r\ncolis sur une plaque résistante à la chaleur au-dessus d''un\r\nune casserole d''eau frémissante doucement,\r\ncouvrir avec un couvercle et cuire à la vapeur.)"]','2026-01-11 00:09:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11130,8200,'fr','Brochettes de poulet au curry rouge','Le poulet et les brochettes sont deux de nos choix les plus populaires, donc cette ancienne star de la couverture est un véritable gagnant – pour les barbecues ou le grill','["2 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en gros morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","2 cuillères à soupe de lait de coco","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en morceaux","1 courgette, coupée en deux et coupée en morceaux","1 oignon rouge, coupé en gros quartiers","1 citron vert, coupé en deux, pour servir"]','["Allumez le barbecue ou faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif. Versez le poulet, la pâte de curry et le lait de coco dans un bol, puis mélangez bien jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit uniformément enrobé. Enfiler les légumes et le poulet sur les brochettes. Cuire les brochettes \r\nsur le barbecue ou la plaque chauffante pendant 5 à 8 minutes, en les retournant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit et carbonisé. Servir avec du riz aux herbes, de la salade et un demi citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11131,8202,'fr','Riz frit thaï aux crevettes et petits pois','Semblable au pad thaï mais avec du riz brun meilleur pour la santé, ce pot de crustacés asiatiques avec œuf, coriandre et petits pois est copieux et frais','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 piment rouge, tranché","250 g de grosses crevettes crues décortiquées","300 g de riz brun cuit (environ 140 g de riz cru)","75 g de petits pois surgelés","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja noire","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement, plus quelques feuilles pour servir","4 gros œufs","sauce chili, pour servir (facultatif - nous avons utilisé de la sriracha)"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un wok,\r\najouter l''oignon, l''ail et le piment,\r\net cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.\r\nAjouter les crevettes et cuire pendant\r\n1 minute. Versez le riz et les petits pois,\r\net continuez à remuer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud.\r\nAjoutez la sauce soja et poisson, puis\r\nincorporer la coriandre hachée.\r\nGardez au chaud pendant que vous faites frire les œufs.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle\r\npoêler et faire revenir les œufs avec un peu\r\nassaisonnement. Divisez le riz frit\r\nmélanger entre 4 bols et dessus\r\nchacun avec un œuf au plat. Servir\r\nparsemé de coriandre, avec\r\nsauce chili, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11132,8204,'fr','Curry de boeuf thaï','Un curry vert thaïlandais authentique et épicé pour votre mijoteuse, idéal pour éliminer le stress de dernière minute lors d''un réception.','["2-3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","2 kg de côtes levées de bœuf (côtes avec os laissées entières) ou de poitrine, coupées en gros morceaux","gros bouquet de coriandre","2 tiges de citronnelle, 1 écrasée, 1 hachée grossièrement","3 gousses d''ail, hachées","1-2 piments verts, hachés grossièrement, épépinés si vous le souhaitez","2 cm de galanga ou de gingembre, pelé et haché","50 ml de vinaigre de vin de riz","50 ml de sauce de poisson","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre de palme ou cassonade légère","400 g de lait de coco en boîte","Anis étoilé 2","6 feuilles de combava","jus de 2 citrons verts, plus des quartiers pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer un peu d''huile dans une grande poêle et\r\nfaire dorer le bœuf par lots, en le retirant\r\nune assiette après, en réservant les jus éventuels. Si votre\r\nla mijoteuse a une fonction de brunissement,\r\nutilisez ceci à la place. Pendant ce temps, dans un mini\r\nhachoir ou robot culinaire, fouettez la moitié\r\nla coriandre, la citronnelle hachée,\r\nail, piments et galanga avec le reste\r\nde l''huile jusqu''à obtenir une pâte rugueuse.","Tournez la mijoteuse sur High. Chaleur\r\nla pâte pendant quelques minutes, puis ajoutez le\r\nle bœuf et tous les autres ingrédients,\r\nà part le reste de coriandre\r\net du jus de citron vert. Tournez la mijoteuse sur\r\nBas et cuire pendant 8 heures, ou jusqu''à ce que le\r\nla viande se détache des os.","Si vous utilisez des côtes de bœuf, retirez les os\r\nle bœuf, puis émincez la viande avec\r\n2 fourchettes. Si la sauce est trop fine, filtrez\r\nretirez-le et faites-le bouillir pour réduire. Incorporer le\r\nle reste de coriandre et le jus de citron vert, puis\r\nassaisonner avec plus de sauce de poisson ou de sucre."]','2026-01-11 00:09:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11133,8206,'fr','Nouilles thaïlandaises épicées aux crevettes','Ces nouilles faibles en gras constituent un dîner sans chichi et seront sur la table dans 30 minutes','["200 g de nouilles de riz thaïlandaises","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","2 oeufs, battus","1 piment rouge, finement haché","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","450 g de crevettes de l''Atlantique cuites, décortiquées","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","petit bouquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","½ petit bouquet de menthe hachée grossièrement","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","une petite poignée de cacahuètes grillées, hachées"]','["Cuire les nouilles en suivant le paquet\r\ninstructions, égoutter et réserver pour plus tard.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et\r\nverser l''oeuf battu. Tourbillonnez autour du\r\npoêle pour faire une fine omelette, cuire pendant\r\n1 à 2 minutes, puis retournez et faites cuire le\r\nde l''autre côté pendant 1 min. Démouler et trancher\r\nen fines lanières.","Ajoutez le piment et le gingembre dans la poêle,\r\nfaire frire pendant 1 à 2 minutes puis verser les nouilles,\r\ncrevettes et oeuf. Verser la sauce soja\r\net faire sauter encore 1 minute. Jetez-y le\r\nherbes hachées et verser sur le citron vert\r\nle jus et le zeste, puis saupoudrer sur le\r\ncacahuètes hachées et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11134,8208,'fr','Soupe thaïe au poulet vert','Utilisez des cuisses de poulet pour cela – elles sont plus savoureuses et d’un meilleur rapport qualité-prix que les poitrines','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 oignon, finement haché","Paquet de 500 g de filets de cuisse de poulet sans peau, hachés finement","4 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","Pot de 285g de pâte de curry vert thaï","400 ml de lait de coco en boîte","1¾ l de bouillon de poulet","5 feuilles de combava","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, le blanc tranché en diagonale et le vert finement haché","280 g de haricots verts fins, parés et coupés en deux","Paquet de 150 g de pousses de bambou","jus de 2 citrons verts, plus des quartiers pour servir","petit bouquet de basilic"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans votre plus grande poêle, ajoutez le\r\nl''oignon et faire revenir 3 minutes pour le ramollir. Ajouter\r\nle poulet et l''ail, et cuire jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle poulet change de couleur.","Ajoutez la pâte de curry, le lait de coco,\r\nbouillon, feuilles de citron vert et sauce de poisson, puis\r\nlaisser mijoter 12 minutes. Ajouter le haché\r\nfanes d''oignons, haricots verts et bambou\r\npousses et laissez cuire 4 à 6 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles haricots sont juste tendres.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le jus de citron vert et\r\nbasilic dans un pichet étroit et mélanger avec un\r\nmixeur plongeant pour obtenir un vert onctueux\r\ncoller. Verser dans la soupe avec le\r\noignon nouveau tranché et réchauffer.\r\nServir avec des quartiers de citron vert pour un déjeuner léger\r\nou un dîner ou comme entrée préparée à l''avance."]','2026-01-11 00:09:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11135,8210,'fr','Bouchées d''épinards thaïlandaises','Ces petites bouchées thaïlandaises sont prêtes en seulement 10 minutes','["2 citrons verts segmentés et hachés","2 cm de gingembre haché","1 échalote finement tranchée","½ piment haché","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de coriandre","2 cuillères à soupe de cacahuètes","un peu de sauce de poisson","saupoudrer de sucre","8 à 12 jeunes feuilles d''épinards"]','["Mélanger\r\ncitrons verts, gingembre, échalote, piment,\r\nfeuilles de coriandre et\r\ncacahuètes. Assaisonner avec un filet de poisson\r\nsauce et une pincée de sucre.","Disposez les feuilles d''épinards sur un\r\nplateau. Déposez une cuillerée du mélange sur\r\nchacun, puis faites circuler et demandez à tout le monde\r\nles rouler avant de les manger en une seule bouchée."]','2026-01-11 00:09:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11136,8212,'fr','Soupe thaïe au poulet et patate douce','Une soupe au poulet onctueuse et épicée avec une couleur vibrante qui regorge d''aromates asiatiques','["1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive ou de colza","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","2 cm de racine de gingembre hachée","1 tige de citronnelle, écrasée","1 paquet de 25 g de coriandre, feuilles et tiges hachées séparément","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","750 ml de bouillon de poulet (fait avec 2 cubes de bouillon)","1 petite boîte (160 ml) de crème de coco","500 g de patates douces pelées et hachées grossièrement","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau, tranchées","1 citron vert, jus seulement","1 cuillère à café de sucre","½ cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","pain croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez l''ail, le piment, le gingembre, la citronnelle, les tiges de coriandre et la pâte de curry et laissez cuire 2 à 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les arômes se libèrent.","Ajouter le bouillon de poulet, la crème de coco et les patates douces et cuire 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres. Retirez la citronnelle et jetez-la. Transférer délicatement dans un mélangeur et mixer jusqu''à consistance lisse. En cas de congélation, pour de meilleurs résultats, congelez à ce stade, sinon, pour une option plus simple, congelez la recette complète.","Remettez dans la casserole, ajoutez le poulet et faites cuire doucement pendant 5 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit.  Incorporer le jus de citron vert, le sucre et la sauce de poisson, parsemer de feuilles de coriandre et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11137,8214,'fr','Pilons thaïlandais parfumés','Faites mariner les batteurs de poulet dans de la pâte de curry rouge thaïlandaise aromatique et du piment doux pour des amuse-gueules super savoureux','["2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","le zeste râpé d''une orange et 2 cuillères à soupe de jus","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaïlandais de bonne qualité","8 pilons de poulet, la peau enlevée, la chair coupée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6\r\net tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium. Mélangez le\r\nsauce chili avec le zeste d''orange et\r\njus, ail, pâte de curry et ¼ cuillère à café de sel.\r\nAjouter le poulet et bien enrober.","Disposez les pilons sur le papier d''aluminium,\r\nespacés. Enrober le poulet de n''importe quel\r\nmarinade laissée dans le bol, puis rôtir pendant\r\n35-40 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Envelopper dans du papier aluminium ou\r\nemballer dans un récipient alimentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:09:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11138,8216,'fr','Ragoût de bœuf à la citronnelle et nouilles','Goûtez à l''Asie du Sud-Est avec ce sauté parfumé riche en fer avec du piment, du gingembre, de la citronnelle et de la coriandre.','["1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","3 tiges de citronnelle, feuilles extérieures enlevées, finement hachées","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de coriandre, plus un peu pour servir","2 piments rouges, tranchés finement (laissez les graines si vous l''aimez épicé)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","250 g de bœuf à ragoût, coupé en cubes de 2½ cm","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja noire","1 cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices","1 cuillère à café de cassonade","400 ml de bouillon de bœuf","100 g de nouilles de riz larges","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Mettez le gingembre, l''ail, la citronnelle,\r\ncoriandre et 1 piment dans un robot culinaire,\r\npuis pulser jusqu''à obtenir une purée. Faites chauffer l''huile dans\r\nune poêle à feu doux. Ajouter la purée\r\net laissez cuire 5 min. Incorporer le bœuf,\r\nsoja, cinq épices, sucre et bouillon. Mettez un\r\ncouvrir et porter à ébullition, puis baisser le feu\r\net laissez mijoter 1h15. Supprimer\r\nle couvercle et laissez cuire encore 15 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le bœuf soit tendre.","Juste avant de servir, préparez les nouilles\r\nen suivant les instructions de l''emballage. Bien égoutter,\r\npuis répartissez dans 2 bols et une cuillère\r\nsur le ragoût de bœuf. Servir saupoudré de\r\nle reste des feuilles de piment et de coriandre,\r\navec des quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11139,8218,'fr','Poulet sauté de Ken Hom aux piments et basilic','Un plat traditionnel thaïlandais plein de saveurs aromatiques, facile à préparer et plein de saveurs aromatiques','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","450 g de cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en morceaux","3 cuillères à soupe d''ail haché grossièrement","3 cuillères à soupe d''échalotes finement tranchées","3 piments verts ou rouges frais, épépinés et finement râpés","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson (nam pla)","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja noire","2 cuillères à café de sucre","une grosse poignée de feuilles de basilic thaï ou ordinaire"]','["Faites chauffer un wok ou une grande friture\r\npoêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude, puis\r\najoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Quand il\r\nest très chaud, ajoutez le poulet\r\net faire sauter à feu vif pendant\r\n8 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés\r\npartout. À l''aide d''une écumoire,\r\nsortir le poulet de la poêle\r\net mettre de côté.","Réchauffez le wok et ajoutez le\r\nhuile restante. Incorporer l''ail\r\net les échalotes et faire sauter pendant 3\r\nminutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Remettez le poulet dans le\r\nwok et ajoutez les piments, le poisson\r\nsauce, sauce soja noire et\r\nsucre. Faire sauter à feu vif\r\npendant encore 8 à 10 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit\r\nà travers. Incorporer les feuilles de basilic\r\net servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:09:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11140,8220,'fr','Pide au poivre et au halloumi','Essayez cette cuisine de rue turque en utilisant un mélange de pain du commerce pour plus de facilité. Garni de halloumi épicé et de poivrons, c''est un délicieux déjeuner à préparer pour la famille','["250 g de mélange à pain ciabatta","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon , coupé en dés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ petit poivron rouge, coupé en dés","½ petit poivron vert, coupé en dés","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","une poignée de persil haché","1 bloc de halloumi, coupé en dés","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","25 g de beurre fondu"]','["Préparez la pâte ciabatta en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage et laissez-la lever pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon, l''ail et les poivrons pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez les épices et un peu d''assaisonnement et laissez cuire quelques minutes, puis incorporez le persil et retirez du feu. Incorporer le halloumi.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Divisez la pâte en quartiers puis étalez-la sur un plan légèrement fariné en formes ovales longues (environ 22 cm x 9 cm). Disposer sur deux plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé. Parsemer du mélange poivre et fromage en laissant des bordures de 1 cm. Pincez à chaque extrémité pour créer une forme de pantoufle.","Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé et doré. Badigeonner les pides de beurre fondu et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11141,8222,'fr','Riz turc (riz vermicelle)','Ce plat d''accompagnement turc classique utilise du riz blanc à grains longs agrémenté de bouillon de poulet et de pâtes vermicelles grillées.','["300 g de riz blanc à grains longs","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","70 g de brins de vermicelles écrasés","30g de beurre doux","625 ml de bouillon de poulet, préparé avec un cube de bouillon"]','["Versez le riz dans un très grand bol sous l''eau froide courante et égouttez soigneusement l''eau du bol à travers un tamis. Répétez plusieurs fois jusqu''à ce que l''eau dans le bol soit claire, puis remplissez le bol d''eau froide et laissez tremper le riz pendant 10 minutes pendant que vous faites cuire les vermicelles.","Mettez l''huile dans une poêle moyenne à feu moyen. Ajoutez les vermicelles et remuez continuellement jusqu''à ce que les brins prennent une riche couleur dorée, 2-3 minutes. Retirer du feu, incorporer le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il fonde et laisser refroidir les vermicelles pendant 1 à 2 minutes.","Égouttez soigneusement le riz au tamis. Ajoutez le riz dans la poêle et remuez bien. Versez le bouillon chaud dans la casserole, saupoudrez d''½ cuillère à café de sel, remuez bien puis remettez la casserole sur le feu à feu vif. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu au minimum, mettez le couvercle sur la casserole et laissez mijoter pendant 7 à 9 minutes. Retirez la casserole du feu, couvrez de quelques feuilles de papier absorbant ou d''un torchon léger et du couvercle de la casserole, et laissez le riz reposer dans la casserole pendant 10 minutes. Remuer avec une fourchette avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11142,8224,'fr','Brochettes d''Adana','Ces brochettes turques utilisent un minimum d''ingrédients pour que la saveur de l''agneau se démarque, complétée par des poivrons rouges et du pul biber épicé.','["2 gros poivrons rouges romano, épépinés, épépinés et coupés en gros morceaux","800 g de viande hachée d''agneau à 20 % de matière grasse","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de piment rouge doux (doux) turc","1 cuillère à soupe de pul biber","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol"]','["Hachez finement les poivrons au robot culinaire, puis versez-les dans une passoire et pressez-les dans la passoire pour que les poivrons libèrent tout leur jus. Versez dans un bol avec le hachis, la pâte de poivron rouge, le pul biber, 1½ cuillère à café de sel marin feuilleté et 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile. Mélangez en pétrissant bien pendant au moins 2-3 minutes. Si nécessaire, mouillez-vous les mains avec de l''eau froide pour éviter que le mélange ne colle. Le mélange doit être collant une fois prêt. Couvrir et réfrigérer pendant au moins 2 heures ou jusqu''à 12 heures.","Au moment de cuisiner, chauffez le gril à feu vif ou le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Divisez le mélange en 12 portions égales d''environ 85g chacune. Si vous souhaitez les embrocher, divisez-les en 8 portions égales et roulez-les en boules. Avec les mains mouillées, enfilez les boules au bout des brochettes, en massant le mélange sur les brochettes entre les paumes de vos mains, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément réparti. Assurez-vous que le mélange est entièrement enroulé autour des brochettes sans aucun métal exposé. Vous pouvez également les déposer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé si vous cuisinez au four, ou de papier d''aluminium si vous cuisez sous le gril. Façonner en köfte de 20 cm de long. Mouillez-vous les doigts avec un peu d''eau froide et faites des empreintes tout au long du köfte pour lui donner la forme traditionnelle.","Badigeonner délicatement chaque köfte avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile restante et cuire sous le gril, sur la grille supérieure pendant 10 à 12 minutes, en les retournant régulièrement, ou cuire au four pendant 16 à 18 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants à l''extérieur et juteux au milieu."]','2026-01-11 00:09:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11143,8226,'fr','Dolma (fausse peluche)','Dégustez une version sans viande de feuilles de vigne farcies, avec tomates et oignons. Une fois que vous maîtrisez la recette, essayez d’expérimenter avec d’autres garnitures.','["250 g de riz blanc à grains longs","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 gros oignon , coupé en dés très finement","4 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","25 g de feuilles de menthe fraîche hachées finement","30 g de persil plat frais, finement haché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade","100 ml de jus de citron frais, environ 3 citrons","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe séchée","1 x 420g de feuilles de vigne sous vide"]','["Lavez le riz dans une passoire sous l''eau froide courante jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire, puis laissez-le égoutter complètement dans une passoire.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive à feu doux et ajoutez les oignons. Laisser ramollir pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit translucide et caramélisé. Ajoutez 3 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates aux oignons en les décomposant délicatement en jus huileux, environ 2 minutes. Incorporez le riz en enrobant entièrement les grains du mélange de tomates et d''oignons, puis retirez la casserole du feu et transférez le contenu dans un grand plat, le nôtre mesurait 22 cm. Ajoutez la menthe fraîche et le persil au plat, ainsi que les tomates hachées, la mélasse de grenade, le jus de citron, la menthe séchée, 1½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin et ¾ cuillère à café de poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Remuer pour combiner, puis laisser refroidir à température ambiante. Réfrigérer 1 h pour permettre aux saveurs de se conjuguer.","Pendant que le mélange refroidit, préparez les feuilles de vigne. Mettez-les dans la casserole la plus large dont vous disposez, puis lavez-les soigneusement à l''eau froide 3 à 4 fois. Remplissez la casserole d''eau froide, placez-la sur le feu à feu moyen, portez à ébullition pendant 10 minutes. Éteignez le feu, puis couvrez la casserole et laissez les feuilles reposer dans l''eau bouillante pendant encore 10 minutes. Égoutter soigneusement l''eau chaude de la casserole, puis remplir la casserole d''eau froide et égoutter encore quelques fois pour débarrasser les feuilles de toute saumure. Remplissez à nouveau la casserole d''eau froide pour couvrir les feuilles – cela facilitera le retrait des feuilles de la casserole sans les déchirer. Réservez 4 à 5 grandes feuilles de vigne pour plus tard, puis utilisez le reste pour faire le dolma.","Dissoudre 1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates restante dans un pichet résistant à la chaleur avec 200 ml d''eau bouillante, puis compléter avec 300 ml d''eau froide et bien mélanger.","Disposez une feuille de vigne sur une grande assiette avec le côté le plus large de la feuille face à vous et la pointe la plus éloignée. Si les feuilles ont encore une tige, coupez-les. Couvrez avec une cuillère à café bombée du mélange le long du point le plus large, en laissant un peu plus de 1 cm (½ pouce) d''espace sur les côtés et le long du bord le plus proche de vous. Pliez ce bord le plus proche sur la garniture, repliez les côtés, puis roulez le dolma loin de vous jusqu''à ce que vous obteniez un rouleau en forme de cigare bien serré.","Ajoutez quelques feuilles réservées au fond d''une grande casserole, puis déposez le dolma roulé (avec l''extrémité pointue de la feuille tournée vers le dessous de la casserole pour éviter que le dolma ne s''effiloche pendant la cuisson) au fond de la casserole et répétez avec les feuilles restantes et la garniture. Disposez bien les dolma, mais veillez à leur laisser suffisamment d''espace pour qu''ils se dilatent pendant la cuisson, en couches.","Versez les 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive restantes dans la poêle, puis recouvrez le dolma avec les feuilles réservées restantes. Placez quelques assiettes résistantes à la chaleur sur les feuilles pour alourdir légèrement le contenu de la casserole, puis versez juste assez de liquide de tomate pour qu''il dépasse de 2 cm du bord des assiettes. N''hésitez pas à rajouter un peu d''eau si la quantité de liquide n''est pas suffisante, ou à vous retenir si elle est trop importante. Mettez la casserole sur feu moyen, portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu le plus bas possible. Mettez le couvercle sur la casserole et laissez cuire environ 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que la majeure partie de l''eau soit réduite, mais vous pouvez encore en voir une petite quantité bouillonner. Retirez la casserole du feu et laissez refroidir au moins 2 heures (de préférence quelques heures de plus) avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11144,8228,'fr','Pains plats aux œufs turcs','Savourez ces pains plats turcs aux œufs pour un déjeuner ou un dîner rapide et facile. Assurez-vous de casser les œufs dans l''huile chaude pour obtenir un fond joli et croustillant.','["175 g de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","1 gousse d''ail, râpée","½ citron, zesté","1 ½ cuillère à café de zaatar","une petite poignée de persil finement haché","2 douleurs place","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 œufs","30 g de feta végétarienne, émiettée","25 g d''olives vertes tranchées","grosse pincée de flocons de piment d''Alep ou d''huile de piment (facultatif)","½ concombre, coupé en deux, épépiné et finement tranché"]','["Mélangez le yaourt avec l''ail, le zeste de citron, la moitié du zaatar, la moitié du persil et un peu de sel et de poivre. Faites chauffer une poêle à sec à feu moyen et badigeonnez légèrement les pains plats d''un peu d''huile. Faites frire chaque côté pendant 1 min, puis transférez dans deux assiettes et réservez.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile d''olive dans la poêle. Une fois bien chauds, cassez les œufs dans la poêle et faites-les revenir quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le blanc soit pris et que les bords soient croustillants. Répartir uniformément le yaourt épicé sur les deux pains plats et garnir des œufs croustillants, de la feta, des olives, du reste du persil et du zaatar, du piment, le cas échéant, et des concombres à part."]','2026-01-11 00:09:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11145,8230,'fr','Katmer à la pistache','Essayez ce fabuleux dessert turc composé de glace prise en sandwich entre une pâte filo et saupoudrée de pistaches. Servir le katmer avec des fruits frais','["2 feuilles de pâte filo d''environ 37 x 30 cm chacune","30 g de beurre doux, fondu","80 g de pistaches décortiquées, grillées et grossièrement moulues, plus un peu pour décorer","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","40 g de crème caillée","4 boules de glace vanille","quartiers de pamplemousse ou d''orange (ou autre fruit frais), pour servir"]','["Prenez 1 feuille de filo et badigeonnez-la d''un peu de beurre fondu. Saupoudrez la moitié des pistaches pour former un carré d''environ 12 x 12 cm au centre de la feuille. Saupoudrer la moitié du sucre et parsemer la moitié de la crème caillée sur les pistaches. En commençant par le coin supérieur gauche, pliez le coin vers le centre, puis pliez le coin inférieur droit vers le centre. Pliez les deux coins restants vers le centre, en les chevauchant légèrement pour obtenir un carré.","Mettez une grande poêle sur feu moyen-vif et badigeonnez-la de la moitié du beurre fondu restant, puis déposez le katmer dans la poêle, couture vers le bas. Cuire de chaque côté pendant 1 à 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Répétez le processus pour l’autre katmer.","Coupez le katmer croustillant en deux pour obtenir quatre morceaux. Répartissez la glace entre deux en pressant légèrement, puis recouvrez avec les morceaux de pâte restants pour réaliser deux sandwichs. Coupez-les à nouveau en deux pour obtenir quatre morceaux. Servir aussitôt, saupoudré de pistaches, de quartiers de pamplemousse ou d''autres fruits de saison."]','2026-01-11 00:09:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11146,8232,'fr','Simulation de douleur','Les pains Simit sont des rondelles de pain au sésame, qui ressemblent aux bagels. Ils sont vendus à tous les coins de rue en Turquie et sont populaires pour le petit-déjeuner ou comme collation.','["250 g de farine à pain blanche forte","1 cuillère à café de sel","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café (5 g) de levure sèche à action rapide","100g de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade ou de sirop de mélasse"]','["Versez la farine, le sel et le sucre dans un bol et mélangez. Ajoutez la levure et 150 ml d''eau tiède, mélangez, puis pétrissez quelques minutes pour rassembler le tout en une pâte molle. Versez sur votre plan de travail et continuez à pétrir pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit élastique. Remettre dans un bol propre, couvrir et laisser lever pendant une heure ou deux jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Pendant ce temps, faites griller les graines de sésame dans une poêle à sec jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Réserver dans la poêle. Mélangez le sirop de mélasse ou la mélasse de grenade avec 50 ml d''eau dans un bol large et peu profond.","Divisez la pâte en quatre morceaux égaux. Rouler chacun en un boudin d''environ 45 cm de long. Retournez la corde de pâte sur elle-même, puis tordez les deux brins et faites une boucle en un anneau, en serrant les extrémités ensemble pour la fixer. Une fois façonné, trempez chaque morceau dans l''eau de mélasse en le retournant pour l''enrober, puis dans les graines de sésame en veillant à ce que chacun soit bien recouvert. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie, couvrir et laisser lever encore 45 minutes à 1 heure. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Lorsque les pains sont gonflés, découvrez-les et enfournez pendant 15 à 18 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir, puis envelopper dans un torchon pour les garder au frais. Peut être préparé jusqu''à la veille et réchauffé doucement avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11147,8234,'fr','Ailes de poulet au cumin, citron et ail','Procurez-vous quelques extras à la charcuterie et transformez-les en un mezze du Moyen-Orient à partager avec des amis.','["12 ailes de poulet","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de miel"]','["À l’aide d’une paire de ciseaux de cuisine bien aiguisés, coupez chaque aile au niveau de la jointure en deux morceaux. Mélangez l''ail, le zeste et le jus de citron, le cumin et l''huile avec beaucoup d''assaisonnement, puis versez dans un plat avec les ailes de poulet et mélangez pour bien enrober. Couvrir et laisser mariner au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 1 heure, ou toute la nuit si vous avez le temps.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6, ou chauffer un barbecue extérieur. Faites cuire les ailes de poulet sur une plaque à four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes, ou faites-les cuire au barbecue pendant 20 minutes, en les arrosant de miel pendant les 10 dernières minutes de chaque méthode. Servir sur une assiette avec beaucoup de serviettes en papier. Remplissez de petits bols d''olives, de pistaches ou d''amandes, de dattes, de piments marinés et de pains plats à servir avec les plats ci-dessous."]','2026-01-11 00:09:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11148,8236,'fr','Aubergine au four farcie de citrouille rôtie, feta et noix avec courgettes à la menthe','Le chef néo-zélandais Peter Gordon met en valeur les saveurs de saison dans ce repas végétarien impressionnant et sain.','["2 grosses aubergines","200 g de citrouille ou de courge (essayez le kabocha ou la courge musquée)","100 g d''oignons rouges émincés","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin (ou utilisez un peu moins de cumin moulu)","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile vierge de colza ou d''olive","2 cuillères à café d''herbes fraîches (le thym, l''origan, la sauge ou le romarin fonctionnent bien)","100 g de fromage feta coupé en dés","grosse poignée de noix légèrement grillées et coupées en deux","4 courgettes","1 citron","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées","une petite poignée de persil plat haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nCoupez les aubergines en deux dans le sens de la longueur,\r\nlaissant la tige en place (cela peut être\r\nretiré en mangeant). En utilisant un petit\r\navec un couteau bien aiguisé, retirez la chair intérieure\r\nlaissant une coquille d''environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Hacher\r\nla chair et mettre dans un bol.","Épluchez le potiron ou la courge, retirez-la\r\nles graines, puis coupées en dés de 1 à 2 cm et\r\nmélanger avec l''aubergine hachée et le rouge\r\noignon. Incorporer le cumin, l''ail et 2 cuillères à soupe\r\nhuile et mélanger avec un peu de sel et\r\npoivre noir. Disposez sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée\r\navec du papier sulfurisé. Frotter 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile\r\nles moitiés d''aubergines et assaisonner. Lieu,\r\ncôté coupé vers le bas, sur un autre plateau recouvert de\r\npapier sulfurisé. Cuire au four 15-20 minutes,\r\njusqu''à ce que les coquilles de potiron et d''aubergine\r\nsont presque cuits.","Remettez le mélange de citrouille dans le\r\nbol et incorporer le mélange d''herbes,\r\nfeta et noix. Retourner l''aubergine\r\nmoitiés, puis empilez le mélange à l’intérieur.\r\nArrosez avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile restante et\r\ncuire au four pendant 20 minutes, après quoi le\r\nla citrouille sera entièrement cuite. Si ça commence à\r\ntrop de couleur, couvrir légèrement de papier d''aluminium.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la salade de courgettes.\r\nGarnir et queue les courgettes, puis les trancher\r\ntrès finement en larges rubans. Mélanger avec\r\nle zeste, le jus d''un demi citron et le\r\nhuile. Laisser poser 10 minutes pour laisser le\r\nles courgettes ramollissent un peu.","Pour servir, passez les herbes dans le\r\ncourgettes et coupez le citron restant\r\nla moitié en quartiers. Disposez une moitié d''aubergine\r\ndans chaque assiette, empiler la salade à côté\r\net servir avec un quartier de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:09:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11149,8238,'fr','Burgers kofta faits maison','Avec ces koftas rapides, faciles et bon marché, il n''y a aucune excuse pour aller au fourgon kebab','["1kg d''agneau haché","2 oignons, grossièrement râpés","1 bulbe d''ail, cassé en gousses et finement haché ou râpé","6 cuillères à soupe de garam masala","bouquet de coriandre hachée (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce chili, plus un peu pour servir","8 douleurs pitta","4 tomates, coupées en deux et tranchées","un demi chou rouge émincé","1 oignon rouge, tranché (facultatif)","petit pot de yaourt nature"]','["Versez le hachis dans un grand bol (utilisez un\r\nnettoyer la cuvette à vaisselle si vous n''en avez pas\r\nquelque chose d''assez grand) avec tous les autres\r\ningrédients du burger et une bonne pincée de sel.\r\nRetroussez vos manches, mettez vos mains dans le\r\nmélanger et écraser le tout ensemble\r\nvos doigts jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement mélangés. Pat le\r\nmélanger dans 16 petits burgers. Ceux-ci peuvent maintenant\r\nêtre congelé jusqu''à 1 mois ou réfrigéré\r\nà un jour à l''avance.","Pour cuisiner, chauffez le gril à son réglage le plus élevé et\r\ndisposer les burgers en une seule couche sur une plaque à pâtisserie\r\nplateau (vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots,\r\nselon la taille de votre plateau). Griller sur\r\nl''étagère la plus haute pendant 5 à 6 minutes de chaque côté\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits. Pile\r\nhamburgers sur une assiette et servir avec tous\r\nles accompagnements, pour que chacun puisse\r\nconstruire son propre sandwich."]','2026-01-11 00:09:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11150,8240,'fr','Gozleme d''agneau épicé et feta avec sauce tomate spéciale','Une pâtisserie turque savoureuse à base de pain. Farcir d''agneau, de feta, de raisins secs et de pignons de pin et servir avec une trempette à la grenade','["Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","250 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, et un peu pour finir","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","50g de raisins secs","le zeste d''1 citron","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","50 g de pignons de pin grillés","Passe de 100 g de fromage","8 cuillères à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","1 cuillère à soupe d''oignon rouge haché très finement"]','["Pour la pâte, mélanger la levure, le sucre\r\net 175 ml d''eau tiède dans un petit\r\nbol. Remuer pour dissoudre la levure, puis\r\nlaisser reposer 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le liquide\r\ncommence à mousser.","Mélangez la farine avec ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un grand\r\nbol. Faire un puits au centre, verser\r\ndans le mélange de levure et d''huile d''olive, et\r\nmélanger à une pâte. Pétrir 10 mn,\r\npuis mettez la pâte dans un moule légèrement huilé\r\nbol et couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé.\r\nLaissez dans un endroit assez chaud jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoublé de taille.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Chauffer le\r\nhuile dans une poêle, ajoutez le hachis et\r\nfaire frire en brisant les grumeaux au fur et à mesure, jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien doré. Incorporer l''ail, les épices\r\net les raisins secs, et faire revenir encore quelques minutes,\r\npuis éteignez le feu et incorporez le\r\nzeste de citron, oignons nouveaux, pignons de pin\r\net l''assaisonnement. Laisser refroidir un peu.","Divisez la pâte en 4. Travaillez un\r\nmorceau à la fois, étalez-le légèrement\r\nsurface farinée à 25 x 30 cm, sans\r\nla pâte se fend. Avec un long bord\r\nde la pâtisserie posée devant vous, cuillère\r\n¼ de la viande hachée sur la moitié inférieure –\r\nen laissant une bordure de 2 cm tout autour. Émietter\r\nplus du quart de la feta. Pliez l''autre moitié de\r\nla pâte sur la garniture, en repliant et\r\npincer les bords pour sceller l''agneau.\r\nRépétez avec le reste des ingrédients.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu vif\r\net badigeonnez tout le gozleme d''huile.","Cuire par lots pendant 3 à 5 minutes chacun\r\ncôté, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien chauds.\r\nMélangez rapidement le ketchup aux tomates,\r\ngrenade et oignon, et servir avec\r\nle gozleme chaud et croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:09:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11151,6764,'fr','Salade de patates douces','Cette salade simple et saine composée de morceaux de pommes de terre au four constitue une excellente alternative aux versions à base de mayonnaise.','["1,2 kg de patates douces, pelées et coupées en gros morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 échalotes (ou un demi petit oignon rouge), hachées finement","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","petit bouquet de ciboulette, coupée en quartiers ou utilisez des mini","5 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à soupe de miel"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger les morceaux de patate douce avec l''huile d''olive et un peu d''assaisonnement, et étaler sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier sulfurisé. Rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés. Refroidir à température ambiante.","Lorsqu''elle est presque froide, mélangez tous les ingrédients de la vinaigrette avec un peu plus d''assaisonnement et mélangez délicatement les morceaux de pommes de terre – utilisez vos mains pour éviter de les briser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11152,8242,'fr','Imam bayildi avec agneau barbecue et tzatziki','Il existe des centaines de versions de ce plat d''aubergines turc. C''est authentiquement assez gras, mais réduisez l''huile si vous préférez','["3 aubergines","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour le badigeonnage","1 oignon espagnol, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","8 tomates mûres, pelées","petit bouquet de persil plat, haché","12 côtelettes ou escalopes d''agneau","paprika, pour l''assaisonnement","1 citron, coupé en deux","Pot de 150 g de yaourt grec","½ concombre, graines vidées, râpées","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nCoupez les aubergines en deux dans le sens de la longueur et\r\nentailler profondément le côté chair, badigeonner avec un\r\nbonne couche d''huile d''olive et mettre sur une plaque allant au four\r\nfeuille. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la chair\r\nest suffisamment mou pour être retiré.","Faire revenir l''oignon dans un peu d''huile jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, ajouter\r\nl''ail et la cannelle et faire revenir 1 min.\r\nUne fois que les aubergines sont suffisamment froides pour\r\nmanipuler, évider les centres. En gros\r\nhachez la chair et ajoutez-la aux oignons.\r\nCoupez les tomates en deux, récupérez les graines\r\net le jus dans une passoire placée au-dessus d''un bol,\r\npuis hachez la chair. Ajouter le haché\r\nmettre les tomates dans la poêle et cuire le tout\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien tendres. Ajoutez un peu\r\nplus d''huile si nécessaire. Incorporer le persil,\r\nen laissant un peu pour disperser à la fin.","Disposez les moitiés d''aubergines dans un plat allant au four\r\nplat et diviser le mélange de tomates\r\nentre eux. Versez dessus le jus de\r\nles tomates, arroser avec plus d''huile d''olive\r\net enfourner 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les aubergines\r\nse sont effondrés.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les ingrédients du tzatziki\r\nensemble et mettre dans un petit bol de service.","Assaisonner l''agneau avec du sel noir\r\npoivre et une pincée de paprika. Plaque chauffante,\r\ngriller ou barbecue 3 minutes de chaque côté\r\nou jusqu''à ce que la graisse soit bien dorée, puis\r\nmettre dans un plat de service et essorer\r\nles moitiés de citron. Dispersez les aubergines\r\navec du persil, puis servir avec l''agneau\r\net le tzatziki."]','2026-01-11 00:09:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11153,8244,'fr','Pâtisseries aux amandes et au miel et à la crème d''orange','Servez ces puddings préparés à l''avance avec du café, du vin de dessert ou du thé à la menthe fraîche pour un véritable régal après le dîner.','["200 g d''amandes entières blanchies, grillées et grossièrement hachées","85 g de sucre glace, plus un peu pour servir","85 g de beurre fondu","2 cuillères à café d''eau de fleur d''oranger","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","1 jaune d''oeuf","Paquet de 190 g de brique","miel clair, pour servir","le zeste d''1 orange","300 g de yaourt grec","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace tamisé"]','["Réservez un quart des amandes. Mettre\r\nle reste au robot culinaire avec le glaçage\r\nsucre, la moitié du beurre, fleur d''oranger\r\neau, cannelle et jaune d''œuf. Whizz pour\r\nune pâte. Verser dans un bol et incorporer\r\nla plupart des noix hachées restantes.","Déroulez une feuille de brick à la fois.\r\ntemps, badigeonner le tout de beurre fondu\r\net divisez-le en deux en 2 demi-cercles. Forme\r\n1 cuillère à soupe bombée du mélange de noix pour voir\r\ncomme une fine forme de coin le long de la moitié du\r\nbord de pâte que vous venez de découper (en laissant 2,5 cm\r\nbordure sur le côté arrondi), donc ça ressemble\r\ncomme si tu coupais le demi-cercle de\r\nla pâte en morceaux comme un gâteau. Roule comme\r\nun cornet de pâtisserie, scellant le mélange de noix\r\nà l''intérieur, puis badigeonner le tout avec plus de beurre\r\net repliez l’extrémité large et ouverte pour sceller.\r\nPoser sur une plaque à pâtisserie, extrémité du rabat vers le bas.\r\naidez-le à rester fermé et répétez jusqu''à ce que l''écrou soit\r\nle mélange est épuisé. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire\r\net détendez-vous. Mettez le zeste, le yaourt, la crème et le glaçage\r\nsucre dans un bol à mélanger. Couvrir et réfrigérer.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6, y mettre les pâtisseries et enfourner 15 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Juste avant qu''ils soient\r\nc''est prêt, battez ensemble le mélange de yaourt\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais. Empiler les pâtisseries sur une portion\r\nplat, arroser de miel et parsemer de\r\nnoix restantes. Servir avec l''orange\r\ncrème et Miel d''orange et de pamplemousse (voir « Se marie bien avec »)."]','2026-01-11 00:09:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11154,8246,'fr','Boulettes d''agneau et abricots','Personne ne peut résister aux boulettes de viande, et cette recette est tellement savoureuse que vous voudrez peut-être en faire le double et la congeler pour une autre fois.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons rouges, hachés très finement","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de cumin et de coriandre moulus (ou 4 cuillères à café de mélange d''épices marocaines)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","½ cuillère à café de sucre","½ paquet de 20 g de menthe hachée finement","Paquet de 500 g de viande hachée d''agneau maigre","8 abricots secs, hachés finement","50 g de chapelure fraîche","pain pitta et salade, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une poêle et faites ramollir le\r\noignons pendant 5 minutes. Ajouter l''ail et\r\népices et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes.\r\nVerser la moitié du mélange d''oignons dans un bol\r\net laisser refroidir. Ajoutez les tomates,\r\nsucre et assaisonnement au reste\r\noignons dans la poêle et laisser mijoter environ\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à réduction.","Pendant ce temps, ajoutez la menthe, l''agneau,\r\nabricots et chapelure au refroidi\r\noignons, assaisonnez et mélangez bien avec votre\r\nmains. Façonner des petites boulettes de viande.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans un poêle antiadhésive\r\npoêler et faire revenir les boulettes de viande jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées\r\n(par lots si nécessaire). Incorporer le\r\nsauce avec un peu d''eau et délicatement\r\nfaites cuire le tout quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles boulettes de viande sont bien cuites.\r\nServir avec du pain pitta et de la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:09:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11155,8248,'fr','Wrap d''agneau chaud au cumin avec salade de chou croquante et mayonnaise épicée','Un pain plat au kebab sain – préparez le double de la salade de chou et des carottes et gardez les restes pour le déjeuner','["4 petits steaks de gigot d''agneau","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café bombée de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","2 carottes, grossièrement râpées","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","400 g de chou blanc tranché très finement","5 poivrons doux Peppadew, 2 tranchés grossièrement","3 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","4 gros pitta ou pains plats, réchauffés"]','["Faites chauffer une poêle à frire. Frotter les steaks d''agneau\r\navec l''huile, le cumin et un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nFaire griller environ 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût. Place à un\r\ncôté sur une assiette pour reposer.","Dans un grand bol, incorporez le sucre au\r\nvinaigre jusqu''à dissolution. Ajoutez les carottes,\r\noignons nouveaux, choux et quelques\r\nassaisonner et mélanger.","Blitzer les poivrons entiers et la mayonnaise\r\ndans un robot culinaire. Ajoutez un tas de\r\nsalade sur chaque pain plat. Tranchez l''agneau,\r\nenlever tout excès de graisse et s''allonger\r\ndessus de la salade, arrosé du reste\r\njus. Verser sur la mayonnaise et disperser\r\navec quelques poivrons tranchés. Rouler\r\net manger. Si vous utilisez du pitta, divisez et tout ça.\r\nServir toute salade supplémentaire à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:09:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11156,8250,'fr','Grillades d''aubergines et de houmous','Essayez quelque chose de nouveau avec les aubergines et faites-en la partie principale de votre repas avec ce plat végétarien','["2 aubergines, tranchées épaisses dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour le brossage","3 tranches de pain brun ou blanc, sans croûte","Pot de 300 g d''houmous","100 g de noix grillées","un demi paquet de 80 g de persil plat, feuilles grossièrement hachées","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en quartiers","jus ½ citron","un peu d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Disposez l''aubergine en une seule couche sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Badigeonner avec parcimonie d’huile végétale, puis assaisonner généreusement. Griller pendant 15 minutes, en retournant deux fois et en badigeonnant d''huile jusqu''à ce que les tranches soient ramollies et bien cuites. Pendant ce temps, réduisez le pain en miettes. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à café d''huile et fouettez à nouveau brièvement pour bien enrober.","Étalez quelques cuillères à café d''houmous sur chaque tranche d''aubergine. Versez la chapelure sur une grande assiette, puis pressez le côté houmous des aubergines dans la chapelure pour bien l''enrober. Griller à nouveau, côté miette vers le haut, pendant environ 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré.","Mélanger les noix, le persil et les tomates cerises dans un bol, assaisonner, puis ajouter le jus de citron et l''huile d''olive et remuer à nouveau. Servir les grillades avec la salade, une cuillerée de houmous et du pain pitta."]','2026-01-11 00:09:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11157,8252,'fr','Aubergine rôtie au fromage de chèvre et pain plat grillé','Des saveurs percutantes et beaucoup de croquant : vous ne remarquerez même pas que vous mangez une salade super saine','["2 aubergines tranchées finement dans le sens de la longueur","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","12 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","1 pain plat du Moyen-Orient ou pitta","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","une poignée de feuilles de menthe","2 échalotes, 1 finement hachée, l''autre finement tranchée","1 piment rouge, finement haché","50 g de fromage de chèvre émietté","poignée de roquette sauvage, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nBadigeonner les tranches d''aubergines avec 1 cuillère à soupe\r\nde l''huile, puis assaisonner. Disposer sur un\r\nplaque ou plaque à pâtisserie et rôtir pendant 20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, en y mettant les tomates\r\nle plateau pour les 5 dernières minutes. Déchirez le\r\npain plat en morceaux et placez-le sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie séparée. Faire dorer au four\r\npendant 8 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants, puis retirez-les.","Pour la vinaigrette, dans un petit bol, mélanger\r\nle vinaigre, la menthe, les échalotes hachées, le piment,\r\nle reste de l''huile et un peu de sel et de poivre.","Répartir les tranches d''aubergines, les tomates,\r\ndes tranches d''échalote et du pain plat croustillant dans un\r\nbol de service. Verser sur la vinaigrette,\r\nsaupoudrer de fromage de chèvre et\r\ndispersez-vous sur une petite fusée."]','2026-01-11 00:09:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11158,8254,'fr','Agneau grillé avec salade de riz hivernal','Un souper savoureux et super sain. Les restes sont également parfaits pour le déjeuner','["2 oignons rouges","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","400 g de steak d''agneau maigre","140g de riz sauvage et basmati","une poignée de menthe hachée","poignée de persil haché","120 g de graines de grenade fraîches","50 g de pistaches concassées","50 g de canneberges séchées","jus ½ orange","jus ½ citron"]','["Râpez 1 oignon dans un plat peu profond,\r\najoutez la cannelle et ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive,\r\npuis mélangez. Placez les steaks d''agneau dans le\r\nplat, frotter avec la marinade, puis couvrir\r\net réservez pendant que vous préparez le riz.","Mettez le riz et 600 ml d''eau dans un\r\ncasserole. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez\r\net laisser mijoter à couvert jusqu''à ce que toute l''eau\r\ns’est évaporé – environ 20 minutes. Prendre\r\nretirer le couvercle et laisser refroidir. Hachez finement le\r\nl''oignon rouge restant et mélanger avec le\r\nriz accompagné des herbes, grenade,\r\npistaches et canneberges. Mélangez enfin\r\ndans le jus d''orange et de citron, le\r\nle reste de l''huile d''olive et bien assaisonner.","Retirez l''agneau de la marinade,\r\nen débarrassant tout excès. Plaque chauffante pendant environ\r\n5 minutes de chaque côté, selon la façon dont\r\nvous aimez votre viande et servez-la avec un\r\ngrosse cuillerée de riz."]','2026-01-11 00:09:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11159,8256,'fr','Aubergines grillées, vinaigrette au sésame','Assaisonnez des aubergines grillées avec du tahini, de l''ail, de la coriandre et du yaourt pour un accompagnement végétarien polyvalent que vous pouvez cuisiner sur la plaque de cuisson ou au barbecue.','["2 grosses aubergines coupées en tranches de 2 cm","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de yaourt grec entier","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tahini","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","jus d''1 citron","une poignée de coriandre, de persil et de menthe hachés, ainsi que des feuilles supplémentaires pour servir"]','["Badigeonner chaque tranche d''aubergine d''un peu\r\nhuile, puis assaisonner. Faire chauffer une poêle\r\nou un barbecue. Lorsqu''il est chaud, faites griller le\r\ntranches d''aubergine pendant 2-3 minutes chacune\r\ncôté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et tendres.","Mélangez le yaourt avec le tahini, l''ail,\r\nle jus de citron et les herbes, puis assaisonner.\r\nGarnir les aubergines de vinaigrette\r\net répartir sur des feuilles d''herbes supplémentaires."]','2026-01-11 00:09:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11160,8258,'fr','Purée d''aubergines fumées','C''est excellent avec de la viande ou du poulet grillé et constitue également un déjeuner simple pour les végétariens.','["2 aubergines moyennes","jus d''1 citron","2-3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt épais","petit bouquet d''aneth, feuilles hachées"]','["Chauffer le gril à très chaud. Coupez les aubergines en\r\nsur la moitié de la longueur, puis griller 25 min en retournant\r\nde temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit douce – la peau restera ferme,\r\nmais la chair va ramollir. Retirez les aubergines\r\nle gril et laisser refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulé.","A l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, incisez la chair grillée\r\net retirez la chair avec une cuillère. Basculer dans un\r\nbol et écraser avec une fourchette jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse\r\npulpe. Incorporer le jus de citron et l''ail. Ajoutez le\r\nyaourt et aneth, et assaisonner. Servir encore chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:09:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11161,8260,'fr','Pains plats d''agneau à la menthe','Servez ces pizzas à la turque pour un souper simple et rapide entre amis','["400 g de viande hachée d''agneau","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 poignées de feuilles de menthe, hachées à moitié","2 grosses tomates épépinées et coupées en dés","4 petits pains plats khobez ou 4 tortillas moelleuses à la farine (vous pouvez acheter des pains plats khobez chez les plus grands Sainsbury''s)","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature faible en gras"]','["Cuire le hachis d''agneau pendant 5 à 6 minutes.\r\nune poêle antiadhésive à feu vif.\r\nQuand il commence à dorer, incorporer l''ail\r\net les épices, puis cuire encore 2-3 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que la viande hachée soit dorée et qu''il n''y ait plus\r\nliquide resté dans la casserole. Incorporer le haché\r\nmenthe, tomates et quelques assaisonnements.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Organiser le\r\npains plats sur une plaque à pâtisserie et tartiner\r\nle mélange de viande hachée dessus. Griller pour\r\n2-3 minutes. Pour servir, répartir sur le tout\r\nfeuilles de menthe et arroser de yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:09:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11162,8262,'fr','Salade de couscous aux aubergines','Une poignée de feuilles de menthe donne vraiment vie à cette salade, les légumes vont l''adorer, mais si vous avez besoin de viande, les escalopes d''agneau sont le complément parfait.','["1 grosse aubergine coupée en rondelles de 1 cm","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","140 g de couscous","225 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","une poignée de feuilles de menthe, hachées grossièrement","100 g de bûche de chèvre ferme coupée en cubes","jus 1?2 citron"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Mettez l''aubergine sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie, badigeonner d''huile et assaisonner. Griller\r\npendant environ 15 minutes en retournant et en badigeonnant\r\nplus d''huile à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et ramollie.","Pendant ce temps, versez le couscous dans un grand\r\nbol, verser sur le bouillon, puis couvrir et\r\nlaisser reposer 10 min. Mélangez les tomates, la menthe,\r\nle fromage de chèvre et le reste de l''huile ensemble. Peluches\r\nle couscous avec une fourchette, puis incorporer le\r\naubergines, mélange de tomates et jus de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:09:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11163,6511,'fr','Recette de houmous facile','Une trempette onctueuse aux pois chiches avec du tahini et de l''ail, polyvalente et bonne pour la santé. Ce houmous facile constitue une excellente collation ou un excellent déjeuner.','["1 boîte de 400 g de pois chiches, ne pas égoutter","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tahini","1 grosse gousse d''ail, hachée","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","bien presser le jus de citron"]','["Égouttez les pois chiches dans une passoire placée au-dessus d''un bol ou d''un pichet pour récupérer le liquide. Versez les pois chiches, le tahini, l''ail et le yaourt dans un robot culinaire ou un mélangeur et mixez pour lisser. Incorporez une cuillère à soupe de liquide de pois chiches à la fois jusqu''à obtenir une belle consistance, puis grattez dans un bol, ajoutez un filet de jus de citron et assaisonnez au goût."]','2026-01-11 00:09:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11164,8263,'fr','Agneau rôti lentement à la cannelle, au fenouil et aux agrumes','Pour un agneau qui fondra en bouche et surprendra votre palais, suivez la recette facile de Sarah Cook','["1 gigot d''agneau","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron et d''1 orange","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle, graines de fenouil et cumin moulu","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées"]','["Mettez l''agneau dans un grand sac de nourriture avec\r\ntout le jus et laisser mariner toute la nuit.","Le lendemain, sortez l''agneau du\r\nau réfrigérateur 1h avant de vouloir le cuisiner.\r\nChauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7. Prendre\r\nl''agneau sorti de la marinade (réserver\r\nreste de la marinade) et séchez-le. Frotter avec\r\nla moitié de l''huile et rôtir pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Retirer l''agneau et réduire le four\r\nà 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 3.","Mélangez les zestes, le reste de l''huile, le miel,\r\népices et ail avec beaucoup d''assaisonnement.\r\nÉtalez une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé dessus\r\nune grande feuille de papier d''aluminium. Posez le gigot d''agneau dessus\r\ndessus, frottez partout avec la pâte et tirez\r\nsur les côtés du papier d''aluminium. Arroser de marinade\r\ndans la base et froisser le papier d''aluminium pour sceller.","Rôtir pendant 4 heures, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très tendre. Repose-toi,\r\nencore enveloppé, pendant 30 minutes. Déballez et\r\nservir avec des jus de fruits."]','2026-01-11 00:09:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11165,8265,'fr','Brochettes de poulet fumées','Un canapé de style tapas composé de brochettes de poulet marinées et grillées, mieux servi avec une trempette à la mayonnaise à l''ail fumé','["6 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau (environ 500 g/1 lb 2 oz)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé (pimenton)","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","aïoli fumé, pour servir (voir conseils ci-dessous)"]','["Il vous faut 15 brochettes : si elles sont en bois, trempez-les\r\ndans l''eau pendant 10 minutes. Couper le poulet en\r\nMorceaux de 3 cm et placez-les dans un bol. Ajouter\r\n1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, les épices, l''ail et\r\nvinaigre, bien mélanger et assaisonner. Vous pouvez\r\nfaites-le jusqu’à un jour avant et réfrigérez.","Enfilez 2-3 morceaux sur chaque brochette.\r\nVersez le reste de l''huile dans une poêle ou frottez\r\nsur une plaque chauffante. Faites chauffer la poêle et\r\nsaisir le poulet pendant 3-4 minutes chacun\r\ncôté – vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots,\r\ngarder les brochettes cuites au chaud dans un\r\nfour bas. Servir avec de l''aïoli fumé si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11166,8267,'fr','Poulet rôti à la sauce crémeuse aux noix','Cette sauce d''inspiration turque constitue une merveilleuse alternative à la sauce au pain classique.','["8 cuisses de poulet, avec la peau et l''os","1 cuillère à café de cumin","½ cuillère à café de paprika","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","6 douleurs pitta","150 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","175g de noix","1 petit oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","50 ml de crème liquide","jus d''1 citron","une poignée de coriandre hachée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDans un plat à rôtir, mélanger le\r\npoulet, cumin, paprika, 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive\r\net l''assaisonnement. Cuire 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle poulet est croustillant et bien cuit.","Pendant ce temps, déchirez 1 pain pitta et\r\nplacer dans un petit bol. Versez-en quelques-uns\r\nà soupe de bouillon de poulet et laisser tremper.\r\nFaire revenir à sec les noix dans une poêle pendant\r\nenviron 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et grillés.\r\nAnnuler. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans le\r\npoêle et cuire l''oignon et l''ail jusqu''à ce que\r\nramolli. Placez le pain pitta ramolli,\r\nmélange d''oignons et la plupart des noix dans\r\nun mixeur. Versez sur le reste du\r\nbouillon de poulet et fouetter ensemble jusqu''à ce que\r\nune pâte grossière se forme. Remettez le mélange\r\nà la poêle. Ajouter la crème et le citron\r\njus, assaisonner et réserver au chaud.","Lorsque le poulet est cuit, disposez\r\nsur un plateau. Incorporer la coriandre\r\nla sauce et verser dans un bol. En gros\r\nhachez le reste des noix et répartissez-les\r\nsur le poulet. Faire griller les pittas, les couper\r\nen quartiers et servir avec"]','2026-01-11 00:09:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11167,8272,'fr','Café aux œufs vietnamien','Ce café sucré après le dîner est comme boire du tiramisu liquide et est notre nouvelle friandise caféinée préférée.','["4 jaunes d''œufs","150 ml de lait concentré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 ml d''espresso fort (environ 4 x doubles expressos)","chocolat noir, râpé (facultatif)"]','["Mettez les jaunes d''œufs, le lait concentré et l''extrait de vanille dans un grand bol à mélanger. Fouetter avec des batteurs électriques pendant au moins 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux.","Mettez 4 verres ou ramequins résistants à la chaleur dans des bols un peu plus grands et à moitié remplis d''eau bouillante (cela permettra de garder le café chaud plus longtemps dans les verres).","Versez le café fraîchement moulu dans les verres en réservant 2 cuillères à soupe, puis garnissez de boules du mélange d''œufs. Versez le reste du café dessus pour qu''il tache la garniture et pénètre. Parsemez d''une pincée de chocolat noir râpé, si vous le souhaitez. Servir immédiatement, avec des cuillères."]','2026-01-11 00:09:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11168,8274,'fr','Burgers vietnamiens au porc et aux cacahuètes','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Mélangez votre menu de semaine avec ces hamburgers de style asiatique, à base de porc haché et parfumés à la sauce d''huîtres, au gingembre et au citron vert.','["500 g de porc haché","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres","6 oignons nouveaux, parés et finement hachés (parties vertes et blanches)","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","½ à 1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1 citron vert, zesté et coupé en quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame ou de tournesol","feuilles de laitue iceberg ou Baby Gem, pour servir","4 pains burger au sésame","25 g de cacahuètes grillées non salées, hachées grossièrement","mayonnaise ou sauce chili douce, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Dans un grand bol, mélanger le porc, la sauce aux huîtres, les oignons nouveaux, le gingembre, les flocons de piment et le zeste de citron vert. Façonnez le mélange en 4 galettes avec vos mains. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen, ajoutez les galettes et faites cuire 8 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites.","Pour servir, déposez des feuilles de laitue sur la moitié inférieure des petits pains et pressez-les avec un peu de jus de citron vert. Ajouter les hamburgers, saupoudrer de cacahuètes et recouvrir avec la moitié supérieure des petits pains. Servir avec les quartiers de citron vert restants et de la mayonnaise ou de la sauce chili douce, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11169,8276,'fr','Porc au caramel à la vietnamienne','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Faites sauter des morceaux de porc avec des échalotes, du gingembre et du piment dans un wok, puis ajoutez la sauce de poisson et la cassonade pour une sauce sucrée, collante et épicée.','["1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide","500 g de steaks d''épaule de porc, coupés en bouchées","2 échalotes, hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement râpé","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","75 g de cassonade","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson, plus un peu au goût","1-2 cuillères à café de sauce chili (nous avons utilisé de la sriracha)","4 oignons nouveaux, coupés en deux et râpés dans le sens de la longueur","riz cuit à la vapeur, pour servir","pak choi, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un wok à feu vif et faites sauter le porc par lots jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré. Retirer avec une écumoire et réserver.","Baissez le feu et ajoutez le reste de l''huile, puis incorporez les échalotes, le gingembre et le piment. Cuire à feu doux pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir. Ajoutez le sucre, la sauce de poisson et 200 ml d''eau dans la casserole et mélangez le tout. Portez à ébullition en remuant pour que le sucre se dissolve, puis remettez le porc dans la poêle. Faites bouillonner vigoureusement pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe pour enrober la viande et devenir brillante. Goûtez et ajoutez un peu plus de sauce de poisson, si nécessaire, avec la sauce chili. Saupoudrer d''oignons nouveaux et servir avec du riz cuit à la vapeur et du pak choi."]','2026-01-11 00:09:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11170,8278,'fr','Poitrine de porc collante avec salade vietnamienne et cacahuètes écrasées','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Aromatisez le porc avec du hoisin, du miel, du soja et du gingembre et servez-le avec une salade croquante de concombre, de radis et d''herbes avec une vinaigrette piquante au piment.','["600 g de poitrine de porc","6 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","3 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","4 cuillères à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","Morceau de 2½ cm de gingembre pelé et finement haché","Riz à la noix de coco, pour servir (voir conseil ci-dessous)","¼ de concombre, coupé en rubans à l''aide d''un épluche-légumes","6 radis, tranchés","75 g de pois mange-tout, coupés en deux horizontalement","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de menthe, grandes feuilles arrachées","2 cuillères à soupe de basilic thaï, grandes feuilles arrachées (utilisez de la coriandre si vous n''en trouvez pas)","1 cuillère à soupe de cacahuète salée, grillée et légèrement écrasée au pilon et au mortier","1 petit piment rouge finement haché","½ gousse d''ail, râpée","jus ½ citron vert (restes de beignets de crabe)","1½ cuillère à café de cassonade claire","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz"]','["Retirez la couenne du porc et mettez la viande dans un grand sac alimentaire refermable ou une cocotte. Dans un bol, mélangez le hoisin, le miel, le vinaigre, le soja, le ketchup et le gingembre, puis versez sur le porc et massez bien. Fermez le sachet ou couvrez le plat et laissez mariner au réfrigérateur au moins 4 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Transférer le porc et sa marinade dans un plat à rôtir bien ajusté, recouvert de papier d''aluminium. Versez dessus 50 ml d''eau, couvrez de papier d''aluminium et faites rôtir pendant 2 heures ou jusqu''à tendreté, en arrosant à mi-cuisson. Sortez le porc et augmentez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Retirez le papier d''aluminium et versez la sauce dans une petite casserole. Portez la sauce à ébullition et laissez-la bouillonner jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit épaisse et sirupeuse. Badigeonnez un peu de sauce sur tout le porc et remettez au four, à découvert, pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit collant et caramélisé par endroits. Transférer sur une planche à découper, couvrir légèrement de papier d''aluminium et laisser reposer 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la salade. Mélanger tous les ingrédients, sauf les cacahuètes, ensemble dans un bol. Pour préparer la vinaigrette, mélanger tous les ingrédients et réserver. Réchauffez le reste de la sauce en ajoutant un peu d''eau si elle est devenue trop épaisse. Mélanger la vinaigrette dans la salade et répartir dans 2 assiettes, puis garnir de cacahuètes écrasées. Coupez le porc en tranches épaisses, disposez-le avec la salade, puis arrosez de sauce. Servir avec du riz à la noix de coco (voir conseil ci-dessous)."]','2026-01-11 00:09:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11171,8280,'fr','Salade de porc vietnamienne','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. La salade vietnamienne de Tom Kime peut être préparée à l''avance, vous permettant de vous détendre lors d''une douce soirée d''été.','["1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","jus de 2 citrons verts","1 piment rouge frais, épépiné et finement haché","une poignée de tiges ou de racines de coriandre hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de chaque huile de sésame, sauce de poisson thaïlandaise et sauce soja légère","50 g de graines de sésame, grillées à sec jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées","500 g de filet de porc dégraissé","huile végétale, pour badigeonner","¼ de chou blanc, râpé","1 concombre, coupé en allumettes","5 branches de céleri, coupées en allumettes","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","2 tiges de citronnelle parées, finement tranchées","le zeste d''1 citron vert","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre et de menthe, hachées"]','["La veille : réaliser la vinaigrette. Mettez le sucre et le jus de citron vert dans une casserole avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et portez à ébullition pour dissoudre le sucre. Ajoutez le piment et la coriandre et remuez bien, puis passez au mélangeur jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez dans un bol, puis incorporez l''huile de sésame, la sauce de poisson, la sauce soja et les graines de sésame pour faire une vinaigrette. Couvrir et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Deux heures avant de servir : faites chauffer une poêle à frire. Préchauffer le four à 200C/gaz 6/chaleur tournante 180C. Badigeonner le porc d''huile et le faire griller sur tous les côtés pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit saisi. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et mettre au four pendant environ 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Laisser refroidir et trancher finement dans le sens inverse des fibres de la viande. Versez dans un bol et versez dessus la moitié de la vinaigrette.","Pour servir : mélanger le reste des ingrédients de la salade dans un bol avec le reste de la vinaigrette. Empilez-les sur une assiette, garnissez-les de tranches de porc et versez-y le jus."]','2026-01-11 00:09:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11172,8282,'fr','Petits pains au porc barbecue','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Plus savoureuse qu''un plat à emporter et idéale à grignoter et à partager. Ces dim sum épateront vos invités.','["85g de sucre","Paquet de 500 g de mélange à pain blanc","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","12 tranches de bacon ou de pancetta non fumé, hachés","noix de gingembre, pelée et hachée","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","3 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","3 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 œuf battu, pour glacer"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz. Mélangez le sucre au mélange à pain dans un grand bol, puis ajoutez de l''eau comme indiqué sur l''emballage. Rassemblez la pâte avec une cuillère en bois, puis pétrissez-la sur une surface légèrement farinée pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse. Mettre dans un grand bol, couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé puis laisser au chaud jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis faites revenir le bacon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant, environ 5 minutes. Ajoutez le gingembre et l''ail et faites revenir 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, puis versez la purée de soja, de miel et de tomate et remuez bien. Peut être préparé jusqu''à 3 jours à l''avance.","Démoulez la pâte et pétrissez brièvement, puis formez 12 boules de taille égale. Aplatissez avec vos mains, puis déposez une goutte de garniture de la taille d''une cuillère à café au milieu. Tirez la pâte et fermez-la comme un sac à main, puis retournez le petit pain et posez-le sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé et laisser lever environ 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit moelleuse. Badigeonner d''œuf et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Servir chaud avec une trempette. Peut être congelé après la deuxième levée jusqu''à 1 mois ou cuit jusqu''à un jour à l''avance et réchauffé."]','2026-01-11 00:09:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11173,8284,'fr','Porc asiatique avec salade de nouilles de riz','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un souper de semaine plein de couleurs et d''épices, avec tout ce qui est bon, et prêt en seulement 20 minutes.','["1 cuillère à café de pâte de citronnelle (nous avons utilisé Bart''s)","1 cuillère à café de gingembre frais finement râpé","½ piment rouge, finement haché","1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","4 côtelettes de porc","200 g de nouilles de riz fines","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","½ concombre","une poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées"]','["Mélangez la pâte de citronnelle, le gingembre, le piment, l''huile et 1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson. Étalez le mélange sur les côtelettes de porc, puis laissez mariner pendant que vous préparez la salade.","Versez les nouilles dans un grand bol. Versez dessus une bouilloire d''eau bouillante, puis laissez reposer 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les nouilles soient tendres (ou préparez-les selon les instructions sur l''emballage). Égouttez les nouilles dans une passoire. Passer sous le robinet d''eau froide jusqu''à refroidissement, puis égoutter à nouveau et remettre dans le bol. Fouettez les 2 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson restantes avec le zeste et le jus de citron vert et le sucre. Versez sur les nouilles froides. Coupez le concombre en fines lanières, puis mélangez-le à la salade avec les feuilles de menthe.","Faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude. Faites griller les côtelettes pendant 5 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites, puis servez-les avec la salade de nouilles."]','2026-01-11 00:09:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11174,8286,'fr','Wraps vietnamiens au poulet','Remplissez des tortillas de farine molles de poulet poêlé, de concombre légèrement mariné et de carottes pour un déjeuner ou un dîner de style asiatique','["½ concombre, coupé en deux, épépiné et tranché","1 petite carotte, râpée","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","8 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en fines lanières","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","25 g de gingembre (poids pelé), finement râpé","3 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","8 mini ou 4 grosses tortillas molles à la farine","2 laitues Little Gem, feuilles séparées et coupées en deux"]','["Mettez le concombre, la carotte et le vinaigre dans un petit bol et réservez. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez le poulet et faites-le frire à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bien cuit. Retirer et réserver. Versez le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et baissez le feu. Ajouter l''ail et le gingembre et cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis mais pas colorés. Ajoutez le sucre, la sauce soja et 150 ml d''eau et faites bouillonner pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit savoureux. Remettez le poulet dans la poêle et faites-le chauffer.","Réchauffez les tortillas en suivant les instructions sur l’emballage. Garnir les tortillas de laitue, de poulet, de concombre et de carottes marinés."]','2026-01-11 00:09:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11175,8288,'fr','Salade de bœuf à la vietnamienne','Allégez le bœuf haché avec cette salade de nouilles d''inspiration asiatique avec des carottes croquantes, des germes de soja et des cacahuètes concassées.','["500 g de bœuf haché","2 piments rouges, 1 finement haché, l''autre émincé","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","100 ml de sauce aux huîtres","3 citrons verts, jus de 2, 1 coupé en quartiers","300 g de nouilles de riz cuites","3 carottes coupées en fine julienne","300 g de germes de soja","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","50 g de cacahuètes non salées, hachées grossièrement"]','["Faites frire le bœuf à sec dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien doré et commence à devenir croustillant, puis retirez le gras. Ajoutez le piment haché et l''ail et faites revenir encore quelques minutes. Ajoutez la sauce aux huîtres et le jus de citron vert et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit collante.","Pour assembler la salade, répartissez les nouilles de riz dans des bols, garnissez de bœuf, puis placez une poignée de carottes, de germes de soja et de feuilles de menthe autour de chaque bol. Saupoudrer de cacahuètes et de piment tranché. Avant de manger, mélangez tous les ingrédients ensemble."]','2026-01-11 00:09:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11176,8290,'fr','Truite au caramel vietnamienne','Une base de caramel équilibre les ingrédients chauds et salés de ce plat de poisson d''inspiration asiatique pour deux','["50 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson thaïlandaise","1 piment rouge, finement tranché","gros morceau de gingembre, finement tranché","2 filets de truite arc-en-ciel","2 têtes de bok choi, coupées en deux","jus ½ citron","brins de coriandre","riz cuit à la vapeur, pour servir"]','["Mettez le sucre dans une grande casserole peu profonde avec un petit peu d''eau. Chauffer doucement en remuant la poêle jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Augmentez le feu et faites bouillonner le sirop jusqu''à ce qu''il prenne une couleur ambrée foncée. Ajoutez la sauce de poisson, la majeure partie du piment et du gingembre, puis ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour diluer. Faire bouillir à nouveau jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient sirupeux, puis ajouter les filets de poisson, côté peau vers le bas, et le bok choi, côté coupé vers le bas.","Couvrir la poêle avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit cuit et que le bok choi soit fané. Éteignez le feu, pressez le citron et parsemez-le du reste de piment, du gingembre et des brins de coriandre. Servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:09:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11177,8292,'fr','Baguettes de poulet vietnamiennes (Bhan Mi)','Farcir votre sandwich de poulet, de carottes, de concombre, d''oignon nouveau et de vinaigrette au piment doux pour une touche asiatique.','["1 petite poitrine de poulet","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de riz","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","jus ½ citron vert","½ petite carotte, pelée et râpée","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","2½ cm de concombre, épépiné et tranché","½ piment rouge, tranché finement en rondelles","1 sandwich-baguette","3-4 feuilles de laitue Little Gem, lavées","1-2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce"]','["Disposez le blanc de poulet entre 2 morceaux de\r\nfilm alimentaire et écraser avec un rouleau à pâtisserie jusqu''à environ\r\n1 cm d''épaisseur. Faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude. Frottez le\r\npoulet avec l''huile, cuire 2-3 minutes par face,\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Laisser refroidir.","Mélanger le vinaigre de riz, le sucre et le citron vert\r\njus, en remuant jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Ajoutez le\r\ncarotte, oignons nouveaux, concombre et piment.","Divisez une baguette sandwich sur le dessus. Des trucs\r\navec les feuilles de Little Gem et émincez le poulet\r\nen haut. Empilez le mélange de carottes et enveloppez-le ou\r\nplacer dans une boîte en plastique. Mettez la sauce chili douce\r\ndans un petit pot portable et quand vient le temps de\r\ndéjeuner, verser sur la sauce juste avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:09:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11178,8294,'fr','Salade vietnamienne de fruits de mer','Une vinaigrette épicée et piquante transforme un sac de poisson décongelé et quelques ingrédients frais en un souper super et réconfortant prêt en seulement 10 minutes.','["Paquet de 400 g de mélange de fruits de mer cuits","300 g de nouilles de riz fines cuites","300 g de germes de soja cuits","3 carottes, tranchées finement","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés dans le sens de la longueur","bouquet de menthe et coriandre, feuilles hachées","5 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 piment rouge, haché","1 bâton de citronnelle, tranchée","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sodium"]','["Pour préparer la salade, mettez tous les légumes et fruits de mer dans un grand bol, en réservant quelques herbes pour le dessus. Mélangez le tout pour que les fruits de mer et les nouilles soient combinés.","Préparez la vinaigrette en mélangeant tous les ingrédients, mélangez-la à la salade, puis répartissez-la dans 5 bols profonds ou empilez-la sur un grand plat et laissez chacun se servir. Répartissez les herbes réservées sur le dessus pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11179,4859,'fr','Salade de crevettes vietnamienne','Inspirée du plat vietnamien Bun xao, cette salade au goût frais contient très peu de gras mais est tellement satisfaisante','["1 petite gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 petit piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","jus de 2 citrons verts","250 g de nouilles de riz fines","Paquet de 150 g de crevettes tigrées cuites, coupées en deux le long de la colonne vertébrale","½ concombre pelé, épépiné et coupé en allumettes","1 carotte, coupée en allumettes ou râpée","6 oignons nouveaux, émincés","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre et/ou de menthe","1 cuillère à soupe de cacahuètes grillées, hachées"]','["Pour faire la vinaigrette, écrasez l''ail,\r\nle piment et le sucre à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier.\r\nAjoutez le jus de citron vert et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et\r\nmélanger. Annuler.","Allumez la bouilloire, mettez les nouilles dedans\r\nun bol, puis couvrir d''eau bouillante.\r\nLaisser reposer 10 minutes jusqu''à tendreté,\r\npuis égouttez et répartissez dans 2 bols.\r\n3 Mélangez les crevettes et les légumes ensemble et\r\nrépartissez également entre les bols. Terminer par\r\ngarnir chaque salade avec les herbes et\r\ncacahuètes, puis verser sur la vinaigrette\r\nservir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11180,8296,'fr','Salade de poulet vietnamienne','Une salade de plat principal sans cuisson avec toutes les saveurs légères et parfumées de l''Asie du Sud-Est comme l''arachide, le piment, la menthe et le soja.','["140 g de nouilles de riz thaïlandaises","1 carotte","½ concombre","2 poitrines de poulet cuites, râpées","50 g de radis émincés","½ oignon rouge, finement tranché","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","25 g de cacahuètes grillées nature, hachées grossièrement","1 petit piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","1½ cuillère à soupe de chaque sauce de poisson, sauce soja faible en sodium et huile de sésame"]','["Pour faire la vinaigrette, fouettez tout le\r\ningrédients ensemble dans une grande portion\r\nbol. Cuire les nouilles suivant le pack\r\ninstructions, puis égouttez-les et ajoutez-les au\r\nbol avec la vinaigrette.","Épluchez la carotte en longues lanières à l''aide\r\nun éplucheur de légumes. Faites de même pour le\r\nconcombre, jusqu''à ce que vous atteigniez les graines\r\n(jetez-les). Ajoutez la carotte et\r\nconcombre au mélange de nouilles\r\navec le poulet émincé, les radis,\r\noignon rouge et menthe. Bien mélanger pour enrober\r\ndans la vinaigrette, parsemer les cacahuètes\r\net servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11181,8298,'fr','Calamars sel et poivre','Un enrobage croustillant et épicé et des calamars chauds et tendres forment une combinaison irrésistible','["85g de maïzena","85 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de poivre noir concassé","2 cuillères à soupe de grains de poivre du Sichuan moulus, grossièrement écrasés","huile de tournesol ou végétale, pour la friture","400 g de calamars nettoyés et coupés en lanières (voir conseils ci-dessous)","oignon nouveau finement tranché et piment vert, pour servir","1 piment rouge, finement haché","demi-concombre, coupé en petits dés","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","100 ml de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson"]','["Pour préparer la trempette, mélangez tous les ingrédients dans un petit bol jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous, puis réservez. Mélangez la maïzena et la farine ordinaire avec les deux poivrons et 2 cuillères à café de sel marin dans un grand bol, puis réservez. Tapisser un plateau de papier absorbant et assurez-vous d''avoir plus de sel à saupoudrer.","Faites chauffer environ 7 cm d''huile à 180°C dans une friteuse, un wok ou une poêle profonde. Si vous n’avez pas de thermomètre, vous pouvez le tester avec un cube de pain : il devrait dorer en 20 secondes. Bien enrober les calamars avec le mélange de farine et les faire frire par lots pendant environ 2 minutes chacun ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants. Utilisez une écumoire pour retirer les calamars, puis égouttez-les sur du papier absorbant et saupoudrez d''un peu plus de sel. Servir les calamars parsemés d''oignons nouveaux et de piment, accompagnés de la trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:09:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11182,8300,'fr','Salade piquante de carottes, chou rouge et oignons','Cette salade automnale constitue un accompagnement frais et sain et est excellente avec du halloumi grillé ou des hamburgers.','["4 carottes, coupées en fins bâtonnets ou râpées","½ chou rouge finement râpé","2 petits oignons rouges, finement tranchés","une poignée de feuilles de menthe","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre","une poignée de cacahuètes grillées, hachées grossièrement","jus de 2 citrons verts","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade molle"]','["Versez les carottes, le chou et les oignons\r\nun bol. Préparez la vinaigrette en remuant le\r\ningrédients ensemble jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit\r\ndissous. Verser sur la salade en mélangeant\r\nlégumes dans la vinaigrette. Ajoutez les herbes,\r\nmélanger à nouveau, puis répartir sur les cacahuètes."]','2026-01-11 00:09:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11183,8302,'fr','Salade de nouilles croquantes aux crevettes','Il est préférable de préparer cette vinaigrette de style vietnamien juste avant de servir pour préserver la couleur vibrante de la menthe.','["100 g de nouilles de riz","100 g de pois mange-tout, émincés","2 carottes, grossièrement râpées","100 g de bébés épinards","85 g de crevettes décortiquées et cuites, décongelées si congelées","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe grossièrement hachée"]','["Versez de l''eau bouillante sur les nouilles pour les couvrir,\r\nlaisser reposer 4 minutes, puis laisser refroidir à froid\r\nl''eau. Bien égoutter. Mélangez les snaps au sucre,\r\ncarottes, épinards, nouilles et crevettes\r\nun bol peu profond. Mélanger la vinaigrette\r\ningrédients jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous,\r\nverser sur la salade, puis mélanger le tout\r\nensemble. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:09:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11184,8304,'fr','Rouleaux d''été vietnamiens aux crevettes','Rouleaux de papier de riz au goût frais remplis de crustacés, de vermicelles légers, de carottes, de concombre et d''herbes, accompagnés d''une trempette sucrée au gingembre et au piment','["2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 petit piment rouge (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant), haché finement","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","jus 1 citron vert","100 g de nouilles de riz vermicelles ou de nouilles aux haricots","12 x 20 cm de papier de riz rond (voir astuce ci-dessous)","une poignée de feuilles de menthe","18 crevettes cuites, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","2-3 grosses feuilles de laitue iceberg, déchirées en 12 morceaux","1 carotte, coupée en fins bâtonnets","une poignée de coriandre","une poignée de basilic thaï","une poignée de ciboulette longue","50 g de germes de soja"]','["Préparez la trempette en\r\npiler l''ail, le piment,\r\ngingembre et sucre ensemble\r\nà l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier, puis remuez\r\ndans la sauce de poisson et le jus de citron vert.\r\nAlternativement, il suffit de tout blitzer\r\nensemble dans un mini mixeur.","Faire tremper les nouilles de riz\r\nun bol d''eau chaude pour\r\n15 minutes, puis bien égoutter.\r\nAssemblez toute la garniture préparée\r\ningrédients – une fois que vous avez commencé,\r\nvous aurez besoin de tout à portée de main.","Quand vous êtes prêt à faire\r\nles petits pains, tremper un des riz\r\npapiers dans un bol d''eau chaude,\r\nle déplacer jusqu''à ce que tout soit\r\nl''emballage est mou – environ 10-15 secondes\r\n– puis égouttez-les sur un torchon.","Placer une feuille de riz\r\nsur une planche et sur un bord\r\nde l''emballage, ajoutez un peu de menthe\r\nfeuilles, puis trois moitiés de crevette.","Déposez un peu de laitue dessus\r\ndes crevettes, suivi de\r\nquelques nouilles, quelques lanières de\r\ncarotte et concombre, un peu plus\r\ndes herbes et enfin quelques germes de soja.\r\nNe remplissez pas trop les crêpes, sinon elles\r\nsera difficile à rouler.","Soulevez le bord du riz\r\nemballage en papier le plus proche\r\nà toi pour le remplissage\r\net, en tenant le remplissage\r\npositionnez-vous avec vos doigts,\r\ncommencez à rouler fermement.","Quand tu es à mi-chemin,\r\nplier les extrémités de la feuille de riz\r\ndans et sur la garniture afin que\r\nil est complètement clos.","Continuez à rouler fermement jusqu''à ce que\r\nl''emballage en papier de riz entier\r\nest enroulé. Pour servir, coupez le\r\nroule en deux sur la diagonale."]','2026-01-11 00:09:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11185,8306,'fr','Salade croquante de choux asiatiques et crevettes','Ce plat principal sans cuisson regorge d''ingrédients bons pour la santé','["250 g de chou chinois","175g/60z de chou blanc","2 branches de céleri","2 carottes","une petite poignée de menthe hachée","une petite poignée de coriandre hachée","200 g de grosses crevettes cuites décortiquées","4 cuillères à soupe de cacahuètes grillées, hachées","1-2 petits piments rouges, tranchés","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson"]','["Râpez les choux, le céleri et la carotte\r\nfinement à la mandoline ou râpez-les sur le\r\nles plus gros trous sur une râpe. Ajouter la menthe\r\net coriandre aux légumes accompagnés\r\navec les crevettes. Mélangez le tout ensemble.","Préparez la vinaigrette en fouettant tout le\r\ningrédients ensemble. Habillez la salade\r\net versez-le dans un bol, saupoudrez-le\r\ncacahuètes et servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:09:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11186,8308,'fr','Salade vietnamienne de crevettes et nouilles aux échalotes croustillantes','Préparer les échalotes frites pour cette salade super saine est facultatif, mais cela en vaut la peine : elles sont incroyablement délicieuses.','["200 g de nouilles de riz fines","200 g de grosses crevettes cuites et décortiquées","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché","1 petit piment rouge, tranché","1 petit concombre coupé en rubans (utiliser un éplucheur)","1 grosse poignée de coriandre et de menthe","2 cuillères à soupe de cacahuètes grillées, hachées grossièrement","jus de 3 citrons verts","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade molle","2 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","5 échalotes, tranchées finement","huile végétale, pour la friture","farine, pour saupoudrer"]','["Pour les échalotes croustillantes, faites chauffer 5 cm d''huile\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud dans un wok. Vous saurez que l''huile est\r\nassez chaud quand un morceau d''échalote\r\ngrésille dès qu''il est déposé.\r\nles tranches d''échalotes avec la farine, secouez\r\nl''excédent et faire revenir dans l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ils\r\nfaire frire rapidement, environ 1 min. Égoutter sur la cuisine\r\npapier, saupoudrer de sel et réserver.","Pour faire la vinaigrette, mélangez le citron vert\r\njus, sucre, sauce de poisson et ail et mettre\r\nde côté. Dans un grand bol à mélanger, versez le bouillon bouillant\r\narroser sur les nouilles. Laissez-les pour\r\n2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste cuits, puis\r\nrincer à l''eau froide. Bien égoutter en secouant\r\nle tamis plusieurs fois pour faire sortir le\r\nl''excès d''eau, puis remettez-le dans le\r\nbol. Ajouter les crevettes, l''oignon, le piment, le concombre\r\net des herbes. Versez la vinaigrette dessus, mélangez,\r\npuis saupoudrez d''échalotes et de cacahuètes."]','2026-01-11 00:09:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11187,8310,'fr','Colis de légumes vietnamiens','Envie de quelque chose d''un peu différent ? Essayez ces colis de légumes sains, à base de petits pains vietnamiens','["2 paquets de 50 g de crêpes à la farine de riz","50 g de nouilles de riz fines","1 poitrine de poulet cuite sans peau, râpée","1 carotte, tranchée finement","½ concombre, finement râpé","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché finement","Laitue Baby Gem, coriandre et feuilles de menthe, pour servir","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson thaïlandaise","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","presser le citron vert","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement tranché"]','["Faire tremper les crêpes à la farine de riz selon le paquet\r\ninstructions ou dans l''eau bouillante pendant 30 secondes. Supprimer\r\net laisser refroidir sur du papier absorbant. Faire tremper les nouilles de riz\r\nselon les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez et coupez\r\nformez-les en bandes de 2 cm.","Disposez une galette de riz sur une planche et disposez-en\r\nnouilles de riz, poulet, légumes et feuilles d''herbes\r\nenviron un tiers de la hauteur, en laissant un bord de 1 cm au niveau\r\nle côté. Repliez les côtés sur les légumes puis\r\nrouler dans le sens de la longueur pour faire un cigare. Conserver au réfrigérateur,\r\nrecouvert de papier absorbant humide jusqu''à 1 jour.","Mélanger les ingrédients de la trempette\r\nsauce et mettre dans un bol. Pour servir, disposez le\r\nroule sur une assiette avec les feuilles et les herbes.\r\nPour manger, enveloppez chaque petit pain dans un morceau de laitue avec un\r\nbrin d''herbes et tremper dans la sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:09:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11188,6124,'fr','Salade asiatique de crevettes et d''ananas','Cette salade de plat principal sans cuisson peut simplement être préparée et servie seule, ou avec du riz cuit à la vapeur ou des nouilles bouillies.','["1 petit ananas ou 350 g de morceaux d''ananas","140 g de germes de soja","250 g de gambas cuites","½ concombre pelé, épépiné et tranché en angle","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","une poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées très grossièrement","50 g de noix de cajou non salées, grillées si vous le souhaitez","½ piment rouge épépiné et tranché","1 gousse d''ail","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","jus de 2 citrons verts","1½ cuillère à café de sauce de poisson"]','["Écrasez le piment, l''ail et le sucre pour\r\nune pâte à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier ou\r\npetit processeur. Incorporer le jus de citron vert\r\net la sauce de poisson, puis réserver.","Peler, couper en quartiers, épépiner et trancher l''ananas\r\nsous un angle. Mélanger avec des germes de soja,\r\ncrevettes, concombre et tomate et quelques\r\ndu pansement. Empilez dans des bols et dispersez\r\nà la menthe et aux noix de cajou. Arrosez avec le\r\nreste de la vinaigrette et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11189,8312,'fr','Salade de bol de nouilles','Salade fraîche et saine pour le pique-nique','["½ paquet de 250 g de nouilles de riz moyennes","200 g de pois mange-tout, tranchés dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement en diagonale","paquet de coriandre, grossièrement déchirée","Paquet de 150 g de saumon fumé à chaud","bretzel ou petit pain, pour servir","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide ou de tournesol","1 gousse d''ail dodue, finement râpée","racine de gingembre, grossièrement râpée"]','["Déposez les nouilles dans un grand bol, puis versez suffisamment d''eau bouillante pour couvrir. Versez les morceaux de sucre tranchés et laissez reposer 4 minutes. Égoutter dans une passoire, passer sous l''eau froide courante pour refroidir, puis égoutter à nouveau. Versez dans un bol et ajoutez l''huile de sésame.","Mélangez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette. Empilez les oignons nouveaux, la coriandre et le saumon sur les nouilles, versez dessus la vinaigrette et mélangez le tout. Servir avec un bretzel ou un petit pain."]','2026-01-11 00:09:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11190,8314,'fr','Salade asiatique de poulet à la menthe','Égayez une salade de poulet, rendez-la mentholée puis ajoutez quelques saveurs asiatiques','["250 g de nouilles de riz fines","2 poitrines de poulet cuites sans peau, râpées","½ concombre, coupé en deux et tranché","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","1 piment rouge, finement haché","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja ou de poisson","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","2 cuillères à café de sucre","20 g de menthe en paquet, feuilles uniquement, hachées grossièrement"]','["Faire tremper les nouilles pendant 5 minutes dans de l''eau bouillante ou selon les instructions sur l''emballage, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies. Égouttez, puis laissez refroidir sous le robinet. Bien égoutter à nouveau, puis verser dans un grand bol avec le poulet, le concombre, les oignons nouveaux et le piment.","Mélangez la sauce soja ou de poisson, le zeste et le jus de citron vert et le sucre, puis versez sur les nouilles. Mélanger les feuilles de menthe et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11191,6042,'fr','Wraps aux rouleaux de printemps aux crevettes','Ces bouchées saines constituent un excellent déjeuner léger ou une collation avec un petit bol de sauce chili douce.','["1 paquet de nouilles de riz séchées (environ 60 g)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","Paquet de 300 g de légumes frais sautés – optez pour un mélange de feuilles","racine de gingembre frais d''un demi-doigt, râpée","petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges finement tranchées, feuilles grossièrement hachées","200 g de crevettes crues décortiquées, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce, plus un peu pour servir","8 petites feuilles de pâte filo","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7. Cuire\r\nles nouilles selon les instructions sur l''emballage.\r\nFaites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans un grand wok ou une friture antiadhésive\r\ncasserole. Faites sauter les légumes, le gingembre et\r\ntiges de coriandre pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce que presque\r\ncuit, mais toujours avec un peu de croquant. Jeter\r\nles crevettes pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient roses, puis incorporez le\r\nsauce chili douce, feuilles de coriandre et\r\nnouilles, puis retirer du feu.","Badigeonner 4 feuilles de filo avec un peu d''huile,\r\npuis recouvrez avec les feuilles restantes. Pile un\r\nquart du mélange de crevettes le long de l''étroit\r\nbord de chaque feuille, repliez les bords, puis\r\nroulez pour obtenir 4 gros rouleaux de printemps. Ces\r\npeut maintenant être congelé jusqu''à 1 mois ; décongeler\r\nsoigneusement avant de cuire comme ci-dessous. Brosse\r\navec le reste d''huile, saupoudrer de sésame\r\ngraines si vous en utilisez, puis cuire au four sur une plaque à pâtisserie,\r\ncouture vers le bas, pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et\r\ncroustillant. Servir avec une salade verte, et un bon\r\nune cuillerée de sauce chili supplémentaire sur le côté."]','2026-01-11 00:09:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11192,8316,'fr','Salade orientale de canard','Qui a dit qu’un dîner de canard devait coûter cher ? Faites aller plus loin votre viande avec cette salade pleine de saveurs','["1 cuisse de canard","1 cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","140 g de nouilles de riz","1 branche de céleri, coupée en allumettes","1 carotte, coupée en allumettes","½ concombre épépiné et coupé en allumettes","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nFrottez toute la cuisse de canard avec\r\ncinq épices et assaisonnement, déposer sur\r\nune plaque à pâtisserie et rôtir pendant 25 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les nouilles de riz\r\nen suivant les instructions de l''emballage. Vidanger\r\net refroidir sous l''eau froide courante,\r\npuis égouttez-les à nouveau et mélangez\r\navec le céleri, la carotte, le concombre\r\net oignons nouveaux. Quand il fait frais\r\nsuffisamment pour être manipulé, retirez le\r\nviande de canard et peau croustillante de\r\nl''os et déchiquetez-le finement.","Pour faire la vinaigrette, mélangez\r\nle hoisin et la sauce soja avec\r\n2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Divisez les nouilles\r\nentre deux assiettes et dessus\r\navec le canard effiloché. Bruine\r\nsur la vinaigrette et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11193,8318,'fr','Salade de crevettes Bang Bang','Prête en 20 minutes, cette jolie salade peut tout aussi bien être réalisée avec du poulet si vous n''êtes pas d''humeur fruits de mer','["140 g de nouilles de riz plates","3 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète croquant","4 cuillères à soupe de lait de coco demi-écrémé","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","1 concombre pelé, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur, épépiné et tranché","300 g de germes de soja en paquet","Un paquet de 200 g de crevettes cuites décortiquées"]','["Cuire les nouilles suivant le pack\r\ninstructions, puis rincer sous l''eau froide\r\net égouttez-les soigneusement. Dans une petite casserole\r\nfaire fondre ensemble le beurre de cacahuète, la noix de coco\r\nlait, sauce chili douce et la moitié du\r\noignons nouveaux, en ajoutant 1-2 cuillères à soupe d''eau\r\npour ramollir le mélange jusqu''à obtenir un filet\r\ncohérence.","Mélangez les nouilles, le concombre et\r\ngermes de soja dans un plat de service. Garnir de\r\nles crevettes, arroser de cacahuète\r\nsauce et répartir sur le reste\r\noignons nouveaux."]','2026-01-11 00:09:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11194,8320,'fr','Sauté de tofu, légumes verts et noix de cajou','Sain, léger et rapide – juste ce dont vous avez besoin pour un repas après le travail','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 tête de brocoli, coupée en petits bouquets","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement tranché","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","140 g de graines de soja","2 têtes de pak choi, coupées en quartiers","2 paquets de 150 g de morceaux de tofu marinés","1 ½ cuillère à soupe de sauce hoisin","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja réduite en sel (ajoutez-en un peu selon votre goût)","25 g de noix de cajou grillées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok antiadhésif. Ajoutez le\r\nbrocoli, puis faire revenir à feu vif pendant 5 min\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si\r\nça commence à attraper. Ajouter l''ail et le piment,\r\nfaire frire pendant 1 min, puis remuer jusqu''au printemps\r\noignons, graines de soja, pak choi et tofu.\r\nFaites sauter pendant 2-3 minutes. Ajouter le hoisin, le soja\r\net des noix pour réchauffer."]','2026-01-11 00:09:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11195,8322,'fr','Soupe asiatique aux nouilles et à la dinde','Cette soupe ressemble un peu au pho, un bouillon vietnamien traditionnellement préparé à base de bœuf et servi avec une assiette d''herbes fraîches piquantes, de piment et de citron vert en accompagnement.','["1½ l de bouillon de dinde ou de poulet","morceau de racine de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et tranché","Anis étoilé 2","1 bâton de cannelle","3 clous de girofle","200 g de nouilles de riz séchées, de tout type","2-3 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","2 citrons verts, un en jus, un pour les quartiers","400 g de dindes rôties, émincées","100 g de germes de soja","bouquet de coriandre","bouquet de menthe","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","2 piments rouges, tranchés (laissez les graines si vous l''aimez chaud)"]','["Versez le bouillon dans une grande casserole, ajoutez le\r\ngingembre et épices, puis laisser mijoter et\r\ninfuser 10 mn. Faire tremper les nouilles selon\r\naux instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez et rincez.","Ajouter la sauce de poisson et le jus de citron vert au\r\nbouillon et goût pour l’assaisonnement – ajoutez-en plus\r\nsauce de poisson si vous le souhaitez. Divisez les nouilles\r\nentre quatre bols, puis garnir avec le\r\nviande râpée, germes de soja et saupoudrage\r\nd''herbes, de ciboule et de piments. Versez le\r\nbouillon chaud sur les nouilles, puis servir avec\r\nplus d''herbes et de quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11196,8324,'fr','Potée végétarienne vietnamienne','Un plat de souper réchauffant, aromatique sans être épicé, pour que les enfants puissent aussi en profiter','["2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","morceau de gingembre frais de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","½ grosse courge musquée, pelée et coupée en morceaux","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja","2 cuillères à café de cassonade molle","200 ml de bouillon de légumes","100 g de haricots verts parés et tranchés","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","feuilles de coriandre et riz basmati ou jasmin cuit, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un récipient de taille moyenne à couvercle\r\ncasserole. Ajoutez le gingembre et l''ail, puis\r\nfaire sauter pendant environ 5 minutes. Ajouter la courge, le soja\r\nsauce, sucre et bouillon. Couvrir puis laisser mijoter\r\npendant 10 minutes. Retirez le couvercle, ajoutez le vert\r\nharicots, puis cuire encore 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nla courge et les haricots sont tendres. Remuez le printemps\r\noignons à la dernière minute, puis\r\nsaupoudrer de coriandre et servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:09:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11197,4413,'fr','Salade asiatique au poulet','Cette salade facile à préparer regorge de saveurs piquantes – la version simplifiée est également idéale pour les boîtes à lunch des enfants','["1 poitrine de poulet désossée et sans peau","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","le zeste et le jus de ½ citron vert (environ 1 cuillère à soupe)","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","Sachet de 100 g de feuilles de salade mélangées","une grosse poignée de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","¼ d''oignon rouge, tranché finement","½ piment épépiné et tranché finement","¼ concombre, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur, tranché"]','["Couvrir le poulet d''eau froide,\r\nporter à ébullition, puis cuire 10 min.\r\nRetirer de la poêle et déchirer\r\ndes lambeaux. Mélanger la sauce de poisson, le citron vert\r\nle zeste, le jus et le sucre jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous.","Placez les feuilles et la coriandre dans un\r\nrécipient, puis garnir de poulet,\r\noignon, piment et concombre. Placez le\r\nvinaigrette dans un récipient séparé et mélanger\r\nà travers la salade au moment de manger."]','2026-01-11 00:09:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11198,8326,'fr','Soupe de nouilles au saumon','Cette soupe de nouilles saine est faible en gras, saine pour le cœur et regorge d''ingrédients savoureux.','["1l de bouillon de poulet faible en sel","2 cuillères à café de pâte de curry rouge thaï","100 g de nouilles de riz plates","150 g de champignons shiitake tranchés","Paquet de 125 g de maïs miniature, tranché","2 filets de saumon sans peau, tranchés","jus de 2 citrons verts","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja réduite en sel","pincée de cassonade","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée"]','["Versez le bouillon dans une grande casserole, apportez\r\nporter à ébullition, puis incorporer la pâte de curry.\r\nAjoutez les nouilles et laissez cuire 8 min.\r\nAjoutez les champignons et le maïs et faites cuire\r\npendant 2 minutes de plus.","Ajouter le saumon dans la poêle et cuire\r\npendant 3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit.\r\nRetirer du feu et incorporer le\r\njus de citron vert, sauce soja et une pincée de\r\nsucre. Verser dans 4 bols et saupoudrer\r\nsur la coriandre juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11199,7321,'fr','Jarret d''agneau vietnamien aux patates douces','Fondants et pleins de saveurs asiatiques classiques, ces jarrets d''agneau sont parfaits pour la congélation','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","4 jarrets d''agneau d''environ 350 g chacun","2 oignons, coupés en deux et coupés en demi-lunes","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre frais finement haché","3 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","2 piments rouges, tous deux épépinés, un haché et un tranché finement","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade molle, plus 1 cuillère à café","Anis 3 étoiles","2 tiges de citronnelle, feuilles extérieures coriaces enlevées, puis meurtries","1,2 l de bouillon d''agneau","1½ cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","4 patates douces pelées et coupées en gros morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce de poisson","jus de 2 citrons verts","une grosse poignée de feuilles de menthe déchirées","une poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une cocotte à fond épais, assaisonnez les jarrets, puis faites-les revenir 2 à la fois sur toutes les faces, en ajoutant le reste d''huile pour la deuxième fournée. Retirez l''agneau et ajoutez les oignons. Faites-les frire assez vivement, environ 30 secondes, ajoutez le gingembre, l''ail et le piment haché, puis baissez le feu et laissez cuire 1 min. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre, remuez, puis ajoutez l''anis étoilé, la citronnelle, le bouillon, la purée et l''assaisonnement. Porter à ébullition.","Couvrir et cuire au four 1h30, puis ajouter les patates douces et cuire encore 1h. L''agneau doit être complètement tendre et presque tomber des os. Incorporez la sauce de poisson, le jus de citron vert et 1 cuillère à café de sucre pour rehausser la saveur, puis parsemez de menthe, de basilic et de piment tranché pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11200,3652,'fr','Taboulé de chou rouge et orange sanguine','Dégustez cette vibrante salade de taboulé avec vos grillades préférées. Avec du chou rouge, des canneberges séchées et des graines de grenade, c''est parfait à Noël','["200 g de boulgour","50 g de canneberges séchées","1 citron , zesté et pressé","1 échalote , tranchée finement","½ chou rouge , tranché finement","une petite poignée de persil finement haché","une petite poignée de brins de menthe, feuilles cueillies et finement hachées","2 oranges sanguines, pelées et pelées, coupées en fines tranches","75 g de graines de grenade","75 g de noix hachées grossièrement","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 orange sanguine, jus","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","50 ml d''huile d''olive"]','["Mettez le boulgour et les canneberges dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et versez dessus suffisamment d''eau bouillante pour couvrir d''environ 2 cm. Couvrir le bol et laisser tremper 15 minutes. Égoutter et transférer dans un bol de service. Ajoutez le zeste de citron, les échalotes et le chou. Mélangez bien.","Versez le jus de citron dans un petit bol avec les ingrédients de la vinaigrette, sauf l''huile. Bien mélanger, puis verser l''huile lentement, en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Assaisonner au goût.","Ajoutez le persil, la menthe et les oranges sanguines au mélange de boulgour avec la plupart des graines de grenade et des noix. Mélangez le tout avec la vinaigrette et assaisonnez à votre goût. Servir dans un grand bol avec le reste des graines de grenade et des noix éparpillées sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:09:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11201,3654,'fr','Carottes glacées au miso avec trempette fouettée à la ricotta','Essayez ces carottes glacées au miso avec une trempette crémeuse à la ricotta et une garniture de pistaches écrasées. Il fera un excellent ajout à un plateau de fête de Noël','["1 kg de carottes, coupées en deux ou en quartiers si épaisses","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","75g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ cuillère à soupe de miso rouge","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","250 g de gazon","½ citron , zesté et pressé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","25 g de pistaches hachées grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez les carottes dans une plaque à rôtir avec un peu d''assaisonnement et l''huile d''olive. Mélanger et rôtir pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très légèrement dorés.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le beurre et l’huile de sésame dans une casserole à feu moyen. Une fois fondu et moussant, incorporez l''ail, le miso, les flocons de piment et le miel. Cuire pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à réduction et légèrement épaissi. Versez-le sur les carottes rôties et remuez bien pour qu''elles soient bien enrobées. Remettre au four et rôtir encore 30 minutes.","Pour faire la trempette, mélangez la ricotta, le zeste de citron et l''huile d''olive jusqu''à consistance lisse. Assaisonner au goût avec du sel, du poivre et du jus de citron. Répartir sur un plat de service et garnir de carottes chaudes, en arrosant le dessus du jus de torréfaction. Répartir sur les pistaches pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11202,3656,'fr','La reine des puddings d''Angela Hartnett','J''adore la reine des puddings. Chapelure imbibée de lait, œuf parfumé à la vanille, confiture dessus puis meringue. Et quand c’est bien fait, c’est délicieux. C’est aussi un excellent moyen d’utiliser du vieux pain ou des restes de confitures, c’est donc un indispensable dans une armoire de magasin. N’utilisez pas de confiture sucrée car le tout deviendra alors extrêmement sucré.','["25 g de beurre doux, plus un peu pour graisser","570 ml de lait entier","100 g de sucre en poudre","3 œufs , séparés","le zeste finement râpé d''un citron non traité","5 cuillères à soupe de confiture de framboise","crème liquide, pour servir"]','["Préchauffer le four à 170°C/150°C chaleur tournante/Gaz 3 et graisser un plat de service ovale allant au four de 24 cm avec un peu de beurre.","Faites chauffer le lait dans une casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement chaud. Mettez la chapelure dans un bol, versez dessus le lait et laissez tremper la chapelure pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout le liquide soit absorbé.","Battez légèrement les jaunes d''œufs à la fourchette, puis ajoutez-les à la chapelure imbibée avec 50 g de sucre semoule, les 25 g de beurre et le zeste de citron. Remuer pour bien mélanger, puis transférer dans le plat de service et cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et pris. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir.","Réduisez la température du four à 140°C/120°C ventilateur/Gaz 1.","Réchauffez doucement la confiture dans une petite casserole pour la détendre et répartissez-la uniformément sur la chapelure prise.","Versez les blancs d''œufs dans un bol propre et, à l''aide d''un fouet électrique à main, fouettez jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous. Ajoutez petit à petit les 175 g de sucre en poudre restants, en fouettant entre chaque ajout, jusqu''à obtenir une belle meringue brillante et aux pics mous. Versez la meringue sur le dessus de la confiture, en utilisant la cuillère pour faire des petits pics - comme les pics de la couronne de la reine - ou vous pouvez mettre la meringue dans une poche à douille et la dresser sur le dessus.","Cuire le pudding encore 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la meringue soit dorée. Servir avec de la crème encore tiède."]','2026-01-11 00:09:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11203,3658,'fr','Salade de pommes de terre écrasées, aneth, feta et oignons rouges marinés','Recherchez les pommes de terre grelots Morrisons Market Street pour préparer cette salade à la feta piquante – elle se marie bien avec de la viande ou du poisson grillé.','["1 oignon rouge , finement tranché","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge ou blanc","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","750 g de pommes de terre grelots Morrisons Market Street","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la plaque à pâtisserie","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon","½ petit bouquet d''aneth , finement haché","100 g de feta émiettée"]','["Mettez l''oignon dans un petit bol non métallique et ajoutez le vinaigre, le sucre, une pincée de sel et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Couvrir et laisser mariner au moins 30 minutes.","Faites cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres – un couteau à couverts devrait pouvoir les percer facilement. Bien égoutter. Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Versez les pommes de terre dans une plaque à rôtir et appuyez à l''aide du fond huilé d''un verre, d''un ramequin ou d''une spatule jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient écrasées. Assurez-vous que les pommes de terre sont en une seule couche sur le plateau, puis arrosez de 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et assaisonnez. Rôtir pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés et croustillants.","Égouttez les oignons marinés en réservant le liquide de marinade. Fouetter l''huile d''olive extra vierge, la moutarde de Dijon et la majeure partie de l''aneth dans le liquide réservé. Versez les pommes de terre écrasées sur un plat de service. Émietter la feta et verser sur la vinaigrette. Répartir le reste de l''aneth et les oignons marinés."]','2026-01-11 00:09:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11204,3660,'fr','Orzo et citron','Préparez cet orzo et utilisez-le comme base. Prévoyez du temps le week-end pour le préparer, puis servez-le plus tard dans la semaine en utilisant nos idées de recettes ci-dessous','["50g de beurre","500 g d''orzo","2 cubes de bouillon de poulet","1 citron , zesté","une grosse poignée d''herbes douces finement hachées, comme la ciboulette, l''aneth et le basilic","un bon filet de jus de citron"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre dans une poêle à feu moyen. Versez l’orzo et remuez bien pour combiner. Faire griller pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, puis émietter sur les cubes de bouillon de poulet.","Augmentez le feu et versez dessus 1,3 litre d''eau bouillante et laissez cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à tendreté, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire.","Laisser refroidir à température ambiante, puis incorporer le zeste de citron et les herbes douces finement hachées. Assaisonnez selon votre goût et ajoutez un bon filet de jus de citron. Laisser refroidir, puis transférer dans des contenants hermétiques et réserver au réfrigérateur jusqu''à utilisation. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à quatre jours. Utilisez-le pour préparer notre orzo au citron avec de la truite ou du poulet mariné avec de l''orzo et de la feta."]','2026-01-11 00:09:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11205,3664,'fr','Nectarines pochées au gingembre et à la cardamome','Présentez des nectarines de saison avec une touche d''épices dans un sirop de rose parfumé. A déguster avec de la glace, de la crème ou du mascarpone','["12 gousses de cardamome verte","200g de sucre semoule","30 g de gingembre frais, coupé en tranches de 2 cm d''épaisseur et écrasé","4 grosses nectarines fermes, juste mûres, lavées, coupées en deux et dénoyautées",", crème fouettée, crème caillée ou mascarpone (ou alternative végétalienne), pour servir"]','["Écrasez la cardamome à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Une fois les graines libérées, réservez les gousses et réduisez les graines en poudre grossière.","Dans une grande casserole (suffisamment grande pour accueillir les nectarines coupées en deux en une seule couche), mélangez 625 ml d''eau, le sucre, la moitié du gingembre, la moitié des gousses de cardamome et des graines écrasées et une pincée de sel. Porter à ébullition à feu moyen-vif, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve, environ 8 à 10 minutes.","Réduisez le feu à moyen-doux et, à l’aide d’une écumoire, ajoutez délicatement les nectarines, côté coupé vers le bas, au sirop. Pochez environ 3 min, puis retournez délicatement avec l''écumoire – le sirop commencera à changer de couleur et deviendra rose clair. Continuez à pocher pendant 3 à 4 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre – un couteau bien aiguisé au centre devrait se glisser facilement avec seulement une touche de résistance. Les peaux peuvent également commencer à glisser. Le temps de cuisson varie en fonction de la taille et de la maturité du fruit.","À l''aide d''une écumoire, transférez les nectarines dans un récipient suffisamment grand pour les fruits et le sirop. Laisser refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulé et, si vous le souhaitez, retirer délicatement les peaux et les jeter.","Porter le sirop à ébullition à feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce qu''il soit réduit et légèrement sirupeux, environ 10 minutes. Éteignez le feu et incorporez le reste du gingembre, les graines et les gousses de cardamome. Couvrir et laisser refroidir à température ambiante.","Passer le sirop à travers une passoire fine dans le récipient contenant les nectarines. Couvrir et réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Servir les nectarines au sirop tièdes, à température ambiante, ou bien fraîches avec votre choix de glace, crème ou mascarpone."]','2026-01-11 00:09:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11206,3666,'fr','Salade de melon sucré, feuille de curry et burrata','Préparez cette salade une fois et vous la préparerez tout l’été. Le melon, la feuille de curry et la burrata sont peut-être une combinaison improbable, mais elle est douce, épicée, crémeuse et aromatique.','["1 melon mûr, ou un mélange de miellat et de cantaloup fonctionne bien (environ 700 g au total, poids préparé)","1 échalote banane, tranchée finement","2 boules de burrata (125g chacune)","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","10 feuilles de curry fraîches","2 cuillères à café de graines de nigelle","1 piment vert épépiné et finement haché","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à café de miel"]','["Pour la vinaigrette, faites chauffer l’huile dans une petite poêle à feu moyen. Ajoutez les feuilles de curry et faites grésiller pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient aromatiques (faites attention car elles vont cracher). Ajoutez les graines de nigelle pendant les 30 dernières secondes. Versez l''huile chaude, les feuilles de curry et les graines dans un bol et laissez refroidir.","Mélanger le reste des ingrédients de la vinaigrette avec l''huile de feuille de curry et bien assaisonner.","Disposez le melon et les échalotes sur une assiette, arrosez de l''essentiel de la vinaigrette et mélangez légèrement avec vos mains. Laisser macérer 20 à 30 min à température ambiante.","Placez la burrata dans la salade, déchirez délicatement chaque boule et assaisonnez avec un peu de sel marin feuilleté. Verser sur le reste de la vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:09:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11207,3668,'fr','Tacos croustillants aux champignons et piments marinés','Servez ces tacos avec de l''avocat crémeux et des piments marinés piquants. Rôtir une variété de champignons pour introduire une texture charnue au plat','["600g de champignons émincés (nous avons utilisé un mélange de châtaignes, pleurotes royales, pleurotes, enoki et boutons)","1 oignon rouge , coupé en fines tranches","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de coriandre séchée","2 cuillères à café de menthe séchée","150 g de yaourt à la grecque","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","10 g de ciboulette finement tranchée","12 tortillas de maïs","1 avocat, tranché, pour servir","2 piments rouges , finement tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 citron vert, jus","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre"]','["Commencez par préparer les piments marinés. Mettez les piments dans un petit bol, versez dessus le vinaigre de vin blanc, le jus de citron vert et le sucre en poudre, ainsi qu''une pincée de sel. Réserver 30 min.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 220°C/200°C/gaz 7. Répartissez les champignons et l''oignon rouge dans une rôtissoire, arrosez d''huile, puis saupoudrez de coriandre, de menthe, de sel et de poivre. Rôtir pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, croustillants et rétrécis, en remuant à mi-cuisson.","Mélangez le yaourt avec le vinaigre de vin blanc et la ciboulette et assaisonnez avec du sel, du poivre et une pincée de sucre.","Réchauffez les tortillas au four pendant quelques minutes, puis ajoutez les champignons, un peu de yaourt aux herbes et d''avocat et parsemez les piments marinés."]','2026-01-11 00:09:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11208,3670,'fr','Pommes de terre nouvelles fumées et oignons nouveaux carbonisés','Servez cet accompagnement de pommes de terre nouvelles dans le cadre d''une tartinade au barbecue. Il se marie parfaitement avec notre recette de poulet à la spatchcock glacé à l''érable et à la moutarde.','["1,2 kg de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux, les grosses en quartiers","6 oignons nouveaux, parés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","50g de beurre doux","copeaux de bois (facultatif)"]','["Versez les pommes de terre dans une casserole, couvrez d''eau froide salée, portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste tendres. Bien égoutter et laisser refroidir. Se conserve au frais pendant 24 heures.","Lorsque votre barbecue est chaud, faites revenir les oignons nouveaux dans l''huile d''olive et assaisonnez. Placer directement sur le barbecue à feu vif et cuire 2-3 minutes en retournant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et carbonisés. Laisser refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulé, puis hacher finement et réserver. Faites chauffer une grande poêle ou un plat à rôtir résistant au barbecue à feu direct. Ajouter le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il mousse, puis incorporer les pommes de terre, bien assaisonner et cuire 10 minutes en remuant la poêle de temps en temps.","Pour donner un goût fumé aux pommes de terre, ajoutez quelques copeaux de bois sur les braises et fermez le couvercle du barbecue pendant la cuisson des pommes de terre. Incorporer les oignons nouveaux carbonisés et cuire encore 5 minutes. Versez dans un grand bol et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11209,3672,'fr','Crêpes faciles au gâteau aux carottes','Combinez un gâteau classique avec la simplicité d''une crêpe pour créer un pudding, un petit-déjeuner ou un brunch spécial. Servir avec du yogourt, des pacanes et un filet de sirop d''érable ou de miel','["225 g de farines autolevantes","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de muscade moulue","3 cuillères à soupe de poudre dorée ou de sucre mou brun clair","400 ml de lait","2 cuillères à soupe de fromage à pâte molle, plus 100 g pour servir","1 oeuf","1 carotte moyenne (environ 115 g), râpée","1 orange , zestée","50 g de noix de pécan hachées, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","150 ml de yaourt nature","huile végétale ou de tournesol, pour la friture","sirop d''érable ou miel, pour servir"]','["Tamisez ensemble la farine, la cannelle, la muscade et le sucre dans un grand bol. Mélangez le lait, 2 cuillères à soupe de fromage à pâte molle et l''œuf dans un grand pichet ou un bol, puis versez dans le mélange sec en fouettant jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Incorporer la carotte râpée, le zeste d''orange et les pacanes, le cas échéant. Laisser reposer quelques minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez 100 g de fromage à pâte molle et le yaourt nature, plus un filet de jus d''orange zesté, si vous le souhaitez. Laisser au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Faites chauffer une cuillère à café d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen-doux, puis ajoutez une louche de pâte et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que la crêpe soit ferme sur les bords et que la surface commence à bouillonner. Si votre poêle est suffisamment grande, vous pouvez en cuire plusieurs à la fois. Retourner la crêpe et cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien cuite. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte, en ajoutant un peu d''huile entre chaque crêpe si nécessaire.","Servir les crêpes avec des cuillerées de mélange de yaourt, un peu de noix de pécan et un filet de sirop d''érable ou de miel, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11210,3676,'fr','Lentilles en sauce à la noix de coco, aux feuilles de curry et au curcuma','Faites une descente dans votre armoire à épices pour réaliser notre plat de lentilles qui pourra servir de base pour réaliser trois autres plats – utilisez du puy ou des lentilles vertes car elles conservent leur forme','["3 cuillères à soupe de ghee ou d''huile de coco pour le rendre végétalien","2 gros oignons , finement hachés","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","8 feuilles de curry frais","6 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","40 g de gingembre râpé","1 piment vert, épépiné si vous aimez","2 cuillères à café de curcuma moulu","1½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de graines de nigelle","1,2 litre de bouillon de légumes (assurer végétalien, si nécessaire)","400 ml de lait de coco en boîte","600 g de puy ou lentilles vertes séchées, rincées"]','["Faites chauffer le ghee ou l''huile dans une grande casserole profonde à feu moyen-vif. Incorporez les oignons, les graines de moutarde et les feuilles de curry avec une pincée de sel et laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes, en remuant fréquemment, jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient un peu caramélisés sur les bords et que les graines de moutarde aient éclaté. Incorporer les graines d''ail, de gingembre, de piment, de curcuma, de coriandre, de cumin et de nigelle. Baisser le feu à moyen et cuire 3 à 4 minutes, jusqu''à ce que ce soit parfumé.","Versez le bouillon de légumes, le lait de coco et les lentilles. Rincez la boîte de lait de coco avec de l''eau et ajoutez-la dans la casserole. Portez à ébullition, puis incorporez les lentilles. Cuire pendant 30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres et réduites. Assaisonner au goût et diviser en trois lots. Se conserve au frais pendant cinq jours dans un contenant hermétique ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois."]','2026-01-11 00:09:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11211,3678,'fr','Soupe de crevettes et de maïs au garam masala','Préparez un souper léger mais savoureux avec cette soupe au garam masala, aux crevettes, aux pommes de terre nouvelles et au maïs doux. Servir avec des quartiers de citron vert à presser et du pain croustillant','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","15 g de gingembre râpé","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","1½ cuillère à café de poudre de curry moyenne","600 ml de bouillon de poulet faible en sel","500 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en petits morceaux","200 g de maïs doux surgelé","300 g de crevettes, décongelées si congelées","200 ml de lait","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée","1 citron vert , coupé en quartiers","pain croustillant"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole à feu moyen. Ajoutez les oignons nouveaux, l''ail et le gingembre et faites cuire pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient grésillants et parfumés. Mélanger toutes les épices et cuire encore une minute jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient aromatiques. Ajoutez le bouillon et les pommes de terre nouvelles. Porter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 12 à 14 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient presque tendres.","Incorporer le maïs doux, les crevettes et le lait et cuire encore 2 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient bien cuites. Assaisonner au goût, saupoudrer de coriandre et servir avec des quartiers de citron vert à presser et du pain croustillant en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:09:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11212,3680,'fr','Dhal au chou-fleur rôti au cumin','Utilisez le chou-fleur entier et faites également rôtir les feuilles pour préparer ce plat de dhal savoureux. Vous pouvez remplacer le chou-chou par du brocoli rôti, si vous préférez','["200 g de lentilles rouges","1 chou-fleur, coupé en bouquets, grandes feuilles hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à café de graines de moutarde noire","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","1 oignon , finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","25 g de gingembre, haché très finement, un peu coupé en allumettes","1 cuillère à café de piment du Cachemire","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates","1 boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","un petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement (garder une petite poignée de feuilles entières pour servir)","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire, versez les lentilles dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur et versez dessus l''eau bouillie. Laissez tremper pendant que vous rôtissez le chou-fleur.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Étalez le chou-fleur et ses feuilles sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie tapissée. Arroser d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale, puis parsemer de curcuma, de graines de moutarde et de cumin, d''un peu de sel et de poivre, et bien masser. Cuire au four 30 mn. Une fois le chou-fleur doré et ramolli, égouttez les lentilles.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une grande casserole à feu moyen. Versez la cuillère à soupe d''huile restante, puis parsemez l''oignon. Cuire pendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, ajouter l''ail et le gingembre finement haché et cuire encore 2 à 3 minutes.","Répartir le piment et la coriandre moulue et ajouter la purée de tomates en remuant bien pour éviter de brûler. Versez les tomates, puis 2 canettes d''eau. Ajoutez les lentilles en mélangeant bien. Cuire 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres et que la sauce épaississe. Vous devrez peut-être ajouter un peu plus d''eau pendant la cuisson, selon la consistance que vous préférez.","Incorporez la coriandre hachée et un peu de sel et de poivre, puis répartissez dans les bols. Garnir d''une cuillerée de yaourt, du chou-fleur et des graines de moutarde et de cumin laissées dans la barquette, des allumettes de gingembre et des feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:09:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11213,3682,'fr','Spaghettis aux champignons et au chou frisé','Mélangez une boîte de haricots beurre à cette sauce aux champignons et au chou frisé pour obtenir une base crémeuse qui ajoute des fibres, des nutriments et une portion supplémentaire de vos cinq par jour.','["250 g de spaghettis","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 gousses d''ail , tranchées finement","1 piment rouge , tranché finement","400 g de champignons châtaignes émincés","150 g de chou frisé, tiges retirées et hachées grossièrement","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso blanche","1 citron, jus","125ml crème fraîche (optional)"]','["Cuire les spaghettis dans de l''eau bouillante salée selon les instructions sur l''emballage, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient al dente. Réservez une tasse d''eau pour les pâtes, puis égouttez-les.","Pendant la cuisson des pâtes, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle à feu moyen. Faites frire l''ail et le piment pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''ail commence à devenir doré. Ajouter les champignons et cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter le chou frisé et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il fane, environ 3-4 minutes.","Versez les haricots, le miso et 150 ml d''eau pour pâtes dans un mélangeur et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant plus d''eau pour pâtes si nécessaire.","Ajoutez la sauce aux haricots au chou frisé et aux champignons et laissez cuire encore 2-3 minutes, en ajoutant plus d''eau pour les pâtes si la sauce est trop épaisse. Assaisonner avec du sel, du poivre noir et du jus de citron au goût. Incorporer la crème fraîche si vous en utilisez. Mélangez les spaghettis égouttés dans la sauce et servez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:09:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11214,3684,'fr','Maquereau fumé sur crumpets grillés','Essayez notre entrée facile – la garniture peut être préparée longtemps à l’avance et réfrigérée. Une fois vos invités arrivés, faites griller les crumpets et empilez la garniture dessus.','["2 filets de maquereau fumé prêts à consommer","90g crème fraîche","½ citron, jus","2 brins d''aneth , finement hachés","2 brins de persil finement hachés","1 pomme Granny Smith, épépinée et coupée en allumettes (facultatif)","4 crumpets","beurre, à tartiner","4 tranches de concombre","1-2 radis , tranchés","une petite poignée de ciboulette finement hachée"]','["Retirez la peau du maquereau et émiettez la chair dans un bol. Ajoutez la crème fraîche, le jus de citron, l''aneth et le persil et mélangez délicatement jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Assaisonner au goût, puis incorporer les allumettes de pomme, le cas échéant.","Faites griller les crumpets au grille-pain ou chauffez votre friteuse à 180°C pendant 2 minutes avant d''ajouter vos crumpets pendant 3-4 minutes. Retirez-les et beurrez-les généreusement. Étalez le mélange de maquereau sur les crumpets. Garnir avec les tranches de concombre, les radis et une pincée de ciboulette, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11215,3686,'fr','Oeuf au plat à la friteuse','Oui, vous pouvez utiliser votre friteuse à air pour préparer des œufs au plat et cuire le jaune à votre guise. Avec certains modèles, il vous suffira peut-être de retourner le plateau à mi-parcours','["2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","2 œufs"]','["Versez l''huile dans un plat ou un moule résistant à la chaleur qui s''adaptera à votre friteuse à air – un moule à gâteau fonctionne bien, ou vous pouvez utiliser des ramequins individuels. Mettez le moule ou le plat dans l''air-fryer et faites cuire à 180°C pendant 2 minutes pour faire chauffer l''huile.","Cassez les œufs dans le moule ou le plat et faites cuire à 180°C pendant 4 à 8 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le jaune soit cuit à votre goût. Certaines friteuses à air ne cuisent pas uniformément – ​​pour vous assurer que votre œuf le fait, retournez le moule ou le plat à mi-cuisson."]','2026-01-11 00:09:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11216,3688,'fr','Garniture de porridge aux pommes et aux raisins secs aux épices Chai','Rehaussez votre porridge du matin avec des morceaux de pommes et des raisins secs imbibés de chai. Ajoutez un filet de crème double, si vous le souhaitez aussi, pour plus de gourmandise','["100 g de raisins secs","2 pommes , épépinées et hachées grossièrement","½ citron, jus","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","¾ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","¾ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","¼ cuillère à café de muscade moulue","5 gousses de cardamome, écrasées","2 clous de girofle","200 g de flocons d''avoine","400 ml de lait","un filet de crème double, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez les raisins secs, les pommes, le jus de citron, le sucre, les épices moulues et entières et un peu de poivre noir dans une casserole. Versez 75 ml d''eau, puis portez à ébullition à feu moyen. Cuire doucement pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les fruits soient ramollis et que le liquide ait réduit. Retirer du feu et réserver. Une fois refroidi, il se conservera au frais dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours.","Pour préparer le porridge, versez les flocons d''avoine, le lait et 800 ml d''eau dans une casserole avec une pincée de sel. Cuire, en remuant souvent, à feu moyen pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement et crémeux – cuire un peu plus longtemps si vous préférez une bouillie plus épaisse, ou ajouter un peu d''eau si vous la préférez plus fine.","Servir le porridge dans des bols garnis du mélange de pommes et de raisins secs épicés au chai et d''un filet de crème double, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11217,3690,'fr','Brochettes de miel, sésame et halloumi','Vous en avez assez des mêmes vieilles brochettes de légumes ? Avec un glaçage au miel et au sésame, ces versions halloumi regorgent de saveurs','["2 blocs de 250g halloumi","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile neutre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile neutre","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame","2 cuillères à café de grains d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe de flocons de piment","100 ml de miel","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre de pomme"]','["Commencez par réaliser le glaçage au miel. Mélangez tous les ingrédients dans un bol et assaisonnez de sel et de poivre. Coupez chaque bloc de halloumi en tiers, parallèlement au pli, puis cassez-le en deux au niveau du pli. Vous devriez vous retrouver avec 12 pièces au total. Enfilez-les soigneusement sur des brochettes en métal.","Badigeonnez les barres du barbecue d''huile neutre, puis badigeonnez le halloumi de glaçage au miel. Griller, en badigeonnant de temps en temps et en retournant soigneusement toutes les 2-3 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient entièrement dorés. Vous pouvez également les faire cuire sur la plaque de cuisson dans une poêle à feu vif si vous préférez. Servir avec le reste du glaçage dans un bol à côté pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:09:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11218,3692,'fr','Brochettes de choux carbonisés au beurre de harissa','Réinventez les brochettes de légumes avec ces versions de chou printanier carbonisé servies avec un beurre de harissa gourmand, du yaourt grec et des oignons croustillants.','["100g de beurre salé","2 cuillères à soupe de harissa (nous avons utilisé de la harissa à la rose)","1 citron , zesté et pressé","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","une petite poignée de persil finement haché","1 chou de printemps pointu","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile neutre","200 g de yaourt grec.","50 g d''oignons croustillants"]','["Faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole, puis ajoutez la harissa, le zeste de citron, le jus de citron et l''ail, et laissez cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils grésillent. Assaisonner de poivre et incorporer la majeure partie du persil, en réservant un peu pour garnir.","Lavez et jetez toutes les feuilles extérieures endommagées ou tachées du chou. Coupez-le en deux en gardant la racine intacte, puis coupez chaque moitié en 2 quartiers en gardant la racine attachée à chaque extrémité. Enfiler délicatement sur des brochettes en métal, badigeonner chaque quartier de beurre de harissa, puis réserver sur une plaque à pâtisserie.","Badigeonnez les barres du barbecue d''huile neutre et faites griller le chou en le badigeonnant de beurre de temps en temps, en le retournant soigneusement toutes les 3 à 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et entièrement carbonisé. Alternativement, vous pouvez les faire cuire sous un grill chaud.","Étalez le yaourt sur un plat de service et garnissez de brochettes en arrosant du reste de beurre, puis parsemez d''oignons croustillants et de persil réservé."]','2026-01-11 00:09:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11219,3694,'fr','Curry de poulet à la noix de coco à la mijoteuse','Demandez à votre mijoteuse de faire le gros du travail pour ce curry à l''indienne. Nous avons ajouté du poulet et de la patate douce, puis servi avec des naans et du riz','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol (facultatif)","1 oignon rouge, finement haché ou tranché","8 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en morceaux","4 gousses d''ail écrasées ou finement râpées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","6 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry","400 ml de lait de coco en boîte","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","500 g de patate douce ou de courge musquée hachée grossièrement","une poignée de coriandre fraîche hachée grossièrement pour servir","1 piment rouge, tranché, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Pour une saveur plus profonde, si vous avez le temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez le poulet et faites-le frire pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement saisi (mais pas complètement cuit), puis ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et laissez cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Incorporer la pâte de curry et cuire 1 min.","Versez dans votre mijoteuse avec le lait de coco, les tomates et la patate douce ou la courge musquée. Alternativement, mettez tout sauf l''huile, la coriandre et le piment dans votre mijoteuse et mélangez. Cuire à feu vif pendant 5 heures ou à feu doux pendant 8 heures, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre et bien cuit. Retirez le couvercle pendant 1 heure pour épaissir la sauce. Servir sur du riz ou avec du pain naan avec une pincée de coriandre et de piment rouge, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11220,3696,'fr','Ragoût d''été de haricots verts','Dégustez ce ragoût d''été avec des morceaux de pain à tremper. Il accompagne également parfaitement des côtelettes d''agneau ou du poisson blanc.','["50 ml d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon , tranché finement","280 g de haricots verts","4 gousses d''ail , tranchées finement","4 anchois, plus un filet d''huile de conserve (facultatif)","2 pincées de flocons de piment (facultatif)","400 g de grosses tomates de vigne hachées","4 brins d''origan, feuilles cueillies ou 1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","Boîte de 400 g de cannellini ou de haricots beurre , égouttés","une poignée de basilic, feuilles cueillies","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-doux. Ajoutez l''oignon avec une pincée de sel et faites cuire lentement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit caramélisé, environ 15 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, préparez les haricots verts. Si les haricots d''Espagne sont jeunes et petits, coupez-les simplement en diagonale. S''ils sont plus âgés, ils auront une ficelle dure de chaque côté. Pour le retirer, coupez l''extrémité de la tige et retirez les ficelles fibreuses, puis coupez en diagonale.","Ajoutez l''ail, les anchois et les flocons de piment, le cas échéant, à l''oignon. Cuire quelques minutes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que les anchois soient dissous et que l''ail soit cuit mais pas doré.","Ajoutez les haricots verts, les tomates, l''origan, le vinaigre, le sucre et une bonne pincée de sel. Couvrir et cuire 15 minutes à feu doux, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient décomposées et que les haricots soient tendres.","Ajoutez les cannellini ou les haricots beurre dans la poêle, remplissez la boîte à moitié avec de l''eau et ajoutez-la également. Cuire encore 10 minutes à découvert, jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait un peu réduit. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement et incorporez les feuilles de basilic. Servir avec un généreux filet d''huile d''olive extra vierge et une pincée supplémentaire de flocons de piment, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11221,3698,'fr','Beignets d''écorces de légumes','Faites des épluchures de légumes la vedette du spectacle avec ces beignets faciles. Ils sont parfaits le lendemain d’un grand dîner de famille, comme à Noël','["500 ml d''huile végétale, pour la friture","1 oeuf","100 g de farine (pois chiches)","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de graines de nigelle","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","150g d''épluchures de légumes, nous avons utilisé un mélange de pomme de terre, carotte et panais","½ petit oignon , finement tranché","cornichon au citron vert, chutney de mangue et raita, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l’huile dans une casserole profonde à feu moyen-doux, en vous assurant qu’elle n’est pas pleine aux deux tiers. Versez 100 ml d''eau dans un bol et mélangez avec l''œuf. Ajoutez la farine de pois chiches, la levure chimique, les épices et 1 cuillère à café de sel marin fin, puis remuez jusqu''à ce qu''une pâte épaisse se forme. Incorporer les épluchures de légumes et l''oignon. Ajoutez un autre peu d''eau pour desserrer si nécessaire.","Pour vérifier si l’huile est suffisamment chaude, déposez-y un petit grain de pâte. Si elle remonte à la surface entourée de bulles et commence à dorer, l''huile est suffisamment chaude pour la friture. Sinon, augmentez le feu à moyen-vif. Une fois suffisamment chaud, abaissez délicatement les cuillères à soupe bombées du mélange dans l''huile, quelques-unes à la fois, puis aplatissez-les avec le dos de la cuillère. Cuire quelques minutes, en retournant une fois, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient uniformément dorés et croustillants, environ 3-4 minutes. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et saupoudrer d''un peu de sel. Servir chaud avec du cornichon au citron vert, du chutney de mangue et de la raita."]','2026-01-11 00:09:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11222,3700,'fr','Gâteau au citron et à la friteuse à air','Avez-vous déjà essayé votre friteuse à air pour la pâtisserie ? Bien qu''il ne soit pas idéal pour des gâteaux parfaitement uniformes, il est idéal pour un gâteau sans tracas, comme ce filet de citron.','["250 g de beurre, à température ambiante","250 g de sucre en poudre","4 œufs","250 g de farines autolevantes","3 citrons , zestés et pressés","100g de sucre glace"]','["Tapisser un moule à cake de papier sulfurisé. Versez le beurre, le sucre, les œufs, la farine, une pincée de sel et les deux tiers du zeste de citron dans un bol, puis battez avec un fouet électrique pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux.","Chauffer la friteuse à 160°C. Versez le mélange à gâteau dans le moule préparé en lissant la surface. Cuire 1h-1h10 jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre (vous pouvez recouvrir la surface de papier d''aluminium si elle commence à devenir trop foncée). Laisser refroidir dans le moule 5 min.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le sucre glace, le zeste de citron restant et juste assez de jus pour obtenir un glaçage onctueux et versable. Soulevez délicatement le gâteau chaud sur une grille au-dessus d''un plateau et percez des trous profonds sur tout le dessus à l''aide d''une brochette. Versez lentement le glaçage en filet, en le laissant s''égoutter sur les bords. Laisser prendre avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11223,3702,'fr','Poulet au curcuma avec houmous aux haricots beurre et poivrons rôtis','Essayez ce poulet au curcuma sain de style meze avec du houmous aux haricots beurre, des poivrons rôtis et du brocoli. Faites griller le poulet et les poivrons, si vous le souhaitez','["1 gros poivron rouge, coupé en deux et épépiné","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","160 g de brocoli à longues tiges","poignée de feuilles de menthe, pour servir","2 gros filets de poitrine de poulet sans peau (environ 125 g chacun)","120g de yaourt nature","3 cuillères à soupe de curcuma finement râpé","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","1 cuillère à café de miel","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre, égouttés, liquide réservé","1 cuillère à soupe de zeste de citron et 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un filet","1 gousse d''ail, hachée grossièrement","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium. Faites quelques petites entailles sur les bords des moitiés de poivron à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, puis aplatissez-les autant que possible avec votre paume. Frotter avec l''huile végétale et rôtir sur la plaque à pâtisserie tapissée pendant 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, coupez les poitrines de poulet en deux dans le sens de la longueur pour obtenir quatre filets fins. Mélangez le yaourt, le curcuma, les graines de cumin, la coriandre moulue, l''ail, le jus de citron, le miel et l''huile d''olive avec du poivre noir et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un bol. Ajouter le poulet et retourner pour l''enrober de marinade. Lorsque les poivrons ont eu 10 minutes, retournez-les, ajoutez les filets de poulet sur la plaque en les espaçant légèrement et versez dessus le reste de la marinade. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes en retournant les filets de poulet à mi-cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits.","Pour le houmous, utilisez un mixeur plongeant pour mélanger les haricots, le zeste et le jus de citron, l''huile d''olive, l''ail, les graines de cumin et la coriandre avec 6 cuillères à soupe de liquide de la boîte, ¾ cuillère à café de sel et beaucoup de poivre noir. Cela devrait être complètement lisse.","Lorsque le poulet a cuit 10 minutes, faites cuire le brocoli à la vapeur pendant 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Répartir le houmous sur deux assiettes, puis garnir de poivrons rôtis et de poulet. Parsemer de menthe, arroser d''huile d''olive et servir avec le brocoli à part."]','2026-01-11 00:09:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11224,3704,'fr','Nouilles udon au poulet et au gingembre','Servez ces nouilles parfumées et légères avec du poulet, des germes de soja et du chou en 30 minutes. Avec du gingembre piquant et du piment rouge, c''est plein de saveur','["1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol","3 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en dés","¼ de chou blanc, tranché finement","25 g de gingembre pelé et finement râpé","1 piment rouge (épépiné si vous le souhaitez), finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de riz","2 cuillères à café de mirin","100 g de germes de soja prêts à consommer","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","300 g de nouilles udon directement au wok","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre mariné (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à frire à feu moyen-vif et, une fois chauds, faites sauter le poulet et le chou pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et presque cuits. Ajouter le gingembre et le piment et cuire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés.","Ajoutez le reste des ingrédients, à l''exception de la coriandre et du gingembre mariné, et faites frire jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit et que les nouilles soient tendres, environ 1 à 2 minutes de plus. Assaisonnez en ajoutant plus de soja, de vinaigre ou de mirin, si vous le souhaitez. Garnir de coriandre et de gingembre mariné, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:09:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11225,3706,'fr','Soupe aux tomates et pains croustillants au houmous','Organisez-vous pour la semaine à venir et préparez cette soupe un dimanche – elle se conserve bien au réfrigérateur. Nous avons emballé des légumes, ainsi que des lentilles rouges pour ajouter des protéines.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 gros oignons (325 g), hachés","320 g de carottes tranchées","4 gousses d''ail , hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","100 g de lentilles rouges séchées","690 g de passata en bouteille","1 l de bouillon de légumes préparé avec 1 cuillère à soupe de bouillon en poudre","4 pains croustillants multigrains","100 g de houmous allégé","¼ concombre , tranché","6 olives Nocellara dénoyautées, tranchées","pincée de feuilles de thym","saupoudrer de paprika fumé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir les oignons et les carottes pendant environ 10 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres.","Incorporer l''ail et le paprika fumé avec les lentilles et cuire encore environ une minute.","Versez la passata et le bouillon, portez à ébullition, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter à feu moyen pendant 30 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres. Retirer du feu et fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant. Mangez la moitié maintenant et réfrigérez le reste. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Pour réchauffer, faites cuire les portions dans une poêle à feu doux avec un filet d''eau jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très chaudes.","Pour accompagner la soupe, tartinez 2 pains croustillants par personne avec la moitié du houmous. Garnir de la moitié du concombre et parsemer de la moitié des olives, du thym et du paprika fumé."]','2026-01-11 00:09:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11226,3708,'fr','Curry rapide de lentilles à la noix de coco','Ce curry rapide et facile a une saveur si profonde qu’il a le goût d’avoir été cuit pendant des heures. C’est aussi sain, en plus d’être faible en gras et en calories','["1 oignon, haché grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","1 piment rouge ou vert, haché grossièrement","1 carotte, hachée grossièrement","10 g de gingembre pelé et haché","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","1 ½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry tikka masala","Boîte de 400 g de lentilles vertes cuites","220 ml de lait de coco léger","200 g de petits pois surgelés","10 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement","200 g de riz brun cuit","4 cuillères à soupe de noix de coco légère ou de yaourt nature, pour servir"]','["Mettez l''oignon, l''ail, le piment, la carotte et le gingembre dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne à feu moyen et faites cuire la pâte végétale pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit parfumée et commence à ramollir. Ajoutez la pâte de curry et laissez cuire encore 1 min, puis ajoutez les lentilles et mélangez.","Versez le lait de coco et 150 ml d''eau et portez à ébullition. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement et crémeux. Ajoutez les petits pois dans les 5 dernières minutes et assaisonnez bien.","Incorporez la majeure partie de la coriandre, puis répartissez le curry dans quatre bols avec le riz. Saupoudrer du reste de coriandre et garnir de yaourt pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11227,3712,'fr','Courgette, piment et menthe avec couscous perlé','Préparez notre simple souper de semaine en 25 minutes. Les courgettes et le couscous nécessitent une préparation minimale, et la menthe, le piment, l''ail et le citron se combinent pour créer une vinaigrette percutante.','["100 g de couscous perlé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","400 g de courgettes hachées grossièrement","½ oignon rouge, tranché","1 piment rouge (épépiné si vous préférez moins de piquant), haché finement","2 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","10 g de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées finement, plus quelques entières pour servir","½ citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","50 g de fromage à salade léger à la grecque"]','["Faites cuire le couscous en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-le et réservez. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l’huile dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif. Ajoutez les courgettes et l''oignon et faites-les revenir, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et ramollis, environ 8 à 10 minutes. Incorporer le piment et l''ail et cuire encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés.","Retirer du feu et incorporer la menthe hachée, le jus de citron, le miel et l''assaisonnement. Répartir le couscous dans les assiettes, garnir du mélange de courgettes, émietter sur le fromage et parsemer de feuilles de menthe entières pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11228,3714,'fr','Soupe miso aux lentilles et aux choux','Préparez une soupe copieuse à l''aide de lentilles vertes, de pancetta, de chou blanc et de champignons, le tout agrémenté de saveurs de miso. Il contient trois de vos 5 par jour','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","150 g de pancetta ou de bacon haché","300 g de champignons émincés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon haché","4 gousses d''ail hachées","4 carottes tranchées non pelées","3 branches de céleri tranchées","2 cuillères à soupe de miso","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","200 g de lentilles vertes séchées lavées et égouttées","½ tête de chou blanc haché","une cuillerée de yaourt épais"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle profonde à feu moyen-vif. Vous pouvez le préparer entièrement végétarien, mais si vous avez environ 150 g de pancetta ou de bacon haché à utiliser, versez-le et faites-le dorer partout avant de le retirer avec une écumoire. Incorporer les champignons tranchés et faire dorer partout avant de transférer dans un bol.","Versez l''huile d''olive, puis ajoutez l''oignon haché, les gousses d''ail, les carottes tranchées et les bâtonnets de céleri, les feuilles et le tout. Cuire doucement pendant 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement ramolli. Incorporer le miso, de préférence rouge ou brun, le bouillon de légumes et 1 litre d''eau et porter à ébullition.","Incorporez enfin les lentilles vertes séchées, lavées et égouttées, ainsi que la tête de chou blanc hachée. Remettez le bacon et les champignons dedans. Couvrez et laissez mijoter doucement pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres. Assaisonnez bien et servez avec une cuillerée de yaourt épais."]','2026-01-11 00:09:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11229,3716,'fr','Sauce au pain croissant','Ne gaspillez pas les croissants rassis du matin de Noël : utilisez-les pour préparer une riche sauce au pain. Pour une gourmandise totale, terminez par une noix de beurre à faire fondre sur le dessus.','["50 g de beurre, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","1 petit oignon , tranché","400 ml de lait entier","grosse pincée de clous de girofle moulus","2 croissants rassis, tranchés grossièrement (environ 80g)"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle à feu doux-moyen, puis incorporer l''oignon et cuire à couvert pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli mais pas coloré. Ajoutez le lait et les clous de girofle moulus. Laisser mijoter doucement, à découvert, pendant 15 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Ajoutez les morceaux de croissant et remuez pour les aider à absorber tout le liquide.","Versez le tout dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré pendant deux jours. Versez la sauce dans une casserole et laissez mijoter à feu doux-moyen jusqu''à épaississement et bien chaud – ajoutez un peu de lait pour la détendre, si nécessaire. Assaisonnez et servez chaud avec la dinde et les parures avec une noix de beurre dessus, si vous le souhaitez, et un peu de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11230,3718,'fr','Bol de riz au poulet fajita et citron vert brûlé','Préparez facilement des fajitas qui plairont à tous avec cette recette en un seul plateau, riche en nutriments et faible en gras et en calories. C''est un repas rapide en milieu de semaine','["2 grosses poitrines de poulet","2 poivrons, tranchés","2 oignons rouges, tranchés","200 g de maïs miniature","3 cuillères à café de pâte de piment chipotle","1 citron vert, zesté puis coupé en deux","2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","15 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement","400 g de riz brun cuit","4 cuillères à soupe de salsa, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Disposez le poulet, les poivrons, les oignons rouges et les petits maïs sur le plateau et versez dessus la pâte chipotle. Assaisonner, puis mélanger. Mettez les moitiés de citron vert sur le plateau, côté coupé vers le bas, puis versez l''huile sur le poulet et les légumes. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien cuit.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer les haricots dans une petite poêle à feu doux et assaisonnez. Mélangez les haricots avec la moitié de la coriandre et le zeste du citron vert, puis pressez dessus le jus du citron vert torréfié. Tranchez finement le poulet en diagonale et répartissez-le dans quatre bols avec les légumes et le riz brun. Saupoudrer du reste de coriandre et servir avec la salsa."]','2026-01-11 00:09:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11231,3720,'fr','Granola pomme, cardamome & tige de gingembre','Offrez ce granola à Noël pour un cadeau attentionné. Rempli de fruits secs, de noix et de tiges de gingembre, il se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à un mois.','["100 g de noix mélangées (nous avons utilisé des noisettes entières, des pistaches, des amandes et des noix de pécan)","15 gousses de cardamome ou ½ cuillère à café de cardamome moulue","50 ml d''huile végétale","100 ml de sirop d''érable","75 ml de miel","3 boules de gingembre tige, hachées, plus 2 cuillères à soupe de sirop","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","300 g de flocons d''avoine","50 g de graines mélangées (nous avons utilisé du tournesol, du potiron et des graines de lin)","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","50 g de rondelles de pommes séchées, hachées grossièrement","50 g de raisins secs ou de canneberges séchées"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Hachez grossièrement les noix en laissant beaucoup de gros morceaux. Ouvrez les gousses de cardamome et broyez légèrement les graines à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier pour libérer leur arôme.","Mélangez l''huile, le sirop d''érable, le miel, le sirop de gingembre et la vanille dans un grand bol. Ajoutez le gingembre haché, les flocons d''avoine, les graines, la cannelle, les noix hachées, la cardamome et ½ cuillère à café de sel marin. Mélangez le tout jusqu’à ce qu’il soit bien enrobé du mélange de sirop.","Versez sur la plaque à pâtisserie et étalez uniformément. Cuire au four 20 minutes, puis remuer et remettre au four encore 10 minutes. Pour un granola en gros morceaux, laissez refroidir sans remuer, puis brisez-le en morceaux. Si vous préférez une texture plus fine, remuez de temps en temps pendant que le granola refroidit. Incorporer les fruits secs. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:09:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11232,3722,'fr','Bouillie de cannelle avec bananes au four','Ajoutez des bananes riches en fibres et du yaourt bio à votre porridge du petit-déjeuner. Inclure du yaourt vivant dans votre alimentation peut soutenir le système digestif et renforcer les défenses immunitaires.','["80 g de flocons d''avoine","150 ml de lait demi-écrémé","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 grosse banane mûre (120 g), coupée en deux dans le sens de la longueur et coupée en deux","½ orange , zestée et pressée","200 g de yaourt nature bio","2 cuillères à café de mélange de trois graines grillées"]','["Mettez les flocons d''avoine, le lait, 450 ml d''eau et la cannelle dans une casserole. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu, en remuant souvent, pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à épaississement.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les bananes dans un plat avec le zeste et le jus d''orange. Couvrir et mettre au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 1½ à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Versez le porridge dans des bols et garnissez de yaourt, de banane et de graines."]','2026-01-11 00:09:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11233,3726,'fr','Caviar de cow-boy','Enthousiasmez les enfants pour les légumes avec cette salsa qui peut être facilement adaptée. Si vous l''emmenez en pique-nique, ajoutez l''avocat et la coriandre au dernier moment','["Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","Boîte de 200 g de maïs doux, égoutté ou congelé (décongelé s''il est congelé)","2 grosses tomates coupées en quartiers, épépinées et finement hachées","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","1 poivron (de n''importe quelle couleur), épépiné et finement haché","1 gros avocat, coupé en deux, pelé, dénoyauté et finement haché (facultatif)","un petit bouquet de coriandre hachée (facultatif)","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 citron vert en jus ou 2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","chips tortilla, pour servir (sans gluten, si nécessaire)"]','["Versez les haricots, le maïs, les tomates, l''oignon, le poivron, l''avocat et la coriandre, le cas échéant, dans un grand bol. (Si vous ne servez pas tout de suite, ajoutez l''avocat et la coriandre juste avant.)","Arrosez d’huile d’olive et de jus de citron vert ou de vinaigre et mélangez délicatement. Assaisonner au goût. Se conserve à température ambiante pendant deux heures, ou au frais toute la nuit, sans l''avocat ni la coriandre. Servir avec des chips tortilla pour les ramasser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11234,3728,'fr','Pommes de feu d''artifice','Illuminez les petits visages lors de la soirée Bonfire avec ces pommes d''amour colorées : les enfants adoreront aussi aider à les décorer.','["250 g de guimauves","50g de beurre","8 pommes rouges","pépites multicolores","framboises lyophilisées","meringues roses, écrasées","bonbons en dentelle aux fraises"]','["Chauffer doucement les guimauves et le beurre dans une casserole de taille moyenne à feu doux, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fondus.","Retirez les tiges des pommes et enfoncez profondément un bâton de sucette en bois en veillant à ne pas les traverser complètement. Versez les garnitures dans des petits bols séparés.","En travaillant une à la fois, trempez les pommes dans la guimauve fondue, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient uniformément enrobées. Décorez rapidement en roulant des pépites de pépites, des framboises lyophilisées ou en les enroulant avec un ou deux lacets de fraises. Placer sur du papier sulfurisé et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris."]','2026-01-11 00:09:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11235,3730,'fr','Soupe aux pois et au jambon à la mijoteuse','Tirez le meilleur parti des restes de jambon de Noël avec cette simple soupe aux pois et au jambon préparée dans la mijoteuse qui n''utilise que six ingrédients. A déguster avec du pain croustillant','["1 oignon, haché","250 g de poireaux tranchés","2 feuilles de laurier","450 g de jambon cuit (pour de meilleurs résultats, conserver en rôti)","1½ l de bouillon de légumes chaud peu salé (ou utiliser de l''eau)","750 g de petits pois frais ou surgelés (décongelés s''ils sont surgelés)"]','["Versez l''oignon, les poireaux, les feuilles de laurier et le jambon dans une mijoteuse. Versez dessus le bouillon de légumes chaud et faites cuire à feu vif pendant 2 heures ou à feu doux pendant 6 heures. Si vous avez un morceau de jambon cru, vous pouvez l''utiliser, mais vous devrez faire cuire la soupe pendant 45 minutes supplémentaires à puissance élevée ou 2 heures à basse température.","Retirez le jambon et réservez. Versez les petits pois dans la mijoteuse et faites cuire à puissance élevée pendant 30 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce que les petits pois soient bien cuits. Pendant ce temps, émincez le jambon. S''il a suffisamment refroidi, vous pouvez le faire avec vos mains ou utiliser deux fourchettes.","Retirez les feuilles de laurier de la soupe et jetez-les, puis transférez la soupe dans un blender et un blitz. Une fois complètement refroidie, la soupe aux pois (sans le jambon) peut être congelée jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler complètement au réfrigérateur pendant la nuit, puis réchauffer dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud au moment de servir. Assaisonner au goût, puis répartir dans les bols et répartir un peu de jambon râpé sur chaque bol avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11236,3732,'fr','Granola maison santé','Sucrez le granola maison avec des pruneaux pour une version plus saine de ce favori du petit-déjeuner. Les pruneaux regorgent également de fibres, qui favorisent la santé intestinale','["Boîte de 290 g de pruneaux dénoyautés au jus naturel, égouttés","1 orange, zestée et pressée","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","350g de flocons d''avoine","25g d''amandes effilées","25g de graines de tournesol","25g de graines de citrouille","2 pots de 400g de yaourt enrichi au soja ou nature bio"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mettez les pruneaux, le zeste et le jus d''orange dans un petit bol, ajoutez le tahini et écrasez le tout pour obtenir une pâte. Versez les flocons d''avoine dans un grand bol, puis ajoutez le mélange de pruneaux et pétrissez le tout avec vos mains, comme si vous prépariez une garniture à crumble, jusqu''à ce que tous les flocons d''avoine soient enrobés et collants. Étalez sur la plaque préparée et faites cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, en retournant les flocons d''avoine toutes les 5 minutes pour les aider à cuire uniformément et à évacuer le plus de vapeur possible.","Sortez du four et mélangez les amandes et les graines sur la plaque, puis laissez refroidir rapidement en remuant le mélange. Une fois complètement refroidi, le granola se conservera deux semaines dans un récipient hermétique.","Mesurez 50 g de granola par portion et dégustez avec 100 g de yaourt au soja."]','2026-01-11 00:09:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11237,3734,'fr','Macchiato au caramel','Économisez du pain en préparant votre boisson de café préférée à la maison – vous n’avez pas non plus besoin d’équipement coûteux pour des résultats professionnels','["250 ml de lait entier ou demi-écrémé","60-70 ml d''espresso (un double shot)","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1-2 cuillères à soupe de sauce caramel"]','["Faites chauffer le lait à l''aide d''un mousseur à lait ou d''une buse vapeur. Vous pouvez également réchauffer sur la plaque de cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste fumant (ne pas faire bouillir) et utiliser un mousseur à main – vous souhaitez viser une température comprise entre 60 °C et 70 °C.","Versez l''espresso dans une tasse à café ou une tasse, puis incorporez la vanille et jusqu''à 1 cuillère à soupe de sauce caramel, selon vos goûts. Versez dessus le lait, puis arrosez de sauce caramel en croisant avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11238,3736,'fr','Omelette végétalienne aux épinards','Essayez une omelette à base de farine de pois chiches : elle est riche en protéines et sans gluten. Les quantités ici sont pour un, mais la recette est facilement doublée','["30 g de farine (pois chiches)","¼ cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à soupe de levure nutritionnelle","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","80 g de pousses d''épinards"]','["Fouettez la farine de pois chiches, l''origan et la levure nutritionnelle dans un bol avec 80 ml d''eau.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive de 19 cm. Versez la pâte à omelette et faites tourner la poêle pour couvrir le fond. Empilez les épinards frais sur le dessus, puis couvrez la poêle et laissez cuire à feu doux pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés et que la base de l''omelette soit cuite mais encore humide. Roulez l''omelette dans la poêle pour enfermer les épinards, puis glissez-la sur une assiette et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11239,3738,'fr','Barres à tarte aux pommes','Profitez au maximum des pommes Bramley de saison pendant l''été britannique et préparez ces magnifiques barres à tarte aux pommes. Ils sont parfaits servis avec une tasse de thé pour onze ans','["250 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","350 g de farine nature","150 g de cassonade légère, plus 3 cuillères à soupe","1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait de vanille","4 pommes Bramley moyennes (environ 900 g), pelées, épépinées et coupées en morceaux","1¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue (facultatif)","½ citron, jus","75g de sucre glace"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 18 x 28 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mettez le beurre, la farine, 150 g de cassonade et l''extrait de vanille dans un robot culinaire avec 1 cuillère à café de sel, et mixez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit homogène. Pressez les deux tiers de la pâte dans le moule en une couche uniforme, puis faites cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée. Gardez le reste de la pâte au frais pendant que vous préparez les pommes.","Versez les pommes dans une poêle avec 3 cuillères à soupe de cassonade, 1 cuillère à café de cannelle (si vous en utilisez) et le jus de citron. Cuire à feu moyen pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes soient ramollies mais pas décomposées.","Versez les pommes sur le fond de pâte, puis brisez le reste de pâte et répartissez-le sur le dessus. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit cuite et dorée. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir dans le moule.","Mélangez le sucre glace et ¼ cuillère à café de cannelle restante avec suffisamment d''eau pour créer un glaçage épais (il vous faut environ 2 cuillères à café). Versez le glaçage sur les barres de tarte aux pommes, puis coupez-les en 12 à 16 carrés. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:09:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11240,3740,'fr','Burger de bœuf barbecue','Un burger de bœuf classique est un incontournable lors d''un barbecue. Emballez le fromage bleu au centre pour le rendre un peu plus spécial et servez-le avec vos accompagnements préférés.','["400 g de bœuf haché","1 échalote banane, hachée finement","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce au raifort forte","1 cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées séchées","1 grosse gousse d''ail, finement râpée","40 g de fromage bleu (facultatif)","2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","4 pains à burger, fendus","feuilles de laitue iceberg, tranches de tomates et relish, pour servir"]','["Versez le bœuf haché, l''échalote, la sauce au raifort, les herbes et l''ail dans un bol et assaisonnez bien avec du sel et du poivre noir. Mélangez bien le tout avec vos mains, en pressant le mélange entre vos doigts à plusieurs reprises pour l''aider à se lier.","Divisez le mélange en quatre portions et façonnez chacune en une galette de 3 cm d''épaisseur. Pressez un petit morceau de fromage bleu de la taille de 50p au milieu de chaque galette, le cas échéant, et emballez la viande autour pour enfermer le fromage – cela fondra pendant la cuisson.","Mettez les burgers dans une assiette, couvrez et réfrigérez pendant au moins 30 minutes ou toute la nuit. Allumez le barbecue et attendez que les braises deviennent cendrées. Ou faites chauffer un barbecue à gaz à feu moyen.","Huiler légèrement les galettes de burger et cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent tout juste à carboniser. Retournez délicatement et laissez cuire encore 4 à 5 minutes (à feu moyen) ou plus si vous préférez bien cuit. Déposez les burgers sur une planche et laissez reposer quelques minutes avant de servir. Vous pouvez également faire frire les hamburgers à feu moyen pendant 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits (un thermomètre à sonde doit indiquer 70 °C).","Servir les hamburgers dans les petits pains avec de la laitue, des tranches de tomates et de la relish (voir recette ci-dessous), ou tout autre accompagnement de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:09:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11241,3742,'fr','Wraps de laitue au saumon et au piment doux','Légères, simples et trois de vos cinq par jour, ces astucieuses coupes de laitue sont le support idéal pour des flocons de saumon au piment doux et de fines tranches de radis et de carottes.','["2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce à teneur réduite en sucre (voir conseil ci-dessous)","1 citron vert, jus","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja réduite en sel ou de tamari sans blé","2 filets de saumon","1 carotte, tranchée finement","½ radis daikon, coupé en deux et finement tranché","100 g de radis finement tranchés","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée","1 laitue Little Gem, feuilles séparées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger la sauce chili douce avec la moitié du jus de citron vert et la moitié de la sauce soja ou du tamari. Séchez les filets de saumon avec du papier absorbant, placez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie et versez-les sur le mélange de sauce chili. Cuire au four pendant 10 minutes, puis chauffer le gril à feu vif et glisser le saumon sous le gril chaud pendant les 2 à 5 dernières minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit et caramélisé. Écailler délicatement la chair du saumon en appuyant dessus avec le dos d''une fourchette.","Mélangez la carotte, le daikon, les radis et la coriandre avec le reste de la sauce soja et le jus de citron vert. Saison. Remplissez les feuilles de laitue avec la salade et les émiettés de saumon pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11242,3744,'fr','Salade épicée de thon, courgettes et pois chiches','Préparez cette salade rapide avec du thon en conserve, des courgettes et des pois chiches, assaisonnée de câpres, de piment et d''ail. Cela fonctionne comme un plat autonome ou comme accompagnement','["1 citron , zesté et pressé","15 g de persil finement haché","10 g de basilic finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, rincées et finement hachées","1 piment rouge (épépiné, si vous préférez moins de piquant), haché finement","Boîte de 160 g de thon à l''huile d''olive","2 courgettes , tranchées finement","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés"]','["Mettez le zeste et le jus de citron dans un bol et mélangez avec le persil, le basilic, l''ail, les câpres, le piment et un peu d''assaisonnement. Filtrez l''huile de la boîte de thon (environ 2 cuillères à soupe), puis incorporez les courgettes. Bien mélanger pour bien enrober de vinaigrette, puis laisser ramollir pendant 15 minutes.","Incorporer les pois chiches et mélanger le tout avant d''émietter le thon et de remuer à nouveau. Servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:09:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11243,3746,'fr','Fèves au lard saines','Essayez notre recette rapide et saine de fèves au lard maison. Il l''emporte haut la main en termes de goût et de texture, et livre trois de vos cinq par jour.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","1 gros oignon (185 g), finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","500g en purée","3 dattes dénoyautées (environ 15 g), hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","2 cuillères à café de bouillon en poudre","1 feuille de laurier","3 x 400 g de haricots blancs égouttés","4 pommes de terre en chemise moyennement cuites"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole antiadhésive à feu doux et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ajoutez une goutte d’eau s’il semble que ça commence à brûler.","Incorporer l''ail, puis ajouter la passata, les dattes, le vinaigre, le bouillon et le laurier. Broyer généreusement avec du poivre noir et laisser mijoter 5 minutes.","Versez les haricots et 400 ml d''eau, puis laissez mijoter 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à épaississement. Pour congeler, laissez refroidir complètement, puis répartissez dans des sacs de congélation et congelez jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler soigneusement au réfrigérateur pendant la nuit et réchauffer dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Servir sur des pommes de terre en chemise."]','2026-01-11 00:09:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11244,3748,'fr','Morue au curcuma et plateau de pois chiches','Préparez un simple dîner de morue avec des pois chiches garnis de gingembre, d''ail et de curcuma. C’est un dîner sain, faible en gras et en calories','["400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","2 cuillères à café d''huile de tournesol","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 échalotes, hachées finement","15 g de gingembre pelé et râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","200 ml de bouillon de volaille chaud, composé d''1⁄2 cube de bouillon","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1⁄4 - 1⁄2 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 x 125g de morue","200 g d''épinards surgelés","10 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement ou quelques feuilles entières pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez les pois chiches, l''huile, l''ail, les échalotes, le gingembre, la purée de tomates, le bouillon et la majeure partie du curcuma et des flocons de piment dans un plat à rôtir de 20 x 30 cm. Remuer et bien assaisonner, puis enfourner pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange bouillonne et que le liquide ait réduit.","Pendant ce temps, séchez la morue. Versez le reste du curcuma et des flocons de piment, ainsi qu''une grosse pincée de sel et de poivre noir fraîchement moulu, sur une assiette peu profonde et pressez la morue dans le mélange pour l''enrober. Retirez le plat à rôtir du four et déposez la morue et les épinards surgelés dans les pois chiches. Cuire 10 minutes, puis incorporer délicatement les épinards aux pois chiches. Remettre au four encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le cabillaud soit bien cuit et opaque. Verser dans des bols et parsemer de coriandre pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11245,3750,'fr','Haricots frits','Essayez cette recette de haricots frits maison. Ils fonctionnent aussi bien comme trempette de fête servie avec des nachos que comme accompagnement d''un plus grand repas de style tex-mex.','["Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs, pinto ou rouges","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 piment vert haché (facultatif)","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","coriandre hachée, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Égouttez légèrement les haricots en réservant le jus de la boîte, mais ne rincez pas (vous voulez que les haricots soient dans environ la moitié du liquide de la boîte). Selon la texture que vous préférez, écrasez-les grossièrement dans un bol ou mixez-les à l''aide d''Ablender jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Annuler.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou une cocotte et faites revenir les oignons pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés. Répartissez les graines d''ail, de piment et de cumin et faites grésiller le tout pendant 2 minutes supplémentaires. Ajoutez les haricots, l''origan, le paprika et une pincée de sel. Faites cuire le tout pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les haricots soient chauds en ajoutant davantage de jus de haricots réservé s''il est trop épais. Servir immédiatement avec une pincée de coriandre, si vous le souhaitez, ou laisser refroidir et conserver au frais. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours ou au congélateur pendant un mois. Réchauffera avec un peu d''eau mélangée."]','2026-01-11 00:09:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11246,3752,'fr','Beignets de maïs doux','Profitez au maximum du maïs doux avec ces beignets croustillants. Dégustez-les pour le brunch, le déjeuner ou en accompagnement','["150 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","160 ml de lait entier","1 oeuf","550g de maïs doux","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés, plus un peu coupés en fines lanières pour servir (facultatif)","10 g de ciboulette tranchée","une poignée de persil haché","huile de colza, pour la friture"]','["Mélanger la farine, la levure chimique, le paprika et le lait dans un grand bol. Incorporer l''œuf, suivi du maïs doux, des oignons nouveaux hachés, de la ciboulette, du persil, 1 cuillère à café de sel et du poivre noir fraîchement moulu.","Faites chauffer 1 cm d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''une petite quantité du mélange de beignets grésille lorsqu''on y dépose. Pour les beignets plus gros, déposez 2 cuillères à soupe bombées du mélange dans la poêle à la fois dans le sens des aiguilles d''une montre (cela vous aidera à vous souvenir de l''ordre dans lequel ils ont été ajoutés dans la poêle, afin que vous puissiez les retourner au bon moment). Pour les petits beignets, faites de même, mais avec 1 cuillère à soupe bombée du mélange à la fois.","Au bout de 2 minutes, retournez les beignets dans le même ordre dans lequel ils ont été ajoutés à la poêle. Cuire encore 2 minutes en continuant de retourner de temps en temps pour que les deux côtés soient uniformément dorés. Une fois prêts, les beignets doivent être d''un brun plus foncé avec des morceaux de maïs croustillants sur les bords – soyez prudent, car certains grains peuvent éclater pendant la cuisson. Retirer sur une grille et éponger tout excès d''huile à l''aide de papier absorbant. Servir aussitôt avec quelques lanières d''oignon nouveau parsemées, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11247,3756,'fr','Pâtes halloumi','Ajoutez les saveurs piquantes du halloumi aux pâtes avec les olives, les courgettes et les tomates. Le halloumi contient plus de sel que le cheddar, donc une petite quantité suffit','["250 g de pennes complètes","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","120 g de halloumi, coupé en deux jusqu''à la couture et coupé en cubes","325 g de petites tomates italiennes sur vigne, coupées en deux","320 g de courgettes coupées en cubes","3 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","6 olives Kalamata dénoyautées, coupées en quartiers","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","10 g de persil haché"]','["Faire bouillir les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive profonde à feu moyen et faites revenir le halloumi en remuant de temps en temps pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Versez sur une assiette, puis faites cuire les tomates dans la poêle pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Versez dans le bol de halloumi.","Versez les courgettes et l''ail dans la poêle, faites sauter brièvement, puis versez les tomates en conserve et incorporez les olives et l''origan. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 mn.","Égoutter les pâtes et incorporer la sauce avec le persil, le halloumi et les petites tomates italiennes. Servir la moitié immédiatement, puis laisser le reste pour un autre jour. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffer dans une poêle avec un filet d''eau à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:09:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11248,3758,'fr','Muffins salés','Préparez un lot de ces muffins salés faciles pour votre prochain pique-nique ou un déjeuner facile. Ces bouchées au fromage et aux légumes de saison sont parfaites pour les boîtes à lunch','["1 courgette (environ 175 g de poids râpé)","4 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 poivron rouge rôti en bocal, égoutté et finement haché","100 g de parmesan finement râpé","quelques brins de romarin, aiguilles cueillies et finement hachées","2 oeufs, battus","90 ml d''huile de tournesol","50-100 ml de lait entier"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser un moule à muffins à huit trous de moules à muffins. Râpez grossièrement la courgette dans une passoire fine et utilisez des mains propres pour faire sortir le plus de liquide possible au-dessus de l''évier. Versez dans un bol les oignons nouveaux, la farine, le poivron rouge rôti, la majeure partie du fromage et le romarin, ainsi que beaucoup de poivre noir et une pincée de sel.","Cassez les œufs dans un pichet, versez l''huile et complétez avec suffisamment de lait pour obtenir 300 ml. Battez ensemble, puis versez dans le mélange de courgettes et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Répartir entre les caissettes, garnir du reste du fromage et cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit levé, ferme et doré. Laisser refroidir complètement sur une grille. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours dans un récipient hermétique au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:09:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11249,3762,'fr','Timbale de courgettes et saucisses','Dégustez ce timballo de saucisses, mozzarella et courgettes chaud ou froid. C’est une excellente façon d’utiliser une surabondance de courgettes si vous en avez cultivé dans le jardin.','["noix de beurre, pour le moule","6 courgettes","2-3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","4 saucisses au choix","2-3 cuillères à soupe de pâte nduja (selon votre préférence pour la chaleur du piment)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées séchées","300 g de pennes","125 g de boule de mozzarella, égouttée et déchirée en morceaux"]','["Beurrer un moule à charnière de 20 cm et réserver. Tranchez finement 5 courgettes dans le sens de la longueur à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé ou d''une mandoline – vous devriez obtenir 6 à 8 tranches pour chaque courgette. Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-doux et faites revenir les tranches de courgettes pendant 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées (vous devrez le faire par lots, en ajoutant un peu d''huile entre chaque lot). Retirer sur une feuille de papier absorbant ou un torchon propre pour égoutter. Laisser refroidir, puis utiliser pour tapisser le moule en laissant les extrémités dépasser du bord. Il devrait vous rester quelques tranches ; mettez-les de côté pour les utiliser pour le dessus plus tard. Mettez le moule sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Annuler.","Hachez finement le reste de la courgette. Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans la même poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir. Pressez la chair des peaux des saucisses dans la poêle et continuez à frire encore quelques minutes, en écrasant la saucisse avec le dos de la cuillère jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à dorer. Incorporer la courgette hachée et cuire 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée. Ajoutez la pâte de nduja et faites frire encore 2 minutes, puis ajoutez les tomates et les herbes et faites frire encore 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout soit combiné et bien chaud. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Cuire les penne dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, égoutter, remettre dans la casserole et incorporer la sauce courgette et tomate ainsi que les morceaux de mozzarella. Versez les pâtes dans le moule tapissé de courgettes, en les tassant pour qu''elles soient bien ajustées. Replier les courgettes qui dépassent sur les pâtes, puis disposer les tranches de courgettes restantes dessus, en les repliant si possible sur les côtés. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tranches de courgettes soient bien chaudes et dorées. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 20 minutes, puis renverser sur une grande assiette de service, retirer le moule et couper en quartiers pour servir. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours et peut être consommé chaud ou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:09:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11250,3764,'fr','Cabillaud et tomates cerises','Essayez cette pâtisserie nutritive à la morue, aux tomates, aux haricots et aux pommes de terre, facile à préparer et qui compte pour deux de vos cinq par jour. Il peut être prêt en moins de 30 minutes','["200 g de tomates cerises de vigne coupées en deux","3 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de basilic finement hachées","6 olives Kalamata, coupées en deux","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 longes de cabillaud d''environ 130 g chacune","300 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux","180 g de haricots verts fins, extrémités parées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger les tomates cerises avec 2 cuillères à soupe de basilic, les olives, l''ail et l''huile, dans un petit plat peu profond allant au four antiadhésif. Ajoutez les longes de cabillaud, puis faites cuire au four pendant 15 à 18 minutes jusqu''à ce que le cabillaud soit bien cuit.","Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir les pommes de terre dans une poêle surmontée d''un cuiseur vapeur pour cuire les haricots, tous deux pendant 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres.","Disposez les haricots au centre de deux assiettes et déposez le cabillaud dessus. Versez les tomates et tout leur jus dans un bol et mélangez avec le reste du basilic, l''huile d''olive extra vierge et le vinaigre balsamique. Verser sur la morue et servir les pommes de terre à côté. Saupoudrez de poivre noir concassé, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11251,3766,'fr','Rôtis de légumes d''été','Préparez ces tostadas végétariennes colorées en seulement 30 minutes. Remplis de légumes d''été, ils constituent un repas de semaine savoureux, sain et faible en calories.','["4 mini tortillas","4 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","1 courgette coupée en deux dans le sens de la longueur, en quartiers puis coupée en morceaux de 3 cm","Boîte de 198 g de maïs doux égoutté","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","80 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 oignons nouveaux, parés et tranchés finement","250 g de petits pois surgelés, décongelés","1 gousse d''ail, pelée","2 brins de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir","une petite poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement","2 citrons verts, 1 en jus, 1 coupé en quartiers pour servir","80g de yaourt nature"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Badigeonner les tortillas avec 2 cuillères à café d''huile et disposer sur deux plaques à pâtisserie. Assaisonner légèrement. Cuire au four 5 minutes, puis retourner, retourner les plaques et cuire encore 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes et dorées. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif. Ajoutez la courgette et le maïs doux et faites cuire en remuant plusieurs fois jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à colorer sur les bords, environ 6 à 8 minutes. Ajoutez le paprika fumé et laissez cuire encore une minute. Laisser refroidir légèrement avant d’ajouter les tomates et les oignons nouveaux, puis un peu d’assaisonnement au goût.","Mettez les petits pois, l''ail, la menthe, la majeure partie de la coriandre, le jus de citron vert et le reste de l''huile dans un mini robot culinaire avec un peu d''assaisonnement et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance semblable à celle du guacamole. Ajoutez un peu d’eau si c’est trop épais.","Pour servir, tartiner chaque tortilla de trempette aux pois et garnir de légumes. Garnir avec le reste de coriandre et une cuillerée de yaourt. Servir avec des quartiers de citron vert à côté pour les presser."]','2026-01-11 00:09:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11252,3768,'fr','Chaudrée de maïs doux','Combinez différents alliums pour donner une saveur d’oignon étagé à cette chaudrée végétarienne de maïs doux. La douceur du maïs se marie à merveille avec les oignons','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 petit oignon, haché","8 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","400 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, pelées et coupées en deux","1l de bouillon de légumes","500 g de grains de maïs doux","200 ml de lait","petit bouquet de ciboulette hachée"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole à feu moyen. Ajoutez les petits oignons hachés et la plupart des oignons nouveaux tranchés (en réservant environ 2 cuillères à soupe) et faites frire pendant 6 à 8 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres mais pas dorés. Répartir les pommes de terre et les faire revenir 4 minutes pour les ramollir un peu, puis verser le bouillon et porter à ébullition. Réduire le feu à moyen-doux et laisser mijoter 15 minutes. Assaisonnez selon votre goût, puis versez le maïs doux et versez le lait. Cuire 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que le maïs soit tendre. À ce stade, vous pouvez le servir en morceaux ou en blitz à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant pour le briser un peu. Répartir dans les bols, puis parsemer de ciboulette avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11253,3770,'fr','Bol à smoothies','Préparez un bol de smoothie aux baies coloré pour le petit-déjeuner. Vous pouvez échanger de la mangue, de l''ananas et du kiwi et remplacer le lait d''avoine par de l''eau de coco pour une version tropicale.','["200 g de baies mélangées surgelées","1 banane mûre","75 ml de lait d''avoine","1 cuillère à café de sirop d''érable","½ cuillère à soupe de poudre de protéine de vanille, version végétalienne si besoin","tranches de kiwis, bananes et baies fraîches","25g de granola","1 cuillère à soupe de mélange de noix et de graines","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre d''amande"]','["Mettez les baies, la banane, le lait d''avoine, le sirop d''érable et la poudre de protéines dans un mélangeur puissant et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez un peu de lait si nécessaire, mais n''oubliez pas qu''il doit être assez épais.","Versez le smoothie dans un bol et répartissez-le sur les fruits frais, le granola et le mélange de noix et de graines. Arroser de beurre d''amande pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11254,3772,'fr','Hot-dogs à la new-yorkaise avec oignons de rue','Essayez ces hot-dogs inspirés de New York : des saucisses de Francfort garnies d''oignons caramélisés classiques, de ketchup, de moutarde américaine et d''un peu de choucroute.','["4 grosses saucisses de Francfort","4 petits pains à hot dog, divisés","choucroute, pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 gros oignons, coupés en deux et tranchés","1⁄4 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","grosse pincée de poudre de chili","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","2 cuillères à café de moutarde américaine, plus un peu pour servir","2 cuillères à café de ketchup, plus un peu pour servir","2 cuillères à café de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de cidre ou de vin blanc","1 cuillère à café de sauce Worcestershire"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez les oignons. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu doux-moyen et faites cuire les oignons pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et légèrement carbonisés par endroits.","Incorporer la cannelle, la poudre de chili, le miel, la moutarde, le ketchup, la purée de tomates, le vinaigre, la sauce Worcestershire, 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et une pincée de sel. Laisser mijoter pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient tendres, en ajoutant un peu d''eau s''ils semblent secs. Goûtez et ajoutez un peu plus de poudre de piment, de moutarde ou une pincée de sucre, si vous le souhaitez. Gardez les oignons au chaud si vous servez immédiatement ou au frais et au réfrigérateur. Ils se conservent dans un récipient hermétique au réfrigérateur jusqu''à cinq jours. Réchauffer à feu doux avant de servir, en ajoutant un peu d''eau pour détendre si nécessaire.","Allumez un barbecue et attendez que les braises soient cendrées, réglez un barbecue à gaz sur feu moyen ou faites chauffer une poêle à feu moyen. Vous pouvez également porter une casserole d’eau à ébullition. Cuire les saucisses de Francfort 15 min au barbecue ou dans une sauteuse jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient carbonisées, ou 8 min dans une casserole d''eau frémissante. Si vous utilisez un barbecue, réchauffez les petits pains sur la braise, si vous le souhaitez. Versez un peu de choucroute dans chaque petit pain, garnissez d''une saucisse de Francfort et versez sur les oignons. Arroser d''un peu de moutarde et de ketchup supplémentaires."]','2026-01-11 00:09:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11255,3774,'fr','Tarte filo aux crevettes, poivrons et pois chiches','Essayez une version plus légère d''une tarte traditionnelle garnie de pâtisserie, avec une garniture de crevettes, de poivrons et de pois chiches. La pâte filo lui donne également un excellent croquant','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus 1 cuillère à café","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1-2 cuillères à café d''harissa, au goût","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","300 g de crevettes crues","3 poivrons rouges rôtis en bocal, finement tranchés","300 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 citron, coupé en quartiers","petit bouquet de persil finement haché","6 feuilles de pâte filo"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une poêle allant au four à feu moyen et ajoutez l''oignon et l''ail. Cuire doucement pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement ramolli. Incorporez la harissa et la purée de tomates et laissez cuire encore 3 minutes. Ajoutez les pois chiches, les crevettes, les poivrons et le bouillon.","Portez à légère ébullition, puis assaisonnez, arrosez d''un filet de jus de citron et du persil. Ébouriffez les feuilles de pâtisserie dessus et badigeonnez-les du reste d''huile d''olive. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bouillonnants. Servir avec des quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:09:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11256,3776,'fr','Rouleaux d''été croustillants au tofu avec trempette aux noix de cajou','Préparez ces rouleaux d''été au tofu vibrants et remplis de légumes végétaliens en remplaçant simplement la sauce de poisson par une variété végétalienne.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame","200 g de tofu fumé coupé en cubes de 1 cm","200 g de nouilles de riz vermicelles","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson végétarienne","14 wraps et papier de riz","½ petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","½ petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies","1 grosse carotte, coupée en fines allumettes","½ concombre, coupé en fines allumettes","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","100 g de beurre de cajou lisse","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen. Séchez le tofu, puis faites-le frire pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant. Retirer dans un bol et réserver.","Versez les nouilles de riz dans un bol profond résistant à la chaleur et couvrez d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Laisser tremper 15 minutes, puis égoutter et rincer sous l''eau froide pour stopper la cuisson. Fouetter ensemble le reste de l''huile de sésame, le vinaigre de riz, la cassonade et la sauce de poisson, puis verser les nouilles et mélanger pour enrober.","Pour la trempette, mélangez le beurre de cajou, la sauce soja, le vinaigre et l''ail, puis incorporez lentement 50 ml d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire pour la détendre.","Pour assembler les rouleaux, plongez l''une des feuilles de papier de riz dans un bol d''eau chaude, en la remuant jusqu''à ce que la feuille soit molle, environ 10 à 15 secondes. Transférer sur un torchon propre pour égoutter. Transférez l''emballage sur une planche et disposez quelques feuilles de menthe et de coriandre le long d''un bord, suivies de quelques allumettes de carottes et de concombre, d''un peu de tofu frit et de quelques nouilles assaisonnées. Soulevez le bord de l''emballage vers le haut et par-dessus la garniture et, en maintenant la garniture en position avec vos doigts, commencez à l''enrouler fermement. Lorsque vous êtes à mi-chemin, pliez les extrémités de l’emballage pour enfermer la garniture, puis continuez à rouler pour sceller. Répétez avec les emballages restants et la garniture.","Pour servir, coupez les rouleaux en deux en diagonale. Saupoudrez les graines de sésame sur la sauce et servez-la à côté pour la tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:09:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11257,3778,'fr','Sablés écossais','Préparez de simples carrés de sablés écossais pour le moule à biscuits en utilisant seulement quatre ingrédients. Ils sont parfaits avec une tasse de thé en milieu de matinée','["250 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","350 g de farine nature","50g de farine de riz","100 g de sucre en poudre, plus 1 cuillère à soupe"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule de 28 x 18 cm. Au robot culinaire, mélangez le beurre, les deux farines, ½ cuillère à café de sel et les 100 g de sucre jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine. Pulsez encore quelques fois jusqu''à ce qu''il se forme en une boule grossière. Vous pouvez également mettre tous les ingrédients dans un bol et frotter du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine. Réunissez en une pâte souple et pressez-la dans le moule préparé. À l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, marquez la pâte en 16 barres.","Saupoudrer du reste de sucre et cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et pris. Retirez et piquez la pâte partout. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 5 minutes avant de transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement. À l’aide d’un couteau bien aiguisé, coupez vos partitions précédentes pour les séparer complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:09:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11258,3780,'fr','Salade Caprese','Préparez cette salade tricolore italienne classique en entrée ou en accompagnement. C’est incroyablement simple mais, réalisé avec des tomates parfaitement mûres, c’est un vrai délice','["8 tomates italiennes mûres, tranchées","2 boules de mozzarella (ou alternative végétarienne), tranchées","une poignée de feuilles de basilic","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique"]','["Disposez les tranches de tomate et de mozzarella sur une assiette, en alternant les tranches de chacune, et saupoudrez de feuilles de basilic. Assaisonner généreusement de sel et de poivre noir, puis arroser d''huile d''olive et de vinaigre. Servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:09:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11259,3782,'fr','Frites de courgettes','Abandonnez les pommes de terre et essayez ces délicieuses frites de courgettes comme collation ou comme plat d''accompagnement. Parsemer de parmesan avant de servir','["2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","2 courgettes coupées en bâtonnets de 1 cm","huile, pour la friture","15 g de parmesan râpé"]','["Versez la farine dans un bol, arrosez de 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et mélangez pour former une pâte épaisse. Assaisonnez avec beaucoup de sel et de poivre noir fraîchement moulu, puis incorporez les courgettes.","Versez l''huile dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne environ 4 cm de profondeur, en veillant à ce qu''elle ne soit pas remplie à plus des deux tiers. Régler sur feu moyen jusqu''à 180°C ou un peu de pâte tombée en grésille et brunit en 30 secondes. Plongez la moitié des courgettes panées dans l''huile chaude et faites-les frire, en les retournant après 1 min à l''aide d''une écumoire, pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. S’ils commencent à se coller, séparez-les doucement avec des pinces. Retirer de l''huile chaude et égoutter sur une assiette recouverte d''une feuille de papier absorbant. Répéter avec la moitié restante, puis parsemer de parmesan avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11260,3784,'fr','Stroganoff de porc','Profitez de notre stroganoff pour un dîner principal décontracté. Un excellent plat à emporter, nous l''avons préparé avec du porc et y avons ajouté de la moutarde de Dijon et des champignons supplémentaires pour plus de punch.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","500 g de champignons châtaignes émincés","400 g de filet de porc coupé en morceaux de 1 cm","2 oignons, coupés en demi-lunes","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon","200 ml de bouillon de porc ou de poulet","284 ml ou 300 ml de crème sure en pot","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","riz cuit, pommes de terre ou tagliatelles, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir la moitié des champignons pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que leur liquide se libère et s''évapore. Retirer de la poêle et réserver, puis répéter avec le reste des champignons et encore 2 cuillères à café d''huile. Annuler. Dans la même poêle, faites revenir le porc pendant 5 à 8 minutes dans 2 cuillères à café d''huile jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Annuler.","Faites revenir les oignons dans 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile restante à feu doux-moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à caraméliser, environ 10 à 12 minutes, puis remettez les champignons dedans avec le porc. Saupoudrer de paprika et verser la moutarde de Dijon. Donnez à tout un bon mélange pour combiner. Versez le bouillon, assaisonnez bien de sel et de poivre, puis mélangez à nouveau. À ce stade, vous pouvez retirer du feu, laisser refroidir, puis couvrir et réfrigérer. Se conservera au frais pendant trois jours ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois. Au moment de servir, décongelez complètement avant de porter à ébullition et de poursuivre la recette.","Incorporer la crème sure. Cuire encore environ 2 minutes pour vous assurer que la viande est bien chaude, puis parsemer de persil haché. Servir avec du riz, des pommes de terre ou des tagliatelles, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11261,3786,'fr','Soupe de céleri-rave','Laissez cette copieuse soupe de céleri-rave vous réchauffer par temps froid. Garnissez de notre crumble aux noisettes pour plus de croquant et servez au déjeuner ou en entrée d''un menu d''hiver.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, tranché","2 branches de céleri, coupées en dés","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 petit céleri-rave (environ 800 g), pelé et coupé en dés","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","¼ cuillère à café de muscade moulue","50 ml de crème fraîche allégée","2 cuillères à soupe de noisettes grossièrement hachées","2 cuillères à soupe de chapelure panko","une petite poignée de ciboulette finement hachée"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen-doux. Faire suer l''oignon, le céleri et l''ail avec la poêle partiellement recouverte par le couvercle pendant 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez le céleri-rave et versez sur le bouillon. Portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le céleri-rave soit tendre. Retirer du feu, incorporer la muscade, la crème fraîche et un peu d''assaisonnement. Mixez avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen. Faites frire les noisettes et la chapelure doucement pendant quelques minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient grillées. Mettre dans un bol, incorporer la ciboulette et assaisonner. Versez la soupe dans des bols et versez-la sur le crumble aux noisettes pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11262,3787,'fr','Flaps aux pommes','Ces flapjacks ajoutent une touche fruitée aux classiques pâtisseries à l''avoine avec un mélange de pommes fraîches et séchées, et constituent une collation gagnante pour toute la famille lorsque vous êtes en déplacement ou en pique-nique.','["175 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","2-3 pommes (environ 350 g), pelées, épépinées et coupées en petits morceaux","200 g de sirop doré","150 g de sucre mou roux clair","300 g de flocons d''avoine","50 g de pommes séchées hachées","1/2 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer le fond d''un moule carré de 20 x 20 cm et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Versez les pommes hachées dans une petite casserole avec 2 cuillères à café d''eau et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes soient juste assez tendres pour être écrasées, mais il reste encore un peu d''eau dans la casserole. Si nécessaire, ajoutez un peu d''eau et faites cuire les pommes un peu plus longtemps. Retirer du feu et écraser les pommes à l''aide d''un presse-purée ou d''une fourchette pour les écraser légèrement, puis les verser dans un bol et réserver.","Versez le beurre, le sirop doré et le sucre dans la casserole et faites chauffer à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu et que le sucre soit dissous. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Mélanger les flocons d''avoine, les pommes séchées et la cannelle, le cas échéant, dans un grand bol. Versez le mélange de sirop de beurre et les pommes cuites, puis mélangez. Versez le mélange de flapjack dans le moule préparé et appuyez fermement. Nivelez la surface à l''aide d''une spatule, puis faites cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et bouillonnante sur les côtés. Laisser refroidir. Couper en 16 morceaux. Se conserve trois jours dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:09:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11263,3789,'fr','Roulade de meringue tiramisu','Combinez le tiramisu et la roulade de meringue pour faire un dessert impressionnant. La meringue croustillante contraste magnifiquement avec la crème au café soyeuse dans cette recette','["4 gros blancs d''œufs à température ambiante","200 g de sucre en poudre","sucre glace et cacao en poudre, pour saupoudrer","200 ml de crème fraîche","50 g de cassonade foncée","150 g de mascarpone","3 cuillères à soupe de liqueur de café masala ou de liqueur de café normale (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe de café instantané dissous dans 50 ml d''eau bouillante et laissé légèrement refroidir","100 g de chocolat noir fondu et laissé légèrement refroidir"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la ganache. Fouettez le café et le chocolat fondu jusqu''à obtenir un mélange lisse et brillant. Laisser refroidir et épaissir en remuant de temps en temps.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de 23 x 32 cm de papier sulfurisé. Pour la meringue, battre les blancs d''œufs et une pincée de sel au fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement fermes.","Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre aux blancs d''œufs, puis fouettez à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir des pics fermes. Répétez avec le reste du sucre, une cuillerée à la fois, jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et brillant. Répartir uniformément sur la plaque, puis cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant au toucher et légèrement doré par endroits. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Pour la garniture à la crème au mascarpone, mettez la crème, le sucre, le mascarpone et la liqueur, le cas échéant, dans un bol moyen et fouettez jusqu''à épaississement.","Pour le montage, tamisez un peu de sucre glace sur une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé, puis retournez délicatement la meringue refroidie dessus. Soulevez le moule et retirez le papier sulfurisé. Avec une extrémité courte face à vous, tracez une ligne à 2 cm du bord de la meringue. Étalez uniformément la ganache sur la meringue, puis recouvrez de crème en la lissant avec une spatule, puis roulez délicatement en roulade, en commençant par l''extrémité rainurée et en vous aidant du papier sulfurisé. Transférer dans une assiette de service et saupoudrer de cacao en poudre."]','2026-01-11 00:09:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11264,3793,'fr','Salade de pommes et feta','Mélangez des pommes, des feuilles mélangées et de la feta pour préparer cette salade polyvalente avec une vinaigrette au citron, à l''huile d''olive et au miel. Vous pouvez également saupoudrer de pul biber, si vous le souhaitez.','["3 petites pommes rouges (type Braeburn ou Gala), évidées, coupées en quartiers et coupées en 4 tranches par quartier","100 g de feuilles mélangées","200 g de feta coupée en petits morceaux","1 citron, zesté et pressé","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe bombées de miel clair","quelques pincées de pul biber (facultatif)"]','["Mélanger les pommes et les feuilles et disposer sur une assiette. Parsemer de feta, puis parsemer de zeste de citron.","Mélangez le jus de citron, l''huile d''olive, le miel, une généreuse mouture de poivre noir fraîchement moulu et une bonne pincée de sel. Versez la vinaigrette sur la salade et saupoudrez d''un peu de pul biber, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:09:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11265,3795,'fr','Friteuse à air halloumi','Cuire le halloumi dans une friteuse à air au lieu d''un gril ou d''une poêle à frire aide à réduire la teneur en matières grasses. Assaisonner avec du paprika fumé ou un mélange d''herbes, si vous le souhaitez, pour une explosion de saveur supplémentaire','["225 g de halloumi, coupé en tranches de 6 cm x 1 cm d''épaisseur","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé, d''herbes mélangées ou d''autres arômes (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer votre friteuse à 200°C pendant 2 minutes. Séchez soigneusement le halloumi avec du papier absorbant ou un chiffon propre, puis brossez ou frottez avec de l''huile. Assaisonner avec du sel et du poivre et des arômes, le cas échéant.","Mettez le halloumi dans le panier de la friteuse et laissez cuire 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer. Retourner et cuire encore 2 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:09:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11266,3797,'fr','Gaufres classiques','Préparez des gaufres salées ou sucrées grâce à ce mélange à pâte tout-en-un. Pour des gaufres encore plus légères, fouettez le blanc d''œuf jusqu''à ce qu''il soit mousseux, puis incorporez-le à la pâte.','["1 oeuf","225 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré (facultatif)","250 ml de lait","50 g de beurre fondu et refroidi","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","sirop d''érable et sucre glace, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Cassez l''œuf (pour des gaufres plus moelleuses, utilisez uniquement le jaune à ce stade) dans un grand bol, puis versez la farine et une généreuse pincée de sel. Ajoutez le sucre, si vous en utilisez, puis incorporez progressivement le lait suivi du beurre fondu jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer la vanille, si vous en utilisez. Si vous avez choisi de faire des gaufres plus moelleuses, fouettez le blanc d''œuf jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous, puis incorporez-le délicatement à la pâte. Vous pouvez également préparer la pâte en mélangeant tous les ingrédients ensemble à l''aide d''un mélangeur ou d''un mélangeur à main. Peut être préparée 1 à 2 heures à l''avance et réfrigérée.","Faites chauffer un gaufrier en suivant les instructions du fabricant, badigeonnez-le d''un peu d''huile, puis versez suffisamment de pâte pour couvrir juste la surface. Cuire en suivant les instructions du fabricant (généralement 5 à 6 minutes) jusqu''à ce que les gaufres soient dorées et croustillantes. Servir immédiatement ou garder au chaud à four doux pendant que vous préparez le reste. Arroser de sirop d''érable ou saupoudrer de sucre glace, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11267,3799,'fr','Chili aux légumes et aux haricots','Ce piment végétarien sain constitue un souper rapide et satisfaisant, rempli de légumineuses et de légumes frais colorés.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail , hachée finement","gingembre , finement haché","1 gros oignon , haché","2 courgettes, coupées en dés","1 poivron rouge épépiné et haché","1 poivron jaune épépiné et haché","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de piment","100 g de lentilles rouges lavées et égouttées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2x boîtes de tomates hachées","Boîte de 195 g de maïs doux égoutté","Boîte de 420 g de haricots beurre égouttés","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges dans l''eau, égouttés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Faites cuire l''ail, le gingembre, l''oignon, les courgettes et les poivrons pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez la poudre de piment et laissez cuire encore 1 min.","Incorporer les lentilles, le concentré de tomates, les tomates et 250 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes.","Ajoutez le maïs doux et les haricots et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:09:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11268,3801,'fr','Pain aux bananes sans sucre','Cette recette est naturellement sucrée avec des fruits et un filet facultatif de sirop d''agave, ce qui signifie que moins de sucre ajouté est nécessaire dans ce pain aux bananes.','["125 g de farine complète autolevante","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","75 g de raisins secs","50 g de beurre fondu","2 cuillères à café d''essence de vanille","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","3 bananes mûres, écrasées","arroser de sirop d''agave, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Adultes : Préchauffer le four à 180 C/160 C chaleur tournante/thermostat 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à pain de 450 g/1 lb de papier sulfurisé.","Enfants : Pesez la farine, la levure chimique, la cannelle et les raisins secs dans un bol et mélangez avec une cuillère en bois. Pesez ensuite le beurre, l''essence de vanille, l''œuf, le lait et la purée de bananes et mettez-les dans un autre bol ou pichet et mélangez avec un petit fouet ballon ou une fourchette. Versez le mélange de bananes « humide » dans le mélange de farine « sèche » et mélangez bien avec une cuillère en bois. La pesée doit être très précise lors de la cuisson, alors aidez les enfants plus âgés à mesurer avec soin. Les jeunes enfants peuvent également participer en versant ou en versant dans la balance sous la surveillance d''un adulte. Les plus jeunes peuvent également battre l’œuf avec une fourchette et écraser la banane avec un presse-purée.","Adultes : Versez le mélange à gâteau dans le moule préparé et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre. A la sortie du four, laissez refroidir dans le moule 10 min puis démoulez.","Enfants : Arroser de sirop d''agave si vous en utilisez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11269,3809,'fr','Frites de brocoli au gingembre et noix de cajou','Essayez nos frites de brocoli au gingembre pour un dîner végétarien sain. C''est un peu comme du riz frit mais avec du brocoli riche en antioxydants','["320 g de tête de brocoli, tiges et fleurons séparés","40 g de noix de cajou hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","15 g de gingembre finement tranché","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en fines lanières","1 grosse carotte (160 g), coupée en fines lanières","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 piment rouge, épépiné et finement haché, plus tranché supplémentaire, pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de tamari","1 citron vert, jus et zesté","7 g de coriandre hachée, plus un peu pour servir","2 oeufs, battus"]','["Passer les tiges de brocoli au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement hachées. Ajoutez les fleurons et mélangez à nouveau pour obtenir une texture semblable à celle du riz.","Faites légèrement griller les noix de cajou dans une poêle awokor, puis versez-les sur une assiette et réservez. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu vif et ajoutez le gingembre, l''oignon, le poivron, la carotte, l''ail et le piment. Faites sauter pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer, puis mettez un couvercle et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes.","Ajoutez le brocoli et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et faites sauter pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que tous les légumes soient tendres. Versez le tamari, le jus et le zeste de citron vert et la coriandre, remuez bien, puis versez les œufs et faites sauter très brièvement pour juste prendre. Servir avec les noix de cajou, de la coriandre supplémentaire et du piment tranché supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11270,3811,'fr','Salade de quinoa aux légumes verts râpés et raisins secs','Mettez le quinoa en valeur dans cette merveilleuse salade composée de légumes verts, d''avocat, de feta et de raisins secs. Plutôt qu''une céréale, le quinoa est une graine et constitue une excellente source de protéines.','["150 g de quinoa","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","200 g de chou frisé, râpé","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 poivron vert épépiné et coupé en petits morceaux","30g raisins","2 petits avocats, hachés","40 g de feta végétarienne"]','["Rincez le quinoa dans un tamis sous l''eau courante jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire, puis faites cuire 20 minutes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Laisser reposer 5 mn. Rincer à nouveau et bien égoutter en appuyant sur le tamis.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le vinaigre et l''huile dans un grand bol, ajoutez le cavolo nero et massez la vinaigrette avec vos mains pour la ramollir.","Ajouter le quinoa, l''oignon, le poivron et les raisins secs, puis bien mélanger. Verser la moitié dans des assiettes, répartir sur 1 avocat haché, émietter la moitié de la feta et mélanger. Le reste se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Garnir du reste de l''avocat et de la feta, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11271,3815,'fr','Pop-corn épicé au micro-ondes','Savourez une collation plus saine que les chips. L''huile de sésame ajoute de la saveur et aide les épices à adhérer au pop-corn, mais vous pouvez utiliser de l''huile d''olive ou de colza à la place.','["50 g de grains de maïs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à café de granulés d''ail","2-3 cuillères à café de paprika fumé"]','["Versez les grains de maïs dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur, couvrez et passez au micro-ondes pendant 5 à 8 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que l''éclatement s''arrête.","Incorporer l''huile et les épices et bien mélanger pour enrober. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:09:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11272,3819,'fr','Œufs brouillés au micro-ondes','Préparez un délicieux petit-déjeuner composé d''œufs brouillés en un rien de temps : ce plat riche en protéines ne passe que quatre minutes au micro-ondes.','["2 œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de lait entier","toasts, pour servir"]','["Utilisez une fourchette pour battre ensemble les œufs, le lait et une pincée de sel dans un pichet allant au micro-ondes. Cuire au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 30 secondes, puis battre à nouveau et remettre au micro-ondes pendant encore 30 secondes.","Battez à nouveau en brisant les morceaux d''œuf. Cuire au micro-ondes pendant encore 15 secondes, puis battre à nouveau ; les œufs seront lâches à ce stade, alors servez-les immédiatement si vous les aimez ainsi. Si vous préférez vos œufs un peu plus fermes, passez encore 15 secondes au micro-ondes, battez, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11273,3821,'fr','Taramasalata','Préparez des taramasalata maison au lieu d''utiliser des taramas achetés en magasin. C''est plus facile que vous ne le pensez et constitue un excellent ajout à un plateau de pâturages.','["100 g de pain blanc rassis sans croûte (environ 5-6 tranches)","250 g d''œufs de cabillaud fumés","½ oignon rouge, haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 citron, jus","75 ml d''huile d''olive, plus un filet pour servir","75 ml d''huile de tournesol","pittas grillées, pour servir"]','["Faites tremper le pain dans un bol d''eau froide, puis essorez l''excédent et versez-le dans un robot culinaire ou un mixeur. Coupez la peau épaisse des lobes d''œufs, grattez les œufs mous en dessous et versez-les dans le robot culinaire avec le pain. Ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail, le jus de citron et une bonne mouture de poivre noir, puis réduisez en pâte.","Moteur tournant, versez progressivement l''huile d''olive, puis l''huile de tournesol, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit incorporé et que vous obteniez une pâte un peu plus épaisse. Grattez le taramasalata dans un bol de service, arrosez d''un peu plus d''huile d''olive et servez avec des pittas grillées pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:09:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11274,3823,'fr','Saucisses à la friteuse','Cuire des saucisses rapidement et facilement à l''aide d''une friteuse à air et sans avoir besoin d''huile supplémentaire','["6 saucisses au choix"]','["Percez les saucisses plusieurs fois partout à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé (c''est facultatif, mais cela aidera à libérer plus de graisse). Disposez les saucisses en une seule couche dans un panier de friteuse à air.","Réglez la friteuse à 180°C et laissez cuire 10 à 15 minutes, en la retournant toutes les 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les saucisses soient bien cuites. Si vous disposez d''un thermomètre à viande, vérifiez qu''il atteint 75°C au milieu. Servir en accompagnement au petit-déjeuner ou dans des petits pains."]','2026-01-11 00:09:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11275,3825,'fr','Poitrines de poulet à la friteuse','Utilisez une friteuse à air pour créer ce plat alléchant de tendres poitrines de poulet enrobées d''ail, de paprika doux et d''herbes. Mélangez les épices pour plus d''intérêt ou gardez-les simples si vous préférez','["4 poitrines de poulet","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à café de sel","1 ½ cuillère à café de granulés d''ail","1 cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","2 cuillères à café d''herbes mélangées","½ cuillère à café de poivre","du riz cuit à la vapeur et des légumes verts comme du brocoli ou des haricots verts ou une salade verte, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Enduisez le poulet d’huile et réservez. Dans un bol, mélanger le sel, l''ail, le paprika et le mélange d''herbes avec une bonne mouture de poivre noir, puis répartir sur une assiette.","Roulez chaque poitrine de poulet huilée dans l''assaisonnement et mettez-la dans votre panier de friteuse à air. Cuire à 180°C pendant 18 à 20 minutes en retournant après 10 minutes. Pour vérifier la cuisson, percez le poulet avec un couteau au niveau de la partie la plus épaisse pour voir si le jus est clair. Ou insérez un thermomètre de température et il devrait indiquer 70 °C. Servir avec du riz et des légumes verts ou une salade."]','2026-01-11 00:09:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11276,3827,'fr','Saumon à la friteuse à air','Les filets de saumon cuisent à merveille dans une friteuse à air et constituent un délicieux repas lorsqu''ils sont enrobés d''un assaisonnement aux herbes et servis avec des légumes verts et des céréales.','["1 cuillère à café de sel","1 cuillère à café de poivre","1 cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées","1 cuillère à café de granulés d''ail (facultatif)","4 filets de saumon (nous avons utilisé 4 filets de 130 g), avec ou sans la peau","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","légumes verts et céréales de saison cuits comme le quinoa ou le riz brun, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez le sel, le poivre, le mélange d''herbes et les granules d''ail, le cas échéant, dans un bol, puis répartissez-les sur une assiette. Frotter chaque filet de saumon avec un peu d''huile d''olive et rouler dans l''assaisonnement pour bien l''enrober.","Mettez le panier de la friteuse en une seule couche et faites cuire à 180°C pendant 8 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Si vous avez des filets de saumon plus gros, ils devront être cuits plus longtemps – continuez à vérifier après 10 minutes et faites cuire par rafales de 1 à 2 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient prêts. Servir avec des légumes verts et du quinoa ou du riz, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11277,3829,'fr','Cuisses de poulet à la friteuse','Cuire des cuisses de poulet dans une friteuse à air est un moyen rapide d’obtenir une viande succulente avec une délicieuse peau croustillante. Un enrobage épicé apporte la touche finale parfaite','["1 cuillère à café de paprika","½ cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées","½ cuillère à café de granulés d''ail (facultatif)","4 cuisses de poulet, avec os","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive"]','["Mélangez le paprika dans un bol avec les herbes et les granules d''ail, le cas échéant, ainsi que ½ cuillère à café de sel et ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu. Répartir sur une assiette. Frotter les cuisses de poulet avec l''huile, puis les enrober du mélange d''épices.","Mettez dans le panier de votre friteuse et faites cuire, peau vers le bas, pendant 10 min. Retourner et cuire encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit et que la peau soit croustillante. Pour vérifier qu''elles sont cuites, percez la partie la plus épaisse de la cuisse avec un couteau pour voir si le jus est clair. Retirer immédiatement de la friteuse à air pour empêcher la peau de ramollir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11278,3835,'fr','Payment Management vanille, ananas & fruit de la passion','Préparez tous les éléments de ces pavlovas et laissez les enfants les construire. L''ananas et le fruit de la passion sont une excellente combinaison au printemps, ou essayez les baies en été.','["3 blancs d''œufs","115 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","200g crème fraîche","25g de sucre glace","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g d''ananas coupé en petits morceaux","2 fruits de la passion, graines vidées","feuilles de menthe, râpées (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 130°C/110°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Dessinez quatre cercles de 8 à 10 cm de diamètre sur le papier sulfurisé, puis retournez-les. Battez les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à formation de pics fermes. Incorporez progressivement le sucre jusqu''à consistance épaisse et brillante, puis la maïzena et le jus de citron. Empilez la meringue en tourbillons sur les cercles marqués, en faisant une trempette au milieu, puis faites cuire au four sur l''étagère la plus basse pendant 55 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit croustillante à l''extérieur et sèche en dessous. Éteignez le four, laissez la porte entrouverte et laissez les meringues refroidir complètement. Peut être préparée la veille et conservée dans une boîte hermétique.","Fouetter la crème fraîche dans un bol avec le sucre glace et l''extrait de vanille jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et moelleuse. Mélangez l’ananas et le fruit de la passion dans un bol à part. Pour assembler, déposer un quart du mélange de crème fraîche sur chaque meringue, garnir d''ananas et de fruits de la passion et arroser de jus de fruit de la passion. Terminez avec des feuilles de menthe pour servir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11279,3837,'fr','Crêpes à la tarte au banoffee','Ce jour des crêpes, essayez une nouvelle version de la tarte au banoffee. Le dulce de leche collant et les bananes sucrées constituent une garniture irrésistible pour des crêpes moelleuses','["3 œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","100 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","80 ml de lait","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","5 cuillères à soupe de dulce de leche","2 bananes, tranchées","1 biscuit digestif émietté","chocolat râpé, pour servir"]','["Séparez les œufs en mettant les blancs dans un bol et 2 des jaunes dans un autre bol (utilisez le troisième jaune dans une autre recette). Mélangez les jaunes avec le sucre, la farine, la levure chimique et le lait pour obtenir une pâte lisse.","Battre les blancs d''œufs et une pincée de sel au fouet électrique (ou à la main) jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient mousseux et conservent leur forme. Incorporer délicatement au mélange de jaunes d''œufs, en prenant soin de ne pas faire sortir l''air.","Faites chauffer le beurre et l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen. Versez un quart (ou la moitié si vous préparez deux crêpes plus grosses) du mélange dans la poêle et faites cuire de chaque côté pendant 1 à 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Répétez avec le reste du mélange pour faire un total de 4 (ou 2) crêpes. Gardez-les couverts.","Réchauffez doucement le dulce de leche dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce qu''il se détache. Servir les crêpes sur deux assiettes et garnir de tranches de banane, de dulce de leche, de biscuit émietté et de chocolat râpé."]','2026-01-11 00:09:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11280,3839,'fr','Houmous épicé à la patate douce','Évitez le gaspillage et savourez une collation copieuse en utilisant les restes de patates douces dans cette recette de houmous – elle a une touche épicée grâce au paprika fumé et aux flocons de piment.','["2 patates douces moyennes (environ 400 g), pelées et coupées en cubes de 2 cm","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","1⁄2 cuillère à café de flocons de piment, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","3 gousses d''ail, non pelées","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","1 citron, jus","crudités de légumes, gressins ou crackers et olives dénoyautées, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez les patates douces sur une plaque à pâtisserie et arrosez d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive. Saupoudrer de flocons de piment, le cas échéant, et de paprika, puis mélanger pour bien enrober d''huile épicée. Étalez en une seule couche. Coupez la racine des gousses d''ail, puis placez-les parmi les patates douces. Rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres, en remuant à mi-cuisson.","Sortez la plaque du four et laissez-la refroidir complètement. Versez les patates douces dans un robot culinaire et pressez l''ail de sa peau. Ajoutez le tahini et le jus de citron, puis mixez pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient décomposées.","Moteur en marche, versez progressivement le reste de l''huile d''olive. Continuez à blitzer jusqu''à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que vous obteniez une pâte lisse. Versez 50 à 60 ml d''eau froide pour détendre, mélangez à nouveau, puis assaisonnez au goût. Versez le houmous dans un bol et remuez avec le dos d''une cuillère à café, puis arrosez d''un peu plus d''huile d''olive et parsemez de flocons de piment supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez. Servir avec votre choix de crudités de légumes, de gressins ou de craquelins et d''olives pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:09:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11281,3841,'fr','Crostini aux haricots cannellini écrasés','Ajoutez un peu plus d''huile à cette trempette aux haricots cannellini écrasés, si vous préférez – plus vous en ajoutez, plus elle devient soyeuse.','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser (facultatif)","12 feuilles de sauge (facultatif)","1 oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1⁄2 cuillère à café de poivre noir concassé","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés et rincés","1⁄2 citron, jus","12 crostini ou gressins, pour servir (voir conseil ci-dessous)"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l’huile dans une casserole peu profonde à feu moyen-doux et parsemez-y les feuilles de sauge, le cas échéant. Faire revenir 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant, soulever sur une assiette à l''aide d''une écumoire. Versez l''oignon dans la poêle et faites cuire 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, puis ajoutez l''ail et laissez cuire encore 1 minute. Saupoudrer de poivre et faire griller pendant 1 min, puis incorporer les haricots. Éteignez le feu. Incorporer le jus de citron.","Assaisonnez le mélange avec du sel, puis versez-le dans un robot culinaire ou un mini hachoir avec le reste de l''huile. Mélangez le tout jusqu''à obtenir la consistance souhaitée – cela peut être une pâte lisse ou rugueuse. Se conservera couvert au réfrigérateur pendant deux jours. Amener à température ambiante 1 heure avant de servir.","Servir la trempette telle quelle avec des crostini ou des gressins, ou arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive supplémentaire et garnir de feuilles de sauge croustillantes, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:09:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11282,3843,'fr','Salade de fenouil et roquette émincé','Servez notre salade de fenouil et de roquette en accompagnement – ​​le fenouil cru peut être fibreux, mais le trancher finement avant de le mariner légèrement dans du jus de citron le décompose','["1 bulbe de fenouil","1⁄2 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil (facultatif)","1⁄2 citron, jus","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","50g de fusée"]','["Retirez les feuilles du bulbe de fenouil et réservez. Coupez les tiges dures, puis tranchez finement le bulbe à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé ou idéalement d''une mandoline. Versez les tranches de fenouil dans un bol et, avec vos mains, écrasez une grosse pincée de sel, les graines de fenouil, le cas échéant, et le jus de citron. Couvrir et laisser reposer à température ambiante pendant au moins 10 minutes, ou réfrigérer jusqu''à quelques heures.","Pour servir, arrosez le fenouil mariné d''huile d''olive, puis mélangez la roquette et les feuilles de fenouil réservées. Servir directement du bol ou empiler dans des assiettes."]','2026-01-11 00:09:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11283,3847,'fr','Salade verte printanière au persil et fromage bleu','Servez cette salade vibrante avec du fromage bleu comme souper léger ou comme plat d''accompagnement. Le chou frisé ou les blettes fonctionneront également à la place des légumes verts du printemps','["300 g de jeunes pousses de verdure, toutes tiges dures enlevées, feuilles finement tranchées","½ gros bouquet de persil haché","250 g de quinoa prêt à l''emploi","1 petit oignon rouge, finement tranché","100 g de fromage bleu émietté (prévoir végétarien si besoin)","1 citron, zesté et pressé","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","35 g de noix hachées grossièrement (facultatif)"]','["Mettez la bouilloire à ébullition. Versez les légumes verts de printemps dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur et couvrez d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire, puis laissez reposer 2 minutes pour ramollir légèrement. Bien égoutter, puis verser sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant. Étalez les légumes verts en une seule couche afin que le papier puisse absorber autant d''excès d''eau que possible. Laisser refroidir 2 min.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le persil, le quinoa et les oignons rouges. Incorporer les légumes verts printaniers, puis répartir sur le fromage et mélanger délicatement avec vos mains pour combiner.","Fouetter le zeste et le jus de citron, la moutarde et l''huile de colza dans un pichet pour faire une vinaigrette. Versez-le sur la salade verte printanière et mélangez délicatement. Versez la salade sur un grand plat de service ou versez-la dans des bols individuels et répartissez-la sur les noix, le cas échéant. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:09:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11284,3853,'fr','Kugel de pommes de terre et céleri-rave','Allégez la charge en glucides en remplaçant la moitié de la pomme de terre par du céleri-rave dans ce kugel de pommes de terre. Le kugel aux pommes de terre est un plat d''accompagnement traditionnel du sabbat juif','["6 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour le plat","2 oignons moyens, hachés","450 g de pommes de terre féculentes, râpées","450 g de céleri-rave paré, pelé et râpé","1 œuf légèrement battu","2 cuillères à soupe de persil finement haché, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et huiler légèrement un plat allant au four ou une rôtissoire de 25 x 20 cm.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen. Faites frire les oignons jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et tendres, environ 10 minutes. Retirer de la poêle et réserver.","Mettez la pomme de terre râpée et le céleri-rave dans un grand bol allant au micro-ondes. Ajoutez une cuillère à soupe d''eau et faites cuire à puissance élevée pendant 1 min (ou faites cuire à la vapeur dans un cuiseur vapeur à plusieurs niveaux pendant 2-3 minutes).","Égouttez les légumes et ajoutez les oignons frits, 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza, l''œuf battu et le persil. Assaisonner avec 1 cuillère à café de sel et un peu de poivre noir. Bien mélanger et verser dans le plat préparé. Appuyez légèrement pour compacter les légumes et badigeonnez le dessus avec la cuillère à soupe d''huile restante.","Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré et croustillant et que le centre soit tendre. Parsemer d''un peu plus de persil pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11285,3862,'fr','Plateau de fruits bizarre','Régalez-vous de serpents raisins macabres, de crocs de pomme, de globes oculaires de litchi et bien plus encore avec ce plateau de fruits bizarre, qui chatouillera et terrifiera à coup sûr les invités d''Halloween !','["70 g de chocolat blanc, plus un peu pour coller les globes oculaires","3 petites bananes pelées et coupées en deux sur la largeur","décorations de gâteau en forme de globe oculaire ou glaçage noir ou stylo à encre comestible","petit morceau de céleri","6 petites mandarines pelées","1 pomme rouge, épépinée et coupée en 6 quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre de noix (nous avons utilisé de l''amande)","25 g de yaourt aux raisins secs","Boîte de 425 g de litchis au jus égouttés","150g de myrtilles","décorations de gâteau ou brochettes de globe oculaire","250 g de raisins noirs et verts","courtes brochettes en bois","glaçage noir ou stylo à encre comestible, ou décorations de gâteaux en forme de globe oculaire"]','["Pour les bananes momies, faites fondre le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une petite casserole d''eau frémissante ou au micro-ondes par rafales de 20 secondes. Laisser refroidir à température ambiante. Disposez les bananes sur une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé et arrosez-les de chocolat en formant un motif entrecroisé pour faire des « bandages ». Collez les décorations des globes oculaires ou utilisez du glaçage noir ou un stylo à encre comestible pour dessiner les yeux sur les bananes, puis laissez-les refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient prises, environ 30 minutes (elles commenceront à se décolorer après environ 2 heures).","Pour les citrouilles mandarines, coupez de minuscules « tiges » dans le morceau de céleri et poussez-les dans le dessus des mandarines, là où les segments se rejoignent.","Pour les crocs de pomme, coupez un petit coin du côté peau des quartiers de pomme pour faire les lèvres, puis remplissez la « bouche » avec le beurre de noix. Poussez les raisins secs dans la bouche pour ressembler à des dents bancales.","Pour les globes oculaires de litchi, farcissez chaque litchi d’une myrtille. Collez les décorations en forme de globe oculaire sur la myrtille en utilisant un peu de chocolat blanc fondu de l''étape 1, ou embrochez les fruits ensemble. Si vous le souhaitez, déposez-les dans un bol à punch.","Pour les serpents raisins, enfilez en alternance des raisins verts et rouges sur des brochettes, puis collez des décorations de globes oculaires avec du chocolat blanc comme à la quatrième étape.","Disposez les fruits bizarres sur un grand plat de service. Remplissez les espaces avec les restes de myrtilles et décorez avec des figurines et des décorations effrayantes d''Halloween, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:09:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11286,3878,'fr','Smoothie à l''ananas','Mélangez de l''ananas frais et de la banane avec du jus de citron vert pour préparer ce smoothie piquant à l''ananas. C''est excellent pour le petit-déjeuner et les enfants vont l''adorer aussi','["150 g d''ananas paré, pelé et haché","1 petite banane, pelée et tranchée","1 citron vert, jus","glace (facultatif)"]','["Mixez l''ananas dans un mélange avec la banane, le jus de citron vert et 50 ml d''eau froide jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Remplissez un grand verre de glaçons, si vous le souhaitez, versez-le sur le smoothie et servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:09:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11287,3880,'fr','Smoothie à la pastèque','Savourez un smoothie à la pastèque par une chaude journée d’été. Mélangée avec du jus de banane et de pomme, cette boisson regorge de vitamine C','["150 g de pastèque pelée et hachée","1 petite banane, pelée et tranchée","100 ml de jus de pomme froid"]','["Mixez la pastèque dans un mélange avec le jus de banane et de pomme jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Versez le smoothie dans un grand verre et servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:09:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11288,3882,'fr','Comment couper une mangue','Les mangues sont délicieuses, mais notoirement difficiles à préparer. Découvrez comment peler la peau, retirer le noyau et couper la chair en petits morceaux.','["1 mangue"]','["Positionnez la mangue de manière à ce que l''une des extrémités pointues soit face à vous, avec les joues de chaque côté.","Trancher vers le bas à l''aide d''un couteau dentelé pour retirer une des joues en guidant le couteau autour de la pierre au milieu. Retournez la mangue et répétez de l’autre côté.","Entaillez la chair de la mangue en diagonale sur toute la longueur de la joue à l''aide de la pointe du couteau. Tournez à 90 degrés et marquez à nouveau pour créer un motif entrecroisé.","Retournez la joue de mangue entaillée et appuyez sur la peau avec vos doigts pour que le côté charnu ressorte – cela ressemblera un peu à un hérisson, avec les morceaux de mangue entaillés qui dépassent. Coupez les morceaux de chair de la peau avec un couteau.","Coupez la chair des deux côtés en suivant la courbe de la pierre. Entaillez les morceaux avec un couteau comme auparavant, puis passez le couteau le long de la peau pour libérer les morceaux. Ajoutez-les au reste des morceaux de mangue."]','2026-01-11 00:09:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11289,3884,'fr','Nunor bora','Savourez ces collations savoureuses à base de farine de riz avec du curry ou une sauce chili. Les nunor bora sont une collation populaire au Bangladesh et sont souvent servies pour l''Aïd.','["2 gros ou 4 petits oignons, hachés","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé","1½ cuillère à café de curcuma","½ cuillère à café de panch puran, moulu (facultatif)","300 g de farine de riz, plus un peu pour rouler","120g de riz moulu","3 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée (facultatif)","huile végétale, pour la friture","ketchup ou sauce chili, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Portez à ébullition 570 ml d''eau dans une grande casserole. Mélangez l''oignon et le gingembre dans un petit robot culinaire pour former une pâte, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire. Alternativement, râpez finement l''oignon et le gingembre.","Ajoutez l''oignon et le gingembre à l''eau bouillante avec 2 cuillères à café de sel, le curcuma et le panch puran, le cas échéant. Laisser mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient translucides et bien cuits.","Réduisez le feu à doux et ajoutez la farine de riz, puis le riz moulu – ils seront immédiatement absorbés dans le liquide. Remuez bien pour vous assurer qu’il n’y a pas de zones sèches. Ajoutez la coriandre hachée, si vous le souhaitez. Mélangez bien, couvrez (idéalement avec un couvercle en verre) et laissez cuire encore 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que des gouttelettes aromatiques et d''eau se forment sur le couvercle. Pour vérifier que la pâte est bien cuite, roulez-en un peu entre vos doigts, elle doit se rassembler assez facilement. Si cela semble trop collant, ajoutez un peu plus de farine de riz pour absorber l''humidité ; S''il est trop sec, arrosez un peu d''eau et laissez cuire à la vapeur encore quelques minutes.","Sortez environ un septième du mélange de la poêle et laissez refroidir légèrement sur un plan de travail saupoudré d''un peu de farine de riz. Pétrissez le mélange avec la base de votre paume pour former une pâte. Continuez à pétrir jusqu''à obtenir plusieurs boules de pâte.","Abaissez la pâte sur 3 à 4 mm d''épaisseur, puis découpez des ronds à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce cannelé ou rond d''environ 7 cm de large, en commençant par le bord de la pâte et en travaillant. Décorez avec un tampon à biscuit, si vous le souhaitez. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte. Les nunor bora peuvent maintenant être congelées – posez-les sur des planches à découper en plastique et congelez-les jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dures, puis transférez-les dans des sacs ou des récipients de congélation et congelez complètement. Décongeler pendant 1 à 2 minutes avant de faire frire.","Pour cuire le nuna bora, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole profonde. Faire frire par lots pendant 2 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient gonflés et croustillants. Déplacez-vous dans une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant pendant que vous faites cuire le reste. Servir avec du ketchup, de la sauce chili ou votre curry préféré."]','2026-01-11 00:09:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11290,3896,'fr','Chou au fenouil, piment et ail','Savourez ce plat d''accompagnement piquant et savoureux avec un rôti de viande tendre. Le chou peut être rôti ou cuit sur la plaque de cuisson si vous manquez d''espace dans le four','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","1 gousse d''ail, finement tranchée","½ piment rouge, finement tranché","1 chou pointu ou hispi, coupé en 6 quartiers"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou un wok et faites grésiller les graines de fenouil, l''ail et le piment pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les graines commencent à crépiter et que l''ail devienne doré. Ajoutez le chou – ne vous inquiétez pas s’il semble trop gros pour la poêle, il commencera bientôt à se flétrir.","Cuire pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chou commence à colorer sur les bords, puis augmenter le feu et ajouter environ 50 ml d''eau dans la poêle. Faites frire le chou à la vapeur pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que toute l''eau se soit évaporée et que le chou soit fané mais conserve encore sa forme. Transférer dans un plat de service."]','2026-01-11 00:09:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11291,3898,'fr','Burgers végétaliens à la betterave et au quinoa','Savourez ces hamburgers végétaliens à la betterave et au quinoa avec une salade de roquette pour un repas sain mais copieux en milieu de semaine','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","200 g de quinoa cuit","2 grosses betteraves cuites (150g), finement râpées et le liquide réservé","50g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin moulues","½ petit bouquet de coriandre, plus quelques feuilles pour servir","25 ml de liquide de conservation de betterave","½ citron, jus","100 g de yaourt de soja allégé","50 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","200g de roquette"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Mettez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza dans une petite poêle et versez-y l''oignon, le cumin et l''ail, puis faites revenir à feu moyen pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et dorés. Versez dans un bol. Ajouter le quinoa cuit, la betterave rouge, la farine, les graines de lin et la coriandre et mélanger jusqu''à homogénéité. Assaisonner légèrement. Laisser reposer 5 minutes pour lier.","Divisez le mélange en quatre – il sera assez lâche – puis, avec les mains mouillées, façonnez-les en galettes. Disposez les burgers sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée et mettez au four pendant 15 minutes. Retournez-les et laissez cuire encore 10 min.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la vinaigrette. Mélangez le liquide de betterave, le jus de citron, le yaourt et l''huile, puis assaisonnez.","Pour servir, empilez la roquette dans des assiettes et déposez un burger dessus. Arroser de vinaigrette et parsemer de coriandre supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:09:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11292,3900,'fr','Mini frittatas de chorizo, petits pois et pommes de terre','Vous allez au parc pour un pique-nique en famille ? Les enfants et les adultes adoreront ces mini frittatas','["4 pommes de terre nouvelles (environ 150g)","6 œufs battus","60 g de chorizo ​​coupé en dés","75 g de petits pois surgelés, décongelés","quelques brins de persil finement hachés","50 g de cheddar râpé"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre dans une petite casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Égoutter, puis laisser sécher à la vapeur et refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à muffins à six trous de caissettes en papier ou en silicone. Versez les œufs, le chorizo, les petits pois, le persil et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un grand bol. Coupez les pommes de terre refroidies en rondelles de l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £ et ajoutez-les dans le bol. Mélangez délicatement.","Versez le mélange dans les caissettes, en vous assurant que chacune contient un peu de pomme de terre, de chorizo ​​et de petits pois. Saupoudrer le dessus de fromage et cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et pris au milieu. Vérifiez que les frittatas sont prises en secouant doucement le moule – il ne devrait y avoir aucune oscillation. Laisser refroidir légèrement et manger chaud, ou refroidir complètement et réfrigérer jusqu''à 24 heures."]','2026-01-11 00:09:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11293,3902,'fr','Sous-marins cocktail de crevettes épicées','Oubliez les sandwichs ennuyeux lors d’un pique-nique – préparez plutôt ces sous-marins cocktail aux crevettes. Si vous voyagez, assemblez-les sur place pour qu''ils soient super frais (voir conseil ci-dessous)','["3 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à soupe de chutney de mangue","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de curry doux","un filet de jus de citron ou de lime","150 g de crevettes de l''Atlantique Nord cuites","6 petits sous-rouleaux","1 petite laitue Little Gem, feuilles cueillies","petit morceau de concombre, tranché finement"]','["Mélangez la mayonnaise, le chutney de mangue et la poudre de curry avec un filet de jus de citron ou de lime dans un bol. Incorporez les crevettes, puis réfrigérez jusqu''à ce que vous soyez prêt à assembler.","Pour servir, divisez les sous-rouleaux sur le dessus, tapissez chacun d''eux d''une feuille de laitue et de quelques tranches de concombre, puis versez la garniture aux crevettes."]','2026-01-11 00:09:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11294,3906,'fr','Salade de chou maison classique','Oubliez les versions achetées en magasin et préparez une salade de chou maison. C''est un plat d''accompagnement idéal pour les barbecues ou pour accompagner des hamburgers, des salades, des sandwichs et plus encore.','["1 petit chou blanc ou ½ gros","4 carottes, pelées","1 gros oignon rouge","½ petit bouquet d''aneth, ciboulette, persil ou coriandre finement haché (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","50 g de mayonnaise","50 g de yaourt, crème sure ou plus de mayonnaise","1 à 2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","quelques pincées de paprika"]','["Retirez toutes les feuilles extérieures de chou meurtries ou endommagées. Coupez la tige en deux, retirez le noyau dense avec un couteau bien aiguisé et jetez-le. Placez le côté coupé vers le bas sur une planche à découper et coupez-le aussi finement que possible en fines lanières. Vous pouvez également le faire sur de l''amandoline (vous voudrez peut-être la couper en quartiers avant de la trancher) ou dans un robot culinaire avec l''accessoire de déchiquetage. Versez dans un bol.","Râpez les carottes sur une râpe pour les râper grossièrement, ou coupez-les en fines lanières à l''aide d''une julienne épluchée ou de l''accessoire râpe du robot culinaire. Versez dans le bol. Tranchez finement l''oignon, aussi fin que possible, et ajoutez-le au bol avec les autres légumes. Ajoutez les herbes si vous en utilisez. Un mélange est bien si vous en avez à utiliser.","Dans un pichet, fouetter la moutarde, la mayonnaise, le yaourt et le vinaigre. Assaisonnez bien et goûtez au piquant et au crémeux. Ajoutez plus de vinaigre si vous le souhaitez.","Versez la vinaigrette dans le bol de légumes et mélangez bien le tout avec une grande cuillère. Remuer pour que tous les légumes soient légèrement enrobés de vinaigrette. Saupoudrer de quelques pincées de paprika et servir aussitôt. Peut être couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à 3 jours. Bien mélanger avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11295,3908,'fr','Kimchi','Préparez une version végétalienne du kimchi (ou kimchee) à partir de cette simple recette coréenne. Savourez les saveurs umami des algues, que vous suiviez ou non un régime à base de plantes.','["2-3 feuilles de Chine (2 kg de poids préparé)","40-60g de sel marin (3% du poids du chou)","1 cuillère à soupe d''algues (j''utilise du wakame), légèrement rincées","1 carotte","½ poireau","2 oignons nouveaux","40 g d''oignon haché","40 g d''ail (10 gousses), pelées","5g de gingembre haché","1 petite poire, épépinée et hachée","40 g de flocons de piment coréen (utilisez-en moins si vous le préférez plus doux)","un pot stérilisé de 2 litres"]','["Coupez la feuille de Chine en bouchées et pesez-la jusqu''à obtenir 2 kg, puis lavez-la sous l''eau courante. Mélangez la feuille de Chine avec le sel et les algues dans un grand bol. Annuler.","De temps en temps, pendant 3 à 4 heures, mélangez avec vos mains la feuille de Chine salée et les algues. (Vous commencerez à voir du liquide s''échapper.) Vous voulez pouvoir plier la feuille chinoise sans casser les morceaux.","Pendant ce temps, râpez la carotte et le poireau et hachez les oignons nouveaux. Annuler. Préparez la pâte de piment en mixant l''oignon, l''ail, le gingembre et la poire dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient réduits en purée. Ajoutez les flocons de piment, puis mélangez à nouveau. Égoutter le mélange de feuilles chinoises en éliminant autant d''eau que possible. Cela peut prendre environ 10 minutes.","Mélangez le mélange de feuilles chinoises avec les autres légumes, puis ajoutez la pâte de piment pour enrober le tout. Versez dans un pot stérilisé de 2 litres. Essayez de ne pas avoir trop de poches d''air et laissez un espace de 1 pouce sous le couvercle. Mettez un poids de fermentation dessus, ou si vous n’en avez pas, essayez d’utiliser des fèves au four dans un sac. Conservez une assiette sous le pot en cas de débordement. Après 24 à 48 heures, vous commencerez à voir des bulles apparaître. Cela signifie que la fermentation est en cours.","À tout moment de la fermentation, vous pouvez goûter le kimchi pour voir si vous en aimez la saveur. Je préfère conserver le mien au réfrigérateur après le troisième jour pour ralentir le processus et commencer à en profiter. Vous pouvez transférer le kimchi dans des pots plus petits pour un accès facile depuis le réfrigérateur. C''est également un excellent cadeau pour la famille et les amis."]','2026-01-11 00:09:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11296,3912,'fr','Tomates de vigne mijotées à l''ail','Dégustez des tomates en grappe mijotées avec de l''ail comme plat d''accompagnement estival. Des herbes ligneuses comme le thym, le romarin ou le laurier peuvent également être ajoutées pour parfumer l''huile.','["300 g de tomates cerises vignes","1 ou 2 petits bulbes d''ail, coupés en deux pour exposer la chair","150 ml d''huile d''olive","pain croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 2. Mettez les tomates et l''ail dans un plat allant au four bien ajusté. Assaisonnez bien. Verser dessus l''huile d''olive et couvrir de papier d''aluminium. Cuire au four pendant 1h30, puis écraser l''ail et l''incorporer à l''huile. Mangez chaud avec du pain croustillant. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux semaines. Laissez d’abord refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11297,3930,'fr','Soupe minestrone classique','Préparez cette soupe de légumes italienne classique avec une riche base de tomates et des pâtes. Il est faible en calories et riche en fibres et en vitamine C','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour servir","1 oignon, finement haché","1 branche de céleri, finement hachée","1 carotte, pelée et hachée finement","1 courgette, hachée finement","70 g de pancetta fumée coupée en dés","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 boîte de 400 g de haricots cannellini","1 boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1,2 litre de bouillon de légumes","1 feuille de laurier","70 g de petites pâtes","100 g de légumes verts – le chou frisé, les blettes ou le cavolo nero fonctionnent bien","une poignée de basilic","parmesan finement râpé, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole ou une cocotte à feu doux-moyen et faites revenir doucement l''oignon, le céleri, la carotte, la courgette et la pancetta pendant 10 minutes. Ajouter l''ail et l''origan et cuire 1 min. Versez les haricots, les tomates concassées, la purée, le bouillon et le laurier. Assaisonner au goût. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 30 min.","Ajoutez les pâtes et les légumes verts et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes. Verser dans des bols et parsemer de basilic et d''un peu de parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:09:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11298,3934,'fr','frites','Des frites parfaites avec notre recette facile : vous obtiendrez des frites légèrement dorées et croustillantes. Ils sont parfaits comme collation ou comme accompagnement d''un festin du vendredi soir.','["1 kg de pommes de terre Maris Piper ou King Edward","huile végétale, pour la friture"]','["Épluchez les pommes de terre et coupez-les en bâtonnets de 1 cm d''épaisseur. Mettez dans un bol d''eau froide et laissez tremper pendant au moins 2 heures pour enlever la fécule des pommes de terre – cela les rendra croustillantes pendant la friture.","Bien égoutter les pommes de terre et les sécher avec du papier absorbant. Remplissez une poêle profonde au maximum au tiers d''huile et chauffez à 140 °C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain tombé dans une couleur dorée en 60 secondes. Faites frire les frites par lots pendant 6 minutes par lot jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, bien cuites et légèrement croustillantes. Bien égoutter sur du papier absorbant.","Augmentez le feu jusqu''à ce que l''huile atteigne 180 °C ou qu''un cube de pain brunisse en 30 secondes. Faites frire à nouveau les frites pendant 2 à 3 minutes par fournée jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement dorées et vraiment croustillantes. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et assaisonner immédiatement avec du sel marin."]','2026-01-11 00:09:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11299,3942,'fr','Gâteau aux crêpes au chocolat et au beurre de cacahuète','Parfait pour le jour des crêpes, tout le monde peut contribuer à préparer ce « gâteau » aux crêpes au chocolat et au beurre de cacahuète. Pendant que vous faites cuire les crêpes, laissez les enfants les étaler et les empiler.','["200g de beurre de cacahuète","200 g de pâte à tartiner au chocolat","sucre glace et crème fouettée, pour servir","5 œufs","750 ml de lait","250 g de farine nature","50g de beurre"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la pâte à crêpes. Versez les œufs, le lait, la farine et une pincée de sel dans l''Ablender et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Vous pouvez également fouetter les œufs et la farine jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporer lentement le lait et une pincée de sel, puis verser dans un grand pichet.","Faites chauffer une poêle ou une poêle à crêpe d''environ 20 cm à feu moyen et, à l''aide d''un essuie-tout, essuyez délicatement un peu de beurre autour de la poêle. Versez suffisamment de pâte pour obtenir une crêpe fine et faites cuire environ 1 min de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée. Glissez la crêpe sur une assiette de service, puis tartinez-la immédiatement d''un peu de beurre de cacahuète, puis de pâte à tartiner au chocolat. Répétez avec une deuxième crêpe, puis empilez-la sur la première. Continuez la cuisson, l''étalement et l''empilage jusqu''à ce que toute la pâte, le beurre de cacahuète et la pâte à tartiner au chocolat soient utilisés.","Lorsque toutes les crêpes sont empilées pour former un « gâteau », saupoudrez le dessus d’un peu de sucre glace. Couper en quartiers et servir garni d''un peu de crème fouettée. Se conservera à température ambiante jusqu''à une journée."]','2026-01-11 00:09:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11300,3944,'fr','Bouillon écossais','Savourez un copieux bol de soupe au bouillon écossais pour un déjeuner ou un dîner sain. Rempli de légumes et de céréales, servir avec un morceau de pain croustillant','["250 g de mélange de bouillon (ou un mélange de 75 g d''orge perlé, 75 g de pois cassés jaunes, 50 g de lentilles cassées rouges et 50 g de pois cassés verts ou à la moelle)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale ou d''olive","1 gros oignon, finement haché","1 poireau lavé et tranché","1 navet moyen, pelé et haché finement","3 carottes, hachées finement","3 branches de céleri, parées et hachées finement","3 litres de bouillon d''agneau","200 g de chou frisé haché"]','["Rincez le mélange à soupe et laissez-le tremper dans l''eau froide pendant 8 heures ou toute la nuit, couvert dans un endroit frais. Égoutter et bien rincer.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon, le poireau, le navet, les carottes et le céleri pendant 10 minutes, recouverts d''un couvercle, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres mais pas dorés. Ajoutez une généreuse pincée de sel et une bonne mouture de poivre.","Versez le bouillon dans la poêle et portez à ébullition. Ajouter le mélange à soupe égoutté et laisser mijoter doucement pendant 1 h à couvert, jusqu''à ce que l''orge et les pois cassés soient tendres. Assaisonnez à nouveau si nécessaire. Incorporer le chou frisé et cuire 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, puis verser dans des bols pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:09:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11301,3946,'fr','Pudding au chia','Préparez ce simple « pudding » pour le petit-déjeuner ou le dessert. Les graines de chia sont riches en protéines, antioxydants et oméga 3, ainsi que de nombreux autres nutriments','["2 cuillères à soupe de graines de chia","125 ml de lait d''avoine, ou substitut du lait de noix, du lait de riz ou du lait de vache","2 cuillères à café de sirop d''érable, plus un filet pour servir","des fruits, comme des baies, de la banane, des kiwis ou de la mangue, pour servir"]','["Mélangez les graines de chia, le lait et 2 cuillères à café de sirop d''érable dans un pot ou un bol. Couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit ou pendant au moins 8 heures.","Au moment de servir, garnir de fruits et d''un filet de sirop d''érable."]','2026-01-11 00:09:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11302,3948,'fr','Jus de céleri','Personnalisez ce simple jus de céleri en ajoutant du piment vert pour un peu de piquant, du curcuma ou un peu de sirop d''érable pour sucrer, si vous le souhaitez.','["1 tête de céleri (environ 500g)","1 pomme verte (environ 120 g), pelée, coupée en quartiers et évidée","½-1 citron, jus","20 g de gingembre finement râpé"]','["Séparez les branches de céleri et lavez-les bien. Coupez les extrémités des racines et hachez-les grossièrement, en gardant une des jeunes tiges tendres entières pour servir.","Mettez le céleri haché, la pomme, la moitié du jus de citron et le gingembre dans un robot culinaire ou un mixeur et mixez pour les hacher finement. Pendant que le moteur tourne, ajoutez 50 à 100 ml d''eau froide et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Filtrez le jus à travers un tamis à mailles fines dans un pichet, en appuyant avec le dos d''une cuillère pour extraire tout le jus. Couvrir et réfrigérer ou servir immédiatement. Remuez bien le jus, ajoutez un peu de citron si vous le souhaitez et servez dans des verres avec un morceau de branche de céleri réservée."]','2026-01-11 00:09:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11303,3954,'fr','Soupe Mulligatawny','Faites cuire un lot de soupe mulligatawny, remplie de légumes et de riz et légèrement épicée avec de la poudre de curry et des épices. Garnir de coriandre et de yaourt','["20g de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","2 branches de céleri, hachées","3 carottes pelées et hachées","1 panais, pelé et haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé","1 pomme à manger, épépinée et hachée","1½ à 2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","¼ cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","1,2 l de bouillon de poulet chaud","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","100 g de riz basmati","1 cuillère à soupe de chutney de mangue","½ citron, jus","½ petit bouquet de coriandre râpée","yaourt, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre et l''huile d''olive dans une cocotte et faites revenir l''oignon et le céleri avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 à 12 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et translucides. Incorporer les carottes, le panais, l''ail, le gingembre et la pomme et cuire encore 1 min. Incorporer la poudre de curry, le cumin et le paprika. Ajouter le bouillon et la purée de tomates et assaisonner selon votre goût. Réduisez le feu à doux, couvrez et laissez cuire 40 minutes.","Rincez le riz et faites-le cuire 10 minutes dans l''eau bouillante. Mixez la soupe jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse avec un mixeur. Égouttez le riz et incorporez-le à la soupe avec le chutney de mangue, le jus de citron et la moitié de la coriandre. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement, puis versez dans des bols et garnissez du reste de coriandre et de yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:09:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11304,3956,'fr','Bol de pois chiches, épinards et beurre d''amande','Combinez les pois chiches et les épinards avec du beurre d’amande et des épices pour préparer ce souper familial rempli de légumes. Prêt en seulement 25 minutes, servir avec du riz','["huile végétale, pour la friture","1 gros oignon, finement haché","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2½ cm de gingembre pelé et râpé","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de fenugrec","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","300 ml de bouillon de légumes","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre d''amande non salé","200 g d''épinards hachés grossièrement","riz cuit, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer un peu d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez 50 ml d''eau et laissez cuire encore 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste dorés. Ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre.","Mélangez la coriandre, le cumin, le curcuma, le fenugrec et un peu de poivre avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et versez dans la casserole. Cuire encore 5 minutes, puis incorporer les pois chiches.","Incorporer le bouillon et le beurre d''amande, puis ajouter les épinards et cuire encore 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés. Servir sur du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:09:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11305,3958,'fr','Pakoras aux carottes','Oubliez le gaspillage alimentaire et utilisez des morceaux de légumes mous pour préparer ces pakoras sensationnels. Le brocoli, le chou-fleur, les haricots verts, les courgettes et le chou fonctionnent également bien.','["3 carottes moyennes, râpées grossièrement dans le sens de la longueur","2 échalotes ou 1 oignon, émincé finement","25 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","pincée de poudre de piment fort (facultatif)","1 œuf battu","100g de farine de maïs","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","100g de yaourt nature","2 cuillères à soupe de cornichon au citron vert (haché grossièrement s''il est trop gros)","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées grossièrement"]','["Versez les carottes et les échalotes ou l''oignon dans une passoire au-dessus d''un évier et mélangez avec 1 cuillère à café de sel marin. Laisser ramollir 10 min. Pendant ce temps, pour la trempette, mélangez le yaourt, le cornichon et la menthe. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser.","Lorsque les légumes sont fanés, enveloppez-les dans un torchon propre et essorez-les pour éliminer l''excès d''eau. Versez dans un bol avec la coriandre, les épices et l''œuf et mélangez bien. Ajoutez la maïzena et remuez jusqu’à ce que tous les légumes soient uniformément enrobés d’une pâte épaisse – il est important que toute la maïzena soit bien mélangée.","Remplissez une poêle large et profonde aux deux tiers maximum d''huile et faites chauffer à 180 °C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain brunisse en 20 secondes. En travaillant par lots, abaissez soigneusement deux cuillerées du mélange pakora à la fois, bien espacées, et faites frire pendant 2 minutes d''un côté, puis 1 à 2 minutes de plus de l''autre côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes. Transférer sur du papier absorbant à l’aide d’une écumoire pour égoutter. Servir chaud avec la trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:09:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11306,3960,'fr','Taboulé d''hiver','Mélangez du chou-fleur, du fenouil, du boulgour, des noix et des graines de grenade pour réaliser cette version hivernale du taboulé. C''est délicieux servi en accompagnement','["60g de raisins secs","200 g de boulgour moyen","175 g de fleurons de chou-fleur finement hachés","1 petit bulbe de fenouil, paré, grosses feuilles extérieures enlevées, haché","1 citron, jus","25g de persil haché","20 g de feuilles de menthe hachées","3 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","50 g de noix concassées et grillées","15 g d''épine-vinettes séchées","100 g de graines de grenade","1 petite gousse d''ail, hachée finement","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","1 cuillère à café de miel","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Mettez les raisins secs dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et couvrez d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Laisser tremper 20 mn.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le boulgour dans un deuxième bol résistant à la chaleur et versez dessus suffisamment d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire pour couvrir d''environ 2 cm. Couvrir le bol et laisser tremper 15 minutes. Égoutter et transférer dans un bol de service. Ajoutez le chou-fleur, le fenouil et le jus de citron et mélangez.","Pour préparer la vinaigrette, mettez l''ail, le cumin, la cannelle, la mélasse de grenade et le miel dans un bol et mélangez. Versez progressivement l''huile en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Goûtez pour l’assaisonnement.","Égouttez les raisins secs et ajoutez-les au mélange de boulgour avec le persil, la menthe, les oignons nouveaux, les noix et les barberries. Mélangez le tout avec la vinaigrette. Goûtez à nouveau pour assaisonner, puis incorporez les graines de grenade."]','2026-01-11 00:09:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11307,3964,'fr','Tarte aux pommes et à la crème anglaise','Impressionnez vos convives avec notre tarte aux pommes et à la crème anglaise. Avec une base de pâtisserie maison et une jolie garniture « roses » à base de pomme, c''est un dessert qui ne passe pas inaperçu.','["1 citron, jus","6-8 pommes","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","200 g de farine nature","100 g de beurre doux, froid et coupé en cubes, plus un peu pour le moule","65g de sucre glace","1 gros jaune d''oeuf","800 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à café de pâte de vanille","5 gros jaunes d''œufs","100 g de sucre en poudre","50 g de poudre de crème anglaise"]','["Mettez la farine et le beurre nature dans un bol et frottez du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce qu''ils ressemblent à de la chapelure. Incorporez le sucre glace et une pincée de sel, puis le jaune d''œuf. Si la pâte est trop sèche pour former une pâte, ajoutez 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau.","Étalez la pâte entre deux feuilles de papier sulfurisé jusqu''à ce qu''elle forme un cercle d''environ 28 cm. Mettre au réfrigérateur 20 min pour raffermir, puis reposer sur un moule à tarte de 23 cm beurré. Poussez dans les coins et coupez le dessus pour qu''il y ait un dépassement de 1 à 2 cm de pâte. Ne vous inquiétez pas s''il se casse légèrement, réparez simplement les déchirures avec les chutes. Piquer plusieurs fois le fond avec une fourchette, puis mettre au réfrigérateur pendant 45 min. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Posez une feuille de papier sulfurisé sur le fond de tarte réfrigéré et remplissez jusqu''au sommet de fèves au four. Cuire à blanc pendant 15 min. Retirez les haricots secs et le papier sulfurisé et faites cuire encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir dans le moule, puis couper l''excédent de pâte sur le dessus avec un petit couteau.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition le lait et la vanille dans une casserole à feu moyen. Battre ensemble les jaunes d''œufs, le sucre en poudre et la poudre à crème anglaise jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Versez le lait chaud sur le mélange d''œufs et de sucre, en fouettant continuellement, jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et bien mélangé. Remettez le mélange dans la casserole à feu moyen-doux. Remuer continuellement pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit très épais. Laisser refroidir légèrement en fouettant de temps en temps pour éviter que le mélange ne forme des grumeaux.","Versez le mélange de crème anglaise dans le fond de tarte cuit en l''étalant pour l''égaliser. Mettez-le au réfrigérateur pendant 2 heures pour qu''il durcisse complètement.","Versez la moitié du jus de citron dans un bol moyen d''eau, puis coupez finement les pommes dans le bol, à l''aide d''une mandoline si vous le souhaitez. Saupoudrer de sucre semoule et passer au micro-ondes pendant 3-4 minutes à puissance maximale, puis transférer dans un bol d''eau froide avec le jus de citron restant.","Enroulez 3 à 4 tranches de pomme les unes autour des autres pour former une rose – en enroulant la première, puis en enroulant les autres tranches autour. Pressez les fleurs de pommier dans la crème anglaise en continuant jusqu''à ce que toute la tarte soit recouverte."]','2026-01-11 00:09:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11308,3966,'fr','Ailes de poulet frites à l''air','Utilisez une friteuse à air pour préparer ces ailes de poulet faciles et ajoutez l''assaisonnement ou la sauce de votre choix. Ils sont parfaits pour un buffet ou juste une collation après une soirée cinéma','["1 kg d''ailes de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou d''olive","assaisonnement de votre choix (utilisez du sel et du poivre, ou ½ à 1 cuillère à café de BBQ fumé, de ras-el-hanout, de granules d''ail, de sel de céleri ou de garam masala)","trempette, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Séparez chaque aile de poulet en deux au niveau du joint, en retirant les extrémités des ailes si vous préférez utiliser des ciseaux de cuisine bien aiguisés. Mélangez les ailes de poulet dans l''huile et l''assaisonnement, puis versez-les dans une friteuse à air (vous pouvez soit en utiliser une avec une palette, soit les disposer sur le plateau de votre friteuse à air si elle n''a pas de palette).","Programmez la friteuse à air pour cuire pendant 35 minutes. Vérifiez que les ailes sont tendres et bien cuites – elles devraient presque se détacher des os – et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes si nécessaire. La peau doit avoir bouillonné et devenir croustillante, et tout excès de graisse du poulet aura coulé dans la base de la friteuse (jetez-le). Ne laissez pas le poulet dans la friteuse, sinon la vapeur rendra la peau douce. Versez immédiatement dans un bol et servez avec une sauce pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:09:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11309,3968,'fr','Salade César au brocoli','Préparez cette salade César au brocoli pour une entrée facile et sophistiquée. Prêt en seulement 10 minutes, il est idéal pour un dîner ou un déjeuner de Noël','["1 petite gousse d''ail","2 anchois à l''huile","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de mayonnaise","½ citron, jus","10 g de parmesan finement râpé, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","300 g de brocoli à longues tiges","2 crostini du commerce, écrasés"]','["Écrasez l''ail avec les anchois. Verser dans un petit bol et mélanger avec l''huile, la mayonnaise, le jus de citron, le parmesan et la moutarde de Dijon.","Cuire le brocoli dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre. Vidange. Disposez le brocoli sur quatre assiettes, puis arrosez de vinaigrette. Écrasez les crostini et répartissez-les sur la salade, puis arrosez d''un peu plus d''huile d''olive et saupoudrez de parmesan râpé supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:09:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11310,3970,'fr','Poires grillées, vinaigrette au chèvre et noisettes','Impressionnez vos convives avec cette entrée d''une simplicité trompeuse, à base de poires, de fromage de chèvre, de cresson et de noisettes. C''est prêt en seulement 15 minutes et parfait à Noël','["40 g de noisettes grillées finement hachées ou concassées","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique ou de vin rouge","2 poires, évidées","une poignée de cresson, pour servir","100 g de fromage de chèvre émietté"]','["Mélangez les noisettes avec l''huile, le vinaigre et une pincée de flocons de sel marin. Coupez chaque poire en six quartiers.","Chauffer la poêle à feu vif et faire griller les quartiers de poire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement carbonisés. Disposez-en trois en ligne sur chaque assiette. Rentrez un peu de cresson autour des poires, puis émiettez-le sur le chèvre. Parsemer de vinaigrette aux noisettes."]','2026-01-11 00:10:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11311,3972,'fr','Diables sauge et oignon à cheval','Faites un petit jeu amusant avec des cochons dans des couvertures pour votre dîner de Noël, en ajoutant une savoureuse farce aux saucisses. Ils constituent le parfait accompagnement festif','["25g de beurre","1 oignon, haché","4 saucisses de porc","1⁄2 cuillère à café de sauge séchée","râpe de muscade","12 pruneaux tendres dénoyautés","12 tranches de bacon fumé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol"]','["Faites fondre le beurre dans une petite poêle à feu doux et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et doré. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Pressez la chair des saucisses des peaux dans un bol, ajoutez-y les oignons frits et la sauge, râpez-les avec un peu de muscade et assaisonnez avec beaucoup de poivre noir. Utilisez vos mains pour mélanger jusqu''à ce que les ingrédients soient combinés, puis divisez en 12 portions et roulez en boules. Divisez chaque pruneau au milieu dans le sens de la longueur pour pouvoir l''ouvrir comme un livre. Pressez une boule de saucisse au milieu de chaque pruneau, en enroulant soigneusement le pruneau autour pour envelopper la farce. Enroulez une tranche de bacon autour de chaque pruneau farci, puis enfilez un bâton à cocktail dans les extrémités libres pour fixer le bacon. Disposez les diables à cheval sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier sulfurisé. Se conserve couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Badigeonner les diables à cheval avec l''huile et cuire au four pendant 15-20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le bacon soit croustillant et doré et que la farce soit bien cuite."]','2026-01-11 00:10:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11312,3974,'fr','Pommes de terre rôties au thym et aux châtaignes','Ajoutez les saveurs festives de la châtaigne et du thym pour rehausser les pommes de terre rôties standard d''un cran ou deux de Noël.','["1,5 à 2 kg de pommes de terre farineuses, telles que King Edward ou Maris Piper, coupées en morceaux égaux","150 ml d''huile végétale","bouquet de thym, haché grossièrement","Sachet de 180 g de marrons cuits, émiettés grossièrement"]','["Mettez les pommes de terre dans une grande casserole et couvrez d''eau froide salée. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre. Vidange.","Mettez l''huile dans un grand plat à rôtir, puis transférez le moule au four avec la dinde pendant 10 minutes. Retirez le moule du four et versez délicatement les pommes de terre et le thym, en les retournant pour les enrober d''huile chaude. Lorsque la dinde est bien cuite, allumez le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et faites rôtir les pommes de terre pendant 40 minutes. Retourner les pommes de terre et les faire rôtir encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient entièrement dorées. Saupoudrer sur les marrons et rôtir encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les marrons soient bien chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:10:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11313,3976,'fr','Pains plats au saumon brouillé','Essayez une alternative plus saine au saumon fumé et aux œufs brouillés, tout aussi délicieuse, mais préparée avec des épinards frais et servie sur des pains plats faits maison.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","90 g de farine complète, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","160 g de pousses d''épinards","3 gros œufs","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth haché, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","1½ cuillère à café de câpres, égouttées et hachées","100 g de saumon sauvage sans peau, coupé en petits morceaux"]','["Pour faire les pains plats, frottez l''huile dans la farine avec vos doigts. Incorporez 60 ml d''eau tiède avec un couteau à couverts, puis pétrissez brièvement sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse et élastique. Couper en deux.","Abaisser chaque moitié de pâte à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie fariné jusqu''à obtenir une pâte très fine (environ 21 cm de diamètre). Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive à feu vif et faites cuire l''un des pains plats pendant 1 min. Retourner et cuire de l''autre côté pendant 30 secondes en appuyant dessus avec une spatule jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré par endroits et assez sec sans être croustillant. Répétez avec le deuxième pain plat. Couvrir les deux d''un torchon et réserver au chaud.","Mettez les épinards dans la poêle et faites-les cuire à feu moyen pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés. Versez dans une passoire au-dessus d''un bol et essorez l''excédent de liquide à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère, puis hachez grossièrement.","Battez les œufs avec l''aneth et beaucoup de poivre noir, puis réservez. Rincez la poêle et faites chauffer à feu moyen. Ajoutez les câpres, puis le saumon et remuez jusqu''à ce que le poisson commence à peine à devenir opaque sur les bords. Versez le mélange d''œufs et remuez pour brouiller les œufs. Lorsque le saumon est presque cuit et que l’œuf est presque pris, incorporez les épinards pour bien les réchauffer. Servir sur les pains plats chauds avec l''aneth supplémentaire parsemé et un bon moulin à poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11314,3978,'fr','Le gâteau de Noël magique de Jessica','Éblouissez vos invités avec ce fabuleux gâteau. Conçu par Jessica Whitlow, huit ans, lors de notre concours magique de gâteaux de Noël, il comprend trois génoises aromatisées','["500 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","700 g de sucre muscovado léger","10 œufs moyens","400 g de chocolat noir fondu et refroidi","1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait de vanille","340 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots onctueuse","750 g de pâte à sucre bleu ciel ou de glaçage fondant","200 g de beurre doux, ramolli","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs moyens","200 g de farine autolevante tamisée","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","5 citrons zestés, 4 jus","1 cuillère à soupe de confiture de framboise","colorants alimentaires rose et rouge","100 g de beurre doux, ramolli","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 œufs moyens","100 g de farine autolevante tamisée","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","120 g de myrtilles mélangées à un peu de farine nature","1-2 cuillères à soupe de crème de citron","colorants alimentaires bleu foncé et bleu clair","200 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao), haché","100 g de crème fraîche","800 g de beurre doux, ramolli","1,6 kg de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à soupe d''extrait de vanille","2 carrés croustillants de riz","150g de pâte à sucre blanche, plus un peu pour les nuages","pâtes à sucre noires, vertes, brunes, oranges et autres couleurs","stylo d''écriture comestible noir","colle comestible","150g de pâte à sucre jaune, plus un supplément pour les étoiles","boules d''argent comestibles (facultatif)","2 bâtonnets de biscuits enrobés de chocolat","Tambours à gâteau de 26 cm, 18 cm et 10 cm","bâtons de cocktail","8 à 10 chevilles à gâteau","emporte-pièces en forme de nuage et emporte-pièces en forme d''étoile de différentes tailles"]','["Chauffer le four à 170°C/150°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Pour réaliser le niveau de brownie, beurrer trois moules à cake à fond amovible de 26 cm et tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre, le sucre et une pincée de sel pendant 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien après chacun. Incorporez le chocolat et la vanille, puis la farine. Verser dans les moules et cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''extérieur soit légèrement feuilleté avec une croûte de brownie et que le centre soit pris sans miettes humides lorsqu''une brochette est insérée au milieu. Laisser refroidir complètement dans les moules. Allumez le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Pour réaliser le niveau intermédiaire, beurrez et tapissez deux moules à gâteau à fond amovible de 18 cm. Battre le beurre, le sucre et une pincée de sel pendant 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit léger et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien après chacun. Incorporez la farine, la levure chimique, le zeste de 2 citrons et un quart du jus de citron. Verser dans les moules et cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et fermes au toucher. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 5 minutes, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pour réaliser le niveau de myrtilles, beurrez et tapissez deux moules à cake ronds de 10 cm de diamètre. Battre le beurre, le sucre et une pincée de sel pendant 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien après chacun. Incorporer la farine, la levure chimique, le lait et les myrtilles. Verser dans les moules et cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et fermes au toucher. Laisser reposer 5 minutes dans les moules, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir complètement.","Pour la ganache, mettez le chocolat dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Portez la crème à ébullition à feu moyen, puis versez-la sur le chocolat en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fondue et lisse. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Pour faire la crème au beurre, battez le beurre, le sucre glace et la vanille pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Mettez 850 g de crème au beurre dans un bol et incorporez la ganache. Étalez une petite goutte de crème au beurre au chocolat au milieu du tambour à gâteau de 26 cm et recouvrez d''une génoise au brownie. Tartiner le dessus de la génoise avec 2-3 cuillères à soupe de crème au beurre au chocolat, puis prendre en sandwich avec une deuxième génoise au brownie. Répétez avec 2-3 cuillères à soupe de crème au beurre au chocolat et la dernière génoise. Étalez le reste de la crème au beurre au chocolat sur le dessus et les côtés en couche épaisse à l''aide d''une spatule. Mettre au frais au moins 1 h.","Incorporer le reste du zeste et du jus de citron au reste de la crème au beurre nature. Étalez une petite goutte de crème au beurre au citron au milieu du tambour à gâteau de 18 cm et recouvrez d''une génoise au citron. Tartiner le dessus du biscuit avec 2 cuillères à soupe de crème au beurre au citron et la confiture de framboise, puis recouvrir du deuxième biscuit. Étalez 400 g de crème au beurre au citron sur le dessus et les côtés. Mettre au frais 1h.","Étalez une petite goutte de crème au beurre citronnée au milieu du tambour à gâteau de 10 cm et recouvrez d''une génoise aux myrtilles. Étalez le dessus de la génoise avec la crème au citron et 1 cuillère à soupe de crème au beurre au citron, puis recouvrez avec la deuxième génoise. Étalez 200 g de crème au beurre au citron sur le dessus et les côtés. Mettre au frais 1h. Teindre 250 g de crème au beurre restante en gris/bleu foncé avec le colorant alimentaire bleu. Étalez-le sur le niveau du gâteau aux myrtilles. Mettre au frais 1h.","Teignez la crème au beurre restante en rouge foncé avec les colorants alimentaires rose et rouge. Étalez-le sur le niveau du gâteau au citron. Mettre au frais 1h.","Retirez le niveau de brownie du réfrigérateur. Faites chauffer la confiture d''abricots dans une poêle pour la décoller, laissez-la refroidir légèrement, puis badigeonnez-en le dessus et les côtés du gâteau. Etalez la pâte à sucre bleu ciel sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé légèrement saupoudrée de sucre glace sur 40 cm (5 mm d''épaisseur). Utilisez-le pour couvrir le niveau de brownie, en le lissant sur les côtés. Réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Pour les décorations, commencez par le bonhomme de neige. Rouler 1 carré de riz croustillant en une grosse boule. Roulez les deux tiers du deuxième carré en une boule moyenne et ce qui reste en une petite boule. Etalez la pâte à sucre blanche. Utilisez-le pour recouvrir les boules, puis roulez-les dans vos mains pour les lisser. Créez un chapeau à partir des pâtes à sucre noires et vertes. Utilisez deux bâtons à cocktail et moulez de la pâte de cassonade autour de chacun pour faire des bras avec des doigts de brindille. Laisser prendre à température ambiante pendant 1 h. Dessinez des yeux et une bouche sur la plus petite boule avec un stylo noir et réalisez un petit nez de carotte en pâte à sucre orange. Assemblez le bonhomme de neige, poussez les bras sur les côtés et collez le chapeau et le nez avec un peu de colle alimentaire. Dessinez des boutons au milieu du bonhomme de neige à l’aide du stylo.","Pour empiler les niveaux de gâteau, mesurez d''abord environ cinq chevilles contre le côté du niveau inférieur et trois ou quatre contre le côté du niveau intermédiaire. Coupez les chevilles à la même hauteur que les gradins. Insérez les chevilles en cercle au milieu des niveaux – cela soutiendra le niveau supérieur. Empilez soigneusement les étages de gâteaux du plus grand au plus petit.","Découpez des petites étoiles dans des pâtes à sucre de différentes couleurs. Etalez un peu de pâte à sucre blanche et effacez quelques nuages. Collez les étoiles sur l''étage inférieur selon un motif arc-en-ciel (utilisez un peu de colle alimentaire, si nécessaire), puis fixez les nuages ​​sur le côté. Étalez la pâte à sucre jaune et tamponnez des étoiles de différentes tailles, puis collez-les sur l''étage intermédiaire. Étalez un peu de pâte à sucre verte et découpez une forme d''arbre à l''aide d''un petit couteau, puis créez un pied d''arbre marron en pâte à sucre. Décorez le sapin avec des chutes de pâte à sucre et des boules d''argent comestibles, si vous le souhaitez. Étalez encore un peu de pâte à sucre, découpez deux petits drapeaux et enroulez-les autour des bâtonnets de biscuit. Écrivez des messages sur les drapeaux à l''aide d''un stylo et collez-les au niveau intermédiaire. Garnissez le gâteau avec le bonhomme de neige, en le fixant au niveau supérieur à l''aide d''un bâton à cocktail. Mieux consommé dans la journée qui suit la décoration. Se conserve jusqu''à cinq jours. NIVEAU INFÉRIEUR (15) 1 332 kcal • matières grasses 69 g • saturés 41 g • glucides 164 g • sucres 141 g • fibres 5 g • protéines 11 g • sel 0,2 g NIVEAU MOYEN (10) 856 kcal • lipides 46 g • saturés 28 g • glucides 104 g • sucres 88 g • fibres 1 g • protéines 5 g • sel 0,4 g TOP TIER (avec décoration) (6) 953 kcal • lipides 42 g • saturés 26 g • glucides 137 g • sucres 113 g • fibres 1 g • protéines 6 g • sel 0,5 g"]','2026-01-11 00:10:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11315,3980,'fr','Jambon glacé à la grenade épicée et à l''orange','Servez notre jambon glacé tiède en fines tranches aux côtés de la dinde de Noël. Celui-ci a un glaçage aigre-doux collant à base de mélasse de grenade et d''orange.','["1,5 à 2 kg de rôti de jambon cru désossé et non fumé","2 feuilles de laurier, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","Anis 3 étoiles","4 clous de girofle entiers, plus un peu pour garnir le jambon","8 baies de piment de la Jamaïque","10 grains de poivre entiers","1 litre de jus de grenade","2 petites oranges, 1 coupée en deux, 1 tranchée et 1 cuillère à café de jus","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","80 g de graines de grenade pour servir (facultatif)","Coupez-le en morceaux et incorporez-le au macaroni au fromage, avec les poireaux et la moutarde.","Couper en tranches épaisses et faire revenir jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés, puis servir avec un œuf au plat qui coule et quelques bulles et couinements.","Râpez-le en gros morceaux et ajoutez-le à une tarte à la dinde.","Râpez et mélangez avec de la salade de choux. Ajoutez des croûtons ou des graines supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez.","Mélanger avec une garniture galloise rare et empiler sur du pain croustillant. Griller jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré."]','["Mettez le jambon dans une grande poêle avec les feuilles de laurier, l''anis étoilé, les clous de girofle, 6 baies de piment de la Jamaïque et 8 grains de poivre. Versez dessus le jus de grenade pour recouvrir le jambon (vous devrez peut-être compléter avec de l''eau). Ajoutez une des moitiés d''orange, puis portez à ébullition et couvrez partiellement avec un couvercle. Cuire 2 h 30 en ajoutant de l''eau au besoin pour garder le jambon couvert. Laisser refroidir dans le liquide pendant 20 minutes, puis démouler et déposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 6. Coupez la peau du jambon en laissant une couche de 1 cm de gras. Tracez des lignes dans la graisse à intervalles de ½ cm à l''aide d''un couteau. Enfourner 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la graisse commence à devenir croustillante.","Pendant ce temps, écrasez les baies de piment de la Jamaïque et les grains de poivre restants avec un pilon et un mortier. Mélangez les épices concassées avec la mélasse, la moutarde, le sucre et 1 cuillère à café de jus d''orange. Sortez le jambon du four et badigeonnez-le du mélange de mélasse. Disposez les tranches d''orange sur le jambon en les fixant avec quelques clous de girofle.","Tournez le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et remettez le gammon au four pendant encore 20 minutes. Badigeonnez les tranches d''orange de miel et faites cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le glaçage bouillonne. Laisser reposer au moins 20 minutes, puis servir avec des feuilles de laurier et des graines de grenade parsemées, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11316,3982,'fr','Gnocchis aux saucisses et pousses de moutarde','Des restes de pousses dans votre réfrigérateur ? Profitez-en avec nos gnocchis à la saucisse et à la moutarde pour le souper. Cela ne prend que 25 minutes à réaliser','["250 g de raviolis","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, tranché finement","3 saucisses de porc (200g)","250 g de pousses, râpées","100 ml de bouillon de poulet","2 cuillères à café de moutarde complète","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche demi-écrémée","½ petit bouquet de persil haché, plus un peu pour servir","parmesan, râpé (facultatif)"]','["Faites cuire les gnocchis dans une casserole d''eau salée en suivant les instructions du paquet. Égoutter et réserver.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon à feu moyen pendant 8 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et doré. Pressez la chair des saucisses pour la retirer des peaux et dans la poêle, en la brisant avec une cuillère en bois. Cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporer les pousses et cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies. Ajouter le bouillon et la moutarde et porter à ébullition. Incorporer la crème fraîche et le persil. Saison. Versez les gnocchis, mélangez avec 100 ml d''eau pour assouplir la sauce et portez à ébullition pendant 3 minutes. Pour servir, saupoudrez de persil et de parmesan supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11317,3984,'fr','Chou-fleur épicé et riz halloumi','Préparez ce riz épicé au chou-fleur, aux épinards et au halloumi pour un souper simple et rapide. Nourrissante et équilibrée, elle est idéale pour les soirs de semaine chargés','["1 petite tête de chou-fleur (500 g), divisée en fleurons moyens","150 g de bébés épinards","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon rouge, tranché","120 g de halloumi coupé en cubes","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","2 sachets de 250 g de riz basmati brun","1 piment rouge, finement tranché"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée et faites cuire le chou-fleur 5 min à feu vif en ajoutant les épinards pour les 2 dernières minutes. Égoutter et réserver.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou une cocotte peu profonde et faites revenir l''oignon à feu moyen pendant 5 minutes. Augmentez le feu, ajoutez le halloumi, laissez cuire encore 5 minutes, puis ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre, le curcuma et le curry et laissez cuire encore 1 minute. Incorporer le riz, le chou-fleur et les épinards pour réchauffer le tout, en ajoutant 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau s''il semble un peu sec. Assaisonner et répartir sur le piment."]','2026-01-11 00:10:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11318,3990,'fr','Couronne de rouleaux de saucisses sans gluten','Créez cette merveille de rouleaux de saucisses sans gluten en disposant les rouleaux de saucisses et de chutney en forme de couronne festive. C''est parfait pour un buffet de Noël','["6 saucisses de porc sans gluten","½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","280 g d''ASDA sans pâte feuilletée prête à l''emploi","2 cuillères à soupe de chutney d''oignons rouges, et un peu plus pour servir","1 œuf, battu pour glacer"]','["Pressez la chair des saucisses de leur peau dans un bol. Assaisonner de sel et de poivre et saupoudrer du mélange d''épices. Bien mélanger à la main.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Dérouler la pâte feuilletée ASDA Free From Ready Rolled sur un plan de travail, en la gardant sur le papier sulfurisé. Étalez le chutney en fine couche sur toute la pâte. Étalez la chair à saucisse dessus en recouvrant toute la surface. Tapotez et pressez la viande dans la pâte avec vos paumes pour former une couche fine et uniforme.","En travaillant avec le côté long le plus proche de vous, roulez la pâte en laissant la feuille de papier sulfurisé derrière vous pour créer une longue et fine spirale de saucisse. Coupez en sections de 3 cm, vous devriez en avoir environ 10. Appuyez les extrémités dans les bords pour les resserrer si vous le souhaitez. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier sulfurisé, côté coupé vers le haut, pour former une couronne, en laissant un espace de 5 mm entre les rouleaux pour leur permettre de gonfler.","Badigeonner l''œuf battu sur le dessus et les côtés des petits pains, puis cuire pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée et croustillante et que la saucisse soit bien cuite. Laisser refroidir légèrement et transférer sur une planche ou une assiette de service avec plus de chutney d''oignons rouges, ou de moutarde et de cornichons."]','2026-01-11 00:10:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11319,3992,'fr','Croquettes de chorizo ​​à l''aïoli','Essayez une nouvelle façon d''utiliser le chorizo, avec ces fabuleuses croquetas servies avec de la mayonnaise à l''ail. Ils nécessitent un peu d''effort, mais constituent une excellente entrée ou une collation de fête','["50g de beurre","½ oignon moyen, haché finement","70 g de farine nature","435 ml de lait entier","135 g de chorizo ​​coupé en petits morceaux","50 g de rap manchego","2 cuillères à soupe de persil finement haché","3 œufs légèrement battus","150 g de chapelure sèche","huile d''arachide, pour la friture","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 gros jaunes d''œufs (congeler les blancs pour une autre recette)","250-300 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","un filet de jus de citron"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre dans une poêle à feu moyen-doux et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli mais pas coloré. Incorporer la farine jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit incorporée à la graisse et aux oignons. Réduisez le feu à doux et laissez cuire 4 minutes en remuant – ne le laissez pas dorer. Faites chauffer le lait dans une casserole moyenne à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fumant.","Retirez le mélange d''oignons du feu et ajoutez le lait, petit à petit, en remuant après chaque ajout jusqu''à consistance lisse. Lorsque tout le lait a été ajouté, remettez la casserole sur feu moyen-doux et portez à ébullition en remuant constamment. Réduisez le feu à doux et laissez cuire 6 minutes en remuant souvent pour éviter qu''il ne colle. Annuler.","Faites cuire le chorizo ​​dans une poêle à feu moyen pendant 3 minutes – vous n''avez pas besoin de matière grasse, car la graisse se dégagera du chorizo ​​au fur et à mesure de la cuisson. Incorporer le chorizo ​​frit à la sauce avec le fromage, le persil et l''assaisonnement. Versez la sauce dans un plat et laissez refroidir complètement, puis couvrez et réfrigérez au moins 3 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Ensuite, préparez l''aïoli. Mettez l''ail et les jaunes d''œufs dans un bol et battez avec un fouet électrique tout en ajoutant lentement l''huile, goutte à goutte. Au fur et à mesure que le mélange commence à épaissir, vous pouvez ajouter l’huile plus rapidement, en plus grande quantité. Pressez un peu de jus de citron et assaisonnez en goûtant au fur et à mesure pour garantir l''équilibre des saveurs (vous pouvez également ajouter une goutte de vinaigre de vin blanc ainsi que du jus de citron, si vous le souhaitez). Couvrir et réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir.","Avec les mains mouillées, rouler le mélange de chorizo ​​réfrigéré en boules de la taille d''une noix. Mettez l''œuf dans un bol peu profond et la chapelure dans une assiette peu profonde. Rouler les croquetas dans l''œuf, puis dans la chapelure, en veillant à ce que chacune soit bien enrobée. Mettez les croquetas sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis couvrez légèrement et réfrigérez pendant quelques heures pour qu''elles se raffermissent afin qu''elles ne se brisent pas lorsque vous les faites frire.","Versez l''huile d''arachide dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle ne soit pas remplie à plus d''un tiers et faites chauffer à 180°C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain déposé dedans devienne doré en 30 secondes. Faites frire les croquetas par lots pendant 2 à 3 minutes par lot, en surveillant la température. Si l’huile est trop chaude, les croquetas noirciront à l’extérieur avant que l’intérieur ne soit chaud – elles devraient être dorées. A l''aide d''une écumoire, transférez les croquetas dans une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant, laissez égoutter quelques minutes, puis servez avec l''aïoli."]','2026-01-11 00:10:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11320,3996,'fr','Pommes de terre rôties aux herbes','Faites cuire ces meilleures pommes de terre rôties sur une plaque à pâtisserie à bords bas pour obtenir des résultats dorés et croustillants. Servir avec un rôti du dimanche.','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","1½ kg de pommes de terre Maris Piper, coupées en quartiers, pelée réservée","50g de beurre","½ bouquet d''herbes ligneuses (thym, romarin ou laurier)","6 gousses d''ail, légèrement écrasées"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Ajouter l''huile dans une grande plaque à pâtisserie ignifuge et mettre au four pour chauffer.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée, versez-y les pommes de terre et leur peau (pour plus de saveur) et laissez mijoter 8 à 10 minutes. Égouttez les pommes de terre et jetez la pelure. Laisser sécher à la vapeur pendant 15 minutes, puis remettre les pommes de terre dans la poêle, mettre le couvercle et secouer délicatement pour gratter légèrement les bords.","Sortez la plaque du four et mettez-la directement sur le feu à feu moyen. Ajoutez le beurre dans l''huile chaude et, à l''aide de pinces, ajoutez les pommes de terre dans la plaque, une à une, en les retournant dans la graisse en laissant un peu d''espace entre chacune. Réduisez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Nestlez les herbes autour des pommes de terre, ainsi que l''ail. Saupoudrer d''1 cuillère à soupe de sel marin et remettre au four pendant 1 heure, en retournant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:10:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11321,3998,'fr','Soupe au chou frisé et aux pois chiches au curry','Préparez cette soupe saine et économique pour un repas nourrissant et facile en milieu de semaine. Il regorge de chou frisé, de pois chiches, de patate douce et beaucoup de saveur','["1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza ou de coco","1 oignon, haché","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 patate douce (environ 200 g), pelée et coupée en cubes de 2 cm","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyen ou fort","400 g de pois chiches en boîte rincés","150 ml de lait de coco faible en gras","500 ml de bouillon de légumes (voir conseil ci-dessous)","160 g de chou frisé haché","1 citron vert, jus","1 piment rouge finement haché (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez le gingembre et l''ail, faites revenir encore 1 min, puis incorporez la patate douce, les épices et les pois chiches. Cuire encore 5 minutes en ajoutant un peu d''eau si les épices collent à la poêle.","Versez le lait de coco et 400 ml de bouillon, puis portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 8 min. Assaisonner, puis transférer un quart de la soupe dans un blender et fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez le bouillon réservé pour détendre, si nécessaire, puis remettez-le dans la poêle avec le reste de la soupe. Incorporer le chou frisé et cuire 5 minutes. Ajoutez le jus de citron vert, puis versez dans des bols et parsemez de piment, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11322,4000,'fr','Risotto rapide à l''orge et à la courge musquée','Remplacez le riz par de l''orge pour préparer ce « risotto » facile à la courge, aux épinards et à la sauge. C’est sain et faible en calories et en matières grasses – parfait pour un souper rapide','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 grosse échalote ou petit oignon, haché finement","300 g de courge ou potiron, coupé en cubes de 1 cm","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","une petite poignée de feuilles de sauge finement hachées","½ cuillère à café de macis moulu ou une bonne râpée de muscade","160 g de feuilles d''épinards","2 boîtes de 400 g d''orge dans l''eau égouttée","300 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","40 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, finement râpé","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 grosse échalote ou petit oignon, haché finement","300 g de courge ou potiron, coupé en cubes de 1 cm","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","une petite poignée de feuilles de sauge finement hachées","½ cuillère à café de macis moulu ou une bonne râpée de muscade","160 g de feuilles d''épinards","2 boîtes de 400 g d''orge dans l''eau égouttée","300 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","40 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, finement râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''échalote avec une pincée de sel pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Ajoutez la courge, l''ail, la sauge et le macis, et faites frire, en remuant continuellement, pendant encore 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que la courge commence à ramollir et que l''ail soit parfumé.","Ajoutez les épinards et l''orge avec un peu d''assaisonnement et le bouillon. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés. Ajoutez un peu plus de bouillon ou d''eau, si vous le souhaitez. Lorsque le « risotto » est épais et crémeux, goûtez pour voir s’il a besoin d’un peu plus de macis ou de muscade et d’assaisonnement. Incorporer la majeure partie du parmesan, puis garnir du reste de parmesan et broyer avec un peu de poivre noir pour servir.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''échalote avec une pincée de sel pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Ajoutez la courge, l''ail, la sauge et le macis, et faites frire, en remuant continuellement, pendant encore 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que la courge commence à ramollir et que l''ail soit parfumé.","Ajoutez les épinards et l''orge avec un peu d''assaisonnement et le bouillon. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés. Ajoutez un peu plus de bouillon ou d''eau, si vous le souhaitez. Lorsque le « risotto » est épais et crémeux, goûtez pour voir s’il a besoin d’un peu plus de macis ou de muscade et d’assaisonnement. Incorporer la majeure partie du parmesan, puis garnir du reste de parmesan et broyer avec un peu de poivre noir pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11323,4002,'fr','Lait de poule sans alcool','Commencez votre Noël avec du lait de poule, un cocktail crémeux classique. Cette version est sans alcool, mais conserve toute l''indulgence de l''originale.','["1 gousse de vanille fendue et les graines grattées","4 jaunes d''œufs","100 ml de sirop de sucre","100 ml de crème double","500 ml de lait entier","glacé"]','["Mettez les graines de vanille dans un grand bol. Ajouter les jaunes d''œufs et le sirop de sucre et battre avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que le mélange blanchisse, environ 2-3 minutes. Ajouter la crème et le lait et battre à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Remplissez un grand pichet de glace, puis filtrez-y le mélange de lait de poule. Remuez doucement jusqu''à ce que l''extérieur du pichet soit froid, puis versez le lait de poule dans des verres pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11324,4010,'fr','Casserole de haricots verts','Préparez cette cocotte facile de haricots verts et de champignons comme accompagnement végétarien pour accompagner un plat principal. Vous pouvez ajouter du fromage à la sauce blanche si vous en avez envie','["50g de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de châtaignes ou de champignons de Paris émincés","500 g de haricots verts parés","50g de farine","500 ml de lait","100 g d''oignons croustillants"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre et d''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir les champignons pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporer les haricots verts et cuire encore 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les haricots deviennent vert vif. Retirez les légumes dans une assiette.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faire fondre le beurre restant dans la poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il mousse. Retirer brièvement du feu et saupoudrer de farine, en incorporant le beurre pour obtenir une pâte dorée. Remettez sur le feu et ajoutez le lait, une touche à la fois, en remuant continuellement jusqu''à ce que tout le lait ait été ajouté et que vous obteniez une sauce blanche onctueuse et épaisse. Assaisonnez bien. Incorporer les haricots et les champignons à la sauce blanche et verser dans un plat moyen allant au four.","Répartir sur les oignons croustillants, puis cuire au four pendant 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils bouillonnent et soient dorés, en couvrant si les oignons dorent trop rapidement."]','2026-01-11 00:10:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11325,4012,'fr','Bouchées de macaroni au fromage','Vous souhaitez accueillir des invités ayant des régimes ou des goûts différents ? Ces bouchées de macaroni au fromage sont un plat de fête idéal. Des champignons aux olives, garnissez de ce que vous voulez','["25 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","25g de farine nature","400 ml de lait","200 g de macaronis ou autres pâtes courtes","200 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","100 g de petits champignons de Paris, tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de persil finement haché","20 g de chapelure séchée","8 olives noires dénoyautées et tranchées","4 tomates séchées, tranchées","100 g de mozzarella ou cheddar"]','["Pour réaliser la garniture, faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle à feu vif et faites cuire les champignons 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporer la moitié de l''ail et du persil et faire revenir encore 1 min. Assaisonner et verser dans un bol. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et faites revenir le reste de l''ail et la chapelure pendant 3 à 5 minutes, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants. Grattez dans un deuxième bol.","Faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole à feu moyen, puis incorporez la farine pour obtenir une pâte épaisse. Ajoutez progressivement le lait, un peu à la fois, en fouettant jusqu''à ce que tout soit incorporé. Cuire encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les macaronis dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 5 à 6 minutes. Incorporer le cheddar à la sauce blanche jusqu''à ce que tout le fromage soit fondu, puis incorporer les macaronis.","Beurrer un moule à muffins à 12 trous et répartir le macaroni au fromage entre les trous en le tassant avec le dos d''une cuillère. Garnir du mélange de champignons, d''olives ou de tranches de tomates séchées, puis parsemer de fromage râpé et de chapelure à l''ail. Se conserve, couvert, au réfrigérateur, jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et très chaud. Laisser refroidir 10 à 15 minutes dans le moule, puis décoller en passant une cuillère sur les bords. Transférer dans une assiette."]','2026-01-11 00:10:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11326,4014,'fr','Bâtonnets de mozzarella à la sauce tomate chili','Préparez ces délicieux bâtonnets de mozzarella à l’avance pour un repas de fête sans tracas. Il suffit de les mettre au four à l''arrivée des invités et de les servir avec notre sauce chili-tomate.','["30g de farine nature","1 œuf battu","100 g de chapelure séchée","pincée d''origan séché","pincée de granules d''ail","250 g de mozzarella ferme en bloc (pas dans l''eau), coupée en lanières de 1 cm d''épaisseur de la longueur d''un doigt","environ 500 ml d''huile végétale, pour la friture","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1-2 piments rouges épépinés et finement hachés","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à café de sucre"]','["Mettez la farine, l''œuf et la chapelure dans trois bols séparés, en assaisonnant chacun. Incorporer l''origan séché et les granules d''ail à la chapelure.","Enrobez les bâtonnets de mozzarella de farine, dépoussiérez l''excédent, puis plongez-les dans l''œuf battu. Secouez doucement pour retirer l''excédent d''œuf, puis incorporez la chapelure jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien enrobée. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et disposer en une seule couche, puis congeler pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit complètement solide.","Pour préparer la trempette, faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole et faites revenir les piments et l''ail pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Ajoutez les tomates, le vinaigre, le sucre et un peu d''assaisonnement. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et savoureux. Si vous préférez une sauce onctueuse, mixez-la avec un mixeur plongeant. Assaisonnez selon votre goût – vous devrez peut-être ajouter un peu plus de sucre, de vinaigre ou de sel. Laisser refroidir. Se conserve, couvert, au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours, ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois.","Remplissez une casserole à fond épais au maximum au tiers d''huile et faites-la chauffer à 180 °C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain grésille lorsqu''il est plongé dans l''huile et dore en 30 secondes environ. Plongez doucement dans les bâtonnets de mozzarella surgelés – vous devrez le faire en deux fois pour vous assurer que la température reste élevée – et faites frire pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le milieu du fromage soit fondu et que l''extérieur soit croustillant et doré. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant. Servir aussitôt ou laisser refroidir. Se conserve, couvert, au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours, ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois.","Pour réchauffer, chauffez le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et faites cuire sur une plaque pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien chaud. Assaisonner et servir avec une trempette chaude."]','2026-01-11 00:10:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11327,4018,'fr','Groupes de routes rocheuses','Offrez à votre famille et à vos amis ces superbes groupes de routes rocailleuses. Ils font un excellent cadeau à Noël ou une friandise à servir avec une tasse de thé.','["100 g de beurre salé haché","200 g de chocolat noir haché","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","150g de biscuits digestifs","100 g de mini guimauves","50 g de noix de pécan hachées grossièrement","50 g de raisins secs","lustre doré comestible, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)"]','["Faire fondre le beurre, le chocolat et le sirop doré dans un bol résistant à la chaleur au-dessus d''une casserole d''eau frémissante, en remuant de temps en temps.","Cassez les biscuits en morceaux dans un autre bol, puis ajoutez les guimauves, les pacanes et les raisins secs. Versez le chocolat fondu et mélangez délicatement le tout jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien enrobé. Déposez des cuillerées du mélange sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, puis saupoudrez chacune d''un peu d''or comestible, le cas échéant. Réfrigérer 1 heure avant l''emballage. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:10:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11328,4022,'fr','Tranches d''orange et de citron séchées','Sécher des tranches d''orange et de citron à utiliser comme décorations au moment de Noël. Ils font de jolies décorations d''arbre, de table ou de couronne, ou sont placés dans un pot comme cadeau.','["1 orange et 1 citron, non pelés et tranchés finement en rondelles de 2 mm d''épaisseur","bâtons de cannelle, feuilles de laurier, brins de romarin ou gousses de cardamome, pour garnir (facultatif)"]','["Disposez les tranches d''agrumes sur deux plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé afin qu''elles soient en une seule couche. Chauffer le four à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼. Cuire au four pendant 2 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et sec, en retournant les plaques à mi-cuisson. Vérifiez au bout d''1h15 en retirant les tranches d''orange qui sèchent trop vite, puis poursuivez la cuisson du reste.","Laisser refroidir complètement sur la plaque, puis conditionner avec les garnitures de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:10:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11329,4026,'fr','Eau de chèvre','Préparez notre version de l''eau de chèvre, un ragoût à base de viande de chèvre qui est le plat national de Montserrat. C’est le reflet direct des ancêtres africains et irlandais de l’île.','["1 citron, jus","1 kg de viande de chèvre coupée en morceaux de 5 cm","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade ou de mélasse","2 cuillères à café de clous de girofle","2 cuillères à café de piment de la Jamaïque","2 cuillères à café de macis moulu","quelques brins de thym","½ bulbe d''ail, gousses pelées et écrasées","1 piment Scotch Bonnet, haché","1 branche de céleri, hachée","½ poivron vert coupé en morceaux de 1½ cm","1 oignon, haché","1 cuillère à café de sauce brune","2-4 feuilles de laurier","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à soupe de rhum (facultatif)","pain, pour servir"]','["Mélangez le jus de citron dans un grand bol d''eau. Rincer la viande de chèvre dans l''eau citronnée, puis égoutter. Séchez la viande de chèvre avec du papier absorbant. Annuler.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole ou une cocotte à feu moyen-vif, puis incorporez le sucre et laissez cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et caramélisée. Ajouter la viande de chèvre et cuire en retournant jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit entièrement dorée. Ajouter les épices, le thym, l''ail, le piment, le céleri, le poivre, l''oignon, la sauce, le laurier et 1 litre d''eau. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu, couvrez et laissez mijoter environ 2 h à 2 h 30 jusqu''à ce que la viande soit très tendre.","Mélangez la maïzena avec 50 ml d''eau, puis ajoutez-la dans la poêle. Laisser mijoter encore 10 minutes, à découvert, jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe légèrement – ​​elle aura la consistance d''une crème liquide. Incorporer le rhum, puis servir avec du pain à part."]','2026-01-11 00:10:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11330,4028,'fr','Sauce végétalienne ultime','Terminez vos efforts du matin de Noël en réchauffant cette sauce préparée à l’avance. C''est le partenaire idéal de toutes vos garnitures préférées à la table de fête.','["6 gros champignons portobello","3 oignons, non pelés, coupés en quartiers","4 carottes non pelées, hachées grossièrement","3 branches de céleri, hachées grossièrement","1 bulbe d''ail, coupé en deux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''agave","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","100 g de farine nature","25g de champignons séchés","150 ml de porto rubis","2 litres de bouillon de légumes","3 feuilles de laurier","petit bouquet de thym"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Versez les champignons portobello, les oignons, les carottes, le céleri et l''ail dans un plat à rôtir, ajoutez l''huile de tournesol, puis étalez-les en une seule couche. Rôtir pendant 40 minutes, sans les déranger – les légumes doivent être très légèrement carbonisés.","Arroser d''agave, de vinaigre, de purée de tomates, de soja et de 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Mélanger jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement enrobé, puis remettre au four pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit collant et caramélisé. Incorporer la farine et les champignons séchés et remettre au four 10 minutes supplémentaires.","Si le moule est ignifuge, mettez le feu sur feu doux, incorporez le porto et laissez cuire jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse mélangée à tous les ingrédients. Versez les deux tiers du bouillon, ajoutez les herbes, portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 10 min. Si la boîte n''est pas ignifuge, versez un filet sur le porto, remuez pour détacher tous les morceaux brûlés, puis versez le tout dans une casserole et continuez avec le bouillon et les herbes.","Éteignez le feu et écrasez le tout avec un presse-purée pour en extraire le plus de saveur possible. Passez délicatement le contenu à travers un tamis placé au-dessus d''une autre casserole, en appuyant vers le bas pour libérer tout le liquide. Ajouter le reste du bouillon et laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que la sauce soit épaisse et riche. Laisser refroidir. Pour servir, il suffit de réchauffer. Se conserve au frais et couvert jusqu''à trois jours ou congelé jusqu''à deux mois."]','2026-01-11 00:10:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11331,4030,'fr','Crème anglaise végétalienne','Préparez notre crème végétalienne à la noix de coco et versez-la sur vos desserts préférés. Fabriqué avec du lait de coco, il se marie à merveille avec notre pudding aux carottes, noix de coco et dattes.','["4 cuillères à soupe de poudre de crème anglaise","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","2 boîtes de 400 ml de lait de coco faible en gras","200 ml d''eau"]','["Mélangez la poudre de crème anglaise avec le sucre. Ajoutez 2 à 4 cuillères à soupe de lait de coco provenant d''une boîte de 400 ml et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Faites chauffer le reste du lait de coco de la boîte dans une casserole avec une autre boîte de 400 ml de lait de coco et l''eau jusqu''à presque ébullition. Incorporez un peu du mélange de lait de coco dans le mélange de poudre de crème anglaise jusqu''à ce qu''il ressemble à une sauce crème onctueuse, puis versez-le dans la casserole avec le reste du lait de coco chaud. Remettre à ébullition à feu doux en remuant continuellement jusqu''à obtenir une crème anglaise épaisse et onctueuse."]','2026-01-11 00:10:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11332,4038,'fr','Carottes et chou-fleur rôtis au cumin avec vinaigrette au tahini vert','Idéale pour un pique-nique ou un barbecue, cette salade copieuse peut servir de plat principal ou d''accompagnement végétarien. Vous pouvez utiliser des carottes tendres de nouvelle saison – il suffit de réduire le temps de cuisson des 15 premières minutes et de les rôtir avec le chou-fleur.','["1 kg de carottes lavées, parées et coupées en morceaux de 3 cm","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de miel (ou utilisez du sucre brun clair pour le rendre végétalien)","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à café de graines de fenouil","à café de flocons de piment (facultatif)","1 chou-fleur coupé en bouquets (environ 500 g), feuilles conservées et coupées en bouchées","60 g de feuilles de roquette","100 g de tahin","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 citron, jus","1 gousse d''ail","2 poignées de feuilles de coriandre"]','["Préparez d’abord la vinaigrette. Versez les ingrédients dans un mixeur ou un mini-hachoir avec une grosse pincée de sel et 6 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide. Blitzer pour obtenir une vinaigrette lisse (ou aussi lisse que possible), goûter pour l''assaisonnement et réserver. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux jours.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Versez les carottes dans un bol avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, le miel, le cumin et les graines de fenouil, un peu d''assaisonnement et du piment, si vous en utilisez. Tapisser 2 plaques à rôtir peu profondes de papier sulfurisé et répartir les carottes entre les deux. Rôtir 15 min jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à caraméliser. Retirer du four et ajouter les fleurons et les feuilles de chou-fleur parmi les carottes en vous assurant que tous les légumes sont enrobés de glaçage, puis arroser du reste d''huile d''olive. Rôtir pendant 30 minutes, en remuant une fois, jusqu''à ce que le tout soit tendre et collant. Laisser refroidir à température ambiante. Se conservera couvert pendant une journée.","Si vous le consommez à l''extérieur, grattez les légumes dans un récipient et prenez les feuilles de roquette et la vinaigrette dans des récipients séparés. Juste avant d''être prêt à manger, jetez la roquette dans les légumes-racines, puis arrosez-la de vinaigrette, en laissant un peu pour servir à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:10:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11333,4040,'fr','Porc effiloché à l''autocuiseur','Saviez-vous que vous pouvez cuire du porc effiloché dans une cocotte minute en seulement un quart du temps ? Une solution astucieuse pour réduire vos coûts de carburant en hiver !','["3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de grains d''ail","2 cuillères à café de granulés d''oignon","100 g de ketchup aux tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","1 kg d''épaule de porc, sans peau et désossée","300 ml de jus de pomme","baps blancs moelleux, ou pommes de terre en chemise et salade de chou, pour servir"]','["Mélangez le vinaigre, le sucre, les épices, les granules d''ail et d''oignon, le ketchup et la moutarde avec une pincée de sel dans un bol et plongez-y le porc. Couvrir et réfrigérer pendant au moins 1 heure – une nuit c''est mieux, si vous avez le temps.","Versez le porc et la marinade dans la cocotte minute, puis versez le jus de pomme. Remuez bien le tout. Fermez le couvercle et portez la pression à haute pression sur feu moyen-vif et laissez cuire 50 minutes. Laissez la pression chuter naturellement. La viande doit être tendre et détachable. Si c''est encore un peu dur, remettez le couvercle, remettez sous haute pression et laissez cuire encore 10 à 20 minutes.","Lorsque la viande est prête, déposez-la sur une planche et laissez-la couverte pour qu''elle repose. Pendant ce temps, faites réduire la sauce dans la cocotte minute. Ajustez l''assaisonnement, puis laissez mijoter et remuez sans le couvercle pendant environ 20 minutes jusqu''à épaississement et un peu gluant.","Juste avant que la sauce soit prête, effilochez la viande en la séparant entre deux fourchettes. Remettez la viande dans la poêle et mélangez-la pour l''enrober de sauce. Le porc effiloché peut être conservé au frais jusqu''à trois jours ou congelé jusqu''à un mois. Décongeler et réchauffer soigneusement avant de servir.","Servez le porc effiloché farci dans des baps moelleux avec de la salade de chou en accompagnement, si vous le souhaitez, ou comme garniture pour des pommes de terre en veste, des tacos ou des tortillas."]','2026-01-11 00:10:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11334,4042,'fr','Omelettes au tofu et vinaigrette au soja','Dégustez une omelette au tofu pour un dîner équilibré et peu calorique. Servir avec du riz, du brocoli et un filet de vinaigrette au chili pour un repas de semaine facile et savoureux.','["100 ml de sauce soja faible en sel","1 citron vert, jus","4 gousses d''ail","280 g de tofu extra-ferme, égoutté","300 g de brocoli surgelé","5 g de gingembre pelé","½ piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","3 œufs","2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","2 sachets de 250 g de riz basmati brun"]','["Mettez 50 ml de sauce soja et la moitié du jus de citron vert dans un plat peu profond. Écrasez 2 gousses d''ail. Coupez le tofu en quatre carrés égaux et ajoutez-le à la marinade. Couvrir et laisser mariner au réfrigérateur au moins 20 minutes en retournant à mi-cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, remplissez un quart de casserole moyenne d''eau, puis mettez sur feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à mijoter. Placez une passoire sur la poêle, ajoutez le brocoli, couvrez et faites cuire à la vapeur pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Pendant ce temps, râpez le reste de l''ail et le gingembre dans un petit bol. Incorporer le reste de la sauce soja et le jus de citron vert, le piment rouge et le miel. Annuler.","Égouttez le tofu et séchez-le soigneusement. Battez les œufs dans un bol avec une pincée de sel.","Faites chauffer ½ cuillère à café d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif. Une fois chaud, ajoutez un morceau de tofu dans la poêle et versez dessus un quart de l''œuf. Utilisez une tranche de poisson pour pousser l’œuf vers le tofu – vous devriez vous retrouver avec un petit carré de tofu aux œufs. Cuire 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, en retournant délicatement. Réserver, couvrir pour garder au chaud et répéter avec le reste de l''huile, du tofu et de l''œuf.","Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Servir les omelettes au tofu avec le riz, le brocoli et un filet de vinaigrette au piment."]','2026-01-11 00:10:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11335,4044,'fr','beignets polonais','Préparez un lot de beignets glacés moelleux, garnis d''amandes hachées croquantes pour une occasion spéciale. La pâte comprend de la confiture pour une douceur subtile','["7g de levure","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de farine","125 ml de lait réchauffé","7 jaunes d''œufs","15g de sucre","5 g de sucre vanillé (ou 5 g de sucre en poudre plus 1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille)","500g de farine","200 ml de crème double, réchauffée","15g de beurre très mou","125 ml de confiture d''églantier (ou autre confiture)","5g d''amandes moulues","saindoux ou huile, pour la friture","75g de sucre glace","½ citron, jus","quelques gouttes d''essence d''amande","50 g d''amandes hachées"]','["Pour faire le levain, mélangez la levure avec le sucre et la farine et incorporez le lait tiède. Réserver dans un endroit tiède pendant 30 minutes.","Pour la pâte, mettez les jaunes d''œufs dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et ajoutez le sucre et le sucre vanillé. Placez le bol sur une casserole d''eau frémissante et fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse et épaisse.","Tamisez la farine dans le bol d''un batteur sur socle, ajoutez les jaunes battus et la crème tiède, mélangez bien, puis ajoutez une pincée de sel et le levain. Réunissez pour faire une pâte et pétrissez pendant 10 minutes (ou 15-20 si vous le faites à la main).","Lorsque la pâte ne colle plus aux mains, versez le beurre fondu refroidi et pétrissez encore quelques minutes. Couvrir d''un torchon et laisser lever dans un endroit tiède au moins 1h-1h30.","Mélangez la confiture avec la poudre d''amandes et versez-la dans une poche à douille ou une seringue à confiture. Divisez la pâte en 16 morceaux et façonnez-les en beignets. Couvrir et laisser lever 30 min.","Remplissez une poêle ou une friteuse au tiers d’huile ou de saindoux fondu et faites-la chauffer jusqu’à 180°C – si vous n’avez pas de thermomètre, déposez-y un petit morceau de pain. L''huile est prête lorsqu''elle brunit en 30 secondes environ. Ajoutez les beignets et faites-les frire en les retournant une fois pendant environ 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté (un mince anneau plus léger devrait se former au milieu). Après les avoir retirés, égouttez les beignets de l''excès de graisse sur du papier absorbant.","Mélangez le sucre glace, le jus de citron et l''essence d''amande, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si vous avez besoin de fluidifier le glaçage. Lorsque les beignets ont un peu refroidi, versez-y le mélange de confiture, glacez-les dans le glaçage et saupoudrez d''amandes hachées."]','2026-01-11 00:10:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11336,4048,'fr','Radis écrasés au beurre de piment','Combinez la saveur douce des radis cuits avec du beurre de piment pour un somptueux plat d’accompagnement. Vous n''êtes pas fan de radis ? Vous changerez d''avis après avoir essayé cette recette','["100g de beurre doux","1 cuillère à soupe de flocons de piment","500 g de radis effeuillés, écrasés avec le bord plat d''un couteau (ou coupés en deux/quartiers si vous avez du mal à le faire)","1⁄2 citron, jus"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre dans une petite poêle avec les flocons de piment jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à mousser et à devenir doré. Ajouter les radis et bien les enrober de beurre, en les retournant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''ils ramollissent, environ 10 à 15 minutes.","Augmentez le feu, ajoutez le jus de citron, laissez grésiller, puis assaisonnez selon votre goût et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11337,4050,'fr','Arancini nduja épicé','Préparez ces boulettes de riz savoureuses avec des saucisses nduja épicées, une garniture mozzarella gluante et un enrobage de chapelure croustillante pour une collation pour la Saint-Valentin.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1⁄2 oignon, finement haché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","1⁄2 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil, écrasées","300 g de riz pour risotto","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","800 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","80 g de parmesan finement râpé","50 g de saucisse nduja finement hachée","150 g de mozzarella coupée en cubes","100 g de farine nature","3 œufs moyens, battus","200 g de chapelure panko","huile végétale, pour la friture"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une cocotte à feu doux et faites revenir l''oignon avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez l''ail et les graines de fenouil et laissez cuire encore 1 min. Incorporer le riz et cuire encore une minute.","Versez les tomates et la moitié du bouillon et baissez le feu à moyen-vif. Cuire en remuant continuellement jusqu''à ce que le bouillon soit presque complètement évaporé. Ajoutez le reste du bouillon, une louche à la fois, en ajoutant davantage lorsque le précédent ajout est absorbé par le riz. Cuire jusqu''à ce que le riz soit al dente, environ 15 à 20 minutes.","Incorporez le parmesan et le nduja, puis étalez le risotto sur une plaque à pâtisserie et laissez refroidir à température ambiante.","Répartissez le risotto refroidi en 20 portions égales, légèrement plus grosses qu''une balle de golf. Aplatissez une des boules en disque dans la main, mettez un morceau de mozzarella au centre, puis enfermez avec le riz. Rouler en boule. Répétez avec le reste du risotto et de la mozzarella.","Versez la farine, les œufs et la chapelure panko dans trois bols peu profonds séparés. Roulez chaque boule de risotto dans la farine, puis l''œuf et enfin la chapelure. Transférez les boules sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Remplissez à moitié une grande casserole à fond épais avec de l''huile végétale et faites chauffer à feu moyen-doux à 170 °C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un morceau de pain devienne doré dans l''huile en 45 secondes. Abaissez délicatement les boules de risotto dans l''huile par lots et faites frire chaque lot pendant 8 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et gluantes au centre. Égoutter sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant."]','2026-01-11 00:10:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11338,4054,'fr','Bœuf & fèves au lard Boston','Dégustez ces fèves au lard Boston avec une pomme de terre en veste ou du pain croustillant. Le temps opère sa magie sur ce plat, mais il y a très peu de travail pratique à faire','["300 g de haricots cannellini séchés","1 feuille de laurier fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","500 g de jarret de bœuf coupé en morceaux de 4 cm","120 g de lardons fumés","1 gros oignon, coupé en quartiers","2 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","100 g de mélasse","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde en poudre","pincée de clous de girofle moulus","pommes de terre en chemise ou pain et salade de chou, pour servir"]','["Versez les haricots dans une grande casserole, puis versez suffisamment d''eau pour couvrir les haricots de 5 cm. Ajouter le laurier et laisser tremper toute la nuit. Le lendemain, égouttez les haricots, remettez-les dans la casserole et versez suffisamment d''eau fraîche pour recouvrir les haricots de 3 cm. Portez à ébullition, réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les haricots soient tendres (vous devrez peut-être ajouter un peu d''eau pendant la cuisson).","Chauffez le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte ou une casserole allant au four et faites revenir le bœuf pendant 5 minutes à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément doré (vous devrez le faire par lots). Transférer dans une assiette à l’aide d’une écumoire. Ajouter les lardons et l''oignon dans la poêle et cuire à feu moyen-vif pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient dorés et que les lardons commencent à devenir croustillants.","Remettez le bœuf dans la poêle. Ajouter les haricots avec le liquide de cuisson et incorporer l''ail, la mélasse, la purée de tomates, la poudre de moutarde et les clous de girofle. Assaisonner, puis compléter avec un peu d''eau pour que les haricots soient recouverts de 2 à 3 cm. Couvrez et portez à ébullition, puis enfournez pour 2h30. Retirez le couvercle, remuez et remettez au four pendant 1 h 30 jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre et la sauce riche. Une fois refroidis, les haricots peuvent être congelés jusqu''à trois mois (voir ci-dessous). Servir avec des pommes de terre en chemise ou du pain et une salade de chou."]','2026-01-11 00:10:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11339,4060,'fr','Pâtisseries à la noix de coco (gujiya)','Préparez cette version d''un bonbon indien populaire rempli de noix de coco, d''amandes et de raisins secs légèrement épicés. Ils sont généralement fabriqués pour célébrer la fête de Holi','["275g de farine","35 g de ghee, fondu et refroidi","huile de tournesol, pour pétrir et frire","1 litre de lait entier (nous avons utilisé du lait de Jersey)","125 g de sucre en poudre","200 g de noix de coco râpée surgelée, décongelée","50 g d''amandes blanchies finement hachées","50g de raisins secs","½ cuillère à café de cardamome moulue","¼ cuillère à café de muscade râpée"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la garniture. Versez le lait dans une casserole sur feu moyen et faites bouillir pendant environ 25-30 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une crème épaisse. (Il est préférable d''utiliser de l''awok, du karahi ou une cocotte solide pour cela, car vous voulez que le lait réduise rapidement sans brûler ni brunir.) Remuez continuellement, en raclant les parois de la casserole pendant la cuisson. Lorsqu''il a la consistance d''œufs brouillés légèrement pris et qu''il se détache des côtés de la casserole, éteignez le feu.","Transférez le lait réduit dans une casserole propre, ajoutez le sucre et laissez cuire à feu doux pendant 3-4 minutes en remuant constamment jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Ajoutez la noix de coco, les amandes, les raisins secs, la cardamome et la muscade et baissez le feu à moyen. Poursuivez la cuisson 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe. Éteignez le feu et laissez refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la pâte. Tamisez la farine et ¼ cuillère à café de sel fin dans un bol à mélanger, puis ajoutez le ghee fondu refroidi. Du bout des doigts, frottez le ghee dans la farine jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure grossière. Ajouter juste assez d''eau froide pour lier le mélange en une pâte très ferme et bien pétrir jusqu''à consistance lisse. Couvrir et laisser à température ambiante au moins 30 minutes.","Divisez et façonnez la pâte en 17 à 18 boules d''environ 20 g chacune et d''environ 3 cm de diamètre. Gardez la pâte couverte pour éviter qu''elle ne se dessèche.","Étalez chaque boule sur une surface légèrement huilée jusqu''à obtenir un cercle d''environ 10 cm de diamètre (la pâte sera plus fine si les boules sont étalées individuellement). Ne vous inquiétez pas si vos cercles ne sont pas parfaits.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok ou un karahi à feu moyen à 130°C ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain tombé en couleur dore en 1 min. Faites frire les gujiyas par lots pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée des deux côtés. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et laisser refroidir avant de servir à température ambiante. Se conserve 3 à 4 jours dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:10:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11340,4062,'fr','Poulet frit à l''air','Utilisez une friteuse à air pour préparer ces cuisses de poulet faciles et ajoutez l''assaisonnement ou la sauce de votre choix. C''est une façon simple de cuisiner du poulet lorsque vous êtes occupé','["4 grosses ou 8 petites cuisses de poulet, avec la peau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","assaisonnement de votre choix (utilisez du sel et du poivre, ou ½ à 1 cuillère à café de BBQ fumé, de ras-el-hanout, de granules d''ail, de sel de céleri ou de garam masala)"]','["Mélangez les cuisses de poulet dans l''huile en vous assurant qu''elles sont toutes bien enrobées.","Mélangez la farine avec l''assaisonnement, puis mélangez avec les cuisses de poulet – ce sera un enrobage très léger, mais vous pouvez doubler la farine et l''assaisonnement si vous préférez un enrobage plus épais.","Disposez le poulet en une seule couche sur la plaque d''une friteuse sans palette et programmez une cuisson de 35 minutes. Vérifiez que les cuisses sont cuites en retirant la chair située sous l’une d’entre elles de l’os – elle devrait se détacher facilement et il ne devrait pas rester de rose. Cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes si nécessaire. La peau doit avoir bouillonné et devenir croustillante, et tout excès de graisse du poulet aura coulé dans la base de la friteuse (vous pouvez le jeter). Ne laissez pas le poulet dans la friteuse, sinon la vapeur rendra la peau douce."]','2026-01-11 00:10:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11341,4064,'fr','Cochons géants dans des couvertures','Préparez des cochons de grande taille dans des couvertures pour un plat d''accompagnement de Noël très spécial. Badigeonner de sirop d''érable en fin de cuisson pour encore plus de gourmandise','["6 saucisses de porc","6 petites branches de romarin","6 tranches de bacon fumé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. En travaillant avec une saucisse à la fois, déposez une branche de romarin dessus et enroulez une tranche de bacon autour.","Mettez les saucisses enveloppées sur une plaque à pâtisserie et arrosez d''huile. Rôtir pendant 25 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits."]','2026-01-11 00:10:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11342,4070,'fr','Œufs à la diable','Préparez des œufs farcis à servir lors d''un buffet du lendemain de Noël. Ils sont remplis de moutarde, d’oignons nouveaux, de mayonnaise, de yaourt et d’une pincée de poivre de Cayenne. Garnir de ciboulette, si vous le souhaitez','["6 gros œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec entier","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","2 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","¼ cuillère à café de sel de céleri","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","ciboulette hachée"]','["Mettez les œufs dans une casserole d’eau juste frémissante et laissez cuire 10 minutes. Éteignez le feu et laissez reposer les œufs dans l''eau chaude pendant 2 minutes. Égoutter puis transférer les œufs dans un bol d''eau glacée et laisser refroidir. Épluchez les œufs et coupez-les en deux, puis versez les jaunes dans un bol avec la mayonnaise, le yaourt, la moutarde, les oignons nouveaux, le sel de céleri et le poivre de Cayenne. Écrasez le tout jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis versez-le dans une poche à douille munie d''une douille ronde unie.","Versez le mélange dans les œufs évidés ou versez délicatement au milieu à l''aide d''une petite cuillère. Saupoudrez de ciboulette, si vous en utilisez, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11343,4074,'fr','Mini hasselbacks à la crème sure, à l''aneth et aux oignons roses marinés','Garnissez ces mini hasselbacks de crème sure, d''oignons roses marinés et d''aneth pour des amuse-gueules faciles. Ils sont idéaux pour les fêtes et les buffets','["1,5 kg de pommes de terre nouvelles","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","8 cuillères à soupe de crème sure","½ petit bouquet d''aneth haché","50g de sucre","100 ml de vinaigre de cidre ou de vin blanc","1 cuillère à café de flocons de sel marin","1 oignon rouge moyen, tranché finement"]','["Préparez les oignons marinés au moins 4 heures avant de servir. Mélangez le sucre et 100 ml d''eau bouillante dans un bol non métallique résistant à la chaleur. Incorporer le vinaigre et le sel. Ajouter les oignons et presser avec une cuillère pour les immerger. Couvrir et laisser mariner au moins 4 heures ou réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Trancher finement les pommes de terre à intervalles réguliers sur toute leur longueur sans les couper. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie, arroser d''huile, assaisonner, ajouter l''ail et rôtir pendant 1 h à 1 h 20, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et doré.","Fouetter la crème sure avec la majeure partie de l''aneth, puis assaisonner. Transférer les pommes de terre dans une assiette de service et verser une cuillère à café du mélange de crème sure sur chacune. Égouttez les oignons marinés (utilisez le liquide de marinade pour les vinaigrettes, si vous le souhaitez) et ajoutez quelques morceaux sur chaque pomme de terre. Parsemer du reste d''aneth."]','2026-01-11 00:10:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11344,4076,'fr','Salade de panais, épinards, artichauts et riz sauvage','Dégustez cette salade de riz sauvage végétarienne aux épinards, artichauts et panais dans le cadre d''un buffet du lendemain de Noël','["350g de riz sauvage (utilisez un mélange, ou du riz noir fonctionne bien)","200 g de panais (environ 2 moyens), pelés et coupés en fins rubans à l''aide d''un économe","8 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin, écrasées","2 citrons, jus","2 cuillères à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","200 g de pousses d''épinards hachées","300 g d''artichauts grillés à l''huile, égouttés et tranchés","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées finement"]','["Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions du paquet, puis égouttez-le. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger les panais avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile et disposer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé en une seule couche. Saupoudrer d''un peu d''assaisonnement et de la moitié des graines de cumin. Rôtir pendant 25 à 30 minutes, en remuant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants.","Fouetter le jus de citron, la moutarde, le reste des graines de cumin et l''origan dans un grand bol, puis ajouter le reste de l''huile en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à épaississement. Assaisonnez bien. Incorporer au riz cuit.","Incorporez les épinards, les artichauts et la menthe au mélange de riz et assaisonnez au goût. Parsemer de chips de panais pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11345,4084,'fr','Sauce aux canneberges épicée','Préparez cette sauce aux canneberges épicée pour la servir à votre table de fête. C’est épais et volumineux comme un chutney – pour une consistance plus fine, ajoutez simplement 100 ml d’eau','["250 g de canneberges fraîches ou surgelées","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade ou de vinaigre balsamique","½ orange, finement zestée et pressée","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu si nécessaire","pincée de piment de la Jamaïque moulu"]','["Versez tous les ingrédients dans une casserole et portez à légère ébullition à feu doux. Cuire 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les canneberges éclatent et que la sauce soit épaisse, brillante et collante.","Si vous préférez une sauce plus sucrée, ajoutez un peu plus de sucre. Laisser refroidir. Se conserve, couvert, au réfrigérateur jusqu''à une semaine ou congelé pendant deux mois."]','2026-01-11 00:10:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11346,4086,'fr','Soupe aux tomates fumées, chipotle et maïs carbonisé','Sortez la pâte de chipotle et préparez cette soupe percutante aux tomates fumées, au chipotle et au maïs doux carbonisé. Un repas facile en milieu de semaine, vous pouvez congeler les restes','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges hachées et feuilles laissées entières","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","600 ml de bouillon de légumes","1-1½ cuillères à soupe de pâte de piment chipotle","2 épis de maïs","50 g de feta émiettée","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec sans gras"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir. Ajouter l''ail, la coriandre moulue et les tiges de coriandre et cuire 1 min. Incorporer les tomates, le bouillon et le chipotle et porter à ébullition. Cuire à couvert à feu doux pendant 20 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Pendant ce temps, portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition et faites cuire le maïs pendant 4 min. Égoutter et laisser refroidir un peu. Coupez les grains de l''épi avec un couteau bien aiguisé. Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive à feu vif. Ajoutez le maïs et faites-le frire pendant 5 à 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit carbonisé, en remuant de temps en temps.","Versez la soupe dans des bols. Garnir de feta, de yaourt, de maïs carbonisé et de feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:10:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11347,4088,'fr','Graines de citrouille grillées','Ne jetez pas les graines si vous cuisinez une citrouille – essayez de les rôtir avec cette recette facile. Ils constituent une collation savoureuse avec un peu d''assaisonnement ou une garniture accrocheuse','["graines de citrouille fraîches, récupérées de la citrouille","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive"]','["Chauffer le four à 200 C/180 C ventilateur/gaz 6. Lavez soigneusement les graines et retirez tous les morceaux filandreux de chair de citrouille. Bien sécher avec du papier absorbant.","Mettez les graines sur une plaque à pâtisserie et mélangez-les avec l''huile d''olive. Rôtir pendant 10 minutes. Servir avec un peu d''assaisonnement pour une collation, si vous le souhaitez, ou utiliser comme garniture pour des salades ou des soupes."]','2026-01-11 00:10:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11348,4090,'fr','Soupe végétalienne à la citrouille','Profitez au maximum de la saison de la citrouille au début de l''automne avec cette soupe végétalienne saine à la citrouille. Faire griller les graines de citrouille et utiliser comme garniture pour ajouter de la texture','["1 citrouille moyenne ou grosse courge (environ 1½ kg)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","½ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","1 gros oignon, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 à 1,2 litre de bouillon végétalien","1 cuillère à soupe de miso blanc végétalien","3 cuillères à soupe de crème de soja ou de yaourt à la noix de coco","3 cuillères à soupe de flocons de noix de coco","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","1 citron vert, zesté et pressé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Épluchez, épépinez et coupez le potimarron en morceaux de 3 cm (réservez les graines pour la relish – voir astuce). Versez la citrouille sur une plaque à pâtisserie, arrosez-la de la moitié de l''huile, parsemez de piment de la Jamaïque et mélangez bien. Assaisonner et rôtir pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et tendres. Pendant ce temps, faites griller les flocons de noix de coco pour la relish dans une poêle sèche à feu doux pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Retirer de la poêle et laisser refroidir, puis incorporer les graines de citrouille, le piment, la coriandre et le zeste de citron vert.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre mais pas doré. Ajoutez le gingembre et l''ail et faites revenir encore une minute, puis versez 1 litre de bouillon et le miso. Mettez le potiron rôti dans la poêle, puis portez à ébullition. Retirer du feu et mélanger la soupe avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Si vous préférez une soupe plus fine, ajoutez le reste du bouillon. Remettez la soupe sur feu doux, puis assaisonnez bien et incorporez le jus de citron vert. Verser dans des bols et servir garni d''un tourbillon de crème de soja et d''une pincée de relish."]','2026-01-11 00:10:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11349,4092,'fr','Petits beignets de crabe & tartare aux herbes','Utilisez du crabe pour faire passer vos croquettes de poisson au niveau supérieur. Ceux-ci sont idéaux à partager et à tremper dans notre sauce tartare piquante. Si vous le pouvez, utilisez de la chair de crabe fraîche','["2 grosses pommes de terre (environ 600g)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol, plus un peu pour la friture","100 g de chair de crabe brune","200 g de chair de crabe blanche","1 citron, zesté","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","pincée de moutarde en poudre","50g de farine nature","2 œufs légèrement battus","100 g de chapelure panko ou de chapelure fraîche","quartiers de citron, pour servir","120 g de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","1 cuillère à café de câpres, égouttées et hachées grossièrement","½ petit bouquet d''aneth finement haché","¼ petit bouquet d''estragon finement haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Piquer les pommes de terre partout avec une fourchette, frotter avec l''huile, mettre sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 1h30, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un couteau puisse être facilement inséré. Laissez refroidir un peu.","Mettez toute la chair de crabe, le zeste de citron, le poivre de Cayenne et la poudre de moutarde dans un bol avec une grosse pincée de sel. Coupez les pommes de terre en deux et versez la chair dans le bol. Pliez délicatement le tout, puis formez 12 petites galettes avec vos mains.","Versez la farine dans un bol peu profond, versez l''œuf dans un deuxième et la chapelure dans un troisième. Tremper chaque galette dans la farine, puis dans l''œuf et enfin rouler dans la chapelure. Disposez les croquettes de poisson dans une assiette et réservez au frais 10 min.","Pour la sauce tartare, mélanger tous les ingrédients dans un bol. Annuler.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer un bon filet d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites frire la moitié des beignets de crabe pendant 3 minutes de chaque côté, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit.","Servir les beignets de crabe sur une assiette avec un bol de sauce tartare à côté pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:10:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11350,4094,'fr','Salade de chou et piment','Servez cette salade de chou et de piment avec des kebabs doner. Réfrigérez pendant un jour ou deux, et il ramollira et se transformera en une salade de chou plus légère de style kimchi.','["½ chou blanc, tranché finement","½ quantité de sauce chili fumée (voir la recette dans « Se marie bien avec » ci-dessous)","½ citron, jus","8 oignons nouveaux, parés et finement tranchés en biais"]','["Mélangez le chou dans un bol avec ½ cuillère à café de sel. Laissez reposer 30 minutes, puis rincez sous l''eau froide. Laisser sécher dans une passoire.","Remettez le chou dans le bol et mélangez-le avec la sauce chili, le jus de citron et les oignons nouveaux. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:10:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11351,4096,'fr','Sauce chili fumée','Préparez cette sauce chili fumée pour accompagner des kebabs, des hamburgers ou des hot-dogs faits maison. Rempli d''ail et de piquant, il promet d''ajouter du punch à vos plats.','["12 piments rouges","10 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un filet supplémentaire","pincée de sucre en poudre"]','["Retirez les tiges des piments, puis versez-les sur une feuille de papier d''aluminium avec les gousses d''ail, un filet d''huile d''olive, du sucre en poudre et un peu de sel. Soulevez les côtés du papier d''aluminium et froissez-le pour fermer.","Griller au barbecue (ou rôtir à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3) pendant 30 min jusqu''à ce que l''ail soit tendre. Versez-le dans un grand pilon et un mortier ou un robot culinaire avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, et écrasez-le ou mixez-le pour obtenir une sauce épaisse. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:10:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11352,4098,'fr','Pavlova banane, tahini et caramel salé','Épatez vos invités avec cette pavlova, dotée d''une fabuleuse garniture de banane, de tahini et de caramel salé. C''est un dessert délicieusement décadent pour un festin d''été','["½ citron pressé (réserver l''autre moitié)","6 gros blancs d''œufs","350 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","400 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","3 bananes, tranchées","3 cuillères à soupe de caramel au beurre salé","2 snaps au sésame"]','["Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. En vous servant d''un moule à cake ou d''une assiette ronde de 18 cm comme guide, tracez un cercle sur le papier sulfurisé, puis retournez-le. Chauffer le four à 130°C/110°C chaleur tournante/gaz ½.","Frottez la moitié de citron réservée à l''intérieur d''un grand bol ou d''un batteur sur socle, puis essuyez-la avec du papier absorbant pour éliminer tout beurre ou huile. Versez les blancs d''œufs et fouettez avec un fouet électrique ou avec le batteur à basse vitesse jusqu''à ce que les blancs forment de petites bulles mousseuses, environ 1 à 2 minutes. Continuez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la mousse à raser, puis ajoutez le sucre, 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois, jusqu''à obtenir une meringue épaisse et brillante. Frottez-en un peu entre vos doigts – si vous sentez des grains de sucre, continuez à fouetter pendant quelques minutes. Ajoutez la maïzena, le jus de citron et la vanille et fouettez encore 30 secondes.","Versez la meringue sur le papier sulfurisé préparé, au centre du cercle, et étalez-la sur les bords avec une spatule. Passez le couteau sur le pourtour, puis lissez le dessus.","Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, puis baisser le four à 100°C/80°C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼ et cuire au four pendant 1 heure. Éteignez le four et laissez la pavlova refroidir à l''intérieur pendant au moins 2 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Au moment de servir, retournez délicatement la pavlova et retirez le papier sulfurisé. Ne vous inquiétez pas s’il craque un peu, il sera recouvert par la garniture.","Pour faire la garniture, fouettez la crème double, le tahini et le sucre glace jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous. Verser sur la pavlova et garnir de tranches de banane, puis arroser de caramel salé et émietter sur les boutons-pression au sésame. Il est préférable de le servir immédiatement, mais les restes se conservent au réfrigérateur pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:10:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11353,4100,'fr','Pavlova au sucre pastèque, citron vert et menthe','Essayez une variante de la pavlova avec une garniture à la pastèque, au citron vert et à la menthe. Avec une meringue croquante et un centre de guimauve, c''est un dessert qui impressionnera à coup sûr','["½ citron pressé (réserver l''autre moitié)","6 gros blancs d''œufs","350 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","une poignée de feuilles de menthe, plus un peu pour servir","50 g de sucre en poudre","400 ml de crème fraîche","200 g de yaourt nature","1 citron vert, zesté","petite pastèque, coupée en quartiers et sans la peau"]','["Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. En vous servant d''un moule à gâteau ou d''une assiette ronde de 18 cm comme guide, tracez un cercle sur le papier sulfurisé, puis retournez-le. Chauffer le four à 130°C/110°C chaleur tournante/gaz ½.","Frottez la moitié de citron réservée autour de l''intérieur d''un grand bol ou d''un batteur sur socle, puis essuyez avec du papier absorbant pour éliminer tout beurre ou huile. Versez les blancs d''œufs et fouettez avec un fouet électrique ou avec le batteur à basse vitesse jusqu''à ce que les blancs forment de petites bulles mousseuses, environ 1 à 2 minutes. Continuez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la mousse à raser, puis ajoutez le sucre, 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois, jusqu''à obtenir une meringue épaisse et brillante. Frottez-en un peu entre vos doigts – si vous sentez des grains de sucre, continuez à fouetter pendant quelques minutes. Ajoutez la maïzena, le jus de citron et la vanille et fouettez encore 30 secondes.","Versez la meringue sur la plaque à pâtisserie préparée, au centre du cercle et étalez-la sur les bords avec un couteau à palette. Passez le couteau sur le pourtour, puis lissez le dessus.","Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, puis baisser le four à 100 C/80 C chaleur tournante/gaz ¼ et cuire au four pendant 1 heure. Éteignez le four et laissez la pavlova refroidir à l''intérieur pendant au moins 2 heures, voire toute la nuit.","Retournez délicatement la pavlova et retirez le parchemin. Ne vous inquiétez pas s’il craque un peu, il sera recouvert par la garniture.","Pour réaliser le topping, mélangez la menthe avec le sucre en poudre. Fouettez la crème épaisse et le yaourt nature avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''ils tiennent tout juste leur forme. Saupoudrer de zeste de citron vert et de sucre à la menthe, puis incorporer au mélange de crème avec une grande cuillère en métal pour onduler. Verser sur la pavlova. Garnir avec le reste du sucre à la menthe, la pastèque et encore de la menthe. Servir avec des quartiers de citron vert à presser. Il est préférable de le servir immédiatement, mais les restes se conservent au réfrigérateur pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:10:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11354,4106,'fr','Piccata de poulet aux feuilles d''ail et pommes de terre nouvelles','Gagnez plus de temps en milieu de semaine avec notre savoureuse piccata de poulet aux câpres, légumes verts et pommes de terre nouvelles. Prêt en 20 minutes, c’est sain et peu calorique','["200 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux ou en quartiers","300 g de haricots verts parés","200 g de verdure printanière, râpée","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau","3 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","100 ml de bouillon de poulet ou d''eau","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres égouttées","1 citron, zesté et pressé","2 petites gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 cuillère à soupe de parmesan râpé"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre nouvelles dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Ajoutez les haricots verts et la verdure printanière pendant les 3 dernières minutes. Égoutter, puis séparer les légumes verts des pommes de terre.","Pendant que les pommes de terre cuisent, coupez les poitrines de poulet au centre dans le sens de la longueur, en laissant un côté attaché pour qu''il s''ouvre comme un livre. Badigeonnez chacun d’eux avec 1 cuillère à café d’huile d’olive, puis assaisonnez.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire le poulet 4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Versez dessus le bouillon, les câpres, le jus et le zeste de citron, puis laissez mijoter doucement quelques minutes pour réduire. Ajouter les pommes de terre cuites et laisser mijoter encore une minute.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile restante dans une autre poêle et faites revenir l''ail pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré et parfumé. Versez les légumes verts égouttés et ajoutez l’huile d’ail. Assaisonner, puis parsemer de parmesan et servir avec le poulet et les pommes de terre."]','2026-01-11 00:10:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11355,4107,'fr','Sucettes aux fruits arc-en-ciel','Emballez des fruits avec ces amusantes sucettes arc-en-ciel, à base de mangue, de banane, de kiwi et de baies. Si vous souhaitez une couleur plus vive, ajoutez du colorant alimentaire aux mélanges fruités','["100 g de mangue pelée, dénoyautée et hachée","2 bananes","400g de yaourt","2 kiwis pelés et hachés grossièrement","100 g de framboises surgelées","100 g de mûres surgelées"]','["Mixez la mangue avec ½ banane et 100 g de yaourt dans un mixeur jusqu''à consistance lisse. Répartissez dans six moules à sucettes glacées et insérez un bâton dans chacun. Tenez chaque bâtonnet à la verticale dans le moule et fixez-le des deux côtés avec du ruban adhésif. Congeler pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris.","Répétez avec une autre ½ banane, 100 g de yaourt supplémentaire et le kiwi, et versez-le sur la couche de banane. Congeler encore 1 heure jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris. Répétez avec les framboises, puis les mûres, en congelant chaque couche avant de garnir de la suivante. Couvrir et congeler les sucettes toute la nuit. Passer sous l''eau tiède pour démouler. Se conserve au congélateur jusqu''à deux mois."]','2026-01-11 00:10:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11356,4109,'fr','Spaghettis arc-en-ciel','Essayez de préparer ces spaghettis arc-en-ciel comme activité sensorielle pour les bébés et les tout-petits, ou servez-les comme un déjeuner amusant – garnissez simplement de leur vinaigrette préférée et dégustez avec une salade.','["200 g de spaghettis","un mélange de colorants alimentaires (nous avons utilisé du rouge, du jaune, du vert et du bleu)","vinaigrette ou beurre fondu","50 g de cheddar râpé","salade composée de feuilles et légumes"]','["Faites cuire les spaghettis en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Égouttez, puis répartissez dans les bols, en fonction du nombre de couleurs que vous souhaitez utiliser (nous avons créé cinq couleurs). Ajoutez une goutte de colorant alimentaire dans chaque bol ou combinez deux couleurs (comme le rouge et le jaune pour obtenir de l''orange). Bien mélanger en ajoutant un peu d''eau pour aider la couleur à se disperser, si nécessaire. Laisser poser 5 minutes, puis rincer les spaghettis sous l''eau froide pour fixer la couleur.","Si vous souhaitez utiliser les spaghettis uniquement à des fins sensorielles, versez-les dans un grand plateau ou un bol en plastique et laissez vos tout-petits plonger dedans. Si vous le souhaitez, ajoutez des glaçons ou donnez aux tout-petits plus âgés (âgés de deux à quatre ans) des ciseaux de sécurité pour pratiquer leurs compétences de coupe.","Si vous servez les spaghettis, mélangez-les avec un peu de vinaigrette ou du beurre fondu, puis garnissez d''un peu de fromage râpé et d''une salade de feuilles et de légumes mélangés."]','2026-01-11 00:10:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11357,4111,'fr','« beignets » aux pommes','Réalisez ces rondelles de pommes façon beignet pour un pique-nique avec les enfants. Les enfants adoreront aider à préparer, décorer et manger ces friandises fruitées, et aucune cuisine n''est requise.','["150g de fromage à pâte molle","2 cuillères à café de miel","3 pommes (utilisez une variété croquante)","3-4 cuillères à soupe de beurre d''amande ou de cacahuète (facultatif)","pépites colorées, pour décorer"]','["Mélangez le fromage à pâte molle avec le miel et réservez. Épluchez les pommes, puis coupez-les chacune à travers le trognon en cinq ou six rondelles d''environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Utilisez un vide-pomme ou un petit emporte-pièce rond pour découper un cercle au milieu de chaque tranche, en retirant le noyau et en créant des formes de « beignets ». Séchez les tranches avec du papier absorbant – elles doivent être aussi sèches que possible pour aider la garniture à adhérer.","Étalez un peu de beurre de noix sur les tranches, le cas échéant, puis garnissez-les de fromage à pâte molle sucrée. Décorez avec les pépites et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11358,4113,'fr','Pizzas aux crumpets','Aidez les jeunes enfants à préparer ces pizzas aux crumpets faciles pour le déjeuner, ou laissez les enfants plus âgés les préparer eux-mêmes. Utilisez les légumes que vous avez au réfrigérateur pour la garniture','["6 crumpets","4 cuillères à soupe passées","4 cuillères à soupe de ketchup","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","garnitures de votre choix (poivrons, tomates cerises, oignon rouge, maïs doux, olives, jambon et basilic fonctionnent tous bien)","75 g de fromage cheddar râpé"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Griller légèrement les crumpets au grille-pain ou sous le grill. Pendant ce temps, mélangez la passata, le ketchup et l’origan dans un bol. Saison. Coupez la garniture de votre choix en petits morceaux – les jeunes enfants peuvent déchirer le basilic ou hacher des légumes mous dans une tasse à l''aide de ciseaux de sécurité.","Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium. Étalez la sauce sur les crumpets, puis garnissez de légumes et de fromage. Disposer sur la plaque et griller pendant 3-4 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit doré et bouillonnant. Laisser refroidir légèrement avant de déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:10:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11359,4115,'fr','Salade de betteraves rôties et miel cru','Servez un déjeuner ou un plat d''accompagnement riche en fibres avec cette salade de betteraves rouges, feta et lentilles vertes. Débordant de couleurs, il regorge de saveurs et de nutriments','["3 grosses betteraves rouges, coupées en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","5 brins de thym","25 g de feta émiettée","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","200 g de lentilles vertes en conserve, égouttées","50g de fusée","30g de graines mélangées","petite poignée d''aneth, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Mélanger la betterave rouge, ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile et le thym dans une rôtissoire. Saison. Rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté, en ajoutant la feta pendant les 10 dernières minutes. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Fouettez le reste de l''huile avec le miel, un peu d''eau froide pour détendre et un peu d''assaisonnement. Réchauffez les lentilles dans une poêle ou au micro-ondes, puis assaisonnez. Mélangez la betterave et la feta avec la roquette et la vinaigrette, puis servez sur les lentilles avec les graines et l''aneth parsemés."]','2026-01-11 00:10:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11360,4119,'fr','Sucettes à la pastèque','Essayez une nouvelle façon amusante de servir de la pastèque aux enfants. Vous pouvez également pousser des raisins verts et noirs sur des bâtonnets de kebab et terminer par une fraise.','["1 grosse pastèque"]','["Coupez la pastèque en tranches de 2 cm d''épaisseur. Coupez chaque tranche en un coin triangulaire.","Faites une petite incision au milieu de la peau de chaque morceau, suffisamment grande pour y insérer un bâton de sucette."]','2026-01-11 00:10:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11361,4121,'fr','Sorbet mangue','Profitez au maximum des mangues sucrées avec ce sorbet rafraîchissant à la mangue. Faible en gras, c''est le dessert parfait pour les journées chaudes et douces','["3 grosses mangues mûres","200 g de sucre en poudre","1 citron vert, jus"]','["Épluchez les mangues avec un épluche-légumes, coupez le plus possible la chair du noyau, mettez-la dans un robot culinaire ou un mixeur.","Ajoutez le sucre, le jus de citron vert et 200 ml d''eau. Mixez quelques minutes, jusqu''à ce que la mangue soit très lisse et que le sucre soit dissous – frottez un peu du mélange entre vos doigts, s''il est encore granuleux, mixez encore un peu. Versez dans un récipient et mettez au congélateur quelques heures.","Remettez le sorbet dans le mixeur (s''il est très solide, laissez-le d''abord à température ambiante pendant 5 à 10 minutes). Mélangez jusqu''à obtenir un mélange gluant, puis remettez-le dans le moule et congelez pendant environ une heure.","Répétez l’étape 3. Congelez jusqu’à ce qu’il soit solide (encore une heure ou deux). Se conservera couvert au congélateur pendant trois mois."]','2026-01-11 00:10:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11362,4123,'fr','Flapjacks au miel faciles','Offrez-vous ces flapjacks au miel faciles pour les onze ou la crise de l''après-midi. Parfait pour les pique-niques, les paniers-repas et les ventes de pâtisseries','["225 g de beurre, plus un peu pour le moule","75 g de sucre en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe de miel","350 g de flocons d''avoine"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule rectangle de 30 x 15 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faire fondre le beurre, le sucre et le miel dans une poêle à feu moyen en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu et que le mélange soit lisse.","Mettez les flocons d''avoine dans un bol à mélanger, puis versez dessus le mélange de beurre et de miel. Remuer jusqu''à ce que tous les flocons d''avoine soient enrobés. Versez dans le moule préparé et utilisez une spatule ou le dos d''une cuillère pour étaler uniformément le mélange. Cuire 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Laisser refroidir dans le moule, puis retirer avant de couper en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:10:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11363,4127,'fr','Beignets de sésame, halloumi et courgettes avec un filet de miel et de piment','Profitez au maximum d''une surabondance de courgettes avec ces beignets faciles et rapides à base de halloumi et de graines de sésame. Servir avec un délicieux filet de miel et de piment','["2 courgettes moyennes, râpées","½ cuillère à café de sel de mer, plus un peu pour servir","30 g de farines autolevantes","20 g de riz ou de maïzena","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame grillées","¼ cuillère à café de poivre blanc moulu","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de menthe, hachées finement","80 g de halloumi râpé","2 gros œufs","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","huile végétale, pour la friture","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","½ cuillère à café de pul biber ou d''autres flocons de piment","2 citrons, zestés"]','["Pour faire un filet de miel et de piment, faites chauffer le miel, 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, les flocons de piment et le zeste de citron dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce qu''ils bouillonnent et soient sirupeux, environ 3 minutes. Mettez les courgettes dans une passoire et saupoudrez de sel. Laissez égoutter pendant 30 minutes, puis utilisez vos mains pour extraire le liquide – vous voulez qu’il soit aussi sec que possible.","Mélangez les farines, les graines de sésame et le poivre dans un bol. Ajouter la menthe, le halloumi et la courgette et mélanger légèrement. Cassez les œufs et utilisez une fourchette pour les incorporer au mélange avec les oignons nouveaux. Remuer jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à fond épais et remuez pour enrober la base. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe bombées de pâte pour chaque beignet, aplatissez-les avec une spatule et faites frire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Retournez-les et appuyez avec la spatule, puis faites-les frire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et assaisonner avec quelques flocons de sel marin. Arroser de miel de piment pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11364,4133,'fr','Pizzas en pâte feuilletée','Amusez-vous à préparer ces pizzas en pâte feuilletée avec les enfants. Coupez tous les légumes que vous avez en petits morceaux et laissez chacun choisir sa propre garniture.','["320 g de pâte feuilletée légère toute prête","6 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","75 g de mozzarella ou cheddar","maïs doux, olives, poivrons, oignon rouge, tomates cerises, épinards, basilic"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Dérouler la pâte, la couper en six carrés et la disposer sur deux plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé. À l''aide d''un couteau à couverts, tracez une bordure de 1 cm sur le pourtour de chaque carré de pâtisserie. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit gonflé mais pas complètement cuit.","Pendant la cuisson de la pâtisserie, préparez la sauce et préparez vos garnitures. Mélangez le concentré de tomates, le ketchup aux tomates, l''origan et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Râpez le fromage et coupez en petits morceaux les légumes ou les herbes que vous souhaitez mettre dessus. Annuler.","Sortez la pâte du four et écrasez-la au milieu avec le dos d''une cuillère. Répartissez la sauce entre les carrés de pâte et étalez-la jusqu''aux bords gonflés. Saupoudrez de fromage, puis ajoutez vos garnitures. Cuire au four encore 5 à 8 minutes et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11365,4137,'fr','Soupe crémeuse de tomates aux 5 légumes','Savourez cette soupe aux légumes pour un bon repas familial léger, avec des restes pour le lendemain. Servir avec du pain ou nos moulinets au fromage, marmite et épinards','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, hachés","2 carottes, hachées","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 poivrons rouges, hachés","1 grosse patate douce, pelée et hachée","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates","1 cube de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet faible en sel","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","3 brins de romarin, feuilles cueillies et hachées","70 ml de crème fraîche"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il ramollisse et commence à prendre un peu de couleur. Ajouter les carottes, l''ail, les poivrons et la patate douce. Cuire encore 10 minutes en remuant souvent et en prenant soin de ne pas brûler l''ail. Ajoutez les tomates, le bouillon, les herbes et 1 litre d''eau. Portez à ébullition. Couvrir et cuire 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la patate douce soit tendre.","Utilisez un mixeur plongeant pour fouetter la soupe jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse. Incorporer la crème et assaisonner selon votre goût. Peut être réfrigéré pendant trois jours ou congelé jusqu''à trois mois."]','2026-01-11 00:10:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11366,4141,'fr','Haricots fumés et œufs au four','Emballez les nutriments avec des haricots fumés et des œufs au four. Idéal pour un déjeuner ou un dîner végétarien en famille, servir avec des pains plats ou des toasts pour plus de nourriture','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile","1 oignon, haché","1 poivron rouge, tranché","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de ketchup","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs ou pinto égouttés","4 à 6 œufs, selon votre faim (les adultes peuvent vouloir 2 œufs chacun)","une poignée de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle large et peu profonde et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez le poivron et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes en remuant régulièrement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Incorporez l''ail, le paprika et le ketchup, puis versez les tomates, couvrez et laissez mijoter doucement 10 minutes. Retirez le couvercle et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes pour épaissir, puis ajoutez les haricots. Peut être refroidi et congelé en portions à ce stade.","Utilisez une cuillère pour faire 4 à 6 espaces dans le mélange pour les œufs – vous devriez pouvoir voir une partie du fond de la casserole. Cassez les œufs un à un dans une tasse ou un bol et déposez-en délicatement un dans chaque trou. Couvrir la casserole et réduire le feu à doux. Cuire pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les blancs d''œufs soient bien cuits mais que les jaunes soient encore coulants. Répartir sur la coriandre pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11367,4149,'fr','Burger de betterave','Vous cherchez un burger végétalien avec du mordant et des tonnes de saveurs ? Ne cherchez pas plus loin, nous sommes convaincus que les mangeurs de viande, les végétariens et les végétaliens adoreront cette recette de burger à la betterave.','["1 oignon, coupé en quartiers","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour le badigeonnage","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","200 g de champignons châtaignes","250 g de tofu fumé ou ordinaire","2 (environ 100 g) de betteraves cuites (pas au vinaigre)","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise végétalienne","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte miso","100g de farine d''avoine","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin moulues","50 g de noix de pécan","Sachet de 200 g de riz brun cuit au micro-ondes","8 tranches de fromage, végétalien si nécessaire (facultatif)","8 pains à hamburger, fendus (vérifiez l''étiquette, si vous préparez des plats végétaliens)","confiture de tomates et de piment (voir recette ci-dessous)","quelques feuilles de laitue croquantes","1 avocat dénoyauté, pelé et grossièrement écrasé","½ citron vert, jus"]','["Mettez l''oignon dans un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''il ressemble à du riz. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle, versez-y l''oignon et faites-le revenir pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et juste doré. Incorporer l''ail et faire revenir encore 1 minute. Versez le mélange dans un grand bol.","Mettez les champignons dans le robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''ils ressemblent également à du riz. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle, ajoutez les champignons et faites-les revenir pendant 10 à 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le liquide libéré se soit évaporé et que les champignons soient tendres. Versez dans le bol avec les oignons.","Mettez le tofu, la betterave rouge, les haricots, la purée de tomates, la mayonnaise, le miso, la farine et les graines de lin dans le robot culinaire avec un peu d''assaisonnement et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Grattez dans le bol avec les légumes. Ajoutez les pacanes et la moitié du riz au robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement hachées ou un peu plus grosses, si vous préférez. Verser dans le bol avec le mélange de légumes et de tofu, ainsi que le reste du riz.","Utilisez vos mains pour façonner le mélange en galettes à peu près de la même taille que vos pains à hamburger. Les galettes seront délicates, alors réfrigérez au moins 30 minutes avant la cuisson. Si vous souhaitez les faire griller, congelez-les d''abord pendant 30 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes.","Faites chauffer une poêle à feu moyen ou allumez le barbecue et badigeonnez les deux faces des galettes d''un peu d''huile. Cuire 5 à 8 minutes de chaque côté, en retournant une fois après la formation d''une croûte, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient carbonisés et chauds jusqu''au centre. Évitez de les déplacer ou de les retourner trop souvent, car ils seront plus délicats que les galettes de viande. Garnir de fromage, le cas échéant, pendant environ la dernière minute (voir le conseil ci-dessous). Faites griller les petits pains au barbecue ou à la poêle, puis tartinez chacun d''un peu de confiture de piment. Remplissez de quelques feuilles de laitue, des galettes et d''un peu d''avocat écrasé mélangé à un filet de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:10:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11368,4153,'fr','Tacos au poulet et au maïs doux','Servez ces tacos sains au poulet et au maïs doux pour un repas facile en milieu de semaine et plein de saveurs. Vous aurez également des restes pour préparer des wraps au poulet et au maïs doux pour le déjeuner de demain.','["250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 cuillères à soupe d''assaisonnement pour tacos ou fajita (voir conseil ci-dessous)","5-6 poitrines de poulet sans peau, tranchées","¼ de chou rouge, finement râpé","3 citrons verts, 1 en jus, 2 coupés en quartiers","un petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","4 épis de maïs doux, les grains tranchés ou 400 g de maïs doux surgelé","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt sans gras, pour servir","sauce chili, pour servir"]','["Mélangez la farine avec la moitié de l''huile et une petite pincée de sel dans un bol. Versez dessus 125-150 ml d''eau tiède, puis rassemblez en une pâte molle avec vos mains. Coupez en six morceaux égaux, puis coupez à nouveau quatre des morceaux en deux, vous obtenez ainsi huit petits morceaux et deux grands. Étalez tous les morceaux sur un plan de travail fariné jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient aussi fins que possible.","Faites chauffer une poêle sèche à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire les petites et grandes tortillas pendant 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et grillées (faites-le une à la fois). Laissez refroidir les grosses tortillas, puis couvrez et réservez pour les utiliser dans les lunchbox (voir astuce ci-dessous). Gardez les petites tortillas au chaud dans du papier d''aluminium.","Saupoudrer l''assaisonnement pour tacos sur le poulet dans un bol et mélanger. Mélangez le chou avec le jus de citron vert, la moitié de la coriandre et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un autre bol, puis laissez mariner.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer deux poêles à feu vif. Répartissez le reste de l''huile entre les poêles et faites frire le maïs doux avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille et devienne doré, en remuant de temps en temps. Vous voulez que le maïs doux carbonise légèrement, car cela ajoute de la saveur, vous devrez donc peut-être le laisser cuire un peu tranquillement. Pendant que le maïs cuit et carbonise, faites frire le poulet dans la plus grande poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit et doré (vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots).","Versez les haricots noirs et l''ail dans le maïs doux et remuez pour bien réchauffer. Pressez deux quartiers de citron vert.","Réservez deux cuillerées de poulet (environ 1 poitrine de poulet) et de mélange de maïs doux pour les utiliser dans les boîtes à lunch (voir conseil ci-dessous), puis servez le reste dans des bols avec le chou, le yaourt, les quartiers de citron vert, le reste de coriandre, la sauce chili et les tortillas pour que tout le monde puisse les déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:10:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11369,4155,'fr','Sauté de nouilles au porc et aux aubergines','Savourez ce sauté de porc et d''aubergines rapide et sain les soirs de semaine chargés. Cette recette pour deux vous donne également des restes pour réaliser des coupes de laitue au porc et aubergines pour le déjeuner du lendemain','["½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide","100 g de porc haché maigre","1 aubergine, coupée en petits cubes","2 nids de nouilles aux œufs moyennes (environ 100g)","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","½ cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","gros morceau de gingembre pelé et ½ râpé, ½ coupé en allumettes","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ -1 piment rouge, finement haché","botte d''oignons nouveaux, émincés finement","2 pak choi, feuilles séparées ou tranchées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok ou une poêle à frire à bords hauts et faites revenir le hachis pendant 5 à 8 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et commence à devenir croustillant sur les bords. Ajoutez l''aubergine et faites sauter encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre et translucide.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les. Mélangez la sauce soja, le vinaigre, la maïzena et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans un petit bol et réservez.","Ajoutez le gingembre râpé et les allumettes de gingembre, l''ail et le piment au hachis et faites sauter pendant une minute avant d''ajouter l''oignon nouveau et le pak choi. Faites sauter encore quelques minutes avant d''ajouter la sauce. Porter à ébullition et cuire jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe légèrement et recouvre l''aubergine. Versez la moitié du sauté dans un bol et laissez refroidir pour vos restes de porc et de laitue aubergine. (Voir le conseil ci-dessous.)","Mélangez les nouilles égouttées avec le reste du sauté dans le wok jusqu''à ce que les nouilles soient enrobées de sauce. Répartir dans des bols chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:10:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11370,4157,'fr','Omelette à la ricotta, brocoli et pommes de terre nouvelles','Réalisez cette frittata rapide et saine avec une salade de haricots en 30 minutes chrono. Aromatisé au brocoli et à la ricotta, vous aurez également des restes à déguster le lendemain','["100 g de pommes de terre nouvelles","200 g de brocoli à longues tiges","200 g de haricots verts parés et coupés en deux","Boîte de 400 g de haricots mélangés, égouttés","3 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","pincée de flocons de piment, de graines de cumin ou de graines de fenouil","4 gros œufs","50 g de gazon","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de Xérès","½ petit bouquet de basilic haché grossièrement (facultatif)"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Ajoutez le brocoli pour les 2 dernières minutes de cuisson. Égouttez et coupez les pommes de terre en tranches épaisses.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les haricots verts et le mélange de haricots dans une casserole et couvrez d''eau. Porter à ébullition et cuire 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les haricots verts soient tendres. Égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur dans la poêle.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive moyenne et faites revenir l''ail pendant 1 minute, puis ajoutez les flocons de piment ou les graines de cumin ou de fenouil et laissez cuire encore 1 minute. Ajouter les pommes de terre, le brocoli et l''assaisonnement, et mélanger pour les enrober d''huile aromatisée.","Battez les œufs dans un bol, assaisonnez et versez dessus le mélange de pommes de terre. Cuire à feu moyen pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la base soit prise. Versez une cuillère à café de ricotta sur le dessus, puis faites griller pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien cuite.","Pendant ce temps, versez encore 1 cuillère à café d''huile sur le mélange de haricots avec le vinaigre. Incorporer le basilic, si vous en utilisez, et assaisonner. Coupez la frittata en quatre quartiers et servez-en deux avec la moitié de la salade de haricots à part. Réfrigérez les quartiers restants et la salade de haricots pour les utiliser dans les boîtes à lunch ci-dessous."]','2026-01-11 00:10:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11371,4159,'fr','Risotto aux crevettes, pancetta et cresson','Préparez notre risotto aux crevettes, à la pancetta et au cresson les soirs de semaine chargés lorsque vous avez besoin de quelque chose de rapide. Vous aurez également des restes pour le déjeuner du lendemain','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus 1 cuillère à café","3 tranches de pancetta","1 gros oignon, finement haché","200 g de riz pour risotto","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1l de bouillon de légumes chaud","200 g de cresson, tiges hachées","25 g de parmesan finement râpé, plus un peu pour servir","½ citron, zesté et pressé","180 g de gambas crues, décortiquées et déveinées"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir la pancetta 2 minutes de chaque côté. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant, puis émietter. Faites revenir l''oignon dans la même poêle pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.","Incorporer le riz et l''ail pendant 2 minutes pour bien les enrober d''huile. Ajouter la moitié du bouillon, porter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à absorption. Ajouter le reste du bouillon, une louche à la fois, en remuant constamment jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre, environ 20 minutes.","Incorporer la majeure partie du cresson et du parmesan. Assaisonnez bien. Ajoutez le zeste de citron et un filet de jus.","Versez la moitié du risotto dans une assiette (à utiliser pour le déjeuner du lendemain, voir astuce ci-dessous). Ajouter les crevettes dans la poêle et cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient roses. Mélangez le reste du cresson avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile et le jus de citron. Servir sur le risotto avec un peu de pancetta et de parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:10:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11372,4163,'fr','Orzo de chou-fleur grillé, citron et câpres','Préparez ce plat d''orzo et de chou-fleur facile en seulement 25 minutes. Il en sert un pour un repas principal, et il y a des restes à déguster pour le déjeuner du lendemain.','["½ chou-fleur cassé en bouquets, tige coupée en cubes","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","100 g d''orzo","2 cuillères à café de câpres, égouttées et rincées","1 petite gousse d''ail, tranchée","½ citron, zesté et pressé","100 ml de bouillon de légumes faible en sel (vérifiez qu''il est végétalien, si nécessaire)","une poignée de feuilles de roquette, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Mélangez le chou-fleur avec la moitié de l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement. Versez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites griller pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, carbonisés et tendres.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire l''orzo dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit al dente. Vidange.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle et faites grésiller les câpres et l''ail jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporer l''orzo, le chou-fleur, le zeste et le jus de citron ainsi que le bouillon. Faire bouillir pendant 1 min, puis en verser la moitié dans un bol et garnir de roquette. Laissez les restes refroidir pour la boîte à lunch, voir le conseil ci-dessous."]','2026-01-11 00:10:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11373,4165,'fr','Lanières de poulet croustillantes','Servez ces bouchées de poulet croustillantes pour toute la famille avec une salade de carottes, une sauce tomate et une pomme de terre au four. Utilisez de la chapelure panko si vous le pouvez, car elle est plus grosse et plus croustillante.','["150 ml de babeurre ou de lait écrémé mélangé à 2 cuillères à café de jus de citron puis laissé reposer 5 minutes","2 grosses poitrines de poulet sans peau ou 4 petits morceaux d''escalope de porc","50 g de chapelure panko","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 cuillères à soupe de ketchup","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja","½ cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin blanc","2 grosses ou 4 petites carottes (environ 300g), pelées et râpées","½ citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","pommes de terre au four, pour servir"]','["Versez le babeurre dans un bol large et peu profond. Coupez chaque poitrine de poulet en deux horizontalement et séchez-la avec du papier absorbant. Retournez-les dans le babeurre, laissez-les dans le plat et réservez au frais 1 h. Pendant ce temps, pour la salade, mélangez la carotte avec le jus de citron et l''huile d''olive. Mélangez les ingrédients de la sauce dans un autre bol et réservez les deux.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive, versez-y la chapelure et faites-la griller dans la poêle sèche pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement dorée, en remuant régulièrement pour qu''elle ne brûle pas. Versez dans un bol et brisez les gros grumeaux.","Chauffer le four à 230°C/210°C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Versez la chapelure sur une grande assiette, puis retirez les poitrines de poulet du babeurre et roulez-les dans la chapelure, en vous assurant qu''elles sont bien enrobées.","Faites chauffer ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive. Faites frire le poulet pendant 1 à 2 minutes à feu moyen-vif, puis retournez-le, ajoutez le reste de l''huile et faites revenir encore 1 minute.","Transférez le poulet sur une plaque à pâtisserie et enfournez 5 minutes, puis laissez reposer 5 minutes et coupez-le en lanières. Servir le poulet et la salade de carottes avec la sauce et les pommes de terre au four."]','2026-01-11 00:10:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11374,4167,'fr','Ratatouille facile','Un bol de cette ratatouille végétarienne réchauffante et saine fournit tous vos cinq par jour et regorge de saveurs. Servir avec des pâtes ou du pain frais','["2 aubergines","3 courgettes moyennes","2 poivrons rouges","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, coupé finement","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché, de basilic ou d''herbes italiennes mélangées","petit bouquet de basilic haché, plus quelques feuilles pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1-2 cuillères à soupe de sucre"]','["Coupez l''aubergine, la courgette et le poivron en morceaux de 3 cm. Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande cocotte ou une poêle à frire à feu moyen. Faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et translucide. Ajoutez les légumes hachés, augmentez le feu et faites frire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis.","Incorporer l''ail dans la poêle et mélanger le tout en faisant frire encore 1 minute. Ajoutez les tomates concassées, une demi-boîte d''eau (200 ml), les herbes séchées et le basilic haché. Laisser mijoter 20 minutes à feu moyen, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres et que les tomates soient épaisses et enrobent les légumes. Assaisonnez et ajoutez le vinaigre et le sucre pour équilibrer la douceur et l''acidité des tomates. Parsemer de feuilles de basilic et servir avec du pain rustique ou des pâtes."]','2026-01-11 00:10:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11375,4169,'fr','Pizza aux tortillas','Besoin d''un souper rapide pour deux, prêt en un éclair ? Utilisez toutes vos garnitures préférées sur cette pizza tortilla facile, avec beaucoup de mozzarella fondue','["4 cuillères à soupe passées","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ cuillère à café d''herbes séchées (un mélange d''herbes, le basilic ou l''origan fonctionnent bien)","2 tortillas nature","50 g de mozzarella râpée","6-8 tranches de pepperoni","6-8 tranches de jalapeño marinées"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Mélanger la passata, l''ail, l''huile d''olive, les herbes et bien assaisonner. Disposez les tortillas sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie ou deux plus petites. Étaler sur la sauce tomate en laissant une bordure de 1 cm sur les bords. Parsemer de mozzarella, ajouter le pepperoni et les jalapeños. Cuire au four pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords des tortillas soient croustillants et dorés et que le fromage soit fondu et bouillonne."]','2026-01-11 00:10:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11376,4175,'fr','Oeufs au four aux haricots en sauce','Préparez ces œufs au four à cinq ingrédients avec des tomates et des haricots en utilisant des produits de base de placard. C''est un plat rapide, facile, savoureux et sain','["2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates cerises","Boîte de 400 g de salade de haricots mélangés, égouttée","200 g de bébés épinards","4 œufs moyens","50 g de jambon fumé émincé, déchiré","pain de seigle complet, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Versez la salade de tomates et de haricots dans une poêle allant au four ou une cocotte peu profonde et ignifuge. Laisser mijoter 10 minutes ou jusqu''à réduction. Incorporer les épinards et cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés.","Chauffer le gril à feu moyen. Faites quatre empreintes dans le mélange à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère, puis cassez un œuf dans chacune. Incorporez le jambon dans le mélange, puis faites griller pendant 4 à 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les blancs soient pris et les jaunes coulants. Servir avec du pain de seigle, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11377,4177,'fr','Frites marinara aux boulettes de viande','Garnissez les frites cuites au four de marinara aux boulettes de viande pour un plateau à partager qui plaira à tous. Idéal pour une soirée entre amis','["300 g de frites surgelées","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ oignon finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","½ cuillère à soupe de sucre","150 g de boulettes de bœuf","40 g de mozzarella râpée","40 g de cheddar râpé"]','["Faites cuire les frites en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 min. Ajoutez l''ail et les flocons de piment et faites revenir encore 5 minutes. Ajoutez les tomates, l''origan et le sucre, puis laissez mijoter 10 minutes.","Dans une autre poêle, faites revenir les boulettes de bœuf pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, puis ajoutez-les à la sauce et faites bouillonner pendant 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites. Mettez les frites dans un plat résistant à la chaleur et garnissez de boulettes de viande et de sauce. Répartir sur la mozzarella et le cheddar. Griller pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu. Assaisonner et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11378,4179,'fr','Nouilles Singapour faciles','Répondez à toute la famille avec nos nouilles de Singapour. Ils sont sains et végétaliens et constituent un accompagnement idéal à un repas chinois ou tout simplement seuls.','["200 g de nouilles de riz vermicelles","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry doux","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","2½ cuillères à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","1 oignon, tranché","1 poivron, tranché (nous avons utilisé ½ vert et ½ orange)","200 g de germes de soja","1 piment rouge, tranché (facultatif)"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire et mettez les nouilles dans une grande casserole ou un bol. Versez suffisamment d''eau bouillie pour couvrir, en poussant les nouilles sous l''eau pour les aider à ramollir uniformément. Laisser reposer 5 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les nouilles soient complètement tendres. Mélangez la poudre de curry, le curcuma, le sucre, l''huile de sésame, la sauce soja et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau dans un bol.","Faites chauffer le wok jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Ajouter l''huile de tournesol, l''oignon et le poivre. Faire sauter pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et commencent à dorer par endroits. Égouttez les nouilles et ajoutez-les à la poêle, avec le mélange de sauce et les germes de soja. Faites sauter encore 3 à 4 minutes, en mélangeant le tout avec la sauce, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud. Ajustez l''assaisonnement avec un peu plus de soja ou de sucre, si vous le souhaitez, et répartissez-le sur le piment, si vous aimez plus d''épices."]','2026-01-11 00:10:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11379,4181,'fr','Salade Cobb de Dinde','Savourez cette salade Cobb de dinde comme plateau de fête sain pour utiliser les restes de Noël. Il regorge de saveurs vibrantes comme la pancetta, l''avocat, les œufs, la chicorée et les tomates.','["6 gros œufs","50 g (environ 7) de fines tranches de pancetta","50 ml d''huile de colza","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","1⁄2 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","1 cuillère à soupe de persil finement haché","1 petite gousse d''ail, finement râpée","500 g de poitrine de dinde cuite, tranchée","3 têtes de chicorée mélangées, feuilles séparées","2 avocats moyens, pelés, dénoyautés et tranchés","4 tomates moyennes, coupées en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe de graines mélangées"]','["Faites cuire les œufs dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 8 minutes. Égoutter, transférer dans un bol d''eau froide et laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Mettez la pancetta sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier d''aluminium et faites-la griller pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit croustillante. Tapotez avec du papier absorbant pour éliminer tout excès d''huile et laissez refroidir.","Fouetter ensemble l''huile, le vinaigre, la moutarde, le persil et l''ail. Épluchez et coupez les œufs en deux.","Disposer la dinde, la chicorée, l''avocat, les tomates, la pancetta et les œufs sur une grande assiette. Arrosez de vinaigrette, assaisonnez et servez avec les graines à côté pour saupoudrer."]','2026-01-11 00:10:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11380,4183,'fr','Ragoût de poulet crémeux','Cuisinez ce ragoût crémeux et réconfortant et servez-le avec nos pommes de terre mini-vestes écrasées. Ce one-pot réchauffant avec du poulet, des petits pois et des poireaux est parfait pour un repas spécial en famille','["3 poireaux, coupés en deux et finement tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu si nécessaire","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","8 petites cuisses de poulet","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","75g crème fraîche","200 g de petits pois surgelés","3 cuillères à soupe de chapelure séchée ou fraîche","petit bouquet de persil finement haché"]','["Versez les poireaux et l''huile dans une cocotte anti-flamme sur feu doux, ajoutez le beurre et faites cuire le tout très doucement pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les poireaux soient tendres.","Mettez le poulet, peau vers le bas, dans une grande poêle antiadhésive sur feu moyen, faites cuire jusqu''à ce que la peau soit dorée, puis retournez et faites dorer l''autre côté. Vous ne devriez pas avoir besoin d’huile, mais si la peau commence à coller, ajoutez-en un peu. Ajoutez le poulet aux poireaux en laissant le gras dans la poêle.","Ajoutez le bouillon dans le plat et portez à ébullition, assaisonnez bien, couvrez et laissez cuire 30 minutes à feu doux. Incorporer la moutarde, la crème fraîche et les petits pois et porter à ébullition. Vous devriez avoir un peu de sauce.","Au moment de servir, allumez le grill. Mélangez la chapelure et le persil, saupoudrez-les sur le poulet et faites-le griller jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré."]','2026-01-11 00:10:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11381,4187,'fr','Risotto aux épinards et à l''orge','Ce plat crémeux utilise une boîte d''orge pour réduire le temps de cuisson à seulement 25 minutes. Il s''agit d''une option de dîner saine et faible en calories qui fournit trois de vos 5 par jour','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 gros poireau (315 g), tranché finement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 boîtes de 400 g d''orge non égouttée","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon de légumes","1 cuillère à café de sauge finement hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym","160 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","160g d''épinards","50 g de fromage à pâte dure végétarien à l''italienne finement râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir le poireau et l''ail pendant 5 à 10 minutes, en remuant fréquemment, jusqu''à ce qu''ils ramollissent, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si ça colle.","Versez les boîtes d''orge et leur liquide, puis incorporez la poudre de bouillon, la sauge et le thym. Laisser mijoter en remuant fréquemment pendant 4 à 5 minutes. Ajouter les tomates et les épinards et cuire encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire. Incorporer la majeure partie du fromage, puis servir avec le reste du fromage parsemé."]','2026-01-11 00:10:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11382,4189,'fr','Tortilla de haricots noirs avec salsa','Préparez cette frittata pour une option de déjeuner rapide, facile et saine, en tirant le meilleur parti des ingrédients du placard et en la préparant en trois sur vos 5 par jour.','["Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 oignon, finement haché","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux, épépiné et finement haché","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","15 g (½ paquet) de coriandre finement hachée","6 olives Kalamata, tranchées finement","½ citron ou citron vert, jus","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","3 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","6 gros œufs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","4 généreuses poignées de roquette"]','["Versez les tomates dans une poêle et incorporez l''oignon, la moitié du piment et le paprika fumé. Cuire à feu doux pendant 10 min. Versez les ¾ dans un bol, puis incorporez 2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre, les olives et le jus de citron.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le gril. Versez les haricots dans un bol et incorporez le reste du piment, l''ail, le cumin et la coriandre. Incorporer les œufs, puis ajouter le quart de salsa réservé et le reste de coriandre fraîche avec un peu de sel au goût. Mixez un peu à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant ou écrasez une partie des haricots avec un presse-purée.","Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive de 24 cm avec l''huile. Versez le mélange de haricots et laissez cuire doucement 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que la base soit prise, puis faites griller 5 minutes. Démoulez et coupez en 4 quartiers. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, servez deux parts avec la moitié de la salsa restante et la roquette. Mettez le reste au frais pour le lendemain."]','2026-01-11 00:10:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11383,4191,'fr','Chaudrée de maïs et de pois cassés','Cuisinez cette soupe végétalienne saine et emballez-en quatre de vos 5 par jour avec des sachets de saveurs de gingembre, de piments, d''ail, de thym et de yaourt à la noix de coco.','["200 g de pois cassés jaunes secs","3 branches de céleri (environ 160 g), tranchés","1 brin de thym et 1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym","2 oignons, coupés en deux et tranchés (350g)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","50 g de gingembre finement râpé","2 piments rouges épépinés et tranchés","3 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées","1 gros poivron vert, coupé en petits morceaux","1 grosse pomme de terre (environ 215 g), non pelée, coupée en morceaux de 1 à 2 cm","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de bouillon de légumes","320 g de maïs doux surgelé","150 g de yaourt à la noix de coco sans produits laitiers"]','["Versez les pois cassés, le céleri et la branche de thym dans une casserole moyenne avec 1 litre d''eau bouillante, portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter à couvert pendant 25 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites revenir l''oignon dans l''huile dans une grande poêle pendant 10 minutes. Incorporer le gingembre, le piment et l''ail. Ajoutez le poivre et la pomme de terre, puis versez ½ litre d''eau bouillante avec le bouillon et le thym restant. Versez le mélange de pois cassés et le maïs, portez à ébullition, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres.","Retirez un tiers des légumes, puis mixez le reste dans la poêle à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant. Remettez les légumes dans la poêle avec le yaourt et remuez bien. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, mangez deux portions maintenant, laissez refroidir puis réfrigérez le reste pour un autre jour. Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:10:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11384,4193,'fr','Salade feta, betterave rouge et grenade','Savourez quelque chose de plus léger pour le déjeuner avec cette salade lumineuse. C''est peu calorique et plein de saveur grâce à la menthe, le persil, la cannelle et le cumin','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade","pincée de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin, grillées","un filet de jus de citron","une poignée de persil finement haché","une poignée de feuilles de menthe déchirées","2 betteraves cuites, coupées en fins quartiers","30 g de feta émiettée","poignée de feuilles de roquette","½ laitue romaine, déchirée en bouchées","20g de graines de grenade"]','["Fouetter l''huile, la mélasse de grenade, la cannelle, les graines de cumin et le jus de citron dans un bol. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour détendre et assaisonnez.","Incorporer les herbes, la betterave rouge, la feta, la roquette et la laitue, et mélanger pour bien enrober de vinaigrette. Saupoudrer de graines de grenade pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11385,4195,'fr','Tinga au poulet chipotle','Servez ce poulet au piment avec notre salsa aux tomates, nos chips tortilla, notre guacamole et notre coriandre pour un repas facile en milieu de semaine.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, tranchés","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","2-3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de piment chipotle","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","6 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","3 tomates mûres, hachées finement","1 citron vert, zesté et pressé","1 petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles et tiges finement hachées, plus des feuilles supplémentaires pour servir","chips tortilla et guacamole, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l’huile dans une grande cocotte ou une casserole antiadhésive ignifuge. Faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez l''ail et faites revenir encore 1 min. Versez la pâte de chipotle, les tomates et le sucre avec une demi-boîte d''eau. Disposez les cuisses de poulet dans la sauce. Porter à ébullition douce et cuire à couvert pendant 20 à 25 minutes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait légèrement réduit et que le poulet soit bien cuit.","À l''aide de deux fourchettes, effilochez le poulet et remuez-le dans la sauce. Assaisonner au goût. Si la sauce est trop fine, remettre sur le feu et laisser mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait encore réduit. Pour congeler, laisser refroidir complètement et transférer dans de grands sacs allant au congélateur.","Pour faire la salsa, mélanger l''oignon rouge, les tomates, le zeste et le jus de citron vert, les feuilles et les tiges de coriandre. Assaisonner au goût. Servir le poulet avec la salsa aux tomates, les chips tortilla, le guacamole et un peu de feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:10:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11386,4197,'fr','Soupe tajine de pois chiches','Découvrez les saveurs rustiques du tajine dans une soupe. Remplie de pois chiches, de poivrons et de chou frisé ainsi que d''abricots pour la douceur, cette soupe satisfaisante est super saine','["2 poivrons rouges","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon rouge, tranché finement","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de harissa à la rose","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","1½ l de bouillon de légumes faible en sel","150 g de chou frisé haché","1 citron, zesté et pressé","50 g d''abricots secs finement hachés","1⁄2 petit bouquet de persil finement haché","yaourt nature sans gras, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffez le gril à son réglage le plus élevé. Coupez les poivrons en deux et épépinez-les, puis déposez-les, côté coupé vers le bas, sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier d''aluminium. Griller pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cloqué et ramolli. Laisser refroidir suffisamment pour être manipulé, puis retirer et jeter les peaux. Coupez les poivrons rôtis en fines lanières.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu doux. Faites revenir l''oignon pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Incorporer l''ail, la coriandre, le cumin et la pâte d''harissa et cuire encore 1 min. Ajouter les pois chiches et le bouillon, porter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 15 minutes à couvert.","Incorporer les poivrons à la soupe avec le chou frisé, le zeste et le jus de citron et les abricots et cuire à couvert pendant encore 5 minutes. Versez la soupe dans des bols et servez avec du persil haché parsemé et une cuillerée de yaourt, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11387,4199,'fr','Okonomiyaki végétarien','Boostez votre alimentation avec cet okonomiyaki végétarien avec des œufs, du chou, du pak choi et des oignons nouveaux. C''est une option de déjeuner saine et faible en calories','["3 gros œufs","50g de farine nature","50 ml de lait","4 oignons nouveaux, parés et tranchés","1 pak choi, tranché","200 g de chou de Milan, râpé","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché, plus un peu pour servir","½ cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de mayonnaise faible en gras","½ citron vert, jus","sushi gingembre, pour servir (facultatif)","wasabi, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Fouetter ensemble les œufs, la farine et le lait jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajouter la moitié des oignons nouveaux, le pak choi, le chou, le piment et la sauce soja. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une petite poêle et versez la pâte. Cuire à couvert à feu moyen pendant 7 à 8 minutes. Retournez l''okonomiyaki dans une deuxième poêle, puis remettez-le sur le feu et laissez cuire encore 7 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré dedans en ressorte propre.","Mélangez la mayonnaise et le jus de citron vert dans un petit bol. Transférer l''okonomiyaki dans une assiette, puis arroser de mayonnaise au citron vert et garnir de piment supplémentaire, d''oignon nouveau et de gingembre à sushi, le cas échéant. Servir avec le wasabi à part, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11388,4201,'fr','Latkes de betterave','Faites de la betterave l''ingrédient vedette avec ces latkes sains qui fournissent trois de vos 5 par jour. La racine violette regorge de vitamine C et de folate','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec sans gras","½ petit bouquet de feuilles de menthe, hachées finement","150 g de feuilles de roquette mélangées","130 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","400 g de betterave crue, pelée, parée et grossièrement râpée","1 gros oeuf, battu","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","1 grosse gousse d''ail, râpée","1 cuillère à café de graines de carvi","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 citron, zesté"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Préparez les latkes en mélangeant tous les ingrédients.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Verser le mélange pour faire six latkes ronds. Faites frire 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté, puis transférez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et enfournez pendant 10 minutes.","Mélangez le yaourt et la menthe dans un petit bol. Mélangez les feuilles de salade et les tomates, puis servez les latkes avec le yaourt à la menthe et la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:10:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11389,4203,'fr','Rouleaux de saucisses à l''harissa et à l''agneau','Pimentez vos rouleaux de saucisses avec les saveurs de harissa, d''herbes et d''épices. C''est un aliment de pique-nique parfait pour l''été et un gagnant lorsque vous nourrissez une foule.','["600 g de viande hachée d''agneau","2 cuillères à soupe d''harissa du commerce, ou utilisez-la maison (voir notre recette)","¼ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1⁄2 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1⁄2 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","1 gousse d''ail, râpée","1 citron confit, le zeste finement haché (jeter la chair)","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","325 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","1 gros œuf, légèrement battu","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame noir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger l''agneau, la harissa (voir notre recette), les épices, la coriandre, l''ail, le citron confit et l''assaisonnement dans un bol. Frappez-le avec vos mains pour vous assurer qu’il est bien combiné.","Saupoudrez légèrement votre plan de travail de farine et déposez la pâte feuilletée dessus. Coupez-le au milieu dans le sens de la longueur, puis roulez chaque morceau avec un rouleau à pâtisserie pour que chaque morceau mesure environ 14 x 42 cm.","Divisez le mélange d''agneau en quatre et roulez chacun en forme de saucisse avec vos mains. Disposez-en deux bout à bout sur l''un des morceaux de pâte. Badigeonnez d''un peu d''œuf le long d''un des côtés longs de la pâte, juste au bord. Tirez l’autre côté pour envelopper les formes de saucisses et pressez les côtés ensemble. Faites de même avec le reste de la viande et de la pâte.","Coupez chaque feuille de pâte en quatre. Transférez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis badigeonnez chaque rouleau de saucisse avec l''œuf et saupoudrez de graines de sésame, le cas échéant. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit gonflée et dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:10:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11390,4205,'fr','Tomate, poivron et haricot dans un pot','Préparez un lot de ce ragoût le week-end, puis réfrigérez-le ou congelez-le en portions pour des déjeuners faciles en milieu de semaine. Voir nos différentes garnitures pour que cela reste intéressant','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, finement haché","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","3 carottes, hachées finement","3 poivrons rouges, tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de haricots cannellini rincés et égouttés","400 g de haricots pinto, rincés et égouttés","400 g de haricots borlotti, rincés et égouttés","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cube de bouillon de légumes (vérifiez l''étiquette si vous êtes végétalien)","2 feuilles de laurier","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade","½ cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou une cocotte à feu moyen. Faites revenir l''oignon, le céleri et les carottes pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés, puis ajoutez les poivrons et faites revenir encore 5 minutes.","Incorporez l''ail pendant une minute, puis ajoutez le concentré de tomates, tous les haricots et les tomates hachées, puis remuez les boîtes de tomates avec un peu d''eau et ajoutez-les dans la poêle avec le cube de bouillon, les feuilles de laurier, le sucre et le vinaigre. Assaisonner et laisser mijoter à découvert pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce réduise pour enrober les haricots et que les poivrons soient tendres. Laisser refroidir avant de stocker dans des contenants transportables. Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant 3 à 4 jours ou se congèle en portions et décongele au réfrigérateur pendant la nuit. Choisissez vos garnituresSucré et épicéAjoutez des dés d''abricots secs et 1 cuillère à soupe d''harissa. Garnir de yogourt mélangé à davantage d''harissa et d''amandes effilées grillées.Tex-MexIncorporer ½ à 1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle, les restes de poulet rôti râpés si vous en avez, et garnir de dés d''avocat, de cheddar râpé et de coriandre.Haricots BBQ fumésIncorporer 1 cuillère à soupe de sauce BBQ fumée et émietter sur du bacon croustillant du commerce, une cuillerée de crème sure ou de yogourt et un peu herbes hachées.Verts ajoutésIncorporer quelques épinards et garnir d''un œuf à la coque tranché.Haricots sur du pain grilléServir les haricots sur du pain grillé ou du pain, ajouter une pincée de Tabasco ou de flocons de piment, émietter sur la feta et arroser d''huile d''olive.Inspiré italienGarnir avec des croûtons grillés, du romarin haché, du zeste de citron et du parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:10:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11391,4207,'fr','Salade miso brocoli, oeuf & quinoa','Préparez un déjeuner qui vous accompagnera tout au long de l''après-midi avec cette salade saine au miso et au citron vert avec du brocoli, des pois, un œuf à la coque et des radis. C''est savoureux et plein de bonté','["100 g de pointes de brocoli à tige fine","1 œuf moyen","2 cuillères à café de pâte miso blanche","1 citron vert, jus","125 g de quinoa cuit","70 g de petits pois surgelés, décongelés","3 radis, tranchés finement","½ cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame"]','["Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition. Ajouter le brocoli et cuire 3 minutes, puis retirer avec une écumoire et laisser refroidir. Plongez l''œuf dans l''eau et laissez mijoter doucement pendant 6 minutes. Égoutter et mettre dans un bol d’eau froide pour refroidir.","Fouetter le miso et le jus de citron vert dans un petit bol, puis mélanger avec le quinoa, les pois, les radis et le brocoli cuit. Versez la salade dans votre boîte à lunch ou dans un récipient hermétique. Épluchez l''œuf, coupez-le en deux et disposez-le sur le quinoa, puis saupoudrez de graines de sésame."]','2026-01-11 00:10:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11392,4209,'fr','Pot de mangue et pois chiches au curry','Préparez cette salade épicée à la mangue, au chou rouge, aux épinards et aux pois chiches comme panier-repas rapide pour une personne. Ce n''est pas seulement savoureux, mais aussi sain, fournissant trois de vos 5 par jour','["200 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec sans gras","½ citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de pâte de curry korma","½ carotte, en julienne ou râpée","70 g de chou rouge émincé","50 g de pousses d''épinards, émincées","40 g de mangue coupée en petits dés","½ cuillère à café de graines de nigelle","½ petit piment rouge finement tranché (épépiné si vous voulez moins de piquant)"]','["Mélangez les pois chiches, le yaourt, le citron et la pâte de korma dans un bol, puis mélangez avec la carotte, le chou, les épinards et la mangue. Versez dans votre lunchbox ou dans un récipient hermétique et parsemez de graines de nigelle et de piment rouge."]','2026-01-11 00:10:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11393,4213,'fr','Tilapia piri-piri au four avec pommes de terre écrasées','Un plat de poisson sain, faible en gras et en calories, débordant de saveur et riche en fibres, folate, fer et vitamine C.','["600 g de petites pommes de terre nouvelles","2 poivrons rouges, coupés en gros morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","un filet d''huile d''olive extra vierge","4 gros morceaux de tilapia ou de morue","salade verte, pour servir","6 piments forts marinés (j''ai utilisé du Peppadew)","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 gousses d''ail","le jus et le zeste d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Faire bouillir les pommes de terre jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres au couteau, puis égoutter. Étalez sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie et écrasez délicatement avec le dos d''une spatule. Ajouter les poivrons, arroser de vinaigre et d''huile, bien assaisonner et rôtir 25 minutes.","Mettez les ingrédients du piri-piri dans un robot culinaire avec un peu de sel. Réduire en purée fine, puis verser dans un bol. Mettez le poisson sur une plaque à pâtisserie et versez-y un peu de sauce piri-piri. Assaisonner et enfourner pour les 10 dernières minutes de cuisson des pommes de terre. Servir le tout avec la sauce supplémentaire et une salade verte en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:10:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11394,4215,'fr','Rouleaux de maki au maquereau fumé','Préparez vos propres sushis pour un déjeuner faible en calories que vous pourrez emporter au travail. Faites l''envie du bureau avec ces rouleaux de maquereau et de légumes, n''oubliez pas la sauce soja !','["150 g de riz à sushi","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin de riz","4 feuilles de nori","1 piment rouge épépiné et coupé en allumettes","½ carotte pelée et coupée en allumettes","¼ de concombre, coupé en allumettes","100 g de maquereau fumé, sans peau, déchiré en petits morceaux","sauce soja, pour tremper"]','["Mettez le riz dans un petit bol, couvrez d''eau froide et massez les grains avec vos mains pour éliminer l''amidon. Égouttez et répétez le processus jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire.","Mettez le riz dans une petite casserole avec un couvercle hermétique. Couvrez de 2,5 cm d''eau froide, mettez le couvercle et laissez mijoter à feu moyen pendant 10 min. Retirez du feu et laissez cuire encore 15 minutes, couvercle fermé. Incorporer le vinaigre, puis laisser refroidir complètement.","Remplissez un petit bol d''eau froide et disposez un tapis à sushi (environ 1 £ dans n''importe quel grand supermarché). Placez une feuille de nori, côté brillant vers le bas, sur le tapis à sushi. Étalez un quart du riz sur le nori en laissant une bordure de 1 cm en haut.","Mettez un quart du piment et de la carotte en ligne au fond du riz. Placer un quart du concombre et du maquereau en bande au centre.","Humidifiez la bordure supérieure avec un peu d''eau pour aider à sceller le rouleau. Repliez le bord inférieur de l''algue sur la première ligne de la garniture, puis utilisez le tapis à sushi pour enrouler le maki. Répétez l’opération pour faire quatre rouleaux. À l''aide d''un couteau dentelé, coupez chaque rouleau en huit rondelles. Servir avec de la sauce soja pour tremper. Vous voulez un peu d''aide avec cette recette ? Regardez notre vidéo comment faire des sushis."]','2026-01-11 00:10:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11395,4217,'fr','Frittata d''asperges et de pommes de terre nouvelles','Un plat printanier simple et faible en calories qui utilise les meilleurs ingrédients de la saison et est prêt en seulement 20 minutes','["200 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en quartiers","100 g de pointes d''asperges","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","6 œufs battus","40 g de cheddar râpé","roquette ou feuilles mélangées, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Mettez les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau froide salée et portez à ébullition. Une fois à ébullition, cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient presque tendres, puis ajouter les asperges pendant 1 minute finale. Vidange.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle allant au four et ajoutez l''oignon. Cuire environ 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Mélangez les œufs avec la moitié du fromage dans un pichet et assaisonnez bien. Versez l''oignon dans la poêle, puis répartissez-le sur les asperges et les pommes de terre. Garnir du reste du fromage et mettre sous le gril pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bien cuit. Couper en quartiers et servir dans la poêle avec de la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:10:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11396,4219,'fr','Aubergines au miso','Une recette d''aubergines très simple, faible en gras et en calories, aux délicieuses saveurs umami. Ce plat est si riche et charnu qu''il est difficile de croire qu''il est végétalien !','["2 petites aubergines, coupées en deux","huile végétale, pour rôtir et frire","50 g de miso brun","100 g de couscous géant","1 piment rouge, tranché finement","½ petit paquet de coriandre, feuilles hachées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. A l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, entrecroisez la chair des aubergines en diagonale, puis disposez-la sur une plaque allant au four. Badigeonner la chair d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale.","Mélangez le miso avec 25 ml d''eau pour obtenir une pâte épaisse. Étalez la pâte sur les aubergines, puis couvrez la plaque de papier d''aluminium et faites rôtir au centre du four pendant 30 minutes.","Retirez le papier d''aluminium et faites rôtir les aubergines encore 15 à 20 minutes, selon leur taille, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition une casserole d''eau salée et faites chauffer 1/2 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale à feu moyen-vif dans une poêle. Ajoutez le couscous dans la poêle, faites-le griller pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, puis versez-le dans la casserole d''eau bouillante et faites cuire pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre (ou suivez les instructions sur l''emballage). Bien égoutter. Servir les aubergines avec le couscous, garni de piment et d''un peu de feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:10:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11397,4221,'fr','Tacos au poulet chipotle avec salsa à l''ananas','Un poulet épicé et fumé garni de tortillas moelleuses, ce dîner gourmand et faible en calories est sur la table en seulement 20 minutes.','["500 g de cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon moyen, haché","2 cuillères à café de paprika doux fumé","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","200 ml en purée","2 cuillères à soupe de cassonade molle","½ petit ananas, épépiné, pelé et haché","½ petit paquet de coriandre hachée","tortillas de maïs ou de farine","sauce piquante (j''aime Tabasco Chipotle), pour servir"]','["Dans un robot culinaire, mixez grossièrement les cuisses de poulet en gros morceaux. Vous pouvez également le couper en bouchées.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez la moitié de l''oignon et le poulet haché. Bien assaisonner et cuire environ 5 minutes à feu vif pour dorer en brisant la viande avec une cuillère. Ajouter les épices, le vinaigre, la pâte chipotle, la passata et le sucre. Cuire encore 5 minutes, puis retirer du feu.","Dans un petit bol, mélangez le reste de l''oignon, l''ananas et la coriandre. Servir le poulet et la salsa à l''ananas avec des tortillas chaudes et de la sauce piquante."]','2026-01-11 00:10:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11398,4223,'fr','Ragoût de poisson simple','Ce one-pot rapide et sain contient des filets de poisson blanc, des gambas, une riche sauce tomate et suffisamment de légumes pour 3 de vos 5 par jour.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","2 carottes, coupées en dés","2 branches de céleri, coupées en dés","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 poireaux, tranchés finement","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","500 ml de bouillon de poisson chaud","2 filets de goberge sans peau (environ 200 g), décongelés s''ils sont congelés et coupés en morceaux","85 g de gambas crues décortiquées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez les graines de fenouil, les carottes, le céleri et l''ail et faites cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez les poireaux, les tomates et le bouillon, assaisonnez et portez à ébullition, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres et que la sauce ait épaissi et légèrement réduite.","Ajouter le poisson, répartir sur les crevettes et cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement cuites. Verser dans des bols et servir avec une cuillère."]','2026-01-11 00:10:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11399,4227,'fr','Salade tiède de chorizo ​​et pois chiches','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Pleine de saveurs audacieuses comme le chorizo, les tomates séchées et l''oignon rouge, cette salade est agrémentée de pois chiches pour en donner 3 sur 5 par jour.','["280 g de chorizo ​​à cuire tranché","1 gros oignon rouge, finement tranché","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en lanières","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","12 tomates mi-séchées","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","Sachet de 100g de roquette, pour servir"]','["Dans une grande poêle, faites revenir le chorizo ​​à sec jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré pendant environ 10 minutes, puis utilisez une écumoire pour le retirer de la poêle et réservez.","Ajouter l''oignon et les poivrons dans la poêle et les attendrir dans la graisse de chorizo ​​pendant 10 min. Incorporer les pois chiches et les tomates en réchauffant.","Versez le vinaigre de vin rouge et assaisonnez. Servir dans des bols avec des poignées de roquette dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:10:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11400,4229,'fr','Salade asiatique au poulet effiloché','Séparez un poulet rôti pour préparer ce plat sain, vibrant et faible en calories en seulement 20 minutes.','["1 petit poulet rôti d''environ 1 kg","½ chou rouge, épépiné et tranché finement","3 carottes, râpées grossièrement ou finement râpées","5 oignons nouveaux, finement tranchés en diagonale","2 piments rouges, coupés en deux et tranchés finement","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement, tiges incluses","2 cuillères à soupe bombées de cacahuètes grillées et salées, grossièrement concassées","3½ cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame grillé"]','["Mélanger les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un petit bol et réserver.","Retirez toute la viande du poulet, coupez-la en gros morceaux et mettez-la dans un grand bol. Ajoutez le chou, les carottes, les oignons nouveaux, les piments et la moitié de la coriandre. Mélanger avec la vinaigrette et empiler sur une assiette de service, puis parsemer du reste de coriandre et de cacahuètes."]','2026-01-11 00:10:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11401,4231,'fr','Cacciatore de poulet plus léger','Le « ragoût du chasseur » italien classique fait peau neuve, avec des poitrines de poulet faibles en gras, du prosciutto et une riche sauce tomate aux herbes.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 tranches de prosciutto, dégraissées, hachées","1 oignon moyen, haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 brins de sauge","2 brins de romarin","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau (poids total 550g), bio de préférence","150 ml de vin blanc sec","Boîte de 400 g de tomates italiennes au jus naturel","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","225 g de champignons de Paris, coupés en quartiers ou en deux s''ils sont gros","une petite poignée de persil plat haché, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Ajoutez le prosciutto et faites-le frire pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Retirer avec une écumoire, en laissant la graisse s''écouler dans la poêle, et réserver. Mettez l''oignon, l''ail et les herbes dans la poêle et faites revenir 3-4 minutes.","Étalez l''oignon dans la poêle, puis déposez les poitrines de poulet dessus. Poivrez et faites revenir 5 min à feu moyen en retournant le poulet une fois, jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer des deux côtés et que l''oignon caramélise au fond de la poêle. Retirez le poulet et réservez-le dans une assiette. Montez le feu, remuez rapidement et, lorsqu''il grésille, versez le vin et laissez bouillonner 2 minutes pour réduire légèrement.","Baissez le feu à moyen, remettez le prosciutto dans la poêle, puis incorporez les tomates (en les cassant avec votre cuillère), la purée de tomates et les champignons. Versez 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans la boîte de tomates vide, faites-la tourner, puis versez-la dans la casserole. Couvrir et laisser mijoter pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait épaissi et légèrement réduite, puis remettre le poulet dans la poêle et cuire à découvert pendant environ 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Assaisonner et parsemer de persil pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11402,4233,'fr','Courgetti bolognaise','Les courgettes en spirale constituent une alternative plus saine aux pâtes dans les spaghettis bolognaises classiques – utilisez du hachis de dinde pour une sauce faible en calories','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g de viande hachée de dinde (cuisse ou poitrine)","1 gros oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 grosses carottes, pelées et coupées en dés","150 g de champignons de Paris hachés grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cubes de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","4 grosses courgettes","pecorino ou parmesan râpé, pour servir","une poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une grande casserole et ajoutez le hachis de dinde. Faire frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis verser dans un bol et réserver.","Ajoutez l''oignon dans la poêle et faites cuire à feu doux pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajoutez ensuite l''ail en remuant pendant environ 1 min, suivi de la carotte et des champignons en remuant pendant environ 3 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Remettez le hachis de dinde dans la poêle, ajoutez le concentré de tomates, remuez le tout rapidement et versez les tomates hachées. Remplissez 1 bidon d''eau et versez dans la casserole. Émietter sur les cubes de bouillon de volaille et porter à ébullition. Une fois à ébullition, baissez le feu et laissez mijoter environ 1 heure, jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe et que les légumes soient tendres.","Lorsque la bolognaise est presque prête, ajoutez la sauce soja et un peu d''assaisonnement. Spiralisez vos courgettes sur le grand embout à nouilles. Faites chauffer une grande poêle avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive restante et ajoutez vos courgetti. Cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement ramolli, pendant 2-3 minutes. Assaisonner de sel et servir garni de bolognaise de dinde, de pecorino râpé et de feuilles de basilic."]','2026-01-11 00:10:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11403,4235,'fr','Nouilles Singapour spiralées','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Les nouilles aux légumes apportent non seulement ce plat à 4 sur 5 par jour, mais elles réduisent également les calories et améliorent la nutrition de ce souper épicé.','["1 gros mooli (radis daikon), 2 courgettes ou 3 carottes","2 cuillères à café d''huile de coco ou d''huile végétale","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché","1 gros piment rouge, ½ finement haché, ½ finement tranché en rondelles","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","6 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1½ cuillère à soupe de curry en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce teriyaki","150 g de crevettes crues hachées grossièrement","100 g de jambon cuit émincé","2 grosses poignées de germes de soja","coriandre, pour servir","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Utilisez un spiraliseur ou un éplucheur à julienne pour créer des nouilles aux légumes – utilisez le grand accessoire pour nouilles. Annuler.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok à feu vif. Lorsqu''il est chaud, ajoutez le gingembre, le piment haché, l''ail et les oignons nouveaux, faites sauter pendant 30 secondes à 1 minute jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste ramollis. Ajoutez la poudre de curry, la sauce soja, le teriyaki, les crevettes et le jambon et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les crevettes deviennent roses.","Ajoutez les nouilles aux légumes et les germes de soja, remuez autour de la poêle pendant 1 minute supplémentaire jusqu''à ce que les nouilles aient un peu ramolli mais soient encore bien croquantes – ne faites pas cuire trop longtemps sinon elles deviendront liquides. Servir parsemé de coriandre et de tranches de piment, accompagné de quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:10:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11404,4237,'fr','Risotto aux crevettes, fenouil et roquette','Ce risotto aux crevettes et au fenouil est légèrement agrémenté de zeste de citron et de roquette – parfait pour un dîner','["1,2 l de bouillon de légumes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 petit bulbe de fenouil, épépiné et finement haché","300 g de riz pour risotto","300 g de gambas crues décortiquées","1 citron, ½ zesté et 1 cuillère à soupe de jus","Fusée en sachet de 70g"]','["Mettez le bouillon dans une grande casserole, portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu à frémissement. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail et le fenouil et faites cuire à feu doux pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient ramollis mais pas colorés. Ajoutez le riz et remuez pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les grains soient chauds et émettent des crépitements. Augmentez le feu à moyen et commencez à ajouter le bouillon, une louche à la fois, en remuant constamment et en vous assurant que le bouillon a été absorbé par le riz avant d''ajouter la louche suivante.","Lorsque le riz est presque cuit, ajoutez les crevettes, le zeste de citron et un peu d''assaisonnement. Continuez à ajouter du bouillon et à cuire encore 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient roses et que le riz soit cuit. Retirer du feu et incorporer la roquette et le jus de citron. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement, laissez reposer le risotto dans la poêle pendant 2 minutes, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11405,4239,'fr','Pizzas aux œufs et à la roquette','Utilisez des tortillas aux graines comme base de pizza pour un déjeuner rapide et sain – cassez un œuf au centre et faites cuire au four pour augmenter l''apport en protéines.','["2 wraps aux graines","un peu d''huile d''olive, pour badigeonner","1 poivron rouge rôti, en pot","2 tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth haché","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","2 œufs","Conditionnement en paquet de 65 g","½ oignon rouge, tranché très finement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Disposez les tortillas sur deux plaques à pâtisserie, badigeonnez avec parcimonie d''huile puis enfournez pendant 3 minutes. Pendant ce temps, hachez le poivron et les tomates et mélangez-les avec la purée de tomates, l''assaisonnement et les herbes. Retournez les tortillas et tartinez-les du mélange de tomates, en laissant le centre exempt de gros morceaux de poivron ou de tomate.","Cassez un œuf au centre puis remettez au four pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que l''œuf soit juste pris et que la tortilla soit croustillante sur les bords. Servir parsemé de roquette et d''oignon."]','2026-01-11 00:10:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11406,4241,'fr','Soupe de lentilles rouges et carottes','Cette soupe végétarienne réchauffante et économique est parfaite emballée dans une fiole pour le déjeuner. Il est également facile de doubler les quantités et d''en congeler la moitié pour plus tard.','["1 oignon blanc, finement tranché","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées","2 carottes lavées et coupées en dés","85g de lentilles rouges","1 cube de bouillon de légumes émietté","de généreuses branches de persil hachées (environ 2 cuillères à soupe) et quelques feuilles supplémentaires"]','["Mettez la bouilloire à ébullition pendant que vous tranchez finement l''oignon. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle moyenne, ajoutez l''oignon et faites revenir pendant 2 minutes pendant que vous tranchez l''ail et coupez les carottes en dés. Ajoutez-les dans la poêle et faites cuire brièvement sur le feu.","Versez 1 litre d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire, incorporez les lentilles et le cube de bouillon, puis couvrez la casserole et laissez cuire à feu moyen pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres. Retirez du feu et incorporez le persil. Verser dans des bols et parsemer de feuilles de persil supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11407,4243,'fr','Paëlla aux fruits de mer','Cet impressionnant one pot espagnol, composé de lotte, de gambas et de moules, est parfait pour nourrir une foule lors d''un dîner.','["20-24 gambas crues décortiquées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g de lotte coupée en morceaux","1 gros oignon, finement haché","500 g de riz paëlla","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne (facultatif)","pincée de safran","½ boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées (garder le reste pour le bouillon ci-dessous)","500 g de moules nettoyées","100 g de petits pois surgelés","100 g de fèves surgelées","une poignée de feuilles de persil hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché grossièrement","½ boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","6 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","1 anis étoilé"]','["Épluchez et déveinez les crevettes en réservant les têtes et les carapaces. Remettez les crevettes\r\nau réfrigérateur.","Pour préparer le bouillon, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif et ajoutez l''oignon, les tomates, l''ail et les coquilles et têtes de crevettes réservées. Laissez cuire 3 à 4 min, puis versez 2 litres d''eau et ajoutez le cube de bouillon et la badiane. Portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 30 mn. Laisser refroidir légèrement, puis mixer par lots dans un mixeur ou un robot culinaire. Passer au tamis fin.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à paella ou une très grande poêle. Faites dorer la lotte quelques minutes de chaque côté, puis retirez-la et réservez. Ajouter l''oignon et faire revenir pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Incorporer le riz et cuire 30 secondes pour griller. Ajoutez l''ail, le paprika, le poivre de Cayenne (le cas échéant) et le safran, laissez cuire encore 30 secondes, puis incorporez les tomates et 1,5 litre de bouillon de poisson. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter en remuant pendant environ 10 minutes (le riz doit être encore al dente). Remettez la lotte dans la poêle avec les crevettes, les moules, les petits pois et les fèves.","Couvrir la poêle d''une grande plaque à pâtisserie ou de papier d''aluminium et cuire à feu doux pendant encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les moules soient ouvertes et que les crevettes soient bien cuites. Parsemer de persil avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11408,4245,'fr','Salade de poulet, brocoli et betterave rouge au pesto d''avocat','Ce souper de superaliments regorge d''ingrédients pour donner un coup de fouet à votre corps, comme l''oignon rouge, les graines de nigelle, les noix, l''huile de colza et le citron.','["250 g de brocoli à tige fine","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","3 poitrines de poulet sans peau","1 oignon rouge, tranché finement","100 g de cresson en sachet","2 betteraves crues (environ 175 g), pelées et coupées en julienne ou râpées","1 cuillère à café de graines de nigelle","basilic en petit paquet","1 avocat","½ gousse d''ail, écrasée","25 g de moitiés de noix émiettées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","le jus et le zeste d''1 citron"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau, ajoutez les brocolis et laissez cuire 2 min. Égoutter, puis rafraîchir sous l''eau froide. Faites chauffer une poêle, mélangez le brocoli dans 1 à 2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza et faites-le griller pendant 2-3 minutes, en le retournant, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit un peu carbonisé. Laisser refroidir. Badigeonner le poulet avec le reste de l''huile et assaisonner. Faire griller pendant 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Laisser refroidir, puis trancher ou déchiqueter en gros morceaux.","Ensuite, préparez le pesto. Cueillez les feuilles de basilic et réservez-en une poignée pour garnir la salade. Mettez le reste dans le petit bol d''un robot culinaire. Retirez la chair de l''avocat et ajoutez-la au robot culinaire avec l''ail, les noix, l''huile, 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron, 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide et un peu d''assaisonnement. Mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis transférez dans un petit plat de service. Versez le jus de citron restant sur les oignons émincés et laissez reposer quelques minutes.","Empilez le cresson sur une grande assiette. Mélangez le brocoli et l''oignon, ainsi que le jus de citron dans lequel ils ont été trempés. Garnissez de betterave rouge, mais ne la mélangez pas, ainsi que du poulet. Répartissez dessus les feuilles de basilic réservées, le zeste de citron et les graines de nigelle, puis servez avec le pesto d''avocat."]','2026-01-11 00:10:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11409,4247,'fr','Paillard de poulet au citron & herbes','Piler la viande jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fine et plate est une excellente technique pour la poitrine de poulet grillée, car elle garantit qu''elle ne se dessèchera pas. Essayez cette version avec du citron et des herbes.','["6 poitrines de poulet sans peau","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 à 2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","Fusée en sachet de 140g","25g de parmesan","quartiers de citron","2 gousses d''ail","3 brins de romarin, feuilles finement hachées","6 feuilles de sauge finement râpées","le zeste d''1 citron et le jus de ½","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Placer chaque poitrine de poulet entre 2 feuilles de film alimentaire ou de papier sulfurisé. Utilisez un maillet à viande ou un rouleau à pâtisserie pour\r\nécrasez chaque morceau de poulet – aplatissez-le en une couche uniforme d''environ 0,5 cm d''épaisseur. Transférer dans un plat.","Pour réaliser la marinade, écrasez l''ail avec une bonne pincée de sel à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Ajoutez le romarin et la sauge et battez bien le tout. Incorporer le zeste et le jus de citron, l''huile d''olive et un peu de poivre noir moulu. Versez la marinade sur le poulet en vous assurant qu''il est bien enrobé. Couvrir et réfrigérer au moins 2 heures.","Faites chauffer le barbecue. Une fois les flammes éteintes, étalez les braises en une couche uniforme. Faites cuire le poulet 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté. Transférer sur une planche et laisser reposer quelques minutes.","Pendant ce temps, versez l''huile et le vinaigre balsamique dans un grand bol. Ajoutez la roquette et un peu d''assaisonnement. Mélangez, puis rasez le parmesan. Servir la salade avec le poulet, avec des quartiers de citron à presser dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:10:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11410,4249,'fr','Poulet poché chinois et riz','Un plat sain d''inspiration asiatique, idéal pour un dîner facile. Utilisez les restes pour préparer notre salade froide de nouilles au poulet pour le lendemain.','["gros morceau de gingembre, 1 cuillère à soupe finement râpé, le reste tranché","3 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja, plus 2-3 cuillères à café (facultatif)","8 cuisses de poulet","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame","2 bottes d''oignons nouveaux, hachés","4 pak choi, coupés en deux","riz à grains longs cuit, pour servir"]','["Mettez le gingembre tranché, l''ail, les grains de poivre et la moitié du soja dans une grande poêle avec les cuisses de poulet. Ajoutez suffisamment d''eau pour couvrir et assaisonnez avec un peu de sel. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu à doux, mettez le couvercle et pochez 30 min.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une poêle et ajoutez l''huile de sésame et les oignons nouveaux. Ramollir pendant 1 min, puis retirer du feu et incorporer le gingembre râpé et le reste de la sauce soja pour faire une relish.","Lorsque le poulet est prêt, retirez-le de la poêle, réservez 4 cuisses et réfrigérez pour demain. Ajouter le pak choi au liquide de pochage et cuire 3-4 minutes. Filtrer le liquide de pochage pour retirer le gingembre, l''ail et les grains de poivre, en réservant le liquide. Retirez la peau des 4 cuisses de poulet restantes et jetez-la. Déchirez la viande en morceaux épais. Servir dans des bols avec du riz, le pak choi, une louche de bouillon de poulet chaud, la relish aux oignons nouveaux et un supplément de sauce soja, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11411,4251,'fr','Risotto crémeux aux tomates','Un plat de riz économique parfumé au romarin, au basilic et aux tomates cerises douces. Un souper idéal en milieu de semaine','["Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1l de bouillon de légumes","noisette de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 brin de romarin, finement haché","250 g de riz pour risotto","300 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","basilic en petit paquet, déchiré grossièrement","4 cuillères à soupe de parmesan râpé"]','["Versez les tomates hachées et la moitié du bouillon dans un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez dans une casserole avec le reste du bouillon, portez à légère ébullition et réservez sur feu doux.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le beurre et l’huile au fond d’une grande casserole et faites chauffer doucement jusqu’à ce que le beurre soit fondu. Ajouter l''oignon et cuire doucement pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Incorporer l''ail et le romarin, puis cuire encore 1 min. Ajouter le riz et cuire 1 min en remuant.","Commencez à ajouter le bouillon chaud et le mélange de tomates environ un quart à la fois. Laissez cuire le risotto en remuant souvent et en ajoutant du bouillon au fur et à mesure qu''il est absorbé. Après avoir ajouté la moitié du bouillon, ajoutez les tomates cerises. Au bout de 20-25 minutes, le riz doit être crémeux et tendre, les tomates cerises ramollies et tout le bouillon doit être épuisé.","Couvrir et laisser reposer 1 min, puis incorporer le basilic. Servir saupoudré de parmesan et d''un bon moulin à poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11412,4253,'fr','Bar rôti et plateau de légumes','Ajoutez une touche simple au poisson dans cette pâtisserie tout-en-un d''inspiration italienne avec des pommes de terre croustillantes, des poivrons rôtis et des olives.','["300 g de pommes de terre à peau rouge, tranchées finement en rondelles","1 poivron rouge, coupé en lanières","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 branche de romarin effeuillée et hachée très finement","2 filets de bar","25 g d''olives noires dénoyautées, coupées en deux","½ citron, tranché finement en rondelles","une poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Disposer les tranches de pomme de terre et de poivron sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive. Arroser d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et parsemer de romarin, d''une pincée de sel et d''un bon moulin à poivre. Mélangez bien le tout et faites rôtir pendant 25 minutes en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient dorées et croustillantes sur les bords.","Disposez dessus les filets de poisson et parsemez-les d''olives. Placez quelques tranches de citron sur le poisson et arrosez du reste d''huile. Rôtir encore 7 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit bien cuit. Servir parsemé de feuilles de basilic."]','2026-01-11 00:10:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11413,4255,'fr','Poivrons farcis au piment et garniture à la feta','Un souper végétarien satisfaisant qui contient 4 de vos 5 par jour. Farcir les poivrons avec le fromage à la crème, les haricots, l''aubergine et la feta','["2 gros poivrons, coupés en deux, épépinés mais avec les tiges laissées","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 petite aubergine coupée en petits cubes","Boîte de 220 g de haricots rouges (ne pas les égoutter)","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","1 gros œuf","25 g de fromage feta allégé, finement râpé","50 g de fromage frais allégé","2 poignées de fusée","quartiers de citron vert, à presser dessus"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Placer les moitiés de poivron dans un plat peu profond allant au four, côté peau vers le haut, et rôtir pendant 15 à 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, versez les épices dans une poêle et réchauffez-les brièvement pour libérer leur saveur. Versez les tomates et incorporez l''oignon, l''ail, le piment, l''aubergine et les haricots rouges avec leur jus. Couvrez la poêle et laissez cuire 20 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Essayez de ne pas ajouter de liquide supplémentaire ; le mélange doit être bien sec. Incorporer la coriandre.","Pendant ce temps, battez l''œuf avec la feta et le fromage frais. Retournez les poivrons et empilez le mélange d''aubergines dans chacun d''eux, en le tassant autant que possible. Garnir du mélange de feta et remettre au four encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit légèrement prise. Ne vous inquiétez pas si une partie s’écoule, car elle va simplement se fixer dans le plat. Servir les poivrons sur la roquette avec des quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:10:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11414,4257,'fr','Salade de poulet au sésame','Une salade asiatique fraîche et saine avec du basilic thaï et de la coriandre, des fèves de soja, des carottes et des tomates','["2 poitrines de poulet sans peau","85 g de graines de soja surgelées","1 grosse carotte, finement coupée en fines allumettes","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","140 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","petite poignée de feuilles de basilic thaïlandais ou ordinaire, hachées si elles sont grosses","85 g d''herbes ou de jeunes pousses de salade","1 cuillère à café de graines de sésame grillées","le zeste et le jus râpés d''1 petit citron vert","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à café de sauce chili douce"]','["Mettez le poulet dans une casserole et versez-le sur de l''eau froide pour couvrir. Versez les graines de soja dans un cuiseur vapeur. Portez la poêle à doux frémissement, puis faites cuire le poulet 8 min avec les haricots dessus.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un grand bol. Lorsque le poulet est cuit, coupez-le en tranches et ajoutez-y la vinaigrette avec les haricots, les carottes, les oignons, les tomates, la coriandre et le basilic. Mélangez bien, empilez sur les feuilles de salade et saupoudrez de graines de sésame."]','2026-01-11 00:10:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11415,4259,'fr','Lentilles du Puy au tofu fumé','Bénéficiez de l''énergie à libération lente des lentilles et des céréales complètes combinée à la riche saveur du tofu fumé, du paprika et des poivrons doux.','["Pulvérisation d''huile 1 cal.","1 grosse courgette, coupée en petits dés","100 g de tofu fumé coupé en petits dés","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1½ cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","Sachet de 250 g de lentilles du Puy cuites","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 poivron rouge rôti moyen en pot (pas dans l''huile), environ 85 g, tranché","une bonne poignée de pousses de pois ou de roquette"]','["Vaporisez une poêle antiadhésive avec 3 jets d''huile et ajoutez les courgettes, le tofu et le paprika fumé. Laissez cuire quelques minutes pour ramollir les courgettes. Incorporer le vinaigre balsamique et laisser grésiller et réduire.","Pendant ce temps, versez les lentilles, l''oignon et le poivron dans un bol et mélangez délicatement pour briser les touffes de lentilles. Ajoutez le tofu et les courgettes et mélangez à nouveau. Se conserve 2 jours au réfrigérateur. Répartir sur les pousses de pois juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11416,4261,'fr','Mulligatawny au butternut en morceaux','Cette soupe épicée au riz basmati et aux pommes est consistante, réchauffante et saine, en plus d''être faible en gras et en calories.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive ou de colza","2 oignons, finement hachés","2 pommes dessert, pelées et hachées finement","3 branches de céleri, hachées finement","½ petite courge musquée, pelée, épépinée, coupée en petits morceaux","2-3 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry sans gluten (selon le degré de piquant que vous aimez)","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de nigelle (également appelées graines d''oignon noir ou de kalonji)","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1½ l de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes sans gluten","140 g de riz basmati","petit paquet de persil, haché","3 cuillères à soupe de chutney de mangue, plus un peu pour servir, si vous le souhaitez (facultatif)","yaourt nature, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans votre plus grande casserole. Ajoutez les oignons, les pommes et le céleri avec une pincée de sel. Cuire 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez la courge musquée, la poudre de curry, la cannelle, les graines de nigelle et un peu de poivre noir moulu. Cuire encore 2 minutes, puis incorporer les tomates et le bouillon. Couvrir avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter 15 min.","Les légumes doivent maintenant être tendres mais pas pâteux. Incorporez le riz, remettez le couvercle et laissez mijoter encore 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit bien cuit. Goûtez et ajoutez plus d’assaisonnement si nécessaire. Incorporez le persil et le chutney de mangue, puis servez dans des bols avec du yaourt et du chutney de mangue supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11417,4263,'fr','Nouilles de Singapour épicées au chou-fleur, poulet et crevettes','Un sauté de nouilles de riz maigres de style asiatique, aromatisé au soja, au piment et à la coriandre et regorgeant de bienfaits végétaux.','["jus ½ citron","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","300 g de fleurons de chou-fleur","100 g de poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en dés","100 g d''oignons nouveaux, blancs et verts tranchés séparément","200 g de choux blancs coupés en morceaux","25 g de piments rouges frais hachés finement","100 g de nouilles de riz fines directement au wok (nous avons utilisé de l''Amoy)","50 g de crevettes crues décortiquées et hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","5g de feuilles de coriandre"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nTapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de pâte à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin. Mélangez le jus de citron avec\r\n½ cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry et mélanger\r\navec le chou-fleur sur la pâtisserie\r\nplateau. Rôtir pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à tendreté\r\net légèrement doré.","Faites chauffer un wok ou une poêle antiadhésive\r\net ajoutez le poulet, les blancs d''oignons nouveaux,\r\nchou, piment rouge, reste de curry\r\npoudre et un peu d''eau. Frire,\r\najouter des éclaboussures d''eau si ça démarre\r\ncollant ou semblant sec, jusqu''à ce que le poulet\r\nest bien cuit et le chou est\r\nramollissement. Ajoutez les nouilles, les crevettes,\r\nsauce soja et sucre, et faire frire pour un autre\r\nquelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien chaudes et les crevettes\r\nsont cuits. Dispersé au printemps\r\noignons verts, chou-fleur rôti et\r\nfeuilles de coriandre et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11418,4265,'fr','Burgers de saumon supersains','Si vous recherchez quelque chose d''un peu plus léger que des galettes de poisson remplies de pommes de terre, essayez ces simples hamburgers de style oriental.','["4 filets de saumon désossés et sans peau, environ 550 g/1 lb 4 oz au total, coupés en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","morceau de gingembre frais de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja","1 bouquet de coriandre, moitié hachée, moitié feuilles cueillies","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","quartiers de citron, pour servir","2 carottes","un demi-gros ou 1 petit concombre","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Versez le saumon dans un robot culinaire avec\r\nla pâte, le gingembre, le soja et la coriandre hachée.\r\nPulser jusqu''à ce qu''il soit grossièrement haché. Versez le mélange\r\net façonner 4 burgers. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un\r\npoêle antiadhésive, puis faites frire les burgers pendant\r\n4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté, en retournant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant\r\net bien cuit.","Pendant ce temps, utilisez un éplucheur pivotant pour éplucher\r\nlanières de carotte et de concombre dans un bol.\r\nMélanger avec le vinaigre et le sucre jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle sucre est dissous, puis jetez-le dans le\r\nfeuilles de coriandre. Répartissez la salade entre\r\n4 assiettes. Servir avec les burgers et le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:10:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11419,4267,'fr','Taboulé de quinoa','Savourez cette salade riche en nutriments, avec des tomates juteuses et du concombre, comme déjeuner délicieux et sain.','["200 g de quinoa","jus de 1-2 citrons","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","petit bouquet de menthe hachée","petit bouquet de persil plat, haché","botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","½ concombre épépiné et coupé en dés","une poignée de noix hachées"]','["Bien rincer le quinoa et le placer dans un\r\ncasserole avec environ le double du volume de\r\nl''eau. Porter à ébullition, couvrir, réduire\r\nle feu et laissez mijoter doucement pendant 10 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce que le grain se déroule. Tourner\r\nhors du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement,\r\npuis égouttez toute eau restante.","Assaisonner le quinoa, incorporer le citron\r\nle jus et l''huile et laisser refroidir complètement. Remuer\r\ndans les autres ingrédients, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11420,4269,'fr','Salade de poulet épicée au brocoli','Cette recette de salade de poulet est parfaite avec une pomme de terre moelleuse ou des nouilles aux œufs et faible en gras également.','["2 têtes de brocoli, coupées en fleurons","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","5 échalotes, finement tranchées","une poignée d''olives noires dénoyautées","4 poitrines de poulet rôties, tranchées","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","2 piments rouges épépinés et tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées"]','["Faites cuire le brocoli à la vapeur pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste\r\ntendre, verser dans un grand bol, puis assaisonner.\r\nPendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis faites revenir le\r\néchalotes pendant 2 minutes. Ajouter les piments et l''ail,\r\npuis cuire encore 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Retirez les échalotes, le piment et l''ail avec\r\nune écumoire, puis mélanger avec le brocoli,\r\nolives et poulet. Ajoutez la sauce soja au\r\npoêle, réchauffer à feu moyen, puis verser\r\nsur la salade. A manger tiède ou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:10:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11421,4271,'fr','Salade de saumon super saine','Supersaine par nom, supersaine par nature : cette salade est riche en oméga-3, en fer et en calcium et compte pour 2 de vos 5 par jour.','["100 g de couscous","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 filets de saumon","200 g de brocoli germé, râpé grossièrement, les plus grosses tiges retirées","jus d''1 citron","graines d''une demi-grenade","une petite poignée de graines de citrouille","2 poignées de cresson","huile d''olive et quartiers de citron supplémentaires, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l’eau dans un cuiseur vapeur. Assaisonner le \r\ncouscous, puis mélanger avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile. Verser bouillant \r\narroser le couscous pour qu''il le recouvre de \r\n1 cm, puis réserver. Lorsque l''eau dans le \r\nle cuiseur vapeur arrive à ébullition, renversez le brocoli \r\ndans l''eau, puis déposez le saumon dans le niveau \r\nci-dessus. Cuire 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que le saumon soit \r\ncuit et le brocoli tendre. Égoutter le \r\nbrocoli et passez-le sous l’eau froide pour le refroidir.","Mélanger le reste de l''huile et le citron \r\njus. Mélanger le brocoli, les graines de grenade \r\net des graines de citrouille dans le couscous \r\navec la vinaigrette au citron. Au dernier moment, \r\nhachez grossièrement le cresson et mélangez-le \r\nle couscous. Servir avec le saumon, le citron \r\nquartiers à presser et huile d''olive supplémentaire \r\npour arroser, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11422,4273,'fr','Fish & chips santé avec sauce tartare','Un repas spécial du vendredi soir parfaitement sain pour deux, fish and chips','["450 g de pommes de terre pelées et coupées en chips","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour le badigeonnage","2 filets de poisson blanc d''environ 140 g chacun","le zeste et le jus râpés d''1 citron","une petite poignée de feuilles de persil hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres hachées","2 cuillères à soupe bombées de yaourt grec 0 %","quartier de citron, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.\r\nMélanger les chips dans l''huile. Étaler sur une plaque à pâtisserie\r\nune couche uniforme, cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée\r\net croustillant. Mettez le poisson dans une assiette peu profonde, badigeonnez\r\nlégèrement avec de l''huile, du sel et du poivre. Saupoudrer de\r\nla moitié du jus de citron, enfournez pour 12-15 min. Après\r\n10 minutes saupoudrer d''un peu de persil et de citron\r\nzeste pour finir la cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les câpres, le yaourt, le reste du persil et le jus de citron, réservez et assaisonnez si vous le souhaitez.\r\nsouhaite. Pour servir, répartissez les chips dans les assiettes, soulevez le poisson dans les assiettes et servez avec un\r\ncuillerée de mélange de yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:10:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11423,4275,'fr','Saumon & épinards à la crème tartare','Le saumon, toujours polyvalent, est aussi populaire sur nos listes de courses que le poulet. Profitez-en au maximum avec cette recette impressionnante','["1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","2 filets de saumon sans peau","250 g d''épinards","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche allégée","jus ½ citron","1 cuillère à café de câpres, égouttées","2 cuillères à soupe de persil plat haché","quartiers de citron, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, assaisonnez le saumon\r\ndes deux côtés, puis faire revenir 4 minutes de chaque côté\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et que la chair se défasse facilement. Partir\r\nreposer sur une assiette pendant que vous faites cuire les épinards.","Versez les feuilles dans la poêle chaude, assaisonnez\r\nbien, puis couvrez et laissez reposer 1 min,\r\nen remuant une ou deux fois. Verser les épinards\r\nsur des assiettes, puis garnir de saumon. Doucement\r\nfaites chauffer la crème fraîche dans la poêle avec un\r\npresser le jus de citron, les câpres et\r\npersil, puis assaisonner au goût. Attention à ne pas\r\nlaisser bouillir. Verser la sauce sur le poisson,\r\npuis servir avec des quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:10:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11424,4277,'fr','Casserole épicée de racines et de lentilles','Les pommes de terre de cette recette prennent à merveille leurs saveurs épicées – notre idée du souper végétarien parfait','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","700 g de pommes de terre pelées et coupées en morceaux","4 carottes, tranchées épaisses","2 panais, tranchés épaissement","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte ou de poudre de curry","1 litre de bouillon de légumes","100 g de lentilles rouges","un petit bouquet de coriandre fraîche hachée grossièrement","yaourt faible en gras et pain naan, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et\r\nfaire revenir l''oignon et l''ail sur une\r\nfeu moyen pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nramolli, en remuant de temps en temps.\r\nVersez les pommes de terre, les carottes et\r\npanais, augmentez le feu et faites cuire\r\npendant 6 à 7 minutes, en remuant, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles légumes sont dorés.","Incorporer la pâte ou la poudre de curry,\r\nverser le bouillon puis porter à\r\nl''ébullition. Réduisez le feu, ajoutez le\r\nlentilles, couvrir et laisser mijoter 15-20\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles et\r\nles légumes sont tendres et le\r\nla sauce a épaissi.","Incorporer la majeure partie de la coriandre,\r\nassaisonner et chauffer pendant une minute ou\r\ndonc. Garnir de yaourt et du reste de\r\nla coriandre. Servir avec du pain naan."]','2026-01-11 00:10:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11425,4279,'fr','Oeufs et chips sains','Celui que les papas vont adorer ! Ce repas à tout moment est parfait avec une portion de fèves au lard','["500 g de pommes de terre coupées en dés","2 échalotes, tranchées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché broyé ou 1 cuillère à café de feuilles fraîches","200 g de petits champignons","4 œufs"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Incliner le\r\npommes de terre et échalotes dans un grand plat antiadhésif\r\nrôtissoire, arroser d''huile, saupoudrer\r\nl''origan, puis mélangez le tout\r\neh bien. Enfourner 15 mn, ajouter les champignons,\r\npuis laissez cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles pommes de terre sont dorées et tendres.","Faire quatre trous dans les légumes et casser\r\nun œuf dans chaque espace. Retour au four\r\npendant 3-4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient cuits à point\r\nvotre goût."]','2026-01-11 00:10:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11426,4281,'fr','The ultimate makeover: Salmon en croûte','Angela Nilsen prépare une version super saine du colis de poisson enveloppé dans une pâtisserie classique sans perdre l''effet wow','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 grosses échalotes, hachées finement","140 g de champignons de Paris finement hachés","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","jus ½ citron","100 g de cresson en sachet haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''aneth ciselé","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette ciselée","2½ cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche demi-écrémée","6 feuilles de pâte filo d''environ 38 x 30 cm chacune (poids total 125 g)","2 x 350 g de filets de saumon décortiqués"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Ajoutez les échalotes et faites-les revenir pendant 2-3 minutes pour les ramollir, puis ajoutez les champignons et l''ail et faites sauter à feu vif pendant encore 3-4 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les champignons et les échalotes soient dorés et que tout liquide des champignons se soit évaporé. Versez le jus de citron – après quelques secondes, il devrait également s''être évaporé. Retirer du feu, puis incorporer le cresson pour qu''il se fane dans la chaleur de la poêle (voir étape 1). Incorporer l''aneth et la ciboulette et assaisonner avec un peu de sel et de poivre. Laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Une fois le mélange de champignons refroidi, incorporez la crème fraîche. Posez l''une des feuilles de filo sur le plan de travail avec l''extrémité courte face à vous. Badigeonner le tout d’un peu du reste d’huile. Superposez 4 autres feuilles de filo de la même manière, en badigeonnant chacune d''elles avec un peu d''huile.","Disposez l''un des filets de saumon, peau vers le haut, sur toute la largeur de la filo, en le positionnant à environ un tiers de la hauteur. Assaisonnez-le de poivre. Verser et étaler le mélange de champignons refroidi sur le dessus du filet (voir étape 2). Déposez dessus l''autre filet de saumon, peau vers le bas. Assaisonner à nouveau. Pliez le bout court de pâte le plus proche de vous sur le saumon, puis ramenez l''autre extrémité pour enfermer complètement le saumon (voir étape 3), en le soulevant pour que la jointure puisse se replier en dessous. Pliez les deux extrémités de la pâte aussi proprement que possible.","Badigeonnez l’extérieur avec un peu plus du reste d’huile. Froissez la dernière feuille de filo en la pressant légèrement dessus en formant de gros plis (voir étape 4), puis badigeonnez délicatement avec le reste d''huile. Peut être préparé 3 à 4 heures à l’avance et réfrigéré. Transférer la parcelle de saumon sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Enfourner 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit croustillante et dorée. Vérifiez pendant la cuisson et si le dessus commence à dorer trop vite, posez une feuille de papier d''aluminium très lâche dessus. Retirer du four et laisser reposer le saumon pendant 2-3 minutes avant de le trancher."]','2026-01-11 00:10:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11427,4283,'fr','Ragoût de crevettes et de tomates avec garniture de gremolata','Une cocotte de poisson avec des crevettes saines, garnie d''une garniture italienne de persil et de zeste de citron – elle est également faible en gras et en calories','["500 g de pommes de terre nouvelles","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, tranché","4 branches de céleri, coupées en morceaux","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 filets d''anchois, hachés","pincée de flocons de piment","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","250 ml de vin blanc","200 ml de bouillon de légumes","400 g de gambas crues, décortiquées","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à café de câpres salées, rincées","une grosse poignée de persil haché","pain grillé, pour servir"]','["Mettez les pommes de terre dans une casserole de\r\neau froide salée et porter à ébullition.\r\nRéduire le feu à moyen et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 15-20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit mais quand même\r\nferme. Égoutter et, une fois suffisamment refroidi pour\r\npoignée, tranche épaisse.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande\r\ncasserole à feu doux-moyen.\r\nAjouter l''oignon, le céleri, l''ail, l''anchois\r\net le piment, assaisonner et cuire 8 min\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Augmenter la chaleur\r\nà moyen-vif, ajouter les tomates,\r\nvin et bouillon, et laissez cuire 15 minutes.\r\nAjouter les crevettes, le jus de citron, les câpres\r\net des pommes de terre. Cuire encore 5 minutes,\r\nou jusqu''à ce que les crevettes deviennent roses et soient\r\njuste cuit. Mélangez le persil et\r\nle zeste de citron, puis répartir sur le ragoût,\r\npuis servir avec du pain grillé, pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:10:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11428,4285,'fr','Spaghettis puttanesca aux légumes','Ajoutez une portion supplémentaire de légumes sous forme de courgettes dans cette version végétarienne de puttanesca. En 35 minutes, c''est un déjeuner faible en gras et en calories','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons (320 g), finement hachés","320 g de courgettes grossièrement râpées","3 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","¼-½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment (facultatif)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique","1 cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","8 olives Kalamata, dénoyautées et coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres, égouttées","300 g de spaghettis complets","15 g de persil plat finement haché","40 g de fromage à pâte dure italien végétarien, finement râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen. Ajoutez les oignons et faites-les revenir pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à colorer. Ajoutez la courgette, l''ail et les flocons de piment, le cas échéant, et laissez cuire encore 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la courgette commence à devenir très molle.","Incorporez les tomates, une boîte d''eau, le concentré de tomates, le vinaigre, le bouillon, les olives et les câpres, portez à douce ébullition et laissez cuire à découvert pendant 15 min.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition une grande casserole d’eau salée. Faites cuire les spaghettis en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les et mélangez-les avec la sauce et le persil. Si vous suivez le plan d''alimentation saine, servez deux portions avec la moitié du fromage parsemée dessus et réfrigérez le reste pendant un autre jour. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffer les portions au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très chaudes, ou sur la plaque de cuisson, à couvert, à feu moyen avec un peu d''eau pour les décoller."]','2026-01-11 00:10:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11429,4287,'fr','Oeufs au four à la salsa verde','Trempez les pains plats dans ces œufs cuits à la salsa verde pour s''imprégner des délicieux jus. Sain et faible en calories, il ne faut que 15 minutes pour le préparer','["5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","200 g de tomates cerises fraîches","2 gousses d''ail","1 petit bouquet de persil","1 petit bouquet de basilic","½ petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","200 g de pousses d''épinards lavées","4 œufs","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment (facultatif)","pains plats, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Versez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle et faites revenir le paprika et le cumin pendant 30 secondes à feu moyen. Ajouter les tomates en conserve et les tomates fraîches, porter à ébullition, puis laisser mijoter à couvert à feu moyen pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates ramollissent.","Pendant ce temps, mettez l''ail, la majeure partie du persil, le basilic, la menthe, les câpres, la moutarde, le vinaigre de vin blanc, 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide dans un mini robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Saison.","Incorporez les épinards dans la poêle avec les tomates jusqu''à ce qu''ils tombent (remettez le couvercle pendant quelques minutes, puis remuez à nouveau pour les aider à flétrir). Faites quatre trempettes dans le mélange et cassez délicatement un œuf dans chacune. Couvrir avec un couvercle et cuire à feu moyen pendant 6 à 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient à peine pris. Découvrez la poêle, puis arrosez de sauce aux herbes. Répartir sur le persil réservé et les flocons de piment, le cas échéant. Servir avec des pains plats, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11430,4289,'fr','Steak miso avec salade de nouilles','À la recherche d’un plat rapide et nutritif pour les journées chargées ? Essayez notre steak miso rapide et facile avec une salade de nouilles et de légumes : il est sain, faible en calories et savoureux.','["2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de gingembre","2 steaks de surlonge (environ 375 g), débarrassés de tout gras visible, puis coupés en lanières","1 1/2 cuillère à soupe de pâte miso brune","320 g de brocoli, tiges tranchées épaisses, fleurons entiers","3 nouilles complètes (132 g de poids sec)","1 1/2 cuillère à soupe de pâte miso brune","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre finement haché","1 1/2 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","2 carottes (150g), coupées en allumettes","4 tomates, coupées en quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame"]','["Pour la salade, faites mijoter le brocoli dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 3 à 4 minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les et réservez.","Pour la vinaigrette, fouettez la pâte miso dans un grand bol avec le jus de citron, le vinaigre, le gingembre et l''huile. Mélanger avec le brocoli cuit, les nouilles, l''oignon rouge, les carottes, les tomates et les graines de sésame.","Pour le steak, faites chauffer une poêle awokor à feu moyen et faites revenir brièvement l''ail et le gingembre jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à colorer. Ajouter le steak et faire sauter pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Empilez la moitié sur la salade de nouilles. Ajoutez le miso dans le wok avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour soulever le gingembre et l''ail de la poêle, puis versez-le sur la viande. Servir la moitié et réfrigérer le reste pour un autre jour. Vous pouvez déguster les restes frais ou les réchauffer au micro-ondes ou au four jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien chauds. Ils se conserveront au frais pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:10:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11431,4291,'fr','Pâtes à la betterave et à la feta','Apportez de la couleur à votre table avec nos pâtes crémeuses à la betterave et à la feta. Rempli de nutriments, c''est un déjeuner ou un dîner végétarien satisfaisant pour la famille','["2 grosses betteraves, pelées et coupées grossièrement en morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, finement hachés","4 branches de céleri, hachées finement, les branches de céleri séparées","4 carottes pelées et hachées finement","1 petit bouquet de basilic","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","400 g de pâtes complètes","75 g de crème fraîche allégée","100 g de féta"]','["Mettez sur feu vif une grande casserole d''eau salée, portez à ébullition et ajoutez les morceaux de betterave. Faire bouillir 5 minutes, puis transférer la betterave dans une assiette à l''aide d''une écumoire. Mettez de côté la casserole d’eau de cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, mettez l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle sur feu moyen, puis ajoutez les oignons, le céleri et les carottes et laissez cuire 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Hachez finement les branches de basilic et les feuilles de céleri, puis ajoutez-les dans la poêle avec l''ail et faites revenir encore 30 secondes.","Versez les pâtes dans la casserole d''eau de betterave et laissez mijoter pendant 13 à 15 minutes (selon les pâtes que vous utilisez) jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste cuites mais en conservant un peu de mordant. Égoutter en réservant 200 ml d''eau pour pâtes et remettre les pâtes dans la poêle.","Pendant ce temps, mettez la betterave avec la moitié des légumes frits dans le bol d''un robot culinaire avec l''essentiel des feuilles de basilic et la crème fraîche, puis mixez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Ajoutez progressivement l''eau des pâtes réservée pour détendre jusqu''à obtenir un mélange épais.","Incorporez cette sauce aux pâtes avec le reste des légumes frits et un peu d''assaisonnement. Répartir dans les bols, émietter sur la feta, puis parsemer du reste des feuilles de basilic. Broyez du poivre noir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11432,4299,'fr','Soupe contre le réfrigérateur','Personnalisez cette recette de soupe en utilisant tous les éléments dont vous disposez. Préparez une soupe aux tomates avec des restes de légumes, puis terminez-la avec des garnitures savoureuses','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","2 carottes, hachées finement","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 brin de thym","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 litre de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots cannelini égouttés","une grosse poignée de légumes verts (environ 150 g, utilisez tous les légumes de saison que vous avez – courgettes, haricots verts, blettes, épinards, etc.), hachés grossièrement","1 grosse pomme de terre, pelée et coupée en cubes de 2 cm","persil haché, feta émiettée, olives déchirées, flocons de piment (facultatif), huile d''olive extra vierge, pain croustillant"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon, la carotte et le céleri jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, environ 10 minutes, puis ajoutez l''ail, le thym et la purée de tomates. Versez le bouillon avec les tomates, réduisez le feu au minimum et laissez mijoter 10 minutes.","Ajoutez les haricots cannelini, les légumes verts et les morceaux de pommes de terre, ainsi qu''une généreuse pincée d''assaisonnement. Couvrir et laisser mijoter encore 15 à 20 minutes environ jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres et que la soupe ait épaissi. Garnir de persil, de feta émiettée, d''olives, de flocons de piment (pour ceux qui aiment les épices) et d''un filet d''huile d''olive extra vierge. Servir avec du pain croustillant à part pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:10:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11433,4303,'fr','Burgers d''aubergines effilochées et de haricots noirs','Demandez aux enfants de vous aider à préparer les légumes pour ces hamburgers familiaux. Ces petits pains végétariens ont toutes les textures réconfortantes de la viande mais sont entièrement végétaliens.','["2 grosses aubergines, piquées partout à la fourchette","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, tranché finement","1 cuillère à café bombée de granulés d''ail","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre demerara","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","5 cuillères à soupe de sauce barbecue","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","4 pains burger, grillés et légèrement beurrés","oignon rouge ou oignon rose mariné, laitue râpée, salade de chou et épi de maïs, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif et faire griller l''aubergine, en la retournant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit noircie et tendre, environ 20 à 30 minutes. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle allant au four à feu moyen, ajoutez l''oignon et faites-le revenir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et doré, environ 10 minutes. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Épluchez la peau de l''aubergine refroidie et jetez-la, ou prélevez la chair à l''aide d''une cuillère, puis mettez-la dans la poêle avec l''oignon. Ajoutez les granules d''ail, le paprika, le sucre, l''origan, 1 cuillère à café de sel marin et 1 cuillère à café de poivre noir. Remuer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit aromatique, puis incorporer la sauce barbecue avec les haricots noirs. Assaisonner et cuire au four jusqu''à ce que la sauce soit riche et épaisse et que l''aubergine ressemble à du porc effiloché – environ 10 à 15 minutes.","Empilez-les dans les pains à hamburger avec l''oignon rouge ou l''oignon rose mariné et toute autre garniture pour hamburger de votre choix. Dégustez avec de la salade de chou et des épis de maïs en accompagnement, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11434,4307,'fr','Brocoli, chou-fleur et halloumi grillés','Allumez le barbecue pour préparer notre plat de brocoli, chou-fleur, halloumi et couscous. C''est un souper d''été facile qui convient à toute la famille.','["2 tomates, hachées finement","½ oignon rouge, finement haché","1 citron, jus","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de cidre","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","1 chou-fleur coupé en bouquets, tiges coupées en morceaux de 5 cm","1 brocoli, coupé en fleurons, tiges coupées en morceaux de 5 cm","3 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","450 g de halloumi coupé en cubes de 2,5 cm","couscous cuit, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez les tomates, l''oignon, le jus de citron, le vinaigre de cidre, la moitié de l''origan séché et ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir dans un bol.","Allumez le barbecue. Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition et faites cuire les fleurons de chou-fleur ainsi que la tige et les morceaux de tige de brocoli pendant 3 minutes. Dans la dernière minute, déposez les fleurons de brocoli. Égoutter les légumes, puis mélanger avec 2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive, le reste de l''origan et le paprika.","Lorsque les braises sont cendrées, disposez les morceaux de légumes sur le gril, laissez cuire 2 minutes, puis passez dans une partie plus froide du gril. Continuez à déplacer les légumes pour qu’ils ne brûlent pas.","Mettez le halloumi sur le grill et laissez cuire 1 min, puis retournez. Répétez jusqu’à ce que tous les côtés soient bruns.","Versez tous les légumes et le halloumi dans un bol de service, arrosez du reste d''huile d''olive, assaisonnez et servez aussitôt avec du couscous."]','2026-01-11 00:10:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11435,4309,'fr','Saumon à la coriandre, quinoa au curry et grenade','Vous devriez essayer de manger du poisson gras au moins une fois par semaine, car les acides gras oméga-3 bénéfiques qui soutiennent la santé cardiaque ne peuvent pas être fabriqués par votre corps.','["120 g de quinoa rincé","320 g de haricots verts fins, parés et coupés en tiers","15 g de coriandre","15 g de gingembre frais pelé et haché","1 citron, jus","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 piment vert ou rouge, épépiné et haché","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","4 darnes de saumon sauvage sans peau (460g)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2-3 courgettes (320 g), coupées en deux et tranchées","2 oignons rouges, finement hachés","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","150 g de graines de grenade"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Faites bouillir une casserole d''eau, ajoutez le quinoa et laissez cuire 5 min. Ajoutez les haricots, ramenez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 10 min. Retirer du feu et laisser reposer 5 minutes, puis égoutter, rincer et égoutter à nouveau.","Pendant ce temps, mixez la coriandre fraîche, le gingembre, le jus de citron, le cumin, le piment et la coriandre moulue dans un petit bol à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant. Disposez les pavés de saumon sur la plaque à pâtisserie, puis étalez sur chacun une cuillère à café du mélange de coriandre en gardant le reste pour plus tard. Cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes, selon l''épaisseur du saumon.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir les courgettes et les oignons pendant 8 à 10 minutes à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et commencent à colorer. Incorporer le garam masala, la poudre de bouillon et le reste du mélange de coriandre, puis ajouter les pois chiches et cuire une minute. Versez dans un bol de service et mélangez le quinoa refroidi, les haricots verts et les graines de grenade. Verser la moitié dans deux assiettes et émietter sur 2 filets de saumon.","Réservez les deux portions restantes de salade de quinoa et de saumon pour les manger froids pour le déjeuner du lendemain, si vous le souhaitez. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:10:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11436,4313,'fr','Salade de pâtes à la mayonnaise au thon','C’est rapide à préparer et parfait comme festin de boîte à lunch, que vous soyez en pique-nique ou à votre bureau.','["250 g de pennes complètes","240 g de yaourt bio","2 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","4 cuillères à café de vinaigre de cidre de pomme","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","une poignée de feuilles de basilic hachées finement","320 g de thon à l''eau de source","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en dés","Boîte de 340 g de maïs doux égoutté"]','["Faites bouillir les pâtes pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente, puis égouttez-les et rincez-les sous l''eau froide courante. Égoutter à nouveau. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le yaourt, la moutarde, l''huile d''olive, le vinaigre, l''oignon et le basilic dans un grand bol, puis incorporez le thon, les poivrons rouges et le maïs doux.","Incorporer les pâtes et servir dans des bols ou conditionner dans des récipients pour le travail ou un pique-nique. Se conservera, couvert, au réfrigérateur pour manger le lendemain."]','2026-01-11 00:10:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11437,4315,'fr','Salade de quinoa aux œufs et à l''aneth','Le quinoa est une protéine complète qui contient les huit acides aminés essentiels. Dégustez-le ici en salade','["120 g de quinoa rincé","6 oeufs","320 g d''asperges, les extrémités ligneuses parées et coupées en deux si elles sont trop longues","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de cidre de pomme","6 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","2 cuillères à soupe d''aneth haché","2 cuillères à soupe de basilic haché, plus quelques feuilles pour servir","15 g de câpres rincées","320 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux"]','["Faites bouillir le quinoa dans beaucoup d''eau pendant 20 minutes. Laisser poser 5 minutes, puis rincer et bien égoutter. Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir les œufs 7 min dans une autre poêle avec les asperges dessus dans un cuiseur vapeur. Si les œufs sont prêts et que les asperges ne sont pas tout à fait tendres, retirez les œufs de la poêle et mettez-les dans l''eau froide tout en poursuivant la cuisson des asperges encore quelques minutes. Épluchez les œufs.","Pour préparer la vinaigrette, mélangez l''huile d''olive extra vierge et le vinaigre de cidre de pomme avec les oignons nouveaux hachés, les herbes et les câpres.","Versez le quinoa dans un bol et mélangez les trois quarts de la vinaigrette et les tomates. Verser la moitié dans des assiettes et le reste dans deux récipients. Disposez les asperges sur les salades avec trois moitiés d''œufs sur chacune, puis versez le reste de la vinaigrette et parsemez de feuilles de basilic. Scellez et réfrigérez les salades emballées. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique au réfrigérateur jusqu''à une journée."]','2026-01-11 00:10:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11438,4323,'fr','Choux frits au beurre avec échalotes croustillantes et amandes','Servez un festin le jour de Noël et ajoutez ces pousses beurrées avec des échalotes croustillantes et des amandes à votre table de dîner de fête.','["50 ml d''huile de tournesol","4 petites échalotes pelées et coupées en fines rondelles","2 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","50 g d''amandes effilées","50 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","500 g de choux de Bruxelles, coupés en deux"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu doux. Faites revenir les échalotes en remuant pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et dorées sur les bords. Ajoutez l''ail et les amandes. Faire revenir encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''ail soit doré. Versez dans un bol.","Faites fondre le beurre et faites sauter les pousses pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies et commencent à dorer, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si elles commencent à prendre. Saison. Mélangez avec la moitié du mélange échalotes et amandes, versez dans un plat, puis répartissez sur l''autre moitié."]','2026-01-11 00:10:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11439,4325,'fr','Barre milkshake à la vanille','Quoi de plus excitant qu''un bar à milkshake pour les enfants (et les grands enfants) ? Parfait pour une fête ou une célébration, laissez les invités choisir leurs propres garnitures','["200 g de glace vanille","500 ml de lait demi-écrémé ou entier","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","chocolat blanc fondu (facultatif)","mini-biscuits, pépites, guimauves, bretzels, pop-corn, chocolats et une variété de friandises","cerises au marasquin","crème jaillissante","4 verres à milkshake ou à dessert","pailles en papier de couleur"]','["Versez les mini biscuits, les pépites, les guimauves et autres friandises de votre choix dans des bols de service séparés et disposez-les sur la table à côté de la crème mousseuse.","Mélangez la glace, le lait et la vanille dans un mélange jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit crémeux. Verser dans une grande carafe.","Si vous le souhaitez, trempez les bords des verres dans le chocolat fondu, puis quelques pépites. Laissez reposer légèrement, puis répartissez le milkshake dans les verres. Laissez chacun personnaliser son shake avec les garnitures et la crème mousseuse, et servez-le avec les pailles en papier."]','2026-01-11 00:10:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11440,4327,'fr','Biscotti expresso et chocolat noir','Offrez-vous ces biscotti gourmands ou offrez-les en cadeau. Cette touche ajoute de l''espresso au mélange, rehaussant la richesse crémeuse du chocolat.','["300 g de farine nature","100 g de sucre en poudre","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","80g d''huile végétale","1 gros œuf","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","2½ cuillères à soupe de grains de café instantané, dissous dans 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude et refroidis","250 g de pépites de chocolat noir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Annuler. Mettez la farine, les sucres, la levure chimique et une bonne pincée de sel dans un grand bol, puis mélangez.","Fouetter l''huile, l''œuf, l''extrait de vanille et le café dans un petit bol séparé. Versez lentement les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs, en mélangeant jusqu''à obtenir une pâte sèche. Incorporez 100 g de pépites de chocolat. Pétrissez la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse – elle sera assez sèche, mais si elle est trop difficile à pétrir, ajoutez encore 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Divisez la pâte en deux, façonnez chaque morceau en une bûche de 25 x 8 cm et transférez les deux sur le plateau préparé. Cuire au four 25-30 min, puis laisser refroidir sur la plaque pendant 15 min.","Réduisez le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 3. Coupez les bûches de biscotti en tranches de 1 à 2 cm d''épaisseur dans le sens de la largeur à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, vous devriez en avoir environ 16. Remettez sur la plaque et faites cuire encore 15 à 20 minutes en retournant la plaque à mi-cuisson. Laisser légèrement refroidir sur la plaque, puis transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Faites fondre les pépites de chocolat restantes au micro-ondes par rafales de 20 secondes jusqu''à consistance lisse, ou dans un bol résistant à la chaleur posé sur une casserole d''eau à peine frémissante, puis plongez une extrémité des biscotti refroidis dans le chocolat fondu. Transférer sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé et laisser prendre. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:10:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11441,4331,'fr','Amaretto aigre sans alcool','Offrez-vous un cocktail sans alcool à l''amaretto sour, avec toutes les saveurs sucrées, piquantes et de noisette du cocktail classique, sans alcool.','["100 ml de jus d''ananas","50 ml de jus de citron","½ blanc d''oeuf","10 ml de sirop de cerises à cocktail (ou plus si vous préférez), plus des cerises pour servir","quelques gouttes d''extrait d''amande"]','["Mettez le jus d''ananas, le jus de citron, le blanc d''œuf, le sirop de cerise et l''extrait d''amande dans un mixeur. Fouettez le mélange plusieurs fois à grande vitesse, jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et commence à augmenter de volume. Si votre mixeur peut être utilisé avec de la glace, ajoutez-en quelques poignées et pulsez encore deux fois pour refroidir le mélange. Vous pouvez également incorporer la glace jusqu''à ce que l''extérieur du pichet soit froid. Verser dans des verres et garnir de cerises pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11442,4333,'fr','Cordonnier de goulasch au porc et à la courge','Combinez du porc avec de la courge et des champignons dans ce copieux repas faible en calories pour deux. Si vous ajoutez le chou pour servir, cela compte pour cinq de vos 5 par jour','["1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","250 g de filet de porc maigre, débarrassé de tout gras visible et coupé en morceaux","3 branches de céleri hachées (160g)","160 g de courge butternut pelée et coupée en cubes","1 poivron vert épépiné et coupé en dés","100 g de champignons de Paris, tiges arrachées et les gros coupés en deux","½ cuillère à café de graines de carvi, plus une pincée pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","160 g de chou cuit, pour servir","100 g de farine complète d''épeautre","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","Pot de 100 g de yaourt nature","goutte de lait, pour glacer (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive allant au four, puis faites sauter le porc pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer. Ajoutez le céleri, la courge, le poivron et les champignons avec leurs pieds, puis laissez cuire encore quelques minutes.","Incorporez le cumin et le paprika, puis versez 350 ml d''eau bouillante, le bouillon, le concentré de tomates et l''ail. Couvrir la poêle et laisser mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres, puis retirer le couvercle et laisser mijoter encore 5 minutes pour réduire un peu.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Pour la garniture au cordonnier, mettre la farine dans un bol et incorporer la levure chimique. Mélangez l’huile et le yaourt, puis incorporez-les à la farine. Réunissez le mélange en une pâte à l''aide d''un couteau à couverts. Pétrir très légèrement sur un plan de travail propre, puis former une forme de boudin d''environ la largeur d''un gros concombre. Couper uniformément en six rondelles et disposer sur le goulasch. Badigeonner d''un peu de lait pour glacer, si vous le souhaitez, et parsemer d''une pincée de graines de carvi. Cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et cuits – vous pouvez le savoir en en soulevant un pour voir si le mélange a pris en dessous. Servir avec le chou cuit à part, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11443,4335,'fr','Fondant classique','Offrez-vous un fudge fondant en bouche. La gâterie parfaite toute l''année, elle est également idéale comme cadeau pour la famille et les amis.','["125 g de beurre demi-sel, plus un peu pour le moule","397 g de lait concentré","460 g de sucre muscovado léger","150 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à café de pâte de gousse de vanille"]','["Beurrer et tapisser un moule à gâteau carré de 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Mettez le beurre, le lait concentré, le sucre et le lait dans une grande casserole sur feu doux. Remuer continuellement jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve.","Augmentez le feu et portez à ébullition. Faites bouillonner pendant 10 minutes en remuant tout le temps jusqu''à ce que le mélange atteigne 115°C sur un thermomètre à sucre ou à sonde. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir à 110°C. Ajoutez la vanille, puis battez au batteur sur socle ou avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''elle refroidisse à 60°C. Cela aidera à briser les gros cristaux de sucre. Le fudge doit être épais et mat.","Versez le fudge dans le moule préparé et appuyez avec une cuillère pour lisser la surface. Laisser prendre, puis couper en carrés. Se conserve jusqu''à trois semaines dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:10:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11444,4337,'fr','Salade de légumes d''automne avec vinaigrette au safran','Savourez cette superbe salade d’automne en accompagnement lors d’un dîner. Il contient des carottes, des courgettes, du brocoli, des tomates et des olives dans une belle vinaigrette au safran.','["12 carottes arc-en-ciel, le dessus laissé, lavées et pelées","1 courgette moyenne, tranchée","8 tiges de brocoli à longue tige, les tiges épaisses coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","100 g de tomates cerises mélangées, coupées en deux","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement en biais","3 tomates italiennes, évidées, blanchies, pelées, épépinées et coupées en petits morceaux","une poignée d''olives noires, dénoyautées et tranchées","½ concombre, coupé dans le sens de la longueur, épépiné et tranché en biais","3 cuillères à soupe de basilic haché grossièrement","20 ml de vinaigre de cidre","½ cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","pincer des brins de safran","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","50 ml d''huile de colza extra vierge","1 petite échalote, hachée finement"]','["Faites chauffer une poêle à feu moyen-vif. Versez les carottes, les courgettes et le brocoli dans un grand bol, assaisonnez légèrement et mélangez avec l''huile de colza. Une fois la plaque chauffante, ajoutez les légumes par lots et laissez-les légèrement carboniser pendant environ 3-4 minutes, puis remettez-les dans le bol. Lorsque tous les légumes sont carbonisés, ajoutez le reste des ingrédients de la salade, mélangez et réservez.","Pour préparer la vinaigrette au safran, fouettez le vinaigre, la moutarde, le safran et le sucre dans un bol avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Incorporer progressivement l''huile, puis incorporer les échalotes. Habillez la salade et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11445,4339,'fr','Curry de poisson aux tomates et au tamarin','Utilisez un poisson blanc durable comme le merlu et servez ce pot d''épices indien sain avec des haricots verts et de la coriandre.','["6 gousses d''ail","1 piment rouge haché grossièrement (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant)","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché grossièrement","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","200 g de haricots verts parés et coupés en deux","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tamarin","4 filets de poisson blanc ferme (nous avons utilisé du merlu)","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées grossièrement","riz basmati cuit, pour servir"]','["Mélangez ensemble l''ail, le piment, le gingembre,\r\ncurcuma et coriandre moulue avec\r\n3 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle\r\net griller les graines de cumin et de fenouil,\r\nles laisser grésiller jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient aromatiques. Ajouter\r\nla pâte de gingembre et faire revenir 3 min.","Videz les tomates dans l''épice\r\ncasserole, plus un bidon d''eau. Ajoutez les haricots,\r\nporter à ébullition, puis baisser le feu\r\nchauffer et laisser mijoter 5 minutes. Incorporer\r\nla pâte de tamarin. Ajoutez les filets de poisson,\r\nassaisonner généreusement avec du noir moulu\r\npoivrer, couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 min.\r\nRetirez le couvercle, retournez délicatement les filets,\r\npuis faites bouillir la sauce jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit\r\nbien cuit et la sauce est épaisse.\r\nSaupoudrer de feuilles de coriandre et\r\nservir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:10:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11446,4341,'fr','Salade de quinoa grillé, lentilles et saumon poché','Idéale si vous suivez un régime pauvre en cholestérol, cette assiette de légumes verts frais contient des supergrains grillés aux noisettes, ainsi que du citron et des herbes savoureux.','["140 g de quinoa","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","400 ml de bouillon de légumes léger (nous avons utilisé du bouillon)","250 g d''asperges parées","100 g de graines de soja surgelées","140 g de brocoli, fleurons parés et coupés en deux (nous avons utilisé Tenderstem)","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 filets de saumon (environ 150 g chacun)","½ gousse d''ail, écrasée","Paquet de 250 g de lentilles du Puy prêtes à l''emploi","6 oignons nouveaux, tranchés en diagonale","une grosse poignée de menthe et de persil hachés grossièrement","85 g de pousses d''épinards","25 g d''amandes effilées, grillées"]','["Rincez le quinoa et versez-le dans un grand\r\npoêle antiadhésive. Baissez le feu à\r\nmoyen et sécher les grains en remuant\r\npour les déplacer dans la poêle. Une fois tout\r\nle liquide s''est évaporé, incorporez l''huile.\r\nPoursuivez la cuisson du quinoa jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien\r\nest devenu brun noisette et commence à « éclater »\r\n– cela prendra 10 à 15 minutes. Remuez de temps en temps\r\nsouvent pour arrêter la combustion du quinoa. Verser\r\nsur le bouillon et laisser mijoter 15 à 20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que tout le liquide soit absorbé.\r\nVersez dans un bol et laissez refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, apportez une grande casserole d''eau\r\nà ébullition. Déposez les graines de soja,\r\nles asperges et le brocoli, et laisser mijoter pendant\r\n2 minutes. Retirer à l''aide d''une écumoire\r\net plongez-le dans un bol d''eau glacée.\r\nÉgouttez les légumes.","Ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de jus de citron au\r\ncasserole avec l''eau végétale, puis\r\nbaissez le feu et laissez mijoter doucement.\r\nAssaisonner les filets de saumon et les plonger\r\nentièrement dans l''eau. Pocher 6 à 8 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste cuit. Retirer, laisser\r\nlaisser refroidir, puis retirer la peau et l''écailler\r\nen gros morceaux.","Faire une vinaigrette en mélangeant\r\nl''ail, la majeure partie du zeste de citron et\r\njus de citron restant. Mélangez le quinoa,\r\nlentilles, légumes égouttés, oignons nouveaux,\r\nherbes, épinards et vinaigrette ensemble\r\nun grand bol, puis assaisonner. Empilez sur un\r\nassiette de service, garnir de saumon, puis\r\nrépartir sur les amandes et le reste\r\nle zeste de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:10:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11447,4343,'fr','Ragoût de bœuf à l''italienne','Un ragoût facile et super sain, plein de vitamine C','["1 oignon, tranché","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","Paquet de 300 g de lanières de bœuf sautées, ou utilisez un steak de bœuf tranché finement","1 poivron jaune, épépiné et tranché finement","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","brin de romarin, haché","une poignée d''olives dénoyautées"]','["Dans une grande casserole, faire revenir l''oignon et l''ail dans l''huile d''olive pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et dorés. Ajoutez les lanières de bœuf, le poivre, les tomates et le romarin, puis portez à ébullition. Laisser mijoter 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la viande soit bien cuite, en ajoutant un peu d''eau bouillante si nécessaire. Incorporer les olives et servir avec de la purée ou de la polenta."]','2026-01-11 00:10:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11448,4345,'fr','Soupe crémeuse de carottes et de haricots beurre au curry','Une soupe de légumes onctueuse avec des épices indiennes à laisser mijoter pendant des heures – parfaite pour nourrir une foule','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 oignons, hachés","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","1¼kg de carottes, 1kg/2lb 4oz tranchées grossièrement, reste grossièrement râpé","3 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés et rincés","1,2 l de bouillon de légumes","400 ml de lait entier","ciboulette ciselée, si vous le souhaitez, pour servir, plus 2 pains croustillants"]','["Mettez l''huile et les oignons dans le plus grand\r\ncasserole ou cocotte que vous avez et\r\nramollir pendant 10 minutes. Incorporer les épices et\r\ncuire 2 min, puis ajouter les tranches\r\ncarottes avec la moitié des haricots et le\r\nbouillon de légumes. Portez à ébullition,\r\npuis couvrez et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les carottes soient tendres.","Réduire la soupe en purée avec la main\r\nmélangeur, ou réduire en purée par lots dans un mélangeur\r\nou un robot culinaire. Remettez-le dans la poêle\r\n(versez-le au tamis ou dans une passoire si\r\nvous aimez), et incorporez le reste des haricots\r\net carotte râpée avec 500 ml d''eau chaude.\r\nRamenez à ébullition, puis couvrez et\r\ncuire doucement pendant 10 min.","Incorporer le lait et assaisonner selon votre goût,\r\npuis maintenez sur feu très doux jusqu''à\r\nnécessaire. Si vous le souhaitez, coupez quelques ciboulette\r\ndessus et servir avec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:10:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11449,4349,'fr','Risotto aux champignons et au thym','L''utilisation d''un mélange de quinoa et de riz donne une texture légère et une belle saveur de noisette à ce plat.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","350 g de champignons châtaignes émincés","100 g de quinoa","1l de bouillon de légumes chaud","175 g de riz pour risotto","une poignée de feuilles de thym","une poignée de parmesan râpé ou une alternative végétarienne","Sachet de 50g de roquette, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle moyenne, faites revenir le\r\nchampignons pendant 2-3 minutes, puis incorporez-y le\r\nle quinoa. Conserver le bouillon de légumes\r\nréchauffer dans une casserole à part à feu doux,\r\najoutez une louche de bouillon et remuez jusqu''à ce que\r\nabsorbé. Incorporer le riz et répéter\r\nà nouveau avec le stock, jusqu''à ce que tout le stock\r\na été épuisé et le riz et\r\nle quinoa est tendre et cuit.","Incorporer les feuilles de thym, puis diviser\r\nentre 4 assiettes ou bols. Servir garni\r\navec du parmesan râpé et des feuilles de roquette."]','2026-01-11 00:10:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11450,4351,'fr','Ragoût de poulet, fenouil et tomates','Ce gros ragoût peut être accompagné de tout ce que vous voulez, du couscous, des pâtes, du riz ou une belle veste, ou simplement un bon morceau de pain.','["1 gros bulbe de fenouil","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 poulets désossés et sans peau, coupés en morceaux","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","200 g de pommes de terre nouvelles coupées en morceaux","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","150 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes","3 poivrons rouges rôtis en saumure, provenant d''un bocal ou d''un comptoir de charcuterie, hachés"]','["Coupez les fanes vertes du fenouil et réservez. Réduisez de moitié, puis quart \r\nle fenouil, retirez le cœur, puis coupez-le en tranches dans le sens de la longueur. Chauffer le \r\nhuile dans une poêle, ajoutez le poulet, puis faites-le revenir rapidement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement coloré. \r\nAjoutez le fenouil et l''ail, puis remuez brièvement jusqu''à ce que le fenouil brille.","Ajoutez les pommes de terre, les tomates, le bouillon et un peu d''assaisonnement, et \r\nporter à ébullition. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre \r\nsont tendres. Incorporer les poivrons et faire chauffer. Hacher grossièrement \r\nles feuilles de fenouil réservées, puis saupoudrer sur le ragoût. Servir \r\navec du pain croustillant pour éponger le jus."]','2026-01-11 00:10:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11451,4353,'fr','Tajine de légumes aux pois chiches et raisins secs','Nous avons simplifié vos cinq jours avec ce tajine sain','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, hachés","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, de coriandre et de cumin","2 grosses courgettes coupées en morceaux","2 tomates hachées","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, rincés et égouttés","4 cuillères à soupe de raisins secs","425 ml de bouillon de légumes","300 g de petits pois surgelés","coriandre hachée, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis faites revenir les oignons pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Remuer  \r\ndans les épices. Ajoutez les courgettes, les tomates, les pois chiches, les raisins secs et \r\nbouillon, puis porter à ébullition. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 mn. Incorporer \r\nles petits pois et cuire encore 5 min. Saupoudrer de coriandre, pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11452,4355,'fr','Risotto rapide aux tomates','Faire un risotto ne nécessite pas nécessairement des heures de brassage sur la cuisinière, comme le prouve cette recette facile à base de tomates.','["250 g de riz pour risotto","1 oignon, finement haché","50g de beurre","250 ml de bouillon de légumes","Carton de purée de 500 ml","500 g de tomates cerises barquette","100 g de boule de mozzarella égouttée et coupée en gros morceaux","parmesan râpé (ou alternative végétarienne) et basilic râpé, pour servir"]','["Versez le riz, l''oignon et la moitié du beurre dans un grand bol allant au micro-ondes. Couvrir et cuire au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 3 minutes. Incorporer le bouillon et la passata, puis poursuivre la cuisson à découvert pendant 10 minutes. Remuez bien et incorporez les tomates et la mozzarella. Cuire au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant encore 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit cuit et que les tomates aient ramolli.","Laissez le risotto reposer quelques minutes, puis incorporez le reste du beurre, le parmesan et le basilic. Assaisonner au goût et servir directement du bol."]','2026-01-11 00:10:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11453,4357,'fr','Steaks de dinde, sauce aux agrumes et au gingembre','Utilisez des steaks de dinde à cuisson rapide pour cette recette car ils cuisent en quelques minutes, et changez du poulet.','["2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","4 steaks de poitrine de dinde à cuisson rapide, pesant environ 300 g/10 oz au total","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","3 oranges, le jus de 2 et une pelée et coupée en quartiers","1 cuillère à café de gingembre frais râpé","1 cuillère à café de miel clair","1 pamplemousse rose pelé et coupé en quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette fraîche ciselée ou de persil haché","riz sauvage ou à grains longs et brocoli cuit à la vapeur, pour servir"]','["Saupoudrer une cuillère à café\r\nmaïzena dans une assiette, puis\r\npresser les steaks de dinde dans\r\nla maïzena pour les saupoudrer\r\nlégèrement. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand\r\npoêle antiadhésive, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit\r\nvraiment chaud. Ajoutez la dinde et\r\nfaire frire pendant 3-4 minutes en retournant\r\nune fois jusqu''à ce que les deux soient dorés\r\ncôtés – cuire par lots si\r\nil le faut. Transférer dans une assiette.","Add the orange juice, ginger\r\net du miel dans la poêle. Doucement\r\nporter à ébullition. Mélangez le\r\nremaining cornflour with 1\r\ntbsp cold water and stir into\r\nla sauce. Continuez à remuer sur un\r\ngentle heat until thickened and\r\nsirupeux, comme un aigre-doux\r\nsauce. Saison.","Remettez la dinde dans la poêle.\r\nAjouter l''orange et le pamplemousse\r\nsegments et chauffer à travers\r\ndoucement. Parsemer de ciboulette ou\r\npersil et servir droit\r\navec du riz et du brocoli."]','2026-01-11 00:10:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11454,4359,'fr','Curry de petits pois et pommes de terre nouvelles','Un curry de légumes faible en gras et en calories, à base d''épices de Madras et de yaourt','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 oignons, tranchés","3 piments rouges épépinés et finement tranchés","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de curry de Madras","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","750 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux","jus 1 citron vert","Pot de 500 ml de yaourt nature","petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges et feuilles finement hachées","200 à 300 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de bouillon de pois (voir conseil ci-dessous)","300 g de petits pois frais écossés (ou surgelés)","quartiers de lime, pour servir","2 pains naan, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à frire.\r\nAjoutez les oignons et faites cuire à feu doux\r\npendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez les piments, le gingembre et les épices et laissez cuire pendant\r\nquelques minutes. Incorporer les pommes de terre et le citron vert\r\njus, enrobé du mélange d''épices.","Ajoutez le yaourt, les tiges de coriandre et\r\nle stock. Laisser mijoter lentement pendant 35 à 40 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres et la sauce\r\na réduit. Incorporer les petits pois et\r\ncuire encore 5 minutes. Saupoudrer\r\nles feuilles de coriandre, et servir avec du citron vert\r\nquartiers et pain naan chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:10:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11455,4361,'fr','Gombo au poulet cajun','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une authentique cocotte de Louisiane avec des épices créoles, des légumes, du jambon et une sauce riche – un pot avec bouchée.','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","5 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en gros morceaux","1 oignon, haché","2 branches de céleri, tranchées","3 feuilles de laurier","5 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","4 cuillères à café de mélange d''épices cajun (ou 1 de chaque paprika, cumin moulu, piment moulu et basilic séché)","600 ml de bouillon de poulet (fait avec 2 cubes de bouillon)","2 poivrons verts épépinés et coupés en morceaux","300 g de jambon en tranches épaisses, débarrassé du gras et coupé en dés","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché très grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande cocotte ou une grande poêle et faites revenir le poulet pendant quelques minutes pour le faire dorer. Versez sur une assiette. Ajoutez l''oignon dans la poêle avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile supplémentaire et faites-le revenir pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque ramolli. Ajoutez le céleri et faites revenir encore 2 minutes, puis renversez-le pour rejoindre le poulet. Ajouter le reste de l''huile, les feuilles de laurier et la farine dans la poêle et cuire jusqu''à obtenir une pâte. Poursuivez la cuisson en remuant constamment (avec un peu d''eau si besoin) jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée, puis incorporez les épices pendant 2 min.","Incorporer progressivement le bouillon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit lisse et savoureux. Remettez le poulet et les légumes dans la poêle, ainsi que les poivrons, couvrez et laissez mijoter doucement pendant 15 minutes. Incorporer le jambon, couvrir et laisser mijoter doucement encore 10 minutes. Vérifiez l''assaisonnement, puis servez, parsemé d''oignons nouveaux mélangés au persil haché."]','2026-01-11 00:10:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11456,4365,'fr','Porridge à la compote de myrtilles','Bouillie d''avoine riche en fibres avec du yaourt grec crémeux et des myrtilles saines – achetez-les surgelés pour réduire le coût de ce petit-déjeuner copieux.','["6 cuillères à soupe de flocons d''avoine","un peu moins de ½ pot de 200 ml de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","½ paquet de 350 g de myrtilles surgelées","1 cuillère à café de miel (facultatif)"]','["Mettez les flocons d''avoine dans une poêle antiadhésive avec 400 ml d''eau et faites cuire sur feu vif en remuant de temps en temps pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Retirer du feu et ajouter un tiers du yaourt.","Pendant ce temps, versez les myrtilles dans une casserole avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et le miel si vous en utilisez et pochez délicatement jusqu''à ce que les myrtilles soient décongelées et qu''elles soient tendres, mais gardant toujours leur forme.","Verser le porridge dans des bols, garnir du reste du yaourt et verser sur les myrtilles."]','2026-01-11 00:10:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11457,4367,'fr','Soupe au brocoli et au chou frisé','Cette soupe super saine combine du brocoli et du chou frisé avec du gingembre, de la coriandre et du curcuma pour un déjeuner riche en nutriments et faible en gras.','["500 ml de bouillon, obtenu en mélangeant 1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon et de l''eau bouillante dans un pichet","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, tranché","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","3 cm de racine de curcuma fraîche, pelée et râpée, ou ½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","pincée de sel rose de l''Himalaya","200 g de courgettes coupées grossièrement","85g de brocoli","100 g de chou frisé haché","1 citron vert, zesté et pressé","petit paquet de persil, haché grossièrement, en réservant quelques feuilles entières pour servir"]','["Mettez l''huile dans une poêle profonde, ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre, la coriandre, le curcuma et le sel,\r\nfaire revenir à feu moyen pendant 2 minutes, puis ajouter 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour donner un peu plus d''humidité aux épices.","Ajoutez les courgettes en prenant soin de bien mélanger pour bien enrober les tranches de toutes les épices et poursuivez la cuisson 3 min. Ajoutez 400 ml de bouillon et laissez mijoter 3 min.","Ajoutez le brocoli, le chou frisé et le jus de citron vert avec le reste du bouillon. Laissez cuire à nouveau encore 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que tous les légumes soient tendres.","Retirez du feu et ajoutez le persil haché. Versez le tout dans un mixeur et mixez à grande vitesse jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Ce sera un beau vert avec des morceaux de noir moucheté (qui est le chou frisé). Garnir de zeste de citron vert et de persil."]','2026-01-11 00:10:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11458,4371,'fr','Salade épicée de poulet et d''ananas','Cette salade colorée regorge de saveurs et de textures contrastées – assaisonnez de piment doux et de coriandre','["227 g de boîte d''ananas en jus","environ 140 g de poitrine de poulet cuite et tranchée (le piment doux, le piquant et les épices ou le barbecue fonctionnent bien)","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché finement","Sachet de 90g de feuilles mélangées","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies","une poignée de tomates cerises, coupées en deux","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce chili douce"]','["Égoutter l''ananas en réservant le jus. Si c''est en rondelles, coupez-les en morceaux. Mélanger avec le poulet, l''oignon, les feuilles, la coriandre et les tomates, et répartir dans 2 récipients si vous le prenez au déjeuner.","Pour la vinaigrette, fouettez 2 cuillères à soupe de jus d''ananas, le piment rouge, le vinaigre et la sauce chili douce avec un peu d''assaisonnement dans un petit pot de confiture ou un récipient à couvercle, et mélangez-les à la salade avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11459,4373,'fr','Crevettes thaïlandaises à l''ananas et aux haricots verts','Ce sauté de milieu de semaine regorge de bienfaits provenant des légumes croquants. Il est aromatisé au citron vert, au basilic thaï et au gingembre','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 tiges de citronnelle, les feuilles extérieures coriaces enlevées, le reste finement haché","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","100 g de morceaux d''ananas frais","100 g de haricots verts","100 g de tomates cerises entières","200 g de crevettes crues","petit paquet de feuilles de basilic thaïlandais ou de feuilles de basilic ordinaires","4 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert, plus des quartiers pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de bouillon de poulet liquide","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade molle"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients de la sauce dans un petit bol. Annuler.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand wok. Faire revenir la citronnelle et le gingembre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajoutez l''ananas, les haricots et les tomates cerises et faites sauter pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les haricots soient juste cuits. Ajoutez les crevettes et la sauce. Faites sauter encore 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient cuites, puis ajoutez la plupart des feuilles de basilic. Servir avec des quartiers de citron vert et le reste des feuilles de basilic parsemées."]','2026-01-11 00:10:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11460,4375,'fr','Frittata aux épinards et poivrons','Un plat équilibré, semblable à une omelette, composé d''œufs riches en protéines cuits avec du fromage, de l''ail, des tomates, des poivrons et des épinards.','["5 gros œufs","Pot de 300 g de fromage cottage naturel faible en gras","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","15 g de parmesan finement râpé (ou alternative végétarienne)","225 g d''épinards en feuilles surgelés, décongelés, pressés et finement hachés","2 poivrons rouges rôtis (pas dans l''huile), déchirés en lanières","généreuse râpe de muscade","100 g de tomates cerises entières"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser un moule à sandwich de 20 cm d''une seule feuille de papier sulfurisé si votre moule a un fond lâche.","Battez les œufs dans un grand bol avec le fromage cottage, l''ail, la moitié du parmesan, les épinards, les poivrons, la muscade et un peu de poivre noir. Verser dans le moule, garnir de tomates et saupoudrer du reste de parmesan. Cuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien pris et qu''il commence à gonfler. Couper en quartiers et servir chaud ou froid. Se conserve 3 à 4 jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:10:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11461,4377,'fr','Soupe méditerranéenne aux tomates en morceaux','Utilisez des légumes rôtis dans cette soupe rapide et faible en calories – nous avons utilisé des poivrons, des aubergines, des oignons et des courgettes. Servir avec du pain de seigle garni de ricotta et d''herbes','["400g de mélange de légumes grillés surgelés (poivrons, aubergines, oignons, courgettes)","2 cuillères à soupe d''ail haché","une poignée de feuilles de basilic","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cube de bouillon de légumes réduit en sel","50g de ricotta par personne, battue avec de la ciboulette ciselée et du basilic, tartinée sur une tranche de pain de seigle"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive, versez-y la moitié des légumes et l''ail et faites cuire en remuant à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir – environ 5 minutes. Ajoutez le basilic, les tomates, le cube de bouillon et 2 boîtes d''eau, puis mixez avec un mixeur plongeant pour obtenir un mélange aussi lisse que possible.","Ajoutez le reste des légumes surgelés, couvrez la poêle et laissez cuire encore 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres. Verser dans des bols. Servir avec la ricotta aux herbes sur du pain de seigle."]','2026-01-11 00:10:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11462,4379,'fr','Tarte aux légumes grillés et feta','La pâte filo croustillante constitue une base légère pour une tarte végétarienne remplie de légumes méditerranéens et de feta','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 aubergine, tranchée","2 courgettes, tranchées","2 oignons rouges, coupés en gros quartiers","3 grandes feuilles de pâte filo","10-12 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","un filet de vinaigre balsamique","85 g de fromage feta émietté","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","grand sac de feuilles de salade mélangées et de vinaigrette faible en gras, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Mettre une plaque à pâtisserie de 33 x 23 cm dans le four pour chauffer. Badigeonnez une poêle avec environ 1 cuillère à café d''huile et faites griller les aubergines jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien carbonisées, puis retirez-les. Répétez avec les courgettes et les oignons, en utilisant un peu plus d''huile si nécessaire.","Sortez la plaque du four et badigeonnez-la d''un peu d''huile. Badigeonnez une grande feuille de filo d''huile, recouvrez d''une autre feuille, ajoutez un peu plus d''huile et répétez avec la dernière feuille. Transférez la pâte sur la plaque chaude en la poussant un peu sur les bords.","Disposez dessus les légumes grillés, puis assaisonnez. Ajouter les tomates, côté coupé vers le haut, puis arroser de vinaigre et du reste d''huile. Émiettez la feta et saupoudrez d''origan. Cuire environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés. Servir avec les feuilles de salade composée assaisonnées."]','2026-01-11 00:10:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11463,4381,'fr','Salade de betteraves et lentilles à la moutarde','Un accompagnement rustique et sain à servir avec des plats principaux comme des saucisses, du poulet rôti ou de l''agneau.','["200 g de lentilles du Puy (ou utiliser 2 paquets de 250 g de lentilles précuites)","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète (ou alternative sans gluten)","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","Paquet de 300 g de betterave cuite (pas au vinaigre), tranchée","une grosse poignée d''estragon, haché grossièrement"]','["Si vous n''utilisez pas de lentilles précuites, faites cuire les\r\nlentilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, égouttez-les\r\net laisser refroidir. Pendant ce temps, mélangez\r\nla moutarde, l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement pour\r\nfaire un pansement.","Versez les lentilles dans un bol, versez dessus\r\nvinaigrette et bien mélanger. Remuer à travers le\r\nbetterave rouge, estragon et quelques assaisonnements,\r\npuis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11464,4383,'fr','Soupe crémeuse de potiron et lentilles','Que vous sculptiez une citrouille d''Halloween ou que vous ayez acheté une courge bon marché, utilisez la chair et les graines abondantes de cette soupe.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus 1 cuillère à café","2 oignons, hachés","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","environ 800 g de chair de citrouille hachée, plus les graines","100 g de lentilles rouges cassées","½ petit paquet de thym, feuilles cueillies, plus un peu pour servir","1l de bouillon de légumes chaud","pincée de sel et de sucre","50 g de crème fraîche, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Faire frire le\r\noignons jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et commencent à tourner\r\ndoré. Incorporer l''ail, la chair de potiron,\r\nlentilles et thym, puis versez le chaud\r\nstocks. Assaisonner, couvrir et laisser mijoter pendant\r\n20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles et\r\nles légumes sont tendres.","Pendant ce temps, lavez les graines de citrouille.\r\nRetirez toute chair qui y adhère encore,\r\npuis séchez-les avec du papier absorbant.\r\nFaites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive\r\net faites frire les graines jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à\r\nsautez et sautez. Remuer fréquemment, mais couvrir\r\nla poêle entre les deux pour les conserver dedans.\r\nQuand les graines ont l''air noisette et grillées,\r\najoutez une pincée de sel et une pincée de\r\nsucre et bien mélanger.","Mélangez le mélange de potiron cuit\r\navec un mixeur plongeant ou dans un aliment\r\nprocesseur jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis ajoutez\r\nla crème fraîche et fouettez à nouveau.\r\nGoûtez pour l’assaisonnement.","Servir avec une cuillerée de crème fraîche,\r\nquelques feuilles de thym et le toasté\r\ngraines dispersées sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:10:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11465,4385,'fr','Tostadas aux haricots épicés, oignons marinés et salade de radis','Le Tex-Mex est sain avec ces tortillas de maïs garnies de haricots chipotle, d''oignons rouges marinés, de coriandre et de citron vert','["2 oignons rouges, 1 tranché finement, 1 finement haché","2 citrons verts, jus de 1 et 1 coupé en quartiers","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés et rincés","4 tortillas de maïs","140 g de radis émincés","une grosse poignée de coriandre, hachée grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nMettez l''oignon émincé, le jus de citron vert et\r\nassaisonner dans un bol et réserver.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir\r\nl''oignon et l''ail hachés jusqu''à tendreté.\r\nIncorporer le cumin et faire revenir encore 1 minute.\r\nAjouter la purée de tomates, la pâte de chipotle et\r\nharicots, remuez, puis versez-y une demi-boîte d’eau.\r\nLaisser mijoter 5 mn, assaisonner, puis grossièrement\r\nréduire en purée. (Vous pouvez cuisiner quelques\r\nminutes de plus si c''est un peu liquide, ou ajoutez-en quelques-unes\r\ndes projections d''eau pour diluer.)","Pendant ce temps, badigeonnez les tortillas de\r\nle reste de l''huile et déposer sur une plaque allant au four\r\nfeuille. Cuire au four pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Propagation\r\nles tortillas avec le mélange de haricots.\r\nMélangez les radis et la coriandre avec\r\nles oignons marinés, puis versez dessus.\r\nServir avec des quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:10:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11466,4387,'fr','Saumon et oeufs au four','Faites quelque chose de différent avec vos œufs et votre saumon fumé en les cuisant dans un petit pain pour un brunch encore plus spécial.','["6 petits pains blancs croustillants (ceux aux graines de pavot sont ravissants)","25 g de beurre fondu","6 tranches de saumon fumé ou gravadlax","6 œufs moyens","quelques ciboulette ciselée"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nCoupez le dessus de chaque rouleau, puis délicatement\r\nretirez le pain à l''intérieur jusqu''à ce qu''il y ait\r\nun trou assez grand pour accueillir\r\nune tranche de saumon et un œuf. Organiser\r\nles petits pains sur une plaque à pâtisserie, en réservant le\r\nsommets. (Si vous le souhaitez, faites passer les milieux dans\r\nmiettes et conserver au congélateur pendant\r\nune autre recette.)","Badigeonner l''intérieur et les bords des rouleaux\r\navec un peu de beurre fondu, puis disposez\r\nune tranche de saumon à l''intérieur de chacun. Fissure\r\nun œuf dans chacun et assaisonner. Cuire au four pour\r\n10-15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient cuits à point\r\nvotre goût. Parsemer de ciboulette ciselée.\r\nFaire griller le dessus, badigeonner du reste\r\nbeurre, puis coupez-le en soldats et utilisez\r\ntremper dans les œufs."]','2026-01-11 00:10:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11467,4389,'fr','Pilaf aux champignons citronné','Si vous recherchez une alternative plus légère au risotto, ce pilaf aux champignons faible en gras est exactement ce qu''il vous faut.','["500 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 oignon, tranché","300 g de champignons mélangés, tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","200 g de mélange de riz basmati et de riz sauvage","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","petit bouquet de ciboulette ciselée","6 cuillères à soupe de fromage à pâte molle léger à l''ail et aux herbes"]','["Mettez 2 cuillères à soupe de bouillon dans une poêle antiadhésive,\r\npuis faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nramolli – ajoutez un peu plus de bouillon s’il\r\ncommence à sécher. Ajouter les champignons et\r\nl''ail et cuire encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez le\r\nle riz et le zeste et le jus de citron, en mélangeant bien.\r\nVerser le reste du bouillon et l''assaisonnement\r\net porter à ébullition. Baissez, couvrez\r\net laisser mijoter pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit\r\ntendre. Incorporer la moitié de chacune des ciboulette\r\net du fromage à pâte molle, puis servir garni de\r\nle reste de ciboulette et le fromage à pâte molle."]','2026-01-11 00:10:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11468,4391,'fr','Salade de nouilles aux crevettes et au pamplemousse rose','Adoptez une approche vietnamienne saine des salades en utilisant des nouilles vermicelles froides avec une vinaigrette sucrée, des crustacés, de la coriandre et de la menthe.','["200 g de nouilles de riz fines (vermicelles)","12 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson","jus 1 citron vert","2 cuillères à café de sucre de palme ou de cassonade molle","1 gros piment rouge, ½ coupé en dés, ½ tranché","2 pamplemousses roses, segmentés","½ concombre pelé, épépiné et tranché finement","2 carottes, coupées en allumettes","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","400 g de grosses crevettes cuites","une grosse poignée de menthe, feuilles cueillies","une grosse poignée de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Mettez les nouilles dans un bol, en cassant\r\nles lever un peu et couvrir d''ébullition\r\nl''eau de la bouilloire. Laisser tremper pendant\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter, rincer sous\r\nl''eau froide courante, puis laissez le\r\nnouilles pour bien les égoutter.","Dans le même bol, écrasez légèrement le\r\ntomates cerises – nous avons utilisé la fin de\r\nun rouleau à pâtisserie. Incorporer la sauce de poisson, le citron vert\r\njus, sucre et dés de piment. Goût pour le\r\njuste équilibre entre le sucré, l''aigre et le piquant\r\n– ajuster si nécessaire (voir conseil ci-dessous).","Mélangez les nouilles, puis ajoutez\r\ntous les autres ingrédients, sauf le\r\npiment tranché. Assaisonner et donner tout\r\nbien mélanger, puis diviser la salade de nouilles\r\nentre 6 plats de service et saupoudrer\r\nsur le piment avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:10:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11469,4393,'fr','Salade de poulet aux canneberges','Utilisez les restes de sauce aux canneberges dans cette salade saine. Ajoutez une boîte de haricots cannellini si vous souhaitez la grossir','["2 poitrines de poulet sans peau","4 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 oignons rouges, tranchés finement","200 g de feuilles mélangées","½ concombre épépiné et tranché","25 g de canneberges séchées","85 g de sauce aux canneberges","jus 1 citron vert"]','["Couper chaque poitrine de poulet en deux\r\nhorizontalement pour donner 4 seins fins,\r\npuis frottez avec la moitié de l''huile et\r\nsaison. Faire chauffer une friture antiadhésive\r\npoêler et faire revenir le poulet pendant 3 minutes\r\nde chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits.\r\nRéserver dans une assiette.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans le\r\nPoêler et faire revenir les oignons pendant 5 minutes.\r\nTrancher le poulet en ramassant les éventuels\r\njus de fruits et superposez-les avec le\r\noignons, feuilles, concombre et\r\ncanneberges séchées. Mélangez le\r\nsauce aux canneberges, jus de citron vert, 2 cuillères à soupe\r\nde l''eau et du poulet au repos\r\njus de fruits et arroser la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:10:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11470,4395,'fr','Tarte aux champignons, épinards et pommes de terre','Un repas végétarien faible en gras et super sain en milieu de semaine – vous pouvez même congeler les restes pour plus tard','["400 g de pousses d''épinards","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g de champignons, comme la châtaigne, le shiitake et le champignon de Paris","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","250 ml de bouillon de légumes (préparé à partir d''un demi-cube de bouillon de légumes faible en sodium)","300 g de pommes de terre nouvelles cuites, coupées en bouchées","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde en grains","1 cuillère à café de muscade fraîchement râpée","2 cuillères à soupe bombées de crème fraîche légère","3 feuilles de pâte filo","300 g chacun de haricots verts et de brocoli, cuits à la vapeur"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faire flétrir les épinards dans une passoire en versant dessus une bouilloire d''eau chaude.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir les champignons à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajouter l''ail et cuire 1 min, puis verser le bouillon, la moutarde, la muscade et les pommes de terre. Faire bouillonner quelques minutes jusqu''à réduction. Assaisonner, puis retirer du feu; ajouter la crème fraîche et les épinards. Verser dans un plat à tarte et laisser refroidir\r\npendant quelques minutes.","Badigeonner la pâte filo avec le reste de l''huile, les quarts de feuilles, puis les froisser sans serrer et les déposer sur la garniture à tarte. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Servir avec des légumes."]','2026-01-11 00:10:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11471,4397,'fr','Salade de sardines méditerranéenne','Une salade super saine et pleine de saveurs intenses avec du poisson gras, des olives et des câpres','["90 g de feuilles de salade","une poignée d''olives noires hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, égouttées","2 boîtes de 120 g de sardines à la sauce tomate, égouttées et sauce réservée","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge"]','["Répartissez les feuilles de salade dans 4 assiettes,\r\npuis saupoudrer d''olives et de câpres.\r\nCassez grossièrement les sardines et ajoutez-les\r\nla salade. Mélangez la sauce tomate avec le\r\nl''huile et le vinaigre et arroser la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:10:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11472,4399,'fr','Poulet chasseur','Rehaussez les poitrines de poulet avec une sauce tomate italienne au romarin et à l''ail, cuite comme une cocotte – c''est aussi un choix santé','["1 oignon, tranché","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de romarin hachées","4 poitrines de poulet","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic","légumes de saison préférés, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faire revenir l''oignon et l''ail dans l''huile\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez les tomates,\r\nromarin et assaisonnement, et cuire\r\npendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à épaississement.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nMettez le poulet sur une plaque à pâtisserie, dessus\r\navec la sauce et enfourner 15-20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits. Servir dispersé\r\nau basilic, avec votre légume préféré,\r\nsi tu veux."]','2026-01-11 00:10:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11473,4401,'fr','Oeufs au four aux épinards et tomates','Un plat rustique avec une délicieuse combinaison de saveurs et seulement quatre ingrédients, essayez de le préparer pour le brunch','["100 g d''épinards","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","4 œufs"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Mettre\r\nles épinards dans une passoire, puis versez\r\nsur une bouilloire d''eau bouillante pour flétrir le\r\nfeuilles. Essorez l''excès d''eau et\r\nrépartir dans 4 petits plats allant au four.","Mélangez les tomates avec les flocons de piment\r\net un peu d''assaisonnement, puis ajoutez-les au\r\nplats avec les épinards. Faites un petit\r\nbien au centre de chacun et craquer\r\nun œuf. Cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes ou plus\r\nselon la façon dont vous aimez vos œufs.\r\nServir avec du pain croustillant, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:10:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11474,4405,'fr','Courge farcie espagnole','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Comme sa cousine plus petite, la courgette, les courgettes en morceaux sont excellentes rôties avec une garniture au goût prononcé comme le paprika et le chorizo.','["1 moelle","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, coupé en dés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","100 g de chorizo ​​haché","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché et de thym séché","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","140 g de poivrons rouges rôtis en bocal, tranchés","poignée de persil haché","85 g de chapelure fraîche","100 g de râpé Manchego"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Couper\r\nla moelle en deux dans le sens de la longueur et cuillère\r\nau milieu. Mettez les moitiés, côté coupé\r\nvers le haut, dans un grand plat à rôtir et assaisonner.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole, ajoutez le\r\nl''oignon et faire suer à feu doux pendant\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez l''ail,\r\nchorizo, épices et herbes séchées. Cuisinier\r\npendant quelques minutes, puis ajoutez les tomates\r\net des poivrons. Baissez à un niveau bas\r\nlaisser mijoter et cuire 10 min, puis\r\nincorporer le persil.","Versez le mélange de tomates dans le\r\nmoitiés de moelle, couvrir de papier d''aluminium et\r\ncuire au four 30 mn. Saupoudrer sur le\r\nchapelure et Manchego, et\r\nremettre au four 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles miettes sont dorées et croustillantes,\r\net la moelle est tendre."]','2026-01-11 00:11:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11475,4407,'fr','Lasagnes de courgettes grillées et fruits de mer','Super saine et moins grasse qu''une lasagne traditionnelle, cette version est également beaucoup plus rapide à assembler','["1 cuillère à café d''huile","4 courgettes, tranchées dans le sens de la longueur","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","½ pot de 680 ml de passata à l''oignon et à l''ail","Sachet de 400 g de mélange de fruits de mer, décongelé si congelé","4 feuilles de lasagnes fraîches, coupées en deux","3 cuillères à soupe de parmesan râpé","3 cuillères à soupe de chapelure séchée","350 g de haricots verts, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer une plaque chauffante et badigeonnez-la d''un peu d''huile\r\nsur les courgettes. Cuisiner par lots\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement carbonisés. Assaisonner et\r\nrépartir sur le piment, puis réserver.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nVersez un peu de passata dans un plat moyen\r\nplat allant au four. Placez la moitié du\r\nfruits de mer dessus, puis assaisonner et\r\ngarnir d''un tiers des courgettes.","Garnir de 2 feuilles de pâtes, puis\r\nplus de sauce tomate, de fruits de mer,\r\ncourgettes, une autre couche de pâtes,\r\nplus de sauce tomate et terminer avec\r\nle reste des courgettes. Mélangez le\r\nParmesan et chapelure,\r\npuis répartissez dessus et laissez cuire pendant\r\n25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Vapeur\r\nou faire bouillir les haricots verts et servir\r\navec les lasagnes."]','2026-01-11 00:11:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11476,4409,'fr','Omelette ricotta, tomates et épinards','Bouchées de légumes saines et pleines de saveurs – un incontournable en milieu de semaine','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, finement tranché","300 g de tomates cerises","100 g de feuilles d''épinards","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic","100 g de gazon","6 œufs battus","salade, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nFaire chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive\r\net faites cuire l''oignon pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nramolli et légèrement doré. Ajoutez le\r\ntomates et mélanger pendant 1 minute pour ramollir.","Retirer du feu, ajouter les épinards\r\nfeuilles et basilic, et mélanger ensemble pour flétrir\r\nun peu. Transférez tous les ingrédients dans un\r\ncuisson rectangulaire graissée de 30 cm x 20 cm\r\nétain. Prenez de petites boules de ricotta et\r\nparsemer les légumes.","Assaisonnez les œufs et battez bien, puis\r\nverser sur les légumes et le fromage.\r\nCuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré pâle et fixé. Servir avec de la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:11:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11477,4411,'fr','Pommes de terre en chemise et fèves au lard maison','Les nuits froides nécessitent des aliments réconfortants, et il n''y a rien de mieux que des pommes de terre en robe des champs – améliorez votre santé avec des fèves au lard faites maison.','["4 pommes de terre au four","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 carotte, coupée en dés","1 branche de céleri, coupée en dés","Boîte de 400 g de haricots blancs égouttés","2 tomates hachées","1 cuillère à café de paprika – choisissez doux ou piquant selon le goût","1 cuillère à café de sauce Worcestershire","2 cuillères à soupe de ciboulette hachée, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nFrottez les pommes de terre et séchez-les bien, puis\r\npiquer à plusieurs endroits avec une fourchette. Cuire au four\r\ndirectement sur la grille du four pendant 1h à 1h30,\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient mous lorsqu''on les presse.","Au bout de 30 minutes, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et\r\ncuire doucement la carotte et le céleri pendant\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez les haricots,\r\ntomates et paprika et cuire doucement\r\npendant encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates\r\nsont ramollies et pulpeuses. Incorporer 100 ml\r\nl''eau et la sauce Worcestershire,\r\ncuire encore 5 minutes puis couvrir et\r\ngarder au chaud.","Ouvrir les pommes de terre et les verser à la cuillère\r\nles haricots. Parsemer de ciboulette et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11478,4415,'fr','Pilafs aux poivrons épicés','Ce souper végétarien coloré est super sain et peut être congelé en portions individuelles, vous pouvez donc en décongeler autant que vous en avez besoin.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cm de gingembre finement haché","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","200 g de riz basmati","850 ml de bouillon de légumes","140 g de lentilles rouges lavées et égouttées","200 g de feuilles d''épinards hachées","une poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées","8 poivrons"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole avec\r\nun couvercle. Ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre,\r\npuis cuire doucement pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.\r\nIncorporer la purée de tomates et les épices, et\r\ncuire encore 1 min. Ajoutez le riz, remuez\r\npour enrober, puis verser le bouillon. Apporter à\r\nfaire bouillir, verser les lentilles, couvrir avec le\r\ncouvercle et laisser cuire à feu doux pendant\r\n15 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les lentilles et le riz soient\r\ncuit. Incorporer les épinards et la menthe (voir conseil ci-dessous, en cas de congélation).","Utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour trancher le dessus\r\nchaque poivron. Découpez la tige du milieu\r\net retirez toutes les graines. Soigneusement\r\ncoupez légèrement les bas pour qu''ils tiennent debout\r\ndroit, mais la garniture ne tombera pas.\r\nRemplissez chaque poivron avec le mélange de riz et\r\nplacez le couvercle dessus. Cuire au four ou envelopper hermétiquement dans un film alimentaire ou des sacs de congélation et congeler.","Pour cuisiner, décongelez complètement les poivrons si\r\ncongelé. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nPlacer les poivrons sur un plat légèrement graissé\r\nplaque à pâtisserie et cuire 25 à 30 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce que les poivrons soient ramollis. Servir\r\navec une salade verte agrémentée de concombre,\r\ndes herbes et une cuillerée de yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:11:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11479,4417,'fr','Se déplacer','Utilisez du boulgour comme base pour cette salade du Moyen-Orient composée de légumes verts supersains, de fromage feta et d''épices.','["100g de blé boulgour","100g de chou frisé","gros bouquet de menthe, hachée grossièrement","botte d''oignon nouveau, tranché","½ concombre, coupé en dés","4 tomates épépinées et hachées","pincée de cannelle moulue","pincée de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","jus et zeste d''un demi citron","100 g de fromage feta émietté","4 laitues Baby Gem, feuilles séparées, pour servir"]','["Versez le boulghar dans un\r\nbol résistant à la chaleur et couvrez-le simplement avec\r\neau bouillante, puis couvrir de film alimentaire\r\nfilmer et laisser reposer 10-15 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à tendreté. Mettez le chou frisé dans un aliment\r\nrobot et pulser pour hacher finement.","Incorporer le chou frisé, la menthe, les oignons nouveaux,\r\nconcombre et tomates à travers\r\nle blé boulghar. Assaisonner avec le\r\ncannelle et piment de la Jamaïque, puis assaisonner avec\r\nl''huile d''olive et le jus de citron au goût.\r\nRépartir sur le zeste de citron et la feta.\r\nPour servir, laissez tout le monde ramasser la salade\r\nsur des feuilles de laitue Baby Gem."]','2026-01-11 00:11:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11480,4419,'fr','Tortilla de pommes de terre et paprika','Cette omelette espagnole traditionnelle et épaisse est garnie de pommes de terre nouvelles et parfumée aux herbes.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, extrémités parées, tranchées épaisses","1 petit oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché ou 3 cuillères à soupe de persil haché, plus quelques feuilles supplémentaires pour garnir (facultatif)","6 gros œufs"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive profonde de 20 cm.\r\npoêle à frire. Faire revenir les pommes de terre, l''oignon et\r\nl''ail pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Incorporer le\r\npaprika et faire revenir encore 1 min.","Battez les herbes séchées ou fraîches dans le\r\noeufs assaisonnés, puis verser dans\r\nla poêle. Remuer plusieurs fois pendant que l''œuf\r\ncommence à prendre au fond de la casserole,\r\npuis laissez cuire lentement sur une\r\nfeu très doux pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que ce soit pris, sauf\r\npour le tout en haut.","Faites glisser délicatement la tortilla sur un\r\nassiette. Remettez-le dans la poêle, avec le\r\nle dessus non cuit maintenant sur le dessous, et\r\ncuire encore 1 à 2 minutes. Garnir avec\r\npersil, si vous en utilisez, enveloppez-le dans du papier d''aluminium et servez\r\ntiède ou réfrigéré."]','2026-01-11 00:11:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11481,4421,'fr','Chou-fleur crémeux au four avec chapelure d''amandes','Essayez notre chou-fleur entier cuit au four avec des miettes d''amandes pour une excellente pièce maîtresse végétarienne lors d''un festin familial. Le pain croustillant à l''ail se marie bien avec','["1 gros chou-fleur, feuilles extérieures parées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons, hachés très finement","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ cuillère à café de macis moulu","4 brins de thym, feuilles cueillies sur 2, 2 laissées entières","4 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","750 ml de lait d''amande non sucré","150 ml de crème de soja","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète","25 g de chapelure séchée (assurez-vous qu''elle soit végétalienne, si nécessaire)","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées","pain végétalien à l''ail et une salade verte avec une vinaigrette citronnée, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Coupez suffisamment de tige de chou-fleur pour qu''elle repose à plat, puis coupez une croix profonde à la base de la tige. Posez le chou-fleur sur un morceau de papier d''aluminium, puis frottez-le avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Saupoudrer de 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, bien assaisonner, puis couvrir hermétiquement avec du papier d''aluminium, en scellant l''eau et le chou-fleur à l''intérieur de l''emballage. Mettez dans un plat allant au four et laissez cuire 1h30.","Pendant ce temps, faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel et 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et translucides. Incorporez l''ail, le macis, les feuilles de thym et la farine et remuez pendant 2 minutes, puis ajoutez le lait d''amande. Portez à ébullition en remuant, puis assaisonnez. Une fois légèrement épaissi, retirer du feu et incorporer la crème de soja et la moutarde.","Frotter la chapelure avec le reste de l''huile. Incorporer les amandes.","Découvrez le chou-fleur et remettez-le dans le plat. Versez la sauce sur tout le chou-fleur et dans le plat. Répartissez les miettes dessus et déchirez dessus les deux brins de thym entiers. Allumez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Cuire au four encore 15-20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la sauce bouillonne et épaississe légèrement et que la chapelure et le chou-fleur soient dorés. Couper en quartiers et servir avec une salade verte et du pain à l''ail."]','2026-01-11 00:11:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11482,4423,'fr','Tarte aux pommes, fromage et pommes de terre','Ajoutez une touche salée à la tarte aux pommes avec des pommes de terre, du fromage et de l''oignon, ainsi que de la moutarde et du thym. Les saveurs sucrées et salées créent une tarte époustouflante','["30g de beurre salé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 gros oignons, coupés en deux et finement tranchés","½ botte de thym, feuilles cueillies","30g de farine nature","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","450 g de pommes de terre (nous avons utilisé Maris Piper), coupées en morceaux de 2 à 3 cm","3 pommes pelées, épépinées et coupées en morceaux de 1 à 2 cm","150 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","300 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","70 g de cheddar râpé","150 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","1 œuf battu"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la pâte. Versez la farine, le fromage et une pincée de sel dans un grand mélange. Ajoutez le beurre et frottez-le du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Mélanger avec 4 à 5 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide et former une pâte. Filmer et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Pour faire la garniture, faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole moyenne à feu moyen, puis ajoutez l''huile et les oignons et laissez cuire 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient caramélisés. Ajoutez le thym et faites revenir encore 1 min. Versez la farine et mélangez. Incorporez progressivement le bouillon, en l''ajoutant par petites quantités pour éviter la formation de grumeaux. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Incorporer la moutarde et le vinaigre vers la fin de la cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les pommes de terre dans une grande casserole d''eau froide, portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient à peine cuites et qu''elles conservent leur forme. Bien égoutter, puis incorporer à la sauce. Ajoutez les pommes, le cheddar et un peu d''assaisonnement, et remuez à nouveau. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Versez la garniture dans un plat allant au four ovale de 28 cm (le nôtre mesurait 28 x 18,5 x 6,5 cm). Pendant qu''elle refroidit, étalez la pâte sur une surface légèrement saupoudrée de farine jusqu''à l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Coupez-les en bandes d''environ 1 cm de large. Disposez la moitié des bandes sur le plat horizontalement en laissant un espace de quelques millimètres entre elles, puis, une à une, tissez les bandes restantes verticalement, selon une technique de superposition et de dessous, en les espaçant également de quelques millimètres. Reroulez les garnitures et coupez-les en fleurs, feuilles ou autres formes pour décorer, si vous le souhaitez (voir conseil ci-dessous). Disposez dessus les formes de pâtisserie éventuelles, puis badigeonnez-les d''œuf battu.","Cuire au four pendant 50 minutes en surveillant – vous devrez peut-être recouvrir le dessus de papier d''aluminium s''il commence à dorer trop rapidement. Laisser refroidir au moins 10 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11483,4425,'fr','Smoothie aux cerises','Essayez d’utiliser des cerises surgelées pour préparer facilement ce smoothie vibrant. Servir seul ou avec un brunch. Les enfants vont l''adorer aussi','["300 g de cerises fraîches ou surgelées, dénoyautées","150g de yaourt nature","1 grosse banane, tranchée","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Versez tous les ingrédients dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajustez l''épaisseur à votre convenance avec 50 à 100 ml d''eau froide. Servir dans quatre verres ou réfrigérer jusqu''à 24 heures, en remuant bien avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11484,4427,'fr','Smoothie puissant aux bleuets et à la banane','Ajoutez du tofu riche en protéines à ce smoothie aux myrtilles et à la banane pour le rendre vraiment crémeux et vous rassasier jusqu''à l''heure du déjeuner. Servir avec du pain grillé ou des céréales','["2 bananes mûres, pelées","125 g de myrtilles (fraîches ou surgelées)","Paquet de 300 g de tofu soyeux, égoutté","2 cuillères à soupe de flocons d''avoine"]','["Mixez tous les ingrédients dans un mixeur avec 300 ml d''eau. Boire immédiatement ou transférer dans une bouteille pour plus tard, en agitant bien avant de boire."]','2026-01-11 00:11:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11485,4429,'fr','Kofte de porc et de pommes de terre à la friteuse','Les kofte constituent un repas facile en milieu de semaine, et si vous préparez le mélange à l''avance, le dîner peut être prêt en seulement 15 minutes – nous utilisons des pommes de terre pour faire avancer la viande.','["500 g de porc haché","1 grosse pomme de terre rouge d''environ 250 g, lavée et grossièrement râpée","1 oignon rouge, grossièrement râpé","2 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","25 g de persil frais finement haché","spray d''huile d''olive, pour la friteuse à air","150 g de boulgour ou de couscous","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 citron , coupé en six quartiers","½ concombre , coupé en dés","4 tomates , hachées","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe fraîche ou de coriandre, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement","Pot de 200 g de feta fouettée, tzatziki ou houmous, pour servir"]','["Pour préparer la salade, mettez le boulgour ou le couscous dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et versez dessus 300 ml d''eau juste bouillie. Couvrir d''une assiette et réserver jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Chauffez la friteuse à air à 190°C. Mettez le porc haché dans un grand bol et ajoutez la pomme de terre râpée, l''oignon et l''ail, les graines de cumin, le paprika fumé, le piment, le persil et un peu de sel et de poivre. Bien mélanger, puis diviser en huit boules de taille égale.","Pressez fermement chaque boulette de viande en forme de boudin, ne vous inquiétez pas si elles ne sont pas parfaitement régulières. Mettre dans le panier de la friteuse, vaporiser d''huile et cuire pendant 15 à 18 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et complètement cuits.","Pour préparer la vinaigrette, mélangez l''huile d''olive et le jus de deux quartiers de citron au boulgour avec un peu de sel et de poivre. Incorporer le concombre, les tomates et les herbes et répartir dans les assiettes de service. Garnir de kofte et servir avec une cuillerée de feta ou de houmous fouetté et les quartiers de citron restants."]','2026-01-11 00:11:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11486,4431,'fr','Gratin de courgettes et tomates au four','Profitez au maximum des courgettes et des tomates dans ce gratin, avec de la mozzarella fondue, du basilic frais et une garniture de chapelure croustillante. C''est un excellent plat à congeler','["2 courgettes moyennes, tranchées dans le sens de la longueur d''environ ½ cm d''épaisseur","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour le plat et pour arroser","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées, mixées au robot culinaire","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","une poignée de basilic frais (facultatif)","50 g de farine de polenta ou de semoule","50g de farine nature","1 gros oeuf, battu","1 boule de mozzarella tranchée (225g)","10 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé","50g de chapelure"]','["Saupoudrez les courgettes d''une pincée de flocons de sel marin et disposez-les sur une assiette avec une autre assiette dessus. Mettez un poids ou une boîte de conserve dessus pour aider à expulser le liquide.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle antiadhésive et ajoutez les tomates et l''ail. Cuire à feu moyen en remuant pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Déchirez le basilic, si vous en utilisez, et assaisonnez.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et huiler un plat à rôtir. Mélangez les farines dans un bol. Videz l''eau de la courgette. Trempez les tranches de courgettes dans l''œuf, puis dans la farine et disposez-les en couche sur le fond du plat. Garnir de quelques tranches de mozzarella, suivies d''une couche de sauce tomate, et répéter avec une autre couche de courgette, de mozzarella et de sauce. Mélangez le fromage et la chapelure ensemble, puis répartissez-les sur le dessus.","Arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive et cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bouillonnants. Servir avec une salade d''oignons rouges aux herbes et du pain pour l''éponger, si vous le souhaitez. Peut être congelé jusqu''à deux mois."]','2026-01-11 00:11:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11487,4433,'fr','Wraps aux falafels aux edamames','Préparez des falafels avec des haricots edamame et des pois chiches pour réaliser ces savoureux wraps. Si vous manquez de temps, vous pouvez utiliser du houmous et des falafels du commerce.','["100 g de haricots edamame surgelés","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","1 petite gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","une petite poignée de persil haché grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour rouler et brosser","¼ de chou rouge, finement râpé","½ citron, jus","4 pains plats ou wraps","4 cuillères à soupe de houmous","¼ de concombre, haché","1 piment rouge, tranché finement (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mettez tous les ingrédients des falafels, sauf l''huile, dans un mixeur et assaisonnez légèrement. Mélangez jusqu’à obtenir un mélange lisse – quelques morceaux d’edamame suffisent.","Avec les mains huilées, prélevez des portions de la taille d''une cuillère à soupe du mélange, roulez-les en boules (vous devriez en obtenir 16) et déposez-les sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Appuyez doucement sur chaque falafel avec la paume de votre main. Badigeonnez chaque falafel d''un peu d''huile, puis enfournez pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et doré.","Mélangez le chou avec une pincée de sel et le jus de citron et laissez mariner 5 minutes. Réchauffez les wraps et tartinez-les de houmous. Garnir de chou, de falafel (5 chacun pour les adultes, 3 pour les enfants), de concombre, de persil supplémentaire, le cas échéant, et de piment pour ceux qui ne craignent pas les aliments épicés."]','2026-01-11 00:11:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11488,4435,'fr','Bouillie de gâteau aux carottes','Essayez une variante du porridge avec notre version gâteau aux carottes, aux saveurs de carottes, de raisins secs, de cannelle et de muscade. Plein d''énergie, il vous préparera pour la journée','["2 petites carottes pelées et râpées","180 g de flocons d''avoine","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","râpé de muscade fraîche","75g de raisins secs","850 ml de lait (le lait de vache ou le lait végétal fonctionnent bien)","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre de noix, comme l''amande (facultatif)","miel, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients sauf le miel dans une casserole et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 10-15 minutes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que les flocons d''avoine et les carottes soient tendres et que le porridge soit crémeux.","Ajoutez un peu plus de lait pendant la cuisson s''il est trop épais. Servir avec un peu plus de lait et un filet de miel, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11489,4437,'fr','Salade de poulet au pesto','Servez cette salade de poulet au pesto et de couscous dans des feuilles de laitue pour un souper sain. Avec des tomates séchées et des pignons de pin ajoutés, il a beaucoup de texture','["50 g de couscous","2 cuillères à soupe de pesto","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt sans gras","2 poitrines de poulet cuites sans peau, émincées, ou 200 g de restes de poulet rôti, émincés","½ petit bouquet de basilic, feuilles cueillies et déchirées, plus quelques petites feuilles pour servir","½ concombre, haché","2 tomates séchées dans l''huile, égouttées et tranchées","2 laitues Little Gem, feuilles séparées","2 cuillères à café de pignons de pin grillés"]','["Mettez le couscous dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur et couvrez de 100 ml d''eau bouillante. Incorporer 1 cuillère à soupe de pesto. Couvrir et laisser reposer 8 min.","Remuer le couscous avec une fourchette, puis incorporer le reste du pesto, le yaourt et un peu d''assaisonnement. Incorporer le poulet, le basilic, le concombre et les tomates.","Versez le mélange à couscous dans les feuilles de laitue et mangez avec vos doigts, ou servez sur la laitue comme une salade. Répartir sur les pignons de pin et davantage de basilic avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11490,4439,'fr','Merlu fumé, haricots et légumes verts','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Grillez des filets de poisson blanc et servez-les sur du chorizo, des haricots cannellini et des épinards pour un dîner rapide qui contient 3 de vos 5 par jour.','["huile d''olive douce","½ paquet de 200 g de chorizo ​​cru à cuire (nous avons utilisé Unearthed Alfresco Smoked)","1 oignon, finement haché","260 g d''épinards","2 x 140 g de filets de merlu sans peau","½ cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","1 piment rouge épépiné et râpé","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés","jus ½ citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","Mayonnaise rapide à l''ail (facultatif) - voir la recette en conseil"]','["Faites bouillir une bouilloire pleine d’eau et faites chauffer le gril à feu vif. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une grande poêle. Pressez la viande du chorizo ​​directement dans la poêle. Ajouter l''oignon et faire revenir 5 minutes en écrasant la viande avec une spatule jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit brisée, dorée et entourée de son jus. L''oignon sera également tendre et doré.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les épinards dans une passoire, versez-y lentement l''eau bouillie pour les flétrir, puis passez-les sous le robinet froid. Essorez l''excès d''eau avec vos mains, puis réservez. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium, frotter avec un peu d''huile et déposer le poisson dessus. Assaisonner, saupoudrer de paprika fumé et arroser d''un peu d''huile.","Versez le piment dans la poêle avec les saucisses, faites revenir encore 1 minute, puis ajoutez les haricots, les épinards, le jus de citron et l''huile d''olive extra vierge. Laissez tiédir doucement, puis assaisonnez selon votre goût.","Faites griller le poisson pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu’à ce qu’il soit feuilleté mais pas sec – vous n’aurez pas besoin de le retourner. Verser le mélange de haricots dans des assiettes, puis garnir délicatement de poisson et du jus du plateau. Servir avec une cuillerée de mayonnaise à l''ail rapide (voir la recette à droite), si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11491,4441,'fr','Salade de légumes rôtis à la menthe et houmous','Combinez des légumes rôtis avec des pois chiches et du fromage feta dans cette salade d''inspiration grecque qui fournit un impressionnant 4 de vos 5 par jour','["4 panais, pelés et coupés en quartiers","4 carottes, coupées en quartiers","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","Paquet de 500 g de betterave cuite (pas au vinaigre), égouttée et coupée en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","200g pot houmous","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","200 g de fromage à salade à la grecque ou de feta en bloc"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger les panais, les carottes, les graines de cumin et les pois chiches avec l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un grand plat à rôtir. Cuire 30 minutes en remuant à mi-cuisson.","Ajoutez la betterave rouge dans le moule et arrosez-la de miel, puis remettez au four 10 min. Étalez finement le houmous sur une grande assiette ou répartissez-le dans 4 assiettes. Lorsque les légumes sont prêts, arrosez de vinaigre et mélangez dans le moule. Versez les légumes rôtis sur le houmous, parsemez de menthe et de fromage, arrosez du jus de la boîte et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11492,4443,'fr','Légumes rôtis épicés et lentilles','Préparez-en 3 impressionnants sur 5 par jour avec ce plat de lentilles végétarien épicé rempli de courge musquée rôtie, de poivrons et d''oignons.','["1 courge musquée petite à moyenne (environ 950 g/2 lb 2 oz)","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché épaisse","3 poivrons (un mélange de rouge, d''orange et de jaune en paquet), épépinés et coupés en lanières de 1 cm ou ½ po de large","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry","2 boîtes de 400 g de lentilles du Puy égouttées et rincées","150 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","une grosse poignée de coriandre hachée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. À l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, épluchez la courge musquée. Coupez-la en deux dans le sens de la longueur, ôtez les graines, puis coupez-la en tranches de 1 cm d''épaisseur dans le sens de la largeur de la courge.","Mettez les tranches de courge dans un grand plat à rôtir avec l''oignon, les poivrons et l''ail. Mélangez l''huile avec la pâte de curry et arrosez les légumes en filet. Bien mélanger pour bien enrober le mélange de curry et assaisonner.","Rôtir pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à ramollir. Ajouter les lentilles et le bouillon dans le plat à rôtir et mélanger. Remettre au four encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres. Incorporer la coriandre et servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:11:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11493,4445,'fr','Burritos marathoniens','Si vous êtes un coureur passionné, mangez des repas nutritifs adaptés à votre programme d''entraînement. Ces enveloppements mexicains énergisants sont parfaits pour le fitness','["300 g de riz brun","½ petit paquet de coriandre hachée","jus 1 citron vert","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","2 cuillères à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 grosses tomates hachées","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","½ petit paquet de coriandre hachée","jus de 2 citrons verts","2 avocats, dénoyautés et pelés","grandes tortillas complètes, yaourt nature, moitiés de citron vert à presser et cheddar râpé (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le riz dans une casserole moyenne avec 600 ml d''eau froide et une pincée de sel si vous le souhaitez. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez mijoter doucement pendant environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que toute l''eau soit absorbée. Éteignez le feu et laissez reposer encore 10 minutes sans être dérangé. Remuez le riz et ajoutez la coriandre et le jus de citron vert.","Pour les haricots noirs, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et ajoutez l''ail, le chipotle, le cumin, le sucre et le vinaigre, et faites cuire le tout 1 min. Ajoutez les haricots et les tomates, remuez le tout et laissez mijoter à découvert pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à épaississement.","Pour la salsa et le guacamole, mélangez les tomates avec l''oignon, la coriandre, le jus de citron vert et l''assaisonnement. Versez la moitié de la salsa dans un autre bol et écrasez-y les avocats pour faire du guacamole. Enveloppez le tout dans des tortillas complètes réchauffées garnies de yaourt nature, de jus de citron vert et de fromage râpé, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11494,4447,'fr','Wraps de beignets d''agneau et de pois chiches','Les galettes d''agneau et de pois chiches épicées avec du yaourt, de la coriandre et de la salade constituent la garniture parfaite pour un pain plat.','["1 boîte de 400 g et 1 boîte de 210 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","1 oeuf","Paquet de 250 g de viande hachée d''agneau maigre","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","¼ petit paquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 grandes tortillas roulées","1 laitue romaine, râpée","4 tomates, tranchées","1 petit oignon rouge, tranché finement","Pot de 150 g de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","frites au four, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Au robot culinaire, mixez les pois chiches avec l''œuf pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à obtenir presque une purée, mais il reste quelques morceaux. Verser dans un bol et incorporer le hachis, les épices, les deux tiers de l''ail, le piment et la coriandre. Assaisonnez bien et formez 12 petits beignets.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites cuire les beignets par lots pendant 4 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants à l''extérieur et bien cuits.","Garnir chaque wrap d''une bonne poignée de laitue râpée, de tomate, d''oignon rouge et de 3 beignets. Mélangez le yaourt avec le reste d''ail et versez-en un peu sur les beignets. Enveloppez et rentrez, avec des chips à part, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11495,4449,'fr','Fajitas aux champignons et houmous à l''avocat','Obtenez quatre de vos 5 par jour en une seule bouffée grâce à ces tortillas aux champignons épicés, houmous à l''avocat et oignons grillés','["1 gros avocat, dénoyauté, pelé et haché","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 tomates épépinées et coupées en dés","1 oignon rouge, coupé en rondelles épaisses","2 gros champignons plats tranchés épaissement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de mélange d''épices pour fajita","4 tortillas","laitue Little Gem râpée et sauce Tabasco, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez l''avocat, les pois chiches, l''ail, le zeste et le jus de citron dans un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse. Verser dans un bol, assaisonner et incorporer les tomates.","Arrosez l’oignon et les champignons d’huile et saupoudrez d’assaisonnement pour fajita. Faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif et faites revenir l''oignon 2 min de chaque côté, puis retirez-le de la poêle et réservez au chaud. Cuire les champignons 2 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et dorés par endroits.","Étalez un peu d''houmous d''avocat au milieu de chaque wrap et garnissez de champignons et d''oignons. Ajoutez de la laitue râpée et un peu de Tabasco, si vous le souhaitez, et terminez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11496,4451,'fr','Nachos plus légers','Réduisez le gras de ce plateau de partage mexicain avec quelques échanges simples. Nos chips tortilla sont garnies de haricots et de salsa','["5 tortillas de maïs moelleuses","1½ cuillère à café d''huile de colza","1 piment jalapeno épépiné, coupé en fines lanières","100 g de mozzarella râpée","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche demi-écrémée","½ petit paquet de feuilles de coriandre hachées","2 avocats moyens mûrs, coupés en deux, dénoyautés, pelés et hachés grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert","2 oignons nouveaux, extrémités parées, finement hachés","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","quelques gouttes de sauce Tabasco","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés et rincés","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux ou moyen","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","4 tomates épépinées, hachées finement","¼ petit oignon rouge, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Pour chaque tortilla, badigeonner les deux côtés d''un peu d''huile et couper en 12 quartiers. Répéter. Mettez tous les quartiers sur 2 grandes plaques à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four environ 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Retirer et réserver. Montez le four à 200C/180C/gaz 6.","Pour le guacamole, mettez les avocats hachés dans un bol et écrasez-les grossièrement à la fourchette en gardant un peu de texture. Incorporer le jus de citron vert, les oignons nouveaux, la coriandre et assaisonner avec le Tabasco et l''assaisonnement. Annuler.","Pour les haricots, versez-les dans un bol, ajoutez les poudres d''ail, de piment et de cumin, écrasez-les grossièrement avec une fourchette, puis mélangez avec environ 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, ou suffisamment pour obtenir une purée grossière. Assaisonner et réserver.","Pour la salsa, mélanger les tomates, l''oignon, l''ail, le jus de lime et l''huile. Assaisonner et réserver.","Dix minutes avant d’être prêt à servir, répartissez les chips tortilla sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie ou un plat allant au four. Répartissez les haricots en petits tas sur les chips, puis versez sur la salsa (si la salsa a été préparée à l''avance, utilisez une écumoire pour laisser derrière vous tout liquide de tomate qui pourrait ramollir les chips). Répartir sur le piment jalapeño et la mozzarella.","Cuire au four pendant 4 à 5 minutes, juste le temps de faire fondre le fromage et de réchauffer les choses, mais sans trop faire dorer les chips tortilla. Retirer et verser sur la crème fraîche, parsemer de coriandre et mettre le guacamole dans 1 ou 2 petites assiettes à côté. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:11:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11497,4453,'fr','Curry de légumes d''hiver et raita fruitée','Utilisez des légumes-racines rustiques dans ce pot à épices d''inspiration asiatique. Nous avons utilisé de la citrouille, des carottes et des panais, accompagnés de tomates','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 oignons, tranchés finement","½ citrouille, courge d''hiver ou courge musquée, coupée en cubes","4 carottes, coupées en bâtonnets","2 panais, coupés en bâtonnets","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry (ou alternative sans gluten)","8 grosses tomates mûres, 2 coupées en quartiers","6 gousses d''ail, pelées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché","petit paquet de coriandre hachée","200 g de riz basmati brun","6 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature faible en gras","100 g de mangues coupées en cubes","1 cuillère à soupe de chutney de mangue","petit paquet d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à couvercle. Ajoutez les oignons et faites cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Incorporer le potiron, les carottes et les panais et cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez la pâte de curry et laissez cuire encore 3 minutes.","Dans un bol, fouettez ensemble les tomates entières, l''ail et le gingembre jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis versez sur les légumes en ajoutant 200 ml d''eau. Gardez une poignée de coriandre pour servir et incorporez le reste. Mettez le couvercle et laissez mijoter pendant 40 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres. Découvrir, incorporer les quartiers de tomates et réduire pour épaissir la sauce.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions du paquet. Mélangez le yaourt, la mangue et le chutney dans un petit bol. Versez le riz dans un plat de service et parsemez le curry du reste de coriandre et des amandes. Assaisonner, puis servir avec le riz et le yaourt fruité."]','2026-01-11 00:11:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11498,4455,'fr','Plateau d''épinards, ricotta et poulet','Ce dîner de poulet sain est accompagné de poivrons rôtis, de courgettes, d''oignons et de tomates – quatre des 5 recommandés par jour.','["3 x sachets de bébés épinards","4 cuillères à soupe de ricotta","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","quelques grains de muscade","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","50 g de chapelure fraîche, assaisonnée","3 courgettes coupées en bâtonnets","2 poivrons, tranchés","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers, racines intactes","250 g de tomates cerises de vigne","4 gousses d''ail"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettez les épinards dans une grande passoire et versez dessus 1 à 2 bouilloires d''eau bouillante pour les faire flétrir. Laissez égoutter quelques minutes, puis essorez le plus d''eau possible. Hacher, mettre dans un bol et incorporer la ricotta, le zeste de citron, la muscade et beaucoup d''assaisonnement.","À l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, coupez une fente sur le côté de chaque poitrine de poulet et utilisez vos doigts pour faire une petite poche. Versez le mélange dans les 4 magrets. Frotter avec 2 cuillères à café d''huile et presser la chapelure dessus, puis disposer le poulet dans un plat à rôtir.","Mettez les légumes sur une autre plaque, arrosez du reste d''huile et assaisonnez bien. Faites cuire le poulet et les légumes pendant environ 30 minutes, en remuant les légumes une fois. Retirez-le lorsque le poulet est bien cuit et que la chapelure est dorée.","Retirez l''ail ramolli des légumes et écrasez-le avec le jus de citron, puis mélangez-le avec les légumes rôtis et servez avec le poulet."]','2026-01-11 00:11:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11499,4457,'fr','Pittas aux œufs et légumes','Garnissez des poches de pain complet avec des aubergines, des betteraves et des carottes saines, puis ajoutez un yaourt à l''ail et à l''aneth et des œufs.','["1 aubergine, coupée en rondelles épaisses","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa","2 œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à café de nectar d''agave ou de sucre en poudre doré","1 betterave crue, râpée","1 grosse carotte, pelée et coupée en julienne","½ petit oignon rouge, tranché très finement","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 pains pitta complets"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Disposer les tranches d''aubergines sur une plaque à pâtisserie, assaisonner, badigeonner d''huile et enfourner 15 min. Retourner, tartiner de harissa et enfourner encore 5 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, plongez délicatement les œufs dans une casserole d’eau bouillante, baissez le feu et laissez mijoter 10 minutes. Passer sous l''eau froide pour refroidir, peler et réserver.","Dans un bol, mélangez le vinaigre et l''agave ou le sucre avec un peu d''assaisonnement, puis versez la betterave, la carotte et l''oignon. Dans un autre bol, mélanger le yaourt, l''aneth, l''ail et l''assaisonnement. Faites griller les pittas et divisez-les en deux. Coupez les œufs en tranches et mettez-les dans les pittas avec les rondelles d''aubergines épicées et un peu de salade de betterave rouge. Verser le yaourt et servir avec le reste d''aubergine, de salade et de yaourt en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:11:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11500,4459,'fr','Paprikash aux champignons','Cette sauce végétarienne est parfumée au cumin, au paprika et au persil. Servir sur des pâtes ou des pommes de terre en veste','["½ cuillère à café de graines de carvi","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","300 g de tasse de champignons coupés en quartiers","1 gros poivron vert épépiné et coupé en morceaux","2 cuillères à café de paprika doux fumé","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cube de bouillon de légumes (ou alternative sans gluten)","4 cuillères à soupe de crème sure","persil haché (facultatif)","pâtes, pommes de terre en veste de micro-ondes ou pain croustillant à l''ail, pour servir"]','["Faire chauffer un grand sauté ? Dans une poêle ou un wok, ajoutez les graines de carvi et faites légèrement griller sur le feu pendant quelques secondes. Ajoutez l''huile, puis versez l''oignon, les champignons et le poivre, et assaisonnez bien (le sel aidera à extraire l''humidité des champignons). Cuire, en remuant fréquemment, pendant environ 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient ramollis et que l''oignon commence à dorer.","Incorporer le paprika aux légumes, ajouter les tomates, le bouillon et une demi-boîte d''eau et laisser cuire 5 minutes. Garnir les portions de crème sure et de persil, le cas échéant, et servir avec des pâtes, des pommes de terre en veste ou du pain à l''ail."]','2026-01-11 00:11:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11501,4461,'fr','Salade de quinoa, courge et brocoli','Combinez cette céréale saine avec des ingrédients végétariens. Fromage feta, graines de citrouille, canneberges, persil et courge musquée s''associent à merveille','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","175 g de morceaux de courge musquée surgelés","140 g de brocoli, tiges tranchées, dessus coupé en petits bouquets","1 cuillère à soupe de feuille de thym frais","Paquet de 250 g de quinoa rouge et blanc prêt à consommer","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","25 g de canneberges séchées","une poignée de graines de citrouille (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","50 g de fromage feta émietté"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok avec un couvercle, ajoutez l''oignon et l''ail et faites revenir pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis, puis retirez-les du wok avec une écumoire. Ajoutez la courge, remuez autour du wok jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à colorer, puis ajoutez le brocoli. Saupoudrer de 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et de thym, couvrir la poêle et cuire à la vapeur pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, versez le quinoa dans un bol et faites-le gonfler. Ajouter le persil, les canneberges, les graines (le cas échéant), l''oignon et l''ail cuits et le vinaigre balsamique, et bien mélanger. Mélanger les légumes avec la feta. Se conserve 2 jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:11:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11502,4463,'fr','Galettes de pois chiches avec salade de carottes et raisins secs','Ces galettes végétariennes relevées d''harissa sont accompagnées d''une salade croquante de cresson, courgette et radis dans une vinaigrette légère.','["400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 gros œuf","1 cuillère à soupe d''amande moulue","2 cuillères à café d''harissa","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","3 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza, pour la friture","1 cuillère à soupe de raisins secs","1 carotte, coupée en rubans avec un éplucheur","1 courgette coupée en rubans avec un économe","5 radis, tranchés finement","2 poignées d''un sachet de cresson, roquette et épinards","1 cuillère à café d''huile de chanvre ou de colza et de vinaigre de vin blanc ou de quartiers de citron (facultatif)"]','["Versez les pois chiches, l''ail, l''œuf, les amandes, l''harissa et le cumin dans un bol et mixez avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer le persil. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et versez-y le mélange en 8 grosses cuillerées espacées. Cuire 5 min de chaque côté.","Pour la salade, mélangez les raisins secs et tous les légumes ensemble, mais n’arrosez pas d’huile et de vinaigre avant d’être sur le point de manger. Si vous vous mettez au travail, ajoutez un quartier de citron à presser à la place de la vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:11:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11503,4467,'fr','Bol de chili au bœuf et aux haricots avec yaourt au chipotle','Le chili con carne est garni d''un mélange de haricots sains aromatisés à la pâte de piment fumé.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","Paquet de 250 g de bœuf haché extra maigre","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte chipotle, plus un peu plus pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de mélange d''assaisonnement cajun","2 boîtes de 400 g de salade de haricots mélangés, égouttée","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cube de bouillon de bœuf faible en sodium","2 carrés de chocolat noir 70% cacao","petit paquet de coriandre hachée","riz brun cuit et yaourt grec faible en gras, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir l''oignon à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez le bœuf avec un peu de poivre noir et un peu de sel, en brisant les grumeaux avec une cuillère en bois, et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ajouter le chipotle et l’assaisonnement cajun. Remuez bien et laissez cuire encore 1 min.","Versez les haricots et les tomates, puis émiettez-les sur le cube de bouillon. Ajoutez une canette d''eau et laissez mijoter environ 20 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à épaississement. Ajoutez le chocolat et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fondu, puis ajoutez la majeure partie de la coriandre.","Servir le piment dans des bols sur le riz saupoudré du reste de coriandre, avec une cuillerée de yaourt faible en gras et un filet supplémentaire de pâte de chipotle sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:11:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11504,4469,'fr','Ratatouille au congélateur','Préparez un lot de notre mélange de légumes sains, puis servez-le de trois façons : avec de la feta, comme illustré, avec des pommes de terre en chemise ou dans des poivrons farcis.','["250 g d''oignons rouges coupés en morceaux de 3 cm","250 g d''oignons blancs coupés en morceaux de 3 cm","600 g de poivrons rouges et jaunes – après les avoir épépinés et équeutés, coupés en morceaux","1 kg de courgette coupée en morceaux de 3 cm","1 kg d''aubergines","20 g de gousses d''ail écrasées","800 g de tomates cerises","3 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à café de thym ou d''origan séché, plus une pincée supplémentaire","1 cuillère à soupe de chapelure complète","25 g de fromage feta léger","30 g de feuilles de laitue Little Gem","25 g d''oignons nouveaux émincés","50 g de concombres tranchés","un filet de jus de citron","1 petite pomme de terre au four de 100 g","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","25 g de yaourt grec sans matière grasse","10 g de feuilles de roquette","un filet de jus de citron","2 petits poivrons de n''importe quelle couleur","25 g de cheddar affiné plus léger","200 g de brocoli cuit","20 g de pousses d''épinards","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nRépartissez les oignons dans un plat à rôtir,\r\nassaisonner et rôtir 25 minutes en remuant\r\nde temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient carbonisés et ramollis.\r\nRépétez avec les poivrons pendant 20 minutes,\r\npuis la courgette pendant seulement 15 minutes.","Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive. Trancher le\r\naubergines en rondelles de 2 à 3 cm d''épaisseur et\r\ndisposer dans la poêle (coupez uniquement ce que vous\r\npeut tenir dans votre poêle à la fois – cuisson\r\nles tranches fraîchement coupées en lots devraient\r\npour éviter qu''ils ne brunissent). Cuire plus\r\nà feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient carbonisés des deux côtés,\r\npuis retirez-le dans une assiette allant au micro-ondes.\r\nRépétez par lots jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien\r\ncroustillant et doré. Couvrir l''assiette\r\navec du film alimentaire, percez quelques trous,\r\npuis mettez les aubergines au micro-ondes à puissance élevée\r\npendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Vous pourriez avoir besoin\r\npour le faire par lots. Coupez les tranches en quatre,\r\nou coupé en morceaux. (Parce que tu es\r\nfrire sans huile, ils brûleront avant\r\nils sont bien cuits, donc finissez\r\nun micro-ondes est idéal. Si vous n''avez pas\r\nun, il suffit de l''ajouter à la sauce pour le final\r\n10-15 minutes de mijotage, mais ils peuvent\r\nrompre un peu.)","Pendant que les légumes rôtissent, mettez l''ail\r\ndans la poêle antiadhésive ou une grande poêle\r\navec un petit verre d''eau. Laisser mijoter jusqu''à\r\nl''eau est presque épuisée, puis versez-la dans le\r\ntomates cerises et concassées, sucre,\r\nvinaigre et beaucoup d''assaisonnement. Laisser mijoter\r\npendant 20 minutes jusqu''à épaississement et sauce.\r\nGoûtez pour l''assaisonnement, puis éteignez et\r\ncombiner avec les légumes. Laisser refroidir, diviser en\r\n10 portions et congeler.","Pour servir comme légumes grecs cuits avec de la feta (pour 1 personne, préparation 10 minutes, cuisson 15 minutes) : Incorporer les herbes dans 1 portion décongelée.\r\nratatouille et verser dans un petit plat.\r\nSaupoudrer de chapelure, puis ajouter\r\nfeta avec une pincée\r\nplus d''herbes. Cuire à\r\n200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6 pendant 15 minutes si\r\ndécongelé ou 25 à 30 minutes après congélation.\r\nMélanger les feuilles de Baby Gem\r\navec de l''oignon nouveau,\r\njus de concombre et de citron. Servir avec le plat de cuisson.Par portion : 236 kcal, protéines 13 g, glucides 34 g, lipides 5 g, lipides saturés 3 g, fibres 10 g, sucre 20 g, sel 1,0 g.","Pour servir en vestes de chili végétariennes (pour 1 personne, préparation 5 minutes, cuisson environ 1 heure) : Cuire les pommes de terre au four. Ajoutez-en quelques-uns\r\nà soupe d''eau dans une casserole avec les graines de cumin et la poudre de piment.\r\nLaisser mijoter, et juste avant l''eau\r\ns''évapore, incorporer 1 portion de décongelé\r\nratatouille. Faites chauffer, puis incorporez la coriandre.\r\nCouper la pomme de terre en deux, garnir de piment végétarien\r\net du yaourt grec. Servir avec des feuilles de roquette assaisonnées\r\navec du jus de citron.Par portion : 270 kcal, protéines 14 g, glucides 50 g, lipides 3 g, graisses saturées 0 g, fibres 12 g, sucre 20 g, sel 0,4 g.","Pour servir comme poivrons farcis au fromage (pour 2 personnes, préparation 15 minutes, cuisson 20 minutes) : Coupez les poivrons en deux et grattez-les.\r\ndes graines. Divisez 1 portion de\r\nratatouille décongelée entre\r\nles moitiés de poivron. Râper sur le cheddar, puis cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes à\r\n200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Servir avec\r\nbrocoli et épinards mélangés\r\navec du vinaigre balsamique.Par portion : 173 kcal, protéines 12 g, glucides 21 g, lipides 4 g, graisses saturées 2 g, fibres 10 g, sucre 20 g, sel 0,4 g."]','2026-01-11 00:11:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11505,4471,'fr','Salade de crevettes, avocat et soja','La combinaison de crustacés, de coriandre, de sauce chili douce et de concombre est gagnante dans cette salade verte pleine de bonté','["85 g de graines de soja surgelées","85 g de gambas cuites et décortiquées","2 cuillères à café de sauce chili douce","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge","½ petit avocat mûr, dénoyauté, pelé et coupé en petits morceaux","¼ de concombre coupé en petits morceaux","petit paquet de feuilles de coriandre","petit paquet de feuilles de salade pour bébés"]','["Cuire les graines de soja dans une poêle\r\nd''eau bouillante pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ntendre, puis égoutter et laisser refroidir sous\r\neau froide. Mélangez les crevettes avec\r\nle piment doux et le zeste de citron vert.\r\nFouetter ensemble l''huile, le citron vert\r\ndu jus et un peu d''assaisonnement\r\nfaire un pansement.","Mélangez les graines de soja, l''avocat,\r\nconcombre et coriandre. Verser\r\nsur la vinaigrette et mélanger\r\nmanteau. Garnir de crevettes et\r\nfeuilles de salade."]','2026-01-11 00:11:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11506,4473,'fr','Couscous 5 par jour','Rebecca Roberts sert des courgettes rôties, des carottes, des oignons rouges, des tomates et des champignons avec du couscous et du poulet dans cette recette pour une personne.','["1 courgette moyenne, coupée en petits morceaux","1 carotte moyenne, coupée en petits morceaux","1 oignon rouge moyen, coupé en quartiers","85 g de champignons coupés en quartiers","une poignée de tomates cerises (environ 8)","2 gousses d''ail, pelées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ cuillère à café de paprika","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment séchés","2 cuisses de poulet avec os, avec la peau","50 g de couscous","½ petit paquet de persil ou de menthe, haché grossièrement","arroser de sauce chili douce (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMettez les légumes et l''ail sur une plaque allant au four\r\nplateau. Bien assaisonner, arroser d''1 cuillère à soupe d''olive\r\nhuiler et mélanger jusqu''à ce que tout soit enrobé.","Saupoudrer les épices et un peu\r\nassaisonner les cuisses de poulet,\r\npuis frottez la peau et la chair. Bruine\r\nun peu d''huile sur la peau et nichez le\r\ncuisses parmi les légumes. Rôtir dans le\r\nfour pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes\r\ncommencent à devenir croustillants et le poulet est\r\nbien cuit.","Environ 10 minutes avant le poulet\r\net les légumes sont cuits, mettez le\r\nle couscous dans un bol et couvrir juste\r\navec de l''eau bouillante, couvrir de film alimentaire\r\nfilmer et réserver 5 min.","Fourcher le couscous pour le séparer\r\nles grains. Mélangez les légumes et\r\npersil ou menthe dans le couscous, assaisonner, puis transférer dans une assiette de service.\r\nGarnir de poulet et arroser de\r\nsauce chili douce, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11507,4475,'fr','Fattouche','Cette salade classique du Moyen-Orient constitue un accompagnement léger et croustillant ou une garniture de boîte à lunch - elle est saupoudrée de sumac, de menthe et de persil.','["2 tomates coupées en morceaux","¼ de concombre épépiné et tranché","½ oignon rouge, tranché","1 petite laitue romaine pommée, râpée","une poignée de feuilles de menthe, hachées grossièrement","une poignée de feuilles de persil hachées grossièrement","2 douleurs pitta","1 cuillère à café de sumac","½ gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","jus ½ citron"]','["La veille, mélanger toute la salade\r\ningrédients sauf le pain pitta et le sumac.\r\nPréparez la vinaigrette et assaisonnez selon votre goût. Partir\r\nceux-ci se séparent jusqu''au matin.","Le lendemain matin, faites griller les pains pitta jusqu''à ce que\r\nlégèrement doré. Une fois refroidi, déchirez-le en morceaux et\r\nmélanger avec la salade et la vinaigrette. Verser dans\r\n2 boîtes en plastique et saupoudrer de sumac."]','2026-01-11 00:11:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11508,4479,'fr','Salade chimichurri aux haricots noirs','Cette simple salade de légumineuses du magasin, adaptée à une boîte à lunch, est assaisonnée de chimichurri, une sauce sud-américaine au persil, à la coriandre et au piment.','["Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","1 tomate, hachée grossièrement","¼ d''oignon rouge, haché grossièrement","½ avocat, haché","50 g de fromage feta émietté en morceaux","une grosse poignée de coriandre","une grosse poignée de persil","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","½ gousse d''ail, hachée grossièrement","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients du chimichurri ensemble dans\r\nun mixeur ou le petit bol d''un robot culinaire,\r\njusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné. Assaisonner au goût et réserver.","Dans un bol ou un récipient en plastique, mélanger le tout\r\nles ingrédients de la salade. Arroser de vinaigrette,\r\nou gardez-le séparé dans un petit pot pour bien mélanger\r\nla salade juste avant de manger."]','2026-01-11 00:11:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11509,4485,'fr','Harissa tomates rôties au couscous','Aromatisez un couscous polyvalent avec de la menthe, du persil et des amandes, puis servez-le avec des tomates rôties aux épices pimentées et une sauce au yaourt à l''ail.','["12 grosses tomates italiennes, coupées en deux","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 oignons, tranchés très finement","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt à la grecque","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tahini","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","200 g de couscous","½ petit paquet de menthe, hachée grossièrement","½ petit paquet de persil, haché grossièrement","50 g d''amandes effilées grillées","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Remuer\r\nles tomates à l''harissa et 2 cuillères à soupe de\r\nhuile. Assaisonner et étaler dans un plat à rôtir,\r\ncôté coupé vers le haut et cuire au four pendant 40 à 45 minutes.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une grande poêle\r\ncasserole. Ajoutez les oignons et faites grésiller pendant un moment.\r\nquelques minutes. Baissez le feu,\r\nassaisonner et cuire 15 minutes ou jusqu''à\r\ndoré et caramélisé. Dans un bol, mélanger\r\nle yaourt, le tahini et l''ail avec un peu\r\nassaisonnement. Annuler.","Versez le couscous dans un grand bol.\r\nVersez dessus 400 ml d''eau bouillante. Couverture\r\navec du film alimentaire et laisser reposer\r\n10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que toute l''eau soit\r\nabsorbé. Fourchette les herbes,\r\nles amandes, les pois chiches et la moitié des oignons.\r\nGarnir avec les tomates et le reste\r\noignons et servir avec une cuillerée de\r\nsauce au yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:11:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11510,4487,'fr','Cuisson étagée d''aubergines et de lentilles','Les lentilles du Puy complètent cette pâtisserie végétarienne faible en calories avec du fromage mozzarella, de la sauce tomate et basilic et des aubergines rôties.','["2 aubergines coupées en tranches de ½ cm dans le sens de la longueur","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","140 g de lentilles du Puy","2 oignons, finement hachés","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","300 g de courge butternut cuite","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","½ petit paquet de feuilles de basilic","125 g de boule de mozzarella déchirée"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nBadigeonner les deux côtés des tranches d''aubergine\r\navec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile, déposer sur la cuisson\r\nfeuilles, assaisonner et enfourner 15-20 minutes\r\njusqu''à tendreté, en les retournant une fois. Cuire le\r\nlentilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une grande poêle\r\ncasserole. Ajoutez les oignons et l''ail et faites cuire\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Remuez bien la courge et le\r\ntomates, plus ½ boîte d''eau. Laisser mijoter pendant\r\n10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe.\r\nIncorporer les lentilles, le basilic et l''assaisonnement.","Versez une couche de lentilles dans un petit\r\nplat allant au four. Garnir de tranches d''aubergines\r\net répétez en terminant par une couche de\r\naubergine. Parsemer de mozzarella et\r\ncuire encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle fromage est doré et bouillonnant."]','2026-01-11 00:11:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11511,4489,'fr','Curry de poulet et patate douce','Ce pot d''épices indien aromatisé à la pâte de korma est assez doux pour les enfants - la patate douce l''étire un peu plus loin','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 oignon, haché","450 g de cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en bouchées","Pot de 165g de pâte Korma","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","500 g de patates douces coupées en petits morceaux","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","100 g de bébés épinards","riz basmati, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez l''oignon et\r\ncuire à feu doux environ 5 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Augmentez légèrement le feu,\r\najouter les morceaux de poulet et faire dorer.","Incorporer la pâte de curry et l''ail,\r\ncuire 2 minutes avant d''ajouter\r\n100 ml d''eau, les patates douces\r\net tomates concassées. Laisser mijoter pendant\r\n20-30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit\r\nà travers et la patate douce est tendre\r\n– ajoutez un peu d''eau si ça commence à chauffer\r\navoir l''air sec. Assaisonner selon votre goût et ajouter le\r\népinards, en retirant la casserole du feu\r\net en remuant jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés.\r\nServir avec du riz basmati."]','2026-01-11 00:11:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11512,4491,'fr','Fajitas aux patates douces au four','Les végétariens ne doivent pas manquer le plaisir des tortillas : nous utilisons des poivrons, des oignons et des patates douces garnis de feta et de crème sure.','["2 grosses patates douces","1 oignon","2 oignons rouges","1 gros poivron rouge, épépiné","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre ou de vin blanc","30 g d''assaisonnement pour fajita","8 petites tortillas roulées","½ petit paquet de coriandre hachée","½ petit pot de crème sure faible en gras","petite laitue iceberg, râpée","100 g de fromage feta allégé, émietté"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nCoupez les légumes en gros quartiers et\r\nmélanger dans un grand bol avec l''huile, le vinaigre\r\net assaisonnement pour fajita. Organiser en un seul\r\ndéposer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie et cuire\r\npendant 40 minutes en retournant à mi-cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, réchauffez les wraps suivants\r\ninstructions sur l''emballage. Une fois les légumes cuits\r\ncuit, saupoudrer de coriandre, puis rouler\r\ndans les wraps avec une cuillerée de aigre\r\ncrème, un peu de laitue et émietté\r\nfeta sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:11:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11513,4493,'fr','Crumble du verger','Vous avez une surabondance ? Utilisez la générosité de cette saison pour préparer ce magnifique pud : nous avons choisi des prunes, des figues, des pommes et des mûres.','["400 g de pommes pelées, épépinées et coupées en petits morceaux","400 g de prunes dénoyautées, coupées en gros quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre, n''importe quel type","300 g de figues, tiges ligneuses parées, coupées en quartiers","300 g de mûres ou de ronces bien lavées","crème, crème anglaise ou glace, pour servir","140 g de farine nature","140g de farine complète","175 g de beurre coupé en petits morceaux","100 g de cassonade molle"]','["Préparez d’abord la garniture. Mettez le\r\nfarines dans un bol avec une pincée de sel,\r\npuis frottez le beurre avec votre\r\ndu bout des doigts pour former des miettes. Remuer\r\ndans le sucre avec une fourchette, et\r\nréfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C ventilé/\r\ngaz 4. Inclinez les pommes, les prunes\r\net le sucre dans un gros\r\nune casserole avec 50 ml d''eau\r\net cuire en remuant pendant\r\nenviron 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles pommes sont molles et\r\njuteux. Incorporer les figues\r\net les mûres, et\r\nverser dans un plat allant au four.\r\nDispersez-vous sur le\r\némietter et cuire au four\r\npendant 45-55 minutes\r\njusqu''à la garniture\r\nest doré et le\r\nles fruits bouillonnent."]','2026-01-11 00:11:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11514,4495,'fr','Aubergines farcies à l''italienne','Oubliez les poivrons farcis et servez plutôt à vos invités végétariens ce plat d''aubergines farcies sophistiqué','["2 aubergines","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","1 gros oignon, finement haché","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","12 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","50 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées et hachées","une poignée de feuilles de basilic hachées","125 g de boule de mozzarella végétarienne, déchirée en bouchées","une poignée de chapelure blanche fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nCoupez les aubergines en deux dans le sens de la longueur,\r\nlaissant la tige intacte. En utilisant un petit\r\ncouteau, coupez une bordure à l''intérieur de chaque aubergine\r\nenviron ½ à 1 cm d''épaisseur. A l''aide d''une cuillère à café,\r\nretirez la chair de l''aubergine, alors\r\nque vous avez 4 coquilles. Brossez-les\r\navec un peu d''huile, assaisonner et placer\r\ndans un plat allant au four. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et\r\nenfourner 20 mn. Hachez la chair et\r\nmettre de côté.","Pendant ce temps, ajoutez le reste de l''huile\r\ndans une poêle antiadhésive. Astuce dans l''oignon\r\net cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter le haché\r\nchair d''aubergine et bien cuire. Astuce\r\ndans l''ail et les tomates et cuire\r\npendant 3 minutes de plus. Incorporer les olives, le basilic,\r\nmozzarella et assaisonnement.","Lorsque les coquilles d''aubergines sont tendres,\r\nsortir du four et baisser le feu\r\nà 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Rembourrage en tas\r\ndans les coquilles, saupoudrer de chapelure\r\net arroser d''un peu plus d''huile. Cuire au four\r\npendant 15 à 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit\r\ngluant et la chapelure est dorée.\r\nServir avec une salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:11:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11515,4499,'fr','Curry de maïs et de noix de coco','Savourez ce curry réchauffant à la noix de coco et au maïs pour un repas facile sans viande pour deux. Plein d''épices réchauffantes, c''est un dîner végétalien rapide et réconfortant','["150g de lentilles rouges","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, finement tranché","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, tranché finement, et un peu plus pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de curcuma","1 cuillère à soupe de curry en poudre (vérifiez qu''il est sans gluten si nécessaire)","250 g de mini-maïs, coupés en deux en diagonale","110 g de yaourt à la noix de coco, plus un peu pour servir","½ petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Mettez les lentilles dans une passoire et rincez jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit propre. Mettez l''huile dans une casserole à feu moyen, versez l''oignon et faites cuire 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez le gingembre, le curcuma et la poudre de curry et laissez cuire encore une minute jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Incorporer les lentilles.","Versez 400 ml d''eau chaude et portez à ébullition. Baissez le feu à moyen et laissez mijoter pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la majeure partie de l''eau soit absorbée. Ajoutez les mini-maïs et 100 ml d''eau, couvrez et laissez mijoter pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres et que le maïs soit encore un peu croquant. Incorporez le yaourt à la noix de coco pour le réchauffer, mais ne le laissez pas bouillir. Servir garni de plus de yaourt à la noix de coco, si vous le souhaitez, et de feuilles de coriandre saupoudrées."]','2026-01-11 00:11:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11516,4501,'fr','Gruau à la banane pour la nuit','Préparez ces flocons d''avoine faciles à préparer pour la nuit à base de bananes, de beurre de noix et d''amandes pour un délicieux petit-déjeuner. Préparés la veille, ils sont idéaux pour les matinées chargées','["2 bananes pelées","100 g de flocons d''avoine","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, plus une pincée pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable","300 ml de lait de votre choix, plus un peu","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète ou d''amande, plus un peu pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées ou hachées","2-4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Écrasez 1 banane dans un bol avec une fourchette jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer les flocons d''avoine, la cannelle, le sirop d''érable, le lait et le beurre d''arachide. Bien mélanger, puis couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Le lendemain matin, remuez le porridge en ajoutant un peu de lait si le mélange est assez ferme. Répartir dans deux bols. Tranchez la banane restante et répartissez-la sur le porridge, arrosez de beurre de noix et saupoudrez d''amandes. Garnir de cuillerées de yaourt, le cas échéant, et saupoudrer d''une pincée de cannelle supplémentaire avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11517,4503,'fr','Salade piquante de clémentines, de dinde et d''arachides','Utilisez intelligemment les restes de Noël avec cette salade saine et piquante, qui met à profit les restes de dinde, les surplus de clémentines et de cacahuètes.','["200 g de haricots edamame surgelés","2 citrons verts, zestés et pressés","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja légère","2 cuillères à café de miel","¼ de chou rouge (environ 220 g), finement râpé","1 poivron rouge, tranché finement","200 g de restes de dinde ou de poulet cuits, émincés","petit bouquet de coriandre (ou utiliser de la menthe ou un mélange), feuilles cueillies","4 clémentines pelées et coupées en rondelles","50 g de cacahuètes grillées et hachées grossièrement"]','["Faites cuire les edamames dans une petite casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 2-3 minutes. Égoutter, puis rincer sous l''eau froide courante et égoutter à nouveau.","Mélangez le zeste et le jus de citron vert, le beurre de cacahuète, la sauce soja, le miel et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un grand bol pour faire une vinaigrette, en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire pour la détendre. Ajoutez l''edamame, le chou râpé, le poivron tranché et la dinde râpée dans le bol et mélangez le tout jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien enrobé.","Versez la salade sur une assiette, puis parsemez de tranches de coriandre et de clémentine. Mélangez-les délicatement à la salade avec des couverts à salade, en prenant soin de ne pas trop casser les fruits. Répartir sur les cacahuètes juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11518,4507,'fr','Soupe miso et butternut','Rendez le déjeuner plus excitant avec cette soupe miso et butternut soyeuse et profondément savoureuse. Livrer tous vos cinq par jour, c''est aussi regorger de bonté','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 gros oignon, haché","400 g de courge butternut, avec la peau, coupée en morceaux","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","Boîte de 210 g de haricots beurre, égouttés","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes","80 g de chou frisé râpé, finement haché","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame grillées","2 cuillères à café de gingembre finement râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de miso de riz brun"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes pour le ramollir. Ajoutez la courge et l''ail et remuez pendant une minute. Ajoutez les haricots et le bouillon ainsi qu''un litre d''eau, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le chou frisé à la vapeur pendant 10 minutes, puis mélangez-le avec l''huile de sésame, les graines et le gingembre.","Ajoutez le miso à la soupe, puis mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant. Verser dans des bols et garnir du mélange de chou frisé au sésame pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11519,4509,'fr','Bouchées de muffins aux œufs et au pesto','Préparez ces bouchées d''œufs au pesto et de muffins à la feta pour le petit-déjeuner, une collation l''après-midi ou dans le cadre d''un panier de pique-nique. Simple à réaliser, les enfants vont les adorer !','["aérosol de cuisson à faible teneur en calories, pour la boîte","18 tomates cerises, coupées en quartiers","80 g de feta ou de chèvre émietté","6 œufs moyens","30 ml de lait","2 cuillères à soupe de pesto (vérifiez l''étiquette si vous êtes végétarien)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Vaporiser un moule à muffins à 12 trous avec le spray d''huile. Répartissez uniformément les tomates dans les trous et garnissez chacune d''elles d''environ 2 cuillères à café de feta ou de fromage de chèvre.","Cassez les œufs dans un grand bol, puis ajoutez le lait, le pesto et l''assaisonnement et fouettez pour combiner. Versez le mélange uniformément dans chaque trou.","Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que l''œuf soit pris. Laisser refroidir 2 à 3 minutes dans le moule, puis retirer et laisser refroidir sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:11:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11520,4517,'fr','Poivrons rôtis avec œufs « confits » et vinaigrette aux amandes et persil','Préparez un déjeuner rapide composé de poivrons rôtis et d''œufs mous, servis avec une vinaigrette aux amandes et au persil. A déguster avec du pain croustillant','["20 g d''amandes blanchies hachées","1 petit bouquet de persil plat haché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique blanc ou de vinaigre de Xérès","7 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","8 œufs moyens","250 g de poivrons rouges rôtis en bocal, égouttés et coupés en lanières de pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Préparez la vinaigrette en battant ensemble les amandes, le persil, l''ail et un peu d''assaisonnement à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Vous voulez créer un mélange légèrement épais. Incorporer le vinaigre et l’huile d’olive en fouettant doucement au fur et à mesure. Goûtez pour l''assaisonnement, en gardant à l''esprit que la vinaigrette peut être assez forte lorsque vous la versez sur des œufs.","Faites bouillir une casserole d''eau, ajoutez les œufs et laissez cuire 7 à 8 minutes. Cela vous donnera ce que certains appellent des œufs « confiturés » : ils sont juste assez fermes pour être considérés comme durs, et le centre même est encore un peu mou. Mettez les œufs dans l''eau froide, puis épluchez-les dès qu''ils sont suffisamment chauds pour être manipulés. Coupez les œufs en deux et disposez-les sur une assiette de service. Assaisonnez, puis enroulez les poivrons autour des œufs et versez la vinaigrette dessus. A déguster avec du bon pain croustillant, pendant que les œufs sont encore chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:11:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11521,4519,'fr','Kedgerée facile','Une version épurée du kedgeree, cette recette simple mais délicieuse à cinq ingrédients est également faible en gras et en calories.','["2 cuillères à soupe de curry en poudre de votre choix (nous avons utilisé du madras)","300 g de riz basmati","600 ml de bouillon de poulet","400 g d''aiglefin fumé sans peau","100 g de petits pois surgelés"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Faites chauffer une casserole allant au four ou une cocotte antidéflagrante à feu moyen et faites griller la poudre de curry pendant 1 min. Incorporez le riz pour l''enrober de poudre de curry, puis versez sur le bouillon. Portez à ébullition, puis déposez l''aiglefin dessus. Couverture. Cuire au four pendant 30 mn.","Retirer délicatement du four. Laisser reposer une minute, puis incorporer les petits pois tout en brisant l''aiglefin et en gonflant le riz. Assaisonner selon votre goût, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11522,4521,'fr','Plateau de poulet au citron et aux herbes, haricots beurre et quartiers de pommes de terre','Préparez ce plateau de cuisson polyvalent pour un repas familial copieux. Copieux et plein d''ingrédients savoureux et sans chichi, c''est le meilleur de la nourriture économique','["800g de pommes de terre","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, finement tranché","4 gousses d''ail, hachées","400 g de tomates en conserve","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés","2 cuillères à café d''herbes séchées mélangées","1 kg de cuisses de poulet avec peau et os","1 citron, coupé en tranches"]','["Coupez les pommes de terre en gros quartiers, puis mélangez-les bien dans un grand bol avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et un peu de sel. Étalez les quartiers sur une plaque à pâtisserie.","Faites revenir l''oignon et l''ail dans le reste de l''huile d''olive à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et translucides. Ajouter les tomates, les haricots beurre et un peu d''assaisonnement. Laissez mijoter quelques minutes, puis versez dans un moule ou un plat allant au four.","Mélangez une pincée de sel avec les herbes. Farcir des quantités égales sous la peau de chaque cuisse de poulet. Déposez une tranche de citron sur chaque cuisse, puis disposez-la sur le mélange de tomates et de haricots dans le moule.","Cuire les quartiers et la plaque de poulet au four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Vérifiez les pommes de terre après environ 30 minutes en les secouant dans la plaque – selon la taille des quartiers, elles peuvent être déjà bien cuites."]','2026-01-11 00:11:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11523,4523,'fr','Saumon salsa verde avec salade de pois chiches écrasés','Servez ce saumon salsa verde sain avec une salade de pois chiches écrasés, de chou frisé et de poivrons rouges rôtis pour un repas rapide et nutritif en milieu de semaine.','["3 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","le zeste et le jus d''1 orange","2 filets de saumon avec la peau","petit bouquet de persil","1/2 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","1 échalote, hachée finement","1/2 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","2 poivrons rouges rôtis en bocal, hachés","50g de chou frisé"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Fouetter 1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive avec le zeste d''orange, un peu de jus et un peu d''assaisonnement. Disposez les filets de saumon côté peau sur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive et versez dessus la marinade. Laisser mariner à température ambiante.","Mettez le persil, la moutarde de Dijon, la moitié de l''échalote hachée, le vinaigre de vin rouge, 1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive et le reste du jus d''orange dans un petit robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une sauce épaisse, en ajoutant un peu d''eau pour la détendre si nécessaire.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive dans une poêle et faites revenir le reste de l''échalote hachée pendant 5 min. Incorporer les pois chiches et assaisonner. Augmentez le feu et remuez jusqu''à ce que les pois chiches soient juste croustillants. Écrasez grossièrement et incorporez les poivrons rouges rôtis et le chou frisé. Ajoutez un peu d’eau et couvrez jusqu’à ce que le chou frisé soit fané. Gardez au chaud. Griller le saumon pendant 4 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût. Répartir la purée dans les assiettes et garnir de saumon et de salsa."]','2026-01-11 00:11:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11524,4525,'fr','Soupe de carottes et panais','Créez un lot de soupe crémeuse aux panais et aux carottes pour un déjeuner ou un dîner réchauffant. Servir avec du pain croustillant et congeler les restes que vous avez pour les journées chargées','["½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, finement hachés","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ petite botte de thym, feuilles cueillies","3 grosses carottes pelées et hachées grossièrement","2 gros panais, pelés et hachés grossièrement","1 litre de bouillon de légumes","100 ml de crème double","¼ bouquet de persil finement haché (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole et faites revenir l''oignon et le céleri pendant 10 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. S''ils commencent à s''accrocher, ajoutez un petit peu d''eau. Ajoutez l''ail, le thym et ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir et laissez cuire 2 minutes. Ajouter les carottes, les panais et le bouillon et porter à ébullition. Réduisez le feu et laissez cuire 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres, en remuant de temps en temps.","Mélanger à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Ajoutez la crème et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis goûtez pour l''assaisonnement. Pour servir, verser dans des bols et parsemer d''un peu de persil haché, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11525,4529,'fr','Houmous de haricots blancs, betteraves marinées et chou frisé','Préparez du houmous maison et garnissez-le de betteraves marinées et de chou frisé pour le rendre encore plus spécial. Il est idéal pour un buffet ou en entrée ou en accompagnement de crudités.','["600 g de betterave cuite, coupée en petits cubes","200 ml d''huile d''olive, plus 2 cuillères à soupe et un peu plus pour arroser","100 ml de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 échalotes pelées et hachées finement","2 feuilles de laurier","1 citron, le zeste pelé en lanières, pressé","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre ou de haricots cannellini, égouttés et rincés","140g de yaourt nature","3 gousses d''ail, 2 écrasées, 1 tranchée","150 g de chou frisé râpé"]','["Mélangez la betterave, 100 ml d''huile, le vinaigre, les échalotes, le laurier et le zeste de citron. Assaisonner, couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Versez les haricots dans un robot culinaire avec le jus de citron, le yaourt, l''ail écrasé, 100 ml d''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement. Mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant un peu d''eau pour desserrer si nécessaire.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''ail émincé pendant 1 à 2 minutes. Ajoutez le chou frisé et un peu d''eau, puis remuez et faites frire pendant 8 à 10 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce que le chou frisé soit vert foncé et que les tiges soient tendres. Ajoutez un peu d’eau si nécessaire pour flétrir le chou frisé. Égouttez le mélange de betterave et incorporez-le au chou frisé jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud. Retirer du feu.","Versez la trempette aux haricots dans un grand bol, puis versez-la sur le mélange de betterave et de chou frisé. Arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive et servir le houmous à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:11:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11526,4535,'fr','Pâtes crémeuses au pesto d''edamame et salade de roquette','Préparez un repas familial économique avec nos pâtes edamame au pesto rapides et faciles. Utilisez des spaghettis complets pour ajouter des fibres si vous préférez','["300 g de spaghettis","350 g de haricots edamame surgelés, décortiqués","50 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","50 g de noix de cajou","2 gousses d''ail","50 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, plus un peu pour servir","90 g de feuilles de roquette"]','["Faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, mettez les edamames surgelés dans un bol, versez dessus 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et faites cuire au micro-ondes à puissance maximale pendant environ 5 minutes. Laisser dans l''eau, à couvert, encore 2 minutes. Vous pouvez également faire mijoter les edamames dans une casserole d’eau bouillante pendant 2-3 minutes.","Pour faire le pesto, mettez 150 g d''edamame, l''huile, les noix de cajou, l''ail, le parmesan et un peu d''assaisonnement dans l''ablender et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Vous pouvez ajouter jusqu''à 6 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour faciliter le mélange si le mélange est trop épais.","Une fois les pâtes cuites, incorporez le pesto et le reste des edamames, puis servez avec la roquette à part et une râpe supplémentaire de fromage, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11527,4541,'fr','Salade de quinoa, chèvre & pêches','Préparez cette salade de quinoa, de blettes, de fromage de chèvre et de pêches grillées inspirée du taboulé comme quelque chose de différent pour le déjeuner. C''est plein de textures et de saveurs fraîches','["200 g de quinoa","100 g de blettes finement râpées","4 pêches ou nectarines dénoyautées, 2 coupées en quartiers et 2 tranchées finement","1-2 citrons, jus","4-5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","50 g de noisettes grossièrement hachées","25 g de persil, feuilles cueillies et finement hachées","25 g de menthe, feuilles cueillies et finement hachées, plus des feuilles de menthe supplémentaires pour servir","4 cuillères à soupe de câpres, égouttées","2 cuillères à soupe de sumac (facultatif)","1-2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","100 g de fromage de chèvre à pâte molle, émietté","2-3 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et cuire le quinoa en suivant les instructions du paquet. Égoutter, mélanger avec les blettes, puis laisser refroidir et flétrir.","Mettez les tranches de pêches dans un bol, arrosez de jus de citron et réservez. Disposez les pêches coupées en quartiers sur une plaque allant au four. Mélanger avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive. Rôtir pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Répartissez les noisettes sur une deuxième plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les griller au four pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées.","Mélangez le mélange de quinoa, les herbes, les pêches tranchées et le jus du bol, les câpres, le sumac (le cas échéant), le vinaigre et le reste de l''huile. Saison. Disposer sur une grande assiette de service et garnir de pêches rôties, de fromage de chèvre, de noisettes, de graines de sésame et de feuilles de menthe supplémentaires."]','2026-01-11 00:11:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11528,4543,'fr','Curry de haricots rouges','Une recette de secours lorsqu''il n''y a rien dans le réfrigérateur ou lorsque vous avez envie de quelque chose de bon marché, délicieux et copieux','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché finement","1 petit paquet de coriandre, tiges finement hachées, feuilles grossièrement déchiquetées","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de paprika moulu","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 g de haricots rouges en boîte, dans l''eau","riz basmati cuit, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-doux. Ajouter l''oignon et une pincée de sel et cuire lentement, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et commencent tout juste à se colorer. Ajouter les tiges d''ail, de gingembre et de coriandre et cuire encore 2 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées.","Ajoutez les épices dans la poêle et laissez cuire encore 1 minute, après quoi tout devrait sentir aromatique. Versez les tomates concassées et les haricots rouges dans leur eau, puis portez à ébullition.","Baissez le feu et laissez mijoter 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le curry soit bien épais. Assaisonner selon votre goût, puis servir avec le riz basmati et les feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:11:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11529,4547,'fr','Curry de chou-fleur, paner et petits pois','Prête en moins d''une heure, cette recette de curry végétarien facile à base de fromage indien poêlé et de légumes est également peu coûteuse à préparer.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","225 g de paner coupé en cubes","1 tête de chou-fleur, cassée en petits bouquets","2 oignons, tranchés épaissement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à soupe bombées de pâte tikka masala","500 g de purée en carton","200 g de petits pois surgelés","petit paquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","riz basmati ou pains naan, pour servir","raita ou votre chutney préféré, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez le paneer et faites revenir doucement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Retirer avec une écumoire et réserver. Ajouter le reste de l''huile et le chou-fleur dans la poêle et cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajoutez les oignons et un peu plus d''huile si nécessaire et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Incorporez l''ail et la pâte de curry, puis versez la passata et 250 ml d''eau et assaisonnez. Portez à ébullition, puis couvrez et laissez cuire 18 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le chou-fleur soit juste tendre.","Ajoutez les petits pois surgelés et le paneer croustillant dans la poêle et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Incorporer la majeure partie de la coriandre et garnir avec le reste. Servir avec du riz basmati ou du pain naan, de la raita ou votre chutney préféré."]','2026-01-11 00:11:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11530,4549,'fr','Tartes indiennes aux patates douces et au dhal','Le dhal de lentilles rouges épicé est garni d''une purée de patates douces crémeuse dans ces tartes végétariennes individuelles – une option bon marché pour un dîner en semaine','["650 g de patates douces pelées et coupées en petits morceaux","1 oignon, coupé en deux et émincé","2 carottes lavées, coupées en deux et tranchées dans le sens de la longueur","15 g de gingembre finement râpé","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 cuillères à café d''huile","1 cuillère à soupe de curry en poudre","1 cube de bouillon de légumes","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","85g de lentilles rouges","une bonne poignée de coriandre hachée et des brins pour servir","une généreuse cuillerée de yogourt à la grecque 0 % de matières grasses","brocoli, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Placer la patate douce dans une casserole d''eau bouillante et cuire 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir l''oignon et la carotte pendant 2 minutes, puis ajoutez l''ail et le gingembre et faites cuire en remuant encore 1 minute. Versez la poudre de curry, remuez autour de la casserole puis ajoutez 750 ml d''eau bouillante avec le cube de bouillon, le concentré de tomates et les lentilles. Couvrir la casserole et faire bouillir pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres et que le liquide soit absorbé. Incorporer la coriandre hachée.","Lorsque les patates douces sont cuites, égouttez-les et écrasez-les avec le yaourt et l''assaisonnement.","Versez le mélange de lentilles dans un ou deux grands plats individuels, puis recouvrez du mélange de patates douces, parsemez de coriandre et servez avec du brocoli, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11531,4551,'fr','Bol de petit-déjeuner aux fruits et noix','Top du porridge d''avoine bon marché et sain avec des oranges fraîches hachées, du yaourt grec et une pincée de fruits secs, de noix et de graines.','["6 cuillères à soupe de flocons d''avoine","2 oranges","un peu moins de ½ pot de 200 ml de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","60 g de raisins secs en pot, noix, baies de goji et graines"]','["Mettez les flocons d''avoine dans une poêle antiadhésive avec 400 ml d''eau et faites cuire sur feu vif en remuant de temps en temps pendant environ 4 minutes jusqu''à épaississement.","Pendant ce temps, coupez la peau et la peau des oranges, puis coupez-les en deux, en coupant de chaque côté, aussi près que possible de l''endroit où se trouverait la tige, car cela enlèvera une section assez dure de la membrane. Maintenant, hachez simplement les oranges.","Versez le porridge dans des bols, versez le yaourt puis empilez les oranges et le mélange de fruits, noix et graines."]','2026-01-11 00:11:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11532,4553,'fr','Baps aux œufs et aux tomates','Remplissez des petits pains complets de tomates juteuses et d''une omelette aux herbes pour un petit-déjeuner ou un brunch copieux mais bon marché.','["2 tomates, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","4 œufs","quelques brins de persil, hachés","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","2 baps de blé complet"]','["Badigeonnez le côté coupé des tomates d''un peu d''huile puis faites-les cuire à feu doux, côté coupé vers le bas, dans une petite poêle antiadhésive. Pendant la cuisson, battez les œufs avec l''assaisonnement et le persil haché dans un petit bol. Retourner les tomates pour les réchauffer brièvement de l''autre côté puis réserver.","Essuyez la poêle, puis ajoutez le reste de l''huile et faites cuire l''ail à feu moyen pendant quelques secondes en remuant constamment jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Versez le mélange d''œufs et faites cuire en remuant de temps en temps sur le feu. Une fois qu’il est presque pris, retournez-le pour cuire l’autre côté encore quelques secondes.","Coupez les baps en deux et écrasez les tomates, coupez l''omelette en quatre et servez, 2 morceaux à l''intérieur de chaque bap."]','2026-01-11 00:11:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11533,4555,'fr','Pilaf au poulet, edamame et gingembre','Préparez ce pot de riz sain pour un dîner en milieu de semaine – rempli de fibres et de vitamine C','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, tranché finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement tranché","3 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en bouchées","250 g de riz basmati","600 ml de bouillon de légumes","100 g d''edamames/soja surgelés","feuilles de coriandre et yaourt grec sans gras (facultatif), pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne,\r\npuis ajoutez l''oignon, le gingembre et le piment,\r\navec un peu d''assaisonnement. Cuisiner pour\r\n5 minutes, puis ajoutez le poulet et le riz.\r\nCuire encore 2 minutes, puis ajouter le\r\nbouillon et porter à ébullition. Tournez le\r\nchauffer à doux, couvrir et cuire pendant\r\n8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit juste cuit.\r\nPendant les 3 dernières minutes de cuisson,\r\najoutez les haricots edamame. Saupoudrer\r\nquelques feuilles de coriandre dessus et\r\nservir avec une cuillerée de yaourt grec,\r\nsi tu veux."]','2026-01-11 00:11:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11534,4557,'fr','Soupe de lentilles rouges, pois chiches et piment','Rentrez à la maison avec un bol réchauffant de cette soupe nourrissante et faible en gras','["2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","grosse pincée de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, haché","140 g de lentilles rouges cassées","850 ml de bouillon de légumes ou d''eau","Boîte de 400 g de tomates entières ou hachées","Carton de 200 g de pois chiches ou ½ boîte de conserve, rincés et égouttés (congeler les restes)","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement (conserver quelques feuilles, pour servir)","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec 0%, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer une grande casserole et faites-y revenir à sec\r\ngraines de cumin et flocons de piment pendant 1 min,\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à sauter dans la poêle\r\net libèrent leurs arômes. Ajouter l''huile et\r\nl''oignon et cuire 5 min. Incorporer le\r\nlentilles, bouillon et tomates, puis apporter\r\nà ébullition. Laisser mijoter 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles lentilles ont ramolli.","Mixez la soupe avec un mixeur plongeant\r\nou dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit grossier\r\nréduire en purée, remettre dans la casserole et ajouter\r\nles pois chiches. Chauffer doucement, bien assaisonner\r\net incorporez la coriandre. Terminez avec\r\nune cuillerée de yaourt et des feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:11:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11535,4559,'fr','Moussaka faible en gras','Un classique grec riche et réconfortant sans calories, pourquoi ne pas aimer ?','["200 g de poivrons tranchés surgelés","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","200 g de bœuf haché extra maigre","100 g de lentilles rouges","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Carton de purée de 500 ml","1 aubergine coupée en rondelles de 1½ cm","4 tomates coupées en rondelles de 1 cm","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","25 g de parmesan finement râpé","Pot de 170 g de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","muscade fraîchement râpée"]','["Cuire doucement les poivrons dans une grande\r\npoêle antiadhésive pendant environ 5 minutes – l''eau\r\nd''eux devraient les empêcher de coller. Ajouter\r\nl''ail et cuire encore 1 min, puis\r\najouter le bœuf en le cassant à la fourchette, et\r\ncuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Versez les lentilles, la moitié\r\nl''origan, la passata et un peu d''eau.\r\nLaisser mijoter 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient\r\ntendre, en ajoutant plus d’eau si nécessaire.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le gril à feu moyen.\r\nDisposez les tranches d''aubergines et de tomates\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive et badigeonner de\r\nl''huile. Saupoudrer du reste d''origan\r\net un peu d''assaisonnement, puis griller pendant 1 à 2 minutes\r\nchaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement carbonisé – vous pouvez\r\nil faut le faire par lots.","Mélangez la moitié du parmesan avec le yaourt et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement. Répartissez le mélange de bœuf\r\nentre 4 petits plats allant au four et le dessus\r\navec les tranches d''aubergine et de tomate.\r\nVerser sur la garniture au yaourt et saupoudrer\r\navec l''origan supplémentaire, le parmesan et\r\nmuscade. Griller pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que des bulles bouillonnent.\r\nServir avec une salade, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11536,4561,'fr','Purée de cresson','Une purée crémeuse mélangée à des légumes verts bons pour la santé constitue un accompagnement simple, faible en gras et également économique.','["650 g de pommes de terre farineuses coupées en morceaux","100 ml de lait","25g de beurre","170 g de cresson"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre dans une grande poêle\r\neau salée pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté.\r\nBien égoutter, puis remettre dans la casserole pour\r\nSécher à la vapeur pendant quelques minutes avant d''écraser.","Mettez les pommes de terre de côté et\r\najouter le lait et le beurre de l''autre côté\r\nde la poêle. Chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le beurre\r\nfond, puis incorporez-le aux pommes de terre avec\r\nle cresson et un peu d''assaisonnement."]','2026-01-11 00:11:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11537,4563,'fr','Chaudrée de crabe et de maïs doux','Cette soupe faible en gras est pleine de saveur et si simple à cuisiner','["1 oignon, finement haché","1 poireau, parties vertes et blanches séparées et tranchées","2 carottes, hachées","850 ml-1 litre/1½ pinte - 1¾ pinte de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes faible en sodium","1 grosse pomme de terre, coupée en dés","175 g de maïs doux surgelé","Boîte de 170 g de chair de crabe blanche égouttée","4 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche légère","1 cuillère à café de ciboulette hachée"]','["Mettez l''oignon, le blanc du poireau\r\net les carottes dans une grande poêle et verser dessus\r\nquelques cuillères à soupe de bouillon. Cuire sur un\r\nà feu moyen pendant environ 10 minutes en remuant\r\nrégulièrement jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez une touche supplémentaire\r\nbouillon si les légumes commencent à coller.","Ajouter la pomme de terre, le poireau vert et le plus\r\ndu bouillon et laisser mijoter 10 à 15 minutes,\r\njusqu''à ce que la pomme de terre soit tendre. Astuce dans le\r\nle maïs doux et la chair de crabe, puis cuire\r\npendant encore 1 à 2 minutes. Supprimer du\r\nchauffer et incorporer la crème fraîche et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement. Ajoutez le reste du\r\nbouillon si la soupe est trop épaisse. Saupoudrer\r\navec la ciboulette et servir avec du brun\r\ndu pain, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11538,4565,'fr','Patates douces et haricots au four','Un souper super sain, parfait pour un soir de semaine chargé. Essayez de préparer le double des haricots et de les congeler pour la prochaine fois.','["4 petites patates douces","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","un peu de sauce Worcestershire (la sauce Lancashire est une option végétarienne)","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots mélangés à l''eau, égouttés","400 g de tomates concassées","4 cuillères à soupe de crème sure légère, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nPercez les patates douces plusieurs fois\r\navec une fourchette, puis faites-les cuire au\r\nmicro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoux. Frotter avec 1 cuillère à café de paprika, 1 cuillère à café\r\nde l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement. Transfert\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie, mettre au four et cuire\r\npendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants.","Pendant ce temps, préparez les haricots. Cuisinier\r\nl''oignon dans le reste de l''huile jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoux. Ajoutez l''ail, le sucre, le vinaigre,\r\nSauce Worcestershire et le reste\r\npaprika et cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit collant. Verser les haricots, les tomates\r\net un peu d''eau, et laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que\r\nles patates douces sont prêtes.","Servir les patates douces avec le\r\nharicots dessus, une cuillerée de crème aigre\r\net une pincée de paprika, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11539,4569,'fr','Tostadas aux haricots noirs avec salsa d''avocat','Pour un regain de santé végétarien rapide, préparez ce souper rapide en utilisant de savoureuses tortillas de maïs, qui constituent un très bon changement par rapport aux tortillas à la farine.','["8 tortillas de maïs (recherchez-les près des autres wraps ou près de la cuisine mexicaine)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","3 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","5 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","3 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","3 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs rincés et égouttés","choisissez quelques garnitures : tomates hachées, oignon rouge tranché, avocat en dés, piments jalapeño tranchés, brins de coriandre","crème fraîche ou sauce chipotle Tabasco, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nBadigeonner les tortillas d''un peu d''huile\r\net déposer en une seule couche sur la cuisson\r\nfeuilles. Cuire 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant.","Dans une grande poêle, faites chauffer le reste\r\nhuile. Ajouter l''oignon et l''ail et cuire\r\npendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez les épices, le vinaigre et\r\nchérie. Cuire encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez le\r\nles haricots et l''assaisonnement, et réchauffer.","Retirer du feu et écraser le\r\nles haricots délicatement avec le dos de votre cuillère\r\nen une grosse purée. Étalez quelques haricots\r\nsur les tortillas de maïs croustillantes, parsemer\r\navec votre choix de garnitures et ajoutez un\r\nune cuillerée de crème fraîche pour refroidir, ou\r\nun peu de chipotle Tabasco pour pimenter le tout."]','2026-01-11 00:11:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11540,4571,'fr','Curry de lentilles jaunes et de noix de coco au chou-fleur','Ce curry végétarien sain convient à un régime alimentaire et constitue une excellente source de fer et de fibres.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, tranché finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché finement","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry (nous avons utilisé de la pâte de curry Bart Veeraswamy Gujurat Masala)","200 g de lentilles jaunes rincées","1½ l de bouillon de légumes","3 cuillères à soupe de noix de coco desséchée non sucrée, plus un peu pour saupoudrer si vous le souhaitez","1 chou-fleur, cassé en petits bouquets","riz basmati cuit et feuilles de coriandre, plus chutney de mangue et pain naan (facultatif), pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole, puis\r\najouter l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre. Cuisinier\r\npendant 5 min, ajoutez la pâte de curry, puis\r\nfaire revenir 1 min avant d''ajouter les lentilles,\r\nbouillon et noix de coco. Apportez le mélange\r\nporter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 40 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres.","Pendant les 10 dernières minutes de cuisson, remuez\r\ndans le chou-fleur à cuire. Verser le riz dans\r\n4 bols, garnir de curry et saupoudrer\r\navec des feuilles de coriandre, et de la noix de coco si vous\r\ncomme. Servir avec un chutney de mangue et du naan\r\npain (facultatif)."]','2026-01-11 00:11:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11541,4573,'fr','Soupe d''oignons caramélisés et d''orge avec croûtons de fromage','L''orge aux noix et nutritive ajoute une réelle substance à cette variante de la soupe à l''oignon française classique.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons moyens, tranchés finement","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","6 brins de thym hachés","une bonne pincée de sucre","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","60g d''orge","60 g de cavolo nero ou chou frisé, tiges épaisses jetées et feuilles tranchées","4 tranches de baguette, grillées","4 cuillères à soupe de gruyère râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole, puis ajoutez\r\nles oignons, l''ail, le thym, le sucre et un\r\nune bonne pincée de sel. Cuire à feu moyen-doux\r\nchauffer pendant 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré\r\ncoloré. Ajouter le bouillon et laisser mijoter pendant\r\nencore 10 minutes.","Dans une grande casserole séparée de sel\r\neau bouillante, cuire l''orge 15 min,\r\nen ajoutant le cavolo nero ou le chou frisé pour le\r\n3 dernières minutes de cuisson. Égoutter et rincer\r\nsous l''eau froide, puis ajouter à la soupe\r\net réchauffer.","Faites chauffer le gril. Garnir le pain grillé\r\navec du fromage et passer sous le grill jusqu''à ce que\r\nc’est pétillant et fondu. Servir dans 2 grands\r\nbols avec les croûtons au fromage dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:11:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11542,4575,'fr','Porridge à la cannelle avec banane et baies','Commencez la journée de manière super saine avec des flocons d''avoine et des fruits frais énergisants.','["100 g de flocons d''avoine","½ cuillère à café de cannelle, plus un peu pour servir","4 cuillères à café de sucre demerara","450 ml de lait écrémé","3 bananes, tranchées","400 g de fraises barquettes, décortiquées et coupées en deux","150 g de yaourt nature sans gras en pot"]','["Dans une casserole de taille moyenne,\r\nmélanger les flocons d''avoine, la cannelle, le sucre, le lait\r\net la moitié des tranches de banane. Apportez\r\nà ébullition en remuant de temps en temps.\r\nBaissez le feu et faites cuire\r\npendant 4 à 5 minutes en remuant constamment.","Supprimer et diviser entre\r\n4 bols, garnir du reste\r\nbanane, fraises, une cuillerée de\r\nyaourt et une pincée de cannelle."]','2026-01-11 00:11:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11543,4577,'fr','Chou de printemps aux graines de moutarde','Donnez un nouveau look à vos légumes verts en les mélangeant avec de la moutarde, du gingembre, de l''oignon et de l''ail.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de moutarde","1 petit oignon, finement tranché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","500 g de chou de printemps, râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis faites cuire le\r\ngraines de moutarde jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées et\r\ncommence à éclater. Ajouter l''oignon, l''ail et\r\ngingembre, puis faire frire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Astuce dans le\r\nchou et remuer pour bien l''enrober d''épices,\r\npuis cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Saison\r\net servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:11:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11544,4579,'fr','Pâtes crémeuses aux asperges et petits pois','Prenez cinq ingrédients et préparez ce simple dîner de fusilli aux légumes verts pour deux, en plus de prendre 3 de vos 5 par jour.','["250 g de fusilli ou votre forme de pâtes préférée","300 g de pointes d''asperges débarrassées des extrémités ligneuses, coupées en tronçons","175 g de petits pois surgelés","le zeste et le jus d''un demi citron","100g de fromage à pâte molle à la ciboulette"]','["Cuire les pâtes en suivant le paquet\r\ninstructions. Deux minutes avant la fin\r\ndu temps de cuisson, ajoutez les asperges\r\net des pois. Faire bouillir le tout ensemble pour le\r\n2 dernières minutes, puis retirer et réserver\r\nune tasse du liquide de cuisson de la poêle\r\navant d''égoutter les pâtes et les légumes.","Remettre les pâtes et les légumes dans la poêle\r\net ajoutez le zeste de citron, le fromage à pâte molle et\r\nassaisonnement. Ajoutez un filet de jus de citron\r\nau goût et incorporer 2-3 cuillères à soupe de cuisson\r\nliquide pour détendre la sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:11:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11545,4581,'fr','Spaghetti au citron, thon et brocoli','15 minutes suffisent pour concocter ces pâtes de poisson fraîches, légères et saines avec des olives, des câpres et des légumes verts','["350 g de spaghettis","250 g de brocoli coupé en petits bouquets","2 échalotes, hachées finement","85 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres, égouttées","Boîte de 198 g de thon à l''huile","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser"]','["Faire bouillir les spaghettis dans de l''eau salée\r\npendant 6 minutes. Ajoutez le brocoli et\r\nfaire bouillir pendant 4 minutes de plus ou jusqu''à ce que les deux\r\nsont juste tendres.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les échalotes, les olives,\r\ncâpres, thon et zeste et jus de citron\r\ndans un bol de service spacieux. Égoutter les pâtes\r\net le brocoli, ajouter au bol et mélanger\r\ntrès bien avec l''huile d''olive et beaucoup de\r\npoivre noir. Servir avec un petit supplément\r\nl''huile d''olive arrosée."]','2026-01-11 00:11:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11546,4587,'fr','Wraps à la dinde et aux oignons nouveaux','Offrez-vous une gâterie faible en gras avec ces tortillas sandwich ultra-rapides – une fabuleuse façon d''utiliser les restes de dinde','["2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise allégée","2 cuillères à soupe de pesto","4 feuilles de laitue frisée","250 g de dinde cuite, émincé","6 oignons nouveaux, émincés","12 cm de concombre, râpé","4 tortillas à la farine"]','["Mélangez la mayonnaise et le pesto. Répartir les feuilles de laitue, la dinde, les oignons nouveaux et le concombre entre les tortillas. Arrosez de vinaigrette au pesto, roulez et mangez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11547,4591,'fr','Frittata anglaise complète aux haricots fumés','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Cette omelette saine cuite au four avec des ingrédients de friture classiques est assez polyvalente pour le brunch ou le dîner.','["2 saucisses faibles en gras, tranchées","4 tranches de bacon extra maigre, dégraissées, hachées","150 g de champignons de Paris coupés en deux ou les plus gros en quartiers","8 blancs d''œufs, ou utilisez 350 ml de blancs d''œufs liquides en carton","3 cuillères à soupe de lait","140 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 boîtes de 400 g de fèves au lard réduites en sel et en sucre","1½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","petit bouquet de ciboulette, ciselée"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Ligne\r\nun plat à rôtir de la taille d''une feuille de papier A4\r\navec suffisamment de papier sulfurisé pour couvrir\r\nla base et les côtés. Faites frire les saucisses et\r\nbacon dans une poêle antiadhésive jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré,\r\nen les remuant souvent pour éviter qu''ils ne collent.\r\nVerser dans le moule.","Remettez la poêle sur le feu et faites frire\r\nles champignons pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce\r\ndoré, puis ajoutez-les également au plateau.\r\nBattre les blancs d''œufs avec le lait et\r\nbeaucoup d''assaisonnement. Versez dans le moule, puis\r\nparsemez les tomates dessus.","Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\nensemble. Pendant ce temps, versez les haricots dans une casserole\r\navec le paprika et faire chauffer.\r\nParsemer la frittata de ciboulette et\r\nservir avec les haricots à part."]','2026-01-11 00:11:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11548,4593,'fr','Boulettes de dinde au four avec brocoli et pommes de terre croustillantes','Le hachis de dinde est le plus maigre du genre et est excellent roulé en boules et servi avec de la sauce tomate et des légumes.','["1 oignon, râpé","1 grosse carotte, râpée","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de romarin hachées","350 g de haschich Dinde","4 grosses pommes de terre, avec la peau et coupées en petits cubes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan râpé","350 g de brocoli à tige fine","bouquet de feuilles de basilic, râpées"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nDans un grand bol, mélanger l''oignon,\r\ncarotte, la moitié de l''ail et la moitié du\r\nromarin avec la dinde et un peu\r\nassaisonnement. Façonner 16 boulettes de viande\r\net mettez dans une petite plaque à pâtisserie. Lancer\r\nles pommes de terre avec le reste d''ail,\r\nle romarin et l''huile, mettre dans un plat allant au four\r\nplaque, puis faites cuire les deux pendant 20 minutes, avec\r\nles pommes de terre sur l''étagère du haut.","Après 20 minutes, égouttez le jus du\r\nboulettes de viande, verser dessus les tomates cerises,\r\nsaupoudrer de parmesan et assaisonner.\r\nMélangez les pommes de terre et échangez-les vers le bas\r\nétagère avec les pommes de terre dessus. Cuisiner pour\r\nencore 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient\r\ncroustillant et la sauce aux boulettes de viande bouillonne.","Quand les pommes de terre et les boulettes de viande sont\r\npresque cuit, cuire le brocoli pendant 3-4\r\nminutes, jusqu''à tendreté. Saupoudrer le basilic\r\nsur les boulettes de viande et servir avec le\r\npommes de terre croustillantes et brocoli."]','2026-01-11 00:11:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11549,4595,'fr','Tagliatelles au ragoût de légumes','Cette sauce végétarienne de style bolognaise est excellente servie avec des pâtes et des crams dans trois de vos cinq par jour.','["1 oignon, finement haché","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","2 carottes, coupées en dés","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates et 1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","250 g de légumes coupés en dés, comme des courgettes, des poivrons et des champignons","50g de lentilles rouges","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées au basilic","250 g de tagliatelles (ou vos pâtes préférées)","2 cuillères à soupe de copeaux de parmesan (facultatif)"]','["Versez l''oignon, le céleri et les carottes dans\r\nune grande casserole antiadhésive et ajoutez\r\n2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau ou de bouillon, si vous en avez\r\ncertains. Cuire doucement, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que\r\nles légumes sont tendres.","Ajouter l''ail, la purée de tomates et\r\nvinaigre balsamique, cuire à feu vif pendant\r\n1 min de plus, ajoutez les dés de légumes, les lentilles,\r\ntomates, puis porter à ébullition.","Portez à ébullition, puis laissez cuire environ\r\n20 minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes\r\nen suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les.\r\nAssaisonner le ragoût et servir avec des pâtes\r\net du parmesan dessus, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11550,4599,'fr','Salade de pois et soja à l''aneth frais','Une salade légère et printanière qui accompagne à merveille les poissons ou les viandes grillées','["200 g chacun de petits pois et de soja surgelés","petite poignée d''aneth, feuilles hachées, plus brins supplémentaires pour servir","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","1 cuillère à café de moutarde complète","1 cuillère à café de miel clair"]','["Faites cuire les petits pois et les graines de soja\r\nfaire bouillir de l''eau salée pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\njuste tendre. Égoutter puis passer à froid\r\nl''eau jusqu''à refroidissement complet.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la vinaigrette. Mélanger\r\ntous les ingrédients ensemble, assaisonner, puis\r\nremuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Mélanger les haricots\r\net petits pois dans la vinaigrette avec le haché\r\naneth et répartir sur les brins pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11551,4601,'fr','Boulgour à l''ail et aux herbes','Cette salade d''été constitue un accompagnement copieux pour un pique-nique ou un barbecue, et elle est également faible en gras','["200 g de boulgour","175 g de petits pois surgelés","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''ail","jus d''1 citron","une poignée d''herbes, comme (menthe, persil, ciboulette), hachées grossièrement"]','["Cuire le boulgour dans du sel bouillant\r\neau pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté, en ajoutant\r\nles petits pois pour les 3 dernières minutes de cuisson.","Préparez la vinaigrette en mélangeant l''huile,\r\njus de citron et assaisonnement. Remuer les herbes\r\nà travers le boulgour égoutté et\r\npetits pois avec la vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:11:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11552,4605,'fr','Dinde grillée avec taboulé de quinoa et vinaigrette au tahini','Ce souper supersain regorge d''ingrédients vibrants et frais','["200 g de quinoa","½ concombre, coupé en morceaux de 1 cm","175 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","une poignée de persil haché grossièrement","une poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus 1 cuillère à café","jus d''1 citron","4 steaks le dîner","1½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de tahini","1½ cuillère à soupe de yaourt faible en gras","jus ½ citron","½ gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à café de miel clair"]','["Versez le quinoa dans une casserole et\r\nversez plus de 600 ml d''eau. Couvrir d''un\r\ncouvrir et porter à ébullition. Baissez et\r\nlaisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit évaporée\r\n(comme vous feriez cuire du riz) – environ 20 minutes.\r\nRetirez le couvercle et laissez refroidir pendant\r\nvous préparez la dinde et la salade.","Astuce le concombre, les tomates, le printemps\r\nles oignons et les herbes dans un grand bol à mélanger.\r\nVersez dessus 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive et le jus de citron,\r\nbien assaisonner et mélanger le tout.","Faites chauffer une poêle et, en fumant\r\nchaud, frottez les steaks de dinde avec 1 cuillère à café d''olive\r\nhuile. Cuire environ 5 minutes de chaque côté,\r\nen fonction de l''épaisseur. Mélanger\r\ntous les ingrédients de la vinaigrette ainsi que\r\n3 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Mélanger le quinoa ensemble\r\navec la salade et dresser sur des assiettes.\r\nCoupez la dinde en tranches épaisses, empilez-les\r\nle quinoa et arroser de vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:11:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11553,4607,'fr','Salade de courge et d''orge avec vinaigrette balsamique','Une salade insolite et pleine de saveurs, délicieuse tiède ou froide – idéale pour un buffet','["1 courge musquée, pelée et coupée en longs morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g d''orge perlé","300 g de brocoli à tige tendre, coupé en morceaux de taille moyenne","100 g de tomates SunBlush, tranchées","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en dés","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille","1 cuillère à soupe de petites câpres rincées","15 olives noires dénoyautées","20 g de basilic haché","5 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Placer\r\nla courge sur une plaque à pâtisserie et mélanger avec\r\nhuile d''olive. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes. Pendant ce temps,\r\nfaire bouillir l''orge pendant environ 25 minutes dans du sel\r\narroser jusqu''à tendreté, mais al dente. Alors que c''est\r\nce qui se passe, fouettez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette\r\nun petit bol, puis assaisonner de sel et de poivre.\r\nÉgoutter l''orge, puis la verser dans un bol et\r\nverser sur la vinaigrette. Mélangez bien et laissez refroidir.","Faire bouillir le brocoli dans de l''eau salée jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste\r\ntendre, puis égouttez-les et rincez-les à l''eau froide.\r\nÉgoutter et sécher. Ajoutez le brocoli et\r\nle reste des ingrédients à l''orge et mélanger\r\neh bien. Cela se conservera 3 jours au réfrigérateur\r\net est délicieux tiède ou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:11:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11554,4609,'fr','Chou de Milan aux amandes','Un accompagnement super sain avec des amandes légèrement grillées pour donner du croquant à votre chou','["1 chou de Milan, tranché finement","25g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","1 brin de romarin, feuilles finement hachées","100 g d''amandes blanchies"]','["Cuire le chou à la vapeur ou au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il\r\njuste cuit. Faire fondre le beurre avec l''huile\r\ndans une grande poêle ou un wok, puis ajoutez le\r\nail, romarin et amandes. Cuisinier,\r\nen remuant les amandes pendant environ 2 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Verser sur une assiette.\r\nAjouter le chou dans la poêle, incorporer le\r\nrestes de jus de beurre, puis retournez\r\nle mélange d''amandes dans la poêle. Saison\r\nbien et verser dans un plat de service."]','2026-01-11 00:11:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11555,4611,'fr','Spaghettis aux sardines','Ce souper dans les placards est super rapide et super sain en plus','["400 g de spaghettis","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","pincée de flocons de piment","Boîte de 227 g de tomates concassées","2 boîtes de 95 g de sardines sans peau et désossées à la sauce tomate","100 g d''olives noires dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, égouttées","une petite poignée de persil haché"]','["Faites cuire les spaghettis dans une grande poêle\r\neau bouillante salée selon l''emballage\r\ninstructions. Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle moyenne et faites cuire\r\nl''ail pendant 1 min. Ajoutez les flocons de piment,\r\ntomates et sardines, brisées\r\ngrossièrement avec une cuillère en bois. Chauffer pour\r\n2-3 minutes, puis incorporez les olives et les câpres\r\net la majeure partie du persil. Bien mélanger pour\r\ncombiner.","Égouttez les pâtes en réservant quelques\r\nà soupe d''eau. Ajoutez les pâtes au\r\nsauce et bien mélanger en ajoutant le jus réservé\r\neau si la sauce est un peu épaisse. Diviser\r\nentre 4 bols et saupoudrer de\r\npersil restant."]','2026-01-11 00:11:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11556,4613,'fr','Salade piquante de saumon et de riz brun','Cette recette estivale contient la combinaison idéale de glucides à libération lente, de protéines maigres et de graisses bonnes pour le cœur.','["200 g de riz basmati brun","200 g de graines de soja surgelées, décongelées","2 filets de saumon","1 concombre, coupé en dés","petit bouquet d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","petit bouquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","1 piment rouge, coupé en dés, épépiné si vous le souhaitez","4 cuillères à café de sauce soja légère"]','["Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions du paquet et 3 minutes avant la fin, ajoutez les graines de soja. Égoutter et refroidir sous l’eau froide courante.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le saumon dans une assiette, puis passez au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Laisser refroidir légèrement, retirer la peau à la fourchette, puis l''émietter.","Incorporez délicatement le concombre, les oignons nouveaux, la coriandre et le saumon au riz et aux haricots. Dans un autre bol, mélangez le zeste et le jus du citron vert, le piment et le soja, puis versez sur le riz avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11557,4615,'fr','Quinoa épicé aux amandes et feta','Utilisez du quinoa à la place du couscous pour préparer une délicieuse salade sans gluten','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","300 g de quinoa rincé","50 g d''amandes effilées grillées","100 g de fromage feta émietté","une poignée de persil haché grossièrement","jus ½ citron"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajoutez les épices,\r\npuis faites frire pendant environ une minute jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées.\r\nAjoutez le quinoa, puis faites revenir encore\r\nmin jusqu''à ce que vous entendiez un léger claquement\r\ndes sons. Incorporez 600 ml d''eau bouillante, puis\r\nlaisser mijoter doucement pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nl''eau s''est évaporée et le quinoa\r\nles grains sont entourés d’un « halo » blanc.\r\nLaisser refroidir légèrement, puis mélanger au\r\nd''autres ingrédients. Servir tiède ou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:11:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11558,4617,'fr','Galettes d''avoine aux graines','Ces biscuits rapides constituent un excellent ajout à un plateau de fromages ou à un panier cadeau gastronomique fait maison.','["50g de beurre","100 g de flocons d''avoine moyens","100 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 cuillères à café de graines de pavot","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nFaire fondre le beurre dans une petite casserole, puis laisser\r\nrefroidir légèrement. Inclinez tous les ingrédients secs\r\ndans un bol, avec ½ cuillère à café de sel, puis versez-y\r\nle beurre. Ajouter 5 à 6 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante\r\net mélanger pour obtenir une pâte ferme.","Démoulez légèrement la pâte\r\nsurface farinée, puis étaler jusqu''à environ\r\n0,5 cm d''épaisseur. Coupez en petits carrés, puis\r\ncuire au four pendant 12-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Partir\r\nlaisser refroidir quelques minutes, puis transférer dans\r\nune grille et laisser refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:11:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11559,9457,'fr','Chili aux légumes et aux haricots','Ce piment végétarien sain constitue un souper rapide et satisfaisant, rempli de légumineuses et de légumes frais colorés.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché finement","1 gros oignon, haché","2 courgettes, coupées en dés","1 poivron rouge épépiné et haché","1 poivron jaune épépiné et haché","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de piment","100 g de lentilles rouges lavées et égouttées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","Boîte de 195 g de maïs doux égoutté","Boîte de 420 g de haricots beurre, égouttés","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges dans l''eau, égouttés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Faites cuire l''ail, le gingembre, l''oignon, les courgettes et les poivrons pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez la poudre de piment et laissez cuire encore 1 min.","Incorporer les lentilles, le concentré de tomates, les tomates et 250 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 15 à 20 minutes.","Ajoutez le maïs doux et les haricots et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:11:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11560,4619,'fr','Salade de saumon et soja','Rempli du type de gras qui est bon pour vous, cela constitue un repas léger mais néanmoins satisfaisant.','["1 gros œuf riche en oméga-3 (Voir la section ESSAYER en bas de la recette)","200 g de graines de soja surgelées, décongelées","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de graines de lin (nous avons utilisé granoVita)","Sachet 250g de lentilles du Puy","petit bouquet d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","2 filets de saumon pochés, sans peau"]','["Mettez l''œuf dans une casserole, couvrez d''eau froide et portez à ébullition. Cuire 4 minutes (ou 8 pour les durs), en ajoutant les graines de soja dans la poêle pendant la dernière minute, puis égoutter et passer sous l''eau froide pour refroidir. Décortiquez et coupez l''œuf en 6 quartiers, puis réservez.","Mélangez le jus et le zeste de citron avec l''huile, assaisonnez, puis incorporez les graines de soja, les lentilles et les oignons nouveaux.","Répartissez dans 2 assiettes, puis cassez délicatement le saumon en gros flocons et déposez-le dessus avec les lentilles ainsi que l''œuf. Essayez-le avec du pain brun aux graines."]','2026-01-11 00:11:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11561,4621,'fr','Cabillaud citronné et purée de haricots basilic','Un souper sain pour le cœur qui constitue le repas parfait en milieu de semaine pour deux','["2 petites grappes de tomates cerises, sur vigne","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","morceaux de morue sans peau ou autre filet de poisson blanc","le zeste d''1 citron et le jus de ½","240 g de graines de soja surgelées","1 gousse d''ail","bouquet de basilic, feuilles et tiges séparées","100 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Mettre \r\nles tomates sur une plaque à pâtisserie, frotter avec \r\nun peu d''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis rôtir \r\npendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les peaux commencent à se fendre. \r\nAjouter le poisson dans le plateau, garnir de la majeure partie  \r\nle zeste de citron et un peu plus d''assaisonnement, \r\npuis arrosez d''un peu plus d''huile. Rôti pour  \r\n8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson se défasse facilement.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les haricots dans une poêle \r\nfaire bouillir l''eau pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste tendre. \r\nÉgouttez, puis versez dans un robot culinaire avec le \r\nreste de l''huile, ail, tiges de basilic, jus de citron \r\net le bouillon, puis pulser jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et légèrement \r\npurée grossière. Assaisonner au goût.","Répartissez les tomates et écrasez-les entre elles \r\ndeux assiettes, garnir de morue, puis parsemer \r\navec des feuilles de basilic et le reste de citron \r\nzeste pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11562,4623,'fr','Curry de légumes d''été','Donnez à votre curry du vendredi soir une cure de jouvence saine avec ce plat végétarien faible en gras et supersain.','["1-2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaïlandais (selon les goûts)","500 ml de bouillon de légumes faible en sodium","2 oignons, hachés","1 aubergine, coupée en dés","75g de lentilles rouges","200 ml de lait de coco allégé en boîte","2 poivrons rouges ou jaunes épépinés et coupés en quartiers","140 g de petits pois surgelés","100 g de pousses d''épinards hachées grossièrement","riz basmati brun et chutney de mangue, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer la pâte de curry dans une grande\r\ncasserole antiadhésive avec un splash\r\ndu stock. Ajouter les oignons et faire revenir\r\npendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à ramollir.\r\nIncorporer l''aubergine et cuire pendant\r\nencore 5 minutes – ajoutez un peu plus\r\nstock si ça commence à coller.","Ajoutez les lentilles, le lait de coco et\r\nle reste du bouillon et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient\r\ntendre. Ajouter les poivrons et cuire\r\npendant 5 à 10 minutes supplémentaires. Remuer à travers le\r\nles pois et les épinards et cuire jusqu''à ce que\r\nles épinards viennent de faner. Servir le\r\ncurry avec riz et chutney de mangue."]','2026-01-11 00:11:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11563,4625,'fr','Nouilles à la dinde, haricots verts et hoisin','Une longue journée de travail ? Préparez ce souper copieux mais faible en gras et dégustez-le sur le canapé','["100 g de nouilles ramen","100 g de haricots verts coupés en deux","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","jus 1 citron vert","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce chili","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","250 g de dinde hachée","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","6 oignons nouveaux, tranchés en diagonale"]','["Faire bouillir les nouilles suivant le paquet\r\ninstructions, en ajoutant les haricots verts\r\npour les 2 dernières minutes. Égoutter et réserver.","Dans un petit bol, mélanger le hoisin,\r\njus de citron vert et sauce chili. Dans un wok ou\r\npoêle, faites chauffer l''huile, puis faites frire le\r\nhacher jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien doré. Ajoutez le\r\nl''ail et faire revenir encore 1 min. Incorporer le\r\nmélange hoisin et cuire quelques minutes\r\nplus jusqu''à ce qu''il soit collant. Enfin, incorporez le\r\nnouilles, haricots et la moitié du printemps\r\noignons à réchauffer. Disperser\r\nles oignons nouveaux restants pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11564,4627,'fr','Edamame & chilli dip with crudités','La nourriture de fête ne doit pas nécessairement faire grossir. Savourez cette collation fraîche et saine autant de fois que vous le souhaitez','["300 g de graines de soja surgelées","150 g de yaourt nature allégé","1 piment rouge, haché","jus 1 citron vert","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","une poignée de coriandre hachée","radis coupés en deux, bâtonnets de carottes, céleri et poivrons, pour servir"]','["Cuire les graines de soja à ébullition\r\neau salée pendant 4 minutes. Égoutter et laisser refroidir\r\nsous l''eau froide courante. Blitz avec le yaourt haché rouge\r\npiment, jus de citron vert et ail écrasé\r\nclou de girofle jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer le finement haché\r\noignon rouge et une poignée hachée\r\ncoriandre. Servir avec des radis coupés en deux\r\net des bâtonnets de carottes, céleri et\r\npoivrons. La trempette restera recouverte de\r\nau réfrigérateur jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:11:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11565,4629,'fr','Soupe indienne d''hiver','Cette soupe d''hiver réchauffante est riche en fibres, faible en gras et peut être congelée pour un confort ultime.','["100 g d''orge perlé","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","½ cuillère à café de graines de moutarde brune","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 piments verts épépinés et finement hachés","1 feuille de laurier","2 clous de girofle","1 petit bâton de cannelle","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 gros oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 panais, coupé en morceaux","200 g de courge butternut coupée en morceaux","200 g de patates douces coupées en morceaux","1 cuillère à café de paprika","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","225 g de lentilles rouges","2 tomates hachées","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","1 cuillère à café de gingembre râpé","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron"]','["Rincer l''orge perlé et cuire\r\nen suivant les instructions de l''emballage. Quand c''est\r\ntendre, égoutter et réserver. Pendant ce temps,\r\nfaites chauffer l''huile dans un récipient profond et à fond épais\r\ncasserole. Faire revenir les graines de moutarde, le cumin\r\ngraines, piments, feuille de laurier, clous de girofle, cannelle\r\net le curcuma jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé et les graines\r\ncommence à crépiter. Ajoutez l''oignon et\r\nl''ail, puis cuire pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.\r\nIncorporer le panais, le butternut et le sucré\r\npomme de terre et bien mélanger, en veillant à\r\nles légumes sont entièrement enrobés de\r\nhuile et épices. Saupoudrer de paprika,\r\ncoriandre moulue et assaisonnement, et\r\nremuez à nouveau.","Ajouter les lentilles, l''orge perlé, les tomates\r\net 1,7 litre d''eau. Porter à ébullition\r\npuis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles légumes sont tendres. Quand les lentilles\r\nsont presque cuits, incorporez-les hachées\r\ncoriandre, gingembre et jus de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:11:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11566,4631,'fr','Brochettes de tofu à la diable','Un kebab végétarien faible en gras pour faire ressortir le diable qui sommeille en vous','["8 échalotes ou oignons de Paris","8 petites pommes de terre nouvelles","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète","300 g de tofu fumé ferme, coupé en cubes","1 courgette, pelée et tranchée","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en dés"]','["Mettez les échalotes ou les oignons de Paris dans un bol, couvrez d''eau bouillante et réservez 5 min. Cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Égoutter et sécher. Mettre le concentré de tomates, soja \r\nsauce, huile, miel, moutarde et assaisonnement dans un bol, puis bien mélanger. Mélangez le tofu dans la marinade. Ensemble \r\nréserver pendant au moins 10 minutes.","Faites chauffer le gril. Égouttez et épluchez les échalotes ou les oignons, puis faites-les cuire dans l''eau bouillante pendant 3 min. Bien égoutter. Enfiler le tofu, les échalotes, les pommes de terre, la courgette et le poivron sur des brochettes de 8 x 20 cm. Griller pendant 10 minutes, en retournant fréquemment et en badigeonnant du reste de la marinade avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11567,4633,'fr','Linguine au crabe, piment et persil','Restez simple avec ce plat de style restaurant qui prend quelques ingrédients de bonne qualité et les laisse briller','["400 g de linguines","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 crabe entier cuit, cueilli, ou environ 100 g de chair de crabe brune et 200 g de chair de crabe blanche fraîche","un petit peu, environ 5 cuillères à soupe, de vin blanc","un petit filet de citron (facultatif)","une grosse poignée de feuilles de persil plat, hachées très finement"]','["Apportez une grande casserole d''eau salée à\r\nfaire bouillir et ajouter les linguines. Donnez-le\r\nbien remuer et faire bouillir pendant 1 min de moins que\r\ndit la meute. Bien remuer de temps en temps\r\ndonc ça ne colle pas.","Pendant la cuisson des pâtes, faites chauffer doucement\r\n3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive avec le piment et l''ail\r\ndans une casserole assez grande pour contenir tout le\r\npâtes confortablement. Faites cuire le piment et\r\nl''ail très doucement jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à grésiller,\r\npuis augmentez le feu et ajoutez le blanc\r\ndu vin. Laisser mijoter le tout jusqu''au vin\r\net l''huile d''olive se réunissent. Alors prends\r\nhors du feu et ajoutez la chair de crabe brune,\r\nà l''aide d''une spatule ou d''une cuillère en bois pour\r\nécrasez-le dans l''huile d''olive pour obtenir un\r\nsauce épaisse.","Quand les pâtes ont fini de cuire\r\ntemps, goûtez un brin – il devrait avoir un\r\ntrès légère morsure. Quand c''est prêt, éteignez\r\nla chaleur. Placez la sauce à feu très doux\r\nchauffer et utiliser une paire de pinces de cuisine pour soulever\r\nles pâtes de l''eau dans la sauce.","Hors du feu, ajoutez la chair de crabe blanche\r\net du persil aux pâtes en saupoudrant\r\nde sel marin. Mélangez vraiment le tout\r\neh bien, j''ajoute une goutte d''eau pour pâtes\r\nsi ça commence à devenir sale. Goût pour\r\nassaisonnement et, s''il a besoin d''un léger relèvement,\r\najoutez un petit filet de citron. Servir\r\nimmédiatement tournoyé dans des bols de pâtes\r\net arrosé du reste de l''huile."]','2026-01-11 00:11:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11568,4635,'fr','Le relooking ultime : la tarte au poisson','Cet aliment réconfortant traditionnellement riche en matières grasses a été transformé en un plat sain pour le cœur.','["500 ml de lait demi-écrémé","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","100 g de crevettes cuites dans leur carapace","quelques brins de thym, de préférence du thym citronné","2 feuilles de laurier","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée finement","750 g de pommes de terre nouvelles type Charlotte (pas besoin de les éplucher)","1 poireau moyen, tranché finement (175 g poids préparé)","400 g de filet d''aiglefin décortiqué","350 g de filet de saumon décortiqué","175 g de filet d''aiglefin fumé, pelé","Pot de 125 g de fromage à pâte molle allégé à l''ail et aux herbes","2 cuillères à soupe de persil finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de ciboulette ciselée"]','["Mélangez 3 cuillères à soupe de lait dans la maïzena\r\net mettre de côté. Versez le reste du lait\r\ndans une casserole. Décortiquez les crevettes,\r\nréserver la viande, puis déposer les coquilles\r\net têtes (lavez-les d’abord si nécessaire)\r\ndans le lait avec les brins de thym,\r\nfeuilles de laurier, ail et poivre moulu.\r\nPorter à ébullition, puis retirer du feu\r\net laissez infuser 20 min.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les pommes de terre dans un\r\ngrande casserole d''eau, porter à ébullition et\r\nlaisser mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Vidange.\r\nFaites cuire à la vapeur les tranches de poireau pendant 3 minutes, puis\r\nretirer du feu et réserver.","Passer le lait infusé au tamis\r\ndans une grande sauteuse peu profonde. Posez tout le\r\nfilets de poisson (pas les crevettes) dans le lait.\r\nPortez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et\r\nlaisser mijoter doucement pendant 3 min. Supprimer de\r\nChauffer le feu et laisser reposer 5 min à couvert.\r\nUtilisez une écumoire pour transférer tout le poisson\r\ndans un plat et laisser refroidir légèrement. Chaleur\r\nfour à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6.","Incorporez la maïzena relâchée, puis remuez\r\ndans le lait chaud de la sauteuse.\r\nRemettez la casserole sur le feu et remuez jusqu''à ce que\r\népaissi. Incorporer brièvement le fromage à pâte molle,\r\nretirer du feu, puis ajouter le\r\npersil et assaisonner de poivre noir.\r\nIncorporer tout liquide qui s''est écoulé de\r\nle poisson. Cassez le poisson en gros morceaux\r\nvous les disposez dans un plat allant au four de 2 litres\r\nafin que les différentes variétés soient uniformément\r\ndistribué. Répartir sur les crevettes et\r\npoireau, puis assaisonner de poivre. Versez le\r\nla sauce et remuez doucement pour\r\nrépartir uniformément la sauce et mélanger\r\nle tout sans casser le poisson.","A l''aide d''une grande fourchette, écraser les pommes de terre\r\nen les brisant (pas en les écrasant)\r\nen gros morceaux. Incorporer l''huile, la ciboulette\r\net une mouture de poivre noir. Verser le\r\nécraser les pommes de terre sur le poisson. Posez le plat dessus\r\nune plaque à pâtisserie et enfourner pendant 25-30 minutes,\r\nou jusqu''à ce que la sauce bouillonne et que le\r\npommes de terre dorées. Alternativement, faites\r\nle plat complètement, réfrigérez-le pendant\r\nplusieurs heures ou toute la nuit, puis enfournez à température\r\nmême température que ci-dessus pendant 45 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:11:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11569,4637,'fr','Salade de courgettes en ruban','Cette salade ne prend que 10 minutes à préparer et regorge de pois chiches, de courgettes, de maïs doux et de feta. Il est suffisamment copieux pour être dégusté seul ou comme accompagnement estival.','["10 g de persil finement haché","1 citron, zesté et pressé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ cuillère à soupe de miel","2 courgettes","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","½ boîte de 198 g de maïs doux, égoutté","80 g de feta (vérifiez qu''elle est végétarienne, si besoin)","2 cuillères à café de graines mélangées","2 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés"]','["Mettez la majeure partie du persil, le zeste et le jus de citron, l''huile d''olive et le miel dans un bol et fouettez ensemble avec un peu d''assaisonnement au goût.","À l''aide d''un économe, épluchez les courgettes en rubans en jetant les graines du centre. Versez dans un grand bol avec les pois chiches et le maïs doux. Versez dessus la vinaigrette, mélangez et laissez mariner 5 minutes. Émiettez la feta et mélangez-la légèrement. Assaisonner avec un peu de poivre noir.","Répartissez la salade dans quatre assiettes. Répartissez le reste du persil et saupoudrez-le avec le mélange de graines et d''oignons nouveaux."]','2026-01-11 00:11:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11570,4639,'fr','Saladier végétalien','Préparez une salade végétalienne facile, avec des haricots, des radis, du chou mariné et du couscous. Débordant de saveur, il constitue un dîner ou un déjeuner satisfaisant sur le pouce','["200 g de couscous","Boîte de 400 g de mélange de haricots","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1⁄2 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","3⁄4 petit bouquet d''aneth, coupé en brins","2 radis pastèque ou 6 petits, tranchés","1⁄2 concombre, pelé en rubans","1 gros oignon rouge, finement tranché","1⁄4 petit chou rouge, tranché finement","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc ou de vinaigre de cidre de pomme","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","1⁄4 petit bouquet d''aneth, feuilles cueillies"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le cornichon. Mélangez tous les ingrédients dans un grand bol avec 1 cuillère à café de sel marin feuilleté, puis couvrez et réservez jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Mélangez le couscous avec 280 ml d''eau bouillante dans un bol, couvrez et laissez reposer 4 min, puis remuez à la fourchette. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Pendant ce temps, égouttez et rincez les haricots, versez-les dans un bol, puis ajoutez l''huile d''olive et les flocons de piment ainsi qu''un peu d''assaisonnement.","Mélangez la majeure partie de l''aneth avec le couscous et assaisonnez. Pour assembler, versez le cornichon rapide, le couscous, les radis, les haricots et le concombre dans des parties séparées de chaque bol. Garnir le cornichon avec l''aneth réservé et broyer avec un peu de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11571,4641,'fr','Grande brochette de poulet barbecue','Un barbecue pour plus de quatre personnes ? Préparez une grosse brochette de poulet à découper, puis la cuisson se fait en une seule fois – et vous pourrez profiter de la fête.','["12 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","500 g de yaourt grec","2 citrons pressés, ½ citron zesté","100 ml d''huile d''olive","4 gousses d''ail, très finement râpées ou écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika doux","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à café de thym séché","1 cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir concassé","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","2 oignons rouges, coupés en deux et finement tranchés","4 tomates (les prunes fonctionnent bien) coupées en deux et tranchées"]','["Tout d’abord, fouettez tous les ingrédients de la marinade avec 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol ou, mieux encore, un grand récipient en plastique muni d’un couvercle. Ouvrez chaque cuisse de poulet, recouvrez-la d''un morceau de papier sulfurisé et aplatissez-la avec la main, puis retirez le papier et coupez la cuisse en deux. Versez la marinade et mélangez pour qu''elle soit complètement enrobée. Couvrir, réfrigérer et laisser mariner pendant au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''à 24 heures – plus c''est long, mieux c''est.","Enfilez tout le poulet sur deux brochettes de manière à ce que les deux brochettes traversent chaque morceau de viande, en les tassant bien au fur et à mesure pour obtenir un kebab compact (voir conseil ci-dessous).","Allumez un barbecue à couvercle et laissez les flammes s''éteindre. Une fois que les charbons sont devenus cendrés, empilez-les d’un côté avec une seule couche de charbons dispersés sur l’autre côté. Disposez la brochette de poulet sur le côté du barbecue avec seulement quelques braises en dessous. Posez le couvercle et laissez cuire 45 minutes en retournant toutes les 15 minutes. Pour finir, soulevez le couvercle et roulez le kebab sur le côté le plus chaud pour carboniser la viande, en la retournant toutes les quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien dorée et bien cuite. Séparez les morceaux de poulet au centre pour vérifier qu''ils sont cuits, ou utilisez un thermomètre de cuisson numérique : il doit indiquer 70 °C ou plus. Laissez reposer 5 à 10 min le temps de cuire les pittas (voir recette ci-contre). Apportez le kebab à table et découpez-le en fines tranches avec un couteau dentelé. Empilez la viande découpée dans les pittas chauds, puis les oignons rouges et les tomates tranchés, les chips et le tzatziki (voir nos recettes ci-dessous)."]','2026-01-11 00:11:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11572,4645,'fr','Le smoothie booste les vitamines','Augmentez votre quota de vitamines avec l''aide de ce smoothie lumineux et frais. L''orange, la carotte, le céleri et la mangue apportent un punch nutritif','["1 orange, pelée et hachée grossièrement","1 grosse carotte, pelée et hachée grossièrement","2 branches de céleri, hachées grossièrement","50 g de mangues hachées grossièrement","200 ml d''eau"]','["Mettez toute l''orange, la carotte, le céleri et la mangue dans le mixeur, complétez avec de l''eau, puis mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse."]','2026-01-11 00:11:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11573,4647,'fr','Smoothie aide-cœur','Mélangez la betterave, la pomme, les myrtilles et le gingembre pour créer une boisson onctueuse et nutritive avec de la profondeur et du piquant.','["2 petites betteraves crues, pelées et hachées grossièrement","1 petite pomme pelée, coupée en quartiers et épépinée","50g de myrtilles","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé","300 ml d''eau"]','["Mettez la betterave, la pomme, les myrtilles et le gingembre dans un mixeur, complétez avec de l''eau puis mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse."]','2026-01-11 00:11:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11574,4649,'fr','Salade d''oranges, pois chiches et prosciutto','Recherchez une mozzarella de bufflonne à utiliser dans cette salade, si vous le pouvez. Avec des pois chiches, du prosciutto et des noisettes, c''est une explosion de couleurs et de textures','["50 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 citron, jus","1 cuillère à café de miel","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","½ petit bouquet de persil finement haché","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre écrasées","2-3 petites oranges, pelées et tranchées","50g de fusée","2 boules de 125 g de mozzarella de bufflonne","80g de jambon","30 g de noisettes grillées et hachées","pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Fouetter l''huile, le jus de citron et le miel dans un bol, puis assaisonner. Mélanger avec les pois chiches, le persil et les graines de coriandre, suivis des tranches d''orange et de la roquette. Étalez la salade sur une grande assiette à partager.","Déchirez la mozzarella sur la salade, puis parsemez de prosciutto et de noisettes. Servir avec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:11:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11575,4651,'fr','Coquilles de pâtes au brocoli','Les enfants adoreront cette version plus saine du pesto et des pâtes, le brocoli augmentant leur consommation de légumes. Cela ne prend que 20 minutes à préparer et est faible en calories','["1 tête de brocoli, coupée en fleurons","1 gousse d''ail, non pelée","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de coquilles de pâtes","½ petit paquet de persil","½ petit paquet de basilic","30 g de pignons de pin grillés","½ citron, zesté et pressé","30 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), plus un peu pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger le brocoli et l''ail dans 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive sur une plaque à rôtir et rôtir au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis.","Versez les coquilles de pâtes dans une casserole d’eau bouillante salée. Cuire selon les instructions du paquet et égoutter. Versez le persil, le basilic, les pignons de pin, le jus de citron et le parmesan dans un mixeur. Une fois le brocoli cuit, réservez quelques-uns des plus petits morceaux. Pressez l''ail de sa peau, ajoutez-le au mixeur avec le reste du brocoli, mixez en pesto et assaisonnez bien.","Mélangez les pâtes avec le pesto. Ajoutez les fleurons de brocoli réservés, répartis dans deux bols et garnissez d''un peu de parmesan supplémentaire, du zeste de citron et d''un bon moulin à poivre noir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11576,4653,'fr','Saumon sauvage avec salade de salsa de maïs et de poivre','Faites mariner du poisson sain pour le cœur avec des épices et servez-le avec du maïs doux coloré et de l''avocat – les végétariens peuvent utiliser du halloumi à la place','["1 gousse d''ail","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 citron vert, son zeste et son jus râpés, ainsi que des quartiers pour servir (facultatif)","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","2 filets de saumon sauvage","1 épi de maïs, la coque enlevée si elle est attachée","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 avocat dénoyauté, pelé et finement haché","1 poivron rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux, épépiné et haché","½ paquet de coriandre, finement hachée"]','["Râpez finement l''ail dans un bol pour le frotter aux épices. Faites bouillir le maïs pour la salade salsa pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, puis égouttez-le et coupez les grains avec un couteau bien aiguisé.","Incorporer les épices, 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert et l''huile dans l''ail pour faire un mélange d''épices, puis utiliser pour enrober le saumon.","Mélangez le reste du zeste et du jus de citron vert avec le maïs et incorporez tous les ingrédients restants. Faites chauffer une poêle et faites cuire le saumon 2 min de chaque côté pour qu''il soit encore un peu rosé au centre. Servir avec la salade salsa avec des quartiers de citron vert supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez, à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:11:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11577,4655,'fr','Goberge au citron avec chips de patates douces et purée de brocoli','Le fish and chips fait peau neuve avec une vinaigrette piquante aux câpres et des petits pois à la menthe – remplacez-les par de l''aubergine pour une option végétarienne','["2 gousses d''ail","2 patates douces (175 g/6 oz), lavées et coupées en chips","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour le poisson","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","2 filets de goberge (environ 100 g chacun)","½ citron non ciré","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1½ cuillère à café de câpres, rincées et hachées","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth haché","1 poireau, haché","4 pointes de brocoli (environ 200 g/7 oz)","85 g de petits pois surgelés","poignée de menthe"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Hachez finement l''ail, mettez-en la moitié dans un bol pour la vinaigrette et réservez le reste pour les chips. Mélanger les patates douces avec l''huile et les étaler sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Enfourner 25 mn en retournant à mi-cuisson.","Disposez le poisson sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé sur une plaque à pâtisserie, badigeonnez d''un peu d''huile, puis râpez dessus le zeste de citron et assaisonnez de poivre noir. Annuler.","Faire bouillir le poireau pendant 5 minutes, puis ajouter le brocoli et cuire encore 5 minutes. Ajoutez les petits pois pendant encore 2 minutes. Égouttez, remettez dans la casserole et mixez avec un mixeur plongeant pour obtenir une purée épaisse. Ajoutez la menthe, puis mixez à nouveau.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez l''ail et le paprika avec les chips et remettez au four avec le poisson pendant 10 minutes. Ajoutez l''huile d''olive à l''ail, avec les câpres et l''aneth et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Servir le tout avec la vinaigrette aux câpres versée sur le poisson."]','2026-01-11 00:11:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11578,4657,'fr','Salade de poulet et d''avocat avec vinaigrette balsamique aux bleuets','Un dîner ou un déjeuner sain et sans gluten, parfait pour utiliser les restes de poulet rôti. Rendez-le végétarien en échangeant la viande contre une poignée de graines de citrouille.','["1 gousse d''ail","85g de myrtilles","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza extra vierge","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre balsamique","125 g de fèves fraîches ou surgelées","1 grosse betterave cuite, hachée finement","1 avocat, dénoyauté, pelé et tranché","Sachet de 85 g de salade de jeunes feuilles mélangées","175 g de poulet cuit"]','["Hachez finement l''ail. Écrasez la moitié des myrtilles avec l''huile, le vinaigre et un peu de poivre noir dans un grand saladier.","Faire bouillir les fèves pendant 5 minutes jusqu’à ce qu’elles soient juste tendres. Égoutter en les laissant sans peau.","Incorporez l''ail à la vinaigrette, puis ajoutez les haricots chauds et le reste des myrtilles avec la betterave, l''avocat, la salade et le poulet. Mélangez, mais n’en faites pas trop, sinon le jus de betterave rendra tout rose. Empilez-les sur des assiettes ou dans des bols peu profonds pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11579,4659,'fr','Boulettes de viande végétariennes aux courgettis aux tomates','Spiralez les courgettes pour préparer ce plat de « pâtes » plus sain et sans gluten. Les boulettes de viande végétariennes utilisent des amandes moulues au lieu de la chapelure pour augmenter les protéines.','["3 gousses d''ail","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour le graissage","1 petit oignon haché très finement","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre balsamique","100 g de haricots rouges en conserve","1 cuillère à soupe d''oeuf battu","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café bombée de poudre de piment","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","15g d''amandes moulues","40 g de maïs doux cuit","Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","2 grosses ou 3 tomates normales, hachées","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique","2 courgettes coupées en « nouilles » avec un spiraliseur, un éplucheur en julienne ou à la main"]','["Hachez finement l''ail. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon en remuant fréquemment pendant 8 minutes. Incorporer le vinaigre balsamique et cuire encore 2 minutes. Pendant ce temps, mettez les haricots dans un bol avec l''œuf, la purée de tomates et les épices, et écrasez-les jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer les amandes et le maïs doux avec le thym, un tiers de l''ail haché et les oignons balsamiques. Bien mélanger et façonner environ 8 boules de la taille d''une noix, et les déposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé huilé.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et cuire les boulettes de viande végétariennes pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient fermes. Pendant ce temps, mettez les tomates, la purée de tomates et le vinaigre balsamique dans une casserole et faites cuire avec 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau jusqu''à consistance pulpeuse, puis incorporez le reste de l''ail et des courgetti. Éteignez le feu car vous souhaitez réchauffer les nouilles plutôt que de les cuire. Servir avec les boulettes de viande végétariennes."]','2026-01-11 00:11:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11580,4661,'fr','Poulet rôti avec salade de gremolata de patates douces','Faites rôtir un poulet entier pour ce déjeuner ou ce dîner faible en calories et conservez les restes pour plus tard – remplacez le poulet par des œufs durs contre une version végétarienne.','["1 citron","1½ kg de poulet entier (fermier ou bio), dégraissé de l''intérieur de la cavité du cou","3 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de persil finement hachées (réserver les tiges)","2 patates douces (175 g/6 oz chacune)","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","7 gousses d''ail entières","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza extra vierge","Sachet de 125 g de bébés épinards lavés","4 cuillères à soupe bombées de graines de grenade"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Râper le zeste et presser le jus du citron dans 2 bols, puis enfoncer les quartiers à l''intérieur de la cavité du poulet avec les tiges de persil. Mettez le poulet dans un plat à rôtir et faites-le rôtir pendant 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, frottez les patates douces (pas besoin de les éplucher) et coupez-les en morceaux. Mettez dans un autre plat à rôtir avec les oignons, le fenouil et 6 gousses d''ail entières, puis mélangez avec l''huile. Lorsque le poulet a fini ses 30 minutes, mettez les pommes de terre au four et faites rôtir encore 30 à 40 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, hachez finement la gousse d''ail restante pour la gremolata, puis mélangez-la avec le zeste de citron et le persil. Mélangez le jus de citron, l''huile et un peu de poivre noir dans un bol.","Retirez le poulet et les pommes de terre du four. Couvrir le poulet et laisser reposer. Incorporer la moitié du mélange de gremolata au jus de citron et à l''huile. Incorporer les épinards au mélange de pommes de terre et remettre au four pendant 2 minutes pour les faire flétrir. Versez la vinaigrette au citron et mélangez bien. Découpez un morceau de poitrine de poulet (il vous faut environ 140 g), retirez la peau, puis coupez-le en morceaux. Incorporer à la salade avec les graines de grenade, puis servir parsemé du reste de gremolata."]','2026-01-11 00:11:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11581,4663,'fr','Pilau de légumes épicé avec raita de concombre','Remplacez le riz par du freekeh pour un one-pot délicieusement différent et faible en calories avec du poivron rouge et des raisins secs sucrés.','["2 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 gros oignon, coupé en quartiers et tranché","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché","1 bâton de cannelle","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","graines de 8 gousses de cardamome","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 piment rouge, coupé en deux, épépiné et tranché","1 gros poivron rouge, épépiné et coupé en dés","50 g de freekeh","350 ml de bouillon de légumes (fait avec 2 cuillères à café de poudre de bouillon réduit en sel)","25 g de raisins secs","½ paquet de coriandre hachée","40 g de noix de cajou","1 gousse d''ail","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt bio","¼ de concombre, râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée"]','["Hachez l''ail pour le pilaf et réservez. Râpez finement l''ail pour la raita et mettez-le dans un bol. Faites chauffer l''huile pour le pilaf dans une grande poêle ouverte et faites revenir l''oignon et le gingembre pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporez les épices entières et moulues et laissez cuire quelques secondes pour libérer leurs arômes. Ajoutez le piment, le poivron rouge et le freekeh, remuez brièvement, puis versez le bouillon et les raisins secs. Laisser mijoter pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le freekeh soit tendre mais toujours noisette, en ajoutant l''ail haché pendant les 2 dernières minutes. Le stock aurait dû être réduit et absorbé dans le freekeh maintenant.","Pendant ce temps, terminez la raita en mélangeant le yaourt, le concombre et la menthe à l''ail râpé.","Lorsque le pilaf est cuit, incorporez la coriandre et les noix de cajou et servez avec la raita."]','2026-01-11 00:11:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11582,4665,'fr','Filet d''agneau aux herbes et caponata','Cochez vos 5 par jour avec ce rôti du dimanche super sain. Pour le rendre végétarien, omettez l''agneau et ajoutez des pois chiches à la caponata.','["3 gousses d''ail","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 oignon rouge, coupé en quartiers","1 aubergine, tranchée et coupée en quartiers","500 g de purée en carton","1 poivron vert, coupé en quartiers, épépiné et tranché","6 olives Kalamata dénoyautées, coupées en deux et rincées","2 cuillères à café de câpres, rincées","1 cuillère à café de romarin haché","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique","4 petites pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux","1 cuillère à café de romarin haché","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","250 g de filet d''agneau maigre, sans graisse visible","Sachet de 240 g de bébés épinards","persil finement haché (facultatif)"]','["Coupez 2 gousses d''ail pour la caponata, râpez finement l''autre pour l''agneau et réservez. Faites chauffer l''huile pour la caponata dans une grande poêle, ajoutez l''oignon et faites revenir 5 minutes pour le ramollir. Versez l’aubergine et faites cuire encore 5 minutes en remuant. Ajoutez la passata et le poivre avec les olives, les câpres, le romarin et le vinaigre balsamique, puis couvrez et laissez cuire 15 minutes en remuant fréquemment.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Faites bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 10 min, puis égouttez-les. Mélangez l''ail râpé avec le romarin et un peu de poivre noir, puis frottez-en partout sur l''agneau. Mélangez les pommes de terre dans l''huile avec un peu plus de poivre noir, placez-les dans un petit plat à rôtir avec l''agneau et faites rôtir pendant 15 à 20 minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites flétrir les épinards au micro-ondes ou dans une poêle et pressez-les pour égoutter tout excès de liquide.","Incorporer l''ail à la caponata et servir avec l''agneau, entier ou tranché, roulé dans du persil si vous le souhaitez, avec les pommes de terre et les épinards."]','2026-01-11 00:11:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11583,4667,'fr','Houmous de cacahuètes avec bâtonnets de fruits et légumes','Cette trempette saine aux noisettes, au tahini et au paprika fumé, est parfaite pour tartiner : mangez-la avec des tranches de pomme et des légumes pour un déjeuner ou une collation rapide.','["380 g de pois chiches en carton","le zeste et le jus d''un demi citron (utilisez l''autre moitié pour presser la pomme pour l''empêcher de brunir, si vous le souhaitez)","1 cuillère à soupe de tahin","½ à 1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à soupe de cacahuètes grillées non salées","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","2 pommes rouges croquantes, épépinées et coupées en tranches","2 carottes, coupées en bâtonnets","4 branches de céleri, coupées en bâtonnets dans le sens de la longueur"]','["Égouttez les pois chiches en réservant le liquide. Versez les trois quarts des pois chiches dans un robot culinaire et ajoutez le zeste et le jus de citron, le tahini, le paprika, les cacahuètes et l''huile avec 3 cuillères à soupe de liquide de pois chiches. Passer au robot culinaire jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporer les pois chiches réservés. Servir avec les bâtonnets de fruits et légumes."]','2026-01-11 00:11:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11584,4669,'fr','Salade d''asperges et lentilles, canneberges et feta émiettée','Les pointes d''asperges sont à l''honneur dans cette salade saine et de saison composée d''oignons nouveaux, de tomates cerises et de fromage émietté salé.','["1 gousse d''ail","125 g de lentilles du Puy","Paquet de 100 g de pointes d''asperges fines","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","25 g de canneberges séchées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza extra vierge, plus un peu plus (facultatif)","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de cidre de pomme biologique","140 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","50 g de feta (lire au dos du paquet pour l''option végétarienne)"]','["Râpez finement l''ail et mettez-le dans un bol. Faites bouillir les lentilles pendant 25 minutes et mettez les asperges dans un cuiseur vapeur dessus pendant les 5 dernières minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste tendres.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les oignons, les canneberges, l''huile et le vinaigre dans le bol avec l''ail et remuez bien. Lorsque les lentilles sont prêtes, égouttez-les et mélangez-les à la vinaigrette avec les tomates. Versez dans des récipients en plastique (pour un panier-repas) ou dans des assiettes, puis garnissez d''asperges et émiettez-les sur la feta. Arrosez d’un peu d’huile supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11585,4671,'fr','Wraps de crêpes aux herbes et au chèvre','Remplacez les tortillas de farine par de fines omelettes, puis garnissez-les de délicieuses garnitures végétariennes pour un déjeuner faible en calories – à déguster tiède ou froid.','["1½ cuillère à café d''huile de colza","2 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","1 grosse courgette, grossièrement râpée et essorée","2 gros œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de basilic haché","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de thym","50 g de fromage de chèvre à pâte molle","2 tomates moyennes, hachées","6 olives Kalamata, rincées et coupées en deux","2 poignées de chou frisé ou de cresson","radis, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une poêle et ajoutez les oignons nouveaux et la courgette. Cuire en remuant fréquemment pour ramollir la courgette et éliminer tout excès d''humidité. Versez les légumes dans un bol et lavez la poêle.","Battez un œuf avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau, la moitié des herbes et un peu de poivre noir. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle, versez le mélange d''œufs et remuez la poêle pour la fixer finement sur le fond. Cuire quelques minutes, verser sur une assiette et répéter avec l''autre œuf, 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et le reste des herbes.","Étalez le fromage de chèvre au centre de chaque crêpe et recouvrez du mélange de courgettes, parsemez de tomates, d''olives et de chou frisé, puis roulez et coupez en deux. Alternativement, étalez le fromage de chèvre sur les crêpes, garnissez de garniture et servez ouvert. Mangez avec quelques radis à part, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11586,4673,'fr','Couscous d''orge & taboulé de crevettes','Des concombres croquants et des nectarines juteuses ajoutent de la fraîcheur à ce déjeuner sain et riche en fibres. Pour une version végétarienne, remplacez les crevettes par des noix de cajou ou des pacanes.','["125 g de couscous d''orge","le zeste d''1 citron, le jus de ½","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza extra vierge","½ petit paquet d''aneth, finement haché","une bonne poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées","½ concombre, haché","2 nectarines, hachées","125g de crevettes décortiquées, ou une poignée de noix de cajou ou de noix de pécan pour une version végétarienne."]','["Versez le couscous dans un bol et versez-y juste assez d''eau bouillante pour couvrir, en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Laisser reposer 5 minutes maximum, égoutter soigneusement, puis gonfler à la fourchette et verser dans un bol. Incorporer le zeste et le jus de citron avec l''huile, l''aneth et la menthe, puis ajouter le concombre et les nectarines.","Mélangez les crevettes ou les noix et servez dans des assiettes ou emballez-les dans des contenants à lunch."]','2026-01-11 00:11:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11587,4677,'fr','Granola aux dattes et au sarrasin, aux pacanes et aux graines','Ce granola entièrement naturel est sucré avec de la purée de dattes pour former des grappes croquantes d''avoine, de graines et de noix riches en nutriments.','["85g de sarrasin","4 dattes Medjool, dénoyautées","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","100 g de flocons d''avoine traditionnels","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","25g de graines de tournesol","25g de graines de citrouille","25g d''amandes effilées","50 g de noix de pécan, grossièrement cassées en deux","50 g de raisins secs (sans huile ajoutée)","2 pots de 150 ml de yaourt nature bio allégé","2 nectarines ou pêches mûres, dénoyautées et tranchées"]','["Faire tremper le sarrasin toute une nuit dans de l''eau froide. Le lendemain, égouttez et rincez le sarrasin. Mettez les dattes dans une casserole avec 300 ml d''eau et la cannelle, et mixez avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse. Ajouter le sarrasin, porter à ébullition et cuire à découvert pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pulpeux. Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2 et tapissez deux grandes plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé.","Incorporez les flocons d''avoine et l''huile au mélange de dattes et de sarrasin, puis versez de petites grappes du mélange sur les plaques à pâtisserie. Enfournez 15 min, puis grattez délicatement les grappes du papier sulfurisé si elles sont collées et retournez-les avant de les étaler à nouveau. Remettre au four encore 15 minutes, en retournant fréquemment, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et doré.","Lorsque le mélange est suffisamment sec, versez-le dans un bol, mélangez les graines et les noix avec les raisins secs et mélangez bien. Une fois refroidi, servez à chaque personne une généreuse poignée de yaourt et de fruits, et mettez l''excédent dans un récipient hermétique. Se conservera une semaine. Les autres jours, vous pouvez varier les fruits ou servir avec du lait ou une alternative sans produits laitiers à la place du yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:11:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11588,4679,'fr','Bouillie de quinoa','Boostez votre matinée avec du quinoa riche en protéines et des graines de chia riches en oméga-3 pour un bol de petit-déjeuner crémeux garni de fruits de saison.','["175 g de quinoa","½ gousse de vanille fendue et graines grattées, ou ½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","15 g de crème de coco","4 cuillères à soupe de graines de chia","125 g de yaourt à la noix de coco","125 g de yaourt à la noix de coco","280 g de baies d''été mélangées, comme des fraises, des framboises et des myrtilles","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées (facultatif)"]','["Activez le quinoa en le trempant toute une nuit dans l''eau froide. Le lendemain, égouttez et rincez le quinoa au tamis fin (les grains sont si petits qu''ils passeront au tamis grossier).","Versez le quinoa dans une casserole et ajoutez la vanille, la crème de coco et 600 ml d''eau. Couvrez la poêle et laissez mijoter 20 min. Incorporer le chia avec encore 300 ml d''eau et cuire doucement encore 3 minutes. Incorporer le pot de yaourt à la noix de coco. Versez la moitié du porridge dans un bol pour un autre jour. Se conserve 2 jours couvert au réfrigérateur. Servir le reste du porridge garni d''un autre pot de yaourt, des baies et des amandes, si vous le souhaitez.","Pour déguster le porridge un autre jour, versez-le dans une casserole et réchauffez-le doucement, avec du lait ou de l''eau. Garnir de fruits, par exemple des tranches d''orange et des graines de grenade."]','2026-01-11 00:11:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11589,4681,'fr','Pains plats au blé complet avec haricots et œuf poché','Ce plat sain et savoureux constitue un brunch très copieux : si vous mangez plus tôt au petit-déjeuner, vous pouvez servir la moitié des haricots.','["2 œufs","500 g de purée en carton","2 petits oignons, coupés en quartiers","1 datte Medjool, défoncée","3 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique","Boîte de 400 g de haricots blancs égouttés","100g de farine complète","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","100g de yaourt nature"]','["Versez la passata dans un robot culinaire avec les oignons, la datte et le paprika, et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit complètement lisse. Chauffer dans une poêle moyenne, couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 minutes en remuant fréquemment pour obtenir une sauce épaisse et pulpeuse. Goûtez pour vous assurer que l’oignon est bien cuit. Sinon, ajoutez un peu d''eau et laissez cuire encore un peu. Incorporer le vinaigre et les haricots, puis retirer du feu.","Pour faire les pains plats, versez la farine et la levure chimique dans un bol, puis incorporez le yaourt pour obtenir une pâte molle. Versez sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrissez légèrement, en incorporant entièrement la farine restante dans le bol. Réduisez le mélange en deux et aplatissez chaque morceau en un ovale grossier, à l''aide de vos mains ou d''un rouleau à pâtisserie, jusqu''à obtenir une épaisseur de deux pièces de 1 £. Coupez plusieurs fois le centre des ovales avec un couteau bien aiguisé, en prenant soin de ne pas couper un bord.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez un pain plat et faites cuire 1 min de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et légèrement gonflé, puis répétez avec l''autre. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une grande casserole d’eau et pochez les œufs à votre convenance.","Réchauffez les haricots et servez-les sur chaque pain plat avec un œuf poché et un peu de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11590,4683,'fr','Salade de fenouil, grenade et fèves','Cette salade de boulgour et d''herbes hachées constitue un délicieux accompagnement à emporter lors d''un pique-nique – arrosez-la de vinaigrette avant de servir.','["200 g de boulgar de blé","petit bouquet de menthe, hachée finement","petit bouquet de persil, finement haché","petit bouquet d''aneth, finement haché","1 bulbe de fenouil, coupé en quartiers, cœur retiré et tranché finement","200 g de graines de grenade","350 g (poids avant pelage) de fèves fraîches ou surgelées","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille","une grosse poignée de roquette ou de cresson","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza ou d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire et mettez le boulghar dans un bol avec une bonne pincée de sel. Versez suffisamment d''eau bouillante pour recouvrir à peine le boulghar, couvrez d''un film alimentaire et laissez reposer 10 minutes.","Mettez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un pot de confiture ou une petite bouteille avec un peu d''assaisonnement, vissez le couvercle et secouez bien. Découvrez le boulghar et, s''il reste de l''eau dans le bol, égouttez le boulghar, puis versez-le dans un grand récipient pour le transport. Ajoutez les herbes, le fenouil, les graines de grenade, les fèves et les graines de citrouille et mélangez le tout. Garnir de feuilles de salade et emballer séparément le pot de confiture de vinaigrette.","Avant de servir, arrosez de vinaigrette et mélangez le tout."]','2026-01-11 00:11:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11591,4685,'fr','Plateau de poulet et pommes de terre nouvelles','Mettez les cuisses de poulet et les pommes de terre dans une casserole et faites-les rôtir avec des olives, du citron, de l''ail et des feuilles de laurier pour un déjeuner ou un dîner paresseux le week-end.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g de pommes de terre nouvelles","140 g de grosses olives vertes dénoyautées","1 citron, en quartiers","8 feuilles de laurier fraîches","6 gousses d''ail, non pelées","4 grosses cuisses de poulet","un sachet de cresson ou de feuilles de salade, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez l''huile d''olive dans un grand plat à rôtir et ajoutez les pommes de terre, les olives, les quartiers de citron, les feuilles de laurier et l''ail. Mélangez le tout ensemble pour qu’il soit enrobé d’huile et uniformément réparti. Ajouter les cuisses de poulet, peau vers le haut, et assaisonner.","Mettez le plat à rôtir au four et faites rôtir pendant 1 h en arrosant avec le jus de cuisson à mi-cuisson. Au bout d''1 heure, vérifiez que les pommes de terre sont tendres et que le poulet est bien cuit, puis remettez au four 15 minutes supplémentaires pour faire croustiller la peau du poulet.","Retirez le plat à rôtir du four. Appuyez sur les gousses d''ail rôties avec le dos d''une cuillère, jetez les peaux et mélangez la purée d''ail avec le jus de viande. Servir avec du cresson ou vos feuilles de salade préférées en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:11:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11592,4687,'fr','Salade de ruban de courgettes','Utilisez un spiraliseur pour créer cette salade crue fraîche et piquante – parfaite avec du poulet ou du poisson grillé et garnie de feta ou de fromage de chèvre émietté.','["jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ petit paquet de ciboulette hachée","½ petit paquet de menthe hachée","300 g de courgettes"]','["Dans un grand bol, versez le jus de citron et assaisonnez bien avec du sel et du poivre. Incorporer l''huile d''olive puis ajouter les herbes hachées.","Passez votre courgette dans votre spiraliseur sur son grand accessoire pour nouilles et versez les rubans dans le bol avec la vinaigrette. Mélangez le tout et servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:11:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11593,4689,'fr','Curry fruité des Caraïbes','Les haricots rouges et les légumes font aller plus loin les pilons de poulet avec ce curry sucré et piquant – emballez-en 4 sur 5 par jour dans un repas familial copieux.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","4 pilons de poulet, peau enlevée","2 gros oignons rouges, hachés","2 poivrons (n''importe quelle couleur fera l''affaire), hachés","3-4 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry doux","Boîte de 425 g de morceaux d''ananas dans du jus non sucré","400 g de lait de coco en boîte","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés","2-4 cuillères à soupe de sauce au piment fort (selon la façon dont vous l''aimez)","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","riz cuit, pour servir (nous avons utilisé du riz Tilda à la noix de coco)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajouter le poulet et bien le faire dorer de tous les côtés, puis transférer dans une assiette. Ajoutez les oignons et les poivrons dans la poêle et faites cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à ramollir. Remettez le poulet dans la poêle et saupoudrez de curry en poudre, puis ajoutez l''ananas avec son jus, ainsi que le lait de coco. Assaisonner et laisser mijoter à découvert pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre et que la sauce ait réduit et épaissi un peu.","Ajouter les haricots et la sauce au poivre dans la poêle. Laisser mijoter encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les haricots soient bien chauds, puis parsemer de coriandre et servir avec du riz cuit."]','2026-01-11 00:11:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11594,4691,'fr','Gombo au poulet facile','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une cocotte réchauffante d''inspiration cajun avec du bacon fumé, des poivrons et du gombo – parfaite servie sur du riz et des haricots.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","200 g de lardons de lard fumé","1 oignon, tranché","130 g de poivrons Padrón, tiges enlevées, tranchés (ou 1 piment vert et 100 g de poivron vert)","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en bouchées","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de mélange d''épices cajun","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","Paquet de 175 g de gombo tranché (ou 2 courgettes tranchées)","500 g de purée en carton","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","riz cuit et haricots noirs, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez les lardons et l''oignon et faites revenir 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le bacon commence à devenir croustillant et que l''oignon soit tendre. Ajoutez les poivrons, le poulet et la farine, et faites revenir encore 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit doré et que la farine commence à prendre une couleur biscuitée.","Incorporer le mélange d''épices cajun et l''ail, puis ajouter lentement le bouillon de poulet en remuant constamment. Ajoutez le gombo, la passata et un peu d''assaisonnement et laissez mijoter 20 minutes à découvert à feu moyen. Remuer fréquemment pendant la cuisson pour détacher la farine du fond de la poêle.","Saupoudrer d''oignons nouveaux et servir avec du riz et des haricots noirs."]','2026-01-11 00:11:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11595,4693,'fr','Bar rôti au miel et à l''orange et lentilles','Égayez vos repas en milieu de semaine avec ce souper de poisson faible en calories et sans gluten – prêt en moins d''une demi-heure','["2 gros filets de bar avec peau (ou autre poisson blanc - voir astuce)","le zeste et le jus d''une ½ orange","2 cuillères à café de miel clair","2 cuillères à café de moutarde complète","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","Sachet de 250 g de lentilles du Puy prêtes à consommer","100 g de cresson","petit bouquet de persil haché","petit bouquet d''aneth, haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz. 6. Placer chaque filet de bar, côté peau vers le bas,\r\nsur des carrés individuels de papier d''aluminium. Mélangez le zeste d''orange, le miel, la moutarde, 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive et un peu d''assaisonnement, et versez-en un filet sur les filets. Tirez les côtés du papier d''aluminium vers le haut et tordez les bords ensemble pour former des colis individuels. Disposez les paquets sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit juste cuit et se défasse facilement lorsqu''on le presse avec un couteau.","Réchauffez les lentilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis mélangez-les avec le jus d''orange, le reste de l''huile, le cresson, les herbes et l''assaisonnement. Répartissez les lentilles dans 2 assiettes et garnissez chacune d''elles d''un filet de bar. Arroser du jus de rôtissage retenu dans le papier d''aluminium et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:11:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11596,4695,'fr','Soupe épicée aux haricots noirs et au poulet avec chou frisé','Utilisez les restes de rôti ou de poulet déjà cuit dans cette soupe saine et chaleureuse de style sud-américain, relevée de cumin et de piment.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive douce","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","petit bouquet de tiges de coriandre finement hachées, feuilles cueillies","zestez 1 citron vert, puis coupez-le en quartiers","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs rincés et égouttés","600 ml de bouillon de poulet","175 g de chou frisé, tiges épaisses enlevées, feuilles déchiquetées","250 g de restes de rôti ou de poulet cuit","50 g de feta émiettée pour servir","tortillas de farine et de maïs, grillées, pour servir (voir conseil)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole, ajoutez l''ail, les tiges de coriandre et le zeste de citron vert, puis faites frire pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées. Incorporez le cumin et les flocons de piment, faites frire encore 1 min, puis versez les tomates, les haricots et le bouillon. Portez à ébullition, puis écrasez plusieurs fois les haricots au fond de la casserole à l''aide d''un presse-purée. Cela épaissira un peu la soupe.","Incorporer le chou frisé à la soupe, laisser mijoter pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, puis déchirer le poulet et laisser chauffer. Assaisonnez au goût avec du sel, du poivre et du jus de la moitié du citron vert, puis servez dans des bols peu profonds, parsemés de feta et de quelques feuilles de coriandre. Servir le reste du citron vert en quartiers pour la table, avec les tortillas grillées à côté. Plus vous laissez le poulet dans la poêle longtemps, plus la soupe deviendra épaisse, alors ajoutez un peu de bouillon si vous ne pouvez pas servir la soupe immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:11:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11597,4697,'fr','Crêpes à la noix de coco et sauce aux framboises','Parsemées de noix de coco desséchée pour plus de texture, ces crêpes arrosées d''une sauce fruitée constituent un délicieux brunch ou un dessert à faible teneur en sucre.','["200g de framboises","2 cuillères à café de farine de maïs","2 cuillères à café de sirop d''érable","140 g de farine nature","2 gros œufs","300 ml de lait de coco","2 cuillères à soupe de noix de coco desséchée grillée","un peu d''huile de tournesol, pour la friture"]','["Réservez 6 framboises. Mélangez la maïzena avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau jusqu''à consistance lisse. Mesurez 300 ml d''eau dans une casserole et incorporez la pâte de maïzena. Chauffer en remuant jusqu''à épaississement. Ajouter le reste des framboises et cuire doucement en écrasant les baies jusqu''à obtenir une pulpe. Passer le mélange au tamis dans un bol pour éliminer les graines, en poussant autant de mélange que possible. Coupez les framboises réservées en quatre et ajoutez-les à la sauce avec le sirop d''érable.","Pour faire les crêpes, versez la farine et une pincée de sel dans un grand pichet, puis incorporez les œufs, le lait de coco, 200 ml d''eau et 1 1/2 cuillère à soupe de noix de coco grillée pour obtenir une pâte ayant la consistance d''une crème double. Diluez avec un peu plus d''eau si c''est trop épais. Faites chauffer une petite poêle avec un filet d''huile, puis versez un peu de pâte en faisant tourner la poêle pour qu''elle recouvre entièrement le fond. Laissez reposer 1 min sur le feu, puis retournez-le délicatement et faites cuire l''autre face encore quelques secondes. Transférer dans une assiette et répéter avec le reste de la pâte jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez au moins 12. Remuez la pâte pour redistribuer la noix de coco au fur et à mesure que vous l''utilisez. Servir 2 crêpes par personne avec un filet de sauce et un peu du reste de noix de coco grillée."]','2026-01-11 00:11:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11598,4699,'fr','Soupe de chou frisé et pommes aux noix','Tirez le meilleur parti du chou frisé de saison et donnez de la profondeur à cette soupe avec des pommes sucrées et une garniture croquante aux noix – parfait comme déjeuner sain.','["8 moitiés de noix, cassées en morceaux","1 oignon, finement haché","2 carottes, grossièrement râpées","2 pommes rouges non pelées et hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","500 ml de bouillon de légumes réduit en sel","200 g de chou frisé, haché grossièrement","Paquet de 20 g de chips de pommes séchées (facultatif)"]','["Dans une poêle sèche et antiadhésive, faites cuire les morceaux de noix pendant 2 à 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient grillés, en les retournant fréquemment pour qu''ils ne brûlent pas. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Mettez l''oignon, les carottes, les pommes, le vinaigre et le bouillon dans une grande casserole et portez à ébullition. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Une fois que l''oignon est translucide et que les pommes commencent à ramollir, ajoutez le chou frisé et laissez mijoter encore 2 minutes. Transférer délicatement dans un mélangeur ou un mixeur et mélanger jusqu''à obtenir une consistance très lisse. Verser dans des bols et servir garni de noix grillées et d''une pincée de chips de pomme, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:11:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11599,4701,'fr','Panzanella d''hiver aux pommes et à la courge','Donnez à la salade italienne classique de tomates et de pain rassis une touche de saison avec des noisettes, des canneberges, de la courge et des pommes.','["½ grosse courge musquée, coupée en morceaux","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","6 feuilles de sauge hachées","2 pommes, épépinées et coupées en fines tranches","3 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","200 g de restes de pain croustillant (nous avons utilisé de la ciabatta), coupé en morceaux","100 g de noisettes grossièrement hachées","200 g de chou frisé haché","100 g de canneberges séchées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettre la courge sur une plaque à pâtisserie, arroser d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et parsemer de sauge et d''un peu d''assaisonnement. Mélangez, puis enfournez pour 30 minutes.","Ajouter les tranches de pomme sur le plateau, arroser de miel et mélanger avec la courge. Mettez le pain sur une plaque séparée et remettez les deux plaques au four. Cuire au four encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la courge et la pomme soient tendres et commencent à caraméliser et que le pain soit croustillant. Pendant ce temps, faites griller les noisettes dans une petite poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Sortez les plaques du four et laissez refroidir un peu.","Fouetter le reste de l''huile, le miel et le vinaigre dans un grand bol avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Ajouter le chou frisé, les canneberges, les noisettes, les pommes de courge et le pain grillé. Mélangez le tout, puis transférez dans un plat ou des assiettes pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11600,4703,'fr','Ragoût brésilien de crevettes et de noix de coco','Donnez aux gambas une touche brésilienne dans ce ragoût épicé de noix de coco, de crevettes et de haricots verts garni d''arachides salées et servi avec du riz.','["300 g de riz à grains longs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1-2 piments rouges (épépinés si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant), finement hachés","200 ml de lait de coco","400 g de tomates coupées en dés","200 g de haricots verts garnis et coupés en deux","300 g de gambas crues décortiquées","jus 1 citron vert","petit paquet de coriandre hachée","50 g de cacahuètes grillées non salées, hachées grossièrement"]','["Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition et faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail et le piment et faites cuire 10 minutes à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez le lait de coco et faites bouillonner encore 4 minutes.","Ajouter les tomates et les haricots et cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates commencent à s''effondrer. Ajouter les crevettes et cuire 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient roses et bien cuites.","Incorporer le jus de citron vert, saupoudrer de coriandre et de noix et servir avec le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:11:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11601,4706,'fr','Wraps épicés au poulet et à l''avocat','Poêler la poitrine de poulet maigre avec du citron vert, du piment et de l''ail, puis l''empiler sur des tortillas aux graines. Laisser refroidir avant d''assembler si vous préparez pour le déjeuner','["1 poitrine de poulet (environ 180 g), tranchée finement en biais","jus pressé généreusement ½ citron vert","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","2 wraps aux graines","1 avocat, coupé en deux et dénoyauté","1 poivron rouge rôti en bocal, tranché","quelques brins de coriandre hachés"]','["Mélangez le poulet avec le jus de citron vert, la poudre de piment et l''ail.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive puis faites revenir le poulet pendant quelques minutes – il va cuire très rapidement alors surveillez-le. Pendant ce temps, réchauffez les wraps en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage ou, si vous avez une cuisinière à gaz, chauffez-les sur la flamme pour les carboniser légèrement. Ne les laissez pas sécher car ils seront difficiles à rouler.","Écrasez un demi-avocat sur chaque wrap, ajoutez les poivrons dans la poêle pour les réchauffer, puis empilez-les sur les wraps avec le poulet et saupoudrez de coriandre. Roulez, coupez en deux et mangez avec les doigts."]','2026-01-11 00:11:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11602,4708,'fr','Beignets verts','Profitez d''un petit-déjeuner sain qui vous rassasiera plus longtemps, avec des œufs et des brocolis et courgettes verts vibrants pour les protéines, les vitamines et les minéraux.','["140 g de courgettes râpées","3 œufs moyens","85 g de fleurons de brocoli finement hachés","petit paquet d''aneth, haché grossièrement","3 cuillères à soupe de farine sans gluten ou de farine de riz","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol, pour la friture"]','["Pressez les courgettes entre vos mains pour éliminer tout excès d''humidité, ou versez-les sur un torchon propre et tournez-le pour éliminer l''humidité.","Battez les œufs dans un bol, ajoutez le brocoli, les courgettes et la majeure partie de l''aneth et mélangez. Ajoutez la farine, mélangez à nouveau et assaisonnez.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive. Mettez une grande cuillère de service du mélange dans la poêle, puis ajoutez 2 cuillères supplémentaires pour obtenir 3 beignets. Laisser reposer 3-4 minutes à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré d''un côté et suffisamment solide pour que vous puissiez le retourner, puis retourner et laisser dorer de l''autre côté. Répétez l’opération pour faire 3 beignets supplémentaires (il n’est pas nécessaire d’ajouter plus d’huile dans la poêle après le premier lot). Parsemer du reste d''aneth pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11603,4710,'fr','Steaks d''aubergines rôtis au miso et patate douce','Rôtissez d''épaisses tranches d''aubergine avec du miso, de l''ail et du gingembre, puis servez-les avec de gros quartiers de patates douces pour un dîner végétarien copieux.','["1 grosse aubergine (environ 375g)","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso brune (nous avons utilisé Clearspring)","350 g de patates douces, non pelées et coupées en gros quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","1 gousse d''ail, râpée","pincée de sel rose de l''Himalaya","8 oignons nouveaux, tranchés en diagonale","petit paquet de persil, feuilles hachées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Épluchez l''aubergine avec un épluche-pomme de terre et étalez grossièrement la pâte miso dessus – la meilleure façon de procéder est d''utiliser le dos d''une cuillère.","Mettez-le dans un plat à rôtir avec les quartiers de patates douces. Versez 225 ml d''eau bouillante dans le fond du moule, puis ajoutez l''huile, le gingembre et l''ail. Saupoudrez une pincée de sel sur les quartiers et enfournez.","Au bout de 30 minutes, versez encore 125 ml d''eau bouillante dans le fond du moule et faites rôtir encore 20 minutes. Répétez l’opération en ajoutant 50 ml d’eau bouillante et les oignons nouveaux, et faites rôtir encore 10 minutes. Vérifiez que l''aubergine est cuite en insérant un couteau au centre – si elle est prête, elle glissera facilement dedans et dehors, et l''aubergine sera molle à l''intérieur.","Saupoudrez de persil haché sur les quartiers de pommes de terre, coupez l''aubergine en « steaks » de 2 cm d''épaisseur et servez sur les pommes de terre. S''il n''y a pas de sauce au fond du moule, ajoutez 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour détendre le miso, puis versez la sauce miso sur les steaks d''aubergines et saupoudrez de poivre noir concassé."]','2026-01-11 00:11:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11604,4712,'fr','Soupe de butternut avec croûtons croustillants à la sauge et aux pommes','La pomme et la sauge contrastent magnifiquement avec la courge musquée naturellement sucrée dans cette entrée de dîner de fête faible en gras et sans gluten.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 courge butternut d''environ 1 kg, pelée, épépinée et hachée","3 cuillères à soupe de Madère ou de Xérès sec","500 ml de bouillon de légumes sans gluten, plus un peu si nécessaire","1 cuillère à café de sauge hachée, plus 20 petites feuilles nettoyées et séchées","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 grosse pomme à manger, pelée, épépinée et coupée en dés","quelques pincées de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez l''oignon et faites revenir 5 minutes. Ajoutez l''ail et la courge et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Versez le madère et le bouillon, incorporez la sauge hachée, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre.","Mixez avec un mixeur plongeant ou au robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse. Laisser refroidir dans la poêle, puis réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir. Se conserve 2 jours ou se congèle 3 mois. Pour faire la sauge croustillante, faites chauffer un peu d''huile (sur une profondeur d''environ 2 cm) dans une petite poêle, puis déposez-y les feuilles de sauge jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes – vous devrez le faire par lots. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant. Se conservera plusieurs heures.","Juste avant de servir, réchauffez la soupe dans une poêle. La texture doit être assez épaisse et veloutée, mais diluez-la avec un peu de bouillon si elle est trop épaisse.","Pour les croûtons aux pommes, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez la pomme et faites-la revenir jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à ramollir. Saupoudrer de sucre et remuer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement caramélisé.","Pour servir, versez la soupe dans des petits bols et garnissez de pomme, de sauge et d''un peu de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:11:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11605,4714,'fr','Quartiers de patates douces épicés','Mélangez la patate douce avec le cumin, le piment et le sumac, puis faites cuire au four avec du citron et de l''ail pour obtenir des chips épaisses, croustillantes mais moelleuses.','["2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à café de sumac","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de thym hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de romarin hachées grossièrement","3 gousses d''ail","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1¼kg de patates douces, coupées en quartiers"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. À l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier, écrasez ensemble les épices, les herbes, l''ail et un peu d''assaisonnement.","Verser dans un grand bol et incorporer le zeste et le jus de citron ainsi que l''huile. Ajouter les pommes de terre et mélanger. Disposer, côté peau vers le bas, sur 2 plaques à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres à l''intérieur et croustillants à l''extérieur."]','2026-01-11 00:11:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11606,4716,'fr','Beignets de flocons d''avoine épicés et poires caramel à la noix de coco','Ces gâteaux grillés denses au goût de noisette sont sans produits laitiers, avec du lait d''amande, de la muscade et de la cannelle – parfaits pour un brunch ou une gâterie paresseuse le week-end.','["250 ml de lait d''amande","½ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","1 cuillère à café de muscade moulue","4 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","100 g de flocons d''avoine","3 gros œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","75g de beurre de coco","2 poires Williams fermes, pelées, évidées et tranchées finement","200 g de yaourt à la noix de coco, pour servir"]','["Dans une grande casserole, mélanger le lait d''amande, les clous de girofle, la muscade et 3 cuillères à café de cannelle. Portez à ébullition. Versez les flocons d''avoine et faites cuire 6 minutes à feu doux, en remuant constamment, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient épais et crémeux, comme du porridge. Versez dans un bol à mélanger, couvrez et laissez refroidir pendant 20 minutes.","En attendant, préparez les poires au caramel. Saupoudrer uniformément le sucre sur une poêle à feu doux. Ne le remuez pas, mais attendez qu’il commence à fondre, devenant doré foncé ici et là. Lorsque la majeure partie du sucre est fondue, remuez doucement pour incorporer les zones sèches. Incorporez 25 g de beurre de coco. Mélangez les tranches de poire dans le reste de cannelle, puis ajoutez-les au caramel et laissez cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies. Annuler.","Revenez maintenant aux flocons d''avoine, en battant les œufs et ½ cuillère à café de sel pour obtenir une pâte lâche semblable à une crêpe. Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1 et mettre les assiettes à chauffer.","Faites fondre un peu du beurre de coco restant dans une poêle. Lorsqu''elle est chaude, ajoutez des demi-louches de pâte espacées et faites cuire 4 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Retirer dans une assiette et réserver au chaud au four. Continuez à faire frire les beignets, en ajoutant plus de beurre de coco si nécessaire. Servir les beignets garnis d''une cuillerée de yaourt à la noix de coco suivis des poires chaudes."]','2026-01-11 00:12:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11607,4718,'fr','Salade de papaye, pousses de soja et mangetout','Associez des légumes croquants et des noix à des papayes sucrées dans ce plat d''accompagnement intéressant – parfait avec les plats principaux aux saveurs asiatiques.','["175g de mange-tout","175 g de germes de soja","1 papaye pelée, épépinée et coupée en cubes","jus 1 citron vert","25 g de cacahuètes non salées","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic déchirées","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu vif. Ajoutez le mangetout, les germes de soja et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et laissez cuire 2-3 minutes. Retirer du feu et incorporer la papaye et le jus de citron vert. Servir parsemé de cacahuètes et d''herbes."]','2026-01-11 00:12:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11608,4720,'fr','Tortilla aux épinards et patates douces','La patate douce ajoute une saveur différente à cette tortilla saine d''inspiration espagnole. C’est parfait à préparer avant une soirée tapas.','["Sachet de 300 g de pousses d''épinards","8 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive légère","2 gros oignons, tranchés finement","4 patates douces moyennes (800 g/ 1 lb 12 oz), pelées, coupées en fines tranches","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","8 gros œufs"]','["Mettez les épinards dans une grande passoire et versez-y une bouilloire d''eau bouillante. Bien égoutter et, une fois un peu refroidi, essorer en essayant de ne pas trop écraser les épinards.","Faites chauffer 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive de 25 cm avec un couvercle, puis faites suer les oignons pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien tendres mais pas colorés. Ajoutez encore 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile et ajoutez les pommes de terre et l''ail. Mélanger avec les oignons, bien assaisonner, couvrir et laisser cuire à feu doux encore 15 minutes environ jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient bien tendres. Remuez de temps en temps pour éviter qu''ils n''accrochent.","Battez les œufs dans un grand bol, ajoutez la pomme de terre et l''oignon cuits et mélangez. Séparez les touffes d''épinards, ajoutez-les au mélange et incorporez-les en essayant de ne pas trop briser la pomme de terre.","Ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile supplémentaire dans la poêle et versez le mélange de patates douces et d''œufs. Couvrir et cuire à feu doux-moyen pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la base et les côtés soient dorés et que le centre soit presque entièrement pris. Passez un couteau à palette sur les côtés pour l''empêcher de coller.\r\n5 Pour retourner la tortilla, posez une assiette face vers le bas sur le moule, puis retournez-la. Remettez la tortilla dans la poêle et faites cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste prise et dorée de partout. (Ne vous inquiétez pas s''il se brise un peu sur les bords lorsque vous le retournez – il sera parfait une fois cuit et pris.) Continuez la cuisson de l''autre côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste pris et doré partout. Utilisez à nouveau un couteau à palette pour détacher la tortilla des côtés. Laisser reposer 5 min, puis renverser sur une planche avant de couper en quartiers."]','2026-01-11 00:12:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11609,4722,'fr','Gaspacho vert','Essayez cette version éblouissante de la soupe espagnole réfrigérée classique – cette version est composée de légumes verts, d''herbes et de yaourt. Ajoutez des glaçons aux fleurs comestibles pour une présentation encore plus spéciale','["Sachet de 100 g de bébés épinards","2 gousses d''ail","1 gros concombre, épépiné et haché","½ piment vert épépiné","½ petit paquet de persil","½ petit paquet de basilic","½ petit paquet de menthe","1 avocat mûr, dénoyauté et pelé","4 oignons nouveaux, garnis et équeutés","200 g de yaourt nature","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","un filet d''huile d''olive extra vierge ou d''huile de colza","une poignée de pousses de pois","des glaçons de fleurs comestibles, pour servir (voir astuce ci-dessous)"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients, sauf l''huile, les pousses de pois et les glaçons, dans un robot culinaire avec une bonne pincée de sel et de poivre et mixez en ajoutant suffisamment d''eau pour obtenir une consistance veloutée. Goûtez et ajoutez un peu plus de vinaigre et d''assaisonnement si nécessaire. Réfrigérer jusqu''à 24 heures, ou au moins 2 heures.","Pour servir, répartissez dans des bols à soupe peu profonds, faites flotter quelques glaçons dans chaque bol (voir conseil ci-dessous) et ajoutez\r\nun peu de pousses de pois et un filet d''huile avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11610,4724,'fr','Salade de calamars grillés','Faire mariner les calamars avant de les grésiller sur le barbecue ou sur une plaque chauffante leur donne un regain de saveur. Accompagner d''une salade de mangue, avocat et haricots noirs','["800 g de calamars frais préparés","zester 3 citrons verts (réserver le jus pour la salade et les quartiers pour servir)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées à plat","1½ cuillère à café de grains de poivre mélangés, concassés","1 gros oignon rouge, finement tranché","1 grosse mangue, coupée en petits morceaux","1 gros piment rouge finement râpé (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant)","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs bien rincés puis essorés","3 avocats mûrs","coriandre en petit paquet, feuilles seulement, déchirées","huile d''olive extra vierge, pour arroser"]','["Faites chauffer le barbecue. Pendant ce temps, faites mariner les calamars pendant au moins 30 minutes ou jusqu''à 4 heures. Tout d’abord, coupez les tubes de calmar partout à des intervalles de 5 à 1 cm de chaque côté, en coupant la majeure partie de la chair mais en laissant les côtés intacts. S''il y a des tubes particulièrement gros, coupez-les en deux dans le sens de la largeur. Mettre dans un bol non métallique avec les autres ingrédients du calmar et laisser mariner.","Pour la salade, mélangez l''oignon, la mangue et le piment avec le jus de citron vert (des citrons verts utilisés pour les calamars) et une pincée de\r\nsaler et laisser reposer au moins 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que l''oignon devienne rose. Ajoutez les haricots d''un côté du bol.","Coupez l''avocat en deux, dénoyautez-le et versez-le dans le bol à salade, puis ajoutez beaucoup d''assaisonnement et assaisonnez les calamars avec du sel marin.","Lorsque le barbecue est prêt, faites griller les tubes et les tentacules des calamars pendant 11,2 minutes maximum au total – la chair doit juste passer de grisâtre à opaque et se rétrécir en forme de spirale là où vous avez fait vos coupes. Mélanger très grossièrement les ingrédients de la salade, les empiler sur une assiette et garnir de\r\ncalamars chauds et coriandre. Arroser d''huile d''olive extra vierge et servir avec\r\nquartiers de lime sur le côté."]','2026-01-11 00:12:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11611,4726,'fr','Omelette aux baies','Une omelette à un œuf constitue un petit-déjeuner riche en protéines. Si les baies qui stimulent le cerveau ne sont pas assez sucrées, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de miel.','["1 gros œuf","1 cuillère à soupe de lait écrémé","3 pincées de cannelle","½ cuillère à café d''huile de colza","100g de fromage blanc","175 g de fraises, myrtilles et framboises hachées"]','["Battre l''œuf avec le lait et la cannelle. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive de 20 cm et versez le mélange d''œufs en remuant pour couvrir uniformément le fond. Cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessous soit pris et doré. Il n''est pas nécessaire de le retourner.","Placer sur une assiette, étaler sur le fromage, puis parsemer de baies. Rouler et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11612,4728,'fr','Morue épicée avec salade de quinoa et chutney à la menthe','Le poisson blanc durable, copieux mais faible en gras, est un choix sain. Servir avec une marinade au yaourt à la coriandre d''inspiration indienne et une salade de céréales','["40 g de quinoa (ou 85 g de quinoa précuit)","3 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée","3 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","Pot de 150g de yaourt nature 0%","1 gousse d''ail","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma","pincée de graines de cumin","2 x 150 g de gros filets de poisson blanc sans peau, comme du cabillaud durable","¼ de concombre, coupé en petits dés","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","4 tomates, hachées","un bon filet de jus de citron"]','["Versez le quinoa (s''il n''est pas précuit) dans une casserole, couvrez d''eau et faites bouillir à couvert pendant 25 minutes, en vérifiant le niveau d''eau pour vous assurer qu''il ne bout pas à sec. Bien égoutter.","Pendant ce temps, mettez 2 cuillères à soupe de menthe et de coriandre dans un bol. Ajouter le yaourt et l''ail et mixer avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Mélangez 2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt aux herbes avec le curcuma et le cumin, puis ajoutez le poisson et incorporez le mélange pour bien l''enrober.","Tournez le gril à High. Disposez le poisson dans un plat peu profond résistant à la chaleur et faites-le griller pendant 8 à 10 minutes, selon son épaisseur, jusqu''à ce qu''il se défasse. Mélangez le quinoa avec le concombre, l''oignon, les tomates, le jus de citron et le reste des herbes. Versez dans une assiette, ajoutez le poisson et versez autour du chutney à la menthe, ou ajoutez-le à table."]','2026-01-11 00:12:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11613,4730,'fr','Houmous aux poivrons et aux noix avec trempettes végétariennes','Emballez les légumes avec cette trempette rapide à préparer, agrémentée de poivrons rouges rôtis et servie avec des bâtonnets de courgettes, de céleri et de carottes.','["400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","1 gousse d''ail","1 gros poivron rouge rôti en bocal (pas dans l''huile), environ 100 g","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tahini","jus ½ citron","4 moitiés de noix, hachées","2 courgettes coupées en bâtonnets","2 carottes, coupées en bâtonnets","2 branches de céleri, coupées en bâtonnets"]','["Mettez les pois chiches, l''ail, le poivre, le tahini et le jus de citron dans un bol. Mixez au mixeur plongeant ou au robot culinaire pour obtenir une purée épaisse. Incorporer les noix. Mettez-les dans des pots, si vous le souhaitez, et servez-les avec les bâtonnets de légumes. Se conserve 2 jours au réfrigérateur, mais il est préférable de préparer les légumes frais pour préserver leurs vitamines."]','2026-01-11 00:12:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11614,4732,'fr','Smoothie avocat-fraise','Un mélange crémeux adapté au petit-déjeuner, riche en calcium et faible en calories','["½ avocat dénoyauté, pelé et coupé en morceaux","150 g de fraises coupées en deux","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature faible en gras","200 ml de lait demi-écrémé","jus de citron ou de lime, au goût","chérie, au goût"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Si la consistance est trop épaisse, ajoutez un peu d''eau."]','2026-01-11 00:12:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11615,4734,'fr','Chana masala (curry de pois chiches) aux épinards','Un curry de légumes super sain avec des pois chiches, des épinards et des tomates. Servez ce délicieux plat indien avec du riz basmati brun fourré','["75 g de riz basmati brun à cuisson rapide","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon moyen, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 cm de gingembre pelé et finement haché ou râpé","½ piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de paprika","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","Boîte de 400 g de tomates italiennes entières","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","jus ½ citron","Sachet de 220 g de bébés épinards"]','["Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive ou un wok et faites frire à sec les graines de cumin pendant 1 min, en remuant souvent, pendant qu''elles éclatent. Retirer et réserver.","Dans la même poêle, faites chauffer l''huile, ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail, le gingembre et le piment et faites revenir à feu moyen pendant environ 3 minutes. Réduisez le feu, ajoutez toutes les épices, mélangez bien et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez les tomates en remuant et utilisez le côté d''une cuillère pour les briser en petits morceaux. Ajoutez les pois chiches et 200 ml d''eau.","Portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 10 minutes avant d''incorporer le jus de citron et les épinards. Laissez les épinards flétrir, puis retirez la casserole du feu.","Répartissez le riz dans 2 bols et servez le curry. (Les saveurs s''intensifient en refroidissant, donc pour une saveur plus riche, préparez-la plus tôt dans la journée et réchauffez-la lentement avant de servir.)"]','2026-01-11 00:12:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11616,4736,'fr','Poulet grillé cajun avec salade de haricots noirs au citron vert et guacamole','Épicez votre poulet avec du poivre de Cayenne, de l''origan, du paprika et du thym, puis servez-le sur une salade de garde-manger de type salsa et une trempette à l''avocat – cette recette en fait assez pour le déjeuner du lendemain.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","½ cuillère à café de thym séché","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé ou ordinaire","¼ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées (pesant chacune 140 g)","200 g de haricots à yeux noirs en boîte, égouttés (ou haricots beurre ou cannellini)","2 tomates épépinées et coupées en dés","85 g de maïs doux en boîte, égoutté","2 oignons nouveaux, parés et finement hachés","25 g de tomates mi-séchées à l''huile en pot, hachées grossièrement","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée","1 avocat, dénoyauté et pelé","¼ de piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","jus 1 citron vert","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée"]','["Mélangez l''huile, les herbes, les épices et l''ail dans un grand sac refermable. Mettez les poitrines de poulet dans le sac et mélangez bien pour couvrir. Écrasez le poulet avec un rouleau à pâtisserie pour l''aplatir un peu, puis laissez mariner au moins 15 minutes.","Dans un grand bol, mélanger tous les ingrédients de la salade de haricots. Bien mélanger et réserver.","Pour le guacamole, prélevez la chair de l''avocat et mettez-la dans un bol moyen en la hachant grossièrement avec le côté de la cuillère. Ajouter le reste des ingrédients et bien mélanger. Si vous préférez que votre guacamole soit plus onctueux, écrasez bien l''avocat avec l''huile d''olive et le jus de citron vert jusqu''à ce qu''il ait la consistance souhaitée avant d''incorporer les autres ingrédients.","Faites chauffer le gril. Tapisser une lèchefrite de papier d''aluminium, y déposer les poitrines de poulet et faire griller pendant 5 minutes, en vérifiant de temps en temps. Une fois doré, retournez-le et faites-le griller encore 5 à 7 minutes. Vérifiez le milieu des poitrines après 5 minutes et, si elles sont bien cuites, retirez-les du feu.","Réservez 2 poitrines de poulet et 2 cuillères à soupe de guacamole pour le sandwich ouvert au seigle (voir « va bien avec », à droite). Placer 1 poitrine de poulet chaude dans chaque assiette, avec un peu de salade de haricots et une cuillerée de guacamole à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:12:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11617,4738,'fr','Smoothie à la menthe et à l''ananas','Les smoothies ne se limitent pas aux fruits : ce mélange vert contient également des épinards, de l''avoine, des graines de lin et des noix de cajou.','["200 g d''ananas pelé, épépiné et coupé en morceaux","quelques feuilles de menthe","50 g de pousses d''épinards","25g de flocons d''avoine","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin","une poignée de noix de cajou non salées et non grillées","jus de citron vert frais, au goût"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un mixeur avec 200 ml d''eau et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. S''il est trop épais, ajoutez plus d''eau (jusqu''à 400 ml) jusqu''à obtenir le bon mélange."]','2026-01-11 00:12:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11618,4742,'fr','Salade d''asperges et œuf poché qui coule','Une salade de style bistro simple et équilibrée, faible en calories mais riche en saveur, en texture et en nutrition.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","200 g de betteraves cuites pelées (pas au vinaigre), coupées en bouchées","2 poignées de feuilles mélangées","¼ de concombre, coupé en bâtonnets","8 pointes d''asperges, parées","2 gros œufs"]','["Versez l''huile d''olive et le vinaigre dans un petit bol, mélangez bien et ajoutez la betterave. Répartissez le mélange de feuilles et de concombre dans 2 assiettes.","Blanchir les asperges dans une casserole d''eau frémissante pendant 2 min, puis les retirer et réserver. Cassez les œufs dans la poêle et laissez mijoter doucement pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les blancs soient cuits et que les jaunes commencent tout juste à prendre, mais encore coulants. Retirer avec une écumoire et égoutter sur du papier absorbant.","Pendant ce temps, ajoutez la betterave rouge dans les assiettes à salade, versez dessus la vinaigrette et mélangez légèrement. Garnir chaque assiette d''asperges et d''un œuf poché pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11619,4744,'fr','Crêpes à la cannelle, beurre de noix, tranches de banane et framboises','Utilisez de la farine sans gluten dans ces fines crêpes du petit-déjeuner servies avec du beurre d''amande, des fruits et du citron','["75 g de farine à pain complet sans gluten","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 œuf moyen","225 ml de lait demi-écrémé","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza, pour la friture","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre de noix d''amande","1 banane, tranchée","140g de framboises","quartiers de citron"]','["Versez la farine dans un grand bol à mélanger avec la cannelle. Ajoutez l''œuf et le lait et fouettez vigoureusement jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse.","Placez une poêle antiadhésive sur feu moyen et ajoutez un peu d''huile. Lorsque l’huile commence à chauffer, essuyez-en la majeure partie avec du papier absorbant. Une fois que la poêle est chaude, versez une petite quantité de pâte au centre de la poêle et faites-la tourner sur les côtés de la poêle en une fine couche. Laisser cuire sans toucher pendant environ 2 minutes. Lorsqu''il est doré en dessous, retournez-le et laissez cuire encore 1 min.","Transférer dans une assiette chaude et couvrir de papier d''aluminium pour garder au chaud. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte. Répartissez les crêpes chaudes dans 2 assiettes et servez avec le beurre de noix, la banane, les framboises et le citron pour assembler à table."]','2026-01-11 00:12:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11620,4746,'fr','Brunch aux œufs au four','Ce petit-déjeuner végétarien faible en calories composé de tomates séchées, d''épinards, de poireaux et de fromage est la façon idéale de commencer un week-end.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 poireaux, tranchés finement","2 oignons, tranchés finement","2 sachets de 100 g de pousses d''épinards","une poignée de chapelure complète fraîche","25 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), finement râpé","4 tomates séchées, hachées","4 œufs moyens"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et ajoutez les poireaux, les oignons et l''assaisonnement. Cuire pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à caraméliser.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les épinards dans une passoire et versez dessus une bouilloire d''eau bouillante. Une fois suffisamment refroidi pour être manipulé, essorez autant de liquide que possible. Mélangez la chapelure et le fromage ensemble.","Disposez le mélange poireaux et oignons dans 4 plats allant au four, puis parsemez d''épinards et de morceaux de tomates séchées. Faites un puits au milieu de chaque plat et cassez-y un œuf. Assaisonner et saupoudrer de chapelure de fromage. Disposez les plats sur une plaque à pâtisserie et laissez cuire 12 à 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les blancs soient pris et que les jaunes soient cuits à votre goût."]','2026-01-11 00:12:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11621,4748,'fr','Délicieuses boulettes de dinde','Remplacez le bœuf haché et la chapelure par de la dinde maigre et de l''avoine. Servir dans une sauce tomate avec des pâtes ou des pommes de terre. Voir l''astuce pour réaliser une version végétarienne – Penne au fenouil & Parmesan.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon, finement haché","2 carottes, coupées en petits dés","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 bulbe de fenouil, coupé en deux et tranché finement, frondes réservées","Carton de 500 g de purée de tomates","500 ml de bouillon de poulet réduit en sel","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","brocoli et pommes de terre ou pâtes et salade, pour servir","400 g de poitrine de dinde maigre hachée","4 cuillères à soupe de flocons d''avoine","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil, écrasées","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","pulvérisation d''huile"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive avec un couvercle, puis versez-y l''oignon, les carottes, le céleri, l''ail et le fenouil et remuez bien. Couvrez la poêle et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 8 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Versez la passata et le bouillon, couvrez et laissez mijoter 20 min.","Pendant ce temps, versez le hachis dans un grand bol. Ajoutez les flocons d''avoine, les graines et les feuilles de fenouil, l''ail et beaucoup de poivre noir et mélangez avec vos mains. Façonner légèrement 25 boulettes de viande de la taille d’une noix. Vaporisez ou frottez une poêle antiadhésive avec un peu d''huile et faites cuire doucement les boulettes de viande jusqu''à ce qu''elles prennent un peu de couleur. Remuez la sauce, puis ajoutez les boulettes de viande et le persil. Couvrir et cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits et que les légumes dans la sauce soient tendres. Servir avec du brocoli et des pommes de terre grelots dans leur peau, ou des pâtes et de la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:12:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11622,4752,'fr','Salade de quinoa aux fruits d''été','Égayez cette céréale bonne pour la santé avec des fruits à noyau comme les abricots, les pêches et les nectarines. Ajoutez un peu de menthe et de persil pour la couleur et la saveur.','["100 g de quinoa","3 pêches ou nectarines, ou 6 abricots, coupés en dés","50 g de noisettes grillées et hachées grossièrement","une poignée de menthe hachée grossièrement","une poignée de persil haché grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron"]','["Mettez le quinoa dans une casserole moyenne\r\net couvrir de 300 ml d''eau. Apporter au\r\nfaire bouillir et laisser mijoter pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle quinoa est tendre. Égoutter tout excédent\r\nliquide et laisser refroidir.","Ajoutez les fruits, les noisettes, les herbes et\r\nassaisonner le quinoa refroidi.","Fouetter ensemble l''huile d''olive, le citron\r\nle zeste et le jus. Verser sur la salade\r\net bien mélanger."]','2026-01-11 00:12:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11623,4754,'fr','Ragoût de tomates et courgettes','Servez un accompagnement simple et sain de légumes mijotés avec du basilic, de l''ail et du parmesan.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","3 Courgettes, la coupe","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","petit bouquet de basilic déchiré","25 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), finement râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle sur un\r\nfeu moyen. Ajouter l''oignon et cuire pendant\r\nenviron 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et commencent\r\ndevenir brun doré. Ajouter l''ail et\r\ncuire encore 5 minutes.","Ajoutez les courgettes et laissez cuire\r\nenviron 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à ramollir. Astuce\r\ndans les tomates et donnez à tout un\r\nbonne agitation. Laisser mijoter pendant 35 à 40 minutes ou jusqu''à\r\nles tomates sont réduites et les courgettes\r\ndoux, puis incorporer le basilic et le parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:12:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11624,4756,'fr','Crêpes végétaliennes aux tomates et aux champignons','Il n''y a rien de mieux que des crêpes pour le brunch. Essayez de préparer cette délicieuse recette sans produits laitiers ni œufs avec une garniture crémeuse aux tomates et aux champignons de Paris.','["140 g de farine blanche autolevante","1 cuillère à café de farine de soja","400 ml de lait de soja","huile végétale, pour la friture","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","250 g de champignons de Paris","250 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe de crème de soja ou de lait de soja","une grosse poignée de pignons de pin","ciboulette ciselée, pour servir"]','["Tamisez les farines et une pincée de sel dans\r\nun mixeur. Ajoutez le lait de soja et mélangez\r\npour faire une pâte lisse.","Faites chauffer un peu d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive moyenne\r\npoêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude. Verser environ\r\n3 cuillères à soupe de pâte dans la poêle et faites cuire\r\nà feu moyen jusqu''à l''apparition de bulles\r\nà la surface de la crêpe. Retournez le\r\nrecouvrir la crêpe avec un couteau à palette et\r\ncuire l''autre côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré.\r\nRépétez avec le reste de la pâte,\r\ngarder les crêpes cuites au chaud\r\nau fur et à mesure. Vous en ferez environ 8.","Pour la garniture, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle\r\ncasserole. Cuire les champignons jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres,\r\najouter les tomates et cuire quelques fois\r\nde minutes. Versez la crème de soja ou le lait\r\net les pignons de pin, puis cuire doucement jusqu''à ce que\r\ncombinés. Répartissez les crêpes entre\r\n2 assiettes, puis verser sur les tomates\r\net des champignons. Parsemer de ciboulette."]','2026-01-11 00:12:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11625,4758,'fr','Flan tomates cerises, thym & bacon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un plat copieux et savoureux particulièrement adapté à ceux qui suivent un régime sans produits laitiers.','["50g de farine complète","85 g de margarine végétale pour pâtisserie","100 g de farine nature","1 gros oeuf, battu","150g de Yofu nature (un yaourt 100% sans produits laitiers)","1 petit oignon, coupé en dés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","4 cuillères à soupe de lait de soja","feuilles de 2 brins de thym, plus quelques brins supplémentaires","150 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 tranches épaisses de bacon non fumé, hachées"]','["Préchauffer le four à 220C/gaz 7/\r\nventilateur 200C. Mettez les farines dans un bol\r\net incorporer la margarine jusqu''à ce qu''elle\r\nressemble à de la chapelure. Mélanger\r\n4-5 cuillères à café d''eau pour obtenir une pâte molle\r\npâte. Allumez sur un plat légèrement fariné\r\nsurface, étalez-la et utilisez-la pour tapisser un moule à flan de 20 cm. Tapisser de cuisson\r\npapier sulfurisé, couvrir de cuisson\r\nharicots et cuire au four pendant 5 minutes.\r\nRetirez le papier et les haricots et\r\ncuire encore 5 minutes. Autoriser à\r\nlaisser refroidir sur une grille. Réduire le four\r\nà 160C/gaz 3/four ventilé 140C.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites cuire\r\nle bacon et l''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants.\r\nRetirer du feu.","Mélangez le lait de soja, le Yofu,\r\nœufs et feuilles de thym. Saison\r\neh bien. Mettez l''oignon, le bacon et\r\ntomates dans l''étui à flan. Ajouter\r\nle mélange de lait et garnir de\r\nbrins de thym supplémentaires sur le dessus. Cuire au four\r\npendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris."]','2026-01-11 00:12:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11626,4760,'fr','Panna cotta à la compote d''abricots','Une panna cotta sans produits laitiers à base de lait de soja. Une texture parfaite et un mélange de saveurs rendent ce plat difficile à reprocher','["3 cuillères à café rases de gélatine (ou d''agar agar)","500 ml de lait de soja (nous avons utilisé So Good)","le zeste d''1 citron","1 gousse de vanille, fendue","un peu de brandy au rhum","25 g de sucre en poudre doré","350 g d''abricots mûrs","50 g de sucre en poudre"]','["Saupoudrer la gélatine sur 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et laisser tremper 5 minutes. Mettez le lait de soja, le zeste, la gousse de vanille, le sucre et le rhum dans une casserole. Chauffer jusqu''à ce que le liquide bout, puis retirer du feu et incorporer la gélatine. Refroidir 10 minutes. Filtrez le mélange de lait, puis répartissez-le dans 4 ramequins. Couvrir et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris (environ 1h30).","Coupez les abricots en deux et dénoyautez-les. Mettez le sucre et 150 ml d''eau dans une casserole, puis faites chauffer jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Ajouter les abricots et cuire à feu doux pendant 12-15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les abricots soient tendres, puis laisser refroidir. Servir dans un plat en accompagnement de la panna cotta."]','2026-01-11 00:12:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11627,4762,'fr','Salade de bœuf chaud BBQ, raifort et pâtes','Un plat de pâtes hypoallergénique que tout le monde appréciera. Parfait pour les invités souffrant d''intolérances alimentaires','["450 g de rumsteck maigre","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce Worcestershire sans produits laitiers ni blé","2 cuillères à café de poivre noir grossièrement moulu","250 g de pâtes fusilli « Free From » (nous avons utilisé Sainsbury''s)","1 botte d''oignon nouveau, tranché finement","3 poivrons rouges, grillés pour enlever la peau, épépinés et tranchés épaisses","petit bouquet de basilic déchiré","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","2-3 cuillères à soupe de raifort fraîchement râpé, au goût"]','["Faites mariner le steak dans la sauce Worcester pendant 10 minutes et saupoudrez de poivre noir.","Faites cuire les pâtes selon les instructions sur l''emballage, égouttez-les, puis mélangez-les avec les oignons nouveaux, les poivrons et le basilic. Mélanger la vinaigrette\r\ningrédients ensemble, assaisonner, puis réserver.","Faites chauffer le barbecue ou une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Faites cuire le steak 3 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût. Couper en tranches épaisses, puis incorporer aux pâtes avec la vinaigrette. Ajuster l''assaisonnement au goût et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11628,4764,'fr','Riz crémeux aux doubles abricots','La preuve que vous pouvez réaliser un pudding simple sans produits laitiers pour le plaisir de toute la famille !','["50 g de riz au lait","Carton de 500 ml d''alternative sucrée au lait de soja longue conservation aromatisé à la vanille (nous avons utilisé de la vanille biologique UHT Provamel)","50 g d''abricots secs prêts à consommer, coupés en petits morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","Carton de 250 ml de crème de soja alternative (nous avons utilisé UHT Provamel Soya Dream)","8 cuillères à soupe de compote d''abricots ou 4 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots","1 cuillère à soupe de pistaches décortiquées, hachées"]','["Mettez le riz et le lait de soja dans une casserole de taille moyenne, remuez et portez à ébullition. Réduisez immédiatement le feu, sinon le soja bouillonnera et pourrait facilement déborder. Couvrir à moitié la casserole avec un couvercle puis cuire doucement 40 à 45 minutes à feu très doux en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le riz soit gonflé et très tendre. Le mélange doit être épais et crémeux.","Pendant que le riz cuit, mélangez\r\nensemble les abricots, le sucre\r\net alternative à la crème unique.","Retirez le riz du\r\nchauffer, laisser refroidir 15\r\nminutes, puis incorporez l''abricot\r\nmélange. Répartir en 4 petits\r\ngobelets ou plats en verre.\r\nCouvrir et réfrigérer au réfrigérateur pendant\r\n30 minutes (ou plus si vous\r\navoir le temps).","Pour servir, versez deux cuillères à soupe de\r\ncompote d''abricots ou 1 cuillère à soupe de\r\nconserver sur chacun\r\ndessert et dispersez le\r\npistaches dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:12:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11629,4766,'fr','Gâteau aux myrtilles et à la noix de coco','Ce dessert sans produits laitiers plaira à coup sûr à tout le monde et peut même être congelé','["250 ml d''huile de son de riz, plus un peu pour la boîte","3 œufs","225 g de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","300 g de farines autolevantes","50g de noix de coco desséchée","175 ml de lait de soja","140 g de myrtilles fraîches ou surgelées, plus un peu pour servir","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4\r\net graisser un moule Bundt ou un moule à bague de 22 cm.\r\nIncorporer l''huile, les œufs, le sucre et la vanille.\r\nun grand bol. Mélangez la farine et\r\nnoix de coco. Alternativement, pliez le mélange de farine\r\net du lait de soja dans les ingrédients humides,\r\nen commençant et en terminant par la farine.","Versez-en un quart dans le moule. Pliez le\r\nles bleuets dans le reste de la pâte, puis\r\nverser dans le moule. Cuire au four pendant 1 à 1¼ heure, ou\r\njusqu''à ce qu''une brochette en ressorte propre. Couverture\r\nle gâteau avec du papier d''aluminium s''il dore trop vite.","Laisser refroidir 10 minutes dans le moule, puis démouler\r\nsur une grille et laisser refroidir complètement. Remplir\r\ncentre du gâteau avec des myrtilles supplémentaires\r\net saupoudrer de sucre glace pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11630,4768,'fr','Fricassée de poulet aux pommes de terre nouvelles et asperges','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmansDélicieuse cocotte sans produits laitiers avec une sauce crémeuse au cidre','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide","4 tranches de bacon fumé maigre, hachées et sans couenne","6 filets de poitrine de poulet sans peau","700 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, tranchées épaisses","250 g de pointes d''asperges, parées et tranchées en diagonale (garder les pointes entières)","225 ml de cidre fruité sec (ou ½ canette)","1 cuillère à soupe de maïzena mélangée à un peu d''eau","Carton de 250 ml Soya Dream","2 cuillères à soupe de persil plat haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, puis faites revenir les lardons pendant 5 minutes à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Retirer avec une écumoire et réserver. Ajoutez le poulet dans la poêle, puis faites-le revenir légèrement pendant 4 à 5 minutes pour le faire dorer des deux côtés (vous devrez peut-être faire dorer le poulet en deux fois si votre poêle n''est pas assez grande).","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Cuire les asperges au cuiseur vapeur sur les pommes de terre pendant 6 à 8 minutes ou au micro-ondes dans un plat couvert avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau pendant 4 à 5 minutes.","Versez le cidre sur le poulet, portez à ébullition puis baissez le feu. Remettez le bacon dans la poêle et laissez mijoter 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Incorporer la pâte de maïzena jusqu''à ce qu''elle épaississe légèrement, puis ajouter le Soya Dream et assaisonner. Incorporer les légumes égouttés et saupoudrer de persil haché avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11631,4770,'fr','Poulet crémeux à l''estragon','Sans gluten, sans œufs ni produits laitiers – c''est le plat de dîner parfait pour les personnes intolérantes','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de riz (nous avons utilisé Doves Farm)","300 ml de lait de soja (nous avons utilisé So Good)","4 poitrines de poulet, peau enlevée","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","250 g de tomates cerises barquette, coupées en deux","250 g de pointes d''asperges blanchies","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","150 ml de bouillon de légumes (nous avons utilisé du bouillon de légumes sans levure Kallo)","3 cuillères à soupe d''estragon haché","4 cuillères à soupe de chapelure sans gluten (nous avons utilisé des muffins anglais Sainsbury''s « Free From »)","1 cuillère à soupe de produits laitiers râpés et de fromage sans lactose (nous avons utilisé Cheezly)"]','["Mélangez la moitié de l''huile et de la farine dans une casserole (hors\r\nle feu), puis incorporez le lait de soja (il doit\r\nêtre bien mélangé avant de chauffer). Apportez le\r\nporter lentement la sauce à ébullition en fouettant constamment,\r\npuis laissez mijoter 1 min. Retirer du feu,\r\ncouvrir de papier sulfurisé et réserver.","Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Chauffer\r\nle reste de l''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez le poulet,\r\npuis faites frire pendant 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés (cela ne sera pas\r\nêtre bien cuit). Transférer dans un plat allant au four\r\nplat à gratin. Ajouter les oignons dans la poêle et faire revenir\r\npendant 2-3 minutes. Verser sur le poulet, puis\r\ngarnir de tomates et d''asperges. Ensemble\r\nréserver pendant que vous préparez la sauce.","Mettez le sucre et le vinaigre dans la poêle.\r\nRemuer à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit foncé\r\ncouleur caramel, puis ajoutez le bouillon. Apporter à\r\nporter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 1 min. Fouetter dans le\r\nsauce laiteuse jusqu''à homogénéité, assaisonner, puis ajouter\r\nl''estragon. Verser la sauce sur le poulet\r\net légumes, saupoudrer de chapelure et de fromage,\r\npuis cuire au four pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit."]','2026-01-11 00:12:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11632,4772,'fr','Salade de haricots beurre et tomates','Cette salade française végétalienne rapide et facile combine de délicieuses saveurs – un plat d''été parfait','["Boîte de 420 g de haricots beurre, égouttés et rincés","500 g de tomates cerises coupées en quartiers","2 petites courgettes vertes ou jaunes (environ 300 g au total), coupées en petits dés","1 petit oignon rouge, haché","15-20 g de coriandre fraîche hachée","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu"]','["Versez tous les ingrédients dans un bol avec du sel et du poivre et mélangez bien. Couvrir et laisser à température ambiante jusqu''au moment de servir. Cette salade peut volontiers être préparée la veille et réfrigérée.","Le jour même, ramenez la salade à température ambiante et remuez-la bien avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11633,4774,'fr','Croquants au chocolat & pots de framboises','Vous ne devineriez jamais qu''il s''agissait d''un dessert sans allergies – sans noix, sans produits laitiers, sans gluten ni œufs. La solution parfaite à ces menus délicats','["250 g de framboises barquette","2 cuillères à soupe de Cointreau (ou Grand Marnier)","le zeste et le jus d''une petite orange","Paquet de 100 g de chocolat « sans produits laitiers », sans gluten et sans blé (nous avons utilisé la barre de chocolat noir Kinnerton Luxury)","3 cuillères à soupe de lait de soja","50 g de sucre en poudre","6 cuillères à soupe de muesli sans gluten, sans blé et sans noix (nous avons utilisé The Food Doctor Cereal, sans noix)"]','["Répartissez les framboises dans 4 verres.\r\nSaupoudrer ½ cuillère à soupe de Cointreau et un peu\r\nle zeste et le jus d''orange sur chacun, puis réserver.","Faire fondre le chocolat et incorporer le soja\r\nlait, puis réserver. Versez le sucre dans une casserole\r\navec 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau. A feu doux,\r\ncuire sans remuer pendant environ 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle sucre fond et commence à devenir doré\r\nmarron. Versez le muesli, remuez, puis versez\r\nsur une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé.\r\nLaisser refroidir, puis briser en fins éclats.","Répartissez le mélange de chocolat dans les verres et laissez refroidir, mais ne réfrigérez pas.\r\nRépartir sur le caramel croquant pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11634,4776,'fr','Crêpes sans produits laitiers','Évitez le lait ordinaire et remplacez-le par du lait de coco ou de chanvre dans ces crêpes légères adaptées aux personnes intolérantes aux produits laitiers ou au lactose.','["125 g de farine nature","1 oeuf","300 ml de lait de chanvre ou de coco (voir astuce)","huile de tournesol ou de son de riz, pour la friture"]','["Mettez la farine dans un bol et faites un puits au centre. Cassez l''œuf au milieu et versez-y un quart du lait. Utilisez un fouet électrique ou un fouet ballon pour bien mélanger le mélange. Une fois que vous avez une pâte, mélangez-en un autre quart et une fois sans grumeaux, mélangez le reste du lait. Laisser reposer 20 mn. Remuer à nouveau avant utilisation.","Faites chauffer une petite poêle antiadhésive avec un peu d''huile. Lorsqu’elle est chaude, versez une petite quantité du mélange dans la casserole et remuez pour enrober la base – vous voulez une fine couche. Cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le fond soit doré, puis retourner et cuire jusqu''à ce que l''autre côté soit doré. Répétez jusqu''à ce que vous ayez utilisé tout le mélange, en remuant le mélange entre les crêpes et en ajoutant plus d''huile pour la friture si nécessaire. Empilez les crêpes entre des feuilles de papier sulfurisé ou cuisinez sur commande. Servir avec la garniture à crêpes de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:12:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11635,4777,'fr','Marmelade d''agrumes','Des agrumes menacent de ramollir dans votre corbeille de fruits ? Préparez une marmelade piquante – en plus de l''étaler sur vos toasts, c''est un joli cadeau','["1 kg d''agrumes non paraffinés (nous avons utilisé un mélange de pamplemousse, citrons et limes)","2,25 kg de sucre semoule"]','["Refroidissez une soucoupe au congélateur, prête à vérifier plus tard le point de prise de votre confiture. Lavez les agrumes et retirez les parties supérieures qui étaient attachées aux tiges.","Mettez les agrumes entiers dans une grande casserole avec 2½ litres d''eau froide. Portez à ébullition, puis couvrez la casserole et laissez mijoter pendant 2 h 30, ou jusqu''à ce que les peaux puissent être facilement percées avec un petit couteau.","Utilisez une écumoire pour retirer les fruits du liquide et laissez-les refroidir pendant au moins 10 à 15 minutes. Mesurez 1,5 litre de liqueur et remettez-le dans la casserole. Si vous n’en avez pas assez, complétez avec de l’eau.","Coupez les agrumes en deux, retirez les pépins et réservez. Coupez la peau et la chair en fines lanières de 0,2 cm (selon l''épaisseur souhaitée). Versez toute la chair et la peau, ainsi que le jus éventuel, dans la casserole avec le liquide. Mettez les pépins dans un petit morceau de mousseline et attachez-les avec de la ficelle. Ajoutez-le également à la poêle, ce qui facilitera le processus de prise.","Versez le sucre et portez à ébullition en remuant fréquemment. Continuez à faire bouillir rapidement pendant 45 à 50 minutes – elle devrait atteindre 105°C. Testez le point de prise en déposant un peu de marmelade sur la soucoupe réfrigérée, laissez-la refroidir 1 min, puis poussez doucement avec votre doigt. S''il se froisse, il a atteint le point de prise. Si ce n’est pas le cas, continuez à bouillir et vérifiez à nouveau après 5 à 10 minutes.","Laissez refroidir la marmelade dans la poêle pendant 10 à 15 minutes, puis retirez délicatement le sac de mousseline à l''aide d''une écumoire. Remuez doucement la marmelade dans une direction pour disperser les bulles d''air, puis versez-la dans des bocaux stérilisés et fermez avec un couvercle. Découvrez comment stériliser les bocaux. Se conservera jusqu''à un an."]','2026-01-11 00:12:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11636,4779,'fr','Recette de smoothie aux bleuets','Préparez un smoothie aux bleuets simple et rapide avec du yaourt, de la banane et du jus de pomme pour les matins occupés. Vous pouvez facilement le rendre végétalien en utilisant du yaourt à la noix de coco.','["175g de myrtilles","1 petite banane, tranchée","1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt nature ou grec","100 ml de jus de pomme réfrigéré","3-4 feuilles de menthe (facultatif), plus un peu pour garnir"]','["Mettez les myrtilles, la banane, le yaourt, le jus de pomme et la menthe, le cas échéant, dans un mélange et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez un peu d''eau si cela semble trop épais.","Versez le smoothie dans un grand verre avec une paille en verre pour servir. Garnir d''un brin de menthe, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11637,4783,'fr','Bacon à la friteuse à air','Faites cuire le bacon dans une friteuse à air pour obtenir une texture croustillante avec moins de gras. Le sandwich au bacon parfait commence ici','["6 tranches de bacon entrelacé ou 3 tranches de bacon arrière"]','["Disposez le bacon en une seule couche dans la base d''une friteuse à air – assurez-vous que les couches ne se chevauchent pas. La taille du panier de la friteuse à air déterminera le nombre de tranches que vous pouvez cuisiner en même temps.","Réglez la friteuse à 200 °C et faites cuire des tranches de bacon entrelacées pendant 6 à 10 minutes – le bacon juste cuit prendra 6 minutes, mais le bacon plus croustillant prendra 9 à 10 minutes. Faites cuire les tranches de bacon pendant 4 à 8 minutes, selon vos préférences. Si vous cuisinez par lots, n''oubliez pas que le deuxième lot sera généralement plus rapide à mesure que la friteuse à air aura chauffé.","Retirez le bacon à l''aide de pinces et mettez-le sur du papier absorbant pour l''égoutter avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11638,4785,'fr','Pancetta & piperade au poivre','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Les œufs sont concassés dans une riche sauce tomate et pancetta dans ce plat traditionnel d''inspiration basque – parfait pour un brunch ou un repas en milieu de semaine.','["2 paquets de 70 g de morceaux de pancetta","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","3 poivrons, 1 de chacun vert, rouge et jaune, épépinés et finement coupés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","4 œufs moyens","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic, émincées","pain croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez la pancetta et l''oignon dans une grande poêle profonde. Cuire 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon commence à ramollir.","Ajouter les poivrons, les tomates et la purée de tomates dans la poêle et bien mélanger. Assaisonner, couvrir et cuire 10 à 15 minutes.","Faites 4 petits puits dans le mélange. Cassez un œuf dans chaque puits et laissez cuire encore 5 à 6 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient pris. Parsemez de basilic et servez aussitôt, avec du pain croustillant, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11639,4787,'fr','Des fèves au lard meilleures que des quartiers épicés','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. La cuisine des étudiants est peut-être la cible de nombreuses blagues, mais avec ces haricots riches en nutriments, faibles en gras et bon marché, ce sont eux qui ont le dernier mot.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile","1 oignon, coupé en deux et émincé","2 tranches de bacon, coupées en gros morceaux","1 cuillère à café de sucre, brunir si vous en avez","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","200 ml de bouillon en cube","Boîte de 410 g de haricots cannellini, de beurre ou de haricots blancs dans l''eau","1 cuillère à soupe de farine blanche (nature ou auto-levante)","½ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne, de paprika ou de poudre de piment doux","1 cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées séchées (facultatif)","2 pommes de terre au four, chacune coupée en 8 quartiers","2 cuillères à café d''huile"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Pour le\r\nquartiers, mélanger la farine, le poivre de Cayenne et les herbes (si\r\nen utilisant), ajoutez un peu de sel et de poivre, puis mélangez\r\navec les pommes de terre et l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien enrobées.\r\nVersez dans un plat à rôtir, puis enfournez pendant environ\r\n35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et bien cuits.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive,\r\npuis faites revenir doucement l''oignon et le bacon ensemble\r\npendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient ramollis et\r\ncommence tout juste à devenir doré. Incorporer le sucre,\r\ntomates, bouillon et assaisonnement au goût, puis\r\nlaisser mijoter la sauce pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez les haricots,\r\npuis laisser mijoter encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce\r\ns''est épaissi. Servir avec les quartiers."]','2026-01-11 00:12:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11640,4789,'fr','Pommes de terre rissolées de panais','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ces pommes de terre rissolées croustillantes peuvent être préparées à l''avance et réchauffées surgelées – idéales pour les visiteurs inattendus de Noël.','["450 g de pommes de terre à chair ferme (type Charlotte)","350 g de panais ou autre légume racine","1 petit oignon, coupé en deux et émincé","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 œuf battu","4-5 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","6 tranches de bacon entrelacé ou tranches de prosciutto","6 tiges de tomates cerises sur vigne","6 oeufs"]','["Épluchez et râpez grossièrement les pommes de terre et les panais – si vous utilisez un robot culinaire, fixez la râpe moyenne. Essorez autant de liquide que possible avec vos mains et mettez-les dans un bol.","Incorporer l''oignon, l''ail, l''œuf et assaisonner si vous le souhaitez. Divisez le mélange en six et façonnez grossièrement des galettes. Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites frire trois gâteaux à feu doux pendant 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et tendres. Transférer sur du papier absorbant avec une écumoire et laisser refroidir tout en faisant frire le reste, en ajoutant le reste de l''huile si nécessaire. Pendant ce temps, faites griller le bacon et les tomates, pochez les œufs et servez à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:12:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11641,4791,'fr','Champignons au four tout-en-un','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un excellent repas en milieu de semaine ou un petit-déjeuner le week-end cuit dans un seul plateau pour éviter la vaisselle.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 très gros champignons des champs","4 tranches de jambon cuit de bonne qualité","4 œufs"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7. Arroser \r\nun peu d''huile d''olive sur le fond d''une céramique \r\nplat allant au four, puis ajoutez les champignons.","Arroser du reste d’huile et d’assaisonnement. \r\nCuire au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, puis retirer \r\ndu four.","Rentrez les tranches de jambon autour des champignons \r\npour créer des petites poches. Cassez les œufs dans le \r\npoches, puis remettre au four 10 min \r\njusqu''à ce que le blanc d''œuf soit pris et que le jaune soit encore \r\nun peu coulant. Servir directement du \r\nplat. Excellent avec des fèves au lard et des chips."]','2026-01-11 00:12:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11642,4793,'fr','Salade de pamplemousse, agave et pistaches','Les salades de fruits sont rapides à préparer et constituent l''une des façons les plus saines de commencer la journée : sucrer avec une alternative au sucre.','["1 pamplemousse rose","1 pamplemousse blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de nectar d''agave","1 cuillère à café de pistache hachée"]','["Segmentez les pamplemousses en enlevant le plus de moelle possible. Répartir les segments dans deux bols et garnir d''agave et de pistaches."]','2026-01-11 00:12:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11643,4795,'fr','Salade d''œufs mollets, bacon et cresson','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Du bacon croustillant et un œuf parfaitement cuit au jaune suintant sont un incontournable du brunch – cette version l''associe au cresson','["2 gros œufs, à température ambiante","1 échalote hachée très finement","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à café bombée de moutarde complète","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","une poignée de ciboulette, ciselée (facultatif)","4 tranches épaisses de bacon fumé à sec","2 tranches de bon pain blanc croustillant (idéalement au levain)","2 bonnes poignées de cresson britannique, tiges épaisses enlevées"]','["Mettez les œufs dans une casserole d''eau froide\r\net porter à ébullition. Faire bouillir 3 minutes,\r\npuis soulevez-le dans un bol d''eau glacée et\r\nrefroidir complètement. Peler très soigneusement\r\nenlever les coquilles. Laissez les œufs dans le\r\nde l''eau glacée jusqu''à ce que vous ayez terminé la recette,\r\nou jusqu''à 1 heure à l''avance.","Mélangez l''échalote avec le vinaigre et\r\nune pincée de sel, puis laisser reposer quelques minutes pour ramollir. Incorporer le\r\nmoutarde, huile et ciboulette, si vous en utilisez,\r\nfaire un pansement.","Chauffer le gril à feu moyen-doux et\r\ncuire le bacon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien croustillant.\r\nRetirez les lardons, puis badigeonnez-les\r\njus de bacon et graisse partout sur le pain.\r\nFaire griller les pains environ 1 min sur chacun\r\ncôté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant, puis coupé en soldats\r\net garder au chaud.","Juste avant de servir, apportez la poêle\r\nd''eau à nouveau à ébullition et ajoutez le\r\nœufs. Faire bouillir 1 min pour réchauffer. Lancer\r\nla vinaigrette au cresson et\r\nrépartir dans 2 assiettes. Garnir d''un\r\nœuf et 2 tranches de bacon, avec le\r\ngriller sur le côté. Les jaunes d''œufs\r\nêtre toujours liquide à l''intérieur."]','2026-01-11 00:12:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11644,4797,'fr','Salade de pamplemousse, orange et abricot','Une salade de fruits ultra simple pour le petit-déjeuner et au-delà, sucrée au miel et riche en nutriments','["2 pamplemousses, pelure et moelle coupées","4 oranges, la peau et la peau coupées","4 abricots dénoyautés et tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair"]','["Segmentez les pamplemousses et les oranges\r\ndans un grand bol pour récupérer le jus. Remuer\r\ndans les abricots et le miel, et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11645,4799,'fr','Shakchouka','Variez ce plat de brunch populaire en aromatisant la simple sauce tomate avec tout ce que vous avez sous la main : poudre de curry, pesto ou herbes fraîches.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons rouges, hachés","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges et feuilles hachées séparément","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates cerises","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","4 œufs"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle munie d''un\r\ncouvercle, puis attendrir les oignons, le piment, l''ail et\r\ntiges de coriandre pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Remuer\r\ndans les tomates et le sucre, puis faire bouillonner\r\npendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Peut être congelé pendant\r\n1 mois.","À l''aide du dos d''une grande cuillère, préparez\r\n4 trempettes dans la sauce, puis casser un œuf dedans\r\nchacun. Mettez un couvercle sur la poêle, puis faites cuire\r\nà feu doux pendant 6 à 8 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les œufs\r\nsont faits à votre goût. Dispersez-vous avec le\r\nfeuilles de coriandre et servir avec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:12:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11646,4801,'fr','Salade d''orange et de menthe','Hannah Measures, lectrice de Good Food, partage sa recette d''une salade de fruits fraîche et saine pour le petit-déjeuner','["4 oranges","12 dattes molles, dénoyautées, tranchées dans le sens de la longueur","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles finement hachées, plus quelques-unes entières","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop de rose ou d''eau de rose"]','["Eplucher puis segmenter les oranges,\r\nen enlevant la peau blanche. Placer dans un bol\r\navec les jus de fruits, puis ajoutez les dattes,\r\nmenthe hachée et sirop de rose et mélanger\r\ndoucement. Répartir dans 4 bols à dessert,\r\nparsemer de feuilles de menthe et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11647,4803,'fr','Petit-déjeuner végétarien','Frappez 3 de vos 5 par jour avec cette friture alternative : elle est remplie de légumes et cuite au four.','["4 gros champignons des champs","8 tomates, coupées en deux","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée finement","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","200 g d''épinards","4 œufs"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMettez les champignons et les tomates dans\r\n4 plats allant au four. Répartir l''ail entre\r\nles plats, arroser d''huile et d''un peu\r\nassaisonner, puis enfourner 10 min.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les épinards dans un grand\r\npassoire, puis versez sur une bouilloire de\r\nde l''eau bouillante pour le flétrir. Éliminez tout\r\nl''excès d''eau, puis ajoutez les épinards à\r\nles plats. Faites un petit écart entre le\r\nlégumes et cassez un œuf dans chacun\r\nplat. Remettre au four et cuire un\r\nencore 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que l''œuf soit\r\ncuisiné à votre goût."]','2026-01-11 00:12:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11648,4805,'fr','Oeufs au four avec jambon et épinards','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Servez ce plat adaptable de style mexicain pour le brunch, le petit-déjeuner ou le dîner avec une sauce tomate épicée.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 petit piment vert épépiné et finement haché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","100 g de poivrons rôtis en bocal, égouttés et tranchés","Paquet de 180 g de jambon, jarret de jambon déchiré ou râpé","50 g de pousses d''épinards","2 œufs moyens","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans un petit sauté allant au four\r\ncasserole. Ajouter l''oignon et cuire 6 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer l''ail et le piment,\r\net laissez cuire encore quelques minutes. Ajouter\r\nles tomates et 100 ml d''eau. Saison\r\nbien et incorporez les poivrons et\r\njambon. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire pendant\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce commence\r\npour épaissir. Ajouter les épinards en remuant\r\njusqu''à flétrir.","Faites 2 creux dans la sauce et\r\ncassez vos œufs dedans. Ajoutez une pincée\r\nde poivre de Cayenne, transférer au four et\r\nenfourner 10 min jusqu''à ce que les blancs de\r\nles œufs sont pris. Servir immédiatement\r\navec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:12:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11649,4807,'fr','Beurre de cacahuète et banane sur pain grillé','Gardez la sensation de faim du milieu de la matinée à distance avec ce toastie de petit-déjeuner nutritionnellement équilibré.','["2 tranches de pain de grenier","1 petite banane","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre de cacahuète croquant"]','["Faire griller du pain et trancher\r\nbanane. Couche de banane sur un\r\ntranche de pain grillé et saupoudrer de\r\ncannelle. Étalez la deuxième tranche\r\navec du beurre de cacahuète,\r\npuis prenez les deux ensemble en sandwich et\r\nmanger tout de suite."]','2026-01-11 00:12:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11650,4809,'fr','Marmelade d''oranges de Séville','Profitez de la courte saison des oranges de Séville et faites bouillir de la marmelade maison pour mettre sur vos toasts et utiliser dans les recettes de Jane.','["1 kg d''oranges de Séville, bien lavées et coupées en deux","1 citron non ciré","2 kg de sucre semoule"]','["Pressez les oranges et conservez-les\r\njus. Grattez la moelle et les pépins avec\r\nune cuillère en métal, encore une fois en gardant tout.\r\nPressez également le citron, puis mettez le citron\r\ncoquilles, la peau d''orange et les graines dans un\r\ncarré de mousseline d''environ 30 x 30 cm, et\r\nattachez-le avec de la ficelle. Laissez la chaîne longue –\r\nde cette façon, vous pouvez l''attacher à votre bois\r\ncuillère, ce qui facilitera le levage\r\nsortir plus tard.","Coupez chaque coquille d''orange en 3 pétales,\r\npuis râpez finement avec un couteau large et pointu.\r\ncouteau. Mettez la peau dans une sauteuse,\r\nversez le jus, puis placez le sac dans le\r\njus. Versez 2,4 litres/4 pintes d''eau froide\r\net laisser infuser toute la nuit.","Le lendemain, en laissant le sachet dans la poêle,\r\nporter le liquide à ébullition, puis laisser mijoter\r\npendant environ 1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce que la peau soit molle et\r\ntranslucide et le liquide a réduit de\r\nun tiers. Éteignez le feu et soulevez le\r\nsac de mousseline dans un grand bol. Laissez le\r\nsac jusqu’à ce qu’il soit suffisamment froid pour être manipulé.","En attendant, préparez vos pots.\r\nLavez 8 pots de 450 g/1 lb (ou l''équivalent\r\nbocaux de plus ou moins grand volume) dans un endroit chaud,\r\neau savonneuse, puis laisser à four doux\r\nsécher complètement. Gardez-les au chaud.\r\nAlternativement, si vous possédez un lave-vaisselle\r\nvous pouvez cependant faire fonctionner les bocaux et les couvercles\r\nun cycle chaud, puis laissez-les sécher. Mettez un\r\nsoucoupe au congélateur à ce stade également.","Maintenant, pour le peu de désordre – j''aime enfiler un\r\npaire de gants en caoutchouc à ce stade. Tenir\r\nle sac sur son bol, et pressez et\r\nFrappez-le jusqu''à ce que vous ayez extrait chaque\r\ndernière goutte de jus et passez à travers le\r\nmousseline. Ce truc contient de la pectine –\r\nl''ingrédient crucial pour un ensemble parfait.\r\nVous pouvez maintenant jeter ce qui reste\r\nle sac et laver la mousseline, prête à\r\nréutilisation.","Remuez le contenu du bol, ainsi que tout\r\nle sucre, dans la poêle. Remuez de temps en temps\r\nsouvent à feu très doux jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle sucre est complètement dissous. Ne\r\nfaire bouillir avant que tout le sucre ait fondu.","Portez lentement la casserole à ébullition. Après\r\n10 minutes d''ébullition, versez une petite goutte de\r\nmarmelade sur la soucoupe froide. Partir\r\npendant quelques secondes, puis poussez la marmelade\r\navec votre doigt. S’il se froisse, c’est prêt.\r\nSinon, faites bouillir encore 10 minutes puis réessayez.\r\nMême si tu as un thermomètre à sucre\r\n(cherchez 105°C ou là où il est écrit « confiture »), je le ferais\r\nJe recommande toujours le test de la soucoupe. Si le vôtre\r\nça semble prendre du temps, ne t''inquiète pas,\r\ncela peut prendre de 10 minutes à\r\n45 minutes pour que la marmelade atteigne la prise\r\npoint, en fonction de vos oranges. Écrémé\r\nde toute écume qui remonte à la surface\r\nen attendant.","Une fois que vous avez atteint le point de réglage,\r\nverser la marmelade dans les bocaux chauds\r\net sceller. Un entonnoir est vraiment pratique si vous\r\nen avoir un. La marmelade se conserve\r\nà 1 an dans un endroit frais et sombre, et pendant\r\njusqu''à un mois au réfrigérateur une fois ouvert."]','2026-01-11 00:12:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11651,4811,'fr','Riz frit épicé','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Donnez une touche épicée à votre anglais complet avec cette délicieuse recette de brunch – la pâte de piment peut être congelée à l''avance.','["2 oignons moyens","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour faire frire les œufs","400 g de riz basmati bien rincé","12 saucisses cocktail, ou 6 chipolatas torsadées puis coupées en deux","6 tranches de bacon salé à sec, coupées en bouchées","140 g de champignons châtaignes coupés en deux","2 piments rouges ou verts épépinés","3 gousses d''ail écrasées à plat pour enlever la peau","6 oeufs","20 g de coriandre","sauce soja et sauce chili, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nTrancher finement un demi-oignon, mélanger avec 1 cuillère à café\r\nhuiler sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis cuire au four\r\npendant 15 minutes, en retournant une fois, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré\r\net commence à devenir croustillant. Pendant ce temps, mettez le\r\nle riz dans une grande casserole avec suffisamment d''eau\r\ncouvrir du bout du doigt. Portez à ébullition,\r\nremuer une fois, puis couvrir et laisser mijoter 10\r\nminutes. Retirer du feu, laisser couvert pendant\r\n10 min, puis gonfler à la fourchette.","Pendant la cuisson du riz et de l''oignon, ajoutez 1 cuillère à café\r\nhuile dans une poêle. Faites frire les saucisses pendant\r\nquelques minutes. Maintenant, versez le bacon\r\net grésiller encore 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle bacon est doré et les saucisses cuites.\r\nVerser dans un grand plat. Faire revenir les champignons pendant\r\n3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, puis versez-le avec le\r\nbacon et saucisses. Essuyez la poêle.","Mettez les piments, l''ail, les oignons restants\r\net 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un petit robot culinaire,\r\npuis réduire en pâte. La pâte peut être\r\npréparé jusqu''à 1 mois à l''avance et congelé.\r\nFaire frire doucement la pâte pendant environ 3 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé, en remuant. Versez le riz,\r\nbien mélanger, puis incorporer la viande et le\r\nchampignons. Ajoutez un peu d''eau et\r\nmélangez le tout. Verser dans le plat,\r\ncouvrir, puis réserver au chaud au four pendant\r\ntu fais frire les œufs.","Essuyez la poêle, puis faites chauffer une fine couche de\r\nhuiler à feu doux et craquer cependant\r\nbeaucoup d’œufs que la poêle peut contenir. Frire doucement,\r\nverser un peu d''huile chaude maintenant\r\net encore, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût.\r\nSortez le plat du four. En gros\r\nhachez la coriandre et passez-la à la fourchette\r\nle riz avec un peu de soja, puis cuillère\r\nsur des assiettes. Garnir chacun d''un œuf, puis\r\narroser avec plus de sauce soja et chili pour\r\ngoût. Répartir sur les oignons croustillants"]','2026-01-11 00:12:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11652,4815,'fr','Hommes aux œufs câlins','Une décoration et un petit-déjeuner à la fois – faites plaisir aux enfants affamés avec ces œufs au four et ces bonhommes de pain faits maison, ils apprécieront aussi les préparer !','["400 g de farine blanche forte","½ cuillère à café de sel","pincée de sucre","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 gros œufs, à température ambiante"]','["Mettez la farine dans un grand bol et incorporez le sel, le sucre et la levure. Versez 250 ml d''eau et l''huile et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte molle. Ajoutez un peu d''eau supplémentaire si nécessaire.","Pétrir la pâte pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse, puis la mettre dans un bol, couvrir et laisser dans un endroit chaud pendant environ 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Étalez la pâte sur une planche, pétrissez brièvement puis coupez-la en quatre. Prenez un morceau, coupez-en un quart et formez une boule pour la tête. Façonnez l’autre morceau en boudin. Fixez la tête au corps avec un peu d''eau froide.","Disposez la pâte sur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive. À l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, coupez la moitié inférieure de la saucisse pour former deux cuisses, puis coupez les côtés jusqu''aux épaules pour former deux bras. À l''aide de ciseaux, coupez à intervalles réguliers autour du sommet de la tête pour faire les cheveux et faites une coupe pour la bouche. Utilisez une pique à brochette en bois pour faire deux yeux.","Prenez un œuf et placez-le sur le ventre du pâtissier. Repliez les bras sur l''œuf et fixez-les avec un peu d''eau froide. Préparez trois autres œufs avec le reste de la pâte. Laisser lever environ 10 minutes.","Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien levés et dorés. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes sur une grille avant d''éplucher l''œuf et de le déguster avec le pain chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:12:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11653,3818,'fr','Cubes de smoothies','Une bonne idée pour une boisson rapide, rafraîchissante et saine, notamment au petit-déjeuner','["mûres, fraises, framboises, fruits de la passion, mangue, tout autre fruit de votre choix"]','["Réduisez en purée un fruit (essayez les mûres, les fraises, les framboises, les fruits de la passion et la mangue, au robot culinaire, laissez les pépins ou passez au tamis.","Congelez dans des bacs à glaçons prêts à être préparés (3 par portion) avec une banane, 150 ml de yaourt nature en pot et du lait et du miel au goût."]','2026-01-11 00:12:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11654,4821,'fr','Casserole de poulet et jambon avec raviolis à la moutarde','Servez des raviolis à la moutarde avec notre cocotte de poulet et de jambon pour un festin familial réconfortant et copieux. Vous pouvez également congeler les restes – s’il y en a !','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 oignon, haché","2 poireaux, tranchés grossièrement","2 carottes pelées et hachées","6 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en gros morceaux","200 ml de cidre","800 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","½ bouquet de thym ficelé","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","150 g de jarret de jambon ou de gammon cuit, râpé en gros morceaux","100 g de petits pois surgelés","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde anglaise ou de Dijon","200 g de farines autolevantes","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à soupe de moutarde anglaise en poudre","100 g de suif ou de beurre froid, râpé","½ petit bouquet de persil finement haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile et le beurre dans une cocotte allant au four à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''oignon, les poireaux et les carottes ainsi qu''une pincée de sel et faites revenir doucement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et translucides. Ajoutez le poulet, augmentez le feu et faites revenir 5 minutes. Versez le cidre, laissez cuire 3 min, puis versez le bouillon de volaille et ajoutez le bouquet de thym. Portez à ébullition, assaisonnez selon votre goût, puis réduisez à feu doux et couvrez la poêle. Cuire 30 min.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante. 4. Préparez les raviolis en mélangeant la farine, la levure chimique, la moutarde en poudre, le suif ou le beurre, le persil et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Mélangez rapidement avec 8 à 10 cuillères à soupe d''eau et rassemblez avec vos mains. La pâte doit être ferme et souple. Divisez-le en huit morceaux de taille égale, en pesant pour plus de précision si vous le souhaitez.","Retirez le bouquet de thym du ragoût et jetez-le. Versez un peu de liquide dans un bol et mélangez avec la maïzena, puis incorporez le mélange dans la cocotte. Ajoutez le jarret de jambon, les petits pois et la moutarde. Disposez les raviolis sur le ragoût, puis enfournez à couvert pendant 30 min. Retirez le couvercle et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les raviolis soient gonflés et dorés. Servir dans des bols. Pour congeler le ragoût, laisser refroidir complètement, puis transférer dans un récipient allant au congélateur. Se conservera jusqu''à trois mois. Décongelez soigneusement, puis réchauffez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:12:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11655,4823,'fr','Côtelettes d''agneau piquantes avec haricots rouges écrasés','Rehaussez les côtelettes d''agneau avec du zeste de citron, puis servez-les avec de la purée de haricots rouges au piment et à l''ail pour un souper rapide en semaine.','["8 côtelettes d''agneau","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","le jus et le zeste d''1 citron","1-2 piments rouges épépinés et finement hachés","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés","petit paquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées finement","feuilles vertes mélangées comme de la roquette et du cresson, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif. Badigeonnez les côtelettes d''agneau d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile, puis frottez-les avec le zeste de citron et un peu d''assaisonnement. Faites griller 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté pour une viande légèrement rosée, ou un peu plus longtemps pour une viande bien cuite. Vous devrez peut-être le faire en 2 lots. Retirer de la poêle, envelopper dans du papier aluminium et laisser reposer 10 minutes.","Faites revenir doucement le reste de l''huile, les piments et l''ail dans une casserole pendant 2-3 minutes. Ajoutez les haricots rouges et écrasez-les délicatement avec un presse-purée, puis poursuivez la cuisson 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les haricots soient chauds. Incorporer le jus de citron, la menthe et l''assaisonnement, et servir avec les côtelettes et les feuilles mélangées."]','2026-01-11 00:12:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11656,4825,'fr','Pizza florentine sans produits laitiers','Atteignez votre objectif de 5 par jour en une seule fois avec cette pizza croustillante remplie de légumes, adaptée aux intolérants au lactose','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 g d''épinards surgelés, décongelés","garnitures de votre choix - anchois, olives, câpres, pepperoni, cœurs d''artichauts, poivrons grillés","2 œufs","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic","2 poignées de fusée","jus ½ citron","350 g de farine blanche forte","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe de semoule grossière ou fine"]','["Pour faire la base, versez la farine dans\r\nle bol d''un mixeur de table (ou d''aliments\r\nrobot avec un accessoire pour pâte). Ajouter\r\n1 cuillère à café de sel sur un côté du bol et le\r\nlevure à l''autre. Ajouter 275 ml tiède\r\neau et mélanger lentement jusqu''à obtenir une pâte collante\r\nformes. Allumez le mixeur pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nune empreinte enfoncée dans la pâte apparaît\r\nsortir rapidement. Mettez la pâte légèrement\r\nbol huilé, puis couvrir et laisser dans un\r\nendroit chaud pour lever jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle\r\net faites grésiller l''ail pendant quelques secondes, puis\r\nverser les tomates, assaisonner et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nPétrissez la pâte quelques minutes, puis\r\ncouper en deux et rouler chaque moitié aussi finement que\r\npossibles. Poser chaque base sur une plaque allant au four\r\nfeuille saupoudrée de semoule. Diviser\r\nla sauce tomate entre les pizzas,\r\ns''étendant presque jusqu''au bord. Point sur\r\nles épinards, ajoutez vos garnitures et arrosez\r\navec un peu d''huile. Cuire 5 min, puis craquer\r\nun œuf sur chaque pizza. Échangez la cuisson\r\nfeuilles, puis cuire encore 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nles bases sont bien cuites. Arroser de basilic\r\net roquette avec une goutte d''huile et le citron\r\njus. Répartissez sur la pizza avant de manger."]','2026-01-11 00:12:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11657,4829,'fr','Curry rouge végétarien thaï','Ce plat thaïlandais parfumé ne manquera pas de mettre vos papilles en action et est prêt en moins d''une heure.','["200 g de tofu ferme, coupé en cubes","4-5 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","jus de 3 citrons verts","2 piments rouges, 1 finement haché, 1 tranché en rondelles","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","400 ml de lait de coco allégé en boîte","1 courgette coupée en morceaux","1 petite aubergine coupée en morceaux","½ poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en morceaux","140 g de champignons coupés en deux","140 g de pois mange-tout","20 g de basilic, feuilles cueillies","1 cuillère à café de cassonade","riz au jasmin, pour servir","3 piments rouges","1 citronnelle hachée grossièrement","3 échalotes hachées grossièrement","½ poivron rouge épépiné et haché grossièrement","le zeste d''1 citron vert","tiges de 20 g de coriandre","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","2 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à café de poivre fraîchement moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue"]','["Mélanger les ingrédients en pâte dans un aliment\r\nprocesseur. Faire mariner le tofu dans 2 cuillères à soupe de soja\r\nsauce, le jus d''un citron vert et le piment haché.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajouter\r\n3-4 cuillères à soupe de pâte et faire revenir 2 minutes. Incorporer\r\nle lait de coco avec 100 ml d''eau, le\r\ncourgette, aubergine et poivron et\r\ncuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque tendre.","Égouttez le tofu, séchez-le, puis faites-le revenir au\r\nle reste de l''huile dans une petite poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée.","Ajouter les champignons, les pois sucrés\r\net la majeure partie du basilic au curry, puis\r\nassaisonner avec le sucre, le reste du citron vert\r\njus et sauce soja. Cuire 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles champignons sont tendres, puis ajoutez le\r\ntofu et réchauffer. Parsemer de tranches\r\npiment et basilic et servir avec du riz au jasmin."]','2026-01-11 00:12:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11658,4831,'fr','Poulet au romarin et ratatouille rôtie au four','Vous ne pouvez pas battre cette recette tout-en-un faible en gras pour un repas facile, débordant de couleurs et de saveurs estivales.','["1 aubergine, coupée en gros morceaux","2 courgettes coupées en demi-lunes","3 poivrons mélangés, épépinés et hachés grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de romarin finement haché, plus 4 petites branches","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées","250 g de tomates cerises ou de petites tomates italiennes, coupées en deux"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDans un grand plat à rôtir, mélanger le\r\naubergines, courgettes et poivrons avec\r\nla moitié du romarin haché, la moitié de l''ail,\r\n2 cuillères à soupe d''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement. Propagation\r\nétalez les légumes en une couche uniforme, puis\r\nrôtir au four pendant 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le reste du romarin,\r\nl''ail et l''huile ensemble. Coupez chacun des\r\npoitrines de poulet 4 à 5 fois avec un piquant\r\ncouteau, badigeonner d''huile aromatisée, assaisonner\r\net réfrigérer 15 minutes.","Après 20 minutes de cuisson des légumes,\r\nincorporer les tomates. Faites des espaces dans\r\nle plat à rôtir et y nicher le poulet\r\npoitrines parmi les légumes. Lieu\r\nun brin de romarin sur chaque poulet\r\nsein. Remettez le moule au four pendant\r\n18-20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit\r\nà travers et les légumes sont légèrement\r\ncaramélisé. Servir avec du nouveau\r\ndes pommes de terre, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11659,4835,'fr','Curry d''épinards et de pois chiches','Un pot végétalien indien faible en gras et en calories, plein de délicieuses saveurs de soleil et d''épices piquantes.','["2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry douce","1 oignon, haché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","Sachet de 250 g de jeunes pousses d''épinards","presser le jus de citron","riz basmati, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer la pâte de curry dans une grande\r\npoêle antiadhésive. Une fois que ça commence\r\npour le fendre, ajouter l''oignon et cuire pendant\r\n2 minutes pour ramollir. Incorporer les tomates\r\net bouillonner pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le\r\nla sauce a réduit.","Ajoutez les pois chiches et un peu\r\nassaisonner, puis cuire encore 1 min.\r\nRetirez du feu puis versez les épinards\r\net laissez la chaleur de la poêle flétrir le\r\nfeuilles. Assaisonnez, ajoutez le jus de citron et\r\nservir avec du riz basmati."]','2026-01-11 00:12:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11660,4839,'fr','Piment aux haricots et au poivre','Utilisez les légumineuses de votre choix dans ce plat végétarien sain','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","350 g de poivrons épépinés et tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de piment","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika doux fumé","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges à la sauce chili","Boîte de 400 g de haricots mélangés, égouttés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","riz, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajoutez le\r\noignon et poivrons, et cuire 8 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez les épices et\r\ncuire 1 min.","Versez les haricots et les tomates, apportez\r\nporter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 15 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce que le piment épaississe. Assaisonner et\r\nservir avec du riz, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11661,4841,'fr','Brochettes d''agneau et de poivre harissa','Rehaussez l’agneau d’épices marocaines pour un dîner spécial après le travail – il est également faible en gras','["2 cuillères à soupe de pâte d''harissa","400 g de steak d''agneau débarrassé du gras et coupé en morceaux","2 poivrons rouges, coupés en gros morceaux","2 oignons rouges, chacun coupé en 8 quartiers jusqu''à la racine pour que les quartiers ne se désagrègent pas","250 g de couscous aromatisé ou nature","PLUS 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Faites chauffer le gril. Dans un grand bol, mélanger\r\nla harissa avec l''huile, puis versez-y le\r\nagneau, poivrons et oignons. Ajoutez-en\r\nsalez, poivrez et mélangez le tout\r\nensemble pour bien enrober.","Enfiler l''agneau, les poivrons et\r\noignons uniformément sur 8 brochettes et\r\ndéposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Gratter\r\nles restes de marinade.","Griller pendant 8 à 10 minutes en retournant fréquemment\r\net arroser avec l''un des jus qui\r\ns''enfuir. Pendant ce temps, préparez le\r\ncouscous en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.\r\nRépartissez le couscous dans 4 assiettes,\r\ngarnir de quelques brochettes chacune et\r\narroser du jus de cuisson."]','2026-01-11 00:12:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11662,4843,'fr','Ragoût de quinoa à la courge, aux pruneaux et à la grenade','Obtenez une dose de fer et de protéines grâce à cette cocotte de courge saine, pleine de texture et de saveur.','["1 petite courge musquée, épépinée et coupée en cubes","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, tranché finement","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement haché","1 cuillère à café de ras-el-hanout ou de mélange d''épices du Moyen-Orient","200 g de quinoa","5 pruneaux hachés grossièrement","jus d''1 citron","600 ml de bouillon de légumes","graines d''1 grenade","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMettez la courge sur une plaque à pâtisserie et\r\nmélanger avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Bien assaisonner\r\net rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans\r\nune grande casserole. Ajouter l''oignon, l''ail\r\net le gingembre, assaisonner et cuire 10 min.\r\nAjouter les épices et le quinoa et cuire pendant\r\nencore quelques minutes. Ajoutez les pruneaux,\r\nle jus de citron et le bouillon, porter à ébullition,\r\npuis couvrez et laissez mijoter 25 minutes.","Quand tout est tendre, remuez le\r\nécraser le ragoût. Verser dans\r\nbols et parsemer de grenade\r\ngraines et menthe pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11663,4845,'fr','Citrouille au piment et légumes asiatiques','Ce plat de courge rôtie aux cinq épices est sain et simple – le souper parfait en milieu de semaine','["1 petite citrouille ou ½ courge musquée, coupée en morceaux (épépines enlevées), pas besoin de la peler","2 cuillères à café d''huile de tournesol ou végétale","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux et de poudre de cinq épices","175 g de brocoli à tige fine","175 g de bok choi coupé en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja faible en sodium","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 citron vert, ½ jus, ½ coupé en quartiers","quelques feuilles de coriandre"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7. Remuer\r\nle potiron dans l''huile, puis saupoudrer sur le\r\npoudre de chili, cinq épices, 1 cuillère à café de poivre noir\r\net une pincée de sel, et bien mélanger. Basculer dans un\r\nplaque à rôtir en une seule couche et cuire pendant\r\n25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à\r\ncaraméliser sur les bords.","Environ 5 minutes avant le potiron\r\nest cuit, faites chauffer un wok ou une grande poêle\r\net ajoutez le brocoli et 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau.\r\nCuire 2-3 minutes, puis ajouter\r\nle bok choi, soja, vinaigre et miel, et\r\ncuire encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient\r\ntendre. Ajoutez le jus de citron vert, puis divisez\r\nentre 2 assiettes avec le potiron,\r\nfeuilles de coriandre et quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:12:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11664,4851,'fr','One-pot italien de bar et fruits de mer','Un ragoût de poisson avec des crustacés et toutes les saveurs fraîches de la Méditerranée – à servir avec beaucoup de pain pour tremper','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 bulbe de fenouil, coupé en deux et tranché, frondes séparées pour la garniture","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","½ piment rouge, haché","250 g de calamars nettoyés, coupés en rondelles","bouquet de basilic, feuilles et tiges séparées, tiges liées ensemble, feuilles grossièrement hachées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","150 ml de vin blanc","2 grosses poignées de moules ou de palourdes","8 grosses crevettes crues (toutes sont les plus belles)","4 filets de bar (environ 140 g chacun)","pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole avec un\r\ncouvercle hermétique, puis ajoutez le fenouil, l''ail\r\net du piment. Faites frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, puis ajoutez le\r\ncalamars, tiges de basilic, tomates et vin.\r\nLaisser mijoter à feu doux pendant 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles calamars sont tendres et la sauce a\r\nlégèrement épaissi, puis assaisonner.","Répartir les moules et les crevettes\r\nla sauce, déposer les filets de bar dessus\r\nrecouvrir, couvrir, augmenter le feu et cuire\r\ndur pendant 5 minutes. Servir parsemé de\r\nles feuilles de basilic et les frondes de fenouil,\r\navec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:12:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11665,4853,'fr','Soupe végétalienne aux poireaux et pommes de terre','Essayez cette version végétale et sans produits laitiers de la soupe classique aux poireaux et aux pommes de terre. Idéal pour un déjeuner ou une entrée, garnir de ciboulette hachée et déguster avec du pain croustillant','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza, plus un filet pour servir (facultatif)","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées","500 g de poireaux émincés","500 g de pommes de terre coupées en cubes","500 ml de bouillon de légumes végétalien, préparé avec 1½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon","500 ml de lait d''amande non sucré","ciboulette hachée et pain, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''ail et les poireaux en remuant jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à ramollir. Ajouter les pommes de terre et le bouillon, puis couvrir et laisser mijoter 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les poireaux et les pommes de terre soient tendres.","Versez le lait d''amande, puis retirez du feu et mixez à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une texture presque lisse et légèrement épaisse. Ou, si vous préférez, mixez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement lisse. Réchauffez à feu doux si nécessaire, puis versez dans des bols et parsemez de ciboulette, arrosez d''un peu d''huile et servez avec du pain, si vous le souhaitez. Peut être congelé jusqu''à trois mois."]','2026-01-11 00:12:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11666,4857,'fr','Burgers et salade de chou du lundi soir','Asseyez-vous pour un dîner facile en semaine composé de hamburgers végétaliens grillés servis avec une salade de carottes et de chou. Nous avons utilisé les hamburgers sans viande Tesco Plant Chef pour un repas rapide, prêt en seulement 20 minutes.','["2 hamburgers sans viande Tesco Plant Chef","2 pains à burger, fendus","1 grosse tomate de vigne, tranchée","une petite poignée de roquette ou d''épinards","¼ de chou (blanc, rouge, chou-fleur ou verdure printanière), tranché finement","1 carotte, râpée","½ oignon rouge, finement tranché","4 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise végétalienne, plus un peu pour servir","un filet de jus de citron","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","une petite poignée de ciboulette, de persil ou de coriandre finement hachée"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen-vif. Mettez les hamburgers sans viande Tesco Plant Chef sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les griller pendant 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Faites griller les petits pains, côté coupé vers le haut, à côté des hamburgers sur le plateau pendant 2-3 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les ingrédients de la salade de chou avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Goûtez et ajoutez un peu plus de citron ou de moutarde, si vous le souhaitez.","Étalez un peu de mayonnaise sur les fonds de pains burger, ajoutez une tranche de tomate et un burger. Ajoutez une cuillerée de salade de chou. Garnir de roquette ou d’épinards et ajouter les couvercles du burger. Servir avec le reste de la salade de chou à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:12:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11667,4861,'fr','Brochettes de crevettes miso et salade de riz végétarien','Pour une nouvelle façon avec les crevettes, marinez-les au soja, servez-les en brochettes et accompagnez-les de basmati sains.','["200 g de riz basmati brun","175g mange tout","200 g de graines de soja surgelées","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","une grosse poignée de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","1 piment vert, finement coupé","400 g de grosses crevettes crues décortiquées","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso sucrée (vous la trouverez avec les ingrédients japonais. Nous avons utilisé du miso blanc Clearspring)","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de riz japonais","2 cuillères à café de cassonade molle"]','["Placer le riz brun dans une poêle avec beaucoup\r\nd''eau froide. Porter à ébullition et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 20-25 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté. Pendant ce temps,\r\ntremper les brochettes en bois dans un peu de froid\r\nde l''eau (pour éviter qu''ils ne brûlent). Ajoutez le\r\nmange-tout et graines de soja au riz pour\r\nles 5 dernières minutes de cuisson. Rincer sous\r\neau froide, en égouttant soigneusement.","Mélangez le riz avec l''huile de sésame et\r\nmélanger dans un grand bol avec le ressort\r\noignons, coriandre, piment et assaisonnement.","Faites chauffer un gril. Placer la brochette\r\ningrédients dans un bol avec quelques moutures de\r\npoivre noir. Remuez bien tout,\r\nen veillant à ce que les crevettes soient bien enrobées.\r\nEnfiler les crevettes sur les brochettes et déposer\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie. Griller pour quelques\r\nminutes de chaque côté, en les retournant, jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient\r\nbien cuit. Servir avec la salade de riz\r\net arroser du jus de cuisson."]','2026-01-11 00:12:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11668,4863,'fr','Fenouil grillé avec vinaigrette aux olives noires','Tranchez le fenouil et faites-le griller comme base d''une salade garnie d''olives Kalamata, de persil, de basilic et d''ail.','["2 bulbes de fenouil, coupés dans le sens de la longueur en morceaux de 1 cm d''épaisseur","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe d''olives noires Kalamata finement hachées","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","jus d''1 citron","une petite poignée de persil et de basilic, finement hachés"]','["Faites chauffer un barbecue ou une poêle à frire. Jetez le\r\nfenouil dans 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile, bien enrober.\r\nCuire 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce que\r\nbrun doré et carbonisé.","Pour faire la vinaigrette, mettez les olives,\r\nail, jus de citron et reste de l''huile\r\ndans un bol. Ajoutez les herbes hachées et\r\ncombiner. Disposez le fenouil sur une assiette\r\net verser sur la vinaigrette. Mangez chaud\r\nou à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:12:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11669,4867,'fr','Salade de pastèque, crevettes et avocat','Trop chaud pour cuisiner ? Cette salade super saine constitue un déjeuner ou une entrée légère et rafraîchissante.','["1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 petit piment rouge finement haché","jus 1 citron vert","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz ou de vin blanc","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","quartier de pastèque, épépiné et coupé en dés","1 avocat, coupé en dés","petit bouquet de feuilles de coriandre hachées","200 g de crevettes tigrées cuites, décongelées si congelées"]','["Mettez l''oignon dans un bol moyen avec\r\nl''ail, le piment, le jus de citron vert, le vinaigre, le sucre\r\net un peu d''assaisonnement. Laisser mariner\r\npendant 10 minutes.","Ajoutez la pastèque,\r\navocat, coriandre et crevettes, puis\r\nmélanger doucement pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11670,4869,'fr','Tajine 5 par jour','Obtenez votre quota de légumes de la journée en une seule fois. Idéal pour nourrir un groupe ou congeler des portions','["4 carottes, coupées en morceaux","4 petits panais ou 3 gros, coupés en morceaux","3 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu, paprika, cannelle et poudre de piment doux","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 petites poignées d''abricots secs tendres","2 cuillères à café de miel"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Disperser\r\nles légumes sur quelques plaques à pâtisserie, arroser\r\navec la moitié de l''huile, assaisonner, puis frotter l''huile\r\nles légumes avec vos mains pour les enrober. Rôti pour\r\n30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à dorer.","Pendant ce temps, faites revenir les épices dans le reste de l''huile.\r\npendant 1 min – ils devraient grésiller et commencer à sentir\r\naromatique. Versez les tomates, les abricots, le miel\r\net un bidon d''eau. Laisser mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla sauce est légèrement réduite et les abricots\r\ndodu, puis incorporez les légumes et un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nServir avec du couscous ou des pommes de terre en chemise."]','2026-01-11 00:12:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11671,4872,'fr','Pilaf de légumes épicés','Obtenez quatre de vos cinq par jour dans un bol coloré. Variez les légumes selon la saison','["6 carottes, coupées en 6 à 8 quartiers dans le sens de la longueur","3 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","4 gousses de cardamome","1 bâton de cannelle","200 g de riz basmati brun rincé","400 ml de bouillon de légumes","Boîte de 400 g de lentilles dorées, rincées et égouttées","200 g de bébés épinards","une poignée d''amandes effilées grillées ou quelques amandes entières (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDans l''eau bouillante, faites cuire les carottes 4 min,\r\nverser des oignons pendant la dernière minute de\r\ncuisine. Égoutter et mélanger dans un plat à rôtir\r\navec 4 cuillères à café d''huile, le cumin et l''assaisonnement.\r\nFaites rôtir 30 minutes pendant que vous faites cuire le riz.","Faites chauffer les 2 cuillères à café d''huile restantes dans une grande poêle.\r\nAjouter la cardamome et la cannelle pendant 30 secondes,\r\npuis ajoutez le riz et faites griller pendant 1 min. Verser\r\nsur du bouillon et 100 ml d''eau, puis laisser mijoter,\r\ncouvert, pendant 25 à 30 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le riz soit\r\ntendre et l''eau absorbée. Supprimer\r\ncannelle et cardamome.","Ajoutez les lentilles et passez-les à la fourchette avant\r\ngarnir d''épinards. Remettez le couvercle et\r\ncuire à feu doux, en remuant une fois, jusqu''à ce que\r\nles épinards sont fanés et les lentilles chauffées\r\nà travers. Traversez à nouveau avant\r\nrenverser les légumes rôtis au cumin sur le\r\ngarnir et saupoudrer d''amandes, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:12:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11672,4874,'fr','Soupe minestrone en morceaux','La solution parfaite pour une nuit froide à la maison ? Un bol réchauffant de cette soupe épaisse faite maison.','["3 grosses carottes, hachées grossièrement","1 gros oignon, haché grossièrement","4 branches de céleri, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 grosses pommes de terre, coupées en petits dés","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2l de bouillon de légumes","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400g de boîte de beurre ou de haricots cannellini","140 g de spaghettis coupés en petits morceaux","1 ou 2 têtes de chou de Milan, râpées","pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Au robot culinaire, mixer les carottes,\r\nl''oignon et le céleri en petits morceaux. Chauffer le\r\nhuile dans une poêle, ajoutez les légumes transformés,\r\nl''ail et les pommes de terre, puis cuire à feu vif\r\nchauffer pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Incorporer la purée de tomates, le bouillon et\r\ntomates. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez\r\nChauffer le feu et laisser mijoter à couvert pendant 10 minutes.","Versez les haricots et les pâtes, puis faites cuire pendant\r\nencore 10 minutes, en ajoutant le chou pendant\r\nles 2 dernières minutes. Assaisonner au goût et servir\r\navec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:12:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11673,4876,'fr','Salade tiède de chou-fleur','Le chou-fleur est souvent négligé, mais essayez-le rôti dans cette salade d''hiver pour une assiette de délices croquants.','["1 chou-fleur, cassé en fleurons","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, tranché finement","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","1½ cuillère à soupe de miel","3 cuillères à soupe de raisins secs","petit bouquet d''aneth, ciselé","3 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées grillées","50 g de pousses d''épinards"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMélangez le chou-fleur avec l''huile d''olive,\r\nassaisonner et rôtir 15 min. Incorporer\r\nl''oignon rouge et continuer à rôtir\r\npendant 15 à 20 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à tendreté.","Pendant que le chou-fleur rôtit,\r\nmélanger le vinaigre, le miel et les raisins secs\r\navec un peu d''assaisonnement.","Lorsque le chou-fleur est cuit, remuez\r\ndans la vinaigrette, aneth, amandes et\r\nles épinards et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11674,4878,'fr','Salade de haricots et riz sauvage','Cherchez dans votre placard des légumineuses et du maïs doux pour former la base de cet accompagnement simple avec une vinaigrette chaude et sucrée.','["375g de mélange de riz, nous avons utilisé du riz basmati brun et du riz sauvage","2 boîtes de 400 g de mélange de haricots égouttés et rincés","Boîte de 340 g de maïs doux égoutté","1 petit oignon rouge, finement tranché","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en dés","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","2 cuillères à café de miel","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement tranché","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.\r\nUne fois cuit, rincer sous l''eau froide\r\npour se rafraîchir. Une fois froid, mélanger dans un\r\nbol avec les haricots, le maïs doux, l''oignon\r\net poivrons rouges.","Mélangez le zeste et le jus du citron vert, le miel et\r\npiment. Versez sur le mélange de riz et mélangez\r\neh bien, puis assaisonnez au goût. Remuer\r\nla coriandre part juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11675,4880,'fr','Couscous aux bijoux','Servez vos céréales avec du concombre, de l''abricot, des poivrons, des olives et des tomates, puis arrosez d''huile infusée au citron pour une finition moelleuse.','["400 g de couscous","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile infusée au citron","500 g d''abricots secs mous, hachés","1 concombre épépiné et haché","1 gros poivron jaune, épépiné et haché","140 g d''olives noires dénoyautées et hachées","140 g de tomates séchées hachées","petit bouquet de persil haché","12 tomates cerises, coupées en deux"]','["Placer le couscous dans un bol et couvrir\r\navec 700 ml d''eau bouillante. Couvrir de film alimentaire\r\nfilmer et laisser reposer 10 min, jusqu''à ce que tout\r\nle liquide a été absorbé.","Versez dessus l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement,\r\nmélanger et gonfler le couscous avec une fourchette.","Incorporer délicatement le reste\r\ningrédients et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11676,4882,'fr','Salade de céleri et boulgour aux herbes','Cette salade rapide se conserve quelques jours au réfrigérateur – un excellent déjeuner ou une collation saine à avoir sous la main.','["200 g de blé boulgour","1 botte de céleri","1 pomme dessert","jus d''1 citron","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","une poignée de noisettes grillées, hachées grossièrement","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","grosse poignée de graines de grenade","petit bouquet de persil haché","petit bouquet de menthe hachée","petit bouquet d''estragon, haché"]','["Mettez le boulghar dans un grand\r\nbol et couvrir simplement d’eau bouillante.\r\nCouvrir le bol d''un film alimentaire et laisser\r\npendant 30 minutes pour absorber toute l''eau.","Pendant ce temps, séparez les bâtonnets de\r\ncéleri et réserver les feuilles. Très\r\ntrancher finement le céleri et le hacher grossièrement\r\nles feuilles. Coupez la pomme en fins\r\nallumettes et incorporer un peu de citron\r\njus. Dans un bol, mélangez le reste\r\ndu jus de citron avec l''huile et un peu\r\nassaisonnement pour faire une vinaigrette.","Remuez délicatement le boulghar avec une fourchette.\r\nMélangez les tranches de céleri et de pomme.\r\nle boulghar, suivi des noix, du piment,\r\ngraines de grenade et herbes. Bruine\r\nsur la vinaigrette et mélangez le tout\r\nensemble doucement. Parsemer de céleri\r\nfeuilles et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11677,4888,'fr','Salade croquante de crevettes et de nouilles','Une vibrante salade de fruits de mer de style vietnamien avec coriandre, carottes et oignons nouveaux','["100 g de nouilles de riz","2 petites carottes, coupées en fines allumettes","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","une petite poignée de coriandre et de menthe, hachées","140 g de crevettes cuites au piment, citron vert et coriandre (nous avons utilisé Waitrose)","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja réduite en sel","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","2 cuillères à café de cassonade légère et molle","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert"]','["Faire tremper les nouilles dans l''eau bouillante\r\nen suivant les instructions de l''emballage. Vidanger\r\net passez-le sous l''eau froide jusqu''à refroidissement, puis\r\nbien égoutter à nouveau. Mélangez les nouilles avec\r\nles carottes, les oignons nouveaux, la coriandre,\r\nmenthe et crevettes.","Dans un petit bol, fouetter le reste\r\ningrédients ensemble, verser sur le\r\nsalade de nouilles et bien mélanger pour enrober.\r\nConserver dans des contenants jusqu''au moment de manger."]','2026-01-11 00:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11678,4890,'fr','Salade de crevettes, grenade et pamplemousse','Oubliez les croûtons de pain et une vinaigrette à la crème épaisse et servez plutôt une salade croustillante et fruitée avec des crustacés.','["2 pamplemousses roses, le zeste et le jus de l''un, les segments coupés de l''autre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe d''aneth haché","300 g de crevettes cuites et décortiquées","½ concombre, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur, les graines vidées avec une cuillère à café, coupées en dés","2 échalotes, hachées finement","2 handfuls frisée, torn","2 poignées de fusée","100 g de graines de grenade"]','["Mélanger le zeste de pamplemousse\r\net jus, huile, vinaigre, sucre et aneth\r\nfaire un pansement. Mélangez la moitié avec le\r\ncrevettes et laisser mariner 10 min.","Juste avant de servir, mélangez délicatement le\r\nconcombre, échalotes, frisée et roquette\r\navec le reste de la vinaigrette. Ajouter une pile\r\nà chacune des 6 assiettes de départ, avec le\r\ncrevettes et quartiers de pamplemousse. Dispersion\r\nsur les graines de grenade et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11679,4892,'fr','Soupe de courge au curry, lentilles et noix de coco','Aromatisez la courge musquée avec des épices indiennes pour cette soupe végétarienne réchauffante et saine','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 courge musquée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en dés","200 g de carottes coupées en dés","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry contenant du curcuma","100 g de lentilles rouges","700 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 boîte de lait de coco allégé","coriandre et pain naan, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole, ajoutez\r\nla courge et les carottes, grésiller 1 min,\r\npuis incorporez la poudre de curry et faites cuire\r\npendant 1 minute de plus. Versez les lentilles, le\r\nbouillon de légumes et lait de coco\r\net remuez bien le tout. Apportez\r\nporter à ébullition, puis baisser le feu\r\net laisser mijoter pendant 15 à 18 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ntout est tendre.","Au mixeur plongeant ou dans un aliment\r\nprocesseur, mixez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit aussi lisse que vous\r\ncomme. Assaisonner et servir parsemé de\r\ncoriandre hachée grossièrement et un peu\r\ndu pain naan à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11680,4894,'fr','Salade de pâtes au thon, câpres et vinaigrette balsamique','Actualisez la salade de pâtes au thon en sautant la mayonnaise et en ajoutant du vinaigre balsamique, de l''huile d''olive, des tomates colorées et du céleri.','["350 g de pâtes orecchiettes","Pot de 225 g de thon approuvé par le MSC dans de l''eau de source, égoutté","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, égouttées","15 piments Peppadew en pot, hachés","1 cœur de céleri, tranché","140 g de tomates cerises jaunes, rouges ou un mélange, coupées en deux","75 ml de vinaigre balsamique","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","Sachet de 100 g de feuilles de roquette","une bonne poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Cuire les pâtes suivant le pack\r\ninstructions, puis égouttez et rincez à froid\r\nl''eau. Après avoir égoutté à nouveau, transférez-le dans un\r\ngrand bol. Ajouter le reste des ingrédients\r\nsauf le basilic, bien assaisonner et mélanger\r\ncombiner. Parsemer de basilic et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11681,4896,'fr','Soupe épicée aux carottes et aux lentilles','Un mélange délicieux et épicé, riche en fer et faible en gras. Il est prêt en moins d''une demi-heure ou peut être préparé dans une mijoteuse','["2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","pincée de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","600 g de carottes lavées et râpées grossièrement (pas besoin de les éplucher)","140 g de lentilles rouges cassées","1 l de bouillon de légumes chaud (en cube, c''est bien)","125 ml de lait","yaourt nature et pain naan, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer une grande casserole et faites frire à sec les graines de cumin et les flocons de piment pendant 1 min, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits.\r\ncommencent à sauter dans la poêle et à libérer leurs arômes. Retirez environ la moitié des graines avec\r\nune cuillère et réserver. Ajouter l''huile, la carotte, les lentilles, le bouillon et le lait dans la poêle et porter à ébullition. Laisser mijoter 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient gonflées et ramollies.","Mixez la soupe avec un mixeur plongeant ou dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse (ou laissez-la en morceaux si vous préférez). Assaisonnez au goût et terminez avec une cuillerée de yaourt et une pincée des épices grillées réservées. Servir avec des pains naan chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:12:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11682,4899,'fr','Houmous aux marrons','Préparez du houmous festif en utilisant des châtaignes à la place des pois chiches habituels. Servir avec des crudités pour une entrée de Noël facile, une collation ou un ajout au buffet','["180 g de marrons cuits sous vide","1 citron, jus","1 gousse d''ail","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","chips pitta et crudités de légumes, pour servir"]','["Prenez une châtaigne du paquet et réservez-la. Versez le reste des châtaignes dans un blender ou un smoothie maker avec le jus de citron, l''ail, l''huile et un peu d''eau fraîchement bouillie de la bouilloire. Saison. Réduire en purée lisse, puis verser dans un bol ou étaler sur quatre assiettes.","Râpez finement sur la châtaigne réservée, puis servez avec des chips pitta et des crudités de légumes."]','2026-01-11 00:12:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11683,4901,'fr','Truffes végétaliennes','Préparez ces magnifiques truffes végétaliennes comme collation ou comme cadeau comestible pour la famille et les amis. Ils sont faits de chocolat sans produits laitiers et de lait végétal','["200 g de chocolat noir sans produits laitiers, haché finement","100 ml de lait végétal (nous avons utilisé de l''avoine)","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre"]','["Mettez le chocolat dans un bol moyen résistant à la chaleur. Versez le lait, le sucre et la vanille dans une petite casserole, puis portez à ébullition à feu moyen en remuant de temps en temps.","Versez le mélange de lait chaud sur le chocolat, laissez reposer 1 min, puis remuez jusqu''à ce que le chocolat soit fondu et que le mélange soit lisse. Couvrir et réfrigérer pendant 4 heures jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris.","Roulez des cuillères à café du mélange en boules avec vos mains, puis transférez-les sur une petite plaque à pâtisserie ou une assiette – vous aimerez peut-être porter des gants. Vous devriez avoir environ 20 balles.","Mettez la poudre de cacao sur une assiette peu profonde et roulez-y les truffes réfrigérées jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien enrobées, en tapotant l''excédent si nécessaire. Réfrigérez jusqu''à ce que vous soyez prêt à offrir. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à quatre jours."]','2026-01-11 00:12:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11684,4903,'fr','Crackers indiens épicés (mathri)','Préparez un lot de ces collations indiennes croustillantes assaisonnées de cumin, puis dégustez-les avec une cuillerée de votre cornichon indien préféré et une tasse de masala chai.','["100 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de sel fin","¾ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de grains de poivre noir concassés","15 g de ghee, fondu et refroidi","huile végétale ou de tournesol pour rouler et frire","cornichon indien, pour servir"]','["Tamisez la farine et le sel dans un bol, puis incorporez les graines de cumin et les grains de poivre.","Ajoutez le ghee refroidi (mais toujours liquide) aux ingrédients secs et mélangez du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure grossière.","Mélangez environ 2 à 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide pour obtenir une pâte ferme, puis pétrissez pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse. Couvrir et laisser reposer 20 minutes à température ambiante.","Pétrissez la pâte reposée pendant 1 min, puis divisez-la en 15 portions (pesez pour être précis si vous le souhaitez – chaque portion doit faire environ 10 g). Roulez chaque portion en boule de la taille d''une bille et couvrez-la d''un chiffon pendant que vous travaillez pour éviter qu''elle ne se dessèche.","Étalez chaque boule sur une surface légèrement huilée en un disque de 4 cm qui a à peu près l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 20 pence. Piquez partout à l''aide d''une fourchette pour empêcher les mathri de gonfler pendant la cuisson.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans l''awkor karahi à feu moyen, en veillant à ce qu''elle ne soit pas remplie à plus des deux tiers, à 130°C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain dore en 1 min. En travaillant par lots, abaissez le mathri dans l''huile à l''aide d''une écumoire plate. Baissez le feu et faites cuire les mathri pendant 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et laisser refroidir. Se conserve dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à deux semaines. Garnir le mathri de cornichon indien et servir à température ambiante avec du masala chai."]','2026-01-11 00:12:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11685,4905,'fr','Gâteau aux carottes sans sucre','Ce gâteau aux carottes sans produits laitiers et sans sucre utilise du xylitol naturel pour le sucrer et est très simple à réaliser.','["100 g de noix de pécan","140 g de farine autolevante tamisée","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","140g de xylitol (voir astuce ci-dessous)","2 gros œufs (à température ambiante)","140 ml d''huile de colza","175 g de carottes râpées","100 g de raisins secs","un filet de sirop d''agave (facultatif)"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/thermostat 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake rond de 18 cm de papier sulfurisé. Réservez 12 noix de pécan et hachez grossièrement le reste.","Dans un grand bol, mélanger la farine, la cannelle, le bicarbonate de soude, le xylitol et les noix de pécan hachées.","Dans un bol ou un pichet séparé, battre ensemble les œufs et l''huile de colza. Verser dans le mélange de farine et remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer les carottes et les raisins secs. Verser dans le moule tapissé, lisser la surface et presser les noix de pécan entières pour former un cercle sur le pourtour.","Cuire pendant 1 heure à 1 heure 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit élastique au toucher et qu''un cure-dent inséré dans le gâteau en ressorte propre. Vérifiez après 50 minutes, si le gâteau devient trop foncé, couvrez-le légèrement de papier d''aluminium. Laisser refroidir sur une grille pendant 10 minutes, puis démouler et laisser refroidir. Servir légèrement tiède ou froid. Ce gâteau se conserve jusqu''à cinq jours dans un moule. Avant de servir, arrosez de sirop d''agave si vous aimez le sucré."]','2026-01-11 00:12:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11686,4907,'fr','Trempette de patate douce avec trempettes de chorizo ​​et de chicorée','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans','["2 grosses patates douces","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","une petite poignée de coriandre ou de persil haché, plus un peu pour servir","250 g de mini-saucisses chorizo ​​à cuire (pour les régimes particuliers, voir conseil ci-dessous)","quelques têtes de chicorée rouge et blanche, feuilles séparées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Mettre\r\nles pommes de terre sur une plaque à pâtisserie et enfourner\r\npendant 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit vraiment tendre. Laisser refroidir.","Versez la chair de la pomme de terre dans un aliment\r\nprocesseur, en jetant les peaux. Ajouter\r\nl''huile, le paprika, le vinaigre, la coriandre ou\r\npersil et un peu d''assaisonnement et assaisonner\r\nune pâte lisse. Transférer dans un bol, couvrir\r\navec un film alimentaire et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Le\r\nla trempette se conserve 2 jours au réfrigérateur – juste\r\nramener à température ambiante avant de servir.","Cuire le chorizo dans une petite poêle\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Vidanger\r\nsur du papier absorbant. Parsemer un peu de coriandre\r\nou du persil sur la trempette et servir avec le\r\nfeuilles de chorizo et de chicorée pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:12:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11687,4909,'fr','Pépites énergétiques aux fruits secs','Donnez un véritable boost à votre niveau d''énergie avec ces bouchées de fruits saines et équilibrées sur le plan nutritionnel.','["50 g d''abricots secs tendres","100 g de dattes séchées tendres","50g de cerises séchées","2 cuillères à café d''huile de coco","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Mélangez les abricots avec\r\ndates et\r\ncerises dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce que très\r\nfinement haché. Versez dans un bol et utilisez\r\nvos mains pour travailler dans l''huile de coco.\r\nFaçonnez le mélange en boules de la taille d''une noix,\r\npuis rouler dans le sésame\r\ngraines. Conserver dans un contenant hermétique\r\njusqu''à ce que vous ayez besoin d''une solution énergétique rapide."]','2026-01-11 00:12:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11688,4911,'fr','Noix sucrées et épicées','Amandes rôties, noix du Brésil et noix de cajou aux saveurs épicées, puis emballées dans des sacs comme cadeau fait maison','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","400 g de mélange de noix, essayez les amandes, les noix du Brésil et les noix de cajou","2 cuillères à soupe de miel"]','["Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1. Mélanger l''huile avec les épices, puis incorporer les noix et arroser de la moitié du miel. Étalez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et laissez cuire 10 min.","Retirer du four et arroser du reste de miel, puis remettre au four et cuire encore 10 minutes. Laisser refroidir complètement."]','2026-01-11 00:12:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11689,4913,'fr','Trempette épicée aux haricots et au maïs','Transformez les aliments de base du maïs doux en conserve, des haricots rouges et des haricots mélangés en quelque chose de spécial','["Boîte de 395 g de haricots rouges à la sauce chili","Boîte de 400 g de haricots mélangés, égouttés","Boîte de 326 g de maïs doux, égoutté","petit oignon rouge, haché","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","350 g de bâtonnets de légumes et chips tortilla, pour servir"]','["Au robot culinaire, mixer les trois quarts\r\ndes haricots rouges et\r\nla moitié des haricots mélangés jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nVersez dans un bol et ajoutez le reste\r\ningrédients avec un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nServir avec des bâtonnets de légumes croquants\r\net des chips tortilla pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:12:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11690,4915,'fr','Très bon guacamole','De gros avocats, un peu de piment et un soupçon de citron vert ne manqueront pas de faire un guacamole fantastique.','["petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de piments jalapeño d''un bocal, égouttés et finement hachés","jus de 2 citrons verts, ou au goût","4 avocats"]','["Dans un bol moyen, mélanger la coriandre, l''ail et les jalapeños avec le jus de citron vert. Épluchez, dénoyautez et écrasez grossièrement les avocats au presse-purée, ajoutez-les dans le bol avec les autres ingrédients et un peu d''assaisonnement, et servez avec les fajitas ou avec quelques chips tortilla pour commencer."]','2026-01-11 00:12:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11691,4919,'fr','Mélange de graines aux épices chinoises','Grignotez ces amuse-gueules gourmands à base de tournesol et de citrouille, un choix plus sain pour une soirée devant la télévision','["1 blanc d''oeuf","2 cuillères à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","½ cuillère à café de sel","85 g chacun de graines de tournesol et de citrouille"]','["Chauffer le four à 150C/130C ventilateur/gaz 2. Légèrement\r\nfouetter le blanc d''oeuf, puis ajouter\r\nCinq épices chinoises et sel. Ajouter le tournesol et la citrouille\r\ngraines et bien enrober. Étalé dans un\r\nune seule couche sur une plaque à pâtisserie légèrement huilée\r\net enfourner 12 min. Laisser refroidir avant de manger."]','2026-01-11 00:12:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11692,4921,'fr','Houmous de légumes grillés avec trempettes','Frappez 3 de vos 5 par jour avec cette trempette aux pois chiches et crudités – parfaite pour un déjeuner ou une collation rapide','["350 g de légumes grillés surgelés, décongelés","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","jus ½ citron","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","2 pains pitta complets, grillés et tranchés","100 g de radis lavés","2 carottes, coupées en bâtonnets","3 branches de céleri, coupées en bâtonnets"]','["Inclinez les légumes, la plupart\r\npois chiches, ail et jus de citron dans\r\nle bol d''un robot culinaire avec un peu\r\nassaisonner, puis fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Mettez le houmous dans un bol de service.\r\nRépartir sur les pois chiches réservés et\r\nl''huile d''olive. Servir avec du pitta grillé\r\ntranches et les légumes à tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:12:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11693,4923,'fr','Pâté de lentilles rouges et patate douce','La trempette végétarienne de Rosie Clewlow est une alternative saine au houmous et excellente avec des crudités dans une boîte à lunch','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","½ oignon, finement haché","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé, plus un petit supplément","1 petite patate douce, pelée et coupée en dés","140 g de lentilles rouges","3 brins de thym, feuilles hachées, plus un peu plus pour décorer (facultatif)","500 ml de bouillon de légumes faible en sodium","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","pain pitta et bâtonnets de légumes, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez le\r\nl''oignon et cuire lentement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et\r\ndoré. Versez le paprika et laissez cuire pendant\r\nencore 2 minutes, puis ajoutez le sucré\r\npomme de terre, lentilles, thym et bouillon. Apportez\r\nlaisser mijoter, puis cuire 20 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce que la pomme de terre et les lentilles soient tendres.","Ajoutez le vinaigre et un peu d''assaisonnement,\r\net écrasez grossièrement le mélange jusqu''à ce que\r\nvous obtenez une texture que vous aimez. Mettre au frais 1h,\r\npuis arroser d''un filet d''huile d''olive, saupoudrer de\r\npaprika supplémentaire et saupoudrer de thym\r\ndes brins, si vous le souhaitez. Servir avec du pain pitta\r\net des bâtonnets de légumes."]','2026-01-11 00:12:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11694,4925,'fr','Frites maigres au four','Un simple accompagnement de chips maison n’est pas toujours mauvais pour la santé : cette version enrobe également les pommes de terre d’épices.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à café de semoule de maïs fine ou de polenta","½ cuillère à café de paprika","¼ cuillère à café de poudre d''ail","2 grosses pommes de terre, coupées en chips de 1 cm d''épaisseur"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nVersez l''huile sur une plaque à pâtisserie et mettez\r\nau four pendant 3 min. Mélangez la semoule de maïs\r\nou polenta, paprika et poudre d''ail\r\nensemble et assaisonner. Jetez les chips\r\ndans le mélange, puis verser sur la plaque. Secouer\r\nbien, puis laissez cuire 40 minutes en secouant\r\nà mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:12:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11695,4927,'fr','Tranches croustillantes d''ail et de romarin','Ces pommes de terre aux herbes méditerranéennes ont si bon goût qu’il est difficile de croire qu’elles sont faibles en gras','["4 grosses pommes de terre, tranchées finement","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 cuillère à soupe d''aiguilles de romarin"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen et laisser mijoter le\r\nles pommes de terre dans l''eau salée pendant 3 min.\r\nBien égoutter, verser dans un plat allant au four peu profond\r\nplateau, puis mélanger délicatement avec l''huile, l''ail,\r\nromarin et assaisonnement. Étaler\r\nen une seule couche et griller pendant 10-15 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:12:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11696,4929,'fr','Pots à salade de betteraves et pommes','Un peu comme une salade Waldorf, ces pots verts individuels avec des noix, du céleri et du persil sont parfaits pour une fête.','["250 g de betterave cuite, coupée en cubes de 1 cm","2 pommes coupées en cubes de 1 cm","2 branches de céleri, finement tranchées","50 g de noix hachées grossièrement","poignée de persil haché","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de noix","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge"]','["Mettez la betterave, les pommes, le céleri, les noix\r\net le persil dans un bol. Fouetter ensemble le\r\nde l''huile de noix, du vinaigre et un peu d''assaisonnement,\r\nverser sur la salade de betteraves et mélanger\r\neh bien. Répartir dans des petits verres ou\r\ntasses à thé et réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir. Peut être préparé jusqu''à 3 heures à l''avance."]','2026-01-11 00:12:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11697,4931,'fr','Sorbet litchi & gingembre','Ce dessert rafraîchissant à préparer à l''avance est une façon rafraîchissante de terminer un dîner sur le thème chinois.','["2 boîtes de 400g de litchis au sirop","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, tranché","1 blanc d''oeuf","2 morceaux de tige de gingembre au sirop, râpés et un peu de sirop pour servir"]','["Égoutter le sirop de deux boîtes de\r\nles litchis dans une petite casserole. Ajouter le sucre\r\net dissoudre à feu doux. Apportez\r\nporter à ébullition pendant 1 min. Blitz les égouttés\r\nlitchis, tranches de gingembre frais et litchi\r\nsirop dans un mélangeur jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très finement\r\nhaché. Passer au tamis. Astuce dans\r\nun récipient d''1 litre et congeler au moins\r\n6 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il soit solide.","Cassez le mélange surgelé, puis mettez-y un\r\nrobot culinaire. Versez le blanc d''oeuf et\r\nfouetter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit épais, pâle et lisse. Retour\r\ndans le récipient et congeler à nouveau, idéalement\r\npendant la nuit. Servir en boules avec des tranches de\r\ntige de gingembre et sirop versé dessus, avec des biscuits chinois ou de fins biscuits au beurre ou aux amandes."]','2026-01-11 00:12:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11698,4935,'fr','Quartiers de pommes de terre à la sauce curry','Cette sauce au curry crémeuse constitue un partenaire idéal pour accompagner des quartiers de pommes de terre croustillants.','["6 grosses pommes de terre au four","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry tikka masala","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","400 g de lait de coco allégé en boîte","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées (facultatif)","jus ½ citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Couper les pommes de terre en quartiers. Versez l''huile dans une grande rôtissoire (pas besoin de la peler), ajoutez-y les quartiers jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient entièrement recouverts, puis assaisonnez de poivre. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés.","Mettez la pâte de curry et le concentré de tomates dans une casserole, remuez bien et faites revenir 1 min. Ajoutez le lait de coco, portez à ébullition puis laissez mijoter doucement 10 min. Peut être congelé ou préparé jusqu''à la veille. Assaisonner au goût et terminer avec un filet de jus de citron et un peu de coriandre, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:12:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11699,4937,'fr','Popcorn sucré et épicé','Prête en moins de 10 minutes, cette collation est excellente à manger chaude ou conservée comme collation pour éviter la faim entre les repas.','["Sachet de 100 g de popcorn salé au micro-ondes","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''agave"]','["Faites cuire le pop-corn au micro-ondes selon les instructions sur le paquet. Verser dans un grand bol. Saupoudrer d''épices, puis verser sur le sirop d''agave. Remuer et servir chaud ou verser dans un sac et emporter au travail comme collation l''après-midi."]','2026-01-11 00:12:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11700,4939,'fr','Chips de pommes épicées','Gardez la sensation de faim à distance en grignotant des fruits secs sains – cette version prépare des Granny Smith à la cannelle','["2 Granny Smith","cannelle, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/thermostat 3. Évider la pomme et la couper à travers l''équateur en tranches très fines de 1 à 2 mm d''épaisseur. Saupoudrer de cannelle et déposer à plat sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé.","Cuire 45 min – 1 heure en retournant à mi-cuisson et en retirant les chips devenues brunes. Poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que les pommes soient sèches et légèrement dorées. Laisser refroidir, conserver dans un contenant hermétique et déguster comme collation."]','2026-01-11 00:12:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11701,4941,'fr','Pains plats aux graines','Pains de style marocain à la nigelle et aux graines de sésame, parfaits pour envelopper et tremper','["7 g de levure sèche en sachet","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","400 g de farine à pain blanche forte","200 g de farine à pain complète","huile, pour graisser","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de kalonji (également appelées graines d''oignon noir ou graines de nigelle)","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame"]','["Mélangez la levure avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau tiède\r\net le sucre, et laissez reposer quelques minutes. Astuce\r\nles farines dans un grand bol avec 1 cuillère à café de sel\r\net faites un puits au centre. Versez le\r\nmélange de levure et 500 ml d''eau tiède. Mélanger\r\navec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce qu''il vienne\r\nensemble comme une pâte, puis renverser sur un ouvrage\r\nsurface et pétrir pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse et élastique – ajoutez un petit plus\r\nfarine si la pâte est trop collante. Mettez le\r\npâte dans un bol huilé, recouvrir d''un thé\r\nserviette et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud\r\npendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Versez la pâte sur votre plan de travail\r\net assommez tout l''air. Pétrir les graines\r\ndans la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien répartie. Diviser\r\ncouper la pâte en 12 morceaux, puis étaler chacun\r\naussi finement que possible. Faites chauffer une grande poêle,\r\ncuire les pains plats pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\ndes bulles apparaissent à la surface, puis retournez\r\net laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Une fois tout\r\nsont cuits, enveloppez-les dans du papier aluminium et conservez-les\r\nà un jour. Mettez à four chaud pour réchauffer."]','2026-01-11 00:12:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11702,4943,'fr','Pizza sans lactose','Préparez une pizza familiale facile et garnissez-la de passata, de Grana Padano et de vos ingrédients préférés. Délicieux pour tous, idéal pour toute personne intolérante au lactose','["100 ml en purée","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","50 g de Grana Padano, 40 g finement râpé, 10 g râpés à l''éplucheur de légumes","petite poignée de câpres, olives dénoyautées, tranches de pepperoni ou jalapenos marinés (facultatif)","poignée de fusée","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","300 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","Sachet de 7g de levure à action rapide","1 cuillère à café de sel marin fin","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, et un peu plus pour le bol"]','["Pour réaliser la pâte à pizza, versez la farine dans un bol, mettez la levure d''un côté et le sel de l''autre. Faites un puits au centre et versez-y 200 ml d''eau tiède et l''huile d''olive. Mélangez avec vos mains pour former une pâte grossière, puis versez-la sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné et pétrissez pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse et élastique. Mettre dans un bol huilé, couvrir d''un torchon et laisser lever jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume, environ 1 h.","Chauffer le four à 240C/220C chaleur tournante/gaz 9 et mettre une plaque à pâtisserie à l''intérieur pour chauffer. Remettez la pâte dans le bol, puis divisez-la en deux boules. Pressez les boules de pâte en ronds plats sur un plan de travail fariné, puis roulez-les en fonds de pizza de 5 mm d''épaisseur et d''environ 25 cm de large. Transférer sur deux feuilles de papier sulfurisé.","Mélangez la passata, l''ail et l''origan dans un petit bol avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Versez la sauce sur les fonds en laissant un bord de 1 cm. Parsemer de Grana Padano finement râpé et de n''importe quelle garniture, si vous le souhaitez. Transférer les pizzas, cuites une à la fois, sur la plaque préchauffée recouverte du papier sulfurisé. Cuire au four 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les croûtes soient dorées et croustillantes. Répétez avec la pizza restante.","Garnir les pizzas de roquette et de copeaux de Grana Padano, puis arroser d''huile pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11703,4947,'fr','Bouillon de dinde','Tirez le meilleur parti de votre dinde en utilisant les os pour faire un bouillon. Il peut être conservé au congélateur pour être utilisé dans les soupes, les risottos et plus encore.','["1 carcasse de dinde, viande retirée","2 oignons, hachés","2 carottes, hachées","2 branches de céleri, hachées","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir","3 brins de thym","1 feuille de laurier"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients dans une grande marmite ou votre plus grande casserole et complétez avec 2 litres d''eau. Ajoutez plus d''eau pour couvrir tous les ingrédients si nécessaire.","Portez à ébullition à feu vif en écumant à l''aide d''une cuillère la mousse qui apparaît à la surface du liquide. Réduire à feu moyen, puis laisser mijoter à moitié couvert pendant 3 h – le bouillon aura réduit et concentré ses arômes. Ou, si vous préférez un bouillon plus léger, couvrez entièrement pendant que vous mijotez.","Éteignez le feu et laissez refroidir quelques minutes, puis filtrez délicatement dans un récipient ou un bol pour qu''il refroidisse complètement. Se conserve une semaine au réfrigérateur et trois mois au congélateur."]','2026-01-11 00:12:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11704,4949,'fr','Gâteau de Noël sans gluten','Préparez ce gâteau de Noël sans produits laitiers, sans gluten, sans noix et sans œufs. C''est un gâteau de fête pour tout le monde, et le meilleur, c''est que personne ne devinera jamais qu''il est exempt !','["150g de raisins secs","100 g de raisins secs","125g de groseilles","200 g de zestes confits mélangés","100 g de cerises glacées, coupées en deux","2 oranges, zestées et pressées","100 ml de cognac ou de thé noir, plus 4 cuillères à soupe","175 g de margarine sans produits laitiers, plus un peu pour la boîte","175 g de cassonade foncée","50g de mélasse","200 ml de lait de soja","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","400g de farine sans gluten","2 cuillères à café de gomme xanthane","¾ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","2 cuillères à café d''épices mélangées","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue"]','["La veille de la cuisson du gâteau, mélangez les raisins secs, les raisins secs, les groseilles, le mélange d''écorces confites, les cerises glacées, le jus d''orange et 100 ml de cognac dans un grand bol. Couvrir et laisser tremper toute la nuit.","Beurrer un moule à cake rond de 20 cm de diamètre et tapisser le fond et les côtés de papier sulfurisé. Battre la margarine, le sucre, la mélasse et le zeste d''orange dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et mousseuse. Incorporez progressivement le lait et le vinaigre (le mélange se divisera à ce stade, mais se reformera lorsque les ingrédients secs seront ajoutés, alors ne vous inquiétez pas). Mélangez la farine, la gomme xanthane, le bicarbonate de soude, le mélange d''épices et la cannelle dans un deuxième grand bol. Mélanger progressivement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Chauffer le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2.","Incorporez les fruits trempés au mélange à gâteau jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien mélangés, puis versez-les dans le moule et nivelez le dessus avec le dos d''une cuillère. Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes, puis réduire le feu à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1 et cuire encore 2-3 heures jusqu''à ce que le gâteau soit bien doré et ferme au toucher (couvrir le dessus du gâteau de papier d''aluminium s''il commence à trop noircir). Le gâteau est prêt lorsqu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressort propre.","Percez des trous sur tout le dessus du gâteau chaud à l''aide d''un pique à brochette, puis versez dessus 4 cuillères à soupe de cognac et laissez refroidir dans le moule pendant 1 heure. Transférer sur une grille, retirer le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir complètement. Lorsque le gâteau est froid, enveloppez-le dans une couche de papier sulfurisé, puis une couche de papier d''aluminium avant de le conserver. Se conserve dans un placard sec et frais jusqu''à trois mois, ou au congélateur jusqu''à six mois."]','2026-01-11 00:12:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11705,4951,'fr','Saucisses végétaliennes en couvertures','Enveloppez des saucisses végétaliennes dans une pâte feuilletée sans produits laitiers pour préparer ces cochons faciles dans des couvertures. Un excellent plat d''accompagnement à Noël, ils sont également parfaits pour les fêtes et les buffets','["½ cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","½ feuille de pâte feuilletée sans produits laitiers toute prête","16 saucisses végétaliennes façon chipolata","1 cuillère à soupe de sauge séchée","1 cuillère à soupe de lait de soja","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","¼ de muscade, râpée","½ gousse d''ail, râpée"]','["Utilisez l''huile pour enrober une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Déroulez la pâte feuilletée sur un plan de travail pour qu''elle soit bien plate, puis coupez-la en bandes de 16 x 10 cm de long.","Enroulez une bande de pâte autour de chaque saucisse pour qu''elle ressemble à un tire-bouchon. Transférer sur le plateau préparé et réfrigérer pendant 15 minutes. Se conservera au réfrigérateur toute la nuit ou au congélateur jusqu''à deux semaines.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Pour faire le glaçage, mélangez le lait de soja, l''huile, la muscade, l''ail, une pincée de sel et beaucoup de poivre noir dans un bol. Badigeonnez les spirales de glaçage à l''aide d''un pinceau à pâtisserie, puis saupoudrez de sauge. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit gonflée et dorée et que les saucisses soient bien cuites."]','2026-01-11 00:12:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11706,4953,'fr','Bar au four avec vinaigrette citronnée et câpres','Cet élégant plat principal sans gluten est assez spécial pour un dîner, mais simple et rapide à préparer pour recevoir sans chichi.','["4 x 100 g de filets de bar","huile d''olive, pour badigeonner","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","le zeste râpé d''un citron et 2 cuillères à soupe de jus","2 cuillères à soupe de petites câpres","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon sans gluten","2 cuillères à soupe de persil plat haché, plus quelques feuilles supplémentaires (facultatif)"]','["Pour faire la vinaigrette, mélangez l''huile avec le zeste et le jus de citron, les câpres, la moutarde, un peu d''assaisonnement et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. N''ajoutez pas encore le persil (à moins de le servir immédiatement), car l''acide contenu dans le citron atténuera la couleur s''il reste ensemble trop longtemps.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et déposer dessus le poisson, peau vers le haut. Badigeonnez la peau d’huile et saupoudrez de sel feuilleté. Cuire au four pendant 7 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la chair se défasse lorsqu''on la teste avec un couteau. Disposez le poisson sur des assiettes de service chaudes, nappez-le de vinaigrette et parsemez de feuilles de persil supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11707,4955,'fr','Biriyani végétalien aux légumes avec salade de carottes','Un plat de riz basmati d''inspiration indienne sans viande ni produits laitiers avec chou-fleur, haricots verts, petits pois, pommes de terre, pâte de curry maison et salade de carottes','["400 g de riz basmati","pincer des fils de safran (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 chou-fleur, coupé en bouquets","2 pommes de terre, coupées en morceaux","100 g de lentilles rouges","100 g de haricots verts, parés et coupés en deux","une poignée de feuilles de curry","2 poignées de petits pois surgelés","petit bouquet de coriandre","50 g de noix de cajou grillées et hachées grossièrement","Poppadoms et pain naan, pour servir","1 gros oignon, haché grossièrement","gros morceau de gingembre, haché grossièrement","5 gousses d''ail","2 cuillères à café de curry en poudre","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 petit piment vert","4 carottes","pincée de sucre en poudre doré","presser le jus de citron","une poignée de noix de cajou, hachées grossièrement","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées grossièrement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé en allumettes","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin, grillées"]','["Faire tremper le riz pendant 30 minutes, puis rincer\r\nplusieurs changements d''eau jusqu''à ce qu''elle coule\r\nclair. Couvrir d''environ 1 cm d''eau, ajouter\r\nle safran (si utilisé), couvrez la poêle, apportez\r\nà ébullition, remuez une fois, puis éteignez le\r\nchaleur. Laisser poser 10 mn à couvert puis\r\nremuer à nouveau et laisser reposer à couvert.","Pour faire la pâte, mixez tous les\r\ningrédients ensemble dans un robot culinaire.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole. Astuce dans le\r\npâte, puis ajoutez le chou-fleur et\r\npommes de terre. Cuire dans la pâte pour colorer,\r\npuis ajoutez les lentilles et les haricots verts, et\r\ncouvrir d''environ 400 ml d''eau. Ajoutez le\r\nfeuilles de curry, assaisonner de sel, couvrir de\r\nun couvercle et laisser mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles lentilles et les légumes sont tendres. Ajoutez le\r\npetits pois pendant les 2 dernières minutes pour les décongeler. Remuer\r\nle riz à travers le curry jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement\r\nmélangé et chaud, puis verser sur une assiette\r\net parsemer de coriandre et de noix de cajou.","Pour la salade de carottes, utilisez un éplucheur pour raser\r\nles carottes en rubans. Saupoudrer de\r\nsucrer et assaisonner avec le jus de citron, puis\r\nmélanger avec les autres ingrédients. Servir le\r\nbiryani sur un grand plateau pour que tout le monde puisse\r\nse servir, avec la salade de carottes dessus\r\nà part, des poppadoms pour tous les végétaliens et\r\npain naan pour les végétariens."]','2026-01-11 00:12:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11708,4957,'fr','Salade de boulgour, dattes et clémentines','Un mélange d''agrumes, de céréales saines et de légumineuses nutritionnelles de style moyen-oriental, sans viande ni produits laitiers – idéal pour les boîtes à lunch','["140 g de blé boulgour","1 cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","6 dattes dénoyautées, hachées","une petite poignée de persil haché","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées grillées","Sachet de 100 g de bébés épinards","2 clémentines, pelées, tranchées","jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Mettez le boulghar et les épices dedans\r\nun grand bol, assaisonner de sel et verser\r\nplus de 140 ml d''eau bouillante. Couvrir de film alimentaire\r\nfilmer et laisser reposer 10 min. Fluff avec\r\nune fourchette, puis ajoutez les dattes hachées,\r\npersil, pois chiches et la plupart des\r\namandes. Versez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette\r\ndans un bocal en verre avec un couvercle ajusté et ajoutez\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement. Bien agiter et verser\r\nsur la salade.","Juste avant de manger, mélangez les épinards\r\nà travers, garnir de tranches de clémentine\r\net parsemer du reste des amandes."]','2026-01-11 00:12:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11709,4959,'fr','Cocktails d''avocat, crevettes et fenouil','Une version moderne et plus légère de l''entrée rétro, le cocktail de crevettes','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 orange segmentée et le jus des parures","jus d''1 citron","1 bulbe de fenouil, paré, coupé en deux et finement tranché","1 avocat, coupé en quartiers, pelé et tranché","200 g de gambas cuites","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","Sachet de 55g de roquette sauvage"]','["Préparez la vinaigrette en mélangeant l''huile et\r\njus d''agrumes ensemble dans un petit bol avec\r\nun peu de sel et de poivre, puis réserver.","Dans un bol, mélangez tous les autres ingrédients,\r\nsauf la fusée, avec l''orange\r\nsegments et la moitié de la vinaigrette. Dispersion\r\nla roquette part dans 4 verres à Martini ou\r\npetits bols, empilez la salade au centre,\r\npuis arroser du reste de la vinaigrette\r\njuste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11710,4963,'fr','Salade bistro de bébés épinards et bacon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Cette simple salade à la française constitue un merveilleux déjeuner léger.','["140 g de haricots verts fins","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","6 tranches de bacon fumé, coupées en petits morceaux","2 tranches épaisses de pain blanc sans croûte, coupées en cubes","200 g de champignons tranchés","1 avocat, coupé en deux et tranché","250 g de bébés épinards","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Mélanger les ingrédients de la vinaigrette ensemble\r\navec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et assaisonner de sel\r\net du poivre. Faire bouillir les haricots pendant 3 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste cuits, égouttez-les dans l''eau froide,\r\npuis égouttez à nouveau.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, puis\r\nfaire grésiller le bacon pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant.\r\nUtilisez une écumoire pour ramasser le bacon\r\ndans un grand saladier. Utilisez la graisse dans le\r\npoêle pour faire frire les cubes de pain jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants,\r\npuis versez-les avec le bacon. Astuce un\r\nVersez plus d''huile dans la poêle, très brièvement\r\nfaire revenir les champignons juste pour les débarrasser\r\nleur crudité, puis éteignez le feu.\r\nQuand les champignons ont refroidi\r\nlégèrement, versez-les dans le saladier\r\navec les haricots et l''avocat.\r\nQuelques instants avant de servir, ajoutez les épinards\r\net s''habiller, puis bien mélanger\r\ntout est enduit."]','2026-01-11 00:12:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11711,4965,'fr','Filets de poisson en croûte de citron et romarin','Utilisez les restes de pain dans cette garniture croustillante pour agrémenter le poisson blanc','["4 filets de poisson blanc (le merlu est durable)","2 brins de romarin, feuilles hachées ou 1 cuillère à café séchée","50 g de pain (environ 2 tranches), déchiré en morceaux","zester 2 citrons, plus les quartiers pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen. Placez le poisson\r\nfilets, peau vers le haut, sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis\r\ngriller 4 min. Pendant ce temps, placez le\r\nromarin, pain, zeste de citron et un peu\r\nassaisonner au robot culinaire, puis mixer\r\npour faire de fines miettes.","Retournez le poisson, puis pressez un quart\r\nde la chapelure sur le dessus de chaque filet.\r\nArrosez d''huile d''olive, puis faites griller 4 minutes.\r\njusqu''à ce que la croûte soit dorée et que le poisson soit\r\nbien cuit et juste s''écaillant. Servir\r\navec pommes de terre nouvelles beurrées et citron\r\ncales pour presser."]','2026-01-11 00:12:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11712,4967,'fr','Tomates farcies aux poivrons rôtis et au chèvre','Savourez un plat sans produits laitiers','["25 g de pignons de pin, plus 2 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires pour saupoudrer","Paquet de 225 g de jeunes feuilles d''épinards","200 g de poivrons rouges rôtis, égouttés et coupés en dés","125 g de fromage de chèvre gallois sans croûte à l''ail et aux herbes, plus 50 g pour l''émietter","6 grosses tomates de boeuf"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Coupez le dessus des tomates et jetez-les. Retirez les graines et jetez-les. Placez les tomates sur un plat peu profond et légèrement huilé.","Faites revenir tous les pignons de pin dans une poêle sèche ou sous le grill jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Faites revenir les épinards dans une poêle chaude pendant 1 min. Bien égoutter dans une passoire en essorant l''excédent de liquide, puis hacher grossièrement.","Mélangez les épinards, les poivrons, 25 g de noix grillées et 125 g de fromage émietté dans un bol, puis assaisonnez selon votre goût. Répartissez le mélange entre les coquilles de tomates. Garnir chaque tomate avec encore du fromage de chèvre émietté et le reste des pignons de pin, puis cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit chaude et que la peau des tomates commence à se froisser et à se fendre. Servir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:12:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11713,4969,'fr','Smoothie végétalien','Un smoothie végétalien sans produits laitiers avec du jus de fruit, du tofu et de l''avoine pour vous donner de l''énergie au petit-déjeuner ou vous nourrir pour faire de l''exercice.','["100 ml (¼ grand verre) de jus de cerise (nous avons utilisé Cherrygood)","200 ml (½ grand verre) de lait de soja non sucré","1 yaourt soja cerise","3 cuillères à soupe ou 50 g de tofu soyeux ferme","75g (1 pot de yaourt vide) de cerises surgelées","2 cuillères à soupe de flocons d''avoine"]','["Mesurez tous les ingrédients avec précision ou utilisez un grand verre et votre pot de yaourt vide pour plus de rapidité – ils n’ont pas besoin d’être exacts. Mettez-les dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez dans 1 grand verre (vous en aurez assez pour faire le plein) ou dans deux verres courts."]','2026-01-11 00:12:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11714,4971,'fr','Lasagnes','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Peu de choses sont plus satisfaisantes que de cuisiner un classique à la perfection – Sarah Cook nous donne une leçon sur la façon de préparer des lasagnes','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","1 oignon, finement haché","1 carotte (environ 100 g/4 oz) finement hachée","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","Paquet de 140 g de cubes de bacon","500 g de bœuf haché (nous avons utilisé 10 % de matière grasse)","500 g de hachis de porc ou de veau britannique","200 ml de lait","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 feuilles de laurier","1 brin de romarin","2 brins de thym","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","2 cubes de bouillon de boeuf","500 ml de vin rouge","environ 400 g de feuilles de pâtes séchées","50 g de parmesan finement râpé","1½ litre de lait","1 oignon, tranché épaisse","3 feuilles de laurier","3 clous de girofle","100g de beurre","100 g de farine nature","bonne noix de muscade râpée"]','["Infusez d’abord le lait pour la sauce béchamel. Mettez le lait, l''oignon, le laurier et les clous de girofle dans une grande casserole et portez très doucement à ébullition. Éteignez le feu et laissez infuser 1 h.","Pour la sauce à la viande, mettez l''huile, le céleri, l''oignon, la carotte, l''ail et la pancetta dans une autre grande casserole. Cuire doucement ensemble jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres mais non colorés. Versez tout le hachis, le lait et les tomates. À l''aide d''une cuillère en bois, mélangez, cassez et écrasez les morceaux de viande hachée contre les parois de la poêle. Lorsque le hachis est presque entièrement décomposé, ajoutez toutes les herbes, les cubes de bouillon et le vin et portez à ébullition. Couvrir et cuire 1 h en remuant de temps en temps pour empêcher le fond d''accrocher. Découvrir et laisser mijoter doucement encore 30 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre et savoureuse. Goûtez et assaisonnez.","Pour terminer la béchamel, filtrez le lait au tamis fin dans un ou deux pichets. Faire fondre le beurre dans la même poêle puis, à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois, incorporer la farine et laisser cuire 2 min. Incorporez le lait filtré, petit à petit – le mélange va d''abord épaissir en une pâte pâteuse, mais continuez, en ajoutant du lait progressivement pour éviter les grumeaux. Lorsque tout le lait est dedans, portez à ébullition douce en remuant constamment (si vous avez des grumeaux, fouettez rapidement). Faire bouillonner doucement pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Assaisonner avec du sel, du poivre et de la muscade.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Étaler une cuillerée de sauce à la viande sur le fond d''un plat allant au four d''environ 3,5 litres. Couvrir d''une seule couche de feuilles de pâtes, en les cassant si nécessaire, puis garnir d''un quart de béchamel. Verser un tiers de la sauce à la viande et parsemer d''un peu de parmesan. Répétez les couches – pâtes, béchamel, viande et parmesan – encore deux fois pour utiliser toute la sauce à la viande. Ajoutez une dernière couche de pâtes, le reste de béchamel et le reste de parmesan. Placez le plat sur une plaque à pâtisserie pour récupérer les déversements et faites cuire au four pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce que le dessus bouillonne, soit doré et croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:12:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11715,4975,'fr','Muffins crumble à la rhubarbe','Les saveurs d''un crumble à la rhubarbe s''effritent sous la forme d''un joli muffin moelleux.','["175 g de sucre en poudre","175 g de rhubarbe coupée en deux dans le sens de la longueur puis en dés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","125 ml de babeurre","200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","50 g de sucre muscovado léger","50g de farine nature","25 g de flocons d''avoine","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","50g de beurre"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nTapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous de papier\r\ncaissettes à muffins. Mélanger le sucre et la rhubarbe\r\nensemble et réservez pendant que vous préparez\r\nla garniture crumble. Mélangez ensemble le\r\nsucre muscovado avec la farine, flocons d''avoine\r\net la cannelle, puis incorporer le beurre\r\njusqu''à ce que le mélange soit grumeleux du bout des doigts.","Incorporer l''huile et l''œuf, la vanille et\r\ndu babeurre dans la rhubarbe sucrée\r\n(ne vous inquiétez pas si c''est un peu juteux).\r\nMaintenant, ajoutez la farine, la levure chimique\r\net le bicarbonate de soude et remuez bien.","Versez rapidement dans les caisses, puis\r\ndisperser chacun avec une épaisse couche de\r\nmélange de crumble. Cuire au four pendant 15-18 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et qu''un bâton à cocktail soit piqué\r\nau centre d''un muffin vient\r\npropre. Laisser refroidir sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:12:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11716,4977,'fr','Bobotie','Prononcé ba-boor-tea, le plat national d''Afrique du Sud est un délicieux mélange de viande et de fruits au curry avec une garniture dorée et crémeuse, semblable à la moussaka.','["2 tranches de pain blanc","2 oignons, hachés","25g de beurre","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 kg de bœuf haché maigre","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry madras","1 cuillère à café d''herbes mélangées séchées","3 clous de girofle","5 baies de piment de la Jamaïque","2 cuillères à soupe de chutney de pêche ou de mangue","3 cuillères à soupe de raisins secs","6 feuilles de laurier","300 ml de lait entier","2 gros œufs"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Verser de l''eau froide sur le pain et laisser tremper.","Pendant ce temps, faites revenir les oignons dans le beurre en remuant régulièrement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à colorer. Ajoutez l''ail et le bœuf et remuez bien, en écrasant le hachis en grains fins jusqu''à ce qu''il change de couleur. Incorporer la pâte de curry, les herbes, les épices, le chutney, les raisins secs et 2 feuilles de laurier avec 1 cuillère à café de sel et beaucoup de poivre noir moulu.","Couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 mn. Pressez l''eau du pain, puis incorporez-la au mélange de viande jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Versez dans un plat ovale allant au four (23 x 33 cm et environ 5 à 6 cm de profondeur). Bien tasser le mélange et lisser le dessus. Vous pouvez le préparer et le réfrigérer 1 jour à l''avance.","Pour la garniture, battez le lait et les œufs avec l''assaisonnement, puis versez sur la viande. Garnir du reste des feuilles de laurier et cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit prise et commence à devenir dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:12:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11717,4981,'fr','Salade de couscous 10 minutes','C''est un excellent remplissage de boîte à lunch pour une journée à l''extérieur et est également bon à la maison depuis le réfrigérateur.','["100 g de couscous","200 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud peu salé (en cube, c''est bien)","2 oignons nouveaux","1 poivron rouge","½ concombre","50 g de fromage feta en cubes","2 cuillères à soupe de pesto","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin grillés"]','["Versez le couscous dans un grand bol, versez dessus\r\nstocks. Couvrir, puis laisser reposer 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\nmoelleux et tout le bouillon a été absorbé.\r\nPendant ce temps, émincez les oignons et le poivron\r\net coupez le concombre en dés. Ajoutez-les au\r\ncouscous, passer le pesto à la fourchette, émietter\r\nfeta, puis saupoudrer de pignons de pin pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11718,4983,'fr','Soupe de courge musquée au piment & crème fraîche','Venez du froid dans un bol chaud d''automne','["1 courge butternut d''environ 1 kg, pelée et épépinée","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","2 oignons, coupés en dés","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée finement","2 piments rouges doux, épépinés et finement hachés","850 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","4 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche, et un peu plus pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nCoupez la courge en gros cubes d''environ\r\n4 cm/1½ po de diamètre, puis incorporez-y un grand\r\nrôtissoire avec la moitié de l''huile d''olive. Rôti\r\npendant 30 mn en retournant une fois pendant la cuisson,\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et tendres.","Pendant la cuisson de la courge, faites fondre la\r\nbeurre avec le reste de l''huile dans un grand\r\ncasserole, puis ajoutez les oignons, l''ail et\r\n¾ du piment. Couvrir et cuire à feu très\r\nfeu doux pendant 15-20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons\r\nsont complètement mous.","Versez la courge dans la poêle, ajoutez le\r\nle bouillon et la crème fraîche, puis fouettez\r\navec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Pour\r\nune soupe vraiment soyeuse, mettez la soupe dans un\r\nmixez-le et mixez-le par lots. Retour\r\ndans la poêle, réchauffer doucement, puis assaisonner pour\r\ngoût. Servir la soupe dans des bols avec des tourbillons\r\nde crème fraîche et un peu de\r\nreste du piment haché."]','2026-01-11 00:12:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11719,4985,'fr','Roulés de poulet','Initiez les jeunes enfants à la cuisine en les laissant préparer leur propre déjeuner, avec cette recette simple et sûre','["Enveloppez votre tortue","1-2 cuillères à soupe d''houmous","3 grosses tranches de poitrine de poulet cuite","¼ d''avocat retiré de sa peau","3 tomates cerises","cheddar, râpé pour faire environ 1 cuillère à soupe"]','["Mettez une enveloppe\r\nune planche ou une assiette.\r\nRépandez le houmous\r\nau milieu de\r\nà l''aide d''une cuillère ou\r\ncouteau à beurre.","Déchirez le\r\npoulet (ou demandez un\r\naide adulte\r\nfaites ceci) et mettez-le dans un\r\nligne au milieu\r\nde l''emballage. Hacher\r\nl''avocat avec un\r\ncouteau à beurre (orak\r\nvotre assistant) et mettez\r\nà côté du poulet.","Écrasez le\r\ntomates\r\nsur l''emballage par\r\nen les pressant et\r\nles déchirer en deux\r\n(ils pourraient gicler,\r\nalors fais attention à toi\r\nvêtements). Saupoudrer\r\nsur du fromage.","Enroulez le film\r\net appuyez dessus\r\nvers le bas fermement.Demandez\r\nton adulte\r\naide pour le couper\r\nla moitié pour toi."]','2026-01-11 00:12:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11720,4987,'fr','Omelette feta & tomates mi-séchées','Cuire des œufs avec du fromage et des tomates constitue un repas ultra-rapide, prêt en 10 minutes.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","2 œufs légèrement battus","4 tomates mi-séchées, hachées grossièrement","25 g de fromage feta émietté","feuilles de salade mélangée, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une petite poêle, ajoutez\r\nles œufs et cuire en remuant les œufs\r\navec une fourchette pendant qu''ils prennent. Quand les œufs\r\nsont encore légèrement coulants au milieu,\r\nrépartir sur les tomates et la feta,\r\npuis pliez l''omelette en deux. Cuisiner pour\r\n1 min de plus avant de glisser sur une assiette.\r\nServir avec une salade composée."]','2026-01-11 00:12:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11721,4991,'fr','Cheeseburger & frites','Les hamburgers et les chips faits maison battent à chaque fois ceux achetés en magasin. Pourquoi ne pas en faire le double et en congeler un lot ?','["1¼kg de bœuf haché maigre","1 oignon, finement haché","140g de chapelure","100 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","petit bouquet de persil haché","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce Worcestershire","1 œuf légèrement battu à la fourchette","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","Sac de 2½ kg de pommes de terre coupées en grosses chips","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","10 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive ou de tournesol","pains à hamburger, laitue, oignon rouge tranché, tomates, cornichons et sauces ou relish, pour servir"]','["Versez le hachis dans un grand bol avec\r\nl''oignon, la chapelure, le fromage, le persil,\r\nSauce Worcestershire, œuf, poudre de piment,\r\n½ cuillère à café de sel et un peu de poivre. Mélanger\r\nbien avec vos mains, puis divisez le\r\nmélanger en 10 et façonner des hamburgers.","Apportez 2 grandes casseroles d''eau à\r\nl''ébullition (ou préparer les chips par lots\r\nsi vous n''avez pas assez de grandes casseroles). Ajouter\r\nles chips, ramenez l''eau au\r\nfaites bouillir et réglez votre minuterie sur 3 minutes. Après\r\n3 min, égouttez bien les pommes de terre et versez-les\r\nsur un ou deux grands papiers de cuisine recouverts\r\nplateaux. Saupoudrer de farine et d''un peu d''assaisonnement et mélanger délicatement pour bien enrober.","Congelez les burgers et les chips (voir\r\nconseils de congélation, ci-dessous) ou, pour cuire directement\r\nloin, chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDans une plaque à pâtisserie, mélangez un peu les chips\r\nhuile, puis rôtir pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant\r\net doré. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une plaque chauffante\r\npoêle, griller ou barbecue jusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud, puis\r\ncuire les burgers pendant environ 5 à 8 minutes\r\nde chaque côté, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits à votre goût.\r\naimer. Sandwich les hamburgers dans des toasts\r\npetits pains avec salade et sauces, puis servir\r\navec les chips."]','2026-01-11 00:12:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11722,4993,'fr','Vestes de patate douce au thon','Si votre souper de veille est composé de pommes de terre au four avec du thon, optez pour des patates douces et une garniture fraîche et épicée – économique et faible en gras également.','["4 petites patates douces (environ 200 g chacune)","Boîte de 185 g de thon à l''eau de source, égoutté","½ oignon rouge, finement tranché","1 petit piment rouge épépiné et haché","jus 1 citron vert","6 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre"]','["Frottez les patates douces et piquez le tout\r\navec une fourchette. Placer sur un plat allant au micro-ondes\r\nassiette et cuire à puissance élevée pendant 18 à 20 minutes, ou\r\njusqu''à tendreté. Divisez en deux et placez chacun\r\nun, côté coupé vers le haut, sur une assiette de service.","Écailler le thon égoutté à la fourchette\r\net répartir entre les patates douces.\r\nGarnir d''oignon rouge et de piment, puis\r\npresser dessus le jus de citron vert. Garnir de\r\nune cuillerée de yaourt et répartir sur le\r\ncoriandre, pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11723,4995,'fr','Salade de thon, asperges et haricots blancs','Une salade printanière nourrissante, prête en quelques minutes','["1 gros bouquet d''asperges","2 boîtes de 200 g de steaks de thon albacore dans l''eau, égouttés","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots cannellini dans l''eau, égouttés","1 oignon rouge, haché très finement","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à soupe d''estragon finement haché"]','["Faites cuire les asperges dans une grande poêle\r\nfaire bouillir l''eau pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre.\r\nBien égoutter, refroidir sous l''eau courante,\r\npuis coupez-le en morceaux de la longueur d''un doigt. Lancer\r\nensemble le thon, les haricots, l''oignon, les câpres\r\net les asperges dans un grand bol de service.","Mélanger l''huile, le vinaigre et l''estragon\r\nensemble, puis verser sur la salade.\r\nRéfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11724,4997,'fr','Salade tiède de poulet','Cette recette de salade de poulet constitue un délicieux repas principal pour une journée chaude, ou emportez-en au travail et faites l''envie de vos collègues.','["2 poitrines de poulet, coupées en bouchées","½ petite baguette, coupée en bouchées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","Sachet de 150 g de feuilles de salade mélangées","1 paquet de 250 g de betterave cuite, coupée en bouchées","100g de fromage de chèvre"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/chaleur tournante 180°C/gaz 6. Étaler les morceaux de poulet et la baguette sur une plaque à rôtir peu profonde. Arroser de\r\n2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et mélanger pour bien enrober. Assaisonner puis mettre au four 15 min jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit et que le pain soit doré et croustillant.","Fouetter ensemble le reste de l''huile d''olive et le vinaigre balsamique pour faire une vinaigrette. Divisez le sachet de feuilles en deux portions\r\nassiettes, ajoutez la betterave, puis parsemez le fromage. Mélanger avec le poulet chaud et le pain, arroser de vinaigrette, puis servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:12:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11725,4999,'fr','Muesli au miel, framboises et noisettes','Préparez votre propre muesli et agrémentez-le de fruits frais pour un petit-déjeuner totalement satisfaisant et sain qui vous permettra de tenir toute la journée.','["225 g de flocons d''avoine, les gros flocons donnent une bonne texture","125 ml de jus d''orange fraîchement pressé","225 ml de yaourt nature, peut être faible en gras","3 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","le zeste finement râpé d''1 citron","2 pommes dessert rouges ou roses","2x 125g barquettes de framboises","50 g de noisettes avec leur peau, légèrement grillées et hachées grossièrement","crème liquide, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mélanger les flocons d''avoine, le jus d''orange et 300 ml/½ pinte\r\neau froide dans un bol. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire\r\net laisser au réfrigérateur toute la nuit.","Le lendemain matin, incorporez le yaourt,\r\nmiel et zeste de citron. Quartier et noyau\r\nles pommes, râpez-les et remuez bien.\r\nVerser dans des bols et garnir de framboises et de noisettes grillées. Versez un peu\r\ncrème liquide, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11726,5001,'fr','Pommes de terre au four croustillantes','Les vestes à la peau croustillante et à la chair moelleuse sont une façon bon marché et joyeuse de nourrir une foule – parfaites avec des haricots et des saucisses.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","8 grosses pommes de terre au four","300 ml de crème sure en pot"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7. Frotter\r\nun peu d''huile sur chaque pomme de terre et mettre\r\nla grille supérieure du four. Enfourner 20 mn,\r\npuis baissez le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 5 et cuire au four pendant 45 minutes-1 heure de plus\r\njusqu''à ce que la peau soit croustillante et la chair tendre.\r\nRetirer du four. Faire une croix\r\nau centre de chaque pomme de terre, déposer une cuillerée\r\nla crème sure et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11727,5003,'fr','Pains de malt collants','Il y a quelque chose de très satisfaisant dans une tasse de thé avec une tranche de pain de malt beurré – cette version simple et bonne pour la santé en fait deux et améliore la conservation.','["huile de tournesol, pour graisser","150 ml de thé noir chaud","175 g d''extrait de malt, plus un peu pour le glaçage (voir astuce)","85 g de sucre muscovado noir","300 g de fruits secs mélangés","2 gros œufs, battus","250 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude"]','["Chauffer le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2. Tapisser le fond et les extrémités de deux moules à pain antiadhésifs graissés de 450 g/1 lb de bandes de papier sulfurisé.","Versez le thé chaud dans un bol à mélanger avec le malt, le sucre et les fruits secs. Remuez bien, puis ajoutez les œufs.","Versez la farine, puis incorporez rapidement la levure chimique et le bicarbonate de soude et versez dans les moules préparés. Cuire au four pendant 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme et bien levé. Pendant qu''il est encore chaud, badigeonnez-le d''un peu plus de malt pour le glacer et laissez-le refroidir.","Retirer des moules. Si vous pouvez supporter de ne pas le manger tout de suite, il deviendra plus collant après avoir été emballé et conservé 2 à 5 jours. Servir tranché et beurré, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11728,5005,'fr','Assiette d''antipasti aux pêches','Un plat d''été facile et sans cuisson, idéal pour recevoir','["4 pêches les plus mûres, dénoyautées et coupées en huitièmes","12 tranches de jambon","50 g de parmesan coupé en copeaux avec un économe","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché très finement","2 poignées de fusée","huile d''olive de très bonne qualité","bâtonnet de grissini, pour servir"]','["Disposez les pêches, le prosciutto et\r\nParmesan sur une grande assiette, saupoudrer\r\nsur le piment et disperse la fusée\r\npour finir. Juste avant de servir, arrosez\r\navec un peu d''huile. Servir avec des gressins\r\npour ajouter du croquant."]','2026-01-11 00:12:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11729,5007,'fr','Milk-shake au moka','Un café glacé décadent pour un après-midi ensoleillé. Servir dans de grands verres pour une gâterie rétro','["85g de chocolat noir 70% ou 80%","1 cuillère à soupe de grains de café","700 ml de lait","4 boules de glace vanille, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Hachez grossièrement 75 g de chocolat et\r\nmettre dans une grande carafe avec le café. Apportez\r\n300 ml de lait juste à ébullition, puis\r\nverser dessus le mélange chocolat et café,\r\nen remuant pour fondre. Une fois fondu, laissez refroidir.","Versez le lait moka refroidi dans le\r\nmixeur avec la glace et le reste\r\ndu lait. Mélanger jusqu''à homogénéité, puis verser dans\r\n4 grands verres. Ajoutez une boule de glace supplémentaire\r\ncrème sur chacun, si vous le souhaitez, puis râpez-en un\r\nun peu du chocolat restant sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:12:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11730,5009,'fr','Glace vanille ultime','La glace à la vanille d''Angela Nilsen est-elle la glace maison la plus onctueuse et la plus crémeuse de l''histoire ?','["Carton de 284 ml de crème double","300 ml de lait entier","115 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 gousse de vanille","3 gros jaunes d''œufs fermiers","ayez beaucoup de glaçons à portée de main"]','["Mettez le récipient de la machine au congélateur un jour avant de préparer la glace. Le lendemain, versez la crème et le lait dans une casserole à fond épais, puis versez la moitié du sucre. Fendez la gousse de vanille sur toute sa longueur avec un petit couteau bien aiguisé et retirez autant de petites graines noires que possible dans le mélange de crème. Coupez la gousse en trois et déposez-la dans la poêle.","Faites chauffer la crème et le lait à feu doux, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu’à ébullition – vous verrez quelques bulles sur le bord. Retirez du feu et laissez reposer 30 minutes pour que la vanille infuse.","Mettez les jaunes d''œufs dans un bol avec le reste du sucre et battez avec un batteur électrique à main pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe, soit de couleur plus pâle et tombe en rubans épais lorsque vous soulevez les batteurs. À l''aide d''un verre doseur, prélevez environ 125 ml du mélange de crème et incorporez-le aux jaunes d''œufs pour les détendre. Réchauffez la crème jusqu''à ébullition, retirez du feu et incorporez le mélange de jaunes d''œufs.","Remettez la casserole sur feu doux et faites cuire, en remuant tout le temps avec une cuillère en bois, pendant 8 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la crème anglaise soit suffisamment épaisse pour recouvrir le dos de la cuillère. Surveillez qu''il ne bout pas : dès que vous voyez des bulles sur le point d''éclater à la surface, elles doivent être suffisamment épaisses, alors retirez la casserole du feu pour que le mélange ne caille pas.","Versez la crème anglaise dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, puis placez-la dans un bol plus grand rempli au tiers d''eau glacée pour qu''elle refroidisse (cela prend environ 20 minutes). Remuer de temps en temps pour empêcher la formation d''une peau. Mettez le bol de crème anglaise au réfrigérateur pendant 3 à 4 heures, de préférence toute la nuit, pour qu''il fasse bien froid.","Mettez la sorbetière en marche, retirez les morceaux de gousse de vanille, puis versez lentement la crème anglaise froide. Laissez-le baratter pendant 10 à 30 minutes (selon votre machine). Lorsqu''il s''arrête, il est probablement trop mou pour être mangé, alors versez-le dans un récipient en plastique, couvrez d''un film alimentaire, puis d''un couvercle et congelez pendant au moins 3 heures. (Il se conserve 3 mois au congélateur mais ne le sortez pas, puis recongelez-le.) Sortez du congélateur 15 minutes avant de servir.","Pour le réaliser à la main : à l''étape 1, faites chauffer le lait, la vanille et la moitié du\r\nsucre sans la crème (la crème anglaise sera légèrement plus épaisse). À\r\nau début de l''étape 6, fouettez la crème pour qu''elle soit légère et souple, pas trop\r\nraide et incorporez-le à la crème anglaise froide. Congeler pendant 3 à 4 heures en remuant\r\nune fois par heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque congelé, puis congeler comme ci-dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:12:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11731,5011,'fr','Bouillie parfaite','Porridge parfait pour une façon saine de commencer la journée','["50 g de flocons d''avoine","350 ml de lait ou d''eau, ou un mélange des deux","Yaourt grec dilué avec un peu de lait et du miel clair, pour servir"]','["Mettez les flocons d''avoine dans un\r\ncasserole, versez le lait ou l''eau et\r\nsaupoudrer d''une pincée de sel. Porter à ébullition\r\net laisser mijoter pendant 4 à 5 minutes en remuant de\r\nde temps en temps et en surveillant attentivement qu''il\r\nne colle pas au fond de la casserole. Ou vous pouvez essayer cela au micro-ondes. Mélangez les flocons d''avoine, le lait ou l''eau\r\net une pincée de sel dans un grand plat allant au micro-ondes\r\nbol, puis micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 5\r\nminutes, en remuant à mi-cuisson. Partir\r\nlaisser reposer 2 minutes avant de manger.","Servir. Verser dans des bols, verser le yaourt\r\ndessus et arroser de miel."]','2026-01-11 00:12:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11732,5013,'fr','Ratatouille facile aux oeufs pochés','Ce one-pot courageux peut généralement être préparé à l''avance – il suffit de casser les œufs à la fin.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","1 poivron rouge ou orange, épépiné et tranché finement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de romarin haché","1 aubergine, coupée en dés","2 courgettes, coupées en dés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique","4 gros œufs","une poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajouter\r\nl''oignon, le poivron, l''ail et le romarin,\r\npuis laissez cuire 5 min en remuant fréquemment,\r\njusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit ramolli. Ajoutez le\r\naubergines et courgettes, puis cuire\r\npendant 2 minutes de plus.","Ajoutez les tomates, puis remplissez la boîte de\r\nl''eau, faites-la tourner et versez-la dans la casserole.\r\nPortez à ébullition, couvrez, puis laissez mijoter pendant\r\n40 minutes, en découvrant après 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\nréduite et pulpeuse.","Incorporez le vinaigre à la ratatouille, puis\r\nfaites 4 emplacements pour les œufs. Casser un œuf\r\ndans chaque trou et assaisonner avec du noir\r\npoivre. Couvrir puis cuire 2 à 5 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris aussi doucement ou fermement que vous le souhaitez.\r\nParsemer de basilic et servir avec\r\ndu pain croustillant pour éponger le jus."]','2026-01-11 00:12:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11733,5015,'fr','Smoothie du petit-déjeuner','Profitez au maximum de la saison des petits fruits avec un verre de bonté fruitée','["1 petite banane mûre","environ 140 g de mûres, myrtilles, framboises ou fraises (ou utilisez un mélange), plus un peu pour servir","jus de pomme ou eau minérale, facultatif","miel qui coule, pour servir"]','["Coupez la banane dans votre mixeur ou robot culinaire et ajoutez les baies de votre choix. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Pendant que les lames tournent, versez du jus ou de l''eau pour obtenir la consistance que vous aimez. Ajoutez quelques fruits supplémentaires dessus, arrosez de miel et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11734,5017,'fr','Compote de fruits d''été','Ajoutez des framboises d''été, des myrtilles et des prunes juteuses au jus d''orange pour un mélange nutritif pour le petit-déjeuner.','["4 grosses prunes, dénoyautées et coupées en quartiers","200 g de barquette de myrtilles","le zeste et le jus d''une orange","25 g de sucre roux clair et mou","150 g de framboises barquette","yaourt épais et miel, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Cuire les prunes et les myrtilles dans une\r\npetite casserole avec le zeste et le jus d''orange,\r\nsucre et 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau jusqu''à ce que légèrement\r\nramolli mais pas pâteux. Incorporer délicatement le\r\nframboises et cuire encore 1 min.","Retirer du feu et laisser reposer\r\nlaisser refroidir à température ambiante. Servir avec\r\ndu yaourt et un filet de miel, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11735,5019,'fr','Frittata de saumon et brocoli à la menthe','Copieux et rapide, et tout aussi bon le lendemain dans votre boîte à lunch','["500 g de pommes de terre nouvelles","1 petite tête de brocoli, coupée en fleurons","2 filets de saumon sans peau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","une petite poignée de menthe hachée finement","8 œufs battus"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre dans une grande poêle pendant 10 à 12 minutes,\r\najouter les morceaux de brocoli pour la finale\r\n4 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout soit tendre. Bien égoutter.\r\nPendant ce temps, déposez les filets de saumon dans un\r\nplat allant au micro-ondes, arrosez-en un peu\r\neau, puis couvrir d''un film alimentaire et passer au micro-ondes\r\nà puissance élevée pendant 2½ minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson se défasse.","Faites chauffer le gril. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une friteuse\r\ncasserole. Coupez les pommes de terre en grosses tranches,\r\npuis cuire rapidement à la poêle à feu vif\r\njusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés. Écaillez le saumon\r\nen gros morceaux et piquez parmi les\r\npommes de terre avec le brocoli. Remuez la menthe et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement dans les œufs, puis versez\r\ndans la poêle. Laisser poser 6 minutes à feu doux\r\nchauffer jusqu''à ce que les côtés soient pris et juste le\r\nle centre est un peu bancal, puis clignote sous le\r\ngriller pour prendre complètement et dorer. Servir dans\r\nquartiers avec une grosse salade verte en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:12:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11736,5021,'fr','Oeuf au four et chips','Ce repas délicieusement simple peut être préparé dans une seule poêle pour un minimum de vaisselle.','["2 pommes de terre moyennes au four, coupées en gros quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","2 tomates, coupées en deux","2 œufs"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nVersez les quartiers de pommes de terre dans un plat à rôtir.\r\nArroser d''huile et saupoudrer sur le\r\npaprika. Assaisonner et bien mélanger pour bien enrober\r\nles pommes de terre. Rôtir pendant 25 minutes en retournant\r\nà mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient presque tendres.","Nestlé les tomates, côté coupé vers le haut,\r\nparmi les pommes de terre. Faites 2 espaces\r\ndans le moule et cassez un œuf dans chacun\r\nun. Remettre au four 6 à 8 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les œufs soient juste pris."]','2026-01-11 00:12:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11737,5023,'fr','Des œufs à tout moment','Fantastique plat d''œufs dans une poêle, pourquoi ne pas utiliser tout ce que vous avez dans le réfrigérateur pour vous l''approprier ?','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2-3 pommes de terre cuites, tranchées","une poignée de tomates cerises, tranchées","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","1 oeuf","quelques feuilles de basilic"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis ajoutez le\r\ntranches de pommes de terre et faire revenir des deux côtés jusqu''à ce\r\nmarron. Ajouter les tomates et les oignons nouveaux\r\net faire revenir environ 1 minute jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.\r\nAssaisonner de sel et de poivre, puis réaliser un\r\nespace dans la casserole. Cassez délicatement l''œuf dans\r\nl''espace et faire frire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût.\r\nRépartir sur les feuilles de basilic et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11738,5025,'fr','Crêpes sans gluten','Utilisez de la farine spécialisée dans ces crêpes rapides et faciles et répondez en toute sécurité aux personnes suivant un régime sans gluten.','["125 g de farine nature sans gluten (nous avons utilisé Doves Farm)","1 oeuf","250 ml de lait","beurre, pour frire"]','["Mettez la farine dans un bol et faites un puits au centre. Cassez l''œuf au milieu et versez-y un quart du lait. Utilisez un fouet électrique ou un fouet ballon pour bien mélanger le mélange. Une fois que vous avez une pâte, mélangez-en un autre quart et une fois sans grumeaux, mélangez le reste du lait. Laisser reposer 20 mn. Remuer à nouveau avant utilisation.","Faites chauffer une petite poêle antiadhésive avec une noix de beurre. Lorsque le beurre commence à mousser, versez une petite quantité du mélange dans la poêle et remuez pour enrober la base – vous voulez une fine couche. Cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que le fond soit doré, puis retourner et cuire jusqu''à ce que l''autre côté soit doré. Répétez jusqu''à ce que vous ayez utilisé tout le mélange, en remuant le mélange entre les crêpes et en ajoutant plus de beurre pour la friture si nécessaire.","Servir avec du sirop d''agave et un filet de jus d''orange ou la garniture de crêpe de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:12:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11739,5027,'fr','Fruits à noyau rôtis à la vanille','Cette compote est délicieuse servie tiède avec de la glace, ou froide au petit-déjeuner avec un yaourt.','["175 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 gousse de vanille fendue en deux","5 gousses de cardamome","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","6 abricots, coupés en deux et dénoyautés","3 pêches, coupées en quartiers et dénoyautées","3 nectarines, coupées en quartiers et dénoyautées"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 8. Verser le sucre, la gousse de vanille, la cardamome, le citron vert \r\nzestez et jus dans un robot culinaire, puis mixez jusqu''à homogénéité, ou écrasez-les ensemble à l''aide d''un \r\npilon et mortier. Versez les fruits dans un plat peu profond, puis ajoutez le sucre boueux.","Rôtir pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les fruits soient ramollis, mais pas effondrés et que le sucre \r\net les jus de fruits ont fait une sauce collante. Les restes se conservent au réfrigérateur  \r\npendant 2 jours maximum."]','2026-01-11 00:12:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11740,5029,'fr','Smoothie banane, clémentine et mangue','Commencez votre journée avec cette boisson délicieusement rafraîchissante, à base de fruits frais et de yaourt. Il est riche en vitamine C et compte pour l''un de vos 5 apports par jour','["environ 24 clémentines juteuses, plus une supplémentaire pour la décoration","2 petites mangues bien mûres et juteuses","2 bananes mûres","Pot de 500 g de lait entier ou de yaourt allégé","une poignée de glaçons (facultatif)"]','["Coupez les clémentines en deux et essorez-les.\r\njus – vous devriez avoir environ 600 ml/1 pinte.\r\n(Cela peut être fait la veille.)\r\nmangues, coupez les fruits du noyau\r\nle centre, puis coupez la chair en gros morceaux\r\nmorceaux. Pelez et tranchez les bananes.","Mettez le jus de clémentine, la chair de mangue,\r\nbananes, yaourt et glaçons dans un\r\nmixer et mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser dans\r\nsix verres et servir. (Vous devrez peut-être\r\nfaites-le en deux lots, en fonction du\r\ntaille de votre mixeur.) Si vous n''ajoutez pas de glace\r\ncubes, réfrigérer au réfrigérateur jusqu''au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:12:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11741,5031,'fr','Recette parfaite d''œufs brouillés','Apprenez à préparer des œufs brouillés parfaits avec cette recette facile. Un petit-déjeuner rapide riche en protéines, gracieuseté de Bill Granger.','["2 gros œufs fermiers","6 cuillères à soupe de crème liquide ou de lait entier","une noix de beurre"]','["Fouetter légèrement les oeufs, la crème\r\net une pincée de sel ensemble\r\njusqu''à ce que tous les ingrédients soient justes\r\ncombiné et le mélange a\r\nune consistance.","Faites chauffer une petite friture antiadhésive\r\ncasserole pendant environ une minute, puis ajoutez\r\nle beurre et laissez-le fondre. Ne\r\nlaissez le beurre dorer ou il\r\ncela décolorera les œufs. Verser\r\nle mélange d''œufs et laisser reposer,\r\nsans remuer, pendant 20 secondes.\r\nRemuer avec une cuillère en bois en soulevant\r\net le replier du\r\nfond de la casserole. Laissez-le reposer pendant\r\nencore 10 secondes puis remuez\r\net pliez à nouveau.","Répétez jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient\r\ndoucement pris et légèrement coulant\r\nendroits, puis retirez-le du\r\nchauffer et laisser reposer quelques\r\nsecondes pour terminer la cuisson.\r\nRemuez une dernière fois et servez le\r\nun brouillage velouté sans tarder."]','2026-01-11 00:12:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11742,5033,'fr','Polenta crémeuse','Empilez de la pepperonata sur cette polenta douce et crémeuse, ou servez-la avec vos ragoûts préférés. C''est naturellement sans gluten','["250 g de polenta","30g de beurre salé","40 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé"]','["Versez 1 litre d''eau dans une grande casserole profonde et portez à ébullition. Ajoutez la polenta, une poignée à la fois, en fouettant continuellement (l''ajouter lentement permet d''éviter la formation de grumeaux) pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à épaissir légèrement. Réduisez le feu et poursuivez la cuisson environ 25 à 30 minutes, en remuant souvent pour éviter qu''elle ne colle, jusqu''à ce que la polenta ait épaissi et se détache des parois de la poêle.","Ajoutez le beurre, le fromage, une généreuse mouture de poivre noir et 1 cuillère à soupe de sel. Fouetter pour combiner. Servir immédiatement – ​​la polenta épaissira en refroidissant."]','2026-01-11 00:12:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11743,5035,'fr','Tarte au pain de maïs et au chili','Utilisez de la farine de pois chiches pour faire la croûte de pain de maïs sur cette tarte au chili pour un dîner sans gluten. La farine de gramme contient également plus de vitamines et de minéraux que la farine de blé','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","2 oignons rouges (320 g), finement hachés","2 branches de céleri (environ 150 g), tranchées","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de piment fort","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","3 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","500 g de purée en carton","2 boîtes de 400 g de salade aux trois haricots dans l''eau","2 cuillères à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes sans gluten","20 g de coriandre, feuilles cueillies et hachées","50 g de semoule de maïs fine","100 g de farine (pois chiches)","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort","1 oeuf","150 ml de yaourt bio","50 ml de lait","50 g de cheddar affiné, râpé grossièrement","1 petit oignon rouge (environ 80 g), finement haché","12 olives Kalamata dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","4 cuillères à café de vinaigre balsamique","2 boîtes de 198 g de maïs doux égoutté","1 sachet de salade de feuilles mélangées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons et le céleri pendant 8 minutes en remuant souvent. Incorporer les épices et l''ail, puis verser la passata, la salade de haricots (avec le liquide des boîtes) et le bouillon. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 minutes, puis incorporer la coriandre. Versez dans un plat peu profond allant au four et laissez refroidir légèrement.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Versez la semoule de maïs, la farine de pois chiches, la levure chimique et la poudre de piment dans un bol et mélangez bien. Battez l''œuf, le yaourt et le lait dans un autre bol, puis versez-les dans les ingrédients secs et mélangez pour obtenir une pâte. Incorporez le fromage, puis versez-le sur les haricots chili et faites cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que le pain de maïs soit gonflé et doré. Mélangez la moitié des ingrédients de la salade de maïs et servez avec la moitié du piment, en réservant le reste pour un autre jour. La tarte se conservera couverte et réfrigérée pendant quatre jours. Réchauffer au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:12:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11744,5037,'fr','Riz et haricots végétaliens en un seul pot','Sans gluten et faible en gras, ce plat de riz végétalien vibrant regorge de haricots rouges, d''olives vertes et de poivrons.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons (320 g), finement hachés","1 poivron orange, coupé en deux, épépiné et coupé en 4 à 5 gros morceaux","1 poivron rouge, coupé en deux, épépiné et coupé en 4 à 5 gros morceaux","3 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées","300 g de riz brun facile à cuire","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym","2 cuillères à soupe de paprika fumé","650 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud, préparé avec 2 cuillères à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","10 olives vertes dénoyautées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés","½ citron, coupé en quartiers"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 5 minutes en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez les poivrons et l''ail et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Ajoutez le riz, le thym et le paprika, puis versez le bouillon et incorporez les olives. Couvrez et laissez cuire à feu doux pendant 15 min. Incorporez les haricots rouges, puis couvrez et laissez cuire encore 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre. Garnir de quartiers de citron, puis couvrir et laisser reposer 5 minutes. Verser deux portions dans des bols et servir. Refroidissez et réfrigérez le reste pour le manger un autre jour. Se conservera au frais pendant une journée. Pour servir, réchauffez-le dans une poêle ou au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud (retirez les quartiers de citron avant de chauffer). Cette recette fait partie de notre plan d''alimentation saine gratuit de 7 jours. Pour accéder au plan de repas complet, cliquez ici."]','2026-01-11 00:12:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11745,5041,'fr','Chou-fleur rôti au fenouil et au quinoa','Empilez cette salade de quinoa aux légumes colorés sur une assiette, garnissez de chou-fleur rôti et arrosez de yogourt à l''ail pour un dîner sain et sans gluten.','["1 gros chou-fleur ou 2 petits, séparés en fleurons","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de fenouil","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, haché","2 poivrons (mélange de rouge, jaune ou orange), hachés","1 courgette, coupée en deux dans le sens de la longueur, épépinée et hachée","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 citron, jus et zesté","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt","250 g de quinoa cuit"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée et faites cuire le chou-fleur 5 min. Égoutter et étaler sur une surface pour que tout excès d''eau s''évapore.","Écrasez les graines de fenouil et de coriandre à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier et mélangez avec le paprika et une pincée d''assaisonnement. Mettez le chou-fleur dans un grand bol, arrosez de la moitié de l''huile d''olive et saupoudrez du mélange d''épices. Mélangez les fleurons pour les enrober complètement.","Disposez les fleurons sur une plaque à pâtisserie et espacez-les. Mettez les oignons rouges, les poivrons et les courgettes sur une plaque à pâtisserie séparée, arrosez du reste d''huile et faites cuire les deux pendant 30 à 35 minutes, en les retournant à mi-cuisson pour qu''ils dorent partout et deviennent légèrement croustillants par endroits.","Mélangez l''ail avec le jus de citron et incorporez le yaourt, en ajoutant un peu d''eau supplémentaire pour le détendre si nécessaire. Incorporer les oignons rôtis, les poivrons et les courgettes au quinoa cuit avec le zeste de citron et une pincée de sel.","Empilez la salade de quinoa dans une assiette, puis garnissez de fleurons de chou-fleur. Arroser de yaourt à l''ail."]','2026-01-11 00:12:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11746,5043,'fr','Ragoût espagnol de boulettes de viande et de haricots beurre','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce copieux one-pot est plein de saveurs méditerranéennes, avec du porc, de l''oignon rouge, des poivrons et du paprika fumé – un impressionnant 4 sur 5 par jour.','["350 g de porc haché maigre","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon rouge, haché","2 poivrons, tranchés, n''importe quelle couleur fera l''affaire","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika doux fumé","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre doré","petit bouquet de persil haché","pain croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Assaisonnez le porc en travaillant l''assaisonnement avec vos mains, puis façonnez de petites boulettes de viande. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez les boulettes de viande et faites cuire 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient entièrement dorées. Poussez d''un côté de la poêle et ajoutez l''oignon et les poivrons. Cuire encore 5 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient ramollis, puis incorporer l''ail et le paprika. Remuez le tout dans la poêle pendant 1 min, puis ajoutez les tomates. Couvrir avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter 10 min.","Découvrez, ajoutez les haricots, le sucre et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis laissez mijoter encore 10 minutes à découvert. Juste avant de servir, incorporez le persil. Servir avec du pain croustillant pour tremper, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:12:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11747,5045,'fr','Courge rôtie aux griottes, graines épicées et feta','Servez ce plat de courge ou de citrouille comme plat principal végétarien intelligent ou comme accompagnement d''un dîner, rempli de saveurs contrastées telles que le miel sucré, les cerises aigres et le fromage émietté salé.','["1 grosse ou 2 petites courges ou potirons, graines vidées et réservées, puis coupées en morceaux ou en quartiers (laisser la peau si elle n''est pas trop dure)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive ou de colza","100 ml de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","100 g de griottes séchées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame grillé","bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","100 g de feta émiettée","100 g de graines de citrouille (si vous n''en avez pas assez de votre citrouille, ajoutez les graines d''un sachet)","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre","une bonne pincée de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive ou de colza"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Disposez les quartiers de courge ou de potiron sur la plaque et arrosez d''huile. Bien assaisonner, mettre au four et rôtir pendant 35 à 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre (différentes variétés prendront plus ou moins de temps, alors vérifiez en appuyant sur la chair avec un couteau – elle doit être très tendre une fois cuite).","Pendant ce temps, préparez les graines épicées. Lavez et séchez les graines de votre courge, en enlevant tous les morceaux filandreux. Mélangez les graines, les épices et l''huile sur une autre plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, assaisonnez bien et mélangez. Mettez sur l''étagère sous la courge et faites rôtir ensemble pendant les 10 dernières minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit grillée.","Mettez le vinaigre, le miel et les cerises dans une petite casserole. Laisser mijoter doucement pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les cerises soient charnues et que la vinaigrette ait réduit de moitié. Incorporez une pincée de sel et l''huile de sésame, retirez du feu et laissez refroidir 10 minutes.","Pour servir, disposez une couche de quartiers chauds sur une assiette. Arrosez de vinaigrette sirupeuse et de cerises, de graines et de feuilles de menthe. Enfin, parsemez de feta."]','2026-01-11 00:12:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11748,5047,'fr','Tajine d''agneau persan','Ce ragoût réchauffant est épicé à la cannelle et au cumin et sucré aux abricots et aux dattes – parfait avec un couscous moelleux','["2 kg de filets de cou d''agneau","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive douce ou d''huile de tournesol","3 oignons moyens, coupés en fines tranches","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","4 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","4 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","grosse pincée de safran","2 bâtons de cannelle","2 citrons confits (en bocal), égouttés et coupés en fins quartiers","300 g d''abricots secs prêts à consommer","250 g de dattes séchées dénoyautées prêtes à consommer","100 g de pistaches décortiquées","2 cuillères à café d''eau de rose","25g de maïzena","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles grossièrement hachées","couscous cuit ou riz basmati, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Débarrasser l''agneau de toute graisse dure, le couper en morceaux et assaisonner le tout. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande cocotte anti-flamme et faites dorer l''agneau en 3-4 fois à feu vif pendant 1-2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement coloré. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile supplémentaire entre chaque lot et transférez dans un bol chaque fois qu''un lot est doré.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans le même plat à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et légèrement colorés. Incorporer l''ail, le cumin, la coriandre, la poudre de piment, le curcuma, 1 cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu et 1 cuillère à café de sel marin en flocons. Cuire 1 min en remuant. Remettez l''agneau dans le plat et ajoutez 1,5 litre d''eau, le safran, la cannelle et les citrons. Portez à ébullition en remuant plusieurs fois. Couvrir avec un couvercle et transférer au four. Cuire 1 h.","Sortez délicatement le plat du four et incorporez les abricots, les dattes et la moitié des pistaches, puis couvrez à nouveau et remettez au four. Cuire encore 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit très tendre.","Transférez le plat sur le feu et rectifiez l''assaisonnement selon votre goût. Mélangez la maïzena avec l''eau de rose et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide, puis incorporez-la au tajine. Cuire à feu moyen pendant 1 à 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe. (L''épaississement de la sauce avec de la maïzena n''est pas traditionnel mais aide le tajine à mieux se congeler.) Au moment de servir, hachez grossièrement les noix restantes et saupoudrez-en sur le dessus. Garnir de coriandre et servir avec du couscous ou du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:13:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11749,5049,'fr','Saumon avec pommes de terre nouvelles, salade de maïs et vinaigrette au basilic','Un souper de poisson sans chichi, composé d''ingrédients sains mais satisfaisants, pour vous aider à bien manger toute la semaine','["400 g de petites pommes de terre nouvelles","2 épis de maïs doux","4 filets de saumon sans peau","2 très grosses tomates, type steak de bœuf","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 échalote, hachée finement","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, hachées finement","une poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre dans l''eau bouillante jusqu''à\r\ntendre, en ajoutant le maïs pour les 5 dernières minutes,\r\npuis égouttez et laissez refroidir un peu.","Pour la vinaigrette, mélangez le vinaigre, l''huile,\r\néchalote, câpres, basilic et un peu d''assaisonnement.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Frottez un peu de vinaigrette\r\nsur le saumon et cuire côté peau\r\nvers le bas, pendant 7 à 8 minutes. Trancher les tomates et\r\ndéposer sur une assiette de service. Tranchez les pommes de terre,\r\ncoupez les épis de maïs et disposez-les\r\nsur les tomates. Garnir de saumon,\r\npuis arroser du reste de la vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:13:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11750,5051,'fr','Pizza fraîchement garnie','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Cette pizza sans gluten deviendra certainement l''une des préférées de toute la famille.','["200g de farine sans gluten","½ sel","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe de romarin haché","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu","125-150 ml d''eau tiède","Pot de 210 g de garniture pour bruschetta aux tomates (nous avons utilisé de la Napolina)","140 g de mozzarella, tranchée épaisse","½ avocat, tranché épaisse","Fusée en paquet de 70g","tomate cerise, coupée en deux","4 tranches de jambon de Parme","4 tranches de jambon","huile d''olive","vinaigre balsamique"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/ventilateur 200C/gaz 7. Mettre la farine, le sel, l''huile d''olive, la levure, le romarin et le poivre dans un robot culinaire. Pulser jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Pendant que le moteur tourne, ajoutez suffisamment d''eau pour amener la farine à une pâte molle mais non collante. Versez sur un plan de travail et pétrissez jusqu''à ce que le tout se rassemble.","Réduisez la pâte en deux. Si vous n''avez qu''une seule grille dans votre four et que vous cuisinez par lots, enveloppez la moitié dans du film alimentaire. Étalez chaque moitié directement sur des plaques à pâtisserie légèrement huilées en ronds très fins de 25 cm/10 pouces. Ne formez pas de rebord sur le bord. Étalez la garniture aux tomates sur chaque morceau de pâte, presque jusqu''au bord. Laisser reposer 15 min. Cuire au four chaud pendant 12 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit croustillante.","Soulevez chaque rond sur une assiette et servez chaud. Faites circuler les garnitures et laissez chaque convive assembler sa propre pizza."]','2026-01-11 00:13:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11751,5053,'fr','Poulet farci aux champignons et risotto au thym citronné','Avez-vous déjà essayé le risotto en accompagnement ? C''est parfait avec ces poitrines de poulet garnies d''une riche farce aux cèpes','["25 g de cèpes séchés, trempés dans 250 ml d''eau pendant 30 min, liquide de trempage réservé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","Paquet de 150 g de petits champignons de Paris finement hachés","2 brins de thym ou brins de thym citronné, effeuillés et hachés","175 ml de vin blanc","4 poitrines de poulet avec la peau","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","1 petit oignon, finement haché","140 g de riz pour risotto","600 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","2 brins de thym ou brins de thym citronné, effeuillés et hachés","jus et zeste d''un demi citron","50 g de parmesan râpé, plus 1 cuillère à soupe supplémentaire pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4.\r\nTout d’abord, préparez la farce. Hachez finement le\r\ncèpes trempés et réserver. Chauffer l''huile\r\ndans une poêle peu profonde, puis faites cuire doucement le\r\nl''oignon pendant 5 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps.\r\nAjoutez les cèpes, les champignons de Paris et\r\nfeuilles de thym, assaisonner, augmenter le feu,\r\npuis laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles champignons ont ramolli.","Ajouter le vin dans la poêle, puis réduire\r\nviolemment jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque sec. Ajoutez 50 ml de\r\nliquide de trempage des cèpes, puis continuez à\r\nréduire pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que vous\r\navoir une sauce sirupeuse. Laisser refroidir pendant\r\nquelques minutes, puis cuillère délicatement\r\nentre la peau et la chair du\r\npoitrines de poulet. Peut être fait par jour\r\nà l''avance et réfrigéré ou congelé pendant 1 mois.\r\nDécongeler au réfrigérateur avant la cuisson. Saison,\r\ndéposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie, côté peau vers le haut, puis\r\ncuire au four pendant 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\nle poulet est bien cuit et doré.","Pendant que le poulet cuit, préparez\r\nle risotto. Faire chauffer le beurre et l''huile d''olive\r\ndans une casserole. Ajoutez le céleri et l''oignon,\r\npuis faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 5 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajouter le riz, bien l''enrober\r\ndans l''huile, puis cuire 1 min. Peu à peu\r\najouter le bouillon une louche à la fois en remuant\r\nà chaque ajout jusqu''à absorption.\r\nContinuez à ajouter le bouillon et à remuer\r\njusqu''à ce que le risotto soit suintant et épais –\r\nenviron 20 minutes. Incorporer le thym, le citron\r\njus, zeste et parmesan.","Quand le poulet est bien cuit\r\net doré, retirer du four.\r\nRépartir le risotto dans des assiettes de service,\r\nsaupoudrer du parmesan supplémentaire et\r\ngarnir d''une poitrine de poulet. Verser dessus\r\nle jus de la poêle à poulet, puis\r\nservir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11752,5055,'fr','Rumsteak avec sauce rapide aux champignons et vin rouge','Préparez une sauce de style restaurant pour votre steak en 15 minutes – parfaite avec une purée crémeuse','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 rumstecks ​​(environ 200 g chacun)","140 g de champignons coupés en quartiers","2 branches de thym effeuillées","150 ml de vin rouge","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle. Assaisonner les steaks,\r\npuis faire revenir 2-3 minutes de chaque côté à feu moyen\r\nsaignant, ou cuisinez-le davantage à votre goût. Supprimer\r\nde la poêle, puis laisser reposer.","Ajouter les champignons et les feuilles de thym\r\ndans la poêle, puis cuire quelques minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et dorés. Versez le\r\nvin et faire bouillir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sirupeux, puis retourner\r\nhors du feu et incorporer le beurre. Saison.","Servir les steaks avec les champignons\r\nsauce versée dessus, accompagnée de crème\r\npurée et quelques légumes verts croquants du printemps."]','2026-01-11 00:13:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11753,5059,'fr','Poulet au romarin et sauce tomate','Cette cocotte à l''italienne vous réchauffera et son rapport qualité-prix est également excellent.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","1 brin de romarin, feuilles finement hachées","1 oignon rouge, finement tranché","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées","2 filets d''anchois, hachés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, égouttées","câpres avec 75 ml d''eau"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive, puis\r\nfaire dorer le poulet partout. Ajoutez la moitié du\r\nromarin haché, remuer pour bien enrober, puis\r\nréserver dans une assiette.","Dans la même poêle, faites chauffer le reste de l''huile,\r\npuis faites revenir doucement l''oignon pendant environ 5 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter l''ail, les anchois et\r\nle reste du romarin, puis faire revenir quelques minutes\r\nplus jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé. Versez les tomates\r\net câpres avec le vin, si utilisé, ou 75 ml\r\nde l''eau sinon. Portez à ébullition, puis remettez le\r\nmorceaux de poulet dans la poêle. Couvrir, puis cuire\r\npendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit\r\nà travers. Assaisonner et servir avec un vert croquant\r\nsalade et pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:13:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11754,5063,'fr','Pouding vapeur à la tige, au gingembre et à la courge','Le secret du délicieux dessert sans gluten de Jodie Montgomery-Cranny est la courge musquée râpée','["beurre, pour graisser","3 boules de gingembre provenant d''un pot, finement hachées, plus 4 à 6 cuillères à soupe de sirop du pot","3 gros œufs","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 g de courge butternut pelée et finement râpée","le zeste d''1 gros citron","175g de farine de riz","50g d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à café de gingembre moulu","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique"]','["Beurrer légèrement une bassine à pudding de 1,5 litre.\r\nMettez un tiers de la tige de gingembre et le tout\r\nle sirop de gingembre au fond. Annuler.","Dans un bol, battre les œufs et le sucre avec\r\nun fouet électrique jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et mousseux.\r\nIncorporer la courge musquée, le zeste de citron\r\net la tige de gingembre restante. Pliez le\r\ningrédients secs dans le mélange d''œufs avec\r\nune grande cuillère en métal jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Remplissez le bassin avec le mélange de génoise.\r\nCouvrir d''une couche de pâtisserie beurrée\r\nparchemin et papier d''aluminium, en faisant un pli\r\nau centre pour permettre au pudding de lever.\r\nAttachez solidement avec de la ficelle, puis mettez-le\r\nun cuiseur vapeur ou une grande poêle avec un couvercle retourné\r\nbol au fond. Ajouter de l''eau bouillante jusqu''à mi-hauteur des parois de la bassine,\r\ncouvrir avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter 1h30.\r\nVérifiez le niveau d''eau de temps en temps et\r\npuis, et rechargez si nécessaire.","Pour tester quand l''éponge est prête, insérez\r\nune brochette au centre. Ça devrait venir\r\npropre, sans trace de mélange cru.\r\nDéballez et servez chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:13:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11755,5065,'fr','Polenta au four aux épinards et fromage de chèvre','Cette recette végétarienne italienne est assez intelligente pour un dîner, mais ne contient que six ingrédients','["3 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","300 g d''épinards frais","Paquet de 500 g de polenta prête à l''emploi","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","100 g de fromage de chèvre avec croûte cassé en morceaux"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7 et\r\nfaire bouillir la bouilloire. Dans un bol, mélanger l''ail\r\net les tomates assaisonnées, puis versez\r\ndans un grand plat allant au four. Placez les épinards\r\ndans une grande passoire et versez de l''eau bouillante\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit flétri. Rincer à l''eau froide et\r\nessorez tout l''excès d''eau possible\r\navec vos mains. Hacher grossièrement, assaisonner,\r\net répartir sur les tomates.","Tranchez la polenta, puis superposez-la dessus\r\ndes épinards. Arroser d''huile et\r\ncuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes. Dispersion\r\nsur le fromage et remettre au four\r\npendant 5 minutes supplémentaires, ou jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit\r\ndoré et bouillonnant."]','2026-01-11 00:13:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11756,5067,'fr','Salade de quinoa au halloumi grillé','Essayez cette salade végétarienne facile, une excellente source de fer et dégustez-la comme déjeuner ou dîner léger. Il utilise du quinoa sans gluten pour une dose supplémentaire de protéines','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 petit oignon rouge, tranché","1 gros poivron rôti en bocal, tranché épaissement ou une poignée de poivrons tranchés déjà rôtis","200 g de quinoa","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","petit bouquet de persil plat, haché grossièrement","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","grosse pincée de sucre","Paquet de 250 g de fromage halloumi, coupé en 6 tranches"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un feu moyen\r\ncasserole. Cuire l''oignon et le poivron pendant\r\nquelques minutes, puis ajoutez le quinoa\r\net laissez cuire encore 3 minutes. Ajoutez le\r\nfaire bouillir, couvrir et baisser le feu\r\nà laisser mijoter. Cuire pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à\r\ndoux, puis incorporez la moitié du persil.\r\nFaites chauffer le gril.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le zeste de citron et\r\njus avec le persil restant et\r\nd''huile et une grosse pincée de sucre et de sel.\r\nGriller le halloumi jusqu''à ce que les deux côtés soient\r\ndoré et croustillant. Servir la salade avec\r\nle halloumi grillé et la vinaigrette\r\nversé sur tout."]','2026-01-11 00:13:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11757,5069,'fr','Épaule d''agneau effilochée glacée à la grenade','Cuire la viande très lentement dans du jus de fruit la rend fondante et le jus sert également de glaçage sucré.','["4 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe d''origan séché","1 citron coupé en quartiers, sans pépins","1½ kg d''épaule d''agneau avec os","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","1 l de jus de grange en carton","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","250 g de yaourt nature","Pot de 100 g de graines de grenade ou les graines d''une grenade fraîche","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées"]','["Mettez l''ail, la cannelle, le cumin,\r\norigan et citron dans un mixeur avec\r\n1 cuillère à café de sel et 2 cuillères à café de poivre noir. Mélange\r\njusqu''à consistance lisse. Mettez l''agneau dans un grand\r\nrôtissoire et versez la marinade sur le\r\nhaut. Masser partout l''agneau et partir\r\npendant 24 heures au réfrigérateur, ou jusqu''à 2 jours.","Sortir l''agneau du réfrigérateur 1 heure avant\r\ncuisine. Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C ventilé/\r\ngaz 3. Répartissez les oignons autour du\r\nagneau, en mettant un peu en dessous, puis\r\nverser dessus le jus de grenade. Couverture\r\nl''agneau avec du papier d''aluminium et cuire 4 heures.","Retirez le papier d''aluminium, versez délicatement le\r\njus de grenade charnu de la boîte\r\ndans une grande casserole et ajoutez le miel.\r\nAugmenter le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7,\r\nrecouvrir l''agneau et poursuivre la cuisson pendant\r\n30 minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites bouillonner la cuisson\r\nliquide à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''il soit réduit et épais\r\net sirupeux – cela peut prendre jusqu''à 30 minutes.","Versez le glaçage collant à la grenade dessus\r\nl''agneau et les oignons et retournez au\r\ncuire encore 30 minutes au four, à découvert,\r\njusqu''à ce que le glaçage bouillonne et juste\r\ncommence à carboniser, et l''agneau est vraiment\r\ntendre. Mélangez le yaourt, la majeure partie\r\ngraines de grenade et feuilles de menthe\r\nun petit bol. Râpez l''agneau à table\r\net servir avec les oignons gluants et le\r\nyaourt à la menthe et à la grenade. Disperser\r\nles graines de grenade restantes."]','2026-01-11 00:13:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11758,5071,'fr','Haricots verts à l''ail','Un simple sauté de haricots frais avec de l''ail légèrement frit et une touche d''huile d''olive constitue un accompagnement sain et polyvalent.','["300 g de haricots verts parés","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Cuire les haricots verts dans l''eau bouillante\r\npendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres, puis égouttez-les\r\nbien et sécher à la vapeur pendant une minute.","Pendant ce temps, faites revenir doucement l''ail dans le\r\nhuile jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement dorée – pas plus. Lancer\r\navec les haricots, assaisonner et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11759,5073,'fr','Pommes de terre fondantes aux herbes','Coupez vos patates, faites-les frire entières, puis laissez mijoter avec du bouillon, du romarin, du thym et du citron pour créer un accompagnement parfaitement tendre.','["1½ kg de petites pommes de terre farineuses, type Désirée ou Maris Piper, pelées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","3 brins de thym","3 brins de thym citronné","2 brins de romarin","3 feuilles de laurier","le zeste épluché d''1 citron pelé avec un économe","environ 600 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes sans gluten ni blé (vérifier l''étiquette)"]','["Coupez le haut et le bas de chaque pomme de terre\r\nafin qu''ils reposent à plat des deux côtés. Chaleur\r\nl''huile dans une grande poêle ou à l''épreuve des flammes\r\ncocotte et faire revenir les pommes de terre sur les deux\r\ncôtés jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés foncés, 10-15 minutes.","Incorporez l''ail, le thym, le romarin,\r\nfeuilles de laurier et zeste, puis versez suffisamment\r\nstock pour monter à mi-hauteur du côté du\r\npommes de terre. Laissez mijoter 20 à 30 minutes, puis\r\nretourner les pommes de terre et cuire l''autre côté\r\npendant encore 20 à 30 minutes, en complétant avec\r\nplus de bouillon s''il s''évapore. Continuer\r\ncuire jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient vraiment\r\ntendre et la majeure partie du stock a disparu.\r\nBien assaisonner et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11760,5075,'fr','Côtelettes d''agneau rôties au romarin','Ce souper de côtelettes d''agneau dans une poêle ne nécessite qu''un assemblage rapide : emballez-le dans les saveurs méditerranéennes puis laissez le four faire le travail.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 côtelettes d''agneau","1 kg de pommes de terre coupées en petits morceaux","4 brins de romarin","4 gousses d''ail, laissées entières","250 g de tomates cerises","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique"]','["Mettez le four à chaleur tournante 200C/\r\nconventionnel 220C/gaz 7. Chauffer la moitié\r\nl''huile dans un plat à rôtir ignifuge ou\r\nsauteuse allant au four. Faire dorer l''agneau\r\npendant 2 minutes de chaque côté, puis retirez-le\r\nde la poêle et réserver. Ajoutez le reste\r\nde l''huile dans la poêle, ajoutez les pommes de terre,\r\npuis faire frire pendant 4 à 5 minutes, jusqu''à commencer\r\ndorer. Ajoutez le romarin et l''ail,\r\npuis remettez également l''agneau dans la poêle.","Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes,\r\npuis répartissez sur les tomates et\r\narroser de vinaigre balsamique. Lieu\r\nremettre au four pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles tomates commencent tout juste à se fendre. Supprimer\r\ndu four et servir directement\r\ndu plat."]','2026-01-11 00:13:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11761,5077,'fr','Poulet collant au xérès, amandes et dattes','Tendres cuisses de poulet rôties enrobées d''un glaçage qui fait claquer les lèvres – idéal pour nourrir une foule','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 cuisses de poulet","2 oignons moyens, hachés","15 gousses d''ail, laissées entières avec la peau","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","250 ml de sherry, comme Oloroso ou Manzanilla","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron, plus le zeste supplémentaire pour servir","50 g d''amandes entières blanchies (nous avons utilisé du Marcona), hachées grossièrement","12 grosses dattes molles, hachées","20 g de persil plat haché grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.\r\nFaites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle\r\ncasserole. Assaisonner le poulet, puis le faire revenir\r\ntous les côtés. Retirez le poulet, placez-le dans\r\nun grand plat allant au four, puis réserver. Ajoutez le\r\nle reste de l''huile, les oignons et l''ail au\r\npoêle, puis assaisonner. Faire frire pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Incorporer le cumin, le xérès et le citron\r\nle zeste et le jus. Portez à ébullition, puis ajoutez\r\nles amandes, les dattes et la moitié du persil.","Versez la sauce sur le poulet. Couverture\r\navec du papier d''aluminium, puis rôtir pendant 1 heure jusqu''à tendreté,\r\nretirer le papier d''aluminium après 15 minutes. Verser le\r\nliquide sur le poulet plusieurs fois\r\npendant la torréfaction. Servir empilé sur un grand\r\nassiette avec la sauce versée dessus, le\r\ngousses d''ail, persil restant et un peu\r\nzeste de citron supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:13:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11762,5079,'fr','Daurade entière rôtie avec pommes de terre et olives','Rôtir le poisson avec les pommes de terre permet de mélanger toutes les belles saveurs','["400 g de pommes de terre nouvelles ou petites","une grosse poignée de petites olives noires","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","gros bouquet de persil plat, feuilles grossièrement hachées, tiges réservées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","zester un demi citron","1 dorade entière d''environ 450 g, éviscérée, avec la tête","petit verre de vin blanc"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/chaleur tournante 200C/gaz 7.\r\nCuire les pommes de terre dans l''eau bouillante pendant environ\r\n10 min, coupez-le en tranches épaisses, puis laissez-le refroidir. Dans un\r\nbol, mélanger les pommes de terre avec les olives, l''ail,\r\nla moitié du persil haché, la moitié de l''huile d''olive,\r\nle zeste de citron, le sel et le poivre. Astuce ceci\r\nmélanger au fond d''un plat à gratin moyen.","Assaisonner le poisson et déposer les tiges de persil\r\ndans la cavité. Disposez le poisson sur les pommes de terre\r\net arroser du reste d''huile d''olive. Cuire au four\r\npendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre commencent à devenir croustillantes\r\nsur les bords. Versez le vin dessus, puis\r\nremettre au four encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles pommes de terre sont dorées et le poisson est cuit.","Sortez le plat du four, répartissez dessus\r\nle reste du persil et porter le plat au\r\ntableau. Lorsque vous servez, n''oubliez pas le\r\nde bons jus de vin blanc au fond du\r\nplat. Délicieux avec un simple bol d''épinards."]','2026-01-11 00:13:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11763,5081,'fr','Salade César au poulet maigre','Transformez la vinaigrette César typiquement lourde en remplaçant la mayonnaise par du yaourt grec – faible en gras et en calories, mais toujours délicieusement crémeux.','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","jus d''1 citron","1 grosse laitue romaine ou Cos, coupée en gros morceaux","1 barquette de cresson","4 œufs durs, pelés et coupés en quartiers","25 g de parmesan finement râpé","50 g de filets d''anchois, moitié hachés, moitié entiers","170 g de yaourt grec sans matière grasse en pot pot"]','["Mettez les poitrines de poulet dans un grand bol avec l''huile d''olive et 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron, puis assaisonnez. Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Mettez les poitrines de poulet sur une plaque recouverte de papier d''aluminium et faites-les cuire sous le gril pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et bien cuites, en les retournant une fois pendant la cuisson. Transférer dans une assiette ou une planche et trancher.","Disposer la laitue, le cresson et les œufs sur une assiette ou des assiettes de service et garnir de poulet cuit. Mélangez le parmesan, les anchois hachés, le yaourt et le reste du jus de citron, assaisonnez selon votre goût et versez sur la salade. Disposez les filets d''anchois entiers sur chaque salade."]','2026-01-11 00:13:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11764,5083,'fr','Frittata au chou frisé et au chèvre','Cette omelette fourrée aux oignons rouges, au chou frisé et au fromage de chèvre est végétarienne, sans gluten et assez rapide à préparer en milieu de semaine.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons rouges, tranchés finement","200 g de chou frisé haché","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","8 gros œufs légèrement battus avec un peu d''assaisonnement","100 g de fromage de chèvre à pâte ferme, coupé en morceaux"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle allant au four de 25 cm. Ajouter les oignons et cuire 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et caramélisés. Ajoutez le chou frisé et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et laissez cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chou frisé soit fané. Versez le vinaigre balsamique et faites bouillonner pendant 1 min, puis ajoutez les œufs. Remuez rapidement le tout, puis laissez cuire tranquillement à feu doux-moyen pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''œuf soit presque pris et que la frittata devienne dorée au fond.","Répartir le fromage de chèvre sur la frittata. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage bouillonne et que la frittata soit prise au centre."]','2026-01-11 00:13:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11765,5085,'fr','Salade de pommes de terre aux anchois et œufs de caille','Cette salade saine et satisfaisante constitue un savoureux panier-repas ou un dîner léger avec des haricots verts, du persil, de la ciboulette et du citron.','["4 œufs de caille","100 g de haricots verts","100 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux ou en quatre si elles sont très grosses","1 anchois, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de persil haché","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette hachée","jus ½ citron"]','["Porter une casserole moyenne d''eau à ébullition. Plongez les œufs de caille dans l’eau et laissez cuire 2 min. Retirez les œufs avec une écumoire et mettez-les dans un bol d''eau froide. Ajouter les haricots dans la poêle, laisser mijoter 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, puis retirer de la poêle avec une écumoire et plonger dans le bol d''eau froide.","Mettez les pommes de terre dans la poêle et faites-les bouillir pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Égouttez les pommes de terre dans une passoire et laissez-les refroidir. Pendant que les pommes de terre refroidissent, épluchez les œufs et coupez-les en deux. Mélangez les pommes de terre et les haricots avec les anchois hachés, les herbes et le jus de citron. Garnir avec les œufs de caille pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11766,5087,'fr','Salade de maquereau super vert','Les haricots verts, les épinards et le brocoli constituent une excellente base pour une boîte à lunch saine avec du poisson gras et une vinaigrette au yaourt.','["85g de haricots verts","85 g de brocoli à tige fine","une grosse poignée de pousses d''épinards","2 filets de maquereau fumés à chaud (environ 75g), pelés et émiettés","2 cuillères à café de graines de tournesol grillées","75 ml de yaourt nature faible en gras","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","1 cuillère à café de moutarde complète","2 cuillères à café d''aneth haché, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Faites bouillir une casserole d’eau. Ajoutez le vert\r\nharicots et cuire 2 minutes, puis ajouter\r\nle brocoli et cuire encore 4 min.\r\nÉgoutter, passer sous l''eau froide jusqu''à refroidissement,\r\npuis bien égoutter.","Pour faire la vinaigrette, mélangez le tout\r\nles ingrédients dans un petit pot de confiture avec\r\nun zeste de poivre noir, mettez le couvercle\r\net secouez-le bien.","Pour servir, mélangez le cuit\r\nlégumes avec les épinards et le maquereau et\r\nmettre dans une boîte à lunch. Juste avant de manger,\r\nverser sur la vinaigrette, répartir sur le\r\ngraines de tournesol et ajoutez une mouture de noir\r\npoivre et aneth supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:13:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11767,5089,'fr','Quiche au chèvre & cresson','Une quiche au chèvre et au cresson sans gluten et vraiment savoureuse','["225 g de farine sans gluten, plus un peu pour rouler","100g de beurre","1 gros œuf battu, plus un œuf battu supplémentaire pour le badigeonnage","1 oignon moyen, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","100 g de cresson haché grossièrement","2 gros œufs","150 ml de lait","150 ml de bûche de chèvre à pâte molle sans croûte, en gros morceaux","muscade fraîchement râpée, facultatif"]','["Mettez la farine et une pincée de sel dans un grand bol. Incorporer le beurre jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure. Incorporer l''œuf et environ 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour former une pâte molle. Bien pétrir puis envelopper et réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes.","Préchauffer le four à 200C/gaz 6/chaleur tournante 180C. Pétrissez à nouveau la pâte et étalez-la pour tapisser un moule à flan à fond meuble de 20 cm (la pâte ne rétrécira pas, donc pas besoin de la refroidir). Rebouchez les trous avec de la pâte de rechange et badigeonnez le fond et les côtés d''œuf.","Pour la garniture, faites revenir l''oignon dans l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre, ajoutez le cresson et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste flétri. Battez les œufs et le lait et incorporez le mélange de cresson et de chèvre.","Assaisonnez et si vous le souhaitez, ajoutez une pincée de muscade. Disposez le moule à flan sur une plaque à pâtisserie et enfournez la pâte à blanc pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez la garniture et enfournez pour 15 minutes. Réduire le feu à 180°C/gaz 4/ventilateur 160°C et cuire pendant 25-30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement pris."]','2026-01-11 00:13:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11768,5091,'fr','Salade de lentilles, carottes et jambon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Utilisez des légumineuses comme base pour votre salade sucrée à la moutarde pour créer un déjeuner sain, riche en fibres et en vitamine C.','["250 g de jambon râpé","Boîte de 400 g de lentilles égouttées","2 carottes, coupées en petits dés","4 branches de céleri, hachées finement","une poignée de persil finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","une bonne pincée de sucre","1 cuillère à café de moutarde complète"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients de la salade dans un\r\ngrand bol à mélanger. Pour réaliser la vinaigrette,\r\nmélanger les ingrédients avec\r\n1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nVersez la vinaigrette sur la salade et\r\nbien mélanger pour combiner."]','2026-01-11 00:13:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11769,5095,'fr','Salade estivale tiède d''artichauts et d''asperges','Ce plat est entièrement consacré aux légumes au plus fort de leur saison','["4 artichauts, parés","2 citrons, coupés en deux","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de coriandre","1 anis étoilé","grosse branche de thym","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","gros bouquet (environ 30) de pointes d''asperges","4 poignées de petites feuilles de salade type micro-feuilles","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","petit bouquet de ciboulette finement ciselée","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique (j''aime utiliser du vinaigre balsamique blanc)"]','["Quand les artichauts sont parés,\r\ntrouvez une casserole assez large pour contenir\r\nles en une seule couche. Presser\r\njus d''un citron à moitié rempli à moitié avec\r\neau froide. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, le\r\népices, thym, vinaigre, artichauts et un\r\ngénéreuse pincée de sel. Portez à ébullition,\r\npuis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant\r\nenviron 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Éteignez le feu\r\net laissez refroidir (voir conseils ci-dessous).","Préparez les asperges. Tout d''abord,\r\ncoupez les extrémités ligneuses, puis\r\nutilisez un éplucheur à lame pivotante pour couper\r\nles extrémités, en les faisant pivoter au fur et à mesure pour qu''elles\r\nfinissent par avoir la même épaisseur que les pointes.","Apportez une grande casserole de sel\r\nl''eau à ébullition. Cuire le\r\nasperges pendant 2 minutes, puis égouttez-les\r\net basculez directement dans l''eau fortement glacée.\r\nLaisser refroidir complètement, égoutter à nouveau,\r\npuis mettre de côté.","Pour faire la vinaigrette, faites chauffer\r\n2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle,\r\npuis faites revenir doucement l''oignon rouge\r\npendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Éteignez le feu\r\nincorporer l''oignon nouveau et la ciboulette, puis\r\nverser dans une cruche. Verser le reste de l''huile\r\net le vinaigre dans la vinaigrette, puis\r\nassaisonner au goût.","Préparez les légumes. Vidanger\r\nles artichauts, puis coupez-les chacun en\r\n6 cales. Trancher chaque asperge\r\nsur l''angle en 3 morceaux.","Essuyez la poêle à vinaigrette\r\net faites chauffer le reste de l''olive\r\nhuile. Faire revenir les asperges avec un peu\r\nassaisonner jusqu''à ce qu''il soit brillant et commencer à\r\ncolorer, puis verser dans une assiette. Lieu\r\nremettre la casserole sur le feu, puis cuire\r\nles quartiers d''artichauts jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent\r\ndorer. Éteignez le feu et vous\r\nsont prêts à être servis.","Verser une flaque de vinaigrette dans\r\nle centre de chaque assiette. Équilibrer les morceaux d''asperges\r\nse confronter pour faire le tour\r\nle pansement. Disposez les artichauts parmi\r\nles asperges pour qu''elles soient uniformément\r\nrépartis sur l''assiette. Répartir sur les feuilles de salade et\r\narroser du reste de la vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:13:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11770,5097,'fr','Veste épicée au thon et au fromage cottage','Pour un déjeuner énergétique faible en gras, essayez une pomme de terre au four riche en glucides avec une garniture légère et nutritive.','["Boîte de 225 g de thon égoutté","½ piment rouge, haché","1 oignon nouveau, tranché","une poignée de tomates cerises coupées en deux","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","1 pomme de terre en chemise de taille moyenne","150 g de fromage blanc allégé"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/Gaz 4/four ventilé 160°C. Piquer la pomme de terre plusieurs fois avec une fourchette et la déposer directement sur une grille dans la partie la plus chaude du four. Cuire au four environ 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre à l''intérieur.","Mélanger le thon avec le piment, l''oignon nouveau et la cerise\r\ntomates et coriandre. Veste fendue\r\npomme de terre et remplir avec le mélange de thon et\r\nfromage cottage."]','2026-01-11 00:13:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11771,5099,'fr','Pains plats au cumin grillé','Une recette de pain sans gluten, idéale comme collation le midi avec quelques trempettes','["400 g de farine autolevante sans gluten, plus un peu pour saupoudrer (nous avons utilisé Doves)","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin, grillées","300 ml de yaourt nature"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen et épousseter\r\nune plaque à pâtisserie avec un peu de farine. Mélangez le\r\nfarine et graines de cumin dans un bol, puis\r\nsaison. Incorporer le yaourt et 100 ml\r\neau, puis bien mélanger pour former une pâte molle.","Divisez la pâte en 8 morceaux égaux,\r\npuis formez des cercles ou des ovales d''environ\r\n½ cm d''épaisseur. Saupoudrez légèrement d''un peu de farine.\r\nGriller sur la plaque à pâtisserie pendant 3 à 5 minutes\r\nde chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et gonflés.\r\nServir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:13:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11772,5103,'fr','Nouilles de riz aux tomates séchées, parmesan et basilic','Une excellente alternative sans gluten aux pâtes. Méfiez-vous également des nouilles soba sans blé','["250 g de nouilles de riz moyennes","85 g de tomates séchées et 2 cuillères à soupe de leur huile","3 gousses d''ail","25 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), en copeaux ou râpé","une grosse poignée de feuilles de basilic déchirées"]','["Préparez les nouilles selon le paquet\r\ninstructions, puis égouttez-les. Faites chauffer l''huile, puis\r\nfaire revenir les tomates et l''ail pendant 3 minutes.\r\nMélanger les nouilles et la majeure partie du fromage\r\net le basilic dans la poêle, assaisonner, puis parsemer\r\nsur le reste du fromage et du basilic."]','2026-01-11 00:13:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11773,5105,'fr','Salade épicée au thon et au quinoa','Des sachets de céréales prêts à manger vous permettent de prendre un déjeuner sain en quelques minutes – à mélanger avec des légumes et du poisson durable','["1 oignon, tranché","350 g de poivrons tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 piment rouge, finement haché","Sachet de 225g de quinoa prêt à consommer","350 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","une poignée d''olives noires hachées","Pot de 225 g de thon germon à l''huile d''olive, émietté"]','["Faire revenir l''oignon et les poivrons dans l''huile\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter le piment et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Mélangez le quinoa, le mélange d''oignons, la cerise\r\ntomates, olives et thon ensemble. Diviser\r\nentre 4 assiettes, versez un peu de\r\nhuile du pot de thon, assaisonner et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11774,5107,'fr','Salade de maquereau et pommes de terre avec vinaigrette au citron et au carvi','Préparez votre boîte à lunch avec du poisson fumé riche en oméga-3, des pommes de terre nouvelles, de la betterave et une vinaigrette légère aux agrumes.','["175 g de petites pommes de terre nouvelles","200 g de filets de maquereau fumés, sans la peau","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","140 g de petites betteraves cuites, coupées en quartiers","petit bouquet d''aneth, finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","jus d''1 citron, le zeste de la moitié","¼ cuillère à café de graines de carvi"]','["Placer les pommes de terre dans un petit\r\nune casserole d''eau bouillante et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres à la fourchette. Frais\r\net coupé en tranches épaisses.","Écaillez le maquereau dans un bol\r\net ajoutez les pommes de terre refroidies, printanières\r\noignons, betteraves rouges et aneth.","Dans un autre bol, fouettez ensemble le\r\nhuile d''olive, jus de citron, graines de carvi et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement. Verser sur la salade\r\net mélangez bien le tout pour bien l''enrober. Dispersion\r\nsur le zeste de citron. Emballer dans du plastique\r\ncontenants et réfrigérer, ou manger immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11775,5111,'fr','Salade de tomates, pastèque et feta avec vinaigrette à la menthe','Ce délice rouge et blanc est un côté estival qui va avec tout','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","¼ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée","4 tomates, hachées","500 g de pastèque, coupée en morceaux","200 g de fromage feta émietté"]','["Préparez la vinaigrette en mélangeant l''huile, le vinaigre, les flocons de piment et la menthe avec un peu d''assaisonnement.","Mettez les tomates et la pastèque dans un bol. Versez dessus la vinaigrette et laissez reposer 10 minutes pour que les fruits deviennent bien juteux. Incorporer délicatement la feta, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11776,5113,'fr','Mini frittatas jambon & asperges','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ces plats simples sont un excellent ajout à votre premier pique-nique de l''année – ou comme collation légère au déjeuner, quelle que soit la météo.','["12 tranches de jambon","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","Paquet de 125 g de pointes d''asperges","6 oeufs","100 ml de lait","85 g de parmesan râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer un moule à muffins à 12 trous et tapisser\r\nchaque trou avec une tranche de prosciutto pour\r\ncouvrir la base et les côtés. Chauffer l''huile dans un\r\npetite poêle et faire revenir l''oignon pendant\r\n5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Pendant ce temps, cassez le\r\npointe des asperges et réserver.\r\nTranchez finement les tiges et ajoutez-les aux oignons lorsqu''ils sont tendres. Cuire 2-3 minutes\r\nplus, puis retirez-le et laissez-le refroidir.","Battez les œufs, le lait et les ¾ du\r\nParmesan ensemble. Ajoutez un peu d''oignon\r\nmélanger dans chaque trou de muffin. Diviser\r\nle mélange d''œufs, puis garnir d''asperges\r\nla pointe se termine. Saupoudrer du reste\r\nParmesan et cuire 18-20 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit pris.","Laisser refroidir quelques minutes puis\r\nretirer du moule et manger chaud ou\r\nfroid."]','2026-01-11 00:13:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11777,5115,'fr','Salade de courge musquée','Obtenez 4 de vos 5 par jour avec cette salade super saine, pourquoi ne pas en préparer un peu plus pour votre boîte à lunch également','["1 courge musquée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en dés","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","50g de riz sauvage et brun","50 g de lentilles du Puy","1 tête de brocoli, coupée en fleurons","50 g de canneberges séchées","25g de graines de citrouille","jus d''1 citron"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nÉtalez la courge sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie\r\nplaque, arroser d''huile et cuire au four\r\npendant 30 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le riz et les lentilles\r\ndans de l''eau bouillante salée pendant 20 mn,\r\najouter le brocoli pour les 4 dernières minutes\r\nde cuisine. Bien égoutter, puis incorporer le\r\ncanneberges et graines de citrouille avec\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement. Ajoutez la courge, versez\r\nsur le jus de citron et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11778,5117,'fr','Salade de quinoa aux herbes, feta et grenade','Un meze bowl de style moyen-oriental avec des céréales saines, du persil, de la menthe et de la coriandre','["300 g de quinoa","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","85 g de raisins secs ou raisins secs","100 g de fromage feta émietté","200 g de graines de grenade du pot ou du fruit","85 g de pignons de pin grillés ou d''amandes effilées grillées","un petit paquet de coriandre, de persil plat et de menthe, hachés grossièrement","jus de 3 citrons","1 cuillère à café de sucre"]','["Faites cuire le quinoa en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage – il doit être tendre mais avec un peu de mordant. Bien égoutter et étaler sur une assiette ou un bol large et peu profond pour refroidir rapidement et sécher à la vapeur.","Lorsque le quinoa est presque froid, mélangez tous les ingrédients restants avec beaucoup d''assaisonnement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11779,5121,'fr','Salade de quinoa et feta aux légumes rôtis','Le quinoa est une céréale fine et riche en protéines qui vous aide à rester rassasié jusqu''à votre prochain repas, faisant de cette salade végétarienne un excellent complément pour votre boîte à lunch.','["200 g de quinoa","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge pelé mais laissé entier, puis coupé en tranches rondes de 1 cm d''épaisseur","2 poivrons, rouges, jaunes ou mélanges, épépinés et coupés en gros quartiers","200 g de petites courgettes coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","3 gousses d''ail, non pelées","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","pincée de sucre","petit paquet de persil plat, haché grossièrement","200 g de feta en paquet"]','["Faites cuire le quinoa en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-le bien et réservez.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélangez l''oignon et les poivrons avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et l''assaisonnement sur une plaque à rôtir, puis faites rôtir pendant 15 minutes.","Mélangez les courgettes et l''ail avec le reste des légumes et faites rôtir encore 15 minutes.","Pressez les gousses d''ail rôties pour les retirer de leur peau et écrasez-les avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Incorporer le reste de l''huile, le jus et le zeste de citron et assaisonner avec du sucre au goût. Arroser de quinoa et mélanger avec les légumes rôtis et le persil. Émiettez la feta, mélangez à nouveau délicatement et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11780,5127,'fr','Quartiers de courge en croûte de Dukkah','Enrober les gros quartiers de courge d''un enrobage croustillant et épicé de noisettes, de graines de coriandre, de graines de sésame et de cumin et cuire au four jusqu''à tendreté.','["50 g de noisettes blanchies","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de coriandre","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 grosse courge musquée","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faire griller les noisettes dans une poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Ajoutez la coriandre et les graines de sésame, et faites griller encore 1 min. Réserver et laisser refroidir, puis ajouter le cumin moulu et écraser ensemble à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier.","Épluchez la courge butternut, retirez les graines et coupez-la en quartiers. Mélangez les quartiers avec l’huile, puis incorporez l’enrobage dukkah. Étaler en une seule couche sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire pendant 30 à 40 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à tendreté."]','2026-01-11 00:13:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11781,5129,'fr','Chips de pommes','Cette collation saine cuite au four ne contient qu''un seul ingrédient - parfaite pour garnir des desserts, des boissons chaudes fruitées ou consommée comme remontant','["1 pomme"]','["Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1. Trancher finement la pomme jusqu''au cœur – utilisez une mandoline, si vous en avez une, pour obtenir de fines tranches. Disposez les tranches sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et enfournez pour 40 minutes. Laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:13:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11782,5131,'fr','Rouleaux de saucisses au fromage Glamorgan','Ces bouchées festives fondantes offrent une alternative savoureuse à vos invités végétariens – elles sont également sans gluten.','["175 g de farine sans gluten (nous avons utilisé Doves Farm, largement disponible)","85g de beurre","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","1 jaune d''œuf mélangé à 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide","100 g de chapelure sans gluten (nous avons utilisé du pain Dietary Specials sans gluten)","100 g de fromage Caerphilly râpé","1 petit poireau haché finement","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde, écrasées","3 jaunes d''œufs","une poignée de feuilles d''estragon ou de thym (facultatif)"]','["Pour faire la pâte, mettre la farine, le beurre\r\net le poivre de Cayenne dans un robot culinaire,\r\npuis réduire en chapelure fine. saupoudrer\r\nle mélange d''œufs et d''eau sur la farine et\r\npulser à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à arriver\r\nensemble. Versez le mélange sur une planche, puis\r\nPressez doucement la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à gonfler.\r\nrassembler en boule, en ajoutant plus d''eau\r\nsi c''est sec. Divisez le mélange en deux, roulez\r\nchaque morceau dans un rectangle de 12 x 30 cm et\r\nglisser sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Ne vous refroidissez pas.","Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.\r\nMélangez les ingrédients de la garniture ensemble, sauf\r\nun jaune d''oeuf, dont vous avez besoin pour le glaçage,\r\ndans un robot culinaire. Divisez en deux et roulez\r\nchacun en forme de boudin de 30 cm de long. Poser\r\nun saucisson au fromage sur un côté de la pâte.\r\nBadigeonner le saucisson et la pâte de jaune d''oeuf\r\net repliez la pâte sur le dessus pour bien envelopper le\r\nsaucisse. Scellez les deux bords, coupez les extrémités,\r\npuis coupez-le en morceaux de 2 cm. Disposer sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie et réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes.","Badigeonnez les rouleaux avec un peu plus de jaune d''oeuf,\r\nplacez les herbes dessus, si vous le souhaitez, puis faites cuire au four pendant\r\n12-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:13:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11783,5133,'fr','Pommes de terre en mini robe','Faites cuire des pommes de terre nouvelles et garnissez de crème sure et de ciboulette pour un canapé simple et en bouchée.','["500 g de pommes de terre nouvelles","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","sel de mer","75 ml de crème sure demi-écrémée","petit bouquet de ciboulette, ciselée"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Piquer les pommes de terre avec une fourchette, frotter avec l''huile, puis mélanger avec du sel marin. Disposez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et enfournez pendant 1 h. Laissez refroidir les pommes de terre pendant 10 à 15 minutes, puis coupez une petite croix sur le dessus de chacune et pincez les bases pour les ouvrir un peu. Ajoutez à chacun une cuillère à café de crème sure, un peu de poivre noir fraîchement moulu et une pincée de ciboulette. Servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:13:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11784,5135,'fr','Gâteau aux carottes sans gluten','La jeune cuisinière Emily partage sa recette simple et sans chichi de gâteau aux carottes sans gluten','["140 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de sucre en poudre","250 g de carottes râpées","140 g de raisins secs","2 œufs légèrement battus","200 g de farine divine sans gluten","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten","50 g de noix mélangées hachées","75 g de beurre ramolli","175 g de sucre glace","3 cuillères à café de cannelle, plus un peu pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 900 g/2 lb\r\navec du papier sulfurisé.","Battre le beurre et le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres\r\net crémeux, puis incorporer le\r\ncarottes et raisins secs. Versez les œufs dans\r\nle mélange petit à petit.","Ajouter la farine, la cannelle, le bicarbonate de soude\r\npoudre et la plupart des noix hachées\r\net bien mélanger. Versez le mélange dans le pain\r\nmoule, puis cuire au four pendant 50 à 55 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un\r\nune brochette enfoncée au milieu sort\r\npropre. Laisser refroidir dans le moule 15 mn,\r\npuis retirer du moule et laisser refroidir\r\ncomplètement sur une grille.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le glaçage. Battre le\r\nbeurre dans un grand bol jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien mou,\r\najoutez le sucre glace et la cannelle, puis\r\nbattre jusqu''à consistance épaisse et crémeuse. Quand le\r\nle gâteau est froid, étalez le glaçage dessus, puis\r\nsaupoudrer d''un peu plus de cannelle et\r\nles noix hachées restantes."]','2026-01-11 00:13:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11785,5137,'fr','Gâteau au citron et à l''orange','Cette pièce maîtresse aux agrumes contient un ingrédient secret qui donne au gâteau une belle texture, tout en le rendant sans gluten ni blé.','["250 g de beurre ramolli","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs","250 g de farine autolevante sans gluten (nous avons utilisé Doves Farm, qui est également sans blé)","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique sans gluten","250 g de purée de pommes de terre, fourchue pour qu''elle ne forme pas un seul morceau","2 citrons, le zeste et le jus","1 orange, le zeste et le jus","175 g de sucre glace","presser le jus de citron (économiser un peu sur la quantité du gâteau)","œufs en chocolat, pour décorer, si vous le souhaitez (vérifiez qu''ils sont sans gluten)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un gâteau rond de 20 cm de profondeur\r\nétain. Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et mousseux, puis battez progressivement\r\ndans les œufs, un à un. Incorporer la farine,\r\nlevure chimique, purée de pommes de terre, zestes et\r\njus. Grattez dans le moule et nivelez le dessus.\r\nCuire au four pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et en brochette\r\nenfoncé, il ressort propre. Refroidir dans la boîte\r\npendant 10 minutes, puis placez-le sur une grille.","Tamisez le sucre glace, puis mélangez-y suffisamment\r\ndu jus de citron pour faire un raide, mais quand même\r\nglaçage qui coule. Répartir sur le gâteau pour qu''il\r\ncoule un peu sur les côtés. Ajouter\r\nquelques œufs en chocolat, si vous en utilisez. Laisser jusqu''à\r\nle glaçage a pris, puis tranchez et servez.\r\nDélicieux avec une cuillerée de yaourt nature."]','2026-01-11 00:13:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11786,5139,'fr','Crêpes au sésame et piment avec tzatziki','Une option sans gluten alléchante et savoureuse pour vos invités. Ce sont un peu des petits blinis','["100 g de farine sans gluten (nous avons utilisé Doves Farm, largement disponible)","1 oeuf","150 ml de yaourt au soja","1 piment vert et 1 piment rouge épépinés et finement hachés","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, finement tranchés, plus un peu pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","un peu d''huile pour frire","150 g de yaourt grec","13 cm de concombre, épépiné et râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée"]','["Mélangez la farine, l''œuf, le yaourt et 2 cuillères à soupe\r\narroser ensemble dans un robot culinaire pour former\r\nune pâte lisse. verser dans un bol, puis incorporer\r\nles piments, les oignons nouveaux, la coriandre et\r\ngraines de sésame. Couvrir et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour faire le tzatziki, mélangez le yaourt,\r\nconcombre et menthe ensemble, assaisonner au goût,\r\npuis détendez-vous.","Faites chauffer une petite poêle avec un peu de\r\nd''huile, en essuyant l''excès d''huile avec du papier absorbant.\r\nfaire revenir le mélange de crêpes une cuillerée à dessert à\r\nà la fois, pendant 1 min de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce que légèrement\r\ndoré. verser dans une assiette et réserver au chaud.\r\nempiler sur une grande assiette, garnir d''une cuillerée de\r\ndu tzatziki et quelques oignons nouveaux tranchés supplémentaires\r\net servir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:13:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11787,5143,'fr','Petits pains chauds croisés sans gluten','Les pâtisseries fruitées de Paul Hollywood sont tout aussi délicieuses lorsque vous effectuez quelques échanges simples pour les rendre sans blé','["300 ml de lait entier, plus 2 cuillères à soupe supplémentaires","50g de beurre","500 g de farine à pain blanc sans gluten et sans blé (nous avons utilisé de la farine à pain blanc sans gluten et sans blé Doves Farm)","1 cuillère à café de sel","75 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 cuillères à café de levure rapide ou à action rapide","1 gros oeuf, battu","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","75 g de raisins secs","50 g de zestes mélangés","le zeste d''1 orange","1 pomme pelée, épépinée et hachée finement","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","30 g de farine nature sans gluten ni blé, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","3 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots"]','["Portez le lait à ébullition, puis retirez du feu et ajoutez le beurre. Laisser refroidir jusqu''à ce qu''il atteigne la température des mains. Mélangez la farine, le sel, le sucre et la levure avec le lait tiède et l''œuf dans un mixeur muni d''un embout pétrisseur ou avec une cuillère en bois, puis rassemblez la pâte avec vos mains. Ne pétrissez pas.","Mettez la pâte dans un bol légèrement huilé. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire huilé et laisser lever dans un endroit chaud pendant 1 heure ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume et qu''un doigt enfoncé laisse une entaille.","Versez l''huile d''olive, les raisins secs, le mélange de zestes, le zeste d''orange, la pomme et la cannelle et mélangez à la pâte. Façonnez des petits pains en huileant légèrement vos mains et divisez la pâte en morceaux de 100 g avant de la rouler en boules. Laisser lever encore une heure.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Mélangez la farine avec environ 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour faire la pâte pour la croix – ajoutez l''eau 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois, afin d''en ajouter juste assez pour une pâte épaisse. Verser dans une poche à douille munie d''une petite douille. Tracez une ligne le long de chaque rangée de petits pains, puis répétez dans l''autre sens pour créer des croix. Cuire au four 20 minutes à mi-hauteur du four, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Faites chauffer doucement la confiture d''abricots pour la faire fondre, puis tamisez-la pour éliminer les morceaux. Pendant que la confiture est encore chaude, badigeonner le dessus des petits pains chauds et laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11788,5145,'fr','Asperges grillées aux amandes effilées & beurre','Une collation parfaite, une entrée ou un accompagnement de pointes d''asperges croquantes aux noisettes avec un glaçage au beurre','["200 g de pointes d''asperges","un peu d''huile d''olive","noisette de beurre","1 cuillère à café d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Cuire les asperges à ébullition\r\neau salée pendant 2 minutes. Égoutter, puis mélanger\r\navec un peu d''huile d''olive. Faire chauffer une poêle\r\ntrop chaud, placez les lances sur le\r\nplaner et cuire quelques minutes en retournant\r\npour obtenir un bel effet carbonisé partout.\r\nPendant ce temps, faites fondre une noix de beurre dans\r\nune casserole. Répartissez les asperges entre\r\n2 assiettes, assaisonner et garnir chaque tas de\r\nun filet de beurre fondu et d''amandes effilées grillées."]','2026-01-11 00:13:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11789,5147,'fr','Mélange de pop-corn Bombay','Une excellente collation maison économique composée de pop-corn salé avec des pois chiches, des raisins secs, des noix et des épices indiennes','["400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés et séchés","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","50g de beurre","2 cuillères à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à café de curry en poudre","Sachet de 70 g de pop corn salé","85g de cacahuètes","100 g de raisins secs"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nVersez les pois chiches sur une plaque à pâtisserie avec l''huile. Assaisonner, secouer\r\nbien enrober, puis enfourner pendant 25 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites fondre le beurre\r\nun micro-onde. Incorporer le garam\r\nmasala, puissance du curry et\r\nun peu de sel et de poivre. Versez le pop-corn, les cacahuètes et les raisins secs dans un bol, ajoutez le\r\npois chiches cuits au four et verser sur le\r\nbeurre épicé. Remuez bien le tout pour enrober."]','2026-01-11 00:13:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11790,5149,'fr','Mini galettes de poisson au saumon et au citron','Ces galettes de poisson offrent une savoureuse alternative sans gluten à votre tartinade festive','["2 grosses pommes de terre au four","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","le zeste et le jus râpés d''un demi citron","1 jaune d''oeuf","140 g de parures de saumon fumé, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de persil haché, plus un supplément","2 cuillères à soupe de farine sans gluten mélangée à 1 cuillère à café de poivre grossièrement moulu","un peu d''huile, pour la friture"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre au micro-ondes à puissance maximale pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Laisser refroidir 5 min, verser la chair dans un bol, puis l''écraser et laisser refroidir. Assaisonner avec de l''huile d''olive, du zeste et du jus de citron au goût, puis incorporer l''œuf, le saumon et le persil. Façonner des petits ronds de 3 cm de large et 1 cm de profondeur. Mettre au frais 15 min.","Saupoudrez chaque gâteau de farine poivrée, puis faites-le revenir à feu doux dans un peu d''huile pendant 2-3 min de chaque côté. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant et servir garni de saumon et de persil."]','2026-01-11 00:13:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11791,5151,'fr','Pois chiches épicés','Faites grignoter toute la famille avec cette alternative faible en gras aux cacahuètes','["400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés et séchés","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de piment"]','["Versez les pois chiches dans un bol avec les légumes\r\nhuile et poudre de piment et mélanger\r\njusqu''à ce que les pois chiches soient enrobés de piment.\r\nTransférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie, étaler\r\nles pois chiches, puis laissez cuire 25 min.\r\nRetirer du four et laisser refroidir.\r\nSaupoudrer de sel marin avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11792,5153,'fr','Brochettes de courgettes et halloumi','Faire mariner le fromage avec de la menthe, du citron et de l''huile d''olive, enfiler sur des brochettes de kebab avec des légumes et du grill','["½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","une petite poignée de menthe hachée","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 courgettes coupées en rondelles de 1 cm","Paquet de 225 g de fromage halloumi, en cubes"]','["Mélangez le piment, la moitié de la menthe, le zeste de citron\r\net jus, huile, courgettes et halloumi.\r\nLaisser mariner 30 mn. Tremper\r\n8 brochettes en bois pendant 20 min.","Enfiler les courgettes et le halloumi\r\nsur les brochettes. Cuire au BBQ, ou\r\nsous le grill, pendant 7-8 min en retournant à mi-cuisson\r\nà travers et arroser avec le reste\r\nmarinade. Répartir sur le reste de menthe."]','2026-01-11 00:13:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11793,5155,'fr','Épi de maïs mexicain','Pimentez le maïs doux grillé avec du piment, du citron vert et du beurre fondu.','["4 épis de maïs","100 g de beurre ramolli","le zeste d''1 citron vert","2 cuillères à café de piment frais haché ou 1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment, doux ou piquant, selon le degré de piquant que vous aimez","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Faire tremper le maïs dans l''eau froide pendant 15 minutes.\r\nFaites chauffer une poêle ou un barbecue et,\r\nlorsqu''il est chaud, déposez le maïs directement dessus\r\nles barres. Cuire 30 à 40 minutes en retournant\r\nrégulièrement, jusqu''à ce que le maïs soit tendre et\r\ncarbonisé par endroits.","Pendant ce temps, écrasez le beurre avec le\r\nle zeste de citron vert et le piment. Quand les épis sont\r\ncuit, garnir chacun d''une noix de\r\nbeurre et servir avec des quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:13:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11794,5157,'fr','Torsades au parmesan, graines de pavot et carvi','Ces twists végétariens et sans gluten sont parfaits pour accompagner des boissons festives','["175 g de farine sans gluten (nous avons utilisé Doves Farm, largement disponible)","85g de beurre","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","1 jaune d''œuf mélangé à 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide","1 œuf battu","3 cuillères à soupe de parmesan fraîchement râpé (ou alternative végétarienne)","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de pavot et de graines de carvi"]','["Pour faire la pâte, mettre la farine, le beurre\r\net le poivre de Cayenne dans un robot culinaire,\r\npuis réduire en chapelure fine. saupoudrer\r\nle mélange d''œufs et d''eau sur la farine, puis\r\npulser à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à arriver\r\nensemble. versez le mélange sur une planche et\r\nPressez doucement la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à gonfler.\r\nrassembler en boule, en ajoutant plus d''eau\r\nsi c''est sec.","Chauffer le four à 190C/ventilateur 170C/gaz 5. rouler\r\nla pâte dans un grand rectangle de format A4,\r\nenviron 20 x 30 cm. Badigeonner la feuille avec\r\nl''œuf battu et coupé en deux dans le sens de la largeur.\r\nSaupoudrer une moitié de parmesan et de\r\nseconde moitié avec des graines de pavot et de carvi.\r\npasser légèrement le rouleau à pâtisserie sur le dessus pour\r\npresser le fromage et les graines dans le\r\npâtisserie. Coupez chaque moitié en 12 à 15 bâtonnets. arranger\r\nsur une plaque à pâtisserie et réfrigérer 10 minutes.","Cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés,\r\npuis laisser refroidir 5 minutes avant de soulever sur un\r\ngrille."]','2026-01-11 00:13:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11795,5159,'fr','Brochettes de feta géniales','Le fromage et l''ananas sur un bâton obtiennent une transformation totalement tropicale : utilisez de la pastèque et de la mangue et saupoudrez de graines de pavot.','["1 grosse mangue, pelée et coupée en gros morceaux en 10","environ 300 g de chair de pastèque coupée en 10","200 g de fromage feta coupé en 20 cubes","1 cuillère à café de graines de pavot, grillées","20 mini brochettes, pour servir","1 agrume, pour servir (facultatif)","1 citron vert"]','["Mettez la mangue dans une assiette, le melon dessus\r\nun autre et feta sur un troisième. Dispersez-en un peu\r\ngraines de pavot sur chacun et mélangez délicatement\r\ndonc les graines collent. Assemblez 10 brochettes\r\navec des cubes de mangue et de feta, et\r\n10 brochettes de cubes de melon et\r\nfeta. Misez sur les agrumes, si vous le souhaitez,\r\nou disposer sur une assiette et presser\r\nsur le citron vert. Couvrir et réfrigérer jusqu''à environ\r\n20 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11796,5161,'fr','Sablés croustillants à l''orange','Les personnes coeliaques ne doivent pas manquer de gourmandises sucrées avec cette recette de sablés fondants et sans gluten','["100 g de beurre ramolli","50 g de sucre en poudre doré","le zeste râpé d''une ½ orange","175 g de farine sans gluten (essayez Doves Farm)","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten (nous avons utilisé Supercook)"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/chaleur tournante 170C/gaz 5. Huiler légèrement une plaque à pâtisserie. Battez le beurre, puis crémez-le avec le sucre et le zeste d''orange jusqu''à consistance légère. Incorporer la farine et la levure chimique et mélanger pour former une pâte.","Divisez le mélange en 10 boules, disposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Appuyez sur chaque boule à plat avec la pointe d''un couteau à lame ronde. Réfrigérez pendant 15 minutes, puis faites cuire au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement dorées. Laisser poser 2 min sur la plaque avant de démouler avec une spatule. Glisser sur une grille pour refroidir. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:13:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11797,5163,'fr','Éponge Victoria sans gluten','Doux, léger et tout aussi festif que la pâtisserie britannique classique, ce plat plaira à tout le monde lors d''une occasion spéciale.','["200 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour les moules","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs moyens","200g de farine autolevante sans gluten à la gomme xanthane (voir astuce)","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 ml de crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","100 g de confiture de fraises ou de framboises"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer deux moules à sandwich de 20 cm et les tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Battre le beurre et le sucre en poudre dans un grand bol à l''aide d''un fouet électrique pendant 5 à 6 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux.","Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant bien entre chaque ajout et en ajoutant une cuillerée de farine avec chaque œuf pour éviter que le mélange ne caille.","Incorporez le reste de la farine et la levure chimique à l''aide d''une spatule, puis incorporez le lait et la vanille. Répartissez le mélange dans les moules et nivelez les surfaces. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, élastiques au toucher et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre en ressorte propre (si un mélange de gâteau humide adhère à la brochette, remettez les génoises au four pendant encore 5 minutes, puis vérifiez à nouveau). Laisser refroidir dans les moules 5 min, puis démouler sur une grille, retirer le papier sulfurisé et laisser refroidir complètement. Une fois complètement refroidies, les éponges peuvent être emballées et congelées jusqu''à un mois. Décongeler à température ambiante avant de monter.","Fouettez ensemble la crème et le sucre glace à l''aide d''un fouet électrique jusqu''à ce que la crème conserve sa forme. Pour assembler, placez une génoise sur une assiette ou un support à gâteau. Étalez sur la confiture, puis versez sur la chantilly. Sandwicher avec la deuxième génoise, puis saupoudrer de sucre glace. Mieux apprécié le jour de son assemblage."]','2026-01-11 00:13:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11798,5165,'fr','Biscuits de Pâque aux morceaux de chocolat aux amandes et à la friteuse à air','Préparez ces pâtisseries faciles sans gluten pour Pâque. Si vous utilisez un chocolat sans produits laitiers, il sera parev (une loi alimentaire juive excluant le lait ou les produits carnés)','["60 g de sucre mou roux clair","60 g de sucre en poudre","½ cuillère à café d''essence de vanille","1 oeuf , battu","180 g de farine d''amande ou de poudre d''amandes (ou la moitié de chaque)","80g de farine de pomme de terre","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique casher","¼ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude casher","100-150 g de morceaux ou de pépites de chocolat noir sans produits laitiers"]','["Dans un bol de taille moyenne, mélanger les sucres, la vanille et l''œuf battu. Dans un autre bol, mélangez les amandes et la fécule de pomme de terre. Ajoutez la levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude et une pincée de sel. Fouetter pour combiner.","Ajouter les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs et remuer jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Incorporer les morceaux de chocolat jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient uniformément répartis.","Faites chauffer votre friteuse à air à 170°C et prenez un morceau de papier sulfurisé qui rentre dans le panier de votre friteuse à air. Percez quelques petits trous dans le papier sulfurisé avec la pointe d''un couteau pour permettre à l''air de mieux circuler.","Pendant que la friteuse chauffe, prélevez de grosses cuillères à soupe du mélange (environ 40 g) et placez-les sur le papier sulfurisé en les appuyant un peu pour les aplatir.","Cuire au four à 170 °C pendant 12 à 15 minutes, en vérifiant après 12 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les biscuits soient dorés et légèrement dorés en dessous, puis transférer sur une grille pour refroidir (en utilisant le papier sulfurisé pour vous aider car ils seront mous). Attendez au moins 10 minutes pour qu’ils refroidissent et se raffermissent. Répétez avec le reste du mélange. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique pendant trois à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:13:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11799,5167,'fr','Sablés sans gluten','Préparez une version sans gluten de sablés à servir avec du thé ou pour accompagner un pot de dessert','["45g de maïzena","155 g de farine nature sans gluten, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","¼ cuillère à café de gomme xanthane","75 g de sucre en poudre doré","125 g de beurre doux froid, coupé en cubes"]','["Tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 20 cm x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé et réserver. Versez les farines, la gomme xanthane et le sucre dans un robot culinaire et mélangez par impulsions.","Ajouter le beurre et mélanger jusqu''à ce que le mélange atteigne une texture semblable à de la chapelure. Déposez-la sur votre plan de travail et rassemblez la pâte avec vos mains. Presser dans le moule préparé en une couche uniforme et réfrigérer pendant au moins 20 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Cuire les sablés pendant 18-22 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Sortez du four et incisez le long de la pâte cuite pour former 12 rectangles. Laisser refroidir 10 minutes avant de découper complètement les lignes rainurées. Laisser refroidir complètement avant de servir. Se conserve dans une boîte à biscuits jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:13:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11800,5169,'fr','Gâteau au pudding au chocolat et aux poires sans gluten','Impressionnez vos invités avec ce gâteau au chocolat sans farine garni de poires juteuses – il est parfait comme dessert ou comme gâterie sucrée l’après-midi.','["200 g de beurre coupé en petits morceaux, plus un peu pour le moule","200 g de chocolat noir à cuire coupé en petits morceaux","3 œufs","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","100 g de mascarpone ou fromage à pâte molle","¼ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","100 g d''amandes moulues","30 g de cacao en poudre, plus un peu pour servir","4 poires Morrisons Market Street très mûres, pelées, coupées en deux et évidées","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Beurrer et chemiser un moule à cake rond de 25 cm. Chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Faites fondre le chocolat et le beurre dans un bol au dessus d''une casserole d''eau chaude, ou faites-le par petites rafales au micro-ondes, puis laissez refroidir. Battre les œufs et le sucre avec un fouet électrique pendant 4 à 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe et que le fouet laisse une trace dans le mélange. Ajouter le mascarpone ou le fromage à pâte molle et la vanille et battre jusqu''à homogénéité. Incorporez légèrement le chocolat fondu refroidi jusqu''à ce qu''il soit incorporé, puis incorporez les amandes. Tamisez la poudre de cacao et une petite pincée de sel et incorporez pour combiner.","Grattez le mélange à gâteau dans le moule préparé. Disposez les poires Morrisons sur le dessus, côté coupé vers le bas, et appuyez doucement. Cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le gâteau ait gonflé autour des poires et craquelé sur le dessus. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant 30 à 40 minutes – il se dégonflera en refroidissant. Saupoudrez de sucre glace et de cacao et servez chaud ou laissez refroidir complètement pour une consistance plus proche d''un brownie."]','2026-01-11 00:13:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11801,5171,'fr','Nouilles au poulet et aux noix de cajou','Préparez ce plat de nouilles rapides avec du poulet, des noix de cajou, des carottes et des poivrons rouges en moins de 25 minutes : il est sans gluten et riche en protéines.','["250 g de nouilles de riz plates séchées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile infusée à l''ail","2 poivrons rouges coupés en fines lanières","2 carottes moyennes, tranchées finement en diagonale","2 poitrines de poulet, coupées en fines lanières","150g de noix de cajou","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment séchés (facultatif)","oignons nouveaux tranchés et coriandre hachée, pour servir","4½ cuillères à soupe de sauce soja sans gluten","1½ cuillère à café de pâte miso blanche ou rouge sans gluten","1 cuillère à café de pâte de gingembre","1½ cuillère à soupe de cassonade foncée","1 cuillère à café de farine nature sans gluten"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la sauce avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau dans un petit bol et réservez.","Faites cuire les nouilles séchées en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis réservez.","Placez un grand wok sur feu vif et ajoutez l''huile. Ajoutez les poivrons et les carottes et faites-les revenir quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés. Incorporer le poulet et faire sauter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré, environ 2 minutes. Ajouter les nouilles de riz cuites et mélanger. Versez la sauce et ajoutez les noix de cajou, puis continuez à faire sauter jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien enrobé et un peu collant. Terminez par une pincée de flocons de piment, si vous en utilisez, d''oignons nouveaux et de coriandre hachée."]','2026-01-11 00:13:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11802,5173,'fr','Crumble aux pommes sans gluten','Préparez un crumble aux pommes sans flocons d''avoine avec du porridge. C''est le pud parfait pour les mois les plus froids, servi avec de la crème anglaise, de la glace ou de la crème','["600 g de pommes Bramley coupées en dés de 2 cm","1 cuillère à café d''épices moulues ou de cannelle","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","crème ou glace vanille, pour servir","100 g de beurre coupé en dés","150 g de farine nature sans gluten","75 g de sucre muscovado léger","3 cuillères à soupe de flocons d''avoine sans gluten"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Mettre la pomme, les épices et le sucre semoule dans une casserole avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Couvrir et cuire doucement 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes commencent à ramollir, puis transférer dans un plat allant au four.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le beurre à la farine, puis incorporez le sucre muscovado léger, les flocons d''avoine et une pincée de sel. Saupoudrer uniformément le mélange sur les pommes.","Mettez le plat sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit doré et que les pommes soient tendres. Laisser refroidir 5 minutes avant de servir avec de la crème, de la glace ou une crème anglaise."]','2026-01-11 00:13:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11803,5175,'fr','Gestion des paiements Boîte de caramel au gluten sans gluten','Savourez une version sans gluten du pudding au caramel gluant. Faire tremper les dattes dans le café ajoute une magnifique saveur de caramel torréfié à l''éponge.','["125 g de beurre salé ramolli, plus un peu pour le moule","225 g de dattes Medjool dénoyautées, hachées finement","200 ml de café préparé avec 1 cuillère à soupe de poudre d''espresso instantané","150 ml de lait entier","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","225 g de sucre mou roux clair","250 g de farine auto-levante sans gluten","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées moulues","¼ cuillère à café de gomme xanthane (facultatif)","3 œufs moyens, battus","glace, crème ou crème anglaise, pour servir","300 ml de crème fraîche","50g de beurre salé","100 g de sucre mou roux clair","75 g de sucre muscovado noir","1 cuillère à café de poudre d''espresso"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer un moule à cake carré de 23 cm de profondeur (ou utiliser un moule rectangulaire d''environ 20 x 28 cm) et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé. Mettez les dattes dans une casserole moyenne avec le café, le lait et le bicarbe, et laissez mijoter à feu moyen-doux pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que les dattes soient presque entièrement décomposées.","Battre le beurre et le sucre ensemble au batteur sur socle ou à l''aide d''un fouet électrique. Tamisez la farine, les épices et la gomme xanthane (le cas échéant), puis ajoutez les œufs. Battre jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien combiné, puis ajouter le mélange de dattes et mélanger à nouveau. Versez la pâte dans le moule et enfournez pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit levée, ferme et qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu en ressorte propre.","Pendant que la génoise cuit, préparez la sauce. Versez 150 ml de crème dans une casserole avec le reste des ingrédients et faites chauffer à feu doux-moyen jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu. Laisser mijoter 4 à 5 minutes pour épaissir. Retirer du feu, puis incorporer le reste de la crème. Coupez le biscuit en carrés ou en rectangles et servez-le chaud nappé de sauce et de glace ou de crème. Une fois refroidi, le biscuit se conserve trois jours dans une boîte hermétique ou trois mois au congélateur (sans la sauce). La sauce se conserve au frais une semaine ou au congélateur pendant trois mois. Décongeler la sauce au réfrigérateur toute la nuit et la génoise à température ambiante. Pour réchauffer, couvrir le biscuit de papier d''aluminium et enfourner 20-30 minutes à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Réchauffer doucement la sauce dans une poêle. Vous pouvez également mettre des portions individuelles au micro-ondes dans des bols résistants à la chaleur à puissance maximale pendant 1 minute jusqu''à ce que la sauce soit fondue et que la génoise soit bien chaude."]','2026-01-11 00:13:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11804,5183,'fr','Mini bouchées de pizza à la polenta','Demandez aux tout-petits de vous aider à préparer ces bouchées de pizza sans gluten. Ils sont idéaux pour une fête d''enfants où certains enfants peuvent être cœaliaques ou avoir une intolérance au gluten.','["2 marmites ou cubes de légumes","500 g de polenta instantanée","huile d''olive, pour arroser, plus un supplément pour le plateau","250 g de sauce à pizza","200 g de fromage végétalien, finement haché","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","garnitures facultatives (par exemple, poivron haché, maïs doux, olives ou champignons)"]','["Portez à ébullition 1½ litre d''eau et ajoutez les marmites et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Versez la polenta en fouettant continuellement, portez à ébullition et réduisez le feu au minimum, puis remuez toutes les minutes pour éviter qu''elle ne colle, pendant environ 8 minutes (ou selon les instructions sur l''emballage).","Pendant ce temps, huilez une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive (la nôtre mesurait 30 x 40 cm). Versez la polenta cuite dans le plateau et nivelez avec une cuillère pour former une grande plaque plate qui remplit tout le plateau (environ 1 cm d''épaisseur). Vous pouvez utiliser des paumes mouillées pour appuyer fermement après quelques minutes. Laisser refroidir et prendre au moins 1 h.","Déposez la polenta sur votre plan de travail et coupez-la en lanières. Coupez les bandes en deux en diagonale pour former des petits quartiers et remettez sur la plaque. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Garnir chaque base de polenta avec 1 cuillère à café de sauce à pizza, un peu de fromage végétalien et une pincée d''origan. Ajoutez des garnitures supplémentaires, si vous le souhaitez. Arrosez d''huile d''olive et enfournez pour 20 à 25 minutes. Servir tiède ou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:13:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11805,5187,'fr','Scones sans gluten','Répondez aux invités intolérants au gluten avec ces scones faciles. Ajoutez des raisins secs si vous le souhaitez et servez avec des tonnes de confiture et de crème caillée.','["250 g de farine auto-levante sans gluten","½ cuillère à café de sel fin","1 cuillère à café de gomme xanthane","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique sans gluten","50 g de sucre en poudre","40 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","75 ml de lait entier","1 gros œuf et 1 jaune d''œuf","50 g de raisins secs (facultatif)"]','["Mélanger la farine, le sel, la gomme xanthane, la levure chimique et le sucre dans un bol. Frotter le beurre du bout des doigts jusqu''à obtenir une chapelure fine. Vous pouvez également le faire en mélangeant progressivement le mélange dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''il ressemble à de la chapelure.","Fouettez ensemble le lait et l''œuf entier et mélangez progressivement au mélange de farine avec vos mains jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Incorporer les raisins secs, si vous en utilisez. Pétrir brièvement pour former une boule.","Étalez délicatement la pâte à scone jusqu''à obtenir une épaisseur de 2 cm. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et réfrigérer pendant 30 minutes pour raffermir la pâte – cela facilitera la découpe.","Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur et, à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 5 cm, découpez 6 à 8 scones (pressez les chutes ensemble et relancez-les si nécessaire). Placez les scones à l''envers (cela signifie que vous obtiendrez un dessus plus net une fois cuits) sur une autre plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, écartés de 2 cm.","Fouettez le jaune d''œuf et badigeonnez uniformément le dessus des scones, en vous assurant que la dorure ne coule pas sur les côtés des scones, sinon ils monteront de manière inégale. Mettez les scones sur un plateau et transférez-les au congélateur pendant 15 minutes. Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Sortez les scones du congélateur et badigeonnez à nouveau le dessus avec l''œuf battu, puis faites cuire au four pendant 12-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. A déguster tiède ou froid, généreusement garni de confiture et de crème, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11806,5189,'fr','Pizza sans gluten','Préparez notre version sans gluten d''une pizza classique. La base est simple, étalée sur une riche sauce tomate maison, puis terminez avec de la mozzarella de bufflonne et du basilic frais.','["400 g de farine à pain sans gluten","2 cuillères à café bombées de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique sans gluten","1 cuillère à café de sel fin","1 cuillère à café bombée de gomme xanthane","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon, finement haché","1 boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","½ petit bouquet de basilic, feuilles hachées","2 boules de 125 g de mozzarella de bufflonne"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200 chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et mettre deux plaques à pâtisserie à l''intérieur.","Préparez la sauce : faites chauffer l''huile dans une petite casserole et faites revenir l''oignon avec une généreuse pincée de sel pendant 10 minutes à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez les tomates concassées, la purée et le sucre et portez à légère ébullition. Cuire à découvert pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit réduit et épais, en remuant régulièrement. Mixez la sauce avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Assaisonner au goût et incorporer le basilic. Laissez refroidir un peu.","Préparez la pâte : mélangez la farine, le sucre, la levure chimique, le sel et la gomme xanthane dans un grand bol à mélanger. Faites un puits au centre et versez-y 250 ml d''eau tiède et l''huile d''olive. Mélangez rapidement avec vos mains pour créer une texture épaisse, humide et pâteuse, en ajoutant 20 ml d''eau tiède supplémentaire si la pâte est un peu sèche. Conserver dans un récipient hermétique ou un bol couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 24 heures avant utilisation.  Fariner légèrement deux autres plaques à pâtisserie. Divisez la pâte en deux et aplatissez-la avec vos doigts en ronds de 20 à 25 cm sur les feuilles.","Terminez les bases avec une fine couche de sauce et de mozzarella déchirée. Placez les plaques à pâtisserie sur les plaques à pâtisserie chaudes du four et faites cuire pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les bords soient croustillants."]','2026-01-11 00:13:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11807,5193,'fr','Saumon épicé à la betterave, feta et riz sauvage','Une salade de poisson sans gluten, riche en oméga-3, en folate et en fibres. Assaisonné de cumin et de carvi, le saumon se marie bien avec la betterave sucrée et vibrante et la feta salée.','["Paquet de 120 g de filet de saumon individuel","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","¼ cuillère à café de graines de carvi","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge et un peu plus pour servir","60g de riz sauvage","100 g de betterave cuite, coupée à votre guise","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés en diagonale","jus ½ citron","25 g de feta grossièrement émiettée"]','["Avant de préparer les légumes, enduisez le filet de saumon d’épices et d’huile, puis laissez mariner. Dans une petite casserole avec un couvercle hermétique, faites mijoter le riz à feu moyen pendant 25 minutes.","Au bout de 15 minutes, assaisonnez le saumon, puis placez le poisson, peau vers le bas, dans une poêle antiadhésive froide (vous obtiendrez ainsi une peau uniformément croustillante). Placez sur feu moyen-vif et faites cuire le saumon pendant 5 minutes, puis retournez-le et faites cuire de l''autre côté 1 à 2 minutes supplémentaires, selon vos préférences.","Égouttez le riz, puis remettez-le dans la casserole et mélangez-le avec la betterave, les oignons nouveaux, le jus de citron et l''assaisonnement au goût. Servir le riz avec le saumon épicé avec la feta émiettée et un filet d''huile d''olive par-dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:13:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11808,5195,'fr','Aubergines et poivrons en croûte d''épices au pilaf','Cette recette regorge de bienfaits savoureux, elle est faible en gras, faible en calories, riche en folate, en fibres, en vitamine C et en fer, et c''est en plus un délicieux plat principal sans viande qui représente 3 de vos 5 par jour – pourquoi ne pas aimer ?','["2 grosses aubergines, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 poivrons rouges, coupés en quartiers","2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à café de flocons de piment","2 cuillères à café de zaatar","4 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","140 g de lentilles du Puy","140 g de riz basmati","graines d''1 grenade","petit paquet de persil plat, haché grossièrement","Yaourt grec ou coco, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. À l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé, tracer un motif en losange dans les aubergines. Badigeonner d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile, bien assaisonner et déposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie, côté coupé vers le bas. Cuire au four 15 mn. Ajoutez les poivrons dans la plaque, retournez les aubergines et arrosez le tout avec le reste d''huile. Saupoudrer d''épices, d''1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse de grenade et d''un peu de sel. Cuire au four encore 15 minutes.","Faire bouillir les lentilles dans beaucoup d''eau jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente. Après 5 minutes de cuisson, ajoutez le riz. Cuire pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit mais avec un peu de mordant. Égoutter et remettre dans la casserole recouverte d''un couvercle pour garder au chaud.","Incorporer les graines de grenade et le persil au riz aux lentilles. Répartir dans quatre assiettes ou verser sur une grande assiette. Garnir avec les légumes rôtis, une cuillerée de yaourt et le reste de mélasse de grenade arrosée."]','2026-01-11 00:13:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11809,5197,'fr','Échalotes et carottes balsamiques au chèvre','Les échalotes douces et le vinaigre balsamique piquant forment un accord parfait dans ce délicieux plat d’accompagnement. Émietter sur une poignée de fromage de chèvre à pâte molle et persil pour servir','["2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de miel clair","4 branches de thym, feuilles cueillies","300 g de mini carottes, non pelées et lavées","300 g d''échalotes banane coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur, racine intacte","50g de fromage de chèvre à pâte molle","½ petit bouquet de persil haché grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger le balsamique, l''huile, le miel, le thym et un peu d''assaisonnement. Mélangez les légumes dans la vinaigrette et étalez-les sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Rôtir pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à caraméliser. Émietter sur le chèvre et le persil pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11810,5199,'fr','Aiglefin fumé & chips de triche','Un souper de poisson simple, rapide à préparer et peu coûteux à préparer. Dégustez cet aiglefin fumé dans une sauce crémeuse et satisfaisante avec du brocoli à tige tendre et des chips faciles','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","300 g de pommes de terre Maris Piper","2 filets d''aiglefin fumé, désossés et sans peau, non teints (environ 300 g/11 oz)","140 g de brocoli à tige tendre","100 ml de crème double"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et faire chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajoutez les pommes de terre et faites-les revenir 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à devenir croustillantes. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant la cuisson de l''aiglefin.","Mettez l''aiglefin, le brocoli et la crème dans la poêle que vous avez utilisée pour les pommes de terre et portez à ébullition. Couvrir avec un couvercle et cuire 8 à 10 minutes, en arrosant l''aiglefin de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit et que le brocoli soit tendre. Servir avec les frites."]','2026-01-11 00:13:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11811,5201,'fr','Poulet frit et trémies du Sri Lanka','Notre version d''un incontournable du Sri Lanka. Le poulet succulent et légèrement épicé est le compagnon idéal des hoppers : des crêpes au riz, servis avec une sauce soyeuse et onctueuse à l''oignon et à la noix de coco.','["250 ml de lait de coco","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","pincée de gingembre moulu","2 gousses de cardamome, écrasées","pincée de poivre blanc","500 g de poitrines de poulet sans peau, chacune coupée en 3 morceaux","250g de farine de riz","1 ½ cuillère à café de levure sèche à action rapide","1 ½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","500 ml de lait de coco","huile de colza, pour badigeonner","4-6 œufs","1l d''huile de tournesol ou d''huile de colza","75g de farine","25g de maïzena","100 g de polenta à cuisson rapide","25 g de noix de coco desséchée","pincée de paprika fumé","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","1 oignon, tranché finement","1 petit piment vert, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de graines de fenugrec moulues","1 cuillère à café de sauce de poisson","2 cuillères à café de canne à sucre ou de sucre brun clair","400 ml de lait de coco entier","125 g de jeunes pousses d''épinards hachées","le jus d''1 citron vert","2 oignons, finement hachés","2 piments rouges, finement hachés","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert"]','["Pour préparer le poulet, versez le lait de coco dans un pichet et incorporez l''ail, les épices et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Mettez le poulet dans un récipient en plastique ou un plat à rôtir et versez dessus le mélange de saumure pour couvrir. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer 24 heures.","Pour les trémies, mettez la farine de riz dans un grand bol. Dans un pichet, mélangez 125 ml d''eau avec la levure et le sucre et laissez reposer environ 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que vous voyiez de la mousse. Versez le lait de coco et fouettez les ingrédients humides dans la farine de riz pour obtenir une pâte lisse, légèrement plus fine que la pâte à crêpes. Assaisonner, couvrir et laisser fermenter toute une nuit au réfrigérateur.","Pour préparer le kiri hodi, mettez tous les ingrédients (sauf le lait de coco, le jus de citron vert et les épinards) dans une casserole à fond épais. Ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et laissez mijoter à feu doux pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que l''oignon ramollisse. Versez le lait de coco et laissez cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes (ne pas faire bouillir). Ajoutez les épinards, remuez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés, puis retirez du feu. Salez au goût et ajoutez le jus de citron vert.","Pour faire le sambol, utilisez un pilon et un mortier ou un mini robot pour broyer les oignons avec les piments, une grosse pincée de sel et du paprika fumé, pour former une pâte grossière. Assaisonner avec du jus de citron vert et plus de sel, si nécessaire.","Pour cuire, sortez le mélange de poulet et de trémies du réfrigérateur pendant environ 1 heure afin qu''ils reviennent à température ambiante. Pour cuire le poulet, faites chauffer l''huile dans une friteuse ou une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne 180°C sur un thermomètre de cuisson. Pour préparer l''enrobage de poulet frit, mélangez tous les ingrédients avec 1/4 cuillère à café de sel dans un bol. Morceau par morceau, retirez le poulet de sa saumure, laissez égoutter l''excédent, puis draguez-le dans l''enrobage. Secouez l''excédent et faites frire dans l''huile pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant, puis reposer à four doux pendant que vous préparez les trémies.","Fabriquez les trémies. Fouettez la base de vos trémies pour éliminer les grumeaux. Ajoutez un peu d''eau supplémentaire pour le diluer si nécessaire. Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive, une sauteuse ou un petit wok à bords hauts et badigeonnez d''un peu d''huile de colza avec du papier absorbant. Ajoutez une louche de mélange dans la poêle et faites-la immédiatement tourbillonner sur les bords pour créer une crêpe en forme de bol. Cuire 1 min, puis ajouter un œuf et couvrir avec un couvercle. Cuire encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''œuf soit cuit et que les bords commencent à dorer. Répétez avec le reste de la pâte et les œufs. Servir les trémies avec le poulet, le sambol et le kiri hodi."]','2026-01-11 00:13:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11812,5203,'fr','Cuisses de poulet confites avec pommes de terre rissolées & œuf poché','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un savoureux plat de poulet parfaitement complété par des pommes de terre poêlées, du bacon et du chou frisé, puis garni avec gourmandise d''un œuf qui coule.','["4 brins de thym et 1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym cueillies","25g de sel marin","le zeste d''1 citron","2 cuisses de poulet","1 échalote","1 bulbe d''ail, coupé en deux","1 brin d''estragon","600 ml d''huile d''olive","400 g de pommes de terre coupées en dés","50 g de lardons coupés en lardons","1 poireau, nettoyé et tranché","1 piment vert, haché","50g d''épinards","25 g de chou frisé, râpé","½ petit persil plat, une poignée réservée pour servir","½ cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès ou de vermouth","2 œufs"]','["Mélangez les feuilles de thym avec le sel et le zeste de citron. Frotter les cuisses de poulet, puis réfrigérer 1 h. Chauffer le four à 140°C/120°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1.","Séchez le poulet avec du papier absorbant. Placer dans une petite rôtissoire avec le reste des ingrédients confits. Cuire au four pendant 2 à 2 heures et demie jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, puis retirer de l''huile et égoutter sur une grille. Réservez et filtrez l’huile – c’est idéal pour rôtir des légumes ou pour faire plus de confit. Réservez l''échalote et l''ail.","Pour préparer le hachis, faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile infusée dans une poêle à fond épais. Ajoutez les pommes de terre et laissez cuire environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Ajouter le bacon et cuire en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Ajoutez les poireaux, le piment, l''échalote confite et l''ail (pressé de sa peau). Cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les poireaux soient ramollis et que les pommes de terre soient bien cuites. Assaisonnez, puis ajoutez les épinards, le chou frisé et le persil. Remuer jusqu''à ce que les feuilles soient fanées. Ajoutez un peu de vinaigre.","Pochez les œufs dans l''eau à peine frémissante pendant 3 min, puis égouttez-les sur du papier absorbant. Servir le poulet avec le hachis, les œufs et une pincée de persil."]','2026-01-11 00:13:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11813,5205,'fr','Puddings du Yorkshire sans gluten','Le véhicule parfait pour la sauce et les friandises rôties : le pudding du Yorkshire – cette version est sans gluten mais n''ayez crainte, vous obtenez toujours cette couleur feuilletée et dorée caractéristique.','["140 g de farine nature sans gluten","50g de farine de maïs","3 œufs","175 ml de lait demi-écrémé","huile de tournesol, pour arroser"]','["Préparez le mélange à pâte. Versez les farines dans un bol avec 1/2 cuillère à café de sel, faites un puits au milieu et cassez-y les œufs. Fouettez le tout, puis ajoutez lentement le lait, en fouettant tout le temps jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sans grumeaux. Laissez reposer jusqu''à ce que vous soyez prêt à cuisiner.","Chauffer le four à 230°C/210°C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Verser un peu d''huile uniformément dans deux moules à muffins antiadhésifs à 12 trous et mettre au four pour bien réchauffer.","Versez la pâte dans un bol, puis sortez les moules chauds du four. Versez délicatement et uniformément la pâte dans les trous. Remettez les moules au four et laissez-les reposer pendant 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les puddings soient gonflés et dorés. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11814,5207,'fr','Poireaux grillés & fromage de chèvre','Une façon simple mais attrayante de servir les poireaux, en longues longueurs avec du chèvre émietté et un filet de balsamique, augmentez les quantités pour un superbe accompagnement de dîner.','["4 à 5 poireaux fins, parés et coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","25 g de pignons de pin grillés","25 g de fromage de chèvre émietté","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique"]','["Badigeonner le côté coupé des poireaux avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et assaisonner de sel marin et de poivre noir. Faites chauffer une poêle à feu moyen et placez-y les poireaux, côté coupé vers le bas. Faites griller pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les poireaux présentent des marques de charbon distinctives et soient tendres.","Badigeonnez le dessus des poireaux avec le reste d''huile, puis retournez-les et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Répartir dessus les pignons de pin et le fromage de chèvre. Arroser de vinaigre balsamique pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11815,5209,'fr','Pilau d''aubergines au yaourt à l''ail','Ce plat de pilaf sain et terreux, rempli d''épinards et d''aubergines, utilise du riz complet prêt à l''emploi pour un repas ultra rapide.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 grosses gousses d''ail, 1 finement hachée, l''autre finement râpée","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement haché","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","1 aubergine (environ 350 g), coupée en dés","Pot de 150g de yaourt bio nature","Sachet de 250 g de riz pilaf complet cuit","2 grosses poignées de bébés épinards (environ 75 g)","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe hachée et quelques feuilles supplémentaires"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok antiadhésif ou une sauteuse profonde et ajoutez l''ail haché, le gingembre, le piment et les graines de cumin. Cuire en remuant jusqu''à ce que l''ail soit ramolli. Ajoutez l''aubergine et faites sauter encore environ 1 minute, puis couvrez la poêle et laissez cuire à la vapeur pendant environ 7 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que l''aubergine soit tendre mais conserve sa forme. Pendant la cuisson, mélangez le yaourt avec l''ail râpé et un peu d''assaisonnement.","Ajouter le riz et les épinards dans la poêle et cuire brièvement pour chauffer le riz et faire flétrir les épinards. Incorporer la menthe et servir avec le yaourt à l''ail parsemé de quelques feuilles de menthe supplémentaires."]','2026-01-11 00:13:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11816,5211,'fr','Poire enrobée de Serrano et fromage de chèvre','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ces canapés ont l''air raffinés, mais sont incroyablement faciles à assembler et sont superbes dans le cadre d''un plateau à partager ou d''une collation de fête.','["6 tranches de jambon serrano","1 poire","une petite bûche (125g) de fromage de chèvre (vous n''utiliserez pas tout)","½ paquet de feuilles de roquette"]','["Déchirez 6 tranches de jambon Serrano en deux. Épépinez une poire et coupez-la en 12 tranches. Déposez un morceau de poire au fond de la tranche de jambon. Ajoutez un morceau de chèvre de 3 cm et quelques feuilles de roquette. Rouler et fixer avec un bâton à cocktail."]','2026-01-11 00:13:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11817,5213,'fr','Pavlova ananas et gingembre','Empilez de la crème fouettée et de l''ananas carbonisé sur une base de meringue pour créer un superbe dessert de dîner que vous pouvez préparer à l''avance.','["4 gros blancs d''œufs","225 g de sucre blanc en poudre","1 cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin blanc","½ gros ananas, pelé, épépiné et coupé en 4 à 5 quartiers","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop de gingembre du pot (voir ci-dessous), plus un peu pour arroser","6 boules de tige de gingembre au sirop, hachées grossièrement","500 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace, plus un peu pour saupoudrer une poignée de feuilles de menthe râpées"]','["Chauffer le four à 150C/130C chaleur tournante/gaz 2. Placer les blancs d''œufs dans un grand bol très propre et fouetter en pics fermes avec un fouet électrique à main. Continuez à fouetter pendant que vous ajoutez le sucre, 1 cuillère à soupe à la fois, jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et brillant. Continuez à fouetter en ajoutant le gingembre, la maïzena et le vinaigre.","Dessinez un cercle de 23 cm sur une feuille de papier sulfurisé, puis retournez-le et disposez-le sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Étalez le mélange de meringue pour remplir le cercle, en créant une trempette au milieu et sur les côtés supérieurs. Passez un couteau à palette sur les bords à intervalles réguliers si vous souhaitez créer des crêtes. Cuire au four 1h, puis laisser au four porte fermée pendant 8h jusqu''à ce que la Pavlova soit complètement refroidie.","Pendant la cuisson de la Pavlova, faites chauffer une poêle propre à feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude. Badigeonner les quartiers d''ananas avec le sirop de gingembre et faire griller pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que des lignes carbonisées apparaissent et que l''ananas soit légèrement ramolli. Laissez refroidir complètement puis coupez en morceaux. (L''ananas peut être grillé la veille et réfrigéré. Laissez-le revenir à température ambiante avant d''assembler la Pavlova. La base de Pavlova peut être préparée jusqu''à 2 jours avant de servir, conservée dans un contenant hermétique, puis garnie de crème et d''ananas juste avant de servir).","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à servir, mixez la tige de gingembre et 2 cuillères à soupe de sirop dans le petit bol d''un robot culinaire pour obtenir une pâte épaisse. Ajoutez la crème et le sucre glace et fouettez jusqu''à obtenir des pics mous, puis versez dans le cratère de la meringue. Garnir d''ananas, arroser d''un peu de sirop de gingembre supplémentaire, parsemer de menthe et saupoudrer de sucre glace."]','2026-01-11 00:13:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11818,5217,'fr','Tartes hachées garnies de crumble','Les régimes sans gluten et sans œufs sont pris en compte avec ces tartelettes croustillantes. Le complément parfait à une tasse de thé ou un verre de vin chaud','["125 g de beurre doux, réfrigéré et coupé en dés","200 g de farine sans gluten (nous avons utilisé Doves Farm), plus un petit supplément pour rouler","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","le zeste râpé d''une orange","200 g de viande hachée sans gluten (nous avons utilisé la viande hachée de luxe Sainsbury''s)","25g d''amandes moulues","25g d''amandes effilées","pincée de cannelle moulue","25 g de beurre doux, fondu","25 g de sucre roux clair et mou"]','["Pour faire la pâte, frottez le beurre dans la farine jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine. Ajoutez le sucre glace et\r\nzeste d''orange. Verser dans 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau en mélangeant avec un couteau jusqu''à ce que la pâte commence à se rassembler. Pétrir légèrement, aplatir en disque, envelopper dans du film alimentaire et réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné, étaler la pâte sur 2 à 3 mm d''épaisseur. Utilisation\r\nA l''aide d''un emporte-pièce cannelé de 9 à 10 cm, découpez des disques de pâte. Reroulez les parures et tamponnez d''autres disques jusqu''à épuisement de la pâte. Tapisser deux moules à muffins à 8 trous avec les disques de pâte, puis remplir chaque fond de pâte avec 1 cuillère à café bombée de viande hachée et étaler pour lisser. Peut être congelé, cru, en barquette jusqu''à 1 mois.","Mélangez les ingrédients du crumble dans un petit bol, puis saupoudrez-en un peu sur le dessus de chaque tartelette. Cuire au milieu du four pendant environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit cuite et dorée. Laisser refroidir dans les moules pendant 5 minutes, puis servir avec du beurre de cognac ou de la crème fraîche."]','2026-01-11 00:13:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11819,5219,'fr','Tourte au poulet et poireaux','Une tarte copieuse sans gluten et sans blé pour réchauffer les soirées d''hiver','["175g de farine sans gluten","85 g de beurre réfrigéré grossièrement râpé","50 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","1 cuillère à café de moutarde à gros grains","500 g de poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en morceaux","25g de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 poireaux, tranchés grossièrement","350 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","1 cuillère à soupe de farine sans gluten","85 g de cresson haché","4 tbsp crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de lait pour le glaçage"]','["Mélanger la farine, une pincée de sel\r\net le beurre dans un bol, puis\r\nincorporer le fromage. Mélanger 2 cuillères à soupe\r\neau froide avec la moutarde\r\net incorporer. Former une pâte.\r\nFilmer et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Faire frire le poulet au chaud\r\nbeurre et huile pendant 5 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajouter les poireaux\r\net faire frire pendant 2 à 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nramolli. Ajoutez le bouillon, apportez\r\nà ébullition puis couvrir et\r\nlaisser mijoter doucement pendant 15 minutes.","Préchauffer le four à 200°C/gaz 6/chaleur tournante 180°C. Transférer le poulet et les poireaux dans un plat à tarte de 1,2 litre à l''aide d''une écumoire – laisser le bouillon dans la poêle. Faites une pâte avec la farine et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau froide. Diluer avec 2 cuillères à soupe de bouillon puis ajouter dans la poêle et remuer sur le feu sans arrêt jusqu''à épaississement. Hors du feu, incorporez le cresson et la crème fraîche, assaisonnez et versez sur le poulet et les poireaux. Cool.","Étalez la pâte entre 2 morceaux de film alimentaire jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste plus grande que le plat. Retirez le morceau de film supérieur et posez la pâte sur un rouleau à pâtisserie avec le film alimentaire en dessous. Poser la pâte vers le bas sur la garniture. Retirez le film, puis coupez le pourtour. Faites un petit trou au centre. Badigeonner la pâte de lait. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:13:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11820,5221,'fr','Pouding au chocolat auto-sauce','Ceux qui suivent un régime sans gluten ne doivent pas manquer de délicieux desserts éponges grâce à quelques échanges astucieux','["100 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de farine nature sans gluten","50g de farine de sarrasin","140 g de sucre en poudre doré","50g de cacao","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique sans gluten","2 cuillères à café de gomme xanthane","4 cuillères à soupe de café au lait, préparé dans une tasse comme si vous alliez le boire","3 gros œufs","150 ml de lait","100 g de chocolat au lait cassé en morceaux","glace vanille ou crème liquide, pour servir","200 g de sucre muscovado léger","25g de cacao"]','["Beurrer un plat allant au four de 2 litres et faire chauffer\r\nfour à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Faire bouillir le\r\nbouilloire. Mettez les farines, le sucre semoule,\r\ncacao, levure chimique, gomme xanthane\r\net une pincée de sel dans un grand bol à mélanger.\r\nFouetter ensemble le café, les œufs fondus\r\nbeurre et lait, puis verser sur le sec\r\ningrédients et mélanger jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse. Incorporer les morceaux de chocolat et\r\ngrattez le tout dans le plat allant au four.","Mélangez 300 ml d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire\r\navec le sucre et le cacao pour la sauce,\r\npuis versez ça partout sur la pâte à pudding\r\n– ne vous inquiétez pas si cela semble pur\r\nscène ! Cuire au four sur la grille du milieu du\r\nfour pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la surface soit\r\nferme, levé et croustillant. Pendant que vous ramassez\r\ncuillerées dans des bols de service, vous devriez\r\ntrouvez une sauce au chocolat riche et brillante\r\nsous l''éponge. Mangez immédiatement\r\navec de la glace vanille ou de la crème liquide."]','2026-01-11 00:13:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11821,5223,'fr','Petits pâtés émiettés','Tartes à la viande hachée en pâte brisée avec une touche d''originalité – un crumble extra croustillant et noisette sur le dessus','["225 g de viande hachée","225 g de farine nature","100 g de beurre refroidi et coupé en gros cubes","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre muscovado léger","satsuma, zeste râpé et jus de","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop de gingembre","sucre glace pour saupoudrer"]','["Pour faire la pâte, versez la farine dans un grand bol et incorporez le beurre refroidi du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure grossière. Incorporer le sucre et le zeste de satsuma.","Versez 4 cuillères à soupe du mélange pâtissier et réservez. Ajoutez environ 4 cuillères à soupe du jus des satsumas au mélange pâtissier principal pour obtenir une pâte assez molle, en pétrissant doucement jusqu''à consistance lisse. Envelopper dans du film alimentaire et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Farinez légèrement une surface et étalez la pâte sur une épaisseur de pièce de 1 £. A l''aide d''un emporte-pièce cannelé de 9 cm, découpez 12 cercles de pâte. Pressez-les doucement dans des moules à tartelettes individuels, la pâte doit juste dépasser des moules pour permettre le rétrécissement à la cuisson. Versez la viande hachée dans les fonds de tarte en prenant soin de ne pas trop remplir.","Saupoudrer légèrement le mélange à crumble pâtissier sur la viande hachée, garnir d''amandes effilées et arroser de sirop de tige de gingembre. A ce stade, vous pouvez les recouvrir d''un film alimentaire et congeler toute la plaque prête à cuire.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à cuire les tartelettes, chauffez le feu à 200°C/ventilateur 180°C/gaz 6. Retirez le film alimentaire de la plaque et faites cuire les tartelettes directement du congélateur pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et bien cuites. Laisser refroidir sur une grille et servir saupoudré de sucre glace. Cuire les tartes non surgelées pendant 18 à 20 minutes."]','2026-01-11 00:13:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11822,5225,'fr','Mango & passion fruit meringue roulade','Vous organisez un dîner ? Que diriez-vous de réaliser cette roulade de meringue délicieusement riche et crémeuse ? Le meilleur, c''est qu''il est faible en gras et sans gluten','["3 gros blancs d''œufs","175 g de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café rase de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de malt","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","200 g de yaourt grec sans matière grasse","1 grosse mangue mûre, pelée, dénoyautée et coupée en dés","4 fruits de la passion, pulpe uniquement","du sucre glace (facultatif) et quelques physalis, pour décorer","sauce aux framboises, pour servir (voir « Essayer » ci-dessous)"]','["Préchauffer le four à 150°C/\r\ngaz 2/ventilateur 130C. Tapisser un 33x23cm\r\nmoule à petit pain suisse avec cuisson antiadhésive\r\nparchemin. Battre les blancs d''œufs\r\navec un fouet électrique jusqu''à consistance mousseuse\r\net doublé en volume. Fouetter lentement\r\ndans le sucre en poudre jusqu''à épaississement et\r\nbrillant. Mélanger la maïzena, le vinaigre\r\net l''extrait de vanille, puis incorporer\r\nles blancs d''œufs.","Verser dans le moule et niveler le\r\nsurface soigneusement, afin de ne pas pousser\r\ndehors. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla surface de la meringue est juste ferme.","Sortir du four et couvrir de papier sulfurisé humide pendant\r\n10 minutes. Époussetez une autre feuille de\r\npapier sulfurisé avec sucre glace.\r\nJetez le papier humide et retournez\r\nla meringue sur le dragéifié\r\npapier. Décollez la doublure\r\npapier, puis étalez du yaourt sur le\r\nmeringue et parsemer de mangue\r\net fruits de la passion. Utilisez le papier pour\r\nrouler la roulade d''un court\r\nfin. Gardez la jointure en dessous. Tamiser\r\nun peu de sucre glace par dessus si tu veux,\r\ndécorer de physalis et servir\r\navec une sauce aux framboises."]','2026-01-11 00:13:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11823,5227,'fr','Forest fruits clafoutis','Un délicieux dessert, à base de farine sans gluten','["500 ml de fruits de la Forêt-Noire surgelés, décongelés","5-6 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","15g de pâte à tartiner pure sans produits laitiers","85 g de farine nature sans gluten Doves Farm","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","4 œufs","400 ml de lait de coco en boîte","3 cuillères à soupe de courge cassis ou fruits rouges","½ cuillère à café d''arrow-root mélangée à un peu d''eau","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Égouttez les fruits en réservant le jus. Mélangez les baies avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre, puis étalez-les en couche uniforme dans un plat rond allant au four de 24 cm, graissé de pâte à tartiner aux légumes.","Tamisez la farine et la cannelle dans un grand bol et incorporez le reste du sucre. Dans un pichet, battez ensemble les œufs et le lait de coco, puis incorporez-les au mélange de farine pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Versez lentement la pâte sur les fruits puis enfournez pour 40 à 45 minutes.","Faites chauffer la courge et le jus réservé dans une poêle. Incorporer l’arrow-root jusqu’à épaississement. Saupoudrez le clafoutis de sucre glace et servez-le arrosé de coulis."]','2026-01-11 00:13:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11824,5229,'fr','Plateau de poulet harissa','Tout le monde aime les plats au four faciles, ce plat de poulet à la pâte d''harissa épicée est rôti à la perfection avec de l''ail, des pommes de terre et des tomates cerises.','["3 cuillères à soupe de harissa","½ pot de 500 g de yaourt nature allégé","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en tranches","1 petite courge musquée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en longs quartiers","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 6. Mélangez 2 cuillères à soupe de harissa\r\navec 3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt. Frotter\r\npartout sur les poitrines de poulet et\r\nlaisser mariner pendant\r\nvous démarrez les légumes.","Mélangez la courge et le\r\noignons avec le reste de harissa,\r\nmélangé avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile (tournesol,\r\nlégume ou olive c''est bien), et certains\r\nassaisonner dans un grand plat à rôtir.\r\nRôtir pendant 10 minutes.","Sortez les légumes du four, ajoutez\r\nle poulet dans le moule, puis rôtir pendant\r\nencore 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet\r\net les légumes sont bien cuits. Servir avec\r\nle reste du yaourt à côté, et\r\nun grand bol de couscous ou de riz."]','2026-01-11 00:13:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11825,5231,'fr','Bruschetta de polenta et tapenade','Idéal pour ceux qui suivent un régime sans blé ou sans gluten','["700 ml de bouillon de légumes (le bouillon de légumes suisse au souci est sans gluten et sans produits laitiers)","140 g de polenta instantanée","2 cuillères à soupe de basilic frais haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","9 cuillères à café (environ un demi-pot de 190 g) de tapenade d''olives","9 tomates SunBlush ou semi-séchées, coupées en deux","100 g de feuilles de salade mélangée"]','["Portez le bouillon à ébullition dans une casserole, puis laissez mijoter. En remuant continuellement, versez la polenta à vapeur constante et laissez cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Incorporer le basilic et assaisonner avec du poivre noir et du sel, si vous le souhaitez. Étalez sur un moule peu profond huilé mesurant 24 x 18 cm. Laisser poser 1h.","Coupez la polenta en 9 rectangles de 8 x 6 cm chacun, puis coupez-la en deux en diagonale pour former des triangles. Faites chauffer une plaque chauffante jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude, badigeonnez chaque triangle d''huile et faites griller pendant 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant et doré.","Garnir chaque triangle avec 1 à 2 cuillères à café de tapenade et une demi-tomate. Servir tiède sur des feuilles de salade."]','2026-01-11 00:13:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11826,5233,'fr','Rouleaux d''halloumi et de bacon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Impressionnez vos amis avec ces délicieuses bouchées sans gluten – idéales pour un buffet.','["250 g de fromage halloumi en bloc","10 rashers de pancetta ou bacon fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette hachée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Couper\r\nle halloumi en 20 bâtonnets. étirer chacun\r\nune tranche de pancetta avec le dos d''un couteau,\r\npuis coupé en deux. assaisonner la pancetta avec\r\njuste du poivre noir, puis saupoudrez de\r\nciboulette hachée.","Roulez la pancetta autour du halloumi\r\nune spirale et disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Cuire au four\r\npendant 10 à 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pancetta soit dorée\r\net commence à devenir croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:13:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11827,5239,'fr','Oeufs au pesto sains sur du pain grillé','Essayez un pesto rapide et faible en gras comme alternative délicieuse à l''huile pour frire les œufs : il ajoute également une excellente saveur au plat pour préparer un brunch ou un déjeuner parfait.','["2 à 4 fines tranches de levain de seigle (environ 70 g au total, selon la taille du pain)","2 œufs","170 g de tomates sur vigne","160 g de pousses d''épinards","pincée de flocons de piment (facultatif)","1 gousse d''ail","10g de basilic","1 cuillère à soupe de pignons de pin","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à soupe de parmesan finement râpé ou alternative végétarienne"]','["Pour faire le pesto, épluchez la gousse d''ail et mettez-la dans un petit robot culinaire avec le basilic, les pignons de pin, l''huile et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez le fromage. Ou mixez à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant.","Faire griller le pain et le répartir dans deux assiettes. Faites cuire le pesto dans une poêle à feu moyen pendant 30 secondes en remuant. Cassez les œufs d''un côté de la poêle, mettez les tomates de l''autre et faites-les frire dans le pesto jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient cuits à votre goût.","Retirez les œufs et déposez-les chacun sur une tranche de pain grillé. Ajoutez les épinards dans la poêle avec les tomates, augmentez le feu et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés, environ 2-3 minutes. Les tomates doivent être tendres. Versez les légumes sur l''autre tranche de pain grillé et saupoudrez de flocons de piment, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11828,5241,'fr','Tofu brouillé','Essayez notre tofu épicé végétalien avec des tomates cerises pour une version sans œufs de pain grillé brouillé. Parfait au petit-déjeuner, servi sur du pain de seigle','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon , finement tranché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","280 g de tofu extra ferme","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","½ petit bouquet de persil haché","pain de seigle, pour servir, (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir doucement l''oignon pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et collant. Incorporer l''ail, le curcuma, le cumin et le paprika et cuire 1 min.","Écrasez grossièrement le tofu dans un bol à l''aide d''une fourchette en gardant quelques morceaux en gros morceaux. Ajouter à la poêle et faire revenir 3 minutes. Augmentez le feu, puis versez les tomates et faites cuire encore 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Incorporez le persil au mélange. Servir seul ou avec du pain de seigle grillé (non sans gluten), si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11829,5243,'fr','Granola matzo à la noix de coco, noix de cajou et canneberge','Dégustez ce granola au petit-déjeuner pendant la fête juive de Pâque, lorsque de nombreux pains ne sont pas au menu. Essayez-le saupoudré sur un bol de yaourt grec et de fruits.','["5 feuilles de pain azyme (tout type : complet, seigle, épeautre, sans gluten)","150 g de noix de cajou hachées grossièrement","150 g d''amandes blanchies ou régulières, hachées grossièrement","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","80 ml de sirop d''érable","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","75g de flocons de noix de coco","100 g de canneberges séchées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Émietter le pain azyme en bouchées dans un grand bol et mélanger avec les noix hachées.","Mélangez l''huile de tournesol, le sirop d''érable, la cannelle et ½ cuillère à café de sel dans un autre bol, puis versez-le sur les ingrédients secs mélangés. Bien mélanger pour enrober et verser sur la plaque à pâtisserie.","Cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes, en retournant plusieurs fois pour que le granola dore uniformément. Au bout de 10 minutes, ajoutez les flocons de noix de coco et laissez cuire les 5 dernières minutes. Gardez un œil dessus car il peut rapidement devenir trop sombre. Lorsqu''il est doré, sortez-le du four et laissez-le refroidir sur la plaque à pâtisserie. Il deviendra croustillant en refroidissant. Incorporer les canneberges, puis transférer dans un récipient propre une fois complètement refroidies.","Servir avec du lait ou du yaourt grec et des fruits hachés. Si vous pouvez arrêter d’en grignoter, il devrait y en avoir suffisamment pour passer la Pâque."]','2026-01-11 00:13:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11830,5247,'fr','Crêpes aux épinards','Dégustez ces crêpes à base d''épinards avec des fruits rouges et du sirop d''érable, ou retirez le sucre de la pâte et servez-les salées avec du bacon et un œuf poché.','["125 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à soupe de sucre (n''importe quelle sorte)","2 œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour la friture","100 ml de lait","50 g de pousses d''épinards lavées et hachées","baies et sirop d''érable, pour servir"]','["Mettez la farine, la levure chimique, le sucre, les œufs, le beurre, le lait et les épinards dans un mélange et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse et vert vif.","Faites chauffer un peu plus de beurre dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et ajoutez de petites cuillerées dans la poêle, 2-3 à la fois. Cuire pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient pris et que des bulles remontent à la surface, puis retourner et cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes. Gardez au chaud pendant que vous faites cuire les lots restants.","Servir avec des baies et un filet de sirop pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11831,5249,'fr','Crêpes américaines au sarrasin','Préparez ces crêpes américaines à base de farine de sarrasin pour un petit-déjeuner ou un brunch paresseux le week-end. Délicieux avec des bleuets ou des pépites de chocolat et du sirop d''érable','["150 g de farine nature","150g de farine de sarrasin","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","50 g de beurre fondu","2 gros œufs","400 ml de babeurre","huile végétale, pour la friture","bleuets","sirop d''érable"]','["Mélangez la farine ordinaire, la farine de sarrasin, le sucre, ½ cuillère à café de sel, la levure chimique et le bicarbonate de soude dans un grand bol. Mélangez le beurre fondu, les œufs et le babeurre dans un pichet et fouettez pour mélanger. Incorporer lentement les ingrédients humides aux ingrédients secs jusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné, pour obtenir une pâte épaisse.","Chauffer une grande poêle ou une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et badigeonner d''une légère couche d''huile végétale. Ajoutez quelques cuillères à soupe bombées du mélange dans la poêle et formez un cercle. Si votre poêle est suffisamment grande, vous pouvez en faire 2 ou 3 à la fois, mais ne surchargez pas non plus la poêle. Une fois que les bords sont pris et que des bulles apparaissent à la surface (environ 2-3 minutes), retournez et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Les crêpes doivent être bien dorées des deux côtés. Transférer dans un four chaud à basse température et répéter le processus jusqu''à ce que toute la pâte soit utilisée.","Servir empilé de bleuets frais et de sirop d''érable généreusement arrosé sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:13:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11832,5251,'fr','Riz petit-déjeuner vanille et cannelle','Envie de changer du porridge ? Ce petit-déjeuner sain à base de riz, de vanille et de cannelle, garni d''abricots et de noix, vous rassasiera pour la matinée.','["200 g de riz basmati complet","200 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","3 feuilles de laurier","1 bâton de cannelle","12 abricots secs coupés en deux dans le sens de la largeur (pour qu''ils paraissent encore entiers)","4 pots de yaourt bio de 100 ml","12 moitiés de noix, cassées en morceaux"]','["Versez le riz dans une grande poêle antiadhésive profonde avec 600 ml d''eau, le lait, la vanille, les feuilles de laurier et le bâton de cannelle. Portez à ébullition, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre. Gardez un œil dessus pour vous assurer qu’il ne bout pas à sec vers la fin de son temps de cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, versez les abricots dans une petite casserole avec 300 ml d''eau et faites cuire à feu moyen-doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, environ 10 à 15 minutes. Annuler.","Retirez les feuilles de laurier et le bâton de cannelle du riz, puis incorporez la moitié du yaourt. Le riz et les abricots se conserveront au frais, séparément, jusqu''à 24 heures. Versez le riz dans des bols et garnissez avec le reste du yaourt, les abricots et leur jus et les noix. Si vous avez préparé le riz et les abricots la veille, mangez froids ou réchauffez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient chauds, en ajoutant un peu de lait au riz pour le détendre."]','2026-01-11 00:13:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11833,5255,'fr','Crêpes protéinées faciles','Augmentez vos protéines avec ces crêpes à base d''œufs, d''avoine, de lait et de poudre de protéines. Un excellent petit-déjeuner après une séance d''entraînement, à déguster avec du beurre de noix ou des fruits','["1 banane","75g de flocons d''avoine","3 gros œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de lait (les laits laitiers, de soja, d''avoine ou de noix fonctionnent tous)","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","pincée de cannelle","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de protéine (petit-lait, pois ou selon votre préférence)","de l''huile de coco, ou une huile sans saveur, pour la friture","beurre de noix, sirop d''érable et baies ou tranches de banane pour servir"]','["Mélangez la banane, les flocons d''avoine, les œufs, le lait, la levure chimique, la cannelle et la poudre de protéines dans un mélange pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse. Vérifiez que les flocons d''avoine sont décomposés, sinon, mélangez pendant encore une minute.","Faites chauffer un filet d''huile dans une poêle. Versez ou versez 2-3 tours de pâte, en laissant un peu d''espace entre chacun pour étaler. Cuire 1 à 2 minutes, jusqu''à ce que des bulles commencent à apparaître à la surface et que le dessous soit doré. Retourner et cuire encore une minute jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Transférer dans un four chauffé et répéter avec le reste de la pâte. Servir en piles avec du beurre de noix, du sirop d''érable et des fruits."]','2026-01-11 00:13:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11834,5257,'fr','Soufflé pancakes','Essayez ces crêpes de style soufflé pour les crêpes les plus légères, les plus moelleuses et les plus rêveuses. Servir avec du beurre, un saupoudrage de sucre glace et un peu de sirop d''érable','["2 gros œufs, séparés","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de lait","2 cuillères à soupe de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","beurre, sucre glace et sirop d''érable, pour servir"]','["Battez les blancs d''œufs dans un bol propre avec 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre à l''aide d''un fouet électrique ou d''un batteur sur socle pour former des pics fermes.","Battez les jaunes d''œufs, 1 cuillère à soupe de sucre et la vanille dans un bol séparé jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux, et qu''une trace de ruban reste à la surface lorsque les batteurs sont retirés. Incorporer délicatement le lait et la farine jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tout juste incorporés.","Incorporez les blancs d''œufs au mélange de jaunes d''œufs et retournez délicatement la pâte pour mélanger, en utilisant le côté d''une cuillère en métal ou d''une spatule pour garder tout l''air dans le mélange.","En travaillant assez rapidement, faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive avec un couvercle à feu très doux. Versez un peu d''huile dans la poêle, puis essuyez-la avec un morceau de papier absorbant – vous voulez seulement un petit film sur le fond de la poêle. Préparez trois grandes crêpes en empilant trois cuillerées de pâte dans la poêle, en utilisant environ les deux tiers du mélange. Gardez-les empilés assez haut, ne renversez pas la poêle et ne les étalez pas comme vous le feriez pour des crêpes normales. Couvrez avec un couvercle et laissez cuire 2 à 4 minutes, la vapeur les aidera à prendre. Retirez le couvercle et ajoutez une autre cuillerée de pâte à chaque crêpe, cela créera la hauteur et l''épaisseur classiques. Remettez le couvercle et laissez cuire encore 4 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit légèrement pris.","Très délicatement et délicatement, retournez les crêpes dans la poêle à l''aide d''une tranche de poisson ou d''une spatule. Les bases doivent être légèrement dorées. Remettez le couvercle et laissez cuire encore 4 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que les deux côtés soient dorés et qu''ils vacillent légèrement, mais ne s''effondrent pas ou ne collent pas. Servir avec une noisette de beurre, un saupoudrage de sucre glace et un peu de sirop d''érable."]','2026-01-11 00:13:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11835,5261,'fr','Gruau végétalien aux amandes et aux baies','Essayez nos flocons d''avoine cuits au four aux amandes et aux baies mélangées pour le petit-déjeuner ou comme un délicieux pudding léger. Les baies surgelées sont un choix économique, même en été','["150 g de flocons d''avoine","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","225 ml de lait d''amande non sucré, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","1 grosse banane bien mûre, pelée","185 g de baies mélangées surgelées (la nôtre contenait une combinaison de fraises, de mûres et de groseilles)","1 cuillère à café de sirop d''érable (facultatif)","1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Chauffez le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Versez les flocons d''avoine dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, puis versez dessus 450 ml d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Bien mélanger, puis incorporer la vanille et le lait d''amande.","Écrasez la banane, puis étalez-la sur le fond d''un plat allant au four moyen (le nôtre était un ovale de 20 x 28 cm) et incorporez les fruits surgelés pour bien mélanger. Vous voulez que la banane adoucisse les baies, mais vous pouvez ajouter 1 cuillère à café de sirop d''érable, si vous le souhaitez. Verser sur le mélange d''avoine et parsemer d''amandes. Cuire au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pris et que les jus de fruits bouillonnent sur les bords du plat. Verser dans des bols et servir avec un peu de lait supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11836,5265,'fr','Scones de petit-déjeuner au chia et à l''avoine avec yaourt et baies','Ces scones sains pour le petit-déjeuner ont une texture légèrement plus rebondissante que les scones traditionnels, mais constituent un bon début de journée et fournissent du folate, de la vitamine C et des fibres.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza pressée à froid, plus un peu pour les ramequins","50 ml de lait","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","160 g de farine d''épeautre complète nature","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de chia","25g de flocons d''avoine","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 pots de 120g de yaourt grec bio","400 g de fraises décortiquées et tranchées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser le fond de 4 ramequins de 185 ml d''un disque de papier sulfurisé et huiler les côtés avec l''huile de colza. Mesurez le lait dans un pichet et complétez à 300 ml avec de l''eau. Incorporer le jus de citron, la vanille et les 2 cuillères à café d''huile. Mélangez la farine, les graines et l''avoine puis passez-les au robot culinaire pour rendre le mélange aussi fin que possible. Incorporer la levure chimique.","Versez le liquide, puis remuez avec la lame d''un couteau jusqu''à obtenir une pâte très humide comme de la pâte. Répartir uniformément dans les ramequins puis cuire au four sur une plaque à pâtisserie pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés – ils n''ont pas besoin d''être dorés mais doivent être fermes. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes puis passer un couteau à l''intérieur des ramequins pour détacher les scones puis les retirer délicatement.","Les scones peuvent être consommés immédiatement ou refroidis et conservés pour plus tard. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, cette recette peut être utilisée pour deux personnes sur deux repas, utilisez immédiatement deux scones divisés en deux et servis garnis de la moitié du yaourt et de deux portions de baies. Refroidissez et emballez le reste pour le manger un autre jour selon le plan."]','2026-01-11 00:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11837,5267,'fr','Gâteau au porridge sain','Commencez votre journée du bon pied avec ce bol rempli d''avoine, de baies, de banane et de graines. C''est sain et regorge de nutriments pour alimenter le corps et l''esprit.','["100 g de framboises surgelées","1 orange, ½ tranchée et ½ jus","150 g de flocons d''avoine","100 ml de lait","½ banane, tranchée","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre d''amande onctueux","1 cuillère à soupe de baies de goji","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de chia"]','["Versez la moitié des framboises et tout le jus d''orange dans une casserole. Laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que les framboises ramollissent, environ 5 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, remuez les flocons d''avoine, le lait et 450 ml d''eau dans une casserole à feu doux jusqu''à obtenir une consistance crémeuse. Garnir de compote de framboises, des framboises restantes, des tranches d''orange, de la banane, du beurre d''amande, des baies de goji et des graines de chia."]','2026-01-11 00:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11838,5269,'fr','Shakchouka saine','Commencez la journée sur une note plus légère avec cette shakshuka satisfaisante, une merveilleuse poêle remplie de tomates, de poivrons, d''épinards et d''œufs. Il contient quatre de vos 5 par jour','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","1 oignon rouge, coupé en fines tranches","1 poivron rouge, finement tranché","1 poivron jaune, finement tranché","3 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre écrasées","1 cuillère à café bombée de paprika doux fumé","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","115 g de pousses d''épinards","4 œufs moyens","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement","½ petit bouquet d''aneth, haché grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Ajoutez l''oignon et les poivrons et faites revenir à feu moyen pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez l''ail, le cumin, la coriandre et le paprika et faites revenir encore 1 min. Versez les tomates, les épinards et 100 ml d''eau et faites bouillonner jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter à découvert pendant 10 minutes. Assaisonner au goût.","Faites quatre empreintes dans le mélange de tomates et cassez délicatement un œuf dans chacune. Couvrir avec un couvercle ou du papier d''aluminium et cuire à feu doux pendant 8 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient à peine pris. Découvrez, parsemez d''herbes fraîches et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11839,5271,'fr','Oeufs d''avocat et de haricots noirs','Préparez-vous pour la journée avec ce petit-déjeuner végétarien sain avec des œufs, de l''avocat et des haricots noirs. Cela ne prend que 10 minutes à préparer et constitue également un excellent déjeuner','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 piment rouge épépiné et tranché finement","1 grosse gousse d''ail, tranchée","2 gros œufs","400 g de haricots noirs en boîte","½ boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","¼ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 petit avocat, coupé en deux et tranché","une poignée de coriandre fraîche hachée","1 citron vert, coupé en quartiers"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Ajouter le piment et l''ail et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et commencent à colorer. Cassez les œufs de chaque côté de la poêle. Une fois qu''ils commencent à prendre, versez les haricots (avec leur jus) et les tomates autour de la poêle et saupoudrez de graines de cumin. Votre objectif est de réchauffer les haricots et les tomates plutôt que de les cuire.","Retirez la casserole du feu et répartissez-y l''avocat et la coriandre. Pressez plus de la moitié des quartiers de citron vert. Servir avec les quartiers restants sur le côté pour les presser."]','2026-01-11 00:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11840,5273,'fr','Burrito du petit-déjeuner','Créez un cocon nutritif pour les ingrédients du petit-déjeuner avec un wrap complet : nous avons inclus des œufs riches en protéines et de l''avocat pour ajouter de bonnes graisses à ce burrito.','["1 cuillère à café de pâte chipotle","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","50g de chou frisé","7 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","½ petit avocat, tranché","1 tortilla complète, réchauffée"]','["Fouettez la pâte de chipotle avec l''œuf et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un pichet. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez le chou frisé et les tomates.","Cuire jusqu''à ce que le chou frisé soit fané et que les tomates aient ramolli, puis poussez le tout sur le côté de la poêle. Versez l''œuf battu dans la moitié dégagée de la poêle et brouillez. Disposez le tout au centre de votre wrap, en garnissant d''avocat, puis enveloppez et mangez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11841,5275,'fr','Gruau du jour au lendemain','Adaptez cette recette de flocons d''avoine faciles à préparer pour la nuit selon vos goûts. Vous pouvez ajouter des fruits secs, des graines et des noix, des pommes ou des poires râpées ou des fruits tropicaux hachés.','["¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","50 g de flocons d''avoine","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature","50 g de baies mélangées","un filet de miel","½ cuillère à soupe de beurre de noix (nous avons utilisé de l''amande)"]','["La veille de servir, mélangez la cannelle et 100 ml d''eau (ou de lait) à vos flocons d''avoine avec une pincée de sel.","Le lendemain, détendez avec un peu plus d''eau (ou de lait) si nécessaire. Garnir avec le yaourt, les baies, un filet de miel et le beurre de noix."]','2026-01-11 00:13:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11842,5277,'fr','Crêpes à la banane et à l''avoine','Préparez nos crêpes plus saines en utilisant des flocons d''avoine et de la banane pour une douceur naturelle. Servir avec une cuillerée de yaourt crémeux et des fruits frais','["125 ml de lait d''avoine","2 œufs, séparés","1 petite banane","100 g de flocons d''avoine","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","quelques gouttes d''extrait de vanille","pulvérisation d''huile","yaourt faible en gras et fruits pour garnir"]','["Mettez le lait d''avoine, les jaunes d''œufs, la banane, l''avoine, la levure chimique et la vanille dans un mélangeur et mixez pour obtenir un mélange aussi lisse que possible. Battre les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce qu''ils forment des pics fermes. Incorporez 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe de blancs à la pâte, puis incorporez le reste.","Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et vaporisez un peu d''huile, versez environ 2 cuillères à soupe de pâte dans la poêle et laissez cuire 1 à 2 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la base prenne et que des bulles apparaissent sur le dessus. Retourner et cuire l''autre côté pendant une minute. Répétez par lots, en vous assurant que le dessus semble sec avant de tenter le retournement, sinon le centre s''effondrera."]','2026-01-11 00:13:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11843,5279,'fr','Omelette aux herbes et tomates frites','Préparez un brunch ou un petit-déjeuner parfait et riche en protéines pour deux personnes. Cette omelette saine peut être servie en seulement 10 minutes, servie avec des tomates juteuses','["1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","3 tomates, coupées en deux","4 gros œufs","1 cuillère à soupe de persil haché","1 cuillère à soupe de basilic haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une petite poêle antiadhésive, puis faites cuire les tomates côté coupé vers le bas jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir et à colorer. Pendant ce temps, battez les œufs avec les herbes et beaucoup de poivre noir fraîchement moulu dans un petit bol.","Retirez les tomates de la poêle et disposez-les sur deux assiettes de service. Versez le mélange d''œufs dans la poêle et remuez doucement avec une cuillère en bois pour que l''œuf qui se dépose au fond de la poêle bouge pour permettre à l''œuf non cuit de s''écouler dans l''espace. Arrêtez de remuer quand il est presque cuit pour lui permettre de prendre une omelette. Coupez-le en quatre et servez-le avec les tomates."]','2026-01-11 00:13:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11844,5281,'fr','Bouillie aux trois céréales','Ce petit-déjeuner sain, à base de flocons d''avoine grillés, d''épeautre et d''orge, est ultra simple à réaliser et se conserve jusqu''à six mois.','["300g de flocons d''avoine","300 g de flocons d''épeautre","300 g de flocons d''orge","nectar d''agave et fraises tranchées, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["En travaillant par lots, faites griller les flocons d''avoine, les flocons d''épeautre et l''orge dans une grande poêle à frire sèche pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis laissez refroidir et conservez dans un récipient hermétique.","Lorsque vous souhaitez le manger, mélangez simplement 50 g du mélange de bouillie dans une casserole avec 300 ml de lait ou d''eau. Cuire 5 minutes en remuant de temps en temps, puis garnir d''un filet de miel et de fraises, si vous le souhaitez (facultatif). Se conservera 6 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:13:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11845,5283,'fr','Bouillie d''été','Un porridge végétalien sain et estival avec de l''avoine géante et des graines de grenade rose vif','["300 ml de lait d''amande","200 g de myrtilles","½ cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de chia","100 g de flocons d''avoine géants","1 kiwi coupé en tranches","50g de graines de grenade","2 cuillères à café de graines mélangées"]','["Dans un mixeur, mixez le lait, les myrtilles et le sirop d''érable jusqu''à ce que le lait devienne violet. Mettez le chia et les flocons d''avoine dans un bol à mélanger, versez le lait de myrtille et remuez bien. Laisser tremper 5 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que le liquide soit absorbé et que les flocons d''avoine et de chia épaississent et gonflent.","Remuez à nouveau, puis répartissez dans deux bols. Disposez les fruits dessus, puis saupoudrez du mélange de graines. Se conserve 1 journée au réfrigérateur. Ajoutez les garnitures juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11846,5285,'fr','Porridge à la cardamome et aux pêches et au quinoa','Un petit-déjeuner sain composé d''avoine et de quinoa avec une pêche fraîche et mûre. Le lait d''amande convient aux régimes sans produits laitiers et végétaliens','["75 g de quinoa","25 g de flocons d''avoine","4 gousses de cardamome","250 ml de lait d''amande non sucré","2 pêches mûres, coupées en tranches","1 cuillère à café de sirop d''érable"]','["Mettez le quinoa, les flocons d''avoine et les gousses de cardamome dans une petite casserole avec 250 ml d''eau et 100 ml de lait d''amande. Portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter doucement pendant 15 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Versez le reste du lait d''amande et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux.","Retirez les gousses de cardamome, versez-les dans des bols ou des bocaux et garnissez de pêches et de sirop d''érable."]','2026-01-11 00:13:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11847,5287,'fr','Bircher Orange & Myrtille','Faire tremper l’avoine et les graines pendant la nuit les rend facilement digestibles. Ajoutez les fruits et vous commencerez la journée de manière nutritive avec le bon type de graisses, de fibres, de vitamines et de minéraux.','["70 g de flocons d''avoine","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin dorées","le zeste d''une ½ orange","¾ d''un pot de yaourt de 175 g","2 oranges pelées et hachées","4 poignées de myrtilles en paquet de 150 g"]','["Mélangez 70 g de flocons d''avoine et 2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin dorées avec le zeste d''une demi-orange. Versez dessus 300 ml d''eau bouillante et laissez reposer toute la nuit. Le lendemain, ajoutez les trois quarts d''un pot de yaourt de 175 g, versez dans des verres ou des bols, garnissez de 2 oranges pelées et hachées, du reste de yaourt et de 4 poignées de myrtilles d''un paquet de 150 g."]','2026-01-11 00:13:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11848,5289,'fr','Oeufs brouillés au basilic, épinards et tomates','Oubliez les toasts et servez vos œufs brouillés avec des tomates fraîches et des épinards pour un petit-déjeuner rapide et suralimenté.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza, plus 1 cuillère à café","3 tomates, coupées en deux","4 gros œufs","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt bio naturel","? basilic en petit paquet, haché","175 g de jeunes épinards bien séchés (s''ils doivent être lavés)"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez les tomates et faites cuire, côté coupé vers le bas, à feu moyen. Pendant la cuisson, battez les œufs dans un pichet avec le yaourt, 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, beaucoup de poivre noir et le basilic.","Transférer les tomates dans des assiettes de service. Ajoutez les épinards dans la poêle et faites-les tomber en remuant plusieurs fois pendant que vous faites cuire les œufs.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen, versez le mélange d''œufs et remuez de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit brouillé et juste pris. Répartir les épinards dans les assiettes et garnir d''œufs brouillés."]','2026-01-11 00:13:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11849,5291,'fr','Bircher muesli aux pommes et bananes','Faire tremper l''avoine et les graines pendant la nuit les rend plus faciles à digérer et le muesli sera encore plus crémeux. Idéal pour un petit-déjeuner rapide directement sorti du réfrigérateur','["1 pomme à manger, râpée grossièrement","50 g de flocons d''avoine géants","25 g de graines mélangées (tournesol, citrouille, sésame et graines de lin)","25 g de fruits à coque mélangés (comme du Brésil, des noisettes, des amandes, des noix de pécan et des noix), hachés grossièrement","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","100g de yaourt bio entier naturel","1 banane moyenne, tranchée","25 g de raisins secs bio"]','["Mettez la pomme râpée dans un bol et ajoutez les flocons d''avoine, les graines, la moitié des noix et la cannelle. Bien mélanger. Incorporer le yaourt et 100 ml d''eau froide, couvrir et réfrigérer plusieurs heures ou toute la nuit. Verser le muesli dans deux bols et garnir de tranches de banane, de raisins secs et de noix restantes."]','2026-01-11 00:13:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11850,5293,'fr','Œufs pochés avec brocoli, tomates et pain plat complet','Des œufs riches en protéines et du brocoli riche en antioxydants en font un choix de petit-déjeuner sain et satisfaisant.','["100 g de brocoli à tige fine, paré et coupé en deux","200 g de tomates cerises sur vigne","4 œufs fermiers moyens (réfrigérateur froid)","2 pains plats complets (voir Se marie bien avec pour la recette)","2 cuillères à café de graines mélangées (comme le tournesol, la citrouille, le sésame et les graines de lin)","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza pressée à froid","une bonne pincée de flocons de piment"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire. Chauffer le four à 120°C/100°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1/2 et mettre une plaque allant au four à l''intérieur pour réchauffer. Remplissez une casserole à fond large au tiers avec l''eau de la bouilloire et portez à ébullition. Ajoutez le brocoli et laissez cuire 2 min. Ajoutez les tomates, remettez à ébullition et laissez cuire 30 secondes. Retirez-le avec une pince ou une écumoire et placez-le sur la plaque chaude du four pendant que vous pochez les œufs.","Remettez l’eau à ébullition douce. Cassez les œufs dans la poêle, un à la fois, et faites cuire pendant 2 1/2 à 3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les blancs soient pris et que les jaunes coulent.","Répartir les pains plats entre les deux assiettes et garnir de brocoli et de tomates. Utilisez une écumoire pour égoutter les œufs, puis placez-les dessus. Saupoudrer de graines et arroser d''huile. Assaisonnez avec un peu de poivre noir et des flocons de piment et servez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:13:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11851,5295,'fr','Granola orange et framboise','Préparez votre propre lait d''avoine avec cette recette de granola sans sucre ajouté, ou servez-le avec du lait de vache ou du yaourt biologique.','["400 g de flocons d''avoine géants","jus de 2 oranges (150 ml), plus le zeste de ½","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à soupe de framboises ou de fraises lyophilisées (voir astuce)","25 g d''amandes effilées, grillées","25 g de graines mélangées (tournesol, citrouille, sésame et graines de lin)","2 grosses oranges, pelées et segmentées","feuilles de menthe (facultatif)"]','["Mettez 200 g de flocons d''avoine et 500 ml d''eau dans un robot culinaire et mixez pendant 1 min. Tapisser une passoire de mousseline propre et verser le mélange d''avoine. Laisser égoutter 5 minutes, puis torsader les extrémités de la mousseline et bien l''essorer pour capter un maximum de lait d''avoine – il doit avoir la consistance d''une crème liquide. Mieux réfrigéré au moins 1 heure avant de servir. Peut être conservé dans un pichet fermé ou couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 3 jours.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mettez le jus d''orange dans une casserole moyenne et portez à ébullition. Faire bouillir rapidement pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait réduit de moitié, en remuant de temps en temps. Mélangez les 200 g de flocons d''avoine restants avec le zeste d''orange et la cannelle. Retirez la casserole du feu et incorporez le mélange d''avoine au jus. Étaler sur la plaque tapissée en une fine couche et cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés et croustillants, en retournant les flocons d''avoine toutes les quelques minutes. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque.","Une fois refroidis, mélangez les flocons d''avoine avec les framboises, les amandes effilées et les graines. Peut être conservé dans un pot fermé jusqu''à une semaine. Pour servir, versez le granola dans des bols, versez dessus le lait d''avoine et garnissez de quartiers d''orange et de feuilles de menthe, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11852,5297,'fr','Haricots fumés sur pain grillé','Oubliez les boîtes de fèves au lard achetées en magasin, cette version maison est plus savoureuse et plus saine, avec un nombre impressionnant de 4 sur 5 par jour.','["½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","½ petit oignon, tranché","½ petit poivron rouge, tranché finement en lanières","1 gousse d''ail, coupée en deux","Boîte de 227 g de tomates concassées","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","Boîte de 210 g de haricots ou de pois chiches au beurre, égouttés","¼ cuillère à café de sucre","1 tranche de pain aux graines","quelques brins de persil finement hachés"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une petite poêle, ajoutez l''oignon et le poivron et faites revenir doucement jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, environ 10 à 15 minutes. Écrasez la moitié de l''ail et ajoutez-le dans la poêle, avec les tomates, le paprika, le vinaigre, les haricots, le sucre et un peu d''assaisonnement. Porter à ébullition et cuire 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit légèrement réduit et épaissi.","Faire griller le pain, frotter avec le reste d''ail et arroser d''un peu d''huile. Versez les haricots sur les toasts, arrosez d''un peu plus d''huile et parsemez de persil."]','2026-01-11 00:13:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11853,5299,'fr','Champignons à la moutarde crémeux sur du pain grillé avec un verre de jus','Un petit-déjeuner végétarien rapide et sain avec une sauce légère au fromage à la crème','["1 tranche de pain complet","1½ cuillère à soupe de fromage à la crème léger","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","3 poignées de petits champignons plats tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe de lait écrémé","¼ cuillère à café de moutarde complète","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette ciselée","150 ml de jus d''orange fraîchement pressé ou en brique"]','["Faire griller le pain, puis tartiner d''un peu de fromage (ne pas utiliser de beurre).","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir les champignons en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Verser le lait, le reste du fromage et la moutarde. Bien mélanger jusqu''à ce qu''il soit enrobé. Verser sur les toasts, garnir de ciboulette et servir avec le jus."]','2026-01-11 00:13:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11854,5301,'fr','Omelette aux champignons et basilic avec tomates écrasées','Un petit-déjeuner végétarien avec du mordant, essayez ce plat d''œufs avec du fromage à la crème, des herbes et des tomates grillées','["2 tomates, coupées en deux","3 œufs moyens","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette ciselée","300 g de champignons châtaignes émincés","1 cuillère à café de beurre non salé","2 cuillères à soupe de fromage à la crème faible en gras","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de basilic finement hachées"]','["Chauffez le gril au maximum et placez les tomates sur un carré de papier d''aluminium en dessous, en les retournant de temps en temps pour éviter qu''elles ne brûlent. Lorsque les tomates sont légèrement roussies, retirez-les du gril en les écrasant légèrement pour en libérer le jus.","Cassez les œufs dans un bol et mélangez à la fourchette. Ajoutez un petit peu d''eau et mélangez. Ajoutez la ciboulette et un peu de poivre noir et battez encore. Réservez pendant que vous préparez les champignons.","Dans une poêle antiadhésive, faites chauffer le beurre à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il mousse. Ajouter les champignons et cuire 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, en remuant toutes les quelques minutes. Retirer et réserver.","Remuez vivement le mélange d''œufs, puis ajoutez-le à la poêle chaude (en l''inclinant pour que le mélange recouvre toute la base) et laissez reposer environ 10 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à prendre. Avec une fourchette, remuez délicatement l''œuf ici et là pour que tout mélange non pris soit cuit.","Pendant que le mélange d''œufs est encore légèrement lâche, versez le mélange de champignons sur un côté de l''omelette et garnissez de fromage à la crème et de feuilles de basilic. Retournez l''autre côté de l''omelette pour couvrir, si vous le souhaitez. Laisser cuire encore 1 min, puis couper en deux et glisser chaque moitié dans une assiette. Servir aussitôt avec les tomates à part."]','2026-01-11 00:13:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11855,5303,'fr','Kedgeree avec œuf poché','Ce plat de poisson et de riz au curry convient au brunch, au petit-déjeuner ou comme plat principal au dîner. Remplacez les œufs durs traditionnels par des œufs pochés','["300 g de riz à grains longs","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","Paquet de 390 g de préparation pour tarte au poisson, décongelée si congelée","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de poudre de curry doux ou moyen","jus d''1 citron","¼ petit paquet de persil, haché","4 œufs"]','["Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-le et réservez. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir l''oignon et l''ail pendant 5 min. Mélangez les morceaux de poisson avec la poudre de curry et le reste de l''huile. Ajouter à la poêle. Cuire encore 5 minutes en remuant délicatement et en retournant le poisson.","Ajoutez le riz dans la poêle et augmentez le feu, puis remuez bien (le poisson va se briser un peu). Cuire 1 à 2 minutes, puis incorporer le citron et le persil. Baissez le feu au maximum et mettez un couvercle.","Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition, baissez le feu et pochez les œufs. Assaisonner le kedgeree et répartir dans les assiettes, en garnissant chacune d''un œuf poché."]','2026-01-11 00:13:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11856,5305,'fr','Couscous clémentine & miel','Les pistaches, les clémentines, le miel et la cannelle font du couscous un parfait plat de petit-déjeuner. Servir avec des fruits et du yaourt','["100 g de pistaches ou autres noix","300 g de couscous","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, et un peu plus pour servir","8 clémentines (les sans pépins sont les meilleures)","1 cuillère à café de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe de miel liquide, et un peu plus pour servir","1 cuillère à café d''eau de fleur d''oranger (facultatif)","300 g de framboises fraîches ou surgelées","500 g de yaourt allégé à la grecque en pot, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Étaler les noix sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faire griller pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement dorées. Pendant ce temps, mettez le couscous et la cannelle dans un grand bol. Râpez finement le zeste de 2 clémentines, puis pressez leur jus dans une casserole avec le zeste. Ajouter le beurre, le miel et 200 ml d''eau et porter à ébullition. Versez-le sur le couscous, couvrez d''un film alimentaire, puis laissez absorber 10 min.","À l’aide d’un couteau dentelé, épluchez puis tranchez finement les clémentines restantes. Arroser d''eau de fleur d''oranger, si vous en utilisez. Hachez grossièrement les noix.","Remuez le couscous avec une fourchette, puis incorporez la plupart des noix. Servir le couscous dans des bols, garni de clémentines et de framboises. Mangez avec une cuillerée de yaourt, une pincée supplémentaire de cannelle et un filet de miel."]','2026-01-11 00:13:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11857,5307,'fr','Pain aux figues, noix et graines, ricotta et fruits','Commencez bien la journée avec ce pain de petit-déjeuner aux fruits et aux noix, tartiné de fromage à la crème et garni d''orange ou de pomme. Ça se conserve aussi un mois','["400 ml de thé noir fort et chaud","100 g de figues séchées, tiges dures retirées, tranchées finement","140 g de raisins secs","50 g de flocons d''avoine","200 g de farine complète autolevante","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100g de mélange de fruits à coque (amandes, noix, Brésil, noisettes), plus 50g pour le topping","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de lin doré","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame, plus 2 cuillères à café pour saupoudrer","25g de graines de citrouille","1 gros œuf","25g de ricotta par personne","1 pomme orange ou verte, tranchée épaisse, par personne"]','["Chauffer le four à 170C/150C ventilateur/gaz 3½. Versez le thé dans un grand bol et incorporez les figues, les raisins secs et les flocons d''avoine. Laisser tremper.","Pendant ce temps, tapissez le fond et les côtés d''un moule à cake de 1 kg de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la farine, la levure chimique, les noix et les graines. Battez l''œuf dans le mélange de fruits refroidi, puis incorporez les ingrédients secs au mélange humide. Versez dans le moule, puis nivelez le dessus et parsemez avec les noix et les graines de sésame supplémentaires.","Cuire au four pendant 1 heure, puis couvrir le dessus de papier d''aluminium et cuire encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre du pain en ressorte propre. Retirer du moule pour laisser refroidir, mais laisser le papier sulfurisé jusqu''à ce qu''il soit froid. Couper en tranches, tartiner de ricotta et servir avec des fruits. Se conserve 1 mois au réfrigérateur ou congeler en tranches."]','2026-01-11 00:13:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11858,5309,'fr','Muffins du petit-déjeuner','Préparez des muffins plus sains avec de la purée de banane et de la compote de pommes pour une douceur naturelle, ainsi que des myrtilles et des graines pour une touche encore plus nutritive.','["2 gros œufs","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature allégé","50 ml d''huile de colza","100g de compote de pommes ou purée de pommes (à retrouver avec la nourriture pour bébé)","1 banane mûre, écrasée","4 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200g de farine complète","50 g de flocons d''avoine, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1½ cuillère à café de cannelle","100g de myrtilles","2 cuillères à soupe de graines mélangées (nous avons utilisé des graines de citrouille, de tournesol et de lin)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Ligne\r\nun moule à muffins 12 trous avec 12 gros muffins\r\ncas. Dans un bol, mélangez les œufs, le yaourt, l''huile,\r\ncompote de pommes, banane, miel et vanille.\r\nInclinez le reste des ingrédients, sauf le\r\ngraines, dans un grand bol, ajoutez une pincée de\r\nsaler et mélanger pour combiner.","Versez les ingrédients humides dans le sec\r\net mélangez brièvement jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse\r\npâte – ne pas trop mélanger car cela rendrait\r\nles muffins lourds. Divisez la pâte\r\nentre les cas. Saupoudrer les muffins\r\navec l''avoine supplémentaire et les graines. Cuire au four\r\npendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien levés,\r\net une brochette insérée au centre de\r\nun muffin en ressort propre. Supprimer de\r\nle four, transférer sur une grille et\r\nlaisser refroidir. Peut être conservé dans un\r\nconteneur jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:13:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11859,5311,'fr','Oeufs Dippy avec des soldats Marmites','Commencez la journée du bon pied avec ce petit-déjeuner rapide, facile et nutritif','["2 œufs","4 tranches de pain complet","une noix de beurre","Marmite","graines mélangées"]','["Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition. Ajouter\r\n2 œufs, laisser mijoter 2 minutes à température ambiante,\r\n3 minutes si le réfrigérateur est froid, puis éteignez le feu.\r\nCouvrir la poêle et laisser reposer encore 2 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites griller 4 tranches de céréales complètes\r\npain et tartiner finement de beurre, puis\r\nMarmite. Pour servir, couper en soldats et\r\ntremper dans l''œuf, puis quelques graines mélangées."]','2026-01-11 00:13:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11860,5313,'fr','Granola bon pour vous','Essayez ce petit-déjeuner granola énergisant pour commencer votre journée – c’est bon pour vous !','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","125 ml de sirop d''érable","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","300 g de flocons d''avoine","50g de graines de tournesol","4 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","50g de graines de citrouille","100 g d''amandes effilées","100g de baies séchées (à retrouver au rayon pâtisserie)","50 g de flocons de noix de coco ou de noix de coco desséchée"]','["Chauffer le four à 150C/chaleur tournante 130C/gaz 2. Mélanger l''huile, le sirop d''érable, le miel et la vanille dans un grand bol. Ajoutez tous les ingrédients restants, à l''exception des fruits secs et de la noix de coco, et mélangez bien.","Versez le granola sur deux plaques à pâtisserie et étalez-le uniformément. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, puis incorporer la noix de coco et les fruits secs et cuire encore 10 à 15 minutes. Retirer et gratter sur un plateau plat pour refroidir. Servir avec du lait froid ou du yaourt. Le granola peut être conservé dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à un mois."]','2026-01-11 00:13:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11861,4314,'fr','Bouillie plus','Commencez la journée avec le ventre chaud : ce porridge regorge d''avoine énergisante et de yaourt grec sans gras.','["assez de flocons d''avoine pour 1 personne","lait demi-écrémé","yaourt grec sans gras","banane, tranchée","noisettes, hachées grossièrement","Miel"]','["Préparez du porridge avec du lait demi-écrémé selon les instructions sur le paquet.","Garnir de yaourt grec sans gras, de tranches de banane et de noisettes grossièrement hachées et arroser de miel."]','2026-01-11 00:13:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11862,4316,'fr','Muffin aux œufs brouillés','Les œufs brouillés sains ne doivent pas nécessairement être fades, essayez cette recette végétarienne simple – idéale pour le lendemain de Noël','["2 œufs","quelques tomates séchées","basilic frais, déchiré","Muffins anglais"]','["Brouillez les œufs sans beurre ni crème, incorporez les tomates séchées hachées et le basilic frais déchiré, et déposez-les sur les moitiés de muffins anglais grillés."]','2026-01-11 00:13:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11863,5319,'fr','Crêpes aux bleuets et au citron','Demandez aux enfants de vous aider à préparer une série de gâteaux à l''américaine : la garniture aux baies piquantes en fait une option de brunch saine.','["200 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de crème de tartre","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de sirop doré","75g de myrtilles","le zeste d''1 citron","200 ml de lait","1 gros œuf","beurre, pour cuisiner"]','["Tout d''abord, mettez la farine, la crème\r\nde tartre et de bicarbonate de\r\nsoda dans le bol. Mélangez-les\r\nbien avec la fourchette. Lâchez l''or\r\nsirop dans les ingrédients secs\r\navec les myrtilles et\r\nle zeste de citron.","Versez le lait dans un\r\npichet doseur. Maintenant, fais une pause\r\ndans l''oeuf et bien mélanger\r\navec une fourchette. Versez la majeure partie du lait\r\nmélange dans le bol et mélanger\r\nbien avec une spatule en caoutchouc. Garder\r\najouter plus de lait jusqu''à obtenir un\r\npâte lisse, épaisse et coulante.","Faites chauffer la poêle et\r\nbadigeonner d''un peu de beurre.\r\nPuis versez la pâte,\r\n1 cuillère à soupe à la fois, en tas. Bulles\r\napparaîtra sur le dessus sous forme de crêpes\r\ncuisiner – retournez-les à ce stade,\r\nen utilisant la spatule en métal pour aider\r\nvous. Cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés sur le\r\ndeuxième face, puis garder au chaud\r\nune assiette recouverte de papier d''aluminium. Répéter\r\njusqu''à épuisement de tout le mélange."]','2026-01-11 00:13:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11864,5321,'fr','Compote de fruits secs','Une compote de fruits saine avec du yaourt sans gras au petit-déjeuner vous permettra de conserver votre énergie jusqu''à l''heure du déjeuner','["140 g de fruits secs (nous avons utilisé des abricots, des cerises et des raisins secs)","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","300 ml de jus de pomme","Pot de 200 g de yaourt grec sans matière grasse","100g de muesli"]','["Mettez les fruits secs dans une petite casserole\r\navec la cannelle et le jus de pomme, donnez\r\ntout remuer puis laisser mijoter 5 min\r\njusqu''à ce que le jus de pomme soit sirupeux. Supprimer\r\ndu feu et laisser refroidir.","Répartissez le yaourt dans 4 bols\r\npuis garnir de compote et de granola."]','2026-01-11 00:13:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11865,5323,'fr','Omelette maigre aux poivrons, tomates et jambon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Si vous avez besoin d''un apport en protéines, essayez de préparer cette omelette saine pour le petit-déjeuner, car utiliser moins de jaunes réduit le cholestérol.','["2 œufs entiers et 3 blancs d''œufs","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 poivron rouge épépiné et finement haché","2 oignons nouveaux, parties blanches et vertes séparées et finement hachées","quelques tranches de jambon extra-maigre très fines, râpées","25 g de cheddar affiné allégé","pain grillé complet, pour servir"]','["Mélanger les œufs et les blancs d''œufs\r\navec un peu d''assaisonnement et réserver.\r\nChauffer l''huile dans un feu moyen antiadhésif\r\npoêle et faites cuire le poivron pendant\r\n3-4 minutes. Jetez les parties blanches\r\ndes oignons nouveaux et cuire pendant\r\n1 minute de plus. Versez les œufs et\r\ncuire à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que\r\npresque complètement fixé.","Saupoudrer de jambon et de fromage\r\net poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste prise\r\nau centre, ou flashez-le sous un feu chaud\r\ngriller si vous l''aimez plus bien cuit.\r\nServir directement de la poêle avec\r\nla partie verte de l''oignon nouveau\r\nsaupoudré sur le dessus et un peu\r\npain grillé complet."]','2026-01-11 00:13:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11866,5325,'fr','Pots de melon et son croquant','Pas seulement pour le petit-déjeuner, ce pot sain de yaourt, de fruits et de graines est un véritable stimulant de la faim en milieu d''après-midi et est prêt en 10 minutes.','["½ paquet de 200 g de mélange de melon","150 g de yaourt sans matière grasse en pot","2 cuillères à soupe de céréales aux fruits et fibres","1 cuillère à soupe de graines mélangées","1 cuillère à café de miel clair"]','["Garnir un mélange de melon avec\r\nyaourt, puis saupoudrer\r\nsur un mélange de céréales\r\navec des graines. Arrosez de miel et mangez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11867,5327,'fr','Tomates grillées au pesto sur toasts','C’est coloré, plein de saveur et faible en gras – cela pourrait être la collation rapide parfaite','["2 tomates moyennes","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce pesto","une tranche de pain de campagne"]','["Coupez les tomates en deux. Diluez la sauce pesto avec un peu d''eau et badigeonnez-en la moitié sur les tomates. Cuire sous un grill chaud pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. En même temps, faites griller la tranche de pain, puis tartinez-la du reste du mélange de pesto. Garnir de tomates chaudes en les écrasant légèrement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11868,4328,'fr','Marmelade faible en sucre','Une version saine de la confiture classique du petit-déjeuner au goût de fruit intense','["900 g d''oranges de Séville","600 ml de jus de pomme pur non sucré","900g de sucre à confiture (disponible dans toutes les grandes surfaces)"]','["Coupez les oranges en fines tranches. Retirez les pépins et nouez-les dans un sac en mousseline. Mettez les tranches d''orange dans une sauteuse avec le jus de pomme et les pépins. Porter à ébullition puis laisser mijoter très doucement pendant 30 à 40 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le zeste d''orange puisse être facilement percé avec une fourchette. Le mélange sera très épais, avec peu de liquide.","Ajoutez le sucre de confiture et remuez à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement dissous, environ 5 minutes. Portez à bonne ébullition puis bouillonnez pendant 4 minutes. Retirez la casserole du feu et écumez toute écume de la surface. (Pour dissoudre tout excès d’écume, déposez une petite noix de beurre sur la surface et remuez doucement.)","Retirez le sac de mousseline et laissez reposer la marmelade dans la poêle pendant 15 minutes pour qu''elle refroidisse un peu et que la peau se dépose ; mettre en pot dans des bocaux stérilisés, sceller et étiqueter."]','2026-01-11 00:13:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11869,5331,'fr','Levez-vous et partez avec des muffins pour le petit-déjeuner','Avec des pommes, des myrtilles, des bananes et des graines, ce petit-déjeuner à emporter est délicieux, faible en calories et utilise du miel au lieu du sucre.','["2 gros œufs","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature allégé","50 ml d''huile de colza","100 g de compote de pommes ou purée de pommes","1 banane mûre, écrasée","4 cuillères à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200g de farine complète","50 g de flocons d''avoine, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1½ cuillère à café de cannelle","100g de myrtilles","2 cuillères à soupe de graines mélangées, nous avons utilisé des graines de citrouille, de tournesol et de lin"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Tapisser un moule à muffins à 12 trous avec 12 grands moules à muffins. Dans un pichet, mélangez les œufs, le yaourt, l''huile, la compote de pommes, la banane, le miel et la vanille. Versez le reste des ingrédients, à l''exception des graines, dans un grand bol, ajoutez une pincée de sel et mélangez.","Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs, mélangez brièvement jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse, ne mélangez pas trop car cela alourdir les muffins. Versez la pâte entre les caissettes. Saupoudrer les muffins avec le surplus de flocons d''avoine et les graines. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien levés, et qu''un cure-dent inséré au centre d''un muffin en ressorte propre. Retirer du four, transférer sur une grille et laisser refroidir. Conserver dans un récipient scellé jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:13:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11870,5333,'fr','Granola croquant aux baies et cerises','Faites de votre petit-déjeuner un festin fruité – cette recette regorge de bienfaits croquants','["175 g de noix mélangées (moitiés de noix de pécan et cacahuètes dans leur peau rouge)","450 g de flocons d''avoine","50g de graines de sésame","50g de graines de tournesol","125 ml d''huile de tournesol","100 ml de miel liquide (essayez l''un des miels de fleurs légèrement aromatisés)","un demi-sachet de 170 g de baies séchées et de cerises"]','["Préchauffer le four à 190C/Gaz 5/chaleur tournante\r\nfour 170C. Coupez quelques noix de pécan en deux, partez\r\nun peu entier. Mélanger avec des cacahuètes, de l''avoine, du sésame\r\ngraines, graines de tournesol et une pincée de sel dans\r\nun grand bol. Dans un pichet, mesurez l''huile et\r\nverser dans le mélange, puis mesurer le\r\nchérie, il glissera facilement. Mélanger\r\navec une fourchette pour briser les grosses touffes d''avoine.","Verser sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie avec\r\ncôtés, de préférence antiadhésifs, en couche mince.\r\nCuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes en remuant bien à\r\nau moins deux fois et en apportant le mélange\r\nà partir des bords, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré.\r\nTransférer dans un grand bol et laisser refroidir.","Incorporer les baies et les cerises\r\net servir avec beaucoup de lait frais.","Conserver jusqu''à 1 mois dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:13:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11871,5335,'fr','Pain aux bananes sain','Prenez votre gâteau et mangez-le avec ce pain aux bananes sain et faible en gras – parfait pour le petit-déjeuner et au-delà','["pâte à tartiner faible en gras, pour le moule, plus un supplément pour servir","140g de farine complète","100 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","300 g de purée de bananes noires trop mûres","4 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''agave","3 gros œufs battus à la fourchette","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature allégé","25 g de noix de pécan ou de noix hachées (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser un moule à pain de 2 lb de pâte à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin (laissez-le dépasser 2 cm au-dessus\r\ndessus de l''étain). Mélanger les farines, le bicarbe, la pâtisserie\r\npoudre et une pincée de sel dans un grand bol.","Mélangez les bananes, le sirop, les œufs et le yaourt.\r\nIncorporer rapidement aux ingrédients secs, puis doucement\r\ngratter dans le moule et parsemer de noix,\r\nsi vous l''utilisez. Enfourner pendant 1h10 à 1h15\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette en ressorte propre.","Laisser refroidir dans un moule sur une grille. Mangez tiède ou\r\nà température ambiante, avec une pâte à tartiner faible en gras."]','2026-01-11 00:13:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11872,5337,'fr','Muesli riche en fibres','Préparez votre propre muesli riche en fibres et en saveurs délicieuses en utilisant des flocons d''avoine géants pour une énergie à libération lente, des graines de lin et des abricots. Un petit-déjeuner facile et sain','["300 g de flocons d''avoine géants","100g d''allbran","25g de germe de blé","100 g de raisins noirs","140 g d''abricots prêts à consommer, coupés en morceaux","50g de graines de lin dorées"]','["Mélangez le tout dans un grand bol.","Versez beaucoup de lait frais\r\net laissez-le tremper pendant que vous préparez\r\nthé. Si tu veux le sucrer, râpe\r\nsur une pomme non pelée et\r\nsaupoudrer de sucre muscovado noir.","Conserver jusqu''à 2 mois, hermétiquement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11873,5339,'fr','Oeufs au four aux tomates','Préparez ces œufs au four faciles avec une sauce tomate à l''ail et servez-les avec du pain croustillant pour un brunch paresseux du week-end ou un déjeuner léger, qui saura vous satisfaire à coup sûr.','["900 g de tomates de vigne mûres","3 gousses d''ail","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 gros œufs fermiers","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché et/ou de ciboulette"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante 180C/\r\nconventionnel 200C/gaz 6. Couper le\r\ntomates en quartiers ou épaisses\r\ndes cales, selon leur taille,\r\npuis répartissez-les sur une assez grande\r\nplat peu profond allant au four de 1,5 litre.\r\nÉpluchez l''ail, coupez-le finement et\r\nsaupoudrer sur les tomates.\r\nArroser d''huile d''olive, assaisonner\r\nbien avec du sel et du poivre et remuer\r\ntout ensemble jusqu''à ce que\r\nles tomates brillent.","Glissez le plat dans le four et\r\ncuire au four pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles tomates ont ramolli et sont\r\nteinté de brun.","Faites quatre trous entre les tomates, cassez un œuf dans chaque trou et couvrez le plat d''une feuille de papier d''aluminium. Remettez-le au four pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient pris à votre goût. Répartir sur les herbes et servir bien chaud avec d''épaisses tranches de pain grillé ou une ciabatta chaude et une salade verte en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11874,5341,'fr','Poulet et riz en une seule casserole','Préparez un dîner de poulet sain pour toute la famille en moins d''une heure. De plus, vous n’avez besoin que d’une seule casserole, donc moins de vaisselle','["1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","600 g de cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en deux","700 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud, préparé avec 2 cuillères à café de poudre","250 g de riz brun facile à cuire","320 g de poireaux lavés et tranchés","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché ou 1 cuillère à soupe de thym frais","2 feuilles de laurier (facultatif)","320 g de légumes surgelés mélangés (nous avons utilisé des tranches de carottes, des fleurons de brocoli et du maïs doux)"]','["Mettez les épices, l''ail et l''huile dans un grand bol et mélangez bien. Ajouter le poulet et incorporer le mélange jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien enrobé. Faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive munie d''un couvercle, puis faites frire le poulet, à découvert (sans huile supplémentaire), à ​​feu moyen-vif pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, en retournant le poulet à mi-cuisson pour qu''il dore des deux côtés. Retirer de la poêle et réserver sur une assiette.","Versez le bouillon dans la casserole en remuant bien pour incorporer les morceaux d''ail qui auraient pu coller au fond de la casserole, puis incorporez le riz, les poireaux, l''origan ou le thym et le laurier, si vous en utilisez. Disposez le poulet dessus, puis couvrez la casserole et portez à ébullition. Baissez le feu et laissez mijoter 20 minutes.","Incorporez les légumes surgelés, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter environ 5 minutes pour bien réchauffer. Laisser reposer environ 5 à 10 minutes, puis mélanger légèrement et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11875,5343,'fr','Sauté de poulet sain','Préparez rapidement ce sauté nutritif et riche en légumes lorsque vous avez besoin de dîner – et si vous aimez une touche épicée, ajoutez un peu de piment à la riche vinaigrette aux arachides.','["65 g de riz basmati brun","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","15 g de gingembre pelé et coupé en fines allumettes","2 petits oignons rouges (160g), coupés en quartiers","160 g de brocoli cassé en fleurons, tige finement hachée","2 carottes (160 g), coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur, puis coupées en tranches diagonales","1 piment rouge finement haché (facultatif)","200 g de blanc de poulet coupé en fines lanières","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre de cacahuète croquant","1 cuillère à soupe de tamari sans blé","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz brun"]','["Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions du paquet, puis égouttez-le. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu vif et faites revenir le gingembre et les oignons rouges pendant 2 min. Ajouter la tige de brocoli, les carottes et le piment, si désiré, et cuire 1 min.","Ajoutez le poulet et le cumin, faites sauter brièvement, puis ajoutez les fleurons de brocoli et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Couvrir et laisser cuire à la vapeur pendant 3 à 4 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les fleurons de brocoli soient juste tendres et que le poulet soit bien cuit.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le beurre de cacahuète avec le tamari et le vinaigre. Incorporer la sauce aux légumes et au poulet, puis servir sur le riz cuit."]','2026-01-11 00:13:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11876,5351,'fr','Salade d''orzo au poulet et au pesto','Rehaussez la salade de pâtes standard en utilisant de l''orzo et du pesto. Le plat offre également une bonne façon de profiter au maximum des asperges pendant qu’elles sont également de saison au printemps.','["2 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau","1 citron, zesté et pressé","3 gousses d''ail, 2 écrasées, 1 laissée entière","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","25g d''amandes effilées","gros bouquet de persil plat","petit bouquet de basilic","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","25 g de parmesan râpé, plus du parmesan râpé supplémentaire pour servir","100 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un filet pour servir","250g d''orge","16 pointes d''asperges"]','["Disposez les poitrines de poulet sur une planche et recouvrez d''une feuille de papier sulfurisé. Utilisez un rouleau à pâtisserie ou un maillet à viande pour écraser le poulet sur une épaisseur uniforme d''environ 2 cm, en prenant soin de ne pas casser le poulet en morceaux.","Mélangez le zeste de citron, l''ail écrasé, l''huile d''olive et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un bol moyen, puis ajoutez le poulet et incorporez la marinade pour l''enrober. Transférez au réfrigérateur pendant que vous préparez le pesto.","Faites griller les amandes effilées dans une poêle sèche à feu moyen pendant 2-3 minutes en remuant souvent la poêle jusqu''à ce que les amandes soient dorées. Versez dans un petit robot culinaire ou un mixeur. Épluchez la gousse d''ail entière et passez-la dans le robot culinaire avec le persil, le basilic, la plupart des feuilles de menthe, le parmesan, l''huile d''olive extra vierge et le jus de citron. Assaisonner, puis mixer jusqu''à obtenir une texture fine.","Faites cuire l''orzo dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante salée en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit al dente. Faites chauffer une poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire le poulet mariné pendant 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit avec des lignes de charbon. Égoutter l''orzo et transférer le poulet dans une assiette pour qu''il repose.","Arrosez les pointes d''asperges d''un peu d''huile d''olive extra vierge et assaisonnez de sel, puis faites-les griller pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient à peine ramollies. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Mélangez la majeure partie du pesto dans l''orzo cuit avec le jus de poulet au repos. Le pesto restant se conservera couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à cinq jours. Tranchez les poitrines de poulet. Versez l''orzo sur un grand plat de service et empilez les asperges et le poulet dessus, puis parsemez-le du reste des feuilles de menthe, de quelques copeaux de parmesan et d''un peu de poivre noir. Arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive extra vierge et servir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:13:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11877,5357,'fr','Plateau de poulet cajun avec quartiers de patates douces et trempette à la ciboulette','Les patates douces ne sont jamais aussi croustillantes que les pommes de terre ordinaires, mais elles ajoutent à votre 5 par jour. Nous avons utilisé le kéfir dans cette recette pour sa riche contribution en bactéries intestinales bénéfiques.','["1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu et 1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym frais ou 1 cuillère à café séchée","8 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées (900g)","1 poivron rouge et 1 jaune, épépinés et hachés","3 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers de 1 cm d''épaisseur","2 branches de céleri (125 g), finement hachées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza, plus 1 cuillère à café","2 patates douces (poids 375 g pelées), coupées en 16 quartiers","150g de Kéfir ou yaourt bio","2 cuillères à soupe de ciboulette ciselée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger le cumin, le paprika, l''origan et le thym dans un bol, avec une bonne mouture de poivre noir. Réservez 1 cuillère à soupe pour les pommes de terre. Utilisez le reste pour frotter toutes les cuisses de poulet.","Versez les poivrons, les oignons et le céleri dans un grand plat à rôtir et mélangez-les avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Étalez les légumes pour qu''ils cuisent uniformément, puis nichez-les dans le poulet. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et rôtir pendant 40 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, enduisez les quartiers de pommes de terre de 1 cuillère à café d''huile et du reste des épices, et disposez-les bien espacés sur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive. Enfourner, sur une grille supérieure, lorsqu''il vous reste 35 minutes pour le poulet. Mélangez le kéfir et la ciboulette pour faire une trempette, en ajoutant jusqu''à 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour les détendre, si nécessaire. Annuler.","Sortez le plat à rôtir et les pommes de terre du four et montez le feu à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Retirez le poulet dans une assiette chaude et laissez reposer 5 minutes. Remettez les légumes au four, à découvert, pendant 5 à 10 minutes pour les colorer un peu. Servir la moitié des quartiers dans des assiettes avec la moitié de la trempette à la ciboulette et la moitié des légumes et du poulet. Couvrir et réfrigérer les portions restantes. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Pour réchauffer, réchauffez doucement les pommes de terre dans une poêle antiadhésive en prenant soin qu''elles ne brûlent pas. Chauffer le poulet jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud dans un micro-ondes ou une poêle à feu moyen. En cas de congélation, laisser décongeler complètement avant de réchauffer dans une poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:13:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11878,5363,'fr','Boulettes de poulet, citron et ricotta avec linguine','Débordantes de saveurs, faciles à préparer et nutritives – nos boulettes de poulet piquantes cochent toutes les cases pour un repas en famille','["2 poitrines de poulet","2 citrons, zestés","200 g de gazon","3 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","150 g de chapelure fraîche","100 ml de lait, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","1 œuf moyen, battu","25 g de farine nature, pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","300 g de linguines","320 g de haricots verts, parés et coupés en deux"]','["Coupez le poulet en très petits morceaux à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé. Vous pouvez utiliser un robot culinaire, mais pulsez pour qu''il ne se transforme pas en pâte. Mettre dans un bol et ajouter la moitié du zeste de citron, la moitié de la ricotta, la moitié du persil, la chapelure et mélanger le tout. Ajoutez les 2 cuillères à soupe de lait, l''œuf et une bonne pincée d''assaisonnement. Mélangez à nouveau.","Saupoudrer légèrement une assiette de farine. Mouillez-vous les mains, prenez un morceau du mélange de boulettes de viande de la taille d’une balle de golf et roulez-le en boule. Disposez sur l''assiette farinée et répétez jusqu''à ce que tout le mélange soit épuisé.","Faites chauffer une poêle à fond épais sur feu moyen, ajoutez l''huile, puis les boulettes de viande en veillant à ce qu''elles ne se touchent pas. Cuire 10 à 15 minutes en les retournant pour qu''ils dorent de tous les côtés. Transférer dans une assiette.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une grande casserole d’eau salée et ajoutez les linguines. Faites cuire en suivant les instructions du paquet, et 3 minutes avant la fin de la cuisson, ajoutez les haricots verts. Égoutter en conservant l''eau des pâtes. Rincez les linguines et les haricots sous l’eau froide pour arrêter la cuisson.","Ajoutez le reste de la ricotta dans la poêle en la brisant le plus possible. Versez les 100 ml de lait et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour pâtes réservée, puis laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe légèrement pendant quelques minutes. Ajouter les pâtes, les haricots, le reste du zeste de citron et le persil. Assaisonner au goût, incorporer les boulettes de viande et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11879,5367,'fr','Boulettes de poulet aigre-douces','Essayez de préparer ces boulettes de poulet aigre-douces à la maison avec cette recette facile. Ces bouchées de poulet satisfaisantes accompagnées d''une trempette piquante sont irrésistibles','["125 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 œufs","160 ml de lait demi-écrémé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide, plus un peu pour la friture","4 filets de poitrine de poulet, coupés en cubes de 3 cm","240 ml de jus d''orange","3 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","3 cuillères à soupe de maïzena mélangée à 6 cuillères à soupe d''eau"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la sauce. Mettez le jus d''orange, le sucre, le concentré de tomates, le ketchup et le vinaigre dans une grande casserole à feu moyen. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter 5 min. Versez lentement le mélange de maïzena, petit à petit, en remuant continuellement jusqu''à obtenir la consistance désirée. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Mélanger la farine, la levure chimique et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol. Battez les œufs, le lait et 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un autre bol. Versez les ingrédients humides dans les ingrédients secs et mélangez bien pour créer une pâte lisse. Ajoutez les morceaux de poulet et mélangez en vous assurant que chaque morceau est bien enrobé.","Remplissez une casserole profonde ou un wok au maximum au tiers d''huile et faites chauffer à 170 °C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain brunisse dans les 30 secondes. Abaissez délicatement les morceaux de poulet enrobés dans l''huile, un morceau à la fois, et faites-les frire par lots de cinq pendant environ 5 à 6 minutes par lot jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits. Si vous disposez d’un thermomètre à sonde alimentaire, la température interne doit atteindre 78°C. Si vous n''avez pas de thermomètre, coupez un morceau de poulet en deux pour que le jus soit clair.","Égouttez le poulet frit sur une grille posée sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier absorbant ou sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant. Servir avec la sauce aigre-douce pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:13:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11880,5369,'fr','Tarte de Noël aux légumes rôtis','Préparez un repas spécial pour le jour de Noël avec cette tarte. Il est rempli de poulet, de saucisses et de sauce aux canneberges et constitue un moyen facile de savourer des saveurs festives sans préparer un dîner copieux.','["200 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 feuilles de sauge, hachées finement","râpe de muscade","110 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","1 jaune d''oeuf","sauce, pour servir","1 poitrine de poulet sans peau","1 saucisse de porc","1 cuillère à soupe de chapelure fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux canneberges, plus un peu pour servir","1 grosse pomme de terre farineuse, comme Maris Piper ou King Edward, coupée en 4 à 6 morceaux","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de colza","80 g de choux de Bruxelles, parés, feuilles extérieures enlevées, coupés en deux","2 mini carottes","3 petits panais, pelés"]','["Pour réaliser la pâte, mettez dans un bol la farine, la sauge, une pincée de sel et la muscade râpée. Frottez le beurre avec vos doigts jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sableux. Battez le jaune d''œuf avec 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Ajoutez-en le plus à la pâte en réservant 1 c. Mélangez, puis rassemblez en pâte avec les mains. Aplatir en disque. Envelopper. Mettre au frais 30 min.","Pour la garniture, disposez le poulet sur une planche et, avec la paume de la main appuyée dessus, coupez le milieu dans le sens de la longueur à partir du côté sans aller jusqu''au bout. Ouvrez comme un livre et coupez-le en six bandes. Pressez la chair de saucisse de la peau.","Coupez un tiers de la pâte et réservez. Abaissez le reste de la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 10p. Tapisser un plat à tarte de 10 cm (environ 3 cm de profondeur), en laissant dépasser l''excédent. Répartir la chapelure dans le fond, puis garnir de la moitié du poulet. Saison. Verser la moitié de la sauce aux canneberges, la chair à saucisse, le reste de la sauce aux canneberges et le reste du poulet. Saison.","Étalez la pâte réservée pour qu''elle soit suffisamment grande pour recouvrir le plat. Badigeonner un peu de l''œuf réservé sur le pourtour de la tarte, puis recouvrir du couvercle à pâtisserie en appuyant sur le bord pour sceller. Coupez tout excédent. Badigeonnez avec le reste de l''œuf et découpez un petit trou de vapeur au centre. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à 24 heures ou au congélateur pendant deux mois.","Cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient mousseuses mais conservent leur forme. Égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger les pommes de terre dans la moitié de l''huile sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie. Saison. Enfourner avec la tarte pendant 30 min.","Poussez les pommes de terre à une extrémité du plateau, puis ajoutez le reste des légumes à l''autre extrémité. Mélanger avec le reste de l''huile et assaisonner. Cuire au four encore 20 minutes, en recouvrant la tarte de papier d''aluminium si elle noircit trop vite. Retirez la tarte du four et faites rôtir les légumes pendant 10 à 15 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et que les pommes de terre soient croustillantes. Servir avec la sauce et la sauce aux canneberges supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:13:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11881,5371,'fr','Poulet farci à l''ail et au riz nduja','Faites quelque chose de différent avec le poulet rôti en le servant avec une farce à base de riz aux saveurs d''ail et de nduja. C''est aussi excellent avec des légumes verts et de la sauce','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, coupé finement","5 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1½ cuillère à café de cumin","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment rouge","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","30-40g de nduja (ou 50g de chorizo), selon le piquant que vous aimez","130 g de riz blanc ou complet à grains longs, rincé","60g de beurre doux","1 citron, zesté","1 poulet entier (environ 1,5 kg)"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et commence à dorer, environ 10 minutes. Incorporez 3 gousses d''ail écrasées, 1 cuillère à café de cumin, les flocons de piment rouge, le paprika fumé, ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir et le nduja, en le brisant au fur et à mesure que vous le mélangez. Cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le nduja ait libéré ses huiles.","Incorporer le riz jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement enrobé d''huile, puis verser 250 ml d''eau. Faites cuire le riz, à découvert, en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque cuit mais en conservant un peu de mordant, puis retirez-le du feu. Annuler.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger le beurre avec le reste d''ail, le zeste de citron, le reste de cumin et une petite pincée de sel. Détachez la peau de la poitrine de poulet avec vos mains, avec précaution, afin de ne pas déchirer la peau. Travaillez à partir de la partie la plus large de l''oiseau et approchez-vous du cou mais pas jusqu''au bout, et essayez également de desserrer la peau au-dessus des pattes. Poussez doucement le beurre d''ail sous la peau aussi loin que possible. Remplissez la cavité avec le mélange de riz, puis attachez les cuisses ensemble pour éviter qu''elle ne déborde.","Frottez la peau avec le reste de l''huile et saupoudrez d''un peu de sel. Rôtir le poulet pendant 1 h à 1 h 15 jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit et que le jus soit clair. Retirer du four et laisser reposer 10 minutes avant de découper. Servir avec des légumes verts et une sauce à base de jus, si vous le souhaitez. Essayez l''une de nos recettes de sauce ici."]','2026-01-11 00:13:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11882,5373,'fr','Poulet jerk jamaïcain','Préparez votre propre assaisonnement jerk à utiliser comme marinade pour le poulet. Les piments et les épices Scotch Bonnet apportent de la chaleur et beaucoup de saveur','["2 cuisses de poulet","2 cuisses de poulet","2-3 cuillères à café de piment de la Jamaïque broyé/alimenté (piment)","1 cuillère à café de sel fin","4 oignons nouveaux, parés","1 oignon blanc moyen","1- 2 piments Scotch Bonnet","6-8 gousses d''ail","2-3 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de thym cueillies","240 ml de jus de citron vert ou de jus d''orange ou d''ananas","60 ml de vinaigre blanc ou de malt","½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","1-2 cuillères à soupe de sucre noir"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la marinade dans un ablender pour former une pâte épaisse. Elle ne doit pas être trop liquide, semblable à la consistance d''une sauce chili douce. Goûtez et rectifiez l’assaisonnement si nécessaire. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique au réfrigérateur jusqu’à trois semaines.","Fendez la peau du poulet avec un couteau bien aiguisé, puis mettez-la dans un récipient. Versez dessus la marinade jerk en vous assurant que le poulet est complètement recouvert. Vous n’aurez peut-être pas besoin de toute la marinade. Couvrez le poulet et placez-le au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 4 heures, mais idéalement 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Mettre le poulet dans un plat allant au four, couvrir de papier d''aluminium et cuire 30 à 45 minutes. Retirez le papier d''aluminium et arrosez le poulet avec le jus du plat, puis laissez cuire encore 10 minutes. La peau devrait commencer à devenir croustillante. Vérifiez que la viande est cuite en coupant la partie la plus profonde du poulet. Si le jus devient rouge, remettez au four pendant 10 minutes supplémentaires ou jusqu''à ce que le jus soit clair. Servir avec du riz et des pois ou l''un de vos plats d''accompagnement préférés."]','2026-01-11 00:13:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11883,5375,'fr','Tacos au poulet plus légers','Le même plat mexicain savoureux avec la moitié de la graisse des tacos standards. Empilez du poulet, de la salsa et du guacamole et préparez-vous un délicieux repas','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","450 g de poitrines de poulet sans peau, de préférence bio","4 tomates moyennes, de préférence sur vigne, coupées en deux","1 poivron rouge, coupé en quartiers","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en 8 quartiers","¼ cuillère à café d''huile de colza","2 cuillères à café de jus de citron vert","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","une bonne pincée de flocons de piment","2 avocats mûrs de taille moyenne, dénoyautés, pelés et hachés grossièrement","4 cuillères à café de jus de citron vert","2 oignons nouveaux, extrémités parées, finement hachés","3 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","une bonne pincée de flocons de piment","8 coquilles de tacos au maïs","8 cuillères à café de yaourt grec 0 %","2 laitues Little Gem, râpées","coriandre hachée","quartiers de citron vert, à presser dessus"]','["Mélangez l''huile avec le cumin et le paprika dans une grande assiette. Placez le poulet sur l''assiette et frottez-le avec l''huile épicée. Assaisonnez avec du poivre et une pincée de sel, puis couvrez et réservez pendant que vous préparez la salsa.","Faites chauffer le gril à feu vif pendant 10 minutes. Pendant ce temps, tapissez une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium et déposez-y les tomates (côté coupé vers le haut), ainsi que le poivron et l''oignon rouge. Badigeonnez l''oignon d''huile et assaisonnez les tomates et l''oignon avec du poivre. Griller pendant 12 à 15 minutes, en retournant les tomates et l''oignon à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien carbonisés. Retirez-le (en laissant le gril allumé) et laissez-le refroidir – mettez le poivron dans un bol et couvrez-le d’un film alimentaire pour qu’il soit plus facile à éplucher plus tard.","Pour le guacamole, mettez l''avocat dans un bol et écrasez-le brièvement avec une fourchette en laissant quelques gros morceaux pour la texture. Incorporer délicatement le jus de citron vert, les oignons nouveaux, la coriandre et les flocons de piment. Assaisonner avec du poivre et une pincée de sel.","Recouvrez la plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium et déposez le poulet dessus, le côté dodu vers le haut. Griller environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit – il n''est pas nécessaire de le retourner. Pendant ce temps, retirez et jetez autant de graines et de jus des tomates que possible (pour que la salsa ne soit pas trop humide), laissant la pulpe et la peau carbonisée. Lorsque le poivron est suffisamment froid pour être manipulé, décollez-le et jetez la peau. Hachez les tomates et l''oignon et coupez le poivron en dés. Mélanger dans un bol avec le jus de citron vert, le cumin, les flocons de piment, un peu de poivre et une pincée de sel.","Lorsque le poulet est cuit, retirez-le du gril, couvrez-le légèrement de papier d''aluminium et laissez reposer 5 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Couper le poulet en grosses tranches et verser sur le jus. Au moment de servir, déposez les coquilles à tacos sur une plaque à pâtisserie et réchauffez-les pendant 2-3 minutes. Servez le poulet, les coquilles à tacos, le yaourt, la laitue, la coriandre et les quartiers de citron vert dans des bols séparés, afin que chacun puisse préparer ses propres tacos."]','2026-01-11 00:13:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11884,5377,'fr','Ragoût de poulet épicé, épinards et patates douces','Un tout-en-pot sain avec des épices réchauffantes, faible en gras, faible en calories, 3 sur 5 par jour et également plein de fibres !','["3 patates douces, coupées en morceaux","190 g d''épinards","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","8 cuisses de poulet, sans peau et désossées","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","2 oignons, hachés","1 piment rouge, haché","1 cuillère à café de paprika","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","400 g de tomates en boîte","2 citrons confits, épépinés et hachés","graines de citrouille, grillées","2-3 citrons confits, épépinés et hachés","4 pains naan, réchauffés"]','["Mettez la patate douce dans une grande casserole profonde sur feu vif. Couvrir d''eau bouillante et laisser bouillir 10 min. Pendant ce temps, mettez tous les ingrédients de la pâte dans un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient hachés très finement. Réserver jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Mettez les épinards dans une grande passoire dans l''évier et versez dessus les patates douces et leur eau de cuisson pour égoutter les pommes de terre et flétrir les épinards par la même occasion. Laisser sécher à la vapeur.","Remettez la casserole sur le feu (pas besoin de la laver au préalable), puis ajoutez l''huile, puis la pâte d''épices. Faites frire la pâte pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à épaississement, puis ajoutez le poulet. Faites frire pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet commence à colorer. Versez dessus le bouillon, portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter 10 min en remuant de temps en temps.","Vérifiez que le poulet est cuit en coupant l’une des cuisses et en vous assurant qu’il est entièrement blanc et sans signe de rose. Assaisonnez de poivre noir, puis ajoutez la patate douce. Laisser mijoter encore 5 min. Pendant ce temps, hachez grossièrement les épinards et ajoutez-les au ragoût. À ce stade, vous pouvez laisser le ragoût refroidir et congeler jusqu''à 3 mois, si vous le souhaitez.","Répartir les graines de citrouille et les citrons confits et servir avec du pain naan chaud en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11885,5379,'fr','Poulet effiloché','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Refaites un favori de la cuisine de rue, le porc effiloché, avec des cuisses de poulet juteuses pour réduire les calories pour une garniture de tacos saine.','["8 cuisses de poulet avec os, peau retirée, jetée et débarrassée de tout gros morceau de gras","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de chipotle","250 ml en purée","75 g de sauce barbecue","1 oignon, haché","jus de 3 citrons verts, plus des quartiers supplémentaires pour servir (facultatif)","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","Boîte de 215 g de haricots frits","1 petit avocat mûr, coupé en dés","½ petit paquet de coriandre, feuilles seulement","3 laitues Baby Gem, râpées","8 à 12 tacos ou riz cuit pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Frotter les cuisses de poulet avec 1 cuillère à soupe de pâte chipotle et un peu d''assaisonnement. Mélangez le reste de la pâte chipotle avec la passata, la sauce barbecue, 100 ml d''eau et la moitié de l''oignon. Versez la sauce dans un plat à rôtir qui épousera parfaitement le poulet en une seule couche et ajoutez les cuisses de poulet. Couvrir hermétiquement de papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 1 heure, puis découvrir, augmenter le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et cuire encore 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez l''oignon restant avec le jus de citron vert et un peu de sel et réservez pendant la cuisson du poulet. Mélangez tous les haricots dans une casserole avec 100 ml d''eau, prêts à chauffer et à servir.","Lorsque le poulet est bien tendre, utilisez deux fourchettes pour effilocher la viande dans la sauce (jeter les os). Gardez couvert de papier d''aluminium pendant que vous chauffez les haricots pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très chauds et pas trop humides, et réchauffez les tacos en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Incorporer les feuilles d''avocat et de coriandre au mélange citron vert-oignon.","Servez le poulet effiloché et les haricots avec de la laitue râpée et des tacos, ou des quartiers de riz et de citron vert à presser, si vous le souhaitez. Garnir d’une cuillerée de salsa d’avocat."]','2026-01-11 00:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11886,5381,'fr','Risotto au poulet et à l''orge perlé','Du poulet tendre et de l''orge perlé sain avec une vinaigrette légère aux herbes en font un excellent dîner de semaine faible en calories et en gras.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol","2 cuisses de poulet, sans peau, avec os","2 carottes, hachées","2 branches de céleri, hachées","1 oignon, haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","140 g d''orge perlé","½ sachet de 60 g de feuilles de roquette fraîches","une petite poignée de menthe, feuilles seulement","une petite poignée de persil plat","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à café de câpres"]','["Faites chauffer une grande casserole à feu moyen-vif et ajoutez l''huile. Ajouter le poulet et faire frire pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien doré de tous les côtés. Versez les légumes et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez l''ail et l''orge perlé, puis versez dessus 500 ml d''eau. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 25 à 30 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Pendant ce temps, mettez tous les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans le petit bol d''un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient hachés très finement. Transférer dans un bol et réserver jusqu''au moment de servir.","Lorsque l’orge perlé est tendre, mais toujours un peu mordante et que la majeure partie du liquide a été absorbée, elle est prête à servir. Assaisonner selon votre goût et répartir le risotto dans deux assiettes, en ajoutant des cuillerées de vinaigrette, pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11887,5383,'fr','Salade péruvienne de poulet, avocat et quinoa','Marre de la salade de pâtes ? Cette alternative sans gluten regorge de protéines maigres provenant du poulet et de graisses saines et respectueuses du cœur provenant de l''avocat.','["50 g de quinoa cru","100 g de maïs doux surgelé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","75 g de tomates cerises coupées en quartiers","petit paquet de coriandre, feuilles grossièrement hachées","2 oignons nouveaux, parés et tranchés finement","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","½ piment rouge long, haché finement (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant)","1 avocat mûr mais ferme","200 g de poulet rôti, froid et cuit, sans peau, coupé en gros morceaux"]','["Remplissez à moitié une casserole moyenne d’eau et portez à ébullition. Rincez le quinoa dans une passoire fine, puis ajoutez-le à l''eau, remuez bien et laissez mijoter pendant 12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre.","Pendant que le quinoa cuit, mettez le maïs doux dans une poêle sèche à feu moyen-vif. Cuire 5 minutes, en retournant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient décongelés et légèrement grillés. Annuler.","Rincez le quinoa cuit dans une passoire sous l''eau froide, puis pressez bien avec une cuillère de service pour éliminer l''excès d''eau.","Versez le quinoa dans un bol et mélangez-le avec l''huile d''olive, le maïs doux, les tomates, la coriandre, les oignons nouveaux, le zeste de citron vert et le piment. Bien assaisonner avec du poivre noir.","Coupez l''avocat en deux et dénoyautez-le. Retirez la chair avec une grande cuillère en métal, coupez-la en tranches et mélangez-la avec le jus de citron vert. Ajouter les morceaux de poulet et l''avocat à la salade et mélanger délicatement avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11888,5385,'fr','Poulet rôti et racines','Ce plat de poulet rôti en un seul plateau, vibrant et riche en légumes, fournit quatre de vos cinq par jour','["1,6 kg de poulet entier","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","4-5 brins de thym, feuilles grossièrement hachées","500 g de courge butternut coupée en morceaux","300 g de carottes coupées en morceaux","300 g de panais épluchés et coupés en longs bâtonnets","1 oignon rouge moyen, coupé en fines tranches","1 bulbe d''ail, gousses séparées","100 g de pousses d''épinards"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettre le poulet dans un grand plat à rôtir. Retirez tout élastique de fixation et attachez à nouveau les cuisses de poulet avec de la ficelle, si vous le souhaitez. Frottez le poulet avec le jus de citron, puis ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et saupoudrez de thym et de beaucoup d''assaisonnement. Rôtir pendant 25 minutes.","Mélangez la courge, les carottes, les panais et l''oignon dans un bol avec le reste de l''huile, le zeste de citron et beaucoup de poivre noir moulu, et mélangez bien.","Sortez le poulet du four et disposez-le sur une assiette. Répartissez les légumes dans le moule en plaçant les gousses d''ail en dessous, puis placez le poulet dessus. Remettre au four encore 45 minutes, en retournant les légumes au bout de 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit et que les légumes soient tendres et légèrement dorés.","Sortez le poulet et placez-le sur une assiette chauffée. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et laisser reposer 10 minutes. Faites cuire les épinards dans une casserole avec un filet d''eau et assaisonnez de poivre noir. Répartissez les légumes autour du poulet et servez avec les épinards. Pressez l''ail pour retirer la peau et étalez-le sur le poulet, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11889,5387,'fr','Poulet sauté au brocoli et riz brun','Combinez du poulet maigre avec du brocoli, du gingembre et de l''ail super sains pour un dîner de semaine rapide et bon marché.','["200 g de fleurons de brocoli parés (environ 6), coupés en deux","1 poitrine de poulet (environ 180 g), coupée en dés","15 g de gingembre coupé en lambeaux","2 gousses d''ail, coupées en lambeaux","1 oignon rouge, tranché","1 poivron rouge rôti, en bocal, coupé en cubes","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja réduite en sel","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","Paquet de 250 g de riz brun cuit"]','["Mettez la bouilloire à ébullition et versez le brocoli dans une casserole moyenne prête à chauffer. Versez l''eau sur le brocoli puis faites bouillir pendant 4 min.","Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans un wok antiadhésif et faites revenir le gingembre, l''ail et l''oignon pendant 2 minutes, ajoutez la poudre de piment doux et remuez brièvement. Ajoutez le poulet et faites sauter encore 2 minutes. Égouttez le brocoli et réservez l''eau. Versez le brocoli dans le wok avec le soja, le miel, le poivron rouge et 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau de brocoli, puis faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage et servez-le avec le sauté."]','2026-01-11 00:13:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11890,5389,'fr','Poulet à la grenade et couscous aux amandes','Égayez les poitrines de poulet dans cette sauce fruitée et légèrement épicée avec des graines de grenade, des amandes grillées et de la pâte de tajine.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","200 g de couscous","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","1 gros oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché finement","600 g de mini-filets de poulet","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte d''épices à tajine (disponible chez Tesco ou Marks & Spencer) ou 2 cuillères à soupe d''harissa","Bouteille de 190 ml de jus de grenade (non sucré ; nous avons utilisé Pom Wonderful)","100 g de graines de grenade","Paquet de 100 g d''amandes effilées grillées","petit paquet de menthe hachée"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire et faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Mettez le couscous dans un bol avec un peu d''assaisonnement et émiettez-le dans la moitié du cube de bouillon. Ajoutez l''oignon dans la poêle et faites-le revenir quelques minutes pour le ramollir. Versez de l''eau bouillante sur le couscous jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste couvert, puis couvrez le bol avec un torchon et réservez.","Poussez l''oignon d''un côté de la poêle, ajoutez les filets de poulet et faites dorer de tous les côtés. Incorporez la pâte de tajine ou l''harissa et le jus de grenade, puis émiettez-la avec le reste du cube de bouillon et assaisonnez bien. Laisser mijoter à découvert pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe et que le poulet soit bien cuit. Incorporer les graines de grenade, en gardant quelques-unes pour les disperser avant de servir.","Au bout de 5 minutes, gonflez le couscous avec une fourchette et incorporez les amandes et la menthe. Servir le poulet sur le couscous avec la sauce arrosée."]','2026-01-11 00:13:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11891,5391,'fr','Brochettes de fajita au poulet grillé','Invitez les enfants à préparer cette recette facile de poulet barbecue, puis assemblez-le avec du guacamole crémeux sur des tortillas.','["2 citrons verts, plus des quartiers pour servir","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées ou finement râpées","4 poitrines de poulet","3 poivrons de couleurs mélangées","1 oignon rouge","2 avocats mûrs","1 citron vert","6 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","tortillas réchauffées, coriandre hachée, crème sure ou yaourt, plus sauce chili pour les adultes, pour servir"]','["Préparez la marinade. Dans un grand bol, pressez les deux citrons verts. Ajouter l''origan, les épices, l''huile d''olive et l''ail et mélanger. Coupez le poulet en dés, puis demandez à votre enfant de le mélanger à la marinade et réservez.","Préparez les légumes. Épépiner les poivrons et couper l''oignon en deux est délicat, alors faites-le vous-même. Les enfants âgés d’environ sept ans ou plus peuvent les couper en morceaux à l’aide d’un couteau adapté aux enfants.","Faites vos brochettes. Enfilez délicatement en alternant les morceaux de poulet, de poivrons et d''oignons sur vos brochettes. Les enfants plus petits peuvent trouver cela un peu difficile, le meilleur moyen est donc de piquer les ingrédients et de les pousser sur les brochettes. Lorsque vous avez utilisé tous les ingrédients, réservez. Peut être préparé plusieurs heures à l’avance et réfrigéré jusqu’au moment de la cuisson.","Préparez le guacamole. Dénoyautez et épluchez les avocats, puis versez-les dans un bol avec les autres ingrédients. Demandez à votre enfant d''utiliser un presse-purée pour écraser le tout et verser dans un plat de service.","Faites cuire les brochettes. Faites chauffer un barbecue ou une poêle à frire. Cuire les brochettes 10 à 12 minutes en les retournant jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites. Un enfant à partir de huit ans peut veiller sur une plancha et retourner les brochettes avec une pince. Servir les brochettes sur des tortillas chauffées avec le guacamole, la crème sure, la coriandre hachée, les quartiers de citron vert en accompagnement et la sauce chili pour ceux qui aiment une touche épicée."]','2026-01-11 00:13:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11892,5393,'fr','Salade de poulet jerk à la papaye','Donnez à la salade de poulet une touche caribéenne avec des épices jerk, de l''avocat crémeux et de la papaye exotique.','["3-4 (selon la taille) de chicorée rouge","4 cuisses de poulet désossées, sans peau, sans gras visible","3 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 citron vert, jus de ½, le reste coupé en 2 quartiers","1 cuillère à café de mélange d''épices jerk","2 cuillères à café d''origan frais","2 cuillères à café de gelée de groseille","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 papaye, coupée en deux, épépinée, pelée et hachée","1 avocat dénoyauté, pelé et haché","pommes de terre nouvelles, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["La chicorée est constituée de feuilles attachées à une base assez solide, alors sentez où commencent les feuilles et coupez-les. Trancher épaissement la base et réserver.","Ouvrez les cuisses de poulet et mettez-les dans un bol avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile, le jus de citron vert, l''assaisonnement jerk et l''origan. Remuez bien, puis faites griller le poulet pendant 10 minutes en le retournant une fois. Retirez la plancha, couvrez d''une assiette et laissez reposer pendant que vous grillez rapidement les tranches de chicorée.","Pendant ce temps, mettez la gelée de groseille, le vinaigre et le reste de l''huile dans un grand bol et mélangez bien. Ajoutez la papaye et l’avocat, puis les feuilles de chicorée, mais ne mélangez pas encore. Hachez le poulet, ajoutez-le à la salade avec la chicorée grillée, puis mélangez bien. Empilez dans des assiettes, arrosez du reste de citron vert et servez encore chaud, avec des pommes de terre nouvelles, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11893,5395,'fr','Salade du jardin au poulet et vinaigrette aux fleurs de sureau','Une salade verte britannique avec beaucoup de mordant composé de radis croquants, de pois mange-tout, d''asperges et de laitue Little Gem','["botte d''asperges (environ 8 pointes), les extrémités ligneuses enlevées et jetées (ou conservées pour faire une soupe), coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","200 g de pois mange-tout","140 g de petits pois frais ou surgelés","1 petit poulet cuit, peau et os jetés, viande râpée","250 g de radis (utilisez des couleurs et des formes variées si vous le pouvez), tranchés","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et émincé","1 grosse laitue ronde frisée ou 2 Little Gems déchirées","une poignée de pousses de pois (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","le zeste et le jus d''1 gros citron","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza extra vierge"]','["Portez à ébullition une casserole moyenne d''eau et remplissez un grand bol d''eau glacée. Déposez les asperges dans la poêle. Au bout d''1 min, ajoutez les sucreries. Après 30 secondes supplémentaires, ajoutez les petits pois. Faites cuire encore 30 secondes, puis égouttez et versez les légumes dans l''eau glacée – cela les refroidira rapidement et aidera à conserver leur mordant et leur couleur éclatante. Après 1 à 2 minutes, égouttez et réservez dans la passoire pendant que vous préparez les autres ingrédients.","Séchez votre bol, versez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette avec beaucoup d''assaisonnement et fouettez ensemble. Ajoutez le poulet, les radis, l''oignon, les légumes refroidis et égouttés et la laitue, et mélangez délicatement le tout jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien enrobés de vinaigrette – le moyen le plus simple est d''utiliser vos mains. Empilez la salade sur une grande assiette et répartissez-la sur les pousses de pois, le cas échéant. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:13:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11894,5397,'fr','Poulet épicé parfumé au sambal à la banane','Ce plat épicé d''inspiration asiatique est parfumé à la coriandre, au cumin, au curcuma, aux amandes et à la cardamome. Servir avec une salade hachée rafraîchissante','["2 gros oignons, coupés en quartiers","4 gousses d''ail","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché grossièrement","600 ml de bouillon de poulet réduit en sel","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","4 gousses de cardamome verte","1 gros piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","500 g de poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en cubes","petit paquet de coriandre hachée","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","¼ de concombre pelé, épépiné et coupé en dés","1 petite banane, coupée en dés","le zeste et le jus de ½ citron vert","Paquet de 250 g de riz basmati brun prêt à l''emploi"]','["Mettez les oignons dans un robot culinaire avec l''ail et le gingembre. Mixez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit aussi lisse que possible, puis versez la moitié du bouillon et mixez à nouveau.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive, saupoudrez d''épices et faites griller 1 min. Versez le mélange d''oignons, le reste du bouillon et tout sauf ½ cuillère à café de piment haché. Ajoutez les amandes et le concentré de tomates et mélangez bien. Laisser mijoter 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement tendre, en remuant de temps en temps et en ajoutant un peu d''eau si le mélange commence à accrocher au fond de la casserole.","Ajoutez le poulet et la moitié de la coriandre fraîche. Faites chauffer très doucement pendant 10 minutes pour bien cuire le poulet. Mélangez tous les ingrédients du sambal avec le reste de la coriandre et du piment et faites chauffer le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Servir le poulet et le sambal avec le riz brun."]','2026-01-11 00:13:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11895,5399,'fr','Burger au poulet jerk','Aromatisez le poulet maigre avec un assaisonnement épicé d''inspiration jamaïcaine, faites-le ensuite griller et servez-le dans un petit pain avec de la mangue, de la tomate, de la laitue et de la sauce.','["2 poitrines de poulet sans peau","quelques brins de thym, feuilles cueillies","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café d''assaisonnement jerk","jus 1 citron vert","2 gros petits pains","½ petite mangue, dénoyautée, pelée et tranchée","1 tomate, tranchée","1 cœur de laitue Little Gem, râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise et de ketchup, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez les poitrines de poulet entre les deux\r\nmorceaux de film alimentaire et écrasez-les avec\r\nun rouleau à pâtisserie pour aplatir. Mélangez ensemble le\r\nthym, huile, assaisonnement jerk et la moitié du\r\njus de citron vert dans un bol. Ajoutez le poulet et\r\nlaisser mariner 5 min.","Chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude et cuire\r\nle poulet pendant 4-5 minutes de chaque côté\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Supprimer de\r\nla chaleur. Pendant ce temps, faites griller les côtés coupés\r\ndes petits pains pendant 1 à 2 minutes.","Mettez le poulet sur les petits pains et dessus\r\navec la mangue, la tomate et une poignée de\r\nlaitue. Presser le reste du citron vert\r\net garnir de mayonnaise et de ketchup, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:13:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11896,5401,'fr','Soupe au poulet, maïs doux et nouilles','Ce bol super sain peut être préparé à l''avance et congelé, prêt à être décongelé et utilisé lorsque vous en avez le plus besoin.','["2 grosses carottes, hachées","2 gros poireaux, parés et finement tranchés","2 épis de maïs, grains de maïs coupés","200 g de vermicelles","petit bouquet de persil, finement haché","2 oignons, coupés en quartiers","1 poireau, coupé en morceaux","2 carottes, tranchées épaisses","2 feuilles de laurier","6 grains de poivre noir","tiges de persil","4 branches de céleri, hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de bouillon de légumes ou 1 cube de bouillon de légumes","1,3 kg de poulet"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients du bouillon et le poulet dans une très grande casserole, puis recouvrez le tout d''environ 3 litres d''eau froide. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 1 h à 1 h 30, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Écumez la mousse toutes les 20 minutes environ. Retirer le poulet dans une assiette pour qu''il refroidisse. Passer le bouillon au tamis en écumant le plus de gras possible.","Rincez la casserole, remettez-y le bouillon, puis laissez mijoter à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''il réduise un peu – il vous faudra environ 2 litres au total. Ajoutez les carottes et les poireaux, puis laissez mijoter 10 min.","Pendant ce temps, effilochez la viande du poulet en jetant la peau et les os. Ajouter à la poêle avec le maïs doux. Ajoutez les vermicelles, sauf si vous souhaitez congeler la soupe, et laissez mijoter encore environ 7 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le maïs et les pâtes soient cuits. Verser dans des bols, parsemer de persil. Pour congeler, laissez la soupe refroidir complètement avant de la congeler (voir astuce), et lorsque vous êtes prêt à manger, laissez la soupe décongeler avant de la faire mijoter doucement dans une casserole. Ajouter les nouilles et laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient cuites."]','2026-01-11 00:13:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11897,5403,'fr','Salade de poulet croustillant et pommes','Le poulet pané n''a pas besoin d''être gras : cette version cuite au four avec accompagnements de légumes convient aux régimes alimentaires.','["½ chou blanc, râpé","½ petit oignon, finement tranché","4 branches de céleri, tranchées","2 pommes Granny Smith, coupées en quartiers, évidées et tranchées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","200 g de yaourt grec sans matière grasse en pot","2 poitrines de poulet cuites, tranchées finement","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 œuf battu","100 g de chapelure séchée à l''ail et aux herbes","4 épis de maïs surgelés","sauce barbecue, pour servir"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients de la salade de chou avec\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement, puis réserver. Ceci\r\npeut être fait jusqu''à un jour à l''avance et\r\nréfrigéré. Apportez une grande casserole d''eau au\r\nfaire bouillir, puis cuire les épis de maïs pendant 8 à 10 minutes.\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et bien cuits.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Versez la farine,\r\nl''œuf et la chapelure sur\r\nassiettes séparées. Trempez le poulet dans\r\nla farine, puis l''œuf, puis enrober de\r\nchapelure. Disposez le poulet sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie et griller 2 minutes sur chaque\r\ncôté ou jusqu’à ce qu’ils soient croustillants et bien cuits.\r\nServir le poulet croustillant avec la salade de chou\r\net des épis de maïs, et un bol de barbecue\r\nsauce à tremper à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:13:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11898,5405,'fr','Poulet tandoori','Ce poulet au curry faible en gras regorge de saveurs. C''est rapide à cuisiner et la marinade fait tout le travail – qui a besoin de plats à emporter ?','["jus de 2 citrons","4 cuillères à café de paprika","2 oignons rouges, finement hachés","16 cuisses de poulet sans peau","huile végétale, pour badigeonner","300 ml de yaourt grec","gros morceau de gingembre, râpé","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","¾ cuillère à café de garam masala","¾ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma"]','["Mélangez le jus de citron avec le paprika\r\net oignons rouges dans un grand plat peu profond.\r\nCoupez chaque cuisse de poulet trois fois,\r\npuis retournez-les dans le jus et réservez\r\nréserver pendant 10 minutes.","Mélanger tous les ingrédients de la marinade\r\nensemble et verser sur le poulet.\r\nMélangez bien le tout, puis couvrez\r\net réfrigérez pendant au moins 1 heure. Cela peut être\r\nfait jusqu''à un jour à l''avance.","Faites chauffer le gril. Soulevez les morceaux de poulet\r\nsur une grille au-dessus d''une plaque à pâtisserie. Brosse\r\navec un peu d''huile et faire griller 8 minutes à feu vif\r\nde chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement carbonisés et\r\ncomplètement cuit."]','2026-01-11 00:13:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11899,5407,'fr','Le relooking ultime : la tarte au poulet','Angela Nilsen réinvente une recette classique pour faire de la tourte au poulet un choix santé pour vous','["450 ml de bouillon de poulet, en cube (j''utilise du Kallo, bio)","100 ml de vin blanc","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","3 brins de thym","1 brin d''estragon et 1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles d''estragon hachées","225 g de carottes coupées en bâtonnets","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau, 500 g/1 lb 2 oz de poids total","225 g de poireaux tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe de maïzena mélangée à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau","3 tbsp crème fraîche","1 grosse cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de persil plat ou frisé haché","70 g de pâte filo (j''ai utilisé trois feuilles de 39 x 30 cm)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza"]','["Versez le bouillon et le vin dans un grand\r\nune large poêle à frire. Ajouter l''ail, le thym,\r\nbrin d''estragon et carottes, porter au\r\nfaire bouillir puis baisser le feu et laisser mijoter pendant\r\n3 minutes. Disposez le poulet dans le bouillon, hachez-le\r\navec un peu de poivre, couvrir et laisser mijoter pendant\r\n5 minutes. Répartir les tranches de poireaux sur\r\npoulet, couvrir à nouveau puis laisser mijoter doucement\r\nencore 10 minutes pour que les poireaux cuisent à la vapeur\r\npendant que le poulet cuit. Supprimer de\r\nle feu et laissez le poulet reposer dans le\r\nfaire bouillir environ 15 minutes pour que ça se conserve\r\nhumide en refroidissant légèrement.","Filtrez le bouillon dans un pichet – vous devriez\r\navoir 500 ml (sinon, compléter avec de l''eau).\r\nVersez le poulet et les légumes dans un récipient de 1,5 litre.\r\nplat à tarte et jeter les brins d''herbes. Verser\r\nremettre le bouillon dans la sauteuse, puis\r\nverser lentement le mélange de maïzena. Retour\r\nla poêle à feu et porter à\r\nfaire bouillir en remuant constamment jusqu''à épaississement.\r\nRetirer du feu et incorporer le\r\ncrème fraîche, moutarde hachée\r\nestragon et persil. Assaisonner de poivre.\r\nChauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Déchirez ou coupez le poulet en gros morceaux\r\ndes lambeaux. Verser la sauce sur le poulet\r\nmélange, puis mélangez le tout.","Coupez chaque feuille de filo en 4 carrés\r\nou des rectangles. Superposez-les par-dessus\r\nla garniture, en badigeonnant chaque feuille avec\r\nun peu d''huile au fur et à mesure. Légèrement\r\nfroisse le filo pour qu''il ne mente pas\r\ncomplètement à plat et rentrez les bords dans\r\nles côtés du plat, ou posez-les sur le\r\nbords si le plat a un rebord. Broyer sur un\r\npeu de poivre, déposer le plat sur une plaque allant au four\r\nplaque, puis cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla pâte est dorée et la sauce est\r\nbouillonnant. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:14:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11900,5409,'fr','Poulet à la Kiev à l''envers','Une recette rapide et facile, faible en gras, avec seulement 3 ingrédients','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées","25 g de beurre à l''ail ramolli","25 g de chapelure croustillante"]','["Disposez le poulet sur une plaque allant au four, frottez-le avec un peu de beurre, assaisonnez et faites cuire sous le grill pendant 15 min en le retournant une fois jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit.","Mélanger le reste du beurre à l''ail et la chapelure. Retirez le poulet du gril et recouvrez chaque poitrine d''une couche de beurre pané. Remettre sur le gril et cuire 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la chapelure soit dorée et le beurre fondu. Servir les jus de beurre, avec des pommes de terre nouvelles et des pois ou des fèves."]','2026-01-11 00:14:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11901,5411,'fr','Poulet chipotle','Gardez un pot de pâte de piment chipotle fumé dans votre placard pour ajouter du piquant à un ragoût de poulet sain.','["1 oignon, haché","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 à 2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de chipotle (voir conseil ci-dessous)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","8 filets de cuisse de poulet sans peau","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","crème sure et riz, pour servir"]','["Faire revenir l''oignon et l''ail dans l''huile dans une\r\npoêle large et profonde jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Ajoutez le\r\npâte de chipotle (utiliser 1 cuillère à soupe pour un\r\nsaveur et 2 cuillères à soupe pour un goût plus piquant et plus fort\r\nun). Remuer et cuire 1 min, puis ajouter\r\nles tomates et le vinaigre de cidre. Apporter à\r\nlaisser mijoter et cuire 10 min avec le\r\ncouvercle à moitié fermé. Remuer pour être sûr que ça ne devienne pas\r\ntrop sec.","Ajouter le poulet et cuire pendant\r\n10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits, en retournant\r\nune fois. Parsemer de coriandre et servir\r\navec du riz et de la crème sure."]','2026-01-11 00:14:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11902,5413,'fr','Jambalaya au poulet et au chorizo','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une recette de pot de riz d''inspiration cajun avec des saucisses espagnoles épicées, des poivrons doux et des tomates.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 poitrines de poulet, hachées","1 oignon, coupé en dés","1 poivron rouge, tranché finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","75 g de chorizo ​​tranché","1 cuillère à soupe d''assaisonnement cajun","250 g de riz à grains longs","400 g de tomates italiennes en boîte","350 ml de bouillon de poulet"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle avec\r\nun couvercle et faire dorer le poulet pendant 5 à 8 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Retirer et réserver.\r\nIncorporer l''oignon et cuire 3 à 4 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajoutez ensuite le poivre, l''ail,\r\nchorizo et assaisonnement cajun, et cuisiner\r\npendant 5 minutes de plus.","Remuez le poulet avec le riz, ajoutez\r\nles tomates et le bouillon. Couvrir et laisser mijoter\r\npendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre."]','2026-01-11 00:14:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11903,5415,'fr','Ragoût de poulet et de haricots épicé','Ce one-pot copieux et satisfaisant est faible en gras et facile à faire la vaisselle.','["1¼kg de cuisses et pilons de poulet (poids approximatif, nous avons utilisé un emballage mixte de 1,23 kg)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, tranchés","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 piments rouges épépinés et hachés","250 g de poivrons surgelés, décongelés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","Boîte de 420 g de haricots rouges à la sauce chili","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés","400 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","150 ml de crème sure et de pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Retirez la peau du poulet\r\net jeter. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand\r\ncocotte, faire dorer le poulet\r\npartout, puis retirez-le avec une fente\r\ncuillère. Ajoutez les oignons, l''ail et\r\npiments, puis faire frire pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ncommence à ramollir et à devenir doré.","Ajoutez les poivrons, les tomates,\r\nharicots et bouillon chaud. Mettez le\r\nremettre le poulet dessus, à moitié couvert\r\navec un couvercle de casserole et laissez cuire 50 minutes,\r\njusqu''à ce que le poulet soit cuit\r\nà travers et tendre.","Incorporer la coriandre et\r\nservir avec de la crème sure et\r\npain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:14:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11904,5417,'fr','Soupe mexicaine au poulet et au riz sauvage','Un plat avec un facteur de bien-être supplémentaire – cette soupe remplie de vitamine C est le remontant idéal après le travail','["1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","1 poivron vert, coupé en dés","200 g de maïs doux, surgelé ou en conserve","1-2 cuillères à soupe de pâte chipotle (nous avons utilisé Discovery)","250 g de mélange de riz à grains longs et sauvage prêt à l''emploi (nous avons utilisé Uncle Ben''s)","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs dans l''eau, rincés et égouttés","1,3 l de bouillon de poulet faible en sodium","2 poitrines de poulet cuites sans peau, râpées","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","crème sure faible en gras et guacamole réduit en gras, pour servir, si vous le souhaitez"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir l''oignon 5 min. Ajoutez le poivre et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes, puis ajoutez le maïs doux, la pâte chipotle et le riz. Bien mélanger et cuire 1 à 2 minutes.","Ajoutez les haricots noirs et le bouillon. Portez à ébullition, baissez le feu et laissez mijoter, puis ajoutez la moitié du poulet et la coriandre. Laisser refroidir 2 à 3 minutes, puis verser dans des bols.","Répartir sur le reste du poulet et de la coriandre. Servir avec une cuillerée de guacamole et une cuillerée de crème sure si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11905,5419,'fr','Poulet harissa avec salade de pois chiches','Un souper faible en gras et riche en fibres avec un côté super sain – parfait pour le milieu de semaine','["250 g de tomates cerises barquette, coupées en deux","½ petit oignon rouge, haché","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","petit bouquet de persil, haché grossièrement","jus d''1 citron","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa","yaourt nature sans gras et pain pitta complet, pour servir"]','["Mélangez les tomates, l''oignon et les pois chiches, ajoutez le persil et le jus de citron et assaisonnez.","Enrober le poulet de harissa. Faites chauffer une plaque chauffante, une poêle ou un barbecue. Cuire le poulet pendant 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement carbonisé et bien cuit.","Répartissez la salade dans 2 assiettes, garnissez de poulet harissa et servez avec une cuillerée de yaourt et du pain pitta chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:14:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11906,5421,'fr','Piment de dinde','Réalisez vos cinq objectifs par jour avec ce chili à la dinde. Plein d''ingrédients sains et d''épices respectueuses de l''intestin, vous ne pouvez pas vous tromper avec un bol pour le dîner','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","500 g de cuisse de dinde hachée (7% de matière grasse)","2 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 piment épépiné et haché","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","500 g de purée en carton","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés (liquide réservé)","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en dés","4 petites patates douces (environ 140 g chacune)","2 avocats","1 citron vert, jus"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen, puis versez-y le hachis et brisez-le à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois. Incorporer l''ail et le piment et cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le hachis soit bien cuit. Ajoutez les herbes et les épices et laissez cuire encore une minute.","Versez la passata, le liquide réservé des haricots, la poudre de bouillon et les poivrons. Couvrir et cuire 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe légèrement. Ajoutez les haricots et laissez cuire encore 3 à 5 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, piquez deux patates douces partout à l’aide d’une fourchette, puis passez au micro-ondes à puissance maximale pendant 7 à 10 minutes jusqu’à ce qu’elles soient tendres. Écrasez un des avocats avec la moitié du jus de citron vert dans un petit bol.","Pour servir, coupez les pommes de terre en deux et versez-y la moitié du piment, puis terminez par la purée d''avocat. Réfrigérez le reste pendant un autre jour. Le piment se conservera couvert et réfrigéré pendant quatre jours ou congelé pendant trois mois. Réchauffer au micro-ondes ou dans une poêle à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Servir avec le reste des patates douces et de la purée d''avocat et du jus de citron vert, comme décrit ci-dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:14:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11907,5423,'fr','Brochettes de porc et d''ananas assaisonnés à la jerk, avec haricots noirs et riz','Déposez ces brochettes saines sur une plaque chauffante ou sur le barbecue : elles regorgent d''épices créoles et constituent un régal maigre.','["400 g de filet de porc coupé en morceaux de 4 cm","2 cuillères à soupe d''assaisonnement jerk ou créole","1 cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce chili piquante, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","3 citrons verts, 1 zeste et jus, 2 autres coupés en quartiers pour servir","½ petit ananas pelé, épépiné et coupé en morceaux de 4 cm","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","200 g de riz basmati","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés"]','["Mélangez le porc, l''assaisonnement jerk, le piment de la Jamaïque, la sauce chili, le cas échéant, le zeste et le jus de citron vert et un peu d''assaisonnement. Enfiler le porc et l''ananas sur des brochettes en métal (ou des brochettes en bois préalablement trempées) et badigeonner d''huile.","Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Bien égoutter, puis remettre dans la casserole avec les haricots, remuer et réserver au chaud.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer la poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude. Cuire les brochettes 3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien carbonisées et que le porc soit bien cuit. Servir les brochettes avec les haricots et le riz, une sauce chili supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez, et des quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:14:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11908,5425,'fr','Biryani parfumé à la morue et à la coriandre','Essayez ce délicieux biryani servi avec des filets de morue. Le poisson blanc est une excellente protéine maigre, ce qui en fait un plat sain, faible en calories et en matières grasses.','["2 gros oignons (320 g), coupés en deux et tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","25 g de gingembre pelé et coupé en fines allumettes","1-2 piments rouges épépinés et tranchés","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","250 g de riz basmati brun","1½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue ou un demi-bâton de cannelle","3 gousses de cardamome, graines enlevées et moulues","320 g de pousses d''épinards","Pot de 120 g de yaourt nature bio","150 g de petits pois surgelés","15 g de coriandre, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","4 longes de cabillaud en morceaux (560g)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettre les oignons, l''huile et le gingembre dans une poêle sur feu moyen. Ajoutez 100 ml d''eau puis couvrez, portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 10 min. Retirez le couvercle, ajoutez les piments et 1 cuillère à café de bouillon, puis laissez cuire encore 10 minutes – l''eau doit s''évaporer.","Pendant ce temps, versez le riz dans une casserole, couvrez de 500 ml d''eau froide et ajoutez 1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin, la cannelle, la cardamome moulue et la cuillère à café de bouillon restante. Portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez mijoter 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit cuit et que l''eau soit absorbée.","Versez le mélange d''oignons dans un bol et réservez. Mettez les épinards dans la poêle avec la ½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin restante et faites cuire jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient juste fanés. Versez 1 cuillère à soupe du mélange d''oignons dans un bol avec 1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt et réservez. Versez la moitié du riz cuit dans une poêle allant au four munie d''un couvercle. Garnir avec les épinards flétris, puis la moitié du mélange d''oignons restant. Ensuite, incorporez les petits pois au reste du riz, puis étalez-le en une couche, suivi du reste du mélange d''oignons, puis du reste du yaourt. Couvrir et enfourner 15 min.","Pendant ce temps, incorporez la coriandre au mélange d''oignons et de yaourt réservé à l''étape 3 avec le jus de citron et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse avec un mixeur plongeant, puis utilisez-le pour enrober la morue. Après 15 minutes de cuisson du biryani, déposez dessus le cabillaud ainsi que la marinade. Couvrir et cuire encore 15 à 18 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson se défasse. Servir à moitié garni de plus de coriandre et réfrigérer le reste pendant un autre jour. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à deux jours. Réchauffer au micro-ondes jusqu’à ce qu’il soit très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:14:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11909,5429,'fr','Dîner de poulet piri-piri dans une poêle','Essayez ce poulet piri-piri dans une poêle pour un dîner en famille et ajustez les niveaux de piment en fonction de la tolérance de votre famille. Vous pouvez utiliser un poulet entier à la place, si vous le souhaitez','["1 kg de cuisses et de pilons de poulet avec os (des quantités égales de chacun évitent les disputes)","500 g de pommes de terre grelots, tranchées épaisses","2 poivrons (1 rouge, 1 jaune), tranchés épaissement","200 g de tomates cerises","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées","épi de maïs beurré, pour servir","1½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","25 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 citron vert, zesté et pressé","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment séchés (utilisez-en moins si vous préférez moins de chaleur)","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ bouquet d''origan frais, feuilles cueillies ou 1 cuillère à soupe d''origan séché","1 piment rouge (facultatif), épépiné et haché","1 cuillère à soupe de vin rouge ou de porto (facultatif)"]','["Pilez tous les ingrédients de la marinade avec 1 cuillère à café de sel à l''aide d''un grand pilon et d''un mortier, ou mixez-les dans un mini hachoir pour créer une pâte lâche. Coupez chaque morceau de poulet plusieurs fois, puis versez-le dans un bol et enrobez-le de marinade. Couvrir et réfrigérer pendant au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Verser le poulet avec la marinade et les pommes de terre dans un plat à rôtir. Mélanger, puis disposer le poulet sur les pommes de terre, les cuisses côté peau vers le haut. Rôtir pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit doré.","Sortez le moule du four et mélangez les poivrons avec les pommes de terre, arrosez le poulet d''un peu de jus du moule et retournez les pilons. Placez les tomates cerises parmi le poulet et faites-les rôtir encore 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit, que la peau soit croustillante et que les légumes soient bien rôtis. Parsemez de coriandre et de sel marin feuilleté, si vous le souhaitez, et servez directement du moule avec le maïs beurré à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:14:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11910,5431,'fr','Gnocchis de patates douces à la sauce tomate','Essayez ces savoureux gnocchis à base de patates douces et de pommes de terre blanches. Les patates douces comptent pour vos cinq par jour, tout comme la sauce tomate qui les accompagne.','["350g de patates douces","4 pommes de terre au four (950g)","200 g de farine d''épeautre complète, plus un peu si besoin","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1-2 piments frais, épépinés et finement hachés","600 g de grosses tomates mûries sur vigne, hachées finement","15 g de basilic haché à moitié","50 g de fromage à pâte dure végétarien à l''italienne finement râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettre les deux types de pommes de terre sur une plaque à pâtisserie, les piquer partout avec une fourchette, puis enfourner pendant 50 à 60 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un couteau s''y glisse facilement. Coupez toutes les pommes de terre en deux pour permettre à l''excès de vapeur de s''échapper en refroidissant.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''ail et les piments jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Versez les tomates, incorporez la moitié du basilic haché, puis couvrez et laissez cuire à feu doux pendant 20-30 minutes pour obtenir une sauce épaisse.","Lorsque les pommes de terre cuites au four sont suffisamment froides pour être manipulées, épluchez et jetez soigneusement la peau, puis écrasez-les bien jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Incorporer la farine, puis pétrir brièvement avec les mains pour créer une pâte, en ajoutant un peu de farine supplémentaire si le mélange est collant.","Coupez la pâte en deux, puis enveloppez-en une moitié et mettez-la au réfrigérateur pendant un autre jour. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Coupez en quatre la pâte restante, puis roulez chaque morceau en un boudin d''environ 28 cm de long et coupez-le en bouchées égales. Appuyez légèrement avec le dos d''une fourchette pour créer des crêtes, si vous le souhaitez, puis réservez en espacant les unes des autres.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau, puis déposez-y les gnocchis et laissez cuire 2 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils remontent à la surface, puis égouttez-les à l''aide d''une écumoire. Ne les laissez pas trop cuire, sinon ils s’effondreront. Mélangez avec la moitié de la sauce tomate, déchirez la moitié du basilic restant et répartissez sur la moitié du fromage. Le reste se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Préparez le reste des gnocchis comme décrit à l''étape 4, puis réchauffez-les dans la sauce et servez comme ci-dessus avec le reste du basilic et du fromage."]','2026-01-11 00:14:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11911,5433,'fr','Burgers de chou-fleur et mayonnaise au curry','Essayez ces hamburgers végétariens lors de votre prochain barbecue – ils contiennent deux de vos cinq par jour et un coup de curry piquant','["1 petit chou-fleur","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","2 grosses tomates, hachées finement","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","½ bouquet de coriandre finement hachée","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry","4 pains à burger","2 poignées de mélange bombay (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Retirez les feuilles du chou-fleur et coupez la base, puis coupez-le en steaks de 2 cm d''épaisseur. Mélangez l''huile avec la poudre de curry. Disposez les steaks de chou-fleur sur une plaque à pâtisserie plate recouverte de papier d''aluminium. Badigeonnez chacun généreusement d''huile de curry des deux côtés et saupoudrez de sel avant de les rôtir pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres.","Dans un bol, mélangez les tomates, l''oignon, la coriandre et une pincée de sel. Dans un deuxième bol, mélangez la mayonnaise, le yaourt et la pâte de curry.","Faire griller les petits pains côté coupé vers le bas dans une poêle sèche. Garnir chaque petit pain d''une cuillerée de mayonnaise au curry, du steak de chou-fleur, d''un peu plus de mayonnaise au curry, du mélange de tomates et d''oignons et d''un peu de mélange de bombay, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11912,5435,'fr','Patates douces rôties au four','Préparez des patates douces parfaitement rôties, moelleuses à l''intérieur et légèrement dorées sur les bords pour un plat d''accompagnement coloré. Ajoutez quelques oignons rouges émincés dans le plat à rôtir, si vous le souhaitez.','["4 patates douces (environ 1,2 kg), pelées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","oignons rouges tranchés, gousses d''ail non pelées, brins de thym ou autres légumes ou herbes de votre choix (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 230°C/210°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 8. Coupez les patates douces en cubes de 2 à 3 cm.","Versez dans un grand plat à rôtir peu profond, arrosez d''huile et assaisonnez de sel et de poivre. Si vous ajoutez des légumes ou des herbes supplémentaires, comme des oignons rouges tranchés, des gousses d''ail et du thym, ajoutez-les également. Mélangez le tout pour bien l''enrober d''huile, puis faites rôtir pendant 20 minutes. Remuez à nouveau pour vous assurer que les pommes de terre cuisent uniformément et faites rôtir encore 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient légèrement dorées à l''extérieur et tendres lorsqu''elles sont percées avec une fourchette ou un couteau."]','2026-01-11 00:14:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11913,5437,'fr','Pâtes crémeuses aux champignons et aux épinards','Mélangez ensemble les tagliatelles, les champignons et les épinards dans une sauce au parmesan et à la crème fraîche pour préparer un dîner rapide et faible en calories qui ne prend que 25 minutes.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon, finement haché","150 g de petits champignons coupés en deux","150 g de tagliatelles","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","200 g de crème fraîche allégée","15 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé","120 g de bébés épinards","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon et les champignons pendant 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et légèrement dorés. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions du paquet.","Ajouter l''ail dans la poêle avec les champignons et cuire encore 2 minutes. Versez la crème fraîche et le parmesan, mélangez, puis ajoutez les pousses d''épinards. Annuler.","Retirez les pâtes du feu et égouttez-les en réservant 25 ml d''eau. Mélanger les pâtes dans la sauce crémeuse aux champignons, remettre sur le feu et cuire à feu doux jusqu''à ce que les épinards fanent, environ 5 minutes. Versez suffisamment d’eau réservée pour desserrer légèrement. Assaisonnez avec du poivre noir et terminez par une pincée de flocons de piment, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11914,5439,'fr','Riz cuit au four aux herbes','Mélangez du riz basmati, du paneer, du mangetout et des pois pour préparer ce dîner végétarien rapide et facile pour deux. C''est un excellent choix pour les soirs de semaine chargés','["150 g de riz basmati","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","400 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","½ petit paquet de persil finement haché","1 citron, zesté et pressé","65 g de paner coupé en cubes de 1½ cm","100 g de mangetout coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur","100 g de petits pois surgelés"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez le riz et l''huile de colza dans une cocotte moyenne (environ 25 x 20 cm), assaisonnez et mélangez pour bien enrober le riz d''huile. Ajouter le bouillon, la majeure partie du persil, la majeure partie du zeste de citron et tout le jus, mélanger et assaisonner.","Disposez les cubes de paneer sur tout le dessus du riz et faites cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit presque cuit et que le paneer commence à dorer sur le dessus. Mélangez le mange-tout et les petits pois, puis remettez au four pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient cuits mais encore de couleur vive. Saupoudrer du persil réservé et du zeste de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:14:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11915,5443,'fr','Radis à la feta fouettée aux herbes','Servez cette trempette crémeuse à la feta fouettée comme plat à partager. Arrosez d''un peu d''huile d''olive et servez avec des radis à tremper, des carottes et du concombre.','["130 g de feta émiettée","150 g de yaourt épais à la grecque","½ citron, zesté","¼ bouquet d''aneth","¼ bouquet de basilic","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu pour arroser","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à café de zaatar ou de flocons de piment","1 botte de radis (voir astuce ci-dessous)"]','["Mettez la feta, le yaourt, le zeste de citron, les herbes et l''huile dans un robot culinaire ou un mélangeur à grande vitesse et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ait une texture crémeuse et lisse. Verser dans un bol de service peu profond et réserver.","Faites griller doucement les graines de coriandre dans une poêle sèche à feu doux-moyen pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées. Répartissez les graines sur la trempette, ainsi que les flocons de zaatar ou de piment. Arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive et servir avec les radis pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:14:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11916,5447,'fr','Saumon poêlé au Little Gem braisé','Si vous recherchez un dîner de poisson rapide et sain, essayez ce saumon poêlé avec des légumes verts et une sauce légère et crémeuse. Cela prend moins de 15 minutes à faire','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","4 laitues Little Gem, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","200 ml de bouillon de légumes","4 x 130 g de filets de saumon","200 g de petits pois frais ou surgelés (décongelés s''ils sont surgelés)","½ petit bouquet d''aneth haché","1 cuillère à soupe de crème fraîche demi-écrémée","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une grande poêle à frire à feu moyen. Disposez les moitiés de laitue dans la poêle, côté coupé vers le bas, et faites-les frire pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à dorer. Versez le bouillon, couvrez et laissez cuire 6 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, assaisonnez le saumon avec une bonne pincée de sel et de poivre de chaque côté des filets. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une deuxième poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir le saumon, peau vers le bas, pendant 3 minutes. Retournez délicatement à l''aide d''une tranche de poisson et laissez cuire encore 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit et que la chair se défasse facilement.","Versez les petits pois et l''aneth dans la poêle avec la laitue et laissez cuire 2 minutes à couvert jusqu''à ce que la laitue soit tendre mais conserve sa structure. Disposez les filets de saumon et les moitiés de laitue sur des assiettes de service.","Incorporer la crème fraîche et la moutarde dans la poêle à laitue et cuire à feu doux pour bien réchauffer. Versez la sauce et les petits pois sur la laitue et le saumon."]','2026-01-11 00:14:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11917,5449,'fr','Carré d''agneau rôti dans une poêle et pommes de terre aux olives vertes','Servez un repas simple et romantique pour deux avec notre carré d''agneau rôti. Nous avons ajouté des olives et des anchois, mais laissez-les de côté si vous voulez que cela soit encore plus simple.','["1 carré d''agneau (6 os est l''idéal)","25g de beurre","1 oignon, finement tranché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 anchois écrasé au pilon et au mortier (facultatif)","une petite poignée de feuilles de romarin hachées grossièrement","500 g de pommes de terre Maris Piper ou King Edward, tranchées finement (utilisez une mandoline si vous en avez une)","10 olives vertes dénoyautées, hachées","100 ml de bouillon de poulet ou d''agneau"]','["Chauffer le four à 210°C/190°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Assaisonner généreusement l''agneau partout et faire chauffer le beurre dans une grande poêle allant au four sur feu moyen. Faites revenir l''agneau partout pendant 10 à 15 minutes, surtout le côté gras. Retirer et réserver dans une assiette.","Remettez la poêle sur le feu et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli, puis ajoutez l''ail, l''anchois (le cas échéant) et le romarin, et faites revenir encore 2 minutes. Disposez délicatement les pommes de terre dans la poêle avec les olives, assaisonnez, puis retournez-les pour qu''elles soient entièrement enrobées du mélange, puis étalez-les en une couche uniforme. Versez dessus le bouillon, puis enfournez 30 min jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre commencent à devenir croustillantes sur les bords.","Placez l''agneau sur les pommes de terre, côté gras vers le haut, et arrosez-le du jus de l''assiette. Remettez la poêle au four pendant 20 min pour un agneau saignant, 25 min pour un agneau rosé mais bien cuit et 30 min pour un agneau bien cuit. Lorsque l''agneau est cuit à votre goût, placez-le sur une planche à découper et laissez reposer 10 minutes. Pendant ce temps, remettez les pommes de terre au four pour les rendre encore plus croustillantes. Coupez l''agneau en côtelettes et servez-le avec les pommes de terre, le cavolo nero et la vinaigrette au persil et aux câpres (voir « va bien avec » ci-dessous)."]','2026-01-11 00:14:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11918,5451,'fr','Courge avec orzo & ail rôti & sauce feta','Dégustez des quartiers de courge rôtis servis avec de l''orzo et une sauce à l''ail rôti, au citron et à la feta. Plein de saveurs, c''est un excellent dîner végétarien pour deux','["1 bulbe d''ail","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 courge moyenne (environ 800 g), pelée, coupée en deux et coupée en quartiers de 2 à 3 cm","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","200g d''orge","1 gros poireau, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur et finement tranché","½ cuillère à soupe de beurre non salé","1 citron confit, haché finement","150 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes","1 petit bouquet de persil plat finement haché","200 g de féta","3½ cuillères à soupe de yaourt","½ citron, jus"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Retirez les couches extérieures du bulbe d''ail et coupez l''extrémité de la racine, en prenant soin de ne pas couper trop profondément dans les gousses. Mettez une petite feuille de papier d''aluminium, arrosez d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive et saupoudrez d''une pincée de sel. Écrasez pour enfermer l''ail dans le papier d''aluminium et enfournez pendant 45 minutes. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir encore enveloppé dans le papier d''aluminium.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez la courge avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile, le paprika et un peu d''assaisonnement. Versez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites rôtir pendant 30 à 40 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre et ait un peu de couleur.","Pour la sauce, mélangez la feta, le yaourt, le jus de citron et 4 gousses d''ail rôties (en pressant la chair des peaux) pour créer une pâte lisse. Il doit être épais mais versable – ajoutez jusqu''à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour le détendre si nécessaire. Annuler.","Faites cuire l''orzo dans une casserole d''eau salée à feu moyen pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit mais encore mordant. Égoutter en réservant une tasse d''eau d''orzo et laisser refroidir dans un tamis sous l''eau froide courante.","Faites cuire le poireau avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et le beurre à feu moyen dans une grande poêle en remuant régulièrement pendant 5 min. Ajoutez le citron confit et la chair de 3 gousses d''ail rôties, puis écrasez bien. Une fois que les poireaux sont translucides, versez-y l''orzo cuit, le bouillon et un peu d''eau de cuisson des pâtes. Remuer pendant une minute pour réchauffer l''orzo. Incorporer la moitié du persil.","Verser l''orzo et les poireaux dans des assiettes, garnir de courge et arroser de sauce feta. Saupoudrer du reste de persil et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11919,5457,'fr','Pâtes crémeuses à la citrouille','Profitez au maximum des citrouilles cet automne. Une fois réduite en purée et combinée au mascarpone et au parmesan, leur chair se transforme en une sauce pour pâtes soyeuse et délicieuse.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","500 g de potiron ou de courge, pelée et coupée en cubes d''environ 3 cm","50-100 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de mascarpone","350 g de pâtes courtes (les rigatoni ou les penne fonctionnent bien)","40 g de parmesan râpé ou alternative végétarienne, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte peu profonde ou une poêle à frire à feu doux-moyen et faites revenir l''oignon avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et translucide. Ajoutez l''ail et faites revenir encore 1 min. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le potiron dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre lorsqu''on le perce avec un couteau à couverts. Égoutter et verser dans un mixeur (ou utiliser un mixeur plongeant). Mélangez avec 50 ml de lait et les oignons jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement lisses, en ajoutant progressivement plus de lait jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit suffisamment épais pour recouvrir le dos d''une cuillère (vous n''aurez peut-être pas besoin de tout le lait). Versez dans une grande poêle le concentré de tomates et le mascarpone et portez à ébullition à feu doux.","Faites cuire les pâtes dans une grande casserole d’eau bouillante salée en suivant les instructions sur l’emballage. Égoutter en réservant une tasse d''eau de cuisson. Mélangez les pâtes avec la sauce à la citrouille, le parmesan et 50 à 100 ml de l''eau réservée pour les décoller. Assaisonner et parsemer de parmesan supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:14:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11920,5459,'fr','Poitrine de grenade','Ajoutez les notes aigre-douces de la mélasse de grenade pour apporter une incroyable profondeur de saveur à ce plat de bœuf mijoté. C''est un plat populaire lors des fêtes juives','["poitrine de bœuf (si roulée, déroulez-la)","oignons rouges, finement tranchés","½ grenade, graines seulement","couscous géant cuit agrémenté de 10 g de feuilles de coriandre, d''un peu de piment urfa, de tranches de concombre et de zeste de citron (facultatif), pour servir","120 ml de mélasse de grenade","60 ml d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de printemps","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment Urfa"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients de la marinade dans un petit bol avec ¾ cuillère à café de sel fin. Mettez le bœuf dans un grand plat allant au four. Versez la moitié de la marinade sur le bœuf et répartissez-la uniformément, puis retournez-la et versez le reste sur la viande pour l''enrober. Couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Sortez la viande du réfrigérateur jusqu''à 1 heure avant la cuisson pour qu''elle soit à température ambiante. S’il fait chaud, vous pouvez réduire cette durée à 30 minutes. Chauffer le four à 240C/220C chaleur tournante/gaz 9.","Retourner la viande dans la marinade pour s''assurer qu''elle soit bien enrobée, en laissant la couche de gras sur le dessus. Mettez la moitié des oignons émincés sous la viande et répartissez le reste sur le dessus. Couvrir le plat de papier d''aluminium sans serrer, en s''assurant qu''il est correctement couvert.","Rôtir pendant 15 minutes, puis baisser le four à 170°C/150°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et cuire encore 2h30-3h. Vérifiez sa tendreté : une fourchette doit entrer et sortir facilement et la viande doit bien s''écailler, sinon remettez au four encore 30 minutes.","Laissez reposer la poitrine pendant 15 minutes, toujours recouverte de papier d''aluminium, puis transférez-la sur une planche. Décorez avec les graines de grenade. Servir avec le couscous géant, si vous le souhaitez, ou râper avec deux fourchettes, puis verser un peu de sauce à la grenade, puis servir avec du pain pitta et des trempettes de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:14:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11921,5461,'fr','Tarte aux champignons','Créez une tarte aux champignons accrocheuse pour un plat principal végétarien simple mais impressionnant. Essayez un savoureux accord de champignons de terre, de fromage à la crème et de pâtisserie aux noisettes','["175 g d''ingrédients Flora 100 % naturels plus 2 cuillères à soupe","300g de farine complète","Une petite poignée de thym, feuilles cueillies","600 g de champignons mélangés, nettoyés et tranchés","1 petit oignon finement haché","125g de fromage à pâte molle","1/2 petit bouquet de ciboulette hachée","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 œuf, battu pour glacer"]','["Mettez 175 g d''ingrédients Flora 100 % naturels, la farine complète, la moitié du thym et une pincée de sel dans un robot culinaire et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à s''agglutiner. Ajoutez 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à former une boule. Filmer et réfrigérer 20 min.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer les 2 cuillères à soupe restantes dans une poêle et faites revenir les champignons et les oignons pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et légèrement dorés. Bien assaisonner et retirer du feu.","Chauffer le four à 220C/ventilateur 200C/gaz 7. Ajoutez une grande plaque à pâtisserie plate au four pour chauffer. Fouetter le fromage à pâte molle avec la moitié de la ciboulette, le reste du thym et tout l''ail. Assaisonnez bien.","Étalez la pâte entre deux feuilles de papier sulfurisé pour obtenir une forme rectangulaire grossière, de l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £, d''environ 30 x 40 cm. Retirez la couche supérieure de papier sulfurisé et lissez le mélange de fromage à pâte molle en laissant une bordure de 5 cm. Verser sur les champignons, en couche uniforme sur le fromage à pâte molle, puis replier les 4 côtés de la bordure pour chevaucher légèrement la garniture. Coupez les côtés avant de les replier si nécessaire, mais ils seront jolis une fois cuits dans les deux cas. Glacer la pâte avec l''oeuf.","En vous aidant du papier sulfurisé, glissez la tarte sur la plaque chaude avec le papier. Cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit cuite et croustillante. Parsemer du reste de ciboulette pour servir, accompagné d''une salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:14:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11922,5463,'fr','Soupe d''été aux haricots et boulgour','Voici une portion de cinq de vos 5 par jour dans une soupe délicieuse et rapide à préparer. Si vous le préparez à l''avance, le boulgour absorbe une grande partie du liquide, alors ajoutez un peu d''eau pour le détendre un peu (ou mangez-le simplement comme un ragoût estival).','["400 g de haricots borlotti en boîte","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","160 g de courge butternut coupée en dés (poids préparé)","1 poireau (environ 160 g), émincé","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 cuillère à café de feuilles de thym frais","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","1 courgette (170 g), coupée en deux et tranchée","80 g de tomates cerises entières","40 g de boulgour","20 g de feuilles de basilic hachées","25 g de parmesan ou de fromage à pâte dure végétarien à l''italienne, finement râpé"]','["Égoutter les haricots et réserver. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez la courge et faites-la revenir quelques minutes à feu vif pour la ramollir. Ajouter le poireau et l''ail et cuire encore quelques minutes. Versez 2 bidons d’eau (à l’aide de la boîte de haricots). Incorporer le thym, la purée de tomates et le bouillon ainsi que les tranches de courgettes et les tomates cerises entières, le boulgour et les haricots. Portez à ébullition, puis ajoutez la moitié du basilic. Couvrir la poêle et laisser mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres.","Incorporer le basilic restant et les trois quarts du fromage. Verser dans des bols et servir avec le reste du fromage parsemé."]','2026-01-11 00:14:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11923,5465,'fr','Boulettes de porc avec salade de boulgour, feta et menthe','Les boulettes de viande à faible teneur en matières grasses peuvent souvent être sèches, mais l''ajout de carottes et d''oignons râpés non seulement les humidifie, mais ajoute également de la saveur et de la texture.','["100 g de carottes râpées","2 oignons blancs (280g), 130g grossièrement râpés, le reste finement haché","500 g de viande hachée de porc 5 % de matière grasse","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","125 g de boulgour","1 citron, zesté et pressé","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","160 g de concombre coupé en petits dés","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en quartiers","6 olives Kalamata, tranchées","15 g de feuilles de menthe, quelques petites réservées pour parsemer, le reste haché grossièrement","75 g de feta émiettée"]','["Mélangez la carotte et l''oignon râpés avec le porc, la moitié de l''origan et beaucoup de poivre noir. Façonner 16 grosses boulettes de viande. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites frire les boulettes de viande pendant environ 5 à 8 minutes, en les retournant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient fermes et commencent à se colorer. Retirer de la poêle et réserver.","Versez l''oignon haché dans la poêle et faites-le revenir à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir, environ 5 minutes. Incorporer l''ail, puis ajouter les tomates ainsi que la purée de tomates, une boîte d''eau, la poudre de bouillon et le reste de l''origan. Cuire à feu doux, à couvert, pendant 15 min, puis ajouter les boulettes de viande. Couvrir et laisser mijoter encore 10 mn","Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir le boulgour pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, puis égouttez-le. Versez dans un bol et incorporez le zeste de citron et 2-3 cuillères à soupe de jus, l''oignon rouge, le concombre, les tomates, les olives et la menthe hachée. Empilez la moitié sur deux assiettes et garnissez de la moitié des boulettes de viande et de la sauce. Répartir sur les feuilles de menthe et la moitié de la feta. Réfrigérez le reste pour une autre nuit. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffez les boulettes de viande à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très chaudes, puis servez-les avec la salade. Si elles sont congelées, laissez-les décongeler complètement et réchauffez-les doucement jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très chaudes."]','2026-01-11 00:14:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11924,5469,'fr','Plat de morue et d''anchois','Obtenez votre portion hebdomadaire de poisson blanc avec cette recette saine tout-en-un à base d''anchois, de tomates, d''épinards et de poivron rouge. Il livre quatre de vos cinq par jour','["1 grosse ou 2 pommes de terre moyennes, coupées en rondelles de 5 mm d''épaisseur (environ 280 g)","1 oignon émincé (environ 160 g)","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym","10 g d''anchois finement hachés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive ou de colza","1 poivron rouge, coupé en quartiers, épépiné et tranché","2 grosses tomates hachées grossièrement (environ 250 g)","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin blanc","½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","2 longes de cabillaud sans peau et désossées (280g)","25 g de cheddar finement râpé","250 g de pousses d''épinards, flétries, pour servir"]','["Faites cuire les pommes de terre et les oignons dans l''eau bouillante pendant 5 à 7 minutes. Égoutter puis mélanger délicatement avec le thym, les anchois et un peu de poivre noir.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l’huile dans une poêle et faites cuire le poivron à couvert pendant 5 min. Ajouter les tomates, le vinaigre, le bouillon et l''ail et cuire encore 8 à 10 minutes, à découvert, jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient ramollies. Vous ne voulez pas que ce soit trop humide, alors continuez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que tout excès de liquide se soit évaporé, si nécessaire.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Disposez les longes de cabillaud dans un plat peu profond allant au four et versez-y le mélange de tomates, puis le mélange de pommes de terre et d''oignons, en couches égales. Saupoudrer de fromage. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit doré et que le poisson s''écaille mais soit moelleux. Servir avec les épinards à part."]','2026-01-11 00:14:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11925,5473,'fr','Curry de poisson au curcuma, gingembre et noix de coco','Servez ce curry de poisson sain, aux saveurs vibrantes de curcuma, de gingembre et de noix de coco, pour un repas facile en milieu de semaine. Cela ne prend que 30 minutes de la préparation à l''assiette','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, finement tranchés","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","½ cuillère à soupe de curcuma","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","½ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","325 ml de lait de coco léger","400 g de longe de cabillaud désossée et sans peau, coupée en morceaux","300 g de petits pois surgelés","300 g de pois mange-tout","400 g de riz basmati brun, cuit, pour servir","1 piment rouge, finement tranché","1 citron vert, coupé en quartiers, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen, puis faites revenir l''oignon pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit translucide. Incorporer le gingembre et les épices et cuire encore une minute. Versez le lait de coco et 100 ml d''eau, remuez puis laissez mijoter 10 min.","Ajouter la morue, les petits pois surgelés et les pois mange-tout et laisser mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit feuilleté. Servir avec du riz, des tranches de piment, une bonne mouture de poivre noir et quelques quartiers de citron vert à côté pour les presser."]','2026-01-11 00:14:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11926,5475,'fr','Gigot d''agneau rôti facile','Rôtir un gigot d''agneau pour un festin en famille. Il est idéal servi avec des rôtis et vos légumes printaniers préférés','["2kg-2,5kg de gigot d''agneau","petit bouquet de romarin, coupé en brins courts de 2 cm","4-5 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","4-6 filets d''anchois bruns, hachés (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gros oignons, tranchés épaissement"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Retirez tous les emballages de l''agneau et notez le poids pour calculer le temps de rôtissage. Faites des incisions dans l''agneau à l''aide d''un petit couteau bien aiguisé, en biais, à environ 5 cm dans la viande. En faisant les trous en biais, la viande sera plus aromatisée et les arômes seront moins tentés d''être expulsés lors du rôtissage.","Insérez une petite branche de romarin, une tranche d''ail et un petit morceau d''anchois (si vous en utilisez) dans chacun des trous, en appuyant bien avec votre doigt. Assaisonnez la viande avec du sel et du poivre, puis frottez l''agneau avec l''huile d''olive. Transférer dans un plat à rôtir, posé sur les tranches d''oignon. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes.","Baissez le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5 et laissez cuire encore 15-20 minutes pour 500g (1h – 1h20 pour 2kg de gigot) selon le rose de votre agneau. Vous pouvez également vérifier la température interne de l’agneau si vous préférez une viande plus rosée – elle sera de 55°C pour une viande moyenne (rose) et de 70°C pour une viande bien cuite.","Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et laisser reposer 15 minutes avant de découper. Conservez le jus du plateau et les tranches d''oignon pour faire la sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:14:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11927,5477,'fr','Truite fumée & pâté au raifort','Préparez cette trempette de poisson avec des notes piquantes de moutarde, de fromage à la crème, de citron et d''aneth – idéale pour un plat de fête de dernière minute.','["140g de fromage frais","1 cuillère à café de crème de raifort","le zeste et le jus d''un demi citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth finement haché, plus des feuilles supplémentaires pour servir","2 filets de truite fumée","500 g de pain de seigle tranché pour servir","1 laitue Baby Gem, feuilles séparées, pour servir"]','["Mettez le fromage à la crème, le raifort, le zeste et le jus de citron dans un bol et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Saison.","Ajoutez l''aneth haché et les flocons dans la truite fumée, en retirant les arêtes ou la peau au fur et à mesure. Bien mélanger et assaisonner davantage au goût. Le pâté se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 2 jours. Servir garni de feuilles d''aneth et saupoudré de poivre noir concassé. Mangez avec du pain de seigle et des feuilles de laitue."]','2026-01-11 00:14:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11928,5485,'fr','Cuisses de canard rôties en une poêle, haricots blancs et carottes','Préparez une version minimaliste du cassoulet en rôtissant lentement des cuisses de canard avec des haricots blancs et des carottes. C''est un plat riche en saveur mais avec peu d''ingrédients','["4 cuisses de canard","une poignée de brins de thym","huile de tournesol, pour arroser","500 g de carottes tranchées","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots blancs égouttés"]','["Si vous avez le temps, salez légèrement les cuisses de canard un jour ou deux avant la cuisson, parsemez de quelques brins de thym, puis couvrez et réfrigérez jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. (Si vous n''avez pas le temps, ce n''est pas une étape indispensable.) Chauffez le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 3. Faites chauffer un peu d''huile dans une cocotte antidéflagrante peu profonde ou un plat à rôtir. Si les cuisses de canard ont été salées au préalable, séchez-les avec du papier absorbant. Faites grésiller les cuisses dans le moule ou la cocotte, côté peau vers le bas, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et que le gras soit fondu. Retournez et laissez cuire 10 à 15 minutes pour les dorer partout.","Retirez les cuisses de canard dans une assiette et versez la moitié de la graisse de la cocotte ou du moule (vous pouvez la conserver pour les rôtis). Remettez sur le feu et faites revenir les carottes, l''ail et le thym avec un peu d''assaisonnement pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les carottes commencent à ramollir. Posez les cuisses de canard dessus, côté peau vers le haut, puis versez environ 100 ml d''eau sur les légumes. Portez à ébullition, couvrez et enfournez pour cuire 1h30.","Sortez la cocotte du four et découvrez. Allumez le four à 200C/180C/gaz 6. Sortez le canard sur une assiette et mélangez les haricots, les carottes et le thym. Reposez le canard dessus, puis remettez au four, à découvert, pour cuire encore 20 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que la peau du canard soit croustillante et que les haricots mijotent. Sortir du four et laisser reposer 10 minutes, puis servir directement du plat."]','2026-01-11 00:14:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11929,5487,'fr','Pâtes à la norme','Essayez cette version simple d''une alla norma, qui utilise des aubergines rôties au lieu d''aubergines frites. Il est ensuite agrémenté de spaghettis et d''une riche sauce tomate et basilic.','["2 aubergines coupées en morceaux de 3 cm","1 grosse cuillère à café de sel","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 petit oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","pincée de flocons de piment","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café de sucre","350 g de spaghettis (sans œufs, si besoin)","petit bouquet de basilic, râpé, plus quelques feuilles pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de câpres","ricotta salata ou parmesan, finement râpé, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez les aubergines avec le sel, puis versez-les dans une passoire au-dessus d''un bol pendant 30 minutes, pour en extraire l''humidité.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une cocotte ou une casserole. Ajoutez l''oignon et une pincée de sel et faites cuire à feu doux pendant 10 minutes. Ajouter l''ail et le piment et cuire 1 min. Ajoutez les tomates et le sucre et portez à ébullition. Cuire à découvert pendant 20 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7.","Séchez l''aubergine avec du papier absorbant, puis mélangez-la avec le reste de l''huile. Étaler sur une plaque à pâtisserie et rôtir pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et doré sur les bords. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes selon les instructions du paquet en réservant 100 ml d''eau de cuisson.","Incorporer l''aubergine à la sauce avec le basilic et les câpres. Assaisonnez au goût, puis mélangez les spaghettis dans la poêle avec la sauce et un peu d''eau pour pâtes. Répartir dans quatre bols et garnir de ricotta et de basilic supplémentaire, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:14:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11930,5489,'fr','Morue au four','Dégustez de la morue au four avec du citron et du thym pour un repas facile en milieu de semaine. Servir avec vos légumes préférés pour un dîner familial sain et sans tracas','["3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","4 cod loin fillets","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 citron, tranché","½ petit bouquet de thym"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Versez la farine dans un bol et ajoutez un peu d''assaisonnement. Tourner chaque filet de morue dans la farine jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément enrobé.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-vif. Ajouter la morue et faire frire de chaque côté pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée.","Transférer la morue dans un plat à rôtir. Disposez les tranches de citron et le thym sur et autour du poisson et arrosez du reste d''huile. Cuire au four pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit."]','2026-01-11 00:14:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11931,5493,'fr','Pains plats à la courge et au halloumi avec confiture de betterave au piment doux','Faites quelque chose de différent pour un dîner en famille avec des pains plats à la courge et au halloumi avec de la confiture de betterave au piment doux. D’autres courges ou patates douces fonctionnent aussi bien','["1 courge musquée","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","225 g de halloumi","100 g de pousses d''épinards","1 petite betterave cuite (environ 125g)","3 cuillères à soupe de cassonade","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment rouge","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","300 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","150-200g de yaourt"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Préparez la courge en la coupant en deux, en ôtant les graines, puis en la coupant en tranches de 1 cm d''épaisseur. Mettre dans un grand bol avec l''huile d''olive, le paprika fumé et une pincée de sel. Bien mélanger pour enrober la courge, puis la déposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 pendant environ 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre et commence à dorer en surface.","Pour la confiture de piment, râpez la betterave (portez des gants pour éviter de vous tacher les mains) et mettez-la dans une casserole avec le sucre, le vinaigre, les flocons de piment, les graines de cumin et le sel au goût. Cuire quelques minutes à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Pour réaliser les pains plats, versez la farine dans un bol et ajoutez 150 g de yaourt, ou jusqu''à 200 g si la pâte semble trop sèche, puis mélangez à l''aide d''un couteau à couverts jusqu''à ce qu''elle forme une boule. Versez la pâte sur un plan de travail et pétrissez pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Divisez-les en quatre boules, puis saupoudrez le plan de travail de farine et roulez chacune en un gros pain plat (ou faites-en huit mini). Faites frire les pains plats dans une poêle à feu moyen pendant quelques minutes de chaque côté.","Juste avant de servir, coupez le halloumi en 8 fines tranches. Cuire à la poêle quelques minutes de chaque côté. Disposez les épinards, la courge et le halloumi sur les pains plats, puis arrosez de confiture de betterave et de piment pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11932,5495,'fr','Trempettes d''ailes de poulet','Servez ces trempettes d''ailes de poulet avec des sauces pour un buffet facile ou un repas de fête. Essayez nos sauces teriyaki et curry sucrées ci-dessous, elles fonctionnent très bien.','["1 kg d''ailes de poulet, bouts d''ailes retirés et ailes divisées en deux morceaux","1 cuillère à café de farine de maïs","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café d''huile de tournesol"]','["Mettez les ailes dans un grand bol et mélangez-les avec 1 cuillère à café de sel, la fécule de maïs et la levure chimique – cela aidera la peau à devenir croustillante lors de la cuisson. Réfrigérer, couvert, pendant au moins 1 heure, ou idéalement toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Mélanger les ailes avec l''huile, puis disposer en une seule couche sur une grille posée sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, puis retourner les ailes et cuire au four encore 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes. Transférer dans un plat de sauces pour tremper (voir conseils ci-dessous), ou poser un grand bol sur la table à côté de chaque sauce et mélanger les ailes dans les sauces."]','2026-01-11 00:14:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11933,5497,'fr','Cabillaud fumé, brocoli et orzo','Savourez ce plat de morue, de brocoli et d''orzo facile et rapide les soirs de semaine chargés. C’est sain et faible en gras, et comme il s’agit d’un plat de cuisson, il y a un minimum de vaisselle !','["½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un filet","1 oignon, haché","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé, plus une pincée","½ à 1 cuillère à soupe de pâte chipotle","200 g de brocoli à longues tiges","400 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","150 g d''orzo","½ petit bouquet d''aneth haché","½ petit bouquet de persil haché","50 g de petits pois surgelés","2 filets de cabillaud durable sans peau","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt sans gras"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle profonde allant au four et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter le paprika, la pâte de chipotle, le brocoli et le bouillon. Incorporer l''orzo et transférer au four pendant 10 minutes.","Incorporez la moitié des herbes et les petits pois et placez le poisson dans l''orzo. Saupoudrer d''une pincée de paprika et arroser d''huile, puis assaisonner. Cuire 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit cuit et que l''orzo soit tendre. Mélangez le reste des herbes avec le yaourt. Détendez avec un peu d''eau si besoin, puis servez avec l''orzo et le poisson."]','2026-01-11 00:14:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11934,5499,'fr','Curry de noix de cajou et de courge musquée','Cuisez par lots ce curry végétalien de courge et de noix de cajou et congelez-le pour les journées chargées lorsque vous avez besoin de quelque chose de rapide et nutritif. C''est parfait pour un repas en famille','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","1 oignon, finement haché","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cm de gingembre pelé et râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry doux","400 g de lait de coco en boîte","Boîte de 200 g de tomates concassées","75 g de noix de cajou, réduites en poudre fine","4 cuillères à soupe de raisins secs","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","1 grosse courge musquée, pelée et coupée en morceaux (environ 750 g de poids préparé)","riz, pains naan et cornichons, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''oignon et faites cuire, en remuant régulièrement, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli, environ 10 minutes. Ajouter l''ail, le gingembre et la poudre de curry et cuire environ 20 secondes en continuant de remuer.","Versez le lait de coco, les tomates, les noix de cajou, les raisins secs, les pois chiches et la courge. Versez 200 ml d''eau, puis portez à ébullition et réduisez immédiatement le feu au minimum. Laisser mijoter à découvert jusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre, environ 20 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps pour éviter qu''elle ne colle. Assaisonner au goût. En cas de congélation, laisser d''abord refroidir complètement. Peut être congelé jusqu''à un mois. Réchauffer congelé à 200°C/180°C ventilateur/gaz 6 pendant 10-15 minutes. Servir avec du riz, du naan et des cornichons, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11935,5501,'fr','Hot dogs au fromage avec sauce moutarde aux cornichons et oignons croustillants','Utilisez des saucisses de style bratwurst pour préparer des hot-dogs lors d''un barbecue et pimentez-les avec notre sauce moutarde aux cornichons. Les oignons croustillants ajoutent de la texture','["8 grosses saucisses façon bratwurst","80 g de mozzarella râpée","8 petits pains briochés à hot dog","50 g d''oignons croustillants","ketchup, pour servir (facultatif)","50 g de mayonnaise","2 cuillères à soupe de moutarde jaune à l''américaine","5 cornichons finement hachés"]','["Préparez la sauce moutarde aux cornichons en mélangeant la mayonnaise, la moutarde et les cornichons dans un bol. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Faites chauffer le barbecue et attendez que les braises deviennent cendrées. Vous pouvez également faire chauffer une poêle à feu vif. Faites cuire les saucisses pendant 7 à 8 minutes, en les retournant régulièrement jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient uniformément dorées et bien cuites, puis rassemblez les saucisses sur le gril ou dans la poêle et parsemez de mozzarella râpée. Cuire sans être dérangé pendant 2 minutes supplémentaires ou jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu.","Ouvrez les pains à hot-dog et farcissez chacun d''eux avec une saucisse garnie de fromage. Arroser de sauce moutarde aux cornichons et garnir d''oignons croustillants et de ketchup, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11936,5503,'fr','Ragoût de poulet printanier','Préparez ce ragoût de poulet réconfortant avec des légumes de saison pour nourrir toute la famille','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en deux","60g de beurre doux","1 oignon, finement haché","2 grosses carottes, hachées","60 g de farine nature","1,2 litre de bouillon de poulet","2 cuillères à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","300 g de petits pois surgelés","150 ml de crème fraîche","200 g de farines autolevantes","¼ cuillère à café de levure chimique","100 g de suif ou de beurre froid non salé, râpé","un petit bouquet de ciboulette finement tranchée (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte anti-flamme à feu vif et faites frire le poulet pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré. Retirer dans une assiette et réserver.","Faites fondre le beurre dans la même poêle, puis réduisez le feu à moyen et faites revenir l''oignon et les carottes pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Saupoudrer de farine et cuire encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez lentement le bouillon en remuant au fur et à mesure. Ajoutez la moutarde et le vinaigre et faites cuire à feu doux-moyen pendant 30 minutes en remuant régulièrement. Assaisonnez selon votre goût, puis ajoutez les petits pois et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Incorporer la crème.","Préparez les raviolis en mélangeant la farine avec la levure chimique, le suif ou le beurre, la ciboulette (le cas échéant) et ½ cuillère à café de sel. Incorporez rapidement 8 à 10 cuillères à soupe d''eau à l''aide d''un couteau à couverts, puis rassemblez la pâte avec vos mains – elle doit être ferme et souple. Divisez-le en huit morceaux de taille égale, en pesant pour plus de précision si vous le souhaitez. Disposez les raviolis sur le ragoût, puis couvrez avec le couvercle et laissez cuire 15 minutes à feu doux. Retirez le couvercle et faites glisser la poêle sous un gril chaud pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les raviolis soient gonflés et dorés. Verser dans des bols pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11937,5505,'fr','Nouilles parfumées au porc et à la citronnelle','En seulement 20 minutes, vous pourrez déguster un sauté capiteux à la citronnelle, au gingembre et au citron vert. Si vous préférez des nouilles plus épaisses, elles fonctionneront également à la place des vermicelles','["2 nids de nouilles de riz vermicelles","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé","4 cuillères à café de pâte de citronnelle","1 citron vert zesté et pressé, plus des quartiers supplémentaires pour servir (facultatif)","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement tranché","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 carottes moyennes, grossièrement râpées","8 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","500 g de porc haché","200 g de blettes, finement tranchées","2 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Préparez les vermicelles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis réservez. Pendant ce temps, mélangez l''ail, le gingembre, la citronnelle, le zeste de citron vert et le piment. Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites frire le mélange pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir. Répartir les carottes et les oignons nouveaux et faire revenir encore 2 minutes en remuant fréquemment. Versez le hachis de porc et laissez cuire encore 3 minutes, puis ajoutez les blettes et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le porc soit bien cuit.","Arroser de sauce de poisson et de jus de citron vert, puis parsemer de coriandre. Faites cuire le tout pendant 1 min en remuant pour combiner. Versez les nouilles, mélangez bien et servez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:14:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11938,5507,'fr','Faire fondre les oignons du milieu','Impressionnez vos convives avec ces oignons farcis au fromage végétarien. Remplis de mozzarella, de pignons de pin, de chapelure et d''herbes, ils sont pleins de saveur','["8 gros oignons bruns","40g de beurre","70 g de pignons de pin","150 g de chapelure blanche moelleuse","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","5 brins de thym, feuilles cueillies","½ petit bouquet de persil finement haché","1 œuf moyen, battu","100 g de scarmoza (mozzarella fumée) ou mozzarella ordinaire"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Coupez un petit disque au fond de la racine de chaque oignon pour qu''il soit bien droit. Coupez des tranches de 1 cm sur le dessus (elles serviront de couvercles), puis remettez-les sur les oignons. Enveloppez chaque oignon dans du papier d''aluminium, transférez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.","Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle. Versez dans un bol. Ajoutez les pignons de pin dans la poêle et faites-les griller à feu doux pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajouter au beurre avec la chapelure, l''ail, le thym, le persil et l''œuf. Remuer, puis assaisonner.","Coupez le fromage en 8 gros cubes. Lorsque les oignons sont suffisamment froids pour être manipulés, retirez le centre mou en laissant quelques couches d''oignon sur le bord. Hachez finement les centres évidés de 2 oignons et ajoutez-les au mélange de chapelure (réservez le reste pour une autre recette, comme le ragoût). Versez le mélange de chapelure dans les oignons évidés pour qu''ils soient à moitié pleins, puis poussez un morceau de fromage au milieu de chacun et complétez avec plus de mélange de chapelure. Garnir chaque oignon de son « couvercle », puis rôtir pendant 35 à 40 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et que le fromage soit fondu."]','2026-01-11 00:14:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11939,5514,'fr','Porc aigre-doux plus léger','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce favori familial chinois à emporter peut être rendu beaucoup plus sain – réduisez les niveaux de sucre, de graisse et de sel avec cette recette facile.','["225 g de filet de porc","1 carotte (140 g), coupée en lanières d''environ 5 cm de long","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza, plus 2 cuillères à café","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 cuillères à café de gingembre finement haché","3 oignons nouveaux, extrémités parées, coupés en longues tranches diagonales","½ poivron rouge épépiné, coupé en longues lanières fines","200 g de riz à grains longs, cuit","1 blanc d''oeuf","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","1½ cuillère à café de farine autolevante","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja noire","½ cuillère à café d''huile de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz blanc chinois ou de vinaigre de cidre","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de maïzena mélangée à 1 cuillère à café d''eau","175 ml de bouillon de légumes, préparé avec 1,2 cuillère à café de poudre (nous avons utilisé du bouillon de légumes suisse au souci)"]','["Coupez le porc en cubes de 2 à 3 cm. Dans un bol moyen, préparez la pâte. Battez légèrement le blanc d''œuf avec une fourchette jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement mousseux, puis incorporez la poudre aux cinq épices, la maïzena, la farine et une bonne mouture de poivre jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et lisse. Incorporer le porc pour que chaque morceau soit uniformément enrobé, puis réserver.","Maintenant, préparez la sauce. Dans un petit bol, mélanger la sauce soja, l''huile de sésame, le vinaigre, le sucre, la purée de tomates, la maïzena mélangée à l''eau et le bouillon. Assaisonner de poivre et réserver. Blanchir la carotte dans un peu d''eau bouillante pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre mais encore croustillante. Égouttez-les puis passez-les sous l''eau froide pour stopper la cuisson. Égoutter à nouveau et réserver.","Versez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza dans un wok antiadhésif ou une grande poêle. Quand il fait très chaud (testez en y déposant un morceau de viande, il doit immédiatement grésiller), ajoutez le porc. Remuer pour séparer tous les morceaux, puis faire sauter pendant environ 5 minutes à feu moyen-vif jusqu''à ce que la viande ne soit plus rose à l''intérieur une fois coupée et que l''extérieur soit doré et croustillant. Retirer avec une écumoire et réserver.","Versez les 2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza restantes dans le wok et ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre, les oignons nouveaux et le poivre. Faire sauter environ 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer (toujours à feu assez vif). Versez la sauce – elle devrait immédiatement commencer à bouillonner rapidement – ​​et incorporez la carotte. Dès que la sauce a légèrement épaissi, environ 30 secondes à 1 minute, incorporez la viande pour l''enrober et la réchauffer rapidement. Retirez la casserole du feu, assaisonnez avec une pincée de sel et servez aussitôt avec le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:14:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11940,5515,'fr','Rôti de porc aux herbes, rôtis de légumes et sauce aux pommes','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce dîner rôti maigre utilise une cuisse de porc garnie de prosciutto. Servir avec des pommes de terre rôties, des carottes et du céleri-rave, ainsi que beaucoup d''herbes et une sauce aux pommes.','["1¼kg de rôti de cuisse de porc désossé","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","2 cuillères à soupe de thym haché et quelques brins supplémentaires","1 cuillère à café de sauge hachée","80 g de jambon en paquet","4 bonnes pulvérisations d''huile","3 carottes, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur, puis coupées en travers","6 petites pommes de terre (500 g), coupées en deux","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","12 gousses d''ail","1 petit céleri-rave (650g), pelé et coupé en 12 quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","600 ml de bouillon de poulet réduit en sel","1 petite pomme Bramley, coupée en dés","Chou de Milan et petits pois, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Coupez toute la couenne et le gras du porc et jetez-les pour ne laisser qu''un morceau de viande maigre. Tartiner de moutarde, parsemer d''herbes hachées et assaisonner de poivre noir. Placez les tranches de prosciutto sur le porc pour protéger la viande là où le gras a été retiré.","Vaporisez un grand plat à rôtir d''huile et placez le porc au centre. Entourez de tous les légumes, parsemez de brins de thym, puis vaporisez à nouveau et couvrez de papier d''aluminium. Rôtir pendant 1 heure, puis augmenter le feu à 220°C/200°C ventilateur/gaz 7. Découvrir, vaporiser à nouveau et rôtir encore 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce. Mélangez la maïzena avec un peu d''eau pour obtenir une pâte humide, faites chauffer le bouillon dans une poêle, incorporez le mélange de maïzena et faites cuire en remuant jusqu''à épaississement. Ajoutez la pomme et laissez cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie mais conserve sa forme.","Retirez la viande du moule et versez le jus du moule dans la sauce. Arrosez les légumes d''huile et faites-les rôtir encore 20 minutes (pendant que la viande repose) pour les faire dorer. Servir le porc avec les légumes rôtis et frais et le jus de pommes."]','2026-01-11 00:14:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11941,5517,'fr','Curry de poisson plus léger du sud de l''Inde','Utilisez du lait de coco allégé et des filets de poisson blanc pour préparer un curry faible en gras et en calories qui reste luxueusement crémeux.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 oignon moyen, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur et tranché finement en quartiers","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement haché (morceau d''environ 2½ cm/1 po)","12 feuilles de curry séchées","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","2 petits piments verts, coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur, épépinés (ou laissez quelques graines si vous voulez un peu de piquant)","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de garam masala","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma","400 g de lait de coco allégé en boîte","¼ cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu","500 g de filets de poisson blanc, fermes et sans peau, comme la morue ou l''aiglefin","100 g de haricots verts fins, parés et coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur","1 mangue mûre","une généreuse poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement, feuilles seulement","200 g de riz basmati cuit pour servir","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou une sauteuse antiadhésive. Ajoutez les graines de cumin et faites frire pendant 1 min, puis ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre et faites revenir encore 1 min. Incorporer les feuilles de curry et les graines de moutarde et faire revenir environ\r\n3-4 minutes à feu moyen, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les oignons brunissent. Incorporer les piments, la coriandre, le garam masala et le curcuma et faire revenir pendant 30 secondes.","Incorporez le lait de coco dans la boîte, puis versez-en la moitié dans la casserole. Il devrait commencer à bouillonner et à épaissir, alors laissez-le mijoter jusqu''à ce qu''il soit assez épais, environ 3 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps. Versez le reste du lait de coco, ajoutez le poivre et une pincée de sel et baissez le feu.","Posez le poisson dans le lait de coco et appuyez dessus pour le submerger à moitié. Couvrez la poêle et laissez mijoter doucement pendant 4 à 5 minutes (selon l''épaisseur de vos filets) jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit presque cuit. Ne remuez pas, sinon le poisson se brisera – versez simplement un peu de sauce sur le poisson à mi-cuisson, puis retirez la casserole du feu et laissez le poisson reposer encore 3 à 4 minutes pour terminer la cuisson lentement. Une fois terminé, il doit être ferme et ne plus être opaque. Si vous souhaitez une sauce plus fine, versez une cuillerée ou deux d’eau.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les haricots verts à la vapeur pendant environ 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres. Dénoyautez la mangue et coupez la chair en fins quartiers (voir astuce en bas à gauche), puis répartissez-la sur le poisson pour la réchauffer.","Pour servir, cassez le poisson en gros morceaux en le retirant dans des bols de service à l''aide d''une écumoire, puis versez la sauce dessus et autour. Servir avec les haricots, une pincée de coriandre et le riz, avec des quartiers de citron vert à côté pour les presser."]','2026-01-11 00:14:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11942,5519,'fr','Soupe à l''ail des ours et aux orties','Recherchez des légumes verts frais du printemps et laissez mijoter avec des légumes finement coupés pour préparer cette soupe verte vibrante, saine et faible en gras.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour arroser","25g de beurre","1 oignon, finement coupé","1 poireau, coupé en petits dés","2 branches de céleri, tranchées finement","1 carotte, coupée en petits dés","1 petite pomme de terre, pelée et coupée en dés","1,2 l de bouillon de légumes de bonne qualité","300 g de jeunes feuilles d''ortie","200 g de feuilles d''ail des ours (conservez les fleurs si vous en avez)","3 cuillères à soupe de lait"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile et le beurre dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez l''oignon, le poireau, le céleri, la carotte, la pomme de terre et une bonne pincée de sel, et remuez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien enrobé. Couvrir et faire suer doucement pendant 15 à 20 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps pour être sûr que les légumes n''accrochent pas au fond de la casserole.","Versez le bouillon et laissez mijoter 10 minutes. Ajoutez les orties en plusieurs fois en remuant, puis ajoutez les feuilles d''ail des ours et laissez mijoter 2 minutes.","Retirer du feu et mixer à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant ou verser dans un mixeur. Remettre sur le feu et incorporer le lait, puis goûter pour l''assaisonnement. Versez dans des bols et arrosez d''un peu d''huile supplémentaire, puis garnissez de quelques fleurs d''ail sauvage, si vous en avez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11943,5521,'fr','Salade de radis, lentilles et menthe','Une combinaison d''ingrédients aigre-doux et de noisette rehausse les différentes variétés de beaux radis dans cette recette','["50 g de morceaux de noix","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, tranché","1 cuillère à café de mélasse noire","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","petit paquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées à moitié","Boîte de 400 g de lentilles vertes égouttées et rincées","½ concombre, haché","300 g de radis, certains laissés entiers, d''autres tranchés et hachés (essayez d''utiliser un mélange de variétés, comme les radis mooli et viande rouge – voir astuce)"]','["Faire griller les morceaux de noix dans une grande poêle à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés et commencent tout juste à carboniser sur les bords. Versez dans un bol et réservez.","Dans la même poêle, baissez le feu à doux et ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive. Ajoutez l''oignon, faites-le revenir doucement pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre, puis retirez la poêle du feu. Ajoutez la mélasse noire, le vinaigre de Xérès et le reste de l''huile d''olive, puis mélangez et laissez refroidir. Ajouter la menthe hachée dans la poêle et bien assaisonner.","Dans un grand bol, mélanger les lentilles, le concombre et la moitié des radis, puis verser sur la vinaigrette à l''oignon et à la menthe refroidie. Mélangez le tout et déposez-le sur un plat de service. Répartir sur les morceaux de noix et le reste de menthe et de radis, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11944,5523,'fr','Canard rouge thaï avec riz gluant à l''ananas','Faites mariner les magrets de canard avec de la pâte de curry rouge et du citron vert, puis servez-les avec du riz à la noix de coco, des petits pois et des germes de soja pour un dîner sain en semaine.','["2 magrets de canard, la peau retirée et jetée","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert, plus des quartiers supplémentaires pour servir","140g de riz au jasmin","125 ml de lait de coco léger, en boîte","140 g de petits pois surgelés","50 g de germes de soja","½ oignon rouge, coupé en dés","100 g d''ananas frais, coupés en cubes","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","¼ petit paquet de coriandre, tiges finement hachées, feuilles grossièrement hachées"]','["Disposez un magret de canard entre 2 feuilles de film alimentaire sur une planche à découper. Utilisez un rouleau à pâtisserie pour écraser le canard jusqu''à ce qu''il atteigne 0,5 cm d''épaisseur. Répétez avec l''autre magret, puis mettez-les tous les deux dans un plat. Mélangez la pâte de curry avec le zeste et le jus de citron vert et frottez-en partout sur le canard. Laisser mariner à température ambiante pendant 20 min.","Pendant ce temps, versez le riz dans une petite casserole avec un peu de sel. Versez dessus le lait de coco avec 150 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition, puis couvrez la casserole, baissez le feu et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Incorporez les petits pois, puis couvrez, éteignez le feu et laissez reposer encore 10 minutes. Vérifiez le riz : tout le liquide doit être absorbé et le riz doit être bien cuit. Faites bouillir la bouilloire, mettez les germes de soja et l''oignon rouge dans une passoire et versez dessus une bouilloire d''eau bouillante. Incorporez les germes de soja et l''oignon au riz avec les tiges d''ananas, de piment et de coriandre, et un peu plus de sel si nécessaire, et remettez le couvercle pour garder au chaud.","Faites chauffer une poêle et faites cuire le canard 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût. Tranchez le canard, remuez la plupart des feuilles de coriandre dans le riz avec une fourchette pour faire gonfler et servez avec le canard, parsemé du reste de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:14:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11945,5525,'fr','Gratins de poissons méditerranéens','Ces portions individuelles de poisson à la sauce tomate, garnies de chapelure aux herbes, se congèlent à merveille – parfaites pour recevoir sans chichi.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, tranché finement","1 bulbe de fenouil (environ 250 g/9 oz), paré et tranché finement","3 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 cuillère à café bombée de graines de coriandre, légèrement écrasées","150 ml de vin blanc","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées aux herbes","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","une bonne pincée de safran","1 feuille de laurier","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron frais","1 petit bouquet de persil plat, feuilles grossièrement hachées","900 g de filets de poisson mélangés sans peau (comme vous le souhaitez) coupés en morceaux","350 g de gambas crues décortiquées","75 g de parmesan finement râpé","50 g de panko ou de chapelure grossièrement séchée","salade verte, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole antiadhésive ou une sauteuse et faites revenir doucement l''oignon, le fenouil, l''ail et les graines de coriandre pendant 15 minutes en remuant régulièrement jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient ramollis et légèrement colorés. Versez le vin dans la poêle et ajoutez les tomates, le concentré de tomates, le safran et le laurier. Assaisonner et porter à légère ébullition. Cuire environ 15 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à épaississement.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Incorporer le jus de citron et la majeure partie du persil au mélange de tomates, mettre les morceaux de poisson cru et les crevettes dessus et bien mélanger. Couvrir hermétiquement avec un couvercle et laisser mijoter doucement à feu moyen pendant 4 à 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit presque cuit. Remuez plusieurs fois pendant la cuisson du poisson, en prenant soin de ne pas le laisser se briser.","Versez le mélange chaud de tomates et de poisson dans 6 plats à tarte individuels – ils devront chacun contenir environ 350 ml. Mélangez le fromage, la chapelure, le reste du persil et un peu de poivre noir moulu et saupoudrez le dessus. Cuire au four sur une plaque à pâtisserie pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les tartes soient dorées et bouillonnantes. Servir avec une salade verte, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11946,5527,'fr','Ragoût de poisson à l''ail rôti et au safran','Essayez cette version plus simple et plus légère de la bouillabaisse, une soupe de poisson classique – servez-la avec des tranches de baguette grillées pour éponger la sauce à base de tomates.','["3 têtes d''ail entières","150 ml de bonne huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","quelques bonnes pincées de sel marin feuilleté","50 ml de Pernod","une bonne pincée de brins de safran","1 bulbe de fenouil","4 branches de céleri","1 oignon","1 piment rouge, les graines laissées dedans","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 gousses d''ail","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de fenouil","pincée de safran","2 feuilles de laurier","50 ml de Pernod","200 ml de vin blanc","750 ml en purée","3 filets de mulet gris (environ 500 g au total), avec la peau, coupés en gros morceaux","300 g de filets de grondin, avec la peau, coupés en gros morceaux","200 g de calamars et tentacules préparés, nettoyés et coupés en rondelles","jus d''1 citron","4 cuillères à soupe de persil plat haché, plus un peu pour servir","tranches de baguette grillées, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 160C/140C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Pour faire la pâte de safran et d''ail, coupez les têtes d''ail entières en deux horizontalement. Placez les têtes d''ail, côté coupé vers le haut, sur une petite plaque à pâtisserie. Arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive et assaisonner de sel. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Retirez le papier d''aluminium et remettez au four pendant encore 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''ail soit doré.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la base de soupe. Coupez le fenouil, le céleri et l''oignon en petits dés et tranchez finement le piment rouge. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole et ajoutez les légumes hachés. Râpez l''ail dans la poêle et ajoutez les graines de fenouil. Bien mélanger, puis couvrir et faire suer 10 min. Ajoutez le safran et les feuilles de laurier et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à ramollir. Versez le Pernod et le vin, portez à ébullition, puis ajoutez la passata et 400 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu pour laisser mijoter. Couvrez et laissez cuire 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que tous les arômes commencent à s''associer, puis retirez la casserole du feu et laissez refroidir un peu.","Transférez la soupe dans un bol mixeur et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis passez-la au tamis fin dans une casserole propre – vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots. Si la soupe a besoin d’épaissir, faites la réduire à feu moyen. Lorsqu''elle a la consistance d''une crème versée, retirer du feu et réserver, ou laisser refroidir et réfrigérer au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. La base de la soupe peut être préparée 3 jours à l’avance.","Pendant ce temps, pour la pâte, versez le Pernod dans une petite casserole et ajoutez le safran. Portez à ébullition, ajoutez l''huile d''olive et faites chauffer doucement. Retirez du feu et laissez refroidir.","Lorsque l''ail est doré, retirez la plaque du four et pressez les gousses dans le bol d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Ajoutez une grosse pincée de sel de mer feuilleté et réduisez-la en une pâte. Ajoutez lentement l''huile d''olive infusée au safran en remuant constamment. Transférer dans un récipient propre et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Portez la base de soupe à ébullition dans une grande casserole, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter légèrement et goûtez l''assaisonnement. Ajoutez les morceaux de poisson et les calamars préparés et pochez délicatement le poisson dans la soupe pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste cuit. Retirer du feu et incorporer le jus de citron et le persil. Versez la soupe dans des bols en empilant le poisson au centre. Verser la pâte de safran et d’ail et saupoudrer d’un peu plus de persil. Servir avec des tranches de baguette grillées et le supplément de pâte de safran et d''ail en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:14:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11947,5529,'fr','Jalfrezi aux crevettes','Comblez votre envie de curry de manière saine avec ce plat indien de crevettes : mélangez les oignons et les épices dans une sauce authentique, épaisse et faible en gras.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","2 oignons moyens, hachés","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché finement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","¼ cuillère à café de flocons de piment (ou moins si vous ne l''aimez pas trop épicé)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","un filet de miel clair","1 gros poivron vert, coupé en deux, épépiné et haché","petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges et feuilles séparées, hachées","140 g de grosses crevettes tigrées cuites et décortiquées","Sachet de 250 g de riz brun cuit","yaourt à la menthe ou chutney, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir les oignons, le gingembre et l''ail pendant 8 à 10 minutes, en remuant fréquemment, jusqu''à ce qu''ils ramollissent et commencent à colorer. Ajoutez les épices et les flocons de piment, remuez brièvement, puis versez les tomates avec une demi-boîte d''eau et le miel. Mixez le tout dans la poêle avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque lisse (ou utilisez un robot culinaire). Incorporez les tiges de poivre et de coriandre, couvrez la poêle et laissez mijoter 10 min. (Le mélange sera très épais et crépitera un peu, alors remuez fréquemment.)","Incorporez les crevettes et parsemez-les de feuilles de coriandre. Faites chauffer le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Servir les deux avec un yaourt à la menthe ou un chutney, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11948,5531,'fr','Poisson rôti entier farci au fenouil','Ce plat de poisson rôti a été inspiré par la Sicile, où les épices aromatiques et les fruits secs de la cuisine arabe se rencontrent avec le poisson frais et les légumes de la Méditerranée.','["2 bulbes de fenouil, coupés en deux et finement tranchés","1 gros oignon, coupé en deux et finement tranché","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu pour arroser","2 citrons, 1 zesté puis pressé, 1 coupé en quartiers","200 g de couscous","pincée de fils de safran","250 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes","2 poissons entiers plus gros ou 4 plus petits, nettoyés et écaillés (nous avons utilisé du bar d''Anglesey)","petit paquet d''aneth, finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin grillés","250 g de petites tomates italiennes, coupées en deux","1 cuillère à soupe de groseilles"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettez le fenouil et l''oignon dans un grand plat à rôtir et mélangez avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile, 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron et beaucoup d''assaisonnement. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque tendre et commence à caraméliser. Pendant ce temps, mettez le couscous dans un bol moyen. Mélangez le safran et le bouillon chaud, versez sur le couscous et couvrez de film alimentaire.","Rincez le poisson à l''eau froide à l''intérieur et à l''extérieur, puis séchez-le. Coupez profondément des deux côtés et assaisonnez avec du sel, du poivre et une pincée de zeste de citron. Après 10 minutes de trempage, gonflez le couscous à la fourchette et ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron, le reste du zeste, l''aneth, 1 cuillère à soupe de pignons de pin et l''assaisonnement au goût. Farcir le couscous dans la cavité de chaque poisson, en réservant les restes de couscous pour plus tard.","Incorporer les tomates et les groseilles dans le moule. Posez le poisson dessus et faites-le rôtir environ 30 minutes, selon sa taille. Recherchez le jus qui coule des entailles dans la chair. Tirez doucement sur la nageoire arrière : si elle se détache facilement, le poisson est cuit.","4 Parsemez avec le reste des pignons de pin, puis servez dans le moule, avec des quartiers de citron à presser dessus. Servez un poisson farci par personne, ou si vous avez cuit de gros poissons, soulevez d''abord délicatement les filets du dessus du poisson, puis retournez-les et répétez. Partagez la farce au couscous et les restes de couscous."]','2026-01-11 00:14:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11949,5535,'fr','Bar en papillote aux saveurs thaïlandaises','Préparez un paquet de papier sulfurisé et laissez votre poisson cuire à la perfection en l''infusant d''ail, de gingembre, de piment et de citron vert.','["2 petits bars écaillés et éviscérés","12 pommes de terre nouvelles, nettoyées","petite noisette de beurre salé","feuilles de coriandre, pour servir","2 tiges de citronnelle","100 g de gingembre frais en morceaux","3 gousses d''ail","3 petits piments rouges finement hachés","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert, plus des quartiers supplémentaires pour servir, si vous le souhaitez"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160° ventilateur/gaz 4. Pour\r\npréparer le mélange de farce, écraser le\r\ncitronnelle avec le côté franc de votre\r\ncouteau pour le meurtrir, puis coupez-le en fines\r\nanneaux. Tranchez finement le gingembre (en travers du\r\ngrain) – vous pouvez laisser la peau.\r\nÉcrasez les gousses d''ail non pelées pour\r\nlibèrent leur arôme. Mettez toute la farce\r\ningrédients dans un bol et mélanger.","Prenez un morceau de papier sulfurisé d''environ\r\n50cm de longueur et placez les 2 bars\r\nsur toute sa largeur. Remplissez les cavités de l''estomac\r\navec ¾ du mélange de farce, en saupoudrant\r\nle reste sur le poisson, puis assaisonner. Plier\r\nles côtés du parchemin sur le\r\ntêtes et queues du poisson, puis roulez-le dans\r\nun colis. Ceci peut maintenant être stocké dans le\r\nréfrigérateur pendant quelques heures, si vous le souhaitez. Quand\r\nprêt à cuire, déposer sur une plaque au four\r\net cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la chair\r\ns''écaille de l''os.","Pendant que le poisson cuit, mettez le nouveau\r\npommes de terre dans l''eau froide et porter au\r\nfaire bouillir. Une fois cuit, bien égoutter, couper en deux\r\net remettez dans la poêle avec une noix de beurre.","Disposer les pommes de terre nouvelles et le bar\r\ndans l''assiette, toujours dans le colis, si vous préférez,\r\net parsemé de feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:14:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11950,5537,'fr','Steak teriyaki avec salade de fenouil','Ce savoureux plat de style asiatique est faible en gras et facile à préparer','["2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja réduite en sel","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à café de miel clair","4 faux-filet ou rumsteck, débarrassés de tout gras visible, d''environ 125 g chacun","1 grosse carotte, râpée grossièrement","1 bulbe de fenouil, coupé en deux et tranché finement","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et émincé","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre","jus 1 citron vert"]','["Mélangez le soja, le vinaigre et le miel, ajoutez\r\nles steaks, puis laisser mariner 10 à 15 minutes.","Mélanger la carotte, le fenouil, l''oignon\r\net la coriandre, puis réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir.","Cuire les steaks dans une poêle à frire pendant\r\nquelques minutes de chaque côté, selon le\r\népaisseur et à quel point vous aimez la cuisson\r\neux. Réserver la viande pour qu''elle repose sur un\r\nassiette, puis ajouter le reste de la marinade\r\nà la poêle. Faites bouillir la marinade jusqu''à ce qu''elle\r\nréduit un peu pour faire une sauce collante.","Assaisonnez la salade avec le jus de citron vert,\r\npuis empiler sur des assiettes et servir avec le\r\ndes steaks. Verser la sauce sur la viande."]','2026-01-11 00:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11951,5539,'fr','Tarte aux abricots et framboises','Délicieuse servie chaude ou froide, cette tarte utilise de la pâte filo pour réduire les calories','["3 grandes feuilles de pâte filo (ou 6 petites)","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre fondu","3 cuillères à soupe de confiture d''abricots","6 abricots mûrs, dénoyautés et tranchés grossièrement","85g de framboises","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre"]','["Laissez le filo revenir à température ambiante\r\npendant environ 10 minutes avant utilisation. Mettez un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie dans le four et chauffer le four\r\nà 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Badigeonner chaque grande feuille de filo avec\r\nbeurre fondu, superposer les uns sur les autres,\r\npuis pliez en deux pour avoir un plus petit\r\nrectangle de 6 couches d''épaisseur. Si vous utilisez un petit\r\nles feuilles s’empilent simplement les unes sur les autres.\r\nReplier les bords du fond de pâte pour\r\nfaire une bordure de 2 cm, puis étaler le\r\nconserve d''abricots à l''intérieur de la bordure.\r\nGlissez délicatement le fond de pâte sur\r\nla plaque à pâtisserie chaude et enfournez pendant 5 minutes.","Retirer du four, disposer les abricots\r\nsur la tarte et badigeonner avec les restes\r\nbeurre fondu. Cuire encore 10 minutes,\r\npuis parsemer de framboises et saupoudrer\r\navec du sucre. Cuire au four encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla pâte est dorée et croustillante."]','2026-01-11 00:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11952,5541,'fr','Pots de mousse au chocolat et aux baies','Le dessert n''a pas besoin d''être diabolique, comme le prouve ce pud bon pour la santé.','["75g de chocolat noir 70% râpé","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt allégé","2 gros blancs d''œufs","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","350 g de baies (essayez les myrtilles, les framboises, les cerises ou un mélange)"]','["Faire fondre le chocolat dans un récipient résistant à la chaleur\r\nbol sur une casserole de cuisson\r\nl''eau, en s''assurant que le bol\r\nne touche pas directement l’eau.\r\nUne fois fondu, laissez-le refroidir pendant\r\n5 à 10 minutes, puis incorporez le yaourt.","Battre les blancs d''œufs en neige ferme,\r\npuis incorporer le sucre et battre\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit à nouveau raide. Pliez les blancs en\r\nle mélange de chocolat – desserrez le\r\nmélanger d''abord avec une cuillerée d''oeuf\r\nblanc, puis incorporez délicatement le reste,\r\nen gardant le plus d''air possible.","Mettez les baies dans des petits verres\r\nou des ramequins, puis répartissez la mousse\r\nen haut. Réfrigérer au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris."]','2026-01-11 00:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11953,5543,'fr','Tarte au poisson avec garniture de rutabagas et de pommes de terre','Faire une tourte au poisson peut être une palabre – pas celle-ci ! D''une simplicité rassurante et prêt en un peu plus d''une heure','["500 g de pommes de terre farineuses coupées en morceaux","1 rutabaga moyen (pesant environ 600 g/1 lb 5 oz), coupé en morceaux","Pot de 200 g de fromage à pâte molle allégé à l''ail et aux herbes","150 ml de bouillon de légumes","4 cuillères à café de farine de maïs, mélangées à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide","650 g de cabillaud sans peau et désossé, coupé en gros morceaux","100 g de crevettes cuites décortiquées","1 cuillère à café de persil frais haché"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre et les rutabagas dans l''eau bouillante jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres (environ 20 minutes).","Préchauffer le four à 190°C/gaz 5/ventilateur 170°C. Pendant que les pommes de terre et le rutabaga cuisent, mettez le fromage à pâte molle et le bouillon dans une grande casserole et faites chauffer doucement, en remuant avec une cuillère en bois, jusqu''à consistance homogène et lisse. Ajoutez maintenant la farine de maïs mélangée et faites cuire jusqu''à épaississement.","Incorporer le poisson à la sauce avec les crevettes et le persil. Assaisonner avec un peu de poivre.","Versez le mélange dans un plat allant au four de 1,5 litre/2¾ pinte. Égouttez les pommes de terre et le rutabaga, écrasez-les bien et assaisonnez de poivre noir. Versez la purée sur le poisson pour le recouvrir complètement. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud, puis transférer sur un gril chaud pendant quelques minutes pour dorer le dessus. Servir avec des petits pois surgelés ou du maïs doux."]','2026-01-11 00:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11954,5545,'fr','Salade de haricots verts à la menthe','Seulement 5 ingrédients dans cette salade végétalienne estivale – vous pouvez également la préparer un jour à l’avance','["600 g de haricots verts parés","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","3 cuillères à soupe de menthe fraîche hachée"]','["Faites cuire les haricots dans de l''eau bouillante salée pendant 5 à 6 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres, puis égouttez-les et rafraîchissez-les sous l''eau froide courante. Bien agiter pour éliminer l''excès d''eau, puis sécher avec du papier absorbant. Vous pouvez le faire la veille et conserver les haricots cuits au réfrigérateur, dans un bol recouvert de film alimentaire.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une petite poêle, ajoutez l''ail et faites-le revenir rapidement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant et légèrement doré. Versez dans un bol avec l’huile de la poêle et laissez refroidir. Cela peut être fait la veille, recouvert d''un film alimentaire et réfrigéré.","Le jour même, fouettez ensemble le reste de l’huile, le vinaigre, la menthe, le sel et le poivre. Versez sur les haricots et mélangez bien. Verser dans un bol de service et répartir sur l''ail dans son huile."]','2026-01-11 00:14:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11955,5549,'fr','Le relooking ultime : la pomme de terre dauphinoise','Crème fraîche, bouillon et lait demi-écrémé remplacent les ingrédients traditionnels pour en faire la Dauphinoise la plus saine à ce jour.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","150 ml de lait demi-écrémé","1 gousse d''ail dodue, pelée et coupée en deux","4 brins de thym, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 feuille de laurier","1 échalote, hachée grossièrement","une bonne pincée de muscade fraîchement râpée","1 kg de pommes de terre à chair ferme (essayez Désirée)","140 g de crème fraîche entière","75 ml de bouillon de légumes (bouillon de souci)","1 cuillère à café de feuilles de thym","25g de Gruyère ou alternative végétarienne, râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nBadigeonner l''huile sur le fond et les côtés\r\nd''un plat allant au four de 25 x 19 x 5 cm. Mettre\r\nle lait, l''ail, 4 brins de thym, le laurier\r\nfeuille et échalote dans une casserole. Apportez\r\njuste à ébullition, puis retirer du feu\r\nchauffer et ajouter la muscade et un peu\r\npoivre. Réserver pour infuser.","Épluchez puis coupez les pommes de terre en tranches très fines.\r\nSéchez-les. Disposez la moitié des tranches dans le\r\nplat en les chevauchant légèrement, puis assaisonner.","Filtrez le lait infusé dans un pichet. Mettre\r\nla crème fraîche dans un bol, puis\r\nverser progressivement le lait en fouettant jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse. Ajoutez le bouillon et les feuilles de thym.\r\nRemettez ce liquide dans le pichet, puis versez\r\nla moitié sur les pommes de terre dans le plat.\r\nSuperposez le reste des pommes de terre, puis\r\najouter le reste du liquide, le fromage et un\r\nmoudre du poivre. Posez le plat sur une plaque allant au four\r\nplaque et cuire au four pendant 1¼-1½ heures jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées\r\net tendre – testez en insérant un objet pointu\r\ncouteau à travers les pommes de terre. Laisser reposer 5 minutes\r\navant de servir, parsemé de brins de thym."]','2026-01-11 00:14:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11956,5551,'fr','Soupe aux pois et à la menthe','Une entrée ou une collation super saine, délicieuse chaude ou froide','["1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, parés et hachés grossièrement","1 pomme de terre moyenne, pelée et coupée en dés","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","850 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet","900 g de jeunes pois dans la cosse (pour donner environ 250 g de petits pois écossés)","4 cuillères à soupe de menthe fraîche hachée","une grosse pincée de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron ou de lime frais","150 ml de babeurre ou de crème sure"]','["Mettez les oignons nouveaux dans une grande poêle avec la pomme de terre, l''ail et le bouillon. Porter à ébullition, baisser le feu et laisser mijoter 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pomme de terre soit très tendre. Pour la garniture, blanchissez 3 cuillères à soupe de\r\nles pois écossés dans l''eau bouillante pendant\r\n2-3 minutes, égouttez, mettez dans un bol d''eau froide et réservez. Ajouter les petits pois restants à la base de soupe et laisser mijoter pendant\r\n5 minutes – pas plus, sinon vous perdrez la délicieuse saveur fraîche des petits pois.","Incorporer la menthe, le sucre et le jus de citron ou de lime, laisser refroidir légèrement puis verser dans un robot culinaire ou un mixeur et fouetter jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse comme vous le souhaitez. Incorporer la moitié du babeurre ou de la crème sure, goûter et assaisonner de sel et de poivre.","Pour servir la soupe froide, laissez-la refroidir rapidement, puis réfrigérez-vous devrez peut-être ajouter plus de bouillon à la soupe avant de la servir, car elle épaissira en refroidissant. Pour servir chaud, remettez la soupe dans la casserole rincée et réchauffez-la sans la faire bouillir (pour éviter que le babeurre ou la crème aigre ne caille).","Servir la soupe dans des bols, garnie du reste de babeurre et des petits pois égouttés."]','2026-01-11 00:14:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11957,5553,'fr','Pâtes au thon saines','Essayez nos pâtes au thon saines, rapides et faciles. C''est réconfortant, mais il contient également trois de vos cinq par jour et peut être doublé pour nourrir une famille.','["150 g de pennes complètes","1 gros poireau (200 g), coupé en deux et émincé","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","160 g de tomates cerises sur vigne de préférence","Boîte de 198 g de maïs doux égoutté","75 g de gazon","Boîte de 160 g de thon à l''eau de source égoutté","une poignée de basilic haché et quelques feuilles entières pour servir"]','["Faire bouillir les penne avec le poireau dans une grande casserole d''eau salée en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir les tomates pendant quelques minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à éclater et à ramollir. Ajoutez le maïs doux et laissez cuire 2-3 minutes pour bien réchauffer. Égoutter les pâtes et les poireaux en réservant un peu d''eau des pâtes. Versez les pâtes et les poireaux égouttés dans la poêle avec les tomates, puis mélangez la ricotta et le thon.","Assaisonner avec beaucoup de poivre noir. Si vous souhaitez adoucir la consistance, ajoutez un peu de l''eau réservée aux pâtes avec le basilic haché. Servir parsemé de feuilles de basilic entières."]','2026-01-11 00:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11958,5555,'fr','Hot-dogs aux bâtonnets de poisson','Une version revisitée d''un sandwich aux bâtonnets de poisson classique que toute la famille adorera. Essayez l’astuce de Paul AInsworth qui consiste à saler légèrement la morue pour la raffermir avant la cuisson – cela change la donne','["300 à 400 g de goberge ou de cabillaud sans peau et désossés, coupés en 4 gros bâtonnets de poisson","25g de farine nature","1 œuf battu","100 g de chapelure panko","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","1 cornichon, finement haché","4 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron et des quartiers de citron, pour servir","4 petits pains briochés à hot dog","½ laitue iceberg, râpée"]','["Si vous avez le temps, assaisonnez légèrement le poisson avec des flocons de sel marin jusqu''à une heure avant de l''enrober, puis couvrez et réfrigérez pour le raffermir. Mettez la farine mélangée avec un peu de sel et de poivre dans un bol peu profond, puis l''œuf battu et la chapelure dans deux autres bols. En travaillant par lots, enduisez d''abord le poisson dans la farine assaisonnée, puis secouez l''excédent et trempez-le dans l''œuf, suivi de la chapelure, puis placez les bâtonnets de poisson enrobés dans une assiette. Peut être préparé la veille et conservé au frais toute la nuit.","Versez suffisamment d''huile dans une grande poêle pour qu''elle recouvre le fond. Faites chauffer l''huile à feu moyen-vif, puis faites frire les bâtonnets de poisson par lots jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés de chaque côté et bien cuits (environ 3-4 minutes de chaque côté). Égoutter sur du papier absorbant, assaisonner de sel marin, puis transférer à four doux pour garder au chaud pendant que vous préparez la sauce.","Mettez les cornichons dans un bol et mélangez-les avec la mayonnaise et le jus de citron. Divisez les pains à hot-dog, faites griller le côté coupé sous le gril, puis tartinez chaque rouleau avec 1 cuillère à soupe du mélange de mayonnaise, ajoutez une poignée de laitue, puis un doigt de poisson chaud dessus. Servir avec les quartiers de citron à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11959,5557,'fr','Thon poêlé & asperges niçoise','Procurez-vous du thon chez un poissonnier de bonne qualité pour préparer cette superbe salade niçoise de thon poêlé et d''asperges. Il doit être de qualité sashimi et peut donc être consommé cru en toute sécurité.','["300 g de petites pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux","250g d''asperges","3 œufs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","200 g de longe de thon épaisse de qualité sashimi ou 2 steaks de thon","3 grosses tomates, coupées en quartiers","50 g d''olives Kalamata dénoyautées, coupées en deux","10 baies de câpres","5 filets d''anchois","½ petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","70 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","½ citron, jus"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 12 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un couteau puisse être facilement inséré. Transférer dans un bol à l''aide d''une écumoire et laisser sécher à la vapeur. Ajoutez les asperges dans la poêle et faites bouillir pendant 2 minutes, puis mettez-les dans un bol d''eau glacée et réservez.","Portez à ébullition une autre casserole d''eau à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire les œufs pendant 7½ minutes. Égoutter, puis ajouter les œufs dans le bol d''eau avec les asperges.","Pour la vinaigrette, écrasez les anchois et l''ail ensemble à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier jusqu''à obtenir une pâte bien lisse. Versez-le dans un bol, puis ajoutez l''huile d''olive extra vierge et le jus de citron. Saison.","Pour saisir le thon, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''il prenne une couleur légèrement dorée. Coupez-le en morceaux épais (il doit être encore rose au milieu), puis épluchez-le et coupez-le en deux.","Mélanger les pommes de terre, les asperges, les tomates, les olives, les câpres et la vinaigrette sur un grand plat de service. Garnir des œufs et des tranches de thon, puis bien assaisonner et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11960,5563,'fr','Dauphinoise d''aiglefin fumé','Ajoutez de l''aiglefin fumé à la dauphinoise pour obtenir une tarte au poisson plus facile à congeler. C''est un excellent dîner sans tracas lorsque vous recevez de la famille ou des amis.','["1 kg de pommes de terre Maris Piper ou King Edward, pelées et tranchées le plus finement possible","300 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à café de feuilles de thym, plus un peu pour servir","25 g de parmesan finement râpé","300 g d''aiglefin fumé sans peau, coupé en fins morceaux","petite noix de beurre, pour le plat","cresson, pour servir"]','["Mettez les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau froide salée et portez à ébullition, puis éteignez le feu. Bien égoutter. Remettez les pommes de terre dans la poêle et versez dessus la crème, puis ajoutez le thym, les deux tiers du parmesan et l''aiglefin. Assaisonnez et mélangez délicatement le tout.","Beurrer un plat à gratin de taille moyenne, puis y verser le mélange de pommes de terre. Parsemer du reste de parmesan. Se conserve couvert et réfrigéré pendant une journée ou congelé pendant trois mois. Décongeler complètement avant la cuisson.","Chauffer le four à 190C/170C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Cuire au four pendant 30-35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bouillonnant sur les bords. Laisser refroidir au moins 5 minutes, puis servir directement du plat avec une salade de cresson habillée en accompagnement, si vous le souhaitez. Saupoudrer d''un peu de thym supplémentaire et broyer avec un peu de poivre noir pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11961,5565,'fr','Tarte au poisson harissa','Ajoutez de la harissa à la tarte au poisson et garnissez de patate douce pour une variante d''un classique. Nutritionnellement équilibré et rassasiant, il est idéal pour un repas en famille','["700 g de patates douces (3-4 petites ou 2 grosses)","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","pincée de cumin","pincée de paprika fumé","1 oignon, finement haché","1 poivron rouge, finement haché","350 ml de lait demi-écrémé","350 g de préparation pour tarte au poisson (assurez-vous qu''elle contient du haddock fumé)","225 g de gambas surgelées, décongelées","2½ cuillères à soupe de pâte d''harissa","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","30 ml de crème double","200 g d''épinards hachés grossièrement","haricots verts cuits à la vapeur, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Piquer les patates douces avec une fourchette et cuire 50 min-1 h ou jusqu''à ce que la chair soit tendre (ou au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 5-7 min). Retirez la peau et écrasez la chair avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile, le cumin et le paprika. Réserver et réserver au chaud.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une poêle avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile restante et faites revenir les oignons et les poivrons à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, environ 7 minutes. Faites chauffer le lait dans une casserole à feu doux-moyen et ajoutez le mélange pour tarte au poisson et les crevettes. Cuire 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les crevettes soient à peine roses, puis retirer le poisson et les crevettes. Réservez le lait.","Ajoutez la pâte d''harissa aux oignons et aux poivrons et laissez cuire 2 min. Incorporez la maïzena, puis ajoutez petit à petit le lait réservé en remuant au fur et à mesure, puis la crème. Ajoutez les épinards et laissez cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils ramollissent, puis ajoutez le poisson et les crevettes en remuant soigneusement pour éviter de les briser.","Versez le mélange de poisson dans un plat allant au four d''environ 25 x 18 cm. Versez délicatement la patate douce dessus, en allant d''un bout à l''autre et en se rejoignant au milieu. Étalez délicatement avec un couteau, puis passez dessus avec une fourchette pour faire des crêtes. Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, puis griller pendant 10 minutes au réglage le plus chaud. Servir avec les haricots verts."]','2026-01-11 00:14:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11962,5567,'fr','Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.','Préparez notre cabillaud au four avec de l''orzo, de la crème de champignons et des poireaux en seulement 20 minutes. C''est un souper ultra rapide – une excellente option pour les journées de travail chargées','["3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","4 cod loin fillets","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 citron, zesté et tranché","½ petit bouquet de thym","2 poireaux, tranchés","200 g de champignons tranchés","300 g d''orzo","500 ml de bouillon faible en sel","2 tbsp crème fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Versez la farine dans un bol et assaisonnez. Trempez chaque filet de morue dans la farine jusqu''à ce qu''il soit uniformément enrobé. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir la morue de chaque côté pendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée. Transférer dans un plat à rôtir avec les tranches de citron dessus et nichées dans la moitié du thym. Enfourner 10 mn.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir les poireaux et les champignons pendant 5 minutes à feu moyen-vif. Ajouter l''orzo et le bouillon et cuire 10 minutes à feu vif en remuant continuellement jusqu''à tendreté. Incorporer la crème fraîche et le zeste de citron. Saison. Servir l''orzo avec la morue dessus, ainsi que les tranches de citron rôties."]','2026-01-11 00:14:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11963,5569,'fr','Poisson grillé au citron et au romarin','Investissez dans une cage à poisson si vous êtes amateur de fruits de mer, car cela rend le barbecue beaucoup plus facile. Si vous n’en possédez pas, salez le poisson ou faites-le cuire au citron','["2 dorades ou bars moyens (environ 600 g chacun), ou 4 maquereaux écaillés et éviscérés (enlevez les nageoires et la tête, si vous préférez)","une poignée de brins de romarin","2 citrons, 1 finement tranché, 1 coupé en deux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser"]','["Allumez le barbecue – vous voulez une couche uniforme de braises cendrées pour un feu moyen. Si vous possédez un barbecue à gaz, réglez-le sur feu moyen. Assaisonnez les cavités du poisson avec du sel et du poivre, puis farcissez-les avec la plupart des brins de romarin et des tranches de citron. Badigeonner ou frotter la peau du poisson avec l''huile d''olive et bien assaisonner avec des flocons de sel marin. Si vous avez une cage à poisson, déposez le poisson à l''intérieur avec les tranches de citron restantes et les brins de romarin et placez-le sur le gril. Vous pouvez également répartir les tranches de citron et les brins de romarin directement sur le gril et déposer le poisson dessus (voir conseil ci-dessous pour une cuisson à l''intérieur).","Faites cuire le poisson pendant 8 à 10 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce que la peau soit légèrement carbonisée et cloquée et que le poisson soit bien cuit. Pendant la cuisson, placez les moitiés de citron côté coupé sur le gril et faites cuire jusqu''à ce que des marques de charbon apparaissent. Servir le poisson arrosé d''un supplément d''huile avec les citrons carbonisés à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:14:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11964,5571,'fr','Ragoût d''œufs du jardin avec plantain vert bouilli','Essayez quelque chose de différent pour le dîner avec ce copieux ragoût d''œufs du jardin d''inspiration africaine (également connu sous le nom d''aubergine blanche) avec des œufs et du poisson salé. Dégustez avec du plantain vert','["1 tilapia entier séché et salé (koobi)","11 petites aubergines blanches, parées et coupées en deux","2 piments Scotch Bonnet","2 oignons indiens ou petits oignons rouges, 1 haché, 1 tranché","4 à 6 plantains verts, pelés, chacun coupé en 2 à 3 morceaux","2 gros œufs","2-4 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète","½ cube de crevettes (facultatif)","½ cuillère à café d''aromate (facultatif)","30g de poisson salé fermenté (momoni)","120 ml d''huile de fruit de palmier rouge et de colza (nous avons utilisé l''huile de cuisson Carotino Mild & Light, disponible chez Morrisons et Tesco)","Boîte de 120 g de sardines à l''huile égouttées","1 avocat, dénoyauté, coupé en deux, pelé et tranché"]','["La veille, mettez le tilapia séché entier dans un grand bol, couvrez d''eau froide et laissez tremper toute la nuit.","Le lendemain, mettez les aubergines blanches et les piments Scotch Bonnet dans une casserole, couvrez d''eau froide et couvrez, puis portez à ébullition sur feu moyen-vif. Cuire 10 à 12 minutes, puis égoutter et réserver.","Pendant ce temps, mettez l''oignon haché dans une marmite asanka et réduisez-le en une pâte. Si vous n''avez pas de pot asanka, vous pouvez utiliser un robot culinaire ou un mixeur. Si vous utilisez un mixeur, égouttez l''eau après le mixage.","Égouttez l''eau du tilapia, puis rincez le poisson sous l''eau froide courante pour éliminer tout excès de sel.","Dans une autre casserole, à feu moyen-vif, porter à ébullition les plantains verts, les œufs et juste assez d''eau pour couvrir. Une fois à ébullition, ajoutez le tilapia. Cuire 10 à 12 minutes, puis retirer du feu. Sortez le poisson de la poêle à l''aide d''une écumoire et transférez-le dans une assiette. Laissez reposer. Égouttez les plantains et les œufs, puis remplissez la casserole d''eau froide et laissez reposer 5 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les piments dans la marmite asanka ou le robot culinaire avec l''oignon et broyez-les. Lorsque le mélange est homogène, ajoutez 2-3 aubergines et broyez à nouveau. Continuez ce processus jusqu''à ce que toutes les aubergines aient été ajoutées. Ajoutez le beurre de cacahuète, puis assaisonnez avec la moitié du cube de crevettes, si vous en utilisez, et l''aromat, si besoin (goûtez pour l''assaisonnement avant d''ajouter l''aromat).","Rincer le poisson salé fermenté sous l''eau froide courante. Faites chauffer les fruits du palmier rouge et l''huile de colza dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir le poisson salé fermenté pendant environ 3 à 5 minutes. Retirez le poisson de la poêle à l''aide d''une écumoire ou d''une tranche de poisson et retirez tous les arêtes visibles. Ajoutez le poisson dans la marmite asanka et broyez-le dans le mélange d''aubergines. Jetez toutes les arêtes de poisson.","Ajoutez les oignons émincés dans la poêle et faites-les revenir pendant 3 à 5 minutes, puis ajoutez le mélange d''aubergines et remuez bien. Réduisez le feu à doux et laissez cuire 3 à 5 minutes. Incorporer les sardines. Laissez cuire à feu doux encore 2 minutes environ et mélangez bien le tout.","Transférez le mélange dans un pot asanka ou un bol de service. Égouttez les plantains, épluchez et coupez en deux les œufs durs, puis ajoutez-les dans la casserole. Garnir d''avocat et de tilapia, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11965,5575,'fr','Saumon aux entrées','Transformez un côté de saumon en une magnifique pièce maîtresse avec seulement quelques ingrédients d''antipasti méditerranéens. Cuire au four ou cuire au barbecue pour un bon plat d''été','["100 g de tomates séchées à l''huile, égouttées et hachées finement","une petite poignée de basilic finement haché et quelques feuilles de basilic entières","une petite poignée d''aneth finement hachée, plus quelques feuilles d''aneth pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres, égouttées et rincées","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 citron, zesté et tranché","150 g de beurre ramolli","600 g de côté de saumon, écaillé et arête retirée","3 cuillères à soupe d''olives noires dénoyautées","100 g de cœurs d''artichauts grillés, égouttés et hachés grossièrement"]','["Mettez les tomates, la moitié des herbes, 1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, l''ail, le zeste de citron et le beurre dans un bol et écrasez-les avec une cuillère. Vous pouvez également les verser dans un robot culinaire et mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Le beurre aromatisé se conserve au frais jusqu’à deux jours.","Étalez une feuille de papier sulfurisé suffisamment grande pour envelopper le saumon sans serrer sur une feuille de papier d''aluminium de même taille. Disposez le saumon dessus, puis coupez le poisson en portions, sans couper jusqu''à la peau, pour que le filet reste intact. Faites des portions aussi grandes ou petites que vous le souhaitez, en fonction de la quantité que vous donnez. Étalez le beurre aromatisé sur le saumon, puis garnissez du reste des câpres, des tranches de citron, des olives et des artichauts. Enroulez le papier d''aluminium et le papier sulfurisé sur le saumon et froissez les extrémités pour sceller, créant ainsi un paquet lâche.","Pour cuire le saumon, chauffez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettez le paquet sur une plaque allant au four et laissez cuire 30 min, puis laissez reposer quelques minutes avant de déballer. Alternativement, allumez le barbecue, attendez que les flammes s''éteignent, posez le paquet directement sur le grill et laissez cuire 8 à 15 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le saumon soit bien cuit. Vérifiez que le saumon est cuit en poussant la chair avec une fourchette : elle doit s''écailler facilement. Servir sur une assiette, parsemé du reste des herbes et du jus de beurre versé dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:14:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11966,5577,'fr','Spaghetti au citron d''Amalfi, piment et anchois','Goûtez à l''Italie avec ce plat de spaghetti inspiré de la côte amalfitaine, parfumé aux citrons, aux anchois, au piment, à l''ail et au parmesan.','["120 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","3 grosses gousses d''ail","350 g de spaghettis, bucatini ou linguine","1-2 piments rouges (selon le degré de piquant souhaité), épépinés et finement hachés","8 filets d''anchois finement hachés","petit bouquet de persil finement haché","1 gros citron d''Amalfi ou non ciré, zesté et pressé","une grosse poignée (environ 40 g) de parmesan finement râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu doux et faites revenir l''ail pendant 2-3 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il devienne doré sur les bords. Retirer du feu et laisser reposer 15 minutes pour que l''ail infuse dans l''huile.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente. Égoutter en réservant 150 ml d''eau de cuisson. Retirez l''ail de l''huile infusée, puis versez les spaghettis cuits, les piments, les anchois, le persil, le zeste et le jus de citron ainsi que le parmesan. Ajouter 50 ml de l''eau réservée et mélanger avec des pinces jusqu''à homogénéité. Ajoutez un peu plus d''eau pour détendre, si vous le souhaitez. Saison. Répartir dans quatre bols peu profonds."]','2026-01-11 00:14:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11967,5579,'fr','Plateau de saumon épicé et tomates','Savourez ce plat de saumon et de tomates épicés et sains avec une légère saveur de curry pour un repas rapide et facile en milieu de semaine. Servir avec du pain naan et des quartiers de citron','["1 oignon rouge, tranché","200 g de tomates cerises","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry doux ou madras","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés","2 filets de saumon sans peau","1 gros ou 2 petits pains naan","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt sans gras","des quartiers de citron et quelques feuilles de coriandre, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger l''oignon, les tomates, 2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry, les pois chiches et 200 ml d''eau dans un plat à rôtir profond de 20 x 25 cm. Rôtir pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient tendres et que les tomates éclatent.","Remuez le tout, puis assaisonnez. Badigeonnez les filets de saumon du reste de pâte de curry et assaisonnez. Placez le saumon dans les légumes dans le moule et faites-le rôtir pendant encore 8 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût.","Pendant ce temps, réchauffez les pains naan – vous pouvez le faire en les plaçant directement sur la grille du four, sous le plat à rôtir. Coupez les pains naan réchauffés en quartiers. Mélangez le yaourt dans les légumes dans le moule, puis servez avec les quartiers de naan pour tremper, quelques feuilles de coriandre saupoudrées, si vous le souhaitez, et les quartiers de citron, le cas échéant, pour presser dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:14:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11968,5581,'fr','Cataplana au merlu et aux fruits de mer','Savourez ce plat d''inspiration portugaise avec des moules et des crevettes. Il est sain, faible en calories et fournit trois de vos 5 par jour, ainsi que du fer, de l''acide folique, de la vitamine C et des fibres.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","1 oignon, coupé en deux et émincé","250 g de pommes de terre à salade coupées en morceaux","1 gros poivron rouge, épépiné et haché","1 courgette (200 g), tranchée épaisse","2 tomates hachées (150g)","2 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre (facultatif)","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","2 filets de merlu sans peau (emballage 240 g)","Paquet de 150 g de moules prêtes à l''emploi (non décortiquées)","60 g de crevettes décortiquées","une grosse poignée de persil haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une large poêle antiadhésive avec un couvercle hermétique. Faites revenir les oignons et les pommes de terre pendant environ 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez les poivrons, les courgettes, les tomates et l''ail, puis incorporez le vinaigre, le cas échéant, le bouillon et 200 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez cuire 25 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les poivrons et les courgettes soient très tendres (si votre poêle n''a pas de couvercle hermétique, mouillez une feuille de papier sulfurisé et placez-la sur le ragoût avant de couvrir – cela aide à conserver le jus).","Ajoutez les filets de merlu, les moules et les crevettes, puis couvrez et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le poisson se défasse facilement à la fourchette. Parsemer de persil et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11969,5585,'fr','Galettes de poisson au curry','Préparez une fournée de ces galettes de morue épicées et congelez-les pour les soirs de semaine chargés. Servir avec de la salade et de la salade de chou pour un savoureux repas en famille','["500 g de pommes de terre Maris Piper, pelées et coupées en morceaux de 3 cm","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","2-3 cuillères à soupe bombées de poudre de curry moyenne","4 filets de cabillaud avec la peau","400 ml de lait demi-écrémé","1 petit citron, zesté et pressé","150 g de farine nature","2 œufs moyens, battus","150 g de chapelure panko","feuilles de salade et salade de chou, pour servir"]','["Mettez les pommes de terre dans une grande casserole, couvrez d''eau froide et portez à ébullition. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Égouttez et laissez sécher à la vapeur pendant 5 minutes. Écrasez légèrement les pommes de terre avec un presse-purée jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement épaisses.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen. Faites revenir l''ail, le gingembre, les graines de moutarde et le curry pendant 1 min. Incorporer les épices aux pommes de terre, assaisonner de sel et réserver.","Mettez le cabillaud dans une grande casserole sur feu moyen, versez dessus le lait et portez à ébullition. Retirer immédiatement du feu, couvrir et laisser pocher 10 minutes. Soulevez le poisson avec une écumoire, puis retirez et jetez la peau. Écaillez la chair dans le mélange de pommes de terre en gros morceaux, puis incorporez-la au zeste et au jus de citron. Façonnez le mélange en huit galettes de poisson avec vos mains.","Mettez la farine, les œufs et la chapelure dans trois bols peu profonds séparés. Tremper chaque galette de poisson dans la farine, puis les œufs, puis la chapelure. Réserver sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Pour congeler, couvrir et congeler sur la plaque jusqu''à ce qu''il soit solide, puis transférer dans des contenants allant au congélateur.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et chauffez le four à feu doux. Faites frire les croquettes de poisson par lots pendant 5 à 6 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes. Gardez au chaud au four pendant la cuisson. Servir avec les feuilles de salade et le chou en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:14:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11970,5587,'fr','Saumon piquant aux betteraves rôties et aux épinards','Ce souper de saumon frais et copieux regorge d''ingrédients sains pour le cœur, est riche en calcium, en fer et en vitamine C et représente 4 de vos 5 par jour.','["4 petites betteraves fraîches, environ 200g","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive pressée à froid","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre légèrement écrasées","2 filets de saumon ou de truite sans peau","2½ petites oranges, le zeste de 1 et le jus de la moitié","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille","1 gousse d''ail","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","4 poignées de pousses d''épinards","1 avocat, tranché épaisse"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C, 160°C chaleur tournante, gaz 4. Coupez les tiges de betterave et réservez les feuilles tendres pouvant être consommées dans la salade. Coupez les betteraves en quartiers, mélangez-les avec 1/2 cuillère à soupe d''huile, les graines de coriandre et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis empilez-les au centre d''une grande feuille de papier d''aluminium et enveloppez-les comme un paquet. Cuire au four 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les betteraves soient tendres puis garnir de saumon, parsemer de la moitié du zeste d''orange et remettre au four 15 minutes. Si vous souhaitez griller les graines de citrouille, mettez-les au four pendant 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, coupez la peau et la peau de 2 oranges puis découpez les segments avec un couteau bien aiguisé en travaillant au-dessus d''un bol pour récupérer le jus. Râpez finement l''ail et laissez reposer 10 minutes pour permettre aux enzymes de s''activer. Incorporer l''ail au jus d''orange et au reste de l''huile d''olive avec l''assaisonnement pour faire une vinaigrette.","Sortez le paquet du four et retirez délicatement le poisson. Versez la betterave rouge dans un bol avec l''oignon rouge, le reste du zeste d''orange, les graines de citrouille et les feuilles d''épinards et mélangez bien. Mélanger délicatement les quartiers d''orange et l''avocat avec les feuilles de betterave, puis empiler sur des assiettes et garnir de saumon chaud. Arroser de vinaigrette et servir encore chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:14:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11971,5589,'fr','Tajine de fruits de mer','Utilisez un mélange de poisson et de crustacés surgelés pour préparer ce ragoût marocain, servi sur un couscous piquant aux amandes.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, haché","1 poivron rouge épépiné et haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","2 cuillères à soupe de harissa","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 g de pois chiches en boîte","Sélection de fruits de mer surgelés sachet 350g","300 g de couscous","coriandre en petit paquet, feuilles seulement, hachées grossièrement","25 g d''amandes effilées grillées","le zeste et le jus d''un demi citron, en réservant l''autre moitié pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon et le poivron rouge pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer l''ail, la harissa et les tomates hachées et cuire environ 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Ajouter les fruits de mer surgelés et cuire encore environ 10 minutes.","Mettez le couscous dans un bol de service, versez dessus de l''eau bouillante pour couvrir, puis couvrez d''un film alimentaire. Laisser tremper pendant la cuisson du tajine, puis incorporer la majeure partie de la coriandre, les amandes, le zeste et le jus de citron et l''assaisonnement. Servir le tajine avec le couscous et couper le reste du citron en quartiers pour le presser. Saupoudrer du reste de coriandre et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11972,5591,'fr','Poisson cuit à la vapeur aux agrumes et au gingembre avec légumes sautés','Gagnez du temps et servez un dîner sain en semaine avec cette recette rapide de poisson blanc de style asiatique avec de l''ail, du gingembre, du poivron rouge et des germes de soja.','["le zeste et le jus d''une orange","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja réduite en sel","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin blanc ou de vinaigre de riz","Pack de 300 g de 2 filets ou long poisson blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre très finement râpé","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","10 oignons nouveaux, coupés en deux et tranchés dans le sens de la longueur","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché","140 g de germes de soja","1-2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Mélangez le zeste et le jus d''orange, le soja et le vinaigre. Tapisser le dessus d''un cuiseur vapeur de papier sulfurisé et faire chauffer de l''eau dans le fond. Garnir le poisson d''un peu de gingembre, l''ajouter au cuiseur vapeur et verser 2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigrette. Couvrir et cuire à la vapeur pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson se défasse facilement.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok antiadhésif et faites revenir les oignons nouveaux, l''ail, le poivre et le reste du gingembre pendant 2 minutes. Ajoutez les germes de soja et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Versez le jus du poisson dans les légumes. Incorporer la vinaigrette, puis répartir dans les bols, garnir de poisson et parsemer de graines de sésame."]','2026-01-11 00:14:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11973,5593,'fr','Morces de poisson, sauce romesco et légumes','La sauce Romesco est composée de poivrons, d''amandes, de piment et d''ail. Accompagnez-le de poisson blanc et d''un mélange de chou-fleur et ciboule','["2 filets de poisson blanc ferme (nous avons utilisé de la morue)","4 tranches de citron","2 brins de thym","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ chou-fleur, coupé en quartiers","10 oignons nouveaux, extrémités parées, racines laissées intactes","1 tranche de pain au levain, déchirée en morceaux","1 piment rouge (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant)","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","10 amandes blanchies","2 poivrons rouges déjà rôtis, en bocal","1 tomate pelée (voir conseil ci-dessous)","½ cuillère à café de vinaigre de Xérès"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Déposer chaque filet de poisson sur un grand morceau de papier sulfurisé et garnir chacun de quelques tranches de citron et d''une branche de thym. Arroser d’1 cuillère à café d’huile et assaisonner. Repliez les bords supérieurs de chaque morceau de parchemin pour former un sceau, puis froissez les extrémités comme un emballage de bonbons. Disposez les paquets sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 15 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le chou-fleur à la vapeur pendant 4 minutes, puis ajoutez les oignons nouveaux pendant 3 minutes supplémentaires ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Séchez-les, puis mélangez les légumes dans 2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive et assaisonnez. Dans une grande poêle, faire griller les morceaux de pain dans le reste de l''huile, puis ajouter le piment et l''ail et cuire 1 min. Versez dans un robot culinaire avec les noix, les poivrons, la tomate et le vinaigre, et mélangez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte grossière. Assaisonner et réserver.","Essuyez puis faites chauffer la poêle. Ajouter les quartiers de chou-fleur et les oignons nouveaux et cuire quelques minutes de chaque côté pour les faire dorer. Servir avec le poisson et la sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:14:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11974,5595,'fr','Poisson au four avec tomates, basilic et chapelure croustillante','Un souper sur plateau faible en gras et plein de saveurs. Mélanger du poisson blanc maigre avec des tomates cerises, une chapelure de pesto, des haricots verts et du brocoli','["2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates cerises","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","3 cuillères à soupe de pesto de basilic","2 cuillères à soupe de chapelure","4 filets de poisson blanc ferme, sans peau (environ 140 g chacun)","320 g de haricots verts","Paquet de 320 g de brocoli à tige fine"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez les tomates dans un plat à rôtir et incorporez le vinaigre et 1 cuillère à soupe de pesto. Assaisonner, mélanger, puis enfourner 10 min.","Mélangez le reste du pesto et la chapelure, puis pressez sur chaque filet de poisson. Ajouter au plat à rôtir et remettre au four pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson se défasse facilement et que la garniture soit légèrement croustillante.","Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir les haricots verts et le brocoli, puis égouttez-les. Servir le plat parsemé de légumes."]','2026-01-11 00:14:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11975,5597,'fr','Poisson au citron et au poivre avec légumes rôtis','Un dîner léger de poisson blanc enrobé de chapelure et d''un mélange de légumes rôtis inspiré de la ratatouille, composé de poivrons, de courgettes et d''oignons.','["3 poivrons mélangés, épépinés et tranchés","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","3 courgettes coupées en rondelles","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","50 g d''olives noires","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","4 cuillères à soupe de chapelure séchée","zester ½ citron, plus les quartiers pour servir","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir concassé","3 filets de poisson blanc surgelés (comme la morue, l''aiglefin ou le lieu jaune)","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 œuf moyen, battu"]','["Mélanger les légumes avec l''ail, les herbes, les olives et l''huile. Assaisonner et verser sur une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Congelez les légumes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient solides, puis transférez-les dans un grand sac de congélation et mettez-les au congélateur.","Mixez la chapelure jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fine, puis faites-la griller quelques secondes dans une poêle sèche en secouant pour éviter qu''elle ne brûle. Versez dans un bol et mélangez avec le zeste de citron, le poivre et une grosse pincée de sel. Versez-le dans un petit sac de congélation et placez-le au congélateur. Les légumes et les miettes peuvent être congelés jusqu''à 3 mois.","Pour cuisiner surgelés, chauffer le four à 200°C/220°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Verser les légumes dans un plat à rôtir et cuire 15 minutes. Pendant ce temps, saupoudrez le poisson congelé de farine, badigeonnez-le légèrement d''œuf et recouvrez de chapelure congelée. Placez le poisson sur une grille et placez-le au-dessus des légumes. Cuire au four 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit cuit. Servir avec des quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:14:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11976,5599,'fr','Saumon aux graines collantes avec salade satsuma','Un plat de poisson multi-texturé et multicolore avec des graines nutritives et une salade de cresson aux agrumes vibrante','["2 filets de saumon sans peau, d''environ 140 g chacun","2 cuillères à café de sirop d''agave ou de miel","2-3 cuillères à soupe de graines mélangées","4 satsuma","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","50 g de cresson","Paquet de 250 g de betterave cuite (pas au vinaigre), égouttée et coupée en fins quartiers"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Badigeonner chaque filet de saumon avec la moitié du sirop d''agave ou du miel, saupoudrer d''un peu de poivre noir, puis presser les graines. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four environ 15 minutes, selon l''épaisseur du poisson, jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit bien cuit et les graines croustillantes.","Pendant ce temps, coupez la peau des satsuma et coupez-les en segments, en réservant tout le jus qui en sort pour la vinaigrette. Fouettez le jus avec l''huile d''olive, le vinaigre et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un petit bol.","Mélanger les segments de cresson, de betterave rouge et de satsuma avec la vinaigrette et répartir dans les assiettes. Ajoutez un morceau de saumon à chacun."]','2026-01-11 00:14:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11977,5601,'fr','Fish & chips piri-piri aux petits pois épicés','Donnez une touche épicée à un aliment de base traditionnel avec de la marinade au piment et des pois à la menthe. Utilisez n''importe quel poisson blanc - nous avons utilisé du bar','["375 g de pommes de terre coupées en chips","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","jus ½ citron","2 cuillères à soupe de marinade piri-piri","300 g de petits pois surgelés","1 piment vert épépiné et finement haché","½ gousse d''ail, écrasée","une poignée de feuilles de menthe, hachées finement","2 filets de poisson blanc (nous avons utilisé du bar)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMélanger les chips avec la moitié de l''huile d''olive\r\net la moitié du jus de citron, disposer\r\nune couche sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis assaisonner.\r\nCuire 25 min. Remuer le reste\r\nle jus de citron dans la marinade.","Pendant ce temps, apportez une casserole d''eau à\r\nfaire bouillir et cuire les petits pois pendant 2-3 minutes,\r\npuis égouttez. Remettre les petits pois au vide\r\npoêle et écraser avec le piment, l''ail,\r\nmenthe et le reste de l''huile. Saison\r\net garder au chaud.","Au bout de 25 minutes, retournez les pommes de terre\r\net déplacez-vous vers les bords du plateau.\r\nAjouter le poisson, peau vers le haut, et la cuillère\r\nsur la marinade. Cuisiner pour un autre\r\n10-12 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit cuit\r\nà travers. Servir avec les petits pois écrasés."]','2026-01-11 00:14:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11978,5603,'fr','Tarte au poisson soufflé au saumon et aux épinards','L''ajout de légumes verts à votre purée de pommes de terre augmente les bienfaits pour la santé de cette pâtisserie réconfortante classique.','["1 kg de pommes de terre Maris Piper, coupées en gros morceaux","2 gros œufs, séparés","Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","85 g de cheddar affiné allégé","muscade entière, à râper","500g de poisson - un mélange de blanc et de saumon c''est bien (j''ai utilisé 2 filets de saumon surgelés et 2 cabillauds décongelés)","1 oignon, coupé en deux","quelques clous de girofle entiers","1 feuille de laurier fraîche ou séchée","300 ml de lait demi-écrémé","300 ml de bouillon de poisson (en cube, c''est bien)","25g de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","50g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de moutarde complète"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ntendre. Pendant ce temps, mettez le poisson dans une friture\r\npoêle, côté peau vers le bas. Piquer l''oignon avec\r\nles clous de girofle et les mettre dans la poêle avec le\r\nlaurier, lait et bouillon. Portez à ébullition, puis\r\ncouvrir et laisser mijoter 2 minutes. Supprimer\r\nle cabillaud, qui doit s''écailler facilement, puis\r\nrecouvrir et cuire encore 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle saumon est juste cuit. Ascenseur\r\nretirer le poisson et réserver. Filtrer le\r\nliquide de cuisson.","Dans une autre poêle, faites fondre le beurre avec le\r\nl''huile, incorporer la farine et cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nça sent le grillé. Retirez du feu et\r\nincorporer lentement le liquide de cuisson du poisson.\r\nRemettre sur le feu, fouetter jusqu''à ce que la sauce\r\nbout et épaissit, puis incorporez la moutarde.\r\nChauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.","Égoutter et écraser les pommes de terre jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient\r\nlisser, puis incorporer les jaunes d''œufs,\r\nles épinards et la plupart du fromage. Saison\r\ngénéreusement avec du sel, du poivre et de la muscade.\r\nMontez les blancs d''œufs en neige ferme, puis\r\nincorporer à la pomme de terre en 2 lots.","Écaillez le poisson dans un grand plat allant au four,\r\nverser sur la sauce et garnir de\r\npomme de terre aux épinards. Dispersez-vous avec le reste\r\ndu fromage et enfourner pendant 35-40 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés."]','2026-01-11 00:14:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11979,5605,'fr','Truite au four avec salade de fenouil, radis et roquette','Un souper de poisson élégant, léger, frais et rempli d''oméga-3, d''acide folique et de vitamine C.','["2 truites entières, écaillées et vidées","½ botte de thym","2 citrons, 1 tranché, 1 pressé","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","1 gros bulbe de fenouil, tranché finement","100 g de radis finement tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres hachées","grosse poignée de fusée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nCoupez la peau de la truite trois fois sur les deux\r\ncôtés puis farcissez une branche de thym dans chacun\r\ncouper. Disposez le poisson sur une plaque à pâtisserie et remplissez-le\r\nla cavité avec les tranches de citron et\r\nbrins de thym restants. Assaisonner le poisson,\r\narroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive puis enfourner pendant\r\n15-20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le jus de citron avec l''olive\r\nhuile, puis verser sur le fenouil et laisser reposer\r\nlaisser reposer 10 minutes. Incorporer les radis et\r\ncâpres et saison. Mélangez la roquette\r\nla salade de fenouil et radis juste avant\r\nservir avec de gros morceaux de truite émiettée."]','2026-01-11 00:14:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11980,5607,'fr','Croquettes de poisson classiques en morceaux','Les croquettes de poisson sont un excellent aliment de base au congélateur car elles sont prêtes à être portionnées afin que vous puissiez en décongeler autant que vous en avez besoin.','["1 kg de pommes de terre pelées et hachées","1kg de mélange de filets de saumon et de lieue","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","un bouquet d''aneth, de ciboulette, de persil et d''oignons nouveaux, hachés","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce tartare, plus un peu pour servir si vous le souhaitez","3 œufs battus","100 g de farine nature","250g de chapelure","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Couvrir les pommes de terre dans du sel froid et salé\r\nl''eau et porter à ébullition. Baisser\r\nporter à ébullition et cuire 10 à 12 minutes\r\njusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter et sécher à la vapeur pendant\r\nquelques minutes, puis écrasez et réservez\r\nrefroidir un peu. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le poisson.\r\nCouvrir d''eau froide et du jus de citron,\r\nporter à légère ébullition, puis pocher pendant\r\n5 minutes (selon l''épaisseur de\r\nle poisson) jusqu''à ce qu''il soit à peine cuit. Supprimer\r\nde l''eau, débarrassez-vous de la peau et\r\némietter en gros morceaux.","Mettez le zeste de citron, les herbes, le printemps\r\noignons, sauce tartare et un peu d''assaisonnement\r\ndans un grand bol avec le poisson et le\r\npommes de terre. Mélangez tous les ingrédients,\r\npuis divisez en 12 et façonnez des gâteaux.","Mettez les oeufs, la farine et la chapelure\r\nsur trois assiettes. Tremper chacune des galettes de poisson\r\ndans la farine, épongez l''excédent, puis plongez-les dans la\r\noeuf. Enfin, enrobez-les de chapelure et\r\ntransférer dans une assiette propre ou une plaque à pâtisserie\r\ntapissé de papier sulfurisé. Répétez avec\r\nles croquettes de poisson restantes. Vous pouvez congeler\r\nles croquettes de poisson maintenant pendant trois mois maximum, ou réfrigérez pendant 1 à 2 jours.","Pour cuire, chauffez le gril à feu moyen.\r\nBadigeonnez les croquettes de poisson d''huile et faites-les griller.\r\npendant 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et\r\nchaud de part en part. Servir avec du tartare supplémentaire\r\nsauce et salade ou légumes verts. Décongeler\r\ncroquettes de poisson surgelées toute la nuit au réfrigérateur et\r\ncuire comme ci-dessus. Alternativement, cuisiner directement à partir\r\ncongelé, chauffer le gril à feu moyen, huiler les galettes de poisson selon la recette, puis griller 12 à 15 minutes d''un côté pour dorer, avant de retourner et de griller l''autre côté pendant 5 minutes supplémentaires."]','2026-01-11 00:14:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11981,5609,'fr','Fish & chips croustillants à la purée de petits pois','Réalisez ce classique à emporter dans votre cuisine, plus sain que votre chippy local et tout aussi savoureux','["400 g de pommes de terre au four","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 tranches de pain blanc","2 filets de poisson blanc, type aiglefin, hoki, goberge","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature, assaisonnée","1 œuf battu","140g de petits pois surgelés à la menthe","2 tbsp crème fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 4. Épluchez et coupez les pommes de terre en chips épaisses, puis mélangez-les avec l''huile d''olive et un peu de sel. Disposer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive et rôtir pendant 20 minutes en retournant à mi-cuisson.","Griller légèrement le pain, puis passer brièvement au robot culinaire pour obtenir une chapelure grossière. Saupoudrez le poisson de farine en secouant l''excédent, puis plongez-le dans l''œuf, puis dans la chapelure pour bien l''enrober. Rôtissez le poisson avec les frites encore 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les deux soient dorés.","Juste avant que le fish and chips ne soit prêt, faites bouillir les petits pois pendant 3 à 4 minutes, puis égouttez-les et écrasez-les. Incorporer la crème fraîche et assaisonner."]','2026-01-11 00:14:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11982,5611,'fr','Saumon au four au fenouil et tomates','Fenouil anisé et tomates cerises juteuses découpées dans la richesse des filets de saumon','["2 bulbes de fenouil moyens","2 cuillères à soupe de persil plat haché","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","175 g de tomates cerises","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 filets de saumon d''environ 175 g chacun","quelques olives noires (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/chaleur tournante 160C/gaz 4. Garnir\r\nles feuilles de fenouil et réserver.\r\nCoupez les bulbes de fenouil en deux, puis coupez chacun\r\nla moitié en 3 quartiers. Cuire à l''ébullition salée\r\narroser pendant 10 minutes, puis bien égoutter. Hacher\r\ngrossièrement les feuilles de fenouil, puis mélanger avec\r\nle persil et le zeste de citron.","Étalez le fenouil égoutté sur un plat peu profond\r\nplat allant au four, puis ajoutez les tomates.\r\nArroser d''huile d''olive, puis enfourner 10 min.\r\nPlacer le saumon parmi les légumes, saupoudrer\r\navec du jus de citron, puis enfourner encore 15 min\r\njusqu''à ce que le poisson soit juste cuit. Dispersez-vous sur le\r\npersil et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11983,5613,'fr','Chaudrée de poisson plus légère','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une version plus saine de la soupe américaine classique qui utilise du saumon et du lieu jaune, ainsi que du prosciutto paré de gras et de la crème fraîche à moitié grasse.','["1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","3 tranches de prosciutto, dégraissées, coupées en lanières","2-3 poireaux, tranchés finement (environ 320 g de poids paré)","2 gousses d''ail dodues, hachées finement","3 brins de thym (de préférence du thym citronné), plus des feuilles supplémentaires pour garnir","2 feuilles de laurier","650 g de pommes de terre farineuses type Desiree ou Maris Piper, non pelées, lavées, tranchées de 5 mm d''épaisseur","600 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud provenant d''un cube ou d''une poudre de bonne qualité (nous avons utilisé du bouillon de souci)","une bonne pincée de flocons de piment","250 g de filets de saumon sans peau","250 g de filets de lieu jaune ou d''aiglefin sans peau","3 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche demi-écrémée","ciboulette ciselée, pour garnir"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande sauteuse profonde\r\ncasserole. Versez le prosciutto et faites revenir 2 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants. Retirer avec une écumoire,\r\nlaisser tout excès d’huile s’écouler dans le\r\ncasserole. Annuler. Ajouter le reste de l''huile et faire revenir\r\nles poireaux, l''ail, le thym et le laurier pendant 2-3 min\r\njusqu''à ce que les poireaux commencent à ramollir mais\r\ngardant leur couleur. Ajoutez les pommes de terre et\r\nfaire revenir 2 minutes en retournant de temps en temps. Verser\r\nle bouillon avec 100 ml d''eau bouillante supplémentaire\r\net appuyez doucement sur les pommes de terre pour que\r\nils sont juste couverts. Porter à ébullition. Faire bouillir\r\nassez vigoureusement, à découvert, à haute température\r\nchauffer pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient\r\npresque cuit. Le liquide devrait avoir\r\ntrès légèrement épaissi. Disperser le piment\r\nflocons, du poivre et une pincée de sel.","Baisser le feu à moyen et déposer le\r\nfilets de poisson entiers sur les pommes de terre.\r\nAssaisonner le poisson avec du poivre et délicatement\r\npresser dans le bouillon pour que les filets\r\nsont à peine submergés. Couvrir et laisser mijoter\r\npendant environ 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit presque\r\ncuit (le temps dépendra de l''épaisseur\r\ndes filets). Retirer du feu et asseoir\r\npendant encore 5 à 10 minutes, pour que le poisson puisse\r\nterminer doucement la cuisson. Retirez le thym\r\net des feuilles de laurier. Toujours hors du feu, versez-y à la cuillère\r\nla crème fraîche et remuez délicatement\r\ndans le bouillon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit crémeux.","Pour servir, réchauffer doucement et brièvement. Diviser\r\nles pommes de terre et le poisson (laissez le poisson pénétrer\r\ngros morceaux lorsque vous le sortez de la poêle)\r\ndans des bols larges et peu profonds. Verser le bouillon\r\nautour et parsemer de ciboulette, quelques\r\nles feuilles de thym et le prosciutto croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:14:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11984,5615,'fr','Wrap au poulet et maïs façon élote','Faites quelque chose de différent pour le déjeuner avec un wrap rempli de poulet épicé, de riz et de maïs doux. Avec deux de vos cinq par jour, des glucides et des protéines, cela alimentera votre après-midi','["3 poitrines de poulet (environ 550 g), tranchées finement","2 cuillères à café d''assaisonnement à la mexicaine, pour tacos ou fajita","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","8 grosses tortillas roulées","200 g de maïs doux surgelé, décongelé","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","1 citron vert, jus","3 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","Sachet de 250g de riz basmati et sauvage (ou l''équivalent en poids cuit)","1 grosse tomate mûre, hachée finement","une poignée de persil finement haché"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif et faites frire le maïs doux jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à carboniser, environ 4 à 5 minutes. Versez dans un bol et mélangez les oignons nouveaux, le jus de citron vert, la mayonnaise et la poudre de piment avec une bonne pincée de sel et de poivre. Bien mélanger pour enrober le maïs. Annuler.","Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis mélangez-le avec la tomate, le persil, une bonne pincée de sel et un peu de poivre noir.","Enduisez le poulet de l''assaisonnement à la mexicaine, puis faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites cuire le poulet jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Annuler.","Faites chauffer les tortillas, puis ajoutez-y le riz, le maïs doux et le poulet."]','2026-01-11 00:14:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11985,5617,'fr','Pad Thaï sain','Mélangez le poulet avec des nouilles de riz et des légumes sautés pour créer un dîner délicieusement sain. Il existe également une option végétalienne, qui utilise du beurre de cacahuète (voir le conseil ci-dessous)','["100 g de nouilles plates au riz brun","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 filets de cuisse de poulet sans peau, hachés","1 oignon (160 g), haché grossièrement","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en fines tranches","1 petite carotte (60 g), pelée en rubans épais à l''aide d''un épluche-légumes","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 piment rouge épépiné et tranché finement","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement râpé","100 g de germes de soja","15 g de cacahuètes grillées non salées","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert et 1 cuillère à café de zeste","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","15g de coriandre hachée","une poignée de basilic haché"]','["Versez les nouilles dans un bol et faites-les tremper en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres mais pas molles – vous ne voulez pas qu''elles deviennent pâteuses. Vidange.","Faites chauffer l''huile à feu moyen-vif et faites sauter le poulet pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit. Transférer le poulet dans un bol et réserver en gardant l''huile dans le wok. Faites revenir l''oignon, le poivron et la carotte pendant 5 minutes pour les ramollir, puis ajoutez l''ail, le piment et le gingembre et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés.","Ajoutez les germes de soja, augmentez le feu et mélangez les cacahuètes, le jus et le zeste de citron vert et la sauce soja. Remettez le poulet dans la poêle avec les nouilles et les herbes, et mélangez délicatement le tout jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud. Mieux servi immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:14:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11986,5619,'fr','Plateau de gnocchis à la ricotta citronnée','Préparez cette merveille en un seul plateau avec des gnocchis, de la ricotta, des artichauts, des tomates italiennes et des courgettes. Il peut être adapté en utilisant n''importe quel légume que vous avez au réfrigérateur.','["500 g de gnocchis","1 courgette, coupée en deux, puis tranchée en gros morceaux","100 g de petites tomates italiennes, coupées en deux","100 g d''artichauts à l''huile, plus 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile","2 gousses d''ail, non pelées, légèrement écrasées","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","85 g de gazon","1 citron zesté puis coupé en quartiers","10 g de basilic haché grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 8. Verser les gnocchis, les courgettes et les tomates dans une grande plaque à rôtir. Ajouter les artichauts et l''huile, les gousses d''ail écrasées et les flocons de piment, et bien assaisonner avec du sel et du poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Mélangez tous les ingrédients avec vos mains, puis enfournez pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que les gnocchis soient croustillants sur les bords et que les légumes soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez la ricotta et le zeste de citron dans un petit bol, puis assaisonnez avec du sel et du poivre au goût. Répartissez-en sur les gnocchis et saupoudrez de basilic.","Répartissez les gnocchis dans deux bols en les mélangeant bien pour que la ricotta se décompose pour obtenir une sauce crémeuse. Servir avec les quartiers de citron à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11987,5621,'fr','Pâtes aux oignons rouges caramélisés et aux anchois avec gremolata','Après un dîner luxueux à deux ? Parfaites pour la Saint-Valentin, ces pâtes nécessitent un peu de préparation, mais la cuisson est simple, pour que vous puissiez passer du temps ensemble','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 oignons rouges , tranchés finement","200 g de pappardelles (ou n''importe quelle pâte longue)","2 filets d''anchois à l''huile, égouttés","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 citron , zesté et pressé","15 g de persil haché grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail , hachées finement"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à fond épais à feu moyen. Faites revenir les oignons rouges avec une grosse pincée de sel. Cuire 30 à 35 minutes à feu moyen-doux, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient caramélisés et dorés.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la gremolata. Mélangez le zeste, le jus, le persil et l''ail du citron avec une pincée de sel, puis réservez. Faites cuire les pappardelles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, en réservant 120 ml d''eau pour pâtes.","Ajoutez les filets d''anchois aux oignons lorsqu''ils sont caramélisés et laissez-les se dissoudre. Incorporer la purée de tomates avec 15 tours de poivre noir (environ ½ cuillère à café) et cuire pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange noircisse.","Ajoutez les pâtes cuites à la sauce avec les 120 ml d''eau pour pâtes réservée. Bien mélanger, puis transférer dans un plat de service. Verser sur la gremolata pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11988,5623,'fr','Ragoût de courge végétalien','Servez ce ragoût végétalien copieux et sain pour un dîner d’hiver réconfortant. Il regorge de vitamine C et contient les cinq de vos cinq par jour','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","320 g de gros champignons châtaignes coupés en quartiers","2 feuilles de laurier","2 cuillères à soupe de romarin frais","4 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","4 gousses d''ail , tranchées finement","320 g de courge musquée préparée","600 ml de bouillon de légumes, préparé avec 1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","4 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","brocoli et petits pois, pour servir","700 g de rutabagas pelé et coupé en morceaux","850 g de pommes de terre coupées en morceaux"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir les champignons, le laurier et le romarin pendant environ 5 minutes. Ajoutez les oignons et l''ail et faites cuire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis.","Ajouter la courge musquée, le bouillon, les pois chiches, le paprika fumé et le concentré de tomates. Couvrir et laisser mijoter pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide soit réduit en une sauce épaisse.","Environ 25 minutes avant la fin de la cuisson, préparez la purée. Portez une grande casserole d''eau à ébullition et faites cuire le rutabaga pendant 5 minutes, puis ajoutez les pommes de terre et faites bouillir pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Égoutter et écraser avec beaucoup de poivre noir.","Servez la moitié du ragoût et écrasez-le maintenant, puis réfrigérez le reste pour le réchauffer et le manger un autre jour. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffez le ragoût dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. La purée peut être réchauffée au micro-ondes. Servir avec du brocoli et des petits pois, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11989,5625,'fr','Salade de chou frisé','Savourez cette salade vibrante remplie de chou frisé nutritif, de légumes-racines, de noix et de fromage. C''est un déjeuner satisfaisant, mais peut également être servi en accompagnement','["200 g de chou frisé, tiges enlevées et feuilles arrachées","1 grosse échalote , tranchée finement","100 g de betterave cuite, hachée grossièrement","30 g de canneberges séchées","250 g de carottes râpées","25 g de noix mélangées, hachées grossièrement","125 g de fromage de chèvre émietté (facultatif)","1 citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","1 petite gousse d''ail écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un grand bol, assaisonnez bien, puis ajoutez le chou frisé et l''échalote. Massez la vinaigrette sur les feuilles de chou frisé jusqu''à ce qu''elles ramollissent et deviennent vert foncé, environ 2-3 minutes.","Ajouter la betterave, les canneberges, les carottes, les noix et le fromage de chèvre, le cas échéant. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que tout soit uniformément enrobé et assaisonner. Servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11990,5627,'fr','Salade de pois chiches fumée','Savourez les couches de saveurs et le contraste des textures de cette salade végétalienne, avec des pois chiches croustillants et frits, du brocoli cru croquant et une vinaigrette au paprika fumé.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","200 g de carottes pelées en rubans ou râpées","200g d''épinards","1 petite tête de brocoli, haché grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à café de grains d''ail","2 cuillères à café d''herbes mélangées séchées","4 cuillères à café de sirop d''érable","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja faible en sodium","4 cuillères à café de vinaigre de riz","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen. Ajoutez les pois chiches et faites-les revenir doucement pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient grésillants et légèrement croustillants.","Mélangez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un bol, puis versez-y les pois chiches avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau et portez à ébullition. Cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à légère réduction, retirer du feu, bien assaisonner et réserver.","Mélanger les carottes, les épinards et le brocoli cru et répartir dans les assiettes. Répartir sur les pois chiches et une cuillerée de jus de cuisson pour assaisonner."]','2026-01-11 00:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11991,5629,'fr','Salade de quartier aux graines de soja et concombres marinés à l''aneth','Essayez le croquant salé et riche en umami des graines de soja accompagné de concombres marinés pour assaisonner cette salade en quartiers – elle surpasse une garniture de bacon classique tous les jours.','["75 ml de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café d''aneth finement haché","1 gros concombre, tranché finement en rondelles de 1 à 2 mm d''épaisseur","1 laitue iceberg, coupée en deux jusqu''au cœur, chaque moitié coupée en quartiers","75g de graines mélangées","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère","100 ml de babeurre","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt à la grecque","½ cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","1 petite gousse d''ail, finement râpée","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de liquide des concombres marinés rapidement (voir ci-dessus)"]','["Mélangez le vinaigre, le sucre, le curcuma, l''aneth et ½ cuillère à café de sel marin dans un bol moyen non réactif, en fouettant pour dissoudre le sucre et le sel. Ajoutez les tranches de concombre, mélangez bien et laissez mariner 10 min. Vérifiez que les tranches de concombre sont encore immergées, et sinon, alourdissez-les avec une assiette. Laisser mariner encore 30 minutes.","Faites griller les graines dans une poêle sèche à fond épais à feu moyen pendant 4 à 5 minutes, en remuant souvent la poêle jusqu''à ce que les graines commencent à se colorer et à éclater. Ajoutez le sucre, puis remuez, éteignez le feu, versez la sauce soja, mélangez bien et versez dans une grande assiette pour refroidir. Brisez les grumeaux à l''aide d''une fourchette et conservez-les dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Se conserve jusqu''à une semaine. Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un bol ou un pichet et assaisonnez bien.","Disposez les quartiers de laitue dans un bol de service et versez-y la moitié de la vinaigrette. Répartissez sur les concombres marinés, puis versez le reste de la vinaigrette et les graines."]','2026-01-11 00:14:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11992,5631,'fr','Ragoût sain','Utilisez des carottes, des pois et de la passata pour étirer un paquet de viande hachée dans cette sauce saine et plus saine qui en fournit trois sur cinq par jour. Dégustez avec des pommes de terre en chemise','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 gros oignons (320 g), coupés en deux ou en quartiers, puis tranchés","3 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","500 g de steak haché 5 % de matière grasse","500 g de purée en carton","3 carottes (320 g), hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon de légumes","½ cuillère à café de poivre blanc moulu","200 g de petits pois surgelés","4 pommes de terre en chemise, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-doux et faites revenir les oignons pendant 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporez l''ail, puis ajoutez le hachis et faites cuire, en le brisant avec une cuillère en bois, pendant encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré.","Ajoutez la passata, les carottes, le thym, la poudre de bouillon et le poivre, puis couvrez et laissez cuire à feu doux pendant 25-30 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que la viande soit cuite et les légumes tendres. Ajoutez un peu d''eau pour détendre, si vous le souhaitez, puis incorporez les petits pois et faites cuire encore 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Servir chaud sur des pommes de terre en chemise. Une fois complètement refroidie, la sauce hachée se conservera congelée jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler au réfrigérateur toute la nuit et réchauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:14:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11993,5633,'fr','Spaghetti aux tomates et aux noix','Servez un bol de spaghettis avec des aubergines, des tomates, des câpres et des noix pour un déjeuner riche en fibres, sain et copieux qui fait partie de notre plan d''alimentation saine.','["350 g de spaghettis complets","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 aubergines (environ 550 g), chacune coupée en 4 dans le sens de la longueur, puis coupée en cubes","4 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées finement","3 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","250 ml de bouillon de légumes, préparé avec 1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon (végétalien, si nécessaire)","330 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","30 g de basilic haché","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres","50 g de morceaux de noix, légèrement grillés et hachés s''ils sont gros"]','["Faites cuire les spaghettis en suivant les instructions du paquet, puis égouttez-les en réservant 150 ml d''eau de cuisson. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l’huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''aubergine et l''ail, remuez bien, puis couvrez et laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes en remuant plusieurs fois.","Incorporer la purée de tomates et le vinaigre et cuire encore 2-3 minutes. Versez le bouillon, puis couvrez et laissez cuire encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''aubergine soit tendre lorsqu''on la perce avec un couteau.","Ajouter les tomates cerises et cuire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies mais conservant leur forme. Incorporer le basilic, les câpres et les noix, puis mélanger les spaghettis, en ajoutant un peu de l''eau réservée aux pâtes si nécessaire pour les détendre. Servir immédiatement la moitié. Conservez le reste pour un autre jour. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à quatre jours. Réchauffer dans une poêle à feu doux avec un peu d''eau jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:14:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11994,5635,'fr','Koftas de poulet avec houmous et salade','Dégustez des koftas au poulet avec du houmous et de la salade pour un déjeuner sain. Le tahini contenu dans le houmous est fabriqué à partir de graines de sésame, réputées avoir des propriétés anti-inflammatoires.','["500 g de poulet haché (5% de matière grasse)","1 oeuf","3 cuillères à soupe d''avoine","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 citron, zesté","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché (pris sur les 30 g des ingrédients de la salade ci-dessous)","½ cuillère à café d''huile de colza, pour la friture","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés (liquide réservé)","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","1 citron pressé (environ 3 cuillères à soupe)","1 gousse d''ail","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 gros oignons rouges, coupés en deux et tranchés finement","1 citron, jus","30 g de persil haché","200 g de concombre coupé en morceaux","4 tomates, coupées en quartiers"]','["À l’aide de vos mains, mélangez tous les ingrédients de la kofta, sauf l’huile. Annuler.","Versez tous les ingrédients du houmous dans un bol, avec 3 cuillères à soupe de liquide de pois chiches, puis mixez avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Si vous préférez une texture plus souple, ajoutez davantage de liquide de pois chiches et mélangez à nouveau.","Pour la salade, versez les oignons dans un bol avec le jus de citron et écrasez-les avec vos mains pour les ramollir. Ajoutez le persil haché et réservez.","Façonnez les koftas en 16 boules. Faites chauffer l''huile de colza dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir les koftas 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et bien cuites. Pour finir au barbecue, faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils tiennent tout juste leur forme, puis enfilez-les sur des brochettes. Cuire 4 minutes de chaque côté sur le barbecue. Les koftas crus se conservent au frais dans un récipient hermétique pendant une journée.","Répartissez la moitié du houmous dans deux assiettes. Mélangez la moitié des oignons marinés rapidement avec la moitié des concombres et des tomates, puis servez la salade avec les koftas et le houmous. Réfrigérez les portions restantes pendant un autre jour. Elles se conserveront couvertes et réfrigérées jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:14:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11995,5637,'fr','Soupe de haricots noirs avec des morceaux de raita','Préparez cette soupe riche en épices et cette raita copieuse pour un déjeuner savoureux et rapide. C''est aussi sain, fournissant quatre de vos 5 par jour','["1-1½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","4 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon de légumes","3 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 petits avocats, hachés","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en quartiers, les plus petites coupées en deux","2 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","2 pots de yaourt bio de 120g","15 g de coriandre hachée, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Faire griller brièvement les graines de cumin dans une grande casserole à feu moyen. Versez le paprika et la coriandre, puis versez 2½ boîtes de haricots avec leur liquide, les tomates, la purée de tomates, le bouillon, l''ail et 500 ml d''eau. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 15 min.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les ingrédients de la raita dans un bol.","Mixez les haricots cuits à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement lisses, puis incorporez le reste des haricots et remettez à ébullition. Servir la moitié et garnir de la moitié de la raita, d''un avocat haché et d''un peu de coriandre supplémentaire. Laissez le reste de la soupe refroidir, puis réfrigérez-le pendant un autre jour. Se conservera au frais pendant quatre jours ; la raita se conservera deux jours. Réchauffer la soupe dans une poêle à feu doux-moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude."]','2026-01-11 00:14:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11996,5639,'fr','Pain de viande sain avec sauce spaghetti','Réalisez trois de vos cinq par jour avec ce pain de viande rempli de légumes dans une sauce inspirée du ragoût italien classique. Cela deviendra bientôt un favori de la famille','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza, plus un peu pour le plat","320 g de carottes finement hachées","2 branches de céleri (environ 135 g), hachées finement","1 oignon (environ 125 g), finement haché","500 g de viande hachée de porc maigre à 5 % de matière grasse","1 oeuf","25 g de flocons d''avoine","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé, plus 1 cuillère à café","30 g de basilic, feuilles et tiges séparées","1½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","3 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","500 ml en purée","40 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","350 g de spaghettis complets"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir les carottes, le céleri et l''oignon, à couvert, pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à caraméliser. Remuer à mi-cuisson pour éviter de brûler.","Pendant ce temps, versez le porc dans un bol avec l''œuf, les flocons d''avoine et 1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé. Hachez les tiges de basilic et la plupart des feuilles, en laissant quelques-unes entières. Ajoutez les tiges hachées et la moitié des feuilles hachées au mélange, ainsi que ½ cuillère à café de bouillon. Assaisonnez avec du poivre noir, puis mélangez avec vos mains pour bien mélanger. Versez la moitié des légumes cuits, laissez refroidir pendant environ une minute, puis incorporez les légumes au mélange. Formez un pain (environ 21 x 7 cm), puis déposez-le dans un plat allant au four peu profond et légèrement huilé. Badigeonnez également le dessus d''un peu d''huile. Cuire au four pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme.","Pour la sauce, ajoutez l''ail aux légumes restants. Remettez sur feu moyen et laissez cuire 1 min. Incorporer le reste du paprika et du bouillon, ainsi que la passata et 100 ml d''eau. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 mn. Incorporer le basilic haché restant.","Sortez le pain du four et versez dessus la sauce. Répartir sur le fromage, puis enfourner encore 10 minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les spaghettis en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Servir les spaghettis dans des bols, garnis des tranches de pain, de quelques cuillerées de sauce et des feuilles de basilic entières."]','2026-01-11 00:14:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11997,5641,'fr','Pâtes aux tomates sardines et gremolata','Savourez nos pâtes qui plairont à tous avec des sardines et de la gremolata. Avec des nutriments ajoutés grâce aux sardines, c''est un plat sain, faible en calories et en matières grasses.','["75 g de spaghettis complets","1⁄2 boîte de 120 g de sardines à l''huile","½ cuillère à soupe de câpres, égouttées","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 tomates hachées grossièrement","30g de fusée","½ citron, zesté","une petite poignée de persil finement haché"]','["Faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante salée. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de la boîte de sardines dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites grésiller les câpres et la moitié de l''ail pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Ajoutez les tomates et faites-les frire encore 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies et éclatantes. Incorporer les sardines et la roquette en remuant plusieurs fois pour briser le poisson et flétrir les feuilles. Saison.","Pour la gremolata, mélanger le zeste de citron, le persil et le reste de l''ail dans un petit bol et assaisonner. Égoutter les pâtes et garnir de sauce aux sardines et de gremolata."]','2026-01-11 00:14:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11998,5643,'fr','Ratatouille','Savourez cette recette de ratatouille traditionnelle super saine pour le déjeuner ou le dîner, en sachant qu''elle compte pour quatre sur cinq par jour.','["2 grosses aubergines","4 petites courgettes","2 poivrons rouges ou jaunes","4 grosses tomates mûres","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","paquet de supermarché ou petit bouquet de basilic","1 oignon moyen, pelé et tranché finement","3 gousses d''ail pelées et écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à café de sucre (n''importe quelle sorte)"]','["Coupez 2 grosses aubergines en deux dans le sens de la longueur. Placez-les sur la planche, côté coupé vers le bas, coupez-les à nouveau en deux dans le sens de la longueur, puis en morceaux de 1,5 cm. Coupez les extrémités de 4 petites courgettes, puis en tranches de 1,5 cm.","Épluchez 2 poivrons rouges ou jaunes de la tige vers le bas. Tenez-le droit, coupez autour de la tige, puis coupez-le en 3 morceaux. Coupez toute membrane, puis coupez-la en bouchées.","Marquez une petite croix à la base de chacune des 4 grosses tomates mûres, puis mettez-les dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Versez l''eau bouillante dessus, laissez reposer 20 secondes, puis retirez. Videz l''eau, remplacez les tomates et couvrez d''eau froide. Laissez refroidir puis retirez la peau.","Coupez les tomates en quatre, grattez les graines avec une cuillère, puis hachez grossièrement la chair.","Faites sauter la poêle à feu moyen et lorsqu''elle est chaude, versez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive. Faites dorer les aubergines 5 min de chaque côté jusqu''à ce que les morceaux soient tendres. Mettez-les de côté.","Faites frire les courgettes dans une autre cuillère à soupe d''huile pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées des deux côtés. Répétez avec les poivrons. Ne faites pas trop cuire les légumes à ce stade.","Arrachez les feuilles du bouquet de basilic et réservez. Cuire 1 oignon moyen émincé dans la poêle pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez 3 gousses d''ail écrasées et faites revenir encore une minute. Incorporez 1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge et 1 cuillère à café de sucre, puis versez les tomates et la moitié du basilic.","Remettez les légumes dans la poêle avec un peu de sel et de poivre et laissez cuire 5 min. Servir avec du basilic."]','2026-01-11 00:14:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(11999,5645,'fr','Salade de lentilles et thon','Préparez cette salade de lentilles et de thon facile et sans cuisson pour un déjeuner ou un dîner rapide et sain. Cela ne prend que 15 minutes à préparer – idéal pour les journées chargées','["2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","50 ml d''huile d''olive","2 sachets de 250 g de lentilles du Puy prêtes à l''emploi","2 boîtes de 160 g de steaks de thon à l''eau de source, égouttés et émiettés","160 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux (environ 10)","2 poivrons déjà rôtis, hachés","une poignée de persil finement haché","½ petit bouquet de ciboulette finement hachée, plus un peu pour garnir"]','["Fouetter le vinaigre, la moutarde et l''ail ensemble dans un petit bol. Versez lentement l’huile en fouettant au fur et à mesure jusqu’à émulsionner, puis assaisonnez au goût.","Ajouter les lentilles, le thon, les tomates, les poivrons et les herbes dans un grand bol et mélanger. Versez sur la vinaigrette et mélangez à nouveau. Répartir dans quatre bols et garnir du reste de ciboulette."]','2026-01-11 00:14:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12000,5647,'fr','Bol de grains de saumon fumé à chaud avec yaourt à l''aneth','Savourez ce bol de céréales au saumon fumé rapide et facile avec de la betterave, du radis et du concombre. Rassemblez-le en seulement 20 minutes et garnissez-le de yaourt à l''aneth.','["3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","80 g de concombre tranché finement","4 radis, tranchés finement","2 sachets de 250 g de quinoa prêt à l''emploi","1 citron, jus","200 g de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth, finement haché, plus un peu pour garnir","4 filets de saumon fumé à chaud, sans la peau","3 betteraves cuites au jus naturel, coupées en fines tranches"]','["Mélangez le vinaigre et le sucre avec une pincée de sel dans un bol. Ajouter le concombre et les radis, mélanger et réserver.","Ajoutez le quinoa dans un autre grand bol. Réservez 1 cuillère à café de jus de citron et versez le reste sur le quinoa. Assaisonner légèrement et mélanger. Ajoutez le yaourt et l''aneth haché dans un petit bol avec 1 cuillère à café de jus de citron et mélangez. Saison.","Répartissez le quinoa dans quatre bols peu profonds et garnissez de saumon, de betterave rouge et de légumes marinés. Arrosez de yaourt et décorez avec le reste d''aneth."]','2026-01-11 00:14:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12001,5651,'fr','Tacos à la patate douce','Changez vos repas en milieu de semaine avec ces tacos végétariens colorés. Omettez la feta et la crème sure pour les rendre végétaliennes, ou utilisez une alternative à base de plantes','["1 oignon rouge, tranché","3 citrons verts, pressés","4 patates douces, pelées et coupées en cubes","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé à chaud","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","2 avocats mûrs, écrasés","2 grosses tomates mûres, épépinées et coupées en cubes","8 petites tortillas de farine","50 g de feta émiettée (facultatif)","crème sure et coriandre déchirée pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez l''oignon dans un bol avec les deux tiers du jus de citron vert et une cuillère à café de sel. Laisser mariner une heure.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie plate, mélanger les patates douces, l''huile, les épices et un peu d''assaisonnement. Rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant. Une fois cuit, mélangez avec les haricots noirs.","Mélangez l''avocat et les tomates avec le reste du jus de citron vert et une pincée de sel. Réchauffez les tortillas et ajoutez-y les patates douces et les haricots. Garnir de l''avocat, des tomates et de l''oignon rouge mariné, ainsi que de la feta émiettée, de la crème sure et de la coriandre, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:14:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12002,5653,'fr','Fèves à pizza sur du pain grillé','Réunissez deux plats bien-aimés, des haricots sur du pain grillé et de la pizza, dans cette gâterie hybride pour le déjeuner – toute la famille l''appréciera.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés","4 grosses tranches de pain au levain ou n''importe quel pain de votre choix","125 g de boule de mozzarella déchirée","pepperoni ou jambon tranché, pour servir (facultatif)","une petite poignée de feuilles de basilic déchirées pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une petite casserole à feu doux et faites revenir l''oignon avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez l''ail et l''origan et faites revenir encore 1 min. Incorporer les tomates, la purée de tomates et ½ cuillère à café de sucre, ainsi qu''un peu d''assaisonnement. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire à découvert pendant 10 minutes en remuant souvent. Au bout de 10 minutes, mixez le tout avec un mixeur plongeant. Ajoutez les haricots et laissez mijoter encore 5 minutes.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Disposez les tranches de pain en une seule couche sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les griller sur un côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement grillées. Retourner et garnir chaque morceau de pain grillé avec le mélange de haricots, des morceaux de mozzarella et des tranches de pepperoni ou de jambon, le cas échéant. Glisser sous le gril chaud pendant 3 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu et légèrement doré par endroits. Parsemer de feuilles de basilic avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12003,5657,'fr','Sandwich panuozzo','Préparez vos propres baguettes et pesto pour préparer ces sandwichs inspirés de la pizza pour toute la famille. Ils sont étonnamment rapides et faciles à préparer et sont parfaits pour un déjeuner ou un dîner léger.','["300 g de farine à pain blanche forte, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","3g (environ un demi-sachet) de levure sèche à action rapide","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 tomate, coupée en deux et tranchée","4 tranches de jambon cuit","150 g de boule de mozzarella tranchée et assaisonnée","une petite poignée de roquette (facultatif)","6 cuillères à soupe de pesto (voir ci-dessous pour la recette)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Mettez la farine dans un grand bol, puis incorporez la levure et une grosse pincée de sel. Faites un puits au centre, versez 175 ml d''eau tiède et l''huile et mélangez avec une cuillère en bois pour obtenir une pâte molle et assez humide. Démouler sur une surface légèrement farinée et pétrir pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse. Divisez la pâte en quatre boules et disposez-les sur une plaque farinée, bien espacées. Couvrir d''un torchon et laisser reposer environ 40 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Chauffer le four à 240C/220C chaleur tournante/gaz 8 et mettre une plaque à pâtisserie dans le four pour chauffer. Étalez les boules de pâte sur une surface farinée en longs bâtonnets de baguette d''environ 22 à 25 cm de long, placez-les sur la plaque chaude et enfournez pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient gonflées et dorées, puis laissez refroidir. Peut être préparé quelques heures avant la cuisson.","Pour assembler, divisez le pain sur un côté et ajoutez soigneusement la tomate, le jambon, la mozzarella et la roquette, le cas échéant. Mélanger le pesto avec l''huile d''olive, arroser, couper en deux et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12004,5659,'fr','Bol de céréales aux choux de Bruxelles','Utilisez vos restes de choux de Bruxelles de la table du dîner de Noël avec ce bol de céréales facile, aux saveurs de courge, d''houmous et de tahini.','["½ courge butternut (environ 300 g), pelée et coupée en cubes de 2 cm","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","170 g de choux de Bruxelles, coupés en deux","1 cuillère à soupe de tahin","2 cuillères à café de sirop d''érable","1 citron, zesté et pressé","50g de graines de citrouille","200 g de céréales cuites en sachet (nous avons utilisé du quinoa)","2 cuillères à soupe de houmous","une poignée d''herbes douces (coriandre, persil, menthe ou aneth, ou un mélange), hachées grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger la courge dans la moitié de l''huile sur une extrémité d''une plaque à pâtisserie. Saison. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes en remuant à mi-cuisson. Ajouter les pousses à l''autre extrémité de la plaque, arroser du reste de l''huile, assaisonner et rôtir encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre et les pousses croustillantes.","Mélangez le tahini, le sirop d''érable, le jus de citron et le zeste dans un petit bol pour faire une vinaigrette, en ajoutant un filet d''eau pour la détendre si elle est trop épaisse. Faites griller les graines de citrouille dans une poêle sèche à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à éclater.","Faites chauffer les grains en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis répartissez-les dans deux bols. Garnir de légumes rôtis, de houmous, de graines de citrouille et d''herbes. Arroser de vinaigrette et mélanger le tout juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12005,5665,'fr','Chorizo ​​& carbonara de brocoli à pousses violettes','Préparez cette version saisonnière de la carbonara en 30 minutes pour un repas facile en milieu de semaine. C''est la nourriture réconfortante à son meilleur','["2 grosses gousses d''ail","200 g de chorizo ​​haché","3 gros œufs, plus 2 jaunes d''œufs (congeler les blancs pour une autre recette)","120 g de parmesan finement râpé","400 g de spaghettis","250 g de brocoli à germes violets, coupé en petits morceaux"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu moyen. Épluchez les gousses d''ail entières et faites-les frire avec le chorizo ​​pendant 5 à 7 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le chorizo ​​devienne croustillant sur les bords. (Vous n’aurez pas besoin d’huile car le chorizo ​​libérera la sienne.) Retirez l’ail avec une écumoire et jetez-le.","Fouettez les œufs et les jaunes d''œufs dans un bol. Ajoutez le parmesan, une pincée de sel et du poivre noir.","Faites cuire les spaghettis dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante salée pendant 5 minutes, puis ajoutez les brocolis et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Égoutter en réservant un peu d''eau de cuisson des pâtes. Ajoutez les spaghettis et le brocoli dans la poêle avec le chorizo, puis versez rapidement sur le mélange d''œufs et mélangez rapidement pour bien enrober. Ajoutez un peu ou deux de l''eau de cuisson réservée pour détendre, si nécessaire, puis servez dans quatre bols peu profonds."]','2026-01-11 00:14:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12006,5675,'fr','Soupe crémeuse aux carottes','Préparez une entrée ou un déjeuner réconfortant en un rien de temps avec notre soupe crémeuse aux carottes, garnie de croûtons aux graines d''ail. Rapide et facile, cela prend 30 minutes à réaliser','["1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile","1 oignon, tranché","1 branche de céleri, tranchée","3 gousses d''ail, 2 écrasées et 1 laissée entière","1 kg de carottes tranchées finement","1,5 litre de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet chaud","½ petit bouquet de thym","2 tranches épaisses de levain","1 cuillère à soupe de graines mélangées","1 cuillère à soupe de persil haché","1½ cuillère à soupe de crème double, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande casserole ou une cocotte. Faites revenir doucement l''oignon et le céleri pendant 5 min. Ajouter l''ail écrasé et cuire encore 1 min. Ajoutez les carottes, le bouillon et le thym, puis assaisonnez et portez à ébullition. Baisser le feu et cuire à couvert pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les carottes soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Frottez la gousse d''ail entière sur les deux faces du levain. Déchirez-le en gros morceaux et mélangez-le avec le reste de l''huile, une bonne pincée de sel et les graines. Étalez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Mélanger avec le persil haché et réserver.","Retirez le thym de la poêle et jetez-le. Mixez la soupe avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Incorporer la crème et assaisonner selon votre goût. Pour servir, versez la soupe dans quatre bols, garnissez de croûtons et arrosez d''un peu de crème supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12007,5677,'fr','Crumpets de crabe et de concombre','Rehaussez les crumpets avec une garniture crémeuse au crabe, au concombre et à l''aneth. Il est prêt en 15 minutes, ce qui le rend idéal pour une entrée de Noël ou un déjeuner léger.','["½ concombre pelé, coupé en deux, épépiné et coupé en fines lanières","150-200 g de chair de crabe cueillie (toute la chair blanche, ou un mélange de blanc et de brun, si vous préférez)","1 tbsp crème fraîche","un filet de jus de citron","1 cuillère à café d''aneth haché","4 crumpets"]','["Versez le concombre dans une passoire, saupoudrez de sel et laissez égoutter 10 min.","Versez la chair de crabe dans un bol avec la crème fraîche et le jus de citron. Saison. Pressez les lanières de concombre pour éliminer l''excès d''eau, puis mélangez-les à l''aneth. Faire griller les crumpets, puis garnir du mélange de crabe, d''un petit enchevêtrement de lanières de concombre et de quelques brins d''aneth supplémentaires."]','2026-01-11 00:14:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12008,5682,'fr','Soupe de pois chiches fumée aux herbes et yaourt','Ajoutez une marmite aromatisée pour donner une touche subtile à cette soupe aux pois chiches fumée. Que ce soit pour le déjeuner ou le dîner, c''est un plat qui plaira à toute la famille','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ oignon, finement haché","1 carotte, hachée finement","½ poivron rouge, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 marmite au piment fumé et aux tomates Knorr","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt","un petit bouquet de coriandre ou de menthe"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole et faites revenir l''oignon, la carotte et le poivron à feu doux pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis, mais pas dorés. Ajoutez l''ail et faites revenir encore 30 secondes.","Versez les tomates, puis remplissez la boîte d''eau et versez également dans la casserole. Ajoutez la marmite au piment fumé et aux tomates Knorr et 500 ml d''eau supplémentaire. Portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 10 min. Si vous souhaitez une soupe moins texturée, mixez-la avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse.","Incorporez les pois chiches en en écrasant quelques-uns avec un presse-purée, puis laissez cuire encore 10 mn. Pour servir, verser dans quatre bols, mélanger un peu de yaourt et parsemer de coriandre ou de menthe dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:14:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12009,5684,'fr','Salade de fruits de mer Bloody Mary','Servez cette salade de fruits de mer Bloody Mary en entrée ou en déjeuner léger. Vous pouvez varier les fruits de mer si vous le souhaitez. Les pétoncles et les crevettes ajoutent de la douceur, mais vous pouvez utiliser des moules, des calamars ou même des huîtres.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile","1 gousse d''ail, pelée et écrasée","180 g de petites coquilles Saint-Jacques ou de grosses coquilles Saint-Jacques coupées en tranches","250 g de crevettes crues décortiquées (voir astuce)","200 ml de jus de tomate fraîche","1-2 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres Lee Kum Kee Premium","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja légère Lee Kum Kee Premium","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de riz assaisonné Lee Kum Kee","½ citron, jus","1 branche de céleri, finement hachée","1 petit avocat, coupé en cubes","une poignée de coriandre hachée"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans l''awok, puis augmentez le feu et ajoutez l''ail et les pétoncles. Faire sauter pendant 30 secondes à 1 min jusqu''à ce que les pétoncles soient juste cuits. Verser sur une assiette. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile et faites sauter les crevettes pendant 1 à 2 minutes à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''elles deviennent roses, puis assaisonnez avec un peu de poivre noir. Tip onto the plate with the scallops. Allow the seafood to cool completely.","Pour préparer la sauce Bloody Mary, mélangez le jus de tomate avec la sauce aux huîtres Premium (utilisez 2 cuillères à soupe pour une saveur plus forte), la sauce soja légère Premium, le vinaigre de riz assaisonné et le jus de citron. Goûtez et ajustez la saveur avec plus d''ingrédients si vous souhaitez une saveur encore plus forte.","Lorsque les fruits de mer sont refroidis, répartissez-les dans quatre verres ou petits bols en gardant 4 crevettes pour la garniture. Ajouter le céleri et l''avocat dans chaque verre et verser sur le mélange de tomates. Laisser mariner 10 minutes ou couvrir et réfrigérer jusqu''à 4 heures. Garnir chaque verre avec les crevettes réservées et un peu de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:14:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12010,5686,'fr','Porc au couscous concombre & abricot','Essayez ce plat de porc savoureux avec du couscous pour le dîner. Il est sain, plein de nutriments et contient quatre de vos 5 par jour','["30g de coriandre fraîche","4 petites gousses d''ail hachées","2 cuillères à café de sumac","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","400 g de filet de porc","1½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","goutte d''huile d''olive, pour rôtir","2 oignons rouges, coupés en deux et tranchés","1 aubergine coupée en cubes de 1 cm","200 g de couscous géant complet","petit bouquet d''oignons nouveaux (environ 100 g), tranchés","½ gros concombre (environ 320 g), haché","1 citron zesté et 2 cuillères à soupe de jus","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","15 g de menthe, feuilles hachées","8 abricots frais (environ 320g)","25 g d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Mettre la coriandre dans un petit bol avec l''ail, le sumac, l''huile et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, puis mixer à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Frottez-en un quart sur tout le porc, puis placez le porc sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie et saupoudrez de paprika.","Pour le couscous, frottez une goutte d''huile sur les oignons rouges et l''aubergine, puis répartissez autour du porc. (Si votre plateau n''est pas assez grand, utilisez-en deux.) Rôtissez pendant 25 minutes. Vérifiez le porc et s''il n''est pas cuit mais que les légumes le sont, sortez les légumes du four et faites cuire le porc encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le jus soit clair.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le couscous en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-le et versez-le dans un bol avec le reste du mélange d''ail et d''herbes. Ajouter les oignons nouveaux, le concombre, le zeste et le jus de citron, l''huile d''olive extra vierge et la menthe. Coupez en quartiers et dénoyautez les abricots. S''ils sont mûrs, ajoutez les abricots dans le saladier, mais s''ils sont un peu fermes, ajoutez-les d''abord sur la plaque du four et laissez cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis.","Mettez le porc de côté pour qu''il repose. Ajoutez les oignons rouges rôtis, l''aubergine, les abricots et les amandes au couscous et mélangez le tout. Tranchez le porc, servez-en la moitié avec la moitié du couscous et réfrigérez le reste un autre jour pour le manger froid. Se conservera au frais pendant deux à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:14:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12011,4686,'fr','Yaki udon végétarien','Emballez des légumes avec notre yaki udon plein de saveurs d''inspiration japonaise. C''est sain, ne prend que 25 minutes à préparer et est faible en gras et en calories.','[]','[]','2026-01-11 00:14:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12012,5690,'fr','Ragoût de bœuf balsamique avec purée de légumes','Obtenez cinq de vos cinq par jour dans ce savoureux ragoût de bœuf balsamique accompagné de la nourriture réconfortante idéale – une purée de légumes – parfaite par temps froid.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive ou de colza","2 gros oignons (325 g), coupés en deux et tranchés","600 g de bœuf maigre à ragoût coupé en dés","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","10 g de cèpes séchés","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","1 cuillère à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","320 g de carottes finement hachées","200 g de gros champignons châtaignes coupés en quartiers","quelques brins de thym frais","4 portions de 80 g de brocoli coupé en fleurons","750 g de rutabagas coupé en morceaux","500 g de pommes de terre coupées en petits morceaux"]','["Chauffer le four à 170°C/150°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte à fond épais, puis faites revenir les oignons pendant environ 8 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajoutez le bœuf et l''ail et faites sauter à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient entièrement dorés.","Versez 500 ml d''eau bouillante sur les champignons séchés dans un bol pour les hydrater brièvement, puis versez dans la cocotte avec le liquide et incorporez le vinaigre balsamique, la purée de tomates, le bouillon et la moutarde. Ajoutez les carottes, les châtaignes, le thym et un peu d''assaisonnement. Couvrir, puis mettre au four pendant 3 h jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre. Vers la fin de la cuisson, ajoutez un peu d''eau si le ragoût semble sec.","Lorsque le ragoût est presque prêt, préparez la purée. Faire bouillir le rutabaga et les pommes de terre ensemble pendant 12 à 15 minutes dans une poêle à feu moyen. Bien égoutter, puis écraser avec une râpe de poivre noir. Cuire à la vapeur ou faire bouillir la moitié du brocoli pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. 4 Servir la moitié du ragoût avec le brocoli cuit. Le reste du ragoût se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours et au congélateur jusqu''à un mois. Décongeler soigneusement avant de réchauffer. Réchauffez le ragoût et écrasez-le au micro-ondes et à la vapeur ou faites bouillir le reste du brocoli pendant la nuit pour aider à préserver les vitamines."]','2026-01-11 00:14:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12013,5692,'fr','Spaghettis au thon, câpres et piment','Mélangez du thon, des câpres et de la roquette avec de l''ail, du piment et des spaghettis pour préparer ce souper facile et sain. Cela ne prend que 25 minutes à réaliser','["150 g de spaghettis ou linguines","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","1 piment rouge, épépiné et finement haché, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres égouttées","petit bouquet de persil finement haché (tiges incluses)","145 g de thon à l''eau de source égoutté","90 g de feuilles de roquette ou de pousses d''épinards","½ citron, jus","150 g de spaghettis ou linguines","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","1 piment rouge, épépiné et finement haché, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres égouttées","petit bouquet de persil finement haché (tiges incluses)","145 g de thon à l''eau de source égoutté","90 g de feuilles de roquette ou de pousses d''épinards","½ citron, jus"]','["Faites cuire les spaghettis 9 à 11 minutes dans une grande casserole d''eau bien salée jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient al dente.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu très doux et faites revenir doucement l''ail et le piment pour infuser l''huile. Retirer du feu si l’ail devient légèrement doré, car cela le rendra amer.","Égouttez les pâtes en gardant une tasse d''eau de cuisson et versez les spaghettis dans la poêle. Mélanger les pâtes dans l''huile à feu doux, en ajoutant un peu d''eau des pâtes pour émulsionner dans une sauce qui enrobe les pâtes, puis incorporer les câpres, le persil, le thon et un peu d''assaisonnement. Ne remuez pas trop vigoureusement, vous souhaitez conserver de plus gros morceaux de thon. Mélangez la roquette et le jus de citron dans les spaghettis et servez avec du piment supplémentaire parsemé, si vous le souhaitez.","Faites cuire les spaghettis 9 à 11 minutes dans une grande casserole d''eau bien salée jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient al dente.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu très doux et faites revenir doucement l''ail et le piment pour infuser l''huile. Retirer du feu si l’ail devient légèrement doré, car cela le rendra amer.","Égouttez les pâtes en gardant une tasse d''eau de cuisson et versez les spaghettis dans la poêle. Mélanger les pâtes dans l''huile à feu doux, en ajoutant un peu d''eau des pâtes pour émulsionner dans une sauce qui enrobe les pâtes, puis incorporer les câpres, le persil, le thon et un peu d''assaisonnement. Ne remuez pas trop vigoureusement, vous souhaitez conserver de plus gros morceaux de thon. Mélangez la roquette et le jus de citron dans les spaghettis et servez avec du piment supplémentaire parsemé, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12014,5694,'fr','Céleri-rave rôti aux truffes entières, sauce fromage & noisettes','Essayez ce céleri-rave rôti aux truffes entières sensationnel avec une sauce crémeuse au fromage et aux noisettes. C''est une fantastique alternative végétarienne au déjeuner de Noël ou au rôti du dimanche.','["1 gros céleri-rave","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de truffe, plus un peu pour arroser","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées","½ petit bouquet de sauge, feuilles cueillies","30 g de noisettes grillées et hachées","40g de beurre","40g de farine nature","350 ml de lait entier","100 g de fromage à pâte dure végétarien à l''italienne, râpé","50 ml de crème double"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Étaler une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé sur une grande feuille de papier aluminium, puis déposer le céleri-rave au centre. Frotter le tout avec l''huile de truffe, puis bien assaisonner. Répartissez sur les feuilles d''ail et de sauge, puis rapprochez les bords du papier sulfurisé et du papier d''aluminium, en les frottant pour sceller et former un paquet. Mettre dans le plat à rôtir et rôtir pendant 2 heures ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et doré. Arroser à mi-cuisson d’un filet supplémentaire d’huile de truffe, si vous le souhaitez.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce. Faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole jusqu''à ce qu''il mousse, puis ajoutez la farine et remuez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Cuire 2 minutes, puis incorporer le lait petit à petit jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement incorporé et lisse et crémeux. Fouetter le fromage et la crème, puis assaisonner au goût.","Coupez le céleri-rave rôti en quatre quartiers. Napper de sauce au fromage et parsemer de noisettes."]','2026-01-11 00:14:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12015,5698,'fr','Salade pitta cocktail de crevettes et citron vert','Préparez cette salade cocktail rapide de crevettes et de citron vert comme un déjeuner copieux et plein de saveurs. C''est savoureux, sain et faible en calories','["½ pitta complète","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à café de Tabasco","1 cuillère à café de ketchup faible en sucre et en sel","1 cuillère à soupe de mayonnaise faible en gras","1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt nature sans gras","½ citron vert, zesté et pressé, plus des quartiers pour servir","60 g de gambas cuites","1 laitue Little Gem, feuilles séparées","¼ petit concombre, pelé en rubans","4 tomates cerises, coupées en deux"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Couper le pitta en triangles, disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et arroser d''huile. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants.","Mélangez le Tabasco, le ketchup, la mayonnaise, le yaourt et le zeste et le jus de citron vert. Mélangez les crevettes dans la vinaigrette.","Disposez la laitue, le concombre, les tomates et les crevettes habillées dans une boîte à lunch ou un bocal. Assaisonner, garnir de chips pitta et servir avec des quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:14:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12016,5702,'fr','César pitta','Préparez une pitta avec du poulet, de la salade et une vinaigrette César maison pour un déjeuner facile. Cela ne prend que 10 minutes de la préparation à l''assiette et c''est aussi sain','["1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","½ petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt grec sans gras","1 cuillère à soupe de mayonnaise plus légère","¼ cuillère à café de moutarde en poudre","1 anchois brun, rincé et finement haché","½ cuillère à soupe de parmesan râpé","1 petite poitrine de poulet cuite sans peau, ou 80 g de poulet cuit, émincé","¼ petit concombre, coupé en cubes","3 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","4 feuilles de laitue Little Gem, râpées","1 pain pitta complet"]','["Fouettez le jus de citron, l''ail, le yaourt, la mayonnaise, la moutarde en poudre, l''anchois, le parmesan et 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau avec une bonne mouture de poivre noir. Incorporer le poulet, le concombre, les tomates et la laitue jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien enrobé. Faire griller le pitta et le fendre, puis farcir du mélange de salade et de poulet."]','2026-01-11 00:14:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12017,5704,'fr','Niçoise de légumes grillés et de thon avec vinaigrette crémeuse au kéfir','Servez cette salade copieuse et faible en calories les jours où vous avez besoin d''un repas rapide à midi. C''est un déjeuner idéal, car il regorge de protéines pour vous permettre de tenir l''après-midi.','["100 g de haricots verts parés","6 oignons nouveaux, parés","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","4 cuillères à café de kéfir ou de yaourt nature sans gras","1 cuillère à café de moutarde en poudre","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 laitue Little Gem, feuilles séparées","Boîte de 160 g de thon à l''eau de source égoutté","4 olives noires, coupées en deux","2 œufs moyens, bouillis et coupés en deux"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Portez à ébullition une petite casserole d''eau et blanchissez les haricots verts et les oignons nouveaux pendant 4 min. Égoutter et bien sécher. Mélanger avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile et transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie avec les tomates, côté coupé vers le haut. Assaisonnez le tout avec du poivre noir, puis faites griller pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir et à carboniser. Laisser refroidir légèrement.","Pendant ce temps, fouettez le kéfir, 1 cuillère à café d''huile, la moutarde en poudre, le vinaigre et un peu d''assaisonnement jusqu''à consistance lisse. Disposez les feuilles de laitue, le thon, les olives et les œufs dans des bols peu profonds ou sur des assiettes. Empilez les oignons, les haricots verts et les tomates, puis arrosez de vinaigrette pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12018,5706,'fr','Poke bowls aux crevettes et aux céréales','Faites mariner rapidement les crevettes dans une vinaigrette au piment et au citron vert, puis servez-les avec des céréales, de la mangue, du radis, de l''avocat et des oignons nouveaux. Ce poke bowl est la salade d''été par excellence','["3 citrons verts, pressés","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de sésame","150 g de gambas cuites","Sachet de 250 g de céréales mélangées (ou 250 g de céréales mélangées cuites)","1 avocat mûr, dénoyauté et coupé en cubes","6 radis, tranchés","100 g de mangue pelée et coupée en dés","3 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","pincée de graines de sésame, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Fouetter le jus de citron vert, le piment et l''huile dans un bol. Assaisonner, ajouter les crevettes et laisser mariner 10 min.","Pendant ce temps, versez les grains dans une passoire et versez dessus l''eau chaude de la bouilloire pour les ramollir légèrement. Bien égoutter.","Répartissez les grains dans deux bols. Garnir de crevettes marinées, d''avocat, de radis, de mangue et d''oignons nouveaux. Arrosez les restes de marinade et servez les poke bowls avec une pincée de graines de sésame, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12019,5708,'fr','Soupe verte glacée à la feta','Servez cette soupe verte réfrigérée dans le cadre d''un menu d''été. Aucune cuisson n''est requise : il suffit de mélanger les ingrédients pour préparer un repas rafraîchissant et riche en nutriments.','["70 g de feta végétarienne, émiettée","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre écrasées","1 gros piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 citron, zesté et pressé","200 g de bébés épinards","2 gros avocats mûrs, dénoyautés et coupés en cubes","1 gros concombre, haché","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","250 g de yaourt nature","petit bouquet de basilic","2 cuillères à soupe de mélange de graines grillées, pour servir"]','["Mettez la feta dans un bol et versez dessus l''huile d''olive, les graines de coriandre, le piment et le zeste de citron. Annuler.","Versez le reste des ingrédients (sauf les graines) dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Saison. Ajoutez 50 à 100 ml d''eau froide et mélangez à nouveau pour desserrer. Réfrigérer jusqu''à 1 heure.","Verser dans quatre bols et garnir de feta, du liquide de marinade et des graines."]','2026-01-11 00:14:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12020,5710,'fr','Wraps complets avec houmous de pois à la menthe et betterave','Cette option de déjeuner rapide contient 3 de vos 5 par jour et constitue un excellent carburant pour faire de l''exercice. Les wraps faits maison sont faciles à préparer et sont beaucoup plus savoureux que ceux achetés en magasin.','["85 g de farine complète autolevante, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","160 g de petits pois surgelés, décongelés","1 citron, ½ pressé, l''autre ½ coupé en quartiers (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt bio","1 grosse gousse d''ail","une poignée de feuilles de menthe","2 poignées de jeunes pousses de salade","1 petit oignon rouge, finement tranché","2 grosses betteraves cuites (160 g), tranchées","30 g de feta émiettée","20 g de noix hachées"]','["Pour les wraps, versez la farine dans un petit bol et frottez grossièrement avec l''huile. Ajoutez 60 ml d''eau tiède et mélangez avec vos mains pour obtenir une pâte molle. Coupez-le en deux, puis étalez chaque morceau sur une surface farinée le plus finement possible pour former un rond qui recouvrira le fond d''une grande poêle. Faites chauffer la poêle, puis faites cuire les wraps environ 2 minutes de chaque côté – vous n''avez pas besoin d''huile supplémentaire. Attention à ne pas les rendre croustillants car ils doivent rester souples.","Pour la garniture, mixez les petits pois, le jus de citron, 2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt, l''ail et la majeure partie de la menthe à l''aide d''un robot culinaire ou d''un mixeur plongeant pour obtenir une purée épaisse. Répartir sur les wraps, puis empiler les feuilles de salade, l''oignon et la betterave. Versez une cuillerée du reste du yaourt et répartissez sur la feta, les noix et le reste de la menthe. Servir avec des quartiers de citron à presser, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12021,5712,'fr','Pâtes scandinaves à la betterave et au saumon','Bien manger au travail avec cette salade fusilli de betterave et de saumon d''inspiration scandinave facile à préparer. Cela vous permettra de tenir l''après-midi','["50 g de complet","1 betterave cuite, coupée en quartiers","½ petit avocat mûr, coupé en cubes","2 petits concombres, tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe d''aneth haché","1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt grec sans gras mélangée à 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau","1 cuillère à café bombée de crème de raifort","50 g de saumon poché, émietté","30g de fusée"]','["Faites cuire les fusilli en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les et laissez-les refroidir. Mélangez les pâtes avec la betterave, l''avocat, le concombre, l''aneth, le yaourt et le raifort, puis assaisonnez généreusement de poivre noir.","Mélangez délicatement le saumon et la roquette aux pâtes, puis versez-les dans votre boîte à lunch ou dans un récipient hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:14:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12022,5716,'fr','Bol de lentilles aux patates douces et au chou-fleur','Préparez ce bol végétalien piquant à l’avance et conservez-le au réfrigérateur pour des déjeuners rapides et satisfaisants sur demande. Chaque bol contient quatre de vos 5 par jour','["1 grosse patate douce, avec la peau, lavée et coupée en morceaux moyens","1 chou-fleur, coupé en gros bouquets, tige coupée en dés","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","2 gousses d''ail","200 g de lentilles du Puy","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","1½ citron vert, jus","2 carottes","¼ de chou rouge","½ petit paquet de coriandre"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger la patate douce et le chou-fleur avec le garam masala, la moitié de l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement. Étaler sur une grande plaque à rôtir. Ajouter l''ail et rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les lentilles dans une casserole avec 400 ml d''eau froide. Portez à ébullition, puis laissez mijoter 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient cuites mais encore un peu croquantes. Vidange.","Retirez les gousses d''ail du plateau et écrasez-les avec la lame de votre couteau. Mettez l''ail dans un grand bol avec le reste de l''huile, le gingembre, la moutarde, une pincée de sucre et un tiers du jus de citron vert. Fouettez, puis versez les lentilles chaudes, remuez et assaisonnez au goût. Râpez grossièrement les carottes, râpez le chou et hachez grossièrement la coriandre. Pressez le reste du jus de citron vert et assaisonnez au goût.","Répartissez le mélange de lentilles dans quatre bols (ou quatre récipients si vous le conservez et le réfrigérez). Garnir chaque portion d’un quart de salade de carottes et d’un quart du mélange de patates douces et de chou-fleur."]','2026-01-11 00:14:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12023,5718,'fr','Linguine à l''avocat, tomate et citron vert','Utilisez des ingrédients de guacamole pour préparer ces linguine végétaliennes faibles en calories qui peuvent également être servies froides comme salade de pâtes. Il offre de la saveur et c''est sain','["115 g de linguines complètes","1 citron vert, zesté et pressé","1 avocat, dénoyauté, pelé et haché","2 grosses tomates mûres, hachées","½ paquet de coriandre fraîche, hachée","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché (facultatif)"]','["Cuire les pâtes selon les instructions sur l''emballage – environ 10 minutes. Pendant ce temps, mettez le jus et le zeste de citron vert dans un bol moyen avec l''avocat, les tomates, la coriandre, l''oignon et le piment, le cas échéant, et mélangez bien.","Égoutter les pâtes, les verser dans le bol et bien mélanger. Servir aussitôt encore tiède ou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:14:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12024,5720,'fr','Riz aux artichauts et aubergines','En plus d''être savoureuses, ces aubergines et artichauts sont faibles en gras, faibles en calories et économiques. Préparez-en une grande quantité et mangez-la froide le lendemain','["60 ml d''huile d''olive","2 aubergines coupées en morceaux","1 gros oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","petit paquet de persil, feuilles cueillies, tiges finement hachées","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à café de curcuma","400 g de riz paëlla","1½ l de bouillon de légumes Kallo","2 paquets de 175 g d''artichauts grillés","2 citrons dont 1 pressé, 1 coupé en quartiers pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive ou une poêle à paella. Faites frire les aubergines jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien colorées de tous les côtés (ajoutez une autre cuillère à soupe d''huile si l''aubergine commence à trop accrocher), puis retirez-les et réservez. Ajoutez une autre cuillère à soupe d''huile dans la poêle et faites revenir légèrement l''oignon pendant 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez les tiges d''ail et de persil, laissez cuire encore quelques minutes, puis incorporez les épices et le riz jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien enrobé. Faites chauffer 2 min, ajoutez la moitié du bouillon et laissez cuire à découvert à feu moyen pendant 20 min en remuant de temps en temps pour éviter que ça colle.","Incorporez l''aubergine et les artichauts dans le mélange, versez sur le reste du bouillon et laissez cuire encore 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le riz soit bien cuit. Hachez les feuilles de persil, mélangez-les avec le jus de citron et assaisonnez bien. Apportez la poêle entière à table et versez-la dans des bols, avec les quartiers de citron à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:14:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12025,5724,'fr','Salade de haricots et œufs cannellini avec chapelure croustillante','Cette salade saine a de nombreuses textures : haricots moelleux, chapelure croustillante, œuf crémeux et laitue Little Gem croustillante.','["2 œufs moyens","8 oignons nouveaux, parés (enlever la racine et la moitié de la partie vert foncé)","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 tranche de pain complet, brisée en chapelure épaisse","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés et rincés","jus ½ citron","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","½ petit oignon rouge, finement haché","une poignée de persil haché grossièrement","1 laitue Little Gem, hachée grossièrement"]','["Cuire les oeufs dans l''eau bouillante\r\npendant 6 minutes, ou plus si vous les préférez\r\ndur. Ajoutez les oignons nouveaux pour\r\nles 3 dernières minutes de cuisson. Supprimer et\r\npasser les deux sous l’eau froide. Quand il fait frais\r\nassez pour manipuler, tapoter les oignons nouveaux\r\nSéchez et épluchez les œufs.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un\r\npoêle antiadhésive. Astuce dans le fil d''Ariane\r\net la saison. Faire frire pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant\r\net doré, puis réserver.","Mélangez les oignons nouveaux avec les haricots,\r\njus de citron, moutarde, oignon rouge, persil,\r\nle reste de l''huile et la laitue. Assaisonner et\r\ndisposer dessus les œufs durs coupés en deux. Saupoudrer\r\navec les miettes et manger aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:14:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12026,5726,'fr','Salade de poulet Vitalité avec vinaigrette à l''avocat','Un mélange super vert et sain de graines de soja, de concombre, d''avocat et de laitue Little Gem – garni de poitrine de poulet maigre râpée','["une poignée de graines de soja surgelées","1 poitrine de poulet cuite sans peau, râpée","¼ de concombre pelé, épépiné et haché","½ avocat, chair évidée","quelques gouttes de sauce Tabasco","le jus d''un demi citron et d''un quartier de citron","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge","5-6 feuilles de laitue Little Gem","1 cuillère à café de graines mélangées"]','["Faites blanchir les graines de soja pendant 3 minutes. Rincer\r\ndans l''eau froide et égouttez-les soigneusement. Mettez le\r\npoulet, haricots et concombre dans un bol.","Blitz l''avocat, Tabasco, citron\r\nle jus et l''huile dans un robot culinaire ou\r\navec un mixeur plongeant. Assaisonner, verser\r\ndans le bol et bien mélanger pour bien enrober.","Verser le mélange dans la laitue\r\nfeuilles (ou servez-les avec elles)\r\net saupoudrer de graines. Réfrigérer jusqu''à\r\ndéjeuner, puis servir avec un quartier de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:14:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12027,5728,'fr','Salade de steak, poivrons rôtis et orge perlé','Une salade vibrante remplie de poivrons jaunes et rouges, d''oignons colorés, de bœuf cuit à votre goût et de céréales saines','["85 g d''orge perlé, rincé","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en lanières","1 poivron jaune épépiné et coupé en lanières","1 oignon rouge, coupé en 8 quartiers, laissant la racine intacte","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu plus","1 gros steak maigre d''environ 300 g, débarrassé de tout excès de gras","½ sachet de 100 g de cresson haché grossièrement","jus de ½ citron, plus des quartiers pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez l''orge perlé dans une grande casserole\r\nd''eau. Porter à ébullition et cuire\r\nvigoureusement pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté.\r\nBien égoutter et transférer dans un bol.","Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 200°C/\r\n180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Mettez les poivrons\r\nune plaque à pâtisserie avec les quartiers d''oignons,\r\najouter 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive et rôtir pendant\r\nenviron 20 minutes jusqu''à tendreté.","Pendant que les poivrons rôtissent, frottez\r\nle steak avec un peu d''huile et\r\nsaison. Cuire dans une poêle antiadhésive\r\npendant 3-4 minutes de chaque côté, ou à votre goût.\r\nLaisser reposer quelques minutes. Mélangez le\r\npoivrons et oignons cuits dans le\r\norge. Incorporer le cresson, le citron\r\ndu jus et un peu d''assaisonnement. Trancher finement\r\nles steaks, les déposer sur la salade et\r\nservir avec des quartiers de citron, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:14:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12028,5730,'fr','Poches pitta de courgettes épicées','Offrez-vous un souper solo de légumes grillés, servis dans des pochettes de pain avec du tahini, du houmous, des fèves et de la harissa.','["1 courgette, parée et tranchée finement dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à café de pâte Harissa","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","une petite poignée de fèves (fraîches ou surgelées)","2 cuillères à soupe d''houmous","1 oignon nouveau, tranché finement","1 cuillère à café de pâte de tahini","petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","presser le jus de citron","1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt à la grecque","1 gros pain pitta complet"]','["Mélangez les tranches de courgettes dans le\r\nharissa et huile d''olive, et assaisonner.\r\nCuire sur une poêle bien chaude pendant 2 minutes\r\nde chaque côté ou jusqu''à tendreté. Transfert\r\ndans une assiette et réserver.","Cuire les fèves à ébullition\r\narrosez pendant 2 minutes, égouttez-les sous l''eau froide courante, puis sortez-les du\r\nleurs peaux extérieures. Jetez les peaux.\r\nMettez les fèves, l''houmous et\r\noignon nouveau dans un petit bol et\r\nmélanger pour combiner.","Dans un autre bol, mélangez le tahini,\r\nail, jus de citron et yaourt.\r\nFaites griller le pitta et divisez-le pour créer\r\n2 poches. Verser le houmous\r\nmélanger à l''intérieur de chaque poche, suivi\r\npar les tranches de courgettes épicées et\r\nun filet du mélange de yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:14:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12029,5732,'fr','Pois chiches chauds aux épinards et bacon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Vous vous ennuyez du même vieux sandwich à l''heure du déjeuner ? Essayez cette collation faible en gras rapide et facile','["1 tranche de bacon maigre","1 gousse d''ail tranchée finement","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin","2-3 cuillères à soupe de pois chiches en conserve, égouttés et lavés","½ sac d''épinards en feuilles"]','["Coupez la tranche de bacon en lanières et faites-la cuire dans une poêle antiadhésive bien chaude avec la gousse d''ail. Incorporer le vinaigre de vin et les pois chiches. Incorporer les jeunes pousses d''épinards en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient fanées. Assaisonnez si vous le souhaitez, puis servez chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:14:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12030,5734,'fr','Minestrone en quelques minutes','Préparez un bol de soupe copieux en un rien de temps, parfait pour un déjeuner rapide ou un dîner réchauffant','["1l de bouillon de légumes chaud","400 g de tomates concassées en boîte","100 g de spaghettis fins, coupés en petits morceaux","350 g de légumes mélangés surgelés","4 cuillères à soupe de pesto","un filet d''huile d''olive","fromage parmesan végétarien grossièrement râpé, pour servir"]','["Portez le bouillon à ébullition avec les tomates, puis ajoutez les spaghettis et laissez cuire 6 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits. Quelques minutes avant que les pâtes soient prêtes, ajoutez les légumes et ramenez à ébullition. Laisser mijoter 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout soit cuit.","Servir dans des bols arrosés de pesto et d''huile,\r\nsaupoudré de parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:14:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12031,5736,'fr','Salade de haricots beurre et tomates chili','Super sain, compte pour 2 sur 5 par jour','["Pot de 540 g de gros haricots beurre","500 g de tomates pelées et évidées","1 piment rouge","bouquet de basilic","1 gousse d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge"]','["Égouttez et rincez les haricots beurre et placez-les dans un bol à mélanger. Hachez les tomates et ajoutez-les aux haricots. Placer le piment, le basilic (en réservant quelques petites feuilles), l''ail, l''huile d''olive et le vinaigre dans le petit bol d''un robot culinaire puis fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajouter aux tomates et aux haricots, assaisonner et mélanger. Servir parsemé de quelques petites feuilles."]','2026-01-11 00:14:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12032,5738,'fr','Minestrone printanier','Cette soupe simple tire le meilleur parti des légumes du printemps et deviendra votre plat préféré pour un déjeuner ou un dîner rapide.','["200 g de légumes verts mélangés (nous avons utilisé des asperges, des fèves et des oignons nouveaux)","700 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","140 g de pâtes cuites (les spaghettis fonctionnent bien, coupés en petits morceaux)","Boîte de 215 g de haricots beurre, rincés et égouttés","3 cuillères à soupe de pesto vert"]','["Placez les légumes verts dans une casserole de taille moyenne, puis versez dessus le bouillon. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient bien cuits, environ 3 minutes. Incorporer les pâtes cuites, les haricots et 1 cuillère à soupe de pesto. Réchauffez, puis versez dans des bols et garnissez chacun d''un autre filet de pesto."]','2026-01-11 00:14:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12033,5740,'fr','Salade de riz au thon à faire soi-même','Idéale pour les ménages occupés, cette salade copieuse se conserve bien au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours, prête à être versée dans un bol en cas de petit creux.','["environ 900 g/2 lb de riz cuit froid (environ 400 g/14 oz de riz non cuit)","400 g de thon à l''eau de source","200 g de petits pois surgelés, décongelés sous le robinet chaud","2 poivrons rouges pelés à l''éplucheur de pommes de terre, épépinés et coupés en dés","3 tomates coupées en petits morceaux","5 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","bouquet de persil plat, haché","une grosse poignée d''olives vertes dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Le riz cuit aura probablement\r\nregroupés, alors divisez-le en un\r\ngrand bol à mélanger. Flocon de thon,\r\npuis incorporez les petits pois, les poivrons, les tomates,\r\noignons nouveaux, persil et olives, si vous êtes\r\nles utiliser.","Incorporer la mayonnaise, le citron\r\njus et huile d''olive et assaisonner au goût.\r\nCouvrir le bol d''un film alimentaire ou placer\r\ndans un grand récipient en plastique et laissez votre\r\nla maison se sert à chaque fois\r\nils ont faim."]','2026-01-11 00:14:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12034,5742,'fr','Club-sandwich vert','Ce sandwich sain regorge de bienfaits pour vous tenir en haleine jusqu''au dîner','["3 tranches de pain grillé aux grains entiers ou au seigle","3 cuillères à soupe d''houmous prêt à l''emploi","1 petit avocat (100g), dénoyauté et tranché","1 poignée de feuilles de roquette","8 à 12 tomates cerises, tranchées"]','["Faire griller le pain et tartiner du houmous\r\nuniformément sur un côté de chaque tranche. Sur\r\nune tranche de pain, déposez la moitié de l''avocat,\r\nroquette et tomate. Assaisonner avec\r\npoivrer, puis recouvrir d''une autre tranche.","Empilez le reste de l''avocat, roquette\r\net la tomate, assaisonner à nouveau et garnir de\r\nla troisième tranche."]','2026-01-11 00:14:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12035,4741,'fr','Plats principaux de la boîte à lunch','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Des garnitures de boîte à lunch satisfaisantes et nutritives qui prennent quelques minutes à préparer.','["Wrap au poulet et au guacamole","salade de pâtes très facile","mini rouleaux de jambon","déjeuner du laboureur de fromage","soupe de patates douces et pois chiches (tous les ingrédients de la recette ci-dessous)"]','["Poulet\r\nguacamole\r\nwrapPrendre 1 tortilla\r\nenvelopper et tartiner 2 cuillères à soupe du commerce\r\nguacamole au milieu. Poser ½\r\npoitrine de poulet râpée et ½ tranchée\r\npoivron rouge sur le dessus. Saupoudrer de 30g\r\ncheddar râpé et rouler fermement. Enveloppement\r\ndans du papier sulfurisé et nouer avec de la ficelle,\r\nou rouler fermement dans un film alimentaire (pour 1 personne).","Très facile\r\nsalade de pâtesCuire 85g de pâtes\r\nformes, en ajoutant 3 cuillères à soupe chacune surgelée\r\npetits pois et maïs doux surgelés pour le\r\ndernière minute. Vidange; rincer à l''eau froide.\r\nMélangez 1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt nature et\r\nvinaigrette balsamique du commerce,\r\navec 1 cuillère à café de mayonnaise. Verser sur le\r\npâtes, puis incorporer 1 cuillère à soupe hachée\r\nbasilic et 3 tomates cerises coupées en deux (pour 1 personne).","Mini rouleaux de jambonMélanger 1 cuillère à soupe de mayonnaise\r\navec 1 cuillère à café chacun\r\ngrains entiers\r\nmoutarde et miel. Diviser 2 petits\r\npetits pains complets coupés en deux et tartinés\r\nchaque côté avec le mélange de mayonnaise. Des trucs\r\nchaque rouleau avec 2-3 tranches de concombre,\r\n1 feuille de Baby Gem et 1 tranche de jambon (pour 1 personne).","Boîte à lunch du laboureurCoupez un morceau de\r\ncheddar et 1 pomme\r\nen quartiers (pressez-y un peu de jus de citron pour éviter qu''ils ne brunissent). Placez 2 feuilles de Baby Gem\r\ndans un récipient, puis versez 2 cuillères à soupe\r\nchutney dans une feuille et utilisez l''autre\r\nfeuille pour contenir une salade composée d''1 petite\r\ncarotte râpée, 3 tomates cerises et\r\n1 cuillère à soupe de cresson. Servir avec une sélection de\r\ndes craquelins, si vous le souhaitez (pour 1 personne).","Patate douce\r\n& pois chiches\r\nsoupeFaites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une poêle; adoucir\r\n1 oignon finement coupé pendant 3 min. Ajouter\r\n2 gousses d''ail tranchées, cuire 3 minutes\r\nplus. Ajouter 1 cuillère à café de chaque cumin moulu\r\net coriandre moulue, cuire 1 min.\r\nAjoutez 1 patate douce coupée en 1 cm\r\ncubes. Faire frire 2 minutes, puis verser dessus\r\n600 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud. Faire bouillir pendant\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pomme de terre soit tendre. Ajouter\r\nBoîte de 220 g de pois chiches égouttés. Chaleur\r\nà travers avant de fouetter jusqu''à consistance lisse.\r\nIncorporer 1 cuillère à soupe de crème sure et 50 ml\r\ndu lait. Verser dans un thermos lorsqu''il est chaud (pour 2 personnes)."]','2026-01-11 00:14:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12036,5748,'fr','Galettes de poireaux, fromage et pommes de terre','Des mini-paquets de pâtisserie végétarienne avec du fromage suintant constituent une collation maison réconfortante et d''un excellent rapport qualité-prix.','["2 petites pommes de terre (environ 300 g/11 oz), coupées en cubes de 1 cm","noisette de beurre","2 petits poireaux, feuilles extérieures coriaces enlevées, fendus en deux dans le sens de la longueur et finement tranchés","3 brins de thym, feuilles hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","2 cuillères à soupe de crème","farine, pour saupoudrer","500 g de bloc de pâte brisée","140 g de fromage gallois Caerphilly, cheddar fort ou alternative végétarienne, coupé en petits morceaux","1 œuf battu"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre à l''ébullition, salées\r\narroser pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à tendreté, mais quand même\r\ngardant leur forme. Pendant ce temps, faites fondre le\r\nbeurre dans une grande casserole. Ajouter les poireaux\r\net le thym et ramollir pendant 10-12 minutes.\r\nÉgoutter les pommes de terre et les ajouter aux poireaux avec\r\nla moutarde et beaucoup d''assaisonnement. Remuer\r\ndans la crème et laisser refroidir un peu.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nSur un plan fariné, étalez la pâte\r\nà l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Utiliser un côté\r\nune assiette ou un bol comme gabarit à découper\r\nsur 6 cercles de 15 cm. Mélanger le fromage\r\navec le mélange de poireaux et empiler une motte\r\ndu mélange au centre de chaque pâtisserie\r\ncercle. Badigeonner les bords avec un peu\r\nœuf, puis rapprochez les bords et\r\nsertir avec les doigts pour sceller.","Placer les pâtés sur une plaque à pâtisserie\r\ntapissé de papier sulfurisé, pinceau\r\navec l''oeuf restant et enfourner\r\npendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.\r\nServir tiède ou laisser refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:14:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12037,5750,'fr','Soupe courgettes, pommes de terre et cheddar','Cette soupe à congeler est une délicieuse façon d''utiliser une surabondance de courgettes','["500 g de pommes de terre non pelées et hachées grossièrement","2 cubes de bouillon de légumes","1 kg de courgettes hachées grossièrement","botte d''oignon nouveau, tranché - gardez-en 1 pour servir, si vous mangez tout de suite","100 g de cheddar extra-affiné ou alternative végétarienne, râpé, plus un petit supplément pour servir","bonne noix de muscade fraîche râpée, et un peu plus pour servir"]','["Mettez les pommes de terre dans une grande poêle avec\r\njuste assez d''eau pour les couvrir et\r\némietter dans les cubes de bouillon. Apporter au\r\nfaire bouillir, puis couvrir et cuire 5 minutes. Ajouter\r\nles courgettes, remettez le couvercle et\r\ncuire encore 5 minutes. Jeter au printemps\r\noignons, couvrir et cuire encore 5 minutes.","Retirez du feu, puis incorporez le\r\nfromage et assaisonner avec la muscade, le sel\r\net du poivre. Mélangez à une soupe épaisse, en ajoutant\r\nplus d''eau chaude jusqu''à ce que vous obteniez le\r\nla cohérence que vous aimez. Servir dispersé\r\navec cheddar extra râpé, oignons nouveaux\r\net de la muscade ou du poivre. Ou cool et\r\ncongeler dans des sacs ou des contenants de congélation avec\r\nbonnes paupières jusqu''à 3 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:15:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12038,5752,'fr','Salade étagée de crevettes','Les dîners en solo peuvent toujours être un régal avec cette recette rapide mais pleine de saveurs','["1 oeuf","1 laitue Baby Gem, râpée","195 g de boîte de maïs doux","1 carotte, râpée grossièrement","½ petit concombre épépiné et coupé en dés","100 g de crevettes cuites","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise extra légère","1 cuillère à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","éclabousser de sauce Tabasco","quartier de citron, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faire bouillir l''œuf dans une petite casserole bouillante\r\narroser pendant 8 minutes, égoutter et passer sous\r\neau froide jusqu''à refroidissement. Décortiquer, puis trancher.","Disposez la salade dans un bol en commençant par\r\nla laitue, puis le maïs, la carotte,\r\nconcombre, œuf et terminer par le\r\ncrevettes. Mélangez la mayonnaise et le ketchup\r\navec un filet de Tabasco, puis versez\r\npar-dessus. Servir avec un citron\r\ncoin, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12039,4751,'fr','Collations en boîte à lunch','Gardez la sensation de faim à distance avec ces collations saines et délicieuses pour la boîte à lunch','["trempette aux haricots avec des bâtonnets de légumes","smoothie framboise-banane","prunes à la crème à la cannelle","Pots de granola au yaourt et aux abricots","muffins aux carottes et à l''ananas (tous les ingrédients des recettes ci-dessous)"]','["Trempette aux haricots avec\r\nbâtonnets de légumes5 de 5 par jour, faibles en gras.\r\nWhiz boîte de 215g\r\nharicots beurre égouttés, presser le citron\r\njus, 1 petite gousse d''ail écrasée,\r\n1 cuillère à soupe chacun de persil haché et de menthe,\r\n2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Servir\r\navec des coupe-légumes en 1\r\nbranche de céleri, 1 carotte et ½ poivron rouge - enveloppez-les dans un morceau de papier absorbant humide pour éviter qu''ils ne se dessèchent\r\n(pour 1 personne).","Smoothie framboise-bananeWhizz 85g de framboises avec\r\n1 banane hachée et 150 ml d''orange\r\njus jusqu''à consistance lisse (pour 1 personne).","Cannelle\r\nprunes à la crèmeMettez 1 cuillère à soupe de miel,\r\n1 cuillère à café de beurre, 2 quartiers de prunes, quelques\r\ngouttes d''extrait de vanille, une pincée moulue\r\ncannelle et 2 cuillères à café d''eau dans un plat.\r\nCouvrir d''un film alimentaire, percer, passer au micro-ondes\r\npendant 3 minutes à puissance élevée. Une fois refroidi, mettez\r\nfruits dans un récipient et versez 2-3 cuillères à soupe de crème anglaise dessus. Sceller et réfrigérer\r\n(pour 1 personne).","Yaourt à l''abricot\r\npots de granolaMélanger 200 g de flocons d''avoine, 2 cuillères à soupe de miel et\r\n1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol dans une plaque à pâtisserie.\r\nÉtalez et enfournez à 200C/180C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 6 pendant 7 minutes. Remuer, enfourner 7 min\r\nplus. Cool. Mélanger avec 150 g de fruits secs (assez pour 8 portions).\r\nPour une portion, mélangez 100 ml de naturel\r\nyaourt avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''abricot sans sucre\r\nconfiture dans un récipient. Conservez le granola dans un\r\nrécipient hermétique et portion dans un\r\npetit sac lors de l''emballage de la boîte à lunch.","Carotte &\r\nmuffins à l''ananasTamissez ensemble 140 g de farine autolevante,\r\n85 g de farine complète (en réservant environ\r\n2 cuillères à soupe de son), ½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate\r\nde soda, 2 cuillères à café de cannelle moulue et un\r\npincée de sel. Dans un autre bol, battre 150 ml\r\nhuile de tournesol avec 100 g de poudre dorée\r\nsucre. Ajouter 200g de purée cuite\r\ncarottes, 3 tranches d''ananas en conserve, coupées\r\nen cubes, 2 cuillères à soupe de jus d''ananas de\r\nla boîte, 1 œuf et 1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille.\r\nIncorporer 50 g de graines de tournesol. Plier à sec\r\nmélanger avec le liquide humide. Découpez une douzaine\r\nCarrés de 10 cm de papier sulfurisé et\r\ndéposer dans les trous d''un moule à muffins. Cuillère\r\nmélange dans le moule, saupoudrer de son et\r\nquelques graines de tournesol. Cuire à 200C/\r\n180°C ventilateur/gaz 6 pendant 20-25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un\r\nla brochette en ressort propre. Laisser refroidir (pour 12)."]','2026-01-11 00:15:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12040,5756,'fr','Soupe de nouilles facile','Cette soupe rapide et facile est le repas parfait pour les enfants – satisfaisante et saine également.','["500 ml de bouillon de légumes faible en sel (en cube, c''est bien)","petit morceau de gingembre frais, râpé","1 gousse d''ail, râpée","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja et 2 cuillères à café de sucre","85 g de restes de poulet cuit, émincés","une poignée de légumes mélangés (essayez les germes de soja, le maïs doux, les carottes tranchées et le mangetout)","Paquet de 150 g de nouilles directement cuites au wok (ou utilisez 85 g/3 oz séchées, cuites selon les instructions sur l''emballage)","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés, pour servir","jus 1 citron vert"]','["Mettez le bouillon, le gingembre, l''ail, la sauce soja et\r\nsucre dans une casserole, puis faites chauffer. Laisser mijoter\r\npendant 5 minutes. Retirez du feu, versez dans un\r\nbol allant au micro-ondes, puis laisser refroidir. Lancer\r\ndans le poulet et les légumes, couvrir, puis réfrigérer pendant\r\njusqu''à un jour.","Au moment de manger, retirez-le de\r\nréfrigérateur, puis ajoutez les nouilles cuites.\r\nCuire au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 2 minutes, remuer,\r\npuis cuire encore 1 min ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nbrûlant. Répartir dans deux bols\r\nou des tasses, parsemer d''oignons nouveaux\r\net ajoutez le jus de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:15:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12041,5760,'fr','Saladier jambon & betterave','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une excellente salade légère pour le déjeuner qui utilise des ingrédients de tous les jours d''une manière nouvelle et intéressante.','["100 g de petits pois surgelés","175g de betterave","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","2 cuillères à café de sauce au raifort","demi-laitue iceberg, râpée","100 g de jambon tranché très fin"]','["Versez de l''eau bouillante sur les petits pois et\r\nlaisser reposer 2 minutes, puis bien égoutter. Hacher\r\nla betterave en cubes.","Inclinez les petits pois, la betterave et les oignons nouveaux\r\ndans un bol et bien mélanger. Mélangez le yaourt et\r\nraifort, puis ajoutez environ 1 cuillère à soupe bouillante\r\neau pour faire une sauce coulante.","Empilez la laitue dans des bols, puis versez-la à la cuillère\r\nsur le mélange de betteraves. Arroser finement le\r\nvinaigrette sur la salade et garnir de jambon."]','2026-01-11 00:15:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12042,5762,'fr','Soupe de haricots noirs chipotle et oignons marinés au citron vert','Utilisez des légumineuses du commerce dans cette soupe saine d''inspiration mexicaine – rafraîchissez-la avec des oignons doux, de la coriandre et de la crème aigre.','["jus de 2 citrons verts","2 petits oignons rouges, tranchés finement","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","½ cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle, ou Tabasco, au goût","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","400 ml de bouillon de légumes","crème sure demi-graisse, pour servir","feuilles de coriandre, pour servir","chips tortilla croustillantes, pour servir"]','["Pour faire les oignons marinés au citron vert,\r\nmélanger ½ du jus de citron vert et ½ du\r\noignons dans un petit bol et assaisonner.\r\nLaisser mariner 30 min.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une\r\ncasserole à feu moyen-vif.\r\nAjouter l''ail et les oignons restants,\r\net la saison. Cuire 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le\r\nles oignons sont translucides. Ajouter les épices\r\net la purée de chipotle, cuire 1 min, puis\r\najouter les haricots, le bouillon et le reste\r\njus de citron vert. Laissez mijoter 15 mn puis\r\nréduire en purée dans un mixeur.","Versez la soupe dans une casserole propre pour\r\nréchauffer. Servir avec un peu de égoutté\r\noignons marinés, garnis d''un petit\r\nun filet de crème aigre et un peu\r\ncoriandre et les tortillas à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:15:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12043,5764,'fr','Fèves aux tomates et anchois','Fèves glorieusement colorées aux tomates et aux anchois, parfaites avec l''agneau de printemps','["1,3 kg de jeunes fèves dans la cosse (pour donner environ 350 g de fèves décortiquées)","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","450 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","6 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","4-6 filets d''anchois, hachés","2 cuillères à soupe de marjolaine ou de persil frais haché"]','["Blanchir les haricots décortiqués dans l''eau bouillante pendant 1 minute. Égouttez-les dans une passoire et passez-les sous l''eau froide pour les refroidir rapidement. Égouttez à nouveau et retirez les peaux dures extérieures – faites une entaille sur le dessus et sortez les haricots.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude, ajoutez les tomates et faites revenir à feu vif jusqu''à ce que les jus commencent à couler et à caraméliser. Ajoutez les oignons nouveaux et l''ail et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons commencent à ramollir et que l''ail commence à devenir doré. Ajoutez maintenant les haricots et faites-les sauter pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien chauds. Incorporez les anchois pour qu''ils se brisent, assaisonnez au goût avec du sel et du poivre noir fraîchement moulu, puis incorporez la marjolaine ou le persil et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12044,5766,'fr','Wraps prêts à emporter','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Parfaits pour les enfants et assez faciles à préparer eux-mêmes, ces wraps pratiques sont parfaits pour le voyage en voiture.','["4 tortillas roulées","8 petites ou 4 grosses tranches de jambon","2 poivrons rôtis (en pot, c''est bien), hachés grossièrement","une poignée de cheddar râpé"]','["Disposez les tortillas sur une surface plane. Placer 1 à 2 tranches de jambon au milieu de chacune. Saupoudrer de poivre haché et de fromage en laissant un bord de 2 cm à une extrémité. En commençant à l’autre extrémité, enroulez-le aussi serré que possible. Enveloppez chaque tortilla dans du papier d''aluminium et tournez les extrémités pour sceller. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 3 jours.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/ventilateur 160°C/gaz 3. Placer les wraps dans le four (directement sur la grille du four, c''est bien) et cuire pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage commence à fondre. Déballez-le pendant les 5 dernières minutes si vous voulez que l''extérieur soit croustillant. Retirez le papier d''aluminium avant de manger."]','2026-01-11 00:15:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12045,5768,'fr','Salade de couscous épicée','Cela peut être préparé comme salade de plat principal (idéal pour les boîtes à lunch) ou comme plat d''accompagnement pour l''agneau rôti.','["100 g de couscous","Boîte de 220 g de pois chiches rincés et égouttés","100 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","1 poivron rouge rôti, haché","25 g d''amandes effilées grillées","une poignée de feuilles de menthe hachées","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec nature","1 cuillère à café d''harissa"]','["Versez le couscous et les pois chiches\r\nun bol et verser sur le bouillon. Couverture\r\net laissez reposer 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle couscous a absorbé le bouillon. Autoriser\r\npour refroidir un peu. Passer le citron\r\nle zeste et le jus, le poivre, les amandes et la menthe.\r\nVerser dans un récipient, puis garnir de\r\nle yaourt et un filet d''harissa."]','2026-01-11 00:15:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12046,5770,'fr','Salade de légumes grillés','Servez ces légumes grillés avec de la mozzarella de bufflonne déchirée, pour une belle entrée ou un dîner léger.','["2 poivrons rouges","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 piment rouge épépiné, finement haché","1 aubergine coupée en rondelles de 1 cm","2 oignons rouges, tranchés d''environ 1½ cm d''épaisseur mais conservés en tranches entières","6 tomates séchées dodues dans l''huile, égouttées et coupées en lanières","poignée d''olives noires","une grosse poignée de basilic, grossièrement déchiré"]','["Tout d’abord, noircissez les poivrons partout –\r\nfaites-le directement sur une flamme, à chaud\r\ncharbons ou sous un gril chaud. Une fois complètement noircis, mettez-les dans un bol, couvrez\r\navec une assiette et laisser refroidir.","Pendant que les poivrons refroidissent, mélangez\r\nl''huile, le vinaigre, l''ail et le piment dans un grand\r\nbol. Sur un barbecue ou une poêle bien chaude,\r\ngriller l''aubergine, la courgette et\r\noignons par lots jusqu''à ce qu''ils aient défini\r\ndes marques de gril des deux côtés et commencent\r\npour ramollir. Le temps dépendra du\r\nl''intensité de votre gril, alors utilisez votre\r\njugement – courgettes et oignons rouges\r\nc''est bien encore légèrement croustillant mais tu veux\r\nl''aubergine est cuite jusqu''au bout.\r\nLorsque les légumes sont prêts, mettez-les\r\ndirectement dans la vinaigrette pour mariner,\r\ncasser les oignons en rondelles.","Quand les poivrons sont suffisamment froids\r\nmanipuler, peler, retirer la tige et\r\ngrattez les graines. Couper en lanières et\r\nmélanger les légumes avec le jus de\r\nle bol. Incorporer les tomates, les olives,\r\nbasilic et assaisonnement. Arroser de plus\r\nhuile, si vous le souhaitez, et servez-le soit sur son\r\npropre ou avec de la mozzarella ou de la feta émiettée."]','2026-01-11 00:15:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12047,5772,'fr','Salade de pâtes dans le placard','Cette salade de pâtes constitue un déjeuner rapide et sain, ou est parfaite préparée à l''avance pour un pique-nique ou une boîte à lunch.','["2 cuillères à café d''oignon rouge finement haché","1 cuillère à café de câpres","1 cuillère à soupe de pesto","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","Boîte de 185 g de thon à l''eau de source égoutté","100 g de restes de formes de pâtes","3 tomates séchées, hachées"]','["Mélangez l''oignon, les câpres, le pesto et l''huile.\r\nÉcaillez le thon dans un bol avec les pâtes\r\net les tomates, puis incorporer le mélange de pesto."]','2026-01-11 00:15:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12048,5776,'fr','Salade croquante d''été','Le croquant des haricots verts fonctionne particulièrement bien dans cette salade','["Paquet de 200 g de petits champignons de Paris émincés finement","jus d''1 citron","200 g de haricots verts parés","une poignée d''herbes vertes et tendres, comme le basilic, le cerfeuil, le persil et l''estragon","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en quartiers","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","75 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), coupé en grosses boucles"]','["Dans un bol, mélanger les champignons avec la moitié  \r\nle jus de citron et réserver – le citron \r\nle jus ramollira les champignons. Blanchir  \r\nles haricots dans l''eau bouillante salée pendant 5-6 minutes \r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils aient encore un craquement, mais ils ne le sont pas \r\ngrinçant, puis égouttez-le et laissez-le refroidir dans de l''eau glacée.","Mélanger les haricots et les champignons ensemble \r\ndans un bol avec les herbes et assaisonner avec \r\nsel et poivre. Passer à travers les tomates, \r\nle jus de citron restant et l''huile d''olive et \r\nparsemer de parmesan juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12049,5778,'fr','Poulet au four avec croûtons à l''ail','Mélangez le poulet, les tomates, la mozzarella et les croûtons à l''ail faits maison pour préparer ce one-pot rapide et facile. C’est idéal pour les journées chargées où vous manquez de temps','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","200g en purée","250 g de tomates cerises","125 g de boule de mozzarella allégée, égouttée et tranchée","3 tranches épaisses de levain ou de bloomer, coupées en cubes de 2 cm","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","pincée d''origan séché","½ petit bouquet de basilic, feuilles cueillies","salade verte, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Couper les blancs de poulet en deux, sans aller jusqu''au bout, et les ouvrir comme un livre. Assaisonnez bien. Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle allant au four ou une cocotte peu profonde (ou une poêle, puis transférez-la dans un plat à rôtir) et faites frire le poulet pendant 3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré.","Versez la passata sur le poulet, puis placez les tomates cerises dans et autour du plat. Disposez les tranches de mozzarella dessus. Versez les cubes de pain dans un bol et mélangez-les avec le reste de l''huile, l''ail et l''origan. Répartir sur le poulet et les tomates. Transférer au four et cuire au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu et que le poulet soit bien cuit. Parsemer de basilic et servir avec une salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:15:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12050,5782,'fr','Boulettes de viande épicées aux haricots noirs au piment','Donnez à vos boulettes de viande préférées une cure de jouvence saine avec cette recette faible en gras, faible en calories et à faible IG avec de la dinde hachée, des haricots noirs et de l''avocat.','["1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 gros poivron jaune, coupé en quartiers, épépiné et coupé en dés","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2-3 cuillères à café de pâte de piment chipotle","300 ml de bouillon de poulet réduit en sel","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs ou rouges égouttés","1 avocat dénoyauté, pelé et haché","jus ½ citron vert","500 g de poitrine de dinde hachée","50 g de flocons d''avoine","2 oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée, tiges et feuilles séparées","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza"]','["Préparez d’abord les boulettes de viande. Versez le hachis dans un bol, ajoutez les flocons d''avoine, les oignons nouveaux, les épices et les tiges de coriandre, puis pétrissez légèrement les ingrédients jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Façonner 12 boules de la taille d''une table de ping-pong. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez les boulettes de viande et faites-les cuire en les retournant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Retirer de la poêle.","Versez l''oignon et l''ail dans la poêle avec le poivre et faites sauter jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer le cumin et la pâte de piment, puis verser le bouillon. Remettez les boulettes de viande dans la poêle et faites cuire à couvert à feu doux pendant 10 min. Incorporer les tomates et les haricots et cuire encore quelques minutes à découvert. Mélangez les morceaux d''avocat dans le jus de citron vert et servez les boulettes de viande garnies de feuilles d''avocat et de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:15:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12051,5784,'fr','Wraps d''agneau de Bombay','Pimentez le hachis d''agneau surgelé bon marché avec des saveurs indiennes et empilez-le sur des wraps à la farine ou des chapatis pour un dîner sain et copieux.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 gros oignon rouge, haché","3 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","200 g de viande hachée d''agneau surgelée","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry (nous avons utilisé du tikka)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 grosses pommes de terre, coupées en cubes de 2 cm","250 g de petits pois surgelés","8 wraps à la farine ou chapatis, réchauffés","140g de yaourt nature"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez l''oignon et faites revenir quelques minutes pour le ramollir. Ajoutez l''ail, remuez pendant 1 min, puis ajoutez le hachis surgelé. Cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit décongelé et bien doré, puis incorporer la pâte de curry, les tomates, les pommes de terre et une demi-boîte d''eau. Assaisonnez bien, puis couvrez avec un couvercle et laissez mijoter pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient presque cuites.","Retirez le couvercle et laissez mijoter encore 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait réduit et que la sauce adhère aux pommes de terre et à la viande hachée. Ajoutez les petits pois, remuez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient décongelés, puis servez avec les wraps chauds et le yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:15:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12052,5786,'fr','Pâtes crémeuses aux tomates, courgettes et crevettes','Cette sauce pour pâtes fraîche et rapide aux tomates cerises, crevettes et crème fraîche est idéale pour un dîner en milieu de semaine et est faible en gras.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","2 grosses courgettes miniatures de 400 g, tranchées","400 g de pâtes orecchiette, ou toute autre petite forme de pâtes","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates cerises","une bonne pincée de sucre","200 g de crevettes crues décortiquées","100 g de crème fraîche demi-élevée","basilic en petit paquet, feuilles seulement, déchirées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez l''ail et faites grésiller quelques minutes, puis ajoutez les courgettes et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Ajouter les tomates, le sucre et l''assaisonnement dans la poêle, remuer et laisser mijoter à découvert pendant environ 10 minutes pendant la cuisson des pâtes.","Ajoutez les crevettes à la sauce et faites bouillonner jusqu''à ce qu''elles deviennent roses. Égouttez les pâtes et ajoutez-les à la sauce avec la crème fraîche. Laisser mijoter encore 1 à 2 minutes, puis ajouter le basilic et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12053,5788,'fr','Paella printanière au poulet','Donnez une nouvelle tournure au riz espagnol classique en ajoutant des fèves vertes fraîches, de l''aneth, de la menthe et du persil.','["6 cuisses de poulet, avec la peau","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, finement hachés","3 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","400 g de riz paëlla","1 cuillère à café de paprika doux","2 bonnes pincées de safran","le zeste et le jus de 2 citrons","1½ l de bouillon de poulet","200 g de petits pois et fèves frais ou surgelés (poids après égrenage et épluchage)","½ petit bouquet d''aneth, haché","½ petit bouquet de menthe hachée","½ petit bouquet de persil haché"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Assaisonner bien les cuisses de poulet puis saupoudrer le tout de farine. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle à paella ou une grande poêle à frire. Faites frire les cuisses jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient entièrement dorées, puis transférez-les dans un plat à rôtir peu profond et terminez au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes.","Ajoutez le reste de l''huile, les oignons et l''ail et faites revenir très doucement jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, environ 10 à 15 minutes. Incorporez le riz, le paprika, le safran et le zeste de citron, puis ajoutez le bouillon et laissez mijoter en remuant de temps en temps pendant environ 20 minutes à feu moyen jusqu''à ce que le riz soit presque cuit.","Ajoutez les petits pois, les fèves et le jus d''1 citron jusqu''à ce que le riz soit bien cuit, ainsi que les légumes. Incorporer les herbes et autant de jus de citron restant que nécessaire, ainsi qu''un peu d''assaisonnement. Rentrez les cuisses de poulet et couvrez pendant 5 minutes pour que le tout repose avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12054,5790,'fr','Tajine d''agneau fruité','Ce one-pot succulent et supersain satisfera à coup sûr toute une foule – gagnez du temps et préparez-le jusqu''à deux jours à l''avance.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g d''agneau maigre coupé en dés","1 gros oignon, haché grossièrement","2 grosses carottes, coupées en quartiers dans le sens de la longueur et en morceaux","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 cuillères à soupe de mélange d''épices ras-el-hanout (voir astuce ci-dessous)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, rincés et égouttés","200 g d''abricots secs","600 ml de bouillon de poulet","120 g de graines de grenade","2 grosses poignées de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte et faites dorer\r\nl''agneau de tous les côtés. Scoop l''agneau\r\ndéposer dans une assiette, puis ajouter l''oignon\r\net les carottes et cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Ajouter l''ail et cuire 1 min\r\nplus. Incorporer les épices et les tomates,\r\net la saison. Remettez l''agneau dedans avec\r\nles pois chiches et les abricots. Verser sur le\r\nbouillon, remuer et porter à ébullition. Couverture\r\nle plat et mettre au four pendant 1 h.","Si l''agneau est encore un peu dur, donnez-le\r\nil 20 minutes de plus jusqu''à tendreté. Une fois prêt,\r\nlaissez-le reposer pour qu''il ne soit pas très chaud, puis\r\nservir parsemé de grenade et\r\nherbes, accompagné de couscous ou de riz."]','2026-01-11 00:15:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12055,5792,'fr','Pot de poulet à la moutarde au miel et aux panais','Pour une cocotte familiale facile et réchauffante à petit budget, cette cocotte coche toutes les cases','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 cuisses de poulet avec os, peau retirée","2 oignons, finement hachés","350 g de panais coupés en bâtonnets","300 ml de bouillon de légumes","2 cuillères à soupe de moutarde complète","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","quelques brins de thym","persil plat, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une grande poêle\r\nou une cocotte peu profonde avec un couvercle. Marron\r\nle poulet jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, puis réserver.\r\nFaites chauffer le reste de l''huile, puis faites cuire le\r\noignons pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis.","Repoussez les cuisses parmi les\r\noignons et ajoutez les panais. Mélangez le bouillon avec le\r\nmoutarde et miel, puis versez-y.\r\nsur le thym, puis porter à ébullition.\r\nCouvrir, puis cuire 30 minutes (ou plus,\r\nvoir conseil) jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre, puis\r\nsaison. Servir avec des légumes verts cuits à la vapeur."]','2026-01-11 00:15:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12056,5794,'fr','Sardines aux pois chiches, citron & persil','Les sardines cuites sur la Barbie sont un excellent régal d''été – vous pouvez également cuisiner à l''intérieur dans une seule casserole.','["50g de farine nature","10 sardines écaillées et nettoyées (8 si grosses)","zester 2 citrons","gros bouquet de persil plat, feuilles seulement, hachées grossièrement","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","un verre de vin blanc (environ 125 ml)","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches ou de haricots beurre, égouttés et rincés","250 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux"]','["Assaisonnez la farine et répartissez-la sur une grande assiette.\r\nTrempez les sardines dans la farine, une à la fois.\r\nMélangez le zeste de citron, le persil et la moitié\r\nde l''ail haché et réserver.","Mettez une très grande poêle (une poêle à paella est\r\nidéal ou une grande plaque à pâtisserie solide avec\r\nun rebord) sur le barbecue et faites chauffer\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Ajouter l''huile, faire chauffer quelques instants\r\nsecondes, puis déposez les sardines farinées\r\ndans l''huile en une seule couche. Faire frire 3 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que le dessous soit doré, puis retournez\r\net faites frire encore 3 minutes. Ascenseur\r\nhors de la poêle et sur une assiette.","Faites frire le reste de l''ail (ajoutez un autre peu de\r\nd''huile si nécessaire) pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie. Verser\r\ndans le vin blanc, grattez les morceaux du fond\r\nde la poêle avec une cuillère en bois et faire bouillir pendant\r\n1 min ou jusqu''à réduction de moitié.","Ajoutez les pois chiches ou les haricots beurre et\r\ntomates, puis remuer jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien chaudes. Saison\r\navec beaucoup de poivre et de sel au goût, puis\r\nremettez le poisson dans la poêle. Enlevez le\r\nchauffer, saupoudrer du mélange de persil et servir avec\r\nbeaucoup de pain croustillant pour éponger le jus."]','2026-01-11 00:15:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12057,5798,'fr','One-pot de courge, poulet et couscous','Utilisez les restes dans ce tout-en-pot supersain, rempli de nutriments essentiels','["2 cuillères à soupe de pâte d''harissa","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu et de coriandre moulue","2 oignons rouges, coupés en deux et coupés en fines tranches","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en bouchées","1 petite courge butternut coupée en morceaux de 1 cm (pas besoin de la peler)","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates","le zeste et le jus de 2 citrons","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","140 g de couscous","petit bouquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer une grande cocotte antiadhésive\r\nplat ou une poêle sur la table de cuisson. Ajoutez le\r\nharissa, épices et oignons, remuer et\r\ncuire doucement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.\r\nAjouter le poulet et faire revenir pendant 5 à 10 minutes.\r\nAjouter la courge en remuant pour combiner,\r\net un peu d''eau si ça démarre\r\ncoller. Cuire encore 5 minutes.","Versez les tomates en conserve dans le\r\ncasserole avec ½ bidon d''eau, couvrir\r\net laissez mijoter 20 à 30 minutes. Ajouter\r\nle zeste et le jus de citron, cerise\r\ntomates, couscous et assaisonnement.\r\nCouvrir et éteindre le feu. Partir\r\nsur le feu pendant 10 minutes, puis remuez\r\nà travers la coriandre et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12058,5800,'fr','Ragoût de poulet et légumes avec couscous complet','Commencez la semaine en toute santé avec ce one-pot copieux et sain','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en morceaux","1 petit oignon, tranché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","pincer chaque paprika et safran","50 g de petits maïs doux, coupés en deux","50g de pointes d''asperges","50g de petits pois","50 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","150 ml de bouillon de poulet","140 g de couscous complet"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, faites cuire le poulet\r\npendant 5 à 6 minutes, puis retirez-le avec une fente\r\ncuillère. Ajouter l''oignon et cuire 2-3 minutes\r\navant d''ajouter l''ail, le paprika, le safran,\r\nmaïs doux, asperges, pois et tomates.\r\nCuire encore 2-3 minutes. Renvoyez le\r\npoulet dans la poêle, verser le bouillon,\r\npuis couvrez et laissez mijoter 15 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le couscous suivant\r\ninstructions sur l''emballage. Pour servir, gonflez le\r\ncouscous avec une fourchette et répartir entre\r\n2 bols avant de verser sur le ragoût."]','2026-01-11 00:15:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12059,5802,'fr','Pilau au poulet et aux pois chiches en une seule casserole','Un repas ultra-sain et ultra-rapide : du pilau au poulet et aux pois chiches préparés dans un seul pot','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 cuisses de poulet, la peau retirée et dégraissée","2 gros poireaux, tranchés finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","400 g de pois chiches en conserve dans l''eau, égouttés et rincés","le zeste râpé d''1 citron","200 g de riz brun facile à cuire","450 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 tête de brocoli, divisée en fleurons"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle à frire à couvercle ou une cocotte antidéflagrante et ajoutez l''huile.\r\nFaire revenir les cuisses de poulet 2 minutes en les retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient\r\nlégèrement coloré, puis déposer sur une assiette. Ajouter les poireaux dans la poêle et faire sauter\r\npendant 3 min, puis ajoutez l''ail et versez les pois chiches, la majeure partie du citron\r\nle zeste et le riz. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Nestle le poulet dans le mélange de riz. Verser sur le bouillon et assaisonner légèrement.\r\nCouvrir et laisser cuire à feu doux pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit presque cuit.\r\nà travers et le riz a absorbé presque tout le liquide. Posez le brocoli dessus\r\ndu riz, couvrir et poursuivre la cuisson jusqu''à ce que le riz et le brocoli soient tendres\r\net le poulet cuit. Saupoudrer du reste de zeste de citron pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12060,5804,'fr','Pot de riz coréen','Un plat de riz en une seule casserole est une excellente façon d''utiliser les restes : celui-ci combine des légumes sains et de la dinde, garnis d''œufs au plat.','["500 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","250 g de riz à grains longs","300 g de dinde cuite, coupée en dés","250 g de bébés épinards","2 carottes, râpées","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame grillé","1 cuillère à café de graines de sésame grillées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","4 œufs","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili épaisse"]','["Versez le bouillon de poulet dans une grande casserole et portez à ébullition. Ajouter le riz et la dinde, porter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le bouillon soit absorbé et que le riz soit tendre.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les épinards dans une passoire et versez-les sur une bouilloire d''eau chaude pour les faire légèrement flétrir. Gardez les épinards et les carottes séparés, mais assaisonnez les deux avec l''huile de sésame et les graines.","Couvrir le riz cuit avec un couvercle et laisser reposer quelques minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l’huile végétale dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu vif. Faites frire les œufs pour que le blanc soit bien croustillant sur les bords.","Versez le riz dans de grands bols et disposez dessus les épinards et les carottes. Terminez chacun avec un œuf au plat et une cuillerée de sauce chili. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:15:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12061,5806,'fr','Curry de poulet au piment','Un curry sain et savoureux qui compte pour l''un de vos 5 par jour et qui est faible en gras','["1 oignon moyen, haché grossièrement","3 cm de racine de gingembre, hachée grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort ou ½ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","Boîte de 230 g de tomates concassées","350 g de pommes de terre pelées et coupées en gros morceaux","500 g de poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau, coupées en morceaux de 3 cm","½ cuillère à café de garam masala","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre fraîche hachée","yaourt nature, pour servir"]','["Mixez l''oignon, le gingembre et\r\nl''ail dans un robot culinaire avec\r\n1 cuillère à soupe d''eau jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Faire revenir les graines de cumin dans l''huile\r\npendant quelques secondes. Ajoutez le\r\npâte d''oignon et faire dorer dessus\r\nun feu moyen. Ajoutez une pincée de\r\nl''eau si elle commence à prendre.","Saupoudrer de curcuma et\r\npiment. Ajoutez les tomates et\r\nfaire frire pendant 5 minutes. Incorporer le\r\npommes de terre et 250 ml/9 fl oz\r\neau chaude. Cuisinez à couvert pendant\r\n10 minutes.","Ajoutez le poulet et le garam masala. Laisser mijoter pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit. Assaisonner de sel. Verser dans un bol, parsemer de coriandre et servir avec du riz aromatisé et du yaourt nature."]','2026-01-11 00:15:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12062,5808,'fr','Poulet aux lentilles dans une casserole','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce repas tout-en-un constitue un superbe souper sans culpabilité, et si vous avez vraiment faim, ajoutez simplement des pommes de terre.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","2 lardons de dos maigres salés à sec, parés et hachés","2 grosses cuisses de poulet avec os, peau retirée","1 oignon moyen, tranché finement","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée finement","2 cuillères à café de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de purée de tomates","150 ml de vin blanc sec","200 ml de bouillon de poulet","50g de lentilles vertes","½ cuillère à café de thym séché","85 g de champignons châtaignes, coupés en deux s''ils sont gros"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle large et peu profonde antiadhésive, ajoutez le bacon et faites-le frire vivement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement coloré, puis déposez-le sur une assiette. Ajouter le poulet et faire revenir de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré. Réserver avec le bacon. Versez l''oignon et l''ail dans la poêle et faites cuire 5 minutes. Incorporez la farine et le concentré de tomates, puis remuez à feu doux pendant 2-3 minutes. Ajoutez le vin, le bouillon, les lentilles et le thym. Portez à ébullition, baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez mijoter 5 minutes.","Incorporer les champignons. Ajoutez le bacon et le poulet en les poussant sous le liquide. Couvrir et laisser mijoter pendant 20 à 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres et que le poulet soit cuit. Assaisonner de sel et de poivre."]','2026-01-11 00:15:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12063,5810,'fr','One-pot rapide au bœuf et au brocoli','Créez rapidement un délicieux repas de bœuf et de brocoli dans une seule casserole ! Contient 2 de vos 5 par jour','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","50 g de noix de cajou non salées","400 g de steak de bœuf à frire, coupé en lanières","1 grosse tête de brocoli, cassée en fleurons","4 branches de céleri, tranchées","150 ml de bouillon de bœuf (en cube, c''est bien)","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce au raifort","2 cuillères à soupe de fromage frais allégé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez les noix et mélangez\r\npendant quelques secondes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement grillés. Annuler.","Assaisonnez les lanières de steak avec beaucoup de poivre et\r\nfaire sauter à feu vif pendant 1 à 2 minutes pour dorer. Ensemble\r\nà part avec les noix. Versez le brocoli et le céleri dans\r\nla poêle et faire sauter pendant 2 minutes. Versez le bouillon dessus,\r\ncouvrir et laisser mijoter 2 minutes. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le\r\nraifort et fromage frais ensemble.","Remettez le steak dans la poêle et mélangez-le avec le\r\nlégumes, puis saupoudrer de noix et servir avec le\r\nraifort crémeux. Excellent avec de la purée de pommes de terre."]','2026-01-11 00:15:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12064,5812,'fr','Penne aux épinards et au pesto','Combinez des pâtes avec des épinards, du pesto et des tomates pour un repas sain et facile. Les tomates contiennent de la vitamine C, qui aidera votre corps à absorber le fer contenu dans les épinards.','["400 g de pennes complètes","5 cuillères à soupe de pesto végétarien au basilic","500 g de pousses d''épinards, hachées grossièrement","220 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux"]','["Faites cuire les penne en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 4 cuillères à soupe de pesto dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-doux. Ajoutez les épinards et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, puis couvrez pour les faire flétrir.","Égouttez les pâtes et mélangez-les avec les épinards, le reste du pesto et les tomates. Servir la moitié. Refroidir et réfrigérer le reste. Se conservera au frais pendant trois jours. Réchauffer avec un peu d''eau."]','2026-01-11 00:15:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12065,5814,'fr','Pâtes aux haricots verts, pommes de terre et pesto en un seul pot','Pour un repas rapide et nutritif en milieu de semaine, combinez le pesto et les légumes verts avec des pâtes et des pommes de terre nouvelles – un souper léger pour les longues soirées d''été.','["350 g de petites pommes de terre nouvelles","400 g de stylos liseux","1 litre de bouillon de légumes chaud","200 g de pesto frais (assurez-vous d''être végétarien, si nécessaire)","120 g de haricots verts parés","½ citron, zesté","parmesan râpé ou alternative végétarienne, pour servir"]','["Versez les pommes de terre, les pâtes et le bouillon dans une cocotte ignifuge. Portez à ébullition à feu moyen, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter 15 minutes à découvert en remuant de temps en temps. Incorporer le pesto, les haricots verts, le zeste de citron et un peu d''assaisonnement, et cuire encore 2 minutes.","Couvrez la casserole avec un couvercle, retirez du feu et laissez reposer 5 minutes. Servir les pâtes dans des bols, garnies de fromage râpé."]','2026-01-11 00:15:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12066,5816,'fr','Préparez votre propre salade de pâtes au pesto','Préparez cette salade de pâtes au pesto facile pour la famille. Personnalisez-le en ajoutant le légume préféré de votre enfant','["400 g de pâtes farfalles","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","50g de pignons de pin","5 cuillères à soupe de pesto (voir recette à droite et ci-dessous si vous souhaitez en faire vous-même)","10 grosses feuilles de basilic","½ citron, jus et zesté","50 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, en copeaux","tomates cerises coupées en deux, maïs doux égoutté, petits pois, roquette"]','["Faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les et ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Transférer dans un grand bol et laisser refroidir, en remuant de temps en temps pour que ça ne colle pas.","Faites griller les pignons de pin dans une poêle sèche à feu doux, en les remuant constamment pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Lorsque les pâtes sont complètement refroidies, ajoutez le pesto, les pignons de pin grillés, le reste de l''huile d''olive, le basilic, le zeste et le jus de citron, ainsi que les tomates, le maïs doux, les petits pois et la roquette, le cas échéant. Assaisonner, puis parsemer de parmesan et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12067,5818,'fr','Orecchiette aux haricots beurre, persil, piment et citron','Préparez ce plat de pâtes simple en utilisant tout ce que vous avez sous la main, y compris différentes formes de pâtes, des haricots ou des tomates hachées. Vous pouvez laisser de côté le piment si vous préférez','["400 g d''orecchiettes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 piments rouges épépinés et finement hachés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre, égouttés et rincés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","1 citron, zesté et pressé","½ gros bouquet de persil finement haché","25 g de parmesan râpé ou alternative végétarienne (facultatif)"]','["Cuire les orecchiette en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente, environ 10 minutes. Égoutter en réservant l''eau de cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les piments et l''ail pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient à peine ramollis. Incorporer les haricots beurre, les tomates, le zeste et le jus de citron. Cuire encore 5 minutes, puis parsemer de persil et cuire encore 2 minutes. Les tomates doivent avoir légèrement réduit et les haricots doivent être bien réchauffés.","Versez les orecchiette dans la poêle avec le mélange de haricots beurre. Versez un peu de l''eau de cuisson des pâtes réservée si vous préférez une sauce plus fluide. Verser dans des bols et saupoudrer de fromage avant de servir, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12068,5822,'fr','Pâtes végétaliennes au pesto de chou frisé','Mélangez du chou frisé, des graines de citrouille, du basilic et de l’ail pour préparer ce pesto de chou frisé facile. Il est parfait mélangé à des spaghettis complets pour un repas végétalien sain.','["150g de chou frisé","petit bouquet de basilic","1 petite gousse d''ail","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","3 cuillères à soupe de levure nutritionnelle","1 citron, zesté et pressé","350 g de spaghettis complets"]','["Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition. Faites cuire le chou frisé pendant 30 secondes, égouttez-le et transférez-le dans un bol d''eau glacée pendant 5 minutes. Égoutter à nouveau et sécher avec du papier absorbant.","Mettez le basilic, l''ail, les graines, l''huile, la levure nutritionnelle, le jus et le zeste de citron ainsi que le chou frisé égoutté dans un robot culinaire. Mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis assaisonnez. Détachez avec un peu d’eau si c’est trop épais.","Faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis mélangez avec le pesto et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12069,5824,'fr','Pâtes Arraya aux aubergines','Choisissez ce souper de pâtes sain après une séance d''entraînement. Bien qu’il soit faible en gras et en calories, il regorge de saveurs et fournit également du calcium et des fibres.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","1 gros oignon finement haché (160g)","2 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","1 aubergine, hachée","150 g de penne ou fusilli complets","une grosse poignée de basilic, plus un peu pour servir","25 g de parmesan ou de fromage à pâte dure végétarien à l''italienne, finement râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez les oignons, couvrez et laissez cuire 5 min. Retirez le couvercle et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez l''ail, les flocons de piment et le paprika, remuez brièvement, puis versez les tomates et une canette d''eau. Incorporez le bouillon et l''aubergine, puis portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez cuire 20 minutes.","Faites cuire les penne dans une casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente. Égoutter en réservant 60 ml d''eau de cuisson. Ajouter les penne cuites à la sauce et bien mélanger avec le basilic et un peu de l''eau réservée, si nécessaire. Verser dans deux bols peu profonds et servir garni de fromage et d''un peu de basilic supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12070,5826,'fr','Bolognaise au jacquier et au parmesan végétalien','Réduire la viande ? Essayez le jacquier comme alternative. Cette bolognaise végétalienne a non seulement un goût délicieux, mais elle compte pour cinq sur vos 5 par jour.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","320 g de carottes (3 moyennes), hachées finement","4 grosses branches de céleri (320 g), finement hachées","4 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","Boîte de 410 g de jacquier dans l''eau, égoutté et finement haché","100 g de lentilles rouges","3 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","4 cuillères à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes (vérifiez qu''il est végétalien)","1 cuillère à soupe de thym haché","325 g de spaghettis complets","persil haché, pour servir (facultatif)","40g de noix de cajou","4 cuillères à café de levure nutritionnelle","1 cuillère à café de granulés d''ail"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir les carottes, le céleri et l''ail pendant 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le parmesan végétalien. Versez les noix de cajou, la levure nutritionnelle et les granules d''ail dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en miettes fines. Ajoutez un peu de sel si nécessaire et réservez.","Versez le jacquier dans le mélange de légumes avec les lentilles, 700 ml d''eau, le concentré de tomates, la poudre de bouillon et le thym, puis couvrez et laissez cuire 25 min. Ajoutez un peu plus d''eau si nécessaire – elle doit être pulpeuse.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les spaghettis en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient al dente. Mélanger avec la sauce, répartir dans les bols et saupoudrer de parmesan végétalien et de persil, le cas échéant. La sauce se conserve, couverte, au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois."]','2026-01-11 00:15:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12071,5828,'fr','Mac''n'' cheese super vert','Réorganisez le macaroni au fromage avec du brocoli, des épinards et des pois, ainsi qu''une garniture croquante aux noix et aux graines. Il a toute la saveur du plat classique, mais avec des nutriments ajoutés','["1l de lait demi-écrémé","75g de beurre","75 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon","175 g de cheddar affiné ou extra affiné, râpé","50 g de parmesan râpé","100 g d''épinards, frais ou surgelés","400 g de macaronis","1 brocoli (environ 300 g), cassé en fleurons","100 g de petits pois surgelés","3 tranches de pain blanc (environ 125g)","1 petit bouquet de feuilles de basilic","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","25 g de mélange de noix ou de graines, comme des graines de citrouille, des pignons de pin et des amandes, pour la garniture"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Versez le lait, le beurre et la farine dans une grande casserole et portez à ébullition en fouettant continuellement jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse et épaisse, environ 3-4 minutes. Ne vous inquiétez pas s’il y a quelques grumeaux, la sauce sera mixée plus tard. Assaisonnez bien, puis ajoutez la moutarde, les fromages et les épinards.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes dans de l''eau bouillante salée pendant 5 min. Ajoutez le brocoli et poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à ce que les pâtes soient bien cuites et que le brocoli soit tendre. Vidange.","Transférer la moitié du brocoli cuit dans la sauce au fromage. Battez la sauce au fromage jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit lisse, crémeuse et vert vif à l''aide d''un mélangeur à main (ou d''un batteur sur socle). Détendez-le avec un peu de lait, si nécessaire. Incorporer les pâtes, le reste du brocoli et les petits pois et verser dans un grand plat allant au four.","Si vous préparez la garniture, mettez le pain, le basilic, l''huile et la moitié des noix ou des graines dans un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en miettes vertes et grossières. Répartir sur les pâtes avec le reste des noix ou des graines. Cuire au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la garniture soit croustillante et que la sauce bouillonne. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois."]','2026-01-11 00:15:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12072,5830,'fr','Spaghetti à la sauce tomate fumée et fruits de mer','Le piment, les graines de fenouil et le paprika fumé ajoutent chaleur et saveur à une riche sauce tomate, servie avec des fruits de mer dans ce plat de pâtes rapide.','["4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement tranché","1½ cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","400 g de spaghettis","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à café de sucre","Paquet de 400 g de fruits de mer cuits surgelés, décongelés","petit bouquet de persil ou de basilic, haché"]','["Faites bouillir la bouilloire et faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à frire. Ajoutez l''ail, le piment et les graines de fenouil et faites grésiller quelques minutes. Versez l''eau bouillante dans une grande casserole et faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Ajouter le paprika, les tomates, le sucre et l''assaisonnement dans la poêle et laisser mijoter pendant 8 à 10 minutes pendant la cuisson des pâtes.","Égoutter les pâtes 1 min avant la fin de la cuisson en réservant une tasse d''eau. Ajouter les pâtes à la sauce aux fruits de mer. Laisser mijoter pendant 1 à 2 minutes, en ajoutant un peu de l''eau des pâtes réservée si elle semble trop épaisse. Mélanger les pâtes dans la sauce pendant la cuisson. Ajoutez les herbes et le poivre noir, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12073,5832,'fr','Fusilli à la butternut et au bacon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce plat de pâtes facile avec de la pancetta, de la courge musquée et des épinards constitue un dîner sain en semaine – le romarin frais ajoute une saveur supplémentaire','["½ paquet de 160 g de cubes de bacon","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","750 g de courge butternut épépinée et coupée en cubes de 2 cm","2 brins de romarin, feuilles finement hachées","¼ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","350g de fusilli perforés (ou fusilli)","100 g de jeunes feuilles d''épinards hachées grossièrement","parmesan râpé, pour servir"]','["Versez la pancetta dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites cuire pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien croustillante. Retirer à l''aide d''une écumoire en laissant la graisse dans la poêle. Ajouter l''huile dans la poêle, ainsi que la courge, le romarin, le piment et l''ail. Couvrir et cuire 25 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre. Assaisonnez bien et écrasez délicatement un peu de courge butternut avec le dos d''une cuillère.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée 15 minutes avant que la courge ne soit prête et faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions du paquet. Égoutter en réservant l''eau de cuisson. Ajoutez 1 à 2 louches d''eau pour pâtes à la courge et laissez-la bouillonner quelques minutes. Versez les pâtes égouttées et mélangez. Incorporer les épinards, puis répartir dans les assiettes. Saupoudrer de pancetta, d''un peu de parmesan râpé et d''un bon moulin à poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12074,5834,'fr','Linguine aux crevettes et au piment','Un plat de fruits de mer élégant et faible en gras, parfait pour recevoir en milieu de semaine – très léger et élégant','["280 g de pâtes linguines","200 g de pois mange-tout, parés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 gros piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","24 gambas crues, décortiquées","12 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","une poignée de feuilles de basilic frais","feuilles de salade mélangées et pain blanc croustillant, pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de fromage frais pratiquement allégé","le zeste râpé et le jus de 2 citrons verts","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette\r\nun petit bol et assaisonner avec\r\nsel et poivre. Annuler.","Cuire les pâtes selon les\r\ninstructions du paquet. Ajouter le sucre\r\npois mange-tout pour la dernière minute environ\r\ndu temps de cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok ou\r\ngrande poêle, ajouter l''ail\r\net du piment et cuire à feu doux\r\nchaleur douce pendant environ 30 secondes\r\nsans laisser l''ail dorer. Astuce\r\ndans les crevettes et cuire à feu vif\r\nchauffer, en remuant fréquemment, pendant environ 3\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils deviennent roses.","Ajoutez les tomates et faites cuire,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps, pendant 3 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Vidanger\r\nles pâtes et le sucre cassent bien,\r\npuis incorporez-le au mélange de crevettes.\r\nDéchirez les feuilles de basilic, remuez et\r\nassaisonner de sel et de poivre.","Servir avec des feuilles de salade arrosées\r\navec la vinaigrette au citron vert et tiède\r\npain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:15:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12075,5836,'fr','Omelette aux spaghettis','Cette omelette aux spaghettis rapide est une excellente façon d’utiliser les restes de pâtes, et elle plaira forcément aux enfants.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 oignon, haché","2 courgettes, râpées","2 cuillères à soupe de persil plat haché","Pot de 300 g de sauce au fromage frais","200 g de spaghettis cuits ou autres pâtes","2 œufs"]','["Chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans un plat antiadhésif moyen\r\npoêle et ajouter l''ail et l''oignon.\r\nCuire 2-3 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Utilisation\r\ntes mains, presse-les autant\r\nl''humidité des courgettes\r\npossibles. Ajoutez-les dans la poêle et faites cuire\r\npendant encore 3-4 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Cuillère\r\nles légumes dans un grand bol.","Incorporer le persil, la sauce au fromage et\r\nspaghettis et assaisonner. Battre les oeufs\r\net incorporer au mélange.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et\r\nverser le mélange de spaghettis. Nivelez-le avec\r\nle dos d''une cuillère et cuire à feu moyen\r\nchauffer pendant 3 à 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque pris.","Transférer sur un gril chaud pendant 2-3 minutes, jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Laisser refroidir dans la poêle pendant\r\n5 minutes, puis coupez-le en quartiers et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12076,5838,'fr','Pâtes végétariennes Vitalité','Pâtes végétariennes faciles et rapides','["250 g de pâtes pappardelles","1 petite courge musquée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","une petite poignée de pignons de pin","1 gousse d''ail dodue, hachée finement","4 gros champignons des champs, tranchés","Sachet de 250 g d''épinards lavés","parmesan râpé et flocons de piment pour servir, facultatif"]','["Versez de l''eau bouillante\r\ndans une grande casserole, porter à ébullition, puis cuire\r\nles pâtes selon les instructions sur l''emballage. Quand le\r\nil reste 5 minutes aux pâtes pour cuire, y mettre la courge\r\net cuire avec les pâtes pour le temps restant.","Pendant que les pâtes cuisent,\r\nfaire chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une grande poêle. Grésiller le pin\r\nnoix dans l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à se colorer, incorporer le\r\nl''ail et cuire un instant juste pour le ramollir. Ajouter\r\nle reste de l''huile, augmentez le feu, ajoutez les champignons\r\net laissez cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Tourner\r\nle feu au maximum, ajoutez les épinards dans la poêle et\r\ncuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement flétri.","Égouttez les pâtes et les courges,\r\npuis mélangez avec les légumes jusqu''à ce que tout soit\r\nbien combiné. Apportez la poêle à table et laissez\r\nchacun s''aide. Vous pourriez aussi faire le tour\r\ndu parmesan râpé et des flocons de piment si les gens le veulent."]','2026-01-11 00:15:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12077,5840,'fr','Spaghettis épicés aux champignons à l''ail','Un plat de pâtes faible en gras et infaillible qui prouvera qu''il est tout aussi facile de préparer un repas que d''allumer le micro-ondes.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de champignons de Paris tranchés grossièrement","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée finement","petit bouquet de persil, feuilles seulement","1 branche de céleri, finement hachée","1 oignon, finement haché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 à 2 piments rouges, épépinés et finement hachés (ou utilisez des flocons de piment séchés)","300 g de spaghettis"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez les champignons,\r\npuis faites revenir à feu vif pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré et ramolli. Ajouter l''ail, faire revenir pendant\r\n1 min de plus, puis versez dans un bol avec le\r\npersil. Ajouter l''oignon et le céleri dans la poêle\r\navec le reste de l''huile, puis faire revenir 5 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement colorés.","Incorporer les tomates, le piment et un peu de sel,\r\npuis portez à ébullition. Réduisez le feu et\r\nlaisser mijoter à découvert pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\népaissi. Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir les spaghettis,\r\npuis égouttez. Mélanger avec la sauce, garnir de\r\nles champignons à l''ail, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12078,5842,'fr','Pâtes aux crevettes et petits pois citronnés','Un plat de pâtes aux crevettes simple et savoureux qui allie saveurs fraîches et cuisson rapide.','["350 g de linguines ou autres pâtes longues","140 g de grosses crevettes surgelées","100 g de petits pois surgelés","1 jaune d''oeuf","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","une poignée de parmesan râpé","crème sure (facultatif)"]','["Faire bouillir les linguines pendant 8 minutes. Trois minutes avant la fin du temps imparti, ajoutez les crevettes et les petits pois. Réservez une tasse\r\nd''eau de cuisson, puis égouttez les pâtes et remettez-les dans la casserole.","Ajoutez le jaune d''œuf, le zeste et le jus de citron, la majeure partie du parmesan et un peu de crème sure, si vous le souhaitez. Mélangez le tout en ajoutant un peu d''eau de cuisson des pâtes pour assouplir le mélange.","Je servirai du parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:15:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12079,5846,'fr','Cannellonis au tofu et aux épinards','Le tofu savoureux est le meilleur ami des végétariens et ce plat de cannellonis, riche en protéines et en fer, sera certainement un favori à congeler.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","50 g de pignons de pin hachés grossièrement","400 g d''épinards","pincée de muscade râpée","Paquet de 349 g de tofu soyeux","Pack de 300 g de feuilles de lasagnes fraîches","4 cuillères à soupe de chapelure fraîche"]','["Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez l''oignon et 1/3 de l''ail et faites revenir 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Versez les tomates, assaisonnez et portez à ébullition. Réduire le feu et cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile restante dans une poêle et faites revenir encore 1/3 de l''ail pendant 1 min, puis ajoutez la moitié des pignons de pin et les épinards. Faites flétrir les épinards, puis versez l’excédent de liquide. Mélangez le tofu dans un robot culinaire ou avec un mélangeur à main jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez les épinards avec la muscade et un peu de poivre. Retirer du feu; laisser refroidir légèrement.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Verser la moitié de la sauce tomate dans un plat de 20 x 30 cm. Répartir le mélange d''épinards sur les feuilles de lasagnes, rouler et déposer sur la sauce. Verser sur le reste de la sauce. Cuire au four 30 mn.","Mélanger la chapelure avec le reste de l''ail et des pignons de pin. Saupoudrer le plat, arroser du reste d''huile et cuire au four pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la chapelure soit dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:15:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12080,5848,'fr','Spaghettis génois','Ce plat de pâtes végétariennes est la solution parfaite lorsque vous voulez quelque chose de rapide et savoureux – et que tout est cuit dans une seule poêle.','["300 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, tranchées","300 g de spaghettis","200 g de haricots verts parés, coupés en deux","Pot de 120 g de pesto frais","huile d''olive, pour arroser"]','["Versez une bouilloire d’eau bouillante dans une très grande casserole jusqu’à moitié pleine. Remettez à ébullition, puis ajoutez les pommes de terre et les spaghettis, ainsi qu''un peu de sel. Cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre et les pâtes soient presque tendres. Ajoutez les haricots verts et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes.","Bien égoutter en réservant 4 cuillères à soupe de liquide de cuisson. Remettez les pommes de terre, les pâtes et les haricots dans la poêle, puis incorporez le pesto frais et le liquide de cuisson réservé. Assaisonner selon votre goût, répartir dans quatre assiettes de service et arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive."]','2026-01-11 00:15:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12081,5850,'fr','Soupe de pâtes copieuse','Faites quelque chose de différent avec un paquet de tortellini. Cette soupe nourrissante est riche en fibres, faible en gras et pleine de légumes. Le déjeuner ou le dîner parfait','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 carottes, hachées","1 gros oignon, finement haché","1l de bouillon de légumes","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","200 g de pois et haricots mélangés surgelés","Paquet de 250 g de tortellinis frais fourrés (nous avons utilisé des épinards et de la ricotta)","une poignée de feuilles de basilic (facultatif)","parmesan râpé (ou alternative végétarienne), pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle. Faire revenir les carottes et l''oignon pendant\r\n5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à ramollir. Ajouter le bouillon\r\net les tomates, puis laisser mijoter 10 min. Ajouter\r\nles pois et les haricots à 5 minutes de la fin.","Une fois les légumes tendres, incorporez les pâtes. Retour au\r\nfaire bouillir et laisser mijoter 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pâtes soient\r\njuste cuit. Incorporer le basilic, si vous en utilisez. Saison,\r\npuis servir dans des bols garnis d''une pincée\r\nde parmesan et des tranches de pain à l''ail."]','2026-01-11 00:15:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12082,5852,'fr','Gratin de pâtes en colère au thon','Cette cuisson de pâtes saine et copieuse constitue le plat réconfortant parfait pour l''hiver, sans culpabilité.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 poivron rouge et 1 jaune, épépinés et tranchés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","pincée de piments séchés écrasés","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","50 g d''olives dénoyautées mélangées, entières ou hachées grossièrement (facultatif)","pincée de sucre en poudre","250 g de formes de pâtes complètes","2 boîtes de 200 g de steak de thon à l''eau de source, égoutté et émietté","25 g de chapelure complète fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole et\r\nfaire revenir les poivrons pendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce\r\ncommence à caraméliser. Ajouter l''ail\r\net les piments, cuire 30 secondes, puis verser\r\ndans les tomates et les olives (le cas échéant).\r\nAssaisonner, ajouter une pincée de sucre, porter à température\r\nfaire bouillir, puis laisser mijoter à découvert pendant 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes selon\r\npour emballer les instructions. Faites chauffer le gril. Vidanger\r\nles pâtes et mélanger à la sauce tomate,\r\navec le thon. Verser dans un grand\r\nplat allant au four. Mélanger la chapelure\r\net le parmesan ensemble et dispersez-les\r\npar-dessus. Griller pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nla garniture est croustillante et dorée. Servir\r\navec une salade verte, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12083,5854,'fr','Spaghetti au crabe, tomates cerises et basilic','Des saveurs fraîches et percutantes dans un plat bon pour la santé sont souvent ce dont vous avez besoin pour un coup de pouce en milieu de semaine. Ce plat de pâtes a tout pour plaire','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","pincée de flocons de piment","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 boîtes de 170 g de chair de crabe blanc égouttée","200 g de spaghettis","1 cuillère à café de câpres, égouttées et rincées","une poignée de feuilles de basilic hachées grossièrement"]','["Dans une grande poêle, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive. Ajouter l''ail et les flocons de piment. Cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés, puis ajouter les tomates. Cuire encore 3 minutes à feu vif jusqu''à ce que les tomates commencent à se décomposer un peu. Ajoutez le jus de citron et laissez cuire 1 à 2 minutes. Retirer du feu et incorporer le crabe pour qu''il se réchauffe – pas trop sinon il se brisera.","Faites bouillir les pâtes dans une grande casserole d''eau salée en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage puis égouttez-les. Mélangez les pâtes dans la casserole chaude avec la sauce, le zeste de citron et les câpres, et mélangez le basilic."]','2026-01-11 00:15:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12084,5856,'fr','Pâtes végétariennes d''été','Cela constitue un excellent souper familial végétarien, mais il peut facilement être réduit de moitié pour en servir deux.','["200 g de nœuds de pâtes","175 g de fèves fraîches ou surgelées (environ 650 g/1 lb 7 oz dans leurs cosses)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive de bonne qualité","1 gros oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 grosses courgettes coupées en bâtonnets","6 tomates italiennes mûres, coupées en quartiers","un généreux shot de sauce Tabasco","une poignée de basilic râpé"]','["Cuire les pâtes selon\r\ninstructions sur le paquet, ajout de frais\r\nfèves pendant les 3 dernières minutes\r\n(congelé les 2 dernières minutes).","Pendant que les pâtes cuisent, faites chauffer\r\nl''huile dans une grande poêle, versez-y le\r\nl''oignon et cuire à feu moyen\r\nchauffer pendant 1 à 2 minutes. Incorporer le\r\nl''ail et les courgettes, mélanger sur un\r\nà feu moyen pendant 2-3 minutes, puis\r\nincorporer les tomates et secouer\r\nle Tabasco. Remuer pendant 2-3 minutes\r\npour ramollir un peu les tomates (pas\r\ntrop ou ils deviendront pâteux).\r\nÉgoutter les pâtes et les haricots.","Mélangez les légumes et le basilic\r\nles pâtes et assaisonner de sel\r\net du poivre. Servir chaud (ou froid selon\r\nune salade avec une vinaigrette faible en gras)."]','2026-01-11 00:15:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12085,5858,'fr','Pâtes à la sauce tomate et légumes cachés','Faites manger plus de légumes à votre famille avec cette recette de sauce pour pâtes super saine qui compte pour 5 de vos 5 par jour. La sauce est également congelable','["1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","2 branches de céleri, hachées","2 carottes, hachées","1 poireau, haché","2 poivrons épépinés et hachés","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées à l''ail","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre et 1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","300 g de formes de pâtes séchées","parmesan, râpé et roquette, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand poêle antiadhésive\r\ncasserole et faites cuire doucement le\r\noignon, céleri, carottes et poireau\r\njusqu''à tendreté, environ 20 minutes. Ajoutez le\r\npoivrons et cuire 10 min\r\nplus, puis versez les tomates,\r\nsucre et vinaigre. Laisser mijoter pendant\r\nau moins 20 minutes – plus c''est long, mieux c''est.","Cuire les pâtes suivant le pack\r\ninstructions. Pendant ce temps, faites un blitz sur\r\nsauce avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisser, assaisonner et remettre au\r\nchauffer pour garder au chaud pendant que les pâtes\r\ncuisiniers. Égoutter les pâtes et mélanger\r\nà travers la sauce. Servir dans des bols\r\ngarni de copeaux de parmesan et\r\nla roquette part, si vous voulez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12086,5860,'fr','Boulettes d''agneau à la sauce tomate au romarin','Ce plat copieux constitue un repas simple et rapide en milieu de semaine, mais peut également être congelé à l''avance pour un dîner de dernière minute.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 paquet de 12 boulettes d''agneau prêtes à l''emploi (environ 450 g)","4 oignons, finement tranchés","4 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de romarin finement hachées, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 g de pâtes cuites pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une grande poêle. Ajouter\r\nles boulettes de viande et faites-les cuire en les retournant souvent,\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Retirer de la poêle.","Versez les oignons dans la poêle avec le\r\nle reste de l''huile et une pincée de sel et cuire\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit très tendre, 10-15 minutes. Ajouter l''ail\r\net le romarin et cuire encore 2 minutes.","Ajouter les tomates et remettre les boulettes de viande\r\nà la poêle. Laisser mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla sauce a épaissi et les boulettes de viande\r\nsont bien cuits. Assaisonner et servir\r\navec les pâtes, saupoudrer de romarin."]','2026-01-11 00:15:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12087,5862,'fr','Spaghetti crémeux au jambon, poireaux et champignons','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Les pâtes crémeuses ne doivent pas nécessairement être exclues du menu lorsque vous surveillez votre poids – celle-ci est faible en gras.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 poireaux moyens, tranchés finement","200 g de champignons châtaignes émincés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","300 g de spaghettis","140 g de fromage à pâte molle faible en gras (nous avons utilisé du Philadelphia Light)","85 g de jambon fumé très fin, émincé","basilic en petit paquet","25 g de parmesan râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole. Remuer\r\ndans les poireaux, 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et un peu\r\nassaisonner, couvrir, puis cuire 5 min\r\nà feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajouter\r\nles champignons et l''ail, puis laissez cuire pendant\r\n3 minutes de plus. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le\r\nspaghetti selon les instructions sur l''emballage,\r\npuis égouttez en réservant un peu de\r\nliquide de cuisson.","Incorporer le fromage à pâte molle au poireau et\r\nmélange de champignons, en ajoutant suffisamment de\r\nliquide de pâtes réservé pour donner une sauce\r\ncohérence. Ajouter le jambon, les feuilles de basilic\r\net le parmesan, puis ajoutez les spaghettis."]','2026-01-11 00:15:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12088,5864,'fr','Pâtes super-légumes','Obtenez deux de vos cinq par jour avec cette sauce délicieusement polyvalente','["2 poivrons rouges, coupés en quartiers et épépinés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 bulbe de fenouil, haché grossièrement","1 oignon, haché grossièrement","1 grosse carotte, hachée grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","¼ cuillère à café de piments broyés","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","600 ml de bouillon de légumes","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","une petite poignée de basilic, feuilles hachées","500 g de pâtes fraîches aux œufs, cuites"]','["Faites chauffer le grill et faites éclater les poivrons,\r\ncôté peau vers le haut, dessous pendant 10 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à carboniser. Transférer à\r\nun bol, couvrir et réserver. Quand il fait frais\r\nsuffisamment pour manipuler, décoller la peau et\r\ncoupez la chair en lanières.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole et\r\nfaire cuire le fenouil, l''oignon et la carotte pendant\r\n8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer l''ail,\r\npiments écrasés, graines de fenouil et tomate\r\nréduire en purée, cuire 2 min, puis ajouter le\r\ntomates en conserve, bouillon et sucre.\r\nLaisser mijoter à découvert pendant 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nles légumes sont complètement mous.","Retirez quelques cuillerées de\r\nsauce (cela ajoutera plus tard de la texture), puis\r\nmélanger le reste dans la casserole jusqu''à ce que\r\npresque lisse avec un mixeur plongeant.\r\nLaisser mijoter 5 minutes pour épaissir, puis incorporer la sauce réservée, le basilic râpé\r\net des poivrons. Servir avec les pâtes."]','2026-01-11 00:15:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12089,5866,'fr','Pâtes aux fruits de mer 20 minutes','Préparez un plat faible en gras et satisfaisant en quelques minutes – idéal pour le vendredi soir','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à café de paprika","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 l de bouillon de poulet (en cube, c''est bien)","300 g de spaghettis grossièrement cassés","Paquet de 240 g de mélange de fruits de mer surgelés, décongelés","une poignée de feuilles de persil hachées et des quartiers de citron pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok ou une grande poêle, puis faites revenir l''oignon et l''ail à feu moyen pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter le paprika, les tomates et le bouillon, puis porter à ébullition.","Baissez le feu et laissez mijoter, incorporez les pâtes et laissez cuire 7 minutes en remuant de temps en temps pour empêcher les pâtes de coller. Incorporer les fruits de mer, cuire encore 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien chauds et que les pâtes soient cuites, puis assaisonner au goût. Saupoudrer de persil et servir avec des quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:15:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12090,5868,'fr','Soupe de pâtes épicée','Préparez une soupe minestrone à l''italienne et des tartelettes individuelles en utilisant les ingrédients de votre placard','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement tranché","Boîte de 800 g de tomates italiennes entières","1l de bouillon de légumes","100 g de spaghettis cassés","4 cuillères à soupe d''olives noires dénoyautées hachées","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres hachées, égouttées et rincées","une grosse poignée de feuilles de basilic grossièrement déchirées ou 1 cuillère à soupe de pesto"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand récipient à fond épais\r\ncasserole. Ajoutez l''oignon et le piment,\r\npuis cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.\r\nIncorporer les tomates en rompant avec\r\nune cuillère au fur et à mesure, puis versez le\r\nstocks. Couvrir, porter à ébullition, retirer\r\nle couvercle, puis laisser mijoter 5 minutes.","Ajoutez les spaghettis, puis laissez mijoter pendant\r\n6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste cuit. Incorporer\r\nles olives, les câpres et le basilic ou le pesto,\r\npuis servir arrosé d''huile d''olive."]','2026-01-11 00:15:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12091,5870,'fr','Macaroni crémeux au fromage et aux tomates','Essayez des pâtes au lieu de pommes de terre comme accompagnement rapide avec du poulet ou un steak.','["300 g de macaronis ou autres petites formes de pâtes","25 g de tomates séchées à l''huile, égouttées et hachées grossièrement","2 tbsp crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de parmesan, râpé"]','["Faire bouillir les pâtes. Pendant ce temps, dans un petit repas\r\nrobot, mixez ensemble les tomates, la crème\r\nla fraîche et la purée de tomates dans une sauce. (Si\r\nvous n''avez pas de petit processeur, hachez finement\r\nles tomates, puis mélangez le tout.)","Égouttez les pâtes en gardant un peu de\r\nl''eau de cuisson, puis remettre dans la casserole avec\r\nla sauce tomate et la moitié du fromage. Mélanger\r\nensemble jusqu''à ce que toutes les pâtes soient enrobées, puis\r\nservir en accompagnement, saupoudré du reste du fromage."]','2026-01-11 00:15:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12092,5872,'fr','Lasagnes au jambon et aux olives','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Quand tout ce que vous voulez, c''est une assiette de lasagnes réconfortantes – cette version est sur la table en 30 minutes','["250 g de feuilles de lasagnes fraîches","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées aux herbes","8 tranches de jambon","généreuse poignée d''olives vertes","2 œufs","150g de yaourt nature doux en pot (le bio fonctionne bien)","50 g de cheddar râpé, plus une poignée supplémentaire pour le dessus"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/chaleur tournante 170C/gaz 5. Mettez les feuilles de lasagnes dans un grand bol et versez sur l''eau juste bouillie. Laisser tremper 5 minutes, puis égoutter. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle allant au four, puis faites revenir l''ail pendant 1 min. Ajoutez les tomates, puis laissez mijoter 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient un peu réduites. Assaisonner selon votre goût, puis verser dans un bol.","Disposez les feuilles de pâtes, le jambon (conservez-le en tranches), la sauce tomate et les olives dans la poêle, en veillant à avoir quelques olives et un peu de sauce sur le dessus. Ne soyez pas trop soigné, froissez le jambon et laissez les pâtes se replier autour de la sauce et des olives.","Battez les œufs, le yaourt et la majeure partie du fromage dans un pichet, assaisonnez de sel et de poivre, puis versez sur les pâtes. Haut\r\navec du fromage supplémentaire et du poivre noir, puis cuire au four pendant environ 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit doré et que la garniture soit prise. Servir avec une salade."]','2026-01-11 00:15:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12093,5874,'fr','Linguine crémeux au jambon, citron et basilic','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Gardez les enfants heureux avec cette recette facile et faible en gras, prête en moins d''une demi-heure.','["400 g de linguines ou de spaghettis","90 g de jambon","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","jus d''1 citron","2 jaunes d''œufs","3 tbsp crème fraîche","une grosse poignée de feuilles de basilic","une grosse poignée de parmesan râpé, plus un peu pour servir, si vous le souhaitez"]','["Faites cuire les linguines. Pendant ce temps, déchirez le\r\njambon en petits morceaux et faire revenir dans l''olive\r\nhuile jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et croustillante.","Égouttez les pâtes en réservant un peu de\r\nl''eau de cuisson, puis remettre dans la casserole.\r\nVersez le jambon cuit. Mélangez ensemble le\r\njus de citron, jaunes d''œufs et crème fraîche,\r\npuis ajoutez-le dans la poêle avec le\r\nbasilic et parmesan. Mélanger avec des pinces,\r\nen ajoutant un peu d''eau de cuisson, si\r\nnécessaire, pour faire une sauce crémeuse qui\r\nenrobe les pâtes. Servir avec un supplément\r\nDu parmesan râpé sur le dessus, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12094,5876,'fr','Pot à pâtes minestrone','Un favori végétarien pour les moins de 5 ans, le pot de pâtes minestrone','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit oignon, finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","300 g de légumes mélangés surgelés (y compris les pois, le maïs doux, les carottes et le brocoli, mais pas les gros ragoûts)","700 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","175 g de petites formes de pâtes, type conchigliette","220 g de fèves au lard en boîte","cheddar râpé, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans un\r\ncasserole à feu moyen\r\nchauffer et faire revenir doucement l''oignon\r\npendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que ça démarre\r\npour ramollir. Incorporer la tomate\r\nréduire en purée, puis verser dans le surgelé\r\nlégumes et verser\r\nle stock.","Portez à ébullition, ajoutez le\r\nles pâtes et remuer. Couvrir et\r\nlaisser mijoter 12 à 14 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce que les pâtes soient cuites.","Incorporer les haricots et faire chauffer\r\nà travers, puis goûtez\r\nassaisonnement. Servir chaud, avec\r\nun bol de cheddar râpé\r\nà saupoudrer sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:15:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12095,5878,'fr','Pâtes dix minutes','Ce repas est plus rapide à préparer que les chips au four et il regorge de légumes frais, ce qui le rend parfait pour les enfants.','["350g de pâtes","1 carotte, hachée grossièrement","½ petit oignon, haché grossièrement","½ branche de céleri, haché grossièrement","6 à 8 tomates italiennes mûres, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à café de pesto rouge","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de framboise","parmesan râpé et feuilles de basilic, pour servir"]','["Cuire les pâtes selon le paquet\r\ninstructions. Pendant ce temps, ajoutez le tout\r\nautre que le parmesan et le basilic\r\ndans un robot culinaire et mixez ensemble\r\njusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse.","Versez dans une casserole et apportez\r\nporter à ébullition, puis réduire le\r\nfaire chauffer à ébullition et\r\nlaisser cuire 5 min.","Égoutter les pâtes, mélanger\r\navec le\r\nsauce tomate, puis\r\nservir avec le\r\nparmesan et\r\nfeuilles de basilic."]','2026-01-11 00:15:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12096,5880,'fr','Minestrone aux haricots verts','Contient du porc – recette réservée aux non-musulmans. L''utilisation d''une sélection de légumes verts donne à cette soupe un côté estival et des textures contrastées.','["1 oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 carotte, hachée finement","1 branche de céleri, finement hachée","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","Paquet de 70 g de cubes de bacon (facultatif)","1 feuille de laurier","1½ l de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet","100 g de petites formes de pâtes, comme la stelline ou l''orzo","300 g de fèves mélangées, vertes et écosées","100 g de chou de printemps, râpé","4 cuillères à soupe de pesto","pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Faire revenir l''oignon, l''ail, la carotte et le céleri\r\ndans l''huile d''olive dans une grande casserole jusqu''à ce\r\ntendre mais pas doré. Retirez et\r\nmettre de côté. Faites frire la pancetta, si vous en utilisez, vous\r\nje n''aurai pas besoin d''ajouter plus d''huile mais gardez\r\nle feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dégager de la graisse.\r\nFaire frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés mais pas trop croustillants. Astuce\r\ndans une passoire et égouttez l''excédent de graisse.\r\nRemettez le mélange de carottes dans la poêle\r\navec la pancetta et ajouter la feuille de laurier,\r\nbeaucoup d''assaisonnement et le bouillon. Apportez\r\nà ébullition, ajoutez les pâtes et faites cuire\r\npendant 5 minutes.","Top et tail du green et du coureur\r\nharicots, coupez les deux en longueurs qui\r\ntenir facilement sur une cuillère et ajouter au pot\r\navec les fèves. Cuire 3 minutes,\r\npuis ajoutez le chou. Ramenez à un\r\nlaisser mijoter et cuire 2 min. Verser le\r\npesto sur le dessus de la soupe juste\r\navant de servir et servir avec le pain."]','2026-01-11 00:15:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12097,5882,'fr','Pâtes aux champignons et aux herbes','Une idée rapide et faible en gras pour un dîner en milieu de semaine – idéale si vous avez un budget d''environ 1,15 £ par personne','["250 g de champignons des champs ou portobello, tranchés épaissement","2 cuillères à café de moutarde complète","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées ou écrasées","150 ml de bouillon de légumes (en cube, c''est bien)","250 g de pâtes penne (ou autres formes de tubes)","3 cuillères à soupe de persil plat haché","le zeste d''1 citron"]','["Mettez les champignons, la moutarde, l''ail et\r\nbouillon de légumes dans une poêle, porter à\r\nfaire bouillir et laisser mijoter pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle stock s''est presque entièrement évaporé et le\r\nles champignons sont mous.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes selon\r\npour emballer les instructions. Égoutter et mélanger avec le\r\nchampignons, persil et zeste de citron. Saison\r\nà déguster et à servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:15:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12098,5884,'fr','Salade de pâtes au thon rapide','Des pâtes rapides avec les restes de la veille. Fait un excellent panier-repas','["2 paquets de 220 g de pâtes prêtes à l''emploi (nous avons utilisé Dolmio Express), ou 440 g de restes de penne cuites (environ 200 g séchées)","100 g de thon à l''huile en boîte","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte (les borlotti ou les haricots beurre sont également bons)","1 ou 2 oignon rouge, finement haché","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","une grosse poignée de persil"]','["Mettez les penne cuites au micro-ondes selon les instructions sur l''emballage. Versez dans un bol. Mélanger le reste des ingrédients (le\r\nles pâtes chaudes vont vraiment s''imprégner des saveurs). Si vous utilisez des restes de pâtes réfrigérées, mélangez simplement le tout – elles auront toujours un goût\r\nsuper. Peut être conservé au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 3 jours."]','2026-01-11 00:15:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12099,5886,'fr','Lasagnes végétariennes','Une lasagne végétarienne légère mais succulente pour chatouiller vos papilles – elle ne contient que 13 g de matières grasses contre 19 g plus habituels.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile","1 oignon, tranché","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","1 aubergine, coupée en morceaux","1 poivron rouge","8 tomates italiennes, coupées en deux","350 ml en purée","200 g de feuilles de lasagnes prêtes à l''emploi","6 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche demi-écrémée","2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan râpé (ou alternative végétarienne)"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/ventilateur 170°C/gaz 5. Mélanger l''huile et les légumes ensemble et rôtir dans un grand moule peu profond pendant 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement carbonisés. Versez une couche de légumes rôtis au fond d’un plat allant au four de taille moyenne.","Versez dessus un peu de passata et recouvrez d''une couche de feuilles de lasagnes. Répétez les couches pour utiliser tous les légumes rôtis et la passata, en terminant par une couche de lasagnes. Utilisez une cuillère pour arroser la crème fraîche, puis saupoudrez de parmesan. Remettre au four pendant 25 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les lasagnes soient bien chaudes et que le dessus soit doré et bouillonnant."]','2026-01-11 00:15:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12100,5888,'fr','Salade de pâtes préférée','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une salade faible en gras et piquante, parfaite pour une boîte à lunch d''été – variez avec vos ingrédients préférés.','["250 g de formes de pâtes","140 g de petits pois surgelés","persil haché, haché","ciboulette en petit paquet, ciselée","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","ingrédients supplémentaires (voir idées ci-dessous)"]','["Cuire les pâtes en ajoutant\r\nles petits pois pour les 2 dernières minutes\r\ntemps de cuisson. Égoutter, rincer\r\navec de l''eau froide pour refroidir,\r\npuis égouttez à nouveau. Astuce dans\r\nun bol avec le haché\r\nherbes, zeste de citron et\r\njus, huile d''olive et beaucoup\r\nd''assaisonnement et bien mélanger.\r\nCouvrir et réfrigérer, en versant à la cuillère\r\nsortir les portions au fur et à mesure.\r\nSi tu fais ça pour une personne\r\npersonne, aux jours 3 et 4, vous\r\nil faut incorporer un peu d''huile d''olive\r\nou quelque chose de crémeux à\r\ndétacher les pâtes."]','2026-01-11 00:15:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12101,5890,'fr','Tortellini à la ricotta, épinards et bacon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ces pâtes croustillantes et crémeuses sont assez spéciales pour recevoir en été.','["Paquet de 250 g de tortellini fourrés (nous avons utilisé de la ricotta et des épinards)","2 tranches de bacon maigre","25 g de noix en morceaux","le zeste d''½ citron, le jus de 1","1 cuillère à soupe de parmesan finement râpé, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour servir","100 g de salade d''épinards en sachet","2 cuillères à soupe de ricotta"]','["Faites chauffer le gril. Faire bouillir les pâtes selon\r\nemballer les instructions, puis verser dans une passoire\r\net laisser refroidir sous l''eau courante.\r\nPendant ce temps, faites griller le bacon sur une plaque allant au four\r\njusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés et croustillants. Quand\r\npresque prêt, versez les noix sur le plateau\r\ntrinquer un peu. Coupez le bacon en lanières.","Mélanger le zeste et le jus de citron, le Parmesan\r\net l''huile dans un grand bol. Assaisonner de poivre,\r\npuis ajoutez les épinards, les tortellini et le bacon\r\net des noix. Bien mélanger, ajouter la ricotta\r\npetites gouttes, puis mélangez doucement. Assaisonner au goût,\r\npuis servir avec un filet d''huile et plus\r\nDu parmesan, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12102,5892,'fr','Poulet rôti entier avec racines et petits pois braisés','Superposez du rutabaga, des pommes de terre et des poireaux à rôtir avec un poulet pour un dîner sain. Un poulet entier est économique car il peut fournir des restes pour la semaine','["800 g de pommes de terre moyennes, tranchées finement","1 gros poireau (environ 350 g), tranché","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym, plus les tiges","4 gousses d''ail, hachées","500 g de rutabagas, tranché finement","450 ml de bouillon de légumes, préparé avec 2 cuillères à café de bouillon en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1,3 kg de poulet entier","320 g de petits pois surgelés"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger les pommes de terre, les poireaux, le thym, l''ail et le rutabaga dans une rôtissoire profonde et antiadhésive. Secouez pour obtenir une couche uniforme. Versez le bouillon et badigeonnez les légumes d’huile. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes.","Mettez les tiges de thym dans la cavité du poulet. Après 20 minutes, placez le poulet sur les légumes et faites-le rôtir pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Après 30 minutes, vérifiez les pommes de terre – ajoutez 150 ml d''eau si elles commencent à prendre. Retirer le poulet sur une planche et laisser reposer 10 minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire la moitié des petits pois en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.","Découpez les cuisses de poulet et retirez leur peau, puis servez avec la moitié des légumes rôtis et les petits pois. Laissez le reste du poulet et des légumes refroidir, puis conservez-les au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Pour préparer les restes, retirez la peau d''un des magrets et réchauffez-le avec les légumes au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud. Faites cuire les pois restants en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Trancher la poitrine et servir avec les légumes. Utilisez la dernière poitrine pour ces wraps aux œufs de poule épicés. Cette recette fait partie de notre plan d''alimentation saine gratuit de 7 jours. Pour accéder au plan de repas complet, cliquez ici."]','2026-01-11 00:15:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12103,5894,'fr','Pommes de terre rôties à l''air libre','Préparez des pommes de terre rôties dans une friteuse à air pour obtenir facilement des rôtis croustillants avec un centre moelleux. Ils constituent le plat d''accompagnement parfait pour un rôti du dimanche','["1 kg de pommes de terre Maris Piper","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou d''olive"]','["Coupez les pommes de terre en morceaux de taille égale, en veillant à ce qu''elles ne soient pas trop grosses. Faites cuire à la vapeur 5 minutes dans un panier vapeur posé sur une casserole d''eau bouillante ou laissez mijoter doucement pendant 5 minutes. Bien égoutter.","Versez les pommes de terre égouttées au fond d''une friteuse à air. Ajoutez l''huile et mélangez le tout pour vous assurer que les pommes de terre sont bien enrobées. Mettez la friteuse à cuire pendant 30 minutes à l''aide de la palette. Vérifiez que les pommes de terre sont bien cuites, puis laissez cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes si elles ne sont pas assez tendres ou suffisamment dorées. Assaisonnez bien."]','2026-01-11 00:15:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12104,5896,'fr','Courge musquée écrasée noisettes et sauge','Ajoutez du beurre noisette à la courge musquée écrasée pour un merveilleux goût de noisette qui se marie à merveille avec les noisettes. Un accompagnement végétarien polyvalent pour les dîners rôtis','["1 grosse courge musquée (environ 1,2 kg), pelée, épépinée et coupée en morceaux de 3 cm","50g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de sauge finement hachée, plus quelques feuilles entières pour servir","bonne noix de muscade râpée","50 g de noisettes blanchies, hachées grossièrement","1 grosse courge musquée (environ 1,2 kg), pelée, épépinée et coupée en morceaux de 3 cm","50g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de sauge finement hachée, plus quelques feuilles entières pour servir","bonne noix de muscade râpée","50 g de noisettes blanchies, hachées grossièrement"]','["Versez la courge dans un grand bol allant au micro-ondes avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau et assaisonnez. Couvrir avec une assiette ou un couvercle allant au micro-ondes et passer au micro-ondes pendant 12 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très tendres.","Pendant ce temps, versez le beurre dans une poêle et faites-le fondre à feu moyen. Laisser cuire 2 à 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés avec une odeur de biscuit. Ajoutez les feuilles de sauge entières la dernière minute pour les rendre croustillantes. Retirer et réserver.","Écrasez la courge cuite avec un presse-purée et mélangez-y l''essentiel du beurre noisette, la sauge hachée, la muscade et une généreuse pincée de sel. Arroser du reste de beurre et parsemer de noisettes et de feuilles de sauge entières croustillantes.","Versez la courge dans un grand bol allant au micro-ondes avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau et assaisonnez. Couvrir avec une assiette ou un couvercle allant au micro-ondes et passer au micro-ondes pendant 12 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très tendres.","Pendant ce temps, versez le beurre dans une poêle et faites-le fondre à feu moyen. Laisser cuire 2 à 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés avec une odeur de biscuit. Ajoutez les feuilles de sauge entières la dernière minute pour les rendre croustillantes. Retirer et réserver.","Écrasez la courge cuite avec un presse-purée et mélangez-y l''essentiel du beurre noisette, la sauge hachée, la muscade et une généreuse pincée de sel. Arroser du reste de beurre et parsemer de noisettes et de feuilles de sauge entières croustillantes."]','2026-01-11 00:15:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12105,5898,'fr','Rôti de noix végétalien facile','Savourez ce rôti de noix facile comme plat principal végétarien. À base de grenade, de canneberges et de châtaigniers, il regorge de saveurs hivernales','["2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin moulues","400 g de courge butternut pelée, épépinée et coupée en morceaux de 3 cm","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la boîte","2 cuillères à soupe de zaatar","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 branche de céleri, finement hachée","250 g de champignons de Paris finement hachés","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte miso","200 g de pistaches décortiquées hachées grossièrement, plus un peu pour servir","100 g de châtaignes cuites hachées finement","100 g de chapelure fraîche","½ petit bouquet de persil finement haché","200 g de canneberges fraîches ou surgelées","4 cuillères à soupe de cassonade légère","graines de grenade, pour servir"]','["Mélangez les graines de lin avec 4 cuillères à soupe d''eau dans un petit bol et laissez épaissir. Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faire revenir la courge dans un plat à rôtir avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, le zaatar, le cumin et la coriandre. Couvrir le moule de papier d''aluminium et rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre mais conserve sa forme. Huiler un moule à cake de 900 g et le tapisser de papier sulfurisé.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir l''oignon, le céleri et les champignons pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer l''ail et la pâte miso.","Versez les pistaches, les châtaignes, la chapelure et le persil dans un bol, puis incorporez le mélange de graines de lin, les légumes frits et la courge rôtie. Assaisonnez bien.","Mettez les canneberges dans une poêle avec le sucre et faites cuire pendant 3-4 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous et que les canneberges commencent tout juste à ramollir. Verser dans le fond du moule à cake, puis laisser reposer 5 minutes pour qu''il prenne légèrement. Garnir du mélange de rôtis de noix, en tapotant fermement et en lissant le dessus avec le dos d''une cuillère. Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 25 minutes, puis découvrir et cuire encore 25 minutes. Laisser reposer 15 min, puis renverser sur une assiette de service en retirant le papier sulfurisé. Garnir de pistaches hachées supplémentaires et de graines de grenade, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12106,5900,'fr','Lentilles à la courge et à l''ail rôties lentement avec du yaourt à la harissa','Faites ressortir la saveur sucrée de la courge musquée en la rôtissant lentement et en la servant avec des lentilles légèrement épicées pour un délicieux plat principal végétarien.','["1 courge butternut pelée, épépinée et coupée en tranches de 2 cm","8 gousses d''ail, avec la peau","4 petites échalotes, avec la peau","3 feuilles de laurier","quelques brins de thym","50 ml d''huile de colza","une poignée de coriandre hachée","150 g de lentilles vertes ou du Puy","1 feuille de laurier","1 gousse d''ail","un filet d''huile d''olive","6 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec épais","1 cuillère à soupe de tahin","1-2 cuillères à soupe de harissa à la rose","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café d''huile de colza"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez les lentilles. Faire tremper pendant au moins 2 heures ou toute la nuit. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger la courge, l''ail, les échalotes, le laurier, le thym, l''huile et une pincée de sel marin dans une rôtissoire, couvrir de papier d''aluminium et rôtir pendant 45 minutes. Retirez le papier d''aluminium et faites rôtir encore 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres et caramélisés sur les bords. Retirer du four et augmenter le feu à 200 °C/180 °C ventilateur/gaz 6. Mélanger les graines de citrouille avec le cumin, l''huile et une pincée de sel, et rôtir jusqu''à ce qu''elles éclatent, environ 5 à 6 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les lentilles dans une poêle avec le laurier, l''ail et une pincée de sel. Couvrir d''eau, porter à ébullition, puis laisser mijoter 20 à 25 minutes. Égoutter et retirer le laurier et l''ail. Mélanger avec l''huile et le poivre noir.","Mélangez le yaourt et le tahini. Ajoutez la harissa selon votre goût, puis mélangez avec les lentilles. Pressez les échalotes rôties et l''ail de leur peau et mélangez-les aux lentilles avec un filet d''huile de la boîte.","Servir la courge sur les lentilles, parsemée de coriandre et de graines, et le yaourt à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:15:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12107,5902,'fr','Comment faire rôtir l''ail','Envie de découvrir comment rôtir l’ail ? Une fois rôti, l''ail devient doux et doux – parfait pour les soupes, les sauces et les trempettes.','["1 bulbe d''ail","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Coupez le dessus du bulbe d''ail, exposant le dessus des gousses d''ail. Mettez un petit carré de papier d''aluminium et frottez avec l''huile d''olive. Assaisonner de sel et de poivre. Froissez le papier d''aluminium pour sceller l''ampoule.","Rôtir pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre lorsqu''on le presse et que l''enveloppe en papier soit légèrement dorée. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes avant de presser les ails rôtis et tendres pour les sortir de leur coquille. Vous pouvez également retirer tout le boîtier en papier et retirer les clous de girofle individuellement."]','2026-01-11 00:15:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12108,5904,'fr','Pommes de terre nouvelles rôties au citron','Une nouvelle façon avec les pommes de terre qui s''accorde particulièrement bien avec un plat principal à base de fruits de mer','["450 g de pommes de terre nouvelles","le zeste d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Incliner le \r\npommes de terre dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante, \r\nattendez que l''eau bout à nouveau, puis laissez cuire  \r\n5 minutes. Égoutter, remettre dans la casserole et secouer \r\nbien pour égratigner un peu les bords. Astuce sur  \r\nune plaque à pâtisserie, mélanger avec le zeste de citron, l''huile et \r\nun peu de sel marin feuilleté, puis rôtir pendant 30 minutes \r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants."]','2026-01-11 00:15:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12109,5906,'fr','Poulet rôti farci au couscous et aux pignons de pin','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Délicieux chaud ou froid et parfait pour un pique-nique, ce poulet farci sera un véritable favori de la famille.','["100 g de couscous","175 ml de bouillon de poulet bouillant","50g de beurre","1 oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","100 g de pignons de pin","140 g d''abricots secs hachés grossièrement","une grosse poignée de persil, haché grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de menthe, hachées grossièrement","1 citron","1 œuf battu","6 poitrines de poulet sans peau","16 morceaux de bacon"]','["Mettez le couscous dans un grand bol résistant à la chaleur, versez dessus le bouillon, puis couvrez d''un film alimentaire pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le liquide soit absorbé. Faites fondre la moitié du beurre dans une poêle, puis faites revenir doucement l''oignon et l''ail pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Annuler. Faites frire les pignons de pin à sec pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Mélanger les oignons, les pignons de pin, les abricots et les herbes avec le couscous. Ajoutez un bon filet de citron\r\njus, assaisonner, puis incorporer l''œuf. Laisser refroidir.","À l’aide du dos d’un couteau, étirez les tranches jusqu’à 1½ fois leur longueur d’origine. Disposez-les en les faisant légèrement chevaucher sur une grande feuille de papier d''aluminium pour former un rectangle. Faites quelques entailles dans la partie la plus épaisse de chaque blanc de poulet et disposez-les entre 2 feuilles de film alimentaire. Utilisez le fond d''une poêle épaisse pour écraser le poulet jusqu''à ce qu''il ait environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Disposer le poulet sur le bacon, en l''adaptant\r\nil n''y a donc pas d''espace, mais laissez une bordure sur les côtés les plus longs. (Cela aide à enrouler le poulet.)","Verser la farce sur le poulet en une bande le long de l''un des côtés les plus longs. En utilisant du papier d''aluminium pour vous aider, roulez le bacon et le poulet autour de la farce comme une bûche. Enveloppez hermétiquement dans du papier d''aluminium, en tordant les extrémités pour bien fixer, puis réfrigérez pendant 2 heures ou jusqu''à 1 jour.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/chaleur tournante 160°C/gaz 4. Placer le poulet, côté joint vers le bas, dans une plaque à rôtir. Cuire pendant 30 minutes, puis déballer le papier d''aluminium et badigeonner le rôti du reste du beurre. Cuire à découvert pendant 20 à 30 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce que la farce soit bien cuite et chaude (une brochette en métal insérée au centre du poulet doit ressortir chaude). Laisser refroidir et envelopper dans du papier d''aluminium frais pour le transport."]','2026-01-11 00:15:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12110,5908,'fr','Poulet rôti et légumes tout-en-un','Envie de la saveur d''un rôti, mais pas du gras ? Essayez cette recette simple et saine dans une poêle','["8 petites pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 carottes, tranchées","1 courgette, tranchée","1 poireau, tranché","1 cuillère à café de thym et de romarin hachés, plus un brin ou deux","2 petites poitrines de poulet sans peau","150 ml de bouillon de poulet faible en sodium"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Dans un\r\npetite plaque à rôtir, mélanger les pommes de terre avec\r\nl''huile, les carottes, la courgette, le poireau, les herbes\r\net l''assaisonnement. Rôtir pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ncommence à dorer. Supprimer du\r\nfour et remuez les légumes, nichez-les dedans\r\nle poulet, puis remettre au four\r\npendant 15 minutes. Versez sur le bouillon, puis\r\ncuire encore 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet\r\net les légumes sont bien cuits."]','2026-01-11 00:15:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12111,5910,'fr','Poulet épicé avec salade de mangue','Un avantage épicé super sain pour le poulet','["4 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau","arroser d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","1 grosse mangue mûre","½ concombre","½ petit oignon rouge","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre fraîche","4 cuillères à soupe de crème sure ou de yaourt nature","le zeste et le jus râpés d''un demi citron vert","pain naan chaud, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer une plaque chauffante ou une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude. Frottez le poulet avec de l''huile, du garam masala et une bonne pincée de sel. Cuire 6 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement carbonisés et bien cuits.","Épluchez et coupez la mangue en fins quartiers. Coupez le concombre en deux dans le sens de la longueur et coupez-le en tranches épaisses en biais. Émincez finement l''oignon. Mélanger les ingrédients de la salade avec la coriandre et empiler sur des assiettes.","Mélangez la crème sure ou le yaourt avec le zeste et le jus de citron vert, assaisonnez et déposez-en une cuillerée à côté de la salade. Coupez le poulet en deux ou en trois en diagonale, disposez ensuite\r\nà la salade et servir avec du pain naan."]','2026-01-11 00:15:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12112,5912,'fr','Légumes racines rôtis','Les légumes-racines sont un incontournable du déjeuner du dimanche et du dîner de Noël, et cette recette facile est faible en gras, super saine et riche en fibres en plus.','["5 carottes pelées et coupées en quartiers","5 panais, pelés et coupés en quartiers","1 céleri-rave pelé et coupé en cubes de 2 cm","½ rutabaga épluché, coupé en cubes de 2 cm","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 bulbe d''ail, coupé en deux","miel clair, pour arroser"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Remuer\r\ntous les légumes avec l''huile et l''ail dans un grand\r\nplat à rôtir, puis rôtir pendant 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ncommence à ramollir et à devenir doré.\r\nSortez le moule du four, arrosez\r\nles légumes avec du miel et retourner au\r\ncuire au four encore 10 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré."]','2026-01-11 00:15:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12113,5914,'fr','Fish & chips rôtis à la raita à l''orange','Une gâterie saine pour satisfaire toute la famille','["3 pommes de terre moyennes au four, lavées","2 patates douces moyennes, lavées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de piment ou d''huile d''olive","1 grosse orange","¼ de concombre, haché finement","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe fraîche hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature faible en gras","4 filets de poisson blanc pesant chacun environ 175 g/6 oz","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin"]','["Préchauffer le four à 200°C/gaz\r\n6/ventilateur 180C. Coupez chaque pomme de terre\r\net patate douce dans le sens de la longueur\r\nen 6 ou 8 quartiers – pas besoin de\r\npeler. Verser dans une rôtissoire\r\net arroser d''huile.\r\nAssaisonner, bien mélanger, puis rôtir\r\npendant 40-45 minutes jusqu''à tendreté,\r\nles retourner à mi-cuisson.","Épluchez l''orange avec un couteau pointu,\r\ncouteau dentelé pour enlever la moelle\r\n– faites-le au-dessus d''un bol pour attraper\r\nle jus, dont vous aurez besoin plus tard.\r\nDécoupez les segments en retirant\r\nn''importe quelle membrane, puis hachez-la\r\neux. Mélanger avec le concombre,\r\noignon, menthe, vinaigre et yaourt.\r\nAjoutez un peu de sel et de poivre, puis\r\nréserver, couvert.","Badigeonner une plaque à pâtisserie d''huile\r\net mettez le poisson dessus. Saison,\r\narroser de jus d''orange\r\net le cumin. Rôti dessus\r\nles chips pendant 12-15 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les chips soient cuites.\r\nServir avec la raita à l''orange."]','2026-01-11 00:15:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12114,5916,'fr','Saumon poché en papillote avec mayonnaise aux herbes','Apprenez à pocher parfaitement un saumon grâce à notre recette étape par étape – puis servez-le avec une mayonnaise maison à la ciboulette, au basilic et à l''aneth.','["huile d''olive légère, pour graisser","3 kg de saumon entier éviscéré et écaillé sans la tête","bouquet d''aneth","1 échalote, coupée en deux et tranchée très finement","5 cuillères à soupe de vin blanc sec, comme le Sauvignon Blanc","2 cuillères à soupe de ciboulette ciselée","2 cuillères à soupe de basilic haché","500 ml de mayonnaise","cresson, concombre, herbes et quartiers de citron, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 150°C/130°C ventilé/\r\ngaz 2. Placez un gros morceau de\r\nfeuille double largeur sur le dessus\r\nune grande plaque à pâtisserie et badigeonnez-la\r\navec de l''huile, puis mettez le saumon dans le\r\ncentre. Rentrez quelques brins généreux\r\nd''aneth et d''échalotes dans le corps\r\ncavité, puis assaisonner.","Soulevez soigneusement les côtés de\r\nle papier d''aluminium pour entourer le poisson,\r\nbien assaisonner à l''intérieur comme à l''extérieur,\r\npuis versez dessus le vin.","Scellez le papier d''aluminium sur tout le pourtour,\r\nmais pas trop serré sur le poisson\r\n– il faut lui donner un peu\r\nespace au sein de la parcelle. Cuire au four pour\r\n1h30.","Une fois le saumon cuit,\r\ndéballer soigneusement le colis en aluminium\r\net tirez la nageoire dorsale sur le\r\ncolonne vertébrale du poisson. Si le saumon est\r\nprêt, il devrait repartir très\r\nfacilement. Refermer le colis et laisser à\r\ncool – ça va continuer à cuire un peu\r\nplus à mesure qu''il refroidit. Si vous n''êtes pas sûr\r\nque le saumon est suffisamment cuit,\r\nremettez-le au four encore 10 minutes.","Une fois froid, décollez délicatement\r\nla peau d''un côté du\r\nsaumon. Vous devrez peut-être utiliser\r\nun couteau pour commencer, mais ça\r\ndevrait se décoller facilement après cela.\r\nLaissez l''aneth et l''échalote cuits\r\nen place, car vous pourriez endommager le\r\nchair du saumon si vous essayez de\r\nretirez-les.","Utilisez un couteau pour gratter le\r\nchair grasse brune. Ça a le goût\r\ndélicieux mais n''a pas l''air\r\naussi attrayant que la chair rose\r\nen dessous. Tournez soigneusement le\r\nle saumon sur une assiette et\r\nretirer la peau et la chair brune\r\nde l''autre côté.","Pour servir, retirez délicatement le\r\nfilets d''un côté du poisson,\r\nlaissant derrière lui les os. Vous\r\nje verrai que le poisson a un naturel\r\ndiviser 2 longs filets de chaque côté.\r\nInsérez votre couteau au centre et\r\nretirez soigneusement chaque filet. Transfert\r\nles filets dans une assiette, côté os vers le haut.","Soulevez l''os central de\r\nle poisson entier restant –\r\nça devrait partir en un seul coup\r\nmorceau – et retirez les aromates.\r\nSéparez les 2 filets restants et\r\nretirez tous les arêtes. Remonter\r\nle saumon sur le plateau. Remuez le\r\nherbes dans votre mayonnaise et\r\ngarnir le saumon de cresson,\r\nconcombre, herbes et citron."]','2026-01-11 00:15:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12115,5918,'fr','Rôti de bœuf avec sauce à l''oignon français','Le Silverside et le Topside sont des coupes de viande moins chères et plus maigres, bien adaptées à la cuisson lente. Le bouillon et les jus font une excellente sauce lorsqu''ils sont combinés avec des oignons caramélisés.','["1 kg de silverside ou de dessus de bœuf, sans matière grasse ajoutée (voir astuce ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 jeunes carottes, fanes parées (mais laissez-en un peu, si vous le souhaitez)","1 branche de céleri, finement hachée","200 ml de vin blanc","600 ml de bouillon de bœuf riche","2 feuilles de laurier","500g d''oignons","quelques brins de thym","1 cuillère à café de beurre","1 cuillère à café de sucre brun clair ou muscovado clair","2 cuillères à café de farine nature"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3.\r\nFrotter la viande avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile\r\net beaucoup d''assaisonnement. Faites chauffer un grand\r\ncocotte antidéflagrante et marron\r\nla viande partout pendant environ 10 minutes.\r\nPendant ce temps, ajoutez 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une poêle à frire.\r\npoêler et faire revenir les carottes et le céleri\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Soulevez le bœuf dans une assiette, éclaboussez-le\r\nvin dans la cocotte chaude et faire bouillir pendant\r\n2 minutes. Versez le bouillon, remettez le\r\nboeuf, puis rentrer les carottes, le céleri\r\net des feuilles de laurier, en essayant de ne pas submerger\r\nles carottes trop. Couvrir et cuire\r\nau four pendant 2 heures. (J''aime tourner le\r\nboeuf à mi-cuisson.)","Pendant ce temps, émincez finement les oignons.\r\nFaites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle et incorporez-y le\r\noignons, thym et un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nCouvrir et cuire doucement pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nles oignons sont ramollis mais non colorés.\r\nRetirez le couvercle, augmentez le feu, ajoutez\r\nle beurre et le sucre, puis laissez les oignons\r\ncaraméliser jusqu''à obtenir un brun doré foncé,\r\nen remuant souvent. Retirez les brins de thym,\r\npuis mettre de côté.","Quand le bœuf sera prêt, il sera tendre\r\net facile à démonter sur les bords.\r\nRetirez-le de la cocotte et coupez-le\r\nhors des cordes. Réchauffer la poêle à oignons, remuer\r\ndans la farine et cuire 1 min. Fouetter le\r\noignons farineux dans les jus de bœuf du\r\ncocotte, pour faire une sauce épaisse à l''oignon.\r\nGoûtez pour l’assaisonnement. Ajoutez le bœuf et\r\nles carottes dans la cocotte, ou coupez-les en tranches.\r\nboeuf et apporter à table sur un plateau,\r\navec les carottes à part et le\r\nsauce versée dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:15:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12116,5920,'fr','Rôti de boeuf épicé','Le rosbif de Matt Tebbutt associe épices et viande fondante. Ce sera tout aussi bon froid aussi','["1 cuillère à soupe de baies de genièvre","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à soupe de grains de poivre noir","1 cuillère à soupe de baies de piment de la Jamaïque","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 kg à 3 kg (4 lb 8 oz à 6 lb 8 oz) de rôti de bœuf - en fonction de la quantité de restes souhaitée"]','["Mélangez toutes les épices et ½ cuillère à soupe de sel dans un pilon et un mortier. Donnez à tout une bonne mouture en gardant un peu de sa grossièreté. Frottez l''huile puis les épices moulues sur tout le bœuf et massez bien. Couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit pour mariner.","Le lendemain, chauffez le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Pesez votre rôti et rôtissez 10 minutes pour 450 g pour une viande saignante et 15 minutes pour 450 g pour une viande moyenne, plus 20 minutes supplémentaires. Couvrir et laisser reposer 20 minutes le temps de finir les salades, puis trancher et servir. Vous pouvez également rôtir le bœuf le matin et le servir à température ambiante pour le dîner."]','2026-01-11 00:15:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12117,5922,'fr','Bœuf poêlé aux champignons sauvages et balsamique','Un plat principal élégant pour deux, inspiré de la région italienne d''Émilie-Romagne','["400 g de morceau de filet de bœuf","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","feuilles d''1 brin de romarin, meurtries","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre","200 g de champignons sauvages mélangés","200 ml de bon bouillon de bœuf","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique, pour servir"]','["Frotter le bœuf avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile, le romarin et\r\nl''ail, puis laisser au réfrigérateur au moins 1 h,\r\nou jusqu''à 24 heures. Assurez-vous que le bœuf retourne à\r\ntempérature ambiante avant de le cuire.","Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Chauffer\r\nune poêle ou un rôtissoire antiadhésif allant au four\r\nl''étain jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Frottez la majeure partie de l''ail et\r\nromarin du bœuf, assaisonner de noir\r\npoivre et sel feuilleté, puis saisir de tous les côtés\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit brun foncé et presque recouvert d''une croûte – environ\r\n5 minutes au total. Transférer la poêle au four,\r\npuis faites rôtir le bœuf pendant 10 minutes pour une cuisson mi-saignante.\r\nLaisser reposer 15 bonnes minutes et\r\nconservez les jus.","Pendant que la viande repose, faites revenir les champignons.\r\nFaites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre et le reste de l''huile dans\r\nune grande poêle, puis y verser les champignons\r\navec beaucoup d''assaisonnement. Frire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré\r\net juste ramolli, puis versez-le dans un bol.","Ajoutez le bouillon dans la poêle à champignons, puis\r\nréduire des deux tiers. Astuce dans les champignons\r\net balsamique, puis ajouter le reste du beurre\r\net laissez-le fondre. Versez le jus de viande, puis\r\nassaisonner au goût et garder au chaud. Tranche épaisse\r\nle bœuf et verser sur la sauce. Servir\r\navec purée et épinards."]','2026-01-11 00:15:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12118,5924,'fr','Pommes de terre rôties croquantes','Les pommes de terre rôties croustillantes sont un élément essentiel du déjeuner rôti parfait. Si vous aimez les panais, faites-les rôtir exactement de la même manière','["20 pommes de terre de taille égale, comme les King Edwards, pelées et coupées en deux si elles sont grosses","Pot de 200 g de graisse d''oie","sel, pour servir"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 10 minutes, puis\r\négoutter. Dépolir leurs surfaces avec\r\nune fourchette ou en les secouant dans la poêle\r\navec le couvercle.","Faire fondre la graisse d''oie dans un grand chaudron à fond épais\r\nplat à rôtir sur le dessus du\r\npoêle. Incorporez délicatement les pommes de terre et\r\nretournez-les jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient uniformément enrobés\r\ndans la graisse. Placer sur l''étagère supérieure du\r\nfour (déplacez la dinde sur une grille si\r\nnécessaire) et rôtir pendant 1 à 1¼ heures,\r\nretourner de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant\r\net doré. Saupoudrer de sel pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12119,5926,'fr','Sarnies de steak avec oignons collants et fromage bleu','Savourez la combinaison classique de steak et de fromage bleu sur un délicieux levain pour un déjeuner simple mais spécial','["2 cuillères à soupe de beurre non salé","1 oignon rouge, tranché finement","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce Worcestershire","½ cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","40 g de stilton émietté","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","1 gros surlonge ou rumsteck (environ 350g)","4 tranches de pain au levain","poignée de roquette, pour servir"]','["Faites fondre le beurre dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon avec une pincée de sel pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Ajoutez la sauce Worcestershire et le sucre et faites revenir encore 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient collants et caramélisés. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Mélangez le stilton avec la mayonnaise et assaisonnez avec du poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Annuler.","Assaisonnez le steak des deux côtés. Faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif et faites cuire le steak 2 à 3 minutes de chaque côté (2 minutes pour une cuisson saignante ou 3 minutes pour une cuisson à point). Retirer sur une planche, couvrir et laisser reposer 10 minutes. Tranchez finement le steak.","Faire griller les tranches de levain, puis tartiner du mélange de fromage bleu. Garnir de steak, d''oignons caramélisés, de roquette et d''un peu de poivre noir moulu, puis servir deux sandwichs ouverts par personne."]','2026-01-11 00:15:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12120,5930,'fr','Garniture pour sandwich au poulet et à l''avocat','Le poulet maigre constitue une excellente base pour un sandwich. Mélanger avec des ingrédients de salade fraîche et un peu de mayonnaise faible en gras','["2 cuillères à café de mayonnaise faible en gras","tranches de poulet cuit","½ petit avocat, coupé en dés","un filet de citron","oignon rouge haché","feuilles de coriandre","tomates cerises coupées en deux","trancher du pain complet aux graines ou du seigle, ou du pitta aux grains entiers, pour servir"]','["Garnir le pain ou remplir le pitta de mayonnaise et de poulet, puis ajouter l''avocat, le citron, l''oignon rouge, la coriandre et les tomates cerises."]','2026-01-11 00:15:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12121,5932,'fr','Garniture pour sandwich houmous et avocat','Rehaussez le houmous avec de la coriandre, de l''oignon rouge, des tomates et du citron et farcissez-le dans du pitta ou servez-le empilé sur du pain de grains entiers ou de seigle.','["2 grosses cuillerées d''houmous","½ petit avocat, coupé en dés","un filet de citron","un peu d''oignon rouge haché","feuilles de coriandre","quelques tomates cerises coupées en deux","trancher du pain aux graines complètes ou du seigle, ou du pitta complet, pour servir"]','["Garnir le pain ou remplir la pitta d''houmous, puis ajouter l''avocat avec le citron, l''oignon rouge, la coriandre et les tomates cerises."]','2026-01-11 00:15:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12122,5934,'fr','Garniture de sandwich cocktail aux crevettes','Préparez des crevettes classiques avec de la mayonnaise plus saines : empilez-les sur du pain ou farcissez-les dans une pitta et servez-les avec une salade verte croquante et un peu d''aneth pour plus de saveur.','["50 g de crevettes","1 cuillère à soupe de mayonnaise faible en gras","purée de tomates en petits jets","plusieurs feuilles de laitue Little Gem","un peu d''oignon nouveau haché","tranches de concombre","saupoudrer d''aneth","trancher du pain aux graines complètes ou du seigle, ou du pitta complet, pour servir"]','["Incorporer les crevettes avec la mayonnaise et la purée de tomates. Empilez-les sur le pain ou dans une pitta avec de la laitue, de la ciboule, du concombre et de l''aneth."]','2026-01-11 00:15:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12123,5936,'fr','Garniture de sandwich à la mayonnaise aux œufs au curry','Pimentez la mayonnaise aux œufs traditionnelle avec un peu de pâte de curry. Servir empilé sur du pain ou farci de pitta avec du concombre croquant, de la laitue et de l''oignon nouveau','["1 œuf dur, haché","un peu de pâte de curry","1 cuillère à soupe de mayonnaise faible en gras","purée de tomates en petits jets","plusieurs feuilles de laitue Little Gem","un peu d''oignon nouveau haché","tranches de concombre","trancher du pain aux graines complètes ou du seigle, ou du pitta complet, pour servir"]','["Incorporer l''œuf dur et la pâte de curry à la mayonnaise et à la purée de tomates. Empilez-les sur du pain ou dans une pitta avec de la laitue, de l''oignon nouveau et du concombre."]','2026-01-11 00:15:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12124,5938,'fr','Wrap crevettes et avocat','Emballez quelque chose de sain pour votre boîte à lunch. Ce sandwich est parfumé au citron vert, à la ciboule et à la sauce épicée','["1 bébé avocat bien mûr, dénoyauté, pelé et haché grossièrement","jus ½ citron vert","quelques shakes de sauce Tabasco","1 tomate épépinée et hachée","1 oignon nouveau, tranché","1 tortilla de farine aux graines (ou alternative sans gluten)","une poignée de feuilles de salade mélangée","85 g de crevettes cuites et décortiquées"]','["Mettez l''avocat dans un bol avec le jus de citron vert, le Tabasco et un peu d''assaisonnement. Écrasez grossièrement, puis ajoutez la tomate, la coriandre (le cas échéant) et l''oignon nouveau.","Réchauffez le wrap au micro-ondes pendant quelques secondes. Étalez le mélange d''avocat au milieu, répartissez sur les feuilles de salade et terminez par les crevettes. Roulez-vous, puis mangez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12125,5940,'fr','Chiens de poisson avec salade de fenouil citronné','L''humble sandwich aux bâtonnets de poisson fait peau neuve – servez-le dans des petits pains à hot-dog avec une salade de chou fraîche et croquante.','["6 sous-marins moelleux et farineux ou rouleaux de hot-dog","800 à 900 g de filets de poisson blanc, fermes et sans peau (le flétan, le grondin, la daurade ou le cabillaud approuvé par le MSC sont tous bons), coupés en filets longs et fins","6 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de paprika","un peu d''huile végétale","1 gros bulbe de fenouil","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe de crème de salade légère","100g de yaourt nature","2 carottes coupées en allumettes ou râpées très grossièrement","une poignée de persil plat, haché grossièrement","1 citron confit (à retrouver en bocaux avec les ingrédients marocains), coupé en deux, les graines du milieu vidées et jetées, et le zeste finement haché"]','["Pour la salade de chou, cueillez les frondes feuillues de\r\nle fenouil et réserver. Jetez tout\r\ncouches extérieures sales, coupez le bulbe en quatre et\r\npuis coupez-le aussi finement que possible. Mélanger avec\r\nle jus de citron et laisser mariner pendant\r\n1h en remuant de temps en temps.","Égouttez le fenouil. Mélanger la crème de salade\r\net le yaourt dans un grand bol, puis ajoutez le\r\nfenouil, reste des ingrédients de la salade de chou,\r\nles feuilles de fenouil (hachées) et\r\nun peu de poivre, puis bien mélanger.","Au moment de servir, divisez les rouleaux et\r\nréchauffer à four doux. Pour le poisson, mélangez le\r\nfarine avec le paprika et un peu de sel dessus\r\nune assiette. Tremper dans les filets de poisson et enrober\r\neh bien. Faites chauffer un peu d''huile dans une poêle\r\n(antiadhésif si vous en avez) et faites frire le poisson\r\npendant quelques minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien cuit et il s''écaille. Divisez le\r\npêcher entre les rouleaux avec la salade de chou et\r\nmanger immédiatement. Les restes de salade de chou seront\r\nêtre bon pendant 2-3 jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:15:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12126,5942,'fr','Rouleaux de poulet, carottes et avocat','Wraps de tortilla sains, rapides et simples avec du poulet râpé, des légumes et de la salade – parfaits pour les petites boîtes à lunch','["75 g de fromage à pâte molle allégé","3 tortillas à la farine","1 poitrine de poulet cuite sans peau, râpée grossièrement","1 grosse carotte, râpée ou râpée","1 gros avocat, dénoyauté et tranché","poignée de feuilles de roquette"]','["Répartir le fromage sur les tortillas\r\net garnir de poulet, de carottes,\r\navocat et roquette.","Enroulez fermement chaque tortilla. Envelopper hermétiquement\r\ndans du film alimentaire, en tordant fermement les extrémités pour\r\nsceller et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous soyez prêt.","Déballez et coupez chaque rouleau en 4 morceaux\r\nà ajouter à vos boîtes à lunch."]','2026-01-11 00:15:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12127,5944,'fr','Sandwich ouvert au fromage cottage et au poivre','Donnez une touche saine à la bruschetta en garnissant vos toasts complets de fromage cottage, de basilic et de balsamique contrastant.','["140g de fromage blanc","½ poivron rouge, tranché finement","quelques feuilles de basilic déchirées","2 tranches de pain au levain ou de pain complet","un filet de vinaigre balsamique (facultatif)"]','["Étalez le fromage cottage, le poivron rouge\r\net basilic avec un peu d''assaisonnement dans un bol\r\nou un récipient en plastique. Réfrigérer jusqu''à l''heure du déjeuner.","Faire griller le pain et laisser refroidir 1 min, puis\r\ndonnez un rapide coup de fouet au mélange de fromage cottage\r\nmélanger et verser à la cuillère. Arrosez de balsamique\r\nvinaigre, si vous le souhaitez, et mangez immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:15:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12128,5946,'fr','Roulés de carottes et houmous','Roulez, roulez – préparez quelque chose de supersain en un éclair avec ces wraps végétariens','["Pot de 200 g d''houmous","4 wraps aux graines","4 carottes","petite poignée de feuilles de roquette"]','["Étalez le houmous entre les wraps. Râpez grossièrement les carottes et répartissez-les sur le houmous, en terminant chaque wrap avec une petite poignée de feuilles de roquette et un peu d''assaisonnement. Roulez-vous et mangez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12129,5948,'fr','Rouleaux arc-en-ciel','Pour un dessus croustillant et un milieu pâteux et moelleux, nous avons conçu des baps hybrides scone-pain, qui utilisent les restes de légumes.','["250 g de farine blanche nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","250 g de farine à pain blanc","500 g de farine à pain aux graines et céréales","Sachet de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","100 g de flocons d''avoine","100 g de graines mélangées, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de noix finement hachées","2 cuillères à café de bicarbonate de soude","50 g de beurre froid coupé en dés","2 pots de 284 ml de babeurre","100 g de courgettes râpées","100 g de carottes râpées","100 g de betterave crue râpée – portez des gants !","un peu de lait ou d''oeuf battu, pour glacer"]','["Dépoussiérez votre plus grande plaque à pâtisserie ou plateau\r\navec de la farine. Mélangez les farines, la levure, les flocons d''avoine,\r\ngraines, noix, bicarbonate et 2 cuillères à café de sel\r\ndans un bol, puis incorporez le beurre avec\r\nvos doigts jusqu''à ce qu''il disparaisse presque.","Versez le babeurre et 150-200 ml\r\narroser et mélanger rapidement avec un bâton en bois\r\ncuillère, puis vos mains, pour former une pâte.\r\nDivisez en 3 et pétrissez un légume râpé\r\nchacun pour faire une pâte de courgette, une carotte\r\npâte et une pâte de betterave. Former chacun en\r\n6 tours avec les mains farinées. Organiser,\r\nespacés, sur la plaque à pâtisserie, couvrir\r\nlégèrement avec du film alimentaire huilé et laisser reposer\r\nlever dans un endroit chaud pendant 30 minutes.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nBadigeonner le dessus de lait ou d''œuf, parsemer\r\navec des graines supplémentaires et cuire au four pendant 30-35 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les bases soient dorées pâles et saines\r\ncreux lorsqu''on le tape. Couvrir d''un thé\r\nserviette et laissez refroidir un peu – cela va\r\ngardez-les doux."]','2026-01-11 00:15:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12130,5950,'fr','Sandwichs ouverts à la truite fumée et au concombre','Cette recette fraîche et saine pour le déjeuner est prête en un éclair','["Paquet de 125 g de filets de truite fumés à chaud sans peau","½ pot de 250 g de Quark","½-1 cuillère à café de sauce au raifort","presser le jus de citron","2 tranches épaisses de pain de grenier","¼ concombre, tranché","25g de cresson","2 poignées de tomates cerises, pour servir"]','["Écaillez le poisson dans un grand bol, puis\r\nincorporer la sauce au fromage blanc et au raifort\r\nau goût. Assaisonner de poivre noir et\r\nun filet de jus de citron.","Faire griller le pain, puis garnir chaque morceau\r\navec des tranches de concombre et du cresson.\r\nDéposer la moitié du pâté de truite sur chacun\r\net servir avec des tomates cerises coupées en deux\r\nsur le côté."]','2026-01-11 00:15:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12131,5952,'fr','Sandwichs aux carottes et aux raisins secs','Un sandwich végétarien différent, cette garniture légère est simple et idéale pour le thé de l''après-midi ou les boîtes à lunch.','["1 grosse carotte, pelée et râpée","2 cuillères à soupe de raisins secs","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","½ cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe hachée","4 à 6 tranches de pain brun","3 cuillères à soupe d''houmous"]','["Mélangez la carotte avec les raisins secs, l''huile d''olive et le vinaigre. Assaisonnez et ajoutez la menthe.","Tartiner 2-3 tranches de pain d''houmous, garnir du mélange de carottes et mettre en sandwich 2-3 tranches supplémentaires. Découpez selon les formes souhaitées."]','2026-01-11 00:15:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12132,5954,'fr','Tartines aux tomates rôties & pesto de menthe','Sandwichs français ouverts au fromage et aux tomates grillés, arrosés de pesto léger à la menthe et à l''ail et tartinés de ricotta','["8 tomates mûries sur vigne de taille moyenne, coupées en deux","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","4 tranches épaisses de pain complet","1 gousse d''ail, laissée entière","25 g de pignons de pin grillés","petit bouquet de menthe","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","100 g de gazon","salade verte, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nMettez les moitiés de tomates dans un rôtissoire\r\nétain en une seule couche. Arroser de\r\n1 cuillère à soupe d''huile, bien assaisonner et\r\nrôtir pendant 20 minutes. Annuler.","Faire griller le pain, puis frotter avec\r\nl''ail - gardez la gousse pour le\r\npesto. Badigeonner un peu plus d''huile\r\nle pain et disposez-le sur 4 assiettes.","À l''aide d''un robot culinaire, whiz\r\nensemble les pignons de pin, la menthe, l''ail,\r\nle reste de l''huile et du vinaigre. Épais\r\nétalez la ricotta sur le pain,\r\npuis garnir avec le rôti\r\ntomates et un peu de pesto à la menthe.\r\nServir avec une salade, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12133,5956,'fr','Galettes de poisson sri lankaises façon empanada avec aïoli au curry','Préparez ces délicieuses galettes de poisson sri lankaises pour nourrir une foule. Servis avec un aïoli au curry rapide en trempette, ils demandent un peu d''effort mais en valent la peine','["300 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","½ cuillère à café de sel fin","100 g de beurre doux, froid et coupé en cubes","1 jaune d''oeuf battu","80 ml de lait de coco","125 g de pommes de terre (1 pomme de terre de taille moyenne)","500 ml d''huile de colza pour la friture, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","½ oignon rouge, finement haché","1½ gousse d''ail, finement hachée","½ morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché finement","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","¼ cuillère à café de cumin","pincée de cannelle moulue","pincée de clous de girofle moulus","½ cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu","150 g de maquereau ou de thon en conserve, égoutté","¼ petit bouquet d''aneth, finement haché","½ cuillère à café de sel fin","¼ citron vert, jus","1 blanc d''oeuf battu","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","½ cuillère à café de curry en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise"]','["Pour la pâte, mélangez la farine et le sel dans un grand bol à mélanger. Ajouter le beurre et incorporer la farine jusqu''à obtenir la texture de la chapelure. Mélangez le jaune d''oeuf battu à la pâte. Versez lentement le lait de coco en pétrissant la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle se rassemble. Ajoutez un peu de farine ou d''eau si nécessaire. Envelopper et réfrigérer pendant une heure.¼½","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Mettez une casserole d''eau à ébullition. Épluchez la pomme de terre et coupez-la en cubes de 1 cm, puis ajoutez-la à la casserole et laissez mijoter à feu moyen pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien cuite. Égoutter et laisser refroidir.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une casserole et faites revenir l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Ajoutez les épices et le poivre noir, remuez et laissez cuire 1 min, puis ajoutez le poisson et l''aneth et laissez cuire encore 2-3 minutes. Ajoutez la pomme de terre et le sel, mélangez bien et laissez cuire 2 minutes. Retirez la casserole du feu, ajoutez le jus de citron vert et laissez refroidir.","Cassez la pâte en deux et étalez chaque moitié tour à tour sur un plan fariné sur une profondeur de 3 mm. Si vous en avez un, utilisez un emporte-pièce de 7 cm pour découper huit cercles dans chaque feuille de pâte, reroulez la pâte et découpez des cercles jusqu''à épuisement. Il y en aura environ 26 à 28 au total.","Verser 1 cuillère à café du mélange de poisson sur chacun des cercles de pâte. A l''aide d''un petit pinceau à pâtisserie, badigeonnez d''un peu de blanc d''œuf le long des bords de chacun des cercles de pâtisserie. Pliez chacun pour former une empanada. À l’aide d’une fourchette, appuyez sur les côtés pour vous assurer qu’ils sont bien scellés.","Versez 500 ml d''huile dans une casserole en vous assurant qu''elle n''est pas pleine aux deux tiers et faites chauffer à 180°C, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un petit morceau de pâte commence à grésiller. Faites frire soigneusement les galettes par petites quantités pendant 2 à 4 minutes, en les retournant à mi-cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Retirer avec une écumoire et placer sur du papier absorbant pour absorber l''excès d''huile.","Mettez tous les ingrédients de l''aïoli dans un bol, mélangez et servez avec les empanadas."]','2026-01-11 00:15:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12134,5958,'fr','Mini pâtés au fromage et à l''oignon','Préparez ces petites pâtisseries au fromage et à l''oignon pour un pique-nique en famille. Si vous ne voulez pas les manger tous les 12, ils se congèlent bien et peuvent être cuits directement congelés.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 oignons, tranchés","4 branches de thym, feuilles cueillies","150 g de cheddar affiné (ou un mélange de fromages à pâte dure forts), râpé","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","125 g de beurre froid","grosse pincée de poivre de Cayenne","½ cuillère à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","1 gros oeuf, battu"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la pâte. Versez la farine dans un bol. En tenant le bloc de beurre dans son emballage, râpez-le directement dans la farine (vous devrez peut-être tremper le bout du beurre dans la farine de temps en temps s''il devient collant). Ajoutez le poivre de Cayenne, la moutarde en poudre et la moitié de l''œuf battu et assaisonnez avec une pincée de sel. Mélangez le tout avec vos mains jusqu''à ce que le mélange commence à s''agglutiner. Versez la pâte sur le plan de travail et pétrissez très brièvement pour obtenir une boule lisse, en ajoutant jusqu''à 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide si elle est trop sèche. Écrasez la pâte en un disque. Enveloppez et réfrigérez pendant que vous préparez la garniture.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir les oignons et les feuilles de thym pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient ramollis et commencent à caraméliser. Versez dans un bol et laissez refroidir. Une fois refroidi, incorporez le fromage râpé, la moutarde et les oignons nouveaux.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Abaisser la pâte refroidie sur un plan légèrement fariné jusqu''à l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1€. Découpez autant de cercles de 10 à 12 cm que possible (vous pouvez utiliser une tasse ou un mug comme modèle), puis relancez les chutes et répétez. Vous devriez obtenir environ 10 à 12 cercles au total.","Versez un tas de garniture au centre de chaque cercle de pâtisserie, en laissant les bords dégagés. En travaillant un cercle à la fois, badigeonnez un peu de l''œuf battu restant sur le pourtour, puis rapprochez les deux côtés pour qu''ils se rejoignent au milieu en forme de demi-lune. Pincez la pâte ensemble en sertissant le bord pour la sceller. Transférer sur la plaque à pâtisserie et répéter avec les cercles de pâte restants et la garniture. Badigeonnez tous les pâtés d''un peu d''œuf battu. Se conservera au congélateur pendant deux mois.","Cuire les pâtisseries pendant 20 à 25 minutes (ou 40 à 45 minutes après congélation) jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit bien dorée. Laisser refroidir au moins 10 minutes avant de manger chaud, ou laisser refroidir complètement et conditionner dans des contenants pour un pique-nique. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:15:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12135,5960,'fr','Boulettes de pelmeni sibériennes','Relevez le défi en cuisine avec ces fantastiques raviolis pelmeni sibériens. Avec un mélange de garnitures d''agneau et de légumes, à déguster avec le bouillon qui l''accompagne','["350 g de farine ''00'' et un peu pour saupoudrer","1 gros œuf","250 g de viande hachée d''agneau","½ oignon, finement haché","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","¼ de poudre de piment","petit bouquet d''aneth, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","200 g de champignons mélangés finement hachés","½ oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","petit bouquet de persil plat, finement haché","un trait de sauce soja","75 g de pignons de pin finement hachés","2 feuilles de laurier","1 cube de bouillon de légumes","petit bouquet d''aneth, feuilles cueillies","crème sure, pour servir","beurre, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Pour faire la pâte, tamisez la farine dans un bol. Faites un puits au milieu et ajoutez une pincée de sel, l''œuf et 100 ml d''eau en y mélangeant progressivement la farine avec les mains pour former une pâte ferme. Bien pétrir pendant 5 à 7 minutes. Couvrir et réfrigérer 30 minutes. Pendant ce temps préparez vos garnitures.","Mélangez soigneusement les ingrédients de la garniture à la viande dans un grand bol avec une pincée de sel.","Pour préparer la garniture aux légumes, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir les champignons, l''oignon, l''ail et le persil avec la sauce soja pendant 5 minutes. Éteignez le feu et incorporez les pignons de pin, un peu de sel et de poivre. Laissez le mélange refroidir avant de le manipuler.","Abaisser la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné jusqu''à obtenir des feuilles de 1,5 mm d''épaisseur. Pour de meilleurs résultats, utilisez une machine à pâtes.","Découpez des disques de pâte d''environ 4 à 6 cm de diamètre à l''aide d''un verre à shot ou d''un emporte-pièce. Mettez une cuillère à café de garniture au milieu de chaque disque, puis utilisez un doigt mouillé pour badigeonner légèrement la pâte autour de la garniture. Pliez chacun en deux pour former une demi-lune, en appuyant pour sceller. Pliez à nouveau la boulette de manière à ce que les bords pointus de la lune soient collés ensemble. Les boulettes peuvent être cuites immédiatement ou congelées en couches plates dans des sacs de congélation pour être cuites plus tard, en utilisant la même méthode que ci-dessous mais en augmentant le temps de cuisson de quelques minutes.","Pour la cuisson, portez à ébullition environ 3 litres d''eau dans une grande casserole en ajoutant les feuilles de laurier et le cube de bouillon. Ajouter les raviolis au bouillon bouillant par lots d''environ 10, puis cuire 5 min. Ils sont prêts lorsqu''ils remontent à la surface. Les viandes peuvent prendre quelques minutes de plus que les légumes.","Versez les pelmeni dans des bols à soupe avec le bouillon de cuisson, en les garnissant d''aneth, de crème sure et de poivre noir. Si vous préférez les manger sans bouillon, utilisez une écumoire pour les déplacer dans un bol, en ajoutant une généreuse cuillerée de beurre avec l''aneth, la crème sure et le poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12136,5962,'fr','Tranche de tomate et halloumi','Garnissez une pâte feuilletée de tomates cerises, de poivrons et de halloumi pour préparer un déjeuner ou un dîner facile en famille. Parsemer de quelques feuilles de basilic pour servir','["400 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","1 poivron jaune, tranché finement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","400 g de halloumi coupé en tranches de 5 mm","500 g de bloc de pâte feuilletée","farine, pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à soupe de fromage à pâte molle","3 cuillères à café de lait","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","1 jaune d''oeuf","poignée de feuilles de basilic, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Disposer les tomates et les poivrons sur une plaque à pâtisserie en une seule couche. Arroser de la moitié de l''huile, saler et rôtir 25 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer la poêle à feu moyen. Badigeonnez légèrement les tranches de halloumi avec le reste de l''huile et faites-les griller pendant 6 minutes. Retourner et cuire encore 3 minutes. Retirer du feu et réserver.","Étalez la pâte feuilletée sur une surface légèrement saupoudrée jusqu''à ce qu''elle mesure environ 32 x 22 cm et environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Transférer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et tracer une bordure de 2 cm sur les bords. Mélanger le fromage à pâte molle, 2 cuillères à café de lait et l''ail et étaler à l''intérieur du bord.","Tournez le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Retirez tout liquide du plateau de tomates et de poivrons, puis disposez les légumes rôtis sur le mélange de fromages à pâte molle. Posez le halloumi dessus. Mélangez le jaune d''œuf et le reste du lait, puis badigeonnez-en le bord. Enfourner 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée et levée. Parsemer de basilic et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:15:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12137,5968,'fr','Crumpets au fromage et aux œufs','Remplacez vos toasts ou sandwichs habituels à l''heure du déjeuner ou du petit-déjeuner par ces délicieuses crumpets au fromage et aux œufs. Délicieux avec des tomates cerises et des tranches d''avocat','["3 œufs","50 ml de lait","6 crumpets","250 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","un filet d''huile végétale","40 g de cheddar râpé","2 petits avocats mûrs, tranchés"]','["Faites chauffer le gril. Battez les œufs et le lait ensemble dans un plat large. Plongez les crumpets dans le mélange aux œufs en les retournant une fois, puis laissez reposer quelques minutes.","Disposez les tomates côté coupé vers le haut sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites-les griller pendant quelques minutes, puis couvrez la plaque de papier d''aluminium pour garder les tomates au chaud.","Faites chauffer l’huile dans une poêle et faites cuire les crumpets quelques minutes de chaque côté jusqu’à ce que l’œuf soit pris – vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots. Transférez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie au fur et à mesure. Une fois que tous les crumpets sont cuits, garnir de fromage et faire griller pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fromage bouillonne et soit doré. Servir avec les tomates et les tranches d''avocat."]','2026-01-11 00:15:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12138,5970,'fr','Tofu croustillant','Faites frire le tofu dans une couche de paprika fumé, d''ail et d''assaisonnement pour réaliser ces bouchées de tofu croustillantes. A consommer en collation ou en entrée ou en accompagnement d''un festin végétarien','["400 g de tofu ferme en bloc","3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","½ cuillère à café de granulés d''ail","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin","½ cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale"]','["Égouttez le tofu, enveloppez-le dans 4 à 5 feuilles de papier absorbant, mettez-le sur une assiette et placez quelque chose de lourd dessus, comme une planche à découper en bois ou un plateau avec quelques boîtes de conserve dessus. Laisser reposer 20 minutes pour égoutter l''excès d''humidité du tofu.","Mélangez la maïzena, l''ail, le paprika, le sel et le poivre dans un petit bol. Déroulez le tofu du papier, coupez-le en deux au centre, puis coupez-le en triangles, cubes ou lanières.","Mélangez les morceaux de tofu dans la farine de maïs épicée pour bien les enrober. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen-vif. Faites frire le tofu pendant 2 à 4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, croustillant et doré sur les bords. Les petits cubes prendront 2 minutes de chaque côté, les plus grands triangles prendront 4 minutes. Faites cuire par lots si nécessaire, en ajoutant un peu plus d''huile si la poêle devient sèche.","Égoutter le tofu cuit sur du papier absorbant et assaisonner avec une pincée de sel supplémentaire avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12139,5972,'fr','Tartine de haricots cannellini écrasés','Un mélange d''ail, de piment, de persil et de haricots cannellini écrasés garnit ces tartines sans cuisson, accompagnées de feta et de tomates. Ils sont rapides et faciles, et sains aussi','["400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés et rincés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","1 gros citron, zesté et pressé","1 petite gousse d''ail, finement râpée","1 petit piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","1⁄2 petit bouquet de persil finement haché","8 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","2 tranches de levain","15 g de feta émiettée","50g de fusée"]','["Mettez les haricots, 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile, le zeste et le jus de citron ainsi que l''ail dans un robot culinaire et mixez pour créer une texture épaisse. Transférer dans un bol et incorporer le piment, le persil et les tomates cerises.","Faites griller légèrement le pain et déposez-y le écrasé de haricots cannellini, répartissez-le sur la feta et arrosez du reste de l''huile. Servir avec la roquette à part."]','2026-01-11 00:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12140,5974,'fr','Aubergines rôties au yaourt et harissa','Vous recherchez un accompagnement simple ou une entrée qui offre du goût ? Ne cherchez pas plus loin que des aubergines rôties avec du yaourt et de la harissa. C''est végétarien et sans gluten','["4 aubergines","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","75g de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''harissa du commerce ou maison (voir notre recette)","6 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre hachée","1 cuillère à café de graines de sésame"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/190C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Percez plusieurs fois les aubergines avec la pointe d''un couteau, puis badigeonnez-les d''huile d''olive et disposez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Rôtir pendant environ 40 à 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les aubergines soient complètement tendres.","Faites fondre le beurre dans une poêle, puis incorporez-y la harissa (voir notre recette). Coupez les aubergines en deux en les ouvrant un peu comme une pomme de terre au four. Disposez-les sur une assiette chaude et assaisonnez l''intérieur de chacun, puis mélangez le yaourt avec l''ail. Versez-en un peu dans chaque aubergine, puis arrosez de beurre épicé. Répartir sur la coriandre et les graines de sésame pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12141,5976,'fr','Oeufs écossais plus légers','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Le classique du pique-nique fait peau neuve – les deux tiers de la graisse sont éliminés en utilisant des lentilles et du porc maigre et en le cuisant au four au lieu de le faire frire.','["5 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 échalote, hachée finement","5 œufs moyens","85 g de lentilles vertes (poids égoutté d''une boîte de 400 g)","225 g de viande hachée de porc extra maigre (moins de 5 % de matière grasse)","2 cuillères à café de sauge finement hachée","3 cuillères à café de ciboulette finement ciselée","½ cuillère à café de moutarde sèche en poudre","une bonne pincée de muscade râpée","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","25 g de chapelure panko (chapelure japonaise)"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une petite poêle antiadhésive. Ajoutez l''échalote et faites-la revenir quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre. Transférer dans une assiette et laisser refroidir. (Pas besoin de laver la poêle, vous pourrez l''utiliser plus tard.)","Pendant ce temps, mettez 4 œufs dans une casserole moyenne en les recouvrant bien d''eau froide. Portez à ébullition – lorsque l''eau commence à bouillonner, réglez la minuterie et faites bouillir pendant 5 minutes. Une fois cuits, versez l''eau bouillante et refroidissez les œufs sous l''eau froide pour éviter qu''ils ne cuisent davantage. Écrasez bien les lentilles dans un bol moyen avec le dos d''une fourchette, puis incorporez le hachis de porc, la sauge, 2 cuillères à café de ciboulette, la moutarde, la muscade, les échalotes refroidies, une pincée de sel et une généreuse râpe de poivre noir. Pelez les coquilles des œufs et séchez-les avec du papier absorbant.","Divisez uniformément le mélange de viande en 4. Versez la farine dans une assiette et roulez-la dans chaque œuf pour l''enrober, en tapotant l''excédent. Étalez un quart du mélange de viande sur le plan de travail en un cercle de 12 à 13 cm, en utilisant le reste de la farine pour éviter qu''elle ne colle. Prenez le cercle dans votre main et placez un des œufs au centre. Avec les deux mains, tapotez, pressez et relâchez le mélange de viande autour de l''œuf jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement et uniformément recouvert. Scellez très bien pour qu''il n''y ait pas de joint, puis tapotez et roulez-le pour lui donner une bonne forme sur la surface farinée. Répétez avec le reste du mélange de viande et les œufs cuits.","Mélangez la chapelure de panko dans une grande assiette avec le reste de ciboulette. Battez l’œuf restant dans une assiette, badigeonnez-en un peu sur chaque œuf enrobé (vous n’utiliserez pas tout), puis roulez les œufs dans la chapelure de panko en les tapotant pour qu’ils collent. Disposez les œufs sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et réfrigérez pendant 20 à 25 minutes (mais pas toute la nuit). Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café de l''huile restante dans la poêle que vous avez utilisée pour l''échalote. Lorsqu''il est bien chaud (il fait assez chaud lorsque quelques miettes de panko tombent immédiatement et commencent à dorer), mettez 2 œufs écossais et roulez dans l''huile pour bien les enrober. Réglez la minuterie sur 2 minutes, puis faites frire en les retournant souvent pour qu''elles soient entièrement dorées. Vous êtes simplement en train de dorer, sans cuire complètement les œufs à ce stade, alors ne les faites pas trop cuire, sinon l''enrobage pourrait commencer à se fendre. Transférer sur la plaque à pâtisserie tapissée et répéter avec les œufs restants, en baissant légèrement le feu si la poêle devient trop chaude.","Faites cuire les œufs écossais pendant 12 minutes. Retirez-les et posez-les sur du papier absorbant pour les égoutter et laisser refroidir légèrement. Coupez les œufs écossais en deux à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé et servez légèrement tiède ou froid. Il est préférable de le consommer le jour même ou, lorsqu''il est froid, de le conserver toute la nuit au réfrigérateur dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12142,5978,'fr','Oeuf et soldats','Nous adorons cette version du traditionnel utilisant des soldats d''asperges pour votre œuf dippy – une excellente collation faible en gras et sans gluten ou un déjeuner léger, un peu plus de 100 calories.','["1 œuf à la coque","7 pointes d''asperges cuites à la vapeur"]','["Coupez l''œuf à la coque en deux et servez-le avec les asperges cuites à la vapeur en trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12143,5980,'fr','Quelques Pittas','Une collation saine et faible en gras avec du poulet, des tomates et du concombre, contenant moins de 150 calories et qui ne prend que quelques minutes à préparer.','["½ pain pitta complet","25 g de poitrine de poulet cuite sans peau","¼ de concombre, coupé en morceaux","4 tomates cerises, coupées en deux"]','["Remplissez la moitié du pitta avec la poitrine de poulet, le concombre et les tomates cerises."]','2026-01-11 00:15:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12144,5982,'fr','Mini fajitas au poulet','Ces bouchées de fête d''inspiration mexicaine sont remplies de poulet chipotle épicé et de poivrons. Préparez-vous pour des réceptions sans tracas.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en morceaux de 1½ cm/½ po","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en morceaux de 1½ cm","1 poivron jaune épépiné et coupé en morceaux de 1½ cm","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort","Boîte de 227 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de chipotle","4 oignons nouveaux, parés et tranchés finement","gros paquet de coriandre, feuilles hachées","3 grosses tortillas à la farine","75 g de mozzarella déjà râpée","1 avocat mûr, dénoyauté et pelé","jus d''1 gros citron vert","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à soupe bombées de coriandre finement hachée","36 bâtonnets à cocktail"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive ou un wok et faites revenir le poulet et les poivrons pendant 2 minutes. Saupoudrer d''épices et cuire encore 30 secondes en remuant. Versez les tomates dans la poêle et incorporez la pâte de chipotle. Laisser mijoter 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la sauce soit épaisse et brillante, en remuant régulièrement. Incorporer les oignons nouveaux et la coriandre, cuire encore 1 min, puis retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Coupez les tortillas en quartiers, puis coupez chaque quartier en trois morceaux, vous obtenez ainsi 36 triangles. Placez 1 cuillère à café du mélange de poulet et un peu de fromage à l''extrémité la plus large d''un triangle. Enroulez l’extrémité pointue du triangle autour de la garniture et fixez-la avec un bâton à cocktail. Placer sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Remplissez et roulez les autres triangles. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer jusqu''à 8 heures jusqu''au moment de réchauffer.","Pour préparer la trempette, écrasez tous les ingrédients dans un bol jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient presque lisses. Couvrir la surface de la trempette d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer jusqu''à 24 heures.","Au moment de servir, chauffez le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Découvrez les fajitas et faites cuire au four pendant 6 à 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien chaudes. Servir avec le guacamole."]','2026-01-11 00:15:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12145,5984,'fr','Chips au four indien','Pimentez les quartiers de pommes de terre avec du curcuma, du gingembre, de l''ail et des graines de fenouil pour un plat d''accompagnement d''inspiration indienne – parfait à partager avec des amis','["1 kg de pommes de terre farineuses type Maris Piper, pelées et coupées en grosses chips","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché, ou finement râpé en pâte","3 gousses d''ail, pelées et hachées, ou finement râpées en pâte","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","généreuse pincée de poivre de Cayenne"]','["La veille de votre dégustation, versez les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau froide et ajoutez le curcuma et une pincée de sel. Porter à ébullition et laisser mijoter doucement pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste cuit. Égoutter, laisser refroidir, puis réfrigérer toute la nuit si vous le pouvez.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Verser 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un plat à rôtir peu profond (de préférence antiadhésif) et mettre au four. Versez le reste de l''huile dans un grand bol et ajoutez le gingembre, l''ail, les graines de fenouil et le poivre de Cayenne. Versez les chips froides dans le bol et mélangez doucement avec vos doigts jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient uniformément enrobées. Sortez la plaque du four et répartissez-la sur les chips. Utilisez une spatule pour enrober les chips dans l''huile chaude, puis étalez-les en une seule couche et faites rôtir pendant 30 minutes. Tournez à l''aide de la spatule, puis remettez au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:15:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12146,5988,'fr','Petits pois et pommes de terre épicés','Un plat végétarien super sain qui tire le meilleur parti des produits de base de votre garde-manger','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou d''huile de tournesol","2 oignons, finement tranchés","300 g de pommes de terre coupées en petits cubes","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de pâte de curry","140 g de petits pois surgelés ou frais","4 grandes feuilles de pâte filo, coupées en deux","chutney de tomates, oignons et mangue, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nFaites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive\r\ncasserole. Ajoutez les oignons et faites cuire jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoux et doré, environ 8 à 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir les cubes de pommes de terre pendant\r\n5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres, puis égouttez-les. Astuce\r\ndans les oignons ramollis et faire revenir pendant\r\n2 minutes de plus. Incorporer la pâte de curry et\r\ncuire 2 min. Ajoutez les petits pois, plus\r\n1 cuillère à soupe d''eau. Cuire 1 min, donner\r\ntout est bien mélangé et assaisonné. Astuce\r\ndans un bol pour laisser refroidir légèrement.","Badigeonner la moitié des demi-feuilles de filo avec\r\nun peu de l''huile restante, puis déposez le\r\nfeuilles restantes sur le dessus pour avoir\r\n4 x doubles couches. Verser un quart du\r\nmélange de pommes de terre le long d''un bord de chacun,\r\nen laissant un peu d''espace à chaque extrémité. Plier\r\naux extrémités, puis enroulez-les pour sceller. Lieu\r\ncôté couture vers le bas sur une plaque à pâtisserie,\r\nbadigeonner avec le reste d''huile et enfourner\r\npendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants. Servir chaud\r\navec une cuillerée de chutney de mangue et un\r\nsalade de tomates et d''oignons, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12147,5990,'fr','Houmous citron & coriandre','Le houmous est si facile à préparer et surpasse à chaque fois les variétés achetées en magasin. Essayez-le avec des crudités de légumes dans votre panier-repas','["2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches dans l''eau, égouttés","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de tahini","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un supplément","le zeste et le jus de 2 citrons","20 g de coriandre"]','["Mettez tout sauf la coriandre\r\nun robot culinaire, puis passez à un assez\r\nmélange onctueux. Grattez les côtés de\r\nle processeur si nécessaire.","Assaisonnez généreusement l''houmous, puis\r\najouter la coriandre et mélanger jusqu''à obtenir environ\r\nhaché. Verser dans un bol de service,\r\narroser d''huile d''olive, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12148,5994,'fr','Salsa au piment chipotle fumé','Emportez un petit pot de salsa dans votre boîte à lunch pour accompagner des crudités de légumes, des chips tortilla ou du pain pitta.','["2 poivrons rouges, coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur","6 tomates mûres, coupées en deux","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","jus 1 citron vert","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à café de pâte chipotle","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","20 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Mettez les poivrons sur un\r\nplaque à pâtisserie, côté peau vers le haut, griller jusqu''à ce que les peaux\r\nsont noirs, puis mettez-les dans un bol et couvrez.\r\nLaisser refroidir, puis retirer les peaux.","Retirez et jetez les graines de tomates.\r\nMettez les tomates dans un robot culinaire avec\r\nail, jus de citron vert, huile et pâte de chipotle.\r\nAjouter les poivrons, puis mélanger jusqu''à obtenir des morceaux. Remuer\r\nl''oignon et la coriandre, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12149,5996,'fr','Quartiers de patates douces harissa','Les chips de patate douce constituent une alternative saine et riche en fibres aux chips traditionnelles, mais ont un goût tout aussi bon (sinon meilleur !)','["1 kg de patates douces lavées et coupées en quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte d''harissa","crème sure et ciboulette, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Dans un\r\ngrand bol, mélanger les quartiers avec le\r\nharissa. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire\r\npendant 40 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres\r\net croustillant sur les bords. Servir avec\r\ncrème sure mélangée à de la ciboulette ciselée."]','2026-01-11 00:15:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12150,6000,'fr','Soupe de légumes-feuilles avec croûtons halloumi piment-miel','Préparez cette soupe verte vibrante avec des légumes-feuilles ou des herbes que vous trouvez en promotion au supermarché pour un déjeuner nutritif et économique.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon ou botte d''oignons nouveaux, haché finement","2 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","3 pommes de terre farineuses d''environ 500 g, non pelées et coupées en cubes de 2 cm","1 litre de bouillon de légumes","100g crème fraîche","300 g de légumes verts à leur meilleur (épinards, feuilles de salade, chou frisé ou cavolo nero), grossièrement déchirés","200 g de petits pois surgelés","une petite poignée d''herbes douces de qualité, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte d''harissa","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","250 g de halloumi en bloc, coupé en cubes de 2 cm, égoutté et essoré","levain grillé et beurré, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande casserole profonde à feu moyen-vif. Incorporer l''oignon et une pincée de sel et cuire pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis sur les bords. Incorporer l''ail et les pommes de terre et cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Verser sur le bouillon et porter à ébullition. Laissez bouillonner 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient juste tendres puis versez la crème fraîche, les légumes verts et les petits pois surgelés. Ramenez à ébullition et laissez cuire 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes verts soient tous fanés et que la crème fraîche soit dissoute. Incorporer les herbes et, à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant, mixer jusqu''à consistance lisse. Saison.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle. Incorporer la harissa et le miel et laisser fondre. Versez dans un bol, puis ajoutez le halloumi dans la poêle et faites dorer partout, en remuant la poêle de temps en temps pendant 4 à 5 minutes. Remettez le mélange de harissa dans la poêle et remuez rapidement pour enrober le halloumi. Répartissez les croûtons de halloumi sur la soupe et servez le levain à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:15:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12151,6002,'fr','Soupe verte apaisante','Emballez les légumes avec cette soupe saine. Garnir d''un filet de yaourt, de quelques feuilles de menthe et de poivre noir. C''est super réchauffé pour le déjeuner s''il vous reste des restes','["1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 oignons rouges, hachés","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","2 courgettes hachées grossièrement","1 grosse pomme de terre d''environ 300 g, pelée et hachée grossièrement","1,3 litre de bouillon de légumes, réalisé avec un cube de bouillon pauvre en sel","250 g de petits pois surgelés","400 g de pousses d''épinards","20 g de menthe hachée grossièrement, quelques feuilles entières (pour servir)","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt nature allégé, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle profonde et faites revenir les oignons avec une grosse pincée de sel pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis mais pas dorés. Ajouter l''ail, les graines de cumin, les courgettes et les pommes de terre et cuire 5 à 6 minutes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Couvrir avec le bouillon et bien assaisonner.","Porter à ébullition, réduire le feu et laisser mijoter pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient très tendres.","Versez les petits pois et faites revenir les épinards par poignées. Saupoudrer de menthe hachée et cuire encore 3 minutes, puis passer au mixeur puissant ou à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant. Assaisonner, puis répartir dans quatre bols et garnir de yaourt, des feuilles de menthe entières restantes et d''un peu de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12152,6004,'fr','Soupe aux légumes en morceaux','Préparez cette soupe aux légumes pour un déjeuner sain. Le fromage cottage est l''ingrédient secret des raviolis sans gluten – une option plus saine et qui ajoute du calcium.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 poireaux (350 g), tranchés","3 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","300 g de pommes de terre grelots, tranchées","1 l de bouillon de légumes composé de 2 cuillères à café de bouillon en poudre (sans gluten, si besoin)","250 g d''asperges, tiges coupées en morceaux, pointes séparées","160 g de fèves ou de soja surgelés pour bébés","Boîte de 400 g de haricots borlotti égouttés","4 tomates, hachées","Paquet de 30 g de basilic, tiges et feuilles séparées et finement hachées","300 g de fromage blanc en pot","75 g de farine (de pois chiches) tamisée","1 œuf battu","3 cuillères à soupe de tiges et de feuilles de basilic (pris sur les 30 g contenus dans les ingrédients de la soupe ci-dessus)"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez les boulettes. Versez le fromage cottage dans un bol et écrasez-le légèrement pour lisser. Incorporer la farine, l''œuf et le basilic, puis laisser reposer environ 10 minutes pour que la farine absorbe l''humidité.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les poireaux, l''ail et les pommes de terre pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Versez dessus le bouillon, puis ajoutez les tiges d''asperges, tous les haricots, les tomates et le reste des tiges de basilic. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter, couvrez et laissez cuire à feu moyen pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres. Incorporez les pointes d''asperges et les feuilles de basilic restantes et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes. Annuler.","Faites chauffer une poêle à frire remplie d''eau et laissez mijoter doucement, puis utilisez une cuillère à glace pour verser huit boulettes dans l''eau frémissante. Cuire 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les boulettes remontent à la surface.","Pour servir, répartissez deux portions de soupe dans des bols et garnissez chacune de deux raviolis. Conservez le reste un autre jour. Se conservera au frais dans un contenant hermétique pendant quatre jours. Réchauffer dans une poêle 10 minutes à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12153,6006,'fr','Soupe de poireaux et brocolis avec scones au fromage','Favorisez la bonne santé intestinale et la digestion avec les légumes du genre Brassica, comme le brocoli. Servez un bol de bonté de brocoli avec des scones au fromage en utilisant cette recette','["375 g de poireaux émincés","400 g de pommes de terre pelées et coupées en morceaux moyens","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","340 g de brocoli haché grossièrement","250 ml de lait","165 g de farine complète nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","20 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, finement râpé","1 cuillère à café de moutarde en poudre","100 ml de lait","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","65 g de fromage de chèvre à pâte molle","4 tomates tranchées pour servir"]','["Versez les poireaux, les pommes de terre et l''ail dans une grande casserole avec le bouillon. Versez dessus 800 ml d''eau bouillante, mélangez bien, couvrez et laissez mijoter 15 min.","Ajoutez le brocoli dans la poêle, puis couvrez et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre. Mixez avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis versez le lait et mixez à nouveau. Ajoutez un peu de bouillon si la soupe paraît trop épaisse.","Pour faire les scones, chauffez le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et tapissez une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Mettez la farine et la levure chimique dans un bol avec tout le parmesan sauf 1 cuillère à soupe et toute la poudre de moutarde. Ajoutez progressivement le lait et l''huile en remuant avec un couteau à couverts jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit homogène. Façonner une bûche d''environ 16 cm de long et 6 cm de large et presser le reste de parmesan dessus. Coupez en deux sur la longueur, puis divisez à nouveau chacun de ces morceaux en deux pour créer quatre scones en forme de coin. Disposez les scones sur la plaque et faites cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Si vous suivez le plan d''alimentation saine, réservez deux des scones pour un autre jour. Ils resteront couverts jusqu''à trois jours. Coupez les deux restants en deux et recouvrez de la moitié du fromage de chèvre et de la moitié de la tomate. Versez la moitié de la soupe dans deux bols et servez avec les scones. Le reste de la soupe se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12154,6008,'fr','Soupe aux tomates et basilic','Combinez des tomates séchées fruitées avec des tomates en conserve pour préparer cette riche soupe aux tomates avec un pesto de basilic maison – parfaite pour les profondeurs de l''hiver.','["1 cuillère à soupe de beurre ou d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","5 tomates tendres séchées au soleil ou SunBlush dans l''huile, hachées grossièrement","3 boîtes de 400 g de tomates italiennes","500 ml de bouillon de dinde ou de légumes","1 cuillère à café de sucre, n''importe quel type, ou plus au goût","142 ml de crème sure","Pot de 125 g de pesto de basilic frais","feuilles de basilic, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre ou l''huile dans une grande poêle, puis ajoutez l''ail et laissez-le revenir quelques minutes à feu doux. Ajouter les tomates séchées ou SunBlush, les tomates en conserve, le bouillon, le sucre et l''assaisonnement, puis porter à ébullition. Laissez la soupe bouillonner pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates se décomposent un peu.","Mixez avec un mixeur plongeant en ajoutant la moitié du pot de crème sure au fur et à mesure. Goûtez et rectifiez l’assaisonnement – ​​ajoutez plus de sucre si nécessaire. Servir dans des bols avec environ 1 cuillère à soupe de pesto tourbillonné dessus, un peu plus de crème sure et parsemer de feuilles de basilic."]','2026-01-11 00:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12155,6010,'fr','Soupe de brocolis aux pousses violettes, babeurre et fromage bleu','Profitez au maximum du brocoli de saison avec cette soupe vibrante, idéale pour le déjeuner ou un dîner léger servi avec du pain chaud croustillant. Garnir d''une pincée de graines mélangées et de ciboulette','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","1 oignon, haché grossièrement","1 branche de céleri, hachée grossièrement","1 grosse pomme de terre (environ 300 g), coupée en cubes de 2 cm","250 g de brocolis violets (tiges, fleurons et feuilles), hachés grossièrement","1,1 litre de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet","100 ml de babeurre","100 g de fromage bleu émietté","3 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche","½ citron, jus","30g de graines mélangées","½ petit bouquet de ciboulette finement tranchée"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte ou une casserole anti-flamme à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon et le céleri avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajouter les pommes de terre, le brocoli et le bouillon et porter à ébullition. Couvrir et cuire pendant 20 à 25 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les épaisses tiges de brocoli soient suffisamment tendres pour être percées avec un couteau à couverts. Retirer du feu et ajouter la moitié du babeurre et 80 g de fromage bleu. Mixez le tout à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Assaisonner selon votre goût, puis incorporer la crème, le reste du babeurre et le jus de citron.","Versez la soupe dans les bols et garnissez du reste du fromage, des graines, de la ciboulette et d''un filet d''huile d''olive, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12156,6012,'fr','Soupe épicée à la citrouille','Profitez au maximum des courges de saison au début de l’automne et essayez une soupe épicée à la citrouille. Vous pouvez également griller les graines et les ajouter comme garniture','["1 citrouille, environ 1,5 à 2 kg (conservez les graines – faites-les griller dans une poêle sèche pour servir)","1 cuillère à soupe de garam masala","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","½ à 1 cuillère à café de flocons ou de poudre de piment, plus une pincée","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","gingembre, pelé et haché finement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","900 ml de bouillon de légumes","100 ml de crème fraîche ou de crème fraîche, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Coupez le potiron en deux et retirez les graines avec une cuillère (voir astuce ci-dessous). Coupez-le en quartiers ou en morceaux (gardez la peau) et versez-le dans un bol. Mettez le garam masala, 1 cuillère à café de coriandre et de cumin dans un petit bol, mélangez avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile et assaisonnez. Arroser la citrouille et bien mélanger pour l''enrober d''huile épicée. Transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie, étaler uniformément et rôtir pendant 40 à 45 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce que le potiron soit très tendre lorsqu''on le perce avec une fourchette. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque quelques minutes.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive restante dans une grande casserole et faites revenir l''oignon avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajoutez le gingembre, l''ail, le reste des épices et les flocons de piment, et faites revenir encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Versez le bouillon et portez à légère ébullition.","Lorsque la citrouille est suffisamment froide au toucher, utilisez une cuillère pour retirer la chair molle des peaux. Ajoutez la citrouille molle dans la marmite en jetant les peaux. Retirer du feu et mixer la soupe avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit crémeuse et lisse. Assaisonnez au goût, en ajoutant du piment supplémentaire ou du garam masala si vous le souhaitez. Remettez sur feu doux et incorporez la crème. Porter à ébullition douce, puis servir dans des bols avec un filet de crème supplémentaire et une pincée de piment pour servir. Garnir de graines de citrouille grillées, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12157,6014,'fr','Soupe aux saucisses de dinde et au pesto','Préparez des saucisses de dinde ou de poulet et mélangez-les avec des haricots cannellini, du chou frisé et du pesto pour obtenir cette soupe copieuse. Servir avec du pain croustillant, si vous le souhaitez','["6 saucisses de dinde ou de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser (facultatif)","1 oignon, finement tranché","2 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","800 ml de bouillon de légumes","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés et rincés","100 g de feuilles de chou frisé, tiges ligneuses enlevées","½ citron, jus","60 g de pesto vert","pain croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Pressez la chair des peaux de saucisses et cassez-la en petits morceaux. Jetez les peaux. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen-doux. Une fois chaude, ajoutez la chair de saucisse et faites cuire en écrasant avec une aspatule jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et légèrement croustillante, environ 6 à 7 minutes. Retirer de la poêle, transférer dans un bol et couvrir.","Ajoutez l''oignon dans la poêle, avec un peu d''huile supplémentaire si la poêle semble sèche, et faites cuire pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez l''ail et faites cuire 1 min. Versez le bouillon en grattant pour détacher les morceaux collés au fond. Remettez la saucisse avec les haricots et portez à légère ébullition. Cuire encore 10 minutes, incorporer le chou frisé en deux fois et cuire encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement flétri. Incorporer le jus de citron et assaisonner légèrement avec du sel et une bonne quantité de poivre noir.","Retirez la soupe du feu, répartissez-la dans les bols et garnissez d''une cuillerée de pesto. Arrosez d''un peu d''huile et servez avec du pain croustillant, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12158,6016,'fr','Soupe de brocolis et petits pois à la ricotta mentholée','Préparez cette soupe au brocoli et aux pois pour le déjeuner ou pour servir en entrée, et garnissez-la de ricotta mentholée et de pignons de pin. Un plat sain, il en livre trois sur cinq par jour','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","1 oignon, finement haché","2 branches de céleri, hachées","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","200 g de brocoli coupé en fleurons","150 g de petits pois frais ou surgelés","500 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud peu salé","1 citron, zesté et pressé","100 g de gazon","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe finement hachée, plus quelques feuilles entières pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de pignons de pin grillés","2 tranches de pain, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte résistante au feu et faites revenir l''oignon et le céleri pendant 10 minutes. Ajoutez l''ail et faites revenir encore 1 min.","Ajouter le brocoli, les pois et le bouillon, porter à ébullition et cuire à couvert pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le brocoli soit tendre. Versez le mélange dans un mélangeur et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse, ou utilisez un mélangeur à main. Saison. Incorporez la moitié du zeste et du jus de citron, puis goûtez et ajoutez le reste, si vous le souhaitez.","Mélangez la ricotta avec la menthe et une pincée de sel. Versez la soupe dans des bols, puis garnissez de ricotta mentholée et de pignons de pin. Arroser d''huile d''olive supplémentaire et parsemer de feuilles de menthe, puis servir avec du pain tranché, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12159,6018,'fr','Soupe au poulet à la mijoteuse','Mettez les ingrédients de cette soupe au poulet dans la mijoteuse le matin et elle sera prête à l''heure du dîner. Ajoutez des nouilles à la fin, si vous le souhaitez','["1 oignon, finement haché","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","2 carottes coupées en morceaux de 1½ cm","2 poireaux, coupés en deux et tranchés","1 feuille de laurier et 3 brins de thym, liés ensemble","1 poulet entier moyen (environ 1,4 kg)","2l de bouillon de poulet","1 citron, jus","½ petit bouquet d''aneth ou de persil finement haché","pain croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Réglez votre mijoteuse à basse température. Ajoutez l''oignon, le céleri, les carottes et les poireaux et nichez-vous dans le bouquet d''herbes. Posez le poulet sur les légumes et versez dessus le bouillon. Cuire pendant 6 à 8 heures.","Retirez le poulet de la mijoteuse et transférez-le sur une planche. Déchiquetez la viande des os à l''aide de deux fourchettes, puis remettez la viande dans la mijoteuse en jetant les os. Assaisonner au goût et incorporer le jus de citron.","Retirez et jetez le bouquet d''herbes. Versez la soupe dans des bols et garnissez d''aneth ou de persil. Servir avec du pain croustillant, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12160,6020,'fr','Soupe de poireaux, chou frisé et pommes de terre garnie de petites frites','Préparez notre soupe saine aux poireaux, au chou frisé et aux pommes de terre pour un déjeuner ou un dîner végétarien facile. Garnir de petites frites pour un peu de croquant','["4 grosses pommes de terre (environ 500 g), 3 pelées et coupées en cubes, 1 entière avec la peau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","15g de beurre","5 poireaux (environ 500g), lavés et coupés en demi-lunes","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1½ l de bouillon de légumes (nous avons utilisé du Bouillon)","Encore 200g","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche demi-écrémée"]','["Chauffer le four à 220 C/200 C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Coupez la pomme de terre entière en allumettes à l''aide d''un éplucheur à julienne, ou rasez de fines tranches à l''aide d''un épluche-légumes, puis coupez-la en allumettes. Séchez-le avec du papier absorbant, puis mélangez-le avec l''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement. Étalez sur la plaque et faites rôtir pendant 15 à 18 minutes.","Faire fondre le beurre dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez les poireaux, les pommes de terre hachées et une pincée de sel, puis laissez cuire doucement 10 min jusqu''à ce que les poireaux soient tendres. Incorporer l''ail et cuire encore 1 min, puis verser le bouillon. Laisser mijoter pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres, puis ajouter le chou frisé et cuire pendant 2 à 3 minutes pour flétrir.","Incorporez la crème fraîche, puis mixez avec un mixeur plongeant et assaisonnez selon votre goût. Répartir la soupe dans les bols et garnir de petites frites."]','2026-01-11 00:15:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12161,6022,'fr','Soupe de lentilles, panais et pommes au curry','Cette soupe épicée combine des lentilles rouges, des pommes et du panais pour une soupe onctueuse et réchauffante – un repas faible en gras que vous pouvez préparer à l''avance et congeler.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry moyenne","2 oignons moyens, hachés grossièrement","500 g de panais (environ 5 panais moyens), pelés et coupés en morceaux","140 g de lentilles rouges séchées","2 pommes Bramley (environ 400 g), pelées, épépinées et coupées en morceaux","1½ l de bouillon de légumes ou de volaille, réalisé avec 1 cube de bouillon","yaourt nature, pour servir (facultatif)","coriandre hachée, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole. Faites revenir la pâte de curry et les oignons ensemble à feu moyen pendant 3 minutes en remuant. Ajoutez les panais, les lentilles et les morceaux de pommes. Verser sur le bouillon et porter à ébullition. Réduisez légèrement le feu et laissez cuire 30 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que les panais soient très tendres et les lentilles pâteuses.","Retirer du feu et mixer avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse. (Ou laissez refroidir quelques minutes, puis mixez au robot culinaire.) Ajustez l''assaisonnement au goût. Faites chauffer doucement, puis versez dans des bols profonds. Servir avec du yaourt nature et garnir de coriandre fraîche, si vous le souhaitez. (Pour les instructions de congélation, voir ci-dessous à gauche.)"]','2026-01-11 00:15:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12162,6026,'fr','Soupe au chou-fleur et au fromage','Donnez une nouvelle tournure à ce classique réconfortant en le mélangeant à une soupe onctueuse et crémeuse.','["noisette de beurre","1 gros oignon, finement haché","1 gros chou-fleur (environ 900 g/2 lb), feuilles parées et coupées en fleurons","1 pomme de terre pelée et coupée en morceaux","700 ml de bouillon de légumes (en cube, c''est bien)","400 ml de lait","100 g de cheddar affiné, coupé en dés"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez l''oignon et faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli, environ 5 minutes, en remuant souvent. Ajouter le chou-fleur, la pomme de terre, le bouillon, le lait et l''assaisonnement. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter environ 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chou-fleur soit tendre et que la pomme de terre s''effondre presque.","Passez-les au robot culinaire ou écrasez-les au presse-purée jusqu''à obtenir une soupe crémeuse et épaisse. Complétez avec plus de lait pour fluidifier un peu si vous servez dans des tasses. Vous pouvez préparer jusqu''à 2 jours à l''avance, laisser refroidir, couvrir et laisser au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin, ou congeler jusqu''à 1 mois. Au moment de servir, réchauffer, verser dans des tasses ou des bols, garnir de morceaux de fromage, puis remuer avant de manger."]','2026-01-11 00:15:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12163,6028,'fr','Soupe crémeuse de poisson et de moules','Un ragoût de poisson sain qui ne prend que 30 minutes','["Paquet de 500 g de moules sauce crémeuse (à retrouver au rayon frais)","1 litre de bouillon de poisson fort et chaud (nous avons utilisé le concentré Knorr Touch of Taste)","500 g de pommes de terre farineuses, coupées en morceaux de la taille d''un morceau de sucre","200 g de poisson mélangé","petit bouquet de persil plat"]','["Égoutter la sauce des moules dans un\r\ngrande casserole et ajoutez le bouillon. Astuce dans le\r\npommes de terre, couvrir et porter à ébullition. Une fois\r\nbouillante, retirez le couvercle et laissez mijoter environ\r\n12 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient très tendres.","Pendant ce temps, coupez le poisson en gros morceaux\r\net hachez grossièrement le persil. Remuez le poisson\r\net les moules dans la soupe, puis apportez\r\nremettre à ébullition pendant environ 3 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce que le poisson ait changé de couleur et\r\nse défasse facilement. Incorporer la majeure partie du\r\npersil, puis servir parsemé\r\navec le reste du persil\r\net manger avec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:15:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12164,6030,'fr','Soupe de courge xérisée','Une bonne soupe devient vite une recette infaillible pour toutes les occasions. Vous pouvez toujours manquer le sherry si vous le préparez pour les enfants','["1 gros oignon, coupé en deux","4 cuillères à soupe de xérès sec (fino)","1 kg de courge butternut pelée, épépinée et hachée","600 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud (nous aimons le souci)","croûtons de pain aux graines et persil plat","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Faites revenir l''oignon dans l''huile pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez le xérès et la courge et faites grésiller pendant 1 à 2 minutes. Versez le bouillon, puis couvrez et laissez mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre lorsqu''on la pique avec un couteau.","Passer au robot culinaire jusqu''à consistance lisse. Se conserve 2 jours au réfrigérateur ou 6 semaines au congélateur. Au moment de déguster, réchauffer jusqu''à bouillonnement et servir en petites portions garnies de croûtons de pain aux graines (voir ci-dessus à droite) et d''un brin de persil."]','2026-01-11 00:15:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12165,6032,'fr','Soupe à la tomate','Pour préparer la soupe aux tomates la plus savoureuse que vous ayez jamais goûtée, attendez que les tomates soient les plus mûres et les plus juteuses, vers septembre.','["1-1¼kg/2lb 4oz-2lb 12oz tomates mûres","1 oignon moyen","1 petite carotte","1 branche de céleri","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 jets de concentré de tomates (environ 2 cuillères à café)","une bonne pincée de sucre","2 feuilles de laurier","1,2 litre de bouillon de légumes chaud (fait avec de l''eau bouillante et 4 cuillères à café de bouillon en poudre ou 2 cubes de bouillon)"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez vos légumes. Vous avez besoin de 1-1,25 kg/2 lb 4 oz-2 lb 12 oz de tomates mûres. Si les tomates sont sur leurs vignes, arrachez-les. Les morceaux de tige verte devraient se détacher en même temps, mais si ce n''est pas le cas, il suffit de les retirer ou de les tordre ensuite. Jetez les vignes et les morceaux verts et lavez les tomates. Maintenant, coupez chaque tomate en quartiers et coupez les noyaux durs (ils ne ramollissent pas pendant la cuisson et vous obtiendrez des morceaux durs dans la soupe à la fin). Épluchez 1 oignon moyen et 1 petite carotte et coupez-les en petits morceaux. Hachez 1 branche de céleri à peu près de la même taille.","Versez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle à fond épais et faites-la chauffer à feu doux. Tenez votre main au-dessus de la poêle jusqu''à ce que vous sentiez la chaleur monter de l''huile, puis versez l''oignon, la carotte et le céleri et mélangez-les avec une cuillère en bois. Toujours à feu doux, faites cuire les légumes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et légèrement colorés. Cela devrait prendre environ 10 minutes et vous devez les remuer deux ou trois fois pour qu''ils cuisent uniformément et ne collent pas au fond de la casserole.","En tenant le tube au-dessus de la poêle, versez environ 2 cuillères à café de purée de tomates, puis remuez pour que les légumes deviennent rouges. Retirez les tomates de la planche à découper, saupoudrez-les d''une bonne pincée de sucre et broyez-les avec un peu de poivre noir. Déchirez 2 feuilles de laurier en quelques morceaux et jetez-les dans la poêle. Remuer pour bien mélanger le tout, mettre le couvercle sur la casserole et laisser mijoter les tomates à feu doux pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles rétrécissent dans la casserole et que leur jus s''écoule bien. De temps en temps, secouez bien la poêle pour que le tout reste bien mélangé.","Versez lentement les 1,2 litres de bouillon chaud (fait avec de l''eau bouillante et 4 cuillères à café de bouillon en poudre ou 2 cubes de bouillon), en remuant en même temps pour le mélanger aux légumes. Augmentez le feu au maximum et attendez que tout bouillonne, puis baissez à nouveau le feu et remettez le couvercle sur la casserole. Cuire doucement pendant 25 minutes en remuant plusieurs fois. À la fin de la cuisson, les tomates seront cassées et auront un aspect très fondant.","Retirez la casserole du feu, retirez le couvercle et attendez quelques secondes environ le temps que la vapeur s''échappe, puis récupérez les morceaux de laurier et jetez-les. Versez la soupe dans votre mixeur jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit remplie aux trois quarts environ, fermez bien le couvercle et allumez la machine à fond. Mixez jusqu''à ce que la soupe soit lisse (arrêtez la machine et soulevez le couvercle pour vérifier après environ 30 secondes), puis versez la purée de soupe dans un grand bol. Répétez avec la soupe qui reste dans la poêle. (La soupe peut maintenant être congelée jusqu''à 3 mois. Décongeler avant de réchauffer.)","Remettez la purée de soupe dans la casserole et réchauffez-la à feu moyen pendant quelques minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que des bulles se brisent doucement à la surface. Goûtez-en une cuillerée et ajoutez une pincée ou deux de sel si vous pensez que la soupe en a besoin, plus du poivre et du sucre si vous le souhaitez. Si la couleur n’est pas assez rouge pour vous, ajoutez une autre cuillère à café de purée de tomates et remuez jusqu’à ce qu’elle se dissolve. Verser dans des bols et servir. Ou tamisez et servez frais avec un peu de crème. Pour d''autres suggestions de présentation, voir ci-contre."]','2026-01-11 00:15:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12166,6034,'fr','Soupe de carottes au miel','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Les enfants adorent cette soupe riche et réchauffante, mais elle est également assez sophistiquée pour les adultes.','["2 cuillères à soupe de beurre","2 petits poireaux, tranchés","800 g de carottes hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de miel clair","petite pincée de flocons de piment séchés (facultatif)","1 feuille de laurier","2½ l de bouillon de légumes","crème sure ou yaourt, pour servir"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une grande casserole à feu moyen. Ajouter les poireaux dans la poêle, puis cuire 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajouter les carottes, le miel, le piment (si utilisé) et le laurier, puis cuire 2 minutes.","Versez le bouillon, portez à ébullition puis laissez mijoter 30 mn. Mélangez la soupe par lots, remettez-la dans une casserole propre, puis assaisonnez au goût. Au moment de servir, ramener à ébullition, puis verser dans des tasses. Ajoutez un tourbillon de crème sure ou de yaourt et servez avec du pain à l''ail ou des butties de bacon."]','2026-01-11 00:15:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12167,9458,'fr','Salade de thon, asperges et haricots blancs','Une salade printanière nourrissante, prête en quelques minutes','["1 gros bouquet d''asperges","2 x boîtes de steaks de thon dans l''eau, égouttés","2 x boîtes de haricots cannellini dans l''eau, égouttés","1 oignon rouge , haché très finement","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","2 cuillères à soupe d''estragon finement haché"]','["Faites cuire les asperges dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Bien égoutter, laisser refroidir sous l''eau courante, puis couper en morceaux de la longueur d''un doigt. Mélanger le thon, les haricots, l''oignon, les câpres et les asperges dans un grand bol de service.","Mélangez l’huile, le vinaigre et l’estragon, puis versez sur la salade. Réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12168,6038,'fr','Coffret salade thon citronné & asperges','Une nouvelle version de la salade niçoise classique. Cette salade maigre est complétée par des haricots cannellini du magasin et parfumée à l''aneth et au citron.','["2 gros œufs","200 g d''asperges, extrémités ligneuses cassées, pointes coupées en deux","Boîte de 160 g de thon dans l''eau de source (pas besoin de l''égoutter)","1 petit oignon rouge haché très finement","125 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés","le zeste et le jus d''un demi citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth frais haché","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Mettez une casserole d''eau à ébullition avec un cuiseur vapeur dessus. A ébullition, plongez les œufs dans l''eau et faites cuire les asperges à la vapeur dessus pendant 8 min.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez délicatement tous les autres ingrédients et disposez-les sur des assiettes ou dans des récipients rigides. Plongez les œufs dans l''eau froide pour les refroidir un peu, puis pelez-les et coupez-les en quartiers. Ajoutez les œufs et les asperges à la salade de thon. Se conserve 2 jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:15:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12169,6040,'fr','Salade de haricots, jambon et œufs','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Cette salade satisfaisante, remplie de légumes verts, de pommes de terre nouvelles et de jambon maigre, est faible en calories et en gras.','["2 œufs durs","500 g de pommes de terre grelots","200 g de haricots verts","200 g de petits pois surgelés, décongelés","175 g de jambon maigre, râpé","jus ½ citron","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","pain croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Épluchez et coupez les œufs en quartiers. Cuire le\r\npommes de terre dans une grande casserole d''eau bouillante pendant\r\n8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté. Astuce dans les haricots\r\npendant les 3 dernières minutes, puis ajoutez les petits pois pendant\r\nla dernière minute. Égoutter tous les légumes, laisser refroidir sous\r\neau courante froide, puis bien égoutter.","Pour la vinaigrette, mélanger le jus, la moutarde\r\net du miel ensemble. Assaisonner puis verser\r\nsur les légumes. Plier le jambon et le dessus\r\navec les œufs. Servir avec du pain, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12170,6044,'fr','Pots de meringue rhubarbe & fraise','Une gâterie savoureuse, légère et moelleuse, faible en gras','["450 g de rhubarbe, coupée en morceaux de 4 cm","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","le zeste râpé d''1 orange","1 cuillère à soupe de confiture de fraises","2 œufs, séparés"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/\r\nFour gaz 4/chaleur tournante 160C. Mettre\r\nla rhubarbe dans un\r\nplat allant au four, saupoudrer\r\nplus de 50g/2oz\r\ndu sucre et de l''orange\r\nzester et mélanger. Couverture\r\net cuire au four pendant\r\n35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à\r\ntendre. (Alternativement, vous\r\npeut\r\ncuire la rhubarbe avec le\r\nsucre et zeste dans le\r\nmicro-ondes pendant 10 minutes\r\nà pleine puissance, en remuant\r\nà mi-cuisson\r\nle temps,\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre.)","Retirez la rhubarbe de\r\nle four et laisser refroidir\r\nlégèrement. Incorporer le\r\nconservez ensuite les jaunes d''œufs.\r\nDivisez la rhubarbe\r\nmélange entre quatre\r\nRamequins de 175 ml/6 fl oz.\r\nMettez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et\r\ncuisiner dans\r\nau four pendant 10 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''elle épaississe légèrement.","Pendant que la rhubarbe est\r\ncuisson, fouetter l''oeuf\r\nles blancs jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes. Saupoudrer\r\nplus de la moitié\r\ndu sucre restant et\r\nfouetter à nouveau. Incorporer délicatement\r\nle reste du sucre. Pile\r\nla meringue sur le dessus\r\nde la rhubarbe pour le recouvrir\r\ncomplètement et faites tourner le dessus. Remettre au four 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la meringue soit gonflée et dorée. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:15:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12171,6048,'fr','Pommes de terre farcies','Une recette simple de pommes de terre au four pour impliquer les enfants dans la cuisine : facile à suivre et idéale pour enseigner','["4 pommes de terre moyennes","100 g de cheddar fort râpé, plus un peu pour la garniture","100g de maïs doux","100 g de poivrons mélangés, coupés en dés","une petite poignée d''herbes fraîches, comme l''origan, le basilic, la coriandre, l''aneth ou le thym"]','["Équipement dont vous aurez besoin : moyen\r\nbol à mélanger, petit bol à mélanger,\r\ncuillère à dessert, fourchette, plaque à pâtisserie,\r\nrâpe, gants de cuisine.","Demander à un adulte de chauffer le four\r\nà 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6 et faites cuire le\r\npommes de terre pendant environ 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient cuites\r\net les peaux sont croustillantes. Laisser refroidir\r\ncomplètement. Cela peut être fait jusqu''à\r\n2 jours à l''avance.","Pour farcir les pommes de terre en chemise, faites chauffer le\r\nfour à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Demandez à un\r\nadulte pour couper les pommes de terre en deux. Utilisation\r\nune cuillère, retirez soigneusement le milieu\r\nde la pomme de terre, en laissant la peau intacte\r\n(comme un bateau). Placez la pomme de terre éparpillée\r\ndans un bol à mélanger.","À l''aide de la fourchette, écrasez la pomme de terre jusqu''à ce que\r\nil n''y a pas de grumeaux. Ajoutez le fromage,\r\nle maïs doux et les poivrons et bien mélanger.\r\nCueillez délicatement les feuilles des herbes.\r\nVous pouvez déchirer les plus grandes feuilles en petites\r\nmorceaux. Incorporer les herbes au fromage\r\nmélange de pommes de terre.","À l''aide de la cuillère, prélevez délicatement le\r\nmélanger dans les barquettes de pommes de terre. Faire\r\nassurez-vous d’utiliser tout le mélange.\r\nSaupoudrer d''un peu de fromage râpé supplémentaire\r\net déposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Utilisation du four\r\ngants, placez la plaque au four et\r\ncuire au four pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:15:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12172,6050,'fr','Porridge aux pommes et aux raisins secs','Un petit-déjeuner faible en gras composé d''avoine chaude et de fruits qui commence la journée de manière nutritive et rassasiante.','["100 g de flocons d''avoine","500 ml de lait écrémé","4 pommes épépinées et coupées en dés","100 g de raisins secs","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade, pour servir"]','["Mettez les flocons d''avoine et le lait dans une petite casserole et\r\ncuire en remuant pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que presque\r\ncrémeux. Incorporer les pommes et les raisins secs,\r\npuis cuire encore 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le\r\nla bouillie est épaisse et crémeuse et le\r\nles pommes juste tendres. Verser dans des bols,\r\nsaupoudrer de sucre et déguster immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12173,6052,'fr','Poulet marocain en une seule casserole','Une cocotte de poulet nord-africaine faible en gras, remplie de légumes et parfumée à l''harissa','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement tranché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte d''harissa (nous avons utilisé Belazu Rose Harissa)","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","2 courgettes moyennes, tranchées épaisses","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés"]','["Assaisonner les poitrines de poulet partout\r\navec du cumin et beaucoup de noir moulu\r\npoivre. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand poêle antiadhésive\r\npoêle et faites cuire le poulet avec\r\nl''oignon pendant 4 minutes. Retourner le poulet\r\net laissez cuire encore 3 minutes.\r\nRemuez les oignons autour du poulet\r\nrégulièrement pendant qu''ils cuisinent.","Versez les tomates et 250 ml d''eau\r\ndans la poêle et incorporer la harissa,\r\nmiel, courgettes et pois chiches.\r\nPortez à légère ébullition et faites cuire\r\npendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre\r\net la sauce a légèrement épaissi."]','2026-01-11 00:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12174,5052,'fr','Salade de radis piquante','Des radis piquants ajoutent du croquant à cette salade de saumon fumé piquante','["2 oranges","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","½ petit oignon rouge, tranché finement","200 g de radis émincés","200 g de saumon fumé","75 g de cresson","pain brun, pour servir"]','["Segmentez les oranges sur une salade\r\nbol, permettant aux segments et à tout\r\nle jus tombe dans le bol. Incorporer le\r\nvinaigre, oignon et radis, ajoutez-en un peu\r\nassaisonner et laisser reposer 5 minutes.","Répartissez le saumon fumé entre 4\r\nassiettes. Passer le cresson dans le\r\nmélangez les radis, puis mettez-en une poignée dessus\r\nle saumon, en vous assurant d''avoir un\r\nun peu de tout dans chaque assiette. Servir\r\navec le jus du bol versé\r\net du pain brun si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12175,6056,'fr','Pâtes aux tomates chili et épinards','Un souper faible en gras composé d''une savoureuse sauce tomate et de penne – faites tomber un sac entier d''épinards pour plus de nutriments','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment séchés","200 g de penne complètes","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","100 ml de vin rouge","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","Sachet de 125 g de jeunes feuilles d''épinards","25 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive\r\net faire revenir doucement l''oignon, l''ail et le piment\r\nflocons, en remuant régulièrement, pendant 5 minutes (ajouter\r\nun peu d''eau s''ils commencent à coller).","Cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage.\r\nAjouter les tomates, le vin et l''origan\r\ndans la poêle et remuer pour combiner.\r\nPortez à légère ébullition et faites cuire,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps, pendant 10 minutes.","Secouez les épinards dans la poêle\r\net cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nfané. Égouttez les pâtes et versez-les\r\ndans la poêle avec la sauce.\r\nMélanger, saupoudrer\r\navec du fromage et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12176,6058,'fr','Salade de truite fumée au fenouil, pomme et betterave','Le délicat poisson fumé à chaud est parfaitement complété par des saveurs croquantes de pomme et d''anis – une délicieuse bouchée légère.','["½ petit bulbe de fenouil, paré et tranché finement","1 pomme à peau verte, épépinée, coupée en quartiers et tranchée","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés en diagonale","100 g de betteraves miniatures au vinaigre doux, égouttées et coupées en quartiers","140 g de filets de truite fumée à chaud sans peau","petit bouquet d''aneth, frondes enlevées","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature faible en gras","1 cuillère à café de sauce au raifort"]','["Mettez le fenouil dans une portion peu profonde\r\nplat et répartir sur la pomme, printemps\r\noignons et betteraves. Écaillez la truite\r\nen gros morceaux et disposer dessus.\r\nSaupoudrer de la moitié des feuilles d''aneth. Finement\r\nhachez les frondes restantes et réservez.","Mélangez le yaourt et le raifort avec\r\n1 cuillère à soupe d''eau froide, puis incorporez le\r\naneth réservé. Versez la moitié de la vinaigrette dessus\r\nla salade et mélanger très légèrement. Cuillère\r\nsur le reste de la vinaigrette et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12177,6060,'fr','Toasts à la dinde et à l''avocat','Associez un avocat crémeux à de la dinde riche en protéines et faible en gras pour une excellente collation saine et énergisante.','["1 avocat","jus ½ citron vert","2-3 petites tranches de pain ciabatta","100 g de tranches de dinde"]','["Coupez l''avocat en deux et dénoyautez-le, puis grattez-en la chair dans un bol. Pressez le citron vert, assaisonnez, puis écrasez grossièrement à la fourchette. Faire griller la ciabatta, tartiner de purée d''avocat, garnir de dinde et terminer avec du poivre noir moulu."]','2026-01-11 00:15:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12178,6062,'fr','Tarte filo à la courge musquée et aux épinards','Cette tarte croustillante garnie de pâtisserie regorge de légumes et contient donc les 5 apports quotidiens recommandés.','["1 courge butternut (environ 1kg), pelée, épépinée et coupée en dés de 2 cm","2 oignons rouges, coupés en quartiers","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","400 g d''épinards","100 g de fromage feta émietté","4 feuilles de pâte filo","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","salade verte, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nMettez la courge, les oignons et les flocons de piment\r\ndans un plat à tarte allant au four (ou 4 individuels\r\nplats). Assaisonner et cuire 20 mn\r\njusqu''à ce que la courge soit tendre et les oignons\r\ncommencent à carboniser sur les bords.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les épinards dans un\r\npassoire et verser dessus une bouilloire de\r\nde l''eau bouillante. Éliminez tout excès\r\nliquide et incorporer au mélange de courge. Point\r\nsur la feta, froisser la pâte et\r\ndéposer dessus, puis badigeonner d''huile.\r\nRemettre au four et cuire encore\r\n15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée et\r\ncroustillant. Servir avec une salade verte, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12179,6064,'fr','Chou frisé sauté au piment et à l''ail','Une façon simple et rapide de donner un coup de fouet au chou frisé : servez-le avec du steak, du poulet et des plats orientaux.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","Sachet de 200 g de chou frisé","2 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","1 piment rouge épépiné et tranché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand wok, puis ajoutez le\r\nchou frisé et quelques cuillères à soupe d''eau. Saison,\r\npuis faire sauter pendant 5 à 8 minutes en ajoutant l''ail\r\net du piment pour les 2 dernières minutes. Quand le\r\nle chou frisé est tendre et d''un vert éclatant,\r\nretirer du feu et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12180,6068,'fr','Palourdes cuites à la vapeur dans un bouillon de safran et vert printanier','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Améliorez cette simple entrée en plat principal avec un soupçon de sherry sec et un lit de spaghetti.','["700 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud faible en sel","75 g de chorizo​​en dés","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée finement","pincée de brins de safran","2 petites têtes de verdure printanière, finement râpées","1 kg de petites palourdes ou coques vivantes, bien lavées","2 cuillères à soupe de persil frais, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","quartiers de citron, pour servir"]','["Placer le bouillon, le chorizo, l''ail et\r\nsafran dans une grande poêle et porter à température\r\nfaire bouillir. Ajouter les légumes verts, couvrir et cuire\r\npendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement fané.","Ajouter les palourdes, couvrir et laisser cuire\r\nà feu vif pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que chaque palourde\r\na ouvert. Incorporer le persil haché.","À l''aide d''une écumoire, divisez les légumes verts\r\net palourdes entre de grands bols peu profonds\r\npuis versez sur le bouillon. Arroser d''huile\r\net servir avec le citron à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:15:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12181,6070,'fr','Gratins de poisson à l''avoine et crevettes','Atteignez les 5 apports recommandés en fruits et légumes avec ces délicieuses pâtisseries saines au poisson et aux tomates.','["340 g de pousses d''épinards hachées grossièrement","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées à l''ail et aux herbes","225 g de filets de poisson blanc durable, coupés en gros morceaux","petit bouquet de basilic, râpé","100 g de crevettes cuites et décortiquées","2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan finement râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de chapelure","2 cuillères à soupe d''avoine","170 g de brocoli bouilli ou cuit à la vapeur pour servir"]','["Mettez les épinards dans une grande passoire\r\net versez sur de l''eau bouillante. Une fois refroidi\r\nassez pour être manipulé, essorez-en tout\r\nl''excès d''eau, puis assaisonner.","Versez les tomates dans une poêle avec\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement et laisser mijoter 5 minutes\r\npour épaissir. Ajouter le poisson et faire chauffer pendant\r\n1 à 2 minutes – il n''est pas nécessaire que ce soit complètement\r\ncuit à ce stade. Incorporer le basilic.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nRépartissez les épinards, le poisson, les crevettes et\r\nsauce tomate entre 2 plats à gratin.\r\nMélangez le parmesan, la chapelure et\r\nflocons d''avoine ensemble et saupoudrer sur le dessus.\r\nCuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et\r\nbouillonnant. Servir avec du brocoli cuit."]','2026-01-11 00:15:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12182,6072,'fr','Salade de chou-rave en copeaux avec vinaigrette aux jalapeños marinés','Élevez vos dîners d’été avec cette salade de chou-rave salée, saumâtre et un peu épicée. Magnifique sur un plateau, il s''assemble en quelques minutes','["100g de yaourt nature","35 g de jalapeños marinés, finement tranchés, plus 2 cuillères à soupe de saumure du pot","2 chou-rave (environ 900g), finement râpés à la mandoline","1 piment rouge , finement tranché","10 g d''aneth haché grossièrement","30 g de cacahuètes salées grossièrement concassées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge (facultatif)"]','["Fouetter le yaourt, la saumure de jalapeño et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un grand bol.","Ajoutez le chou-rave et mélangez bien avec vos mains. Disposer sur un plat de service, puis répartir sur les tranches de jalapeño et de piment, l''aneth et les cacahuètes. Arroser d''huile d''olive, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:15:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12183,6074,'fr','Fresh salmon niçoise','Par une douce soirée d’été, une salade chaude est à la fois satisfaisante et légère. Traditionnellement, la niçoise est préparée avec du thon en conserve, mais les acides gras oméga-3 contenus dans le poisson ne passent pas le processus de mise en conserve. Nous avons donc utilisé du saumon sauvage à la place.','["1 oignon rouge (environ 130 g), finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre de pomme","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","12 olives Kalamata dénoyautées, coupées en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe d''aneth haché","2 cuillères à café de feuilles d''estragon hachées","400 g de petites pommes de terre grelots","2 œufs","320 g de haricots verts fins, parés","4 filets de saumon sauvage (environ 100-125 g chacun), décongelés s''ils sont congelés","2 x 160 g de laitues Little Gem, 1 râpée","4 tomates, coupées en quartiers"]','["Mélanger l''oignon, le vinaigre, l''huile, les olives et les herbes dans un bol moyen.","Faire bouillir les pommes de terre dans le fond d''un cuiseur vapeur pendant 10 min. Ajoutez les œufs (rajoutez de l’eau bouillante de la bouilloire s’ils ne sont pas immergés). Versez les haricots verts dans une casserole et placez le cuiseur vapeur dessus, puis laissez cuire encore 8 minutes.","Retirez les pommes de terre et les œufs du cuiseur vapeur, mais ne les égouttez pas. Ajouter le saumon à l''eau et cuire 5 minutes. Incorporer les pommes de terre chaudes à la vinaigrette.","Pour servir, répartissez la moitié de la laitue entre deux assiettes (ou empilez-la sur une assiette) avec la moitié des haricots verts et des tomates, puis versez dessus la moitié des pommes de terre assaisonnées. Retirez et jetez la peau du saumon, puis émiettez la moitié du poisson sur la salade. Épluchez un œuf, coupez-le en deux et servez-en une moitié sur chaque salade. Réfrigérez le reste des ingrédients pour le lendemain et mangez-le froid. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à une journée."]','2026-01-11 00:15:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12184,6076,'fr','Soupe de concombre','La soupe rafraîchissante au concombre est servie froide, elle sera donc très appréciée lors d''une journée d''été. Versez-le dans des bols pour une petite réunion, ou versez-le dans de petites tasses pour un amuse-bouche.','["2 concombres (environ 675g)","150 g de yaourt grec","1 à 2 citrons verts, pressés selon les goûts","une petite poignée d''estragon haché","3 brins de menthe, feuilles cueillies","petit bouquet de ciboulette hachée","huile de colza, pour servir"]','["Hachez finement un tiers de l’un des concombres et réservez-le lorsque vous serez prêt à servir plus tard. Hachez grossièrement les concombres restants et versez-les dans un mixeur ou un robot culinaire avec le yaourt et le jus de citron vert d''un citron vert. Ajoutez l''estragon, la majeure partie des feuilles de menthe et la majeure partie de la ciboulette. Mixez jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse. Goûtez la soupe et ajoutez tout ou partie du jus de citron vert du deuxième citron vert si vous voulez plus d''acidité.","Versez la soupe dans des bols ou des petites tasses, parsemez-la de concombre finement haché, des feuilles de menthe restantes et du reste de ciboulette. Arroser d''un peu d''huile de colza juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:15:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12185,6078,'fr','Nuggets végétariens avec salade de chou d''été','Fabriquées à partir de quinoa riche en protéines et de beurre de cacahuète, ces nuggets savoureux sont délicieux servis avec notre salade de chou saine à base de yaourt bio respectueux des intestins.','["100 g de quinoa","2 oignons (320 g), hachés très finement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché","3½ cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète croquant","3 cuillères à soupe de persil haché","1 cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","2 oeufs, battus","90 g de yaourt bio en pot","1 cuillère à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de cidre de pomme","1 carotte (150 g), râpée grossièrement","1 poivron rouge épépiné et finement haché","1 très petit oignon, finement haché","320 g de chou blanc finement râpé","4 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée"]','["Faites bouillir le quinoa pendant 20 minutes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, laissez reposer 5 minutes, puis égouttez-le bien. Pendant ce temps, faites revenir les oignons dans 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile à feu moyen-doux pendant 5 minutes avec le couvercle sur la poêle, puis découvrez et faites revenir encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et commencent à colorer. Hors du feu, incorporez les haricots noirs, l''origan, le beurre de cacahuète, le persil et le bouillon, puis écrasez le tout avec un presse-purée pour écraser les haricots. Ajoutez le quinoa et les œufs et mélangez bien.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile restante dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, puis, à l''aide d''une cuillère à soupe doseuse, prélevez des cuillerées rondes du mélange et ajoutez-les dans la poêle en les espaçant. Cuire environ 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce que les nuggets soient dorés. Faites cuire la moitié du mélange et conservez le reste pour un autre jour. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours.","Pour faire la salade de chou, mettez le yaourt, la moutarde en poudre et le vinaigre dans un bol, mélangez pour faire une vinaigrette, puis ajoutez les légumes et la coriandre et mélangez bien. Servir la moitié de la salade de chou avec deux portions de nuggets. Le reste se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:15:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12186,6080,'fr','Brochettes de pommes de terre croustillantes, poivrons et chorizo','Toute la famille adorera ces brochettes rapides et faciles lors du prochain barbecue d''été. Si le soleil ne brille pas, nous vous avons donné des instructions sur la façon de les cuisiner à l''intérieur.','["500 g de petites pommes de terre nouvelles","3 poivrons romano ou rouges, coupés en morceaux","250 g de chorizo ​​à cuire coupé en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 brins de romarin, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement","70 g de mayonnaise","1 petite gousse d''ail, finement râpée","½ citron, jus","une petite pincée de paprika fumé (facultatif)","quelques brins de persil, feuilles cueillies (facultatif)","salade, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer un barbecue ou un grill. Portez à ébullition une casserole d''eau légèrement salée. Ajouter les pommes de terre et cuire 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''une brochette puisse facilement être insérée. Égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur. Mélanger les pommes de terre avec les poivrons, le chorizo, l''huile d''olive et le romarin dans un grand bol. Prenez six à huit grosses brochettes en métal et enfilez-y alternativement les pommes de terre, les poivrons et le chorizo. Griller pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement carbonisés à l''extérieur, ou griller pendant 5 à 6 minutes de chaque côté.","Mélangez la mayonnaise, l''ail et le jus de citron dans un petit bol. Saupoudrez d''un peu de paprika, si vous le souhaitez. Servir les brochettes avec le persil parsemé, le cas échéant, et la mayonnaise à l''ail et la salade en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:15:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12187,6082,'fr','Salade hachée croquante','Encouragez les enfants à acquérir les compétences essentielles en cuisine avec cette salade croquante à base de graines de grenade. La recette est facile à suivre pour les enfants âgés de 7 à 11 ans.','["1 citron","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","1 cuillère à café de miel","10 tomates cerises (utilisez un mélange de différentes couleurs, si vous le souhaitez)","1⁄2 concombre","2 laitues Little Gem","1 barquette de cresson","100 g de graines de grenade","25 g de graines mélangées (nous avons utilisé des graines de tournesol et de citrouille ; voir conseil ci-dessous)","planche à découper","torchon ou essuie-tout (facultatif)","couteau bien aiguisé","presse-agrumes","cuillerée à soupe","cuillère à café","pot de confiture ou petit bol","grand saladier","ciseaux de cuisine","échelles de mesure"]','["Avant de commencer, jetez un œil à notre guide de compétences en matière de hachage et de couteau. Si votre planche à découper n''est pas dotée de poignées antidérapantes, posez un torchon ou une feuille de papier absorbant humide sur le plan de travail, puis placez la planche dessus pour l''empêcher de glisser.","En tenant le citron avec votre main en position pont, coupez le citron en deux. Mettez une moitié dans un presse-agrumes, tournez et pressez pour libérer le jus. Répétez avec la deuxième moitié de citron. Versez le jus dans un pot de confiture ou un petit bol avec l''huile.","Ajoutez la moutarde, le miel et une bonne pincée de sel et de poivre noir. Fermez le pot et secouez-le pour combiner, ou fouettez les ingrédients ensemble. Se conservera couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à une semaine.","Coupez les tomates en deux en les pinçant chacune entre votre pouce et un doigt et en les coupant soigneusement au milieu avec un petit couteau dentelé. Coupez à nouveau chaque morceau en deux pour former des quartiers, puis versez les tomates dans un grand bol.","Essuyez la planche à découper, puis coupez le concombre en deux dans le sens de la longueur. Placez les deux moitiés côté coupé vers le bas sur la planche pour qu''elles ne roulent pas, puis coupez à nouveau en deux sur la longueur, vous obtenez ainsi quatre gros bâtonnets de concombre. Coupez maintenant le concombre pour former de petits triangles, en gardant votre main libre en position griffe avec vos doigts éloignés de la lame du couteau. Versez le concombre dans le bol avec les tomates.","Coupez la tige dure des laitues, puis coupez chaque laitue en deux, puis à nouveau en deux pour obtenir quatre quartiers. En travaillant avec un quartier de laitue à la fois, tenez le coin avec votre main en position griffe et coupez-le en petits rubans – plus c''est petit, mieux c''est pour cette salade. Répétez avec les quartiers restants et versez la laitue dans le bol.","Coupez le cresson directement dans le bol à l''aide de ciseaux de cuisine. Pesez les graines de grenade à l''aide de la balance et ajoutez-les dans le bol. Répétez avec les graines mélangées. Versez environ la moitié de la vinaigrette sur la salade (il vous en restera quelques-uns) et mélangez le tout pour enrober."]','2026-01-11 00:15:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12188,6086,'fr','Riz Jollof au four','Savourez une version de l''aliment de base d''Afrique de l''Ouest, le riz Jollof. C''est un excellent partenaire pour le poulet, le poisson ou la salade et vous pouvez utiliser une sauce toute prête si vous préférez.','["400 g de riz basmati","3 poivrons rouges, coupés en deux et épépinés","1 oignon blanc, coupé en deux","2 gousses d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre râpé ou de purée de gingembre","1 piment Scotch Bonnet, épépiné si vous préférez moins de piquant (facultatif)","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","100 g de purée de tomates","2 feuilles de laurier","1 cuillère à soupe de thym séché","2 cuillères à café de curry en poudre (nous avons utilisé du madras chaud)","½ cuillère à café de poivre blanc moulu","600 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud, composé de 2 cubes de bouillon"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez le riz dans une passoire, rincez sous l''eau froide, égouttez et réservez. Mettez les poivrons, l''oignon, l''ail, le gingembre et le piment, le cas échéant, dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient hachés.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte allant au four à feu moyen et faites revenir le concentré de tomates pendant 2-3 minutes en remuant souvent. Ajoutez le mélange de poivrons mixés et faites revenir encore 5 minutes, puis ajoutez les herbes, les épices et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Faites frire encore 1 à 2 minutes, puis incorporez le riz pour bien l''enrober. Versez le bouillon, remuez, couvrez et enfournez 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre."]','2026-01-11 00:16:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12189,6088,'fr','Galettes de poisson fondantes et moyennes de Mornay','Essayez de préparer ces délicieuses galettes de poisson avec de la chapelure croustillante à l''extérieur et une surprise au fromage et en sauce au centre. Ils sont parfaits pour le déjeuner ou le dîner','["500 g de pommes de terre farineuses, type Maris Piper ou King Edwards, coupées en petits morceaux","1 feuille de laurier","300 g d''aiglefin ou de morue fumé","140g de saumon","râpe de muscade","petit bouquet de persil haché","1 citron zesté puis coupé en quartiers pour servir","3 cuillères à soupe de farine","2 oeufs, battus","100 g de chapelure fraîche","huile végétale, pour la friture, plus un peu pour le moule","salade verte mélangée, pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","300 ml de lait","50 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la sauce mornay au moins quelques heures avant de préparer les galettes de poisson. Mettez la farine et le beurre dans une petite casserole à feu doux-moyen et faites cuire jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu, puis remuez pour obtenir une pâte. Incorporez lentement le lait jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse. Poursuivez la cuisson jusqu''à épaississement, environ 5 minutes, puis retirez du feu et incorporez le fromage et la moutarde. Saison. Huiler quelques petits morceaux de papier sulfurisé, puis tapisser quatre trous d''un moule à muffins. Vous pouvez également utiliser des caissettes à cupcakes en silicone. Répartir la sauce dans les caissettes et congeler au moins 2 heures.","Mettez les pommes de terre et le laurier dans une grande casserole, couvrez d''eau et assaisonnez de sel. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Retirez les pommes de terre à l''aide d''une écumoire, mettez-les dans une passoire et laissez-les sécher à la vapeur.","Ajoutez tous les poissons dans l''eau de la casserole, réduisez le feu au minimum et pochez-les 5 minutes. Le poisson est cuit lorsqu''il commence à peine à se défaire. Transférez délicatement le poisson sur une planche avec une écumoire et laissez refroidir 5 minutes.","Écailler le poisson en éliminant la peau et les arêtes. Versez les pommes de terre dans une poêle propre, assaisonnez bien et râpez-les avec un peu de muscade. Écrasez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez le poisson, le persil et le zeste de citron. Laisser refroidir.","Divisez le mélange de croquettes de poisson en quatre portions. En travaillant une portion à la fois, façonnez-la en boule. Faites un puits au centre et insérez-y un des disques de sauce mornay surgelée. Façonnez la galette de poisson autour du milieu de la sauce pour obtenir une forme lisse de rondelle de hockey. Répétez avec les portions restantes et la sauce, puis congelez les croquettes de poisson pendant au moins 15 minutes.","Mettez la farine dans un bol peu profond, l''œuf dans un second et la chapelure fraîche dans un troisième. Assaisonnez l''œuf. Bien enrober les croquettes de poisson de farine, puis d''œuf et enfin de chapelure. S''il vous reste de l''œuf ou de la chapelure à la fin, continuez à tremper et à enrober jusqu''à ce que tout soit épuisé. Congeler les croquettes de poisson jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient fermes, environ 1 heure. Se conserve au congélateur jusqu''à un mois. Décongeler au réfrigérateur 2 heures avant la cuisson.","Remplissez d’huile une grande poêle profonde aux deux tiers maximum et faites-la chauffer à 180 °C. Ou utilisez une friteuse. Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Faire frire les croquettes de poisson pendant 7 minutes, en les retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes. Égoutter sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant, puis transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 5 minutes (ou 15 minutes après congélation) jusqu''à ce que le milieu soit chaud. Servir avec de la salade et des quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:16:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12190,6090,'fr','Tarte à l''oignon et pâtisserie au fromage et au thym','Impressionnez vos invités pour le déjeuner avec cette quiche à l''oignon française avec une pâtisserie au gruyère et au thym. Les anchois dans la garniture donnent une saveur umami très spéciale','["200 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","100 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes, plus 25 g","150 g de gruyère, comté ou fromage à pâte dure italienne végétarien, râpé","une petite poignée de thym, feuilles cueillies","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 gros oignons, finement tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe de vin blanc ou de vinaigre de Xérès","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre","2 anchois bruns finement hachés ou utilisez 1 cuillère à café de tapenade d''olive ou de pâte umami","2 gros œufs","300 ml de crème fraîche","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre balsamique","2 tomates séchées, tranchées finement","6 à 8 olives noires dénoyautées, tranchées finement","1 cuillère à café de câpres","quelques poignées de roquette"]','["Mettez la farine dans le bol d''un robot culinaire avec les 100 g de beurre. Mixez jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine, puis ajoutez 50 g de fromage, 1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym, du poivre noir fraîchement moulu et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Blitz à nouveau brièvement pour combiner. Ajoutez 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir une pâte. Si vous n''avez pas de robot culinaire, faites-le dans un bol : frottez d''abord la farine dans le beurre, puis incorporez le reste des ingrédients avec un couteau. Filmer et réfrigérer au moins 40 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 25 g de beurre et l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle à feu doux-moyen et faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel pendant 40 à 50 minutes en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient collants, dorés et très mous lorsqu''on les presse avec le dos d''une cuillère. S''ils commencent à s''accrocher, réduisez encore le feu et ajoutez un peu d''eau. Soyez patient, car ils mettront un certain temps à caraméliser, mais gardez un œil sur la poêle pour qu''ils ne brûlent pas.","Incorporer le vinaigre, le sucre et les anchois. Continuez à remuer jusqu''à ce que le vinaigre se soit évaporé et que les anchois soient dissous dans les oignons. Retirer du feu.","Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5 et étaler la pâte sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné sur 3 mm d''épaisseur. Tapisser avec la pâte feuilletée un moule à tarte de 23 cm (aidez-vous du rouleau à pâtisserie). Coupez les bords pour qu’ils dépassent juste des côtés. Remplissez la pâte avec les chutes, si besoin. Froissez une feuille de papier sulfurisé, puis ouvrez-la à nouveau pour tapisser la pâte et remplissez-la de fèves au four. Cuire au four pendant 15 minutes, retirer le papier sulfurisé et les haricots, puis cuire encore 5 à 8 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit sèche, sans aucune tache crue.","Pendant ce temps, fouettez les œufs, la crème, le reste du thym et le reste du fromage avec une pincée de sel et de poivre noir. Incorporez les oignons caramélisés. Découpez les côtés de la pâte à l''aide d''un couteau dentelé pour resserrer les bords. Versez la garniture dans le fond de tarte et tapotez doucement le moule sur le plan de travail pour faire sortir les bulles.","Cuire la quiche pendant 25 à 30 minutes sur la grille du milieu du four jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement dorée et prise au milieu, avec une légère oscillation. Laisser refroidir dans le moule pendant au moins 15 à 20 minutes, puis trancher. Pour préparer la salade, fouettez l’huile d’olive et le vinaigre dans un bol, puis ajoutez le reste des ingrédients. Empilez la salade sur la quiche ou servez-la à côté. Si vous le souhaitez, laissez la quiche refroidir complètement, puis refroidissez-la avant de la servir. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:16:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12191,6092,'fr','Salade de fenouil et radis râpés aux pêches marinées','Célébrez la saison du fenouil au milieu de l’été avec cette délicieuse salade d’accompagnement. Il est fait de radis, de copeaux de fromage du Lancashire, de basilic, de menthe et de pêches marinées.','["50 g d''amandes entières avec la peau","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","2 bulbes de fenouil","1 citron, jus","4 radis émincés très finement (de préférence à la mandoline) et plongés dans de l''eau glacée","20 g de fromage Lancashire, finement râpé à l''aide d''un épluche-légumes","une poignée de basilic","une poignée de feuilles de menthe","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 pêches mûres (les pêches plates ou en beignet fonctionnent bien), dénoyautées et coupées en tranches épaisses","50 g de sucre en poudre","100 ml de vin blanc ou de vinaigre de riz","1 anis étoilé"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez les pêches marinées. Mettez les tranches de pêches dans un bol et réservez. Versez le reste des ingrédients dans une casserole avec 50 ml d''eau et portez à ébullition en remuant jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir 10 min. Versez le mélange sur les pêches et laissez mariner au moins 30 minutes, voire quelques heures.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettez les amandes et les graines de fenouil sur une plaque allant au four, arrosez d''huile de colza et saupoudrez de paprika fumé et d''un peu de sel. Remuer pour enrober. Cuire au four pendant 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient grillés et légèrement croustillants.","Retirez toutes les feuilles extérieures dures des bulbes de fenouil (vous pouvez les conserver pour les utiliser comme bouillon). Coupez les bases et retirez les tiges et les frondes (encore une fois, en les réservant pour le bouillon, si vous le souhaitez). Coupez les bulbes en deux le long de leur noyau, puis déposez-les, côté coupé vers le bas, sur une planche à découper. Coupez très finement chaque moitié en demi-lunes, puis versez-les dans un bol et arrosez de jus de citron. Pendant ce temps, égouttez les tranches de pêches marinées.","Égouttez les radis et mélangez-les avec le fenouil et une grosse pincée de sel. Laisser reposer quelques minutes, puis incorporer les pêches, la majeure partie du fromage et la moitié des herbes. Arroser d''huile d''olive et parsemer d''amandes grillées et de graines de fenouil. Garnir avec le reste des herbes et un peu plus de fromage."]','2026-01-11 00:16:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12192,6096,'fr','Salade niçoise','Faites de la salade niçoise votre salade préférée pour l''été. Avec de la laitue croquante, des tomates mûres, des pommes de terre, du thon et des œufs mollets, c''est plein de saveur et de texture','["8 pommes de terre nouvelles","50 g de haricots verts (ou une petite poignée), parés et coupés en deux","3 œufs","2 laitues Little Gem, coupées en quartiers","50 g d''olives noires dénoyautées","2 tomates moyennes (les prunes sont bonnes), coupées en quartiers","Boîte de 145 g de thon à l''huile d''olive, égoutté, huile réservée (voir ci-dessous)","½ gousse d''ail","1 filet d''anchois (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive réservée de la boîte de thon (rajoutée si nécessaire)"]','["Pour faire la vinaigrette, écrasez l''ail et l''anchois, le cas échéant, avec une petite pincée de sel sur une planche à l''aide de la lame d''un grand couteau, ou dans un pilon et un mortier. Mélangez la pâte avec la moutarde et le vinaigre, puis incorporez lentement l''huile de thon. Annuler.","Versez les pommes de terre nouvelles dans une grande casserole d’eau froide salée en veillant à ce qu’elles soient bien couvertes. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu pour laisser mijoter. Ajoutez les haricots et laissez cuire 5 minutes, puis retirez-les à l''aide d''une écumoire et plongez-les immédiatement dans un bol d''eau glacée pour les refroidir. Faites cuire les pommes de terre encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres, puis égouttez-les et laissez-les refroidir. Une fois suffisamment refroidis pour être manipulés, coupez-les en deux ou en quatre et mélangez-les dans un grand bol avec 1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigrette. Laisser refroidir complètement.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les œufs dans une deuxième casserole d''eau frémissante pendant 7½ minutes, puis transférez-les dans un bol d''eau glacée pour les refroidir. Égouttez les haricots et les œufs, puis épluchez-les et coupez-les en deux.","Versez les quartiers de laitue, les haricots cuits et les olives dans le bol avec les pommes de terre. Ajouter la majeure partie du reste de la vinaigrette et mélanger délicatement. Répartissez la salade dans deux bols et garnissez de tomates et d''œufs. Écaillez le thon, puis arrosez du reste de la vinaigrette et assaisonnez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12193,6098,'fr','Salade de tomates et mozzarella avec vinaigrette aux tomates','Savourez cette salade de tomates et de mozzarella ultra-rapide en accompagnement, ou ajoutez des tranches d''avocat pour un déjeuner copieux. Garnir de feuilles de basilic et de crostini écrasés pour plus de saveur et de texture.','["200 g de tomates anciennes mélangées, tranchées","1 grosse échalote, tranchée en fines rondelles","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 gouttes de Tabasco","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc (le muscat est bon)","6 feuilles de basilic, râpées, plus de très petites feuilles pour servir","4 crostini du commerce, grossièrement écrasés","1 boule de mozzarella de bufflonne, ou burrata si vous en trouvez (environ 150g), coupée en deux"]','["Mettez les tomates dans un bol avec les échalotes et assaisonnez avec une grosse pincée de sel. Laisser reposer 10 min pour que les tomates libèrent leur jus.","Sortez les tomates et les échalotes du bol à l''aide d''une écumoire et réservez le jus. Disposez les tomates sur deux assiettes, puis parsemez d''échalotes.","Incorporer l''huile d''olive, le Tabasco et le vinaigre dans le jus de tomates réservé pour faire une vinaigrette. Arroser de tomates et d''échalotes, puis parsemer de basilic râpé et de crostini écrasés. Mettez la moitié de la mozzarella au centre de chaque assiette et assaisonnez avec du poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Garnir avec les feuilles de basilic supplémentaires et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12194,6100,'fr','Vinaigrette facile','Préparez cette vinaigrette facile avec de la moutarde de Dijon, de l''huile d''olive et du vinaigre de vin blanc. Cette vinaigrette simple se conserve dans un bocal jusqu''à un mois','["1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Djion","100 ml d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","petite pincée de sucre"]','["Versez la moutarde dans un bol et incorporez lentement l''huile avec un petit fouet. Ajoutez progressivement le vinaigre et 1 cuillère à café d''eau pour obtenir une vinaigrette crémeuse. Assaisonner avec le sucre et une généreuse pincée de sel. Se conserve dans un bocal fermé jusqu''à un mois, mais doit être à nouveau fouetté avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12195,6102,'fr','Salade de fruits','Recherchez des fruits mûrs et odorants pour cette simple salade de fruits composée de kiwi, de mangue, d''ananas, de raisins, d''orange et de baies. C''est un dessert d''été délicieux et léger','["2 kiwis","1 mangue","150g d''ananas","100g de raisins","400g de baies mélangées, nous avons utilisé des fraises, des framboises et des mûres","1 grosse orange","2 cuillères à café de miel (facultatif)"]','["Préparez les fruits avec un petit couteau dentelé. Coupez le haut et le bas du kiwi, posez-le sur l''une de ses surfaces planes et coupez la peau en gardant le couteau le plus près possible de la peau. Coupez-les en deux en suivant le cœur jusqu''au centre, puis coupez chaque moitié en tranches. Mettez dans un bol et répétez avec l''autre kiwi.","Coupez soigneusement la peau de la mangue et coupez chaque joue en passant votre couteau aussi près que possible de la pierre. Coupez chaque morceau en tranches. Retirez tous les fruits restants du noyau en tranches longues et fines. Ajoutez la mangue au kiwi.","Garnissez et équeutez l''ananas, puis, de la même manière que le kiwi, coupez la peau. Utilisez votre couteau pour faire le tour de l''ananas, en retirant les piqués ou les yeux, deux à trois à la fois, vous vous retrouverez avec un motif en spirale se tissant autour de l''extérieur du fruit. Prélevez une tranche circulaire d''environ 150 g, un quart, retirez le noyau puis coupez-la en morceaux. Ajouter au bol.","Coupez les raisins en deux et ajoutez-les au reste des fruits avec les baies. Vous voudrez peut-être trancher ou couper en deux les fraises si elles sont grosses. Retirez la peau de l''orange en utilisant la même méthode que pour le kiwi et l''ananas. En tenant l''orange au-dessus du bol de fruits, retirez les quartiers d''orange en les coupant soigneusement entre la membrane et le fruit. Les morceaux devraient tomber dans le bol avec le jus éventuel. Pressez la membrane sur le fruit pour en extraire le jus, ajoutez un filet de miel si vous le souhaitez. Mélangez le tout et laissez macérer au réfrigérateur 30 minutes, si vous avez le temps."]','2026-01-11 00:16:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12196,6104,'fr','Brochettes de calamars et crevettes','Préparez nos brochettes de fruits de mer grésillantes sur un barbecue et ajoutez votre marinade préférée. Nous avons des idées pour trois glaçages savoureux','["150 g de crevettes crues","250 g de calamars nettoyés","le glaçage de votre choix (facultatif)"]','["Épluchez les gambas et coupez les calamars nettoyés en morceaux de 3 cm, puis enfilez-les sur trois brochettes. Allumez le barbecue. Badigeonnez les brochettes du glaçage de votre choix, puis, lorsque les flammes sont éteintes, faites cuire 2 minutes de chaque côté (ou faites cuire dans une poêle à frire sur feu vif). Badigeonner du reste du glaçage et cuire encore 1 min de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit carbonisé et collant."]','2026-01-11 00:16:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12197,6106,'fr','Salade de maïs grillé, poulet et tortilla avec vinaigrette au yaourt chipotle','Essayez cette salade vibrante avec ou sans poulet. Si vous le servez en accompagnement de brochettes ou de saucisses, remplacez-le par de la feta émiettée, si vous en avez.','["1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé, plus ½ cuillère à café","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle, plus 1 cuillère à café","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 citrons verts, 1 zesté et pressé, 1 coupé en quartiers pour servir","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour badigeonner et frire","6 cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","150g de yaourt nature","2 cuillères à café de miel","2 épis de maïs, les coques enlevées si nécessaire","2 laitues Little Gem, coupées en deux jusqu''au cœur, feuilles écartées et déchirées","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés, rincés et égouttés à nouveau","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 avocats dénoyautés, pelés, coupés en deux et coupés en morceaux","2 tortillas de maïs","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement"]','["Mélangez 1 cuillère à soupe de paprika, l''origan, 1 cuillère à soupe de chipotle, la cannelle, l''ail, le zeste de citron vert et 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans un bol avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Verser sur les cuisses de poulet en les retournant pour bien les enrober, puis couvrir et réfrigérer pendant au moins quelques heures ou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Allumez le barbecue et laissez les flammes s''éteindre, ou faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif. Mélangez le yaourt, le jus de citron vert, le reste de l''huile, ½ cuillère à café de paprika, 1 cuillère à café de chipotle et le miel avec une pincée de sel. Annuler. Badigeonnez les épis de maïs d''un peu d''huile, puis faites-les cuire ainsi que le poulet mariné sur le barbecue ou dans la poêle pendant environ 10 minutes, en les retournant souvent jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit (il doit être carbonisé et ferme au toucher – vérifiez qu''il est cuit en le coupant dans l''un des morceaux les plus épais) et que le maïs soit jaune vif et juteux.","Transférer le poulet et le maïs sur une planche ou une assiette et couvrir pour garder au chaud. Disposez la laitue, les haricots, les tomates et l''avocat sur une grande assiette ou dans un bol de service, mais attendez de mélanger ensemble juste avant de servir – cela aide à empêcher les feuilles de laitue de se flétrir.","Coupez les wraps en lanières ou en petits morceaux. Faites chauffer un filet d''huile dans une poêle et faites frire les lanières jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient croustillantes et dorées, puis égouttez-les sur du papier absorbant. Saupoudrer de sel.","Coupez le poulet cuit en lanières de 1 cm et coupez l''épi de maïs carbonisé. Ajouter à la salade, puis arroser de vinaigrette et du jus de poulet et mélanger. Répartir sur la coriandre et les lanières de tortilla croustillantes et servir avec les quartiers de citron vert à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:16:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12198,6108,'fr','Brochettes de bœuf teriyaki piquantes','Si vous recherchez un dîner léger et sain, ces brochettes sont faites pour vous : riches en folate, fibres, fer et vitamine C, plus 3 de vos 5 par jour.','["1 cuillère à soupe de sauce tamari ou soja","3 cuillères à soupe de jus d''orange fraîchement pressé","15 g de gingembre en morceaux pelé et râpé très finement","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de miel (de préférence cru)","¼ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","300 g de surlonge de bœuf, débarrassé du gras dur et coupé en longues et fines lanières","100 g de riz brun à grains longs","? concombre, coupé en petits cubes","2 carottes moyennes, pelées et coupées en rubans avec un économe","4 oignons nouveaux, parés et tranchés en diagonale","100 g de radis parés et tranchés","20 g de coriandre, feuilles grossièrement hachées, plus un peu pour garnir","10 g de feuilles de menthe, plus un peu pour garnir","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","25 g de noix de cajou non salées, grillées et hachées grossièrement"]','["Mettez le tamari, le jus d''orange, le gingembre, l''ail, le miel et les flocons de piment dans une petite casserole avec 100 ml d''eau froide et portez à ébullition. Cuire pendant 3 à 5 minutes, en faisant bouillir fort jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien réduit, brillant et légèrement sirupeux. Retirer du feu, verser dans un plat peu profond et laisser refroidir.","Enfilez le bœuf sur 4 brochettes en bois ou en métal imbibées. Placer dans la marinade, retourner et badigeonner jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien enrobé. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et laisser mariner 30 min.","Pendant que le bœuf marine, préparez la salade. Remplissez à moitié une casserole moyenne d’eau et portez à ébullition. Faites cuire le riz pendant environ 20 minutes ou en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Rincer dans une passoire sous l''eau courante jusqu''à refroidissement, puis bien égoutter. Verser dans un grand bol.","Ajouter le concombre, les carottes, les oignons nouveaux, les radis, la coriandre, la menthe, l''huile, le zeste et le jus de citron vert, et bien mélanger. Assaisonner avec un peu de poivre noir. Répartir dans deux assiettes et garnir d''une pincée de noix et d''herbes supplémentaires pour garnir.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. (Vous pouvez également faire cuire les brochettes sur une plaque chauffante antiadhésive.) Placez les brochettes sur une grille au-dessus d''une plaque à pâtisserie tapissée de papier d''aluminium, en réservant l''excédent de marinade. Griller les brochettes près du feu pendant 3 à 5 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient cuites à votre goût. Badigeonner avec plus de marinade lorsqu''ils sont retournés. Ils doivent paraître collants et brillants une fois cuits. Servir chaud ou froid avec la salade de riz."]','2026-01-11 00:16:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12199,6110,'fr','Crabe au piment avec salade de fenouil et persil émincés','Cette salade sans cuisson est légère, fraîche et pleine de saveurs. Utilisez de la chair de crabe fraîche – elle a bien meilleur goût que celle en conserve. Cela peut être préparé à l''avance afin que vous puissiez préparer votre assiette à la dernière minute.','["2 bulbes de fenouil, frondes cueillies, hachées très grossièrement","le zeste et le jus finement râpés d''1 citron","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu pour arroser","300 g de chair de crabe blanche fraîche","1 piment épépiné et finement tranché","bouquet de persil plat, feuilles cueillies et hachées une ou deux fois"]','["Coupez la tige du fenouil et retirez la première couche de chaque bulbe si elle semble fatiguée ou meurtrie. Coupez le fenouil en rondelles le plus finement possible à l''aide d''un couteau bien aiguisé ou, mieux encore, à la mandoline si vous en avez une. Versez le fenouil dans un bol et assaisonnez avec une pincée de sel marin. Pressez la moitié du jus de citron et arrosez de 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, puis laissez mariner brièvement.","Versez la chair de crabe dans un autre bol, assaisonnez légèrement, puis ajoutez le reste du jus de citron et de l''huile d''olive, ainsi que la moitié du piment, et mélangez bien. Le crabe et le fenouil peuvent être préparés jusqu''à 2 heures à l''avance et conservés au réfrigérateur, mais ressortez le fenouil 20 minutes avant de servir.","Mélangez le persil et le reste du piment avec le fenouil. Répartir dans six assiettes, puis garnir chacune d''elles d''une grosse cuillerée de chair de crabe au milieu. Répartissez dessus les feuilles de fenouil, le zeste de citron et un filet d''huile d''olive, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12200,6112,'fr','Porc au citron et romarin avec salade de pois chiches','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Rehaussez le porc avec du citron et du romarin pour un souper réconfortant qui sera servi en moins d''une demi-heure.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de romarin finement haché","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","jus et zeste d''un demi citron","4 steaks de porc disposés, appariés au gras","1 oignon rouge, finement tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches, rincés et égouttés","Sachet de 110 g de feuilles de salade mélangées"]','["Mélanger l''huile d''olive, le romarin, l''ail, le jus et le zeste de citron dans un grand bol. Ajouter le porc, retourner pour enrober et bien assaisonner. Si vous avez le temps, laissez mariner au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive. Sortez le porc de la marinade, en secouant l''excédent et en réservant la marinade pour plus tard. Cuire le porc dans la poêle pendant 3 à 4 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Reposez-vous sur une assiette pendant que vous préparez la salade.","Versez la marinade réservée dans la poêle avec l''oignon. Cuire 1 min à feu vif avant d''ajouter le vinaigre ainsi que 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Faites bouillir pendant 1 min, jusqu''à ce que l''oignon ait un peu ramolli et que la vinaigrette ait légèrement épaissi. Incorporer les pois chiches, un peu de sel et de poivre et le jus de porc restant. Mettez les feuilles de salade dans un bol, versez-y le contenu de la poêle et mélangez délicatement avant de manger immédiatement avec le porc."]','2026-01-11 00:16:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12201,6114,'fr','Taboulé de chou-fleur rôti','Un repas simple, faible en calories et sans céréales avec du chou-fleur rôti, de la feta piquante et des graines de grenade sucrées qui peut être préparé à l''avance : idéal pour le dîner et le panier-repas du lendemain.','["1 gros chou-fleur (environ 650 g/1 lb 7 oz de poids paré)","1 cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","25 g d''amandes effilées, grillées","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","200 g de feta émiettée","Pot de 110 g de graines de grenade","jus d''1 citron","½ petit paquet de persil, finement haché","½ petit paquet de menthe finement hachée, plus quelques feuilles pour garnir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Retirez les feuilles extérieures du chou-fleur et le noyau dur, puis hachez grossièrement les fleurons (ne vous inquiétez pas de leur apparence, ils vont être blitzés). Mettez le chou-fleur dans le grand bol d''un robot culinaire, mixez pendant 30 secondes jusqu''à ce qu''il ressemble à des grains de couscous, puis versez-le dans un grand bol.","Mélangez les épices et l''huile d''olive au chou-fleur et assaisonnez au goût. Étalez le « couscous » de chou-fleur sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie en une couche fine et uniforme. Rôtir 12 minutes en mélangeant à mi-cuisson pour qu''il soit uniformément grillé, puis laisser refroidir légèrement.","Une fois à température ambiante, mélangez le reste des ingrédients et assaisonnez au goût, puis saupoudrez de feuilles de menthe."]','2026-01-11 00:16:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12202,6116,'fr','Asperges balsamiques rôties et tomates cerises','Ce plat d''accompagnement végétarien simple peut être servi avec des plats de viande, de poisson et de légumes.','["350 g de pointes d''asperges, les extrémités ligneuses jetées","330 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","50 g de fromage feta émietté"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Disposer les asperges et les tomates cerises sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Arroser d''huile d''olive et de vinaigre balsamique. Assaisonnez, puis mélangez le tout. Cuire au four 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les asperges soient bien cuites. Servir garni de feta."]','2026-01-11 00:16:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12203,6120,'fr','Bar aux agrumes','Place des oranges sur votre barbecue pour empêcher votre poisson de coller - Servir avec une salade citronnée aux câpres, olives vertes et cresson','["2-3 grosses oranges","zester 1 citron (utiliser le jus ci-dessous)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 x 300 g de petit bar entier, écaillé, vidé et coupé plusieurs fois de chaque côté","2 oranges, segmentées","jus d''1 citron","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 sacs de cresson","une poignée de petites câpres","une poignée d''olives vertes dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement"]','["Râpez finement le zeste d''une des oranges\r\net ajoutez-le au zeste de citron. Mélanger avec le\r\nhuile d''olive, puis arroser le poisson et\r\nsaison. Coupez le reste des oranges en\r\ntranches d''environ 5 mm d''épaisseur. Quand les charbons\r\nsont cendrés, disposez les tranches d''orange\r\nsur le barbecue en groupe sur toute la longueur\r\nde chaque poisson. Charbonner les tranches d''orange\r\n1 côté, puis retournez-les et posez le\r\npêcher dessus – cela arrête le poisson\r\ncoller. Faire griller le poisson pendant 5 à 8 minutes\r\nde chaque côté (en les retournant soigneusement),\r\nou jusqu''à ce que la chair se détache facilement\r\nlorsqu''on le pousse.","Pendant que le poisson cuit au barbecue (ou\r\nau préalable), préparez la salade. Mettez le\r\nquartiers d''orange dans un grand bol avec\r\nle jus pressé du reste du\r\nles oranges et le jus de citron. Saison\r\net incorporer l''huile d''olive. Quand le poisson\r\nest cuit, jetez le cresson dans le\r\nvinaigrette à l''orange avec les câpres et\r\nolives. Servir le poisson avec la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:16:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12204,6122,'fr','Le relooking ultime : Salade César au poulet','Angela Nilsen s''est donné pour mission de rendre la salade César, pas si innocente, plus honnête. Le résultat ? Une version plus saine et plus savoureuse. Alors rentre','["1½ cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de thym frais et quelques brins","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée pour meurtrir","4 filets de poitrine de poulet bio/fermier, sans peau et désossés, d''environ 140 g/5 oz chacun","100 g de pain de campagne rustique","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","½ cuillère à café de sauce Worcestershire","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron, plus un peu pour presser","une bonne pincée de flocons de piment","4 filets d''anchois finement hachés","3 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise de bonne qualité (nous avons utilisé Hellman''s)","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt sans gras","1 tête de laitue romaine ou Cos, feuilles séparées, lavées et séchées","Sachet de 100 g de roquette ou de cresson","25 g de parmesan coupé en copeaux avec un épluche-pomme de terre"]','["Faites mariner le poulet. Mélangez le jus de citron, l''huile, le thym et l''ail dans un plat peu profond.\r\nAjoutez le poulet et retournez-le dans le\r\nmarinade pour bien enrober. Assaisonner avec du frais\r\npoivre moulu et laisser reposer jusqu''à 2 heures.","Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.\r\nTranchez, puis coupez le pain en gros morceaux grossiers\r\ncubes pour les croûtons. Répartissez-les dans un\r\nune seule couche sur une plaque à pâtisserie, puis badigeonner\r\npartout avec les 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile. Cuire au four environ\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants.","Pendant ce temps, mettez l''ail dans un mini mixeur avec la moutarde Worcestershire.\r\nsauce, jus de citron, piment et anchois.\r\nMélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse, ajouter la mayonnaise\r\net le yaourt, puis mélangez à nouveau – cela devrait\r\navoir la consistance d''une double crème. Ajuster\r\nle goûter avec du jus de citron et du poivre. Si\r\nnécessaire, diluez avec quelques cuillères à café de froid\r\nl''eau pour obtenir la bonne consistance afin qu''elle soit\r\nenrober les feuilles.","Faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude. Poser le\r\npoulet sur la plaque chauffante, du côté qui avait\r\nla peau dessus. Cuire 15 à 16 minutes en retournant\r\nune ou deux fois, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits.\r\nRetirer, puis laisser reposer la viande 5 minutes\r\navant de trancher.","Conservez les petites feuilles de laitue intérieures\r\nentier, déchirez les plus grandes feuilles extérieures en 2-3\r\nmorceaux, puis mettez-les tous dans un grand bol\r\navec la roquette ou le cresson. Versez juste\r\nsous la moitié de la vinaigrette sur les feuilles et\r\nmélanger soigneusement pour enrober – c’est plus doux à utiliser\r\nvos mains. Soit assembler dans le bol,\r\nou empilez les feuilles dans des assiettes individuelles,\r\nen rentrant les croûtons, le poulet et\r\nParmesan. Arrosez le reste de la vinaigrette\r\nencore et encore, puis terminez par un supplément\r\nun filet de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:16:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12205,6126,'fr','Brochettes de crevettes harissa et couscous aux carottes','Ces brochettes de crevettes vibrantes et faibles en calories sont servies avec un délicieux couscous à la menthe, du tahini et du yaourt à l''ail.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","3 carottes, grossièrement râpées","200 g de couscous","400 g de crevettes crues","16 tomates cerises","1 oignon, coupé en 12 fines tranches, laissant la racine intacte","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa","2 cuillères à café de pâte de tahini","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature faible en gras","1 petite gousse d''ail, écrasée","jus d''½ citron, plus les quartiers, pour servir","une poignée de feuilles de menthe, hachées grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle avec le\r\ngraines de cumin et griller quelques minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit aromatique. Ajoutez les carottes, assaisonnez,\r\npuis cuire 3 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Transfert\r\ndans un bol, puis verser sur le couscous\r\net 400 ml d''eau chaude. Couvrir de film alimentaire\r\nfilmer et laisser poser 10 min, ou jusqu''à ce que tout soit\r\nl''eau a été absorbée et le\r\nle couscous est tendre.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le gril à feu vif. Mettre\r\nles crevettes, les tomates cerises et l''oignon\r\nles quartiers dans un autre bol, assaisonner, puis\r\nincorporer la harissa. Discussion sur tout\r\nsur des brochettes (si vous utilisez des brochettes en bois,\r\nfaites-les d''abord tremper dans l''eau pour éviter\r\nbrûlant), puis déposez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie.\r\nGriller 2 à 3 minutes de chaque côté, ou jusqu''à ce que\r\nles crevettes sont cuites cependant.","Mélanger le tahini, le yaourt, l''ail, le citron\r\njus et assaisonnement pour faire une sauce.\r\nFourchette la menthe dans le couscous,\r\ntransférer dans un plat et placer le\r\nbrochettes dessus. Arrosez toute cuisson\r\njus de fruits et servir avec une cuillerée de sauce\r\net des quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:16:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12206,6128,'fr','Maquereau grillé avec salade d''orange, piment et cresson','Riche en oméga-3 et en vitamine C, cette salade ne pourrait pas être plus saine – ni plus savoureuse.','["1 cuillère à café de poivre noir","1 cuillère à café de graines de coriandre","4 oranges","1 piment rouge épépiné, finement haché","8 filets de maquereau frais","1 cuillère à café de moutarde complète","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","Sachet de 120 g de mélange de cresson, épinards et roquette","1 échalote, tranchée finement"]','["Écrasez finement les grains de poivre et\r\ngraines de coriandre ensemble à l''aide d''un pilon\r\net du mortier. Râper le zeste d''un demi\r\norange et mélanger au mélange de poivrons\r\navec la moitié du piment haché. Entailler légèrement\r\nla peau du maquereau et appuyez sur le\r\nmélanger le mélange piquant et poivré sur le poisson.\r\nFaites chauffer le gril.","Pour la salade, segmentez les oranges.\r\nCoupez d’abord le haut et le bas de chacun\r\norange, puis coupez la peau et les restes\r\nla moelle blanche à l''aide d''un petit couteau bien aiguisé.\r\nTenir chaque orange au-dessus d''un bol pour attraper\r\ntout le jus, coupé de chaque côté de chaque\r\nsegment pour le libérer, puis appuyez sur le\r\ncoquilles pour libérer tout jus supplémentaire. Mesurer\r\n4 cuillères à soupe de ce jus dans un petit bol et mélanger avec la moutarde, le miel et\r\npiment restant.","Griller le maquereau, peau vers le haut, pendant\r\n4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et bien cuits.\r\nPendant ce temps, divisez les feuilles de salade\r\nentre 4 assiettes et parsemer avec le\r\nquartiers d''orange et échalote tranchée.\r\nArroser de vinaigrette chili-orange\r\net garnir de maquereau grillé."]','2026-01-11 00:16:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12207,6130,'fr','Salade de concombre et fenouil','Cette salade d''accompagnement rafraîchissante est faible en gras, super saine et pleine de saveurs estivales.','["1 gros concombre, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur, épépiné et coupé en fines demi-lunes","1 cuillère à café de sucre","1 bulbe de fenouil, finement tranché","Pot de 150 ml de crème sure allégée","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","petit bouquet d''aneth, haché grossièrement"]','["Mettez le concombre dans une passoire. Saupoudrer de\r\n1 cuillère à café de sel et le sucre, puis laisser reposer\r\n10 minutes. Ajoutez le fenouil.","Mélanger la crème sure,\r\njus de citron, vinaigre et aneth, puis assaisonner\r\navec du poivre noir et ajouter au mélange de fenouil."]','2026-01-11 00:16:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12208,6132,'fr','Cabillaud avec croûte de citron et persil et légumes verts d''été','Vous ne savez jamais quoi faire avec un filet de poisson ? Faites en sorte que notre chic (et sain) prenne un bâtonnet de poisson','["1 tranche épaisse de pain rassis, sans croûtes","gros bouquet de persil","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 filets de morue, environ 175 g/6 oz chacun","Paquet de 260 g de légumes préparés, comme des petits pois et des haricots verts ou un mélange de pois, poireaux et épinards","1 cuillère à café de moutarde complète"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/chaleur tournante 170C/gaz 5. Déchirez le pain en morceaux et mettez-le dans un robot culinaire avec le persil et le zeste de citron.\r\nBlitz pour obtenir des miettes grossières.","Huiler légèrement un plat peu profond, puis ajouter la morue en une seule couche. Badigeonnez légèrement le poisson d''huile, puis appuyez sur les miettes. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les légumes à la vapeur jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, puis ajoutez le reste de l''huile, la moutarde et le jus de citron. Servir avec le poisson."]','2026-01-11 00:16:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12209,6134,'fr','Saumon frotté à la cannelle avec couscous et yaourt à la harissa','Un souper de poisson super sain servi en moins d''une demi-heure','["100 g de couscous","2 cuillères à soupe de raisins secs","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, plus une grosse pincée","200 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 filets de saumon","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de pâte d''harissa","Pot de 170 g de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse"]','["Faites chauffer le gril. Mettez le couscous,\r\nraisins secs, la plupart de la coriandre, 1 cuillère à café\r\ncannelle et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un bol.\r\nVersez dessus le bouillon de légumes chaud et\r\nlaisser tremper 5 minutes.","Mélangez la pincée de cannelle,\r\ndu miel et de l''huile. Disposez le saumon dans un plat allant au four\r\nplateau, étaler sur le mélange de miel et\r\nsaison. Cuire sous le grill chaud pendant environ\r\n8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit bien cuit.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez la harissa\r\net du yaourt. Remplissez le couscous avec\r\nune fourchette et servir avec le poisson et le yaourt,\r\nparsemé du reste de coriandre\r\navec quelques haricots verts, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12210,6135,'fr','Aiglefin piquant avec pommes de terre écrasées et petits pois','Être pressé par le temps ne signifie pas que vous devez manger de manière malsaine, comme le prouve ce souper de poisson rapide et faible en gras.','["600 g de pommes de terre farineuses, non pelées, coupées en morceaux","140 g de petits pois surgelés","2½ cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","jus et zeste d''un demi citron","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe de ciboulette ciselée","4 filets d''aiglefin ou autres gros filets de poisson blanc, d''environ 120 g chacun (ou utilisez-en 2 petits par personne)","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","brocoli, pour servir"]','["Couvrir les pommes de terre d''eau froide, amener\r\nporter à ébullition, puis laisser mijoter. Cuisinier\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à tendreté, en ajoutant les pois pendant\r\nla dernière minute de cuisson. Égoutter et\r\nécraser grossièrement ensemble, en ajoutant beaucoup de\r\nassaisonnement et 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Gardez au chaud.","Pendant ce temps, pour la vinaigrette, mélangez 1 cuillère à soupe\r\nl''huile, le jus et le zeste de citron, les câpres et\r\nciboulette avec un peu d''assaisonnement.","Saupoudrez le poisson dans la farine en le tapotant\r\ntout excès et saison. Chaleur restante\r\nhuile dans une poêle antiadhésive. Faire frire le poisson\r\npendant 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à cuisson,\r\npuis ajoutez la vinaigrette et réchauffez.\r\nServir avec le béguin et le brocoli."]','2026-01-11 00:16:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12211,6137,'fr','Burgers aux champignons et pois chiches','Riches en fibres et faibles en gras, ces hamburgers végétariens au yaourt épicé sont une façon saine de savourer la restauration rapide','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de champignons de Paris finement hachés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","le zeste et le jus d''un demi citron","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, rincés et égouttés","85 g de chapelure complète fraîche","6 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec 0 %","pincée de cumin moulu","2 muffins ou petits pains aux céréales mélangées, grillés et coupés en deux","2 tomates italiennes, tranchées","poignée de feuilles de roquette"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive\r\net faites cuire les champignons, l''ail et\r\noignon nouveau pendant 5 minutes. Incorporer le curry\r\npoudre, le zeste et le jus de citron et cuire\r\npendant 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le mélange semble assez sec.\r\nVerser sur une assiette pour qu''il refroidisse légèrement.","Utilisez un presse-purée ou une fourchette pour écraser\r\nles pois chiches dans un bol en laissant quelques\r\ngros morceaux. Ajouter le mélange de champignons\r\net la chapelure, puis façonner 4 galettes.\r\nFaire revenir dans le reste de l''huile pendant 3-4 minutes\r\nde chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés.","Mélangez le yaourt avec le cumin. Lieu\r\nun demi-muffin dans chaque assiette, puis étaler\r\navec le yaourt. Garnir avec les burgers,\r\nquelques tranches de tomate et un peu de roquette."]','2026-01-11 00:16:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12212,6139,'fr','Salade de quinoa, lentilles et feta','Le quinoa, une graine riche en protéines, constitue un excellent substitut au riz ou au couscous','["200 g de quinoa","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 échalote ou ½ oignon, haché finement","2 cuillères à soupe d''estragon, haché grossièrement","14oz Boîte de 400g de lentilles du Puy ou vertes rincées et égouttées","¼ de concombre légèrement pelé et coupé en dés","100 g de fromage feta émietté","6 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","le zeste et le jus d''une orange","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge ou blanc"]','["Faites cuire le quinoa dans une grande poêle\r\nfaire bouillir de l''eau pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre,\r\nbien égoutter, puis laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une petite poêle,\r\npuis faites revenir l''échalote ou l''oignon quelques\r\nminutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Ajoutez l''estragon,\r\nbien mélanger, puis retirer du feu.","Incorporer l''échalote ramollie et l''estragon\r\ndans le quinoa refroidi avec le\r\nlentilles, concombre, feta, oignons nouveaux,\r\nle zeste et le jus d''orange et le vinaigre. Lancer\r\nbien ensemble et réfrigérer jusqu’au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12213,6141,'fr','Risotto d''été aux courgettes','Ce souper frais tout-en-un tire le meilleur parti des produits frais de saison. De plus, c''est une excellente façon d''inciter les enfants à manger leurs légumes.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon et 2 gousses d''ail finement hachées","3 tomates mûres, hachées grossièrement","350 g de riz carnaroli ou autre riz à risotto","1 cuillère à café de romarin haché","1½ l de bouillon de légumes chaud","3 courgettes, coupées en petits dés","140 g de petits pois frais ou surgelés","une grosse poignée de basilic légèrement déchiré"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Cuire le\r\nl''oignon et l''ail pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon\r\ns''est adouci. Ajoutez les tomates et\r\ncuire pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et\r\npulpeuse, puis ajoutez le riz et le romarin.","Versez la moitié du bouillon et laissez reposer\r\ncuire 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait\r\névaporé en remuant de temps en temps.\r\nAjoutez le reste du bouillon, puis continuez\r\ncuire encore 5 minutes.","Incorporez les courgettes et les petits pois, puis\r\ncuire encore 5 minutes environ en remuant\r\njusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre, mais le mélange\r\nest encore un peu déluré. Peut être gelé à ce moment-là\r\nétape jusqu''à 1 mois. Assaisonner avec\r\nbeaucoup de poivre noir, puis ajoutez le basilic et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''il ramollisse. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:16:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12214,6143,'fr','Atta laddoo aux noisettes','Préparez ce joli dessert indien avec de la farine de chapatti, des noix de cajou et des noix. Décorez-les avec un peu de feuille d''or comestible pour les rendre encore plus spéciaux, si vous le souhaitez','["80g de noix","80g de noix de cajou","150 g de farine de chapatti","5 cuillères à soupe de ghee","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''agave","1 cuillère à café de cardamome moulue","10 morceaux de noix cassées","feuille d''or comestible (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer une petite poêle sèche à feu moyen-doux et faites griller les noix et les noix de cajou pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Versez-les dans un mélangeur ou un robot culinaire et réduisez-les en une pâte – les noix commenceront à libérer de l''huile. Versez dans un bol.","Dans la même poêle, faire griller la farine pendant 8 à 10 minutes à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit légèrement dorée et sentant le grillé, en remuant fréquemment pour éviter qu''elle ne brûle. Ajoutez le ghee et mélangez bien jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit friable. Grattez le mélange dans la pâte de noix avec le sirop d''agave et la cardamome. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes, puis bien mélanger le tout avec les mains.","En travaillant avec une portion de la taille d''une noix à la fois, façonnez le morceau en boule dans la paume de votre main pour former un laddoo. Répétez avec le reste du mélange jusqu’à ce qu’il soit entièrement utilisé (vous devriez en obtenir environ 10). Décorez chaque laddoo avec un morceau de noix encore chaud et badigeonnez-le d''un peu de feuille d''or comestible, si vous en utilisez. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à cinq jours. Amenez-les à température ambiante avant de les déguster."]','2026-01-11 00:16:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12215,6145,'fr','Petits pains à la crème','Soyez malin avec la crème anglaise et réalisez ces magnifiques petits pains à la crème. Servir avec des fruits frais ou rôtis si vous le souhaitez pour un petit-déjeuner sucré ou une gâterie l''après-midi','["300 g de farine blanche forte, plus 1 cuillère à café et un peu plus pour saupoudrer","175 ml de crème fraîche","45 g de sucre en poudre, plus 1 cuillère à café","2 cuillères à café de levure sèche à action rapide","1 œuf plus 3 jaunes d''œufs et 1 blanc d''œuf, à température ambiante (congeler les blancs supplémentaires pour les utiliser dans une autre recette)","huile végétale, pour lever","1 cuillère à soupe de lait entier","fruits frais ou rôtis (comme des prunes ou de la rhubarbe), pour servir (facultatif)","15g de farine nature","15g de sucre glace","15 g de beurre froid non salé","60 g de sucre en poudre","15g de farine de maïs","1 oeuf","90 ml de lait entier","160 ml de crème fraîche","1⁄2 cuillère à café de pâte de gousse de vanille"]','["Versez 35 g de farine et la crème dans une casserole et fouettez à feu doux pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Verser dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et laisser refroidir. Pendant ce temps, mélangez 1 cuillère à café de sucre, 1 cuillère à café de farine et la levure avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau tiède. Couverture. Laisser reposer 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le bouillon bouillonne.","Versez l''œuf et les jaunes d''œufs dans un grand bol ou un batteur sur socle avec les 45 g de sucre. Battre pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit pâle et mousseux. Réduisez la vitesse au minimum, ajoutez 1/4 cuillère à café de sel et le mélange de crème et battez pour combiner. Ajoutez le mélange de levure et tamisez les 265 g de farine restants, puis mélangez à basse vitesse pendant 10 minutes à l''aide du crochet pétrisseur. Ou pétrir à la main pendant 5 minutes en faisant tourner le bol au fur et à mesure. Couvrir et laisser lever 20 min dans un endroit tiède. Pétrissez à nouveau pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit élastique, puis transférez-la dans un bol légèrement huilé, couvrez et laissez à température ambiante pendant encore 20 minutes. Transférer au réfrigérateur pour lever environ 8 à 12 heures, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il double de volume.","Pour le streusel, mélangez la farine avec le sucre et une pincée de sel, puis incorporez le beurre jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure fine. Conserver au congélateur jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser.","Pour la crème anglaise, fouettez ensemble le sucre, la maïzena et ¼ cuillère à café de sel dans un petit bol. Ajoutez l''œuf et mélangez au fouet, puis incorporez le lait et réservez. Portez à ébullition la crème et la vanille dans une casserole. Retirer du feu et ajouter lentement le mélange d''œufs en fouettant continuellement. Cuire à feu moyen-doux pendant 7 à 10 minutes, en fouettant tout le temps, jusqu''à consistance lisse et épaisse. Retirer du feu, couvrir et laisser refroidir 30 minutes.","Abaisser la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné jusqu''à obtenir une épaisseur de 2 cm. Découpez huit cercles de 6 cm et utilisez une cuillère à soupe pour presser une trempette au milieu de chacun. A l''aide de vos mains, étirez chaque cercle sur environ 8 cm en gardant une bordure en relief. Disposer sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et remplir chaque trempette avec 1 cuillère à soupe de crème anglaise. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Laisser lever dans un endroit tiède pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils reprennent lentement leur forme lorsqu''on les appuie doucement. Mélangez le blanc d''œuf avec 1 cuillère à soupe de lait et une pincée de sel et badigeonnez-en les côtés des petits pains. Saupoudrer de streusel surgelé.","Cuire au four pendant 10 minutes, puis réduire le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3 et cuire encore 8 à 10 minutes. Laisser refroidir 30 minutes, puis servir avec des fruits frais ou rôtis, si vous le souhaitez. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à deux jours. Servir à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:16:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12216,6147,'fr','Latté aux épices et à la citrouille','Installez-vous confortablement avec un latte aux épices et à la citrouille, parfait pour les froides nuits d''automne et d''hiver. Aux saveurs de gingembre, cannelle, muscade et citrouille, c''est un vrai régal','["2 cuillères à café de purée de potiron","pincée de cannelle moulue, plus un peu pour servir (ou utilisez des épices de citrouille)","pincée de gingembre moulu","pincée de muscade moulue","30 ml d''espresso ou de café fort","250 ml de lait (n''importe lequel fera l''affaire)"]','["Mettez la purée de potiron dans un grand verre ou une tasse résistant à la chaleur. Incorporez les épices et l''espresso ou le café fort.","Faites chauffer le lait dans une casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fumant et mousseux. Verser dans le verre ou la tasse et verser sur la mousse éventuelle. Remuer pour combiner, puis saupoudrer de cannelle ou d''épices de citrouille avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12217,6153,'fr','Cheesecake à la banane au four','Oubliez le pain aux bananes, utilisez des fruits trop mûrs dans ce cheesecake faible en sucre avec une base de chocolat et de noix et une garniture à la ricotta et au yaourt.','["50g de beurre","75 g de galettes d''avoine finement écrasées","50 g de crackers à la crème","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à soupe de cacahuètes salées, hachées très finement, plus 1 cuillère à soupe pour parsemer (facultatif)","2 petites bananes mûres","jus d''1 citron","2 pots de 250 g de ricotta","Pot de 200 g de yaourt grec","4 gros œufs","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille sans sucre","2 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","200 ml de crème fraîche"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et huiler légèrement un moule à cake antiadhésif de 22 cm à fond amovible. Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle et incorporer les flocons d''avoine, les craquelins, le cacao et les cacahuètes hachées jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien enrobés. Presser au fond du moule pour former une couche ferme, puis enfourner pendant 10 minutes. Retirer du four et augmenter le feu à 240C/220C ventilateur/gaz 9.","Pour faire la garniture, écrasez les bananes avec le jus de citron dans un grand bol, puis incorporez la ricotta, le yaourt, les œufs, la vanille et la maïzena jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Verser sur le fond de biscuit et enfourner 10 min, puis baisser le four à fond à 110°C/90°C chaleur tournante/gaz 1/4 et cuire encore 25 min. Éteignez le four et laissez refroidir le cheesecake à l''intérieur. Une fois froid, réfrigérez pendant 3 à 4 heures. (Refroidir le cheesecake de cette façon devrait l''empêcher de se fissurer.)","Pour servir, retirez le cheesecake du moule et glissez-le sur une assiette. Fouettez la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle conserve sa forme, puis lissez-la sur le dessus du cheesecake, saupoudrez légèrement de cacao et répartissez sur les cacahuètes."]','2026-01-11 00:16:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12218,6161,'fr','Pain d''épice','Biscuit allemand semblable au pain d''épices, le lebkuchen est facile à préparer et constitue un excellent régal de Noël.','["250 g de farine nature","85g d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","200 ml de miel clair","1 citron, le zeste finement râpé","85g de beurre","une pincée de clous de girofle moulus, de muscade râpée et de poivre noir","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","100g de sucre glace","1 blanc d''oeuf battu"]','["Versez les ingrédients secs dans un grand bol. Faites chauffer le miel et le beurre dans une poêle à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu, puis versez-le dans le mélange de farine avec le zeste de citron. Bien mélanger jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit homogène et assez solide. Couvrir et laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/ventilateur 160°C/gaz 4. À l''aide de vos mains, rouler la pâte en environ 30 boules de 3 cm de large chacune, puis aplatir légèrement chacune en un disque. Répartissez les biscuits sur deux plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé en leur laissant de la place pour qu''ils gonflent. Cuire au four 15 minutes, puis laisser refroidir sur une grille.","Pour glacer les biscuits, mélangez le sucre glace, le blanc d''œuf et 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau pour former un glaçage lisse et coulant. Trempez le dessus de chaque biscuit dans le glaçage et étalez-le avec le dos d''un couteau. Laisser sécher au chaud"]','2026-01-11 00:16:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12219,6163,'fr','Gâteau au citron sans sucre','Sucrée au xylitol entièrement naturel, cette génoise a une texture dense et sirupeuse et se conserve bien quelques jours','["225 g de farine autolevante tamisée","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","225g de xylitol (voir astuce ci-dessous)","2 citrons, le zeste seulement","2 gros œufs, à température ambiante","125 ml d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","200 g de yaourt grec 0% de matière grasse","1 citron, jus seulement","50 g de xylitol"]','["Préchauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Beurrer et tapisser un moule à cake de 1,2 litre (22 cm x 13 cm de largeur, 7 cm de profondeur) de papier sulfurisé. Mélangez la farine, la levure chimique, le xylitol et le zeste de citron dans un grand bol.","Mélangez les œufs, l''huile de tournesol, le lait et le yaourt dans un bol ou un pichet séparé et incorporez-les au mélange de farine.","Verser dans un moule et lisser la surface. Transférer immédiatement au four, cuire à mi-hauteur du four pendant 1 heure – 1 heure 10 minutes. Vérifiez après 50 minutes, si le gâteau devient trop foncé, couvrez-le légèrement de papier d''aluminium.","Juste avant la fin de la cuisson, réalisez le filet en faisant chauffer le jus de citron et le xylitol. Remuer à feu doux jusqu''à ce que le xylitol soit dissous. Une fois le gâteau cuit, sortez-le du four et versez-y le filet.","Laisser refroidir dans le moule avant de démouler."]','2026-01-11 00:16:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12220,6165,'fr','Guimauves aux ronces','Natasha Lee, lectrice de Good Food, donne aux guimauves une touche saisonnière en ajoutant des mûres, pour un cadeau sucré fait maison','["50g de sucre glace","50g de farine de maïs","9 feuilles de gélatine","450g de sucre semoule","1 cuillère à soupe de glucose liquide (à trouver au rayon pâtisserie)","2 gros blancs d''œufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","140g de mûres"]','["Dans un bol, mélangez le sucre glace\r\navec la maïzena et réserver.\r\nDissoudre la gélatine dans 150 ml\r\neau chaude dans une carafe résistante à la chaleur. Ligne\r\nun moule à pâtisserie de 20 cm x 30 cm\r\nparchemin et poussière avec un peu\r\ndu mélange de sucre glace. Mettez le\r\nsucre cristallisé et glucose liquide\r\ndans une poêle à fond épais avec\r\n200 ml d''eau. Cuire à feu doux\r\njusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous\r\ncomplètement, augmentez le feu et\r\nfaire bouillir jusqu''à ce que le mélange devienne ferme\r\nstade de boule sur un thermomètre à sucre\r\n(125C/256F) – environ 10-15 minutes.\r\nSi vous n''avez pas de thermomètre,\r\ndéposez un peu du mélange dans un verre\r\nd''eau très froide – s''il s''installe\r\nune boule squameuse, c''est prêt. Alors que le\r\nle sucre bout, utilisez un appareil électrique\r\nfouetter pour battre les blancs d''œufs jusqu''à ce que\r\nraide. Lorsque le sirop atteint le\r\nbonne étape, versez-le dans le pichet avec\r\nl''eau gélatine ; soyez prudent car\r\nsera très chaud et pourrait bouillonner.","Continuez à fouetter l''oeuf\r\nles blancs en versant le sirop\r\nen flux constant, puis en ajoutant\r\nl''extrait de vanille – le mélange\r\ndeviendra brillant et commencera à s’épaissir.\r\nContinuez à fouetter pendant environ\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très ferme. Versez la moitié\r\nle mélange de blancs d''œufs dans le moule,\r\npuis répartissez sur les baies. Haut\r\navec le reste du mélange et\r\nlaisser dans un endroit frais et sec\r\nlaisser reposer pendant au moins 2 heures jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme.","Étalez une grande plaque à pâtisserie\r\nparchemin sur une planche à découper\r\net saupoudrer du reste de glaçage\r\nmélange de sucre. Retournez les guimauves\r\net coupez-les en carrés, en les roulant\r\ndans le mélange de sucre. Conserver dans une boîte hermétique\r\nrécipient mais il est préférable de le manger dans la journée."]','2026-01-11 00:16:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12221,6173,'fr','Orzo poireaux, petits pois et épinards','Réalisez trois de vos cinq par jour dans ce plat d''orzo lumineux rempli de fibres prébiotiques respectueuses de l''intestin. Vous pouvez remplacer les légumes par des alternatives saisonnières','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","320 g de poireaux émincés finement","250g d''orge","320 g de petits pois surgelés","10 g de brins d''estragon, feuilles cueillies","320g d''épinards","½ citron , zesté et pressé","2 tbsp crème fraîche"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''ail pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et doré. Ajoutez les poireaux et une pincée de sel. Cuire pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et fanés.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire l''orzo en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Égoutter en réservant un peu d''eau de cuisson.","Incorporer les petits pois, l''estragon et deux grosses poignées d''épinards aux poireaux. Cuire jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés avant d''en ajouter davantage, en cuisant par lots jusqu''à ce que tous les épinards soient incorporés. Assaisonnez bien et ajoutez un peu d’eau de cuisson des pâtes réservée. Incorporer le zeste et le jus de citron, l''orzo et la crème fraîche, ainsi qu''un autre peu d''eau de cuisson pour ajuster la consistance si nécessaire. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:16:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12222,6177,'fr','Soupe de panais épicée à la mijoteuse','Il vous reste des restes de panais de votre rôti du dimanche ? Ils se régaleront dans cette soupe végétalienne au curry épicé. La recette est faite dans une mijoteuse','["750 g de panais pelés et hachés","400 g de carottes hachées","1 oignon, haché","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées ou finement râpées","1-2 cuillères à soupe de curry en poudre (ou au goût)","1l de bouillon de légumes"]','["Versez les panais, les carottes, les oignons, l''ail et la poudre de curry dans une mijoteuse et mélangez bien pour que tous les légumes soient enrobés de poudre de curry. Versez le bouillon de légumes, puis mélangez à nouveau et assaisonnez bien.","Cuire à feu doux pendant 8 heures. Transférer dans un blender et un blitz jusqu''à consistance lisse. Si vous préférez une soupe un peu plus souple, vous pouvez y ajouter quelques gouttes d''eau bouillie de la bouilloire. Répartir dans les bols et assaisonner avec du poivre noir moulu avant de servir. Une fois complètement refroidie, la soupe se conservera congelée jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler complètement au réfrigérateur pendant la nuit, puis réchauffer dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12223,6179,'fr','Riz aux cinq épices en un seul pot','Commencez avec ½ cuillère à café de cinq épices dans ce riz épicé car il a une saveur assez forte, mais vous voudrez peut-être en ajouter plus. Il constitue un plat principal végétarien copieux et sain.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","25 g de gingembre pelé et finement râpé","½-1 cuillère à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","1 piment frais, épépiné et tranché","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en dés","200 g de riz brun facile à cuire","650 ml de bouillon de légumes, préparé avec 2 cuillères à café de bouillon en poudre","420 g de haricots mélangés surgelés (fèves, petits pois et haricots verts)","½ paquet d''oignons nouveaux (environ 8), parés et tranchés","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","75 g de noix de cajou grillées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile de colza dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''ail et le gingembre pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez les cinq épices, le piment, les poivrons et le riz, puis versez le bouillon, couvrez bien et laissez cuire 15 min.","Incorporez les haricots surgelés et les oignons nouveaux, puis couvrez et laissez cuire 10 minutes. Vérifiez que le riz est tendre ; sinon, laissez reposer encore 5 minutes. Éteignez le feu, ajoutez l''huile de sésame et laissez reposer à couvert pendant 5 minutes.","Répartissez le riz dans deux bols et répartissez-le sur la moitié des noix de cajou. Laissez le reste refroidir complètement pendant un autre jour. Se conservera au frais dans un récipient hermétique jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffer au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud, puis ajouter les noix de cajou."]','2026-01-11 00:16:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12224,6181,'fr','Ragoût de pois chiches épicé','Préparez un repas copieux qui favorise la santé des bactéries intestinales avec ce ragoût de pois chiches et de chou-fleur. Précieuse protéine végétale, les pois chiches regorgent de fibres','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons (320 g), hachés grossièrement","2 poivrons verts épépinés et coupés en cubes","2 cuillères à café de poudre de piment fort","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","Carton de purée de 500 ml","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","40 g de raisins secs flambés","½ citron pressé, chair évidée et peau blanche retirée, puis zeste finement haché (il vous faudra 2 cuillères à café)","350 g de fleurons de chou-fleur","15 g de persil haché","140 g de couscous complet","40 g d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à couvercle à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 10 minutes, en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporer les poivrons et cuire encore 5 minutes.","Ajoutez la poudre de piment, la coriandre et le cumin, remuez brièvement, puis versez la passata et les pois chiches ainsi que le liquide des boîtes.","Incorporez la poudre de bouillon, les raisins secs et le zeste de citron, puis ajoutez le chou-fleur. Couvrir hermétiquement et laisser mijoter à feu moyen pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chou-fleur soit tendre. Incorporer la moitié du persil.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le couscous dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et versez dessus 175 ml d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Incorporez le jus de citron, puis couvrez et laissez reposer environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le couscous ait absorbé le liquide et soit tendre. Incorporer les amandes effilées grillées et la majeure partie du persil restant.","Répartir la moitié du couscous dans deux assiettes et garnir de la moitié du ragoût de pois chiches et du reste du persil. Laissez le reste refroidir pendant un autre jour. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffez le ragoût dans une casserole à feu doux avec un peu d''eau jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud. Réchauffez le couscous au micro-ondes."]','2026-01-11 00:16:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12225,6183,'fr','Chaudrée de maïs, noix de coco et lentilles','Servez notre chaudrée saine de maïs, de noix de coco et de lentilles pour le déjeuner. Les lentilles, les oignons et le maïs doux donnent à ce plat des fibres précieuses pour un système digestif sain.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons hachés (320g)","4 gousses d''ail, hachées","2 piments rouges épépinés et hachés","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à café de curcuma moulu","250 g de lentilles rouges","2 l de bouillon de légumes, préparé avec 3 cuillères à café de bouillon en poudre","600 g de maïs doux surgelé","600 g de pommes de terre coupées en petits cubes","280 g de yaourt à la noix de coco","10 g de coriandre hachée"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 8 minutes en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer l''ail, les piments, la poudre de curry, les graines de cumin, le curcuma et les lentilles, et cuire encore quelques minutes, toujours en remuant. Versez le bouillon et le maïs doux. Porter à ébullition, puis couvrir, réduire le feu et laisser mijoter 15 à 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres.","Retirez du feu et mixez brièvement la soupe à l’aide d’un mixeur plongeant – vous ne voulez pas qu’elle soit complètement lisse. Ajoutez les pommes de terre, puis couvrez et remettez à feu moyen pendant 10 à 15 minutes supplémentaires ou jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres. Retirer du feu et incorporer le yaourt et la coriandre.","Servez immédiatement deux bols. Laissez le reste de la soupe refroidir complètement, puis conservez-le au frais jusqu''à quatre jours. Réchauffer dans une poêle à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Cette recette fait partie de notre plan d''alimentation saine gratuit de 7 jours. Pour accéder au plan de repas complet, cliquez ici."]','2026-01-11 00:16:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12226,6185,'fr','Alu tamatar masala','Essayez ce plat végétalien de pommes de terre cuites dans du masala aux tomates. C''est simple à préparer, mais avec des tomates cuites dans des épices et des feuilles de curry, c''est plein de saveurs','["6 pommes de terre moyennes (environ 1 kg), hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","6-8 feuilles de curry","1 piment vert, tranché finement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","Morceau de gingembre de 2,5 cm, pelé et finement haché","5 tomates moyennes, hachées finement","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre"]','["Portez une grande casserole d''eau à ébullition à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire les pommes de terre pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient juste tendres (un couteau à couverts devrait juste pouvoir les couper). Égoutter et réserver.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu doux et ajoutez les graines de moutarde. Lorsqu''ils commencent à éclater, ajoutez les feuilles de curry, le piment, l''ail et le gingembre et laissez cuire 1 min jusqu''à ce que les arômes commencent à se libérer. Incorporer les tomates, puis couvrir et cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres et pâteuses.","Ajoutez le garam masala, la poudre de piment, le curcuma et 1 cuillère à café de sel. Bien mélanger et laisser cuire encore une minute avant d''ajouter les pommes de terre cuites. Versez 200 ml d''eau, couvrez et laissez mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient complètement tendres. Écrasez quelques pommes de terre avec un presse-purée en gardant le reste entier. Saupoudrer de feuilles de coriandre au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12227,6187,'fr','Salade de trois haricots à la mozzarella','Cette salade consistante contient un délicieux mélange de cannellini, de haricots rouges et verts et est idéale pour un pique-nique estival.','["320 g de haricots fins, les extrémités parées et coupées en deux si elles sont grosses","4 carottes (320 g), coupées en bâtonnets fins","2 oignons rouges, coupés en deux et tranchés","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés","320 g de petites tomates de couleurs mélangées (les nôtres étaient rouges, jaunes et orange), coupées en deux","15 g de feuilles de basilic grossièrement déchirées","120 g de mozzarella végétarienne, coupée en cubes","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1-2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","½-1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","1 cuillère à café de poudre de moutarde anglaise séchée","15 olives Kalamata dénoyautées (environ 45 g), tranchées","½ cuillère à café de zeste de citron et 2 cuillères à soupe de jus"]','["Faire bouillir ou cuire à la vapeur les haricots verts et les carottes pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres. Mettez les oignons émincés dans un bol et versez-les sur de l''eau bouillante jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient à peine couverts.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la vinaigrette. Mélanger tous les ingrédients dans un grand bol.","Versez les haricots et les carottes cuits dans la vinaigrette avec les oignons égouttés, les haricots en conserve et les tomates, mélangez bien, puis ajoutez le basilic et mélangez à nouveau. Servir parsemé de mozzarella et d''un peu de poivre noir moulu, si vous le souhaitez. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:16:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12228,6191,'fr','Salade de pois chiches, aubergines grillées et feta','Cette salade à partager contient deux de vos 5 par jour et regorge de saveurs. Assurez-vous que la feta est végétarienne si nécessaire','["1 grosse ou 2 aubergines moyennes","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1 citron, jus","2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés","une petite poignée de menthe finement hachée et quelques feuilles entières pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin grillés","200 g de feta émiettée"]','["Coupez finement l''aubergine dans le sens de la longueur en morceaux de 1 cm d''épaisseur, puis coupez chacun en trois lanières. Mélanger avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile et un peu de sel. Faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit presque fumante, puis faites griller les lanières pendant 2-3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Transférez-les dans un grand bol (vous pouvez également les faire griller si vous préférez).","Mélangez les flocons de piment, le jus de citron et le reste de l''huile avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Versez les pois chiches dans le bol avec l''aubergine, ajoutez la vinaigrette et la menthe, puis mélangez le tout. Verser sur un plat de service, parsemer de pignons de pin et de feta, et parsemer de quelques feuilles de menthe pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12229,6193,'fr','Pommes de terre parmentières','Servez des pommes de terre parmentières à la place des chips ou des rôtis pour un accompagnement plus élégant. C''est un plat classique aromatisé au romarin et à l''ail, et il est facile à préparer','["1 kg de pommes de terre farineuses, pelées et coupées en cubes de 2 cm","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 brins de romarin, aiguilles cueillies et finement hachées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale"]','["Versez les pommes de terre dans une grande casserole d''eau froide et assaisonnez avec une grosse pincée de sel. Portez à ébullition à feu vif, puis égouttez aussitôt et laissez sécher quelques minutes à la vapeur dans une passoire.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Versez les pommes de terre sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie avec les gousses d''ail, le romarin et l''huile. Assaisonnez bien, puis mélangez bien le tout pour que chaque cube de pomme de terre soit enrobé d''huile. Secouez doucement le plateau pour étaler les pommes de terre en une seule couche rugueuse. Rôtir pendant 30 à 35 minutes, en les retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient dorées et croustillantes à l''extérieur et tendres lorsqu''on les pique avec une fourchette. Servir avec de l''agneau rôti, du poisson ou comme alternative aux chips ou aux pommes de terre rôties."]','2026-01-11 00:16:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12230,6195,'fr','Pommes de terre au four à la friteuse','Essayez de faire cuire des pommes de terre dans une friteuse à air pour obtenir une peau croustillante avec un centre moelleux. Le processus est plus rapide et plus économe en énergie que l''utilisation du four','["4 pommes de terre au four (environ 250 g chacune)","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","garnitures de votre choix, comme du beurre, du fromage, des fèves au lard ou de la mayonnaise au thon"]','["Frottez les pommes de terre, puis séchez-les avec du papier absorbant. Transférer dans une assiette, arroser d''huile et frotter la peau avec vos mains pour que les pommes de terre soient bien enrobées. Assaisonnez avec du sel et du poivre – le sel aidera les peaux à devenir croustillantes.","Disposez les pommes de terre en une seule couche dans un panier de friteuse à air. Réglez la friteuse à air à 200 °C et faites cuire pendant 40 à 50 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un couteau bien aiguisé traverse facilement les pommes de terre. Vérifiez les pommes de terre après 20 minutes – si elles semblent dorer trop rapidement d''un côté, retournez-les à l''aide de pinces, puis vérifiez à nouveau après 20 minutes supplémentaires pour vous assurer qu''elles sont bien cuites.  Une fois prête, la peau doit être croustillante et l’intérieur tendre et moelleux. Divisez et servez immédiatement avec les garnitures de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:16:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12231,6197,'fr','Tartes aux épinards et aux pommes de terre épicées','Préparez un lot de ces tartes aux légumes au curry et conservez-les au congélateur pour un déjeuner facile avec une salade ou une entrée réchauffante. Manger comme un pâté avec un chutney de mangue','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin, plus une pincée pour saupoudrer","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, finement râpé","6 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 cuillères à soupe de curry en poudre","500 g de pommes de terre coupées en petits morceaux","200 g d''épinards hachés grossièrement","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","1 oeuf","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma","Bloc de 500 g de pâte brisée (voir astuce ci-dessous)","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","chutney de mangue ou cornichon au citron vert, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à frire munie d''un couvercle ou dans une grande casserole à feu moyen. Faites cuire les graines de cumin dans l''huile pendant quelques secondes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à crépiter, puis incorporez le gingembre et l''ail et laissez cuire encore une minute. Incorporer la poudre de curry et cuire encore une minute. Incorporer les pommes de terre jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient complètement enrobées du mélange d''épices et cuire 4 minutes.","Versez environ 75 ml d''eau sur les pommes de terre et assaisonnez de sel. Mettez le couvercle et faites cuire à feu moyen-vif pendant 6 à 8 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient juste cuites et que la majeure partie de l''eau ait été absorbée. Ajoutez les épinards, couvrez la poêle et laissez cuire une minute. Retirez le couvercle et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient complètement fanés et qu''il n''y ait plus de liquide dans la poêle. Éteignez le feu et assaisonnez avec le garam masala. Laisser refroidir. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à deux jours.","Pour assembler les tartes, mélangez l''œuf avec le curcuma et une pincée de sel dans un bol et réservez. Étalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné jusqu''à l''épaisseur d''une pièce d''une livre et découpez quatre cercles d''environ 12 cm de large en les disposant sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Déposez un quart du mélange de pommes de terre au milieu de chaque cercle de pâte en laissant un bord. Reroulez les chutes de pâte, puis découpez quatre autres cercles d''environ 8 cm de large. Badigeonnez les bords des plus grands cercles de pâtisserie avec l''œuf épicé, puis drapez les petits cercles sur la garniture aux pommes de terre. Pincez les bordures pour sceller. Badigeonner les tartes avec davantage d’œuf épicé et parsemer d’une pincée de graines de cumin. Se conserve congelé jusqu''à deux mois. Décongeler complètement avant la cuisson.","Chauffez le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7 et faites cuire les tartes pendant 30-35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien dorées. Laissez refroidir un peu, puis dégustez tiède ou laissez refroidir complètement et dégustez comme un pâté avec un chutney de mangue ou un cornichon au citron vert. Se conserve deux jours au frais dans un contenant hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:16:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12232,6199,'fr','Mac''n'' cheese aux champignons sauvages','Donnez au macaroni au fromage une métamorphose aux champignons pour un repas familial surgelé. Utiliser des champignons sauvages séchés signifie que vous n’avez pas besoin d’attendre la saison.','["25 g de champignons séchés (un mélange de champignons séchés ou de cèpes sont bons)","75g de beurre","200 g de champignons châtaignes émincés","50g de farine nature","500 ml de lait entier","1 cuillère à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre ou moutarde anglaise","350 g de macaronis ou autres pâtes courtes","râpe de muscade","150 g de cheddar extra-fort, râpé","50 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé","25 g de chapelure panko (facultatif)"]','["Versez les champignons séchés dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, versez-les sur l''eau chaude de la bouilloire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste couverts, puis laissez tremper jusqu''à refroidissement. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer environ un tiers du beurre dans une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille et parsemez-y les châtaignes. Assaisonner et faire revenir 4 à 5 minutes à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et bien cuits. Annuler. Lorsque les champignons séchés sont refroidis, égouttez-les dans un bol pour récupérer le jus de trempage, appuyez pour en extraire tout le liquide, puis hachez-les grossièrement.","Faites chauffer tout le beurre restant, sauf environ ½ cuillère à café, dans une grande casserole à feu vif jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille, puis ajoutez les champignons réhydratés et faites-les revenir pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien dorés. Répartir sur la farine et mélanger pour obtenir une pâte sableuse. Cuire 2 minutes, puis verser progressivement le liquide de trempage des champignons réservé en laissant les sédiments au fond du bol. Laisser mijoter jusqu''à épaississement, puis remuer progressivement ou fouetter le lait jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement incorporé à la sauce. Ajoutez la poudre de moutarde ou la moutarde et assaisonnez selon votre goût avec une râpe de muscade et un peu de sel et de poivre. Laissez cuire doucement la sauce à feu moyen-doux. Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les macaronis dans une casserole d''eau bouillante 2 minutes de moins qu''indiqué sur le paquet.","Lorsque les macaronis sont prêts, égouttez-les bien et remettez-les dans la casserole. Versez dessus la sauce aux champignons, versez les châtaignes poêlées, tout le cheddar et la moitié du parmesan, puis mélangez vigoureusement le tout jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Utilisez le reste du beurre pour beurrer la cocotte, puis grattez-y le mélange de macaronis et de champignons. Parsemer du reste de parmesan et de chapelure, le cas échéant. Se conserve couvert et réfrigéré jusqu''à deux jours ou au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois. Décongeler complètement au réfrigérateur avant la cuisson.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à cuisiner, chauffez le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bouillonnant. Laisser reposer quelques minutes, puis servir à table et servir directement du plat."]','2026-01-11 00:16:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12233,6205,'fr','Pousses croquantes d''ail et de parmesan','Oubliez les choux de Bruxelles détrempés ! Rehaussez un accompagnement de Noël classique à l''aide d''une garniture croustillante et dorée au parmesan et à la chapelure.','["600 g de choux de Bruxelles, coupés en deux","50 g de beurre fondu","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","50 g de chapelure panko","25 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, finement râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Versez les pousses dans un bol, arrosez de beurre fondu, ajoutez l''ail et assaisonnez. Mélangez les pousses jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien enrobées de beurre, puis ajoutez la chapelure et le parmesan et mélangez à nouveau.","Versez les pousses sur une plaque à pâtisserie, en vous assurant qu’elles sont bien espacées en une seule couche. (S’ils sont trop serrés, ils seront cuits à la vapeur au lieu de rôtir.) Placez-en autant que possible, côté coupé vers le bas pour un croustillant maximum. Appuyez sur les miettes en excès sur les pousses pour les aider à coller.","Rôtir pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:16:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12234,6207,'fr','Carottes du patrimoine au granola noisettes','Essayez ces carottes caramélisées aux noisettes comme plat d''accompagnement époustouflant. Vous pouvez préparer le granola jusqu''à deux jours à l''avance et le conserver dans un contenant hermétique.','["400 g de mini carottes lavées et parées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 brins de thym","½ cuillère à soupe de beurre","40g de miel","50g de flocons d''avoine","25g de graines de tournesol","25g de noisettes","100g de beurre","4 grosses carottes, coupées en fines rondelles","80 g de mimolette ou de Leicester rouge finement râpé"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le granola. Chauffer le four à 160C/140C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Faire fondre le beurre avec le miel au micro-ondes pendant 40 secondes. Faire griller les flocons d''avoine, les graines et les noisettes sur une plaque allant au four pendant 5 min. Retirer du four, mélanger avec le mélange de beurre fondu et remettre au four encore 8 minutes. Bien mélanger, puis remettre au four encore 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le granola soit doré et grillé. Assaisonner avec du sel et laisser refroidir. Peut être préparé jusqu''à deux jours à l''avance et conservé dans un contenant hermétique.","Montez le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mettez les mini carottes dans du papier aluminium avec un filet d''huile d''olive, le thym et un peu d''assaisonnement. Envelopper dans une enveloppe et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la purée en faisant chauffer 80 g de beurre dans une poêle et faites revenir doucement les tranches de carottes avec 50 ml d''eau jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à caraméliser. Gardez à feu doux pendant environ 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient profondément colorés et complètement tendres. Laisser refroidir un peu, puis mettre au blender. Mélanger avec 25 ml d''eau jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis assaisonner.","Faire fondre les 20 g de beurre restants et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement dorés avec une odeur de noisette. Pour servir, répartissez la purée dans deux assiettes. Coupez les mini carottes en deux ou trois morceaux et déposez-les sur la purée. Arroser d''un peu de beurre noisette, saupoudrer généreusement de granola et terminer par une râpe de fromage et une pincée de sel marin."]','2026-01-11 00:16:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12235,6211,'fr','Tarte au fromage et à l''oignon','Faites un effort supplémentaire pour préparer cette tarte au fromage et à l’oignon et elle plaira à coup sûr. Avec la pâtisserie maison, on la mange aussi bien froide que tiède','["250 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de farine de seigle (ou compléter le poids avec de la farine nature)","grosse pincée de poivre de Cayenne","1 cuillère à café de graines d''oignon","25 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, finement râpé","125 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","1 œuf battu","40g de beurre","3 gros oignons, finement tranchés","2 feuilles de laurier","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym","1 pomme de terre moyenne (environ 350 g), coupée en deux dans le sens de la longueur et tranchée","100 ml de crème double","150 g de cheddar extra affiné, ½ râpé, ½ coupé en petits morceaux"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la pâte. Versez les farines dans un bol moyen avec le poivre de Cayenne, les graines d''oignon, le parmesan et une généreuse pincée de sel. Incorporez le beurre jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à de la chapelure, puis versez la moitié de l''œuf et 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide et mélangez le tout avec vos mains. Pétrir plusieurs fois jusqu''à consistance lisse. Aplatissez un tiers de la pâte en disque, puis faites de même avec le reste de la pâte. Envelopper les deux disques de pâte et réfrigérer au moins 30 minutes au réfrigérateur. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à deux jours.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la garniture. Faites chauffer le beurre dans une casserole à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille, puis parsemez-y les oignons, le laurier, le thym, une grosse pincée de sel et une bonne mouture de poivre noir. Remuer, puis cuire lentement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient cuits et commencent à caraméliser. Incorporer les tranches de pommes de terre, couvrir et cuire encore 8 à 10 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient tendres et commencent à se décomposer. Incorporez la crème, retirez la casserole du feu et laissez refroidir. Une fois refroidi, retirez et jetez la baie, puis incorporez le fromage.","Étalez le petit disque de pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée à la taille d''une assiette et posez-le sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Étalez le disque de pâte restant ainsi que les chutes éventuelles en un cercle environ 5 cm plus large que le premier. Versez la garniture au milieu du petit cercle de la plaque à pâtisserie, en laissant une bordure de 4 cm. Badigeonnez la bordure exposée avec un peu de l’œuf battu restant, puis recouvrez le plus grand cercle de pâtisserie. Rentrez le bord autour de la garniture pour l''enfermer, comme si vous prépariez un ravioli géant. Coupez le bord pour le rendre net, puis sertissez-le avec le manche d''un couteau à couverts ou une fourchette pour sceller. Badigeonnez toute la tarte avec la majeure partie de l''œuf battu restant et utilisez les parures pour faire des décorations, si vous le souhaitez.","Chauffer le four à 210°C/190°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Cuire la tarte pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit bien dorée, en la badigeonnant du reste de l''œuf battu à mi-cuisson. Laisser refroidir sur la plaque à pâtisserie pendant au moins 20 minutes avant de couper en quartiers, ou laisser refroidir complètement et servir froid."]','2026-01-11 00:16:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12236,6213,'fr','Chocolat chaud chai végétalien','Ne faites pas de compromis sur la saveur ou la consistance crémeuse du chocolat chaud végétalien ; cette boisson épicée à base de lait d''avoine est parfaite pour réchauffer l''hiver','["350 ml de lait d''avoine (utiliser style barista pour une texture crémeuse)","1 cuillère à café de poudre de cacao biologique","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","½ cuillère à café de muscade moulue, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","1 gousse de cardamome","½ cuillère à café de café moulu","1 gousse de vanille bio fendue (ou utiliser 1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait de vanille)","1 cuillère à soupe de nectar d''agave","crème fouettée végétalienne et copeaux de chocolat noir végétalien mi-sucré, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Versez les deux tiers du lait d''avoine dans une casserole. Ajoutez le cacao, la cannelle, la muscade, la gousse de cardamome et le café. Porter à ébullition à feu moyen-vif. Cuire 1 à 2 minutes.","Réduire le feu à moyen et incorporer la vanille et l''agave. Faites mousser le reste du lait d''avoine à l''aide d''un mousseur à lait électrique ou du mini fouet d''un mixeur plongeant. Filtrez le chocolat chaud dans deux tasses en jetant la cannelle et la gousse de cardamome, puis versez délicatement la mousse de lait.","Garnir de crème fouettée, de copeaux de chocolat et d''une pincée de cannelle et de muscade, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12237,6221,'fr','Steak de chou-fleur au fromage et gratin de haricots cannellini avec chapelure de sauge','Dégustez ce gratin de chou-fleur au fromage et de haricots cannellini comme pièce maîtresse végétarienne lors d''un festin de famille, ou essayez-le comme plat d''accompagnement pour accompagner un plat principal de viande.','["1 gros ou 2 petits choux-fleurs (environ 1kg)","50g de beurre","50g de farine nature","500 ml de lait","2 feuilles de laurier","200 g de cheddar affiné, râpé","1 cuillère à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre","petit bouquet de sauge, feuilles cueillies et hachées finement","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots cannellini, égouttés et rincés","75 g de mozzarella râpée","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","50g de chapelure séchée","1 citron, zesté"]','["Retirez les feuilles du chou-fleur, jetez celles qui ont des tiges très épaisses ou endommagées et réservez les plus petites. Coupez le chou-fleur en quatre à six steaks ou quartiers à travers la tige pour aider à maintenir les fleurons attachés. Coupez les fleurons qui tombent en morceaux de taille égale.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée et faites cuire les steaks de chou-fleur pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres. Ajoutez les feuilles réservées et les fleurons en vrac pour les 2 dernières minutes de cuisson. Égoutter, puis laisser sécher à la vapeur pendant que vous préparez la sauce au fromage.","Pour faire la sauce au fromage, faites fondre le beurre dans la même poêle à feu moyen, puis saupoudrez de farine. Fouettez jusqu''à obtenir une pâte épaisse, puis ajoutez progressivement le lait, un peu à la fois, en fouettant jusqu''à ce que tout soit incorporé. Ajouter les feuilles de laurier et cuire encore 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Incorporer le cheddar et la poudre de moutarde et bien assaisonner.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Verser la moitié de la sauge et tous les haricots dans la sauce. Remuer brièvement. Incorporez les fleurons et les feuilles de chou-fleur en vrac. Disposez les steaks de chou-fleur dans un plat allant au four, puis versez dessus la sauce au fromage en veillant à ce qu''elle enrobe bien les steaks. Parsemer de mozzarella et enfourner 20 min.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez l’huile, l’ail, la chapelure, le zeste de citron et le reste de la sauge dans un bol.","Sortez le plat du four et répartissez-le sur le mélange de chapelure. Cuire au four encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''un couteau traverse facilement les steaks de chou-fleur et que le dessus soit doré et bouillonnant. Laisser reposer 5 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12238,6223,'fr','Gratin de pommes de terre, pousses râpées et marrons','Dégustez ce gratin végétarien avec des légumes verts d''hiver ou comme accompagnement crémeux lors d''un festin familial. Avec des choux et des châtaignes, c''est un plat merveilleusement festif','["3 gousses d''ail","400 ml de crème fraîche","400 ml de lait entier","1 oignon, coupé en quatre tranches épaisses","1 feuille de laurier froissée","quelques noix de beurre, plus un peu pour le plat","1 kg de pommes de terre farineuses, tranchées très finement","250 g de châtaignes entières cuites, coupées grossièrement en morceaux","250 g de choux de Bruxelles, râpés","125 g de cheddar râpé","râpe de muscade"]','["Écrasez les gousses d''ail pelées avec la lame d''un couteau, puis mettez-les dans une grande casserole avec la crème, le lait, les tranches d''oignon, le laurier et 2 cuillères à café de sel marin. Portez à ébullition à feu doux. Lorsque le mélange bouillonne, retirez du feu et laissez infuser 1 h.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3, et beurrer généreusement un grand plat allant au four profond. Tamisez le lait infusé dans un bol et jetez l''oignon, le laurier et l''ail (vous pouvez les réserver pour les utiliser dans une sauce au pain, si vous le souhaitez). Disposez une couche de pommes de terre dans le plat, puis parsemez-y quelques châtaignes, pousses, fromage et un peu de muscade. Arrosez d’un peu du mélange de lait infusé. Répétez jusqu''à ce que vous ayez utilisé tous les ingrédients, en terminant par une couche de pommes de terre, puis recouvrez avec le reste du mélange de lait infusé. Parsemer de quelques petites noix de beurre.","Cuire le gratin pendant 1 h 15 à mi-hauteur du four jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et croustillant sur le dessus. Un couteau inséré au milieu devrait glisser facilement. Laissez reposer le gratin 10 min, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12239,6225,'fr','Wellington aux champignons et patates douces','Épatez la famille et les amis avec ce Wellington aux champignons, patates douces et canneberges. C''est un plat central impressionnant lors d''un Noël végétarien.','["90 g de cèpes séchés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, finement haché","250 g de champignons de Paris finement hachés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","500 g de patates douces (environ 2 grosses), pelées et coupées en morceaux de 2 cm","1 cuillère à soupe de romarin finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de sauge finement hachée, plus 4 feuilles entières","100 g de chapelure blanche moelleuse","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade (voir astuce ci-dessous)","40 g de noix ou de noix de pécan hachées","40 g de canneberges séchées","râpe de muscade","2 feuilles de 320 g de pâte feuilletée sans produits laitiers","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","3 cuillères à soupe de lait végétal","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde anglaise ou de moutarde de Dijon avec une pincée de curcuma"]','["Mettez les champignons séchés dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et versez dessus 500 ml d''eau bouillante de la bouilloire. Remuez et pressez-les pour qu''ils soient bien couverts, puis laissez tremper.","Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon et les châtaignes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient très tendres et que les champignons paraissent fanés et réduits, environ 20 minutes.","Incorporez l''ail et les patates douces, puis les champignons réhydratés et leur liquide de trempage en laissant le reste du liquide dans le bol (celui-ci peut contenir des graviers de champignons). Couvrir et cuire pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les patates douces soient à peine ramollies et que la majeure partie du liquide se soit évaporée. Ajoutez un peu d''eau à mi-cuisson si le liquide s''évapore trop rapidement.","Retirez le couvercle et incorporez les herbes hachées, la chapelure, la mélasse, les noix et les canneberges. Assaisonnez bien et saupoudrez de muscade. Le mélange doit être suffisamment ferme pour ressembler à une farce, mais pas sec – toute la chapelure doit être enrobée et avoir absorbé une partie du liquide. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir dans la poêle.","Une fois refroidie, déroulez une des feuilles de pâte feuilletée sur une plaque à pâtisserie antiadhésive légèrement farinée ou recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Fouettez le lait et la moutarde avec une pincée de sel et réservez.","Versez la garniture refroidie au milieu de la feuille de pâte en formant une ligne nette, en laissant une bordure de 5 cm sur les bords. Badigeonner les bords avec le mélange moutarde-lait, puis recouvrir de la deuxième feuille de pâte. Pressez la pâte autour de la garniture pour éliminer les poches d''air, puis sertissez pour sceller les côtés. Coupez tout excédent de pâte avec un couteau bien aiguisé et utilisez une fourchette ou vos doigts pour créer un motif autour du bord du Wellington.","Découpez un petit trou de vapeur en haut au milieu, puis badigeonnez le dessus avec le mélange moutarde-lait. Refroidir sur la plaque ou la plaque pendant 30 minutes. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Sortez le Wellington du réfrigérateur et badigeonnez-le avec davantage du mélange moutarde-lait. Tracez un motif sur le dessus de la pâte avec un couteau ou une fourchette, si vous le souhaitez, puis faites cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée, gonflée et croustillante – couvrez de papier d''aluminium si elle brunit trop rapidement. Disposez les feuilles de sauge entières sur le Wellington et collez-les avec le mélange moutarde-lait, puis remettez au four 10 min supplémentaires.","Laisser reposer 10 minutes sur une planche ou un plat avant de couper en grosses tranches pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12240,6227,'fr','Courge miniature farcie aux champignons crémeux et à l''estragon','Faites plaisir à vos convives avec ces courges miniatures farcies, à base de céréales mélangées, de champignons et d''estragon. C''est une pièce maîtresse végétarienne idéale à Noël','["4 oignons ou courge poivrée","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","50 g de champignons sauvages séchés","2 échalotes bananes, pelées et tranchées","200 g de champignons de Paris finement hachés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","100 ml de bouillon de légumes","250 g de céréales mélangées cuites","4 tbsp crème fraîche","½ petit bouquet d''estragon finement haché","80 g de cheddar affiné finement râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. À l''aide d''un couteau dentelé, coupez un petit disque au fond de chaque courge afin qu''elles tiennent debout sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Coupez le dessus (ceux-ci serviront de couvercles), puis retirez et jetez le centre épépiné. Frottez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile à l''intérieur et à l''extérieur des courges, puis assaisonnez.","Versez les champignons séchés dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et couvrez de 100 ml d''eau bouillante. Couvrir et laisser tremper 15 min. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir les échalotes pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies et translucides. Égouttez les champignons réhydratés (en réservant le liquide de trempage) et hachez-les grossièrement, puis ajoutez-les dans la poêle avec les châtaignes. Faites frire encore 10 minutes. Incorporer l''ail et cuire encore une minute. Ajoutez le bouillon, la majeure partie du liquide de trempage réservé (laissez les dernières gouttes au fond du bol, car celui-ci peut contenir des grains) et les grains, et portez à ébullition. Retirer du feu et incorporer la crème fraîche, l''estragon et le fromage. Saison.","Répartissez la garniture entre les courges évidées. Posez les « couvercles » dessus et enfournez pendant 1h à 1h10, selon la taille de la courge. Une fois prêtes, les peaux de courge doivent être cloquées et la chair molle et bien cuite. Laisser reposer 10 minutes avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12241,6229,'fr','Tarte aux panais, feta et haricots beurre','Vous cherchez un plat végétarien époustouflant ? Remplie de panais, de feta et de haricots beurre, cette tarte constitue la pièce maîtresse de Noël parfaite','["400 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","150 g de farine de seigle","300 g de beurre froid coupé en cubes","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym","2 gros œufs, plus 1 jaune d''œuf pour glacer","pincée de thym séché ou d''un mélange d''herbes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, tranché","600 g de panais épluchés et coupés en cubes de 1 cm","2 gros œufs","200g crème fraîche","200 g de feta émiettée","1/2 petit bouquet de thym, feuilles cueillies","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés et rincés","½ cuillère à café de macis moulu","1 citron, zesté"]','["Pour réaliser la pâte, mettez les deux farines dans le bol d''un robot culinaire avec le beurre, les feuilles de thym et ½ cuillère à café de sel marin fin. Pulsez pendant quelques secondes jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à des décombres sableux, puis ajoutez les œufs entiers et 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau froide. Pulsez à nouveau jusqu''à ce qu''il forme une boule, puis transférez-le sur une surface de travail légèrement saupoudrée et pétrissez brièvement jusqu''à consistance lisse. Filmer et réfrigérer 30 minutes.","Pour faire la garniture, faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu doux-moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit collant, doré et caramélisé. Cela prendra un certain temps, mais cela ajoutera de la profondeur et de la douceur à la tarte. Ajoutez un peu d''eau si les oignons commencent à noircir trop rapidement ou à s''accrocher.","Ajoutez les panais et 250 ml d''eau. Cuire 15 minutes en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit évaporée et que les panais soient tendres et commencent tout juste à colorer. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir.","Mélangez les œufs et la crème fraîche dans un grand bol jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis incorporez la feta, le thym, les haricots beurre et le mélange de légumes. Ajoutez le macis, le zeste de citron, ½ cuillère à café de poivre noir et un peu de sel.","Coupez les deux tiers de la pâte et étalez-la sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné sur une épaisseur de 3 à 4 mm. Utilisez-le pour tapisser un plat à tarte rond de 23 cm de diamètre (il doit faire environ 7 cm de profondeur), en laissant dépasser un peu de pâte. Verser la garniture en nivelant le dessus.","Étalez le reste de la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit suffisamment grande pour recouvrir le dessus de la tarte. Badigeonnez un peu de jaune d''œuf sur le pourtour de la tarte, puis soulevez le couvercle de la pâtisserie par-dessus et appuyez sur le bord pour sceller. Coupez tout excédent de pâte avec un couteau bien aiguisé. Faites un trou de vapeur au milieu du couvercle, puis badigeonnez avec le reste du jaune d''oeuf. Saupoudrer d''herbes séchées, puis réfrigérer 30 minutes. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Enfourner la tarte pendant 50 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée, croustillante et sèche. Laisser reposer 15 minutes avant de couper et de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12242,6231,'fr','Tarte à la ratatouille avec pâte feuilletée au cheddar et au thym','Préparez une pâte feuilletée au fromage garnie d''une compote d''aubergines et de tomates fumées et de courgettes rôties pour cette superbe tarte. C''est idéal pour un déjeuner entre amis','["5 tomates moyennes (un mélange de différentes couleurs est joli)","1 aubergine","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons rouges, tranchés","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","2 courgettes (nous avons utilisé 1 verte et 1 jaune)","20 g de parmesan râpé ou alternative végétarienne","150g de beurre","300 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","4 cuillères à soupe de polenta","50 g de cheddar extra-fort, râpé grossièrement","petit bouquet de thym, feuilles cueillies","1 jaune d''oeuf battu (congeler le blanc pour une autre recette)"]','["La veille de la tarte, enveloppez le beurre pour la pâtisserie dans du papier aluminium et congelez-le jusqu''à ce qu''il soit solide – cela facilitera son râpage. Pour réaliser la pâte, mettez la farine dans un grand bol et mélangez la moitié de la polenta, le fromage, le thym (en réservant quelques feuilles pour servir) et une bonne pincée de sel. À l’aide d’une râpe à fromage grossière, râpez le beurre congelé – essayez de le manipuler le moins possible pour qu’il ne ramollisse pas – et remuez-le avec un couteau. Remuez une dernière fois le mélange pour vous assurer que tout le beurre est bien enrobé de farine, puis incorporez rapidement 125 ml d''eau très froide. Rassemblez délicatement avec vos mains (en arrosant un peu plus d''eau si le mélange semble sec), puis enveloppez-le dans du papier sulfurisé et placez-le au réfrigérateur pendant 30 minutes.","Coupez les tomates en tranches à peu près de l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £ (utilisez une mandoline, si vous en avez une). Réservez environ la moitié des tranches de tomates pour le dessus de la tarte, puis coupez grossièrement le reste en morceaux.","Chauffez le gril à feu vif (ou vous pouvez utiliser la flamme d''une cuisinière à gaz). Percez l''aubergine quatre ou cinq fois avec la pointe d''un couteau et faites-la griller (ou maintenez-la sur la flamme du gaz à l''aide de pinces), en la retournant souvent, pendant 8 à 10 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la peau soit carbonisée et que l''aubergine soit molle et s''effondre. Laissez refroidir un peu.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle à feu doux-moyen et faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons commencent à caraméliser. Pendant ce temps, grattez la peau de l’aubergine (ne vous inquiétez pas si quelques morceaux adhèrent à la chair, cela ajoutera une saveur fumée). Hachez grossièrement la chair des aubergines.","Ajouter l''ail et l''aubergine aux oignons et cuire encore 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que tout liquide libéré par l''aubergine se soit évaporé. Ajoutez les tomates concassées et le sucre, assaisonnez et poursuivez la cuisson 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Laisser refroidir, puis réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de l''utiliser. Peut être préparé jusqu''à un jour à l''avance.","Coupez les courgettes en tranches d''environ l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £. Mettez dans un bol et mélangez avec une bonne pincée de sel. Laisser poser 10 min.","Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur. Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 avec une plaque à pâtisserie à l''intérieur (ou une poêle peu profonde de 30 cm si vous en avez une). Abaisser la pâte sur une grande feuille de papier sulfurisé saupoudrée d''un peu de farine, en un cercle d''environ 35 cm de large. Coupez le bord si vous souhaitez une finition soignée.","Égouttez les courgettes, puis versez-les sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant. Séchez pour éliminer autant d’humidité que possible. Saupoudrer le reste de polenta sur la pâte, puis garnir du mélange de tomates et d''aubergines réfrigérées. Étalez-le à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère en laissant un bord de 3 cm sur le pourtour.","Disposez les tranches de tomates réservées et les courgettes en cercles concentriques superposés sur la tarte. Badigeonner les légumes du reste d''huile, assaisonner et saupoudrer de parmesan. Pliez légèrement le bord de la pâte sur les légumes, en appuyant doucement pour sceller. Badigeonner le bord de la pâte avec le jaune battu.","Glissez délicatement la tarte, toujours sur le papier sulfurisé, sur la plaque chaude ou dans la poêle. Cuire au four pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés, puis parsemer de feuilles de thym supplémentaires, le cas échéant. Laisser refroidir un peu et servir tiède ou à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:16:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12243,6233,'fr','Cordonnier aux tomates, maïs, ricotta et parmesan','Préparez ce cordonnier aux tomates et au fromage et servez-le avec du poulet rôti ou dégustez-le seul. C''est une révélation si vous n''avez jamais fait de cordonnier salé auparavant','["145 g de gazon","235 g de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","235 g de semoule de maïs fine ou polenta","1½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","115 g de beurre froid coupé en petits cubes","220 ml de babeurre (ou 120 g de yaourt mélangé à 100 ml de lait si vous ne trouvez pas de babeurre)","1 kg de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 épis de maïs, les grains coupés des épis","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","2½ cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 gros oignons, hachés grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","4 branches de thym, feuilles cueillies","25 g de parmesan râpé ou alternative végétarienne"]','["Mettez la ricotta dans une passoire recouverte d''un morceau de mousseline, posée au-dessus d''un bol. Mettez au réfrigérateur et laissez égoutter pendant quelques heures – vous voulez qu’il s’égoutte suffisamment pour qu’il ne soit plus « humide ».","Mettez la farine, la semoule de maïs, ½ cuillère à café de sel, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate et le sucre dans un bol. Ajoutez le beurre et mélangez-le aux ingrédients secs, comme si vous faisiez une pâtisserie. Faites un puits au centre, versez le babeurre et, à l''aide d''un couteau, mélangez progressivement. Vous devriez obtenir une pâte molle. Émiettez la ricotta et mélangez-la à la pâte.","Étalez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné et, avec vos mains, formez-la en un rectangle d''environ 20 x 15 cm. Pliez le tiers supérieur au milieu, puis faites de même avec le tiers inférieur. Pressez à nouveau le mélange dans un rectangle de 20 x 15 et répétez le processus deux fois de plus. Vous devriez obtenir une pâte d’environ 2,5 cm d’épaisseur. Filmer et réfrigérer 20 min.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mettez les tomates dans un plat allant au four (environ 20 x 30cm) avec les grains de maïs. Ajoutez le vinaigre, un peu d''assaisonnement et 1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile, et mélangez pour bien enrober. Annuler.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et tendres, environ 12 minutes. Ajoutez l''ail et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes, puis ajoutez le thym et un peu d''assaisonnement. Verser le mélange d''oignons sur les tomates et le maïs.","Étalez la pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée et coupez-la en cercles ou en carrés à l''aide d''un couteau. Disposez les formes de pâte sur les légumes en laissant un peu d''espace entre elles. Saupoudrer de parmesan et cuire au four pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et bouillonnantes (vous devriez pouvoir voir les tomates bouillonner sous la garniture de cordonnier). Laissez refroidir un peu – les tomates seront très chaudes à la sortie du four – puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12244,6235,'fr','Burgers de champignons au soja','Changez de la viande avec ces merveilleux burgers aux champignons. La douceur de l''oignon et de la courgette s''accorde à merveille avec la savoureuse sauce aux huîtres','["1 oignon rouge, finement tranché","½ cuillère à café d''huile de sésame pour wok Lee Kum Kee","½ cuillère à soupe de sauce soja noire Lee Kum Kee Premium","½ cuillère à soupe de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce aux huîtres Lee Kum Kee Premium (voir conseil)","4 champignons des champs, pelés, si vous le souhaitez, et les tiges retirées","1 courgette coupée en 4 tranches dans le sens de la longueur","4 pains à burger","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à café d''huile de piment Lee Kum Kee Chiu Chow (utilisez les flocons de piment du fond du pot pour une meilleure saveur)","4 feuilles de laitue"]','["Faire revenir les oignons rouges dans l''huile de sésame pour wok jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et bien cuits, environ 8 minutes. Réserver et réserver au chaud.","Pendant ce temps, mettez la sauce soja noire premium et le beurre dans un pan et faites fondre ensemble, puis ajoutez la sauce aux huîtres premium et remuez. Badigeonnez les champignons du mélange, puis laissez reposer une minute pour que les champignons absorbent la sauce. Chauffer le gril à feu vif.","Griller les champignons jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, environ 10 minutes. Une fois prêt, vous devriez pouvoir glisser assez facilement un couteau dans les parties les plus épaisses.","Griller les tranches de courgettes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à cloquer, qu''elles soient dorées et tendres. Réchauffez brièvement les pains à burger sous le grill et mélangez la mayonnaise avec l''huile de piment Chiu Chow.","Badigeonnez le fond de chaque pain burger d''un peu de mayonnaise froide, puis ajoutez une tranche de courgette, une feuille de laitue et un champignon. Garnir de quelques oignons sautés et des petits pains."]','2026-01-11 00:16:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12245,6239,'fr','Salade d''orzo aux herbes et citron','Préparez cette salade d''orzo estivale remplie d''herbes et de citron pour un accompagnement de saison. Les restes constituent un excellent déjeuner le lendemain','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","½ cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","350 g d''orzo","50 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 gros citron, jus","1 petit bouquet de basilic finement haché","1 petit bouquet de persil finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de câpres, égouttées et rincées","50 g d''amandes effilées légèrement grillées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive et le beurre dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 à 15 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et caramélisé. Ajoutez l''ail et le sucre et laissez cuire encore 3 minutes. Assaisonner au goût.","Faites cuire l''orzo en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Égoutter, puis mélanger avec un peu d''huile d''olive extra vierge et laisser refroidir complètement. Fouettez le reste de l''huile avec le jus de citron et réservez.","Mélangez l''orzo avec l''oignon gluant et l''ail, la vinaigrette citronnée, les herbes et les câpres, ainsi que la moitié des amandes grillées. Saison. Verser sur une assiette à partager et garnir du reste des amandes. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:16:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12246,6241,'fr','Feta grillée croustillante avec haricots beurre en sauce','Coincé dans une ornière alimentaire ? Prenez une boîte de haricots beurre, de la feta et de la passata pour préparer ce souper ultra rapide et ultra savoureux. Plein de bonté, c''est sain aussi','["500 ml en purée","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés et rincés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché, plus une pincée","200g d''épinards","2 poivrons rouges rôtis, tranchés","1⁄2 citron, zesté et pressé","100 g de feta coupée en morceaux","1⁄2 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","4 petites pitas"]','["Mettez une grande poêle allant au four sur feu moyen-vif et versez-y la passata, les haricots beurre, l''ail, l''origan, les épinards et les poivrons. Mélangez et laissez cuire 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce bouillonne et que les épinards soient fanés. Assaisonnez, puis ajoutez le jus de citron.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Répartissez la feta sur la sauce pour qu''elle soit toujours exposée, arrosez d''huile d''olive et saupoudrez de zeste de citron et d''une pincée d''origan, puis broyez du poivre noir. Griller pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que la feta soit dorée et croustillante sur les bords.","Pendant ce temps, faites griller les pittas sous le grill ou au grille-pain, puis servez avec les haricots et la feta."]','2026-01-11 00:16:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12247,6243,'fr','Fenouil rôti & gratin de pain','Servez ce gratin de fenouil rôti et de levain en accompagnement d''un poulet rôti ou avec quelques feuilles de salade arrosées d''une vinaigrette à la moutarde.','["2 petits bulbes de fenouil, bases parées, bulbes coupés dans le sens de la longueur en quartiers de 1 cm d''épaisseur","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 grosses branches de thym, feuilles cueillies","2 tranches épaisses de levain","100 ml de lait","50 ml de vin blanc","20 g de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, râpé, plus un peu pour servir","150g de crème fraîche ou crème double","râpe de muscade","une poignée d''herbes douces mélangées, hachées grossièrement (le persil et l''estragon fonctionnent bien)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger le fenouil avec l''huile d''olive pour l''enrober sur une plaque allant au four ou dans un plat à gratin, en ajoutant une pincée de gros sel et les feuilles de thym. Rôtir pendant 20 minutes en remuant à mi-cuisson jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et caramélisés.","Pendant ce temps, déchirez le levain en morceaux, versez-le dans un bol et versez dessus le lait et le vin. Annuler. Mélangez le parmesan avec la crème fraîche et assaisonnez avec du sel, du poivre et un peu de muscade râpée.","Une fois le fenouil rôti, sortez-le du four et laissez-le refroidir légèrement. Ajouter le pain trempé au fenouil et mélanger. Versez dessus le mélange de crème fraîche et la moitié des herbes, et remuez pour bien enrober le pain et le fenouil. Râpez un peu de fromage supplémentaire, puis faites cuire encore 25 à 30 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, bouillonnant et croustillant sur les bords. Garnir du reste des herbes."]','2026-01-11 00:16:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12248,6249,'fr','Salade de melon et tomates avec vinaigrette menthe et fleur de sureau','Profitez au maximum des meilleurs produits de l’été en utilisant des melons et des tomates dans cette salade vibrante, arrosée d’une vinaigrette à la menthe et aux fleurs de sureau. Le secret de cette salade consiste à utiliser les ingrédients les plus frais','["400 g de tomates d''un mélange de couleurs et de tailles, si possible","½ Charentais or cantaloupe melon","½ melon Galia","200 g de pastèque en cubes","1½ cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''arachide","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies","¼ cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","½ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop de fleur de sureau","4 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche"]','["Pour faire la vinaigrette, mettez le vinaigre, les huiles, la moitié de la menthe, la moutarde, le sucre et le cordial dans un mixeur, puis assaisonnez et mélangez au mixeur. Ajoutez la crème et vérifiez l''assaisonnement : c''est une vinaigrette aigre-douce, il faut donc trouver le bon équilibre. Vous voudrez peut-être le rendre un peu plus doux en ajoutant un peu plus de crème.","Coupez les petites tomates en deux et coupez les plus grosses en quartiers. Mettre dans un bol de service peu profond.","Retirez les graines des melons charentais ou cantaloup et Galia, coupez-les en quartiers, épluchez et coupez la chair en morceaux. Ajouter au bol avec les tomates, ainsi que la pastèque. Arroser d''un peu de vinaigrette (vous n''en aurez peut-être pas besoin en totalité), parsemer du reste des feuilles de menthe et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12249,6251,'fr','Cupcakes végétaliens à la banane','Préparez ces cupcakes à la banane faciles pour une gâterie l''après-midi. Sans produits laitiers ni œufs, ils sont parfaits pour toute personne suivant un régime végétalien','["2 grosses bananes (environ 225g), noircies et pelées","50 ml d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","65 g de sucre roux clair","150 g de farine nature","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","2 cuillères à café de cannelle","50 g de mélange de fruits secs et de graines","2 cuillères à soupe d''avoine","2 cuillères à soupe de graines mélangées"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Écraser les bananes dans un bol moyen avec une fourchette, puis incorporer l''huile et le sucre jusqu''à homogénéité.","Ajouter la farine, la levure chimique, la cannelle et le mélange de fruits secs et de graines. Mélanger jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Tapisser un plateau à cupcakes de 10 à 12 caissettes à cupcakes (la quantité dont vous avez besoin dépendra de la taille des bananes) et remplissez-les aux ¾ du mélange. Saupoudrer de flocons d''avoine et de graines mélangées.","Cuire au four pendant 25 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu d''un muffin en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:16:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12250,6253,'fr','Burger végétalien','Préparez cette fantastique recette de base pour un burger végétalien et ajoutez-y ce dont vous avez envie : des flocons de piment, du zeste de citron râpé ou d''autres herbes fonctionnent très bien.','["1 échalote ou ½ oignon, haché","1 branche de céleri ou ¼ de poivron rouge, haché","une poignée de feuilles de persil","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et laissés sécher un peu","1-2 cuillères à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de polenta, de couscous ou de chapelure séchée","huile, pour la friture","pains à hamburger ou pain pitta, laitue, tomate et sauces pour servir"]','["Mixez l''échalote, le céleri, le persil et la plupart des pois chiches en une pâte grossière. N’en faites pas trop, vous voulez une texture légèrement plus rugueuse que le houmous. Écrasez les pois chiches restants et incorporez-les à la pâte avec le garam masala, la purée de tomates, la farine et la polenta. Assaisonnez bien.","Façonnez le mélange en quatre galettes. Laissez-les reposer au moins 30 minutes – vous pouvez les laisser toute la nuit au réfrigérateur si vous le souhaitez. La polenta a besoin de temps pour absorber tout liquide supplémentaire.","Faites chauffer un peu d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites cuire les galettes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes de chaque côté. Essayez de ne pas trop les manipuler car ils seront assez mous lorsqu’ils seront chauds. Glissez-le dans des petits pains ou des pitta avec les accompagnements que vous souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12251,6255,'fr','Brochettes de halloumi','Préparez nos brochettes de fromage végétarien sur un barbecue ou une plaque chauffante et ajoutez votre marinade préférée. Nous avons des idées pour trois glaçages savoureux','["500 g de halloumi","le glaçage de votre choix (facultatif)"]','["Coupez le halloumi en gros morceaux et enfilez-le sur trois brochettes. Allumez le barbecue. Badigeonnez les brochettes du glaçage de votre choix et, lorsque les flammes sont éteintes, faites cuire 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté (ou faites cuire dans une poêle à frire à feu vif). Badigeonner du reste de glaçage et cuire encore 1 min de chaque côté."]','2026-01-11 00:16:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12252,6257,'fr','Salade de pommes de terre végétalienne','Préparez une version végétalienne d''une salade de pommes de terre classique en utilisant de la mayonnaise végétalienne. C''est l''accompagnement parfait pour un barbecue, un pique-nique ou des salades en été.','["600 g de pommes de terre nouvelles grelots, les plus grosses coupées en deux","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin blanc","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive extra vierge","120g de mayonnaise végétalienne","1½ cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","1 échalote, ou ½ oignon rouge, haché finement","2 cuillères à café de câpres, hachées si grosses","une petite poignée de persil haché","une petite poignée de ciboulette hachée"]','["Mettez les pommes de terre dans une casserole, salez et couvrez d''eau froide. Portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter 15 à 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur dans une passoire pendant 5 min. Si les peaux sont comme du papier et se décollent, vous pouvez les frotter si vous le souhaitez.","Versez les pommes de terre dans un bol et ajoutez le vinaigre, l''huile d''olive et un peu d''assaisonnement, mélangez bien, puis laissez refroidir.","Incorporer la mayonnaise, la moutarde, l''échalote, les câpres et les herbes (en garder un peu pour garnir). Vérifiez l''assaisonnement et ajoutez un peu plus de sel ou de vinaigre, si vous le souhaitez. Répartir sur le reste des herbes et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12253,6259,'fr','Purée de patate douce','Remplacez la purée ordinaire par une version à base de patates douces, pleine de vitamine C et de fibres. C''est excellent comme garniture pour un pâté chinois ou un pâté au poisson, ou comme accompagnement végétarien.','["500 g de patates douces pelées et coupées en cubes","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre"]','["Faites bouillir les pommes de terre dans de l''eau salée pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres, le temps qu''elles prendront dépendra de la taille des cubes. Bien égoutter et laisser sécher à la vapeur pendant quelques minutes.","Remettez les pommes de terre dans la poêle et écrasez-les avec 1 cuillère à soupe de beurre à l''aide d''une fourchette ou d''un presse-purée, puis assaisonnez bien. Servir avec le beurre supplémentaire et plus d''assaisonnement sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:16:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12254,6261,'fr','Aubergines grillées aux haricots blancs et salsa verde','Servez ces aubergines carbonisées avec des haricots blancs et une garniture de salsa verde comme option végétarienne lors d''un barbecue. Les aubergines carbonisent et blisterent magnifiquement','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour frotter et arroser","1 oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots cannellini, égouttés et rincés","2 brins de thym","200 ml de bouillon de légumes","3 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche ou alternative végétalienne, si nécessaire","citron, zesté, plus des quartiers pour servir","4 aubergines moyennes","50 g d''amandes effilées grillées","un petit bouquet de persil haché grossièrement","40 g de noisettes sans peau","½ petit bouquet de gousse d''ail","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, égouttées","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","7 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu doux et faites revenir l''oignon avec une pincée de sel pendant 10 minutes. Ajoutez l''ail et les flocons de piment et faites revenir encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez les haricots, le thym et le bouillon, portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 15 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les haricots se soient un peu décomposés. Incorporez la crème fraîche et le zeste de citron. Assaisonner au goût.","Pour faire la salsa verde, mettez le persil, les noisettes, l''ail, les câpres, le vinaigre et l''huile dans un pilon et un mortier et écrasez le tout ensemble – cela prendra environ 5 minutes. Vous pouvez également passer au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit homogène mais pas lisse. Transférer dans un bol et assaisonner au goût.","Allumez le barbecue et attendez que les flammes s''éteignent. Coupez les aubergines en deux dans le sens de la longueur et incisez le côté coupé en losanges à l''aide de la pointe d''un couteau. Frotter avec un peu d''huile, puis mettre directement sur le gril et cuire 7 à 10 minutes de chaque côté, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient carbonisés et tendres. Vous pouvez également cuisiner sous un grill (voir conseil ci-dessous). Garnir les aubergines cuites avec le ragoût de haricots et la salsa verde, puis parsemer d''amandes grillées et servir avec les quartiers de citron à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:16:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12255,6263,'fr','Piment végétalien aux trois haricots avec des vestes de pommes de terre','Cette garniture saine aux pommes de terre cuites au four fournit quatre de vos 5 par jour dans chaque portion, ainsi que du fer, de la vitamine C et des fibres, ainsi que beaucoup de saveur provenant des épices des magasins.','["2 pommes de terre au four (environ 180 g chacune)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","1 poivron jaune ou orange, épépiné et haché","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","Boîte de 400 g de salade de trois haricots (cannellini, flageolet et adzuki), égouttée","une poignée de coriandre hachée et des feuilles supplémentaires pour servir","1 petit avocat, dénoyauté, coupé en deux et haché ou écrasé","1 citron vert, coupé en quartiers"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et cuire les pommes de terre pendant 50 minutes-1 heure, ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l’huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir le poivron et l’ail quelques minutes. Incorporer les graines de cumin, les flocons de piment et les épices, puis ajouter les tomates, la poudre de bouillon et les haricots. Porter à ébullition, couvrir et cuire 15 minutes ou jusqu''à réduction en une sauce épaisse. Incorporer la coriandre hachée.","Coupez une croix dans le dessus des pommes de terre cuites et appuyez doucement sur les côtés pour les ouvrir. Verser sur le piment, puis garnir d''avocat et presser quelques quartiers de citron vert. Parsemer de quelques feuilles de coriandre et servir avec les quartiers de citron vert restants."]','2026-01-11 00:16:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12256,6265,'fr','Jambalaya végétalien','Savourez un délicieux dîner à base de plantes avec ce one-pot végétalien au riz et aux haricots. Il contient vos cinq apports quotidiens, ainsi que du fer, de la vitamine C et des fibres.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","1 gros oignon (180 g), finement haché","4 branches de céleri, hachées finement","1 poivron jaune, haché","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","115 g de riz basmati brun","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","400 g de haricots beurre égouttés et rincés","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","une grosse poignée de persil haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu vif et faites revenir l''oignon, le céleri et le poivron, en remuant de temps en temps, pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir et à colorer.","Incorporer les épices et le riz, puis verser les tomates et une canette d''eau. Incorporer l''ail, les haricots et le bouillon. Portez à ébullition, puis couvrez et laissez cuire 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et ait absorbé la majeure partie du liquide. Gardez un œil sur la casserole vers la fin de la cuisson pour vous assurer qu’elle ne bout pas à sec – si elle commence à s’accrocher, ajoutez un peu plus d’eau. Incorporer le persil et servir chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:16:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12257,6269,'fr','Pain de cèpes aux légumes verts d''été','Préparez ce pain aux champignons, au jacquier et aux châtaignes pour un déjeuner végétarien du dimanche. C''est super sain et fournit cinq de vos 5 par jour dans chaque portion','["450 g de pommes de terre à salade, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza pressée à froid, plus un peu pour la boîte","1 citron, zesté et pressé (vous aurez besoin de 2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron)","1 cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","2 poireaux, coupés en rondelles","350 g d''asperges (paquet de 250 g et paquet de 100 g), extrémités parées, coupées en quartiers sur la largeur","320 g de petits pois surgelés","Sachet de 260 g de jeunes feuilles d''épinards","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec bio","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles d''estragon hachées","Boîte de 410 g de jacquier égoutté","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles d''estragon hachées","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","3 œufs","40 g de cèpes séchés","200 g de purée de marrons","40 g de noix de cajou grillées non salées"]','["Chauffer le four à 190°C/170°C chaleur tournante/gaz 5. Huiler et tapisser un moule à cake de 500 g de deux bandes de papier sulfurisé pour qu''il soit entièrement tapissé, avec un surplomb en haut qui peut être replié. Mélangez les pommes de terre avec l''huile et mettez-les dans un petit plat à rôtir.","Pour réaliser le pain, pesez 125 g de jacquier en choisissant les morceaux qui ont la texture la plus « ouverte », puis tranchez-le finement. Versez dans un bol et incorporez l''estragon, l''ail et le paprika.","Versez le reste du jacquier dans un bol avec les œufs et les champignons séchés et mixez avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance très lisse. Ajoutez la purée de marrons, puis mixez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Mélangez 150 g du mélange de champignons avec les tranches de jacquier. Versez la moitié du mélange de champignons séchés restant dans le moule, puis ajoutez le mélange de champignons et de jacquier tranché et recouvrez avec le reste du mélange de champignons séchés. Appuyez et répartissez sur les noix de cajou. Repliez le papier sulfurisé et faites cuire au four à côté des pommes de terre pendant 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient fermes.","Mélangez le zeste de citron avec les pommes de terre. Couvrez le pain et laissez-le reposer pendant que vous faites cuire les légumes.","Versez 150 ml d''eau dans une casserole avec le bouillon et les poireaux. Couvrir et cuire à feu moyen pendant 2 min. Ajoutez les asperges et les petits pois, puis couvrez et laissez cuire encore 2 min. Enfin, ajoutez les épinards et remuez pour les faire flétrir. Ajoutez le jus de citron et le yaourt au mélange de légumes et remuez bien. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, servez la moitié des légumes avec quatre tranches de pain, en réservant les quatre tranches restantes et le reste des légumes pour une autre nuit. Se conserve jusqu''à trois jours, couvert, au réfrigérateur. Pour servir le deuxième soir, réchauffez les restes au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:16:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12258,6271,'fr','Soupe de pois chiches et gremolata en morceaux','Si vous aimez le houmous, vous adorerez cette soupe faible en calories et sans gluten qui fournit un incroyable quatre de vos 5 par jour dans chaque portion.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","3 oignons hachés (environ 340 g)","3 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches, ne pas égoutter le liquide","3 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","4 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","1 aubergine finement coupée en cubes (350g)","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","210 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en quartiers","1 citron, zesté et à moitié pressé","15 g de persil finement haché","3 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de menthe hachées","paprika fumé, pour saupoudrer"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir les oignons pendant 10 minutes pour les ramollir. Versez les 3 boîtes de pois chiches dans la poêle et incorporez 2 gousses d''ail râpées, le piment, la coriandre et le cumin ainsi que la poudre de bouillon, l''aubergine et 1½ boîte d''eau. Couvrir et laisser mijoter pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''aubergine soit tendre, puis retirer du feu, ajouter le tahini et mixer avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la gremolata. Versez la petite boîte de pois chiches dans un bol, ajoutez les tomates, le zeste et le jus de citron, le persil et la menthe avec le reste de l''huile et de l''ail.","Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, versez la moitié de la soupe dans deux bols ou grands flacons et garnissez ou emballez la moitié de la gremolata et une pincée de paprika. Refroidissez et réfrigérez le reste de la soupe pour un autre jour selon le plan. Réchauffez la soupe dans une poêle ou au micro-ondes pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12259,6273,'fr','Crostini aux fèves et feta aux herbes et aux asperges','Profitez au maximum des fèves de saison pendant les mois d’été et préparez ces crostini vibrants aux haricots et à la feta. Idéal en entrée, garnir simplement d''asperges','["160 g de fèves","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","50 g de feta émiettée","1 cuillère à café de miel","un filet de jus de citron","une grosse poignée de feuilles d''aneth","4 tranches de baguette","1 gousse d''ail, coupée en deux","4 pointes d''asperges blanchies"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau salée et faites cuire les fèves pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Plongez immédiatement dans un bol d’eau glacée. Pressez les fèves de leurs gousses et transférez-les dans le bol d''un robot culinaire avec l''huile d''olive, la feta, le miel, le jus de citron et les feuilles d''aneth. Assaisonner avec du poivre noir et réduire en purée lisse.","Pendant ce temps, badigeonnez les tranches de baguette d''un peu d''huile d''olive et faites-les griller ou griller jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Frotter avec le côté coupé d''une gousse d''ail coupée en deux. Hachez finement les pointes d''asperges blanchies et mélangez-les à un peu d''huile d''olive avec un filet de jus de citron. Répartir la purée sur les crostini et garnir de tranches d''asperges et d''un peu d''aneth supplémentaire. Les restes de purée se conservent au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:16:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12260,6275,'fr','Trempette à l''avocat et aux haricots cannellini','Battez la sensation de faim avec cette trempette végétalienne à l’avocat et aux haricots cannellini. Servir avec des crudités et des crackers comme collation, déjeuner léger ou dans le cadre d''un pique-nique','["1 petit avocat","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment, plus un peu pour servir","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 citron, zesté et pressé","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''avocat, plus un peu pour arroser","mélange de graines, craquelins ou crudités, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Versez la chair de l''avocat dans un mixeur ou un petit robot culinaire. Ajouter les haricots, l''ail, les épices, le zeste et le jus de citron et l''huile. Mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement lisse, en relâchant avec 50 à 100 ml d''eau, si nécessaire. Saison.","Verser dans un bol et garnir de flocons de piment supplémentaires et d''huile d''avocat. Servir avec les graines éparpillées et des craquelins ou des crudités, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12261,6277,'fr','Épinards au curry, œufs et pois chiches','Faites le plein de nutriments avec ce souper végétarien à base d''épinards, d''œufs et de pois chiches. C''est sain, faible en calories, plein de saveur et fournit quatre de vos cinq par jour','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon, tranché finement","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","3 cm de gingembre pelé et râpé","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","450 g de tomates hachées","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","1 cuillère à café de sucre","200g d''épinards","2 gros œufs","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature","1 piment rouge, finement tranché","½ petit bouquet de coriandre déchirée"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle ou une cocotte anti-flamme à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et collant. Ajoutez l''ail, le gingembre, le curcuma, la coriandre moulue, le garam masala, le cumin et les tomates, et faites revenir encore 2 minutes. Ajoutez les pois chiches, 100 ml d''eau et le sucre et portez à ébullition. Incorporez les épinards, puis couvrez et laissez cuire 20 à 25 minutes. Assaisonner au goût.","Faites cuire les œufs dans une casserole d''eau bouillante pendant 7 minutes, puis rincez-les sous l''eau froide pour les refroidir. Égoutter, peler et couper en deux. Incorporez le yaourt au curry, puis garnissez avec les œufs, le piment et la coriandre. Saison."]','2026-01-11 00:16:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12262,6279,'fr','Salade de riz au curry et aux œufs','Dégustez cette salade de riz et d''œufs légèrement épicée comme plat d''accompagnement lors d''un barbecue ou d''un pique-nique d''été. Garnir d''amandes grillées, de carottes râpées et de tranches de concombre','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive ou de colza","1 oignon, haché","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry douce (nous avons utilisé de la pâte de korma)","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","300 g de riz basmati","50g de raisins secs","1 cube de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes","3 œufs","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies","30 g d''amandes effilées, grillées","2 carottes, râpées ou finement râpées","½ concombre, tranché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et doré. Faites bouillir la bouilloire. Incorporer la pâte de curry, le curcuma moulu, le riz et les raisins secs aux oignons. Émiettez le cube de bouillon et versez dessus suffisamment d''eau bouillie de la bouilloire pour recouvrir le riz de ½ cm (environ 1 litre). Assaisonner avec un peu de sel. Portez à légère ébullition, puis couvrez la casserole, réduisez le feu au minimum et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Sans retirer le couvercle, retirez du feu et laissez cuire à la vapeur 15 min. Cela vous donnera un riz parfait et moelleux.","Pendant ce temps, portez à ébullition une autre casserole d''eau et faites cuire les œufs pendant 7 minutes. Plongez-les dans un bol d''eau froide pour arrêter la cuisson et une fois refroidis, égouttez-les et coupez-les en deux.","Versez le riz dans un récipient et réfrigérez pendant au moins 1 heure ou jusqu''à deux jours. Au moment de servir, parsemez de coriandre et d’amandes, et garnissez de carottes râpées, de tranches de concombre et d’œufs."]','2026-01-11 00:16:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12263,6283,'fr','Sandwichs à la mayonnaise sans œufs','Utilisez du tofu comme substitut à l''œuf avec de la mayonnaise sans produits laitiers pour préparer ces sandwichs végétaliens. Ils sont idéaux pour une fête d’enfants où certains enfants peuvent avoir une intolérance ou une allergie','["Bloc de 400 g de tofu mi-ferme dans l''eau","6 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise végétalienne","½ cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de levure nutritionnelle","2 cuillères à café de ciboulette finement hachée","1 gros sandwich blanc ou pain complet (10-12 tranches), ou 12 mini petits pains (utiliser du pain sans gluten si nécessaire)","1 cresson barquette (facultatif)"]','["Retirez le tofu du paquet et essorez l''excès d''eau, soit entre des feuilles de papier absorbant ou un torchon propre, lesté d''une assiette pendant environ 30 minutes.","Mélangez la mayonnaise, la moutarde, le curcuma et la levure nutritionnelle avec un peu de sel et de poivre.","Émiettez le tofu dans un bol en laissant de gros morceaux pour créer une texture d''œuf haché. Incorporer délicatement la ciboulette. Si vous le voulez plus lâche, vous pouvez ajouter plus de mayonnaise.","Étalez le mélange sur le pain pour faire quatre ou cinq tours de sandwichs (selon la quantité de garniture souhaitée), puis ajoutez du cresson, si vous le souhaitez. Utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour couper en triangles."]','2026-01-11 00:16:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12264,6285,'fr','Nuggets végétaliens','Préparez un lot de nuggets végétaliens, remplis de haricots cannellini, de chou-fleur et de carottes. Ils constituent d''excellents plats de fête pour les enfants que tout le monde peut apprécier ou servir de collation après l''école.','["300 g de fleurons de chou-fleur (ou ¾ de petit chou-fleur)","2 carottes hachées (environ 165g)","½ oignon moyen, haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à soupe de levure nutritionnelle","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de levure","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés","50 g de farine (pois chiches)","huile d''olive, pour la plaque à pâtisserie","100 g de farine, plus un peu plus","100 g de chapelure (utiliser du sans gluten si nécessaire)"]','["Mixez le chou-fleur, les carottes et l''oignon dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient hachés très finement, comme du riz. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir doucement le mélange pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il ramollisse. Ajoutez l''ail et faites revenir encore 1 minute, puis retirez du feu et incorporez la levure nutritionnelle et l''extrait de levure. Annuler.","Mélangez les haricots en purée pâteuse dans un robot culinaire, puis ajoutez-les au mélange de légumes et mélangez bien. Incorporer la farine et assaisonner. Mettre au réfrigérateur pour raffermir pendant 1 h.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé et badigeonner d''un peu d''huile d''olive. Pour réaliser l''enrobage, mélangez la farine de gramme avec 150 ml d''eau à l''aide d''une fourchette pour qu''elle ressemble à un œuf battu, puis assaisonnez. Répartissez le surplus de farine de pois chiches dans une assiette et remplissez-en une seconde avec la chapelure.","Roulez le mélange de haricots en morceaux de la taille d''une noix, puis aplatissez-les pour former des pépites. Trempez les morceaux d''abord dans la farine de gramme, puis dans la pâte à gramme, et enfin roulez-les dans la chapelure – manipulez-les avec précaution car ils seront un peu mous. Lorsque les nuggets sont entièrement enrobés, disposez-les sur le plateau préparé.","Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, puis utiliser des pinces pour retourner chaque nugget et cuire encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes. Laisser refroidir 20 minutes avant de servir avec les trempettes de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:16:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12265,6287,'fr','Asperges aux petits pois, menthe et Jersey Royals au beurre d''ail des ours','Enrober les asperges, les petits pois et les Jersey Royals dans un beurre à la menthe et à l''ail des ours, puis garnir d''amandes grillées – le partenaire idéal des viandes rôties et des tartes salées.','["300 g de pommes de terre Jersey Royal","une poignée d''amandes effilées","75g de beurre ramolli","une petite poignée de feuilles d''ail des ours hachées très finement (ou 1 gousse d''ail écrasée)","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de menthe","250 g de petits pois fraîchement écossés","un filet d''huile d''olive, pour la friture","½ citron, zesté et pressé"]','["Portez une grande casserole d''eau à ébullition et faites cuire les pommes de terre pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Vidange.","Faire griller les amandes effilées dans une poêle à sec jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Annuler.","Mélangez le beurre, les feuilles d’ail des ours et la menthe (vous pouvez passer au robot culinaire, si vous le souhaitez). Annuler.","Couvrez les petits pois d''eau bouillante pendant 30 secondes, puis égouttez-les et plongez-les immédiatement dans l''eau froide.","Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande casserole à couvercle à feu moyen. Ajoutez les pointes d''asperges et une bonne pincée de sel marin et secouez pour les enrober d''huile. Mettez le couvercle et faites cuire les asperges à feu doux à moyen en secouant la poêle pour déplacer les pointes, environ 4 minutes. Retirez les lances de la poêle et plongez-les immédiatement dans l''eau glacée.","Faites fondre le beurre d''ail dans la poêle et pressez-y le jus du citron. Incorporer les pommes de terre, les asperges et les petits pois au beurre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient chauds. Versez le tout sur un plat de service et râpez dessus un peu de zeste de citron. Garnir d''amandes grillées."]','2026-01-11 00:16:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12266,6289,'fr','Aubergines rôties avec tarator aux amandes, feta, aneth et piment vert','Rôtissez quelques aubergines et garnissez de tarator – une sauce aux noisettes et à l''ail qui se marie parfaitement avec l''aubergine. A déguster en entrée ou en accompagnement','["4 aubergines","100 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge, plus un peu pour badigeonner et arroser","125 g de feta émiettée","175 g de yaourt grec","1-2 piments verts (selon le piquant que vous aimez), coupés en deux, épépinés et tranchés très finement","petit bouquet d''aneth, haché grossièrement","30 g de pain de campagne blanc grossièrement déchiré","4 cuillères à soupe de lait","50 g d''amandes blanchies","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","½ citron, jus"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Badigeonner les aubergines d''un peu d''huile et les disposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Percez chacune plusieurs fois avec une fourchette, puis faites rôtir au four pendant 45 min – 1 h (cela dépend de la taille des aubergines), jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient complètement tendres.","Pendant ce temps, réalisez le tarator. Mettez le pain dans un bol et laissez-le tremper dans le lait pendant environ 30 minutes. Versez dans un robot culinaire avec les noix, l''ail et le jus de citron et mélangez en ajoutant progressivement 85 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge. Assaisonnez et ajoutez un peu d’eau si vous souhaitez que le mélange soit plus fluide (il ne doit pas être épais mais il ne doit pas non plus être aussi fluide qu’une crème liquide).","Écrasez très grossièrement la feta avec le yaourt dans un bol. Fendez les aubergines sur toute leur longueur et assaisonnez l''intérieur. Disposez-les dans des assiettes individuelles ou dans une assiette de service plus grande et versez un peu du reste d''huile à l''intérieur de chacune. Verser sur le mélange de feta et de yaourt, puis garnir avec le tarator (le tarator peut éclabousser les côtés des aubergines), les piments tranchés et l''aneth.","Arroser d''un peu d''huile d''olive extra vierge sur chaque aubergine et servir avec des pains plats s''il s''agit d''une entrée, ou tels quels s''il s''agit d''un plat d''accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:16:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12267,6291,'fr','Gratin de légumes verts au fromage','Rehaussez le fromage de chou-fleur avec du brocoli vert et des épinards, ainsi qu''une sauce au cheddar et à la ciboulette. Assurez-vous également d''utiliser les feuilles de chou-fleur pour plus de saveur.','["1 chou-fleur (450 g), cassé en fleurons, feuilles réservées","200 g de brocoli à germes violets","200g d''épinards","70g de beurre doux","70 g de farine nature","900 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise","150 g de cheddar affiné","½ bouquet de ciboulette finement hachée"]','["Portez à ébullition une casserole d''eau légèrement salée et faites cuire les fleurons de chou-fleur pendant 3 min. Ajoutez le brocoli et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Égoutter dans une passoire et laisser sécher à la vapeur.","Versez les épinards dans une grande casserole, ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et faites cuire avec le couvercle à feu doux pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés, puis versez-les dans une passoire et essorez-en l''excès d''humidité avec le dos d''une cuillère en bois. Annuler.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Faire fondre le beurre dans une casserole à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il mousse, puis incorporer la farine pour créer une pâte épaisse. Cuire 2 minutes, retirer la casserole du feu et incorporer le lait en plusieurs fois jusqu''à ce qu''il soit sans grumeaux. Remettre sur le feu et fouetter jusqu''à épaississement. Incorporer la moutarde, la majeure partie du fromage et la ciboulette. Assaisonner au goût.","Disposez les légumes, y compris les feuilles de chou-fleur, dans un plat moyen allant au four. Versez dessus la sauce, puis saupoudrez du reste de fromage. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bouillonnants."]','2026-01-11 00:16:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12268,6293,'fr','Moussaka végétalienne','Préparez cette moussaka alléchante et saine avec un simple ragoût à base de plantes. C''est un dîner facile pour la famille qui contient vos cinq repas par jour','["30 g de cèpes séchés","8 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","2 carottes, hachées finement","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées","quelques pousses de thym","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates","100 ml de vin rouge végétalien (facultatif)","250 g de lentilles vertes séchées","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates italiennes entières","250 g de champignons de Paris hachés","250 g de champignons portobello tranchés","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja","1 cuillère à café de Marmite","1 kg de pomme de terre farineuse (type Maris Piper), pelée et hachée","1 ½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","3 aubergines, tranchées dans le sens de la longueur","150 ml de lait de soja"]','["Versez 800 ml d''eau bouillante sur les cèpes séchés et laissez reposer 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient hydratés. Pendant ce temps, versez 1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez l''oignon, la carotte, le céleri et une pincée de sel. Cuire doucement en remuant pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Retirez les cèpes du liquide en gardant le bouillon de champignons et hachez-les grossièrement. Mettez les deux de côté.","Ajouter l''ail et le thym dans la poêle. Cuire 1 min, puis incorporer le concentré de tomates et cuire encore une minute. Versez le vin rouge, si vous en utilisez, faites cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque réduit, puis ajoutez les lentilles, le bouillon de champignons réservé et les tomates. Portez à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter avec le couvercle.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une grande poêle. Ajoutez 1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile et versez tous les champignons dans la poêle, y compris ceux réhydratés. Faites frire jusqu''à ce que toute l''eau soit évaporée et que les champignons soient bien dorés. Versez la sauce soja. Mélangez bien le tout, puis grattez les champignons dans la casserole de lentilles.","Incorporez la Marmite, puis poursuivez la cuisson du ragoût, en remuant de temps en temps, à feu doux-moyen pendant 30 à 45 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient cuites et que la sauce soit épaisse et réduite, en ajoutant de l''eau supplémentaire si nécessaire. Retirez les brins de thym et assaisonnez selon votre goût.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Mettre les pommes de terre dans une casserole d''eau froide salée. Porter à ébullition, puis cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit écrasé.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les 5 cuillères à soupe d''huile restantes avec l''origan, puis badigeonnez les tranches d''aubergines avec la majeure partie et saupoudrez de sel marin. Faire griller pendant 3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre.","Égouttez et écrasez les pommes de terre avec le lait de soja. Assaisonner au goût.","Versez le ragoût dans un grand plat à lasagnes (ou deux petits plats allant au four), déposez-y la moitié de l''aubergine, suivi de la purée. Badigeonnez la purée du reste d''huile d''origan, puis terminez en recouvrant du reste des tranches d''aubergine. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bouillonnants."]','2026-01-11 00:16:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12269,6295,'fr','Soupe Supergreen au yaourt et pignons de pin','Une soupe simple et faible en gras qui constitue une nouvelle façon d''utiliser un sac de feuilles mélangées : elle est également riche en vitamine C, en fibres, en acide folique et en calcium.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 pomme de terre (environ 250 g), coupée en petits cubes","600 ml de bouillon de légumes","Sachet de 120 g de salade composée de cresson, roquette et épinards","Pot de 150 g de yaourt nature","20 g de pignons de pin grillés","huile de piment, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole moyenne à feu moyen-doux. Ajoutez l''oignon et une pincée de sel, puis faites cuire lentement, en remuant de temps en temps, pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis mais pas colorés. Ajouter l''ail et cuire encore 1 min.","Versez la pomme de terre suivie du bouillon de légumes. Laisser mijoter pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pomme de terre soit suffisamment tendre pour qu''un couteau puisse y glisser facilement. Ajoutez le sachet de salade et laissez-le ramollir 1 min, puis passez la soupe au mixeur jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit parfaitement lisse.","Servir avec une cuillerée de yaourt, quelques pignons de pin grillés et un filet d''huile de piment, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12270,6297,'fr','Chou pointu au vin blanc aux graines de fenouil','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Pour une version rapide de la choucroute, essayez le chou mijoté dans du vin blanc, avec de l''oignon et des herbes. L''acidité de cet accompagnement se marie à merveille avec l''onctuosité du rôti de porc.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","1 gros oignon, tranché","1 gros chou pointu, cœur retiré, râpé","250 ml de vin blanc sec","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Dans une grande casserole, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive, ajoutez les graines de fenouil et faites griller 1 min pour libérer les arômes. Incorporer l''oignon et cuire doucement pendant 2 minutes, puis incorporer le chou pour l''enrober d''huile et de fenouil.","Versez le vin blanc et le vinaigre, laissez réduire de moitié environ pendant 5 min, puis laissez mijoter sur le feu encore 5 min jusqu''à ce que le chou soit cuit et que la sauce épaississe légèrement. Incorporer la coriandre et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12271,6299,'fr','Chou-fleur entier rôti au vin rouge, échalotes et baies de blé','Pour les végétariens, le chou-fleur est la royauté des légumes. Ce plat capture tout ce qui est juste dans le mariage des céréales et des légumes','["1 grosse tête de chou-fleur, feuilles extérieures enlevées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde","3 grosses échalotes bananes, coupées en quartiers","4 champignons portobello, tranchés","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de thym","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","150 ml de vin rouge","100 g de jeunes feuilles d''épinards","350 g de baies de blé","1l de bouillon de légumes chaud","50 g de noisettes (avec la peau), hachées grossièrement","½ cuillère à café de poivre rose concassé","50 g de parmesan végétarien finement râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Posez la tête de chou-fleur à l''envers sur une planche à découper et coupez la tige dure. Laissez un peu de base pour que le chou-fleur reste intact.","Faites chauffer l’huile dans une grande cocotte ignifuge à feu doux-moyen. Ajoutez les graines de moutarde et, une fois qu’elles commencent à « éclater », ajoutez les échalotes. Faites revenir doucement pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à caraméliser, puis ajoutez les champignons, le thym et l''ail et laissez cuire encore 4 à 5 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Versez le vin et laissez réduire de moitié. Incorporer les épinards et laisser les feuilles se flétrir.","Ajoutez ensuite les baies, assaisonnez bien et mélangez. Faites un puits au centre et mettez le chou-fleur au milieu. Versez le bouillon autour – pas dessus – du chou-fleur, puis assaisonnez.","Couvrir et transférer au four. Cuire pendant 50 minutes à 1 heure jusqu''à ce que le chou-fleur et les baies de blé soient tendres. Retirer du four et saupoudrer les noisettes, les grains de poivre et le parmesan sur le chou-fleur. Remettre au four encore 5 minutes, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12272,6301,'fr','Curry vert thaï léger','Cette version végétarienne légère de votre curry vert thaïlandais préféré est un incroyable 5 de vos 5 par jour ! Des légumes réchauffants au chili et à la noix de coco crémeuse pour un souper satisfaisant','["25 g de flocons d''avoine, trempés dans 200 ml d''eau froide pendant 20 minutes","1 ½ cuillère à soupe de crème de noix de coco, râpée","1 cuillère à café d''huile de coco ou d''huile de tournesol","2 carottes, tranchées","1 panais, coupé en petits morceaux","1 petite patate douce, coupée en petits morceaux","¼ cuillère à café de Marmite","2 feuilles de combava (séchées ou fraîches)","6 tiges de brocoli à germes violets, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","50 g de petits pois surgelés","1 citron vert, coupé en 6 quartiers","1 poivron vert, haché","½ petit paquet de coriandre","1 gousse d''ail, pelée","2 cm de morceau de gingembre pelé","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","2 oignons nouveaux, hachés grossièrement","1 piment vert","riz brun","½ petit paquet de coriandre (facultatif)"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez la pâte. Mettez tous les ingrédients dans le petit bol d''un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement hachés. Transférer dans un petit bol et réfrigérer.","Mettez les flocons d''avoine et leur eau de trempage dans le robot culinaire (pas besoin de le nettoyer au préalable) et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient aussi lisses que possible. Passez-le au tamis pour éliminer les restes d''avoine, puis ajoutez la crème de noix de coco et réservez.","Mettez une grande poêle antiadhésive ou un wok sur feu vif. Ajouter l''huile de coco suivi de la carotte, du panais et de la patate douce. Faites sauter pendant environ 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à se colorer sur les bords, puis ajoutez la pâte de curry et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce que le curry n''ait plus l''air liquide. Versez le mélange lait d''avoine et coco, la marmite, les feuilles de tilleul et 300 ml d''eau et portez à ébullition. Couvrir et cuire 15 minutes, puis ajouter le brocoli avec 50 ml d''eau et cuire encore 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Enfin, ajoutez les petits pois surgelés pendant 1 minute supplémentaire ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien chauds. Retirez la casserole du feu, puis pressez le jus de 2 quartiers de citron vert.","Servir immédiatement avec du riz brun, les quartiers de citron vert restants et quelques feuilles de coriandre, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12273,6303,'fr','Frittata masala avec salsa d''avocat','Une version épicée d''une recette simple de frittata, avec de la pâte Masala, de la coriandre et des tomates cerises dodues. Associez-le à notre salsa d''avocat pour un souper léger et économique','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","3 oignons, 2 ½ tranchés finement, ½ finement hachés","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry Madras","500 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","petit paquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","8 gros œufs battus","1 avocat dénoyauté, pelé et coupé en cubes","jus d''1 citron"]','["Faites chauffer l’huile dans une poêle antiadhésive moyenne allant au four. Ajoutez les oignons émincés et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés. Ajoutez la pâte de Madras et faites revenir encore 1 min, puis versez la moitié des tomates et la moitié du piment. Cuire jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit épais et que les tomates aient toutes éclaté.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Ajoutez la moitié de la coriandre aux œufs et assaisonnez, puis versez sur le mélange épicé d''oignons. Remuer doucement une ou deux fois, puis cuire à feu doux pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque pris. Transférer sur le gril pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris.","Pour faire la salsa, mélangez l''avocat, le reste du piment et les tomates, l''oignon haché, le reste de la coriandre et le jus de citron, puis assaisonnez et servez avec la frittata."]','2026-01-11 00:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12274,6305,'fr','Aubergine Parmigiana plus légère','Nous avons cuit les aubergines et utilisé de la ricotta crémeuse dans cette version saine de Parmigiana di melanzane – bien moins riche en matières grasses et en calories que l''originale.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza, plus 1 cuillère à café","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","3 aubergines (750 g/1 lb 10 oz poids total), extrémités des tiges parées, coupées en tranches de 1 cm/½ dans le sens de la longueur","1 petit oignon, haché","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","400 g de tomates italiennes en boîte","Boîte de 225 g de tomates italiennes","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe d''origan frais haché","100 g de gazon","50 g de mozzarella coupée en petits morceaux","une poignée de feuilles de basilic grossièrement déchirées","2 tomates moyennes, tranchées","25 g de parmesan végétarien, râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Mesurez les 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans un petit bol. Badigeonnez-en un peu sur 2 grandes plaques à pâtisserie antiadhésives (si vous n''avez qu''une seule plaque, faites cuire les aubergines par lots). Mélangez le jus de citron dans l''huile mesurée. Disposez les tranches d''aubergines en une seule couche sur les plaques à pâtisserie, badigeonnez le dessus avec la moitié de l''huile et du citron, assaisonnez de poivre et enfournez pour 20 minutes. Retournez les tranches, remuez bien le reste du mélange d''huile et de citron car il se sera séparé et badigeonnez-le à nouveau. Assaisonner de poivre et cuire au four encore 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile restante dans une casserole moyenne. Ajoutez l''oignon et l''ail et faites revenir pendant 3-4 minutes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit ramolli et commence à dorer. Versez les boîtes de tomates, remuez pour les briser, puis incorporez la purée, le poivre et une pincée de sel. Laisser mijoter à découvert pendant environ 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à épaississement et sauce, puis incorporer l''origan.","Étalez un peu de sauce tomate au fond d''un plat peu profond allant au four (environ 25 x 20 x 5 cm). Commencez par disposer un tiers des tranches d''aubergines dans le sens de la largeur du plat, répartissez sur un tiers du reste de sauce et mettez dessus la moitié de la ricotta par petites cuillerées, puis la moitié de la mozzarella. Répartir sur la moitié du basilic déchiré et bien assaisonner de poivre. Répétez la superposition des tranches d''aubergine, de la sauce tomate, de la ricotta, de la mozzarella et du basilic, et terminez avec les dernières tranches d''aubergine, les tranches de tomates et le reste de la sauce. Assaisonner de poivre et parsemer de parmesan. Cuire au four environ 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit doré et que le jus bouillonne."]','2026-01-11 00:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12275,6307,'fr','Soupe épicée aux haricots et au piment','Il y a peu de temps de préparation pour préparer ce ragoût végétarien copieux, qui fonctionne aussi bien qu''un dîner facile ou emballé dans une fiole pour le déjeuner.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","Boîte de 400 g de haricots mélangés, égouttés et rincés","1 poivron rouge, coupé en gros dés","chips tortilla, pour servir","4 quartiers de citron vert, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole profonde et faites revenir l''oignon émincé à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter l''ail et la purée de tomates en remuant pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Saupoudrer d''épices et cuire encore 1 min.","Versez les tomates concassées, remplissez à moitié la boîte d’eau et ajoutez-les à la poêle. Versez le bouillon et laissez mijoter à feu moyen pendant 10 à 15 minutes, à découvert. Assaisonner, puis mixer à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Ajoutez les haricots et le poivron rouge et laissez cuire encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poivron soit tendre.","Servir dans des bols garnis d''un petit tas de chips tortilla et d''un quartier de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12276,6309,'fr','Moelle rôtie à l''érable sur salade cavolo nero','Arroser la moelle de sirop d''érable et d''ail, puis garnir de noisettes croquantes et de chapelure pour un plat végétarien à la fois réconfortant et sain.','["1 moelle moyenne","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable","3 cuillères à soupe de noisettes coupées en deux","2 tranches de pain au levain grillées, réduites en miettes","200 g de cavolo nero, tiges retirées, râpées","10 radis, coupés en quartiers","16 copeaux de parmesan végétarien","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 échalote, hachée finement","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","pincée de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Couper la moelle dans le sens de la longueur et retirer les graines. Coupez la moelle en tranches et disposez-la sur une plaque allant au four. Mélanger avec l''huile d''olive, l''ail, le sirop d''érable et un peu d''assaisonnement. Faire rôtir 20 min, puis parsemer de noisettes et de chapelure. Rôtir encore 8 minutes, puis retirer.","Pendant que la moelle rôtit, préparez le reste de la salade. Râpez les feuilles de cavolo nero en bouchées. Mettre sur une grande assiette ou un bol peu profond et garnir de radis.","Mélangez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un petit bol en ajoutant un peu de sel. Bien mélanger.","Juste avant la fin de la cuisson de la moelle, versez la vinaigrette sur le cavolo nero. Utilisez vos mains pour masser le cavolo nero pendant quelques minutes afin qu''il le ramollisse, puis recouvrez de moelle, de chapelure et de noisettes. Saupoudrez de copeaux de parmesan et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12277,6311,'fr','Tajine d''aubergines fumées au citron et abricots','Un tajine parfumé est parfait pour les réceptions estivales, plus léger qu''un ragoût mais tout aussi satisfaisant avec des aubergines charnues et des épices aromatiques.','["2 aubergines coupées en gros morceaux","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, hachés","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre fraîchement râpé","1½ cuillère à café de cuillère à café","1½ cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","une bonne pincée de safran","300 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet chaud","2 citrons confits, le zeste des deux tranchés, la pulpe du centre de 1 citron grossièrement hachée","120 g d''abricots secs coupés en deux","200 g de tomates hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","le zeste d''1 citron, le jus ½","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame grillées","2 cuillères à soupe de persil plat finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe finement hachée","Yaourt grec, pour servir (facultatif)","blé boulghar complet, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites revenir les aubergines dans 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile pour qu''elles soient dorées de tous les côtés, mais pas encore tendres au milieu – il est préférable de le faire par lots dans une grande poêle antiadhésive.","Faites chauffer une poêle à fond épais avec un couvercle peu profond ou un tajine ignifuge avec le reste de l''huile, puis ajoutez les oignons, le gingembre et les épices et faites-les revenir doucement jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et dorés.","Pendant ce temps, ajoutez le safran au bouillon pour le faire tremper. Incorporer le zeste et la pulpe de citron confit, les abricots, les tomates, le miel et le jus de citron aux oignons avec le bouillon de safran. Insérez bien les aubergines, couvrez avec un couvercle et laissez mijoter 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les aubergines soient tendres. Assaisonner au goût.","Mélangez le zeste de citron, les graines de sésame et les herbes hachées et saupoudrez sur le tajine. Servir avec du yaourt grec et du boulghar complet, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:16:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12278,6313,'fr','Risotto d''orge perlé, panais et sauge','L''orge perlé constitue une excellente alternative au riz dans cette recette de risotto végétarien parfumé à la sauge, à l''ail et au parmesan.','["25 g de beurre, plus une noix supplémentaire pour remuer","1 oignon, finement haché","4 panais d''environ 500 g, pelés et coupés en morceaux","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","10 feuilles de sauge, râpées, plus un peu pour servir","400 g d''orge perlé, rincé","1,4 l de bouillon de légumes chaud","25 g de parmesan râpé, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer le beurre dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez l''oignon et une pincée de sel et faites cuire doucement pendant 5 min. Ajoutez les panais, augmentez le feu et laissez cuire 8 à 10 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les panais commencent à dorer et à caraméliser.","Ajouter l''ail et la sauge et mélanger. Versez l’orge et remuez pour bien enrober. Versez le bouillon, portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 35 à 40 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que presque tout le liquide ait été absorbé et que l''orge perlé soit tendre mais encore croquante. Vous devrez peut-être ajouter un peu d''eau bouillante supplémentaire.","Hors du feu, garnissez de parmesan et d''une noix de beurre, puis laissez fondre. Remuez bien le risotto, puis versez-le dans les plats. Garnir de sauge, de parmesan et d''un peu de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12279,6315,'fr','Feta poêlée avec salsa de betterave rouge et purée de haricots','Préparez ce dîner végétarien économique en quelques minutes : empilez des tranches de feta légère sur une purée de haricots cannellini et garnissez de salsa de betterave piquante.','["environ 100 g de feta végétarienne légère, tranchée épaisse","un peu de farine, pour saupoudrer","Conditionnement en paquet de 65 g","250 g de betterave cuite coupée en dés","½ oignon rouge, finement haché","le zeste et le jus râpés d''un demi citron vert","2 cuillères à soupe d''aneth haché, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la cuisson","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","400 g de haricots cannellini"]','["Mélangez la betterave et l''oignon dans un bol avec le zeste de citron vert, un bon filet de jus, l''assaisonnement et l''aneth.","Faites chauffer la cuillère à café d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir doucement l''ail jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli, puis versez-y les haricots et un peu du jus de la boîte avec l''assaisonnement. Écrasez les haricots en les gardant bien gros, puis réservez au chaud.","Mélangez les tranches de feta dans un peu de farine. Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive, essuyez avec un peu d''huile puis faites cuire la feta quelques minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et bien chaude, en la retournant pour s''assurer qu''elle est cuite uniformément. Verser la purée de haricots dans des assiettes, garnir de feta et de la moitié de la salsa, puis parsemer d''aneth supplémentaire. Servir avec la roquette à part et le reste de la salsa dans un bol."]','2026-01-11 00:16:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12280,6317,'fr','Wraps épicés à l''avocat','Poêler des morceaux végétariens de style poulet avec du citron vert, du piment et de l''ail, puis les empiler sur des tortillas aux graines – laisser refroidir avant de les assembler si vous les préparez pour le déjeuner.','["½ paquet de 300 g de morceaux de poulet Quorn (ou produit végétarien similaire), tranchés en biais","jus pressé généreusement ½ citron vert","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","2 wraps aux graines","1 avocat, coupé en deux et dénoyauté","1 poivron rouge rôti, en pot","quelques brins de coriandre hachée"]','["Mélangez les morceaux végétariens façon poulet avec le jus de citron vert, la poudre de piment et l''ail.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive puis faites frire les morceaux pendant quelques minutes, pendant que vous réchauffez les wraps en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage ou si vous avez une cuisinière à gaz, faites-les chauffer sur le feu pour les carboniser légèrement. Ne les laissez pas sécher car ils seront difficiles à rouler.","Écrasez un demi-avocat sur chaque wrap, ajoutez les poivrons dans la poêle pour les réchauffer, puis empilez-les sur les wraps avec les morceaux de poulet et saupoudrez de coriandre. Roulez, coupez en deux et mangez avec les doigts."]','2026-01-11 00:16:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12281,6319,'fr','Soupe de courgettes, petits pois et pesto','Savourez cette soupe super saine lorsque vous souhaitez un déjeuner réconfortant mais faible en calories – riche en fibres, en vitamine C et en acide folique','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","500 g de courgettes coupées en quartiers dans la longueur et hachées","200 g de petits pois surgelés","400 g de haricots cannellini en boîte, égouttés et rincés","1l de bouillon de légumes chaud","2 cuillères à soupe de pesto de basilic ou une alternative végétarienne"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole. Faites cuire l''ail quelques secondes, puis ajoutez les courgettes et laissez cuire 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Incorporez les petits pois et les haricots cannellini, versez le bouillon chaud et laissez cuire encore 3 minutes.","Incorporez le pesto à la soupe avec un peu d''assaisonnement, puis versez dans des bols et servez avec du pain brun croustillant, si vous le souhaitez. Ou insérez une flasque à emporter au travail."]','2026-01-11 00:16:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12282,6321,'fr','Pad Thaï au tofu et aux asperges','Une alternative végétarienne et super saine au toujours populaire pad thaï','["200 g de nouilles de riz plates","2 citrons verts, 1 en jus, un coupé en quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de tamarin ou de jus de citron vert supplémentaire","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce, plus un peu pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale ou d''huile de tournesol","300 g de tofu ferme, égoutté, épongé et coupé en cubes","10 pointes d''asperges, parées et tranchées en diagonale","6 oignons nouveaux coupés en deux et tranchés finement dans le sens de la longueur","300 g de germes de soja","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre et de cacahuètes salées, pour servir"]','["Cuire les nouilles suivant le paquet\r\ninstructions. Mélanger le jus de citron vert, le tamarin\r\net la sauce chili dans un petit bol. Annuler.","Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive\r\nou un wok et faites frire le tofu pendant 5 à 8 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit.\r\ndoré partout. Annuler.","Ajouter le reste de l''huile et faire revenir le\r\nasperges jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Astuce au printemps\r\noignons, germes de soja et ail. Cuisiner pour\r\n2 minutes de plus. Incorporer les nouilles égouttées,\r\nsauce et un peu de sel. Incorporer le tofu et\r\nchauffer à travers. Servir avec de la coriandre,\r\ncacahuètes salées et quartiers de citron vert."]','2026-01-11 00:16:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12283,6323,'fr','Salade d''aubergines marinées et roquette','Des morceaux juteux d''aubergine rôtie ajoutent de la satisfaction à cette salade sucrée et super saine.','["2 aubergines coupées en petits morceaux","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","petite poignée de sultanes","Fusée en sachet de 50g"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMélanger l''aubergine avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive\r\net assaisonner dans un grand plat à rôtir et\r\nrôtir pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et tendre.","Une fois cuit, mélanger avec le vinaigre,\r\nles raisins secs et le reste de l''huile. Disperser\r\nla roquette juste avant de servir. Peut être\r\nservi chaud ou à température ambiante."]','2026-01-11 00:16:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12284,6327,'fr','Lentille hésita','Vous avez du mal à obtenir vos cinq par jour ? Ce ragoût supersain vous rapprochera de quatre pas et peut être congelé pour plus de commodité','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, finement hachés","3 carottes, hachées finement","3 branches de céleri, hachées finement","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","Sachet de 500 g de lentilles rouges séchées","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à café d''origan séché et de thym","3 feuilles de laurier","1l de bouillon de légumes","500 g de spaghettis, plus du parmesan ou du fromage végétarien, râpé, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole et\r\najouter les oignons, les carottes, le céleri et\r\nl''ail. Cuire doucement pendant 15 à 20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que tout soit ramolli. Incorporer le\r\nlentilles, tomates concassées, purée de tomates,\r\nherbes et bouillon. Portez à ébullition, puis\r\ncuire 40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient\r\ntendre et savoureux – éclabousser dans l''eau si\r\nvous avez besoin. Saison.","Si vous mangez tout de suite, restez à faible consommation\r\nfaites chauffer pendant que vous faites cuire les spaghettis,\r\nen suivant les instructions de l''emballage. Bien égoutter,\r\nrépartir dans des bols ou des assiettes à pâtes,\r\nverser la sauce sur le dessus et râper dessus\r\ndu fromage. Alternativement, refroidissez le\r\nsauce et réfrigérer jusqu''à 3 jours. Ou congeler jusqu''à 3 mois. Simplement\r\ndécongeler les portions toute la nuit dans la pièce\r\ntempérature, puis réchauffer doucement au moment de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12285,6329,'fr','Mulligatawny d''hiver','Utilisez les restes de dinde rôtie dans cette soupe copieuse et faible en gras aux saveurs de curry. Il est riche en vitamine C qui soutient le système immunitaire, ce qui le rend idéal pour les mois d’hiver','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons (350 g), hachés","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement haché","2 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1½ litre de bouillon de légumes chaud, réalisé avec 1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon","500 ml en purée","320 g de carottes coupées en dés","2 branches de céleri , hachées","180 g de lentilles rouges séchées","100 g de riz basmati brun","200 g de dinde ou de poulet cuit, haché","15 g de coriandre hachée","½ citron, jus"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 10 minutes en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''ils ramollissent et commencent à dorer.","Incorporer le gingembre, l''ail et le piment et cuire encore une minute. Ajoutez la poudre de curry et les graines de cumin, remuez bien, puis versez le bouillon de légumes chaud et la passata et remuez à nouveau.","Ajoutez les carottes, le céleri, les lentilles et le riz, mélangez bien et portez à ébullition. Une fois à ébullition, baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles, les légumes et le riz soient tendres.","Retirer du feu, incorporer la coriandre et le jus de citron et verser dans des bols. Les restes se conservent au frais jusqu’à trois jours ou se congèlent jusqu’à trois mois. Réchauffer dans une poêle avec un peu d’eau jusqu’à ce qu’il soit très chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:16:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12286,6331,'fr','Salade d''hiver aux choux de Bruxelles et vinaigrette à la clémentine','Les choux ne sont pas seulement pour Noël ! Associés à des saveurs piquantes, ils apportent de la fraîcheur et du goût à cette salade végétarienne d''hiver.','["350 g de choux de Bruxelles , râpés","150 g de chou frisé, râpé","50 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge","3 clémentines, 2 pelées et segmentées, 1 zestée et pressée","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre de pomme","1 cuillère à soupe de miel ou de sirop d''érable","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon","50g de pignons de pin","50g de graines de grenade, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez les pousses râpées et le chou frisé dans un grand bol avec une grosse pincée de sel. Versez l''huile d''olive dans un petit bol ou un pichet et mélangez le zeste et le jus de clémentine, le vinaigre, le miel et la moutarde, puis versez-le sur les feuilles. Frotter avec les mains jusqu''à ce que la vinaigrette soit bien répartie, puis laisser ramollir 15 minutes.","Incorporez les pignons de pin et les segments de clémentines, puis versez la salade sur une assiette ou dans des bols. Répartir sur les graines de grenade, le cas échéant, et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:16:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12287,6333,'fr','Salade d''hiver de courge rôtie et houmous','Les salades ne sont pas réservées à l''été : cette magnifique salade d''hiver regorge de bêta-carotène et de vitamine C pour aider à soutenir les défenses immunitaires.','["4 petites pommes de terre (environ 320 g), avec la peau, coupées en quartiers","320 g de courge musquée coupée en longues tranches fines","2 poivrons rouges et jaunes ou verts, épépinés et coupés en gros morceaux","3 oignons rouges (environ 320 g), coupés en tranches épaisses","200 g de carottes coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur et coupées en tranches épaisses","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de thym frais","30g de roquette, pour servir","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre","2 grosses gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 gros citron, zesté et pressé","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","25 g de noix hachées"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Faire bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 5 minutes, puis les égoutter et les laisser sécher à la vapeur. Versez tous les légumes, y compris les pommes de terre séchées à la vapeur, dans un grand plat à rôtir peu profond où ils peuvent tenir en une seule couche, et mélangez délicatement avec l''huile et le thym. Rôtir pendant 25 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le houmous. Égoutter les haricots beurre en retenant l''eau. Pesez 300 g de haricots et mettez-les dans un bol avec l''ail, le paprika fumé, 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza, 3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron, 1 cuillère à café de zeste de citron et 3 cuillères à soupe de liquide de haricots et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez encore 2 cuillères à soupe de liquide de haricots pour une consistance plus lisse, si vous le souhaitez. Incorporer les noix. Dans un autre petit bol, mélangez 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron avec le reste de l''huile de colza.","Une fois que les légumes sont tendres, incorporez les haricots réservés et remettez la plaque au four pendant 5 minutes pour bien réchauffer. Pour servir, étalez la moitié du houmous sur deux assiettes. Garnir de la moitié des légumes rôtis, puis verser un peu du mélange de citron et d''huile, en gardant un peu pour un autre repas. Répartir sur la roquette et servir. Se conservera au frais dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffez les légumes au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient très chauds."]','2026-01-11 00:16:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12288,6335,'fr','Salade d''hiver','Profitez au maximum du chou-fleur dans cette merveilleuse salade d''hiver aux raisins secs, à l''aneth et aux noix, accompagnée d''un houmous maison aux haricots beurre et au paprika fumé.','["320 g de chou-fleur coupé en bouquets","1 poivron rouge, coupé en quartiers, épépiné et tranché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et émincé","1 gros citron, zesté et pressé","15g de raisins secs","35 g de noix grossièrement hachées ou cassées en morceaux","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","15 g d''aneth haché","400 g de haricots beurre en boîte","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza"]','["Chauffer le four à 200 C/180 C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Frotter le chou-fleur et le poivre partout avec ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile et rôtir dans un plat à rôtir moyen pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres.","Mettez l''oignon et tout sauf 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron dans un bol non réactif et mélangez avec vos mains pour commencer à ramollir les oignons. Ajouter les raisins secs, les noix et le piment, puis réserver.","Pour le houmous, égouttez les haricots en réservant le liquide de la boîte. Versez les haricots dans un robot culinaire avec l''ail, le paprika, l''huile et le jus de citron réservé. Ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe du liquide de haricots réservé et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Répartir le houmous sur deux assiettes. Mélangez les légumes rôtis avec les oignons, le reste de l''huile, la moitié du zeste de citron et l''aneth. Verser sur le houmous et parsemer du zeste restant. Cette recette fait partie de notre plan d''alimentation saine gratuit de 7 jours. Pour accéder au plan de repas complet, cliquez ici."]','2026-01-11 00:16:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12289,6337,'fr','Soupe poulet et nouilles','Le bouillon aromatique de Mary Cadogan vous réchauffera les soirées d’hiver : il contient du gingembre, particulièrement efficace contre le rhume.','["900 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes (ou de mélange à soupe Miso)","1 poitrine de poulet désossée et sans peau (environ 175 g)","1 cuillère à café de gingembre frais haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","50 g de nouilles de riz ou de blé","2 cuillères à soupe de maïs doux, en conserve ou surgelé","2-3 champignons, tranchés finement","2 oignons nouveaux, émincés","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja, plus un peu pour servir","feuilles de menthe ou de basilic et un peu de piment râpé (facultatif), pour servir"]','["Versez le bouillon dans un pan et ajoutez la poitrine de poulet, le gingembre et l''ail. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu, couvrez partiellement et laissez mijoter 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit tendre.","Mettez le poulet à bord et déchiquetez-le en bouchées à l''aide de quelques fourchettes. Remettez le poulet dans le bouillon avec les nouilles, le maïs doux, les champignons, la ciboule et la sauce soja. Laisser mijoter 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les nouilles soient tendres.","Verser dans deux bols et parsemer du reste de la ciboule, des feuilles de menthe ou de basilic et du piment, le cas échéant. Servir avec de la sauce soja supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:16:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12290,6341,'fr','Cornichon à la citrouille','Préparez votre propre panier de Noël et assurez-vous d''ajouter ce cornichon à la citrouille de saison. Il peut être servi avec de la charcuterie, du fromage ou une part de tarte tiède salée.','["850 g de potiron ou de courge (600 g de poids préparé), pelée et coupée en morceaux de 1 cm","1 gros oignon, haché","2 pommes de table, épépinées, pelées et coupées en morceaux de 1 cm","2 cuillères à café de graines de moutarde noire","2 cuillères à café de graines de coriandre","2 cuillères à café de graines de nigelle","200 g de sucre en poudre","450 ml de vinaigre de cidre","2 feuilles de laurier","1½ cuillère à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et coupé en fines tranches","1 piment vert ou rouge, haché finement"]','["Mettez la citrouille préparée dans un bol et saupoudrez de 2 cuillères à soupe de sel marin. Bien mélanger, couvrir et laisser à température ambiante pendant 24 heures.","Stérilisez vos bocaux avant de commencer (voir conseil ci-dessous). Égouttez et rincez le potiron, puis versez-le dans une grande casserole. Ajoutez l''oignon, les morceaux de pomme, les graines de moutarde, de coriandre et de nigelle, le sucre, le vinaigre et les feuilles de laurier. Versez 200 ml d''eau sur le tout, puis mettez sur feu moyen et portez à ébullition. Mettez un couvercle sur la casserole en laissant un espace pour que la vapeur s''échappe, augmentez le feu à moyen-vif et laissez cuire 8 minutes.","Utilisez une tasse pour retirer un peu de liquide de la casserole et mélangez 50 ml avec le curcuma et la farine dans un petit bol pour obtenir une pâte lisse. Ajoutez un peu plus de liquide en mélangeant bien pour éliminer les grumeaux, jusqu''à ce que la pâte devienne liquide, puis versez dans la casserole et ajoutez le gingembre et le piment. Laisser mijoter encore 5 minutes, à découvert, en remuant jusqu''à épaississement et que la courge ait ramolli mais conserve encore un peu de mordant.","Remplissez soigneusement vos bocaux stérilisés avec le cornichon pendant qu''il est encore chaud, en pressant les morceaux de courge dans le liquide pour expulser les poches d''air, puis posez le couvercle. Se conserve dans un endroit frais et sombre jusqu''à un an. Une fois ouvert, à conserver au réfrigérateur et à consommer dans le mois. Mieux servi après un mois de maturation ou plus, mais peut être consommé immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:16:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12291,6343,'fr','Essayez-le','Attendez-vous à un coup de pied de ce chocolat chaud en couches pour adultes qui contient une dose d''espresso. Ce chocolat chaud italien est aussi traditionnel que le chocolat chaud l''est','["125 ml de crème fraîche","250 ml de lait entier ou de crème liquide","50 g de chocolat noir (au moins 70 % de cacao), haché finement","sucre demerara, au goût","2 shots d''espresso fraîchement moulu","10 g de noisettes finement râpées ou hachées","pincée de cacao en poudre"]','["Fouetter la crème double dans un bol jusqu''à ce qu''elle conserve sa forme mais soit encore versable. Annuler.","Versez le lait ou la crème liquide dans une casserole avec le chocolat noir. Remuer continuellement à feu doux-moyen à l’aide d’un fouet jusqu’à ce que le mélange arrive à ébullition. Réduisez le feu à doux et laissez mijoter tout en continuant de fouetter. Ajoutez le sucre demerara au goût.","Réchauffez deux verres résistants à la chaleur en les rinçant à l''eau chaude, puis séchez-les et versez l''espresso. Versez délicatement sur le mélange chocolaté, puis recouvrez de chantilly, de noisettes et d''une pincée de cacao en poudre."]','2026-01-11 00:16:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12292,6347,'fr','Macaroni au fromage sans lactose','Savourez une version sans lactose de macaroni au fromage. Le plat réconfortant par excellence lors des froides nuits d’hiver, il plaira à coup sûr à toute la famille.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","500 ml de lait sans lactose","125 g de Grana Padano finement râpé","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon","250 g de macaronis coudés ou de pâtes courtes","3 cuillères à soupe de chapelure séchée","pincée de paprika ou de poivre de Cayenne"]','["Fouetter l''huile d''olive et la farine dans une casserole jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis réchauffer à feu moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement dorées et légèrement épaissies. Ajoutez le lait petit à petit, en fouettant continuellement, jusqu''à ce qu''une sauce blanche et onctueuse se forme. Cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit suffisamment épais pour recouvrir le dos d''une cuillère. Incorporez 100 g de Grana Padano et la moutarde de Dijon, puis laissez cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit fondue. Assaisonnez bien.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient al dente. Bien égoutter et incorporer à la sauce au fromage. Versez dans un plat allant au four et chauffez le gril à feu moyen. Mélangez la chapelure, le paprika ou le poivre de Cayenne et le reste du Grana Padano, puis répartissez-le sur le macaroni au fromage. Griller pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus soit croustillant et doré. Servir avec une salade verte bien garnie."]','2026-01-11 00:17:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12293,6349,'fr','Ragoût de jambon fumé et lentilles','Profitez au maximum de vos restes de jambon de Noël et de légumes rôtis dans ce ragoût de jambon et de lentilles fumé – parfait pour nourrir la famille pendant les vacances','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza ou d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","1 branche de céleri, hachée","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","2 cubes ou bouillon de poulet ou de légumes faible en sel","140 g de restes de jambon cuit ou de gammon, coupés en morceaux","350 g de restes de légumes racines rôtis (comme des pommes de terre, des carottes, des panais, du céleri ou du rutabaga), coupés en morceaux","Sachet de 200 g de lentilles du Puy cuites","petit bouquet de persil haché","pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon et le céleri pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez le paprika et la moutarde, laissez cuire encore 30 secondes, puis émiettez-les dans les cubes de bouillon et ajoutez le jambon ainsi que 1 litre d''eau. Portez à ébullition, puis bouillonnez doucement pendant 10 minutes.","Ajoutez les légumes-racines et les lentilles, puis assaisonnez au goût et continuez à faire bouillir le tout pendant encore 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le ragoût soit très chaud. Juste avant de servir, incorporez le persil, puis versez dans des bols et servez avec du pain croustillant à part pour éponger le ragoût."]','2026-01-11 00:17:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12294,6351,'fr','Sirop d''épices de citrouille','Ajoutez ce sirop d''épices de citrouille polyvalent, à base de cannelle, de clous de girofle et de gingembre, aux lattés et aux milkshakes. Vous pouvez également en verser sur des pâtisseries et des desserts','["200 g de sucre en poudre doré","50 g de sucre mou roux clair","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","¼ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","2 cuillères à café de gingembre moulu","râpe de muscade","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de potiron en conserve"]','["Versez tous les ingrédients dans une casserole avec 125 ml d''eau et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous et que vous obteniez un sirop fin.","Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir. Transférez le sirop dans une bouteille ou un pot stérilisé. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à deux semaines."]','2026-01-11 00:17:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12295,6353,'fr','Ragoût de betterave et butternut','Ce one-pot végétarien vibrant contient 4 de vos 5 par jour et constitue un délicieux dîner faible en gras et en calories.','["250 g de betterave crue","350 g de courge musquée non pelée","1 gousse d''ail, râpée","1 petit oignon, coupé en dés","¼ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","4 gousses de cardamome, graines enlevées et écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","100 g de haricots verts garnis et coupés en deux","50 g de blettes ou d''épinards, les tiges enlevées et les feuilles hachées grossièrement","petit paquet de persil plat, haché grossièrement","riz brun, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Épluchez la betterave et coupez-la en petits morceaux. Coupez la courge butternut en petits morceaux. Mettez-les dans des bols séparés jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Dans une grande casserole à fond large, faire revenir l''ail, l''oignon, les graines de cumin, la coriandre et les gousses de cardamome dans l''huile pendant 2 minutes à feu moyen. Ajoutez 125 ml d''eau avec la betterave et laissez reposer encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''eau frémisse.","Ajoutez 250 ml d''eau, la courge musquée et la cannelle et laissez mijoter à feu moyen pendant 10 min. Ajoutez 250 ml d''eau et laissez mijoter encore 10 minutes.","Ajoutez 125 ml d''eau, les haricots verts et laissez mijoter encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''eau frémisse. Retirez du feu et incorporez les blettes et le persil. Servir seul ou avec du riz brun pour un repas plus complet."]','2026-01-11 00:17:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12296,6355,'fr','Salade d''épinards et de courges avec vinaigrette à la noix de coco','Courge musquée rôtie, oignons marinés au citron vert et feuilles d''épinards assaisonnées de crème de coco composent la parfaite salade de buffet d''hiver.','["1 grosse courge musquée ou citrouille, épépinée mais avec la peau","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon rouge, tranché en fines rondelles","2 citrons verts, le zeste d''un, le jus des deux","½ boîte de 160 ml de crème de coco","2 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","2 sachets de 100 g de jeunes pousses d''épinards"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Couper la courge en bouchées, mélanger avec l''huile et l''assaisonnement, puis rôtir pendant 30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et tendre. Laisser refroidir.","Mélanger les rondelles d''oignon avec le jus d''un citron vert et réserver pendant que la courge rôtit.","Préparez la vinaigrette. Fouetter ensemble le reste du jus de citron vert, le zeste, la crème de coco, la sauce de poisson et le sucre. Couvrir et laisser infuser au réfrigérateur pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''au moment de servir. Au moment de manger, mélanger la courge, les épinards et les oignons et servir avec un généreux filet de vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:17:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12297,6357,'fr','Casserole d''orge perlé, bacon et poireaux','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Cette céréale de magasin constitue une excellente alternative au riz ou au couscous. Accompagnez-le de bacon et de légumes dans ce ragoût semblable à un risotto','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 poireaux, tranchés grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","300 g d''orge perlé","4 carottes, coupées en cubes","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon, plus un peu pour servir","1l de bouillon de poulet","300 g de choux de Milan émincés","200 g de lard maigre, cuit, coupé en petits morceaux"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''huile d''olive et faites cuire les poireaux quelques minutes, puis ajoutez l''ail et laissez cuire encore 1 minute.","Ajoutez l''orge perlé, les carottes et la moutarde, puis versez sur le bouillon de poulet. Assaisonnez avec beaucoup de poivre noir moulu et laissez mijoter pendant 20 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. Ajoutez le chou avec\r\nle bacon et cuire 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chou soit fané et tendre. Servir avec de la moutarde de Dijon supplémentaire en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:17:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12298,6359,'fr','Cerf braisé aux épices, piment et chocolat','Cela peut être consommé en ragoût ou utilisé dans une pâtisserie ou une tarte cottage. Le chocolat ajoute une richesse et une brillance supplémentaires à la sauce finie','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1½ kg de chevreuil à l''étouffée en dés","3 grosses carottes, hachées grossièrement","1 oignon, haché grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","grosse pincée de poudre de chili","petit bâton de cannelle","1 piment rouge, entier","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de farine nature","500 ml de vin rouge","300 ml de bouillon de bœuf","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","grosse branche de thym","2 feuilles de laurier","50 g de chocolat noir (plus de 70 % de cacao)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte ignifuge et faites dorer la viande par lots. Ajouter les légumes dans le plat et faire revenir légèrement, puis incorporer les épices, le piment et la farine et cuire quelques minutes. Versez le vin, le bouillon et les tomates, puis ajoutez les herbes. Portez à ébullition.","Couvrir avec un couvercle et mettre au four pendant 1h30, puis retirer le couvercle et laisser cuire encore 1h jusqu''à ce que la viande soit bien tendre. Retirer du four et laisser refroidir légèrement, puis incorporer le chocolat et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12299,6361,'fr','Curry de dinde','Optez pour le classique avec vos restes de dinde et préparez ce ragoût sain rempli d''épices avec des poivrons et des tomates.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 gros oignon, tranché épaisse","1 poivron vert épépiné et haché","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry (ou alternative sans gluten)","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","300 g de restes de dinde coupés en dés","300 g de restes de pommes de terre cuites (bouillies ou rôties), coupées en dés","2 cuillères à soupe de chutney de mangue","petit paquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","riz ou pain naan, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu assez vif. Faites cuire l''oignon et le poivron pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir et à dorer légèrement. Incorporer la pâte de curry et l''ail, puis cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes. Ajoutez les tomates concassées et 150 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition et bouillonnez 5 min.","Baissez le feu, incorporez la dinde et les pommes de terre et laissez cuire encore 2-3 minutes, puis assaisonnez et ajoutez le chutney de mangue. Parsemer de coriandre et servir avec du riz ou du naan."]','2026-01-11 00:17:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12300,6363,'fr','Sauté de poulet, chou frisé et pousses','Les choux de Bruxelles ne sont pas réservés à Noël : ajoutez-les à un pot de nouilles sain pour plus de nutrition et de croquant.','["100 g de nouilles soba","100 g de chou frisé râpé","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","2 poitrines de poulet maigres, la peau retirée et coupées en fines lanières","25 g de gingembre frais pelé et coupé en allumettes","1 poivron rouge, épépiné et tranché finement","une poignée de choux de Bruxelles, coupés en quartiers","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sodium","2 cuillères à soupe de vin de riz ou de vinaigre de vin blanc","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert"]','["Faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis égouttez-les et réservez. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer un grand wok ou une poêle à frire et ajoutez le chou frisé avec un bon filet d''eau et laissez cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit flétri, avec un peu de bouchée, puis laissez refroidir sous l''eau courante pour conserver la couleur.","Ajoutez la moitié de l''huile et faites cuire les lanières de poulet jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, puis retirez-les et réservez. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile et faites revenir le gingembre, le poivre et les pousses jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient un peu ramollis. retournez le poulet et le chou frisé et ajoutez les nouilles.","Versez le soja, le vin de riz, le zeste et le jus de citron vert avec suffisamment d''eau pour créer une sauce qui adhère aux ingrédients. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:17:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12301,6365,'fr','Tarte au poulet masala','Une pâtisserie au curry de noix de coco garnie de pommes de terre Bombay, saine et faible en gras. Blottissez-vous avec des aliments réconfortants et nutritifs','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","2 oignons, hachés","morceau de gingembre de la longueur d''un doigt, râpé","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de graines de moutarde noire ou brune","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin blanc ou rouge","2 cuillères à café de sucre (blanc ou brun)","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","150 ml de lait de coco léger (achetez une canette de 400 ml, vous en aurez besoin de plus pour la garniture)","1 gros poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en gros morceaux","1 gros poivron vert épépiné et coupé en gros morceaux","½ petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles grossièrement hachées, tiges réservées (voir ci-dessous)","1½ kg de pommes de terre farineuses, coupées en très gros morceaux","150 ml de lait de coco léger","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","jus d''1 citron","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, finement hachés","tiges d''un demi petit bouquet de coriandre, finement hachées","1 cuillère à café de graines de kalonji (également appelées graines de nigelle ou d''oignon)","pain naan, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer une poêle à frire ou antidéflagrante\r\ncocotte et ajoutez 2 cuillères à café d''huile.\r\nFaire dorer les poitrines de poulet rapidement mais\r\nbien des deux côtés, puis retirer dans un\r\nassiette. Baissez le feu et ajoutez le\r\nle reste de l''huile, les oignons, le gingembre et\r\nl''ail. Frire doucement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter les épices\r\net laissez cuire quelques minutes en remuant.","Incorporer le vinaigre, le sucre, les tomates et\r\nlait de coco. Portez à ébullition et\r\nbouillonner pendant 10 minutes. Hachez grossièrement le\r\npoitrines de poulet et incorporer dans la poêle avec\r\nles jus de poulet et les poivrons.\r\nLaisser mijoter encore 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle poulet est bien cuit et la sauce\r\nréduit un peu. Retirez du feu, incorporez\r\nles feuilles de coriandre et assaisonner selon votre goût\r\n– il lui faudra un bon assaisonnement.","Pour faire la garniture, mettez les pommes de terre\r\ndans une grande casserole d''eau, porter à ébullition,\r\npuis faites bouillir jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit – 10 à 15 minutes selon la taille de vos morceaux.\r\nBien égoutter, puis remettre dans le\r\npoêle et sécher à la vapeur pendant quelques minutes.","Ajoutez le lait de coco et le curcuma\r\nla poêle et écrasez très bien. Saison\r\navec le jus de citron et un peu de sel,\r\npuis incorporez les oignons nouveaux et\r\ntiges de coriandre.","Verser le poulet masala dans un\r\nplat allant au four. Verser des cuillerées de\r\nécraser pour couvrir, puis saupoudrer sur le\r\ngraines de kalonji. Peut être couvert et\r\nréfrigéré jusqu''à 2 jours (ou congelé pendant\r\njusqu''à un mois).","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6\r\net enfourner pendant 25-30 minutes (ou 45 minutes\r\ndu froid) jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien chaud et\r\ncroustillant sur le dessus. Servir avec des naans\r\ndu pain, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:17:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12302,6369,'fr','Ragoût épicé de petites aubergines à la coriandre et à la menthe','Super sain et riche en fibres également, ce one-pot miraculeux du Moyen-Orient contient moins de 150 calories par portion et compte pour 5 de vos 5 par jour.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons rouges, tranchés","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 piments rouges épépinés et tranchés, ou 2-3 piments rouges séchés laissés entiers","2 cuillères à café de graines de coriandre grillées et écrasées","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin, grillées et écrasées","16 jeunes aubergines, laissées entières avec la tige intacte","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à café de sucre","un bouquet de feuilles de menthe, hachées grossièrement","bouquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","couscous et yaourt pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole à fond épais,\r\najouter les oignons et l''ail et cuire\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à se colorer. Ajoutez le\r\npiments, graines de coriandre et de cumin.\r\nQuand les graines dégagent un goût de noisette\r\narôme, incorporer le tout\r\naubergines, en les enrobant\r\ndans l''oignon et les épices.","Ajoutez les tomates et le sucre,\r\ncouvrir et laisser cuire doucement 40 min,\r\njusqu''à ce que les aubergines soient tendres.","Assaisonner la sauce et mélanger en deux\r\nla menthe et la coriandre. Couvrir et\r\nlaisser mijoter 2 min. Saupoudrer\r\nherbes restantes et servir avec\r\ncouscous et yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:17:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12303,6371,'fr','Tourtes au poulet et poireaux','Les aliments réconfortants ne signifient pas nécessairement des calories, cette tarte super saine utilise de la pâte filo pour la maintenir faible en graisses saturées','["1 grosse patate douce, coupée en grosses chips","4 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","2 poitrines de poulet, coupées en bouchées","1 poireau, finement tranché","1 carotte, hachée","225 ml de bouillon de poulet faible en sodium","2 cuillères à café de moutarde complète","85 g de fromage à pâte molle légère","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles d''estragon hachées","2 feuilles de pâte filo"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Dans\r\nune plaque à rôtir, mélanger les patates douces\r\navec 2 cuillères à café d''huile et un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nCuire pendant 30 à 40 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et\r\ncroustillant. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à café d''huile dans une friture moyenne\r\ncasserole. Faire frire le poulet jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré,\r\nretirer de la poêle et réserver. Ajouter\r\nle poireau et un peu d''eau, et délicatement\r\nfaire frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres, environ 7 minutes. Ajoutez le\r\ncarotte et cuire encore 3 min. Verser\r\nle bouillon et faire bouillir jusqu''à réduction de moitié,\r\npuis ajoutez la moutarde et le fromage à pâte molle,\r\nbien mélanger. Renvoyez le\r\npoulet dans la poêle, ajoutez l''estragon et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement.","Répartissez le mélange entre 2 petits\r\nplats allant au four. Prenez les feuilles de filo\r\net les froisser. Garnir chaque tarte avec\r\nune feuille et badigeonner avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile restante.\r\nCuire les tartes au four avec les frites\r\npendant 15 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit dorée."]','2026-01-11 00:17:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12304,6373,'fr','Tarte aux légumes d''hiver','Une portion de ce délicieux pâté chinois végétarien contient les 5 apports recommandés pour 5 jours.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, tranchés","1 cuillère à soupe de farine","300 g (environ 2 grosses) carottes, coupées en petits bâtonnets","½ chou-fleur, cassé en petits bouquets","4 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","1 brin de romarin, feuilles finement hachées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","200 g de petits pois surgelés","900 g de pommes de terre coupées en morceaux","jusqu''à 200 ml de lait"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un\r\nplat antidéflagrant sur feu moyen\r\nchaleur. Ajouter les oignons et cuire pendant\r\n10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis, puis incorporer\r\nla farine et laissez cuire encore\r\n2 minutes. Ajoutez les carottes, le chou-fleur,\r\nl''ail et le romarin, et laissez cuire 5 minutes en remuant régulièrement jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient\r\ncommencer à ramollir.","Versez les tomates dans le\r\nlégumes accompagnés d''une boîte pleine\r\nd''eau. Couvrir avec un couvercle et\r\nlaisser mijoter 10 minutes, puis retirer\r\nle couvercle et laissez cuire 10-15 minutes\r\nplus, jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait épaissi\r\net les légumes sont cuits.\r\nAssaisonner, incorporer les petits pois et cuire\r\npendant 1 minute de plus.","Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir les pommes de terre\r\npendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter,\r\npuis remettre dans la casserole\r\net écraser. Incorporer suffisamment de lait\r\npour atteindre une consistance assez molle,\r\npuis ajoutez le reste de l''huile d''olive\r\net la saison.","Faites chauffer le gril. Verser le chaud\r\nmélange de légumes dans un plat à tarte, dessus\r\navec la purée et faites glisser une fourchette\r\nlégèrement sur la surface. Lieu\r\nsous le grill quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle dessus est brun doré et croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:17:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12305,6375,'fr','Pommes de terre à la dinde et au chili','Le hachis de dinde est bon marché et maigre – aromatisé à la mexicaine avec du cumin et du paprika et servi dans des pommes de terre croustillantes au four.','["4 grosses pommes de terre au four","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","300 g de dinde hachée","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre brun clair et mou","350 ml en purée","Red Leicester allégé, râpé, pour servir","4 oignons nouveaux, hachés, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nUtilisez une fourchette pour piquer toutes les pommes de terre\r\nfini. Frottez avec un peu d''huile et\r\ncuire au four pendant 45 minutes jusqu''à tendreté.","Pendant ce temps, préparez le piment. Chauffer le\r\nle reste de l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu\r\nfeu moyen. Ajouter l''oignon, l''ail et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement et cuire 5 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Ajouter le hachis de dinde et\r\nassaisonner à nouveau, puis augmenter le feu et\r\ncassez le hachis avec le dos de votre\r\ncuillère. Quand c''est bien cuit, ajoutez\r\nles épices, le vinaigre, le sucre et la passata.\r\nRéduisez le feu et laissez cuire 10 min\r\nou jusqu''à ce que le liquide ait réduit.","Couper une croix sur le dessus de chaque pomme de terre\r\net ajouter le piment. Servir chaque pomme de terre\r\nsaupoudré de fromage et d''oignons nouveaux."]','2026-01-11 00:17:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12306,6377,'fr','Poulet harissa au boulgour','Le boulgour est facile à cuisiner et constitue une excellente alternative aux céréales raffinées. Il est riche en fibres et en nutriments, donc bon pour la santé intestinale, digestive et cardiaque. Servez-le avec des ragoûts, ou utilisez-le dans des salades ou comme alternative nutritive au riz. Cette recette est une préférée de mes enfants !','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","250 g de mini-filets de poulet","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de harissa à la rose, au goût","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 poivron rouge, finement haché","150 g de boulgour rincé et égoutté","160 g de haricots verts hachés grossièrement","1/2 citron, jus","Une petite poignée de coriandre hachée ou des feuilles laissées entières","80 g de graines de grenade"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen. Faites frire l''ail pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré, en prenant soin de ne pas le brûler. Ajoutez le poulet et faites-le revenir quelques minutes. Incorporer la harissa et la purée de tomates.","Ajouter le poivron haché et cuire quelques minutes en remuant bien.","Incorporez le boulgour égoutté, une pincée de sel et 300 ml d''eau bouillante. Portez à ébullition, mettez le couvercle sur la casserole et laissez cuire 5 minutes.","Soulevez le couvercle et déposez les haricots verts dessus, couvrez à nouveau et laissez cuire 5 minutes. Retirer du feu et laisser couvert encore 5 minutes.","Découvrez, pressez le jus de citron et mélangez bien. Garnir de coriandre et de graines de grenade."]','2026-01-11 00:17:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12307,6379,'fr','Curry super vert avec riz au quinoa','J''ai utilisé des pois chiches là-dedans, mais la base de curry est adaptable ; ajoutez simplement la protéine de votre choix. Un filet de citron ajoute de la vitamine C pour faciliter l''absorption du fer et mélanger le quinoa avec du riz augmente votre apport en céréales complètes et en protéines riches en fibres.','["75 g de quinoa","75g de riz","1 cuillère à café d''huile","1/2 oignon rouge , haché","1/2 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","50g de chou frisé","150 g de pousses d''épinards","1/4 cuillère à café de curcuma","400 g de boîte de pois chiches égouttés","presser le jus de citron, pour servir","1-2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","5 gousses d''ail , tranchées finement","1 piment rouge , tranché finement"]','["Dans un grand bol allant au micro-ondes, mélanger le quinoa et le riz. Laver et rincer trois fois. Ajoutez 320 ml d''eau bouillante, couvrez et faites cuire au micro-ondes à puissance maximale pendant 10 minutes. Laisser reposer 5 min, puis remuer à la fourchette.","Pendant la cuisson du riz, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen. Faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et légèrement doré. Ajoutez le cumin et remuez pendant 1 min pour éviter qu''il ne brûle.","Ajoutez le chou frisé, les épinards, le curcuma et une pincée de sel. Versez 250 ml d''eau bouillante. Couvrir et cuire 10 à 15 minutes en remuant à mi-cuisson.","Transférer dans un mixeur, laisser refroidir quelques minutes, puis mixer jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Remettez le mélange dans la casserole et incorporez les pois chiches. Cuire à feu doux pendant 5 minutes pour bien réchauffer.","Faites chauffer l''huile pour le tadka dans une poêle à feu moyen. Faites frire l''ail et les piments pendant 2-3 minutes. Versez rapidement sur le curry. Servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:17:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12308,6383,'fr','Curry de tofu super vert','Passer sans viande ? Savourez ce délicieux curry de tofu et d''épinards que vous pouvez préparer en quelques minutes. Servir avec du riz sauvage et un peu de coriandre','["280 g de tofu ferme, coupé en petits triangles","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à café de graines de coriandre","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","2 gousses de cardamome, graines écrasées","10 g de gingembre pelé et haché grossièrement","1 oignon , finement haché","2 gousses d''ail , hachées grossièrement","400g d''épinards","10 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement, plus des feuilles entières supplémentaires pour servir","2 sachets de 250 g de mélange de riz brun et sauvage cuit, pour servir"]','["Séchez le tofu avec du papier absorbant, puis faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle à frire à feu moyen. Faites frire le tofu pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré de chaque côté. Retirer de la poêle à l''aide d''une tranche de poisson et laisser égoutter sur du papier absorbant.","Versez le reste de l''huile dans la poêle, puis parsemez les graines de coriandre, les graines de cumin et la cardamome et laissez cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles éclatent.","Ajouter le gingembre, l''oignon et l''ail et cuire encore 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce que les bords soient dorés. Baissez le feu et ajoutez les épinards, une poignée à la fois et remuez pour les faire flétrir. Retirer du feu. Versez le mélange d''épinards, la coriandre et 300 ml d''eau dans un mixeur puissant et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse. Remettez le mélange dans la casserole et assaisonnez de sel. Portez à ébullition.","Versez le tofu frit et faites cuire pendant 4 à 5 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que le tofu soit bien chaud. Assaisonner, puis verser sur le riz sauvage et parsemer de feuilles de coriandre pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12309,6385,'fr','Des burritos plus sains','Ajoutez du chou râpé, de la salade de chou ou de la salsa au maïs doux pour une version plus saine d''un favori mexicain. Notre méthode de préparation du chili de bœuf donne les meilleurs résultats','["300 g de riz brun","4 à 6 tortillas complètes, pour servir","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","400 à 500 g de bœuf haché","1 gros oignon , finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à café de pâte chipotle","1 cuillère à soupe d''assaisonnement cajun ou fajita","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de cidre","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés mais non rincés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 tomate, hachée","1 oignon rouge , finement haché","½ petit paquet de coriandre hachée","1 citron vert, jus","2 avocats dénoyautés et pelés","yaourt nature, moitiés de citron vert à presser et cheddar râpé (facultatif)"]','["Préparez d’abord le piment. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen, émiettez-la avec le hachis et faites-la revenir pendant 15 à 20 minutes. Au début, il libérera un peu de liquide, mais une fois que celui-ci aura bouillonné, le hachis grésillera dans sa propre graisse et commencera à dorer et à devenir croustillant. À ce stade, cassez-le à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois pour qu''il dore et caramélise partout, puis incorporez l''oignon et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit ramolli. Ajouter l''ail, la pâte chipotle, le mélange d''épices, le sucre et le vinaigre et cuire 1 min. Ajoutez les haricots et les tomates, remuez le tout et laissez mijoter à découvert pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à épaississement. Se conserve au frais pendant deux jours ou au congélateur pendant un mois. Décongeler complètement et réchauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud.","Pendant ce temps, mettez le riz dans une casserole moyenne avec 600 ml d''eau froide et une pincée de sel, si vous le souhaitez. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu, couvrez et laissez mijoter doucement pendant environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que toute l''eau soit absorbée. Éteignez le feu et laissez reposer encore 10 minutes sans être dérangé. Remuez le riz et laissez reposer.","Pour le guacamole, mélangez les tomates avec l''oignon, la coriandre, le jus de citron vert et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis écrasez-les pour obtenir un gros guacamole. Pour servir, réchauffez les tortillas, étalées grossièrement sur un peu de guacamole, ajoutez une généreuse couche de riz, puis le piment, le yaourt nature, le jus de citron vert et le cheddar râpé, si vous le souhaitez. Enveloppez le tout bien serré, coupez-le en deux au milieu et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:17:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12310,6387,'fr','Salade tiède de poulet avec vinaigrette à l''avocat','Les avocats de cette salade fumée et chaude sont très nutritifs et contiennent de la vitamine E, du fer, du potassium et de la niacine, ainsi que des graisses monoinsaturées saines pour le cœur.','["3 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en lanières épaisses","2 filets de poitrine de poulet sans peau, chacun coupé en six lanières environ","2 gousses d''ail, toutes deux pelées, une finement râpée, une entière","14 cuillères à café d''origan séché, plus une pincée","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","15g de coriandre moulue","1 oignon rouge d''environ 50 g, émincé","3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert","1 avocat, coupé en deux et dénoyauté, une moitié évidée et tranchée","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","15 g de coriandre hachée","50 g de pousses d''épinards"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu doux, ajoutez les poivrons puis couvrez et laissez cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Secouez la casserole plusieurs fois pour les déplacer, mais essayez de ne pas soulever le couvercle. Retirer de la poêle et réserver.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le poulet dans un bol avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile restante, l''ail râpé, ¼ cuillère à café d''origan, le paprika et ½ cuillère à café de coriandre. Mélanger l''oignon avec 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert dans un autre bol et réserver.","Pour préparer la vinaigrette, versez l''avocat coupé en deux non tranché dans un bol avec la gousse d''ail entière, une pincée d''origan, 2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et mixez avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse. Vous pouvez également utiliser un robot culinaire.","Remettez la poêle de poivrons sur le feu et ajoutez le poulet, couvrez et laissez cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et bien cuit. Versez les haricots, les oignons marinés rapidement et la coriandre hachée dans la poêle et mélangez bien.","Empilez les épinards sur deux assiettes et garnissez du mélange de poulet. Verser la vinaigrette à l''avocat et garnir de tranches d''avocat. Servir encore chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:17:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12311,6389,'fr','Burritos au poulet santé','Utilisez les ingrédients et les restes du placard pour préparer ce déjeuner nutritif et facile de style mexicain. La garniture des burritos peut être préparée à l''avance','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","1 gros poivron rouge, coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur, épépiné et coupé en lanières épaisses","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2-3 cuillères à café de poudre de piment doux, au goût","400 g de haricots noirs en boîte","Boîte de 198 g de maïs doux égoutté","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 grosse gousse d''ail, finement râpée","Sachet de 220 g de riz complet cuit (ou restes de riz brun cuit)","300 g de poulet cuit, tranché ou râpé (ou une combinaison de viande de cuisse et de poitrine restant d''un rôti)","15 g de coriandre hachée","2 petits avocats dénoyautés et coupés en quartiers","1 citron vert, jus","4 grandes tortillas complètes"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites cuire le poivron, à couvert, pendant 10 minutes à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et légèrement carbonisé.","Pendant ce temps, dans une poêle sèche, faites griller doucement les épices à feu doux pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient parfumées, puis versez-y les haricots, leur liquide, le maïs doux, le concentré de tomates et l''ail. Mélangez bien et augmentez le feu à moyen pour que le mélange bouillonne, puis incorporez le riz, le poulet et la coriandre. Cuire pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Se conservera au frais jusqu''à une journée. Laisser d''abord refroidir complètement. Réchauffer dans une poêle ou au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud.","Mélangez l''avocat dans un bol avec le jus de citron vert. Disposez les tortillas sur un plan de travail et empilez le riz au centre en laissant un espace de chaque côté. Garnir de poivrons et d''avocat, puis replier les tortillas à chaque extrémité pour enfermer la garniture et enrouler fermement le wrap. Mettez dans la poêle dans laquelle vous avez fait cuire les poivrons, joint vers le bas, et faites cuire doucement de chaque côté à feu doux pour les faire légèrement griller, environ 2-3 minutes. Vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots."]','2026-01-11 00:17:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12312,6391,'fr','Lentilles végétaliennes au tofu soja et gingembre','Combinez du tofu frit sucré, collant et épicé avec des lentilles du Puy, de la coriandre et du piment pour un plat riche en fibres.','["160g dried puy lentils or lentilles vertes","2 feuilles de laurier","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza, plus un filet","2 oignons (350 g), finement hachés","180 g de céleri tranché finement","320 g de carottes finement hachées","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de thym frais","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète, plus 1 cuillère à café","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre de pomme cru","1 cuillère à soupe de persil plat haché","260 g de tofu extra-ferme","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre balsamique","2 cuillères à café de gingembre finement râpé","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja faible en sel","4 cuillères à café de mélange de trois graines grillées","1 cuillère à soupe de feuilles de coriandre fraîche","1 piment rouge, haché"]','["Mettez les lentilles dans une casserole d''eau avec les feuilles de laurier et portez à ébullition. Faire bouillir pendant 10 minutes, puis baisser le feu à moyen-doux et cuire encore 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu vif et faites revenir l''oignon en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''il ramollisse. Ajoutez le céleri, les carottes et le thym, couvrez avec le couvercle, baissez le feu à moyen et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres.","Égouttez les lentilles et ajoutez-les aux légumes dans la poêle avec 1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde et de vinaigre de cidre. Mesurez la moitié du mélange de lentilles et réservez. Vous pourrez les utiliser pour les déjeuners plus tard dans la semaine, comme dans notre salade de lentilles du Puy à la betterave et aux noix. Mélanger le persil dans le reste du mélange de lentilles.","Coupez le tofu en doigts épais. Mélangez l''ail, le vinaigre balsamique, le gingembre et la sauce soja, puis badigeonnez-en les morceaux de tofu.","Faites chauffer un filet d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir le tofu de tous les côtés jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Servir le tofu sur la moitié des lentilles, garni du mélange de graines, de coriandre fraîche et de piment rouge haché."]','2026-01-11 00:17:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12313,6393,'fr','Soupe orzo et pois chiches','Préparez cette soupe saine, faible en gras et en calories avec de l''orzo, des pois chiches, des légumes et une boîte de tomates hachées. Garnir de parmesan râpé pour servir','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon , haché","2 carottes , hachées","2 branches de céleri , hachées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","3 gousses d''ail , hachées","3 brins de romarin ou de thym","1 litre de bouillon de légumes","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 g de pois chiches en boîte","zeste de parmesan ou alternative végétarienne (facultatif)","150 g d''orzo","huile d''olive extra vierge, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle profonde à feu moyen-vif et faites revenir l''oignon, les carottes et le céleri, y compris les feuilles, pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer le concentré de tomates, les gousses d''ail et les brins de romarin ou de thym. Cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que la purée soit caramélisée. Versez le bouillon, les tomates concassées, les pois chiches (et le liquide de la boîte) et le zeste de parmesan, si vous en avez un. Laisser mijoter 15 mn.","Versez de l''eau bouillante sur l''orzo dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et laissez reposer 15 minutes. Égouttez l''orzo, ajoutez-le à la poêle et faites cuire pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''orzo soit tendre. Pêchez et jetez les tiges de romarin et la croûte de fromage, puis assaisonnez bien. Arroser d''huile d''olive extra vierge et de fromage râpé pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12314,6395,'fr','Hachis de petit-déjeuner d''hiver','Mettez en valeur les choux de Bruxelles dans ce hachis savoureux. Les légumes crucifères peuvent aider à abaisser la tension artérielle et à réduire le risque de maladies cardiaques et de cancer','["375 g de pommes de terre coupées en petits morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon (environ 200 g), haché","½ cuillère à café de graines de carvi","2 gousses d''ail , hachées","1 poivron vert épépiné et coupé en dés","200 g de gros choux de Bruxelles, parés et tranchés","2 œufs"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 8 minutes en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à colorer. Ajoutez le carvi, l''ail, le poivre et les pousses et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes avec le couvercle sur la poêle pour qu''ils cuisent en même temps.","Égoutter et écraser légèrement les pommes de terre cuites à l''aide d''un pilon. Incorporez-les aux légumes et laissez cuire 5 à 10 minutes en les retournant de temps en temps pour que le mélange dore.","Pendant ce temps, pochez les œufs quelques minutes pour un jaune qui coule ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits à votre goût. Retirer de la poêle à l''aide d''une écumoire. Servir chaque portion de hachis garnie d''un œuf."]','2026-01-11 00:17:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12315,6397,'fr','Curry de haricots beurre','Les haricots beurre de ce curry végétarien créent une texture satisfaisante. Nous les avons associés à de l''aubergine à la peau foncée, riche en antioxydants.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons (320 g), finement hachés","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement râpé","3 grosses gousses d''ail, finement râpées","1 piment rouge épépiné et tranché","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre","2 cuillères à café de poudre de bouillon végétalien","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry moyenne","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 aubergine (320g), coupée en cubes","15 g de coriandre hachée","Sachet de 250 g de riz complet cuit","2 petites bananes pelées et hachées finement","½ citron vert, jus","¼ de concombre , haché finement","1 petit oignon rouge (60g), finement haché","1 piment rouge épépiné et tranché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez le gingembre, l''ail et le piment et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes. Mesurez 300 ml du liquide des boîtes de haricots beurre dans un pichet et mélangez-y la poudre de bouillon pour obtenir un bouillon (ne vous inquiétez pas s''il est épais ou grumeleux car il se dissoudra dans la poêle pendant la cuisson).","Incorporer les graines de cumin et la poudre de curry aux oignons, suivis des tomates, des haricots et de l''aubergine. Ajoutez le bouillon. Porter à ébullition. Réduisez le feu à moyen-doux, couvrez et laissez mijoter pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres. Incorporer la moitié de la coriandre. Retirer du feu.","Pour la raita, mélangez les bananes dans le jus de citron vert. Ajoutez le concombre, l''oignon, le piment et le reste de la coriandre. Réchauffez le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage et servez-le avec la moitié du curry et de la raita. Refroidissez et réfrigérez le reste du curry et de la raita pour préparer nos wraps au curry aux haricots beurre. Le curry se conservera au frais jusqu''à trois jours. La raita se conserve au frais pendant une journée."]','2026-01-11 00:17:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12316,6399,'fr','Crespolini aux épinards','Savourez ces crêpes d''épeautre saines fourrées aux épinards, à la ricotta et aux tomates – elles vous apportent la totalité de vos 5 par jour, et les épinards soutiennent la santé des os et des yeux.','["50g de farine complète d''épeautre","1 oeuf","100 ml de lait","½ cuillère à café d''huile de colza","250 g de bébés épinards","généreuse râpe de muscade","1 grosse gousse d''ail, finement râpée","80 g de gazon","2 cuillères à soupe de fromage à pâte dure végétarien à l''italienne, finement râpé","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","10g de basilic","½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre balsamique","1 petit oignon rouge (environ 80 g), finement haché","80 g de céleri coupé en dés","3 poignées de roquette","160 g de tomates cerises"]','["Fouetter la farine et l''œuf ensemble, puis incorporer progressivement le lait pour créer une pâte onctueuse de type crêpe. Verser dans une carafe.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive de 19 cm à feu moyen, versez-y un quart de la pâte et remuez pour couvrir le fond. Cuire brièvement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste pris, puis retourner à l''aide d''un couteau à palette et cuire l''autre côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste doré. Soulever sur une assiette, puis répéter avec le reste de la pâte pour faire quatre crêpes au total.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une deuxième grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites revenir les épinards, la muscade et l''ail pendant environ 5 minutes en remuant avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient complètement fanés. Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement, puis incorporer la ricotta. Versez un quart des épinards au centre de chaque crêpe, puis roulez-les en saucisse et disposez-les bien dans un plat allant au four. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Pour préparer la sauce, mettez les tomates en conserve, le basilic, le bouillon et l''ail dans un bol et mixez à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse (ou faites-le dans un bol mixeur). Versez la sauce sur les crêpes et répartissez sur le fromage. Cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bouillonnants sur les bords. Pour la salade, mélanger le vinaigre, l''oignon et le céleri. Juste avant de servir, mélangez le mélange d''oignons avec la roquette et les tomates et servez avec les crêpes farcies."]','2026-01-11 00:17:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12317,6401,'fr','Concombres chauds aux herbes et au citron','Saviez-vous que réchauffer les concombres rehausse leur saveur fraîche ? Pour finir, tout ce dont ce plat d''accompagnement d''été a besoin est une pincée d''aneth et de persil frais, ainsi que du citron.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","une petite poignée de menthe hachée","2 concombres, coupés en fins rubans à l''aide d''un épluche-légumes","une petite poignée d''aneth haché","une petite poignée de persil haché","½ citron zesté et pressé"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole et faites revenir la menthe hachée pendant 1 min avant d''incorporer délicatement les rubans de concombre. Mélangez et laissez cuire encore 2 à 3 minutes pour les réchauffer.","Retirer du feu et mélanger l''aneth, le persil et un filet de jus de citron. Versez sur une assiette, arrosez de jus de citron si vous le souhaitez et saupoudrez de zeste de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:17:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12318,6403,'fr','Bol de burrito végétalien','Ce bol de riz nourrissant est garni de haricots noirs épicés, de maïs doux, d''avocat et de citron vert. Il regorge de fibres, compte pour 4 sur 5 par jour et est faible en graisses saturées.','["250 g de riz brun facile à cuire","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de poudre de piment fort","1 cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes (sans gluten, si besoin)","400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","4 tomates, hachées","1 petit oignon rouge finement haché, environ 75g","20 g de coriandre fraîche hachée","2 citrons verts, jus","2 avocats","2 boîtes de 198 g de maïs doux"]','["Versez le riz et 600 ml d''eau dans une casserole, puis incorporez la purée de tomates, le cumin, le piment et la poudre de bouillon. Couvrir et laisser cuire à feu doux pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et qu''il ait absorbé le liquide. Retirer du feu et incorporer les haricots noirs.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les tomates avec l''oignon rouge, la coriandre et le jus d''1 citron vert pour faire une salsa. Écrasez grossièrement le jus de citron vert restant avec les avocats pour créer une texture épaisse.","Versez le riz dans quatre bols ou récipients rigides (refroidissez d''abord la moitié que vous conservez pour un autre jour). Garnir de salsa aux tomates, d''avocat et de maïs. Le riz se conservera jusqu''à deux jours – il suffit de préparer les garnitures fraîches le jour même."]','2026-01-11 00:17:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12319,6405,'fr','Pâtes aux olives, chou-fleur et harissa','L''harissa ajoute de la couleur et de la chaleur à ce plat de pâtes végétalien en milieu de semaine, avec du chou-fleur frit, des olives vertes et du persil. Ajoutez plus de harissa, si vous l''aimez épicée','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 petit chou-fleur cassé en petits bouquets, tiges et feuilles finement hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","200 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","25 g d''olives vertes dénoyautées, coupées en deux","2 cuillères à soupe de harissa à la rose","150 g de pâtes complètes sans produits laitiers de votre choix (comme des pappardelles ; sans gluten si besoin)","une petite poignée de persil finement haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif et versez-y les fleurons, les tiges et les feuilles de chou-fleur. Assaisonnez, couvrez et faites frire pendant 8 à 10 minutes, en secouant la poêle de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient légèrement dorées et ramollies. Mélangez le concentré de tomates et les tomates, couvrez et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates éclatent. Ajouter l''ail, les olives et la harissa et cuire 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions du paquet. Égoutter en réservant une tasse d''eau. Incorporer les pâtes et un peu d''eau au mélange de tomates. Assaisonner, parsemer de persil et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12320,6407,'fr','Dîner rôti à la friteuse à air','Oubliez d’allumer le four pour cuisiner le grand repas du dimanche : préparez les principaux éléments dans une friteuse à air. Utilisez un micro-ondes pour chauffer la sauce plutôt que sur la plaque de cuisson','["2-3 pommes de terre moyennes, pelées et coupées en quartiers","3 cuillères à café d''huile végétale, d''olive ou de colza","1 grosse ou 2 petites poitrines de poulet, avec la peau","3 carottes moyennes, pelées et coupées en bâtonnets","100 g de petits pois surgelés","sauce, pour servir"]','["Faites tremper les pommes de terre dans l''eau pendant 30 minutes, puis égouttez-les et rincez-les. Faites chauffer la friteuse pendant 2 minutes. Séchez soigneusement les pommes de terre, puis mettez-les dans un bol, arrosez d''1 cuillère à café d''huile et assaisonnez de sel et de poivre. À l''aide de vos mains ou d''une cuillère, enduisez les pommes de terre d''huile, puis mettez-les dans le panier de la friteuse, en une seule couche si possible. Cuire 10 min à 190°C.","Pendant ce temps, enduisez le poulet d’une autre cuillère à café d’huile et assaisonnez avec du sel et du poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Une fois les pommes de terre cuites 10 minutes, déplacez-les sur les côtés et déposez le poulet au centre du panier. Cuire 10 min.","Enrober les carottes du reste de l''huile. Après 10 minutes de cuisson du poulet, retirez-le du panier et ajoutez les carottes mélangées aux pommes de terre, puis déplacez les deux sur les côtés et remettez le poulet au centre. Cuire 10-15 min, toujours à 190°C. À ce stade, le poulet doit être cuit – vérifiez en insérant un couteau dans la partie la plus épaisse et en vérifiant que le jus est clair. Alternativement, un thermomètre à viande devrait indiquer 70 °C. Si ce n’est pas tout à fait cuit, laissez cuire encore 5 minutes. Retirez le poulet et placez-le sous un morceau de papier d''aluminium.","Mettez les petits pois dans un petit plat ou une tasse allant au four avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau et couvrez de papier d''aluminium pour empêcher toute humidité de s''échapper. Mettre dans le panier de la friteuse où se trouvait le poulet et cuire encore 10 minutes à 190°C. Les pommes de terre doivent être dorées et croustillantes, les carottes tendres et les petits pois bien chauds. Trancher la poitrine de poulet et servir avec les légumes et la sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:17:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12321,6411,'fr','Tarte aux légumes verts crémeuse','Savourez cette tarte végétarienne saine et faible en calories pour un dîner en famille facile. Il est rempli de haricots beurre, de chou frisé, de poireaux et de pois et garni de pâte filo','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 poireaux, coupés en deux et hachés finement","300 g de chou frisé ou de chou ou un mélange, râpé","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre, égouttés et rincés","200 g de petits pois surgelés","200 ml de bouillon de légumes faible en gras","3 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche allégée","3 cuillères à soupe de pesto frais (vérifiez l''étiquette pour vous assurer qu''il est végétarien si nécessaire)","1 citron, zesté et pressé","250 g de feuilles de pâte filo","1 cuillère à café de graines de nigelle (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une cocotte ronde peu profonde ou une poêle allant au four (la nôtre mesurait 23 cm) à feu moyen. Ajouter les poireaux et cuire 5 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez le chou frisé ou le chou et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit fané.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C/gaz 6. Verser les haricots beurre, les petits pois, le bouillon, la crème fraîche, le pesto ainsi que le jus et le zeste de citron. Mélangez, laissez mijoter 3 minutes et assaisonnez bien. Froissez les feuilles de filo et placez-les sur la garniture à tarte, badigeonnez du reste d''huile et saupoudrez de graines de nigelle, le cas échéant. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:17:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12322,6415,'fr','Bouchées de chicorée à la salade Waldorf','Associez ces bouchées de chicorée à la salade Waldorf avec un verre de pétillant pour une garden-party. Des collations rapides comme celles-ci se passeront bien et sont très simples à préparer','["2 têtes de chicorée (nous avons utilisé du rouge)","1 pomme verte, épépinée et hachée finement","1 branche de céleri, finement hachée","une petite poignée de noix hachées grossièrement","6 raisins rouges finement hachés","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature","½ citron, jus","1 cuillère à café de moutarde de Dijon","50 g de fromage bleu friable ou alternative végétarienne"]','["Coupez la racine de chaque tête de chicorée et séparez les feuilles individuelles (vous devriez obtenir 16 à 20 feuilles). Disposez les feuilles sur un grand plat de service (voir astuce ci-dessous).","Mélanger les morceaux de pomme, le céleri, les noix, les raisins, le yaourt, le jus de citron et la moutarde dans un bol et bien assaisonner. Versez un peu de garniture dans chacune des feuilles de chicorée vers l’extrémité de la racine, en laissant l’extrémité feuillue servir de poignée. Émietter sur le fromage bleu et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12323,6417,'fr','Grémolata','Rehaussez votre cuisine avec la gremolata, un mélange d''herbes, de zestes d''agrumes, d''ail et d''huile d''olive. Il ajoute de la fraîcheur et de la profondeur aux plats de viande, de poisson et de légumes rôtis.','["30 g de persil plat, feuilles et tiges","2 gousses d''ail, pelées","2 citrons non cirés, zestés et ½ citron, pressés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Hachez finement le persil, râpez finement l''ail, puis mélangez-le avec le zeste et le jus de citron dans un petit bol. Incorporer l''huile. Cela ressemblera à un mélange assez sec par rapport à un pesto ou à une vinaigrette, mais plus d''huile peut être ajoutée si vous préférez une consistance plus lâche. Pour servir, saupoudrer la gremolata sur la viande ou les légumes cuits."]','2026-01-11 00:17:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12324,6419,'fr','Restes de bols de céréales de dinde avec zaatar, salade de chou arc-en-ciel et yaourt à la harissa','Tirez le meilleur parti de vos restes de dinde et préparez ces bols de céréales avec de la salade de chou arc-en-ciel et une vinaigrette au tahini. Ils sont faciles et pleins de saveur','["4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt probiotique naturel","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa à la rose","200 g de riz sauvage cuit","200 g de lentilles du Puy ou noires cuites","2 cuillères à soupe d''herbes mélangées hachées (nous avons utilisé un mélange de menthe, persil et coriandre)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à soupe de zaatar","200 g de restes de dinde rôtie (vous pouvez utiliser un mélange de viande blanche et brune)","1 avocat, dénoyauté, coupé en deux, pelé et tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille grillées","1 cuillère à café de sirop d''érable","grosse pincée de poivre blanc","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","1⁄2 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 clémentine, jus","1 citron, jus","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, râpée","1 cuillère à café de gingembre râpé","1⁄2 cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","1⁄4 petit chou rouge, tranché finement","4 carottes, coupées en julienne ou râpées","100 g de choux de Bruxelles finement tranchés","1 panais, pelé et coupé en julienne ou râpé","1 pomme, pelée, épépinée et coupée en julienne ou râpée","1⁄2 oignon rouge, finement tranché","1 piment vert, finement tranché"]','["Mélangez le yaourt et la harissa et réservez. Pour faire la vinaigrette, versez le sirop d''érable, le poivre blanc, une grosse pincée de sel, le tahini, le curcuma, le jus de clémentine, la moitié du jus de citron, l''huile, 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau chaude, l''ail, le gingembre et le poivre de Cayenne dans un petit robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit crémeux. Goûtez et rectifiez l''assaisonnement avec un peu plus de citron ou de sel, selon vos besoins.","Mélanger tous les ingrédients de la salade de chou ensemble dans un grand bol. Assaisonnez bien, puis arrosez avec la majeure partie de la vinaigrette et mélangez à nouveau pour bien enrober. Dans un autre grand bol, mélanger le riz cuit, les lentilles et les herbes. Assaisonner avec le jus de citron restant, l''huile d''olive et un peu d''assaisonnement. Répartissez le zaatar sur les restes de dinde. Répartissez le mélange de céréales dans quatre bols de service et disposez dessus la dinde assaisonnée, les tranches d''avocat et la salade de chou. Répartissez sur les graines de citrouille et terminez avec une cuillerée de yaourt harissa. Servir le reste de la vinaigrette à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:17:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12325,6421,'fr','Boulettes d''agneau & taboulé au tahini vert','Combinez les céréales et la betterave avec des boulettes de viande d''agneau et une vinaigrette au tahini pour préparer ce souper rapide et facile, plein de textures et de saveurs.','["2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt sans gras","½ petit bouquet de persil","1 citron, jus","½ petite gousse d''ail","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","10-12 boulettes de viande d''agneau prêtes à l''emploi","2 sachets de 250 g de grains mélangés","4 betteraves cuites, hachées","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","200 g de petites tomates coupées en deux","50 g d''olives noires dénoyautées, coupées en deux","1 concombre, pelé et coupé en cubes","½ cuillère à soupe de zaatar"]','["Mélangez le tahini, le yaourt, le persil, le jus de citron, l''ail, 2-3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et une pincée de sel dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à consistance lisse. Annuler.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites cuire les boulettes de viande à feu moyen pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites, en les retournant régulièrement.","Réchauffez les grains en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Laisser refroidir un peu, puis mélanger avec le reste des ingrédients. Saison. Répartir dans quatre assiettes, garnir de boulettes de viande et arroser de vinaigrette au tahini."]','2026-01-11 00:17:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12326,6423,'fr','Soupe saine aux boulettes de viande et aux nouilles','Réchauffez-vous lors des soirées froides avec ce bouillon aromatique dans une casserole avec des boulettes de viande de porc et des nouilles. Nous nous sommes inspirés des saveurs pho vietnamiennes','["1 fournée de boulettes de viande (voir recette dans ''Se marie bien avec''))","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","8 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","Anis étoilé 2","1 bâton de cannelle","2 bâtonnets de citronnelle, feuilles extérieures coriaces enlevées et finement tranchées","1-2 piments verts (épépinés si vous préférez moins de piquant), finement tranchés","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles et tiges séparées, toutes deux finement hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de cassonade légère","1¼ litre de bouillon de bœuf","1-2 cuillères à café de sauce de poisson","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja, plus un peu pour servir","2 poignées de germes de soja prêts à consommer","3 nids de nouilles de riz","1 citron vert, coupé en quartiers"]','["Préparez les boulettes de viande (voir recette dans « S''accorde bien avec »), puis faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen. Faites frire les boulettes de viande par lots, en les retournant toutes les 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient entièrement dorées. Retirez la casserole du feu, transférez les boulettes de viande dans une assiette et réservez.","Mettez dans la casserole le gingembre, les trois quarts des oignons nouveaux, l''anis étoilé, la cannelle, la citronnelle, la moitié du piment vert, les tiges de coriandre, le sucre et le bouillon de bœuf, et portez à ébullition sur feu moyen. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que la citronnelle soit devenue tendre et que les saveurs se soient infusées.","Ajouter les boulettes de viande et laisser mijoter pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient bien cuites, puis ajouter la sauce de poisson au goût, ainsi que la sauce soja et le poivre noir fraîchement moulu. Ajoutez les germes de soja, augmentez le feu à moyen-vif et laissez cuire encore 3 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les nouilles en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Bien égoutter et répartir dans quatre bols. Garnir avec les boulettes de viande et le bouillon, en retirant la cannelle et l''anis étoilé. Répartir le reste des oignons nouveaux, des feuilles de piment et de coriandre et servir avec des quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:17:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12327,6425,'fr','Chiu Chow a frappé le concombre','Dégustez ce concombre épicé avec un steak, si vous le souhaitez, ou comme apéritif. « Frapper » le concombre permet à la marinade d''être absorbée par la chair','["1 concombre","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja légère Lee Kum Kee Premium","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de riz assaisonné Lee Kum Kee","1-2 cuillères à café d''huile de piment Lee Kum Kee Chiu Chow, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez le concombre sur une planche à découper et écrasez-le légèrement sur toute la longueur à l''aide d''un rouleau à pâtisserie ou en utilisant votre poing pour appuyer sur la lame plate d''un couperet – vous voulez casser un peu la chair mais pas la réduire en pulpe. Coupez le concombre en deux et retirez les graines, puis coupez la chair en petits morceaux. Saupoudrez environ ½ cuillère à café de sel marin (vous pouvez le faire sur la planche à découper), laissez reposer 10 minutes, puis rincez bien à l''eau froide et égouttez.","Mélangez l''ail, le sucre, la sauce soja légère de qualité supérieure et le vinaigre de riz assaisonné avec l''huile de piment Chiu Chow dans un bol de service. Ajoutez le concombre et laissez mariner 10 min. Servir avec plus d''huile de piment en accompagnement, si vous le souhaitez, pour ceux qui préfèrent plus d''épices."]','2026-01-11 00:17:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12328,6427,'fr','Udon sauté au sésame et aux oignons nouveaux avec tofu croustillant','Faites quelque chose de différent pour le dîner avec notre sauté végétalien de nouilles, de tofu, de haricots verts et d''oignons nouveaux. C’est rapide et sain, et c’est aussi économique','["400 g de tofu ferme en bloc","1 cuillère à soupe de farine de maïs","½ à 1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment, au goût","¼-½ cuillère à café de grains de poivre du Sichuan, moulus, au goût","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","botte d''oignons nouveaux, parés et coupés en longueurs","200 g de haricots verts parés et coupés en longueurs","400 g de nouilles udon épaisses prêtes à l''emploi","½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de sésame","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame, plus une pincée pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel, plus un peu pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de riz"]','["Égouttez et séchez le tofu avec du papier absorbant. Coupez-le en cubes, enveloppez-le dans du papier absorbant et placez une planche épaisse sur le dessus. Laisser égoutter 15 min.","Mélangez la maïzena, les flocons de piment et les grains de poivre moulus dans un bol avec une pincée de sel, puis ajoutez le tofu égoutté. Bien mélanger pour enrober.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile végétale dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu vif et faites revenir les morceaux de tofu pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient entièrement dorés. Retirer de la poêle et laisser égoutter sur du papier absorbant.","Ajoutez le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et faites revenir les oignons nouveaux et les haricots pendant 3 à 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et légèrement dorés. Versez une bouilloire d''eau bouillante sur les nouilles dans une passoire pour les décoller. Bien égoutter, puis verser dans la poêle. Faire revenir quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud. Ajoutez l''huile de sésame et les graines de sésame et faites grésiller quelques secondes. Versez la sauce soja, le vinaigre de riz, puis ajoutez le tofu. Bien mélanger, puis servir dans des bols avec une pincée de graines de sésame sur le dessus et un peu de sauce soja en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:17:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12329,6431,'fr','Spaghettis aux crevettes et à l''harissa','Essayez notre dîner spaghetti pour deux, avec gambas et vinaigrette harissa. Cela ne prend que 20 minutes à préparer et est également sain : idéal pour un repas en milieu de semaine ou pour une occasion spéciale comme la Saint-Valentin.','["100 g de brocoli à tige longue, coupé en trois","180 g de spaghettis séchés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 grosse gousse d''ail, légèrement écrasée","150 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","150 g de crevettes crues","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de pâte de harissa à la rose","1 citron finement zesté"]','["Portez à ébullition une casserole d''eau légèrement salée. Ajouter le brocoli et faire bouillir pendant 1 min 30 secondes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Égoutter et réserver. Faites cuire les pâtes selon les indications du paquet, puis égouttez-les en réservant une louche d''eau de cuisson.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez la gousse d''ail et faites revenir à feu doux pendant 2 minutes. Retirer avec une écumoire et jeter en laissant l''huile aromatisée.","Ajoutez les tomates dans la poêle et faites-les revenir à feu moyen pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir et à devenir juteuses. Incorporer les crevettes et cuire 2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles deviennent roses. Ajouter la harissa et le zeste de citron en remuant pour bien enrober.","Mélanger les spaghettis cuits et l''eau des pâtes dans les crevettes et la harissa, assaisonner au goût et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12330,6433,'fr','Porc au parmesan avec spaghetti aux tomates et aux olives','Ce dîner sain et équilibré est prêt en moins de 45 minutes et regorge de protéines maigres, de fibres, de calcium, de vitamine C, de fer et de trois de vos 5 par jour.','["300 g de filet de porc maigre, coupé en 6 tranches égales","3 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","3 cuillères à café de sauge fraîche finement hachée","4 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","15 g de parmesan très finement râpé","1 grosse carotte (215 g), hachée","3 branches de céleri (165 g), hachées","6 olives Kalamata, tranchées finement","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","150 g de spaghettis complets","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","une grosse poignée de persil haché (environ 10 g)"]','["Mettez le porc dans un bol avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile, 1 cuillère à café de sauge, 1 gousse d''ail et beaucoup de poivre noir. Bien mélanger, disposer sur une plaque et parsemer de fromage.","Faites chauffer les 2 cuillères à café d''huile restantes dans une poêle et faites revenir la carotte, le céleri et le reste de l''ail et de la sauge pendant 5 minutes, en remuant fréquemment. Ajoutez les olives, la purée de tomates, le bouillon et 200 ml d''eau, couvrez et laissez cuire 5 à 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les spaghettis en suivant les instructions du paquet et faites chauffer le gril. Griller le porc 6 min, puis laisser reposer. Égouttez les spaghettis en réservant un peu d''eau et mélangez-les aux légumes avec les tomates et le persil. Ajoutez l''eau pour détendre, puis servez avec le porc."]','2026-01-11 00:17:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12331,6435,'fr','Galettes d''avoine du Staffordshire aux champignons','Préparez des crêpes salées pour le petit-déjeuner avec du porridge d''avoine. La recette est également végétalienne et saine, fournissant du folate, des fibres, du fer et deux de vos 5 par jour.','["85 g de flocons d''avoine","85 g de farine complète nature","½ cuillère à café de levure séchée","4 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","320 g de champignons de Paris émincés","4 tomates, chacune coupée en 8 quartiers","4 cuillères à soupe de graines moulues de lin et de chia","4 cuillères à soupe de tahin","quelques brins de coriandre hachés"]','["Pour les galettes d''avoine, versez les flocons d''avoine et 350 ml d''eau dans un bol et mixez avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporer la farine et la levure, couvrir et laisser au réfrigérateur toute la nuit, ou laisser à température ambiante pendant 2-3 heures jusqu''à ce que des bulles apparaissent.","Utilisez du papier absorbant pour frotter ½ cuillère à café d''huile autour d''une poêle antiadhésive, puis faites chauffer. Versez un quart de la pâte et faites tourner la poêle pour couvrir le fond. Cuire 2 minutes, puis retourner et cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Préparez quatre galettes d''avoine de la même manière. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, détendez-en deux pendant un autre jour. Se conserve, couvert au réfrigérateur, pendant deux jours.","Pour préparer la garniture de deux galettes d''avoine, faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez 160 g de champignons et faites-les revenir pendant 2-3 minutes, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporez 2 tomates, puis ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe de graines moulues et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes. Réchauffez les galettes d''avoine dans une poêle sèche ou au micro-ondes si nécessaire, puis tartinez chacune d''elles avec 1 cuillère à soupe de tahini, le mélange de champignons et parsemez d''un peu de coriandre avant de servir. Le deuxième jour, répétez l''étape 3 avec le reste des ingrédients."]','2026-01-11 00:17:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12332,6437,'fr','Caponata au four','Cette pâtisserie végétarienne saine et réconfortante est garnie de tranches de pommes de terre au fromage et en paquets dans chacun de vos 5 repas par jour, ainsi que de calcium, de vitamine C, de fer et de fibres.','["700 g de pommes de terre moyennes (environ 6), tranchées finement","4 cuillères à soupe de lait","85 g de cheddar affiné finement râpé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons (320 g), finement hachés","4 cuillères à café de vinaigre balsamique","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 aubergines coupées en morceaux","2 poivrons rouges (540 g), épépinés et hachés","30 g de basilic, feuilles cueillies et hachées finement","3 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","10 olives Kalamata, dénoyautées et coupées en deux","2 cuillères à café de câpres","⅓ x 30 g de persil plat haché","320 g de fleurons de brocoli"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Faites bouillir les tranches de pommes de terre pendant 10 minutes, puis égouttez-les, versez-les dans un bol (ne vous inquiétez pas si elles se cassent un peu) et ajoutez le lait et la moitié du fromage. Mélanger.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Verser le vinaigre balsamique et la poudre de bouillon, puis incorporer les tomates, l''aubergine, les poivrons, le basilic et l''ail. Couvrir et cuire 20 minutes en remuant fréquemment et en ajoutant un peu d''eau si nécessaire, jusqu''à ce que l''aubergine soit tendre au couteau.","Retirer du feu et incorporer les olives, les câpres et le persil. Verser dans deux plats peu profonds allant au four. Couvrir de pommes de terre et saupoudrer du reste de fromage.","Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, faites griller celui que vous mangez maintenant jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Pendant la cuisson, faites cuire à la vapeur ou faites bouillir la moitié du brocoli pour accompagner la cuisson. Pour réchauffer le deuxième jour, chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et cuire au four pendant 30 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il bouillonne et soit doré. Faites cuire le reste du brocoli et servez-le avec."]','2026-01-11 00:17:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12333,6439,'fr','Falafel au four et taboulé de chou-fleur, sauce tahini verte et oignons nouveaux carbonisés','Oubliez les sandwichs détrempés pour le déjeuner et essayez ces falafels faciles, servis avec un délicieux taboulé de chou-fleur, une sauce tahini et des oignons nouveaux carbonisés.','["400 g de pois chiches en boîte égouttés (ou 85 g de pois chiches secs trempés dans 500 ml d''eau froide pendant une nuit, puis égouttés)","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","¼ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","½ petit oignon rouge, haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique (sans gluten si vous le souhaitez)","petit bouquet de persil, tiges et feuilles séparées, feuilles hachées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus 1 cuillère à café","½ petit chou-fleur, coupé en bouquets","½ petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles hachées","1 citron, jus","6 oignons nouveaux, conservés entiers, garnis et équeutés","poignée de fusée","½ petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges et tout","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin"]','["Chauffer le four à 200 C/180 C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Versez les pois chiches, ½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu, ½ cuillère à café de coriandre moulue, le poivre de Cayenne, l''oignon rouge, 1 gousse d''ail, les graines de sésame, la levure chimique, les tiges de persil et ½ cuillère à soupe d''eau dans un robot culinaire. Mélangez jusqu''à ce que tout soit combiné mais pas pâteux : vous voulez que le falafel ait une certaine texture, plutôt que de ressembler à du houmous. Assaisonner au goût, puis rouler en 18 boules de taille égale. Aplatissez chaque boule en forme de disque et placez-les sur la plaque à pâtisserie (plus la surface est grande, plus elles deviendront croustillantes). Badigeonnez-les de ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile. Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes.","Pendant ce temps, nettoyez le robot culinaire. Pulsez brièvement le chou-fleur jusqu''à obtenir une consistance de « couscous ». Mélangez le chou-fleur avec le reste des épices moulues, ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive et l''assaisonnement. Verser sur une plaque à pâtisserie et rôtir pendant 10 à 12 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement grillés. Une fois refroidi, mélangez le persil haché, la menthe et la moitié du jus de citron. Assaisonner au goût.","Chauffez le gril à feu vif (cela peut être fait la veille, si vous le souhaitez). Badigeonnez les oignons nouveaux d''1 cuillère à café d''huile, assaisonnez, puis faites-les griller jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et carbonisés pendant environ 5 minutes, en les retournant à mi-cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, mixez la roquette, la coriandre, le reste de l''ail, le jus de citron et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient vert vif. Mettez le tahini dans un bol, puis ajoutez progressivement l''eau aux herbes jusqu''à ce que le tahini se détache pour obtenir une consistance de sauce. Assaisonner au goût.","Répartissez le tahini vert et les oignons nouveaux entre les falafels et le taboulé cuits au four dans des bols."]','2026-01-11 00:17:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12334,6441,'fr','Falafel au four et taboulé de chou-fleur','Préparez un lot de nos falafels faciles à cuire pour une option de déjeuner savoureuse et faible en calories. Cette recette simple et saine est parfaite pour accompagner beaucoup de salade.','["3 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés (ou 250 g de pois chiches secs, trempés dans 1 litre d''eau froide toute une nuit, puis égouttés)","3 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","1 oignon rouge, coupé en quartiers","3 gousses d''ail","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame","1 ½ cuillère à café de levure chimique (sans gluten, si vous le souhaitez)","2 petits paquets de persil, tiges et feuilles séparées, feuilles hachées","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 chou-fleur, coupé en gros bouquets","1 petit paquet de menthe, feuilles hachées et tiges jetées","1 citron, jus"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Versez les pois chiches, 2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu, 1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue, le poivre de Cayenne, l''oignon, l''ail, les graines de sésame, la levure chimique, les tiges de persil et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau dans un robot culinaire. Blitz jusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné mais pas lisse (vous voulez que le falafel ait une certaine texture, plutôt que d''avoir la consistance du houmous). Assaisonner au goût, puis rouler en 18 boules de taille égale. Aplatissez chaque boule en forme de disque et disposez-la sur les plaques à pâtisserie, puis badigeonnez le dessus avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile. Cuire au four 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants, en les retournant à mi-cuisson.","Pendant ce temps, nettoyez le robot culinaire, puis versez-y le chou-fleur et mélangez brièvement jusqu''à ce qu''il ressemble à du couscous. Mélangez le couscous de chou-fleur avec le reste des épices moulues et de l''huile d''olive, puis ajoutez un peu d''assaisonnement. Versez sur une plaque à rôtir et faites rôtir pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient légèrement grillés, en remuant de temps en temps.","Sortir du four et laisser refroidir, puis mélanger les feuilles de persil, les feuilles de menthe et le jus de citron. Assaisonner au goût. Se conserve trois jours au réfrigérateur. Servez les falafels cuits au four avec le taboulé de chou-fleur et un peu de salade, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:17:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12335,6443,'fr','Bolognese végétalienne','Essayez notre copieuse bolognaise végétalienne pour un repas rapide et sain pour deux. Notre plat de pâtes simple contient quatre de vos cinq plats par jour et il est même faible en gras','["180 g de spaghettis","2 x portions de ragoût végétalien (voir « Se marie bien avec » pour la recette)","une poignée de feuilles de basilic frais"]','["Faites cuire les spaghettis dans une grande casserole d''eau salée pendant 1 min de moins que les instructions sur l''emballage. Réchauffez le ragoût. Égoutter les pâtes en réservant une louche d''eau, puis mélanger les spaghettis dans la sauce en utilisant un peu de liquide pour détacher légèrement le ragoût. Servir garni de basilic frais et de poivre noir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12336,6445,'fr','Pudding au chocolat et au chia','Préparez un pudding au chocolat savoureux et sain en seulement cinq minutes. C''est faible en calories et végétalien également, et les graines de chia sont une excellente source d''acides gras oméga-3.','["60 g de graines de chia","400 ml de lait d''amande ou de noisette non sucré","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable","½ cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","éclats de cacao, mélangés","baies surgelées, pour servir"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un grand bol avec une généreuse pincée de sel marin et fouettez pour combiner. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire puis laisser épaissir au réfrigérateur au moins 4 heures, voire toute une nuit.","Versez le pudding dans quatre verres, puis garnissez de baies surgelées et de grué de cacao."]','2026-01-11 00:17:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12337,6447,'fr','Curry de poulet katsu','Ce katsu plus sain est enrobé d''amandes effilées finement hachées et cuit au four (plutôt que frit) jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant et doré. Si vous suivez le régime alimentaire sain, alors c''est un excellent plat à ajouter à votre répertoire.','["25g d''amandes effilées","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza pressée à froid","2 poitrines de poulet désossées et sans peau (environ 300 g/11 oz au total)","quartiers de citron vert, à presser dessus","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza pressée à froid","1 oignon moyen, haché grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché finement","2 cuillères à café de poudre de curry moyenne","1 anis étoilé","¼ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de farine complète nature","100 g de riz brun à grains longs","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement (y compris la partie verte)","1 carotte moyenne, pelée en longues lanières avec un économe","? concombre, pelé en longues lanières avec un épluche-légumes","1 petit piment rouge finement haché (épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant)","jus ½ citron vert","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe","une petite poignée de feuilles de coriandre"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Cuire le riz brun dans beaucoup d''eau bouillante pendant 35 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très tendre.","Écrasez les amandes à l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier, ou passez-les au robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient finement hachées, puis saupoudrez-les sur une assiette. Beurrer une petite plaque à pâtisserie avec un peu d''huile. Badigeonner le poulet des deux côtés avec le reste de l''huile et bien assaisonner. Enduisez le poulet de noix et placez-le sur le plateau. Pressez les noix restantes de l’assiette sur chaque poitrine. Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et bien cuits. Laisser reposer 4 à 5 minutes sur la plaque, puis trancher épaissement.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole antiadhésive moyenne et ajoutez l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre. Couvrir légèrement la poêle et faire frire doucement pendant 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie et légèrement dorée, en remuant de temps en temps. Retirez le couvercle pendant les 2 dernières minutes et ne laissez pas l''ail brûler.","Incorporer la poudre de curry, l''anis étoilé, le curcuma et une bonne mouture de poivre noir. Cuire encore quelques secondes en remuant. Saupoudrer de farine et bien mélanger. Ajoutez progressivement 400 ml d''eau dans la casserole en remuant constamment.","Portez la sauce à ébullition et laissez cuire 10 minutes en remuant de temps en temps. S’il commence à crépiter, couvrez-le sans serrer avec un couvercle. Retirez la casserole du feu et mixez la sauce avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très lisse. Ajustez l''assaisonnement selon votre goût. Gardez au chaud.","Une fois le riz tendre, ajoutez les oignons nouveaux et laissez cuire encore 1 min. Bien égoutter, puis laisser reposer quelques minutes le temps de préparer la salade. Mélangez la carotte et le concombre avec le piment, le jus de citron vert et les herbes.","Répartissez les tranches de poulet dans deux assiettes, versez dessus la sauce et servez avec le riz, la salade et les quartiers de citron vert à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:17:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12338,6449,'fr','Graines de Betrot, Feta et Asperges','La salade colorée de Tom Kime est une excellente option végétarienne pour les réceptions estivales','["une grosse poignée de feuilles fraîches d''origan ou de marjolaine","1 gousse d''ail","jus de 1½ citron","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","250 g de bottes d''asperges, coupées en longueurs de 3 cm","2 paquets de 250 g de betteraves fraîches bouillies, coupées en quartiers","le zeste d''1 citron","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","Sachet de 85 g de cresson débarrassé des grosses tiges","10 feuilles de basilic vert et 10 feuilles de basilic violet (ou 20 d''une même couleur)","400 g de feta ou de chèvre"]','["La veille : réaliser la vinaigrette. Mettez l''origan ou la marjolaine, un\r\npincée de sel et l''ail dans un robot culinaire et\r\nréduire en pâte. Ajoutez le jus de citron et fouettez jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse. Incorporer l''huile d''olive et assaisonner – cela devrait être\r\npiquant et un peu salé. Couvrir et réfrigérer.","Deux heures avant de servir : portez à ébullition une casserole d''eau salée, ajoutez le\r\nasperges et cuire 3 minutes. Égoutter et laisser refroidir\r\nsous le robinet froid. Couvrir et réserver au frais.","Mettez la betterave rouge dans un grand bol et mélangez-la aux deux tiers.\r\ndu pansement. Ajouter le zeste de citron et le printemps\r\noignons, couvrir et conserver au frais pièce avec\r\nle reste de la vinaigrette.","Pour servir : ajoutez le cresson à la betterave et déchirez le basilic.\r\nIncorporer les asperges et assaisonner avec du jus fraîchement moulu.\r\npoivre noir. Goûtez avant d''ajouter du sel car le fromage est\r\nassez salé. Mélangez légèrement pour ne pas tout teindre en rose,\r\npuis empilez-les dans un plat de service. Émietter sur le fromage\r\net versez le reste de la vinaigrette dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:17:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12339,6451,'fr','Le relooking ultime : le cocktail de crevettes','Essayez une version plus légère et moderne de cette entrée rétro toujours populaire','["650 g de crevettes dans leur carapace, cuites (pour donner 200 g de crevettes cuites et décortiquées)","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron vert","100 g de concombre","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth ciselé","1 petit avocat mûr","50g de cresson","pincée de poivre de Cayenne, pour saupoudrer","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","5 tbsp fromage frais","1½ cuillère à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","éclabousser de sauce Tabasco","éclabousser la sauce Worcestershire","1 cuillère à café de cognac"]','["Épluchez les crevettes. Rincez-les dans un\r\ngrand tamis sous un robinet froid, puis tapotez\r\nsécher avec du papier absorbant. Disposez les crevettes\r\ndans un plat peu profond et presser dessus\r\n1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert, puis ajoutez\r\nune touche de poivre. Annuler.","Coupez le concombre en petits dés\r\net verser dans un plat. Verser sur le\r\nvinaigre, parsemer d''aneth et d''un\r\nrâpe de poivre, puis réserver.\r\nCoupez l''avocat en deux, dénoyautez et épluchez-le,\r\npuis coupez-le en petits dés. Verser dessus\r\nle reste du jus de citron vert et mélanger\r\nensemble doucement avec une touche de poivre.","Pour la sauce, mélangez le\r\nmayonnaise, fromage frais et ketchup.\r\nIncorporer le Tabasco, le Worcestershire et\r\nbrandy avec une touche de poivre.","Pour servir, mettez une petite cuillerée de\r\nsauce au fond de chaque cocktail\r\nverre. Hachez très grossièrement la majeure partie\r\ncresson en laissant quelques brins entiers.\r\nDisposez dessus le cresson haché.\r\nla sauce. Bien égoutter le concombre, puis\r\nversez-le sur le cresson avec le\r\navocat. Empilez les crevettes, puis\r\nverser sur le reste de la sauce. Replier\r\ndans les brins de cresson et servir\r\navec une pincée de poivre de Cayenne."]','2026-01-11 00:17:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12340,6453,'fr','Ragoût de poisson épicé','Parfait avec du pain croustillant, ce ragoût simple et sain deviendra bientôt un favori – préparez-le avec du poulet si vous préférez','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de paprika","Boîte de 200 g de tomates concassées","1 poivron rouge épépiné, coupé en morceaux","450 g de filets de poisson blanc coupés en morceaux","une poignée de coriandre hachée grossièrement","1 citron, coupé en quartiers"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole. Ajoutez l''ail, le cumin et le paprika et laissez cuire 1 min. Ajoutez 100 ml d''eau et les tomates. Portez à ébullition, puis baissez le feu. Ajoutez le poivre, laissez mijoter 5 min. Ajoutez le poisson, laissez mijoter 5 min. Servir avec de la coriandre et un quartier de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:17:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12341,6455,'fr','Bœuf sauté à la sauce hoisin','Rapide, facile à préparer et sain','["1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de xérès sec","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à café de racine de gingembre frais finement hachée (ou de pâte de gingembre frais en pot)","200 g de steaks de surlonge maigres, tranchés finement dans le sens du grain","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 grosse carotte, coupée en allumettes","100 g de mangetout coupé en deux dans le sens de la longueur","140 g de champignons tranchés","3 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","Nouilles chinoises, pour servir"]','["Mélanger le soja\r\nsauce, xérès, huile de sésame,\r\nail\r\net le gingembre dans une assiette peu profonde.\r\nAjouter le steak et laisser reposer\r\nlaisser mariner environ 20\r\nminutes (ou plus, si vous\r\navoir le temps).","Faites chauffer un grand feu à base épaisse\r\npoêle ou un wok, ajoutez le\r\ngraines de sésame et pain grillé\r\nà feu vif, en remuant,\r\npendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Verser dans une assiette.","Au moment de cuisiner,\r\nfaites chauffer l''huile de tournesol dans une\r\ngrande poêle ou wok\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit chaud. Ajoutez le steak avec\r\nla marinade et le sauté\r\npendant 3-4 minutes à feu vif\r\nchauffer jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré.\r\nRetirer à l''aide d''une fente\r\nverser dans une assiette, en laissant\r\nle jus dans la poêle.","Faire revenir les carottes dans la poêle\r\net faire sauter quelques instants\r\nminutes, puis ajoutez le\r\nmangertout et cuisiner pour un\r\nencore 2 minutes.","Remettez le steak dans le\r\npoêle, ajoutez les champignons\r\net je jette tout\r\nensemble. Ajouter le hoisin\r\nsauce et faire sauter pour une finale\r\nminute. Saupoudrer de graines de sésame grillées et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:17:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12342,6457,'fr','Truite avec salade de pommes de terre crémeuse','Essayez de servir le poisson avec une salade de pommes de terre au goût frais au lieu de patates bouillies nature.','["250 g de pommes de terre à chair ferme, type Charlotte, pelées si vous le souhaitez et coupées en deux","4 cuillères à café de yaourt nature","4 cuillères à café de mayonnaise","1 citron, ½ zesté","1 cuillère à soupe de petites câpres rincées","4 petits cornichons ou cornichons, tranchés","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","¼ de concombre, coupé en dés","2 filets de truite"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre dans de l''eau salée\r\npendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres. Égoutter et\r\nrincer sous l''eau froide pour refroidir, puis\r\négoutter à nouveau. Faites chauffer le gril.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le yaourt\r\net la mayonnaise, puis assaisonner avec un\r\nun bon filet de citron. Incorporer délicatement\r\nles pommes de terre aux câpres, cornichons,\r\nla plupart de l''oignon nouveau et du concombre.","Assaisonner la truite, puis la faire griller sur une\r\nplaque à pâtisserie, côté peau vers le bas, pour\r\n3 à 4 minutes selon l''épaisseur,\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste cuit. Parsemer de citron\r\nzester et servir avec la salade de pommes de terre,\r\nparsemé du reste des oignons nouveaux.\r\nCoupez la moitié du citron restant en\r\ncales pour presser."]','2026-01-11 00:17:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12343,6463,'fr','Salade des îles grecques au poulet et avocat','La salade d''avocat colorée et estivale de Jill Dupleix est parfaite pour un buffet décontracté','["1,8 kg de poulet rôti, à température ambiante","2 coeurs de laitue romaine","4 tomates","3 oignons nouveaux","2 avocats mûrs","3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron, plus un peu pour presser","200 g de fromage feta en sachet","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","½ cuillère à café de menthe séchée","un demi-bouquet de persil plat","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","2 cuillères à soupe d''olives noires Kalamata","pain pitta, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Retirez la viande du poulet\r\net déchiquetez-le grossièrement. Coupez la base\r\nde chaque laitue, laver et sécher le\r\nfeuilles, puis râpez-les grossièrement.\r\nCoupez les tomates en quartiers.\r\nÉmincez finement les oignons nouveaux (à l''aide\r\nparties blanches et vertes). Couper\r\nles avocats en deux dans la longueur,\r\nenlever les pierres et\r\npeler. Couper en tranches transversalement,\r\net presser avec du jus de citron.\r\nÉmiettez la feta avec votre\r\ndoigts et mélangez-le avec le\r\norigan et menthe. Cueillir les feuilles\r\nretirer le persil et réserver.","Fouettez les 3 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron\r\navec l''huile d''olive, le sel marin et le poivre.\r\nDans un grand bol, mélanger le poulet,\r\nlaitue, tomates et oignons nouveaux,\r\npuis pliez sur les trois quarts de\r\nla vinaigrette aux avocats\r\n(avec attention, pour que les avocats ne\r\nrompre). Assaisonner de sel et\r\npoivrer, puis parsemer sur la feta,\r\nolives et persil, et arroser de\r\nle reste de la vinaigrette. Presser\r\njus de citron supplémentaire sur le dessus et servir\r\navec du pain pitta si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:17:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12344,6465,'fr','Bar poêlé au brocoli aux agrumes','Un souper de poisson de qualité restaurant, prêt en seulement une demi-heure','["2 filets de bar d''environ 140 g chacun (voir conseils ci-dessous)","1 petite tête de brocoli","1 orange","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 cuillères à soupe de petites câpres","6 anchois, hachés grossièrement","1 citron"]','["Avant de commencer à cuisiner, procurez-vous\r\ntout est préparé. Coupez chaque mer\r\nfilet de bar donc ils sont tous les deux pareils\r\nforme, puis incisez la peau en coupant dans le\r\nchair légèrement, 5 ou 6 fois à environ 1 cm\r\nintervalles. Annuler.","Segmentez l''orange – coupez-la\r\nhaut et bas, puis coupez les\r\npeau et moelle. Coupez chaque segment,\r\npuis pressez le jus du reste de\r\nl''orange dans un bol. Coupez le brocoli en\r\nfleurons de taille moyenne.","Pour préparer la salade tiède de brocolis,\r\ncuire les fleurons dans une casserole bouillante\r\neau salée pendant 1 min jusqu''à ce que\r\ncuit. Pendant que le brocoli cuit, mettez un\r\npoêle à frire sur le feu. Dès que le brocoli\r\nest cuit, égouttez-le puis versez-le directement dans le\r\npoêle chaude pour « brûler » toute l’humidité.","Éteignez le feu, puis dispersez le\r\nquartiers d''orange sur le brocoli.\r\nRemuer quelques instants juste pour réchauffer\r\nà travers, puis versez-le dans un bol et assaisonnez avec\r\nle jus d''orange et 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive. Saison\r\navec du poivre et une petite pincée de mer\r\nsalez, puis réservez.","Essuyez la poêle. Assaisonnez le poisson avec un peu de sel et\r\npoivrer juste avant la cuisson.\r\nFaites chauffer la poêle jusqu''à ce que\r\ntrès chaud, puis ajoutez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile. Poser le\r\nfilets de poisson dans la poêle, côté peau vers le bas.\r\nDès qu''il entre, appuyez sur chaque\r\nfileter avec les doigts ou un poisson\r\ntrancher pour l’empêcher de s’enrouler.","Réduisez le feu à moyen, puis\r\nlaisser cuire le poisson 3-4 minutes,\r\ntranquille, jusqu''à ce que vous puissiez voir cela\r\nla chair est cuite aux deux tiers\r\nde la montée et la peau est croustillante\r\net marron.","Retournez les filets, puis faites-les revenir sur le\r\ncôté chair pendant environ 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que juste\r\nterminé, en badigeonnant la peau avec l''huile\r\nla poêle pendant la cuisson. Laisser reposer au chaud\r\nassiette, peau vers le haut, et arrosez avec le\r\nl''huile chaude et le jus de la poêle.","Versez 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive dans la poêle et\r\nremettez-le sur feu vif. Disperser dans\r\nles câpres et les anchois, puis faites cuire\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à devenir croustillants. Râper sur le citron\r\nZester et presser le jus de la moitié du citron.\r\nS''il n''y a pas assez de jus dans la poêle pour\r\narroser les deux assiettes, ajouter un peu plus\r\nhuile. Vous êtes maintenant prêt à dresser votre assiette."]','2026-01-11 00:17:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12345,6467,'fr','Salade de courgettes à la menthe','Une salade fraîche et parfumée complète une tartinade d''antipasti méditerranéenne pour un repas d''été détendu','["½ oignon rouge, tranché finement","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","2 courgettes","une grosse poignée de feuilles de menthe","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Mélanger l''oignon et le jus de citron ensemble\r\navec un peu d''assaisonnement et réserver pour\r\n10 minutes. Au moment de servir, utilisez un\r\néplucheur de légumes pour trancher les courgettes\r\nen fins rubans. Mettre dans un bol avec le\r\noignon et jus de citron, zeste, menthe et huile.\r\nMélanger délicatement et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12346,6469,'fr','Bouillie protéinée','Augmentez la teneur en protéines de votre petit-déjeuner en ajoutant des garnitures riches en protéines à votre porridge. C''est idéal après une séance de sport','["80 g de flocons d''avoine","500 ml de lait (n''importe quelle sorte)","30 g de protéines en poudre (la vanille, le chocolat ou les baies fonctionnent bien)","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt à la grecque","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille, de chia, de lin ou de tournesol","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre de noix ou de graines","100 g de fruits frais ou surgelés (comme des baies, des bananes ou des pommes tranchées)","miel ou autre sirop, pour servir"]','["Cuire les flocons d''avoine et le lait dans une poêle à feu moyen-doux pendant 4 à 6 minutes, en remuant continuellement jusqu''à épaississement et crémeux. Retirer du feu et tamiser la poudre de protéines. Ajoutez un peu plus de lait ou d''eau pour détendre, si vous préférez une bouillie plus fine.","Répartir dans les bols et garnir des garnitures de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:17:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12347,6471,'fr','Barres protéinées','Préparez vos propres barres protéinées maison pour un boost après l''entraînement. Ils sont faits de poudre de protéines, de bananes, de beurre de noix et d''un mélange de graines','["150 g de flocons d''avoine","2 petites bananes (environ 160g), pelées et écrasées","100 ml de sirop d''érable","200 g de beurre d''amande, de cacahuète ou de tournesol","90 g de poudre de protéine de vanille","50 g de graines mélangées, plus 1 cuillère à soupe pour la garniture","1 cuillère à soupe d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de lait, n''importe quelle sorte (facultatif)","50 g de chocolat noir fondu"]','["Mettez les flocons d''avoine dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''ils ressemblent à de la farine. Ajouter la purée de banane, le sirop d''érable, le beurre de noix, la poudre de protéines, le mélange de graines et l''extrait de vanille. Mélangez à nouveau pour obtenir une pâte épaisse, en ajoutant le lait, si nécessaire, pour la rassembler.","Pressez la pâte dans un moule carré de 20 cm recouvert de papier sulfurisé, en vous assurant qu''elle forme une couche uniforme. Arroser de chocolat fondu et parsemer de 1 cuillère à soupe supplémentaire de graines mélangées et d''une pincée de flocons de sel marin. Mettre au frais 1 h avant de couper en barres. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à trois jours."]','2026-01-11 00:17:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12348,6473,'fr','Morue au four avec tomates, câpres et basilic','Dégustez du poisson blanc une fois par semaine pour un repas faible en gras et riche en protéines. Il fournit également des vitamines qui soutiennent le cœur, le cerveau et les os.','["200 g de pommes de terre nouvelles grelots (environ 12)","3 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","½ cuillère à café d''origan séché","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres","15 g de basilic haché","1 cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon de légumes","320 g de filets de cabillaud, en morceaux et sans peau","180 g de haricots verts fins"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Mélanger les pommes de terre avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile, l''origan et beaucoup de poivre noir moulu, puis répartir dans un plat allant au four et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir brièvement l''ail en remuant pour qu''il ne brûle pas. Ajoutez les tomates, les câpres, le basilic haché et le bouillon, puis laissez bouillonner à feu moyen jusqu''à obtenir une sauce épaisse – environ 5 minutes.","Sortez les pommes de terre du four et poussez-les jusqu''à une extrémité du plat. Versez la sauce dans l''autre extrémité et recouvrez de morue, puis remettez au four pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la morue se défasse au test, mais soit encore humide.","Pendant que le poisson cuit, faites bouillir les haricots verts pendant 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Empilez les haricots dans 2 assiettes pour former une pile, puis versez la sauce et la morue dessus. Ajouter les pommes de terre et servir parsemées de feuilles de basilic entières."]','2026-01-11 00:17:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12349,6475,'fr','Sauté de tempeh collant','Préparez ce sauté végétalien qui utilise du tempeh, une excellente source de protéines à base de graines de soja. Rapide et facile, cela ne prend que 30 minutes à réaliser','["2-3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","200 g de tempeh coupé en morceaux","1 oignon rouge , finement tranché","3 gousses d''ail , hachées grossièrement","1 bâton de citronnelle, coupé en trois (facultatif)","2 cm de gingembre pelé et haché grossièrement","1 piment rouge haché grossièrement (épépiné si vous préférez)","100 g de mange tout , tranché en biais","100 g de brocoli à longues tiges, haché","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja faible en sodium","1½ cuillère à soupe de cassonade","15 g de coriandre hachée grossièrement","Sachet de 200 g de riz brun cuit"]','["Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle awokor à feu vif. Une fois scintillant, faites frire le tempeh pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et carbonisé sur les bords. Retirer de la poêle et égoutter sur du papier absorbant.","Ajoutez un filet d''huile dans la poêle si elle est sèche, puis faites revenir l''oignon pendant 3-4 minutes en remuant continuellement. Une fois ramolli, ajoutez l''ail, la citronnelle (le cas échéant), le gingembre et le piment. Cuire pendant 3 minutes en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé.","Mélangez le mange-tout et le brocoli, puis versez 50 ml d''eau dans la casserole pour créer de la vapeur. Cuire 3-4 minutes. Ajouter la sauce soja et la cassonade. Remettez le tempeh dans la poêle et mélangez, en cuisant encore 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout soit tendre et collant. Incorporer la moitié de la coriandre.","Faites cuire le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, puis répartissez-le dans deux bols. Garnir du sauté et du reste de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:17:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12350,6477,'fr','Harissa de légumes au quinoa','Combinez du quinoa riche en protéines avec des légumes-racines pour profiter de vos cinq repas par jour. Le yaourt fermenté à la noix de coco ajouté aura également des bienfaits sur les bactéries intestinales.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons rouges (160g), hachés","1 poivron vert épépiné et coupé en cubes","1 petite patate douce (200 g), pelée et coupée en morceaux","2 grosses branches de céleri (125 g), coupées en grosses tranches","10 g de gingembre finement haché","300 ml de bouillon de légumes préparé avec 2 cuillères à café de poudre de bouillon végétalien","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte d''harissa","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 abricots secs, coupés en quartiers","10 g de coriandre ou de persil haché, plus quelques feuilles supplémentaires pour servir","Paquet de 250 g de quinoa rouge et blanc cuit","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt à la noix de coco"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir les légumes et le gingembre pendant 10 minutes en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et commencent à se colorer.","Incorporer le bouillon, la harissa, la purée de tomates et les abricots. Portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez mijoter 15 min. Incorporer la coriandre.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le quinoa en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Servir avec les légumes et le yaourt, ainsi qu''un peu de feuilles de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:17:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12351,6479,'fr','Boules de protéines','Préparez de délicieuses boules de protéines en utilisant de l''avoine, de la poudre de protéines, des graines de lin et de la cannelle pour en profiter après l''exercice et reconstituer vos réserves de protéines.','["150 g de flocons d''avoine","50g de protéine en poudre au choix (nous avons utilisé du lactosérum vanillé)","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de lin moulues","pincée de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable","150g de beurre de noix de votre choix (nous avons utilisé de la cacahuète)","4 cuillères à soupe de lait végétal","25 g de pépites de chocolat ou de raisins secs (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez les flocons d''avoine, la poudre de protéines, les graines de lin et la cannelle dans un grand bol. Incorporer le sirop d''érable, l''extrait de vanille, le beurre de noix, le lait et les pépites de chocolat.","Remuez bien pour bien mélanger le mélange, puis, avec les mains humides, roulez-le en 15 boules (elles doivent peser environ 30 g chacune). Disposer sur une assiette et réfrigérer 30 minutes jusqu''à consistance ferme, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12352,6483,'fr','Poitrine fumée','Allumez le fumoir pour cette savoureuse poitrine cuite lentement. Servir sur une planche avec des légumes verts carbonisés et de la salsa rossa pour que chacun puisse se servir','["2,5 kg de poitrine de bœuf","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment rouge","1 cuillère à café de poivre noir entier","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","1 cuillère à café de thym séché","2 cuillères à café de sucre demerara","2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","1 cuillère à café de paprika","1 cuillère à café de poudre d''oignon","1 cuillère à café de poudre d''ail","1 cuillère à café de moutarde en poudre","1 cuillère à café de sel"]','["Faire griller doucement le cumin, les flocons de piment, les grains de poivre, les graines de fenouil et le thym dans une poêle à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient aromatiques. Réduire en une fine poussière avec le sucre demerara à l''aide d''un mélangeur à épices ou d''un pilon et d''un mortier. Versez dans un bol et mélangez le reste des ingrédients du mélange.","Assaisonnez généreusement la poitrine avec le mélange et laissez reposer à température ambiante pendant une heure maximum. Préparez le fumoir pour une cuisson indirecte à 120-130C. Une fois prête, placez la poitrine assaisonnée sur le fumoir, côté gras vers le haut. Laisser agir 10 heures ou jusqu''à ce que l''extérieur soit d''une couleur acajou foncé. Remplissez le fumoir si nécessaire.","Retirez la poitrine et enveloppez-la dans du papier de boucherie. Remettez dans le fumoir et continuez la cuisson pendant 2-3 heures jusqu''à ce que la viande atteigne 93-94°C lorsqu''elle est sondée avec un thermomètre. Laisser reposer 40 minutes avant de trancher et de servir avec des légumes verts carbonisés et de la salsa rossa."]','2026-01-11 00:17:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12353,6485,'fr','Petit-déjeuner anglais à une poêle','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Elle combine tous les meilleurs ingrédients d''un petit-déjeuner anglais traditionnel dans une poêle à frire, sans rien hacher.','["4 chipolata de porc de bonne qualité","4 tranches de bacon fumé","140 g de champignons de Paris","6 œufs battus","8 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","une poignée de fromage râpé (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe de ciboulette ciselée"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive de taille moyenne, ajoutez les chipolatas et faites revenir 3 minutes. Ajoutez le bacon, en le retournant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à devenir croustillant, environ 5 minutes de plus. Ajoutez les champignons et poursuivez la cuisson encore 3 à 5 minutes. Égoutter tout excès de graisse et déplacer les ingrédients pour qu''ils soient uniformément répartis.","Assaisonnez les œufs, puis ajoutez-les à la poêle en remuant pour remplir les espaces. Remuez doucement avec une fourchette pendant 2 minutes à feu doux-moyen jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à prendre. Répartir sur les tomates, le fromage, le cas échéant, et la ciboulette, puis griller pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris. Coupez-le en quartiers et servez-le avec vos sauces préférées."]','2026-01-11 00:17:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12354,6487,'fr','Brochettes de poulet aux herbes','Un plat de poulet super sain avec une relish « sans cuisson »','["500 g de petites pommes de terre nouvelles – recherchez des paquets de pommes de terre nouvelles minuscules ou miniatures, ou choisissez les plus petites que vous pouvez trouver si elles sont vendues en vrac","3 cuillères à soupe de persil haché, de menthe et de ciboulette","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de jus de citron","500 g de poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en morceaux de 3 cm","1 oignon rouge, pelé","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en morceaux de 3 cm","1 citron, coupé en 8 quartiers","8 tomates mûres – les tomates de vigne ont tendance à avoir la meilleure saveur","2 piments verts épépinés et finement hachés","2 petites gousses d''ail, hachées finement","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc"]','["Si vous utilisez du bois ou du bambou\r\ntremper huit brochettes dans de l''eau froide\r\npendant environ une demi-heure. Cuire le\r\npommes de terre dans de l''eau bouillante salée pendant\r\n10-12 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres,\r\négoutter et laisser refroidir. Mélangez le\r\nherbes, huile, jus de citron, sel et\r\npoivrer dans un grand bol et ajouter le\r\npoulet et pommes de terre. Bien mélanger\r\njusqu''à ce que tout brille. Couper\r\nl''oignon en 6 quartiers, puis\r\nséparer les calques sur chacun\r\ncoin. Ajoutez l''oignon et le\r\npoivrer la marinade et mélanger\r\nà fond.","Pour préparer la relish, coupez-la en deux et\r\népépiner les tomates, puis hacher les\r\nla chair finement. Mélangez les tomates,\r\npiments, ail, huile, vinaigre, sel\r\net poivrer et verser dans un\r\npetit plat.","Enfilez le poulet, les pommes de terre,\r\npoivrons et oignons dessus\r\n8 brochettes finissant chacune par un\r\nquartier de citron. Griller directement\r\nà feu moyen-vif pendant 5-6\r\nminutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce que le\r\nle poulet est cuit. Servir empilé\r\nun plat de service avec la tomate\r\nsavourer."]','2026-01-11 00:17:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12355,6489,'fr','Omelettes miniatures à la ricotta','Ces petites omelettes – appelées frittatine en italien – constituent un merveilleux apéritif','["4 œufs","une petite poignée de persil plat, finement haché, plus des brins supplémentaires pour servir","une poignée de ciboulette finement ciselée","1 petite gousse d''ail, hachée finement","50 g de parmesan fraîchement râpé","huile d''olive, pour la friture","Pot de 250 g de ricotta","une poignée de basilic frais, déchiré","50 g de parmesan fraîchement râpé"]','["Battez les œufs avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau, puis assaisonnez si vous le souhaitez. Incorporer le persil, la ciboulette, l''ail et le parmesan.","Faites chauffer une poêle à fond épais de 23 cm à feu moyen avec un peu d''huile. Lorsque l’huile est chaude, ajoutez une louche (environ un tiers) du mélange d’œufs et versez le mélange pour qu’il recouvre le fond. Réduisez le feu et faites cuire l''omelette jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit juste ferme, puis retournez-la et faites cuire l''autre côté. Gardez au chaud. Répétez l’opération pour faire trois omelettes, en ajoutant à chaque fois un peu d’huile supplémentaire dans la poêle.","Préparez la garniture en mélangeant la ricotta, le basilic, le parmesan et un peu de poivre. Étalez le mélange sur chaque omelette, roulez-la sans serrer comme un cigare et coupez-la en tranches épaisses. Peut être préparé jusqu''à 5 heures à l''avance. Servir garni de persil."]','2026-01-11 00:17:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12356,6491,'fr','Piment mexicain aux haricots','L''ingrédient secret de ce chili con carne au bœuf épicé au chipotle est un favori des placards : les fèves au lard.','["1 oignon, coupé en dés","1 poivron rouge, coupé en dés","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment","500 g de bœuf haché","Boîte de 415 g de fèves au lard","150 ml de bouillon de bœuf","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","feuilles de coriandre, riz et yaourt, pour servir"]','["Faire revenir l''oignon et le rouge\r\npoivrer dans l''huile d''olive à feu moyen\r\nchauffer pendant 10 à 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli.\r\nAugmentez le feu, ajoutez le piment\r\npoudrer et cuire quelques minutes avant\r\najouter le hachis. Cuire jusqu''à\r\ndoré et tout le liquide s’est évaporé.","Versez les fèves au lard, le bouillon de bœuf et la pâte de chipotle.\r\nLaissez mijoter à feu doux pendant 15 à 20 minutes.\r\nAssaisonner, parsemer de feuilles de coriandre\r\net servir avec du riz et du yaourt."]','2026-01-11 00:17:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12357,6493,'fr','Yaourt aux fruits et aux noix','Un pot de petit-déjeuner énergisant qui constitue une excellente alternative aux céréales et vous rassasiera jusqu''au déjeuner','["3 cuillères à soupe de mélange de noix hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de tournesol","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de citrouille","1 banane tranchée","1 à 2 poignées de baies (congelées et décongelées, c''est très bien)","200 g de yaourt à la vanille"]','["Mélangez les noix, les graines de tournesol et les graines de citrouille. Mélangez les tranches de banane et les baies. Mettez-le dans un bol avec du yaourt et dégustez."]','2026-01-11 00:17:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12358,6497,'fr','Oeufs brouillés aux épices','Commencez la journée sainement avec des œufs brouillés crémeux sur du pain grillé, parfaits pour utiliser une ou deux tomates égarées.','["1 petit oignon haché","1 piment rouge haché","noisette de beurre","4 oeufs battus","un peu de lait","une bonne poignée de tomates en dés","feuilles de coriandre","toasts, pour servir"]','["Faites ramollir l''oignon et le piment dans une noix de beurre.\r\nIncorporer les œufs battus et un peu de\r\ndu lait. Quand presque brouillé, doucement\r\nincorporer une bonne poignée de tomates en dés\r\nsuivi de quelques feuilles de coriandre.\r\nAssaisonner et déguster sur des toasts."]','2026-01-11 00:17:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12359,6499,'fr','Plateau de poulet, poivrons rouges et amandes','Un savoureux souper de poulet rôti dans une poêle avec du citron, du cumin, du paprika, de la coriandre et d''autres saveurs nord-africaines','["500 g de cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","3 oignons rouges moyens, coupés en quartiers épais","500 g de petites pommes de terre rouges coupées en tranches épaisses","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en tranches épaisses","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu, de paprika fumé et de graines de fenouil, légèrement écrasées","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","50 g d''amandes entières blanchies grossièrement hachées","Pot de 170 g de yaourt grec 0%, pour servir","petite poignée de persil ou de coriandre hachée pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Placer le poulet, les oignons, les pommes de terre et les poivrons dans un grand bol et assaisonner. dans un autre bol, mélanger l''ail, les épices, l''huile, le zeste et le jus de citron. Versez ceci sur le tout et répartissez le mélange entre 2 plaques à pâtisserie.","Rôtir pendant 40 minutes, en retournant après 20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Ajoutez les amandes pour les 8 dernières minutes de cuisson. Servir dans des bols avec une grosse cuillerée de yaourt grec et du persil ou de la coriandre hachés."]','2026-01-11 00:17:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12360,6501,'fr','Brochettes de saumon thaïlandaises avec trempette au piment doux et au citron vert','Mettez toujours des filets de saumon dans votre panier ? Essayez cette nouvelle façon de les transformer…','["4 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","jus 1 citron vert","4 x 140 g de filet de saumon sans peau, coupé en gros morceaux","huile, pour arroser"]','["Mélangez la sauce chili douce et le jus de citron vert dans un bol. Versez la moitié du mélange dans un bol pour servir. Enfiler le saumon sur 4 brochettes et badigeonner du reste de sauce chili. Laisser mariner 20 mn.","Faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude. Secouez l''excédent de marinade des brochettes, puis arrosez d''huile, assaisonnez et faites griller pendant 8 minutes en retournant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que le saumon soit opaque et se détache facilement de la poêle. Servir chaud avec la trempette."]','2026-01-11 00:17:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12361,6503,'fr','Quinoa au poulet cajun épicé','Le quinoa riche en protéines fait de ce repas en milieu de semaine une option super saine','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en bouchées","1 cuillère à soupe d''assaisonnement cajun","100 g de quinoa","600 ml de bouillon de poulet chaud","100 g d''abricots secs tranchés","½ sachet de 250 g de lentilles du Puy prêtes à l''emploi","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons rouges, coupés en fines tranches","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, hachés","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMélanger le poulet avec les épices cajun\r\net disposer en une seule couche dans un plat à rôtir\r\nétain. Cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet\r\nest cuit. Annuler.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le quinoa au\r\nbouillon de poulet pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre,\r\najouter les abricots et les lentilles pour le\r\n5 dernières minutes. Égoutter et placer dans un grand\r\nbol avec le poulet, mélanger.","Pendant que le quinoa cuit, faites chauffer\r\nl''huile dans une grande poêle et ramollir le\r\noignons pendant 10-15 minutes. Mélanger les oignons\r\ndans le quinoa avec la coriandre et\r\nun peu d''assaisonnement, puis bien mélanger."]','2026-01-11 00:17:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12362,6505,'fr','Steaks de dinde cajun avec sauce à l''ananas','La dinde est l’aliment sain et réconfortant par excellence – faible en gras mais riche en protéines. Égayez-le avec une salsa épicée','["1 oignon rouge, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en dés","200 g de riz basmati","450 ml de bouillon de poulet","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges rincés et égouttés","4 steaks le dîner","2 cuillères à café d''assaisonnement cajun","140 g d''ananas frais (ou 220 g de potins d''ananas égouttés)","½ piment vert, finement haché","jus 1 citron vert"]','["Réservez 2 cuillères à soupe d''oignon pour le\r\nsalsa. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une casserole et\r\nfaire revenir l''oignon restant et la moitié\r\npoivrer pendant 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli et\r\ncoloré. Incorporer le riz, puis verser le\r\nstocks. Ajouter les haricots rouges et une pincée\r\nde sel. Porter à ébullition, remuer une fois, couvrir\r\nla poêle, puis réduisez le feu à feu doux\r\nlaisser mijoter. Cuire 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit\r\ntendre et le liquide absorbé.","Saupoudrer les steaks de dinde de cajun\r\népices et plaque chauffante ou frire dans une poêle antiadhésive\r\npendant environ 4 à 6 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien cuit. Coupez l''ananas en\r\npetits morceaux et mélanger avec le\r\noignon rouge réservé, poivron, piment vert\r\net du jus de citron vert. Verser un peu de salsa dessus\r\nchaque steak et servir avec le riz."]','2026-01-11 00:17:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12363,6507,'fr','Saumon printanier aux légumes à la menthe','Un repas sain et facile à préparer qui compte pour deux de vos cinq par jour','["750 g de petites pommes de terre nouvelles, tranchées épaisses","750 g de pois et de haricots surgelés (nous avons utilisé un mélange de pois et de haricots Waitrose, 2,29 £/1 kg)","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","petit paquet de menthe, feuilles seulement","4 filets de saumon d''environ 140 g chacun"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre dans une grande poêle pendant 4 minutes.\r\nVersez les petits pois et les haricots, faites remonter\r\nporter à ébullition, puis poursuivre la cuisson pendant une autre\r\n3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre et les haricots soient\r\ntendre. Mélangez l''huile d''olive, le zeste de citron et\r\nle jus et la menthe dans un mélangeur pour faire une vinaigrette (ou hachez finement la menthe et fouettez-la dans le\r\nhuile et citron).","Mettez le saumon dans un plat allant au micro-ondes,\r\nassaisonner, puis verser la vinaigrette dessus. Couverture\r\navec du film alimentaire, percer, puis mettre au micro-ondes\r\nÀ feu vif pendant 4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit.\r\nÉgoutter les légumes, puis mélanger avec la vinaigrette chaude\r\net les jus de cuisson du poisson. Servir le\r\npoisson sur les légumes."]','2026-01-11 00:17:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12364,6509,'fr','Ragoût d''agneau copieux','Un one-pot classique est la réponse facile à la cuisine en milieu de semaine : copieux, copieux, réchauffant et rempli de légumes.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","500 g d''agneau à ragoût en cubes","1 oignon, tranché épaisse","2 carottes, tranchées épaisses","2 poireaux, tranchés grossièrement","400 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet chaud","1 cuillère à café de romarin séché ou 1 brin frais","400 g de haricots cannellini rincés et égouttés","pain croustillant ou pommes de terre bouillies pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte. Versez l''agneau et laissez cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à disparition du liquide, puis ajoutez l''oignon, les carottes et les poireaux. Cuire encore 5 minutes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que les légumes commencent à ramollir.","Versez dessus le bouillon, ajoutez le romarin, couvrez et laissez cuire à feu doux pendant 1 h. Incorporer les haricots et cuire encore 30 minutes, en ajoutant de l''eau si nécessaire, jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit tendre et bien cuit. Servir avec du pain croustillant ou des pommes de terre, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:17:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12365,6513,'fr','Beignets de courgettes','Utilisez de la courgette râpée pour préparer une entrée estivale simple mais délicieuse ou un dîner léger avec seulement cinq ingrédients principaux. Utiliser une surabondance du jardin','["250 g de courgettes râpées","20g de farine nature","1 œuf battu","25 g de parmesan finement râpé, ou alternative végétarienne (facultatif)","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","Pot de 170 g de houmous aux poivrons rouges rôtis, pour servir"]','["Mélangez la courgette râpée, la farine, l''œuf et le parmesan dans un grand bol.","Faites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et ajoutez l''huile. Faites frire les beignets 2 à 3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Servir aussitôt avec du houmous aux poivrons rouges."]','2026-01-11 00:17:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12366,6515,'fr','Poivron vert rôti et piment aux haricots rouges','Préparez ce chili végétarien facile à servir avec des patates douces cuites au four et du yaourt rafraîchissant pour un grand déjeuner ou un dîner léger.','["3 poivrons verts, coupés en deux","1½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé à chaud","3 gousses d''ail , tranchées finement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 patates douces moyennes","1 oignon rouge , finement haché","10 g de coriandre, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement, tiges finement hachées","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés","Boîte de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés","Boîte de 400 g de tomates cerises","4-6 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","1 piment vert , finement tranché"]','["Chauffer le four à 240C/220C chaleur tournante/gaz 9. Disposer les poivrons verts sur une plaque à rôtir, côté coupé vers le haut. Assaisonnez avec du sel et ½ cuillère à café de paprika, puis répartissez quelques tranches d''ail dans chaque poivron avec un filet d''huile d''olive. Mettez les patates douces sur le même plateau, puis rôtissez pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que les poivrons soient légèrement carbonisés, mais toujours tendres et juteux, et que les pommes de terre soient tendres. (Selon leur taille, les pommes de terre devront peut-être être remises au four pendant 5 à 10 minutes.)","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le reste de l''huile d''olive dans une grande casserole à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel pendant 4 à 5 minutes. Ajouter le reste de l''ail et du paprika, les tiges de coriandre hachées, le cumin, la pâte de chipotle et la purée de tomates, et cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés. Ajoutez les haricots rouges, les haricots noirs, les tomates cerises et une canette d''eau, puis laissez mijoter 20 à 25 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange épaississe et soit brillant. Assaisonner de sel. Vous pouvez également ajouter plus de pâte de chipotle et/ou de cumin au goût, si nécessaire.","Servir une demi-patate douce et un poivron vert par personne. Verser sur le piment, puis garnir de yaourt, de feuilles de coriandre et de piment vert tranché."]','2026-01-11 00:17:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12367,6517,'fr','Houmous sans tahini','Savourez notre recette de houmous facile et économique avec vos accompagnements préférés, comme des pittas, des craquelins et des crudités. Ajoutez plus de liquide de la boîte de pois chiches pour un houmous plus onctueux, si vous le souhaitez.','["Boîte de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés (liquide réservé)","½ petite gousse d''ail écrasée ou ½ cuillère à café de purée d''ail","1 cuillère à café de jus de citron","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un filet","pittas or vegetable crudités, to serve"]','["Versez les pois chiches, l''ail, le jus de citron et l''huile d''olive dans un petit mixeur ou un robot culinaire. Assaisonnez et ajoutez 1 cuillère à soupe du liquide réservé de la boîte de pois chiches.","Mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant davantage du liquide de pois chiches réservé pour obtenir un houmous plus onctueux, si vous le souhaitez. Versez le houmous dans un bol, arrosez d''un peu d''huile d''olive et réfrigérez jusqu''au moment de servir. Servir avec des pittas ou des crudités de légumes."]','2026-01-11 00:17:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12368,6519,'fr','Salade de salicorne et crabe','Savourez cette salade comme dîner généreux pour deux, ou comme déjeuner ou dîner léger pour quatre. Samphire chante lorsqu''il est associé au crabe et à cette vinaigrette piquante','["2 tranches de pain au levain","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","180g de salicorne","1 citron, jus","1 tbsp crème fraîche","1 crabe, chair brune et blanche séparées (environ 60g de chaque)","1 cuillère à soupe d''aneth haché (facultatif)","100 g de cresson"]','["Chauffer le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Déchirez le pain en gros morceaux et mettez-le dans un bol avec ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza et un peu d''assaisonnement. Bien mélanger, puis verser sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Annuler.","Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau et faites cuire la salicorne 3 min avant de l''égoutter et de la plonger dans l''eau glacée. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes avant d''égoutter.","Pour préparer la vinaigrette, mélangez le jus de citron, la crème fraîche, 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza restante, la chair de crabe brune et l''aneth, le cas échéant, dans un petit bol. Assaisonner, mélanger pour uniformiser et réserver.","Mélanger le cresson et la salicorne égouttée dans un grand bol, arroser de vinaigrette et bien mélanger pour bien enrober. Servir sur une assiette ou répartir dans les assiettes, puis garnir de chair de crabe blanche et de croûtons."]','2026-01-11 00:17:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12369,6521,'fr','Casserole de saucisses au miel et à la moutarde','Préparez une cocotte de saucisses et d''épinards réconfortante aux saveurs classiques de miel et de moutarde. Servir avec de la purée de pommes de terre pour un souper d''hiver qui plaira à tous','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","8 saucisses de porc ou sans viande","1 gros oignon, tranché","2 carottes, ou tout autre légume racine, haché grossièrement","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 cuillères à café d''herbes séchées mélangées","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cube de bouillon de légumes","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde anglaise","1 sachet d''épinards de 260 g","purée de pommes de terre, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à couvercle à feu moyen et faites revenir les saucisses jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Réduisez le feu à doux-moyen, ajoutez les oignons et les carottes et faites cuire doucement pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres.","Ajouter l''ail et les herbes séchées, puis cuire 1 min. Incorporer les tomates concassées, le cube de bouillon, le miel et la moutarde. Augmentez le feu à moyen et portez à ébullition. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter pendant 30 à 40 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les carottes soient tendres et que la sauce ait un peu réduit.","Environ 5 minutes avant de servir, ajoutez les épinards, par lots si nécessaire. Couvrir et cuire 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit flétri. Assaisonner de sel et de poivre et servir avec de la purée de pommes de terre, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:17:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12370,6523,'fr','Soupe aux pois et à la menthe avec baguettes','Célébrez la Journée mondiale du livre et laissez-vous inspirer par le livre pour enfants La Pire Sorcière, avec des bols chauffants de soupe aux pois et à la menthe servis avec des trempettes « baguette » au fromage.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile végétale","1 oignon, haché grossièrement","1 grosse pomme de terre, hachée","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée ou écrasée","1l de bouillon de légumes","Paquet de 350 g de pâte feuilletée déjà roulée","75 g de cheddar finement râpé","750 g de petits pois surgelés","une poignée de feuilles de menthe, plus des feuilles déchiquetées supplémentaires pour garnir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Ajoutez la pomme de terre et l''ail et laissez cuire encore quelques minutes avant de verser le bouillon et de laisser mijoter pendant 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la pomme de terre soit juste tendre.","Pendant ce temps, démêlez la pâte et découpez des formes de baguettes en coupant des lignes légèrement diagonales afin qu''une extrémité de la bande soit plus épaisse que l''autre. Transférez les baguettes à pâtisserie sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé, puis répartissez-les sur le fromage et assaisonnez de poivre noir, si vous le souhaitez. Cuire au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Une fois que la pomme de terre est juste tendre, versez les pois et la menthe dans le mélange de soupe et faites cuire pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pois soient décongelés et tendres. Retirer du feu et mixer à l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant. Versez la soupe dans des bols, parsemez-la de feuilles de menthe râpées, puis servez avec les baguettes à pâtisserie pour tremper."]','2026-01-11 00:17:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12371,6527,'fr','Soupe verte au chorizo ​​croustillant','Mélangez des épinards, du chou frisé et des pommes de terre pour préparer cette soupe verte vibrante, garnie de chorizo ​​croustillant pour plus de saveur.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour servir","1 oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","500 g de pommes de terre pelées et hachées","1½ litre de bouillon de légumes","250g d''épinards","Encore 120g","50 ml de crème double, plus un peu pour arroser","½ citron, jus","100 g de chorizo ​​finement haché"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte ou une casserole à feu moyen. Ajoutez l''oignon et une pincée de sel et faites revenir doucement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et translucides. Ajouter l''ail et faire revenir 1 min. Incorporer les pommes de terre et le bouillon, couvrir et cuire 15 minutes. Ajouter les épinards et le chou frisé et cuire encore 5 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés.  Utilisez un mixeur plongeant pour mixer le tout jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse, incorporez la crème double et le jus de citron et assaisonnez au goût.","Faites chauffer une petite poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir le chorizo ​​haché jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Versez la soupe dans des bols. Garnir de chorizo, d''un filet d''huile de chorizo ​​de la poêle et d''un bon moulin à poivre noir. Terminez par un filet de crème."]','2026-01-11 00:17:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12372,6529,'fr','Soupe à la moelle','Faites de la moelle la vedette du spectacle dans cette soupe copieuse. Fabriqué avec des haricots beurre, du lait de coco et de la poudre de curry, il a une délicate saveur épicée.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","2 oignons, hachés grossièrement","250 g de pommes de terre hachées grossièrement","1 courge (environ 750 g), pelée, épépinée et hachée grossièrement (voir astuce ci-dessous)","1-2 cuillères à soupe de curry en poudre, au goût","500 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés","400 ml de lait de coco léger en boîte","une petite poignée de feuilles de coriandre"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons avec une pincée de sel pendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez les pommes de terre et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes, puis versez la moelle et la poudre de curry. Cuire 1 min. Versez le bouillon, les haricots beurre et la majeure partie du lait de coco (réservez quelques cuillères à soupe). Portez le mélange à ébullition, puis réduisez le feu à moyen-doux et laissez mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que tous les légumes soient tendres.","Retirer du feu et laisser refroidir légèrement, puis transférer le mélange dans un blender et un blitz jusqu''à consistance lisse. Remettez la soupe dans la casserole et faites-la chauffer à feu doux, puis versez-la dans des bols. Arroser du lait de coco réservé et parsemer de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:17:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12373,6531,'fr','Rosti de betterave au yaourt vert et saumon fumé','Dégustez ces rostis de betterave colorés avec du saumon fumé, des œufs pochés et du yaourt aux herbes. Ils font un fabuleux brunch, déjeuner ou dîner le week-end','["600 g de betterave rouge parée, pelée et grossièrement râpée","400 g de pommes de terre grossièrement râpées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon rouge, finement tranché","5 gros œufs","4 cuillères à soupe de farine","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","200 g de saumon fumé","170 g de yaourt grec","½ bouquet d''aneth, plus un peu pour servir","½ bouquet de persil","pincée de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, égouttées et rincées"]','["Mélangez la betterave et la pomme de terre avec une grosse pincée de sel, versez-les dans une passoire dans l''évier et laissez égoutter 30 minutes. Transférer sur un torchon propre et essorer tout excès de liquide. Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir l''oignon pendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez les légumes râpés et faites revenir encore 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres. Retirer du feu. Refroidissez légèrement. Mélanger avec 1 œuf et la farine, assaisonner et former huit galettes.","Pour le yaourt aux herbes, versez le tout dans un robot culinaire avec une pincée de sel marin et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Faites chauffer le beurre et le reste de l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive à feu moyen et faites frire les rosti pendant 4 à 5 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et bien cuits. Disposez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et réservez au chaud à four doux.","Portez à ébullition une casserole d''eau légèrement salée avec le vinaigre. Remuer pour créer un tourbillon. Cassez 1 œuf dans une tasse, attendez que le tourbillon se soit presque calmé, puis versez l''œuf. Pocher 2 à 3 minutes, retirer à l''aide d''une écumoire et égoutter sur du papier absorbant. Répétez avec les autres œufs.","Servir les rosti avec le yaourt aux herbes, les œufs pochés, le saumon fumé et un peu d''aneth supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:17:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12374,6537,'fr','One-pot de porc chinois','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une soupe rapide avec une touche orientale qui séduira vos amis et votre famille.','["400 g de filet de porc coupé en longues et fines lanières","600 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","2 cuillères à café de poudre de cinq épices chinoises","grosse noix de gingembre pelée et coupée en allumettes","Paquet de 200 g de feuilles de bébé vertes coupées en quartiers","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché ou 1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","botte d''oignons nouveaux, blancs et verts tranchés"]','["Versez tous les ingrédients, à l’exception des feuilles d’oignons nouveaux, dans une grande casserole, mettez le couvercle et portez à légère ébullition. Cuire sans faire bouillir pendant environ 8 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le porc ait changé de couleur et que les légumes verts soient cuits, mais encore un peu croquants. Verser dans des bols, parsemer d''oignon nouveau et servir avec du riz bouilli ou des nouilles en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:17:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12375,6539,'fr','Gombo au poulet','Un ragoût de gombo et de poivron vert faible en gras d''inspiration créole avec du poivre de Cayenne, du paprika, du cumin et du thym','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g de cuisses de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en morceaux","1 oignon, haché","1 poivron vert épépiné et haché","3 branches de céleri, hachées finement","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","¼ cuillère à café de poivre de Cayenne","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de thym séché","1 feuille de laurier","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de farine nature","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 ml de bouillon de poulet","100 g de gombo coupé en rondelles de 2 cm","une petite poignée de sauge, feuilles hachées","pain croustillant ou riz au micro-ondes, pour servir"]','["Chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen\r\nchaleur élevée. Ajouter le poulet et cuire par lots\r\npendant environ 5 minutes pour dorer partout. Retirez le\r\npoulet avec une écumoire et réserver.","Ajouter l''oignon, le poivron vert et le céleri au\r\ncasserole, mettez le couvercle et laissez cuire 5 minutes en remuant\r\nde temps en temps jusqu''à ce qu''il soit un peu ramolli. Incorporer l''ail,\r\népices, thym et laurier et cuire 1 min\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé. Remettez le poulet et tout\r\nverser le jus dans la poêle avec la farine, en remuant pour enrober\r\ntout. Versez les tomates et le bouillon, et\r\nporter à ébullition, laisser cuire 5 min, puis ajouter le\r\nle gombo et la moitié de la sauge. Baissez le feu et laissez mijoter,\r\nmettez le couvercle et laissez cuire 10 min. Puis assaisonner\r\net servez en dispersant le reste du sage."]','2026-01-11 00:17:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12376,6541,'fr','Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.','Essayez une version fraîche et saine de la salade classique en utilisant de la viande hachée de dinde maigre roulée en galettes et servie avec une vinaigrette au babeurre.','["Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","1 oignon, finement haché","Erreur 500 (Erreur du serveur) !!1500.C''est une erreur.Une erreur s''est produite. Veuillez réessayer plus tard. C''est tout ce que nous savons.","125 ml de babeurre","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","4 cuillères à soupe de pecorino ou de parmesan râpé, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","2 shakes de sauce Tabasco","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce Worcestershire","1 petit rouleau ciabatta, haché ou déchiré en morceaux","presser le jus de citron","2 laitues Cos"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDans un bol, mélanger le hachis, l''oignon, la moitié\r\nla ciboulette, 1 cuillère à soupe de babeurre, le\r\nail, 2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan, la moitié\r\nle Tabasco et la moitié du Worcestershire\r\nsauce avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Façonner en\r\nenviron 20 petites boulettes de viande (légèrement huilées\r\nles mains rendront cela plus facile).","Disposer les boulettes de dinde en une seule couche\r\ndans une rôtissoire et laissez cuire 10 min.\r\nRetirer, retourner les boulettes de dinde et disposer\r\nles morceaux de pain entre les deux. Cuisiner pour\r\nencore 10 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, versez le reste du babeurre\r\ndans un bol avec le reste de parmesan,\r\nTabasco, sauce Worcestershire et le\r\njus de citron. Assaisonner et mélanger. Mettez le\r\nlaitue dessus, mélanger juste avant\r\nservir et répartir dans les assiettes. Haut\r\navec quelques boulettes de viande et croûtons au four,\r\npuis saupoudrez de ciboulette. Servir avec\r\ndu parmesan supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:17:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12377,6543,'fr','Frittata aux petits pois, feta et herbes d''été','Utilisez vos herbes douces préférées dans cette épaisse omelette grillée aux petits pois, au fromage à la crème et à la courgette - nous aimons l''aneth, la menthe et le persil','["300 g de pommes de terre nouvelles (comme les Jersey Royals), coupées en deux si elles sont grosses","4 œufs et 2 blancs d''œufs","un peu de lait","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète sans gluten","une poignée d''herbes douces mélangées, comme l''aneth, la menthe et le persil, hachées grossièrement","3 cuillères à soupe de fromage à la crème","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 courgette, râpée grossièrement","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","140 g de petits pois (décongelés si surgelés)","100 g de fromage feta émietté","50 g de tomates séchées égouttées et hachées grossièrement","100 g de feuilles de salade pour servir"]','["Mettez les pommes de terre dans une casserole de sel\r\neau, porter à ébullition, puis laisser mijoter pendant\r\n12-15 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter, laisser\r\nlaisser refroidir, puis trancher finement. Battre les oeufs et\r\nblancs d''oeufs avec le lait, ail, moutarde\r\net les herbes, et assaisonner généreusement. Ajouter\r\nle fromage à la crème et incorporer juste un\r\npeu pour qu''il reste quelques grumeaux. Chaleur\r\nle gril à feu moyen-vif.","Faites chauffer l''huile à feu moyen dans\r\nune poêle antiadhésive de 23 cm. Ajoutez le\r\npommes de terre et faire revenir environ 5 minutes,\r\njusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à devenir dorés. Ajouter\r\nles flocons de courgettes et de piment, et\r\ncontinuez à frire encore quelques minutes.\r\nIncorporer le petit pois.","Versez le mélange d''œufs dans la poêle et\r\nparsemer de feta et de tomates.\r\nCuire à feu doux pendant 10 à 12 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque pris. Mettez la casserole en dessous\r\nle gril et cuire pendant 3 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nsoufflé, doré et bien cuit.\r\nCouper en quartiers et servir avec\r\nune salade verte croquante."]','2026-01-11 00:17:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12378,6545,'fr','Riz sauté aux sardines','Nous apportons une nouvelle touche au pot de riz traditionnel indonésien : cette version utilise du poisson gras combiné avec du riz au curcuma, de la coriandre et des crevettes.','["4 sardines vidées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 oeufs, battus","6 oignons nouveaux, 4 hachés, 2 râpés","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de crevettes","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","2 cuillères à café de purée de tomates","2 piments rouges, tranchés","400 g de riz cuit (250 g cru)","85 g de petites crevettes","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","une grosse poignée de feuilles de coriandre","3 cuillères à soupe de flocons d''échalote croustillants (facultatif)","concombre finement tranché, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif et brosser le\r\nsardines avec un peu d''huile. Griller pendant environ\r\n4 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il y ait de légères cloques\r\net bien cuit, puis réserver.","Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile restante dans un wok et\r\ncuire les œufs en une fine omelette. Astuce sur\r\nune assiette pour refroidir. Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans\r\nle même wok. Ajouter le ressort haché\r\nles oignons, l''ail, la pâte de crevettes, le curcuma,\r\npurée de tomates et la moitié du piment. Grésillement\r\nle tout ensemble pour former une pâte, puis\r\najoutez le riz et les crevettes. Assaisonner avec\r\nsauce soja et faire sauter pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ntout est mélangé et chaud.","Roulez l''omelette et râpez-la finement.\r\nÉcaillez le poisson en gros morceaux désossés.\r\nIncorporer les rubans d''omelette et le poisson\r\nle riz, puis répartissez-le sur le riz râpé\r\noignons nouveaux, piment restant, coriandre\r\nfeuilles et flocons d''échalote croustillants (le cas échéant).\r\nServez le riz avec du soja supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez,\r\net du concombre finement tranché sur le côté."]','2026-01-11 00:17:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12379,6549,'fr','Poulet grillé au piment et graines de sésame','Aromatisez les lanières de poulet grillées avec de la sauce chili thaïlandaise, du gingembre et du miel et servez avec du brocoli pour ce repas rapide pour deux.','["2 poitrines de poulet sans peau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1½ cuillère à soupe de sauce chili sriracha (voir conseil ci-dessous)","2 cuillères à café de gingembre râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz","Paquet de 240 g de brocoli à tige tendre","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Trancher chaque poitrine de poulet dans le sens de la longueur\r\nen 2 morceaux minces. Frottez avec l''huile et\r\nassaisonner des deux côtés. Faites chauffer une poêle à griller et\r\ncuire les morceaux 2-3 minutes de chaque côté.","Pendant que le poulet cuit, mélangez le\r\nsauce chili, gingembre, miel et vinaigre\r\navec un peu d''assaisonnement dans un petit bol.\r\nBadigeonnez le poulet pendant la cuisson – attendez\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit grillé d''un côté avant\r\nbrossage, sinon il brûlera.","Blanchir le brocoli, le répartir entre les\r\nassiettes et verser sur le reste de la sauce.\r\nGarnir de poulet et de graines de sésame."]','2026-01-11 00:17:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12380,6551,'fr','Aubergines grillées au satay','Brochettes prêtes – ces brochettes végétariennes sont marinées dans du soja et du curcuma et servies avec une riche trempette aux arachides.','["1 grosse aubergine pelée et coupée en cubes de 3 cm","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","3 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète croquant","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","2 cuillères à soupe de lait de coco","riz basmati, pour servir","1 petit concombre, coupé en morceaux de 2 à 3 cm","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en demi-lunes","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe fraîche","une petite poignée de feuilles de coriandre fraîche"]','["Mélanger l''aubergine avec le soja\r\nsauce, huile, curcuma, 1 cuillère à soupe de piment\r\nsauce et un peu de poivre noir, puis\r\nenfiler sur du bois pré-trempé\r\nbrochettes. Faites chauffer une poêle ou une poêle\r\npoêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit moyennement chaude. Griller le \r\ndes aubergines de tous côtés se retournant après\r\ndes marques de gril apparaissent. Ils ont besoin de temps pour\r\nramollir donc garder le feu à moyen-doux\r\net cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés.\r\nBadigeonner d''un peu d''huile s''ils commencent à\r\ncoller à la poêle.","Pour la salade, mélangez tout le\r\ningrédients dans un petit bol, puis mettre\r\nde côté. Dans un autre bol, mélangez le\r\nreste de sauce chili, beurre de cacahuète,\r\nhoisin, vinaigre et lait de coco.\r\nServir les brochettes avec la salade,\r\nsauce aux cacahuètes et du riz basmati."]','2026-01-11 00:17:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12381,6555,'fr','Poulet collant au citron','Une recette rapide à réaliser','["4 poitrines de poulet partiellement désossées, avec la peau","le zeste râpé et le jus d''1 gros citron","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","pomme de terre nouvelle et salade verte, pour servir"]','["Préchauffer le four à chaleur tournante\r\n170C/conventionnel 190C/gaz 5.\r\nDisposez les poitrines de poulet, côté peau\r\nvers le haut, en une seule couche dans une zone peu profonde\r\nplat ou boîte allant au four. Mettez tout le\r\ningrédients restants dans un bol\r\net réchauffer dans le\r\nmicro-ondes ou une petite casserole pour\r\n1 minute, puis remuez pour bien mélanger le tout\r\nensemble et verser sur le poulet.","Faites glisser le plat\r\nmettre au four et rôtir le poulet\r\npendant 30 à 40 minutes, en arrosant tous les\r\n10 minutes environ. Les jus seront\r\népaissir progressivement et donner le\r\npoulet une couche brillante à la fin.\r\nLaisser le poulet reposer\r\n5 minutes avant de servir avec du nouveau\r\ndes pommes de terre et une salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:17:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12382,6559,'fr','Salade de pêches et fromage bleu','Essayez cette salade crémeuse et fruitée – parfaite pour le déjeuner ou un dîner léger d''été','["½ pain ciabatta, tranché","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de miel clair","un filet de jus de citron","1 sachet de feuilles de salade mélangée","une poignée de feuilles de menthe déchirées","4 pêches, chacune coupée en 8 morceaux","140 g de fromage bleu ou Brie, coupé en morceaux","100 g de pois mange-tout, coupés en deux dans le sens de la longueur"]','["Faire griller les tranches de ciabatta et arroser d''1 cuillère à soupe\r\nhuile. Préparez la vinaigrette en fouettant ensemble le\r\nle reste de l''huile, le miel et le jus de citron, puis\r\nassaisonner au goût. Mélanger tous les autres ingrédients\r\nensemble dans un grand bol et mélanger avec le\r\nvinaigrette avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:17:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12383,6561,'fr','Poulet à la harissa et aux tomates','Recette de souper au poulet rapide et facile en milieu de semaine, avec juste un petit soupçon d''épice','["4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","2 cuillères à café d''harissa (l''harissa à la rose de Belazu est vraiment savoureuse)","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café d''origan séché","250 g de tomates cerises","une poignée d''olives (nous avons utilisé du kalamata)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Mettre le \r\npoulet dans une plaque à rôtir moyenne, puis \r\nfrotter avec la harissa, l''huile et l''origan.","Couvrir de papier d''aluminium et rôtir pendant 5 minutes, puis retirer \r\nle papier d''aluminium et ajouter les tomates cerises et \r\nolives sur le plateau. Rôtir encore 10 minutes \r\njusqu''à ce que la peau des tomates commence à se fendre et que le \r\nle poulet est bien cuit. Servir avec du bouilli \r\npommes de terre nouvelles"]','2026-01-11 00:17:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12384,6563,'fr','Linguine au citron et au jambon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Essayez ce plat de pâtes savoureux et piquant, un déjeuner d''été parfait ou un dîner léger.','["400 g de linguines","une tasse de petits pois surgelés","200ml tub crème fraîche","le zeste râpé d''un demi citron et le jus d''un citron","3-4 tranches de jambon cuit, coupées en lanières"]','["Cuire les pâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, en ajoutant\r\nles petits pois pour les 2 dernières minutes de cuisson.","Bien égoutter les pâtes et remettre dans la poêle. Remuer\r\ndans la crème fraîche, le zeste et le jus de citron, puis\r\nsaison. Servir avec les lanières de jambon parsemées."]','2026-01-11 00:17:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12385,6569,'fr','Truite acidulée','Essayez cette recette de truite saine pour un souper d''été léger','["4 filets de truite","50g de chapelure","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre ramolli","1 petit bouquet de persil haché","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron, plus des quartiers de citron pour servir","25 g de pignons de pin grillés et hachés grossièrement pour la moitié","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Disposez les filets, côté peau\r\nvers le bas, sur une plaque à pâtisserie huilée. Mélangez ensemble le\r\nchapelure, beurre, persil, zeste de citron et\r\nle jus et la moitié des pignons de pin. Répartir le mélange\r\nen fine couche sur les filets, arroser d''huile\r\net passer sous le grill pendant 5 min. Saupoudrer\r\nsur les pignons de pin restants, puis servir avec\r\nles quartiers de citron et une salade de pommes de terre."]','2026-01-11 00:17:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12386,6571,'fr','Chaudrée fraîche et légère','Plus besoin de soupe du commerce avec cette recette rapide et nutritive','["100 g de filets d''aiglefin fumés et 100 g de filets d''aiglefin non fumés, avec la peau","500 ml de lait écrémé","500 ml de bouillon de légumes","2 brins de thym","1 cuillère à café d''huile végétale","1 oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 poireau, tranché","1 grosse patate douce, coupée en dés","Boîte de 200 g de maïs doux dans l''eau, égoutté","50g de lentilles rouges","une petite poignée de persil haché","pain croustillant, pour servir"]','["Placez le poisson dans une poêle, puis\r\najoutez le lait, le bouillon et le thym. Apporter à\r\nporter à ébullition et retirer du feu; partir jusqu''à\r\nassez froid pour être manipulé. Sortez le poisson\r\n(en réservant le liquide), décollez la peau et\r\némiettez le poisson dans une assiette pour l''utiliser plus tard.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande\r\ncasserole. Faire revenir doucement l''oignon, l''ail\r\net poireaux pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et\r\ntranslucide. Ajoutez la patate douce,\r\nmaïs doux et lentilles, puis verser dessus\r\nle liquide dans lequel vous avez cuit le poisson. Apportez\r\nporter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 30 mn. Vérifier\r\nl''assaisonnement et le semi-blitz d''une main\r\nmixeur – j’aime le laisser assez brut.\r\nAjoutez le poisson émietté et le persil haché.\r\nServir bien chaud avec du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:17:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12387,6573,'fr','Pois chiches aux tomates et épinards','Pour passer une bonne soirée, préparez ce repas chaleureux, servez-le avec un peu de naan et installez-vous confortablement sur le canapé.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon rouge, tranché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","½ morceau de gingembre frais, râpé, de la longueur d''un doigt","2 piments rouges doux, tranchés finement","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","¾ cuillère à café de garam masala","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","4 tomates, hachées","2 cuillères à café de purée de tomates","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, rincés et égouttés","200 g de pousses d''épinards","riz ou pain naan, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un wok et faites revenir l''oignon\r\nà feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis. Incorporer le\r\nl''ail, le gingembre et les piments et cuire pendant\r\nencore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les oignons soient\r\ndoré et l''ail légèrement grillé.","Ajoutez le curcuma, le garam masala et\r\ncumin, en remuant à feu doux pendant quelques\r\nsecondes. Versez les tomates concassées et\r\najouter le concentré de tomates, puis laisser mijoter\r\npendant 5 minutes.","Ajoutez les pois chiches dans la poêle avec\r\n300 ml d''eau (remplir le bidon aux trois quarts\r\nplein). Laisser mijoter 10 mn avant de remuer\r\ndans les épinards pour qu''ils flétrissent. Assaisonner et servir\r\navec du riz ou du naan."]','2026-01-11 00:17:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12388,6575,'fr','Korma de poulet léger','Un curry de poulet korma doux et sain, toujours satisfaisant et plein de saveur','["petite noix de gingembre frais, pelé et finement tranché","1 gousse d''ail","1 oignon, tranché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en bouchées","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","100 ml de bouillon de poulet","3 cuillères à soupe de fromage frais allégé","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues","poignée d''amandes grillées et tranchées, pour servir","feuilles de coriandre, riz nature, pain naan ou chapatis, pour servir"]','["Cuire le gingembre, l''ail et l''oignon dans une grande poêle\r\navec l''huile jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie. Versez le poulet et\r\ncuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré, environ 5 minutes, puis\r\najouter le garam masala et cuire encore 1 minute.","Versez dessus le bouillon et laissez mijoter 10 mn\r\njusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Mélanger\r\nle fromage frais et la poudre d''amandes. Prenez le\r\nhors du feu et incorporez le fromage frais\r\nmélange. Saupoudrer d''amandes effilées, garnir\r\navec de la coriandre et servir avec du riz bouilli, des chapatis\r\nou du pain naan nature."]','2026-01-11 00:17:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12389,6577,'fr','Bol de nouilles japonaises au tofu','Cette soupe saine regorge de saveurs fraîches du printemps et constitue un repas végétarien sophistiqué pour les invités.','["3 cuillères à soupe de tamari ou de sauce soja noire","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de riz assaisonné","1 cuillère à soupe de mirin ou 2 cuillères à café de sucre en poudre","200 g de tofu ferme, égoutté, épongé et coupé en 8 cubes","farine de maïs, pour enrober","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","1 botte d''asperges, base des tiges cassée, coupée en diagonale en 4 morceaux environ","50 g de haricots edamame frais ou surgelés","50 g de petits pois surgelés","petit morceau de gingembre, râpé","Paquet de 400 g de nouilles udon directement au wok","feuilles de coriandre, pour garnir","huile de piment, pour servir"]','["Mélangez le tamari ou la sauce soja,\r\nvinaigre et mirin ou sucre dans un récipient peu profond\r\nbol et remuer jusqu’à dissolution. Placez le\r\ntofu dans la marinade et retourner pour enrober.\r\nLaisser absorber les arômes pendant environ\r\n30 minutes ou plus. (Si vous faites mariner pendant\r\nplusieurs heures, conserver au réfrigérateur.)","Au moment de cuisiner, allumez le four\r\npour réchauffer. Répartissez la maïzena dessus\r\nune assiette. Retirez le tofu du\r\nmarinade, en réservant la marinade, et\r\nrouler dans la maïzena pour enrober tous les côtés. Chaleur\r\nune grande poêle à feu moyen-vif\r\net ajoutez suffisamment d''huile de tournesol pour couvrir\r\nle fond de la poêle. Faites frire le tofu en utilisant\r\ntourner les pinces jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes.\r\npartout. Égoutter sur du papier absorbant, puis réserver\r\nréchauffer au four.","Mettre 1 litre d''eau dans un milieu\r\ncasserole avec la marinade réservée\r\net porter à ébullition. Ajouter les asperges,\r\nharicots edamame, pois, gingembre et\r\nnouilles et remettre à ébullition. Laisser mijoter\r\njusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tout juste tendres, environ\r\n3-4 minutes. Répartir dans 4 bols et\r\nplacez 2 cubes de tofu dans chacun. Garnir de\r\nfeuilles de coriandre et servir arrosé\r\navec un peu d''huile de piment."]','2026-01-11 00:17:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12390,6579,'fr','Ragoût de poisson espagnol dans une poêle','Utilisez n’importe quel poisson blanc ou saumon durable dans ce ragoût facile et savoureux – parfait avec du pain croustillant','["une poignée de feuilles de persil plat hachées","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour servir","1 oignon moyen, finement tranché","500 g de pommes de terre farineuses, coupées en petits morceaux de 2 cm maximum","1 cuillère à café de paprika","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cube de bouillon de poisson","200 g de gambas crues décortiquées","½ boîte de 410 g de pois chiches, rincés et égouttés","500 g de filets de poisson sans peau, coupés en très gros morceaux"]','["Dans un petit bol, mélangez le persil avec\r\n½ de l''ail et du zeste de citron, puis mettre\r\nde côté. Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande sauteuse\r\ncasserole. Ajoutez l''oignon et les pommes de terre,\r\ncouvrir la poêle, puis faire suer le tout\r\npendant environ 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit\r\nramolli. Ajouter le reste de l''huile, l''ail\r\net les épices, puis cuire encore 2 minutes.","Versez dessus le jus de citron et faites grésiller\r\npendant un instant. Ajouter les tomates, ½ a\r\nbidon d''eau et émietter dans le bouillon.\r\nAssaisonner avec un peu de sel, puis couvrir le\r\ncasserole. Laissez mijoter le tout pendant 15 à 20 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient à peine cuites.","Incorporer les crevettes et les pois chiches,\r\npuis placez les morceaux de poisson sur le dessus\r\ndu ragoût. Baisser le feu et récupérer\r\nla poêle, puis laissez cuire environ 8\r\nminutes, en remuant très doucement une ou deux fois.\r\nQuand le poisson est à peine cuit,\r\nretirer du feu, parsemer de\r\nmélange de persil, puis porter le plat au\r\ntable avec la bouteille d''huile d''olive pour\r\narrosé et du pain croustillant,\r\nsi tu veux."]','2026-01-11 00:17:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12391,6581,'fr','Saumon cuit à la vapeur au micro-ondes','Essayez un festin du Nouvel An chinois avec du poisson cuit à la vapeur','["450 g de filets de saumon ou de poisson blanc ferme, comme le cabillaud","1½ cuillère à soupe de gingembre frais finement râpé","3 cuillères à soupe d''oignons nouveaux finement émincés","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja légère","2 cuillères à café de sauce soja noire","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''arachide","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","une poignée de brins de coriandre fraîche, pour garnir"]','["Séchez le poisson avec du papier absorbant\r\npuis coupez-le en très gros morceaux. Mettre dedans\r\nun plat résistant à la chaleur et répartir uniformément\r\navec le gingembre. Envelopper hermétiquement dans du film alimentaire\r\nfilmer. Peut être prêt à ici jusqu''à\r\n2-3 heures à l’avance, détendez-vous. Mettez l''assiette\r\nde poisson au micro-ondes et cuire\r\npendant 3 à 5 minutes (en fonction de son\r\népaisseur et comment vous aimez votre poisson\r\ncuit) à pleine puissance.","Retirez l''assiette de poisson cuit. Attendez une minute et versez l''excédent de liquide qui aurait pu s''accumuler dans l''assiette, puis répartissez les oignons nouveaux sur le poisson, ainsi que les sauces soja claires et foncées.","Faites chauffer les deux huiles ensemble dans une petite casserole jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient très chaudes, puis versez-les sur le poisson. Parsemer d''une poignée de brins de coriandre et servir aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:17:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12392,6583,'fr','Crevettes et œuf sur pain grillé','Découvrez votre nouvelle recette de brunch préférée : une mayonnaise aux crevettes et aux œufs rapide et facile sur du pain grillé. Saupoudrer de ciboulette pour finir','["3 œufs","250 g de crevettes décortiquées et cuites (décongelées si congelées)","3 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","1 citron, jus","4 tranches épaisses de pain blanc","beurre, pour servir","un petit bouquet de ciboulette finement tranchée pour servir"]','["Portez à ébullition une casserole moyenne d''eau, puis plongez-y délicatement les œufs et laissez cuire 9 minutes. Retirer dans un bol d''eau glacée à l''aide d''une écumoire et laisser reposer 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit froid. Peler, puis hacher finement.","Versez l''œuf haché dans un bol avec les crevettes. Incorporer la mayonnaise et le jus de citron, puis assaisonner de sel et de poivre.","Faire griller le pain, puis le beurrer. Verser dessus la mayonnaise aux crevettes et aux œufs, puis saupoudrer de ciboulette et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12393,6585,'fr','Feuilletés de tarte aux amandes faciles','Préparez un incontournable de Noël avec des tartelettes faites maison à base de pâte feuilletée. Servir au petit-déjeuner ou déguster chaud avec de la glace à la vanille en dessert','["320 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","farine nature, pour saupoudrer","1 œuf battu","150 g de viande hachée (végétarienne, si besoin)","20 g d''amandes effilées","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Déroulez la pâte sur un plan légèrement fariné et coupez-la en deux dans le sens de la longueur. Coupez chaque moitié en six pour obtenir 12 carrés. En travaillant un carré à la fois, pliez-le en deux en diagonale pour créer un triangle. Disposez le triangle avec le bord plié face à vous. Découpez une bordure de ½ cm le long des deux autres bords, en vous arrêtant juste avant l''intersection des deux coupes. Dépliez délicatement la pâte, puis badigeonnez les bords avec un peu d''œuf battu. Soulevez le coin le plus à gauche de la pâte et repliez-la vers la droite, en l''appuyant doucement contre le coin intérieur droit pour la sceller. Répétez l’opération depuis le coin le plus à droite de la pâte jusqu’au coin intérieur gauche. Disposez les pâtisseries sur deux plaques à pâtisserie recouvertes de papier sulfurisé et versez 1 cuillère à café de viande hachée au milieu de chacune. Garnir chacun de quelques amandes effilées. Se conserve au frais jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 210C/190C chaleur tournante/gaz 6½. Badigeonner la pâte avec davantage d''œuf et cuire au four pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit gonflée et dorée. Saupoudrez de sucre glace et dégustez tiède ou laissez refroidir complètement. Une fois refroidi, se conserve dans un récipient hermétique à température ambiante pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:18:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12394,6587,'fr','Crêpes à la banane','Des crêpes à la banane sans gluten que vous pouvez préparer en seulement 10 minutes ! Parsemez de noix de pécan et de framboises pour savourer un petit-déjeuner faible en calories mais gourmand','["1 grosse banane","2 œufs moyens, battus","pincée de levure chimique (sans gluten si cœliaque)","un peu d''extrait de vanille","1 cuillère à café d''huile","25 g de noix de pécan hachées grossièrement","125g de framboises"]','["Dans un bol, écrasez la banane à la fourchette jusqu''à obtenir une purée épaisse. Incorporer les œufs, la levure chimique et la vanille.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle antiadhésive ou une poêle à crêpes à feu moyen et badigeonnez-la de la moitié de l''huile. Avec la moitié de la pâte, versez deux crêpes dans la poêle, faites cuire 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté, puis versez sur une assiette. Répétez le processus avec le reste de l’huile et de la pâte. Garnir les crêpes avec les pacanes et les framboises."]','2026-01-11 00:18:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12395,6589,'fr','Kale, tomate et œuf poché sur toasts','Il n''y a pas de façon plus savoureuse de manger du chou frisé que de le recouvrir d''un jaune coulant et de le parsemer de fromage feta. Ce petit-déjeuner végétarien et faible en calories a tout pour plaire !','["2 cuillères à café d''huile","100 g de chou frisé déjà haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 gros œufs","2 tranches de pain multigrains","50 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","15 g de feta émiettée"]','["Portez à ébullition une grande casserole d''eau. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et ajoutez le chou frisé, l''ail et les flocons de piment. Cuire, en remuant de temps en temps, pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que le chou frisé commence à devenir croustillant et à flétrir jusqu''à la moitié de sa taille. Annuler.","Réglez le feu pour que l''eau soit à forte ébullition, puis pochez vos œufs pendant 2 minutes. Pendant ce temps, faites griller le pain.","Retirez les œufs pochés avec une écumoire et garnissez chaque morceau de pain grillé de la moitié du chou frisé, d''un œuf, des tomates cerises et de la feta."]','2026-01-11 00:18:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12396,6591,'fr','Frittata jambon, champignons et épinards','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Essayez une frittata copieuse, faible en calories et qui vous tiendra en haleine jusqu''au déjeuner. Conservez-en la moitié au réfrigérateur pendant la nuit si vous cuisinez pour une personne.','["1 cuillère à café d''huile","80 g de champignons de Paris émincés","50 g de jambon coupé en dés","80 g d''épinards","4 œufs moyens, battus","1 cuillère à soupe de cheddar râpé"]','["Chauffez le gril à son réglage le plus élevé. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle allant au four à feu moyen-vif. Ajoutez les champignons et faites-les revenir pendant 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient presque entièrement ramollis. Incorporer le jambon et les épinards et cuire encore 1 minute jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés. Bien assaisonner avec du poivre noir et une pincée de sel.","Réduisez le feu et versez sur les œufs. Cuire sans être dérangé pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient presque entièrement pris. Saupoudrer de fromage et passer sous le grill pendant 2 min. Servir chaud ou froid."]','2026-01-11 00:18:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12397,6594,'fr','Pots de yaourt à la banane','Idéal comme pudding ou à préparer au petit-déjeuner','["1 pot de 450 g de yaourt épais","3-4 bananes coupées en morceaux","4 cuillères à soupe de cassonade foncée","25 g de noix grillées et hachées"]','["Versez environ 1 cuillère à soupe de yaourt dans le fond de 4 petits verres. Ajoutez une couche de banane, puis encore un peu de yaourt. Répétez les couches jusqu''à ce que les verres soient pleins. Répartissez le sucre et les noix, puis laissez au réfrigérateur pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous."]','2026-01-11 00:18:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12398,6596,'fr','Muffins gallois rares','Demandez aux enfants de vous aider à préparer ces délicieux muffins, parfaits pour les boîtes à lunch','["225 g de farines autolevantes","50g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de levure chimique","½ cuillère à café rase de bicarbonate de soude","¼ cuillère à café de sel","½ cuillère à café rase de moutarde en poudre","100 g de fromage fort, moitié râpé, moitié en cubes","6 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","150 g de yaourt grec","125 ml de lait","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce Worcestershire"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6.","Mélangez la farine autolevante et ordinaire, la levure chimique, le bicarbonate de soude, le sel et la poudre de moutarde dans un bol.","Dans un autre bol, mélanger le fromage, l''huile, le yaourt, le lait, l''œuf et la sauce Worcestershire.","Mélanger tous les ingrédients et répartir dans les moules à muffins.","Mettre au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré. Retirer et laisser refroidir légèrement sur une grille.","Ce dont vous avez besoin : Demandez aux enfants de vous aider à tout préparer, une balance, un verre doseur, une fourchette, 2 bols à mélanger, 12 caissettes à muffins en papier, un moule à muffins, une râpe à fromage, un couteau bien aiguisé, une cuillère à soupe, une grille de refroidissement."]','2026-01-11 00:18:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12399,6598,'fr','Pommes de terre rissolées à la moutarde et au saumon fumé','Ce plat de brunch brillant est particulièrement sensationnel servi avec des œufs pochés','["1 grosse pomme de terre (environ 350 g/12 oz), lavée","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde complète ou de sauce au raifort","noisette de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","4 tranches de saumon fumé","crème sure ou crème fraîche, pour servir","ciboulette, pour servir"]','["Râpez la pomme de terre non pelée sur un torchon propre. Remontez les bords de la serviette, puis pressez-la au-dessus de l''évier pour éliminer tout excès d''eau dans les pommes de terre. Versez dans un bol et ajoutez la farine et la moutarde ou le raifort. Bien assaisonner et mélanger.","Divisez le mélange en 8 boules et aplatissez-les entre vos mains. Faites chauffer une grande poêle avec le beurre et l''huile, puis ajoutez le\r\npommes de terre dans la poêle. Cuire 2-3 minutes de chaque côté, à feu moyen, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Empilez quelques pommes de terre rissolées sur chaque assiette de service et garnissez d''une tranche de saumon fumé, d''une cuillerée de crème sure ou de crème fraîche et d''un peu de ciboulette pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12400,6600,'fr','Poires croquantes au miel et aux noix','Cette idée simple constitue une gâterie rapide en milieu de semaine pour toute la famille','["4 poires mûres","noisette de beurre","½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","2 cuillères à soupe de miel clair","50 g de cornflakes","25 g d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/chaleur tournante 180/gaz 6. Couper les poires en deux dans le sens de la longueur, retirer le noyau (voir astuce à gauche), puis garnir d''une petite noix de beurre et d''une pincée du mélange d''épices. Disposez les poires dans un plat peu profond, puis faites-les rôtir pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le miel et une autre noix de beurre dans un grand bol au micro-ondes pendant 30 secondes. Mélanger avec les cornflakes et les noix.","Sortez les poires du four, puis garnissez-les du mélange cornflakes. Cuire encore 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les cornflakes prennent une riche couleur dorée. Laisser refroidir quelques minutes (les cornflakes redeviennent croustillants en refroidissant), puis servir chaud avec de la glace."]','2026-01-11 00:18:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12401,6602,'fr','Curry de yaourt, pois chiches et épinards','Servez ce curry de pois chiches léger et crémeux avec un mélange moitié quinoa, moitié riz pour plus de fibres et de protéines. C’est sain et faible en gras et en calories','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon rouge , finement haché","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 grosses gousses d''ail, râpées","50 g de gingembre pelé et râpé","1-2 piments verts (facultatif ; épépinés pour moins de piquant, si vous le souhaitez), finement hachés","300 g de tomates finement hachées","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","100g de yaourt nature","Pot de 570 g de pois chiches dans l''eau, ou 2 boîtes de 400 g de pois chiches","1 cuillère à café de fenugrec séché (facultatif)","320 g de pousses d''épinards","100 g de riz basmati","100 g de quinoa"]','["Pour faire le riz au quinoa, rincez bien le riz, puis mettez-le dans une grande casserole avec le quinoa et 1,5 litre d''eau bouillante. Cuire pendant 12 à 14 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté. Égoutter et réserver.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons pendant 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et légèrement dorés. Incorporer les graines de cumin, suivies de l''ail, du gingembre et de la moitié du piment, le cas échéant. Cuire 1 min en remuant continuellement pour éviter que l''ail ne brûle.","Ajoutez les tomates, le curcuma, la coriandre et une grosse pincée de sel. Cuire environ 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient tendres. Transférez le mélange dans un mixeur. Ajouter le yaourt et mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis remettre dans la poêle.","Ajoutez les pois chiches avec le liquide du pot ou des boîtes de conserve (cela permet d''épaissir la sauce et de lui donner un fini brillant). Portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez cuire à feu moyen pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''huile commence à se séparer à la surface.","Incorporer le fenugrec (le cas échéant) et les épinards et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fanés. Ajoutez un peu d''eau si nécessaire pour ajuster la consistance. Assaisonner selon votre goût, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12402,6604,'fr','Jalfrezi de poulet aux épinards, riz brun et quinoa','Savourez une version saine, faible en gras et en calories d''un jalfrezi au poulet, rempli de poivrons colorés et d''épinards et servi avec du riz brun et du quinoa.','["100g de riz brun","100 g de quinoa","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon rouge , tranché","500 g de poitrine de poulet coupée en lanières","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à café d''ail émincé","2 cuillères à café de gingembre émincé","120 g de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire","1 cuillère à café de garam masala","3 poivrons (rouge, jaune et vert), tranchés","200 g de pousses d''épinards","une poignée de coriandre fraîche, pour servir"]','["Préparez d’abord le riz et le quinoa. Lavez et rincez bien le riz brun, puis versez-le dans une casserole d''eau bouillante salée. Baissez le feu et laissez mijoter 20 minutes, puis ajoutez le quinoa et laissez cuire encore 10 minutes.","Pendant que le riz cuit, faites chauffer l’huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir l’oignon jusqu’à ce qu’il brunisse. Ajoutez les lanières de poulet et faites-les revenir jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées, puis ajoutez les graines de cumin, l''ail et le gingembre. Mélangez une minute, puis versez le concentré de tomates, le curcuma, la coriandre, la poudre de piment et une pincée de sel, puis mélangez bien.","Versez 300 ml d''eau bouillante dans le mélange de poulet épicé et laissez mijoter jusqu''à ce que la sauce devienne d''un rouge riche, environ 10 minutes, puis incorporez le garam masala, les poivrons et les épinards. Couvrir et cuire à feu moyen pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que les épinards soient fanés mais que les poivrons soient encore légèrement croquants. Ajoutez un peu d''eau pour ajuster la consistance selon vos envies. Égoutter le riz et le quinoa et servir avec le poulet et la coriandre parsemés."]','2026-01-11 00:18:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12403,6606,'fr','Ragoût de pancetta et haricots blancs','Utilisez tous les légumes du réfrigérateur dans ce ragoût rapide et faible en calories, avec des haricots blancs et de la pancetta. Épongez le jus avec du pain croustillant, si vous le souhaitez','["150 g de lardons","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon , finement haché","1 branche de céleri , hachée finement","1 carotte , hachée finement","2 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots blancs, un égoutté et un non égoutté (nous avons utilisé des cannellini et des haricots beurre)","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 croûte de parmesan (facultatif)","200 g de cavolo nero, feuilles grossièrement hachées","½ cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","10g de ciboulette"]','["Répartissez la pancetta dans une cocotte profonde à l''épreuve du feu et faites cuire à feu moyen pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit croustillante et libère son gras. Retirer de la poêle à l''aide d''une écumoire, en laissant le gras derrière. Versez l''huile, puis versez l''oignon, le céleri et la carotte. Cuire 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Incorporer l''ail et cuire encore 1 min.","Versez les haricots, le bouillon de poulet et le zeste de parmesan (le cas échéant). Cuire 15 minutes à feu moyen, puis incorporer le cavolo nero et la pancetta cuite pendant 5 dernières minutes. Incorporer le vinaigre de Xérès et assaisonner.","Répartir dans quatre bols et saupoudrer de ciboulette pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12404,6608,'fr','Salade de crevettes cajun et maïs grillé','Inspirez-vous des saveurs tex-mex avec cette salade parsemée de gambas, de maïs doux et de piments jalapeño. C’est idéal pour un barbecue ou un dîner léger','["200 g de grains de maïs doux frais","150 g de gambas crues, décortiquées et déveinées","½ cuillère à soupe de mélange d''épices cajun","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 citron vert, jus","1 cuillère à café de miel","1 piment jalapeño finement haché (facultatif)","1 poivron rouge, finement haché","1 avocat pelé, coupé en deux, dénoyauté et finement haché","3 oignons nouveaux, hachés finement","une petite poignée de coriandre finement hachée","1 laitue romaine , hachée"]','["Faites chauffer une poêle à sec à feu moyen-vif et faites cuire le maïs doux quelques minutes sans remuer, puis secouez la poêle et poursuivez la cuisson 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les grains soient dorés. Verser sur une assiette et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Mélanger les crevettes, le mélange d''épices cajun et une pincée de sel et de poivre dans un petit bol. Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans la même poêle que celle utilisée pour carboniser le maïs et faites cuire les crevettes à feu moyen-vif pendant 2 à 4 minutes, en remuant jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient roses et bien cuites. Transférer dans l''assiette avec le maïs.","Mélanger le jus de citron vert, le miel, le reste de l''huile et le jalapeño haché (le cas échéant) dans un grand bol et bien assaisonner. Ajouter les poivrons rouges, l''avocat, les oignons nouveaux, la coriandre et la laitue, puis bien mélanger. Incorporer le maïs et les crevettes, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12405,6610,'fr','Tajine de morue et d''olives avec riz brun','Profitez au maximum de la morue dans ce tajine aromatique délicatement épicé, faible en gras et en calories. Comme les autres fruits de mer, la morue est une source utile d''iode','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons rouges (environ 320 g), hachés","250 g de rutabagas finement haché","2 carottes (environ 200 g), hachées finement","3 lanières de zeste de citron finement hachées","4 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","300 ml de bouillon de légumes, préparé avec 1½ cuillère à café de poudre de bouillon","12 olives vertes dénoyautées, coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","250 g de riz brun facile à cuire","4 filets de cabillaud sans peau surgelés (environ 360g)","⅓ paquet de coriandre hachée"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir les oignons, le rutabaga, les carottes, le zeste de citron et l''ail pendant 10 minutes en remuant fréquemment. Ajoutez les épices et remuez brièvement.","Incorporer les tomates, la purée de tomates, le bouillon et les olives. Couvrir et cuire 25 min.","Faites bouillir le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage. Remuez bien le mélange de tomates, puis déposez-le dans les filets de morue surgelés. Couvrir et cuire 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit bien cuit. Parsemer de coriandre. Servir la moitié avec la moitié du riz cuit. Laisser refroidir le reste du tajine et du riz, puis conserver au frais jusqu''à trois jours. Réchauffez le tajine dans une poêle à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud, et réchauffez le riz au micro-ondes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement chaud. Cette recette fait partie de notre plan d''alimentation saine gratuit de 7 jours. Pour accéder au plan de repas complet, cliquez ici."]','2026-01-11 00:18:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12406,6616,'fr','Filet de saumon au four avec canneberges marinées, persil et pistaches','Équilibrez un poisson gras, comme le saumon, avec des canneberges marinées maison. Ils ajoutent également une touche amusante et de Noël au plat.','["300 ml de vinaigre de cidre","300 g de sucre en poudre","340 g de canneberges fraîches","½ cuillère à café de clous de girofle entiers","½ cuillère à café de baies de genièvre","75 g de chapelure panko","½ cuillère à soupe de thym séché","2 cuillères à soupe de sumac","1 citron, zesté","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","1 kg de filet de saumon désossé (vous pouvez demander à votre poissonnier de le faire pour vous)","60 g de pistaches concassées","½ petit bouquet de persil haché pour servir"]','["Préparez les canneberges marinées une semaine ou deux à l’avance. Mettez le vinaigre et le sucre dans une casserole sur feu moyen et portez à ébullition. Incorporez le reste des ingrédients et poursuivez la cuisson pendant 4 minutes. Versez le mélange dans un pot stérilisé d''1 litre ou deux plus petits, fermez bien puis laissez refroidir. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant au moins une semaine.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faire griller la chapelure dans une poêle sèche pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit dorée et grillée, puis la verser sur une assiette et laisser refroidir.","Mélangez la chapelure, le thym, le sumac, le zeste de citron et un peu d''assaisonnement dans un bol à mélanger. Arroser de 5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive et bien mélanger.","Disposez un morceau de papier sulfurisé sur une plaque à pâtisserie suffisamment grande pour contenir le filet de saumon. Posez dessus le filet de saumon côté peau vers le bas et étalez délicatement le mélange de croûte sur le dessus du saumon. N’appuyez pas trop sur le mélange. Arrosez d’un peu d’huile d’olive supplémentaire.","Faites cuire le saumon au four pendant 20 à 25 minutes idéalement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste cuit et que la croûte ait pris une couleur dorée. Une fois cuit, transférer dans un plat de service et garnir de pistaches, de quelques canneberges marinées égouttées et de persil. Essayez de servir avec des légumes verts beurrés et des pommes de terre nouvelles rôties."]','2026-01-11 00:18:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12407,6618,'fr','Sarrasin aux petites aubergines carbonisées','Profitez au maximum du sarrasin avec notre déjeuner végétarien sain et faible en calories. Aubergines, lentilles, noix, oignons nouveaux, cerises séchées et fromage de chèvre apportent une véritable dose de saveur','["350 g de petites aubergines coupées en deux","8 oignons nouveaux entiers, le dessus paré","250g de sarrasin","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","1 boîte de 400 g de lentilles vertes égouttées","30 g de cerises séchées hachées grossièrement","8 moitiés de noix, hachées finement","1 citron, jus","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","petit bouquet d''aneth, finement haché","30 g de fromage de chèvre à pâte molle, émietté"]','["Chauffez le gril à son réglage le plus élevé. Étalez les aubergines sur une plaque à pâtisserie, côté coupé vers le haut, et faites-les griller pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir et à se cloquer.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une poêle à feu vif. Ajouter les oignons nouveaux et cuire de chaque côté pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis et carbonisés. Retirer avec des pinces et réserver.","Portez à ébullition une casserole d’eau de taille moyenne. Versez le sarrasin dans une poêle et faites-le frire à sec à feu moyen pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement grillé. Ajoutez le sarrasin à l''eau bouillante et laissez cuire 4 à 5 minutes. Égoutter et mélanger avec l''huile. Laisser refroidir 5 min.","Mélangez le sarrasin chaud, les lentilles, les cerises, les noix, le jus de citron, le piment et la majeure partie de l''aneth dans un bol. Étaler sur une assiette de service et garnir d''aubergines, d''oignons nouveaux carbonisés, du reste d''aneth et de fromage de chèvre."]','2026-01-11 00:18:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12408,6620,'fr','Burgers de porc et de pommes','Nos hamburgers économiques au porc et aux pommes sont parfaits pour un souper familial facile et délicieux. Ce repas facile en milieu de semaine ne prend que dix minutes à préparer','["300 g de chair à saucisse","4 pains burger complets","4 cuillères à café de marmelade d''oignons","2 pommes, évidées et tranchées finement","2 poignées de fusée","2 cuillères à café de mayonnaise","un peu de moutarde anglaise anglaise (facultatif)","quartiers de patates douces, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Divisez la chair à saucisse en quatre portions et formez des galettes. Faire frire dans une poêle antiadhésive pendant 10 à 12 minutes, en retournant plusieurs fois, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés des deux côtés et entièrement cuits.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Coupez les petits pains en deux et faites-les griller sous le gril, côté coupé vers le haut.","Tartiner les moitiés inférieures des petits pains grillés avec la marmelade, puis ajouter les burgers, les tranches de pomme, la roquette, la mayonnaise et la moutarde (si utilisée). Garnir des couvercles de petits pains et servir avec des quartiers de patates douces, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:18:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12409,6622,'fr','Poivrons farcis au porc et au boulgour','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Ce souper coloré et réconfortant apporte une saveur estivale à tout moment de l''année.','["4 poivrons, coupés en deux et noyaux retirés","200 g de porc haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de paprika","50g de blé boulghar","250 ml de bouillon de légumes","½ petit bouquet de persil haché","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec 0%, pour servir"]','["Mettez les poivrons, côté coupé vers le bas, sur une assiette et mettez-les au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien cuits (mais pas si mous qu''ils s''effondrent). S''ils ont besoin de plus de temps, passez au micro-ondes pendant 1 minute de plus et répétez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits.","Mettez le porc dans une poêle froide et allumez le feu. Faites frire en brisant les grumeaux jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer. Incorporer l''ail et les épices pendant 1 min, puis ajouter le boulghar et le bouillon. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le boulghar soit tendre.","Faites chauffer le gril. Incorporer la moitié du persil au boulghar, puis farcir les poivrons sur une plaque allant au four. Griller jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant, saupoudrer de la majeure partie du persil, puis servir avec le yaourt mélangé au reste du persil."]','2026-01-11 00:18:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12410,6624,'fr','Saumon poché à l''estragon','Pocher légèrement les filets de saumon et servir avec des haricots verts crémeux et des pommes de terre nouvelles pour un repas léger.','["1 citron","200 g de crème fraîche demi-élevée","estragon en petit paquet, feuilles seulement, hachées","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée en pâte","400 g de haricots verts parés et coupés en deux","4 filets de saumon","pommes de terre nouvelles cuites, pour servir"]','["Zester le citron et le couper en quartiers. Mélangez la crème fraîche, l''estragon, l''ail, le zeste de citron et un filet de jus, assaisonnez selon votre goût et réservez.","Apportez une grande casserole peu profonde d''eau salée dans le bol et faites cuire les haricots verts pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste cuits. Retirer à l''aide d''une écumoire, égoutter et refroidir sous l''eau froide courante avant de mélanger avec le mélange de crème fraîche.","Portez à nouveau la casserole à ébullition, puis baissez le feu pour laisser mijoter très doucement et glissez-y les morceaux de saumon. Pocher pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit cuit à votre goût. Retirer de la poêle et déposer sur du papier absorbant avant de dresser. Servir avec les haricots verts et les pommes de terre nouvelles."]','2026-01-11 00:18:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12411,6626,'fr','Dhansak à la noix de coco et à la courge','Ce curry végétarien rapide et facile est parfait pour un dîner sain en semaine – avec de la courge musquée, du lait de coco, des lentilles et des épinards','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","500 g de courge butternut (environ 1 petite courge), pelée et coupée en petits morceaux (ou acheter un paquet de toute prête pour gagner du temps), voir astuce en bas à gauche","100 g d''oignons hachés surgelés","4 cuillères à soupe bombées de pâte de curry douce (nous avons utilisé du korma)","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","400 g de lait de coco léger en boîte","mini pain naan, pour servir","Boîte de 400 g de lentilles égouttées","Sachet de 200 g de bébés épinards","150 ml de yaourt à la noix de coco (nous avons utilisé Rachel''s Organic), plus un peu pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Mettez la courge dans un bol avec un peu d''eau. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et mettre au micro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté. Pendant ce temps, ajoutez les oignons dans l''huile chaude et faites cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter la pâte de curry, les tomates et le lait de coco et laisser mijoter pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement d''une sauce riche.","Réchauffez les pains naan à four doux ou au grille-pain. Égoutter le liquide de la courge, puis l''ajouter à la sauce avec les lentilles, les épinards et un peu d''assaisonnement. Laisser mijoter encore 2-3 minutes pour faire flétrir les épinards, puis incorporer le yaourt à la noix de coco. Servir avec le naan chaud et une cuillerée de yaourt supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:18:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12412,6628,'fr','Ragoût Somerset avec purée de cheddar et persil','Ce réchaud d''hiver familial est plein de saveur et de bonté. Adaptez-vous aux amateurs de viande en ajoutant des saucisses','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","1 oignon, finement haché","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","1 grosse carotte, hachée finement","1 poireau, haché","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","Boîte de 200 g de haricots beurre égouttés","Boîte de 400 g de flageolets rincés et égouttés","200 ml de cidre sec","250 ml de bouillon de légumes","quelques brins de thym, feuilles seulement","purée de cheddar et persil (voir astuce ci-dessous)","2 saucisses","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive par portion"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon,\r\nl''ail, la carotte et le poireau jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres mais pas\r\ncoloré. Ajouter le concentré de tomates hachées\r\ntomates, haricots beurre, flageolets,\r\ncidre, bouillon et thym et laisser mijoter pendant\r\n15-20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le ragoût épaississe\r\net les légumes sont tendres.","Pendant ce temps, si vous ajoutez des saucisses\r\nà n''importe quelle portion, coupez chaque saucisse en\r\n3-4 morceaux. Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une poêle\r\npoêler et faire dorer les morceaux pendant 5 minutes,\r\npuis incorporez les portions appropriées du\r\nragoût et laisser mijoter doucement pour le reste\r\ntemps de cuisson. Servir avec la purée."]','2026-01-11 00:18:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12413,6630,'fr','Korma au poulet','Envie d''un curry sans trop de calories ? Utilisez du yaourt grec sans gras au lieu de la crème pour un korma sain qui donnera du fil à retordre à vos plats à emporter locaux.','["1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché grossièrement","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de korma","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées, coupées en bouchées","50 g d''amandes moulues, plus un peu pour servir (facultatif)","4 cuillères à soupe de raisins secs","400 ml de bouillon de poulet","¼ cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","Pot de 150 g de yaourt grec 0 % de matière grasse","petit bouquet de coriandre hachée"]','["Mettez l''oignon, l''ail et le gingembre dans un\r\nrobot culinaire et réduire en pâte.\r\nVersez la pâte dans un grand moule à bords hauts\r\npoêle avec 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau et laissez cuire pendant\r\n5 minutes. Ajouter la pâte de korma et cuire\r\npendant encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit aromatique.","Incorporer le poulet à la sauce, puis\r\najouter la poudre d''amandes, les raisins secs, le bouillon\r\net du sucre. Donnez à tout un bon mélange,\r\npuis couvrir et laisser mijoter 10 minutes ou\r\njusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit.","Retirez la casserole du feu, remuez\r\ndans le yaourt et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis\r\nparsemer de coriandre et de flocons\r\namandes, si vous en utilisez. Servir avec du brun\r\nou du riz basmati blanc."]','2026-01-11 00:18:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12414,6634,'fr','Fish & chips au four','Donnez à cette combinaison classique une cure de jouvence saine en cuisant les ingrédients au four au lieu de les faire frire.','["880 g de pommes de terre farineuses, lavées et coupées en chips","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","50 g de chapelure fraîche","le zeste d''1 citron","2 cuillères à soupe de persil plat haché","4 filets de poisson blanc durable de 140 g/5 oz d''épaisseur","200 g de tomates cerises"]','["Chauffer le four à 220C/200C ventilateur/gaz 7.\r\nSéchez les chips sur du papier absorbant, puis déposez-les\r\nen une seule couche sur une grande plaque à pâtisserie.\r\nArroser de la moitié de l''huile d''olive et assaisonner\r\navec du sel. Cuire 40 minutes en retournant\r\naprès 20 minutes, pour qu''ils cuisent uniformément.","Mélanger la chapelure avec le citron\r\nle zeste et le persil, puis bien assaisonner. Haut\r\nla morue uniformément avec la chapelure\r\nmélange, puis arroser 0,0 avec le reste\r\nhuile. Mettre dans un plat à rôtir avec la cerise\r\ntomates, puis cuire au four pendant\r\n10 dernières minutes de cuisson des chips."]','2026-01-11 00:18:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12415,6636,'fr','Bol de fruits de mer riche en paprika','Manger sainement n''est pas qu''une question de salade, ce ragoût de poisson compte pour 3 de vos 5 par jour et il est faible en gras','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, coupés en deux et tranchés finement","2 branches de céleri, hachées finement","gros bouquet de persil plat, feuilles et tiges séparées","2-3 cuillères à café de paprika","200 g de poivrons rouges rôtis, égouttés, tranchés épaissement","400 g de tomates concassées à l''ail","400 g de filet de poisson blanc coupé en très gros morceaux","quelques moules fraîches (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis ajoutez les oignons,\r\ncéleri et un peu de sel. Couvrir, puis faire revenir doucement\r\njusqu''à tendreté, environ 10 minutes. Mettez le persil\r\nles tiges, la moitié des feuilles, l''huile et l''assaisonnement\r\nun robot culinaire et réduire en pâte. Ajouter\r\nceci et le paprika aux oignons ramollis,\r\nfaire frire quelques minutes. Ajoutez les poivrons et\r\ntomates avec un peu d''eau, puis laisser mijoter\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait réduit.","Disposez le poisson et les moules dessus.\r\nsauce, mettre un couvercle, puis laisser mijoter 5 min\r\njusqu''à ce que le poisson se défasse et que les moules\r\nsont ouverts – jetez ceux qui restent fermés.\r\nIncorporer délicatement les fruits de mer à la sauce,\r\nassaisonner, puis servir dans des bols."]','2026-01-11 00:18:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12416,6640,'fr','Cabillaud aux tomates et au thym','Prêt en 20 minutes et faible en gras, ce plat de poisson est idéal pour un lundi soir où l''on préfère être sur le canapé plutôt qu''à la cuisine','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café bombée de cassonade légère et molle","quelques brins de thym, effeuillés","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce soja","4 cabillauds, des filets (on aime No Catch) ou un autre poisson blanc feuilleté, comme le lieu jaune"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, ajoutez l''oignon, puis faites revenir pendant 5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement doré. Incorporer les tomates, le sucre, le thym et le soja, puis porter à ébullition.","Laisser mijoter 5 min, puis glisser le cabillaud dans la sauce. Couvrir et cuire doucement pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la morue se défasse facilement.\r\nServir avec des pommes de terre au four ou à la vapeur."]','2026-01-11 00:18:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12417,6645,'fr','Légumes méditerranéens à l''agneau','Un tout-en-un rempli de légumes et d''agneau tendre qui satisfera toute la famille','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de filet d''agneau maigre, débarrassé de tout gras et tranché finement","140 g d''échalotes coupées en deux","2 grosses courgettes coupées en morceaux","½ cuillère à café de chaque cumin moulu, paprika et coriandre moulue","1 poivron rouge, 1 orange et 1 vert, coupés en morceaux","1 gousse d''ail, tranchée","150 ml de bouillon de légumes","250 g de tomates cerises","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre hachées grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand récipient à fond épais\r\npoêle à frire. Cuire l''agneau et les échalotes\r\nà feu vif pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.\r\nAjouter les courgettes et faire sauter pendant\r\n3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle commence à ramollir.","Ajouter les épices et bien mélanger, puis ajouter\r\nles poivrons et l''ail. Réduisez la chaleur\r\net faites cuire à feu modéré pendant\r\n4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir.","Versez le bouillon et remuez pour bien enrober. Ajouter\r\nles tomates, assaisonner, puis recouvrir de\r\nun couvercle et laisser mijoter 15 minutes en remuant\r\nde temps en temps jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres.\r\nIncorporer la coriandre pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12418,6647,'fr','Champignon Stroganoff','Quelques substitutions astucieuses peuvent rendre cette cocotte crémeuse traditionnelle faible en gras et en calories.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","300 g de champignons mélangés, hachés","150 ml de bouillon de bœuf ou de légumes faible en sodium","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce Worcestershire ou alternative végétarienne","3 cuillères à soupe de crème sure demi-écrémée","petit bouquet de persil, haché grossièrement","Sachet de 250 g de riz sauvage cuit"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive\r\npoêle et attendrir l''oignon pendant environ\r\n5 minutes. Ajoutez l''ail et le paprika, puis\r\ncuire encore 1 min. Ajouter les champignons\r\net faites cuire à feu vif en remuant souvent,\r\npendant environ 5 minutes.","Versez le bouillon et le Worcestershire\r\nsauce. Portez à ébullition, bouillonnez 5 mn\r\njusqu''à ce que la sauce épaississe, puis éteignez le\r\nchauffer et incorporer la crème sure et\r\nla majeure partie du persil. Assurez-vous que la casserole est\r\npas sur le feu sinon la sauce pourrait se fendre.","Chauffer le riz en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage,\r\npuis incorporez le persil restant\r\net servir avec le stroganoff."]','2026-01-11 00:18:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12419,6649,'fr','Galettes de saumon et brocoli avec salade de cresson, avocat et tomate','Augmentez le facteur bon pour la santé avec ces galettes de poisson au saumon garnies de légumes, servies avec une salade fraîche','["500 g de pommes de terre coupées en morceaux","85 g de brocoli coupé en petits bouquets","paquet de 2 filets de saumon pochés","le jus d''1 citron et des quartiers pour servir","petit bouquet d''aneth, haché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 cuillère à soupe de moutarde de Dijon","1 avocat pelé, dénoyauté et haché grossièrement","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","100 g de cresson en sachet"]','["Couvrir les pommes de terre dans de l''eau salée,\r\nporter à ébullition et laisser mijoter pendant\r\n8 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres, en ajoutant le\r\nbrocoli 3 min avant la fin de la cuisson\r\nle temps. Égoutter, laisser sécher le tout à la vapeur,\r\npuis écrasez grossièrement. Écaillez le saumon,\r\najoutez la moitié du jus de citron et l''aneth avec un peu\r\nassaisonner, puis façonner 4 gâteaux.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle et faites revenir le\r\ngâteaux pendant 3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.\r\nPendant ce temps, mélangez le reste du jus de citron\r\navec la moutarde et l''assaisonnement, puis\r\nmettre de côté. Mélangez l''avocat, les tomates\r\net le cresson et diviser entre\r\nassiettes. Servir une galette de poisson chacune avec\r\nla salade, arrosée de vinaigrette, et\r\ndes quartiers de citron supplémentaires à presser."]','2026-01-11 00:18:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12420,6651,'fr','Paquets de poisson cuit à la vapeur et de pak choi','Ajoutez simplement du riz cuit à la vapeur pour un repas savoureux et faible en calories','["4 filets de plie, d''aiglefin ou autre poisson blanc certifié MSC","2 pak choi, tranchés épaissement","4 oignons nouveaux, émincés","1 piment rouge, tranché finement","3 cm de gingembre, coupé en allumettes","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja réduite en sel","jus 1 citron vert","1 cuillère à café d''huile de sésame"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nPlacer chaque filet au centre d''un grand\r\ncarré de papier d''aluminium. Garnir de pak choi,\r\noignons nouveaux, piment et gingembre, puis retirer\r\nsur les bords du papier d''aluminium.","Mélanger la sauce soja, le jus de citron vert\r\net 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau puis versez-en un peu\r\nsur chaque filet. Sertissez le dessus du papier d''aluminium\r\npour enfermer le poisson et s''assurer qu''il y a\r\nil n''y a pas d''espace permettant à la vapeur de s''échapper.","Disposez les paquets sur une plaque à pâtisserie\r\net cuire au four pendant 10-15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson\r\nest bien cuit (cela dépend de\r\nl''épaisseur de votre poisson). Ouvrez le\r\nparcelles et arrosez de quelques gouttes de\r\nhuile de sésame. Servir avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:18:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12421,6653,'fr','Soupe de poivrons rouges rôtis et croûtons croustillants','Réchauffez-vous lors des soirées plus froides avec cette soupe vibrante, agrémentée de poudre de piment ardent et d''harissa. Les croûtons croustillants sont facultatifs mais ajoutent un croquant satisfaisant','["2 oignons rouges, hachés grossièrement","2 carottes (250 g), hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, hachées grossièrement","200 g de poivrons rouges rôtis en pot (poids égoutté), égouttés et hachés grossièrement","1 cuillère à café de pâte de harissa à la rose","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment du Cachemire (ou toute autre poudre de piment)","850 ml de bouillon de légumes faible en sel","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature, pour servir","100 g de pain croustillant complet légèrement rassis, coupé en cubes","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive"]','["Mélangez les oignons et les carottes ensemble dans un robot culinaire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement hachés, ou hachez-les finement à la main. Si vous préparez les croûtons, chauffez le four à 220°C/200°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon et la carotte hachés avec une pincée de sel pendant 5 à 6 minutes, en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Incorporer l''ail et les poivrons et cuire encore 1 minute jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient parfumés.","Ajouter la pâte d''harissa, les graines de cumin et la poudre de piment et cuire 1 min en remuant. Ajoutez le bouillon et augmentez le feu à moyen-vif, portez à ébullition et laissez cuire 15 à 18 minutes jusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres.","Pendant ce temps, si vous préparez les croûtons, mélangez le pain avec l''huile et assaisonnez bien. Versez sur une plaque à pâtisserie et faites cuire au four pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient profondément dorés et croustillants.","Transférez le mélange de légumes dans un mélangeur puissant (ou utilisez un mélangeur à main) et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Assaisonner et verser dans des bols. Garnir de yaourt et répartir sur les croûtons, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:18:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12422,6655,'fr','Bols à sushi au sésame et au gingembre','Ce panier-repas végétalien regorge de bienfaits, à base de riz complet riche en fibres et de haricots edamame riches en protéines, le tout accompagné d''une vinaigrette piquante au tamari et au sésame.','["25 g de gingembre (choisir un morceau droit et assez fin), pelé","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de cidre de pomme brut, plus 1 cuillère à soupe","200 g de riz basmati brun","320 g de haricots edamame surgelés","1½-2 cuillères à soupe de tamari","2 avocats, dénoyautés et tranchés","1 grosse carotte, râpée en longues allumettes ou grossièrement râpée","50 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","¼ concombre, tranché","2 cuillères à café d''huile de sésame","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Coupez le gingembre aussi finement que possible pour obtenir des tranches très fines ou râpez-le finement. Mettre dans un bol avec 4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau et masser brièvement pour ramollir. Annuler.","Mettez le riz dans une casserole moyenne et ajoutez 600 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition, couvrez et laissez mijoter à feu doux pendant 15 min. Ajoutez les haricots edamame, mais ne les remuez pas, puis couvrez et laissez cuire encore 7 minutes. Le riz doit être tendre et avoir absorbé toute l''eau.","Retirez les haricots du riz et réservez. Versez 1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre et ½ cuillère à soupe de tamari dans le riz et remuez bien. Verser dans une assiette et étaler pour refroidir rapidement. Une fois refroidi, répartir dans quatre bols ou boîtes à lunch. Garnir de l''avocat, de la carotte, des haricots, des tomates et du concombre.","Verser le gingembre du vinaigre et répartir dessus. Ajoutez le reste de tamari et l''huile de sésame au vinaigre. Verser sur le bol à sushi et parsemer de graines. Se conserve au réfrigérateur pendant deux jours."]','2026-01-11 00:18:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12423,6657,'fr','Salade asiatique de crevettes et quinoa','Cette salade fraîche représente 3 de vos 5 par jour. Avec du citron vert piquant et une touche de piment, c''est également une excellente introduction au quinoa si vous ne l''avez jamais essayé auparavant.','["60 g de quinoa","150 g de crevettes décortiquées cuites","1 petit avocat, dénoyauté et tranché","¼ de concombre, coupé en deux et tranché","50g de cresson","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","le zeste et le jus finement râpés d''un gros citron vert","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","2 oignons nouveaux, parés et finement hachés","1 cuillère à café de tamari sans blé","une poignée de coriandre hachée","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","½ cuillère à café de sirop d''érable"]','["Faites bouillir le quinoa dans une petite casserole pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les grains soient tendres et semblent avoir éclaté. Bien égoutter et verser dans un bol. Pendant ce temps, préparez la vinaigrette : mélangez le zeste et le jus du citron vert et le piment dans un bol.","Incorporer la moitié de la vinaigrette au quinoa avec les oignons nouveaux, le tamari et la moitié de la coriandre. Incorporer tous les légumes de la salade, puis répartir sur deux assiettes de service.","Incorporer l''huile et le sirop d''érable au reste de la vinaigrette et ajouter les crevettes. Verser sur la salade de quinoa et parsemer de coriandre pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12424,6659,'fr','Egg Niçoise salad','Une salade niçoise végétarienne pleine de bienfaits : sans fibres, folate, fer, vitamine C et sans gluten également','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de colza","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique","1 gousse d''ail, râpée","? basilic en petit paquet, feuilles hachées","3 olives noires Kalamata dénoyautées, rincées et hachées","2 œufs","250 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, tranchées épaisses","200 g de haricots verts fins","½ oignon rouge, haché très finement","14 tomates cerises, coupées en deux","6 feuilles de laitue romaine, déchirées en bouchées","6 olives Kalamata noires dénoyautées, rincées et coupées en deux"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un petit bol avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau.","Pendant ce temps, faites bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 7 minutes, ajoutez les haricots et faites bouillir 5 minutes de plus ou jusqu''à ce que les deux soient juste tendres, puis égouttez-les. Faites bouillir 2 œufs pendant 8 minutes puis décortiquez-les et coupez-les en deux.","Mélanger les haricots, les pommes de terre et le reste des ingrédients de la salade, à l''exception des œufs, dans un grand bol avec la moitié de la vinaigrette. Disposez les œufs dessus et arrosez du reste de la vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:18:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12425,6661,'fr','Salade satay au poulet','Faites mariner les poitrines de poulet, puis arrosez-les d''une sauce satay aux arachides percutante pour un repas en milieu de semaine sans chichi, riche en protéines et riche en saveurs.','["1 cuillère à soupe de tamari","1 cuillère à café de poudre de curry moyenne","¼ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 gousse d''ail, finement râpée","1 cuillère à café de miel clair","2 filets de poitrine de poulet sans peau (ou utilisez de la poitrine de dinde)","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre de cacahuète croquant (choisissez une version sans sucre et sans huile de palme, si possible)","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce chili douce","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron vert","un peu d''huile de tournesol, pour essuyer la poêle","2 cœurs de laitue Little Gem, coupés en quartiers","¼ de concombre, coupé en deux et tranché","1 échalote banane, coupée en deux et tranchée finement","une généreuse poignée de coriandre hachée","graines d''une ½ grenade"]','["Versez le tamari dans un grand plat et incorporez la poudre de curry, le cumin, l''ail et le miel.\r\nBien mélanger. Coupez les poitrines de poulet en deux horizontalement pour obtenir 4 filets au total, puis ajoutez-les à la marinade et mélangez bien pour enrober. Réserver au réfrigérateur pendant au moins 1 heure, voire toute la nuit, pour permettre aux saveurs de pénétrer dans le poulet.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le beurre de cacahuète avec la sauce chili, le jus de citron vert et 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau pour obtenir une sauce à la cuillère. Au moment de cuire le poulet, essuyez une grande poêle antiadhésive avec un peu d''huile. Ajouter le poulet et cuire, couvert d''un couvercle, pendant 5 à 6 minutes à feu moyen, en retournant les filets pendant la dernière minute, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient cuits mais encore humides. Laisser reposer, couvert, quelques minutes.","Pendant que le poulet repose, mélangez les quartiers de laitue avec le concombre, l''échalote, la coriandre et la grenade, et empilez-les dans des assiettes. Verser un peu de sauce. Trancher le poulet, l''empiler sur la salade et verser sur le reste de la sauce. Mangez pendant que le poulet est encore chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:18:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12426,6663,'fr','Scones à l''aneth, saumon fumé et relish de concombre','Les scones salés sont une excellente alternative aux pains à hamburger ou aux bagels','["200 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","200 g de farine complète nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","20 g d''aneth haché finement à moitié","50g de beurre doux, très froid et coupé en cubes","300 ml de lait réchauffé, plus un peu pour le brossage","1 cuillère à café de graines de pavot","Paquet de 200 g de tranches de saumon fumé et paquet de 300 g de fromage à pâte molle, pour servir","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre","100 ml de vinaigre de vin de riz","1 gros concombre, pelé","un demi-oignon rouge, tranché très finement","1 piment rouge doux, épépiné et finement haché (facultatif)"]','["Pour les scones, chauffer le four à 230C/210C chaleur tournante/gaz 8 et fariner légèrement une plaque à pâtisserie. Mélangez les farines, le bicarbe, l''aneth haché et 1 cuillère à café de sel fin dans un grand bol, puis incorporez le beurre jusqu''à ce qu''il disparaisse. Versez le lait et remuez brièvement pour obtenir une pâte collante.","Grattez la pâte sur une surface farinée, saupoudrez la pâte et vos mains avec plus de farine, puis pliez la pâte 2 à 3 fois pour la lisser un peu. Tapotez en un rond de 4 cm de profondeur. Utilisez un emporte-pièce de 7 cm pour découper les scones (voir conseil ci-dessous). Appuyez sur les garnitures ensemble et répétez. Badigeonner de lait, parsemer de graines de pavot, puis cuire au four pendant 15 à 18 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et bien levées. Laisser refroidir sur une grille. Comme pour tous les scones, il est préférable de les manger le jour même.","Pour le cornichon, incorporez le sucre au vinaigre jusqu''à dissolution. Coupez le concombre en deux et épépinez-le, coupez-le en tranches épaisses, puis mélangez-le avec le vinaigre, l''oignon et le piment. Laisser reposer au moins 15 minutes au réfrigérateur. Peut être préparé jusqu''à 24 heures à l''avance. Au moment de servir, déchirer le reste de l''aneth sur la relish. Fendu des scones, tartiné de fromage à pâte molle et garni d''un ruban de saumon et d''un peu de relish."]','2026-01-11 00:18:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12427,6665,'fr','Frittata de pommes de terre, oignons nouveaux, aneth et fromage','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Le déjeuner d''été parfait sans stress. Pour une option non végétarienne, ajoutez quelques tranches de jambon','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","400 g de restes de pommes de terre nouvelles cuites, tranchées","4 œufs, battus","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 bouquet d''aneth, haché grossièrement","25 g de cheddar râpé"]','["Dans une petite poêle antiadhésive, faites chauffer\r\nhuile à feu moyen. Ajouter les pommes de terre,\r\npuis faire revenir jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à devenir croustillant, environ\r\n8 minutes. Dans un bol, fouettez ensemble les œufs,\r\noignons nouveaux, aneth et un peu d''assaisonnement.\r\nFaites chauffer le gril.","Versez les œufs dans la poêle, mélangez rapidement,\r\nbaisser le feu, puis saupoudrer\r\nfromage. Après environ 8 minutes, une fois en haut\r\nle côté est presque pris, passez-le sous le gril\r\npendant 2-3 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient fermes et dorés.\r\nFaites glisser hors de la poêle. Mangez immédiatement avec de la mayonnaise ou du ketchup ou refroidissez rapidement et réfrigérez."]','2026-01-11 00:18:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12428,6667,'fr','Salade de saumon fumé à chaud, lentilles et grenade','Pas de cuisson, pas d''effort, mais vous ne manquerez pas de saveur avec ce souper vibrant pour deux','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","jus ½ citron","1 gousse d''ail, hachée finement","2 cuillères à soupe d''estragon grossièrement haché","1 cuillère à café de miel clair","1 petit oignon rouge, tranché finement","Boîte de 400 g de lentilles du Puy rincées et égouttées","140 g de saumon fumé à chaud","20 g de persil plat, feuilles cueillies","1 grenade, épépinée","pain pitta grillé, pour servir"]','["Mélangez l''huile, le jus de citron, l''ail,\r\nestragon et miel dans un grand bol et\r\nsaison. Incorporer l''oignon rouge et les lentilles\r\net laisser mariner 10 min.","Cassez le saumon en gros flocons et\r\nincorporer à la salade avec le persil et\r\ngrenade. Servir avec du pitta grillé."]','2026-01-11 00:18:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12429,6669,'fr','Tortillas de thon frais','Un gagnant à tous points de vue – vitamine D, oméga 3 et 1 de vos 5 par jour, c''est même simple à préparer','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","2 gros steaks de thon","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","4 tortillas moelleuses","1 avocat, tranché","2 tomates, tranchées","jus 1 citron vert","une poignée de coriandre hachée","crème sure, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Frottez de l''huile sur chaque steak, puis saupoudrez-le de\r\nles épices. Faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude, puis\r\ncuire les steaks d''un côté pendant 2 minutes. Tourner\r\net laissez cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes. Couper en lanières.","Chauffer les tortillas 30 secondes au micro-ondes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre. Pile de thon, avocat et tomates\r\nsur chacun, puis presser le citron vert\r\njus et parsemer de coriandre. Cuillerée aigre\r\ncrème dessus, si vous le souhaitez, puis roulez et mangez."]','2026-01-11 00:18:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12430,6671,'fr','Soupe de patates douces et lentilles','Satisfaisante et simple à préparer, la soupe maison est un excellent souper ou un déjeuner à emporter au travail.','["2 cuillères à café de poudre de curry moyenne","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, râpés","1 pomme à manger, pelée, épépinée et râpée","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","20 g de coriandre, tiges hachées","morceau de gingembre frais de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","800 g de patates douces","1,2 l de bouillon de légumes","100 g de lentilles rouges","300 ml de lait","jus 1 citron vert"]','["Mettez la poudre de curry dans un grand\r\ncasserole, puis faire griller à feu moyen\r\nchauffer 2 min. Ajouter l''huile d''olive en remuant\r\ntandis que les épices grésillent dans la poêle. Astuce dans le\r\noignons, pomme, ail, tiges de coriandre et\r\ngingembre, assaisonner, puis cuire doucement pendant\r\n5 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Pendant ce temps, épluchez puis râpez le sucré\r\npommes de terre. Verser dans la poêle avec le bouillon,\r\nlentilles, lait et assaisonnement, puis laisser mijoter,\r\ncouvert, pendant 20 minutes. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse\r\nà l''aide d''un mixeur plongeant. Incorporer le jus de citron vert,\r\nvérifier l''assaisonnement et servir garni\r\navec des feuilles de coriandre grossièrement hachées."]','2026-01-11 00:18:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12431,6673,'fr','Enveloppements hoisin','Préparez cette version délicieuse et saine d''un wrap au canard laqué pour une collation rapide ou un déjeuner savoureux.','["200 g de dinde ou de poulet cuit, coupé en lanières","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce hoisin","2 tortillas à la farine","¼ de concombre épépiné et râpé","4 oignons nouveaux, parés et finement émincés","une bonne poignée de cresson"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Mélangez la dinde ou le poulet avec la moitié de la sauce hoisin pour qu''elle soit bien enrobée, puis étalez-la dessus.\r\nun plat allant au four et griller jusqu''à ce qu''il grésille. Réchauffez les tortillas sous le gril ou selon les instructions sur l''emballage.","Tartiner les tortillas avec le reste de la sauce hoisin, puis utiliser pour envelopper la dinde ou le poulet avec le concombre, les oignons et le cresson. Coupez-le en deux et dégustez-le encore chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:18:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12432,6675,'fr','Salade de nouilles aux crevettes et au piment doux','Cette salade faible en gras est idéale pour un pique-nique, une boîte à lunch ou même un buffet','["3 nids de nouilles aux œufs de taille moyenne","½ gros concombre","botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","1 piment vert épépiné, finement haché","200 g de gambas cuites, décongelées si congelées","le zeste et le jus de 2 citrons verts","4 cuillères à soupe de sauce chili douce","100 g de pousses d''épinards","25 g de noix de cajou grillées"]','["Faites bouillir les nouilles pendant 4 minutes, puis égouttez-les.\r\nRefroidir sous l''eau courante, puis égoutter\r\nencore une fois. Mettez dans un grand bol, puis utilisez\r\nciseaux, coupés en longueurs plus courtes.","Coupez le concombre en deux dans le sens de la longueur, puis\r\nretirez les graines. Couper en demi-lunes\r\net ajoutez aux nouilles avec le\r\noignons, tomates, piment et crevettes.","Mélangez le zeste, le jus et la sauce chili du citron vert.\r\nfaire une vinaigrette et incorporer les nouilles.\r\nMettez une poignée d''épinards sur chaque portion\r\nassiette, garnir de nouilles et de noix de cajou."]','2026-01-11 00:18:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12433,6677,'fr','Salade de légumes rôtis et couscous','Préparez une salade de couscous copieuse et parfumée pour un repas végétarien dans une boîte à lunch, ou doublez-la pour un buffet','["1 poivron rouge et 1 jaune, coupés en deux et épépinés","½ courge musquée","2 courgettes, tranchées épaisses","4 gousses d''ail, laisser la peau","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 oignon rouge, tranché épaisse","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte d''harissa","50 g d''amandes entières blanchies","250 g de couscous","300 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron","20 g de menthe en paquet, hachée grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Couper\r\npoivrons et courges en bouchées\r\n(laisser la peau sur la courge). Donnez un pourboire à tous les légumes\r\ndans une plaque à pâtisserie, ajouter l''ail, 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile\r\net l''assaisonnement, puis mélanger et rôtir pendant 20 min.\r\nAjouter l''oignon, le cumin, la harissa et les amandes.\r\nRôtir encore 20 minutes, puis laisser refroidir.","Mettez le couscous dans un grand bol, versez\r\nsur le bouillon, couvrir, puis réserver\r\n10 minutes. Remuez avec une fourchette.","Dans un bol, mélanger le zeste, le jus et le reste\r\nhuile. Pressez la pulpe d''ail des peaux dans le\r\nbol, bien écraser et incorporer la menthe. Verser\r\nsur les légumes, puis mélanger avec le couscous."]','2026-01-11 00:18:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12434,6679,'fr','Ragoût de bœuf fumé','Savourez ce simple ragoût pour le dîner, puis emballez-le dans des boîtes pour tenir le coup pour le déjeuner.','["1 kg de bœuf à ragoût, coupé en gros morceaux","2 oignons, hachés","800 g (2 boîtes) de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à café de paprika doux, de cumin moulu et de poudre de piment doux","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge ou blanc","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre","Boîte de 400 g de haricots beurre, rincés et égouttés"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/\r\n140C ventilateur/gaz 3. Mélangez le\r\nboeuf, oignons, tomates,\r\népices, vinaigre et sucre dans\r\nune cocotte. Couvrir et\r\ncuire au four pendant 2h30. Incorporer le\r\nharicots et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes\r\nplus (avec le couvercle retiré si le\r\nla cocotte est un peu humide ou\r\ncouvercle si bonne consistance),\r\njusqu''à ce que le bœuf soit tendre.","Laisser refroidir, puis congeler\r\n6 à 8 portions en petite nourriture\r\nsacs ou récipients en plastique.\r\nDécongeler au micro-ondes ou\r\nune nuit au réfrigérateur, puis\r\nchaleur le matin et\r\ntransférer dans un thermos\r\nrécipient ou chauffer dans le\r\nmicro-ondes à midi."]','2026-01-11 00:18:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12435,6681,'fr','Ragoût de boulettes de viande rapide','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Servir les boulettes de viande de bœuf dans une cocotte de tomates avec de l''ail et du romarin et manger avec des pâtes ou du pain croustillant.','["2 pommes de terre moyennes, pelées et coupées en petits cubes","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","250 g de petites boulettes de bœuf maigre","1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de romarin haché","Pot de purée de 560 ml","200 g de petits pois surgelés","quelques copeaux de parmesan, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres.\r\nPendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole.\r\nAssaisonnez les boulettes de viande, puis faites-les dorer toutes\r\npendant environ 5 minutes. Retirer de la poêle,\r\négouttez l''excédent de graisse, puis ajoutez l''oignon,\r\nail et romarin. Faites frire doucement pendant 5 min.","Ajouter la passata dans la poêle, porter à ébullition,\r\npuis ajoutez les boulettes de viande. Laisser mijoter 5 mn\r\nou jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien cuit. Ajouter\r\nles pommes de terre et les petits pois, puis laisser mijoter pendant\r\n1 minute. Emballez dans un flacon ou réchauffez au travail,\r\najoutez du parmesan, si vous en utilisez, et mangez avec de bons\r\npain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:18:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12436,6683,'fr','Bol à hamburger','Inspirez-vous de la tendance populaire des hamburgers déconstruits et à faible teneur en glucides, sans pain. N''hésitez pas à changer les garnitures – les champignons frits fonctionnent également bien.','["2 grosses pommes de terre, coupées en gros morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 cuillères à soupe de mélange d''épices cajun","1 cuillère à café de granulés d''ail (facultatif)","250 g de bœuf haché maigre","25 g de cornichons ondulés, plus 1 cuillère à soupe de saumure du pot","1 laitue iceberg, râpée","1 oignon rouge oignon finement tranché en rondelles et rincé à l''eau froide, si vous le souhaitez (cela réduira le fort goût de l''oignon cru)","150 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","50 g de cheddar râpé","3 cuillères à soupe de ketchup faible en sucre","2 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise légère","½ cuillère à soupe de moutarde américaine"]','["Chauffez la friteuse ou le four à 220°C/200°C/gaz 7. Mettez les pommes de terre dans la friteuse ou le four, arrosez d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale, 1 cuillère à soupe de mélange d''épices cajun, les granules d''ail (si vous en utilisez) et assaisonnez. Cuire pendant 20 minutes en secouant à mi-cuisson ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et bien cuits.","Lorsqu''il reste environ 10 minutes aux pommes de terre, faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile restante dans une poêle à feu moyen-vif. Une fois chatoyant, versez le hachis dans la poêle et utilisez une spatule pour le briser. Saupoudrer du reste de la cuillère à soupe de mélange d''épices cajun et assaisonner. Cuire pendant 7 à 8 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et bien cuits.","Répartissez les pommes de terre dans quatre bols, puis garnissez de cornichons, de laitue, d''oignon rouge, de tomates cerises, de viande hachée et d''un peu de fromage.","Mélangez le ketchup, la mayonnaise, la moutarde et la saumure de cornichon dans un petit bol, puis versez-en un filet sur les bols à burger et rentrez-y."]','2026-01-11 00:18:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12437,6685,'fr','Côtelettes de porc au fromage et à l''oignon','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Dégustez du porc britannique avec du fromage Cheshire fondu et un soupçon de moutarde anglaise.','["4 côtelettes de porc","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de moutarde anglaise","4 cuillères à soupe d''oignon caramélisé, en pot","50 g de fromage Cheshire râpé","1 cuillère à café de thym haché"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif, puis placer les côtelettes sur une lèchefrite, frotter avec de l''huile et assaisonner. Griller environ 6 minutes de chaque côté, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Étalez un peu de moutarde sur un côté de chaque côtelette, puis garnissez de 1 cuillère à soupe d''oignons. Mélangez le fromage et le thym, saupoudrez sur les côtelettes, puis faites griller jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et bouillonnantes."]','2026-01-11 00:18:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12438,6687,'fr','Surlonge de bœuf rôtie et sauce au Porto','Servez un superbe surlonge de bœuf ce dimanche, pour un dîner rôti que vous n''oublierez pas','["3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de thym","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1½ -2 kg/3 lb 5 oz-4 lb 8 oz morceau de surlonge de bœuf roulé","1 gousse d''ail","1 feuille de laurier","quelques brins de thym","Port de 75 ml","350 ml de vin rouge","200 ml de bouillon de bœuf (si vous préférez préparer votre sauce sans alcool, doublez simplement la quantité de bouillon)"]','["Pour le bœuf, mélangez l''ail, le thym et l''huile d''olive avec un peu de poivre noir. Frotter le bœuf et laisser reposer au moins 1 heure, plus c''est long, mieux c''est. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6, assaisonner le bœuf avec du sel et le placer dans une rôtissoire. Faites rôtir au four pendant 30 minutes, puis baissez le feu à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et faites cuire 10-15 minutes pour 450 g selon votre goût de la viande – 10 minutes pour 450 g vous donneront une viande saignante et 15 minutes vous donneront une viande bien cuite.","Lorsque le bœuf est cuit, sortez-le du plat à rôtir et laissez-le reposer dans un endroit chaud, légèrement enveloppé dans du papier d''aluminium, pendant 30 minutes. Versez et réservez les jus de repos.","Pour faire la sauce, placez le plat à rôtir sur feu vif avec l''ail, le laurier et le thym. Versez le porto, grattez avec une cuillère en bois pour détacher les débris de la boîte et faites bouillonner jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque complètement réduit. Verser le vin rouge et laisser réduire des trois quarts avant d''ajouter le bouillon. Porter à ébullition et assaisonner selon votre goût. Versez le jus de repos réservé dans le moule. Enfin, versez la sauce au tamis dans un pichet chaud. Découpez la viande et servez avec la sauce."]','2026-01-11 00:18:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12439,6691,'fr','Goberge salée à la crème d''aneth et salade de radis','L''élégante entrée de fruits de mer de style scandinave de Tom Kerridge, semblable au plat de saumon gravadlax, impressionnera à coup sûr lors de n''importe quel dîner.','["100 g de gros sel marin","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de fenouil","1 petit paquet d''aneth, haché","400 g de filet de lieu jaune sans peau (voir ''Astuce'')","500 ml d''huile de colza","140 g de crème fraîche entière","poivre de Cayenne, pour assaisonner","½ petit paquet d''aneth, haché","le zeste finement râpé d''1 citron","300 g de radis (nous avons utilisé des radis français pour le petit-déjeuner)","1 cuillère à soupe de tarasalade","jus ½ citron","½ paquet de ciboulette, ciselée","¼ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","pain brun grillé, pour servir"]','["Mélangez le sel, le sucre, les graines de fenouil et l''aneth dans un bol. Tapisser un grand plat de film alimentaire et recouvrir de la moitié du mélange de sel. Déposez dessus le filet de lieu jaune et recouvrez-le du reste du mélange de sel. Placez le film alimentaire par-dessus et recouvrez complètement le poisson. Mettez le poisson au réfrigérateur et laissez-le durcir pendant au moins 8 heures ou toute la nuit. Passé ce délai, le poisson sera très ferme et aura un goût salé. Lavez le sel, mettez le poisson dans un grand plat, couvrez complètement d''eau froide et laissez tremper 30 minutes. Égoutter et sécher avec du papier absorbant.","Chauffer le four à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 2. Mettez le poisson dans un plat allant au four ou dans une rôtissoire. Versez l''huile de colza sur le dessus du poisson et couvrez le moule d''une feuille de papier d''aluminium, scellez-le sur les bords et faites cuire au four pendant 25 minutes. Retirer du four et laisser recouvert de papier d''aluminium jusqu''au moment de servir. Peut être préparé plusieurs heures à l’avance et laissé reposer à température ambiante.","Fouettez la crème fraîche dans un bol avec une pincée de sel et de poivre de Cayenne pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle épaississe comme de la crème caillée. Incorporez l’aneth haché et le zeste de citron. Couvrir d''un film alimentaire et conserver au réfrigérateur jusqu''à utilisation.","Lavez les radis et coupez-les en deux dans le sens de la longueur. Mettez le tarama et le jus de citron dans un bol et fouettez ensemble. Retirez le lieu jaune de l''huile (voir astuce ci-dessous), égouttez-le sur du papier absorbant pour éliminer l''excédent d''huile, puis émiettez le poisson sur une grande assiette de service. Ajoutez 3-4 cuillères à soupe d''huile de cuisson au taramasalata et fouettez ensemble. Ajoutez les radis, la ciboulette et le paprika fumé à la vinaigrette et pliez le tout en veillant à ce que les radis soient bien enrobés. Servir le poisson tiède avec l''aneth, la crème et la salade de radis. Le pain brun grillé se marie très bien avec cela aussi."]','2026-01-11 00:18:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12440,6693,'fr','Coupes de laitue cocktail crevettes et crabe','Servez des fruits de mer sur un plateau à partager et laissez chacun préparer ses propres petites bouchées de cocktail de crevettes pour une entrée ou un canapé parfait pour un dîner.','["4 cuillères à soupe de mayonnaise","3 cuillères à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","2 cuillères à café de sauce Worcestershire","le jus et le zeste d''1 citron","pincée de poivre de Cayenne","4 tomates épépinées et coupées finement","1 petit oignon rouge, coupé finement","1½ cuillère à soupe de Tabasco","3 laitues Little Gem, feuilles séparées","300g de crevettes cuites et décortiquées (nous avons utilisé un mélange de gambas et de petites crevettes de l''Atlantique Nord)","200 g de chair de crabe blanche","½ bouquet de ciboulette, ciselée","quartiers de citron, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez tous les ingrédients de la sauce Marie Rose et réservez au réfrigérateur. Faites de même avec les ingrédients de la salsa aux tomates. Ceux-ci peuvent être réfrigérés jusqu''à 24 heures.","Disposez les feuilles de laitue, les crevettes, le crabe et la ciboulette dans des bols séparés. Mettez le tout sur la table avec un tas de quartiers de citron.","À table, ajoutez quelques crevettes et du crabe aux feuilles de laitue, nappez de salsa de tomates et de sauce Marie Rose et parsemez de quelques ciboulette. Presser\r\nun peu de jus de citron, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:18:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12441,6695,'fr','Tarte polenta et champignons','Ce joli plat végétarien est composé de polenta au fromage à cuisson rapide garnie de champignons, de mozzarella, de roquette et de vinaigre balsamique.','["25 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","850 ml de bouillon de légumes","200 g de polenta à cuisson rapide","50 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), râpé","2 brins de romarin, feuilles finement hachées","500 g de champignons châtaignes coupés en deux","petit bouquet de thym, feuilles seulement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","125 g de boule de mozzarella égouttée","grosse poignée de fusée","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre balsamique"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nBeurrer et tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de\r\npapier sulfurisé. Apportez le stock au\r\nfaire bouillir dans une grande casserole, puis verser lentement\r\ndans la polenta, en fouettant tout le temps. Apportez\r\nporter à ébullition et faire bouillonner pendant 8 minutes en fouettant\r\nen continu. Retirer du feu et remuer\r\ndans le fromage, le beurre, le romarin et beaucoup\r\nd''assaisonnement. Étalez la polenta sur le\r\nplaque tapissée et enfourner pendant 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les champignons avec le thym et un peu d''assaisonnement. Faites chauffer un peu d''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir les champignons en quelques fois jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Déchirez la mozzarella en morceaux et séchez-la avec du papier absorbant. Garnir la polenta cuite avec les champignons et la mozzarella, puis cuire à nouveau pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu et bouillonne. Répartir la roquette sur la tarte et arroser de vinaigre balsamique."]','2026-01-11 00:18:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12442,6697,'fr','Fondants d''aubergines','Choisissez une aubergine brillante et charnue pour préparer ce plat principal végétarien réconfortant.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 aubergines coupées en deux dans le sens de la longueur","4 tomates","1 boule de 150 g de mozzarella égouttée","une poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Verser l''huile sur l''aubergine et cuire au four pendant 25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit ramollie. Pendant ce temps, coupez les tomates et la mozzarella en tranches, puis disposez-les sur l''aubergine. Remettre au four encore 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit fondu. Parsemer de quelques feuilles de basilic. Servir avec du couscous et de la salade verte."]','2026-01-11 00:18:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12443,6699,'fr','Bouillon thaï de poulet et champignons','Une recette idéale pour mettre vos papilles thaïlandaises en pratique','["1l de bouillon de poulet chaud","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de curry rouge thaï","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce de poisson thaïlandaise","2 cuillères à café de sucre","le zeste et le jus de 2 citrons verts","100 g de champignons portobello tranchés","botte d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés, blancs et verts séparés","200 g de restes de poulet émincés"]','["Versez le bouillon dans une casserole, puis remuez\r\ndans la pâte de curry, sauce poisson, sucre, citron vert\r\nle jus et la majeure partie du zeste. Apporter au\r\nfaire bouillir, puis ajouter les champignons et les blancs\r\nde l''oignon nouveau. Couvrir puis laisser mijoter\r\npendant 2 minutes.","Incorporer le poulet et le plus\r\nà soupe de feuilles d''oignon nouveau pour chauffer doucement\r\nà travers, puis servir à la louche dans des bols et\r\nparsemé du zeste de citron vert restant. Servir avec du jus de citron vert supplémentaire, du sucre et de la sauce de poisson en accompagnement pour que chacun puisse ajuster ses propres bols."]','2026-01-11 00:18:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12444,6701,'fr','Frittata de crevettes et chorizo','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Vous n''avez jamais essayé de fruits de mer avec du chorizo ​​épicé ? Essayez-le lors de ce simple dîner pour deux','["½ oignon, finement haché","50 g de chorizo ​​tranché","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","4 œufs légèrement battus","1 cuillère à soupe de lait","85 g de crevettes cuites et décortiquées","100 g de petits pois surgelés, décongelés","salade de feuilles, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen. Dans une friture de 20 cm\r\npoêle, faire revenir l''oignon et le chorizo dans l''huile\r\nà feu doux. Cuire 4 à 5 minutes,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit tendre.","Retirez la casserole du feu, versez\r\ntout excès de graisse du chorizo, puis remuez\r\ndans les œufs battus et le lait avec un peu\r\nassaisonnement. Incorporer les crevettes et les petits pois\r\net remettre sur feu doux pendant 10-12 min\r\njusqu''à ce que tout sauf le haut de la frittata soit\r\nensemble. Passez-le sous le grill jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré\r\n(garder la poignée à l''abri de la chaleur).\r\nServir en quartiers avec une salade feuillue."]','2026-01-11 00:18:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12445,6703,'fr','Omelette à la salade grecque','Un souper rapide et sain','["10 œufs","une poignée de feuilles de persil hachées (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon rouge, coupé en quartiers","3 tomates coupées en gros morceaux","une grosse poignée d''olives noires (dénoyautées sont plus faciles à manger)","100 g de fromage feta émietté"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Battez les œufs dans un grand bol avec le persil haché, le poivre et le sel, si vous le souhaitez. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, puis faites revenir les quartiers d''oignons à feu vif pendant environ 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à dorer sur les bords. Ajoutez les tomates et les olives et faites cuire 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les tomates commencent à ramollir.","Baissez le feu à moyen et versez les œufs. Faites cuire les œufs dans la poêle en les remuant au fur et à mesure qu''ils commencent à prendre, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient à moitié cuits, mais encore coulants par endroits – environ 2 minutes. Répartissez sur la feta, puis placez la poêle sous le gril pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''omelette soit gonflée et dorée. Couper en quartiers et servir directement de la poêle."]','2026-01-11 00:18:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12446,6705,'fr','Saumon rôti','Cuisiner des côtés entiers de saumon pour une pièce maîtresse est une façon sociable et spéciale de manger','["1 saumon de 2 kg/4 lb 8 oz, en filets pour donner deux côtés, avec la peau","1 citron, tranché","une bonne poignée d''herbes mélangées comme le persil, l''aneth, le cerfeuil ou l''estragon","2 feuilles de laurier","1-2 échalotes, tranchées finement","éclabousser du vin blanc"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Asseyez-vous\r\nun des filets de saumon, peau vers le bas,\r\nsur une grande feuille de papier d''aluminium ou de papier sulfurisé.\r\nParsemer de tranches de citron, d''herbes,\r\nles échalotes et l''assaisonnement, puis assoyez le\r\ndeuxième filet sur le dessus – côté peau vers le haut. Attachez-vous\r\n2-3 endroits avec ficelle pour sécuriser, éclabousser\r\navec du vin et pliez le papier d''aluminium ou le papier pour\r\nsceller. Peut être réfrigéré jusqu''à 3 heures.","Placer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant\r\n50 min-1 h jusqu''à ce que le saumon soit cuit\r\nà travers – vérifiez en enfonçant un couteau dans\r\nles filets et en veillant à ce que la chair\r\nse défasse facilement. Servir dans du papier d''aluminium ou du papier\r\nune assiette de service, ou retirez-le délicatement à l''aide d''un\r\nquelques tranches de poisson. Couper en portions et\r\nservir avec la mayonnaise citron-ciboulette et\r\nPommes de terre nouvelles « Lyonnaise » (voir recettes « Accompagnements ») et mi-cuites\r\nbrocoli (voir ci-dessous)."]','2026-01-11 00:18:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12447,6707,'fr','Morue au bacon, laitue et petits pois','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Bonne source de folate et de fibres, ce souper de poisson sain en contient également deux par jour.','["2 cuillères à café d''huile de tournesol","2 tranches de bacon fumé sans couenne, coupées en petits morceaux","1 longue échalote ou petit oignon, émincé très finement","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 filets de morue épais sans peau de 140 g/5 oz","140 g de petits pois surgelés","200 ml de bouillon de poulet frais ou préparé avec ½ cube","2 laitues Little Gem, râpées épaisses","2 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche demi-écrémée","2 tranches épaisses de pain complet croustillant, pour servir"]','["Chauffer l''huile de tournesol à feu moyen\r\npoêle antiadhésive. Ajoutez le bacon,\r\néchalote ou oignon et ail. Cuire doucement,\r\nen remuant, pendant 2 minutes, puis pousser à un\r\ncôté de la poêle.","Assaisonner la morue avec du noir moulu\r\npoivre. Faire revenir à la poêle pendant 2 minutes, puis\r\nretourner. Ajoutez les petits pois et le bouillon, et\r\nporter à ébullition. Cuire à feu moyen\r\nchauffer encore 2 minutes, puis ajouter le\r\nlaitue et crème fraîche. Cuisinez pendant un\r\nquelques minutes de plus, en remuant les légumes\r\nde temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit juste cuit\r\net la laitue est fanée. Servir avec\r\ndu pain pour éponger le bouillon."]','2026-01-11 00:18:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12448,6709,'fr','Aiglefin à la sauce tomate basilic','Un dîner de poisson délicieusement simple et faible en gras','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, tranché finement","1 petite aubergine d''environ 250 g/9 oz, hachée grossièrement","½ cuillère à café de paprika moulu","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 cuillère à café de sucre muscovado foncé ou clair","8 grandes feuilles de basilic, plus quelques-unes supplémentaires pour saupoudrer","4 filets de poisson blanc ferme sans peau de 4 x 175 g, comme l''aiglefin"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une grande poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir l''oignon et l''aubergine. Après environ 4 minutes, les légumes commenceront à devenir dorés mais ne seront pas encore tendres, alors couvrez avec un couvercle et laissez les légumes frire à la vapeur dans leur propre jus pendant 6 minutes – cela les aidera à ramollir sans avoir besoin d''ajouter d''huile supplémentaire.","Incorporer le paprika, l''ail,\r\ntomates et sucre avec 1?2 cuillère à café\r\nsaler et cuire encore 8 à 10 minutes\r\nminutes, en remuant, jusqu''à ce que l''oignon\r\net l''aubergine sont tendres.","Répartir dans les feuilles de basilic\r\npuis placez le poisson dans le\r\nsauce, couvrir la poêle et cuire\r\npendant 6 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson\r\ndes flocons lorsqu''on les teste avec un couteau\r\net la chair est ferme mais quand même\r\nhumide. Déchirez le reste du\r\nbasilic et servir avec une salade\r\net du pain croustillant."]','2026-01-11 00:18:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12449,6713,'fr','Moules de Goa','Vous pouvez ajouter n''importe quel autre fruit de mer à ce curry vert aromatique rapide – les crevettes peuvent accompagner le lait de coco et les palourdes avec les moules.','["1 kg de moules fraîches","huile de tournesol, pour la friture","1 oignon, haché","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, râpé","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 piments verts, hachés","1 cuillère à café de graines de moutarde noire","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","400 ml de lait de coco","brins de coriandre, pour servir","quartiers de lime, pour servir"]','["Retirez les barbes, puis lavez le\r\nbien les moules dans l''eau froide. Actualiser le\r\narrosez et répétez jusqu’à ce qu’elle soit claire. Jeter\r\nles moules cassées ou restées\r\ns''ouvre lorsqu''on appuie dessus.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte ignifuge.\r\nFaire revenir l''oignon jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très légèrement doré,\r\npuis ajoutez le gingembre, l''ail, les piments,\r\népices, une bonne pincée de sel et une mouture\r\nde poivre. Cuire pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé\r\net grillé. Versez le lait de coco et\r\nporter à ébullition, puis laisser mijoter quelques instants\r\nminutes pour tout mélanger.","Versez les moules dans le plat, couvrez,\r\naugmenter le feu au maximum et faire bouillir\r\npendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce que les moules soient\r\nvient d''ouvrir. Parsemer de coriandre\r\nbrins et servir avec des quartiers de citron vert\r\npour presser."]','2026-01-11 00:18:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12450,6715,'fr','Bœuf à l''ail','Une coupe de bœuf bon marché transformée en une tendre friandise','["1 cuillère à soupe de poivre noir","6 gousses d''ail","4 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","Pièce de 600 g de jupe de bœuf bien parée"]','["Dans un pilon et un mortier, écraser les grains de poivre\r\net l''ail avec une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce que vous ayez\r\nobtenir une pâte onctueuse, puis incorporer le vinaigre.\r\nDisposez le bœuf dans un plat non métallique, puis frottez\r\npartout avec la pâte. Laisser au réfrigérateur\r\npendant quelques heures, mais pas plus.","Pour cuisiner, placez une poêle à frire sur un feu très\r\nchaleur chaude. Frottez la marinade de la viande,\r\npuis assaisonnez avec un peu plus de sel. Cuisinier\r\nviande jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit carbonisée de chaque côté – environ 5\r\nminutes de chaque côté pour une cuisson saignante ; si la coupe est très\r\népais, vous voudrez peut-être le rôtir dans un four chaud\r\npendant 5 minutes après avoir saisi. Soulever sur une planche à découper\r\nplanche, puis repos 5 minutes avant de découper\r\nen tranches et servir avec des chips, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:18:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12451,6717,'fr','Relish des messieurs et œufs brouillés','Le Gentleman’s Relish est une pâte d’anchois salée classique – elle constitue un excellent partenaire pour les œufs brouillés au beurre.','["25 g de beurre ramolli, plus un peu pour les œufs","2 cuillères à café de Gentleman''s Relish","4 œufs","4 tranches de pain complet grillé","1 cuillère à café de persil plat haché"]','["Battre le beurre et le Gentleman''s Relish avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé. Battez légèrement les œufs et assaisonnez avec du poivre, mais pas de sel. Faites fondre une noix de beurre dans une poêle et versez-y les œufs. Laissez-les cuire quelques secondes, puis remuez, toujours sur le feu, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient crémeux.","Lorsque les œufs ne sont pas tout à fait cuits, retirez-les du feu et ajoutez une autre généreuse noix de beurre. (C''est une astuce utile si vous préparez également des œufs brouillés pour le petit-déjeuner : ajouter du beurre supplémentaire ou une cuillère à soupe de crème fait baisser la température et évite que les œufs ne cuisent trop avant d''être servis à table.) Beurrez les toasts avec le beurre aromatisé au Gentleman''s Relish et garnissez avec les œufs. Coupez en doigts, saupoudrez d''un peu de persil et servez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:18:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12452,6719,'fr','Barres granola aux baies de cannelle','Ces barres granola sont idéales pour les boîtes à lunch, le petit-déjeuner sur le pouce ou simplement avec une tasse de café','["100 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","200 g de flocons d''avoine","100 g de graines de tournesol","50g de graines de sésame","50 g de noix concassées","3 cuillères à soupe de miel","100 g de sucre muscovado léger","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","100 g de canneberges, cerises ou myrtilles séchées, ou un mélange"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/chaleur tournante 140°C/gaz 3. Beurrer et tapisser le fond d''un moule de 18 x 25 cm. Mélangez les flocons d''avoine, les graines et les noix dans un plat à rôtir, puis mettez au four pendant 5 à 10 minutes pour griller.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer le beurre, le miel et le sucre dans une casserole en remuant jusqu''à ce que le beurre soit fondu. Ajoutez le mélange d''avoine, la cannelle et les fruits secs, puis mélangez jusqu''à ce que tous les flocons d''avoine soient bien enrobés. Versez dans le moule, appuyez légèrement puis enfournez pour 30 min. Refroidissez dans le moule, puis coupez en 12 barres."]','2026-01-11 00:18:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12453,6721,'fr','Frittata de chèvre, petits pois et haricots','Cette recette est idéale pour un souper en attente, car vous trouverez probablement tous les ingrédients dans votre réfrigérateur.','["300 g de mélange de petits pois et haricots surgelés","8 gros œufs","un peu de lait","100 g de bûche de chèvre à croûte ou utilisez de la feta","1-2 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée","un peu d''huile"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu moyen. Faire bouillir les petits pois\r\net les haricots pendant 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient juste tendres,\r\npuis bien égoutter. Battez les œufs avec un\r\nun peu de lait et un peu d''assaisonnement. Tranche\r\n4 tranches fines et rondes de fromage de chèvre (vous\r\nutiliser environ la moitié de la bûche), hacher grossièrement ou\r\némiettez le reste en morceaux, puis remuez-le\r\ndans les œufs avec les légumes et la menthe.","Huiler légèrement une poêle peu profonde allant au four et mettre sur le feu. Versez le mélange d''œufs et faites cuire doucement sur le feu pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il reste juste un peu de mélange non pris à la surface. Garnir de tranches de chèvre, puis passer sous le grill et faire griller jusqu''à ce que le fromage soit pris, doré et bouillonnant."]','2026-01-11 00:18:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12454,6723,'fr','Porridge aux pommes et aux graines de lin','Commencez la journée du bon pied avec un petit-déjeuner à base d''avoine riche en nutriments – plein de fibres bonnes pour l''estomac, idéales pour la digestion.','["100 g de flocons d''avoine","2 pommes à manger, pelées et râpées","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","500 ml de lait écrémé","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin moulues","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt probiotique","un filet de miel ou de sirop d''agave"]','["Dans une casserole moyenne, mélanger les flocons d''avoine,\r\npommes, cannelle et lait. Apporter à\r\nfaire bouillir en remuant de temps en temps, puis retourner\r\nbaisser le feu et laisser cuire 4 à 5 minutes,\r\nen remuant constamment.","Incorporez les graines de lin moulues, puis\r\nrépartir dans 4 bols de petit-déjeuner. Garnir chacun\r\navec une cuillerée de yaourt, un filet de\r\ndu miel ou du sirop d''agave et une pincée\r\nplus de cannelle."]','2026-01-11 00:18:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12455,6725,'fr','Barres de petit-déjeuner sur le pouce','Pas le temps de prendre le petit déjeuner ? Économisez du temps et de l’argent : créez vos propres barres de petit-déjeuner','["100g de beurre","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","85 g de sucre démérara","140 g de flocons d''avoine","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","50g de noix de coco desséchée","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de lin légèrement écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de sésame","100 g de noisettes concassées"]','["Chauffer le four à 160°C/chaleur tournante 140°C/gaz 3. Beurrer un moule carré de 22 cm de diamètre. Faire fondre le beurre, le sirop et le sucre dans une casserole. Versez les flocons d''avoine, la cannelle, la noix de coco, les graines et les noix, mélangez et versez dans le moule. Cuire au four pendant 30-35 minutes. Laisser refroidir 5 min, puis couper en tranches. Se conserve 1 semaine dans une boîte hermétique."]','2026-01-11 00:18:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12456,6727,'fr','Gâterie tropicale','Commencez votre journée avec une gâterie au muesli aux fruits et aux noix','["250 g de flocons d''avoine géants","50g de noix de coco desséchée","25 g de sucre muscovado noir","50g de graines de citrouille","100 g de mélange de noix du Brésil hachées et de noix de cajou crues entières","Paquet de 250 g de fruits tropicaux prêts à consommer","yaourt, myrtilles fraîches, tranches de banane et miel pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Préchauffer le four à 200C/Gaz\r\n6/four ventilé 180C. Mettez l''avoine, la noix de coco,\r\nsucre et graines de citrouille sur un grand\r\nplaque à pâtisserie avec parois, idéalement antiadhésives.\r\nIncorporer le sucre et briser\r\nmorceaux avec les doigts, puis ajoutez les noix.","Cuire au four 15 minutes en remuant\r\ntoutes les 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que le sucre commence\r\nfondre et les noix sont légèrement grillées.\r\nVersez dans un grand bol et laissez refroidir.","Coupez de petits morceaux de\r\nfruits tropicaux dans le mélange. Servir\r\navec du lait frais, du yaourt et des fruits","Conserver jusqu''à 2 mois, hermétiquement."]','2026-01-11 00:18:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12457,6729,'fr','Barres aux fruits, à l''avoine et aux graines','Une version savoureuse des flapjacks avec une succulente couche d''abricots à l''intérieur','["140 g de sucre muscovado léger","3 cuillères à soupe de sirop doré","140g de beurre","250 g de flocons d''avoine","85 g de raisins secs ou raisins secs","85 g de morceaux de noix (ou utilisez vos noix préférées, hachées grossièrement)","50 g de sésame ou de graines mélangées","25 g de canneberges séchées","50 g d''abricots prêts à consommer, hachés finement"]','["Chauffer le four à 160C/chaleur tournante 140C/gaz 3.\r\nChauffer doucement le sucre, le sirop doré\r\net beurrer dans une poêle jusqu''à ce que le sucre et\r\nle beurre a tous deux fondu. Remuez l''avoine,\r\nraisins secs, noix, graines et canneberges\r\ndans la poêle jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient enrobés de beurre.","Verser la moitié du mélange d''avoine dans un plat à gratin\r\nétain (23 x 23 cm environ). Dispersion\r\nles abricots par-dessus, puis garnir de\r\nle reste du mélange d''avoine. Emballez le mélange\r\nbien descendre et lisser avec le dos\r\nd''une cuillère en métal. Enfourner 35 mn\r\nou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés foncés. Laisser refroidir\r\ncomplètement avant de couper en 16 barres\r\navec un couteau bien aiguisé."]','2026-01-11 00:18:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12458,6731,'fr','Salade de steak grillé avec vinaigrette au raifort','Une salade de tomates colorée égaye ce souper rapide et sain composé d''un steak de bœuf maigre mariné avec une sauce moutarde piquante.','["250 g de bavette ou de bavette","1 cuillère à café de graines de céleri, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce Worcestershire","un peu d''huile d''olive, pour badigeonner","6 branches de céleri, tranchées finement, feuilles réservées","200 g de tomates mélangées, tranchées ou coupées en deux (le steak de bœuf, la prune et la cerise rouge et jaune sont tous bons)","1 cuillère à soupe de sauce Worcestershire","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 cuillère à café de sauce au raifort","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à café de purée de tomates"]','["Frottez le steak des deux côtés avec le\r\ngraines de céleri écrasées, un peu d''assaisonnement\r\net la sauce Worcestershire. Brosse\r\navec de l''huile d''olive et laisser mariner pendant\r\nvous préparez la salade.","Mélangez les ingrédients de la vinaigrette dans un petit\r\nbol. Répartissez le céleri et les tomates\r\nentre 2 assiettes. Faire chauffer une poêle\r\nà feu vif, puis faites cuire la viande\r\npendant 2-3 minutes de chaque côté (selon\r\nsur l''épaisseur de vos steaks). Supprimer\r\ndu feu et laisser reposer à couvert\r\navec du papier d''aluminium, pendant 5 minutes.","Trancher les steaks et les disposer dessus\r\ndes salades, verser la vinaigrette dessus\r\net répartir sur les feuilles de céleri."]','2026-01-11 00:18:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12459,6733,'fr','Crevettes à l''ail et lentilles asiatiques du Puy','N’écartez pas les lentilles trop rapidement : elles sont nourrissantes, saines et faciles à combiner avec d’autres saveurs, comme le prouve ce plat.','["400 g de crevettes tigrées crues décortiquées, décongelées si congelées","2 piments rouges épépinés et finement hachés","le zeste et le jus d''1 citron vert","2 grosses gousses d''ail, écrasées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile","200 g de lentilles du Puy","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja","1 cuillère à soupe de miel clair","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin de riz","3 cuillères à soupe de graines de sésame grillées","bouquet de coriandre, feuilles hachées grossièrement"]','["Disposez les crevettes dans un plat peu profond. Mélanger\r\nensemble la moitié du piment finement haché, du citron vert\r\nle zeste et le jus, l''ail et l''huile, puis verser dessus\r\nles crevettes. Couvrir et réfrigérer 20 minutes pour\r\nmariner.","Pendant ce temps, mettez les lentilles dans une casserole, couvrez\r\navec deux fois leur profondeur dans l''eau, porter à la\r\nfaire bouillir, puis laisser mijoter pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ntendre. Ajoutez de l''eau si nécessaire.","Pour faire la vinaigrette, mettez le reste\r\npiment haché, soja, miel et vinaigre\r\ndans un petit bol et mélanger. Égoutter le\r\nlentilles, puis versez-les dans un grand bol. Verser dessus\r\npresque toute la vinaigrette pendant que les lentilles sont\r\nchaud, ajoutez les graines de sésame, puis mélangez bien.","Faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très chaude. Soulevez le\r\ncrevettes hors de la marinade, puis faire frire pendant 1-2\r\nminutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient roses et légèrement dorées.\r\nVersez la marinade et portez à ébullition.\r\nPliez la coriandre hachée dans le\r\nlentilles, puis déposer dans des assiettes de service. Haut\r\navec les crevettes et le jus de cuisson éventuel."]','2026-01-11 00:18:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12460,6738,'fr','Poisson cuit à la vapeur au gingembre et à l''oignon nouveau','Adoptez une approche asiatique de la cuisine faible en gras : faites cuire du poisson à la vapeur avec du pak choi, du mirin, de l''ail et du soja et servez-le garni de coriandre.','["100 empilages.","4 x 150g de filets de poisson blanc ferme","Morceau de 5 cm de gingembre finement râpé","2 gousses d''ail, finement tranchées","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja faible en sel","1 cuillère à café de vin de riz mirin","1 botte d''oignons nouveaux, finement émincés","une poignée de coriandre hachée","riz brun, pour servir","1 citron vert, coupé en quartiers, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nDécoupez un grand rectangle de papier d''aluminium, suffisamment grand\r\nfaire une grande enveloppe. Placez le paquet\r\nchoi sur le papier d''aluminium, suivi du poisson, puis\r\nle gingembre et l''ail. Verser sur le soja\r\nsauce et vin de riz, puis assaisonner.","Repliez le papier d''aluminium et scellez les 3 bords, puis\r\nmettre sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Cuire 20 minutes,\r\nouvrez le colis et répartissez-le sur le\r\noignons nouveaux et coriandre. Servir avec\r\nriz brun et jus de citron vert pressé."]','2026-01-11 00:18:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12461,6740,'fr','Ragoût de bœuf haché et patates douces','Le hachis maigre et économique constitue une base idéale pour une cocotte familiale copieuse – servez ce tout-en-un avec des légumes verts de saison.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 gros oignon, haché","1 grosse carotte, hachée","1 branche de céleri, tranchée","500 g de bœuf haché maigre","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cuillère à soupe de ketchup aux champignons","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","450 g de patates douces pelées et coupées en gros morceaux","quelques brins de thym","1 feuille de laurier","poignée de persil haché","Chou de Milan, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle, ajoutez le\r\noignon, carotte et céleri, et sueur\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter le boeuf\r\net cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré.","Ajouter le concentré de tomates et laisser cuire\r\nquelques minutes, puis ajoutez les champignons\r\nketchup, tomates, patates douces,\r\ndes herbes et une canette pleine d''eau. Saison\r\nbien et porter à ébullition.","Laisser mijoter à feu doux pendant 40 à 45 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les patates douces soient tendres,\r\nen remuant plusieurs fois tout au long de la cuisson\r\npour vous assurer qu''ils cuisent uniformément.","Une fois cuit, retirez la feuille de laurier,\r\nincorporer le persil haché et\r\nservir avec du chou."]','2026-01-11 00:18:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12462,6742,'fr','Plateau de saumon et brocoli à l''orientale','Cinq ingrédients suffisent pour créer ce plat de poisson aux saveurs asiatiques avec des légumes verts sains et du citron frais.','["4 filets de saumon avec la peau","1 tête de brocoli, divisée en fleurons","jus ½ citron, ½ citron coupé en quartiers","petit bouquet d''oignons nouveaux, tranchés","2 cuillères à soupe de sauce soja"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nMettez le saumon dans un grand plat à rôtir,\r\nen laissant un espace entre chaque filet.","Lavez et égouttez le brocoli et, pendant ce temps\r\nencore un peu humide, disposer dans le plateau tout autour\r\nles filets. Versez le jus de citron dessus\r\nle tout, puis ajoutez les quartiers de citron.","Garnir de la moitié des oignons nouveaux, arroser\r\navec un peu d''huile d''olive et mettre au four\r\npendant 14 minutes. Retirer du four,\r\nsaupoudrez le tout avec le soja, puis\r\nremettre au four encore 4 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nle saumon est bien cuit. Saupoudrer\r\navec les oignons nouveaux restants juste\r\navant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12463,6744,'fr','Purée de patate douce et chipotle','Comme alternative à une purée réconfortante classique, essayez de rôtir des patates douces et de les écraser avec de la pâte de piment fumé épicé.','["4 grosses patates douces, environ 1 kg/2 lb 4 oz","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte de chipotle","125 ml de crème sure","25g de beurre"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMettez les pommes de terre au four et faites-les rôtir\r\npendant 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre une fois percé\r\navec un couteau. Retirez les peaux, mettez le\r\nchair dans un bol et écraser jusqu''à consistance lisse.","Ajouter la pâte chipotle, la crème sure\r\net le beurre et bien mélanger. Assaisonner au goût."]','2026-01-11 00:18:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12464,6746,'fr','Pâtisserie mexicaine','Faites une descente dans votre placard et essayez cette nouvelle idée de haricots en conserve aux épices pour fajita – garnis de tortillas et de fromage.','["2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots noirs égouttés et rincés","Sachet de 35 g d''assaisonnement pour fajita au choix","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées au piment","6 tortillas","140 g de fromage Monterey Jack ou cheddar râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nFaites chauffer une poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez le noir\r\nharicots et mélange d''épices pour fajita, mélanger ensemble et\r\ncuire 1 à 2 minutes. Ajoutez les tomates et\r\nlaisser mijoter à feu doux pendant 10 mn.","Coupez les tortillas en deux. Graisser légèrement un\r\nPlat allant au four de 2 litres. Répandre un tiers de la\r\nmélange de haricots sur le fond du plat,\r\nsuivi de 3 cuillères à soupe de fromage et d''un\r\ncouche de tortillas. Répétez le processus,\r\nterminer par une couche de tortilla sur le dessus.\r\nSaupoudrer du reste de fromage.\r\nCuire au four 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés."]','2026-01-11 00:18:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12465,6748,'fr','Ragoût de poulet, haricots beurre et poivre','Utilisez des légumineuses du placard et de savoureuses cuisses de poulet dans cette cocotte saine au goût de paprika avec des poivrons et des tomates.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, haché","2 branches de céleri, hachées","1 poivron jaune épépiné et coupé en dés","1 poivron rouge épépiné et coupé en dés","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à soupe de paprika","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","150 ml de bouillon de poulet","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots beurre égouttés et rincés","8 cuisses de poulet sans peau"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nFaites chauffer l''huile dans un grand récipient antidéflagrant\r\ncocotte. Ajouter l''oignon, le céleri\r\net les poivrons, et faire revenir pendant 5 minutes. Ajouter\r\nl''ail et le paprika, et laissez cuire pendant\r\nencore 3 minutes.","Incorporer les tomates, le bouillon et le beurre\r\nharicots et bien assaisonner. Portez à ébullition,\r\npuis placez les cuisses de poulet dans le\r\nsauce. Couvrir avec un couvercle hermétique et\r\nmettre au four 45 mn."]','2026-01-11 00:18:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12466,6750,'fr','Poulet marocain avec purée de patate douce','Du poulet tendre et parfumé et une purée de patates douces crémeuse constituent un repas de semaine réconfortant et faible en gras.','["1 kg de patates douces, en cubes","2 cuillères à café de ras-el-hanout ou un mélange de cannelle moulue et de cumin","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau et désossées","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, tranché finement","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","200 ml de bouillon de poulet","2 cuillères à café de miel clair","jus ½ citron","une poignée d''olives vertes, dénoyautées ou entières","20 g de coriandre, feuilles hachées"]','["Faire bouillir les pommes de terre dans de l''eau salée pendant\r\n15 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté. Mélangez le ras el\r\nhanout avec l''assaisonnement, puis saupoudrer le tout\r\nsur le poulet. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans un grand\r\npoêle, puis faire dorer le poulet pendant\r\n3 minutes de chaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.","Sortez le poulet de la poêle. Ajoutez le\r\nl''oignon et l''ail et cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nramolli. Ajouter le bouillon, le miel, le citron\r\njus et olives, remettre le poulet dans le\r\npoêle, puis laisser mijoter 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le\r\nla sauce est sirupeuse et le poulet cuit.","Écrasez les pommes de terre avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et\r\nsaison. Trancher épaissement chaque poitrine de poulet\r\net incorporez la coriandre à la sauce.\r\nServir le poulet et la sauce sur une purée."]','2026-01-11 00:18:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12467,6752,'fr','Poulet ratatouille rôti','Une recette de poulet classique qui incitera les foules à revenir pour en savoir plus','["1 oignon, coupé en quartiers","2 poivrons rouges épépinés et coupés en morceaux","1 courgette, coupée en morceaux","1 petite aubergine, coupée en morceaux","4 tomates, coupées en deux","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour arroser","4 poitrines de poulet, avec la peau","quelques brins de romarin (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Poser \r\ntous les légumes et les tomates dans un \r\nplat à rôtir peu profond. Verser dessus l''huile d''olive \r\net mélangez bien le tout jusqu''à ce que \r\nbien enduit (les mains sont plus faciles pour cela).","Disposez les poitrines de poulet, peau vers le haut, \r\nsur les légumes et incorporez-y quelques \r\nbrins de romarin, si vous en utilisez. Assaisonner le tout \r\navec du sel et du poivre noir et arroser un peu \r\nhuile sur le poulet. Rôtir environ 35 minutes \r\njusqu''à ce que les légumes soient tendres et le poulet \r\nest doré. Arroser d''huile avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12468,6754,'fr','Pâtes de blé complet au brocoli et aux amandes','Les spaghettis bruns vous rassasient plus longtemps – associez-les à des légumes verts sains aromatisés à l''ail, au piment et au citron.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","1 piment rouge, épépiné et tranché (ajoutez du piment supplémentaire si vous le souhaitez)","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées finement","250 g de spaghettis au blé complet","300 g de brocoli à tige fine, coupé en morceaux","le zeste d''1 citron","25 g d''amandes effilées grillées","copeaux de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), pour servir"]','["Apportez une grande casserole d''eau salée au\r\nfaire bouillir. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile d''olive dans une\r\ngrande poêle à frire. Ajoutez le piment et l''ail,\r\net cuire à feu doux jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.\r\nRetirer du feu.","Ajouter les pâtes à l''eau et cuire\r\nen suivant les instructions de l''emballage. En finale\r\n4 min de cuisson, ajoutez les brocolis.\r\nUne fois cuit, égouttez-le et versez-le dans l''ail\r\ncasserole. Ajoutez le zeste de citron et les amandes,\r\net bien mélanger. Servir dans des bols,\r\ngarni de copeaux de parmesan."]','2026-01-11 00:18:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12469,6756,'fr','Haricots grecs à l''agneau poêlé','Braiser des haricots beurre ou « gigantes » avec des tomates, de l''oignon et de l''ail et servir avec un tendre filet d''agneau et du fromage feta émietté.','["500 g de filet d''agneau","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 gros oignon, haché","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","petit bouquet d''aneth, haché en grande partie","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","500 ml de bouillon de poulet","2 boîtes de 400 g de haricots géants ou de haricots beurre égouttés","2 cuillères à soupe de fromage feta émietté"]','["Frotter l''agneau avec ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile\r\net 1 gousse d''ail. Bien assaisonner et prendre\r\nréserver pour mariner pendant que vous préparez le\r\nharicots, ou jusqu''à 2 heures si vous avez le temps.","Faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle. Ajoutez le\r\nl''oignon et le reste de l''ail, et assaisonner.\r\nFaire frire pendant 8 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter la tomate\r\npurée, aneth haché, vinaigre, bouillon et\r\nharicots, assaisonner et laisser mijoter 15 minutes\r\nou jusqu''à ce que la majeure partie du liquide se soit évaporée.","Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer une poêle jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit chaude.\r\nSaisir l''agneau de tous les côtés, environ 5 minutes\r\ntotale. Laisser reposer, recouvert de papier d''aluminium, pendant 5 minutes,\r\npuis trancher épaissement. Servir l''agneau avec le\r\nharicots, parsemés de feta et de\r\nfeuilles d''aneth restantes."]','2026-01-11 00:18:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12470,6758,'fr','Poulet aux champignons','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une cocotte de poulet saine et faible en calories avec du bacon, des petits pois et une sauce au persil – utilisez des cuisses de poulet pour plus de saveur et de jutosité.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","500 g de cuisses de poulet désossées et sans peau","farine, pour saupoudrer","50 g de lardons","300 g de petits champignons de Paris","2 grosses échalotes, hachées","250 ml de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","50 g de petits pois surgelés","une petite poignée de persil finement haché"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle. Saison\r\net saupoudrez le poulet de farine, faites-le dorer\r\ntous les côtés. Retirer. Faites frire la pancetta et\r\nchampignons jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient ramollis, puis retirez-les.","Ajouter la dernière cuillère à soupe d''huile et faire revenir les échalotes\r\npendant 5 minutes. Ajoutez le bouillon et le vinaigre,\r\nbouillonner pendant 1 à 2 minutes. Renvoyez le poulet,\r\npancetta et champignons et cuire pendant\r\n15 minutes. Ajoutez les petits pois et le persil et\r\ncuire encore 2 minutes, puis servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12471,6760,'fr','Risotto à l''orge, poulet et champignons','Vous aimez le risotto ? Essayez cette version faible en gras, qui remplace le riz à risotto traditionnel par de l''orge perlé','["1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 grosses échalotes, tranchées finement","1 gousse d''ail, hachée","3 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en gros morceaux","300 g d''orge perlé","250 ml de vin blanc","400 g de champignons sauvages et de châtaigniers mélangés, hachés","1 cuillère à soupe de feuille de thym","1l de bouillon de poulet chaud","3 cuillères à soupe de parmesan râpé","ciboulette ciselée, pour servir (facultatif)","copeaux de parmesan, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Dans une grande casserole à fond épais, faire chauffer\r\nle beurre et l''huile. Faire revenir les échalotes\r\net de l''ail avec un peu d''assaisonnement pour\r\n5 minutes, puis incorporez le poulet et\r\ncuire 2 min.","Ajouter l''orge et cuire 1 min.\r\nVersez le vin et remuez jusqu''à ce qu''il soit\r\nabsorbé. Ajoutez les champignons et\r\nthym, puis versez dessus les ¾ du bouillon.\r\nCuire 40 minutes à feu doux jusqu''à ce que\r\nl''orge est tendre, en remuant de temps en temps\r\net faire l''appoint avec le stock restant si\r\nça a l''air sec. Retirer du feu et\r\nincorporer le parmesan râpé. Servir\r\nimmédiatement, avec de la ciboulette et du parmesan\r\ncopeaux éparpillés, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:18:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12472,6762,'fr','Houmous de petits pois et fèves au chèvre et levain','Les restes de houmous de ce plat de déjeuner estival se conservent bien couverts au réfrigérateur jusqu''à trois jours et constituent une excellente collation avec des pittas grillées.','["300 g de petits pois frais ou surgelés","300 g de fèves fraîches, écosées (pas besoin de retirer leur enveloppe vert pâle) ou surgelées (décongelées)","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive ou de tournesol","2 gousses d''ail, pelées","le zeste de 2 citrons, le jus de 1","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive extra vierge","8 tranches de pain au levain, coupées en deux","125 g de bûche de fromage de chèvre à pâte molle à tartiner","Sachet de 50 g de pousses de pois (ou utiliser du cresson)"]','["Versez les pois et les haricots dans un grand\r\nune casserole d''eau bouillante salée, puis faites cuire\r\npendant 3 minutes. Égoutter, refroidir sous l''eau froide,\r\npuis égouttez-les à nouveau soigneusement.","Mettez les 4 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une poêle, faites chauffer doucement,\r\npuis ajoutez l''ail. Cuire 3 minutes, très\r\ntrès doucement, jusqu''à ce que l''huile soit infusée et que le\r\nl''ail a ramolli mais n''est pas coloré.\r\nVersez l''huile et l''ail dans un pichet et laissez refroidir.","Mélangez les petits pois, les haricots et presque tout\r\nle zeste dans un robot culinaire, puis égoutter\r\ndans l''huile d''ail. Ajoutez les gousses d''ail,\r\npresque tout le jus de citron et 1 cuillère à soupe\r\nhuile d''olive extra vierge. Les houmous devraient\r\nje vais bien tourner autour du bol à cause de ça\r\npoint, mais sans avoir une texture trop fine. Gratter\r\nles côtés vers le bas si nécessaire. Saison\r\neh bien, vous aurez besoin d''environ 1 cuillère à café de sel marin\r\net beaucoup de poivre noir. Ajoutez le reste de\r\nle jus de citron au goût. Verser dans un\r\nplat, remuer le dessus, puis arroser le\r\nle reste de l''huile d''olive extra vierge.","Pour servir, griller le pain, puis tartiner\r\navec le fromage de chèvre. Une bonne cuillerée\r\nune cuillerée d''houmous sur chaque morceau,\r\narroser d''un peu plus d''huile d''olive, parsemer\r\navec le zeste restant, puis broyer\r\nun peu de poivre noir. Garnir de quelques petits pois\r\ntire et sert."]','2026-01-11 00:18:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12473,6766,'fr','Beurre d''amande','Si vous pensez qu''il n''y a pas de pâte à tartiner comme le beurre de cacahuète, essayez cette version, sucrée au miel, comme collation énergisante.','["300 g d''amandes avec la peau","bon filet de miel","miche de malt ou pain complet, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nRépartir les amandes dessus\r\nune plaque à pâtisserie et rôtir pendant 10 minutes.\r\nRetirer et laisser refroidir.","Mettre dans un robot culinaire et fouetter\r\npendant 12 minutes, en s''arrêtant de temps en temps pour\r\nRaclez les côtés et terminez par un filet de miel. Servir la tartinade\r\nsur du pain de malt ou du pain complet. Se conserve au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 3 semaines."]','2026-01-11 00:18:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12474,6768,'fr','Trempette aux pois, menthe et piment','Une purée rapide de style guacamole, prête en quelques minutes et parfaite pour les collations ou les boîtes à lunch','["400 g de petits pois surgelés, décongelés","100 g de yaourt nature sans gras","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","une petite poignée de feuilles de menthe","1 petit piment rouge, haché","4 pains pitta complets","500 g de carottes coupées en bâtonnets"]','["Mélangez les petits pois, le yaourt, le jus de citron,\r\ncumin, menthe et piment ensemble dans un\r\nrobot culinaire jusqu''à obtenir une texture que vous aimez.\r\nRépartir dans des bacs en plastique pour emballer\r\ndans des boîtes à lunch, ou verser dans une portion\r\nbol. Faites légèrement griller les pittas, puis\r\ncouper en quartiers et servir avec le\r\ntrempette et carottes."]','2026-01-11 00:18:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12475,6772,'fr','Tortillas cajun maison','Cuire au four les tortillas de farine dans des chips croquantes aromatisées aux épices traditionnelles de Louisiane et servir avec une trempette.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile","1 cuillère à soupe de mélange d''épices cajun","8 tortillas nature"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger\r\nl''huile avec l''épice cajun\r\nmélanger. Badigeonner les tortillas d''huile épicée, en les empilant dessus.\r\nles uns les autres au fur et à mesure. Coupez la pile en\r\n8 cales. Séparez les coins et\r\nrépartir uniformément sur des plaques à pâtisserie et\r\ncuire au four pendant 6 à 7 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants."]','2026-01-11 00:18:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12476,6774,'fr','Carrés cocktails aux crevettes','Bannissez la verrerie et servez vos cocktails de crevettes en une seule bouchée élégante.','["100 g de mayonnaise (utilisez de la légère si vous préférez)","3 cuillères à soupe de ketchup aux tomates","300 g de crevettes cuites décortiquées","poivre noir","4 grosses tranches de pain de seigle","¼ de laitue iceberg","poivre de Cayenne"]','["Mélangez la mayonnaise avec le ketchup aux tomates. Ajouter\r\ncrevettes cuites décortiquées et quelques\r\npoivre noir.","Coupez 4 grosses tranches de seigle\r\npain en petits carrés – vous devriez être\r\ncapable d''obtenir 6 carrés de chacun.","Disposer sur un plateau. Râpez la laitue,\r\ndiviser entre les carrés, recouvrir chacun\r\navec une cuillerée de crevettes puis un\r\nsaupoudrer de poivre de Cayenne."]','2026-01-11 00:18:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12477,6776,'fr','Patates douces aux champignons et romarin','Vous ne savez pas quoi faire avec des patates douces ? Voici la réponse parfaite','["2 patates douces, environ 300 g/10 oz chacune","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","200 g de champignons châtaignes coupés en deux","1 cuillère à café de romarin frais haché ou ½ cuillère à café séchée","2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan fraîchement râpé"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/chaleur tournante 180C/gaz 6. Piquer\r\nles pommes de terre plusieurs fois avec une fourchette, puis\r\nmicro-ondes à puissance élevée pendant 8 à 10 minutes, en retournant\r\nune fois, jusqu''à tendreté. Pendant ce temps, faites chauffer l''huile\r\ndans une poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez les champignons et\r\nle romarin et cuire à feu assez vif,\r\nen remuant, jusqu''à ce que les champignons soient tendres et\r\nlégèrement coloré. Assaisonner au goût.","Mettez les pommes de terre au four et faites-les rôtir pendant\r\n15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les peaux commencent à devenir croustillantes. Diviser\r\nouvrir et verser sur les champignons.\r\nSaupoudrer de parmesan pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12478,6778,'fr','Le meilleur guacamole en morceaux de tous les temps','C''est la meilleure version de cette trempette classique. Les ingrédients sont réduits au minimum pour un goût aussi frais que possible','["1 grosse tomate mûre","3 avocats bien mûrs mais pas meurtris","jus d''1 gros citron vert","une poignée de coriandre, feuilles et tiges hachées, plus quelques feuilles grossièrement hachées, pour servir","1 petit oignon rouge, finement haché","1 piment rouge ou vert épépiné et finement haché","chips tortilla, pour servir"]','["Utilisez un grand couteau pour pulvériser la tomate\r\nréduire en pulpe sur une planche, puis verser dans un bol.\r\nCoupez les avocats en deux et dénoyautez-les (en gardant un\r\npierre) et utilisez une cuillère pour retirer le\r\nchair dans le bol avec la tomate.","Versez tous les autres ingrédients dans le bol,\r\npuis assaisonnez avec du sel et du poivre. Utilisez un\r\nfouetter pour écraser grossièrement le tout.\r\nSi vous ne servez pas immédiatement, posez une pierre dans le\r\nguacamole (cela aide à l''arrêter\r\ndorer), couvrir d''un film alimentaire et réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que\r\nnécessaire. Parsemer de coriandre, si vous en utilisez,\r\npuis servir avec des chips tortilla ou des quartiers épicés\r\net de la crème sure."]','2026-01-11 00:18:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12479,6780,'fr','Mélange de graines épicé','Pour une collation saine, grignotez ce mélange de graines de tournesol, de citrouille et de lin, ou saupoudrez-le sur vos salades et soupes.','["250 g de graines mélangées (tournesol, potiron, graines de lin)","1 cuillère à café d''huile de colza","1 cuillère à café de sp-eux","¼ cuillère à café de sel faible en sodium","1 cuillère à café de sauce soja réduite en sel","1 cuillère à café de sirop d''agave","pincée de poivre de Cayenne"]','["Préchauffer le four à 160°C/ventilateur 140°/thermostat 3.","Mélanger tous les ingrédients dans un bol et étaler sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Cuire 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient secs et dorés. Remuer une fois pendant la cuisson. Laisser refroidir et conserver dans un récipient fermé jusqu''à 3 semaines."]','2026-01-11 00:18:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12480,6782,'fr','Tortilla mexicaine aux haricots et au piment','Coloré et délicieux – un festin végétarien pour toute la famille','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 boîtes de 420 g de haricots pinto ou rouges, égouttés","4 tomates mûres","1 grosse courgette, coupée en dés","1 cuillère à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à soupe de feuilles de coriandre grossièrement hachées","8 tortillas de farine ou de maïs","½ laitue iceberg, râpée","1 mini concombre, coupé dans la longueur en tranches très fines à l''aide d''un épluche-pomme de terre","Pot de 180 ml de crème sure et de trempette à la ciboulette"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir l''oignon\r\npendant 2 minutes. Ajoutez 1 boîte de haricots et faites chauffer pendant\r\nencore 2-3 minutes, en écrasant les oignons\r\navec un presse-purée ou une fourchette pour obtenir une pâte grossière.","Ajoutez le reste de la boîte de haricots, les tomates,\r\ncourgettes, paprika et 5 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Couvrir et\r\nlaisser mijoter très doucement pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à épaississement\r\net pulpeux, en remuant de temps en temps. Assaisonner au goût\r\navec le jus de citron vert, le sel et le poivre, puis incorporez le\r\ncoriandre. Réchauffer les tortillas de farine dans une friture à sec\r\npoêle, puis disposer avec les haricots piments râpés\r\nlaitue, tranches de concombre et trempette à la crème sure.\r\nDemandez à chacun de se servir : remplir, rouler et manger !"]','2026-01-11 00:18:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12481,6784,'fr','Porc aux herbes, salade de pommes et chicorée','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Une salade croustillante et saine servie avec un morceau de porc faible en gras en croûte d''herbes – un souper rapide qui fait du bien à la santé.','["400 g de filet de porc, débarrassé de tout gras et tendon","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de noix","2 cuillères à café de moutarde complète","1 cuillère à soupe d''estragon et de persil hachés chacun","jus d''1 citron","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","2 grosses pommes à manger, épépinées et tranchées","Paquet de 270 g de chicorée, feuilles séparées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Frotter le porc avec 1 cuillère à café d''huile, 1 cuillère à café de moutarde et un peu d''assaisonnement. Faire dorer, transférer sur une plaque à pâtisserie et presser la moitié des herbes. Rôtir pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste cuit.","Pour préparer la salade, mélangez le jus de citron, le miel, le reste de l''huile de noix et la moutarde. Assaisonner et mélanger les pommes, la chicorée et le reste des herbes. Servir le porc tranché, accompagné de la salade."]','2026-01-11 00:18:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12482,6786,'fr','Tilapia tandoori avec purée de patates douces épicée et salade de tomates','Ce souper de poisson grillé d''influence indienne contient tous vos cinq repas par jour dans un plat léger et légèrement épicé.','["4 filets de tilapia de 140 g","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte tandoori","1 kg de patates douces, coupées en petits morceaux","4 carottes, hachées","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","8 tomates hachées","petit oignon rouge, tranché finement","petit bouquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement"]','["Enduisez les filets de tilapia de pâte tandoori et réservez. Mettez les patates douces, les carottes et l''ail dans une grande casserole d''eau salée. Porter à ébullition et cuire 10 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté. Bien égoutter, puis laisser sécher à la vapeur quelques minutes. Ajoutez le piment dans la poêle et écrasez le tout avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Couvrir et réserver au chaud.","Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Griller le tilapia pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Pendant ce temps, mélangez les ingrédients de la salade et servez-la avec le tilapia et la purée."]','2026-01-11 00:18:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12483,6788,'fr','Cuisiner avec les enfants : Fajitas','Wraps mexicains pour mettre toute la famille à la cuisine – remplissez les tortillas de farine de poulet mariné et de poivrons','["4 poitrines de poulet, coupées en morceaux","huile d''olive, pour la friture","4 citrons verts, jus seulement","2 cuillères à café d''assaisonnement pour fajita","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","1 poivron rouge","½ pot de poivron rôti (nous avons utilisé des poivrons rouges Gaea rôtis à la flamme 290 g)","1 petite pomme pelée","4 tomates mûres","½ citron vert, jus seulement","petit bouquet de coriandre, feuilles cueillies","sauce chili, au goût (facultatif)","2 avocats bien mûrs, coupés en deux et dénoyautés","½ citron vert, jus seulement","fromage râpé, pour servir","6 à 8 tortillas (vous pouvez désormais vous procurer des mini tortillas pour les enfants)","crème sure (facultatif)"]','["Adultes :Mettez le poulet et les ingrédients de la marinade dans un bol et couvrez. Mettre au réfrigérateur pendant au moins deux heures.","Enfants : Si vos enfants ont 5 ans ou plus, vous pouvez leur faire hacher grossièrement le poivron, le poivron rôti, la pomme et les tomates pour la salsa à l''aide d''un couteau en plastique ferme de bonne qualité ou d''un couteau à couverts. Sinon, faites-le vous-même.  Les plus jeunes peuvent cueillir les feuilles de coriandre et les mélanger à la salsa.","Adultes : Versez les ingrédients de la salsa dans un robot culinaire, avec le jus de citron vert et un peu d''assaisonnement et mélangez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement hachés. Sortez 2 grandes cuillères du mélange pour les jeunes enfants, puis ajoutez la sauce chili, le cas échéant, et mélangez à nouveau.","Enfants : Pressez ou versez l''avocat dans un bol et utilisez un presse-purée pour l''écraser. Incorporez le jus de citron vert et un peu de poivre noir avec une cuillère. Le jus de citron vert peut piquer, c''est pourquoi les adultes voudront peut-être le presser pour les jeunes enfants.","Adultes : Faites chauffer un peu d''huile d''olive dans une poêle et versez le contenu du bol de poulet dans la poêle. Cuire pendant 5 à 8 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les morceaux de poulet soient bien cuits.","Enfants : Mettez le fromage râpé, la salsa (pour adultes et enfants), le guacamole et la crème sure dans des bols colorés séparés à poser sur la table.","Adultes : Chauffez les tortillas selon les instructions sur l''emballage et mettez le poulet cuit dans un bol. Montrez aux enfants comment remplir et rouler leur tortilla.","Enfants : Disposez votre tortilla, choisissez vos garnitures, roulez-les et dégustez !"]','2026-01-11 00:18:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12484,6790,'fr','Pilaf de boulgour épicé au poisson','Utilisez du poisson blanc durable dans ce pot de riz d''inspiration nord-africaine avec de la harissa et de l''abricot – plein de fer, de fibres et 2 de vos 5 par jour','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 oignons, finement tranchés","3 carottes, râpées","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à soupe de harissa","200 g de boulgar de blé","6 abricots secs, hachés","700 ml de bouillon de poulet faible (nous avons fait avec 1 cube de bouillon)","200 g de bébés épinards","4 filets de poisson blanc ferme","4 extrémités de tranches de citron"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans un récipient antidéflagrant à couvercle\r\ncocotte. Versez les oignons et faites cuire\r\npendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et dorés. Ajoutez le\r\ncarottes et cumin, et cuire 2 min\r\nplus. Incorporer la harissa, le bulghar et\r\nabricots, verser sur le bouillon et porter à\r\nl''ébullition. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 7 min.","Ajouter les épinards et remuer jusqu''à ce que\r\njuste fané. Disposez dessus les filets de poisson,\r\nmettez une tranche de citron sur chacun et assaisonnez.\r\nRemettez le couvercle et laissez cuire 8 minutes,\r\nen gardant à feu doux.","Baissez le feu et laissez cuire 7 à 8 minutes\r\nplus jusqu''à ce que le poisson soit bien cuit\r\net le boulghar est tendre. Assaisonner avec\r\npoivrer et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:18:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12485,6792,'fr','Salade tiède de courges rôties et lentilles du Puy','Cette salade fraîche et vibrante utilise des lentilles en conserve, un incontournable des armoires de magasin. Le résultat est copieux, faible en gras et contient tous vos cinq par jour','["1 kg de courge butternut coupée en gros dés","1½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","2 cuillères à café de feuilles de thym","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre balsamique","1 cuillère à café de moutarde complète","2 boîtes de 400 g de lentilles du Puy à l''eau","½ oignon rouge tranché","100 g d''épinards","150 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","40 g de fromage Cheshire","1-2 cuillères à soupe de graines de citrouille grillées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Mélanger la courge musquée avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, la gousse d''ail, les feuilles de thym et l''assaisonnement. Rôtir pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à tendreté.","Mélangez le vinaigre balsamique, ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, la moutarde complète et 1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau. Égouttez les lentilles du Puy dans l''eau et mélangez-les avec la vinaigrette, l''oignon rouge, les épinards et les tomates cerises.","Répartissez les lentilles dans quatre assiettes. Garnir de courge, puis émietter sur le fromage Cheshire et les graines de citrouille."]','2026-01-11 00:18:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12486,6794,'fr','Poulet crémeux aux asperges et à l''estragon','Une cocotte de poulet légère et faible en calories avec une sauce soyeuse aux herbes, des légumes verts et des pommes de terre nouvelles.','["500 g de pommes de terre nouvelles grelots, coupées en deux","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 gros oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","350 ml de bouillon de poulet","petit bouquet d''estragon","175 g d''asperges parées","3 cuillères à soupe de crème fraîche allégée"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre dans une grande poêle\r\nfaire bouillir de l''eau pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit tendre,\r\npuis égouttez-les et réservez-les au chaud dans la poêle.\r\nAssaisonner le poulet avec du noir moulu\r\npoivre. Faites chauffer l''huile dans un grand poêle antiadhésive\r\npoêle à frire. Faire revenir doucement le poulet avec\r\nl''oignon et l''ail pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que les deux\r\nsont légèrement dorés. Retournez le\r\npoulet une fois et remuez l''oignon régulièrement.","Versez sur le bouillon, ajoutez 2 brins de\r\nl''estragon et porter à légère ébullition.\r\nCuire 5 min, puis retourner le poulet,\r\najouter les asperges et cuire 3 min\r\nplus. Hachez le reste de l''estragon.","Incorporer la crème fraîche et l''estragon\r\ndans la poêle avec le poulet et faire chauffer\r\nà travers, en remuant, pendant quelques secondes. Servir\r\navec les pommes de terre nouvelles."]','2026-01-11 00:18:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12487,6796,'fr','Risotto printanier et sauce','Angela Nilsen opère sa magie sur ce plat de riz italien préféré, le rendant faible en gras et nourrissant','["350 g de fût d''asperges","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 botte (environ 9) d''oignons nouveaux, extrémités parées et tranchées","175 g de petits pois frais ou surgelés","250 g de fèves décortiquées, fraîches ou surgelées","2 cuillères à soupe de basilic râpé","2 cuillères à soupe de ciboulette ciselée","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe finement hachée","le zeste finement râpé d''1 citron","1,7 litre de bouillon de légumes (nous avons utilisé du souci)","4 échalotes, hachées finement","3 gousses d''ail dodues, hachées finement","300 g de riz carnaroli ou arborio","150 ml de vin blanc sec","25 g de parmesan (ou alternative végétarienne), râpé","25 g de feuilles de roquette"]','["Coupez les extrémités ligneuses des asperges,\r\npuis coupez les tiges en diagonale de 5 cm\r\nlongueurs. Faites chauffer la moitié de l''huile dans un grand\r\npoêle antiadhésive. Astuce dans les asperges\r\net faire sauter à feu moyen-vif pendant\r\nenviron 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien doré\r\nterminé (étape 1). Incorporer les oignons nouveaux et faire revenir\r\npendant 1 à 2 minutes avec les asperges jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Retirer, assaisonner de poivre\r\net mettre de côté. Cuire les petits pois et les haricots\r\nséparément dans un peu d''eau bouillante pendant\r\n3 minutes chacun, puis égouttez-les\r\nun tamis. Quand les fèves sont froides\r\nassez à manipuler, sortez-les de leur\r\npeaux. Réglez les pois et les haricots sur un\r\ncôté. Mélangez le basilic, la ciboulette, la menthe et\r\nle zeste de citron ensemble dans un petit bol\r\net assaisonner de poivre (étape 2). Annuler.","Versez le bouillon dans une casserole et\r\ngardez-le à feu très doux. Versez le\r\nle reste de l''huile dans un grand et large sauté\r\ncasserole. Ajoutez les échalotes et l''ail, et\r\nfaire frire pendant 3-4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et seulement\r\nlégèrement brune. Incorporer le riz et\r\ncontinuez à remuer pendant 1 à 2 minutes sur une\r\nfeu moyen-vif. Dès qu''il commence à grésiller, versez le vin et remuez à nouveau jusqu''à ce que\r\nle vin a été absorbé. Commencez à\r\nincorporer le bouillon chaud, 1½ louche à la fois\r\ntemps (étape 3), pour qu''il mijote et soit absorbé\r\naprès chaque ajout. Pour dire quand c''est\r\nprêt à recevoir la prochaine 1½ louche\r\najouté, faites glisser la cuillère sur le\r\nfond de la casserole et il devrait partir\r\nune ligne claire. Continuez à remuer le tout\r\ntemps, pour garder le risotto crémeux.\r\nContinuez à ajouter le stock comme ci-dessus –\r\naprès 20 minutes, le riz doit être tendre avec\r\nun peu de mastication au milieu. Si ce n''est pas le cas,\r\najoutez plus de stock – vous devriez toujours avoir\r\nil reste au moins une louche de bouillon à ce moment-là\r\npoint. Assaisonner avec du poivre, il ne faut pas\r\nbesoin d''ajouter du sel.","Retirez la casserole du feu. Verser dessus\r\nune louche du stock restant à conserver\r\nle liquide du mélange, puis répartir sur tout le\r\nlégumes, un moulin à poivre, la moitié\r\ndu mélange d''herbes (étape 4) et la moitié du fromage.\r\nCouvrir avec le couvercle de la casserole et laisser le risotto\r\nasseyez-vous pendant 3-4 minutes pour vous reposer. Remuer doucement\r\nle tout ensemble, si nécessaire en ajoutant\r\nune baisse du stock restant pour de bon\r\ncohérence. Verser dans les plats de service\r\net servir garni d''un petit tas de\r\nroquette et le reste des herbes et\r\nfromage éparpillé dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:18:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12488,6798,'fr','Pâtes espagnoles aux fruits de mer','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. L''Italie et l''Espagne se rencontrent dans ce plat de pâtes orzo, semblable à une paella, avec du chorizo, des petits pois et les fruits de mer de votre choix.','["350g de formes de pâtes courtes (nous avons utilisé de l''orzo)","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à café de curcuma ou une grosse pincée de brins de safran","85 g de chorizo ​​coupé en dés","Paquet de 200 g de fruits de mer cuits mélangés","2 poivrons rouges rôtis, d''un pot, tranchés","100 g de petits pois surgelés","2 cuillères à soupe de persil haché"]','["Cuire les pâtes dans beaucoup d''eau\r\nen suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, avec\r\nle cube de bouillon et la moitié du curcuma\r\nou du safran. Environ 7 minutes avant\r\nles pâtes sont cuites, versez le chorizo\r\ndans une poêle et faites cuire à feu vif\r\nfeu moyen pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que légèrement\r\ncroustillant. Retirez un peu de graisse, puis\r\najoutez le curcuma restant ou\r\nsafran, fruits de mer, poivrons et petits pois.","Égouttez les pâtes en réservant un peu\r\ndu stock. Renversez les pâtes\r\ndans la poêle, ajoutez le chorizo et\r\nmélange de fruits de mer et un peu de\r\nle bouillon réservé, et chauffer\r\nà travers. Incorporer la majeure partie du persil.","Servir dans des bols chauds, avec le\r\nle reste du persil saupoudré sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:19:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12489,6800,'fr','Pâtisserie aux légumes à l''italienne','Un plat vibrant pour les mijoteuses, superposez des courgettes estivales, des tomates et des aubergines avec du pain et de la mozzarella – irrésistible !','["4 gousses d''ail, 3 écrasées, 1 laissée entière","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","bouquet d''origan, feuilles hachées","grosse pincée de flocons de piment","environ 300 g d''aubergines pour bébés ou normales, tranchées","2 courgettes, tranchées","½ grand pot de poivrons rouges rôtis","3 tomates de bœuf, tranchées","bouquet de basilic déchiré (conserver quelques feuilles pour saupoudrer)","petite baguette, tranchée et grillée","2 boules de 125 g de mozzarella déchirées","salade verte, pour servir"]','["Mettez la mijoteuse sur High\r\nou le réglage brunissage et versez-le dans le\r\nail écrasé, tomates en conserve, la moitié\r\nles feuilles d''origan, le piment et un peu\r\nassaisonnement. Cuisinez à couvert pendant que vous\r\nhachez le reste des légumes.","Versez la majeure partie de la sauce et commencez\r\nsuperposer la moitié des légumes et\r\nherbes assaisonnées – les aubergines,\r\ncourgettes, poivrons rouges, tomates,\r\nbasilic et origan restant. Superposer\r\nla moitié du pain frotté avec le tout\r\ngousse d''ail, la moitié de la mozzarella et\r\nla moitié de la sauce tomate renversée. Répéter\r\ncouches de légumes, d''herbes et de sauce tomate,\r\nsuivi du pain et de la mozzarella.\r\nPoussez bien le tout pour comprimer,\r\npuis faites cuire à puissance élevée pendant 5 à 6 heures.","Passer sous le grill avant de servir\r\nsi vous le souhaitez (et votre marmite à la mijoteuse\r\nconvient), jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et bouillonnant.\r\nServir avec les restes de feuilles de basilic\r\nsur le dessus et une grosse salade à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:19:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12490,6802,'fr','One-pot de courge, lentilles et haricots avec raïta aux figues','Atteignez votre 5 par jour avec ce pot d''épices végétarien au curry, rempli de légumineuses et de courges, servi avec une trempette rafraîchissante au yaourt','["400 g de courge musquée, pelée, épépinée et coupée en gros dés","1 oignon, tranché","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de flocons de piment","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","100 g de lentilles rouges séchées","2 cuillères à café de sirop d''agave ou de cassonade","2 cuillères à café de vinaigre de vin rouge ou blanc","Boîte de 400 g de haricots rouges égouttés et rincés","2 figues séchées, hachées finement","150 ml de yaourt nature sans gras en pot","½ petit bouquet de persil haché"]','["Faire revenir la courge et l''oignon dans l''huile pendant\r\n5 à 8 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit ramolli. Remuer\r\ndans le cumin et le piment pendant 1 min. Ajoutez le\r\ntomates et une canette d''eau de\r\nla boîte de tomates, les lentilles, l''agave ou\r\nsucre et vinaigre. Porter à ébullition\r\net laissez cuire 10 minutes, puis incorporez le\r\nharicots et cuire encore quelques minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les lentilles soient tendres et que\r\nharicots bien chauffés.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez les figues, le yaourt et\r\npersil ensemble. Assaisonnez le ragoût, puis\r\nservir dans des bols avec la raita aux figues en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:19:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12491,6808,'fr','Soupe épicée aux poivrons et tomates avec yaourt au concombre','Servez ce mélange de légumes sain et vibrant froid comme gaspacho à l''espagnole ou chaud comme souper réconfortant.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour servir","2 oignons, finement tranchés","1 carotte, hachée finement","3 poivrons rouges, hachés grossièrement","3 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 piment rouge, tranché","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","850 ml-1 litre/1½-1¾pts de bouillon de légumes ou de bouillon","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt à la grecque","½ concombre, coupé en deux, épépiné, grossièrement râpé et essoré de l''excès d''eau","quelques feuilles de menthe hachées"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole.\r\nAjoutez les oignons, les carottes et les poivrons.\r\nCuire doucement pendant 15 minutes, pour ramollir.\r\nAjouter l''ail et le piment et cuire pendant\r\nencore quelques minutes. Verser sur le haché\r\ntomates et 800 ml de bouillon. Apportez\r\nporter à ébullition et laisser mijoter 10-15 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que les légumes soient complètement tendres.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le yaourt, le concombre\r\net la menthe dans un bol, et assaisonner.","Mixez la soupe avec un mixeur plongeant jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisser, en utilisant le bouillon supplémentaire pour diluer s''il\r\nest devenu trop épais. Chauffer à travers,\r\nassaisonner et verser dans des bols. Servir\r\navec une cuillerée du mélange de yaourt\r\ndessus et un filet d''huile d''olive."]','2026-01-11 00:19:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12492,6809,'fr','Soupe de courgettes et tomates','Préparez une soupe de légumes par lots lorsque vous disposez d''une prime saisonnière et vous aurez toujours un repas sain au congélateur','["1 cuillère à soupe de beurre","2 oignons, hachés","1 kg de courgettes tranchées","1 kg de tomates hachées","2 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","2 l de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes en cubes","pain croustillant, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faire fondre le beurre dans une grande poêle,\r\najoutez les oignons et les courgettes, et\r\ncuire 5 min à feu moyen,\r\nen remuant de temps en temps.","Ajoutez les tomates et la farine. Cuisinier\r\npendant quelques minutes, en remuant\r\npour éviter que la farine ne devienne grumeleuse.\r\nAjouter le curcuma et le bouillon, couvrir et\r\nlaisser mijoter 30 mn.","Réduire en purée au mixeur plongeant, puis passer au tamis\r\nsi vous voulez une texture vraiment lisse.\r\nServir chaud avec du pain croustillant, si vous le souhaitez,\r\nou réfrigérer, puis congeler jusqu''à 2 mois."]','2026-01-11 00:19:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12493,6811,'fr','Risotto au poulet rôti et petits pois','Préparez quelque chose de spécial avec vos restes de poulet rôti avec cette recette riche et crémeuse','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale","1 oignon, haché","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","350 g de riz pour risotto","1 petit verre de vin blanc","1l de bouillon chaud","2 poitrines de poulet du poulet rôti, hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de feuille de thym","200 g de petits pois surgelés","1 tbsp crème fraîche","2 cuillères à soupe de parmesan râpé, plus un peu pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites cuire le\r\nl''oignon et l''ail pendant 5 minutes. Incorporer le riz\r\net laissez cuire encore 1 min, jusqu''à ce que ça commence à\r\nparaître transparent. Versez le vin et\r\ncontinuez à remuer jusqu''à ce que tout le liquide soit absorbé.","Ajouter le bouillon et laisser mijoter jusqu''à ce que\r\nle riz est juste tendre. Remuer à travers le\r\npoulet, thym et petits pois, puis cuire pendant\r\n2 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit réchauffé\r\nà travers. Ajoutez la crème fraîche et\r\nDu parmesan avec un peu d''assaisonnement, puis\r\nretirer du feu. Couvrir avec un couvercle\r\net laisser reposer 2 minutes avant\r\nservir avec du parmesan supplémentaire, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12494,6813,'fr','Salade d''aubergines grillées, poivrons et boulgour','Aromatisez les céréales de base avec des tomates séchées, des aubergines, des poivrons rouges et des olives pour un plat d''accompagnement polyvalent.','["175 g de blé boulghar","2 cuillères à soupe de concentré de tomates séchées","4 petites aubergines, chacune coupée en 3 dans le sens de la longueur","1 poivron rouge, coupé en morceaux de 1 cm dans le sens de la longueur","2 cuillères à café d''huile d''olive","une poignée de feuilles de basilic"]','["Préparer le bulghar suivant le pack\r\ninstructions. Versez dans un grand bol et\r\nincorporer la pâte de tomate. Saison.","Chauffer un barbecue ou une poêle à frire à feu vif.\r\nArroser les aubergines et le poivron rouge\r\navec l''huile et laissez cuire 5 min à feu vif\r\nchaque côté jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement carbonisé.","Mélanger les aubergines et le poivron rouge\r\ndans le mélange de bulghar, puis assaisonner\r\net incorporer le basilic."]','2026-01-11 00:19:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12495,6817,'fr','Salade arc-en-ciel de thon','Rouge, jaune, violet, vert – pas tout à fait un arc-en-ciel, mais cette salade vibrante de poisson et de légumes en conserve s''en rapproche','["1 poivron rouge, tranché","1 grosse carotte, râpée","Boîte de 340 g de grains de maïs doux égouttés","150 g de pois mange-tout","6 jeunes betteraves cuites, coupées en quartiers","Boîte de 185 g de thon émietté dans l''eau de source, égoutté","100 g de mayonnaise","1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron","2 cuillères à café de moutarde complète","1 cuillère à café d''eau","feuilles de laitue","1 oignon nouveau, tranché"]','["Dans un grand bol, mélanger le poivron rouge, la carotte, le maïs doux, les pois mange-tout, la betterave et le thon.","Dans un petit bol, mélanger la mayonnaise, le jus de citron, la moutarde complète, l''eau et\r\nassaisonner, si vous le souhaitez, pour faire une vinaigrette.","Tapisser un grand bol de feuilles de laitue, remplir de salade et\r\narroser de vinaigrette. Garnir d’oignon nouveau et servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:19:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12496,6819,'fr','Salade de poulet au curry et mangue','Cette salade fruitée légèrement épicée est une version moderne du poulet Coronation – un déjeuner faible en calories pour deux.','["6 mini filets de poulet","1 cuillère à café d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de curry en poudre","4 cuillères à soupe de yaourt grec","2 cuillères à soupe de chutney de mangue","le zeste d''un demi citron vert et 2 cuillères à café de jus","1 laitue Little Gem, feuilles séparées","1 mangue mûre, pelée et tranchée","½ oignon rouge, finement tranché","2 cuillères à café de graines de sésame grillées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.\r\nMélanger le poulet dans l''huile et 1 cuillère à café de\r\nla poudre de curry, assaisonner et bien mélanger\r\nenrober. Mettez le poulet sur une plaque recouverte de papier d''aluminium\r\nplaque à pâtisserie et cuire au four pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nbien cuit. Laisser refroidir un peu,\r\npuis tranchez.","Pendant ce temps, préparez la vinaigrette. Dans\r\nun bol, mélanger le reste du curry\r\npoudrer avec le yaourt, le chutney et\r\nle zeste et le jus de citron vert (ajouter 1 cuillère à soupe d''eau)\r\nsi la vinaigrette est un peu épaisse).","Pour servir, disposez les feuilles de laitue\r\nsur 2 assiettes. Garnir de mangue et\r\npoulet cuit, puis arroser de\r\ns''habiller. Parsemer d''oignon rouge\r\net les graines de sésame avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12497,6821,'fr','Foies de poulet sur pain grillé','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Pas seulement pour les farces et les pâtés, les foies de poulet poêlés constituent une entrée d''un bon rapport qualité-prix ou un déjeuner léger.','["250 g de foies de volaille","2 échalotes, hachées finement","une grosse poignée de persil plat, feuilles hachées très grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de câpres, rincées et égouttées, hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès","4 tranches de bon pain, comme au levain","1 cuillère à soupe de farine nature","grosse pincée de poivre de Cayenne"]','["Ramassez les foies, en coupant tout\r\nmorceaux de graisse et tendons, puis tapotez les foies\r\nsec. Placer l''échalote, le persil et les câpres\r\ndans un bol et arroser de la moitié de l''olive\r\nd''huile et 1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de Xérès.","Faire griller le pain (de préférence sur une plaque chauffante)\r\nmais un grille-pain c''est bien). Jetez les foies dedans\r\nla farine et le poivre de Cayenne, et\r\nassaisonner généreusement de sel et de poivre.\r\nFaites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle et\r\nfaire revenir les foies à feu très vif pendant\r\n4 à 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants\r\ndehors et cuit, mais encore un peu rosé\r\nau milieu. Verser le reste du vinaigre\r\ndans la poêle et faire bouillonner pendant 1 min.","Versez le contenu de la casserole avec le\r\néchalote et persil, mélanger le tout\r\nensemble, assaisonner au goût, puis empiler\r\nle pain grillé. Assaisonner avec un peu\r\nsel de mer croquant et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12498,6823,'fr','Pâtes aux tomates cerises, chou frisé, ricotta et pesto','La sauce au basilic frais et les tomates cerises donnent une belle couleur à ce plat sain – il regorge également de fibres et de vitamine C.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 gousses d''ail, hachées","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment broyés","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates cerises","500 g de pennes","200 g de chou frisé haché","4 cuillères à soupe de ricotta","4 cuillères à soupe de pesto frais","parmesan ou alternative végétarienne, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande casserole, ajoutez\r\nl''ail et cuire 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré. Ajoutez les flocons de piment et les tomates,\r\nbien assaisonner et laisser mijoter 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\nla sauce est épaisse et réduite.","Pendant que la sauce cuit, faites cuire le\r\npâtes en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage – ajouter\r\nle chou frisé pour les 2 dernières minutes de cuisson.\r\nBien égoutter et incorporer à la sauce, puis\r\nrépartir dans 4 bols. Garnir chacun avec\r\nune cuillerée de ricotta, un filet de pesto et\r\ndes copeaux de parmesan, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12499,6829,'fr','Porc & pommes à la moutarde','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Préparez-vous un repas carré britannique sain et traditionnel avec cette recette.','["4 steaks de porc, environ 140 g/5 oz chacun, débarrassés de l''excès de gras","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","2 pommes à manger, épépinées et coupées en huit","1 oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","une petite poignée de feuilles de sauge déchirées ou 2 cuillères à café séchées","100 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de jambon (en cube, c''est bien)","2 cuillères à café de moutarde de Dijon ou de moutarde complète"]','["Frotter les steaks de porc avec un peu d''huile et assaisonner de poivre et de sel selon votre goût. Faites chauffer une grande poêle et faites revenir les steaks 2 minutes des deux côtés jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Transférer dans une assiette. En ajoutant un peu plus d''huile dans la poêle, faites revenir les pommes, les oignons et la sauge pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les pommes soient ramollies.","Versez le bouillon et la moutarde, puis remettez le porc dans la poêle et laissez mijoter pendant 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait réduit d''environ un tiers et que le porc soit bien cuit. Servir avec des légumes et de la purée de pommes de terre."]','2026-01-11 00:19:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12500,6833,'fr','Ragoût de poisson méditerranéen avec toasts à l''ail','Nourrissez une foule comme une maman méditerranéenne avec ce magnifique ragoût de fruits de mer estival','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 gros oignon, tranché","2 gousses d''ail, tranchées","1 piment rouge, finement haché","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","1 kg de tomates hachées grossièrement","200 ml de vin blanc","350 ml de bouillon de poisson","3 bandes de zeste d''orange","1 kg de filets de flétan sans peau, coupés en gros morceaux","500 g de palourdes","400 g de grosses crevettes crues","une poignée de persil plat haché","1 gros pain ciabatta, coupé en tranches de 1 cm","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gousses d''ail, coupées en deux"]','["Pour faire les toasts à l''ail, arrosez-les de\r\npain avec de l''huile, puis griller ou griller jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré partout. Pendant que les toasts sont encore\r\nchaud, frottez-les avec de l''ail et réservez.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle large et profonde.\r\nAjouter l''oignon et faire revenir à feu doux\r\npendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit ramolli. Remuer à travers le\r\nl''ail et le piment et cuire quelques minutes\r\nplus. Ajoutez le concentré de tomates et les tomates.\r\nAugmentez le feu et laissez cuire 10 à 15 minutes,\r\nen remuant jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient pulpeuses. Verser\r\navec le vin et cuire encore 10 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce que la majeure partie ait bouilli.","Ajoutez le bouillon de poisson et le zeste d''orange et\r\nchauffer jusqu''à ce que le mélange frémisse doucement. Nestlé le\r\nles morceaux de flétan dans le liquide et cuire\r\npendant 5 minutes. Ajouter les palourdes et les crevettes\r\net cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poisson\r\nest bien cuit et les palourdes ont\r\nouvert (jetez ceux qui ne l’ont pas été).\r\nSaupoudrer le persil sur le ragoût\r\net servir avec les toasts à l''ail."]','2026-01-11 00:19:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12501,6835,'fr','Saumon épicé et lentilles','Ce plat est facile à cuisiner mais toujours plein de saveurs.','["2 cuillères à café de pâte de curry","Boîte de 410 g de lentilles vertes égouttées et rincées","2 filets de saumon, environ 175 g/6 oz chacun","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","le jus d''1 citron","2 grosses poignées de bébés épinards"]','["Faites chauffer une grande poêle à couvercle\r\npoêle peu profonde à feu moyen. Pourboire\r\nla pâte de curry et faire revenir brièvement en remuant\r\nconstamment, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit grésillant et aromatique. Ajouter\r\nles lentilles avec environ un quart de boîte de\r\narroser et assaisonner. Chauffer jusqu''à ébullition\r\npuis déposez le saumon dessus, côté peau vers le haut.Couvrir\r\net laissez cuire le saumon pendant 6 à 8 minutes\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il soit ferme lorsqu''on le pousse.","Pendant que le saumon cuit,\r\nfaire la vinaigrette. Mélanger l''olive\r\nl''huile et le jus de citron et bien assaisonner.\r\nLorsque le saumon est cuit, retirez-le du\r\npoêle avec une tranche de poisson et réserver. Tourner\r\nle feu, incorporez les épinards et un tiers\r\nde la vinaigrette et cuire jusqu''à ce que les épinards\r\nvient de faner. Verser les lentilles et\r\nles épinards sur deux assiettes puis posez les\r\nsaumon dessus. Arroser du reste\r\nvinaigrette et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12502,6841,'fr','Cordonnier jambon-poireaux','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Utilisez un morceau de jambon restant dans ce souper familial sain mais copieux.','["2½ cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","450 g de poireaux parés et tranchés épais","450 ml de bouillon de légumes","100 g de farine autolevante, plus un peu pour étaler la pâte","75 ml de yaourt nature sans gras","1 cuillère à café de feuilles de thym, plus un peu pour décorer","140 g de petits pois surgelés","85 g de morceau de jambon râpé","1 petite pomme ou ½ grosse pomme, râpée"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/ventilateur 180C/gaz 6. Chauffer\r\n½ cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle, puis faire revenir les poireaux,\r\nen remuant pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à ramollir. Ajouter\r\nle bouillon, puis laisser mijoter 5 min.","Pendant ce temps, versez la farine dans un bol, faites\r\nun puits au centre, puis ajoutez le yaourt,\r\nle reste de l''huile, les feuilles de thym et un peu de sel.\r\nA l''aide d''un couteau à couverts, mélanger pour rassembler\r\nà une pâte molle. Divisez en 4 et façonnez en\r\nronds sur une surface farinée.","Incorporer les petits pois, le jambon et la pomme râpée.\r\nles poireaux, puis répartissez-les entre 4 individuels\r\ndes plats à tarte ou un grand plat. Garnir chacun avec\r\nun rond de pâte, parsemer de thym,\r\npuis enfourner pendant 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré."]','2026-01-11 00:19:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12503,6843,'fr','Poulet au jambon de Parme croustillant','Contient du porc – la recette est réservée aux non-musulmans. Un délicieux plat faible en gras en seulement 30 minutes, parfait si des amis passent en milieu de semaine','["450 g de pommes de terre nouvelles, coupées en deux si grosses","225 g de haricots verts, parés et tranchés","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","4 tranches de jambon de Parme","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","jus d''1 citron"]','["Cuire les pommes de terre nouvelles à l''eau bouillante salée\r\narroser pendant 10-15 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste tendre,\r\najouter les haricots verts pour la finale\r\n2 minutes. Pendant ce temps, mettez chaque poulet\r\npoitrine entre deux feuilles de film alimentaire\r\net écrasez-les avec un rouleau à pâtisserie jusqu''à ce que\r\nils font environ 1 cm d''épaisseur. Saison.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle et ajoutez-y le\r\nJambon de Parme. Cuire 2 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant.\r\nÉgoutter sur du papier absorbant. Ajouter l''huile au\r\npoêle et ajouter deux poitrines de poulet.\r\nCuire 3 minutes de chaque côté, transférer dans un\r\nassiette et réserver au chaud. Cuire l''autre\r\ndeux seins de la même manière.","Retirez la casserole du feu et ajoutez\r\nl''ail et le jus de citron. Mélanger dans le\r\nharicots et pommes de terre égouttés et crumble\r\ndans le jambon de Parme. Divisez le poulet et\r\nlégumes entre quatre assiettes."]','2026-01-11 00:19:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12504,6845,'fr','Pâté chinois aux épices indiennes','Un pâté chinois faible en gras et ultrasain qui peut être mis au congélateur ou dégusté le jour même','["Paquet de 500 g d''agneau haché maigre","1 oignon, haché","2 carottes, coupées en dés","2 cuillères à soupe de garam masala","200 ml de bouillon chaud (agneau, bœuf ou poulet)","200 g de petits pois surgelés","800 g de pommes de terre coupées en dés","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","petit bouquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","jus d''un demi-citron, plus des quartiers pour servir"]','["Dans une grande poêle antiadhésive, cuire l''agneau, l''oignon et les carottes, en remuant souvent, jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit doré et que les légumes commencent à ramollir, environ 8 minutes. Ajoutez le garam masala et un peu d''assaisonnement et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit parfumé. Versez le bouillon, portez à ébullition, versez les petits pois et laissez cuire encore 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que les petits pois soient cuits et que la majeure partie du liquide se soit évaporée.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire les pommes de terre dans une grande casserole d''eau salée jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient tendres, environ 8 minutes. Bien égoutter, remettre dans la casserole et incorporer délicatement le curcuma et la coriandre – essayez de ne pas trop briser les pommes de terre.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Transférer le hachis dans un plat allant au four et garnir de pommes de terre au curcuma. Pressez le jus de citron, puis enfournez pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que les pommes de terre soient dorées. Servir immédiatement avec des quartiers de citron supplémentaires en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:19:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12505,6847,'fr','Saumon à la purée de céleri-rave à la moutarde','Si la beauté est une affaire de peau, alors le céleri-rave en est un parfait exemple – et il est délicieux lorsqu’il est servi sous forme de purée crémeuse.','["2 filets de saumon d''environ 100 g/4 oz chacun","700 g de céleri-rave épluché pour enlever toute la peau noueuse et coupé en morceaux comme une pomme de terre","2 cuillères à café de moutarde complète","2 cuillères à café de jus de citron","100 g de pousses d''épinards"]','["Badigeonner légèrement le saumon d''huile d''olive et assaisonner de sel et\r\npoivre. Tapisser une lèchefrite de papier d''aluminium et\r\ndéposer le saumon dessus.","Placez le céleri-rave dans une casserole avec de l''eau froide pour couvrir. Sel et\r\nporter à ébullition. Baissez le feu,\r\ncouvrir et laisser mijoter 12-15\r\nminutes jusqu''à tendreté.\r\nPréchauffer le gril à feu moyen.\r\nFouetter ensemble la moutarde, le citron\r\njus, une pincée de sucre, sel, poivre\r\net 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive.","Griller le saumon pendant cinq minutes\r\nde chaque côté. Pendant ce temps, égouttez le\r\ncéleri-rave, en réservant 1 cuillère à soupe de cuisson\r\nl''eau. Remettez le céleri-rave dans le\r\ncasserole. Écraser jusqu''à ce qu''il soit assez lisse. Ajouter\r\nles épinards, en remuant de temps en temps\r\nà feu doux, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient flétris. Incorporer\r\n1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigrette à la moutarde et le\r\neau de cuisson réservée. Saison.","Verser la purée sur deux plats chauds\r\nassiettes et garnir chacune d''un filet.\r\nArroser des restes de vinaigrette."]','2026-01-11 00:19:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12506,6853,'fr','Halva hamantaschen aux fraises','Dégustez ces biscuits triangulaires fourrés au tahini, au miel et à la confiture de fraises. Les Hamantaschen sont souvent appréciés lors de la fête juive de Pourim.','["300 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","165 g de beurre doux, ramolli","65g de sucre glace","50 g de crème fraîche","1 jaune d''oeuf","120 ml de tahin","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","100g de confiture de fraises","1 œuf battu"]','["Pour faire la pâte, mélangez tous les ingrédients avec vos mains pour former une pâte. Coupez-le en deux et formez deux disques. Enveloppez les disques et placez-les au frais pendant environ 1 h.","Pour préparer la garniture halva, mélangez le tahini et le miel dans un petit bol avec une pincée de sel marin. S’il est très épais, ajoutez un peu d’eau – veillez à ne pas en mettre trop sinon il deviendra trop liquide.","Étalez un des morceaux de pâte sur une surface légèrement farinée jusqu''à ce qu''il fasse environ 2 à 3 mm d''épaisseur. Il est important de le garder fin, sinon le hamantaschen sera trop gros une fois plié. Découpez des cercles de pâte à l''aide d''un emporte-pièce de 6 ou 7 cm – plus l''emporte-pièce est petit, plus vous aurez de hamantaschen.","Étalez environ ½ cuillère à café de garniture de halva sur chaque cercle et recouvrez d''environ ¼ de cuillère à café de confiture – vous ne voulez pas plus d''environ une cuillère à café des deux combinées, sinon elle sera difficile à plier et la garniture suintera lors de la cuisson.","Pour assembler les hamantaschen, peignez très légèrement le bord extérieur d’un cercle avec de la dorure à l’œuf. Prenez le bord inférieur gauche du cercle (s''il s''agissait d''un cadran d''horloge, ce serait entre 5 heures et 8 heures) et pliez-le en biais vers le centre pour former un rabat qui recouvre le tiers gauche du cercle. Ensuite, prenez le côté opposé du cercle (7h-3h) et pliez-le vers le centre, en chevauchant légèrement le rabat du côté gauche pour créer une pointe triangulaire au bas du cercle. Vous devriez pouvoir voir la garniture au milieu. Enfin, pliez la partie supérieure du cercle vers le bas pour créer un troisième rabat et complétez le triangle — un petit triangle de remplissage doit être visible au centre. Appuyez doucement sur les pointes du triangle ensemble pour les faire bien coller. Idéalement, vous souhaitez que les bords soient au-dessus du suivant d''un côté et en dessous de l''autre pour créer un effet de moulinet. Placez les hamantaschen sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé et réfrigérez pendant 20 à 30 minutes pour qu''ils raffermissent. Répéter avec les cercles restants, puis avec le deuxième disque de pâte et le reste de la garniture.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Cuire au four environ 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés – vérifier après 15 minutes qu''ils ne deviennent pas trop foncés. Transférer sur une grille pour refroidir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12507,6859,'fr','Éclairs à la pistache','Développez vos talents de pâtissier avec ces éclairs divins à la pistache, faits de pâte à choux et de crème pistache – ils en valent bien la peine.','["250 ml de lait","45 g de pâte de pistache","4 jaunes d''œufs","60 g de sucre en poudre doré","25g de farine nature","15g de farine de maïs","25 ml de crème fouettée","125 ml de lait","65 g de beurre doux coupé en dés","125 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre en poudre doré","4 œufs moyens, légèrement battus","25g de sucre glace","1 boule de gingembre tige, hachée finement","25 g de pistaches grillées et hachées grossièrement"]','["Commencez par préparer la garniture à la crème anglaise. Faites chauffer le lait avec la pâte de pistache. Dans un autre bol, fouettez les jaunes d''œufs avec le sucre, la farine et la maïzena jusqu''à consistance lisse. Lorsque le lait est fumant, juste avant de bouillir, versez-le progressivement sur le mélange de jaunes et fouettez bien. Remettez le mélange sur le feu et laissez cuire jusqu''à ce qu''il épaississe et commence à bouillir. Cela deviendra très grumeleux, mais continuez à fouetter vigoureusement jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser dans un bol propre. Couvrir et laisser refroidir complètement. La crème pistache peut être préparée jusqu''à deux jours à l''avance et conservée dans un récipient hermétique au réfrigérateur.","Pendant ce temps, préparez les choux. Faites chauffer le lait, 125 ml d''eau et le beurre dans une grande casserole et portez à ébullition. Retirez du feu et ajoutez la farine, le sucre et une pincée de sel. Mélangez et remettez sur le feu en remuant avec une cuillère en bois jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit lisse et se détache des parois de la casserole. Versez dans un mixeur de table et mélangez avec la palette jusqu''à ce que le mélange ait refroidi (si vous n''avez pas de mixeur, étalez-le sur une assiette pour qu''il refroidisse). Une fois refroidi, commencez à battre progressivement l''œuf (soit au batteur de table, soit avec un fouet électrique à main) jusqu''à ce qu''il soit complètement incorporé. Vous voulez que le mélange soit brillant et tombe de la cuillère en 3 à 5 secondes. Mettre dans une poche à douille et réserver.","Chauffer le four à 220C/200C chaleur tournante/gaz 7. Tapisser deux plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé. Coupez environ 1 cm de l''extrémité de la poche à douille et pochez la pâte à choux en une ligne de 10 cm, puis revenez sur elle-même en laissant un espace entre les éclairs pour que les choux se dilatent. Vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots. Cuire au four pendant 3-4 minutes, puis réduire le feu à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Cuire au four encore 12-15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit entièrement doré et bien cuit. Retirez-les, percez le côté de chacun pour laisser s''échapper la vapeur, puis laissez-les refroidir sur une grille. Peut être préparé la veille et conservé dans une boîte hermétique.","Au moment de monter, fouettez la crème jusqu''à formation de pics mous, puis réservez. À l''aide de batteurs électriques, fouettez le mélange de crème anglaise jusqu''à consistance lisse. Incorporez la chantilly à l''aide d''une spatule et mettez la crème anglaise dans une poche à douille.","Pour servir, coupez la pâte à choux en deux horizontalement et garnissez-la de gouttes de crème pistache. À l''aide d''une passoire fine, saupoudrez généreusement le dessus de sucre glace et saupoudrez de gingembre en tige et de pistaches hachées juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12508,6873,'fr','Curry de poulet aux noisettes','Rapide et savoureux, ce curry de poulet crémeux est prêt en moins de 20 minutes','["1 gros piment rouge, épépiné","½ morceau de gingembre frais de la longueur d''un doigt, haché grossièrement","1 grosse gousse d''ail","petit bouquet de coriandre, tiges grossièrement hachées","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en morceaux","5 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète","150 ml de bouillon de poulet","Pot de 200 g de yaourt grec"]','["Tranchez finement un quart du piment, puis mettez le reste dans un robot culinaire avec le gingembre, l''ail, les tiges de coriandre et un tiers des feuilles. Réduire en pâte grossière avec un peu d''eau si nécessaire.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis faites revenir rapidement les morceaux de poulet pendant 1 min. Incorporer la pâte pendant encore une minute, puis ajouter le beurre de cacahuète, le bouillon et le yaourt. Lorsque la sauce bouillonne doucement, laissez cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit et que la sauce épaississe. Incorporer la majeure partie de la coriandre restante, puis parsemer le reste avec le piment, le cas échéant. A manger avec du riz ou de la purée de patate douce."]','2026-01-11 00:19:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12509,6875,'fr','Pots d''amaretti orange et rhubarbe','Un dessert facile que vous pouvez préparer pour un déjeuner divertissant du dimanche. Ils ne font que s''améliorer au réfrigérateur, alors prenez de l''avance et éliminez une tâche !','["400 g de crème fraîche","360 g de yaourt grec entier épais","150 g de biscuits amers cassés en petits morceaux","500 g de rhubarbe coupée en tronçons de 2½ cm","150 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus une grosse pincée","150 ml de jus d''orange, plus le zeste d''1 orange","4 œufs moyens et 2 jaunes moyens","150g de beurre doux"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez le caillé. Mettez la rhubarbe, une pincée de sucre et le jus d''orange dans une casserole sur feu moyen et couvrez avec un couvercle. Cuire 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que la rhubarbe soit bien tendre. Retirer du feu.","Passer la rhubarbe au tamis fin en la poussant pour en extraire le plus de pulpe possible. Gardez la chair dans la passoire pour l''incorporer plus tard.","Fouetter les œufs, les jaunes d''œufs et le sucre jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient pâles et mousseux. Faire fondre régulièrement le beurre dans une poêle à feu doux. Une fois fondu, versez lentement le mélange d''œufs et le zeste d''orange en remuant continuellement. Ajoutez la pulpe de rhubarbe égouttée et mélangez, en continuant de cuire doucement jusqu''à ce que le caillé épaississe comme une crème anglaise. Cela peut prendre 10 à 12 minutes, mais soyez patient et n''augmentez pas le feu, car vous pourriez brouiller les œufs.","Une fois le caillé épaissi, transférez-le dans un bol et fouettez jusqu''à consistance lisse. À ce stade, j’aime rajouter la chair de rhubarbe du tamis, pour donner plus de corps au dessert – mais si vous voulez un caillé onctueux, ne faites pas cela.","Fouettez la crème en vous arrêtant juste avant la formation de pics mous. Incorporez le yaourt, 300 g de caillé et la plupart des biscuits amaretti.","Versez le mélange dans huit verres et saupoudrez des amaretti réservés. Conservez le reste du caillé pour l''utiliser sur des crêpes, du granola ou pour faire des petites tartelettes. Conservez-le dans un pot stérilisé (lavez un pot dans de l''eau chaude savonneuse, rincez, puis enfournez tête en bas à 120C/100C ventilateur/gaz 1/2 pendant 15 min pour sécher)."]','2026-01-11 00:19:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12510,6877,'fr','Glace végétalienne au chocolat et à la banane','Une glace au chocolat allégée ? Ça existe vraiment ! Notre création de banane éclair est sans gluten et sans produits laitiers et prête en quelques minutes','["1 banane congelée","1 cuillère à café de cacao en poudre"]','["Dans un mixeur, mixez la banane surgelée avec la poudre de cacao jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Mangez tout de suite."]','2026-01-11 00:19:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12511,6879,'fr','Pudding au chocolat, beurre de cacahuète et avocat','La saveur neutre et la texture crémeuse de l''avocat en font un merveilleux substitut aux produits laitiers dans les desserts ou les smoothies. Ces petits pots se conservent quelques jours au réfrigérateur : un excellent dessert à préparer à l''avance !','["2 gros avocats mûrs, coupés en deux et dénoyautés","1 grosse banane, hachée","5 pruneaux tendres","6 cuillères à soupe de lait d''amande non sucré ou de lait de coco","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre de cacahuète crémeux (non sucré, si possible)","3 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre (ou de cacao en poudre de bonne qualité)","100 g de yaourt au lait de coco (type CoYo)","2 cuillères à café de sirop d''érable ou de miel","chocolat noir (80% de cacao, si possible), pour décorer"]','["Versez la chair de l''avocat dans un robot culinaire. Ajoutez la banane hachée, les pruneaux, le lait d''amande ou de coco, le beurre de cacahuète crémeux et la poudre de cacao. Mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant un peu plus de lait si la lame reste coincée. Raclez les côtés une ou deux fois et mélangez à nouveau.","Répartissez le mélange dans 4 petits verres. Mélangez le yaourt à la noix de coco avec le sirop d''érable ou le miel et garnissez chaque pudding d''une généreuse cuillerée. Râpez finement un peu de chocolat noir dessus et réservez au frais au moins 1 h."]','2026-01-11 00:19:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12512,6881,'fr','Tiramisu simple et rapide','Le lait concentré est le secret de ce dessert italien ultra vif. Le café et le chocolat sont une combinaison classique, il suffit de les superposer et de savourer','["3 cuillères à café de grains de café instantané","3 cuillères à soupe de liqueur de café (ou Camp Chicory & Coffee Essence)","250 g de mascarpone en casserole","85 g de lait concentré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 à 6 doigts éponge","1 cuillère à soupe de cacao en poudre"]','["Mélangez les grains de café avec 2 cuillères à soupe d''eau bouillante dans une grande carafe et mélangez. Ajoutez la liqueur de café et 75 ml d''eau froide. Verser dans un plat peu profond et réserver.","Préparez la couche de crème en battant le mascarpone, le lait concentré et l''extrait de vanille avec un fouet électrique jusqu''à obtenir une consistance épaisse et lisse.","Cassez les biscuits en deux ou trois morceaux et laissez-les tremper dans le mélange de café pendant quelques secondes. Mettez quelques morceaux de biscuit au fond de deux verres à vin ou à coupe glacée et recouvrez de crème. Tamisez le cacao et réfrigérez au moins 1 heure avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12513,6883,'fr','Tarte aux pêches et aux amandes','Authentique tarte italienne aux pêches et aux amandes','["100 ml de beurre froid","200 g de farine nature","85 g de sucre en poudre","3 jaunes d''œufs","le zeste râpé d''un citron","50 g d''amandes entières blanchies","50 g de sucre en poudre, plus 2 cuillères à soupe","50g de beurre","50g de farine nature","1 gros œuf et 1 jaune d''œuf","50 g de biscuits amaretti légèrement écrasés","5-6 pêches ou nectarines selon leur taille","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Coupez le beurre en dés le plus petit possible. Si\r\ntu trempes ton couteau dans la farine pour la pâtisserie\r\net continuez à recouvrir le beurre de farine au fur et à mesure\r\nvous dés, vous trouverez cela plus facile.","Mettez les dés de beurre et la farine dans les aliments\r\nprocesseur et pulser jusqu''à ce que tout semble aller bien\r\nchapelure. Ajoutez une pincée de sel, le\r\nsucre, jaunes d''oeufs et zeste de citron et pouls\r\nencore une fois – cela devrait presque immédiatement\r\nadhérer en boule. Retirer du\r\nrobot, posez-le sur une feuille de film alimentaire ou\r\npapier d''aluminium, puis presser légèrement et façonner en un\r\nbûche compacte (touchez-la le moins possible).\r\nEnvelopper et réfrigérer pendant au moins 1 heure – le\r\nplus il repose, moins il rétrécira par la suite.","Beurrer et fariner soigneusement un moule à tarte de 24 cm.\r\nDéballez et coupez la bûche de pâte en fines\r\nmême des tranches et utiliser pour couvrir le fond\r\net les côtés de la boîte en touchant simplement ou\r\ntranches légèrement superposées. Gardez un bol de\r\ndes glaçons et des serviettes en papier à portée de main\r\nrafraîchissez-vous et séchez-vous les mains pendant que vous travaillez.","Tapotez légèrement la pâte avec les doigts froids pour\r\nla base est uniforme et rend la coque un peu\r\nplus épais sur les côtés, garantissant qu''il atteigne\r\njusqu''en haut car il pourrait rétrécir. Pour même\r\nla base, passez rapidement un glaçon dessus,\r\ndu centre vers les bords. Détendez-vous à nouveau.","Versez les amandes et 50 g de sucre\r\ndans le robot culinaire et fouettez jusqu''à ce que\r\nfinement haché. Coupez le beurre en dés et ajoutez\r\naux amandes avec la farine. Processus\r\nencore jusqu''à ce que le mélange semble bon\r\nchapelure, puis ajoutez l''œuf et par exemple\r\njaune et mélanger brièvement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et\r\ncrémeux. Ajoutez les amaretti écrasés et\r\nsifflez à nouveau brièvement. Froideur.","Préchauffer le four à 180°C/gaz 4/chaleur tournante\r\n160C.Déposez les pêches dans une casserole de\r\neau bouillante, retirer après quelques secondes\r\npuis refroidir dans l''eau froide. Peler, couper en deux et\r\ndénoyauter les pêches, saupoudrer de 2 cuillères à soupe\r\nsucre et laisser reposer 5 minutes. Répandre le\r\ncrème amaretti dans le fond de pâte\r\ncas. Mettez les moitiés de pêches dessus,\r\ncôté arrondi vers le haut, en les coupant si nécessaire\r\npour remplir le centre. Parsemer d''amandes","Cuire au four pendant 25 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés.\r\nVérifiez le remplissage avec un cure-dent (qui\r\ndevrait ressortir à peine moucheté) et\r\nassurez-vous que la pâte rétrécit\r\nl''étain. Saupoudrer de sucre glace et servir un\r\ntempérature ambiante, avec un verre de\r\nVin Santo toscan."]','2026-01-11 00:19:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12514,6887,'fr','Posset au citron et sablé aux dragées','Faire vos propres puddings aux agrumes individuels est encore plus impressionnant lorsqu''ils sont servis avec des biscuits faits maison pour récupérer la crème.','["600 ml de crème fraîche","200 g de sucre en poudre doré","zester 3 citrons et 75 ml de jus","140 g de beurre froid coupé en dés","140 g de farine nature","85 g de sucre en poudre doré, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","50 g de riz moulu (ou plus de farine si vous n''en trouvez pas)","85 g d''amandes effilées"]','["Faites d''abord le posset. Mettez la crème dedans\r\nune grande casserole avec le sucre et doucement\r\nchauffer en remuant jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit fondu.\r\nPortez à ébullition et bouillonnez 1 min.\r\nÉteignez le feu et incorporez le citron\r\nle zeste et le jus. Répartir dans les pots ou\r\nbols, laisser refroidir à température ambiante, puis\r\ncouvrir soigneusement et réfrigérer pendant au moins 3 heures,\r\nou jusqu''à 24 heures.","Pour réaliser les sablés, chauffer le four\r\nà 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 3. Mélangez le beurre et la farine ensemble dans un robot culinaire\r\njusqu''à ce qu''il ne reste plus de grumeaux de beurre (ou frottez\r\ndu bout des doigts). Basculer dans un\r\nbol et incorporer le sucre, le riz moulu et\r\nalmonds. Tapisser la base d''un papier d''environ 22 cm\r\nmoule carré avec du papier sulfurisé. Astuce\r\ndans le mélange et appuyez fermement,\r\nen le rendant aussi plat que possible. Dredge with\r\nplus de sucre et cuire au four pendant 25-30 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\npale golden. Cool in the tin.","Coupez les sablés en éclats et\r\nservir avec les possets et les petites cuillères."]','2026-01-11 00:19:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12515,6889,'fr','Fondants choco-cacahuètes, terreau chocolaté & cerises','La terre au chocolat est une grande tendance dans les restaurants en ce moment – ​​servez-la avec votre pud fondant pour un effet wow sérieux.','["50 g de beurre ramolli plus du beurre fondu supplémentaire pour graisser","poudre de cacao, pour saupoudrer","85 g de beurre de cacahuète croquant","175 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","4 gros œufs","85 g de farine nature","300 g de chocolat noir cassé en morceaux et fondu","grand pot de compote de cerises","6 boules de glace vanille, pour servir","6 cerises avec les queues, pour servir","1 gâteau au chocolat acheté (non glacé), environ 250g"]','["Préparez d''abord le sol. Chauffer le four à\r\n180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4. Tranchez finement le\r\ngâteau au chocolat et déposer sur des plaques à pâtisserie\r\ntapissé de papier sulfurisé. Cuire au four pour\r\n30 minutes, en retournant les tranches à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce que\r\ncroustillant au toucher. Mettre dans un robot culinaire\r\net réduire en miettes croustillantes. Gardera\r\nbien jusqu''à une semaine dans une boîte hermétique.","Réaliser les fondants en badigeonnant 6\r\nla dariole se moule bien avec le beurre fondu.\r\nMettre au frais 1 min, puis badigeonner à nouveau. Mettez un\r\ncuillère de cacao en poudre dans une et secouer\r\nà peu près pour que tout l''intérieur soit recouvert, alors\r\nversez le reste dans le suivant et appuyez sur le\r\nbas de la dariole pour en sortir\r\nexcès. Répétez avec toutes les darioles.","Battre ensemble le beurre ramolli,\r\nbeurre de cacahuète, sucre et vanille pour\r\ncrémer-les, puis incorporer les œufs,\r\nsuivi de la farine. Incorporer le fondu\r\nchocolat et répartir entre les\r\ndarioles. Réfrigérer jusqu''à 24 heures.","Pour servir, chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/\r\ngaz 6. Cuire les fondants pendant 10-12 minutes –\r\nle dessus sera pris, mais vous devriez sentir un\r\nmilieu doux lorsque vous le poussez. Ajoutez un petit\r\ntas de terre dans chaque assiette et recouvrir d''un\r\ncerise – ou mettre la terre dans un mini seau\r\nou un pot de fleurs. Ajoutez une cuillère de cerise\r\ncompote dans chaque assiette et garnir de\r\nune boule de glace vanille. Enfin,\r\nretournez soigneusement chaque fondant au chocolat\r\ndans l''assiette – ils devraient sortir\r\nfacilement. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:19:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12516,6891,'fr','Bols ballons en chocolat','Ces bols comestibles transformeront votre dessert de dîner en quelque chose de vraiment impressionnant – remplissez-les de crème glacée ou de votre pud préféré','["300 g de chocolat (nous avons utilisé du noir, mais choisissez votre préféré)","un dessert au choix (nous avons utilisé de la glace et du nid d''abeille)","4 petits ballons"]','["Cassez le chocolat en petits morceaux.\r\nMettre dans un bol suspendu au-dessus d''une casserole de\r\neau frémissante et laisser fondre.\r\nRetirer du feu et laisser refroidir\r\npendant 5 minutes. Pendant ce temps, fais exploser ton\r\nballons – vous voulez que chaque bol soit\r\nenviron 10 cm de large, alors essayez de choisir des petits\r\ndes ballons et ne les gonfle pas aussi\r\nbeaucoup. Attachez avec un nœud.","Tapisser une plaque à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé.\r\nTenant l''extrémité nouée du ballon,\r\ntrempez-le dans le chocolat fondu pour créer\r\nla forme de votre bol. Placez-le sur le plateau et\r\nmaintenez le ballon pendant quelques secondes jusqu''à ce que le\r\ndes flaques de chocolat autour de la base permettant\r\nà vous de lâcher le ballon. Continuer\r\navec les ballons restants. Détendez-vous pendant au\r\nau moins 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que le tout soit pris.","Lorsque le chocolat est pris, éclatez-le\r\nles ballons et décollez-les soigneusement\r\nloin des bols. Remplissez avec votre\r\ndessert choisi – la glace est bonne\r\ncar il garde les bols froids."]','2026-01-11 00:19:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12517,6893,'fr','Tarte au citron et aux fruits d''été','Une tarte au citron piquante de M. Ramsay. La version de Gordon de la classique tarte au citron française en vaut la peine','["5 citrons non cirés","6 oeufs","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","200 ml de crème fraîche","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer et décorer","375 g de pâte à dessert en bloc","4 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace","300 g de fraises décortiquées, coupées en deux ou en quartiers","350g de framboises","150g de myrtilles","1 cuillère à café de vinaigre de Xérès","une poignée de menthe, feuilles, finement râpées"]','["Râpez finement le zeste de 3 citrons dans un bol. Coupez tous les citrons en deux, puis utilisez une fourchette pour presser tout le jus et la pulpe dans le bol avec le zeste – ne vous inquiétez pas pour les graines. Cassez les œufs dans un autre bol, puis incorporez le sucre en poudre jusqu''à ce que le tout soit complètement mélangé. Incorporer le mélange crème et jus de citron, puis réserver.","Disposez un cercle à tarte ou un moule à flan à fond amovible de 23 cm sur une plaque à pâtisserie recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Sur une surface saupoudrée de sucre glace, étalez la pâte sur l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 euro. Soulever sur un rouleau à pâtisserie, puis draper sur le cercle à tarte ou le moule à flan, en laissant l''excédent dépasser sur le bord. Pressez délicatement la pâte sur les côtés avec une petite boule de pâte. Mettre au réfrigérateur ou au congélateur pendant 20 minutes pour permettre à la pâte de refroidir.","Pendant que la pâte refroidit, chauffer le four à 200°C/chaleur tournante 180°/gaz 6. Piquer le fond du fond de tarte, tapisser de papier sulfurisé et de billes de cuisson, puis enfourner 15 min. Retirez le papier et les haricots, puis faites cuire le moule pendant 5 à 10 minutes supplémentaires jusqu''à ce qu''il soit brun biscuit et croustillant. Baisser le four à 150C/chaleur tournante 130C/gaz 2.","À l''aide d''une louche, passez la crème au citron au tamis dans un bol, en appuyant sur la pulpe pour en extraire le plus de jus possible. Écumez les bulles de la surface de la crème anglaise, puis versez la crème anglaise dans un pichet. Sortez légèrement la tarte du four, puis versez la crème anglaise pour qu''elle remonte jusqu''au sommet. Il vous en reste peut-être. Repoussez la tarte, puis faites cuire au four pendant 35 à 40 minutes jusqu''à ce que le dessus forme une croûte légère et que la crème anglaise soit juste prise. Laisser refroidir, puis réfrigérer.","Pendant que la tarte refroidit, préparez la salade de fruits rouges. Placez une grande poêle antiadhésive sur feu moyen et répartissez le sucre glace sur le fond. Chauffer jusqu''à ce que le sucre se dissolve et caramélise. Ajoutez les baies, mélangez avec le sucre, puis ajoutez le vinaigre de Xérès. Faites bouillir pendant une minute jusqu''à ce que tout commence à ramollir, puis versez sur une assiette et laissez reposer.\r\nrefroidir légèrement.","Utilisez un couteau dentelé pour découper la pâte et faire un bord net. Saupoudrez légèrement la tarte de sucre glace, puis caramélisez le dessus au chalumeau. Laissez le dessus durcir, puis répétez le processus pour obtenir une couche de caramel très épaisse. Incorporer la menthe aux baies. Servir la tarte en tranches avec un bol de salade de fruits rouges à part."]','2026-01-11 00:19:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12518,6895,'fr','Fou de crème de citron et de yaourt','Offrez-vous un dessert familial délicieusement simple – prêt en seulement cinq minutes','["Pot de 300 g de crème au citron (nous avons utilisé la crème au citron traditionnelle Duchy Originals)","Pot de 500 g de yaourt grec 0%","200 g de framboises barquette","1 cuillère à soupe de sucre glace","sablés, pour servir"]','["Mettez la crème au citron et le yaourt dans un bol. Pliez ensemble pour un effet ondulé. Répartissez le mélange dans quatre verres et mettez au frais.","Mélangez les framboises et le sucre glace et écrasez-les délicatement, puis versez leur jus sur le mélange réfrigéré et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12519,6897,'fr','Véritable glace à la vanille','Préparez une glace à la vanille super crémeuse et mangez-la telle quelle, ou ajoutez différentes saveurs pour tous les goûts','["500 ml de lait entier","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","1 gousse de vanille","5 gros jaunes d''œufs (congelez les blancs pour la prochaine fois que vous voudrez faire de la meringue)","140 g de sucre en poudre doré"]','["Mettez le lait et la crème dans une casserole.\r\nFendez la gousse de vanille sur toute la longueur avec\r\nun petit couteau bien aiguisé et retirez-le comme\r\nautant de petites graines noires que possible\r\ndans le mélange de lait. Ajoutez le pod à\r\nla poêle aussi. Faites chauffer le tout sur une\r\nfeu doux, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''il\r\nbout presque – vous verrez quelques bulles à\r\nle bord. Retirer du feu et réserver\r\npendant 30 min pour que la vanille infuse.","Mélangez les jaunes d''œufs et le sucre dans\r\nun bol. Versez progressivement le lait sur\r\nmélange d''œufs, en fouettant continuellement\r\njusqu''à ce que le tout soit combiné. Remettez le tout dans\r\nla casserole nettoyée, remettez sur feu doux et\r\ncuire 8 à 10 minutes en remuant tout le temps\r\navec une cuillère en bois, jusqu''à ce que la crème anglaise\r\nest suffisamment épais pour recouvrir l''arrière du\r\ncuillère. Assurez-vous qu''il ne bout pas ou\r\nvous vous retrouverez avec des œufs brouillés.","Passer la crème anglaise au tamis fin\r\ndans un bol, puis placez-le dans un bol plus grand,\r\nun tiers plein de glace et d''eau, pour le refroidir\r\nvers le bas – continuez à remuer de temps en temps\r\npour arrêter la formation d''une peau. Détendez-vous pour être sûr\r\nil fait complètement froid, je mets du film alimentaire\r\ndirectement à la surface de la crème anglaise\r\npour éviter la formation d''une peau.","Versez la crème anglaise dans une glace\r\nmachine. Taux de désabonnement suivant les fabricants\r\ninstructions jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient congelés, puis versez-les dans\r\nun récipient en métal ou en plastique allant au congélateur.\r\nCouvrir et congeler jusqu''à ce qu''il soit solide. Si tu ne le fais pas\r\navez une sorbetière, versez le\r\ncrème anglaise dans le récipient et congeler.\r\nToutes les 2-3 heures, sortez le mélange du\r\ncongélateur et remuez. Une fois que c''est doucement\r\nensemble, battez-le bien avec des batteurs électriques,\r\npuis congeler solidement. Il se conservera dans le\r\ncongélateur pendant 3 mois. Supprimer de\r\nau congélateur 15 minutes avant de servir\r\nlaissez-le devenir suffisamment mou pour pouvoir le ramasser."]','2026-01-11 00:19:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12520,6901,'fr','Puddings à la tasse de thé aux fruits de la passion','Faites cuire ces puddings éponge cuits à la vapeur dans de petits ramequins solides et servez-les dans de petites tasses en porcelaine lorsque vous recevez.','["250 g de crème de fruit de la passion ou de citron","4 fruits de la passion bien mûrs, graines et pulpe retirées","3 gros œufs","100 g de sucre en poudre doré","85 g de beurre fondu","100 ml de lait","140 g de farine nature","½ cuillère à café de levure chimique","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer","crème caillée, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 3. Ligne\r\nun grand plat à rôtir profond avec un torchon,\r\nréserver et faire bouillir la bouilloire. Mettez 100g de\r\nle caillé dans un bol, mélanger le reste du caillé\r\navec les graines et la pulpe du fruit de la passion, et\r\nrépartir dans 6 tasses à thé ou ramequins\r\n(les miens faisaient environ 200 ml).","Fouetter les œufs et le sucre ensemble\r\nun grand bol jusqu''à ce qu''il soit pâle et mousseux – cela\r\nprend environ 5 minutes. Ajoutez le réservé\r\ncaillé, beurre, lait, farine et pâtisserie\r\npoudre. Pliez le mélange avec un\r\nspatule jusqu''à ce qu''il n''y ait plus de grumeaux visibles\r\nfarine, puis répartissez-la dans les tasses à thé.","Mettez les tasses à thé dans le plat à rôtir.\r\nRemplissez soigneusement le moule avec de l''eau chaude provenant\r\nla bouilloire arrive à mi-hauteur du\r\ncôtés des tasses à thé, en faisant attention à ne pas\r\npour mettre de l''eau dans les tasses. Cuire au four pour\r\n50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient levés et dorés. Une fois\r\ncuit, vous pouvez refroidir les puddings et\r\nréfrigérer jusqu''à une journée ou envelopper dans un film alimentaire\r\net congeler jusqu''à 2 mois. Pour réchauffer,\r\nramener à température ambiante, remettre dans un\r\nbain d''eau chaude au four et cuire au four pendant\r\n15 minutes à 160C/140C ventilateur/gaz 3. Avant\r\nAu moment de servir, saupoudrez chaque pudding d''un peu\r\nsucre glace et mettre une cuillerée de caillé\r\ncrème dessus, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12521,6903,'fr','Muffins au pain de maïs','Ces collations salées sont parfaites pour les pique-niques et les boîtes à lunch – et elles peuvent en outre être congelées à l''avance.','["85 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour la friture","1 gros maïs doux, grains tranchés","1 petit oignon, finement haché","½ piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","140 g de farine nature","140 g de polenta ou de semoule de maïs","2 cuillères à café de levure chimique","50 g de cheddar fort râpé","2 œufs","Pot de 284 ml de babeurre","100 ml de lait"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6 et\r\nbadigeonner un moule à muffins à 12 trous avec un peu de\r\nle beurre fondu Mettre les grains de maïs\r\ndans une poêle avec l''oignon, le piment et une pomme\r\nde beurre. Faire frire doucement pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré et doux.","Mélanger la farine, la polenta, les pâtisseries\r\npoudre et cheddar avec 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un\r\ngrand bol à mélanger. Fouetter ensemble le\r\nles œufs, le babeurre et le lait, puis incorporer\r\nles ingrédients secs avec le reste\r\nmélange de beurre fondu et de maïs. Diviser\r\nentre les trous des muffins (ils seront\r\nassez plein) et cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que\r\ndoré et bien cuit – poke\r\nen brochette pour vérifier. Mieux mangé chaud."]','2026-01-11 00:19:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12522,6905,'fr','Nectarines au four aux amandes et Marsala','Créez une délicieuse garniture à l''italienne pour les pêches et les nectarines pour un dessert d''été simple','["6 nectarines, coupées en deux, dénoyautées","100 g de biscuits amers","100 g de beurre ramolli","85g d''amandes moulues","85 g de sucre en poudre doré","1 oeuf","1 à 2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes effilées grillées","250 ml de Marsala","Yaourt grec ou crème fraîche, pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nDisposez bien les moitiés de nectarine dans un\r\nplat allant au four, côté coupé vers le haut. Mettez les amaretti\r\nbiscuits dans un grand bol et utilisez le bout\r\nd''un rouleau à pâtisserie pour réduire en miettes. Ajouter\r\nle beurre ramolli, la poudre d''amandes,\r\nle sucre en poudre et l''œuf et mélanger.","Versez des cuillerées du mélange dans le\r\ncavités des nectarines, s''empilant davantage\r\ncouvrir jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit uniformément divisé\r\nparmi eux. Parsemer d''amandes, puis\r\nverser délicatement le Marsala dans le plat\r\nà travers un espace entre les fruits afin que le\r\nla garniture ne devient pas détrempée. Cuire au four pour\r\n40 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants, et\r\nle fruit est doux. A manger tiède avec les jus\r\nà la cuillère et une cuillerée de grec\r\ndu yaourt ou de la crème fraîche à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:19:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12523,6907,'fr','Piles de désordre d''Eton','Nous aimons les puddings individuels, ils ajoutent un certain « Je ne sais quoi » à une occasion. Et ces fabuleuses petites meringues sont définitivement un pudding d''occasion','["1 blanc d''oeuf","350 g de sucre glace","1 cuillère à café de graines de cardamome écrasées","un peu d''huile pour graisser","Pot de 142 ml de crème double","jus 1?2 citron","250 g de framboises barquette"]','["Fouettez légèrement le blanc d''œuf, puis incorporez-le\r\nsucre glace et cardamome pour faire une pâte ferme\r\nglaçage fondant. Rouler le glaçage en 8 balles de golf\r\ndes balles (vous n’en aurez probablement pas besoin de toutes).\r\nDeux à la fois, placez les boules en face\r\nextrémités d''un morceau de papier sulfurisé graissé,\r\npuis micro-ondes pendant 30 à 40 secondes à puissance élevée jusqu''à ce que\r\nquadruplé de taille. Laisser refroidir quelques instants\r\nminutes, puis retirez le papier et répétez jusqu''à ce que\r\ntoutes les boules sont cuites.","Fouettez la crème avec la moitié du jus de citron.\r\nÉcrasez la moitié des framboises, puis incorporez-les\r\nla crème. Pour servir, déposez une petite touche\r\nde crème de framboise dans chaque assiette. Pile\r\nune meringue avec un peu plus de crème, puis\r\ndéposer une autre meringue dessus. Verser dessus\r\nplus de crème, puis garnir de quelques\r\nframboises. Saupoudrez de sucre glace et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12524,8783,'fr','Vinaigrette au tahini','Oubliez le commerce et préparez une vinaigrette au tahini maison. Crémeux et acidulé, il donnera vie aux salades. Il se conservera au frais jusqu''à cinq jours','["4 dattes dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe de tahin","1 citron, jus","1 petite gousse d''ail","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","75 ml d''huile au goût neutre, comme une huile végétale"]','["Mettez les dattes dénoyautées dans un bol résistant à la chaleur. Versez dessus 150 ml d’eau bouillante pour couvrir. Laisser tremper 20 minutes jusqu''à ramollissement, puis passer dans un mixeur avec l''eau du bol, le tahini, le jus de citron, la gousse d''ail, le cumin moulu et l''huile au goût neutre. Mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant plus d''eau si nécessaire pour obtenir une bruine. Assaisonner au goût. Se conserve au frais dans un contenant hermétique jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:19:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12525,9368,'fr','Taboulé d''agneau croustillant et petits pois','Préparez notre kebab au four sans faff et utilisez les restes comme base pour réaliser ce taboulé d''agneau, pois, grenade et boulgour. C''est super pour les déjeuners préparés à l''avance','["120 g de boulgour séché","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 citron, jus","une petite poignée de persil haché grossièrement","une petite poignée de brins de menthe, feuilles cueillies et finement hachées","200 g de petits pois surgelés","150 g de restes de brochettes d''agneau cuites sur plaque, hachées grossièrement (voir étape 2)","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés finement","2 poivrons rouges rôtis, hachés finement","30g de graines de grenade, pour servir"]','["Faites cuire le boulgour en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage puis égouttez-le et rincez-le sous l''eau froide. Laisser refroidir légèrement. Mélangez 3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive avec le jus de citron et les herbes dans un grand bol, puis incorporez le boulgour et assaisonnez au goût.","Versez le reste de l''huile d''olive dans une poêle et mettez sur feu moyen-vif. Incorporer les petits pois surgelés et les restes d''agneau et faire frire pendant 5 à 6 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et que les pois éclatent. Incorporer les oignons nouveaux et les poivrons et cuire 1 minute seulement, puis retirer du feu. Incorporer au taboulé et parsemer de graines de grenade pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12526,9369,'fr','Écrasement','Profitez de cette salade pour accompagner vos plats turcs préférés. L''ezme authentique est haché très finement à la main, ou vous pouvez utiliser un robot culinaire, si vous le souhaitez.','["2-3 grosses tomates mûres, coupées en quartiers, environ 400 g","1 piment Romano rouge moyen, épépiné et haché grossièrement","1 sivri biber moyen ou petit piment vert, épépiné et haché grossièrement","1 petit oignon , haché grossièrement","2 grosses gousses d''ail écrasées","25 g de persil plat frais","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de poivron rouge","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","2 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","1 cuillère à soupe de pul biber","2 cuillères à café de sumac","1 cuillère à soupe de menthe séchée","60 ml d''huile d''olive extra vierge"]','["Mettez les tomates et tous les poivrons dans un robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement hachés. Versez dans une passoire, déposez au-dessus d''un bol et laissez égoutter. Ajoutez les oignons, l''ail et le persil au robot culinaire et mixez jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient finement hachés, puis réservez.","Ajouter la pâte de poivron rouge, la purée de tomates, la mélasse de grenade, le pul biber, le sumac, la menthe séchée et la majeure partie de l''huile d''olive extra vierge dans un bol de service et bien fouetter pour que le tout se forme comme une sauce. Versez le mélange d''oignons mixés et le mélange de poivrons égouttés avec 1 cuillère à café de sel marin feuilleté. Bien mélanger, puis arroser du reste d''huile d''olive extra vierge pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12527,8789,'fr','Brochettes de poulet avec pains plats maison','Griller des brochettes de poulet épicé et envelopper dans des pains plats chauds avec une salade vibrante – c''est une recette gagnante de Matty','["300 g de farine nature + un peu pour saupoudrer","1 cuillère à café de graines de nigelle","1 cuillère à café de poudre de piment","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, plus un peu pour la friture","30 g de beurre doux, fondu","1 oignon, râpé","1 kg de poulet haché","5 gousses d''ail écrasées","1 piment vert épépiné et finement haché","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","1 cuillère à soupe de sumac","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","200 g de chou rouge émincé finement","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin blanc","1⁄4 concombre , finement tranché","1 petit bijou, râpé","3 tomates de boeuf","1 oignon rouge , tranché","une petite poignée de persil","1 citron, jus","250 g de yaourt grec","1 citron, jus","1 cuillère à café de sumac"]','["Commencez par préparer les brochettes de poulet. Versez l''oignon râpé dans un torchon propre et essorez autant d''eau que possible au-dessus d''un évier. Ajouter dans un bol avec le reste des ingrédients sauf l''huile, puis assaisonner avec 1 cuillère à café de sel et 1 cuillère à café de poivre noir moulu. Bien mélanger jusqu''à consistance collante, puis diviser en quatre portions. Mouillez-vous légèrement les mains et rassemblez chaque portion en une bûche, puis enfilez-la sur une grande brochette en métal. Couvrir et réserver au réfrigérateur jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour la salade, ajoutez le chou dans un petit bol avec le vinaigre et assaisonnez. Dans un bol de service, ajouter tous les ingrédients restants et bien assaisonner. Pour la vinaigrette au yaourt, mélanger tous les ingrédients, assaisonner et réserver jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin.","Pour faire les pains plats, versez la farine, les graines de nigelle et la poudre de piment dans un bol avec une grosse pincée de sel. Versez l''huile d''olive et 150 ml d''eau tiède et mélangez. Réunissez-le en boule, puis démoulez-le sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné. Pétrissez pendant 5 minutes, jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit lisse et ne colle plus aux doigts. Divisez en 4 boules égales et étalez chacune sur une surface légèrement farinée en un grand cercle fin d''environ 18 cm de large.","Faites chauffer une grande poêle à feu moyen-vif. Une fois chaud, ajoutez un petit filet d’huile d’olive et répartissez-le dans la poêle. Ajoutez le premier pain plat dans la poêle et faites cuire 2-3 minutes de chaque côté, ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tacheté de taches brunes. Une fois cuit, déposer sur une plaque à pâtisserie, badigeonner un côté de beurre fondu et répéter avec le reste des pains plats. Gardez au chaud à four doux.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à cuire le poulet, chauffez le gril à feu moyen-vif. Tapisser une grande plaque à pâtisserie de papier d''aluminium et ajouter les brochettes. Arrosez d''huile et faites griller pendant 20 à 25 minutes, en retournant régulièrement, jusqu''à ce que le poulet soit bien cuit. Utilisez un thermomètre à viande si vous en avez un pour vérifier sa cuisson – il doit indiquer 70 °C.","Servez les brochettes de poulet avec les pains plats, la salade et le yaourt pour que les gens puissent créer leurs propres wraps."]','2026-01-11 00:19:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12528,9371,'fr','Trempette épicée aux poivrons rouges et hachis croustillant à la harissa','Ceci est mon interprétation d’un plat étonnant, le muhammara, une trempette épicée aux poivrons rouges du Moyen-Orient et aux noix. C’est très facile à préparer, surtout si vous utilisez un pot de poivrons rôtis. J''ai garni le mien de hachis d''harissa croustillant pour un repas plus complet, mais si vous le laissez de côté, il est parfait pour les fêtes, servi avec des crudités ou des pains pitta, ou tartiné à l''intérieur de sandwichs.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive, et un peu plus pour arroser","1 oignon , coupé finement","400 g de viande hachée végétalienne","1 gousse d''ail, finement hachée","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte d''harissa","une poignée de feuilles de persil plat","une poignée d''aneth frais","sel et poivre","100g de noix","400 g de poivrons rouges rôtis","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","Le jus d''un citron","1 cuillère à café de paprika","1 citron , coupé en quartiers","4 à 8 pains plats"]','["Dans une grande poêle, faire griller à sec les noix pendant environ 5 minutes à feu moyen, en secouant la poêle de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que les noix soient parfumées et grillées. Retirer de la poêle et réserver.","Dans la même poêle, faites chauffer les 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive à feu moyen et faites revenir l''oignon avec une généreuse pincée de sel et de poivre noir, en remuant souvent jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très tendre. Ajoutez le hachis et augmentez légèrement le feu. Cuire pendant 5 à 7 minutes, en remuant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit doré et croustillant. Ajoutez l''ail et faites cuire encore une minute, puis versez la harissa et mélangez. Retirer du feu et réserver.","En réservant 1 cuillère à soupe pour une garniture, mixez les noix grillées avec le reste des ingrédients du muhammara dans un mélangeur à grande vitesse, jusqu''à obtenir une sauce onctueuse. Goûtez et assaisonnez avec du sel et du poivre, puis étalez sur une grande assiette à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère.","Garnir la sauce avec la harissa hachée croustillante, parsemer du reste des noix et les hacher un peu si vous le souhaitez. Terminez avec des herbes fraîches, un filet supplémentaire d’huile d’olive et un trait de poivre noir. Servir avec des pains plats pour récupérer le tout ou avec du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:19:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12529,9372,'fr','Brochettes de poulet tikka à la friteuse','Utilisez votre friteuse à air pour préparer ces brochettes de poulet tikka. Dégustez-le sur des naans avec vos accompagnements préférés, comme un chutney de mangue, une raita, un cornichon au citron vert ou un bhaji émietté.','["3-4 poitrines de poulet (environ 600 g), coupées en bouchées","150 g de yaourt nature, plus un supplément pour servir (facultatif)","2 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry tikka masala","2 gousses d''ail écrasées ou finement râpées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et râpé","2 Grands Nans (nous avons utilisé des Nans ronds)","une poignée de coriandre hachée","votre choix de chutney de mangue, cornichon au citron vert, dés de concombre ou raita et bhaji émietté"]','["Mettez le poulet dans un bol avec le yaourt, la pâte de curry, l''ail et le gingembre. Mélangez le tout et laissez mariner au moins 20 minutes ou réservez au frais toute la nuit. Se conservera couvert et réfrigéré pendant une journée.","Chauffez la friteuse à air à 180°C. Enfilez le poulet sur des brochettes – il vous en faudra entre quatre et huit. Si votre friteuse à air est suffisamment grande pour contenir les brochettes les plus longues, utilisez-en quatre, sinon utilisez-en huit plus courtes ou coupez-les en deux. (Vous pouvez également faire frire le poulet en morceaux à l''air libre pendant 15 à 20 minutes, en le retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit bien cuit. Vous devrez peut-être le faire par lots.)","Réchauffez les naans en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage – le micro-ondes est une bonne option car il a tendance à les ramollir, ce qui est utile pour envelopper le poulet. Ou encore, arrosez les pains avec de l''eau, puis faites-les griller.","Servir les naans garnis de poulet, de coriandre hachée, d''un filet de yaourt si vous le souhaitez et des accompagnements de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:19:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12530,9373,'fr','dames complètes','Essayez cette brillante recette égyptienne du chef cuisinier du restaurant londonien Ombra. Fabriqué à partir de fèves, il est réduit en purée avec de l''ail, du citron et du tahini.','["Boîte de 400 g de fèves (disponibles en ligne) ou de fèves","1 petit oignon, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","100 ml d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de flocons de piment","2 grosses tomates mûres, hachées grossièrement (ou une boîte de 200 g de tomates concassées, si les tomates ne sont pas de saison)","½ citron, jus","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin"]','["Égoutter les haricots et rincer. Remplissez la boîte vide et propre avec de l''eau et versez-la dans une casserole avec les haricots. Portez-les à ébullition pour bien les réchauffer, puis retirez-les du feu.","Pendant ce temps, dans une autre poêle moyenne, faites revenir doucement l''oignon et l''ail dans quelques cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive pendant 5 minutes, puis ajoutez 2 cuillères à café de flocons de sel marin, le cumin, les flocons de piment et les tomates. Égoutter les haricots en réservant un peu du liquide de cuisson. Ajouter au mélange d''oignons et cuire à feu doux pendant 30 minutes en remuant souvent et en ajoutant un peu du liquide de cuisson s''il semble sec.","A l''aide d''un presse purée, écrasez les haricots avec le reste de l''huile d''olive, le jus de citron et le tahini. La consistance finale doit être une purée épaisse et moelleuse. S''il se fend légèrement, ajoutez une goutte d''eau froide."]','2026-01-11 00:19:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12531,9374,'fr','Kebabs kofta d''agneau irakien','Réalisez ces brochettes d''agneau avec des aubergines harissa. Le gagnant du Celebrity MasterChef UK 2020 partage la recette qui ramène son père dans son pays natal','["3 gousses d''ail écrasées ou râpées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et finement râpé","2 échalotes , hachées grossièrement","une petite poignée de persil haché grossièrement","2 brins de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre hachée","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de grenade","houmous, salade fattoush, pains plats et tzatziki, pour servir (facultatif)","6 petites aubergines","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","75g de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe de harissa"]','["Tout d’abord, préparez les aubergines. Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. Couper les aubergines en deux dans le sens de la longueur et entailler la chair dans le sens de la largeur en prenant soin de ne pas la couper complètement. Mélanger l''huile et le cumin dans un petit bol et bien assaisonner. Badigeonnez-en les aubergines. Rôtir pendant 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Retirer dans un plat.","Faites fondre le beurre dans une petite poêle et faites revenir la harissa avec une pincée de sel pendant quelques minutes. Versez-en un filet sur les aubergines cuites.","Pendant ce temps, mettez l''ail, le gingembre, les échalotes, le persil, la moitié de la menthe, le cumin, la coriandre, la cannelle, la purée de tomates et 1 cuillère à café de sel et de poivre noir fraîchement moulu dans un robot culinaire. Blitz jusqu''à ce que tout soit finement haché, environ 30 secondes.","Versez l''agneau dans un grand bol et ajoutez le mélange d''épices en remuant jusqu''à ce que tout soit bien mélangé. Si vous utilisez des brochettes de bambou, faites-les tremper pendant 15 minutes avant de continuer.","Formez des poignées grossières du mélange d''agneau en boulettes de viande et enfilez-les sur les brochettes. Roulez la viande dans vos mains pour l''aplatir en forme d''œuf. Continuez jusqu''à ce que tout le mélange ait été utilisé.","Chauffez le gril à feu vif et faites griller la kofta pendant environ 6 minutes, puis retournez-la et laissez cuire encore 6 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la viande soit bien cuite. Disposez la kofta sur les aubergines et parsemez-la du reste de graines de menthe, de coriandre et de grenade. Servir avec du houmous, de la salade fattoush, des pains plats et du tzatziki, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12532,9375,'fr','Pilaf aux épices dorées et échalotes croustillantes','Combinez des échalotes croustillantes, des épices réchauffantes, des noix croquantes et des fruits rouges pour préparer ce superbe pilaf. Servir seul avec du yaourt ou avec des légumes, de la viande ou du poisson','["250 g de riz basmati","25g de beurre","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale, plus un peu pour la friture","1 oignon , finement haché","2 gousses d''ail , hachées finement","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 petit bâton de cannelle","8 gousses de cardamome","1 anis étoilé","1 citron","600 ml de bouillon de légumes ou de poulet chaud, ou 1 cube de bouillon mélangé à l''eau chaude de la bouilloire","6 échalotes , pelées, coupées en deux et tranchées finement","50g de noix au choix (nous avons utilisé un mélange de noix de cajou, pistaches et amandes effilées)","200 g de yaourt nature","grosse pincée de safran","125 g de fruits secs de votre choix, comme des abricots, des canneberges ou des raisins secs","une poignée de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Versez le riz dans une casserole et couvrez d''eau tiède, puis laissez tremper 30 minutes.","Pendant ce temps, faites fondre le beurre dans une grande poêle à feu moyen, puis versez un filet d''huile et faites revenir l''oignon et l''ail pendant 8 à 10 minutes, en remuant jusqu''à ce que l''oignon soit translucide.","Incorporez le sol et les épices entières, faites-les grésiller dans le beurre et l''huile pendant 1 à 2 minutes, puis égouttez le riz et ajoutez-le à la poêle. Épluchez trois longues bandes de zeste du citron à l''aide d''un économe et déposez-les dans la poêle. Mélangez le tout, versez dessus le bouillon et portez à ébullition. Remuez à nouveau et couvrez, puis laissez mijoter encore 2 minutes. Éteignez le feu et laissez reposer, sans ouvrir le couvercle, pendant 15 minutes.","Versez 2 cm d''huile dans une poêle profonde ou un wok sur feu moyen et faites chauffer à 180 °C ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cube de pain brunisse en 20 secondes. Faites frire les échalotes en deux lots, en les faisant grésiller pendant 8 minutes par lot jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Cela prendra un certain temps et ils attraperont rapidement, alors surveillez attentivement pour éviter cela. Verser sur une assiette recouverte de papier absorbant à l''aide d''une écumoire, puis saupoudrer de sel et laisser refroidir légèrement.","Faire griller les noix dans une poêle sèche à feu moyen-doux pendant 2-3 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées. Mélangez le yaourt avec le safran et une pincée de sel dans un petit bol de service et réservez.","Découvrez le riz et vérifiez qu''il est prêt : il doit être tendre et tout le liquide doit avoir été absorbé. Sinon, couvrez et laissez reposer encore 5 minutes. Une fois cuits, remuez les grains à l''aide d''une fourchette et incorporez les noix et les fruits secs. Versez sur un plat de service en retirant au fur et à mesure les épices entières et le zeste de citron. Parsemer d''échalotes croustillantes et de feuilles de coriandre, puis servir avec le yaourt au safran en accompagnement."]','2026-01-11 00:19:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12533,9376,'fr','Agneau harissa mijoté','Essayez cet agneau harissa cuit lentement comme rôti alternatif. Nous adorons la texture – elle est à moitié rôtie et à moitié effilochée, tendre à la fourchette mais toujours facile à découper.','["2 kg de gigot d''agneau entier avec l''os","10 oignons rouges, coupés en deux","300 ml de bouillon de poulet","4 cuillères à soupe de coriandre hachée","20 piments séchés","6 gousses d''ail, râpées","100 ml d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de graines de carvi","2 cuillères à café de paprika fumé","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge"]','["Si vous préparez la harissa, versez les piments séchés dans un bol résistant à la chaleur et versez juste assez d''eau bouillie de la bouilloire pour couvrir. Couvrir le bol et laisser refroidir. Une fois suffisamment refroidis pour être manipulés, égouttez les piments en réservant l’eau. Retirez les tiges et séchez-les avec du papier absorbant. Versez les piments dans un robot culinaire avec l''ail, 1 cuillère à café de sel, l''huile d''olive, les épices et le vinaigre, et réduisez-les en purée. Si nécessaire, ajoutez un peu de l’eau réservée pour détendre. Se conserve au frais jusqu’à un mois.","Faites 15 coupes d''environ 3 à 5 cm de long sur tout l''agneau. Réservez 1 cuillère à soupe de pâte d''harissa, puis frottez le reste sur tout l''agneau et dans les coupes. Répartissez les oignons dans un plat à rôtir plus grand et posez l''agneau dessus. Laisser à température ambiante pendant 1 heure ou couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2. Rôtir l''agneau pendant 4 à 5 heures jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre à la fourchette. Soulevez l''agneau sur une grande planche ou une assiette de service. Si le moule est ignifuge, versez-y le bouillon ; sinon, versez d''abord le contenu du moule dans une casserole. Portez à ébullition, grattez les morceaux dorés à l''aide d''une cuillère en bois et faites cuire jusqu''à ce que le liquide soit réduit d''environ un tiers – ce devrait être une sauce à l''oignon épaisse et riche. Incorporer la harissa réservée et la coriandre hachée. Servir l''agneau avec la sauce à l''oignon."]','2026-01-11 00:19:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12534,9377,'fr','Pouding au chocolat et au caramel collant auto-sauce','Combinez une éponge de pudding au caramel collant avec une généreuse portion de morceaux de chocolat et de sauce au chocolat pour un dessert réconfortant ultime.','["200 g de dattes medjool dénoyautées","100 g de beurre doux, ramolli, plus un peu pour le plat","75 g de sucre démérara","75 g de cassonade foncée","2 gros œufs","250 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1 cuillère à soupe de levure chimique","100 g de chocolat noir haché grossièrement","glace à la vanille ou crème anglaise, pour servir","200 ml de crème fraîche","75 g de beurre doux, coupé en cubes","200 g de cassonade foncée","30g de cacao en poudre"]','["Mettez les dattes dans un bol et versez 300 ml d''eau bouillante. Laisser tremper 30 mn. Pendant ce temps, préparez la sauce en versant tous les ingrédients, une grosse pincée de sel et 300 ml d''eau bouillante dans une casserole, puis fouettez à feu moyen et laissez mijoter 2 min. Verser dans un pichet et laisser refroidir légèrement. Une fois les dattes trempées, utilisez un mixeur plongeant pour mixer les dattes et l''eau jusqu''à obtenir une pâte lisse. Laisser refroidir légèrement. Beurrer un plat profond de 35 x 25 cm.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Battre ensemble le beurre et le sucre pendant 3 minutes jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez les œufs, un à la fois, en battant entre chaque ajout. Incorporez la farine, le bicarbonate et la levure chimique ainsi qu''une pincée de sel. Une fois combiné, incorporez la purée de dattes, puis incorporez le chocolat noir. Versez la pâte à biscuit dans le plat préparé et étalez-la uniformément à l''aide du dos d''une cuillère. Versez uniformément la sauce au chocolat sur le dessus de la pâte.","Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit levé, puis laisser reposer 2 minutes. Servir tiède avec une grosse boule de glace ou une crème anglaise tiède."]','2026-01-11 00:19:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12535,9378,'fr','Pain végétalien aux dattes et au chocolat et pudding au beurre','Utilisez du lait de soja pour préparer ce délicieux pudding au pain végétalien. Les dattes, la cannelle et la vanille apportent toutes de la douceur, vous n''avez donc pas besoin d''ajouter beaucoup de sucre','["3 cuillères à soupe de farine de maïs","500 ml d''Alpro Soja Original","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ citron, zesté","½ cuillère à soupe de pâte de gousse de vanille","2 cuillères à soupe de sirop d''érable ou d''agave","huile sans saveur (comme de l''huile végétale), pour le plat","6 à 8 tranches de bloomer blanc végétalien rassis, coupées en deux en triangles","4 dattes Medjool, dénoyautées et tranchées finement","50 g de pépites de chocolat noir vegan","Yogourt nature Alpro, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez la farine de maïs, l''Alpro Soya Original, la cannelle, le zeste de citron, la vanille et le sirop d''érable dans une casserole et fouettez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse. Mettre à feu doux et cuire, en fouettant continuellement, pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange ait légèrement épaissi pour former une fine crème anglaise qui recouvre juste le dos d''une cuillère.","Huiler légèrement un plat allant au four d''environ 20 x 25 cm de large. Coupez les croûtes du pain, si vous le souhaitez, et disposez-les dans le plat en les superposant légèrement. Incorporez la plupart des dattes à la crème anglaise, puis versez sur le pain en pressant doucement le pain dans le mélange avec le dos d''une cuillère pour l''aider à absorber le liquide. Laisser tremper 15 min.","Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Répartir les pépites de chocolat et les dattes tranchées restantes sur le pouding au pain et cuire au four pendant 20-25 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient dorées et croustillantes sur les bords. Laisser reposer 10 minutes avant de servir avec une cuillerée de yaourt nature Alpro ou de glace sans produits laitiers, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12536,9379,'fr','Agneau à l''Azerbaïdjanaise aux abricots et châtaignes','Préparez ce ragoût d’agneau à l’avance et congelez-le pour les journées chargées ou pour recevoir. Avec des abricots, des châtaignes et des épices, c''est joliment aromatique','["pincée de safran","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile de tournesol ou d''arachide","800 g d''agneau braisé (comme l''épaule), débarrassé de l''excès de gras","2 gros oignons, hachés grossièrement","4 tomates italiennes, hachées grossièrement","2 gousses d''ail, hachées","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de piment de la Jamaïque","250 ml de bouillon d''agneau ou de poulet","100g d''abricots secs","125g de marrons cuits (en conserve ou sous vide)","½ citron, jus","½ cuillère à café de sumac","15 g de coriandre, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement"]','["Mettez le safran dans une tasse résistante à la chaleur et versez dessus 75 ml d''eau bouillante. Laisser agir 30 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que l''eau prenne une couleur jaune foncé.","Faites chauffer l’huile dans une casserole à fond épais et faites revenir l’agneau partout – vous devrez le faire par lots. Transférez l''agneau doré dans un bol à l''aide d''une écumoire pendant que vous poursuivez la cuisson du reste.","Faites revenir les oignons dans la graisse résiduelle dans la poêle à feu moyen-doux pendant 10 à 12 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et tendres. Ajoutez les tomates et l''ail et continuez à frire jusqu''à ce que les tomates soient tendres. Incorporer les épices et cuire quelques minutes, puis remettre l''agneau dans la poêle avec un peu d''assaisonnement. Versez le bouillon et l’eau infusée de safran. Portez juste sous ébullition, puis ajoutez les abricots, les châtaignes et un peu plus d''assaisonnement. Réduisez le feu et laissez mijoter, couvrez et laissez cuire à feu très doux pendant 1h-1h15 jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit tendre. A ce stade, l''agneau peut être congelé. Laisser d’abord refroidir complètement, puis transférer dans un récipient hermétique allant au congélateur. Se conserve au congélateur jusqu''à trois mois.","Pour servir aussitôt, incorporez le jus de citron, le sumac et la coriandre. Alternativement, si vous avez congelé l''agneau, décongelez-le au réfrigérateur pendant la nuit, puis transférez-le dans une casserole et faites chauffer doucement. Lorsqu''il est bien chaud, ajoutez le jus de citron, le sumac et la coriandre. Goûtez pour vérifier l''assaisonnement, puis servez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12537,9380,'fr','Smoothie carottes et orange','Commencez votre journée avec un smoothie vibrant à l’orange et à la carotte au petit-déjeuner. Avec de l''avoine et du gingembre ajoutés, il vous apportera de la vitamine C et comptera pour votre 5 par jour.','["2 carottes moyennes, pelées et grossièrement hachées ou râpées selon votre mixeur","2 oranges, pelées","Morceau de gingembre de 2 cm, râpé","2 cuillères à soupe d''avoine","100g de glace"]','["Versez tous les ingrédients dans un mixeur ou un appareil à smoothie et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse, en ajoutant 150 ml d''eau si le mélange est trop épais – modifiez la consistance à votre guise."]','2026-01-11 00:19:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12538,9381,'fr','Pouding au caramel collant à la mijoteuse','Laissez notre pudding collant à la mijoteuse cuire toute la journée pour qu''il soit prêt à être servi le soir avec de la crème glacée. Riche et gourmand, c''est le dessert réconfortant par excellence','["250 g de dattes dénoyautées et hachées","100 g de beurre, plus un peu pour la bassine","4 cuillères à soupe de mélasse","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","250 g de sucre mou roux clair","300 ml de crème fraîche","2 œufs légèrement battus","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","glace à la vanille, pour servir"]','["Mettez les dattes dans un bol résistant à la chaleur, couvrez de 150 ml d''eau bouillante et laissez tremper 30 minutes. Beurrer une bassine à pudding d''1 litre et tapisser le fond de papier sulfurisé.","Versez la moitié du beurre, la moitié de la mélasse, la vanille, 75 g de sucre et la crème dans une casserole sur feu moyen. Cuire 4 à 5 minutes en remuant jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous. Montez le feu, bouillonnez pendant 3 minutes, puis fouettez une pincée de sel. Versez un tiers de la sauce dans la bassine.","Battez ensemble le reste du beurre, la mélasse, le sucre et les œufs, puis incorporez la farine, le bicarbonate, ¼ cuillère à café de sel, les dattes et leur liquide de trempage. Verser dans la bassine et lisser la surface en laissant un espace de 1 cm à partir du haut. Couvrir d''une double couche de papier sulfurisé et de papier d''aluminium, en faisant un pli au milieu pour que le pud puisse se dilater. Fixez avec de la ficelle de cuisine.","Réglez la mijoteuse à basse température. Sit the basin inside, then add boiling water so it comes halfway up the basin. Couvrir et cuire 7 à 8 heures. Passez un couteau sur le pourtour du pudding et démoulez-le sur une assiette. Réchauffez le reste de la sauce et versez dessus. Servir avec de la glace."]','2026-01-11 00:19:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12539,9382,'fr','Sachets de thé Chaï','Remplissez les sachets de thé d''épices et de feuilles de thé pour un magnifique cadeau sur mesure. C''est un joli cadeau pour le Ramadan','["18 gousses de cardamome concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à soupe de poivre noir moulu","½ noix de muscade, râpée","¼ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","150 g de feuilles de thé noir Assam"]','["Faites griller les gousses de cardamome, le gingembre, la cannelle, le poivre, la muscade et les clous de girofle dans une poêle sèche pendant 1 minute.","Mélangez les épices dans un bol avec les feuilles de thé, puis remplissez 18 sachets de thé vides avec le mélange et fermez. Emballage avec instructions de service : Pour préparer un chai latte, infusez 1 sachet de thé dans 200 ml de lait entier bouilli ou de lait de coco pendant 5 minutes, puis sucrez avec du miel au goût. Ou simplement infuser avec de l’eau bouillante. Se conserve six mois dans un pot fermé."]','2026-01-11 00:19:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12540,9383,'fr','Poulet marocain au fenouil et aux olives','Obtenez quatre de vos 5 par jour avec notre tajine de poulet sain au fenouil et aux olives. Servir avec du couscous complet','["½ citron","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 gros oignon, finement haché","1 bulbe de fenouil, coupé en deux et tranché finement, frondes réservées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, haché finement","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées","4 filets de cuisse de poulet sans peau, coupés en deux et paré du gras","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","400 ml de bouillon de légumes chaud, préparé avec 2 cuillères à café de bouillon en poudre","2 tomates, coupées en quartiers","6 olives Kalamata ou vertes, dénoyautées et coupées en deux","généreuse poignée de coriandre hachée, plus un peu pour servir","70 g de couscous complet","400 g de pois chiches en boîte, égouttés et rincés"]','["Pressez le citron sur un bol et mettez le bol de côté. Coupez le citron en deux, retirez la peau d''une moitié et hachez le zeste.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive et faites revenir l''oignon, le fenouil, le gingembre et l''ail jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajoutez le poulet et faites-le revenir encore quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit juste doré.","Ajoutez le zeste de citron et les épices, puis versez le bouillon. Couvrir et laisser mijoter 25 min, puis ajouter les tomates, les olives, la coriandre et la moitié du jus de citron. Cuire encore 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que le fenouil et le poulet soient tendres et que la sauce soit réduite.","Pendant ce temps, faites cuire le couscous en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage et incorporez les pois chiches. Ajoutez plus de jus de citron selon votre goût, puis servez le tajine avec le couscous, la coriandre supplémentaire et les feuilles de fenouil."]','2026-01-11 00:19:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12541,9384,'fr','Fattoush halloumi & quinoa','Avec du halloumi grillé, des morceaux de pitta grillés, des céréales, des tomates, de l''aneth et de la menthe, cette salade d''inspiration moyen-orientale constitue un déjeuner rapide et satisfaisant pour quatre.','["2 pittas brunes, déchirées en morceaux","5 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 citrons, jus","1 gousse d''ail, écrasée","250 g de halloumi en bloc, tranché","250 g de quinoa micro-ondable","350 g de tomates moyennes coupées en quartiers","1 gros concombre, coupé en deux, épépiné et tranché","4 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","½ petit bouquet de menthe hachée","½ petit bouquet d''aneth, haché grossièrement"]','["Chauffer le gril à feu vif. Mélangez les morceaux de pitta avec 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile et étalez-les sur une plaque à pâtisserie. Griller pendant 3 à 4 minutes, en retournant à mi-cuisson, jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants. Laisser refroidir.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le reste de l''huile avec le jus de citron et l''ail, puis assaisonnez. Faites chauffer une grande poêle ou une poêle antiadhésive à feu vif et faites cuire le halloumi pendant 1 à 2 minutes de chaque côté ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit légèrement carbonisé.","Faites cuire le quinoa en suivant les instructions sur l''emballage, laissez-le refroidir, puis mélangez-le avec les tomates, le concombre, l''oignon nouveau, la plupart des herbes fraîches et la vinaigrette. Assaisonner au goût. Verser sur une assiette de service et garnir de halloumi, de pitta et du reste des herbes."]','2026-01-11 00:19:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12542,9385,'fr','Biryani d''agneau spécial','Classiquement, le biryani indien est cuit dans un « dum », un pot en argile scellé avec de la pâte. Essayez cette version à l''agneau avec un couvercle pâtissier qui libère les arômes lorsque vous le percez','["500 g de cou ou d''épaule d''agneau coupé en petits morceaux","3 cuillères à soupe de mélange d''épices indiennes, plus une pincée (voir ci-dessous)","100 g de yaourt, plus un peu pour servir","½ citron, jus","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","2 gros oignons, coupés en deux et tranchés","300 g de riz basmati","4 gousses d''ail, écrasées","morceau de gingembre de la taille d''un pouce, pelé et haché finement","4 tomates italiennes hachées ou une boîte de 200 g de tomates concassées","une bonne pincée de safran","100g de beurre","2 bâtons de cannelle","6 gousses de cardamome","4 feuilles de laurier ou 6 feuilles de curry","Anis étoilé 2","320 g de pâte feuilletée toute prête","1 œuf battu","2 cuillères à café de graines de nigelle","une poignée de coriandre ou de menthe hachée","1 oignon rouge, coupé en deux et émincé","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de coriandre","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de paprika doux","2 cuillères à café de poudre de piment doux (poudre de piment du Cachemire si vous en trouvez)","2 cuillères à café de graines de fenugrec","3 clous de girofle entiers","1 cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","1 cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","10 gousses de cardamome, graines enlevées et gousses jetées"]','["Mélangez l''agneau avec le mélange d''épices, le yaourt, le jus de citron et une pincée de sel. Laisser à température ambiante pendant au moins 30 minutes ou réfrigérer toute la nuit.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile dans une grande poêle et faites revenir les oignons à feu doux-moyen pendant 15 à 20 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient caramélisés. Pendant ce temps, rincez le riz trois fois sous l''eau froide. Égoutter, puis couvrir d''eau fraîche et laisser reposer 30 min.","Transférez les oignons dans un bol, ajoutez le reste de l''huile dans la poêle et faites dorer l''agneau par lots. Si la marinade commence à prendre, grattez-la du fond de la casserole et continuez à remuer – cela ajoutera de la saveur. Remettez la viande dans la poêle avec l''ail et le gingembre. Cuire encore une minute ou 2, puis ajouter les tomates et 200 ml d''eau (faire couler l''eau autour du plat dans lequel l''agneau marinait pour récupérer toute la marinade avant de l''ajouter à la poêle). Assaisonner de sel et porter à légère ébullition. Couvrir et laisser cuire 45 minutes en remuant de temps en temps et en arrosant d''un peu d''eau si la sauce accroche. Vous pouvez maintenant réfrigérer l''agneau jusqu''à deux jours.","Videz l''eau de riz, couvrez d''eau fraîche et assaisonnez. Portez à ébullition, bouillonnez 2 min, puis égouttez et laissez refroidir. Mettez le safran dans un bol, versez dessus 50 ml d''eau bouillante et laissez infuser 10 minutes.","Étalez 50 g de beurre dans une cocotte. Saupoudrer d''un peu du mélange d''épices indiennes et d''un peu de sel. Pour assembler le biryani, commencez avec 1/3 de l''agneau, complétez avec 1/3 du riz, 1/3 des oignons, un bâton de cannelle, quelques gousses de cardamome, quelques feuilles de laurier ou de curry et une anis étoilé. Répétez jusqu’à ce que tous les ingrédients soient épuisés. Versez le safran et son eau sur la dernière couche de riz, parsemez du reste de beurre et assaisonnez de sel. Vous pouvez maintenant le réfrigérer jusqu''à 24 heures.","Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Dérouler la pâte et découper un cercle un peu plus grand que le plat. Badigeonnez d''un peu d''œuf le contour extérieur du plat, puis soulevez la pâte par-dessus en la pressant sur le pourtour pour la sceller. Badigeonner avec plus d''œuf et saupoudrer de graines de nigelle. Cuire au four pendant 45 à 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Mélangez les herbes et l''oignon et servez avec le biryani et du yaourt supplémentaire."]','2026-01-11 00:19:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12543,9386,'fr','Tajine de poulet aux citrons, olives et grenade','Cuisinez un tajine de poulet en une seule casserole que toute la famille adorera. Il évoque en quelque sorte l''été et l''automne en une seule bouchée en utilisant un mélange d''épices marocaines douces mais enivrantes.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","8 cuisses de poulet","1 oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail","2 cuillères à soupe de mélange d''épices marocaines (voir ci-dessous)","1 gros ou 2 petits citrons confits, peau seulement, hachés finement","2 grosses tomates hachées","1 cube de bouillon de poulet","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","1 cuillère à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","poignée d''olives","1 petit citron, ½ tranché très finement","½ grenade, graines seulement","100 g de feta émiettée","petit bouquet de menthe, feuilles seulement","couscous, pour servir","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de coriandre","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","1½ cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","½ cuillère à café de poivre noir","¼ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","1 cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","une bonne pincée de safran"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une cocotte large et peu profonde ou une poêle allant au four. Assaisonner le poulet et cuire, peau vers le bas, pendant 8 à 10 minutes, jusqu''à ce qu''il soit croustillant. Retourner et cuire encore 5 minutes. Transférer dans une assiette. Chauffer le four à 170C/150C ventilateur/gaz 3.","Ajoutez le reste de l''huile et l''oignon dans la poêle. Remuer quelques minutes, puis ajouter le mélange d''ail et d''épices marocaines. Remuer en grattant les morceaux d''oignons et de poulet du fond, jusqu''à ce que les épices sentent bon. Ajoutez le citron confit, les tomates, le cube de bouillon, le miel, le vinaigre et 750 ml d''eau. Portez à ébullition, puis déposez le poulet dessus. Couvrir avec un couvercle ou du papier d''aluminium et transférer au four pendant 1 heure.","Découvrez, déposez dessus les olives et les tranches de citron et arrosez les citrons d''un peu d''huile. Remettez au four pendant 20 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que la sauce ait un peu réduit (vous pouvez le faire sur le feu si vous manquez de temps). Vérifiez l''assaisonnement en ajoutant un filet de citron, plus de miel ou de sel si vous pensez en avoir besoin. Répartir sur les graines de grenade, la feta et la menthe et servir avec du couscous."]','2026-01-11 00:19:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12544,9387,'fr','Houmous aux boulettes d''agneau à la pistache','Transformez un simple houmous du commerce avec ces fabuleuses boulettes de viande garnies de pistaches et de menthe. Cela ne prend que 15 minutes à préparer, mais a un goût si décadent','["250 g de viande hachée d''agneau","½ petit bouquet de menthe, plus quelques feuilles de menthe pour garnir","30 g de pistaches, plus quelques-unes pour garnir","1 citron, zesté","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","Pot de 200 g de houmous nature","30 g de feta émiettée"]','["Mettez le hachis d''agneau, la menthe et les pistaches dans un robot culinaire. Mélangez grossièrement, puis ajoutez le zeste de citron et assaisonnez généreusement de sel et de poivre. Façonner huit boulettes de viande.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle. Faites frire les boulettes de viande pendant 8 à 10 minutes, en les retournant pour qu''elles soient uniformément dorées. Étalez le houmous dans une assiette. Garnir de boulettes de viande, de quelques feuilles de menthe, de feta émiettée, de quelques pistaches hachées et d''un filet de jus de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:19:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12545,9388,'fr','Tajine d''agneau à la mijoteuse','Cuisinez quelque chose de copieux et d’exotique pour la famille lorsqu’il fait froid dehors, comme notre tajine d’agneau. Si vous ne pouvez pas obtenir de cerises séchées, utilisez plutôt des abricots ou des pruneaux.','["900 g d''épaule, de cou ou de gigot d''agneau coupé en morceaux","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 oignon, haché","3 carottes, coupées en morceaux","2 cuillères à café de sp-el-hanout","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","1 cube de bouillon de poulet ou d''agneau ou une marmite","1 patate douce, coupée en morceaux","30g de cerises séchées","½ cuillère à café de miel","½ bouquet de coriandre hachée","couscous, pour servir"]','["Faites frire l''agneau dans l''huile par lots et versez-le dans la mijoteuse. Faites revenir l''oignon dans la même poêle pendant 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il ramollisse un peu. Ajoutez les carottes et les épices, mélangez le tout, ajoutez le concentré de tomates, le bouillon et 250 ml d''eau et remuez le tout dans la poêle. Versez dans la mijoteuse. Ajoutez la patate douce, les cerises séchées, le miel et encore 500 ml d''eau.","Cuire à feu doux pendant 8 heures ou à feu vif pendant 4 heures. Incorporer la coriandre et servir avec du couscous. Laisser refroidir avant de congeler."]','2026-01-11 00:19:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12546,9389,'fr','Biryani d''agneau','Préparez ce plat indien classique et préparez un agneau délicieusement moelleux avec du paneer, du riz et des épinards, le tout épicé à la perfection. Idéal pour se divertir occasionnellement','["400 g de cou d''agneau coupé en petits cubes","4 gousses d''ail, râpées","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre finement râpé","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de tournesol","1 gros oignon, haché","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de nigelle","1 cuillère à soupe de pâte d''épices Madras","200 g de riz basmati bien rincé","8 feuilles de curry","400 ml de bouillon d''agneau ou de poulet de bonne qualité","100 g de paner haché","200 g d''épinards cuits et essorés","coriandre hachée","piments verts tranchés","yaourt nature"]','["Mélanger l''agneau dans un bol avec l''ail, le gingembre et une grosse pincée de sel. Laisser mariner au réfrigérateur toute la nuit ou au moins quelques heures.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une cocotte. Faites frire l''agneau pendant 5 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer. Ajoutez l''oignon, les graines de cumin et les graines de nigelle et laissez cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Incorporer la pâte de curry, puis cuire encore 1 min. Répartir le riz et les feuilles de curry, puis verser sur le bouillon et porter à ébullition. Pendant ce temps, chauffez le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4.","Incorporer le paner, les épinards et un peu d''assaisonnement. Couvrez le plat avec un couvercle hermétique en papier d''aluminium, puis mettez le couvercle pour vous assurer qu''il est bien scellé. Cuire au four pendant 20 min, puis laisser reposer à couvert pendant 10 min. Apportez le plat à table, retirez le couvercle et le papier d''aluminium, parsemez de coriandre et de piments et servez avec du yaourt à part."]','2026-01-11 00:19:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12547,9390,'fr','Biryani à la butternut et raita de concombre','Cuisinez notre curry végétarien sain avec des champignons séchés, des épices et de la courge musquée. Il contient trois de vos 5 par jour ainsi que du calcium, du fer et des fibres.','["20 g de cèpes séchés, hachés grossièrement","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","2 oignons tranchés (160g)","2 gousses d''ail, râpées","1 cuillère à soupe de gingembre frais haché","1 piment rouge épépiné et haché","85 g de riz basmati brun","160 g de courge butternut coupée en dés (poids préparé)","1 cuillère à café de graines de cumin","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de bouillon de légumes","Concombre de 10 cm de longueur, râpé, noyau retiré","125g de yaourt bio","2 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée et quelques feuilles","un tiers de paquet de coriandre fraîche hachée","25 g d''amandes effilées grillées"]','["Versez 425 ml d''eau bouillante sur les champignons séchés et réservez.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive. Ajoutez les oignons, l''ail, le gingembre et le piment et faites sauter brièvement à feu vif pour qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez le riz et la courge et remuez pendant quelques minutes. Ajoutez le cumin et la coriandre puis incorporez les champignons et leur eau avec le bouillon.","Couvrir la poêle et laisser mijoter 20 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre. Pendant ce temps, mélangez le concombre et le yaourt avec la menthe pour faire une raita. Incorporez la coriandre et les amandes au riz lorsqu''il est prêt et servez avec la raita et quelques feuilles supplémentaires de menthe ou de coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:19:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12548,9391,'fr','Biryani d''agneau et de courge avec raita de concombre','Cuisinez notre curry d''agneau sain avec de la courge musquée pour un dîner savoureux et copieux. Il est faible en calories, riche en fer et fournit trois de vos 5 par jour','["4 steaks d''agneau maigres (environ 400 g), débarrassés de tout gras, coupés en morceaux","2 gousses d''ail, finement râpées","8 cuillères à café de gingembre frais haché","3 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","4 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","4 oignons, tranchés","2 piments rouges épépinés et hachés","170 g de riz basmati brun","320 g de courge butternut coupée en dés","2 cuillères à café de graines de cumin","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","Concombre de 20 cm de longueur, râpé","100 ml de yaourt bio","4 cuillères à soupe de menthe hachée et quelques feuilles supplémentaires","une poignée de coriandre hachée"]','["Mélangez l''agneau avec l''ail, 2 cuillères à café de gingembre haché et 1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue et réservez.","Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive. Ajoutez les oignons, le reste du gingembre et du piment et faites sauter brièvement à feu vif pour qu''ils commencent à ramollir. Ajoutez le riz et la courge et remuez sur le feu pendant quelques minutes. Versez toutes les épices restantes, puis incorporez 500 ml d''eau bouillante et le bouillon. Couvrez la poêle et laissez mijoter 20 min.","Pendant ce temps, mélangez le concombre, le yaourt et la menthe dans un bol pour faire une raita. Réfrigérez la moitié pour plus tard.","Environ 5 minutes avant que le riz soit prêt, faites chauffer le reste de l''huile dans une poêle antiadhésive, ajoutez l''agneau et remuez pendant quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré mais encore bien tendre. Incorporer le riz épicé avec la coriandre et servir avec la raita et quelques feuilles de menthe ou de coriandre sur le dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:19:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12549,9392,'fr','Salade égyptienne aux œufs','Donnez un nouveau souffle à la salade avec une recette d''inspiration égyptienne qui combine des fèves avec de l''œuf et les riches saveurs du tahini, de l''ail, du citron et du cumin.','["2 gros œufs","1 citron, jus","1 cuillère à soupe de tahin","1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza","1 oignon rouge, haché","3 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","Boîte de 400 g de borlotti ou de fèves, jus réservé","2 laitues Little Gem coupées en quartiers","2 tomates, coupées en quartiers","saupoudrer de flocons de piment séché et de persil plat grossièrement haché, facultatif"]','["Portez une casserole d''eau à ébullition, plongez-y les œufs et faites bouillir pendant 8 minutes. Égouttez-les et passez-les sous le robinet froid pour les refroidir un peu, puis épluchez-les et coupez-les en deux. Pendant ce temps, mélangez 1 cuillère à soupe de jus de citron et 3 cuillères à soupe d''eau avec le tahini pour faire une vinaigrette.","Faites chauffer l''huile et faites revenir l''oignon et l''ail pendant 5 minutes pour les ramollir. Ajoutez le cumin moulu et les graines, remuez brièvement puis ajoutez les haricots et écrasez-en légèrement quelques-uns pendant que vous les chauffez, en ajoutant un peu du jus de la boîte pour obtenir une belle consistance crémeuse mais en gardant aussi les haricots entiers. Goûtez et ajoutez du jus de citron et juste un peu d''assaisonnement si nécessaire.","Répartir les haricots dans des assiettes avec la laitue, puis ajouter les œufs et les tomates, la vinaigrette au tahini, le piment et le persil, le cas échéant."]','2026-01-11 00:19:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12550,9393,'fr','Tajine de courge musquée et pois chiches','Réalisez ce savoureux tajine végétarien que les enfants adoreront autant que les grands. C''est une excellente façon de servir quatre de leurs cinq par jour et c''est congelable','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile","1 oignon rouge, finement haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à café de gingembre râpé","½ cuillère à café de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à café de coriandre moulue","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","¼ cuillère à café de poudre de piment doux","500 g de morceaux de courge butternut surgelés","2 carottes coupées en petits dés","1 courgette coupée en petits dés","2 boîtes de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 boîte de 400 g de pois chiches égouttés","couscous ou riz cuit, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à fond épais, puis faites revenir lentement les oignons pendant environ 10 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent à caraméliser. Incorporer l''ail, le gingembre et les épices et cuire encore 2 minutes. Ajouter les légumes et les tomates en conserve et porter à ébullition. Mettez le couvercle et laissez mijoter environ 15 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que tous les légumes soient tendres. Incorporer les pois chiches, réchauffer et servir avec du couscous ou du riz."]','2026-01-11 00:19:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12551,9394,'fr','Koftas épicés au miel et aux pois chiches','Les koftas d''agneau épicés sont une excellente option économique pour un repas simple en famille. Servir avec un filet de vinaigrette crémeuse au yaourt et des pois chiches cuits au four.','["1 ½ cuillère à café de graines de fenouil","500 g de viande hachée d''agneau","1 ½ cuillère à soupe de ras el hanout","2 cuillères à soupe de pignons de pin grillés et hachés grossièrement","2 boîtes de 40 g de pois chiches égouttés et rincés","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","80 g de yaourt grec","2 cuillères à soupe de tahin","1 citron, ½ pressé, ½ coupé en quartiers pour servir","25 g de persil haché grossièrement pour servir"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz. 4. A l''aide d''un pilon et d''un mortier, écraser les graines de fenouil. Dans un grand bol, mélanger les graines concassées, l''agneau, le ras el hanout et les pignons de pin, et bien assaisonner. Divisez le mélange en huit koftas égaux en forme d''œuf.","Versez les pois chiches dans un plat allant au four, assaisonnez selon votre goût et enfournez pendant que vous faites frire les koftas. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen. Ajoutez les koftas et faites-les revenir doucement pendant 5 minutes, en les retournant de temps en temps, jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient uniformément dorées. Retirer de la poêle avec une écumoire et réserver sur une assiette.","Sortez les pois chiches du four, ajoutez les koftas dans le plat, puis versez dessus le reste de l''huile et le miel, et remettez au four pour 15 min.","Dans un bol, mélanger le yaourt, le tahini et le jus de citron avec 70 à 100 ml d''eau et bien assaisonner. Servir les koftas et les pois chiches garnis de persil et d''un bon filet de vinaigrette crémeuse, accompagnés de quartiers de citron."]','2026-01-11 00:19:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12552,9395,'fr','Tarte à l''agneau épicée','Cette superbe tarte en pâte filo est une variante d''un tajine d''agneau. Un repas principal copieux qui ne déparerait pas sur n''importe quelle table de dîner','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","800 g d''épaule d''agneau dégraissée, coupée en dés","3 cuillères à soupe de farine nature","1 gros oignon, haché","2 gousses d''ail, écrasées","1 cuillère à soupe de ras el hanout","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","2 cuillères à café de cumin moulu","une bonne pincée de clous de girofle moulus","une bonne pincée de safran (facultatif)","1 bâton de cannelle","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 citron, zesté et pressé","1 cuillère à soupe de miel","4 cuillères à soupe de mélasse de grenade","Paquet de 270 g de pâte filo (4 à 6 feuilles)","50 g de beurre fondu","50g d''amandes effilées","50g de graines de grenade"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande cocotte ignifuge. Mélangez l''agneau dans la farine avec un peu d''assaisonnement, puis faites-le dorer dans le plat. Faites-le par lots afin de ne pas surcharger le plat (ce qui ferait cuire la viande à la vapeur au lieu de la frire). Prenez votre temps pour obtenir une couleur brun foncé, qui ajoutera beaucoup de saveur de viande au ragoût. Réservez la viande dans une assiette au fur et à mesure.","Ajouter le reste de l''huile dans le plat avec l''oignon et l''ail. Cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à tendreté, puis incorporer les épices, les tomates, le zeste et le jus de citron, le miel et la mélasse. Remplissez la boîte de tomates à moitié avec de l''eau, versez-la et ajoutez-la également. Assaisonnez bien, portez à ébullition et couvrez avec un couvercle. Réduire le feu et cuire 2 h 30 à 3 h ou jusqu''à ce que la viande soit tendre. Laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Transférer la viande dans un plat à tarte d''environ 25 cm de large, ou la laisser dans la cocotte si elle est suffisamment large pour contenir la garniture. Déballez la pâte filo et badigeonnez une feuille de beurre, froissez-la et placez-la sur la tarte. Continuez avec les feuilles restantes jusqu''à ce que le tajine soit recouvert. Versez le reste du beurre sur le dessus et répartissez-le sur les amandes, puis faites cuire au four pendant 45 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que la pâte soit croustillante et dorée. Répartissez les graines de grenade juste avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12553,9396,'fr','Feta au four avec sumac et raisins','Une entrée de dîner moderne, idéale pour un budget limité : la feta salée, les raisins sucrés, le sumac piquant et l''aneth anisé créent des saveurs contrastées mais complémentaires.','["1 petit oignon rouge, coupé en deux et tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de vinaigre de vin rouge","1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre doré","350 g de raisins rouges laissés sur la vigne en petites grappes","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 cuillères à café de sumac","½ petit paquet d''aneth, haché","2 blocs de feta de 250 g","pain ou pains plats au sésame, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez l''oignon rouge dans un bol et ajoutez le vinaigre, le sucre et une pincée de sel. Massez le tout avec vos doigts pendant 1 minute – cela fera légèrement mariner les oignons. Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6.","Froissez une feuille de papier sulfurisé et utilisez-la pour tapisser un plat à gratin. Ajoutez les raisins, arrosez d''1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive, 1 cuillère à café de sumac, la majeure partie de l''aneth et un peu d''assaisonnement, puis mélangez le tout pour enrober. Placez les blocs de feta parmi les raisins, puis répartissez-les sur les oignons et le vinaigre de marinade, le reste de l''huile et le sumac. Vous pouvez maintenant laisser au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 24 heures ou cuire immédiatement.","Cuire au four pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce que la feta soit dorée et que les raisins soient juteux. Répartissez le reste d''aneth, puis servez au milieu de la table avec du pain pour récupérer le fromage, les raisins et les jus."]','2026-01-11 00:19:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12554,9397,'fr','Fattoush de racines rôties','Nous avons donné à cette salade de pain classique du Moyen-Orient une cure de jouvence hivernale avec des légumes-racines rôtis d''un bon rapport qualité-prix et une riche vinaigrette au yaourt au beurre brun.','["2 navets, pelés et coupés en quartiers","4 panais, pelés et coupés en quartiers dans le sens de la longueur","1 rutabaga, pelé et coupé en quartiers","2 cuillères à soupe de dukkah, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","4 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","3 douleurs pitta","½ cuillère à soupe de sumac","gros paquet de persil, haché grossièrement","petit paquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement","1 piment rouge, tranché finement, épépiné si vous ne l''aimez pas trop piquant","100 g de graines de grenade","75g de beurre","1 citron, jus","200 g de yaourt nature"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C ventilateur/gaz 6. Mélanger les légumes-racines dans le dukkah et 2 cuillères à soupe d''huile et bien assaisonner. Répartir sur deux plaques à pâtisserie et rôtir pendant 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''il soit tendre et commence à carboniser.","Pendant ce temps, déchirez les pittas en morceaux et enrobez-les de sumac, du reste de l''huile et d''un peu d''assaisonnement. Mettez sur une plaque à pâtisserie, faites rôtir pendant 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et croustillants, puis réservez.","Pour la vinaigrette, faites fondre le beurre dans une casserole à feu doux et faites cuire lentement jusqu''à ce qu''il soit brun noisette, environ 8 minutes. Versez aussitôt le jus de citron et laissez refroidir. Une fois refroidi, incorporez le yaourt.","Assemblez les légumes rôtis sur une assiette à partager avec les herbes et le pitta, puis parsemez-les de piment et de graines de grenade. Arroser d''un peu de vinaigrette et servir le reste à côté."]','2026-01-11 00:19:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12555,9398,'fr','Tajine de boulettes de viande épicées, boulgour et pois chiches','Qui aurait cru que les boulettes de viande pouvaient représenter 4 de vos 5 par jour ? Ce tajine sain est plein de saveur et faible en gras, assurez-vous simplement de choisir un hachis maigre avec 5 % de matières grasses.','["2 oignons, 1 en quartiers, 1 coupé en deux et tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de purée de tomates","2 gousses d''ail","1 oeuf","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de piment","Paquet de 500 g de bœuf haché extra-maigre","2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza","4 grosses carottes, coupées en bâtonnets","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","1 citron, le zeste retiré avec un épluche-pomme de terre, puis haché","12 olives Kalamata, hachées","1 cuillère à soupe de poudre de bouillon de légumes","? emballer de la coriandre fraîche, hachée","200 g de boulgar de blé","400 g de pois chiches en boîte","2 cuillères à café de bouillon de légumes en poudre","2 cuillères à café de coriandre moulue"]','["Mettez l''oignon coupé en quartiers dans le robot culinaire et mixez-le pour le hacher finement. Ajoutez le bœuf haché, 1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates, l''ail, l''œuf et la poudre de piment et mixez pour obtenir une pâte onctueuse. Divisez le mélange en 26 morceaux de taille égale et roulez en boules.","Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande poêle et faites cuire les boulettes de viande pendant environ 5 à 10 minutes pour les faire légèrement dorer. Verser du moule sur une assiette.","Ajoutez maintenant l''oignon émincé et les carottes dans la poêle et faites revenir brièvement dans le jus de la poêle pour les ramollir un peu. Ajoutez les épices et versez les tomates avec 1 ½ boîte d''eau puis incorporez le zeste de citron haché, le reste de la purée de tomates, les olives et la poudre de bouillon. Remettez les boulettes de viande dans la poêle puis couvrez et laissez cuire 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que les carottes soient juste tendres. Incorporer la coriandre.","Pendant que le tajine cuit, versez le boulghar dans une casserole avec les pois chiches et l''eau de la conserve. Ajoutez 2 bidons d''eau, le bouillon et la coriandre. Couvrir et cuire 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que le boulghar soit tendre et que le liquide soit absorbé. Servir la moitié avec la moitié du tajine et réfrigérer le reste pour une autre nuit si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12556,9399,'fr','Tajine de poulet aux choux de Bruxelles épicés et feta','La savoureuse recette de pousses de Joe Wicks équilibre les saveurs terreuses, sucrées et épicées, en utilisant de tendres cuisses de poulet, des pois chiches et du fromage pour un ragoût festif copieux.','["1 ½ cuillère à soupe d''huile de coco","1 gros oignon rouge, tranché","1 poivron rouge, finement tranché","3 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","10 filets de cuisse de poulet (désossés et sans peau)","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","½ cuillère à café de paprika fumé","1 cuillère à soupe de purée de tomates","250 ml de bouillon de poulet","6 abricots secs, coupés en deux","175 g de pois chiches en conserve, égouttés et rincés","½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","275 g de choux de Bruxelles, râpés","50g de féta","½ petit bouquet de coriandre hachée grossièrement"]','["Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de noix de coco dans une grande cocotte anti-flamme à feu moyen. Une fois fondu et chaud, ajoutez l''oignon, le poivron et l''ail. Cuire, en remuant régulièrement, pendant 3 à 4 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il commence tout juste à ramollir. Augmentez le feu au maximum et ajoutez les cuisses de poulet. Faites frire le tout pendant environ 3 minutes en remuant de temps en temps.","Saupoudrer d''épices, presser le concentré de tomates et faire revenir 1 min en remuant presque constamment. Versez le bouillon et portez à ébullition. Réduire le feu et laisser mijoter et couvrir partiellement avec un couvercle. Au bout de 30 minutes, ajoutez les abricots secs et les pois chiches et laissez mijoter encore 10 minutes.","Pendant que le tajine bouillonne, faites chauffer la 1/2 cuillère à soupe d''huile de coco restante dans une poêle à feu vif. Une fois fondues, ajoutez les graines de cumin, faites griller pendant 10 secondes, puis ajoutez les pousses râpées. Faites frire les pousses à feu vif, en remuant presque constamment, pendant 5 minutes, après quoi elles devraient avoir ramolli et doré par endroits.","Servir le tajine dans un grand bol, parsemer de pousses frites, émietter sur la feta et terminer par la coriandre."]','2026-01-11 00:19:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12557,9400,'fr','Tajine d''agneau et canneberges','Il s’agit d’une marmite parfumée qui permet à votre four de faire tout le travail difficile. Si vous recevez Noël, servez ce succulent agneau avec du couscous et du yaourt','["1½ kg d''épaule d''agneau, débarrassée de l''excès de gras, puis coupée en cubes","1 cuillère à soupe de cumin moulu","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre","1 cuillère à café de paprika doux","1 cuillère à café de paprika fort","3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 gros oignons rouges, coupés en demi-lunes","4 gousses d''ail, hachées finement","2 bâtons de cannelle, cassés en deux","6 gousses de cardamome légèrement écrasées","Boîte de 400 g de tomates concassées","2 cuillères à soupe de miel","200 g de canneberges fraîches ou surgelées","50 g de pistaches décortiquées, grillées et hachées grossièrement, pour servir","yaourt nature, poignée de feuilles de menthe et couscous, pour servir"]','["Au moins 3 heures avant (ou de préférence une journée), mélangez l''agneau avec la moitié du cumin, de la coriandre et du paprika doux et piquant dans un grand bol. Couvrir et laisser infuser au réfrigérateur.","Chauffer le four à 160°C/140°C chaleur tournante/gaz 3. Faites chauffer 1 cuillère à soupe d''huile dans une grande cocotte antiflamme à feu vif et assaisonnez bien l''agneau épicé. En travaillant par lots, faites frire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient complètement dorés, puis réservez. Ajoutez plus d’huile selon vos besoins et obtenez une couleur profonde sur la viande – cela ajoutera à la saveur du tajine.","Une fois l''agneau doré, versez le reste de l''huile dans le plat, réduisez le feu à moyen et ajoutez les oignons, l''ail et le reste des épices moulues. Cuire 5 minutes jusqu''à tendreté, puis incorporer les bâtons de cannelle et les gousses de cardamome. Remettez l''agneau dans le plat avec les tomates, plus 1/2 boîte d''eau et le miel. Portez à ébullition, assaisonnez, couvrez et enfournez pour 2h15.","Sortez le tajine du four, remuez bien et versez les canneberges. Remettre au four, sans le couvercle, pendant encore 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''agneau soit complètement tendre.","Goûtez le tajine pour l''assaisonnement et retirez les bâtons de cannelle et les gousses de cardamome. Répartir dessus les pistaches, le yaourt et les feuilles de menthe, puis servir hors du plat à table avec du couscous."]','2026-01-11 00:19:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12558,9401,'fr','Baklava aux noisettes','Notre version de cette pâtisserie imbibée de sirop est légèrement épicée de cannelle et de cardamome et contient un mélange de pacanes, de pistaches et de noix.','["200 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","200g de pistaches","50g de noix","50 g de noix de pécan","3 cuillères à soupe de miel","2 paquets de 270 g de pâte filo","250 g de sucre en poudre doré","50g de miel","2 cuillères à café d''eau de fleur d''oranger","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","¼ cuillère à café de cardamome moulue (à partir de 3 gousses)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et graisser un moule à cake carré de 21 cm x 21 cm avec du beurre. Coupez les noix en petits morceaux à l''aide d''un robot culinaire, en prenant soin de ne pas les réduire en pâte. Mettez-les dans un bol, ajoutez le miel et une pincée de sel et réservez.","Faire fondre le beurre dans une poêle à feu doux. Coupez le premier paquet de feuilles de pâte filo en deux (pour qu''elles s''adaptent au moule). Mettez une feuille dans le moule et badigeonnez de beurre fondu. Posez une autre feuille sur le dessus et badigeonnez à nouveau de beurre, continuez à superposer ainsi jusqu''à ce que tout le paquet soit épuisé.","Étalez le mélange de miel et de noix sur la pâte et pressez-la légèrement avec le dos d''une cuillère. Ouvrez l''autre paquet de filo, coupez-le en deux et continuez le processus de superposition et de beurrage. Lorsque vous atteignez la dernière feuille, versez le beurre restant sur le dessus pour terminer. Utilisez un couteau bien aiguisé pour découper des lignes profondes dans la pâte afin de créer des carrés ou des losanges, puis faites cuire au four pendant 20 minutes.","Réduisez le feu à 150°C/130°C chaleur tournante/gaz 2 et enfournez encore 45 minutes. Pendant que les baklava cuisent, mettez tous les ingrédients du sirop dans une casserole et ajoutez 200 ml d''eau. Faites chauffer doucement jusqu''à ce que le sucre soit dissous, puis faites bouillir le mélange pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il ait réduit à la consistance d''un miel qui coule.","Lorsque le baklava sort du four, versez le sirop tiède dessus en le laissant couler jusqu''aux lignes que vous avez découpées. Laissez-le tremper et servez-le lorsqu’il est complètement froid."]','2026-01-11 00:19:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12559,9402,'fr','Fattouche de poulet','Cette salade saine du Moyen-Orient garnie de pain pitta saupoudré de sumac est un déjeuner ou un dîner rapide et facile.','["jus de 2 citrons","2 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","1 laitue Cos, hachée","2 tomates coupées en morceaux","petit paquet de persil plat, haché","½ concombre, coupé en morceaux","Paquet de 200 g de morceaux de poulet cuits (ou restes de poulet cuit)","2 oignons nouveaux, tranchés","2 douleurs pitta","1-2 cuillères à café de sumac moulu"]','["Versez le jus de citron dans un grand bol et fouettez pendant que vous ajoutez lentement l''huile. Lorsque toute l’huile a été ajoutée et que le mélange commence à épaissir, assaisonnez.","Ajouter la laitue, les tomates, le persil, le concombre, les morceaux de poulet et les oignons nouveaux, et bien mélanger pour bien enrober la salade de vinaigrette.","Mettez les pains pitta dans le grille-pain jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient croustillants et dorés, puis coupez-les en morceaux. Répartissez les morceaux de pitta grillés sur la salade et saupoudrez de sumac. Servir immédiatement."]','2026-01-11 00:19:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12560,9403,'fr','Baklava à la rose','Servez des carrés sucrés et collants de cette pâtisserie fourrée à la cannelle et aux amandes comme dessert léger pour terminer un dîner grec ou un rôti du dimanche.','["Yaourt grec, pour servir","300 g de sucre en poudre doré","jus ½ citron","4 cuillères à soupe d''eau de rose (non concentrée, voir astuce)","1 gros bâton de cannelle","75 ml d''huile d''olive","500 g d''amandes hachées","75 g de sucre en poudre doré","2 cuillères à soupe de cannelle moulue","½ cuillère à café de clous de girofle moulus","Paquet de 250g-270g de feuilles de pâte filo","150 ml d''eau de rose (non concentrée, voir astuce)"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients du sirop dans une casserole à fond épais et ajoutez 400 ml d''eau froide. Remuer à feu doux pour dissoudre le sucre, puis laisser mijoter régulièrement pendant 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il devienne légèrement sirupeux. Laisser refroidir.","Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4. Badigeonner légèrement les côtés et le fond d''un plat peu profond allant au four de 23 x 33 cm avec un peu d''huile.","Pour le baklava, mélangez les amandes, le sucre, la cannelle, les clous de girofle et l''eau de rose.","Placer 1 feuille de filo au fond du plat et badigeonner généreusement d''huile. (Si les feuilles de filo sont très grandes, coupez-les toutes en deux avant utilisation.) Placez-en une autre dessus et enduisez-les à nouveau d''huile. Répétez ce processus de superposition et de badigeonnage d’huile jusqu’à ce que la moitié des feuilles de filo soient épuisées. Étalez maintenant la garniture et recouvrez avec les feuilles de filo restantes, en superposant et en huilant comme avant. Assurez-vous également de badigeonner la feuille supérieure d’huile. Incisez le dessus pour former des tranches en forme de losange.","Cuire au four environ 30 minutes en augmentant le feu pendant les 5 dernières minutes à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 pour donner à la pâte une couleur légèrement dorée.","Sortez du four et versez immédiatement la moitié du sirop de rose refroidi sur la pâte chaude. Laisser reposer au moins 30 minutes pour que le sirop puisse s''infiltrer à travers les couches. Servir avec de grosses cuillerées de yaourt grec et le sirop restant."]','2026-01-11 00:19:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12561,9404,'fr','Pots de noix et de grenades au miel','Créez un baklava de triche en trempant du blé râpé dans du miel. Garnir de yaourt crémeux, de pistaches et d''agrumes','["85 g de blé râpé, concassé","200 g de pistaches hachées","100g de miel","jus ½ orange","Pot de 300 ml de crème double","½ pot de 250 g de yaourt grec","2 cuillères à café d''eau de rose","110 g de graines de grenade en pot"]','["Dans un bol, mélangez le blé râpé concassé avec les noix, 50 ml de miel et le jus d''orange, puis répartissez dans 8 petits verres ou tasses à thé.","Fouettez la crème jusqu''à ce qu''elle soit très doucement fouettée, puis incorporez le yaourt, le reste du miel et l''eau de rose. Répartissez-le également entre les pots. Réfrigérer pendant au moins 2 heures ou jusqu''à 24 heures. Avant de servir, garnissez les pots de graines de grenade."]','2026-01-11 00:19:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12562,9405,'fr','Biryani au poulet','Un excellent plat de riz en une seule casserole qui peut encore être servi quelques jours plus tard, parfait pour les restes','["300 g de riz basmati","25g de beurre","1 gros oignon, finement tranché","1 feuille de laurier","3 gousses de cardamome","petit bâton de cannelle","1 cuillère à café de curcuma","4 poitrines de poulet sans peau, coupées en gros morceaux","4 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry (nous avons utilisé la pâte balti de Patak))","85g de raisins secs","850 ml de bouillon de poulet","coriandre hachée et amandes effilées grillées pour servir"]','["Faire tremper le riz dans de l''eau tiède, puis le laver\r\nfroide jusqu''à ce que l''eau soit claire. Faire chauffer le beurre\r\ndans une casserole et faites revenir les oignons avec le\r\nfeuille de laurier et autres épices entières pendant 10 minutes.\r\nSaupoudrer de curcuma, puis ajouter le poulet\r\net la pâte de curry et cuire jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient aromatiques.","Incorporer le riz dans la poêle avec les raisins secs,\r\npuis versez sur le bouillon. Placez un raccord serré\r\ncouvrir la casserole et porter à ébullition forte, puis\r\nbaisser le feu au minimum et cuire le\r\nriz pendant encore 5 minutes. Éteignez le feu et\r\nlaisser reposer 10 min. Bien mélanger en mélangeant\r\nla moitié de la coriandre. Pour servir, répartir sur le\r\nle reste de la coriandre et les amandes."]','2026-01-11 00:19:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12563,9406,'fr','Le pudding au pain le plus simple de tous les temps','Le nec plus ultra en matière de plats réconfortants rapides – seulement cinq minutes à préparer, parfaits pour mettre au four avant le plat principal','["150 ml de lait entier","140 g de pain blanc","50 g de raisins secs ou de cerises séchées","Pot de 568 ml de crème anglaise fraîche","beurre, pour graisser","5-7 cuillères à soupe de sucre en poudre"]','["Chauffer le four à 140°C/chaleur tournante 120°C/gaz 1. Mélanger la crème anglaise avec le lait. Coupez les croûtes du pain, coupez-les en triangles, puis placez-les dans un grand bol avec les raisins secs ou les cerises séchées. Versez dessus le mélange de crème anglaise, puis mélangez délicatement le tout pour que tous les morceaux de pain soient enrobés. Beurrer légèrement un petit plat allant au four, puis y verser le mélange.","Cuire pendant 30 à 35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il y ait juste une légère oscillation au centre de la crème. Saupoudrez de sucre pour couvrir la surface, puis passez sous un grill chaud pendant 1 à 2 minutes jusqu''à ce que le sucre commence à fondre et à caraméliser."]','2026-01-11 00:19:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12564,9407,'fr','Biryani aux légumes épicés','Ce curry végétarien simple, plein de saveurs indiennes fraîches, est rapide à préparer et cuit dans une seule casserole.','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","1 petit chou-fleur, cassé en petits bouquets","2 grosses patates douces, pelées et coupées en cubes","1 gros oignon, tranché","1l de bouillon de légumes chaud","3 cuillères à soupe de pâte de curry chaude (Madras c''est bon)","1 piment rouge épépiné et finement haché","grosse pincée de brins de safran","2 cuillères à café de graines de moutarde (noires ou blanches)","500 g de riz basmati","140 g de haricots verts parés, coupés en deux","2 citrons, jus seulement","une poignée de feuilles de coriandre fraîche","50 g de noix de cajou grillées et salées","poppadoms et raita, pour servir"]','["Préchauffer le four à 220C/gaz 7/chaleur tournante 200C. Versez l''huile dans un grand plat à rôtir ou un plat allant au four et mettez au four pendant quelques minutes pour bien réchauffer. Ajoutez tous les légumes dans le moule, sauf les haricots, en remuant pour les enrober d''huile chaude. Assaisonner de sel et de poivre et remettre au four 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à dorer.","Pendant que les légumes rôtissent, mélangez le bouillon, la pâte de curry, le piment, le safran et les graines de moutarde.","Mélangez le riz et les haricots verts avec les légumes dans le moule, puis versez dessus le mélange de bouillon. Baissez le four à 190C/gaz 5/chaleur tournante 190C. Couvrir hermétiquement le plat de papier d''aluminium et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que le riz soit tendre et que le liquide soit absorbé. Incorporez le jus de citron et vérifiez l''assaisonnement, puis parsemez de coriandre et de noix de cajou. Servir avec un tas de poppadums et un bol de raita."]','2026-01-11 00:19:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12565,9408,'fr','Poulet biryani pilau','Facile et pas cher à recréer à la maison, les étudiants n’auront plus jamais besoin de commander des plats à emporter !','["2 cuillères à soupe d''huile végétale","6 grosses cuisses de poulet, avec la peau","1 gros oignon, finement tranché","2 cuillères à soupe de poudre de curry (piquant si vous l''aimez épicé, doux pour les currys plus apprivoisés)","350 g de riz à grains longs facile à cuire","700 ml de bouillon de poulet ou de légumes","250 g de petits pois surgelés"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/chaleur tournante 180°C/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une grande sauteuse et faites revenir les cuisses de poulet, côté peau vers le bas, pendant 8 à 10 minutes jusqu''à ce que la peau soit dorée et croustillante. Ajoutez l''oignon et poursuivez la cuisson 5 minutes jusqu''à ce que l''oignon ramollisse. Saupoudrer de poudre de curry et cuire encore une minute, puis incorporer le riz et verser sur le bouillon. Portez le bouillon à ébullition.","Couvrir la poêle et cuire au four pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce que tout le liquide soit absorbé et que le riz soit cuit. Incorporez les petits pois et laissez le riz reposer quelques instants avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12566,9409,'fr','Délice turc','Préparez votre propre délice turc avec notre recette facile. C''est un excellent cadeau pour l''Aïd, ou offrez-vous simplement quelque chose de sucré.','["huile sans saveur pour le plateau","500g de sucre semoule","½ cuillère à café de crème de tartre","120 g de maïzena, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","½ cuillère à café d''eau de rose (ou 2 cuillères à soupe de sirop de rose)","colorant alimentaire rose, si vous n''utilisez pas le sirop de rose","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer"]','["Huiler une plaque à pâtisserie carrée peu profonde en métal ou en silicone, d''environ 18 x 18 cm. Mettez le sucre dans une casserole avec la crème de tartre et 500 ml d''eau et faites chauffer doucement dans un premier temps en remuant pour que le sucre fonde. Ensuite, augmentez le feu et faites bouillir pendant 10 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit un peu plus sirupeux. Si vous avez un thermomètre à sucre, il devrait atteindre 115-118°C.","Incorporez la maïzena dans 150 ml d''eau, puis, en fouettant tout le temps, versez-la dans le sirop de sucre. Continuez à fouetter jusqu''à ce que tout se mélange pour obtenir un mélange lisse et gluant. Sortez le fouet et commencez à remuer avec une spatule ou une cuillère à feu moyen. Continuez à remuer jusqu''à ce que le mélange soit suffisamment épais pour voir une ligne claire tracée à travers lui avec la cuillère et qu''il commence à quitter les côtés de la casserole. Il sera très épais et fera de grosses bulles qui éclateront à la cuisson, alors soyez prudent. Cela peut prendre jusqu''à une heure. Testez le mélange en versant une petite quantité dans de l''eau très froide ; il doit former une boule qui peut être pressée doucement à froid et qui sera un peu élastique.","Incorporez l''eau de rose ou le sirop de rose et le colorant alimentaire, le cas échéant, puis versez le tout dans le plateau et nivelez le dessus. Laisser refroidir et prendre complètement. Tamisez un peu de maïzena et de sucre glace sur une planche et démoulez soigneusement le délice turc. Couvrez-le de sucre glace et de maïzena et coupez-le en cubes avec un couteau bien aiguisé. Saupoudrez encore davantage du mélange de sucre glace et écartez les morceaux pour qu''ils puissent sécher. Peut être stocké ouvertement ou dans de petites boîtes ou sacs en carton."]','2026-01-11 00:19:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12567,9410,'fr','Biscuits à la cardamome et à la pistache','Tout le monde adorera ces magnifiques biscuits et constitueront un cadeau fait maison impressionnant. Trempez-les dans le chocolat et saupoudrez pour finir','["200 g de beurre doux, à température ambiante","400 g de farine ordinaire, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","150 g de sucre en poudre doré","50g de miel liquide","¼ cuillère à café d''eau de rose","1 oeuf","une pincée de sel","5 gousses de cardamome, décortiquées et écrasées","½ cuillère à café de crème de tartre","100 g de chocolat noir fondu","choix de pépites - nous avons utilisé des pétales de roses séchées, des pistaches hachées, de la noix de coco desséchée et du zeste d''orange","rouleau à pâtisserie","2 plaques à pâtisserie","papier sulfurisé"]','["Mettez le beurre et la farine dans un grand bol et frottez du bout des doigts jusqu''à ce que le mélange ressemble à du sable granuleux.","Dans un autre bol, mélanger le reste des ingrédients jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et liquide. Versez dessus le mélange beurre-farine et mélangez avec les mains. Lorsque la pâte est molle et gluante, formez-la en boule, enveloppez-la dans du film alimentaire et mettez-la au réfrigérateur pendant 20 à 30 minutes pour la raffermir un peu.","Juste avant de sortir la pâte du réfrigérateur, chauffez votre four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapissez 2 plaques à pâtisserie de papier sulfurisé.","Sortez la pâte du réfrigérateur. Saupoudrez un peu de farine sur votre plan de travail et sur un rouleau à pâtisserie, puis étalez la pâte jusqu''à ce qu''elle ait environ l''épaisseur d''une pièce de 1 £.","Utilisez votre règle et un couteau de table pour découper soigneusement la pâte à biscuit en rectangles de 10 cm de long et 3 cm de large et disposez-les sur les plateaux en laissant 2 doigts d''espace entre chaque biscuit.","Mettez les biscuits au four pendant 10 à 12 minutes. Une fois cuit, laissez refroidir dans les plaques pendant quelques minutes, puis transférez délicatement sur une grille jusqu''à refroidissement complet. Répétez jusqu''à ce que toute la pâte soit épuisée.","Pour décorer, faire fondre le chocolat au micro-ondes puis tremper l''extrémité de chaque biscuit dans le chocolat fondu et laisser reposer sur une assiette ou une plaque recouverte de papier sulfurisé. Avant que le chocolat ne prenne, saupoudrez-les d''une pincée de vos garnitures préférées, puis laissez-les dans un endroit frais pendant 1 à 2 heures. Si vous offrez, emballez-le dans de petites boîtes une fois que le chocolat est complètement pris (se conserve 2 à 3 jours)."]','2026-01-11 00:19:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12568,9411,'fr','Pudding persan à la rose fouettée et au beurre de miel','Des saveurs d''orange et de rose sont incorporées dans ce pudding cuit à la vapeur alternatif. Le beurre sucré et épicé constitue l''accompagnement parfait','["250 g de dattes dénoyautées, hachées grossièrement","300g de raisins secs","100 g de zestes mélangés","50g d''amandes entières","50 g de pistaches décortiquées","175 g de sucre muscovado léger","175 g de chapelure blanche","1 cuillère à café d''épices mélangées","½ cuillère à café de gingembre moulu","125 g de farines autolevantes","zester 2 oranges","1 cuillère à soupe d''eau d''orange","1 cuillère à soupe d''eau de rose","2 gros œufs, battus","175 g de beurre fondu, plus un peu pour graisser","125 g de beurre mou","2 cuillères à soupe de sucre glace, plus un peu pour servir","50g de miel clair","pincée de cannelle","1 cuillère à café d''eau de rose"]','["Versez les dattes dans un bol avec les raisins secs, couvrez de 200 ml d''eau chaude de la bouilloire et réservez. Pendant ce temps, graissez une bassine à pudding de 1,5 litre et tapissez le fond d''un disque de papier sulfurisé. Mettez les ingrédients secs et le zeste d''orange dans un grand bol. Incorporer les dattes et les raisins secs (et le liquide de trempage), l''eau de rose et d''orange, les œufs et le beurre. Mélangez jusqu''à ce que tout soit combiné. Versez dans la bassine et couvrez d''un cercle de papier sulfurisé, puis de papier d''aluminium, puis attachez le bord avec de la ficelle.","Placez le pudding sur un couvercle de pot retourné dans une grande casserole et versez l''eau chaude de la bouilloire jusqu''à ce qu''elle atteigne la moitié du bol. Couvrez la casserole et faites cuire doucement à la vapeur pendant 4 heures, en ajoutant plus d''eau si nécessaire. Le pudding peut être consommé immédiatement, réfrigéré et conservé jusqu''à une semaine, ou congelé pendant 1 mois. Pour réchauffer, décongeler complètement ou retirer du réfrigérateur et cuire à nouveau le pud à la vapeur pendant 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il soit très chaud.","Pour faire le beurre, fouettez les ingrédients ensemble. Servir le pudding en quartiers avec une cuillerée de beurre fondant dessus."]','2026-01-11 00:19:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12569,9416,'fr','Smoothie petit-déjeuner au kéfir','Commencez votre matinée avec ce smoothie de petit-déjeuner au kéfir riche en probiotiques. Avec de la mangue, du jus d''orange, du gingembre et du curcuma, vous serez prêt pour la journée à venir','["1 grosse mangue, dénoyautée et hachée","2 cm de gingembre finement râpé","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","200 ml de jus d''orange frais","300 ml de kéfir","1-2 cuillères à soupe de miel ou d''agave, au goût"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse. Goûtez et ajoutez un peu plus de gingembre, de curcuma et de miel, si vous le souhaitez.","Versez dans deux grands verres et servez. Peut être réfrigéré dans un pichet couvert au réfrigérateur jusqu''à 24 heures."]','2026-01-11 00:19:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12570,9417,'fr','Smoothie déesse verte fraise','Essayez ce délicieux smoothie pour le petit-déjeuner pour commencer votre journée, associant des fruits sucrés à des épinards et à des avocats nutritifs pour une dose de calcium, de vitamine C, d''acide folique et de fibres.','["160 g de fraises mûres, décortiquées","160 g de pousses d''épinards","1 petit avocat coupé en deux et la chair retirée","Pot de 150 ml de yaourt bio","2 petites oranges, pressées, plus ½ cuillère à café de zeste finement râpé"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse. Si c''est un peu épais, ajoutez une goutte d''eau glacée puis mixez à nouveau. Versez dans des verres et buvez aussitôt."]','2026-01-11 00:19:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12571,9418,'fr','Smoothie petit-déjeuner en deux minutes','Préparez un smoothie pour le petit-déjeuner faible en gras en un rien de temps. Utilisez de la banane avec d''autres fruits rouges, ainsi que du miel pour un peu de douceur et de l''avoine pour un carburant à libération lente.','["1 banane","1 cuillère à soupe de flocons d''avoine","80 g de fruits rouges (tout ce que vous avez – les fraises, les myrtilles et la mangue fonctionnent tous bien)","150 ml de lait","1 cuillère à café de miel","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un mixeur et mixez pendant 1 min jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse.","Versez le mélange dans deux verres pour servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12572,9419,'fr','Smoothie au chou frisé','Offrez-vous une dose de vitamine C le matin avec ce smoothie vert végétalien. En plus du chou frisé et de l''avocat, il y a une touche de citron vert et d''ananas piquants.','["2 poignées de chou frisé","½ avocat","½ citron vert, jus seulement","une grosse poignée de morceaux d''ananas surgelés","morceau de gingembre de taille moyenne","1 cuillère à soupe de noix de cajou","1 banane, facultatif"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un bullet ou un smoothie maker, ajoutez un grand peu d''eau et mixez. Ajoutez plus d''eau jusqu''à obtenir la consistance souhaitée."]','2026-01-11 00:19:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12573,9420,'fr','Super-shake du petit-déjeuner','Ce smoothie est riche en graisses naturelles et en sucre : idéal si vous avez besoin de carburant pour un exercice intense.','["100 ml de lait entier","2 cuillères à soupe de yaourt nature","1 banane","150g de fruits des bois surgelés","50g de myrtilles","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de chia","½ cuillère à café de cannelle","1 cuillère à soupe de baies de goji","1 cuillère à café de graines mélangées","1 cuillère à café de miel (idéalement Manuka)"]','["Mettez les ingrédients dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Versez dans un verre et dégustez !"]','2026-01-11 00:19:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12574,9421,'fr','Smoothie au soleil','Commencez votre journée avec un petit rayon de soleil : un smoothie faible en gras qui représente deux de vos cinq par jour et qui est également savoureux !','["500 ml de jus de carotte réfrigéré","200 g d''ananas (conserve ou conserve)","2 bananes coupées en morceaux","petit morceau de gingembre pelé","20 g de noix de cajou","jus 1 citron vert"]','["Mettez les ingrédients dans un mélangeur et mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Boire immédiatement ou verser dans une bouteille pour boire sur le pouce. Se conserve une journée au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12575,9422,'fr','Smoothie à la banane','Rapide et facile à préparer, ce smoothie à la banane, aux pruneaux, au lait d''amande et au beurre de noix est un regain d''énergie idéal lors de vos déplacements.','["500 ml de lait d''amande non sucré","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre d''amande","6 pruneaux","1 cuillère à café de cannelle","1 petite banane mûre"]','["Dans un mixeur, mixez le lait d''amande avec le beurre d''amande, les pruneaux, la cannelle et la banane. Transférer dans 2 bouteilles et réfrigérer jusqu''au moment de boire, ou préparer pour un déjeuner sur le pouce. Ils se conserveront 2 jours au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12576,9423,'fr','Smoothie noix de coco et banane','Ce smoothie crémeux regorge d’ingrédients nutritifs. Le baobab ajoute une saveur piquante de sorbet et est riche en fibres, en antioxydants et en vitamine C.','["100 g de yaourt à la noix de coco","3 cuillères à soupe de lait de votre choix (nous avons utilisé du lait d''amande non sucré)","½ cuillère à café de curcuma moulu","Morceau de 3 cm de gingembre frais, pelé","2 cuillères à café de poudre de baobab (facultatif)","1 petite banane mûre","1 cuillère à café de miel","1 cuillère à soupe d''avoine","le jus d''un ½ citron"]','["Ajoutez le yaourt à la noix de coco et le lait dans un mélangeur à grande vitesse, puis ajoutez le curcuma, le gingembre frais et la poudre de baobab (le cas échéant). Versez le reste des ingrédients puis mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Ajoutez de la glace et mixez à nouveau si vous préférez une boisson plus froide. Verser dans des verres et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12577,9424,'fr','Smoothie vert','Ce smoothie sucré contient de nombreux ingrédients nutritifs, tels que des épinards, des graines de lin et de la banane, avec une cuillerée facultative de poudre de maca pour un regain d''énergie naturel.','["250 ml de lait de votre choix (nous avons utilisé du lait d''amande non sucré)","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de lin moulues","1 cuillère à café de poudre de maca (facultatif)","pincée de cannelle moulue","1 datte Medjool, défoncée","1 petite banane mûre","poignée de cavolo nero ou d''épinards","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre d''amande"]','["Versez le lait dans un mélangeur à grande vitesse puis ajoutez les graines de lin moulues, la poudre de maca (si vous en utilisez) et la cannelle. Ajoutez le reste des ingrédients puis mixez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Verser dans des verres et servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12578,9425,'fr','Smoothie vert pour le petit-déjeuner','Mélangez des ingrédients sains pour un petit-déjeuner énergisant. L''utilisation de lait de riz brun non sucré enrichi en calcium et en vitamines le rend plus nutritif','["1 poignée d''épinards (environ 50 g/2 oz), hachés grossièrement","100 g de fleurons de brocoli hachés grossièrement","2 branches de céleri","4 cuillères à soupe de noix de coco desséchée","1 banane","300 ml de lait de riz (voir Astuce)","¼ cuillère à café de spiruline ou 1 cuillère de poudre de légumes verts ou de poudre de protéines végétaliennes (facultatif)"]','["Mélangez 300 ml d''eau et les ingrédients dans un mélangeur jusqu''à consistance lisse."]','2026-01-11 00:19:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12579,9426,'fr','Smoothie fraise-banane-amande','Commencez votre journée avec ce smoothie aux fruits sain, composé d''amandes moulues et de produits laitiers riches en calcium.','["1 petite banane","7 fraises, décortiquées","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt bio 0%","3 cuillères à soupe de lait écrémé","2 cuillères à soupe d''amandes moulues"]','["Coupez la banane dans le bol d''un robot culinaire ou dans un pichet si vous utilisez un mixeur plongeant. Ajoutez les fraises, le yaourt, le lait et la poudre d''amandes et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance complètement lisse. Versez dans un verre et dégustez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12580,9427,'fr','Smoothie à l''açaï','L''Açaí est un ingrédient phare : réputé pour être l''un des meilleurs antioxydants, il constitue la base idéale pour un smoothie aux fruits. Mélanger avec de l''ananas, des fraises et de la banane','["100 g de pulpe d''açaí crue, congelée, non sucrée, décongelée","50 g d''ananas surgelé","100g de fraises","1 banane moyenne","250 ml de jus de mangue ou d''orange","1 cuillère à soupe de nectar d''agave ou de miel"]','["Placez tous les ingrédients dans le mixeur ou un robot culinaire. Mélanger jusqu''à consistance lisse. Si c''est trop épais, ajoutez un peu plus de jus de mangue ou d''orange. Servir dans 2 grands verres."]','2026-01-11 00:19:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12581,9428,'fr','Wraps aux œufs pour le petit-déjeuner','Savourez ces roulés aux œufs riches en protéines, remplis de champignons et de tomates pour un petit-déjeuner rapide, copieux et sain. Il fournit du fer, du folate et des fibres.','["Paquet de 500 g de champignons en coupe fermée","4 cuillères à café d''huile de colza pressée à froid, plus 2 gouttes","320 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux ou 8 tomates coupées en quartiers","2 généreuses poignées de persil finement haché","8 cuillères à soupe de flocons d''avoine (40 g)","10 œufs","4 cuillères à café de moutarde anglaise en poudre à base d''eau"]','["Trancher épaissement la moitié du paquet de champignons. Faites chauffer 2 cuillères à café d''huile de colza dans une poêle antiadhésive. Ajoutez les champignons, remuez brièvement puis faites revenir avec le couvercle sur la poêle pendant 6 à 8 minutes. Incorporer la moitié des tomates puis cuire encore 1 à 2 minutes sans le couvercle jusqu''à ce qu''elles soient ramollies.","Battez très bien les œufs avec le persil et les flocons d''avoine. Faites chauffer une goutte d''huile dans une grande poêle antiadhésive. Versez ¼ du mélange d''œufs et faites revenir 1 min jusqu''à ce qu''il soit presque pris, retournez-le comme pour faire une crêpe. Sortez la poêle, tartinez avec un quart de moutarde, versez ¼ de la garniture au centre et roulez. Maintenant, faites un deuxième wrap en utilisant un autre quart du mélange d''œufs et de la garniture. Si vous suivez notre plan d''alimentation saine, gardez le reste pour le lendemain."]','2026-01-11 00:19:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12582,9429,'fr','Gruau de nuit au chia et aux amandes','Commencez la journée avec de l''avoine énergisante et des graines de chia riches en oméga-3 avec ce délicieux petit-déjeuner. C’est végétalien, mais vous pouvez utiliser du lait de vache et du yaourt, si vous préférez','["200 g de flocons d''avoine","50g de graines de chia","600 ml de lait d''amande non sucré, plus 8 cuillères à soupe","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","125 g de framboises barquette","100 g de yaourt aux amandes","250 g de barquette de myrtilles","20 g d''amandes effilées, grillées"]','["Versez les flocons d''avoine et les graines dans un bol et versez dessus le lait et l''extrait de vanille. Laisser reposer 5 à 10 minutes pour que les flocons d''avoine absorbent une partie du liquide.","Réservez 16 framboises, puis ajoutez le reste aux flocons d''avoine et écrasez-les dans le mélange. Verser dans quatre verres ou plats à coupe glacée, puis garnir de yaourt et de deux lots de baies. Couvrir et réfrigérer toute la nuit ou jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin. Pour servir, versez 2 cuillères à soupe de lait d''amande sur chacun et parsemez d''amandes."]','2026-01-11 00:19:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12583,9459,'fr','Tofu brouillé','Essayez notre tofu épicé végétalien avec des tomates cerises pour une version sans œufs de pain grillé brouillé. Parfait au petit-déjeuner, servi sur du pain de seigle','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile de colza pressée à froid","1 petit oignon, finement tranché","1 grosse gousse d''ail, écrasée","½ cuillère à café de curcuma","1 cuillère à café de cumin moulu","½ cuillère à café de paprika doux fumé","280 g de tofu extra ferme","100 g de tomates cerises coupées en deux","½ petit bouquet de persil haché","pain de seigle, pour servir, (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle à feu moyen et faites revenir doucement l''oignon pendant 8 à 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''il soit doré et collant. Incorporer l''ail, le curcuma, le cumin et le paprika et cuire 1 min.","Écrasez grossièrement le tofu dans un bol à l''aide d''une fourchette en gardant quelques morceaux en gros morceaux. Ajouter à la poêle et faire revenir 3 minutes. Augmentez le feu, puis versez les tomates et faites cuire encore 5 minutes ou jusqu''à ce qu''elles commencent à ramollir. Incorporez le persil au mélange. Servir seul ou avec du pain de seigle grillé (non sans gluten), si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12584,9430,'fr','Beurre de dattes','Préparez ce beurre de dattes facile avec seulement une poignée d''ingrédients. Il n’y a pas de cuisson à faire, c’est délicieux sur du pain grillé ou du pain aux bananes – et c’est végétalien si vous le préparez avec de l’huile de coco','["150 g d''huile de coco ou de beurre","80 g de dattes molles dénoyautées","1 cuillère à soupe de sirop d''érable","pincée de cannelle","pincée de sel"]','["Dans un petit robot culinaire, mélangez l''huile ou le beurre de noix de coco, les dattes (nous avons utilisé du medjool), le sirop d''érable, la cannelle et le sel. Réfrigérer jusqu''à ce que vous en ayez besoin, se conservera jusqu''à une semaine."]','2026-01-11 00:19:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12585,9412,'fr','Boules d''énergie crumble aux pommes','Préparez un lot de nos boules d''énergie faciles et sans cuisson pour une collation parfaite sur le pouce. Ces bouchées végétaliennes rapides aux pommes et à la cannelle ne prennent que 10 minutes à préparer','["50g de flocons d''avoine","50 g de dattes dénoyautées (environ 3)","50g d''amandes moulues","2 cuillères à soupe de beurre d''amande","¼ cuillère à café de cannelle, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","30 g de tranches de pommes séchées","½ pomme"]','["Mélangez 30 g de flocons d''avoine avec les dattes, la poudre d''amandes, le beurre d''amande, la cannelle, les tranches de pomme séchées et une pincée de sel jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient grossièrement hachés et commencent à s''agglutiner. Râpez la pomme, la peau et le tout, puis ajoutez le reste des flocons d''avoine et mélangez jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé.","Formez 10 boules et saupoudrez d''un peu plus de cannelle. Mettre au réfrigérateur 30 minutes pour raffermir. Se conserve dans un contenant hermétique au réfrigérateur jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:19:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12586,9431,'fr','Flapjacks au miel et à la framboise','Préparez ces flapjacks faciles à préparer au miel et aux framboises en utilisant seulement cinq ingrédients. Servir avec une tasse de thé pour un parfait remontant en milieu de matinée, ou congeler pour une date ultérieure.','["150g de beurre","150 g de sucre mou roux clair","4 cuillères à soupe de miel (nous avons utilisé du miel de bruyère)","300 g de flocons d''avoine","100 g de framboises surgelées"]','["Chauffer le four à 200°C/180°C chaleur tournante/gaz 6 et tapisser un moule à pâtisserie de 20 x 20 cm de papier sulfurisé. Faites fondre le beurre, le sucre, le miel et une pincée de sel dans une poêle. Une fois que le mélange bouillonne et est combiné, incorporez les flocons d''avoine.","Versez le mélange d''avoine dans le moule tapissé et appuyez avec vos doigts ou le dos d''une cuillère. Répartissez-les sur les framboises, puis pressez-les légèrement dans le mélange d''avoine. Cuire au four pendant 25 à 30 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés. Laisser refroidir, puis couper en 9 ou 12 flapjacks."]','2026-01-11 00:19:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12587,9432,'fr','Pots de beurre de cacahuète et d''avoine','Essayez ces flocons d''avoine préparés à l''avance pour bien commencer la journée. Ils sont naturellement sucrés avec des dattes et de la cannelle et constituent une bonne source de calcium.','["180 g de flocons d''avoine","75g de beurre de cacahuète croquant (nous avons utilisé Meridian 100% noix)","40 g de dattes Medjool dénoyautées, hachées","2 cuillères à café d''extrait de vanille","5 pots de 120g de yaourt nature bio (ou 600g en grand pot)","cannelle moulue, pour saupoudrer"]','["Versez les flocons d''avoine dans un grand bol et versez dessus 600 ml d''eau bouillante. Ajouter le beurre de cacahuète, les dattes et la vanille et bien mélanger. Laisser refroidir, puis incorporer 240 g de yaourt. Diluer avec un peu d''eau si la consistance est un peu ferme.","Verser dans six verres, puis garnir du reste du yaourt et saupoudrer de cannelle. Couvrir chaque verre et conserver au réfrigérateur jusqu''au moment de déguster. Se conserve bien jusqu''à cinq jours."]','2026-01-11 00:19:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12588,9433,'fr','Naans pour le petit-déjeuner','Garnissez les pains naan de fromage à la crème, de chutney, d''avocat et d''œufs pour un délicieux petit-déjeuner ou brunch. Il ne leur faut que 10 minutes pour préparer et livrer l''un de vos 5 par jour.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile végétale ou de tournesol","2 oeufs","2 petits pains naans","4 cuillères à soupe de fromage à la crème faible en gras","2 cuillères à soupe de chutney de mangue","1 avocat, coupé en deux et tranché","½ citron vert, jus","1 piment vert","une petite poignée de coriandre, feuilles cueillies"]','["Chauffer le four à 200C/180C chaleur tournante/gaz 6. Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle, puis faites frire les œufs. Réchauffez les pains naan au four pendant que les œufs cuisent.","Tartinez les naans chauds avec le fromage à la crème, puis arrosez de chutney. Ajoutez un œuf au plat à chaque naan et garnissez d''avocat, de jus de citron vert, de piment et de coriandre. Assaisonner et rentrer."]','2026-01-11 00:19:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12589,9434,'fr','Muffins épicés aux carottes et aux pommes','Ces muffins fruités sont parfaits pour le petit-déjeuner sur le pouce ou comme gâterie en milieu de matinée. Ajoutez des fruits secs, des noix ou des graines pour plus de texture, si vous le souhaitez','["100 ml d''huile de colza","100 ml de yaourt nature","50 ml de miel liquide","2 oeufs","1 cuillère à café d''extrait de vanille","200 g de farines autolevantes","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","1½ cuillère à café d''épices mélangées moulues","1 pomme, râpée","1 carotte, râpée","50 g de raisins secs, raisins secs, noix ou graines hachées (facultatif)"]','["Chauffer le four à 180°C/160°C chaleur tournante/gaz 4 et tapisser un moule à muffins de neuf caissettes (vous pouvez également utiliser des carrés de papier sulfurisé). Mélangez l''huile, le yaourt, le miel, les œufs et la vanille dans un pichet. Dans un bol, mélanger la farine, le bicarbonate, le mélange d''épices et ¼ cuillère à café de sel. Versez le mélange de yaourt dans le mélange de farine et ajoutez la pomme et la carotte, ainsi que tous les ingrédients supplémentaires que vous utilisez. Mélangez avec une spatule jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis versez le mélange dans les moules à muffins.","Cuire au four pendant 20 à 22 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce qu''un cure-dent inséré au milieu d''un muffin en ressorte propre. Laisser refroidir au moins 5 min. Peut être conservé dans une boîte de conserve pendant trois jours ou congelé pendant deux mois ; décongeler toute la nuit avant de servir."]','2026-01-11 00:19:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12590,9435,'fr','Hachis de pois chiches, poivron rouge, œuf et feta','Commencez votre journée avec notre hachis végétarien aux pois chiches, poivron rouge, œuf et feta. Ce superbe petit-déjeuner est facile à préparer et livre deux de vos 5 par jour','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive ou de colza","1 oignon, coupé en deux et tranché","400 g de pois chiches en conserve égouttés","1½ cuillère à café de graines de cumin","4 poivrons rouges rôtis d''un bocal, déchirés en morceaux","2-4 oeufs","40 g de feta émiettée","½ citron, zesté","une petite poignée de menthe, feuilles hachées","pains plats, pour servir (facultatif)"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle. Faites revenir l''oignon 12 à 15 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''il commence à caraméliser. Ajoutez les pois chiches, le cumin et les poivrons et assaisonnez bien, puis laissez cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient bien chauds.","Créez des espaces dans la poêle pour chacun des œufs. Cassez les œufs dans la poêle, puis couvrez et faites cuire pendant 2-3 minutes, ou jusqu''à ce que les œufs soient cuits à votre goût. Répartir sur la feta, le zeste de citron et la menthe. Servir avec les pains plats, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12591,9436,'fr','Porridge avec compote rapide de baies, figues et pistaches','Prenez le temps de prendre un petit-déjeuner nutritif et sain pour vous préparer pour la journée. Le porridge se marie parfaitement avec notre compote rapide de petits fruits, notre topping figues et pistaches','["150 g de flocons d''avoine","100 ml de lait","120 g de baies surgelées","½ orange, zestée et pressée","1 figue, tranchée","1 cuillère à soupe de pistaches grillées et hachées"]','["Mettez les flocons d''avoine, le lait et 450 ml d''eau dans une casserole avec une pincée de sel. Cuire environ 5 minutes jusqu''à consistance épaisse et crémeuse. Pendant ce temps, mettez les baies, le jus et le zeste d''orange au micro-ondes pendant 2-3 minutes.","Répartir le porridge dans des bols et garnir chacun de compote de baies, de figues et de pistaches."]','2026-01-11 00:19:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12592,9437,'fr','Bol d''açaï','Essayez ce bol de petit-déjeuner rempli de fruits pour commencer votre journée rapidement et facilement. Variez les garnitures selon la saison – les baies fraîches ou les pêches fonctionnent bien en été','["2 cuillères à café de poudre d''açaï","une poignée de baies congelées","½ banane bien mûre, hachée","une poignée de glaçons","1 cuillère à café de flocons de noix de coco, 5 morceaux d''ananas, ½ fruit de la passion, 1 cuillère à soupe de flocons d''avoine grillés, pour garnir (facultatif)"]','["Mettez la poudre d''açaí, les baies congelées, la banane et les glaçons dans un mixeur puissant avec 100 ml d''eau. Mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse, puis versez dans un bol et ajoutez la garniture de votre choix."]','2026-01-11 00:19:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12593,8925,'fr','Bol de smoothie aux fruits rouges','Cette délicieuse recette saine ne contient absolument aucun produit laitier, soja, gluten ou sucres ajoutés. Il a été créé par les experts en aliments santé Nana Bowls.','["3 bananes surgelées, pelées et hachées","200 g de myrtilles surgelées","100 g de fraises surgelées","20 ml d''eau de rose","100 ml de lait de coco","50 ml d''eau froide","20 g de protéine de pois en poudre","30 g d''amandes concassées","30 g de pistaches concassées","20 g de pollen d''abeille","20 g de grué de cacao"]','["Ajoutez les bananes, les myrtilles, les fraises surgelées, l''eau de rose, le lait de coco et l''eau froide dans un mélangeur puissant.","Bien mélanger pendant environ 30 secondes. Ajoutez ensuite votre poudre de protéines et mélangez à nouveau jusqu''à obtenir une texture épaisse, lisse et crémeuse.","Versez dans vos bols et garnissez d''amandes croquantes, de pistaches concassées, de pollen d''abeille et de grué de cacao. Vous pouvez également ajouter des flocons de noix de coco grillés, du granola maison ou un filet de beurre de noix pour un peu plus de bonté."]','2026-01-11 00:19:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12594,9439,'fr','Le micro-ondes a secoué','Préparez la shakshuka, un favori du Moyen-Orient, en seulement 10 minutes. Parfait pour le brunch, le déjeuner ou le dîner, c''est sain et constitue une excellente option pour un repas économique.','["1 cuillère à soupe d''huile d''olive","200 ml de passata ou de tomates en conserve, réduites en pâte","1 gousse d''ail, finement tranchée","1 cuillère à soupe bombée de salsa au poivron rouge (nous avons utilisé du Gran Luchito) ou ¼-½ poivron rouge, haché","2 œufs moyens","1 cuillère à soupe de coriandre hachée et de pain pitta, pour servir"]','["Badigeonner un bol ou un plat à micro-ondes avec un peu d''huile. Mélanger la passata, l''ail et la salsa et bien assaisonner. Versez dans le bol et faites une trempette au centre. Cassez l''œuf, puis piquez le jaune avec la pointe d''un couteau bien aiguisé.","Couvrez le bol avec son couvercle ou du film alimentaire. Cuire au micro-ondes à puissance maximale pendant 1 min, puis par rafales de 20 secondes jusqu''à ce que le blanc soit pris. Parsemer de coriandre et servir avec le pitta réchauffé."]','2026-01-11 00:19:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12595,9440,'fr','Bouchées de dattes et de noix à la cannelle','Ces bouchées aux dattes et aux noix et à la cannelle sont rapides à préparer pour une collation saine. Ils fonctionnent également comme un régal après le dîner si vous avez des amis autour','["3 moitiés de noix","3 dattes medjool dénoyautées","cannelle moulue, au goût"]','["Coupez soigneusement chaque moitié de noix en trois tranches, puis faites de même avec les dattes. Déposez une tranche de noix sur chaque datte, saupoudrez de cannelle et servez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12596,9441,'fr','Muesli maison avec avoine, dattes et baies','Rempli d''avoine, de pacanes, de graines, de dattes, de blé soufflé et de baies, ce délicieux muesli pour le petit-déjeuner vous aidera à commencer votre journée du bon pied.','["100 g de flocons d''avoine traditionnels","12 noix de pécan, cassées en morceaux","2 cuillères à soupe de graines de tournesol","6 dattes Medjool dénoyautées, coupées en morceaux","25 g de blé soufflé riche en fibres (nous avons utilisé Good Grain)","4 pots de yaourt bio de 150 ml","300 g de baies mélangées, comme des framboises, des fraises et des myrtilles","saupoudrer généreusement de cannelle moulue (facultatif)"]','["Versez les flocons d''avoine dans une poêle et faites-les chauffer doucement en remuant fréquemment jusqu''à ce qu''ils commencent tout juste à griller. Ajoutez les noix de pécan et les graines pour les réchauffer brièvement, puis versez-les dans un grand bol et mélangez pour qu''elles refroidissent rapidement.","Ajoutez les dattes et le blé soufflé, mélangez bien jusqu''à ce que le tout soit bien mélangé, puis servez garni de yaourt et de fruits et d''une pincée de cannelle, si vous le souhaitez."]','2026-01-11 00:19:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12597,9442,'fr','Shakshuka verte','Offrez-vous une shakshuka avec une différence. Mélangez vos légumes verts, œufs et pains plats préférés pour accompagner ce petit-déjeuner sain du week-end.','["3 cuillères à soupe d''huile d''olive","2 poireaux lavés et tranchés","Sachet de 200 g de bébés épinards","250 g de petits pois surgelés","2 grosses gousses d''ail, hachées finement","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de cumin","petit paquet de persil, haché grossièrement","petit paquet de coriandre, hachée grossièrement","petit paquet de menthe, feuilles cueillies et hachées grossièrement, en réservant quelques feuilles pour garnir","8 œufs moyens","Pot de 150 g de yaourt nature","1 cuillère à soupe de harissa","pain plat, pour servir"]','["Faites chauffer l''huile dans une poêle large et peu profonde à feu moyen. Ajoutez les poireaux avec une pincée de sel et laissez cuire 4 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres. Ajouter des poignées d’épinards dans la poêle en remuant jusqu’à ce qu’ils soient fanés.","Incorporer les petits pois, l''ail, le cumin, les herbes et un peu d''assaisonnement. Cuire quelques minutes jusqu''à ce que ça sente parfumé, puis créer quatre espaces et casser deux œufs dans chacun. Couvrir et cuire 10 minutes ou jusqu''à ce que les blancs soient pris mais que les jaunes soient coulants – ils continueront à cuire légèrement au fur et à mesure que vous les porterez à table.","Assaisonnez les œufs avec du sel marin feuilleté, des cuillerées de yaourt parsemées de harissa et parsemez-les de quelques feuilles de menthe. Servir avec une pile de pain plat à ramasser."]','2026-01-11 00:19:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12598,9443,'fr','Bol à smoothie arc-en-ciel vert','Commencez comme vous voulez continuer avec ce bol de petit-déjeuner super sain composé de baies et d''avocat.','["50g d''épinards","1 avocat dénoyauté, pelé et coupé en deux","1 mangue mûre, dénoyautée, pelée et coupée en morceaux","1 pomme épépinée et coupée en morceaux","200 ml de lait d''amande","1 fruit du dragon, pelé et coupé en morceaux égaux","100 g de fruits mélangés (nous avons utilisé des fraises, des framboises et des myrtilles)"]','["Mettez les épinards, l''avocat, la mangue, la pomme et le lait d''amande dans un mixeur et mixez jusqu''à obtenir une consistance lisse et épaisse. Répartir dans deux bols et garnir de fruit du dragon et de baies."]','2026-01-11 00:19:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12599,9413,'fr','Boosters d''énergie choc-orange','Il ne faut que 15 minutes pour mélanger les dattes, les noix, les graines et l''avoine pour préparer cette collation riche en énergie, parfaite dans une boîte à lunch.','["100 g de dattes Medjool dénoyautées","100 g de noix de pécan","50g de graines de citrouille","50 g de flocons d''avoine","4 cuillères à soupe de cacao en poudre ou de cacao non sucré","2 cuillères à soupe bombées de beurre d''amande","le zeste et le jus d''une orange"]','["Mettez tous les ingrédients et 3 cuillères à soupe de jus d''orange dans un robot culinaire. Blitz jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient hachés et commencent à s''agglutiner. S''il est un peu sec, ajoutez une goutte de jus d''orange supplémentaire. Rouler le mélange en boules de la taille d''une noix avec les mains légèrement huilées. Mettez-en 2 ou 3 dans une boîte à lunch pour une collation. Se conserve 2 semaines dans un récipient hermétique au réfrigérateur."]','2026-01-11 00:19:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12600,9444,'fr','Bol de smoothie au curcuma','Rempli d''ingrédients réchauffants et nourrissants, ce bol de petit-déjeuner crémeux peut être prêt en seulement 10 minutes','["10 cm de curcuma frais ou 2 cuillères à café de curcuma moulu","3 cuillères à soupe de yaourt au lait de coco (nous avons utilisé du Co Yo), ou la crème écrémée du dessus du lait de coco en conserve","50 g de flocons d''avoine sans gluten","1 cuillère à soupe de beurre de cajou (ou une poignée de noix de cajou)","2 bananes pelées et hachées grossièrement","½ cuillère à café de cannelle moulue","1 cuillère à soupe de graines de chia ou de noix hachées, pour servir"]','["Épluchez la racine de curcuma, le cas échéant, et râpez-la. Mettez tous les ingrédients dans un mixeur avec 600 ml d''eau et mélangez jusqu''à consistance lisse. Servir dans un bol avec des graines de chia ou quelques noix hachées parsemées."]','2026-01-11 00:19:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12601,9445,'fr','Pain aux dattes et aux figues','Un pain au levain qui regorge de fruits et de saveurs – il cuit en seulement 20 minutes','["400 g de farine complète","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","300 ml d''eau","175g de farine complète","400 g de farine blanche forte","2 cuillères à café de sel","Sachet de 7 g de levure à action rapide","140 g de beurre fondu","1 cuillère à soupe de mélasse","225 ml d''eau","200 g de figues hachées grossièrement","100 g de dattes hachées grossièrement"]','["Mélangez les ingrédients du démarreur dans un bol. Démoulez et pétrissez pendant 10 minutes. Placer dans un bol légèrement huilé et laisser lever une nuit au réfrigérateur.","Pour réaliser la deuxième pâte, mélangez le reste des farines, le sel et la levure dans un grand bol. Faites un puits au centre, mélangez le beurre et la mélasse, puis versez les ingrédients secs ainsi que la quasi-totalité de l''eau. Si la pâte semble un peu ferme, ajoutez le reste de l''eau. Démoulez sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné. Incorporer le levain à la pâte et pétrir pendant 10 minutes. Mettez la pâte dans un bol légèrement huilé et laissez lever 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume.","Démoulez sur un plan de travail légèrement fariné. Étalez la pâte en un rectangle d''environ 2,5 cm d''épaisseur et saupoudrez-la de figues et de dattes, puis roulez-la comme un rouleau suisse en pétrissant pour bien mélanger. Couper en 20 morceaux et façonner des rouleaux. Laisser lever 1 heure jusqu''à ce qu''elle double de volume. Chauffer le four à 220°C/ventilateur 200°C/gaz 7. Cuire au four pendant 18-20 minutes, jusqu''à ce que les petits pains sonnent creux lorsqu''on les tape en dessous. Laisser refroidir sur une grille."]','2026-01-11 00:19:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12602,9446,'fr','Carrés aux dattes et aux pommes','Un plateau moelleux à base d''avoine avec des dattes collantes et des pommes – qui sera forcément un grand succès.','["225 g de beurre, plus un peu pour graisser","140 g de pommes à cuire, pelées, évidées et hachées","140 g de dattes dénoyautées, hachées","280 g de cassonade légère et molle","175 g de farine nature","1 cuillère à café de bicarbonate de soude","100 g de flocons d''avoine"]','["Chauffer le four à 190C/170C ventilateur/gaz 5.\r\nBeurrer un moule carré de 18 cm et tapisser\r\navec du papier sulfurisé.","Versez les pommes dans une poêle avec 2 cuillères à soupe\r\nl''eau. Portez à ébullition et laissez mijoter\r\nà feu doux pendant 5 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient tendres et légèrement pulpeux. Ajoutez les dattes et 50g de\r\nle sucre et laissez cuire encore 5 minutes.\r\nRetirez du feu et cassez les pommes\r\nvers le bas avec le dos d''une cuillère jusqu''à ce que\r\nlisse et bien mélangé avec le\r\ndates. Annuler.","Faire fondre doucement le beurre dans un\r\ncasserole. Mélanger la farine, le bicarbonate,\r\nles flocons d''avoine et le reste du sucre dans un\r\nbol. Versez le beurre fondu\r\net remuez bien jusqu''à ce que l''avoine soit enrobée.","Presser fermement la moitié du mélange\r\ndans le moule, étalez la pomme\r\nmélanger dessus et lisser.\r\nCouvrir avec le reste des flocons d''avoine\r\nmélange et presser. Cuire au four\r\npendant 30-35 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et\r\nferme. Laisser refroidir dans le moule avant\r\ncouper en carrés."]','2026-01-11 00:19:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12603,9447,'fr','Petits pains aux dattes collants','Plus la pâte de ce pain aux fruits sucré reste longtemps au réfrigérateur, meilleur est son goût – parfait avec une tasse de thé','["1 cuillère à café de sucre en poudre","2 sachets de 7 g de levure sèche à action rapide","600 g de farine 00, de farine à biscuit ou de farine nature, plus un peu pour saupoudrer","400 ml de lait tiède","200g de beurre, 50g fondu, le reste très mou","1 gros œuf battu à la fourchette","200g de dattes","250 g de cassonade légère et molle","sucre glace, pour saupoudrer (facultatif)"]','["Jusqu''à 3 jours avant de vouloir cuisiner,\r\nmélanger le sucre semoule, la levure, 400g de\r\nfarine et 1 cuillère à café de sel dans un grand bol. Fouet\r\nensemble le lait, le beurre fondu et\r\nœuf, puis versez-le dans les ingrédients secs et\r\nmélanger avec une cuillère en bois. Couvrir avec\r\nfilm alimentaire beurré et mettre au réfrigérateur\r\nau moins une nuit ou jusqu''à 3 jours.","Lorsque vous êtes prêt à faire les petits pains,\r\nmettre les dattes dans un bol et verser dessus\r\njuste assez d''eau bouillante pour couvrir. Partir\r\nlaisser tremper pendant 15 à 20 minutes. Égouttez, séchez,\r\ndénoyauter et hacher.","Mélangez le reste de la farine à la pâte.\r\nUtilisez vos mains pour amener la pâte\r\nensemble, puis basculez-le légèrement sur un\r\nsurface farinée et pétrir légèrement. Rouler\r\nsortir avec un peu plus de farine jusqu''à obtenir un gros\r\nrectangle, d''environ 50 x 30 cm, avec l''un des\r\nles côtés courts face à vous. Étalé sur\r\nles trois quarts du beurre mou, puis\r\nsaupoudrer sur les trois quarts du brun\r\nsucre. Pliez le tiers inférieur de la pâte\r\nvers le haut et au-dessus du tiers médian, puis le\r\nle tiers supérieur vers le bas par rapport aux deux autres.","Chauffer le four à 180C/160C ventilateur/gaz 4.\r\nFaites pivoter la pâte de 90 degrés, ou un\r\nquart de tour dans un sens. Déployez à nouveau pour\r\nun rectangle de taille similaire à celui précédent, ceci\r\ntemps avec l''un des bords longs face\r\nvous. Répartir sur tout sauf 1 cuillère à café bombée de\r\nle beurre restant, répartir sur le\r\nle reste de la cassonade et saupoudrer\r\nles dates. Rouler fermement comme un petit pain suisse\r\nde l''un des bords longs. Coupez les extrémités\r\nun tout petit peu, et coupez-le en 12 à peu près de façon égale\r\nportions. Beurrer légèrement les trous d''un\r\nmoule à muffins avec le beurre réservé, puis\r\npoussez un rouleau, côté coupé vers le haut, dans chaque trou.","Cuire au four pendant 50 minutes jusqu''à ce qu''ils soient dorés et levés.\r\nRetirer du moule lorsqu''il est chaud, afin qu''ils\r\nne colle pas. Saupoudrer le dessus de sucre glace, si\r\nvous aimez, ou servez le fond collant vers le haut."]','2026-01-11 00:19:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12604,8330,'es','Muffins de croissant de almendras','Muffins de croissant de almendras inspirados en un favorito de la panadería francesa con un toque nutritivo, Linwoods Sprouted Flax.','["2 cucharadas de linaza","4 cucharadas de agua","100 ml de jarabe de arce","80 g de mantequilla de almendras","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","100 g de yogur de soja","50ml de leche vegetal","180 g de harina con levadura","¼ cucharadita de sal","50 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharada de lino germinado Linwoods","30 g de jarabe de arce","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","30ml de leche vegetal","almendras en hojuelas","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Precalienta el horno a 180°C ventilador y forra un molde para muffins con 6 cajas. En un bol pequeño mezclar la linaza con agua y dejar espesar durante 5 minutos.","En un tazón grande, mezcle la mezcla de lino espesa, el jarabe de arce, la mantequilla de almendras, el extracto de almendras, el yogur de soja y la leche vegetal. Agregue la harina con levadura y la sal y mezcle suavemente hasta que estén combinados; evite mezclar demasiado.","En un recipiente aparte, mezcle todos los ingredientes del relleno de almendras hasta que se forme una pasta espesa. Vierta la mitad de la masa para muffins en las cajas, agregue una cucharada de relleno de almendras a cada una y luego cubra con la masa restante. Espolvorea con almendras laminadas y hornea por 20 minutos, o hasta que estén doradas y al pincharlas salga limpia.","Deje que se enfríe un poco y luego espolvoree con azúcar glas antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12605,8332,'es','Pan de jengibre con mantequilla marrón y cardamomo','Dale un giro al clásico lebkuchen en Navidad. Condimentada con cardamomo fragante, la mantequilla marrón le da a estas galletas masticables un toque de nuez','["100 g de mantequilla salada","150 g de azúcar moreno blando","200ml de miel","350 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharadita de cardamomo molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","¼ cucharadita de clavo molido","¼ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica molida","¼ cucharadita de jengibre molido","pizca de maza molida","pizca de nuez moscada molida","1 cucharada de cacao en polvo","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 huevo","1 limón, rallado","200 g de azúcar glas tamizada","1 clara de huevo"]','["Vierte la mantequilla en una cacerola a fuego medio. Una vez derretida, cocine hasta que la mantequilla forme espuma, revolviendo regularmente. Debería empezar a oler a nuez y los sólidos de la leche en el fondo se dorarán en unos 7 minutos. Retirar del fuego y agregar el azúcar y la miel. Regrese al fuego a fuego lento. Cocine durante 3-5 minutos hasta que el azúcar se derrita. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Combine la harina, las almendras molidas, las especias, el cacao en polvo, el polvo para hornear y el bicarbonato en un bol. Batir el huevo con la mezcla de mantequilla enfriada, luego verterlo en los ingredientes secos y agregar la ralladura de limón. Mezclar bien y formar una bola. Reservar en el frigorífico durante 1 hora para que se endurezca.","Espolvoree ligeramente una superficie de trabajo limpia con harina y cubra dos bandejas para hornear grandes con papel para hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Sacar la masa y extenderla hasta que tenga aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor. Utilice cortadores con forma de corazones, muñecos de jengibre y estrellas de distintos tamaños, entre 5 y 8 cm, para cortar el lebkuchen. Si quieres colgarlos, usa una brocheta para hacer un pequeño agujero en la parte superior. Colóquelos en la bandeja para hornear, dejando un poco de espacio entre ellos. Hornee durante 13-15 minutos hasta que los bordes estén dorados y esté listo, luego déjelo enfriar completamente en las bandejas.","Para glasear las galletas enfriadas, mezcle el azúcar glas y la clara de huevo para formar un glaseado suave y que se pueda pipetear. Vierta en una manga pastelera reutilizable y coloque adornos en la parte superior de las galletas. Reservar para que se asiente el glaseado, al menos 1 hora. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12606,8334,'es','Bollos de mermelada de polietileno roly','Tome un pudín de polietileno con mermelada y transfórmelo en bollos arremolinados. Utiliza tangzhong, una pasta de leche y harina al estilo chino que produce bollos excepcionalmente esponjosos.','["400ml de leche entera","150 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","2 huevos batidos","300 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","7 g de levadura instantánea","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 cucharada de natillas en polvo","100 g de mantequilla salada, cortada en cubitos y blanda","aceite vegetal, para fermentar","6-7 cucharadas de mermelada de frambuesa","2 cucharadas de natillas en polvo","5 cucharadas de azúcar glas","1½ cucharada de leche","½ cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla"]','["Primero, haz el tangzhong. Mezclar 200 ml de leche con 50 g de harina común en un bol pequeño resistente al calor. Cocine en el microondas durante 1-2 minutos, revolviendo cada 30 segundos, hasta obtener una pasta espesa y pegajosa. Deja enfriar unos minutos mientras montas el resto de la masa.","Calentar suavemente el resto de la leche en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento sobre la encimera. Una vez que esté humeante, retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar hasta que esté ligeramente tibio antes de incorporar la mitad del huevo batido.","Tamiza ambas harinas en el tazón de una batidora de pie equipada con el gancho para amasar. Agregue la levadura, 1 cucharadita de sal, el azúcar en polvo dorado y la natilla en polvo, y bata brevemente para combinar.","Con la batidora a fuego lento, agregue el tangzhong, luego agregue lentamente la mezcla de leche y huevo en un chorro continuo. Sube la batidora a temperatura media y mezcla durante 7-8 minutos hasta obtener una masa suave.","Agrega la mantequilla, un cubo a la vez, esperando hasta que se haya incorporado el primer cubo antes de agregar el siguiente; esto debería tomar unos 10 minutos. Quedará una masa suave, así que enharina bien tus manos y la superficie de trabajo antes de formar una bola con la masa y colocarla en un tazón grande engrasado. Dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora, luego tapar y enfriar durante la noche.","Al día siguiente, extienda la masa hasta formar un rectángulo de aproximadamente 40 x 30 cm. Extienda sobre la mermelada, luego enrolle el rectángulo firmemente desde uno de los lados más largos. Corte en 12 espirales con un cuchillo de sierra afilado, luego transfiéralas a una bandeja para hornear o molde forrado con papel para hornear, separándolas ligeramente. Tapar y dejar reposar una hora más hasta que se hinche y se toque por los lados. Unte con el huevo batido restante.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y hornea durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado y cocido. Dejar enfriar durante 15 minutos. Mientras los panecillos se enfrían, prepara el glaseado. Batir las natillas en polvo y el azúcar glas. Combine la leche y la pasta de vainilla, luego agregue esto lentamente a la mezcla seca en un chorro constante, mezclando todo el tiempo hasta obtener un glaseado amarillo espeso. Transfiera a una manga pastelera.","Corta la punta de la manga pastelera y rocía el glaseado sobre los panecillos calientes antes de servir. Es mejor consumirlos el día en que se preparan, pero se conservan a temperatura ambiente durante dos días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:53:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12607,8336,'es','Bollos de brioche con patas de gatito','Prepare estas "patas de gatito" para el desayuno con mermeladas o cualquier otro aderezo para tostadas que le guste a su familia. Hacer pan es una gran actividad interior para los más pequeños','["200ml de leche entera","50 g de mantequilla salada","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","5 g de sal marina fina","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","3 huevos, 1 batido para glasear"]','["Calienta la leche y la mantequilla juntas en una jarra en el microondas, o en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento, hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y la leche esté tibia.","Vierta la harina para pan en el tazón de una batidora de pie, luego agregue la sal y el azúcar por un lado y la levadura por el otro. Batir brevemente con el gancho amasador, luego agregar la mezcla de leche y mantequilla y 2 de los huevos, y amasar a velocidad baja durante 6-8 minutos hasta que esté suave, terso y elástico. También puedes hacer esto en un bol haciendo un hueco en el medio, agregando la leche y 2 huevos, luego juntándolos y amasando la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo hasta que quede suave. Intenta no agregar más harina, simplemente dobla la masa pegajosa sobre sí misma, raspando con las manos de vez en cuando. Un raspador de masa es una excelente herramienta que los niños pueden usar al hacer panes y masas. Colóquelo en un bol, cúbralo con un paño de cocina limpio y déjelo reposar durante 1-2 horas hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Retira la masa y luego córtala en 12 bolas. Forme ocho de las bolas en rondas ordenadas y luego colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear grande forrada con papel para hornear. Corta cada una de las bolas restantes en ocho trozos pequeños para formar 32 bolitas de masa. Usa un poco del huevo batido para pegar cuatro bolitas en cada una de las más grandes para que parezcan patas. Dejar reposar otros 45 minutos para que vuelva a hincharse.","Calienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Unta los panecillos con más huevo, luego cocina durante 20-25 minutos hasta que estén dorados e inflados. Dejar enfriar un poco antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 12:53:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12608,8338,'es','Pastel crumble de ruibarbo y natillas','Disfrute de los sabores clásicos del crumble de ruibarbo y las natillas en una rebanada de pastel: es una combinación de texturas de ensueño. Sirva con crema doble, si lo desea.','["125 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","400 g de ruibarbo, picado en trozos de 1 cm","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","150 g de harina con levadura","50 g de polenta de cocción rápida","3 cucharadas de natillas en polvo","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","125 ml de nata agria","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","crema doble, para servir (opcional)","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","60 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de natillas en polvo","1 cucharada de polenta de cocción rápida","50 g de mantequilla, en cubos"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base y los lados de un molde desmontable redondo de 23 cm con papel para hornear. Mezclar un tercio del ruibarbo con 1 cucharada de azúcar y reservar.","Para hacer la cobertura crumble, mezcle el azúcar, la harina, las natillas en polvo y la polenta en un bol. Agregue la mantequilla y frote con los ingredientes secos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado grueso, luego reserve.","Para hacer el bizcocho, mezcle la harina, la polenta, las natillas en polvo, la levadura en polvo y ½ cucharadita de sal en un bol y reserve. En un segundo tazón, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar restante hasta que estén bien combinados y su color se aclare ligeramente. Agrega los huevos uno a uno, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Agregue la vainilla y la crema agria, antes de incorporar la mezcla de harina y el ruibarbo restante que no estaba cubierto de azúcar.","Extienda la mezcla del pastel en el molde preparado, luego cubra con el ruibarbo cubierto de azúcar y esparza sobre la cobertura crumble. Hornee durante 1 hora-1 hora 10 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos, luego desmoldar con cuidado y dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla. Cortar en rodajas para servir y espolvorear con un poco de azúcar glas, si se desea. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta tres días. Vierta sobre crema doble para servir, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:53:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12609,8340,'es','Muffins de donuts de canela y manzana','Prepare estas versiones de muffins con rosquillas cuando prefiera evitar la fritura. Llenos de sabores invernales, son ideales para un té festivo por la tarde.','["110 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","70 g de azúcar en polvo, más 30 g para espolvorear","110 g de harina común, tamizada","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de canela, más ½ cucharadita para espolvorear","50ml de yogur natural","1 huevo mediano de corral","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","60 g de compota de manzana suave","12 cucharaditas de mermelada de arándanos"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Usa mantequilla derretida para cepillar muy ligeramente los pocillos de una bandeja para mini muffins de 24 orificios.","Mezcle 70 g de azúcar en polvo con la harina, el bicarbonato y 1 cucharadita de canela en un tazón grande usando un batidor para dispersar los grumos.","Mezclar la compota de yogur, huevo, vainilla y manzana con 110 g de mantequilla derretida y luego verter en la mezcla de harina. Doble suavemente hasta que se incorpore sin grumos.","Vierta la mitad de la masa en la bandeja para muffins con una bola de helado pequeña o dos cucharaditas. Cubra cada muffin con ½ cucharadita de mermelada y luego con el resto de la masa. Hornee durante 8-9 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y ligeramente elásticos al presionarlos suavemente.","Ponga 30 g de azúcar en polvo y la canela restante en un tazón grande y poco profundo y mezcle para combinar. Cuando los muffins estén listos, déjelos enfriar durante 5 minutos en el molde, luego sáquelos suavemente con la punta de un cuchillo y enrolle cada muffin de donut tibio en el azúcar con canela. Dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla o servir caliente. Se conservará hasta por tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:53:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12610,8342,'es','Pastel pegajoso de zanahoria y dátiles con glaseado de tahini y arce','Agregue dátiles pegajosos y un glaseado dulce y salado para llevar el tradicional pastel de zanahoria a nuevas y deliciosas alturas. Decorar con galletas de sésamo desmenuzadas y nueces pecanas.','["200 g de dátiles sin hueso","200 g de mantequilla blanda","4 huevos","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","300 g de harina con levadura","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","200 g de azúcar mascabado light","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","¼ de nuez moscada fresca, finamente rallada","300 g de zanahorias (unas 3), bien lavadas y ralladas gruesas (no es necesario pelarlas)","75 g de nueces pecanas, picadas en trozos grandes, más algunas enteras para decorar","60 g de galletas de sésamo","100 g de queso tierno","1 cucharada de tahini","200 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","600 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharada de jarabe de arce","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Ponga los dátiles en un bol y vierta sobre 200 ml de agua hirviendo. Dejar en remojo durante 30 minutos.","Forre la base y los lados de dos moldes para pasteles redondos de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Vierta los dátiles y el líquido de remojo en un procesador de alimentos y luego mezcle hasta obtener un puré. Agrega la mantequilla, los huevos, la vainilla, la harina, el bicarbonato, el azúcar, la canela, el jengibre, la nuez moscada y una pizca de sal y mezcla hasta obtener una masa de pastel suave.","Coloque las zanahorias en un tazón grande y agregue la mezcla del pastel junto con las nueces picadas, luego mezcle todo. Divida la mezcla entre las latas, luego nivele la parte superior con una espátula. Hornee durante 45 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorado. Al insertar una brocheta en el centro debe salir limpia, si no, regresar al horno por 5-10 minutos. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 20 minutos y luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para enfriar.","Para hacer el glaseado, bate el queso tierno y el tahini hasta que quede suave, si el tahini está muy espeso, agrega un poco de queso tierno y bate hasta que quede suave antes de agregar más. Agrega la mantequilla, el azúcar glas, el jarabe de arce y el extracto de vainilla y vuelve a batir hasta obtener un glaseado suave y esponjoso.","Coloque uno de los pasteles en un soporte para pasteles o en un plato y vierta una cantidad generosa de glaseado encima. Extiende hasta los bordes y luego cubre con el otro pastel. Apila el resto del glaseado encima y usa una espátula o espátula para extenderlo por encima y por los lados hasta que esté completamente cubierto. Desmenuza las galletas de sésamo y mézclalas con las nueces enteras. Espolvorear formando un aro sobre el pastel. Se mantendrá en un lugar fresco durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12611,8344,'es','Blondies de mantequilla de maní y gelatina','Hornee rubias con la deliciosa combinación americana de mantequilla de maní y mermelada de fresa. Utilice cualquier mermelada que desee: fresa, mora o ciruela funcionarán bien.','["150 g de mantequilla con sal, en cubos, más un poco más para la lata","100 g de mantequilla de maní crujiente","300 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos batidos","220 g de harina común","1/2 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","6-7 cucharadas de mermelada de fresa"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/170C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para hornear cuadrado de aproximadamente 20 cm y cubrir con papel para hornear. Derrita la mantequilla de maní, la mantequilla, el azúcar moreno y la vainilla en una cacerola grande a fuego lento, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que se combinen. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.","Batir los huevos y una pizca generosa de sal, luego tamizar la harina y el polvo de hornear e incorporar con una espátula hasta que estén combinados. Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado. Coloque la mermelada encima y luego use una brocheta para hacerla girar suavemente y crear un efecto veteado.","Hornee durante 30 a 40 minutos, o hasta que las rubias estén brillantes en la parte superior y se bamboleen suavemente en el medio. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde. Si lo desea, enfríe las rubias enfriadas durante 1 hora si prefiere que estén blandas. Cortar en 16 cuadrados."]','2026-01-11 12:53:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12612,8346,'es','Pastel especiado de ciruela y coco','Pruebe este horneado entre finales de verano y principios de otoño. Las ciruelas combinan muy bien con el coco y las especias. Servir caliente con una cucharada de yogur o nata.','["200 g de mantequilla, derretida","200 g de yogur griego con sabor a coco, más algo extra para servir (opcional)","200 g de azúcar moreno blando, más 1 cucharada","3 huevos medianos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de harina con levadura","85 g de coco rallado","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas molidas","1 cucharadita de canela molida","4 ciruelas, partidas por la mitad, sin hueso y cortadas en gajos","un puñado de hojuelas de coco o coco extra desecado (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde desmontable de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla derretida, el yogur, 200 g de azúcar moreno, los huevos y la vainilla en una jarra para combinar. Mezcle la harina, el coco rallado, el polvo para hornear, las especias y ½ cucharadita de sal en un bol.","Vierta los ingredientes húmedos en los secos y mezcle hasta obtener una masa suave. Vierta en la lata y luego coloque las ciruelas encima. Esparza sobre 1 cucharada de azúcar moreno y hojuelas de coco, si las usa. Hornee durante 1 hora y 10 minutos, o hasta que haya subido, esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el medio del pastel, éste salga limpio.","Deje enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe un poco. Servir caliente con una cucharada de yogur de coco, si se desea, o dejar enfriar por completo. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético durante tres días o congelado durante tres meses."]','2026-01-11 12:53:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12613,8348,'es','Muffins de tarta de zanahoria y queso crema','Para darle un nuevo giro a uno de tus favoritos, prueba estos muffins de pastel de zanahoria, aromatizados con especias calientes y rellenos con un centro pegajoso de queso tierno.','["175 g de azúcar moreno suave y 1 cucharada para espolvorear","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","1½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","2 huevos","150 ml de aceite de girasol","1 naranja, rallada","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","175 g de zanahorias Morrisons Market Street, peladas y ralladas","50 g de pasas","50 g de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con cajas. En un bol grande, combine el azúcar, la harina, el bicarbonato, la canela y el jengibre con una pizca de sal.","En una jarra batir los huevos, el aceite, la ralladura de naranja y la vainilla. Vierta los ingredientes secos, agregue las zanahorias Morrisons, las pasas y las nueces y mezcle con una espátula para combinar completamente.","Vierta 2 cucharadas de la mezcla en cada molde para muffins. Cubra con ½ cucharada de queso tierno y luego termine con el resto de la mezcla de pastel de zanahoria. Espolvorea una pizca de azúcar moreno sobre cada uno y hornea por 25 minutos hasta que suban y estén dorados. Dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12614,8350,'es','Tarta de manzana alemana','Utilice sus manzanas favoritas para hornear este tradicional pastel de manzana alemán. Disfrútalo con el té de la tarde o tómate un café por la mañana.','["125 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente, más un extra para la lata","220 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","175 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","4 huevos","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","40 g de harina de maíz","100ml de leche","800 g de manzanas para comer, sin corazón y cortadas en gajos","2 cucharaditas de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde desmontable de 23 cm y espolvorear con harina. Batir la mantequilla blanda con 115 g de azúcar y una pizca de sal durante 3-5 minutos hasta que esté pálida y cremosa. Agrega el extracto de vainilla, la ralladura de limón y el jugo y mezcla hasta que se combinen.","Separar los huevos y poner las claras en un bol grande. Utiliza una batidora de mano eléctrica para batir las claras con el azúcar restante hasta que se formen picos rígidos. Mezcle las yemas de huevo con la mezcla de mantequilla y azúcar.","Mezclar la harina con el polvo para hornear y la maicena, luego verter en la mezcla de mantequilla, azúcar y yemas. Mezcle para combinar, luego agregue la leche seguida de una cucharada de las claras de huevo. Una vez que esté completamente incorporado, incorpora suavemente las claras de huevo restantes a la masa.","Vierta la masa en el molde desmontable. Presione las manzanas en la masa con el lado cortado hacia abajo y hornee durante 45-50 minutos hasta que estén doradas y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, ésta salga limpia. Deje enfriar en el molde por un tiempo y luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para enfriar. Espolvoree con azúcar glas. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12615,8352,'es','Florentinas de almendra, naranja y jengibre','Regale estos florentinos como parte de una caja de regalo para amantes de la gastronomía en Navidad. Con jengibre, naranja, almendras y cobertura de chocolate, son deliciosamente decadentes.','["aceite sin sabor, para la lata","50 g de mantequilla salada","50 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","50 g de almíbar dorado","50 g de harina común","50 g de jengibre de tallo, picado en trozos grandes","125 g de almendras laminadas","2 naranjas, ralladas","175 g de chocolate negro","175 gramos de chocolate blanco"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Unte ligeramente la base y los lados de un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con aceite. Derretir la mantequilla, el azúcar y el almíbar dorado en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento, revolviendo frecuentemente. Retirar del fuego y agregar la harina, luego agregar el jengibre, las almendras en copos y la ralladura de naranja.","Coloque 1 cucharada plana de la mezcla en cada agujero del molde para muffins. Es posible que te quede algo de mezcla, pero puedes hornear en tandas. Hornee por 10 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Deje enfriar durante 2 minutos hasta que esté lo suficientemente firme como para transferirlo a una rejilla y enfriar por completo. Repita con cualquier parte de la mezcla restante.","Derrita el chocolate negro y el chocolate blanco en dos tazones diferentes, cada uno sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo (asegurándose de que los tazones no toquen el agua), o en el microondas en ráfagas de 30 segundos. Sumerja la mitad de un florentino enfriado en el chocolate amargo y luego rocíelo sobre el chocolate blanco. Dejar reposar sobre una rejilla. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético durante una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:53:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12616,8354,'es','Pasteles de carne picada de pan de jengibre','Combine dos pasteles navideños muy tradicionales (pan de jengibre y pasteles de carne picada) para crear un brillante clásico moderno. Cubra con mini figuras de pan de jengibre.','["400 g de carne picada (preferiblemente vegetariana, si es necesario)","50 g de tallo de jengibre, picado, más 1 cucharada de sirope de jengibre del frasco","250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","¼ cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","125 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en trozos pequeños","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 huevo batido","Cortador de galletas redondo de 8 cm.","Mini cortador de galletas de persona de jengibre."]','["Para la masa, vierta la harina, las especias y la mantequilla en un tazón grande con una pizca grande de sal. Frote con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino. Agrega el azúcar. Agrega el huevo y usa un cuchillo para mezclar todo hasta que los ingredientes comiencen a agruparse. Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase brevemente hasta obtener una masa suave. O mezcle los ingredientes en un procesador de alimentos. Forme un disco, luego envuélvalo y enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos. Se mantendrá frío durante un día o congelado durante tres meses.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Mezclar la carne picada con el jengibre y el almíbar. Extender la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener un espesor de 3 mm. Selle 12 discos con un cortador de galletas de 8 cm y presiónelos ligeramente en un molde para cupcakes de 12 agujeros.","Llene cada caja de hojaldre con 1 cucharada de la mezcla de carne picada. Vuelva a enrollar los restos de masa y saque 12 mini figuras de pan de jengibre, luego coloque una encima de cada pastel. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por dos meses.","Hornee durante 20 minutos o 30 minutos congelados. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos, luego sáquelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Espolvoree con azúcar glas. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12617,8356,'es','Tarta hundida de chocolate, aceite de oliva y avellanas','Deléitese con un pastel con una deliciosa cobertura crujiente que da paso a un centro suave y pegajoso. Con su bizcocho sin harina, es ideal para invitados que no pueden comer gluten','["100 g de avellanas blanqueadas, picadas en trozos grandes (ver el consejo a continuación)","175ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un extra para la lata","200 g de chocolate negro 70%, picado en trozos grandes","5 huevos, separados","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada de azúcar glas y helado de vainilla, para servir"]','["Calentar una sartén seca a fuego medio y verter las avellanas. Tuesta, agitando la sartén de vez en cuando, hasta que esté dorada y fragante. Transfiera a un plato para que se enfríe por completo, luego viértalo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que esté finamente picado, como pan rallado.","Engrase y forre la base y los lados de un molde desmontable de 23 cm. Vierta el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor y colóquelo sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que la base del recipiente no toque el agua. Derretir el chocolate, removiéndolo de vez en cuando. Alternativamente, derrítelo en breves ráfagas en el microondas. Una vez que esté completamente derretido, retírelo del fuego y vierta lentamente el aceite de oliva, batiendo constantemente hasta que quede suave y brillante.","Batir las yemas de huevo y 50 g de azúcar en polvo en otro bol hasta que estén pálidas y espesas, unos 5 minutos. Incorpora suavemente la mezcla de yemas batidas a la mezcla de chocolate junto con las avellanas picadas y una pizca de sal marina. (No es necesario que los ingredientes estén completamente combinados todavía). Déjelo a un lado.","Batir las claras de huevo y el azúcar restante en un recipiente aparte, usando una batidora de pie o un batidor eléctrico, hasta que se formen picos medianamente suaves. Use una cuchara grande de metal para agregar un poco de las claras a la mezcla de chocolate para aflojarla, luego agregue suavemente el resto. Vierta con cuidado la masa en el molde preparado. Se mantendrá envuelto en el congelador hasta por dos meses.","Si no congelas el pastel, calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y hornea durante 35-45 minutos. Para hornear congelado, caliente el horno como se indica arriba, pero hornee durante 55 a 60 minutos, hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio salga casi limpio, con solo unas pocas migajas adheridas. Deje enfriar en el molde hasta que esté tibio, luego retire con cuidado la base y los lados del molde. Espolvoree con azúcar glas y sirva con bolas de helado de vainilla, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:53:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12618,8358,'es','esponja genovesa','Aprenda cómo lograr el bizcocho genovés perfecto con una textura ligera y aireada. El impresionante pastel de capas de Paul Hollywood aprovecha al máximo las bayas y la crema del verano','["50 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para engrasar","250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","250 g de azúcar en polvo más 1 cucharada","8 huevos medianos","Bote de 600ml de nata doble","400 g de fresas en canastilla, cortadas por la mitad","180 g de arándanos en canastilla","150 g de frambuesas en canastilla","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear"]','["Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Unte 2 moldes para pasteles de 20 cm con mantequilla derretida, cubra las bases con papel de horno y luego espolvoree bien con harina eliminando el exceso. Dejar de lado.","Coloque el azúcar y los huevos en un recipiente grande resistente al calor y luego colóquelo sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo. Batir con un batidor de mano eléctrico durante unos 7 minutos o hasta que la mezcla esté pálida y haya triplicado su volumen. Retire del fuego, luego vierta lentamente la mantequilla, incorporándola mientras vierte hasta que esté completamente mezclada.","Incorpora suavemente la harina y una pizca de sal a la mezcla de huevo, luego vierte en los moldes para pasteles preparados. Cocine durante 20 minutos hasta que el pastel esté dorado y leudado; si se introduce una brocheta en el pastel, éste debe salir limpio. Deje que los pasteles se enfríen durante unos minutos en el molde, luego retírelos y déjelos enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla.","Mientras tanto, bata la nata hasta que mantenga su forma y luego reserve. Batir aproximadamente una cuarta parte de las fresas con 1 cucharada de azúcar hasta que quede suave, luego incorporar este puré a la crema para obtener un efecto dominó.","Para armar las tortas, corta cada una por la mitad de manera horizontal. Coloque un bizcocho en un plato para servir, esparza una cuarta parte de la mezcla de crema encima y luego coloque una cuarta parte de los arándanos y las frambuesas alrededor del borde. Repita este paso dos veces más, coloque la última capa de pastel encima (guarde la mitad superior del pastel para la capa superior), extienda la crema restante, luego coloque los arándanos y las frambuesas alrededor del borde y apile las fresas en el centro. Espolvorea con azúcar glas justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12619,8360,'es','Lasaña clásica','Prepare esta lasaña casera fácil con anticipación y guárdela en el congelador, cruda, para cuando la necesite durante una semana ocupada. Simplemente hornee por 45 minutos más.','["2 aceites de oliva, más extra para el plato","750 g de carne picada magra","paquete de 90 g de jamón serrano","800g de passata o la mitad de nuestra salsa de tomate básica","200 ml de caldo de carne caliente","nuez moscada","300 g de láminas de lasaña fresca","salsa blanca (encuentre una receta en el método o úsela comprada en la tienda)","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, cortada en tiras finas"]','["Para hacer la salsa de carne, caliente 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva en una sartén y cocine 750 g de carne magra picada en dos tandas durante unos 10 minutos hasta que se dore por completo.","Pique finamente 4 rebanadas de prosciutto de un paquete de 90 g y luego revuelva con la mezcla de carne.","Vierta sobre 800 g de passata o la mitad de nuestra receta básica de salsa de tomate y 200 ml de caldo de carne caliente. Agrega un poco de nuez moscada rallada y sazona.","Llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante 30 minutos hasta que la salsa se vea rica.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrasar ligeramente una fuente refractaria (de unos 30 x 20 cm).","Vierta un tercio de la salsa de carne en el plato y luego cubra con unas láminas de lasaña fresca de un paquete de 300 g. Rocíe aproximadamente 130 g de salsa blanca casera o ya preparada.","Repite hasta tener tres capas de pasta. Cubrir con los 390 g restantes de salsa blanca, asegurándose de que no se vea la pasta asomando.","Esparza 125 g de queso mozzarella desmenuzado por encima.","Coloca el resto del prosciutto encima. Hornee durante 45 minutos hasta que la parte superior burbujee y esté ligeramente dorada."]','2026-01-11 12:53:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12620,8362,'es','Pan de halloumi y chipotle','Disfrute de un pan lleno de texturas deliciosas y sabores intensos, con halloumi cremoso y el calor del chipotle dulce y ahumado. Disfrútalo con montones de mantequilla.','["500 g de harina fuerte para pan, más un poco más para espolvorear","25 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de sal fina","aceite vegetal, para fermentar","250 g de halloumi rallado","2 cucharadas de hojuelas de chile chipotle"]','["Pese la harina en un tazón grande. Frote la mantequilla ablandada con los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca migajas finas. Agrega la levadura y el azúcar a un lado del bol y la sal al otro. Con una espátula, mezcle todo para combinar.","Hacer un hueco en el centro y verter 300 ml de agua tibia. Con la espátula mezcla hasta tener una masa rugosa. Incline la masa sobre la superficie de trabajo y forme un montículo grande.","Amasar la masa a mano durante 10-15 minutos o en una batidora de pie equipada con un gancho para masa durante 6-8 minutos a velocidad alta hasta que quede suave y elástica. Engrase un tazón grande y vierta la masa. Cubra y deje reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Una vez que la masa se haya duplicado, inclínela sobre la superficie de trabajo y aplánela para eliminar las bolsas de aire. Espolvorea sobre el halloumi en una capa uniforme y luego el chipotle en hojuelas. Doble la masa y amase con el queso y la guindilla hasta que se distribuyan uniformemente. Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear.","Meta los bordes de la masa hacia el centro hasta obtener una bola de masa ordenada. Transfiera esto a la bandeja, con la costura hacia abajo, cúbralo con un paño de cocina limpio y déjelo reposar durante una hora más hasta que vuelva a duplicar su tamaño. Sabrás que la masa está lista cuando la pinches con el dedo; si regresa lentamente y queda una pequeña hendidura, está lista.","Calienta el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 7 con la fuente para asar en el estante inferior. Destapar la masa y tamizar ligeramente un poco de harina por encima. Corta una cruz en la parte superior con la punta de un cuchillo de sierra afilado.","Coloque el pan en su bandeja en la fuente para asar, luego vierta un poco de agua caliente en la fuente alrededor de la bandeja para generar vapor mientras hornea. Esto le dará una corteza crujiente. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que el pan esté dorado y suene hueco al golpear la base.","Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla. Córtelo en rodajas y disfrútelo con montones de mantequilla."]','2026-01-11 12:53:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12621,8364,'es','Horneado en bandeja de colinabo asado','Ase colinabo con tomates pera pequeños y cubra con crema fresca y cebollino para una cena o acompañamiento lleno de sabor. Es un gran plato para el otoño.','["2 colinabos grandes (aproximadamente 1,3 kg), pelados y cortados en gajos","230 g de tomates pera pequeños","3 ramitas de tomillo","1 chile rojo, picado en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de semillas de cilantro trituradas (opcional)","5 dientes de ajo machacados","25 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un chorrito","10 g de cebollino, finamente picado","5 g de manojo de albahaca, finamente picada","1 lima, rallada y en jugo","125 g de crema fresca"]','["Caliente el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9. Forre una bandeja para hornear grande de lados altos con papel para hornear. Coloque el colinabo, los tomates, el tomillo, la guindilla, el cilantro (si se usa) y el ajo sin pelar en la bandeja. Esparcir sobre los cubos de mantequilla y rociar sobre el aceite. Sazone bien y luego mezcle. Ase durante 20 minutos. Baje el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y cocine durante 35 minutos hasta que esté suave y ligeramente carbonizado.","Combine los ingredientes de la cobertura en un tazón y sazone. Deje que el colinabo se enfríe durante 5 minutos, luego vierta sobre el aderezo y rocíe con un poco de aceite."]','2026-01-11 12:53:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12622,8366,'es','Pasta de atún horneada en freidora','Haga de esta comida reconfortante un clásico con su freidora. Cubra con mozzarella y sirva caliente con ensalada o sus acompañamientos favoritos.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","150 g de pasta de tu elección, cocida siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","145-165 g de lata de atún en aceite de oliva, escurrido","50 g de mozzarella rallada","2 cucharadas de perejil picado"]','["Calentar la freidora a 190C. Vierta el aceite, la cebolla y el ajo en un plato resistente al calor y fríalos al aire durante 3 minutos. Agregue los tomates y las hojuelas de chile, si los usa, junto con un poco de condimento. Freír al aire durante 5 minutos más.","Reducir la temperatura a 170C. Agrega la pasta cocida, el atún, la mayor parte de la mozzarella y el perejil. Esparce la mozzarella reservada por encima.","Freír al aire durante 5 minutos hasta que estén dorados, luego cubrir con papel de aluminio y cocinar durante 5 minutos más hasta que burbujee. Servir caliente con ensalada."]','2026-01-11 12:53:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12623,8368,'es','Bollos pegajosos de baklava','Combine bollos pegajosos con baklava turco para hacer estos gloriosos bollos. El relleno está ricamente condimentado y relleno de pistachos, nueces y naranja.','["500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","3 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","320ml de leche entera","70 g de mantequilla sin sal","un poco de aceite, para leudar","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","3 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","2 naranjas grandes, ralladas","130 g de nueces","130 g de pistachos","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","pizca de pimienta de Jamaica molida","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de miel","1 cucharada de jugo de naranja"]','["Combine la harina, la levadura, el azúcar y ½ cucharadita de sal fina en un tazón grande. Calienta la leche y la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento, moviendo la cacerola regularmente hasta que comience a humear. Vierta en un tazón y deje enfriar a temperatura ambiente.","Haga un hueco en los ingredientes secos, luego vierta la mezcla de leche y mantequilla. Combine rápidamente con una cuchara, luego colóquelo sobre una superficie enharinada y amase la masa durante 10 minutos. O haga esto en una batidora de pie usando el gancho para masa durante 7 minutos. Transfiera a un recipiente ligeramente engrasado, cubra y déjelo en un lugar cálido para que duplique su tamaño durante al menos 1 hora. Alternativamente, para obtener el mejor sabor, deje reposar la masa en el refrigerador durante la noche.","Para el relleno, utiliza una cuchara de madera para batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y la ralladura de naranja. Picar finamente las nueces y 100 g de pistachos, a mano o en un procesador de alimentos. Incorpora la mezcla de mantequilla junto con la canela, la pimienta de Jamaica y ¼ de cucharadita de sal marina fina.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, forme un rectángulo rugoso y luego extiéndala hasta que tenga unos 45 x 35 cm. Extienda la mantequilla de nueces y canela sobre la masa, hasta los bordes. Trabajando desde uno de los lados más largos, enrolle la masa lo más fuerte que pueda hasta darle forma de salchicha. Cortar en 12 trozos iguales. (Puede marcar con una regla unos 3,5-4 cm por bollo y luego cortar con un trozo de hilo dental, hilo o un cuchillo afilado). Forre una bandeja o molde para hornear grande de 20 x 30 cm con papel para hornear.","Coloca los bollos, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, en la bandeja. Asegúrate de que las colas de los panecillos (donde se abre la masa) estén metidas hacia adentro para que no se desplieguen cuando se hornean. Deja algo de espacio alrededor de cada bollo, ya que se expandirán. Cubra sin apretar y déjelo reposar durante 30 a 45 minutos (dependiendo de qué tan caliente esté su cocina) hasta que los bollos estén inflados y tocándose por los lados. Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Hornea durante 30 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y leudado.","Mientras tanto, haz el almíbar. Ponga el azúcar y la miel en una cacerola pequeña, cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos y luego retire del fuego. Deje enfriar y luego agregue el jugo de naranja. Sacar los bollos del horno, verter inmediatamente sobre el almíbar y dejar enfriar.","Pica finamente los pistachos restantes y espolvoréalos sobre los bollos en pequeños montículos, tal como se hace con el baklava. Sirva caliente. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante tres días. Caliente brevemente en el horno antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 12:53:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12624,8370,'es','Muffins crumble de frambuesa y chocolate blanco','Mezcle frambuesas picantes con chispas de chocolate blanco, un bizcocho ligero y una cobertura tostada para hacer estos deliciosos muffins. Son ideales para la merienda de media mañana.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada","65 g de azúcar en polvo","65 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","125 g de yogur griego","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","5 cucharadas de leche","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","175 g de frambuesas (frescas o congeladas)","90 g de chispas de chocolate blanco","3 cucharadas de harina común","3 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","50 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en cubos","50 g de copos de avena"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con fundas de papel. Coloque todos los ingredientes de la cobertura desmenuzable en un bol junto con una pizca de sal y frótelos con las yemas de los dedos hasta obtener una mezcla desmenuzable.","Para los muffins, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar durante 5 minutos hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos gradualmente, batiendo hasta que se combinen. Incorpora el yogur, la vainilla y la leche.","Incorpora la harina, la levadura en polvo y una pizca de sal fina hasta obtener una masa suave. Por último, incorpora las frambuesas y las chispas de chocolate blanco y rellena los moldes para muffins dejando un pequeño hueco en la parte superior. Cubra los muffins con una capa de cobertura crumble y hornee por 10 minutos, luego reduzca el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y hornee por 25-30 minutos más hasta que suban y estén dorados, y al insertar un palito en el centro, éste salga limpio."]','2026-01-11 12:53:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12625,8372,'es','Tarta de queso vasca quemada','Pruebe esta tarta de queso horneada al estilo español con exterior bruñido. Con notas agridulces estilo crema y caramelo y un centro cremoso pero ligero, es celestial','["mantequilla, para la lata","800 g de queso tierno","225 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de harina común","200 g de crema agria","4 huevos medianos","2 cucharaditas de vainilla"]','["Calienta el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9 asegurando suficiente espacio sobre el estante del medio. Unte con mantequilla un molde para pasteles desmontable o de fondo suelto de 20 cm de profundidad. Coloque dos hojas grandes de papel para hornear, una encima de la otra, una hoja girada 45 grados, de modo que las esquinas apunten en diferentes direcciones. Empuja el pergamino dentro de la lata, presionando en las esquinas y asegurándote de que sobresalga mucho papel por encima del borde. Presiona los pliegues hacia los lados, pero no te preocupes por forrar el molde con demasiada precisión: las ranuras en el pergamino le dan a esta tarta de queso su aspecto característico.","Vierta el queso tierno y el azúcar en un tazón grande o en una batidora de pie. Batir con una batidora eléctrica (o batidora de pie) durante uno o dos minutos, hasta que los granos de azúcar se hayan disuelto; compruébelo frotando un poco de la mezcla entre las yemas de los dedos. Si se siente granulado, siga mezclando durante aproximadamente un minuto más.","Vierta la harina, la crema agria, los huevos, la vainilla y ¼ de cucharadita de sal en el tazón y mezcle nuevamente hasta obtener una consistencia suave. Vierta en el molde para pastel forrado, raspando hasta el último trozo de mezcla de tarta de queso. Dale un golpe fuerte a la lata contra la encimera para eliminar las burbujas de aire y luego hornea durante 30 minutos.","Una vez cocida, la tarta de queso debe estar profundamente caramelizada por fuera e inflada como un soufflé. Todavía se tambaleará cuando agite la lata. Déjelo enfriar completamente en la lata; se hundirá a medida que se enfríe. Enfríelo durante al menos 1 hora antes de servir. Se conservará en el refrigerador hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12626,8374,'es','Tarta tatin de cebolla morada','Ponga la cebolla morada en el centro del escenario en esta vibrante tarta tatin hecha con una base de hojaldre y servida con una picante salsa verde. Es un plato ideal para entretener','["320 g de masa de hojaldre ya laminada","50 g de mantequilla sin sal","3 cebollas moradas grandes, cortadas en gajos, dejando la mayor parte de la raíz intacta","2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","30 g de azúcar moreno blando","un puñado pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes","un puñado pequeño de menta, con las hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes","un puñado pequeño de cebollino, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de alcaparras, picadas en trozos grandes","1 limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","80ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4. Desenredar la lámina de hojaldre quitando el pergamino. Cortar un círculo de 25 cm de masa, utilizando como plantilla una sartén apta para horno. Coloque el círculo de masa en una bandeja y déjelo enfriar hasta que lo necesite. Derrite la mantequilla en la misma sartén a fuego medio. Una vez que esté espumosa, coloque las cebollas en círculos concéntricos en la sartén, apretándolas bien y reduzca el fuego a bajo. Sazona con una pizca de sal y cocina durante 10-15 minutos hasta que las cebollas empiecen a caramelizarse. Vigílalos para que no se quemen.","Agrega el vinagre y el azúcar y baja el fuego a medio-bajo. Cocine durante 5-8 minutos más hasta que se forme un glaseado pegajoso en la base de la sartén y las cebollas estén profundamente caramelizadas. Saca la masa del frigorífico y colócala encima de las cebollas, metiéndola por el borde. Pínchalo por todas partes con un tenedor, luego transfiérelo al horno y hornéalo durante 20-25 minutos, o hasta que la masa esté dorada y hinchada.","Mientras tanto, prepara la salsa verde. Combine las hierbas y las alcaparras en un tazón grande, luego agregue el jugo de limón, el vinagre y el aceite de oliva. Sazona con sal, pimienta y una pizca de azúcar.","Retirar la tarta tatin del horno y dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos. Coloque un plato grande sobre la sartén e invierta la tarta tatin sobre él, dejando la sartén en su lugar (deberá usar guantes para horno ya que la sartén aún estará caliente). Deje la sartén boca abajo en el plato durante unos minutos más (esto ayudará a que la tarta se suelte de la base de forma natural), luego retire la sartén y vierta sobre la salsa verde antes de cortarla en gajos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12627,8376,'es','pudín horneado','Para obtener una alternativa cálida y acogedora a la tarta Bakewell, intente preparar este pudín a base de huevo. Se sirve mejor con nata o helado.','["Hoja de 320 g de hojaldre con mantequilla ya enrollado","150 g de mantequilla, ablandada","150 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos","150 g de almendras molidas","1 limón, rallado","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","3 cucharadas de mermelada de frambuesa","25 g de almendras laminadas","1 cucharada de azúcar glas"]','["Desenrede la masa y úsela para forrar un molde para pastel o pastel de 20 cm con lados inclinados. Recorta la masa dejando unos 2 cm sobresaliendo. Enfría la masa de hojaldre mientras preparas el relleno. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en un bol con una batidora eléctrica durante 2-3 minutos hasta que quede suave y cremoso.  Agrega los huevos, las almendras molidas, la ralladura de limón, el extracto de almendras y una pizca de sal, luego bate nuevamente hasta que se combinen. Saca la funda de hojaldre de la nevera y extiende la mermelada sobre su base, luego vierte la mezcla de almendras y huevo, alisando hasta el borde con una espátula. Esparce las almendras laminadas encima y hornea durante 50 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Deje enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos, luego espolvoree con azúcar glas y sirva con nata o helado. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético durante unos días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12628,8378,'es','Brownies de calabacín','¿Cultivar calabacines en el jardín? Úselos para hacer estos gloriosos brownies de calabacín rellenos con chispas de chocolate. Servir con helado de vainilla','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, cortada en cubos, más un poco más para la lata","120 g de harina común","50 g de cacao en polvo","200 g de chocolate negro, partido en trozos","4 huevos","300 g de azúcar en polvo","1 calabacín (unos 300 g), rallado","100 g de chispas de chocolate con leche"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pastel de 30 x 20 cm o una bandeja para hornear profunda y cubrir con papel para hornear. Tamizar la harina y el cacao en un bol y reservar.","Derrita la mantequilla y el chocolate amargo juntos en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una olla con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua. O haga esto en ráfagas cortas en el microondas. Una vez derretido, déjelo enfriar un poco.","Batir los huevos y el azúcar en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que espese y duplique su volumen. (Cuando levante los batidores, la mezcla debe dejar un rastro que dure 2-3 segundos). Agregue la mezcla de chocolate derretido, seguido de la mezcla de harina, luego el calabacín rallado y las chispas de chocolate con leche. Haga esto suavemente para retener la mayor cantidad de aire posible en la masa.","Vierta la masa en el molde preparado, nivele suavemente la superficie con una espátula o espátula y hornee durante 20 a 30 minutos, o hasta que esté listo; la parte superior debe tener una corteza brillante, pero el centro debe tambalearse ligeramente. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde, aproximadamente 1 hora. Retirar sobre una tabla y cortar en 16 trozos. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12629,8380,'es','Pastel de mármol','Si necesitas un pastel fácil pero impresionante para una celebración o venta benéfica de pasteles, prueba este bizcocho de chocolate y vainilla.','["180 g de mantequilla, muy blanda, más un poco para la lata","6 huevos, separados","300 g de azúcar granulada","250ml de leche o nata","2 cucharadas de azúcar de vainilla","450 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear"]','["Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde de 2,5 litros. Calentar el horno a 180°C/160°C ventilador/gas 4. Batir las yemas con el azúcar hasta que tengan un color más claro, luego incorporar la mantequilla blanda seguida de la leche o la nata.","En otro bol batir las claras hasta que formen picos suaves, luego agregar el azúcar de vainilla y batir hasta que estén firmes. Batir la harina y el polvo de hornear con la mezcla de yemas, luego incorporar las claras.","Vierta la mitad de la masa en el molde, agregue el cacao en polvo al resto de la masa y luego vierta sobre la capa de vainilla. Utilice el mango de una cuchara para mezclar las masas. Hornee durante aproximadamente 1 hora o hasta que el pastel haya subido y esté ligeramente dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio.","Retirar el bizcocho del horno, dejar enfriar un rato en el molde, luego desmoldar y dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla. Espolvoree con azúcar glas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12630,8382,'es','Bandeja horneada de limón y flor de saúco','Esta versión inteligente del clásico recipiente para hornear tiene un delicado sabor floral, lo que lo hace ideal para servir en fiestas de primavera en el jardín o ventas de pasteles.','["250 g de cuajada de limón, más un poco para decorar","250 g de mantequilla, ablandada","250 g de azúcar en polvo","2 limones, rallado","4 huevos","100 g de harina con levadura","150 g de almendras molidas","200 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","125 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en cubos","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","1 limón, rallado","1 yema de huevo","200 g de azúcar glas","2 limones en jugo (use los limones rallados arriba)","2 cucharadas de cordial de flor de saúco"]','["Primero, haz la masa. Vierta la harina, la mantequilla, el azúcar y la ralladura de limón en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino. Vierta la yema de huevo y ½-1 cucharada de agua fría y mezcle nuevamente para formar una masa. Si la masa no se une, agregue más agua fría, ½ cucharadita a la vez, y vuelva a mezclar. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener un grosor de 3 mm, luego úsela para forrar la base de una bandeja para hornear o brownie de fondo suelto (la nuestra era de 20 x 30 cm). Transfiera a la nevera y enfríe durante 20 minutos.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cubra la caja de masa fría con papel para hornear y frijoles para hornear, luego hornee por 15 minutos. Retire el pergamino y los frijoles y hornee por 5 minutos más hasta que la masa esté ligeramente dorada. Dejar enfriar unos minutos antes de esparcir sobre la crema de limón, dejando un borde de 2 cm alrededor de los bordes (se extenderá cuando se vierta la masa del bizcocho). Bajar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y la ralladura de limón con una batidora eléctrica o en una batidora de pie hasta que estén pálidos, suaves y esponjosos, aproximadamente 8 minutos. Batir los huevos, uno a la vez junto con 1 cucharada de harina, luego incorporar el resto de la harina y las almendras molidas. Con cuidado, vierta la masa sobre la cuajada de limón y extiéndala suavemente con el dorso de la cuchara, luego hornee durante 35 a 40 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde y luego retirar con cuidado sobre una tabla.","Para hacer el glaseado, combine el azúcar glas, el jugo de limón y el cordial de flor de saúco hasta que esté lo suficientemente suelto como para rociarlo sobre el bizcocho, luego agítelo con más cuajada de limón, si lo desea. Córtelo en cuadritos y sirva. Se conservará en una lata hermética hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12631,8384,'es','Muffins especiados de chirivía y arce','¿Tienes un exceso de chirivías? Haga algo diferente con esta caja de verduras favorita y prepare muffins de chirivía y arce especiados para el molde del pastel.','["200 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de canela molida, más un poco más para servir (opcional)","1 cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","125 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 chirivía (unos 200 g), pelada y rallada","100 g de nueces pecanas picadas, más 10-12 nueces enteras para servir (opcional)","3 cucharadas de jarabe de arce","3 huevos","125 ml de aceite vegetal","50 g de azúcar glas","50 g de mantequilla blanda","100 g de queso tierno","1 cucharada de jarabe de arce, más algo extra para rociar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con fundas de papel. Tamiza la harina, el polvo para hornear, la canela y la nuez moscada en un bol grande. Vierta el azúcar y frote los grumos entre los dedos para deshacerlos.","Incorpora la chirivía rallada y las nueces picadas, asegurándote de que todo esté completamente combinado. Vierta el jarabe de arce en una jarra y mezcle los huevos y el aceite. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos en los secos y mezcle con una cuchara de madera hasta que estén casi combinados con algunas motas de harina restantes. Vierta aproximadamente 2 cucharadas de masa en cada caja, de modo que estén llenas aproximadamente hasta las tres cuartas partes. Hornee durante 22-24 minutos hasta que suba y al insertar una brocheta en el medio de un muffin, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos antes de transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Tamiza el azúcar en un bol y añade la mantequilla con unas varillas eléctricas. Incorpora el queso tierno y el jarabe de arce. Si el glaseado está demasiado suelto, bata durante unos minutos más o enfríe hasta que vuelva a endurecerse.","Vierta o coloque el glaseado sobre los muffins enfriados, luego rocíe un poco de jarabe de arce, espolvoree con canela y decore cada uno con una nuez entera, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:53:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12632,8386,'es','Rollito de Pascua con triple chocolate','Prepare este rico trino para el Domingo de Pascua: es casi como un cruce entre un pastel y un brownie','["aceite vegetal, para la lata","150 g de chocolate amargo, picado","5 huevos","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo, más un poco más para espolvorear","110 g de chocolate blanco, picado","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","250 g de mascarpone","200ml de nata doble","200ml de nata doble","200 g de chocolate con leche, picado","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","una mezcla de mini huevos de chocolate, para decorar","barras de chocolate blanco y negro, picadas o partidas en trozos grandes, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrasar ligeramente un molde para panecillos de 33 x 23 cm. Cubra la base y los lados con papel para hornear y luego vuelva a engrasar ligeramente. Derrita el chocolate amargo en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo (asegurándose de que la base del recipiente no toque el agua), o en ráfagas de 20 segundos en el microondas. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Separar los huevos poniendo las claras en un bol grande y las yemas en otro. Batir las claras a punto de nieve con una batidora eléctrica; deben mantener su forma. Agrega el azúcar a las yemas y bate hasta que la mezcla esté pálida. Incorpora el chocolate amargo derretido a la mezcla de yemas, luego afloja la mezcla de chocolate incorporando dos cucharadas grandes de las claras de huevo batidas. Agregue las claras de huevo batidas restantes, el cacao y ¼ de cucharadita de sal, y mezcle todo suavemente para combinar, teniendo cuidado de no perder el aire. Vierta la masa en el molde preparado y hornee por 18 minutos. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar hasta que esté tibio.","Mientras el bizcocho aún está caliente, enróllelo suavemente formando una espiral (con el papel para hornear adentro) desde uno de los extremos cortos. Dejar enfriar por completo, aún enrollado (esto hará que sea más fácil enrollarlo una vez lleno). Derretir el chocolate blanco como lo hiciste con el oscuro, luego dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos. Batir la vainilla, el mascarpone, la crema doble y el chocolate blanco derretido hasta que la mezcla esté espesa y se pueda tomar con una cuchara.","Coloque el rollo enrollado sobre una hoja de papel para hornear y desenrede con cuidado. Retire el papel de hornear original y luego extienda uniformemente el relleno de mascarpone y chocolate blanco sobre el bizcocho, dejando un pequeño borde alrededor de los bordes. Usando el pergamino como guía, enrolle el rollito nuevamente formando una espiral y déjelo enfriar durante 20 minutos.","Para la cobertura, calentar la nata doble en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento hasta que esté humeante. Vierta el chocolate con leche en un recipiente resistente al calor con el almíbar dorado y luego viértalo sobre la nata caliente. Deje reposar por un momento, luego revuelva todo hasta que se derrita y quede suave. Coloque el rollito sobre una rejilla colocada sobre una bandeja para hornear y vierta suavemente la ganache sobre la parte superior para que gotee por los lados. Cubra el rollo con los mini huevos de chocolate y los trozos de chocolate, luego déjelo reposar un poco antes de cortarlo en rodajas. Se mantendrá cubierto y frío hasta por 24 horas."]','2026-01-11 12:53:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12633,8388,'es','Tarta de chocolate fácil','Perfecta para una cena, esta tarta vegana tiene una base digestiva crujiente y un relleno cremoso de chocolate elaborado con leche de coco.','["350 g de galletas digestivas","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","1 cucharada de harina común","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","125-175 g de margarina o mantequilla vegana, más un poco más para la lata","2 latas de 400 g de leche de coco, fría","200 gramos de chocolate amargo","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","spray comestible con purpurina plateada u dorada","frambuesas"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Tritura las galletas hasta obtener migajas en un bol usando la punta de un rodillo o pulsando en un procesador de alimentos. Agrega el cacao en polvo, la harina, el almíbar y suficiente margarina o mantequilla vegana para crear una masa. Unte con mantequilla un molde para tarta de fondo suelto de 23 cm y presione la mezcla en el molde.","Hornee en el horno durante 10-12 minutos y luego déjelo enfriar en el molde.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Abre las latas de leche de coco que se habrán separado con el agua arriba y el coco espeso abajo. Deseche el agua (o úsela para hacer un batido) y vierta el coco espeso en un bol.","Rompe el chocolate amargo en trozos y derrítelo en el microondas a temperatura alta en ráfagas de 10 segundos, revolviendo entre ellos, o en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una olla con agua hirviendo hasta que quede suave. Agrega el coco junto con el almíbar dorado y bate todo batiendo fuerte hasta que no queden grumos de coco.","Vierta el relleno sobre la base de la tarta y refrigere para que cuaje durante 3-4 horas, o toda la noche.","Rocíe la tarta con spray comestible de purpurina plateada o dorada, si lo desea, y sírvala con frambuesas. Se conservará en el refrigerador durante tres días; de hecho, sabe aún mejor uno o dos días después de hornearse."]','2026-01-11 12:53:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12634,8390,'es','Mücver al horno (calabacín y queso feta horneado)','Convierta los buñuelos de calabacín de inspiración mediterránea en un horneado grande: es más fácil de cocinar, más sustancioso y se puede servir como almuerzo con ensalada y yogur de ajo.','["6 calabacines (unos 325 g)","2 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","½ manojo pequeño de menta, finamente picada","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado, más un poco más para servir","4 huevos","75 g de halloumi rallado","100 g de queso feta desmenuzado","2 dientes de ajo rallados","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para la lata","80 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo tostadas, más algo extra para servir","1 cucharada de semillas de nigella, más extra para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Rallar los calabacines en trozos grandes en un paño de cocina limpio, envolverlos y exprimir todo el exceso de líquido. Vierta en un colador y luego déjelo a un lado para que se escurra por completo. Mientras tanto, vierte todos los ingredientes restantes en un tazón grande. Añade los calabacines escurridos y rallados, sazona y mezcla.","Forre una fuente para horno o un molde para pasteles redondo de aproximadamente 25-26 cm con papel para hornear y rocíe con aceite de oliva extra para cubrir la superficie. Calentar el plato en el horno durante 5 minutos.","Retire con cuidado la fuente del horno y vierta la mezcla de calabacín sobre el aceite caliente (esto asegurará que la mezcla se dore en el fondo). Espolvorea con las semillas extra de sésamo y nigella y hornea durante 35 minutos hasta que se doren por encima. Dejar reposar al menos 20 minutos antes de servir espolvoreado con más eneldo."]','2026-01-11 12:53:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12635,8392,'es','Pastel de limón','Es difícil no demoler esta clásica llovizna de limón de una sola vez, así que ¿por qué no hacer dos a la vez?','["225 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","225 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos","225 g de harina con levadura","1 limón, rallado","1½ limones, exprimidos","85 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo hasta que estén pálidos y cremosos, luego agregar los huevos, uno a la vez, mezclando lentamente.","Tamice la harina con levadura, luego agregue la ralladura de limón y mezcle hasta que esté bien combinado.","Forre un molde para pan (8 x 21 cm) con papel vegetal, luego vierta la mezcla y nivele la parte superior con una cuchara.","Hornee durante 45-50 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta fina en el centro del pastel, ésta salga limpia.","Mientras el bizcocho se enfría en su molde, mezcle el jugo de limón y el azúcar en polvo para hacer un chorrito.","Pinche todo el pastel tibio con una brocheta o un tenedor, luego vierta sobre la llovizna; el jugo se absorberá y el azúcar formará una cobertura deliciosa y crujiente.","Déjelo en la lata hasta que se enfríe por completo, luego retírelo y sirva. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante 3 a 4 días o se congelará hasta por 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:53:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12636,8394,'es','Tarta de crema cuajada de limón','Prepare un rico y delicado pastel de limón como delicia por la tarde. Tiene una deliciosa cuajada de limón que le da una cobertura pegajosa. Disfruta con helado','["125 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más 2 cucharadas","100 g de nata cuajada","2 limones, rallados y exprimidos","2 huevos","200 g de harina con levadura","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","4 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","helado de vainilla, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm y forrar con papel para hornear. Ponga la mantequilla, 200 g de azúcar, la nata cuajada y la ralladura de limón en el bol de una batidora y bata durante 3-5 minutos hasta que adquiera un color más claro y esté cremoso. Alternativamente, use un tazón grande y una cuchara de madera. Vierta la mitad del jugo de limón y bata durante 2 minutos más hasta que esté bien combinado. Rompe los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Finalmente, agregue la harina y el polvo para hornear, asegurándose de que estén bien combinados, sin bolsas de harina. Vierta la mezcla en el molde; quedará bastante espesa. Batir la cuajada de limón en un tazón pequeño para que se suelte y rociar sobre la masa. Hornee durante 40-45 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, vierta el jugo de limón restante y 2 cucharadas de azúcar en un bol. Revuelva bien para combinar antes de rociar generosamente esto sobre el pastel. Transfiera a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo, luego córtelo en rodajas y sirva con helado de vainilla, si lo desea. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12637,8396,'es','pastelitos de caramelo salado','Date un capricho con estos sencillos cupcakes con bizcocho con sabor a caramelo y cobertura de caramelo salado. Perfecto para el té de la tarde','["100 g de mantequilla salada blanda","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharada de leche","6 cucharaditas de salsa de caramelo","75 g de mantequilla blanda con sal","150 g de azúcar glas","200 g de salsa de caramelo","una pizca de escamas de sal marina"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar un molde para pastel de 12 agujeros con fundas de papel.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, y el extracto de vainilla. Mezcle brevemente la harina hasta que esté combinada y agregue la leche hasta que la masa se desprenda de los batidores.","Divida la mezcla entre las cajas, dejando aproximadamente 2 cucharadas de masa en el tazón. Agrega una pizca de sal a la salsa de caramelo si no es caramelo salado, luego agrega ½ cucharadita a la parte superior de cada cupcake. Use una cucharadita para cubrir la salsa de caramelo con la masa restante. Hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté elástico y dorado. Dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Batir la mantequilla y la mitad del azúcar glas, luego verter el azúcar glas restante y batir vigorosamente hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agregue la mitad de la salsa de caramelo y luego vierta la mezcla en una manga pastelera con boquilla redonda o de estrella.","Coloca remolinos de glaseado encima de los cupcakes enfriados. Revuelva el resto de la salsa de caramelo con una pizca de sal, si no tiene sal, y luego úsela para rociar sobre el glaseado. Espolvoree una pizca de sal marina sobre cada uno, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:53:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12638,8398,'es','Bollos cruzados calientes de masa madre','¿Disfrutas horneando pan de masa madre? Entonces tienes que probar estos panecillos cruzados calientes. Requieren más esfuerzo, pero el resultado son algunos de los mejores bollos que jamás hayas probado.','["300 g de masa madre activa (ver receta a continuación)","2 huevos grandes, batidos","200ml de leche","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","60 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","1 naranja, rallada","150 g de pasas o una mezcla de pequeños frutos secos (como pasas, piel mixta y arándanos)","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada"]','["Antes de comenzar, asegúrese de que la masa madre esté muy burbujeante (si no lo está, aliméntela y espere hasta que 1 cucharadita de masa madre flote en agua tibia). Vierta 200 g de masa madre en un tazón grande con todo menos 2 cucharadas de huevo, la leche, la harina, el azúcar, la canela, la mezcla de especias, la ralladura de naranja y las pasas. Mezclar con las manos hasta obtener una masa peluda (se debe mezclar toda la harina). O haga esto en una batidora de pie equipada con un gancho para masa. Cubrir con un paño de cocina limpio y húmedo y dejar reposar durante 30 minutos. Cubra el resto de la masa madre y manténgala fría.","Incorpora la mantequilla y 1 cucharadita de sal a la masa aplastándola con las manos. Una vez que esté completamente combinada, incline la masa sobre una superficie y amase suavemente durante 5 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástica (nuevamente, esto se puede hacer en una batidora de pie equipada con un gancho para masa). Forme una bola con la masa y luego regrésela al bol. Cubra y déjelo en un lugar ligeramente cálido durante 3-4 horas para que repose hasta que la masa casi haya duplicado su tamaño.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada y amase brevemente, luego divídala en 12 trozos, de unos 100 g cada uno. Enrolle los trozos en bolas y colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear, dejando algo de espacio entre cada uno. Cubra con un paño de cocina limpio y húmedo, luego déjelo reposar nuevamente durante 2 a 3 horas a temperatura ambiente hasta que duplique su tamaño, o enfríelo durante la noche (esto dará como resultado un mejor sabor y una forma más ordenada).","Si los panecillos se han enfriado, sácalos del frigorífico 1 hora antes de hornearlos. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Pintar los bollos con el huevo reservado. Vierta el resto del iniciador en una bolsa para manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla pequeña y coloque cruces sobre los panecillos. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que se dore. Deje que se enfríe un poco y sirva tibio o enfríe por completo. Es mejor consumirlo ese mismo día, pero se conservará durante dos días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:53:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12639,8400,'es','pan crujiente','Pruebe nuestra receta de siguiente nivel para pan blanco crujiente: lleva mucho más tiempo prepararlo, pero el resultado será la mejor barra de pan que haya horneado en casa.','["500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","4 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","10 g de sal marina fina, sal marina en escamas o sal de mesa"]','["Vierte la harina en un bol grande junto con la levadura. Vierta 325 g de agua a temperatura ambiente (obtendrá una cantidad más precisa pesando el agua, pero también puede usar 325 ml, dependiendo de su báscula), luego use las manos o una espátula para mezclar hasta que se forme una masa. Es importante que te asegures de mezclar toda la harina, incluidos los trozos que se encuentran en los lados del tazón. Cubrir con un paño de cocina húmedo y dejar reposar durante 30 minutos.","Espolvoree la sal y luego incorpórela estirando la masa sobre la sal varias veces hasta que esté completamente incorporada. Vierta sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Usa la palma de una mano para estirar la masa mientras la sostienes con la otra mano. Luego, dobla la masa sobre sí misma, gírala 90 grados hacia la izquierda y repite. Haga esto durante unos 5 minutos, o hasta que la masa luzca más brillante e inmediatamente rebote cuando se forma una bola apretada o se empuja suavemente. Enrolle la masa hasta formar una bola apretada, cúbrala con un paño de cocina húmedo y déjela reposar a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora hasta que doble su tamaño. O, para obtener un sabor más intenso, transfiéralo a un recipiente limpio, tápelo y déjelo reposar en el refrigerador durante la noche hasta que duplique su tamaño. Es más fácil trabajar con la masa fría, por lo que es mejor pasar la noche.","Cuando la masa haya duplicado su tamaño y esté liviana y esponjosa, inclínela sobre una superficie de trabajo y amásela unas cuantas veces más para eliminar el aire. Formar una bola con la masa y dejar reposar 5 minutos. Forme suavemente la bola de masa hasta darle una forma redondeada y apretada sobre la superficie de trabajo, luego inclínela con el lado abovedado hacia abajo en una canasta o tazón de fermentación forrado con un paño de cocina limpio. Déjelo reposar en un lugar cálido durante 40 minutos a 1 hora, o en el refrigerador durante 2 a 3 horas hasta que aproximadamente duplique su tamaño.","Introducir una cazuela con su tapa en el horno, luego calentar el horno a 230C/210C ventilador/gas 8. Una vez que el horno esté a temperatura, retirar la cazuela. Voltee la masa sobre un cuadrado de papel para hornear, córtelo con un cuchillo afilado y use los lados del papel para bajar con cuidado la masa (aún sobre el papel) en la cazuela caliente. Cubrir con la tapa. Hornee por 25 minutos. Retire la tapa y hornee durante 5 a 10 minutos más hasta que tenga una corteza crujiente y profundamente dorada y suene hueco cuando se golpea en el fondo. Deje enfriar sobre una rejilla durante 40 minutos antes de cortarlo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12640,8402,'es','pastel de vaquero','¿Qué dice mejor la comida reconfortante que las salchichas y los frijoles horneados en un pastel cubierto con puré de papa mantecoso y con queso? Este es un favorito familiar garantizado.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla, finamente picada","8 salchichas de cerdo, cortadas en trozos pequeños","2 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente rallados","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado picante","2 latas de 410 g de judías cocidas","3 cucharadas de salsa barbacoa","1 kg de patatas, peladas y picadas en trozos grandes","50 g de mantequilla","4 cucharadas de leche","75 g de queso cheddar rallado","2 cucharadas de cebollino picado, para decorar, opcional"]','["Primero, haz el puré de patatas. Hierva una cacerola grande con agua con sal a fuego medio y luego agregue con cuidado las patatas picadas. Cocine durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir, luego volver a colocar en la sartén y dejar secar al aire durante un par de minutos antes de triturar. Vierta la mantequilla y la leche y revuelva hasta que se combinen. Reservar con la tapa puesta para mantener el calor.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C/gas 6. Mientras se cocinan las patatas, calentar el aceite en una sartén o cazo a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla durante 6-8 minutos hasta que se ablande. Vierta los trozos de salchicha y fríalos durante 4 minutos hasta que se doren por completo, luego agregue el ajo y cocine por 1 minuto antes de agregar el pimentón ahumado y cocinar por 1 minuto más. Vierta los frijoles y la salsa barbacoa y cocine hasta que esté a punto de hervir a fuego lento antes de retirar del fuego.","Vierta la mezcla de salchicha y frijoles en una fuente o fuente para horno (la nuestra era de 20x20 cm), luego vierta sobre el puré de papa y espolvoree el queso cheddar rallado encima. Hornee en el horno durante 25-30 minutos hasta que burbujee en los bordes y el queso esté dorado. Retirar del horno y esparcir sobre las cebolletas, si las usa."]','2026-01-11 12:53:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12641,8404,'es','pastel de zanahoria brasileño','¿Te encanta el pastel de zanahoria? Pruebe esta versión de inspiración brasileña del favorito para hornear, con un toque de chocolate que lo lleva a nuevos niveles de delicia.','["250ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para la lata","260 g de harina común","400 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 zanahorias medianas (unos 250 g), peladas y picadas en trozos grandes","2 huevos","250ml de leche","30 g de cacao en polvo","60 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar la base de un molde desmontable de 20 cm. Mezcle la harina, el azúcar y el polvo para hornear en un tazón grande y reserve. Vierta el aceite, las zanahorias y los huevos en la licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos en los secos, revolviendo hasta que quede suave.","Vierta la masa en el molde para pastel y agítelo para eliminar las burbujas de aire. Hornee durante 45 minutos a 1 hora, hasta que al insertar un cuchillo o una brocheta limpia en el medio, éste salga limpio. Si el centro está pegajoso, volver a meter en el horno otros 5 minutos. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar en el molde.","Para el chorrito, calentar en un cazo la leche, el cacao y el azúcar a fuego lento. Revuelva hasta que el azúcar se disuelva (aproximadamente 5 minutos), creando una llovizna espesa y brillante.","Retire el pastel del molde y nivele la parte superior con un cuchillo de sierra, luego voltee para que la parte inferior se convierta en la parte superior. Perfore todo con un cuchillo o un palillo y colóquelo sobre una rejilla con una bandeja o tazón grande debajo. Vierta la llovizna sobre el pastel en tandas hasta que se absorba por completo. Puedes reutilizar cualquier llovizna que quede en la bandeja o bol. La mayor parte de la llovizna debería absorberse."]','2026-01-11 12:53:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12642,8406,'es','galletas de coco','Prepara estas galletas de coco para un estimulante perfecto. Están recubiertos de lujoso chocolate amargo y chispas de coco tostado.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","75 g de azúcar en polvo","75 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","1 huevo grande","275 g de harina común","125 g de coco rallado, tostado y enfriado","100 gramos de chocolate amargo"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Batir la mantequilla en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica en una batidora de pie hasta que esté muy suave. Incorpora ambos azúcares y la vainilla hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos, luego bate el huevo hasta que esté combinado. Tamiza la harina y una pizca de sal y revuelve para combinar. Incorpora 100 g de coco tostado.","Enrolle la masa en 14-16 bolas (de unos 45 g cada una) y colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear, bien espaciadas entre sí. Aplana cada uno ligeramente con la palma de tu mano y hornea durante 12-15 minutos hasta que estén dorados y ligeramente firmes al tacto. Deje enfriar brevemente en la bandeja, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Rompe el chocolate en trozos y viértelo en un recipiente resistente al calor, luego derrítelo en ráfagas de 20 segundos en el microondas. O coloque el recipiente sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua, y revuelva hasta que quede suave. Sumerja la mitad de cada galleta en el chocolate derretido, luego colóquela sobre una hoja de papel para hornear y espolvoree con el coco tostado restante. Dejar reposar unos 30 minutos."]','2026-01-11 12:53:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12643,8408,'es','Mordeduras robadas','Convierte el stollen en golosinas del tamaño de un bocado. Con pan dulce y blando salpicado de fruta y envuelto en mazapán, es fácil ver por qué este horneado alemán es tan popular.','["150 g de pasas","300 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","¼ cucharadita de cardamomo molido","¼ cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","¼ cucharadita de canela molida","150ml de leche entera","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","1 huevo mediano","1 limón, rallado","100 g de cerezas glaseadas, picadas en trozos grandes","aceite sin sabor, para fermentar","250 g de mazapán","100 g de azúcar glas y un poco más para espolvorear","75 g de mantequilla sin sal"]','["Coloque las pasas en un recipiente resistente al calor y vierta sobre 100 ml de agua caliente del hervidor. Déjelo en remojo durante al menos 2 horas o toda la noche.","Vierta la harina, la levadura, el azúcar en polvo, las especias y 1 cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande. Calienta la leche en una sartén a fuego lento o en el microondas hasta que esté tibia, pero sin que hierva. Batir la vainilla y el huevo con la leche tibia y verter en los ingredientes secos. Use sus manos para combinar todo hasta obtener una masa suave, luego colóquela sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que esté suave y elástica. (También puede hacer esto en una batidora de pie equipada con el gancho para masa, durante 5 minutos).","Escurrir bien las pasas y amasarlas junto con la ralladura de limón y las cerezas hasta que la fruta se distribuya uniformemente. Limpiar el bol y engrasarlo ligeramente, luego devolver la masa al bol, cubrir con un paño de cocina limpio y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 2 horas, o hasta que aproximadamente doble su tamaño. También puedes reposar en el frigorífico durante la noche para realzar el sabor de la masa.","Forre un molde para pastel de 20 x 20 cm con papel para hornear. Si la masa está fría, déjala a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora antes de darle forma. Sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada, córtela por la mitad y enrolle o estire cada pieza hasta formar un cuadrado que quepa en el molde. Utiliza un trozo para forrar la base, luego extiende el mazapán sobre una superficie espolvoreada con azúcar glas del mismo tamaño que la masa y colócalo encima. Coloque el segundo cuadrado de masa encima, pellizcándolo alrededor de los bordes para sellar el mazapán. Cubra sin apretar y deje reposar nuevamente durante 30 minutos a 1 hora, o hasta que suba ligeramente. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Hornee por 30 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 5 a 10 minutos, luego levántelo sobre una rejilla y déjelo enfriar por completo. Una vez enfriado, córtelo en 25-36 mini cuadrados (use una regla si quiere ser preciso). Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña a fuego lento y úsela para untar la parte superior de los bocados de stollen, luego espolvoree generosamente con azúcar glas. Déjelo reposar durante 30 minutos y luego sirva. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12644,8410,'es','Rubias de ruibarbo y natillas','Agregue natillas en polvo a la mezcla de rubios para obtener una textura más esponjosa. Combínalo con ruibarbo para obtener una combinación de sabores clásica o prueba con un poco de mermelada o compota.','["225 g de mantequilla salada (o sin sal con una pizca de sal), más un poco más para la lata","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar en polvo","150 g de harina común","50 g de natillas en polvo","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 huevos medianos","250 g de chispas de chocolate blanco o chocolate blanco finamente picado","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","200 g de ruibarbo (congelado o enlatado y escurrido está bien)","75 g de azúcar en polvo","colorante alimentario rosa o rojo (opcional)","4 cucharadas de crema pastelera ya preparada (de cartón está bien o hecha con polvo)"]','["Para el remolino de ruibarbo y natillas, coloque el ruibarbo y el azúcar en una cacerola ancha con 2 cucharadas de agua (omita el agua si usa ruibarbo enlatado). Cocine a fuego medio, revolviendo frecuentemente durante unos 10 minutos, hasta que el ruibarbo se deshaga y se vuelva mermelada. Agrega unas gotas de colorante alimentario si quieres un remolino de ruibarbo rosado, pero el sabor seguirá siendo excelente si usas ruibarbo teñido de verde. Dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner en una cacerola la mantequilla y ambos azúcares y poner a fuego lento. Derretir hasta que quede suave y brillante, luego retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos mientras tamizas la harina, las natillas en polvo y el polvo de hornear en un bol. Unte con mantequilla un molde para hornear de 20 x 30 cm y forre con papel para hornear.","Batir los huevos con la mezcla enfriada de azúcar y mantequilla, luego incorporar los ingredientes secos hasta obtener una masa suave. Agrega 150 g de chispas de chocolate y la vainilla. Vierta en la lata de brownie y luego use una cucharadita para hacer girar la compota de ruibarbo sobre la masa. Agregue cucharadas de natillas y luego pase una brocheta o un palito por la compota para crear un patrón veteado.","Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que cuaje y los bordes se despeguen de los lados del molde, luego déjelo enfriar en el molde. Derrita los 100 g de chocolate restantes en breves ráfagas en el microondas o en un recipiente colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Use una cuchara para rociar el chocolate sobre la rubia en forma de zig-zag. Córtelo en cuadritos para servir. Se conservará durante tres días en un recipiente hermético o congelará los cuadritos individualmente."]','2026-01-11 12:53:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12645,8412,'es','Pastel crumble de mermelada de moras y almendras','Disfrute de estas rebanadas de pastel de moras y almendras para el té de la tarde o como postre servidas con helado de vainilla. Están hechos con moras frescas y mermelada.','["225 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para la lata","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más 1 cucharada","3 huevos medianos","275 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","50 g de almendras molidas","2 cucharadas de leche","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla o almendras","3 cucharadas de mermelada de frutos rojos de tu elección (nosotros usamos grosella negra)","150 g de moras","un puñado de almendras laminadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4, untar con mantequilla un molde cuadrado de 20 cm y forrar con papel de horno. Batir 200 g de mantequilla y 200 g de azúcar en un bol grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Batir los huevos, uno a la vez, hasta que estén bien combinados. Cuando esté suave y cremoso, agregue 225 g de harina, el polvo para hornear, las almendras, la leche y la vainilla y mezcle para combinar.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde y nivele la superficie con una espátula. Coloque cucharaditas de mermelada y luego esparza sobre las moras, presionándolas suavemente.","Para hacer la cobertura crumble, pesa los 25 g restantes de mantequilla y los 25 g de azúcar en un bol, añade el resto de la harina y una pizca de sal. Frote los ingredientes entre las yemas de los dedos hasta que tengan una consistencia quebradiza. Incorpora las almendras en copos y luego esparce el crumble sobre el pastel. Espolvorea con 1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo y hornea por 45 minutos hasta que al insertar un palillo en el medio, éste salga limpio.","Si el pastel no está listo, regresa al horno por 5 a 10 minutos más y luego revisa nuevamente. Dejar enfriar durante al menos 20 minutos en el molde antes de cortar y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12646,8414,'es','Rollitos de canela de hojaldre','Utilice hojaldre ya preparado para preparar rápida y fácilmente estos rollos de canela; un hojaldre exclusivamente con mantequilla le dará el mejor sabor.','["1½ cucharada de canela molida","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","320 g de hojaldre ya enrollado","harina común, para espolvorear","1 huevo mediano, batido","50 g de azúcar glas"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Mezcle la canela y el azúcar en un tazón pequeño. Desenreda el hojaldre sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y luego espolvorea la mezcla de azúcar y canela por toda la parte superior. Nivele suavemente la mezcla de azúcar y canela con el dorso de una cuchara para que cubra la masa casi por completo, dejando un borde de 1 cm en uno de los lados cortos. Pincelar un poco de huevo batido sobre el borde de masa expuesto.","Enrolle la masa formando un tronco apretado por el lado corto sin el borde. Presione suavemente a lo largo del borde lavado con huevo para sellar, luego córtelo en 12 rondas iguales. Coloca los rollos de canela en la bandeja para hornear preparada, colocándolos uno contra el otro para que apenas se toquen. Unte el huevo batido restante por toda la parte superior y los lados de la masa, luego hornee durante 15-18 minutos hasta que esté dorado y leudado. Dejar enfriar en la bandeja durante 10-15 minutos.","Combine el azúcar glas con 1½ cucharadita de agua en un tazón pequeño hasta obtener un glaseado espeso que se escurra fácilmente de la cuchara. Rocíe esto sobre los panecillos calientes y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:53:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12647,7419,'es','Pollo asado en lata tikka masala','Prepare una cena rápida y abundante entre semana con este pollo al curry horneado todo en uno. Servir con naans y cebolla morada finamente picada.','["4 muslos de pollo grandes","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","2 dientes de ajo grandes","1 cebolla, picada en trozos grandes","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","1 chile rojo, picado en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de ghee o mantequilla","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma molida","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","4 cucharadas de puré de tomate","4 vainas de cardamomo, machacadas con la punta de un rodillo","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","200 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","100ml de nata doble","½ manojo de cilantro, finamente picado","½ cebolla morada, finamente picada, para servir","arroz pilau cocido y naans, para servir"]','["Sazona las piernas de pollo con un poco de sal. Caliente el aceite de colza en una sartén grande antiadherente a fuego alto y agregue las piernas de pollo a la sartén, con la piel hacia abajo. Freír durante 5-7 minutos, volteando ocasionalmente hasta que estén dorados y crujientes por todos lados. Retirar a un plato y reservar.","Pele los dientes de ajo y tritúrelos hasta obtener un puré en un procesador de alimentos con la cebolla, el jengibre y la guindilla. Calienta el ghee o la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio y cocina el puré de cebolla durante 15 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia. Agregue las especias, el puré de tomate y el cardamomo, luego cocine por 2 minutos más. Agregue los tomates enlatados, el caldo y el azúcar, cocine a fuego lento, cubra y cocine por 15 minutos más. Sazone al gusto.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Revuelve la crema doble con la salsa, luego viértela en una fuente para hornear lo suficientemente grande como para que quepan todas las piernas de pollo en una sola capa. Coloque las piernas de pollo en la salsa y hornee en el horno durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén bien cocidas; los jugos deben salir claros al perforar con la punta de un cuchillo en la parte más gruesa de las piernas. Esparza con las hojas de cilantro y la cebolla morada, luego sirva con arroz pilau y naans para absorber la salsa."]','2026-01-11 12:53:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12648,8416,'es','Tarta de cítricos, almendras y yogur','Disfrute de este sabroso pastel de cítricos, almendras y yogur para el té de la tarde. Se sirve mejor caliente con una taza de té.','["165 g de mantequilla, más un poco para la lata","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más 2 cucharadas","150 g de harina con levadura","100 g de almendras molidas","3 huevos","75 g de yogur natural, más 2 cucharadas","1 limón grande","1 naranja","100 g de azúcar glas","15 g de almendras laminadas tostadas"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco. Mientras tanto, unte con mantequilla un molde desmontable de 23 cm y forre con papel para hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Ponga los 200 g de azúcar en polvo, la harina y las almendras molidas en un bol grande y mezcle bien. Batir los huevos y 75 g de yogur con la mantequilla derretida enfriada y luego verter esto en el bol con los ingredientes secos. Ralla el limón y la naranja sobre el bol. Revuelva con una espátula hasta que no queden rayas de harina, luego raspe el molde y hornee en el estante central del horno durante 40 minutos.","Corta algunas rodajas de limón y naranja ralladas, luego exprime el jugo de lo que queda de cada una en una cacerola (necesitarás aproximadamente 6 cucharadas en total). Agrega las 2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo y las rodajas de fruta a la sartén. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar durante 5 a 10 minutos, o hasta que el jugo se haya reducido a un almíbar fino y las rodajas de fruta se hayan ablandado. Dejar enfriar. Retire las rodajas de fruta a una hoja de papel para hornear y déjelas secar.","Inserta una brocheta en el medio del pastel; debe salir seca, sin mezcla húmeda para pastel adherida. Si no está listo, hornee por 5 a 10 minutos más y verifique nuevamente. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos y luego vierta sobre el almíbar de cítricos. Dejar enfriar 10 minutos más y luego desmoldar. Para congelar, primero dejar enfriar por completo y luego envolver bien el bizcocho. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por tres meses.","Mezcla las 2 cucharadas de yogur con el azúcar glas para hacer un glaseado espeso. Coloque esto en el centro del pastel y use el dorso de una cuchara para llevarlo hasta el borde (debe gotear por el costado). Repartir sobre las almendras laminadas y decorar con las rodajas de fruta. Sirva caliente o déjelo enfriar por completo. Se conservará en una lata hermética hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12649,8418,'es','Galletas con chispas de chocolate del siguiente nivel','Olvídese de las versiones quebradizas en paquetes y prepare estas fantásticas galletas con chispas de chocolate. Espere un exterior crujiente, un centro masticable y trozos de chocolate amargo pegajoso.','["125 g de mantequilla sin sal","100 g de harina común","100 g de harina de centeno","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de sal marina, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo grande, más 2 yemas grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de chocolate, picado en trozos pequeños (elija negro o con leche, o una mezcla de ambos)"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña hasta que chisporrotee. Obsérvelo con atención: la mantequilla formará espuma y, cuando la espuma desaparezca, cambiará de amarillo a marrón avellana. En este punto, retirar del fuego, verter en un bol y dejar enfriar. Mientras tanto, mezcle las harinas, la sal, el polvo para hornear y el bicarbonato en un bol y reserve.","Cuando la mantequilla esté fría, agregue el azúcar y bata con una cuchara de madera para combinar. Agrega el huevo, las yemas y la vainilla y bate. Incorpora la mezcla húmeda a los ingredientes secos y revuelve hasta que todo forme una masa. Incorpora el chocolate y luego enfríalo durante al menos 3 horas o hasta que esté firme. Se mantendrá frío hasta por 24 horas.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forra dos bandejas para hornear grandes con papel para hornear. Separe la masa en 12 trozos, pesándolos para mayor precisión si lo desea. Haga una bola con cada pieza con las manos, luego coloque seis bolas en cada hoja, dejando espacio entre ellas para esparcirlas. Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego, una hoja a la vez, retírela del horno, espolvoree con un poco de sal marina y golpee la hoja con fuerza contra la superficie de trabajo.","Hornee por otros 3 minutos, luego repita el golpe de la hoja. Hornee por 3 minutos más. Este tiempo te dará galletas suaves, pero si las prefieres un poco más firmes, cocina unos minutos más. Deje enfriar en las hojas durante 10 minutos antes de transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:53:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12650,8420,'es','Pan de dátiles y nueces','Hornea este rico pan de dátiles y nueces el fin de semana para disfrutarlo durante la semana. También puedes congelarlo para otro día y servirlo a los invitados de último momento.','["125 g de mantequilla sin sal, cortada en cubos y blanda, más un poco más para la lata","200 g de dátiles blandos, deshuesados ​​y picados en trozos grandes","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","150 g de azúcar mascabado light","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","225 g de harina con levadura","100 g de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de azúcar glas"]','["Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / 160 ° C con ventilador / gas 4. Unte con mantequilla un molde para pan de 2 libras (el nuestro tenía 22 x 10 cm y 6 cm de profundidad) y cubra con papel para hornear. Pon la mantequilla, los dátiles y el bicarbonato de sodio (que ayuda a descomponer los dátiles) en un bol grande y añade 150 ml de agua hirviendo. Revuelve para que la mantequilla se derrita y déjalo reposar unos 20 minutos hasta que los dátiles se ablanden.","Batir el azúcar hasta que quede suave y luego agregar gradualmente los huevos hasta que se combinen. Incorpora el polvo para hornear, la harina y una pizca de sal marina hasta que no queden grumos de harina y quede suave. Incorpora tres cuartos de las nueces y luego vierte en la lata preparada. Espolvorea las nueces restantes por encima.","Hornee durante 20 minutos, luego baje el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3 y cocine durante otros 45-50 minutos hasta que se doren y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Deje que el pastel se enfríe en el molde durante 15 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para enfriar por completo. Espolvoree ligeramente con azúcar glas y sirva en rodajas. Congélelo entero o córtelo en rodajas, luego colóquelo en un recipiente hermético o divídalo en bolsas reutilizables para congelar. Se puede congelar hasta por tres meses. Descongelar completamente durante la noche."]','2026-01-11 12:53:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12651,8422,'es','Tarta de queso con frambuesa y sin horno','Personaliza nuestra tarta de queso con frambuesa añadiendo chocolate blanco, yogur o mascarpone o, para una base más rica, cambia las galletas digestivas por galletas de mantequilla.','["300 g de galletas digestivas","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","500 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","100 g de azúcar en polvo, más 2 cucharadas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","300ml de nata doble","300 g de frambuesas","azúcar glas, para espolvorear (opcional)"]','["Mezcle las galletas en un procesador de alimentos o introdúzcalas en una bolsa de comida y tritúrelas hasta obtener migajas finas con un rodillo. Transfiera a un tazón y agregue la mantequilla derretida hasta que la mezcla parezca arena húmeda. Vierta las migas de mantequilla en un molde desmontable de 20 cm y presione en la base con el dorso de una cuchara hasta obtener una capa suave y uniforme. Enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Vierta el queso tierno, el azúcar, la vainilla y la nata en un bol y bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede espeso y cremoso. Incorpora aproximadamente dos tercios de las frambuesas, presionando las bayas ligeramente contra el costado del tazón mientras lo haces para exprimir parte de su jugo y ondular ligeramente la crema.","Raspe la mezcla de tarta de queso sobre la base fría y alise la parte superior con una espátula. Enfríelo durante al menos 6 horas, o preferiblemente durante la noche. Puede prepararse con hasta dos días de anticipación y enfriarse. Para servir, retírelo con cuidado del molde, espolvoree con las frambuesas restantes y espolvoree con azúcar glas, si lo usa."]','2026-01-11 12:53:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12652,8424,'es','pastel de frutas','Prepara este pastel de frutas fácil de hervir para tu molde para pasteles. Repleto de jugosas pasas, sultanas, grosellas y cáscaras mixtas, es perfecto para tomar el té de la tarde con una taza de té.','["125 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubos, más un poco más para la lata","175 g de azúcar moreno blando blando,","200 g de uvas","200 g de pasas","100 g de grosellas","50 g de piel mixta","225 g de harina con levadura","1½ cucharadita de especias mixtas","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 huevos batidos"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g con papel para hornear. Derrita el azúcar, la mantequilla y 225 ml de agua en una cacerola grande. Una vez derretido, agregue las pasas, las sultanas, las grosellas y la piel mixta. Llevar a ebullición suave y, revolviendo ocasionalmente, cocinar hasta que se reduzca y se ablande, aproximadamente de 10 a 15 minutos. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente.","Vierta la harina, la mezcla de especias, el bicarbonato de sodio y una pizca de sal en un tazón grande. Agregue la mezcla de frutas enfriada y revuelva, luego agregue los huevos y mezcle para combinar. Hornee durante 45-55 minutos hasta que se dore y al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Cortar en rodajas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12653,8426,'es','Hornear en bandeja de mármol','Sea creativo con la bandeja horneada de mármol de Jane Dunn, con bizcochos de vainilla y chocolate y crema de mantequilla arremolinada. Es un dulce regalo que le encantará a toda la familia.','["375 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","375 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","6 huevos medianos","375 g de harina con levadura","50 g de cacao en polvo","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","250 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","500 g de azúcar glas","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","50 g de cacao en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para hornear de 23 x 33 cm con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos con un batidor eléctrico, aproximadamente de 4 a 5 minutos. Agrega los huevos y la harina, luego bate nuevamente hasta que quede suave. Divida la masa en dos tazones. Agrega el cacao en polvo a uno y la vainilla al otro, luego mezcla bien cada tazón para combinar.","Coloque cucharadas alternas de la masa de chocolate y vainilla en el molde preparado hasta que se acabe todo. Use una brocheta o la punta de un cuchillo para cubiertos para hacer girar ligeramente las masas para lograr un efecto mármol. Hornee durante 45-50 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde.","Para la crema de mantequilla, bata la mantequilla con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté pálida y suave. Tamice el azúcar, una cucharada grande a la vez, y bata a velocidad baja para combinar. Divide la crema de mantequilla en dos tazones. Agrega la vainilla a uno y el cacao al otro, y bate hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. (Agregue 1-2 cucharadas de agua hirviendo para aflojar, si es necesario).","Corta el bizcocho en cuadritos. Vierta la crema de vainilla en un lado de una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella y el chocolate en el otro lado. La pipa se arremolina sobre los cuadrados para servir. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12654,5347,'es','condimento de pollo','Pruebe esta sencilla mezcla de pimienta negra, pimentón, ajo, cebolla, tomillo y orégano para condimentar el pollo antes de hornearlo, asarlo o freírlo.','["1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas","1 cucharadita de pimienta negra, recién molida","1 cucharadita de pimentón","1 cucharadita de ajo granulado","1 cucharadita de cebolla granulada","1 cucharadita de tomillo seco","1 cucharadita de orégano seco"]','["Mida todos los ingredientes en un bol y revuelva bien. También se pueden combinar ligeramente en una licuadora o triturar con un mortero y un mortero para crear un polvo más fino, si lo prefiere. Espolvorea sobre el pollo antes de hornearlo, asarlo o freírlo."]','2026-01-11 12:53:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12655,8428,'es','florentinos rapidos','Toma un puñado de ingredientes y crea estos florentinos de chocolate amargo. Son un delicioso manjar con el té de la tarde o un sabroso regalo casero.','["100 g de azúcar en polvo","40 g de miel","60 g de mantequilla","75 g de nata doble","200 g de almendras laminadas","60 g de almendras molidas","100 gramos de chocolate amargo"]','["Calentar el azúcar, la miel y la mantequilla con la nata en una cacerola pequeña. Lleva la mezcla a ebullición y cocina por 5 minutos. Añade las almendras en copos y la almendra molida, retira del fuego y mezcla todo bien.","Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Use dos cucharaditas para formar 35 montones pequeños en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Hornee durante 15 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente caramelizado y adquiera un color dorado. Si la mezcla se separa, simplemente vuelva a amontonarla con las dos cucharaditas.","Deja que los florentinos se enfríen por completo. Derrita el chocolate amargo en el microondas o en un recipiente colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Con una brocha de repostería, unte la parte inferior de cada florentino con chocolate, coloque el chocolate hacia arriba y déjelo reposar."]','2026-01-11 12:53:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12656,8430,'es','galletas especuloas','Estas deliciosas galletas son fáciles de hacer y están llenas de especias. Prepare un lote de estos deliciosos bocados para un maravilloso regalo casero para alguien especial.','["270 g de harina común y un poco para espolvorear","150 g de azúcar en polvo","pizca de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de especia speculoos (una mezcla de canela, clavo, cilantro, jengibre, cardamomo y nuez moscada), disponible en línea","100ml de leche","100 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","200 g de almendras laminadas"]','["Mezclar en un bol la harina, el azúcar, una pizca de sal, la levadura en polvo y las especias. Añade 50ml de leche y la mantequilla. Amasar rápidamente hasta obtener una masa suave, luego envolver en papel de aluminio y enfriar durante 1 hora.","Calienta el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Forra 2-3 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Espolvorea el papel de hornear con las almendras laminadas. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada hasta que tenga un grosor de unos 3 mm. Cortar en rectángulos (de unos 4 cm x 6 cm). Colóquelos en las bandejas y presiónelos ligeramente sobre las almendras. Pincelamos las galletas con el resto de la leche y horneamos durante 8 minutos, vigilándolas para que no se doren demasiado en los bordes. Dejar enfriar.","Recorta las almendras que sobresalgan de los bordes de los speculoos para limpiarlas y guárdalas en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:53:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12657,3833,'es','Pan blanco clásico','Comience su viaje para hornear pan con este sencillo pan blanco; una vez que lo haya conquistado, podrá pasar a recetas más avanzadas.','["500 g de harina blanca fuerte y un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","aceite de girasol, para fermentar"]','["Vierta la harina, la levadura y 1 cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande y haga un hueco en el medio. Vierta poco menos de 350 ml de agua tibia y use los dedos o una cuchara de madera para mezclar la mezcla de harina y el agua; debe tener una masa ligeramente húmeda, esponjosa y trabajable, así que agregue un poco más de agua si es necesario.","Coloca la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amasa durante al menos 10 minutos, o hasta que quede suave y elástica. O haga esto en una batidora de pie equipada con el gancho para masa durante 3 a 5 minutos. Coloque la masa en un recipiente limpio engrasado, cubra y déjela reposar hasta que doble su tamaño, aproximadamente 1-2 horas.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Golpea la masa inclinándola hacia atrás sobre la superficie enharinada y sacando el aire con las palmas de las manos. Forme una bola con la masa, transfiérala a una bandeja para hornear, cubra con un paño de cocina limpio y déjela reposar nuevamente durante 40-45 minutos, o hasta que aproximadamente vuelva a duplicar su tamaño.","Espolvoree la parte superior del pan con un poco de harina y, si lo desea, haga un corte en cruz en la parte superior con un cuchillo afilado. Hornee durante 15 minutos, luego reduzca el fuego a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5 y hornee durante 30 minutos más hasta que el pan suene hueco al golpearlo en la parte inferior. Transfiera a una rejilla y déjelo enfriar por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días o congelado durante un mes."]','2026-01-11 12:53:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12658,8432,'es','Rollitos de canela Simnel','Enrolle todas sus delicias favoritas de Pascua en un panecillo pegajoso y especiado con estos fragantes panecillos para el desayuno. Los hemos probado en el frigorífico para que tengan mejor sabor.','["3 huevos batidos","125ml de leche","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","40 g de azúcar mascabado light","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para la lata","100 g de pasas","125 g de mantequilla, blanda","125 g de azúcar moscabado light, tamizada","1 cucharada de canela molida","500 g de mazapán (ver consejo a continuación)","2 cucharadas de almíbar dorado"]','["Vierta los huevos, la leche, la levadura, la harina, la mezcla de especias, el azúcar y 1 cucharadita de sal en el recipiente de una batidora de pie equipada con el accesorio de paleta. Batir hasta que la mezcla forme una masa suave, luego batir durante 2 minutos más. Agregue gradualmente la mantequilla, 1-2 cucharaditas a la vez, mientras mezcla a velocidad media. Cuando se haya incorporado toda la mantequilla, vierta las pasas y mezcle durante 1 min. Si no tiene una batidora de pie, mezcle todo en un tazón, amasando lentamente la mantequilla con las manos, seguido de las pasas. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y aplánela hasta formar un cuadrado de aproximadamente 20 x 20 cm. Cubra y enfríe durante 30 minutos o hasta 2 horas.","Mientras tanto, para el relleno, batir con unas varillas eléctricas la mantequilla, el azúcar y la canela con una pizca de sal. Reservar a temperatura ambiente. Unte con mantequilla un molde para hornear de aproximadamente 30 x 20 cm y cúbralo con papel para hornear. Extienda la masa fría sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un rectángulo de aproximadamente 40 x 30 cm. Unta la mantequilla con canela por la superficie hasta cubrirla por completo. Extienda 400 g de mazapán sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un rectángulo del mismo tamaño que la masa y luego colóquelo sobre la capa de mantequilla con canela. Con el borde largo hacia usted, enrolle la masa hasta formar un tronco apretado. Córtelo por la mitad para hacer dos troncos, luego levante ambos sobre una bandeja y congélelos durante 15 minutos, o enfríelos durante 30 minutos a 1 hora para que se endurezcan.","Corte los troncos enfriados en 12 rebanadas iguales y luego colóquelas, con la espiral hacia arriba, en la lata preparada. Déjelos reposar durante 1 hora en un lugar cálido, o hasta 24 horas en el refrigerador hasta que sean aproximadamente un tercio más grandes y se toquen por los lados.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Hornea los panecillos durante 20 minutos. Mientras tanto, forma 11 bolas con el resto del mazapán. Después de 20 minutos, coloque las bolas de mazapán en 11 de los panecillos, dejando uno liso (esto tradicionalmente representa a los apóstoles y Judas en un pastel de simnel). Hornee durante 10-15 minutos más hasta que los panecillos estén dorados y las bolas de mazapán tostadas.","Mezclar el almíbar dorado con 2 cucharaditas de agua hirviendo. Cepille inmediatamente los panecillos calientes (pero no las bolas de mazapán) con el glaseado de almíbar. Dejar enfriar un poco antes de comer tibio o a temperatura ambiente. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12659,8434,'es','Tortitas de miel y almendras quemadas','Sirva estos pasteles de miel y almendras calientes como postre o simplemente como delicia a la hora del té. Espolvorea con azúcar glas y disfruta con nuestra salsa espresso de chocolate caliente.','["50 g de mantequilla, más un extra para la lata","1 cucharada de miel","1 huevo","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","30 g de harina común","30 g de almendras molidas","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","azúcar glas, para espolvorear (opcional)"]','["Coloque la mantequilla y la miel en una cacerola pequeña y cocine a fuego medio-alto durante 2-3 minutos hasta que la mantequilla forme espuma y la mezcla adquiera un color caoba.","Batir el huevo, el azúcar y la mezcla de miel y mantequilla en un tazón grande. Agregue la harina, las almendras, el polvo para hornear y una pizca de sal marina para hacer una masa. Puede usarse inmediatamente o guardarse en el refrigerador durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y untar con mantequilla cuatro agujeros de un molde para muffins. Divida la mezcla entre los agujeros y hornee durante 12-14 minutos hasta que esté dorada y bien cocida. Colóquelo sobre una rejilla para enfriar y déjelo enfriar durante unos minutos. Espolvoree con azúcar glas, si lo desea, y sirva con salsa de chocolate espresso caliente (consulte \"combina bien\", a continuación)."]','2026-01-11 12:53:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12660,4898,'es','Galletas flapjack con sabor a fruta','Tuesta la avena antes de mezclarla con la masa para hacer estas galletas afrutadas, un delicioso híbrido de flapjacks almibarados y macarrones de coco.','["125 g de avena gigante","150 g de mantequilla blanda","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","1 huevo","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de harina con levadura","100 g de frutos secos variados o pasas","75 g de orejones finamente picados","50 g de coco rallado","½ cucharadita de canela molida (opcional)"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Esparce la avena sobre una bandeja para hornear y hornea durante 20 minutos, volteándola una vez hasta que esté ligeramente dorada. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar. Vierta la mantequilla y el azúcar en un bol y bata con una batidora eléctrica durante 2 minutos hasta que quede esponjoso. Rompe el huevo y agrega el almíbar dorado y la vainilla, luego bate hasta que esté completamente combinado. Echar la harina, todos los frutos secos, el coco, la canela (si se usa), la avena tostada y una pizca de sal. Vuelve a batir hasta que todo esté combinado y tengas una masa espesa. Use la masa inmediatamente o tápela y enfríe por hasta dos días.","Forre dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear y coloque seis cucharadas grandes de masa en cada una, bien espaciadas. Hornee durante 15 minutos (o 18-20 minutos si la masa está fría en el refrigerador) hasta que las galletas se hayan extendido y estén doradas en los bordes pero suaves en el medio. Deje enfriar en la bandeja para hornear durante 5 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla y déjelo enfriar por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente o lata hermética hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12661,8436,'es','Arroz con leche clásico','Prepara este cremoso arroz con leche en el horno mientras preparas la cena y completa tu comida con un reconfortante pudín. Sirva con mermelada para sentirse bien','["mantequilla, para el plato","130 g de arroz con leche","70 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla o 1 vaina de vainilla, partida y sin semillas","800ml de leche entera","170ml de nata doble","rallado de nuez moscada","mermelada de frutas de su elección, para servir (fresa o albaricoque funcionan bien)"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3 y untar con mantequilla una fuente para horno de 1,5 litros. Ponga el arroz con leche, el azúcar, la vainilla, la leche y la nata en un bol y revuelva para combinar. Vierte la mezcla en el plato preparado y ralla sobre una generosa capa de nuez moscada. Hornee durante 1 hora y 30 minutos hasta que se forme una piel marrón encima y el arroz esté cocido y tierno.","Deje que se enfríe un poco, luego coloque el pudín tibio en tazones y sirva con una cucharada de mermelada encima."]','2026-01-11 12:53:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12662,8438,'es','Pastel de jengibre vegano','Prepárate para el otoño con este bizcocho de jengibre helado y especiado. Es un verdadero placer, seas vegano o no.','["100ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para la lata","275 g de harina con levadura","150 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","50 g de melaza","50 g de jengibre de tallo de un frasco, finamente rallado, más 1 cucharadita de almíbar de jengibre","150 g de azúcar glas","½ limón, exprimido","4 trozos de jengibre de tallo cristalizado, rebanados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Engrasar un molde para pan de 900 g (el nuestro era de 19 x 9 x 6 cm) y forrar con una tira larga de papel para hornear. Mezcle la harina, el azúcar mascabado, el polvo para hornear y el jengibre molido en un tazón grande. Vierta el aceite, la melaza, el jengibre rallado y 170 ml de agua fría, luego bata hasta que quede suave con una cuchara de madera.","Vierta la mezcla del pastel en el molde preparado y hornee en el centro del horno durante 45-50 minutos hasta que al insertar un pincho en el medio salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Tamice el azúcar glas en un tazón, agregue el jarabe de jengibre y mezcle con suficiente jugo de limón para hacer un glaseado espeso y vertible que pueda cubrir el dorso de una cuchara. Coloque el bizcocho en un plato o soporte, retire el pergamino y rocíe sobre el glaseado. Esparcir inmediatamente sobre el tallo el jengibre. Corta el bizcocho en rodajas gruesas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12663,6209,'es','Queso de coliflor entero al horno','¿Por qué tomarse la molestia de picar coliflor? Asarlo entero es muy sencillo de preparar y es un complemento impresionante para una cena asada.','["1 coliflor grande (aproximadamente 1 kg)","50 g de mantequilla sin sal","50 g de harina común","una pizca grande de pimentón dulce ahumado","600ml de leche entera","2 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa","170 g de queso cheddar maduro, gruyere, comté o una mezcla","½ manojo de cebollino, finamente picado"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua con sal. Retire las hojas grandes de la coliflor, pero deje las más pequeñas adheridas. Sumerja con cuidado la coliflor en el agua y hierva durante 15 minutos, luego escurra y reserve.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén mediana a fuego medio, luego agregue la harina y el pimentón y cocine durante 1-2 minutos. Retirar del fuego y batir lentamente la leche hasta que quede suave, luego mezclar con la mostaza. Regrese la cacerola al fuego y hierva la mezcla, batiendo continuamente. Agrega dos tercios del queso y bate hasta que el queso se derrita. Sazone al gusto.","Coloque la coliflor en el medio de una fuente para horno honda y vierta sobre la salsa de queso. Espolvorea con el queso restante. Hornee sin tapar durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante. Esparcir con las cebolletas antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12664,3870,'es','Galletas masticables de macarrones con almendras','Prepara estas sencillas galletas de almendras. Populares para Pesaj, no contienen lácteos ni gluten. También puedes agregar un poco de canela para convertirlas en bolitas de canela, si quieres.','["225 g de almendras molidas","120 g de azúcar en polvo","2 claras de huevo","20 almendras blanqueadas (opcional)","1 cucharada de canela molida","4 cucharadas de azúcar glas"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forra una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Coloque las almendras molidas y el azúcar en un tazón grande para mezclar y mezcle para combinar.","En un recipiente aparte, bata las claras hasta que estén espumosas y luego agréguelas a la mezcla de almendras y azúcar. Revuelva bien; formará una mezcla ligeramente pegajosa pero debe mantener su forma.","Mójese las manos ligeramente y haga una bola con una cucharadita colmada de la mezcla entre las palmas; debe tener unos 4 cm de diámetro. Poner en la bandeja y aplanar ligeramente con los dedos mojados hasta obtener un disco grueso, dejando al menos 3 cm entre cada galleta. Presione una almendra blanqueada en cada uno, si lo desea.","Hornee durante 18-20 minutos hasta que comience a dorarse en los bordes, luego retírelo del horno y déjelo enfriar sobre una rejilla. Quieres que tengan un centro suave y masticable y cuanto más oscuros se vuelvan, más duro será el medio.","Para hacer bolitas de canela, agrega la canela a las almendras y el azúcar antes de agregar la clara de huevo. Al darles forma dejarlas como bolitas. Hornee durante 18-20 minutos; desea que se mantengan suaves en el centro. Mientras aún están calientes, colóquelas suavemente en un bol con azúcar glas y déles la vuelta para cubrirlas. Dejar hasta que esté completamente frío."]','2026-01-11 12:53:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12665,8440,'es','Pastel de cerezas','Prepare este delicioso pastel de cerezas para el té de la tarde o un café por la mañana. Elaborado con cerezas dulces glaseadas y almendras crujientes, no durará mucho','["200 g de mantequilla blanda sin sal, más un poco más para la lata","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras (opcional)","75 g de cerezas glaseadas, secas si están en almíbar y luego cortadas en cuartos","175 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de azúcar glas","una gota de extracto de almendras","1-2 cucharadas de leche","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas tostadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pan de 900 g y cubrir con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos, luego agregar los huevos uno a la vez, seguidos del extracto de vainilla y almendras (si se usa).","Mezcle las cerezas con 2 cucharadas de harina en un bol. Vierta el resto de la harina, las almendras molidas, el polvo para hornear y una pizca de sal en el bol con el azúcar y los huevos y mezcle hasta que estén combinados. Incorpora las cerezas y el resto de la harina en el bol. Vierta en el molde preparado y alise por encima.","Hornee durante 50-55 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos en el molde, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Sirva como está o mezcle el azúcar glas con el extracto y suficiente leche para obtener una consistencia espesa pero que se pueda verter. Rocíe sobre el bizcocho y esparza sobre las almendras en hojuelas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12666,7067,'es','Tarta de manzana vegana','Haz este bizcocho de manzana y almendras para llenar tu molde de bizcocho. Es una delicia ideal para cualquiera que siga una dieta vegana o sin lácteos, y es delicioso para tomar el té de la tarde con una taza de té.','["150 g de crema para untar sin lácteos, derretida y un poco más para la lata","300ml de leche de avena","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","350 g de harina con levadura, más 1 cucharada para cubrir las manzanas","100 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","300 g de manzanas Granny Smith, peladas, sin corazón y picadas en cubos de 2 cm","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas"]','["Utilice la pasta para untar para untar con mantequilla un molde para pasteles de 20 cm de profundidad y forre con papel para hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Vierta la leche de avena en una jarra, agregue el jugo de limón y deje reposar 5 minutos a temperatura ambiente.","Ponga la harina, los dos azúcares y el polvo de hornear en un bol grande, vierta sobre la mezcla de leche de avena espesa y el extracto de almendras, luego agregue la mantequilla y ½ cucharadita de sal. Batir todo junto con una batidora eléctrica. Vierta las manzanas en un segundo tazón grande, espolvoree 1 cucharada extra de harina y revuelva para cubrir. Incorpora las manzanas a la masa del pastel con una espátula, luego vierte la mezcla en el molde preparado y espolvorea sobre las almendras.","Hornee en el centro del horno durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 20 minutos, o hasta que esté dorado y firme al tacto. Dejar enfriar unos minutos en el molde. Sirva caliente o colóquelo sobre una rejilla y déjelo enfriar por completo. Una vez frío, se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12667,8442,'es','pastel de chocolate blanco','Si estás celebrando una ocasión especial, este pastel en capas es una excelente pieza central. Está cubierto con sedosa ganache de chocolate blanco y frambuesas frescas.','["300 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para las latas","300 g de azúcar en polvo","5 huevos grandes, batidos","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","300 g de harina con levadura","100 g de chocolate blanco, finamente picado","350 g de frambuesas frescas, partidas por la mitad","450 g de chocolate blanco, finamente picado","200ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Unta con mantequilla tres moldes para sándwich de 18 cm y cúbrelos con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, la vainilla, el polvo para hornear y la harina con una batidora de pie o un batidor de mano eléctrico hasta obtener una mezcla esponjosa, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Incorpora el chocolate blanco hasta que esté bien distribuido.","Divida la mezcla uniformemente entre las latas y nivele con una espátula o el dorso de una cuchara hasta que quede suave. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar los bizcochos en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego retirarlos de los moldes y transferirlos a una rejilla para enfriar, con la parte superior hacia abajo, y dejar enfriar por completo. Si los bizcochos no están nivelados, utilice un cuchillo de sierra para cortar los picos.","Mientras los bizcochos se enfrían, prepara la ganache. Pon el chocolate blanco en un bol grande. Vierte la nata en una cacerola a fuego medio y deja que hierva a fuego lento. Verter inmediatamente la nata sobre el chocolate y dejar reposar durante 4-5 minutos hasta que el chocolate se derrita. Mezcle para formar una ganache suave, asegurándose de que todo el chocolate se haya derretido por completo, luego mezcle con la vainilla. Enfríe en el refrigerador durante 30 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente para que no se endurezca por completo, hasta que se pueda untar y esté lo suficientemente espeso como para cubrir el pastel.","Una vez que los bizcochos estén fríos y la ganache haya adquirido una consistencia untable, puedes construir el pastel. Coloque un bizcocho en un plato para servir, extiéndalo sobre una fina capa de ganache de chocolate y luego rellene el centro con un tercio de las frambuesas. Coloca otro bizcocho encima y repite con una capa de ganache y otro tercio de frambuesas. Pon el bizcocho final encima y cubre suavemente todo el bizcocho con una fina capa de ganache. Dejar reposar en el frigorífico al menos 20 minutos. Para terminar, esparza el ganache restante y cubra con las frambuesas restantes. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:53:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12668,8444,'es','pan de jengibre de halloween','Haz una tanda de pan de jengibre para tu lata de galletas este Halloween. Coloca fantasmas macabros y momias monstruosas como glaseado para un tema adecuadamente espeluznante.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubos","50 g de almíbar dorado","50 g de melaza negra","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","225 g de harina común","100 g de azúcar glas","glaseado de escritura negro"]','["Calienta la mantequilla, el almíbar, la melaza y el azúcar en una cacerola mediana a fuego lento durante 6-8 minutos hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos.","Batir brevemente el bicarbonato, el jengibre, la canela, la mezcla de especias y la harina común en un tazón grande para combinar. Agrega una pizca de sal, y la mantequilla y el azúcar a la mezcla. Mezcle brevemente con una cuchara, luego amase hasta formar una bola rugosa en el tazón. Agregue 1 cucharada de agua para unir la masa, si es necesario. Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase brevemente nuevamente hasta obtener una masa suave y flexible. Presione hasta formar un disco plano, envuélvalo y congélelo durante 15 minutos o enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada, divida la masa en secciones y trabaje en tandas si es necesario. Estirar hasta obtener un grosor de 5 mm. Recorte con un cortador de pan de jengibre. Vuelva a enrollar los recortes. Obtendrás entre 20 y 25 dependiendo del tamaño de tu cortador.","Transfiera las galletas a una bandeja forrada con papel pergamino con un poco de espacio en el medio y enfríe nuevamente durante 10 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3. Hornear el pan de jengibre durante 10-15 minutos hasta que los bordes estén ligeramente dorados. Deje enfriar en la bandeja durante 5 minutos y luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mezcle el azúcar glas con ½-1 cucharada de agua para hacer un glaseado espeso y que se pueda pipetear. Transfiera la mitad del glaseado a una manga pastelera y corte un agujero muy pequeño en el fondo.","Para hacer los fantasmasCon ayuda de la manga pastelera, haz un contorno alrededor de las personas de jengibre y déjalas reposar. Una vez que esté listo, agregue una gota más de agua al glaseado restante en el tazón para que se afloje un poco, luego úselo para rellenar las formas de los fantasmas. Utilice un palito para alisar el glaseado hasta el contorno establecido. Dejar reposar nuevamente. Agrega dos puntos negros para los ojos y luego un óvalo para la boca abierta.","Para hacer las momias, corte un agujero un poco más grande en la manga pastelera en ángulo y pase hacia adelante y hacia atrás sobre las personas de jengibre restantes, para que parezcan vendas. Añade dos puntos blancos a modo de ojos y deja secar. Añade pupilas a los puntos blancos una vez fijados con el glaseado de escritura negro."]','2026-01-11 12:53:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12669,3876,'es','Tortilla de boniato y calabacín al horno','Disfrute de una tortilla horneada en lugar de frita, lo que la hace más saludable y más fácil de preparar. Si no tienes manchego, puedes usar queso cheddar o queso feta desmenuzado.','["2 batatas medianas (500 g), peladas y cortadas en rodajas finas","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","1 calabacín, en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","6 huevos","50 g de crema fresca","30 g de manchego o alternativa vegetariana, rallado","1 cucharada de cebollino picado","ensalada verde, para servir"]','["Calienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Coloca las rodajas de batata, la cebolla y el calabacín en una fuente para horno mediana antiadherente (la nuestra era de 18 cm x 30 cm x 4 cm), rocía con aceite de oliva, sazona y mezcla todo. Hornee durante 30 minutos, revolviendo las verduras hasta la mitad. Los boniatos deben estar tiernos, el calabacín un poco carbonizado y la cebolla blanda.","Mientras tanto, bata los huevos y la crème fraîche junto con una pizca de condimento. Vierte la mezcla de huevo batido sobre el boniato, la cebolla y el calabacín. Espolvorea sobre el manchego y vuelve a meter en el horno durante 25-30 minutos hasta que la tortilla esté cocida. Espolvorea encima las cebolletas y cómelas frías o calientes con ensalada."]','2026-01-11 12:53:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12670,3894,'es','Patatas nuevas asadas trituradas','Combine patatas asadas, rösti y puré con esta sencilla receta. Puedes realzarlo machacándolo con aceitunas deshuesadas, alcaparras, hierbas, cebolletas o ajo.','["1 kg de patatas nuevas","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Cocine las patatas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 15 minutos, o hasta que estén bien cocidas pero sin desmoronarse. Escurrir bien. Rocíe 1½ cucharada de aceite en una bandeja para hornear o para asar poco profunda (de unos 30 x 20 cm; una lata para panecillos suizos funciona bien). Vierta las patatas en la lata y agregue el aceite. Aplasta las papas con un machacador de papas o un tenedor; las papas trituradas deben llenar la bandeja y unirse en los bordes como si fueran piezas de un rompecabezas. Se mantendrán frías hasta por un día.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Rociar las patatas con el aceite restante y sazonar con sal marina. Hornee durante 40 minutos hasta que esté muy dorado y crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:53:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12671,3920,'es','Pan de maíz con calabacín y queso cheddar','Disfrute de este pan de maíz con queso y chile picante, o tostado y cubierto con huevos escalfados y tomates asados ​​para el desayuno.','["75 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","75 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","150 g de polenta instantánea","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","3 huevos","350ml de leche entera","100 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","2 calabacines pequeños o 1 mediano (unos 200 g), cortados y rallados"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pan de 900 g y forrar con una tira ancha de papel para hornear. Mezclar la harina, la polenta y el polvo para hornear en un bol con 1 cucharadita de sal.","Batir en una jarra los huevos, la leche y la mantequilla derretida. Vierta en los ingredientes secos y mezcle. Agrega el queso y los calabacines. En esta etapa estará bastante líquida, pero no te preocupes, ya que la polenta se hincha gradualmente y absorbe el líquido en el horno.","Vierta en el molde para pan preparado y hornee por 15 minutos, luego baje el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y cocine por otros 25-30 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio del pan salga limpio (puede cubrir la parte superior sin apretar con papel de aluminio si comienza a oscurecerse demasiado rápido).","Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde, luego desmoldar y cortar en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:53:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12672,4317,'es','Pide de espinacas y queso','Prepara nuestra versión de pide turco con espinacas y queso de cabra, ideal para un almuerzo ligero o un picnic. Los pide son panes planos con forma de barco que se rellenan y se hornean','["300 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 huevo batido","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla blanca, finamente picada","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino enteras","240 g de espinacas","50 g de queso de cabra firme, desmenuzado","2 cucharadas de eneldo picado"]','["Coloque la harina, la levadura, el azúcar y 1 cucharadita de sal marina en un tazón grande y revuelva para combinar. Agrega 80 ml de agua y el aceite para que todo se junte y forme una masa firme y suave (es posible que tengas que agregar un poco más de agua). Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase durante 5 minutos hasta que la masa esté suave y elástica. Regrese al tazón, cubra y déjelo reposar en un lugar cálido hasta que haya duplicado su tamaño, aproximadamente 1 hora.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Calentar el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla durante unos 5 minutos hasta que esté transparente. Agregue el comino y las espinacas y continúe cocinando hasta que las espinacas se ablanden y el líquido se haya evaporado; esto tomará unos 5 minutos. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Cuando la masa haya subido, calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Colocar la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y dividir en cuatro. Enrolle cada pieza hasta formar una bola, luego cada bola forme un óvalo rugoso, de unos 3-4 mm de grosor. Transfiera los óvalos de masa a una bandeja para hornear antiadherente de aproximadamente 30 x 20 cm.","Coloque el relleno de espinacas enfriado en el centro de cada óvalo de masa, dejando un borde de 2 cm alrededor del borde. Espolvorea el queso de cabra y el eneldo sobre el relleno. Doble con cuidado los lados de la masa aproximadamente 1 cm para que se superpongan ligeramente al relleno y junte los extremos para formar una punta. Es posible que sea necesario girar ligeramente los extremos y presionarlos hacia abajo para fijarlos en su lugar.","Cuando los cuatro pide estén montados, unte la masa con huevo batido. Hornee durante 10-15 minutos hasta que la masa esté dorada y el relleno burbujee. Sirva caliente (las sobras también se pueden comer frías)."]','2026-01-11 12:53:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12673,5125,'es','Tarta de chocolate sin gluten','Prepare un pastel de chocolate denso y rico para una ocasión especial o un capricho en cualquier momento. Si bien es adecuado para quienes siguen una dieta sin gluten, será un éxito para todos.','["150ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para las latas","175 g de harina sin gluten","1 cucharadita de goma xantana","50 g de cacao en polvo","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","75 g de azúcar moreno blando","75 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","2 huevos","100 g de yogur griego","100ml de leche","2 cucharadas de café instantáneo, disuelto en 4 cucharadas de agua caliente","300 g de azúcar glas","25 g de cacao en polvo","150 g de mantequilla blanda con sal","3 cucharadas de leche","65 g de chocolate amargo, derretido"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar la base de dos moldes para sándwiches de 18 cm y forrar con papel para hornear. Mezclar en un bol grande la harina, la goma xantana, el cacao, la levadura en polvo, el bicarbonato de sodio, una pizca grande de sal y ambos azúcares.","Batir en una jarra el almíbar dorado, los huevos, el aceite, el yogur, la leche y el café. Incorpora gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos a los secos hasta obtener una mezcla suave.","Vierta la mezcla en los moldes preparados y hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que suba y esté firme al tacto. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos en los moldes antes de colocarlos en una rejilla para enfriar.","Mientras los pasteles se enfrían, prepara el glaseado. Batir el azúcar glas, el cacao en polvo, la mantequilla y la leche durante 5 minutos hasta que quede suave y esponjoso. Vierta gradualmente el chocolate derretido mientras bate, raspando los lados del tazón para asegurarse de que todo esté incluido.","Extienda la mitad del glaseado sobre el centro de un bizcocho con una espátula pequeña. Coloque el otro bizcocho encima, con la parte inferior plana hacia arriba. Extienda el glaseado restante por la parte superior y los lados del pastel, alisando con una espátula. Si te queda algo de glaseado, puedes colocar algunas rosetas encima del pastel."]','2026-01-11 12:53:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12674,3932,'es','Salchichas Glamorgan','Involucre a la familia y obtenga sus propias salchichas Glamorgan, una salchicha vegetariana tradicional galesa con queso, puerros y pan rallado. Haz un lote de 12 y congela los que no comas.','["50 g de mantequilla","2 puerros grandes, rebanados","400 g de pan rallado fino, blanco, suave y fresco","2 cucharaditas de hojas de tomillo","4 huevos grandes, separados","400 g de Caerphilly o queso cheddar maduro fuerte, finamente rallado","1 cucharada colmada de mostaza integral o de Dijon o 2 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa","50 g de harina común, para espolvorear","100ml de aceite vegetal para freír, más un poco más si es necesario"]','["Derretir la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio hasta que forme espuma, luego sofreír los puerros con una pizca de sal durante 5-10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Ponga 200 g de pan rallado suave, el tomillo, las yemas de huevo, el queso, la mostaza y una generosa pizca de pimienta en un bol y mezcle para combinar. Agregue los puerros fritos y la mantequilla que quede en la sartén. Sazone con sal y mezcle bien con las manos.","Moldee la mezcla en 12 salchichas (divida y pese para mayor precisión si lo desea). Puede que te resulte útil tener las manos húmedas limpiándolas de vez en cuando para evitar que se peguen. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear y congele durante 10 minutos hasta que esté firme, o enfríe durante 30 minutos en el refrigerador.","Mientras las salchichas se endurecen, bata las claras de huevo en un recipiente poco profundo con una pizca de sal hasta que estén ligeramente espumosas. Coloque la harina y parte del pan rallado restante en platos separados.","Espolvoree las salchichas frías y firmes con harina, luego sumérjalas en la clara de huevo y páselas por el pan rallado. Rellene el plato con pan rallado según sea necesario. Enfríe durante al menos 1 hora y hasta 24 horas antes de freír.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio alto. Fríe las salchichas en tandas, volteándolas suavemente cada minuto, durante 4 a 6 minutos, hasta que estén doradas y crujientes por todas partes. Agregue un poco más de aceite entre lotes si es necesario. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear y hornee por 10 minutos. Si va a congelar las salchichas, una vez que estén doradas, transfiéralas a una bandeja y déjelas enfriar durante unos minutos, luego congélelas (sin taparlas) hasta que estén sólidas y transfiéralas a recipientes aptos para el congelador. Se mantendrán congeladas hasta por tres meses. Cocínelas congeladas en el horno durante 25 minutos hasta que estén bien calientes."]','2026-01-11 12:53:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12675,5479,'es','Pastel cremoso de pescado con puerros, patatas, queso cheddar y cebollino','Utilice pescado fresco para hacer este pastel cremoso cubierto de masa. El relleno de gambas, eglefino y salmón y la cobertura desmenuzable hacen que este pastel sea extremadamente sabroso.','["400 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de sal fina","½ manojo pequeño de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","½ cucharada de mostaza inglesa en polvo","180 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en cubos","2 huevos grandes, batidos","verduras al vapor, para servir","1 patata (unos 270 g), picada en trozos de 3 cm","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","50 g de mantequilla","2 puerros, finamente cortados","3 cucharadas de harina común","400ml de leche entera","100ml de nata doble","100 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","3 tsp Dijon mustard","¼ de manojo de cebollino finamente picado","200 g de filete de salmón sin piel, cortado en trozos","200 g de filete de eglefino ahumado sin piel y cortado en trozos","100 g de langostinos crudos, pelados"]','["Vierta la harina, la sal, el tomillo y la mostaza en polvo en un procesador de alimentos y presione brevemente. Agregue la mantequilla y presione nuevamente hasta obtener una textura fina de pan rallado. Agrega la mitad del huevo y 1 cucharada de agua fría y pulsa hasta formar una masa (puedes agregar hasta 1 o 2 cucharadas más de agua si está seca). Coloca la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo y amasa brevemente. Envuelva y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Para hacer el relleno, cocine la papa en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 8-10 minutos. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor. Calentar el aceite y la mantequilla en una sartén grande a fuego medio y sofreír los puerros durante 5 minutos. Agregue la harina y cocine por 2 minutos, luego agregue la leche, poco a poco, revolviendo entre cada adición para combinar. Agrega la crema, el queso y la mostaza y cocina durante 1-2 minutos más hasta que el queso se derrita. Agregue las cebolletas y sazone. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 15 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8. Incorpora con cuidado el salmón, la patata, el eglefino y las gambas a la mezcla cremosa de puerro y luego vierte en un molde para pastel redondo de 27 cm. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de £1. Coloque la masa sobre el pastel y luego recorte el exceso. Engarza los bordes y luego dale forma a los recortes para decorar la parte superior, si lo deseas. Unte con el huevo restante y luego hornee en el centro del horno durante 35 a 40 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Sirva con verduras al vapor."]','2026-01-11 12:53:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12676,8446,'es','Pastel de mazapán y chocolate','Combine el sabor a nuez del mazapán con un rico pastel de chocolate para hacer el mejor regalo. Esta receta fácil es perfecta para hornear con niños.','["165 g de mantequilla salada, blanda y un poco más para la lata","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","350 g de mazapán","100 g de azúcar en polvo","60 g de azúcar moreno blando","3 huevos grandes","200 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","75ml de leche","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","50 g de chispas de chocolate amargo","180ml de nata doble","140 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pan de 1 kg (el nuestro era de 14 x 24 x 7 cm) y forrarlo con una tira larga de papel para hornear. Espolvoree ligeramente una superficie con azúcar glas y enrolle el mazapán hasta formar un rectángulo de 1 cm de grosor, luego córtelo para que sea un poco más pequeño que la base del molde para pan.","Batir la mantequilla y ambos azúcares en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Batir los huevos, la harina, el polvo para hornear, el extracto de almendras, la leche y el cacao en polvo hasta que quede suave. Incorpora las chispas de chocolate, raspando los lados del tazón para asegurarte de que todo esté combinado.","Vierta la mitad de la masa en el molde. Cubra con el rectángulo de mazapán, luego vierta el resto de la masa encima y alise la superficie. Hornee durante 1 hora-1 hora 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado, levado y al insertar un pincho en el medio, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde.","Para hacer la ganache, ponga la crema a fuego lento en una cacerola pequeña. Mientras tanto, poner el chocolate negro, el almíbar dorado y el extracto de almendras en un bol resistente al calor. Una vez que la crema esté hirviendo a fuego lento, viértala sobre la mezcla de chocolate y déjela reposar durante 2 minutos para que se derrita. Batir hasta que quede suave, luego dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos y espesar un poco. Vierte la ganache por todo el bizcocho y córtalo en rodajas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12677,5253,'es','imitar pastelería','Prepare pan de desayuno simit poğaça, relleno de aceitunas, queso y hierbas para obtener todos los sabores de un desayuno turco. Están deliciosos servidos con una taza de té.','["350ml de leche entera","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","2 yemas de huevo (congela las claras para otra receta)","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","115 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente, cortada en trozos","1 huevo batido","1 cucharadita de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharadita de semillas de nigella","125 g de aceitunas negras marinadas, deshuesadas y picadas (ver consejo a continuación)","125 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","125 g de queso cheddar rallado","½ manojo pequeño de perejil picado","75 g de pasta de pimienta turca"]','["Calienta la leche en un recipiente resistente al calor en el microondas o en una sartén a fuego lento hasta que esté tibia. Agrega la levadura y el azúcar, luego deja reposar durante 15 minutos hasta que esté espumoso. Vierta las yemas de huevo, la harina, la mantequilla y ½ cucharadita de sal en el tazón de una batidora equipada con un gancho para masa y agregue la mezcla de leche tibia. Amasar durante 10 minutos; la masa debe quedar pegajosa. O amase a mano durante unos 15 minutos.","Cubra y déjelo reposar durante al menos 1 a 2 horas hasta que duplique su tamaño, o enfríelo durante la noche. Si está fermentando a temperatura ambiente, enfríe la masa durante 30 minutos después de que se haya duplicado para que sea más fácil trabajar con ella.","Mientras tanto, prepara el relleno. Combine las aceitunas, los quesos y el perejil y reserve. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un rectángulo grande (de unos 46 x 30 cm).","Extienda la pasta de pimiento por toda la masa. Con el lado largo hacia usted, esparza la mitad del relleno sobre la mitad del rectángulo más cercana a usted, luego doble la otra mitad sobre ella para encerrar el relleno. Vuelva a extender la masa con cuidado para ayudar a que el relleno se adhiera a la masa, luego corte el rectángulo verticalmente en tiras de 20 x 2½ cm. Trabajando con una tira a la vez, dóblela sin apretar por la mitad, luego sosteniéndola por ambos extremos, gírela y luego tire suavemente de los extremos sueltos a través del bucle.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Colocar el simit sobre la sábana y pincelar con el huevo batido. Espolvoree sobre las semillas de sésamo y nigella, luego déjelas reposar en la bandeja para hornear durante unos 20 minutos.","Hornee durante 25-30 minutos o hasta que estén dorados. Dejar enfriar un poco en la bandeja antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12678,8448,'es','Tarta banoffee de caramelo salado y avellanas','Pruebe una nueva versión del pastel banoffee con praliné crujiente de avellanas, caramelo salado y crema batida moscovado. Algunos ingredientes del truco te ahorrarán tiempo','["100 g de avellanas blanqueadas","4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","300 g de galletas de avena con chocolate","85 g de mantequilla salada, derretida","400g dulche de leche","300ml de nata doble","3 cucharadas de azúcar moscabado oscuro","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla o 1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 plátanos medianos, pelados y rebanados"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloca las avellanas en una bandeja para hornear y tuesta en el horno durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén uniformemente doradas. Vierta en un tazón. Forre la bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear y reserve.","Vierta el azúcar en polvo, la mitad de las avellanas tostadas y una pizca de sal marina en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento. Cocine suavemente durante 7 a 10 minutos hasta que el azúcar se derrita y adquiera un color ámbar; no revuelva, gire la sartén de vez en cuando. Vierta la mezcla sobre la bandeja para hornear. Dejar enfriar por completo y luego partir en trozos pequeños.","Forre la base de un molde para tarta estriado de 23 cm con papel para hornear. Rompe las galletas en un procesador de alimentos y mezcla con el resto de las avellanas hasta obtener una migaja fina. O bien, selle las galletas y las nueces en una bolsa para alimentos y tritúrelas con un rodillo. Vierta las migas en un tazón y combine con la mantequilla derretida. Presione en la base del molde y hacia los lados, luego enfríe durante 2 horas.","Retire la base de la tarta fría del molde (si se pega un poco, póngala en un horno tibio durante 3-4 minutos para ayudar a que se suelte), luego colóquela en un plato para servir. Vierta el dulce de leche en un tazón y agregue suavemente una pizca grande de sal marina (no mezcle demasiado o se aflojará demasiado).","Vierta la nata, el azúcar moscovado y la vainilla en otro bol y bata suavemente con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave. Extienda el caramelo salado sobre la base de la tarta y luego coloque las rodajas de plátano encima. Vierta sobre la crema moscovado. Enfríe durante al menos 3 horas o toda la noche. Espolvorear con el praliné de avellanas justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12679,5491,'es','Whirl pegajoso de tomate y espinacas con tamarindo','Prueba este riff de una spanakopita griega. Con un toque pegajoso, dulce, especiado y picante, es un espectacular centro vegetal para cualquier ocasión especial.','["300 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","4 dientes de ajo pequeños, rebanados","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","4 cucharadas de pasta de tamarindo","1 cucharadita de azúcar","1 puerro, partido por la mitad y en rodajas finas","5 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","300 g de espinacas, marchitas, exprimidas el exceso de agua y picadas en trozos grandes","400 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","3 huevos grandes, batidos","2 cucharadas de hojas de cilantro finamente picadas, más unas cuantas hojas para servir","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","6 láminas de masa filo","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Mezclar los tomates, el ajo, la mitad del aceite, el tamarindo y el azúcar, junto con una pizca generosa de condimento. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear y colóquelo en el horno durante 25 a 30 minutos o hasta que esté pegajoso y tostado. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén grande a fuego medio, luego agrega el puerro y las cebolletas, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que se ablanden, aproximadamente 10 minutos. Deje enfriar por completo, luego viértalo en un bol y mezcle con las espinacas, el queso feta, los tomates asados, los huevos, el cilantro, el pimentón ahumado y los condimentos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C/gas 6. Unte una hoja de filo con mantequilla derretida, luego coloque otra hoja encima y unte con mantequilla nuevamente, manteniendo el resto del filo cubierto con un paño de cocina limpio y húmedo para evitar que se seque. Coloque un tercio del relleno a lo largo del lado largo del rectángulo y enrolle suavemente hasta formar un tubo largo. Repite esto dos veces más hasta que hayas usado todo el filo y el relleno. En un molde para pastel redondo, o en un molde redondo apto para horno, enrolle con cuidado los tres rollos de filo desde el exterior del molde hacia el centro, de modo que termine con una espiral grande. No te preocupes si se agrieta un poco; puedes colocar capas de filo para cubrir las grietas. Unte toda la espiral con más mantequilla, espolvoree sobre las hojuelas de chile y hornee durante 50-60 minutos hasta que esté dorado y profundo. Esparza el cilantro extra para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12680,3950,'es','Galletas veganas de mantequilla de maní','Prepare unas deliciosas galletas veganas de mantequilla de maní como delicia de bienvenida a media mañana. Elaborados con ingredientes sin lácteos, seguramente a todos les encantarán.','["100 g de margarina sin lácteos","100 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de pasta de vainilla","100 g de mantequilla de maní crujiente","225 g de harina común","3 cucharadas de maní tostado, partido por la mitad"]','["Batir la margarina, el azúcar y la vainilla con un batidor eléctrico durante 1 minuto hasta que estén pálidos y suaves, luego mezclar con la mantequilla de maní y la harina hasta que estén completamente incorporados. Con las manos, forme una masa suave.","Extienda la masa entre dos hojas de papel para hornear hasta que tenga aproximadamente 1 cm de espesor. Si la masa está muy blanda (esto dependerá de la margarina utilizada), enfriar durante 45 minutos hasta que se endurezca un poco. Calienta el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3 y forra una bandeja para hornear grande o dos medianas con papel para hornear.","Corta círculos de la masa con un cortador de galletas de 8 cm y colócalos en las bandejas para hornear forradas. Presione firmemente algunas mitades de maní, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, en la parte superior de las galletas. Hornee durante 12-15 minutos hasta que se doren ligeramente en los bordes. Deje enfriar en las bandejas durante 5 minutos, luego levántelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:53:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12681,8450,'es','Pastel de salchicha y puré','Disfrute de esta ingeniosa versión de uno de los favoritos de la familia: salchichas con puré. Reúne los dos ingredientes en un pastel abundante que se puede congelar fácilmente.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","8 salchichas de cerdo","25 g de mantequilla","2 cebollas, finamente cortadas","pizca de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharadas de harina común","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","500 ml de caldo de carne","guisantes, para servir (opcional)","1,25 kg de patatas King Edward o Maris Piper, cortadas en trozos grandes","150ml de leche entera","25 g de mantequilla","25 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado grueso (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén y cocina suavemente las salchichas a fuego medio-alto durante 10-12 minutos, dándoles vuelta hasta que se doren por todos lados. Transfiera a un plato, luego ponga la mantequilla en la sartén y caliente hasta que chisporrotee. Vierta las cebollas, revolviéndolas con la mantequilla, luego espolvoree con el azúcar y fríalas durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que las cebollas estén doradas. Esparce la harina y revuelve hasta formar una pasta, luego agrega el puré de tomate. Cocine por un minuto, luego agregue el vinagre, vierta el caldo y lleve a ebullición. Bajar a fuego lento. Vierta el jugo de las salchichas, luego córtelas en rodajas gruesas y agréguelas a la sartén. Cocine todo junto durante 5 minutos hasta obtener una salsa de cebolla brillante. Vierta la mezcla en una fuente para horno.","Para hacer el puré, vierta las papas en una cacerola con agua fría con sal y déjelas hervir, luego bájelas y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 a 12 minutos o hasta que estén cocidas (la punta de un cuchillo debe deslizarse fácilmente). Escurrir y dejar actuar un minuto. Vierta la leche en la cacerola y cocine a fuego lento, luego vierta las papas escurridas y la mantequilla y triture bien. Sazone al gusto.","Cubra las salchichas y la salsa con el puré, comenzando desde el borde del plato y avanzando hasta el centro. Use un tenedor para raspar las líneas de la cobertura y esparza sobre el queso, si lo usa. Puede ensamblarse, cubrirse y enfriarse hasta por dos días o congelarse durante tres meses. Descongelar completamente antes de cocinar. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Hornear el pastel en una bandeja durante 35-40 minutos hasta que la parte superior se dore. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos antes de sacarlo directamente de la fuente para hornear en la mesa y servirlo con guisantes, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:53:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12682,4537,'es','Chorizo, rocket & preserved lemon calzones','Llene estos calzone llenos de sabor con anticipación y luego hornee directamente desde el congelador cuando esté ocupado. La combinación de chorizo ​​picante y masa de pimentón ahumado es divina.','["500 g de harina fuerte para pan, más un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharadas de pimentón","1½ cucharadita de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para el bol","sémola, para espolvorear","100 g de chorizo ​​para cocinar, en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","350ml en puré","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","2 limones pequeños en conserva, cortados en cuartos, sin la médula y con la ralladura finamente picada","½ manojo pequeño de albahaca, picada en trozos grandes","50 g de rúcula, picada en trozos grandes","75 g de mozzarella, cortada en trozos","25 g de parmesano rallado"]','["Para la masa, poner en un bol la harina, el pimentón, la levadura, el aceite, 300ml de agua tibia y una pizca grande de sal. Mezclar hasta obtener una masa suave y ligeramente húmeda. Amasar en una batidora de pie equipada con un gancho para masa o a mano durante 10 minutos hasta que quede suave (aún estará bastante suave). Verter en un bol engrasado, tapar y dejar reposar durante 2 horas.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Freír el chorizo ​​en una cacerola grande a fuego medio durante 2 minutos hasta que suelte parte de su aceite. Agrega el ajo y continúa sofriendo durante 30 segundos. Agregue la passata, el azúcar, el vinagre y los limones en conserva y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que espese. Agregue la albahaca y la rúcula. Dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 con una bandeja para hornear adentro. Divida la masa en cuatro trozos y luego extiéndalos sobre una superficie ligeramente espolvoreada hasta formar un círculo fino de 30 cm. Coloque cada círculo sobre un cuadrado de papel para hornear espolvoreado con sémola. Extienda el relleno enfriado sobre la mitad de cada círculo, dejando un borde, luego cubra con un poco de mozzarella. Cepille el borde de cada círculo con un poco de agua. Trabajando con un círculo a la vez, doble una mitad sobre la otra para que el relleno quede cerrado, luego doble el borde para sellar. Los calzones ahora se pueden congelar por hasta tres meses (ver más abajo). Levante los calzones en los cuadrados de pergamino sobre la bandeja para hornear caliente en el horno, espolvoree el parmesano encima y hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que estén inflados y dorados."]','2026-01-11 12:53:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12683,8452,'es','flan de huevo','Invite a su familia a disfrutar de esta crema de huevo al horno como postre reconfortante. Servir caliente o dejar enfriar en el frigorífico durante la noche y disfrutar con fruta escalfada.','["3 huevos, más 1 yema, ligeramente batidos","1 vaina de vainilla, partida a lo largo y sin semillas o 1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","60 g de azúcar en polvo","215ml de leche entera","215ml de nata doble","nuez moscada, para rallar"]','["Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2. Batir los huevos, la vainilla y el azúcar con una cuchara de madera hasta que se combinen. Incorpora la leche y la nata y vierte en un plato mediano. Rallar finamente sobre una generosa capa de nuez moscada.","Llene hasta la mitad una fuente para asar con agua para hacer un baño María. Coloque el plato en la lata de modo que el agua suba aproximadamente tres cuartos de los lados del plato. Hornee durante 45 a 50 minutos, o hasta que esté listo y con un ligero movimiento en el centro. Servir caliente o dejar enfriar en el frigorífico durante la noche. Servir con fruta escalfada."]','2026-01-11 12:53:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12684,8454,'es','Rollito de arce, pera, nueces y mascarpone','Pruebe la combinación de nueces pecanas y jarabe de arce con peras jugosas y un bizcocho ligero como el aire en este impresionante rollito. Queda genial con una taza de té o servido como pudín.','["aceite vegetal, para la lata","4 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de canela molida","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","3 peras pequeñas maduras, peladas, sin corazón y cortadas en trozos de 1 cm","1 limón, exprimido","250 g de mascarpone","150 g de nata doble","5 cucharadas de jarabe de arce oscuro, más algo extra para servir (opcional)","200 g de nueces"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar un molde para panecillos suizos de 30 x 24 cm y cubrir con papel para hornear. Pon los huevos, la vainilla y ambos azúcares en un tazón grande y bate con un batidor eléctrico durante 5 minutos, o hasta que espese y duplique su volumen. Los batidores deben dejar un rastro espeso al sacarlos de la mezcla.","Tamice sobre la harina, el polvo para hornear, la canela y ¼ de cucharadita de sal, e incorpore muy suavemente con una cuchara grande de metal. Vierta en el molde preparado y hornee durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y elástico. Dejar enfriar un poco en el molde y luego colocar sobre una hoja de papel para hornear espolvoreada con azúcar glas. Enrollar por el extremo más largo, junto con el pergamino, y dejar enfriar.","Mezcle las peras con el jugo de limón en un tazón, luego viértalas en un colador colocado sobre un tazón para escurrir el exceso de líquido. Batir el mascarpone, la nata doble y 3 cucharadas de jarabe de arce hasta que espese y se pueda tomar con una cuchara. Coloque las nueces en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que estén finamente picadas, luego extiéndalas sobre una hoja grande de papel para hornear.","Cuando el bizcocho esté completamente frío, desenróllelo y rocíelo sobre el jarabe de arce restante. Untar con tres cuartas partes de la mezcla de mascarpone, luego esparcir sobre las peras y volver a enrollar bien. Extienda el mascarpone restante por todo el exterior del rollito y luego enrolle rápidamente las nueces picadas. Córtelo en rodajas gruesas y sírvalo con un chorrito extra de jarabe de arce, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:53:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12685,8456,'es','Pastel de moras y naranja','Pruebe una versión diferente del bizcocho en capas con moras, naranjas picantes y mermelada en lugar del relleno habitual. Coloca la cobertura para una apariencia profesional.','["225 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para las latas","225 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 naranjas ralladas (reserva las naranjas para la llovizna, a continuación)","150 g de moras, partidas por la mitad si son grandes","3 naranjas, en jugo (use las naranjas ralladas, arriba, necesitará alrededor de 150 ml), 1 rallada","100 g de azúcar en polvo","150 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","350 g de azúcar glas","1 naranja, rallada y ralladura extra para servir","1 cucharada de leche","200 g de mermelada","100 g de moras"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla dos moldes para pasteles de fondo suelto de 20 cm y cubrirlos con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, hasta que se combinen. Agregue la vainilla, la harina y el polvo para hornear y mezcle hasta que quede suave, luego agregue suavemente la ralladura de naranja y las moras, teniendo cuidado de no mezclar demasiado.","Divida la masa entre los dos moldes y hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Cubra con papel de aluminio después de 30 minutos si comienzan a colorear demasiado rápido.","Mientras tanto, haz la llovizna. Coloque el jugo de naranja, la ralladura y el azúcar en una cacerola pequeña y cocine a fuego lento durante 4-5 minutos hasta que se forme un almíbar fino. Vierta en un recipiente resistente al calor y reserve.","Cuando los bizcochos estén listos, rocíe el almíbar sobre ambos mientras aún están calientes y unte uniformemente con una brocha de repostería. Dejar enfriar completamente en los moldes.","Mientras tanto, prepara la crema de mantequilla para la cobertura. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar glas en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave, pálida y esponjosa. Agrega la ralladura de naranja y la leche hasta que se afloje un poco. Vierta en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla redonda grande. Batir la mermelada para que se suelte y luego transferir un poco a una manga pastelera provista de una pequeña boquilla redonda.","Retire los bizcochos enfriados de los moldes y coloque uno en una tabla o plato para pasteles. Coloque puntos de crema de mantequilla encima formando un círculo alrededor del borde, luego tres puntos en el medio. Vierta un poco de mermelada en los espacios entre la crema de mantequilla y luego cubra con el segundo bizcocho. Coloque más puntos de crema de mantequilla por toda la superficie y luego rellene los espacios con la mermelada restante. Para terminar, espolvorea con las moras y la ralladura de naranja extra."]','2026-01-11 12:53:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12686,8458,'es','Pastelitos de natillas de ciruelas asadas y pistachos','Aprovecha las ciruelas a finales de verano y hornéalas en una tartera con relleno de pistachos y natillas. Valen la pena el esfuerzo','["50 g de mantequilla fría, picada, más 120 g de mantequilla congelada (ver paso 1)","300 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de azúcar glas","2 huevos batidos","100 g de pistachos sin cáscara","150ml de leche entera","150ml de nata doble","3 yemas de huevo (congela las claras para otra receta)","65 g de azúcar en polvo","15 g de harina común","15 g de harina de maíz","4 ciruelas rojas, partidas por la mitad y sin hueso","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","1⁄2 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["La noche antes de preparar los pasteles, envuelva 120 g de mantequilla en papel de aluminio y congélelos hasta que estén sólidos. Combine la harina, el azúcar glas y ¼ de cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande. Agregue la mantequilla picada y frote con la mezcla de harina hasta que parezca pan rallado fino. Agregue 7 cucharadas de agua muy fría (si todavía parece un poco seca, agregue 2 cucharadas adicionales). Amasar ligeramente la masa hasta que se una, luego extenderla sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un rectángulo. Con un rallador de queso grueso, ralle la mitad de la mantequilla congelada sobre los tercios medio e inferior de la masa. Dobla hacia abajo el tercio superior y dobla hacia arriba el tercio inferior, como si estuvieras doblando una letra. Gira la masa 90 grados y repite con el resto de la mantequilla congelada. Envuelva y enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos.","Ponga 75 g de pistachos en un recipiente resistente al calor. Cubrir con agua hirviendo y dejar en remojo durante 5 minutos. Escurrir, verter en un procesador de alimentos y batir durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta obtener una pasta suave. Dejar de lado.","Poner la leche y la nata doble en una cacerola pequeña a fuego medio. Llevar a fuego lento y luego retirar del fuego. Batir las yemas de huevo, el azúcar en polvo y la harina en un bol. Agregue gradualmente la mezcla de leche en varias adiciones y luego vierta en una sartén limpia a fuego lento. Cocine, revolviendo continuamente, hasta que la crema esté espesa. Cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos más, luego agregue una pizca de sal marina. Pasar a un bol y dejar enfriar. Una vez enfriado, vierta en un procesador de alimentos con la pasta de pistacho y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Poner en un bol y reservar.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner las ciruelas en una fuente para asar, con el lado cortado hacia abajo. Espolvorea sobre el azúcar y la vainilla. Ase durante 15 minutos hasta que se ablanden pero mantengan su forma. Dejar enfriar. Sube el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8.","Extienda la masa fría sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un rectángulo de aproximadamente 38 x 24 cm. Recorta los lados con un cuchillo afilado y luego corta la masa en ocho rectángulos de 11 x 10 cm. Marque un borde de 1 cm alrededor de cada uno y luego colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear (es posible que necesite dos bandejas). Pincelar con huevo batido y dejar enfriar durante 15 minutos. Hornee por 20 minutos. Empuje los centros hacia abajo, luego coloque o vierta la crema de pistacho y cubra cada uno con la mitad de una ciruela. Hornee por 10-15 minutos más. Picar finamente el resto de los pistachos y esparcirlos sobre la masa caliente. Dejar enfriar completamente antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12687,8460,'es','Bollos de canela y manzana con caramelo','Equilibre el fuerte sabor de la manzana con la dulzura del caramelo y un glaseado picante de queso suave para hacer estos panecillos de canela inspirados en la manzana acaramelada.','["320 ml de leche (cualquier leche servirá), más un chorrito extra","50 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","aceite vegetal, para fermentar","3 manzanas medianas, peladas, sin corazón y cortadas en cubos de 1 cm","nuez de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharada de canela","150 g de queso tierno","150 g de azúcar glas","pizca grande de canela","3 cucharadas de caramelo enlatado"]','["Prepare la masa para los bollos el día antes de hornearlos, si tiene tiempo; esto desarrollará un mejor sabor. Calentar la leche en una cacerola hasta que esté humeante pero no hirviendo. Agrega la mantequilla y agita la sartén durante 1-2 minutos hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y la leche se enfríe un poco. Debería estar simplemente tibio.","Ponga la harina en un tazón grande o en el tazón de una batidora de pie. Agregue la levadura y el azúcar a un lado del tazón, luego ½ cucharadita de sal al otro. Batir y luego verter la leche con mantequilla tibia. Mezcle hasta que los ingredientes formen una masa suave (debe quedar un poco pegajosa), luego colóquela sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase a mano durante 8 a 10 minutos, o mantenga la batidora encendida durante 5 minutos aproximadamente. La masa se sentirá elástica y suave cuando esté lista; deberías poder separarla sin que se rompa inmediatamente (esto significa que el gluten se ha desarrollado). Engrasa ligeramente un bol, añade la masa y tapa. Dejar reposar a temperatura ambiente durante unas horas o hasta que la masa haya duplicado su tamaño. O déjelo enfriar durante la noche.","Para hacer el relleno de manzana, cocine las manzanas, la mantequilla, el azúcar y 1 cucharada de agua en una sartén durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que estén suaves y pegajosas. Agrega un chorrito más de agua si la sartén parece seca o el azúcar comienza a quemarse. Dejar enfriar.","Si la masa está fría, sácala del frigorífico 30 minutos antes de darle forma. Para la mantequilla de canela, mezcla la mantequilla, el azúcar, la vainilla y la canela junto con una pizca de sal. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, forme un rectángulo rugoso y luego extiéndala hasta que tenga unos 50 x 40 cm. Extienda la mantequilla de canela sobre la masa y hasta los bordes. Vierta sobre el relleno de manzana.","Trabajando desde uno de los lados más largos, enrolle la masa lo más fuerte que pueda hasta darle forma de salchicha. Cortar en 12 trozos iguales. Para hacer esto fácilmente, primero corte la masa por la mitad en forma transversal, luego corte cada mitad en tres pedazos y luego parta cada pedazo por la mitad. Forre una fuente para hornear redonda grande o un molde para pasteles (de unos 33 cm) con papel para hornear. Coloque los bollos, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, en el plato o lata. Asegúrate de que las colas de los bollos (donde se abre la masa) estén metidas hacia el centro del molde, para que no se desplieguen cuando se hornean. Deja algo de espacio alrededor de cada panecillo, ya que se expandirán a medida que crezcan. Cubra sin apretar y déjelo reposar durante 30 minutos a 2 horas (dependiendo de qué tan caliente esté su cocina) hasta que los bollos estén inflados y tocándose por los lados. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Revise los panecillos después de 25 minutos; si todavía se ven un poco pastosos en el centro pero los bordes se queman, cúbralos con papel de aluminio y continúe horneando. Déjalo enfriar en el molde mientras haces el glaseado.","Mezcle el queso tierno, el azúcar glas y la canela. Extienda sobre los panecillos mientras aún está ligeramente caliente, de modo que el glaseado gotee un poco en los remolinos de los panecillos sin derretirse por completo. Afloje el caramelo con una gota de leche, si es necesario, luego rocíe sobre el glaseado. Dejar reposar durante 30 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:53:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12688,8462,'es','Pancitos helados','Estos panecillos helados perfectos son ideales para untar el té de la tarde o un proyecto de repostería de fin de semana. Rellénelo con mermelada y crema para disfrutar de una delicia tradicional.','["350ml de leche, más extra para el cepillado","30 g de mantequilla, en cubos","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","10 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","300 g de azúcar glas, más 1 cucharada","colorante alimentario amarillo, rosa y morado (opcional)","300 ml de nata para montar o nata doble","200 g de cuajada de limón","200 g de mermelada de frambuesa","200 g de mermelada de grosella negra","cerezas glaseadas, chispas o pétalos de rosa y violeta cristalizados, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar la leche en una cacerola hasta que esté humeante. Agrega la mantequilla y revuelve hasta que se derrita. Dejar enfriar un poco. Vierta la harina y la levadura en un tazón o batidora equipada con un gancho para amasar, luego agregue el azúcar en polvo y ½ cucharadita de sal.","Cuando la mezcla de leche se haya enfriado un poco (debe sentirse tibia), viértala en la mezcla de harina. Si usa una batidora de pie, mezcle durante 5 a 8 minutos a velocidad media hasta que esté elástico. O amase en el tazón durante unos 10 minutos; cuando la masa se separe, debería poder estirarse sin romperse.","Poner la masa en un bol limpio, cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar durante 1½ horas o hasta que doble su tamaño. O transfiéralo al refrigerador para que suba lentamente por hasta 24 horas (esto mejorará la textura y el sabor).","Si la masa está fría, sacar de la nevera 1 hora antes de darle forma. Divida en 10 porciones iguales (péselas si quiere ser preciso). Para hacer panecillos, tome un trozo de masa y enróllelo hasta darle la forma de un dedo áspero, como un mini panecillo para hot dog. Meta los lados en el medio del panecillo. Dale la vuelta al panecillo y asegúrate de que la superficie esté agradable y tensa. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear forrada, dejando espacio entre cada uno. Cubra sin apretar y déjelo reposar durante 30 minutos a 1 hora hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar los bollos con leche y hornear durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Poner sobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar.","Mezcle el azúcar glas con 2-3 cucharadas de agua; debe quedar espesa. Divida en tazones, dependiendo de cuántos colorantes alimentarios esté usando (nosotros usamos tres). Tiñe cada uno con un color diferente, añadiendo un chorrito más de agua si es necesario.","Batir la nata y 1 cucharada de azúcar glas hasta que mantenga su forma. No bata demasiado, ya que se espesará a medida que vierta (consulte el consejo a continuación). Coloca una manga pastelera con boquilla de estrella y rellénala con un tercio de la crema (ver consejo a continuación).","Divide los panecillos por la mitad a lo largo. Vierta aproximadamente 60 g de cuajada de limón o mermelada sobre la mitad inferior de cada panecillo (o por la mitad), alternando los sabores, luego agregue un remolino de crema. Continúe hasta que todos los bollos estén llenos, rellenando la manga pastelera con crema según sea necesario. Vierta un poco de glaseado sobre cada panecillo, haciendo coincidir los colores con la mermelada (usamos amarillo para la cuajada, rosa para la mermelada de frambuesa y morado para la grosella negra). Decore con las cerezas glaseadas, chispas y pétalos cristalizados, si lo desea, luego déjelo reposar durante unos 20 minutos antes de servir. Es mejor consumirlo el día en que se preparan, pero se conservará en el refrigerador durante 24 horas."]','2026-01-11 12:53:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12689,8464,'es','Pan de maíz con calabaza y mantequilla de jalapeño batida','Unte una rodaja de pan de maíz con un poco de mantequilla de jalapeño especiada para obtener una combinación espectacular servida con chile con carne. Es fantástico compartir comida.','["50 g de mantequilla salada, derretida, más un poco más para la sartén","300 g de sémola fina o polenta","150 g de harina común","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 huevos grandes","425 g de puré de calabaza","250ml de suero de leche o yogur natural","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y finamente picados","150 g de mantequilla blanda","25 g de jalapeños en rodajas de un frasco, picados en trozos grandes, más 2 cucharadas de líquido del frasco"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Untar con mantequilla un molde apto para horno de 30 cm. Combine la sémola, la harina, el polvo para hornear y el bicarbonato en un tazón grande y sazone. Ponga la mantequilla, los huevos, la calabaza, el suero de leche y los chiles en una jarra y bata hasta que se combinen. Incorpora gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos a los secos, teniendo cuidado de no mezclar demasiado. Vierta en el molde y hornee durante 50 minutos a 1 hora hasta que esté dorado.","Mientras tanto, prepara la mantequilla de jalapeño batida. Batir la mantequilla con los jalapeños y el líquido del frasco con unas varillas eléctricas, hasta que la mezcla se torne clara y pálida. Sazone al gusto.","Una vez que el pan de maíz esté cocido, sírvelo tibio o déjalo enfriar, con la mantequilla de jalapeño a un lado para esparcirlo. El pan de maíz se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días o congelado durante dos o tres meses. La mantequilla se mantendrá en el refrigerador, tapada, hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:53:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12690,8466,'es','Flaps veganos de dátiles y nueces','Prepare estos sencillos flapjacks de dátiles y nueces para las once o cuando necesite un estímulo. De origen vegetal y vegano, son ideales para cualquiera que siga una dieta sin lácteos.','["100 g de dátiles medjool deshuesados","1 plátano maduro","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de nueces en mitades","250 g de gachas de avena","50 g de semillas de cáñamo"]','["Forrar un molde cuadrado de 20 x 20 cm con papel pergamino. Picar los dátiles en trozos grandes y cubrir con 100 ml de agua hirviendo. Dejar en remojo durante 10 minutos.","Pon el plátano en un bol, tritúralo con un tenedor, luego agrega la canela, la vainilla, una pizca de sal marina y los dátiles remojados junto con su líquido.","Vierta la mezcla en un procesador de alimentos con la mitad de las nueces y 100 g de avena. Pulsa hasta obtener una pasta espesa. Vierta en un tazón y combine con la mayoría de las nueces, la avena y las semillas de cáñamo restantes.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Presione la mezcla en el molde forrado, cubra con las nueces y semillas restantes y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado y firme. Dejar enfriar por completo antes de cortar en nueve cuadrados."]','2026-01-11 12:53:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12691,8468,'es','Pan para partir y compartir queso, cebollino y jamón','Hornee este delicioso pan desmenuzable, relleno de queso exudado, mostaza y jamón. Puedes utilizar cualquier queso que tengas en la nevera.','["170ml de leche entera","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, cortada en cubos","1½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","3 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa en polvo","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","1 sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","4 huevos medianos, ligeramente batidos, más 1 para glasear","aceite, para probar","250 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","50 g de parmesano rallado","½ manojo de cebollino, finamente picado","150 g de jamón ahumado, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Vierte la leche en una cacerola y agrega el azúcar y la mantequilla. Calienta suavemente, girando la sartén hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Reservar hasta que esté tibio.","Vierta la sal, la mostaza, la harina y la levadura en un tazón grande y revuelva. Haga un hueco en el centro y luego vierta la mezcla de huevos batidos y leche. Mezcle rápidamente con una cuchara de madera para hacer una masa rugosa, luego colóquela sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que esté elástica y elástica. Alternativamente, amase en una batidora de pie durante 7 a 10 minutos usando el gancho. Engrase ligeramente un tazón grande para mezclar. Coloque la masa en el bol y cúbrala sin apretar con un paño de cocina. Déjelo en un lugar cálido durante 1½-2 horas o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Vuelva a colocar la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada golpeándola ligeramente y amasándola brevemente. Espolvorea sobre la mitad del queso, todo el cebollino y todo el jamón. Amasar la masa hasta que el jamón y el queso queden bien distribuidos. Divide la masa en 18 bolas del mismo tamaño. Pellizque la parte inferior para crear bolas redondas y uniformes. Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear y dibuje una plantilla redonda de 25 cm en el papel (un plato grande funciona bien para esto). Coloca las bolas de masa en círculos concéntricos en el círculo que has dibujado. Rellena cada hueco con otro trozo de queso. Cubrir ligeramente. Dejar reposar durante 1-1½ horas o hasta que la masa suba.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Batir el huevo restante y utilizarlo para cepillar ligeramente las bolas de masa. Espolvoree la mayor parte del queso restante y luego hornee por 25 minutos. Espolvorea lo que queda del queso y hornea por 5 minutos más. Dejar enfriar un poco antes de servir caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:53:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12692,4129,'es','Feta al horno con sésamo y miel','Combina los sabores del queso salado y la miel dulce para crear un plato que es mucho más que la suma de sus partes. Rico y decadente, sírvalo con pita caliente.','["1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo, tostadas","200 g de queso feta en bloque","2 cucharadas de miel, más extra para servir","1 cucharadita de orégano picado","aceite de oliva, para rociar","panes pita calientes, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner las semillas de sésamo en un plato poco profundo y untar todo el bloque de queso feta con miel. Presione con cuidado el queso feta cubierto de miel sobre las semillas de sésamo, volteándolo para que quede bien cubierto de semillas.","Coloque el queso feta en una fuente para horno (debe quedar bien ajustado), luego espolvoree el orégano y una pizca de sal marina. Rocíe con un poco de aceite de oliva. Hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que el queso feta esté suave, luego rocíe con un poco más de miel y sirva con el pan de pita a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:53:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12693,8470,'es','Rollitos de salchicha del siguiente nivel','Haga un esfuerzo adicional con rollos de salchicha caseros y haga su propio hojaldre. La mezcla para relleno de hierbas y carne de salchicha comprada en la tienda ahorra tiempo extra','["800 g de salchicha","100 g de mezcla de relleno de salvia y cebolla","1 huevo batido","Mostaza inglesa, ketchup o salsa marrón, para servir","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla, congelada","400 g de harina común (o 350 g de harina común y 50 g de harina de centeno blanca), más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de mostaza inglesa en polvo","1 cucharada de vinagre de sidra o vino blanco"]','["La noche antes de hornear, congela la mantequilla para la masa. Ese día, verter la harina en un bol grande con una pizca de sal y la mostaza en polvo. Sostenga el bloque de mantequilla en su envoltorio y ralle en trozos grandes directamente con la harina, retirando el envoltorio poco a poco según sea necesario y sumergiendo el extremo de la mantequilla en la harina de vez en cuando para evitar que se aglomere en el tazón. Use una paleta o un cuchillo para cubiertos y revuelva ligeramente, luego agregue unos 200 ml de agua helada y el vinagre para unir la masa. Envuelva y enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Vierta la carne de la salchicha en un bol con la mezcla para relleno, 100 ml de agua fría y mucha pimienta negra. Aprieta todo con las manos hasta que se mezcle uniformemente, luego enfríalo en el refrigerador mientras extiendes la masa. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie enharinada, extiéndala hasta formar un rectángulo de unos 50 cm x 25 cm y recorte los bordes. Unte ligeramente la masa con un poco de huevo y luego moldee la mezcla de salchicha en un rollo de 50 cm. Coloque la salchicha justo descentrada sobre la masa, luego doble la masa y dóblela o use un tenedor para presionar los extremos. Córtelo en ocho trozos con un cuchillo humedecido en agua tibia y límpielo entre rodajas. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear y enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos. Se mantendrá frío hasta por 24 horas. Para hornear antes, meter en el congelador durante 15 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Pintar los panecillos con más huevo batido, hornear durante 20 minutos, luego pincelar de nuevo y volver al horno durante 10-15 minutos más hasta que adquieran un color caoba claro. Deje enfriar sobre una rejilla y luego sirva caliente con mostaza inglesa, ketchup o salsa marrón y un vaso de sidra fría, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:53:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12694,4135,'es','Molinetes de queso, marmita y espinacas','Prepare estos sencillos molinetes con sabores de queso cheddar, Marmite y espinacas para servir con sopa o como parte de un picnic familiar. Congela antes de hornear, si lo prefieres.','["Hoja de 320 g de masa de hojaldre ligera ya laminada","1 cucharada de marmita","2-3 puñados grandes de espinacas","80 g de queso cheddar"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Desenrolla la masa con el lado más largo directamente frente a ti. Extiende la Marmite por la superficie. Corte las espinacas sobre la Marmite y esparza con el queso, asegurándose de que quede uniformemente esparcido.","Enrolle bien la masa hacia afuera (comenzando por el lado más largo) para crear una forma de salchicha larga, luego córtela en 12 trozos. Colóquelas en dos bandejas para hornear forradas con papel para hornear, con la espiral hacia arriba y aplástalas un poco con la mano. Se mantendrá cubierto y congelado en esta etapa. Hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos (o 25 minutos si se cocina congelado), hasta que esté inflado y dorado."]','2026-01-11 12:53:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12695,8472,'es','Pastel de goteo de ganache de chocolate','Prepare este impresionante pastel de ganache de chocolate con crema de mantequilla de merengue suizo para una ocasión especial. Este delicioso bizcocho es perfecto para una celebración.','["340 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para las latas","340 g de azúcar en polvo","6 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","340 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de leche","3 claras de huevo grandes","225 g de azúcar en polvo","300 g de mantequilla sin sal, cortada en cubitos y blanda","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","75ml de nata doble","flores comestibles, brillantina o chocolate, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Unte con mantequilla tres moldes para pasteles redondos de 20 cm y cúbralos con papel de horno antiadherente. Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en un tazón grande hasta que estén suaves y suaves. Incorpora poco a poco los huevos hasta que se combinen, luego incorpora la vainilla. Incorpora la harina y el polvo para hornear hasta que todo esté combinado. Agregue la leche para que se afloje.","Hornea los bizcochos durante 20 minutos hasta que estén dorados y al insertar un palillo en el centro, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras tanto, prepara la crema de mantequilla de merengue suizo. Coloque las claras de huevo y el azúcar en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola pequeña con agua hirviendo a fuego lento. Asegúrate de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Batir durante 3-4 minutos hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Poner en una batidora eléctrica y batir durante 10 minutos a velocidad media-alta hasta obtener un merengue espeso.","Agregue gradualmente la mantequilla a la mezcla de merengue durante 5 minutos hasta que se incorpore y la crema de mantequilla esté esponjosa.","Coloque un bizcocho en un plato o soporte para pasteles, cúbralo con unas cucharadas de crema de mantequilla y extiéndalo en una capa uniforme. Agrega el siguiente bizcocho y repite. Cubra con el bizcocho final.","Alise una fina capa de crema de mantequilla alrededor del pastel, de modo que todos los lados queden cubiertos; esto se llama capa de migas. Enfriar en la nevera durante 45 min. Retire y alise una capa gruesa de la crema de mantequilla restante alrededor del pastel con una espátula, reservando un poco para decorar. Vuelva a colocarlo en el refrigerador durante 45 minutos a 1 hora para que cuaje.","Mientras tanto, haz la ganache. Pon el chocolate amargo en un bol y calienta la nata en una cacerola pequeña hasta que esté humeante. Verter la nata sobre el chocolate y dejar derretir durante 5-10 minutos. Revuelva para hacer una ganache brillante, luego déjela a un lado para que se endurezca un poco; desea que se pueda verter pero no demasiado líquida. Coloque la ganache sobre el borde superior del pastel, animándola a rociar los lados con la cuchara; comience por la parte posterior del pastel para dominarlo. Rellena también el centro de la parte superior del pastel con chocolate. Dejar reposar durante 10 minutos.","Para decorar, poner la crema de mantequilla sobrante en una manga pastelera con boquilla redonda y hacer pequeños puntos encima del pastel. Decora como quieras, retira las flores antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 12:53:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12696,8474,'es','brioche','Prepara brioche casero y disfrútalo con mermelada o mantequilla en el desayuno. Requiere un poco de esfuerzo, pero los resultados de este pan dulce y tierno bien valen la pena.','["450 g de harina blanca fuerte","2 cucharaditas de sal marina fina","50 g de azúcar en polvo","7 g de levadura activa seca","100ml de leche entera","4 huevos a temperatura ambiente, batidos, más 1 para batir","190 g de mantequilla salada, cortada en cubitos y blanda"]','["Ponga la harina en un bol de una batidora de pie con un gancho para masa. Agrega la sal por un lado y el azúcar por el otro. Vierta la levadura al lado del azúcar. Mezcle cada lado con la harina con las manos, luego mezcle todo con el gancho para masa.","Calienta la leche hasta que esté tibia al tacto, pero no caliente. Mezcle con la mezcla de harina hasta que se combinen. Con el gancho para masa a temperatura media, agregue gradualmente los huevos y mezcle durante 10 minutos.","Agregue gradualmente la mantequilla ablandada, uno o dos cubos a la vez, hasta que se combinen. Esto tardará entre 5 y 8 minutos. Raspe los lados, la masa quedará muy suave.","Vierta la masa en un tazón grande, cubra con un paño de cocina y déjela durante 1 hora 30 minutos - 2 horas hasta que duplique su tamaño y esté bien leudada. Una vez leudado meter en el frigorífico 1h.","Forre el fondo y los lados de un molde para pan de 900 g con papel para hornear. Divida la masa en siete trozos iguales (la forma más sencilla de hacerlo con precisión es pesarla). Espolvoree ligeramente una superficie de trabajo con harina, tome un trozo de masa y tire de cada esquina hacia el centro para formar una forma circular. Con un poco de presión, empuja hacia abajo y haz una bola. Repita con las seis piezas restantes.","Pon las bolas en el molde, cuatro de un lado y tres en los huecos del otro lado. Cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar durante 30-35 minutos hasta que casi duplique su tamaño. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Unte ligeramente la masa con huevo batido y hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté dorada y leudada. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 20 minutos, luego retirar y enfriar por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:53:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12697,8476,'es','Giros de canela','Hornee estos fabulosos giros de canela para un desayuno para llevar o un dulce. Requieren un poco de esfuerzo pero valen la pena.','["275 g de leche entera","40 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubos","500 g de harina blanca fuerte y un poco más para espolvorear","7 g de levadura activa seca","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo pequeño, más 1 huevo batido, para glasear","75 g de mantequilla, derretida","150 g de azúcar en polvo","3 cucharaditas de canela molida","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de canela molida"]','["Calienta la leche y la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Deje que se enfríe un poco; la leche debe estar tibia, no caliente. Coloque la harina en un tazón grande con una pizca de sal a un lado del tazón. Agrega la levadura a la harina en el otro lado del tazón, para que no toque la sal. Vierta el azúcar y luego mezcle todo.","Vierte poco a poco la leche tibia sobre los ingredientes secos, mezclando con las manos hasta tener una masa relativamente pegajosa. Es posible que no necesite toda la leche. Agregue el huevo y continúe trabajando hasta que se combinen.","Espolvoree ligeramente una superficie con harina y saque la masa. Quedará bastante húmedo; cuanto más lo amases, más fácil te resultará. Amasar durante unos 10 minutos hasta obtener una masa suave. Colóquelo en un tazón ligeramente enharinado para que repose durante 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Para hacer el relleno, mezcla la mantequilla derretida, el azúcar y la canela hasta obtener una pasta suave. Dejar de lado.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un rectángulo de 30 x 40 cm. Extender sobre el relleno con una espátula hasta cubrir la masa por completo.","Doblar por la mitad a lo ancho y cortar en 16-18 tiras por el lado más corto. Gira ambos extremos de cada tira en direcciones opuestas hasta que se forme una espiral. Sosteniendo un extremo en la mano, envuelva el resto de la masa alrededor y encima, presionando los extremos en el fondo del panecillo para que no se deshaga durante la cocción.","Colóquelo en dos bandejas para hornear forradas con una separación de 5 cm. Dejar reposar durante 30-45 minutos hasta que suba ligeramente. Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Pintar la parte superior de los bollos con un poco de huevo y hornear durante 18-20 minutos hasta que estén dorados. No te preocupes si se sale un poco de mantequilla con canela.","Para la cobertura, mezcle el azúcar y la canela. Mientras aún están calientes, mezcle los bollos con el azúcar y cómelos inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:53:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12698,8478,'es','Bollos de masa madre con canela','Utilice una masa madre para hacer estos deliciosos bollos de canela. Agrega un sabor contrastante a los clásicos sabores dulces y pegajosos. Cubra con un glaseado de queso tierno, si lo desea.','["200 g de masa madre blanca activa","350 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de harina integral","1 cucharadita de canela molida","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200ml de leche tibia","1 huevo","50 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para la lata","150 g de azúcar moreno claro","125 g de mantequilla, blanda","2 cucharadas de canela molida","2 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","100 g de queso tierno","150 g de azúcar glas","¼ cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla"]','["Asegúrese de que su iniciador esté activo; debe ser agradable y burbujeante. Si no es así, aliméntelo y espere hasta que una cucharadita del iniciador flote en agua tibia.","Vierta todos los ingredientes para la masa, excepto la mantequilla, en un bol y mezcle con las manos para formar una masa peluda; asegúrese de que toda la harina de alrededor del bol esté mezclada. Deje la masa en el bol, cubierta con un paño húmedo, durante 30 minutos.","Incorpora la mantequilla a la masa con 1 cucharadita de sal. Una vez que esté completamente combinada, vierta la masa sobre una superficie y amase suavemente durante 5 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástica. Forme una bola con la masa y siéntese en el bol. Cubra y déjelo en un lugar cálido durante 3-4 horas hasta que la masa casi haya duplicado su tamaño.","Mientras tanto, hacer el relleno batiendo el azúcar, la mantequilla, la canela y una pizca de sal. Déjelo a temperatura ambiente para mantenerlo suave.","Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde para hornear cuadrado: los moldes más pequeños (20 x 20 cm) tendrán capacidad para nueve bollos, los moldes más grandes (25 x 25 cm) tendrán capacidad para 12. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie enharinada y enróllela hasta formar un rectángulo de aproximadamente 50 x 25 cm. Extiende el relleno sobre el rectángulo para que quede completamente cubierto. Enrolle la masa a lo largo del borde largo hasta formar una salchicha apretada tipo rollo suizo. Corta la masa en trozos y colócalos, con la espiral hacia arriba, en el molde. Dejar reposar 1 hora a temperatura ambiente, luego tapar y dejar en el frigorífico toda la noche.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cubra el molde con papel de aluminio y hornee en una bandeja para hornear (esto evitará que la mezcla gotee en su horno) durante 30 minutos, luego retire el papel de aluminio y hornee durante 10-15 minutos más para que se dore ligeramente.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el almíbar dorado con 1 cucharada de agua hirviendo. Tan pronto como los bollos salgan del horno, untarlos generosamente con el almíbar y luego dejar enfriar un poco. Sacar los bollos del molde aún calientes y dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla. Para hacer el glaseado, bata el queso tierno, el azúcar y la vainilla hasta que quede espeso pero lloviznante. Rocíe sobre los panecillos cuando estén completamente fríos."]','2026-01-11 12:53:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12699,8480,'es','galletas imperio','Prepare un lote de estas sencillas galletas imperio y disfrútelas con una taza de té. Sándwich con mermelada de frambuesa y cúbralo con glaseado espeso y una cereza glaseada para terminar','["175 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de mantequilla fría con sal, cortada en cubos","335 g de azúcar glas","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 yemas de huevo medianas","100 g de mermelada de frambuesa","50 g de cerezas glaseadas, en cuartos"]','["Ponga la harina, la mantequilla, 85 g de azúcar glas, la vainilla y las yemas de huevo en un procesador de alimentos y presione en ráfagas hasta que se combinen (alternativamente, frote la mantequilla y la harina con las yemas de los dedos y mezcle el azúcar, la vainilla y las yemas de huevo). Agrega ½ cucharada de agua si la mezcla se siente un poco seca. Vierta la mezcla rugosa sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase brevemente hasta que la masa se una. Envuelva y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Espolvoree ligeramente la superficie de trabajo con harina y extienda la masa hasta que tenga un grosor de unos 3 mm. Corta 24 rodajas de masa con un cortador de 7 cm. Junte los restos de masa restantes y vuelva a enrollarlos para hacer más galletas. Alinee los discos de masa en las bandejas para hornear, luego hornee durante 10 a 12 minutos o hasta que los bordes estén ligeramente dorados. Pasar a una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo.","Mezcle el azúcar glas restante con 2-3 cucharaditas de agua para hacer un glaseado muy espeso. Coloque o coloque el glaseado sobre la parte superior de la mitad de las galletas, dejando un borde alrededor del borde de cada una. Cubra con un pequeño trozo de cereza glaseada en el centro y luego déjelo reposar durante 30 minutos. Extienda la mermelada sobre las galletas sin hielo y haga un sándwich junto con las mitades heladas. Se conservará durante dos días en una lata hermética."]','2026-01-11 12:53:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12700,8482,'es','galletas sin huevo','Prepare algunas galletas con chispas de chocolate sin huevo como delicia y agregue cacao, si lo desea, para hacer versiones de chocolate. Son ideales si sigues una dieta sin huevo.','["125 g de mantequilla, blanda","125 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de esencia o extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de chispas de chocolate blanco o con leche","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con una cuchara de madera o una batidora eléctrica en un tazón grande hasta que esté suave, esponjoso y dorado.","Agrega la vainilla, la harina, el polvo para hornear y las chispas de chocolate. Agrega 1 cucharada de agua para unir la mezcla si es necesario, y el cacao en polvo para hacer galletas de chocolate, si lo deseas. Forma una bola con la masa con las manos.","Espolvorea un poco de harina sobre la superficie de trabajo y la masa. Estirar la masa hasta que tenga un grosor de 3 mm y, con la ayuda de cortadores de galletas, recortarlas y colocarlas en bandejas para horno forradas, espaciándolas bien.","Hornee durante unos 12 minutos o hasta que estén dorados. Si hornea en dos bandejas, intercambie las bandejas a la mitad de la cocción. Déjelo en las bandejas para hornear durante 5 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe. Se conservará en una lata hermética durante tres o cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12701,8484,'es','Pan de soda con cebolla y mantequilla de mostaza inglesa batida','Anímate con pan de soda casero con cebolla y una mantequilla de mostaza ligera pero contundente. Sirva junto con sus carnes frías favoritas y una ensalada fresca.','["340 g de harina integral fuerte","340 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","40 g de hojuelas de cebolla seca","1 cucharada de semillas de nigella","85 g de mantequilla, derretida","625ml de yogur natural","chorrito de leche","1 cucharada de avena","135 g de mantequilla sin sal, picada y blanda","25 g de mostaza inglesa"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta las harinas en un bol con el bicarbonato, las hojuelas de cebolla, las semillas de nigella y 1½ cucharada de sal. Revuelva y haga un hueco en el medio. Vierta la mantequilla y el yogur y, con una espátula, forme una masa suave y pegajosa. Si parece seco, añade un chorrito de leche.","Incline la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y forme una ronda con cuidado. Colóquelo sobre una bandeja para hornear ligeramente enharinada, corte una cruz profunda en la parte superior con un cuchillo afilado y espolvoree sobre la avena. Hornee durante 1 hora o hasta que esté dorado y el pan suene hueco al golpearlo por debajo. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Mientras el pan se enfría, bata la mantequilla, la mostaza y una pizca de sal marina hasta que quede suave y aireado. Vierta en una olla pequeña. Cortar el pan en rodajas y servir con la mantequilla de mostaza para untar."]','2026-01-11 12:53:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12702,8486,'es','pastel de fresa','Aprovecha la temporada de fresas con nuestra tarta de fresas, con bizcocho ligero, mermelada y glaseado de queso tierno. Es un postre central fabuloso.','["400 g de mantequilla blanda, y más para la lata","400 g de azúcar en polvo","5 huevos grandes","400 g de harina con levadura","100ml de yogur natural","300 g de fresas, peladas y partidas por la mitad","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","250 g de queso tierno","600 g de azúcar glas","400 g de mermelada de fresa"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre las bases de tres moldes para pasteles de 18 cm. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Licuar la mantequilla y el azúcar en un procesador de alimentos hasta que quede suave y cremoso. Agrega los huevos, la harina y el yogur y vuelve a licuar. Añade 200g de fresas (guarda las mejores para decorar) y la vainilla. Licue una vez más, hasta que la mezcla esté bien combinada.","Divida la masa del pastel de manera uniforme entre los tres moldes para pastel. Extienda y alise la parte superior con una espátula, luego hornee durante 25-30 minutos, hasta que los pasteles hayan subido y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Regrese al horno por otros 5 minutos si queda alguna mezcla húmeda adherida a la brocheta. Dejar en los moldes durante 5 minutos, luego volcar sobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo. Los pasteles se pueden preparar hasta dos días antes de glasearlos o congelarlos durante dos meses.","Para el glaseado, licúa la mantequilla y la mitad del azúcar hasta que quede suave y cremoso, agrega el queso tierno y el azúcar restante y licúa nuevamente. Tenga cuidado de no mezclar demasiado ya que el glaseado se volverá líquido. (Si mezcla demasiado, no se preocupe: siga mezclando con un batidor eléctrico y volverá a espesarse).","Cubra los pasteles con la mermelada y la mitad del glaseado. Invierta el pastel final en la parte superior, de modo que la base del pastel ahora quede en la parte superior, dándole una superficie plana. Apila el resto del glaseado encima del pastel, usando una espátula para esparcir el glaseado por encima y por los lados. Guarde un poco de glaseado para colocar rosetas alrededor del borde del pastel, si lo desea. Cubra con las fresas restantes. Se puede preparar hasta un día antes de servir y conservar en un lugar fresco o en el refrigerador. Se conservará durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12703,8488,'es','Pastel banoffee fácil','Invite a sus seres queridos a disfrutar de un pastel banoffee de postre con una base de galleta clásica, caramelo exudado, plátanos, crema y chocolate. ¿Quién podría resistirse?','["225 g de galletas digestivas","150 g de mantequilla, derretida","397g can caramel or 400g dulce de leche","3 plátanos pequeños, en rodajas","300ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","1 cuadrito de chocolate amargo (opcional)"]','["Tritura las galletas digestivas, ya sea a mano con una cuchara de madera, o en un robot de cocina, hasta obtener unas migajas finas, verter en un bol. Mezclar las galletas trituradas con la mantequilla derretida hasta que estén completamente combinadas. Vierta la mezcla en un molde para tarta estriado de fondo suelto de 23 cm y cubra el molde, incluidos los lados, con la galleta en una capa uniforme. Empuje hacia abajo con el dorso de una cuchara para alisar la superficie y enfríe durante 1 hora o toda la noche.","Batir el caramelo para que se suelte y verterlo sobre el fondo de la base de galleta. Extiéndalo uniformemente con el dorso de una cuchara o una espátula. Empuje suavemente el plátano picado hacia la parte superior del caramelo hasta cubrir la base. Poner en el frigorífico.","Batir la nata con el azúcar glas hasta que esté esponjosa y espesa. Saca la tarta del frigorífico y vierte la nata montada encima de los plátanos. Ralla el chocolate negro sobre la nata, si quieres, y sirve."]','2026-01-11 12:53:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12704,5185,'es','Pan de plátano sin gluten','Utilice plátanos demasiado maduros y haga pan de plátano con almendras molidas y harina sin gluten. Esta receta es ideal para cualquiera que siga una dieta sin gluten.','["5 plátanos pequeños maduros (4 machacados, 1 cortado por la mitad para decorar la parte superior)","150 g de harina con levadura sin gluten","100 g de avena sin gluten","50 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten","1 cucharadita de canela","90 g de azúcar moreno oscuro","90 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","2 huevos grandes, batidos","1 cucharada de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g con papel pergamino (nuestro molde medía 19 x 9 x 6 cm). Coloque todos los ingredientes, excepto el plátano en rodajas, 1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo y el azúcar glas, en un tazón grande y revuelva hasta que quede suave y combinado.","Vierta en el molde y coloque las dos mitades de plátano restantes con el lado cortado hacia arriba sobre la parte superior de la masa, presionando ligeramente hacia abajo. Espolvorea sobre el azúcar en polvo. Hornee durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 15 minutos hasta que una brocheta salga limpia, cubriendo con papel de aluminio hacia el final de la cocción si se dora demasiado.","Espolvorear con azúcar glas y dejar enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:53:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12705,8490,'es','Bizcocho de vainilla fácil','Haz sonreír a tus amigos y familiares con una porción de nuestro bizcocho de vainilla. Es el compañero perfecto para una taza de té de las once o el té de la tarde.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","200 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos batidos","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 cucharadas de leche entera","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla / ½ semillas de vaina de vainilla","125 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla / ½ semillas de vaina de vainilla"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g con papel pergamino (el mío medía 19 cm x 9 cm x 6 cm). Coloque todos los ingredientes excepto los del glaseado en un tazón grande y bata, ya sea con un batidor eléctrico de mano o una cuchara de madera, hasta que quede suave y combinado. Vierta la mezcla en el molde para pan y extiéndala uniformemente con el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee durante 40 – 45 minutos.","Una vez fuera del horno dejar enfriar y hacer el glaseado. Combine el azúcar glas y la pasta de vainilla con tres cucharadas de agua; es posible que necesite más, pero agréguelas gradualmente para obtener un glaseado espeso. Extiéndelo sobre la parte superior del pastel; está bien si gotea por los bordes. Dejar reposar y luego cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:53:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12706,8492,'es','Bollos helados con nata y mermelada','Prepare nuestros panecillos helados para una merienda o una venta de pasteles. Aprenda a preparar crema y darle forma a la masa con nuestra guía paso a paso para hacerlas muy especiales.','["350ml de leche, más extra para el cepillado","30 g de mantequilla, en cubos","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","10 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","300 g de azúcar glas, más 1 cucharada","unas gotas de colorante alimentario amarillo, rosa y morado (opcional)","300ml de nata para montar o doble","200 g de cuajada de limón","200 g de mermelada de frambuesa","200 g de mermelada de grosella negra","cerezas glaseadas, chispas o pétalos de rosa y violeta cristalizados, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calienta la leche hasta que esté humeante. Agrega la mantequilla y revuelve hasta que se derrita. Dejar enfriar un poco. Vierta la harina y la levadura en un tazón o batidora equipada con un gancho para amasar, luego agregue el azúcar en polvo y ½ cucharadita de sal.","Cuando la mezcla de leche se haya enfriado un poco (debe sentirse tibia al meter un dedo) vierta en la mezcla de harina. Si usa una batidora de pie, mezcle durante 5 a 8 minutos a velocidad media hasta que esté elástico. O amase en el tazón durante unos 10 minutos; cuando la masa se separe, debería poder estirarse sin romperse.","Poner la masa en un bol limpio, cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar durante 1½ horas o hasta que doble su tamaño. O transfiéralo al refrigerador para que suba lentamente por hasta 24 horas (esto mejorará la textura y el sabor).","Si la masa está fría, sacar de la nevera 1 hora antes de darle forma. Divida en 10 porciones iguales (péselas si quiere ser preciso). Para hacer bollos redondos, enrolle y forme cada pieza en una bola suave, o para hacer bollos con los dedos, enrolle y dé forma a cada pieza en forma de dedo. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear forrada, dejando espacio entre cada uno. Cubra sin apretar y déjelo reposar durante 30 minutos a 1 hora más hasta que doble.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar los bollos con leche y hornear durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Poner sobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar.","Mezcle el azúcar glas con 2-3 cucharadas de agua; debe quedar espesa. Divida en tazones, dependiendo de cuántos colorantes alimentarios esté usando (nosotros usamos tres). Tiñe cada uno con un color diferente, añadiendo un chorrito más de agua si es necesario.","Batir la nata y 1 cucharada de azúcar glas hasta que mantenga su forma. No bata demasiado, ya que se espesará a medida que vierta (consulte el consejo a continuación). Colocar una manga pastelera con boquilla de estrella y rellenar con un tercio de la nata.","Divida los panecillos redondos por la mitad como lo haría con un panecillo de hamburguesa, o los panecillos por la mitad a lo largo. Vierta aproximadamente 60 g de cuajada de limón o mermelada sobre la mitad inferior de cada panecillo (o por la mitad), alternando los sabores, luego agregue un remolino de crema. Continúe hasta que todos los bollos estén llenos, rellenando la manga pastelera con crema según sea necesario. Coloque un poco de glaseado sobre cada panecillo, haciendo coincidir los colores con la mermelada (usamos amarillo para la cuajada, rosa para la mermelada de frambuesa y morado para la grosella negra). Decore con las cerezas glaseadas, chispas y pétalos cristalizados, si lo desea, luego déjelo reposar durante unos 20 minutos antes de servir. Es mejor consumirlos el día en que se preparan, pero se conservan en el refrigerador durante 24 horas."]','2026-01-11 12:53:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12707,8494,'es','Galletas tipo sándwich de ruibarbo y natillas','Combina dos delicias retro en un delicioso bocado. Estas galletas de ruibarbo y natillas tienen un centro de mermelada, para darle un toque de nostalgia a una merienda o venta de pasteles.','["175 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubos","50 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de azúcar glas","¼ cucharadita de sal marina fina","250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de natillas en polvo","2 yemas de huevo","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla","200 g de ruibarbo, recortado y picado","200 g de azúcar en polvo","¼ de limón, en jugo"]','["Para hacer la mermelada, ponemos en una cacerola a fuego medio el ruibarbo, el azúcar y el zumo de limón. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 15 minutos, o hasta que el ruibarbo se descomponga y suelte su líquido. Mezcle con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave, luego cocine a fuego lento durante otros 5 a 10 minutos hasta que esté espeso y mermelada. Para comprobar que está listo, pasa una cuchara de madera por la base de la sartén; debe dejar un rastro en lugar de llenarse inmediatamente. Deje enfriar (se endurecerá más a medida que lo haga), luego enfríe hasta que esté listo para usar. Se conservará en un recipiente o frasco sellado en el refrigerador hasta por una semana.","Para hacer la masa de galleta, ponga la mantequilla, el azúcar y la sal en un procesador de alimentos y presione varias veces hasta obtener una pasta gruesa. Raspe los lados, luego agregue la harina y las natillas en polvo y presione nuevamente hasta obtener una consistencia arenosa y húmeda. Agrega las yemas de huevo y la vainilla y pulsa nuevamente hasta que la masa forme una bola. Agregue ½-1 cucharada de agua para unirlo, si es necesario. Saque la masa, luego envuélvala y póngala en el refrigerador para que se enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie enharinada hasta que tenga un espesor de 5 mm. Elimina tantas galletas como puedas con un cortador redondo de 6 mm; deberías obtener unas 32 en total.","Corta círculos o corazones de los centros de la mitad de las galletas usando el extremo ancho de una boquilla para manga pastelera simple (aproximadamente 1,5 cm) o un cortador de corazones pequeño. Transfiera todas las galletas a bandejas para hornear forradas, luego transfiéralas al refrigerador y enfríe durante 15 minutos. También puedes cocinar las formas recortadas para hacer mini galletas; si lo haces, colócalas en su propia bandeja para hornear.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6, luego hornea las galletas durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén doradas (5-6 minutos para las mini galletas). Poner sobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo.","Transfiera la mermelada a una manga pastelera, corte el extremo y coloque una pequeña capa de mermelada sobre las galletas simples (aquellas sin los centros cortados). O use una cucharadita. Extienda la mermelada; puede salirse de los lados al intercalar las galletas, así que no llegue demasiado al borde.","Coloque las galletas restantes sobre la mermelada (no presione demasiado), luego transfiéralas a un recipiente hermético en una sola capa y déjelas reposar durante la noche. Esto garantiza que la mermelada no se derrame al morderlos, pero se pueden comer de inmediato si no puedes resistirte. Se mantendrán en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días, pero las galletas comenzarán a ablandarse con el tiempo."]','2026-01-11 12:53:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12708,8496,'es','Tarta de albaricoque, almendras y polenta','Combine almendras y albaricoques en este delicioso pastel. Elaborado con polenta, el pastel tiene una hermosa textura húmeda y un sabor afrutado. Disfrútalo con crème fraîche','["50 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco más para la lata","125 g de azúcar granulada","8 albaricoques frescos, partidos por la mitad y sin hueso (es posible que necesites más si los albaricoques son pequeños)","150 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente, en cubos","150 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos","1 limón, rallado","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","50 g de harina común","50 g de polenta molida fina","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de almendras molidas","125ml de leche","3 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque, para glasear","crème fraîche o crema, para servir"]','["Unte con mantequilla un molde para pastel redondo de 20-23 cm. Si tiene el fondo suelto, deberás envolver el exterior con papel de aluminio para evitar que se derrame algo de caramelo. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Para los albaricoques, poner en un cazo el azúcar granulada y 75ml de agua. Calentar lentamente hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Cuando el azúcar se haya derretido, llevar a ebullición y observar el almíbar hasta que empiece a adquirir un color ámbar intenso. Retirar del fuego y agregar la mantequilla. Remueve hasta que se haya derretido. Vierta en la lata y luego coloque los albaricoques con el lado cortado hacia abajo.","Para el bizcocho, bate la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que esté suave con unas varillas eléctricas. Agrega el huevo poco a poco, luego la ralladura y el extracto de almendras. Mezcle todos los ingredientes secos y luego incorpórelos gradualmente a la mezcla de huevo, alternando con la leche. Vierta esto sobre los albaricoques y hornee por 50 minutos. Para probar que está horneado, introduce una brocheta en el centro. Debería salir limpio.","Deje que el pastel se enfríe durante 15 minutos, luego pase un cuchillo entre el pastel y el interior del molde e inviértalo en un plato. Si alguna de las mitades de albaricoque se queda en la lata, recójala con cuidado (tratando de mantener su forma intacta y no aplastarla demasiado) y vuelva a colocarla, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, sobre el pastel. Deja enfriar el bizcocho o sírvelo caliente si quieres.","Calentar la mermelada de albaricoque con 2 cucharadas de agua. Una vez que la mermelada se haya disuelto, la pasamos por un colador para quitar los pedacitos de albaricoque. Déjelo enfriar un poco (de lo contrario, se cocinarán demasiado los albaricoques, que deben estar perfectamente cocidos y sin desmoronarse) y luego pinte una capa espesa de mermelada en la parte superior del pastel. Deje reposar un poco y luego sirva con crème fraîche o nata, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:53:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12709,8498,'es','Tarta de jengibre y chocolate blanco','Hornea nuestro pastel de jengibre pegajoso en un molde para sorprender. Condimentado con tallo de jengibre y decorado con glaseado de chocolate blanco, es un verdadero placer para el público.','["220 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","365 g de harina con levadura","200 g de azúcar mascabado","50 g de melaza negra","150 g de almíbar dorado","2 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos","300ml de leche","2 bolitas de jengibre en almíbar, finamente picadas, más 50ml de almíbar","1 cucharadita de sal marina fina","3 cucharaditas de jengibre molido","½ cucharadita de canela","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","un puñado pequeño de trozos de jengibre cristalizado, picados, para decorar","30ml de leche","160 g de azúcar glas tamizada","150 g de chocolate blanco, picado"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Derrita 1 cucharada de mantequilla en una sartén pequeña, luego agregue ½ cucharada de harina para crear una pasta húmeda. Cepille el interior de un molde de 9 pulgadas. Ponga el resto de la mantequilla, el azúcar, la melaza y el almíbar dorado en una sartén a fuego medio y revuelva hasta que todo se derrita. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Vierta la mezcla en un tazón grande y agregue los huevos y la leche. Incorpora el jengibre en rama, el resto de la harina, la sal, el jengibre molido, la canela y el bicarbonato. Vierta en el molde preparado y hornee durante 40-45 minutos, o hasta que esté firme al tacto. Dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos en el molde, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer el glaseado, mezcle la leche, el almíbar de jengibre y el azúcar glas. Derrita el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor en el microondas en ráfagas de 1 minuto. Dejar enfriar un poco y luego incorporar a la mezcla de leche. Vierta el glaseado sobre el pastel y luego decore con los trozos de jengibre cristalizado."]','2026-01-11 12:53:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12710,8500,'es','canutillos de chocolate','Estos deliciosos canutillos de chocolate rellenos de cremosa natilla de vainilla merecen el esfuerzo. Haz un lote de estos clásicos pasteles franceses','["140 g de harina común","pizca de azúcar","125ml de leche","100 g de mantequilla","4 huevos","300ml de leche","50 g de azúcar en polvo","2 yemas de huevo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 cucharaditas de harina común","4 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","375ml de nata doble","100 g de chocolate natural","25 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de azúcar glas"]','["Empezamos haciendo el relleno de natillas. Calentar la leche hasta que casi hierva en una cacerola. Mientras tanto, mezcle el azúcar, las yemas de huevo y la vainilla en un tazón, luego agregue las harinas, un par de cucharaditas a la vez, hasta obtener una pasta suave.","Agregue gradualmente la leche caliente, vierta todo nuevamente en la cacerola y cocine a fuego alto, revolviendo constantemente, durante unos 5 minutos hasta que espese; se volverá alarmantemente grumoso, pero no se preocupe, simplemente siga revolviendo vigorosamente con una cuchara de madera hasta que quede suave.","Coloque una hoja de film transparente directamente sobre la superficie de las natillas, luego enfríe y enfríe hasta que esté listo para llenar los bollos.","Para hacer los bollos choux, calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Tamizar la harina con el azúcar y una pizca de sal en un bol pequeño. Pon la leche y la mantequilla en una cacerola mediana con 125 ml de agua y calienta suavemente para que la mantequilla se derrita pero el líquido no burbujee.","Una vez que la mantequilla se haya derretido por completo, aumente el fuego hasta que el líquido hierva rápidamente. Inmediatamente apaga el fuego, vierte la harina tamizada y bate vigorosamente con una cuchara de madera hasta obtener una masa suave que se despegue de los lados de la sartén. Extiéndalo sobre un plato grande para que se enfríe a temperatura manual.","Deje enfriar durante unos minutos, luego agregue gradualmente los huevos, mezclando bien entre cada adición hasta que la mezcla se caiga de la cuchara a regañadientes. No agregues todo el huevo a menos que sea necesario.","Corta dos hojas grandes de papel para hornear. En cada uno, dibuja dos conjuntos de líneas de \"pista\" con un espacio de 10 cm; estas serán tus pautas para que todos tus canutillos tengan aproximadamente el mismo tamaño. Utilice el papel para forrar dos bandejas para hornear grandes, boca abajo.","Vierta la mezcla de choux en una manga pastelera con una estrella de 1 cm o una boquilla redonda de ancho, o en una manga pastelera desechable con un orificio de tamaño similar cortado para la manga pastelera. Coloque dos filas de formas de \"S\" aplastadas y bien espaciadas en cada hoja entre las guías. Hornee, una bandeja a la vez, en un estante alto durante 25 minutos, reduciendo la temperatura a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 tan pronto como entren al horno.","Después de 25 minutos, haga un agujero en el extremo de cada panecillo o, con un cuchillo de sierra pequeño, divídalo por la mitad y regréselo al horno, boca abajo, para que se seque durante 5 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y dorado. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras los bollos se enfrían, termina el relleno. Batir la crema hasta que espese, luego usar la batidora eléctrica para batir las natillas enfriadas y preparadas hasta que vuelvan a estar suaves. Incorpora la crema. Vierta el relleno en una manga pastelera; use una boquilla pequeña si está llenando los panecillos a través de los agujeros que ha perforado, o una boquilla grande si ha partido los panecillos por la mitad. Coloca con cuidado la crema pastelera en cada panecillo enfriado; deben sentirse pesados ​​una vez llenos.","Para hacer el glaseado, derrita 100 g de chocolate natural y 25 g de mantequilla en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo. Una vez derretido, retirar del fuego y agregar 75 ml de nata doble y 1 cucharada de azúcar glas tamizada. Una vez que se haya enfriado un poco, esparcir por la parte superior de los bollos y dejar enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:53:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12711,8502,'es','pastel simnel','Celebre la Pascua con un horneado de temporada primaveral. Este clásico pastel de simnel está lleno de frutos secos y especias y cubierto con mazapán.','["225 g de pasas","100 g de grosellas","50 g de piel mixta","2 limones, 1 exprimido y 2 rallados","50ml de jugo de naranja","50 ml de brandy (opcional)","225 g de mantequilla, blanda","225 g de azúcar mascabado light","4 huevos medianos","225 g de harina con levadura","100 g de cerezas glaseadas, en cuartos","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","500 g de mazapán amarillo","1 cucharada de mermelada de albaricoque"]','["Coloque las pasas, las grosellas y la cáscara mixta en un bol con el jugo de limón, el jugo de naranja y el brandy, si lo usa. Mezclar bien, tapar y dejar en remojo toda la noche.","Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2. Forrar la base y los lados de un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm con papel para hornear.","Agrega el resto de los ingredientes del pastel a la fruta remojada y revuelve hasta que estén bien combinados. Vierta la mitad de esta mezcla en el fondo del molde para pastel y nivele para que quede lo más plano posible. Enrolle un tercio del mazapán formando un círculo de 20 cm de diámetro y colóquelo encima. Agrega suavemente el resto de la mezcla, nivelando nuevamente la superficie.","Hornee durante aproximadamente 2½ horas hasta que esté dorado, bien levado y firme al tacto. Un pincho de metal debe salir limpio al insertarlo. Dejar enfriar durante 20 minutos en el molde y luego desmoldar para que se enfríe sobre una rejilla.","Calienta la mermelada de albaricoque en una cacerola pequeña y unta la parte superior del pastel. Extienda la mitad del mazapán restante del tamaño de la parte superior del pastel. Presiónelo hacia abajo firmemente y empuje los bordes hacia abajo con el pulgar para doblarlo alrededor de los lados.","Enrolla el resto del mazapán en 11 bolas (éstas representan a los Apóstoles). Coloca las bolas uniformemente encima del bizcocho formando un círculo, pegándolas con un poco de mermelada. Sople suavemente la parte superior del pastel hasta que las bolas adquieran un color dorado claro; alternativamente, coloque todo el pastel bajo una parrilla caliente hasta que el mazapán adquiera un color dorado claro."]','2026-01-11 12:53:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12712,8504,'es','Budín de donut de limón y frambuesa','¡Espere solicitudes de segundas porciones de este delicioso postre! Hornea donuts de frambuesa con natillas frescas, cuajada de limón y frambuesas','["mantequilla, para la fuente para hornear","8 donuts de mermelada de frambuesa","150 g de frambuesas","500 ml de natillas frescas compradas en la tienda","250ml de leche entera","150 g de cuajada de limón"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y untar con mantequilla una fuente para horno de 20 x 20 cm. Corta en cuartos los donuts de mermelada de frambuesa y colócalos en capas superpuestas en el plato preparado. Distribuya más de 100 g de frambuesas.","Calienta la natilla con la leche hasta que esté humeante, luego bate con la cuajada de limón. Vierta la crema de limón sobre las donas, luego déjelas en remojo durante 30 minutos, asegurándose de que algunas de las donas sobresalgan para que queden crujientes cuando se horneen.","Esparza otros 50 g de frambuesas y hornee durante 35 a 40 minutos, o hasta que estén doradas y recién cuajadas."]','2026-01-11 12:53:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12713,8506,'es','Tarta de crema de limón, mascarpone y maracuyá','Sirva esta vibrante tarta de cuajada de limón y maracuyá como postre fácil o dulce. Sus sabores tropicales lo hacen perfecto para el verano.','["320 g de hoja de hojaldre","1 huevo batido","250 g de mascarpone","150ml de nata doble","6 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","3 maracuyá, sin semillas","30 g de pistachos picados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Desenrollar el hojaldre sobre una bandeja de horno forrada. Marque un borde de 2 cm alrededor del borde de la masa con un cuchillo afilado y luego cepille el borde con el huevo.","Hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Empuje suavemente hacia el centro con el dorso de una cuchara y luego déjelo enfriar por completo.","Batir el mascarpone con la nata doble y 3 cucharadas de cuajada de limón hasta que esté suave y se pueda tomar con una cuchara. Agregue otras 3 cucharadas de cuajada de limón y las semillas de 1 maracuyá.","Vierta la mezcla de crema en el centro de la masa y esparza sobre las semillas de 2 maracuyá y los pistachos picados."]','2026-01-11 12:53:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12714,8508,'es','Pastel de naranja y cuajada de limón','Disfrute de una rebanada de pastel de naranja y cuajada de limón para las once o el té de la tarde. Cubra con almendras laminadas y ralladura de limón y sirva con una taza de té.','["170 g de mantequilla blanda con sal","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos","70 gramos de yogur natural","150 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","1 naranja grande, rallada","2-3 cucharadas de leche","10 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","20 g de almendras laminadas","ralladura de limón, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pan de 1 litro y forrar con papel de hornear.","Ponga la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, el yogur, la harina con levadura, las almendras molidas, la ralladura de naranja, la leche y 5 cucharadas de crema de limón en un tazón grande y bata hasta que quede suave. Coloque otras 5 cucharadas de cuajada de limón en un segundo tazón y bata para aflojar.","Vierta la mitad de la masa en el molde preparado, vierta sobre la cuajada de limón y cubra con la masa restante. Esparce las almendras en hojuelas y hornea durante 50 minutos o hasta que suban y estén doradas. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla, esparcir un poco de ralladura de limón y cortar en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:53:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12715,8510,'es','Horneado en bandeja con chispas de chocolate','Hornea estos cuadrados con chispas de chocolate para la familia. Fácil de preparar, este horneado en bandeja es ideal para cocinar (¡y comer!) con niños.','["190 ml de aceite de colza, más un poco más para la lata","250 g de harina común","80 g de cacao en polvo","3 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","300 g de azúcar moreno blando","350ml de leche entera","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos grandes","100 g de chispas de chocolate blanco","150 g de mantequilla, en cubos","200 g de azúcar glas tamizada","4 cucharaditas de cacao en polvo","2 cucharadas de leche"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar la base y los lados de una fuente para asar de 33 x 23 cm y que tenga al menos 2,5 cm de profundidad. Cubra con papel para hornear. Combina la harina, el cacao en polvo, la levadura en polvo, el azúcar y una buena pizca de sal en un bol grande. Rompe los grumos de azúcar con un batidor.","Batir el aceite junto con la leche, la vainilla y los huevos en una jarra y verter en los ingredientes secos, luego agregar las chispas de chocolate. Remueve bien con una espátula hasta que no queden bolsas de harina. Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Si queda algo de mezcla húmeda adherida a la brocheta, regrese al horno por 5 minutos y luego verifique nuevamente. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante al menos 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Derrita la mantequilla, luego retírela del fuego y agregue el azúcar glas, el cacao en polvo y la leche. El glaseado quedará muy líquido, pero se espesará un poco a medida que se enfríe. (Si el glaseado se ha espesado demasiado antes de que el pastel se haya enfriado, recaliéntalo un poco para que sea más fácil de verter).","Vierta el glaseado de chocolate sobre el pastel y déjelo hasta que cuaje antes de cortarlo en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:53:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12716,8512,'es','Pastel crumble de cerezas','Aprovecha al máximo las jugosas cerezas en este pastel, enriquecido con almendras y crema agria y terminado con una cobertura crumble. Está delicioso con natillas','["180 g de mantequilla salada, blanda y un poco más para la lata","220 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos","250 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de almendras molidas","80 g de crema agria","300 g de cerezas frescas, deshuesadas y partidas por la mitad","45 g de harina común","35 g de mantequilla fría con sal, en cubos","20 g de azúcar en polvo dorado"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Unte con mantequilla la base de un molde para pastel de fondo suelto de 20 cm de profundidad y cubra con papel para hornear.","Para hacer la cobertura crumble, ponga la harina y la mantequilla en un bol y frótelas con las yemas de los dedos hasta obtener una textura gruesa y quebradiza. Agregue el azúcar y luego transfiéralo al refrigerador.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica durante 5 minutos hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Incorpora poco a poco los huevos, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Incorpora la harina, el polvo para hornear, las almendras molidas y la crema agria, luego la mayoría de las cerezas y reserva un puñado para decorar. Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y alise por encima con una espátula. Salpica con las cerezas reservadas y luego hornea en el centro del horno durante 30 minutos.","Esparza la cobertura desmenuzada, luego regrese el pastel al horno y hornee por 30 a 50 minutos más hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar en el molde.","Corta el pastel en trozos gruesos y sírvelo con natillas o helado, si lo deseas. Guárdelo en una lata o en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:53:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12717,8514,'es','Galletas de chocolate con chispas de chocolate','Hornee una tanda de estas sencillas galletas de mantequilla con chispas de chocolate para acompañar su taza de té de la tarde. Estos sencillos dulces son perfectos para compartir.','["300 g de harina común","200 g de mantequilla salada fría, en cubos","1 yema de huevo grande","100 g de azúcar en polvo y un poco más para espolvorear","80 g de chispas de chocolate con leche o amargo"]','["Tamiza la harina en un tazón grande y agrega la mantequilla. Frote la mantequilla y la harina entre los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca migajas. Agrega la yema de huevo, el azúcar y las chispas de chocolate y aplasta todo en el bol para crear una masa. Una vez que haya comenzado a unirse en el tazón, colóquelo sobre la superficie de trabajo y déle forma de disco redondo y aplanado, envuélvalo y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Precalienta el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3. Forra 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear.","Extienda la masa entre dos hojas de papel para hornear hasta que tenga 1 cm de grosor. Retire la hoja superior de pergamino y córtela en 14 rondas con un cortador de galletas redondo de 7 cm. Vuelva a enrollar los restos para aprovechar al máximo la masa. Transfiera con cuidado las rondas a las bandejas para hornear con una espátula o una espátula, dejando algo de espacio entre ellas. Espolvorea cada uno con un poco de azúcar. Hornee en el horno durante 15-20 minutos o hasta que estén ligeramente dorados. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos antes de transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:53:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12718,6927,'es','Lamington','Disfrute de un lamington con una taza de té caliente. Este horneado tradicional australiano está relleno de crema y mermelada, cubierto con un glaseado de chocolate y enrollado en coco.','["125 g de mantequilla con sal, blanda y un poco más para la lata","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos grandes","250 g de harina con levadura","3 cucharadas de leche","½ cucharadita de sal","250ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas","200 g de mermelada de frambuesa","350 g de coco rallado","80 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","250ml de leche","50 g de cacao en polvo","400 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde rectangular de 20 x 30 cm.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en una batidora independiente hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Añade los huevos uno a uno y bate bien. Batir la harina, la leche y la sal hasta que estén completamente combinados, luego verter en el molde. Hornee en el horno durante 25 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y firme al tacto. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Corta el bizcocho horizontalmente para crear dos mitades. Recorta los bordes para hacer esquinas perfectas. Corta el bizcocho en 18 cuadrados. Batir ligeramente la nata con el azúcar glas hasta conseguir picos suaves. Untar un poco de mermelada sobre la mitad de los cuadrados de bizcocho y luego untar o esparcir sobre un poco de nata. Emparede cada uno con un segundo cuadrado de bizcocho y luego déjelo enfriar en el refrigerador.","Para hacer el glaseado, mezcle la mantequilla derretida y la leche en un bol. Tamizar el cacao en polvo y el azúcar glas en un recipiente aparte. Añade poco a poco el cacao y el azúcar a la mezcla de mantequilla y leche, batiendo continuamente para asegurarte de que no queden grumos. Si se forman grumos, bata con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave.","Divide el coco en tres tazones poco profundos (esto evita que se cubra con demasiado chocolate mientras lo mojas).","Sumerge cada lamington en el glaseado hasta que esté completamente cubierto. Enrollar el coco y colocar sobre una rejilla. Repita con las esponjas restantes. Enfriar por un mínimo de 1 hora."]','2026-01-11 12:53:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12719,8516,'es','Galette de plátano caramelizado y chocolate','Impresiona a amigos y familiares con esta sencilla galette de 5 ingredientes con plátano caramelizado y chocolate. Este postre fácil combina de maravilla con helado','["70 g de avellanas, picadas en trozos grandes","150 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","500 g de masa de hojaldre en bloque comprada","3 plátanos, en rodajas","3 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","helado de vainilla, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezclar 50 g de avellanas en un procesador de alimentos pequeño hasta que parezcan pan rallado fino, luego verter en un bol con el chocolate.","Extienda la masa hasta formar una ronda de aproximadamente 30 cm de diámetro sobre una hoja de papel para hornear. Esparce la mezcla de chocolate y avellanas sobre el círculo de masa, dejando un borde de 5 cm. Cubra con los plátanos y la mayoría de las avellanas restantes, luego doble los bordes de la masa. Transfiera la galette a una bandeja para hornear junto con el papel para hornear y luego enfríe en el refrigerador durante al menos 10 minutos.","Retirar del refrigerador y espolvorear el azúcar sobre la galette, luego hornear durante 25-30 minutos, o hasta que esté dorada e inflada. Esparce las avellanas restantes y sirve con una bola de helado de vainilla, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:53:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12720,8518,'es','Pan de plátano con caramelo pegajoso','Use plátanos demasiado maduros para hacer este pan de plátano con caramelo pegajoso. Es aún más indulgente con la salsa de caramelo y el crujiente de nueces.','["125 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco para la lata","75 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","3 huevos medianos","2 plátanos maduros grandes, triturados","50 gramos de yogur natural","200 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","50 g de dátiles sin hueso, picados (unos 10)","50 g de nueces pecanas o nueces picadas (o nueces picadas mixtas)","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","25 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubos","100ml de nata doble","150 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de nueces pecanas o nueces (o frutos secos mixtos)","50 g de chips de plátano","½ cucharadita de sal marina en escamas"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g con una tira de papel para hornear.","Batir la mantequilla y ambos azúcares en un bol durante 5 minutos con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede muy esponjoso. Batir los huevos, el plátano y el yogur en un recipiente aparte hasta que queden casi suaves, luego incorporarlos a la mezcla de mantequilla y azúcar. Agregue la harina y el polvo para hornear hasta que estén combinados, luego agregue los dátiles y las nueces. Vierta en el molde, alise por encima y hornee durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 15 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego sáquelo con la tira de pergamino. Puedes servirlo caliente ahora o dejarlo enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla. Se conservará durante cuatro días en un recipiente hermético.","Mientras tanto, prepara la salsa de caramelo. Coloque el azúcar en una sartén de base pesada y derrita a fuego medio-bajo hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y líquido; no revuelva, simplemente incline la sartén para derretir el azúcar. Incorpora con cuidado la mantequilla hasta que quede suave, luego vierte la crema lentamente y haz que forme una burbuja. Mezclar hasta que la salsa esté suave y brillante. Verter en un recipiente resistente al calor, tapar y dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente.","Para los crujientes, ponga el azúcar en una sartén con 2 cucharadas de agua a fuego medio, revuelva brevemente y luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que el caramelo adquiera un color ámbar. No revuelvas después de la mezcla inicial, simplemente inclina la sartén para obtener un color dorado uniforme y profundo.","Mientras tanto, forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Agrega con cuidado las nueces, los chips de plátano y la sal al caramelo hasta que estén bien cubiertos, luego vierte en la bandeja. Incline la bandeja (o use una cuchara) para asegurarse de que las nueces estén en una sola capa, o será más difícil separarlas más adelante. Déjelo enfriar por completo antes de romperlo en pedazos.","Revuelva la salsa de caramelo para que se afloje si se ha puesto dura, o caliéntela durante unos segundos en el microondas (agregue un poco más de crema si es necesario), luego rocíe sobre el pastel para que gotee por los lados. Cubra con los fragmentos de quebradizo. Se conservará durante dos días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:53:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12721,8520,'es','Budín de bizcocho con limón','Transforme un clásico pastel de limón en un pudín con salsa para obtener un postre económico y reconfortante. Servir con crema o natillas.','["250 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para el plato","380 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 limones, rallados y exprimidos","2½ cucharadas de harina de maíz","natillas o crema, para servir","50 g de azúcar glas","1 limón, exprimido y rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla una fuente para horno de 30 x 20 cm de profundidad.","Ponga la mantequilla y 250 g de azúcar en polvo en un bol y bata durante 5 minutos hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Batir los huevos, luego tamizar sobre la harina y el polvo para hornear y mezclar hasta obtener una masa. Agrega la ralladura de limón y reserva un poco para decorar.","Vierta la masa de bizcocho en el plato y alise por encima.","Mezcle el jugo de limón con la harina de maíz en un recipiente resistente al calor para hacer una pasta suave. Mezcle los 130 g restantes de azúcar en polvo con 300 ml de agua hirviendo en una jarra, vierta sobre la mezcla de harina de maíz y bata hasta que quede suave. Vierta esto sobre el bizcocho. Hornee durante 45-50 minutos hasta que esté dorado y cuajado, y el bizcocho rebote hacia atrás al tocarlo.","Mientras se hornea el pudín, rocíe el limón. Mezcle el azúcar glas con suficiente jugo de limón (aproximadamente la mitad) para crear una consistencia suelta. Rocíe sobre el bizcocho mientras aún esté tibio y decore con la ralladura de limón reservada. Servir inmediatamente con nata o natillas."]','2026-01-11 12:53:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12722,8522,'es','Galletas de terciopelo rojo','Convierte el popular pastel en galletas masticables y completa con glaseado de queso crema. Envuélvalos en cajas para regalar o haga una tanda de masa para guardar en el congelador.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda con sal","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo grande","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","½-1 cucharada de gel colorante alimentario rojo, según la concentración","225 g de harina común","25 g de cacao en polvo","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","150 g de chispas o trozos de chocolate blanco","2 cucharadas de queso tierno","6 cucharadas de azúcar glas"]','["Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Batir el huevo, la vainilla y el colorante alimentario hasta obtener una masa de color rojo brillante. Tamizar sobre la harina, el cacao y el bicarbonato. Doble todo para formar una masa rígida de color uniforme, luego agregue las chispas de chocolate.","Coloque la masa sobre una hoja de papel para hornear, doble el papel sobre la masa y moldee en forma de salchicha de unos 6 cm de ancho. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para hornear. Se conservará una semana en el frigorífico o un mes en el congelador.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Cortar la masa para galletas en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor con un cuchillo afilado y colocarlas en dos bandejas para hornear grandes forradas con papel para hornear bien espaciadas para que tengan espacio para esparcirse en el horno. Hornee en tandas, manteniendo las galletas sin hornear en la bandeja en el refrigerador mientras se hornea el resto.","Hornee en el medio del horno durante 13-15 minutos hasta que las galletas estén crujientes en los bordes, pero aún suaves en el centro. Deje enfriar en la bandeja para hornear durante unos minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Batir el queso tierno en un tazón pequeño hasta obtener una consistencia suelta, luego agregar el azúcar glas. Utilice una manga pastelera o una cuchara para rociar el glaseado sobre las galletas. Las galletas sin hielo se conservan durante cinco días en un recipiente hermético o dos días heladas."]','2026-01-11 12:53:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12723,8524,'es','Tarta de arroz con leche de limón y arándanos','Transforma un arroz con leche clásico en una tarta moderna con masa crujiente y limón picante. Es un postre delicioso para finalizar cualquier menú de cena.','["500 g de masa quebrada ya preparada","harina común, para espolvorear","500ml de leche entera","125ml de nata doble","3 limones rallados","100 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de arroz con leche, enjuagado","4 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","100 g de mascarpone","75 g de mermelada de arándanos","2 huevos batidos","100 g de arándanos congelados","1 cucharada de mermelada de arándanos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un círculo del grosor de una moneda de £1. Forre un molde para tarta de 20 cm de profundidad con la masa, dejando unos 2 cm colgando sobre el borde. Pinche la base con un tenedor y luego enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Para hacer el arroz con leche, ponemos en una cacerola la leche, la nata, la ralladura de limón y el azúcar. Llevar a ebullición, luego verter el arroz y revolver. Cocine a fuego lento, tapado, a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, luego destape y cocine, revolviendo, durante 25-30 minutos hasta que el arroz esté cocido pero conserve algo de sabor. Retirar del fuego y agregar la mitad de la cuajada de limón y el mascarpone, luego dejar enfriar un poco.","Mientras tanto, cubra la masa con una hoja de papel para hornear ligeramente arrugada y rellénela con frijoles para hornear. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear y hornee por 15 minutos. Retire el pergamino y los frijoles y hornee por 15-20 minutos más hasta que estén dorados. Dejar enfriar, luego recortar los bordes con un cuchillo de sierra y reservar.","Batir la mermelada hasta que quede suave y verterla en la base de la masa de hojaldre, extendiéndola. Agrega los huevos al arroz con leche y vierte en el estuche. Hornee durante 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y firme con una ligera oscilación. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Mientras tanto, haz la compota. Combine los arándanos, 1 cucharada de agua y la mermelada y cocínelos en el microondas durante 1-2 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que quede un jarabe. Los arándanos deben estar suaves pero manteniendo su forma.","Retire la tarta del molde, ponga el resto de la cuajada en una manga pastelera y póngala por encima, luego rocíe sobre la mayor parte de la compota. Sirva con cualquier compota extra al lado."]','2026-01-11 12:53:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12724,8526,'es','donut de mermelada','Prepare un lote de nuestras rosquillas de mermelada dulce para disfrutar del máximo placer. Estos donuts suaves y acolchados bien valen la pena y son excelentes para compartir.','["500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","60 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","15 g de levadura fresca, desmenuzada","4 huevos","½ limón, rallado","2 cucharaditas de sal marina fina","125 g de mantequilla blanda sin sal","unos 2 litros de aceite de girasol, para freír","azúcar en polvo, para mezclar","300 g de mermelada para el relleno"]','["Ponga 150 g de agua y todos los ingredientes de la masa, excepto la mantequilla, en el bol de una batidora con paleta batidora. Mezclar a velocidad media durante 8 minutos o hasta que la masa comience a despegarse de los lados y forme una bola. Apaga la batidora y deja reposar la masa durante 1 min.","Vuelva a encender la batidora a velocidad media y agregue lentamente la mantequilla a la masa, aproximadamente 25 g a la vez. Una vez que esté todo incorporado, mezcle a velocidad alta durante 5 minutos hasta que la masa esté brillante, suave y muy elástica al estirarla.","Cubre el bol con film transparente o un paño de cocina limpio y déjalo reposar hasta que doble su tamaño. Vuelva a colocar la masa en el tazón brevemente, luego vuelva a taparla y póngala en el refrigerador para que se enfríe durante la noche.","Al día siguiente sacamos la masa de la nevera y la cortamos en trozos de 50g (deberían salir unos 20).","Enrolle los trozos de masa hasta formar panecillos suaves y apretados y colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear enharinada, dejando suficiente espacio entre ellos, ya que no querrá que se peguen mientras se fermentan.","Cubra sin apretar con film transparente y déjelo durante 4 horas o hasta que duplique su tamaño. Llene su freidora o cacerola de base pesada hasta la mitad con aceite. Calentar el aceite a 180C. Lea nuestra guía sobre cómo freír de forma segura para obtener más información esencial.","Cuando el aceite esté caliente, desliza con cuidado los donuts de la bandeja con una espátula de repostería enharinada. Con cuidado de no deshincharlas, introdúcelas en el aceite. Haga 2-3 por tanda, dependiendo del tamaño de su freidora o sartén.","Freír durante 2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados; se hinchan y flotan, por lo que es posible que tengas que empujarlos suavemente hacia abajo después de aproximadamente 1 minuto para ayudar a que adquieran un color uniforme.","Retira los donuts de la freidora y colócalos sobre papel de cocina.","Mezcle las donas en un bol con azúcar en polvo mientras aún estén calientes. Repita los pasos hasta que todas las donas estén fritas, pero siga verificando que la temperatura del aceite sea la correcta; si es demasiado alta, se quemarán y quedarán crudas en el medio; si es demasiado bajo, el aceite será absorbido por las donas y se volverán grasosas. Dejar enfriar antes de rellenar.","Para rellenar las donas, haz un agujero con un cuchillo pequeño en el pliegue de cada una, en cualquier lugar alrededor de la línea blanca entre la parte superior e inferior frita.","Llene una manga pastelera con mermelada y póngala en el donut hasta que esté bien hinchado, aproximadamente 1 cucharada por donut. Después del relleno, es mejor comer los donuts de inmediato, pero se conservarán en una lata hermética."]','2026-01-11 12:53:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12725,8528,'es','Bizcocho de naranja sanguina','Pruebe esta versión moderna de un bizcocho americano, con crema agria y glaseado de naranja sanguina para equilibrar el dulzor. Decorar con pistachos','["150 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada, más un poco más para la lata","250 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos medianos, a temperatura ambiente","250 g de harina común","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","100 g de nata agria entera","3 naranjas sanguinas, finamente ralladas","3 cucharadas de pistachos picados, para decorar (opcional)","cáscara confitada, para decorar (opcional, ver el consejo a continuación)","170 g de azúcar glas tamizada","2-3 cucharadas de jugo de naranja sanguina"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y mantequilla y forrar un molde para pan de 1 litro.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en un bol durante 8 minutos hasta que quede esponjoso y muy pálido. Batir los huevos uno a la vez. Incorpora la harina, la levadura en polvo, el bicarbonato de sodio y la sal, luego la crema agria y la ralladura. Vierta en el molde y hornee en el centro del horno durante 45-50 minutos, o hasta que al insertar un pincho en el medio, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar un poco en el molde y luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer el glaseado, combine el azúcar y el jugo y vierta sobre el pastel. Espolvoree sobre los pistachos y la cáscara confitada, si los usa (consulte el consejo a continuación). Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12726,8530,'es','pasteles de mariposa','Invite a familiares y amigos a bonitos cupcakes de mariposas. Los nuestros están cubiertos con una ligera crema de vainilla, mermelada y chispas, pero puedes decorarlos como quieras.','["110 g de mantequilla, blanda","110 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","110 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharada de leche, más 2 cucharadas si es necesario, para soltar la crema de mantequilla","mermelada de fresa (opcional)","chispas (opcional)","300 g de azúcar glas","150 g de mantequilla blanda","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar un molde para cupcakes con 10 cajas. Para hacer el bizcocho, vierta la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, la vainilla, la harina, el polvo para hornear y la leche en un tazón grande y bata con un batidor de mano o con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave, pálido y combinado. Divida la masa entre las cajas y hornee por 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el medio del pastel, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Mientras los pasteles se enfrían, prepara la crema de mantequilla batiendo el azúcar glas, la mantequilla y la vainilla hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Agrega la leche extra si el glaseado se siente demasiado rígido.","Una vez que los pasteles estén fríos, use un cuchillo afilado para cortar la parte superior y luego córtela por la mitad. Coloca o extiende la crema de mantequilla sobre los pasteles, luego empuja suavemente dos mitades semicirculares en la crema de mantequilla de cada pastel, haciendo esto en ángulo para que parezcan alas de mariposa. Puedes servir los cupcakes en esta etapa o decorarlos con una pequeña gota de mermelada en el centro y un poco de chispas, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12727,8532,'es','pastelitos de terciopelo rojo','Hornea una tanda de cupcakes de terciopelo rojo como regalo. Con bizcocho de chocolate y cobertura de queso crema, son perfectos para once servidos con una taza de té.','["150 g de harina común","1 cucharada de cacao en polvo","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","50 g de mantequilla, ablandada","150 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo grande, batido","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","100 ml de suero de leche o kéfir","50 ml de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharada de colorante alimentario en gel rojo","100 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, blanda","225 g de azúcar glas","100 g de queso crema con toda la grasa, revuelto para aflojar"]','["Forre un molde para cupcakes con 12 moldes para cupcakes y reserve. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Tamizar la harina, el cacao, el bicarbonato y una pizca de sal fina en un tazón mediano y mezclar para combinar.","Con una batidora de pie o un batidor de mano eléctrico, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos, luego agregue el huevo, la vainilla, el suero de leche, el aceite y el vinagre hasta que se combinen. Mezcle gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos con los secos. Una vez combinado, mezcle el colorante alimentario rojo hasta obtener una mezcla de color rojo intenso; el color puede variar según la marca que use.","Divide la masa entre los moldes para cupcakes y hornea durante 15 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro del pastel, éste salga limpio.","Mientras los pasteles se enfrían, prepara el glaseado. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar glas con una batidora eléctrica o a mano hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos, aproximadamente 3 minutos, luego agregar el queso crema durante 1 o 2 minutos más hasta que estén bien combinados.","Una vez que los pasteles estén fríos, use una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella para cubrir los pasteles con el glaseado de queso crema, o coloque el glaseado encima con una cuchara."]','2026-01-11 12:54:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12728,8534,'es','muffins de chocolate','Prepare muffins de chocolate como proyecto de repostería de fin de semana con los niños. Son perfectos con una taza de té y, si lo deseas, puedes duplicar el chocolate agregando chispas de chocolate.','["125 g de harina común","25 g de cacao en polvo","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 huevo grande","60 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","100ml de leche entera","50 g de chispas de chocolate (opcional)","100 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar un molde para muffins con seis moldes para muffins. Tamiza la harina, el cacao y el polvo para hornear en un tazón mediano. Mezcle el huevo, el azúcar, el aceite y la leche en una jarra, luego vierta gradualmente en los ingredientes secos (agregue chispas de chocolate ahora para hacer muffins dobles de chocolate, si lo desea) y mezcle hasta que se combinen.","Vierta la mezcla uniformemente en los moldes para pastel y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, mezcle gradualmente entre ½ y 1 cucharada de agua con el azúcar glas hasta obtener una consistencia suelta y no demasiado líquida. Rocíe el glaseado sobre los muffins una vez que estén fríos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12729,8536,'es','Pastel de nueces especiado con glaseado de melaza de granada','Hornee este pastel de celebración relleno de nueces como postre alternativo del Eid. Está cubierto con un impresionante glaseado de melaza de granada y nueces confitadas.','["4 huevos","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 ml de aceite de oliva ligero","1 cucharada de miel","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","150 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de canela molida","6 vainas de cardamomo verde, sin semillas y trituradas","200 g de harina de nueces (mezcle las nueces en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener harina gruesa; tenga en cuenta que si la tritura demasiado finamente se convertirá en una pasta)","100 g de nueces picadas","40 g de mitades de nuez","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","20 g de melaza de granada","60 g de azúcar glas","Tarrina de 400 g de queso crema entero","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada","50 g de semillas de granada"]','["Forre dos moldes desmontables de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Batir los huevos con el azúcar en un bol durante unos 5 minutos hasta que estén espesos y aireados. Vierta lentamente el aceite de oliva, batiendo continuamente, luego vierta la miel y la vainilla y vuelva a batir para combinar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Combinar la harina, el polvo para hornear, las especias y una pizca de sal en otro bol y mezclar. Tamice esto ligeramente en la mezcla húmeda, incorpore y luego agregue la harina de nueces, poco a poco, hasta que se combinen. Incorporar las nueces picadas y dividir entre las latas.","Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Retirar y dejar enfriar en los moldes.","Para hacer las nueces confitadas, colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear y áselas en el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 durante 4-5 minutos hasta que estén crujientes. Mientras tanto, combine el azúcar, la melaza y 20 ml de agua en una cacerola y póngala a fuego medio hasta que la mezcla adquiera un color caramelo intenso (alrededor de 3-4 minutos). Baje el fuego, luego agregue las nueces, revolviendo constantemente hasta que estén completamente cubiertas. Retirar del fuego y colocar sobre una capa de papel para hornear para que se enfríe.","Para hacer el glaseado, bata el azúcar glas y el queso crema hasta que estén bien combinados y suaves (el glaseado se adelgazará antes de espesarse, así que continúe batiendo durante 2 minutos), luego revuelva brevemente con la melaza para crear un efecto dominó. Extienda la mitad del glaseado sobre una de las capas de pastel y luego emparéjelo con la otra. Cubra con más glaseado, las semillas de granada y las nueces confitadas. Servir cortado en rodajas. Se mantendrá frío en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12730,7978,'es','Pan retorcido especiado con miel y mantequilla tahini','Hornee este pan inspirado en el Medio Oriente para servirlo en un brunch festivo. Para hacer las cosas aún más indulgentes, unte rebanadas gruesas con nuestra deliciosa miel y mantequilla tahini.','["120-140 ml de leche entera","50 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubitos","300 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 huevo mediano, ligeramente batido","aceite, para el bol","50 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo, tostadas","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","3 cucharaditas de canela","¼ cucharadita de cardamomo molido","70 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","2 cucharadas de miel líquida","2 cucharadas de tahini","75 g de azúcar glas dorado","semillas de sésamo, para espolvorear (opcional)"]','["Caliente 120 ml de leche y la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña hasta que se derrita. Dejar enfriar hasta que esté tibio.","Combine la harina, el azúcar, la sal y la levadura en el tazón de una batidora. Haga un hueco en el centro y vierta el huevo y la leche tibia, luego mezcle hasta que estén combinados. Si parece un poco seco, añade 20 ml más de leche. Amasar la mezcla a velocidad suave usando un gancho para masa durante 5 a 8 minutos, o hasta que la masa esté suave y rebote cuando se presiona. Si no tiene una batidora de pie, combine todo en un tazón y luego amase sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada durante 8 a 10 minutos. Forme una bola con la masa y déjela reposar en un tazón grande ligeramente engrasado cubierto con un paño de cocina durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 30 minutos, o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Para hacer el relleno, combine los ingredientes y reserve.","Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Extienda la masa probada sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un cuadrado de 40 cm. Extienda el relleno uniformemente sobre la masa con una espátula, dejando un borde de 2 cm alrededor del borde. Enrolle la masa hasta formar un tronco apretado, comenzando por el extremo más alejado de usted; debe medir aproximadamente 40 cm de largo. Corta el tronco de masa por la mitad, a lo largo por la mitad, de modo que tengas dos trozos largos uno al lado del otro, horizontalmente, con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Junte ambos extremos, luego levante los extremos y gire las piezas entre sí, como si estuviera haciendo una cuerda.","Transfiera el pan a la hoja preparada. Cubra sin apretar y déjelo reposar en un lugar cálido hasta que vuelva a duplicar su tamaño, aproximadamente entre 45 minutos y 1 hora. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Coloque la bandeja en el centro del horno y hornee durante 35 a 40 minutos, cubriéndola ligeramente con papel de aluminio si comienza a oscurecerse demasiado durante el horneado. Cuando esté listo, el pan debe estar dorado y sonar hueco al golpearlo en la parte inferior. Déjelo enfriar un poco durante 15 minutos si lo va a servir caliente, o déjelo enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla.","Para hacer la mantequilla tahini, mezcle los ingredientes con una pizca de sal con una cuchara de madera hasta que se combinen. Para hacer el glaseado, mezcle el azúcar con 1 cucharada de agua tibia hasta que quede suave y agregue más si está demasiado espesa. Rocíe sobre el pan y espolvoree con las semillas de sésamo, si las usa. Cortar el pan en rodajas y servir con miel y mantequilla tahini. Es mejor comerlo el día de su elaboración."]','2026-01-11 12:54:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12731,8538,'es','Galletas de chocolate y naranja','Cubra las ricas galletas de chocolate con cáscara de naranja confitada para hacer estos deliciosos bocados. Son un gran regalo comestible para Navidad.','["225 g de mantequilla, blanda","60 g de azúcar glas","1 naranja, rallada y ½ en jugo","300 g de harina con levadura","40 g de cacao en polvo","175 g de chocolate amargo, picado","40 g de piel de naranja confitada picada","5 tiras de piel de naranja confitada y azucarada, cada una cortada en 5 trozos"]','["Batir la mantequilla con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave y esponjosa, luego agregar el azúcar glas poco a poco, agregando la ralladura de naranja y 1 cucharada de jugo de naranja. Incorpora la harina y el cacao poco a poco, luego mezcla el chocolate y la piel de naranja.","Divida la mezcla en dos, déle palmaditas a cada pieza en forma de tronco sobre un trozo de papel film antiadherente o papel para hornear, luego use la envoltura para ayudarlo a darle forma a cada pieza en un tronco de aproximadamente 15 cm de largo. Enfríe hasta que esté firme, aproximadamente 2 horas (consulte el consejo a continuación).","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forra dos bandejas para hornear. Corta galletas de ½ cm de grosor de la masa y colócalas en las bandejas para hornear, dejando espacio para que se hinchen y se extiendan. Poner encima de cada uno un trozo de naranja confitada azucarada. Hornee durante 10-15 minutos o hasta que las galletas estén infladas. Deje enfriar las hojas durante un par de minutos antes de deslizarlas sobre una rejilla. Se conservará durante dos o tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:54:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12732,8540,'es','galletas de jengibre','Levante los pies y disfrute de estas deliciosas galletas de jengibre con una taza de té, hechas con clavo aromático, jengibre, canela y rica melaza negra.','["120 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","1½ cucharada de melaza negra","170 g de azúcar moreno claro y suave","½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","1 huevo mediano","200 g de harina común","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","¼ cucharadita de clavo molido","1½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","½ cucharadita de canela molida","60 g de azúcar en polvo dorado"]','["Batir la mantequilla, la melaza, el azúcar moreno y la sal en un tazón grande. Agrega el huevo y luego bate todos los ingredientes secos restantes, excepto el azúcar en polvo. Enfriar la mezcla en el frigorífico durante 1 hora.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4. Forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Enrolle la mezcla en 20 bolas del mismo tamaño (si lo desea, pese para mayor precisión). Vierta el azúcar en polvo en un plato pequeño, luego agregue cada bola y gírela para cubrirla. Separe cada bola en las bandejas para hornear. Hornee durante 9-10 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 12:54:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12733,8542,'es','galletas de mantequilla veganas','Prepare nuestras galletas de mantequilla veganas con aceite de oliva para darle un sabor mantecoso y harina de maíz para obtener el desmenuzamiento de las versiones tradicionales. Saben muy bien con mantequilla de nueces','["250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","75 g de azúcar en polvo, más 1 cucharada","½ cucharada de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","125 ml de aceite de oliva ligero"]','["Batir la harina, el azúcar y la maicena en un procesador de alimentos para tamizar y mezclar brevemente, luego agregar la vainilla y rociar con el aceite de oliva, pulsando las cuchillas del procesador de alimentos hasta obtener una masa suave y dorada. Envuelva y enfríe durante 30 minutos para que descanse.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y cubre una bandeja para hornear con papel pergamino o un tapete para hornear. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener un grosor de 5 mm y utilice un cortador redondo o estriado, de unos 6 cm de diámetro, para cortar rondas de galletas de mantequilla. Use una espátula pequeña para transferir a la bandeja para hornear. Se puede congelar en la bandeja para hornear y luego transferirlo a una caja cuando esté sólido. Se conservará hasta por tres meses.","Espolvorea 1 cucharada de azúcar sobre las galletas y hornea durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Deje enfriar durante unos minutos para que se endurezca en la bandeja, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para enfriar por completo. Agregue de 2 a 4 minutos al tiempo de cocción si hornea congelado."]','2026-01-11 12:54:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12734,8544,'es','Rubias de caramelo y pera','Hornee estas rubias de pera y caramelo para disfrutar de un delicioso capricho a la hora del té. Con un sabor a galleta que se obtiene al dorar la mantequilla, son deliciosos y masticables.','["250 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubos, más un poco más para la lata","3 huevos grandes","275 g de azúcar moreno blando","25 g de azúcar mascabado moreno oscuro","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","1 cucharadita de sal marina fina","200 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de peras secas, picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de caramelo, de lata o frasco"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde cuadrado para brownie de 20 x 25 cm.","Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola a fuego medio, girándola. Deje burbujear durante unos minutos o hasta que adquiera un color dorado claro y huela a galleta. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.","Vierta los huevos en un tazón grande y bata con los azúcares claro y oscuro hasta que estén combinados. Batir la mantequilla derretida, la vainilla y la sal.","Incorpora suavemente la harina, el polvo para hornear, las peras secas y la mayoría de los trozos de chocolate, teniendo cuidado de no mezclar demasiado (esto hará que las rubias se vuelvan densas).","Vierte la mezcla en el molde forrado. Cubra con el chocolate restante y cucharadas de caramelo. Mete en el centro del horno a hornear durante 30 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta salga con migas pegajosas (no debe estar mojada). Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde. Se hundirá un poco; el centro debe quedar un poco blando. Cortar en 12 cuadrados. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12735,8546,'es','Budín de bizcocho de higos','El pudín de bizcocho mejora un nivel con la adición de deliciosos higos horneados y tomillo, lo que da como resultado un postre invernal realmente reconfortante. Servir caliente con nata, helado o yogur griego.','["250 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para el plato","5 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","4 cucharadas de miel","8 higos frescos","4 huevos grandes","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 cucharadas de yogur griego entero","2-3 ramitas de tomillo (opcional)","aceite de oliva virgen extra o miel, para rociar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla una fuente refractaria de 20 x 22 cm, luego verter el almíbar dorado y la miel. Recorte los tallos de los higos, luego corte una cruz profunda en la parte superior, para que se abran un poco, pero tenga cuidado de no cortarlos por completo. Coloque los higos en posición vertical sobre el almíbar y póngalos en el horno para hornear durante 15-20 minutos hasta que se ablanden y comiencen a caramelizarse un poco en los bordes.","Mientras se cocinan los higos, haz la mezcla del bizcocho. Pon en un bol los huevos, el azúcar, la harina, la levadura, la vainilla y la mantequilla y utiliza una batidora eléctrica para batir hasta que quede suave.","Retirar la fuente del horno, sacar los higos con una espumadera y reservar. Una vez que la mezcla de almíbar se haya enfriado en el plato, tome cucharadas de masa de bizcocho y colóquelas suavemente sobre el almíbar. Es mejor hacer esto primero alrededor del borde y luego terminar en el medio; esto ayuda a mantener la mezcla de almíbar separada. Alise la masa con mucho cuidado para cubrir los huecos y sellar la mezcla de almíbar.","Hornee durante 35 a 40 minutos o hasta que el bizcocho rebote cuando se presiona. Deje enfriar durante unos 5 minutos o hasta que esté tibio, luego, segundos antes de servir, salpique la superficie con ocho pequeñas cucharadas de yogur. Cubra cada montículo con un higo horneado, luego esparza algunas hojas de tomillo y rocíe con aceite de oliva virgen extra, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:54:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12736,8548,'es','Tartas de baba de kiwi','Prepare estos pasteles de kiwi para una fiesta de Halloween y serán un placer para niños y adultos por igual. La gelatina verde y las natillas hacen un delicioso relleno de ''baba''','["320 g de masa quebrada ya laminada comprada en la tienda","4 yemas de huevo, más 1 clara (las claras restantes se congelan para hacer merengues otro día)","400ml de leche","35 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada colmada de harina común","5 cubitos de gelatina verde","2-3 kiwis verdes y dorados, pelados y cortados en rodajas"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Dividir la masa en ocho trozos iguales. Extiéndalos hasta que sean lo suficientemente grandes como para forrar moldes para tartaletas estriados de 7 a 8 cm de profundidad u ocho agujeros de un molde para muffins grande. Forre los moldes con la masa, dejando un poco sobresaliendo por encima de los bordes, luego forre con cajas de papel y frijoles para hornear. Coloque los moldes en una bandeja para horno y hornee por 10 minutos, luego retire el papel y los frijoles, unte con la clara de huevo y hornee por 5-10 minutos más hasta que estén crujientes y dorados. Dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos, luego desmoldar y dejar enfriar por completo.","Poner la leche en una cacerola y llevarla casi a ebullición, luego retirar del fuego. Pon las yemas de huevo, el azúcar y la harina en un bol y bate con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén pálidas y esponjosas; debe dejar un rastro que permanezca en la superficie momentáneamente cuando se levante la batidora. Vierta un tercio de la leche caliente en el bol, batiendo lentamente todo el tiempo, hasta que se haya mezclado todo. Agregue el resto de la leche.","Regrese la mezcla a la sartén, raspándola con una espátula de goma. Deje hervir lentamente, revolviendo, hasta que la crema esté espesa, suave y brillante. Al principio se verá un poco grumoso, pero sigue revolviendo y quedará suave. Reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos, revolviendo. Agrega la gelatina hasta que los cubos se hayan disuelto. Deje que la mezcla se enfríe hasta que esté tibia, luego divídala entre las cajas de tarta horneadas. Cubra cada uno con una rodaja de kiwi y déjelo enfriar por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12737,8550,'es','Mezcla de crumble rápido','Haga este rápido crumble de frutas para cuando lleguen los invitados. Se tarda 20 minutos en prepararlo, luego puedes dejarlo en el horno mientras entretienes.','["450 g de fruta picada en trozos de 1 cm (nosotros utilizamos 400 g de manzanas Bramley y 50 g de moras frescas)","75 g de azúcar granulada","50 g de mantequilla, fría y en cubos","100 g de harina común","50 g de azúcar demerara"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Mezcle la fruta y el azúcar granulada (necesitará menos azúcar para la fruta enlatada) para que quede cubierta uniformemente. Vierta en un molde para pastel donde quede bien ajustado.","Frote la mantequilla con la harina para obtener una textura ligera de pan rallado. No lo trabajes demasiado o el crumble se volverá pesado. Agrega el azúcar demerara hasta que se combine y esparce sobre la fruta hasta cubrir completamente.","Hornee durante 35 a 50 minutos hasta que esté dorado, burbujeante y la fruta esté tierna. Dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12738,8553,'es','tiffin de chocolate','Anímate y regálate estas rodajas de tiffin de chocolate, llenas de chocolate con leche y negro, pasas y galleta. Tenga cuidado: ¡no durarán mucho!','["150 g de mantequilla, en cubos, más un poco más para la lata","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","3 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","6 cucharaditas de cacao en polvo","225 g de galletas trituradas","un puñado de pasas","110 gramos de chocolate con leche","110 g de chocolate negro"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde de 15-20 cm con papel de horno. En una cacerola grande, derrita la mantequilla, el azúcar, el almíbar y el cacao. Agrega las galletas y las pasas.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y presione hacia abajo, luego alise la parte superior con el dorso de una cuchara. Cocine ambos chocolates en el microondas en ráfagas cortas de 20 segundos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que se derrita. Viértelos sobre la mezcla en el molde. Use una espátula o una cuchara para alisar, de modo que quede completamente cubierto de chocolate.","Coloque la lata en el frigorífico y déjela reposar durante unas 2 horas o toda la noche. Pasa un cuchillo de cocina bajo el grifo de agua caliente y luego córtalo en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12739,8555,'es','Bollos de queso clásicos','Deléitese con unos bollos de queso para el té de la tarde o como parte de un picnic. También son excelentes para acompañar sopas y puedes congelarlas para usarlas más tarde.','["225 g de harina con levadura, más un poco más para espolvorear","pizca de sal","pizca de pimienta de cayena","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","55 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","120 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","90-100 ml de leche, más 1 cucharada para glasear"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 con una bandeja para hornear grande adentro. Tamiza la harina, la sal, la pimienta de cayena y el polvo para hornear en un bol, luego tamiza nuevamente para asegurarte de que los ingredientes estén bien combinados.","Añade la mantequilla al bol y combínala con las yemas de los dedos para formar pan rallado. Espolvorea 100 g de queso en la mezcla de pan rallado y frota hasta que se distribuya uniformemente. Trate de no mezclar demasiado ya que el calor de sus manos puede comenzar a derretir la mantequilla.","Haga un hueco en el centro de la mezcla y vierta suficiente leche para obtener una masa bastante suave pero firme. No vierta toda la leche a la vez, ya que es posible que no la necesite toda para obtener la consistencia adecuada.","Enharina ligeramente una superficie y extiende la masa hasta que tenga un grosor de aproximadamente 2 cm. Corta los bollos con un cortador mediano (de unos 8 cm), luego colócalos en una hoja de papel para horno, glaséalos con un poco de leche y espolvoréalos con el resto del queso. Deslizar sobre la bandeja del horno caliente.","Hornee en el horno durante 15-20 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y bien cocidos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12740,8557,'es','pastel de sirena','Crea un pastel con el factor sorpresa con nuestra colorida sirena sombría. Es un desafío de horneado, pero es un pastel de fiesta mágico para niños y adultos por igual.','["300 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para las latas","300 g de azúcar en polvo","5 huevos grandes, batidos","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","300 g de harina con levadura","colorante alimentario en gel morado (o una mezcla de colorante en gel morado, azul y rojo)","700 g de azúcar glas","350 g de mantequilla blanda","Colorante alimentario en gel azul o morado","perlas comestibles y chispas de plata, o decoración opcional adicional","200 gramos de chocolate blanco","2 cucharaditas de brillo dorado o metálico (consulte el consejo a continuación)","Molde de cola de sirena y moldes de conchas pequeñas, disponibles online"]','["Si estás haciendo las colas de sirena, derrite el chocolate blanco en un recipiente resistente al calor en ráfagas de 20 segundos en el microondas, revolviendo después de cada vuelta. Vierta en los moldes de cola y conchas pequeñas, y colóquelo en una bandeja pequeña en el congelador durante 15-20 minutos hasta que cuaje. Puedes repetir esto para cuatro colas si solo tienes un molde.","Una vez listo, desmolda, mezcla el brillo con ¼ de cucharadita de agua y píntalo sobre las colas de sirena (ver el consejo a continuación). Vuelva a colocarlo en un plato o bandeja en el congelador hasta que lo necesite.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base de tres moldes para sándwich de 18 cm con papel para hornear. Con una batidora de pie o un batidor de mano eléctrico, bata la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, la vainilla, el polvo para hornear y la harina hasta obtener una mezcla esponjosa.","Divida la mezcla uniformemente entre tres tazones y mezcle unas gotas de colorante en cada tazón hasta que estén completamente combinados, haciendo que cada tazón tenga un tono diferente de púrpura, volviéndose más claro. Vierta cada mezcla de bizcocho de colores en latas separadas y alise la parte superior. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Después de 10 minutos, retire los pasteles de sus moldes y transfiéralos a una rejilla para enfriar, con la parte superior hacia abajo, y déjelos enfriar. ¡No te preocupes si el exterior no se ve morado, el interior sí lo hará!","Mientras el pastel se enfría, prepara el glaseado. Batir el azúcar glas y la mantequilla hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos, mezclando con 1 cucharada de agua tibia para aflojar la mezcla si es necesario. Reserva la mitad del glaseado en un bol. Divide la otra mitad del glaseado en tres tazones y colorea cada uno con un tono diferente de azul, oscuro, medio y claro. Apila los bizcochos, esparciendo la mayor parte del glaseado blanco sobre cada uno con una espátula, luego usa la espátula para cubrir aproximadamente el exterior de los pasteles con el glaseado blanco restante para crear una capa de migas. Enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Coloque cada uno de los tonos de glaseado azul en mangas pasteleras separadas y corte un agujero grande de 2 cm en la parte inferior. Comenzando con el tono oscuro en la parte inferior del pastel, coloca un anillo uniforme sobre todo el pastel, dos o tres veces. Continúa subiendo por el pastel y el glaseado se vuelve más claro a medida que llegas a la parte superior del pastel. Con una espátula pequeña, recorra la unión entre cada fila, empujando suavemente para unir cada línea. Guarde un poco de glaseado en las mangas pasteleras para decorar la parte superior. Alise el pastel con una espátula grande o un raspador para pasteles para crear un glaseado sombrío suave, guardando el exceso para decorar la parte superior.","Puedes mezclar todo el glaseado sobrante y ponerlo en una manga pastelera limpia con boquilla de estrella para obtener un efecto multicolor, o colocar tonos individuales en la parte superior. Agrega algunos puntos alrededor de la parte superior del pastel en diferentes colores azules para que parezcan ondas (usando un poco del blanco para que parezca la parte superior de una ola rompiendo) y puntea alrededor de las perlas, chispas, conchas y colas de sirena, empujándolas hacia el glaseado en el costado del pastel y encima para terminar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12741,8559,'es','Galletas básicas','Hornee un lote de estas sencillas galletas con solo cinco ingredientes, o menos. Un compañero perfecto para una taza de té, puedes prepararlos en poco tiempo.','["225 g de mantequilla, blanda","110 g de azúcar en polvo","275 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de canela u otras especias (opcional)","75 g de chispas de chocolate blanco o con leche (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Batir la mantequilla en un bol grande con una cuchara de madera o en una batidora hasta que esté suave. Agrega el azúcar y sigue batiendo hasta que la mezcla esté ligera y esponjosa. Tamiza la harina y agrega los ingredientes opcionales, si los estás usando. Une la mezcla con las manos en forma de ocho hasta formar una masa. Puedes congelar la masa en este punto.","Enrolle la masa en bolas del tamaño de una nuez y colóquelas ligeramente separadas entre sí en una bandeja para hornear (no es necesario untarla con mantequilla ni forrarla). Aplana un poco las bolas con la palma de tu mano y hornéalas en el horno durante unos 10-12 minutos hasta que estén doradas y ligeramente firmes por encima. Deje las galletas en una rejilla para enfriar durante unos 15 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12742,8561,'es','Bagatelas de frambuesa, pistacho y cuajada de limón','Disfrute de estas bagatelas individuales de frambuesa, pistacho y limón como parte de un menú de verano. Son fáciles de montar y puedes empacarlos fácilmente.','["1 tarta de madeira (unos 200 g)","5 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","300 g de frambuesas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 cucharadas de limoncello","100 g de pistachos verdes sin piel y finamente picados","400 g de natillas espesas","300ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas"]','["Cortar el pastel de madeira en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor y emparedar los trozos con 4 cucharadas de cuajada de limón. Córtelo en cuadritos y apílelo en cuatro vasos de postre o en un plato mediano.","Triture la mitad de las frambuesas en un bol con un tenedor y agregue la vainilla y el limoncello. Vierta sobre el bizcocho. Cubra con más frambuesas enteras o partidas por la mitad (guarde algunas para terminar) y un poco de pistachos.","Agrega la mayoría de los pistachos restantes a la natilla, luego vierte sobre la fruta y el bizcocho.","Batir la crema y el azúcar en un tazón grande hasta que esté espeso, esponjoso y con picos suaves. Vierta sobre las bagatelas. Cubra con los pistachos reservados, un toque de cuajada de limón y las frambuesas restantes."]','2026-01-11 12:54:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12743,8563,'es','Tarta tahini de plátano','Prueba el tahini como ingrediente secreto del pastel de plátano: funciona de maravilla. Decóralo con nuestro topping de crema de mantequilla tahini y chispas de chocolate.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada, más un poco más para la lata","250 g de azúcar moreno blando","85 g de tahini","2 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","275 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","60ml de leche","2-3 plátanos pequeños, muy maduros, triturados (unos 275 g)","3 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","115 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","125 g de azúcar glas","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2½ cucharadas de tahini","3 cucharadas de chispas de chocolate"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 cm con papel para hornear.","Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y el tahini hasta que estén pálidos y suaves. Batir los huevos poco a poco, luego agregar la vainilla, raspando los lados del tazón según sea necesario.","Mezcle la harina, el bicarbonato de sodio y ½ cucharadita de sal, luego incorpore la mezcla de mantequilla. Agrega la leche. Incorpora con cuidado el plátano y las semillas de sésamo, luego vierte la masa en el molde preparado y hornea durante 40-50 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar un poco en el molde, luego sáquelo y transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer la cobertura de crema de mantequilla, bata todos los ingredientes, excepto las chispas de chocolate, hasta que quede suave. Extiende esto sobre el pastel enfriado, luego esparce sobre las chispas de chocolate y corta el pastel en cuadrados o rectángulos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12744,8565,'es','Empanadas de mermelada','Prepare estas empanadillas de mermelada súper fáciles con simples cuadrados de hojaldre comprados en la tienda y su mermelada favorita. Espolvorear con azúcar glas y servir con nata cuajada.','["320 g de hojaldre","1 cucharada colmada de mermelada (la de albaricoque, frambuesa o fresa funcionan bien)","1 huevo batido","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","crema cuajada, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Desenredar el hojaldre sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Corta la masa en seis cuadrados. Vierta la mermelada en el centro de cada cuadrado de masa. Sellar los bordes presionando con un tenedor y pincelar con huevo. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear forrada y hornee por 20 minutos. Espolvorear con el azúcar glas y servir con la nata cuajada."]','2026-01-11 12:54:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12745,8567,'es','galletas de jengibre','Utilice jengibre fresco y molido para hacer estas deliciosas galletas. Son perfectos para acompañar una taza de té de la tarde o como capricho en cualquier momento.','["100 g de mantequilla salada, en cubitos","75 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharada de jengibre fresco rallado","100 g de almíbar dorado","250 g de harina con levadura","1½ cucharada de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 yema de huevo pequeña, batida"]','["Calienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Forra dos bandejas para hornear grandes con papel para hornear. En un cazo a fuego lento derretir la mantequilla, el azúcar, el jengibre fresco y el almíbar dorado y dejar enfriar.","Mezclar la harina, el jengibre molido y el bicarbonato de sodio en un bol con una cuchara de madera. Agregue gradualmente la mezcla de azúcar enfriada y la yema de huevo y amase brevemente hasta formar una masa.","Enrolle la masa en bolas de 20 g y colóquelas en las bandejas para hornear preparadas con 3 cm entre cada una para permitir que se extienda. Hornee durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Deje enfriar en las bandejas durante un minuto, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para enfriar por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12746,8569,'es','Pastel de caramelo fácil','¿Necesitas hacer un pastel de celebración con poca antelación? Este espectacular pastel de caramelo, infalible y espectacular, utiliza ingredientes que se encuentran en las tiendas y se prepara rápidamente','["225 g de mantequilla blanda con sal, más un poco más para las latas","125 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 huevos grandes","225 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharadas de leche","trozos de toffee, chocolate o caramelo, para decorar","200 g de mantequilla salada blanda","400 g de azúcar glas (azúcar glas dorado si lo puedes encontrar; añade un color dorado y sabor a caramelo)","70 g de salsa de caramelo, dulce de leche o caramelo para untar, más 3 cucharadas para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla dos moldes desmontables de 20 cm y forrar las bases con papel para hornear.","Batir la mantequilla y ambos azúcares en un bol con una batidora eléctrica durante unos minutos hasta que tenga un color más claro y esponjoso. Agrega la vainilla y los huevos, uno a la vez, agregando una cucharada de harina y batiendo entre cada huevo. Agrega el resto de la harina y la leche. Divida entre los moldes para pastel y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén dorados, reboten al presionarlos y una brocheta salga limpia al insertarla en el medio. Deje enfriar en los moldes durante unos minutos, luego sáquelos y déjelos enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla.","Mientras tanto, para el glaseado, ponga la mantequilla y el azúcar glas en un bol y bata durante unos minutos hasta que esté suave y aireado. Incorpora el caramelo brevemente y agrega 1 cucharada de agua hirviendo para que se afloje, si es necesario. Déjalos a un lado hasta que los bizcochos estén completamente fríos antes de armarlos, o el glaseado se derretirá.","Use la mitad del glaseado para emparedar los pasteles, luego extienda el resto por encima, alisándolo con un cuchillo o el dorso de una cuchara. Dejar en un lugar fresco hasta el momento de servir. Rocíe con 3 cucharadas adicionales de salsa (caliéntela brevemente en el microondas si está un poco dura), deje que un poco gotee por los lados si lo desea, y esparza sobre los trozos de caramelo, chocolate o caramelo para servir. Purpurina comestible, velas de cumpleaños o bengalas, opcional."]','2026-01-11 12:54:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12747,8571,'es','Pastel de miel especiado','Disfrute de este fabuloso pastel de miel hecho con una mezcla de especias y jengibre y un delicioso aderezo de mantequilla y miel. Es ideal para el té de la tarde o para las once.','["100 g de mantequilla salada, más un poco para la lata","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de miel líquida","1 huevo grande","100ml de leche","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","150 g de harina con levadura","25 g de mantequilla salada","25 g de miel líquida"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que quede cremoso. Agrega la miel, el huevo, la leche, las especias y una pizca de sal (no te preocupes si se cuaja un poco, se volverá una masa suelta), luego agrega la harina.","Vierta en el molde para pan preparado y hornee durante 45 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Deje que el pastel se enfríe durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para el glaseado, derrita la mantequilla y la miel en una cacerola pequeña hasta que quede suave. Deje enfriar hasta que espese y luego rocíe sobre la parte superior del pastel enfriado. Dejar reposar antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12748,8573,'es','Blondies de pistacho, rosas y chocolate blanco','Pruebe una versión diferente de las rubias usando pistachos, rosas y chocolate blanco. Esparce pétalos de rosa secos para darle un acabado bonito, si lo deseas','["60 g de pistachos","150 g de chocolate blanco, picado","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubos, más un poco más para la lata","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 huevos grandes","½-1 cucharada de agua de rosas","85 g de harina común","100 g de chispas de chocolate blanco","pétalos de rosa secos, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y mantequilla y forrar un molde para hornear de 20 x 20 cm. Coloca los pistachos en una sartén y tuéstalos a fuego medio durante 3-4 minutos hasta que estén aromáticos, revolviendo ocasionalmente para que no se quemen. Dejar de lado.","Derrita el chocolate blanco picado y la mantequilla, ya sea en un recipiente colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo o en el microondas en períodos cortos. Dejar enfriar un poco y luego incorporar el azúcar moreno con una cuchara de madera. Agregue los huevos, mezcle bien después de cada adición, luego agregue el agua de rosas y ¼ de cucharadita de sal. Tamizar la harina y mezclar suavemente.","Pique los pistachos enfriados en trozos grandes, luego agréguelos a la mezcla de rubias y agregue las chispas de chocolate blanco. Vierta la mezcla en el molde para hornear forrado.","Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que cuaje y se dore, luego déjelo enfriar por completo antes de cortarlo. Para servir, espolvoree con pétalos de rosa secos, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:54:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12749,8575,'es','Tortitas de zanahoria con almíbar de naranja y miel','Hornea estos magníficos cupcakes de zanahoria hechos con un delicioso glaseado de naranja y miel para disfrutar de la tarde. Las flores comestibles dan un bonito toque final','["150ml de aceite de girasol, más un poco para la lata","175 g de azúcar mascabado light","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","1 naranja, rallada y exprimida (guarda el jugo para el almíbar)","2 huevos grandes","50 gramos de yogur natural","200 g de zanahorias, unas 2 grandes, peladas y ralladas","50 ml de miel líquida y un poco más para rociar (opcional)","150 g de mascarpone","100 g de yogur natural espeso","75 g de azúcar glas tamizada","flores comestibles o ralladura de naranja extra, para decorar"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrase un molde para muffins de 12 orificios o cúbralo con moldes para muffins. En un tazón grande, mezcle el azúcar, la harina, el bicarbonato, la mezcla de especias y la ralladura de naranja. Batir los huevos, el aceite y el yogur, luego agregar los ingredientes secos junto con las zanahorias ralladas. Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado, o divídala entre las cajas, si la usa, luego hornee durante 20-22 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio salga limpia. Coloca las tartas sobre una rejilla y déjalas enfriar un poco.","Mientras tanto, para hacer el almíbar, calentar la miel y el jugo de naranja en una sartén. Llevar a ebullición, luego cocinar a fuego lento durante un minuto hasta que esté almibarado. Vierta unas cucharaditas sobre cada pastel mientras aún esté caliente y luego déjelo enfriar por completo. Para el glaseado, mezcle el mascarpone, el yogur y el azúcar glas hasta que estén combinados (si mezcla demasiado, quedará líquido). Utilice una paleta o un cuchillo para cubiertos para hacer girar el glaseado encima de los pasteles, rociar con un poco más de miel, si lo desea, y decorar con flores comestibles o ralladura de naranja."]','2026-01-11 12:54:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12750,8577,'es','pan de té','Disfrute de un pastel clásico y afrutado, repleto de grosellas y pasas con infusión de té. Córtelo en trozos gruesos y úntelo con mantequilla salada para disfrutar de un placer satisfactorio.','["170 g de pasas","170 g de pasas","1 naranja, rallada","300 ml de té Earl Grey o Lady Grey fuerte y caliente","2 huevos medianos, ligeramente batidos","250 g de harina con levadura","200 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","mantequilla, para engrasar, y extra para servir"]','["Mezcle las pasas, las pasas y la ralladura de naranja en un tazón grande. Vierta sobre el té y cubra el bol. Dejar reposar un mínimo de 6 horas o idealmente toda la noche para permitir que los frutos secos absorban todo el líquido.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160 ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g. Agrega los huevos, la harina y el azúcar a la fruta remojada, asegurándote de que todo esté bien combinado. Vierta la mezcla en el molde y colóquela en el centro del horno durante 1 hora 30 minutos o hasta que esté firme al tacto. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos antes de transferirlo a una rejilla.","Cortar en rodajas gruesas y servir con mantequilla. Para guardarlo, envuélvalo bien y guárdelo en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días. El pan sabrá aún mejor después de unos días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12751,8579,'es','flapjacks veganos','Elige tus nueces y frutas secas favoritas en esta versátil receta de flapjack sin lácteos, o cámbialas cada vez que las prepares: ¡sé aventurero!','["140 g de crema para untar sin lácteos","140 g de azúcar moreno claro y suave","2 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","175 g de copos de avena","75 g de nueces picadas de tu elección","75 g de frutos secos (como pasas, arándanos secos, albaricoques picados)"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para hornear cuadrado de 20 cm con papel para hornear.","Derrita la crema para untar sin lácteos, el azúcar y el almíbar en una cacerola a fuego medio. Retirar del fuego y agregar la avena, las nueces picadas y los frutos secos. Transfiera a la lata, compactando la mezcla con el dorso de una cuchara.","Hornee durante 30 a 35 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y crujiente en los bordes. Dejar enfriar en el molde antes de cortar en cuadritos. Guárdelo en un recipiente hermético por hasta tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12752,8581,'es','Bollos cruzados calientes veganos','¿Qué dice mejor la Pascua que los bollos cruzados calientes? Pruebe esta versión vegana, usando crema para untar sin lácteos y leche de almendras: la canela, la mezcla de especias, las pasas y los cítricos aportan todos los sabores tradicionales.','["300ml de leche de almendras sin azúcar","50 g de crema para untar sin lácteos","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","Sobre de 7 g de levadura de acción rápida.","70 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de sal","2 cucharaditas colmadas de canela molida","2 cucharaditas colmadas de especias mixtas","1 naranja grande, rallada","70 g de pasas","50 g de piel mixta","70 g de harina común","50 g de mermelada de albaricoque"]','["Pon la leche de almendras en un cazo a fuego medio. Una vez que hierva a fuego lento, agregue la pasta para untar, retire del fuego y deje que se derrita. Dejar enfriar a temperatura manual.","Mezcle la harina, la levadura, el azúcar, la sal y las especias en un tazón grande. Haga un hueco en el centro y vierta la mezcla de leche, combinándola rápidamente con una cuchara de madera para crear una masa pegajosa. Saque del tazón sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.","Amasar la masa estirándola hacia adelante y hacia atrás sobre la superficie durante 5 a 7 minutos o hasta que quede suave, elástica y elástica. Forme una bola y colóquela en un tazón ligeramente engrasado. Cubra y déjelo reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Vuelva a colocar la masa en la superficie y aplánela hasta formar una ronda. Extiende la ralladura de naranja, las pasas y las pieles mixtas sobre la masa y vuelve a amasar hasta que quede todo bien distribuido. Formar una bola, volver al bol, tapar y dejar reposar una hora más.","Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Golpea la masa hacia atrás girándola sobre la superficie y golpeando suavemente para sacar el aire. Divida la masa en 12 trozos del mismo tamaño y pese para mayor precisión si lo desea. Haga una bola con cada uno. Coloca los bollos en la bandeja para hornear, dejando un espacio de 2 cm entre cada uno. Cubrir con film transparente ligeramente engrasado y dejar reposar durante 45 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 220 °C/200 ventilador/gas 7. Para hacer la cruz, en un tazón pequeño, mezcla la harina con 1 cucharada de agua a la vez para crear una pasta espesa que se pueda pipetear. Colóquelo en una manga pastelera equipada con una pequeña boquilla redonda y coloque cruces en los bollos. Transfiera al estante central del horno y hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos o hasta que estén bien dorados.","Mientras tanto, calienta suavemente la mermelada en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento para que se suelte. Pasar por un colador para eliminar los grumos. Una vez cocido, unte la mermelada tibia sobre la parte superior de los panecillos. Dejar enfriar un poco antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 12:54:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12753,8583,'es','Tarta Amarena de cerezas y almendras','Esta tarta agridulce de cerezas y almendras de Lina Stores es la delicia italiana por excelencia. Sirva una porción como final perfecto para cualquier comida.','["125 g de mantequilla","125 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","225 g de harina común","½ huevo o 1 yema de huevo","125 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","125 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos medianos","1 limón, rallado","125 g de almendras finamente molidas o harina de almendras","120 g de cerezas Fabbri amarena (ver consejo)","azúcar glas, para espolvorear (opcional)"]','["Mezclar la mantequilla, el azúcar, la harina, una pizca de sal y el huevo en un procesador de alimentos para hacer una masa, luego envolver y dejar reposar en el frigorífico durante 30 minutos. La masa debe estar fría pero aún así será fácil trabajar con ella cuando la extiendas.","Mientras tanto, prepara el relleno de frangipane. Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego lento, luego déjela enfriar un poco. Batir en un bol el azúcar con los huevos y la ralladura de limón hasta que esté cremoso. Vierta la mantequilla derretida sin dejar de batir, luego agregue las almendras molidas (o harina de almendras) e incorpore a la mezcla. Caliente el horno a 175C/155C ventilador/gas 3½.","Forre un molde para tarta o un molde circular untado con mantequilla (aproximadamente 23 cm) con la masa de hojaldre extendida y luego recorte los bordes que sobresalgan. Extienda la frangipane uniformemente en el molde y coloque las cerezas encima con un poco de su almíbar, de modo que la parte superior de la tarta quede cubierta con una capa fina.","Coloque la tarta en el horno y hornee durante unos 40-45 minutos hasta que esté dorada, inflada y firme al tacto. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla. Espolvoree con un poco de azúcar glas, si lo desea, antes de servir en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12754,8585,'es','Pastel de mousse de matcha','El matcha en polvo, un ingrediente popular en los postres asiáticos, se elabora a partir de hojas de té verde finamente molidas. Este bonito pastel con glaseado de chocolate blanco y cerezas es todo un desafío pero vale la pena.','["aceite vegetal, para engrasar","6 huevos grandes, separados","200 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de harina común","25 g de almendras molidas","50 g de mantequilla, derretida y enfriada","5 hojas de gelatina","Bote de 600ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de matcha en polvo (ver consejo)","250 g de azúcar glas y un poco para espolvorear","150ml de nata doble","150 g de chocolate blanco, picado en trozos pequeños","1 cucharadita de matcha en polvo","cerezas y flores frescas de cerezo rosadas, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar dos moldes para pasteles de 20 cm (uno debe tener al menos 8 cm de profundidad) con aceite y forrar la base y los lados con papel para hornear. Vierta las yemas de huevo, el azúcar en polvo y la vainilla en un tazón grande y las claras en un segundo tazón grande. Combine la harina, las almendras y 1/4 cucharadita de sal en un tercer tazón.","Con una batidora de mano eléctrica, bata las claras hasta que dupliquen su tamaño y queden a punto de nieve. Transfiera los batidores al tazón de yemas de huevo (no es necesario limpiarlos primero) y bata hasta que la mezcla esté espesa y pálida. Levante los batidores y rocíe la mezcla alrededor del tazón; debe quedar una cinta en la superficie durante 2-3 segundos.","Con una cuchara grande de metal, transfiera una cucharada de clara de huevo a las yemas y mezcle para aflojar la consistencia. Agrega las claras restantes e incorpora suavemente las yemas, tratando de retener el mayor volumen posible. Deténgase antes de que la mezcla esté totalmente combinada. Espolvoree la mezcla de harina y almendras uniformemente sobre la superficie, luego rocíe la mantequilla enfriada alrededor del borde del tazón. Doble todo junto hasta que esté combinado, asegurándose de llevar la cuchara hasta el fondo del tazón para recoger la mantequilla y las bolsas de harina. Divida la mezcla entre los moldes para pastel, nivele las superficies y luego hornee en el estante central del horno durante 22-25 minutos. Pruebe que los pasteles estén listos insertando una brocheta en el centro; debe salir limpio. Dejar enfriar en sus moldes sobre una rejilla durante 30 minutos, luego retirar los moldes y el pergamino y dejar enfriar por completo.","Hervir la tetera. Poner la gelatina en un bol con agua fría y reservar para que se ablande. Vierta 150 ml de nata y 50 ml de agua caliente en un cazo. Agrega el polvo de matcha y bate a fuego suave hasta que esté bien combinado y humeante. Retirar del fuego. Exprime el agua de las hojas de gelatina y añádelas, una a una, a la crema de matcha caliente, batiendo hasta que se disuelvan. Vierta la nata tibia en un bol y póngala en el frigorífico para que se enfríe a temperatura ambiente; no la deje demasiado tiempo o la gelatina se endurecerá.","Forre el molde para pasteles más profundo de 20 cm con una doble capa de film transparente, asegurándose de que los lados queden bien cubiertos. Coloque uno de los bizcochos en la lata, con el lado más plano hacia abajo. Verter los 450ml restantes de nata en un bol y añadir el azúcar glas. Batir hasta que la crema tenga picos suaves, luego incorporar la crema matcha enfriada. Vierta la nata en el molde para bizcocho y nivele la superficie. Coloque el bizcocho restante encima, con el lado más plano hacia arriba, empujando el bizcocho suavemente hacia la crema. Envuelva el molde en film transparente y déjelo enfriar durante al menos 4 horas.","Poner la nata, el chocolate y el matcha en polvo en un cazo y calentar muy suavemente, revolviendo hasta que el chocolate se derrita y el matcha esté bien mezclado. Dejar enfriar y espesar durante 10 minutos. Saca el bizcocho de la nevera y desenvuelve el molde. Invierta el bizcocho sobre una base para pasteles o un plato y retírelo del molde y del film transparente. Usando una espátula sostenida en un ángulo de 90 grados hacia el costado del pastel, raspe alrededor del borde para eliminar el exceso de mousse y darle al pastel un acabado suave. Con papel para hornear, cree un cuello ajustado, aproximadamente 2 cm más alto que el pastel. Vierta el glaseado de chocolate enfriado sobre la parte superior, alisándolo hasta el borde; el cuello debe evitar que gotee por los lados. Enfríe por 30 minutos más o hasta por 24 horas.","Retire con cuidado el cuello de pergamino. Sostenga una tabla de cortar (u otro objeto con borde recto) sobre la mitad del pastel y espolvoree la superficie expuesta con azúcar glas. Coloque encima cerezas frescas y flores de cerezo u otra flor comestible, si lo desea, y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:54:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12755,8587,'es','Bollos de cardamomo','Este panecillo sueco especiado tiene un intenso perfume floral procedente de las semillas de cardamomo, que penetra en la masa durante la cocción.','["35 vainas de cardamomo","350 ml de leche entera","200 g de mantequilla, en cubos","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","½ cucharadita de canela molida","aceite vegetal o aceite de girasol, para engrasar","1 huevo grande, batido","2 cucharadas de azúcar perlada (disponible en ocado.com)"]','["Abra 10 de las vainas de cardamomo con un mortero y viértalas en una cacerola. Agregue la leche y caliente hasta que esté humeante pero no hirviendo. Agregue 50 g de mantequilla (deje la mantequilla restante a temperatura ambiente para que se ablande) y déjela enfriar hasta que esté tibia, moviendo la sartén de vez en cuando para que la mantequilla se derrita.","Ponga la harina, 75 g de azúcar, la levadura, la canela y 1/2 cucharadita de sal en un bol grande o en el bol de una batidora independiente. Mezclar hasta que esté bien combinado. Cuando la leche se haya enfriado, colarla a través de un colador con la harina, desechando el cardamomo. Con una cuchara de madera o un gancho para masa, mezcle hasta formar una masa suave. Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase durante 10 minutos, o haga funcionar la batidora independiente durante 5 minutos, hasta que la masa esté suave y elástica. Limpiar el bol, engrasar ligeramente con aceite, luego devolver la masa al bol y darle la vuelta hasta que esté bien cubierta de aceite. Cubre el bol con un paño de cocina o film transparente y déjalo reposar durante 2 horas o hasta que doble su tamaño (puedes dejarlo reposar en el frigorífico durante la noche).","Rompe las vainas de cardamomo restantes con un mortero. Ábralos e incline las semillas nuevamente en el mortero, desechando las vainas. Triture las semillas hasta convertirlas en polvo y luego combine con 150 g de azúcar. En un tazón, mezcle la mantequilla restante con todo menos 2 cucharadas de azúcar con cardamomo.","Forre dos bandejas para hornear con pergamino. Golpea la masa para eliminar el aire, luego enrolla hasta formar un rectángulo de aproximadamente 35 x 45 cm, con el borde más largo hacia ti. Extienda la mantequilla de cardamomo por la superficie, hasta los bordes. Dobla el tercio superior hacia el medio y el tercio inferior hacia arriba, como un sobre, para tener tres capas de masa. Marque y luego córtelo en 12 tiras iguales, de aproximadamente 3,5 x 11 cm cada una. Corta cada tira por el centro, dejándola unida en la parte superior. Gire cada tira lejos del centro dos o tres veces, luego haga un nudo con la masa y meta los extremos debajo del panecillo. Coloque cada uno en la bandeja cuando esté listo.","Cubra ambas bandejas con una hoja de film transparente ligeramente engrasado y déjelas en un lugar cálido para que crezca durante 30 minutos - 1 hora, o hasta que casi duplique su tamaño. Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.","Destapar los bollos y pintarlos con huevo batido y luego espolvorear con azúcar perlado. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que se doren; cambie las bandejas a la mitad si se doran de manera desigual.","Vierta el resto del azúcar con cardamomo en una cacerola y agregue 50 ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición, luego retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar, revolviendo para disolver el azúcar. Unte el almíbar sobre los bollos dos o tres veces mientras se enfrían y déjelos en remojo durante 20 minutos antes de comerlos. Se conservará durante 2 días en un recipiente sellado o se congelará durante 2 meses. Descongelar a temperatura ambiente y recalentar durante 5 minutos en el horno antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 12:54:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12756,8589,'es','Galletas de chocolate tahini negro','Haz tu propio tahini con semillas de sésamo blancas o negras, esta receta te muestra cómo. Los negros tienen un sabor más dulce y a nuez, lo que los hace perfectos para hornear.','["50 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","125 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","125 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo batido","200 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","200 g de chocolate con leche, partido en trozos","100 g de chocolate blanco, derretido, para rociar","100 g de semillas de sésamo negro (disponibles en Waitrose), más algo extra para decorar","100 g de aceite sin sabor","30 g de jarabe de arce"]','["Primero, haz el tahini negro. Tuesta las semillas de sésamo en una sartén pequeña a fuego suave hasta que puedas oler el aroma del sésamo. Transfiera a un mini procesador y bátelo. Vierte el aceite poco a poco hasta que se forme una pasta. Agrega el jarabe de arce y vuelve a mezclar. Vierta en un tazón pequeño hasta que esté listo para usar.","Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre dos bandejas para hornear con pergamino. En un tazón grande, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Añade el huevo y 80 g de pasta de tahini negro y bate para combinar. Agrega la harina, el cacao y los trozos de chocolate con leche y bate hasta que esté completamente incorporado.","Con una bola de helado, forme una bola con la masa en unos 20 trozos y colóquelos en las bandejas para hornear. Presiona cada bola ligeramente para que quede un poco más plana, dejando suficiente espacio entre ellas, ya que se esparcirán.","Hornee durante 6-8 minutos hasta que aún estén suaves en el medio; se endurecerán a medida que se enfríen. Deje enfriar en las hojas durante unos minutos antes de transferirlo a rejillas para que se enfríe por completo.","Una vez enfriadas, rocía chocolate blanco en zigzags por todas las galletas y espolvorea unas semillas de sésamo negro por encima. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12757,8591,'es','Rodajas de limón','Un pastel británico clásico del juez de Bake Off, el chorrito de limón de Paul Hollywood es un sencillo horneado en bandeja, hecho muy especial con glaseado de plumas.','["70 g de mantequilla blanda sin sal","120 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos medianos","140 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","ralladura fina de 1 limón","1 cucharada de cuajada de limón","2 cucharadas de leche entera","30 g de azúcar granulada","jugo 1 limon","250 g de azúcar glas","3 cucharadas de agua","Un toque de colorante alimentario amarillo."]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forre un molde para hornear cuadrado de 20 x 20 cm con papel para hornear.","Con una batidora eléctrica, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén pálidas, ligeras y esponjosas. Agrega los huevos y vuelve a mezclar. Agrega la harina, el polvo para hornear, la ralladura de limón, la cuajada de limón y la leche, y mezcla con una cuchara de madera hasta que todos los ingredientes estén bien combinados. Vierte la mezcla en el molde preparado y hornea durante 25-30 minutos o hasta que al pinchar un pincho salga limpio.","Mezclar el azúcar y el jugo de limón y verter sobre el hot cake. Dejar enfriar en el molde. Puedes comer el pastel tal cual o, para darle un acabado elegante, intenta hacer este glaseado de plumas.","Mezcle el azúcar glas con suficiente agua para obtener un glaseado líquido, pero no acuoso. Ponga una pequeña cantidad de glaseado en un recipiente aparte. Agregue unas gotas de colorante alimentario al glaseado hasta que tenga un color amarillo pálido. Vierta en una bolsa de glaseado desechable.","Retire el bizcocho del molde y retire el papel de horno. Coloque el pastel sobre una rejilla sobre una bandeja para hornear. Extienda el glaseado blanco por encima. Coloque líneas finas del glaseado de color a lo ancho del pastel. Utilice un palillo para arrastrar las líneas en direcciones opuestas para crear un efecto de plumas. Dejar reposar antes de cortar en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12758,8593,'es','Tarta de queso al horno con almendras, plátano y arándanos','Endulzada con frutas naturales y un poco de jarabe de arce, esta tarta de queso combina ricota y yogur para obtener una textura baja en grasa, pero rica y cremosa.','["50 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","1 cucharadita de jarabe de arce","75 g de galletas de avena, finamente trituradas hasta obtener migajas","40 g de almendra molida","2 plátanos","2 tarrinas de ricota de 250 g","Bote 150g yogur natural bio","4 huevos grandes, batidos","2 cucharadas de jarabe de arce","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de almendras molidas","140 g de arándanos"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrasar ligeramente un molde desmontable redondo antiadherente de 20 cm. Derrita la mantequilla y el almíbar en una sartén, luego agregue las galletas de avena y las almendras hasta que estén bien mezcladas y cubiertas. Presione firmemente en la base del molde para formar una capa compacta, luego hornee por 10 minutos. Retirar del horno y aumentar la temperatura a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9.","Para hacer el relleno, machaca los plátanos en un bol grande. Agrega la ricota, el yogur, los huevos, el almíbar, la vainilla y las almendras, y bate con una cuchara de madera hasta que esté todo muy bien mezclado. Vierta sobre la base, esparza sobre los arándanos y hornee por 10 minutos, luego baje el horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas 1/4 y cocine por 30-35 minutos más. Todavía debería oscilar un poco en el medio cuando agite suavemente la lata. Apagar el horno y dejar la tarta de queso dentro para que se enfríe y cuaje. Enfriar antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12759,8595,'es','Pastel de café con leche de avellanas','Dale al pastel de café la mejor mejora: cubre con glaseado de chocolate y avellanas, agrega una cobertura cremosa y espolvorea con nueces trituradas.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco para engrasar","Bolsa de 100g de avellanas tostadas picadas","300 g de azúcar moreno blando","6 cucharadas de leche semidesnatada","1 cucharadita de café instantáneo fino en polvo (ver consejo)","6 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","175 g de harina común","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de café instantáneo fino en polvo","1 cucharada de licor Frangelico (avellana), o use Kahlua o Tía María","400 g de mascarpone","300 g de chocolate para untar con avellanas (Nutella tiene la mejor textura para esto)","1 cucharada de café instantáneo fino en polvo","50 g de avellanas tostadas picadas","Bote de 150ml de nata doble","4 cucharaditas de azúcar glas","3 cucharadas de leche semidesnatada","1 cucharada de café instantáneo fino en polvo, disuelto en 1 cucharadita de agua hirviendo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla generosamente dos moldes para sándwich de 20 cm (idealmente de unos 4,5 cm de profundidad o más) y forrar las bases con papel para hornear. Pon las avellanas en un procesador de alimentos con 2 cucharadas de azúcar, luego pulsa hasta que estén finamente picadas. No espere que queden tan finas como las almendras molidas y evite procesarlas en exceso, ya que esto puede engrasar las nueces.","Pon la mantequilla, la leche y el café en polvo en una cacerola pequeña y calienta suavemente hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Dejar de lado.","Ahora empieza la esponja. Rompe los huevos en el tazón de una batidora de mesa, agrega el resto del azúcar y bate durante 5 a 10 minutos (o bate con una batidora de mano eléctrica en un tazón grande y hondo durante 15 a 20 minutos) o hasta que esté espesa y ondulante, y la mezcla deja un rastro que se mantiene durante un par de segundos. Es muy importante que la mezcla haya espesado, casi duplicando su tamaño, para conseguir un bizcocho ligero.","Mezcle la harina de maíz, la harina común y 1/2 cucharadita de sal y tamice sobre la mezcla batida. Con una cuchara grande de metal, doble con mucho cuidado. Espolvorea las nueces molidas y luego dóblalas también. Vierta la mezcla de leche tibia alrededor del borde del tazón y dóblelo. No se apresure a doblar y continúe con un ligero movimiento de elevación y corte hasta que dejen de aparecer cintas de líquido. Divida la masa entre los moldes, luego hornee durante 25 minutos hasta que alcance la mitad y esté dorada bruñida.","Afloje los lados de los pasteles con una espátula, luego déjelos enfriar en los moldes sobre una rejilla durante 20 minutos (los pasteles se nivelarán y posiblemente se arrugarán un poco, pero eso es normal). Retirar con cuidado de las latas y dejar enfriar, con el papel hacia abajo.","Prepara el almíbar y el glaseado mientras esperas. Pon el azúcar y 4 cucharadas de agua en una cacerola pequeña. Llevar a ebullición y dejar reposar 1 min y luego retirar del fuego. Agrega el café y el alcohol. Batir el mascarpone, la crema de chocolate con avellanas y el café con una cuchara de madera hasta obtener una mezcla sedosa y uniforme.","Para armar, corte los pasteles fríos horizontalmente por la mitad, usando un cuchillo de sierra largo. Con una brocha de repostería, humedezca todas las superficies cortadas con el almíbar. Úselo todo. Coloque una capa de pastel en un plato o soporte, con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Vierta 3 cucharadas generosas de glaseado y luego extiéndalo hasta los bordes con una espátula. El glaseado debe tener unos 5 mm de profundidad. Repita con las siguientes dos capas. Cuando llegues a la capa final, colócala con el lado cortado hacia abajo, de modo que la parte superior del pastel quede suave. Rema el resto del glaseado sobre la parte superior y los lados del pastel. La capa superior puede ser fina. Limpia el cuchillo y luego úsalo para presionar un anillo limpio de nueces en el glaseado del costado del pastel. Cepille cualquier exceso.","Para la cobertura, ponga 3 cucharadas de nata, 1 cucharadita de azúcar glas y 1 cucharada de leche en un bol pequeño. Pon en un bol más grande el resto de la nata, la leche y el azúcar, más la mayor parte del café disuelto. Batir la nata blanca, luego la nata de café, hasta que parezca una espuma suave de capuchino, espesa pero que aún pueda fluir de una cuchara. Vierta la mayor parte de la crema de café sobre el pastel y empújela para cubrir la parte superior. Agrega un poco más de café al resto para que se oscurezca un poco más.","Para decorar con la característica forma de “árbol” del café con leche, cargue una cucharadita puntiaguda con un poco de crema blanca. Comienza en la base del árbol, justo a la derecha del centro del pastel. Introducir la cuchara en la crema de café y dejar que la crema blanca fluya lentamente. A medida que fluye, arrastre la cuchara y luego retírela suavemente para darle forma de hoja. Repita con más crema blanca a la izquierda para hacer otra hoja, luego repita 3 o 4 veces, subiendo la parte superior del pastel y graduando de hojas grandes a pequeñas. Utilice la misma técnica para barrer un par de formas de arco alrededor del borde del patrón.","Use la crema oscura para agregar detalles a cada hoja; puede pintar esto con la punta de una cucharadita o un palito de cóctel limpio. Utilice un palillo para arrastrar las puntas de cada hoja hacia arriba y hacia afuera. Dibuja una línea desde la parte superior del \"árbol\" hasta la parte inferior para terminar. El pastel se conservará hasta por 2 días. Cubre sin apretar los bordes cortados, pero evita cubrir el pastel directamente, ya que podrías dañar la decoración. Servir desde el frigorífico o a temperatura ambiente fresca."]','2026-01-11 12:54:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12760,8597,'es','Pan de jengibre más ligero','Este pastel de jengibre oscuro y pegajoso se hace más saludable con dátiles naturalmente dulces, suero de leche y mucha canela y jengibre fresco.','["140 g de dátiles enteros secos, deshuesados, preferiblemente Medjool, picados en trozos pequeños","75ml de aceite de colza, más unas gotas para engrasar","75 g de melaza negra","50 g de jarabe de arce","1 cucharadita de jengibre fresco finamente rallado","1 huevo grande","175 ml de suero de leche","250 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","½ cucharadita de canela molida","50 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro"]','["Pon los dátiles en un bol pequeño y vierte sobre 125 ml de agua hirviendo. Dejar enfriar durante 30 min. Engrase ligeramente una bandeja para hornear de 28 x 19 x 3 cm y luego cubra la base con papel para hornear.","Mientras tanto, ponga el aceite, la melaza negra, el jarabe de arce y el jengibre recién rallado en un bol y bata con un tenedor para mezclar bien. Dejar de lado. Batir el huevo en un tazón pequeño y agregar el suero de leche. En un tazón grande, mezcle la harina con el bicarbonato de sodio, el jengibre molido, la canela y el azúcar; frote la mezcla entre los dedos para deshacer los grumos de azúcar. Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.","Licue los dátiles y su líquido hasta obtener un puré espeso en un procesador de alimentos pequeño.\r\nVierta el huevo, los dátiles y la mezcla de melaza en el bol con la harina. Revuelva brevemente con una cuchara de madera hasta que esté bien mezclado; la mezcla quedará suave como una masa espesa. Viértelo en el molde forrado, nivela suavemente la mezcla y hornea durante 40-45 minutos. Para comprobar si está cocido, inserte una brocheta en el centro; si la brocheta sale limpia y sin mezcla cruda y el pastel se siente firme pero elástico al tacto, debe estar listo.","Dejar en el molde unos minutos antes de pasar a una rejilla, quitar el pergamino y dejar enfriar por completo. Si puedes esperar, envuélvelo bien en pergamino y luego envuélvelo en papel de aluminio. Déjalo reposar un día antes de cortarlo, ya que se volverá más pegajoso y se mantendrá húmedo durante 3 o 4 días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12761,8599,'es','Tarta de chocolate vegana fácil','Este delicioso y dulce horneado vegano está cubierto con un rico glaseado; nunca imaginarías que no contiene lácteos, huevos, trigo ni nueces.','["un poco de crema de girasol sin lácteos, para engrasar","1 aguacate grande y maduro (unos 150 g)","300 g de azúcar mascabado light","350 g de harina común sin gluten","50 g de cacao en polvo de buena calidad","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 cucharaditas de levadura en polvo sin gluten","400 ml de leche de soja sin azúcar","150 ml de aceite vegetal","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","85 g de pulpa de aguacate maduro, triturada","85 g de cremas de girasol sin lácteos","200 g de chocolate sin lácteos, 70% cacao, partido en trozos","25 g de cacao en polvo","125 ml de leche de soja sin azúcar","200 g de azúcar glas tamizada","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","chispitas veganas y sin gluten, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Engrasar 2 moldes para sándwiches de 20 cm y luego forrar las bases con papel para hornear. Pon el aguacate y el azúcar en un procesador de alimentos y bate hasta que quede suave. Agregue el resto de los ingredientes del pastel al tazón con 1/2 cucharadita de sal fina y procese nuevamente hasta obtener una masa líquida y aterciopelada. Divida entre los moldes y hornee por 25 minutos o hasta que haya subido por completo y al insertar una brocheta en el medio de los pasteles, éste salga limpio.","Deje enfriar en los moldes durante 5 minutos, luego gire los pasteles sobre una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo. Mientras esperas, empieza a preparar el glaseado. Batir la crema de aguacate y girasol con batidoras eléctricas hasta que quede cremoso y suave. Pasar por un colador y reservar.","Derrita el chocolate, ya sea sobre un recipiente con agua o en el microondas, luego déjelo enfriar durante unos minutos. Tamiza el cacao en un bol grande. Lleva la leche de soja a fuego lento y luego incorpora gradualmente el cacao hasta que quede suave. Deje enfriar por unos minutos. Vierta la mezcla de aguacate, el azúcar glas, el chocolate derretido y la vainilla, y siga mezclando para obtener un glaseado espeso y brillante. Úselo para emparedar y cubrir el pastel. Cúbrelo con chispas o tu propia decoración, luego déjalo reposar durante 10 minutos antes de cortarlo. Se puede realizar con 2 días de antelación."]','2026-01-11 12:54:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12762,8601,'es','Cruffins de almendras y frambuesa','Cruza un croissant con un muffin y obtendrás estos pasteles mantecosos, hojaldrados y afrutados, perfectos para el brunch o un capricho.','["1 cucharadita de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","225 g de harina blanca fuerte, tamizada y un poco más para darle forma","25 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, picada en trozos del tamaño de un terrón de azúcar","50 g de mantequilla sin sal","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharadita de harina común","unas gotas de extracto de almendras","1 yema de huevo","unas cucharadas de mermelada de frambuesa sin semillas","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear"]','["Para la masa, medir 75 ml de agua recién tibia, añadir la levadura y remover para que se disuelva. Mide otros 75 ml de agua helada y agrégale el jugo de limón. Mezcle la harina y el azúcar con 1/2 cucharadita de sal fina en un tazón grande, luego agregue los cubos de mantequilla hasta que estén cubiertos de harina. Salpica el agua de levadura y el agua de limón sobre el contenido del bol. Con un cuchillo de hoja redonda, trabaje rápidamente para que la mezcla adquiera una masa rugosa con trozos de mantequilla en su interior.","Colóquelo sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada, forme un rectángulo achaparrado sin amasarlo demasiado, luego envuélvalo en film transparente y enfríe durante 15 minutos en el congelador.","Espolvorea la superficie de trabajo y la masa con harina. Enrolle la masa en una dirección hasta que tenga 3 veces más largo que ancho, o unos 45 x 15 cm. Intente mantener los lados rectos mientras rueda y los bordes superior e inferior lo más cuadrados posible.","Dobla la masa sobre sí misma. Dobla el tercio inferior hacia arriba y luego el tercio superior hacia abajo para formar un bloque ordenado. Gire el bloque de modo que su borde abierto quede hacia la derecha, como un libro. Presione los bordes suavemente con el rodillo. Estire y doble la masa así 3 veces más para hacer una masa suave, con alguna que otra raya de mantequilla aquí y allá. Si se siente grasoso en algún momento o se vuelve elástico, tápelo y déjelo enfriar durante 10 minutos antes de continuar. Envuelva la masa terminada y enfríe durante al menos 1 hora.","Para hacer el relleno, bate todos los ingredientes y sazona con una pizca de sal. Reservar hasta que sea necesario.","Para darle forma, poner la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada. Córtelo por la mitad y devuélvalo a la nevera. Enrolle el otro hasta formar un rectángulo de 30 x 20 cm, luego córtelo en 3 tiras, cada una de 10 cm de ancho. Para crear aún más capas, dobla cada pieza por la mitad a lo largo. Coloque una cucharadita generosa de la mezcla de almendras en un extremo de la masa y luego enrolle la masa alrededor en espiral. Colóquelo, con el borde cortado hacia arriba, en un molde para muffins antiadherente. Repita para hacer 6 cruffins. Cubra sin apretar con film transparente. Se puede enfriar durante la noche. (Es posible que le sobre algo de relleno, que puede congelarse).","Deje fermentar la masa a temperatura ambiente fresca durante 2 horas o hasta que la masa haya llenado los huecos del molde. Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Hornee los cruffins durante 20-25 minutos hasta que suban y estén dorados. Retirar y enfriar un poco sobre una rejilla. Para rellenar con mermelada, vierta la mermelada en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de 5 mm o use una botella exprimible del chef. Empuje la boquilla en el medio del cruffin y apriete. Espolvorea los cruffins con azúcar glas y cómelos fríos o calientes el día de hornearlos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12763,8603,'es','Pan integral sin semillas','Este pan abundante y saludable es rico en sabor y está lleno de semillas: pruebe con calabaza, girasol, amapola o linaza.','["400 g de harina integral fuerte para pan","100 g de harina de espelta","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de melaza negra","aceite, para engrasar","50g de semillas mixtas (nosotros utilizamos calabaza, girasol, amapola y linaza)","1 yema de huevo, aflojada con un tenedor"]','["Combine ambas harinas en un tazón grande con la levadura y 1 cucharadita de sal fina. Mezclar la melaza con 250 ml de agua tibia hasta que esté bien combinada. Agregue la harina para hacer una masa ligeramente pegajosa. Si necesita agregar más agua, vierta 1 cucharada a la vez.","Amasar la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada durante 10 minutos (o en una batidora de mesa durante 5-7 minutos). Tu masa debe quedar suave y elástica cuando esté lista. Coloque la masa en un bol ligeramente engrasado, voltee la masa.\r\ncubrirlo con aceite y luego cubrirlo con una hoja de film transparente engrasado. Déjelo en un lugar cálido hasta que duplique su tamaño; esto tomará aproximadamente 1 hora (consulte la nota a continuación). Engrase ligeramente un molde para pan de 900 g.","Una vez que haya duplicado su tamaño, amase la masa nuevamente durante 3 a 5 minutos para eliminar las burbujas de aire; agregue la mayoría de las semillas e incorpórelas a la masa mientras amasa. Dale forma a la masa en un óvalo aproximadamente del mismo largo que tu molde. Colóquelo en el molde y déjelo reposar, cubierto con film transparente engrasado, durante 30-45 minutos hasta que casi haya vuelto a duplicar su tamaño. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Presione suavemente con un dedo en el pan para comprobar si ha tenido suficiente tiempo de fermentación (ver consejo). Cuando esté listo, glasea la parte superior del pan con la yema de huevo y espolvorea sobre las semillas restantes. Hornee en el horno durante 40-45 minutos hasta que esté dorado; si saca el pan del molde y golpea el fondo, debe sonar hueco. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla durante al menos 30 minutos antes de cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12764,8605,'es','Pan de masa madre fácil','No se deje intimidar por preparar un entrante de pan con masa madre en casa: esta versión fácil, que se prepara durante la noche, hace un delicioso pan.','["100 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","100 g de harina de centeno oscura orgánica","½ sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","400 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","½ sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida"]','["Para preparar tu entrante, coloca todos los ingredientes en un bol y añade 250 ml de agua fría. Mezcle bien con una cuchara hasta obtener una mezcla esponjosa, luego cubra con film transparente y déjela a temperatura ambiente al menos durante la noche, pero hasta 24 horas si tiene tiempo.","Para hacer la masa de pan, vierte los ingredientes en un bol limpio y añade 1 cucharada de sal fina, 200 ml de agua fría y tu entrante. Junte todos los ingredientes hasta formar una masa, agregue un poco más de agua si está demasiado dura, luego colóquela sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase durante al menos 10 minutos hasta que quede suave, elástica y elástica (esto tomará de 5 a 7 minutos en una batidora con gancho para masa). Coloque la masa en un recipiente limpio y ligeramente engrasado, cúbrala con film transparente y déjela hasta que doble su tamaño: aproximadamente 1 hora a temperatura ambiente, 3 horas en el refrigerador (consulte los consejos a continuación).","Incline la masa sobre una superficie enharinada y forme suavemente una ronda; no querrás quitarle demasiado aire a la masa. Espolvorea abundantemente un trozo de papel para hornear con harina y coloca la masa encima. Cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar durante 1 hora hasta que doble su tamaño.","Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Coloque una bandeja para hornear plana y resistente en el estante central del horno y una bandeja más pequeña con los lados debajo. Espolvoree la masa con harina y córtela con un cuchillo. Desliza el pan en la bandeja caliente de arriba y echa unos cubitos de hielo (o vierte un poco de agua fría) en la bandeja de abajo; esto crea una ráfaga de vapor que ayuda a que el pan forme una bonita corteza. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que el pan suene hueco al golpearlo en la parte inferior. Deja que el pan se enfríe por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12765,8607,'es','Remolinos de queso y pesto','Estos panecillos con hierbas para cortar y compartir contienen mozzarella y tomates secados al sol, perfectos para un picnic o para mojar en una sopa.','["450 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito","150 g de pesto fresco en tarrina","240 g de tomates semisecos en tarrinas, escurridos y picados en trozos grandes","100 g de mozzarella rallada (mejor para esto, ya rallada, ya que está más seca que fresca)","50 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), rallado","un puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Combine la harina, la levadura, el azúcar y 1 1/2 cucharadita de sal fina en un tazón grande para mezclar o en el tazón de una batidora de mesa. Mide 300 ml de agua tibia y añade aproximadamente 280 ml a la harina, junto con el aceite de oliva, y empieza a mezclar hasta que los ingredientes empiecen a formar grumos formando una masa. Si la masa parece un poco seca, agrega el agua restante. Una vez combinado, amase durante 10 minutos a mano sobre la superficie de trabajo, o durante 5 minutos a velocidad media en una batidora. La masa estará lista cuando se sienta suave, elástica y elástica. Limpiar el bol, rociar con un poco de aceite, luego volver a colocar la masa, darle la vuelta y cubrir los lados del bol con aceite. Cubra con un poco de film transparente engrasado y déjelo a un lado en un lugar cálido para que duplique su tamaño; esto tomará entre 1 y 3 horas, dependiendo de la temperatura.","Forre una bandeja para hornear con pergamino. Destapa la masa y golpéala un par de veces con el puño, eliminando todas las burbujas de aire. Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada y espolvoree también la parte superior con un poco de harina, si está pegajosa. Estire la masa hasta formar un rectángulo de aproximadamente 40 x 30 cm. Unte el pesto sobre la masa, luego esparza sobre los tomates, ambos quesos y la albahaca. Enrolle la masa desde uno de los lados más largos, formando una salchicha larga.","Utilice un cuchillo afilado para cortar la masa en 12 trozos iguales. Colóquelos en la bandeja para hornear, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, en una formación de 3 por 4, asegurándose de que el extremo abierto de cada rollo quede hacia el centro del arreglo; esto evitará que se desenrollen durante la cocción. Deja un poco de espacio entre cada rollo ya que irán creciendo y tocándose a medida que vayan probándose. Cubra sin apretar con film transparente engrasado y déjelo reposar durante 30 minutos a 1 hora hasta que casi doble su tamaño nuevamente. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Destapar el pan cuando esté inflado. Hornee en el estante del medio durante 35 a 40 minutos hasta que estén dorados y el centro se vea seco y no pastoso. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar durante al menos 10 minutos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12766,8609,'es','Brownies de caramelo salados','Lleve los deliciosos y dulces brownies de chocolate al siguiente nivel con una capa de caramelo salado que recorre el centro de cada bocado.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco más para engrasar","100 g de chocolate, 70% cacao sólido","100 g de chocolate, 50 % sólidos de cacao","Lata de 397g de caramelo de clavel","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas, más un poco más para la parte superior","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos medianos, a temperatura ambiente","100 g de harina común, más 2 cucharadas","50 g de cacao en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y luego forrar una bandeja para hornear cuadrada de 23 cm con papel para hornear. Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén mediana, agregue todo el chocolate, luego retire la sartén del fuego y espere a que los cubos se derritan.","En un tazón pequeño, mezcle 175 g de caramelo con 1 cucharadita de sal marina; se aflojará. Poner el resto del caramelo en un bol grande con el azúcar y los huevos, y batir con batidora eléctrica de mano o batidora de globo hasta que quede uniforme.","Incorpora el chocolate y la mantequilla. En otro bol, combine la harina, el cacao y una buena pizca de sal de mesa, luego tamice esto sobre la mezcla de chocolate. Batir brevemente hasta que quede suave.","Vierte la mitad de la masa del brownie en el molde y nivela con una espátula. Con una cucharadita, vierta la mitad del caramelo salado sobre la capa de masa en 5 franjas gruesas y espaciadas uniformemente. Coloque el resto de la masa de brownie encima y alíselo, tratando de no alterar el caramelo de debajo. Cubra con el resto del caramelo de la misma forma a rayas. Pasa una brocheta o la punta de un cuchillo a través del caramelo para hacer un patrón de plumas en la parte superior.","Espolvorea con un poco más de sal marina, luego hornea durante 25 a 30 minutos o hasta que haya subido hasta la mitad y tenga una corteza firme encima. Cuando esté listo, el brownie se moverá un poco al agitar la lata. Déjelo enfriar completamente en el molde y luego córtelo en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12767,8611,'es','pan de mono','Este dulce americano desmenuzable es pegajoso, condimentado y relleno de nueces: un delicioso desayuno, brunch o postre para compartir.','["200ml de leche semidesnatada","85 g de mantequilla sin sal","2 huevos grandes","550 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para amasar si lo haces a mano","2½ cucharaditas de levadura seca de acción rápida","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","aceite, para engrasar","125 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco para engrasar","1 cucharada de canela molida","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","225 g de azúcar mascabado light","140 g de nueces pecanas, tostadas y picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de azúcar glas tamizada","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharada de leche semidesnatada","pizca de canela molida","2 cucharadas de mantequilla sin sal, derretida"]','["Empieza con la masa. Coloque la leche y la mantequilla en una cacerola mediana y caliente suavemente hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y la leche hierva a fuego lento. Deje enfriar durante unos minutos y luego bata los huevos con un tenedor. Mezcle los ingredientes secos en un tazón grande con 1 1/2 cucharadita de sal fina, luego agregue el líquido y revuelva hasta obtener una masa pegajosa. Déjelo durante 5 minutos, luego colóquelo sobre una encimera enharinada y amase durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástico. Use un poco de aceite para engrasar un tazón grande, agregue la masa, colóquela en el aceite para cubrirla y luego cubra el tazón con film transparente. Dejar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño. Amasar en una batidora de mesa con un gancho para masa si lo prefiere.","Para montar, engrase un molde de 25 cm con mantequilla. Derrita el resto de la mantequilla en una sartén. En un tazón mediano mezcle las especias y el azúcar más una pizca de sal. Vierta 2 cucharadas de mantequilla derretida, 3 cucharadas de azúcar especiada y 4 cucharadas de nueces pecanas en el fondo de la lata.","Divida la masa en unos 65 trozos pequeños y forme bolas. Tomando 4 o 5 a la vez, sumerge las bolas de masa en la mantequilla derretida, deja escurrir el exceso y luego viértelas en el azúcar especiado. Enrolle para cubrir y luego colóquelo al azar en la lata. Repita hasta que quede una capa completa de masa en el molde. Espolvorear con el resto de nueces picadas y seguir llenando el molde con las bolitas de masa rebozadas. Vierta el azúcar y la mantequilla sobrantes sobre la masa. Se puede congelar ahora hasta por 1 mes. Descongelar en el frigorífico y dejar reposar.","Cubra la sartén con film transparente engrasado y déjela reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora, o hasta que suba y la masa ya no rebote cuando la pinche.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Hornea el pan de mono durante 35 minutos, o hasta que esté bien leudado y dorado. Deje que la sartén se enfríe durante 5 minutos y luego déle un golpe fuerte en la encimera. Déjelo en la lata hasta que esté tibio.","Batir todos los ingredientes para hacer el glaseado. Se espesará a medida que la mantequilla derretida se enfríe. Coloque el pan de mono en un plato para servir y luego rocíe con el glaseado. Déjalo reposar, si puedes soportar la espera."]','2026-01-11 12:54:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12768,8613,'es','Deliciosa tarta de queso al horno con limón','Un pudín sencillo pero muy impresionante, lo suficientemente ligero como para tomar un trozo para terminar una gran comida.','["225 g de galletas digestivas","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","Tarrina de 250 g de mascarpone","600 g de queso tierno","2 huevos, más 2 yemas","ralladura de 3 limones, jugo de 1","4 cucharadas de harina común","175 g de azúcar en polvo","½ bote de nata agria de 284 ml","3 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","un puñado de frambuesas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4.\r\nForrar el fondo de un molde desmontable de 23 cm.\r\nlata con papel vegetal. Inclina el\r\ngalletas y mantequilla derretida en un alimento\r\nprocesador, luego bombardee para que quede bien\r\nmigajas. Presione en la lata y enfríe.","Batir todos los demás ingredientes en\r\nun tazón grande hasta que esté completamente\r\ncombinados, verter en el molde y luego hornear\r\ndurante 35-40 minutos hasta que la tarta de queso\r\ntiene una oscilación uniforme.","Apagar el horno y dejar el bizcocho.\r\nadentro hasta que se enfríe. Cuando esté completamente\r\nenfriado, retirar del molde y cubrir\r\ncon crema agria. Remolino de cuajada de limón\r\npor encima y decorar con\r\nframbuesas, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:54:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12769,8615,'es','Pequeños cupcakes de rosas y almendras','Bonito como una imagen, pero absolutamente simple. Agregue una bandera de papel y éstas servirán como nombres de lugares o obsequios en una boda.','["140 g de harina con levadura","100 g de almendras molidas","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","175 g de azúcar en polvo","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","3 huevos grandes","100 gramos de yogur natural","175 g de mantequilla derretida","100 g de azúcar glas, más algo extra para espolvorear y pegar el almíbar","350 g de glaseado listo para enrollar","175 g de mazapán","colorantes alimentarios verde, amarillo y rosa"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y\r\nforrar un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con cupcake\r\no estuches para muffins. Mezclar la harina, las almendras,\r\npolvo de hornear y azúcar juntos en una\r\ntazón grande. Batir el extracto de almendras y\r\nhuevos en el yogur, luego viértalo en el\r\ningredientes secos con la mantequilla. batir\r\njuntos hasta que no queden grumos, luego divida\r\nentre los casos. Hornee durante 18-22 minutos\r\nhasta que al pinchar un pincho éste salga limpio.\r\nDejar enfriar sobre una rejilla. Los pasteles se congelarán\r\nhasta por 1 mes.","Extender el mazapán sobre una superficie.\r\nespolvoreado con un poco de azúcar glas, hasta aproximadamente\r\nel grosor de una moneda de £1. Usando un 6 cm\r\ncortador de galletas redondo, sellar 12 círculos,\r\nvolver a laminar y estampar los recortes si\r\nnecesario. Mezcle suficiente azúcar glas en\r\nuna taza de agua para obtener un glaseado almibarado, luego\r\ncepillar el dorso de los círculos de mazapán\r\ny pegarlo a los pasteles.","Amasar un poco de colorante alimentario amarillo\r\nuna cuarta parte del glaseado ya preparado, un poco\r\nrosa en otro cuarto y verde en\r\notro cuarto. Envolver el glaseado verde\r\ny reserve, luego repita el paso 2 usando un\r\nCortador de 7 cm para tallar 4 círculos cada uno del glaseado rosa, amarillo y blanco.\r\npegar de nuevo con almíbar.","Mezcle suficiente agua con los 100 g de glaseado.\r\nazúcar para darle un glaseado duro. dividir en\r\ntres, deja uno blanco y colorea el\r\notros rosados y amarillos – hazlos\r\ncolores un poco más oscuros para que las rosas se mantengan firmes\r\nfuera. Transfiera el glaseado a bolsas pequeñas de comida,\r\nGire la parte superior para sellar y corte solo la parte superior.\r\npunta más pequeña de una esquina de cada bolsa. Tubería\r\nespirales sobre pasteles, mezclando los colores.\r\nPellizque pequeños trozos de glaseado verde en\r\nhojas, marcando la vena con un palillo\r\nsi quieres. Añade 1, 2 o 3 hojas a cada una.\r\nespiral para que parezca una rosa (puedes usar\r\nel glaseado almibarado para ayudar a que se peguen si\r\nnecesidad). Es mejor comer los pasteles dentro\r\n2 días, y una vez decorado se conservará durante\r\n1-2 días en recipientes herméticos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12770,8617,'es','Cuadritos de dulce de chocolate y naranja','Ricos brownies de chocolate con una ligera cobertura de naranja estilo pastel de zanahoria','["200 g de chocolate natural, partido en cubos (nosotros usamos Bournville)","200 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","175 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","3 huevos, separados","140 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","ralladura de 1 naranja","200 g de queso tierno en tarrina (yo usé Philadelphia Extra Light)","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","50 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4.\r\nUnte con mantequilla y forre un molde para hornear, 23 x 23 cm.\r\no por ahí. Pon el chocolate,\r\nazúcar y mantequilla en una sartén, luego calentar muy\r\nsuavemente durante unos 5 minutos, revolviendo cada minuto\r\nhasta que la mantequilla y el chocolate tengan\r\nderretido. Dejar enfriar durante 10 min. batir\r\nen las yemas de huevo, la harina, la vainilla y la mitad de la\r\nralladura de naranja.","Poner las claras en un recipiente grande y muy\r\nlimpie el tazón, luego bata hasta que reposen\r\narriba en picos. Agrega ¼ de las claras a la\r\nmezcla de chocolate para aflojarlo, luego con cuidado\r\nIncorpora el resto con una cuchara de metal. verter\r\nla mezcla en el molde, luego hornee por 25 minutos\r\no hasta que haya subido uniformemente y esté firme hasta el punto\r\ntoque. Dejar enfriar en el molde y luego cortar en cuadritos.\r\nSe puede congelar hasta por 1 mes.","Batir el queso, la vainilla y el azúcar.\r\ny la ralladura restante hasta que quede suave. difundir\r\nsobre cada cuadrito de chocolate y servir. si\r\nestás avanzando, extiende la cobertura\r\njusto antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12771,8619,'es','Quiche definitiva Lorena','La clave para hacer la quiche perfecta es la sencillez, como podrás comprobar con esta sabrosa receta','["175 g de harina común","100 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en trozos","1 yema de huevo","Paquete de 200 g de manteca de cerdo, cruda o ahumada","50 g de gruyere","Cartón de nata fresca de 200 ml.","200ml de nata doble","3 huevos bien batidos","pizca de nuez moscada molida"]','["Para la masa, poner la harina, la mantequilla, la yema de huevo y 4 cucharaditas de agua fría en un procesador de alimentos. Usando el botón de pulso, procese hasta que la mezcla se una. Incline la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, forme una bola suave y luego extiéndala lo más finamente posible. Forre un molde para flan estriado y de fondo suelto de 23 x 2,5 cm, introduciendo la masa en la base. Recorta los bordes de la masa con unas tijeras (guarda los recortes) para que quede ligeramente por encima del molde (si se encoge, no debería quedar por debajo del nivel del molde). Presione la masa en las flautas, pinche ligeramente la base con un tenedor y luego enfríe durante 10 minutos. Coloque una bandeja para hornear en el horno y caliente el horno a 200 ° C/ventilador 180 ° C/gas 6.","Forre la funda de masa con papel de aluminio, con el lado brillante hacia abajo, rellénela con frijoles secos y hornee en la bandeja caliente durante 15 minutos. Retire el papel de aluminio y los frijoles y hornee durante 4-5 minutos más hasta que la masa esté dorada pálida. Si nota pequeños agujeros o grietas, repárelos con recortes de pastelería. Puedes llegar a este punto con un día de antelación.","Mientras se cuece la masa, prepara el relleno. Calentar una sartén pequeña, verter los mantecas de cerdo y freír durante un par de minutos. Escurre el líquido que salga y luego continúa cocinando hasta que los mantecas empiecen a tomar color, pero no estén crujientes. Retirar y escurrir sobre toallas de papel. Cortar tres cuartas partes del queso en dados pequeños y rallar finamente el resto. Esparcir el queso cortado en dados y la manteca frita sobre el fondo de la masa.","Con una cuchara, bata la crema fresca para que se suelte y luego agregue lentamente la nata doble. Incorpora los huevos batidos. Sazona (no debería necesitar mucha sal) y añade nuez moscada. Vierta las tres cuartas partes del relleno en la masa de repostería.","Saque la parrilla del horno hasta la mitad y coloque el molde para flan en la bandeja para hornear. Vierta rápidamente el resto del relleno en la masa de repostería; de esta manera llegará hasta arriba. Esparza el queso rallado por encima y luego empuje con cuidado la rejilla hacia el horno. Baje el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Hornee durante unos 25 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y suave (el centro no debe sentirse demasiado firme). Deje que la quiche repose durante 4-5 minutos y luego retírela del molde. Servir recién horneado, aunque también está bien frío."]','2026-01-11 12:54:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12772,4961,'es','Receta deliciosa de pastel de zanahoria','Deleita a tus amigos con un té de la tarde que incluye este sencillo pastel de zanahoria. Puedes hornear el pastel, congelarlo y simplemente rociarlo con el glaseado ese día.','["175 g de azúcar mascabado light","175 ml de aceite de girasol","3 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos","140 g de zanahorias ralladas (unas 3 medianas)","100 g de pasas","ralladura de 1 naranja grande","175 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada rallada (recién rallada le dará el mejor sabor)","175 g de azúcar glas","1½-2 cucharadas de jugo de naranja"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/Gas 4/ventilador 160C. Engrase y cubra la base y los lados de un molde para pastel cuadrado de 18 cm con papel para hornear. La forma más sencilla de hacerlo es cortar dos tiras largas del ancho de la lata y colocar cada tira en forma transversal.\r\ncubriendo la base y lados del molde, con doble capa en la base.","Vierta el azúcar en un tazón grande, vierta el aceite y agregue los huevos. Mezclar ligeramente con una cuchara de madera. Agregue las zanahorias ralladas, las pasas y la ralladura de naranja.","Mezclar la harina, el bicarbonato de\r\nrefresco y especias, luego tamizar en el\r\ncuenco. Mezclar ligeramente todos los\r\ningredientes – cuando todo\r\nse amalgama uniformemente\r\nmezclando.\r\nLa mezcla quedará bastante blanda.\r\ny casi líquida.","Vierta la mezcla en el\r\nmolde preparado y hornear durante 40-\r\n45 minutos, hasta que se sienta firme.\r\ny elástico cuando lo presionas\r\nel centro. Dejar enfriar en la lata durante 5\r\nminutos, luego apáguelo, pélelo\r\nQuitar el papel y enfriar sobre un alambre.\r\nestante. (Puedes congelar el pastel en\r\neste punto.)","Batir el glaseado\r\ningredientes en un tazón pequeño hasta\r\nsuave – quieres el glaseado\r\nCasi tan líquido como una crema simple.\r\nColoca el pastel en un plato para servir.\r\ny rocíe audazmente el glaseado\r\ny adelante en líneas diagonales sobre\r\nla parte superior, dejando que gotee por los lados."]','2026-01-11 12:54:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12773,8621,'es','Cupcakes de limón y semillas de amapola','Estos sabrosos cupcakes se ven tan deliciosos que no querrás comértelos, pero una vez que comienzas no podrás parar.','["225 g de harina con levadura","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura de 2 limones","1 cucharada de semillas de amapola, tostadas","3 huevos","100 gramos de yogur natural","175 g de mantequilla, derretida y enfriada un poco","225 g de mantequilla, blanda","400 g de azúcar glas tamizada","jugo 1 limon","unas gotas de colorante alimentario amarillo","flores de glaseado o chispas amarillas, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4\r\ny forre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con cupcake\r\no estuches para muffins. Mezclar la harina, el azúcar,\r\nralladura de limón y semillas de amapola juntas en\r\nun tazón grande para mezclar. Batir los huevos\r\nel yogur, luego viértalo en el seco\r\ningredientes con la mantequilla derretida. Mezclar\r\njunto con una cuchara de madera o un batidor\r\nhasta que no queden grumos, luego dividir entre la\r\ncasos. Hornee durante 20-22 minutos hasta que se forme una brocheta.\r\nAl pincharlo, éste sale limpio: los pasteles\r\nEstar bastante pálido arriba todavía. Dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos\r\nen la lata, luego levántelo con cuidado sobre un alambre\r\nrejilla para terminar de enfriar.","Para glasear, bata la mantequilla ablandada hasta que\r\nmuy suave en un tazón grande, luego gradualmente\r\nIncorpora el azúcar glas y el jugo de limón.\r\nAgregue suficiente colorante para alimentos para que quede pálido.\r\ncolor limón, luego vierta el glaseado en\r\nuna manga pastelera con boquilla de estrella grande.","Hiele un pastel a la vez, sosteniendo el\r\nmanga pastelera casi en posición vertical con la boquilla\r\naproximadamente a 1 cm de la superficie del pastel.\r\nColoca una espiral de glaseado alrededor del borde,\r\nluego haga una pausa para interrumpir el flujo antes\r\nmoviendo la boquilla hacia el centro\r\nligeramente y ribeteando un segundo, más pequeño\r\nespiral que continúa hasta que hay\r\nsin huecos en el centro. Ligeramente \"punto\"\r\nla boquilla en el glaseado cuando te detengas\r\napretando para terminar prolijamente. Repetir para cubrir\r\ntodos los pasteles, luego cubra con azúcar\r\ndecoraciones o espolvorear con chispas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12774,8623,'es','Crumble de ruibarbo y pera','Tiene una deliciosa cobertura crujiente que sabe a flapjack, una comida reconfortante perfecta.','["3 peras maduras","600 g de ruibarbo","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura fina y jugo de 1 naranja","200 g de harina integral","200 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubitos","140 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro","50 g de muesli o gachas de avena","25 g de cereal para el desayuno con nueces o racimos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Para la cobertura, juntar todos los ingredientes y frotar con los dedos hasta obtener una masa rugosa, luego reservar en el frigorífico.","Pele las peras y córtelas en trozos grandes, luego pique el ruibarbo en bastones del tamaño de un dedo. Vierta en una fuente grande para horno y mezcle con el azúcar, la ralladura y el jugo de naranja. Desmenuza la cobertura y hornea durante 40 minutos hasta que esté dorada y burbujeante por los lados. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos antes de verterlo en tazones y servirlo con natillas o helado."]','2026-01-11 12:54:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12775,8625,'es','Bandeja horneada de frambuesa y almendras','Una mezcla, toda batida en el procesador de alimentos, constituye la base y la cobertura de este horneado.','["250 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","200 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubitos","280 g de azúcar granulada dorada","50 g de coco rallado","2 huevos medianos","350-450 g/12 oz-1 lb de frambuesas frescas o congeladas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pastel alargado (aproximadamente 31 x 17 x 3 cm). Vierta la harina, las almendras molidas, la mantequilla y el azúcar en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que la mantequilla esté distribuida uniformemente, o frótela con la mano. Retire 85 g/3 oz de la mezcla, agregue el coco y reserve. Añade los huevos a la mezcla restante en el procesador de alimentos y bate rápidamente – o mezcla con una cuchara de madera. No es necesario que quede muy suave.","Extienda esta mezcla sobre la base del molde y luego esparza la mitad de las frambuesas por encima. Espolvorea con la mezcla de coco y hornea por 45 minutos. Distribuya la fruta restante sobre la superficie y cocine por 15 minutos más, hasta que esté firme al tacto. Dejar enfriar en el molde y cortar en rodajas, cuadritos, la forma que quieras. Se conservarán hasta 2 días en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 12:54:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12776,8626,'es','pasteles de banbury','La tarta Banbury reina en las Midlands. Pruebe esta receta rápida para disfrutar a la hora del té, deliciosa con una taza de Earl Grey','["50 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","1 cucharada de miel inglesa","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada recién rallada","½ cucharadita de canela molida","100 g de grosellas","50 g de piel de naranja confitada","harina común, para espolvorear","Paquete de 500 g de hojaldre con mantequilla","1 clara de huevo batida","1-2 cucharadas de azúcar molida o terrones de azúcar triturados y con bordes ásperos"]','["Batir la mantequilla y la miel\r\ncon las especias. Añade las grosellas y el\r\ncáscara confitada y mezclar bien. a la ligera\r\nsuperficie enharinada, extienda la masa hasta\r\ngrosor de una moneda de £1 y recórtela 10 x\r\nCírculos de 10 cm, volviendo a enrollar los recortes.\r\nDivide el relleno entre los círculos.","Levante los bordes de la masa para\r\nEncierra el relleno y riza los bordes.\r\nde la masa junta para que parezca pequeña\r\nmonederos. Voltee los paquetes, con el\r\nse pliega por debajo. Extienda cada paquete\r\nsuavemente hasta darle una forma ovalada, teniendo cuidado de no\r\npara exponer el relleno.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nColoque los pasteles en una bandeja para hornear forrada\r\ncon papel antiadherente. Pincelar con el huevo\r\nBlanco y espolvorear con azúcar. cocinar para\r\n25-30 minutos hasta que esté cocido y crujiente. girar\r\nBaje el horno si la parte superior se dora demasiado rápido.","Cuando esté cocido, transfiéralo a una rejilla.\r\ny dejar enfriar un poco antes de comer.\r\nCuando están fríos, se untan excelentemente.\r\ncon un poco de mantequilla salada."]','2026-01-11 12:54:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12777,8628,'es','Pan de calabacín y champiñones','Un excelente acompañamiento para sopas y ensaladas o simplemente servido caliente con un poco de mantequilla.','["3 calabacines medianos rallados","2 cucharaditas de sal","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","100 g de champiñones castaños picados","350 g de harina común","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca fácil de mezclar","2 cucharadas de albahaca fresca picada","½ cucharada de sal marina gruesa, para espolvorear"]','["Pon los calabacines rallados en un colador y espolvorea con 1 cucharadita de sal. Déjelo reposar durante 20 minutos y luego, con las manos, exprima la mayor cantidad de humedad posible. Enjuague bien los calabacines y luego exprima nuevamente.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén y cocina la cebolla y el ajo durante 4 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue los champiñones y cocine por 4 minutos más hasta que se ablanden y se doren, luego agregue los calabacines y cocine por otros 2 minutos. Colar bien y dejar enfriar; desechar el líquido.","Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. Coloque la harina en un tazón grande, agregue la levadura, el resto del aceite y la sal, la albahaca y la mezcla de calabacín. Mezclar bien para combinar. Haga un hueco en el centro y agregue 125 ml de agua caliente a mano. Mezclar bien hasta formar una masa ligeramente pegajosa. Amasar sobre una superficie enharinada durante aproximadamente \r\n10 minutos, luego forme una bola y colóquela en una bandeja para hornear engrasada.","Aplana ligeramente la bola de masa con la palma de la mano y cúbrela sin apretar con film transparente engrasado. Dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 25-30 minutos hasta que duplique su tamaño. Cepille la parte superior de la masa con un poco de agua, luego espolvoree con sal marina y hornee durante 40 minutos hasta que esté dorada. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12778,9448,'es','Pastel de brownie de chocolate','Haga que los niños cocinen el fin de semana horneando este delicioso pastel de brownie, mucho mejor que el comprado en la tienda.','["100 g de mantequilla","175 g de azúcar en polvo","75 g de azúcar moreno claro o mascabado","125 g de chocolate (natural o con leche)","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto/esencia de vainilla","100 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar un molde para pastel de 20 cm.","Coloque la mantequilla, el azúcar en polvo, el azúcar moreno, el chocolate y el almíbar dorado en la sartén y derrita suavemente a fuego lento hasta que esté suave y sin grumos.","Retire la sartén del fuego.","Rompe los huevos en el bol y bate con el tenedor hasta que estén suaves y espumosos. 5 Agrega los huevos, el extracto o esencia de vainilla,\r\nAgregue la harina, el polvo para hornear y el cacao en polvo a la mezcla de chocolate y mezcle bien.","Coloque la mezcla en el molde para pastel engrasado y forrado y colóquelo en el estante central del horno. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos.","Retirar y dejar enfriar durante 20-30 minutos antes de cortarlo en gajos y servir.","Servir con nata o helado y mucha fruta fresca."]','2026-01-11 12:54:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12779,8630,'es','Tortitas de limón','La versión mini y extra maravillosa de nuestra receta más popular, el pastel de limón','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla, suavizar","400 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos, ligeramente batidos","250 g de harina con levadura","ralladura y jugo de 3 limones"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nForre un molde para muffins con 12 cajas para muffins.\r\nCon una batidora eléctrica batir la mantequilla,\r\n250 g de azúcar, huevos, harina, ralladura de\r\n2 limones y jugo de 1 limón hasta\r\nrecién combinado, no bata demasiado. dividir\r\nentre los casos (serán bastante\r\nlleno), luego hornee en un estante intermedio durante\r\n30 minutos, hasta que entre una brocheta.\r\nsalir limpio.","Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos, luego transfiera los pasteles a\r\nuna rejilla para enfriar en una bandeja y pinche cada uno\r\nunas cuantas veces con una brocheta. Vierta el resto\r\njugo de limón sobre los 150 g restantes de azúcar\r\ny rallar 1 limón, e inmediatamente verter\r\nsobre los pasteles. Dejar enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12780,8632,'es','budín de pan','Este sencillo horneado queda delicioso con té, natillas o helado de postre.','["500 g de pan blanco o integral","500 g/1 libra 2 oz de frutos secos variados","85 g de piel mixta","1 ½ cucharada de especias mixtas","600ml de leche","2 huevos grandes, batidos","140 g de azúcar mascabado light","ralladura de 1 limón (opcional)","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","2 cucharadas de azúcar demerara"]','["Corta el pan en un tazón grande para mezclar.\r\ny añadir la fruta, pelarla y condimentar. Vierta\r\nla leche, luego revuelva o triture\r\ntus dedos para mezclar todo bien y\r\nromper completamente el pan. Agrega los huevos,\r\nmoscovado y ralladura de limón si se usa. Revuelva\r\nBueno, luego déjelo en remojo durante 15 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nUntar con mantequilla y forrar la base de un molde de 20cm.\r\nmolde para pastel cuadrado antiadherente (no uno con\r\nuna base suelta). Agrega la mantequilla derretida\r\nla mezcla de pudín, verter en el molde, luego\r\nesparcir con demerara. Hornear por 1½ horas\r\nhasta que esté firme y dorado, cubriendo con papel aluminio\r\nsi empieza a dorarse demasiado. resulta\r\ndel molde y quitarle el papel. Cortar en\r\ncuadritos y servir caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:54:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12781,8634,'es','Tarta de natillas con hojaldre de nuez moscada','Hay algo tan honesto en una tarta de natillas, simplemente cubierta con una ralladura de nuez moscada.','["Paquete de 500 g de masa quebrada","1 nuez moscada entera, para rallar","4 huevos grandes","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","300ml de nata doble","300ml de leche entera","1 vaina de vainilla, sin semillas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEstire la masa hasta que tenga aproximadamente 1 cm de espesor,\r\nluego rallar sobre un poco de nuez moscada\r\nutilizando un rallador fino. Doblar la masa por la mitad,\r\nluego extiéndalo nuevamente hasta obtener el grosor de\r\n2 monedas de £1 y lo suficientemente grandes como para forrar una\r\nMolde para sándwiches de fondo suelto de 20 cm con\r\nalgún saliente. Presione la masa en el\r\nestaño (dejando el exceso extendido sobre el\r\nlados), poner en una bandeja para hornear y enfriar\r\ndurante 10 min. Forrar la masa con horneado.\r\npergamino y rellénelo con frijoles para hornear.\r\nHornee por 20 minutos, luego retire los frijoles.\r\ny papel. Hornee por otros 15 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado y arenoso por todas partes. Recorta los bordes\r\nde la tarta con un cuchillo de sierra afilado.","Baje el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/\r\ngas 2. Batir los huevos y el azúcar.\r\nen un tazón grande. Poner la nata, la leche,\r\nvaina de vainilla y semillas en una cacerola\r\ny llevar a ebullición. Vierta sobre los huevos,\r\nbatiendo a medida que avanza. Colar en una jarra. poner\r\nla bandeja para hornear sobre la bandeja\r\nrejilla del horno, luego vierta las natillas, a la derecha\r\nhasta la cima. Puede que no necesites hasta el último\r\ncaer. Rallar sobre una buena capa de nuez moscada,\r\nluego deslícelo suavemente nuevamente dentro del horno y\r\nhornee por 1 hora. Cuando esté lista, la tarta\r\ndebe estar cuajado y dorado pálido en la parte superior,\r\ny tener sólo el más mínimo temblor en el\r\ncentro cuando agite la bandeja. genial\r\ncompletamente y luego sírvelo en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12782,8636,'es','Cuadritos de pistacho y chocolate con leche','Pruebe algo diferente con los cuadrados de pistacho y chocolate con leche de Sarah Cook: ¡no podrá detenerse en una sola pieza!','["140 g de pistachos sin cáscara","200 g de chocolate con leche, partido en trozos","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de mantequilla muy blanda","3 huevos","200 g de harina con levadura","100ml de leche","150 ml de nata agria"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nForrar un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 cm con masa para hornear.\r\npergamino. Batir 125 g de pistachos,\r\n75 g de chocolate y aproximadamente la mitad del\r\nazúcar en un procesador de alimentos hasta que esté muy fina\r\npicado. Vierta en un tazón con el resto\r\nazúcar, mantequilla, huevos, harina y leche, más un\r\npizca de sal y batir. Raspar en la lata\r\ny hornee durante 35-45 minutos hasta que se forme una brocheta.\r\nmetido sale limpio. Fresco.","Derretir el chocolate con leche restante,\r\nagregue la crema agria y enfríe hasta\r\nuntable. Recorta los bordes del pastel,\r\nluego dividir por la mitad. Untar un poco de glaseado\r\nla base, emparedar la parte superior del bizcocho\r\nde nuevo. Extienda el resto del glaseado\r\nla parte superior, pique el resto\r\npistachos y esparcirlos por encima.\r\nCortar en 16 cuadrados para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12783,8638,'es','El pudín de Eva','Aquí tienes un pequeño recordatorio de un delicioso pudín británico que probablemente no hayas comido en años.','["6 manzanas Bramley grandes, finamente cortadas","200 g de mantequilla sin sal","140 g de pasas","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","4 huevos","200 g de harina con levadura"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nPelar, descorazonar y cortar en rodajas las manzanas. engrasar un\r\nfuente grande para servir, aproximadamente 2,5 litros/3 litros\r\ncon 25g/1oz de mantequilla y verter en el\r\nmanzana. Esparce las pasas por encima.","En un plato aparte batir el resto\r\nmantequilla y azúcar juntos durante 10 minutos\r\nhasta que la mantequilla palidezca y el azúcar\r\ncomienza a disolverse. Batir los huevos, luego\r\nincorporar con cuidado la harina con un gran\r\ncuchara. Extiende la masa sobre las manzanas.\r\nluego hornee por 45 minutos hasta que esté dorado. servir\r\ncon las natillas, abajo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12784,8640,'es','Gajos de pan de ajo con queso','Una versión maravillosamente pegajosa de pan de ajo con jarlsberg','["85 g de mantequilla, temperatura ambiente","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","175 g de queso jarlsberg rallado grueso","2 cucharadas de perejil picado","¼ cucharadita de chiles secos triturados","1 pan redondo francés o ciabatta"]','["Precalienta el horno a ventilador\r\n170C/convencional 190C/\r\ngas 5. Batir la mantequilla y\r\najo, luego mezcle el queso,\r\nperejil y chiles. Cortar el\r\npan por la mitad transversalmente\r\npor el centro.","Untar la mezcla de queso\r\nen los lados cortados de ambos pan\r\nmitades. Envolver cada mitad\r\nsin apretar en papel de aluminio y colóquelo\r\nbandeja para hornear. Hornear por 20\r\nminutos, desenvuelva el papel de aluminio y\r\nhornee otros 10-15 minutos\r\nhasta empezar a palidecer\r\ndorado. Cortar en gajos\r\ny servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12785,8642,'es','Bakewell de grosella negra','Hornear no tiene por qué ser complicado: este sencillo horneado en bandeja con sabor a fruta está listo en 45 minutos.','["250 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para engrasar","280 g de harina con levadura","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","4 huevos","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural","1 cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","4 cucharadas de mermelada de grosella negra","25 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrasar una fuente para hornear o asar de 20 x 30 cm.\r\nestaño y cubra con papel para hornear. a\r\nhacer el bizcocho, batir la mantequilla,\r\nharina, azúcar, levadura en polvo, huevos, yogur,\r\nextracto de vainilla y almendras en un tazón grande\r\ncon unas varillas eléctricas hasta que no queden grumos.\r\nVierta en el molde y hornee por 10 minutos.","Rápidamente salpique sobre la mermelada, esparza sobre\r\nalmendras, luego hornee por 15-20 minutos más\r\nhasta que esté dorado y levado y pinchado con una brocheta\r\nsale limpio. Dejar enfriar en la lata y luego\r\nespolvorear con azúcar glas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12786,8644,'es','Tarta de chocolate del millonario','Una versión para cenas del favorito de la hora del té, las galletas de mantequilla millonarias. No es demasiado amargo, por lo que a los niños también les encantará.','["Paquete 375g de masa quebrada de postre","1 cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla","harina, para espolvorear","250 g/9 oz de caramelo (nosotros usamos caramelo Carnation de lata)","100 g de chocolate natural 70%, partido en trozos","100 g de chocolate blanco partido en trozos","6 cucharadas de mantequilla derretida","2 huevos, más 3 yemas","4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","azúcar glas y crema, para servir (opcional)"]','["Romper la masa en trozos y dejar caer\r\nen un procesador de alimentos. Rocíe sobre el\r\npasta de vainilla y pulsa hasta que la vainilla esté\r\nmoteado a través de la masa (el extracto\r\ndebe ser completamente absorbido). dar propina\r\nsobre una superficie enharinada, junte\r\nforma una bola y luego extiéndela para forrar una superficie de 23 cm.\r\nmolde para tarta (deje la masa que sobresalga como\r\nlo recortarás cuando la tarta esté\r\nhorneado). Enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Línea\r\nla masa con papel vegetal. Rellenar con\r\nhornear frijoles, hornear a ciegas durante 15-20 minutos,\r\nluego retire el papel y los frijoles y\r\nhornee durante 5-10 minutos más hasta que esté dorado pálido.\r\nExtender con cuidado el caramelo sobre la base.\r\ny reserva mientras haces el relleno.\r\nBaje el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Derretir los chocolates en un bol sobre una\r\ncacerola con agua apenas hirviendo, luego revuelva\r\nen la mantequilla derretida. batir los huevos\r\nyemas y azúcar junto con una batidora eléctrica\r\nbata en un tazón grande durante 10 minutos,\r\nhasta que esté lo suficientemente pálido y espeso como para dejar un rastro\r\ncuando se levantan los batidores. Doblar\r\nel chocolate derretido con un metal grande\r\ncuchara, luego raspar en la lata.","Hornee durante 20-25 minutos; la superficie debe estar firme.\r\ne hinchado pero todavía con un ligero bamboleo.\r\nDeje enfriar y luego enfríe durante al menos 3 horas o\r\ndurante la noche, antes de espolvorear con glaseado\r\nazúcar y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12787,8646,'es','Receta de galletas de mantequilla','Hornea estas clásicas galletas de mantequilla para sorprender a la multitud. Solo necesitas cuatro ingredientes, pero puedes mezclarlo con ralladura de limón o naranja, o intentar agregar pistachos picados.','["300 g de mantequilla blanda","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más 4 cucharadas","300 g de harina común","140 g de harina de arroz"]','["Coloque la mantequilla y 140 g de azúcar en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos y bata hasta que quede suave.\r\nIncorpora ambas harinas y una pizca de sal.\r\nluego mezcle hasta que la mezcla se una.","Con las manos, extienda aproximadamente la\r\nMezcle en una bandeja para hornear de 20 x 30 x 4 cm.\r\nCubrir con film transparente y alisar.\r\nhasta que no queden arrugas. Colocar en el\r\nrefrigerador, crudo, durante al menos 30 minutos\r\ny hasta 2 días.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nRetire la película adhesiva y luego marque ligeramente el\r\ngalletas de mantequilla por todas partes con un tenedor. espolvorear\r\ncon el azúcar restante, luego hornee por\r\n20-25 minutos. Dejar enfriar en el molde y luego\r\ncortar en 24 rodajas finas. Las galletas de mantequilla se mantendrán\r\nen un recipiente hermético por hasta 1 semana."]','2026-01-11 12:54:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12788,8648,'es','Pan en cuatro sencillos pasos','Los niños pueden ayudar con esta receta de pan súper sencilla. Usa la harina que prefieras, granera, integral o blanca.','["500 g de harina de granero, integral fuerte o pan blanca (yo usé granero)","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de sal","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de miel clara"]','["Vierte la harina, la levadura y la sal en un bol grande.\r\ny mezclar con las manos. Revuelva 300ml\r\nagua caliente a mano con el aceite y la miel, luego revuelva\r\nen los ingredientes secos para hacer una masa suave.","Colocar la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.\r\nsuperficie y amasar durante 5 minutos, hasta que la masa\r\nya no se siente pegajoso, rociando con un poco\r\nmás harina si la necesitas.","Engrasar el molde y poner la masa en el molde.\r\npresionándolo uniformemente. Poner en una comida de plástico grande.\r\nbolsa y dejar reposar durante 1 hora, hasta que la masa tenga\r\nSubió para llenar la lata y ya no regresa.\r\ncuando lo presionas con el dedo.","Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Hacer\r\nvarios cortes en la parte superior del pan con\r\ncon un cuchillo afilado, luego hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que\r\nel pan ha subido y está dorado. Inclínelo sobre un enfriamiento.\r\nRejilla y golpea la base del pan para comprobarlo.\r\nestá cocido. Debería sonar hueco. Dejar enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12789,8650,'es','pan de soda irlandés','Experimente el sabor de Irlanda con este pan de soda fresco y sencillo','["250 g de harina blanca normal","250 g de harina integral normal","100 g de gachas de avena","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de sal","25 g de mantequilla, cortada en trozos","500 ml de suero de leche"]','["Precalentar el horno a 200C/gas 6/ventilador\r\n180C y espolvorear una bandeja para hornear con harina.\r\nMezclar los ingredientes secos en un tazón grande,\r\nluego frote la mantequilla. Vierta el suero de leche\r\ny mezclarlo rápidamente con un cuchillo de mesa, luego\r\nunir la masa muy ligeramente con\r\nyemas de los dedos (manipúlelo con mucho, mucho cuidado).\r\nAhora dale forma de pan plano y redondo.\r\nMide 20 cm/8 pulgadas de diámetro.","Coloque el pan en la bandeja para hornear y\r\nMarca un centro profundo en la parte superior. (Tradicionalmente,\r\nEsto deja salir a las hadas, pero también ayuda a las\r\npan para que se cocine bien.) Hornee durante 30-35\r\nminutos hasta que suene el fondo del pan\r\nhueco cuando se golpea. Si no está listo después\r\nesta vez, dale la vuelta sobre la bandeja para hornear.\r\nbandeja y hornee por unos minutos más.","Transfiera a una rejilla, cubra con un paño limpio.\r\npaño de cocina (esto mantiene la corteza agradable y suave)\r\ny dejar enfriar. Para servir, irrumpir\r\ncuartos, luego rompa o corte cada cuarto en\r\nla mitad para hacer 8 gajos o rebanadas – o simplemente\r\ncortar a lo ancho. Come muy fresco."]','2026-01-11 12:54:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12790,8652,'es','Galletas de harina de coco','Hornea una tanda de galletas de coco para el molde de galletas. Tienen un delicado sabor a coco y una textura similar a la de un macarrón. Añade chips de chocolate, si quieres, también','["75 g de harina de coco","60 g de aceite de coco, derretido","2 huevos","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní","60 g de azúcar moreno blando","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de chispas de chocolate (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Pon todo en un bol y mezcla bien hasta que esté combinado y tenga una consistencia húmeda similar a la arena.","Forme de 10 a 12 bolas de masa aproximadamente del tamaño de una nuez y colóquelas en la bandeja para hornear a unos centímetros de distancia. Empuje hacia abajo para crear un disco de un par de centímetros de grosor, luego métalo en el horno y hornee durante 12-14 minutos, hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos antes de retirarlo a una rejilla y enfriarlo por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12791,8654,'es','Galletas de molinete en blanco y negro','Las galletas blancas y negras son un clásico entre las galletas navideñas. Puedes hacerlos en forma de tablero de ajedrez o como una hermosa espiral como estas.','["300 g de harina común","100 g de azúcar glas","8 g de azúcar de vainilla o 8 g de azúcar en polvo, más 1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 huevo, más 1 clara para glasear","125 g de mantequilla, blanda","1 cucharada de cacao","1 cucharada de leche"]','["Ponga la harina, el azúcar glas, el azúcar de vainilla, una pizca de sal, el huevo y la mantequilla blanda en una batidora y mezcle. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase brevemente a mano. Corta la masa por la mitad. Envuelva la mitad y enfríe durante una hora. Amasar el cacao y la leche en la otra mitad. Envolver y enfriar durante una hora.","Enrolle cada lote de masa formando un rectángulo (de unos 30 cm x 20 cm) sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada. Cubra la parte superior de una capa con clara de huevo, luego levante el otro color de masa encima y cubra la parte superior con clara de huevo. Enrollar bien como si fuera un panecillo suizo. Envuelva y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 175C/ventilador 155C/gas 3½. Forre 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Cortar la masa en rodajas de unos 5 mm de grosor con un cuchillo afilado. Hornee en tandas durante 10 a 12 minutos, pero no deje que la masa pálida se oscurezca ya que desea mantener el contraste. Dejar enfriar por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12792,8656,'es','Galletas de la noche de las hogueras','Celebra la Noche de las Fogatas con estas lindas galletas. Decora estas galletas otoñales con especias con diseños de fuegos artificiales helados','["75 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","100 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo grande","250 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo, tamizado","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 clara de huevo grande","250 g de azúcar glas tamizada","½ cucharadita de jugo de limón","colorantes alimentarios en gel (usamos azul, amarillo y rojo)","chispas de estrellas (opcional)"]','["Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con un batidor eléctrico durante 4-5 minutos hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Batir el huevo hasta que esté combinado. Agrega la harina, el cacao en polvo, la canela y el jengibre y continúa batiendo hasta que la mezcla forme una masa. Coloque la masa entre dos trozos de papel para hornear y extiéndala hasta obtener un grosor de 6 mm con un rodillo.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Retire la capa superior de pergamino y corte las galletas con un cortador redondo o de estrella de 6 cm. Vuelva a enrollar los restos y continúe cortando galletas hasta que se haya usado toda la masa (debe obtener 20-22, dependiendo del cortador).","Coloque las galletas en una bandeja para hornear grande forrada con papel para hornear, espaciándolas al menos 2 cm (es posible que necesite dos bandejas para hornear). Hornee durante 7-10 minutos hasta que los bordes estén ligeramente dorados. Deje enfriar en la bandeja para hornear durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Una vez frío, haz el glaseado. Batir la clara de huevo con una batidora eléctrica hasta que empiece a hacer espuma, aproximadamente 1 min. Agregue el azúcar glas, 1 cucharada a la vez, batiendo continuamente a velocidad media-alta hasta que se combinen. Agregue el jugo de limón y bata hasta obtener picos rígidos, aproximadamente 5 minutos; el glaseado debe estar brillante. Agregue más azúcar glas si es necesario para ayudar a que se endurezca.","Para decorar, divide el glaseado en tazones y colorea con los colorantes alimentarios en gel (dejamos un poco de glaseado blanco, luego coloreamos tres tazones con azul, amarillo y rojo). Coloque el glaseado de color en mangas pasteleras separadas equipadas con pequeñas boquillas redondas (o corte los extremos). Coloque líneas en las galletas para crear patrones o remolinos en forma de \"ráfagas\" similares a fuegos artificiales. Mientras el glaseado está húmedo, decora con chispas de estrellas, si lo deseas. Deje reposar un poco y luego sirva. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:54:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12793,8658,'es','Galletas de cuchara finlandesas','Hornea estas delicadas galletas rellenas de mermelada en Navidad. Son una tradición festiva finlandesa y el secreto de su delicioso sabor a nuez es la mantequilla marrón.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal","125 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de azúcar de vainilla o 1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","300 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","75 g de mermelada de frambuesa casera o de buena calidad","50 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Calienta el horno a 195C/175C ventilador/gas 51/2 y forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear.","Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola a fuego lento y cocine durante 10 minutos, revolviendo regularmente, hasta que se dore y huela ligeramente a nuez. Vigila el color ya que la mantequilla puede quemarse rápidamente. Vierta inmediatamente la mantequilla en un tazón grande, agregue el azúcar y la vainilla y mezcle bien. Dejar enfriar un poco y luego colar la harina y el bicarbonato.","Use una cucharadita grande para sacar trozos de la mezcla y moldearlos, empujando ligeramente hacia abajo para aplanar la parte superior y alisando el exceso de los lados con un dedo. Retire la cuchara y colóquela en la bandeja para hornear preparada, con el lado plano hacia abajo. Repita con la mezcla restante. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Unte una pequeña cantidad de mermelada en el lado plano de cada galleta. Sándwich con otra galleta. Vierta el azúcar en un plato y luego enrolle cada una de las galletas para cubrirlas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12794,4058,'es','farlo de soda','Celebre el Día de San Patricio con soda farls: un pan de soda irlandés aplanado en un círculo y dividido en cuatro "farls". Comer caliente con mantequilla.','["250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","½ cucharadita de sal","1 cucharadita de azúcar","1 cucharadita colmada de bicarbonato de sodio","225 ml de suero de leche"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón grande y agregue la sal, el azúcar y el bicarbonato. Haga un hueco en el centro y vierta el suero de leche, luego revuelva rápidamente para combinar. Vierta sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase brevemente. Enrolle hasta formar un círculo de aproximadamente 20 cm y córtelo en cuartos.","Calienta una sartén o sartén de base pesada a fuego medio-bajo. Agregue los farls y cocine durante 8 a 10 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que estén dorados y bien cocidos. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar los farls en la sartén durante 10 minutos. Abrir y comer caliente con mantequilla."]','2026-01-11 12:54:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12795,5964,'es','Galletas de cardamomo (no se comen)','Disfrute de estas tradicionales galletas indias de cardamomo con una taza de masala chai humeante. Los Nan khatai se destacan por su textura quebradiza y su sabor rico en mantequilla.','["3 vainas de cardamomo verde","40 g de azúcar glas","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","70 g de harina blanca con levadura","25 gramos de harina","25 g de sémola","24 almendras con piel o pistachos picados"]','["Partir las vainas de cardamomo y quitar las semillas. Machaca las semillas hasta convertirlas en polvo en un mortero y con 1 cucharadita de azúcar.","Batir la mantequilla hasta que esté suave, luego agregar gradualmente el resto del azúcar glas y el cardamomo molido. Continúe batiendo hasta que esté suave y cremoso, aproximadamente 10 minutos.","Tamizar la harina y la harina de garbanzos en un bol y batir la sémola y una pizca de sal. Agregue la mantequilla y el azúcar en dos incrementos. Con cuidado, junte todo hasta obtener una masa suave.","Enrolle la masa en bolitas del tamaño de una canica con las manos y colóquelas, espaciadas, en bandejas para hornear forradas con papel para hornear.","Aplana ligeramente la parte superior de cada bola y presiona una almendra entera o unos pistachos picados en el medio de cada una. Enfriar durante 20 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Hornea las galletas durante unos 20 minutos o hasta que estén doradas. Dejar enfriar antes de guardar en una lata hermética."]','2026-01-11 12:54:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12796,8660,'es','florentinos','Disfruta de estos clásicos florentinos en época navideña. Joyas con cerezas, pistachos y recubiertas de chocolate, estas galletas son el regalo festivo perfecto.','["50 g de mantequilla salada","50 g de azúcar mascabado light","50 g de almíbar dorado","50 g de harina común","50 g de cerezas glaseadas, picadas","75 g de almendras laminadas","50 g de pistachos picados","2 naranjas, ralladas","175 g de chocolate negro"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C/gas 4. Forre dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Derrita la mantequilla, el azúcar y el almíbar dorado en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento, revolviendo con frecuencia. Retirar del fuego y batir la harina, luego añadir las cerezas, las almendras laminadas, los pistachos y la ralladura de naranja.","Coloque 10 cucharadas planas de la mezcla sobre las bandejas para hornear, dejando espacio para que se esparzan. Deberá hacerlo en lotes. Hornee por 10 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Deje enfriar durante 2 minutos hasta que esté lo suficientemente firme como para colocarlo sobre una rejilla. Dejar enfriar por completo. Repita con la mezcla restante.","Derrita el chocolate en un bol sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo o en el microondas en ráfagas de 30 segundos. Dar la vuelta a los florentinos sobre la rejilla. Vierta chocolate sobre la base de cada florentino y extiéndalo suavemente hasta los bordes. Cuando el chocolate esté lo suficientemente firme como para mantener su forma, use un tenedor para dibujar líneas onduladas a lo largo del chocolate. Deje reposar y luego guárdelo en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:54:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12797,8662,'es','Galletas arrugadas de chocolate y naranja','Intente hornear estas sencillas galletas arrugadas con chocolate y naranja con los niños. Con una capa de azúcar de naranja, son muy divertidos de preparar (¡y comer!)','["60 g de cacao en polvo tamizado","230 g de azúcar en polvo","60ml de aceite vegetal","2 naranjas grandes, ralladas","2 huevos grandes","180 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","unas gotas de colorante alimentario naranja, o utilice rojo y amarillo","40 g de azúcar glas"]','["Mezclar el cacao, 200 g de azúcar en polvo y el aceite junto con la mayor parte de la ralladura de naranja. Incorpora los huevos uno a la vez, hasta que estén completamente combinados.","Mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear y una pizca de sal en un recipiente aparte, luego agregue a la mezcla de cacao y mezcle hasta formar una masa suave. Si la masa se siente muy suave, transfiérala al refrigerador y déjela enfriar durante 1 hora.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Vierta el azúcar en polvo restante en un tazón pequeño. Añade una gota de colorante alimentario y revuélvelo con el azúcar hasta que tenga todo color; añade más si quieres un color más fuerte. Agregue el azúcar glas hasta que todo el azúcar adquiera color, luego agregue la ralladura de naranja restante.","Forme una bola con una cucharadita colmada de masa, luego enrolle el azúcar para cubrirla; es posible que tenga que presionar el azúcar, especialmente si ha enfriado la masa. Si el azúcar no se pega bien, enrolla las bolitas de masa entre tus manos hasta que la mezcla se caliente un poco. Repita con el resto de la masa, luego colóquela, espaciada uniformemente, en la bandeja para hornear.","Hornee en el centro del horno durante 10 minutos; se arrugarán mientras se cocinan. Las galletas se endurecerán a medida que se enfríen, así que no las cocines demasiado. Pasar a una rejilla y dejar enfriar. Se conservará durante cuatro días en una lata de galletas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12798,8664,'es','Galletas arrugadas y espolvoreadas con dulce de chocolate','Haga un lote de estas divertidas galletas arrugadas y espolvoreadas con dulce de chocolate. A los niños les encantará ayudar, ¡especialmente decorando con chispas!','["60 g de cacao en polvo tamizado","200 g de azúcar en polvo","60ml de aceite vegetal","2 huevos grandes","180 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 bote pequeño de chispitas"]','["Mezclar el cacao, el azúcar en polvo y el aceite. Incorpora los huevos uno a la vez, hasta que estén completamente combinados.","Mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear y una pizca de sal en un recipiente aparte, luego agregue a la mezcla de cacao y mezcle hasta formar una masa suave. Si la masa se siente muy suave, transfiérala al refrigerador y déjela enfriar durante 1 hora.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Coloca las chispas en un plato poco profundo. Forme una bola con una cucharadita colmada de masa y luego enrolle las chispas para cubrirlas; es posible que tenga que presionar las chispas, especialmente si ha enfriado la masa. Si no se pegan bien, enrolla las bolas de masa entre tus manos hasta que la mezcla se caliente un poco. Repita con el resto de la masa, luego colóquela, espaciada uniformemente, en la bandeja para hornear.","Hornee en el centro del horno durante 10 minutos; se arrugarán mientras se cocinan. Las galletas se endurecerán a medida que se enfríen, así que no las cocines demasiado. Pasar a una rejilla y dejar enfriar. Se conservará durante cuatro días en una lata de galletas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12799,8666,'es','Galletas arrugadas con dulce de chocolate','Utilice ingredientes de la despensa para hacer estas deliciosas galletas arrugadas con dulce de chocolate. Son el compañero perfecto para un café como merienda.','["60 g de cacao en polvo tamizado","200 g de azúcar en polvo","60ml de aceite vegetal","2 huevos grandes","180 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","70 g de azúcar glas"]','["Mezclar el cacao, el azúcar en polvo y el aceite. Agrega los huevos uno a la vez, batiendo hasta que estén completamente combinados.","Mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear y una pizca de sal en un recipiente aparte, luego agregue a la mezcla de cacao y mezcle hasta que se forme una masa suave. Si se siente suave, transfiéralo al refrigerador y déjelo enfriar durante 1 hora. Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Vierta el azúcar glas en un plato poco profundo. Forme una bola con una cucharadita colmada de masa y luego enrolle el azúcar para cubrirla. Repita con el resto de la masa, luego colóquela, espaciada uniformemente, en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear.","Hornee en el centro del horno durante 10 minutos; se endurecerán a medida que se enfríen. Pasar a una rejilla y dejar enfriar. Se conservará durante cuatro días en una lata de galletas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12800,8668,'es','Galletas de mantequilla de maní con doble chocolate','¿Qué podría ser mejor con un vaso de leche fría que una galleta de mantequilla de maní tibia y pegajosa? Estas delicias de chocolate están cubiertas con maní picado crujiente','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada a temperatura ambiente","100 g de azúcar moreno claro","100 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo batido","150 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","¼ cucharadita de sal","200 g de chocolate con leche, 150 g cortados en trozos y 50 g derretidos para rociar","75 g de mantequilla de maní (crujiente o suave está bien)","un puñado de maní salado, picado en trozos grandes","leche para servir, opcional"]','["Calienta el horno a 180c/160 ventilador/termostato de gas 4 y forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel pergamino. Con una batidora de alimentos o una batidora eléctrica, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que quede suave y esponjoso. Agregue el huevo y bata para combinar, luego agregue la harina, el cacao en polvo, la sal y los trozos de chocolate hasta que estén completamente incorporados. Con una cuchara, mezcle la mantequilla de maní con la masa para galletas.","Coloque la masa en 12 galletas grandes y colóquelas en las dos bandejas con una cuchara de postre, dejando suficiente espacio entre cada galleta a medida que se esparcen. Hornee en el horno durante 9-10 minutos hasta que aún esté suave y derretido en el medio. Parecerán poco cocidas, pero se endurecerán una vez que se enfríen. Rocíe sobre el chocolate con leche derretido y cubra con unos cacahuetes picados y una pizca de sal marina en escamas. Servir con un vaso de leche para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12801,8670,'es','galletas florentinas','Le hemos dado al clásico florentino una base de galleta cubierta de chocolate para que sean perfectos para mojar. Disfruta o regala algo hecho en casa','["175 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, blanda","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","225 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","¼ cucharadita de canela molida","50 g de mantequilla","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","50 g de almíbar dorado","½ cucharadita de sal","50 g de harina común","75 g de cerezas glaseadas, picadas","75 g de almendras laminadas","150 g de chocolate amargo, picado"]','["Para hacer las galletas, poner en un bol la mantequilla, el azúcar y la vainilla y batir con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que estén cremosas. Agrega la harina y la canela y combina con una espátula para hacer una masa suave. Forme una bola, envuélvala en film transparente y déjela enfriar durante al menos 1 hora.","En un cazo derretir la mantequilla, el azúcar, el almíbar dorado y la sal. Retire del fuego y agregue la harina, luego agregue las cerezas y las almendras. Dejar enfriar y endurecer un poco. Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre una bandeja para hornear con pergamino.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada y extiéndala hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de £1. Con un cortador de galletas acanalado de 6 cm, elimine tantos círculos como pueda, luego aplaste los recortes, vuelva a enrollarlos y elimine un poco más. Transfiera a la bandeja para hornear y vierta un poco de la mezcla florentina en cada galleta hasta que se acabe. Hornee en el estante del medio durante 12 a 15 minutos hasta que las galletas estén doradas y la cobertura se derrita. Dejar enfriar en la sábana durante al menos 15 minutos.","Mientras las galletas se enfrían, derrita el chocolate en un recipiente pequeño resistente al calor suspendido sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento, o en ráfagas cortas en el microondas. Revuelva cada 30 segundos aproximadamente para asegurarse de que no se queme. Sumerja cada galleta aproximadamente un tercio del camino en el chocolate, luego vuelva a colocarla en la bandeja para que cuaje. Es posible que tengas que echar el chocolate sobre los últimos. Se conservará hasta por cuatro días en un recipiente sellado."]','2026-01-11 12:54:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12802,8672,'es','remolinos vieneses','Estas galletas elegantes y mantecosas pueden parecer muy impresionantes, pero son sorprendentemente fáciles de hacer. Sumérjalo en chocolate para darle un toque extra dulce','["200 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, blanda","50 g de azúcar glas","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","170 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","50 g de mermelada de frambuesa o mermelada de fresa"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Ponga la mantequilla y el azúcar glas en un tazón grande y bata con una batidora eléctrica durante unos 5 minutos hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega el extracto de vainilla y vuelve a batir hasta incorporar por completo.","Tamice la harina, la maicena y el polvo para hornear e incorpórelo a la mezcla con una espátula hasta que se combinen (la masa debe tener una consistencia pegajosa). Vierta la masa en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla grande en forma de estrella. Si no cabe toda la mezcla hacerlo en 2 tandas.","Coloque círculos en espiral de 5 cm de diámetro en 2 bandejas para hornear, asegurándose de que haya espacios de 3 cm entre cada espiral.","Hornee durante 10 a 12 minutos, cambiando las bandejas a la mitad del tiempo de cocción para que las galletas se horneen uniformemente, hasta que estén doradas y bien cocidas. Deje enfriar en las bandejas para hornear durante unos minutos, luego transfiéralo a rejillas.","Mientras las galletas se enfrían, prepara el relleno. Coloque la mantequilla blanda en un tazón grande y agregue el azúcar glas. Mezcle inicialmente con una cuchara de madera y luego cambie a batidoras eléctricas o un batidor para que la crema de mantequilla quede esponjosa y suave. Agrega el extracto de vainilla y bate una vez más para combinar. Transfiera la crema de mantequilla a una manga pastelera y corte el extremo.","Voltee las galletas para que su lado plano quede hacia arriba, luego coloque crema de mantequilla sobre la mitad de las galletas y esparza un poco de mermelada sobre el resto. Sandwich una galleta cubierta de mermelada junto con una de crema de mantequilla y repita hasta que se acaben todas las galletas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12803,8674,'es','Galletas de avena y avellanas','Suaves y ligeramente masticables, estas galletas de avena contienen jarabe de manzana y arce en lugar de azúcar. Están repletas de avellanas, que son una buena fuente de vitaminas y minerales.','["50 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","2 cucharadas de jarabe de arce","1 manzana de postre, sin pelar y rallada gruesa (necesitas 85 g)","1 cucharadita de canela","50 g de pasas","50 g de gachas de avena","50 g de harina de espelta","40 g de avellanas sin blanquear, cortadas en rodajas gruesas","1 huevo"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrase ligeramente una bandeja para hornear antiadherente (o forre una bandeja para hornear normal con papel para hornear). Vierta la mantequilla y el almíbar en una sartén pequeña antiadherente y derrita, luego agregue la manzana y cocine, revolviendo, a fuego medio hasta que se ablande, aproximadamente de 6 a 7 minutos. Agrega la canela y las pasas.","Mezcla en un bol la avena, la harina de espelta y las avellanas, vierte la mezcla de manzana, luego añade el huevo y bate todo muy bien.","Vierta en la bandeja para hornear, bien espaciados para formar 9 montículos, luego presione suavemente para formar discos. Hornee durante 18-20 minutos hasta que esté dorado, luego enfríe sobre una rejilla. Se conservará durante 3 días en un recipiente hermético o 6 semanas en el congelador."]','2026-01-11 12:54:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12804,8676,'es','Galletas de conejo blanco','Estas adorables galletas de conejito saltarán del plato más rápido de lo que puedes hornearlas. Son una gran actividad de Pascua para niños o un regalo muy especial.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","400 g de harina común","280 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","una pizca de sal","½ cucharadita de crémor tártaro","600 g de azúcar glas","Paquete de 170g de coco rallado","gel colorante alimentario rosa","15 mini malvaviscos","1 cortador de galletas con forma de cabeza de conejo.","1 cortador de galletas redondo de 7 cm.","1 cortador de galletas redondo de 3 cm."]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Frote ligeramente la mantequilla y la harina con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fresco.","Mezclar el azúcar y el huevo en otro bol con unas varillas y cuando esté muy bien combinado y líquido añadirlo a la mezcla de harina.","Agrega todos los demás ingredientes y aplástalo con las manos, sigue trabajando la masa hasta que esté suave, tersa y se una en una sola pieza.","Extiende la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada con un rodillo hasta que tenga aproximadamente medio centímetro de espesor. Cortar en formas. Hicimos 15 cabezas de conejo, 15 círculos grandes y 30 minicírculos.","Coloque las galletas en bandejas para hornear forradas con papel de hornear y hornee en tandas durante unos 15 minutos (o hasta que estén ligeramente doradas en los bordes).","Déjelos enfriar en el molde durante unos minutos antes de transferirlos con cuidado a una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo y queden crujientes.","Mientras las galletas se enfrían, mezcle suficiente agua fría con el azúcar glas para crear un glaseado espeso. Coloque una cuarta parte del glaseado en otro bol y agregue una cantidad muy pequeña de colorante alimentario en gel rosa. Transfiera tanto el glaseado blanco como el glaseado rosado a mangas pasteleras desechables y corte el extremo para hacer una boquilla muy pequeña en el glaseado rosado y una más ancha en el glaseado blanco.","Coloque glaseado blanco sobre las galletas pequeñas y redondas y déjelas secar. Luego, coloque glaseado blanco para cubrir todas las galletas circulares grandes y las galletas de conejo (sea bastante moderado y extiéndalo con el dorso de una cuchara; no es necesario que quede limpio en estas). Una vez que hayas glaseado cada uno, espolvorea generosamente con coco rallado antes de que se seque el glaseado.","Tome el glaseado rosa y úselo para crear patas en los círculos más pequeños, luego pegue 2 de ellos en cada uno de los círculos grandes usando glaseado como pegamento. Con el glaseado que te queda, cubre los malvaviscos y cúbrelos también con coco antes de pegarlos en el medio de los círculos más grandes para crear una cola esponjosa. Deje reposar completamente durante unos 15-20 minutos y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:54:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12805,8678,'es','Galletas de mantequilla de flores azucaradas','Estas delicadas galletas de mantequilla son un regalo perfecto. Si le das un toque floral con agua de rosas, también puedes utilizar extracto de flor de naranjo o lavanda seca.','["250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","140 g de mantequilla fría ligeramente salada, cortada en cubos pequeños","85 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","½ cucharadita de agua de rosas (opcional)","surtido de 15-20 flores comestibles, sin rociar (usamos pensamientos, violas, prímulas y pétalos de rosa; consulte el consejo)","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1 clara de huevo batida","300 g de pasta colorante alimentaria de azúcar glas real (nosotros usamos amarillo, morado y rosa)","polvo brillante comestible (opcional)","pinzas","1 pincel pequeño","cortador de galletas de 8 cm","1 manga pastelera desechable","1 boquilla para escritura fina","papel de seda y una bonita caja, para envolver las galletas","Primero, verifique que las flores que haya recogido de su jardín sean comestibles (visitrhs.org.uk si no está seguro). Si va a comprar las flores, verifique que no estén rociadas (orgánicas) y que no contengan productos químicos. Para comprar flores ya cristalizadas, pruebeeatmyflowers.co.uk."]','["Retire los tallos y las hojas de las flores pequeñas, como las violas o los pensamientos, y separe con cuidado las rosas para separar los pétalos. Coloque una hoja de papel para hornear en su superficie de trabajo. Espolvorea el azúcar en polvo sobre un platillo y luego bate ligeramente la clara de huevo en un tazón pequeño. Sosteniendo una flor o un pétalo con unas pinzas, utiliza un pincel pequeño para pintar ambos lados con clara de huevo. Vierta el azúcar, luego sacuda el exceso y colóquelo sobre el pergamino. Repita con los pétalos o flores restantes. Déjalo secar durante 3 horas o toda la noche si puedes. Se mantendrán en un recipiente hermético hasta por 1 mes, pero su color puede comenzar a desvanecerse después de unas semanas.","Vierta la harina en un tazón grande y agregue la mantequilla. Use las yemas de los dedos para frotar la mantequilla con la harina hasta obtener una textura húmeda y quebradiza. Vierta el azúcar y mezcle suavemente con las yemas de los dedos. Batir la vainilla, el agua de rosas y las yemas de huevo en un tazón pequeño con un tenedor, luego rociar la mezcla sobre la harina mantecosa. Mezcle nuevamente, aplastando las migajas para formar una masa. Si la mezcla se desmorona un poco, rocíe 1-2 cucharaditas de agua fría y luego mezcle nuevamente. Vierta sobre la superficie de trabajo y amase muy brevemente hasta que la masa se vea uniforme, sin vetas de huevo. Envuélvalo en film transparente, forme un disco redondo y déjelo enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre dos bandejas para hornear grandes con papel para hornear. Saca la masa del frigorífico; si está muy firme, déjala a temperatura ambiente durante 15 minutos para que se ablande. Espolvoree ligeramente la superficie de trabajo con harina, desenvuelva la masa y extiéndala hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de £1. Saca discos de 8 cm con el lado estriado de un cortador de galletas y transfiérelos a las bandejas para hornear. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos, intercambiando las bandejas a mitad de la cocción. Una vez ligeramente doradas y firmes, retiramos las galletas del horno. Deje enfriar en las bandejas durante 10 minutos o hasta que esté lo suficientemente estable como para transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mezclar el azúcar glas con suficiente agua para hacer un glaseado espeso. Divide el glaseado en tantos tazones como colores quieras usar y tiñe cada uno de un tono pastel con una gota de colorante alimentario. Transfiera la mitad de uno de los glaseados a una manga pastelera desechable equipada con una boquilla de escritura fina. Coloque un anillo alrededor del exterior de la galleta y déjela secar. Continúe hasta que haya glaseado un tercio de las galletas (si está usando tres colores), luego pase al siguiente color y transfiera el glaseado sobrante a su recipiente original. Deje secar las galletas durante 10-15 minutos.","Agregue 2-3 cucharaditas de agua a cada glaseado para que quede un poco más líquido. Vierta el glaseado sobre las galletas, haciendo coincidir el color con los aros. Haga que el glaseado inunde la superficie acercándolo hacia los bordes con la cuchara; no sea demasiado generoso con el glaseado, ya que puede derramarse cuando agregue las flores y los pétalos. Ahora puedes espolvorear la superficie de cada galleta con un poco de polvo brillante, si lo deseas, y luego cubrir con las flores. Deje reposar las galletas durante al menos 1 hora antes de envolverlas en papel de seda en una bonita caja. Se conservará hasta por 1 semana."]','2026-01-11 12:54:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12806,8680,'es','galletas de la fortuna','Llene galletas de la fortuna caseras con mensajes personalizados para un regalo personalizado, ideal para cualquier ocasión, como el Año Nuevo chino, Navidad, Día de San Valentín, cumpleaños y bodas.','["2 claras de huevo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","100 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","100 g de azúcar en polvo","1½ cucharada de semillas de sésamo negro"]','["Precalienta el horno a 180C/160 ventilador/gas 4 y cubre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear, o usa una bandeja para hornear de silicona. Escribe o imprime fortunas en papel de 6 cm de largo por 1 cm de ancho.","Ponga las claras de huevo, la vainilla, el extracto de almendras, el aceite y 2 cucharaditas de agua fría en un bol y bata con un batidor eléctrico hasta que esté espumoso, 20-30 segundos. Mida la harina, la maicena, el azúcar y una buena pizca de sal en un bol, luego tamice con la mezcla de clara de huevo. Batir todo hasta obtener una consistencia suave, parecida a una masa. Enfríe la mezcla durante 1 hora.","Luego, ponga una cucharada de la mezcla en la bandeja para hornear preparada. Engrase una cuchara de metal y luego use el dorso para hacer girar la mezcla hasta formar un círculo de 8 a 10 cm. Repita con otra cucharada de la mezcla para crear 2 galletas. Asegúrate de que haya espacio entre cada galleta ya que se esparcirán en el horno. Lo mejor es hornear sólo 2 o 3 galletas a la vez, ya que tendrás que darles forma mientras estén calientes. Espolvorea 1 de las galletas con semillas de sésamo negro, luego hornea durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que los bordes de las galletas se doren.","Retire las galletas una a la vez con una espátula una vez que estén fuera del horno. Quieres que aún estén suaves para poder darles forma y trabajar rápidamente. Dale la vuelta a la galleta para que las semillas de sésamo queden boca abajo y pon la fortuna en el medio del círculo. Dobla el círculo por la mitad para asegurar la fortuna y junta los 2 bordes para sellar. Coloca la galleta en el borde de una taza o vaso y tira muy suavemente de las 2 esquinas hacia abajo para obtener la forma de galleta de la fortuna. Mantenga durante 10 segundos, luego transfiera las galletas a moldes para muffins para que mantengan su forma mientras se enfrían por completo. Repita con la mezcla de galletas restante."]','2026-01-11 12:54:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12807,8682,'es','Coco agradable','Mejora la clásica galleta Nice con glaseado de crema de coco y cobertura de coco rallado; también son veganas','["1 cucharada de linaza","400 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","200 g de aceite de coco","50 g de coco rallado","280 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 cucharadas de crema de coco","200-225 g de azúcar glas","50 g de coco rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner las semillas de lino en un tazón pequeño y agregar 3 cucharadas de agua. Dejar en remojo durante 5-10 minutos. Mientras tanto, frote la harina y el aceite de coco en un tazón grande hasta que el aceite de coco esté bien distribuido y la mezcla parezca pan rallado fresco. Agrega el coco rallado y reserva.","Vierta las semillas de lino, junto con el agua de remojo, en el recipiente de un mini procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que estén espumosas. Agrega el azúcar y bate nuevamente hasta que esté bien mezclado. Vierta la mezcla de linaza y azúcar en la harina y el aceite de coco y amase hasta formar una bola de masa. Si la masa se siente demasiado seca y puede agrietarse al extenderla, agregue un poco de agua, 1 cucharadita a la vez.","Transfiera la masa a una superficie enharinada y extiéndala hasta obtener aproximadamente el grosor de una moneda de £1. Córtelo en rectángulos de 7 cm x 4 cm y colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear grande forrada con papel para hornear; asegúrese de dejar 2-3 cm entre cada galleta. Hornee en tandas durante 10-12 minutos o hasta que empiecen a dorarse en los bordes. Transfiera a una rejilla con una espátula o una rodaja de pescado y déjelo enfriar por completo antes de decorar.","Para decorar, mezcla la crema de coco y suficiente azúcar glas para hacer una pasta espesa. Transfiera a una manga pastelera y haga una línea delgada alrededor del borde exterior de una galleta, luego sumerja el glaseado en el coco desecado. Repita con todas las galletas. Coloque la palabra \"NICE\" en el medio de cada galleta y luego déjela reposar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12808,8684,'es','Dodgers con mermelada de sorbete de limón','La galleta de mermelada favorita de todos se renueva con sabor: sándwich con cuajada de limón y espolvoreado con sorbete para darle más sabor.','["175 g de mantequilla fría ligeramente salada, en cubitos","250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de azúcar glas","ralladura de 1 limón, más 1-2 cucharaditas de jugo","1 yema de huevo grande","Paquete de 23 g de sorbete (yo usé Dip Dab)","75 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, a temperatura ambiente","250 g de azúcar glas","100 g de cuajada de limón"]','["En un procesador de alimentos, bata la mantequilla, la harina y una pizca de sal hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino. Agrega el azúcar y la ralladura de limón y vuelve a batir. Agrega el jugo de limón y la yema de huevo y mezcla hasta que se formen grumos de masa alrededor de las cuchillas. Continúe mezclando, usando el botón de pulso, hasta que se formen bolas de masa más grandes. Vierta la mezcla sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase brevemente para formar una bola suave; no la trabaje demasiado o quedará dura. Corta la masa en 2 trozos iguales y forma discos planos, luego envuélvelos en film transparente y déjalos enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos. Forre 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear.","Saca la masa del refrigerador 15 minutos antes de que estés listo para enrollarla. Enharine ligeramente la superficie de trabajo y el rodillo. Desenvuelva 1 trozo de masa y extiéndalo hasta obtener el grosor de\r\nuna pieza de 50 peniques. Utilice un cortador de 6 cm para estampar los discos (debe obtener unos 15) y transfiéralo a una bandeja para hornear con una espátula.","Desenvolver y extender la masa restante hasta obtener el mismo espesor. Sella 15 discos y transfiérelos a la segunda bandeja para hornear. Utilice un cortador redondo pequeño (de aproximadamente 1 cm) o el extremo de una boquilla para hacer agujeros en el centro de 15 galletas. Cubra sin apretar las bandejas con film transparente y déjelas enfriar durante 15 minutos. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Hornea las galletas durante 15 minutos, cambiando las bandejas a la mitad. Retirar del horno, dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos, luego transferir a una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Coloca en un bol la mantequilla, el azúcar y la mitad de la cuajada de limón. Triture y luego mezcle con un batidor de mano eléctrico. Transfiera a una manga pastelera y corte el extremo, haciendo una abertura de 1 cm. Coloque la cuajada de limón restante en otra manga pastelera y corte el extremo para hacer un agujero un poco más pequeño. Espolvorea un poco de sorbete sobre las galletas con un agujero en el centro.","Coloque gotas de relleno de limón en forma de anillo sobre cada galleta entera, dejando espacio en el centro para rellenar con cuajada de limón. Llene los centros, luego coloque una galleta espolvoreada con sorbete encima de cada uno. Conservar en una lata de galletas durante 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12809,8686,'es','galletas anzac','Estas galletas icónicas se hicieron originalmente para enviarlas a los ANZAC (Cuerpo del Ejército de Australia y Nueva Zelanda) que sirven en Gallipoli.','["85 g de gachas de avena","85 g de coco rallado","100 g de harina común","100 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de mantequilla, más mantequilla extra para engrasar","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Poner en un bol la avena, el coco, la harina y el azúcar. Derretir la mantequilla en un pequeño\r\nsartén y agregue el almíbar dorado. Agregue el bicarbonato de sodio a 2 cucharadas de agua hirviendo, luego agregue el\r\nmezcla de almíbar dorado y mantequilla.","Haga un hueco en medio de los ingredientes secos y vierta la mezcla de mantequilla y almíbar dorado. Revuelva suavemente\r\npara incorporar los ingredientes secos.","Coloque cucharadas de postre de la mezcla en bandejas para hornear untadas con mantequilla, a una distancia de aproximadamente 2,5 cm / 1 pulgada para dejar espacio para untar. Hornee en tandas durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Transfiera a una rejilla para que se enfríe."]','2026-01-11 12:54:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12810,8688,'es','Galletas de pistacho y arándanos','Estas crujientes galletas de frutas y nueces seguramente serán las favoritas de la familia: prepárelas con anticipación y congélelas o envuélvalas para obtener el regalo casero perfecto.','["175 g de mantequilla, blanda","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","225 g de harina común","75 g de pistachos","75 g de arándanos secos"]','["Mezclar la mantequilla, el azúcar y el extracto de vainilla con una cuchara de madera. agregue la harina, luego agregue los pistachos y los arándanos; es posible que necesite meter las manos en esta etapa para unir la mezcla como una masa. Corta la masa por la mitad y dale forma a cada mitad de un tronco de unos 5 cm de ancho. Envuélvalo en film transparente y luego enfríelo durante 1 hora o congélelo hasta por 3 meses.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Cortar los troncos en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor, colocarlos en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear y hornear durante 12-15 minutos. Dejar enfriar completamente en la bandeja."]','2026-01-11 12:54:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12811,8690,'es','Galletas de naranja, avena y pasas','Las galletas no tienen por qué ser un placer culpable: estas delicias de Leiths School of Food and Wine son súper saludables','["100 g de mantequilla a temperatura ambiente","1 huevo","50 g de plátano maduro triturado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro","½ cucharadita de ralladura de naranja","100 g de harina integral","¼ cucharadita de sal","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de copos de avena","25 g de coco rallado","50 g de nueces picadas","75 g de pasas o chispas de chocolate amargo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nBatir la mantequilla y el azúcar\r\nhasta que esté bien mezclado y suave.\r\nIncorpora poco a poco el plátano, la vainilla\r\nextracto y huevo. Añade el\r\nentusiasmo. Mezclar bien con una cuchara de madera.\r\nhasta que esté bien mezclado.","En un bol grande, mezcle la harina, la sal,\r\nlevadura en polvo, avena, coco,\r\nnueces y pasas o chocolate\r\npatatas fritas. Agregue los ingredientes secos a\r\nhúmedo y mezcle bien hasta que quede\r\nSe forma una masa espesa. Forrar una hornada\r\nhoja con pergamino. gota colmada\r\ncucharadas en la sábana, dejando un espacio de 5 cm.\r\n(2 pulgadas) de espacio alrededor de cada uno, y\r\npresione ligeramente hacia abajo. Hornee por 15-20\r\nminutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Fresco."]','2026-01-11 12:54:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12812,8692,'es','galletas de cumpleaños','Estas galletas anulares son perfectas para fiestas y quedan bien en cualquier forma, pide que los niños te ayuden','["250 g de harina blanca normal","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","175 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente, en cubos","2 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","250 g de azúcar glas blanca","1 cucharada de conserva de fresa (nosotros usamos St Dalfour)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4.  \r\nPoner la harina, el azúcar y la mantequilla en un alimento. \r\nprocesador. Batir hasta que se forme la mezcla. \r\nmigajas, luego presione un poco más hasta  \r\nforma una bola.","Extienda una hoja grande de papel para hornear. \r\nsobre la superficie de trabajo y voltear la masa \r\nsobre ello. Espolvorear con un poco de harina y extender hasta \r\naproximadamente del grosor de dos monedas de £1. Sello \r\nRealiza 24 rondas usando una ronda estriada de 5 cm. \r\ncortador, luego corte los centros con el extremo \r\nde una boquilla de tubería. Pele con cuidado el resto de \r\nla mezcla lejos de las formas estampadas. \r\nColóquelo en bandejas para hornear y hornee por 10 minutos. \r\nhasta que esté dorado pálido. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Pon la cuajada de limón en un bol con 2 cucharadas. \r\nagua hirviendo y mezclar hasta que quede suave. tamiz en \r\n175 g de azúcar glas; mezclar para hacer \r\nun glaseado suave. Poner la crema de fruta de fresa. \r\nen otro bol y agregue 2 cucharaditas de agua hirviendo, \r\nmezcle, luego tamice el azúcar glas restante.","Vierta el glaseado de limón sobre las galletas. \r\nluego rocíe o coloque sobre el glaseado del meñique. salir \r\ndejar reposar durante al menos 20 minutos. Se mantendrá hasta \r\n2 días en una lata hermética, más tiempo si se deja sin hielo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12813,8694,'es','Galletas de avena ricas','Galletas de avena, masticables y picantes: listas en menos de una hora y excelentes para la hora del té','["175 g de mantequilla","175 g de azúcar demerara","100 g de almíbar dorado","85 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","250 g de gachas de avena","1 cucharadita de canela molida","100 g cada uno de orejones listos para comer, picados y jengibre de tallo, picado","Paquete de 75-80 g de guindas secas","2 cucharadas de agua hirviendo","1 huevo mediano, batido"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Forra varias bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear o bandejas antiadherentes. Calentar la mantequilla, el azúcar y el almíbar dorado en una cacerola grande a fuego medio hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Agrega la harina, el bicarbonato, la avena, la canela, los frutos secos y el jengibre, luego el agua y finalmente el huevo. Dejar enfriar hasta que sea fácil de manipular.","Con las manos humedecidas, forme 18 bolas grandes con la mezcla, luego aplánelas sobre las bandejas para hornear (dejando suficiente espacio para untar) y hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que estén doradas. (Esto dará como resultado una galleta suave y masticable. Para obtener una más crujiente, reduzca el fuego a 160 °C/ventilador 140 °C/gas 3 y hornee durante 5 a 10 minutos más).","Deje que las galletas se enfríen brevemente en las bandejas, luego levántelas y colóquelas en una rejilla para enfriar. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético, separado con papel para hornear, hasta por 1 semana."]','2026-01-11 12:54:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12814,7690,'es','Galletas de vainilla espolvoreadas con azúcar','Ideales para mantener la lata de galletas llena durante la Navidad, estas finas galletas de mantequilla dulces son un regalo perfecto.','["1 cantidad de masa de mantequilla de vainilla (ver más abajo)","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Con las manos, haga rodar el\r\nmasa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada\r\nsuperficie en una salchicha\r\nforma de unos 25 cm/9 pulgadas de largo\r\ny 5 cm/2½ pulgadas de diámetro.\r\nEnvuelva el rollo y déjelo enfriar durante al menos\r\nmenos 1 hora. (El rollo puede ser\r\ncongelado por hasta 6 semanas. a\r\nusar, sacar del congelador\r\ny dejar descongelar por uno\r\nhora a temperatura ambiente para que\r\nque la masa quede lo suficientemente suave\r\npara cortarlo en galletas).","Precalienta el horno a\r\n180C/gas 4/ventilador 160C y engrase ligeramente 2 pasteles grandes\r\nhojas. Usando un cuchillo afilado,\r\ncortar la masa en rodajas,\r\ncada uno con un generoso tamaño de 5 mm/¼ pulg.\r\nde espesor, luego colóquelas\r\nsobre la hornada engrasada\r\nhojas, espaciando las galletas\r\nligeramente separados para que tengan\r\nun poco de espacio para difundirse como\r\nellos cocinan.","Hornee por 20 minutos hasta que\r\nlas galletas apenas están girando\r\ndorado pálido alrededor del\r\nbordes, luego transfiéralo a un\r\nrejilla para enfriar. polvo\r\ngenerosamente con azúcar glas.\r\nLas galletas se mantendrán frescas.\r\npor hasta una semana almacenado en\r\nuna lata hermética."]','2026-01-11 12:54:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12815,8698,'es','galletas de jánuca','La lectora de Good Food, Danielle Brown, comparte la receta de su abuela de las sabrosas galletas Kaak, que se comen tradicionalmente durante la festividad judía de Hanukkah.','["450 g de harina blanca fuerte","1 cucharadita de semilla de alcaravea","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","100 g de margarina a base de aceite, derretida","1 huevo batido"]','["Coloque la harina, ½ cucharadita de sal, las semillas de alcaravea y la levadura en un bol grande. Hacer un hueco en el centro y verter la margarina derretida y 200 ml de agua tibia. Mezcle para combinar todos los ingredientes, agregue más agua o harina si es necesario, luego amase durante 2 minutos para formar una masa suave. Colocar en un bol engrasado, cubrir con film transparente y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora.","Una vez que haya duplicado su tamaño, amase la masa durante 1 minuto y luego divida la mezcla en 12 bolas. Corta cada bola por la mitad y enrolla cada pieza hasta darle forma de salchicha fina. Gira las 2 piezas juntas, luego une los extremos para\r\nformar un círculo. Colocar en una bandeja de horno ligeramente engrasada, cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar durante 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 5. Untar las galletas con un poco de huevo batido y hornear durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Retirar para enfriar sobre una rejilla, luego bajar el horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas 1?4. Una vez frías, regresa las galletas al horno y hornea por 10 minutos más, luego apaga el fuego por completo y deja que las galletas se sequen en el horno durante 2 horas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12816,8700,'es','galletas de frutas','El regalo perfecto para preparar con anticipación, se conservarán hasta un mes después de hornearse y lucirán realmente impresionantes.','["350 g de harina común y un poco más para enrollar","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos batidos","ralladura gruesa 1 naranja","85 g de pasas","85 g de cerezas secas","50 g de almendras blanqueadas","50 g de pistachos sin cáscara"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Línea\r\n2 bandejas para hornear con papel de horno. Pon el\r\nharina, levadura en polvo, especias y azúcar en una olla grande\r\ntazón, luego mezcle bien. Agregue los huevos y la ralladura.\r\nhasta que la mezcla comience a formar grumos, luego\r\njunte la masa con las manos – se\r\nParecerá seco al principio, pero sigue amasando hasta que ya no esté.\r\nquedan manchas harinosas. Añade las frutas y nueces,\r\nluego trabaje hasta que se distribuyan uniformemente.","Colocar la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.\r\nsuperficie y dividir en 4 pedazos. con ligeramente\r\nCon las manos enharinadas, enrolle cada trozo hasta formar una salchicha.\r\nunos 30 cm de largo. Coloca 2 en cada bandeja, bien\r\nespaciados. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que\r\nla masa ha subido, se ha extendido y se siente firme.\r\nAún debería verse pálido. Quitar del\r\nHorno, transfiéralo a una rejilla durante unos minutos.\r\nhasta que esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, luego bájelo\r\nel horno a 140C/ventilador 120C/gas 1.","Con un cuchillo para pan, cortar en rodajas de aproximadamente 1 cm.\r\nde espesor en diagonal, luego coloque las rodajas planas\r\nlas bandejas para hornear. Las galletas se pueden enfriar.\r\ny congelado sobre la sábana en este punto, luego\r\nEmbolsado y congelado por hasta 2 meses. hornear\r\ndurante otros 15 minutos (20 minutos si está congelado),\r\nVoltee y hornee nuevamente por otros 15 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté seco y dorado. Vierta sobre una rejilla para\r\nDeje enfriar completamente y luego guárdelo en una lata hermética.\r\npor hasta un mes, o empacar en cajas o\r\nBolsas de celofán si se regalan de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 12:54:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12817,8702,'es','Galletas con trozos de chocolate totalmente americanas','Irresistibles galletas con trozos de chocolate totalmente americano','["300 g de chocolate natural (aproximadamente 55 % de sólidos de cacao)","100 g de barra de chocolate con leche","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","85 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","100 g de mantequilla de maní, mejor crujiente","1 huevo mediano","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de harina con levadura","100 g de maní tostado grande y salado"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/gas 4/ventilador 160C. Reunir y pesar todos los ingredientes.","Pica 200 g/7 oz de chocolate natural en trozos ásperos e irregulares. Picar el chocolate con leche de la misma forma, pero reservarlo por separado.","Rompe el chocolate natural restante en un tazón grande resistente al calor. Derrita en el microondas a temperatura media durante aproximadamente 11 a 2 minutos (o sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo).","Revuelve el chocolate hasta que se derrita, luego agrega el azúcar, la mantequilla, la mantequilla de maní, el huevo y la vainilla y bate con una cuchara de madera hasta que esté bien mezclado. Agrega la harina, todos los trozos de chocolate con leche, las nueces (no es necesario picar) y la mitad de los trozos de chocolate natural. La mezcla se sentirá bastante suave y se caerá fácilmente de la cuchara si la agitas.","Deje caer cucharadas grandes en 12 montones sobre 2 o 3 bandejas para hornear, dejando espacio para que se extiendan (es posible que deba hornear en tandas). Introduce los trozos restantes en las galletas (2-3 trozos en cada uno).","Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que se oscurezcan un poco alrededor de los bordes. El olor te hará saber que están listos. Quedarán suaves en el medio, pero se pondrán crujientes a medida que se enfríen. (Cocine por más tiempo y tendrá galletas más crujientes). Déjelas enfriar y endurecer durante unos minutos en la bandeja para hornear (se romperán si las mueve mientras aún están calientes), luego levántelas con una espátula ancha y colóquelas en una rejilla para enfriar. Se mantendrán crujientes en una lata hermética durante 3 o 4 días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12818,8704,'es','Macarrones de coco y chocolate','Un delicioso macarrón con el sabor tropical del coco fresco.','["1 clara de huevo","200 g de azúcar en polvo","4 cucharadas de harina común","200 g de coco fresco rallado grueso (aproximadamente 1 coco en total)","150 g de barra de chocolate negro, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. En un recipiente limpio, bata las claras hasta que estén firmes y luego agregue gradualmente el azúcar, batiendo continuamente hasta que quede espesa y brillante. Tamizar la harina y luego incorporar las claras con el coco hasta que estén completamente combinados.","Con un cortador de masa de 8 cm, aplasta cucharadas de la mezcla en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel de hornear antiadherente o láminas de plástico de silicona; es posible que tengas que hacerlo en dos tandas.  Hornee durante 15-18 minutos hasta que estén dorados en los bordes y empiecen a dorarse por encima. Deje enfriar y luego transfiéralo a una rejilla.","Mientras los macarrones se enfrían, derrita el chocolate en el microondas o sobre una cacerola con agua caliente y déjelo enfriar un poco. Cubrir el lado liso con chocolate y dejar reposar en el frigorífico. Los macarrones se conservarán en un recipiente hermético durante 2 días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12819,8706,'es','Galletas de manzana y caramelo','Son realmente deliciosos: crujientes en los bordes y masticables en el centro.','["175 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 yemas de huevo","50 g de almendras molidas","85 g de caramelos masticables, picados en trozos grandes","85 g/3 oz de trozos de manzana secos listos para comer, picados en trozos grandes","225 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharadas de leche"]','["Precalentar el horno a 170C ventilado/convencional 190C/gas 5. Usando\r\nuna batidora eléctrica, batir\r\nla mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén pálidas\r\ny cremoso.","Agregue las yemas de huevo molidas.\r\nalmendras, toffees, manzana seca y\r\nharina. Mezclar bien y luego enrollar\r\nbolitas del tamaño de una nuez.","Colóquelos bien separados sobre dos\r\no bandejas para hornear forradas y aplanar\r\nligeramente con la mano. Pincel con\r\nleche y hornee durante 8-12 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado. Dejar endurecer durante 5\r\nminutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla\r\ny dejar enfriar por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12820,8708,'es','Avena de arándanos y nueces','Haga el doble de cantidad de esta masa para galletas afrutada y congélela, para tener siempre a mano deliciosas galletas caseras.','["175 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","85 g de gachas de avena","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de canela molida","140 g de mantequilla picada","Paquete de 70 g de arándanos secos (o utilice pasas o arándanos secos)","50 g de nueces pecanas, partidas toscamente","1 huevo batido"]','["Vierta la harina, el polvo para hornear, la avena,\r\nazúcar y canela en un tazón, luego mezcle\r\nbien con las manos. Agrega la mantequilla, luego\r\nfrótelo en la mezcla hasta que haya desaparecido.","Agregue los arándanos y las nueces,\r\nagregue el huevo, luego mezcle bien con un cubierto\r\ncuchillo o cuchara de madera hasta que venga todo\r\njuntos en una gran bola. Enharinar ligeramente la obra\r\nsuperficie, luego enrolle la masa hasta formar una salchicha\r\nunos 6 cm de ancho. Envuélvalo en film transparente y luego\r\nenfríe en el refrigerador hasta que esté sólido.","Para hornear, calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/\r\ngas 4. Desenvuelva el tronco de galleta, córtelo en rodajas gruesas\r\nen discos, luego colóquelos en bandejas para hornear.\r\nHornee durante 15 minutos (o unos minutos más si\r\ndesde congelado) hasta que esté dorado, dejar en las bandejas\r\nendurecer, luego enfriar completamente sobre un alambre\r\nrejilla antes de meterlo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12821,8710,'es','Botones de cuajada de almendras y limón','Escondido dentro de estas galletas desmenuzables se encuentra un corazón de cuajada de limón, que le da una inesperada explosión de sabor.','["250 g de mantequilla, ablandada","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más extra","1 huevo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","ralladura de 2 limones","300 g de harina común","100 g de almendras molidas","un poco de leche, para sellar","aproximadamente 3 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","almendras en hojuelas, para la parte superior"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5.\r\nBatir la mantequilla, el azúcar, el huevo, la vainilla y la ralladura.\r\ny una pizca de sal en un bol grande hasta que\r\nsuave, luego agregue la harina y el suelo\r\nalmendras. Forme 2 rondas y aplánelas.\r\nluego envuélvalos en film transparente y enfríelos.\r\nhasta que esté firme, unos 30 minutos.","Extienda 1 trozo de masa sobre una mesa enharinada.\r\nsuperficie hasta obtener aproximadamente £1 de espesor, luego\r\nSelle las rondas con un cortador de 7 cm.\r\nCepille todo con leche, luego vierta\r\ngotas de cuajada de limón del tamaño de 20 peniques en el\r\nmitad de la mitad de las rondas.","Coloque con cuidado las rondas restantes.\r\nencima de la cuajada de limón, luego suavemente\r\npresione alrededor de los bordes con los dedos\r\npara sellar. Espolvorear con un poco de azúcar en polvo\r\ny las almendras laminadas. Hornear por 15 minutos\r\nhasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Repita con el resto\r\nhojaldre, luego aplaste los restos\r\ny volver a rodar. Puedes congelar las galletas.\r\nantes de hornear, pero agregue hasta 5 minutos más\r\nal tiempo de cocción."]','2026-01-11 12:54:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12822,8712,'es','Galletas pegajosas de chocolate y cereza','Si te gustan las galletas al estilo americano, te encantarán estas delicias pálidas y masticables. Además, se pueden hornear congelados.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","85 g de azúcar mascabado light","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo","225 g de harina con levadura","50 g de chocolate natural, 50-70 % de cacao, picado en trozos grandes","50 g de chocolate blanco, picado en trozos grandes","85 g de cerezas glaseadas de color natural, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5.\r\nBatir la mantequilla, el azúcar y el huevo hasta\r\nsuave, luego mezcle la harina, los chocolates\r\ny trozos de cereza y ½ cucharadita de sal. Cuchara\r\nen bandejas para hornear antiadherentes en trozos grandes\r\nmanchas ásperas: obtendrás 20 de esto\r\nmezclar. Asegúrese de que estén bien espaciados\r\nlas galletas crecen sustancialmente a medida que\r\nhornear. La masa cruda se puede congelar.","Hornee durante 12-14 minutos hasta que esté dorado.\r\npero todavía bastante pálido y suave en el medio.\r\nSi hornea congelados, deles unos cuantos\r\nminutos más. Dejar enfriar en las sábanas durante 5 minutos.\r\nluego levántelo sobre las rejillas con una rodaja de pescado y\r\ndejar enfriar por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12823,8714,'es','Pan caliente de calabaza y miel','Combine calabaza suave, miel caliente y un toque de especias para hacer este pan sabroso y húmedo. Es un reconfortante horneado de otoño ideal para el té de la tarde.','["175 g de mantequilla, ablandada","140 g de miel picante o miel clara mezclada con una pizca de hojuelas de chile, y más para servir","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 huevo, batido","250 g de calabaza, pelada y rallada gruesa","350 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","mantequilla o crème fraîche, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pan de 1,5 kg con papel para hornear.","Mezclar la mantequilla con la miel caliente, el azúcar y el huevo en un bol grande. Agregue la calabaza rallada, luego mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear y la canela.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde para pan preparado y nivele la parte superior. Hornee durante 45-50 minutos hasta que suba y se dore. Rocíe la parte superior con 1 cucharadita de miel caliente. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla.","Sirva en rodajas gruesas aún caliente con mantequilla o crème fraîche y más miel caliente, o déjelo enfriar por completo y tueste las rodajas para servir de la misma manera. Se conservará durante varios días en un lugar fresco. Puede cortarlo cuando esté frío y congelarlo, luego descongelarlo cuando sea necesario."]','2026-01-11 12:54:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12824,3662,'es','pan de oliva','Hornee una hogaza con aceitunas verdes y negras para disfrutarla simplemente untada con mantequilla, o para mojarla en una sopa o un guiso al estilo mediterráneo.','["Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","550 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","1½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","1 cucharada de orégano seco","100 g de aceitunas verdes deshuesadas, picadas en trozos grandes, más 1 cucharada de salmuera","100 g de aceitunas negras deshuesadas, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","sémola, para espolvorear"]','["Vierta la levadura, la harina, la sal, el orégano seco, las aceitunas, la salmuera de oliva y el aceite de oliva en una batidora de pie equipada con un gancho para masa, junto con 300 ml de agua tibia. Mezclar a velocidad baja durante 8-10 minutos hasta obtener una masa suave y elástica. Forre un recipiente con un paño de cocina limpio. Forme una bola con la masa y luego transfiérala al tazón, con la costura hacia arriba. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos unas horas hasta que duplique su tamaño, o hasta 24 horas (cuanto más tiempo dure, más profundo será el sabor).","Cuando esté listo para hornear, caliente el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9 con una cacerola grande con tapa adentro durante 30 minutos. Quita la tapa de la cacerola y espolvorea un poco de sémola sobre una hoja grande de papel para hornear. Transfiera con cuidado la masa, con la costura hacia abajo, al papel para hornear. Retirar la cazuela del horno y poner en ella la masa, luego tapar con la tapa. Hornee durante 40 minutos, luego retire la tapa y hornee durante 10 minutos más hasta que el pan esté dorado y la base esté hueca al golpearla. Se mantendrá cubierto a temperatura ambiente hasta por tres días o refrigerado hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:54:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12825,8716,'es','Focaccia cargada de tomate, burrata y jamón','Disfrute de estas foccacias cargadas con una ensalada de hojas como acompañamiento para un almuerzo satisfactorio. Puedes usar pesto fresco comprado en la tienda si no tienes tiempo para hacer el tuyo propio.','["400 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","Sobre de 5 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","50 ml de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para la bandeja de horno y para rociar","1 cucharada de sémola o polenta","600 g de tomates mixtos, una variedad de colores y tamaños funcionan bien, los más grandes cortados por la mitad o en cuartos","4 dientes de ajo enteros, sin pelar","2 bolas de burrata de 250 g","6 rebanadas de prosciutto","manojo pequeño de albahaca, más unas cuantas hojas para servir","25 g de piñones tostados","25 g de parmesano","1 limón rallado y un chorrito de jugo","1 diente de ajo","75 ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un poco más para rociar"]','["Haz la masa el día anterior al que quieras hornear la focaccia. Mezcle la harina, la levadura, 1 cucharadita de sal y 275 ml de agua tibia en un tazón grande o en el tazón de una batidora de pie con un gancho para masa adjunto. La masa debe quedar bastante húmeda y pegajosa. Trabaja durante unos minutos, estirándola y doblándola en el bol con la mano, o dejando que el gancho amasador haga el trabajo. Con las manos mojadas, formar una bola áspera con la masa, luego tapar el bol, meter en el frigorífico y dejar toda la noche.","Para hacer el pesto, mezcla todos los ingredientes con una buena pizca de sal y una pizca de pimienta negra. Transfiera a un tazón y enfríe hasta que sea necesario. Se mantendrá refrigerado hasta por una semana o congelado por dos meses.","Sacar la masa del frigorífico y dejar a temperatura ambiente durante 1-2 horas, hasta que haya duplicado su tamaño y el exterior del bol haya perdido el frío. Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.","Engrase una bandeja para hornear de 22 cm x 32 cm y espolvoree con sémola. Saque suavemente la masa del bol sobre la bandeja y, trabajando con las manos engrasadas, estírela para que quepa en la bandeja. Dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, ponga los tomates y los dientes de ajo en una fuente para asar. Sazona bien y rocía con un poco de aceite. Ase durante 20 minutos y luego enfríe durante 10 minutos.","Vierta los tomates calientes sobre la masa de focaccia, rociando con cualquiera de los jugos aceitosos del tazón. Saque los dientes de ajo de la piel y exprímalos entre los dedos en trozos más pequeños, salpique el ajo tierno sobre los tomates. Espolvorea con sal en escamas y hornea en la parte superior del horno caliente durante 30 minutos.","Cuando la focaccia esté cocida, déjela enfriar durante al menos 15 a 45 minutos (o déjela enfriar y vuelva a calentarla antes de servir). Corta la focaccia en 8 rectángulos gruesos, luego corta cada burrata en cuartos y coloca un trozo en cada trozo. Coloque tiras de prosciutto encima, luego vierta sobre el pesto fresco, espolvoree con hojas de albahaca y rocíe con un poco de aceite de oliva virgen extra."]','2026-01-11 12:54:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12826,8718,'es','Pan de ajo con queso cheddar y harissa','Lleve su pan de ajo al siguiente nivel con este pan desmenuzable lleno de queso derretido y ligeramente condimentado con harissa.','["500 g de pan blanco redondo y crujiente de Morrisons Market Street (una bola de masa madre funciona bien)","100 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","2-3 cucharadas de harissa (dependiendo de lo picante que te guste)","3 dientes de ajo grandes, rallados","75 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado grueso","75 g de mozzarella rallada"]','["Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Corte la barra de pan Morrisons a intervalos diagonales de 2 cm con un cuchillo de sierra, hasta llegar casi hasta el final, luego repita en la dirección opuesta para crear un patrón de diamante. Coloque el pan en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear.","Ponga la mantequilla, la harissa y el ajo en un tazón pequeño y bata con una espátula o una cuchara de madera. Sazona con un poco de sal y pimienta.","Unte la mantequilla en los cortes de la barra de pan, luego espolvoree ambos quesos en los cortes y sobre la parte superior de la barra, asegurándose de llenar cada espacio con mantequilla y queso. Envolver bien en papel de aluminio.","Hornee por 20 minutos, luego retire el papel de aluminio de la parte superior y regrese al horno por 10 minutos más hasta que se derrita, esté dorado y pegajoso. Sirva entero para que todos puedan partir y compartir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12827,8720,'es','bollos de leche','Utilice el método "tangzhong" (hacer una pasta similar a un roux para agregar a la masa) para darle al pan de estos bollos de leche una excelente subida y una textura suave y esponjosa.','["125 ml de leche, preferiblemente entera, más un poco más para glasear","7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","350 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo","50 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada y cortada en cubos","Aceite de sabor neutro, como el de girasol, para fermentar.","20 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","60ml de leche, preferiblemente entera"]','["Forre un molde para hornear de lados altos de 20 x 30 cm con papel para hornear. Para hacer el tangzhong, ponga la harina, la leche y 30 ml de agua en una cacerola pequeña, bata a fuego medio hasta que se convierta en una pasta espesa, luego reserve hasta que esté a temperatura ambiente.","Vierte la leche en una cacerola y ponla a fuego lento hasta que esté tibia. Alternativamente, calentar en el microondas en ráfagas de 10 segundos, pero con cuidado de no hervir. Agregue la levadura para combinar completamente. Mezcle la harina, el azúcar y 1 cucharadita de sal marina fina en el tazón de una batidora de pie con un gancho para masa. Con la batidora en marcha, agregue la mezcla de huevo, tangzhong y leche. Amasar durante 2 minutos y luego agregar la mantequilla poco a poco. Continúe amasando durante 7-8 minutos más hasta que esté suave, elástico y ligeramente pegajoso. Forme una bola y colóquela en un recipiente limpio ligeramente engrasado. Cubra y deje reposar durante aproximadamente 2 horas hasta que duplique su tamaño. Se mantendrá frío durante la noche. Llevar a temperatura ambiente, luego dejar crecer hasta que doble antes de continuar.","Espolvorea ligeramente una superficie de trabajo limpia con harina y bate la masa durante 10 segundos. Dividir en ocho trozos (de unos 85 g cada uno) y formar bolitas. Pon las bolas en el molde preparado y tapa. Deje reposar durante 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Unta generosamente un poco de leche sobre los bollos para glasear y hornea durante 20-25 minutos hasta que estén dorados y leudados. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 15 a 20 minutos antes de transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante tres días o se congelará durante dos meses."]','2026-01-11 12:54:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12828,7397,'es','pitas esponjosas','Intente hacer estas pittas al estilo griego que son más esponjosas que las que encontrará en la mayoría de las tiendas. Rellénelo con pollo o cerdo a la parrilla, ensalada y tzatziki para obtener un delicioso kebab falso.','["500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de hojas frescas de tomillo (opcional)","200ml de leche","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para fermentar y cepillar"]','["Unas horas antes de querer comer, haz la masa. Mezclar en un bol con las yemas de los dedos la harina, la levadura, el azúcar, el tomillo, si lo usamos, y 2 cucharaditas de sal. Vierta sobre la leche, el aceite de oliva y 100 ml de agua tibia y, siempre con los dedos, combine hasta formar una masa. Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase durante 8 a 10 minutos (o bátalo en una batidora de pie durante 5 minutos). Limpiar y engrasar ligeramente un bol, poner la masa en el bol y cubrir con un paño de cocina. Deje reposar durante 1 hora o hasta que casi duplique su tamaño. Si quieres darte más tiempo, la masa tardará más en subir en la nevera (al menos 2 h).","Divide la masa en ocho trozos iguales. Uno a la vez, sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, extienda los círculos de unos 20 cm de ancho, luego unte con un poco más de aceite de oliva y cocine en el lado caliente de la barbacoa durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén inflados y formando ampollas. Alternativamente, calienta una sartén o plancha (o dos si puedes) a fuego medio-alto y cocina, una por una en cada sartén, hasta que aparezcan burbujas en la superficie después de 1-2 minutos. Cuando la parte inferior esté dorada, voltea y cocina por otros 2-3 minutos. Continúe hasta que todas las pitas estén cocidas, envolviéndolas en papel de aluminio a medida que avanza para mantenerlas calientes."]','2026-01-11 12:54:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12829,6203,'es','Pan para compartir con ajo y aceitunas negras','Reúna a sus amigos para un festín y sirva este pan para compartir con ajo y aceitunas negras. Se puede realizar hasta con tres días de antelación.','["300ml de leche entera","140 g de mantequilla sin sal, cortada en cubos","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","4 dientes de ajo machacados","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de perejil, finamente picado","140 g de aceitunas negras, deshuesadas y finamente picadas (las Kalamata funcionan bien)","aceite vegetal, para fermentar"]','["Calienta 80 ml de leche en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento o en el microondas y añade 1 cucharada de sal marina. Revuelva para disolver y deje enfriar.","Mientras tanto, derretir la mitad de la mantequilla en 200 ml de leche en una cacerola a fuego medio, junto con el azúcar y la mitad del ajo. Dejar enfriar hasta que esté tibio.","Vierta la harina y la levadura en el tazón grande de una batidora de pie y mezcle con el gancho para masa. Incorpora poco a poco la mezcla de mantequilla y leche derretida. Una vez que la masa comience a unirse, agrega la leche con sal, el perejil y la mitad de las aceitunas. Continúe mezclando durante 6 minutos con el gancho para masa, o colóquelo sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase a mano durante 10 minutos.","Engrase el bol, agregue la masa y luego frote aceite por encima. Cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar en un lugar cálido durante al menos 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Mientras tanto, caliente el resto de la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento y agregue el resto del ajo machacado y las aceitunas restantes. Calentar el ajo y las aceitunas durante unos minutos y dejar enfriar.","Una vez que la masa haya subido, colóquela sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y golpéela suavemente. Divídalo en siete trozos, de entre 130 y 140 g cada uno, y enróllelos formando bolas apretadas, metiendo los bordes por debajo para que las bolas queden perfectamente lisas con las costuras en la parte inferior. Colóquelas en un molde para pastel redondo de 20-23 cm forrado con papel para hornear, asegurándose de que las bolas de masa queden igualmente espaciadas alrededor del borde y una en el medio. Cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar hasta que vuelva a duplicar su tamaño, unos 20-30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Untar la masa con la mantequilla de ajo, evitando las aceitunas. Hornee en el horno durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté dorado por encima y bien cocido. Vierta sobre el resto de la mantequilla de ajo junto con las aceitunas. Se conservará hasta por tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:54:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12830,4505,'es','Pizza con tripas sangrientas, rasga y comparte pan','Organiza una fiesta de Halloween para recordar con este sangriento pan para compartir y romper. Haz una base de salsa de tomate y usa los rellenos de pizza de tu elección.','["500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","250 g de mozzarella o queso cheddar rallado, o utilizar una mezcla","rellenos de pizza de tu elección (nosotros usamos aceitunas y jamón)","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de ajo y hierbas"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón grande. Agrega la levadura a un lado del bol y 2 cucharaditas de sal al otro. Vierta 300 ml de agua tibia y mezcle con una cuchara de madera o en una batidora de pie equipada con un gancho para amasar hasta obtener una masa suave (es posible que necesite agregar hasta 25 ml más de agua si la masa parece seca). Amasar sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada durante 10 minutos o en la batidora durante 5 minutos hasta obtener una masa suave y elástica. Frote un poco de aceite sobre la bola de masa, luego póngala en un recipiente limpio y cúbrala con un paño de cocina. Déjelo reposar en un lugar cálido durante 2 horas o enfríelo durante la noche (o hasta por 24 horas).","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén a fuego medio y chisporrotea el ajo durante 30 segundos, no dejes que se dore. Agrega los tomates, el orégano y 2 cucharaditas de azúcar. Sazone bien. Reduzca el fuego a medio-bajo y deje hervir durante 20-30 minutos hasta que la salsa esté espesa y rica. Utilice un machacador de patatas para aplastar los restos de tomate en la salsa. Deje enfriar hasta que esté listo para usar. Una vez que esté completamente frío, se mantendrá en el refrigerador en un recipiente hermético por hasta tres días o en el congelador por seis meses.","Cuando esté listo para armar, extienda la salsa sobre la base de una fuente para hornear más grande (la nuestra era de 40 x 30 cm). Extienda la masa sobre una superficie enharinada formando un rectángulo de 60 x 30 cm. Corta el rectángulo por la mitad a lo largo para tener dos rectángulos más pequeños de 15 x 30 cm. Apila el queso a lo largo del centro de cada rectángulo y agrega los ingredientes de pizza que desees. Junte los lados largos de los rectángulos para encerrar los rellenos; hágalo con cuidado para no romper la masa. Apriete a lo largo de cada salchicha larga para asegurarse de que estén bien selladas y estírelas suavemente para alargarlas un poco. Coloque las salchichas de masa sobre la salsa con la costura hacia abajo, moviéndolas en forma de intestinos pero dejando un poco de espacio entre ellas para que el pan se expanda mientras se hornea. Cubra y déjelo reposar a temperatura ambiente durante 30 minutos o enfríe hasta por 8 horas. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C/gas 6.","Hornee por 45 minutos hasta que el pan esté dorado. Unte con mantequilla de ajo y hierbas y luego déjelo enfriar durante al menos 10 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12831,3890,'es','Pan naan fácil','Prepare pan naan suave y esponjoso cubierto con mantequilla de ajo y hierbas. Un acompañamiento perfecto para mojar en curry, es muy fácil de preparar','["570 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de azúcar","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½-1 cucharadita de semillas de sabor fuerte, como semillas de nigella o comino (opcional)","2 cucharadas de mantequilla derretida","8 cucharadas de yogur natural","aceite, para el bol","2 dientes de ajo machacados","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado, y un poco más para servir"]','["Pon la harina en un bol grande, luego agrega el azúcar, el polvo para hornear y 1½ cucharadita de sal. Agrega las semillas, si quieres. Batir ligeramente para dispersar los ingredientes uniformemente por toda la harina.","Agrega 1 cucharada de mantequilla derretida, seguido del yogur natural. Mezclar con las manos. Una vez que el yogur y la mantequilla se hayan absorbido, añade poco a poco 180-200 ml de agua, 50 ml a la vez. Mezcle entre adiciones, hasta que comience a formar una masa. La cantidad de agua dependerá de la consistencia del yogur y la mantequilla; deja de agregar cuando tengas una bola de masa.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase bien durante 5 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástica. Poner en un bol engrasado, cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar al menos 1 hora. La masa no sube, pero es importante dejarla reposar ya que esto ayuda a que los naans sean menos masticables y más esponjosos.","Si prepara mantequilla de ajo, mezcle el ajo con la 1 cucharada restante de mantequilla derretida y el cilantro. Dejar de lado.","Divide la masa en ocho, 10 o 12 trozos del mismo tamaño, dependiendo del tamaño que quieras para los naans. Forme bolas redondas y luego vuelva a colocarlas en el bol, cubiertas con un paño de cocina.","Extienda una de las bolas de masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta darle forma redonda, ovalada o de lágrima; enrolle con un movimiento diagonal para obtener un óvalo. Dale la vuelta a la masa y repite del otro lado.","Calienta una sartén. Freír en seco la masa a fuego medio alto hasta que comience a hincharse y la parte inferior se dore en algunos lugares. Voltear y repetir del otro lado. Retire el naan cocido de la sartén. Vierta un poco de mantequilla de ajo sobre el naan, si lo usa. Espolvorea un poco de cilantro, si quieres. Cubre con un paño de cocina mientras repites el proceso con las bolas de masa restantes."]','2026-01-11 12:54:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12832,5667,'es','Sarnies de bistec estilo chimichurri y papas fritas picantes','Realce un sándwich de bistec con una picante y picante salsa chimichurri, mayonesa de chipotle y papas fritas picantes estilo cajún como acompañamiento.','["2 x 200 g de filetes de lomo, sin grasa","2 panecillos largos de chapata","2 puñados de rúcula","30 ml de aceite de girasol","270 g de patatas fritas congeladas compradas en la tienda","Mezcla de especias cajún","70 g de mayonesa","1 cucharadita de pasta de chile chipotle","½ lima, rallada y en jugo","1 chalote de plátano, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1½ cucharada de vinagre de jerez","manojo pequeño de perejil","manojo pequeño de cilantro","50ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Calienta el horno a su temperatura más alta. Para las patatas fritas, vierte el aceite de girasol en una bandeja para horno y mete al horno durante 15 minutos para que se caliente. Reduzca la temperatura a 220 C/200 C ventilador/gas 8. Vierta las patatas fritas en el aceite, voltéelas para cubrirlas y cocine durante 20 minutos. Agrega la mezcla de especias cajún y regresa al horno durante 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente.","Mientras tanto, haga la mayonesa mezclando todos los ingredientes en un bol. Dejar de lado.","Para la salsa estilo chimichurri, mezcle todos los ingredientes hasta obtener una salsa suave y luego sazone al gusto. Dejar de lado.","Calienta una sartén a fuego alto. Frote los filetes solo con sal (la pimienta se pegará y quemará), coloque los filetes en la sartén y cocínelos durante 3 minutos por cada lado (a fuego medio). Retirar de la sartén, cubrir con papel aluminio y dejar reposar 10 minutos.","Corta los panecillos ciabatta por la mitad, tuéstalos en la misma sartén en la que cocinaste el bistec, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, y unta la mitad de cada uno con la mayonesa de chipotle. Cortar el filete en tiras, dividirlo entre las chapatas, rociar sobre el chimichurri y añadir un poco de rúcula. Sirva con las papas fritas y la mayonesa sobrante."]','2026-01-11 12:54:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12833,6916,'es','Filete estilo pastrami y mayonesa de mostaza','Combine chucrut y mayonesa de mostaza con bistec para crear una combinación sensacional. Sirva con papas fritas o puré, o prepárelo en un increíble sándwich de carne.','["2 cucharadas de mayonesa","2 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa","2 x 250 g de solomillo o chuletón","aceite de girasol o vegetal, para rociar","50 g de mantequilla","150 g de chucrut"]','["Mezclar la mayonesa con la mostaza y reservar. Sazona los filetes. Calentar un chorrito de aceite y la mantequilla en una sartén grande a fuego alto hasta que chisporrotee y se dore. Cocine los filetes durante 1-2 minutos por un lado, luego déles la vuelta y cocínelos durante 1-2 minutos más. Voltee nuevamente y continúe este proceso durante 6 a 7 minutos en total para que esté crudo, de 8 a 9 minutos para que esté medio cocido y 10 minutos para que esté medio cocido. Voltear los filetes ayuda a que se cocinen uniformemente y formen una corteza uniforme.","Cuando los filetes estén cocidos a tu gusto, transfiérelos a una tabla y déjalos reposar. Mientras tanto, cocine el chucrut en la sartén con los jugos pegajosos del bistec durante 3-4 minutos hasta que esté completamente caliente y dorado. Sirva los filetes con chucrut y mayonesa de mostaza a un lado, o vierta el chucrut sobre los filetes."]','2026-01-11 12:54:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12834,7439,'es','Panes planos rápidos e hinchados','Prepare estos rápidos panes planos para un festín al estilo indio. Son como una versión trampa del pan naan y son excelentes para limpiar un curry.','["300 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","150 gramos de yogur natural","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","ghee o mantequilla derretida, para untar","semillas de comino, dientes de ajo picados, cilantro picado o chiles picados (opcional)"]','["Combine la harina, el polvo para hornear, el yogur y el aceite con 1 cucharadita de sal y 2 cucharadas de agua y forme una masa rugosa. Vierta sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase durante unos minutos hasta que quede ligeramente suave, luego divídalo en cuatro a ocho trozos, según el tamaño de pan plano que desee.","Calienta una sartén de base pesada a fuego alto. Para hacer panes planos básicos, extienda los trozos de masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar óvalos rugosos, luego fríalos durante 1 a 2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados y ligeramente carbonizados en algunas partes. Alternativamente, extienda los trozos de masa, unte con un poco de ghee o mantequilla derretida y esparza sobre las semillas de comino, ajo, cilantro o chiles, si lo desea. Doble cada trozo de masa sobre sí mismo, luego extiéndalo nuevamente hasta formar un óvalo rugoso y cocine de la misma manera.","Unte los panes planos con un poco de mantequilla derretida o ghee y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:54:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12835,8722,'es','Pan rallado casero','Aprende a hacer pan rallado en casa con nuestra receta y método súper sencillos. Utilízalos como una capa crujiente para alimentos fritos, relleno de tarta de melaza o aderezo para hornear pasta.','["2 rebanadas de pan blanco del día anterior (sin corteza, si lo prefieres)"]','["Para hacer pan rallado fresco, corte el pan en pedazos y colóquelo en un procesador de alimentos equipado con un accesorio para cuchillas. Pulse hasta obtener pan rallado del tamaño que desee. Si desea hacer pan rallado muy uniforme, páselo por un colador grueso. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético a temperatura ambiente hasta por una semana.","Para hacer pan rallado seco, corte el pan en trozos y hornee a fuego lento hasta que los trozos estén completamente secos. Pulse en un procesador de alimentos como antes. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos meses o congelado durante seis meses."]','2026-01-11 12:54:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12836,8724,'es','Cinnabun gigante','Lleve los remolinos de canela a un nuevo nivel de placer con esta versión gigante. Perfecto para una fiesta, requiere un poco más de esfuerzo pero los resultados valen la pena.','["200ml de leche","50 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para la lata","450 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de canela molida","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo batido","aceite vegetal, para el bol","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","150 g de mantequilla blanda","2 cucharadas de canela molida","100 g de azúcar glas","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Para la masa, calienta suavemente la leche y la mantequilla hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Dejar enfriar hasta que esté tibio al tacto (no debe estar caliente). Vierta la harina en un bol grande con la levadura, la canela, el azúcar y una pizca de sal. Vierta la mezcla tibia de mantequilla y leche junto con el huevo, luego combine con las manos hasta que se forme una masa. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie enharinada y amase durante unos 10 minutos hasta que esté elástica. Alternativamente, puede hacer esto en una batidora de pie equipada con un gancho para masa; la masa solo requerirá unos 5 minutos de amasado con este método. Forme una bola con la masa y luego colóquela en un recipiente engrasado. Cubrir con un paño de cocina limpio y dejar reposar durante aproximadamente 1 hora, o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Mientras tanto, bata los ingredientes del relleno con una pizca de sal con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que estén completamente combinados. Dejar de lado. Unte con mantequilla un molde desmontable de 20 cm o un molde para pasteles de fondo suelto. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase brevemente para eliminar el aire. Déjelo reposar unos minutos, luego extiéndalo hasta formar un rectángulo de 30 x 50 cm y colóquelo sobre la superficie de modo que el borde corto quede hacia usted. Extiende sobre el relleno de manera que el rectángulo de masa quede completamente cubierto. Corta la masa en cuatro tiras a lo largo. Enrolle la primera tira formando una espiral apretada desde el extremo corto, luego coloque la espiral en el extremo corto de la segunda tira y enróllela formando una espiral alrededor de la primera. Coloque esta espiral más grande en el extremo corto de la tercera tira y enróllela nuevamente, luego repita con la última tira de masa. Deberías terminar con un bollo de canela grande. Transfiera a la lata preparada, cubra con un paño de cocina limpio y déjela reposar durante 45 minutos a 1 hora, o hasta que haya subido aproximadamente un tercio.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque el molde para pastel en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 50 minutos a 1 hora hasta que esté inflado, dorado y bien cocido. Mientras tanto, combine el azúcar glas, la vainilla y 3 cucharadas de agua hasta obtener un glaseado suelto que se pueda rociar. Dejar enfriar el panecillo en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego desmoldar, rociar con el glaseado y dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla. Sirva en rodajas o deje que todos lo separen. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12837,5928,'es','Sándwich de sobras de Navidad','Lleva tu sarnie del Boxing Day al siguiente nivel. Ahueca una barra de pan y coloca en capas todas las sobras navideñas en su interior para hacer un sándwich delicioso.','["400 g de pan crujiente redondo blanco","2 cucharadas de mayonesa","2 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa","3-4 cucharadas de salsa de arándanos","un puñado de espinacas tiernas","3-4 cucharadas de cebollas crujientes","250 g sobrantes de pavo asado","6 sobras de cerdo cocido en mantas, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","150 g sobrantes de relleno cocido"]','["Corta una tapa de aproximadamente 3 cm de la parte superior del pan. Saque la mayor parte del pan de la hogaza y la tapa, dejando una capa de aproximadamente 1 cm (puede usar el pan sacado para hacer picatostes o en otra receta).","Combine la mayonesa y la mostaza, luego esparza 2 cucharadas sobre el interior del pan y 1 cucharada dentro de la tapa. Vierta la mayor parte de la salsa de arándanos en la tapa, seguida de la mitad de las espinacas, las cebollas crujientes y la mitad del pavo. Acomoda el resto del pavo en la base del pan, seguido del resto de la salsa de arándanos, los cerdos en mantas, el relleno y el resto de las espinacas. Cubra el pan con la tapa rellena, presione ligeramente hacia abajo, luego envuélvalo bien y enfríelo durante al menos 3 horas. Córtelo en cuatro o seis gajos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12838,8726,'es','Abuela de chocolate y naranja','Prepare una babka de chocolate y naranja para disfrutar de una delicia espectacular en Navidad. Babka es una masa de pan enriquecida que generalmente se hace en un molde para pan, pero le hemos dado forma de corona.','["100ml de leche entera","550 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de azúcar en polvo","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","4 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","150 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente, cortada en cubos","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","30 g de cacao en polvo","125 g de chocolate amargo, finamente picado","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, picada","3 naranjas ralladas","100 g de azúcar en polvo","3 naranjas exprimidas (o use el jugo de 2 naranjas mezclado con 25 ml de triple sec), más 1 naranja, pelada la ralladura y cortada finamente en tiras"]','["Calienta la leche en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento hasta que esté tibia, pero no caliente. Dejar de lado. Pon la harina en el bol de una batidora de pie. Agrega ½ cucharadita de sal a un lado del bol y el azúcar y la levadura al otro. Mezcle cada lado con la harina con las manos y luego use el gancho para masa hasta que esté completamente combinado.","Vierte la leche tibia, luego, con la batidora a temperatura media, agrega los huevos uno a la vez. Continúe mezclando la masa durante 10 minutos hasta que quede suave, luego agregue gradualmente la mantequilla, uno o dos cubos a la vez, hasta que esté completamente incorporada, aproximadamente de 5 a 8 minutos. Raspe los lados del tazón; la masa quedará muy suave.","Vierta la masa en un tazón grande, cúbrala con un paño de cocina limpio y déjela reposar durante 1 hora, 30 minutos o 2 horas hasta que doble su tamaño. Una vez duplicado, enfríe durante 1 hora.","Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear y reserve. Para hacer el relleno, ponga todos los ingredientes del relleno y una pizca grande de escamas de sal marina en una cacerola pequeña a fuego medio-bajo, revolviendo continuamente hasta que todo se haya derretido. Transfiera a un tazón, déjelo enfriar por completo, luego transfiéralo al refrigerador y enfríe durante 40 minutos, revolviendo cada 20 minutos hasta que la mezcla se espese pero aún se pueda untar.","Retire la masa del frigorífico y extiéndala sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un rectángulo de aproximadamente 70 x 40 cm. Extienda el relleno uniformemente sobre la masa con una espátula o espátula. Con el extremo más corto más cercano a usted, enrolle la masa hasta formar una salchicha apretada. Transfiera a una tabla, con la costura hacia abajo, y córtela por la mitad a lo largo para tener dos piezas largas. Coloque las dos piezas frente a usted, paralelas entre sí, y crúcelas a lo largo en forma de trenza. Rízalo formando un círculo y une los extremos para formar una corona, luego transfiérelo con cuidado a la sábana forrada.","Cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar durante 1 hora hasta que doble su tamaño. Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y hornea la babka durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté dorada.","Para el almíbar, cocine a fuego lento el azúcar, el jugo de naranja y la ralladura a fuego alto durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que espese. Unte la babka con el almíbar tibio. Colar la ralladura de naranja confitada y esparcirla sobre la babka. Sirva caliente o déjelo enfriar por completo y luego manténgalo envuelto. Se mantendrá envuelto a temperatura ambiente hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12839,4024,'es','Jalá','Prepare pan jalá, un pan dulce y enriquecido que las familias judías comen tradicionalmente los viernes por la noche para celebrar el sábado. Las sobras hacen unas deliciosas tostadas francesas.','["500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","70 g de azúcar en polvo","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 huevos batidos","70ml de aceite de girasol, más un extra para el bol","1 cucharada de semillas de amapola o semillas de sésamo (opcional)"]','["Combine la levadura, una pizca de azúcar y un par de cucharadas de agua tibia en un tazón pequeño. Revuelva para disolver la levadura, luego déjela durante 10 minutos hasta que esté espumosa.","Mientras tanto, combine la harina, el azúcar restante y 3 cucharaditas de sal fina en un tazón grande. Hacer un hueco en el centro y añadir la mitad del huevo batido, la mezcla de levadura y el aceite. Vierte 200 ml de agua tibia (debe sentirse ligeramente tibia al tacto) y revuelve con una cuchara, luego mezcla con una mano, manteniendo la otra limpia mientras juntas la masa. Si hay muchos trozos muy secos, agregue gradualmente un poco de agua para unirlos; no querrá que quede demasiado húmedo y pegajoso. La masa debe quedar húmeda, pero no empapada.","Una vez que la masa se haya unido, colóquela sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Amasar con ambas manos durante 10 minutos hasta que quede suave y un poco elástico. Si se pone muy pegajoso, añade una cantidad muy pequeña de harina, la menor cantidad posible. Un raspador de masa es útil si la masa se pega a la superficie de trabajo. Estire los lados de la masa hacia abajo y júntelos para formar una bola. Engrase ligeramente un tazón y luego haga rodar ligeramente la bola de masa alrededor del tazón para que quede cubierta con aceite. Cubrir con un paño de cocina limpio y dejar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora, o hasta que la masa haya duplicado su tamaño.","Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia y divídala en tres partes iguales, pesando para mayor precisión, si lo desea. Enrolle cada pieza en forma de salchicha larga de unos 25 cm de largo, ahusándolas ligeramente en ambos extremos. Coloca las piezas frente a ti, paralelas entre sí con un par de centímetros entre cada una. Junte las salchichas en el extremo superior, luego trencéelas a lo largo, metiendo los extremos cuando llegue al fondo. Transfiera con cuidado el pan a la bandeja para hornear preparada y cúbralo sin apretar con un paño de cocina limpio. Deje reposar hasta que esté hinchado y ondulado, unos 40 minutos.","Mientras tanto, calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Unta suavemente el resto del huevo batido por toda la jalá, metiéndolo en todas las grietas, y espolvorea con semillas de amapola o sésamo, si las usas. Hornee en un estante intermedio del horno durante 25 a 30 minutos, hasta que el pan esté dorado por debajo y suene hueco al golpearlo. Compruébelo después de unos 15 minutos; si la parte superior del pan ha comenzado a oscurecerse demasiado, cúbrala con papel de aluminio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12840,4032,'es','Salsa de pan tostado','Haga una versión vegana de salsa de pan para la mesa de Navidad. Si lo desea, hágalo con anticipación para ahorrar tiempo: guárdelo en el refrigerador hasta por dos días.','["6 rebanadas de pan blanco (asegúrate de que sea vegano)","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza con sabor a mantequilla, más un poco más para servir","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 hoja de laurel","1 ramita de tomillo","600 ml de leche de almendras","pizca de clavo molido","pizca de nuez moscada molida","100ml de crema de soja"]','["Tuesta el pan hasta que esté dorado y luego déjalo enfriar. Mezclar en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener migajas ásperas.","Caliente la mitad del aceite en una cacerola y cocine la cebolla durante 10 minutos hasta que esté dorada y pegajosa. Agrega el laurel, el tomillo y la leche, luego sazona con las especias, sal y pimienta. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.","Retire las hierbas y luego agregue todo menos un puñado de pan rallado. Cocine a fuego lento hasta que espese. Si lo desea, mezcle hasta que quede suave. Se mantendrá refrigerado durante dos días.","Mientras tanto, sofreír el resto de las migas en el aceite restante hasta que estén doradas.","Agregue la crema a la salsa y caliente, luego viértala en un plato y vierta sobre las migajas fritas y un chorrito más de aceite. Se mantendrá tapado en el refrigerador hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12841,8728,'es','bollos belgas','Deléitese con estos deliciosos bollos belgas como delicia por la tarde con una taza de té. Están rellenos de cuajada de limón y cubiertos con glaseado y cereza glaseada.','["450 g de harina blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","7g de levadura de acción rápida","75 g de azúcar en polvo","165ml de leche tibia","1 huevo grande batido más 1 para batir","50 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida, más un extra para la bandeja","5 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","150 g de pasas","250 g de azúcar glas","12 cerezas heladas"]','["Mezcle la harina, la levadura, el azúcar en polvo y 1 cucharadita de sal marina en un tazón grande. Hacer un hueco en el centro y verter la leche tibia, el huevo batido y la mantequilla derretida. Mezclar bien y se forma una masa suave. Si se siente seco, agregue un poco de agua tibia, si se siente demasiado pegajoso y húmedo, agregue 1 cucharada de harina.","Espolvorea una superficie de trabajo con harina y vierte la mezcla sobre ella. Amasar la masa hasta que se sienta suave y elástica. Forme una bola y colóquela en un bol grande ligeramente enharinado. Tapar y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño. O déjelo reposar en el refrigerador durante la noche y retírelo 45 minutos antes de continuar.","Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel de hornear antiadherente. Espolvoree ligeramente una superficie de trabajo y extienda la masa hasta que quede de 30 x 45 cm. Distribuya uniformemente la cuajada de limón sobre la masa y espolvoree con las pasas. Enrolle la masa a lo largo desde el lado más corto, como un panecillo suizo, para formar un tronco. Córtelo en 12 panecillos del mismo tamaño con un cuchillo afilado, lave con huevo el extremo suelto de la masa y presiónelo hacia abajo para que no se deshaga. Colóquelos, separados, en la bandeja para hornear preparada, cubra y déjelo reposar durante 45 minutos hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Pintar los bollos con un poco de huevo batido. Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego reduzca la temperatura a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y cocine durante 10 minutos más. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, tamice el azúcar glas y mezcle con 3 cucharadas de agua hasta que se forme un glaseado blanco y espeso. Extiende el glaseado encima de los panecillos con el dorso de una cuchara y luego pon una cereza en el medio de cada uno."]','2026-01-11 12:54:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12842,8730,'es','Bandeja horneada con albóndigas y pan de ajo','Prepare esta reconfortante bandeja horneada con albóndigas y pan con ajo para una cena que disfrutará toda la familia. Podrías comprar un paquete de albóndigas si tienes poco tiempo','["350 g de muslo de pavo picado","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","150 g de mozzarella en bolas, cortada en trozos","4 palitos de pan con ajo o rebanadas de pan con ajo, desmenuzados o cortados en trozos","25 g de queso cheddar rallado","ensalada verde o espagueti, para servir"]','["Combine la carne picada, el orégano, las semillas de hinojo y un poco de condimento en un bol. Tome trozos de la mezcla del tamaño de una nuez y forme bolas. Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén grande y poco profunda apta para horno y cocina las albóndigas hasta que se doren por completo; no te preocupes si no están bien cocidas. Transfiera a un plato. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Calienta el aceite restante en la sartén y agrega la cebolla. Cocine hasta que se ablanden, aproximadamente de 10 a 12 minutos, revolviendo regularmente. Agrega el ajo un minuto más, luego el puré de tomate, los tomates picados y el azúcar.","Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 a 15 minutos y luego sazone al gusto. Coloca las albóndigas encima de la salsa, luego agrega la mozzarella, el pan de ajo y el queso cheddar encima. Hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:54:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12843,7069,'es','rarebit galés','Deléitese con una rebanada de rarebit galés burbujeante, dorado y con queso para un almuerzo satisfactorio. Sirva bien caliente de la parrilla con abundante cebollino picado.','["120 ml de cerveza marrón","25 g de mantequilla sin sal","25 g de harina común","140 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado grueso","1 cucharadita colmada de mostaza inglesa en polvo","1 cucharada de salsa inglesa","1 cucharada de cebollino picado","2 rebanadas grandes de pan de masa madre"]','["En una cacerola pequeña calentar suavemente la cerveza y reservar. Toma otra cacerola pequeña y a fuego medio derrite la mantequilla hasta que comience a hacer espuma, vierte la harina y revuelve todo, cocinando por 1 min. Agregue la cerveza tibia en varias adiciones para crear una salsa espesa y luego mezcle el queso para crear una pasta espesa. Agrega la mostaza, la inglesa y el cebollino a la salsa.","Calienta una parrilla a su temperatura más alta. Coloque las rebanadas de pan en una bandeja para hornear plana y cocine a la parrilla por un lado hasta que estén doradas. Voltear el pan y untar cada uno con la mezcla de queso. Vuelva a colocarlo debajo de la parrilla y cocine por 1-2 minutos más o hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante, sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:54:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12844,8732,'es','Bolitas de masa de ajo rellenas de queso con salsa de tomate','Impresione a familiares y amigos con el mejor entrante para compartir: bolitas de masa de ajo deliciosas y con queso. Con salsa a base de tomate, son un complemento ideal para cualquier menú de inspiración italiana.','["50 g de mantequilla, en cubos","300 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","200 g de mozzarella en bloque, cortada en cubos de 1½ cm","65 g de gruyere rallado grueso (opcional)","100 g de mantequilla","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 ramita de romero, hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para el tazón y la bandeja para hornear","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","250 g de puré","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","pizca de hojuelas de chile","½ manojo pequeño de albahaca, desmenuzado y más para servir"]','["Calienta 175 ml de agua en una cacerola hasta que esté humeante, luego agrega la mantequilla. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar hasta que la mezcla esté tibia (no debe estar caliente). Combine la harina, la levadura, el azúcar y 1 cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande o en una batidora. Agregue la mezcla de mantequilla enfriada y mezcle hasta obtener una masa suave con una cuchara de madera o la batidora. Amasar durante 10 minutos a mano (o 5 minutos con una batidora) hasta que la masa se sienta flexible y suave. Transfiera a un recipiente engrasado y cubra con un paño de cocina limpio. Déjelo reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1½ a 2 horas, o hasta que duplique su tamaño. Alternativamente, déjelo reposar en el refrigerador durante la noche.","Engrase y cubra una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Quite el aire de la masa y luego amase nuevamente durante varios minutos. Aplanar un pequeño trozo de masa (unos 20 g) formando un disco y poner un cubo de mozzarella y una pizca de gruyere en el centro del disco. Encierre los quesos con la masa y luego forme una bola. Transfiera a la bandeja para hornear preparada. Repita con el resto del queso y la masa, colocando las bolas de masa a ½ cm de distancia en la bandeja para hornear; deben tocarse justo después de fermentar. Cubrir con un paño de cocina limpio y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, haz la mantequilla de ajo. Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña a fuego lento, luego agregue el ajo y el romero. Retirar del fuego y reservar hasta que sea necesario. Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Unte las bolas de masa leudadas con mantequilla de ajo, luego hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que las bolas de masa estén bien cocidas y el centro rezume.","Mientras se hornean las bolas de masa, prepare la salsa de tomate. Calentar el aceite en una cacerola y sofreír los ajos durante 30 segundos. Agregue la passata, el vinagre, el azúcar y las hojuelas de chile y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que espese. Sazone al gusto y agregue la albahaca. Unte las bolas de masa tibia con el resto de la mantequilla de ajo y luego sirva con la salsa de tomate a un lado para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12845,8734,'es','Pan de masa madre de centeno','Este pan básico de masa madre de centeno tiene un profundo sabor a malta que combina bien con pescado ahumado o carnes curadas. El centeno tiene menos gluten que el trigo, por lo que requiere una técnica ligeramente diferente','["250 g de harina integral de centeno","100 g de iniciador de centeno activo (ver arriba)","500 g de harina integral de centeno, extra para espolvorear","10 g de sal fina","25 g de mantequilla blanda para el molde"]','["Día 1: Para comenzar tu entrante, mezcla 50g de harina con 50g de agua tibia en un frasco o, mejor aún, en un recipiente de plástico. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y déjala tapada con un paño de cocina a temperatura ambiente durante 24 h.","Días 2, 3, 4 y 5: mezcle 25 g de harina con 25 g de agua tibia y agregue a la mezcla de ayer. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y déjala tapada con un paño de cocina a temperatura ambiente durante 24 h.","Día 6: La mezcla debe estar muy burbujeante y desprender un fuerte olor a alcohol. Una cucharadita de masa madre debe flotar en agua tibia si está lista. De lo contrario, continúe agregando 25 g de harina y 25 g de agua tibia a la mezcla diariamente hasta que se active. Si su frasco se está llenando, saque la mitad de la mezcla con una cuchara y continúe. Ahora tienes un iniciador de centeno, que es una base con sabor a malta para el pan de masa madre. Guárdalo en el frigorífico (permanecerá inactivo) y 12 horas antes de que quieras usarlo, quítale la mitad con una cuchara y aliméntalo con 100 g de harina y 100 g de agua. Dejar tapado a temperatura ambiente.","Vierta 100 g de masa madre en un bol y agregue 400 g de agua tibia. Batir o frotar los dos con las manos, no te preocupes si quedan algunos grumos. Agregue la harina y junte (con una espátula o con la mano) hasta obtener una masa espesa y pegajosa, asegurándose de que toda la harina esté mezclada, incluidos los trozos secos de los lados del tazón. Cubrir con un paño de cocina húmedo y dejar a temperatura ambiente durante 2 horas.","Incorporar la sal a la masa y dejarla tapada durante 2 horas más.","Unte con mantequilla un molde para pan de 900 g. Espolvorea la superficie de trabajo con más harina de centeno y luego raspa toda la masa. Moldee la masa en un bloque aproximadamente del mismo tamaño que el molde y colóquelo en el molde. Presiona la masa hacia abajo para que se llene por completo y espolvorea generosamente la parte superior con más harina. Deje el pan afuera, descubierto, durante 2 horas hasta que haya subido aproximadamente una cuarta parte y se haya vuelto rugoso en la parte superior, o déjelo en el refrigerador, descubierto, durante la noche. Esto le dará un sabor aún más profundo.","Calienta el horno a 230/210C ventilador/gas 8 con un estante en el medio del horno y un estante debajo con una bandeja para asar encima. Coloque el pan en la bandeja del medio y vierta con cuidado un vaso pequeño de agua en la bandeja para asar. Cocine durante 50-55 minutos hasta que suene hueco al golpearlo. (La mitad del pan indicará 98 ° C en un termómetro digital cuando esté listo). Retire el molde y déjelo enfriar sobre una rejilla durante al menos 4 horas. Se conservará durante 3-4 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:54:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12846,8736,'es','Pan de cocción lenta','Haga una hogaza fácil con esta receta de pan de cocción lenta. Este sencillo proyecto es perfecto para principiantes y utiliza harina integral o blanca fuerte.','["500 g de harina integral fuerte o harina blanca fuerte (o una mezcla de harinas, ver consejo), más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 g de sal marina fina"]','["Mezclar la harina, la levadura y la sal en un bol grande y hacer un hueco en el medio. Mide 350 ml de agua tibia y vierte la mayor parte en el pozo. Mezcle la harina y el agua con los dedos o con una cuchara de madera hasta que se combinen en una masa ligeramente húmeda, esponjosa y manejable; agregue un chorrito más de agua si es necesario.","Coloca la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amasa durante al menos 10 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástica. Esto también se puede hacer en una batidora de mesa con gancho para masa.","Forme una bola grande y apretada con la masa y colóquela sobre un cuadrado de papel para hornear. Use el pergamino para levantar la masa en su olla de cocción lenta, cubra y ajuste la olla de cocción lenta a temperatura alta. Dejar actuar 2 h.","Saca el pan usando el pergamino. La parte inferior debe estar crujiente y la parte superior debe estar elástica, no blanda. (Si tiene un termómetro de cocina digital, la mitad del pan debe estar a 90 °C). Si no está listo, vuelva a colocarlo en la olla de cocción lenta durante 15 minutos y vuelva a probar; podría tardar hasta 2 horas y 30 minutos.","El pan no adquirirá una corteza significativa ni un color dorado en la olla de cocción lenta. Una vez cocido, puedes dejarlo enfriar o meterlo en el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9 durante 5-10 minutos para que coja un poco de color."]','2026-01-11 12:54:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12847,8738,'es','Panes planos','Haga nuestra receta de pan plano más fácil con solo un puñado de ingredientes. Son perfectos para preparar un curry caliente o un shakshuka picante.','["110 g de harina con levadura, más un poco más para espolvorear","110 g de harina integral o harina atta","3 cucharadas de aceite de colza, más un poco más para el bol","pequeña porción de mantequilla, derretida"]','["Tamiza las harinas y 1 cucharadita de sal en un bol grande. Añade 1 cucharada de aceite y 150 ml de agua tibia. Forme una masa suave pero no demasiado pegajosa (es posible que necesite hasta 175 ml de agua). Si se siente demasiado húmedo, agregue un poco de harina. Si está demasiado seco, agregue agua.","Vierta sobre una superficie enharinada y amase durante 4-5 minutos, o hasta que quede suave. Poner la masa en un bol engrasado, tapar y dejar actuar 30 min.","Vierta sobre una superficie enharinada. Dividir en seis bolas y extender cada una hasta formar un círculo fino de 18 a 20 cm de ancho con un rodillo. Si lo prefieres, puedes volver a dividirlo en doce bolas para hacer panes planos más pequeños.","Unte una sartén de base pesada con aceite y cocine un pan plano a fuego alto durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que esté dorado y comience a inflarse. Poner en un plato y untar con mantequilla. Repetir con el resto de la masa."]','2026-01-11 12:54:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12848,8740,'es','Panecillos fáciles','Hornee estos sencillos panecillos blancos para sándwiches, panecillos para hamburguesas o para mojar en sopa. Con sólo un puñado de ingredientes, hacer pan nunca ha sido tan fácil','["500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura de acción rápida.","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo blanca","2 cucharaditas de sal fina","1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol, más un poco más para la superficie de trabajo y el tazón"]','["Echa en un bol la harina, la levadura, el azúcar, la sal y el aceite. Vierta 325 ml de agua tibia y luego mezcle (con una espátula o con la mano) hasta obtener una masa peluda. Asegúrate de que se haya incorporado toda la harina. Cubrir y dejar actuar 10 minutos.","Engrase ligeramente la superficie de trabajo e incline la masa sobre ella. Amasar la masa durante al menos 10 minutos hasta que quede más firme y elástica; si tienes una batidora de pie, puedes hacerlo con un gancho para masa durante 5 minutos. Forme una bola con la masa y colóquela en un recipiente limpio y engrasado. Déjelo por 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y enrolle hasta darle forma de salchicha larga. Corta la masa por la mitad y luego divide cada mitad en cuatro trozos, de modo que tengas ocho porciones del mismo tamaño. Enrolle cada una de ellas formando una bola apretada y colóquela en una bandeja para hornear espolvoreada, dejando algo de espacio entre cada bola para que suba. Cubrir con un paño de cocina húmedo y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 40 minutos a 1 hora o hasta que casi duplique su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 230C/210C ventilador/gas 8. Cuando la masa esté lista, espolvorear cada bola con un poco más de harina. (Si lo desea, puede glasear los panecillos con leche o huevo batido y cubrir con semillas). Hornee durante 25 a 30 minutos, hasta que se doren ligeramente y suene hueco al golpear la base. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 12:54:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12849,8742,'es','pan de harina normal','Este pan sin levadura se elabora con cualquier harina común que tengas en casa. Es un poco más denso que un pan con levadura, pero muy satisfactorio untado con mantequilla o sumergido en sopa caliente.','["500 g de harina blanca o integral, más un extra","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","½ cucharadita de sal fina","1 cucharada de azúcar","350ml-400ml de yogur natural o suero de leche","un puñado de avena o semillas, opcional"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g con papel para hornear. Coloque una bandeja para hornear plana en el horno para que se caliente mucho.","Mezcla la harina, el bicarbonato, la sal y el azúcar en un bol grande hasta que se distribuyan uniformemente. Haga un hueco en el centro y vierta el yogur. Juntar para hacer una masa ligeramente pegajosa.","Espolvoree ligeramente la masa con más harina y forme un tronco gordo, aproximadamente del mismo tamaño que la lata. Poner en la lata. Mojar una cuchara de madera en harina y hacer una línea a lo largo del centro. Cubra con un pequeño puñado de avena o semillas, si lo desea.","Hornee en la bandeja para hornear caliente durante 40-45 minutos o hasta que estén dorados. Deje enfriar en el molde y luego colóquelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo antes de cortarlo en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12850,8744,'es','iniciador de masa madre','Aprenda a preparar una masa madre burbujeante con harina de pan blanco y agua. Después de darle la masa madre durante cinco días, puedes usarla para hacer una hogaza de masa madre.','["250 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, preferiblemente orgánica o molida a la piedra"]','["Día 1: Para comenzar tu entrante, mezcla 50 g de harina con 50 g de agua tibia en un frasco o, mejor aún, en un recipiente de plástico. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y deja, semidescubierta, a temperatura ambiente durante 24 hrs.","Día 2: Mezcle 50 g de harina con 50 g de agua tibia y agregue a la mezcla de ayer. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y deja, semiabierta, a temperatura ambiente otras 24 hrs.","Día 3: Mezcle 50 g de harina con 50 g de agua tibia y agregue a la mezcla de ayer. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y deja, semiabierta, a temperatura ambiente otras 24 hrs.","Día 4: Ahora deberías empezar a ver algo de actividad en la mezcla; Deberían formarse algunas burbujas y burbujear en la parte superior. Mezcle 50 g de harina con 50 g de agua tibia y agregue a la mezcla de ayer. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y deja, semiabierta, a temperatura ambiente otras 24 hrs.","Día 5: La mezcla debe estar muy activa ahora y lista para hacer su levadura (iniciador). Si no burbujea, continúa alimentándolo diariamente hasta que lo haga. Cuando esté listo, debe oler a yogur.","Ya tienes un entrante, que es la base del pan. Tendrás que cuidarlo, ¡pero ponerle un nombre es opcional! Guárdalo en el frigorífico (permanecerá inactivo) y 24 horas antes de usarlo, vierte la mitad y aliméntalo con 100 g de harina y 100 g de agua. Déjalo a temperatura ambiente y debería volver a activarse. Cuanto más tiempo haya estado inactivo el iniciador, más veces será necesario renovarlo (el proceso de vaciar la mitad del iniciador y reemplazarlo con harina nueva y agua) para reactivarlo. Si su masa madre está lista para usar, una cucharadita de la mezcla debe flotar en agua tibia. Ahora puede usar la masa madre para hacer pan blanco de masa madre."]','2026-01-11 12:54:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12851,8746,'es','Focaccia','Olvídese de la focaccia comprada en la tienda y haga una versión casera y sencilla de este clásico pan italiano. Sirva junto con platos de pasta o disfrútelo con ensaladas.','["500 g de harina fuerte para pan, más un poco más para espolvorear","7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharaditas de sal marina fina","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para el molde y para servir","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas","¼ de manojo pequeño de romero, con las ramitas recogidas"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón grande para mezclar. Mezcle la levadura por un lado de la harina y la sal fina por el otro lado. Luego mezcle todo, esta separación inicial evita que la sal mate la levadura.","Hacer un hueco en medio de la harina y añadir 2 cucharadas de aceite y 350-400ml de agua tibia, añadiendo poco a poco hasta tener una masa ligeramente pegajosa (puede que no necesites toda el agua). Espolvorea la superficie de trabajo con harina e inclina la masa sobre ella, raspando los lados del tazón. Amasar durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que la masa esté suave y menos pegajosa. Poner la masa en un bol limpio, cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar durante 1 hora hasta que doble su tamaño.","Engrase una lata rectangular poco profunda (25 x 35 cm). Coloca la masa sobre la superficie de trabajo y luego estírala para llenar el molde. Cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar otros 35-45 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Presiona la masa con los dedos para hacer hoyuelos. Mezcle 1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva, 1 cucharada de agua y la sal en escamas y rocíe sobre el pan. Introduce ramitas de romero en los hoyuelos de la masa.","Hornee por 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Mientras el pan aún esté caliente, rocíe entre 1 y 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva. Córtelo en cuadritos y sírvalo tibio o frío con más aceite de oliva, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:54:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12852,8748,'es','Pan de soda de esinkorn','Utilice harina de escanda, una de las primeras formas de trigo consumidas por la humanidad, para hacer este pan de soda. Ofrece un delicioso sabor rico y a nuez.','["250 g de harina de escanda y un poco más para espolvorear","250 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","1½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","370ml de yogur natural","1 huevo grande"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Espolvorea un poco de harina de einkorn sobre una bandeja para hornear, luego vierte ambas harinas, el bicarbonato de sodio, la sal y el azúcar en un bol y revuelve para combinar. Batir el yogur y el huevo en una jarra.","Haga un hueco en el centro de los ingredientes secos y vierta la mezcla húmeda. Mezcle rápidamente los ingredientes para crear una masa ligeramente pegajosa. Forme una ronda, de unos 4-5 cm de grosor y colóquela en el centro de la bandeja para hornear. Sumerge el mango de una cuchara de madera en un poco de harina y luego presiona ligeramente en la parte superior para crear una cruz. Espolvoree ligeramente con un poco más de harina de escanda.","Hornee en el horno durante 40-45 minutos o hasta que haya subido ligeramente y no haya manchas grises crudas en la cruz. Deje enfriar y luego sirva con mantequilla salada, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:54:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12853,7832,'es','tortillas','Olvídate de las compradas en la tienda y prueba las tortillas caseras. Se almacenarán durante dos días o puedes congelarlos para usarlos más tarde. Son perfectos para envolturas.','["250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","½ cucharadita de sal fina"]','["Combine la harina, el aceite vegetal y la sal en un bol. Vierta 150 ml de agua tibia y amase para unir la mezcla. Retirar del bol y amasar sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada durante unos 5 minutos hasta obtener una bola de masa suave y tersa. Cubrir con un paño de cocina limpio y dejar reposar durante al menos 15 minutos antes de extenderlo.","Cortar la masa en 6 trozos iguales (de unos 75 g cada uno). Extienda cada bola de masa lo más finamente posible sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada. Deben hacer rondas de unos 20 cm de ancho y 2 mm de grosor.","Calienta una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto. Cocine las tortillas durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas y tostadas. Envuélvelos en papel de aluminio y cúbrelos con un paño de cocina para mantenerlos calientes, mientras cocinas el resto. Se conserva bien envuelto durante dos días o se enfría, envuelve y congela hasta por tres meses."]','2026-01-11 12:54:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12854,8750,'es','rollitos al estilo italiano','Cargue panecillos ciabatta con pesto fresco, mozzarella de búfala, alcachofas, pimientos rojos asados ​​y hojas de albahaca para un delicioso sándwich de inspiración italiana.','["2 panecillos estilo ciabatta, tostados","1½ cucharada de pesto fresco","50 g de alcachofas marinadas de un tarro, escurridas y cortadas en rodajas","1 pimiento rojo asado grande de un frasco, escurrido y cortado en rodajas","1 bola de mozzarella de búfala o burrata, desmenuzada","un puñado de hojas de albahaca fresca"]','["Dividir los rollitos y esparcir el pesto sobre las bases. Cubra con las alcachofas, la pimienta, el queso, la albahaca y los panecillos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12855,8752,'es','masa madre blanca','Domina el arte de hacer pan de masa madre con nuestra receta paso a paso. Aprenda a crear un entrante, levain y el propio pan con nuestros consejos de expertos.','["250 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, preferiblemente orgánica o molida a la piedra","1 cucharada de masa madre (ver arriba)","100 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, preferiblemente orgánica o molida a la piedra","levain (ver arriba)","1 kg de harina de pan blanca fuerte, preferiblemente orgánica o molida en piedra, más un poco más para espolvorear","20 g de sal marina fina"]','["Día 1, lunes: Para comenzar tu entrante, mezcla 50 g de harina con 50 g de agua tibia en un frasco o, mejor aún, en un recipiente de plástico. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y deja, semidescubierta, a temperatura ambiente durante 24 hrs.","Día 2, martes: mezcle 50 g de harina con 50 g de agua tibia y agregue a la mezcla de ayer. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y deja, semiabierta, a temperatura ambiente otras 24 hrs.","Día 3, miércoles: mezcle 50 g de harina con 50 g de agua tibia y agregue a la mezcla de ayer. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y deja, semiabierta, a temperatura ambiente otras 24 hrs.","Día 4, jueves: ahora deberías empezar a ver algo de actividad en la mezcla; Deberían formarse algunas burbujas y burbujear en la parte superior. Mezcle 50 g de harina con 50 g de agua tibia y agregue a la mezcla de ayer. Asegúrate de incorporar toda la harina y deja, semiabierta, a temperatura ambiente otras 24 hrs.","Día 5, viernes: La mezcla debe estar muy activa ahora y lista para hacer tu levadura. Si no burbujea, continúa alimentándolo diariamente hasta que lo haga. Cuando esté listo, debe oler a yogur.","Ya tienes un entrante, que es la base del pan. Tendrás que cuidarlo, ¡pero ponerle un nombre es opcional! Guárdalo en el frigorífico (permanecerá inactivo) y 24 horas antes de usarlo, vierte la mitad y aliméntalo con 100 g de harina y 100 g de agua. Déjalo a temperatura ambiente y debería volver a activarse. Cuanto más tiempo haya estado inactivo el iniciador, más veces será necesario renovarlo (el proceso de vaciar la mitad del iniciador y reemplazarlo con harina nueva y agua) para reactivarlo. Si su iniciador está listo para usar, una cucharadita de la mezcla debe flotar en agua tibia.","Para el levain, mezcle 1 cucharada de masa madre con 100 g de harina y 100 g de agua (este es el mismo proceso que utilizar la masa madre, pero debe hacerlo en un recipiente nuevo y aparte, manteniendo la masa madre original como respaldo, ya que esta es la mezcla que usará para hornear el pan). Deje el levain durante 8 horas a temperatura ambiente hasta que se active. Cuando esté lista, una cucharadita de la mezcla debe flotar en agua tibia.","Para el pan, vierta 600 g de agua tibia en el levain y revuelva con una espátula de goma para mezclar; no se preocupe si quedan trozos de levain sin mezclar. Vierta la harina y mezcle todo con una espátula de goma para hacer una masa rugosa, asegurándose de que toda la harina se incorpore uniformemente y que no queden trozos secos en los lados del tazón. Cubra y déjelo en un lugar cálido durante al menos 30 minutos o hasta 4 horas.","Espolvorea sal y añade 50 g de agua a la masa. Pellizque y exprima la sal y el agua en la masa con las manos. Si la masa se vuelve fibrosa (como chicle viejo), sigue trabajando hasta que tenga una textura suave. Dejar por otros 15 minutos.","Mójate las manos, toma la masa de un lado y estírala sobre sí misma, luego repite con el otro lado. Esta técnica de estiramiento ayuda a desarrollar el gluten. Levante la masa y enróllela sobre sí misma, luego cubra y déjela por otros 20-30 minutos. Repita este proceso dos veces más (tres en total), luego deje la masa por otras 2 o 3 horas hasta que haya subido aproximadamente un 30 % y se vea burbujeante y suave.","Con una espátula de goma, raspe la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y divídala en dos. Dobla cada pieza sobre sí misma para crear una bola y luego déjala descubierta durante 30 minutos. Las bolas de masa se esparcirán durante este tiempo.","Espolvoree generosamente dos cestas de fermentación de pan con harina.  Raspe una de las bolas de masa de la superficie de trabajo y luego dóblela sobre sí misma para crear una bola apretada que quede atrapada en todo el aire. Levante la bola y colóquela en una canasta, con la costura hacia arriba, luego transfiérala al refrigerador para que se enfríe durante la noche o hasta por 18 horas. Repita con la otra bola de masa.","Calentar el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9 y poner una cacerola con tapa en el horno a calentar. Corta una hoja de papel para hornear en un cuadrado un poco más grande que la base de uno de los panes. Retire con cuidado la cacerola caliente del horno y retire la tapa. Invierta una barra sobre el papel para hornear y luego, trabajando rápidamente, marque la parte superior en ángulo. Utilice las esquinas del pergamino para levantar el pan y colocarlo en la cacerola. Cubra con la tapa y hornee durante 30 minutos, luego destape con cuidado y continúe horneando durante otros 10 minutos (o más para un acabado más oscuro). Saque con cuidado el pan del plato con una espátula, transfiéralo a una rejilla y déjelo enfriar a temperatura ambiente antes de cortarlo. Repita con el segundo pan."]','2026-01-11 12:54:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12856,5191,'es','Masa para pizza sin gluten','No te pierdas tus delicias italianas favoritas, prepara esta sencilla y rápida masa para pizza sin gluten, lista para convertir en pizzas individuales o bolas de masa.','["400 g de harina panificable sin gluten","2 cucharaditas colmadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","2 cucharaditas de levadura en polvo sin gluten","1 cucharadita de sal fina","1 cucharadita colmada de goma xantana","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Mezcle la harina, el azúcar, el polvo para hornear, la sal y la goma xantana en un tazón grande. Hacer un hueco en el centro y verter 250 ml de agua tibia y el aceite de oliva. Combine rápidamente con las manos para crear una textura espesa, húmeda y pastosa, agregando 20 ml adicionales de agua tibia si la masa se siente un poco seca. Guárdelo en un recipiente hermético o en un recipiente tapado en el refrigerador hasta por 24 horas antes de usarlo. ¿Usar la masa para hacer pizza? Consulta la receta completa de pizza sin gluten."]','2026-01-11 12:54:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12857,7487,'es','Roti','Prepara una deliciosa salsa de curry con un roti tibio. Estos panes planos asiáticos fáciles se hinchan en la sartén y son perfectos para tomar un puñado de un relleno de masala vegetal.','["115 g de harina con levadura","115 g de harina integral","1½ cucharadita de sal","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal y extra para freír","2 cucharaditas de mantequilla, para freír"]','["Tamiza las harinas y la sal en un tazón grande para mezclar. Agregue 1 cucharada de aceite y 175-200 ml de agua tibia y mezcle para formar una masa suave pero no demasiado pegajosa. Si se siente un poco húmedo, agrega un poco más de harina.","Coloca la masa sobre una encimera ligeramente enharinada y amasa durante 4-5 minutos o hasta que quede suave y elástica. Reservar en un bol ligeramente engrasado durante 30 minutos.","Divida la masa en seis trozos del mismo tamaño (si lo desea, pese cada trozo para mayor precisión). Con un rodillo, enrolle cada uno hasta formar un círculo fino de unos 18-20 cm de ancho.","Calienta un poco del aceite y la mantequilla restantes en una sartén de base pesada a fuego alto. Una vez que esté espumoso, agregue el roti extendido, uno a la vez, y cocine durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado o hasta que estén dorados y comiencen a inflarse. Reservar en un plato caliente hasta que esté listo para comer."]','2026-01-11 12:54:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12858,8754,'es','Sándwich de focaccia al pesto','Los rellenos de sus sándwiches se hornean en el pan, lo que lo convierte en una opción fácil de picnic vegetariano que no se empapa.','["500 g de harina blanca fuerte","7 g de levadura de acción rápida","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco extra","paquete pequeño de albahaca, hojas recogidas","2 bolas de mozzarella de 125 g","2 cucharadas de piñones tostados","3 cucharadas de pesto verde"]','["Pon la harina, la levadura y 1 cucharadita de sal en un bol grande, asegurándote de que la levadura y la sal no se toquen. Vierta 350 ml de agua tibia y aceite de oliva y mezcle con una cuchara hasta formar una masa húmeda y elástica. Si usa una batidora de pie, amase durante 5 minutos o hasta que la masa deje de pegarse a los lados del tazón. Si amasa a mano, amase durante 10 minutos sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.","Coloque la masa en un bol ligeramente engrasado, cúbrala con un paño de cocina limpio y húmedo y déjela reposar durante 1 hora o hasta que doble su tamaño.","Forre una fuente para asar de 20 x 30 cm con un trozo de papel para hornear arrugado. Cortar la masa por la mitad y presionar, lo más ligeramente posible, una mitad en el molde para asar, estirándola hasta llenar el molde. Cubrir con la albahaca, la mozzarella y los piñones, luego extender la otra mitad de la masa y colocar encima. Cubra y deje reposar durante 1 hora o hasta que esté suave e hinchado.","Mientras tanto, caliente el horno a 200C/ 180C ventilador/gas 6. Una vez que haya subido, presione las marcas con los dedos en la parte superior de la masa. La masa está lista si quedan las hendiduras; si rebotan dejar la masa más tiempo. Rellene los huecos con pesto, luego espolvoree con un poco de sal marina en escamas y rocíe con un poco de aceite de oliva.","Hornee en el estante superior del horno durante 25-30 minutos, sin abrir la puerta del horno, hasta que esté dorado.","Pasar a una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo. Llévelo entero a su picnic y córtelo en 10 a 12 sándwiches al momento de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12859,8756,'es','Paletilla de cordero y pan plano de berenjena ahumada','Esto se basa libremente en el plato turco de lahmacun, pero con una base de pan más espesa similar a la pizza. Excelente para usar las sobras de cordero, la berenjena carbonizada le da una profundidad ahumada.','["7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","200 g de harina ''00''","200 g de harina fuerte para pan","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 berenjena","½ cebolla morada, cortada finamente","150 g de sobras de cordero, desmenuzadas o picadas","2 cucharadas de perejil finamente picado","1 tomate, finamente picado","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 diente de ajo, machacado","pizca de comino molido","pizca de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de melaza de granada (opcional)","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de piñones","1 cucharadita de tahini"]','["Para hacer el pan plano, ponemos en una jarra la levadura y 250ml de agua tibia y mezclamos bien. Dejar reposar unos minutos.","Tamizar las harinas en un bol con 2 cucharaditas de sal, luego incorporar lentamente la mezcla de levadura, revolviendo con una cuchara de madera. Agrega el aceite y coloca la masa sobre una superficie limpia. Amasar durante 5 minutos hasta obtener una masa suave y elástica. Regresar al bol, cubrir con film transparente y dejar reposar 30 minutos para que se infle.","Cocine la berenjena sobre una llama de gas o debajo de una parrilla caliente hasta que esté humeante y colapse; debe estar lo suficientemente suave como para separarla con un tenedor. Dejar enfriar.","Saque la masa y amase durante unos minutos más, luego divídala en cuatro y enrolle cada pieza hasta formar una bola suave. Envuelva tres en film transparente y congélelos para usarlos más adelante.","Calentar el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 8. Aplanar la bola de masa con la palma de la mano y extenderla hasta formar una base ancha y plana de 25-30 cm de largo. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear engrasada y déjelo reposar un poco mientras prepara la cobertura.","Saque la pulpa suave y ahumada de la berenjena carbonizada en un tazón y combine con todos los demás ingredientes de la cobertura, excepto los piñones. Extienda la cobertura sobre el pan plano y luego esparza sobre los piñones. Hornee durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que el pan esté inflado y dorado y la cobertura esté bien caliente.","Mezcla el tahini con 1 cucharada de agua para formar un aderezo suave. Rocíe sobre el pan plano, córtelo en trozos y comparta."]','2026-01-11 12:54:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12860,8758,'es','Bollos bao al vapor','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Rellene estos panecillos chinos al vapor con carne de cerdo a la barbacoa y verduras encurtidas para un bocado perfecto para la fiesta del Año Nuevo Chino.','["525 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1½ cucharada de azúcar en polvo, más una pizca","1 cucharadita de levadura seca de acción rápida","50ml de leche","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol, más un extra para engrasar y cepillar","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear"]','["Mezcle la harina, el azúcar y 1/2 cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande (ver consejo). Disolver la levadura y una pizca de sal en 1 cucharada de agua tibia, luego añadirla a la harina con la leche, el aceite, el vinagre y 200 ml de agua. Mezcle hasta obtener una masa, agregando un poco más de agua si es necesario.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase durante 10 a 15 minutos, o hasta que quede suave. Colóquelo en un recipiente ligeramente engrasado, cubra con un paño húmedo y déjelo reposar durante 2 horas o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Incline la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia y golpéela. Aplana la masa con las manos, luego espolvorea el polvo de hornear y amasa durante 5 minutos.","Estire la masa en forma de salchicha larga, de unos 3 cm de grosor, luego córtela en trozos de unos 3 cm de ancho; debería tener 18.","En la palma de tu mano, forma una bola con cada trozo de masa y déjala reposar durante 2-3 minutos.","Utilice un rodillo para extender cada bola, una por una, hasta darles una forma ovalada de unos 3-4 mm de grosor. Frote la superficie de los óvalos de masa con aceite y unte un poco de aceite con un palillo.","Coloca el palillo engrasado en el centro de cada óvalo. Doble la masa sobre el palillo y luego sáquelo lentamente.","Transfiera los bollos preparados a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear, cúbralos con un paño de cocina limpio o una película adhesiva ligeramente engrasada y déjelos reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora y 30 minutos, o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calienta una vaporera grande a fuego medio-alto. Cocine los panecillos al vapor durante 8 minutos hasta que estén inflados (deberá hacerlo en tandas). Abra cada panecillo y rellénelo con cerdo asado, zanahoria y mooli en escabeche. Cómelos mientras aún estén calientes."]','2026-01-11 12:54:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12861,6689,'es','pan de nube','Ligero y esponjoso, este sustituto del pan hace honor a su nombre. Úselo como una opción baja en carbohidratos para sándwiches.','["aceite o mantequilla para engrasar","4 huevos, separados","50 g de queso crema","¼ cucharadita de crémor tártaro","½ cucharadita de semillas de nigella"]','["Caliente el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2 y forre 2 bandejas para hornear grandes con papel de horno, luego engrase bien con mantequilla o aceite.","En un tazón grande y con la ayuda de unas varillas eléctricas, bata las claras hasta que se formen picos rígidos. Deberías poder darle la vuelta al recipiente con cuidado sin que se caiga.","En otro bol, ponga las yemas de huevo, el queso crema y el crémor tártaro y luego mezcle (no es necesario lavar las batidoras primero) hasta que quede una mezcla suave, pálida y espumosa. A continuación, incorpora las claras, una cucharada a la vez, a la mezcla de yemas, sé lo más suave posible con esto para no quitar demasiado aire y finalmente incorpora las semillas de nigella y sazona con sal y pimienta.","Vierta con cuidado la mezcla en las bandejas para hornear preparadas; si la mezcla está un poco líquida cuando llegue al fondo del tazón, no use las últimas cucharadas; solo use la mezcla realmente esponjosa en la parte superior. Hornee durante 20 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y crujiente por encima. Deje enfriar por unos momentos antes de retirarlo con cuidado del papel con una espátula."]','2026-01-11 12:54:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12862,7992,'es','Pan para compartir al estilo turco','Esta versión profunda de una clásica "pizza" turca llamada lahmacun, cubierta con carne picada de cordero picante y cebolla morada, se corta en trozos pequeños para disfrutar de un refrigerio de fiesta sin complicaciones pero lleno de sabor.','["Paquete de 500 g de mezcla para pan ciabatta","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, en cuartos","1 diente de ajo","1 cucharadita de canela","1 cucharadita de comino","¼ cucharadita de chile en polvo","un puñado de perejil de hoja plana","2 cucharadas de pasta de tomate seco","250 g de carne picada de cordero","150 g de baba ganoush en olla","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, cortada en aros finos","50 ml de vinagre de vino tinto","50 g de piñones tostados","1 cucharada de perejil de hoja plana picado"]','["Haga la masa de pan ciabatta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Una vez que haya subido, devuélvelo sacando un poco de aire y amasándolo un poco. Enrolle hasta darle forma ovalada (aproximadamente 35 x 25 cm) y colóquela en una bandeja para hornear grande. Unte ligeramente toda la superficie con aceite de oliva y cubra con film transparente. Déjalo reposar durante 30 minutos mientras preparas la cobertura.","Coloque todos los ingredientes de la cobertura, excepto el cordero, en un procesador de alimentos pequeño y mezcle hasta que estén finamente picados. Vierta en un tazón grande, agregue el cordero, sazone bien y luego aplaste todo con las manos hasta que esté bien mezclado. Enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. En una cacerola pequeña, calentar los aros de cebolla morada con el vinagre y 1 cucharada de agua hasta que estén muy suaves, luego dejar enfriar.","Salpique la superficie de la masa con la cobertura de cordero; presione suavemente hacia abajo con los dedos para esparcirla uniformemente sobre la superficie, pero trate de no sacar demasiado aire de la masa. Hornee en el horno durante 15-20 minutos o hasta que la base esté leudada y dorada, y la carne esté bien cocida y caramelizada en los bordes.","Mientras tanto, haz el aderezo. Mezcle el baba ganoush, el jugo de limón y el aceite de oliva, luego refrigere hasta servir.","Una vez horneado el pan, transfiérelo a una tabla de madera. Escurrir las cebollas en un colador de metal y esparcirlas sobre el pan. Rocíe sobre el aderezo de baba ganoush, dejando un poco a un lado como salsa, luego espolvoree sobre los piñones y el perejil. Servir caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:54:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12863,8760,'es','Pan de soda de calabacín y cheddar','Este pan sencillo es fácil de hacer pero tiene mucho sabor y textura, con queso curado, calabacines rallados, avena y tomillo.','["400 g de harina con levadura, más un poco más para espolvorear","2 calabacines medianos","50 g de copos de avena","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","75 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","manojo pequeño de tomillo, solo las hojas","Bote de 284 ml de suero de leche","1 cucharada de miel clara","1 huevo batido"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y espolvorear una bandeja para horno con un poco de harina. Coloque un rallador encima de un paño de cocina limpio y ralle los calabacines en trozos grandes. Levanta las esquinas del paño de cocina y, sosteniéndolo sobre el fregadero, gíralo para compactar los calabacines y exprimir todo el líquido que puedas.","Pon en un bol grande la harina, la avena, el bicarbonato y 1 cucharadita de sal fina. Añade la mayor parte del queso cheddar (reserva un poco para la parte superior), el tomillo y el calabacín. Mezcle el suero de leche y la miel, luego vierta en la mezcla de harina. Revuelva con una cuchara de madera hasta que la masa comience a formar grumos, luego inclínela sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase brevemente para unir todos los trozos sueltos; trate de no trabajar demasiado la masa o el pan quedará pesado.","Forme una hogaza redonda y colóquela en la bandeja para hornear. Pincelar con huevo y espolvorear con el queso restante. Use un cuchillo afilado para marcar una cruz profunda en la parte superior del pan, luego hornee durante 40 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Es mejor servirlo caliente, pero las sobras se conservarán durante 1 o 2 días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12864,8762,'es','Tés de gruyer y cebolla y orilla','Estos sabrosos panecillos blancos están rellenos de queso y cebolla; deje que todos se sirvan ellos mismos como parte de un buffet.','["500 g de harina fuerte para pan, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","pizca de azúcar","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más 2 cucharaditas extra","nuez de mantequilla","2 cebollas, en rodajas finas","140 g de gruyere rallado","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo"]','["En un tazón grande, combine la harina, la levadura, el azúcar y 1 cucharadita de sal. Hacer un hueco en el centro y verter poco a poco 350 ml de agua tibia, revolviendo y mezclando el agua con la harina. Si la mezcla está un poco húmeda, agrega un poco más de harina; Si está un poco seco, agrega un poco más de agua. La masa debe quedar blanda pero no demasiado pegajosa. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada y amase durante unos 10 minutos hasta que la masa esté elástica pero suave. Poner en un tazón grande enharinado, cubrir con film transparente y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido hasta que duplique su tamaño (esto tomará entre 45 minutos y 1 hora).","Mientras la masa sube, calentar 2 cucharadas de aceite y mantequilla en una sartén antiadherente. Agregue las cebollas y cocine a fuego medio durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que estén doradas y blandas. Deje enfriar, luego agregue el queso y las hojas de tomillo y sazone.","Una vez que la masa haya subido y haya duplicado su tamaño, retírela y divídala en 12 bolas. Enharine una superficie de trabajo y extienda las bolas hasta que tengan unos 10 cm de ancho. Coloque 1 cucharada colmada de la mezcla de cebolla en el medio de la masa y junte los bordes sobre el relleno, presionando para sellar. Haz esto con todas las bolitas, reservando un poco de la mezcla de cebolla. Engrase una bandeja para hornear y coloque las bolas, con la costura hacia abajo, en filas. Cubrir con film transparente engrasado y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante otros 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Una vez que los bollos hayan subido un poco más y comiencen a unirse, retire el film transparente, rocíe con el aceite restante y vierta sobre la mezcla de cebolla sobrante. Hornee por 10 minutos, luego baje el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y cocine por otros 10 minutos. Los panecillos deben quedar dorados y crujientes por debajo. Dejar enfriar antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12865,8764,'es','Pizzas de pan de ajo','Un snack fresco y fácil de preparar','["500 g de harina blanca fuerte, más un poco para enrollar","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","1 cucharadita de sal","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","50 g de mantequilla, ablandada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","Paquete de 300 g de mozzarella escurrida","4 tomates, picados en trozos grandes","un puñado de hojas de albahaca, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico"]','["Vierta todos los ingredientes base en un\r\ntazón para mezclar. Vierta sobre 300 ml tibios.\r\nagua – no demasiado caliente. Revuelva bastante fuerte con un\r\nvierta con una cuchara hasta que la mezcla se una.","Colocar sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.\r\ny amasar 2-3 veces hasta que la mezcla\r\nforma una bola. Divida la masa en 8 del mismo tamaño.\r\npiezas. Tome 1 pieza, dejando el\r\nresto ligeramente cubierto con aceite engrasado\r\npelícula adhesiva. Enharinar ligeramente la superficie nuevamente.\r\ny use un rodillo para extender la masa\r\nuna ronda de unos 15 cm de diámetro o tan delgada\r\ncomo puedas. Pon la pizza en una bandeja para hornear.","Mezclar la mantequilla y triturar.\r\najo, luego esparcir un poco sobre la pizza.\r\nCortar la mozzarella en tiras finas y\r\ndispersarse. Repita para el resto\r\ntrozos de masa. Deberías poder encajar\r\n2 pizzas por bandeja para hornear; dependiendo de\r\n¿Cuántas bandejas para hornear tienes?\r\nEs posible que tenga que cocinar en tandas.","Calentar el horno a 240C/ventilador 220C/gas 9.\r\nHornee las pizzas durante 12 a 15 minutos hasta que estén crujientes y\r\nbien cocido. Mientras tanto, mezcle\r\nlos ingredientes restantes, luego sazone\r\nbueno. Cuando la pizza sale del\r\nhorno, cubra con la mezcla de tomate y\r\nservir de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 12:54:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12866,8766,'es','Focaccia de alcachofas','Inyecte el sabor de Italia en sus picnics y cenas al aire libre con esta irresistiblemente deliciosa focaccia.','["500 g de harina fuerte","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","1 cucharadita colmada de sal","manojo grande de romero","Tarro de 285g de antipasti de alcachofas en aceite (nosotros utilizamos Sacla)","50 g de parmesano recién rallado (o una alternativa vegetariana), más un poco más para rallar"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón grande y haga un hueco en el centro. Agregue la levadura y la sal, luego vierta gradualmente 350 ml de agua tibia, revolviendo sobre la marcha. Unir la masa con una cuchara y luego con las manos. Debe quedar suave, pero no demasiado pegajoso ni húmedo. Si no se une, vierte un poco más de agua; Si la masa está demasiado húmeda, agregue más harina. Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada y amase durante unos 10 minutos, o hasta que esté suave y terso y rebote cuando se empuja con un dedo. Dejar reposar en un recipiente engrasado cubierto con film transparente en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora o Lleno de sabores de verano hasta que la masa haya duplicado su tamaño.","Quite las hojas de la mitad del romero y pique finamente. Rompe el resto en trozos más pequeños. Escurre las alcachofas, reserva el aceite y pícalas en trozos.","Cuando haya subido, incline la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo engrasada y extiéndala formando un rectángulo de 35 x 45 cm. Desliza una bandeja para hornear engrasada debajo de la mitad de la masa. Cubra la mitad con las alcachofas, todo el parmesano y el romero. Moler sobre pimienta negra y rociar con un poco del aceite reservado. Dobla la otra mitad de la masa, presionando los bordes hacia abajo para sellar. Dejar reposar en un lugar cálido, cubierto con film transparente engrasado, durante 30 minutos. Calentar el horno a 240C/ventilador 220C/gas 9.","Rocíe con un poco más de aceite y haga mellas en la parte superior con los dedos. Introduce las ramitas de romero en las abolladuras y ralla un poco más de queso. Hornee durante 15 minutos, hasta que esté dorado y levado. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla durante 30 minutos, cortar en cuadritos y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12867,8768,'es','Rollitos de roquefort y nueces','Utilice su queso favorito en estos deliciosos panecillos del juez de Great British Bake Off, Paul Hollywood.','["140 g de nueces","100 g de harina integral","400 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","Sobre de 14 g de levadura de acción rápida","25 g de mantequilla","250 g de queso roquefort desmenuzado","2 huevos medianos, batidos"]','["Coloca las nueces en un procesador de alimentos.\r\ny pulsa para picar finamente; dejar a un lado.\r\nPoner las harinas, 10g de sal, la levadura, la mantequilla y\r\n300 ml de agua en un bol, revuelva y\r\nComience a masajear los ingredientes durante un\r\nminuto. Si la mezcla parece seca, agregue\r\nmás agua una cucharada a la vez para hacer una\r\nmasa suave pero no pegajosa, luego amasar\r\nel bol por un par de minutos más\r\npara unir la masa.","Coloca la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.\r\nsuperficie de trabajo y amasar bien durante 10 minutos\r\nantes de regresar al bol. Cubrir el\r\nRecipiente con film transparente y dejar reposar.\r\nun lugar cálido durante 1 hora. Amasar brevemente el\r\nnueces en la masa, luego dejar reposar\r\nen el bol durante 20 minutos más.","Coloca la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.\r\nsuperficie y extiéndalo formando un rectángulo,\r\n50 x 20 cm aproximadamente, 1 cm de espesor. espolvorear\r\nel Roquefort uniformemente sobre la masa y\r\npresione ligeramente. Coloque el rectángulo\r\na lo ancho frente a usted y enrolle el\r\nrectángulo como un panecillo suizo. Cortar en 8 del mismo tamaño\r\ntrozos y colocarlos sobre una superficie ligeramente\r\nbandeja para hornear engrasada, con el lado cortado hacia abajo. Portada\r\ncon film transparente y dejar reposar 1 h.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nCepille cada ronda de masa con la\r\nhuevo batido y hornear por 20 min. salir\r\ndejar enfriar unos minutos y comer mientras\r\ntodavía caliente. Estos son deliciosos en su\r\nsolo o servido con una sopa o un trozo\r\nEnsalada con manzana."]','2026-01-11 12:54:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12868,5101,'es','Pan con tomates secos sin gluten','Una receta rápida de pan sin gluten, sin necesidad de levadura, lista en menos de una hora','["200 g de harina blanca sin gluten (Doves Farm está disponible en la mayoría de los supermercados)","1 cucharadita de sal","3 cucharaditas de levadura en polvo sin gluten","284 ml de suero de leche (o la misma cantidad de leche entera con un chorrito de jugo de limón)","3 huevos","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","50 g de tomates secos en aceite (unos 6-8), picados en trozos grandes","25 g de parmesano (o parmazano vegetariano), rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Mezclar la harina, la sal y el polvo para hornear en un tazón grande. en\r\nEn un recipiente aparte, mezcle el suero de leche, los huevos, el puré de tomate y el aceite. Incorpora los ingredientes húmedos a los secos, luego agrega los tomates secos y la mitad del parmesano.","Engrase un molde para pan de 900 g y vierta la mezcla. Espolvoree el queso parmesano restante encima y hornee durante 50-60 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Colóquelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe."]','2026-01-11 12:54:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12869,8770,'es','Focaccia con pesto y mozzarella','Este pan al pesto casero es un delicioso acompañamiento de la comida italiana','["500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco para espolvorear","1 ½ cucharadita de sal","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un poco para rociar","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, escurrida","5 cucharadas de pesto (comprado en la tienda o consulte la receta a continuación)","sal marina, para servir (opcional)"]','["Poner la harina en un bol y mezclar con la\r\nsal. Mezclar la levadura en 325 ml de agua tibia.\r\nAgrega el agua y el aceite a la harina, luego mezcla.\r\nbien con un raspador de plástico o con las manos.\r\nCuando se incorpora la mayor parte del líquido,\r\nusa tus manos para traer todos los ingredientes\r\njuntos formando una bola de masa.","Inclinar la masa sobre una encimera.\r\nligeramente espolvoreado con harina y trabajarlo\r\ntirando y estirando durante al menos 10 minutos.\r\nIntente introducir la mayor cantidad de aire posible.\r\nPoner la bola de masa trabajada en un\r\nrecipiente bien engrasado, cubrir con un poco más\r\naceite y un paño de cocina o film transparente. dejar para\r\nDescanse aproximadamente 1 hora en un lugar sin corrientes de aire.\r\nlugar cálido, hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Ahora estira la masa sobre una\r\nbandeja para hornear hasta que tenga unos 20 x 30 cm.\r\nDeje que la masa vuelva a crecer hasta aproximadamente\r\nla mitad de alto nuevamente, alrededor de 30-40 minutos en\r\nun lugar cálido y sin corrientes de aire,\r\ncubierto con un paño de cocina.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nCuando la masa haya subido, presione su\r\nIntroduzca los dedos suavemente para hacer algunos agujeros.\r\nHornee durante unos 15 minutos y luego retírelo.\r\ndel horno. Rompe la mozzarella,\r\nluego hornee por otros 5-10 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado y bien cocido. rociar sobre\r\nel pesto y espolvorear con sal marina, si\r\ncomo. Servir de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 12:54:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12870,8772,'es','Pan mixto de semillas','Esta receta utiliza un método básico de masa de pan, pero la mezcla de harinas le da una textura y un sabor interesantes.','["350 g de harina integral","100 g de harina de centeno","50 g de harina de quinua o harina extra de centeno","2 cucharaditas de sal","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","Paquete de 125 g de semillas de girasol.","25 g de semillas de alcaravea","50 g de semillas de amapola y de sésamo cada una","75ml de melaza negra","300ml de agua"]','["Mezcle las harinas, la sal, la levadura, el girasol, la alcaravea y las semillas de amapola en un bol grande. Agrega la melaza negra y el agua, luego mezcla bien. Si la masa parece un poco dura, agregue 1 cucharada o más de agua. Mezclar bien, luego colocar sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amasar suavemente la masa durante 7 minutos. Vuelva a colocarlo en un recipiente ligeramente engrasado durante aproximadamente 2 horas hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Forre una bandeja con papel para hornear. Incline la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y golpee hacia atrás, luego moldee suavemente la masa hasta formar una bola. Enrolle la masa con las semillas de sésamo y colóquela en la bandeja para hornear para que repose durante una hora más hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Caliente el horno a 220 ° C / ventilador 200 ° C / gas 7. Corte la parte superior en cortes cruzados con un cuchillo afilado y hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que se dore y el pan suene hueco cuando se golpea por debajo. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 12:54:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12871,8774,'es','pan blanco facil','Una gran receta para una panificadora eléctrica, o hazla de la forma tradicional','["500 g de harina blanca fuerte y un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharaditas de sal","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","300ml de agua"]','["Mezclar la harina, la sal y la levadura en un bol grande. Hacer un hueco en el centro, luego agregar el aceite y el agua y mezclar bien. Si la masa parece un poco rígida, agregue 1-2 cucharadas de agua, mezcle bien, luego colóquela sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase. Una vez que la masa esté satinada, colóquela en un bol ligeramente engrasado. Dejar reposar durante 1 hora hasta que doble su tamaño o colocar en el frigorífico durante la noche.","Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Golpee la masa hacia atrás y luego moldee suavemente la masa hasta formar una bola. Colóquelo sobre el papel para hornear para que repose durante una hora más hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. Espolvorear el pan con harina y cortar una cruz de unos 6 cm de largo en la parte superior del pan con un cuchillo afilado. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que se dore y el pan suene hueco al golpearlo por debajo. genial\r\nsobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 12:54:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12872,8776,'es','Pan de centeno','Esta receta de pan de centeno tiene menos gluten que el pan blanco promedio; esta receta utiliza harina blanca o integral para darle una textura ligera, pero puedes experimentar con las proporciones.','["200 g de harina de centeno, más un poco más para espolvorear","200 g de harina blanca o integral fuerte","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","½ cucharadita de sal fina","1 cucharada de miel","1 cucharadita de semillas de alcaravea (opcional)"]','["Echar en un bol las harinas, la levadura y la sal. En una jarra mezcla la miel con 250ml de agua tibia, vierte el líquido en el bol y mezcla hasta formar una masa. La harina de centeno puede estar bastante seca y absorbe mucha agua; si la masa se ve demasiado seca, agregue más agua tibia hasta obtener una masa suave. Vierta sobre la superficie de trabajo y amase durante 10 minutos hasta que quede suave. El centeno contiene menos gluten que la harina blanca, por lo que la masa no se sentirá tan elástica como una hogaza blanca convencional.","Coloque la masa en un recipiente bien engrasado, cubra con film transparente y déjela reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1-2 horas, o hasta que aproximadamente duplique su tamaño.  Espolvorea un molde para pan de 900 g/2 lb con harina.","Vuelva a colocar la masa sobre la superficie de trabajo y amase brevemente para eliminar las burbujas de aire. Si usa semillas de alcaravea, incorpórelas a la masa.  Forme una hogaza ovalada suave y colóquela en su lata.  Cubra la lata con film transparente engrasado y déjela reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 a 1,5 horas más, o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Retire el film transparente y espolvoree la superficie del pan con harina de centeno. Haga algunas incisiones en ángulo y luego hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que tenga un color marrón oscuro y suene hueco al golpearlo. Transfiera a una rejilla para enfriar y déjela enfriar durante al menos 20 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12873,9449,'es','Pan blanco clásico','Una vez que domines este pan básico, el mundo de la elaboración del pan será tu ostra.','["500 g de harina blanca fuerte y un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de sal","hasta 350 ml de agua tibia","un poco de aceite de girasol, para engrasar"]','["Hacer la masa volcando la harina, la levadura\r\ny sal en un bol grande y haciendo un pozo\r\nen el medio. Vierta la mayor parte del agua y\r\nuse sus dedos o una cuchara de madera para mezclar\r\nla harina y el agua juntas hasta que se combinen\r\nhasta obtener una masa ligeramente húmeda, esponjosa y trabajable\r\n- añadir un chorrito más de agua si es necesario. consejo\r\nla masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y\r\namase durante al menos 10 minutos hasta que quede suave y\r\nelástico. Esto también se puede hacer en una mesa.\r\nbatidora con gancho para masa. colocar la masa\r\nen un recipiente limpio engrasado, cubrir con film transparente\r\ny dejar reposar hasta que doble su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7.\r\nDerribar la masa inclinándola hacia atrás.\r\nsobre una superficie enharinada y empujando el aire\r\nfuera. Moldea la masa en forma de pelota de rugby.\r\nque quepa en un molde para pan de 900 g y colóquelo en el\r\nestaño. Cubrir con un paño de cocina limpio y dejar\r\npara fermentar durante 30 minutos. Espolvorea la parte superior del pan.\r\ncon un poco más de harina y cortar la parte superior con\r\nun cuchillo afilado si quieres. Hornear el pan para\r\n15 minutos, luego reduzca el fuego a 190C/ventilador\r\n170C/gas 5 y continuar horneando durante 30 minutos.\r\nhasta que el pan suene hueco al retirarlo\r\nde la lata y se golpea la base. salir\r\nel pan sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.\r\nEl pan se mantendrá fresco en un recipiente hermético.\r\ndurante 3 días o se puede congelar durante 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:54:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12874,7683,'es','pan rústico','Este es un pan tradicional siciliano que puedes hacer por la mañana para salir adelante','["250 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","1 cucharadita de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","200 ml de agua con gas","sémola, para espolvorear (opcional)","romero finamente picado y sal Maldon, para espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. Mezclar la harina, la levadura y 1/2 cucharadita de sal. Agrega el aceite, luego vierte el agua gradualmente, agregando lo suficiente para hacer una masa suave. Amasar la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada durante unos 4-5 minutos hasta que la masa se sienta fuerte, saltarina y con un tacto sedoso.","Corta la masa en 8 trozos y luego extiéndela en círculos gruesos de unos 16-17 cm de diámetro. (No los apile uno encima del otro o se pegarán).","Espolvorea una o dos bandejas para hornear con sémola si la tienes; de lo contrario, déjala sola. Coloque los panes en las bandejas y déjelos reposar durante 5 minutos, luego espolvoree con romero, sal y pimienta y rocíe con aceite de oliva. Hornee en tandas durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que estén hinchados y dorados. Se puede preparar con 3-4 horas de anticipación."]','2026-01-11 12:54:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12875,8778,'es','Masa básica de pan granero (para panecillos o una hogaza grande)','No hay nada mejor que el pan casero recién salido del horno: listo en sólo 35 minutos','["225 g de harina blanca fuerte","225 g de harina de pan granero malteada","1 cucharadita de sal","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","Sobre de 7 g de levadura fácil de mezclar","150ml de leche tibia","1 huevo batido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","100-150 ml de agua tibia"]','["Mezcle las harinas y la sal en un tazón grande, luego agregue el azúcar.\r\ny levadura. Hacer un hueco en el centro de la harina y verter la leche tibia, el huevo batido, el aceite de oliva y suficiente agua para formar una masa suave y húmeda.","Sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, amase la masa durante 10 minutos hasta que quede suave. poner\r\nColocar la masa en un bol ligeramente engrasado, cubrir con film transparente engrasado y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido hasta que doble su tamaño. La masa ya está lista para darle forma.","Para hacer 12 panecillos, divide la masa en 12 trozos y dale forma de panecillos. Enharine ligeramente 3 bandejas para hornear. Coloque los rollos sobre las hojas y cúbralos sin apretar con una película adhesiva engrasada. Reservar en un lugar cálido durante 30 minutos.\r\no hasta que hayan duplicado su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Untar el pan con huevo batido y espolvorear con semillas de sésamo y amapola. Hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén bien dorados y bien leudados.","Para hacer un pan de maceta, deje reposar la masa durante aproximadamente 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño. Remoje una maceta de terracota grande u ocho pequeñas en agua fría durante unos 30 minutos. Seque bien, luego cepille el interior de las macetas con aceite y cubra con papel pergamino. Forme una masa redonda y suave con una forma aproximadamente puntiaguda en un extremo para que llene la olla hasta la mitad. Dejar hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Pintar la parte superior del pan con huevo batido, espolvorear con semillas de amapola o sésamo y hornear durante 45-50 minutos (15-20 minutos para panes pequeños) hasta que estén dorados. Déjalo reposar durante 5-10 minutos, luego sácalo de la olla y déjalo enfriar sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 12:54:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12876,8780,'es','Pan de hoguera con queso','Este sabroso pan, que se come mejor fresco, también se puede preparar con antelación y congelar, perfecto para la Noche de las Hogueras.','["200 g de harina integral","200 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 cucharaditas de cremor tártaro","1 cucharadita de sal","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","25 g de mantequilla, derretida","300ml de leche, a temperatura ambiente","175 g de queso cheddar rallado grueso","3 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza","85 g de pimientos asados ​​de un frasco, escurridos y picados"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Tamizar el\r\nSeque los ingredientes en un tazón grande y haga una gran\r\nbien en el medio. Combine la mantequilla derretida y\r\nleche, luego verter en el pozo. Mezclar hasta obtener una masa suave.","Espolvorea la superficie de trabajo con harina. Añadir la mayor parte de\r\nel queso cheddar, 2 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza y el\r\npimientos picados a la masa. Amasar suavemente para\r\ncombine sobre la superficie enharinada. Dividir en 8 trozos\r\ny forme rondas rugosas de dos dedos de profundidad.","Coloque las piezas una al lado de la otra sobre una bandeja para hornear enharinada.\r\nhoja, esparcir el resto del queso cheddar y la calabaza\r\nsemillas por encima y hornee por 30 minutos hasta que estén doradas.\r\nSe dore y el queso burbujee. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla\r\ny comer mientras esté caliente. El pan se puede congelar en este\r\npunto. Para recalentar, envuelva bien el pan en papel de aluminio y\r\nHornee a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6 durante unos 30 minutos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12877,8782,'es','Pimienta negra molida y pan de higos','Un golpe ardiente que combina bien con el queso','["650 g de harina blanca fuerte","2 cucharaditas de pimienta negra molida","2 cucharaditas de sal","7 g de sobre de levadura fácil de mezclar","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","425-450 ml/¾ pinta-16 fl oz de agua tibia","350 g de higos secos listos para comer, picados en trozos grandes"]','["En un tazón grande, mezcle la harina, la pimienta, la sal y la levadura. Agrega el aceite de oliva y suficiente agua tibia para formar una masa suave. Colóquelo sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase durante 10 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástico.","Coloque la masa en un tazón grande ligeramente engrasado. Cubrir con film transparente engrasado y dejar en un lugar cálido durante aproximadamente 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño. Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Cuando la masa haya subido, amasarla nuevamente para incorporar los higos, empujando la masa y amasándola ligeramente. No trabajes demasiado la masa; puede parecer bastante tosco.","Forme un óvalo rugoso con la masa y colóquela en una bandeja para hornear ligeramente enharinada. Con unas tijeras, corta la parte superior del pan y espolvorea un poco de harina. Déjelo reposar nuevamente, sin tapar, hasta que se hinche ligeramente, aproximadamente de 10 a 15 minutos (si la cocina está caliente). Hornee durante 40-45 minutos hasta que suene hueco cuando lo golpee por debajo, luego enfríe sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 12:54:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12878,8784,'es','Focaccia de cebolla morada y romero','Este pan sencillo y rústico es un excelente compañero para ensaladas y antipasti.','["1 lote de masa de pan blanco (consulte la receta ''Combina bien'' a continuación)","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas grandes, cortadas en rodajas","un puñado de ramitas de romero","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas"]','["Hacer la masa básica añadiendo 2 cucharadas de aceituna.\r\naceite y sólo una pizca de sal. mientras la masa\r\nestá subiendo, cocine las cebollas en 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva durante\r\n5 minutos hasta que esté suave, luego reserve.","Cuando la masa haya subido, retírala.\r\ny estirarlo para que quepa en un molde para panecillos suizos engrasado.\r\nunos 25 x 35 cm. Dejar reposar la masa.\r\ndurante unos 20 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.\r\nExtender las cebollas sobre la masa y\r\nespolvorear con el romero. presiona tus dedos\r\nen la masa para hacer hoyuelos, rocíe la\r\nel aceite restante y espolvorear sobre la sal,\r\nluego hornee por 30 minutos hasta que esté dorado. salir\r\ndejar enfriar y luego servir cortado o cortado en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12879,8786,'es','Remolinos de pan de oliva','Estos deliciosos panecillos salados son un excelente acompañamiento para un almuerzo','["500 g de harina blanca fuerte, más un poco para enrollar","1 cucharadita de sal","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca fácil de mezclar","6 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un poco para untar","manojo pequeño de albahaca","170 g de aceitunas negras sin hueso (unos 200 g de peso sin hueso)","1 diente de ajo, machacado","4 anchoas en lata (opcional)","50 g de aceitunas verdes deshuesadas"]','["En un bol grande, mezcle la harina, la sal,\r\nlevadura, 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva y 300 ml tibios\r\nagua, para hacer una masa suave. Amasar por\r\nmano durante 10 minutos o con el gancho amasador\r\nen un procesador de alimentos o batidora durante 5 minutos.\r\nVuelva a colocar la masa en el recipiente limpio.\r\ntazón para mezclar, luego cubra el tazón con\r\nfilm transparente engrasado. Dejar reposar una hora\r\nen un lugar cálido hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Descartar\r\ncualquier tallo de albahaca duro (deje los tiernos\r\nencendido) y colóquelo en un mini procesador de alimentos o\r\nVaso de batidora con las aceitunas negras.\r\nAñade 4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, el ajo y la\r\nanchoas, si las usa. Batir hasta obtener una pasta rugosa.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nForre un molde para hornear poco profundo de unos 30 x 20 cm.\r\ncon papel antiadherente. Sobre una encimera enharinada,\r\nextender la masa hasta formar un rectángulo aproximadamente\r\n30x40cm. Extender la pasta de aceitunas por todas partes.\r\ny disponer las aceitunas verdes enteras en un\r\nalinee uno de los bordes cortos. rodar\r\nlevantar la masa como si fuera un panecillo suizo, empezando por\r\nel extremo corto con incrustaciones de aceitunas para hacer\r\nuna forma de salchicha.","Cortar la masa en 12 rebanadas, luego\r\nlevante con cuidado cada uno dentro de la lata, para\r\nHaz 4 filas de 3 formas de remolino. ligeramente\r\nunte todo con el aceite de oliva restante.\r\nCubra sin apretar con film transparente y luego déjelo\r\ndejar crecer durante unos 20 minutos, hasta que esté ligeramente\r\ninflado y llenando la lata. cocinar para\r\n20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado, luego dejar reposar.\r\nenfriar en la lata."]','2026-01-11 12:54:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12880,4817,'es','Pan de semillas de nueces malteado','Con una textura de pan adecuada y una buena corteza, este pan sin gluten se corta bien y fue un éxito en nuestra cocina de prueba.','["500 g de harina integral fuerte (nosotros utilizamos harina de pan de malta de grano mixto Doves Farm)","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de sal","hasta 350 ml de agua tibia","100 g de semillas mixtas (nosotros utilizamos una mezcla de semillas de lino, semillas de cáñamo, semillas de calabaza y semillas de sésamo)","50 g de nueces en trozos","un poco de aceite de girasol, para engrasar"]','["Hacer la masa con la harina, la levadura, la sal.\r\ny agua como se indica en la receta \"Combina bien\" (ver a la derecha), agregando\r\nla mayoría de las semillas y todas las nueces como quieras\r\nAmasar la masa. Dejar reposar en un bol limpio.\r\ncomo se indicó, luego golpee y forme una\r\nronda grande. Enrolle la ronda en el resto.\r\nsemillas, luego levante el pan y colóquelo en una bandeja para que quede firme.\r\ndurante unos 30 minutos hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7.\r\nHornee el pan durante 15 minutos, luego reduzca\r\nel calor a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5 y\r\ncontinúe horneando durante 30 minutos hasta que el pan\r\nSuena hueco cuando se golpea en la base.\r\nDeje el pan en una rejilla para enfriar.\r\ncompletamente. El pan se mantendrá fresco en un\r\nrecipiente hermético durante 3 días o puede ser\r\ncongelado durante 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:54:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12881,8788,'es','Stromboli de jamón y tomate','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Este pan estilo pizza alimentará a una multitud para el almuerzo.','["1 lote de masa de pan blanco (consulte la receta ''Combina bien'' a continuación)","6 cucharadas de salsa de tomate de buena calidad","3 lonchas de jamón finas como una oblea, desmenuzadas","100 g de mozzarella en bolas, rallada","un puñado de hojas de albahaca","1 huevo batido"]','["Hacer la masa, dejar reposar y\r\nderribar como se indica. Calentar el horno a\r\n200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.","Sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, estirar la masa.\r\nhasta obtener un rectángulo aproximado de 40 x 25 cm.\r\nExtender la salsa sobre la masa, dejando\r\nun borde pequeño y esparcir sobre el jamón,\r\nmozzarella y albahaca. Meta los lados cortos\r\nhacia adentro y enrolle el lado largo como si fuera un panecillo suizo.\r\nLevante sobre una bandeja, con el lado del sello hacia abajo, y cepille\r\ncon el huevo. Hornee por 30 minutos hasta que esté inflado.\r\nArriba y dorado: no te preocupes si hay un\r\npocas grietas. Dejar enfriar un poco y luego servir.\r\ncortado en una tabla."]','2026-01-11 12:54:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12882,8790,'es','Brownies de camote','Utilice los azúcares naturales de las batatas para hacer brownies dulces. También es fácil hacer que la receta sea vegana: solo asegúrate de que el chocolate amargo y el cacao en polvo que estás usando no contengan lácteos.','["2 batatas (unos 400 g), cortadas por la mitad","125 g de mantequilla de almendras","100 g de jarabe de arce","25 g de cacao en polvo tamizado","50 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","25 g de almendras picadas (opcional)","100 g de chocolate amargo, picado (sin lácteos si es necesario)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forrar un molde para hornear cuadrado de 20 cm con papel para hornear y reservar. Coloque las mitades de batata en un molde o bandeja para hornear diferente y ase durante 40-50 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Deje enfriar, luego póngalo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que quede suave.","Reducir el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Vierta la mezcla de batata en un bol y combine con todos los ingredientes restantes, excepto las almendras y 50 g de chocolate amargo. Vierta la masa en la bandeja para hornear preparada. Esparza las almendras, si las usa, luego hornee durante 30-40 minutos hasta que salga una brocheta con algunas migas. Dejar enfriar. Derrita el chocolate amargo restante en un recipiente resistente al calor en el microondas durante 30 segundos, revolviendo, luego en ráfagas de 10 segundos hasta que se derrita. Rocíe sobre los brownies, luego déjelos enfriar antes de cortarlos en 12 o 16 trozos. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12883,8792,'es','Brownies de triple chocolate del siguiente nivel','Date un capricho con estos brownies que se derriten en la boca: son densos, pegajosos y sabrosos, ideales para Pascua o en cualquier momento en el que te apetezca el chocolate.','["150 g de mantequilla sin sal","350 g de chocolate negro (al menos 70 %), picado","1 espresso o 30ml de café muy fuerte","100 g de harina de centeno o normal","25 g de cacao en polvo orgánico","4 huevos, temperatura ambiente","300 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","100 g de chocolate con leche, picado","100 g de chocolate blanco, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para hornear de 20 x 20 cm con papel para hornear, dejando un poco de sobrante. Coloque el chocolate amargo, la mantequilla y el café en un recipiente resistente al calor y colóquelo sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Revuelva hasta que quede suave, luego déjelo a un lado para que se enfríe un poco. Esto también se puede hacer en ráfagas cortas en el microondas, revolviendo entre cada ráfaga. En un recipiente aparte, mezcle la harina de centeno, el cacao en polvo y ½ cucharadita de sal marina.","Con una batidora de pie o un batidor de mano eléctrico, bata los huevos, el azúcar y la vainilla durante 5 minutos hasta que estén espesos, pálidos y duplique su volumen. Incorpora gradualmente la mezcla de chocolate derretido enfriado, teniendo cuidado de retener la mayor cantidad de aire posible. Tamice suavemente los ingredientes secos sobre la masa y dóblelos hasta que estén combinados. Agrega dos tercios de la leche picada y el chocolate blanco y mezcla brevemente. Vierta la masa en el molde y alise la parte superior con una espátula, luego esparza el resto de los trozos de chocolate y empújelos ligeramente hacia la parte superior con la espátula. Hornee durante 30 minutos o hasta que los bordes estén firmes pero el centro aún se tambalee ligeramente. Retirar del horno y espolvorear con un poco de sal marina en escamas.","Deja que los brownies se enfríen completamente en el molde y luego sácalos con el papel. Si los quieres súper pegajosos y suaves en el medio, sírvelos a temperatura ambiente, pero si los quieres esponjosos, enfríalos en el refrigerador; de cualquier manera, se cortarán en nueve cuadrados generosos o en 16 trozos más pequeños. Guárdelo en un recipiente hermético a temperatura ambiente por hasta tres días, o en el refrigerador para que quede blando hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:54:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12884,3928,'es','Rubias fáciles','Prepare estas rubias fáciles con deliciosos trozos de chocolate blanco esparcidos por todas partes. Estos pegajosos cuadrados dorados son el acompañamiento perfecto para una taza de té o café.','["175 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubos, más un poco más para el molde","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla o pasta de frijoles","200 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de chocolate blanco picado o utilizar chispas de chocolate blanco","175 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubos, más un poco más para el molde","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla o pasta de frijoles","200 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de chocolate blanco picado o utilizar chispas de chocolate blanco"]','["Derretir la mantequilla y ambos azúcares en una sartén a fuego lento, añadiendo una pizca de sal si la mantequilla no tiene sal. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos; esto evitará que los huevos se cuajen cuando se agreguen. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde cuadrado de 23 cm o un molde para hornear de 25 x 20 cm y cubrir con papel para hornear.","Batir los huevos y la vainilla con la mezcla de mantequilla y azúcar enfriada hasta que estén bien combinados. Tamiza la harina y el polvo para hornear, luego incorpora suavemente hasta obtener una masa suave. Incorpora el chocolate blanco y luego vierte en el molde preparado. Alise la parte superior y hornee durante 40-45 minutos hasta que los bordes se despeguen de los lados del molde, la parte superior tenga una corteza parecida al papel y al insertar una brocheta en el medio salga con algunas migas, pero sin masa líquida. Las rubias se endurecerán a medida que se enfríen.","Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Las rubias se conservarán en un recipiente hermético durante tres días.","Derretir la mantequilla y ambos azúcares en una sartén a fuego lento, añadiendo una pizca de sal si la mantequilla no tiene sal. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos; esto evitará que los huevos se cuajen cuando se agreguen. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde cuadrado de 23 cm o un molde para hornear de 25 x 20 cm y cubrir con papel para hornear.","Batir los huevos y la vainilla con la mezcla de mantequilla y azúcar enfriada hasta que estén bien combinados. Tamiza la harina y el polvo para hornear, luego incorpora suavemente hasta obtener una masa suave. Incorpora el chocolate blanco y luego vierte en el molde preparado. Alise la parte superior y hornee durante 40-45 minutos hasta que los bordes se despeguen de los lados del molde, la parte superior tenga una corteza parecida al papel y al insertar una brocheta en el medio salga con algunas migas, pero sin masa líquida. Las rubias se endurecerán a medida que se enfríen.","Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Las rubias se conservarán en un recipiente hermético durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12885,3994,'es','Brownies veganos de pudín navideño','Haga que los brownies sean fabulosamente festivos agregando pudín navideño a la mezcla. No contienen lácteos, por lo que también son perfectos para veganos.','["1 x 150 g de pudín navideño sin Asda","2 cucharadas de linaza o linaza molida","200 g de chocolate negro sin lácteos, picado","100 g de crema para untar sin lácteos","100ml de leche vegetal, como avena o almendras","aceite vegetal, para la lata","125 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","50 g de cacao en polvo","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","¼ cucharadita de sal marina fina","1 cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla","un poco de azúcar glas mezclado con una pizca de canela molida, para espolvorear"]','["Corta o desmenuza el pudín navideño sin Asda en trozos pequeños o trozos y reserva. Mezcle la linaza molida o la linaza con 4 cucharadas de agua en un tazón pequeño y deje que espese y adquiera una apariencia de gel.","Derrita 150 g de chocolate, la crema para untar y la leche en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola pequeña con agua hirviendo (asegúrese de que el fondo del recipiente no toque el agua). Revuelve hasta que el chocolate se derrita y la mezcla esté suave. Retirar del fuego.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar un molde para brownie o pastel cuadrado de 20 cm y cubrir con papel para hornear. Batir brevemente la harina, las almendras molidas, el cacao, los azúcares y la sal en un bol grande con una batidora eléctrica para deshacer los grumos de azúcar. Haga un hueco en el centro, luego agregue la mezcla de chocolate, junto con la mezcla de linaza y vainilla. Batir hasta que quede suave y toda la harina esté incorporada; la masa debe quedar espesa.","Incorpora los trozos de pudín de Navidad y los trozos de chocolate restantes hasta que estén incorporados, luego mézclalos en el molde preparado. Alise la superficie con una espátula y hornee durante 40-50 minutos hasta que la parte superior tenga una costra ligera y se tambalee ligeramente en el centro. Una brocheta insertada en el medio debe tener migajas húmedas adheridas, pero no masa cruda. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde.","Corte los brownies en cuadritos y sírvalos a temperatura ambiente, o enfríelos para obtener una textura más esponjosa. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético a temperatura ambiente o refrigerado por hasta tres días, o congelado por hasta tres meses. Espolvorea con azúcar glas y canela justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12886,8794,'es','Brownies pegajosos y fáciles','¿Conoces el secreto de los brownies pegajosos? No los cocines demasiado y agrega caramelo o chocolates rellenos de caramelo líquido o ganache para ayudar a agregar humedad.','["150 g de mantequilla","75 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro","150 g de chocolate natural, partido en trozos","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","3 huevos","125 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","150 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo y más para espolvorear","4-6 cucharadas de dulce de leche, caramelo o chocolate para untar con avellanas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Derrita la mantequilla, el azúcar moreno, el chocolate y el almíbar dorado suavemente a fuego lento hasta que quede suave. Retire la sartén del fuego.","Batir los huevos y el azúcar en polvo en un tazón grande hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos; esto llevará unos minutos y vale la pena hacerlo correctamente. Agrega el extracto de vainilla, luego tamiza sobre la harina, la levadura en polvo y el cacao en polvo y agrega la mezcla de chocolate. Incorpora todo rápidamente y coloca la mitad de la mezcla en el molde. Coloque bolas de caramelo o chocolate para untar con avellanas y luego coloque el resto de la mezcla de brownie por encima. Agregue más bolas de caramelo o chocolate para untar, si lo desea, y hornee por 30 minutos. La parte superior de la mezcla ahora debería estar fraguada y con un aspecto ligeramente agrietado, pero la mezcla de debajo aún tendrá un ligero bamboleo.","Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar por completo antes de cortar en cuadritos. Espolvoree la parte superior con cacao o azúcar glas, si lo desea, o si sirve como postre, rocíe con más caramelo. Se conservará durante 3 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:54:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12887,6151,'es','Brookies','Combine dos pasteles populares, una galleta con chispas de chocolate masticable y un rico brownie, en esta delicia creativa. Llene el molde para pasteles con estos para la temporada festiva o regálelos.','["120 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para la lata","120 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","1 huevo grande, más 1 yema","250 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","50 g de trozos de chocolate con leche","185 g de mantequilla sin sal","185 g de chocolate negro (al menos 70% de cacao)","3 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","275 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de cacao en polvo","130 g de harina común","50 g de trozos de chocolate con leche"]','["Unte con mantequilla un molde para pastel cuadrado de 23 cm y forre con papel para hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Primero, hacer la capa de galleta. Poner la mantequilla y ambos azúcares en un bol y batir con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que estén combinados. Alternativamente, haga esto en una batidora de pie. Agrega el huevo entero y la yema y bate nuevamente hasta que se combinen. Agrega la harina, ¼ de cucharadita de sal, el bicarbonato de sodio y los trozos de chocolate. Presione la masa para galletas en la base del molde preparado con el dorso de una cuchara, luego enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Para la capa de brownie, derrita la mantequilla y el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, revolviendo hasta que quede suave y combinado. Dejar enfriar un poco, unos 10 minutos. Batir los huevos, la vainilla y el azúcar en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que espese un poco, aproximadamente 3 minutos.","Incorpora la mezcla de chocolate con mantequilla, el cacao y la harina para combinar. Vierta la mezcla de brownie sobre la capa de masa para galletas, salpique con los trozos de chocolate y espolvoree con hojuelas de sal marina, si lo desea. Hornee en el centro del horno durante 50 minutos a 1 hora, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio salga con solo unas pocas migas adheridas. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde antes de cortar en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12888,8796,'es','brownies sin harina','Sirve estos brownies sin harina calientes con helado de postre. Son fáciles de hacer y solo requieren cinco ingredientes, por lo que son ideales para panaderos novatos.','["200 g de mantequilla picada y un poco más para el molde","250 g de chocolate negro (al menos 70 % de sólidos de cacao), partido en trozos pequeños","225 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos","100 g de almendras molidas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 x 20 cm de 4 cm de profundidad y forrar con papel para hornear. Derrita 200 g de chocolate junto con la mantequilla en un recipiente grande resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo (asegúrese de que el fondo del recipiente no toque el agua), revolviendo ocasionalmente. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, bata el azúcar, los huevos y una pizca de sal en un tazón grande hasta que estén pálidos y espumosos; debe verse como un batido espumoso. Esto tardará entre 2 y 3 minutos con un batidor eléctrico, o entre 5 y 8 minutos con un batidor de globo. Vierte la mezcla de mantequilla y chocolate junto con las almendras, luego mezcla todo hasta que no queden vetas de chocolate. Vierta la mezcla en el molde, esparza sobre el resto del chocolate y hornee por 25 minutos, hasta que esté cocido con un ligero tambaleo en el medio.","Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos, luego vierta en tazones y sirva caliente para hacer un pudín. Alternativamente, déjelo enfriar completamente en el molde, luego córtelo en cuadritos y guárdelo en un molde hermético. Se conservará hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12889,8798,'es','Brownies salados de chocolate y avellanas','La crema de chocolate y avellanas garantiza que estos deliciosos brownies tengan un centro esponjoso. Con nueces pecanas y sal marina: serán la nueva receta de brownie','["100 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, cortada en trozos pequeños, más un poco más para el molde","200 g de chocolate negro 70%, partido en trozos","150 g de crema de chocolate y avellanas","3 huevos batidos","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","150 g de harina común","100 g de nueces pecanas tostadas, picadas en trozos grandes","helado y salsa de caramelo, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base y los lados de un molde cuadrado de 20 cm. Coloque la mantequilla, el chocolate y la crema de chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor y derrítalos en una cacerola con agua ligeramente hirviendo. Una vez derretido, revuelve y deja enfriar un poco.","En otro tazón, use una batidora eléctrica para batir los huevos y el azúcar durante 5 minutos hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos. Vierta la mezcla de chocolate y bata brevemente para combinar. Tamice la harina y mezcle suavemente la mezcla, luego agregue la mayoría de las nueces. Vierta la mezcla en el molde y extiéndala con una espátula. Esparcir sobre las últimas nueces y una buena pizca de sal marina.","Hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté listo pero un poco pegajoso en el medio. Deje enfriar, luego córtelo en cuadritos y sirva con helado y salsa de caramelo."]','2026-01-11 12:54:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12890,8800,'es','Brownies de huevos de Pascua','Lleno de huevos y pollitos de chocolate, este es el centro de mesa de Pascua definitivo: un regalo especial ''eggstra'' para el té o el postre de la tarde.','["185 g de mantequilla sin sal, cortada en trozos pequeños, más un poco más para engrasar","185 g del mejor chocolate negro, partido en trozos","3 huevos grandes","275 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","85 g de harina común","40 g de cacao en polvo","5 huevos rellenos de fondant (usamos huevos con crema de Cadbury)","150 g de mini huevos (nosotros utilizamos una mezcla de mini huevos Cadbury''s y Smarties)","También necesitarás unos cuantos pollitos de Pascua de chenilla esponjosos para decorar (opcional)"]','["Coloque la mantequilla y el chocolate en un recipiente mediano resistente al calor y colóquelo sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que se derrita. Alternativamente, cubra el recipiente sin apretar con film transparente y cocínelo en el microondas a intervalos de 30 segundos hasta que se derrita. Deje que la mezcla de chocolate derretido se enfríe a temperatura ambiente.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar un molde cuadrado de 20 cm con mantequilla y forrar con 2 tiras largas de papel de horno o papel de aluminio doblado, una de arriba a abajo y la otra de izquierda a derecha, y luego forrar la base con un trozo de papel de horno. Las tiras te ayudarán a sacarlo más tarde.","Rompe los huevos en un tazón grande y agrega el azúcar en polvo. Con una batidora eléctrica a velocidad máxima, bata los huevos y el azúcar durante unos 5-8 minutos o hasta que se vean espesos y cremosos y hayan duplicado su tamaño.","Vierta la mezcla de chocolate enfriada sobre la mezcla de huevo y luego mezcle suavemente.","Tamice la harina y el cacao en los ingredientes húmedos y luego continúe incorporando la mezcla suavemente con una espátula hasta que todo esté completamente combinado, trate de no mezclar demasiado.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y nivele con cuidado la mezcla con la espátula. Mételo en el medio del horno y hornea por 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, corte los huevos rellenos de fondant por la mitad y reserve, luego coloque los mini huevos en un mortero. Tritura algunos de los mini huevos pero deja algunos enteros. Después de 20 minutos, saca el brownie del horno y presiona los huevos de fondant, con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Esparce también la mitad de los mini huevos y luego vuelve a meterlos en el horno durante 5 minutos más.","Una vez horneado, cubra con los mini huevos restantes, déjelos enfriar por completo y luego colóquelos en el refrigerador durante aproximadamente 1 hora para que se endurezcan. Sácalo del molde con las tiras de papel de horno y córtalo en cuadritos para servir. Decora con pollitos de Pascua si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:54:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12891,8802,'es','Brownies de la Selva Negra','Estos brownies blandos y fáciles de preparar, completos con decoración retro, combinan una combinación de sabores muy apreciada de cereza y chocolate.','["250 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para engrasar","1 cucharada de café instantáneo en polvo","350 g de azúcar moreno blando","4 huevos medianos","75 g de cacao en polvo","100 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de esencia de cereza (opcional), disponible en Lakeland","100 g de guindas secas, picadas","200 g de chocolate negro (60% cacao)","25 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada a temperatura ambiente","50 g de azúcar glas","gel colorante alimentario verde","20 cerezas glaseadas, partidas por la mitad"]','["Engrase un molde para pastel de 30 x 20 cm y forre con papel pergamino. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Mezclar el café con 2 cucharadas de agua hirviendo y dejar enfriar.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar durante unos 5 minutos hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos, luego agregar los huevos, uno a la vez, incorporando bien después de cada adición. En un recipiente aparte, combine el cacao en polvo y la harina. Agrega la esencia de cereza y el café enfriado a la mezcla de mantequilla, seguido de los ingredientes secos. Mezcle bien y luego agregue las cerezas.","Vierta en el molde preparado, nivele la parte superior con el dorso de una cuchara y hornee en el centro del horno durante 30-35 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde.","Una vez frío, derrita el chocolate amargo en el microondas o sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, luego extiéndalo en una capa uniforme sobre la parte superior de los brownies.","Mientras el chocolate cuaja, mezcla la mantequilla con el azúcar glas y unas gotas de colorante verde. Coloque la crema de mantequilla en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla para escribir. Corta los brownies en 20 cuadrados, coloca dos mitades de cereza glaseadas encima de cada uno y usa la crema de mantequilla para crear el tallo de la cereza."]','2026-01-11 12:54:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12892,8804,'es','brownies de avellanas','Los chocolates Ferrero Rocher dan un delicioso toque final a estos cuadrados de brownie de chocolate rellenos de nueces picadas.','["caja de 16 bombones Ferrero Rocher","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla salada, más algo extra para engrasar","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","225 g de azúcar mascabado light","100 g de cacao en polvo","4 huevos grandes","100 g de harina con levadura","85 g de avellanas ya picadas","4 cucharadas de licor de avellanas Frangelico o Fratello (o Disaronno)"]','["Desenvuelve los chocolates, colócalos en una bandeja y mételos en el congelador. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar ligeramente y forrar la base y los lados de un molde cuadrado de 21-22 cm con papel para hornear.","Pon la mantequilla, el azúcar y el cacao en la cacerola más grande y derrítelos suavemente, revolviendo regularmente para que la mezcla no se pegue. Una vez que los gránulos de azúcar casi hayan desaparecido, retirar del fuego, verter en un bol y dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos.","Utilice un batidor o una cuchara de madera para batir los huevos, uno por uno, con la mezcla. Cuando estén completamente incorporados y la mezcla esté suave y brillante, agrega la harina, las avellanas y el licor. Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y hornee por 35 minutos.","Retire la lata del horno y use un cuchillo para cubiertos para marcar la parte superior de los brownies en 16 cuadrados (no los corte, es solo como guía). Use una cucharadita para hacer una pequeña abolladura en el centro de cada porción y agregue un chocolate Ferrero Rocher congelado en cada salsa. Regresar al horno por 3 minutos, luego retirar y dejar enfriar por completo.","Una vez frío, córtelo en 16 cuadrados. Se conservará durante 3 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:54:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12893,8806,'es','Brownies de mantequilla de maní y mermelada para microondas','Olvídese de los mug cakes en el microondas: si busca un capricho serio en solo 15 minutos, esta receta sencilla de brownie de chocolate seguramente dará en el clavo.','["75 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para engrasar","50 g de mantequilla de maní","1 huevo","25 g de cacao en polvo","50 g de harina común","100 g de azúcar","unas cucharaditas de mermelada"]','["Agregue la mantequilla y la mantequilla de maní a un recipiente apto para microondas y cocine a temperatura alta durante 30 segundos para que se derrita. Retirar del microondas y revolver bien. Deje que se enfríe un poco, luego agregue el huevo y revuelva para combinar. Engrasar con mantequilla y forrar un segundo plato redondo apto para microondas (de unos 15 cm de ancho) con film transparente. Vierta la mezcla de mantequilla de maní en el plato forrado, luego tamice el cacao en polvo y la harina y agregue el azúcar. Mezcle suavemente para formar una pasta espesa y pegajosa. Alise la parte superior de la mezcla con el dorso de una cuchara grande.","Con una cucharadita, haga cráteres en la parte superior de la mezcla de brownie y llénelos generosamente con mermelada, ya que se derretirá y burbujeará cuando esté cocida. Mételo en el microondas durante 3-4 minutos a temperatura alta. Retirar y dejar enfriar durante 15 minutos (continuará cocinándose a medida que se enfríe) ¡y luego a disfrutar!"]','2026-01-11 12:54:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12894,8808,'es','Brownie blanco y negro','Mejore el clásico brownie con una pegajosa masa de chocolate cubierta con una mezcla cremosa de tarta de queso para lograr un sorprendente efecto veteado.','["250 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","200 gramos de chocolate amargo","50 gramos de chocolate blanco","375 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","5 huevos medianos","50 g de harina común, más 1 cucharada","85 g de cacao","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de queso crema en tarrina"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar un molde de 20 x 30 cm con papel para hornear. Picar finamente 150 g de chocolate negro y picar en trozos grandes el chocolate negro restante y el chocolate blanco. Coloque el chocolate finamente picado en un bol y derrítalo en una cacerola pequeña con agua hirviendo a fuego lento o en el microondas. Reservar para que se enfríe un poco.","Poner la mantequilla y 350 g de azúcar en un bol y batir hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Agrega 4 huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien entre cada adición, luego tamiza la harina, el cacao, la levadura en polvo y una buena pizca de sal. Finalmente, agregue el chocolate derretido y los trozos de chocolate picados. Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y alise la superficie.","Trabajando rápidamente, vierte el queso crema en un bol y bate para suavizar con una espátula. Agregue el huevo restante, la harina y el azúcar y mezcle hasta que estén combinados. Vierta gotas de la mezcla de queso crema sobre el brownie hasta que se acabe y use la punta de un cuchillo para cubiertos o una brocheta para hacer girar las 2 mezclas para crear un efecto veteado. Hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que esté listo; todavía debería tambalearse un poco cuando salga del horno, y al insertar una brocheta en el centro debería salir con migas pegajosas. Deje enfriar completamente en el molde antes de cortarlo en cuadritos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12895,8810,'es','Pastelitos de brownie de cerezas','Hermosos pasteles individuales de brownie de chocolate con una cucharada de crema suavemente batida y fruta extra para decorar','["175 g de mantequilla picada y un poco más para engrasar","200 g de chocolate amargo, picado","250 g de azúcar moreno claro blando","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","85 g de harina común","50 g de cacao en polvo, más un poco más para servir","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 huevos grandes, batidos","200 g de cerezas, partidas por la mitad y sin hueso, más 12 con tallos, para servir (opcional)","crema doble, para servir (opcional)"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Unte con mantequilla 12 agujeros de una bandeja profunda para muffins y cubra cada agujero con una tira de papel para hornear; esto le ayudará a levantar los brownies más tarde (o forre 16 agujeros de 2 bandejas con moldes para muffins). Poner la mantequilla, 150 g de chocolate, el azúcar y la vainilla en un recipiente resistente al calor, suspendido sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo. Calentar suavemente, revolviendo de vez en cuando hasta que se derrita, luego retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar unos minutos. Mientras tanto, tamizamos en un bol grande la harina, el cacao, la levadura y una buena pizca de sal.","Añade la mezcla de chocolate caliente y derretido, los huevos, las cerezas y los 50 g de chocolate restantes a los ingredientes secos, luego mezcla hasta que estén combinados. Divide la mezcla entre los agujeros de las bandejas/cajas para muffins, asegurándote de que a cada uno le queden unos trozos de cereza. Hornee durante 18 minutos hasta que estén cocidos pero aún pegajosos en el centro; continuarán cocinándose un poco a medida que se enfríen. Deje enfriar durante 30 minutos en la lata antes de transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo, o cómelo caliente con una cucharada de crema, un poco de cacao y más cerezas encima, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:54:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12896,8812,'es','Brownies veganos de cerezas y almendras','Profundamente rico y decadente, este horneado de chocolate sin lácteos ni huevos es una delicia vegana indulgente.','["80 g de margarina vegana, más un extra para engrasar","2 cucharadas de linaza molida","120 g de chocolate negro","½ cucharadita de café granulado","125 g de harina con levadura","70 g de almendras molidas","50 g de cacao en polvo","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","70 g de cerezas glaseadas (lavadas y partidas por la mitad)"]','["Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 31?2. Engrasa y forra un molde cuadrado de 20 cm con papel de horno. Combine la linaza con 6 cucharadas de agua y déjela reposar durante al menos 5 minutos.","En un cazo derretir el chocolate, el café y la margarina con 60ml de agua a fuego lento. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Ponga la harina, las almendras, el cacao, la levadura en polvo y 1?4 cucharadita de sal en un bol y revuelva para eliminar los grumos. Con un batidor de mano, mezcle el azúcar con la mezcla de chocolate derretido y bata bien hasta que quede suave y brillante, asegurándose de que todo el azúcar esté bien disuelto. Agrega la mezcla de linaza y el extracto de vainilla, las cerezas y luego la mezcla de harina. Ahora quedará muy espeso. Revuelva hasta que se combinen y vierta en el molde preparado. Hornee durante 35-45 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio y con migas húmedas. Deje que se enfríe completamente en el molde y luego córtelo en cuadritos. Guárdelo en un recipiente hermético y consúmalo dentro de los 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12897,8814,'es','Barras de brownie de chocolate y pan de jengibre con glaseado dulce','Estas lujosas barritas están basadas en un clásico pastel sin harina, por lo que son ricas y ligeras a partes iguales.','["400 g de chocolate amargo, partido en trozos","25 g de cacao en polvo","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","140 g de almendras molidas","6 huevos grandes, separados","100 g de mantequilla, en cubos","50 g de chocolate negro, utilizar una barra partida en trozos o chips","50 g de cacao","200 g de azúcar glas tamizada","2 cucharadas de jengibre molido","unos trozos de jengibre cristalizado, picado en trozos pequeños"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar un molde para pastel de 20 x 30 cm y forrar la base y los lados con papel para hornear. Derretir el chocolate, el cacao, el azúcar y la mantequilla en un cazo a fuego muy lento. Una vez que el chocolate y la mantequilla se hayan derretido y el azúcar disuelto, retirar del fuego y agregar el jengibre y las almendras, seguido de las yemas de huevo, una a la vez.","Batir las claras a punto de nieve. Con una cuchara de metal, agregue un par de cucharadas de claras de huevo a la mezcla de chocolate para que se afloje antes de incorporar muy suavemente el resto.","Raspe suavemente la lata. Hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que la parte superior parezca firme y el centro no se tambalee demasiado. Colocar el molde sobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo.","Una vez frío, haz el glaseado. Pon en una cacerola la mantequilla, el chocolate, el cacao, el azúcar glas, el jengibre molido y 4 cucharadas de agua. Calienta suavemente, revolviendo, hasta obtener un glaseado suave. Vierta sobre el pastel (aún en su molde), déjelo enfriar un poco durante 1-2 minutos y luego esparza sobre el jengibre. Deje enfriar completamente (también puede guardarlo en el refrigerador si lo deja a temperatura ambiente unos 20 minutos antes de servir) antes de cortarlo en barras."]','2026-01-11 12:54:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12898,8816,'es','Cuadritos de chocolate dulce','Estos cuadrados de bizcocho blandos y profundamente chocolateados no contienen gluten; pruébelos como postre con helado.','["200 g de mantequilla, picada","200 g de chocolate negro sin gluten, picado en trozos grandes","350 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de mezcla de harina con levadura sin gluten","50 g de almendras molidas","50 g de cacao","1 cucharadita de goma xantana","4 huevos grandes, batidos","50 g de nueces, partidas o picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de mantequilla, picada","2 cucharadas colmadas de cacao","200 g de azúcar glas tamizada","2 cucharadas de leche","50 g de nueces, partidas o picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4\r\ny forrar una lata de brownie de 20 x 30 cm con\r\npergamino para hornear. Volcar la mantequilla y\r\nchocolate en una cacerola antiadherente y\r\nDerretir a fuego lento, revolviendo de vez en cuando.\r\ny luego, hasta que quede suave – tenga cuidado de no\r\nsobrecalentarlo. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, mezclar el azúcar, la harina, el cacao.\r\ny almendras con la goma xantana. Revuelva\r\nen la mezcla de chocolate, luego bata\r\nlos huevos y añadir las nueces. Gire el\r\nmezcla en el molde, nivelar con una espátula\r\ny hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté firme y\r\nrecién cocido – cuando se prueba con una brocheta,\r\nla miga todavía debe estar un poco húmeda.\r\nDejar enfriar en la lata.","Para hacer el glaseado, derrita la mantequilla en una\r\nsartén antiadherente. Agregue el cacao y cocine.\r\nrevolviendo, durante aproximadamente 1 min. Agrega el glaseado\r\nazúcar y leche, y batir bien. verter\r\nencima del pastel enfriado, espolvorear con el\r\nnueces y presiónelas ligeramente. Dejar\r\nhasta que cuaje, luego retírelo con cuidado del\r\nmolde, quitarle el papel de horno y\r\ncortar en cuadrados. Se mantendrá durante varios\r\ndías en una lata."]','2026-01-11 12:54:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12899,4973,'es','Pastel de brownie de chocolate','El pastel perfecto para los amantes del brownie, prueba un trozo grande caliente con un poco de helado.','["175 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco para engrasar","225 g de chocolate amargo, partido en trozos","200 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos medianos, separados","65 g de harina común","50 g de nueces pecanas picadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pastel de 20-25 cm y forrar con papel vegetal.","Coloque 175 g/6 oz de chocolate, más la mantequilla y el azúcar en una sartén de base pesada y caliente suavemente hasta que se derrita, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Dejar enfriar.","Batir las yemas de huevo con la mezcla de chocolate, luego agregar la harina, las nueces y el chocolate restante.","Batir las claras hasta que formen picos suaves y luego, suave pero bien, incorporarlas a la mezcla de chocolate.","Vierta en el molde preparado y hornee en el centro del horno durante unos 35-40 minutos hasta que esté crujiente por encima. Dejar enfriar, luego pasar un cuchillo por los lados y retirar del molde. Espolvorear con azúcar glas y servir caliente con natillas o helado o frío con nata."]','2026-01-11 12:54:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12900,8818,'es','brownies fáciles','Estos brownies, una delicia pegajosa y deliciosa, son muy fáciles de hacer. Pruebe la rica cobertura de chocolate para un horneado aún más delicioso.','["375 g de chocolate negro de buena calidad","375 g de mantequilla, cortada en trozos","6 huevos medianos","500 g de azúcar en polvo","225 g de harina común","140 g de chocolate negro de buena calidad","50 g de mantequilla, cortada en trozos","azúcar glas para espolvorear"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde de 30 cm x 21 cm. Precalentar\r\nel horno a aire 160/convencional 180/gas 4.\r\nRompe el chocolate con la mantequilla y\r\nderrita en el microondas a temperatura media durante aproximadamente\r\n5 minutos, revolviendo a la mitad.","Batir el azúcar y los huevos en un bol. Agregue\r\nel chocolate derretido, agregar la harina y batir\r\nbueno. Vierta en el molde y hornee por 40-45\r\nminutos, o hasta que la parte superior parezca parecida al papel y\r\nse siente ligeramente tambaleante. Dejar enfriar en el molde.","Rompe el chocolate con la mantequilla.\r\ny derretir en el microondas a temperatura media durante\r\naproximadamente 1 minuto. Revuelva hasta que quede suave y luego\r\nesparcir sobre el pastel. Espolvorear con azúcar glas\r\ny cortar en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12901,8820,'es','Brownies de arándanos y pistachos','Húmedo, afrutado y con sabor a nuez: ¿qué más se puede pedir de un brownie? Listo en menos de una hora','["200 g de mantequilla cortada en cubitos y un poco más para engrasar","2 barras de 150 g de chocolate natural (aproximadamente un 40 % de sólidos de cacao está bien)","280 g de azúcar mascabado light","4 cucharadas de jugo de arándano o leche","4 huevos medianos","200 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 paquete de 75 g de arándanos secos","100 g de pistachos, en rodajas","azúcar glas hasta espolvorear, opcional"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para hornear antiadherente (aproximadamente 31 x 17 x 3,5 cm) o forrar la base si lo prefiere. Rompe el chocolate en una cacerola, agrega la mantequilla, el azúcar y el jugo o la leche, luego caliéntalo suavemente, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que se derrita y se mezcle uniformemente. Deje que se enfríe un poco y luego agregue los huevos uno a la vez. Incorpora la harina, la canela y los arándanos.","Extienda la mitad de la mezcla en la lata preparada, esparza sobre las nueces y luego esparza suavemente el resto de la mezcla encima. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos. Cortar en cuadritos mientras aún está caliente. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:54:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12902,8822,'es','Brownies de mantequilla de maní','Dos de nuestras cosas favoritas (mantequilla de maní y brownies) se combinan para hacer estas delicias irresistibles.','["225 g de mantequilla de maní crujiente","200 g de barra de chocolate negro, partido en trozos","280 g de azúcar moreno claro suave","3 huevos medianos","100 g de harina con levadura"]','["Reserva 50 g de cada mantequilla de maní.\r\ny chocolate. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C\r\nventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para hornear cuadrado de 20 cm.\r\nlata con papel para hornear. Derretir suavemente\r\nresto de mantequilla de maní, chocolate y\r\ntodo el azúcar en una cacerola, revolviendo de vez en cuando,\r\nhasta que el azúcar casi se haya derretido.\r\nApagar el fuego y utilizar una cuchara de madera.\r\nbatir los huevos uno a uno. Agregue el\r\nharina y raspar en el molde.","Derrita la mantequilla de maní reservada en el\r\nmicroondas a temperatura alta durante 45 segundos, o en\r\nuna sartén, hasta que esté líquido, luego rocíe sobre\r\nbrownie. Hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que\r\ntiene una corteza, pero el medio todavía parece\r\nligeramente crudo.","Derrita el chocolate reservado y rocíelo\r\nel brownie, luego enfriar en el molde antes\r\ncortando en cuadrados."]','2026-01-11 12:54:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12903,8823,'es','Los mejores brownies de chocolate y frambuesa','Blandos y súper sabrosos, estos magníficos pasteles de chocolate afrutados infalibles se consumirán en segundos','["200 g de chocolate amargo, partido en trozos","100 g de chocolate con leche, partido en trozos","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla salada","400 g de azúcar moreno claro blando","4 huevos grandes","140 g de harina común","50 g de cacao en polvo","200 g de frambuesas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nForrar un molde para horno de 20 x 30 cm con\r\npergamino para hornear. Pon el chocolate,\r\nmantequilla y azúcar en una sartén y suavemente\r\nderretir, revolviendo ocasionalmente con un\r\ncuchara de madera. Retirar del fuego.","Agrega los huevos, uno por uno, a la\r\nmezcla de chocolate derretido. tamizar\r\nla harina y el cacao y revuelva. Revuelva\r\nen la mitad de las frambuesas, raspar en el\r\nbandeja, luego esparza sobre el resto\r\nframbuesas. Hornear en el estante del medio\r\ndurante 30 minutos o, si prefieres un más firme\r\ntextura, durante 5 minutos más. fresco antes\r\ncortar en cuadrados. Almacenar en un lugar hermético.\r\ncontenedor por hasta 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12904,8825,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: brownies de chocolate','Ángela le da un cambio de imagen a estas ricas delicias, con un ingrediente mágico para reducir el contenido de grasa…','["85 g de chocolate amargo, 70 % de cacao, picado en trozos pequeños","85 g de harina común","25 g de cacao en polvo","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de azúcar mascabado light","½ cucharadita de café granulado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de suero de leche","1 huevo","100 g de mayonesa (yo usé Hellman''s)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4.\r\nVierta suficiente agua en una cacerola pequeña para\r\nllenarlo en un tercio. Llevar a ebullición, luego\r\nRetire la sartén del fuego. Pon el\r\nchocolate picado en un tazón grande\r\nque quepa cómodamente sobre la sartén sin\r\ntocando el agua. Sienta la sartén sobre el\r\nagua (aún fuera del fuego) y dejar el\r\nchocolate para que se derrita lentamente durante unos minutos,\r\nrevolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que se derrita\r\nuniformemente. Retire el bol de la sartén,\r\nLuego deja que el chocolate se enfríe un poco.","Mientras tanto, engrase ligeramente y aplique una línea base.\r\nMolde para bizcocho cuadrado de 19cm y 5cm de fondo.\r\nCombina la harina, el cacao y el bicarbonato.\r\nde refresco. Con una cuchara de madera, revuelva ambos\r\nlos azúcares en el chocolate enfriado\r\ncon el café, la vainilla y el buttermilk.\r\nAgregue 1 cucharada de agua tibia. romper y golpear\r\nen el huevo, luego agregue la mayonesa\r\nhasta que quede suave y brillante. tamizar\r\nla mezcla de harina y cacao, luego suavemente\r\nincorporar con una espátula sin mezclar demasiado.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde y luego\r\nextiéndalo suave y uniformemente en el\r\nesquinas. Hornee por 30 minutos. cuando un\r\nSi se inserta una brocheta en el medio,\r\ndebe salir con solo unos pocos húmedos\r\nmigajas que se le peguen. Si se cocina demasiado tiempo,\r\nla mezcla se secará; no lo suficiente\r\ny puede hundirse. Dejar en la lata hasta\r\ncompletamente frío, luego afloje los lados\r\ncon un cuchillo de hoja redonda. gire hacia\r\nuna tabla, retira el papel de revestimiento y corta\r\nen 12 cuadrados."]','2026-01-11 12:54:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12905,8827,'es','Brownies de coco blandos','Densas y pegajosas, estas delicias de despensa están hechas con cacao en lugar de barras de chocolate.','["100 g de cacao","250 g de mantequilla","500 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos batidos","100 g de harina con levadura","100 g de coco rallado","azúcar glas, para espolvorear (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nForrar la base de un molde cuadrado de 21 cm con\r\npergamino para hornear. Poner el cacao, la mantequilla.\r\ny azúcar en tu cacerola más grande y\r\nDerrita suavemente, revolviendo para que la mezcla no se deshaga.\r\natrapar. Cuando la mezcla de cacao se derrita\r\ny combinados, enfriar un poco, luego agregar\r\nlos huevos, poco a poco, seguidos de los\r\nharina y coco.","Vierta en el molde y hornee por 45 minutos.\r\nen un estante del medio – comprobar después de 30 minutos\r\ny cubrir con otro trozo de horno\r\npergamino si la corteza se está dorando demasiado\r\nmucho. Deje enfriar en la lata y luego levante con cuidado.\r\nSacar y cortar en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12906,8829,'es','Trozos de brownie de chocolate con salsa de chocolate','Coloque estas pequeñas tentaciones en un horno bajo para que se calienten rápidamente antes de servir.','["200 g de chocolate amargo, partido en trozos","100 g de chocolate con leche, partido en trozos","85 g de mantequilla","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","85 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","3 huevos, a temperatura ambiente y ligeramente batidos","140 g de harina común","140 g de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes","200ml de yogur natural"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 6 y línea\r\nla base de un molde para hornear cuadrado de 20 cm\r\nlata con papel para hornear. Derretir 100 g de oscuro\r\nchocolate, todo el chocolate con leche y el\r\nmantequilla en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola de\r\nagua hirviendo. Retirar del fuego,\r\nluego agregue los azúcares. Refréscate un poco mientras\r\nPrepara el resto de los ingredientes.","Agrega los huevos a la mezcla de chocolate,\r\nseguido de la harina, las nueces y una pizca\r\nde sal hasta que esté muy bien combinado. Vierta el\r\nmezcla en el molde preparado, luego hornee por\r\n25-30 minutos hasta que salga una brocheta insertada\r\ncon migas pegajosas. Dejar enfriar en la lata.","Para la salsa, derrita suavemente el resto.\r\nchocolate como arriba, luego agregue el yogur\r\ny relájate. Para servir, corte los brownies en\r\ntrozos, luego vierta la salsa en tazones pequeños."]','2026-01-11 12:54:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12907,8831,'es','Brownies de chocolate, arándanos y macadamia','¿Salsa de arándanos sobrante? Úsalo como excusa para hacer estos deliciosos cuadritos de pastel de chocolate y nueces.','["150 g de chocolate amargo, partido en trozos","200 g de mantequilla","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","150 g de harina con levadura","40 g de cacao en polvo tamizado","3 huevos grandes, batidos","50 g de arándanos secos","100 g de nueces de macadamia","60 g de salsa de arándanos"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ 160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para hornear de 20 cm x 20 cm con papel para hornear. Derrita el chocolate amargo con la mantequilla en el microondas o en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre agua hirviendo.","Mezcle el azúcar, la harina y el cacao en polvo y agregue la mezcla de chocolate derretido y mantequilla, seguido de los huevos. Agregue los arándanos secos y las nueces de macadamia, luego agregue la salsa de arándanos.","Vierta en el molde y alise la superficie. Hornee durante 25 a 30 minutos. Dejar enfriar antes de cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12908,8833,'es','Llovizna de limón del siguiente nivel','Lleva la humilde llovizna de limón a nuevas alturas con esta receta del siguiente nivel. Ya sea para una venta de pasteles o una celebración, seguramente agradará al público.','["350 g de mantequilla blanda","350 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","6 huevos medianos","350 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de leche","1 cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla","3 limones sin cera, rallados y exprimidos","150 g de azúcar granulada, más un poco más para servir","300ml de nata doble","50 g de azúcar glas tamizada","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 cucharadas de cuajada de limón"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forra la base de tres moldes de 20 cm con papel para hornear; si no tienes tres, forra tantos como tengas y hornea en tandas. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo con una batidora eléctrica durante 3 minutos hasta que quede suave y esponjoso. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien entre cada adición y raspando los lados del tazón. Incorpora la harina y el polvo para hornear hasta que estén bien combinados, luego agrega la leche, la vainilla y la ralladura de 2½ limones. Divida la masa entre los moldes, luego hornee durante 30-35 minutos, o hasta que esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el medio de los bizcochos salga limpio (o cuando un termómetro de sonda marque 90 ° C).","Mientras tanto, haz la llovizna. Combine el jugo de limón y el azúcar granulada en un bol. Deje que los bizcochos se enfríen en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego invierta dos sobre una rejilla colocada sobre una bandeja para hornear, con el lado plano hacia arriba. Coloque el tercero en la rejilla con el lado abovedado hacia arriba. Vierta un chorrito sobre los bizcochos y déjelos enfriar por completo.","Para el relleno, bata la nata, el azúcar glas y la vainilla con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que espese y se pueda untar. Coloque un bizcocho frío, con el lado plano hacia arriba, en un plato para servir o en un soporte. Extienda sobre la mitad del relleno y luego rocíe sobre la mitad de la cuajada de limón. Cubra con un segundo bizcocho, con el lado plano hacia arriba, y repita con el resto del relleno y la cuajada. Cubra con el bizcocho final, con el lado abovedado hacia arriba. Espolvorea por encima la ralladura de limón restante y un poco de azúcar granulada. Sirva inmediatamente o déjelo a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora. Se mantendrá frío hasta por 24 horas (retírelo del refrigerador 30 minutos antes de servir)."]','2026-01-11 12:54:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12909,8835,'es','Crema de mantequilla de merengue suizo','Rellena tus pasteles con una suave y sedosa crema de mantequilla de merengue. Esta receta es suficiente para rellenar y glasear un pastel de tres niveles, y se puede reducir fácilmente a la mitad para pasteles más pequeños.','["300 g de claras de huevo","600 g de azúcar en polvo","800 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Poner las claras y el azúcar en polvo en un recipiente resistente al calor y colocar sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo, asegurándose de que el agua no toque el fondo del recipiente. Revuelve suavemente durante unos minutos hasta que ya no sientas ningún grano de azúcar entre tus dedos al tocarlo. Transfiera al tazón de una batidora de pie equipada con el accesorio para batir.","Batir a velocidad media hasta que la mezcla se parezca a un merengue y haya alcanzado picos rígidos, aproximadamente 3 minutos. (Puede usar un batidor eléctrico, pero tomará mucho más tiempo, alrededor de 35 minutos). Agregue la mantequilla 1 cucharada a la vez, batiendo para combinar antes de la siguiente adición. Puede parecer cuajado y espeso, pero tenga paciencia y siga batiendo hasta obtener una crema de mantequilla suave y esponjosa. Incorpora la vainilla. Si usa esta crema de mantequilla para glasear un pastel, cambie al accesorio de paleta y póngalo a velocidad baja durante unos minutos; esto ayuda a eliminar las burbujas de aire del glaseado y le da un acabado más suave a su pastel. Si lo deseas, también puedes añadir chocolate derretido, polvo de frutas liofilizadas, extracto de malta u otros aromas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12910,8837,'es','Pastel de hebilla de grosella espinosa','¿Tienes un exceso de grosellas de cosecha propia? Muéstrelos en su máxima expresión en este glorioso pastel, con base de bizcocho, relleno de grosella y cobertura crumble.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para la lata","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos","200 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","50 g de almendras molidas","100 ml de crema agria","60 g de harina común","50 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en cubos","60 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","60 g de gachas de avena","25 g de almendras laminadas","500 g de grosellas frescas o congeladas (consulte el consejo a continuación; una mezcla de verde y rosa, si está disponible)","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo"]','["Para el relleno, combine las grosellas y el azúcar en un bol, triturando ligeramente las bayas. Reservar para macerar.","Para hacer la cobertura crumble, frote la harina y la mantequilla en un tazón pequeño hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Agregue el azúcar, la avena y las almendras y, con las manos, forme una masa suelta. Enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos o hasta un día.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pastel de fondo suelto de 23 cm y forrar con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y la vainilla con una batidora de pie o un batidor eléctrico hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos. Batir los huevos, uno a la vez, añadiendo una cucharada de harina entre cada adición para evitar que la mezcla se cuaje. Incorpora el resto de la harina, el polvo para hornear, las almendras molidas y la crema agria para combinar. Vierta en la lata, seguido del relleno de grosella. Esparza la cobertura crumble sobre la superficie para cubrir el relleno y hornee durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 10 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Si el pastel se dora demasiado rápido, cúbrelo con papel de aluminio durante los últimos 15 minutos. Deje que se enfríe completamente en la lata, luego enfríe hasta que esté frío para facilitar el corte. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12911,3807,'es','pastel sin leche','Pruebe este sencillo bizcocho de chocolate y vainilla para preparar un horneado fácil y sin leche el fin de semana. Utiliza un método todo en uno para ahorrar tiempo en la cocina','["250 g de mantequilla","4 huevos","250 g de azúcar","250 g de harina común","80 g de pudín de vainilla (o harina de maíz más 1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla)","5 g de levadura en polvo","5 ml de extracto de vainilla","20g de cacao","azúcar glas para espolvorear"]','["Comience derritiendo la mantequilla y enfriándola. Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Batir los huevos con el azúcar en una batidora hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos, luego incorporar la harina, el pudín de vainilla, el polvo para hornear, la vainilla y la mantequilla enfriada para hacer una masa suave.","Vierta ¾ de la masa preparada en un molde para pan de 950 g o en un molde para pastel forrado redondo de 20 cm y agregue el cacao a la masa restante. Vierta la mezcla de chocolate en el centro de la masa pálida. Hornee por 40 minutos. Después de hornear, enfriar el bizcocho y espolvorearlo con azúcar glas o cubrirlo con glaseado de chocolate, si lo prefieres."]','2026-01-11 12:54:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12912,8839,'es','pastel de arándanos','Hornea este sencillo pastel de arándanos cuando se te antoje algo dulce. Este horneado fácil y afrutado utiliza yogur natural para mantener el bizcocho húmedo y blando.','["1 cucharadita de mantequilla","400 g de arándanos congelados","335 g de harina, más una cucharada de frutos rojos","275 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos","165 ml de aceite vegetal","2 cucharadas de ralladura de limón","65 ml de jugo de limón","250ml de yogur natural espeso","4 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear"]','["Precaliente el horno a 200 ° C / ventilador 180 ° C / gas 6. Unte con mantequilla un molde para pastel de 22 cm y cubra el fondo con papel para hornear. Reservar un tercio de los arándanos congelados, espolvorear el resto con harina, reservar (no descongelar).","En un bol grande, bata el azúcar y los huevos hasta que quede suave, agregue el aceite vegetal, la ralladura y el jugo de limón y el yogur. Combine los ingredientes húmedos con la harina, el polvo para hornear y una pizca de sal con un batidor. No te preocupes si quedan algunos grumos. Agrega los arándanos mezclados con la harina.","Vierta la mezcla del pastel en el molde preparado. Espolvorea las bayas restantes encima. Mete el molde en el horno, reduce la temperatura a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Hornea durante 1 h 10 min-1 h 20 min o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el bizcocho salga limpio. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar. Después de sacarlo del molde, espolvorea el bizcocho con azúcar glas, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12913,3813,'es','Pastel polaco de chocolate y nueces','Este delicioso y delicado pastel de capas de chocolate es un verdadero horneado espectacular. Apila bizcocho de chocolate, glaseado de chocolate y nueces crujientes.','["150 g de harina común, más 1 cucharada","50 g de cacao","8 huevos, separados","200 g de azúcar en polvo","5 huevos separados (guarda las yemas para la natilla)","200 g de azúcar en polvo","250g de nueces, un par de puñados guardados para decorar y el resto troceado","1 cucharada de harina común","1 cucharada de fécula de patata","100 g de nata doble","100 g de chocolate, picado"]','["Antes de hacer el bizcocho, saca los huevos y la mantequilla del frigorífico para que alcancen temperatura ambiente.","Calentar el horno a 170C/ventilador 150C/gas 3½. Tamizar la harina y mezclarla con el cacao. Batir las claras hasta que estén firmes y luego agregarles el azúcar en tandas pequeñas. Luego agrega las yemas una a una, batiendo constantemente. Tamizar la harina mezclada con el cacao sobre la mezcla de huevo y mezclar todo suavemente con una espátula. Vierta la masa preparada en un molde para hornear poco profundo de 30 cm x 22 cm forrado con papel para hornear y hornee durante 35 minutos. Dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos, retirar del molde y volver a forrar el molde.","Para hacer el merengue, batir las claras a punto de nieve, añadiendo poco a poco el azúcar, una cucharada a la vez. Cuando tengamos un merengue tieso y brillante incorporar las nueces finamente picadas, la harina y la harina de patata. Extienda la mezcla en el molde y cocine por 40 minutos. Retirar con cuidado del horno y dejar enfriar.","Para el glaseado de chocolate, calienta la nata a fuego lento, luego retira del fuego, vierte el chocolate picado y mezcla hasta que se disuelva y el glaseado quede brillante y uniforme.","Cortar el bizcocho de chocolate enfriado en dos capas. Poner el merengue de nueces encima de la capa inferior de bizcocho y espolvorear algunas de las nueces reservadas. Agrega otra capa de merengue y luego la capa superior de bizcocho de chocolate y cubre la parte superior con glaseado de chocolate. Decorar con nueces. Coloque el pastel terminado en el refrigerador durante 1-2 horas antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12914,3817,'es','Esponja victoria de mora','Domina el bizcocho Victoria con esta receta para cocineros más jóvenes, que presenta un método fácil de seguir. Los niños pueden adaptarlo con diferentes mermeladas y frutas.','["200 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco para engrasar","200 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 huevos medianos","200 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","250ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de azúcar glas, más un poco más para espolvorear","250 g de moras","brocha de repostería","2 moldes para pasteles redondos de fondo suelto de 20 cm","paño","tazón grande para mezclar","balanzas","cucharas medidoras","batidor de mano eléctrico","tazón pequeño","espátula","guantes de horno","brocheta","rejilla de enfriamiento","jarra medidora","colador pequeño o coctelera para glaseado"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Utilice una brocha de repostería para untar dos moldes para pasteles redondos de 20 cm con un poco de mantequilla, luego cúbralos con papel para hornear (consulte Cómo forrar un molde para pasteles).","Coloque un paño limpio debajo de un tazón grande; esto lo mantendrá estable mientras mezcla. Pesar la mantequilla, el azúcar en polvo y el extracto de vainilla en el bol.","Asegúrese de que los accesorios para batir estén bien colocados en su batidor de mano, luego conéctelo. Encienda el batidor a velocidad media y úselo para batir los ingredientes durante 2 minutos, o hasta que se vean suaves y cremosos. Asegúrate de mantener los dedos alejados del batidor mientras esté encendido.","Rompe los huevos en un tazón pequeño. Continúe batiendo la mantequilla y el azúcar y use la otra mano para verter los huevos, uno a la vez. Mezclar durante 1 min más o hasta que quede suave.","Pesar la harina y añadirla al bol. Use una espátula para mezclar los ingredientes hasta que no queden bolsas de harina y la mezcla del pastel esté suave.","Use su espátula para dividir la mezcla del pastel de manera uniforme entre los moldes para pastel, luego extienda la mezcla hasta los bordes y alise la superficie.","Use guantes de cocina para colocar las latas en el estante central del horno y programe un temporizador de 22 minutos. Cuando suene el cronómetro, use los guantes de cocina para sacar un poco la rejilla del horno, pero deje los pasteles adentro, deben estar levados y dorados. Introduce una brocheta en el centro de las tortas para comprobar si están cocidas: si la brocheta sale seca, están cocidas; Si queda algo de mezcla de pastel húmeda en la brocheta, los pasteles necesitan un poco más de tiempo en el horno. Si este es el caso, regréselo al horno y hornee por otros 5 minutos, luego verifique nuevamente.","Use sus guantes de cocina para sacar con cuidado los pasteles del horno, colóquelos en una rejilla para enfriar y déjelos enfriar durante 15 minutos en el molde. Cuando esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, coloque los pasteles sobre la rejilla y retire el papel para hornear, luego déjelos hasta que se enfríen por completo.","Mida la nata doble en una jarra y viértala en un bol grande para mezclar. Mide el azúcar glas con una cuchara dosificadora y agrégala a la nata. Utiliza tu batidor eléctrico de mano para batir la nata hasta que quede suavemente batida, como nubes.","Coloque uno de los pasteles en un plato o soporte para pasteles, luego use una espátula o espátula para esparcir la crema sobre el pastel en una capa uniforme. Pon las moras encima de la nata, luego pon el otro bizcocho encima. Utiliza un colador o una coctelera para espolvorear el pastel con un poco de azúcar glas. Es mejor servirlo de inmediato, pero se conservará en el refrigerador durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12915,8841,'es','Pastel de zanahoria clásico','Perfecciona un clásico con nuestra receta de pastel de zanahoria de siguiente nivel. Ha sido probado meticulosamente para que puedas hornear la mejor versión de este pastel tradicional.','["aceite vegetal, para las latas","200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","200 g de azúcar mascabado light","4 huevos","150 g de harina con levadura","50 g de harina de centeno o espelta (opcional; utilice un total de 200 g de harina con levadura si lo prefiere)","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de canela molida","¼ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","250 g (unas 3 medianas) de zanahorias, peladas y ralladas gruesas","75 g de pasas o pasas","75 g de azúcar mascabado light","100 g de nueces","150 g de mantequilla blanda","150 g de azúcar glas","340 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","½ limón, rallado"]','["Para el praliné, forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear y luego vierta el azúcar en una cacerola con 1 cucharada de agua. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 1-2 minutos hasta que el azúcar comience a caramelizar. Agregue las nueces y una pizca de sal marina y revuelva hasta que las nueces estén completamente cubiertas. Raspe con cuidado la mezcla de nueces calientes sobre la bandeja y déjela reposar durante al menos 10 minutos. Saque unas 12 nueces enteras del praliné y resérvelas para decorarlas más tarde, luego pique o triture el resto del praliné en trozos pequeños. Reservar. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético durante un día.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar dos moldes para sándwiches redondos de 20 cm y cubrirlos con papel para hornear. Vierta la mantequilla y el azúcar en un tazón y bata con un batidor eléctrico durante 3 minutos hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos, luego agregue los huevos, uno a la vez, o hágalo con una batidora de pie. Cuando los huevos estén incorporados, incorporar las harinas, el bicarbonato, las especias y una pizca de sal, seguido de las zanahorias, las pasas y la mitad del praliné triturado.","Divida la masa entre los moldes y nivele la superficie con una espátula. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que los bizcochos estén elásticos y al insertar una brocheta en el medio de cada uno, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en las latas durante 10 minutos, luego colóquelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se mantendrá envuelto durante la noche.","Para hacer el glaseado, bate la mantequilla y el azúcar con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que quede suave. Agrega la mitad del queso tierno y la ralladura de limón y bate nuevamente, luego agrega el resto y bate hasta que quede suave.","Para armar, coloque un bizcocho, con el lado plano hacia arriba, sobre un soporte para pasteles o un plato y unte con un tercio del glaseado. Espolvorea con la mayor parte del praliné triturado restante y luego cubre con el otro bizcocho, también con el lado plano hacia arriba. Extienda el resto del glaseado por la parte superior y los lados, luego decore con las nueces praliné enteras. Enfríe durante 1 hora para que cuaje, luego córtelo y sirva con el praliné triturado restante para espolvorear. Se mantendrá en una lata hermética durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12916,8843,'es','pasteles de jaffa','Lleva el clásico snack de pasteles de jaffa a otro nivel haciendo una versión casera con gelatina de naranja con mermelada y rico chocolate amargo.','["mantequilla, para la lata","1 huevo","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de harina con levadura","1 naranja, rallada","125 g de chocolate negro","Paquete de 135 g de gelatina de naranja, cortada en cubos (asegúrese de ser vegetariana, si es necesario)","1 cucharada de mermelada de naranja (opcional)","1-2 naranjas exprimidas (necesitarás 50 ml de jugo)"]','["Primero, haz la gelatina de naranja. Coloque los cubitos de gelatina y la mermelada (si la usa) en un recipiente mediano resistente al calor. Vierta el jugo de naranja y 100 ml de agua hirviendo, luego revuelva hasta que los cubos de gelatina se hayan disuelto. Vierta la mezcla en una bandeja para hornear poco profunda (la nuestra era de 25 x 20 cm) forrada con film transparente; debe llegar aproximadamente ½ cm hacia arriba por los lados. Enfríe durante 2 horas o toda la noche hasta que cuaje.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y unta con mantequilla un molde para cupcakes poco profundo de 12 agujeros. Vierta el huevo y el azúcar en un bol y bata con una batidora eléctrica durante 5 minutos hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. O haga esto en una batidora de pie. Tamizar sobre la harina, añadir la ralladura de naranja y doblar suavemente hasta que no queden bolsas de harina. Vierta 1 cucharada en cada agujero de la lata y extienda suavemente hacia los bordes con el dorso de la cuchara. Hornear durante 8-9 minutos hasta que el bizcocho esté dorado y al pinchar con una brocheta salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 2 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Invierta la gelatina fraguada sobre una tabla, retire el film transparente y corte los discos con un cortador redondo de 5 cm. Voltee los bizcochos de modo que el lado plano quede hacia arriba y luego cubra cada uno con un disco de gelatina. Vierta el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor y derrítalo en ráfagas cortas en el microondas, o coloque el recipiente sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo asegurándose de que no toque el agua. Vierta 1-2 cucharaditas de chocolate derretido sobre cada disco de gelatina, extendiéndolo suavemente para cubrir. Deje reposar durante 2-3 minutos, luego presione suavemente las púas de un tenedor en el chocolate. Deje reposar durante 1 hora antes de servir. Se conservará hasta por tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:54:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12917,8845,'es','horneado en bandeja de pascua','Prepare esta sencilla bandeja horneada con temática de Pascua con los niños. Cuenta con un bizcocho de chocolate cubierto con glaseado de dulce de azúcar y luego decorado con dulces y golosinas de Pascua.','["150 ml de aceite de girasol, más un extra para la lata","165 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos","150ml de leche","165 g de harina con levadura","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","100 g de chocolate con leche o negro, picado (ya sea una barra de chocolate o un huevo de Pascua, partido)","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","100 g de azúcar glas","100 g de golosinas de Pascua (huevos de chocolate, dulces, trozos de barra de chocolate)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar una bandeja para hornear, de unos 20 x 30 cm y 5 cm de profundidad. Ponga el aceite, el azúcar, los huevos y la leche en un bol y bata hasta que estén bien combinados. Tamice sobre la harina, el cacao y el bicarbonato y revuelva brevemente hasta que se combinen. Vierta la mezcla en el molde y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que el pastel haya subido bien y rebote cuando se presiona. Transfiera a una rejilla y deje enfriar por completo.","Derrita el chocolate en un recipiente colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua, o en breves ráfagas en el microondas hasta que se derrita. Dejar enfriar unos minutos.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar glas hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos, luego rociar con el chocolate y volver a batir hasta que quede suave y de color uniforme. Agite el glaseado sobre la parte superior del pastel, con algunos picos y remolinos para decorar. Espolvoree con las delicias de Pascua para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12918,8847,'es','Cupcakes veganos de vainilla','Hornea estas versiones veganas de cupcakes de vainilla para disfrutar de un dulce capricho. Son ideales para acompañar una taza de té a media mañana o para tomar el té de la tarde.','["50 ml de aceite de colza","1 cucharadita de vinagre de sidra","200ml de leche vegetal (nosotros utilizamos de avena)","225 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","200 g de bloque de mantequilla vegetal vegana, ablandada","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","400 g de azúcar glas"]','["Combine el aceite de colza, el vinagre de sidra y la leche de avena en una jarra. Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forra una bandeja para cupcakes o muffins de 12 orificios con fundas de papel. Vierta la harina, el polvo para hornear y el azúcar en un tazón grande. Haga un hueco en el medio y vierta lentamente la mezcla húmeda, batiendo constantemente. Agregue la pasta de vainilla y revuelva para combinar. Divida uniformemente entre las cajas de papel y hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el medio de un cupcake, éste salga limpio. Transfiera a una rejilla para enfriar para que se enfríe por completo.","Para el glaseado, bate el bloque de plantas y la vainilla hasta que estén suaves y cremosos, aproximadamente 2 minutos. Agrega el azúcar glas en tandas, batiendo bien después de cada adición, y una pizca grande de sal. Transfiera a una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella. Coloque remolinos encima de cada cupcake enfriado. Se conservará helado hasta por tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:54:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12919,8849,'es','Tarta de calabacín vegana','Usa un exceso de calabacines y hornea este bizcocho vegano con una picante llovizna de limón. Ideal para un café por la mañana o un té por la tarde.','["80 g de bloque de mantequilla vegana, ablandada, más un poco más para la lata","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 limones, rallados, 1 en jugo","100ml de leche vegetal (nosotros utilizamos de avena)","100 g de almendras molidas","175 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","175 g de calabacines rallados gruesos","200 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g. Batir el bloque de mantequilla vegana, el azúcar y la ralladura de limón hasta que se combinen. Agrega la leche vegetal y bate lentamente para combinar. Agrega las almendras molidas, la harina y la levadura en polvo, junto con el calabacín rallado, y revuelve para combinar. Vierta la masa en el molde preparado (quedará bastante espesa) y nivele la parte superior. Hornee durante 55-60 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Pasar a una rejilla y dejar enfriar completamente en el molde.","Para hacer el glaseado, tamice el azúcar glas en un bol y agregue 1 cucharada de jugo de limón y revuelva para combinar. Agregue un poco más de jugo de limón si es necesario, ½ cucharadita a la vez, hasta alcanzar la consistencia deseada. Retire el pastel del molde y rocíe sobre el glaseado, dejando que gotee por los lados. Dejar reposar durante 20-30 minutos. Cortar en rodajas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12920,8851,'es','Tarta de queso al horno con chocolate y naranja','Prepare un postre que será el tema de conversación de la fiesta con este cremoso y rico pastel de queso con chocolate y naranja.','["225 g de jengibre o digestivos","115 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","1 naranja, rallada","rodajas de naranja confitada, para servir (opcional)","600 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","3 huevos, más 2 yemas (congela la clara extra para otra receta)","175 g de nata doble","175 g de azúcar moreno blando","350 g de chocolate amargo (al menos 70 % de sólidos de cacao), picado en trozos grandes, y más para servir","3 naranjas ralladas"]','["Para el relleno, saca el queso tierno, los huevos y la nata doble del frigorífico para que alcancen temperatura ambiente 1 hora antes de empezar. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar la base de un molde desmontable de 23 cm con papel para hornear: soltar el aro, colocar el papel sobre la base y volver a colocar el aro. Esto asegurará que no quede ningún borde en el fondo del pastel de queso terminado.","Coloque las nueces de jengibre en un procesador de alimentos y triture hasta obtener una migaja fina. Agregue la mantequilla derretida y la ralladura de naranja, luego mezcle brevemente hasta que las migajas estén cubiertas. Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y presione hasta obtener una capa uniforme con el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee durante 10-15 minutos hasta que la base esté ligeramente crujiente.","Batir el queso tierno y el azúcar moreno hasta que esté cremoso con una batidora eléctrica. Batir los huevos enteros, las yemas y la nata hasta que quede suave. Vierta el chocolate amargo en un recipiente resistente al calor y derrítalo en el microondas en ráfagas de 20 segundos, o haga esto en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una olla con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Dejar enfriar hasta que esté tibio al tacto. Vierta lentamente el chocolate derretido sobre la mezcla de queso tierno, batiendo continuamente hasta que se combinen. Agrega la ralladura de naranja y reserva las naranjas.","Envuelva bien el fondo del molde para pastel en papel de aluminio para evitar fugas, luego colóquelo en un molde para asar profundo. Vierte el relleno de tarta de queso sobre la base de galleta. Coloque el molde para asar en el horno, luego vierta suficiente agua caliente en el molde para asar hasta que suba 2½ cm por los lados del molde para pasteles. Hornee durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 15 minutos hasta que el borde de la tarta de queso esté firme, pero el centro se tambalee ligeramente (continuará endureciéndose en el refrigerador).","Coloque el molde para pastel sobre una rejilla y luego pase un cuchillo pequeño y afilado por el borde para aflojarlo. Retire el papel de aluminio y déjelo enfriar completamente en el molde, luego enfríe durante al menos 6 horas en el refrigerador antes de colocarlo en un plato. Segmente las naranjas reservadas, evitando la médula, y úselas para decorar la parte superior junto con una ralladura de chocolate amargo y rodajas de naranja confitadas, si lo desea. Se mantendrá tapado en el frigorífico hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12921,3872,'es','Rollo suizo de chocolate','Este postre nostálgico se puede preparar con un día de anticipación. Rellenar con crema de vainilla, espolvorear con azúcar glas para terminar y servir en rodajas','["60 g de harina con levadura","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","3 huevos","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más un poco más para esparcir","200ml de nata doble","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","50 g de azúcar glas tamizada y un poco más para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Forrar un molde para panecillos suizos de 22 x 32 cm (si es de 20 x 30 cm, todavía está bien) con papel para hornear. Tamizar la harina y el cacao en polvo juntos en un bol y reservar.","Rompe los huevos en otro tazón o en el tazón de una batidora y agrega el azúcar. Use un batidor eléctrico o el accesorio para batir para batir los huevos y el azúcar durante 5 minutos hasta que estén pálidos y muy espesos. Use una cuchara o espátula para incorporar suavemente la mezcla de harina hasta que esté completamente incorporada y todo tenga el mismo color sin rayas.","Raspe suavemente la mezcla en el molde y extiéndala en las esquinas. Hornee durante 9-10 minutos hasta que esté inflado y elástico al tacto. Mientras se hornea el bizcocho, coge otro trozo de pergamino un poco más grande que el molde y espolvoréalo con azúcar. Cuando el bizcocho esté cocido, utilice guantes de cocina para invertirlo con cuidado sobre el papel endulzado. Retire la lata y retire la capa superior de pergamino. Marque una línea a 2 cm de uno de los bordes más cortos, luego use el pergamino para enrollar el bizcocho en espiral con el pergamino atravesándolo. Deje que el bizcocho enrollado se enfríe por completo.","Mientras el bizcocho se enfría, prepara el relleno batiendo todos los ingredientes hasta que la crema se endurezca. Desenrollar el bizcocho y extenderlo sobre el relleno dejando limpio el borde marcado. Comenzando desde el borde marcado, use el pergamino para enrollar el bizcocho alrededor del relleno. Colóquelo en una tabla o fuente para servir y espolvoree con azúcar glas. Puede servirse inmediatamente o enfriarse hasta por 24 horas. Servir en rebanadas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12922,8853,'es','Tarta de queso al horno con chocolate blanco y frambuesas','Mezcle puré de frambuesa picante con un relleno cremoso de pastel de queso con chocolate blanco y vainilla para obtener un postre perfectamente equilibrado. Es ideal para una ocasión especial.','["225 g de galletas digestivas","15 g de frambuesas liofilizadas (opcional)","115 g de mantequilla, derretida","250 g de frambuesas frescas o congeladas","½ limón, exprimido","175 g de azúcar en polvo, más 2 cucharaditas","600 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","3 huevos grandes, más 2 yemas","175 g de nata doble","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla","350 gramos de chocolate blanco"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar la base de un molde desmontable de 23 cm con papel para hornear. Coloque las galletas y las frambuesas liofilizadas, si las usa, en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener migajas finas. Agregue la mantequilla para cubrir las migajas, luego vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y presione hasta obtener una capa uniforme con el dorso de una cuchara. Enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Para el relleno, poner en una sartén a fuego medio las frambuesas, el jugo de limón y 2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo. Cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que las bayas se ablanden y se vuelvan jugosas. Transfiera a un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Verter en un bol y dejar enfriar. Si prefieres un puré suave, pasa la mezcla por un colador de malla fina y desecha las pepitas.","Batir el queso tierno con una batidora eléctrica hasta que se suelte, luego incorporar 175 g de azúcar, los huevos, las yemas, la nata y la vainilla hasta que quede suave. Derrita el chocolate blanco en un recipiente resistente al calor en el microondas en ráfagas de 20 segundos, o sobre una olla con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el fondo del recipiente no toque el agua. Vierta lentamente un tercio de la mezcla de queso tierno endulzado en el chocolate derretido, batiendo continuamente hasta que se combinen, luego viértalo en el resto de la mezcla de queso tierno. Batir hasta que esté completamente combinado.","Retire la lata del refrigerador y envuelva bien el fondo de la lata con papel de aluminio para evitar fugas. Coloque la lata en una fuente para asar honda. Vierte la mezcla de cheesecake sobre la base de galleta. Vierta sobre el puré de frambuesa y revuélvalo con la mezcla de tarta de queso con una brocheta.","Coloque el molde para asar en el horno, luego vierta suficiente agua caliente en el molde para asar hasta que suba 2½ cm por los lados del molde para pasteles. Hornee durante 1 hora 15 minutos a 1 hora 30 minutos, o hasta que el borde de la tarta de queso esté firme, pero el centro se tambalee ligeramente (continuará endureciéndose en el refrigerador).","Coloque la lata sobre una rejilla y luego pase un cuchillo pequeño y afilado por el borde. Deje enfriar completamente en el molde, luego enfríe durante al menos 6 horas antes de sacarlo del molde."]','2026-01-11 12:54:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12923,8855,'es','Tarta de queso con boniato','Coloque capas de jarabe de arce, camote especiado y queso crema frío sobre una base digestiva triturada para hacer este postre. Confía en nosotros, realmente funciona','["100 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","250 g de galletas digestivas","1 cucharadita de canela molida","300 g de queso crema","50 g de azúcar glas","1 vaina de vainilla, solo semillas","150ml de nata doble","350 g de batata, cocida, triturada hasta obtener un puré y enfriada","150ml de nata doble","1-2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","3 cucharadas de jarabe de arce, más un poco más para servir","palomitas de caramelo, para servir"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde de fondo suelto de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Mezcle las galletas en un procesador de alimentos con la canela y luego vierta la mantequilla derretida. Mezcle bien para cubrir todas las migas de galleta, luego presione en el molde forrado para crear una base uniforme. Poner en el frigorífico para que cuaje durante 1 hora aproximadamente.","Para hacer el relleno de queso crema, bate el queso crema con el azúcar glass y la vainilla hasta que esté suave, luego agrega la crema doble y bate hasta que esté bien mezclado y espese. Vierta esto sobre la base de galleta, alisando la superficie y asegurándose de que no queden burbujas de aire. Alisar con el dorso de una cuchara o espátula y meter en el frigorífico para que cuaje durante 3 h.","Para la cobertura, bata la batata, la crema y la mezcla de especias hasta que espese. Vierta esto con cuidado sobre la capa de queso crema, una vez más usando el dorso de una cuchara o una espátula para alisar la superficie y asegurarse de que no queden burbujas de aire. Dejar reposar en el frigorífico durante la noche. Rocíe sobre el jarabe de arce, luego espolvoree con las palomitas de caramelo y una pizca de sal marina."]','2026-01-11 12:54:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12924,8857,'es','galletas dobles','Galletas de chocolate y dulces que quedan increíblemente calientes recién horneadas o hechas en sándwiches de helado. El máximo capricho','["100 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","120 g de azúcar moreno claro","1 huevo","100 g de harina con levadura","50 g de copos de avena","100 g de chispas de chocolate con leche","1 cucharada de mini trozos de dulce de azúcar","Paquetes de 4 barras Twix de 25 g, picadas"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forre 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear resistente a la grasa.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en una batidora de mesa hasta que estén pálidos y ligeros, luego agregar el huevo, la harina, la avena y una pizca de sal y batir una vez más.","Agregue las chispas de chocolate y los trozos de dulce de azúcar, luego vierta cucharadas de postre redondeadas de la masa para galletas en las bandejas para hornear preparadas; debería terminar con 12. Presione suavemente trozos de Twix en la parte superior de cada montículo y hornee en el horno durante 12 a 15 minutos o hasta que estén dorados en los bordes.","Deje enfriar unos minutos sobre el papel y luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. ¡Increíble en sándwiches de helado!"]','2026-01-11 12:54:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12925,8859,'es','Las barritas veganas del millonario','Estas delicias de chocolate veganas y sin gluten con dátiles, anacardos y jarabe de arce son tan pegajosas y deliciosas como las galletas de mantequilla originales del Millonario.','["150 g de anacardos","50 g de copos de avena","4 dátiles Medjool, sin hueso","50 g de aceite de coco, derretido","350 g de dátiles Medjool deshuesados","125 ml de leche de almendras sin azúcar","25 ml de jarabe de arce","150 g de aceite de coco","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","150 g de aceite de coco","5 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","2 cucharaditas de jarabe de arce"]','["Engrase un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 cm y forre con papel para hornear. Vierta los anacardos y la avena en un procesador de alimentos y tritúrelos hasta obtener migajas. Agrega los dátiles y el aceite de coco y vuelve a licuar. Transfiera a la lata y use una cuchara para presionar la mezcla de nueces en una capa compacta y uniforme que cubra la base. Enfría mientras preparas el relleno.","Para el relleno, agregue los dátiles, la leche de almendras, el jarabe de arce y el aceite de coco a una cacerola con una pizca generosa de sal y cocine a fuego lento. Hierva durante 2-3 minutos hasta que los dátiles estén muy suaves, luego viértalos en la licuadora, agregue el extracto de vainilla y mezcle hasta obtener un puré suave. Añade un poco más de sal si la mezcla queda demasiado dulce. Vierta sobre la base de nueces y extienda por los lados del molde, dejando la superficie lo más lisa posible. Enfríe mientras prepara la cobertura.","Calienta suavemente el aceite de coco en una cacerola hasta que se derrita. Retirar del fuego y agregar el cacao y el sirope de arce hasta que no queden grumos. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos, vierta sobre la capa de caramelo y regrese al refrigerador por al menos 3 horas o hasta que cuaje firmemente. Para servir, cortar en cuadritos. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta 1 semana."]','2026-01-11 12:54:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12926,8861,'es','galletas de pastel de zanahoria','¡Un favorito universal, en forma de galleta! Mejora tu pastel de zanahoria estándar con estas delicias de galleta del tamaño de un bocado','["140 g de queso crema","140 g de azúcar glas más 3 cucharadas","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","350 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorearse las manos","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","140 g de mantequilla, blanda","140 g de azúcar moreno claro y suave","1 huevo batido","200 g de zanahoria, finamente rallada","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","3 cucharadas de nueces finamente picadas"]','["Mezcle el queso crema, 3 cucharadas de azúcar glas y el extracto de vainilla en un bol, luego póngalo en el congelador para que se endurezca durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, combine la harina, el polvo para hornear y las especias en un bol. En un tazón más grande, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que quede cremoso. Batir el huevo y luego la zanahoria. Vierta los ingredientes secos y mezcle para formar una masa.","Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Espolvorea tus manos con un poco de harina, luego divide la masa en 14 bolas y colócalas en la bandeja. Usa la palma de tu mano para aplanar cada uno hasta formar un círculo delgado. Agregue 1 cucharadita de la mezcla de queso crema al centro de cada uno, luego envuelva con cuidado la masa alrededor del relleno para sellarlo, pellizcando la parte superior y enrollándola hasta formar una bola áspera para evitar que se escape el relleno.","Cuando todas las bolas tengan forma, use la palma de la mano para aplanarlas ligeramente y luego póngalas en el refrigerador para que se enfríen durante 30 minutos. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Hornea las galletas durante 20 minutos hasta que estén doradas y crujientes. Retirar del horno, dejar que se endurezcan en la bandeja durante 10 a 15 minutos, luego transferirlos a rejillas para que se enfríen por completo.","Mezcle el azúcar glas con el jugo de naranja hasta obtener una consistencia llovizna. Rocíe todas las galletas, espolvoree con las nueces y la ralladura de naranja y luego déjelas reposar. Es mejor consumirlos el día en que se preparan, pero se conservan en el refrigerador en un recipiente hermético hasta por 2 días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12927,8863,'es','pastelitos de coco','Obtén una triple dosis de coco en estos pastelitos ligeros y esponjosos, cubiertos con crema de coco batida y coco rallado nevado: una delicia deliciosa sin gluten a la hora del té.','["Lata de 400 g de leche de coco entera (no debe contener estabilizantes)","140 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","50 g de coco rallado","100 g de aceite de coco","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos grandes","200 g de harina con levadura sin gluten (la mezcla debe incluir goma xantana; yo usé Doves Farm)","100ml de leche de coco","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Enfría la lata de leche de coco durante la noche. Al día siguiente, haz las tartas. Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con cajas para muffins. Coloque el aceite de coco y el azúcar en un tazón grande y use un batidor eléctrico para batir durante unos 5 minutos hasta que esté suave y cremoso. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo hasta que estén completamente combinados antes de agregar más. Trabajando en tres adiciones, agregue la harina, alternando con la leche de coco, luego agregue el extracto de vainilla.","Coloque la masa en el molde para muffins preparado con una bola para helado, luego hornee durante 20-22 minutos o hasta que los pasteles estén dorados y al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Sacar los cupcakes del molde y dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Es mejor preparar la crema batida unas horas después de servirla. Abra la lata de leche de coco boca abajo y vierta el líquido fino. Coloque la leche de coco espesa en un tazón grande, agregue el azúcar glas y la vainilla y bata durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté suave y esponjosa. Unte o saque la crema batida sobre los cupcakes y espolvoree con el coco rallado. Es mejor guardarlo en el refrigerador y consumirlo en un par de días."]','2026-01-11 12:54:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12928,8865,'es','Rollo de higo dulce','Los sabores del bizcocho tradicional se transforman en un panecillo suizo, con nuez moscada, canela, plátano en el bizcocho y un toque de mermelada de higos.','["140 g de higos secos blandos, picados","1 plátano mediano muy maduro","nuez de mantequilla, para engrasar","3 huevos grandes, separados","225 g de azúcar mascabado light","120 g de harina integral","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de canela molida","buena nuez moscada fresca rallada (opcional)","4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","300ml de nata doble","4 cucharadas de azúcar glas, tamizada","unos 250-300 g de mermelada o conserva de higos"]','["Cubrir los higos con agua hirviendo en una\r\ntazón y dejar reposar para que se ablande durante 30 minutos.\r\nEscurrir y triturar bien con el plátano.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nEngrase un molde para panecillos suizos, de unos 34 x 24 cm.\r\nForre la base con papel para hornear.","Separar los huevos, recogiendo los\r\nclaras en un tazón grande y limpio. batir con\r\nuna batidora eléctrica hasta que se formen picos rígidos\r\nel extremo de su batidor, luego agregue la mitad del\r\nazúcar y batir hasta que esté espeso y brillante.","En otro bol batir las yemas.\r\ncon el azúcar restante hasta que esté pálido. batir\r\nen la mezcla de puré de higos. Doblar esta mezcla\r\nen la mezcla de merengue hasta que esté bien\r\ncombinado. Mezclar la harina, el bicarbonato de\r\nrefresco, especias y una pizca de sal. Espolvorealo\r\nsobre la mezcla húmeda y doblar muy suavemente\r\nnuevamente hasta que esté bien combinado. Raspe suavemente\r\ny esparcir la masa en el molde. hornear\r\ndurante 12-15 minutos hasta que esté elástico al tacto.","Mientras tanto, coloque un paño de cocina limpio\r\nel banco (esto ayuda a mantener el pastel bonito\r\ny húmedo). Esparcir el azúcar en polvo por encima\r\nla toalla, voltear el pastel, quitar la\r\npergamino, luego enrolle desde el más corto\r\nlado con el paño de cocina en un rollo suizo.\r\nLevantar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Desenrolla el bizcocho con cuidado. Usando electricidad\r\nbatidoras, batir la nata y el azúcar glas\r\njuntos hasta formar picos suaves. Untar la mermelada de higos\r\nsobre el bizcocho, seguido de la nata.\r\nEnrollar nuevamente y cortar en rodajas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12929,8867,'es','Giros rizados','Utilice masa de croissant lista para enrollar para crear estas delicias rellenas de chocolate y caramelo que son pegajosas y pegajosas cuando se comen calientes.','["140 g de caramelos blandos","2 x tubos de 6 croissants listos para enrollar (nosotros usamos Jus Rol)","100ml de leche","50 g de gotas de chocolate amargo, o utilice un bloque de chocolate y pique en trozos grandes","azúcar glas dorado, para espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPon los caramelos en una cacerola pequeña con\r\nla leche y derretir a fuego muy lento,\r\nrevolviendo ocasionalmente para unir\r\nhasta obtener una salsa suave. Enfriar el fuego durante\r\n1-2 minutos hasta que esté un poco menos derretido y\r\nespesado ligeramente.","Cubra dos bandejas para hornear con\r\npergamino. Desenrolla un tubo de croissant\r\nmasa. Pellizca la diagonal\r\ncosturas perforadas, pero dividir la masa\r\nen tres rectángulos a lo largo de la recta\r\ncosturas cruzadas. Corta cada rectángulo en\r\n4 tiras largas y delgadas, para terminar con 12.\r\nRocíe un poco de caramelo a lo largo de\r\ncada tira, luego esparza con un poco\r\ngotas de chocolate. Desenrolla la otra masa\r\ny cortar en tiras del mismo tamaño, luego\r\nsándwich junto con el toffee-choc\r\nlos cubiertos. Sosteniendo los extremos de cada\r\npelar, girar bien y colocar sobre la preparación\r\nbandejas para hornear: se expandirán un poco.","Una vez que todos tengan forma, hornee durante 12-15 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Espolvorear con un poco\r\nAzúcar glas dorado para servir y disfrutar.\r\nLo mejor, recién horneado."]','2026-01-11 12:54:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12930,8869,'es','Cupcakes con botones de caramelo','Estos bizcochos individuales tienen un centro secreto y un glaseado de queso crema; sírvelos cubiertos con botones de caramelo caseros.','["175 g de mantequilla, blanda","175 g de azúcar mascabado light","2 huevos grandes","175 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharadas de leche","Botones de caramelo caseros (consulte la receta en los consejos a continuación)","Lata 397g Nestlé Clavel Caramelo","Tarrina de 200 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","100 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","450 g de azúcar glas dorado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y\r\nforre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con cajas. poner\r\nla mantequilla y el azúcar en un bol,\r\nnata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave\r\ny pálido. Agrega los huevos y vuelve a batir.\r\nluego agregue la harina y la leche, y mezcle con\r\nuna espátula hasta que esté bien combinado. dividir el\r\nmezcla entre las cajas de muffins. hornear\r\ndurante 18-20 minutos hasta que esté elástico y en una brocheta\r\nsale limpio. Dejar enfriar.","Mezclar 140g de Caramelo de Clavel con\r\nel queso crema, la mantequilla y el azúcar glas\r\ncon un batidor eléctrico de mano, hasta que quede suave.\r\nEnfriar durante 10 minutos. Cortar un agujero en el centro.\r\nde cada cupcake (nosotros usamos un descorazonador de manzanas)\r\ny rellénelo con el resto del caramelo Carnation.\r\nTransfiera el glaseado a una manga pastelera equipada con\r\nuna boquilla redonda y agítela sobre los cupcakes.\r\nSe conservará durante 3 días si se conserva en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 12:54:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12931,8871,'es','Pastel gigante de naranja jaffa','Dale aún más sorpresa a la clásica combinación de sabores de chocolate y naranja con este pastel con gelatina picante y lujosa ganache de chocolate.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos grandes","100 g de yogur natural desnatado","300 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","ralladura de 4 naranjas grandes (use las naranjas a continuación)","exprime 5 naranjas grandes (unos 500 ml), guarda la ralladura de 1 naranja para terminar","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","6 hojas de gelatina","Bote de 300ml de nata doble","200 g de chocolate con leche, finamente picado","100 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque","ralladura de 1 naranja"]','["Primero haz la gelatina. Engrasar unos 20cm\r\nmolde para pastel redondo y forrar con film transparente\r\n(puedes utilizar la lata de 23cm que necesitarás\r\nhornea el pastel, pero tendrás que hacerlo\r\nesto el día anterior para que puedas\r\nretírela antes de hacer el bizcocho).\r\nQuitar la ralladura de 4 de las naranjas.\r\ny reservar para el bizcocho. Inclina la naranja\r\njugo y azúcar en una cacerola y suavemente\r\nCalentar para disolver el azúcar. Mientras tanto,\r\nremojar las hojas de gelatina en agua fría\r\ndurante unos minutos hasta que esté suave. Retire el\r\ngelatina del agua, exprimir\r\ncualquier exceso y agregar al tibio\r\njugo de naranja, revuelva hasta que la gelatina\r\nse ha disuelto. Vierta el líquido en el\r\nmolde para pastel forrado y enfríe durante al menos 4 horas\r\no preferiblemente durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3 y\r\nforrar un molde para pastel redondo de 23 cm con horneado\r\npergamino. Volcar todos los ingredientes del pastel.\r\nen un tazón grande y combine con\r\nun batidor de mano eléctrico hasta que quede suave. Cuchara\r\nen el molde y alisar la superficie.\r\nHornee en el centro del horno durante\r\n55 minutos, o hasta que se inserte una brocheta\r\nsale limpio. Dejar enfriar en la lata durante\r\n15 minutos, luego invertir sobre una rejilla\r\ny dejar enfriar por completo.","Ahora haz la ganache. Calentar el\r\nCrema en una sartén pequeña hasta que esté caliente. Pon el\r\nchocolate en un tazón pequeño y vierte sobre\r\nla nata, dejar actuar 10 minutos y luego mezclar\r\nbueno, deberías quedarte con un suave\r\nsalsa de chocolate. dejar en la habitación\r\ntemperatura hasta que la ganache se enfríe\r\ny espesa un poco (puedes ponerlo en\r\nel refrigerador para acelerar esto, pero manténgalo\r\nojo, ya que se endurecerá rápidamente).","Para montar el bizcocho, colóquelo sobre una\r\nsoporte para pastel y recorte la parte superior para darle\r\nuna superficie plana. Calentar la mermelada de albaricoque en\r\nel microondas hasta que esté un poco líquido. pintar\r\ncolóquelo sobre la parte superior del pastel, luego voltee el\r\ngelatina de naranja de su lata y colocar sobre\r\narriba. Usando una espátula, haga girar el\r\nganache de chocolate sobre gelatina de naranja,\r\ndejándolo gotear por los lados del\r\npastel un poco. Servir inmediatamente o\r\ndentro de las 24 horas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12932,8873,'es','pasteles de whoopie','Estas pequeñas y divertidas delicias tardan menos de una hora en prepararse y serán un dulce complemento para cualquier venta de pasteles.','["300 g de harina con levadura","50 g de cacao","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","175 g de azúcar moreno claro y suave","1 huevo","75ml de aceite de girasol, más extra","150 ml de suero de leche","1 tarrina de glaseado listo para usar","chispitas de colores, para decorar","100 g de azúcar glas","50 g de cacao","100ml de nata doble"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y\r\nforre las bandejas para hornear con pergamino. Mezclar\r\nharina, cacao, bicarbonato, azúcar y una pizca de\r\nsal. Batir el huevo, el aceite y el suero de leche.\r\njuntos, luego mezcle con los ingredientes secos con\r\n75ml de agua hirviendo. Cuchara 20 cucharadas\r\nen bandejas, bien espaciadas. Hornear por 12 minutos\r\no hasta que esté firme al tacto, retire las bandejas. Fresco.","Para el glaseado, tamizar el azúcar glas y el cacao.\r\nen una cacerola pequeña. Incorpora poco a poco la nata.\r\nseguido de 100 ml de agua hirviendo. Calor\r\nsuavemente hasta que quede almibarado.","Sandwich 2 pasteles junto con el\r\nglaseado, vierta sobre un poco de glaseado y\r\ndecorar con chispas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12933,8875,'es','Pasteles de hadas helados','Enseña a niños de 8 a 14 años a hacer pasteles de hadas y garantiza una actividad divertida en la cocina.','["100 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de mantequilla muy blanda","100 g de harina con levadura","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de mantequilla muy blanda","200 g de azúcar glas","colorantes alimentarios, confites, malvaviscos, etc."]','["Pregúntale a un adulto\r\nayudante para girar\r\nel horno a\r\nVentilador/gas 180C/160C 4.\r\nPon una caja de papel\r\nen cada hueco del panecillo.","poner el azucar\r\ny mantequilla (es\r\ndebe ser suave o tu\r\nno podrá mezclarse\r\ncorrectamente) en un bol\r\ny mezclarlo.\r\nTamizar la harina.","romper los huevos\r\nen un separado\r\ntazón (con una cuchara, saque\r\npedazos de concha que caen\r\nen) y agregarlos\r\nal bol con\r\nla vainilla. Mezclar\r\ntodo junto.","dividir entre\r\nlos casos usando\r\nuna cuchara, raspando\r\nQuítelo con un cuchillo. Pregúntele a un adulto.\r\nayudante para poner el\r\nbandeja en el horno para\r\n20 minutos.","mezclar la mantequilla\r\ny azúcar glas\r\nhacer una cremosa\r\nglaseado. Añadir colorante,\r\nsi quieres. Empujar un\r\nboquilla de glaseado en\r\nuna bolsa de hielo, entonces\r\nvierta el glaseado.","deja los pasteles\r\nenfriar completamente\r\nen la bandeja. Tubería\r\nglaseado en cada pastel\r\ny decorar con\r\nmalvaviscos\r\no chispas, o\r\nlo que quieras."]','2026-01-11 12:54:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12934,8877,'es','galletas locas','Ya sea que las compartas en el trabajo o las incluyas en una venta de pasteles, ¡estas pequeñas y atrevidas galletas seguramente alegrarán el día de todos!','["350 g de harina común, más extra","200 g de mantequilla salada, en cubitos","120 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","2 yemas de huevo","2 botes de 300 g de glaseado real listo para usar (usamos Dr Oetker, Sainsbury''s)","colorantes alimentarios rojos y amarillos"]','["Batir la harina y la mantequilla hasta que\r\nLa mezcla parece pan rallado. Añade el\r\nazúcar, vainilla y yemas de huevo y batido\r\nhasta obtener una masa suave. Enrollar la masa\r\nuna superficie ligeramente enharinada en 2 salchichas\r\nFormas de unos 4-5 cm de diámetro. Envolver\r\nen film transparente y dejar enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nCortar la masa en rodajas de 4 mm de grosor y\r\ncolocar en bandejas para hornear, ligeramente espaciadas\r\naparte. Hornee por 15 minutos o hasta que esté pálido.\r\ndorado. Transfiera a una rejilla para que se enfríe.","Caliente el glaseado siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.\r\nAgrega un poco de colorante alimentario a cada tarrina.\r\ny glasear la mitad de las galletas en amarillo, y\r\ndecorar con rojo, luego congelar la otra mitad\r\nrojo y decorar en amarillo. Dejar secar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12935,8879,'es','Pasteles pegajosos de chocolate','Este horneado fácil de preparar se mantendrá fresco en un recipiente hermético hasta por dos días.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla sin sal","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes","200 g de harina con levadura","50 g de cacao","100 g de gotas de chocolate con leche","85 g de mantequilla","85 g de azúcar en polvo","200 g de leche condensada light","50 g de gotas de chocolate con leche, más un extra para esparcir"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre una bandeja para hornear o una pequeña\r\nfuente para asar, de unos 20 x 30 cm. Calor\r\nhorno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Suavemente\r\nderrita la mantequilla en una cacerola grande,\r\nDeje enfriar durante 5 minutos, agregue el azúcar y la vainilla.\r\ny los huevos, luego batir hasta que quede suave con\r\nuna cuchara de madera. Agregue la harina,\r\ncacao y ¼ de cucharadita de sal. Agregue las gotas de chocolate con leche y hornee.\r\ndurante 35 minutos hasta que haya subido por completo y una brocheta\r\nsale con unas cuantas migas húmedas.","Para la parte superior, calentar suavemente 85 g de mantequilla.\r\ny 85 g de azúcar en polvo juntos hasta\r\nambos están derretidos. Agregue 200 g de luz\r\nleche condensada y llevar a ebullición.\r\nDeje enfriar durante 5 minutos y luego agregue 50 g de leche.\r\ngotas de chocolate para derretir. difundir\r\nsobre el bizcocho frío, espolvorear con más\r\ngotas de chocolate y cortar en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12936,8881,'es','Pasteles de hadas de plátano Dotty','Estos dulces pasteles de plátano son deliciosos y sencillos de preparar para una venta de pasteles o una fiesta infantil.','["100 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","140 g de harina con levadura","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 plátano muy maduro","140 g de azúcar glas","100 g de glaseado real listo para enrollar","colorante alimentario rojo","cientos y miles"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nForre un molde de 12 panecillos con cajas de pastel de hadas.\r\nPoner el azúcar, la mantequilla, la harina, los huevos, la vainilla.\r\ny plátano en un tazón grande juntos.\r\nBatir con batidora eléctrica hasta obtener plátano\r\nSe tritura y se mezcla todo. dividir\r\nentre las cajas y hornear por\r\n20-22 minutos hasta que se introduzca una brocheta\r\nsale limpio. Fresco.","Para decorar, mezcla el azúcar glas con\r\nsuficiente agua para poder tomarla con una cuchara, pero no\r\ndemasiado líquido o se derramará de los pasteles.\r\nUnte un poco sobre cada pastel. Amasar\r\nun poco de colorante alimentario en el regal\r\nglaseado para obtener un color rojo brillante. rodar\r\n12 bolitas de diferentes tamaños, mojar un lado o\r\nla parte superior de cada uno con algunas chispas y\r\npega uno en cada pastel."]','2026-01-11 12:54:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12937,8883,'es','Rodajas de zanahoria con coco','Si está buscando un regalo para el té de la tarde o algo para preparar para una venta de pasteles, pruebe esta bandeja horneada con superficie crujiente.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla sin sal","300 g de azúcar mascabado light","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes","200 g de harina con levadura","50 g de coco rallado","200 g de zanahorias ralladas","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","85 g de coco rallado","25 g de azúcar mascabado light","25 g de mantequilla, derretida"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre una bandeja para hornear o una pequeña\r\nfuente para asar, de unos 20 x 30 cm. Calor\r\nhorno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Suavemente\r\nderrita la mantequilla en una cacerola grande,\r\ndejar enfriar durante 5 minutos, agregar el azúcar, la vainilla\r\ny los huevos, luego batir hasta que quede suave con\r\nuna cuchara de madera. Agregue la harina,\r\ncoco y ¼ de cucharadita de sal. Agrega la zanahoria y la mezcla de especias a la mezcla. Hornee por 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle uniformemente 85 g más.\r\ncoco con 25g de moscovado ligero\r\nazúcar y 25 g de mantequilla derretida.\r\nAlise esto sobre el pastel y luego hornee.\r\ndurante 10 minutos más hasta que esté dorado y un\r\nAl insertar una brocheta, ésta sale limpia.\r\nDeje enfriar y luego córtelo en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12938,9450,'es','pastel de chocolate blanco','Sea creativo con aderezos para preparar un regalo para familiares y amigos, o agregue estos pasteles pequeños a su próxima venta de pasteles.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda","300 g de harina con levadura","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","4 huevos","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural","3 cucharadas de leche","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","200 g de chocolate blanco en barra, medio picado","300 g de queso tierno, no frío en la nevera","100 g de azúcar glas tamizada","dulces, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrasar un molde de 20 x 30 cm y forrar con\r\npergamino para hornear. Batir la mantequilla, la harina,\r\nazúcar, levadura en polvo, huevos, yogur, leche\r\ny vainilla hasta que no queden grumos. Agregue el\r\nchocolate picado. Vierta en lata; hornear\r\ndurante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y leudado y\r\nuna brocheta sale limpia. Dejar enfriar en la lata.","Derretir el resto del chocolate. Revuelva el glaseado\r\nazúcar en queso tierno, luego el chocolate\r\nhasta que quede suave. Enfriar, esparcir sobre el bizcocho,\r\nluego cortar en cuadritos y decorar."]','2026-01-11 12:54:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12939,8885,'es','Galletas de frambuesa del Día de la Nariz Roja','Recauda algo de dinero para Comic Relief con estas atrevidas galletas.','["1 cantidad Masa básica para galletas Ver ''Combina bien'' a continuación","1 cucharadita de canela","6 cucharadas de mermelada de frambuesa","6 cucharadas de azúcar glas tamizada","glaseado, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Prepare la masa de galleta básica, tamizando la canela cuando agregue la harina. Forma\r\nen 2 bolas, envuélvalas en film transparente y déjelas enfriar durante 20-30 minutos.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y luego saque 28 galletas con un cortador de 7-8 cm de ancho. Colóquelos en bandejas para hornear antiadherentes. Con un cortador de 4 cm, corta las “narices” de la mitad de las galletas. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté dorado pálido, luego levántelo y colóquelo en una rejilla para enfriar.","Mezclar la mermelada de frambuesa con el azúcar glas tamizada. Cuando las galletas estén frías, vierta un poco de mermelada sobre cada galleta entera y luego coloque con cuidado las otras galletas encima. Sírvelos tal cual, o glaseados en pipa, hechos con un poco de agua, para dibujar muecas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12940,8887,'es','Galletas de mantequilla doble chocolate','Estos dulces causarán un gran revuelo en tu próxima venta de pasteles y prepararlos cuesta solo alrededor de 15 peniques cada uno.','["200 g de mantequilla, en cubos","325 g de harina común y un poco más para enrollar","100 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 yemas de huevo","100 g de chispas de chocolate negro o con leche","200 g de barra de chocolate blanco, derretido","tubo de glaseado de escritura roja"]','["Frote la mantequilla con la harina para hacer\r\nmigajas, luego agregue el azúcar, la vainilla y las yemas.\r\ny chispas de chocolate y juntar\r\npara formar una masa. Estirar ligeramente\r\nsuperficie enharinada y sellar círculos de 6 cm.\r\ngalletas. Vuelva a enrollar los recortes y\r\nrepetir. Organizar en bandejas forradas con papel pergamino.\r\ny enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nHornee las galletas durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén doradas.\r\nFresco. Untar cada uno con chocolate blanco.\r\ny dejar reposar. Decorar o escribir\r\nnombre del comprador con glaseado rojo en el lugar,\r\nsi quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:54:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12941,8889,'es','Cuadritos Melba Melba','Esta bandeja para hornear se puede mezclar en poco tiempo y es fácil de cortar y transportar.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla sin sal","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes","200 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","2 melocotones recién maduros, sin hueso, partidos por la mitad y luego cada mitad cortada en 3","100 g de frambuesas","un puñado de almendras laminadas","1 cucharada de azúcar glas, para terminar"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre una bandeja para hornear o una pequeña\r\nfuente para asar, de unos 20 x 30 cm. Calor\r\nhorno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Suavemente\r\nderrita la mantequilla en una cacerola grande,\r\ndejar enfriar durante 5 minutos, agregar el azúcar, la vainilla\r\ny los huevos, luego batir hasta que quede suave con\r\nuna cuchara de madera. Agregue la harina,\r\nalmendras y ¼ de cucharadita de sal.","Vierta la mezcla en la lata, luego coloque la\r\nrodajas de melocotón uniformemente encima – de esa manera\r\ncada cuadrado de pastel tendrá un bocado de\r\nfruta. Esparcir las frambuesas y las almendras.\r\nterminar, luego hornear durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 10 minutos,\r\ncubriendo con papel de aluminio después de 40 minutos. Prueba con\r\nuna brocheta: el medio debe tener solo un\r\nun pequeño toque de blandura, que reafirmará\r\nuna vez que el pastel se enfríe. Enfriar en la lata\r\ndurante 20 minutos, luego levante y coloque en un recipiente para enfriar.\r\nestante. Una vez frío, rebozar con azúcar glas,\r\nluego córtelo en cuadrados."]','2026-01-11 12:54:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12942,8891,'es','Pastel de falla de caramelo espolvoreado y especiado','Sorprenda a sus invitados con este mágico pastel de celebración. Capas de bizcocho suavemente condimentado están envueltas en una esponjosa crema de mantequilla de vainilla y destellos brillantes: este horneado es algo especial.','["200ml de leche entera","4 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","300ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para las latas","500 g de harina común","4 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","500 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","4 pizcas pequeñas de clavo molido","400 ml de suero de leche (si no consigues suero de leche, utiliza 300 g de yogur griego mezclado con 100 ml de leche)","4 huevos medianos","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","500 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, blanda","1 kilo de azúcar glas","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","chorrito de leche (opcional)","150 g de caramelo enlatado","50 g de chispas (usamos una mezcla de oro, bronce y morado, rojo y turquesa metálico; una mezcla de diferentes colores y formas dará el mejor resultado), más algo extra para la parte superior (opcional)","bolígrafo decorativo de oro comestible o lustre de oro comestible mezclado con unas gotas de alcohol transparente (como vodka)"]','["Ponga la mitad de la leche y la mitad del almíbar dorado en una cacerola y cocine a fuego lento. Revuelva hasta que se combinen, luego retire del fuego y deje enfriar. O calienta la mezcla en una jarra resistente al calor en el microondas durante 1 min. Mientras tanto, engrase dos moldes para pasteles de fondo suelto de 20 cm y cubra las bases con papel para hornear (si los moldes tienen menos de 4 cm de profundidad, cubra también los lados con un anillo alto de papel para hornear). Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Para los bizcochos, necesitarás usar la mitad de los ingredientes para el primer lote de pasteles y luego los ingredientes restantes para otro lote, para hacer cuatro bizcochos en total. Para el primer lote, vierta 250 g de harina, 2 cucharaditas de levadura en polvo, 250 g de azúcar, 1 cucharadita de canela y 2 pizcas de clavo molido en un tazón grande con ¼ de cucharadita de sal fina. Batir y romper los terrones grandes de azúcar para crear una mezcla uniforme y arenosa.","Batir 150 ml de aceite, 200 ml de suero de leche, 2 huevos y 1 cucharadita de vainilla en una jarra grande. Agrega la mezcla de leche y almíbar enfriada y vuelve a batir. Incorpora gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos a los secos hasta que quede suave. Dividir entre las latas. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio de cada bizcocho, éste salga limpio.","Deje que los bizcochos se enfríen en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego inviértalos sobre una rejilla (de modo que las bases se conviertan en la parte superior), retire el pergamino y déjelos enfriar por completo. Limpia, engrasa y forra las latas nuevamente como se describe en el paso 1, y repite los pasos 1 a 3 para hacer dos bizcochos más. Deje que los cuatro bizcochos se enfríen por completo. Una vez enfriados, los bizcochos se pueden envolver y almacenar en un lugar fresco hasta por tres días o congelarse hasta por dos meses.","Para hacer el glaseado de crema de mantequilla, ponga la mantequilla y la mitad del azúcar glas en un bol grande. Triture con una espátula y luego bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave y pálido. Agregue el azúcar restante, la vainilla y la leche para aflojar la mezcla y obtener una consistencia untable, si es necesario. Batir nuevamente hasta que quede suave. Transfiera la mitad de la crema de mantequilla a un segundo tazón y reserve.","Trabajando con el primer tazón de crema de mantequilla, extienda unas cucharadas en el centro de una tabla para pastel o soporte de 20 cm y coloque uno de los bizcochos encima, boca abajo, de modo que la base plana quede arriba. Unte un cuarto de la crema de mantequilla, seguido de un tercio del caramelo. Cubra con otro bizcocho, luego otra capa de crema de mantequilla y caramelo, luego repita el proceso con un tercer bizcocho. Coloque la esponja final encima, boca abajo, para tener una superficie plana. Cubre todo el pastel con una capa muy fina de crema de mantequilla, usando lo que sobra del primer tazón; no te preocupes por dejarlo limpio, ya que las migajas atrapadas en el glaseado quedarán cubiertas con la capa final. Enfríe el pastel durante 30 minutos hasta que el glaseado esté firme.","","","","","",""]','2026-01-11 12:54:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12943,8893,'es','Corona de lucro speculoos','Deshazte del postre comprado en la tienda en Navidad por este impresionante centro de mesa choux. Elaborado con galletas speculoos y cubierto con un delicioso caramelo salado.','["100 g de harina común","85 g de mantequilla sin sal","3 huevos, a temperatura ambiente","4-5 galletas speculoos, desmenuzadas","chispitas doradas, para decorar (opcional)","400ml de nata doble","250 g de galleta para untar speculoos","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","rallado de nuez moscada","130 g de azúcar granulada","20 g de mantequilla sin sal","6 cucharadas de crema doble","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","¼ cucharadita de canela molida","¼ cucharadita de mezcla de especias"]','["Tamiza la harina y ¼ de cucharadita de sal en un bol. Ponga a hervir la mantequilla y 225 ml de agua en una cacerola y cocine a fuego lento hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Vierta la mezcla de harina y bata rápidamente con una cuchara de madera hasta que todo forme una masa suave y brillante que se desprenda de los lados de la sartén. Vierta la masa en un recipiente limpio y extiéndala por los lados con la cuchara para ayudar a que se enfríe un poco rápidamente (no querrás que se enfríe por completo; es más fácil incorporar los huevos mientras aún está un poco caliente). Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Dejar de lado.","Mientras la masa aún esté ligeramente tibia, agregue los huevos uno a la vez, batiendo bien con la cuchara de madera entre cada adición hasta que quede suave (es posible que no necesite usar todos los huevos). Cuando esté lista, la masa debe caer lentamente de la cuchara en forma de V; si la mezcla está demasiado líquida, no podrás colocarla; si está demasiado espeso, no se hinchará en el horno. Coloque la masa en una manga pastelera y corte el extremo para que tenga una abertura de 1 cm.","Sosteniendo la manga pastelera en un ángulo de 90 grados con respecto a la bandeja para hornear, coloque bolas de masa del tamaño de una nuez sobre las dos hojas; debería obtener entre 18 y 20 en total. Sumerja el dedo en un poco de agua y golpee suavemente los picos de la parte superior de las bolas. Hornee durante 30-35 minutos, cambiando las bandejas después de 20 minutos. Los panecillos choux deben quedar hinchados y crujientes cuando estén cocidos. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Para hacer el relleno, bata la nata con la galleta para untar y las especias en un bol grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave.","Para la salsa de caramelo, vierta el azúcar en una cacerola a fuego medio, agregue 6 cucharadas de agua y cocine hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Suba un poco el fuego y cocine a fuego lento, moviendo la sartén de vez en cuando hasta que esté dorado (no revuelva o el azúcar cristalizará). Retire del fuego, agregue la mantequilla y revuelva la sartén hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y se combine con el almíbar. Incorpora rápidamente la nata, la vainilla, la canela, la mezcla de especias y una pizca de sal marina. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Corta cada panecillo choux enfriado por la mitad. Vierta el relleno en una manga pastelera, corte el extremo y póngalo sobre las bases de los bollos. Emparedé estos con la parte superior y luego colóquelos en forma de corona redonda de aproximadamente 27 cm en un plato o tabla grande para servir. Rocíe todo con la salsa de caramelo, luego esparza sobre las galletas desmenuzadas y las chispas doradas, si las usa. Es mejor consumirlo inmediatamente. Se mantendrá frío hasta por 24 horas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12944,8895,'es','Dulce de caramelo salado','Saque su termómetro de azúcar para hacer este dulce de azúcar. Requiere un poco de precisión, pero el resultado es fabuloso, con un delicioso sabor a caramelo salado.','["450 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","400 g de nata doble","50 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de jarabe de glucosa","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla","2 cucharadas de caramelo enlatado","450 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","400 g de nata doble","50 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de jarabe de glucosa","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla","2 cucharadas de caramelo enlatado"]','["Forre un molde para pastel de 20 x 20 cm con papel para hornear. Vierta el azúcar, la nata, la mantequilla y el jarabe de glucosa en una cacerola grande. Calentar a fuego lento para disolver el azúcar y derretir la mantequilla, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Cuando el azúcar se haya disuelto, coloque un termómetro para azúcar en la mezcla, asegurándose de que el extremo esté completamente cubierto por el almíbar; si no es así, transfiera la mezcla a una cacerola más pequeña que aún sea lo suficientemente grande para que el almíbar burbujee. Suba el fuego a medio-alto y hierva el almíbar, revolviendo ocasionalmente para evitar que se pegue. Cuando el termómetro alcance los 116 ° C, o etapa de \"bola blanda\", retire la sartén del fuego.","Deje reposar la mezcla, sin tocar, durante 5 minutos, hasta que la temperatura baje a 110 ° C, luego agregue la pasta de vainilla y una buena pizca de sal.","Retire el termómetro, luego bata vigorosamente la mezcla con una cuchara de madera, verificando la temperatura aproximadamente cada minuto hasta que baje nuevamente a aproximadamente 60 ° C. En ese momento, la mezcla estará muy espesa y habrá perdido su brillo. Saca el termómetro y continúa batiendo la mezcla unos minutos más. Esta parte es crucial ya que ayuda a crear pequeños cristales de azúcar que le dan al dulce de azúcar una textura suave y cremosa.","Vierta rápidamente la mezcla de dulce de azúcar en el molde preparado y alise la superficie con una espátula. Coloque el caramelo por encima y gírelo a través del dulce de azúcar con una brocheta. Espolvorea con 1 cucharadita de sal marina y luego déjalo enfriar durante la noche a temperatura ambiente; no lo guardes en el refrigerador, ya que se volverá pegajoso y no se endurecerá correctamente. Córtelo en 36 trozos pequeños. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético a temperatura ambiente hasta por dos meses.","Forre un molde para pastel de 20 x 20 cm con papel para hornear. Vierta el azúcar, la nata, la mantequilla y el jarabe de glucosa en una cacerola grande. Calentar a fuego lento para disolver el azúcar y derretir la mantequilla, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Cuando el azúcar se haya disuelto, coloque un termómetro para azúcar en la mezcla, asegurándose de que el extremo esté completamente cubierto por el almíbar; si no es así, transfiera la mezcla a una cacerola más pequeña que aún sea lo suficientemente grande para que el almíbar burbujee. Suba el fuego a medio-alto y hierva el almíbar, revolviendo ocasionalmente para evitar que se pegue. Cuando el termómetro alcance los 116 ° C, o etapa de \"bola blanda\", retire la sartén del fuego.","Deje reposar la mezcla, sin tocar, durante 5 minutos, hasta que la temperatura baje a 110 ° C, luego agregue la pasta de vainilla y una buena pizca de sal.","Retire el termómetro, luego bata vigorosamente la mezcla con una cuchara de madera, verificando la temperatura aproximadamente cada minuto hasta que baje nuevamente a aproximadamente 60 ° C. En ese momento, la mezcla estará muy espesa y habrá perdido su brillo. Saca el termómetro y continúa batiendo la mezcla unos minutos más. Esta parte es crucial ya que ayuda a crear pequeños cristales de azúcar que le dan al dulce de azúcar una textura suave y cremosa.","Vierta rápidamente la mezcla de dulce de azúcar en el molde preparado y alise la superficie con una espátula. Coloque el caramelo por encima y gírelo a través del dulce de azúcar con una brocheta. Espolvorea con 1 cucharadita de sal marina y luego déjalo enfriar durante la noche a temperatura ambiente; no lo guardes en el refrigerador, ya que se volverá pegajoso y no se endurecerá correctamente. Córtelo en 36 trozos pequeños. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético a temperatura ambiente hasta por dos meses."]','2026-01-11 12:54:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12945,8897,'es','Terrina de chocolate y caramelo','Prepare esta exquisita terrina de chocolate y caramelo como postre sofisticado para una cena. Espolvoree generosamente con cacao en polvo antes de cortarlo en rodajas.','["aceite de girasol, para la lata","200ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de cacao en polvo, más un poco más para espolvorear","300 g de caramelo de tarro o lata","100 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","200 g de mascarpone","7-8 galletas de caramelo (según el tamaño del molde), cortadas por la mitad a lo largo"]','["Engrase un molde para pan de 900 g y cúbralo con una doble capa de papel de horno. Poner la nata, el cacao, 200 g de caramelo y una pizca de sal en un cazo a fuego medio y llevar a ebullición, batiendo de vez en cuando para combinar. Vierta el chocolate en un recipiente mediano resistente al calor y viértalo sobre la mezcla de crema caliente. Deje reposar durante 1 minuto, luego revuelva todo hasta que el chocolate se derrita y quede suave. Dejar enfriar un poco durante 5-10 minutos.","Batir el mascarpone con la mezcla de chocolate enfriada usando un batidor eléctrico durante 3-4 minutos hasta que quede suave, brillante y el batidor deje un rastro en la mezcla.","Para armar la terrina, presione las mitades superiores de las galletas de caramelo en el fondo del molde, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, recortándolas para que quepan si es necesario.","Batir el caramelo restante con un batidor para que se suelte y luego esparcir la mitad sobre las galletas en el molde. Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de chocolate encima y luego coloque las mitades restantes de la oblea sobre la capa de chocolate. Cubra con el caramelo restante, asegurándose de que todo esté cubierto uniformemente, luego cubra con el resto de la mezcla de chocolate. Cubra la terrina con una tira de papel para hornear y luego congélela durante al menos 6 horas o toda la noche.","Retire la terrina del congelador 10 minutos antes de servir y luego colóquela en un plato frío o en un plato para servir. Espolvoree generosamente con cacao en polvo antes de cortarlo en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:54:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12946,8899,'es','Canutillos de caramelo salado y palomitas de maíz','¡Dale al clásico horneado francés un cambio de imagen moderno! Coloque un delicioso relleno de caramelo salado en panecillos de masa choux ligeros y espolvoréelos con crujientes trozos de palomitas de maíz con caramelo.','["1 cantidad de receta de canutillos y crema pastelera - ver enlace en método","1 lata de 397 g de caramelo de clavel Nestlé","600 g de azúcar glas para fondant","escamas de sal marina","600ml de nata doble","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","100 g de palomitas de caramelo picadas"]','["Prepara los canutillos y la crème pâtissière con nuestra receta clásica.","Mezclar 150 g de caramelo de clavel con el azúcar glas para fondant. Mezcle hasta obtener un glaseado espeso pero lloviznado, agregando un chorrito de agua si está demasiado espeso. Cubrir con film transparente.","Transfiera otros 200 g de caramelo de clavel a una manga pastelera y trace una línea a lo largo de la mitad inferior de los canutillos partidos, luego espolvoree unas cuantas hojuelas de sal marina.","Vierta la nata doble en un bol con el caramelo restante y la pasta de vainilla. Batir con un batidor de mano eléctrico para espesar la crema hasta obtener picos rígidos. Doble la crema pastelera y luego transfiérala a una manga pastelera. Coloque generosas gotas de crema sobre la base y luego espolvoree sobre 50 g de palomitas de maíz con caramelo picado.","Extienda el glaseado con cuidado sobre la parte superior de los canutillos y luego colóquelo encima de la crema. Después de cada cuatro o cinco canutillos, decore la parte superior, mientras el glaseado aún esté húmedo, con 50 g de palomitas de maíz con caramelo picado y una pizca de escamas de sal marina. Para obtener más ayuda, vea nuestro vídeo sobre cómo hacer masa choux y canutillos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12947,8901,'es','Alitas de pollo asiáticas con caramelo','El uso de caramelo oscuro en platos salados es común en la cocina asiática: agrega profundidad de sabor y contrasta bien con notas ácidas y picantes.','["100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 cucharadas de salsa de pescado sin gluten","1 chile verde, cortado a la mitad (opcional)","trozo pequeño de corteza de canela","jengibre en trozos pequeños, finamente picado","jugo de 1 lima grande, más extra para exprimir","1 kg de ala de pollo, sin puntas y cortada por la mitad","manojo pequeño de cebolleta, cortada en trozos de 1 cm","jengibre en trozos grandes, cortado en palitos","1 chile verde (quita las semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante), cortado en aros","un puñado de ramitas de cilantro","arroz blanco hervido, para servir"]','["Pon el azúcar en una sartén mediana con suficiente agua para que quede espesa. Coloque a fuego lento y deje hervir, luego cocine hasta obtener un caramelo de color ámbar oscuro (consulte el consejo a continuación).","Con los brazos extendidos, agregue los demás ingredientes, excepto el pollo y la guarnición, y cocine a fuego lento; tenga cuidado porque escupirá. Una vez que se haya calmado un poco y tengas una salsa espesa, agrega las alitas hasta que estén bien cubiertas. Vierta 100 ml de agua y cocine a fuego medio durante unos 30 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando hasta que la salsa tenga una consistencia más espesa; agregue un poco más de agua si es necesario.","Baje el fuego y continúe cocinando tapado durante 15 minutos más, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que las alitas estén lacadas y tiernas y la salsa muy espesa. Apague el fuego y revuelva rápidamente con la mitad de la cebolleta, el jengibre y la guindilla. Coloca las alitas y la salsa en un plato. Espolvoree con la guarnición restante y el cilantro y sirva con más lima y arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:54:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12948,8903,'es','Smores de caramelo salado y mantequilla de maní','¿Qué es más delicioso que un clásico malvavisco americano y galletas saladas? Nuestra versión de postre de lujo con toffee, chocolate, nueces y galletas tipo gofre','["16 galletas tipo gofre","8 tazas de mantequilla de maní","8 cucharaditas de caramelo (nosotros usamos clavel)","hojuelas de sal marina, para espolvorear"]','["Precalienta la parrilla a fuego alto y cubre una bandeja para hornear con pergamino. Coloque 8 galletas tipo gofre en la bandeja con una taza de mantequilla de maní en cada una y cocine a la parrilla hasta que comience a derretirse.","Pon una cucharadita de caramelo sobre los otros 8 gofres y espolvorea unas escamas de sal sobre cada uno.","Coloca los waffles en un sándwich y disfrútalos con un capuchino."]','2026-01-11 12:54:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12949,8905,'es','Tortitas de calabaza con caramelo de nueces y nueces saladas','El puré de calabaza es un complemento delicioso para una pila de panqueques grasos y esponjosos: el brunch perfecto para empezar el fin de semana con un dulce comienzo.','["250 g de calabazas o calabacines, pelados, sin semillas y cortados en trozos grandes","2 huevos","3 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","25 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco para cocinar","125 ml de suero de leche (o utilizar la misma cantidad de leche, con un chorrito de zumo de limón)","200 g de harina común","2½ cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de canela molida","un chorrito de aceite sin sabor, como el de girasol o de maní, para freír","helado, para servir, o yogur o crème fraîche","50 g de nueces pecanas, picadas en trozos grandes","50 g de mantequilla","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas","100ml de nata doble"]','["Coloque la calabaza en un recipiente grande resistente al calor, agregue 1 cucharada de agua, cubra con film transparente y cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 5 a 8 minutos o hasta que esté muy suave; los diferentes tipos tomarán una cantidad de tiempo variable. Escurrir bien la calabaza y dejar enfriar por completo. Si quieres desayunar los panqueques, es mejor realizar este paso la noche anterior.","Una vez fría, poner la calabaza en un procesador de alimentos con el resto de los ingredientes de las tortitas y añadir una buena pizca de sal. Licue hasta que todo esté bien combinado hasta obtener una masa suave y espesa (como alternativa, triture bien la calabaza y luego agregue los ingredientes restantes). Transfiera a una jarra o manga pastelera y reserve mientras prepara la salsa de caramelo.","Tuesta las nueces en una cacerola durante 1-2 minutos hasta que estén un poco más oscuras. Saque y reserve. Agrega la mantequilla, el azúcar, la sal y la nata a la sartén. Deje hervir a fuego lento, luego burbujee suavemente durante unos minutos hasta obtener una salsa brillante. Agregue las nueces y deje enfriar un poco.","Calentar una nuez de mantequilla y un chorrito de aceite en una sartén grande. Caliente el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1, para mantener los panqueques calientes mientras los cocina en tandas; tenga una bandeja para hornear a mano. Cuando la mantequilla esté espumosa, gírela alrededor de la sartén, luego vierta cantidades de masa del tamaño de una pelota de tenis en la sartén (consulte el consejo a continuación); se esparcirán un poco a medida que se cocinan, así que deje algo de espacio entre cada panqueque y no abarrote la sartén. Cocine a fuego medio-bajo. No toques los panqueques hasta que veas que aparecen algunas burbujas en la superficie; mira debajo y, si los panqueques están dorados, dales la vuelta y cocina durante 2 minutos más por el otro lado. Transfiera los panqueques cocidos a la bandeja para hornear y manténgalos calientes en el horno mientras continúa cocinando.","Una vez cocidos, apile los panqueques en platos, cubra con helado, yogur o crème fraîche y vierta sobre la salsa de caramelo de nuez salada."]','2026-01-11 12:54:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12950,8907,'es','Caramelos salados de Cheat','Estos dulces tramposos son una gran adición a una fiesta o a una cesta de regalo. Utilice caramelos de chocolate y cubra con oro comestible.','["caramelos cubiertos de chocolate (nosotros usamos Rolos)","brillo dorado comestible (compramos el nuestro en Waitrose)","escamas de sal marina"]','["Desenvuelva los caramelos cubiertos de chocolate y use un pincel pequeño para espolvorear el exterior con brillo dorado. Agregue unas cuantas hojuelas de sal marina encima de cada una, luego colóquelas en un plato para servir (apilarlas en una torre las hace lucir muy especiales). Enfríe durante al menos 1 hora antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12951,8909,'es','Bollos choux crumble de caramelo salado y palomitas de maíz','Edd Kimber le da un nuevo giro a la clásica masa choux francesa con estos panecillos de caramelo salado rellenos de crema de palomitas de maíz y terminados con una cubierta de craquelín crujiente','["125 g de palomitas de caramelo (para rellenar los bollos)","azúcar glas, para servir","pan de oro comestible, para decorar (opcional)","50 g de harina común","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","40 g de mantequilla sin sal, fría y picada en trozos pequeños","150 g de azúcar granulada","125ml de nata doble","10 g de mantequilla sin sal","una pizca grande de sal marina en escamas","600 ml de nata doble y un poco más para completar","125 g de palomitas de caramelo","una pizca grande de sal marina en escamas","60 g de mantequilla sin sal, picada en cubos pequeños","¼ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","85 g de harina común","2-3 huevos grandes"]','["Para la cobertura crumble, mezcle la harina y el azúcar en un tazón mediano. Agrega la mantequilla y frota hasta tener una textura de pan rallado. Con las manos, presione esta mezcla para formar una masa uniforme. Colóquelo entre 2 hojas de papel para hornear y extiéndalo hasta que tenga unos milímetros de espesor. Mételo en el congelador en una bandeja para hornear hasta que lo necesites.","Para el caramelo salado, poner el azúcar en una cacerola mediana y poner a fuego medio. Deje que el azúcar se derrita y se caramelice, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Una vez que el azúcar tenga un color caramelo cobrizo oscuro, agregue la mitad de la nata doble. Cuando el burbujeo haya disminuido, agregue la crema restante, la mantequilla y la sal y revuelva para combinar. Si quedan grumos, vuelva a poner al fuego y revuelva hasta que se derrita y quede suave. Retirar del fuego, verter en un tazón pequeño, cubrir con film transparente y enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Para la crema de palomitas de maíz, poner todos los ingredientes en una cacerola mediana a fuego medio-alto y llevar a ebullición. Retirar del fuego, tapar la cacerola y dejar infusionar durante 1 hora. Cuele la crema a través de un colador en una jarra medidora, presionando las palomitas de maíz blandas para sacar la mayor cantidad de crema posible. Completa la crema hasta que te queden 600 ml. Presione un trozo de film transparente sobre la superficie de la crema y enfríe hasta que sea necesario. Se puede preparar el día anterior hasta este punto.","Para la masa choux, caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Usando un cortador de galletas de 5 cm como guía, dibuja 5 círculos en cada trozo de papel para hornear y dales la vuelta. Ponga 140 ml de agua, la mantequilla, ¼ de cucharadita de sal y el azúcar en una cacerola mediana y, a fuego medio-alto, lleve la mezcla a ebullición. Una vez que hierva y la mantequilla se haya derretido, retirar del fuego, verter la harina e inmediatamente mezclar con una cuchara de madera hasta que se forme una pasta suave. Regresar al fuego y batir durante 1-2 minutos para que se seque un poco. Vierta la pasta en un tazón grande y bata durante unos minutos para que se enfríe un poco.","Agregue los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo hasta que estén completamente combinados antes de agregar otro; agregue el último huevo poco a poco, ya que es posible que no lo necesite todo. Deténgase cuando el choux suave caiga de la cuchara en forma de V. Coloque la masa en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla redonda grande, luego coloque rondas de masa en las bandejas para hornear preparadas, usando los círculos como plantillas. Retire la cobertura crumble del congelador y retire la capa superior de pergamino. Con un cortador de galletas de 5 cm, corte 10 discos de cobertura crumble y coloque uno encima de cada ronda de masa. Hornee durante 40 minutos o hasta que los choux hayan subido bien y el crumble esté dorado. Apague el horno pero deje los choux adentro hasta que se enfríen por completo.","Para armar los panecillos, use un cuchillo de sierra grande para cortarlos con cuidado por la mitad. Coloca unos cuantos trozos de palomitas de maíz en la base de cada panecillo y vierte también un poco de caramelo (si has preparado el caramelo con antelación, se habrá endurecido, así que colócalo sobre un recipiente con agua hirviendo para que se suelte). Para el relleno, retire la crema del refrigerador y bata hasta obtener picos suaves, luego colóquela en una manga pastelera provista de una punta de estrella grande y forme un remolino en la base de cada bollo. Para terminar, volver a colocar la parte superior de los bollos choux encima de la nata y espolvorear ligeramente con azúcar glas. Terminé el mío con un trozo de pan de oro comestible."]','2026-01-11 12:54:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12952,8911,'es','Chirivías con caramelo salado','No reserve el caramelo salado para los postres: también combina perfectamente con tubérculos asados ​​y terrosos.','["1 kg de chirivías peladas","3 cucharadas de aceite de colza","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","trozo grande de mantequilla","1 cucharadita de sal marina"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cortar las chirivías por la mitad y luego cortar el extremo más grueso en dos a lo largo. Hervir durante 5 minutos, luego escurrir bien y dejar secar al vapor unos minutos. Mientras tanto, vierte el aceite en una fuente para asar poco profunda o en una bandeja para hornear con borde y caliéntalo en el horno durante 3 minutos.","Retirar el molde del horno y añadir con cuidado las chirivías al aceite caliente. Gírelos para cubrirlos y asegúrese de que no estén abarrotados (de lo contrario, no quedarán crujientes). Ase durante 30-35 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y crujientes, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad del tiempo de cocción.","Unos 10 minutos antes de que las chirivías estén listas, vierta el azúcar y 2 cucharadas de agua en una sartén pequeña. Calentar muy suavemente hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Sube el fuego y lleva el líquido a ebullición. Mida 3½ cucharadas de agua fría en una jarra. Continúe moviendo la sartén hasta que el azúcar alcance un rico color caramelo rojizo oscuro, luego retírela del fuego. Retroceda y agregue el agua (¡chisporroteará!). Vuelva al fuego, agregue la mantequilla y la sal y revuelva para quitar los grumos. El caramelo debe estar líquido, así que agrega un chorrito más de agua si es necesario. Apila las chirivías en una fuente para servir y luego rocíalas con el caramelo salado."]','2026-01-11 12:54:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12953,8913,'es','Pastel de capas de caramelo completamente loco','La cobertura de caramelo y nuez le da un toque especial a este bizcocho: utilizamos nueces de Brasil, avellanas, nueces pecanas y almendras.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla salada, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","175 g de nueces mixtas, nosotros usamos nueces de Brasil, avellanas, nueces y almendras, picadas en trozos grandes","250 g de azúcar moreno claro blando","3 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","4 huevos grandes","140 g de harina con levadura","75 g de almendras molidas","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","3 cucharadas de leche","200ml de nata doble","5 cucharadas de caramelo, de lata (nosotros usamos Clavel)"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forre 2 moldes para pastel de sándwich Victoria de fondo suelto de 2 x 20 cm con papel para hornear, luego engrase uno de los moldes sobre la parte superior del pergamino (esto ayudará a evitar que la cobertura de caramelo y nueces se pegue cuando lo desmolde).\r\nColoca las nueces en una sartén y tuéstalas a fuego medio hasta que estén doradas. Añadimos 50g de mantequilla, 50g de azúcar, el almíbar dorado y una buena pizca de sal. Revuelva hasta que la mantequilla se derrita, luego burbujee durante 2 minutos hasta que la salsa de mantequilla esté dorada; no deje que burbujee por mucho tiempo o la cobertura se endurecerá una vez que se haya enfriado. Vierta en el molde para pastel con el pergamino engrasado y alise. Deja enfriar mientras haces el bizcocho.","Vierta el resto de la mantequilla y el azúcar en un tazón grande y bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, mezclando bien entre cada adición. Agregue la harina, las almendras, el polvo para hornear, 1?2 cucharadita de sal, el extracto de almendras y la leche, y mezcle nuevamente hasta que estén combinados. Divida la mezcla del pastel entre los moldes y alise la superficie. Hornea por 25 minutos o hasta que al pinchar con una brocheta este salga limpio. Deje enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego voltee sobre una rejilla y retire el pergamino. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Batir la nata y 2 cucharadas de caramelo hasta que estén suaves y manteniendo su forma. Para armar el pastel, coloque el pastel simple en un plato o soporte. Cubra con la crema batida, girándola hacia los bordes. Rocíe sobre el caramelo restante (primero mezcle bien para aflojarlo), dejando que gotee por los lados. Cubra con el bizcocho restante, con la nuez hacia arriba. Sirva dentro de 1 día o guárdelo en el refrigerador durante 3 días, retirándolo del refrigerador 10 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12954,8915,'es','Tartaletas de crema brulée','Combinamos un postre francés clásico suave y cremoso con una masa crujiente y dorada en estos deliciosos pudines de caramelo.','["175 g de harina común","100 g de mantequilla fría, en cubos","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","ralladura de ½ naranja","1 yema de huevo batida con 2 cucharadas de agua fría","Crema doble de cartón de 300 ml.","1 vaina de vainilla, cortada por la mitad a lo largo","3 yemas de huevo y 1 huevo entero","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","aceite de girasol, para engrasar","85 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Pon la harina, una pizca de sal y la mantequilla en un procesador de alimentos y pulsa hasta que parezca migajas finas. Agrega el azúcar y la ralladura de naranja y vuelve a pulsar brevemente. Vierta 2 cucharadas de la mezcla de huevo y presione hasta que la masa se una, agregando más líquido si es necesario.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y úsela para forrar cuatro moldes para tartaletas estriados (8 x 3 cm). Coloque las latas\r\nen una bandeja y dejar enfriar durante 30 min. Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Cubra cada funda de hojaldre con papel para hornear y rellénela con frijoles para hornear. Hornee durante 10-15 minutos, hasta que los lados estén listos. Retire el pergamino y los frijoles y cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos. Dejar enfriar. En esta etapa, se puede preparar con hasta 1 día de anticipación y almacenar en un recipiente hermético. Bajar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2.","Vierta la crema en una cacerola de base pesada, raspe las semillas de la vaina de vainilla y luego agregue las 2 mitades.\r\nde la vaina. Caliente hasta que comiencen a formarse pequeñas burbujas alrededor de los lados de la sartén, luego déjelo en infusión durante 5 minutos. Retire la vaina. En un bol batir las yemas, el huevo entero y el azúcar. Sigue revolviendo, luego vierte la crema y mezcla hasta que se combinen. Colar a través de un colador en una jarra. Vierta la crema pastelera en las bases de la tarta, luego hornee durante 18 a 22 minutos hasta que casi cuaje (deben estar bastante tambaleantes en el centro, pero se endurecerán al enfriarse). Deje enfriar por completo y luego enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, prepara la cobertura de caramelo. Engrase una bandeja para hornear de metal con reborde\r\nun poco de aceite. Vierta el azúcar en polvo en una sartén con 3 cucharadas de agua y caliente suavemente hasta que el azúcar comience a derretirse. No caigas en la tentación de revolver el azúcar, ya que esto puede hacer que el caramelo cristalice. Sin embargo, puedes inclinar la sartén para moverla. Una vez que el azúcar esté casi derretido, suba el fuego y haga burbujear el caramelo hasta obtener un color marrón dorado intenso. Vierta rápidamente sobre la bandeja engrasada y déjela enfriar por completo. Una vez frío, voltea la bandeja y golpea para soltar el caramelo. Rómpelo en pedazos y luego mézclalo en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener cristales finos.","Calienta la parrilla. Esparza una capa gruesa de cristales de caramelo sobre la superficie de cada tarta y coloque un collar de papel de aluminio alrededor del borde superior de la masa. Colóquelo debajo de la parrilla, no demasiado cerca de la fuente de calor, y deje que el caramelo se derrita; observe con atención ya que se quemará fácilmente. Deje enfriar y luego enfríe durante 30 minutos o hasta que esté listo para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:54:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12955,8917,'es','Tatin de chalote','Esta versión de un postre clásico de manzana le da un toque estrella a las chalotas que a menudo se pasan por alto y es un plato principal vegetariano impresionante.','["450 g de chalotes","3 cucharadas de azúcar demerara","50 g de mantequilla","1 cucharadita de hoja de tomillo fresco","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico o un poco de pimienta negra molida","harina común, para espolvorear","Paquete de 500 g de hojaldre"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta agua hirviendo sobre las chalotas y déjelas hasta que el agua se enfríe. (Esto hace que sea más fácil quitarles la piel). Pele y corte las chalotas por la mitad, luego reserve. Pon el azúcar en una sartén refractaria de 23cm y calienta hasta que se disuelva y tengas un caramelo pegajoso. Añade la mantequilla, el tomillo y un chorrito de vinagre balsámico o pimienta negra molida (cuidado que escupe).","Retire la sartén del fuego y ponga todas las chalotas en la sartén, con el lado cortado hacia abajo. Sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, extienda la masa y corte un círculo 2 cm más grande que el molde. Coloque la masa sobre las chalotas y meta los bordes para que \"abrace\" las chalotas. Coloca el molde en el horno y cocina durante 25-30 minutos hasta que la masa esté inflada y dorada. Dejar reposar 1 min y luego invertir la tarta en un plato. Sirva con una ensalada picante de rúcula y queso de cabra."]','2026-01-11 12:54:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12956,8919,'es','Flaps de arándanos, semillas de calabaza y caramelo','La mantequilla salada equilibra la dulzura del caramelo y los frutos secos en esta deliciosa bandeja horneada hecha con copos de avena.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla salada","6 cucharadas de caramelo, de una lata de 397 g de caramelo Carnation (use el resto para cubrir, ver más abajo)","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","350 g de copos de avena","85 g de harina con levadura","caramelo restante","50 g de mantequilla salada","25 g de semillas de calabaza","50 g de arándanos secos","25 g de chispas de chocolate amargo"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3\r\ny forrar un molde para pastel cuadrado de 22 cm con\r\npergamino para hornear. Derretir la mantequilla,\r\ncaramelo y azúcar en una cacerola grande,\r\nluego agregue la avena y la harina. Revuelva bien\r\nasegurándose de que cada avena esté cubierta\r\nla mezcla mantecosa, luego vierta en su\r\nmolde para pastel y presione firmemente con la\r\ndorso de una cuchara para nivelar la superficie.\r\nHornee por 40 minutos.","Vierta el resto del caramelo y la mantequilla.\r\nen una cacerola pequeña y burbujee durante\r\n5 minutos, revolviendo continuamente, hasta que\r\nla mezcla adquiere un color marrón dorado oscuro y\r\nespesa un poco. Cuando los flapjacks tienen\r\nterminada la cocción, retírelas del\r\nHorno y verter sobre el caramelo caliente.\r\nDejar enfriar durante 5 minutos y luego esparcir.\r\ncon las semillas, los arándanos y\r\nchispas de chocolate. Dejar enfriar por completo\r\nen la lata antes de cortar en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:54:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12957,8922,'es','Masa de chocolate, caramelo salado y plátano','Cambie las bayas de un plato de Eton por plátano y convierta el tradicional postre de crema en una delicia tipo banoffee.','["½ vaina de vainilla, sin semillas","150ml de nata doble","2 nidos de merengue ya preparados, desmenuzados en trozos","2 plátanos, en rodajas","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","3 cucharadas de crema doble","1 cucharada de mantequilla","una pizca de escamas de sal marina","2 cucharadas de leche entera","1 cucharada de crema doble","50 g de chocolate negro, partido en trozos pequeños"]','["Para hacer el caramelo salado, poner el\r\nazúcar y 2 cucharadas de agua en un vaso pequeño\r\ncacerola de fondo grueso. Colocar en un\r\nfuego lento y revuelva suavemente hasta que el azúcar\r\nse ha derretido. Sube el fuego y deja que\r\nburbuja de azúcar y caramelizar hasta obtener una nuez\r\nmarrón. Retirar del fuego y verter el\r\ncrema, mantequilla y sal en escamas – haz esto\r\ncon cuidado, ya que podría escupir. Revuelva suavemente\r\njuntos hasta que quede suave y brillante.","Para la salsa de chocolate, trae el\r\nleche y nata a hervir en un cazo pequeño\r\ncacerola. Coloque los trocitos de chocolate en un\r\ncuenco. Vierta más de dos tercios de la leche.\r\ny mezcla de crema, revolviendo hasta que se derrita\r\ny suave. Ajustar la consistencia con\r\nel resto de la mezcla de leche caliente.","Pon las semillas de vainilla en la nata.\r\ny bata hasta que tenga picos suaves.\r\nDoblar los merengues y las rodajas de plátano.\r\nen la nata, dejando unas rodajas\r\npara decorar. Poner en platos para servir y\r\nrocíe con las dos salsas. arriba\r\ncon las rodajas de plátano restantes.\r\nServir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:55:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12958,8924,'es','Budines de manzana con jengibre y caramelo','Ingredientes esencialmente británicos componen los reconfortantes pudines de Frances Auger, que impresionaron a los jueces del Britain''s Best Pud','["50 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para los moldes","1 manzana grande para cocinar, pelada, sin corazón y finamente picada","75 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","140 g de mantequilla, blanda","100 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","1 huevo","125 ml de suero de leche","2 bolas de jengibre en conserva, finamente picadas, más 1 cucharada de almíbar del frasco","100 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1½ cucharada de jengibre molido","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","crema o natillas, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nUn poco de mantequilla y harina de 6 x 8 cm de profundidad.\r\nmoldes, sacando el exceso de harina. Calor\r\nla mantequilla en una cacerola hasta que esté espumosa, agregar la\r\nmanzana y cocinar durante 1 min a fuego medio.\r\ncalor. Agregue el azúcar y cocine hasta que\r\ndisuelto. Dividir entre los moldes.","Para los budines, batir la mantequilla.\r\ny azúcar junto con una batidora eléctrica.\r\nbata hasta que esté completamente combinado. en un separado\r\ntazón, mezcle el huevo, el suero de leche,\r\njengibre picado y almíbar de jengibre, luego\r\nrevuelve esto con la mezcla de mantequilla. doblar\r\nen harina, jengibre molido, para hornear\r\npolvo, bicarbonato de sodio y una pizca\r\nde sal. Dividir entre los moldes\r\npor lo que se llenan hasta 1 cm por debajo de la parte superior.\r\nColócalos en una bandeja para horno y hornea.\r\ndurante 20 minutos, hasta que esté dorado y levado.","Sirva caliente, espolvoreado con azúcar glas.\r\nAcompaña con crema o natillas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12959,8926,'es','Tarta de manzana caramelizada con cobertura de streusel','Este pastel húmedo con una cobertura crujiente de nueces seguramente se convertirá en uno de los favoritos a la hora del té.','["100 g de mantequilla, más 1 cucharada","175 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro, más 1 cucharada","2 manzanas de postre, peladas y cortadas en trozos de 1½ cm","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de canela molida","100ml de leche","25 g de harina","85 g de azúcar demerara, más 1 cucharada","½ cucharadita de canela molida","50 g de mantequilla fría","3 cucharadas de avellanas tostadas y picadas"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de mantequilla y 1 cucharada de azúcar en un\r\nsartén grande a fuego medio hasta que\r\nel azúcar comienza a derretirse. Agregue las manzanas, luego cocine.\r\ndurante unos 5 minutos, hasta que esté bien dorado y\r\nla salsa es un rico caramelo. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras las manzanas se enfrían, prepara la cobertura.\r\nEn un procesador de alimentos o usando las puntas de\r\ncon los dedos, frote la harina, 85 g de azúcar,\r\ncanela y mantequilla fría hasta que la mezcla\r\nes desmenuzable y sólo hay trozos del tamaño de un guisante.\r\nQueda la mantequilla. Agrega 2 cucharadas de avellanas.\r\nReservar en un lugar fresco.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nPara hacer el bizcocho, coloque el resto\r\nmantequilla y azúcar en un bol o batidora\r\ny batir hasta que esté suave y cremoso. Añade el\r\nhuevos uno a la vez, seguidos por el\r\nextracto de vainilla. Agrega la harina, hornea.\r\npolvo, canela y leche en dos\r\nva, alternando entre seco y húmedo\r\ningredientes. Cuando la mezcla esté bien\r\ncombinado, revuelva las manzanas.","Engrasar un molde para bizcocho de 20 cm con removible\r\nbase y forre la base con un círculo de\r\npapel para hornear. Vierta la mezcla de pastel,\r\nalise la parte superior con una cuchara, luego\r\nespolvorea sobre la cobertura de streusel. dispersión\r\ncon la 1 cucharada restante de demerara\r\nazúcar y avellanas. cocinar en el horno\r\ndurante 50 minutos a 1 hora o hasta que se inserte una brocheta\r\nAl introducirlo en el bizcocho, éste sale limpio. dejar para\r\ndejar enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego desmoldar\r\nsobre una rejilla para hornear, retire el papel y enfríe."]','2026-01-11 12:55:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12960,8928,'es','Tarta de queso con caramelo','Sabor a melaza proveniente de azúcares moscovado y una cobertura de dulce de azúcar en rodajas finas... este pudín preparado con anticipación es puro placer','["50 g de mantequilla sin sal","140 g de galletas digestivas naturales","4 hojas de gelatina (yo usé Supercook), cortadas en tiras anchas (o 1 sobre de 11 g, ver Saber hacer, más abajo)","400 g de crema fresca","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","50 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","400 g de ricota","50 g de dulce de azúcar, finamente cortado","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Derrita suavemente la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña.\r\na fuego lento. Coloque los digestivos en\r\nuna bolsa de plástico y triturar hasta obtener migajas finas\r\nusando un rodillo; también puedes hacer esto en\r\nun procesador de alimentos. Inclínelos en la sartén\r\ncon la mantequilla derretida, revuelva para cubrir, luego\r\ntransferir a un molde desmontable para pasteles de 20 cm\r\n(9 cm de profundidad). Usando el dorso de una cuchara,\r\npresiónelos en la base, asegurándose de\r\nsellas los bordes. Colocar en la nevera\r\nmientras preparas la siguiente etapa.","Si usa gelatina en hojas, colóquela en un bol,\r\ncubrir con agua fría, remojar durante 5 minutos,\r\nluego escurrir. Vierta 3 cucharadas de agua hirviendo sobre\r\nla gelatina remojada y revuelva para que se disuelva.\r\nSi utiliza un sobre, consulte Conocimientos técnicos a continuación.","Coloque la crème fraîche en una cacerola pequeña.\r\ncon el azúcar moscovado y una pizca\r\nde sal marina, luego calentar suavemente, revolviendo\r\nconstantemente con una cuchara de madera hasta\r\nla mezcla se licua y el azúcar tiene\r\ndisuelto. Batir rápidamente la mezcla.\r\npara deshacerse de los grumos. debe estar tibio,\r\naproximadamente la misma temperatura que la\r\nsolución de gelatina. Revuelva la gelatina y\r\nextracto de vainilla en la crème fraîche\r\nmezcla, transfiérala a un bol y enfríe.","Coloca la ricota en un procesador de alimentos.\r\ny bata hasta que quede suave, luego agregue el\r\nmezcla de crème fraîche y batir nuevamente.\r\nVierta esto encima de la base de tarta de queso.\r\nCubrir con film transparente y enfriar durante la noche.","Pasa un cuchillo por los lados de la lata,\r\nluego deshaga el clip y retírelo. Transferir\r\na un plato o dejar la tarta de queso en el\r\nbase para facilitar el servicio. Apila el dulce de azúcar\r\nhojuelas en el centro y espolvorear con glaseado\r\nazúcar. Cubra y enfríe hasta que sea necesario."]','2026-01-11 12:55:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12961,8930,'es','Tatins de plátano y caramelo salado con helado de crème fraîche','La combinación del moderno caramelo salado con un clásico francés crea un elegante pudín individual que podría adornar el menú de cualquier restaurante elegante.','["1 vaina de vainilla","200ml de nata doble","100ml de leche","3 yemas de huevo","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","300 ml de crema fresca entera","250 g de hojaldre","harina común, para espolvorear","1 plátano, pelado","50 g de azúcar moreno claro y suave","50 g de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de crema doble"]','["Para hacer el helado, parte la vainilla.\r\nvaina por la mitad a lo largo y raspe\r\nlas semillas. Coloque la vaina y las semillas en un\r\ncazo con la nata y la leche, y\r\nllevar lentamente a ebullición. Mientras tanto, en\r\nEn un bol batir las yemas y el azúcar.\r\njuntos hasta que estén pálidos. Vierta la nata caliente\r\nmezcla sobre el huevo y el azúcar, batiendo\r\ncontinuamente. Vierta nuevamente en la sartén, cuaje\r\na fuego suave y remover con una varilla de madera.\r\ncuchara. Calentar suavemente hasta que la natilla\r\nla mezcla se espesa lo suficiente como para cubrir la parte posterior\r\nde la cuchara, luego retirar del fuego.","Vierta la crème fraîche en un bol y\r\nbata para aflojar. Vierta lentamente el agua caliente\r\nmezcla de natillas, batiendo a medida que avanzas. verter\r\nla mezcla en una máquina para hacer helados\r\ny batir hasta que esté suave y congelado. Transferir a\r\nen un recipiente, luego congélelo durante 2 horas para que se endurezca.","Para hacer los tatins, extender la masa.\r\nsobre una superficie enharinada hasta alcanzar el espesor de una\r\nMoneda de £1. Usando el plátano como guía, corte\r\nSaque 2 tapas de masa lo suficientemente grandes como para caber sobre el\r\nplátano, dejando un borde de 1 cm alrededor del\r\nborde. Coloca la masa en una bandeja para horno.\r\ny meter en la nevera.","Coloque un recipiente de fondo grueso y resistente al horno.\r\nsartén a fuego medio. Añade el\r\nazúcar, mantequilla y nata y cocinar durante\r\n5 minutos hasta que el azúcar se derrita y\r\nel caramelo está burbujeando. Agrega ½ cucharadita de mar\r\nescamas de sal. Cortar el plátano por la mitad\r\na lo largo y colocar las 2 mitades,\r\ncon el lado cortado hacia abajo, en el caramelo.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nColoque una tapa de hojaldre encima de cada plátano.\r\nmitad, metiendo cada uno firmemente alrededor de la\r\nbordes. Esto se puede hacer con 1 hora de antelación.\r\nTransfiera la sartén al horno y cocine.\r\ndurante 20 minutos hasta que la masa suba y\r\ndorado. Rápida y cuidadosamente apague el\r\nTatins, espolvorear con unos copos de mar\r\nsal y servir con bolas de crema\r\nhelado fresco."]','2026-01-11 12:55:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12962,8932,'es','Tarta de chocolate, avellanas y caramelo salado','Una masa de hojaldre mantecosa con una capa de caramelo y solo un toque de sal, salpicada de nueces y terminada con un relleno de dulce de azúcar.','["50 g de avellanas blanqueadas","200 g de harina común","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","140 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubitos","1 yema de huevo","harina, para espolvorear","75 g de azúcar en polvo","25 g de mantequilla","100ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","una pizca grande de escamas de sal marina","50 g de avellanas blanqueadas, tostadas y picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de chocolate negro (70%)","75 g de mantequilla","2 huevos grandes, más 1 yema","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de cacao"]','["Para hacer la masa, batir\r\navellanas en un procesador de alimentos hasta que estén finamente\r\nsuelo. Añadimos la harina, el azúcar glas y\r\nmantequilla y pulsa hasta que la mezcla\r\nse parece al pan rallado. agrega el huevo\r\nyema y 1-2 cucharadas de agua fría y pulso\r\nhasta que la masa se una. Inclina el\r\nSaque la masa y aplánela formando un disco, luego\r\nenvolver en film transparente y enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nSobre una superficie enharinada, extiende la masa.\r\npara forrar un fondo suelto de 23 cm de profundidad\r\nlata de tarta. Recorta los bordes y pincha el\r\nbase con un tenedor, luego cubra con masa para hornear\r\npergamino y rellénelo con frijoles para hornear.\r\nHornee durante 20 minutos y luego retírelo con cuidado.\r\nlos frijoles para hornear y el pergamino y\r\nHornee durante 5-10 minutos más hasta que esté suave.\r\ndorado. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, hacer el caramelo salado.\r\nVierta el azúcar en una cacerola pequeña, agregue\r\n1-2 cucharadas de agua y calentar suavemente para que se disuelva\r\nel azúcar. Aumentar el fuego y cocinar.\r\nhasta que el azúcar adquiera un color ámbar\r\ncaramelo. Reducir el fuego y\r\nagregar la mantequilla, la nata y el almíbar dorado,\r\ny revuelva hasta que la salsa esté suave y\r\nengrosado. Retirar del fuego y\r\nagrega la sal. Dejar enfriar unos minutos,\r\nluego esparcir sobre la base de la tarta. dispersión\r\ncon las avellanas picadas y reservar.","Para el relleno de chocolate, derretir el\r\nchocolate y mantequilla en un recipiente resistente al calor\r\ncolóquelo sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Revuelva\r\nhasta que quede suave, luego retirar del fuego\r\ny dejar enfriar un poco. en un separado\r\nbol, batir los huevos, la yema y las ruedas\r\nazúcar durante unos 6 minutos hasta que espese y\r\npálido. Incorporar el chocolate derretido y\r\ncacao, luego verter en la tarta.\r\nTransfiera a una bandeja para hornear y cocine por\r\n20-25 minutos o hasta que cuaje y la parte superior\r\nformó una costra. Dejar enfriar a la habitación.\r\ntemperatura antes de servir en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12963,8934,'es','Rebanada del multimillonario de caramelo salado y mantequilla de maní','Esta popular galleta horneada se coloca en una liga completamente nueva con la adición de una capa adicional de indulgencia y un aderezo de caramelo salado.','["225 g de mantequilla picada en cubos, más un poco para engrasar","140 g de maní sin sal, tostado y enfriado","225 g de harina común","50 g de harina de maíz","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de mantequilla","225 g de mantequilla de maní suave","140 g de azúcar glas","2 latas de caramelo de clavel de 397 g","1½ cucharadita de sal marina en escamas o ½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","3 barras de 100 g de chocolate negro, partidas en trozos pequeños","140 g de caramelos lácteos blandos","3 cucharadas de leche","½ cucharadita de sal marina en escamas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrasa y forra un rectangular de 20 x 30 cm.\r\nmolde para pastel con papel para hornear – el\r\nLa mejor manera de hacerlo es con 2 tiras largas.\r\nde pergamino. Pon los ingredientes para\r\nla base en un procesador de alimentos y triturar\r\nhasta que empiece a agruparse – no lo hagas\r\nPreocúpate si los cacahuetes aún están un poco\r\nGruesos, agregarán una textura encantadora.\r\nIncline sobre su superficie de trabajo y amase.\r\nbrevemente para juntar como una masa.\r\nPresiona la masa en la base de tu\r\nestaño en una capa uniforme. Hornear por 25 minutos\r\nhasta que esté dorado, luego déjelo enfriar.","Para hacer la capa de mantequilla de maní, derrita\r\nla mantequilla y la mantequilla de maní en un pequeño\r\nsartén y mezclar hasta que quede suave. tamizar el\r\nazúcar glas en un bol, luego vierta el\r\nmezcla de mantequilla caliente y revuelva para combinar.\r\nMientras la mezcla aún esté tibia, vierte sobre\r\nla base y alisar con una espátula.\r\nEnfríe durante 2 horas hasta que cuaje.","Para hacer la capa de caramelo, poner el\r\ncaramelo y sal en una cacerola, llevar hasta el\r\nhervir y cocinar a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos,\r\nbatiendo continuamente, hasta que el color\r\noscurece uno o dos tonos y el caramelo\r\nespesa ligeramente. Dejar el caramelo\r\ndéjelo enfriar durante 20 minutos (consulte los consejos a continuación).\r\nUna vez enfriado, viértalo sobre el maní.\r\ncapa de mantequilla y regresar a la nevera para\r\notras 2 h.","Derretir el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor.\r\ncolóquelo sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo.\r\nMientras tanto, poner los toffees y la leche.\r\nen una cacerola pequeña y calentar suavemente. ellos\r\nse agruparán y lucharán por derretirse\r\nal principio, pero sigue calentando y eventualmente\r\nse convertirán en una salsa de caramelo líquida.","Sacar la lata de la nevera y\r\nverter el chocolate sobre la sal\r\ncapa de caramelo, inclinando la lata para untar\r\nel chocolate sobre la superficie. Utilice un\r\ncuchara para rociar rápidamente el caramelo\r\nel chocolate en un patrón fino y circular (o\r\nver consejo a continuación). Si el caramelo empieza a ponerse\r\ndemasiado espeso, añadir un chorrito más de leche o\r\ncrema y volver a ponerla al fuego hasta que\r\nlíquido. Espolvorear sobre las escamas de sal marina.\r\ny volver a poner la lata en el frigorífico para que se enfríe.\r\ndurante 2 horas antes de cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:55:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12964,7931,'es','Pastel de chocca mocca y caramelo','Una delicia en cualquier momento, pero sobre todo cuando están repletos de huevos de chocolate para Semana Santa','["2 cucharaditas de café instantáneo en gránulos/en polvo","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","2 cucharadas de agua caliente","175 g de mantequilla blanda","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos","2 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","200 g de harina con levadura","4 cucharadas de leche","0 2 x 50 g/2 x 2 oz barras de chocolate y caramelo","100 g de barras de chocolate y caramelo","50 g de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de leche","100 g de azúcar glas tamizada"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/Gas 4/horno ventilado 160C. Unte con mantequilla un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm / 8 pulgadas y cubra la base con papel para hornear.","Mida el café y el cacao en una taza, agregue el agua caliente y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave. Coloque la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, el almíbar, la harina, la leche y la pasta de cacao en un tazón grande y bata con una cuchara de madera o batidora eléctrica durante 2-3 minutos hasta que quede suave.  Rompe las barras de caramelo en secciones y agrega a la mezcla.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y alise la parte superior.  Hornee durante 35-40 minutos, hasta que la parte superior rebote cuando la presione ligeramente. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos, luego desmoldar, retirar el papel de revestimiento y dejar enfriar.","Para hacer el glaseado, rompe las barras de caramelo y ponlas en una cacerola pequeña con la mantequilla y la leche.  Calienta suavemente hasta que quede suave, revolviendo todo el tiempo, luego retira del fuego y agrega el azúcar glas (no te preocupes si no se disuelve inmediatamente, solo sigue revolviendo). Dejar enfriar hasta que espese lo suficiente como para dejar un rastro.\r\ncuando levantas la cuchara. Coloque el pastel en un plato para servir, extienda el glaseado por encima, dejándolo caer suavemente por los lados, luego déjelo reposar."]','2026-01-11 12:55:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12965,8938,'es','Tartas de queso con crema y caramelo de naranja','Es mejor preparar estos pasteles de queso individuales con un par de días de anticipación para que el caramelo del molde se disuelva en una salsa pegajosa.','["Bote de 284ml de nata doble","pelar 1 naranja","225 g de azúcar en polvo","4 cucharadas de licor de naranja","200 g de queso crema en tarrina","4 huevos","250 g de galletas digestivas","85 g de mantequilla, derretida","100 g de azúcar en polvo","aceite de girasol"]','["Calentar el horno a 150C/ventilador 130C/gas 2. En una cacerola pequeña, llevar a ebullición la nata con la piel de naranja y reservar para infusionar. Vierta 140 g/5 oz de azúcar en otra cacerola con suficiente agua para que quede espesa. Llevar a ebullición, luego bajar el fuego a fuego lento y hervir para obtener un caramelo oscuro. Añade 2 cucharadas de licor de naranja (cuidado que chisporrotea). Déjelo reposar un poco, luego vierta el caramelo sobre la base de 6 moldes de 250 ml y reserve.","Batir el queso crema y los 85 g/3 oz de azúcar restantes. \r\nen un tazón grande, luego agregue los huevos y el licor de naranja restante. Colar la crema infundida y luego batir todo para hacer una crema pastelera. Retire la espuma y reserve.","Hervir la tetera. Coloque los moldes en una fuente para asar honda. Divida la natilla entre ellos (sólo llegará a la mitad), luego lleve la lata al horno y llénela con agua caliente de \r\nla tetera de modo que llegue hasta la mitad del exterior de los moldes. Hornea los pasteles de queso durante 40 minutos o hasta que estén listos, luego retíralos del horno y del molde. Dejar enfriar y luego enfriar. \r\nal menos durante la noche. Estos se pueden preparar con hasta 2 días de anticipación y dejarlos enfriar.","Hasta 2 días antes de servir, hacer las bases. Desmenuza las galletas en \r\nun procesador de alimentos y luego triturar hasta obtener migajas finas. Agrega la mantequilla derretida y pulsa hasta que todo esté mezclado. Línea \r\nEn una bandeja para hornear plana con papel vegetal, vierta la mezcla base sobre ella y luego cubra con otra hoja de papel vegetal. Extienda suavemente la mezcla hasta que sea lo suficientemente grande como para cortar 6 bases del mismo tamaño que los moldes. Enfriar.","Para hacer los garabatos de caramelo, \r\nCalentar el azúcar con un poco de agua en un cazo y hervir para hacer caramelo, luego dejar enfriar un poco. Línea \r\nuna bandeja con papel de horno y engrasar con un poco de aceite. Rocíe el caramelo de arriba a abajo para que todo \r\nlas hebras de caramelo se pegan \r\npara crear estrellas, luego déjelo reposar.","Para servir, utilice un cortador del mismo diámetro que el molde para cortar. \r\n6 bases de la mezcla para galletas. ascensor \r\nlas bases en 6 platos. Desmolda las cheesecakes guardando la salsa de caramelo en el molde. Cubra las bases con los flan, rocíe la salsa sobre y alrededor de los platos, decore con una estrella y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:55:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12966,8940,'es','Profiteroles helados de vainilla y caramelo','Rellenos con rico helado de vainilla y bañados en salsa de caramelo, estos exquisitos profiteroles de caramelo son un postre espectacular.','["50 g de mantequilla","60 g de harina común","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos batidos","200 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de crema doble","chorrito de coñac","300 g de helado de vainilla de buena calidad, comprado o casero (ver más abajo)","250ml de leche","250ml de nata doble","50 g de azúcar","6 yemas de huevo","semillas de 2 vainas de vainilla"]','["Pon 150 ml de agua, la mantequilla y una pizca de sal en una cacerola mediana y calienta suavemente hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Sube el calor\r\ny llevar a ebullición. Tan pronto como esté hirviendo, vierta la harina de una vez. Batir rápidamente para combinar. CONSEJO: Es importante verter la harina tan pronto como el agua hierva, porque perder demasiado líquido por evaporación afectará la masa.","Ahora es necesario cocinar el almidón de la harina. Batir bien a fuego lento hasta que la mezcla se vuelva suave y brillante y comience a desprenderse del borde de la sartén. Vierta la mezcla en un bol y déjela enfriar un poco.","Batir rápidamente la mezcla y luego comenzar a agregar los huevos poco a poco, usando un batidor, una cuchara de madera o una batidora eléctrica. Es posible que no necesites agregar todo el huevo; detente una vez que la masa esté suave y elástica y se caiga fácilmente de una cuchara.","Caliente el horno a 220 ° C / ventilador 200 ° C / gas 7. Coloque una boquilla mediana en una manga pastelera grande y coloque la masa en ella. Forre dos bandejas para hornear con papel antiadherente y coloque 15 bolas de masa de tamaño 10p en cada una. Utilice un dedo mojado para alisar la parte superior. Hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y muy firme. Transfiera a una rejilla, voltee cada uno y luego déjelo enfriar. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por 2 días. CONSEJO: Los panecillos recién horneados tienen la parte superior puntiaguda, que puede quemarse rápidamente. Golpéalos suavemente con un dedo mojado antes de ponerlos a hornear.","Para la salsa, calienta el azúcar en una sartén antiadherente grande. Derrítelo suavemente, girando de vez en cuando hasta que se disuelva. Sube un poco el fuego y luego burbujea hasta obtener un caramelo dorado oscuro, unos 5 minutos en total. Mantenga la sartén al fuego y agregue con cuidado la crema para hacer una salsa sedosa. Agrega el coñac y revuelve nuevamente. Vierta en una jarra para servir. puede ser\r\nPrepare con hasta 2 días de anticipación: caliéntelo en el microondas durante unos segundos y revuelva para que se afloje.","Si haces tu propio helado, coloca la leche y la nata doble en una cacerola. Tome 1 cucharada de azúcar y agréguela también a la sartén. Batir el azúcar restante con las yemas de huevo y las semillas de las vainas de vainilla. Calienta la leche hasta que hierva, luego viértela sobre la mezcla de huevo, batiendo constantemente. Vierta nuevamente en la sartén y caliente suavemente, revolviendo con una cuchara de madera hasta que la crema espese y cubra el dorso de una cuchara. Pasar por un colador y dejar enfriar. Ahora bate la mezcla en una máquina para hacer helados o congélala en un recipiente poco profundo, batiendo bien al menos tres veces, hasta que esté congelada y suave. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por 1 mes. Rinde unos 500 ml, 5 minutos de preparación, 20 minutos de cocción y congelación.","Deja que el helado se ablande un poco en el frigorífico durante 30 minutos. Luego, colóquelo en una manga pastelera y sostenga la bolsa con\r\nCon un paño de cocina, introduce la boquilla en el fondo de uno de los panecillos. Vierta el helado hasta que esté completamente lleno (ver consejos). Trabaja lo más rápido que puedas; debes volver a colocar los profiteroles en el congelador antes de que el helado comience a derretirse. Se mantendrá bien envuelto en el congelador hasta por 1 semana. NOTA: Envolver un paño de cocina alrededor de la manga pastelera aísla el helado del calor de tus manos. Si colocar el helado parece demasiado complicado, simplemente corte los panecillos con un cuchillo de sierra y rellénelos con bolas de helado del tamaño de una cucharadita."]','2026-01-11 12:55:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12967,8942,'es','Tazas de tarta de queso onduladas y con caramelo','Budines individuales con sabores almendrados de crujientes galletas amaretti combinados con suave crema y caramelo','["100 g de galletas amaretti (unas 20)","400 g de queso tierno","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","6 cucharadas de salsa de caramelo, nosotros usamos Clavel, batida hasta que quede suave"]','["Triture las galletas en migajas grandes y divídalas en 4 moldes o vasos pequeños.","En un bol, bata el queso con el azúcar y la vainilla, luego agregue 4 cucharadas de salsa y bata hasta que esté casi incorporado pero aún ligeramente rayado. Vierta con cuidado sobre las galletas y alise la parte superior.","Vierta el resto del caramelo por encima y use una cucharadita para hacer girar la parte superior de la capa de queso con el caramelo. Dejar en el frigorífico durante al menos 2 horas pero hasta 2 días antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12968,8944,'es','Dulce de leche','Esta salsa clásica utiliza sólo tres ingredientes. Rocíe alrededor de pudines de chocolate o sobre su helado favorito.','["250 g de azúcar en polvo","Bote de 142ml de nata doble","50 g de mantequilla"]','["Vierta el azúcar en una fritura de base espesa.\r\ncacerola, agregue 4 cucharadas de agua, luego colóquela sobre\r\na fuego medio hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto.\r\nSube el fuego y burbujea durante 4-5 minutos.\r\nhasta tener caramelo. Quítate el calor,\r\nluego agregue con cuidado la crema y la mantequilla.\r\nDeje que la salsa se enfríe y luego viértala en un\r\nbotella exprimible."]','2026-01-11 12:55:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12969,7941,'es','Panal','Hacer tu propio caramelo de ceniza requiere un poco de cuidado y atención, pero vale la pena. Romper en pedazos y esparcir sobre helado y otros postres.','["mantequilla, para engrasar","200 g de azúcar en polvo","5 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio"]','["Engrasar un molde cuadrado de 20 cm con mantequilla. Mezcle el azúcar en polvo y el almíbar en una cacerola honda y revuelva a fuego suave hasta que el azúcar se derrita. Intenta no dejar que la mezcla burbujee hasta que los granos de azúcar hayan desaparecido. Una vez completamente derretido, sube un poco el fuego y cocina a fuego lento hasta obtener un caramelo de color ámbar (esto no tomará mucho tiempo), luego tan rápido como puedas apaga el fuego, vierte el bicarbonato y bate con una cuchara de madera hasta que haya desaparecido todo y la mezcla esté espumosa. Vierta la mezcla inmediatamente en el molde, pero tenga cuidado porque la mezcla estará muy caliente.","La mezcla seguirá burbujeando en la lata, simplemente déjala y en aproximadamente 1 hora - 1 hora 30 minutos el panal estará duro y listo para desmoronarse o romperse en trozos."]','2026-01-11 12:55:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12970,8946,'es','Sundaes de chocolate y caramelo de nuez','Busca en tu alacena y congelador para crear esta suntuosa mezcla de helado con maní salado, galletas y caramelo.','["100 g de chocolate amargo, partido en trozos","200ml de leche","300g/11oz de caramelo (nosotros usamos clavel)","85 g de mantequilla de maní crujiente","4 galletas crujientes, desmenuzadas en trozos (usamos galletas crujientes arrugadas con mantequilla de Fox)","50 g de maní tostado y salado, picado","6 bolas grandes de helado de vainilla","6 bolas grandes de helado de chocolate"]','["Poner el chocolate y 100ml de leche en un\r\ncacerola pequeña, y poner el caramelo, maní\r\nmantequilla y 100 ml de leche en otra cacerola.\r\nDerrita ambos suavemente, revolviendo hasta que estén picantes.\r\nDejar enfriar.","Revuelva bien las salsas para que se suelten.\r\nluego coloque en capas las 2 salsas, los trozos de galleta,\r\nmaní y helado en 6 sundae\r\nvasos o tazones y comer inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:55:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12971,8947,'es','Soufflés de caramelo con salsa de caramelo','Los soufflés siempre son un ganador después de la cena, y estas delicias picantes de caramelo no son una excepción.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco para engrasar","200 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro, más 4 cucharadas extra","200 ml de nata para montar","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 yemas de huevo","1 cucharada de harina común","3 claras de huevo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nMantequilla 5 platos de soufflé individuales de 150 ml\r\no moldes y espolvorear todo con\r\n2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno blando. Colocar en un\r\nbandeja para hornear. Derretir la mantequilla en un\r\ncacerola, luego agregue el azúcar, la crema, la vainilla\r\ny una buena pizca de sal. cuando el azúcar es\r\nderretido, burbujear durante 1 minuto hasta que parezca\r\nuna salsa. Vierta 200 ml en una jarra para servir.","Agrega las yemas de huevo y la harina al resto.\r\ncaramelo en la cacerola. batir constantemente\r\na fuego medio hasta que la mezcla espese,\r\nunos 3 minutos. Colar en un bol y dejar enfriar.\r\ndurante 15 min. Batir las claras de huevo en un tazón grande.\r\nhasta que esté espumoso, luego agregue gradualmente\r\n2 cucharadas restantes de azúcar hasta que las claras estén\r\nrígido pero no seco. Doblar un tercio de las claras.\r\nen la mezcla de caramelo en la sartén, luego doble\r\neso de vuelta a los blancos. dividir entre\r\nplatos y use una espátula para raspar\r\nnivel superior. Hornee hasta que los soufflés estén inflados.\r\ny dorado – unos 11 minutos. los soufflés\r\ntodavía debería estar un poco inestable en el medio,\r\npero no líquido, así que si sirves cuatro,\r\ningrese a su probador para verificar. Regresar\r\nel resto al horno durante 2 minutos si no está cocido.\r\nServir inmediatamente con salsa de caramelo,\r\ncalentar un poco mientras se hornean los soufflés."]','2026-01-11 12:55:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12972,8948,'es','Pastel de manzana y caramelo','El pastel húmedo cubierto con una cobertura crujiente y pegajosa hará que tus invitados vuelvan por más.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco para engrasar","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos","225 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de canela","4 cucharadas colmadas de yogur griego","2 comiendo manzanas","50 g de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes, más 1 cucharada extra picada","50 g de caramelos blandos (nosotros utilizamos caramelos masticables de Werther)","2 cucharadas de crema doble"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase un molde para pan de 2 libras y forre la base y\r\nTermina con una tira larga de papel de horno.","Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y\r\nvainilla hasta que esté pálida, luego batir los huevos,\r\nuno por uno. Vierta la harina, la canela.\r\ny yogur. Pelar, descorazonar y picar las manzanas\r\nen trozos pequeños, luego agréguelos al tazón\r\ny mezclar todo junto con un\r\ncuchara de madera.","Raspe la lata, alise la parte superior y\r\nesparce las nueces por la mitad.\r\nHornee en un estante intermedio durante 1 h 20-30 min.\r\nhasta que al pinchar un pincho éste salga limpio.\r\nDejar enfriar en la lata.","Para decorar, poner los toffees en un recipiente pequeño.\r\ncazo con la nata doble. suavemente\r\ncalentar, revolviendo, hasta que los caramelos se hayan derretido\r\nen una suave salsa de caramelo. Genial para\r\naproximadamente 1 minuto mientras apagas suavemente\r\npastel. Rocíe lentamente la salsa de caramelo\r\nla parte superior del pastel. Dispersarse inmediatamente\r\ncon las nueces sobrantes – deberían pegarse\r\ndonde golpean el caramelo. Dejar por 10 minutos\r\nantes de servir. Mejor fresco pero se conservará.\r\nen una lata hermética durante 3-4 días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12973,8949,'es','Pastel de la selva negra del siguiente nivel','Reelabora este deleite retro para el público con un relleno más espeso y cremoso y más chocolate para disfrutar del puro placer. Es el postre central perfecto.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco más para las latas","200 g de chocolate amargo, picado","300 g de harina común","50 g de cacao en polvo tamizado y un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","400 g de azúcar moreno blando","300ml de yogur natural","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos","100 ml de almíbar de las cerezas en frasco (ver más abajo), completar con agua si es necesario","2 cucharadas de kirsch (opcional)","150 g de chocolate amargo, frío","500 g de mascarpone","600ml de nata doble","100 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","8 cucharadas de conserva de cerezas","2 frascos de 370 cerezas negras, escurridas y reservadas en almíbar (es posible que no necesites todas las cerezas)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla las bases de dos moldes desmontables de 20 cm de profundidad y cubrir con papel para hornear. Derrita la mantequilla y el chocolate juntos en un recipiente resistente al calor en ráfagas cortas en el microondas o sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Revuelva hasta que quede suave y luego reserve.","Combine la harina, el cacao, el polvo para hornear, el bicarbonato, el azúcar y ½ cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande. Batir el yogur, la vainilla y los huevos en una jarra hasta que quede suave. Vierta la mezcla de yogur y la mezcla de chocolate derretido en los ingredientes secos, luego mezcle para combinar hasta formar una masa espesa.","Divida la masa entre los moldes y hornee durante 30-35 minutos, o hasta que suba y al insertar una brocheta en el centro salga limpia. Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo. Se mantendrá refrigerado y envuelto hasta por tres días o congelado durante tres meses. Recorta la parte superior de los bizcochos para que queden planos.","Mientras tanto, combine el almíbar de cereza con el kirsch, si lo usa, y reserve. Se mantendrá frío durante tres días. (Si prefiere no usar kirsch, reserve el almíbar de cereza tal cual). Corte el chocolate frío con un pelador de verduras y enfríe los copos nuevamente o congélelos en una bandeja forrada con papel para hornear hasta que esté listo para usar. Para el relleno, bata el mascarpone, la nata, el azúcar y la vainilla hasta obtener picos firmes con una batidora eléctrica.","Para armar, corte cada bizcocho por la mitad a través del ecuador para tener cuatro capas uniformes. Asegure una capa en un plato para servir o en un soporte para pasteles con un poco de crema batida. Unte generosamente un poco de almíbar y luego extienda sobre la mitad de la conserva de cerezas. Cubra con una segunda capa de bizcocho, unte con más almíbar y luego extienda aproximadamente una cuarta parte de la crema batida. Coloque suficientes cerezas encima para cubrir la crema (reservando 12-14 para decorar), luego vierta un poco más de crema para cubrir las cerezas. Cubra con el tercer bizcocho, unte con más almíbar y esparza sobre la conserva restante, luego emparéjelo con el último bizcocho, con el lado cortado hacia abajo. Unte con un pincel el resto del almíbar.","Vierta aproximadamente una cuarta parte de la crema restante en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella y reserve. Extienda el resto sobre la parte superior y los lados del pastel, alisándolo con una espátula. Coloque el pastel en un plato para servir o colóquelo sobre una bandeja o plato grande, y presione la mayoría de las virutas de chocolate frío por todo el costado del pastel, volviendo a presionar las que caigan sobre la bandeja sobre el pastel para que quede completamente cubierto. Esparza las virutas de chocolate restantes encima. Coloque de 12 a 14 remolinos de crema alrededor del borde superior y luego coloque una cereza en cada remolino. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir. Se mantendrá frío hasta por un día."]','2026-01-11 12:55:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12974,8950,'es','Pastel de cerezas','Reúna todos los queridos sabores de la clásica tarta Bakewell en un pastel espectacular. Es ideal para una celebración o el té de la tarde.','["300 g de mantequilla salada, blanda, más un poco más para las latas","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharaditas de extracto de almendras","4 huevos medianos, a temperatura ambiente (use huevos de yema dorada para obtener un bizcocho amarillo más intenso)","75ml de leche","150 g de harina con levadura","150 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","unas cuantas almendras tostadas en láminas","380 g de mantequilla blanda","650 g de azúcar glas","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","2-3 cucharadas de leche (opcional)","gota de colorante rosa","400 g de cerezas, 12 con tallos","300 g de confitura o mermelada de cereza negra"]','["Unte con mantequilla tres moldes para pasteles de fondo suelto de 20 cm y cúbralos con papel para hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Pesar la mantequilla, el azúcar y el extracto de almendras en un tazón grande o en el tazón de una batidora y batir con una batidora eléctrica (o la batidora) durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté suave y esponjoso.","Batir los huevos y la leche en una jarra y pesar la harina, las almendras molidas y la levadura en un bol. Con el motor en marcha, agregue la mezcla de huevo a la mezcla de mantequilla, poco a poco, agregando una cucharada de la mezcla de harina entre cada adición para evitar que se parta. Cuando todo esté incorporado, mezcla por un minuto más hasta tener una masa suave y sin bolsas de harina.","Divida la masa uniformemente entre las latas. Hornee por 25 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Si quedan migas húmedas, hornee por otros 5 minutos y luego verifique nuevamente. Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 30 minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla, retirar el pergamino y dejar enfriar por completo.","Para la crema de mantequilla, bata la mantequilla, el azúcar y el extracto de almendras en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave y esponjoso, agregando una gota de leche si está demasiado dura; debe poder untar (o haga esto con una batidora de pie). Vierta aproximadamente una cuarta parte de la crema de mantequilla en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella grande. Agrega una gota de colorante rosa al resto y bate hasta obtener un tono rosado uniforme. Vierta aproximadamente otro cuarto de crema de mantequilla rosa en una manga pastelera y corte la punta.","Elige las 12 mejores cerezas con sus tallos y resérvalas. Retire los huesos de las cerezas restantes y luego córtelas en cuartos. Mezclar con la conserva o mermelada. Dejar de lado.","Unte un poco de crema de mantequilla rosa en un plato para servir o en un soporte para pasteles (esto mantendrá el pastel en su lugar) y coloque el primer bizcocho encima. Unte un poco de crema de mantequilla rosa encima y luego coloque un anillo alrededor del borde (esto evitará que la mermelada se salga por los lados). Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de mermelada en el medio. Repita con el segundo bizcocho, más crema de mantequilla y el resto de la mermelada. Sándwich con el bizcocho final. Enfríe durante al menos 20 minutos hasta que esté firme.","Cuando el pastel esté firme, cubra la parte superior y los lados con una fina capa de crema de mantequilla rosa, alisándolo con una espátula o una espátula; esta es una capa de migajas, que atrapa las migajas. Enfríe por 20 minutos más.","Extienda la crema de mantequilla rosa restante sobre el pastel. Puedes calentar la espátula con agua caliente y luego secarla antes de pasarla sobre la crema de mantequilla para obtener un acabado más limpio, si lo deseas. Coloque de 10 a 12 rosetas encima del pastel en un círculo alrededor del borde usando la crema de mantequilla simple, luego decore con las cerezas enteras y las almendras en hojuelas. Se conservará en un molde para bizcocho durante cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12975,8951,'es','pastel maltés','Mima a tu niño interior con este rico pastel de chocolate y malta con glaseado de mascarpone. Decorar con virutas de chocolate con leche, chispas y Maltesers.','["80 g de mantequilla salada, cortada en cubos, más un poco más para el molde","100 g de chocolate amargo, al menos 70 % de sólidos de cacao, picado en trozos grandes","50 g de cacao en polvo","80 g de bebida de chocolate malteado en polvo","250 g de harina común","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 huevos batidos","250 ml de suero de leche","200 ml de café preparado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","400 g de chocolate amargo, al menos 70 % de sólidos de cacao, picado en trozos grandes","50 g de bebida de chocolate malteado en polvo","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de mantequilla salada","400ml de nata doble","150 g de mascarpone","virutas de chocolate con leche","asperja","Maltesers"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base y los lados de moldes para pasteles redondos de 2 x 20 cm. Vierta la mantequilla y el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor. Coloque el recipiente sobre una cacerola llena de agua hirviendo asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Revuelva regularmente hasta que se derrita y luego retire del fuego. Alternativamente, puedes derretirlo en el microondas en períodos de 20 segundos, revolviendo regularmente.","Tamiza el cacao en polvo y la bebida de chocolate malteada en polvo en un bol grande. Añade la harina, el azúcar, el bicarbonato y la levadura en polvo junto con una pizca grande de sal y bate. En una jarra, mezcle los huevos, el suero de leche, el café y la vainilla, luego vierta los ingredientes secos. Batir bien hasta que quede suave, luego verter el chocolate derretido y mezclar hasta formar una masa suave. Dividir entre los moldes y hornear durante 35-40 minutos, hasta que al insertar un pincho en el medio salga limpio. Reservar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por dos días.","Para hacer el glaseado, vierta el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor y reserve. Vierta la bebida malteada en polvo, el azúcar, la mantequilla y la nata en una cacerola y póngala a fuego medio-bajo. Calentar suavemente hasta que el azúcar y la mantequilla se derritan, luego verter esto sobre el chocolate, batiendo bien. Si el chocolate no se ha derretido, llena la cacerola con agua caliente del hervidor y coloca el recipiente encima, luego vuelve a batir. Con batidoras eléctricas, bata la mezcla hasta que esté espesa y brillante, luego agregue el mascarpone y continúe batiendo hasta que esté bien mezclado. Deje enfriar a temperatura ambiente (se espesará a medida que se enfríe).","Cuando esté listo para armar, coloque uno de los pasteles en un soporte para pasteles o en un plato para servir y luego vierta un poco del glaseado enfriado, extendiéndolo uniformemente sobre el pastel. Haga un sándwich con el otro bizcocho, luego cubra con una capa el resto del glaseado, esparciendo una capa espesa por la parte superior y los lados del pastel. Esparce por encima algunas virutas de chocolate con leche, chispas y Maltesers® para decorar. Se mantendrá cubierto por hasta cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12976,8952,'es','Pastel de queso con calabaza y nueces','Deléitese con nuestro pastel de queso con masa casera, relleno de calabaza y cobertura de nueces pecanas. Es un postre perfecto para el otoño.','["250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","125 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en trozos","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1 nuez moscada entera, para rallar","2 huevos, más 1 yema de huevo (congela la clara extra para usarla en otra receta)","Lata de 425g de puré de calabaza","150 g de azúcar moreno blando","½ cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","250 g de queso tierno","125 g de mitades de nueces","50 ml de jarabe de arce"]','["Mezcle la harina y la mantequilla en un procesador de alimentos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino, luego agregue el azúcar en polvo y unas cuantas ralladuras de nuez moscada. Agregue la yema de huevo y suficiente agua fría (aproximadamente 1 cucharada) para crear una masa firme. Vierta en un bol, cubra y enfríe durante al menos 20 minutos. Alternativamente, frote la mantequilla con la harina en un tazón grande con las yemas de los dedos, luego agregue el azúcar, la nuez moscada, la yema de huevo y el agua.","Extienda la masa fría sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta que sea un poco más grande que un molde para tarta estriado y de fondo suelto de 22 cm, luego úsela para forrar el molde. Pinche toda la base con un tenedor y luego enfríe durante 20 minutos.","Aproximadamente 5 minutos antes de que la masa termine de enfriarse, caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Retire la masa del refrigerador, luego cúbrala con un trozo de papel para hornear y rellénela con frijoles para hornear o arroz o lentejas crudas. Hornee durante 12 minutos, luego retire los frijoles y el pergamino y hornee durante otros 8-10 minutos hasta que la masa esté ligeramente dorada.","Mientras tanto, combine el puré de calabaza, 2 huevos, el azúcar moreno claro, la canela, el jengibre y el queso tierno. Ralla aproximadamente ½ cucharadita de nuez moscada, mezcla bien y luego vierte el relleno en la masa de hojaldre. Hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que el relleno esté ligeramente firme y se tambalee ligeramente en el medio. Coloque las nueces sobre el relleno en círculos concéntricos y luego unte el jarabe de arce. Regrese al horno por 15 minutos más hasta que las nueces estén ligeramente doradas y el relleno esté listo. Deje que se enfríe completamente en el molde antes de retirarlo y servirlo. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12977,8953,'es','pastel de pistacho','Pruebe este pastel de pistacho ligero y esponjoso, cubierto con crema dulce de pistacho, frambuesas frescas, nueces trituradas y ralladura de lima.','["250 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para el molde","200 g de pistachos, picados en trozos grandes","80 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","225 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos, a temperatura ambiente","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de azúcar glas","250 g de mascarpone","200ml de nata doble","100 g de pasta de pistacho","400 g de frambuesas","1 lima sin cera, rallada"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde desmontable de 23 cm. Vierta 150 g de pistachos en un procesador de alimentos y triture hasta que estén finamente molidos. Vierta en un bol y mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear y una pizca de sal. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en un recipiente aparte hasta que estén esponjosos y pálidos, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Rompe los huevos uno a la vez, batiendo bien durante 1 minuto después de cada adición, hasta que se hayan agregado todos. Incorpora la vainilla y luego incorpora suavemente la mezcla de harina. Vierta con cuidado en el molde preparado y hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla en el molde.","Mientras tanto, tamice el azúcar glas en un bol, luego agregue el mascarpone, la nata doble y la pasta de pistacho. Batir hasta que esté bien combinado, luego reservar en el refrigerador durante 20-30 minutos para que espese hasta obtener una consistencia de cuchara.","Corta el pastel enfriado por la mitad horizontalmente con un cuchillo de sierra, para tener dos capas. Poner la capa inferior en un plato o soporte para tartas y esparcir sobre una cucharada generosa de crema de pistacho. Cubra con un puñado generoso de frambuesas para cubrir el pastel. Cubra con la otra mitad del bizcocho y luego cubra la parte superior y los lados del pastel con la crema restante. Esparza sobre las últimas frambuesas, los pistachos restantes y la ralladura de lima para servir. Se mantendrá frío en un recipiente hermético durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12978,8954,'es','Pastel de barro Tahini Mississippi','Pruebe nuestra versión de este postre clásico de los Estados Unidos: es ideal para preparar con anticipación, cubierto con sésamo crujiente para obtener un impresionante pudín central.','["300 g de galletas de bourbon","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","125 g de chocolate negro (70% cacao), partido en trozos pequeños","125 g de mantequilla sin sal","175 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 huevos","100 g de tahini","75 g de harina común","1 cucharada de cacao en polvo","250 g de natillas de vainilla","75 g de chocolate negro (70% cacao), partido en trozos pequeños","350ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de tahini","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","sésamo quebradizo, para decorar"]','["Coloque las galletas en un procesador de alimentos y triture hasta obtener migajas, o viértalas en un tazón y golpee suavemente con la punta de un rodillo. Incorpora la mantequilla derretida. Vierta en un molde para tarta estriado de 26 cm de profundidad y use una cuchara para presionar las migas en la base y hacia los lados del molde para tarta, asegurándose de que quede compacto y que no queden espacios. Dejar enfriar en la nevera.","Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Derrita el chocolate y la mantequilla en un recipiente en el microondas en ráfagas de 30 segundos, revolviendo regularmente hasta que quede suave, o en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una olla con agua hirviendo (asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua). En otro bol, bata el azúcar y los huevos con una batidora eléctrica durante 4-5 minutos hasta que estén cremosos.","Vierta la mezcla de chocolate y tahini en la mezcla de azúcar y huevo. Tamice la harina, el cacao en polvo y ½ cucharadita de sal sobre los ingredientes húmedos, luego incorpore todo suavemente, teniendo cuidado de no sacar demasiado aire. Vierta la mezcla de brownie en el molde para tarta y colóquela en una bandeja para hornear (puede que salga un poco de mantequilla del molde). Hornee en el medio del horno durante 20 minutos hasta que esté listo; aún debe oscilar en el centro. Dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente durante aproximadamente 2 horas.","Mientras tanto, prepara la cobertura. Poner las natillas y el chocolate en una sartén y cocinar a fuego medio, revolviendo, hasta que el chocolate se derrita. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Unte la crema de chocolate sobre la capa de brownie. Enfríe durante 30 minutos hasta que esté firme.","Batir la nata, 1 cucharada de tahini y el azúcar glas hasta que forme picos suaves. Apilar encima del pastel y decorar con sésamo crujiente. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12979,8955,'es','Pastel de zanahoria y piña','Prepare este pastel tropical económico con piña fresca o enlatada. Si lo usa fresco, decore con "flores" de piña para darle un toque sorpresa.','["175 ml de aceite vegetal, más un poco más para la lata","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","300 g de azúcar moreno blando","3 huevos","100ml de leche","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de zanahoria rallada","200g de piña, de lata y escurrida, o fresca, reservando el jugo, finamente picada","75 g de nueces picadas (opcional)","flores de piña, para servir (opcional; vea la receta a continuación)","100 g de mantequilla","275 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","150 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa"]','["Engrase un molde para pastel de 23 cm con una profundidad de al menos 7 cm, luego cubra la base y los lados con papel para hornear. Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Combina la harina, el bicarbonato, las especias y el azúcar en un tazón grande con ¼ de cucharadita de sal. Con las yemas de los dedos, frote la mezcla harinosa durante unos minutos para aplastar los grumos de azúcar en la harina.","Batir en una jarra el aceite, los huevos, la leche y el extracto de vainilla y verter en los ingredientes secos. Agrega la zanahoria rallada, la piña picada y las nueces (si las usas), luego incorpora todo junto con una espátula.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde y nivele la parte superior con la espátula. Hornee durante 1 hora hasta que suba y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Si queda algo de la mezcla de pastel cruda pegada, regrese al horno durante 5 minutos y luego verifique nuevamente. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla y vierta 1 cucharada de jugo de piña (si usa piña enlatada) sobre el bizcocho. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Para hacer el glaseado, bata la mantequilla y la mitad del azúcar glas, a mano o con una batidora eléctrica, hasta que quede suave. Agrega el resto del azúcar glas y la vainilla y bate por unos minutos más hasta que quede suave, luego mezcla con el queso tierno. Coloque el pastel en un plato o soporte para pasteles y apile el glaseado encima. Coloque las flores de piña encima, si las usa (consulte la receta a continuación). Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético en un lugar fresco durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12980,8956,'es','Gingerbread tres leches cake','Dale un toque festivo a este pastel de inspiración mexicana con jengibre y canela. El pastel se remoja en un trío de leches azucaradas y luego se cubre con crema batida.','["aceite sin sabor, para la lata","4 huevos, separados","200 g de azúcar mascabado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida, más una pizca","100ml de leche","Lata de 410g de leche evaporada","200 ml de leche condensada azucarada, más 2 cucharadas","300ml de nata doble"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar un molde desmontable de 23 cm y que tenga al menos 6 cm de profundidad y forrar la base con papel para hornear. Pon las claras en un bol grande con una pizca de sal y bate con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén espumosas, unos 3 minutos. Agregue lentamente 150 g de azúcar, una cucharada a la vez, batiendo continuamente hasta que esté espeso y brillante.","Mezcle las yemas de huevo, el azúcar restante y la vainilla en un segundo tazón durante 2 minutos, o hasta que estén pálidos y espumosos. Agregue la harina, el polvo para hornear, las especias y la leche, luego mezcle con una espátula.","Agregue una cucharada grande de claras de huevo batidas a la masa del pastel, bata para aflojar y luego incorpore las claras de huevo restantes con una cuchara de metal grande (no mezcle demasiado o perderá el aire) hasta que quede suave. Vierte esto en el molde, alisa la superficie y hornea durante 40-45 minutos hasta que al insertar un pincho en el centro, éste salga limpio. Combina las leches evaporada y condensada con 50ml de la nata doble.","Deje que el pastel se enfríe en el molde durante 10 a 15 minutos, luego inviértalo con cuidado sobre un plato para servir o un soporte para pasteles y retire el pergamino. (Asegúrese de usar un plato o un soporte con un ligero borde para recoger el exceso de leche). Deje enfriar durante otros 10 minutos.","Haz agujeros sobre el pastel con una brocheta y, mientras aún esté caliente, vierte lentamente aproximadamente una cuarta parte de la mezcla de leche por encima. Deje que el pastel absorba esto antes de agregar más, luego repita hasta que se acabe toda la mezcla de leche; si el pastel se satura antes de haber usado toda la leche, vierta lo que queda en una jarra y sírvalo junto con el pastel más tarde para verterlo. Este proceso puede tardar un par de horas, pero en cuanto el bizcocho se enfríe, deberás trasladarlo al frigorífico. Una vez que se haya absorbido toda la leche, déjela enfriar durante 2 horas más, o toda la noche, para enfriar y mejorar la textura.","Batir el resto de la nata y las 2 cucharadas de leche condensada hasta obtener picos suaves. Vierta sobre el pastel frío y luego espolvoree con una pizca de canela. Se mantendrá frío durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12981,8957,'es','Pastel de piña helado','Crea este impresionante horneado para la mesa navideña. Decorado con piñas de almendras, es un centro de mesa perfecto si no eres fanático del tradicional pastel de frutas.','["250 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para las latas","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de yogur natural","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","4 huevos","300 g de harina con levadura","150 g de mermelada de albaricoque","150 g de mazapán","100 g de almendras tostadas laminadas","cacao en polvo, para espolvorear","200 g de mantequilla","500 g de azúcar glas","75ml de leche","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","1 clara de huevo","100 g de azúcar en polvo","8 ramitas de romero","50 g de arándanos"]','["Unte con mantequilla dos moldes para pastel redondos de fondo suelto de 20 cm y cúbralos con papel para hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos, aproximadamente 2 minutos.","Mezclar en una jarra el yogur, el aceite, la vainilla y los huevos. Agrega la harina y los ingredientes húmedos a la mezcla de mantequilla, junto con una pizca de sal. Mezcle todo durante 1-2 minutos hasta que quede suave y cremoso.","Divida la masa entre los moldes y nivele las superficies con una espátula. Hornee por 25 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Si hay alguna mezcla húmeda, regresa los bizcochos al horno por otros 5 minutos y luego revisa nuevamente. Deje enfriar en los moldes durante 15 minutos, luego colóquelos sobre una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo. Una vez enfriados, los bizcochos se mantendrán en una lata hermética durante cinco días o bien envueltos y congelados durante tres meses.","Haz las decoraciones a continuación. Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Batir ligeramente la clara de huevo y poner en un plato el azúcar en polvo. Dobla las ramitas de romero formando curvas; esto ayudará a que se asienten alrededor de la base del pastel. Unte o sumerja las ramitas de romero y los arándanos en la clara de huevo y luego cúbralos con el azúcar. Sacuda el exceso, luego colóquelo en la bandeja y déjelo secar durante al menos 1 hora.","Para hacer las piñas almendradas, divide el mazapán en cinco trozos y enrolla cada uno hasta darle forma de huevo. Comenzando por el extremo más ancho, presione las almendras en hojuelas en el mazapán en ángulo para que parezcan una piña. Cubra un lado de cada bola de mazapán de esta manera, teniendo cuidado de no romper las hojuelas de almendra. Poner las piñas de mazapán en una bandeja y espolvorear ligeramente con cacao en polvo.","Para hacer la crema de mantequilla, bata la mantequilla, el azúcar glas, la leche, la vainilla y el extracto de almendras en un tazón grande con un batidor eléctrico o en una batidora de pie hasta que quede suave y cremoso, aproximadamente 3 minutos.","Coloque un pastel en un plato soporte para pasteles y extiéndalo sobre aproximadamente 6 cucharadas de crema de mantequilla con una espátula. Cubra con la mermelada de albaricoque y luego coloque el segundo pastel encima.","Apila la crema de mantequilla restante encima del pastel y extiéndela por la parte superior y los lados. Este pastel luce mejor con un glaseado estilo \"desnudo\". Para crear esto, raspe la mayor parte de la crema de mantequilla de los lados con una espátula para que el pastel sea ligeramente visible a través de una fina capa de crema de mantequilla. Limpiar el plato alrededor del borde del bizcocho con una hoja de papel de cocina.","Coloque las ramitas de romero glaseadas alrededor de la base del pastel y cubra con las piñas y los arándanos glaseados. Se conservará en una lata hermética hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12982,8958,'es','Pastel de espéculoos fácil','¿Te encantan las galletas speculoos? Transfórmalos en este bizcocho, que también aprovecha los speculoos untados en el glaseado. ¡Seguro que será el favorito de la familia!','["175 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","175 g de azúcar moreno blando","150 g de galleta para untar speculoos","50 gramos de yogur natural","4 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharadita de canela molida","175 g de harina con levadura","4 tbsp caramel or dulce de leche","6 galletas speculoos, trituradas aproximadamente","200 g de mantequilla sin sal","400 g de azúcar glas","100 g de galleta para untar speculoos"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar las bases de dos moldes para pasteles de 20 cm con papel de horno. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos, aproximadamente 2 minutos. Agrega la pasta para untar y vuelve a batir para combinar.","Combina el yogur, los huevos y la vainilla en una jarra, luego agrégalo junto con la canela, la harina y una pizca de sal. Batir durante 1-2 minutos hasta que se combinen. Divida entre las latas, nivele la parte superior con una espátula y hornee en el estante central del horno durante 30 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorada, o al insertar una brocheta en el medio salga limpia; si queda algo de masa húmeda, hornee por 5 minutos más y luego verifique nuevamente. Dejar en los moldes durante 15 minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para el glaseado, batir con unas varillas eléctricas la mantequilla, la mitad del azúcar y toda la crema para untar hasta que quede suave. Agrega el resto del azúcar y vuelve a batir. Calienta el caramelo en el microondas durante 30 segundos para que se suelte. Coloque los dos bizcochos juntos usando la mitad del glaseado y un chorrito de caramelo, luego extienda el resto del glaseado por la parte superior y los lados. Rocíe sobre el resto del caramelo y espolvoree sobre las galletas trituradas. Se conservará en un molde para pastel hasta por cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12983,8959,'es','Pastel de sidra de manzana especiado','Agregue pimienta de Jamaica, clavo y nuez moscada a este pastel de sidra de manzana para darle un toque cálido otoñal. Se agregan manzanas Bramley a la mezcla del bizcocho y se cubren con nueces crujientes.','["125 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda, más un poco más para la lata","250 ml de sidra de manzana","1 cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica molida","1 cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","1 cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","una pizca grande de clavo molido","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","75ml de yogur natural estilo griego","250 g de manzanas Bramley, peladas, sin corazón y picadas","125 g de azúcar glas tamizada","30 g de nueces picadas"]','["Unte con mantequilla un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm y forre con papel para hornear. Vierta la sidra en una cacerola, déjela hervir y hierva rápidamente durante 10 minutos hasta que se reduzca a unos 100 ml, o aproximadamente a la mitad. Fresco. Combine las especias y reserve 1 cucharadita de la mezcla para el glaseado. Mezclar el resto con la harina, la levadura y una pizca de sal.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en una batidora de pie o con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien entre cada adición. Incorpora la vainilla, el yogur y 75 ml de sidra reducida. Finalmente, incorpora la mezcla de harina y las manzanas hasta que no queden rayas de harina. Vierta en el molde preparado y alise la superficie. Hornee durante 55 minutos a 1 hora, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 20 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Una vez que esté completamente frío, el pastel se puede envolver y congelar por hasta tres meses. Descongela completamente antes de glasear y servir como se muestra a continuación.","Cuando el pastel se haya enfriado, bata los 25 ml restantes de sidra reducida con el azúcar glas y la mezcla de especias reservada hasta que quede suave, agregando un chorrito de agua si es necesario para hacer un glaseado espeso y lloviznante. Vierta esto sobre el pastel, dejando que gotee por los lados. Espolvorea sobre las nueces picadas, en forma de anillo si lo deseas, y deja reposar el glaseado antes de servir. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético en un lugar fresco hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12984,8960,'es','Tarta de queso con pistacho','Disfrute de una versión persa del pastel de queso de la lectora de Good Food, Amani Al-Sitrawi, quien comparte esta receta de postre inspirada en un regalo de su hermano.','["500 g de queso tierno","225 g de azúcar en polvo","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de crema agria","3 huevos","40 g de pistachos picados","4 cucharadas de crema de pistacho, derretida","40 g de pistachos molidos","400 g de galletas digestivas trituradas","140 g de mantequilla derretida"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y poner una fuente refractaria hasta la mitad llena de agua en el estante inferior. Para la base, combine los digestivos y la mantequilla derretida en un tazón, luego viértalo en un molde desmontable de 23 cm de profundidad. Presione hacia la base y hacia los lados con una espátula. Reservar en una bandeja para hornear.","Batir el queso, el azúcar, la maicena, la vainilla y la crema agria, luego agregar los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo hasta que estén cremosos. Agrega los pistachos picados y luego vierte el relleno sobre la base. Hornee en el estante del medio durante 10 minutos, luego reduzca el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2 y hornee durante 40 minutos más hasta que cuaje con una ligera oscilación en el medio. Apagar el horno y dejar la tarta de queso dentro con la puerta entreabierta durante 30 minutos (para evitar grietas). Deje enfriar por completo y luego enfríe durante 24 horas. Vierta sobre la crema de pistacho y espolvoree con los pistachos molidos para servir. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12985,8961,'es','Tarta de limonada de fresa','Sorprenda a sus invitados con este espectacular pastel de celebración. Sabe a limonada de fresa, con bizcochos empapados en almíbar de limón, glaseado de tarta de queso, limones confitados y caramelos.','["225 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","225 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos medianos","225 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","75 g de yogur natural","2 limones sin cera","500 g de fresas","1 cucharada de caramelo para hacer estallar (opcional)","1 limón sin cera","75 g de azúcar en polvo","250 g de mantequilla, ablandada","600 g de azúcar glas","180 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","10 g de polvo de fresa o frambuesa liofilizado (consulte el consejo a continuación)"]','["Unte con mantequilla dos moldes para pastel de fondo suelto de 20 cm y forre la base y los lados con papel para hornear. Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Vierte la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo en una batidora y bate hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. O haga esto usando una batidora eléctrica. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo entre cada adición.","Agrega la harina, la levadura en polvo y una pizca de sal y vuelve a mezclar, luego el yogur. Ralla los dos limones, agrega esto y mezcla hasta que todo esté completamente combinado. Es posible que tengas que raspar los lados del recipiente a medida que avanzas.","Divida la masa del pastel entre los moldes preparados y alise las superficies con una espátula. Hornee por 30 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Una vez fríos, los pasteles se pueden envolver y congelar hasta por tres meses. Descongelar durante la noche antes de glasear.","Para la cáscara de limón confitada, utilice un pelador de verduras para quitar la cáscara del limón restante en tiras largas y finas. Use un cuchillo pequeño y afilado para cortar la médula blanca de la cáscara y luego córtela en tiras más finas. Ponga 50 g de azúcar en polvo en una cacerola pequeña con 100 ml de agua. Exprima los tres limones y viértalos en la sartén. Llevar la mezcla a ebullición, reducir a fuego lento y cocinar durante unos minutos hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Vierta las tiras de cáscara de limón, luego vuelva a hervir, reduzca el fuego a fuego lento nuevamente y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que la cáscara esté suave. Vierta los 25 g de azúcar restantes en un bol. Retire la piel de limón del almíbar con un tenedor y agréguela al bol de azúcar. Agite suavemente el recipiente para cubrir las tiras de cáscara, luego sacuda el exceso y coloque la cáscara confitada en un plato o bandeja para hornear en una sola capa para que se seque, aproximadamente 30 minutos. Una vez endurecida, la cáscara confitada se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético en un lugar fresco durante seis meses.","Vierta 3 cucharadas de almíbar de limón sobre cada uno de los bizcochos enfriados. Para el glaseado, bata la mantequilla en una batidora hasta que esté suave y cremosa, o hágalo con una batidora eléctrica. Agrega la mitad del azúcar glas y la mitad del queso tierno y vuelve a batir. Agrega el resto del azúcar glas y el queso tierno y la mayor parte del polvo de fresa liofilizado (reservando 1 cucharadita para decorar más tarde) y bate hasta que esté bien combinado.","Pele y pique finamente 200 g de fresas. Coloque uno de los bizcochos en un plato soporte para pasteles y extiéndalo sobre una generosa cantidad de glaseado. Esparcir uniformemente con algunas de las fresas picadas y poner encima el segundo bizcocho. Coloque el resto del glaseado sobre la parte superior y use una espátula para esparcirlo por toda la parte superior y los lados, alisándolo y girándolo a medida que avanza. Corta en rodajas finas cinco o seis fresas de un tamaño similar y luego colócalas alrededor de la base del pastel, con los extremos puntiagudos hacia arriba. Corta la mitad de las fresas restantes por la mitad, dejando el resto entero con sus tallos intactos, y apílalas todas encima del pastel. Esparza sobre la cáscara de limón confitada, el polvo de fresa liofilizado reservado y el caramelo, si lo usa. Es mejor consumirlo en un día, pero se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12986,8962,'es','Pastel de celebración de chocolate y vainilla','Complete el fin de semana de Pascua con este impresionante pastel espectacular. Los bizcochos saben aún mejor después de uno o dos días, por lo que es una excelente receta para seguir adelante.','["225ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para las latas","300 g de harina común","100 g de cacao en polvo","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","400 g de azúcar moreno blando","300ml de leche","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino blanco","100 ml de café fuerte o espresso, enfriado","2 cucharaditas de extracto o pasta de vainilla","3 huevos medianos","400 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","800 g de azúcar glas","2 cucharaditas de extracto o pasta de vainilla","4-5 cucharadas de leche","pastas colorantes para alimentos","flores comestibles, peladillas en colores pastel o huevos de chocolate"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasa tres moldes para pasteles de 20 cm y cúbrelos con papel para hornear. Pesa la harina, el cacao en polvo, el polvo para hornear, el bicarbonato y el azúcar en un tazón grande, agrega una pizca de sal y bate suavemente para combinar. Agite el bol para que los grumos de azúcar suban a la superficie y exprímalos con las yemas de los dedos.","Mide el aceite, la leche, el vinagre, el café y la vainilla en una jarra, luego agrega los huevos y bate para combinar. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos en los secos y revuelva con un batidor hasta que quede suave, asegurándose de que no queden bolsas de harina en el fondo del tazón; la mezcla quedará bastante líquida. Divida la masa de manera uniforme entre los moldes preparados, luego hornee en el estante central del horno (o en el medio y arriba si no caben todos en un estante) durante 25 minutos. Cambie las latas y hornee 5 minutos más.","Verifique que los pasteles estén cocidos insertando una brocheta en el centro de cada una; si queda algo de masa húmeda pegada a la brocheta, regrese las latas al horno por otros 5 minutos y luego verifique nuevamente. Déjelos enfriar en las latas durante 30 minutos, luego coloque los bizcochos sobre rejillas para que se enfríen por completo. Si los prepara con anticipación, envuelva bien los bizcochos enfriados y guárdelos en un recipiente hermético por hasta tres días, o en el congelador por hasta dos meses.","Para la crema de mantequilla, bata la mantequilla con una batidora eléctrica o en una batidora de pie durante unos minutos hasta que quede suave y cremosa. Agrega la mitad del azúcar glas y vuelve a batir para combinar. Agregue el azúcar glas restante, la vainilla y 4 cucharadas de leche y bata nuevamente para combinar, agregando un chorrito más de leche si es necesario para hacer una crema de mantequilla suave y esponjosa. Divida en tres tazones. Agregue unas gotas de pasta colorante para alimentos diferente a cada tazón, luego mezcle bien; nosotros usamos rosa pastel, morado y amarillo.","Coloque las mezclas de crema de mantequilla de colores en tres mangas pasteleras separadas y corte las puntas. Coloque un punto de crema de mantequilla en una base para pasteles o en una tabla y coloque un bizcocho encima para ayudar a mantenerlo en su lugar. Coloque pequeñas gotas de crema de mantequilla morada por toda la parte superior del bizcocho sosteniendo la manga pastelera directamente encima del pastel, aproximadamente a ½ cm de la superficie, y apretando la bolsa mientras tira hacia arriba para crear un pequeño pico.","Coloca el segundo bizcocho encima y luego repite el proceso con la crema de mantequilla rosa. Agregue el tercer bizcocho encima y luego coloque cuidadosamente gotas de crema de mantequilla amarilla sobre la superficie. Decora con flores comestibles, peladillas o mini huevos de chocolate, si lo deseas. Se conserva en lata a temperatura ambiente hasta cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12987,8963,'es','Ventana de pastel de rosas y pistachos (''Window Cake'')','Impresiona a tus amigos con este colorido pastel estilo Battenberg de rosas y pistachos. No solo tiene un sabor delicioso, sino que también luce maravilloso como parte de un té de la tarde.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","175 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos","175 g de harina con levadura","50 g de pistachos molidos en una licuadora","unas cuantas gotas de colorante alimentario verde y rosa","2-4 cucharadas de leche","50 g de almendras molidas","unas gotas de esencia de rosa","100-150 g de mermelada de albaricoque","azúcar glas y azúcar en polvo, para espolvorear","400 g de mazapán","unos pistachos triturados y pétalos de rosa secos, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde cuadrado de 20 cm. Corta una hoja de papel para hornear antiadherente en un rectángulo de 40 x 20 cm. Doble por la mitad, de modo que los extremos cortos se junten, luego bájelo hasta el centro de la lata, asegurándose de que el doblez sobresalga para dividir la lata en dos partes iguales, cada una de las cuales mide 20 x 10 cm. El pergamino debe sobresalir un poco por ambos lados.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en una batidora de pie o en un bol con una batidora eléctrica durante 5 minutos hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega los huevos uno a uno, añadiendo una cucharada de harina con el último huevo para evitar que se cuaje. Incorpora con cuidado el resto de la harina con una cuchara de metal.","Vierta la mitad de la mezcla del pastel en un recipiente aparte. Agregue los pistachos molidos a uno de los tazones junto con el colorante verde y 1-2 cucharadas de leche y mezcle para combinar. La mezcla debe tener una consistencia gomosa. Si queda muy duro añadir un chorrito más de leche. Agregue las almendras molidas al otro tazón de la mezcla junto con 1-2 cucharadas de leche, el colorante rosado y la esencia de rosas (no agregue más de ¼ de cucharadita o el sabor a rosas será abrumador). La mezcla rosada debe tener la misma consistencia que la verde.","Vierte las diferentes mezclas en las diferentes secciones del molde y nivela la parte superior con el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio de cada pastel, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar por completo antes de sacarlo del molde con papel de horno.","Nivele la parte superior de los dos pasteles con un cuchillo de sierra y recorte los bordes para que ambos tengan el mismo tamaño. Corta ambos pasteles por la mitad a lo largo para obtener dos trozos largos de pastel rosa y dos de verde.","Extienda mermelada de albaricoque a lo largo de un trozo verde y uno rosa, luego péguelos. Unte más mermelada de albaricoque encima y en un lado largo de cada uno de los trozos restantes. Coloca la pieza verde encima de la rosa y la rosa encima de la verde, usando nuevamente la mermelada como pegamento. Unte la parte superior del pastel con más mermelada.","Espolvoree azúcar glas sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia y extienda el mazapán hasta formar un rectángulo lo suficientemente grande como para encerrar el pastel (aproximadamente 20 x 35 cm). Use el rodillo para levantar el mazapán, luego retire el azúcar glas y espolvoree el azúcar en polvo sobre la superficie de trabajo. Coloque el mazapán encima del azúcar en polvo con uno de los extremos más largos más cerca de usted.","Coloque con cuidado el pastel, con la mermelada hacia abajo, en el medio del mazapán, a lo largo, y unte los lados y la parte superior con más mermelada. Dobla el mazapán alrededor del pastel, recortando los bordes más largos si es necesario. Junte los bordes del mazapán y alise con un cuchillo. Ordene cada extremo cortando una rodaja fina. Con cuidado, voltee el pastel hacia arriba sobre un plato para servir y decórelo con pistachos y pétalos de rosa, si los usa."]','2026-01-11 12:55:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12988,8964,'es','Brith de bara de chocolate negro, naranja y jengibre','Pruebe una versión diferente del bara brith, el clásico pastel de té galés, elaborado con chocolate, naranja y jengibre. Es perfecto para celebrar el día de San David.','["3 bolsitas de té negro fuerte","300 g de frutos secos variados","mantequilla, para la lata","180 g de azúcar moreno blando","4-5 bolas de tallo de jengibre, picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de chocolate negro, picado","2 cucharaditas de mermelada","2 gotas de esencia de naranja, o utilizar 1 naranja rallada","1 huevo mediano, batido","230 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","1 cucharadita de canela molida","pizca de jengibre molido","50 gramos de chocolate amargo","2 naranjas (opcional)"]','["Coloque las bolsitas de té en una jarra resistente al calor, vierta 350 ml de agua hirviendo del hervidor y déjelas reposar durante 5 minutos. Vierta los frutos secos en un recipiente grande resistente al calor y viértalos sobre el té caliente. Cubra y déjelo en remojo durante la noche.","Caliente el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3. Unte con mantequilla un molde para pan de 2 libras y cúbralo con papel para hornear. Esparce el azúcar sobre la fruta remojada y revuelve para que se disuelva. Agrega el jengibre, el chocolate, la mermelada, la esencia de naranja, el huevo, la harina, una pizca de sal y todas las especias, luego mezcla hasta obtener una masa espesa.","Vierta en el molde y hornee durante 1 hora y 15 minutos. Dejar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe.","Para decorar, derrita el chocolate en ráfagas cortas en el microondas o en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una olla con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Si vas a hacer la cáscara seca, pela las naranjas y córtala en tiras. Seque con un paño de cocina, luego esparza sobre una bandeja para hornear y hornee a 90 ° C o la temperatura más baja de su horno durante 3 horas, revisando cada 45 minutos. Dejar enfriar. Rocíe el chocolate sobre el pan y espolvoree con la piel."]','2026-01-11 12:55:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12989,8965,'es','pastel del tottenham','Disfrute de un nostálgico pastel de vainilla y frambuesa, horneado por primera vez en el distrito homónimo del norte de Londres a finales del siglo XIX y que sigue siendo uno de los favoritos de los británicos.','["250 g de mantequilla con sal, blanda y un poco más para la lata","250 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","4 huevos","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","4 cucharadas de leche","1 limón, rallado","coco rallado o chispitas, para decorar","150 g de frambuesas o arándanos","1 limón exprimido (necesitarás 30 ml)","300 g de azúcar glas","gel colorante alimentario rosa (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pastel de 20 x 30 cm y cubrir con papel para hornear. Vierta la mantequilla, el azúcar y la vainilla en un tazón grande y bata con un batidor eléctrico durante 4 a 5 minutos hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. O haga esto en una batidora de pie. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien entre cada adición. Incorpora la harina, el polvo para hornear, la leche y la ralladura de limón con una espátula de goma hasta que quede suave.","Vierta la masa en el molde preparado y nivele la parte superior con el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Si no está listo, revíselo cada 5 minutos para asegurarse de que no se hornee demasiado. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos en el molde, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Coloque las frambuesas o los arándanos en un tazón pequeño resistente al calor junto con el jugo de limón. Cocine en el microondas durante 1 minuto, revolviendo a la mitad, hasta que se ablanden. O haga esto en una sartén pequeña a fuego lento. Rompa las bayas con un tenedor para liberar el jugo, luego presione las bayas trituradas a través de un colador y colóquelas en un tazón pequeño para recoger el jugo sin semillas.","Vierta el azúcar glas en un tazón grande y vierta sobre el jugo de bayas. Batir bien hasta obtener un glaseado espeso pero que se pueda untar; si está demasiado espeso, agregue 1 cucharadita de agua a la vez hasta alcanzar la consistencia deseada. Agrega una gota de colorante alimentario en gel rosa para obtener un color más brillante, si lo deseas. Extienda el glaseado sobre el pastel enfriado, luego esparza inmediatamente sobre el coco o las chispas. Deje reposar durante 30 minutos, luego corte y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:55:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12990,8966,'es','pastel de unicornio','Detén a la gente en seco con un impresionante pastel de unicornio. Con un bizcocho ligero y crema de mantequilla con caramelo salado, queda fabuloso y también tiene un sabor divino.','["300 g de fondant blanco","polvo de brillo dorado comestible","chispitas multicolores, para decorar (opcional)","10 g de fondant negro","325 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada, más un poco más para la lata","325 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","6 huevos","325 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","4 cucharadas de leche","450 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","900 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","200 g de caramelo salado (opcional)","Colorantes alimentarios en gel morado, rosa y azul."]','["Comienza haciendo el cuerno y las orejas del unicornio; deberán secarse completamente antes de usarlos. Enrolle 225 g de fondant blanco hasta darle forma de salchicha alargada, con un extremo ligeramente más grueso que el otro. Comenzando por el extremo más grueso, gire la salchicha formando un rollo apretado hasta que tenga forma de cuerno. Pellizque el extremo pequeño hacia arriba hasta formar una punta puntiaguda. A continuación, divide el fondant blanco restante en dos trozos. Extienda cada uno hasta formar un óvalo rugoso sobre una hoja de papel para hornear, luego pellizque el extremo superior de cada óvalo hacia arriba para formar una punta. Reserva las orejas con el cuerno y déjalas secar mientras haces el bizcocho.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla la base de tres moldes para sándwich de 20 cm y forrar con papel de horno. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y la vainilla en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Tamizar la harina, la levadura en polvo y una pizca de sal e incorporar con una cuchara grande de metal. Agregue suficiente leche para crear una consistencia suave.","Divida la masa entre los moldes preparados y alise la parte superior con una espátula. Hornee en el estante medio del horno durante 25 a 30 minutos, o hasta que estén dorados y firmes al tacto. Deje enfriar un poco en las latas, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras el pastel se enfría, prepara la crema de mantequilla. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar glas y la vainilla hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos, batiendo con 4-6 cucharadas de agua caliente para aflojar la mezcla si es necesario.","Coloque uno de los bizcochos enfriados sobre una tabla para pasteles o sobre un soporte y extienda un poco de crema de mantequilla encima con una espátula. Extienda suavemente sobre la mitad del caramelo salado, si lo usa, luego emparéjelo con otro bizcocho. Repita el proceso con un poco más de crema de mantequilla, el caramelo salado restante (si lo usa) y el tercer bizcocho. Unte el exterior del pastel con una fina capa de crema de mantequilla; no es necesario que quede limpio. Enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Extienda una capa espesa y uniforme de crema de mantequilla sobre el pastel frío con una espátula. Divida la crema de mantequilla restante en tres tazones y coloree cada uno de manera diferente con el colorante alimentario en gel. Los nuestros eran rosa claro, morado y rosa oscuro.","Ponga un poco de polvo de brillo dorado en un bol, agregue una gota de agua y revuelva para hacer una pasta dorada. Con un pincel pequeño, pinta de dorado el cuerno de unicornio con la pasta, así como el interior de las orejas, si lo deseas. Coloca con cuidado el cuerno dorado en el medio del pastel helado, con las orejas a cada lado.","Coloca tres mangas pasteleras con tres boquillas diferentes (nosotros usamos una boquilla redonda y dos boquillas en forma de estrella de diferentes tamaños) y rellena cada una con un color diferente de crema de mantequilla. Coloca cada color alrededor de las orejas y el cuerno y por toda la parte superior del pastel, bajando por un lado y sobre el borde del frente: esta es la melena del unicornio. Decora con algunas chispas, si las usas.","Divida el fondant negro en dos trozos y enrolle cada uno hasta darle forma de salchicha fina. Forme un arco con cada uno y luego presione sobre el frente del pastel para hacer los ojos. Si lo deseas, curva los bordes exteriores de los ojos hacia arriba para crear pestañas. Cortar en rodajas y servir. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12991,3952,'es','Pasteles de hadas de chocolate','Haga sonreír a familiares y amigos con sencillos pasteles de hadas de chocolate: tienen un delicioso bizcocho ligero y un glaseado mantecoso.','["100 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada","2 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","80 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de leche","75 g de mantequilla blanda","150 g de azúcar glas","40 g de cacao en polvo","2-3 cucharadas de leche"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar un molde para panecillos de 12 agujeros con fundas de papel. Ponga el azúcar y la mantequilla en un bol y bata hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos. Incorpora poco a poco los huevos y la vainilla hasta que se combinen.","Añade la harina, el cacao en polvo y el polvo para hornear al bol y mezcla hasta formar una masa suave. Doble la leche para aflojarla. Divida la mezcla entre las cajas usando una cuchara. Hornee durante 20 minutos, o hasta que al introducir un palito en el centro de uno de los pasteles de la fila del medio, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 5 a 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras los pasteles se enfrían, prepara el glaseado. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar glas y el cacao en polvo en un bol durante 5 a 10 minutos, hasta obtener una consistencia suave y cremosa. Agregue la leche para aflojar si es necesario. Coloque o extienda sobre los cupcakes enfriados."]','2026-01-11 12:55:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12992,8967,'es','pastel de miel judío','Este sencillo pastel de miel, también conocido como "lekach", es un dulce imprescindible para celebrar el Año Nuevo judío o Rosh Hashaná. Es mejor prepararlo con unos días de anticipación, ya que el sabor y la textura mejoran a medida que madura.','["100 ml de aceite de girasol","175 g de almíbar dorado","50 g de miel líquida","50 g de azúcar moreno oscuro blando","150 ml de té fuerte, enfriado","2 huevos grandes, batidos","225 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de canela","1 cucharadita de jengibre","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","almendras en hojuelas, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar la base y los lados de un molde para hornear cuadrado de 20 cm. Calentar el aceite, el almíbar dorado, la miel y el azúcar en una cacerola pequeña para disolver el azúcar. Revuelva para combinar, luego deje enfriar. Agrega el té y los huevos batidos.","Batir ligeramente la harina, el polvo para hornear, las especias y una pizca de sal en un tazón grande para combinar. Haga un hueco en los ingredientes secos y mezcle los ingredientes húmedos, usando un batidor o una cuchara de madera, hasta que estén combinados y sin grumos.","Vierte la masa en el molde forrado y espolvorea con las almendras, si quieres. Hornee durante 50-55 minutos, hasta que el pastel rebote cuando se presiona suavemente y al insertar un pincho en el medio, éste salga limpio. No abras el horno durante los primeros 45 minutos de horneado.","Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde sobre una rejilla. Envuélvalo bien y consérvelo durante tres o cuatro días antes de comerlo, para que mejore el sabor. Cortar en nueve cuadrados para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12993,8968,'es','Pastel de coco nevado','Haz que los niños te ayuden a hacer este pastel de coco nevado. Decora con virutas de coco, ‘bolas de nieve’ y lo que quieras','["185 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","185 g de leche de coco, batida","250 g de azúcar en polvo","250 g de harina con levadura","3 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de coco (opcional)","25 g de coco rallado","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","250 g de azúcar glas","2 cucharadas de leche de coco","½ cucharadita de extracto de coco (opcional)","25 g de chips de coco o coco rallado","trufas de chocolate blanco o chispas blancas grandes, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pan de 900 g (el nuestro mide 10 x 21 x 5 cm) y forrar la base con una tira larga de papel para hornear que sobresalga por los lados.","Coloque la mantequilla, la leche de coco, el azúcar, la harina, los huevos, el extracto de coco (si se usa) y el coco rallado en un tazón grande y bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que se combinen. Vierta en el molde preparado y nivele la parte superior con una espátula o el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee durante 55 minutos a 1 hora, o hasta que el pastel haya subido y esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Si queda algo de la mezcla de pastel húmeda pegada a la brocheta, hornee por otros 5 a 10 minutos y luego verifique nuevamente. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego levante el pastel y colóquelo sobre una rejilla, usando el pergamino como ayuda. Dejar enfriar por completo. El bizcocho enfriado se mantendrá en el congelador, bien envuelto, hasta por dos meses.","Para hacer el glaseado, bata la mantequilla, el azúcar, la leche de coco y el extracto de coco, si lo usa, en un bol hasta que quede suave y cremoso. Extienda sobre la parte superior del pastel con una espátula o el dorso de una cuchara, luego esparza sobre una generosa capa de chips de coco. Decora con “bolas de nieve” de trufa de chocolate blanco o con chispas blancas grandes, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12994,8969,'es','Pan de jengibre y miel','Prepara nuestro bizcocho multifuncional de jengibre y miel. Disfrútelo con yogur y fruta guisada para un brunch festivo, o pruébelo como delicia a la hora del té untado con mantequilla.','["100 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para la lata","100 g de miel","125 g de azúcar demerara moreno oscuro","4 cucharadas de leche","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina con levadura","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","una pizca grande de nuez moscada rallada","una pizca grande de clavo molido","una pizca grande de pimienta de Jamaica molida","1 huevo batido"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y mantequilla y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g. Poner la miel, la mantequilla y el azúcar en una cacerola y calentar a fuego lento, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y el azúcar se disuelva. Retirar del fuego y verter la leche y la vainilla, luego dejar enfriar.","Vierte la harina en un bol con la levadura en polvo, las especias y una pizca de sal. Agregue el huevo, luego incorpore suavemente junto con la mezcla de mantequilla derretida. Una vez combinados, viértalos en el molde preparado, colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 40 minutos hasta que estén elásticos al tacto y al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos en la lata, luego colóquelo en una rejilla para enfriar y déjelo enfriar por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12995,6867,'es','Pastel asado de calabaza con miel y nueces','Sorprenda a sus invitados con este impresionante pastel asado de calabaza con miel y nueces. Es un centro de mesa vegetariano que agradará a la multitud para una celebración, perfecto para Navidad.','["300 g de nueces mixtas (las nueces de Brasil, las pecanas, las avellanas, las nueces y las almendras funcionan bien)","1 zanahoria grande, rallada","1 rama de apio, rallado","1 cebolla rallada","400-500 g (½ mediana) de calabaza, pelada y cortada por la mitad, justo encima del extremo del bulbo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un extra para la lata","3 cucharadas de miel o jarabe de arce","180g de castañas cocidas al vacío","50 g de mantequilla de almendras, anacardos o cacahuete","manojo pequeño de salvia, hojas recogidas"]','["Coloque las nueces mezcladas en el tazón de un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que estén finamente picadas, luego viértalas en un tazón. Alternativamente, córtelo en trozos grandes con un cuchillo. Pon en una sartén la zanahoria, el apio y la cebolla. Corte la mitad larga y delgada de la calabaza por la mitad a lo largo o en cuartos (dependiendo de su ancho) y córtela en rodajas largas y delgadas con un cuchillo afilado o una mandolina (reserve la mitad más gruesa del bulbo de la calabaza para otra receta).","Rocíe el aceite sobre las verduras en la sartén y luego fríalas durante 15 a 20 minutos a fuego medio-bajo hasta que estén doradas y suaves. Incorpora la mezcla a las nueces picadas y agrega 2 cucharadas de miel, las castañas y la mantequilla de nueces. Revuelva todo y luego sazone.","Engrase un molde desmontable de 20 cm y cubra la base con papel para hornear. Coloque de 3 a 5 hojas de salvia en la lata, boca abajo. Pica finamente el resto de las hojas de salvia y agrégalas a la mezcla de nueces. Coloque algunas de las rodajas de calabaza en la base de la lata, colocándolas cuidadosamente de modo que las capas se superpongan ligeramente para formar un patrón en espiral. Rocíe sobre ½ cucharada de la miel restante. Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de nueces, presionándola firmemente en la lata con el dorso de una cuchara, luego cubra con otra capa de calabaza, esta vez en una sola capa en lugar de superponerla; esto hará que sea más fácil de cortar más tarde. Rocíe sobre el resto de la miel. Vierta el resto de la mezcla de nueces y presiónela firmemente con el dorso de una cuchara. La calabaza restante se conservará en el refrigerador hasta por tres días para usarla en tartas y quiches, o para asarla y preparar ensaladas.","Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Cubra el molde con papel de aluminio y ase durante 30 minutos, luego destape y ase durante otros 20 minutos hasta que la parte superior esté dorada y crujiente. Déjelo reposar durante 15 minutos, luego inviértalo en un plato y córtelo en gajos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12996,7991,'es','Tarta de queso arcoiris','Nuestro espectacular pastel de queso arcoíris seguramente alegrará cualquier fiesta. Este postre fácil tiene una deliciosa base de galleta y capas vibrantes y coloridas.','["170 g de mantequilla","140 g de galletas Oreo (o similar) sin nata","140 g de galletas digestivas, trituradas hasta obtener migajas finas","600 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa (nosotros usamos Philadelphia)","170 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharadas de harina común","1 ½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos grandes","200 g de crema agria","colorantes alimentarios en gel","crema doble, batida para decorar (opcional)"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forre la base de un molde desmontable de 20 cm colocando un trozo cuadrado de papel pergamino o papel de aluminio encima de la base del molde y luego recortando el costado para que el papel o papel de aluminio quede atrapado y el exceso sobresalga del fondo.","Para la base, derrita 85 g de mantequilla en una sartén mediana. Agregue las migas de galleta más oscuras para que la mezcla esté uniformemente húmeda. Presione la mezcla en el fondo de la sartén. Derrita la mantequilla restante y agregue las migajas digestivas como antes. Hacer una capa encima de la primera, apisonar todo firmemente y hornear por 10 minutos. Dejar enfriar mientras se prepara el relleno.","Aumentar la temperatura del horno a ventilador 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Batir el queso tierno con el azúcar en polvo, la harina común, una pizca de sal y el extracto de vainilla. Batir los huevos y la crema agria, pero no batir demasiado. La masa debe quedar suave y muy espesa. Divida la masa en partes iguales entre 6 tazones y coloree cada uno con morado, azul, verde, amarillo, naranja y rojo.","Unte los lados del molde con mantequilla derretida y colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear. Vierta el relleno, comenzando con rojo y luego naranja, amarillo, etc. La mezcla debe ser lo suficientemente espesa como para poder verter y esparcir cada capa con cuidado sobre la otra. Hornee por 10 minutos.","Reduzca la temperatura del horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼ y hornee durante 35-40 minutos más. Si agitas suavemente la lata, el relleno debe temblar muy levemente en el centro, si se ve líquido, cocina un poco más y revisa nuevamente. Apagar el horno y dejar enfriar con la puerta ligeramente entreabierta. Enfría la tarta de queso enfriada hasta que quieras servirla. Decora justo antes de servir.","Para servir batir la nata hasta que esté lo suficientemente espesa como para montarla. Vierta la crema y coloque gotas o rosetas encima de la tarta de queso. Para las rosetas de arcoíris, con un pincel, haga algunas franjas de color de alimentos del arcoíris en el interior de una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla antes de verter la crema."]','2026-01-11 12:55:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12997,8971,'es','Pastel de cumpleaños vegano','Hornee una versión vegetal de un pastel de chocolate dulce para una fiesta de cumpleaños. Todos pueden disfrutarlo, incluidos los huéspedes que tienen intolerancia a los lácteos o alergias al huevo.','["320ml de aceite de girasol, más un extra para las latas","450 ml de leche de soja, almendras o coco (la variedad para verter, no una lata)","1 cucharada de vinagre de manzana","500 g de azúcar mascabado light","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla o pasta de vainilla","260 g de yogur natural de soja o coco","450 g de harina con levadura","160 g de cacao en polvo","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","200 g de chocolate negro sin lácteos","400 g de crema vegana a temperatura ambiente","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla o pasta de vainilla","800 g de azúcar glas tamizada","chispas de colores (asegúrate de que sean aptas para veganos)"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasa tres moldes para pasteles redondos de 20 cm y cubre las bases y los lados con papel para hornear (si no tienes tres moldes, cocina la masa en tandas). Batir la leche y el vinagre en una jarra; la leche debe cuajar un poco. Dejar de lado.","Batir el azúcar, el aceite y el extracto de vainilla en un bol, luego agregar el yogur, asegurándose de deshacer los grumos de azúcar. Vierta la leche agria y mezcle bien.","Tamiza la harina, el cacao en polvo, el polvo para hornear, el bicarbonato de sodio y ½ cucharadita de sal en un recipiente aparte y revuelve bien para combinar. Incorpora gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos a los secos hasta obtener una masa suave, pero ten cuidado de no mezclar demasiado.","Divida la masa uniformemente entre los moldes y hornee durante 25-30 minutos, hasta que esté bien leudada y elástica, y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, ésta salga casi limpia. Unas cuantas migas pegajosas están bien, pero la mezcla no debe quedar húmeda.","Deje que los pasteles se enfríen en sus moldes durante 20 minutos, luego con cuidado colóquelos sobre una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo. Serán delicados, así que sea cuidadoso (un levantador de pasteles es útil). Las esponjas se mantendrán cubiertas a temperatura ambiente hasta por dos días.","Para la crema de mantequilla vegana, derrita el chocolate en el microondas o en un recipiente colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Dejar enfriar. Batir la crema para untar y la vainilla a alta velocidad en una batidora de pie durante unos minutos hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Agrega el azúcar glas gradualmente, batiendo lentamente al principio, luego aumenta la velocidad al máximo hasta que la mezcla esté ligera y cremosa. Vierta el chocolate enfriado y combine bien. Enfríe la crema de mantequilla durante al menos 30 minutos antes de usarla.","Para armar el pastel, primero use un cuchillo afilado para recortar la parte superior de los bizcochos y nivelarlos. Coloque uno de los bizcochos en un plato para servir, en un soporte para pasteles o en un tambor para pasteles redondo de 20 cm (el uso de un tambor para pasteles hace que sea más fácil congelar el pastel de manera ordenada y moverlo a un soporte o plato más tarde). Extienda sobre una capa de crema de mantequilla, usando una espátula para obtener un acabado uniforme y limpio. Cubra con el segundo bizcocho y extiéndalo sobre otra capa de crema de mantequilla.","Cubra con el último bizcocho boca abajo, de modo que la parte inferior del pastel se convierta en la parte superior (esto ayudará a mantener el glaseado limpio y relativamente libre de migas). Unte los lados del pastel con crema de mantequilla. Mantenga firme el bizcocho superior con la palma si necesita estabilizar el pastel. Una vez que tengas los lados cubiertos lo más prolijamente posible, cubre la parte superior con una fina capa de crema de mantequilla. Usa tu espátula para limpiar la parte superior y los lados. Si tiene un raspador lateral, úselo para barrer los lados y la parte superior para afilar el recubrimiento. (Esta es una capa de migas que atrapa las migajas para darle una base limpia y firme). Coloque el pastel en el refrigerador para que se endurezca y enfríe durante 1 a 2 horas.","Para terminar, cubre los lados y la parte superior del pastel de la misma manera, usando la mayor parte de la crema de mantequilla restante. Presione las chispas contra el fondo del pastel, aproximadamente entre un cuarto y un tercio de su altura. Puede vestir la parte superior del pastel con un círculo de chispas o, para darle un acabado más elegante, hacer pequeños remolinos alrededor del borde superior del pastel usando la crema de mantequilla restante raspada en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella abierta grande, luego terminar con más chispas.","Mantenga el bizcocho en el frigorífico para que se mantenga firme y luego retírelo 1 hora antes de servir. Se mantendrá tapado en el refrigerador hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12998,8972,'es','Pastel de capas de cumpleaños de chocolate y frambuesa','¿Quién podría resistirse a nuestra tarta de chocolate y frambuesa? Como un bizcocho Victoria, pero mejor: prueba las económicas frambuesas congeladas para la crema.','["225ml de aceite de girasol, más un extra para las latas","250 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos grandes","225ml de leche","250 g de harina con levadura","4 cucharadas de cacao","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","150 g de mermelada de frambuesa","100 g de frambuesas congeladas y descongeladas","300ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar dos moldes desmontables redondos de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Batir el aceite, el azúcar, los huevos y la leche en un bol hasta que quede suave. Tamice la harina, el cacao y el bicarbonato en otro tazón grande, luego mezcle gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos.","Divida la mezcla entre los moldes y hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que los pasteles hayan subido y salten cuando se presionen. Deje enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para la capa de frambuesa, mezcle la mermelada y las frambuesas descongeladas. Una vez que los pasteles estén fríos, bata la crema con el azúcar hasta obtener picos suaves, luego incorpore suavemente la mitad de la mezcla de frambuesa a la crema para crear un efecto dominó.","Vierta la mayor parte de la mezcla de frambuesa reservada sobre uno de los pasteles y luego agregue la mitad de la crema. Alise con una espátula y luego coloque el otro bizcocho encima. Agite la crema restante y agite lo último de la mezcla de frambuesa. Se conservará en el frigorífico dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(12999,8973,'es','Pastel de cebra arcoiris','Celebre nuestro 30 cumpleaños con nosotros, o su ocasión especial, con esta impresionante esponja arcoíris. Cubierto con crema de mantequilla y cubierto con chispas de colores, es un pastel que tiene el factor sorpresa.','["375 g de mantequilla salada, ablandada, más un poco más para la lata","375 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","6 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","375 g de harina con levadura","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","150ml de leche","colorante alimentario azul y rosa (ver consejo a continuación)","chispitas, para decorar","250 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","400 g de azúcar glas tamizada","vaina de vainilla, semillas raspadas","100 g de queso crema entero"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar tres moldes para sándwich de fondo suelto de 20 cm con papel para hornear.","Para hacer el bizcocho, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar en una batidora de pie o con un batidor eléctrico durante 5 a 8 minutos o hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Incorpora los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Incorpora la harina, el polvo para hornear y la leche para aflojar. Divida la mezcla entre tres tazones para mezclar, pesando para mayor precisión si lo desea. Colorea una de las masas de azul y otra de rosa, comenzando con un poco de color y luego agregando más para un acabado más profundo. Deje uno de los tazones de masa sin colorear.","Prepara los tres moldes para pastel y los tazones de masa frente a ti. Vierta una cucharada colmada de masa azul en el centro del primer molde, luego rosa en el segundo y simple en el tercero. Trabajando rápido para que no se esparza demasiado, agrega otra cucharada de masa de diferente color encima de cada uno. No esperes a que la masa se asiente o se extienda, simplemente sigue alternando los colores hasta que se acabe. El peso de cada capa hará que la masa se extienda a medida que avanza, así que golpee y agite muy suavemente los moldes para pastel para nivelar la mezcla, luego hornee en el centro del horno durante 25 a 30 minutos o hasta que esté firme al tacto. Colóquelo boca abajo sobre rejillas de alambre inmediatamente y luego déjelo enfriar por completo.","Para el glaseado, ponga la mantequilla, el azúcar glas y las semillas de vainilla en una batidora de pie equipada con el accesorio de paleta o colóquela en un bol y use una batidora eléctrica. Batir durante 5 minutos o hasta que quede esponjoso y aireado. Agrega el queso crema y bate brevemente hasta que esté combinado.","Coloque uno de los pasteles en un soporte para pasteles o en un plato para servir y esparza 2 cucharadas de crema de mantequilla encima, luego repita con los otros bizcochos. Extienda una capa suave de glaseado sobre la parte superior y los lados del pastel, usando una espátula grande, dejando algunas zonas ligeramente menos heladas para un acabado \"desnudo\". Cubra con chispas y velas, si lo desea. Se conservará en una lata hermética durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13000,8974,'es','Pastel de ruibarbo y flor de saúco','Aprovecha al máximo el vibrante ruibarbo rosa con un pastel que combina sus deliciosos sabores ácidos y dulce cordial de flor de saúco: ¡una pieza central impresionante!','["400 g de ruibarbo recortado y cortado en rodajas de 4 a 5 cm","110 g de azúcar en polvo","½ limón, rallado y en jugo","2 cucharadas de cordial de flor de saúco","115 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para las latas","95 g de almendras enteras con piel (o utilice almendras blanqueadas o molidas)","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 limón, rallado","3 huevos, 2 enteros y 1 solo clara","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharada de cordial de flor de saúco, más un poco más para cepillar","100 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","130 g de yogur natural desnatado","flores de saúco, enjuagadas y secas, para decorar (o pétalos de rosa, lila, geranio o peonía)","300ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de cordial de flor de saúco","100 g de yogur natural desnatado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Untar con mantequilla los lados de dos moldes para pasteles redondos de 20 cm y forrar las bases con papel para hornear.","Para asar el ruibarbo, forre una bandeja para hornear de lados altos con papel para hornear, agregue el ruibarbo y luego cubra con el azúcar, el jugo de limón, la ralladura y el cordial. Cubra con papel aluminio y ase en el horno durante 25 minutos hasta que esté suave. Retirar del horno y reducir la temperatura a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Colar el ruibarbo del licor de caza furtiva, reservando el almíbar.","Vierta las almendras en el tazón de un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que estén molidas (si usa almendras enteras), pero aún conservando algo de textura.","Coloque la mantequilla en el tazón de una batidora de pie equipada con un accesorio para batir (o use un batidor eléctrico) y bata a velocidad media durante 2 minutos, luego, con una espátula de goma, raspe la mantequilla de los lados del tazón, luego agregue el azúcar y la ralladura de limón. Aumente ligeramente la velocidad de la batidora y continúe batiendo durante 5 minutos hasta que esté suave y esponjosa. Baje ligeramente la velocidad de la batidora, luego agregue los huevos, la clara de huevo, el extracto de vainilla y el cordial y mezcle.","Combina la harina, las almendras, el polvo para hornear, el bicarbonato de sodio y una pizca de sal en un bol. Raspe la mezcla de mantequilla de los lados del tazón de la batidora, gire la batidora a velocidad baja (para que solo se revuelva) luego agregue la mezcla de harina y almendras en cuatro tandas, alternando con cucharadas de yogur y terminando con una tanda de la mezcla de harina y almendras. Mezcle hasta que esté combinado, sin que queden rayas, luego agregue la mitad del ruibarbo asado y 1 cucharada de su almíbar a la masa e incorpórelo.","Divida la masa uniformemente entre los moldes para pastel y hornee en el horno durante 25-30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en cada pastel, éste salga limpio. Retirar los bizcochos del horno, dejar enfriar completamente en los moldes sobre una rejilla y luego desmoldar con cuidado.","Para el relleno, bata la crema hasta obtener picos suaves en un tazón y agregue las tres cuartas partes del ruibarbo asado restante, junto con el cordial de flor de saúco y el yogur.","Coloque uno de los pasteles con el lado plano hacia abajo sobre un soporte para pasteles o un plato, pínchelo por todas partes con una brocheta y use una brocha de repostería para untar el pastel con un poco de cordial de flor de saúco. Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de crema, cubra con el otro pastel y unte ese pastel con cordial también. Vierta sobre la mezcla de crema restante, cubra con el ruibarbo restante y vierta un poco del almíbar para escalfar. Adorne con flores de saúco o flores de temporada."]','2026-01-11 12:55:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13001,8975,'es','Pastel triple de capas de chocolate y mantequilla de maní','Haz un pastel espectacular esta Pascua. Cubra el bizcocho de chocolate con glaseado de mantequilla de maní, ganache, corteza de pretzel y huevos de chocolate para obtener un postre divino.','["225 ml de aceite de colza y más para las latas","250 g de harina con levadura","4 cucharadas de cacao","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","225 g de azúcar en polvo","3 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","3 huevos grandes, batidos","225ml de leche","200 g de chocolate amargo, picado","2 cucharadas de chispas de chocolate","un puñado de trozos pequeños de pretzel","2 cucharadas de trozos de panal","65 g de chocolate negro","250 g de mantequilla blanda con sal","500 g de azúcar glas","45 g de mantequilla de maní suave","1-2 cucharadas de cacao","200ml de nata doble","100 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","una mezcla de huevos de chocolate de diferentes tamaños, algunos huecos, otros rellenos, brillo dorado, palomitas de caramelo y pretzels"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar la base de tres moldes para sándwich de 19 cm. Mezclar en un bol la harina, el cacao, el bicarbonato y el azúcar. Hacer un hueco en el centro y agregar el almíbar, los huevos, el aceite y la leche con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave.","Divida la mezcla entre los moldes y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que los pasteles hayan subido y estén firmes al tacto. Deje enfriar en las latas durante 10 minutos antes de colocarlos sobre una rejilla para enfriar y enfriar por completo. En esta etapa se pueden congelar, bien envueltos, hasta por ocho semanas.","Haz la corteza mientras el pastel se enfría. Derrita el chocolate en ráfagas cortas en el microondas, revolviendo cada 20 segundos, hasta que quede suave. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino y alise con una espátula para formar una capa fina, de aproximadamente 35 x 20 cm. Espolvoree sobre las chispas de chocolate junto con los trozos de pretzel y el panal, luego enfríe hasta que esté sólido. Retire la corteza del refrigerador y déjela por un minuto para que alcance la temperatura ambiente antes de usar un cuchillo afilado para cortarla en pedazos (si está frío en el refrigerador, el chocolate se romperá en lugar de cortarse). Enfríe nuevamente hasta que esté listo para decorar el pastel.","Para hacer el glaseado, derretir el chocolate en el microondas, revolviendo entre golpes cortos, luego dejar enfriar un poco. Mientras tanto, bata la mantequilla, el azúcar glas y 1 cucharada de agua hirviendo con una batidora eléctrica o una batidora de pie, lentamente al principio, luego aumente la velocidad y bata hasta obtener un glaseado pálido y esponjoso. Vierta un tercio de la mezcla en un recipiente aparte y agregue la mantequilla de maní. Batir el chocolate derretido con el resto del glaseado, luego agregar el cacao si quieres un glaseado más oscuro y de color chocolate.","Sandwich los tres pasteles junto con el glaseado de mantequilla de maní. Use la mitad del glaseado de chocolate para cubrir los lados y la parte superior del pastel y rellene los bordes entre las capas, raspando el exceso. Enfriar durante 20 minutos. Esto se llama capa de miga, lo que le permite obtener un acabado realmente suave cuando se trata del glaseado final.","Extienda el glaseado de chocolate restante sobre el pastel ligeramente frío, alisando los lados y la parte superior para obtener un acabado impecable. Enfríe nuevamente durante 20 minutos.","Para hacer la ganache, calienta la nata en una cacerola pequeña hasta que esté humeante. Vierta el chocolate amargo en un bol y luego viértalo sobre la crema. Mezclar bien hasta que quede suave y brillante. Pasar a una manga pastelera y dejar enfriar unos minutos a temperatura ambiente.","Coloca la ganache encima del pastel, empujándola sobre el borde y permitiendo que gotee suavemente. Haga esto en todo el pastel y luego rellene el centro con más ganache. Alise la parte superior con un cuchillo. Enfríe durante 1 hora para que se endurezca la ganache.","Presiona los fragmentos de corteza en el pastel, sobresaliendo. Agrega muchos huevos de chocolate, palomitas de maíz y pretzels dentro y alrededor de los fragmentos. Cortar en rodajas para servir. Se conservará hasta por tres días en un lugar fresco en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:55:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13002,8976,'es','pastel de pimm','Sí, has leído bien, Pimm está en forma de tarta. La suave crema de mantequilla de fresa y limón junto con la esencia de pepino hacen de este el mejor sabor del verano.','["1 pepino","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","300 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","400 g de harina con levadura","1 ½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","500 g de azúcar glas","80 g de fresas peladas","200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","400 g de azúcar glas","jugo y ralladura de 1 limón","100 g de fresas, peladas y cortadas en rodajas más 3 fresas cortadas por la mitad (con los tallos)","3 cucharadas de Pimm''s","¼ de pepino, rebanado"]','["Pon las fresas cortadas en rodajas y partidas por la mitad para el relleno y la decoración en un bol pequeño y vierte sobre los Pimm''s. Dejar en remojo durante al menos una hora o toda la noche. Caliente el horno a 190 ° C / 170 ° C con ventilador / gas 5. Forre moldes para sándwich de 3 x 20 cm con papel para hornear y engrase con mantequilla.","Corta el pepino entero por la mitad a lo largo y con una cucharadita raspa y desecha las semillas. Pica el resto del pepino en trozos grandes y hazlo puré en una licuadora con el jugo de limón.","En un tazón grande y con batidoras eléctricas, bata la mantequilla blanda con el azúcar hasta que esté pálida y ligera. Continúe batiendo mientras agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo entre adiciones. Una vez añadidos todos los huevos vierte el puré de pepino, la ralladura de limón y el extracto de vainilla. No te preocupes si la mezcla se parte; se volverá a unir cuando agregues la harina.","Incorpora la harina y la levadura en polvo y bate una vez más brevemente hasta que no queden grumos de harina y luego divide la mezcla entre las tres latas. Hornee en el horno durante 30-35 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio de los pasteles, éste salga limpio. Sacar los bizcochos del horno y dejar enfriar en sus moldes durante cinco minutos y luego desmoldar sobre rejillas para que se enfríen por completo.","Mientras los pasteles se cocinan y enfrían, prepare las cremas de mantequilla. Para hacer la crema de mantequilla de fresa, triture las fresas en un tazón pequeño con un tenedor hasta que queden blandas. En un tazón más grande, bata la mantequilla y la mitad del azúcar glas hasta que quede suave, luego agregue el puré de fresas seguido del azúcar glas restante. Batir hasta que quede suave y de color rosa pálido y colocar en el refrigerador hasta que sea necesario. Repite el proceso con la crema de mantequilla de limón.","Una vez que los pasteles estén completamente fríos, coloque uno de los pasteles en un plato giratorio y agregue aproximadamente un tercio de la crema de mantequilla de limón, extiéndalo uniformemente sobre la superficie y luego cubra con la mitad de las rodajas de fresa remojadas. Luego, unta un tercio de la crema de mantequilla de fresa sobre otro de los pasteles y cubre con las rodajas de fresa restantes. Apila con cuidado las dos capas rellenas con el pastel final encima.","Transfiera las cremas de mantequilla restantes a mangas pasteleras desechables y corte los extremos. Coloca la crema de mantequilla de fresa en aros alrededor del exterior del pastel, comenzando por la base. Una vez que llegue a las tres cuartas partes de la altura, cambie a la crema de mantequilla de limón y continúe colocando la parte superior del pastel. Alise la parte superior con una espátula y luego alise los lados con una espátula grande o, mejor aún, con una espátula de repostería. Utilice movimientos largos y amplios y gire suavemente el plato giratorio para obtener un acabado suave pero con un sutil efecto degradado donde se unen los dos colores. Retire el exceso de glaseado y póngalo en un tazón.","Para terminar, cubre con las mitades de fresa remojadas restantes y las rodajas de pepino."]','2026-01-11 12:55:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13003,8977,'es','Pastel de fiesta de verano','Este generoso pastel es lo suficientemente grande como para alimentar a una multitud y es una combinación de todos nuestros ingredientes favoritos del verano: fresas, bizcocho Victoria, merengues, crema fresca, chocolate blanco y galletas de mantequilla con mantequilla.','["300 g de mantequilla salada, a temperatura ambiente","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla (o las semillas de 2 vainas de vainilla con 2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla)","6 huevos medianos, ligeramente batidos","300 g de harina con levadura","900ml de nata doble","1 cucharada colmada de azúcar glas","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","300g de mermelada de fresa casera o de buena calidad (ver consejo)","1 kg de fresas, cortadas en rodajas iguales para obtener capas limpias (guarde 8 para decorar)","paquete de pan de oro (opcional)","besos de merengue, corteza de chocolate y fresas bañadas en chocolate (ver recetas en ''combina bien'')","galletas de mantequilla (ver receta o usar galletas compradas en la tienda)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar dos moldes de 23 cm con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y la vainilla en una batidora de mesa (o con una batidora de mano o una cuchara de madera) hasta que la mezcla esté muy ligera, pálida y esponjosa.","Incorpora gradualmente los huevos batidos, raspando los lados del tazón después de cada adición, hasta que estén completamente combinados. Si usa una batidora, a fuego lento, agregue la harina hasta que esté combinada; no bata demasiado, ya que puede hacer que el bizcocho se vuelva pesado. Si no estás usando una batidora, incorpora la harina con una cuchara grande de metal.","Divide la mezcla entre los moldes y hornea por 30 minutos o hasta que los bizcochos se despeguen de los lados y al insertar una brocheta en el centro salga limpio. Retirar y enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos. Desmoldar sobre una rejilla y retirar el pergamino para que escape el vapor y se enfríen los bizcochos. Mientras tanto, haz las decoraciones.","Ahora arma tu pastel. Antes de dividir los bizcochos, recorte la parte superior abovedada de cada pastel con un cuchillo para pan. Use el mismo cuchillo o un alambre para pastel para dividir cada bizcocho horizontalmente, de modo que quede cuatro capas de bizcocho. Un buen consejo es cortar una línea marcadora en cada bizcocho con un cuchillo de pan, de modo que una vez cortados los bizcochos y rellenos, puedas utilizar la línea para volver a unirlos en el lugar correcto. De esa manera, si el corte quedó un poco torcido, el pastel no quedará desigual.","Batir la nata doble con el azúcar glas y la vainilla hasta que esté suave y esponjosa, y manteniendo la forma. Coloque la capa inferior sobre un soporte para pasteles o una tabla. Untar con una fina capa de mermelada, luego extender o colocar una buena capa de nata. Coloque una capa uniforme de fresas cuidadosamente alrededor del borde y luego salpique el centro del bizcocho con más fruta. Repita con dos capas más de pastel.","Para la capa superior, agregue el bizcocho y la mermelada, pero cubra con cuidado la crema. Presione suavemente la hoja de oro sobre el chocolate, las fresas, algunos merengues y un poco de corteza.","Coloque las fresas cubiertas de chocolate encima del bizcocho cremoso y luego acomódelas con trozos de corteza, merengues y galleta. Terminar con una pizca de merengue triturado y un poco más de fresas liofilizadas (de la receta de corteza de chocolate). Servir y comer en unas pocas horas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13004,8978,'es','pastel funfetti','¡Perfecto para una fiesta, este pastel con motas de arcoíris grita "celebra"! Coloque un glaseado cremoso de vainilla y espolvoréelo sobre chispas para obtener un pastel espectacular que encantará a adultos y niños.','["300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","450 g de mantequilla blanda","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla","8 huevos batidos","450 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","4 cucharadas de leche entera","200 g de chispas de arcoíris y más para decorar","150 g de mantequilla blanda","450 g de azúcar glas tamizada","Tarrina de 180 g de queso crema entero","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla"]','["Precalienta el horno a 180C/160 ventilador/gas 4 y engrasa y forra 4 moldes para pasteles de 20 cm. Si no tienes 4, reduce a la mitad la receta del bizcocho y hornéalo en 2 tandas.","Pon el azúcar, la mantequilla y la pasta de vainilla en un bol grande y bate con una batidora eléctrica (o en una batidora de mesa) hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega los huevos gradualmente, batiendo entre cada adición hasta que estén completamente incorporados. Agregue una o dos cucharadas de harina si la mezcla parece que se está cuajando.","Tamizar la harina y la levadura en polvo con una cucharadita de sal e incorporar a la masa del bizcocho. Vierta la leche y bata para soltar la mezcla. Esparza las chispas sobre la masa del pastel y extiéndalas antes de dividirlas entre cada molde para pastel. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y el bizcocho rebote cuando lo presione ligeramente. Cambie las latas en el horno después de 15 minutos para asegurarse de que se cocinen de manera uniforme. Deje enfriar completamente sobre rejillas antes de glasear.","Mientras tanto, haga el glaseado batiendo la mantequilla con la mitad del azúcar glas hasta que esté combinado y esponjoso. Agrega el queso crema y el resto del azúcar glas, batiendo nuevamente hasta que esté completamente combinado. Rocíe sobre la pasta de vainilla y bata hasta incorporar. Coloque una boquilla redonda grande en una manga pastelera y vierta el glaseado.","Cuando los pasteles se hayan enfriado, coloque una gota de glaseado sobre una tabla para pasteles y coloque 1 de los bizcochos encima. Coloque gotas de glaseado de vainilla en un círculo que cubra toda la base del bizcocho, luego cubra con el siguiente bizcocho. Repita con las 3 capas, esparciendo algunas chispas adicionales en la parte superior. Servir en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13005,6871,'es','Bizcocho de agua de rosas y frambuesa','Eloise Shardlow crea un toque floral delicado en el clásico bizcocho. Pétalos de rosa secos, glaseado de rosas y frambuesas forman una decoración espectacular.','["225 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos medianos, batidos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","225 g de harina con levadura, tamizada","150ml de nata doble","1 cucharadita de agua de rosas","4 cucharadas de mermelada de frambuesa","150 g de frambuesas, ligeramente trituradas","175 g de azúcar glas y un poco más para espolvorear","½ cucharadita de agua de rosas","pétalos de rosa secos","un puñado de frambuesas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar ligeramente dos moldes para pasteles de 20 cm y cubrirlos con papel para hornear. En un tazón grande, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agregue gradualmente los huevos poco a poco, raspando el costado del tazón después de cada adición. Si la mezcla comienza a cuajar, agregue 1 cucharadita de harina. Agregue el extracto de vainilla, mezcle la mitad de la harina y luego agregue el resto.","Divida la mezcla entre los moldes para pasteles y hornee durante 20-25 minutos; al insertar una brocheta en el medio de los pasteles, debe salir limpio. Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Batir la crema hasta obtener picos suaves, agregar el agua de rosas a medida que avanza, luego agregar la mermelada, teniendo cuidado de no mezclar demasiado.","Coloque uno de los bizcochos en un plato para servir y cubra con la mezcla de crema. Esparcir las frambuesas y cubrir con el otro bizcocho.","Para el glaseado, mezcle el azúcar glas, 2 cucharadas de agua y el agua de rosas, y agregue el jugo de algunas frambuesas trituradas. Rocíe sobre el pastel, coloque los pétalos de rosa y las frambuesas restantes encima y espolvoree con azúcar glas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13006,8979,'es','Pastel de bodas – pastel de frutas ligero','Esto constituye el nivel superior de un pastel de bodas de tres niveles, o hágalo solo para bautizos, Navidad o cuando necesite un pastel de frutas bueno y más ligero.','["2 cucharadas de agua de azahar","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","140 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos grandes, batidos","175 g de harina común","100 g de cereza glaseada sin teñir, partida por la mitad","100 g de albaricoque seco, picado en trozos grandes","100 g de pieles mixtas, picadas (nosotros usamos Sundora)","100 g de pasas doradas","50 g de pistacho pelado, dejado entero","50 g (3 bolas) de jengibre de tallo de un frasco"]','["Caliente el horno a 160 ° C / ventilador 140 ° C / gas 3. Engrase y forre dos veces la base y los lados de un molde para pastel hondo de 15 cm. Envuelva también una doble capa de papel encerado o papel marrón alrededor del exterior de la lata y luego asegúrela con una cuerda.","Con una batidora eléctrica o una batidora de mesa, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que quede esponjoso y ligero. Incorpora los huevos poco a poco. En un bol pequeño mezcla el agua de azahar con la ralladura y el jugo de la naranja y el limón. Incorpora la harina, luego los frutos secos, los pistachos y el jengibre a la mezcla de crema, seguido de la mezcla de jugo y ralladura.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y hornee por 30 minutos, luego baje el horno a 150 ° C/ventilador 130 ° C/gas 2 y hornee por 1 hora y 45 minutos más hasta que suba, esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta salga limpio. Deje enfriar durante 15 minutos antes de transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","El bizcocho se mantendrá bien envuelto en un lugar fresco hasta por 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:55:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13007,8980,'es','Pastel Selva Negra','Impresiona a tus invitados con este pastel de crema con capas de chocolate y cerezas: una versión renovada de un clásico retro','["175 g de mantequilla salada, más un poco para engrasar","200 g de barra de chocolate negro","300 g de harina común","375 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","25 g de cacao","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 huevos medianos","200 g de suero de leche o yogur natural","Lata de 425 g de cerezas deshuesadas, 2 cucharadas de jugo reservadas y el resto escurrido","100 g de mermelada de guindas","4 cucharadas de kirsch (o más jugo de lata si quieres que no tenga alcohol)","Tarrina de 500ml de crema doble","3 cucharadas de azúcar glas","1 canastilla pequeña de cerezas frescas (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar la base de 3 moldes para pasteles de 20 cm. Hervir la tetera. Poner la mantequilla y 75 g de chocolate partido en trozos en una cacerola pequeña y calentar suavemente, revolviendo, hasta que se derrita por completo.","Mezclar en un bol la harina, el azúcar, el cacao y el bicarbonato de sodio con una pizca de sal. Batir los huevos y el suero de leche o el yogur. Incorpora la mezcla de chocolate derretido y la mezcla de huevo a los ingredientes secos, añade 100 ml de agua hirviendo y bate brevemente con un batidor eléctrico hasta que la masa del pastel no tenga grumos.","Divida la mezcla entre los moldes y hornee durante 25 minutos, intercambiando los moldes después de 20 minutos si están en estantes diferentes. Para comprobar que están cocidos, introduce una brocheta y comprueba que sale limpio.","Pincha las tartas unas cuantas veces con una brocheta. Mezcle las 2 cucharadas de jugo de cereza reservado y el kirsch (o más jugo) y rocíe sobre los pasteles. Enfriar los pasteles.","Mezcle las cerezas escurridas restantes y la mermelada. Vierta 200 ml de crema en una cacerola pequeña y caliente hasta justo por debajo del punto de ebullición. Picar el chocolate restante y poner en un bol resistente al calor, verter sobre la nata caliente y remover hasta que se derrita. Reservar hasta que se pueda untar.","Cuando los pasteles estén fríos, bata la nata restante y el azúcar glas hasta que estén suaves. Distribuya sobre dos de los pasteles y luego vierta sobre las cerezas confitadas. Apila los pasteles juntos. Unte la crema de chocolate sobre el tercer bizcocho y colóquelo encima de los otros bizcochos. Apila las cerezas frescas dentro y alrededor del pastel y sirve."]','2026-01-11 12:55:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13008,8981,'es','Pastel de capas de miel y almendras','April opta por el estilo de decoración "desnudo" para que el pastel no esté inundado de glaseado, sino terminado delicadamente con almendras confitadas y crema de mantequilla de merengue suizo.','["280 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","225 g de azúcar mascabado light","140 g de miel clara, más 2 cucharadas","3 huevos medianos, más 4 yemas medianas (reserva las claras para la crema de mantequilla)","280 g de harina común","100 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","125ml de leche","140 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","75 g de almendras blanqueadas","350 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","4 claras de huevo medianas","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharadas de miel clara"]','["Primero, haz los bizcochos de miel y almendras. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar dos moldes para pasteles de 15 cm y forrar las bases con papel para hornear. Con una batidora de pie o una batidora de mano eléctrica, bata la mantequilla, el azúcar moscabado y 140 g de miel hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos y las yemas, uno a la vez, batiendo después de cada adición hasta que estén bien incorporados. En un recipiente limpio, mezcle la harina, las almendras, el polvo para hornear y 1/4 de cucharadita de sal. Agregue la mitad de la mezcla de harina a la mezcla de mantequilla y bata hasta que esté combinado. Agrega la vainilla y la leche, continúa batiendo, luego agrega la mezcla de harina restante, batiendo hasta que esté combinado. Divida la mezcla uniformemente entre los moldes y hornee durante 45-55 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro de cada pastel, éste salga limpio. Deje que los pasteles se enfríen durante 10 minutos en sus moldes, luego colóquelos sobre una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo. Dejar el horno encendido para las almendras confitadas.","Para hacer un almíbar de miel, ponga 2 cucharadas de miel y 2 cucharadas de agua en una cacerola pequeña y caliente durante 1 a 2 minutos o hasta que la miel se haya disuelto. Dejar de lado.","Prepare las almendras confitadas calentando 150 ml de agua y el azúcar en una cacerola mediana de fondo grueso con un termómetro para azúcar adjunto y revuelva hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Mientras tanto, extienda las almendras en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Calienta el almíbar de azúcar a 119 ° C, apaga el fuego y agrega las almendras tibias. Sigue revolviendo hasta que el almíbar cubra las nueces y se vuelva blanco y crujiente. Vuelva a colocar las almendras en la bandeja para hornear y pique aproximadamente la mitad.","A continuación, prepara la crema de mantequilla de merengue suizo. Con una batidora de pie o una batidora de mano eléctrica, bata la mantequilla hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Coloque las claras de huevo y el azúcar en un recipiente limpio resistente al calor sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Batir con una batidora de mano eléctrica limpia y calentar la mezcla hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto (puedes comprobarlo palpando un poco de clara de huevo entre los dedos para comprobar que no está granulada). Retire el tazón del fuego y, con una batidora de pie o eléctrica, bata durante 10 minutos o hasta que la mezcla forme picos rígidos y se haya enfriado a temperatura ambiente. Agrega la mantequilla, 1-2 cucharadas a la vez, y bate hasta que la mezcla esté suave y cremosa. Incorpora la miel y transfiérala a una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de 1 cm.","Para armar el pastel, nivele los bizcochos cortando la parte superior abovedada y divida cada bizcocho por la mitad para crear cuatro capas. Fije la capa inferior a una tabla para pastel o colóquela con un chorrito de crema de mantequilla, unte con el almíbar de miel y coloque una capa de crema de mantequilla encima. Presione suavemente la segunda capa encima y repita con las capas restantes. Cubra el pastel con una fina capa de crema de mantequilla, luego use una espátula para raspar los lados y limpiarlos. Coloque un anillo de gotas de crema de mantequilla alrededor de la parte superior o extienda una capa gruesa con una espátula. Decorar con las almendras confitadas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13009,8982,'es','Cupcakes de naranja y almendras','Pequeños y delicados cupcakes con glaseado de crema de mantequilla de almendras. Si te sientes ambicioso, sigue nuestra guía para crear un ramo comestible.','["300 g de mantequilla blanda","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos grandes","250 g de harina común","100 g de almendras molidas","2½ cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","ralladura de 1 naranja y 2 cucharadas de jugo","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","450 g de azúcar glas y un poquito más","200 g de queso crema","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","1 cucharada de jugo de naranja","pasta colorante para alimentos de su elección (usamos una mezcla de rosa y amarillo para crear coral)","Paquete de 250 g de pasta de azúcar verde (o glaseado de fondant mezclado con colorante alimentario verde)","24 estuches para muffins (nosotros usamos verdes)","manga pastelera grande","boquilla de tubería grande y curvada con punta de estrella","Bola de poliestireno de 15 cm/6 pulgadas.","Maceta de 15 cm/6 pulgadas (medida en la parte superior)","papel de seda verde","cinta adhesiva","24 brochetas de madera cortas (o largas cortadas por la mitad)","cinta, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3½.\r\nForre 2 moldes para muffins de 12 hoyos con muffins\r\ncasos. Poner la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo.\r\nen un tazón grande y licuar con una batidora eléctrica.\r\nbata a mano hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Añadir\r\nlos huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien\r\nentre cada adición. Agrega la harina,\r\nalmendras, levadura en polvo y una pizca\r\nde sal. Mezclar nuevamente, luego agregar la naranja.\r\nralladura y jugo, y extracto de almendras.\r\nDar una mezcla final para combinar todo.","Utilice 2 cucharadas de postre para dividir el\r\nmezcla entre los casos. Hornear para\r\n22-25 minutos, cambiando las latas después\r\n15 minutos. Retirar del horno, dejar reposar\r\ndejar enfriar durante 10 minutos en las latas, luego transferir\r\na una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. puede\r\nAhora se puede congelar hasta por 3 meses.","Para hacer el glaseado, vierte la mantequilla en\r\nun tazón grande y licua con una batidora eléctrica.\r\nbata a mano hasta que quede suave. Agrega el glaseado\r\nazúcar, queso crema, extracto de almendras y\r\njugo de naranja. Triture todo primero con una espátula (para evitar ensuciar),\r\nluego introduce con la batidora eléctrica\r\ny mezcle hasta que quede suave. Añade tu\r\ncolorante alimentario y mezclar nuevamente hasta\r\nTienes un color uniforme. (Si eres\r\nusando colorante alimentario líquido,\r\nhaz que el glaseado esté líquido, así que agrega un poco\r\nmás azúcar glas.)","Coloque la manga pastelera con una gran curva \r\nboquilla de tubería con punta de estrella y luego llene el \r\nbolsa con la mitad del glaseado y girar \r\nel final cerrado. Para canalizar, sostenga el \r\nmanga pastelera directamente encima del centro de \r\nla torta y, aplicando una presión constante, \r\ntubo en un remolino, trabajando hacia el \r\nborde del cupcake. cuando llegues \r\nel borde, deslice la boquilla para crear un \r\nacabado suave: siempre puedes cubrir \r\nesta parte con hojas, así que no te preocupes también \r\nmucho si se ve desordenado. cuando tienes \r\nPrepare 12 cupcakes, vacíe el glaseado restante del\r\nVuelva a colocar la bolsa en el bol con lo reservado.\r\nglaseado. Añade un poco más de colorante\r\ncrear un tono más profundo (y un poco más\r\nazúcar glas tamizada si el glaseado se pone demasiado\r\nlíquido). Vuelve a batir y luego vuelve a llenar tu\r\nmanga pastelera y ponga hielo en los pasteles restantes.\r\nSe puede almacenar en un lugar fresco hasta por\r\n1 día (la nevera está bien, solo asegúrate\r\nque retiras 30 min antes de comer).","Antes de servir, añade unas cuantas hojas, si\r\ncomo: pellizcar pequeños trozos de azúcar verde\r\npegar o glaseado de fondant y darle forma\r\nhojas. Utilice un cuchillo afilado para agregar detalles,\r\nluego pégalo sobre los cupcakes. Mira los consejos, abajo a la izquierda,\r\npara saber cómo construir tu ramo."]','2026-01-11 12:55:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13010,8983,'es','Tarta de tiramisú de chocolate','Este cremoso pastel de capas de chocolate y café tiene un verdadero factor sorpresa y es ideal para una celebración.','["50 g de mantequilla, más un extra para las latas","4 huevos grandes","140 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de harina común","25 g de cacao","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharada de azúcar demerara","75 ml de espresso caliente o café rico y fuerte","4 yemas de huevo grandes","75 g de azúcar en polvo","125ml marsala","200 g de chocolate blanco, mitad picado y mitad rallado","500 g de mascarpone en tarrina","200 g de chocolate negro rallado","1 cucharada de cacao"]','["Para las tartas, calentar el horno a 180C/\r\nVentilador 160C/gas 4. Mantequilla y hilo 2 x 20cm\r\nlatas para sándwiches. Derretir la mantequilla y dejar\r\nque se enfríe un poco. Poner los huevos, el azúcar y\r\nvainilla en un bol y batir durante aproximadamente\r\n8 minutos o hasta que la mezcla esté pálida y espesa.\r\ny ha triplicado su volumen.","Tamizar la harina, el cacao, la levadura\r\ny una pizca de sal sobre el huevo\r\nmezcla, luego mezcle suavemente.\r\nVierta la mantequilla enfriada alrededor del\r\nborde del tazón y doblar hasta que\r\ntotalmente incorporado. dividir la masa\r\nentre los moldes preparados y hornear\r\ndurante 10-12 minutos o hasta que se inserte una brocheta\r\nen medio de los pasteles viene\r\nsalir limpio. Dejar enfriar en las latas.\r\ndurante unos minutos, luego transfiéralo a un cable\r\nrejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. disolver\r\nel azúcar en el café y reservar.\r\nPoner las yemas de huevo, el azúcar y el Marsala en\r\nun recipiente resistente al calor, luego colóquelo sobre una fuente grande\r\ncacerola con agua hirviendo. Batir durante 5 minutos\r\nhasta que la mezcla esté espesa y se haya triplicado\r\nen volumen – asegúrese de que la mezcla esté\r\nmuy grueso. Retirar del fuego y\r\nSaca el bol de la sartén. sigue batiendo\r\nhasta que la mezcla esté fría.","Derretir el chocolate blanco picado\r\nen el microondas a temperatura baja y dejar\r\nque se enfríe un poco. Mientras tanto, vence el\r\nmascarpone hasta que quede suave, luego doble\r\nen la mezcla de huevo con el enfriado\r\nchocolate blanco.","Corta los pasteles por la mitad horizontalmente.\r\nColoque una capa en el fondo de un recipiente de 20 cm.\r\nestaño desmontable. Pincelar con el café\r\nalmíbar y untar con 3 cucharadas de\r\nmezcla de mascarpone. Dispersión con\r\n1 cucharada de chocolate amargo rallado, luego repita\r\nhasta terminar con la cuarta capa de\r\npastel. Cubrir con film transparente y enfriar durante\r\nal menos 2 horas junto con el resto\r\nmezcla de mascarpone.","Retirar el molde y poner la tarta.\r\nen un plato para servir, luego cubra con el\r\nresto de la mezcla de mascarpone. Mezclar\r\nel chocolate negro restante con el\r\nchocolate blanco rallado y prensar\r\ncon cuidado sobre los lados del pastel.\r\nEspolvorea la parte superior con cacao."]','2026-01-11 12:55:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13011,8984,'es','Pastel sombrío Bakewell de Edd Kimber','Inspirado en la clásica tarta Bakewell, los sabores de mermelada de frambuesa y almendras de este bizcocho tipo sándwich complementan el impresionante glaseado graduado en rosa.','["325 g de harina común","25 g de harina de maíz","4½ cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","225 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","400 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharaditas de extracto de almendras","5 claras de huevo medianas, ligeramente batidas","300ml de leche entera","300 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","625 g de azúcar glas","450 g de queso crema entero","300 g de mermelada de frambuesa sin semillas","colorante alimentario en pasta roja"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase 3 moldes para pasteles redondos de 20 cm y\r\nforrar las bases con papel para hornear,\r\nengrasando también el pergamino.","En un tazón mediano, mezcle la\r\nharina, maicena, levadura en polvo y ½ cucharadita\r\nsal y luego reserva. Poner la mantequilla en un\r\ntazón grande y batir durante unos 3 minutos.\r\nhasta que quede suave y cremoso. Agrega la rueda\r\nazúcar y batir durante unos 5 minutos hasta\r\nligero y esponjoso. Añade los extractos y\r\nmezclar para combinar.","Agrega la clara de huevo poco a poco,\r\nbatiendo hasta que esté completamente combinado. Tamizar\r\nla mezcla de harina en 3 adiciones,\r\nalternando con la leche, pero empezando\r\ny terminando con la harina.","Divida la mezcla en partes iguales entre los\r\nlatas preparadas, nivelando suavemente. hornear\r\ndurante 25-30 minutos, o hasta que el pastel salte\r\nhacia atrás cuando se toca ligeramente. Permitir el\r\npasteles para enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos\r\nantes de invertirlo sobre una rejilla para\r\nenfriar completamente. La esponja es bastante\r\ndelicado, así que tenga cuidado al trabajar\r\ncon el bizcocho enfriado.","Para el glaseado, batir la mantequilla por\r\nunos 3 minutos hasta que esté suave y cremoso. Añadir\r\nel azúcar glas, poco a poco, hasta que\r\ntotalmente combinado. Batir el glaseado hasta\r\nligero y suave, luego agrega la crema\r\nqueso y la mitad de la mermelada. Mezclar hasta que apenas\r\nsuave – no mezcle demasiado ya que quedará\r\nMás delgado cuanto más revuelvas.","Coloque el primer bizcocho en un plato para servir y\r\nExtienda una capa de glaseado por encima.\r\nLuego esparza uniformemente la mitad de la mermelada restante.\r\nsobre el glaseado. Repita con el segundo\r\npastel y finalmente coloque el tercer pastel\r\narriba. Cubrir el exterior de todo el pastel.\r\ncon una fina capa de glaseado usando una paleta\r\ncuchillo y guárdelo en el frigorífico mientras\r\nPrepara el glaseado para la decoración.","Divida el glaseado restante entre\r\n3 tazones pequeños. Agregue aproximadamente ½ cucharadita de rojo\r\npegar colorante a uno de los tazones y\r\naproximadamente 1 cucharadita de colorante en otro tazón,\r\ndejando el tercer bol como está. tu quieres\r\ntener tres tazones de glaseado con\r\ncolores claramente diferentes.","Para decorar las tartas, poner cada una\r\nglaseado en una manga pastelera provista de un\r\npequeña punta de tubería redonda. Coloca 6 puntos de\r\nglasear el bizcocho, 2 de cada color,\r\ncon el más oscuro en la base del bizcocho.\r\nUtilice una cucharadita o una espátula pequeña para\r\nunte el glaseado hacia la derecha. repetir\r\nel proceso de tubería, moviendo los puntos hacia arriba\r\nuno para que mientras rodeas el pastel\r\nel color se graduará en un remolino. Para\r\nEn la parte superior, coloque 2 anillos del rosa más oscuro.\r\npuntos alrededor del exterior, extendiendo el\r\nglaseado de la misma manera, seguido\r\npor 2 anillos de los puntos rosados medianos, y\r\nterminar con el glaseado más claro en el\r\nmedio.Se conservará hasta por 3 días, refrigerado."]','2026-01-11 12:55:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13012,8985,'es','Pastel de gasa de chocolate de John Whaite con crema de mantequilla y caramelo salado','Dale a este bizcocho de celebración un acabado espectacular colocando picos de ganache encima y rellenándolo con glaseado de mantequilla y caramelo salado.','["125ml de aceite de girasol, más un extra para engrasar","7 huevos grandes, separados","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","375 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de cacao en polvo","300 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","250 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","150ml de nata doble","140 g de mantequilla, blanda","½ cucharadita de sal","250ml de nata doble","250 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado o rallado","cristales de sal marina, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrasar y forrar un bizcocho redondo de 25 cm de profundidad.\r\nlata con papel para hornear. en un gran\r\nbol, mezclar el aceite, las yemas de huevo, la pasta de vainilla,\r\nazúcar en polvo y 200ml de agua hasta que esté bien\r\ncombinado. Tamizar el cacao en polvo y\r\nbatir hasta que quede suave.","Tamizar la harina, el bicarbonato y 1 cucharadita de sal.\r\nEn un recipiente aparte batir las claras\r\nhasta picos rígidos. Incorporar a la masa con\r\nuna cuchara grande de metal y mezcle hasta\r\ntodo está bien combinado.","Vierte suavemente la mezcla en tu pastel.\r\nestaño, luego golpéelo contra la superficie de trabajo dos veces\r\npara expulsar las grandes bolsas de aire. Hornear para\r\n1 hora 10 minutos o hasta que el bizcocho vuelva a crecer\r\ncuando se empuja suavemente y se inserta\r\nla brocheta sale limpia. (Cubrir con papel de aluminio\r\ndespués de 1 hora si el pastel comienza a ponerse demasiado\r\noscuro.) Retirar del horno, enfriar en el\r\nlata durante 10 minutos, luego transfiérala a una fuente grande\r\nRejilla y retire el pergamino.\r\nDejar hasta que el bizcocho esté completamente frío.","Prepare el glaseado de caramelo salado mientras\r\nel pastel se hornea. Calentar el azúcar moreno,\r\n½ cucharadita de sal y nata en una cacerola\r\nhasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. burbuja\r\ndurante unos minutos, luego dejar enfriar\r\ncompletamente. Batir la mantequilla hasta que quede suave,\r\nvierta la mezcla de crema enfriada y\r\ncontinúe mezclando hasta que esté suave.\r\nEnfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Para hacer la ganache calentar la nata.\r\nhasta que apenas hierva. Retirar del fuego\r\ny verter sobre el chocolate. dejar para\r\ndejar reposar unos minutos hasta que el chocolate\r\nse ha derretido y te queda una salsa tersa\r\nconsistencia. Dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente.\r\ntemperatura hasta que la ganache esté\r\nespesor entubable, luego transfiéralo a un\r\nManga pastelera equipada con boquilla de estrella. a\r\nterminar el bizcocho, cortarlo por la mitad y rellenar con\r\nla crema de mantequilla con caramelo salado. Tubo alto\r\npicos de ganache de chocolate encima y\r\ndecorar con los cristales de sal marina. voluntad\r\nconservar hasta por 2 días en un lugar fresco."]','2026-01-11 12:55:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13013,8986,'es','Tarta de terciopelo rojo frambuesa','El puré de frutas aporta gran parte del color a este pastel de tonos rosados, que combina frambuesas, cacao y una buena ración de glaseado de queso crema.','["280 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","175 g de mantequilla, blanda","3 huevos grandes","280 g de harina con levadura","75 g de cacao en polvo","150 ml de suero de leche","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino blanco","85 g de queso crema entero","75 g de frambuesas en puré, tamizadas para quitar las semillas","¼ cucharadita de gel alimentario rojo","150 g de frambuesas en canastilla, opcional","200 g de azúcar glas","50 g de mantequilla, ablandada","140 g de queso crema"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrasar y forrar las bases de 2 x 20cm.\r\nmoldes para sándwiches con papel para hornear.\r\nCon una batidora de mano eléctrica, bata\r\njuntar el azúcar en polvo y la mantequilla hasta\r\nligero y esponjoso. Añade los huevos uno a uno.\r\ntiempo, batiendo bien entre cada adición.","Tamizar la harina y el cacao en polvo\r\nen un bol. Agrega la mitad a la mezcla de huevo.\r\ny doblar con cuidado. Mezclar juntos el\r\nsuero de leche, vinagre, queso crema,\r\npuré de frambuesa y gel alimentario. Doblar por la mitad\r\nla mezcla de suero de leche en el pastel\r\nmasa y repetir el proceso con ambos\r\nla mezcla de harina y la mezcla de suero de leche.","Vierta las mezclas combinadas en\r\nsus latas preparadas y cocine por aproximadamente\r\n25-30 minutos, hasta que se inserte una brocheta\r\nsale limpio. Dejar enfriar 10 min.\r\nantes de colocarlo sobre una rejilla.","Para el glaseado, mezcle el glaseado\r\nazúcar y mantequilla hasta que estén suaves y cremosos,\r\nluego agregue el queso crema. Sándwich\r\nlas tortas enfriadas junto con la mitad de la\r\nglaseado, añadiendo 150 g de frambuesas frescas si\r\nlo que quieras, luego extiende el resto\r\nglaseado por encima. Se mantendrá hasta el final.\r\na 3 días en un lugar fresco."]','2026-01-11 12:55:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13014,8987,'es','Tarta de merengue de moras y almendras','Impresiona a tus amigos y familiares con este fabuloso pastel de celebración.','["200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","2 huevos y 2 yemas, batidos","2-4 cucharadas de leche","150 g de moras en canastilla","2 claras de huevo","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más una pizca","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas","200 ml de nata doble, ligeramente batida","4 cucharadas de gelatina de zarza"]','["Forre la base de dos moldes para sándwiches antiadherentes de 20 cm de fondo suelto con papel para hornear. Calentar el horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3.","Pon todos los ingredientes del bizcocho (excepto las moras y usando solo la mitad de la leche) en un bol, luego bate hasta que esté cremoso y bien mezclado. Agrega 100 g de moras, junto con la leche extra si la necesitas para aflojar un poco la mezcla. Divida entre las latas para sándwiches y nivele la parte superior.","Batir rápidamente las claras en un bol limpio, añadiendo los 100 g de azúcar, una cucharada a la vez, hasta que estén muy espesas y brillantes. Extienda ligeramente sobre uno de los pasteles, luego espolvoree con las almendras en copos y una pizca extra de azúcar. Hornea ambos bizcochos durante 40 minutos, luego saca del horno el bizcocho sin merengue y reserva. Hornea el resto del bizcocho durante 30 minutos más hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el bizcocho, éste salga limpio. Retire con cuidado los pasteles de los moldes y déjelos enfriar sobre una rejilla. Cuando los bizcochos estén fríos, retiramos el papel.","Para servir, unte la crema sobre el bizcocho hasta los bordes. Vierta sobre la gelatina de zarza, luego haga un sándwich con el pastel cubierto de merengue y decore con las moras restantes."]','2026-01-11 12:55:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13015,8988,'es','Horneado en bandeja con bandera afrutada','Un bizcocho infalible que es más fácil de lo que parece: las almendras y el yogur lo mantienen húmedo y su decoración frutal es adecuadamente patriótica.','["100 g de mantequilla o crema para hornear (Stork para pasteles), ablandada, más un poco más para el molde","175 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","4 huevos grandes","225 g de azúcar en polvo","125 ml de yogur griego entero","ralladura de 2 limones","175 g de mantequilla, blanda","350 g de azúcar glas tamizada","300 g de frambuesas","175 g de arándanos"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nUnte con mantequilla y forre una bandeja para hornear de 30 x 20 cm con papel para hornear. Mida todos los\r\nEsponja los ingredientes en un tazón para mezclar.\r\ny mezclar con una mano eléctrica\r\nbatir hasta que quede suave. Vierta en la lata\r\ny nivelar la superficie.","Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado.\r\ny la parte superior del pastel regresa\r\ncuando se presiona con el dedo, y el\r\nLos lados de la esponja se están encogiendo.\r\nde los lados de la lata. Levante con cuidado\r\nSaque la esponja de la lata y luego transfiérala.\r\na una rejilla para que se enfríe. Retire el\r\npergamino para hornear.","Para hacer el glaseado, vierte la mantequilla en\r\nun bol y batir con una mano eléctrica\r\nbata hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Añadir la mitad\r\nel azúcar glas y batir nuevamente hasta\r\nincorporado. Agrega el azúcar restante\r\ny bata nuevamente hasta que quede suave. difundir\r\nel glaseado sobre la parte superior del pastel frío.","Para decorar, coloca una doble hilera de\r\nframbuesas por el centro y hacia abajo\r\nel largo del pastel para hacer una cruz.\r\nLuego, coloque una sola fila en diagonal desde\r\ncada esquina hacia el medio. Ahora completa\r\nlos espacios vacíos con arándanos. cortar\r\nen cuadritos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13016,8989,'es','Pastel de especias de frambuesa','Un espectacular bizcocho de capas de bizcocho húmedo de suero de leche, mermelada, frutos rojos y glaseado de queso crema: una verdadera pieza central','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda","450 g de harina común","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","5 huevos grandes","4 cucharadas de miel","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de canela","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","½ cucharadita de clavo molido","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","¼ cucharadita de sal","4 cucharadas de suero de leche","200 g de mermelada de frambuesa","200 g de frambuesas y un poco más para decorar (opcional)","Paquete de 200 g de mantequilla blanda","Paquete de 200 g de queso tierno","200 g de azúcar glas tamizada y un poco más para espolvorear (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase y forre moldes para pasteles de 3 x 20 cm con\r\npergamino para hornear. Inclina todo el pastel\r\ningredientes en un tazón grande y batir\r\ncon una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave.\r\nDividir en moldes y hornear por 25 minutos.\r\nhasta que al pinchar un pincho éste salga limpio.\r\nColóquelo sobre rejillas para que se enfríe.","Divide cada pastel por la mitad. puré\r\nla mermelada y las frambuesas juntas, luego\r\nrepartir sobre 5 mitades de pastel, dejando 1 parte superior\r\nmedio gratis. Sándwich juntos, con el\r\npastel simple encima. Poner en un plato y aferrarse.\r\npelícula a fondo. Invierta un molde para pastel encima\r\ncomo un sombrero y cubra con 3 x 400 g de comida\r\nlatas. Dejar toda la noche.","Para finalizar batir la mantequilla, el queso y\r\nazúcar glas juntos, luego esparcir sobre\r\nel pastel. Decorar con frambuesas extra\r\ny un poco de azúcar glas, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:55:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13017,8031,'es','Pastel de boda sencillo y elegante','Para hacer un pastel de bodas de tres niveles, todo lo que necesitas hacer es multiplicar las mezclas básicas para pastel y los glaseados, y tómate tu tiempo.','["5 x ingredientes para pastel de vainilla fácil (consulte la receta ''Combina bien'' a continuación)","5 x ingredientes para crema de mantequilla de vainilla básica (ver receta a continuación)","Tarro de 340 g/12 oz de mermelada de fresa, opcional (yo usé Tiptree Strawberry & Champagne)","Tarro de 340 g de mermelada de albaricoque, calentada y tamizada","4 kg de glaseado blanco listo para enrollar (yo usé Regalice)","Tablas para tartas redondas y finas de 15 cm, 23 cm y 30 cm.","Tabla para tartas redonda de 40 cm de grosor.","palitos de cóctel","espátula","un rollo de papel para hornear","una bandeja para hornear plana o un levantador de pasteles","azúcar glas, para extender","cuerda, para medir","8 x tacos largos de plástico","tijeras de cocina","Cinta de raso blanca de 3½ m x 1½ cm","tubo de cola UHU, o similar","Dummies de poliestireno para tartas de 12 y 15 cm.","Alambre para floristería de calibre 18, cortado en trozos de unos 20 x 10 cm","15-20 cabezas de hortensias blancas y verde pálido (consiga algunas más pequeñas, otras más grandes, si puede); tu florista puede aconsejarte","Cajas para tartas con tapa de 40 cm, 30 cm y 18 cm, si vas a transportar la tarta"]','["PREPARAR LOS PASTELES: Prepare la receta básica de pastel de vainilla fácil (consulte ''Combina bien con''), siguiendo las instrucciones a continuación para cada nivel, luego enfríe y empape con el almíbar. Los pasteles se pueden congelar con antelación, sin glasear. Sin embargo, si los horneas tres días antes de la boda, la tarta estará bien hasta el gran día.","Para el nivel inferior, triplique las cantidades de la mezcla básica para pastel, luego vierta en un molde para pastel redondo, profundo y de 30 cm, ya forrado. Hornee durante 2 horas y 15 minutos en el estante del medio hasta que suba y esté bien cocido como antes. Mientras se cocina, prepare una tanda cuádruple de almíbar; esto será suficiente para los tres pasteles. Dejar enfriar y bañar el bizcocho con almíbar como antes.","Para los niveles medio y superior, duplique las cantidades de la mezcla para pastel básica, luego viértala en moldes para pastel de 15 cm y 23 cm ya forrados, llenando cada uno hasta aproximadamente dos tercios de su capacidad. Hornéelos juntos en el estante del medio, sacando el pastel pequeño después de 1 hora 15 minutos y dejando cocinar el pastel más grande durante 1 hora 30 minutos en total. Si sabes que tu horno tiene puntos calientes, mueve rápidamente los pasteles después de 50 minutos. Deje enfriar y moje con almíbar como antes.","CAPA Y CUBRA LAS TORTAS: Haga la crema de mantequilla como en la receta básica. Necesitará 5 veces la cantidad básica; esto es mucho, así que divida las cantidades pesadas en dos antes de comenzar a mezclar. Quizás te sobra algo, pero mejor demasiado que muy poco. Pese la crema de mantequilla: necesitará aproximadamente 400 g para el bizcocho de 15 cm, 600 g para el bizcocho de 23 cm y 1,3 kg para el bizcocho de 30 cm. Unte un poco de crema de mantequilla sobre la tabla para tartas de 15 cm. Nivela la parte superior del pastel si es necesario y luego voltea el pastel de 15 cm sobre ella. Dividir en tres con un cuchillo para pan. Me gusta marcar el frente del pastel en cada capa antes de levantarlo, usando palillos, para poder volver a armarlo exactamente de la manera correcta. Primero quita el tercio superior (lo que era la parte inferior del pastel) y reserva. Corta con cuidado la capa intermedia y déjala a un lado también. Una bandeja para hornear plana o un levantador de pasteles pueden ser muy útiles en este caso para deslizar las capas del pastel y luego volver a colocarlas una sobre otra.","Extienda una capa de crema de mantequilla sobre el pastel en la tabla. Devuelva la capa intermedia, alineando las marcas de los palillos, luego extienda otra capa de crema de mantequilla encima. Agregue un poco de mermelada si lo desea, salpique y luego distribuya uniformemente. Cubra con el último trozo de pastel y luego quite el polvo de las migajas que haya sobre o alrededor del pastel. Ahora unta todo el bizcocho con una fina capa de mermelada de albaricoque. Esto debería evitar que queden demasiadas migas en la crema de mantequilla. Coloque todo el pastel sobre una hoja grande de papel para hornear.","Extienda el resto de la crema de mantequilla, comenzando por la parte superior, luego alise y remueva por los lados y hasta la tabla. Repite todo el proceso con el resto de bizcochos, utilizando las tablas correspondientes y las diferentes cantidades de buttercream. Los pasteles ya están listos para ser glaseados. Puede dejarlos toda la noche si es necesario, cubiertos sin apretar con film transparente.","CUBRIR LA TARTA CON HELADO: Necesitarás unos 500 g de glaseado para la tarta de 15 cm, 1 kg para la tarta de 23 cm y 1,7 kg para la tarta de 30 cm. Espolvorea la superficie de trabajo con azúcar glas, amasa el glaseado hasta que esté flexible, luego usa el rodillo para enrollarlo formando un círculo lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir los lados y la parte superior del pastel, con un poco de sobrante. Utilice una cuerda para comprobar el tamaño. Usa tu rodillo para ayudarte a levantar el glaseado sobre el pastel.","Alise el glaseado alrededor del pastel con las manos, pasándolo por los bordes y bajando hasta la tabla. Luego, corte el exceso con un cuchillo afilado, al ras con el fondo de la tabla para pasteles. Suaviza cualquier marca con las palmas de las manos, puliendo el glaseado hasta obtener un ligero brillo.","Una vez que hayas glaseado todos los pasteles, cubre la base gruesa. Cepille ligeramente con agua hervida enfriada y luego coloque el glaseado encima. Recorte hasta el borde de la tabla con un cuchillo (tiendo a hacer esto como lo haría con una base de pastel, sosteniendo la tabla con la mano izquierda y el cuchillo con la derecha), luego deje que la tabla y los pasteles se sequen durante la noche.","APILAMIENTO DE LOS PASTELES: Los tacos, que son básicamente palos de plástico, brindan estabilidad y resistencia a los pasteles en niveles, y los bloques de poliestireno le permiten agregar una capa \"flotante\" de flores. Al medir y cortar las clavijas del mismo largo que el poliestireno, proporcionarás una plataforma uniforme para que se asiente el siguiente pastel, incluso si el pastel de abajo está un poco torcido.","Coloca el muñeco de 15 cm en el centro encima del pastel más grande. Inserta cuatro de los tacos en el pastel, alrededor del exterior del muñeco, en forma cuadrada. Empújelos hacia abajo hasta que se encuentren con el tablero del pastel. Marca con un bolígrafo hasta dónde llega la parte superior del chupete.","Saque con cuidado las clavijas; luego, usando unas tijeras, marca alrededor de cada clavija donde la marcaste. Rompe el plástico limpiamente. Vuelva a insertar las clavijas en sus orificios originales, con el extremo redondeado hacia abajo. Repite el proceso con la tarta de 23cm y el chupete de 12cm.","Coloque el pastel más grande en el medio de la tabla cubierta. Pase una fina línea de pegamento alrededor de la placa base y fije la cinta a su alrededor. Fija la cinta alrededor de cada pastel, usando un poco de pegamento en la cinta para asegurarlo a sí mismo. Si vas a trasladar el pastel a un lugar, colócalos en sus cajas ahora. Haz un pequeño kit para llevar contigo (pegamento, tijeras, etc.) en caso de que tengas que volver a hacer algo.","EN EL DÍA - APILAR Y DECORAR EL PASTEL CON FLORES: Usé hortensias: son hermosas, están en temporada y puedes lograr un efecto dramático con relativamente pocas flores. \r\nEse día, deja de poner las flores en el pastel hasta lo más tarde que puedas. Corta los tallos de las hortensias a unos 2-3 cm. Divide la flor que menos te guste en trozos más pequeños; esto te ayudará a llenar los huecos incómodos más adelante. Asegúrate de guardar una hermosa flor para la parte superior.","Inserte un trozo de alambre de floristería en cada tallo (o enróllelo alrededor del tallo), dejando una punta de alambre de unos 3 cm de largo. Empuje esto dentro del muñeco de poliestireno. Repita hasta que los dos muñecos estén rodeados por un halo de flores. La torta inferior debería estar ahora en su posición permanente, alejada de la luz directa y de cualquier radiador. Levante el bizcocho de 23 cm sobre el muñeco de poliestireno inferior, con cuidado de no aplastar ningún pétalo, luego repita con el bizcocho superior. Llene los espacios con la cabeza de flor rota que reservó anteriormente. Coloca la flor final encima del pastel y ¡listo!","CORTAR EL PASTEL: Cortar el pastel a lo ancho, en forma de cuadrícula, en lugar de en gajos. Deberías poder obtener 50 porciones del bizcocho grande, 30 del medio y 12 de la parte superior, cuando lo cortas en trozos de 2,5 x 5 cm."]','2026-01-11 12:55:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13018,8991,'es','Pastel de chocolate con el doble de amor','Una simple crema de mantequilla de chocolate blanco se ve genial cuando se arremolina sobre este hermoso pastel de bodas, sin importar cómo lo hagas.','["400 g de mantequilla","200 g de chocolate natural","700 g de harina común","800 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de cacao","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","4 huevos grandes","400 ml de suero de leche","2 barras de chocolate blanco de 200 g","550 g de mantequilla blanda","550 g de azúcar glas","2-3 bolsas de 80 g de botones, flores y cintas de chocolate blanco, opcional"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase y forre la base y los lados de\r\nmoldes para pasteles hondos y redondos de 20 cm y 15 cm\r\ncon papel para hornear, asegurándose de que\r\nEl papel llega unos cms por encima de los lados.","Hervir la tetera. Poner la mitad de la mantequilla y\r\nchocolate en una sartén y derretir suavemente,\r\nrevolviendo. Mezclar la mitad de la harina,\r\nazúcar, cacao y bicarbonato con una pizca\r\nde sal. Batir 2 de los huevos y 200ml.\r\nsuero de leche juntos. Raspar lo derretido\r\nmezcla de chocolate y mezcla de huevo en\r\nlos ingredientes secos. Añadir 150ml hirviendo\r\nagua y mezclar todo junto\r\ncon unas varillas eléctricas hasta que no queden grumos.\r\nDividir entre las latas y hornear por\r\n40-45 minutos, cambiando de ronda tras\r\n30 minutos si están en estantes diferentes\r\n(el de 15 cm debe hacerse después\r\n40 minutos). Para probar que están cocidos, presione\r\nuna brocheta y comprobar que sale limpia.\r\nEnfriar las tartas en sus moldes.","Repita los pasos 1 y 2 nuevamente para que\r\nterminar con 2 pasteles de 20 cm y\r\n2 tartas de 15 cm.","Derretir el chocolate blanco en un bol\r\nuna cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo. batir\r\njuntar la mantequilla y el azúcar glas, luego\r\nIncorpora el chocolate blanco. cuando el\r\nLos pasteles están fríos, divídalos por la mitad.\r\nUsa el glaseado para volver a unir\r\nentonces terminas con 2 x cuatro capas\r\npasteles. Coloca el bizcocho de 20 cm en tu porción.\r\nplato y esparza un poco más de glaseado\r\nla parte superior. Coloque el pastel más pequeño encima\r\neso, y cubrir completamente con glaseado.\r\nDecorar con los botones de chocolate.","Si quieres agregar algunas flores\r\nElija algo comestible, como rosas.\r\nHaz un ramillete, envolviendo los tallos en\r\nun poco de papel de cocina húmedo y luego un poco\r\nfilm transparente, agregue una cinta y agregue a la\r\npastel el día de la boda."]','2026-01-11 12:55:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13019,8992,'es','pastel de pasión','Hornea el delicioso pastel de tres capas de Sarah Cook para alguien a quien amas este Día de San Valentín','["150ml de aceite de girasol, más un poquito más para la lata","300 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","300 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de coco rallado","2 huevos, más 2 claras, huevos enteros batidos","2 plátanos demasiado maduros, triturados","140 g de zanahorias ralladas","Lata de 432 g de piña triturada en jugo, escurrida en un colador, reservando el jugo (o batir brevemente una lata de trozos de piña y luego colar)","100ml de leche","4 maracuyás maduros, cortados a la mitad","25 g de azúcar en polvo","200 g de queso tierno en tarrina","100 g de mantequilla blanda","85 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nAceitar y forrar las bases de 3 x 20cm.\r\nmoldes para sándwiches con papel para hornear.\r\nMezclar la harina, la canela, el polvo para hornear,\r\nla mitad del azúcar y el coco en una cacerola grande\r\ntazón para mezclar. En otro bol mezclar la\r\nhuevos enteros batidos, plátanos machacados,\r\nzanahoria rallada, piña triturada escurrida,\r\nleche y aceite. Batir las claras hasta\r\na punto de nieve, luego agregar el azúcar restante y\r\nbatir hasta que esté rígido y brillante nuevamente.","Agrega la mezcla húmeda a la seca hasta que\r\nsuave y sin grumos, luego usando un\r\ncuchara o espátula grande de metal, doblar hacia adentro\r\nla mezcla de clara de huevo. Dividir uniformemente\r\nentre los moldes y hornear por 25 minutos.\r\nhasta que suba y salga un pincho\r\nlimpio. Es posible que necesites cambiar el\r\nPosición de las latas después de 20 min.","Para la llovizna, saque la maracuyá.\r\npulpa en una cacerola pequeña. Agrega la piña\r\njugo y azúcar en polvo y calentar hasta\r\nburbujee, luego burbujee hasta que esté espeso. Para\r\nel glaseado, batir el queso y la mantequilla\r\nhasta que no queden grumos, luego agregue el azúcar glas\r\ny vainilla. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para armar.","Pinchar todas las tartas con una brocheta,\r\nrocíe sobre la mayor parte del almíbar de pasión,\r\nluego enfriar. Una vez frío, esparcir el glaseado.\r\nsobre dos de las esponjas. Sándwich\r\njuntos y cubra con el tercero, sin hielo,\r\nesponja. Rocíe sobre el almíbar restante."]','2026-01-11 12:55:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13020,8993,'es','Pastel de bodas – limón picante','El segundo nivel de nuestro pastel de bodas de tres niveles le da un verdadero toque cítrico y el rocío de jarabe de limón lo mantiene maravillosamente húmedo.','["350 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","350 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","6 huevos batidos","140 g de harina común","280 g de harina con levadura","ralladura de 4 limones, jugo de 3 (aproximadamente 100 ml/3½ fl oz)","ralladura y jugo de 2 limones","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3. Preparar el interior y el exterior de un molde de 23 cm, como antes. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos, luego incorporar gradualmente los huevos poco a poco. Agregue una cucharada de harina común si comienza a partirse. Incorporar las harinas y una pizca de sal, seguido de la ralladura y el jugo de limón.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde y hornee durante 1 hora y 15 minutos hasta que esté bien leudado y dorado y al insertar un pincho éste salga limpio. Mientras tanto, haga el almíbar calentando el azúcar, la ralladura de limón y el jugo en una cacerola pequeña hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Dejar de lado.","Una vez que el pastel esté fuera del horno, déjelo enfriar hasta que esté tibio, luego use una brocheta para hacer agujeros hasta el fondo por todo el pastel. Vierta el almíbar y déjelo empapar completamente después de cada adición. Deje que se enfríe por completo, luego envuelva o rellene y coloque hielo en el pastel. El pastel sin relleno se conservará bien si lo envuelves con papel para hornear y film transparente hasta por 4 días, o en el congelador hasta por un mes."]','2026-01-11 12:55:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13021,8994,'es','pastel de chocolate','Sabemos que a todos os encanta el pastel de café tanto como el de chocolate, así que ¿por qué no combinar los dos?','["200 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","85 g de cacao en polvo de buena calidad, como Cafédirect o Green & Black''s","140 g de harina con levadura","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos","2 cucharadas de leche","2 tarrinas de mascarpone de 250 g","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 cucharadas de café muy fuerte (ver consejo a continuación)","50 g de chocolate negro, para rallar"]','["Calentar el horno, forrar los moldes y hacer el bizcocho como se describe en la receta \"comida bien\", tamizando el cacao en polvo con la harina y la levadura.","Para el relleno, bata el mascarpone y el azúcar y luego agregue el café. Use la mitad de la mezcla para emparedar los pasteles y extienda la otra mitad por encima, girando con el dorso de una cuchara para hacer rizos puntiagudos. Rallar finamente el chocolate por encima y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13022,8995,'es','Pastel Battenberg "peek-a-boo"','Un impresionante bizcocho de rosas y almendras con el distintivo patrón de cuadros, escondido en un dulce glaseado de mazapán.','["225 g de mantequilla salada muy blanda, más un poco más para engrasar","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","225 g de harina con levadura","85 g de almendras molidas","3 huevos grandes","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","1 cucharada de leche","225 g de mantequilla salada muy blanda","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","225 g de harina con levadura","85 g de almendras molidas","3 huevos grandes","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharadita de agua de rosas","1 cucharada de leche","un poco de colorante alimentario rosa artificial (ver consejo a continuación)","tarro de mermelada de albaricoque","1 cucharadita de agua de rosas","un poco de azúcar glas, para espolvorear","2 paquetes de mazapán blanco de 500g (tendrás sobras, pero mejor tener sobras que quedarte corto)"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrasar y forrar la base de 2 redondos de 18cm.\r\nmoldes para sándwiches con papel para hornear.","Empezar por el bizcocho de almendras: poner todo\r\nlos ingredientes en un bol y batir con\r\nuna batidora eléctrica hasta que salga la mezcla\r\njuntos sin problemas. Pesar la mezcla y\r\nesparza exactamente la mitad en cada lata. Hornear para\r\n30 minutos – cuando introduces una brocheta\r\npor el medio debe salir limpio. genial\r\nen las latas durante 15 minutos, luego voltee con cuidado\r\ncolóquelo sobre rejillas para terminar de enfriar mientras\r\nhaces la segunda esponja.","Limpiar las latas, luego engrasar y forrar.\r\ncomo arriba. Batir la mantequilla,\r\nazúcar, harina, almendras molidas, huevos,\r\nvainilla, agua de rosas y leche como arriba.\r\nCuando esté suave, agregue un poco de rosa.\r\ncolorante alimentario, poco a poco, hasta conseguir\r\nun bonito color – se desvanecerá un poco durante\r\nhornear, para que puedas hacerlo un poco más fuerte\r\nde lo que quieres la esponja terminada.\r\nPesar, dividir entre las latas y\r\nhornee como arriba. Enfriar de la misma manera.","Una vez que los bizcochos estén fríos, tapar\r\nsuavemente y enfríe durante 30 minutos; esto\r\nhacer que cortarlos sea más fácil y ordenado.","Desenvolver los bizcochos y, si tienen\r\nEn forma de cúpula en el centro, recórtela para aplanarla. cortar\r\nun círculo de 6 cm de diámetro desde el centro de\r\ncada bizcocho (un cortador de galletas de 6 cm es ideal,\r\no hazte una plantilla de papel) y configura\r\na un lado. Luego corta un círculo de 12 cm de diámetro.\r\ndesde el centro de cada esponja trazando una\r\ncuchillo alrededor de un plato del mismo diámetro\r\n(o utilice otra plantilla de papel). Entonces de\r\ncada esponja debes terminar con un 6 cm\r\ncírculo, un aro de 12 cm y un aro de 18 cm.","Cambia los aros del medio de la almendra.\r\nesponjas con los anillos centrales del\r\nesponjas de rosas, y volver a colocar las piezas cortadas\r\njuntos. Manipule las esponjas con mucho cuidado,\r\npara evitar que se agriete o se desmorone\r\nbordes demasiado. deberías terminar\r\ncon 4 esponjas que parecen dianas.","Calentar la mermelada de albaricoque para que se derrita y luego colar.\r\ny agregue el agua de rosas. Cepilla un poco\r\nsobre la parte superior de una de las esponjas y\r\ncubra con una esponja alterna. repetir\r\npara apilar todas las capas. Sienta el pastel\r\nun plato para servir o un soporte para pasteles.","Espolvoree su superficie de trabajo con un poco\r\nazúcar glas y extiende tu mazapán\r\nhasta que sea lo suficientemente grande para cubrir el pastel (use\r\nun trozo de hilo para medir el bizcocho; ver\r\nconsejo a continuación). Unte un poco más de mermelada por todo el\r\nparte superior y lados del pastel. Usa tu balanceo\r\nalfiler para levantar el mazapán sobre el pastel,\r\nluego bájelo por los lados, presionando para\r\npalo. Recorta el mazapán de la base,\r\nLuego decora el pastel como más te guste. cortar\r\nen gajos y sírvalo con té. mantendrá\r\ndurante 3 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:55:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13023,8996,'es','Pastel de celebración de verano','Este pastel de frutas es impresionante pero fácil de hacer, perfecto para cumpleaños o como postre.','["Mezcla fácil para pastel de vainilla (consulte la receta a continuación; no necesitará el almíbar)","2 canastillas de 170 g de frambuesas","225 g de arándanos en canastilla","Tarro de 225 g de crema fresca","azúcar glas (opcional)"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre la base y los lados de un molde redondo de fondo suelto.\r\nMolde para bizcocho de 23cm con papel de horno antiadherente.\r\nPrepare la masa para pastel de vainilla fácil (ver ''Combina bien''), extienda la mitad en el molde,\r\nluego mezcle la mitad de las bayas con lo que está\r\nizquierda. Vierta esto sobre la primera capa y\r\nalisa la parte superior. Hornee por 1 hora 30 minutos;\r\ncompruébalo con una brocheta, debe salir limpio.","Deje enfriar durante 30 minutos, luego retírelo de\r\nel molde y dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.\r\nUna vez completamente frío, poner en un plato,\r\nalisar la crème fraîche y apilar\r\nlas bayas restantes en la parte superior. polvo\r\ncon azúcar glas, si se usa. el pastel es mejor\r\nSe come fresco, pero se conserva en el frigorífico durante\r\nhasta 2 días; volver a la temperatura ambiente\r\nantes de cubrir con la crema y la fruta\r\ny servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13024,8997,'es','Pastel de bodas – rico pastel de chocolate amargo','Esta receta hace la capa inferior de nuestro pastel de bodas de tres niveles o un delicioso pastel de chocolate simple, perfecto con un toque de crema.','["650 g de mantequilla sin sal","650 g de chocolate natural (70% cacao)","100 ml de café muy fuerte; el espresso es ideal","3 cucharaditas de esencia de vainilla","650 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","950 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","10 huevos","2 x 284 ml/9½ fl oz de crema agria"]','["Caliente el horno a 160 ° C / ventilador 140 ° C / gas 3. Unte con mantequilla, forre dos líneas y envuelva los lados del molde para pastel redondo de 30 cm de profundidad como antes. Coloque la mantequilla y el chocolate en una cacerola mediana, luego revuelva a fuego lento hasta que se derrita y quede suave. Agrega el café y la vainilla.","Tamiza la harina, la levadura en polvo y el bicarbonato en el bol más grande que tengas. Agrega el azúcar, deshaciendo los grumos con las yemas de los dedos si es necesario. Batir los huevos y la crema agria en una jarra o bol y verter en la mezcla de harina. Vierta también la mezcla de chocolate derretido, luego revuelva con una cuchara de madera hasta obtener una masa de chocolate espesa y uniforme.","Vierta en el molde preparado y hornee durante 2½ horas; no abra la puerta del horno antes de que pasen las 2 horas, ya que esto hará que el pastel se hunda. Una vez cocido dejar en el molde hasta que se enfríe por completo. El bizcocho sin relleno se conservará hasta cuatro días, envuelto como antes, o\r\ncongelado durante un mes."]','2026-01-11 12:55:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13025,8998,'es','Tarta de queso con chocolate de Dubái','Aproveche la tendencia del chocolate de Dubái en esta tarta de queso horneada. Con una base de hojaldre kataifi, relleno de pistacho y cobertura de ganache de chocolate, es espectacular','["100 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","200 g de galletas digestivas","50 g de pistachos sin cáscara y un poco más para decorar","50 g de masa kataifi tostada y un poco más para decorar","800 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","200 g de crema o mantequilla de pistacho","200 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de harina común","4 huevos","200 ml de nata agria","150ml de nata doble","100 g de chocolate amargo, finamente picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Untar con mantequilla un molde desmontable de 23 cm y forrar los lados con papel para hornear. Triture las galletas y los pistachos hasta obtener migajas finas en un procesador de alimentos. Vierta la mezcla en un bol, luego agregue la masa y la mantequilla derretida y mezcle bien. Presiona la mezcla en la base del molde y hornea por 10 minutos. Deja enfriar mientras haces el relleno.","Enjuague el procesador de alimentos, luego agregue el queso tierno, la crema de pistacho, el azúcar, la vainilla, la harina, los huevos y la crema agria. Bate hasta que la mezcla esté suave y con una consistencia similar a la crema doble. Coloque la base de la tarta de queso en una bandeja para hornear para recoger las gotas no deseadas que se escapen del molde y vierta con cuidado la mezcla de la tarta de queso sobre la base.","Reduzca la temperatura del horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3 y coloque la tarta de queso en el estante del medio, luego hornee por 45 minutos más. Después de este segundo horneado, apague el horno y deje que el pastel de queso se enfríe por dentro con la puerta cerrada durante 1 hora; no caiga en la tentación de mirar, o el pastel de queso podría romperse. Abre la puerta del horno pasado este tiempo y déjala entreabierta durante una hora más (puedes utilizar una cuchara de madera apoyada en la puerta para mantenerla ligeramente abierta). Deje enfriar durante una tercera hora a temperatura ambiente, luego cubra y enfríe durante la noche.","Para hacer la cobertura, caliente la crema doble en un recipiente resistente al calor en el microondas en ráfagas cortas o en una sartén pequeña a fuego lento hasta que esté humeante. Coloque el chocolate amargo en un recipiente resistente al calor, viértalo sobre la nata caliente y déjelo reposar unos minutos, luego revuelva para obtener una ganache suave. Vierta esto con cuidado sobre la capa de tarta de queso y extiéndalo rápidamente hasta el borde antes de que cuaje. Espolvoree los pistachos adicionales y la masa kataifi alrededor del borde. Enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos, luego retírelo del molde y retire con cuidado el pergamino antes de servir. Se mantendrá frío hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13026,8999,'es','Tarta de queso japonesa (chizu keki)','Pruebe este pastel de queso al estilo japonés con su característica textura esponjosa y ondulante. Decorar con frutos rojos y hojas de menta para servir.','["250 g de queso tierno, a temperatura ambiente","35 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","60ml de leche","3 huevos, separados","2 cucharadas de jugo de yuzu","20 g de harina de maíz, tamizada","15 g de harina común, tamizada","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","fresas, arándanos y unas hojas de menta, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forrar la base y los lados de un molde desmontable de 18 cm con papel para hornear. Envuelva el exterior de la lata con papel de aluminio para que sea hermético.","Llene un recipiente o cacerola pequeña resistente al calor con agua recién hervida. Coloque el queso tierno, la mantequilla y la leche en un recipiente grande resistente al calor y colóquelo sobre la cacerola con agua caliente. Dejar unos minutos para que la mantequilla se derrita, luego revolver con una espátula hasta que se derrita por completo y la mezcla quede suave. Retirar del fuego. Agregue las yemas de huevo y el jugo de yuzu, luego mezcle suavemente las harinas tamizadas hasta que estén combinadas. Cuele la mezcla a través de un colador y viértala en otro tazón para asegurar una masa suave. Enfría en la nevera mientras preparas el resto de la tarta de queso.","En un bol limpio, bata las claras, agregando poco a poco el azúcar, hasta obtener picos suaves (con cuidado de no batir demasiado). Agrega un tercio a la mezcla de queso para aflojarla, luego incorpora suavemente los dos tercios restantes en dos tandas, creando una masa ligera y aireada. Vierta en el molde para pastel preparado.","Coloque el molde para pastel en un molde para hornear mediano y llénelo hasta la mitad con agua recién hervida para crear un baño de agua. Hornee durante 20 minutos, luego reduzca la temperatura del horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼. Continúe horneando durante 1 hora o hasta que la parte superior esté dorada.","Retire el bizcocho del horno y saque el molde del baño maría inmediatamente. Retire con cuidado el papel de aluminio y deje enfriar la tarta de queso en el molde. Este paso es crucial para evitar que la esponja se encoja. Se mantendrá cubierto y refrigerado hasta por cinco días. Una vez enfriado, decora con fresas, arándanos y unas hojas de menta."]','2026-01-11 12:55:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13027,9000,'es','Tarta de queso con fresas al horno de siguiente nivel','Realce la tarta de queso con fresas con una corteza mantecosa y un relleno horneado que es aterciopelado y rico sin dejar de ser ligero. Es un postre de verano impresionante.','["120 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida, más un poco más para la lata","300 g de galletas digestivas","25 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","750 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos","200 ml de nata agria","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 limón, rallado","2 cucharadas de harina común","400 g de fresas cortadas por la mitad","25 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de mermelada de fresa","1 cucharada de jugo de limón"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Untar con mantequilla un molde desmontable de 20 cm y forrar la base con papel para hornear. Triture las galletas hasta obtener migajas finas en un procesador de alimentos, o colóquelas en una bolsa para alimentos y golpéelas con un rodillo. Vierta en un tazón. Agrega la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que la mezcla parezca arena húmeda. Presione la mezcla firmemente en la base de la lata, luego use el dorso de una cuchara o un vaso para presionar las migajas hacia los lados en una capa uniforme. Enfríe durante 20 minutos para que se endurezca.","Mientras tanto, para el relleno, bata el queso tierno y el azúcar en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave y cremoso. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Incorpora la crema agria, la vainilla y la ralladura de limón, luego tamiza la harina y mezcla hasta que esté combinado. Raspar el relleno sobre la base de galleta y alisar la superficie con una espátula.","Coloque la tarta de queso en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante aproximadamente 1 hora y 10 minutos, o hasta que el centro esté listo con una ligera oscilación. Apagar el horno y dejar enfriar la tarta de queso dentro con la puerta del horno entreabierta durante 1 hora. (Esto ayuda a evitar que se agriete). Una vez enfriado, transfiéralo al refrigerador y déjelo enfriar durante al menos 4 horas, o durante la noche.","Mientras tanto, para la cobertura, coloque las fresas en un colador colocado encima de un tazón, luego esparza el azúcar y revuelva para combinar. Dejar macerar las fresas durante 1 hora aproximadamente. Vierta el jugo de fresa del bol en una cacerola pequeña con la mermelada y el jugo de limón, y caliente a fuego lento hasta que la mermelada se derrita y la mezcla esté brillante. Mezcle las fresas con la mezcla de mermelada y luego apílelas sobre la tarta de queso fría. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días. Retire con cuidado la tarta de queso del molde, transfiérala a un plato para servir y córtela en trozos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13028,9001,'es','Tarta de queso con gelatina de terrazo','Prueba este postre brillante y divertido. Cubos de gelatina suspendidos en una cremosa tarta de queso para crear un contraste de texturas y un bonito efecto terrazo.','["Paquete 135g gelatina de naranja","Paquete de 135g de gelatina de frambuesa","300 g de galletas digestivas","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","4 hojas de gelatina","300ml de nata doble","100 g de azúcar en polvo","500 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Primero, haz la gelatina de naranja. Hervir la tetera, romper los cubitos de gelatina de naranja y verterlos en una jarra o bol. Vierta 250 ml de agua hirviendo y revuelva hasta que se disuelva, agregue otros 100 ml de agua fría y mezcle bien. Vierta en un recipiente o bandeja pequeña (la nuestra era de 20 x 30 cm) y déjela enfriar a temperatura ambiente, luego enfríe durante al menos 2 horas o hasta que cuaje.","Repite el mismo proceso con la gelatina de frambuesa.","Forre los lados de un molde desmontable de 23 cm con papel para hornear. Mezcle las galletas en un procesador de alimentos o colóquelas en una bolsa de alimentos y tritúrelas hasta obtener migajas finas con un rodillo. Transfiera a un tazón y agregue la mantequilla derretida hasta que la mezcla parezca arena húmeda. Vierta en la lata preparada y presione en la base con el dorso de una cuchara hasta obtener una capa suave y uniforme. Enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Llena un recipiente grande con agua fría, agrega las hojas de gelatina una a la vez para evitar que se peguen y asegurándote de que queden completamente sumergidas. Dejar actuar 5 minutos hasta que esté suave. Mientras tanto, en un cazo calentar suavemente la nata y el azúcar durante unos minutos hasta que el azúcar se disuelva y la nata humee. Retirar del fuego. Saque cada hoja de gelatina del agua, exprima el exceso de agua y revuelva con la crema caliente hasta que toda la gelatina se haya agregado y disuelta. Deje enfriar a temperatura ambiente, unos 30 minutos.","Vierta el queso tierno, la vainilla y la nata enfriada en un bol y bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede espeso y cremoso.","Cortar las gelatinas en cubos pequeños de aproximadamente 1 cm y luego, con mucho cuidado, incorporarlas a la mezcla cremosa, procurando no romperlas. Vierta la mezcla en el molde desmontable y alise la parte superior con una espátula. Enfriar durante al menos 3 horas.","Retire la tarta de queso del molde y transfiérala con cuidado a un plato, luego córtela en rodajas para servir. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13029,9002,'es','Tarta de queso con grosellas negras','Utilice grosellas negras recolectadas para hacer esta deliciosa tarta de queso, con la clásica base de galleta digestiva y una cobertura cremosa. Es un magnífico postre de verano.','["140 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida, más un poco más para la lata","300 g de galletas digestivas","275 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de grosellas negras frescas o congeladas (llevadas a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora antes de usarlas, si están congeladas)","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","900 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","4 cucharadas de harina común","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos","200 ml de nata agria"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Untar con mantequilla el costado de un molde desmontable de 23 cm y forrar con papel para hornear. Coloque las galletas en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una miga fina, luego agregue la mantequilla y mezcle nuevamente para combinar. Vierta en el molde, luego presione firmemente hasta formar una capa uniforme y hornee durante 10 minutos. Dejar de lado.","Vierta 25 g de azúcar y las grosellas negras en una cacerola pequeña. Mezcle la harina de maíz con 1 cucharada de agua fría y luego agréguela a la sartén. Caliente a fuego medio-bajo durante 1-2 minutos hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, luego suba el fuego a medio y burbujee durante 1-2 minutos hasta que esté picante. Dejar de lado.","Batir el queso tierno en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave. Agrega el azúcar restante y bate nuevamente, luego agrega la harina, la vainilla, los huevos y la crema agria, luego bate por tercera vez hasta que quede suave y bien combinado.","Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de tarta de queso sobre la base de galleta enfriada y luego salpique sobre la mitad de la salsa de grosellas negras enfriada. Vierta sobre el resto de la mezcla de tarta de queso y alise con cuidado la superficie con una espátula. Rocíe sobre el resto de la salsa de grosellas negras y luego extiéndalo suavemente a través de la mezcla de tarta de queso con una brocheta o la punta de una cuchara. Hornee por 10 minutos, luego reduzca la temperatura del horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼ y hornee por 30 minutos más hasta que cuaje con una ligera oscilación en el medio. Apagar el horno y dejar la tarta de queso dentro con la puerta cerrada durante 1 hora, luego abrir ligeramente la puerta y dejar actuar 1 hora más. Finalmente, déjelo enfriar completamente a temperatura ambiente, luego enfríe durante al menos 3 horas o toda la noche antes de cortarlo. Se mantendrá frío durante cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13030,9003,'es','Tarta de queso con moras','Invite a familiares y amigos a este postre cremoso a finales del verano y principios del otoño. Está cubierto con moras frescas (o use frambuesas durante los meses de verano).','["150 g de galletas digestivas","50 g de almendras molidas","100 g de mantequilla derretida","700 g de queso tierno","220 g de azúcar granulada","1 cucharada de extracto de vainilla, más 1 cucharadita","3 huevos","250 g de moras, más un puñado para servir","250 g de crema agria","unas hojas de menta, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Mezclar las galletas trituradas con las almendras y la mantequilla, luego presionar la mezcla en el fondo de un molde para pasteles de 18-20 cm, forrado con papel para hornear. Hornee durante 15 minutos, luego enfríe completamente hasta que la corteza se endurezca. Reduzca la temperatura del horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1 y coloque una bandeja para hornear llena de agua en el fondo del horno.","Batir el queso tierno con 200g de azúcar. Cuando esté completamente combinado, agregue el extracto de vainilla y bata todos los huevos, uno a la vez. Finalmente, agregue la crema agria.","Batir las moras en una licuadora y pasarlas por un colador fino, desechando las semillas. Te deberían quedar unos 60ml de puré de moras. Agrega 1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla y el azúcar restante, luego reserva. Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de tarta de queso sobre la base de galleta triturada y rocíe sobre la mitad del puré de moras. Utilice una brocheta para crear un \"remolino de moras\". Repita con la mitad restante de la mezcla y el puré de moras.","Hornea el pastel de queso durante 50 minutos a 1 hora o hasta que los bordes estén firmes y el centro aún se tambalee. Apaga el horno, abre un poco la puerta y deja que la tarta de queso se enfríe por dentro hasta que esté casi fría. Luego lo sacamos, lo dejamos enfriar por completo y lo metemos en el frigorífico durante la noche. Esparza sobre un puñado de moras frescas y algunas hojas de menta para servir. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13031,9004,'es','Tarta de queso con chocolate y naranja','Rica e indulgente, esta tarta de queso con sabor a fruta y chocolate y naranja no tarda mucho en prepararse. También puedes prepararlo la noche anterior, por lo que es perfecto para los próximos días ocupados.','["100 g de mantequilla","200 g de galletas digestivas","300 g de chocolate con sabor a naranja 275 g partido en trozos","400 g de queso crema","300ml de nata doble","75 g de azúcar glas","2 naranjas"]','["Forre la base y los lados de un molde para pastel de fondo suelto de 20 cm. Triture las galletas, ya sea pulsando en un procesador de alimentos o colóquelas en una bolsa para alimentos y tritúrelas con un rodillo. Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén o en el microondas y luego agregue las galletas trituradas. Presione hasta formar una capa uniforme en la base del molde y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Derretir los 275 g de chocolate en el microondas o en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo. Batir la crema hasta obtener picos suaves y luego incorporar el queso crema. Tamice el azúcar glas y mezcle bien, luego vierta el chocolate derretido y mezcle hasta que esté completamente combinado. Vierta la mezcla en el molde y nivele la parte superior con el dorso de la cuchara. Enfriar en el frigorífico durante 4 horas o toda la noche.","Cuando esté listo para servir, corte la parte superior e inferior de las naranjas con un cuchillo pequeño y afilado y luego corte la cáscara siguiendo la curva de la naranja. Sosteniendo la naranja con una mano sobre un bol, corte con cuidado cada gajo y escurra en un colador. Retire la tarta de queso del molde y coloque los gajos encima y luego ralle sobre el chocolate restante."]','2026-01-11 12:55:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13032,5177,'es','Tarta de queso con chocolate blanco y frambuesa sin gluten','Haga una versión de tarta de queso sin gluten utilizando galletas digestivas sin gluten como base. Cubra con un relleno sedoso de chocolate blanco y frambuesa.','["200g de chocolate blanco, más extra para decorar (opcional)","275 g de galletas digestivas sin gluten","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","500 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","300ml de nata doble","300 g de frambuesas frescas"]','["Una hora antes de empezar, saca todos los ingredientes de la nevera y deja que alcancen la temperatura ambiente. Forre la base de un molde desmontable de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Derretir el chocolate blanco en un recipiente resistente al calor en el microondas durante 1 minuto, revolviendo a la mitad. Si es necesario, vuelva a colocarlo durante 10 segundos más hasta que el chocolate se derrita. Alternativamente, derrita el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el fondo del recipiente no toque el agua. Deja enfriar mientras haces la base.","Mezcle los digestivos en un procesador de alimentos, luego viértalos en un tazón o tritúrelos en el tazón con la punta de un rodillo. Vierta la mantequilla derretida y mezcle hasta que la textura parezca arena húmeda. Vierta en la lata preparada y presione hacia abajo para formar una capa uniforme. Mantenlo frío mientras haces el relleno.","Batir el queso tierno, el extracto de vainilla y la nata doble en un bol con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté espeso y cremoso. Incorpora el chocolate blanco derretido; si se atasca, puedes meter el tazón en el microondas durante 10 segundos antes de batir para volver a unirlo. Revuelve 250 g de frambuesas, asegurándote de que se rompan un poco para darle un poco de ondulación.","Vierta la mezcla de tarta de queso sobre la base de galleta y alise hasta obtener una capa uniforme. Déjelo enfriar en el refrigerador durante al menos 6 horas o toda la noche. Se mantendrá frío durante dos días. Para servir, retírelo con cuidado del molde y esparza sobre las frambuesas restantes, luego ralle sobre un poco de chocolate blanco, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:55:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13033,9005,'es','Tarta de queso con grosellas','Combine grosellas picantes con cordial dulce de flor de saúco y mascarpone cremoso en esta tarta de queso ligera. Es un magnífico postre de verano, perfecto para una fiesta.','["750 g de grosellas","4 cucharadas de cordial de flor de saúco","1 naranja, rallada y en jugo","125 g de galletas de jengibre","125 g de galletas digestivas","125 g de mantequilla sin sal","500 g de queso tierno","250 g de mascarpone","125 g de azúcar glas"]','["Vierta las grosellas, 2 cucharadas de cordial de flor de saúco y el jugo de naranja en una cacerola. Cocine a fuego medio durante 10 minutos hasta que las grosellas se ablanden pero no se descompongan por completo. Dejar de lado.","Forre la base de un molde desmontable de 23 cm de profundidad con papel para hornear. Mezcle todas las galletas en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener migajas finas y luego viértalas en un tazón. Derrita la mantequilla a fuego lento y agregue las migas de galleta para combinar. Vierta en la lata y presione hacia abajo hasta obtener una base uniforme. Enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos o hasta 1 hora.","Ponga el queso tierno, el mascarpone, el cordial restante y la ralladura de naranja en un bol y mezcle bien para combinar. Tamizar el azúcar glas y mezclar todo. Incorpora tres cuartas partes de las grosellas cocidas junto con 1 cucharada de su líquido de cocción y luego viértela sobre la base de galleta. Enfríe durante al menos 4 horas o toda la noche.","Justo antes de servir, retira la tarta de queso del molde y colócala en un plato o soporte para tartas. Coloque las grosellas restantes sobre el centro de la tarta de queso, junto con un chorrito del líquido de cocción."]','2026-01-11 12:55:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13034,9006,'es','Cuadrados de tarta de queso PB&J sin hornear','Prueba estos cuadritos de tarta de queso con mantequilla de maní y mermelada. Hemos elegido un aderezo de fruta, pero puedes optar por chocolate, convirtiéndolo en una taza gigante de mantequilla de maní.','["100 g de mantequilla","250 g de galletas digestivas trituradas en migajas finas","500 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","100 g de azúcar glas","237 g de mantequilla de maní crujiente","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","300ml de nata doble","4 cubos de gelatina de frambuesa, picada en trozos más pequeños","200 g de frambuesas congeladas y descongeladas","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo"]','["Forra un molde para hornear cuadrado de 18 a 20 cm con una tira de papel para hornear, dejando los extremos colgando; esto te ayudará a levantar la tarta de queso más tarde. Coloque la mantequilla en un recipiente grande resistente al calor que tenga un borde ancho y colóquelo sobre un recipiente resistente al calor más pequeño lleno de agua hirviendo del hervidor. Deje reposar por un minuto, luego revuelva hasta que esté completamente suave. Agregue las galletas trituradas, luego vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado, presionándola con el dorso de una cuchara.","Batir el queso tierno, el azúcar glas, la mantequilla de maní y la vainilla en un tazón hasta que estén bien combinados. Batir la crema doble en un tazón aparte hasta que mantenga su forma. Incorpore esto suavemente a la mezcla de mantequilla de maní, luego extiéndalo sobre la base de galleta y alise la superficie con el dorso de una cuchara. Enfríelo durante al menos 1 hora para que cuaje. Se mantendrá frío hasta por un día.","Mientras tanto, vierte los cubitos de gelatina en un recipiente resistente al calor y vierte sobre 100 ml de agua hirviendo. Revuelva para disolver, luego agregue las frambuesas y el azúcar y revuelva, triturando las bayas con la cuchara. Pasar por un colador hasta una jarra y luego verterlo sobre la tarta de queso ya preparada. Enfríe durante al menos 4 horas. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días. Pasa un cuchillo por los lados y luego usa el pergamino que sobresale para levantar el pastel de queso sobre una tabla. Cortar en cuadrados."]','2026-01-11 12:55:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13035,9007,'es','Tarta de queso con durazno','Esta impresionante tarta de queso utiliza melocotones enlatados, merengue y una superficie de masa enrejada para crear un delicioso postre para compartir.','["5 huevos, separados, más 7 yemas","375 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharada de azúcar de vainilla","1 naranja","450 g de harina común","80 g de harina de patata","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","500 g de mantequilla, fría","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","1 kg de requesón, a temperatura ambiente","50 g de pudín de vainilla (o harina de maíz más 1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla)","3 gotas de extracto de naranja","1 lata de duraznos"]','["Batir 4 yemas de huevo con 125 g de azúcar glas y el azúcar de vainilla hasta que estén suaves y esponjosas. Escaldar la naranja con agua caliente y rallar la ralladura.","Tamizar la harina común y la harina de patata y colocarlas sobre una tabla de repostería o una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada, junto con la levadura en polvo. Rallar más de 250 g de mantequilla y picarla a través de la harina con un cuchillo y luego frotarla para que la mezcla parezca más migajas. Vierta la mezcla de yemas y ralladura de naranja y junte la mezcla, luego amase hasta obtener una masa suave.","Cortar un tercio de la masa, envolverla bien y reservar en el frigorífico. Extiende la masa restante y úsala para forrar la base y los lados de un molde desmontable de 26 cm que ya has forrado con un círculo de papel para hornear untado con mantequilla. Metemos el molde en el frigorífico durante 20 minutos. Calienta el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Cubra la masa con papel para hornear y rellénela con frijoles para mantener los lados en su lugar, luego hornee la base durante 10-15 minutos.","Para hacer el relleno, pasa el requesón por un colador de metal. Batir el resto de la mantequilla hasta que esté suave y esponjosa, añadir el queso, 8 yemas de huevo, 80 g de azúcar glas, el pudín en polvo y el extracto de naranja. Mezcle durante unos 2 minutos hasta que quede esponjoso. Batir 2 claras de huevo con una pizca de sal hasta que estén firmes y añadir el azúcar glas restante para hacer una mezcla de merengue firme. Incorpora las claras a la mezcla de cuajada.","Batir las 3 claras restantes con el azúcar en polvo hasta obtener una textura de merengue. Desenvolver la masa cruda y rallarla con un rallador de dientes grandes. Unte la mezcla de queso sobre la base horneada. Escurre los melocotones, córtalos en trozos más pequeños y ponlos encima del relleno de queso. Cubrir la masa con merengue y luego espolvorear un poco de masa rallada por encima. Amasar el resto de la masa, extenderla, cortar tiras finas y colocarlas en forma de celosía. Hornee durante 50 minutos-1 hora. Deje enfriar en el horno apagado durante 40 minutos antes de retirar. Dejar enfriar por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:55:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13036,9008,'es','Huevos de Pascua rellenos de tarta de queso','Invite a familiares y amigos a este delicioso postre de Pascua con galletas trituradas y un relleno cremoso de tarta de queso envasado en huevos de chocolate huecos.','["1 huevo de Pascua de chocolate hueco","75 g de galletas digestivas","25 g de mantequilla, derretida","75 g de mascarpone","100 g de queso tierno","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas, tamizada","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo, tamizado","100 g de nata doble","Delicias de Pascua, como mini huevos de chocolate o chocolates desmenuzados","salsa de caramelo o chocolate derretido enfriado"]','["Separe con cuidado el huevo de Pascua por la mitad a lo largo de la costura. (Use un cuchillo sumergido en un recipiente con agua caliente para cortar la costura en lugar de rebanarlo, ya que podría romper el chocolate).","Vierta las galletas digestivas en un tazón o bolsa de comida y tritúrelas hasta obtener migajas con la punta de un rodillo. Agregue la mantequilla derretida hasta que la mezcla parezca arena húmeda. Vierta esto en las mitades de los huevos de Pascua y empáquelos suavemente con el dorso de la cuchara. Enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Mezcle el mascarpone, el queso tierno, el azúcar glas y el cacao en un tazón mediano con una cuchara de madera hasta que quede suave. En un recipiente aparte, bata la nata doble hasta obtener picos suaves con una batidora eléctrica. Incorpora suavemente la crema batida a la mezcla de mascarpone, luego vierte con cuidado el relleno de tarta de queso sobre las bases de galletas frías en los huevos de Pascua. Nivele suavemente las superficies con una espátula o una espátula, luego enfríe durante al menos 2 horas o durante la noche hasta que esté firme y listo. Es posible que le quede relleno adicional de tarta de queso, dependiendo del tamaño de sus huevos de Pascua; esto se puede servir en vasos sobre migajas digestivas adicionales para otra delicia.","Esparce los huevos rellenos de tarta de queso con mini huevos de chocolate u otras delicias de Pascua, luego rocía con caramelo o chocolate derretido para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13037,9009,'es','Tarta de queso vegana al horno con frambuesas y clementina','Disfrute de una tarta de queso horneada hecha con anacardos para una versión vegana de un postre clásico. Con clementinas, frambuesas y pistachos, es perfecto para Navidad','["100 g de anacardos sin sal","175 g de crema de coco","150 g de queso tierno vegano","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","70 ml de jarabe de arce","50 g de aceite de coco, derretido","½ limón, exprimido","200 g de frambuesas","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","50 g de pistachos sin cáscara, picados en trozos grandes","50 g de piel de clementina confitada","200 g de gachas de avena","75 g de azúcar en polvo","4 cucharadas de aceite de coco, derretido"]','["Coloque los anacardos en un recipiente grande resistente al calor y cúbralos con agua hirviendo del hervidor. Dejar ablandar durante 1 h.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forrar la base de un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm (4 cm de profundidad) con papel para hornear. Para hacer la base, poner la avena, el azúcar y una pizca de sal en un procesador de alimentos y triturar hasta obtener un polvo fino. Agregue el aceite de coco hasta que se combinen, luego agregue gradualmente 3-4 cucharadas de agua hasta formar una masa; debe quedar quebradiza, no pegajosa.","Presione la masa en la base y hacia los lados del molde con el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Dejar enfriar.","Reducir el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Escurrir los anacardos, luego transferirlos a la blendera junto con la crema de coco, el queso tierno, la harina de maíz, la vainilla, el jarabe de arce, el aceite de coco, el jugo de limón y una pizca de sal. Bate a alta velocidad hasta que la mezcla esté cremosa y suave.","Vierta la mezcla de anacardos y queso tierno sobre la base y hornee durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 15 minutos hasta que el borde adquiera color y el centro se haya endurecido en su mayor parte con solo una ligera oscilación. Deje que se enfríe por completo (se hundirá ligeramente a medida que se enfríe), luego enfríe durante al menos 3 horas o durante la noche.","Coloque las frambuesas y el azúcar en un recipiente resistente al calor y cocine en el microondas durante 1 minuto y 30 segundos a temperatura alta. Revuelva y deje enfriar por completo, luego viértalo sobre la tarta de queso. Esparza sobre los pistachos y la cáscara de clementina confitada. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13038,9010,'es','Tarta de queso con calabaza','Celebre el otoño con esta tarta de queso horneada de temporada. Con un relleno cremoso, delicioso y ligeramente especiado y una base de jengibre crujiente, vale la pena el esfuerzo.','["80 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","275 g de galletas digestivas o de jengibre","1 clara de huevo grande (use la yema de huevo en el relleno, a continuación)","800 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","Lata de 425g de puré de calabaza","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","50 g de harina común","5 huevos grandes, más 1 yema grande","400 ml de nata para montar","canela molida o especia de calabaza, para espolvorear","25 g de nueces picadas","3 cucharadas de salsa de caramelo"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pastel de fondo suelto de 22 cm de profundidad y cubrir con papel para hornear. Envuelva la base y los lados del molde con tres capas de film transparente, seguido de tres capas de papel de aluminio (esto ayuda a mantenerlo impermeable durante el horneado). Dobla un paño de cocina limpio y colócalo en el fondo de una fuente para asar más grande.","Triture las galletas hasta obtener migajas en un procesador de alimentos. Agregue la mantequilla derretida y presione para cubrir las migajas. Vierta la mezcla en el molde para pastel preparado, extendiéndola hacia un lado y presionando hacia abajo con el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee por 10 minutos. Retirar del horno, untar con la clara de huevo y hornear por otros 3 minutos (esto ayudará a evitar que la base se empape).","Para hacer el relleno, poner el queso tierno en un bol o en el bol de una batidora y batir con una batidora eléctrica o con la batidora hasta que se suelte. Agrega el puré de calabaza, el azúcar y la harina y bate nuevamente hasta que se combinen. Con el motor en marcha, agrega poco a poco los huevos y la yema hasta que la mezcla esté suave y cremosa. Vierta el relleno sobre la base de galleta horneada y luego coloque el molde para pastel sobre el paño de cocina en la fuente para asar. Vierta una tetera con agua recién hervida en el molde para hornear de modo que el agua llegue hasta la mitad del costado del molde para pastel.","Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego reduzca la temperatura del horno a 110 ° C/90 ° C ventilador/gas ¼. Hornee durante 1 hora y 30 minutos más hasta que la tarta de queso esté firme y se tambalee ligeramente en el medio cuando agite suavemente el molde. Apague el horno, luego abra un poco la puerta del horno y deje que el cheesecake se enfríe por dentro durante 2 horas hasta que esté completamente frío. Retirar del horno y enfriar durante la noche.","Retire con cuidado la tarta de queso fría del molde y transfiérala a un soporte para tartas o a un plato para servir. Batir la crema hasta obtener picos suaves con una batidora eléctrica y verter grandes porciones sobre la tarta de queso. Espolvoree con un poco de canela o especias de calabaza, espolvoree sobre las nueces picadas y rocíe con la salsa de caramelo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13039,9011,'es','Tarta de queso con chocolate blanco, mascarpone y pistachos','Prueba esta tarta de queso al horno diferente. Con un sabor ligeramente ácido, además de sabores a chocolate blanco y pistacho, es un postre celestial.','["mantequilla, para la lata","100 gramos de chocolate blanco","200 g de galletas digestivas trituradas","500 g de mascarpone","200 g de yogur entero","3 huevos","100 g de azúcar en polvo","1 limón, rallado y ½ jugo","½ cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","50 g de pistachos sin cáscara, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de azúcar glas (opcional)","bayas mixtas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Forre la base de un molde desmontable de 20 cm de profundidad con papel para hornear y unte con mantequilla la base y los lados. Derrita el chocolate blanco en un recipiente grande resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo (asegúrese de que el fondo del recipiente no toque el agua). Alternativamente, derrita el chocolate en el microondas en períodos cortos. Cuando el chocolate esté completamente suave, incorpora las galletas y una pizca de sal. Presione en la base de la lata, hasta los bordes, asegurándose de que la base esté uniforme. Poner en el frigorífico para que se enfríe durante al menos 20 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1. Batir el mascarpone, el yogur, los huevos, el azúcar en polvo, la ralladura y el jugo de limón y la pasta de vainilla con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave, luego volcar la base de galleta. Transfiera el molde a una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 45 minutos hasta que esté casi listo, con solo una ligera oscilación en el medio. Apaga el horno con la tarta de queso dentro y deja la puerta entreabierta. Deja que la tarta de queso se enfríe por completo.","Una vez que esté completamente frío y listo, afloje los lados y la base del molde con un cuchillo y transfiera con cuidado el pastel de queso a un plato para servir. Esparza los pistachos y espolvoréelos con azúcar glas, luego sirva con las bayas a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:55:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13040,9012,'es','Tarta de queso con masa de galleta','Celebre la Pascua con nuestro cremoso pastel de queso y chocolate: tiene una rica base cubierta con masa para galletas y todo cubierto con una sedosa ganache. Decorar con mini huevos y galletas.','["aceite de girasol o vegetal, para la lata","200 g de chocolate con leche, picado","100 g de chocolate negro, picado","500 g de queso tierno","3 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 ml de nata agria","3 cucharadas de harina común","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","225 g de azúcar moreno blando","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","2 yemas de huevo (congela las claras para otra receta)","2 cucharadas de pasta de vainilla","3 cucharadas de leche","225 g de harina común","225 g de harina con levadura","200 g de chispas de chocolate amargo","100 g de chocolate negro, picado","100 g de chocolate con leche, picado","300ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","mini huevos de chocolate, nidos de chocolate y botones de chocolate blanco (ver consejos a continuación)"]','["Forre la base de un molde para pastel de fondo suelto de 20 cm de profundidad con papel para hornear, luego forre los lados con una tira de pergamino que sobresalga del molde unos 7 cm (ya que la tarta de queso crecerá en el horno). Engrase ligeramente el pergamino.","Haga la masa para galletas batiendo el azúcar y la mantequilla en una batidora de pie durante 5 minutos, o hasta que esté suave y esponjosa. Agrega las yemas de huevo, la pasta de vainilla y la leche, luego bate nuevamente hasta que estén bien combinados. Divida la mezcla entre dos tazones para mezclar, luego bata la harina común en una mitad de la mezcla y la levadura en la otra mitad. Divide las chispas de chocolate entre los dos tazones y vuelve a batir ambos hasta que las chispas de chocolate estén distribuidas uniformemente. Se mantendrá tapado en el frigorífico hasta por tres días.","Coloque la mezcla de harina con levadura en el refrigerador mientras presiona la masa de galleta de harina común en la base del molde para pastel preparado. Mantenlo frío en la nevera mientras preparas el resto de la tarta de queso.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear, luego saca del refrigerador la masa para galletas hecha con la harina con levadura. Pellizque trozos de masa y forme bolas del tamaño de canicas hasta haber usado toda la masa. Sepárelos en las bandejas para hornear y hornee durante 5-7 minutos o hasta que estén dorados. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Para hacer la parte principal de la tarta de queso, derrita los trozos de chocolate con leche y amargo en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo, luego déjelo a un lado para que se enfríe un poco. Batir el queso tierno en un tazón grande para aflojarlo, luego agregar un huevo a la vez. Incorpora el azúcar, la crema agria, la harina y la vainilla durante 5 minutos o hasta que esté suave y espumoso. Déjelo durante 20 minutos para que alcance la temperatura ambiente, luego vierta lentamente el chocolate y dóblelo suavemente hasta que la mezcla tenga un color uniforme.","Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3½. Saca el molde de la nevera y vierte la mezcla de chocolate y queso sobre la base de masa para galletas. Hornee durante 40 minutos o hasta que cuaje encima con un ligero tambaleo en el centro, luego apague el horno y deje que el pastel de queso adentro se enfríe lentamente durante 3 horas (se hundirá ligeramente en el medio). Enfriar en la nevera hasta que esté completamente frío.","Para la ganache, poner el chocolate negro y el chocolate con leche en un bol resistente al calor. Poner la nata y el azúcar en un cazo y poner a fuego medio hasta que hierva (no dejar que hierva), luego verter sobre el chocolate. Batir para derretir el chocolate y crear una mezcla suave y brillante. Enfríe en el refrigerador durante 1 hora o hasta que la ganache esté espesa y se pueda comer con una cuchara.","Cuando la tarta de queso esté fría, colóquela en un plato para servir o en un soporte para tartas y luego gírela sobre la ganache. Decora con las galletas de chocolate y unos mini huevos de chocolate, nidos de chocolate y botones de chocolate blanco, si gustas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13041,9013,'es','Tarta de queso funfetti','Lleva a la familia a la cocina con esta sencilla tarta de queso "funfetti". Utiliza solo siete ingredientes y no requiere cocción: perfecto para preparar con niños.','["75 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","200 g de galletas digestivas","600 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","75 g de azúcar glas","300ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de extracto de vainilla","6 cucharadas de chispas"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde para pasteles de fondo suelto de 20 cm. Coloque las galletas en una bolsa para alimentos y tritúrelas hasta obtener migajas con un rodillo o en un procesador de alimentos. Transfiera a un tazón y mezcle con la mantequilla. Vierta en la lata preparada y presione firmemente hasta formar una capa uniforme. Enfríe en el refrigerador durante 30 minutos o hasta que cuaje.","Batir el queso tierno y el azúcar glas con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que quede suave. Agrega la crema y la vainilla, luego continúa batiendo hasta que todo esté completamente combinado. Agregue 4 cucharadas de chispas y vierta la mezcla sobre la base de galleta. Golpee la lata sobre una superficie de trabajo para asegurarse de que no queden burbujas de aire, luego alise la superficie con una espátula o el dorso de una cuchara. Enfríe durante al menos 5 horas o toda la noche.","Saque la tarta de queso del refrigerador para que alcance la temperatura ambiente 30 minutos antes de servir. Coloca la lata encima de una lata y luego tira de los lados de la lata hacia abajo. Deslice con cuidado la tarta de queso en un plato para servir, luego retire el papel para hornear y la base del molde. Decora con las chispas restantes."]','2026-01-11 12:55:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13042,9014,'es','coulis de frambuesa','Prepare una tanda de coulis de frambuesa para usar como aderezo frutal para una tarta de queso, como salsa para postres, para mezclar con yogur o para verter sobre helado.','["450 g de frambuesas","½ limón pequeño, exprimido","3 cucharadas de azúcar glas"]','["Coloque todos los ingredientes en un procesador de alimentos pequeño o use una batidora de mano para batir hasta que quede muy suave.","Coloca un colador sobre una jarra. Vierta la mezcla en el colador y empuje el líquido con una espátula. Deseche las semillas. El coulis está listo para usar. Se mantendrá refrigerado en un frasco hermético hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13043,9015,'es','Tarta de queso con chocolate','Invite a familiares y amigos a este delicioso postre de chocolate. Es un final indulgente para una cena o comida familiar de fin de semana.','["150g de galletas digestivas (unas 10)","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","45 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","150 gramos de chocolate amargo","120ml de nata doble","2 cucharaditas de cacao en polvo","200 g de queso crema entero","115 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Para hacer la base de galleta, triture las galletas digestivas con un rodillo o páselas en un procesador de alimentos, luego viértalas en un tazón con el azúcar y la mantequilla y revuelva para combinar. Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde desmontable de 18 cm y vierta la mezcla de galletas, empujándola hacia abajo con el dorso de una cuchara. Enfriar en la nevera durante 30 min.","Para hacer la tarta de queso, derrita el chocolate en breves lapsos en el microondas y luego déjelo enfriar un poco. Batir la nata en un bol grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que se formen picos suaves y luego incorporar el cacao en polvo. Batir el queso crema y el azúcar, luego incorporar la mezcla de crema y el chocolate enfriado.","Vierta la mezcla de tarta de queso sobre la base de galleta, nivelándola con el dorso de una cuchara. Transfiera al congelador y congele durante 2 horas o hasta que cuaje. Retirar del molde y dejar a temperatura ambiente para que se ablande durante unos 20 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13044,9016,'es','Tarta de queso con yogur y albaricoques asados ​​con miel','Transforma tus postres con un chorrito de néctar dorado. Cubra esta tarta de queso con miel con albaricoques asados ​​con miel o cámbiela por cualquier fruta blanda o ruibarbo.','["75 g de mantequilla salada, derretida, más un poco más para la lata","200 g de galletas de crema pastelera","250ml de nata doble","150 g de yogur griego entero","500 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","3 cucharadas de miel líquida","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla","6 albaricoques maduros, partidos por la mitad y sin hueso (unos 240 g)","50 g de miel líquida, más 2 cucharadas para servir","1 naranja pequeña, ralladura cortada en tiras","½ vaina de vainilla, cortada por la mitad a lo largo"]','["Unte con mantequilla la base de un molde desmontable de 23 cm y forre con un círculo de papel para hornear. Triture las galletas hasta obtener migajas finas en un procesador de alimentos, luego viértalas en un tazón y mezcle con la mantequilla. Empaque la mezcla en la base del molde y enfríe durante 10 minutos.","Batir la nata doble hasta obtener picos suaves. En un recipiente aparte, mezcle el yogur, el queso tierno, la miel y la vainilla hasta que quede suave. Incorporar la nata y verter sobre la base. Alise por encima con una espátula y cubra. Enfríe durante al menos 4 horas o toda la noche.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle los albaricoques con 50 g de miel, la ralladura de naranja y la vainilla en una bandeja para horno. Ase en el estante del medio durante 20 a 25 minutos hasta que los albaricoques estén tiernos pero aún mantengan su forma. Mezcle todo a la mitad y agregue 1 cucharada de agua si la miel comienza a cuajar. Dejar enfriar desechando la naranja y la vaina de vainilla.","Utilice un cuchillo para soltar los lados de la tarta de queso y retírela del molde. Vierta sobre los albaricoques junto con el jugo tostado. Rocíe más miel por encima, permitiendo que corra por los lados."]','2026-01-11 12:55:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13045,9017,'es','Tarta de queso con pudín navideño','Cruza un pudín navideño con una tarta de queso y ¿qué obtienes? Un fantástico postre festivo alternativo con una base de jengibre crujiente y un relleno cremoso.','["200 g de galletas de jengibre y nueces, trituradas","30 g de azúcar moscabado light","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas","110 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","240 g de pudín navideño","30ml de brandy","30ml de cerveza negra","1 naranja, rallada","2 tarrinas de 280 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","Bote de 300ml de nata doble","200 g de azúcar mascabado light","2 vainas de vainilla, partidas y semillas raspadas","2 clementines","azúcar moscabado ligero, para espolvorear"]','["Para hacer la base, mezcle las nueces de jengibre y el azúcar en un tazón grande y espolvoree la sal en escamas. Vierta la mantequilla derretida y mezcle con una cuchara de madera hasta formar una mezcla parecida a migas de galleta. Presione en un molde para pastel desmontable redondo de 20 cm, extendiendo la mezcla en una capa uniforme hasta las esquinas. Enfriar en el frigorífico durante 30 minutos hasta que cuaje.","Ponga el pudín de Navidad, el brandy, la cerveza negra y la ralladura de naranja en una licuadora y mezcle hasta obtener un puré.","Con una batidora eléctrica de mano, bata el queso crema con la nata doble, el azúcar y las semillas de vainilla, luego incorpore el puré. Extender la mezcla sobre la base de galleta y dejar enfriar en el frigorífico durante la noche.","Al día siguiente, pelamos las clementinas, las cortamos en rodajas y las colocamos en una bandeja de horno. Espolvorearlos con azúcar, luego soplete hasta que estén caramelizados y déjalos enfriar. Saca la tarta de queso del molde y coloca las clementinas encima. Se conservará durante tres días en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 12:55:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13046,9018,'es','Tarta de queso moscovado en olla de cocción lenta con avellanas y moras','Esta tarta de queso increíblemente cremosa tiene un suntuoso almíbar de bayas y un toque crujiente de avellanas tostadas para rematar: ideal para alimentar a una multitud.','["50 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para engrasar","225 g de galletas de avena (como las Hobnobs)","100 g de avellanas blanqueadas","250 g de azúcar mascabado light","4 cucharadas de leche entera","750 g de queso crema entero","2 cucharadas de harina común","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes","Bote de 200 ml de crema agria","1 cucharada de Frangelico (opcional)","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de moras"]','["Hierve la tetera y prepara tu olla de cocción lenta (de al menos 22 cm de ancho). Haz un salvamanteles para tu tarta de queso arrugando un trozo largo de papel de aluminio hasta formar una salchicha. Enrolle hasta formar un rollo suelto y colóquelo en el fondo de la olla de cocción lenta. Encienda la olla de cocción lenta a temperatura alta y vierta suficiente agua caliente para que suba 4 cm por los lados. Envuelva el exterior de un molde desmontable de 20 cm con dos capas de film transparente y luego con papel de aluminio; asegúrese de que no queden espacios por los que pueda filtrarse el agua. Engrase el interior con mantequilla, forre con film transparente y engrase nuevamente, luego forre la base y los lados con papel para hornear.","Vierta las galletas y 50 g de avellanas en un procesador de alimentos y triture hasta obtener migajas finas. Agrega la mantequilla y licúa nuevamente hasta que esté bien combinado. Vierta las migas en la lata; use una cuchara para presionar en la base. Enfriar durante 10 minutos.","En un cazo calentar el moscovado y la leche hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Dejar enfriar. En un bol batir el queso crema, la harina, la vainilla y los huevos hasta que quede suave. Agregue la crema agria, el Frangelico (si lo usa) y la mezcla de azúcar enfriada hasta que estén bien combinados. Vierta en el molde y póngalo con cuidado en la olla de cocción lenta. Envuelva la tapa en un paño de cocina para evitar que la condensación gotee sobre la tarta de queso. Tape y cocine por 2 horas, luego apague la olla de cocción lenta. Dejar la tarta de queso dentro sin abrir durante 2 hrs más. Retirar de la olla de cocción lenta y dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora más, luego enfriar durante 4 horas o toda la noche.","Poner en un cazo la maicena, el azúcar en polvo y la mitad de las moras y poner a fuego alto. Cocine durante 3-4 minutos, aplastando un poco las moras, hasta que queden almibaradas. Agregue las bayas restantes, caliente, luego retire del fuego y enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir. Picar las nueces restantes y tostarlas en una sartén.","Para servir, retire con cuidado la tarta de queso del molde, retire el papel para hornear y transfiérala a un plato o soporte para tartas. Cubra con las bayas y las avellanas y sirva con un trago de Frangelico, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:55:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13047,9019,'es','Barras de tarta de queso tropical','El mango fresco, una base de galleta crujiente y un suave relleno de queso crema son un postre ligero de verano que a todos les encantará. Cubra con maracuyá, piña y crema de limón.','["200 g de galletas de jengibre","200 g de galletas digestivas","200 g de mantequilla, derretida","3 x 280 g de queso crema","200 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de harina común","ralladura de 1 limón","3 huevos grandes, batidos","200ml de nata doble","100 g de mango fresco, picado en cubos pequeños","4 maracuyá","3 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","50 g de mango y piña en rodajas","hojas de menta"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forrar la base y los lados de un molde rectangular de 20 x 30 cm con papel para hornear. Coloque las galletas en una bolsa grande para comida y golpéelas con algo pesado como un rodillo o, alternativamente, páselas en un procesador de alimentos. Coloque las migas de galleta en un tazón grande y vierta sobre la mantequilla derretida, revuelva bien para combinar y luego viértala en la lata preparada. Presione bien la mezcla con el dorso de una cuchara para formar una capa comprimida. Hornee en el horno precalentado durante 10 minutos. Sácalo del horno para que se enfríe y baja el horno a 120C/100C ventilador/gas 1/2.","En otro tazón grande, mezcle los ingredientes restantes del pastel de queso hasta que quede suave, puede hacerlo con batidoras eléctricas o con un batidor de globo. Vierta sobre la base de galleta y luego esparza los trozos de mango aquí y allá, empujando algunos de ellos hacia la tarta de queso y dejando que otros reposen orgullosos en la superficie. Hornee durante 1 hora, luego abra la puerta del horno y déjelo enfriar durante 30 minutos más. Una vez fría, enfriar toda la tarta de queso en el frigorífico durante la noche.","Cuando esté listo para servir, pase la pulpa de la maracuyá por un colador para eliminar las semillas y luego mezcle la pulpa resultante con la cuajada de limón. Rocía la mezcla sobre el cheesecake y decora con mango fresco, piña y hojas de menta."]','2026-01-11 12:55:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13048,9020,'es','Tarta de queso con helado de chocolate y avellanas','Nadie adivinará que esta tarta de queso fácil, rica y cremosa, sin cocción y preparada con antelación, utiliza solo 4 ingredientes: ideal para una cena.','["200 g de copos de maíz con miel y nueces","2 tarros de 400 g de crema de chocolate y avellanas","2 tarrinas de 180 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","1 cucharada de avellanas tostadas y picadas"]','["Coloque los copos de maíz y medio frasco de chocolate para untar con avellanas en un tazón y bata para combinar; no se preocupe por romper los copos de maíz. Presione la mezcla en la base de un molde desmontable de 23 cm.","En un recipiente aparte, bata el queso crema hasta que quede suave y luego agregue el resto de la crema de chocolate y avellanas. Alise sobre la base de copos de maíz, envuélvalo bien en film transparente y congele durante la noche.","Sácalo del congelador 30 minutos antes de servir, o hasta que puedas cortarlo fácilmente con un cuchillo afilado. Sirva en rodajas con avellanas espolvoreadas. Se mantendrá en el congelador hasta por 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:55:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13049,9021,'es','Tartas de queso calientes con panecillo cruzado','Un postre cremoso que sabe exactamente igual que su horneado favorito de Pascua: el panecillo cruzado caliente. Cubra con ralladura de naranja, jugo y un chorrito de glaseado para lograr la cruz característica.','["150 g de galletas de jengibre","25g de pasas","25 g de piel mixta","50 g de mantequilla","½ cucharadita de canela","Paquete de 280 g de queso crema","25 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","½ cucharadita de canela","100 g de mascarpone","2 huevos, ligeramente batidos","150 g de azúcar glas","½ naranja, ralladura y jugo"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Unte con mantequilla 6 moldes de 150 ml de capacidad. Coloque las galletas de jengibre en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que estén picadas en trozos muy pequeños, luego agregue las pasas y la cáscara mezclada y mezcle nuevamente solo una o dos veces para combinar.","Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén, luego agregue la canela y luego la mezcla de galletas. Divida en partes iguales entre los moldes, de modo que la base de cada uno quede cubierta con una capa de aproximadamente 1 cm de espesor. Presiona un poco con el dorso de una cucharadita y luego hornéalos en una bandeja en el horno durante 10 minutos hasta que estén crujientes y dorados. Deje enfriar, luego baje el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2.","Batir todos los ingredientes del relleno de tarta de queso hasta que quede suave. Coloque los moldes en una bandeja para hornear y vierta un poco de mezcla en cada uno, llenándolos hasta aproximadamente 1 cm por debajo del borde. Deslícelos con cuidado en el horno y cocínelos durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén listos. La mezcla aún debe tambalearse ligeramente cuando se golpea suavemente. No te preocupes si se hunde un poco o se agrieta. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar por completo antes de cubrir con film transparente y guardar en el frigorífico. Puedes llegar a este punto con hasta 2 días de antelación.","Para hacer la decoración, coloca el azúcar glas en un bol grande y agrega suficiente jugo de naranja para hacer una pasta firme. Transfiera a una manga pastelera desechable y corte el extremo. Pasa un cuchillo pequeño por el borde de las tartas de queso y colócalas sobre una tabla de modo que la capa de galleta quede hacia arriba. Use la mezcla de glaseado de naranja para hacer una cruz en la parte superior de cada uno, luego use una rebanada de pastel o una espátula para colocarlos en los platos y luego espolvoree con la ralladura de naranja antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13050,9451,'es','Tarta de queso con chocolate y naranja','Este delicioso postre preparado con anticipación es perfecto para una cena festiva o un buffet, con un sabroso relleno de queso crema y una base de galleta de chocolate amargo.','["200 g de galletas digestivas de chocolate amargo, partidas aproximadamente","75 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para engrasar","4 huevos grandes","2 yemas de huevo grandes","2 tarrinas de 280 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","Tarrina de 150ml de crema doble","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura fina 1½ naranjas","4 cucharadas de licor de naranja, como Cointreau","50 g de chocolate con leche y naranja, rallado","50 g de chocolate con leche de almendras rallado"]','["Engrase ligeramente y forre un molde desmontable de 20 cm. Para hacer la base, coloque las galletas y la mantequilla en un procesador de alimentos, presione hasta obtener migajas finas y luego viértalas en el molde. Distribuir uniformemente sobre la base y presionar firmemente con el dorso de una cuchara. Pon el molde en el congelador y déjalo reposar durante 30 minutos.","Coloque un trozo grande de papel de aluminio (extra ancho si es posible) sobre la superficie de trabajo, o entrecruce dos trozos de papel de aluminio pequeño. Coloque el molde para pastel en el centro del papel de aluminio y levante los lados para crear un recipiente de aluminio alrededor del pastel de queso. Colóquelo en una fuente para asar de tamaño mediano.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Para hacer el relleno, poner los huevos y las yemas en un procesador de alimentos y batir hasta que estén bien combinados. Agregue el queso, la crema, el azúcar, la ralladura de naranja y el licor de naranja al procesador de alimentos y presione hasta que estén combinados. Vierta suavemente el relleno de tarta de queso sobre la base fría.","Agregue suficiente agua recién hervida a la fuente para asar para que suba aproximadamente 2 cm por los lados. Coloque con cuidado la fuente para asar en el centro del horno y hornee durante aproximadamente 1 hora y 15 minutos. La tarta de queso estará lista cuando esté ligeramente dorada y recién cuajada.","Sacar del horno y espolvorear con el chocolate rallado. Dejar enfriar al baño maría durante 15 min. Sacar el molde del agua y dejar enfriar durante 1 hora más. Cubrir con film transparente y enfriar la tarta de queso durante la noche antes de servir.","Para servir, pase un cuchillo de hoja redonda alrededor de la tarta de queso y sáquela con cuidado del molde. Con una espátula, deslice la tarta de queso sobre un plato plano para servir o sobre un soporte para tartas y córtela en trozos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13051,9022,'es','Macetas de tarta de queso con arándanos rojos y jengibre','Coloque capas de galletas de jengibre, un sabroso queso crema y mermelada de arándanos rojos en vasos para preparar estos impresionantes postres individuales para rematar una cena sueca para dos.','["50 g de queso crema entero","75ml de nata doble","ralladura de ½ naranja","4 cucharadas de mermelada de arándanos rojos (nosotros usamos mermelada de arándanos rojos silvestres Felix) o gelatina de arándanos, más un poco más para servir","8 pepparkakor suecos de jengibre o 4 nueces de jengibre trituradas, más 1 extra para servir","nuez de mantequilla, derretida"]','["Batir el queso crema, la crema doble y la ralladura de naranja en un tazón mediano hasta que espese y mantenga su forma. Tenga cuidado de no batir demasiado o el queso crema se volverá aguado. Distribuya suavemente la mermelada de arándanos rojos.","Mezcle las galletas trituradas y la mantequilla y sirva en 2 vasos. Divida la mezcla de arándanos rojos entre los vasos y déjela enfriar hasta que la necesite, al menos 30 minutos. Las tartas de queso se pueden preparar hasta este punto el día anterior.","Para servir, mezcle un poco de mermelada con 1 cucharadita de agua y rocíe sobre las tartas de queso. Desmenuza el resto de la galleta y espolvoréala por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:55:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13052,9023,'es','Tarta de queso con merengue de limón','Sirva una porción de este dulce y encuéntrese en el paraíso de los postres dobles: tarta de merengue de limón y tarta de queso cremosa con cítricos.','["aceite de colza, para engrasar","Paquete de 300 g de nueces de jengibre, trituradas hasta obtener migajas","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","3 tarrinas de 280 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 cucharadas de harina común","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","ralladura de 3 limones, jugo de 1","3 huevos grandes, más 1 yema (guarda la clara)","300 ml de crema agria","2 frascos de 312 g de cuajada de limón (usamos Tiptree)","1 huevo grande, más 3 yemas grandes (guarda las claras)","jugo 1 limon","3 cucharadas de harina común","4 claras de huevo grandes (desde arriba)","300 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de glucosa líquida"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Engrasar un molde redondo de fondo suelto o desmontable de 25 cm con un poco de aceite y forrar la base y los lados con una doble capa de papel para hornear. Mezcle las migas de galleta y la mantequilla derretida, luego presione en el fondo del molde. Hornee por 10 minutos.","Para hacer el relleno, bate el queso crema durante 1 o 2 minutos con un batidor eléctrico en el tazón más grande hasta que esté cremoso. Agrega el azúcar, la harina, la vainilla, la ralladura de limón y el jugo con una pizca de sal. Finalmente, agregue los huevos y la crema agria hasta que se mezclen. Vierta el relleno en el molde y golpéelo varias veces con fuerza en la encimera para eliminar las burbujas. Hornee por 40 minutos.","Batir los ingredientes para la capa de limón. Vierta suavemente la mezcla sobre la tarta de queso y vuelva a colocarla en el horno durante 40 minutos más hasta que esté firme en los bordes pero aún un poco tambaleante en el medio. Apague el horno y deje el pastel de queso hasta que esté frío, luego enfríe durante al menos 2 horas o toda la noche.","Unas horas antes de querer servir, elabora el merengue. Poner las claras en un bol grande y poner el azúcar en un cazo pequeño con 100ml de agua y la glucosa líquida. Colocar a fuego medio-bajo hasta que el azúcar se derrita, luego aumentar el fuego y hervir con un termómetro para azúcar en la sartén. Cuando el termómetro alcance los 100°C, bate las claras con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que se formen picos rígidos. Sigue hirviendo el almíbar de azúcar hasta que alcance la etapa de bola blanda: 113 ° C en el termómetro. Retirar del fuego y, mientras se baten las claras, verter el almíbar en un chorro lento y constante, evitando golpear las cuchillas de las batidoras. Sigue batiendo hasta que el merengue esté firme. Use una cuchara grande para apilar encima de la tarta de queso, luego use un soplete para caramelizar el merengue o hornee a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 durante 5 minutos aproximadamente. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13053,9024,'es','Tarta de queso con mascarpone y piña','Esta inteligente tarta de queso utiliza tortas de avena trituradas y coco rallado como base y piña naturalmente dulce como postre con bajo contenido de azúcar.','["40 g de mantequilla","100 g de galletas de avena, trituradas hasta obtener migajas","25 g de coco rallado tostado","Lata de 425g de piña en jugo natural escurrida","5 hojas de gelatina","Tarrina de 250g de mascarpone reducido en grasas","Tarrina de 500 g de queso fresco (versión con toda la grasa)","Lata de 160g de crema de coco","ralladura de ½ limón"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén y agregue las migas de galleta y todo menos 1 cucharada de coco. Mezcle bien y luego presione muy firmemente sobre la base de un molde desmontable de 21 cm ligeramente engrasado para formar una capa firme. Enfriar.","Pica finamente una rodaja de piña y luego licúa el resto hasta obtener pulpa en un procesador de alimentos o con una batidora de mano. Remojar la gelatina en agua fría para ablandarla. En un bol batir el mascarpone y el queso fresco.","Calentar muy suavemente la crema de coco en una cacerola pequeña. Exprime el exceso de humedad de la gelatina, agrégala al coco tibio y revuelve hasta que se derrita. Agrega la mezcla de mascarpone con la piña triturada y picada y la ralladura de limón, luego vierte sobre la base de galleta y deja enfriar hasta que cuaje.","Retirar con cuidado del molde, deslizar sobre un plato y decorar con el coco reservado por el borde."]','2026-01-11 12:55:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13054,9025,'es','Tarta de queso semifreddo de lima','Este atractivo postre helado se puede preparar con anticipación y congelar por hasta 3 meses, perfecto para adelantarse a una cena de Navidad.','["140 g de galletas digestivas, partidas aproximadamente","75 g de mantequilla, derretida","300 g de leche condensada","200 g de queso crema entero","150ml de nata doble","ralladura fina de 3 limas, más algo extra para servir","3 cucharadas de jugo de lima (de 2 limas)","200 g de arándanos frescos o congelados","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada de arrurruz molido o harina de maíz"]','["Forre un molde para pan de 900 g con un trozo grande de papel de aluminio. Presione bien hacia la base y los lados de la lata y deje mucho sobresaliendo de los bordes. Coloque las galletas en una bolsa para congelador y tritúrelas con un rodillo. Mezcle con la mantequilla derretida y vierta las migajas en el molde preparado; presione firmemente en la base para crear una capa uniforme. Enfriar mientras se hace el relleno.","Use un batidor eléctrico a temperatura media para batir la leche condensada, el queso y la crema hasta que quede suave y espeso; esto tomará alrededor de 2 minutos. Agrega la ralladura y el jugo y bate lentamente hasta que la mezcla de queso forme picos suaves.","Vierta la mezcla de lima sobre la base de galleta. Cubra ligeramente con el papel de aluminio que sobresale y selle firmemente para evitar la mayor cantidad de aire posible. Envuélvalo en una segunda capa de papel de aluminio, colóquelo en una bolsa grande para congelador y congélelo durante la noche.","Para hacer la compota de arándanos, poner los arándanos, el azúcar y 150 ml de agua fría en una cacerola y llevar a fuego lento. Cocine durante 5 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que los arándanos se ablanden pero mantengan su forma. Mezcle el arrurruz o la harina de maíz con 2 cucharadas de agua fría hasta que quede suave y luego agregue la fruta. Cocine por otros 2 minutos, revolviendo regularmente. Dejar enfriar, luego tapar y enfriar. Se puede congelar en esta etapa.","Coloque la tarta de queso congelada en un plato o tabla y déjela descongelar durante 30 minutos, luego retire con cuidado el papel de aluminio. Calentar suavemente la compota de arándanos y servir con el semifreddo en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13055,9026,'es','Barras de tarta de queso especiadas con arce y nueces','Esta rica tarta de queso está condimentada con cálidos sabores de jengibre, canela y nuez moscada; cubra con jarabe de arce y nueces.','["Paquete de 250 g de galletas de jengibre y nueces.","140 g de mantequilla salada, derretida","200 g de nueces","3 tarrinas de 250 g de queso crema","Bote de 300 ml de crema agria","150 ml de sirope de arce (comprar una botella de 330 ml)","85 g de azúcar mascabado light","3 huevos medianos","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","4 cucharadas de harina común","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","½ nuez moscada entera, rallada","jarabe de arce restante (aproximadamente 175 ml)","100 g de mantequilla salada","3 cucharadas de azúcar mascabado light","100 g de nueces pecanas, partidas aproximadamente"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forre un molde para brownie de 20 x 30 cm con papel para hornear; si usa un molde con fondo suelto, asegúrese de forrarlo muy bien, ya que la mezcla de tarta de queso queda muy líquida (esta receta también funcionará en un molde para pastel hondo de 23 cm). Coloque las galletas en un procesador de alimentos y tritúrelas hasta obtener migajas finas, agregue la mantequilla y las nueces, y vuelva a batir hasta que estén bien combinadas y las nueces estén finamente picadas pero aún tengan un poco de textura. Vierta en el molde para hornear y presione hasta obtener una capa uniforme y compacta con el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego retírelo del horno y déjelo enfriar.","Batir el queso crema y la crema agria en un tazón grande hasta que quede suave y combinado. Agrega el jarabe de arce, el azúcar, los huevos, la vainilla, la harina y las especias y vuelve a mezclar hasta que quede suave. Vierte sobre la base de galleta, mete en el centro del horno y hornea por 15 min.","Baje el fuego a 110C/90C ventilador/gas 1/2 y continúe cocinando durante 30 minutos más. Apagar el horno y dejar la tarta de queso dentro durante 1 hora, luego dejar durante 1 hora más con la puerta entreabierta. Finalmente, déjelo a temperatura ambiente hasta que se enfríe por completo, luego enfríe durante al menos 3 horas o, mejor aún, toda la noche.","Para hacer la cobertura, derretir el resto del sirope de arce con la mantequilla, el azúcar y una buena pizca de sal. Burbujee durante 2-3 minutos, luego agregue las nueces y déjelas enfriar y espesar un poco. Antes de servir, retire la tarta de queso del molde, vierta el caramelo de arce y nueces sobre la parte superior de la tarta de queso (recaliéntela si comienza a cuajar demasiado) y luego córtela en barras. Las sobras se conservarán en el refrigerador hasta por 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13056,9027,'es','Playa de galletas de tarta de queso','Si te sientes creativo, esta escena de playa de galletas con relleno de tarta de queso y vainilla no solo tendrá un aspecto brillante sino que también sabrá delicioso.','["375 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada","aceite, para engrasar","500 g de queso crema entero","1 cucharada de extracto de vainilla","200 g de azúcar glas","Bote de 300ml de nata doble","100 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, blanda","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos batidos","150 g de frambuesas en canastilla","cientos y miles, para decorar","500 g de galletas variadas","helado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Primero haz tu castillo de arena y glaseado de tarta de queso. Calienta suavemente la mantequilla en una cacerola. Mientras tanto, coloque las galletas en un procesador de alimentos y presione hasta obtener migajas finas parecidas a arena. Agrega la mantequilla y bate nuevamente hasta que esté bien combinado. Reserva mientras preparas el glaseado de tarta de queso.","Pon el queso crema en un bol grande y, con una batidora eléctrica, bate durante unos segundos hasta que quede suave. Agrega el extracto de vainilla, tamiza sobre el azúcar glas y mezcla bien. Vierta la crema y bata hasta que la mezcla esté suave y lo suficientemente espesa como para servir. Transfiera a una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella grande.","Cepilla el molde del castillo de arena con un poco de aceite y luego cubre la base con un círculo de papel para hornear. Rellenar con un poco de arena mantecosa para galletas, de modo que suba 2,5 cm por los lados, y compactar. Para crear un agujero para el centro del glaseado de tarta de queso, busque un vaso que se coloque encima de la arena para galletas en su molde y deje aproximadamente 1,5 cm de espacio alrededor del borde. Engrasa el vaso con un poco de aceite y mételo dentro del recipiente del castillo de arena. Empaque más arena para galletas alrededor del vaso hasta que el molde esté lleno, luego reserve la arena sobrante. Enfriar durante 1 hora. Mueve el vaso y desmolda; si no sale fácilmente, llénalo con agua caliente y déjalo reposar unos minutos. Deslice el vaso hacia afuera y retire el agua. Coloca glaseado en la cavidad y agrega un par de puñados de frambuesas a medida que avanzas; asegúrate de reservar unas 20 frambuesas para decorar los cupcakes y llenar todo el cono. Guarde el glaseado restante en la manga pastelera y enfríe. Vierta un poco más de arena mantecosa para cubrir el glaseado, empaquete la mezcla firmemente en el recipiente, luego enfríe durante al menos 1 hora o hasta que cuaje.","Haz los pasteles de cono. Para hacer los mini conos y los moldes para cupcakes de waffle, coloque un paño de cocina doblado sobre la superficie de trabajo y coloque un cono de waffle encima. Utilice el paño de cocina para sostener el cono y, con un cuchillo de sierra, marque suavemente alrededor del centro del cono. Repita con otros 8 conos (debe dejar 1 cono entero para la parte superior del castillo de arena). Con mucho cuidado, corta cada cono por la mitad a lo largo de la línea marcada, tratando de no romperlos ni hacer añicos. Terminarás con 9 mini conos desde la parte inferior del cono y 9 moldes para cupcakes tipo waffle desde la parte superior del cono. Si alguno de los conos se rompe, simplemente agrégalo a la mezcla de arena en el paso 7.","Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Para hacer los mini pasteles de cono, forre un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con 9 nidos de papel de aluminio arrugados. Coloque los mini conos en el centro de los nidos de papel de aluminio y moldee el papel de aluminio alrededor de las puntas para sostenerlos y mantenerlos en posición vertical. Ponga 25 g de mantequilla, 25 g de azúcar, 25 g de harina, 1,4 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla y 25 g de huevo batido en un bol grande. Con una batidora eléctrica, bata hasta que todo esté combinado. Transfiera la mezcla a una manga pastelera desechable y corte 1 cm del extremo. Coloca la mezcla en los mini conos, asegurándote de llenarlos solo hasta las tres cuartas partes de su capacidad, ya que el bizcocho se elevará en el horno; es posible que te quede un poco de mezcla. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. salir\r\npara enfriar.","Para hacer los cupcakes de cono de waffle, forre un molde para mini muffins de 12 orificios con círculos de papel para hornear. Coloque las 9 cápsulas para cupcakes de gofres en el molde. Ponga los 75 g restantes de mantequilla, 75 g de azúcar, 75 g de harina, 3,4 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla y el huevo batido restante en un tazón grande y bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén bien combinados. Transfiera a una manga pastelera y úsela para llenar las cajas de conos más grandes, nuevamente llenando solo tres cuartos de su capacidad. Hornee durante 18-20 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar y recuerde pelar los discos de papel para hornear antes de glasear.","A continuación haz la arena para galletas. Ahora haz la arena para tu playa. Pulse las galletas y los conos rotos en un procesador de alimentos hasta que parezcan migajas finas, luego reserve. Corta 3 hojuelas al tamaño adecuado para que tengas media hojuela para el helado volteado, 9 trozos medianos de hojuelas para los cupcakes y mini trozos de hojuelas para los conos. Algunos copos pueden romperse, por lo que quedan sobrantes; son más fáciles de cortar cuando están a temperatura ambiente.","Monta tu escena de playa. Una vez que los pasteles se hayan enfriado y el castillo de arena se haya asentado, estarás listo para montar la escena de la playa. Gire con cuidado el castillo de arena sobre una superficie o bandeja limpia y rodéelo con arena para galletas. Tendrás que golpear el fondo del recipiente con un rodillo (o ver el consejo al lado) si tu castillo de arena no sale fácilmente.","Coloca una frambuesa en cada cupcake y coloca un poco de glaseado encima. Espolvorea con Hundreds & Thousands e inserta un trozo mediano de Flake. Coloque glaseado en los mini conos, esparza con Hundreds & Thousands y cubra con un mini Flake. Inserta los mini conos y cupcakes en la arena, dentro y alrededor del castillo de arena principal, usando la arena como soporte.","Para hacer el cono invertido, coloca un poco de glaseado en el cono de waffle entero reservado y agrega las frambuesas restantes a medida que avanzas. Coloque el cono boca abajo en la parte superior del castillo de arena y coloque glaseado alrededor para crear el efecto de un helado caído. Espolvorea con Hundreds & Thousands e inserta la mitad de Flake. Sirve la playa de galletas con bolas de tu helado favorito, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:55:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13057,9028,'es','Maracuyá (mousse de maracuyá horneado en bandeja)','Hemos convertido este picante pudín de mousse brasileño en una tarta de queso horneada en bandeja con base de galleta y gelatina para facilitar el corte.','["2 maracuyás, sin pulpa","250 ml de zumo de maracuyá de un cartón","4 hojas de gelatina","2 latas de 400 g de leche condensada azucarada","500 ml de nata doble, ligeramente batida","250 g de galletas digestivas","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","2 mangos","jugo 1 lima","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","2 maracuyás, sin pulpa y picada"]','["Para la base, triture las galletas en una bolsa con un rodillo o púlselas en un procesador de alimentos. Agrega la mantequilla y revuelve. Forre un molde para pasteles de 20 x 30 cm con papel para hornear antiadherente. Vierta la mezcla de galletas y presione firmemente hacia abajo. Enfriar.","Mezclar la pulpa de maracuyá con el jugo. Coloque la gelatina en un recipiente pequeño con agua fría para remojar. Vierta la pulpa y el jugo en una cacerola y caliente hasta que esté caliente. Exprime el agua de la gelatina, agrégala a la cacerola y revuelve hasta que se disuelva, luego retira y vierte en un bol.","Agregue la leche y la crema batida sin apretar y mezcle. Vierta en el molde y enfríe hasta que esté firme, aproximadamente 2 horas.","Para el coulis, haga puré 1 mango con el jugo de limón y el azúcar en un procesador de alimentos, luego revuelva para disolver el azúcar. Pica el otro mango.","Para servir, corta la bandeja horneada en cuadritos. Cubra cada uno con el coulis, un poco de mango picado y maracuyá."]','2026-01-11 12:55:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13058,9029,'es','Tarta de queso con chocolate y avellanas sin hornear','La lectora Jessica Creed comparte su postre de chocolate vistoso y sin fallas: es perfecto para entretener','["140 g de mantequilla sin sal","300 g de galletas digestivas, partidas","500 g de queso crema, ablandado","85 g de azúcar glas","300ml de nata doble","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","15 chocolate con avellanas (nosotros usamos Ferrero Rocher), 5 picados en trozos grandes, el resto reservado, para decorar","4 cucharadas de chocolate para untar con avellanas","25 g de avellanas, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Hacer la base de la tarta de queso: derretir la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña a fuego medio. Mezcle las galletas en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener una migaja fina, agregue la mantequilla derretida y presione hasta que estén bien combinadas. Vierta en un molde desmontable de 23 cm y presione firmemente hacia la base. Enfría mientras haces el relleno.","Batir el queso crema y el azúcar glas en un bol para que se ablanden. Batir la crema y la vainilla en un recipiente aparte hasta que se formen picos suaves, luego incorporar el queso crema. Revuelva los chocolates picados. Vierta sobre la base de galleta y alise con una espátula. Cubra con film transparente y enfríe durante al menos 6 horas o toda la noche.","Una vez que haya cuajado, coloca la crema de chocolate y avellanas en una cacerola y derrítela a fuego lento durante 3-4 minutos hasta que esté líquida. déjelo enfriar un poco antes de esparcirlo sobre la parte superior del pastel de queso. Decorar con los chocolates restantes y unas avellanas picadas. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13059,9030,'es','Tarta de queso con remolino de arándanos','La textura dulce y cremosa de este pudín de vainilla horneado se complementa con una vibrante salsa de frutas.','["300 g de galletas digestivas","140 g de mantequilla, derretida","275 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de arándanos","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","3 paquetes de 300 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","4 cucharadas de harina común","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes","Bote de 200 ml de crema agria"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nForrar un molde rectangular de 20 x 30 cm con\r\npergamino para hornear. Pon las galletas en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos y triturar hasta obtener una migaja fina.\r\nAgregue la mantequilla y mezcle nuevamente para combinar.\r\nVierta en la lata, presione firmemente con\r\nel dorso de una cuchara para cubrir la base,\r\nluego hornee por 10 minutos. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, verter 25 g de azúcar y la\r\narándanos en una cacerola pequeña. Mezclar el\r\nharina de maíz con 1 cucharada de agua fría y agregar\r\nesto a la sartén. Calentar suavemente hasta que el azúcar\r\nse disuelve. Aumentar el calor y la burbuja.\r\ndurante 1-2 minutos hasta que esté picante. Dejar enfriar.","En un bol grande batir la nata\r\nqueso con batidor eléctrico de mano\r\nhasta que quede suave. Agrega el azúcar restante\r\ny batir nuevamente. Agrega la harina, la vainilla,\r\nhuevos y crema agria, y batir hasta\r\nsuave y bien combinado.","Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de tarta de queso sobre\r\nla base de galleta, luego vierta la mitad de la\r\nsalsa de arándanos encima en pequeñas gotas.\r\nCubrir con el resto del pastel de queso.\r\nmezclar y alisar la superficie con un\r\nespátula. Rocíe el arándano restante\r\nsalsa por encima, luego use el final\r\nde la cuchara para ondularla en el\r\ntarta de queso. Hornee por 10 minutos, luego\r\nbajar el fuego a 110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼\r\ny hornee por 30 minutos más. Apagar\r\nal horno y dejar la tarta de queso dentro\r\ndurante 1 hora, luego dejar durante 1 hora más con\r\nla puerta entreabierta. Finalmente dejar en la habitación.\r\ntemperatura hasta que esté completamente frío, luego\r\nenfríe durante al menos 3 horas o, mejor aún,\r\ndurante la noche. Cortar en 14 barras. Se mantendrá\r\nen el frigorífico hasta por 5 días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13060,9031,'es','Tarta de queso con mantequilla de maní','Este irresistible pastel de queso es el capricho perfecto para los fanáticos de la mantequilla de maní: congélelo por hasta dos meses y sírvalo como postre espectacular para una cena.','["50 g de mantequilla","Paquete de 175 g de galletas de maní","5 hojas de gelatina","500 g de ricota en tarrina","175 g de mantequilla de maní suave","175 g de almíbar dorado","150ml de leche","Bote de 270ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","1 barra de maní quebradizo, triturado"]','["Engrase y forre un molde para pasteles redondo de 20 cm de fondo suelto con film transparente, dejándolo lo más liso posible. Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén. Triture las galletas golpeándolas en una bolsa con un rodillo y luego revuélvalas con la mantequilla hasta que estén muy bien cubiertas. Presione la mezcla firmemente en la base del molde y enfríe.","Remoja la gelatina en agua mientras haces el relleno. Vierta la ricota en un tazón, luego agregue la mantequilla de maní y el almíbar. La ricota tiene una textura ligeramente granulada, así que, si lo prefiere, mezcle hasta que quede suave con una batidora para obtener una textura más suave.","Sacar la gelatina remojada del agua y exprimirla para secarla. Ponlo en una sartén\r\ncon la leche y calentar muy suavemente hasta que se disuelva la gelatina. Incorpora la mezcla de maní y luego vierte sobre la base de galleta. Enfríe hasta que cuaje.","Para congelar dejar en el molde y en cuanto esté sólido cubrir la superficie con film transparente, luego envolver el molde con film transparente y papel de aluminio.","Para descongelar, descongelar en el frigorífico durante la noche.","Para servir, desmoldar con cuidado. Batir la nata con el azúcar hasta que mantenga su forma, luego esparcir sobre la tarta de queso y espolvorear con el crujiente de maní."]','2026-01-11 12:55:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13061,9032,'es','Tarta de queso helada con ondas de castañas','Con una base digestiva de chocolate amargo y cobertura de queso crema con nueces, este postre helado tiene un toque invernal.','["10 galletas digestivas de chocolate amargo","50 g de mantequilla, derretida","aceite de girasol, para engrasar","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de trozos de castaña, picados en trozos grandes","Lata 435g de puré de castañas","200 g de azúcar glas","3 cucharadas de ron oscuro","Bote de 300ml de nata doble","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","300 g de queso tierno en tarrina, batido hasta que quede suave"]','["Para la base, mezcle las galletas con\r\nun procesador de alimentos o bash en una bolsa\r\npara hacer migas. Agregue la mantequilla,\r\nLuego presione en la base de un 22 cm.\r\nmolde desmontable para pastel. Enfriar.","Para el praliné, forrar una bandeja con papel para hornear.\r\npergamino y engrasarlo ligeramente. Incline la rueda\r\nazúcar en una sartén y colocar encima\r\nun calor alto. Cocine por 5 minutos, sin\r\nrevolviendo, hasta que se disuelva y tenga\r\nun caramelo de color ámbar oscuro. Eche el\r\ntrozos de castaña, luego inclínelos rápidamente\r\nel papel de horno y dejar reposar\r\nendurecerse. Romper o picar en trozos pequeños\r\ny dejar a un lado.","Para el relleno, batir el puré de castañas.\r\nen un procesador de alimentos con el azúcar glas\r\ny 1 cucharada de ron. Coloque 3 cucharadas de\r\nmezclar a un lado. En un tazón grande, bata la\r\nnata con el azúcar en polvo y la vainilla\r\nhasta que mantenga su forma, luego agregue el\r\nqueso tierno. Incorporar los trozos de praliné,\r\nluego doble suavemente a través de la castaña\r\nHaga puré para que ondee la nata. Cuchara\r\nsobre la base de galleta. Golpear el molde para pastel\r\nsuavemente sobre la superficie de trabajo para nivelar y\r\nalise por encima. Cubrir con adhesivo\r\nfilmar y congelar durante al menos 12 horas o más\r\na 1 mes.","Para la llovizna, mezcle el ron restante.\r\ncon el puré de castañas reservado y\r\nsuficiente agua para que quede líquida. si\r\nservir el pastel dentro de 2 días, enfriar el\r\nllovizna; si se conserva por más tiempo, congelar y\r\ndescongelar cuando sea necesario.","Pon la tarta de queso en el frigorífico para que se descongele.\r\nun poco 30 minutos antes de servir. Usando un\r\nbolsa de sándwich con una esquina cortada,\r\nColoca la llovizna sobre la parte superior del pastel.\r\nen forma de zig-zag. Retire con cuidado de\r\nla lata y servir en trozos pequeños – con un\r\nvaso de ron si te apetece."]','2026-01-11 12:55:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13062,6885,'es','Tarta de queso de chocolate blanco con compota de ruibarbo','Esta tarta de queso suave y cremosa constituye un final impresionante e indulgente para una cena.','["200 g de galletas de avena","85 g de mantequilla derretida","450 gramos de chocolate blanco","Bote de 284ml de nata doble","400 g de queso blando con toda la grasa, como el Philadelphia","4 huevos","1 cucharadita de esencia de vainilla","600 g de ruibarbo (peso recortado), cortado en trozos de 2½ cm","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ vaina de vainilla, partida por la mitad a lo largo","100ml de vino de postre moscatel de azahar (nosotros utilizamos Brown Brothers)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Forrar la base de un molde desmontable de 23 cm con papel para hornear. Batir las galletas en un procesador de alimentos hasta que parezcan pan rallado. Vierta la mantequilla, vuelva a batir brevemente, luego vierta la mezcla en el molde y presione firmemente. Hornee por 10 minutos, luego enfríe.","Reduzca la temperatura del horno a 140 ° C/ventilador 120 ° C/gas 1. Envuelva una doble capa de papel de aluminio, forrada con film transparente, alrededor de la base y los lados del molde para que quede hermético. Rompe 400 g de chocolate en una sartén, luego vierte la nata y calienta hasta que el chocolate se derrita. Dejar enfriar un poco. Enjuaga el tazón del procesador, luego licúa el queso crema, los huevos y la esencia de vainilla junto con el chocolate derretido y la crema hasta que quede suave.","Coloque la lata en una bandeja para asar honda y luego vierta el relleno. Llene la bandeja para asar hasta la mitad con agua hirviendo, hornee durante 1 hora y luego apague el horno. Dejar enfriar en el horno con la puerta entreabierta durante 1-2 horas. Saque la tarta de queso del agua, deseche el papel de aluminio, luego cúbrala con film transparente y enfríe. La tarta de queso se puede preparar con hasta 3 días de antelación. Ralla el chocolate restante sobre la tarta de queso antes de servir.","Para la compota, calentar el horno a 180°C/ventilador 160°C/gas 4. Mezclar el ruibarbo y el azúcar en una fuente refractaria. Raspe las semillas de la vaina de vainilla que están encima del ruibarbo y luego coloque también la vaina. Vierta el moscatel encima, cubra con papel de aluminio y luego hornee durante 30 a 40 minutos, revolviendo hasta la mitad, hasta que el ruibarbo esté cocido. Dejar enfriar y luego retirar la vaina. Sirve la compota con la tarta de queso. La compota se puede conservar en el frigorífico hasta 4 días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13063,6955,'es','tarta de queso de nueva york','Este auténtico postre cremoso agregará el sabor de Nueva York a cualquier mesa de comedor.','["85 g de mantequilla derretida, más un extra para lata","140 g de galletas digestivas, hechas en migajas finas","1 cucharada de azúcar, granulada o dorada","Paquete de 3 x 300 g/11 oz de queso Philadelphia u otro queso blando con toda la grasa","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 cucharadas de harina común","1½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","ralladura fina de 1 limón (aproximadamente 2 cucharaditas)","1½ cucharadita de jugo de limón","3 huevos grandes, más 1 yema","Caja de 284 ml de crema agria","Caja de 142 ml de crema agria","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","2 cucharaditas de jugo de limón"]','["Coloque una rejilla del horno en el medio del horno. Precalienta el horno a 160 ° C / convencional 180 ° C / gas 4. Forra la base de un molde desmontable de 23 cm con papel pergamino. Para la base, derrita la mantequilla en una sartén mediana. Agregue las migas de galleta y el azúcar para que la mezcla se humedezca uniformemente. Presione la mezcla en el fondo del molde y hornee por 10 minutos. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla mientras se prepara el relleno.","Para el relleno, aumente la temperatura del horno a 200 C/convencional 240 C/gas 9. En una batidora de mesa equipada con el accesorio de paleta, bata el queso tierno a velocidad media-baja hasta que esté cremoso, aproximadamente 2 minutos. Con la batidora a fuego lento, agregue poco a poco el azúcar, luego la harina y una pizca de sal, raspando las paredes del bol y la paleta dos veces.","Cambia el accesorio de paleta por el batidor. Continúe agregando la vainilla, la ralladura de limón y el jugo. Incorpora los huevos y la yema, uno a la vez, raspando el bol y bate al menos dos veces. Revuelva el cartón de 284 ml de crema agria hasta que quede suave, luego mida 200 ml/7 onzas líquidas (un poco más de 3?4 del cartón). Continúe a velocidad baja mientras agrega la crema agria medida (reserve el resto). Batir para mezclar, pero no batir demasiado. La masa debe quedar suave, ligera y algo aireada.","Cepille los lados del molde desmontable con mantequilla derretida y colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear. Vierta el relleno - si hay grumos, hundirlos con un cuchillo - la parte superior debe quedar lo más lisa posible. Hornee por 10 minutos. Reduzca la temperatura del horno a 90 ° C/convencional 110 ° C/gas 1?4 y hornee por 25 minutos más. Si agitas suavemente la lata, el relleno debería tambalearse ligeramente. Apaga el horno y abre la puerta del horno para obtener una tarta de queso cremosa en el centro, o déjala cerrada si prefieres una textura más seca. Dejar enfriar en el horno durante 2 horas. Es posible que la tarta de queso se agriete ligeramente en la parte superior a medida que se enfría.","Combine la crema agria reservada con el cartón de 142 ml, el azúcar y el jugo de limón para la cobertura. Extienda sobre la tarta de queso hasta los bordes. Cubra sin apretar con papel aluminio y refrigere durante al menos 8 horas o toda la noche.","Pasa un cuchillo de hoja redonda por los lados de la lata para aflojar los bordes pegados. Destrabe el costado, deslice la tarta de queso del fondo del molde sobre un plato y luego deslice el papel pergamino hacia afuera desde abajo."]','2026-01-11 12:55:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13064,9033,'es','Tarta de queso tía María','Perfecto para una ocasión especial, este postre estilo americano realmente tiene el factor sorpresa.','["85 g de mantequilla derretida caliente, más mantequilla extra para engrasar","14 galletas digestivas de chocolate natural, finamente trituradas","3 paquetes de 300 g de queso Philadelphia con toda la grasa","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 cucharadas de harina común","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de Tía María","3 huevos grandes","Caja de 285 ml de crema agria","Caja de 142 ml de crema agria","2 cucharadas de Tía María","cacao, para espolvorear","8 bombones Ferrero Rocher, sin envolver"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Forrar la base de un molde desmontable de 25 cm con papel para hornear. Licuar la mantequilla y la galleta\r\nmigajas. Presione sobre la base del molde, hornee durante 10 minutos y luego enfríe.","Aumente la temperatura del horno a 240C/ventilador 200C/gas 9. Batir el queso y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave, luego agregar la harina, la vainilla, 2 cucharadas de Tía María, los huevos y 285 ml de crema agria.","Engrase los lados del molde para pastel con mantequilla. Vierta la mezcla y alise. Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego baje el horno a 110 ° C/ventilador 90 ° C/gas ¼ durante 25 minutos. Apagar el horno, luego abrir la puerta y dejar enfriar dentro del horno durante 2 hrs. No te preocupes si se agrieta un poco.","Mezcle 142 ml de crema agria y Tía María, luego extienda sobre la tarta de queso. Enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:55:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13065,9034,'es','Pequeñas tartas de queso con fresas','Las porciones individuales evitarán peleas por la porción más grande de este cremoso pudín de ricotta con compota de frutas.','["50 g de mantequilla","6 galletas digestivas finamente trituradas","250 g de ricota en tarrina","50 g de azúcar glas","ralladura de 1 limón, jugo de ½","1 huevo y 1 yema","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","150ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de mermelada de fresa, derretida","3 fresas, partidas por la mitad"]','["Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2\r\ny forre 6 agujeros del molde para muffins con muffins\r\ncasos de papel. Derrita la mantequilla, agregue la\r\nmigas de galleta hasta que estén bien mezcladas, luego\r\nPresione lo más firmemente que pueda en las bases.\r\nde cada caja de papel. Enfríelos mientras\r\ntú haces el relleno.","Batir la ricota con el azúcar, el limón.\r\nralladura y jugo, huevo entero, yema de huevo y\r\nvainilla. En otro bol batir la\r\ncrema hasta que mantenga su forma, luego\r\nincorporar a la mezcla de queso. Cuchara\r\nuniformemente en las cajas de papel, hasta\r\nhasta la parte superior, luego golpea la lata sobre el trabajo\r\nsuperficie para aplanar el relleno. Hornear para\r\n30 minutos, luego apague el horno y deje\r\npara que se enfríe completamente por dentro.","Para decorar, cubra cada tarta de queso.\r\ncon 1 cucharadita de mermelada y media fresa."]','2026-01-11 12:55:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13066,9035,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: tarta de queso de Nueva York','Angela Nilsen se enfrenta al máximo desafío: mantener una tarta de queso cremosa y deliciosa y al mismo tiempo hacerla más saludable y ligera.','["35 g de mantequilla","85 g de galletas digestivas bajas en grasas, finamente trituradas","2 tarrinas de 300 g/11 oz de queso tierno ligero, nosotros usamos queso Philadelphia, a temperatura ambiente","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","1½ cucharadita de ralladura de limón finamente rallada, preferiblemente usando un rallador Microplane","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos, temperatura ambiente, batidos","150 g de queso fresco","25 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","225 g de arándanos en canastilla","½ cucharadita de ralladura de lima fina","100 g de queso fresco"]','["Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Forre un molde desmontable o de fondo suelto de 20 cm con papel para hornear y colóquelo sobre una bandeja para hornear. Derrita la mantequilla y agregue las migas de galleta. Presione la mezcla en la base del molde y luego hornee por 10 minutos. Retirar del horno y subir la temperatura a 240C/ventilador 220C/gas 9.","Para el relleno, bata el queso tierno hasta que quede suave con una batidora eléctrica a velocidad baja. Agrega poco a poco el azúcar, también a velocidad baja, luego la maicena sin batir demasiado. Raspe los lados del tazón. Incorpora lentamente la ralladura y el jugo de limón, la vainilla y luego los huevos. Raspe los lados del bol y finalmente bata el queso fresco. La mezcla debe quedar suave y bastante líquida.","Vierte el relleno sobre la base de migas. Mueva la lata para nivelar la mezcla y aplaste las burbujas de la superficie con el dorso de una cucharadita. Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego baje el fuego a 110 ° C/ventilador 90 ° C/gas ¼. Hornea otros 25 minutos y, si estás usando un horno eléctrico, deja la puerta del horno ligeramente entreabierta durante los primeros 3 minutos. Después de los 25 minutos, agite la lata y debería haber una oscilación en el centro del relleno. Si se deja hasta que esté más firme, es más probable que se agriete más tarde. Apagar el horno, mantener la puerta cerrada y dejar el bizcocho dentro durante 2 hrs. Abra la puerta, afloje los bordes superiores del pastel con un cuchillo de hoja redonda, luego déjelo en el horno para que se enfríe suavemente durante 1-1½ horas más.","Mientras tanto, ponga el azúcar para la cobertura en una cacerola pequeña con 3 cucharadas de agua. Deje hervir a fuego lento, revolviendo para disolver el azúcar, luego déjelo burbujear durante 1-2 minutos para hacer un almíbar fino. Vierta los arándanos, revuelva suavemente y cocine durante aproximadamente 1 minuto, solo para reventar ligeramente la fruta y liberar los jugos morados. Revuelva\r\nen la ralladura de lima y dejar enfriar.","Extienda el queso fresco sobre la parte superior de la tarta de queso enfriada. Cubra con papel aluminio y enfríe durante al menos 4 horas (o toda la noche). Retirar del frigorífico 1 hora antes de servir, aflojar completamente los lados de la tarta de queso, retirar del molde y luego deslizar sobre un plato, despegando el papel mientras lo hace. Cortar con un cuchillo afilado y servir cada trozo cubierto con una cucharada de arándanos almibarados."]','2026-01-11 12:55:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13067,8123,'es','Tarta de queso con chocolate Kahlúa','Delicioso y tentador pastel de queso con chocolate y sabor a licor de café','["50 g de mantequilla","225 g de galletas digestivas de chocolate natural, trituradas","225 g de chocolate amargo (al menos 50 % de sólidos de cacao), partido","2 x 200 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa, a temperatura ambiente","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos medianos","0 cartón de 284ml de nata doble","5 cucharadas de Kahlúa","Tarrina de 200ml de crema fresca","2 cucharadas de Kahlúa","cacao en polvo, para espolvorear","Kahlúa extra para servir"]','["Engrase ligeramente la base de un 23cm.\r\nestaño con forma de resorte. Derretir la mantequilla en un\r\nsartén, agregue las galletas trituradas y\r\npresione sobre la base de la lata con\r\nel dorso de una cuchara. Relájate mientras\r\nhacer el relleno.","Derretir el chocolate en un bol\r\nuna cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento,\r\nrevolviendo a mitad de camino. Quitar\r\nel tazón de la sartén. Precalentar el\r\nhorno a 160C/gas 3/ventilador 140C.","Batir el queso y el azúcar.\r\njunto con una batidora de mano eléctrica\r\nhasta que quede esponjoso. Añade los huevos, uno a uno.\r\ntiempo, pero no batir demasiado. con el\r\nbatidor a baja velocidad, mezcle el\r\nchocolate derretido, la nata y\r\nel Kahlúa. Vierta sobre la galleta\r\nbase y hornee en una bandeja para hornear durante\r\n55 minutos-1 hora o hasta que cuaje. prueba\r\ntocando la superficie, que\r\ndebe ser brillante y un poco tambaleante\r\ny más oscuro en el centro. Afloje el\r\ntarta de queso de lata con un\r\ncuchillo de hoja redonda y dejar reposar\r\ngenial. Enfríe durante 3 horas o toda la noche.","Saca la tarta de queso de la lata.\r\nPara la cobertura, combine la crema.\r\nfraîche con la Kahlúa y untar\r\npor encima. Espolvorear ligeramente con cacao\r\npolvo y servir en gajos con una\r\nLa pequeña Kahlúa se vertió sobre cada rebanada."]','2026-01-11 12:55:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13068,9037,'es','Tarta de queso con quark y limón','Esta ligera y deliciosa tarta de queso con limón sabe tan bien como parece','["80 g de galletas digestivas","50 g de mantequilla derretida","200 g de queso tierno y ligero","500 g de requesón","200 g de azúcar glas","ralladura de 2 limones, jugo de 3","4 hojas de gelatina"]','["Triturar las galletas digestivas y mezclar.\r\ncon la mantequilla derretida. Presione en el\r\nBase de un molde desmontable de 20 cm. Relájate para\r\nfirme.","Batir el queso tierno ligero con\r\nel quark y el azúcar glas, luego incorporar la ralladura\r\n2 limones.","Remojar las hojas de gelatina en agua fría y luego derretirlas.\r\nen el jugo 3 limones a fuego lento. Batir el queso\r\nmezcle y luego vierta sobre la base de galleta. Enfríe hasta que cuaje."]','2026-01-11 12:55:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13069,9038,'es','Tarta de queso con frutos rojos y chocolate blanco','Un impresionante pudín sin cocinar repleto de sabores veraniegos, ideal para un entretenimiento relajado','["2 barras de chocolate blanco de 150 g","2 tarrinas de 300 g de queso tierno (nosotros usamos Philadelphia)","Bote de 284ml de nata doble","50 g de azúcar en polvo","170 g de frambuesas en canastilla","5 cucharadas de mermelada de frambuesa","85 g de galletas amaretti","200 g de fresas pequeñas","unos cuantos arándanos (opcional)"]','["Rompe el chocolate en un bol de cristal,\r\nLuego ponlo sobre una cacerola a fuego lento.\r\nagua para que se derrita, asegurándose de que el fondo\r\ndel recipiente no toca el agua. Línea\r\nun molde para pan de 900 g ligeramente engrasado y con film transparente.","Batir el queso, la nata y el azúcar.\r\njuntos, preferiblemente con batidoras eléctricas,\r\nluego agregue el derretido casi frío\r\nchocolate blanco hasta que esté bien combinado.","Revuelva 50 g de frambuesas con 2 cucharadas de\r\nmermelada. Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de queso en\r\nel molde para pan, luego vierta la mermelada\r\nframbuesas en el centro. Cubra con\r\nel resto de la mezcla de queso, nivelar\r\narriba, luego presione las galletas. Cubrir y\r\nenfríe durante 6 horas o toda la noche.","Reserva unas 6 fresas. Reducir a la mitad\r\nel resto, luego calentar en una sartén con el\r\nmermelada restante hasta que esté suave. Whiz en una comida\r\nprocesador o con una batidora de mano, luego\r\nfrotar a través de un colador para quitar las semillas\r\ny hacer una salsa. Agrega una gota de agua\r\nsi la salsa está demasiado espesa.","Para servir, gire con cuidado la lata sobre\r\nun plato, levántelo y quítele la adherencia\r\npelícula. Cortar a la mitad las fresas restantes,\r\nluego disponer encima del pastel con el\r\nframbuesas y arándanos restantes (si\r\nusando). Vierte un poco de salsa y sirve.\r\nel resto por separado para rociar."]','2026-01-11 12:55:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13070,9039,'es','Tarta de queso Melba y melocotón','Un favorito para fiestas que no se cocina y se prepara con anticipación, con una cobertura espesa de queso crema, una base de galleta mantecosa y terminado con coulis de frambuesa.','["100 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","200g de galletas crujientes (nosotros utilizamos galletas de mantequilla Fox)","600 g de queso tierno","100 g de azúcar glas y más al gusto","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","Bote de 300ml de nata doble","450 g de frambuesas","3 duraznos muy maduros, pelados si lo deseas, o 6 mitades de duraznos enlatados (ahorra el jugo), cortados en trozos del tamaño de una frambuesa"]','["Forrar la base y los lados de un 20cm.\r\nlata con fondo suelto o desmontable\r\ncon papel para hornear – use manchas\r\nde mantequilla para ayudar a que el papel se mantenga en su lugar\r\nalrededor de los lados. Pon las galletas en un\r\nBolsa de plástico para alimentos y triture hasta obtener migajas.\r\nusando un rodillo, luego mezcle bien\r\ncon la mantequilla derretida. Inclínate hacia el\r\nlata preparada y presione firmemente\r\npara crear una base uniforme. Relájate mientras\r\npreparas el relleno.","Poner el queso tierno, el azúcar glas y\r\nvainilla en un bol, luego batir con un\r\nbatidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave. Consejo en\r\nla nata y seguir batiendo hasta\r\nse combina la mezcla. dispersarse\r\n100g de frambuesas y la mitad de\r\nlos trozos de durazno. Usando una espátula,\r\ndóblelo con sólo unos pocos pliegues, a medida que\r\nmontarán la tarta de queso.\r\nse propaga a través de más.","Vierta la mezcla de crema sobre el\r\nbase de galleta, trabajando desde los bordes\r\nhacia adentro. Alise la parte superior de la tarta de queso.\r\nabajo con el dorso de una cuchara de postre o\r\nespátula. Dejar reposar en el frigorífico durante la noche.","En un procesador de alimentos, mezcle 250 g de\r\nframbuesas restantes, tamizar y remover\r\nen 1 cucharadita de semillas, si quieres, y\r\nendulzar al gusto con azúcar glas. Añadir\r\nsuficiente agua o jugo de durazno enlatado para\r\nhágalo picante y enfríe hasta servir.","Lleva la tarta de queso a la habitación.\r\ntemperatura unos 30 minutos antes\r\nsirviendo. Si utiliza una lata de fondo suelto,\r\ndesmoldar colocándolo encima de una lata,\r\nluego, baje gradualmente los lados del\r\nestaño. Desliza la tarta de queso sobre una porción.\r\nplato, retirando el papel de revestimiento y\r\nbase. Esparcir las frambuesas restantes\r\ny trozos de melocotón sobre la tarta de queso,\r\nrociar un poco de salsa y\r\nsirva el resto al lado."]','2026-01-11 12:55:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13071,9040,'es','Tarta de queso con frambuesa y limón al horno','Una rica y cremosa tarta de queso horneada que es un excelente postre para una cena.','["200 g de galletas digestivas","75 g de mantequilla, derretida","600 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","Tarrina de 150g de yogur natural","3 huevos medianos","ralladura fina de 2 limones, jugo de 1","50 g de harina común","200 g de frambuesas","azúcar glas, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 120C/100C ventilador/gas y forrar la base de un molde desmontable redondo de 20 cm con papel vegetal.  Tritura las galletas en un procesador de alimentos o en una bolsa para alimentos usando un rodillo. Vierta en un bol con la mantequilla derretida y mezcle bien. Empuje las galletas en una capa uniforme en la base del molde para pastel y enfríe hasta que las necesite.","En un bol aparte utiliza una batidora eléctrica para batir el queso tierno con el azúcar. Luego agregue el yogur y luego los huevos uno a la vez. Finalmente agregue la ralladura de limón, el jugo de limón y la harina. Doble dos tercios de las frambuesas triturándolas muy ligeramente para que comiencen a sangrar en la mezcla, luego vierta la mezcla sobre la base de la galleta y alise por encima. Hornee por 45 minutos, luego apague el horno, deje el bizcocho adentro por una hora más y luego enfríe a temperatura ambiente. Enfriar durante la noche. Para servir, desmoldar, espolvorear con las frambuesas restantes y espolvorear abundantemente con azúcar glas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13072,9041,'es','Tarta de queso horneada','Esta tarta de queso horneada con almendras y cerezas es una combinación celestial de dos postres increíbles.','["200 g/7 oz de galletas de almendras","100 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","3 paquetes de 300 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","250 g de azúcar en polvo","4 cucharadas de harina común","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes","Tarro de 200 ml de crema agria","poco más de medio tarro de mermelada de cerezas de 300 g","azúcar glas y crema, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nForrar la base y los lados de un 23cm.\r\nmolde desmontable con papel para hornear.\r\nTriturar las galletas y 75g de la desmenuzada.\r\nalmendras hasta migajas: pruebe con doble bolsa\r\nen bolsas de comida y triturando con un rodillo. Mezclar con el extracto de almendras y\r\nmantequilla derretida, luego presione en el\r\nbase del molde preparado y hornear durante\r\n10 minutos. Déjalo enfriar mientras\r\nhacer el relleno.","En tu tazón más grande, bate el queso.\r\ncon una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté cremoso. Añadir\r\nel azúcar y batir para combinar. batir\r\nen la harina, luego la vainilla, los huevos, uno\r\na la vez, y finalmente la nata agria.","Vierta cucharadas de la mezcla en la lata,\r\nañadiendo cucharadas de mermelada a medida que avanzas. Suave\r\nla parte superior lo más suavemente que puedas.","Coloque con cuidado la lata en el estante del medio.\r\ndel horno y hornear por 10 min. dispersión\r\ncon las almendras restantes. Disminuir horno\r\na 110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼ y hornee por un\r\n35 minutos más. Apague el horno, mantenga\r\nLa puerta se cerró y salió la tarta de queso.\r\ndejar enfriar durante 1 hora. Abra la puerta del horno y\r\nDéjalo entreabierto durante una hora más (puedes usar tu\r\nguantes de horno para abrirlo). genial\r\ndurante una tercera hora a temperatura ambiente, luego cubra\r\ny enfriar durante la noche.","Retirar del molde y pelar con cuidado\r\nfuera del pergamino. Espolvorear con azúcar glas\r\ny servir con crema."]','2026-01-11 12:55:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13073,9042,'es','Tarta de queso con frutos rojos en un vaso','Mascarpone es un excelente recurso para preparar un postre casi instantáneo. Aquí, su riqueza cremosa se ve atenuada por el picante de las moras.','["150 g de moras en canastilla","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 limón, ralladura fina y jugo","4 galletas de jengibre, trituradas","nuez de mantequilla, derretida","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas","½ tarrina de 250 g de mascarpone o ricotta"]','["Mezcle las moras, el azúcar en polvo y 1 cucharada de jugo de limón en una cacerola pequeña. Calienta suavemente durante 3-4 minutos o hasta que las bayas empiecen a estallar. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, mezcle las galletas trituradas y la mantequilla derretida. Vierta en 2 vasos. Incorpora suavemente el resto del jugo de limón, la ralladura de limón y el azúcar glas al mascarpone o ricotta. Divida el queso al limón entre los vasos, luego vierta sobre las moras y sus jugos almibarados."]','2026-01-11 12:55:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13074,9043,'es','pizza de chocolate','Haga este divertido proyecto para hornear pizza de chocolate con los niños. Además de los malvaviscos, los plátanos, los pretzels y la salsa de caramelo también funcionan bien como aderezos.','["40 g de mantequilla sin sal","200ml de leche, más extra para el cepillado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","300 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo dorado","40 g de chispas de chocolate con leche","5 cucharadas de crema de chocolate y avellanas","mini malvaviscos (opcional)"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola a fuego medio, luego reserve 1 cucharada en un tazón pequeño. Vierta la leche y la vainilla en la sartén y cocine a fuego lento hasta que esté bien caliente. Combine la harina, la levadura, el azúcar y una pizca de sal en un tazón grande. Vierta la mezcla de leche en el bol y mezcle con una cuchara de madera hasta que esté bien combinada. Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase durante 5 minutos hasta obtener una masa suave y elástica. Enrolle la masa hasta formar una bola apretada, colóquela en un recipiente limpio y cubra. Déjelo reposar en un lugar cálido durante 2 a 3 horas hasta que duplique su tamaño, o enfríelo hasta por 48 horas.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie enharinada y elimine las burbujas de aire. Enróllela hasta formar una base de pizza redonda de unos 40 cm de ancho. Espolvorea una bandeja para horno grande con un poco más de harina y pon la masa encima. Utilice las chispas de chocolate para crear un anillo alrededor del exterior de la base de la pizza, a ½ cm del borde. Unte un poco de leche dentro del anillo con chispas de chocolate, luego doble el borde exterior para encerrar el chocolate y crear una corteza rellena, presionando muy firmemente para pegar la masa en su lugar. Se puede preparar con hasta 1 hora de anticipación y reservar para que se hinche.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8. Unta la mitad de la masa con la mantequilla derretida reservada y hornea durante 15 minutos hasta que esté dorada. Retirar del horno y esparcir sobre la crema de chocolate y esparcir sobre los malvaviscos, si los usa, y cualquier otro aderezo que desee. Regrese la pizza al horno durante 4-5 minutos para que se caliente la cobertura. Déjelo reposar por un minuto antes de cortarlo para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13075,9044,'es','Pan de plátano con chispas de chocolate','Prepare un delicioso pan de plátano con chispas de chocolate: es una excelente manera de aprovechar los plátanos maduros que quedan en el frutero.','["140 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada, más un poco más para la lata","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos batidos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","140 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 plátanos maduros, pelados y triturados","100 g de chispas de chocolate"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pan de 900 g y forrar la base y los lados con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla ablandada y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave y esponjosa. Combine el huevo y el extracto de vainilla y vierta esto, poco a poco, mezclando entre cada adición. Agregue la harina, una pizca de sal, el polvo para hornear, el puré de plátano y todo menos un puñado de chispas de chocolate.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y esparza sobre el resto de las chispas de chocolate. Hornee durante unos 50 minutos, o hasta que esté inflado y bien cocido; al insertar una brocheta en el medio del pan debe salir limpio. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego retirar a una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo. Cortar antes de servir. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13076,3803,'es','Galletas navideñas de chocolate','Estas sencillas galletas de chocolate son el regalo navideño perfecto que encantará tanto a niños como a adultos. Involucra a toda la familia en la decoración','["270 g de harina común","50 g de cacao en polvo","120 g de azúcar glas","150 g de mantequilla","2 huevos","chocolate derretido o glaseado, perlas de azúcar, chispas"]','["Mezclar en un bol la harina, el cacao, el azúcar glas y una pizca de sal. Frote la mantequilla y luego mezcle los huevos. Amasar rápidamente con las manos hasta obtener una masa suave. Envuélvalo en papel de aluminio, presione hasta formar un disco plano y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Forra un par de bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada hasta que tenga un grosor de unos 3 mm. Recorta formas de la masa. Coloque las galletas en las bandejas para hornear; es mejor juntar galletas de tamaño similar. Hornear durante 7-10 minutos, dependiendo del tamaño de las galletas.","Amasar los restos de la masa y enfriar nuevamente durante 15 minutos. Enrollar, cortar y hornear como antes. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Cuando se enfríen, las galletas se pueden decorar con chocolate o glaseado y perlas de azúcar y chispas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13077,4781,'es','avena al horno','Disfrute de avena horneada para el desayuno con plátanos, una mezcla de especias y su elección de chispas de chocolate, arándanos o frambuesas. Sirva caliente con más fruta para hacerlo extra especial.','["100 g de gachas de avena","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 plátano, pelado y picado","1 cucharada de jarabe de arce o miel","2 huevos","pizca de mezcla de especias o canela molida","100 g de chispas de chocolate, arándanos o frambuesas, más algo extra para servir","aceite sin sabor, para los moldes"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Pon la avena en la licuadora y pulsa unas cuantas veces hasta que empiece a parecerse a harina. Agregue el polvo para hornear, el plátano picado, el jarabe de arce o la miel, los huevos y la mezcla de especias o canela y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Agregue las chispas de chocolate o las bayas.","Engrase ligeramente cuatro moldes resistentes al calor y luego divida la masa entre ellos. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos, o hasta que haya subido bien y la avena horneada vuelva a saltar al presionarla ligeramente. Espolvoree con más chispas de chocolate o bayas antes de servir, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:55:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13078,9045,'es','magdalenas navideñas','Prepare estos deliciosos muffins especiados antes del día de Navidad y luego comience las festividades repartiéndolos mientras todos abren sus regalos debajo del árbol.','["125 g de mantequilla sin sal","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharaditas de canela","¼ de nuez moscada, recién rallada","150 gramos de yogur natural","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos medianos","1 naranja, rallada y en jugo","150 g de chocolate (blanco, con leche u oscuro), picado","50 g de arándanos secos","50 g de azúcar glas","2 cucharadas de azúcar perlada (opcional)"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forra una bandeja para muffins de 12 orificios con moldes de papel para muffins.","Derrita la mantequilla en el microondas o en una sartén pequeña a fuego lento, luego déjela enfriar durante 10 minutos. Mientras tanto, mezcla en un bol grande la harina, el bicarbonato, el azúcar, la canela y la nuez moscada con una pizca de sal.","Agrega el yogur, la vainilla y los huevos a la mantequilla enfriada y mezcla bien. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos sobre los secos junto con la ralladura de naranja, el chocolate y los arándanos secos. Mezclar bien hasta que no queden bolsas de harina.","Divida la mezcla uniformemente entre las cajas de papel, luego hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorada. Comprueba que estén cocidos introduciendo un palito en el centro de uno de los muffins (elige uno en el centro de la bandeja). Si queda algo de masa húmeda para pastel adherido a la brocheta, regrese al horno por 5 minutos.","Retirar los muffins del horno y dejar enfriar en el molde durante al menos 10 minutos. Mientras tanto, mezcle el azúcar glas con suficiente jugo de naranja para formar un glaseado suelto. Cepille el glaseado de naranja sobre cada muffin y luego espolvoree con un poco de azúcar perlado, si lo usa. Deje enfriar antes de comer. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días o congelado hasta por dos meses."]','2026-01-11 12:55:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13079,5123,'es','Pastel de chocolate y almendras sin harina','Este denso y esponjoso pastel de chocolate y almendras es perfecto para el postre. No contiene gluten; solo asegúrate de que tu cacao en polvo y tu chocolate tampoco lo contengan','["200g de chocolate negro para cocinar, troceado en pedazos pequeños","200g de mantequilla, troceada en pedazos pequeños","3 huevos","175g de azúcar extrafino dorado","100 g de queso mascarpone o crema","¼ cdta de extracto de vainilla","100g de almendras molidas","30g de cacao en polvo, y un poco más para servir"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180°C/160°C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar la base de un molde desmontable de 20 cm con papel de hornear. Derretir el chocolate y la mantequilla en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento, o en el microondas en intervalos de 20 segundos. Remover, luego dejar enfriar un poco.","Mientras tanto, poner los huevos y el azúcar en un segundo bol y batir con una batidora eléctrica durante 4-5 minutos, o hasta que esté espeso y cremoso. Agregar el mascarpone o queso crema y la vainilla, y continuar batiendo hasta que todo esté combinado. Incorporar suavemente la mezcla de chocolate derretido enfriado hasta que tenga un color uniforme, luego incorporar las almendras. Tamizar el cacao en polvo y una pizca pequeña de sal, e incorporar para combinar.","Verter la masa del pastel en el molde preparado. Poner el molde en una bandeja de horno y hornear durante 35-40 minutos hasta que el pastel se haya inflado y agrietado en la parte superior. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar en el molde durante 30-40 minutos; se desinflará a medida que se enfríe. Servir tibio como un pudin de chocolate, o dejar enfriar completamente y disfrutar como un pastel tipo brownie fundente. Espolvorear con cacao en polvo extra antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13080,3910,'es','Muffins de frambuesa y chocolate blanco','Deléitese con estos muffins de frambuesa y chispas de chocolate blanco para disfrutar de un dulce capricho. Elaborados con frambuesas frescas o congeladas, son perfectos para acompañar una taza de té.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada","65 g de azúcar en polvo","65 g de azúcar moreno claro","2 huevos grandes, temperatura ambiente","125 g de yogur griego","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","5 cucharadas de leche","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de frambuesas (frescas o congeladas)","75 g de chispas de chocolate blanco"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con fundas de papel.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar durante 5 minutos hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos gradualmente y bate hasta que se combinen. Agrega el yogur, la vainilla y la leche. Incorpora la harina, la levadura en polvo y una pizca de sal fina hasta obtener una masa suave. Finalmente, agregue 150 g de frambuesas y chispas de chocolate blanco y llene los moldes para muffins hasta las tres cuartas partes de su capacidad.","Introduce 2 frambuesas en la parte superior de cada muffin para que sobresalgan ligeramente. Hornee durante 8 minutos, luego reduzca el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y hornee durante 20-25 minutos más hasta que suba y esté dorado, y al insertar un palito en el centro, éste salga limpio."]','2026-01-11 12:55:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13081,9046,'es','Tarta de chocolate negro y maracuyá','Combine el chocolate con maracuyá para preparar este postre deliciosamente decadente. La cuajada de frutas picante combina maravillosamente con la rica ganache.','["180 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","85 g de azúcar glas","50 g de cacao en polvo, más 1-2 cucharadas para espolvorear","140 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en cubos","2 yemas de huevo","semillas de cacao, para decorar (opcional)","crème fraîche, para servir","200 g de pulpa de maracuyá (de unas 8-10 maracuyás)","1 hoja de gelatina","3 huevos medianos","70 g de mantequilla sin sal","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1½ cucharada de harina de maíz","150 g de chocolate negro (al menos 70 % de cacao)","150ml de nata doble","150 g de azúcar moreno blando"]','["Tamizar en un bol la harina, el azúcar glas, el cacao y ½ cucharadita de sal. Frote la mantequilla con los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Agrega las yemas de huevo junto con 2 cucharadas de agua helada y continúa mezclando con las manos hasta que se forme una masa suave. Alternativamente, mezcle los ingredientes en un procesador de alimentos. Envuelva la masa y enfríe durante al menos 1 hora. Se mantendrá fría hasta por dos días.","Forre la base de un molde para tarta de fondo suelto de 23 cm con papel para hornear. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de £1, luego úsela para forrar el molde para tarta, presionándola hacia un lado y dejando un poco sobresaliendo. Cubra y enfríe por 1 hora más.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Forrar la masa con papel para hornear y rellenar con frijoles para hornear. Hornee por 20 minutos. Retire los frijoles y el pergamino y hornee por 20 minutos más hasta que estén crujientes. Deje enfriar por completo y luego use un cuchillo afilado para recortar el exceso de masa.","Para hacer la cuajada, ponga la pulpa de maracuyá en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle para separar las semillas y la pulpa. Pasar por un colador sobre una cacerola mediana y luego desechar las semillas. Vierta los ingredientes restantes y coloque la sartén a fuego lento. Batir hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y luego, con una cuchara de madera, revolver hasta que la cuajada se espese, aproximadamente 10 minutos. (No suba el fuego para acelerar el proceso, ya que los huevos se cuajan). Revuelva bien, especialmente en el borde, ya que aquí es donde la cuajada puede atascarse. Colar en un bol, dejar enfriar y verter en el estuche. Enfriar la tarta rellena durante 30 minutos.","Para hacer la ganache, derrita el chocolate, la crema, el azúcar y una pizca de sal marina en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua, revolviendo hasta que esté brillante y espesa. Retirar del fuego, dejar enfriar durante 15 minutos y luego verter sobre la capa de cuajada. Esparza sobre las semillas de cacao, si las usa, luego enfríe durante al menos 4 horas o durante la noche. Espolvoree con cacao, luego córtelo en rodajas y sirva con crema fresca."]','2026-01-11 12:55:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13082,4016,'es','Pan de Pain au Chocolat para rasgar y compartir','Comience su fin de semana con este pan de dolor de chocolate para arrancar y compartir para el brunch. Sirva con frambuesas o simplemente solo con una taza de chocolate caliente.','["Paquete de 275 g de masa Jus-Rol™ Pains Au Chocolat","6 cucharaditas de mermelada de frambuesa, mermelada o pasas","25 g de chocolate amargo, picado","azúcar glas y frambuesas para servir"]','["Forre un molde para pan (de aproximadamente 900 g de volumen) con una tira de papel para hornear que sobresalga de los lados. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Abre el paquete de Jus-Rol™ Pains Au Chocolat Dough, girando la lata para retirar la masa. Desenreda sobre una superficie de trabajo y separa cada pieza perforada, luego corta cada pieza por la mitad para obtener 12 cuadrados. Agrega una tira de chocolate a cada uno de los cuadritos, y agrega ½ cucharadita de confitura, mermelada o unas pasas a cada uno (o déjalo simple si lo prefieres) y envuélvelos en la masa, como si fuera un rollo de salchicha.","Coloque los rollos de chocolate en la lata sobre sus extremos para que el chocolate quede expuesto en la parte superior y coloque los rollos espaciados uniformemente para que haya mucho espacio para expandirse. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén dorados y bien leudados.","Derrita el chocolate en un recipiente sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo hasta que se derrita, o derrítalo en breves ráfagas en el microondas. Deje los pasteles durante 10 minutos en el molde y luego use el pergamino para sacarlos del molde. Transfiera a un plato para servir. Rocíe sobre el chocolate derretido y espolvoree con un poco de azúcar glas, si lo desea. Sirva caliente o a temperatura ambiente con frambuesas, o simplemente solo con una taza de chocolate caliente. Es mejor comerlo el mismo día."]','2026-01-11 12:55:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13083,9047,'es','Tarta de brownie de chocolate y naranja','Sorprenda a familiares y amigos con esta tarta de brownie de chocolate y naranja. Con una base de hojaldre desmenuzable, es un postre deliciosamente exquisito o un capricho para cualquier momento.','["Paquete de 320 g de lámina de masa quebrada Jus-Rol™","120 g de chocolate amargo, picado","120 g de mantequilla, en cubos","2 huevos","80 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","80 g de azúcar moreno blando","80 g de harina común","1 naranja, rallada y en jugo y más ralladura para servir","crema fresca para servir"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Desenreda la lámina de masa quebrada Jus-Rol™ y úsala para forrar un molde para tarta de 20 cm. Presione los lados de la lata y corte sin apretar alrededor de los bordes, dejando un poco sobresaliente. Forre la masa con un trozo de papel para hornear arrugado y rellénela con arroz crudo o frijoles para hornear. Hornee por 15 minutos, retire el papel y hornee por otros 5-10 minutos hasta que se seque.","Mientras se cocina la masa, coloque la mantequilla y el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo y derrita, revolviendo con frecuencia. Cuando esté derretido, retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco. Agrega una pizca de sal si tu mantequilla no tiene sal.","Batir brevemente los huevos y el azúcar en un tazón hasta que se combinen, luego agregar el chocolate derretido y la mantequilla. Tamizar sobre la harina e incorporar hasta que esté combinado. Agrega el jugo de naranja y la ralladura.","Recorta los bordes de la tarta de hojaldre con un cuchillo de sierra para que quede limpio y vierte la mezcla de brownie en el medio. Alise con el dorso de una cuchara o espátula y hornee durante 30-35 minutos más hasta que la parte superior forme una costra y el relleno ya no esté húmedo sino ligeramente tambaleante.","Deje enfriar durante 15 minutos antes de sacarlo del molde si sirve caliente, o sírvalo a temperatura ambiente. Sirva con una cucharada de crema fresca y un poco más de ralladura de naranja. Se conserva durante 3 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:55:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13084,9048,'es','Pavlova de chocolate y mantequilla de maní','Combine maní dulce y salado, merengue crujiente y un cremoso cremoso de chocolate mezclado con una rica crema de mantequilla de maní en este postre. Es un deleite sensorial','["75 g de leche entera","115 ml de nata para montar","2 yemas de huevo, reservando las claras para el merengue","50 g de azúcar en polvo","150 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","60 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","3 claras de huevo grandes","200 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino blanco","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","50 g de chocolate amargo, derretido y enfriado","100 g de maní sin cáscara, normal o tostado","60 g de azúcar granulada","100 g de chocolate blanco, picado en trozos grandes","100 g de mantequilla de maní suave","25 g de mantequilla fría con sal, cortada en cubos","225ml de nata doble","virutas de chocolate amargo, para servir (opcional)"]','["Primero, haz el cremeux. Hierva la leche y la nata en una cacerola pequeña, batiendo ocasionalmente. Bate las yemas de huevo y el azúcar en un recipiente mediano resistente al calor hasta que quede suave. Vierta la mezcla de crema caliente en un chorro constante, batiendo continuamente hasta que se combinen. Regrese a la cacerola y cocine a fuego lento durante 3-4 minutos, revolviendo continuamente hasta que espese.","Coloque el chocolate amargo en un recipiente grande resistente al calor y cuele la crema caliente sobre él a través de un colador de malla fina, batiendo hasta que el chocolate se derrita y la mezcla esté suave. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos hasta que esté tibio. Agregue la mantequilla y mezcle con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Cubra y déjelo a temperatura ambiente hasta que lo necesite.","Calienta el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2 y forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Para el merengue, bata las claras de huevo en un tazón grande y limpio usando una batidora eléctrica o una batidora de pie hasta que se formen picos suaves, luego agregue gradualmente el azúcar, 1 cucharadita a la vez, hasta que el merengue esté espeso y brillante. Incorpora el vinagre y la harina de maíz.","Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de merengue en el medio de una de las bandejas para hornear preparadas y extiéndala formando un círculo de aproximadamente 20-25 cm. Repita con la mezcla de merengue restante en la segunda bandeja para hornear. Rocíe el chocolate derretido uniformemente sobre ambos círculos, luego gírelo suavemente con un cuchillo para cubiertos o una brocheta hasta obtener un efecto veteado. Hornear durante 1 h, apagar el horno y dejar enfriar los merengues por completo por dentro.","Mientras tanto, haz los cacahuetes confitados. Vierta los cacahuetes, el azúcar y 1 cucharada de agua en una cacerola de fondo grueso y cocine a fuego medio durante 3-4 minutos, revolviendo hasta que los cacahuetes empiecen a cristalizar y ponerse blancos. Continúe cocinando, revolviendo, durante otros 3-4 minutos hasta que los cacahuetes adquieran un color marrón oscuro. Espolvorea con una pizca de hojuelas de sal marina y luego raspa sobre una hoja de papel para hornear. Extender con una espátula y dejar enfriar por completo.","Para la crema de mantequilla de maní, derrita el chocolate blanco, la mantequilla de maní, la mantequilla y 25 ml de nata en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento, revolviendo hasta que quede suave. Pasar a un bol y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos. Batir el resto de la crema hasta obtener picos suaves, luego incorporar la mezcla de mantequilla de maní hasta que esté espesa y esponjosa.","Para armar, coloque un círculo de merengue en un plato para servir, vierta la mitad del crémeux seguido de la mitad de la crema de mantequilla de maní y luego espolvoree con la mitad de los maní confitados. Cubra con el segundo círculo de merengue, luego el resto del crémeux y la crema de mantequilla de maní y el resto de los maní confitados. Si lo desea, esparza algunas virutas de chocolate amargo. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13085,9049,'es','Tronco de Navidad vegano','Prepare este tronco de Navidad de chocolate vegano con anticipación para disfrutar de un postre festivo sin estrés: una excelente alternativa al pudín navideño.','["50 g de margarina sin lácteos, derretida, más un poco más para la lata","250 ml de leche de soja","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de sidra","250 g de harina con levadura","50 g de azúcar en polvo, más 2 cucharadas","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharada de cacao en polvo","90 g de margarina sin lácteos","200 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 gramos de chocolate amargo","1½ cucharada de azúcar moreno","130 g de tofu sedoso","frutos rojos variados, acebo o azúcar glas para decorar (opcional)"]','["Primero, haz la ganache. Derrita el chocolate y el azúcar en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento, asegurándose de que el fondo del recipiente no toque el agua. Dejar enfriar un poco. Batir el tofu en un tazón mediano con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave. Agrega la mezcla de chocolate derretido y bate durante 1-2 minutos más hasta que espese y quede suave. Reservar en un lugar fresco.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para panecillos suizos de 33 x 23 cm con papel para hornear. Mezcle la leche y el vinagre en una jarra y déjelo a un lado para que espese un poco. Batir la harina, 50 g de azúcar, la levadura en polvo y el cacao en polvo hasta que se combinen. Batir la margarina derretida con la mezcla de leche y verterla gradualmente en los ingredientes secos, batiendo continuamente hasta que quede suave. Vierte en el molde, alisa la superficie y hornea por 20 minutos. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos.","Espolvorea las 2 cucharadas de azúcar sobre una hoja grande de papel para hornear. Coloque el bizcocho tibio sobre el pergamino azucarado y luego retire el pergamino usado para forrar la lata. Enrolla el bizcocho por uno de los extremos cortos, ayudándote del pergamino azucarado. Mientras está enrollado, cúbralo con un paño de cocina y déjelo enfriar por completo (enrollar el bizcocho mientras está tibio ayuda a evitar grandes grietas). No te preocupes si quedan pequeñas grietas, quedarán ocultas por la ganache.","Haga el glaseado batiendo la margarina, el azúcar glas y la vainilla hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Desenrolle el bizcocho enfriado con cuidado y luego extienda el glaseado con una espátula, dejando un borde de aproximadamente 5 cm en el extremo corto del rollo. Enrollar nuevamente el bizcocho.","Revuelva la ganache para aflojarla y luego extiéndala sobre el tronco de Navidad con una espátula. Arrastre un tenedor a lo largo del tronco varias veces para crear un patrón similar a una corteza. Enfríe durante 30 minutos. Se mantendrá en el refrigerador hasta por tres días. Decore con bayas y acebo, o espolvoree con azúcar glas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:55:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13086,4078,'es','Galletas con chispas de chocolate y menta','Disfruta de estas galletas durante la temporada navideña y compártelas con tus seres queridos. Están hechos con pequeños trozos de bastones de caramelo de menta para darle un toque extra festivo.','["125 g de mantequilla salada","125 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo grande","225 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 gotas de extracto de menta","100 g de chispas de chocolate amargo","100 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos grandes","3 bastones de caramelo de menta, finamente picados o triturados"]','["Derretir la mantequilla en una sartén, dejar enfriar unos minutos y luego verter en un bol grande. Batir los azúcares y el huevo hasta que se combinen.","Use una cuchara de madera para mezclar la harina y el polvo para hornear hasta que la mezcla forme una masa. Incorpora el extracto de menta y luego incorpora las chispas de chocolate. Envolver bien y enfriar durante 1 hora.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Divida la masa para galletas en 16 trozos (de unos 45 g cada uno) y forme una bola con cada trozo con las manos. Coloque las bolas de masa en dos bandejas para hornear forradas con papel de hornear, bien espaciadas y presiónelas ligeramente. Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego retire las bandejas del horno y golpee con fuerza una superficie de trabajo para aplanar las galletas. Regrese al horno y repita esto después de 2 minutos, luego nuevamente después de otros 2 minutos (deben hornearse durante 14 minutos en total). Dejar enfriar completamente en las bandejas.","Derrita el chocolate picado en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, o en ráfagas de 15 segundos en el microondas, revolviendo entre cada ráfaga. Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Sumerge la mitad de cada galleta en el chocolate derretido, colócalas en la bandeja forrada y espolvorea con trozos de bastón de caramelo. Transfiera la bandeja al refrigerador y enfríe durante 30 minutos para que cuaje."]','2026-01-11 12:55:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13087,9050,'es','Corteza de chocolate casera fácil','Haga de nuestra corteza de chocolate un maravilloso regalo en Navidad. La receta es adaptable, así que usa las galletas que tengas o las favoritas de tu regalo.','["400 g de chocolate con leche o negro, partido en trozos","100 g de chocolate blanco partido en trozos","75 g de galletas, de tu elección, partidas en trozos","2 cucharadas de chispas, nueces picadas o dulces"]','["Derrita la leche o el chocolate amargo en un recipiente grande resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Retirar del fuego y luego derretir el chocolate blanco de la misma forma. O derrita los chocolates en el microondas en ráfagas cortas.","Forre una bandeja o bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Use una bandeja para hornear si desea fragmentos de corteza más delgados o una bandeja más pequeña para obtener menos trozos más gruesos.","Vierta la leche derretida o el chocolate amargo sobre la hoja o bandeja preparada, luego incline de lado a lado para esparcir el chocolate hasta obtener la forma y el grosor deseados. Vierta cucharaditas de chocolate blanco, reserve un poco, luego use la punta de un cuchillo o una brocheta para hacer girar el chocolate blanco con la leche o el chocolate negro.","Distribuya sobre los trozos de galleta y luego rocíe sobre el chocolate blanco restante en forma de espiral. Esparza sobre las chispas, nueces o dulces, luego déjelo en un lugar fresco para que cuaje por completo. Cortar o romper en pedazos y envolver."]','2026-01-11 12:55:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13088,9051,'es','Tarta de brownie de chocolate del millonario','Imagínese una caja de masa de mantequilla de chocolate con relleno de brownie dulce que esconde bolitas de caramelo exudado... Este es el postre soñado por los amantes del chocolate.','["175 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","85 g de azúcar glas","50 g de cacao en polvo","140 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","2 yemas de huevo, ligeramente batidas","150 g de mantequilla, picada","200 g de chocolate negro, partido en trozos","2 huevos","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","75 g de cacao en polvo, más algo extra para servir","18 bombones rellenos de caramelo"]','["Para hacer la masa, tamizamos la harina, el azúcar glas y el cacao en un bol. Agrega la mantequilla y frótala con los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Agrega las yemas de huevo y 3 cucharadas de agua helada y continúa mezclando con los dedos hasta obtener una masa suave. Alternativamente, haga esto en un procesador de alimentos mezclando los ingredientes. Envuelva la masa y enfríe durante al menos 1 hora. Se mantendrá fría hasta por dos días.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de £1, luego úsela para forrar un molde para tarta de fondo suelto de 23 cm, trabajando la masa hasta el borde y dejando algo que sobresalga. Tapar y meter en el frigorífico para que se enfríe una hora más.","Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Cubra la caja con papel para hornear y luego llénela con frijoles para hornear. Hornee por 20 minutos. Retire los frijoles para hornear y el pergamino y hornee por 15 a 20 minutos más, o hasta que la base esté crujiente. Dejar enfriar por completo. Una vez enfriado, use un cuchillo afilado para recortar el exceso de masa y crear un borde liso.","Para el relleno, derrita la mantequilla y el chocolate amargo en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una olla con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Remueve hasta que quede suave, retira del fuego y deja enfriar un poco. Batir los huevos y el azúcar con un batidor eléctrico en otro bol durante 5-6 minutos, o hasta que estén espesos y pálidos. Incorpora el chocolate y luego tamiza el cacao.","Esparce los bombones de caramelo sobre la base de la masa de hojaldre y luego vierte sobre el relleno. Transfiera la tarta a una bandeja para hornear y métala en el horno (aún a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5) durante 20-25 minutos, o hasta que cuaje y la parte superior haya formado una costra. Deje enfriar a temperatura ambiente, luego retírelo con cuidado del molde y colóquelo en un plato para servir. Espolvoree con el cacao extra y espolvoree un poco de sal marina, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:55:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13089,9052,'es','Bandeja doble de chocolate y coco','Combine chocolate con leche cremoso con coco para lograr una combinación perfecta, luego decore con más coco y un chorrito de chocolate blanco.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","3 huevos grandes","60 g de coco rallado","200 g de harina con levadura","100 g de yogur griego","½ cucharadita de saborizante de coco (opcional, consulte el consejo a continuación)","200 g de chocolate con leche o negro, picado en trozos pequeños","200ml de nata doble","40 g de chocolate blanco, derretido","un puñado de hojuelas de coco, coco tostado o desecado o chispitas"]','["Forre un molde para pastel rectangular de 22 x 28 cm con papel para hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Primero, prepara la cobertura. Coloque los trozos de chocolate con leche o amargo en un recipiente grande resistente al calor. Calienta la crema doble en una sartén mediana hasta que esté humeante, luego vierte lentamente sobre el chocolate, batiendo hasta que el chocolate se derrita y la mezcla esté suave. Deje que se enfríe un poco, luego enfríe durante 1 hora y 30 minutos hasta que esté suave, pero aún se pueda tomar con una cuchara.","Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y ¼ de cucharadita de sal en una batidora de pie o con un batidor eléctrico durante 5 minutos, o hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Agrega los huevos uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Agregue el coco desecado, la harina, el yogur y el saborizante de coco, si lo usa, y bata brevemente hasta que se combinen. Vierta la mezcla en el molde, alise la superficie con el dorso de una cuchara y luego hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que esté dorada y firme al tacto. Dejar en el molde hasta que se enfríe por completo.","Cuando esté completamente frío, extiéndalo sobre la cobertura de chocolate, luego rocíe con el chocolate blanco y esparza sobre las hojuelas de coco tostadas. Enfríe durante unos 15 minutos hasta que cuaje la cobertura. Córtelo en 12 cuadrados y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:55:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13090,6869,'es','Bandeja de fiesta de chocolate vegana','Prepare una deliciosa bandeja horneada de chocolate vegana que le encantará a toda la familia. Este sencillo horneado es perfecto para compartir en fiestas o una ocasión especial.','["215 ml de aceite de girasol, más un poco más para la lata","300ml de leche de soja, almendras o coco","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de manzana","335 g de azúcar mascabado light","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla o pasta de vainilla","175g soy yogurt or coconut yogurt","300 g de harina con levadura","105 g de cacao en polvo","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","¼ cucharadita de sal","100 g de chocolate negro sin lácteos","140 g de crema vegana a temperatura ambiente","1 cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla","265 g de azúcar glas tamizada","½ –1 ​​cucharada de leche vegetal (la que hayas usado en el bizcocho)","chispas de colores (asegúrate de que sean aptas para veganos), para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar un molde para hornear de 23 x 33 cm (al menos 4 cm de profundidad) y forrar las bases y los lados con papel para hornear. Batir la leche y el vinagre en una jarra; la leche debe cuajar un poco. Dejar de lado.","Batir el azúcar, el aceite y el extracto de vainilla en un bol, luego agregar el yogur, asegurándose de deshacer los grumos de azúcar. Vierta la leche agria y mezcle bien.","Tamiza la harina, el cacao en polvo, el polvo para hornear, el bicarbonato de sodio y la sal en un recipiente aparte y revuelve bien para combinar. Incorpora gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos a los secos hasta obtener una masa suave, pero ten cuidado de no mezclar demasiado.","Vierta la masa en el molde y hornee durante 30-35 minutos, hasta que esté bien leudada y elástica, y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, ésta salga casi limpia. Unas cuantas migas pegajosas están bien, pero la mezcla no debe quedar húmeda.","Deje que el pastel se enfríe en su molde durante 20 minutos, luego con cuidado desmoldelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Será delicado, así que sé gentil. La esponja se mantendrá cubierta a temperatura ambiente hasta por dos días.","Para la crema de mantequilla vegana, derrita el chocolate en el microondas o en un recipiente colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Dejar enfriar. Batir la crema para untar y la vainilla a alta velocidad en una batidora de pie durante unos minutos hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Agrega el azúcar glas gradualmente, batiendo lentamente al principio, luego aumenta la velocidad al máximo hasta que la mezcla esté ligera y cremosa. Vierta el chocolate enfriado y combine bien, agregue un chorrito de leche vegetal si el glaseado está muy duro. Enfríe la crema de mantequilla durante al menos 30 minutos antes de usarla.","Cuando el bizcocho esté completamente frío, esparce el glaseado por encima y decora con las chispas, si quieres. Mantenga el bizcocho en el frigorífico para que se mantenga firme y luego retírelo 1 hora antes de servir. Se mantendrá tapado en el refrigerador hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13091,5181,'es','Pastel de chocolate sin harina','Invite a alguien a este pastel de chocolate sin harina. Es ideal para cualquiera que siga una dieta sin gluten y es un postre irresistible con frutos rojos frescos.','["225 g de mantequilla con sal, en cubos y más para la lata","300 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de café en polvo","6 huevos grandes, claras y yemas separadas","100 g de azúcar moreno claro suave","200 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","30 g de cacao en polvo","bayas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Untar con mantequilla un molde desmontable de 23 cm y forrar la base con papel para hornear.","Derrita la mantequilla y el chocolate en un recipiente mediano resistente al calor en el microondas o sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento. Mezcla el café en polvo con 2 cucharadas de agua caliente hasta que se disuelva. Agrega el café al chocolate y deja enfriar un poco.","Batir las claras en un bol grande durante 2 minutos con una batidora eléctrica hasta que se formen picos suaves. En otro tazón grande, bata los azúcares, la vainilla y las yemas de huevo durante 5 a 8 minutos, o hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Tamiza el cacao en polvo en la mezcla de yemas de huevo y mezcla suavemente para combinar.","Agrega el chocolate enfriado a la mezcla de yemas de huevo, luego incorpora suavemente las claras hasta que quede suave. Transfiera al molde y hornee durante 1 hora a 1 hora 20 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio del pastel, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar, desmoldar y servir con frutos rojos frescos, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:55:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13092,9053,'es','Bandeja financiera de frambuesa y chocolate blanco','Piense en los financieros como elegantes hornos hechos con mantequilla marrón. Tom Kerridge los convierte aquí en una bandeja para hornear, usando frambuesas y chocolate blanco.','["200 g de mantequilla, más un extra para la lata","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de harina común","100 g de almendras molidas","una pizca pequeña de canela molida","6 claras de huevo grandes (congela las yemas para otra receta)","150 g de frambuesas","100 g de chispas o trozos de chocolate blanco","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","227 g de nata coagulada, para servir"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña hasta que chisporrotee. Obsérvelo con atención: la mantequilla formará espuma y, cuando la espuma desaparezca, cambiará de amarillo a marrón nuez. Retirar del fuego, verter en un bol para detener la cocción y dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para hornear de 20 x 25 cm con al menos 4 cm de profundidad y cubrir con papel para hornear. Mezclar el azúcar, la harina, las almendras y la canela. Batir las claras de huevo en un recipiente grande aparte con una batidora eléctrica hasta obtener picos suaves. Incorpora las claras batidas a la mezcla de harina con una cuchara de metal grande. Vierta lentamente la mantequilla dorada, incorporándola hasta que todo esté combinado y la masa esté ligera. Vierta en la lata preparada. Esparcir sobre las frambuesas y el chocolate.","Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté firme. Dejar enfriar en el molde, espolvorear con un poco de azúcar glas y cortar en cuadritos o barras. Se mantendrá bien envuelto hasta por tres días a temperatura ambiente. Servir con crema cuajada."]','2026-01-11 12:55:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13093,9054,'es','Budín de chocolate y mermelada al vapor con crema de mermelada','Combine chocolate y mermelada para obtener un postre hecho en el cielo. La crema, que también combina con muchos otros postres, sube un nivel superior','["175 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para el recipiente","45 g de cacao en polvo","175 g de harina común","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 naranja, rallada","3 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos","115 g de mermelada blanda, batida para aflojar","100 g de chocolate negro, picado","300ml de nata doble","1 cucharada colmada de azúcar glas","125 g de mermelada blanda, batida para aflojar y más para servir"]','["Unte con mantequilla un recipiente para budín de 1,2 litros y coloque un círculo de papel de horno untado con mantequilla en la base.","Tamizar juntos el cacao, la harina, el bicarbonato, la levadura y una pizca de sal. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos, luego agregar la ralladura de naranja. Agrega poco a poco los huevos, poco a poco, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Agrega la mermelada. Incorpora los ingredientes tamizados y luego los trozos de chocolate amargo. Vierta la masa en el recipiente para pudín preparado.","Coloque un trozo de papel para hornear encima de una hoja de papel de aluminio (ambos deben ser lo suficientemente grandes como para cubrir el recipiente y sobresalir de los bordes). Doble un pliegue a lo largo del medio y luego colóquelo, con el lado del pergamino hacia abajo, sobre el pudín. El pliegue debe atravesar el centro. Átelo firmemente al lavabo con una cuerda y utilícela como asa. Recorta el exceso de pergamino y papel de aluminio.","Coloque el pudín en una cacerola grande sobre un salvamanteles o un platillo volteado. Agregue suficiente agua hirviendo para llegar a un tercio de los lados del recipiente. Lleve el agua a ebullición, baje a fuego lento, cubra la cacerola y cocine el pudín al vapor durante 2 horas a 2 horas y 15 minutos. Siga rellenando con agua caliente.","Saque el pudín del molde, déjelo reposar durante 10 minutos y luego pase un cuchillo entre el recipiente y el borde del pudín. Invierta sobre un plato; el pudín debe deslizarse hacia afuera. Retire el pergamino.","Batir la nata y el azúcar glas hasta obtener picos suaves y luego agregar la mermelada. Servir el pudín con un chorrito de nata y un poco de mermelada por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:55:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13094,9055,'es','Tazas de chocolate banoffee','Haga estos para regalar como regalo de Navidad comestible. Elaborados con chocolate, dulce de leche y chips de plátano, tienen todo el sabor del pastel banoffee en un pequeño bocado.','["150 g de chocolate amargo, picado","150 g de chocolate con leche, picado","12 mini galletas digestivas (o unas galletas digestivas trituradas)","40 g de chips de plátano, finamente desmenuzados","100g dulce de leche","rizos de chocolate, chispas de oro u pan de oro comestible, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Forre un molde para cupcakes de 12 agujeros con fundas de papel o silicona. Derrita el chocolate negro y el chocolate con leche juntos durante 1-2 minutos en el microondas. Dividir las galletas digestivas entre las cajas y poner en cada una los chips de plátano. Vierte en las cajas suficiente chocolate derretido para cubrir las galletas, reservando el resto. Transfiera la lata al congelador para que se enfríe durante 15 minutos.","Revuelva el dulce de leche para aflojarlo, luego con una cuchara o coloque un pequeño punto en el centro de cada taza. Vierta sobre el chocolate reservado para cubrir el relleno, luego decore con rizos de chocolate, chispas de oro o pan de oro comestible, si lo desea. Ponlo en el frigorífico para que se enfríe durante 2 horas, luego retira las cajas y empaca en cajas de regalo. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13095,9056,'es','Camino rocoso de Navidad','Adapta este festivo camino rocoso como quieras. Es genial para usar los dulces y galletas sobrantes de Navidad, y también puedes involucrar a los niños en su preparación.','["100 g de mantequilla cortada en cubos, más un poco más para el molde","250 g de galletas navideñas, como galletas de mantequilla o de chocolate","75 g de nueces sin cáscara (use una bolsa de nueces enteras o trozos del horno)","100 g de frutos secos variados (como pasas, cerezas o jengibre glaseado)","75 g de dulces navideños (bastones de caramelo, malvaviscos o gominolas)","400 g de chocolate con leche o natural (o una mezcla de ambos), picado","140 g de almíbar dorado (péselo directamente en la sartén que usará para derretir)","2 cucharadas de chispas, o más dulces, para decorar"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde cuadrado de 20 cm, o utilice un molde de silicona cuadrado de 20 cm. Rompe las galletas en pedazos; no deben ser más pequeños que un guisante, pero tampoco demasiado gruesos o el camino rocoso no se mantendrá unido.","Corte por la mitad las nueces más grandes, ya sea partiéndolas o cortándolas con cuidado con un cuchillo, luego combínelas con las galletas. Corte por la mitad los trozos grandes de fruta seca y pique o parta los dulces en trozos más pequeños, luego agréguelos al tazón.","Derretir con cuidado 300 g de chocolate, la mantequilla y el almíbar dorado en una sartén a fuego lento, revolviendo de vez en cuando, luego verter esto sobre la mezcla de galleta y nueces y mezclar para que el chocolate lo cubra todo.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde y luego nivele la parte superior; no es necesario que quede completamente suave. Derrita el chocolate restante en el microondas en ráfagas cortas o en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola pequeña con agua hirviendo, luego rocíelo por encima y espolvoree con las decoraciones. Enfríelo durante al menos 3 horas o toda la noche antes de cortarlo en cuadritos. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante tres o cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13096,9057,'es','Fondant de chocolate de siguiente nivel','Sorprenda a los invitados a la cena con nuestro fondant de chocolate definitivo. Su centro fundido es un postre de ensueño, y también le hemos añadido sabores de caramelo y café.','["200 g de mantequilla, derretida","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo, para espolvorear","50 g de salsa de caramelo","200 g de chocolate amargo, picado","4 cucharadas de café en polvo muy fuerte (el espresso es ideal)","6 huevos, tres enteros, más las yemas de 3 (congela las claras sobrantes para otra receta)","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de harina común","6 recipientes pequeños de metal para pudín"]','["Utilice 50 g de mantequilla para cepillar el interior de los recipientes para pudín. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear y transfiéralo al refrigerador para que se enfríe hasta que la mantequilla cuaje. Unte otra capa de mantequilla y luego espolvoree generosamente con el cacao. Regresar a la nevera para que cuaje. Mezclar la salsa de caramelo con una buena pizca de escamas de sal marina y luego enfriar en el frigorífico hasta el momento de usar.","Vierta la mantequilla restante, el chocolate y el café en polvo en un recipiente resistente al calor. Coloque el recipiente sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento, asegurándose de que el fondo del recipiente no toque el agua. Revuelva la mezcla hasta que quede suave y agregue otra pizca de sal marina. Vierta los huevos enteros, las yemas y el azúcar en otro bol y bátalos con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén muy pálidos; la batidora debe dejar un rastro en la mezcla cuando la levante. Tamice la harina y luego agregue suavemente la mezcla de chocolate derretido.","Vierta la mezcla de fondant en los recipientes preparados hasta que estén casi hasta la mitad, luego transfiérala al congelador en una bandeja para hornear durante unos 20 a 25 minutos, o hasta que la mezcla esté firme. Agregue 1 cucharadita de salsa de caramelo salado al centro de cada fondant, luego complete con la mezcla de fondant restante. Regrese al congelador hasta que esté congelado. Se puede preparar con hasta dos semanas de anticipación.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque los fondants en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 15 minutos hasta que la parte superior haya formado una costra y comience a despegarse de los lados de los recipientes. Retirar del horno, luego dejar reposar durante 1 minuto antes de colocar en platos calientes. Espolvoree con más sal marina y sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 12:55:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13097,9058,'es','Hormigón de chocolate con salsa de caramelo','Actualice una receta clásica de cena escolar usando salsa de caramelo en lugar de natillas rosadas para servir junto con cuadritos de chocolate. A los niños (y a los grandes) les encantará.','["175 g de harina común","50 g de almendras molidas","60 g de cacao","115 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","145 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","azúcar demerara, para espolvorear","4 cucharadas de caramelo","50ml de nata líquida"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner la harina, las almendras, el cacao, el azúcar en polvo y una pizca grande de sal en un procesador de alimentos y batir brevemente. Agrega la mantequilla y bate hasta que la mezcla parezca arena húmeda.","Unte con mantequilla generosamente la base y los lados de un molde para hornear pequeño (15 x 25 cm). Vierta la mezcla en el molde y presione hacia abajo. Hornee por 30 minutos. Retirar del horno, espolvorear un poco de azúcar demerara y cortar en cuadritos con un cuchillo afilado mientras aún esté suave.","Mientras tanto, calentar el caramelo y la nata juntos en una sartén. Sirve el hormigón tibio con la salsa de caramelo. Puedes enfriar las sobras y comerlas frías; se endurecerán como galletas de mantequilla."]','2026-01-11 12:55:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13098,9059,'es','Bollos cruzados calientes de doble chocolate','Una versión indulgente de un regalo tradicional de Pascua. Si eres fanático del chocolate y la naranja, agrega un poco de ralladura a la masa seca y remoja las pasas en jugo de naranja.','["300ml de leche","400 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de cacao en polvo","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 huevo grande, batido","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de pasas","100 g de chispas de chocolate con leche","50 gramos de chocolate blanco","2 cucharadas de leche","50 g de harina común"]','["Para la masa, calentar 275 ml de leche durante unos minutos en una cacerola pequeña o 1 minuto en el microondas a temperatura alta. Mezcle la harina, el cacao, la levadura, el azúcar y la canela en un tazón grande y bata el huevo y el extracto de vainilla con la leche tibia. Vierta el líquido en los ingredientes secos y revuelva para hacer una masa suave. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia y amase durante 10 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástica. Vuelva a colocar la masa en el tazón limpio, cubra con film transparente engrasado y déjela reposar hasta que doble su tamaño, aproximadamente 1 hora.","Vuelva a colocar la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo, esparza las pasas y las chispas de chocolate y amase.","Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Divida la masa en 12 trozos iguales y forme una bola suave con cada uno. Coloque las bolas en la bandeja para hornear preparada en una formación de 4 x 3, dejando algo de espacio entre ellas para que crezcan. Marque una cruz en la parte superior de cada panecillo, cúbralo sin apretar con film transparente engrasado y déjelo reposar hasta que los panecillos casi hayan duplicado su tamaño.","Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Para las cruces de chocolate blanco, derrita el chocolate blanco con la leche en una cacerola pequeña o en el microondas, luego agregue la harina, 1 cucharada a la vez, para hacer una pasta suave. Vierta en una manga pastelera desechable o en una bolsa de comida y corte la punta de la esquina.","Glasea los panecillos con la leche restante y hornea por 15 minutos, luego coloca cruces donde marcaste la masa y hornea por 5 minutos más. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 12:55:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13099,9060,'es','Tarta de chocolate, naranja y avellanas','Nunca imaginarías que este espectacular postre no contiene lácteos y está decorado con una sabrosa ganache que utiliza jugo de naranja en lugar de crema.','["175 ml de aceite de oliva de color claro y un poco más para engrasar","140 g de avellanas blanqueadas","100ml de zumo de naranja, más ralladura de 1 naranja","140 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de cacao en polvo","3 huevos grandes","175 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 naranja grande, cortada en rodajas de 3 mm/1/8 pulg.","75ml de zumo de naranja","100 g de chocolate negro sin lácteos","50 g de avellanas blanqueadas y tostadas","1 cucharadita de polvo de oro comestible (ver consejo)"]','["Si puedes, prepara las rodajas de naranja confitadas con un día de antelación. Poner el azúcar y 300ml de agua en una cacerola mediana y llevar a ebullición. Reduzca a fuego lento, agregue las rodajas de naranja y cocine durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 10 minutos o hasta que la médula esté transparente, volteándola ocasionalmente. Forre una bandeja para hornear con pergamino. Retire con cuidado las rodajas del almíbar, colóquelas en la bandeja preparada y déjelas secar (al menos 8 horas) antes de cortarlas por la mitad. Reserva el almíbar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar ligeramente un molde para pan (el mío pesaba 900 g) con aceite de oliva y cubrir con una tira de papel para hornear.","Muele las avellanas en un procesador de alimentos hasta que parezcan pan rallado grueso (no las tritures demasiado o se volverán aceitosas), luego agrégalas a un bol junto con la ralladura de naranja, una pizca de sal y el resto de los ingredientes secos. Mezcle hasta que esté uniformemente combinado.","Vierte el aceite y el jugo de naranja en una jarra y mezcla. Coloque los huevos y el azúcar en una batidora de mesa o en un tazón grande y bata durante 5 a 10 minutos o hasta que la mezcla haya triplicado su volumen y sostenga una cinta en la superficie cuando se saquen los batidores. Vierta lentamente la mezcla de aceite en la mezcla de huevo y mezcle hasta que se combinen.","Agregue la mezcla de harina a la mezcla de huevo en 3 o 4 adiciones, mezclando hasta que se combinen. No puedes tamizar esta mezcla sobre los huevos debido a las avellanas, pero trata de no tirar la harina en un solo lugar; debes tener cuidado y doblar la masa para que conserve su ligereza. Una vez que esté completamente combinado, vierta la masa en el molde para pan preparado y hornee durante 50-55 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro del pastel, éste salga limpio.","Pinche la parte superior del pastel por todas partes y luego vierta 5 cucharadas del almíbar de naranja reservado. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos, luego colóquelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Recorte la parte superior del pastel (guárdelo para una mini bagatela) y colóquelo, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, en una fuente para servir.","Para decorar, vierte el jugo de naranja en una cacerola pequeña y deja hervir a fuego lento. Coloque el chocolate en un tazón pequeño, vierta el jugo de naranja y revuelva para formar una ganache suave. Reservar en el frigorífico hasta que espese, unos 20-25 minutos. Vierta las avellanas en un tazón pequeño y agregue el polvo dorado con un chorrito de agua, revolviendo para cubrir. Coloque la ganache en una manga pastelera provista de una pequeña punta redonda. Forma picos sobre la parte superior del bizcocho, decorando con las avellanas doradas y las rodajas de naranja. Se conservará hasta por 3 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:55:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13100,9061,'es','Pastel de chocolate malteado','Este pastel de goteo en capas está cubierto con glaseado de queso crema y rociado con ganache de chocolate amargo: una impresionante pieza central para una gran ocasión.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos grandes","225 g de harina común","25 g de bebida de malta en polvo","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","100 gramos de yogur natural","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","175 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos grandes","225 g de harina común","25 g de cacao en polvo","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","50 gramos de yogur natural","100 g de chocolate negro, derretido y enfriado un poco","mantequilla o aceite sin sabor, para engrasar","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","5 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","Paquete de 37 g de Malteasers","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, blanda","750 g de azúcar glas","3 cucharadas de bebida de malta en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","Tarrina de 280 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","100 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","75ml de nata doble"]','["Primero haz los bizcochos de malta. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar las bases de 2 moldes para pasteles de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Pon la mantequilla y el azúcar en un tazón grande y bate hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien entre cada adición. Vierta la harina, la malta y el polvo de hornear en el tazón con 1/4 cucharadita de sal y mezcle, luego agregue el yogur y la vainilla y revuelva todo por última vez. Divida la mezcla del pastel entre los 2 moldes, nivele las partes superiores y hornee en el estante del medio durante 25 a 30 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro de los pasteles, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos, luego retírelo de los moldes, retire el papel para hornear y transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Lavar las latas.","Ahora haz los bizcochos de chocolate. Engrasar y forrar la base de los moldes como antes y hervir la tetera. En el mismo bol (no te preocupes por lavarlo), bate la mantequilla y el azúcar como antes, agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, y mezcla hasta que se combinen. Tamiza la harina, el cacao y la levadura en polvo con 1/4 cucharadita de sal. Incorpora la mezcla, luego agrega el yogur, el chocolate derretido y 100 ml de agua hirviendo. Revuelva hasta que se combinen, luego divida entre las latas. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos, probando con una brocheta como antes. Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego desmoldar, retirar el papel de horno y dejar enfriar por completo. Los bizcochos se pueden preparar hasta 2 días antes de congelarlos, enfriarlos y envolverlos bien en film transparente.","Haz el panal. Engrasa una bandeja para horno con un poco de mantequilla o aceite. Poner el azúcar y el almíbar dorado en una cacerola grande. Calentar a fuego medio y dejar burbujear hasta obtener un caramelo líquido, pero no revolver. Cuando esté satisfecho con el color (cuanto más oscuro se vuelve, más intenso será el sabor), agregue el bicarbonato de sodio y revuelva rápidamente con el almíbar. Antes de que las burbujas desaparezcan, vierta la mezcla espumosa en la bandeja para hornear, luego déjela reposar durante 30 minutos para que se enfríe y se endurezca.","Haz el glaseado. En el tazón más grande, bate la mantequilla con la mitad del azúcar glas, la malta y la vainilla hasta que quede suave. Agregue el resto del azúcar glas y el queso crema y bata nuevamente hasta que estén bien combinados; no mezcle demasiado o el glaseado podría quedar líquido.","Ahora estás listo para ensamblar. Coloque uno de los bizcochos en un soporte para pasteles o en una tabla para pasteles, pegándolo con una pequeña gota de glaseado. Utilice 1/4 del glaseado para apilar los pasteles, alternando entre los bizcochos de malta y chocolate. Coloque el bizcocho final encima, con el lado plano hacia arriba. Cuando esté armado, use una espátula para cubrir todo el pastel con una fina capa de glaseado, llenando los espacios entre los bizcochos, pero no se preocupe por cubrir completamente los bizcochos en esta etapa. Esto se llama capa de migas y garantiza que la capa final esté libre de migas. Haga espacio en su refrigerador y enfríe el pastel durante 30 minutos para endurecer el glaseado.","Una vez que el glaseado esté frío, usa el glaseado restante para cubrir completamente el pastel. Esto es más fácil si apilas el glaseado encima del pastel y luego usas una espátula para pasarlo por el borde y los lados. Puedes hacerlo tan suave o tan áspero como quieras. Enfríe por otros 30 minutos.","Haz la llovizna. Mientras tanto, ponga el chocolate amargo en un bol y caliente la nata en una cacerola pequeña hasta que esté humeante. Verter la nata sobre el chocolate y dejar derretir durante 5-10 minutos. Revuelva para hacer una ganache brillante, luego déjela a un lado para que se endurezca un poco; desea que la ganache se pueda verter pero no demasiado líquida, para que se formen gotitas por los lados del pastel.","Cuando la ganache tenga la consistencia correcta, saca el pastel del refrigerador y vierte la ganache sobre el borde superior del pastel, animándola a rociar los lados con la cuchara; comienza por la parte posterior del pastel para dominarlo. Rellena también el centro de la parte superior del pastel con chocolate.","Rompe el panal en trozos altos y apílalos encima del pastel. Termine con Maltesers enteros y partidos por la mitad, agregando algunos alrededor de la base, junto con algunas migas de panal. Es mejor servir el pastel dentro de las 2 o 3 horas posteriores a su armado, pero seguirá teniendo un sabor delicioso por hasta 3 días. Guarde las sobras en el refrigerador y déjelas que vuelvan a temperatura ambiente antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13101,9062,'es','Muffins con chispas de chocolate en maceta','A los niños les encantará hacer estos deliciosos pasteles con doble chispas de chocolate cubiertos con flores de papel de arroz, perfectos para un proyecto infantil de horneado de Pascua.','["3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","125 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","25 g de cacao en polvo","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo grande","100ml de leche","150 g de chispas de chocolate con leche","25 g de adornos para tartas de chocolate, como fideos finos o caramelos rebozados cubiertos de chocolate.","20 obleas de papel de arroz (vienen en paquetes de 12, así que consigue 2 paquetes)","10 mini macetas de terracota (ver consejo)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar ligeramente el interior de las macetas de terracota con un poco de aceite vegetal y colocar en una bandeja para horno. Coloque un estuche de papel para mini muffins en el fondo de cada olla.","Ponga la harina, la levadura en polvo y el cacao en un bol y agregue el azúcar.","Rompe el huevo en una jarra y bate con la leche y el aceite restante. Vierta esto sobre la mezcla de harina y cacao y agregue 50 g de chispas de chocolate. Tenga cuidado de no mezclar demasiado: desea una mezcla suelta pero aún con bastante grumos. Vierta en las ollas hasta tres cuartos de su capacidad. Colóquelo en el medio del horno y hornee durante 12-15 minutos hasta que suba y esté firme. Pasar a una rejilla (aún en las ollas) y dejar enfriar.","Coloque el resto de las chispas de chocolate en un tazón pequeño y derrítalas en una cacerola pequeña con agua hirviendo a fuego lento (no deje que el agua toque el tazón), o colóquelas en un recipiente apto para microondas y caliente a temperatura alta durante 1 minuto hasta que se derrita.","Unta la parte superior de los muffins con el chocolate derretido. Espolvoree sobre las decoraciones de chocolate y agregue 2 obleas de papel de arroz a cada olla para servir. Se conservará durante 2 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:55:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13102,9063,'es','Galletas de chocolate, anacardos y arándanos','Estas galletas de nueces están repletas de trozos de chocolate y frutos secos masticables; cambia los anacardos por maní si lo prefieres.','["Paquete de 100 g de anacardos, o más si lo deseas","140 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para engrasar","250 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","100 g de mantequilla crujiente de anacardos o utilizar mantequilla de maní","1 huevo grande, batido","2 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","200 g de chocolate en barra, 50 % cacao, picado en trozos de 1 cm","50 g de arándanos secos (opcional)"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Esparza los anacardos sobre una bandeja para hornear y tueste durante 5-7 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Deje enfriar y luego pique en trozos grandes.","Mientras tanto, engrase y forre 2 bandejas para hornear con pergamino. Tamice la harina, el polvo para hornear y 1/2 cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande, luego agregue el azúcar. Corta la mantequilla en cubos gruesos y agrégala junto con la mantequilla de nueces al bol. Frote hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado húmedo.","Con un cuchillo, mezcle el huevo y el almíbar en el bol para hacer una masa suave. Agregue el chocolate, las nueces y los arándanos (si los usa) y revuelva para combinar. Intenta no trabajar demasiado la masa en este punto.","Enrolle cucharadas de masa ligeramente colmadas en bolas y colóquelas en cada bandeja para hornear, dejando suficiente espacio para que las galletas se extiendan. Hornee durante 12 minutos o hasta que estén dorados en los bordes y leudados en el medio. Déjelos enfriar durante 5 minutos, luego páselos a una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo. Repita hasta que toda la masa tenga forma y esté horneada. Para seguir adelante, congele las galletas crudas en una bandeja para hornear y luego transfiéralas a una bolsa o caja para congelar una vez que estén sólidas. Hornee congelado, agregando 5 minutos al tiempo de cocción."]','2026-01-11 12:55:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13103,9064,'es','Tarta de remolino de cardamomo y chocolate negro y blanco','Coloque dos tipos de ganache de chocolate en capas sobre una base de galleta para hacer una impresionante tarta veteada, perfecta como postre para una cena.','["7 vainas de cardamomo","400 g de nata doble","100 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","200 g de barra de chocolate blanco belga","Paquete de 180 g de Willie''s Cacao Venezolano Negro 100% cacao Carenero, o pruebe Lindt 99% cacao (ambos disponibles en Waitrose)","25 g de mantequilla sin sal, cortada en trozos pequeños y ablandada","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","150ml de leche entera","200 g de digestivos de chocolate negro","75 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida, más un poco más para engrasar","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo (blanca o dorada)"]','["Triture las vainas de cardamomo con un mortero y luego ponga las semillas y las cáscaras en una cacerola mediana. Vierta la nata y el azúcar, revuelva y luego caliente suavemente hasta que la nata empiece a hervir a fuego lento. Retirar la cacerola del fuego y dejar infusionar durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, pique finamente el chocolate blanco en un procesador de alimentos y luego viértalo en un tazón mediano. Repita con el cacao, viértalo en otro bol y agregue la mantequilla. Sazona cada chocolate con una pizca de sal.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrasar ligeramente un molde para tarta estriado de 23 cm o un molde desmontable. Sin limpiar el procesador, vierta los digestivos y presione hasta obtener migajas finas. Agrega la mantequilla derretida y el azúcar hasta que la mezcla parezca arena húmeda, luego presiona firmemente en la base del molde. Deslícelo sobre una bandeja para hornear, hornee durante 10 minutos y luego enfríe por completo.","Cuando la base esté fría, recalienta la crema infundida a fuego lento. Colar la mitad de la nata sobre el chocolate blanco y remover. Agrega la leche a lo que queda en la sartén, recalienta, luego cuela sobre el cacao picado y la mantequilla y revuelve. Pasarán unos minutos antes de que cada chocolate se derrita por completo.","Vierta todo menos unas 3 cucharadas de ganache de cacao sobre la base de galleta y enfríe durante 15 minutos o hasta que esté listo. Ahora inunda la parte superior con la ganache de chocolate blanco. Terminar con la mezcla de cacao reservada,\r\ndejando caer 6 cucharadas encima como la esfera de un reloj y una en el medio. Utilice una brocheta para mezclar los colores. Enfríelo durante al menos 4 horas o, idealmente, durante la noche para que la ganache se endurezca, luego sáquelo del refrigerador durante 30 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13104,9065,'es','Bollos cruzados calientes de chocolate y especias','Salpicados de chocolate amargo, canela, ralladura de naranja y pasas, estos panecillos son un regalo de Pascua muy especial.','["ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja grande","aceite de girasol, para engrasar","225ml de leche semidesnatada","50 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco para engrasar","1 huevo grande","450 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharaditas de levadura de acción rápida","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de pasas","100 g de chocolate, 70% cacao sólido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de harina común"]','["Primero haz la masa. Calentar la leche en una cacerola hasta que esté humeante. Retirar del fuego y verter la mantequilla. Después de un par de minutos, incorpora el huevo y la mitad de la ralladura de naranja.\r\nEl líquido debe estar apenas tibio para el paso 2.","Mezcle la harina fuerte, la levadura, 1 cucharadita de sal y el azúcar en un tazón grande, luego vierta el líquido y revuelva para hacer una masa suave y sin zonas secas. Enharina la superficie de trabajo y tus manos, luego amasa la masa durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástica. Utilice una batidora de pie o un procesador si lo desea. Engrase un tazón grande, coloque la masa dentro y luego cúbralo con una película adhesiva engrasada. Levantar en un lugar cálido durante aproximadamente 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Coloque las pasas y la mitad del jugo de naranja en una cacerola pequeña o en un tazón tapado y cocine a fuego lento durante unos minutos o cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 1 minuto hasta que esté caliente. Dejar enfriar por completo. Rompe el chocolate en un procesador de alimentos con la canela y 2 cucharadas de azúcar, luego pulsa hasta que esté muy finamente picado. Incorpora el resto de la ralladura. Si no tienes procesador, pícalo a mano o rallalo, luego mézclalo con los demás ingredientes.","Coloque la masa leudada sobre una superficie enharinada y presiónela hasta formar un rectángulo grande, un poco más grande que un papel A4. Distribuir uniformemente con la mezcla de chocolate y las pasas, que deberían haber absorbido todo el jugo (escurrirlas si no). Enrolle la masa alrededor del relleno y luego amase bien durante unos minutos hasta que el chocolate y la fruta se esparzan uniformemente. Algunas pasas y chocolate intentarán escapar, pero sigue amasándolos nuevamente.","Engrase y luego cubra una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Divide la masa en 12 trozos iguales. Forme bollos pellizcando cada bola de masa en forma de bolso, concentrándose en hacer que la parte inferior de la bola (que será la parte superior) lo más suave posible. Coloque los panecillos, con el lado liso hacia arriba, en la bandeja para hornear, dejando espacio para que crezcan. Cubra sin apretar con una película adhesiva engrasada y deje reposar en un lugar cálido durante 30 a 45 minutos o hasta que la masa haya subido y no rebote rápidamente cuando se la empuja suavemente.","Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Para hacer la pasta para las cruces, agregue gradualmente 6-7 cucharadas de agua a la harina común para hacer una pasta suave y espesa, luego colóquela en una bolsa de comida y corte el extremo a unos 5 mm. Coloque las cruces y luego hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que los panecillos hayan subido y estén dorados oscuros.","Mezclar el resto del jugo de naranja con el azúcar restante y dejar que se disuelva. Unte el almíbar sobre los bollos mientras estén calientes y luego déjelos enfriar. Comer el día de la cocción o tostar al día siguiente."]','2026-01-11 12:55:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13105,9066,'es','Pastel de apagón de Brooklyn','Este bizcocho rico y oscuro se rellena y se recubre con una espesa crema de chocolate y luego se termina con pastel desmenuzado; es mejor comerlo frío.','["140 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco para engrasar","100 ml de aceite vegetal","140 g de suero de leche","100 ml de café, elaborado con 1 cucharadita de espresso en polvo","2 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de azúcar mascabado light","250 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","50 g de cacao en polvo","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","500 ml de leche entera","140 g de chocolate, 85 % de cacao, partido en cubos","50 g de harina de maíz","2 cucharaditas de café expreso en polvo","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla"]','["Primero haz la natilla, ya que es necesario que se enfríe. Ponga todos los ingredientes, excepto la vainilla, en una cacerola grande y déjelos hervir suavemente, batiendo todo el tiempo, hasta que el chocolate se derrita y obtenga una natilla espesa y sedosa. Tardará entre 5 y 7 minutos desde frío. Agrega la vainilla y una pizca generosa de sal, luego raspa la natilla y viértela en un tazón ancho y poco profundo. Cubra la superficie con film transparente, enfríe y luego enfríe durante al menos 3 horas o hasta que esté frío y listo.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y luego forrar las bases de 2 moldes para sándwich de 20 cm. Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén, luego retírela del fuego y agregue el aceite, el suero de leche, el café y los huevos. En un tazón grande, mezcle los ingredientes secos más 1/4 de cucharadita de sal (guarde el tamizado) y aplaste los grumos de azúcar resistentes con los dedos. Agregue los ingredientes húmedos y bata hasta que quede suave.","Divida la masa entre los moldes preparados y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que suba y al insertar una brocheta en el medio de los pasteles, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo, con el lado del pergamino hacia abajo.","Retire las capas de pergamino de los pasteles. Si los pasteles tienen forma de cúpula, recórtalos hasta quedar planos. Ahora corte cada pastel por la mitad con un cuchillo de sierra grande. Coloque la capa menos exitosa y los recortes en un procesador y púlselo hasta obtener migajas. Vierta en un tazón grande.","Coloque una capa en un plato para pastel y úntela con un cuarto de la crema pastelera. Coloque la siguiente capa encima, agregue otra cuarta parte de la crema pastelera y luego cubra con la última capa de pastel. Vierta el resto de la crema pastelera encima del pastel, luego extiéndala por la parte superior y por los lados hasta que quede suave. Enfríe durante 15 minutos para que la crema vuelva a endurecerse.","Sostenga el pastel sobre el recipiente que contiene las migas, luego espolvoree y presione suavemente una capa de migas por todo el pastel. Cepille cualquier exceso del plato. Te quedarán algunas migas. Déjelo enfriar durante 2 horas o más antes de servir y cómelo frío. Se puede realizar con hasta 2 días de anticipación. El pastel se vuelve más esponjoso y atractivo cuanto más tiempo lo dejas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13106,9067,'es','Tarta Mont Blanc de merengue de chocolate','Este imponente pastel tiene capas de bizcocho de chocolate, merengue y crema de castañas: una impresionante pieza central para una cena festiva.','["300 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para engrasar","200 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","2 huevos grandes, más 3 yemas","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de azúcar moreno blando","200 g de puré de castañas de una lata de 415 g (reserva el resto para el relleno, más abajo)","175 g de harina común","50 g de cacao en polvo","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 claras de huevo grandes","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","Bote de 300ml de nata doble","215 g de puré de castañas (de lata, arriba)","100 g de azúcar glas y un poco más para espolvorear","virutas de chocolate (opcional)"]','["Engrase 2 moldes para pasteles de fondo suelto de 20 cm de profundidad y forre la base y los lados con papel para hornear. Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Derrita el chocolate y la mantequilla en un recipiente sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento, luego déjelo a un lado para que se enfríe un poco.","En un tazón grande, bata los huevos enteros, las yemas y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que dupliquen su tamaño; esto tomará unos 5 minutos. Tamizar la harina, el cacao y el polvo de hornear con una pizca de sal. Incorpora el puré de castañas a la mezcla de mantequilla de chocolate, luego agrégalo al otro tazón y mezcla todo suavemente. Divida uniformemente entre las latas.","Trabajando rápidamente, limpia las varillas y el bol grande, pon las claras en el bol y bate hasta que estén firmes. Agregue el azúcar, una cucharada a la vez, batiendo continuamente, hasta que espese y pueda mantener picos rígidos. Use una cuchara para esparcir el merengue sobre la mezcla del pastel en ambos moldes, luego use el dorso de la cuchara para esparcir la mezcla. Llene los espacios para tocar los bordes de las latas; haga bonitos picos y caídas en forma de remolino a medida que extiende. Hornear durante 1 h 15 min hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro del bizcocho salga húmedo.\r\npero deja migas. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Cuando estés listo para servir, prepara el relleno. Poner en un bol la nata, el puré de castañas y el azúcar glas y batir hasta que quede suave. Retire los pasteles de sus moldes y coloque 1 en un soporte o plato para pasteles (guarde el que tenga la parte superior más bonita para la capa final). Vierta la crema y gírela hacia los bordes (no se preocupe si aplasta un poco el merengue). Coloque el siguiente bizcocho encima, espolvoree con azúcar glas y luego cubra con virutas de chocolate, si lo usa. Es mejor servirlo inmediatamente, pero se conserva en el frigorífico.\r\ndurante 2 días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13107,9068,'es','Budín de pera y chocolate blando','Este pudín de chocolate caliente y pegajoso, con chocolate amargo y peras enlatadas, se puede preparar con anticipación y congelar: un postre perfecto para una cena sin complicaciones.','["200 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos grandes","75 g de harina común","50 g de cacao en polvo","Lata de 410 g de peras en mitades en su jugo, escurridas","100 g de chocolate negro natural (70% cacao)","25 g de almendras laminadas (opcional)","crema o helado, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Ligeramente\r\nengrase una superficie poco profunda de aproximadamente 20 x 30 cm.\r\nfuente apta para horno. Poner la mantequilla en una cacerola grande.\r\ncacerola y colocar a fuego lento hasta que\r\nderretido. Retirar la mantequilla del fuego.\r\ny agregue el azúcar hasta que esté bien combinado.","Batir los huevos en un tazón grande. Agrega poco a poco los huevos a la mantequilla y\r\nazúcar, batiendo bien con una cuchara de madera\r\nentre cada adición. Tamizar la harina y\r\ncacao en polvo encima de la mezcla de huevo,\r\nluego batir fuerte con una cuchara de madera hasta\r\ncompletamente combinado.","Vierta en la lata o plato preparado y\r\nColoque las peras en la masa de chocolate.\r\nPon el chocolate en una tabla y córtalo en\r\ntrozos gruesos de aproximadamente 1,5 cm con una gran\r\ncuchillo. Esparcir los trozos de chocolate sobre\r\nrebozar y espolvorear con almendras, si lo desea.\r\nSe puede congelar en esta etapa.","Hornear en el centro del horno durante 30 minutos.\r\no hasta que la mezcla esté crujiente en la superficie\r\ny ligeramente cocido por dentro. No permitas que\r\ncocinar demasiado, ya que el pastel se volverá esponjoso.\r\nen lugar de pegajoso en el centro. Servir caliente\r\ncon nata o helado"]','2026-01-11 12:55:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13108,9069,'es','Tarta estrella de trufa de chocolate','Lo suficientemente glamoroso como para servir como postre, es una pieza central impresionante. Y la ventaja es que puedes adelantar todo y congelar hasta que lo necesites.','["140 g de chocolate amargo, 70 % de cacao, partido en trozos","140 g de mantequilla, cortada en trozos","2 cucharaditas de café granulado","50 g de harina con levadura","50 g de harina común","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","140 g de azúcar mascabado light","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1½ cucharada de cacao en polvo","2 huevos medianos","3 cucharadas de crema agria","100 gramos de chocolate blanco","25 g de chocolate negro","5-6 trufas de chocolate pequeñas","100ml de nata doble","50 g de chocolate blanco, muy finamente picado","1 cucharada de agua hirviendo","100ml de nata doble","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de chocolate negro, muy finamente picado","1½ cucharada de agua hirviendo"]','["Es mejor preparar el pastel y las estrellas con un día de anticipación (el pastel es más fácil de cortar y rellenar, y las estrellas tienen tiempo de solidificarse). Caliente el horno a 160 ° C / ventilador 140 ° C / gas 3. Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde para pan hondo (22 x 11 x 6 cm). Pon en un cazo el chocolate y la mantequilla para el bizcocho. Mezclar el café con 50 ml de agua y luego verter en la cacerola. Calentar a fuego lento, solo para que se derrita; tenga cuidado de no sobrecalentarse.","Mientras el chocolate se derrite, mezcla ambas harinas con el bicarbonato de sodio, ambos azúcares y el cacao. Rompe los grumos del azúcar con los dedos. Batir los huevos y luego revolver. \r\nen la crema agria. Vierta esto y \r\nel chocolate derretido sobre la mezcla de harina, luego revuelva todo junto; la mezcla quedará muy suave. Viértalo en el molde y luego hornee durante aproximadamente 1½ horas o hasta que esté firme por encima. Deje que el pastel se enfríe en el molde (puede romperse si lo desmolda demasiado pronto), luego afloje los lados y gírelo con cuidado sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer las estrellas, forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Derrita ambos chocolates por separado. Vierta y extienda el chocolate blanco formando un rectángulo sobre el pergamino. Rocíe el chocolate amargo del extremo de una cucharadita formando garabatos llamativos sobre la parte superior. Déjelo en un lugar fresco y seco (no en el refrigerador) hasta que esté casi listo pero no duro, luego presione ligeramente con un cortador de estrellas, de aproximadamente 5,5 cm de ancho, para hacer al menos 6 contornos de estrellas. (Haga unos cuantos más en caso de roturas y limpie el cortador cada vez que presione una forma de estrella). Cuando esté completamente listo, corte los contornos de las estrellas con un cuchillo pequeño y afilado, luego levántelos con cuidado sobre papel para hornear.","Para el glaseado de chocolate blanco, calentar la nata hasta que hierva. Retire del fuego, vierta el chocolate y revuelva para que comience a derretirse, luego vierta el agua hirviendo y revuelva para que se derrita por completo. Vierta en un tazón pequeño y enfríe en el refrigerador durante aproximadamente 1 hora para que se enfríe y espese un poco. Batir con una batidora de mano eléctrica hasta que esté espeso y brillante.","Cuando el bizcocho esté completamente frío, colóquelo en el frigorífico para que se enfríe (esto hace que sea más fácil de cortar). Saca el bizcocho del frigorífico y dale la vuelta para que la base plana se convierta en la parte superior del bizcocho. Corta el bizcocho horizontalmente en tres. Vuelva a colocar el sándwich junto con el glaseado de chocolate blanco, no hasta los bordes. (Esto se puede hacer con un día de anticipación y enfriar).","Para el glaseado de chocolate amargo, calentar la nata con el azúcar hasta que hierva. Retirar del fuego, verter el chocolate y luego agregar el agua hirviendo. Dejar enfriar y espesar un poco. Coloque el pastel sobre una rejilla con papel pergamino debajo (para recoger las gotas). Vierte y extiende el glaseado por todo el bizcocho. Deje reposar un poco, luego coloque las trufas en el centro y apoye 5 o 6 de sus mejores estrellas contra ellas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13109,7296,'es','Soufflés de chocolate caliente con salsa de crema de chocolate','Ligeros como una pluma, estos soufflés de chocolate que se derriten en la boca seguramente te complacerán','["Bote de 142ml de nata líquida","25 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de chocolate negro (70% cacao), partido en trozos","25 g de mantequilla","mantequilla derretida, para engrasar","50 g de azúcar en polvo, más 2 cucharadas extra","175 g de chocolate negro (70% cacao), partido en trozos","2 cucharadas de crema doble","4 yemas de huevo","5 claras de huevo","2 cucharadas de crema doble","azúcar glas, para servir"]','["Calienta el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7 y coloca una bandeja para hornear en el estante superior. Para la salsa, calentar la nata y el azúcar hasta que hierva. Retirar del fuego, agregar el chocolate y la mantequilla hasta que se derrita y luego mantener caliente.","Unte 6 moldes de 150 ml con mantequilla derretida, espolvoree con 2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo y luego retire el exceso. Derretir el chocolate y la nata en un bol sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, enfriar y luego mezclar con las yemas de huevo. Batir las claras hasta que mantengan su forma, luego agregar el azúcar, 1 cucharada a la vez, batiendo hasta obtener la misma consistencia. Mezclar una cucharada\r\nen el chocolate, luego agregue suavemente el resto.","Trabajando rápidamente, llene los moldes, limpie los bordes y pase el pulgar por los bordes. Baje el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6, coloque los moldes en la bandeja para hornear, luego hornee durante 8-10 minutos hasta que se levanten con una ligera oscilación. No abras la puerta del horno demasiado pronto ya que esto podría hacer que se colapsen.","Una vez que los soufflés estén listos, espolvorea con azúcar glas, haz un pequeño agujero en la parte superior y luego vierte un poco de salsa de chocolate caliente. Vuelva a colocar las tapas y sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 12:55:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13110,9070,'es','La tarta de chocolate más ligera de Ángela','Una tarta de chocolate con un rico sabor y textura moussey, pero con dos tercios menos de grasa que la versión clásica','["140 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de mantequilla, cortada en trozos","2 cucharaditas de cacao en polvo","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 yema de huevo mediana","crème fraîche media grasa, para servir (opcional)","100 g de chocolate amargo, 70 % de cacao, muy finamente picado","1 cucharada de cacao en polvo, más ½ cucharadita extra para tamizar","¾ cucharadita de café granulado","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de leche semidesnatada","2 claras de huevo medianas","2 cucharadas de azúcar mascabado oscuro","85 g de crema fresca semidesnatada"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón para mezclar y\r\nretire 2 cucharaditas (el cacao reemplazará\r\nmás tarde). Añade la mantequilla y frótala con\r\nharina hasta que la mezcla parezca fina\r\nmigas de pan. Tamizar el cacao y el glaseado.\r\nazúcar, luego, con un cuchillo de hoja redonda,\r\nagregue el aceite, la yema de huevo y 1½-2 cucharadas frías\r\nagua, hasta que la masa se una.\r\nForme una bola con cuidado y luego extiéndala.\r\nuna superficie ligeramente enharinada, lo suficientemente grande como para\r\nse ajusta a un fondo suelto redondo de 20 cm x 3,5 cm de profundidad\r\nlata de flan. Introduzca fácilmente la masa\r\nla lata, dejando un ligero saliente. ligeramente\r\npinche la base con un tenedor y luego enfríe\r\nunos 10 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Siéntate\r\nlata en una bandeja para hornear. Forrar la masa con\r\npapel de aluminio y rellénelo con frijoles para hornear. hornear a ciegas\r\ndurante 15 minutos o hasta que cuaje. Levante con cuidado\r\nlos frijoles y el papel, luego hornea el\r\ncaja de hojaldre por otros 10 minutos o hasta\r\nla base está cocida. Retirar, con cuidado\r\nRecortar la masa que sobresale con un\r\ncuchillo afilado, para darle a la masa un borde plano,\r\nluego dejar hasta que esté completamente frío.","Para hacer el relleno poner el chocolate.\r\nen un tazón grande que quepa sobre una cacerola de\r\nagua hirviendo sin tocarla. Mezclar\r\nel cacao, el café y la vainilla con la leche.\r\nVierta sobre el chocolate. Sienta el cuenco\r\nuna cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento, revuelva y luego\r\nRetire inmediatamente la sartén del fuego,\r\ncon el cuenco de chocolate todavía sobre el\r\nagua, revolviendo ocasionalmente, para comprobar cuando\r\nderretido. Revuelva el chocolate derretido; lo hará.\r\nser bastante espeso. Agregue 2 cucharadas de agua hirviendo\r\ny el chocolate se adelgazará inmediatamente\r\nhacia abajo y se vuelve suave como la seda. Toma el\r\nRetirar del recipiente y dejar enfriar un poco.","Batir las claras a punto de nieve y luego\r\nAgregue el azúcar hasta que esté espeso y brillante.\r\nIncorporar la crème fraîche a la mezcla enfriada.\r\nchocolate. Doblar un tercio del huevo.\r\nclaras en la mezcla de chocolate usando\r\nuna cuchara grande de metal y luego doble con mucho cuidado\r\nen las claras restantes, un tercio a la vez,\r\nhasta que se mezclen uniformemente. Retire la masa\r\ncaja de lata y colocar sobre una porción\r\nplato. Vierta el relleno en el estuche y luego\r\nextiéndalo suave y uniformemente. Relájate para\r\naproximadamente 3 horas, o toda la noche, antes\r\nsirviendo. Servir con un tamiz de cacao.\r\ny crema fresca media grasa, si lo desea. Tenga en cuenta, mujeres embarazadas, que el\r\nancianos, bebés y niños pequeños, y personas\r\nque generalmente no se encuentran bien, deben evitar\r\ncomer huevos crudos o parcialmente cocidos."]','2026-01-11 12:55:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13111,9071,'es','canutillos caseros','Los canutillos caseros son un trabajo de amor, pero la recompensa será un bocado delicioso de hojaldre crujiente que rezuma natilla cremosa de vainilla.','["140 g de harina común","pizca de azúcar","125ml de leche","100 g de mantequilla","4 huevos","300ml de leche","50 g de azúcar en polvo","2 yemas de huevo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 cucharaditas de harina común y harina de maíz","300ml de nata doble"]','["Empezamos haciendo el relleno de natillas.\r\nCalentar la leche hasta que casi hierva en una\r\ncacerola. Mientras tanto, mezcle los\r\nazúcar, yemas de huevo y vainilla en un bol,\r\nluego agregue las harinas, un par de cucharaditas a\r\ntiempo, hasta obtener una pasta suave. batir poco a poco\r\nen la leche caliente, verter todo nuevamente en\r\nla cacerola y cocine a fuego alto,\r\nrevolviendo constantemente, durante unos 5 minutos hasta que\r\nespeso: se volverá alarmantemente grumoso, pero\r\nno te preocupes, solo sigue revolviendo\r\nvigorosamente con una cuchara de madera hasta\r\nsuave. Coloque una hoja de film transparente directamente\r\nsobre la superficie de la natilla, luego enfriar y\r\nenfría hasta que estés listo para llenar los bollos.","Para hacer los panecillos choux, calentar el horno a\r\n220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Tamizar la harina con\r\nel azúcar y una pizca de sal en un vaso pequeño\r\ncuenco. Poner la leche y la mantequilla en un\r\ncacerola mediana con 125ml de agua y\r\nCaliente suavemente para que la mantequilla se derrita pero la\r\nel líquido no burbujea. Una vez que la mantequilla\r\nse ha derretido por completo, aumente el fuego\r\nhasta que el líquido hierva rápidamente.\r\nApague inmediatamente el fuego, vierta el\r\nharina tamizada y batida enérgicamente con un\r\ncuchara de madera hasta tener una masa suave\r\nmasa que se despega de los lados de\r\nla sartén (ver imagen 1). Distribuir en una gran\r\nplato llano para que se enfríe a temperatura manual.","Una vez que la mezcla de masa se haya enfriado, raspe\r\nVuelve a colocarlo en tu sartén. Usando tu madera\r\ncuchara, bata cada huevo, uno por uno, hasta\r\nTienes una mezcla suave y brillante.","Corta 2 hojas grandes de papel para hornear.\r\nEn cada uno, dibuja 2 conjuntos de líneas de \"pista\".\r\ncon un espacio de 10 cm: estos serán tus\r\npautas para que todos tus canutillos queden\r\naproximadamente del mismo tamaño (ver imagen 2). Utilice el\r\npapel para forrar 2 bandejas para hornear grandes – al costado\r\nabajo. Vierta su mezcla de choux\r\nen una manga pastelera con una boquilla de 1 cm de ancho,\r\no en una manga pastelera desechable con\r\nSe cortó un orificio de tamaño similar para la tubería.\r\nColoque 2 filas de trozos bien espaciados y aplastados.\r\nFormas de ''S'' en cada hoja entre las\r\ndirectrices (ver imagen 3). Hornee, una bandeja a la\r\ntiempo, en un estante alto durante 25 minutos,\r\nreduciendo la temperatura a 200C/180C ventilador/\r\nGas 6 nada más entrar al horno.","Después de 25 minutos, haz un agujero en el extremo de\r\ncada bollo, o usando un pequeño cuchillo de sierra,\r\ndividir por la mitad y volver a la\r\nHorno, boca abajo, para que se seque durante 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté crujiente y dorado. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras los panecillos se enfrían, termina tu\r\nrelleno. Batir la nata hasta que espese, luego\r\nUsa tu batidor eléctrico para batir el\r\nenfriado, coloque las natillas hasta que queden suaves\r\notra vez. Incorpora la crema. Cuchara tu\r\nllenar en una manga pastelera – use una pequeña\r\nboquilla si estás llenando los bollos\r\nlos agujeros que has perforado, o un gran\r\nBoquilla si has partido los bollos por la mitad.\r\nColoca con cuidado la crema pastelera en cada\r\npanecillo enfriado: deberían sentirse pesados una vez\r\nlleno. Colocar los bollos sobre una rejilla y\r\nunta cada uno con un poco de tu elegido\r\nglaseado (ver más abajo). si no puedes\r\ndecidir, es realmente\r\nfácil de dividir tu\r\nlote de choux\r\nbollos, reducir a la mitad\r\ncantidades de glaseado,\r\ny hacer un\r\nselección para mantener\r\ntodos felices."]','2026-01-11 12:55:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13112,8193,'es','Danés de Pascua con doble chocolate','A todo el mundo le encantan los pasteles daneses, especialmente cuando tienen chocolate y son lo suficientemente grandes para compartir.','["175ml de leche tibia","1 huevo batido","450 g de harina blanca fuerte","1 sobre de levadura seca de acción rápida","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250 g de mantequilla fría en rodajas","200 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","50 g de azúcar glas","25 g de cacao en polvo","50 g de mantequilla, ablandada","1 clara de huevo","50 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos pequeños","1 yema de huevo","3 cucharadas de leche","azúcar en polvo dorado, para espolvorear","50 g de azúcar glas"]','["Haz la masa con un día de anticipación si tienes tiempo. Batir la leche y el huevo en una jarra. Pon en un robot de cocina la harina, la levadura, el azúcar y la mantequilla con una pizca de sal. Pulse hasta que la mezcla comience a unirse, pero todavía esté salpicada de trozos de mantequilla. Vierta en un tazón y use sus manos para trabajar en el contenido de la jarra. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie enharinada, amase ligeramente, luego extiéndala hasta formar un rectángulo y doble los dos lados cortos para que los bordes se junten en el medio, luego doble nuevamente hacia el medio. Estire y doble dos veces más, enharinando la superficie mientras trabaja. Cubre la masa con film transparente y luego déjala reposar en el frigorífico durante al menos 4 horas o toda la noche.","Para el relleno, vierta 150 g de almendras en un procesador de alimentos con el azúcar glas y el cacao en polvo y mezcle hasta que se combinen. Agregue la mantequilla y la clara de huevo, presione hasta obtener una pasta, luego agregue el chocolate y reserve.","Divida la masa en dos y presione la mitad en la base de un molde desmontable antiadherente de 23 cm. Extiende el relleno por el centro de la masa, dejando un borde, y cubre con el resto de la masa. Cubrir con film transparente y dejar en un lugar cálido durante aproximadamente una hora.","Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Batir la yema de huevo con la leche y untar por encima para glasear. Espolvorea con las almendras restantes y un poco de azúcar en polvo y hornea durante 40-50 minutos hasta que estén inflados y dorados. Dejar enfriar durante una hora. Mezclar el azúcar glas con unas gotas de agua fría para hacer un glaseado líquido y rociarlo sobre el bizcocho. Sirva en gajos con café o con helado de postre."]','2026-01-11 12:55:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13113,7316,'es','Crema catalana de chocolate blanco','Sirve este postre de chocolate súper cremoso solo o como parte de un “assiete” de mini budines de chocolate.','["Bote de 568ml de nata doble","100 g de chocolate blanco Green & Black''s, partido en trozos","1 vaina de vainilla, partida o 1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","6 yemas de huevo","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada, más un poco más para cubrir"]','["Calentar la nata, el chocolate y la vaina de vainilla.\r\nen una cacerola hasta que el chocolate se derrita. tomar\r\nRetirar del fuego y dejar infundir durante 10 minutos.\r\nraspando las semillas de las vainas en la crema. si\r\nusando el extracto de vainilla, agregue de inmediato.\r\nCalentar el horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3.","Batir las yemas y el azúcar hasta que estén pálidos. revuelva en el\r\ncrema de chocolate. Colar en una jarra y verter\r\nen moldes. Colocar en una bandeja para asar honda.\r\ny vierta agua hirviendo hasta la mitad de los lados.\r\nHornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que cuaje y se tambalee.\r\ncentro. Enfriar en la nevera durante al menos 4 horas.","Para servir, espolvorea un poco de azúcar encima\r\nbrûlées y caramelizar con un soplete o\r\nbrevemente bajo una parrilla caliente. dejar caramelo\r\nendurecer y luego servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13114,9073,'es','Pastel de chocolate y brownie','A este pegajoso postre de chocolate se le da un toque especiado con canela en la masa. Se congela bien para un postre fácil para una cena.','["175 g de harina común","85 g de mantequilla, picada en trozos","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de canela molida","3 huevos grandes","300 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","175 g de mantequilla, derretida","50 g de harina común","50 g de cacao, más extra para servir","50 g de nueces de macadamia picadas","50 g de chocolate amargo, picado","helado para servir"]','["Vierta la harina, la mantequilla, el azúcar glas y la canela en un procesador de alimentos y presione para formar migajas. Agregue 2 1?2-3 cucharadas de agua y presione hasta que se una. Envolver en film transparente y enfriar durante 20 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y úsela para forrar un molde para tarta de base suelta de 23 cm de profundidad. Deje el exceso de masa sobresaliendo de los bordes del molde. Cubra con papel para hornear, rellénelo con frijoles para hornear y enfríe durante 15 minutos.","Hornee durante 15 minutos, retire el papel y los frijoles, luego hornee 5 minutos más hasta que la masa esté crujiente y dorada pálida.","Batir los huevos y el azúcar para crear una textura similar a una mousse. Agregue la vainilla y la mantequilla derretida, luego agregue la harina y el cacao. Esparce las nueces y el chocolate sobre la masa de hojaldre y vierte el relleno encima. Hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que esté firme y se tambalee ligeramente. Retirar el exceso de masa y dejar enfriar. Si se congela, envuélvalo en film transparente y papel de aluminio. Descongelar, desenvolver y descongelar.","Servir a temperatura ambiente o tibio, con una bola de helado y espolvoreado de cacao."]','2026-01-11 12:55:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13115,9074,'es','fondant de chocolate','Un postre pegajoso que se puede preparar con anticipación y que es perfecto para entretener; todo es cuestión de tiempo...','["50 g de mantequilla derretida, para untar","cacao en polvo, para espolvorear","200 g de chocolate negro de buena calidad, picado en trozos pequeños","200 g de mantequilla, en trozos pequeños","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos y 4 yemas","200 g de harina común","Salsa de caramelo (ver ''Combina bien'') y helado de vainilla o sorbete de naranja, para servir"]','["Primero prepara tus moldes. Usando trazos hacia arriba, cepille fuertemente el derretido\r\nmantequilla por todo el interior del molde para budín.\r\nColoca el molde en el frigorífico o congelador. Unte más mantequilla derretida sobre los enfriados.\r\nmantequilla, luego añadir una buena cucharada de cacao\r\npolvo en el molde. Incline el molde para que el polvo cubra completamente.\r\nla mantequilla. Vuelva a colocar el exceso de cacao en el frasco.\r\nluego repita con 1 el siguiente molde.","Coloque un recipiente sobre una cacerola de\r\nagua apenas hirviendo, luego derrita lentamente el\r\nchocolate y mantequilla juntos. Retire el tazón\r\ndel fuego y revuelva hasta que quede suave. dejar para\r\ndéjelo enfriar durante unos 10 minutos.","En un recipiente aparte batir los huevos\r\ny las yemas junto con el azúcar hasta\r\nespesa y pálida y las hojas del batidor\r\nun sendero; use una batidora eléctrica si lo desea. tamizar\r\nIncorpora la harina a los huevos y luego bate.","Vierte el chocolate derretido en el huevo.\r\nmezclar en tercios, batiendo bien entre\r\ncada adición, hasta que todo el chocolate\r\nSe añade y la mezcla queda completamente\r\ncombinados hasta obtener una masa de pastel suelta.","Vierta la masa de fondant en una jarra y luego\r\ndividir uniformemente entre los moldes.\r\nLos fondants ahora se pueden congelar durante\r\nhasta un mes y cocinado congelado. relajarse\r\ndurante al menos 20 minutos o hasta la noche anterior. Para hornear congelado, simplemente continúe como se indica, agregando 5 minutos más a la\r\ntiempo de cocción.","Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.\r\nColoca los fondants en una bandeja para horno,\r\nluego cocine durante 10-12 minutos hasta que\r\nlas puntas han formado una costra y están\r\nempezando a separarse de los lados de sus\r\nmoldes. Retirar del horno y dejar\r\nreposar durante 1 min antes de desmoldar.","Afloje los fondants moviendo el\r\nremata muy suavemente para que se despeguen\r\ndesde los lados, sacándolos del\r\nmoldes. Inclina ligeramente cada fondant sobre tu\r\nmano para que sepas que se ha desprendido, entonces\r\nVuelva a colocarlo en el molde listo para servir.","Empezando por el centro de cada plato, exprima\r\nuna espiral de salsa de caramelo – haz todos los platos que quieras\r\nnecesita antes de pasar a la siguiente etapa.","Coloca un fondant en el medio de cada plato.\r\nCon una cuchara grande mojada en agua caliente, saque\r\nuna ''quenelle'' de helado.","Coloque con cuidado el helado encima del\r\nfondant, luego sirva inmediatamente. Repita con\r\nel resto de fondant."]','2026-01-11 12:55:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13116,9075,'es','Tarta de chocolate y nueces','Pastel de nueces cruzado con tarta de chocolate con una pizca de jarabe de arce: no podemos discutir eso','["Paquete de 375 g de masa quebrada","un poco de harina, para espolvorear","185 g de chocolate negro","50 g de mantequilla salada","4 huevos batidos","200 ml de jarabe de arce","200 g de nueces pecanas enteras"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Enrollar\r\nla masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada\r\ny utilizar para forrar un fondo suelto de 20 cm.\r\nlata de tarta. Rellenar la tarta con papel de horno y\r\nhornear frijoles, hornear por 25 minutos, luego\r\nRetire el papel de hornear y los frijoles.\r\nContinúe cocinando por 10 minutos más hasta que\r\ndorado. Retirar del horno y enfriar.","Derretir el chocolate y la mantequilla juntos.\r\nen un tazón grande sobre una cacerola a fuego lento\r\nagua. Batir los huevos y el sirope de arce.\r\njuntos, luego agregue el chocolate con\r\nla mayoría de las nueces. Vierta en la base de la tarta,\r\ncubra con las nueces restantes y hornee por\r\n30-40 minutos hasta que cuaje. Enfriar y servir con\r\nhelado de vainilla o crema doble."]','2026-01-11 12:55:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13117,9076,'es','Galletas de chocolate doble','Estás a sólo cinco ingredientes de una delicia de chocolate doble que se derrite en la boca','["175 g de mantequilla, blanda","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","100 g de chispas de chocolate, con leche o negro"]','["Mezclar la mantequilla y el azúcar junto con\r\nuna cuchara de madera. Agregue la harina y\r\ncacao, seguido de las chispas de chocolate\r\n– probablemente necesitarás mezclarlo\r\ncon las manos en esta etapa. Reducir a la mitad\r\nmasa y enrolle cada pieza en un tronco\r\nunos 5 cm de espesor. Envolver en film transparente y\r\nenfríe durante 1 hora o durante varios días. puede ser\r\ncongelado hasta por 1 mes.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nCortar los troncos en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor y transferirlos.\r\na una bandeja para hornear forrada con hornear\r\npergamino y hornee durante 10-12 minutos.\r\nDejar enfriar en la bandeja."]','2026-01-11 12:55:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13118,9077,'es','Torta de chocolate y Earl Grey','Nunca antes había sido tan fácil impresionar: esta torta de centro blando se puede preparar con anticipación y congelar u hornear desde cero en solo una hora.','["hojas de 2 bolsitas de té Earl Grey","100ml de leche caliente","250 g de buen chocolate negro (nosotros utilizamos una barra del 78%)","200 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubitos","140 g de almendras molidas","6 huevos, separados","200 g de azúcar en polvo","cacao, azúcar glas y crème fraîche o nata, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase y forre la base y los lados de\r\nuna lata profunda de 22 cm de fondo suelto con\r\npergamino para hornear, así sale el papel\r\nunos 2,5 cm por encima de los lados. Revuelve al conde\r\nTé gris en la leche caliente.","Derretir el chocolate, la mantequilla y una pizca.\r\nde sal juntos en un bol sobre una cacerola de\r\nagua apenas hirviendo. Luego agregue el\r\nalmendras molidas, seguidas del huevo\r\nyemas y té con leche, incluidas las hojas.\r\nBatir las claras a punto de nieve y luego batir.\r\nen el azúcar en polvo hasta que vuelva a estar rígido.\r\nDoblar las claras por el chocolate.\r\nmezclar y raspar en la lata. Hornear para\r\n30-35 minutos – todavía debería tener un ligero\r\ntambalearse. Luego enfriar completamente en la lata.","Retirar con cuidado del molde y levantar.\r\nen un plato para servir. Espolvoree todo con\r\ncacao y azúcar glas, luego servir en\r\nrodajas con crème fraîche o nata."]','2026-01-11 12:55:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13119,9078,'es','Galletas de nuez con trozos de chocolate','No hay nada mejor que las galletas al estilo americano con grandes trozos de chocolate y nueces. La galleta perfecta para adultos','["200 g de chocolate amargo, partido en cuadritos (nos gusta el de Green & Black)","100 g de mantequilla, picada","50 g de azúcar mascabado light","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 huevo batido","100 g de nueces enteras","100 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio"]','["Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Derrita 85 g de chocolate en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 1 minuto o sobre una olla con agua hirviendo.","Agrega la mantequilla, el azúcar, la vainilla y el huevo hasta que quede suave, luego agrega tres cuartas partes de las nueces y el chocolate restante, luego la harina y el bicarbonato de sodio.","Apila 12 cucharadas, espaciadas, en 2 bandejas para hornear (no esparzas la mezcla), luego introduce las nueces y el chocolate reservados. Hornee durante 12 minutos hasta que esté firme, luego déjelo enfriar sobre las hojas. Se puede conservar en lata hasta 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13120,9079,'es','Pavlova de chocolate y cerezas','Termina tu comida con este impresionante postre, con crema ondulante y fruta fresca de verano.','["6 claras de huevo grandes","300 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino blanco","25 g de cacao en polvo","50 g de chocolate negro finamente picado","Bote de 284ml de nata doble","3 cucharadas de azúcar glas","½ tarro de 600 g de compota de cerezas deshuesadas (yo usé Bonne Maman)","cerezas frescas, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 140C/ventilador 120C/gas 1.\r\nBatir las claras hasta que se formen.\r\npicos rígidos. Incorpora poco a poco el azúcar, un\r\nun par de cucharadas a la vez, asegurándose de\r\nbata muy bien entre cada adición.\r\nCuando se haya añadido todo el azúcar, conservar\r\nbatiendo durante un par de minutos hasta que\r\nLa mezcla es muy espesa y brillante y se ve\r\nun poco como espuma de afeitar. Agregue con cuidado\r\nla maicena, el vinagre, el cacao en polvo y\r\nchocolate con una cuchara grande de metal, solo\r\nhasta incorporar.","Arranca una hoja de papel para hornear.\r\ny úselo para cubrir una bandeja para hornear. Marcar un\r\nCírculo de 25 cm sobre el papel. Vierta sobre el\r\nmezcla de merengue, arremolinándose en el círculo,\r\nconstruyendo un poco los lados, listo para mantener\r\nel relleno. Cocine por 1½ hrs. Dejar enfriar.","Cuando esté listo para servir, batir el doble\r\nLa nata y el azúcar glas juntos en un recipiente grande.\r\ntazón hasta que se formen picos suaves. Cuchara el\r\ncompota de cerezas sobre el merengue, una cucharada\r\nsobre la crema y luego revuelva. Organizar\r\nalgunas de las cerezas frescas encima para terminar."]','2026-01-11 12:55:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13121,9080,'es','Pastel de cola de chocolate y cereza','Hornee este plato popular hecho con cola y luego decórelo con chispas de arcoíris, cerezas tipo cóctel y dulces de botella de cola para disfrutar de un regalo nostálgico.','["200ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para la lata","275 g de harina común","100 g de cacao en polvo","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","150ml de yogur natural","250 ml de cola de cereza o cola natural","3 huevos","50 g de mantequilla","250 g de azúcar glas","2-3 cucharadas de leche","unas gotas de colorante rosa","chispas de arcoíris, cerezas cóctel y dulces de botella de cola (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar la base y los lados de un molde para hornear o para pasteles de 34 x 25 cm (al menos 2½ cm de profundidad) y forrar con papel para hornear. Combina la harina, el cacao, la levadura en polvo, el bicarbonato, el azúcar y una buena pizca de sal en un bol grande. Rompe los grumos de azúcar frotándolos entre los dedos y agitando el bol para llevarlos a la superficie.","Batir el aceite, el yogur, la cola y los huevos en una jarra y luego verter los ingredientes húmedos en los secos. Revuelva bien, asegurándose de que no queden bolsas de harina, luego vierta en el molde y hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Si queda algo de mezcla húmeda pegada a la brocheta, hornee por 5 minutos más. Deje enfriar en el molde durante al menos 20 minutos.","Para el glaseado, derrita la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego lento. Retirar del fuego y agregar el azúcar, la leche y el colorante alimentario. Extienda el glaseado sobre el pastel y luego decore con chispas, cerezas y dulces, si los usa. Dejar reposar y luego cortar en cuadritos. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13122,9081,'es','Rollo de chocolate','Prepara nuestro rollito de chocolate de siguiente nivel, con un espectacular merengue de chocolate recubierto de un relleno de chocolate y nata y salsa de caramelo.','["aceite vegetal, para la lata","5 claras de huevo","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","225 g de azúcar en polvo","60 g de cacao en polvo, más algo extra para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","100 g de chocolate amargo, más algo extra para servir","100ml de nata doble","150ml de nata doble","25 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de salsa de caramelo (de lata o frasco), revuelta hasta que quede suave","una pizca de escamas de sal marina"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar la base y los lados de una bandeja para hornear de 23 x 32 cm y forrar con papel para hornear. Batir las claras, el jugo de limón y una pizca de sal con una batidora de pie o una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén muy firmes. Agrega 1 cucharada de azúcar y bate hasta obtener picos rígidos, luego agrega el resto del azúcar, una cucharada a la vez, hasta que la mezcla esté espesa y brillante. Tamiza el cacao y la harina de maíz y luego incorpóralos suavemente con una espátula hasta que estén completamente combinados. Extienda la mezcla uniformemente en el molde preparado, luego hornee durante 14-15 minutos hasta que esté crujiente al tacto. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde.","Mientras tanto, haz los rellenos. Para el relleno de chocolate, vierta el chocolate y la crema en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo y revuelva hasta que el chocolate se derrita y la mezcla esté brillante y suave. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente. Para el relleno de nata, bata la nata y el azúcar hasta obtener picos rígidos con una batidora eléctrica.","Espolvorea una hoja grande de papel para hornear con cacao en polvo y luego voltea con cuidado el merengue sobre ella. Retire la lata y retire con cuidado el pergamino. Con el extremo corto hacia ti, marca una línea a lo largo del merengue, a 2 cm del borde. Unte sobre el relleno de chocolate seguido de la crema y luego rocíe con la mayor parte de la salsa de caramelo. Espolvoree sobre las hojuelas de sal marina y pase una paleta o un cuchillo para cubiertos a través de los rellenos para agitarlos suavemente. Enrolle el rollo hasta formar un tronco apretado, comenzando por el extremo marcado y utilizando el pergamino de debajo como ayuda. Colóquelo en un plato o tabla. Se mantendrá frío hasta por un día. Rocíe sobre el resto de la salsa de caramelo y luego ralle finamente sobre más chocolate para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:55:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13123,9082,'es','Pastel de nevera de la Selva Negra','Haga una versión sencilla de pastel de nevera del pastel de la Selva Negra colocando capas de cerezas, crema de chocolate y galletas de chocolate. Es un postre delicioso para terminar una comida.','["aceite vegetal, para la lata","300 gramos de chocolate amargo","400ml de nata doble","250 g de nata agria entera","80 g de azúcar glas","½ cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","Tarro de 460 g de cerezas en kirsch (disponibles online o en la sección de repostería de los grandes supermercados)","700 g de galletas de bourbon","50 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Engrase ligeramente un molde desmontable de 20 x 25 cm, forre con film transparente y vuelva a engrasar ligeramente. Dejar de lado.","Coloque 200 g de chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor y derrítalo en el microondas en períodos de 20 segundos, revolviendo hasta que quede suave. Alternativamente, derrita el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una olla con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos. Batir la nata doble, la nata agria, el azúcar glas y la pasta de vainilla hasta que quede suave pero que se pueda comer con una cuchara (debe estar bastante suelta en esta etapa, pero se endurecerá en el frigorífico más tarde). Transfiera la mitad de la mezcla a un segundo tazón, luego agregue el chocolate derretido.","Vierta la mitad de las cerezas y todo el kirsch en una cacerola. Pica las cerezas restantes y reserva. Cubra el fondo del molde preparado con una capa de galletas de bourbon, luego vierta la mitad de la crema de chocolate, la mitad de las cerezas picadas y la mitad de la crema de vainilla. Repetir con una segunda capa de bizcochos y el resto de la crema de chocolate, las cerezas picadas y la crema de vainilla. Cubra y enfríe durante la noche.","Vierta el azúcar en polvo en la cacerola con las cerezas enteras restantes y el kirsch. Cocine a fuego lento durante unos 5 minutos, revolviendo hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Suba el fuego, lleve a ebullición y continúe cocinando a fuego alto durante 8 a 10 minutos, o hasta que el líquido se haya reducido a una consistencia almibarada que cubra el dorso de una cuchara. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Retire con cuidado el bizcocho del molde y retire el film transparente. Dejar a temperatura ambiente durante 30 minutos para que se ablande un poco. Pica el chocolate amargo restante en trozos grandes. Vierta las cerezas enfriadas y el almíbar sobre el pastel y esparza sobre el chocolate. Córtelo en 12 cuadrados para servir. Se conservará tapado en el refrigerador hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:55:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13124,9083,'es','Pastel de galleta de chocolate y caramelo salado','Hornee este espectacular pastel de chocolate cubierto con delicioso caramelo salado y galletas. Perfecto para celebrar una ocasión especial','["150ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para las latas","200 g de harina con levadura","50 g de cacao en polvo","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","250 g de azúcar moreno","150 ml de yogur griego","50ml de leche","100 ml de café fuerte, frío","2 huevos grandes","100 g de chispas de chocolate blanco","150 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","300 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharada de cacao en polvo","50 gramos de chocolate amargo","200g de galletas","4 cucharadas de salsa de caramelo salado","½ cucharada de leche","chocolate amargo (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Engrasar dos moldes para sándwiches de 20 cm y forrar las bases con papel de horno antiadherente. Tamiza la harina, el cacao y el polvo para hornear en un tazón grande y luego agrega el azúcar. Batir el yogur, la leche, el café y los huevos en una jarra hasta que se combinen. Incorpora gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos a la mezcla de harina hasta obtener una masa suave. Incorpora las chispas de chocolate.","Divida la mezcla entre los moldes y hornee durante 30-35 minutos, hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro de cada bizcocho, éste salga limpio. Retirar de los moldes y poner sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras tanto, haz la crema de mantequilla. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar glas y el cacao durante 5-8 minutos hasta que quede suave y cremoso. Derrita el chocolate amargo en un bol sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo o en ráfagas de 30 segundos en el microondas. Batir el chocolate derretido con la crema de mantequilla hasta que esté completamente incorporado. Coloque tres cuartas partes en una manga pastelera con una boquilla redonda grande.","Coloque uno de los bizcochos en un plato y coloque crema de mantequilla alrededor de su borde, con puntos alrededor de la circunferencia. Unte 2 cucharadas de la crema de mantequilla restante en el centro del pastel con una cuchara o una espátula.","Mezclar el caramelo y la leche con una pizca de sal. Unte la mitad del caramelo en el centro para cubrir la capa de crema de mantequilla. Desmenuza la mitad de las galletas encima. Enfríe durante 30 minutos hasta que la crema de mantequilla se haya endurecido ligeramente.","Coloca la segunda esponja encima de la primera. Repita el ribete de los puntos alrededor de la parte superior del pastel, pero esta vez llene todo el círculo con puntos de crema de mantequilla. Rocíe el caramelo salado sobre los puntos de crema de mantequilla. Rompe las galletas restantes en mitades o cuartos y colócalas encima del pastel, luego ralla sobre un poco de chocolate amargo, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 12:55:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13125,9084,'es','Pastelitos de chocolate y naranja','Invite a familiares y amigos a estos deliciosos cupcakes con bizcocho de chocolate con sabor a naranja y cobertura de crema de mantequilla. Decorar con ralladura de naranja y chocolate.','["140 g de azúcar moreno claro","100 g de harina con levadura","50 g de cacao en polvo","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 huevos grandes","135 ml de aceite vegetal","4 cucharadas de leche","50 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado y un poco más para decorar","2 naranjas grandes, ralladas","300 g de glaseado","150 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","1 naranja rallada y ralladura extra para decorar","25 g de cacao en polvo","2 cucharadas de leche","Colorante alimentario en gel de naranja."]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner en un bol grande el azúcar, la harina, el cacao, la pizca de sal y la levadura. Batir los huevos, el aceite vegetal y la leche. Incorpora gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos a los secos hasta obtener una mezcla suave. Incorpora el chocolate amargo. Coloque 12 moldes para cupcakes en una lata de 12 hoyos. Divida la mezcla entre las cajas, luego hornee por 20 minutos hasta que suba. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Batir el azúcar glas y la mantequilla hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agregue 2 cucharadas de agua caliente para aflojar y agregue la ralladura de naranja. Divida el glaseado uniformemente entre dos tazones. Agregue unas gotas de colorante alimentario de naranja a un tazón y revuelva hasta que el glaseado adquiera un color naranja brillante. En el otro tazón, agrega el cacao en polvo y 2 cucharadas de leche, luego bate hasta que se combinen.","Llene un lado de una manga pastelera (use una con boquilla redonda grande) con el glaseado de naranja, luego llene el otro lado con la crema de chocolate. Coloque encima de cada cupcake. Decorar con un poco de ralladura de naranja extra y una ralladura de chocolate negro."]','2026-01-11 12:55:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13126,9085,'es','Pastel de chocolate y sésamo','El tahini le da a este pastel un sutil sabor a nuez que combina perfectamente con el rico chocolate. Con esta receta salen 2 pasteles, así que ¿por qué no congelar uno como delicia para otro día?','["200 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","200 g de chocolate amargo, picado","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 ml de espresso fuerte","100 ml de crema agria","2 huevos","200 g de harina con levadura","5 cucharaditas de cacao en polvo","250 g de harina con levadura","150 g de tahini","1 cucharadita colmada de levadura en polvo","150 ml de café negro fuerte","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","¼ cucharadita de canela","2 cucharadas de leche","200ml de nata doble","40 g de mantequilla","200 g de chocolate amargo, picado","Paquete de 4 galletas de sésamo de 30 g."]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar dos moldes para pan de 900 g (8,5 cm de profundidad) y forrar con papel para hornear.","Primero, haz la mezcla de pastel de chocolate. Coloque la mantequilla y el chocolate en un recipiente grande resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Pon todos los demás ingredientes en un bol grande y, cuando el chocolate y la mantequilla se hayan derretido, vierte y mezcla con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave y bien combinado. Reserva y enjuaga los batidores.","En otro tazón grande, agrega todos los ingredientes del pastel de sésamo y luego combina con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave.","Alternando con cucharadas de cada mezcla, divida entre las dos latas. Nivele la parte superior, luego haga girar una brocheta a través de la mezcla para crear un efecto veteado. Hornee en el medio del horno durante 45-50 minutos o hasta que al insertar un palillo en el centro, éste salga limpio. Deje que los pasteles se enfríen completamente sobre una rejilla mientras prepara la cobertura (hay suficiente para ambos pasteles, pero la receta de la cobertura se puede reducir fácilmente a la mitad si desea congelar uno y congelarlo más tarde)","Calentar la nata doble y la mantequilla suavemente en una cacerola pequeña hasta que hierva a fuego lento, luego retirar del fuego y agregar el chocolate. Revuelva hasta que la mezcla esté suave, luego colóquela en el refrigerador durante 20 minutos para que se endurezca.","Batir bien con una cuchara de madera y luego transferir a una manga pastelera desechable. Corta el extremo para hacer una abertura amplia y luego haz zigzags gruesos y superpuestos a lo largo de los pasteles. Corte las galletas de sésamo en trozos y colóquelas encima, esparciéndolas sobre las migas, luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:56:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13127,6831,'es','Pastel sándwich de chocolate bajo en azúcar','Húmedo y blando, ¿quién creería que este magnífico pastel de chocolate contiene solo 2 g de azúcar por rebanada? La cobertura cremosa de chocolate también es baja en azúcar pero rica en delicias.','["150 ml de aceite de colza y un poco más para engrasar","250 g de remolacha cocida","50 g de cacao","140 g de harina integral normal","100 g de harina blanca normal","50 g de almendras molidas","200 g de xilitol, como Total Sweet","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 huevos grandes","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","50ml de leche desnatada","Bote 150ml bioyogurt natural","2 cucharadas de cacao","100 g de xilitol como Total Sweet","Bote de 150ml de nata doble"]','["Caliente el horno a 160C/140C/gas 3 y engrase, luego forre la base de dos moldes para sándwiches de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Para empezar a hacer la crema de chocolate revuelve el yogur con el cacao y el xilitol hasta que se mezclen por completo y reserva mientras haces el bizcocho. Esto ayuda a disolver los gránulos de xilitol.","Para hacer el pastel, primero tritura la remolacha en un procesador de alimentos hasta que parezca un puré espeso. Agregue el cacao, las harinas, las almendras molidas, el xilitol, el polvo para hornear y la soda y presione brevemente para mezclar los ingredientes.","Ahora agregue los huevos, los 150 ml de aceite de colza, el extracto de vainilla y la leche, y mezcle nuevamente para obtener una masa líquida suave.","Divida la mezcla de manera uniforme entre los moldes trabajando rápidamente, ya que el polvo de hornear se activa una vez que entra en contacto con los ingredientes líquidos, luego hornee durante 25 a 30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio del pastel, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar durante unos minutos, luego retírelo de los moldes y termine de enfriar sobre una rejilla. Una vez frío, retiramos con cuidado el papel de revestimiento.","Para terminar la crema de chocolate, montamos la nata doble hasta que mantenga su forma. Revuelva la mezcla de cacao y luego agregue todo menos 2 cucharaditas. Extienda un tercio encima de uno de los bizcochos fríos, cubra con el bizcocho restante y unte con el resto de la crema de chocolate para crear un acabado en forma de remolino. Salpica sobre la mezcla de cacao reservada y extiende suavemente con la punta de una cucharadita. El pastel se mantendrá en el refrigerador por un par de días, pero volverá a temperatura ambiente antes de comerlo para obtener el mejor sabor y textura."]','2026-01-11 12:56:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13128,9086,'es','Tarta de fiesta de galletas y nata','Apila nuestros mejores bizcochos de chocolate y cúbrelos con un glaseado de galleta Oreo para hacer este imponente pastel de celebración.','["300ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para engrasar","400 g de harina común","130 g de cacao en polvo","4 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","560 g de azúcar moreno blando","400 ml de suero de leche","200 ml de café fuerte o espresso","4 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","4 huevos grandes","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, blanda","600 g de azúcar glas","Tarrina de 280 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","10 galletas Oreo (aproximadamente ¾ de paquete)","Galletas Oreo, tantas como necesites para las letras de arriba (algunas pueden romperse al insertar las brochetas, así que compra más)","pinchos de madera finos","100 g de chocolate blanco, finamente picado","glaseado de fondant listo para enrollar, de color (usamos una mezcla de colorante alimentario azul y verde), o un bolígrafo para escribir glaseado"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrase y forre dos moldes para pasteles de 20 cm con papel para hornear; si los moldes para pasteles son bastante poco profundos, forre los lados hasta una profundidad de al menos 5 cm. Ponga 200 g de harina, 8 cucharadas de cacao en polvo, 2 cucharaditas de levadura en polvo, 1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio, 280 g de azúcar moreno blando y 1 cucharadita de sal en un bol y mezcle bien. Si hay grumos en el azúcar, exprímelos con los dedos para deshacerlos.","Mida 200 ml de suero de leche, 100 ml de café, 150 ml de aceite y 2 cucharaditas de vainilla en una jarra. Agrega 2 huevos y bate hasta que quede suave. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos en los secos y bata hasta que estén bien combinados. Vierta la mezcla del pastel de manera uniforme en los dos moldes y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que suba y al insertar un pincho en el centro, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla, retirar el papel de horno y dejar enfriar.","Repite los pasos 1 y 2, hasta tener 4 bizcochos en total. Estos bizcochos se pueden preparar con hasta tres días de anticipación y permanecerán húmedos si se envuelven en film transparente, o puede envolverlos bien y congelarlos por hasta dos meses.","Para hacer el glaseado, ponga la mantequilla en un bol grande y tamice la mitad del azúcar glas. Triture con una espátula y luego bata con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Agregue el queso crema y tamice el resto del azúcar glas, vuelva a triturar y luego mezcle una vez más con la batidora de mano. Coloque las galletas Oreo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener migajas finas. Agregue las migas de galleta al glaseado y mezcle nuevamente hasta que se combinen.","A continuación, haz los adornos para el pastel de galletas. Necesitarás una Oreo por cada letra de la palabra que quieras escribir: el nombre de alguien o, como hemos hecho nosotros, \"¡GUAU!\" Inserta con cuidado una brocheta en el relleno cremoso en el medio de cada Oreo; algunas galletas pueden romperse, así que guárdalas para más adelante. Derrita el chocolate en el microondas, revolviendo cada 20 segundos aproximadamente, o en un recipiente resistente al calor suspendido sobre una olla con agua hirviendo a fuego lento. Unta un poco de chocolate sobre la superficie de un lado de cada galleta. Extiende el glaseado de fondant hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de 50 peniques y recorta las letras, luego pégalas a las galletas y déjalas secar. Alternativamente, deja que el chocolate se seque y luego usa un bolígrafo para glaseado para escribir el nombre o la palabra directamente en la superficie.","Para montar el bizcocho, pega uno de tus bizcochos en una base para pasteles o tabla con un poco del glaseado de queso crema. Use aproximadamente la mitad del glaseado para apilar los pasteles restantes encima, esparciendo una cantidad generosa entre cada capa. Apila el glaseado restante encima del pastel ensamblado y usa una espátula para pasarlo por los bordes, cubriendo toda la superficie del pastel. Ordena el plato con un trozo de papel de cocina.","Si te sobraron galletas Oreo, rómpelas en pedazos y empújalas alrededor de la base del pastel. Inserte los adornos de pastel de galletas secos en la parte superior del pastel y sirva. Guarde las sobras en el refrigerador hasta por 2 días, pero déjelas a temperatura ambiente durante aproximadamente una hora antes de comerlas."]','2026-01-11 12:56:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13129,9087,'es','Pastel dulce que desafía la gravedad','Los pasteles antigravedad son la tendencia imprescindible de este año para cumpleaños o fiestas: este impresionante pastel Smartie hará las delicias de niños y adultos por igual.','["150ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para engrasar","200 g de harina común","8 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","280 g de azúcar moreno blando","200 ml de suero de leche","100 ml de café fuerte o espresso","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos grandes","2½ paquetes de 114 g de dedos de chocolate con leche","8 tubos de Smarties u otros dulces","100 g de chocolate con leche, picado en trozos pequeños, más 50 g/2 oz para decorar","200 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, blanda","400 g de azúcar glas, troceado","4 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","2 cucharadas de leche","1 pajita flexible","2 brochetas de madera","1 bolsa de papel o paquete de dulces (ver consejo)","cinta adhesiva"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrase y forre dos moldes para pasteles de 20 cm con papel para hornear; si los moldes para pasteles son bastante poco profundos, forre los lados hasta una profundidad de al menos 5 cm. Pon en un bol la harina, el cacao en polvo, la levadura, el bicarbonato, el azúcar y 1 cucharadita de sal y mezcla bien. Si hay grumos en el azúcar, exprímelos con los dedos para deshacerlos.","Mide en una jarra el suero de leche, el café, el aceite y la vainilla. Agrega el huevo y bate hasta que quede suave. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos en los secos y bata hasta que estén bien combinados. Vierta la mezcla del pastel de manera uniforme en los dos moldes y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que suba y al insertar un pincho en el centro, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla, retirar el papel de horno y dejar enfriar. Estos bizcochos se pueden preparar con hasta tres días de anticipación y permanecerán húmedos si se envuelven en film transparente, o puede envolverlos bien y congelarlos por hasta dos meses.","Para hacer el glaseado de dulce de chocolate, coloque el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor, suspendido sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo. Revuelve de vez en cuando hasta que se derrita. (Como alternativa, derrítelo en el microondas, revolviendo el chocolate cada 20 segundos para que no se queme). Retira el bol del fuego y deja enfriar un poco. Mientras tanto, ponga la mantequilla y el azúcar glas en otro tazón grande y triture con una espátula para combinar (esto evitará que cubra la superficie de trabajo con azúcar glas), luego bata con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Tamice el cacao y vierta el chocolate derretido y la leche, luego mezcle nuevamente hasta que quede suave.","Use aproximadamente la mitad del glaseado para emparedar los pasteles en un soporte para pasteles o en una tabla. Use una espátula para cubrir todo el pastel con el glaseado restante; no se preocupe por quedar demasiado limpio. Utilice los dedos de chocolate para cubrir los lados de los pasteles; haga esto inmediatamente después de aplicar el glaseado, ya que el glaseado se endurecerá después de un tiempo y los dedos de chocolate no se pegarán.","Derrita los 50 g de chocolate restantes en el microondas o en un tazón pequeño suspendido sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento. Dejar enfriar hasta que el chocolate tenga una consistencia untable. Puedes acelerar esto poniéndolo en el refrigerador; simplemente revuélvelo cada 5 minutos aproximadamente para evitar que el chocolate se endurezca.","Introduce una brocheta en el centro del pastel y desliza la pajita por encima; esto le dará más estabilidad. Introduce 1-2 cm de pajita en el pastel. Usa un cuchillo para cubiertos para esparcir una gota de chocolate sobre un Smartie y, comenzando por la base, pega los Smarties a la pajita. Tendrás que hacer esto por etapas para permitir que el chocolate se asiente un poco antes de agregar otra capa de Smarties. Sube por la pajita hasta que esté completamente cubierta. Si el chocolate en su tazón se vuelve demasiado firme, simplemente caliéntelo nuevamente hasta que tenga la consistencia correcta. Deténgase cuando llegue a la curva de la pajita.","Introduce la brocheta restante en la parte superior de la pajita para que sobresalga en ángulo. Coloca la bolsa de papel encima; es posible que tengas que usar un poco de cinta adhesiva para mantenerla en su lugar. Si algo de la pajita queda expuesto, cúbrelo con más Smarties.","Coloca los Smarties restantes encima del pastel para inundar la superficie. Se mantendrá bien almacenado en una lata hermética durante 2 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13130,9088,'es','Pastel de chocolate más ligero con glaseado de chocolate','Nunca imaginarías que este bizcocho de textura ligera y rico sabor tiene menos grasa, calorías y azúcar gracias a las almendras molidas y el yogur.','["25 g de mantequilla","140 g de harina con levadura","25 g de cacao en polvo tamizado","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de azúcar mascabado light","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","25 g de almendras molidas","175 g de yogur natural","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos grandes, batidos","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","25 g de chocolate negro (preferiblemente con 70 % de cacao), finamente picado","50 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharada de cacao en polvo, tamizado","25 g de mantequilla, temperatura ambiente","1 cucharadita de leche semidesnatada","100 g de queso crema light, recién sacado de la nevera","100 g de queso quark","10 peladillas (opcional)"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forre las bases de 2 moldes redondos para pastel de sándwich de 18 cm con papel para hornear. Derretir la mantequilla y dejar enfriar. Mezclar en un bol grande la harina con el cacao en polvo, la levadura en polvo, tanto el azúcar como la almendra molida. Agrega el yogur y la vainilla a los huevos batidos. Vierta esto en la mezcla seca junto con la mantequilla derretida y el aceite. Revuelva brevemente hasta que esté mezclado, cremoso y suave. No batir demasiado.","Vierta la mezcla uniformemente entre las dos latas y nivele las superficies. Hornee durante 20 minutos hasta que suba y comience a despegarse de los lados del molde. Retirar de los moldes, quitar el pergamino y dejar enfriar las tartas sobre una rejilla.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Derrita el chocolate en un recipiente colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento. Retirar el bol de la sartén y dejar enfriar el chocolate. Tamiza el azúcar glas y el cacao en un recipiente aparte. Agrega la mantequilla y la leche y bate hasta que quede suave. Incorpora el queso crema y el quark, luego agrega el chocolate derretido y enfriado.","Cuando los pasteles estén fríos, use la mitad del glaseado para emparedar ambos pasteles. Extienda el resto del glaseado encima formando pliegues esponjosos y luego decore con almendras azucaradas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:56:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13131,9089,'es','Tarta de espresso, chocolate y guindilla con crema de café','La calidez del café y el chile se combinan maravillosamente con el chocolate en este impresionante postre para cenas, y termine con crema doble.','["3 cucharadas de harina común, más un poco más para la lata","250 g de chocolate negro, partido en trozos","250 g de mantequilla salada, ablandada y picada, más un poco más para engrasar","1 cucharada de espresso instantáneo en polvo","2 chiles rojos ojo de pájaro, sin semillas y finamente picados","¼ cucharadita de chile en polvo (opcional)","6 huevos medianos, separados","4 cucharadas de azúcar moreno","175 g de azúcar en polvo","½ cucharadita de crémor tártaro","4 cucharadas de almendras molidas","cacao en polvo, para servir","300ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de espresso instantáneo en polvo"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrase un molde desmontable de 22 cm con mantequilla blanda y cubra el fondo con papel para hornear. Agite un poco de harina alrededor de los bordes untados con mantequilla.","Derrita el chocolate y la mantequilla en una cacerola con agua hirviendo o en el microondas. Una vez derretido, mezcle hasta que quede suave y agregue el espresso en polvo y los chiles y el chile en polvo, si los usa. Batir las yemas de huevo con el azúcar moreno y el azúcar en polvo, ya sea en una batidora eléctrica o con una batidora eléctrica de mano, durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que estén espesas y pálidas. En un recipiente aparte, usando un batidor limpio, bata las claras y el crémor tártaro hasta que se formen picos suaves y redondeados.","Vierta la mezcla de chocolate sobre las yemas batidas y el azúcar y mezcle suavemente hasta que quede suave. Agrega las almendras y la harina y vuelve a mezclar. Vierta las claras de huevo en la mezcla de chocolate y mezcle suavemente. Vierta la masa en el molde preparado y hornee durante 40-45 minutos hasta que el pastel esté listo pero con un ligero movimiento en el centro. (Si el pastel comienza a dorarse demasiado rápido, cúbralo con un trozo de papel para hornear).","Dejar enfriar en el molde; se hundirá un poco a medida que se enfríe. Pasa un cuchillo por el interior del molde para aflojarlo. Retire el papel para hornear y colóquelo sobre una base para pasteles. Batir la nata y el espresso en polvo hasta que se formen picos suaves. Sirva a un lado o colóquelo encima del pastel espolvoreado con un poco de cacao en polvo."]','2026-01-11 12:56:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13132,9090,'es','Pastel de capas de chocolate con glaseado de maracuyá','La ganadora del Great British Bake Off, Jo Wheatley, comparte su receta infalible de bizcocho en este pastel en capas con un glaseado de mantequilla picante.','["175 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos grandes, batidos","75 g de harina con levadura","200 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","75 g de cacao","200 ml de nata agria, a temperatura ambiente","50 g de queso crema entero, a temperatura ambiente","250 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","500 g de azúcar glas","150 g de queso crema entero","3 maracuyás muy maduros"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar la base de un molde desmontable de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo hasta que estén pálidos, ligeros y esponjosos; esto es más fácil usando una máquina independiente o una batidora eléctrica de mano. Agrega poco a poco el huevo, poco a poco, batiendo bien entre cada adición.","Tamizamos en un bol ambas harinas, el bicarbonato y el cacao. Agregue la mitad de los ingredientes secos tamizados a la mezcla de huevo e incorpore con una cuchara de metal grande. En otro tazón, mezcle la crema agria y el queso crema hasta que quede suave. Agregue la mitad a la masa del pastel e incorpore. Repita este proceso con la harina restante y la crema agria y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Vierta en el molde para pastel. Hornee en el estante del medio durante 1 hora o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio del pastel, éste salga limpio. Deje que el pastel se enfríe en el molde durante 10 minutos antes de desmoldar sobre una rejilla y quitar el papel para hornear.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Con una batidora eléctrica, bata la mantequilla hasta que esté pálida y suavemente batida. Agrega el azúcar glas y bate hasta que quede suave, luego agrega el queso crema y bate nuevamente. Tamizar el jugo de las maracuyás, reservando la pulpa y las semillas. Agrega el jugo al glaseado.","Para armar, divida el pastel en 3 capas iguales y coloque la capa inferior en un soporte o plato para pasteles. Extienda un tercio del glaseado sobre la capa inferior, girando hacia los bordes. Repita con las 2 capas restantes de pastel y glaseado, terminando con una capa de glaseado. Cubra con la pulpa y las semillas de maracuyá. Servir de inmediato. Se conservará refrigerado durante 3 días, pero se devolverá a temperatura ambiente antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13133,9091,'es','Pastel de chocolate amargo y dulce','Bizcocho de chocolate amargo, el pastel de fiesta perfecto, el pastel de té de la tarde o el pastel con cualquier excusa','["200 g de azúcar en polvo","200 g de mantequilla blanda","4 huevos batidos","200 g de harina con levadura: cambie 2 cucharadas de harina por 2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo tamizado (nosotros usamos Green & Black''s)","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de leche","200ml de nata doble","50 g de mantequilla","3 cucharadas de miel clara","200 g de chocolate amargo (use 70% de cacao si puede), partido en trozos","cubra con chocolate rallado o rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Untar con mantequilla dos moldes para sándwich de 20 cm y forrar con papel de horno antiadherente. En un tazón grande, bata todos los ingredientes del pastel hasta obtener una masa suave y tersa.","Divida la mezcla entre los moldes, alise la superficie con una espátula o el dorso de una cuchara, luego hornee durante unos 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y el pastel salte hacia atrás al presionarlo. Colóquelo en una rejilla para enfriar y déjelo enfriar por completo.","Para el glaseado de dulce de azúcar, calienta la nata hasta que empiece a hervir. Retirar del fuego y agregar la mantequilla, la miel y el chocolate (partido en trozos).","Deje que se derrita durante 5 minutos, luego revuelva brevemente para combinar; no mezcle demasiado o perderá su brillo. Coloca los pasteles en un sándwich con un tercio del glaseado recién tibio y esparce el resto por la parte superior y los lados. Cubra con chocolate rallado o rallado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:56:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13134,9092,'es','pastel de cumpleaños de chocolate','Usamos velas de colores en lugar de dulces artificiales para alegrar este delicioso pastel de cumpleaños.','["140 g de mantequilla, más un poco para la lata","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos","225 g de harina integral con levadura","50 g de cacao en polvo","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","250 gramos de yogur natural","300 g de azúcar glas dorado, tamizado","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo, tamizado","1 cucharada de mantequilla, derretida","3-4 cucharadas de agua hirviendo","50 g de chocolate blanco, natural y con leche, partidos en cuadritos"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Mantequilla \r\ny forrar la base de un molde para bizcocho de 18 x 28 cm.  \r\no bandeja. Ponga la mantequilla y el azúcar en un bol; \r\nbatir con batidores eléctricos de mano hasta \r\nligero y esponjoso. agregue los huevos poco a poco, \r\nbatiendo bien entre cada adición.","Tamizar la harina, el cacao y el bicarbonato.  \r\nde refresco en el tazón, luego vierta cualquier  \r\nsalvado que queda en el colador. Vierta lo natural \r\nyogur. Revuelva todo hasta obtener una mezcla suave. \r\ny vierta en la lata preparada. Hornear para \r\n20-25 minutos hasta que esté firme y encogido  \r\nlejos de los lados de la lata. fresco en el  \r\nlata durante 5 minutos, luego voltea sobre una rejilla  \r\nque se enfríe por completo.","Para el glaseado, tamizar el azúcar glas y \r\ncacao en un bol, luego vierte la mantequilla \r\ny 2 cucharadas de agua recién hervida. Revuelva juntos  \r\nhasta obtener una consistencia suave y untable. si es \r\ndemasiado tieso, con mucho cuidado añadir un poco más \r\nagua hirviendo, gota a gota.","Extienda el glaseado sobre la parte superior del pastel. \r\nusando una espátula mojada en agua caliente. voluntad \r\nmanténgalo en un recipiente hermético por hasta 1 semana.","Derretir los chocolates en tres formas diferentes. \r\ntazones en el microondas a potencia alta durante 1 min  \r\no sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Cuchara  \r\nlos chocolates derretidos en tres plástico \r\nmangas pasteleras desechables. Corta los extremos \r\ny coloca 12 formas simples encima del \r\npastel. Dejar reposar. Justo antes de servir,  \r\ncortar el bizcocho en 12 cuadrados y empujar  \r\nen las velas."]','2026-01-11 12:56:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13135,8235,'es','Tarta de chocolate negro y naranja','Un pastel denso, oscuro y endiabladamente delicioso, esto desaparecerá antes de que te des cuenta.','["1 naranja de Sevilla","un poco de mantequilla derretida, para engrasar","100 g de chocolate natural, partido en trozos","3 huevos","280 g de azúcar en polvo","240 ml de aceite de girasol","25 g de cacao en polvo","250 g de harina común","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","cáscara de naranja confitada, para decorar","200 g de chocolate natural, partido en trozos","225ml de nata doble"]','["Perfora la naranja con una brocheta (hasta el final). Cocine en agua hirviendo durante 30 minutos hasta que estén suaves. Batir la naranja entera en un procesador de alimentos hasta que quede suave; dejar enfriar.","Precalienta el horno a 180C/gas 4/ventilador 160C. Engrasa y forra la base de un molde para pastel redondo de 23 cm/9 pulgadas. Derrita el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo o en el microondas durante 2 minutos a temperatura alta, revolviendo después de 1 minuto. Dejar enfriar.","En un bol grande batir ligeramente los huevos, el azúcar y el aceite. Agregue gradualmente el puré de naranja, desechando las pepitas, luego agregue el chocolate derretido enfriado. Tamizar el cacao, la harina y la levadura. Mezclar bien y verter en el molde. Hornee en el centro del horno durante 55 minutos, o hasta que el pastel rebote cuando se presiona ligeramente en el medio. (Revise después de 45 minutos y cubra con papel de aluminio si se está dorando demasiado). Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos en el molde, luego colóquelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Hacer la ganache de chocolate: poner el chocolate en un bol resistente al calor. Llevar la nata a ebullición y verter sobre el chocolate. Déjelo por 2 minutos, luego revuelva hasta que quede suave. Déjelo a un lado hasta que esté lo suficientemente firme como para esparcirlo sobre el pastel, hasta 1 hora y media.","Transfiera el pastel a un plato para servir. Con una espátula, haga girar la ganache por encima. Decorar con tiras de piel de naranja confitada."]','2026-01-11 12:56:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13136,9094,'es','Pastel de cerezas bañado en chocolate','Hornea tu pastel de cerezas bañado en chocolate y cómelo.','["150 g de chocolate con leche de buena calidad","175 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de mantequilla muy blanda y ligeramente salada","3 huevos grandes","3 cucharadas de leche","1 plátano mediano, triturado","200 gramos de chocolate blanco","400 g de cerezas","150 ml de crema fresca","2 cucharadas de kirsch (opcional)"]','["Precalienta el horno a temperatura ventilada 160C/\r\nconvencional180C/gas 4. Mantequilla y línea\r\nla base de dos moldes para sándwiches de 20 cm.\r\nRallar en trozos grandes dos tercios de la\r\nchocolate y picar el resto. Dejar de lado.","Poner la harina, la levadura y el azúcar.\r\nen un tazón grande para mezclar. hacer un pozo en\r\nel centro y agregar la mantequilla, los huevos y\r\nleche (la mantequilla debe estar muy blanda para esto)\r\npara trabajar). Batir juntos con una mano.\r\nbatidor eléctrico durante unos 2 minutos hasta que\r\nligero y esponjoso (o use una cuchara de madera\r\ny batir bien durante 3 minutos). Doblar ligeramente\r\nen el chocolate rallado y picado y\r\npuré de plátano.","Divida la mezcla uniformemente entre los\r\nlatas. Nivele suavemente la superficie con el\r\ndorso de una cuchara o espátula de metal. hornear\r\nuno al lado del otro en el estante del medio durante 25-30\r\nminutos hasta que esté elástico al tacto y\r\ncomenzando a alejarse de los lados.","Retirar del horno, dejar enfriar en\r\nlas latas durante 5 minutos. Girar en un cable\r\nrejilla, quitar el papel de revestimiento y dejar\r\ndejar enfriar durante aproximadamente 1 hora antes de glasear.","Para el glaseado y el relleno, parta el chocolate blanco en un recipiente resistente al calor y derrítalo suavemente.\r\nsobre una cacerola con agua caliente, no del todo hirviendo\r\nagua hasta que se derrita. Quitar del\r\nsartén y dejar reposar durante 5-6 minutos.","Cubra una bandeja para hornear con papel de aluminio o encerado.\r\npapel. Mojar las cerezas, una a una,\r\nen el chocolate para cubrirlos hasta la mitad, luego\r\ncolóquelos en la bandeja para hornear para que cuajen.","Agrega la crème fraîche a la\r\nchocolate derretido restante hasta\r\nsuave y brillante. Luego dejar enfriar\r\ny espesar (5 minutos más o menos). Ahora\r\ntransferir la mitad de esta mezcla a otra\r\ncuenco. Deshuesar otros 200 g/8 oz\r\ncerezas, córtelas por la mitad y luego agréguelas a una\r\nde los tazones con 2 cucharadas de kirsch (opcional)\r\ny revuelva hasta que se mezcle. Pon un bizcocho\r\nen un plato de servir y extender la superficie\r\ncon la mezcla de cerezas, luego sándwich\r\ncon la segunda esponja. difundir el resto\r\nde la mezcla de chocolate por encima y\r\ndecorar con las cerezas enteras bañadas.\r\nEs mejor comer este pastel el día en que está\r\nsido hecho."]','2026-01-11 12:56:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13137,9095,'es','Pan de chocolate blanco y cerezas','Este delicioso pastel es perfecto para tomar un té en el jardín.','["225 g de mantequilla, blanda","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos batidos","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","225 g de harina con levadura, tamizada y un poco más para espolvorear","375 g de cerezas frescas, sin hueso","175 g de chocolate blanco, picado en trozos pequeños","100 g de chocolate blanco partido en trozos pequeños","140 g de mascarpone medio graso","rizos de chocolate blanco o cerezas frescas, para decorar"]','["Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Forre un molde para pan de 1 kg con papel para hornear, asegurándose de que el papel quede más alto que los lados. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que quede esponjoso, luego agregar los huevos, poco a poco, junto con la vainilla. Incorpora la harina hasta tener una mezcla suave.","Espolvoree las cerezas con un poco de harina y luego agregue con cuidado la mitad de la fruta y el chocolate a la mezcla. Vierta en la lata preparada, luego esparza las cerezas y el chocolate restantes encima, presionándolos ligeramente. Hornear durante 1 h 10 min - 1 h 15 min hasta que al insertar un pincho en el medio salga limpio. Asegúrate de no confundir el chocolate derretido con la mezcla cruda para pastel. Dejar enfriar en el molde unos minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo. Ahora se puede envolver bien en film transparente y guardar en el refrigerador hasta por 3 días.","Saca el marscapone del frigorífico para que alcance la temperatura ambiente. Derrita el chocolate blanco en un bol sobre una cacerola con agua caliente. Agregue rápidamente 1 cucharada de marscapone y luego agregue el resto (tenga cuidado de no batir demasiado la mezcla o se volverá granulada). Extienda sobre la parte superior del pan y termine con rizos de chocolate blanco o cerezas frescas."]','2026-01-11 12:56:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13138,9096,'es','Torta de chocolate y jengibre','Este delicioso postre con un triple toque de jengibre es el sueño de un adicto al chocolate','["250 g de mantequilla sin sal, cortada en cubitos, más un poco más para la lata","cacao, para espolvorear","350 g de chocolate amargo, picado","2 cucharadas de vino de jengibre Stone''s","140 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","5 huevos, separados","75 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharada colmada de conserva de jengibre","140 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","150ml de nata doble","25 g de mantequilla sin sal","2 cucharadas de vino de jengibre Stone''s"]','["Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3-4.\r\nUnte con mantequilla y forre un molde desmontable redondo de 23 cm.\r\nlata con un disco de horno untado con mantequilla\r\npergamino. Espolvorea ligeramente el interior\r\ndel molde con cacao y retirar el exceso.","Poner el chocolate y la mantequilla en un\r\nrecipiente mediano resistente al calor, agregue el\r\nvino de jengibre y colocar el bol sobre una sartén\r\nde agua apenas hirviendo. Revuelva ocasionalmente\r\nhasta que se derrita y quede suave. Quitar de\r\nel fuego y enfriar un poco.","Vierta ambos azúcares en una mezcla grande.\r\nbol o el bol de una batidora eléctrica y\r\nagrega las yemas de huevo. Batir hasta que esté pálido y\r\nluz. Vierta el chocolate derretido y\r\nmantequilla a las yemas y revuelva hasta\r\nsuave. Con otro grande, impecablemente\r\nLimpiar el bol y batir, batir el huevo.\r\nclaras con una pizca de sal hasta que\r\nsólo mantén un pico rígido.","Tamizar las almendras y el jengibre en el\r\nmezcla de chocolate e incorporar usando\r\nuna cuchara grande de metal. Añade un tercio de\r\nlas claras de huevo y revuelva para que se suelten\r\nla mezcla. Doblar el resto\r\nclaras de huevo hasta que se combinen.","Vierta la mitad de la mezcla en el\r\nlata preparada y esparcida suavemente a nivel\r\nutilizando una espátula. Caliente suavemente el\r\nconserva de jengibre hasta que se pueda untar\r\ny vierta con cuidado sobre el pastel en\r\npequeñas porciones. Vierta sobre el resto\r\nmezcla de chocolate, untar nivelado y\r\nhornee justo debajo del estante central de\r\nHorno durante 50 minutos-1 hora hasta que se forme una masa de madera.\r\nbrocheta insertada en el medio de\r\nel bizcocho sale con una miga húmeda\r\nadjunto. Deje que el pastel se enfríe en el\r\nestaño y no te desanimes si la parte superior\r\nhundimientos y grietas.","Para hacer el glaseado de ganache, incline la\r\nchocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor. entonces\r\nañade la nata, la mantequilla y el vino de jengibre.\r\nColoque el recipiente sobre una cacerola de apenas\r\nagua hirviendo y revuelva hasta que se derrita\r\ny aterciopelada. Quitar de\r\nEl fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.","Pase con cuidado una espátula por el\r\nborde del pastel para aflojarlo, luego colocar\r\nun plato para servir. Extender la ganache\r\nla parte superior y dejar reposar antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13139,9097,'es','Tarta de chocolate blanco y negro','Para las grandes celebraciones, este pastel es imprescindible: cuatro capas de bizcocho húmedo, montones de ganache de chocolate y el crujiente de Maltesers.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","100 g de chocolate blanco (nos gusta M&S o Green & Black’s con vainilla auténtica)","100 g de chocolate negro (70% cacao)","3 huevos","100ml de leche entera o semidesnatada","175 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharadas de café muy fuerte (el instantáneo está bien)","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","Bote de 284ml de nata doble","200 g de chocolate negro (70% cacao)","50 g de chocolate blanco, derretido","Bolsa pequeña de Maltesers de chocolate blanco (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Mantequilla y fondo para moldes para sándwich de 2 x 20 cm. Para el pastel, parta el chocolate blanco y el chocolate negro en dos tazones pequeños, luego derrita en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 1 minuto o sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Pon todo lo demás, excepto el café y la vainilla, en un tazón grande y luego bate hasta que esté cremoso.","Divida la mezcla en dos, luego agregue el café y el chocolate amargo derretido a un tazón, y la vainilla y el chocolate blanco derretido.\r\nchocolate al otro. Revuelva hasta que esté bien mezclado, luego vierta en las latas. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que suba y se encoja ligeramente de los lados de las latas. Deje enfriar en los moldes durante unos minutos y luego colóquelos sobre una rejilla.","Para la ganache, calienta la nata en una sartén y luego rompe el chocolate amargo en un bol grande. Una vez que la crema esté hirviendo, viértala sobre el chocolate y déjela por 5 minutos. Revuelva hasta que quede suave, luego déjelo hasta que espese y se enfríe. Divida los pasteles en dos por la mitad (un cuchillo para pan funciona bien), coloque los trozos en capas, alternando capas blancas y oscuras, y haga un sándwich, luego cúbralos con la ganache.","Para decorar, vierta el chocolate blanco derretido en una manga pastelera con boquilla fina (o use una bolsa para sándwich y corte el extremo). Haga un zigzag con el chocolate blanco sobre el pastel y luego termine con un puñado de Maltesers blancos. Servir solo o de postre con nata líquida. Es mejor consumirlo ese mismo día, pero se conserva en un recipiente hermético hasta por 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13140,9098,'es','Pastel de chocolate con glaseado de ángel','Lo último en placer, este pastel de chocolate dulce parece una estrella con glaseado estilo americano y se hornea en una sola lata.','["250 g de chocolate negro, partido en trozos (el chocolate estándar del supermercado está bien)","300 g de harina con levadura","300 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro, más 2 cucharadas","50 g de cacao","200ml de aceite de girasol y un poco más para engrasar","284 ml de nata agria","3 huevos","1 cucharadita de esencia de vainilla","500 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharada de glucosa líquida","2 claras de huevo","25 g de azúcar glas tamizada"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 4\r\ny engrasar y forrar una ronda profunda de 20 cm.\r\nmolde para pastel. Batir el chocolate en una comida.\r\nprocesador hasta que se desmenuce. Volcar la harina,\r\nazúcar, cacao, aceite, 150 ml de nata agria,\r\nhuevos, vainilla y 150 ml de agua en el\r\ntazón para mezclar más grande que tengas. batir\r\ncon una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave, luego\r\nagregue rápidamente 150 g de su preparado\r\npedacitos de chocolate. Pasar a una lata y hornear.\r\nen el estante del medio durante 1 h 20-1 h 30\r\nminutos, o hasta que se inserte una brocheta en el\r\nel centro sale limpio. Dejar enfriar en la lata.","Mientras se hornea el pastel, haz el\r\nglaseado. Combine los trozos de chocolate restantes\r\ny crema agria con 2 cucharadas de color marrón suave\r\nazúcar en una cacerola pequeña y calentar,\r\nrevolviendo, hasta que el chocolate se derrita y\r\ntienes un glaseado suave. Dejar enfriar.","Cuando el bizcocho esté frío, córtelo en\r\n3 capas iguales. Extender 2 capas con\r\nglaseado de chocolate.","Para hacer el glaseado de ángel, pon el\r\nAzúcar, vainilla y glucosa líquida en una cacerola.\r\ncon 125ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición y\r\ncocine hasta que el azúcar se haya derretido y\r\nel almíbar se vuelve claro. Retirar del fuego.\r\nMientras tanto, bata las claras hasta\r\nrígido, luego continúa batiendo, gradualmente\r\nvertiendo el almíbar de azúcar caliente en forma constante\r\nchorrear, hasta que la mezcla esté esponjosa y\r\nlo suficientemente grueso como para extenderse; esto podría tomar\r\nunos minutos mientras la mezcla se enfría. Golpear\r\nel azúcar glas. Trabaja rápido y difunde\r\nun poquito sobre cada capa cubierta de chocolate\r\ncapa. Armar el pastel y agitar el resto.\r\nglaseado sobre todo el pastel."]','2026-01-11 12:56:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13141,9099,'es','Pastel sombrío de chocolate y caramelo','Para disfrutar del máximo placer, no busque más que el espectáculo de cuatro capas de chocolate y caramelo de Sarah Cook.','["225 g de mantequilla muy blanda, más un poco para engrasar","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","175 g de harina con levadura","85 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 huevos","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","5 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","225 g de mantequilla muy blanda, más un poco para engrasar","175 g de azúcar mascabado light","50 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","175 g de harina con levadura","85 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 huevos","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharada de cacao","Lata de 397 g de caramelo (almacenada cerca de la leche condensada en las tiendas)","140 g de chocolate negro","140 g de chocolate con leche","300ml de nata doble"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nBases de grasa y hilo de 2 x 20cm.\r\nmoldes para sándwiches con papel para hornear.\r\nPara los bizcochos de vainilla y chocolate, mezclar\r\ntodos los ingredientes, menos el cacao,\r\njunto con una batidora eléctrica. raspar\r\nla mitad de la mezcla en un segundo tazón y\r\nMezcla el cacao. Raspar en las latas\r\ny hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que se forme una brocheta.\r\nmetido sale limpio.","Repita el paso 1 para Caramelo y\r\nbizcochos de caramelo y chocolate, dejando nuevamente\r\ncacao de la primera mezcla, luego\r\ndividir la mezcla por la mitad y batir la\r\ncacao en un solo lote. Cocine como arriba.","Mientras las esponjas se enfrían, derrita las\r\nchocolate negro y con leche juntos en un\r\ntazón sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo\r\nagua. Retirar del fuego, agregar el\r\ncrema y enfriar o enfriar hasta que se pueda untar.","Cuando los bizcochos estén fríos, esparcir\r\nun tercio del caramelo sobre la vainilla\r\nbizcocho y cubrir con el bizcocho de caramelo.\r\nRepartir otro tercio del caramelo.\r\ny cubrir con el bizcocho de caramelo y chocolate,\r\nluego el último tercio de caramelo y encima\r\ncon el bizcocho de chocolate (que no cunda el pánico\r\nSi mezclas las capas, el pastel aún\r\nse ve genial cuando lo cortas). difundir el\r\nglaseado de chocolate sobre todo el pastel para\r\nservir. Se mantendrá en un lugar fresco en un\r\nrecipiente hermético por hasta 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13142,9100,'es','Pan de chocolate denso y amargo','Este bizcocho se mezcla y se hace en una cacerola, ¡qué fácil es! Es mejor comerlo el mismo día o dentro de dos días.','["200 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","100 g de chocolate amargo (use uno que tenga un 70 % de sólidos de cacao), partido en trozos","150g de yogur natural en bote","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes","250 g de harina con levadura","175 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","100ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de mantequilla","100 g de chocolate negro, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5 y\r\nAsegúrate de que haya un estante listo en el medio.\r\ndel horno. Unte con mantequilla un molde para pan grande (de unos 20 cm\r\nde largo, medido desde el borde superior), luego corte\r\nuna tira de papel para hornear unos centímetros más larga\r\nque la longitud total de la base y los dos\r\nlados más cortos. Presiónelo en la lata. (Cuando tu\r\nYa está listo el pastel, puedes usar las “alas” de papel.\r\nen cada extremo para ayudar a levantarlo).","Poner la mantequilla y el chocolate en un recipiente grande.\r\ncacerola y calentar muy suavemente hasta que se derrita,\r\nrevolviendo de vez en cuando. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos, luego\r\nuse un batidor para mezclar el yogur y la vainilla,\r\nluego los huevos y una pizca de sal.","Mezclar la harina, el azúcar y el bicarbonato de sodio.\r\nen un tazón grande, aplastando los grumos grandes de\r\nazúcar con los dedos, luego agregue el\r\nMezcle el chocolate en la cacerola hasta que quede uniforme. verter\r\no vierta en el molde, luego hornee por 45 minutos\r\nhasta que suba y brille (y probablemente con un bonito\r\ngrieta a lo largo). Pruebe si está listo para\r\nMetiendo una brocheta en el medio del pastel.\r\n(ver consejo a continuación). Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos y luego\r\ndesmoldar y dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla.","Poner la nata en un cazo pequeño, llevar\r\nhasta que hierva, luego agrega la mantequilla y la mitad de la\r\nchocolate picado. Quitar el fuego y\r\ndejar que se derrita. Revuelva hasta que quede suave y brillante,\r\nluego vierta sobre el pastel. Dispersarse con el\r\nresto del chocolate picado y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13143,9101,'es','Bizcocho de naranja y chocolate blanco','Un pastel deslumbrante que rápidamente se convertirá en una opción segura para cualquier evento.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura fina de 4 naranjas y zumo de 1","4 huevos, separados","100 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de almendras molidas","200 gramos de chocolate blanco","200 ml de crema fresca","100g de chocolate blanco, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Mantequilla\r\ndos moldes para sándwich redondos de 20 cm y forrar\r\nbases con papel para hornear. inclina el azúcar\r\nen un tazón y agregue la mezcla ablandada\r\nmantequilla y ralladura de naranja. Batir durante 1 min o\r\nasí hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso, luego agregue el huevo\r\nyemas. Tamizar la harina y el polvo para hornear\r\nla mezcla del pastel e incorporar ligeramente. Finalmente,\r\nagregue las almendras y el jugo de naranja. batir\r\nlas claras hasta que mantengan su punto\r\nforma. Incorporar un tercio de la clara de huevo\r\nla mezcla para pastel, usando el batidor. Repita con\r\notro tercio, luego el último tercio. cuidate\r\nNo mezclar demasiado o perderás la ligereza.\r\nde las claras de huevo.","Divida la mezcla para pastel entre lo preparado\r\nlatas y hornee por 30-35 minutos. Enfriar en la lata\r\ndurante 5 minutos, luego colóquelo sobre una rejilla,\r\nRetirar el papel de revestimiento y dejar enfriar.","Para hacer el glaseado, derrita el chocolate\r\nuna cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo o en el\r\nCocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 1½ minutos, revolviendo.\r\ncada 30 segundos y luego dejar enfriar. batir el\r\ncrème fraîche hasta que espese, luego agregue la\r\nchocolate blanco. Coloque un pastel en una porción\r\nsoporte para platos o pasteles. Vierta la mitad del glaseado sobre\r\nel pastel y cubra con el otro pastel. difundir\r\ncon el resto del glaseado, luego dejar reposar\r\nen el frigorífico durante al menos 1 h.","Si quieres hacer los rizos decorativos,\r\nderretir el chocolate en un bol a fuego lento\r\nagua o en el microondas y esparcir finamente\r\nsobre una bandeja para hornear. Deja la bandeja en la nevera.\r\npara que el chocolate se endurezca un poco, luego usar\r\nuna rodaja de pescado o una hoja de cuchillo en ángulo para raspar\r\nrizos de chocolate. Apila los rizos en el medio.\r\ndel bizcocho y servir cortado en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:56:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13144,9102,'es','Pastel de chocolate definitivo','Deléitese con esta receta definitiva de pastel de chocolate que es maravillosamente jugosa, rica y esponjosa. Perfecto para una celebración o un té por la tarde.','["200 g de chocolate negro de buena calidad, aproximadamente un 60 % de sólidos de cacao","200 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de café instantáneo en gránulos","85 g de harina con levadura","85 g de harina común","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","200 g de azúcar mascabado light","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","25 g de cacao en polvo","3 huevos medianos","75 ml de suero de leche (5 cucharadas)","chocolate rallado o rulos, para decorar","200 g de chocolate negro de buena calidad, como el anterior","Caja de 284 ml de crema doble (tipo verter)","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada"]','["Unte con mantequilla un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm (7,5 cm\r\nde profundidad) y forrar la base. Precalentar el\r\nhorno a ventilador 140C/convencional 160C/\r\ngas 3. Romper 200 g de chocolate negro de buena calidad en trozos\r\nuna sartén mediana de base pesada. Corte 200 g de mantequilla en trozos y vierta con el chocolate, luego mezcle 1 cucharada de café instantáneo granulado en 125 ml de agua fría y vierta en el\r\nsartén. Calentar a fuego lento apenas\r\nhasta que todo se derrita – no sobrecalentar.\r\nO derrita en el microondas a temperatura media durante\r\nunos 5 minutos, revolviendo a la mitad.","Mientras el chocolate se derrite, mezcle 85 g de harina con levadura, 85 g de harina común, ¼ de bicarbonato de sodio,\r\n200 g de azúcar moscovado claro, 200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado y 25 g de cacao en polvo en un bol grande,\r\nmezclar con las manos para eliminar\r\ncualquier grumo. Batir 3 huevos medianos en un bol.\r\ny agregue 75 ml (5 cucharadas) de suero de leche.","Ahora vierte el chocolate derretido.\r\nmezcla y la mezcla de huevo en la harina\r\nmezcla, revolviendo hasta que todo esté\r\nbien mezclado y tienes una suave,\r\nconsistencia bastante líquida. Vierta esto en\r\nel molde y hornear durante 1 hora 25-\r\n1 hora 30 minutos – si empujas un\r\nbrocheta en el centro debe\r\nsale limpio y la parte superior\r\ndebe sentirse firme (no se preocupe si se agrieta\r\npoco). Dejar enfriar en el molde (no te preocupes si\r\nse hunde ligeramente), luego voltee sobre un alambre\r\nrejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Cuando el bizcocho esté frío, córtalo horizontalmente.\r\nen tres. Hacer la ganache: picar 200 g de color oscuro de buena calidad.\r\nchocolate en trozos pequeños y volcarlo en un\r\ncuenco. Vierta un cartón de 284 ml de nata doble en una cacerola, agregue 2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada y caliente hasta que esté a punto de hervir.\r\nRetirar del fuego y verterlo sobre el\r\nchocolate. Remueve hasta que el chocolate tenga\r\nderretido y la mezcla queda suave.","Sandwich las capas juntas con solo\r\nun poco de ganache. Vierta el resto\r\nel bizcocho dejándolo caer por los lados y\r\nalisar hasta cubrir con una espátula.\r\nDecorar con chocolate rallado o un montón de \r\nrizos de chocolate. El pastel se mantiene húmedo y \r\npegajoso durante 3-4 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13145,9103,'es','Tarta de chocolate y calabacín','El calabacín rallado le da a este pastel una deliciosa textura húmeda: una excelente manera de aprovechar el exceso de tu jardín.','["350 g de harina con levadura","50 g de cacao en polvo","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","175 ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","375 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","500 ml de calabacines rallados (medir por volumen en una jarra medidora, pero son aproximadamente 2 calabacines medianos; si usa 1 demasiado grande, pélelo primero y quítele las semillas)","140 g de avellanas tostadas, picadas en trozos grandes","200 g de chocolate amargo, picado","100ml de nata doble"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEn un tazón grande, combine la harina, el cacao.\r\npolvo, mezcla de especias y 1 cucharadita de sal. en\r\nEn otro bol, combine el aceite de oliva,\r\nazúcar, huevos, esencia de vainilla y rallado\r\ncalabacín. Mezclar la mezcla seca y húmeda.\r\nhasta que esté combinado, luego doble el\r\navellanas tostadas. Forrar una tarta de 24 cm.\r\nenlatar con papel vegetal y luego verter\r\ntu mezcla. Hornee durante unos 40-50 minutos,\r\no hasta que se inserte un cuchillo en el medio\r\nsale limpio. Dejar enfriar en la lata durante\r\n10 minutos, luego volcar sobre un alambre.\r\nrejilla y dejar enfriar.","Para hacer el glaseado, coloca el chocolate.\r\nen un bol y llevar a ebullición la nata\r\nuna cacerola. Vierta la nata caliente por encima\r\nel chocolate y revolver hasta que esté completamente\r\nsuave y derretida. Deja el glaseado\r\nenfriar un poco y espesar, luego esparcir\r\ncolóquelo sobre el pastel para que quede cubierto y\r\nel glaseado comienza a gotear por los lados.\r\nSirva con una taza de té o disfrútelo como pudín.\r\ncon una cucharada de algo cremoso."]','2026-01-11 12:56:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13146,9104,'es','Pastel de chocolate realmente rico','Oscuro, rico y delicioso: el postre perfecto','["100 g de mantequilla cortada en cubitos y un poco más para engrasar","harina, para espolvorear","140 g de chocolate negro de la mejor calidad, con 70% de sólidos de cacao, partido en trozos","6 huevos grandes, separados","140 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharada de kirsch o Cointreau (opcional)","pizca de sal","85 g de azúcar en polvo","cacao en polvo y crème fraîche, para servir"]','["Precalentar el horno a 170C/Gas 3/horno ventilado 150C. Engrase un molde desmontable de 23 cm y cubra la base con papel vegetal o papel vegetal. Espolvorea los lados con un poco de harina. Coloque el chocolate y la mantequilla en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento. Calienta hasta que se derrita, luego retira el tazón de la sartén y revuelve hasta que quede suave. Dejar enfriar un poco durante unos 5 minutos.","Agregue las yemas de huevo, las almendras molidas y el licor, si lo usa. Pon las claras en un bol grande, añade una pizca de sal y bate hasta que se formen picos suaves. Continúe batiendo, espolvoreando el azúcar poco a poco, hasta que se formen picos rígidos. Agrega 2 cucharadas de claras a la mezcla de chocolate, luego incorpora con cuidado el resto hasta que no quede nada.\r\nQuedan rastros de blanco.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que haya subido bien y esté firme al tacto. Déjalo enfriar en el molde (no te preocupes si el pastel se hunde y se agrieta un poco, seguirá estando bien). Puedes preparar el pastel hasta esta etapa con hasta cuatro días de anticipación y guardarlo en un recipiente hermético en un lugar fresco. También se congela bien hasta por un mes.","Para servir, retiramos el bizcocho del molde y retiramos el papel de revestimiento. Tamiza generosamente el cacao en polvo por encima y córtalo en rodajas. Sirva con crema fresca."]','2026-01-11 12:56:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13147,9105,'es','Tarta de remolacha y chocolate','La remolacha es realmente muy dulce y mantiene esta rica barra de chocolate maravillosamente húmeda.','["1 remolacha grande cocida, de unos 175 g de peso, picada en trozos grandes","200 g de harina común","100 g de cacao en polvo","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","200 ml de aceite de girasol","100 g de chocolate negro (no demasiado amargo), picado en trozos","crème fraîche o crema cuajada, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5.  \r\nColoca la remolacha en un procesador de alimentos y tritura.  \r\nhasta que esté picado. Añadimos una pizca de sal y la \r\nresto de ingredientes, excepto el aceite y \r\nchocolate. Cuando esté completamente mezclado (usted  \r\nEs posible que sea necesario raspar los lados hacia abajo una vez. \r\no dos veces), agregue el aceite en un chorro constante, \r\ncomo si estuvieras haciendo mayonesa.","Cuando se haya agregado todo el aceite, agregue  \r\nel chocolate, luego vierta la mezcla en un recipiente forrado \r\nMolde para pan de 900g. Cocine durante 1 hora hasta que se inserte \r\nLa brocheta sale prácticamente limpia. salir \r\nel pan para que se enfríe sobre una rejilla. Servir en rodajas  \r\ncon la crème fraîche o nata cuajada."]','2026-01-11 12:56:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13148,9106,'es','Pastel de mármol de chocolate','El pastel de mármol es un recuerdo culinario clásico de la infancia. Ya sea usando colores llamativos para un acabado psicodélico o simplemente chocolate y vainilla, es un placer a la hora del té.','["225 g de mantequilla, blanda","225 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos","225 g de harina con levadura","3 cucharadas de leche","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/gas 160C/gas 4. Engrasar un molde para pasteles de 20 cm y forrar el fondo con un círculo de papel vegetal. Si quieres hacer la vida más fácil, simplemente pon todos los ingredientes (excepto el cacao en polvo) en un procesador de alimentos y bate durante 1-2 minutos hasta que quede suave. Si prefieres mezclar a mano, bate la mantequilla y el azúcar, luego agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, mezclando bien después de cada adición. Incorpora la harina, la leche y el extracto de vainilla hasta que la mezcla esté suave.","Divida la mezcla entre 2 tazones. Agrega el cacao en polvo a la mezcla en uno de los tazones. Tome 2 cucharas y úselas para verter alternativamente las mezclas para pastel de chocolate y vainilla en el molde. Cuando se haya agotado toda la mezcla (y si los niños pequeños hacen esto, deberá asegurarse de que la base de la lata esté cubierta de manera bastante uniforme), golpee el fondo de la superficie de trabajo para asegurarse de que no queden burbujas de aire. Tome una brocheta y gírela alrededor de la mezcla en la lata unas cuantas veces para crear un efecto veteado.","Hornea el bizcocho durante 45-55 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Colocar sobre una rejilla para enfriar y dejar enfriar. Se conservará durante 3 días en un recipiente hermético o se congelará hasta por 3 meses."]','2026-01-11 12:56:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13149,5235,'es','Pastel de chocolate y pera sin harina','Un pastel ligero pero delicioso hecho con avellanas: sirva una porción de postre con una cucharada de crema fresca.','["85 g de mantequilla, más 1 cucharada extra para lata","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorada, más un extra para lata","85 g de chocolate negro sin gluten, partido en trozos","1 cucharada de brandy","3 huevos, separados","85 g de avellanas tostadas y molidas en un robot de cocina","4 peras muy maduras, peladas, partidas por la mitad y sin corazón","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Corta un círculo de papel para hornear que se ajuste a la\r\nbase de una lata de fondo suelto de 25 cm. derretir\r\n1 cucharada de mantequilla y untar el interior del molde,\r\nluego forrar la base con el pergamino y\r\ncepille nuevamente con más mantequilla. Cuchara\r\n2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo, revuélvalas para cubrir\r\nla base y los lados, luego incline el exceso.","Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Derretir el\r\nchocolate y mantequilla en un bol sobre una cacerola de\r\nagua caliente, retirar del fuego, agregar el\r\nbrandy y dejar enfriar. Batir las yemas de huevo\r\ncon el azúcar en un bol grande hasta que esté pálido y\r\ngrueso; incorporar el chocolate con las avellanas.","En un recipiente aparte, con un batidor limpio,\r\nbatir las claras hasta que alcancen un pico suave\r\n(intenta no batirlos demasiado fuerte o tendrás\r\nproblemas para doblarlos). Revuelva una cucharada de\r\nlas claras a la mezcla de chocolate,\r\nluego dobla con cuidado el resto de ellos.\r\nen 2 adiciones. Vierta en lo preparado\r\nestaño. Nivele, luego coloque las peras sobre el\r\nmezcla, con el lado cortado hacia abajo. Hornear por 40 minutos\r\nhasta que las peras estén blandas y el bizcocho\r\ncocido por completo. dejar enfriar\r\nligeramente en la lata antes de soltarla, luego\r\ncolóquelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. polvo con\r\nazúcar glas y servir con crème fraîche."]','2026-01-11 12:56:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13150,9107,'es','Tarta doble de chocolate','El chocolate y el pastel son dos de nuestras cosas favoritas, entonces, ¿qué es lo que no me encanta de este delicioso pastel?','["175 g de mantequilla blanda, más algo extra para engrasar","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos","140 g de harina con levadura","85 g de almendras molidas","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100ml de leche","4 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","50 g de chispas o trozos de chocolate natural","unos trozos extra de chocolate blanco, natural y con leche, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase y forre un molde para pan de 900 g/2 lb con\r\nuna tira larga de papel para hornear. a\r\nhacer la masa del bizcocho, batir la mantequilla\r\ny el azúcar con unas varillas eléctricas hasta\r\nligero y esponjoso. Batir los huevos, la harina,\r\nalmendras, levadura en polvo, leche y cacao\r\nhasta que quede suave. Agregue las chispas de chocolate,\r\nluego raspar en la lata. Hornee por 45-50\r\nminutos hasta que esté dorado, levado y una brocheta\r\npinchado en el centro sale limpio.","Déjelo enfriar en la lata y luego sáquelo sobre un alambre.\r\nrejilla sobre un poco de papel de cocina. Derretir el\r\ntrozos de chocolate adicionales por separado en\r\ncacerolas sobre agua apenas hirviendo, o\r\nen tazones en el microondas, luego use un\r\ncuchara para rociar cada uno por turno sobre el\r\npastel. Dejar reposar antes de cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:56:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13151,9108,'es','Pastel de chocolate y caramelo','Este rico pastel es una impresionante pieza central para cualquier fiesta de té de verano.','["300 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para engrasar","300 g de azúcar mascabado light","3 huevos grandes","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","85 g de cacao en polvo","225 g de harina común","225 ml de nata agria","Bote de 300ml de nata doble","5 tbsp dulce de leche or caramel sauce","25 g de chocolate con sabor a caramelo, finamente picado (nosotros usamos Lindt)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase ligeramente 2 x 23 cm de fondo suelto\r\nmoldes para pasteles y forre con un círculo de hornear\r\npergamino. Batir la mantequilla y\r\nazúcar hasta que esté pálida y cremosa. Añade el\r\nhuevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien entre\r\ncada adición, luego agregue la cocción\r\npolvo, cacao y un tercio de la harina.\r\nMezcle bien para combinar, luego agregue la mitad de la\r\ncrema agria. Alternando entre\r\nagregando la harina y la crema agria, mezcle\r\ntodo hasta que esté combinado. Cuchara\r\nen las latas preparadas, luego alise\r\nla superficie con una cuchara.","Hornee por 30 minutos o hasta que los pasteles estén\r\nfirme al tacto y con una brocheta insertada en\r\nlos centros sale limpio. dejar para\r\ndejar enfriar en las latas durante 5 minutos, luego desmoldar\r\nsobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo.","Cuando esté listo para servir, bata el\r\ncrema doble con 2 cdas de dulce de leche\r\nhasta que se formen picos suaves. Coloque 1 pastel en un\r\nplato para servir y untar con la mitad del\r\ncrema, luego rocíe sobre el resto\r\nDulce de leche. Cubra con el otro pastel,\r\nluego esparce el resto de la nata encima.\r\nEspolvorea con el chocolate. Enfriar hasta\r\nlisto para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13152,9109,'es','Galletas con huella digital de mantequilla de maní y reno','Hornee un lote de estas dulces galletas de reno en Nochebuena para dejarlas para Santa. ¡A los niños les encantará ayudar y agregar la nariz roja y confitada de Rudolph!','["100 g de mantequilla de maní suave","2 huevos","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","225 g de harina común","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ tarro de mermelada de frambuesa o fresa sin semillas","22 pretzels pequeños","22 pares de adornos para ojos comestibles.","bolígrafo de glaseado blanco o mezclar un poco de azúcar glas con una gota de agua"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Mezcle la mantequilla de maní, los huevos, el azúcar, la vainilla, la harina, el polvo para hornear y una pizca de sal en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener una masa suave y con grumos.","Enrolle la masa en bolas del tamaño de una nuez y colóquelas en las bandejas. Empuje un pulgar en el centro de cada uno para hacer una marca y llene cada uno con ½ cucharadita de mermelada para las narices.","Corta los pretzels por la mitad y empújalos hacia la parte superior de las galletas para crear \"astas\". Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que se vean secos. Dejar enfriar en las bandejas. Decorar con los ojos, pegándolos con el glaseado. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13153,9452,'es','galletas de jengibre','Levanta los pies y disfruta de estas galletas de jengibre especiadas con una bebida caliente: están hechas con clavo, jengibre, canela y melaza oscura.','["1 barra más 1 cucharada de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada","1½ cucharada de melaza oscura","1⅓ tazas de azúcar moreno suave","½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","1 huevo","1¾ tazas más 1 cucharada de harina para todo uso","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","¼ cucharadita de clavo molido","1½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","½ cucharadita de canela molida","¼ taza de azúcar granulada"]','["Batir la mantequilla, la melaza, el azúcar moreno y la sal en un tazón grande. Agrega el huevo, luego bate todos los ingredientes secos restantes, excepto el azúcar. Refrigere por 1 hora.","Calienta el horno a 400F/gas 6. Forra dos bandejas para galletas con papel pergamino. Extienda la masa para galletas en 20 bolas del mismo tamaño (si lo desea, pese para mayor precisión). Vierta el azúcar en un plato pequeño y luego enrolle cada bola para cubrirla. Coloque cada bola en las bandejas para hornear galletas y luego hornee durante 9 a 10 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla para enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:56:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13154,9110,'es','Galletas tahini con chispas de chocolate saladas','Tienen un sabor dulce y salado con bordes crujientes perfectos y un centro masticable: se convertirán en tu receta de galletas preferida.','["120 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","120 g de tahini, bien revuelto","90 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","110 g de azúcar moreno claro y suave","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","1 huevo de corral Morrisons The Best White Golden Yelk, más una yema (guarda la clara para otra receta)","175 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","100 g de chocolate con leche, picado en trozos grandes","125 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo blanco","3 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo negro"]','["En un tazón grande o en el tazón de una batidora de pie, ponga la mantequilla salada, el tahini, el azúcar en polvo dorado, el azúcar moreno suave, la pasta de vainilla y una pizca de sal. Batir con batidoras eléctricas hasta que quede esponjoso, aproximadamente de 5 a 6 minutos.","Rompe el huevo de gallinas camperas Morrisons The Best White Golden Yolk y agrega la yema extra, luego bate para combinar, aproximadamente 2 minutos. Tamice sobre la harina y el bicarbonato, mezcle suavemente hasta que estén combinados, luego mezcle ambos chocolates. Enfriar la masa en el frigorífico durante al menos dos horas.","Calienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Usa una bola para helado o galletas para medir 12 bolas de masa, aproximadamente 65 g cada una. Vierte las semillas de sésamo en un recipiente poco profundo y mézclalas suavemente. Enrolle cada bola de masa para galletas en las semillas de sésamo. Colóquelos en dos bandejas para hornear grandes forradas y bien espaciadas para que se esparzan.","Hornear durante 13-15 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente dorados, luego retirar del horno y darle un buen golpe a la bandeja por el lado de la cocina. Esto ayuda a crear una textura crujiente y masticable. Dejar enfriar completamente en la bandeja antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13155,9111,'es','Galletas de chocolate heladas','Mantenga un lote de bolas de masa para galletas crudas en el congelador listas para freír al aire para invitados inesperados durante Navidad. Son ideales para la lata de galletas festiva.','["2 huevos","175 g de azúcar en polvo","75 g de mantequilla salada, derretida","150 g de harina con levadura","50 g de cacao en polvo","65 g de chispas de chocolate con leche","50 g de azúcar glas"]','["Batir los huevos y el azúcar con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que estén espesos y voluminosos. Incorpora la mantequilla derretida. Tamiza la harina y el cacao en polvo, agrega las chispas de chocolate y mezcla para combinar. Cubra y enfríe durante 1 hora. La masa se mantendrá fría en un recipiente hermético hasta por una semana.","Calienta la freidora a 170 ° C y coloca un cuadrado de papel para hornear en la canasta. Forme bolas con cucharaditas colmadas de la mezcla. Si las cocina inmediatamente, pase las bolas por el azúcar glas hasta que estén bien cubiertas. Colóquelos sobre el pergamino, dejando suficiente espacio para que se extiendan. Las bolas de galleta sin espolvorear se pueden congelar hasta por dos meses.","Freír al aire en tandas durante 8 a 10 minutos (o 10 a 12 minutos si están congelados), luego dejar enfriar y endurecer durante unos minutos antes de transferirlos con cuidado a una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo. Se conservará en lata durante cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13156,9112,'es','Galletas pegajosas de s''mores','Combine galletas con s''mores, una delicia estadounidense que consiste en chocolate, malvaviscos y galletas saladas.','["150 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","160 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","1 huevo, batido","225 g de harina común","5 malvaviscos grandes, cortados por la mitad en forma transversal","10 cuadritos de chocolate (unos 100g)","20 galletas saladas"]','["Vierta la mantequilla en un tazón grande y agregue el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave y esponjosa. Agrega la vainilla, el extracto de almendras y el huevo y bate hasta que se combinen y espese.","Tamizar la harina y mezclar hasta formar una masa. Divida la masa en 10 trozos de unos 55 g cada uno, luego forme bolitas (humedezca ligeramente las manos para evitar que se peguen, si es necesario). Aplana suavemente cada bola de masa entre tus palmas, luego coloca la mitad de un malvavisco y un trozo de chocolate en el medio, y levanta la masa para encerrar los rellenos, asegurándote de que estén completamente cubiertos. Presione suavemente una galleta en la base y la parte superior de cada bola de masa rellena. Poner en el frigorífico para que se enfríe durante 1 hora para que se endurezcan un poco antes de hornear.","Unos 10 minutos antes de que quieras hornear, retíralo del refrigerador. Calienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 3 y forra dos bandejas para hornear grandes con papel para hornear. Disponemos las bolitas de masa en las bandejas, bien espaciadas (nosotros ponemos cinco en cada bandeja). Hornee durante 15 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar un poco en las bandejas antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13157,9113,'es','galletas de canela','Deje algunas de estas galletas condimentadas con canela para Papá Noel en Nochebuena. Perfecto para la lata de galletas festiva, también puedes agregar algunas pasas.','["120 g de mantequilla salada blanda","50 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 cucharaditas de canela molida","1 huevo, ligeramente batido","220 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de pasas (opcional)","1 cucharada de azúcar glas"]','["Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar moscovado, el azúcar en polvo y 2 cucharaditas de canela junto con un batidor eléctrico durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén bien combinados. Agrega el huevo, la harina, el polvo para hornear y las pasas, si las usas, y continúa batiendo hasta que la mezcla se convierta en una masa uniforme. Enrolle cucharadas de masa en bolas entre las palmas de las manos (debe tener 12-15). Enfriar en el frigorífico durante al menos 2 horas hasta que esté firme, o toda la noche. Las bolas de masa sin hornear se mantendrán en un recipiente hermético en el congelador hasta por tres meses (consulte el consejo a continuación).","Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre dos bandejas para hornear grandes con papel para hornear. Coloque las bolas de masa a una distancia de 3-4 cm en las bandejas para hornear preparadas para permitir que la mezcla se extienda sin tocarse. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado en los bordes pero aún suave y pegajoso en el centro. Dejar enfriar completamente en las bandejas para horno.","Mezcle el azúcar glas con la canela restante y luego espolvoree sobre las galletas. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13158,9114,'es','galletas de mantequilla','Estas galletas de seis ingredientes son maravillosamente mantecosas. Sumérgelos en chocolate y agrega un poco de brillantina comestible para darle brillo si lo deseas.','["165 g de mantequilla","100 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de ralladura de limón","250 g de harina común","1 cucharada de leche","100 g de chocolate negro, chocolate con leche o chocolate blanco"]','["Batir la mantequilla con el azúcar glas, una pizca de sal y la ralladura de limón hasta obtener una mezcla suave.","Tamizar la harina y añadir la leche, mezclar hasta formar una masa y luego amasar brevemente. Envuelva y enfríe durante 1-2 horas.","Calienta el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Forra 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada hasta 2 mm y corte diferentes formas. Coloca las galletas en las bandejas para hornear, agrupando todas las del mismo tamaño. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté dorado, luego enfríe por completo.","Derrita el chocolate en el microondas o en un recipiente colocado sobre agua hirviendo. Sumerja un lado de cada galleta en el chocolate y déjela enfriar y cuajar."]','2026-01-11 12:56:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13159,9115,'es','galletas sin azucar','Estas sencillas galletas de mantequilla están hechas con sirope de agave como una inteligente alternativa al azúcar. Prepare un lote en solo 25 minutos con solo cinco ingredientes','["150 g de harina común","80 g de mantequilla","3 cucharadas de sirope de agave","2 yemas de huevo","1 vaina de vainilla"]','["Batir la harina, la mantequilla, el sirope de agave, las yemas de huevo, las semillas de la vaina de vainilla y una pizca de sal en una batidora de pie hasta obtener una masa suave. Envuelva la masa y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Extiende la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y corta 36 galletas con un cortapastas.","Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Cubra 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Levante las galletas sobre las bandejas para hornear y hornee durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Deje que se enfríe por completo. Guárdelo en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:56:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13160,4020,'es','galletas de azucar','Decora nuestras galletas de azúcar mantecosas y que se derriten en la boca con glaseado y chispas para obtener galletas festivas muy especiales. Hacen preciosos regalos de Navidad.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada","100 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","25 g de harina de maíz","250 g de harina común"]','["Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica durante 4 minutos hasta que esté suave y esponjosa. Batir los huevos, uno a la vez, luego agregar la vainilla. Agregue la harina de maíz y la harina común hasta que la mezcla forme una masa. Coloque la masa entre dos trozos de papel para hornear y extiéndala hasta obtener un grosor de 6 mm con un rodillo. Enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Quita la capa superior de pergamino de la masa y corta círculos con un cortador redondo de 6 cm (o la forma que prefieras). Vuelva a enrollar los restos y continúe cortando rondas hasta que se use toda la masa. Transfiera las galletas a una segunda bandeja para hornear grande forrada con papel para hornear, separándolas a 2 cm de distancia (es posible que necesite dos hojas). Hornee durante 7-10 minutos. Deje enfriar en la bandeja durante 15 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:56:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13161,4082,'es','Galletas de globo de nieve','Haz estas bolas de nieve comestibles como bonitas decoraciones para tu árbol de Navidad: ¡tus luces navideñas brillarán en el centro, haciéndolas lucir mágicas!','["175 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de mantequilla fría, en cubos","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharada de leche","aceite vegetal, para el pergamino","30 (aproximadamente 160 g) de mentas glaciares u otros dulces hervidos claros con sabor a menta","200 g de azúcar glas real","6 cucharadas de chispas"]','["Mezcle la harina, la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo en un procesador de alimentos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Agregue la vainilla y la leche y presione hasta obtener migajas más grandes. Amasar brevemente sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar una bola suave, luego envolver y enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos. Forre dos bandejas para hornear grandes con papel para hornear y luego engrase ligeramente el papel.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas. 4. Extienda la masa fría sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de £1. Selle círculos con un cortador de 8 cm y luego corte agujeros en el centro con un cortador de 5 cm. Haz pequeños agujeros en la parte superior de las galletas usando la punta de una boquilla redonda o una pajita; aquí es donde enhebrarás la cinta para colgar. Vuelva a enrollar los restos y continúe sacando galletas hasta que se use toda la masa; necesitará una cantidad uniforme, ya que tendrá que intercalar las galletas (debe obtener unas 20). Transfiera con cuidado a las hojas preparadas.","Hornee durante 6 minutos hasta que los bordes estén dorados. Mientras tanto, coloque las mentas o los dulces en un procesador de alimentos o en un mortero y tritúrelos o tritúrelos hasta que estén finamente desmenuzados. Después de 6 minutos, retire las galletas del horno y vierta las mentas trituradas en los centros recortados (use aproximadamente 1 cucharadita colmada por galleta). Hornee por 5 minutos más hasta que las mentas se hayan derretido, pero no hayan comenzado a tomar color (se dorarán si se dejan demasiado tiempo). Los medios se verán burbujeantes, pero se asentarán a medida que se enfríen. Si las mentas derretidas no han llegado a los bordes, use una brocheta de metal para mover con cuidado los centros derretidos hacia los lados. Deje que las hojas se endurezcan, luego transfiéralas a una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo.","Para hacer el glaseado, mezcle el azúcar glas con 5-6 cucharaditas de agua hasta obtener un glaseado espeso y que se pueda pipetear. Vierta en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla redonda pequeña. Decore la base de las galletas (las mentas derretidas quedarán al ras de la base, por lo que esto dejará más espacio para las chispas) inundándolas con glaseado o colocando patrones o copos de nieve. Dejar secar por completo, guardando el glaseado sobrante en la manga pastelera.","Una vez que las galletas estén secas, voltea una con cuidado sobre un paño de cocina limpio para no dañar el glaseado. Coloque un poco del glaseado reservado alrededor de la galleta, teniendo cuidado de no acercarse demasiado al centro o a los bordes; el glaseado se esparcirá cuando coloque las galletas juntas. Vierta una cucharadita de chispas en el centro transparente, asegurándose de no tocar el glaseado, luego haga un sándwich con otra galleta, haciendo coincidir los agujeros de la cinta. Deje secar completamente antes de agitar, ya que las chispas se pegarán al glaseado húmedo. Repita con el resto de las galletas, el glaseado y las chispas. Pase cintas por los agujeros y cuélguelas como decoración, o guárdelas en un recipiente hermético hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:56:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13162,4143,'es','Galletas de desayuno de frambuesa, almendras y avena','Tome algunas de estas galletas que aumentan la energía para un desayuno rápido u ofrézcalas como refrigerios para reducir el hambre antes de la cena. Disfruta con yogur y fruta.','["2 plátanos maduros, triturados","150 g de gachas de avena","2 cucharadas de almendras molidas","1⁄2 cucharadita de canela","100 g de frambuesas (frescas o congeladas)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Mezclar en un bol el plátano, la avena, las almendras, la canela y una pizca de sal hasta formar una masa pegajosa. Revuelva suavemente las frambuesas, tratando de no romperlas. Tome cucharadas de la mezcla y forme bolitas, luego colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear y aplánelas con la mano.","Hornee durante 15 minutos hasta que las galletas se sientan firmes en los bordes y doradas. Dejar enfriar. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13163,9116,'es','Galletas de miel caramelizada y tahini','Usa ese frasco de pasta de sésamo que tienes en el fondo de tu alacena para hornear estas exquisitas galletas de miel y tahini. Son dulces, salados y totalmente adictivos.','["150 g de miel","150 g de mantequilla salada, en cubitos","75 g de azúcar moreno blando","75 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de tahini","1 huevo grande, más 1 yema grande","250 g de harina común","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo blanco y negro mezcladas"]','["Hierva la miel en una cacerola pequeña a fuego medio-alto. Hervir durante 5 minutos hasta que se oscurezca y huela a nuez; no te preocupes si se ve bastante oscuro, esto le dará sabor. Batir brevemente, luego retirar del fuego y agregar con cuidado la mantequilla hasta que se derrita. Pasar a un recipiente resistente al calor y dejar enfriar.","Vierta los azúcares, el tahini, el huevo y la yema en el tazón con la mezcla de miel, luego bata para combinar. En un recipiente aparte, mezcle la harina y el bicarbonato, luego vierta gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos en los secos y mezcle hasta formar una masa. Enfríe durante 3 horas o durante la noche.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Enrolle la masa en 18 bolas iguales (péselas para mayor precisión, si lo desea; deben pesar alrededor de 45 g cada una) y colóquelas en las bandejas con una separación de 5 cm. Presione suavemente con el dorso de una cuchara para aplanar ligeramente la parte superior, luego espolvoree sobre las hojuelas de sal marina y las semillas de sésamo y hornee durante 10 a 12 minutos.","Golpee la bandeja sobre una superficie de trabajo para aplanar ligeramente las galletas. Deje enfriar en las bandejas durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13164,9117,'es','Galletas masticables con chispas de chocolate','Disfrute de estas galletas masticables con chispas de chocolate con una taza de té. Si tienes tiempo, deja la masa durante la noche para obtener el mejor sabor y textura.','["150 g de mantequilla blanda","150 g de azúcar moreno blando, azúcar en polvo dorado o, idealmente, la mitad de cada uno","1 huevo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","180-200 g de harina común (consulte el consejo a continuación)","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de chispas de chocolate o chocolate picado"]','["Mezcle la mantequilla y el azúcar con un batidor eléctrico o manual hasta que esté muy suave y esponjoso, luego agregue el huevo y la vainilla. Incorpora la harina, el polvo para hornear, el chocolate y ¼ de cucharadita de sal lo más rápido que puedas. No trabajes demasiado la masa ya que esto endurecerá las galletas.","Para obtener el mejor sabor, deje la mezcla durante la noche: cubra el recipiente y enfríe, o forme bolas con la mezcla y enfríe.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forra dos bandejas para hornear con pergamino. Divide la mezcla en bolitas, cuanto más rugosas sean las bolitas, más ásperas se verán las galletas. Si quieres darle más textura a la masa, parte las bolas por la mitad y vuelve a juntarlas ligeramente. Distribuya uniformemente en las bandejas para hornear, dejando suficiente espacio entre cada una para permitir que se extienda.","Hornee las galletas frescas durante 8 a 10 minutos y las frías durante 10 a 12 minutos, o hasta que estén doradas y un poco crujientes en los bordes pero aún muy suaves en el medio; se endurecerán un poco a medida que se enfríen. Deje enfriar en la bandeja durante unos minutos antes de comer caliente, o transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se conservará durante tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:56:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13165,9118,'es','Galletas de mantequilla bañadas dos veces','¿Qué podría ser mejor que las galletas de mantequilla? ¡Galletas bañadas doblemente en chocolate con leche y blanco! Seguramente arrasarán con familiares y amigos.','["200 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","100 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de harina común","1 cucharada de leche, más extra si es necesario","50 g de chocolate blanco, picado","50 g de chocolate con leche, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Batir la mantequilla con el azúcar glas con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que la mezcla esté ligera y esponjosa. Agregue la vainilla y la harina (la mezcla se endurecerá y parecerá desmoronarse a medida que se agrega la harina). Agrega la leche y sigue batiendo hasta que la mezcla se ablande y se pegue (agrega un poco más de leche si es necesario).","Coloque la masa en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella grande y coloque los anillos en forma de remolino en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Si la mezcla está demasiado dura para verterla fácilmente, puedes enrollar la masa en bolas y ponerlas en la bandeja. Las galletas se esparcirán mientras se cocinan, así que no se preocupe si queda un pequeño espacio en el centro de los remolinos, pero asegúrese de que haya suficiente espacio entre cada galleta para que no se peguen mientras se cocinan. Hornee durante 15 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente dorado, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe.","Coloque el chocolate blanco y el chocolate con leche en tazones separados y cocine en el microondas cada uno en ráfagas de 20 segundos hasta que se derrita. Sumerja las galletas en cada chocolate, leche en un extremo y blanco en el otro, luego deje que escurra el exceso antes de devolverlas a la rejilla para que cuajen. Se mantendrá en una lata hermética hasta por cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13166,9119,'es','Sándwiches de galletas de avellanas y chocolate','¿Cómo se hacen aún mejores las galletas con chispas de chocolate? ¡Rellénalas con chocolate! Estos sándwiches de galletas de chocolate y avellanas son el máximo placer','["120 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","1 huevo mediano, ligeramente batido","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina común","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","100 g de chocolate con leche, picado en trozos grandes","70 g de avellanas sin piel, picadas y tostadas","120 g de crema de chocolate y avellanas"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4. Forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear y reserva.","Batir la mantequilla con ambos azúcares en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica, luego agregar la sal, el huevo y la vainilla. Agrega la harina, el bicarbonato de sodio, el chocolate y las avellanas con una cuchara de madera hasta que estén bien combinados.","Coloque la masa en las bandejas para hornear en 24 montones, bien espaciados. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos o hasta que los bordes estén ligeramente dorados. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar completamente sobre las bandejas para hornear. Unte 1 cucharadita de chocolate para untar en la base de la mitad de las galletas y luego emparéjelas con las otras mitades. Se conservará en un molde para pasteles o en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13167,9120,'es','Pizza de masa de galleta','Hemos visto pizza en todo tipo de variedades, pero esta tiene que ser nuestra favorita. Cubra su base de pizza de masa para galletas con cualquier delicia que le guste','["185 g de mantequilla, blanda","185 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","150 g de azúcar moreno claro suave","2 huevos medianos, batidos","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","335 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de sal","200 g de chispas de chocolate","200 g de chocolate negro, derretido","25 g de botones gigantes de chocolate blanco","25 g de mini malvaviscos","25 g de fresas, peladas y en rodajas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160 ventilador/gas 4. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica o una batidora de mesa. Vierta los huevos batidos y la vainilla, batiendo bien hasta que se combinen.","Tamice la harina y la sal y mezcle hasta que se combinen uniformemente. Esparce sobre las chispas de chocolate y revuelve hasta que se esparzan por toda la masa.","Enrolle hasta formar una galleta grande y redonda y colóquela en una bandeja para hornear grande cubierta con papel pergamino. Hornee en el horno precalentado durante 25 minutos hasta que estén dorados en los bordes y todavía un poco tambaleantes en el medio. Dejar enfriar un par de minutos antes de cubrir. Unte el chocolate derretido sobre la galleta, espolvoree con botones gigantes de chocolate, mini malvaviscos y fresas. Cortar en unas 15 rodajas y servir mientras aún esté un poco caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:56:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13168,9121,'es','Galletas con huella digital de chocolate y avellanas','El procesador de alimentos hace la mayor parte del trabajo en esta receta de galletas, pero los niños más pequeños disfrutarán haciendo bolas con la masa y tomando huellas digitales. Los niños mayores pueden hacerlos solos.','["180 g de avellanas tostadas","100 g de harina común","90 g de harina de trigo sarraceno","60 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","180 g de mantequilla sin sal","100 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de aceite de coco (o use cualquier aceite sin sabor)"]','["Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Vierta las avellanas en el tazón de un procesador de alimentos y presione hasta que estén finamente picadas. Agregue las harinas, el azúcar y una pizca de sal marina en escamas y procese durante 20 a 30 segundos hasta que estén completamente combinados. Agregue la mantequilla y presione hasta que la mezcla comience a unirse. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase a mano hasta que quede suave.","Enrolle la masa en 25 bolitas y luego transfiérala a la bandeja para hornear preparada. Con el pulgar o el mango de una cuchara de madera, haga una marca en el centro de cada trozo de masa. Coloque la bandeja en el frigorífico y déjela enfriar durante 30 minutos antes de hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Hornee en el horno durante 15-20 minutos o hasta que estén ligeramente dorados. Coloque el chocolate y el aceite en un recipiente resistente al calor y colóquelo sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que se derrita por completo. Usa una cucharadita para cubrir cada galleta con un poco de chocolate derretido. Reservar hasta que el chocolate se haya endurecido."]','2026-01-11 12:56:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13169,9122,'es','Galletas de mantequilla de maní','Con solo tres ingredientes, estas sencillas galletas de mantequilla de maní harán las delicias de niños y adultos por igual, y además no contienen gluten.','["200 g de mantequilla de maní (crujiente o suave está bien)","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","¼ cucharadita de sal de mesa fina","1 huevo grande"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre 2 bandejas para hornear grandes con papel para hornear. Mide la mantequilla de maní y el azúcar en un bol. Agrega ¼ de cucharadita de sal de mesa fina y mezcla bien con una cuchara de madera. Agrega el huevo y vuelve a mezclar hasta que la mezcla forme una masa.","Cortar trozos de masa del tamaño de un tomate cherry y colocarlos, bien espaciados, en las bandejas. Presiona las galletas con el dorso de un tenedor para aplastarlas un poco. Las galletas ahora se pueden congelar durante 2 meses, cocinarlas congeladas agregando uno o dos minutos más al tiempo de cocción. Hornee durante 12 minutos, hasta que estén dorados en los bordes y más pálidos en el centro. Deje enfriar en las bandejas durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla y enfríe por completo. Guárdelo en un frasco de galletas por hasta 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13170,9123,'es','Galletas dobles de jengibre','Si te encantan las nueces de jengibre, te encantarán estas galletas especiadas al estilo americano con trozos de jengibre y bañadas en chocolate amargo.','["350 g de harina común","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","175 g de azúcar mascabado light","100 g de mantequilla, picada","8 trozos de tallo de jengibre, picados (no muy finos), más rodajas finas, para decorar (opcional)","1 huevo grande","4 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","200 g de barra de chocolate negro, picado"]','["Mezcle la harina, el jengibre molido, el bicarbonato de sodio, 1/2 cucharadita de sal y el azúcar en un bol, luego frote con la mantequilla para hacer migajas. Agregue el jengibre de tallo picado.","Batir el huevo y el almíbar, verter en los ingredientes secos y revolver, luego amasar con las manos hasta formar una masa. Corta la masa por la mitad y dale forma a cada pieza de salchicha gruesa de unos 6 cm de ancho, asegurándote de que los extremos queden rectos. Envolver en film transparente y enfriar durante 20 minutos. Ya puedes congelar toda o parte de la masa durante 2 meses.","Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Corte gruesamente cada salchicha en 12 y coloque las rebanadas en las bandejas para hornear, espaciándolas bien y remodelando las que sean necesarias, si es necesario, para formar rondas. Hornee durante 12 minutos, luego déjelo enfriar durante unos minutos para que se endurezca antes de transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Derrita el chocolate en un recipiente sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento, asegurándose de que el agua no toque el fondo del recipiente. Sumerge la mitad de cada galleta en el chocolate; es posible que tengas que echarla con una cuchara cuando llegues a las últimas. Decora con una rodaja de jengibre, si quieres, y deja reposar. Se conservará durante 1 semana en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:56:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13171,9124,'es','Galletas de avena con pasas','Rellena el molde de galletas con estas galletas rústicas. Remojar las pasas aumenta la textura y evita que se quemen durante la cocción.','["100 g de pasas","150 ml de aceite vegetal","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo grande, batido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","140 g de harina común","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","300 g de avena"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Vierta 50 ml/2 fl oz de agua hirviendo sobre las pasas y déjelas en remojo durante 20 minutos hasta que estén rellenas. Escurrir reservando el líquido.","Mientras tanto, en un bol grande, mezcle el aceite y el azúcar. Incorpora poco a poco el huevo, junto con el agua reservada de las pasas, la canela y el extracto de vainilla. Tamiza en el bol la harina, el bicarbonato y una pizca de sal, luego añade la avena. Finalmente, agregue las pasas.","Deje caer cucharadas colmadas de masa para galletas en las bandejas para hornear, bien espaciadas para que se esparzan al cocinar. Hornee durante 12-15 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Deje enfriar en las bandejas durante 10 minutos antes de meterlo, o transfiéralo a una rejilla para enfriar por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13172,9125,'es','Galletas con cara de calabaza y naranja','Galletas estupendas y divertidas para pedir dulces: prepáralas con uno o dos días de antelación y luego rellénalas antes de que lleguen tus espeluznantes invitados.','["140 g de mantequilla, blanda","175 g de harina común","50 g de azúcar glas","ralladura fina 1 naranja mediana","100 g de mascarpone","1 cucharadita de azúcar glas","25 g de chocolate natural (55 % de sólidos de cacao está bien), derretido","50 g de azúcar glas","aproximadamente 1 cucharada de jugo de naranja"]','["Precalienta el horno a temperatura ventilada 160C/\r\nconvencional 180C/gas 4. Poner la mantequilla en\r\nun bol y batir con una cuchara de madera hasta\r\nsuave. Añadimos la harina, el azúcar glas y\r\nralladura de naranja y batir para hacer una\r\nmasa blanda. Amasar hasta formar una bola y envolver\r\nen film transparente. Enfriar durante 1 hora.","Extender la masa sobre una mesa ligeramente enharinada.\r\nsuperficie hasta un espesor de aproximadamente 3 mm. cortar\r\n24 círculos con un cortador liso redondo de 7,5 cm.\r\nPonlos en un par de bandejas para hornear.","Con un cuchillo pequeño y afilado, corte\r\nCaras de Halloween en 12 de los círculos.\r\nRecoge la masa de galleta sobrante y\r\npresione en forma de tallo de calabaza, recortando\r\ncon un cuchillo afilado. Presione hasta la parte superior de cada \r\ngalleta con un cuchillo para unir. hacer líneas en\r\nla cara de las galletas con el dorso de una hoja redonda\r\ncuchillo, para parecerse a las marcas en un\r\ncalabaza. Hornea todas las galletas durante unos 15\r\nminutos hasta que esté dorado pálido. Dejar reposar durante un\r\nMientras tanto, luego enfríe completamente sobre una rejilla.","Mezcle los ingredientes del glaseado para hacer un\r\nglaseado suave y líquido, agregando un poco más de jugo\r\nsi es necesario, déjelo a un lado. Para el relleno,\r\nbatir el mascarpone con el azúcar glas,\r\nluego agregue el chocolate derretido enfriado.","Extienda el relleno sobre la llanura enfriada.\r\ngalletas, luego presione las de la \"cara\" en la parte superior\r\n– haz esto justo antes de comerlos,\r\nde lo contrario se ablandan. Cepilla con el\r\nglaseado, usando un pincel limpio o pastelería.\r\ncepillo. Come el mismo día."]','2026-01-11 12:56:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13173,9126,'es','Galletas navideñas de vainilla espumosas','Cuélguelos de un árbol de Navidad o empáquelos en cajas como obsequio de fin de curso para profesores y amigos.','["140 g de azúcar glas tamizada","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 yema de huevo","250 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubos pequeños","375 g de harina común, tamizada","200 g de azúcar glas tamizada","colorante alimentario comestible, opcional","bolas comestibles de oro y plata","Cinta fina de aproximadamente 2 m cortada en trozos de 10 cm"]','["Vierta el azúcar glas, el extracto de vainilla, la yema de huevo y la mantequilla en un tazón, luego mezcle con una cuchara de madera (o presione en un procesador de alimentos hasta que estén bien combinados). Agrega la harina y mezcla hasta obtener una masa firme. Forme dos discos planos con la masa y envuélvalos en film transparente. Enfríe durante 20-30 minutos. Caliente el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5 y forre dos bandejas para hornear con papel de horno antiadherente.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener aproximadamente el grosor de dos monedas de £1. Recorta formas navideñas (usa un cortador si quieres) y colócalas en las bandejas para hornear. Con la punta de una brocheta, corta un pequeño agujero en la parte superior de cada galleta. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado.","Levante las galletas sobre una rejilla para que se enfríen. Mientras tanto, mezcle el azúcar glas con unas gotas de agua fría para obtener un glaseado espeso pero aún líquido. Colorea con colorante alimentario comestible, si lo deseas. Extenderlo sobre las galletas enfriadas, decorar con bolitas comestibles y enhebrar con cinta cuando esté seco."]','2026-01-11 12:56:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13174,9127,'es','Muestra tus sándwiches de galletas','Estas pequeñas galletas, cubiertas con crema de mantequilla y cubiertas con Smarties, son perfectas para vender pasteles y cocinar con niños.','["200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","140 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos grandes, 1 batido para glasear","350 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","Bolsa de 147g Sabelotodos","4 cucharadas cientos y miles","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","140 g de azúcar glas","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["En un procesador de alimentos, bata la mantequilla,\r\nazúcar glas y vainilla hasta que quede suave.\r\nAgregue 1 huevo y mezcle para combinar, luego\r\nVierta la harina y revuelva una vez más.\r\nForma una bola con la masa y envuélvela\r\nen film transparente. Enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEspolvoree 2 bandejas para hornear grandes con harina. descanso\r\nla masa en trozos grandes del tamaño de una cereza.\r\nHacer bolitas y ponerlas a hornear.\r\nbandejas, un poco espaciadas. aplastar\r\nlas bolitas ligeramente con 3 dedos. hornear (en\r\nlotes, si es necesario) durante 8 minutos – el\r\nLas galletas todavía estarán muy pálidas en esta etapa.","Saca las galletas del horno.\r\nMientras aún esté caliente, cepille rápidamente la parte superior.\r\ncon el huevo batido, luego mojar la mitad en el\r\ncientos y miles, y presione algunos\r\nSabelotodos sobre cada uno de los restantes\r\ngalletas – haz esto mientras el huevo aún esté\r\nmojado, para que los ingredientes se peguen una vez\r\ncocido. Hornee por 4 minutos más.\r\nDejar enfriar sobre rejillas.","Para hacer el glaseado, bata las\r\nmantequilla, azúcar glas y vainilla. Una vez que el\r\nLas galletas están completamente frías, usa el glaseado.\r\npara emparedar los 2 diferentes\r\ngalletas. Se pueden hacer galletas sin hielo\r\nhasta 4 días de anticipación y mantenido en un\r\nrecipiente hermético. Puedes llenar con\r\nla guinda hasta 1 día antes."]','2026-01-11 12:56:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13175,9128,'es','galletas congeladas','Todo el mundo necesita un capricho de vez en cuando, y estas galletas están llenas de avena, lo que elimina parte de la culpa.','["Paquete de 200 g de mantequilla blanda","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina con levadura","140 g de avena","50g de frutos secos picados como pecanas, avellanas o almendras","50 g de coco rallado","50 g de pasas o frutas mixtas"]','["Cuando la mantequilla esté muy blanda la vertemos en un bol junto con el azúcar. Usando un batidor de mano eléctrico o ejercitando un poco de músculo del brazo, bata hasta que el azúcar se mezcle bien. Batir los huevos, uno a la vez, seguido del extracto de vainilla y una pizca de sal, si se desea. Agrega la harina y la avena. La mezcla estará bastante dura en este punto. Ahora decida qué más le gustaría agregar (cualquiera o todos los sabores son deliciosos) y revuelva.","Arranca una hoja de papel vegetal de tamaño A4. Apila la mitad de la mezcla en el medio de la hoja, luego usa una cuchara para esparcir la mezcla de manera espesa a lo largo del centro del papel. Pasa un borde del papel y enróllalo hasta obtener un cilindro apretado. Si tiene problemas para alisarlo, páselo como lo haría con un rodillo sobre la superficie de la cocina. Necesitará que tenga aproximadamente el ancho de una taza de té. Cuando esté bien envuelto, retuerza los extremos y luego colóquelo en el congelador. Se puede congelar hasta por 3 meses.","Para cocinar, calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4 y desenvolver la mezcla de galleta congelada. Con un cuchillo afilado, corte un disco de aproximadamente\r\n½ cm de ancho. Si tiene dificultades para cortar, sumerja el cuchillo en una taza de agua caliente. Corta tantas galletas como quieras\r\nnecesita, luego vuelva a colocar la mezcla en el congelador para otro momento. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear, espaciándolos bien.\r\nya que la mezcla se esparcirá durante la cocción, luego cocine durante 15 minutos hasta que la parte superior esté dorada. Dejar enfriar al menos\r\n5 minutos antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 12:56:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13176,9129,'es','galletas de caramelo','Las bolitas de arroz ocultas dan un buen crujido a las galletas con chispas de chocolate y caramelo de la lectora Pamela Johnson','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada, más un poco más para la bandeja para hornear","100 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro","2 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","175 g de harina con levadura","25 g de cereal de arroz inflado, como Rice Krispies","chispas de chocolate amargo, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEn un tazón grande, bata la mantequilla,\r\nazúcar y almíbar dorado hasta que quede suave.","Tamizar la harina y mezclar,\r\nluego doble el cereal de arroz inflado.\r\nFormar bolitas del tamaño de una nuez y colocarlas.\r\nbien espaciadas, sobre una bandeja para hornear ligeramente untada con mantequilla.\r\nhoja. Decora cada bola con unas cuantas\r\nchispas de chocolate.","Hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté dorado.\r\nDejar en la bandeja para hornear durante 1 min.\r\nantes de retirarlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe."]','2026-01-11 12:56:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13177,9130,'es','galletas de frutas','Esta receta fácil pero deliciosa fue preparada por los alumnos de Year 7 de la Priory School de Suffolk.','["200 g de mantequilla","175 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 cucharadas de mermelada fina","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas molidas","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","175 g de gachas de avena","200 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","175 g de frutos secos (pruebe con cerezas, albaricoques y pasas pasas glaseados picados)","100 g de nueces picadas (nosotros usamos avellanas)"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nBatir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que esté suave\r\ny esponjoso. Mezclar la mermelada con 2 cucharadas.\r\nagua hirviendo. Agregue la mezcla de crema,\r\nluego agregue las especias, la avena, la harina y\r\npolvo para hornear. Incorpora las frutas y las nueces.","Espolvorea tus manos y la superficie con harina.\r\ny enrollar la masa hasta formar una salchicha larga.\r\nforma. Cortar en unos 20 discos. Colocar en\r\nuna bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear,\r\nespaciados a medida que se extenderán. hornear\r\ndurante unos 25 minutos hasta que se doren."]','2026-01-11 12:56:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13178,9131,'es','Florentinas de cereza y coco','Lindos bocados masticables. Haz una versión gigante y luego elimina las formas de las estrellas, ¡dejando muchos pedazos para mordisquear!','["140 g de azúcar mascabado light","100 g de miel clara","200 g de mantequilla salada","100 g de coco rallado","140 g de almendras laminadas","300 g de cerezas glaseadas, en rodajas","4 cucharadas de harina común","250 g de chocolate negro, con leche o blanco, o una mezcla"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner\r\nel azúcar, la miel y la mantequilla en una cacerola grande\r\ny derretir suavemente. Cuando todos los\r\nel azúcar se ha disuelto revuelva en el coco,\r\nalmendras laminadas, cerezas laminadas y harina.","Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel vegetal (de unos 40 x 30 cm) y\r\nesparcir aproximadamente la mezcla florentina\r\nhasta formar una capa fina; no te preocupes si\r\ntiene pequeños espacios, debería fundirse\r\nen el horno. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que\r\nun rico color dorado, luego reserve para\r\nenfriar y reafirmar.","Derretir el chocolate por separado.\r\ntazones resistentes al calor a fuego lento\r\nagua. Forre una segunda bandeja o tabla grande.\r\ncon papel vegetal y voltearlo con cuidado\r\nencima el horneado florentino enfriado. Pelar\r\ndel papel vegetal. difundir el\r\nchocolate derretido, si estás usando un\r\nAlgunos tipos simplemente dejan un espacio entre cada uno.","Déjelo a un lado hasta que esté listo, luego corte las formas usando cortadores de estrellas para galletas; si el cortador se le clava en las manos (ya que la mezcla florentina puede estar un poco dura), coloque un plato pequeño o una sartén encima y empújelo hacia abajo."]','2026-01-11 12:56:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13179,9132,'es','galletas olvidadas','¿Qué hay en un nombre? Mételos en el horno, olvídalos durante la noche y tendrás galletas desmenuzables por la mañana.','["2 claras de huevo grandes","120 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","120 g de nueces pecanas, picadas en trozos grandes","150 g de chocolate amargo (al menos 70 % de sólidos de cacao), picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/gas\r\n4/ventilador 160C. Forre dos bandejas para hornear\r\ncon papel de aluminio para cubrir. En una gran limpieza\r\nbol, batir las claras con\r\nuna pizca de sal hasta que esté firme y seco.\r\nIncorpora poco a poco el azúcar.\r\na la vez para hacer una espesa y brillante\r\nmerengue. Consejo en las nueces pecanas\r\ny chocolate, luego la vainilla\r\nextraer y doblar suavemente en el\r\nmerengue con una cuchara grande de metal.","Cuchara cucharaditas colmadas de\r\nla mezcla de merengue, espaciada\r\naparte, sobre la bandeja para hornear forrada\r\nhojas. Pon las hojas en el horno,\r\nluego apágalo y deja el\r\ngalletas durante al menos 3 horas,\r\ntoda la noche o hasta que el horno esté frío.","Pele con cuidado las galletas de\r\nel papel de aluminio. Guardar en una lata hermética\r\ndonde se conservarán durante 3-4 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13180,9133,'es','Galletas de azúcar de clavo','Estas galletas dulces, con sabor a nuez y especias se pueden servir después de la cena o envasarlas como obsequio para familiares y amigos.','["250 g de mantequilla, ablandada","100 g de avellanas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de azúcar glas","1½ cucharadita de clavo molido","350 g de harina común"]','["Ponga la mantequilla, las avellanas, el extracto de vainilla y 85 g de azúcar glas en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta. Agregue 1 cucharadita de clavo molido y la harina, y presione hasta que se forme una masa.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forre un par de bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Enrolle la masa en bolas del tamaño de una nuez y colóquelas en las bandejas para hornear. Use el dorso de un tenedor para aplastar ligeramente cada bola, luego hornee durante 12 a 15 minutos hasta que adquieran un color pálido como una galleta; si se doran demasiado, se secarán.","Mezcle el azúcar glas restante y el clavo molido, luego tamice bien sobre las galletas calientes. Déjelo enfriar un poco antes de comerlo, solo tibio o frío."]','2026-01-11 12:56:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13181,9134,'es','Galletas con chispas de chocolate antiguas','Una receta fácil de galletas con chispas de chocolate para obtener galletas suaves con un centro blando que impresionará a familiares y amigos. Haga muchos, ya que seguramente serán un éxito.','["150 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","80 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","80 g de azúcar granulada","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","1 huevo grande","225 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","¼ cucharadita de sal","200 g de chispas o trozos de chocolate natural"]','["Precalienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Forra dos bandejas de horno con papel de horno antiadherente.","Poner la mantequilla y el azúcar en un bol y batir hasta que quede cremoso. Incorpora el extracto de vainilla y el huevo. Tamizar la harina, el bicarbonato y la sal sobre la mezcla y mezclar con una cuchara de madera. Agrega las chispas de chocolate y revuelve bien.","Con una cucharadita, coloque pequeños montículos de la mezcla bien separados en las bandejas para hornear. Hornee en el horno durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente dorados en los bordes y aún ligeramente suaves en el centro.","Déjelo en la bandeja durante un par de minutos para que se endurezca y luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:56:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13182,9135,'es','Galletas triples de chocolate','Tienes todas las bases cubiertas con chocolate blanco, con leche y amargo en estas galletas estilo americano, que se disfrutan mejor calientes con un vaso de leche fría.','["100 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","1 huevo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","225 g de harina común","140 g de chocolate con leche, derretido","85 g de chocolate blanco, troceado o troceado","85 g de chocolate natural, en trocitos o en trozos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nForre 1-2 bandejas para hornear con masa para hornear.\r\npergamino. Mezclar los azúcares y la mantequilla.\r\njunto con una cuchara de madera, luego agregue\r\nel huevo, la vainilla, la harina y la mitad del derretido\r\nchocolate con leche y mezclar. Agregue\r\nlas chispas de chocolate blanco y natural o\r\ntrozos, luego use una bola de helado o\r\ncucharada redonda (como una cuchara medidora)\r\nsacar bolitas de masa para galletas y\r\ndéjelos caer directamente sobre las bandejas.","Hornee en tandas durante 8-9 minutos hasta que esté pálido.\r\ndorados y aún suaves al tacto, lo harán\r\nse endurezcan mientras se enfrían. Transfiera con cuidado a\r\nuna rejilla tan pronto como se puedan levantar\r\narriba, luego rocíe con el resto\r\nchocolate derretido."]','2026-01-11 12:56:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13183,9136,'es','galletas arcoiris','Estas coloridas galletas seguramente serán un gran éxito entre niños y adultos por igual.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de azúcar glas","2 yemas de huevo","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","300 g de harina común","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","140 g de azúcar glas tamizada","chispitas, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nMezclar la mantequilla, el azúcar, las yemas de huevo y\r\nvainilla con una cuchara de madera hasta\r\ncremoso, luego mezcle la harina en\r\n2 lotes. Agrega la ralladura de naranja.\r\nEnrolle la masa en aproximadamente 22 nueces del tamaño de\r\nbolas y reposar en bandejas para hornear. Hornear para\r\n15 minutos hasta que esté dorado, luego dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el azúcar glas con\r\nsuficiente jugo de naranja para hacer una crema espesa,\r\nglaseado líquido. Sumerge cada mitad de galleta en\r\nel glaseado y luego directamente a las chispas.\r\nSecar sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 12:56:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13184,4102,'es','pastelitos de fresa','Invite a familiares y amigos con estos hermosos cupcakes de fresa. Están hechos con trozos de fresa fresca en el bizcocho y un glaseado de crema de mantequilla de color rosa vibrante.','["175 g de harina con levadura","115 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos","100 g de yogur griego","115 g de mantequilla, derretida y ligeramente enfriada","100 g de fresas, peladas y finamente picadas","300 g de azúcar glas tamizada","150 g de mantequilla blanda","2 cucharadas de leche","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","unas gotas de colorante rosa","6 fresas partidas por la mitad o 12 fresas pequeñas enteras"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forra un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con moldes para cupcakes. Mezcle la harina y el azúcar en un tazón grande. En una jarra grande, bate los huevos, el yogur y la mantequilla derretida. Mezcle gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos con los secos hasta obtener una masa suave, luego agregue las fresas.","Llene las cajas preparadas hasta que queden aproximadamente tres cuartos de su capacidad. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos, o hasta que estén dorados y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Batir el azúcar y la mantequilla hasta que quede suave y pálido, luego agregar la leche, la vainilla y un poco de colorante rosa y batir hasta que el glaseado tenga un tono rosa pálido uniforme. Coloque el glaseado en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella y luego forme remolinos sobre los cupcakes enfriados. Decora cada uno con media fresa o fresa pequeña y luego sirve."]','2026-01-11 12:56:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13185,9137,'es','pastelitos arcoiris','Haz sonreír a alguien con estos alegres cupcakes de arcoíris. El bizcocho rayado y la cobertura de crema de mantequilla seguramente alegrarán el día a cualquiera.','["110 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","110 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos grandes","110 g de harina con levadura","Colorante alimentario en gel rojo, azul y amarillo.","chispas (opcional)","150 g de mantequilla blanda","300 g de azúcar glas","3 cucharadas de leche"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y llenar una bandeja para cupcakes con 10 cajas.","Batir la mantequilla, la vainilla y el azúcar en polvo con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Incorpora poco a poco los huevos, raspando los lados del tazón después de cada adición.","Agrega la harina y una pizca de sal hasta que estén combinados. Dividir en cinco tazones y colorear cada uno de un tono diferente con una gota de colorante alimentario. Elegimos rojo, amarillo, verde, azul y morado.","Comenzando por el final del arcoíris (en nuestro caso, morado), esparza uniformemente 1 cucharadita de la mezcla en cada molde para cupcakes usando una manga pastelera o el dorso de una cucharadita. Cubra con 1 cucharadita del siguiente color y extiéndalo; tenga cuidado de no mezclar los colores mientras lleva la mezcla hasta el borde de la caja. Repita hasta que se acaben todos los colores y quede una capa uniforme de rojo en la parte superior.","Hornee por 15 minutos, hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio de cada pastel, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla.","Para hacer la crema de mantequilla, bate la mantequilla hasta que esté muy suave. Añade el azúcar glas, el extracto de vainilla y una pizca de sal y bate hasta que quede suave (comienza lentamente para evitar que se forme una nube de azúcar glas). Batir la leche hasta que se combinen.","Coloca la crema de mantequilla encima de los cupcakes con una boquilla circular o extiéndela con una espátula. Cubra con chispas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:56:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13186,9138,'es','pastelitos de mariposa','Estos bonitos cupcakes son perfectos para una ocasión especial. El almíbar aromatizado ayuda a que los pasteles se mantengan húmedos, por lo que puedes prepararlos con un día de anticipación y decorarlos al día siguiente.','["300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos","300 g de mantequilla, derretida y enfriada","300 g de harina con levadura","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada de flores de lavanda secas (ver consejo)","400 g de mantequilla blanda","550 g de azúcar glas","3 colorantes alimentarios en gel (nosotros usamos morado, amarillo y rosa)","400 gramos de chocolate blanco","3 colorantes alimentarios en gel (nosotros usamos morado, amarillo y rosa)","2 galletas de chocolate, trituradas (nosotros usamos galletas Oreo pero le quitamos el relleno blanco)"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre dos moldes para cupcakes de 12 agujeros con moldes de papel para muffins. Pon todos los ingredientes del pastel en un tazón grande y bate con una batidora eléctrica durante 3-4 minutos o hasta que esté pálido y ligero. Divida la mezcla de manera uniforme entre las 24 cajas y hornee por 20 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro de un pastel, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Mientras se hornean los cupcakes, prepara el almíbar. Pon el azúcar, la lavanda y 300ml de agua en una cacerola mediana a fuego lento. Llevar a ebullición poco a poco, cocinar durante 2 minutos, luego apagar el fuego y dejar infusionar. Cuando esté frío, colar a través de un colador en una jarra pequeña.","Para hacer el glaseado, poner en un bol grande la mantequilla, el azúcar glas y 100ml de almíbar. Mezclar con una cuchara de madera, luego cambiar a una batidora eléctrica y batir hasta que quede suave y esponjoso. Divida la mezcla en tres tazones. Agregue un pequeño punto de gel colorante para alimentos a cada tazón para hacer tres colores diferentes de crema de mantequilla; revuelva para mezclar y luego transfiera la mitad de cada color a mangas pasteleras desechables.","Use un palito de cóctel para hacer algunos pequeños agujeros en la parte superior de los cupcakes, luego rocíe cada uno con 1 cucharadita de almíbar. Coloque 1 cucharadita colmada de glaseado en cada pastel (haga ocho de cada color) y gírelo con el dorso de la cuchara para cubrir completamente la parte superior. A continuación, utilice la manga pastelera correspondiente para trazar una línea recta de unos 2-3 cm de largo a lo largo del centro de cada pastel.","Para hacer las alitas, derrita el chocolate blanco en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Divida en tres tazones más pequeños y agregue los mismos colores de gel que antes. Corta cuadrados de papel para hornear de 8 cm y, con un bolígrafo, dibuja un par de alas de mariposa en cada cuadrado para que el diseño se vea en el otro lado o, si lo prefieres, calca el diseño a continuación. Dale la vuelta al papel y, usando la línea como guía, pinta sobre el chocolate derretido. Espolvoree galletas trituradas en los bordes para crear patrones y luego déjelas reposar. Una vez listo, empuja suavemente las alas dentro de los cupcakes en un ángulo de 45 grados."]','2026-01-11 12:56:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13187,9139,'es','pastelitos del ciclo lunar','Los novatos observadores de estrellas, hornean su camino a través del ciclo lunar con nuestros sabrosos cupcakes de chocolate. Colóquelos en el orden correcto para crear una exhibición magnífica y poner a prueba sus habilidades científicas.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda sin sal","175 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos grandes","150 g de harina con levadura","50 g de cacao en polvo","4 cucharadas de azúcar glas","100 g de glaseado de fondant azul ya preparado","100 g de glaseado de fondant negro ya preparado","140 g de glaseado de fondant blanco","purpurina dorada comestible (opcional)"]','["Forre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con 12 moldes para muffins de color marrón oscuro o negro. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner todos los ingredientes en un bol grande y con una batidora eléctrica de mano, batir durante 2-3 minutos, hasta que quede esponjoso.","Divide la mezcla entre los moldes para muffins, luego hornea durante 20 a 25 minutos, hasta que haya subido y esté elástico al tacto; pídele a un adulto que te ayude con este paso. Cuando los pasteles estén cocidos, sácalos del horno y transfiérelos a una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo; pídele a un adulto que te ayude con esto también. Necesitarás 8 de los pasteles para hacer un ciclo completo de la luna. Si es necesario, puedes recortar la parte superior de los pasteles para que queden planos.","Mezcla 3 cucharadas de azúcar glas con suficiente agua para hacer una pasta untable y reserva. Amasar el glaseado de fondant azul y negro hasta que los colores estén casi mezclados, dejando algunas rayas de azul.","Espolvorea una superficie de trabajo con un poco de azúcar glas y extiende el glaseado de color hasta que sea lo suficientemente grande como para cortar círculos de 12 x 7 cm. Extienda un poco de pasta de azúcar glas sobre cada pastel y pegue una ronda de glaseado encima.","Extienda el glaseado blanco hasta que tenga un espesor de aproximadamente 0,5 cm. Con un cuchillo pequeño y afilado, corte 2 formas de media luna finas para hacer la media luna creciente y menguante. Con un cortador de 7 cm, corta 4 rondas. Corta una ronda por la mitad para formar el primer y el tercer cuarto de luna. Deje una ronda como está para hacer la luna llena y corte una pequeña media luna de las 2 rondas restantes, para hacer la luna gibosa creciente y menguante. Usando un poco de pasta glaseada, pegue cada forma a un pastel. Deja un pastel sin nada: esta será la luna nueva. Utiliza un cortador en forma de estrella para decorar los 4 cupcakes no incluidos en el ciclo con el glaseado blanco sobrante.","Con una brocha de repostería, aplica un poquito de agua sobre el glaseado más oscuro y luego espolvorea un poco de brillantina por encima; el agua ayuda a que se pegue en su lugar. ¡Diviértete organizando tus pasteles en un ciclo lunar!"]','2026-01-11 12:56:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13188,9140,'es','Nido de Pascua cupcakes de coco y chocolate blanco','Prueba a decirle no a estos bizcochos con glaseado y una ingeniosa decoración de pájaros hecha con huevos de chocolate','["3 huevos medianos, batidos","100ml de leche","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de coco rallado","200 g de harina con levadura","50 g de mantequilla derretida","100 g de chocolate blanco, derretido","100 g de chocolate blanco, derretido","200 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","225 g de azúcar glas tamizada","unos 25 g de coco rallado","36 mini huevos","glaseado naranja o amarillo para picos","tubo de glaseado de escritura negro"]','["Forre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con cajas de papel y caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Batir los huevos, la leche y la vainilla. Batir el azúcar con el coco en un procesador de alimentos hasta que esté muy finamente molido. Vierta en un tazón grande con la harina y mezcle. Agregue la mezcla de huevo batido, la mantequilla derretida y el chocolate, luego revuelva hasta que quede suave.","Vierta en las cajas (estarán bastante llenas) y hornee durante 18-20 minutos en un estante del medio hasta que estén doradas y al pinchar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Enfriar los bizcochos sobre una rejilla (mantener el horno encendido).","Extienda el coco rallado en una bandeja para hornear y póngalo en el horno durante unos 10 minutos para que se tueste ligeramente; revuelva a la mitad. Fresco. Para hacer el glaseado, ponga el chocolate, la mantequilla y el azúcar glas en un tazón grande y bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén combinados.","Extienda generosamente un poco de glaseado sobre la parte superior de los pasteles enfriados; no es necesario que llegue directamente a los bordes. Una vez que hayas hecho los 12, raspa el resto del glaseado en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de 1 a 2 cm y coloca un anillo alrededor del borde superior para hacer un nido. Enrolle el coco enfriado para cubrirlo aproximadamente.","Convierta cada mini huevo en un pollito moldeando pequeños picos con el glaseado naranja o amarillo y pegándolos con un poco de glaseado negro líquido cuando agregue los ojos. Coloque pollitos en el medio de cada pastel y disfrútelo."]','2026-01-11 12:56:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13189,9141,'es','Cupcakes calientes de panecillo cruzado','Estos pasteles tienen todas las frutas y especias del panecillo tradicional pero son más rápidos de hacer. Termine con cruces de glaseado de queso crema con especias.','["1 cucharada de jugo de limón","100ml de leche entera","175 g de mantequilla sin sal","175 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","175 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","100 g de almendras molidas","3 huevos grandes, batidos, a temperatura ambiente","ralladura ¾ naranja","100g de pasas, pasas o una mezcla de ambas","1 manzana mediana, pelada y luego rallada","1 cucharada de mermelada de albaricoque calentada con un chorrito de agua","ralladura de ¼ de naranja","50 g de queso crema entero","50 g de azúcar glas","25 g de mantequilla, ablandada","¼ cucharadita de mezcla de especias"]','["Combine el jugo de limón y la leche en una jarra grande y déjelo reposar durante 5 minutos. Mientras tanto, calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y derretir la mantequilla en una cacerola. Usa un poco de mantequilla para engrasar un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos.","Ponga la harina, el polvo para hornear, el azúcar, las especias, las almendras y una pizca de sal en un tazón grande, luego tamícelo con los dedos para aplastar los terrones de azúcar. Batir los huevos, la ralladura y la mantequilla derretida con la leche espesa. Vierta esto en los ingredientes secos, luego bata con un batidor de globo hasta que quede uniforme. Agregue las frutas secas y la manzana, vierta la mezcla en el molde (los agujeros estarán llenos; consulte el consejo a continuación) y luego hornee durante 18 a 20 minutos hasta que estén dorados y bien leudados. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos en el molde y luego retírelo a una rejilla.","Cuando los panecillos estén fríos, corta una cruz en la parte superior de cada uno con un cuchillo de sierra y luego unta la parte superior con mermelada de albaricoque. Para la crema de mantequilla especiada, bata todo hasta que esté cremoso y pálido. Coloca la crema de mantequilla en las cruces. Alternativamente, simplemente glasee los bollos y coloque cruces en la parte superior."]','2026-01-11 12:56:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13190,9142,'es','pastelitos de celebración','Prepare estas esponjas individuales para fiestas con anticipación y luego siga nuestras sugerencias para decorar y glasear.','["3 huevos grandes","200 gramos de yogur natural","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","250 g de azúcar en polvo","280 g de harina con levadura","140 g de almendras molidas","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda","300 g de azúcar glas tamizada y un poco más para enrollar","Paquete de 500 g de glaseado listo para enrollar, para la parte superior","algunos colorantes alimentarios diferentes","glaseado adicional y decoraciones de su elección (consulte la sección de métodos para obtener ideas)"]','["Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Forre 2 moldes para muffins de 12 orificios con cajas de papel. Pon los huevos, el yogur, la vainilla, el azúcar, la harina, las almendras y la mantequilla en tu tazón más grande y bate hasta que quede suave y sin grumos. Divida entre las cajas de papel y hornee durante 25-30 minutos (cambie las bandejas después de 15 minutos si tiene que usar 2 estantes) hasta que al pinchar un pincho en el centro de los pasteles salga limpio. Deje enfriar sobre una rejilla. Se pueden congelar hasta por 1 mes o guardar en un recipiente hermético durante la noche.","Para decorar, bate la mantequilla y el azúcar glas hasta que quede una mezcla suave y ligera. Use una cucharadita para colocar una cucharada colmada en el centro de cada pastel o, para acelerar, vierta en una bolsa de comida, corte unos 2 cm de la esquina y coloque una cucharada sobre cada uno.","Divide el glaseado en tantos colores como quieras, además de un trozo que queda para que quede blanco o para pincelarlo con brillantina, si lo deseas. Amasar un poco de colorante en cada pieza hasta obtener un buen color, luego extender sobre una superficie ligeramente espolvoreada con azúcar glas. Utilice un cortador acanalado de 6,5 cm para hacer círculos y presione el glaseado para aplanarlo un poco. Repita con los otros colores para cubrir todos los pasteles. Ahora decora como desees o mira nuestras ideas a continuación."]','2026-01-11 12:56:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13191,9143,'es','Pastelitos de fresa y polenta','Estos cupcakes son pequeñas porciones de perfección y son geniales para compartir con amigos.','["140 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura de ½ limón","85 g de polenta","3 huevos batidos","140 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharada de leche","140 g de fresas, peladas y picadas en trozos","140 g de azúcar glas","3 fresas, peladas y picadas en trozos grandes, más 6 cortadas por la mitad, para decorar","zumo de limón"]','["Forre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con cajas de papel y caliente el horno a 180 ° C/ventilador 160 ° C/gas 4. En un tazón grande, mezcle la mantequilla, el azúcar y la ralladura de limón hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega la polenta y continúa batiendo hasta que se combinen. Batir los huevos, poco a poco.","Tamice la harina y el polvo para hornear, luego incorpore rápidamente con una cuchara grande o una espátula hasta obtener una masa espesa (la mezcla puede verse grumosa debido a la polenta). Agregue la leche para que se afloje y luego agregue suavemente las fresas picadas. Divida la mezcla entre las cajas de papel, luego hornee por 20 minutos o hasta que esté dorada, leudada y elástica al tacto. Deje enfriar durante unos minutos, luego coloque los pasteles sobre una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo. Los pasteles ahora se pueden almacenar en un recipiente hermético hasta por dos días.","Retire con cuidado las cajas de los pasteles. Tamiza el azúcar glas en un bol grande. Coloca las fresas picadas en un bol con 1 cucharadita de jugo de limón y tritúralas con un tenedor hasta que estén pulposas. Pasar un colador sobre el azúcar glas (sólo necesitas unas gotas de jugo para que el glaseado adquiera un color rosado). Agregue más jugo de limón, un chorrito a la vez, hasta obtener una pasta espesa pero fluida. Sumerge la parte superior de cada pastel en el glaseado y luego cubre inmediatamente con la mitad de una fresa. Dejar reposar y luego servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13192,9144,'es','Pastelitos de comida del diablo','Estos bizcochos con cobertura de queso crema son ligeros pero maravillosamente chocolateados.','["50 g de cacao en polvo","2 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","175 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de sal","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","225 g de azúcar en polvo","175 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","4 cucharadas de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada","200 g de queso crema, ablandado","1 cucharadita de vainilla","400 g de azúcar glas tamizada","Un puñado pequeño de bolitas o chispas plateadas, para decorar."]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forre 2 moldes para muffins con 16 cajas de papel para muffins. Batir 175 ml de agua hirviendo con el cacao en polvo en un tazón mediano hasta que quede suave. Deja que la mezcla se enfríe hasta que alcance temperatura ambiente (métela en el congelador para acelerar), luego bátela con los huevos y la vainilla.","En una batidora eléctrica, combine la harina, la sal, el bicarbonato de sodio y el azúcar. Mezcle a velocidad baja durante 30 segundos, luego agregue un tercio del líquido de cacao y la mantequilla blanda. Sigue mezclando a velocidad baja, luego sube a velocidad media alta y bate durante 1 min. Agrega el líquido restante en 3 tandas, batiendo cada una.\r\ndurante 30 segundos. Raspe los lados y el fondo del bol con una espátula y mezcle una vez más. Llene los moldes para cupcakes hasta tres cuartos de su capacidad y hornee por 20 minutos, luego retírelos y déjelos enfriar en el molde.","Para hacer el glaseado, bate la mantequilla y el queso crema durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté cremoso, luego agrega la vainilla. Mientras sigue mezclando, vierta el azúcar en 4 tandas, batiendo cada vez para combinar completamente. Batir durante un minuto más, luego enfriar durante 2 horas.","Agita el glaseado sobre los cupcakes enfriados y decora con bolitas plateadas o lo que quieras."]','2026-01-11 12:56:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13193,9145,'es','Pastelitos de pasión de calabaza','Utilice calabaza rallada o calabacín para estos magníficos cupcakes especiados','["175 ml de aceite de girasol","175 g de azúcar mascabado light","3 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de pulpa de calabaza o calabacín rallada gruesa","100g de pasas","ralladura 1 naranja","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","Tarrina de 200 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","85 g de azúcar glas","nueces tostadas picadas para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nForre una bandeja para muffins de 12 orificios con papel.\r\ncasos. Vierta el aceite en un bol grande y\r\nagrega el azúcar, los huevos y la vainilla. batir\r\njuntos, luego agregue la calabaza rallada,\r\npasas y ralladura de naranja.","Agregue la canela, la harina y\r\nbicarbonato de sodio, la mezcla quedará\r\nbastante mojado. Vierta en los estuches. hornear\r\ndurante 25 minutos hasta que esté firme y elástico al\r\ntoque y un pincho insertado en el\r\nEl centro de un cupcake sale limpio.\r\nDeje enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla. En esto\r\netapa puedes congelar los pasteles durante 4 meses.","Para hacer el glaseado, bate la nata.\r\nqueso y azúcar juntos hasta que quede suave\r\nluego esparce sobre los cupcakes.\r\nDejar simple o decorar con tostadas.\r\nnueces. Conservar en el frigorífico, pero volver a\r\ntemperatura ambiente para servir mejor\r\nsabor y textura."]','2026-01-11 12:56:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13194,8341,'es','Cupcakes de Pascua de cerezas y almendras','Estos pequeños pasteles Simnel son realmente almendrados, con trozos de mazapán en la mezcla, y se ven maravillosos.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","5 huevos batidos","250 g de harina con levadura, más 2 cucharadas extra","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","ralladura de 1 naranja, más 2 cucharadas de jugo","250 g de mazapán natural rallado grueso (más fácil si se enfría previamente)","½ cucharadita de esencia de almendras, opcional","200 g de cerezas glaseadas, partidas por la mitad","unos 100 g/4 oz de azúcar glas, tamizada","mini huevos de chocolate, para decorar"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4 y coloque 24 moldes para cupcakes en moldes para cupcakes. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con batidoras eléctricas o una batidora de mesa hasta que estén suaves y esponjosas. Añade los huevos, 250 g de harina, la levadura en polvo, la ralladura de naranja y el jugo y bate bien hasta que esté espeso, cremoso y uniformemente mezclado.","Agregue las cerezas a las 2 cucharadas adicionales de harina e incorpórelas a la masa junto con el mazapán rallado y la esencia de almendras (si se usa). Vierta en los moldes para cupcakes y hornee durante 20-25 minutos, o hasta que estén bien leudados y dorados. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego colóquelo en una rejilla para enfriar por completo.","Mezcle el azúcar glas con aproximadamente 1 cucharada de agua para hacer un glaseado suelto pero no demasiado líquido. Hielo la parte superior de los cupcakes y cubra cada uno con unos 3 mini huevos de chocolate."]','2026-01-11 12:56:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13195,9147,'es','Pastelitos de chocolate dulce','Estos cupcakes brillantes y divertidos son perfectos para fiestas infantiles','["200 g de mantequilla","200 g de chocolate natural, con menos del 70 % de sólidos de cacao está bien","200 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro","2 huevos batidos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de harina con levadura","Smarties, dulces y chispitas, para decorar","200 g de chocolate natural","100ml de nata doble, no fría","50 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3\r\ny forre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con cajas.\r\nDerretir suavemente la mantequilla, el chocolate y el azúcar.\r\ny 100 ml de agua caliente juntos en un recipiente grande\r\ncacerola, revolviendo ocasionalmente, luego coloque\r\na un lado para que se enfríe un poco mientras se pesa el\r\notros ingredientes.","Agrega los huevos y la vainilla a la\r\nmezcla de chocolate. Poner la harina en\r\nun tazón grande para mezclar, luego agregue el\r\nmezcla de chocolate hasta que quede suave. Cuchara\r\nen casos hasta poco más de las tres cuartas partes\r\nlleno (puede que le quede un poco de mezcla),\r\nluego dejar reposar durante 5 minutos antes de poner\r\nen un estante bajo en el horno y hornear durante\r\n20-22 minutos. Dejar enfriar.","Para el glaseado, derretir el chocolate en una\r\nrecipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola de apenas\r\nagua hirviendo. Una vez derretido, apague\r\nel fuego, añadir la nata doble y tamizar\r\nen el azúcar glas. Cuando se pueda untar, tapar\r\ncada pastel con un poco y decorar con\r\ntus confites y dulces favoritos."]','2026-01-11 12:56:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13196,9148,'es','Cupcakes de crema de café y nueces','Pastel retro favorito de café y nueces en versión cupcake, con opción de lujosa cobertura de mascarpone o crema de mantequilla clásica','["100 g de mantequilla, bien blanda","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","100 g de harina con levadura","2 huevos grandes","2 cucharaditas de café instantáneo, mezclado con 100 ml/3½ fl oz de agua hirviendo y luego enfriado","25 g de mitades de nueces picadas y 12 más para la parte superior","200ml tarrina de mascarpone (lo encontrarás con los quesos tiernos)","2 cucharadas de azúcar mascabado light"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4 y\r\nasegúrese de que haya un estante listo en el medio.\r\nForre un molde para panecillos de 12 hoyos con cajas de pastel de hadas.\r\nBatir la mantequilla, el azúcar, la harina y los huevos con\r\n4 cucharaditas de café y una pizca de sal hasta\r\ncremoso. Agrega las nueces picadas.","Vierta la mezcla en las cajas (comience por\r\nagregando 1 cucharadita colmada a cada uno, luego regrese\r\ny recargarlos – de esa manera todos deberían\r\nser del mismo tamaño), luego hornear durante 18-20 minutos\r\nhasta que esté ligeramente dorado y elástico. Genial por unos pocos\r\nminutos en el molde, luego levante los pasteles y\r\ndejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla.","Poner el mascarpone, 3 cucharaditas más de\r\ncafé y el azúcar en un bol grande, luego\r\nbatir juntos. Extender una cucharada de café.\r\ncrema en la parte superior de cada pastel, luego terminar\r\ncon media nuez. Los pasteles son mejores si\r\nestán helados bastante cerca del momento de comerlos,\r\nasí que si estás avanzando, prepara el\r\nmezcla de mascarpone, conservar en el frigorífico, batir\r\nVuelva a colocarlo y luego viértalo sobre los pasteles.\r\nantes de servir. Los pasteles sin hielo seguirán el ritmo\r\na 2 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:56:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13197,9149,'es','pastelitos de pistacho','Convierte cualquier reunión en una ocasión especial con estos glamorosos cupcakes para adultos','["100 g de pistachos","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de mantequilla, muy blanda","2 huevos","140 g de harina con levadura","5 cucharadas de leche","brillantina comestible, para decorar","250 g de azúcar glas tamizada","colorante alimentario verde menta"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3 y\r\nforre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con cajas. poner\r\n85 g de pistachos en un procesador de alimentos con\r\naproximadamente la mitad del azúcar, luego bata hasta que esté muy\r\nfinamente picado. Vierta en una mezcla grande\r\nbol con el resto del azúcar, la mantequilla,\r\nhuevos, harina y leche y batir hasta que quede suave.\r\nDivida en cajas, luego hornee a fuego lento.\r\ndejar reposar durante 22-25 minutos hasta que se pinche una brocheta.\r\nsale limpio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Para el glaseado, mezcla suficiente agua.\r\nen el azúcar glas para obtener una consistencia muy espesa pero\r\nglaseado aún líquido – solo agregue 1 cucharada de agua\r\na la vez. Agregue suficiente colorante para alimentos.\r\npara dar un bonito color verde pálido. Si alguno\r\nlos pasteles sobresalen por encima de las cajas,\r\nrecórtelo con un cuchillo pequeño o sáquelo con\r\nuna cucharadita – teniendo mucho cuidado de no\r\nsuelte cualquiera de los casos de los lados de\r\nel pastel. Poner una cucharada generosa de glaseado.\r\nen cada pastel y dejar que se extienda suavemente\r\ncubierta. Picar los pistachos restantes y\r\nespárcelos con una pizca de comestible\r\nbrillo. Colocar y luego servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13198,9150,'es','pastelitos de navidad','Diviértete con los niños durante las fiestas navideñas elaborando y decorando estas sencillas tartas','["200 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","175 g de mantequilla picada","700 g de frutos secos variados de lujo","50 g de cerezas heladas","2 cucharaditas de raíz de jengibre fresco rallado","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","100 ml de ron oscuro, brandy o zumo de naranja","85 g/3 oz de nueces pecanas, picadas en trozos grandes","3 huevos grandes, batidos","85 g de almendras molidas","200 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","1 cucharadita de canela","Paquete de 400 g de mazapán ya enrollado (nosotros utilizamos Dr Oetker)","4 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque tibia o mermelada rallada","Paquete de 500 g de azúcar glas para fondant.","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","6 moldes para muffins dorados y 6 plateados","6 peladillas doradas y 6 plateadas","chispas de copo de nieve"]','["Vierta el azúcar, la mantequilla, los frutos secos enteros.\r\ncerezas, jengibre, ralladura de naranja y jugo\r\nen una cacerola grande. Vierta sobre el ron,\r\nbrandy o jugo, luego poner al fuego y\r\nllevar a ebullición lentamente, revolviendo con frecuencia\r\npara derretir la mantequilla. Reducir el fuego y\r\nburbujear suavemente, sin tapar durante 10 minutos,\r\nrevolviendo de vez en cuando para asegurarse\r\nla mezcla no se pega en el fondo\r\nde la sartén. Deje enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Revuelve las nueces, los huevos y las almendras molidas.\r\nen la fruta, luego tamice la harina y hornee\r\npolvo y especias. Revuelve todo\r\njuntos suavemente pero a fondo. tu\r\nla masa está lista.","Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2.\r\nColoque la mezcla para pastel en 12 muffins hondos.\r\ncasos (una bola de helado funciona bien),\r\nluego nivele la parte superior con una cuchara mojada en agua caliente.\r\nagua. Hornee durante 35-45 minutos hasta que esté dorado.\r\ny apenas firme al tacto. Un pincho insertado\r\ndebe salir limpio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Desenredar el mazapán en una obra.\r\nsuperficie ligeramente espolvoreada con azúcar glas.\r\nSelle 12 rondas de 6 cm de ancho. cepillo\r\ncubra el pastel con mermelada de albaricoque, cubra con\r\nuna rodaja de mazapán y presionar ligeramente.","Prepare el glaseado de fondant hasta obtener\r\nesparcir la consistencia, luego girar encima\r\nde cada pastelito. Decorar con azucar\r\nalmendras y copos de nieve, luego dejar reposar\r\nconjunto. Se conservará en lata durante 3 semanas."]','2026-01-11 12:56:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13199,9151,'es','Cupcakes calientes de frambuesa con un chorrito de azúcar de naranja','Estas maravillosas delicias picantes saben perfectas con una cucharada de crema fresca.','["200 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","4 huevos","200 g de azúcar en polvo","3 cucharadas de leche","50 g de almendras molidas","ralladura de 1 naranja mediana","150 g de frambuesas en canastilla, ligeramente trituradas y un poco más para decorar","jugo de 1 naranja mediana","4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo"]','["Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Forre un molde para muffins de 12 orificios con cajas de papel para muffins. Vierta los primeros 8 ingredientes en un tazón grande y bata con batidor eléctrico hasta que quede suave. Incorpora las frambuesas trituradas a la masa.","Divida la masa entre las cajas (deben estar llenas hasta la mitad) y hornee durante 20-25 minutos o hasta que esté dorada y firme. Haga la cobertura mezclando el jugo de naranja y el azúcar hasta que estén bien mezclados.","Saca los cupcakes del horno y déjalos enfriar un poco. Rocíe cada uno con la mezcla de naranja y corteza de azúcar. Cubra con las frambuesas adicionales para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13200,9152,'es','Cupcakes de queso ondulado con arándanos','Estos pudines de una porción tienen una fuerte ondulación de arándano para resaltar la dulzura.','["250 g de galletas digestivas","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","600 g de queso tierno","2 cucharadas de harina común","175 g de azúcar en polvo","extracto de vainilla","2 huevos, más 1 yema","400 g de arándanos, frescos o congelados","100 g de azúcar glas y un poco más para espolvorear"]','["Primero haz la ondulación poniendo el\r\narándanos y azúcar glas en un recipiente poco profundo\r\nsartén y cocinando a fuego medio alto\r\ncalentar durante 10 minutos hasta que las bayas\r\ncolapsar en una salsa espesa y pegajosa.\r\nApagar el fuego y dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nForre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con 12 muffins.\r\ncasos. Triturar las galletas en una bolsa de plástico.\r\no mezcle en un procesador de alimentos, luego mezcle\r\ncon la mantequilla derretida. dividir entre\r\nlos moldes para muffins y presionar con\r\ntus dedos. En un recipiente aparte, mezcle la\r\nqueso tierno con la harina, el azúcar y\r\nextracto de vainilla, luego agregue gradualmente\r\nhuevos y yema hasta que quede suave. Ondular el\r\nmezclar las bayas con el queso, siendo\r\ntenga cuidado de no mezclar demasiado. Vierta la mezcla\r\nen las cajas y alisar la parte superior con\r\nel dorso de la cuchara. Hornee por 30 minutos,\r\ndejar enfriar, luego enfriar en el frigorífico hasta\r\ncompletamente frío.","Para servir, retire las cajas de los pasteles,\r\nsi lo desea, espolvoree con azúcar glas.\r\nSirva amontonados en un buen plato para\r\ncada uno para ayudarse a sí mismo."]','2026-01-11 12:56:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13201,9153,'es','Cupcakes de zanahoria y queso crema','Esta receta que agrada a todos convierte el favorito del té de la tarde en deliciosos cupcakes.','["175 g de azúcar moreno moreno","100 g de harina integral con levadura","100 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","ralladura de 1 naranja","2 huevos","150 ml de aceite de girasol","200 g de zanahorias ralladas","chispitas de color naranja, para decorar","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","300 g de queso tierno","100 g de azúcar glas tamizada","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y\r\nforre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con cajas. en\r\nEn un bol grande, mezcle el azúcar, las harinas,\r\nbicarbonato de sodio, mezcla de especias y\r\nralladura de naranja. Batir los huevos\r\ny aceite, luego agregue los ingredientes secos\r\ncon la zanahoria rallada. dividir la mezcla\r\nentre cajas y hornee durante 20-22 minutos\r\nhasta que al pinchar un pincho éste salga limpio.\r\nDeje enfriar sobre una rejilla antes de glasear.","Para el glaseado, bate la mantequilla hasta que esté bien\r\nsuave, luego agregue el queso tierno, el glaseado\r\nazúcar y vainilla. Utilice una paleta o cubiertos.\r\ncuchillo para hacer girar el glaseado encima del\r\npasteles, luego espolvorear con decoraciones."]','2026-01-11 12:56:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13202,9154,'es','Pastelitos de chocolate fáciles','Estos pasteles ligeros son perfectos para congelar; solo necesitan un rápido golpe en el microondas para que vuelvan a la vida.','["300 g de chocolate negro, partido en trozos (no utilices uno con alto contenido de cacao)","200 g de harina con levadura","200 g de azúcar mascabado light, más 3 cucharadas extra","6 cucharadas de cacao","150ml de aceite de girasol, más un poco más para engrasar","Bote de 284 ml de crema agria","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4\r\ny forrar un molde para muffins de 10 agujeros con papel\r\ncasos. Batir el chocolate en trozos pequeños\r\ntrozos en un procesador de alimentos. en el\r\ntazón para mezclar más grande que tengas, propina\r\nen harina, azúcar, cacao, aceite, 100ml\r\nnata agria, huevos, vainilla y 100ml\r\nagua. Batir todo junto con\r\nbatidoras eléctricas hasta que quede suave, luego\r\nagregue rápidamente 100 g del batido\r\npedacitos de chocolate. Dividir entre los\r\n10 cajas, luego hornee por 20 minutos hasta que\r\nun pincho insertado sale limpio\r\n(asegúrese de no meterlo en un\r\ntrozo de chispas de chocolate). Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Para hacer el glaseado, poner el resto\r\ntrocitos de chocolate, crema agria y 3 cucharadas\r\nazúcar en una cacerola pequeña. Calienta suavemente,\r\nrevolviendo, hasta que el chocolate se derrita\r\ny tienes un glaseado suave. Relájate\r\nel refrigerador hasta que esté lo suficientemente firme como para girar\r\nencima de los muffins y luego mételos."]','2026-01-11 12:56:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13203,9155,'es','Pastelitos de merengue de limón','Estos mini merengues le darán un toque de chispa a tu fiesta y se pueden preparar con un día de anticipación para mayor facilidad.','["200 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de mantequilla blanda","2 huevos, más 2 claras","rallar 2 limones, más 2-3 cucharadas de jugo de limón","100 g de harina con levadura","4 cucharadas de cuajada de limón"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nBatir la mitad del azúcar y toda la mantequilla hasta\r\npálido, luego agregue los huevos enteros, uno por uno,\r\nbatiendo bien cada vez. Agregue la ralladura\r\ny un chorrito de jugo de limón, luego incorporar\r\nharina. Verifique la consistencia de la masa; eso\r\ndebe caer suavemente del extremo de una cuchara.\r\nAgrega más jugo de limón si está un poco rígido.","Forre un molde para panecillos de 12 agujeros con cajas para pasteles.\r\ny ponga 1 cucharada grande de mezcla en cada uno. Suave\r\nLuego haz un pequeño chapuzón en el centro. Cuchara\r\n1 cucharadita de cuajada de limón en cada salsa y cubra\r\ncon 1 cucharada de mezcla para pastel. Hornee por 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, colocar las claras en\r\nEn un recipiente limpio, bata hasta que se formen picos rígidos.\r\nluego agregue el resto del azúcar una cucharada\r\na la vez. Sigue batiendo hasta que la mezcla\r\nse ve brillante y se ha espesado un poco,\r\ncomo espuma de afeitar. Vierta la mezcla en\r\nuna bolsa para congelar y cortar el extremo para\r\ndejar un agujero de 1,5 cm de diámetro.","Sacar los bizcochos del horno – tapas\r\ndebe estar muy pálida y firme – entonces\r\nColoca merengue por todos los pasteles. Regresar\r\nal horno durante 10-15 minutos hasta que los pasteles\r\nestán bien cocidos y merenguen ligeramente\r\ndorado. Se puede realizar con 1 día de antelación."]','2026-01-11 12:56:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13204,9156,'es','Pastelitos de la pequeña Luisa','Estos cupcakes brindan dulces estallidos de alegría con cada bocado, perfectos para una celebración o fiesta.','["175 g de mantequilla, blanda","350 g de azúcar en polvo blanca o dorada","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","5 huevos, 4 separados","175 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","150ml de leche","12 cucharaditas de mermelada de frambuesa (use una mermelada firme, nosotros usamos Waitrose Essential Raspberry Jam)","85 g de coco rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4\r\ny forre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con cajas.\r\nEn un tazón grande mezcle los\r\nmantequilla, 175g de azúcar y vainilla\r\nextraiga hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Batir en el\r\nhuevo entero, seguido de las 4 yemas,\r\nantes de incorporar brevemente la harina, hornear\r\npolvo y leche hasta que quede suave. dividir\r\ndos tercios de la mezcla uniformemente entre\r\nlos casos, luego cubra el centro de cada\r\ncon 1 cucharadita de mermelada. Divida el pastel restante\r\nmezcle por encima, usando un dedo mojado para\r\nalíselo en su lugar para que no se vea ningún atasco.\r\nHornee durante 18-22 minutos hasta que pinche una brocheta.\r\nal centro sale limpio. espera\r\nhasta que esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, luego transfiéralo\r\nlos pasteles a una bandeja para hornear plana.","Baje el horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼.\r\nEn un bol grande y limpio, bata los 4 huevos.\r\nclaras hasta que estén firmes, luego continúe batiendo\r\nmientras vas agregando poco a poco el resto\r\n175 g de azúcar. Batir hasta que esté espeso y brillante,\r\nluego agregue el coco y use\r\ncucharadas de la mezcla para cubrir cada uno\r\npastel. Hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que\r\nel exterior del merengue esté crujiente, luego\r\nenfriar antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13205,8363,'es','rosas de azúcar simples','Estas bonitas rosas se pueden utilizar en pasteles y cupcakes para darle un acabado romántico y sofisticado.','["pasta colorante comestible (usamos Claret y Party Green)","200 g de glaseado listo para enrollar","un poco de grasa vegetal sólida, para enrollar (ver saber hacer más abajo)","brillo comestible (usamos un rosa brillante), opcional","destellos comestibles (usamos rosa brillante), opcional"]','["Empieza con las rosas. Amasar un poco de pasta colorante en 150 g de glaseado hasta que\r\npálido y uniforme. Divídalas en tres bolas y luego agregue un poco más de colorante a dos, dando tres profundidades de color diferentes. Mantener bajo film transparente. Frote una capa muy fina de grasa sobre una superficie de trabajo lisa. Despliegue uno de los\r\nBolas de glaseado finas, de aproximadamente 1 a 2 mm, luego córtelas en un rectángulo de aproximadamente 8 x 20 cm. Corta una tira de glaseado de 1 cm a lo ancho y deja el resto cubierto.","Enrolle con cuidado el glaseado hacia arriba y alrededor de sí mismo. Para una apariencia de rosa más realista, comience a rodar ligeramente inclinado para que el\r\nEl borde exterior de la rosa terminada sobresale más que el centro. Cuando faltan unos 2 cm, comience a guiar el extremo del glaseado hacia abajo y hacia abajo para formar un bonito capullo de rosa. Pellizque para darle forma, luego corte o pellizque la parte inferior. Reservar para al menos\r\nal menos 1 hora hasta que esté firme. Repita con el resto del glaseado.","Para las hojas, colorea el resto del glaseado de verde. Pellizque los trozos pequeños del tamaño de un guisante, forme bolitas y luego aplánelas un poco. Pellizque un extremo para darle forma de hoja. Dejar secar.","Una vez que las rosas estén secas y firmes, espolvorea un poco de brillo en cada rosa con un pincel o con la yema del dedo. Espolvoree con destellos, si los usa. Coloque las rosas sobre los cupcakes en grupos de tres, seguidos de tres hojas. Necesitarás 36 hojas y rosas para 12 pasteles."]','2026-01-11 12:56:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13206,9158,'es','Muffins salados de espinacas','Prepara estos muffins súper verdes como primer alimento de destete. Elaboradas con espinacas, queso y harina integral, son un buen primer alimento para bebés a partir de los seis meses.','["200 g de espinacas frescas","100 g de queso cheddar rallado","1 cucharada de tomillo seco","2 huevos","150 ml de yogur griego","2-3 cucharadas de leche","150 g de harina común","150 g de harina integral","3 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","mantequilla, para la lata"]','["Pon el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Pon las espinacas en un procesador de alimentos y tritura hasta que estén desmenuzadas (no hechas puré). Poner en un bol junto con el queso rallado y el tomillo seco.","Rompe los huevos en un bol y mézclalos con el yogur. Mezcle 2 cucharadas de leche y agregue otra cucharada si es necesario.","Tamice la harina y el polvo para hornear sobre el tazón, luego mezcle bien para combinar.","Unte con mantequilla un molde para muffins, luego agregue la masa y hornee durante 20-25 minutos. Fresco."]','2026-01-11 12:56:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13207,9159,'es','Focaccia de fresa y chocolate','Muestre las dulces fresas Morrisons Market Street en este sencillo horneado: la focaccia no siempre tiene que ser sabrosa','["2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","1½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","100 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos grandes","150 g de fresas Morrisons Market Street, cortadas por la mitad","1½ cucharada de azúcar demerara"]','["Vierta el azúcar en un bol y vierta 350 ml de agua tibia. Revuelva bien para disolver el azúcar y luego agregue la levadura. Agrega la harina, la sal, 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y el chocolate. Revuelva bien para formar una bola y colóquela sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que esté elástica, suave y menos pegajosa. Transfiera a un tazón limpio, cubra y deje reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 a 2 horas, o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Forre un molde para hornear de 25 x 35 cm con papel para hornear y rocíe 1 cucharada de aceite sobre la base. Vierta suavemente la focaccia en la lata preparada, estirándola ligeramente para que llegue a los lados, luego cúbrala y déjela a un lado en un lugar cálido durante 30 minutos a 1 hora hasta que suba y esté hinchada.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Rocía el aceite de oliva restante y luego, con las manos, haz hoyuelos en toda la masa. Esparce las fresas, presionándolas ligeramente en los hoyuelos. Espolvorea azúcar demerara y hornea durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté completamente dorado. Retirar y reservar hasta que esté tibio antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13208,9160,'es','Galette de arándanos y almendras','Dale a los mejores arándanos del pasado la oportunidad de brillar en esta galette de almendras. Sirva cortado en gajos con helado de vainilla para un postre familiar fácil.','["400 g de arándanos","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","1 limón, exprimido","½ cucharadita de canela molida","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharadas de almendras molidas","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas","1 huevo, batido","1½ cucharada de azúcar demerara","helado de vainilla, para servir","200 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","150 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubos","3-4 cucharadas de leche"]','["Para hacer la masa, vierte la harina, el azúcar, la vainilla, la mantequilla y una pizca de sal en un procesador de alimentos. Mezcle hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino, luego vierta 3 cucharadas de leche y presione hasta que comience a unirse, agregando un poco más de leche si es necesario. Forme una bola y luego forme un disco. Envolver bien y enfriar durante 30 minutos. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y coloca una bandeja para hornear grande adentro para calentar. Espolvoree ligeramente una superficie de trabajo limpia con harina y extienda la masa hasta que mida 30 cm de circunferencia. Transfiera a una hoja de papel para hornear. Vierta los arándanos, la harina de maíz, el jugo de limón, la canela y el azúcar en un bol y revuelva bien.","Espolvorea las almendras molidas sobre la base de la masa, dejando un borde de 4 cm, luego vierte la mezcla de arándanos encima y extiéndela. Esparcir las almendras en copos y luego doblar el borde de la masa, superponiendo ligeramente el relleno. Pincelar un poco de huevo por el borde y espolvorear sobre el azúcar demerara.","Deslice con cuidado la galette sobre la bandeja para hornear caliente y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que la masa esté dorada. Dejar reposar y enfriar en la bandeja hasta que esté tibio. Servir cortado en gajos con helado de vainilla."]','2026-01-11 12:56:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13209,9161,'es','pastel de jengibre jamaicano','Hornee este pastel pegajoso y picante con ingredientes que históricamente prosperaron en Jamaica; se disfruta mejor con una taza de té por la tarde.','["120 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda, más un poco más para la lata","285 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 huevos","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","80 ml de jarabe de jengibre de tallo (de un frasco de jengibre de tallo), más un poco más para la parte superior","50ml de miel","110ml de leche de coco"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g (2 libras) con papel para hornear. Mezcle la harina, el bicarbonato, el polvo para hornear, la mezcla de especias, el jengibre y ½ cucharadita de sal fina en un bol.","En un recipiente aparte, vierta la mantequilla y el azúcar y bata con una batidora eléctrica, hasta que quede suave y esponjoso, de 3 a 5 minutos. Agrega los huevos, la vainilla, el jarabe de jengibre, la miel y la leche de coco y bate hasta que se mezclen uniformemente.","Vierta los ingredientes secos y doble suavemente la masa hasta que no queden rayas de harina, teniendo cuidado de no mezclar demasiado. Vierta la masa en el molde preparado y hornee en el estante central del horno durante 45-55 minutos, hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Retirar y untar con un poco de almíbar de jengibre de tallo. Déjelo en el molde hasta que se enfríe por completo y luego sirva en rodajas. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:56:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13210,9162,'es','Pan de nueces con chispas de chocolate y nueces','¿Te encanta el pan de plátano? Te encantará este pan de nueces, que en realidad es más bien un pastel. La calabaza aporta dulzura manteniendo la textura densa y esponjosa.','["250 g de calabaza","2 huevos","125ml de aceite vegetal o de girasol","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","100ml de leche","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","¼ cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","225 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de chocolate amargo, picado","75 g de nueces pecanas, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Corte la calabaza en cubos de 2 cm, viértala en un recipiente resistente al calor, luego agregue 2 cucharadas de agua, cubra con un plato o tapa resistente al calor y cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 5 a 8 minutos hasta que esté suave. (O ase o fría al aire durante 15-20 minutos a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.) Deje enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g con papel para hornear. Triture la calabaza con un tenedor, luego agregue los huevos, el aceite, el azúcar, la leche, el extracto de vainilla, las especias y ½ cucharadita de sal. Mezcle hasta que quede suave, luego agregue la harina y el polvo para hornear. Mezcle nuevamente hasta que quede suave y no queden bolsas de harina.","Revuelva la mayor parte del chocolate picado y las nueces. Vierta la masa en el molde preparado y esparza sobre el chocolate y las nueces restantes.","Hornee en el centro del horno durante 50 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorado, y al insertar una brocheta en el centro del pastel, éste salga limpio. Si queda algo de masa húmeda adherida a la brocheta, regrese al horno por otros 5 minutos y luego verifique nuevamente. Una vez cocido, déjelo enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético a temperatura ambiente hasta por cinco días o congelado hasta por tres meses."]','2026-01-11 12:56:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13211,9163,'es','galletas de tenedor','Llene su lata de galletas con estas delicias fáciles que toman su nombre de la marca del tenedor que se agrega antes de hornear. Bóñelos en chocolate, si lo desea, para darle un toque más agradable.','["100 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","150 g de harina con levadura","100 g de chocolate amargo, para cubrir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forra una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Vierta la mantequilla y el azúcar en un tazón y bata, usando batidoras eléctricas o una batidora de pie, durante 3 a 5 minutos, hasta que estén muy suaves y cremosos. Vierte la vainilla y bate por 20 segundos, hasta que esté bien incorporada. Agrega la harina y revuelve con una espátula. Una vez casi mezclado, juntar con las manos.","Divida la masa en 18-20 bolas, que pesen aproximadamente 15 g cada una, y forme bolas. Coloque las bolas en las bandejas para hornear preparadas, bien espaciadas. Con un tenedor sumergido en agua, presione suavemente hacia abajo para aplanar las bolas y deje una marca del tenedor. Hornee durante 12-15 minutos, hasta que los bordes estén dorados pálidos. Dejar enfriar completamente en las bandejas.","Para cubrir las galletas con chocolate, derrita el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor, colóquelo sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento. Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Una vez que las galletas se hayan enfriado, sumerja la mitad de cada galleta en el chocolate y luego transfiéralas con cuidado a la rejilla para que cuajen."]','2026-01-11 12:56:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13212,9164,'es','Pastel de pan de jengibre pegajoso','Disfrute de una rebanada de pastel de jengibre pegajoso con una taza de té por la tarde o llévelo a tomar un café por la mañana: siempre es un placer para el público.','["200 g de mantequilla, más un extra para la lata","100 g de miel","100 g de melaza negra","2 bolas de tallo de jengibre de un frasco, picadas, más 2 cucharadas de almíbar","225ml de leche","275 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de nuez moscada recién rallada","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","1 huevo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pan de 2 litros. Ponga la mantequilla, la miel, la melaza, el jengibre picado y el almíbar de jengibre en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Dejar enfriar unos minutos, luego verter la leche y dejar enfriar unos 15 minutos.","Tamiza la harina, el bicarbonato y las especias en un tazón grande, luego vierte la mezcla de leche y revuelve para combinar. Batir el huevo y luego verter la mezcla en el molde preparado. Hornee en el horno durante 1 hora, o hasta que el pastel esté bien cocido y al insertar un palillo en el centro, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos y luego desmoldar para que se enfríe completamente sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 12:56:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13213,6175,'es','Coli cremoso, brioche y laurel horneado','Crea este cremoso horneado de queso y coliflor con trozos añadidos de brioche para un reconfortante acompañamiento navideño o asado dominical.','["750ml de leche entera","3 hojas de laurel","1 coliflor grande (unos 750 g), cortada en trozos, con hojas y todo","75 g de mantequilla","75 g de harina común","75ml de nata doble","rallado de nuez moscada","2 tsp Dijon mustard","75 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana","50 g de brioche, cortado en cubos de 1 cm"]','["Calentar la leche y el laurel en una cacerola a fuego lento durante unos minutos. Una vez cocido al vapor, apaga el fuego. Dejar en infusión durante 10 minutos. Mientras tanto, poner el cauli en otra cacerola, cubrir con agua caliente y hervir durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté tierno. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor en el colador.","Derretir la mantequilla en la sartén de coliflor (no es necesario lavarla) a fuego medio. Agregue la harina y cocine por uno o dos minutos, revolviendo para hacer una pasta arenosa. Agrega un cucharón de leche tibia y revuelve hasta que quede suave. Sigue agregando la leche, revolviendo bien, hasta tener una salsa suave. Agrega la nata, la nuez moscada, la mostaza y la mitad del queso. Sazone bien.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 si cocinas inmediatamente. Coloca la coliflor en una fuente para horno (la nuestra era de 20 x 30 cm), colocando las hojas para que sobresalgan un poco, para que queden bien crujientes. Vierta sobre la salsa, asegurándose de que la coliflor esté completamente cubierta. Esparza sobre el brioche y el queso restante. Se mantendrá frío durante dos días. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 12:56:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13214,9165,'es','Pastel de taza de plátano','Prepare este sencillo pastel de plátano en el microondas como postre rápido para uno. Agregue nueces picadas o chispas de chocolate, si lo desea, y rocíe con jarabe de arce.','["1 plátano, pelado","1 huevo batido","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal o de girasol","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 cucharadas de jarabe de arce, más un poco más para rociar (opcional)","4 cucharadas de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharada de nueces pecanas picadas o chispas de chocolate (opcional)"]','["Corte 2 rodajas finas de plátano del centro de la fruta, reserve y luego triture el resto.","Coloque el puré de plátano en una taza apta para microondas, luego agregue los ingredientes restantes, excepto las rodajas de plátano. Cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 1 minuto, 30 segundos y 2 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido y al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar durante 1 minuto, luego cubra con las rodajas de plátano y rocíe con jarabe de arce, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:56:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13215,9166,'es','donas azucaradas','Evoque recuerdos de días en la playa con estos donuts caseros estilo marinero, con un exterior crujiente y azucarado y un centro cálido y esponjoso; pruébelos con salsas para mojar.','["2 huevos","300 ml de crema agria","400 g de harina con levadura, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 limón rallado (opcional)","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo, más 75 g para espolvorear","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","40 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubos y ligeramente blanda","aceite vegetal, para freír"]','["Batir los huevos y la nata agria en una jarra y reservar. Vierta la harina, la ralladura de limón (si la usa), 2 cucharadas de azúcar, el bicarbonato y una pizca de sal en un tazón mediano, revuelva brevemente para combinar y luego frote la mantequilla con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado grueso. Vierta la mezcla de crema agria y forme una masa con un cuchillo para cubiertos.","Coloca la masa sobre una superficie enharinada. Amasar brevemente hasta obtener una masa cohesiva y sin vetas secas de harina. Enharine ligeramente la parte superior de la masa y luego dé golpecitos suaves hasta que tenga unos 2,5 cm de grosor. Elimina las rosquillas con un cortador redondo de 3,5 cm y vuelve a enrollar los restos hasta que tengas unas 40 rosquillas.","Llene una cacerola mediana con no más de un tercio de su capacidad con aceite. Caliente a fuego lento a 180 ° C, o hasta que un cubo de pan chisporrotee y se dore en 30 segundos. Vierta los 75 g de azúcar en un recipiente poco profundo. Dejar de lado.","Sumerja con cuidado las donas en el aceite caliente y fríalas durante 3-4 minutos hasta que estén doradas y bien cocidas, moviéndolas suavemente con una rodaja de pescado o una espumadera para que adquieran un color uniforme. Transfiera a una rejilla colocada sobre una hoja de papel de cocina para escurrir y luego, mientras aún esté caliente, agregue el tazón de azúcar para cubrir. Si lo desea, divídalo en bolsas de papel antes de servir. Es mejor servirlo el día en que se preparan."]','2026-01-11 12:56:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13216,9167,'es','Chuletas de cerdo al horno','Disfrute de chuletas de cerdo al horno cocinadas en un glaseado de miel y mostaza integral con papas nuevas para una cena deliciosamente fácil, solo agregue sus verduras favoritas.','["1 kg de patatas nuevas, partidas por la mitad","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","6 dientes de ajo, machacados","un puñado pequeño de tomillo","6 cucharadas de miel","6 cucharadas de mostaza integral","4 chuletas de cerdo con hueso y cortadas gruesas (de unos 250 g cada una)"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Mezcle las patatas, el aceite, el ajo y el tomillo en una bandeja para asar poco profunda y mezcle con las manos para cubrirlos con el aceite. Sazone bien. Ase durante 25 minutos hasta que las patatas estén tiernas al pincharlas con un cuchillo.","Batir la miel y la mostaza en un tazón pequeño. Sazone las chuletas de cerdo con sal y pimienta y luego unte con la mitad de la marinada. Coloque las papas en la bandeja y hornee por otros 10 minutos antes de darles la vuelta a las chuletas y verterlas sobre el glaseado restante. Continúe horneando durante 10 minutos más hasta que esté bien cocido."]','2026-01-11 12:56:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13217,9168,'es','Rollos de pizza de peperoni','Prepare estos rollos de pizza de pepperoni para toda la familia. Puedes acelerar las cosas si lo deseas usando masa para pizza y salsa para pizza ya preparadas.','["450 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","5 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para fermentar","1 cucharada de polenta fina o harina de maíz","175 g de salsa para pizza","100 g de mozzarella rallada","75 g de peperoni","manojo pequeño de albahaca, picada"]','["Pon la harina y la levadura en un bol grande. Agregue 1 cucharadita de azúcar y 1½ cucharadita de sal y mezcle para combinar. Agregue 300 ml de agua tibia y 2 cucharaditas de aceite y mezcle con las manos o con el gancho para masa de una batidora de pie hasta que se forme una masa. Si la hace a mano, coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase durante 10 minutos hasta que la masa se sienta suave y elástica, o amase con la batidora durante 5 minutos.","Limpiar y engrasar ligeramente el bol, verter la masa y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 2 horas, o hasta que aproximadamente duplique su tamaño. También puedes guardarlo en el refrigerador durante la noche; simplemente déjalo a temperatura ambiente antes de darle forma.","Forre sin apretar un molde para pasteles de 22 cm o una sartén para horno con un disco de papel para hornear y espolvoree 1 cucharadita de polenta sobre la base. Esparce la polenta restante sobre una superficie de trabajo junto con un poco de harina (agrega más si comienza a pegarse) y volca la masa encima. Enrolla y estira la masa hasta formar un rectángulo, de unos 35 x 45 cm. Unte la salsa para pizza encima y luego esparza sobre el queso, el pepperoni y la albahaca. Desde el lado más largo, enrolle bien. masa para darle forma de salchicha. Utilice un cuchillo afilado para cortarlo en ocho trozos y colóquelo con el lado cortado hacia arriba en la lata o sartén. Cubra sin apretar y déjelo reposar durante otros 30 minutos hasta que los panecillos se vean ligeros e hinchados.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Hornea los panecillos durante 30-35 minutos hasta que estén dorados y el queso rezume. Déjelo enfriar durante 5 minutos antes de servir. Es mejor consumirlo dentro de las 24 horas siguientes."]','2026-01-11 12:56:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13218,9169,'es','Pastel de jamón, queso y patatas','¿Te apetece comida reconfortante? Prueba este sencillo pastel de jamón, queso y patatas, que puedes preparar con sólo cinco ingredientes. Conviértalo en una comida familiar sirviéndolo con una ensalada verde.','["350 g de patatas nuevas","375 g de hojaldre ya enrollado","100 g de crema fresca","50 g de jamón en lonchas finas","125 g de queso brie o camembert, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas","ensalada verde, para servir (opcional)"]','["Hervir las patatas en agua con sal durante 8-10 minutos, hasta que estén tiernas pero aún firmes. Dejar enfriar y luego cortar en rodajas.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Desenrollar la masa con su papel de hornear en una bandeja para hornear. Reservar 1 cucharada de crème fraîche y esparcir el resto sobre la masa dejando un borde de 2 cm alrededor del borde. Estación. Coloque las patatas, el jamón y el queso sobre la mitad de la masa y sazone las patatas a medida que avanza.","Dobla la otra mitad de la masa y usa un tenedor para sellar los bordes. Recorte con un cuchillo para obtener un acabado prolijo: el pastel debe verse como un rollo de salchicha grande. Mezcle un poco de agua con la crème fraîche reservada y luego unte toda la masa. Haga algunos cortes a lo largo y luego hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Déjelo enfriar durante 10 minutos y luego sírvalo con una ensalada, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:56:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13219,9170,'es','Pastel de natillas filo','Prepare nuestra tarta de natillas filo que agradará a todos. Hacer una tarta de natillas puede ser complicado, pero esta versión es igual de impresionante pero mucho más fácil de hacer.','["250ml de leche","150ml de nata doble","2 yemas de huevo (congela las claras para otra receta)","50 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","2 cucharadas de natilla instantánea en polvo","40 g de azúcar glas y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de canela molida","40 g de mantequilla, derretida","5 láminas grandes de masa filo"]','["Vierta la leche y la nata en una cacerola a fuego lento y caliente hasta que hierva a fuego lento, luego retire del fuego. Mientras tanto, vierta las yemas de huevo en un bol, agregue el azúcar y las natillas en polvo y bata hasta que quede suave. Vierta sobre la mezcla de crema tibia, revuelva bien y luego vierta nuevamente en la sartén. Cocine a fuego medio durante unos 5 minutos, revolviendo constantemente, hasta obtener una crema espesa. Cubra la superficie con papel para hornear o papel film encerado para que no se forme una piel. Se mantendrá cubierto y refrigerado hasta por tres días.","Para montar la tarta, mezcle el azúcar glas y la canela en un bol y reserve. Unte un molde para pasteles de fondo suelto de 22 cm con un poco de mantequilla. Desenreda la masa filo y coloca una hoja en el molde para pastel con un poco de saliente. Unte con más mantequilla y espolvoree con un poco de azúcar y canela. Repetir con otra hoja de masa, girándola unos 45 grados sobre la primera, luego volver a hacer lo mismo con las últimas tres hojas de masa, untando siempre con mantequilla y espolvoreando con azúcar. Vierta y alise el relleno de natillas, luego tire de la masa que sobresale hacia el centro, aplastándola para encerrar el relleno. Rocíe con la mantequilla restante y espolvoree con toda la mezcla de azúcar menos aproximadamente 1 cucharada.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Coloque el molde en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que la masa esté crujiente y dorada. Deje enfriar un poco, luego retírelo con cuidado del molde y transfiéralo a un plato para servir. Deje enfriar completamente a temperatura ambiente. Se conservará hasta un día, tapado, a temperatura ambiente. Espolvoree con un poco de azúcar glas y córtelo en gajos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13220,9171,'es','Pan de soda con semillas','Prepare nuestro sencillo pan integral sin levadura, que no requiere amasado ni fermentación. Hemos utilizado leche de avena apta para veganos, pero puedes utilizar leche normal si lo prefieres.','["520 g de harina integral normal, más un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de mezcla de cuatro semillas (girasol, calabaza, sésamo y lino dorado), más una cantidad adicional para espolvorear","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","400 ml de leche de avena fortificada","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezclar la harina, las semillas y el bicarbonato en un bol, luego mezclar la leche y el jugo de limón en una jarra pequeña y verterlo en los ingredientes secos. Revuelva con un cuchillo hasta que la mezcla forme una masa pegajosa.","Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y forme una bola ligeramente con las manos mojadas o enharinadas, ya que quedará pegajosa al manipularla. Colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear enharinada, déles forma si es necesario, luego espolvoree más semillas por encima y presiónelas ligeramente. Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté firme y dorado. Déjelo enfriar sobre una rejilla y luego envuélvalo en papel de aluminio hasta que lo necesite. Se mantendrá frío hasta por cuatro días o congelado hasta por un mes."]','2026-01-11 12:56:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13221,9172,'es','Lasaña Nduja','Actualice una lasaña clásica con la ayuda de nduja, que aporta riqueza adicional a un favorito de la familia. Disfrútelo con una ensalada verde fresca como acompañamiento.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados o rallados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate seco o normal","500 g de carne picada","4 cucharadas de nduja","2 tomates grandes, picados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","500 ml de caldo de verduras","1 ramita de albahaca, hojas recogidas y rasgadas","9 láminas de lasaña seca","200 g de mozzarella o cheddar rallado","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, desmenuzada","200 g de crema fresca","250 g de mascarpone","50 g de parmesano rallado y un poco más para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas y el ajo durante 5-6 minutos hasta que se ablanden un poco. Agrega el puré de tomate y revuelve. Añade la carne picada, partiéndola con el dorso de una cuchara y dórala durante unos minutos. Agregue la nduja, los tomates frescos y enlatados y el caldo. Sazone con sal, pimienta negra y 1 cucharadita de azúcar. Agregue la albahaca, luego cocine a fuego lento y cocine durante 45 minutos a 1 hora hasta que se reduzca ligeramente.","Para hacer la salsa blanca, mezcle en un bol la crème fraîche, el mascarpone, el parmesano y una buena pizca de pimienta negra.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Extienda un tercio del ragú de ternera sobre la base de una fuente para horno rectangular (la nuestra era de 25 x 18 cm), luego coloque tres láminas de lasaña. Vierta un tercio de la salsa blanca y luego agregue un puñado de mozzarella o queso cheddar rallado. Repita para hacer tres capas de cada una, terminando con el resto de la salsa blanca. Cubra con mozzarella y más parmesano rallado, si lo desea.","Cubra y hornee por 45 minutos, luego destape, reduzca la temperatura del horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y hornee por 15-20 minutos más hasta que el queso burbujee y esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 12:56:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13222,3791,'es','pan cetogénico','Pruebe este pan cetogénico de almendras como sustituto saludable del pan elaborado con nueces y semillas. El pan quedará ligeramente húmedo pero puedes secar las rebanadas en el horno o tostarlas.','["60 g de aceite de coco derretido y un poco más para la lata","100 g de harina de almendras","12g de psyllium recuerda","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","100 g de semillas molidas (nosotros utilizamos 50 g de semillas de girasol y 50 g de semillas de calabaza)","20 g de harina de coco","12 g de linaza molida","3 g de sal","3 huevos batidos","1 calabacín mediano, rallado","1 cucharada de vinagre de manzana"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Engrasar y forrar un molde para pan de 900 g con papel para hornear. Dejar de lado.","Coloque todos los ingredientes secos en un tazón grande para mezclar, revuelva y reserve.","Coloque el aceite de coco, los huevos, el calabacín y 115 ml de agua caliente en un tazón grande para mezclar aparte, luego viértalo en el tazón con los ingredientes secos y combine. Agregue el vinagre de sidra de manzana y mezcle suavemente; trate de no mezclar demasiado la masa.","Transfiera la mezcla al molde para pan. Mójate los dedos para alisar la parte superior del pan o utiliza el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee por 20 minutos, luego reduzca el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2 y hornee por 30 minutos más. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego transferir a una rejilla para enfriar. Cortar el pan y tostar las rebanadas en una sartén o en el horno."]','2026-01-11 12:56:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13223,9173,'es','Pastel de ciruela al revés','Disfrute de nuestro pastel invertido de ciruelas como un delicioso manjar con una taza de té o como un maravilloso pudín servido con una cucharada de natillas o un chorrito de crema doble.','["150 ml de aceite de girasol, más un extra para la lata","50 g de mantequilla, ablandada","300 g de azúcar moreno blando","6 ciruelas, deshuesadas y cortadas en 8 gajos","Bote de 284 ml de suero de leche","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 huevos","325 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar la base de un molde desmontable de 20 cm de profundidad. Combine la mantequilla con 50 g de azúcar moreno blando y extiéndala sobre la base del molde forrado. Coloca las rodajas de ciruela encima en círculos concéntricos.","Vierta el suero de leche, la vainilla, el aceite, el azúcar restante y los huevos en un tazón grande y bata durante 1 a 2 minutos con un tenedor o un batidor para romper los huevos. Agrega la harina y el bicarbonato de sodio y mezcla hasta obtener una masa suave. Vierta esto con cuidado sobre las ciruelas, luego póngalo en el horno durante 45 minutos a 1 hora hasta que al pinchar con una brocheta salga limpio. Deje enfriar completamente en el molde, luego retírelo e inviértalo sobre una tabla o plato para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13224,9174,'es','risitas','¿La galleta de tus sueños está crujiente por fuera y suave por dentro? Si es así, estas galletas de canela son para ti. Un horneado americano clásico, son populares por una razón','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","150 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","300 g de harina común","1½ cucharadita de crémor tártaro","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","3 cucharadas de leche","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de canela molida"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y ambos azúcares en un tazón grande con un batidor eléctrico durante 2 minutos hasta que quede suave y esponjoso.","Agrega la vainilla y bate hasta que se combine, raspando los lados una vez. Agregue la harina, el crémor tártaro, el bicarbonato de sodio y ¼ de cucharadita de sal y mezcle hasta que estén combinados. Agrega la leche para aflojar la mezcla.","Para la cobertura, combine el azúcar y la canela en un recipiente poco profundo. Forma una bola con 40 g de masa. Enrolle la bola de masa en la mezcla de canela y azúcar, luego colóquela en la bandeja preparada y presiónela ligeramente. Repita con el resto de la masa y la cobertura, espaciando las bolas unos 5 cm entre sí.","Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté dorado e inflado. Deje enfriar en la bandeja durante 5 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla y déjelo enfriar por completo. Se mantendrá en una lata hermética hasta por cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13225,9175,'es','Croissant horneado de frangipane y frambuesa','¿Te encantan los croissants de almendras? Te encantará este lujoso plato de brunch. Es una excelente manera de aprovechar los restos de masa y también puedes servirlos como postre.','["100 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para el plato","100 g de azúcar en polvo, más 1 cucharada","150 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharada de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","3 huevos","100 g de crème fraîche, más algo extra para servir","300ml de leche entera","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 croissants","150 g de frambuesas frescas o congeladas","25 g de almendras laminadas","yogurt, crema o helado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Unte con mantequilla una fuente para horno (la nuestra era de 18 x 26 cm) y reserve. Ponga la mantequilla, 100 g de azúcar en polvo, las almendras molidas, la harina y el extracto de almendras en un bol y luego rompa 1 huevo. Batir la mezcla con una batidora eléctrica hasta obtener una frangipane suave, aproximadamente 2 minutos.","Rompe los huevos restantes en una jarra grande y bate con la crema fresca, la leche, la vainilla y 1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo para hacer una crema suave.","Abra cada croissant y rellénelo con 2-3 cucharadas de frangipane y algunas frambuesas. Colóquelos en el plato con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Vierta sobre las natillas, asegurándose de que cada croissant esté saturado, luego vierta sobre el frangipane restante. Déjelo en remojo a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora. En esta etapa, el croissant horneado se puede enfriar durante la noche.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Esparce sobre las almendras en hojuelas y hornea en el medio del horno durante 35 minutos hasta que la crema esté cocida y las almendras tostadas. Sirva con crème fraîche, yogur, nata o helado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:56:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13226,9176,'es','pastel de frambuesa','Prepara este pastel veraniego con frambuesas frescas de temporada. Un poco de azúcar glas compensa el rojo de las frambuesas, pero también puedes servirlas con un glaseado.','["125 ml de aceite de girasol, más un extra para la lata","175 g de harina con levadura","175 g de azúcar en polvo","125ml de yogur griego 10% de grasa","3 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 limón, rallado","200 g de frambuesas","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear","100 g de frambuesas (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar un molde para pastel hondo de 20 cm de fondo suelto y cubrirlo con papel para hornear. Combine la harina y el azúcar en un bol. Dejar de lado.","Mezclar en otro bol el aceite, el yogur, los huevos, el extracto de vainilla y la ralladura de limón. Vierta la mezcla de harina y azúcar y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Incorpora suavemente las frambuesas y hornea durante 30-40 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar en el molde unos minutos y luego enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla. Espolvoree ligeramente con azúcar glas y sirva cubierto con más frambuesas, si lo desea. Se conservará hasta por tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:56:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13227,9177,'es','Esponjas mini victoria','Prepare estos bizcochos victoria del tamaño de un bocado para una merienda especial o una celebración de cumpleaños. Elige tu mermelada favorita para el relleno y luego agrega crema batida.','["150 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos","1 cucharada de leche","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","150 g de harina con levadura","250ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas, más un poco más para espolvorear","185 g de mermelada de tu elección (de fresa o frambuesa funciona bien)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con fundas de papel. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos, luego agregar los huevos, uno a la vez, raspando los lados del tazón después de cada adición.","Agrega la leche, la vainilla, la harina y una pizca de sal, luego vuelve a batir hasta que quede suave. Divida la masa uniformemente entre las cajas de papel; esto se puede hacer fácilmente con una bola de helado. Hornee durante 17-20 minutos, o hasta que los bizcochos estén dorados, leudados y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Una vez que esté completamente frío, los bizcochos se pueden congelar por hasta tres meses.","Retire las fundas de papel de los bizcochos y luego divida los bizcochos por la mitad a través del ecuador con un cuchillo de sierra pequeño. Dejar de lado.","Batir la nata y el azúcar glas hasta obtener picos suaves con una batidora eléctrica. Extienda un poco de mermelada sobre la base de cada bizcocho, luego vierta o coloque una cucharada de crema batida y haga un sándwich con la parte superior de los bizcochos. Espolvoree con un poco de azúcar glas antes de servir. Es mejor consumirlo el mismo día."]','2026-01-11 12:56:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13228,5441,'es','Quiche de espárragos, queso feta y eneldo','Aprovecha al máximo los huevos en esta versátil quiche de verduras. Horneado con queso feta y espárragos, envuelto en una masa con queso y es un complemento perfecto para un picnic.','["½ cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","500 g de espárragos (aproximadamente dos manojos), sin tallos leñosos","100ml de nata doble","300ml de crema fresca","1 cucharada de yogur natural","3 huevos","¼ cucharadita de pimienta blanca","¼ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","pequeño puñado de eneldo","200 g de queso feta, cortado en cubos de 1 cm","250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de queso duro vegetariano estilo italiano, rallado","130 g de mantequilla fría con sal, cortada en cubos"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofríe la cebolla durante 5 minutos. Agrega el ajo y cocina por 5 minutos más hasta que la cebolla esté suave pero no dorada. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua con sal y cocine los espárragos durante 3 minutos. Escurrir y luego sumergir en un recipiente con agua fría para detener el proceso de cocción. Escurrir nuevamente. Deje a un lado ocho tallos y luego corte el resto en trozos de 3 cm.","Para la masa, combine la harina y el queso en un bol, luego frote la mantequilla con los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Agregue 1 cucharada de agua fría a la vez hasta que la mezcla forme una masa; es posible que necesite de 3 a 6 cucharadas de agua. Envuélvalo y enfríe en el congelador durante 5 minutos para que se endurezca un poco.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta que sea lo suficientemente grande como para forrar un molde para flan de 23 cm de profundidad con una ligera superposición. Con la ayuda del rodillo, desenrede la masa sobre el molde y empújela suavemente hacia el borde. Recorta la masa que sobresale para que sobrepase 2 cm el borde del molde. Pincha suavemente toda la base de la masa con un tenedor y luego regresa al congelador para que se enfríe durante 15 minutos. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Arruga un cuadrado de papel para hornear y luego úsalo para forrar la caja de masa fría. Rellénelo con frijoles para hornear y hornee por 15 minutos. Retire los frijoles para hornear y el pergamino y hornee por 5 minutos más. Dejar enfriar. Mientras tanto, combine la nata, la crème fraîche, el yogur y los huevos en un bol, pero no revuelva demasiado, evite crear burbujas. Agregue la mezcla de cebolla frita, el pimiento y el pimentón, luego agregue el eneldo, la mayor parte del queso feta y los espárragos cocidos.","Pon la funda de hojaldre en una bandeja para horno. Vierta el relleno, asegurándose de que el queso feta y los espárragos picados se distribuyan uniformemente, luego agregue los espárragos enteros y el queso feta restante.","Mételo en el horno y reduce inmediatamente la temperatura a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Hornea durante 35-40 minutos hasta que cuaje con una ligera oscilación en el medio. Dejar enfriar antes de cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:56:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13229,3845,'es','Tarta de queso con limón y arándanos','Combine los sabores clásicos de limón y arándanos con un relleno cremoso inspirado en una tarta de queso para esta tarta. Sólo tarda 20 minutos en hornearse.','["320 g de masa de hojaldre ya laminada","1 huevo batido","225 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","2 limones, rallados y 1 en jugo","4 cucharadas de azúcar glas, tamizada","3 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","100 g de arándanos"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C/gas 6 con una bandeja para hornear adentro para calentar. Desenrede el hojaldre sobre su papel de horno y marque ligeramente un borde a unos 2 cm del borde alrededor de todo el hojaldre. Pincelar un poco de huevo batido alrededor del borde y reservar.","Batir el queso tierno, la mayor parte de la ralladura de limón y todo el jugo, 3 cucharadas de azúcar glas y el resto del huevo batido en un tazón mediano durante 1 minuto hasta que quede suave y ligeramente espeso.","Vierta la mezcla de tarta de queso sobre el centro de la base de la tarta, extendiéndola hasta el borde del borde con una espátula o el dorso de una cuchara. Coloque cucharaditas de cuajada de limón encima y, con un cubierto o una espátula, agite suavemente la cuajada en la mezcla de tarta de queso para crear un efecto veteado. Espolvoree los arándanos de manera uniforme, luego deslice con cuidado la tarta sobre la bandeja para hornear caliente dentro del horno y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que la masa esté dorada y crujiente en los bordes.","Deje que la tarta se enfríe por completo o hasta que esté tibia. Espolvoree con el resto del azúcar glas y espolvoree con el resto de la ralladura de limón, luego córtelo en rectángulos y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:56:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13230,5453,'es','Col lombarda asada con melaza de granada','Sirva esta col lombarda caramelizada y asada con semillas de granada rubí como guarnición vegetal especial esta Navidad.','["½ col lombarda, sin las hojas exteriores dañadas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada","50 g de semillas de granada"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cortar el repollo en cuatro gajos, dejando el corazón intacto (esto mantendrá los trozos juntos). Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear, frote los trozos de repollo con aceite y sazone bien. Ase durante 20 minutos.","Rocíe sobre la melaza de granada y regrese al horno por otros 8-10 minutos hasta que la melaza se caramelice. Espolvorea con semillas de granada antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13231,6339,'es','Pasteles fáciles de pollo y puerros','Prepare con anticipación estos cremosos pasteles de pollo y puerros con queso y congélelos, listos para esas frías noches de invierno en las que no tiene ganas de cocinar.','["25 g de mantequilla","3 puerros, lavados y rebanados","350 g de salsa de queso fresco en tarrina","½ manojo de cebollino, cortado en tiras","200 g de pollo cocido, desmenuzado","3 cucharadas de leche","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","Paquete de 320 g de masa quebrada","harina común, para espolvorear","1 huevo grande, batido","verduras verdes, para servir (opcional)"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén grande, luego agregue los puerros y cocine tapados durante 10 minutos hasta que estén muy suaves. Retire del fuego y agregue la salsa de queso, el cebollino, el pollo, la leche y la mostaza. Mezcle bien y vierta en platos pequeños o moldes.","Desenrolla la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Use un platillo para cortar círculos para la parte superior, colóquelos encima, recórtelos para que quepan, doble los bordes y glasee con huevo. Se mantendrá cubierto y congelado hasta por dos meses.","Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5 y hornee durante 45 minutos o, para cocinar congelado, caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cubra con papel aluminio y colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear. Hornee por 15 minutos. Reducir el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5 y hornear durante 45 minutos, quitando el papel de aluminio durante los últimos 30 minutos. Sirva con verduras verdes, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:56:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13232,5820,'es','Pasta horneada con albóndigas','Sirva una pasta vegana burbujeante horneada hecha con bolas sin carne Tesco Plant Chef en una rica salsa de tomate. Esta cena reconfortante y baja en calorías seguramente se convertirá en la favorita de la familia.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","12 bolas sin carne Tesco Plant Chef","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","pizca de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","500ml en puré","1 cucharadita de azúcar","manojo pequeño de albahaca, hojas cortadas y cortadas, tallos finamente picados","350 g de pasta del formato que prefieras","100 g de masa madre, triturada hasta obtener migajas finas en un procesador de alimentos","20 g de aceitunas negras, deshuesadas y partidas por la mitad (opcional)","ensalada verde, para servir"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén honda a fuego medio y fríe las bolas sin carne Tesco Plant Chef durante 10 minutos hasta que estén doradas y crujientes, volteándolas con frecuencia. Retirar a un plato con una espumadera.","Calienta otra cucharada de aceite en la misma sartén y fríe la cebolla durante 6-8 minutos hasta que esté suave y traslúcida. Agrega la mitad del ajo y las hojuelas de chile y sofríe durante 2 minutos más, luego agrega el puré de tomate y la mitad del orégano seco. Cocine un minuto más hasta que el puré se oscurezca un poco, luego agregue el vinagre, la passata, el azúcar, los tallos de albahaca y algunas hojas de albahaca. Vierta 200 ml de agua y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 15-20 minutos hasta que la salsa se espese un poco.","Mientras tanto, cocine la pasta en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 6-8 minutos hasta que esté tierna, pero aún poco cocida en el medio. Drenar. Mezclar el pan rallado de masa madre y el resto del ajo, el orégano y el aceite en un bol y sazonar. Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.","Vierta la pasta cocida, las albóndigas y las aceitunas (si las usa) en la sartén con la salsa y revuelva suavemente para combinar. Vierta todo en un plato de lasaña, luego esparza sobre el pan rallado con ajo y hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que la cobertura esté dorada y crujiente y la pasta esté al dente. Espolvoree con las hojas de albahaca restantes y sirva con una ensalada verde como acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 12:56:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13233,9178,'es','Tazas de galletas de mantequilla de maní','Combine la combinación ganadora de mantequilla de maní y chocolate amargo en estos moldes para galletas. Son perfectos para un picnic o un refrigerio para toda la familia.','["175 g de mantequilla, blanda","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada de extracto de vainilla","1 huevo grande","250 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","150 g de chocolate negro (al menos 70 % de cacao)","240 g de mantequilla de maní o de almendras"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Verter la mantequilla, el azúcar y la vainilla en un bol y batir con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Batir el huevo. Añadimos la harina, el bicarbonato y una pizca de sal, y mezclamos todo junto con la espátula.","Rompe trozos de masa del tamaño de una pelota de golf (aproximadamente 65 g cada uno) y presiona en los agujeros de un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros, asegurándote de que suba por los lados; si estás usando un molde para muffins hondo, la masa debe llegar aproximadamente a la mitad del lado de cada agujero. Hornee por 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado. La masa se hundirá mientras se hornea, así que déjala hasta que se enfríe lo suficiente como para manipularla, luego presiónala hacia los lados de los agujeros nuevamente. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Rompe el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor y derrítelo hasta que quede suave en el microondas en ráfagas de 20 segundos, o colócalo sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo asegurándote de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Retire los moldes para galletas de la lata (es posible que necesite un cuchillo para cubiertos para ayudarlo a hacer esto). Vierta 1 cucharadita de mantequilla de nueces en el centro de cada uno y luego cubra con el chocolate derretido. Deje enfriar hasta que el chocolate cuaje, aproximadamente 1 hora. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13234,6036,'es','Tomates al horno con queso feta y dukkah','Haga su propia mezcla de especias dukkah para espolvorear sobre tomates y queso feta, o compre una versión ya preparada si lo prefiere. Servir con panes planos de sésamo','["1 kg de mezcla de tomates maduros medianos y grandes","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo (opcional)","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","150 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","4 cucharadas de dukkah (ver más abajo)","perejil y hojas de menta, para servir","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de sal marina fina","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","25 g de pistachos, pelados y picados en trozos grandes","25 g de avellanas, peladas y picadas en trozos grandes","4 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de semillas de alcaravea"]','["Primero, haz la dukkah, mezcla los ingredientes y reserva. Para los panes planos, mezcle la harina, la levadura, el azúcar y la sal en un tazón grande. Agrega 300 ml de agua tibia y mezcla hasta formar una masa suave y pegajosa. Coloca la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amasa durante 5 minutos hasta que la masa esté suave. Regrese la masa al tazón, cubra y déjela reposar en un lugar cálido hasta que duplique su tamaño, aproximadamente 1 hora.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Incline la masa cocida sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y divídala en cuatro trozos. Enrolle cada pieza hasta formar una bola, luego extienda cada bola hasta formar un óvalo rugoso, de unos 4 mm de grosor. Transfiera con cuidado los óvalos de masa a dos bandejas para hornear grandes antiadherentes. Unte con aceite de oliva y espolvoree uniformemente con las semillas de sésamo. Hornee por 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y firme al tacto. Transfiera los panes planos horneados a una rejilla y déjelos enfriar.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Corta los tomates por la mitad a lo largo del ecuador y colócalos en una fuente grande para horno, con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Sazone con una pizca de sal marina, un poco de pimienta negra y azúcar, si es necesario. Rocíe con aceite y espolvoree sobre el queso feta y el dukkah.","Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que los tomates estén tiernos y jugosos y el queso feta esté dorado, pero no demasiado oscuro. Dejar reposar durante 5 minutos y luego esparcir sobre las hierbas frescas. Sirva caliente con los panes planos al lado."]','2026-01-11 12:56:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13235,9179,'es','Pastel de hojaldre de manzana y caramelo','Piense en un pastel de manzana hecho con un pastel grande en este pudín súper sencillo con centro de manzana caramelizada. Servir con una bola de helado o crema doble.','["6 manzanas para comer (unos 800 g), peladas, sin corazón y cortadas en cuartos","25 g de mantequilla","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","320 g de masa de hojaldre ya laminada","1 yema de huevo batida"]','["Pica las manzanas en trozos pequeños. Calienta la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio-alto hasta que chisporrotee, luego esparce la mayor parte del azúcar y reserva aproximadamente 1 cucharadita. Burbuja hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto y la mezcla esté pegajosa. Vierta las manzanas y revuelva para cubrir. Sazone con una pizca de escamas de sal marina y cocine durante 5-6 minutos hasta que las manzanas se ablanden y comiencen a caramelizarse y el jugo que hayan soltado se haya evaporado. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar por completo. Una vez enfriado, se mantendrá frío hasta por un día.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 con una bandeja para hornear dentro en el estante del medio. Desenreda la masa sobre su papel de horno. Vierta la mezcla de manzana sobre el lado derecho de la masa, dejando un borde de aproximadamente 1-2 cm alrededor del borde, luego unte el borde alrededor de la masa con un poco de yema de huevo batida. Dobla el lado izquierdo de la masa sobre el relleno de manzana para encerrarlo. Engarce o pellizque el borde, o use un tenedor para sellar. Utilice el dorso de un cuchillo para marcar seis triángulos sobre la parte superior del pastel y haga algunas hendiduras pequeñas en el centro de cada uno. Unte todo con el resto de la yema de huevo y luego espolvoree con la cucharadita de azúcar reservada.","Levante con cuidado el pastel, todavía sobre su pergamino, sobre la bandeja para hornear caliente en el horno. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté inflado y profundamente dorado. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos y luego córtelo en gajos utilizando los triángulos marcados como guía."]','2026-01-11 12:56:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13236,9180,'es','Budín de manzana y caramelo salado','Prepare este postre cálido y familiar en menos de una hora con manzanas y caramelo dorado. Servir caliente del horno con una bola de helado.','["1 cucharada de mantequilla, ablandada","3 huevos grandes y 2 yemas","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","200ml de leche entera","300ml de nata doble","375 g de lata de caramelo, batido hasta que quede suave","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","75 g de harina común","3 manzanas (nosotros usamos Pink Lady)","helado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla una fuente para horno de 30 x 20 x 4 cm. Ponga los huevos, el exceso de yemas, el azúcar, la leche, la nata, 200 g de caramelo, la vainilla y una pizca grande de sal marina en un bol grande, luego bata hasta que se combinen. Agregue la harina hasta que la masa esté suave.","Corta las manzanas por la mitad, descorazonalas y córtalas en rodajas de 1 cm; no es necesario pelarlas. Colóquelos en la fuente para horno y vierta sobre la masa. Hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que la masa esté firme en el centro, dorada y ligeramente leudada.","Rocíe sobre el caramelo restante y luego espolvoree con un poco más de sal marina. Dejar reposar 5-10 mins (se desinflará un poco). Sirva caliente con helado de vainilla o mantequilla de maní, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:56:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13237,9181,'es','Pastel de capas de limón con glaseado de queso tierno','Deléitese con una rebanada de pastel de limón para el té de la tarde. Con hermosas y ligeras capas de bizcocho, un toque cítrico compensa el rico y cremoso glaseado de queso blando.','["225 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","225 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos grandes","225 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","75 g de yogur natural","1 cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla","3 limones rallados","150 g de azúcar granulada","3 limones, ralladura de 2 cortados en tiras, exprimidos (necesitarás 60 ml)","150 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","150 g de azúcar glas tamizada","1 cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla","300 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar la base de dos moldes para sándwiches de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar durante 3 minutos con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave y esponjosa. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien entre cada adición y raspando los lados del tazón. Incorpora la harina y el polvo para hornear hasta que estén bien incorporados, luego agrega el yogur, la vainilla y la ralladura de limón. Divida entre los moldes y hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio.","Mientras tanto, haz la llovizna. Vierta el azúcar, el jugo de limón y 100 ml de agua en una cacerola pequeña a fuego medio y revuelva hasta que se disuelva. Agregue la ralladura de limón, lleve a ebullición y cocine a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos hasta que la ralladura se ablande y el líquido esté almibarado. Retire la ralladura a una hoja de papel para hornear con una espumadera y retire el almíbar del fuego.","Deje que los bizcochos se enfríen durante 10 minutos en los moldes y luego viértalos sobre la llovizna tibia. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Para el glaseado, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar glas con una batidora eléctrica durante 4-5 minutos hasta que quede suave, raspando los lados del tazón a medida que avanza. Agrega la vainilla y el queso tierno y bate durante 4 minutos más hasta que esté espeso y cremoso. No te preocupes si al principio no parece espeso: se aflojará y luego se espesará nuevamente a medida que lo batas.","Retire los bizcochos enfriados de las latas. Vierta el glaseado en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella. Coloque un bizcocho en un soporte para pasteles o en un plato para servir y coloque un poco menos de la mitad del glaseado alrededor del borde con un movimiento circular para obtener un efecto ondulado. Coloque un poco más de glaseado sobre el centro vacío (no es necesario que quede limpio) y alise con el dorso de una cuchara. Enfríe durante 45 minutos a 1 hora hasta que cuaje. Cubra con la segunda esponja, luego coloque ocho gotas de glaseado alrededor del borde a intervalos regulares, dejando un espacio entre cada una. Vierta la ralladura de limón confitada en cada espacio y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:56:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13238,6533,'es','Cebolla carbonizada y panes planos con queso feta batidos','Cubra los panes planos caseros con queso feta batido y cebollas carbonizadas para un almuerzo o cena sensacional. Termina con un toque de harissa, tomillo y miel.','["300 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","70 ml de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para fermentar.","½ cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","3 cebollas marrones, cortadas en gajos gruesos","5 ramitas de tomillo y hojas adicionales para servir","2 cucharadas de miel, más extra para servir","100 g de queso feta","50 g de yogur griego espeso","1-2 cucharadas de rosa harissa"]','["Combine la harina, 1 cucharadita de sal y la levadura en un tazón grande. Hacer un hueco en el centro y verter 150 ml de agua tibia y aceite de oliva. Mezcle hasta que se combinen, luego amase sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada durante 10 minutos. Vierta en un recipiente ligeramente engrasado, cubra y deje reposar durante al menos 1 hora, o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calentar el aceite de oliva virgen extra en una sartén a fuego alto y sofreír las cebollas durante unos 5 minutos hasta que empiecen a carbonizarse, revolviendo de vez en cuando. Coloca las cebollas en una fuente para asar con el tomillo y la miel. Ase durante 15 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Desmenuza el queso feta en un bol con el yogur y luego bate hasta que quede suave y cremoso.","Calienta una sartén seca a fuego medio. Divida la masa en cuatro a seis bolas y extiéndalas formando un círculo de 1 cm de grosor sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Freír, uno a la vez, durante 2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén bien cocidos y ligeramente carbonizados. Cubra con el yogur feta, la harissa, las cebollas asadas, un poco más de tomillo y miel y una pizca de sal marina."]','2026-01-11 12:56:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13239,4319,'es','Crutones caseros','Aprenda a hacer picatostes en casa con nuestra receta sencilla, nuestro método y nuestros mejores consejos. Estos servirán como aderezos crujientes para sopas, ensaladas y pastas horneadas calientes.','["1 diente de ajo","2 rebanadas gruesas de pan de masa madre","½ cucharada de aceite","1 cucharada de semillas mixtas","1 cucharada de perejil"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Frotar el diente de ajo entero por ambos lados de la masa madre. Cortarlo en trozos grandes y echarlo con el aceite, una buena pizca de sal y las semillas.","Extiéndalo en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Mezclar con el perejil picado. Espolvoree sobre sopa o ensalada para darle un toque más crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:56:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13240,4321,'es','patatas duquesa','Impresione a los invitados a la cena con una porción de papas duquesa. Elaborados con huevos, mantequilla y Grana Padano y colocados en espirales, son una guarnición deliciosa.','["500 g de patatas harinosas, picadas","1 huevo grande, separado","30 g de mantequilla blanda","30 g de Grana Padano, finamente rallado","rallado de nuez moscada","aceite vegetal, para la bandeja"]','["Cocine las patatas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 15 minutos hasta que estén muy tiernas al presionarlas contra el costado de la cacerola. Escurrir bien y dejar secar al vapor en la sartén durante 2 minutos. Triture las papas hasta que queden muy suaves; use un pasapurés si tiene uno, o use un machacador, luego presione las papas a través de un colador de metal para asegurarse de que no tengan grumos.","Mezcle la yema de huevo, la mantequilla y el queso en un tazón grande, luego agregue el puré, la nuez moscada y un poco de condimento. Mezclar bien con una espátula hasta que la mantequilla se haya derretido y esté bien incorporada. Se desprenderá de los lados del bol, de forma similar a la masa choux.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Vierta el puré en una manga pastelera con boquilla de estrella ancha. Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear y unte con un poco de aceite vegetal. Coloque 20 montículos puntiagudos del tamaño de una nuez en la bandeja preparada, como si estuviera glaseando un pastelito. Batir la clara de huevo con una pizca de sal y pincelar suavemente los montículos de patatas para que queden estriados.","Hornea las patatas durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén doradas y crujientes."]','2026-01-11 12:56:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13241,5259,'es','Pan de plátano con carne picada','Comienza el día de Navidad con un delicioso desayuno que puedes preparar con anticipación. El pan de plátano es el favorito de la familia y la carne picada lo lleva a un nivel superior.','["150 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada, más un poco más para la lata","90 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos grandes, batidos","150 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","2 plátanos maduros (200 g), pelados y triturados","150 g de carne picada (asegúrate de que sea vegetariana, si es necesario)","100 g de mantequilla salada, blanda","2 cucharadas de miel","2 cucharaditas de canela molida"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para pan de 900 g y forrar la base y los lados con papel para hornear. Dejar de lado.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave y esponjoso, luego agregar lentamente el huevo batido y luego la mitad de la harina. Agregue la harina restante, el polvo para hornear, la mezcla de especias, el puré de plátanos y la carne picada.","Vierta en el molde y hornee durante 1 hora hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio salga limpio (cubra con papel de aluminio si se oscurece demasiado rápido). Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego transferir a una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo.","Para hacer la mantequilla batida, bate la mantequilla, la miel y la canela con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén pálidas y esponjosas. Si lo desea, tueste rebanadas de pan y unte con mantequilla mientras esté caliente. El pan se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante tres días y la mantequilla fría hasta cinco."]','2026-01-11 12:56:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13242,4329,'es','Molinillos de kimchi, queso y cebolleta','Combine la acidez del kimchi con el queso cheddar añejo en estos fabulosos molinetes. Hacen estupendos canapés para celebraciones como Nochevieja','["150 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","70 g de kimchi, picado en trozos grandes","320 g de masa de hojaldre ya laminada","1 huevo, ligeramente batido","togarashi, para espolvorear (opcional)"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Combine el queso, las cebolletas y el kimchi en un tazón pequeño.","Desenrolle la masa, úntela con la mezcla de queso y kimchi, luego enróllela formando un rollo apretado desde uno de los lados largos. Cortar en 14 trozos.","Coloque los molinetes de masa, con el lado en espiral hacia arriba sobre las bandejas para hornear, bien espaciados. Pincelar con un poco de huevo batido y hornear durante 30-35 minutos, o hasta que estén dorados e inflados. Espolvoree con un poco de togarashi, si lo usa, y déjelo enfriar durante 5 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13243,9182,'es','Tarta fina de picadillo, mazapán y manzana','Sirva esta festiva tarta de carne picada, mazapán y manzana de inspiración francesa con crema fresca para eliminar la dulzura. Es un postre navideño fabuloso.','["320 g de masa de hojaldre ya laminada","5 cucharadas de carne picada (verifique que sea vegetariana, si es necesario)","200 g de mazapán listo para enrollar","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","4 manzanas Granny Smith medianas","25 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos pequeños","25 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","crème fraîche, para servir"]','["Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear y desenrolle la masa encima. Pinche todo con un tenedor, luego extienda la carne picada sobre la masa para que quede cubierta en una capa fina, dejando un borde de 1 cm alrededor de los bordes. Enfriar durante 20 minutos.","Extienda el mazapán sobre una superficie de trabajo espolvoreada con azúcar glas hasta obtener un rectángulo de aproximadamente 30 x 21 cm y unos 2 mm de grosor. Colóquelo sobre el rodillo y colóquelo sobre la masa, encima de la capa de carne picada. Debe encajar perfectamente en el centro de la masa, dentro del borde. Enfríe por otros 20 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 con una bandeja para hornear adentro. Pela y quita el corazón a las manzanas, pero mantenlas enteras. Con una mandolina o un cuchillo afilado, corte las manzanas en rodajas finas en forma transversal, de modo que obtenga aros finos de manzana. Coloque los aros de manzana sobre el mazapán en forma de espiral apretada superpuesta que vaya desde el exterior hacia el centro, o en ordenadas líneas superpuestas. Unte sobre la mantequilla y espolvoree con el azúcar.","Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que las manzanas estén doradas y caramelizadas y la masa esté bien cocida. Sirva en rodajas pequeñas con crème fraîche. Se conservará tapado en el frigorífico hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13244,5179,'es','Pan de jengibre sin gluten','Disfruta de nuestra versión de pan de jengibre sin gluten. Le hemos dado forma de estrellas para un regalo navideño que puedes regalar o usar para decorar tu árbol.','["100 g de mantequilla salada","3 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","100 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1½ cucharada de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","225 g de harina común sin gluten","50 g de azúcar glas"]','["En una sartén pequeña, caliente la mantequilla, el almíbar y el azúcar hasta que se derrita, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Déjelo a un lado para que se enfríe un poco. En un tazón grande mezcle el bicarbonato, el jengibre, la canela y la harina. Vierta la mezcla de mantequilla derretida y revuelva para combinar y, con las manos, junte para formar una masa. Quedará suave pero se asentará en el refrigerador.","Tome 2 hojas de papel vegetal, coloque la masa sobre una, déle forma de rectángulo y coloque la otra hoja encima. Estire la masa hasta obtener 1/2 cm de espesor y colóquela en el frigorífico durante 1 hora para que cuaje y se endurezca.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5 y forrar una bandeja de horno grande con papel vegetal antiadherente. Saca la masa enrollada del frigorífico y recorta formas. Nosotros hicimos estrellas de 9cm, pero también puedes elegir cualquier forma, dependiendo del tamaño necesitarás unos minutos menos/más en el horno. También hicimos algunos con estrellas más pequeñas recortadas en el centro.","Mientras tanto, haga el glaseado, combine el azúcar glas con 1 o 2 cucharadas de agua, hasta que esté espeso y se pueda pipetear, pero no lo suficientemente delgado como para que se corra. Decora las galletas enfriadas con cualquier diseño."]','2026-01-11 12:56:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13245,4046,'es','Tarta de cebolleta, guisantes y panceta','Pruebe nuestra sabrosa versión de tarta de hojaldre, hecha con guisantes, huevos, hierbas y panceta. Rápido y fácil, seguramente se convertirá en el favorito de toda la familia.','["Hoja de 320 g de hojaldre ya enrollado con mantequilla","8 cebolletas","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","100 g de panceta ahumada cortada en cubos","200 g de queso tierno","un puñado de menta, albahaca, perejil o cebollino (o use una mezcla), picados, más hojas enteras adicionales para servir","1 yema de huevo","25 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","1 cucharadita colmada de mostaza Dijon","100 g de guisantes congelados y descongelados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Desenredar la hoja de hojaldre sobre su papel de horno y deslizarla sobre una bandeja de horno grande. Marque un borde a aproximadamente 1 cm del borde alrededor de la masa, teniendo cuidado de no cortarla por completo. Pinche el centro con un tenedor y hornee durante 15 minutos hasta que esté inflado y dorado. Coloque las cebolletas en una bandeja para hornear pequeña, rocíe con aceite y sazone. Ásalos junto con la masa durante los últimos 5 minutos de cocción.","Mientras tanto, cocine la panceta en una sartén pequeña a fuego medio hasta que esté dorada. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Mezcle el queso tierno, las hierbas picadas, la yema de huevo, la mitad del parmesano y la mostaza y sazone bien. Aplaste suavemente la mitad de la base de la tarta con el dorso de una cuchara y luego extienda sobre la mezcla de queso tierno. Esparza los guisantes descongelados y la panceta sobre la mezcla de queso tierno y luego coloque las cebolletas asadas encima. Espolvorea sobre el queso parmesano restante y regresa al horno por 10 minutos. Esparza las hierbas de hoja entera restantes, luego córtelas en rodajas y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:56:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13246,4066,'es','Crujiente de chocolate','Deléitese con estos cuadrados crujientes de chocolate cuando necesite un capricho dulce. Quedan deliciosos con una taza de té o café.','["170 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida, más un poco más para la lata","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","170 g de azúcar en polvo","225 g de harina con levadura","25 g de cacao en polvo","1 huevo grande, batido","2 cucharadas de azúcar granulada"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde cuadrado de 20 cm y forrar con papel de hornear. Mezcle la mantequilla derretida y la vainilla en un tazón. Mezclar el azúcar en polvo, la harina y el cacao en otro bol.","Vierta el tazón de ingredientes húmedos en los secos y bata, luego agregue el huevo y bata nuevamente hasta que se combinen. Presione en la lata preparada. Cepille la parte superior con agua y espolvoree sobre el azúcar granulada.","Hornee durante 30-35 minutos. Deje enfriar un poco en el molde durante 5 minutos antes de cortarlo en cuadritos y transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:56:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13247,9183,'es','ratones de azúcar','Prepare estos ratones de azúcar al menos un día antes de servirlos, para que tengan tiempo de secarse. La receta rinde 12 ratones: ¡suficiente para uno para cada uno de tus familiares y amigos!','["1 clara de huevo","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","400-500 g de azúcar glas tamizada","colorante alimentario en gel o pasta rosa","pequeñas chispas de chocolate","hilo de cocina","palo de coctel","1 bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear"]','["Ponga la clara de huevo en un bol grande y bata hasta que esté espumosa. Agrega el jugo de limón.","Agregue gradualmente el azúcar glas con una cuchara de madera hasta que esté muy rígido, como una masa. O espolvoree la superficie de trabajo con un poco de azúcar glas y amase el azúcar en la mezcla hasta obtener la consistencia adecuada.","Divide la mezcla por la mitad. Agregue un punto de colorante rosa a la mitad y luego amase para distribuir uniformemente el color. Agrega un poquito más de colorante si quieres un color más fuerte. Deja la segunda mitad lisa.","Rompe un trozo de la mezcla del tamaño de una nuez y enróllalo hasta darle forma de cono redondeado, luego aplana un lado para que el ratón pueda sentarse sobre una superficie plana sin caerse. Pellizca las orejitas encima del extremo angosto y luego aprieta el mismo extremo en la nariz. Presiona chispas de chocolate en la cara debajo de las orejas para hacer los ojos. Corta un trozo de hilo de cocina de unos 4 cm de largo y empújalo hacia el extremo redondo del ratón para hacer una cola.","Use un palito de cóctel para aplicar una pequeña cantidad de colorante rosado en la nariz, luego coloque el ratón en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear.","Repita el proceso con las mezclas restantes de rosa y blanco, luego deje que los ratones se sequen durante al menos 12 horas."]','2026-01-11 12:56:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13248,9184,'es','galletas de mantequilla noruegas','Disfrute de estas tradicionales galletas de mantequilla noruegas en Navidad como regalo para familiares y amigos. Son rápidos de hacer y tienen un sabor delicioso.','["300 g de harina común, tamizada","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","200 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","125 g de azúcar glas más 2 cucharadas","2 cucharaditas de azúcar con infusión de vainilla o azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo, más 1 clara de huevo ligeramente batida para pintar","azúcar perlada o almendras en copos o picadas, para espolvorear"]','["Mezclar la harina, la levadura en polvo y una pizca de sal. Agrega la mantequilla y frota con los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca migajas gruesas. Mezcle todo el azúcar glas y el azúcar de vainilla, luego agregue el huevo entero y mezcle hasta que esté combinado, pero tenga cuidado de no mezclar demasiado.","Transfiera la masa a una bolsa de comida y póngala en el refrigerador para que se enfríe durante aproximadamente 1 hora.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Enrollar la masa fría en unas 40 bolas iguales (de unos 15 g cada una). Coloque las bolas de masa sobre dos bandejas para hornear forradas con papel para hornear, dejando espacio entre cada una para untar. Con el dorso de un tenedor, presione suavemente las bolas hacia abajo en el medio, de modo que se extiendan hasta un diámetro de unos 3 cm (se extenderán más a medida que se horneen). Si prefieres galletas planas, utiliza el fondo de un vaso.","Pincelamos las galletas con la clara de huevo batida y espolvoreamos por encima el azúcar perlado o las almendras. Hornee durante 10 minutos o hasta que estén bien cocidas (las galletas no deben estar completamente doradas, solo ligeramente doradas en los bordes). Retirar del horno y transferir a rejillas para que se enfríe por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:56:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13249,5966,'es','muffins de calabaza','Pruebe estos muffins de calabaza con especias y canela, fáciles de hornear, como refrigerio a media mañana. También son ideales para Halloween y la Noche de las Hogueras.','["225 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharada de canela molida (o 2 cucharaditas de especias de calabaza)","100 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de azúcar moreno claro y suave","200 g de puré de calabaza (en lata o casero; consulte \"combina bien\" a continuación)","2 huevos grandes","125 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, derretida"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forrar un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con moldes para muffins. Mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear, la canela y ambos azúcares en un tazón grande. Rompe los grumos de azúcar moreno frotándolos entre tus dedos.","Batir el puré y los huevos en una jarra y luego añadir a los ingredientes secos con la mantequilla derretida. Batir durante 1-2 minutos con un batidor de mano eléctrico hasta que esté combinado.","Hornee durante 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y levado y al insertar un pincho este salga limpio. Levante sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se conservará durante tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:56:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13250,6149,'es','empanadas de manzana','Invite a familiares y amigos a estas deliciosas empanadillas de manzana. Con relleno de manzana y canela revestido de hojaldre, quedan deliciosos servidos con helado.','["2 manzanas Bramley medianas-grandes, peladas, sin corazón y picadas en trozos grandes","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 manzana gala o de postre dulce, pelada, descorazonada y cortada en dados de 1 cm","Paquete de 320 g de hoja de hojaldre Jus-Rol™","2 cucharadas de leche para glasear","2 cucharaditas de azúcar demerara"]','["Pon la manzana Bramley, el azúcar y la canela en una cacerola pequeña con 1 cucharada de agua. Cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos hasta que la manzana se rompa y se convierta en una compota.","Agregue la mantequilla y la manzana Gala y cocine durante 5 minutos más, sin tapar, hasta que la manzana Gala esté suave pero conserve su forma y el exceso de agua se haya evaporado para formar una compota espesa alrededor de los trozos de Gala. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Desenreda la lámina de hojaldre Jus-Rol™ sobre una superficie de trabajo y córtala en 4 rectángulos iguales. Divide el relleno de manzana a un lado de cada uno de los rectángulos de hojaldre, dejando un borde de 1 cm. Cepille el borde con leche y doble el lado vacío de la masa sobre el relleno y pliegue. Unte con más leche y espolvoree sobre el azúcar. Hacer un pequeño agujero de vapor en medio de las empanadas.","Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado e inflado. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos sobre una rejilla (el relleno se derretirá cuando salga del horno por primera vez) antes de servir caliente con una bola de helado de vainilla o servir a temperatura ambiente. Conservar durante 2 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:56:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13251,9185,'es','Pan de jengibre fácil y definitivo','Haz algunas estrellas de pan de jengibre para colgar de tu árbol de Navidad. Esta masa de galleta es extremadamente tolerante si se trabaja demasiado, por lo que es perfecta para hornear con niños.','["100 g de mantequilla salada","3 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","100 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","225 g de harina común","50 g de azúcar glas"]','["Caliente la mantequilla, el almíbar y el azúcar juntos en una cacerola pequeña hasta que se derrita, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Mezcle el bicarbonato, el jengibre, la canela y la harina en un tazón grande. Vierta la mezcla de almíbar mantecoso y revuelva para combinar, luego use las manos para unir y formar una masa. La masa estará blanda en este punto, pero se endurecerá en el frigorífico.","Coloque la masa en una hoja de pergamino para hornear, forme un rectángulo y coloque otra hoja de pergamino encima. Estirar la masa hasta que tenga un espesor de ½ cm. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear para mantenerla plana, dejando el pergamino en su lugar, luego enfríe en el refrigerador durante 1 hora.","Calienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5 y cubre una bandeja para hornear grande con más papel para hornear. Saca la masa del frigorífico y corta formas con un cortador de galletas. Nosotros utilizamos estrellas de 9 cm, pero puedes elegir cualquier forma. También hicimos algunos con estrellas más pequeñas cortadas en el centro para pasar una cinta y colgarlas de un árbol de Navidad.","Coloque las formas, separadas, en la bandeja para hornear forrada y hornee durante 10 a 12 minutos. (Dependiendo del tamaño de los cortadores que utilices, puede que necesiten unos minutos más o menos de cocción en el horno). Dejar enfriar completamente en la bandeja para hornear.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el azúcar glas con 1-2 cucharadas de agua; desea crear una consistencia espesa y que se pueda pipetear, y no demasiado líquida o se correrá. Decorar las galletas enfriadas con el glaseado utilizando una manga pastelera de boquilla fina. Descubra cómo hacer una manga pastelera."]','2026-01-11 12:56:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13252,4117,'es','Muffins de limón fáciles','Hornee una tanda de estos sencillos muffins, rociados con un glaseado de limón picante, usando un método todo en uno. Son geniales para las once o cuando necesitas un capricho dulce.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada","100 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos batidos","115 g de harina con levadura","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 limones, rallados y exprimidos","100 g de yogur","150 g de azúcar glas","1 limón, exprimido"]','["Forre un molde para muffins con cajas grandes para muffins. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Vierta todos los ingredientes en un bol grande y mezcle hasta que quede suave con una cuchara de madera o una batidora eléctrica. Vierta cucharadas de masa en los moldes para muffins hasta que estén llenos hasta tres cuartas partes (puede preparar hasta 8, según el tamaño del molde). Hornea por 30 minutos o hasta que al pinchar con una brocheta este salga limpio. Dejar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Tamice el azúcar glas en un tazón y agregue gradualmente jugo de limón hasta obtener un glaseado espeso pero que se pueda verter; es posible que no necesite todo el jugo. Rocíe sobre los muffins enfriados y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:56:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13253,9186,'es','Muffins de huevo fáciles','Prepare estos mini muffins de huevo para un desayuno o almuerzo fácil con los niños. Añade jamón picado, tocino o salmón ahumado, si te apetece','["1 cucharada de aceite","150 g de brócoli, finamente picado","1 pimiento rojo, finamente picado","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","6 huevos grandes","1 cucharada de leche","una pizca grande de pimentón ahumado","50 g de queso cheddar o gruyere rallado","un puñado pequeño de cebollino picado (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4. Untar la mitad del aceite en un molde para muffins de 8 agujeros. Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén y agrega el brócoli, el pimiento y las cebolletas. Freír durante 5 minutos. Dejar enfriar.","Batir en un bol los huevos con la leche, el pimentón ahumado y la mitad del queso. Agrega las verduras cocidas. Vierta la mezcla de huevo en los agujeros para muffins y cubra cada uno con el queso restante y algunas cebolletas, si lo desea. Hornee durante 15-17 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y bien cocidos."]','2026-01-11 12:56:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13254,9187,'es','Crumble de ruibarbo y manzana','Utilice un exceso de ruibarbo y manzanas para este sencillo crumble. El jengibre molido añade un agradable toque especiado a la cobertura, pero omítelo si lo prefieres.','["450 g de ruibarbo, cortado en rodajas de 3 cm","350 g de manzanas (Bramley o Granny Smith funcionan bien), peladas y cortadas en trozos de 3 cm","1 vaina de vainilla, abierta o 1 cucharadita de pasta o extracto de vainilla","120 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","helado o natillas, para servir","200 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido (opcional)","100 g de mantequilla salada fría, picada","70 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle el ruibarbo, las manzanas, la vainilla y el azúcar en una fuente refractaria y ase durante 10 minutos.","Mezcle la harina y el jengibre, si lo usa, en un tazón grande. Frote la mantequilla con las yemas de los dedos para crear una mezcla con textura de pan rallado con trozos. Revuelva con el azúcar. Espolvoree la cobertura crumble sobre la fruta y cocine durante 30-35 minutos más o hasta que la cobertura esté ligeramente dorada. Servir con helado o natillas."]','2026-01-11 12:56:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13255,9188,'es','Mezcla y combina muffins de panqueques','Olvídate de estar parado frente a una hornilla volteando panqueques el Día de los Panqueques; en su lugar, prepara estos muffins de panqueques esponjosos. Son fáciles de hacer y a los niños les encantará ayudar.','["aceite de girasol o vegetal, para la lata","350 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","50 g de mantequilla","350ml de leche","2 huevos","2 cucharadas de jarabe de arce, más un poco más para servir","un puñado de frambuesas o arándanos, o un poco de cada uno","½ plátano, en rodajas","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Engrase generosamente un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros, utilizando una brocha de repostería para asegurarse de llegar a todas las esquinas y a los lados. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezclar la harina, la levadura en polvo y una pizca de sal en un bol.","Derretir la mantequilla en una jarra en el microondas. Agrega la leche, luego los huevos y el jarabe de arce, bate, luego vierte los ingredientes secos y vuelve a batir hasta obtener una masa suave. Divida uniformemente entre los agujeros de su lata.","Cubra cada muffin con algunas bayas o rodajas de plátano. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Pruebe si los muffins están cocidos empujando una brocheta en el centro de uno. Si sale limpio es que están listos. Si no, continúa cocinando unos minutos más. Una vez cocido, dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos y luego retirar del molde con un cuchillo para cubiertos. Apilar en un plato, espolvorear con azúcar glas y servir mientras aún está caliente con abundante jarabe de arce extra."]','2026-01-11 12:56:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13256,9189,'es','Tarta de frutas súper sencilla','Este sencillo pastel de frutas de una de nuestras lectoras más jóvenes, Bree Hamilton, es simple, utiliza ingredientes que se encuentran en las tiendas y es perfecto para un rápido estímulo invernal.','["175 ml de aceite de oliva, más un extra para engrasar","100 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","2 huevos batidos","225 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica","½ naranja, en jugo","½ limón, exprimido","200 g de frutos secos variados","200 g de mermelada de albaricoque","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Engrasar y forrar la base de dos moldes desmontables de 20 cm con papel para hornear.","Mezcle el aceite y el azúcar, agregue los huevos, la harina, el polvo para hornear, las especias y los jugos, y mezcle bien con una cuchara de madera hasta que se pueda verter y esté razonablemente líquido. Incorpora suavemente la fruta y luego divide la masa uniformemente entre las latas. Hornear durante 20-25 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro salga limpio, luego dejar enfriar.","Cuando esté frío, desmoldar y emparedar los bizcochos con mermelada. Tamizar un poco de azúcar glas encima para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13257,9190,'es','Pastel de muñeco de nieve derretido con leche malteada','A todo el mundo le encanta una Navidad blanca y este pastel de muñeco de nieve evoca ese sentimiento festivo. Los niños pueden ayudar a decorar con botones, glaseado y palitos de chocolate.','["500 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","500 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","10 huevos","200 g de harina común","200 g de yogur natural desnatado","460 g de harina con levadura","4 cucharadas de extracto de malta (o 2 cucharadas de pasta de vainilla) (ver el consejo a continuación)","1 cucharada de leche entera (o 2 cucharadas si usa pasta de vainilla)","400 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","700 g de azúcar glas","2 cucharadas de extracto de malta (o 1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla)","1 cucharada de leche entera","100 gramos de chocolate blanco","½ cucharadita de aceite vegetal","30 g de fondant negro","30 g de fondant naranja brillante","1 taco de madera, cortado del mismo largo que la nariz","2-3 botones gigantes de chocolate","2 palitos de mikado de chocolate blanco, para los brazos","2 moldes para pastel de 20 cm","Molde para pastel semiesférico de 16 cm (ver consejo a continuación)","tablero de pastel de 23 cm","tablero de pastel de 16 cm","botella exprimible"]','["Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Engrase dos moldes para pasteles redondos de 20 cm y cúbralos con papel para hornear. Engrase bien un molde para pastel semiesférico de 16 cm y colóquelo sobre un molde sobre una bandeja para hornear para mantenerlo firme.","Primero, haz los bizcochos. Con batidoras eléctricas o una batidora de mesa, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Vierta los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien la mezcla antes de agregar el siguiente. Si la mezcla comienza a verse cuajada, agregue 2 cucharadas de harina común. Incorpora el yogur.","Mezcle ambas harinas, agregue 1/2 cucharadita de sal y mezcle lentamente con la masa, seguido del extracto de malta (o pasta de vainilla) y la leche. Vierta la mitad de la mezcla en una de las latas de 20 cm y divida la mitad restante entre la otra lata de 20 cm y el hemisferio de 16 cm. Hornea la cantidad menor de masa para bizcocho en el molde de 20 cm y el molde de 16 cm durante 1 hora, y la cantidad mayor durante 1 hora 20 minutos o hasta que un pincho salga limpio al insertarlo en el medio de los pasteles. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos antes de desmoldar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se puede congelar en esta etapa hasta por tres meses.","Mientras tanto, haga la crema de mantequilla batiendo toda la mantequilla y la mitad del azúcar glas con una batidora eléctrica o de mesa. Agrega el resto del azúcar glas una vez incorporado, seguido del extracto de malta (o pasta de vainilla) y la leche. Reservar hasta que esté listo para usar.","Para armar, corte por la mitad el pastel más grande de 20 cm horizontalmente para que queden dos bizcochos del mismo tamaño que el pastel restante de 20 cm. Coloque una gota de crema de mantequilla en una tabla para pasteles de 23 cm (o soporte para pasteles) y extiéndala con una espátula. Pega una de las esponjas al tablero. Extienda una capa gruesa de crema de mantequilla encima del pastel y coloque otro bizcocho encima. Extiende otra capa gruesa y coloca el bizcocho final encima. Con una espátula, cubra todo el pastel con una fina capa de crema de mantequilla y alise los lados y la parte superior con cuidado, trabajando alrededor de todo el pastel, raspando el exceso de glaseado. Enfriar en el congelador durante 10 minutos o en el frigorífico durante 1 hora hasta que cuaje.","Mientras tanto, coloque el bizcocho semiesférico en la tabla para pasteles más pequeña y córtelo por la mitad horizontalmente. Rellene el centro con un poco de crema de mantequilla, haga un sándwich con la parte superior y cubra todo el pastel con una fina capa de crema de mantequilla. Enfriar en el congelador durante 5 minutos o en el frigorífico durante 30 minutos.","Saque el pastel más grande del refrigerador/congelador y cúbralo con otra capa de crema de mantequilla. Tenga cuidado al cubrir este tiempo, ya que desea que el pastel tenga un acabado suave. Pasar la espátula por agua caliente ayuda a suavizar los lados una vez que esté completamente cubierta. Enfriar nuevamente durante 5 minutos en el congelador.","Cubre el bizcocho semiesférico con crema de mantequilla y alisa con la espátula. Levanta con cuidado la semiesfera hasta el centro del bizcocho (como el bizcocho está congelado no debes dejar marcas de dedos). Presione ligeramente para fijar la crema de mantequilla. Si hay un espacio alrededor del borde, use una espátula pequeña para rellenar con la crema de mantequilla restante. Enfríe durante 10-15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, haz los ojos y la nariz con fondant de colores. Enrolle el fondant negro en dos bolas para los ojos y cinco bolas más pequeñas para la boca. Enrolla el fondant de naranja dándole forma de zanahoria. Deje reposar y endurecer ligeramente mientras prepara la ganache goteante.","Haga la ganache goteante mezclando el chocolate y el aceite y colóquelo en el microondas durante 30 segundos, revolviendo y luego dándole otros 30 segundos hasta que se derrita. Transfiera a una botella exprimible, luego vierta sobre los bordes del pastel redondo para crear el efecto de nieve derretida.","Para terminar el bizcocho, pega los ojos a la cabeza con un poco de crema de mantequilla restante. Introduce la clavija de madera en la nariz de la zanahoria, dejando un poco sobresaliendo para pegarla a la cara. Pega las cinco bolitas de fondant negro para la boca y los botones de chocolate en la parte delantera del pastel como botones. Inserta los palitos de Mikado a cada lado para los brazos. Lleva el pastel a temperatura ambiente antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:56:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13258,9191,'es','Tartas pop de melocotón y melba','Estos pasteles fáciles de preparar están rellenos de sabor y son muy divertidos para decorar con los más pequeños.','["200 g de frambuesas","Lata de 410 g de melocotón en rodajas en zumo de fruta, escurrido y picado","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","1 cucharada de miel","2 láminas de masa quebrada de 320 g","1 huevo batido","150 g de azúcar glas","frambuesas liofilizadas o chispas, opcional"]','["Reserva 6 frambuesas regordetas y vierte el resto en un bol. Agregue los duraznos y mezcle. En un tazón pequeño mezcle la harina de maíz y la miel hasta formar una pasta, vierta sobre la fruta y combine.","Desenrolla las láminas de masa y utiliza una rueda de pizza para cortar 6 rectángulos de cada una. Gire un trozo de masa de manera que el lado largo quede más cerca de usted y dóblelo por la mitad como un libro, para crear un pliegue por la mitad. Abra la masa y vierta el relleno de fruta en un lado, dejando un borde de aproximadamente 1 cm alrededor del borde. Pincelar los bordes con huevo batido y volver a doblar la masa para cubrir el relleno. Use un tenedor para sellar los bordes por todos lados, luego unte todo con más huevo. Haz algunos agujeros para que entre aire en la parte superior con el tenedor. Repita con el resto de la masa y el relleno. Coloque las paletas en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear y enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos o hasta 24 horas. Alternativamente, congélelo por hasta 2 meses.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Hornee las paletas durante 20 minutos, o hasta que la masa esté dorada y el relleno burbujee a través de los agujeros. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar durante al menos 20 minutos. Si cocina congelado, hornee por 5 minutos más. Mientras tanto, tritura las frambuesas restantes hasta que estén jugosas y mézclalas con el azúcar glas para hacer un glaseado espeso. Extienda una fina capa sobre las tartas y espolvoree con frambuesas liofilizadas o chispas, si lo desea. Cómelo caliente o frío para el desayuno o rocíelo con crema o natillas como postre."]','2026-01-11 12:56:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13259,9192,'es','Tarta PBJ Bakewell','¡Hemos tomado todo lo que amamos de una tarta Bakewell y le hemos agregado un toque americano con mantequilla de maní y mermelada o "gelatina", como la llaman en Estados Unidos!','["80 g de maní tostado sin sal, más 2 cucharadas para servir","100 g de mantequilla de maní","75 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","120 g de mantequilla, ablandada","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo, más 1 clara (usa la yema en la masa)","50 g de mermelada de frambuesa, más 2 cucharaditas para servir","200 g de harina común","4 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","130 g de mantequilla fría, picada en trozos pequeños","1 yema de huevo","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas, más 5 cucharadas para el chorrito"]','["Primero, haz la masa. Vierta la harina, el cacao, la mantequilla y una pizca de sal en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino. Añade la yema de huevo, el azúcar glas y 2 cucharadas de agua fría y bate nuevamente hasta que empiecen a formar grumos. Vierta sobre la superficie de trabajo (no se preocupe por lavar el tazón), amase brevemente hasta obtener una bola de masa suave, luego aplánela en forma de disco grueso, envuélvala en film transparente y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Agrega los ingredientes restantes (excepto la mermelada y el maní para servir) al procesador de alimentos y mezcla hasta que quede suave y cremoso. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Saca la masa de la nevera y extiéndela hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de 1 libra. Levante la masa y colóquela en un molde para tarta estriado de 22 cm y presiónela en las esquinas, con cuidado de no romperla. Recorta el exceso de masa con unas tijeras, dejando un saliente de aproximadamente 1 cm. Cubra con papel para hornear y frijoles para hornear y hornee por 15 minutos.","Retire el pergamino y los frijoles y regrese al horno por 5 minutos más, hasta que se vea como una galleta. Retirar del horno y utilizar un cuchillo de sierra pequeño para recortar la masa a la altura del molde. Deseche (o mordisquee) los recortes.","Vierta la mermelada en la base de la tarta y extiéndala hasta los bordes. Cubra con la mezcla de maní, extendiéndola hasta los bordes para cubrir la mermelada. Hornear durante 45 minutos hasta que el bizcocho esté cocido y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos y luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Triture el resto del azúcar glas y la mermelada para obtener un glaseado suave y rocíe encima. Pica el maní restante en trozos grandes y espárcelo. Las sobras se conservarán en un recipiente hermético durante 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13260,9193,'es','Muffins de batata, aguacate y queso feta','Utilice aguacates súper maduros en este sabroso horneado, cubiertos con queso desmenuzado, trozos de batata y una pizca de semillas mixtas.','["1 batata (unos 200 g), pelada y picada en trozos pequeños","un chorrito de aceite sin sabor, como el vegetal o el de girasol","1 aguacate grande, sin piel ni hueso, picado en trozos grandes (aproximadamente 150 g de peso preparado)","100 g de almendras molidas","100 g de polenta fina","80 ml de jarabe de arce","3 huevos grandes","1 ½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","100ml de leche semidesnatada","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado, opcional","2 cucharadas de semillas mixtas","¼ cucharadita de pimentón dulce"]','["Coloque la batata en un recipiente resistente al calor, cúbrala con film transparente y cocínela en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 8 minutos o hasta que esté muy suave. Dejar enfriar por completo. Engrase 9 agujeros de un molde para muffins con un poco de aceite (o cubra cada agujero con un cuadrado de papel para hornear).","Pica 1/4 de la batata en trozos aún más pequeños y reserva. Coloca el camote, el aguacate, las almendras, la polenta, el jarabe de arce, los huevos, el polvo para hornear, el bicarbonato, la leche y 1/4 cucharadita de sal en el bol de un procesador de alimentos. Licue hasta que esté completamente suave. Divida la mezcla uniformemente entre los agujeros del molde para muffins, luego cubra con la batata picada reservada, el queso feta, las semillas y un poco de pimentón. Hornee durante 22 minutos, o hasta que suba, se dore por encima y esté bien cocido; verifique insertando una brocheta en el centro, debe salir seco. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla y enfríe por completo. Guárdelo en un recipiente sellado por hasta 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13261,9194,'es','Hebilla de ruibarbo','Esta hebilla de vainilla y ruibarbo, una prima más brillante del tradicional pastel de la hora del té al estilo americano, es perfecta para los meses fríos cuando brilla el ruibarbo forzado.','["50 g de harina común","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","50 g de mantequilla sin sal, fría","25 g de copos de avena","225 g de ruibarbo fino, forzado, recortado, enjuagado y cortado en trozos de 2½ cm de largo","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura de 1 naranja","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para engrasar","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura de 1 naranja","2 huevos grandes","200 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","125 ml de nata agria"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm de profundidad y forrar la base con papel para hornear.","Para hacer la cobertura crumble, ponga la harina, el azúcar y el jengibre en un bol y mezcle. Agregue la mantequilla y mezcle hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Agregue la avena y, con las manos, junte la mezcla hasta formar una masa, envuélvala en film transparente y enfríe hasta que la necesite.","Ponga los trozos de ruibarbo en un bol con el azúcar y la ralladura de naranja y mezcle. Reserva mientras preparas la masa del pastel.","Coloque la mantequilla, el azúcar y la ralladura de naranja en un tazón grande y, con una batidora eléctrica, bata hasta que esté suave y esponjoso, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Agregue los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo hasta que se combinen antes de agregar el siguiente.","En un recipiente aparte, mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear, la pasta de vainilla y una pizca de sal y, en dos adiciones, incorpore la mezcla de mantequilla, alternando con la crema agria. Vierta en el molde para pastel y nivele con una espátula. Cubra con la mezcla de ruibarbo y termine rompiendo el crumble frío en trozos de tamaño irregular y esparciéndolos sobre el ruibarbo. Hornee en el horno durante aproximadamente 1 hora y 10 minutos o hasta que el crumble esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el medio del pastel, éste salga limpio. Revise el pastel después de 1 hora; si se está coloreando demasiado rápido, cúbralo ligeramente con papel de aluminio durante los últimos 10 minutos.","Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos antes de transferirlo con cuidado a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por 3 días, pero el crumble perderá parte de su textura después del primer día."]','2026-01-11 12:56:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13262,9195,'es','Bandeja horneada de chai de coco','Este sencillo horneado en bandeja está inspirado en una de nuestras cervezas favoritas: el chai. Condimentado con canela, nuez moscada y cardamomo, este bizcocho de coco húmedo es el acompañamiento perfecto para una taza de té.','["100ml de aceite vegetal, más un poco para engrasar","300 ml de leche de coco (no baja en grasa) - si la nata se ha separado en la lata, mezclar bien antes de medir","4 huevos grandes","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","280 g de azúcar moreno blando","250 g de harina con levadura","75 g de coco rallado","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","¼ de nuez moscada, finamente rallada","¼ cucharadita de clavo molido","10 vainas de cardamomo, sin semillas y trituradas con un mortero","4 cucharadas de jarabe de jengibre","3-4 cucharadas de leche de coco","140 g de azúcar glas","2 bolas de jengibre de tallo, finamente picado","pistachos picados y hojuelas de coco (opcional)"]','["Engrasar un molde para horno de 20 x 30 cm con un poco de aceite y forrar la base y los lados con papel de hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Mida la leche de coco y el aceite en una jarra. Rompe los huevos, agrega la vainilla y bate con un tenedor para combinar.","En un bol grande mezcla el azúcar, la harina, el coco, las especias y una pizca de sal. Exprima los terrones de azúcar con los dedos y agite el recipiente varias veces para que salgan a la superficie. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos y use un batidor grande para mezclar hasta obtener una masa suave. Vierta en el molde, raspando cada gota de la mezcla del bol con una espátula.","Hornee en el estante central del horno durante 25 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio salga limpio. Si queda algo de mezcla húmeda adherida, hornee por 5 minutos más y luego verifique nuevamente. Deje enfriar durante 15 minutos en el molde, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla y rocíe sobre el almíbar de jengibre.","Para hacer el glaseado, mezcla la leche de coco con el azúcar glas hasta que quede suave. Rocíe el glaseado sobre el pastel en forma de garabatos, luego espolvoree con el jengibre picado, los pistachos y las hojuelas de coco, si las usa. Coma caliente o frío. Se conservará durante 3 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:56:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13263,9196,'es','Muffins Bakewell de arándanos','Estos sencillos muffins de arándanos tienen un delicioso centro de mermelada y una cobertura crujiente desmenuzada: una delicia deliciosa para la hora del té o el almuerzo para llevar.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada, más 1 cucharada de mantequilla derretida para engrasar","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos grandes","140 gramos de yogur natural","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","2 cucharadas de leche","250 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","Paquete de 125 g de arándanos (o utilizar congelados)","3 cucharadas de azúcar demerara","¼ cucharadita de canela molida","3 cucharadas de almendras en hojuelas, picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de almendras molidas","3 cucharadas de harina común","1 cucharada de mantequilla fría cortada en cubitos","12 cucharaditas de conserva de arándanos silvestres (yo usé mermelada de arándanos silvestres Felix, disponible en ocado.com)"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forre un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con fundas de papel. Ponga todos los ingredientes de la cobertura, excepto la mermelada, en un bol y frótelos.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos y bate durante 1 minuto, luego mezcla el yogur, los extractos y la leche. Combine la harina, el polvo para hornear y el bicarbonato en un tazón con 1/4 cucharadita de sal fina, luego vierta esto en los ingredientes húmedos y revuelva. Finalmente, agregue los arándanos y divida la mezcla entre los moldes para muffins. Cubra cada muffin con 1 cucharadita de mermelada de arándanos y luego esparza sobre la mezcla desmenuzada.","Hornee durante 5 minutos, luego reduzca el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y hornee durante 15-18 minutos más hasta que suba y esté dorado, y al insertar un palito sale solo mermelada, sin mezcla de pastel húmeda.","Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego levante con cuidado sobre una rejilla para terminar de enfriar. Se mantendrán durante 3 a 4 días en un recipiente hermético; después de uno o dos días, métalos en el microondas durante 10 a 15 segundos en temperatura alta para refrescarse."]','2026-01-11 12:56:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13264,9197,'es','Sándwiches de galleta de jengibre con mascarpone de limón','Galletas de jengibre tipo sándwich con un relleno cremoso y picante para preparar estas delicias a la hora del té sin gluten que son aromáticas con especias invernales: clavo, nuez moscada y cardamomo.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","25 g de melaza negra","1 huevo grande","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","175 g de mezcla de harina sin gluten (yo usé Doves Farm)","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","½ cucharadita de pimienta negra molida","¼ cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","¼ cucharadita de clavo molido","¼ de cucharadita de cardamomo molido (las semillas de 3 vainas, trituradas – ver consejo)","75 g de azúcar demerara, para cubrir","175 g de mascarpone","85 g de cuajada de limón"]','["Para hacer las galletas, ponga la mantequilla, el azúcar, la melaza, el huevo y la vainilla en un tazón grande y mezcle con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave y combinado. En un recipiente aparte, mezcle los ingredientes restantes excepto la demerara. Agrega los ingredientes secos a la mezcla de huevo y mezcla hasta que se forme una masa muy pegajosa. Cubrir con film transparente y enfriar durante al menos 4 horas.","Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Enrolle la masa para galletas en bolas, de aproximadamente una cucharada de tamaño, luego enrolle el azúcar demerara. Colocar en las bandejas forradas, dejando un espacio de unos 2,5 cm entre las galletas.","Hornee durante unos 14 minutos o hasta que los bordes estén ligeramente dorados, intercambiando las bandejas a mitad de la cocción. Deje enfriar en las bandejas durante 10 minutos antes de transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer el relleno, bata el mascarpone y la cuajada de limón en un bol hasta que quede suave y cremoso. Transfiera a una manga pastelera equipada con una punta de tubería redonda y lisa. Coloca una capa de crema sobre la base de la mitad de las galletas y emparéjala con la otra mitad. Se conservará durante 3 o 4 días en un recipiente sellado en el refrigerador; la textura se volverá suave y pastosa (esto no es malo)."]','2026-01-11 12:56:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13265,9198,'es','Pastel de naranja y cilantro','Este horneado afrutado tiene una naranja entera batida y agregada a la masa para obtener un delicioso manjar a la hora del té.','["1 naranja grande","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharadas de semillas de cilantro","50 g de polenta","175 g de mantequilla, blanda","150 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 huevos","1 naranja","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de azúcar glas"]','["Para hacer el bizcocho, poner la naranja en una cacerola, cubrir con agua, llevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento durante 1 hora o hasta que puedas perforar la naranja fácilmente con un cuchillo.","Escurrir, dejar enfriar y luego cortar la naranja en cuartos. Corta cada cuarto por la mitad para tener 8 trozos y retira las pepitas. Poner 75g de azúcar en una cacerola pequeña y añadir 100ml de agua y los trozos de naranja. Calienta suavemente hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, luego sube el fuego y cocina a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Deje que la naranja se enfríe un poco, luego bátala con una batidora o licúela hasta obtener una pulpa. Triture las semillas de cilantro con un mortero o un molinillo de especias, luego agréguelas a la pulpa de naranja tibia junto con la polenta. Revuelva para combinar, luego deje enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Engrasar y forrar la base y los lados de un molde para pastel de fondo suelto de 22 cm. Coloque la mantequilla, la harina, el polvo para hornear, los huevos y los 100 g restantes de azúcar en polvo en un tazón grande junto con la pulpa de naranja enfriada. Mezcle hasta que esté bien mezclado usando una batidora de mano eléctrica. Vierta en el molde preparado y hornee durante 35 a 45 minutos o hasta que esté elástico al tacto; al insertar una brocheta en el centro debe salir limpio. El bizcocho debe tener un color pálido y quedar justo en los lados del molde. Pasar a una rejilla y dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, prepara la decoración. Con un pelador de patatas, pela la mitad de la ralladura de la naranja en tiras grandes y luego córtalas en rodajas muy finas para obtener muchos trozos de ralladura de naranja (como lo harías con la mermelada). Poner el azúcar en polvo y 100 ml de agua en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, luego agregar la naranja rallada. Llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que los trozos estén bastante suaves. Retirar con una espumadera y reservar en una bandeja forrada con papel para hornear.","Cuando el bizcocho se haya enfriado, tamiza el azúcar glas en un bol pequeño. Exprima la naranja y agregue suficiente cantidad al azúcar glas para hacer un glaseado líquido. Rocíe el glaseado sobre el pastel enfriado y esparza los trozos de naranja encima."]','2026-01-11 12:56:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13266,9199,'es','Flaps de canela y anacardos','Prepare una tanda de estos crujientes flapjacks de avena, repletos de nueces, semillas y coco rallado, perfectos para tomar un estimulante por la tarde.','["140 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","140 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 cucharadas de miel","1 cucharada de canela molida","140 g de avena avena","85 g de coco rallado","85 g de semillas de sésamo","50 g de semillas de girasol","1 cucharada de harina común","85 g de anacardos o nueces"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Engrasar y forrar un molde para pastel de 20 x 30 cm con papel para hornear. Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén grande antiadherente, agregue el azúcar, la miel y la canela y revuelva con una cuchara de madera a fuego lento durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que el azúcar se disuelva.","Retire del fuego y agregue todos los ingredientes restantes hasta que estén bien cubiertos con la mezcla mantecosa de especias. Vierta en la lata y presione hacia abajo hasta obtener una capa uniforme. Hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos, luego márquelo en cuadrados; no los saque del molde todavía, ya que no se mantendrán unidos hasta que estén fríos. Se conservará en un recipiente cerrado durante un par de días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13267,6155,'es','Budín de canela, manzana y nueces','Puede que tenga un sabor delicioso, pero este horneado afrutado bajo en azúcar está endulzado con xilitol y cubierto con nueces crujientes.','["85 g de mantequilla blanda","85 g de xilitol (nosotros usamos Total Sweet)","125 g de harina con levadura","25 g de avena","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita colmada de levadura en polvo","2 huevos grandes","3 cucharadas de leche","1 manzana Bramley (unos 280 g), pelada, sin corazón, un cuarto rallado y el resto cortado en cubitos","25 g de nueces pecanas, picadas o partidas","yogur griego o crema, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrasar ligeramente una fuente para tarta o horno de 1 litro (20 x 16 cm). Vierta la mantequilla y el xilitol en un bol con la harina, la avena, la canela y la levadura en polvo. Rompe los huevos, agrega la leche y luego bate con un batidor eléctrico hasta que se mezclen uniformemente y que queden suaves. Agregue toda la manzana, luego póngala en el plato, nivele la parte superior y espolvoree con las nueces.","Hornee durante 35-45 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorado y al insertar un pincho en el centro, éste salga limpio. Servir con yogur griego o crema."]','2026-01-11 12:56:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13268,9200,'es','Galletas con chispas de chocolate y malta','Pruebe estas galletas con chispas de chocolate, fáciles y masticables, con leche malteada: colóquelas en la lata o en el frasco de galletas por hasta 5 días.','["140 g de mantequilla, blanda","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de azúcar moreno claro suave","2 huevos medianos","200 g de harina común","175 g de bebida de leche malteada en polvo (nosotros usamos Horlicks)","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de barra de chocolate negro, picado"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en un bol hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos, luego incorporar los huevos uno a la vez.","Agrega la harina, la bebida de leche malteada en polvo, la levadura en polvo y una buena pizca de sal, luego remueve con una cuchara de madera hasta que la mezcla forme una masa. Vierta sobre la superficie de trabajo y amase suavemente el chocolate. Divida la mezcla en 20 trozos, aproximadamente del tamaño de una nuez entera. Enrolle cada pieza en una bola y colóquela en las bandejas para hornear, dejando suficiente espacio para que las galletas se extiendan. Aplana ligeramente cada bola con la mano.","Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que comience a dorarse en los bordes. Retirar del horno, dejar en la bandeja para hornear durante 5 minutos para que se enfríe un poco y luego transferir a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Se conservará en un molde para pasteles o en un tarro de galletas hasta por 5 días."]','2026-01-11 12:56:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13269,9201,'es','Tarta de manzana y nueces con glaseado de melaza','Este sencillo pastel todo en uno es perfecto si tienes amigos que vienen a tomar un café o el té de la tarde.','["300 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","140 g de azúcar moreno blando","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250 ml de aceite de colza o girasol","4 huevos","3 manzanas sin pelar, ralladas gruesas","100 g de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","50 g de azúcar moreno suave y oscuro","1 cucharada de melaza negra","Tarrina de 200 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa"]','["Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2. Línea\r\nDos moldes para tarta de 20 cm. Pon la harina,\r\ncanela y bicarbonato de sodio en un\r\ntazón grande, luego agregue los azúcares, haciendo\r\nAsegúrate de que no queden grumos de azúcar. Añade el\r\naceite, huevos y manzanas, y batir todo\r\njuntos. Incorpora las nueces y luego divide.\r\nla mezcla entre los moldes y hornear\r\npor 45 mins o hasta que salga una brocheta\r\nlimpio. Dejar enfriar unos minutos en el\r\nluego retírela y enfríe completamente sobre una\r\nrejilla de alambre.","Para el glaseado, bate todos los ingredientes.\r\nLuego enfríe hasta que la mezcla esté\r\nespeso pero untable. Distribuir la mitad del\r\nglaseado encima de un pastel, sándwich\r\ncon el otro y esparcir el resto\r\nglaseado encima"]','2026-01-11 12:56:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13270,9202,'es','Pastel crujiente de flor de saúco','Capture la esencia del verano en este sencillo pastel con llovizna de flor de saúco','["175 g de mantequilla blanda, más algo extra para engrasar","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos","140 g de harina con levadura","85 g de almendras molidas","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100ml de leche","4 cucharadas de cordial de flor de saúco","4 cucharadas de azúcar granulada blanca o dorada"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase y forre un molde para pan de 900 g/2 lb con\r\nuna tira larga de papel para hornear. para hacer\r\nla masa del bizcocho, batir la mantequilla y\r\nazúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave\r\ny esponjoso. Batir los huevos, la harina,\r\nalmendras, levadura en polvo y leche\r\nhasta que quede suave. Vierta en la lata y\r\nHornee durante 45-50 minutos hasta que esté dorado y levado.\r\ny viene un pincho clavado en el centro\r\nsalir limpio.","Tan pronto como el pastel haya salido\r\ndel horno, pincharlo todo con una brocheta.\r\nMezclar el cordial y el azúcar extra,\r\nLuego vierte sobre todo el pastel. fresco en el\r\nlata, luego levántela con cuidado para cortarla."]','2026-01-11 12:56:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13271,9453,'es','Pastel de cereza Bakewell','Si conoces a alguien a quien le guste Bakewelltart, entonces le encantará este pastel: está lleno de sabor a almendras y acompañado de mermelada de cerezas.','["200 g de mantequilla bien blanda y un poco más para engrasar","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de almendras molidas","100 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de extracto o esencia de almendras","4 huevos grandes","½ tarro de conserva de guindas de 340 g","175 g de azúcar glas","5-6 cucharaditas de agua o jugo de limón","1 cucharada de almendras en hojuelas ya tostadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4 y\r\nasegúrese de que haya un estante listo en el medio.\r\nUnte con mantequilla y forre las bases de círculos de 2 x 20 cm.\r\nmoldes para sándwiches con papel de horno.","Con unas batidoras eléctricas, bata todos los\r\ningredientes del bizcocho con una pizca de sal hasta\r\nalise, luego vierta en las latas y nivele\r\nlas cimas. Hornee por 30 minutos o hasta que esté dorado.\r\ny elástico. No abras el horno antes\r\nHan pasado 25 minutos de cocción.","Cuando estén listos, enfriar los bizcochos\r\nunos minutos, luego sacar de las latas y enfriar\r\ncompletamente sobre una rejilla. Asegúrate de que la parte superior\r\nde uno de los pasteles está hacia arriba como querrás\r\nuna superficie lisa para el glaseado más adelante.","Cuando esté frío, ponga un bizcocho en una porción.\r\nplato y luego untar con mermelada. Sándwich el\r\nsegunda esponja encima. Tamizar el azúcar glas\r\nen un tazón grande. Agrega el agua o el limón.\r\njugo, luego revuelva hasta que quede suave y espeso. difundir\r\nuniformemente sobre la parte superior y déjelo gotear sobre el\r\nlados. Espolvorear con las nueces y dejar reposar.\r\ndurante unos minutos antes de cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:56:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13272,9203,'es','Horneado en bandeja de cerezas, chocolate y coco','Mantenga estos cinco ingredientes en su alacena para que pueda preparar un delicioso horneado en bandeja cuando sus amigos lleguen inesperadamente.','["200 g de coco rallado","85 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos batidos","200 g de chocolate blanco en barra, picado en trozos grandes","85 g de cerezas glaseadas, partidas por la mitad"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nForrar una bandeja para horno de 20 x 30 cm con papel para hornear.\r\npergamino. En un tazón grande, mezcle el\r\ncoco rallado, azúcar, huevos,\r\nchocolate blanco y cerezas glaseadas\r\nhasta que se combinen. Cocine por 20 minutos hasta que\r\ndorar y cuajar, luego enfriar\r\nla lata antes de cortarla en barras."]','2026-01-11 12:57:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13273,9204,'es','Pastel de llovizna de frutas de verano','El delicioso pastel de Sarah Cook es realmente fácil y versátil: usa la fruta que quieras y lo prepararás una y otra vez.','["2 huevos grandes","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","175 g de fruta, deshuesada y cortada en cubitos","140 g de azúcar granulada","1-2 cucharadas de jugo de cítricos (limón, lima o naranja)","175 g de mantequilla muy blanda, más un poco para engrasar","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250 g de harina con levadura"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase un molde para pan de 900 g/2 lb y forre el\r\nbase y termina con una tira larga de hornear\r\npergamino. Poner la mantequilla, el azúcar, la harina,\r\nhuevos y extracto de vainilla en un tazón grande\r\ny batir con una batidora eléctrica de mano\r\ndurante 5 minutos hasta que esté pálido y cremoso – el\r\nLa mezcla quedará muy espesa.","Unte un tercio de la mezcla para pastel en\r\nla lata y luego esparcir 50 g de fruta.\r\nCon cuidado puntee y extienda otro tercio de\r\nla mezcla para pastel encima y espolvorear con\r\nOtros 50 g de fruta. Finalmente puntee el resto de\r\nla mezcla para pastel y untar suavemente con\r\nel dorso de una cuchara. Hornee por 1 hora, hasta que\r\nun pincho insertado sale limpio.","Pincha todo el bizcocho con una brocheta.\r\nPonga los 75 g de fruta restantes en un bol con\r\nel azúcar granulada. Agregue 1 cucharada de\r\njugo de cítricos primero con un tenedor, triturando un\r\npoco de la fruta a medida que avanza. Si está un poco seco,\r\nagregue un chorrito más de jugo y vierta\r\nel pastel. Dejar en el molde hasta que el bizcocho esté\r\nenfríe y la cobertura esté firme y crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:57:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13274,9205,'es','Bandeja horneada de frambuesa y chocolate blanco','El pudín de verano perfecto para un almuerzo o para acompañar el té de la tarde.','["Paquete de 375 g de masa quebrada ya laminada","500 g de mascarpone","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de almendras molidas","2 huevos grandes","250 g de frambuesas frescas","100 g de chocolate blanco, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 160c/ventilador 140c/gas 4. Estirar un poco más la masa en una\r\nsuperficie enharinada y utilizar para forrar un molde de 30 x 20 cm o un molde de panecillo suizo. Línea con\r\npapel vegetal, rellenar con frijoles para hornear y cocinar durante 10 minutos. saca el\r\nfrijoles y papel, luego regresar al horno por 5 minutos más.","Batir el mascarpone, el azúcar, las almendras y los huevos hasta que estén bien\r\nmezclado. Incorpora las frambuesas y el chocolate y luego vierte en el molde. hornear\r\ndurante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté cuajado y ligeramente dorado. Apague el horno, abra la\r\npuerta y dejar hornear la bandeja para que se enfríe gradualmente. Para obtener mejores resultados, enfríe durante\r\nal menos 1 hora antes de cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:57:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13275,8269,'es','Tarta de nueces, dátiles y miel','Una delicia para la hora del té, repleta de dulce miel. También es una excelente manera de consumir esos plátanos maduros.','["225 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de canela molida","175 g de mantequilla blanda","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","3 cucharadas de miel clara","2 huevos batidos","2 plátanos medianos maduros, de aproximadamente 250 g/9 oz de peso total con piel","100 g de dátiles sin hueso","Paquete de 50g de nueces en trozos"]','["Precalentar el horno a 160C/Gas 3/horno ventilado 140C. Forre la base y los lados largos de un molde para pan de 900 g con papel vegetal, untando con mantequilla el molde y el papel.","Vierta la harina, la canela, la mantequilla, el azúcar, 2 cucharadas de miel y los huevos en un tazón grande. Triture los plátanos y pique los dátiles (las tijeras de cocina son más fáciles para esto) y agréguelos al bol. Batir la mezcla durante 2-3 minutos, con una cuchara de madera o una batidora de mano, hasta que esté bien mezclada.","Vierta en la lata preparada y nivele la parte superior. Esparcir los trozos de nuez. Hornee durante 1 hora, luego presione ligeramente la parte superior; se sentirá firme si se cocina. Si no, hornee por 10 minutos más.","Deje enfriar durante 15 minutos y luego sáquelo del molde con el papel. Cuando esté frío, rocíe el resto de la miel. Cortar en rodajas gruesas."]','2026-01-11 12:57:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13276,9206,'es','Helado de chocolate y mantequilla de maní','Ahorre tiempo y use helado de vainilla comprado en la tienda para hacer un impresionante helado con sabor a mantequilla de maní crujiente y chocolate amargo.','["175 g de chocolate amargo, desmenuzado","200ml de nata doble","125 g de mantequilla de maní crujiente, derretida y enfriada","1 kilo de helado de vainilla","un puñado de maní tostado sin sal, picado, para decorar"]','["Derretir 100 g de chocolate negro con la nata y 75 g de mantequilla de maní juntos en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento, revolviendo hasta que la mezcla esté suave y la salsa se haya espesado. Si la salsa te parece demasiado espesa, puedes añadir un poco más de nata doble.","Derrita el chocolate restante en un recipiente resistente al calor en el microondas en breves períodos. O haga esto sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua.","Coloque un poco de helado en cuatro vasos de helado y luego rocíe con la mitad de la salsa. Repita esto y luego cubra con otra bola de helado cada uno. Rocíe sobre el chocolate derretido que debe solidificarse sobre el helado frío. Esparcir sobre el maní picado y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13277,7912,'es','Guiso de frijoles al curry con coco y cilantro','Aproveche al máximo un alimento básico de la despensa, los frijoles mantecosos, en este guiso abundante y fragante. Son abundantes, llenos de proteínas y también de bajo costo.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal, más un chorrito","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 cucharaditas de semillas de mostaza negra o marrón","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharada de curry en polvo mediano","2 dientes de ajo, rallados","15 g de jengibre rallado","700 ml de leche de coco","2 latas de 400 g de alubias, escurridas","200 g de col rizada, con las hojas rotas","20 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","1 chile verde, picado en trozos grandes (opcional)","1 lima, rallada y en jugo"]','["Ponga una cacerola grande, profunda y con tapa a fuego medio. Una vez caliente, vierte el aceite. Esparza la cebolla y cocine durante 8-10 minutos para que se ablande. Agregue las semillas de mostaza, las semillas de cilantro, el curry en polvo, el ajo y el jengibre, y cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén fragantes y las semillas comiencen a chisporrotear y a estallar.","Vierta 600 ml de leche de coco y lleve a ebullición. Reduzca a fuego lento y luego agregue los frijoles. Déjelo burbujear durante 10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C/gas 4. Rociar la mitad de la col rizada con aceite y sazonar bien con sal. Extienda sobre una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que esté oscuro y crujiente.","Mientras tanto, ponga el cilantro, el resto de la leche de coco, la guindilla verde, la mitad del jugo de lima y una buena pizca de sal en el bol de un procesador de alimentos pequeño, o en un recipiente hondo si usa una batidora de mano. Mezcle hasta obtener una consistencia que se pueda rociar y luego reserve.","Agrega las hojas de col rizada restantes a los frijoles, tapa y cocina durante 5 minutos. Una vez que estén tiernos, agrega el jugo de lima restante. Divida en cuatro tazones, cubra con la col rizada crujiente, luego rocíe con el chutney de cilantro y una pizca de ralladura de lima."]','2026-01-11 12:57:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13278,7914,'es','Curry de calabaza con mantequilla de maní','Prepara este curry vegano fácil con calabaza y todo el sabor de la salsa satay. Cubra con cilantro, chile y maní y sirva con arroz.','["6 dientes de ajo","3 tallos de limoncillo, machacados y picados en trozos grandes","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y picado","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharada de cúrcuma molida","2 chiles rojos, 1 picado en trozos grandes y 1 en rodajas para servir (opcional)","1 cebolla pequeña, picada en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 calabaza, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","100 g de mantequilla de maní suave","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja","Lata de 440ml de leche de coco.","250 ml de caldo de verduras","1 lima, exprimida","cilantro, picado","maní, picado en trozos grandes (opcional)","arroz cocido"]','["Mezcle el ajo, la hierba de limón, el jengibre, las especias, los chiles, la cebolla y un chorrito grande de agua en un procesador de alimentos con una pizca de sal hasta obtener una pasta suave.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén y cocina la pasta durante 8-10 minutos hasta que se parta. Revuelva la calabaza para cubrirla con la pasta, luego agregue el azúcar, la mantequilla de maní y la salsa de soja y cocine hasta que se combinen.","Vierta la leche de coco y el caldo, cocine a fuego lento, sazone y continúe cocinando a fuego lento durante 30-35 minutos o hasta que la calabaza esté tierna (siga revisando, ya que depende de la calabaza; algunas tardan 15 minutos y otras 45 minutos), revolviendo con frecuencia. Apague el fuego, agregue el jugo de limón, luego esparza sobre el cilantro fresco, el chile en rodajas y maní, si lo desea, y sirva con arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:57:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13279,7916,'es','Lentejas Schmaltzy con pollo, aceitunas y limón','La grasa dorada de pollo (schmaltz) agrega sabor a la base de lentejas y col rizada en este abundante plato. Es una comida deliciosa entre semana.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 pechugas de pollo con piel","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de zumaque","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","500 ml de caldo de pollo bajo en sal","500 g de lentejas cocidas, con sabor a tomate si puedes conseguirlas","125 g de col rizada, finamente picada","1 limón, mitad en rodajas y mitad en jugo","50 g de aceitunas verdes, deshuesadas y picadas en trozos grandes","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva en una cazuela o sartén honda a fuego medio-alto. Sazone todo el pollo y agréguelo a la sartén, con la piel hacia abajo. Cocine durante 6-8 minutos hasta que estén bien dorados y dorados, luego voltee y cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén dorados, no es necesario que estén bien cocidos en este punto. Retire el pollo a un plato.","Agrega la cebolla y el ajo a la sartén para pollo. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos antes de agregar las especias. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que esté fragante, luego agregue el caldo de pollo, raspando el fondo para eliminar los trozos dorados. Incorpora las lentejas, la col rizada, las rodajas de limón y las aceitunas. Deje hervir a fuego lento, vuelva a colocar las pechugas de pollo, con la piel hacia arriba y cocine durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que se reduzca y el pollo esté bien cocido. Sazone con jugo de limón y un poco de pimienta negra, luego decore con perejil para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13280,7918,'es','Pasta y brócoli de brotes morados con anchoas, ajo y limón en conserva','¿Te encantan las anchoas? Este plato de pasta es para ti: el sabor salado combina bien con los brotes de brócoli morados ricos en hierro y se realza con el toque de limón.','["8 filetes de anchoa, finamente picados, más 2 cucharadas de aceite del frasco","100 g de mantequilla","2 cebollas moradas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","4 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","3 limones pequeños en conserva, sin semillas ni pulpa, con la piel finamente picada","400 g de pasta trofie (u otra forma de pasta pequeña)","300 g de brócoli de brotes morados","1 limón, exprimido","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva o de colza","150 g de pan rallado fresco","1 limón, rallado","2 buenas pizcas de hojuelas de chile seco"]','["Hervir la tetera. Rocíe el aceite del frasco de anchoas en una sartén grande y ponga a fuego medio. Agrega las anchoas y revuelve un par de minutos para deshacerlas. Agregue la mantequilla a la sartén, revolviendo hasta que se derrita y forme espuma, luego agregue las cebollas. Cocine suavemente durante 10 minutos hasta que las cebollas estén suaves, luego agregue el ajo y el limón en conserva y revuelva por un minuto más.","Llene una cacerola grande con agua caliente, sazone con sal y deje hervir. Agregue la pasta, cocine por 5 minutos, luego agregue el brócoli y cocine por otros 5 minutos, o hasta que la pasta esté cocida pero todavía tenga un poco de mordisco. Saque una taza de agua para pasta y déjela a un lado, luego escurra la pasta y el brócoli en un colador.","Mientras se cocina la pasta, caliente el aceite para las migas de chile en una sartén y agregue el pan rallado. Revuelva regularmente hasta que las migajas estén doradas y crujientes, luego agregue la ralladura de limón y las hojuelas de chile.","Vierta la pasta y el brócoli en la salsa de anchoas y agregue un buen chorrito del agua de la pasta reservada y un chorrito de limón. Cocine por unos minutos, revolviendo, hasta que esté suave como la seda y cubra la pasta. Comprobar y ajustar la sazón si es necesario. Sirva la pasta espolvoreada con las migas de chile crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:57:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13281,7920,'es','Pastel de filo al curry','Haga una tanda de lentejas especiadas y luego úselas como base para hacer el relleno de este pastel de filo al curry con coliflor. Esparcir sobre semillas de nigella para servir.','["1 coliflor pequeña, unos 800g","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","4 cebolletas, finamente cortadas","700 g sobrantes de lentejas con salsa de coco, hojas de curry y cúrcuma (ver paso 2)","2 cucharadas de pepinillo de lima","100ml de nata doble","150 g de queso cheddar maduro rallado","270 g de masa filo","25 g de mantequilla, derretida","1 cucharadita de semillas de nigella"]','["Deseche las hojas exteriores gastadas de la coliflor y luego córtela en floretes pequeños. Cortar finamente el tallo y las hojas también. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto. Agrega toda la coliflor picada y las cebolletas con 100 ml de agua caliente. Cocine durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté suave y el agua se haya evaporado.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Agrega las lentejas sobrantes, el pepinillo de lima y la nata doble. Llevar a fuego lento, luego retirar del fuego y agregar el queso. Vierta en una fuente para horno (la nuestra era de 20 x 30 cm) y extiéndala. Tome cada hoja de filo, rasgue y arrugue ligeramente un poco y colóquela sobre la parte superior del relleno, asegurándose de que toda la parte superior quede cubierta. Unte la mantequilla derretida y luego esparza las semillas de nigella. Hornee en el horno durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén dorados y crujientes."]','2026-01-11 12:57:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13282,7922,'es','rabo de toro jamaiquino','Cocine el rabo de toro a fuego lento y lento en esta receta para que quede maravillosamente tierno y se desprenda del hueso. El rico sabor se ve realzado por hierbas y especias.','["2 cebollas, picadas en trozos grandes","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas grandes","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharadas de jengibre, finamente picado","12 g de ramitas de tomillo, hojas recogidas (consulte el consejo a continuación)","90ml soy sauce","1 kg de rabo de toro, pídale a su carnicero que lo corte en trozos de 1 pulgada de grosor","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 pimientos escoceses (agregue más si prefiere más picante)","arroz blanco cocido o arroz y guisantes"]','["Vierta en un bol las cebollas, las cebolletas, el ajo, el jengibre, el tomillo, la salsa de soja, una pizca grande de sal y 1 cucharadita de pimienta negra recién molida. Mezclar bien y agregar el rabo de toro, volteándolo para cubrirlo. Mantener en frío durante la noche o durante al menos 12 horas.","Cuando esté listo para cocinar, retirar el rabo de toro del adobo (reservar el adobo), poner en un plato y espolvorear ligeramente con la maicena. Caliente el aceite en una cacerola o cacerola grande y profunda y dore cada trozo de rabo de toro por ambos lados, aproximadamente 2-3 minutos por cada lado, trabajando en tandas. Deje el rabo de toro a un lado en un plato, luego vierta la marinada reservada en la cacerola y cocine durante 2-3 minutos, raspando el fondo con una cuchara de madera para soltar los trozos dorados.","Regrese el rabo de toro a la sartén y luego agregue suficiente agua para cubrir la carne, alrededor de 800 ml deberían ser suficientes. Incorpora los gorros escoceses y luego déjalos hervir. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 horas 30 minutos – 3 horas hasta que la carne se desprenda del hueso. Sazone al gusto y sirva con arroz blanco cocido o arroz y guisantes."]','2026-01-11 12:57:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13283,7924,'es','Carne de res jamaicana','Disfruta de este clásico jamaicano, también conocido como corned beef. La carne en conserva se convirtió en un alimento básico durante la guerra debido a su asequibilidad y su larga vida útil.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol, para freír","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 cebolla tierna, finamente cortada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 ramitas enteras de tomillo","½ chile scotch bonnet, sin semillas y finamente picado (puedes ajustar esto según tus niveles de picante)","1 tomate grande, picado","1 pimiento, sin corazón y finamente picado","Lata de 240 g de carne en conserva","2 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","arroz blanco cocido"]','["En una sartén, calienta el aceite a fuego medio-bajo. Una vez caliente, agregue la cebolla, la cebolleta, el ajo, el tomillo y el whisky. Cocine durante 8 minutos hasta que las cebollas se ablanden un poco. Agrega el tomate y el pimiento y cocina durante 4-5 minutos hasta que todo esté tierno.","Aumente el fuego a medio-alto y agregue la carne en conserva, partiéndola en la sartén con una cuchara de madera antes de agregar el ketchup y ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra recién molida. Cocine por otros 6 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente y sirva con arroz blanco al vapor y hojas de tomillo para decorar."]','2026-01-11 12:57:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13284,7926,'es','Tazón de arroz con garbanzos y maní','Haz un bol de arroz lleno de textura gracias a los garbanzos y el maní. Se puede cocinar en el horno o en la freidora y las sobras se guardan para el almuerzo del día siguiente.','["2 latas de garbanzos de 400 g, escurridos y secados con papel de cocina","manojo pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado (guarde algunas hojas enteras adicionales para servir, opcional)","1 zanahoria, cortada en palitos (no es necesario pelar)","½ pepino, sin semillas y cortado en medias lunas","½ col lombarda, finamente rallada","400 g de arroz integral, cocido","semillas de sésamo, cebollas crujientes o chile rojo en rodajas, para servir","4 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní crujiente","3 cucharaditas de salsa de soja reducida en sal","1 lima, exprimida","1 cucharada de aceite de chile (opcional)","½ cucharadita de jarabe de arce o miel de sabor suave"]','["Calienta el horno o la freidora a 200C/190C ventilador/gas 6. Haz el aderezo mezclando todos los ingredientes y sazona ligeramente. Vierta los garbanzos en una bandeja para hornear forrada y mezcle con la mitad del aderezo. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y dorado. Dejar enfriar durante 5 min.","Mezcle el aderezo restante con suficiente agua para obtener una consistencia que se pueda verter. Mezcle el cilantro picado, la zanahoria, el pepino y la col lombarda en un tazón pequeño y sazone ligeramente.","Divida el arroz en tazones, cubra con la mezcla de verduras y los garbanzos crujientes, luego esparza sobre las hojas de cilantro, las semillas de sésamo, las cebollas crujientes y el chile en rodajas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:57:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13285,7928,'es','Muslos de pollo al ajillo en una olla y cous cous gigante','Si lo deseas, puedes cambiar el cavolo nero por col rizada en este plato de pollo. Viene con un aderezo ligero de perejil, ralladura de limón y aceite de oliva.','["4 muslos de pollo grandes con piel y hueso","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","200 g de cavolo nero, tallos finamente picados y hojas picadas en trozos grandes","5 dientes de ajo rallados","250 g de cuscús gigante","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva"]','["Sazone el pollo y luego colóquelo con la piel hacia abajo en una sartén ancha apta para horno, de aproximadamente 30 cm de ancho. Sube el fuego a medio-bajo y luego cocina durante 8-10 minutos hasta que la piel esté dorada.","Transfiere los muslos de pollo a un plato (terminarás de cocinarlos más tarde). Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Coloque la cebolla y los tallos de cavolo en la sartén, sazone y cocine durante 8-10 minutos hasta que comience a ablandarse. Agregue el ajo y las hojas de cavolo nero y cocine por otros 3-4 minutos. Agrega el cuscús gigante.","Vierta 675 ml de agua fría y revuelva bien. Sazone, lleve a ebullición, luego reduzca a fuego lento y coloque los muslos de pollo nuevamente, con la piel hacia arriba. Metemos al horno durante 18-20 min.","Mientras tanto, mezcla el perejil con la ralladura de limón, el jugo y el aceite de oliva. Estación.","Retire el pollo del horno, déjelo reposar durante 5 minutos, luego rocíe con el aderezo y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:57:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13286,7930,'es','Espaguetis con tomate y sardinas con pan rallado crujiente','Prepare este plato rápido y lleno de sabor elaborado con ingredientes que se encuentran en la despensa.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","30 g de pan rallado panko","1 cebolla, finamente cortada","300 g de espaguetis","2 dientes de ajo, rallados","2 latas de 120g de sardinas en salsa de tomate","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","Lata de 200g de tomates picados","25 g de aceitunas negras, picadas en trozos grandes","1 limón, exprimido y rallado","manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Pon una sartén amplia a fuego medio y vierte 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva. Esparza el pan rallado y cocine durante 4-5 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Sazone y transfiera a un tazón pequeño forrado con papel de cocina.","Limpia la sartén, vierte la cucharada de aceite restante, luego esparce la cebolla y una pizca de sal. Cocine durante 8-10 minutos hasta que se ablanden y se doren en los bordes. Cuece los espaguetis siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y escúrrelos reservando un poco del agua de cocción.","Agregue el ajo a la sartén, cocine por 1 minuto, luego agregue las sardinas y las hojuelas de chile, si las usa. Triture suavemente con una cuchara de madera para hacer una salsa espesa. Echar las aceitunas, el zumo de limón y los espaguetis cocidos, junto con un buen chorrito del agua de cocción de la pasta. Mezclar muy bien para cubrir.","Agregue el perejil picado, divídalo en tazones, luego espolvoree sobre el pan rallado crujiente y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:57:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13287,7932,'es','Budín de albóndigas y pan con ajo y mantequilla','Haga sus propias albóndigas y hornee en una rica salsa de tomate con capas de pan de ajo con queso. Una deliciosa versión de la clásica comida reconfortante','["4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","3 dientes de ajo, machacados","1 cucharadita de orégano","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca, finamente picadas (si lo desea, reserve algunas enteras para servir)","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 baguette de ajo (unos 210 g), en rodajas","125 g de mozzarella de búfala en bolas, escurrida y cortada en trozos","ensalada verde, para servir","50 g de pan rallado seco","2 cucharadas de leche","500 g de carne picada","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, machacados","1 huevo","1 cucharadita de hierbas mixtas"]','["Para hacer la salsa de tomate, calienta la mitad del aceite en una fuente de horno o sartén refractaria a fuego medio. Agregue el ajo y déjelo chisporrotear durante 2 minutos hasta que esté fragante, luego agregue el orégano, el azúcar, la albahaca y los tomates picados. Enjuague las latas con un chorrito de agua cada una y luego viértalas en la sartén. Llevar a fuego lento, luego dejar burbujear durante 15-20 minutos hasta que espese y se reduzca. Sazone al gusto.","Mientras tanto, para las albóndigas, mezcle el pan rallado y la leche en un tazón grande y déjelo reposar durante 5 minutos para que se absorba. Incorpora la carne picada, la cebolla, el ajo, el huevo, las hierbas mixtas, ½ cucharadita de sal y un poco de pimienta. Forme 20 bolas, aproximadamente del tamaño de pelotas de golf.","Calienta el aceite restante en una segunda sartén a fuego medio-alto. Añade las albóndigas y dóralas por todos lados. Una vez dorados, retírelos a un plato (no es necesario que estén bien cocidos en este punto).","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta la mitad de la salsa de tomate en una fuente para horno, luego agregue el pan de ajo en capas con las albóndigas. Rocíe el resto de la salsa con una cuchara y salpique los trozos de mozzarella. Rocíe un poco más de aceite de oliva y sazone con pimienta. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante. Si lo desea, esparza algunas hojas enteras de albahaca y sirva con una ensalada grande, verde y bien aderezada."]','2026-01-11 12:57:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13288,7934,'es','Aromático arroz frito con cangrejo y chile con puerros crujientes','Transforme una cena entre semana en algo más especial utilizando cangrejo de origen sostenible y puerros fritos crujientes. Rocíe sobre salsa de chile sriracha para servir.','["3 puerros","aceite de girasol o vegetal, para freír","4 dientes de ajo rallados","2 cucharadas de jengibre, pelado y rallado","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","1½ cucharada de salsa de soja","2 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado","1½ cucharada de sriracha, más extra para servir","500 g de arroz basmati o jazmín cocido","2 huevos batidos","100 g de carne de cangrejo blanco","1 lima, ½ jugo, ½ cortada en gajos o carrilleras para servir","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, para servir"]','["Corta los puerros por la mitad por el centro, enjuágalos con agua corriente fría para eliminar la suciedad atrapada entre las capas y luego córtalos en rodajas finas.","Calentar suficiente aceite en un wok o sartén honda para que suba unos centímetros por los lados. Calienta el aceite a fuego medio durante unos minutos, luego echa las puntas verdes de los puerros en el aceite caliente, con cuidado de no salpicar. Freír los puerros durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén dorados y crujientes, luego usar una espumadera para transferirlos a una hoja de papel de cocina. Sazone los puerros crujientes con sal y reserve hasta el momento de servir.","Vierta todo menos 1-2 cucharadas de aceite de la sartén (guarde para futuros salteados). Añade el resto de los puerros, el ajo y el jengibre y sofríe a fuego medio durante unos minutos para que se ablanden.","Combine el azúcar, la soja, la salsa de pescado y la sriracha en un bol. Añadir a la sartén con el arroz cocido y sofreír unos minutos, hasta que el arroz se deshaga. Crea espacio en el centro y agrega los huevos. Déjelo reposar por un minuto y luego incorpórelo al arroz.","Agrega la carne de cangrejo y el jugo de lima. Sirva espolvoreado con cilantro y puerros crujientes, con rodajas de lima y sriracha extra a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:57:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13289,7938,'es','Escalopes de pollo con kimchi','Sirva estos deliciosos escalopes de pollo con nuestra potente mayonesa de kimchi y repollo crujiente a un lado, además de rodajas de limón para exprimir.','["4 pechugas de pollo","150 g de kimchi, finamente picado, más 3 cucharadas de salmuera","2 huevos","50 g de harina común","150 g de pan rallado blanco fino y seco","½ repollo blanco, finamente cortado","1,5 litros de aceite vegetal","150 g de mayonesa","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","rodajas de limón, para servir"]','["Mariposa las pechugas de pollo cortando la parte más gruesa de la pechuga, deteniéndote 1 cm antes del borde y luego abriéndolas como un libro. Cubrir con una hoja de papel para hornear y, con un rodillo, golpear cada pechuga de pollo lo más finamente posible. Transfiera a un recipiente y vierta sobre la salmuera de kimchi, volteando para cubrir. Enfríe durante al menos 2 horas o hasta 24 horas.","Retire las pechugas de pollo de la salmuera y colóquelas sobre una tabla de cortar limpia. Sal ligeramente ambos lados del pollo y reserva. Vierta la salmuera en un recipiente poco profundo y agregue los huevos. Vierta la harina y el pan rallado en dos tazones poco profundos separados. Sumerja cada pechuga de pollo primero en la harina, presionando para cubrir, luego en la mezcla de huevo y finalmente en el pan rallado, luego presione bien nuevamente. Transfiera a una rejilla forrada con papel para hornear. Para congelar los escalopes, coloque con cuidado la rejilla en el congelador y congélelo hasta que esté sólido, aproximadamente 5 horas. Transfiera a un recipiente con papel para hornear entre cada escalope. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por tres meses.","El día de servir, poner el repollo en un recipiente con agua helada y dejar reposar 10 minutos. Justo antes de servir, escúrralo y séquelo en una centrifugadora de ensaladas para que quede crujiente, o colóquelo en un paño de cocina limpio y gírelo para girarlo de la misma manera.","Vierta el aceite en una cacerola ancha y profunda (asegúrese de que no esté llena a más de un tercio) a fuego medio y caliente suavemente hasta que algunas migas de pan chisporroteen y se doren en unos 30 segundos. Coloque con cuidado los escalopes en el aceite caliente, uno o dos a la vez, dependiendo del ancho de la sartén, y fríalos durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado o 5 minutos por cada lado si están congelados. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear y manténgala caliente en el horno bajo.","Mientras tanto, combine el kimchi, la mayonesa y el vinagre y sazone al gusto. Sirva los escalopes con mayonesa de kimchi y repollo crujiente a un lado, con rodajas de limón para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13290,7940,'es','Pudín con salsa propia en olla de cocción lenta','Crea un regalo para familiares y amigos en tu olla de cocción lenta. La salsa de jengibre agregada significa que promete estar deliciosamente jugosa, pero puedes servirla con crema para disfrutar aún más.','["100 g de mantequilla derretida, más un poco más para el recipiente","125 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 huevos","200ml de leche","275 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1½ cucharada de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","crema doble, para servir (opcional)","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","175 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharada de jengibre molido"]','["Calienta la olla de cocción lenta a temperatura alta durante 20 minutos. Frote con cuidado el recipiente de su olla de cocción lenta con mantequilla. Haga el bizcocho combinando la mantequilla derretida con ambos azúcares, los huevos y la leche, luego agregue la harina, la levadura en polvo, el jengibre y la canela. Batir para eliminar los grumos si es necesario, luego verter en la olla de cocción lenta.","Para la salsa, mezcle la harina de maíz con 1 cucharadita de agua y reserve. Combine el azúcar y el jengibre con 350 ml de agua hirviendo hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Incorpora la pasta de harina de maíz y luego vierte sobre la masa.","Cocine a temperatura alta durante 1 hora 30 minutos - 2 horas 30 minutos (esto variará según su olla de cocción lenta), hasta que el bizcocho se haya endurecido y esté firme al tacto. Para servir, vierta un poco de crema doble, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:57:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13291,7942,'es','Curry de gambas, guisantes y espinacas con coco y arroz con quinoa para microondas','Prueba este curry sencillo para una cena familiar. Proporciona siete puntos vegetales, mucha fibra y dos de tus cinco al día.','["150g quinua","150 g de arroz basmati","1 cebolla morada pequeña, picada","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de jengibre finamente picado","1 cucharadita de ajo finamente picado","3 cucharadas de puré de tomate","300 g de crema de coco","300 g de guisantes congelados","300 g de langostinos","200 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 lima, para servir (opcional)"]','["Enjuague y escurra la quinoa y el arroz en un colador tres veces para eliminar el exceso de almidón. Vierta en un tazón muy grande (para evitar que se derrame en el microondas), luego vierta 300 ml de agua hirviendo del hervidor, cubra con un plato pesado y cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 15 minutos. Déjelo reposar, aún tapado, durante 5 minutos antes de esponjarlo con un tenedor.","Mientras tanto, prepara el curry. En una sartén a fuego medio sofreír la cebolla en el aceite hasta que empiece a dorarse. Agrega el comino, el jengibre y el ajo y revuelve por un minuto. Incorpora el puré de tomate y cocina por un minuto más.","Añade la crema de coco, los guisantes, las gambas, las espinacas, la cúrcuma y la sal. Cubra y cocine hasta que los langostinos se vuelvan opacos y rosados, y las espinacas se hayan marchitado, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Agrega un poco de agua para ajustar la consistencia según sea necesario. Sirva el curry sobre el arroz de quinua con un chorrito de lima fresca, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:57:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13292,7944,'es','pollo a la naranja','Sirva filetes de pollo crujientes en una salsa rápida de naranja, sobre una cama de lechuga iceberg rallada.','["1 huevo, batido","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel","pizca de pimienta blanca molida","6 cucharadas colmadas de harina con levadura","4 cucharadas colmadas de harina de maíz","2-3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 naranja, cortada en rodajas y luego cortada en cuartos o por la mitad","lechuga iceberg rallada, arroz basmati al vapor y cebolletas finamente picadas, para servir","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","4 cucharadas de cordial de naranja doblemente concentrado"]','["Mezclar en un bol el huevo batido con una pizca de sal y la pimienta blanca. Corta las pechugas de pollo por la mitad para tener dos filetes finos por pechuga, luego viértelos en el tazón y revuélvelos para cubrirlos con el huevo.","Combine ambas harinas con una pizca de sal y viértalas en un plato. Saque los filetes de pollo del huevo, permita que escurra el exceso y sumérjalos en la mezcla de harina hasta que estén completamente cubiertos. Reservar en un plato.","Calienta el aceite vegetal en una sartén grande a fuego medio (querrás agregar suficiente aceite para cubrir el fondo de la sartén) hasta que brille y fríe los filetes de pollo rebozados durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados. (Es posible que deba hacer esto en tandas). Coloque los filetes de pollo cocidos sobre una rejilla colocada sobre papel de cocina para que escurran. Los filetes de pollo se pueden freír hasta con un día de anticipación, enfriar y refrigerar. Vuelva a dorar en un horno con ventilador/gas 6 a 200 C/180 C durante 8-10 minutos.","Para hacer la salsa, combine la harina de maíz con 2 cucharaditas de agua. Vierta el cordial y 150 ml de agua en una cacerola mediana, luego agregue la pasta de harina de maíz. Llevar a ebullición lentamente a fuego lento, batiendo continuamente hasta que se vuelva transparente y comience a espesarse. Si el sabor es demasiado fuerte o la salsa demasiado espesa, añade hasta 50ml más de agua. O, si desea que el sabor sea más intenso, agregue más cordial de naranja, 1 cucharadita a la vez.","Corta los filetes de pollo en tiras, de aproximadamente 1,5 a 2 cm de ancho, y luego espárcelos sobre lechuga iceberg rallada. Cubra con los trozos de naranja y vierta sobre la salsa, luego decore con cebolletas y sirva con arroz basmati caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:57:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13293,7946,'es','Pollo Marmita Cremoso','¿Te encanta Marmite? Intente mezclarlo con crema fresca y caldo de pollo para hacer una salsa cremosa para pechugas de pollo. Sirva con verduras de temporada y quinua o puré.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 pechugas de pollo con piel","1 cebolla, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo rallados","½ cucharada de marmita","200 ml de caldo de pollo bajo en sal","100 g de crema fresca","10 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","Bolsa de 240g de verduras para microondas","10 g de cebollino, finamente picado","quinua o puré, para servir"]','["Vierta 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén honda a fuego medio. Una vez que brillen, sazone ligeramente las pechugas de pollo y luego colóquelas en la sartén, con la piel hacia abajo. Cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que la piel esté muy dorada, luego déle la vuelta y cocine por el otro lado hasta que esté casi cocido (se cocinarán más tarde). Retirar de la sartén y reservar en un plato.","Vierta el aceite restante en la sartén, agregue la cebolla y cocine por 10 minutos hasta que comience a ablandarse. Agrega el ajo y cocina por 3 minutos.","Agrega la Marmite, luego agrega el caldo de pollo, la crema fresca y el parmesano, mezclando bien para combinar. Llevar a fuego lento y luego poner el pollo en la salsa, con la piel hacia arriba. Cocine durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido.","Cocine las verduras siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego espolvoree las cebolletas sobre el pollo y sirva con quinua o puré y las verduras."]','2026-01-11 12:57:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13294,7948,'es','Albóndigas Stroganoff y puré','Prepara una salsa stroganoff con champiñones como base para servir con albóndigas, puré y espinacas. Seguro que agradará al público','["2 cucharadas de aceite de ajo, más un extra para la bandeja","500 g de carne picada","1 huevo","2 cucharadas de harina común sin gluten","150 g de champiñones picados","1½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1½ cucharadita de mostaza integral o Dijon","½ cucharada de puré de tomate","250 ml de caldo de verduras sin gluten","80 g de crema agria","puré de papa y espinacas marchitas, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y engrasar la bandeja para hornear. Combine la carne picada, el huevo, 1 cucharada de harina y una pizca de sal y pimienta negra molida en un tazón grande. Coloque tantas albóndigas como pueda en la bandeja con una bola para helado, luego hornee durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que las albóndigas estén doradas uniformemente.","Mientras tanto, haz la salsa. Calienta el aceite de ajo en una sartén pequeña a fuego medio y cocina los champiñones durante unos minutos hasta que estén ligeramente dorados. Agrega la harina restante, el pimentón, la mostaza y el puré de tomate, luego mezcla para cubrir los champiñones. Vierta el caldo, sazone y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 a 6 minutos hasta que espese un poco. Reduzca el fuego a bajo y agregue la crema agria. Cocine por 1 minuto más, luego agregue las albóndigas y revuelva para cubrirlas con la salsa. Una vez que esté completamente frío, se mantendrá congelado por hasta tres meses. Descongele durante la noche en el refrigerador y luego vuelva a calentar hasta que esté bien caliente. Sirve las albóndigas y la salsa con puré y espinacas marchitas."]','2026-01-11 12:57:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13295,9207,'es','Sándwiches de helado de donut con mantequilla de maní y jalea','Transforme un PB&J clásico en un delicioso sándwich de helado de donut: es divertido de preparar y alegrará a todos.','["200 ml de helado con sabor a mantequilla de maní","4 donas de mermelada compradas en la tienda","50 g de mantequilla de maní suave","150 g de frambuesas, las más grandes cortadas a la mitad","30 g de mini tazas de mantequilla de maní cubiertas de chocolate, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Saca el helado del congelador para que se ablande mientras preparas las donas. Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Divida las donas por la mitad a través del ecuador y colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear, con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Tuesta bajo la parrilla caliente durante 2 minutos hasta que esté dorado.","Mientras tanto, caliente la mantequilla de maní en una sartén pequeña a fuego lento, revolviendo con frecuencia hasta que se derrita y se suelte. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos.","Coloque el helado ablandado sobre las bases de donas tostadas, rocíe sobre la mantequilla de maní tibia y luego esparza sobre las frambuesas y las tazas de mantequilla de maní picadas. Haga un sándwich con las tapas de las rosquillas y sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 12:57:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13296,9208,'es','helado de coco','Prepara un helado de coco vegano cremoso y refrescante. Se puede servir en conos o tazones y queda excelente si se le añade aún más coco.','["lata de 400g de leche de coco","Lata de 400g de crema de coco","150 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de glucosa líquida","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","coco rallado o hojuelas de coco tostadas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Vierta todos los ingredientes, excepto las hojuelas de coco, en una cacerola a fuego medio-bajo y cocine a fuego lento. Cocine por 1 min, luego retire del fuego y deje enfriar por completo, aproximadamente 1 hora.","Vierta la mezcla enfriada en una máquina para hacer helados y bata durante 30 minutos a 1 hora, según las instrucciones del fabricante. En esta etapa todavía estará blando. Coloque el helado batido en un recipiente apto para congelador o en un molde para pan y congélelo durante al menos 4 horas o durante la noche hasta que esté lo suficientemente firme como para sacarlo. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por tres meses. Sirva en conos o tazones cubiertos con coco rallado o hojuelas de coco tostadas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:57:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13297,9209,'es','Semifreddo de fresa y flor de saúco','Termine su menú de verano con el pudín al aire libre perfecto: este semifreddo es increíblemente fácil de hacer pero tiene un aspecto impresionante.','["500 g de fresas, peladas y en cuartos","50 g de azúcar en polvo, más 2 cucharadas (opcional)","6 cucharadas de cordial de flor de saúco","300ml de nata doble","300 ml de yogur griego entero"]','["Forrar un molde para pan de 1 litro con film transparente. Cuece 300g de fresas con los 50g de azúcar y 4 cucharadas de cordial de flor de saúco durante 8-10 minutos en una cacerola pequeña a fuego medio hasta que las fresas hayan soltado un poco de su líquido y se haya reducido un poco. Dejar enfriar.","Batir la crema doble hasta obtener picos suaves, luego agregar el yogur griego hasta que se combine. Incorpora suavemente las fresas cocidas a la mezcla de crema y yogur para crear un efecto dominó. Vierta la mezcla en el molde forrado y luego nivele suavemente con el dorso de una cuchara. Cubra con film transparente y congele durante al menos 5 horas o durante la noche. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por un mes.","Para servir, sacar del congelador, colocar en un plato para servir, retirar el film transparente y descongelar durante 20 minutos. Mientras tanto, mezcle el resto de las fresas con el resto del cordial de flor de saúco, espolvoree sobre las 2 cucharadas de azúcar, si las usa, y apílelas sobre el semifreddo."]','2026-01-11 12:57:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13298,9210,'es','Dulce de leche','Esta rica y cremosa salsa de caramelo es una excelente manera de mejorar tus postres favoritos. Es fácil de preparar y tiene un sabor delicioso: pruébalo rociado sobre helado de vainilla.','["50 g de azúcar granulada","50 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubitos","75ml de leche entera","1 lata de 397 g de leche condensada"]','["Pon el azúcar en una cacerola grande. Sube el fuego a temperatura media y derrite con cuidado el azúcar. Incline suavemente la sartén a medida que el azúcar se derrita, en lugar de revolver, ya que se adherirá a una cuchara o espátula.","Cuando el azúcar se derrita, agregue la mantequilla y mezcle con el azúcar. Burbujeará, así que ten cuidado. A continuación, agregue la leche poco a poco, revolviendo continuamente.","Por último, agrega la lata de leche condensada y revuelve bien hasta incorporar por completo. Sigue revolviendo mientras el dulce de leche burbujea y se espesa a fuego medio. Necesitará otros 5-10 minutos de cocción. Se volverá de un tono marrón más oscuro y adquirirá un ligero tono rojo anaranjado a medida que se oscurece. Debe quedar lo suficientemente espeso como para dejar un canal transparente en la sartén cuando se pasa una cuchara y luego se agrega una pizca de sal. Se endurecerá a medida que se enfríe. El dulce de leche se puede guardar en un frasco en el refrigerador y se conservará hasta por un mes. Si no lo guarda en un frasco, asegúrese de taparlo para que no se forme piel."]','2026-01-11 12:57:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13299,9211,'es','helado de chocolate','Olvídese de las heladeras y las natillas: este helado de chocolate dulce no solo tiene un sabor divino, sino que también es fácil de preparar en casa.','["200 g de chocolate negro (al menos 70 % de cacao), picado en trozos pequeños","500ml de nata doble","Lata de 340g de leche condensada azucarada","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo orgánico, tamizado","50 g de chispas de chocolate con leche","hojuelas de sal marina, para servir (opcional)"]','["Derrita el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua recién hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua, o haga esto en el microondas en ráfagas de 20 segundos hasta que quede suave y brillante. Dejar enfriar un poco. Vierta la nata, la leche condensada y la vainilla en un segundo bol y bata durante 3 minutos con una batidora eléctrica hasta que espese un poco y los batidores dejen un rastro en la mezcla cuando se levanten por el bol. Tenga cuidado de no batir demasiado, ya que no quiere que la mezcla quede demasiado dura; tan pronto como los batidores dejen un rastro, estará lista.","Incorpora suavemente el chocolate derretido y el cacao en polvo a la mezcla de crema hasta que estén bien combinados, asegurándote de que la espátula llegue al fondo del tazón para que todo el chocolate se mezcle. Incorpora la mayoría de las chispas de chocolate, reservando un puñado pequeño. Vierta la mezcla en un recipiente apto para congelador de 1 litro y luego esparza sobre las chispas de chocolate reservadas. Cubra y congele durante al menos 6 horas hasta que esté firme pero se pueda sacar con pala. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por un mes. Para servir, coloque el helado en tazones o conos de helado fríos y espolvoree con una pizca de sal marina, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:57:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13300,9212,'es','Terrina de helado de frambuesa y chocolate negro','Pruebe esta terrina fácil de postre, cubierta con capas de helado, chocolate amargo y veteada con un picante puré de frambuesa. Prepáralo con anticipación para sorprender a tus invitados.','["225 g de frambuesas","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","½ limón, exprimido","400ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla","275 g de leche condensada","200 g de chocolate amargo, derretido y ligeramente enfriado, más un poco más para cubrir"]','["Forre un molde para pan de 900 g (el nuestro era de 9 x 20 x 7 cm) con dos hojas de papel para hornear superpuestas, dejando algo que sobresalga por todos los lados del molde. Ponga 175 g de frambuesas, el azúcar en polvo y el jugo de limón en una sartén a fuego medio y cocine a fuego lento durante 3 minutos hasta que se ablanden un poco. Vierta en un procesador de alimentos o use una licuadora de mano para batir hasta que quede suave.","Batir con unas varillas eléctricas la nata doble, la vainilla y la leche condensada hasta que se formen picos suaves. Vierta el puré de frambuesa y luego revuelva con cuidado unas cuantas veces para que la frambuesa penetre en la crema.","Coloca las frambuesas restantes en la base del molde forrado. Cubrir con un tercio de la mezcla de nata, distribuyéndola uniformemente. Golpea la lata sobre una superficie para que la mezcla cubra las frambuesas. Con una cuchara, rocíe sobre la mitad del chocolate derretido para cubrir la crema. Cubra con otro tercio de la mezcla de crema y extiéndala. Rocíe sobre el chocolate restante y cubra con la crema restante.","Use el pergamino que sobresale para cubrir la parte superior de la lata, use más pergamino si no cubre la terrina por completo y congélelo durante al menos 8 horas, o durante la noche. Antes de servir, deja reposar el helado a temperatura ambiente durante 10 minutos. Voltear y desmoldar, y rociar con un poco más de chocolate derretido para decorar. Deje correr agua hirviendo sobre el cuchillo, séquelo y córtelo en rodajas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13301,6094,'es','yogur helado','Prepare este yogur helado para disfrutarlo en los calurosos días de verano: es bajo en calorías y está lleno de sabor. Usamos fresas, pero puedes probar con otras frutas.','["200-300 g de fresas (dependiendo del sabor afrutado que quieras), peladas","300 g de yogur griego o estilo griego","3 cucharadas de leche condensada"]','["Use un procesador de alimentos o una licuadora para triturar las fresas y obtener un resultado final más suave, o tritúrelas en un tazón con un tenedor para obtener trozos más gruesos.","Vierta el yogur y la leche condensada en el procesador de alimentos o licuadora con las fresas y mezcle nuevamente para combinar.","Vierta en un recipiente apto para congelador y póngalo en el congelador, revolviendo cada hora para romper los cristales de hielo, luego déjelo congelar nuevamente durante la noche. Retirar del congelador 10 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13302,9213,'es','Barras de “tarta de queso” congeladas de arándanos y coco','Estos dulces de crema de coco y bayas sin gluten ni lácteos de la lectora de la revista BBC Good Food, Jenna Hope, están completamente crudos.','["280 g de anacardos sin sal","aceite sin sabor, para engrasar","140 g de almendras sin sal","140 g de dátiles sin hueso","100 g de crema de coco","2 cucharadas de aceite de coco, derretido","2 cucharadas de miel clara","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","jugo ½ limón","140 g de arándanos, más un puñado","5 dátiles sin hueso"]','["Remoja los anacardos en agua hirviendo durante 10 minutos o durante la noche en agua fría si tienes tiempo. Engrase ligeramente un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 x 20 cm.","Para hacer la base, bate las almendras y los dátiles en un procesador de alimentos hasta que estén muy finamente picados. Vierta la lata preparada y presione la mezcla hacia abajo, alisando con el dorso de una cuchara hasta que se distribuya uniformemente por toda la base. Pon el molde en el congelador para que se endurezca mientras haces la capa de \"tarta de queso\".","Escurrir los anacardos y poner la mitad en el procesador de alimentos. Agregue los ingredientes para la capa de \"tarta de queso\" y mezcle hasta que quede suave y cremoso. Saca el molde del congelador y extiende la mezcla cremosa sobre la base. Regrese al congelador durante 30-40 minutos hasta que esté firme.","Para hacer la cobertura, licúa los 140 g de arándanos y los dátiles junto con los anacardos restantes en el procesador de alimentos. Saque la lata del congelador y vierta sobre la cobertura, luego esparza sobre un puñado de arándanos. Regrese al congelador durante al menos 1 hora para que se endurezca. Se puede conservar en el congelador hasta por 2 meses. Retirar del congelador 10 minutos antes de servir, luego cortar en 10-12 barras y disfrutar."]','2026-01-11 12:57:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13303,9214,'es','Yogur helado de galletas de fresa','No necesitas una máquina para hacer helados para preparar este postre helado fácil, cubierto con fresas liofilizadas y galletas trituradas.','["550 g de fresas peladas","500 g de yogur griego en bote","Lata de 397g de leche condensada.","2 cucharaditas de pasta o extracto de vainilla","200ml de nata doble","8 galletas de mantequilla, trituradas (opcional)","2 cucharadas de trozos de fresa liofilizados (opcional, disponibles en Waitrose, Sainsbury''s o en línea)"]','["Ponga 400 g de fresas en un procesador de alimentos y tritúrelas hasta obtener un puré suave. Pica las fresas restantes en trozos pequeños y reserva. Agrega el yogur, la leche condensada y la vainilla al procesador y bate nuevamente para combinar.","Vierta la crema en un bol y bata ligeramente hasta que mantenga su forma. Agregue aproximadamente un tercio de la mezcla de fresas, mezcle con una espátula, luego agregue el resto de la mezcla de fresas y las fresas picadas y mezcle nuevamente.","Vierta la mitad en un recipiente apto para congelador, esparza la mitad de los trozos de mantequilla, si los usa, y la mitad de las fresas liofilizadas, luego cubra con la mezcla de yogur restante, las galletas de mantequilla trituradas y las fresas liofilizadas. Congele durante al menos 4 horas hasta que esté sólido. Retirar del congelador 10-15 minutos antes de sacarlo. Congele por hasta 2 meses."]','2026-01-11 12:57:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13304,9215,'es','Fantasmas de plátano congelado','Los plátanos saben espeluznantemente a helado cremoso cuando se congelan en fantasmales capas de chocolate blanco: rápido y fácil, con solo 4 ingredientes','["200 g de barra de chocolate blanco (la marca belga del supermercado es buena), partida en trozos","4 plátanos maduros medianos-grandes","85 g de coco rallado (no lo usarás todo)","un puñado de gotas de chocolate amargo"]','["En un tazón pequeño, derrita suavemente el chocolate en el microondas, en ráfagas cortas a temperatura alta o sobre una olla con agua hirviendo (asegúrese de que el tazón no toque el agua). Reserva un momento mientras preparas los plátanos.","Pela los plátanos, córtalos por la mitad y coloca un palito de paleta en el centro de cada trozo. Extienda el coco en un recipiente poco profundo. Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear y asegúrese de que haya espacio para la bandeja en el congelador.","Con una brocha de repostería, cubra la mitad de un plátano con chocolate, dejando que escurra el exceso. Espolvorea con abundante coco hasta que esté cubierto, luego colócalo en la hoja preparada. Ahora añade dos ojos de chocolate y una boca y, si quieres, corta también unas cuantas cejas de las gotas de chocolate. Congela los caramelos durante al menos 4 horas y hasta una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:57:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13305,9216,'es','Tarta de yogur helado de moras y manzana','Las capas de yogur helado obtienen un contraste crujiente con una base de galleta de avena en este impresionante pudín: una excelente alternativa a la tarta de queso.','["85 g de mantequilla, más algo extra para engrasar","1 cucharada de azúcar mascabado light","½ cucharadita de canela molida","200 g de galletas Hobnob, finamente trituradas","1 manzana Bramley grande (aproximadamente 350 g), pelada y picada para obtener 250 g","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","450 g de moras y algunas más para servir","2 latas de leche condensada de 400 g","750 g de yogur griego entero (nosotros usamos Total)","600ml de nata doble","½ cucharadita de canela molida","4 cucharadas de azúcar mascabado light","1 cucharadita de arrurruz en polvo mezclado con 1 cucharadita de agua (opcional)"]','["Engrase y forre la base y los lados de un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm de profundidad con papel para hornear, dejando 2,5 cm de papel sobresaliendo por encima del borde, como un collar. En una sartén grande, derrita la mantequilla con el azúcar. Mezcle la canela y las migas de galleta, luego agregue la mantequilla y mezcle hasta que parezca arena húmeda. Presione las migas en la base en una capa uniforme y luego congélelas.","Pon la manzana, el jugo de limón y 1 cucharada de agua en una cacerola grande. Llevar a fuego lento, luego tapar y cocinar durante 3 minutos o hasta que esté totalmente suave. Pase esta mezcla pulposa por un colador a un tazón grande. Dejar enfriar. Triture las moras con un tenedor y luego tamícelas en otro tazón; una espátula de goma es mejor para exprimir hasta el último trozo de fruta de las semillas.","Mezcle la leche condensada, 500 g de yogur y 300 ml de nata hasta que se mezclen uniformemente. Vierta 450 g de esto sobre el puré de manzana, agregue 1,4 cucharadita de canela y luego bata con un batidor de globo hasta que espese un poco. Vierta sobre la capa de galleta, nivele y luego congele durante 30 minutos o hasta que esté firme. Enfríe la mezcla de yogur restante en el frigorífico.","Batir unas 3 cucharadas de puré de moras con el resto de la mezcla de yogur hasta obtener un color rosa pálido. Vierta un tercio de esto sobre la capa de manzana y luego congele hasta que esté firme. Repita dos veces, agregando suficiente fruta a la mezcla de yogur para que cada capa tenga un rosa ligeramente más oscuro que la anterior. Congele durante la noche o hasta que esté totalmente sólido. Se puede preparar con 1 mes de antelación, bien envuelto en el congelador.","Cuando esté listo para servir, descongele el puré de moras restante, si está congelado. Llevar a fuego lento el puré, 1,4 cucharaditas de canela y 1 cucharada de azúcar. Agregue la mezcla de arrurruz hasta que esté ligeramente espesa y brillante. (El arrurruz no se congela bien, así que no lo congele después de este punto). Deje enfriar.","Saca el bizcocho del congelador 10 minutos antes de servir. Retirar del molde después de 5 minutos, quitar el papel y transferir a un plato. Batir los 300 ml de nata restantes, 250 g de yogur y 3 cucharadas de azúcar hasta que estén esponjosos pero no rígidos. Vierta encima del pastel en picos y espolvoree con algunas bayas más. Añade un chorrito de salsa justo antes de servir y pasa el resto en una jarra."]','2026-01-11 12:57:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13306,9217,'es','Pastel de panal de frambuesa congelado','Un dulce, lleno de helado, panal y frambuesas para satisfacer a los golosos.','["85 g de mantequilla, derretida","500 g de helado de vainilla en tarrina","400 g de frambuesas","150 g de panal, desmenuzado","Bote de 150ml de nata doble","100 g de azúcar mascabado","75 g de mantequilla"]','["Coloque las galletas de caramelo en un procesador de alimentos y tritúrelas hasta obtener migajas. Agrega la mantequilla derretida y bate nuevamente hasta que esté bien combinada. Utilice las migas de galleta para forrar un molde para tarta estriado de 22 cm de profundidad, presionando las migajas en la base y hacia los lados con el dorso de una cuchara hasta que estén realmente compactas. Enfría por 30 minutos mientras preparas el relleno.","Saca el helado del congelador 20 minutos antes de que estés listo para usarlo. Vierta las frambuesas en un bol, reserve un puñado y triture ligeramente aproximadamente la mitad con el dorso de un tenedor hasta que queden jugosas. Una vez que el helado se haya ablandado, viértalo en otro tazón y triture con el dorso de una cuchara hasta que esté flexible pero no completamente descongelado. Agregue las frambuesas y la mitad del panal, luego mezcle.","Retire la tarta del refrigerador y vierta la mezcla de helado de frambuesa en el centro, alisando hasta los bordes. Cubra con las frambuesas y el panal reservados, empujándolos un poco hacia la capa de helado, luego congélelo durante 4 horas hasta que esté completamente congelado.","Para hacer una salsa de caramelo, poner en un cazo la nata, el azúcar y la mantequilla con una buena pizca de sal y llevar a fuego lento. Burbujee durante 5 minutos hasta que tenga la consistencia de caramelo, luego enfríe durante 2 minutos antes de servir con rebanadas de pastel. Se mantendrá durante 1 semana."]','2026-01-11 12:57:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13307,9218,'es','Paletas heladas de yogur de bayas y jengibre','Estos polos son clientes realmente interesantes: son un cruce entre tarta de queso, yogur helado y helado de frutas.','["100 g de galletas de jengibre y nueces","Lata de 405g de leche condensada light","250g de frutos rojos, nosotros utilizamos fresas, frambuesas y grosellas","Bote de 500g de yogur griego natural 0% grasa","250 g de frutos rojos, nosotros utilizamos arándanos, moras y grosellas negras","8 vasos de papel","8 palitos de paleta de madera"]','["Coloque las galletas en un procesador de alimentos y triture hasta obtener migajas. Agrega 2 cucharadas de leche condensada y licúa nuevamente hasta que las migas comiencen a formar grumos. Divida las migas de galleta en 8 vasos de papel, presionando con el dorso de una cuchara. Asegúrate de raspar hasta la última migaja, así no tendrás que lavar el procesador antes del siguiente paso.","Pica las bayas grandes en trozos grandes. Poner la mitad de los frutos rojos, la mitad del resto de la leche condensada y la mitad\r\nel yogur en el procesador de alimentos y licua hasta que quede suave. Retire la cuchilla del procesador y revuelva con los frutos rojos picados restantes. Divide la mezcla entre 4 de los vasos de papel. Repita con las bayas moradas y los ingredientes restantes.","Coloque un palito de paleta en cada taza, empujándolo hacia abajo en la base de la galleta para ayudar a que quede erguido. Congele durante al menos 4 horas antes de servir. Para quitar los polos de los vasos, inclínelo boca abajo y apriete suavemente el vaso hasta que el polo se salga."]','2026-01-11 12:57:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13308,9219,'es','Yogur de plátano helado','Este postre helado sin batir es una excelente alternativa al helado. Sirva cubierto con crujientes chips de plátano.','["4 plátanos demasiado maduros (cuanto más negros, mejor) unos 375 después de pelarlos","Bote de 500 g de yogur griego entero","175 g de leche condensada","un puñado grande de chips de plátano"]','["Batir la pulpa de los plátanos, el yogur y la leche condensada en un procesador de alimentos o licuadora hasta que quede suave. Viértalo en un recipiente para helado o en un molde para pan, o divídalo en recipientes individuales.","Triture los chips de plátano, si los usa, introduciéndolos en una bolsa de comida y golpeándolos con la punta de un rodillo, como lo haría con las galletas para una base de tarta de queso. Agite la mezcla de yogur helado, luego cubra bien el recipiente o los recipientes con film transparente y congele durante la noche hasta que esté sólido. Se conservará durante 3 meses en el congelador."]','2026-01-11 12:57:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13309,9220,'es','Tarta de queso congelada con frambuesa y chocolate blanco','Con su base de galleta y su cobertura cremosa, la tarta de queso siempre es un ganador. Esta versión afrutada congelada es un postre perfecto para preparar con anticipación para el entretenimiento.','["Bote de 200ml de nata doble","200 g de chocolate blanco en barra, partido en trozos, más algo extra para servir","300 g de frambuesas, más algo extra para servir","500 g de queso crema","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","300 g de helado de vainilla o chocolate blanco: todos sabrán bien, pero los helados sin demasiados trozos son los mejores","175 g de galletas de mantequilla crujientes (nosotros utilizamos Butter Crinkle Crunch de Fox)","140 g de nueces de jengibre","140 g de mantequilla, derretida"]','["Pincele un molde para hornear de 20 x 30 cm con un\r\nun poco de aceite, luego cubrir bien con dos capas de\r\nfilm transparente, dejando un saliente para levantarlo\r\n– o utilice una lata con el fondo suelto. Pon el\r\ngalletas en un procesador de alimentos y mezclar\r\nhasta obtener migajas, luego agregue la mantequilla derretida\r\ny mezclar nuevamente. Presione las migas firmemente\r\nen la base de la lata preparada, luego\r\nenfría mientras haces el relleno.","Poner la nata y el chocolate en un pequeño\r\nsartén. Derretir muy suavemente, revolviendo, hasta que no\r\nQuedan trozos de chocolate. Limpiar el\r\nprocesador de alimentos y agregue las frambuesas\r\ny mezcla cremosa de chocolate. Batir juntos hasta que no pueda obtener nada.\r\nmás suave, luego frótelo a través de un colador para\r\ndeshazte de las semillas de frambuesa.","Poner el queso crema en una batidora.\r\nbol con el azúcar y el tamizado\r\nmezcla de frambuesa. Batir con un\r\nbatidor eléctrico hasta que quede suave.","Deja que el helado se ablande en un bol grande,\r\npero sin derretir, luego incorporar la crema.\r\nmezcla de queso poco a poco hasta\r\nbien mezclado y no se forman grumos de helado\r\nvisible. Vierta en la lata preparada y nivele la parte superior. Cubrir con film transparente, no\r\ndejando que toque la parte superior de la tarta de queso,\r\nluego congelar al menos durante la noche o hasta\r\na 3 meses antes de servir.","Para servir, retire la cubierta adhesiva.\r\npelícula, levante la tarta de queso o deslícela\r\nsi está en una lata de fondo suelto. Eliminar cualquier\r\npelícula adhesiva restante. decorar la parte superior\r\ncon frambuesas frescas y rociar con\r\nun poco más de chocolate blanco derretido."]','2026-01-11 12:57:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13310,5986,'es','Palitos de fruta congelada con llovizna de maracuyá y lima','En un día caluroso, te alegrará este refrigerio helado y afrutado, bajo en grasa y una excelente fuente de vitamina C, perfecto para los niños.','["100 g de fresas, peladas y partidas por la mitad","8 uvas sin semillas","100 g/4 oz de trozos de mango","100 g/4 oz de trozos de melón","2 kiwis, pelados y cortados en trozos","100 g/4 oz de trozos de piña","jugo 2 limones","4 maracuyás, cortados por la mitad y sin semillas","1 cucharadita de azúcar glas"]','["Mezclar los ingredientes de la llovizna en un\r\ntazón pequeño, revolviendo hasta que el azúcar\r\nse ha disuelto. Si quieres la salsa\r\npara que quede suave pasarlo por un\r\ncolar para quitar las semillas, o dejar\r\nsi lo prefieres.","Ensartar las frutas en madera.\r\nbrochetas y rociar la salsa\r\nencima, reservando un poco para mojar.\r\nColoca las brochetas en el congelador durante\r\n45 minutos, hasta que empiece a congelarse.\r\nServir con el chorrito sobrante."]','2026-01-11 12:57:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13311,7721,'es','Yogur helado de té verde con trozos quebradizos de sésamo','El yogur helado es realmente fácil de preparar y tiene menos grasa que el helado. Puedes encontrar té verde ''matcha'' en polvo en tiendas naturistas','["2 botes de 500 g de yogur griego al 2%","200 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de té verde matcha en polvo","200 g de azúcar en polvo","4 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo tostadas"]','["En un tazón grande, bata la\r\nbien el yogur, el azúcar y el matcha en polvo\r\nhasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Cubrir y\r\nenfríe durante 1 hora o hasta que la mezcla esté muy\r\nfrío. Vierta en una máquina para hacer helados.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del fabricante.\r\nVierta en un recipiente congelable y\r\nCongele durante 4-5 horas hasta que esté firme.","Para hacer el sésamo quebradizo, forre un\r\nbandeja para hornear con papel para hornear.\r\nCalienta el azúcar en una cacerola mediana.\r\nDejar derretir, sin revolver, durante aproximadamente\r\n5 minutos hasta que burbujee y esté dorado. Revuelva el\r\nsemillas de sésamo en el caramelo claro,\r\nhervir durante unos segundos, luego verter la mezcla\r\nen la bandeja para hornear, extendiendo como\r\nlo más delgado posible. Una vez endurecido, golpear\r\nlo quebradizo en el mostrador para romperlo\r\npiezas. Se puede hacer con 1 semana de antelación\r\ny almacenado en una lata hermética.","Retire el yogur helado del\r\ncongelar aproximadamente 1 hora antes de servir, para\r\nsuavizar ligeramente. Vierta en tazones pequeños\r\ncon el sésamo crujiente esparcido por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:57:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13312,9221,'es','Parfait congelado de plátano y praliné','Este postre congelado para una cena tiene un verdadero factor sorpresa, por lo que todo lo que te queda por hacer esa noche es presentarlo con un estilo deslumbrante.','["200 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de avellanas enteras blanqueadas","aceite de girasol, para engrasar","2 plátanos maduros (la piel debe tener muchas manchas, pero no magulladas ni negras)","2 cucharaditas de jugo de limón","300ml de nata doble","2 claras de huevo","100 g de azúcar en polvo","4 plátanos maduros pero firmes","100 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Para hacer el praliné, pon el azúcar.\r\nen una sartén de base pesada con 3 cucharadas\r\nagua. Colocar a fuego lento hasta que\r\nel azúcar se ha disuelto y está claro. No revuelvas o cristalizará. aumentar\r\nel calor y burbujee hasta obtener un caramelo oscuro\r\n(ver técnica de video), sobre\r\n5 minutos. Retirar del fuego, revolver\r\na través de las tuercas, luego inclínelo sobre una superficie ligeramente\r\nbandeja para hornear antiadherente engrasada. Difundir a\r\nnivelar y dejar enfriar. Tenga cuidado como el\r\nLa bandeja se calentará mucho.","Cuando el praliné esté frío y quebradizo,\r\nromperlo en pedazos. Luego, usando el final\r\nde un rodillo, tritúrelo hasta que esté bastante bien\r\naplastado. Si esto está resultando un trabajo duro, dé una propina\r\nen un procesador de alimentos y presione hasta que esté\r\nla textura del pan rallado grueso.","Forrar un molde para pan de 1,2 litros con una tira de\r\npergamino para hornear (este tamaño de molde le da una forma ordenada, pero puede colocar el parfait en cualquier molde, o en recipientes o moldes para pudín individuales). En un bol triturar la\r\nplátanos con la mitad del jugo de limón hasta\r\ntienes un puré grueso, luego reserva.","Poner la nata en un bol y montar\r\nhasta que mantenga su forma pero todavía esté un poco\r\nsuave. En otro bol muy limpio y\r\ncon unas varillas eléctricas muy limpias, batir\r\nlas claras con un apretón más\r\njugo de limón hasta que esté firme. Añade lentamente el\r\nazúcar hasta tener una consistencia dura y brillante\r\nmerengue.","Incorporar suavemente la nata montada y\r\nmerengue juntos, luego agregue el plátano\r\ny la mayor parte del praliné, dejando aproximadamente\r\n4 cucharadas para servir. Vierta en el molde para pan,\r\nalise la parte superior y congele hasta que esté firme,\r\npreferiblemente durante la noche.","Para servir, retire el parfait del\r\ncongelar 10 minutos antes de servir y dejar\r\nen el frigorífico para que se ablande un poco. Mientras tanto,\r\nCortar los plátanos en forma inclinada, permitiendo\r\n3 rebanadas por cada porción. Coloca las rodajas\r\nen una bandeja para hornear colocada sobre una tabla de madera\r\ny espolvorear abundantemente con el azúcar. Utilice un\r\nsoplete para caramelizar el plátano y luego reservar. ser muy\r\nTenga cuidado ya que la bandeja estará extremadamente caliente. Si no tienes un soplete, coloca las rodajas en una sartén seca y caliente y dora los lados cubiertos de azúcar hasta que se caramelicen. Levántalos y voltéalos sobre una bandeja.","Para emplatar, espolvoree una línea limpia de praliné.\r\njusto descentrado en cada plato. Disponer las lonchas de caramelizado\r\nplátano en ángulos opuestos. Desmoldar el parfait y luego utilizar un\r\ncuchillo calentado para limpiar los lados\r\ny cortar en rodajas del grosor de un dedo. Coloque la rebanada en el lado opuesto.\r\nlado del plato al plátano\r\ny servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:57:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13313,5998,'es','Yogur instantáneo de frutos rojos congelado','Tres ingredientes y dos minutos es todo lo que necesitas para preparar este yogur bajo en grasas y calorías, ideal para comer después del ejercicio o de un largo día de aprendizaje en la escuela.','["250 g de frutos rojos congelados","250 g de yogur griego 0% grasa","1 cucharada de miel o sirope de agave"]','["Licue las bayas, el yogur y la miel o el jarabe de agave en un procesador de alimentos durante 20 segundos, hasta obtener una textura de helado suave. Vierta en tazones y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:57:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13314,5547,'es','Yogur helado de fresa','El magnífico yogur helado de Sarah Cook es intensamente afrutado y muy cremoso... ¡pero totalmente libre de grasa!','["140 g de fresas","½ lata de 405g de leche condensada light","Tarrina de 500 g de yogur griego 0% grasa"]','["Pica la mitad de las fresas en trozos grandes y bate el resto en un procesador de alimentos o con una batidora hasta obtener un puré.","En un tazón grande, agregue la leche condensada al puré de fresas y luego agregue suavemente el yogur hasta que esté bien mezclado. Incorpora las fresas picadas.","Vierta la mezcla en un molde para pan o en un recipiente, tápelo o envuélvalo bien en una película adhesiva y congélelo durante la noche, hasta que esté sólido. Sácalo del congelador unos 10 a 15 minutos antes de servir el yogur helado. Se puede congelar hasta por 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:57:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13315,9222,'es','Tonto de mora congelada','A medio camino entre un helado y un programa de estudios, este postre cubierto de bayas es espectacular y de temporada.','["300 g de moras","jugo 1 limon","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","300ml de nata doble","galletas de mantequilla, para servir"]','["Triture la mayoría de las moras con el\r\nJugo de limón y la mitad del azúcar. látigo\r\nla nata con el azúcar restante.\r\nDoblar la nata montada y la mora.\r\nmezclar para hacer una crema malva,\r\nluego viértalo en un recipiente para congelar y\r\ncongelar hasta que cuaje. Servir en cucharadas en\r\nvasos, con las galletas de mantequilla y\r\nlas moras restantes a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:57:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13316,9223,'es','Tarta de queso congelada con plátano y mantequilla de maní','Un excelente postre de reserva que funciona bien e impresionará a niños y adultos.','["3 plátanos pequeños","50 g de mantequilla, derretida","10 galletas digestivas, trituradas hasta obtener migajas","Tarrina 142ml crema doble","140 g de azúcar glas","400 g de queso tierno en tarrina","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","237 g de mantequilla de maní crujiente"]','["Varias horas antes, coloca 2 plátanos en el congelador hasta que la piel se ponga negra, luego retíralos y descongélalos. te quedarás\r\ncon plátanos muy tiernos. Pelar, luego triturar bien y reservar.","Mezcle la mantequilla y las galletas y luego presione en un molde desmontable para pasteles de 22 cm. Montar la nata hasta que mantenga su\r\nforma. En un recipiente aparte, bata el azúcar, el queso tierno y la vainilla hasta que estén completamente combinados. En otro bol batir la mantequilla de maní para que se suelte.","Incorpora la mezcla de queso a la mantequilla de maní, luego agrega el puré de plátano y agrega suavemente la crema. Extender la mezcla sobre la base de galleta y alisar la parte superior. Congelar durante varias horas o preferiblemente durante la noche. Para servir, deja el bizcocho en el frigorífico durante 20 minutos, luego pasa un cuchillo por los lados y retira los lados del molde. Corta el plátano restante en rodajas y úsalo para decorar la tarta de queso."]','2026-01-11 12:57:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13317,9224,'es','pastel de luz navideña','Sorprenda a sus invitados con nuestra cobertura navideña con luces navideñas, hecha con glaseado de fondant y almendras azucaradas. También puedes usar dulces de gelatina, si quieres.','["100 g de mermelada de albaricoque suave","1 pastel de frutas de 20 cm","300 g de azúcar glas y un poco más para espolvorear","600 g de mazapán","gel colorante alimentario azul","1 kg de glaseado de fondant blanco listo para enrollar","gel colorante alimentario verde","500 g de peladillas de colores (ver consejo a continuación)"]','["Calentar la mermelada en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento hasta que se suelte. Unte todo el pastel de frutas con la mitad de la mermelada. Espolvoree ligeramente una superficie de trabajo con azúcar glas y luego extienda el mazapán formando un círculo lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir la parte superior y los lados del pastel; debe tener aproximadamente ½ cm de espesor. Levante el mazapán sobre el pastel con el rodillo, luego alise el mazapán por los lados y recorte el exceso.","Agregue unas gotas de colorante azul al glaseado de fondant, luego amase hasta que el fondant esté suave y de color azul pálido (consulte el consejo a continuación).","Unte todo el bizcocho cubierto de mazapán con el resto de la mermelada. Enrolle el fondant azul formando un círculo lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir la parte superior y los lados del pastel, luego levántelo con el rodillo y alise el costado. Recorta el exceso de fondant y suaviza las marcas con la palma de tu mano. Dejar de lado.","Mezcle el azúcar glas con 1 cucharada de agua a la vez hasta obtener un glaseado espeso y que se pueda pipetear (puede usar hasta 3 cucharadas de agua). Divida el glaseado en dos tazones. Agregue unas gotas de colorante alimentario verde a uno de los tazones (dejando un tazón liso), revuelva para combinar y luego transfiéralo a una bolsa para manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla redonda mediana.","Coloca líneas ondulantes del glaseado verde alrededor de la parte superior y lateral del pastel unas cuantas veces; este será el \"cable\" para las luces de colores. Use la punta de un cuchillo para cubiertos o una cucharadita para colocar una pequeña cantidad de glaseado simple en la parte posterior de las almendras azucaradas, luego colóquelas a lo largo del cable verde entubado para que las almendras parezcan una cadena de luces de colores."]','2026-01-11 12:57:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13318,9225,'es','Pastel de arándanos y avellanas','Un pastel de frutas versátil y ligero con un toque especiado y muchos arándanos y cerezas jugosos: ¡hielo como quieras!','["200 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","100 g de pasas","Tarro de 200 g de cerezas glaseadas, partidas por la mitad","100 g de arándanos secos","200 g de arándanos frescos o congelados","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","50ml de jerez, brandy, Disaronno o Frangelico","250 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 huevos grandes","200 g de harina con levadura","100 g de almendra molida","100 g de avellanas tostadas picadas","1 cucharada de especias mixtas"]','["Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Engrase un molde para pasteles de 20 cm de profundidad y cúbralo con papel para hornear, lo suficientemente alto como para quedar 2,5 cm por encima de la parte superior del molde. Ponga las pasas, las cerezas, todos los arándanos, la ralladura y el jugo de naranja y el alcohol en una cacerola pequeña. Llevar a ebullición y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 3 minutos, hasta que los arándanos se ablanden un poco y la mayor parte del líquido se haya evaporado. Dejar enfriar.","Poner el azúcar, la mantequilla y la vainilla en un bol y batir con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega los huevos, la harina, las almendras, las avellanas y la mezcla de especias. Bate nuevamente hasta que esté combinado, luego revuelve la fruta remojada y el jugo restante. Vierta la mezcla del pastel en el molde y nivele la parte superior, luego hornee durante 1 hora y 20 minutos, hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro del pastel, éste salga limpio. Si la brocheta tiene mezcla de pastel cruda, regrésela al horno durante 10 minutos y luego verifique nuevamente. Dejar enfriar en el molde. Se congelará durante 4 meses envuelto en film transparente y luego en papel de aluminio."]','2026-01-11 12:57:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13319,9226,'es','Pastel de Navidad para todos los gustos','Dale un cambio de imagen al clásico pastel de frutas navideño con canela, rosa, azahar y mango tropical para obtener un pastel afrutado y fragante.','["rallar 1 naranja o 2 clementinas, más 100 ml de zumo","ralladura de 2 limones y 100 ml de zumo","1 cucharada de agua de azahar","1 cucharadita de agua de rosas","3 cucharadas de miel clara","200 g de cerezas heladas","200 g de piel mixta","200 g de orejones cortados en cubitos","175 g de pasas doradas","140 g de arándanos o guindas secos, o una mezcla","100 g de mangos secos, cortados en cubitos","280 g de mantequilla a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para engrasar","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de azúcar mascabado light","4 huevos grandes, batidos","250 g de harina común","100 g de almendras molidas","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","1 cucharadita de agua de azahar","50ml de jugo de naranja"]','["Mezcle las ralladuras y el jugo de naranja y limón, el agua de azahar, el agua de rosas y la miel en un tazón grande. Agregue todos los frutos secos, cubra y déjelo en remojo durante la noche.","Al día siguiente, caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Engrase y forre dos veces un molde para pastel redondo o cuadrado de 22 cm (para un pastel más plano) o un molde redondo o cuadrado de 20 cm (para un pastel más profundo) con papel para hornear. En otro tazón grande, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Batir los huevos, uno por uno, luego incorporar la harina, las almendras y la canela.","Vierta las frutas remojadas y el jugo que quede en el tazón y revuelva. Vierta la mezcla en la lata preparada y nivele la parte superior. Si desea que su pastel sea plano en lugar de ligeramente redondeado, haga un baño gradual en el centro de la mezcla con el dorso de una cuchara de madera. Hornee durante 1 hora 30 minutos, luego baje el horno a 140 ° C/120 ° C ventilador/gas 1 y hornee durante 1 hora 30 minutos más para pasteles de 22 cm, o 1 hora 50 minutos para pasteles de 20 cm, hasta que al pinchar un pincho en el centro, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar en el molde, sobre una rejilla.","Mientras el bizcocho aún está caliente, mezcle los ingredientes de la alimentación, salpimente el bizcocho con agujeros con una brocheta fina y vierta sobre el líquido. Si va a preparar el pastel con anticipación, aliméntelo una vez a la semana durante hasta 4 semanas. Manténgalo bien envuelto en pergamino, dentro de un recipiente hermético, hasta por 1 mes. Si no estás avanzando, este pastel sabe igual de delicioso uno o dos días después de hornearlo."]','2026-01-11 12:57:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13320,5215,'es','Tarta de clementinas rellena de frutas','Un hermoso y húmedo pastel sin gluten lleno de sabores cítricos, maravilloso para Navidad','["4 clementinas pequeñas","200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","140 g de pasas","140 g de pasas","140 g de grosellas","100 g de cerezas glaseadas, en cuartos","2 cucharadas de brandy","200 g de azúcar moreno oscuro","3 huevos batidos","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","pellizcar clavo molido","140 g de polenta","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo (nosotros usamos Fiddes Payne, que no contiene gluten)","azúcar glas, para decorar (la mayoría son sin gluten, pero revisa el empaque)","100 g de almendras molidas","4 clementines","140 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Para hacer el bizcocho, coloca las clementinas en una cacerola pequeña, cúbrelas con agua y deja que hierva. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine durante 1 hora o hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir y enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde desmontable de 20 cm y forrar la base con un disco de papel para hornear untado con mantequilla. Cortar las clementinas cocidas por la mitad y quitarles las pepitas. Colóquelo en el tazón de un procesador de alimentos y presione hasta que esté finamente picado pero no hecho puré.","Combine las pasas, las pasas, las grosellas, las cerezas y el brandy en un bol. Agrega la pulpa de clementina y mezcla bien. Crema la\r\nmantequilla y azúcar juntos hasta que estén pálidos. Agrega los huevos batidos, poco a poco, mezclando bien entre cada adición. en otro\r\nEn un tazón, combine las especias, las almendras molidas, la polenta y el polvo para hornear. Incorporar a la mezcla de crema junto con los frutos secos y la pulpa de clementina.","Vierta en el molde preparado y alise la parte superior. Hornee en el estante medio del horno durante 30 minutos. Reducir la temperatura del horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3 y continuar cocinando durante 40 minutos más. Es posible que tengas que cubrir sin apretar la parte superior del pastel con una hoja de papel para hornear durante los últimos 20 minutos para evitar que se dore demasiado rápido. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 30 minutos antes de colocarlo sobre una rejilla para enfriar.","Para hacer la cobertura, corte las clementinas en rodajas de 5 mm de grosor. Vierta el azúcar en una cacerola con 140 ml de agua y cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Pon las rodajas de clementina en la sartén y revuelve. Para mantener las clementinas sumergidas en el almíbar, corta un círculo de papel vegetal para que quepa en el molde y colócalo sobre la fruta. Cocine a fuego lento durante 1 hora hasta que esté brillante y traslúcido. Retirar y extender sobre papel vegetal para que se enfríe.","Para servir, espolvorea todo el pastel con azúcar glas y luego coloca las rodajas de clementina, superpuestas, sobre la parte superior del pastel."]','2026-01-11 12:57:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13321,9227,'es','Pastel joya de frutas, nueces y semillas','Si no te gustan el glaseado y el mazapán, hornea una corona de nueces tostadas, semillas y cerezas jugosas en tu pastel.','["1 lote de mezcla para pastel de frutas Hot Toddy cruda (ver enlace a continuación)","Tabla para tartas fina de 20 cm (opcional)","Cinta de aproximadamente 65 cm de largo de ancho.","50 g de mantequilla","50 g de almíbar dorado","2 cucharadas de anacardos grandes sin sal","3 cucharadas de almendras enteras blanqueadas","5 cucharadas de pistachos sin cáscara","25 g de nueces de Brasil","85 ml de cerezas heladas","50 g de arándanos secos","2 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza"]','["Prepare el pastel Hot Toddy (ver enlace a la derecha) en un molde de fondo suelto, reservando aproximadamente 2 cucharadas de la mezcla para más tarde. Mientras se hornea, hornee la cobertura de frutas y nueces. Derrita la mantequilla y el almíbar dorado, luego mezcle con las nueces, los frutos secos y las semillas. Dejar de lado; la mezcla de mantequilla comenzará a enfriarse y espesarse.","Saque el bizcocho del horno 30 minutos antes de que finalice la cocción y luego extiéndalo suavemente sobre la mezcla restante del bizcocho con\r\nel dorso de una cuchara. El bizcocho seguirá estando bastante blando pero aguantará el peso, no te preocupes si se hunde. Esparza la mezcla de frutas y nueces por encima en una capa uniforme. Hornee por los 30 minutos restantes hasta que el pastel esté cocido y las nueces doradas. Pruebe si está cocido metiendo una brocheta a través de la cobertura y dentro del pastel. Si está poco cocido, pero las nueces están doradas, simplemente cúbralo con papel de aluminio y déjelo otros 10 minutos; luego prueba de nuevo.","Deje que el pastel se enfríe completamente en el molde para que la cobertura de nueces se endurezca. Afloje los bordes obviamente pegajosos y luego saque el pastel del molde desde abajo. Transfiera a una tabla o plato para pastel y fije la cinta alrededor de la base antes de servir. Se puede conservar en una lata hermética hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:57:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13322,8505,'es','Pastel elegante con corona de frutos rojos','Sencillo, inteligente, pero aún así tranquilizadoramente tradicional','["Paquete de 500g de mazapán natural","3 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque, calentada y tamizada","400 g de azúcar glas","2 claras de huevo","1 clara de huevo","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","varias ramitas de eucalipto (las variedades de hojas más pequeñas lucen mejor)","muchas hojas de laurel frescas, en ramitas si es posible","100 g de arándanos, descongelados si están congelados"]','["HAGA UN PASTEL EN FORMA DE ANILLO: Prepare la mezcla para pastel de frutas Hot Toddy (receta al lado), luego engrase y forre dos veces un molde para pastel redondo y profundo de 23 cm. Retire la etiqueta de una lata vacía de 400 g y lávela bien. Unte con mantequilla el exterior de la lata y\r\nenvolver en papel de horno antiadherente. Llene la lata hasta un tercio de su capacidad con frijoles para hornear, arroz o legumbres secas (para pesar\r\nhacia abajo), luego colóquelo en el medio de la lata. Vierta la mezcla para pastel alrededor del \"anillo\" y luego alise la parte superior. Hornee a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3 durante 1½ horas, luego baje a 140C/ventilador 120C/gas 1 y hornee por otra hora o hasta que salga una brocheta.\r\nsalir limpio.","Mientras el bizcocho aún esté caliente, utiliza la brocheta.\r\nsalpimentar el bizcocho con agujeros, pinchándolo todo\r\nel camino hacia abajo. Disuelva el azúcar en el té,\r\nagregue el whisky o el jugo de naranja, luego vierta\r\nsobre la superficie. Si estás haciendo el pastel\r\ncon anticipación, aliméntelo con un trago fresco de\r\nponche todas las semanas, pero tenga cuidado de no hacer\r\nel pastel empapado. Se puede conservar durante un mes.\r\nbien envuelto en un recipiente hermético en un\r\nlugar fresco y seco. Si hay poco tiempo, el pastel puede\r\nSe hará el mismo día que lo decores.","Para decorar, batir ligeramente la clara de huevo,\r\nluego ponga el azúcar en polvo en un plato plano o\r\nbandeja. Sumerge las puntas de las hojas en el huevo.\r\nblanco, sacudir el exceso y luego sumergirlo en el\r\nazúcar para cubrir. Dejar secar mientras cubres.\r\nla tarta con mazapán. Si tus arándanos\r\nestán congeladas, déjalas sobre unas hojas de\r\ntoalla de cocina en esta etapa para descongelar y secar\r\no el jugo correrá hacia el glaseado.","Enrollar el mazapán hasta formar un círculo de 23 cm, dándole forma\r\nforma una ronda con las manos. Alternativamente,\r\nenrolle el mazapán un poco más grande de lo necesario,\r\nluego corte una ronda usando la base del molde para pastel como\r\nuna guía. Dale la vuelta al mazapán. Cepilla el\r\nencima del bizcocho con mermelada, luego ponlo, por el lado de la mermelada\r\nabajo, sobre el mazapán.","Haz el agujero en el medio. Usando la lata,\r\nEmpuje a través del agujero en el centro de la\r\npastel y sacar el exceso de mazapán – esto es\r\nLa forma más fácil de asegurarse de que el agujero en el\r\ncubrir el agujero del pastel con cerillas. girar pastel\r\nhacia arriba y siéntate en un plato para pastel.","Tamizar el azúcar glas y batir con la\r\nclara de huevo hasta que esté espesa y suave. difundir\r\nsobre el mazapán con una espátula, luego\r\ndecorar la parte superior con arándanos, hojas de laurel\r\ny las ramitas de eucalipto escarchadas. salir\r\ndejar reposar durante la noche antes de cortar. puede ser\r\ndecorado hasta con un día de antelación. mantener el pastel\r\nenvuelto en papel de aluminio hasta el glaseado."]','2026-01-11 12:57:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13323,9229,'es','pastel de dundee','Un famoso pastel de frutas tradicional escocés con cerezas, pasas y almendras y un glaseado dulce.','["100 g de almendras blanqueadas","180 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","180 g de azúcar mascabado light","ralladura de 1 naranja grande","3 cucharadas de confitura o mermelada de albaricoque","225 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 huevos grandes, batidos","100 g de almendras molidas","2 cucharadas de leche","500 g de frutos secos variados","100 g de cerezas enteras glaseadas","1 cucharada de leche","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo"]','["Coloque las almendras en un tazón pequeño y viértalas con agua hirviendo hasta cubrirlas. Dejar reposar 5 minutos, luego escurrir en un colador y dejar secar.","Precalienta el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 5. Forra un molde para pastel hondo de 20 cm de base suelta con papel para hornear.","Pon la mantequilla en un bol grande y bate bien hasta que esté suave. Agrega el azúcar y bate hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Agrega la ralladura de naranja y la mermelada de albaricoque.","Tamizar la harina y la levadura en polvo. Agrega los huevos a la crema de mantequilla y el azúcar, poco a poco, batiendo bien entre cada adición. Si la mezcla comienza a cuajar, agregue un poco de harina.","Agrega la harina restante y las almendras molidas y mezcla bien. Mezcle la leche y luego agregue los frutos secos y las cerezas y mezcle suavemente.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y extiéndala nivelada con el dorso de una cuchara. Coloque las almendras enteras juntas formando círculos prolijos en la parte superior del pastel. Hornear en el horno durante 45 min.","Baje la temperatura del horno a 160 C/130 C ventilador/gas 2 y cocine durante 60 a 80 minutos más. Revisa el bizcocho después de 50 minutos insertando un pincho de madera o metal en el bizcocho. Cuando esté listo, debería tener solo unas pocas migas adheridas. Verifique cada 10 minutos; es importante no cocinar demasiado este pastel para que el centro quede un poco blando.","Cuando esté cocido, retiramos brevemente el bizcocho del horno, ponemos la leche y el azúcar en una cacerola pequeña y calentamos a fuego lento hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Cepille la parte superior del pastel y regréselo al horno durante 2-3 minutos. Retirar y dejar enfriar el bizcocho en el molde. Cuando esté bastante frío, desmoldar y envolver en papel de aluminio y conservar al menos 2 días antes de cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:57:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13324,9230,'es','Pastel de frutas rico en jengibre','Este pastel tradicional ha sido adornado con mucho jengibre; nunca sabrías que no contiene gluten ni lácteos. Perfecto para bodas y Navidad.','["aceite, para engrasar","100 g de grosellas secas, pasas y pasas","225 g de higos y ciruelas pasas semisecas, picados en trozos grandes","Tarrina de 200g de jengibre cristalizado","100 g de jengibre de tallo, de un frasco, picado","2 cucharadas de jarabe de jengibre de tallo","4 cucharadas de Cointreau","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido y especias mixtas","ralladura de 2 limones","150 ml de aceite de oliva","175 g de azúcar mascabado light","4 huevos","225 g de harina sin gluten","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten","4 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque","1 cucharada de Cointreau","450 g de frutas variadas, incluidos higos, ciruelas pasas, dátiles y albaricoques"]','["Caliente el horno a 140 ° C / ventilador 120 ° C / gas 1. Engrase ligeramente un molde para pastel redondo de 25 cm y 71?2 cm de profundidad y cúbralo con una doble capa de papel para hornear.","Mezclar los frutos secos, el jengibre y el almíbar, el Cointreau, las especias y la ralladura de limón. Ponga el aceite de oliva, el azúcar y los huevos en un bol, mezcle hasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Tamice la harina y el polvo para hornear en la mezcla y agregue la fruta. Doblar y mezclar bien.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde para pastel. Hornee en el centro del horno durante 2-21?2 horas, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Cubra con papel de aluminio si el pastel comienza a dorarse demasiado. Sacar del horno y dejar enfriar en el molde. Retirar dejando el papel de hornear en su lugar hasta decorar.","Para la cobertura: calentar la mermelada y el Cointreau juntos hasta que la mermelada esté líquida, dejar enfriar. Acomoda la fruta sobre el bizcocho y unta con la mermelada."]','2026-01-11 12:57:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13325,9231,'es','Pastel de frutas con glaseado de mantequilla de albaricoque','Este delicioso bizcocho de frutas ligero está repleto de productos básicos de alacena, como nueces y frutos secos, y también es económico.','["200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","100 g de almendras enteras","200 g de harina común","200 g de azúcar glas","4 huevos medianos","700 g de frutos secos variados","25ml de brandy","150 g de mantequilla blanda","150 g de mermelada de albaricoque","275 g de azúcar glas tamizada"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase un molde redondo de 20 cm de profundidad con\r\nun poco de mantequilla, luego cubrir con\r\npapel vegetal o papel para hornear.\r\nEnvuelve un par de hojas de periódico\r\nalrededor del exterior de la lata, luego\r\nasegúrelo con una cuerda.","En un procesador de alimentos, licúa las almendras.\r\ncon la harina hasta que la mezcla parezca\r\nmigajas. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar glas.\r\nhasta que esté suave y esponjoso. Batir los huevos\r\nuno por uno, luego incorporar la harina y\r\nalmendras, frutos secos y brandy. raspar\r\nen el molde, nivelar la superficie y hornear\r\ndurante 1 hora y 15 minutos, hasta que se introduzca una brocheta\r\nsale limpio. Dejar enfriar en la lata.","Cuando el bizcocho esté completamente frío,\r\nhacer el glaseado rápidamente batiendo el\r\nmantequilla, mermelada y azúcar glas hasta que palidezca.\r\nNo dejes que la mantequilla se caliente demasiado.\r\no batir demasiado ya que el glaseado podría romperse.\r\nRemueve todo el pastel y luego déjalo ahí.\r\nun lugar fresco para colocar (pero no el refrigerador)."]','2026-01-11 12:57:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13326,9232,'es','Pastel de frutas con ponche caliente','Esta fabulosa tarta navideña se puede elaborar y decorar de cuatro formas muy diferentes. Sólo elige tu favorito','["200 ml de té negro fuerte y caliente (use cualquier tipo)","3 cucharadas de whisky","3 cucharadas de mermelada de naranja de buena calidad, fina o mediana rallada","700 g de frutos secos variados","100 g de piel mixta","100 g de cerezas glaseadas (color natural)","225 g de mantequilla","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos batidos","225 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas molidas","1 cucharadita de canela molida","ralladura fina de 1 limón","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","50 ml de té negro caliente","1 cucharada de whisky (o usa jugo de naranja si lo prefieres)"]','["Mezclar el té caliente, el whisky y la mermelada.\r\nen un bol grande hasta que la mermelada se derrita.\r\nAgregue todos los frutos secos, la cáscara y las cerezas.\r\nluego tapar y dejar en remojo durante la noche.","Al día siguiente, calentar el horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3\r\ny engrasar y hacer doble línea en un círculo de 20 cm,\r\nmolde para pasteles hondo con papel de horno antiadherente.\r\nCon unas batidoras eléctricas, bata las\r\nmantequilla y azúcar hasta que quede esponjoso. Agrega los huevos\r\npoco a poco, batiendo bien después de cada\r\nAdemás, luego agregue la harina y las especias,\r\nseguido de la ralladura de limón y la fruta remojada.\r\nAgregue cualquier líquido que no haya sido absorbido por\r\nla fruta también. Vierta en la lata preparada,\r\nnivele la parte superior, luego hornee por 1½ horas. Gire el\r\nhorno a 140C/ventilador 120C/gas 1 y\r\nhornee por 1½ horas más o hasta que una brocheta\r\ninsertado en el centro del pastel viene\r\nsalir limpio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla en el molde.","Mientras el bizcocho aún esté caliente, utiliza la brocheta.\r\nsalpimentar el bizcocho con agujeros, pinchándolo todo\r\nel camino hacia abajo. Disuelva el azúcar en el té,\r\nagregue el whisky o el jugo de naranja, luego vierta\r\nsobre la superficie. Si estás haciendo el pastel\r\ncon anticipación, aliméntelo con un trago fresco de\r\nponte ponche todas las semanas, pero ten cuidado de no empapar el pastel. Se puede conservar durante un mes. \r\nbien envuelto en un recipiente hermético en un\r\nlugar fresco y seco. Si hay poco tiempo, el pastel puede\r\nSe hará el mismo día que lo decores."]','2026-01-11 12:57:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13327,8515,'es','Pastel de frutas clásico de invierno','Este glaseado festivo es fácil de usar, tiene un aspecto fantástico y aporta un final más ligero a una comida. El centro de mesa perfecto para el té navideño','["1 clara de huevo","50 g de azúcar en polvo","racimo pequeño de uvas negras","hojas de acebo o laurel","Pastel de frutas redondo de 20 cm/8 pulgadas","1-2 clementines","1-2 higos recién maduros","unos cuantos kumquats","unos cuantos physalis (grosellas de Cabo)","Cinta roja u dorada de aproximadamente 65 cm.","2 claras de huevo","175 g de azúcar glas"]','["Batir ligeramente la clara de huevo en un bol poco profundo y esparcir el azúcar en polvo en una bandeja o bandeja para horno. Mojar las uvas y\r\nLas hojas de acebo o laurel en la clara de huevo o utilizar un pincel. Sacuda el exceso y luego cúbralo con el azúcar. Deje secar durante al menos 10 minutos, idealmente unos 30 minutos.","Cuando estés listo para decorar, haz el glaseado. Coloque un recipiente grande sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el fondo del recipiente no toque el agua. Pon las claras y el azúcar glas en el bol y bate durante 5-7 minutos hasta obtener un glaseado espeso y muy brillante. Use una espátula para limpiar los bordes del tazón de vez en cuando mientras bate. Coloque el glaseado sobre la parte superior del pastel y extiéndalo con un cuchillo de borde plano, girándolo a medida que avanza para crear un efecto nevado (consulte Knowhow, a continuación).","Corta por la mitad las clementinas, los higos y los kumquats, luego colócalos encima del pastel glaseado con el physalis, las uvas glaseadas y las hojas. Coloca una cinta alrededor de la base y deja el pastel en un lugar fresco, pero no en el refrigerador, hasta que lleguen tus invitados."]','2026-01-11 12:57:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13328,9234,'es','Pastel festivo de frutas y nueces','Este pastel navideño increíblemente húmedo y con sabor a nuez se hornea con almíbar y cobertura de nueces, un poco como una galleta florentina.','["250 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","140 g de azúcar mascabado light","6 huevos grandes, batidos","280 g de harina común","85 g de almendras molidas","2 cucharaditas de jengibre molido","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","700 g de frutas variadas (incluidas pasas, grosellas, pasas, cerezas mixtas y glaseadas)","3 cucharadas de ron oscuro","140 g de mazapán blanco cortado en cubitos","50 g de avellanas enteras sin piel y almendras blanqueadas","85 g de nueces de Brasil y almendras en copos","140 g de cerezas enteras glaseadas","100 g de almíbar dorado","1 metro de cinta ancha"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/gas\r\n4/ventilador 160C y engrasar ligeramente\r\ny forrar la base y los lados de un\r\nprofundo 22-23 cm redondo de base suelta\r\nmolde para pastel con Bake-o-Glide o\r\npapel para hornear (ver al dorso).\r\nBatir la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, la harina,\r\nalmendras molidas y especias hasta\r\nbien mezclado y cremoso,\r\npreferiblemente con batidora eléctrica\r\no en una batidora de alimentos.","Mida 100 g/4 oz de\r\nmezcla de pastel, poner en un bol y\r\ndejar de lado. Doblar la fruta y el ron.\r\nen la mezcla restante, luego\r\nagregue suavemente el mazapán. Cuchara\r\nesta mezcla en el preparado\r\nmolde para bizcocho y aplanar con una espátula\r\npara hacer una superficie lisa y uniforme,\r\nluego haga una ligera inmersión en el centro\r\ndel pastel. Este sencillo truco\r\ndale al pastel terminado un bonito plano\r\narriba. Hornee durante 11?4 horas.","Mientras el bizcocho está en el horno,\r\nprepara la cobertura de frutas y nueces. Mezclar\r\ntodas las nueces, cerezas y almíbar en\r\nel resto de la mezcla del pastel (ver consejo\r\nal dorso). Vierta la mezcla encima\r\ndel bizcocho medio cocido (una vez que\r\nha tenido sus 11?4 horas), uniformemente\r\ndistribuyendo la mezcla de nueces y\r\ncerezas a lo largo de la superficie del\r\npastel. Cubra sin apretar la parte superior del\r\nestaño con papel de aluminio.","Regresar al horno por 40 minutos.\r\nmás, luego retire el papel de aluminio y\r\nhornee por otros 10-15 minutos,\r\npara que las nueces se doren. mantener\r\nun ojo sobre ellos, para que no se\r\ndemasiado oscuro. Para comprobar que la mezcla del pastel está cocida, inserte una brocheta fina en\r\nel bizcocho – si sale limpio\r\nentonces está listo. Luego dejar enfriar en la lata.\r\ndesmoldar, dejando el forro puesto y\r\nenvolver con papel de aluminio. (El pastel\r\nconservar hasta por 2 semanas o puede ser\r\ncongelado por hasta 2 meses.)","Para servir, retire el pastel de\r\nel papel de aluminio y quitar el forro.\r\nColóquelo en una tabla o plato para servir.\r\ny atar con una cinta decorativa."]','2026-01-11 12:57:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13329,9235,'es','Pastel de frutas crujiente de azúcar','La fruta húmeda y una cobertura azucarada y crujiente hacen que sea imposible comer solo una rebanada de este delicioso pastel.','["100 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","2 huevos","85 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","ralladura de ½ limón","2 porciones de compota de manzana, pera y cereza (ver ''Combina bien'')","2 cucharadas de azúcar demerara"]','["Primero haga la compota de manzana, pera y cereza (ver ''Combina bien''). Necesitarás 2 de las 12 porciones de compota para este bizcocho.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y\r\nEngrasar un molde para bizcocho de 20 cm. batir juntos\r\nla mantequilla, los huevos, el azúcar en polvo, la harina,\r\nalmendras y ralladura de limón hasta que quede suave\r\nmezcla. Vierta en la lata y vierta\r\nla compota, luego hornear durante 25-30 minutos\r\nhasta que haya subido bien. Esparcir sobre el azúcar\r\ny regresar al horno por 10-15 minutos.\r\nhasta que el pastel esté bien cocido.","Quitar\r\nde lata y comer caliente o a temperatura ambiente\r\ntemperatura con nata o natillas."]','2026-01-11 12:57:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13330,9236,'es','Pastel de frutas de albaricoque y almendras','Este horneado es más liviano que el rico pastel de frutas tradicional y es un lienzo en blanco para congelar y decorar como desees.','["140 g de pasas doradas","4 cucharadas de jerez","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","250 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes, batidos","200 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de almendras molidas","50 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","140 g de orejones picados","140 g de piel mixta","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja"]','["Mezclar las pasas y el jerez y dejar reposar durante 1 hora en remojo.","Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Engrase un molde para pasteles profundo y de fondo suelto de 23 cm y cubra la base y los lados con una doble capa de papel para hornear que quede aproximadamente 2,5 cm por encima de los lados del molde. En su tazón más grande, bata la mantequilla, el azúcar y la vainilla hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Batir los huevos uno a uno.","Agregue la harina, el polvo para hornear y las almendras molidas y en copos. A continuación, agregue las pasas remojadas con el jerez restante, los orejones, la piel mezclada y toda la ralladura y el jugo. Vierta en el molde para pastel, alisando la superficie.","Hornee en el estante medio del horno durante 1 hora y 25 minutos. Pinche con una brocheta en el centro para verificar que esté cocido; si la brocheta sale con alguna mezcla cruda pegada, hornee por 10 minutos más antes de verificar nuevamente. Dejar enfriar en la lata. Decorado o envuelto en papel vegetal y papel de aluminio, el pastel se conservará hasta por un mes."]','2026-01-11 12:57:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13331,9237,'es','pastel de frutas de chocolate','Si a alguien de tu familia no le gusta el pastel de frutas tradicional, este podría ser el compromiso que estaba buscando.','["200 g de mantequilla","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de chocolate negro (nosotros usamos 80%) partido en trozos","75ml de brandy","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de pasas","250 g de grosellas","100 g de arándanos secos","100 g de guindas secas","100 g de piel mixta","200 g de harina con levadura","100 g de almendras molidas","3 cucharadas de cacao","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","3 huevos batidos con un tenedor"]','["Poner la mantequilla, el azúcar, el chocolate, el brandy,\r\nvainilla y frutos secos en una cacerola grande\r\ncacerola. Calentar suavemente, revolviendo ocasionalmente.\r\nhasta que todo se haya derretido.\r\nRetirar del fuego.","Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2.\r\nForre un molde para pasteles hondo, redondo de 20 cm o\r\nCuadrado de 18cm, con doble capa de\r\npergamino para hornear. Envolver algunas capas\r\nde periódico alrededor del exterior y\r\nasegúrelo con una cuerda.","Mezclar la harina, las almendras, el cacao y las especias.\r\njuntos. Agrega los huevos ligeramente\r\nmezcla de chocolate enfriada en la cacerola,\r\nseguido de la mezcla de harina. raspar en\r\nsu molde preparado y hornee por 1½ hrs.\r\n1 hora 45 minutos o hasta que se introduzca una brocheta\r\nsale limpio. Dejar enfriar en la lata y luego\r\ndecorar (consulte ''Combina bien con'', a la derecha, para obtener ideas de decoración). El pastel envuelto en grasa\r\nconservar durante 2 meses en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:57:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13332,9238,'es','Tarta de frutas con avellanas','Disfruta de este bizcocho de “glut and nut”, elaborado con el exceso de calabacines y manzanas, con una taza de té','["225 g de mantequilla blanda sin sal, más un poco más para la lata","Bolsa de 100 g de avellanas blanqueadas, la mitad picadas muy toscamente","225 g de azúcar mascabado light","225 g de harina con levadura","3 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharaditas de mezcla de especias o canela molida","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","175 g de calabacines rallados gruesos","1 manzana para comer, rallada (aproximadamente 85 g/3 oz de pulpa)","250 g de frutos secos variados"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nUnte con mantequilla un molde para pastel redondo y hondo de 20 cm.\r\ny forrar la base y los lados con bicarbonato\r\npergamino. Poner las avellanas enteras, además\r\n1 cucharada de azúcar y harina, en\r\nun procesador de alimentos y bata hasta que\r\nlas avellanas son lo mejor que puedes conseguir.","Agrega la mantequilla, el azúcar restante y\r\nhuevos al procesador, luego vierta los\r\nvainilla, especias, ¼ de cucharadita de sal, harina restante\r\ny polvo para hornear. Batir hasta que quede suave.\r\nRetire la cuchilla y luego agregue el rallado.\r\ncalabacines, manzana y frutos secos.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde, suave\r\nla parte superior, luego espolvorear con lo picado\r\navellanas, presionándolas en la masa\r\nun poco. Hornee durante 1 hora y 10 minutos (consulte el consejo,\r\nabajo), cubriendo la parte superior sin apretar con papel de aluminio\r\ndespués de 45 minutos, hasta que el bizcocho suba y\r\ndorado. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 20 minutos y luego\r\nRetirar y enfriar sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 12:57:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13333,9239,'es','Pastel de manzana fácil','Este pastel tiene todos los sabores de la Navidad, pero no te llevará mucho tiempo prepararlo; puedes decorarlo como quieras. Ideal también para un pastel de bodas.','["200 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","200 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","3 huevos batidos","1 cucharada de melaza negra","200 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 manzanas para comer, ralladas (aproximadamente 100 g cada una)","300 g de pasas y pasas mixtas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar el fondo de un molde para pasteles redondo y profundo de 20 cm con papel vegetal. Batir los primeros siete ingredientes en un tazón grande (manual eléctrico).\r\n(los batidores son mejores para esto), hasta que estén pálidos y espesos. Con una cuchara grande de metal, incorpore suavemente la fruta hasta que esté uniformemente combinada.","Vierta la masa en el molde y hornee durante 50 minutos a 1 hora o hasta que el pastel esté dorado oscuro, elástico al tacto y se haya encogido ligeramente del molde. Al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste saldrá limpio cuando esté listo. Deje enfriar completamente antes de decorar. Se conservará, envuelto en un recipiente hermético o helado, hasta por una semana, o se puede congelar sin hielo hasta por un mes; descongélelo completamente antes de decorarlo."]','2026-01-11 12:57:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13334,9240,'es','Pequeños pasteles navideños helados','Estos deliciosos mini pasteles de frutas son el regalo perfecto para amigos y vecinos.','["mantequilla, para engrasar","1 cantidad de pastel de manzana fácil, crudo (ver enlace a continuación)","2 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque","Paquete de 500g de mazapán natural","Paquete de 500 g de glaseado blanco listo para enrollar","16 arándanos frescos","manojo de romero, partido en hojas pequeñas","50 g de azúcar en polvo","1 clara de huevo","50 g de azúcar glas","Cinta dorada de aproximadamente 1 m."]','["Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Unte con mantequilla ocho moldes de 150 ml y cubra los fondos con círculos de papel de hornear antiadherente. Divida la mezcla para pastel entre los moldes, transfiérala a una bandeja para hornear y deslícela en el horno. Hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que esté elástico y dorado oscuro. Déjelo hasta que se enfríe lo suficiente como para manipularlo, luego pase un cuchillo de punta redonda por el borde de cada pastel. Desmoldar y dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla.","Si los pasteles han formado picos, aplanelos cortando la parte superior con un cuchillo de sierra. Derrita la mermelada con 1 cucharada de agua y unte la parte superior de los pasteles. Amasar ligeramente el mazapán y darle forma a ocho bolitas del tamaño de una pelota de golf. (Te sobrará un poco; envuélvelo bien para otro momento). Con un rodillo, enrolla suavemente las bolas hasta formar círculos planos, de aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor y del mismo diámetro que los pasteles. Coloca el mazapán en el lado confitado de los pasteles. Haz lo mismo con el glaseado, untando el mazapán con un poco de agua hervida fría para que se pegue.","Batir la clara de huevo hasta que esté espumosa y desmenuzada. Extiende el azúcar en polvo sobre un plato. Sumerge los arándanos y el romero en la clara de huevo, sacude el exceso y reboza en el azúcar en polvo para crear un efecto escarchado. Dejar secar durante 15 minutos. Retire todo menos 2 cucharaditas de clara de huevo y mezcle con el azúcar glas para crear una pasta espesa. Úselo para fijar dos arándanos y una ramita de romero en la parte superior de cada pastel. Decorar con cinta dorada. Los pasteles se conservarán en un recipiente hermético hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 12:57:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13335,9241,'es','Pastel al revés de naranja sanguina','Aprovecha al máximo el sabor y el hermoso color de las naranjas sanguinas en este impresionante pastel al revés. Es un pastel perfecto para disfrutar con una taza de té.','["2 naranjas sanguinas, ralladas","200 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para la lata","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","4 huevos","125 g de harina común","75 g de polenta o harina de maíz","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","100 gramos de yogur natural","2-3 cucharadas de leche (opcional)"]','["Retire con cuidado la médula de las naranjas ralladas, teniendo cuidado de mantenerlas enteras. Cortar en rodajas finas, quitando y desechando las pepitas. Dejar de lado.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base de un molde para pastel de fondo suelto de 23 cm con papel para hornear. Coloque el molde en una bandeja para hornear, luego coloque las rodajas de naranja en la base, superponiéndolas ligeramente para cubrir la mayor cantidad posible.","Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y la ralladura hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Incorpora los huevos, uno a la vez, añadiendo un par de cucharadas de harina entre cada adición para evitar que la mezcla se cuaje. Incorpora el resto de la harina, la polenta y el polvo para hornear seguido del yogur. Si la mezcla parece un poco seca, agregue 2-3 cucharadas de leche. Hornear durante 35-40 minutos hasta que al pinchar con una brocheta este salga limpio. Sirva en rodajas. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:57:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13336,3805,'es','Bollos crumble de fresa','Celebre la temporada de fresas con estos deliciosos panecillos crumble. Estos llamativos postres son perfectos para el verano y son un dulce impresionante.','["120 g de mantequilla, 70 g a temperatura ambiente y 50 g fría y en cubos","370 g de harina común","2 huevos","135 g de azúcar en polvo","7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","100 ml de leche, tibia","250 g de fresas partidas por la mitad"]','["Derretir los 70 g de mantequilla y dejar enfriar. Tamizar 300 g de harina en un bol, añadir los huevos, 75 g de azúcar y la levadura y mezclar todo con una cuchara. Agregue lentamente la leche tibia y la mantequilla enfriada. Mezclar hasta que todos los ingredientes estén bien combinados formando una masa muy suave y pegajosa. Cubra el recipiente con un paño limpio y colóquelo en un lugar cálido para que suba durante 40 a 60 minutos hasta que duplique su volumen.","Para hacer el crumble, combine la harina restante con el azúcar restante y la mantequilla fría. Frote la mantequilla con la harina hasta obtener una textura similar a la del pan rallado. Enfriar.","Cuando la masa haya subido, divídela en seis porciones, aplastándolas ligeramente y luego dale forma de bola a cada una sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada; la masa aún puede estar pegajosa, así que espolvoréala con harina y trabaja rápidamente. Aplana las bolas suavemente con la mano para que parezcan bollos. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear.","Divide las fresas entre los bollos, colocándolas en el centro de cada uno y espolvorea con crumble. Calienta el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Hornea los bollos durante 25 minutos hasta que estén inflados y cocidos. Deje enfriar y luego espolvoree con azúcar glas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:57:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13337,9242,'es','Bagatela real de verano','Sorprenda a la multitud con esta bagatela afrutada. Sirve para 10 personas, lo que lo hace ideal como postre para compartir en una fiesta al aire libre con motivo del Jubileo de Platino de la Reina.','["500 ml de natillas de vainilla frescas compradas en la tienda","400 g de bizcocho de madeira, cortado en trozos","70 ml de cordial de frutos rojos de tu elección","150 g de frambuesas","300ml de nata doble","3 cucharadas de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","250 g de fresas","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta, para decorar","1 naranja, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","6 hojas de gelatina","100 g de azúcar en polvo","1 limón, ralladura cortada en tiras, exprimida","500 g de fresas peladas","una gota de colorante rojo (opcional)","600ml de nata doble","200 ml de azúcar en polvo","2 naranjas, ralladas y en jugo"]','["Primero, haz la gelatina. Poner la gelatina en un bol pequeño, cubrir con agua y dejar en remojo. Mientras tanto, vierta el azúcar, la ralladura y el jugo de limón y 400 ml de agua en una cacerola a fuego lento y cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Agregue las fresas y deje hervir, luego reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que las fresas se deshagan. Vierta la mezcla a través de un colador en una jarra. Exprima el exceso de agua de la gelatina y revuelva con la mezcla de fresas hasta que se disuelva, luego agregue una gota de colorante rojo, si lo usa.","Vierta la crema pastelera en la base de un bol de 3 litros y cubra con los trozos de bizcocho. Rocíe con el cordial de frutos rojos y espolvoree con las frambuesas. Vierta lenta y cuidadosamente sobre la mezcla de gelatina y enfríe durante 5 horas hasta que cuaje.","Cuando la capa de gelatina esté cuajada, haz la capa de crema de naranja. Poner la nata, el azúcar y la ralladura de naranja en una cacerola a fuego lento y llevar a fuego lento. Sube el fuego a medio y burbujea durante 3 minutos exactamente, luego retira inmediatamente del fuego y agrega el jugo de naranja. Vierta la mezcla a través de un colador sobre la capa de gelatina fraguada y enfríe durante 4 horas.","Batir la nata doble, el azúcar glas y la pasta de vainilla hasta obtener picos suaves con una batidora eléctrica, luego verter la nata montada sobre la bagatela con una cuchara grande. Enfríe durante al menos 1 hora o hasta que esté listo para servir. Corta la mayoría de las fresas por la mitad a través del tallo y espárcelas sobre la bagatela junto con las hojas de menta. Sirva las rodajas de naranja y las fresas enteras restantes en un bol a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:57:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13338,9243,'es','Tarta de mermelada de grosella, moscatel y mascarpone','Impresione a sus invitados con este impresionante pastel de moscatel y mascarpone, elaborado con un lujoso centro de mermelada de grosella. Este postre para adultos es perfecto para el té de la tarde.','["215 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para las latas","285 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de almendras","½ limón, rallado","250 g de harina con levadura","150 g de almendras molidas","165 g de yogur natural","3 huevos medianos, a temperatura ambiente, ligeramente batidos","200 g de mascarpone","150ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de vino de postre moscatel","2-3 cucharadas de azúcar glas, al gusto, más un poco más para servir","250 g de mermelada de grosella","flores comestibles o almendras en hojuelas ligeramente tostadas, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y untar con mantequilla dos moldes para pasteles de 23 cm, luego forrar con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos con una batidora eléctrica, luego incorporar el extracto de almendras y la ralladura de limón. Mezclar la harina, las almendras y una pizca de sal en otro bol. Con la batidora a velocidad baja, agrega poco a poco el yogurt y los huevos al bol con la mezcla de mantequilla y azúcar, alternando con cucharadas de la mezcla de harina y almendras hasta que todo esté completamente combinado.","Vierta la masa en los moldes preparados, dividiéndola uniformemente. Hornear durante 30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio salga limpia. Deje enfriar los bizcochos en el molde durante 5 minutos, luego desmoldelos sobre una rejilla, retire el pergamino y déjelos enfriar por completo.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Batir el mascarpone, la nata, el vino y el azúcar glas con una batidora eléctrica durante 2-3 minutos hasta obtener picos suaves.","Coloque uno de los pasteles enfriados en un plato para servir. Extienda con cuidado sobre la mermelada (es fácil romper el bizcocho, así que tenga cuidado), luego extienda suavemente la crema de mascarpone sobre la mermelada. Pon el segundo bizcocho encima. Tamizamos un poco de azúcar glas y decoramos con flores comestibles, si queremos. Las flores blancas o crema quedan preciosas, pero si no las encuentras, opta por un solo color. Alternativamente, espolvoree algunas almendras en hojuelas ligeramente tostadas antes de tamizar el azúcar glas extra."]','2026-01-11 12:57:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13339,9244,'es','Esponja Victoria de albaricoque de verano','Pruebe una nueva versión del clásico bizcocho Victoria con una capa de compota de albaricoque y tomillo limón. Intercalado con crema batida de vainilla, es deliciosamente delicioso.','["225 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para las latas","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","225 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","2 cucharadas de leche","200 g de conserva de albaricoque","3-4 mitades de albaricoque enlatadas, escurridas y picadas","6 ramitas de limón o tomillo normal, las hojas recogidas de 1 y el resto entero","300ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 vaina de vainilla, partida y con las semillas raspadas, o 1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base y los lados de dos moldes para sándwich de 20 cm.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica durante 8 a 10 minutos, o hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Tamice la harina, el polvo para hornear y la sal e incorpore con una cuchara de metal grande. Agregue suficiente leche para crear una consistencia que gotee.","Divida la masa entre los moldes preparados y alise la parte superior con una espátula. Hornee en el estante medio del horno durante 25 a 30 minutos, o hasta que estén dorados y firmes al tacto. Deje enfriar un poco en las latas, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Vierta la conserva en una cacerola pequeña y agregue los albaricoques y las ramitas enteras de tomillo. Caliente a fuego lento durante 2 minutos hasta que se suelte, luego transfiéralo a un recipiente resistente al calor y déjelo enfriar e infundir durante 1-2 horas.","Batir la nata con el azúcar glas y la vainilla hasta que la mezcla mantenga su forma (tenga cuidado de no batir demasiado; consulte el consejo a continuación).","Retire y deseche todo el tomillo de la mezcla de conservas y agregue las hojas de tomillo. Extienda la mezcla sobre uno de los bizcochos, luego cubra con la crema batida de vainilla y emparéjelo con el bizcocho restante. Espolvorea el bizcocho con un poco de azúcar glas. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:57:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13340,9245,'es','Bizcocho de naranja sanguina y aceite de oliva','Usando un molde, le da un efecto sorprendente a este sabroso pastel con un ligero bizcocho de aceite de oliva y un exquisito glaseado de chocolate blanco y naranja sanguina.','["spray antiadherente para pasteles (disponible en Lakeland y amazon.co.uk) o mantequilla derretida, para engrasar","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","5 huevos grandes","ralladura y zumo de 3 naranjas sanguinas (unos 150 ml de zumo)","150 g de aceite de oliva ligero","280 g de harina con levadura","140 g de chocolate blanco, picado en trozos grandes","ralladura de 1 naranja sanguina, más el jugo de 1 ½ (aproximadamente 75 ml de jugo)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrasar un molde de 2,5 litros con spray antiadherente o mantequilla.","Ponga el azúcar, los huevos y la ralladura en un tazón grande y bata con un batidor de mano eléctrico durante unos 10 minutos hasta que esté espeso y pálido. Con la batidora a velocidad media-baja, vierte el jugo y el aceite, mezclando hasta que estén completamente combinados. Tamiza la harina en el tazón y bate hasta que esté combinada hasta obtener una masa suave. Vierta en el molde preparado, colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear y hornee en el horno durante 35-40 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el pastel, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos antes de desmoldar con cuidado sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer el glaseado, coloque el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Una vez que el chocolate se haya derretido, vierte el jugo de naranja sanguina y revuelve para combinar. Retire el recipiente del fuego y déjelo enfriar, luego enfríe hasta que el glaseado esté espeso pero aún se pueda verter. Una vez que el glaseado tenga la consistencia deseada, viértalo sobre el pastel, dejando que gotee por los lados. Espolvorea la ralladura de naranja para terminar. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante 3 a 4 días; Se puede congelar hasta por 3 meses."]','2026-01-11 12:57:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13341,9246,'es','Tarta de manzana con caramelo','Este espectacular horneado es una celebración de los postres clásicos de manzana con bizcocho especiado, glaseado de vainilla y un pegajoso relleno de manzana acaramelada.','["150ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para engrasar","175 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 huevos grandes","250 g de manzanas para comer (peso preparado: unas 3 manzanas), peladas, sin corazón y ralladas gruesas","200 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","25 g de copos de avena","50 g de almendras molidas","100g de pasas","ralladura de 1 limón","jugo 1 limon","4 manzanas para comer (yo usé Pink Lady)","25 g de mantequilla","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharada de almíbar dorado","¼ cucharadita de canela","100 g de azúcar en polvo blanca (opcional, para las pequeñas manzanas acarameladas)","75 g de azúcar moreno blando","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharada de brandy o agua","50 g de mantequilla","100 gramos de chocolate blanco","280 g de queso crema en tarrina","1 vaina de vainilla, solo semillas","170 g de yogur griego en bote","8 brochetas largas de madera (opcional, para las pequeñas manzanas acarameladas)"]','["Empiece por hacer las tartas. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar 2 moldes desmontables de 18 cm con papel para hornear y untar con un poco de aceite. Coloque el azúcar y los huevos en un tazón grande y bata con batidoras eléctricas hasta que estén brillantes y pálidos. Mantenga los batidores funcionando mientras vierte el aceite.","Agregue la manzana rallada y luego agregue todos los demás ingredientes del pastel. Divida la mezcla entre los moldes y hornee por 30 minutos o hasta que al insertar un palillo en el medio salga limpio.","Mientras se cocinan las tartas, prepara el relleno de manzana. Vierta el jugo de limón en\r\nun recipiente grande y llénelo hasta la mitad con agua fría. Pela las manzanas y luego córtalas en esferas con una batidora de melón; mételas en el recipiente con agua con limón a medida que avanzas para evitar que se decoloren. En una cacerola mediana, combine la mantequilla, el azúcar moreno, el almíbar dorado, la canela y 200 ml de agua y caliente hasta que hierva. Saca las bolas de manzana del agua y colócalas en la sartén; si quieres hacer pequeñas manzanas acarameladas para la parte superior, mantén 8 bolas de manzana en el agua hasta que las necesites. Vuelva a hervir la mezcla en la sartén durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que las manzanas estén suaves pero sin perder su forma y comience a formarse un almíbar espeso. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar por completo, luego enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Mezcle todos los ingredientes del almíbar en un bol. Cuando los bizcochos estén cocidos, guárdalos en el molde, pero haz agujeros por toda la superficie con una brocheta y rocía el almíbar por encima. Deje que los bizcochos se enfríen completamente en el molde.","Mientras los pasteles se enfrían, prepara el glaseado. En un recipiente pequeño resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, derrita la mantequilla y el chocolate blanco. Una vez derretido y brillante, vierte en un tazón grande. Agrega el queso crema, bate hasta que quede suave, luego\r\nagrega la vainilla. Finalmente, incorpora el yogur. Cuando la mezcla esté fría,\r\nenfríe hasta que sea necesario.","Para montar el bizcocho, saca los bizcochos enfriados de sus moldes y coloca uno de ellos sobre un soporte para pasteles. Cubra con la mitad del glaseado de chocolate blanco; use una cuchara o póngalo con una boquilla redonda muy grande. Esparza los trozos de manzana cocidos, junto con un chorrito de almíbar, sobre el glaseado, luego colóquelos en el refrigerador para que se endurezcan durante 15 minutos. Agregue la capa superior del pastel, luego decore con el resto del glaseado colocándolo en muchos montículos pequeños y regulares por toda la parte superior con una boquilla redonda grande. Guarda todo el bizcocho en el frigorífico hasta el momento de servir. Se conservará durante 2 días en el frigorífico.","Para un acabado espectacular, pero opcional, haga unas hermosas manzanas acarameladas en miniatura. Su efecto es sorprendente pero fugaz, así que hazlos justo antes de servir el pastel, ya que el caramelo se disolverá rápidamente debido a la humedad del aire. Unte una bandeja para horno con un poco de aceite vegetal y reserve. Seca muy bien las bolitas de manzana reservadas del paso 3 del bizcocho con papel de cocina o un paño de cocina limpio e inserta una brocheta larga de madera en cada una.","Pon el azúcar en polvo en una cacerola pequeña a fuego medio, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que el azúcar se derrita. Sigue cocinando hasta que el azúcar se haya convertido en un caramelo líquido dorado, luego retira del fuego. Si parece que se está calentando demasiado, coloque la base de la sartén en un recipiente resistente al calor con agua fría.","Incline la sartén y, trabajando rápidamente (ya que el azúcar seguirá cocinándose), sujete las bolitas de manzana por la brocheta y sumerja cada una en el caramelo y gírela.\r\nalrededor para cubrirlo. Es muy importante que las bolitas de manzana estén bien secas y que no las voltees en el caramelo caliente más de dos veces, de lo contrario la manzana se cocinará y soltará líquido, lo que evitará que el caramelo se pegue. Tan pronto como estén cubiertos, levántelos lentamente y verticalmente. Sostenga la manzana fuera de la sartén y haga una pausa antes de transferirla a la bandeja engrasada de lado. Sostenerlo así permitirá que una gota larga de caramelo se endurezca y cree una hermosa y larga punta. Repite el proceso con el resto de las manzanas, trabajando rápido para que el caramelo no se endurezca por completo antes de haber cubierto todas las manzanas. Sin embargo, no te preocupes demasiado, siempre puedes recalentarlo suavemente a fuego lento antes de continuar; solo ten cuidado de no quemarlo, de lo contrario tendrá un sabor amargo.","Después de un par de minutos, las manzanas deberían haberse cuajado. Cuando estén lo suficientemente fríos para manipularlos, saca las brochetas. Coloque las manzanas encima del pastel de modo que la punta apunte hacia arriba y la base de la manzana (donde estaba la brocheta) quede presionada contra el glaseado. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:57:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13342,9247,'es','Pastel crumble de ciruelas','Este suntuoso horneado de temporada está cubierto con ciruelas o albaricoques partidos por la mitad y una cobertura crujiente de mantequilla; sírvelo como pudín o pastel.','["175 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos grandes","225 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","100 g de almendras molidas","85 g de crema agria","5-6 ciruelas maduras, partidas por la mitad y sin hueso","50 g de almendras molidas","50 g de harina común","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de mantequilla picada en trozos","crema agria o yogur, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar un molde para pastel redondo de 22 cm de profundidad (preferiblemente con el fondo suelto) con papel para hornear.","Primero haga la cobertura: ponga todos los ingredientes del crumble en un bol y frótelos hasta que se desmorone.","Para el bizcocho, poner en un bol grande la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, la harina, la levadura en polvo, la vainilla, las almendras molidas y la nata agria. Batir con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave, luego verter en el molde y nivelar la parte superior. Coloque las ciruelas, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, sobre la mezcla y luego esparza sobre el crumble.","Hornee durante 50 minutos a 1 hora en un estante intermedio hasta que al insertar una brocheta en la mezcla del pastel, éste salga limpio (sin embargo, las ciruelas permanecerán pegajosas). Deje enfriar en el molde durante 20 minutos y luego termine de enfriar sobre una rejilla. Sirva solo o con crema agria o yogur. Se conserva durante 3-4 días en un molde para pasteles hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:57:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13343,9248,'es','Pastel especiado de higos, café y avellanas','Este sofisticado pastel está ligeramente condimentado y lleno de sabores melosos provenientes de higos secos y azúcar moscabado, y está terminado con un glaseado de queso crema.','["4 higos secos, picados en trozos pequeños","75 ml de café fuerte o espresso caliente","100 g de avellanas blanqueadas","200 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, muy blanda, más un poco para engrasar","225 g de azúcar mascabado light","200 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","50 gramos de yogur natural","4 huevos grandes","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, muy blanda","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla o pasta de frijoles","400 g de azúcar glas","Tarrina de 250 g de queso crema con toda la grasa","6 cucharadas de mermelada o conserva de higos","10-12 higos, partidos por la mitad o en cuartos","200 g de caramelo (Carnation o Bon Maman funcionan bien)"]','["Primero, haz la esponja. Pon los higos secos en un bol y vierte sobre el café. Dejar en remojo durante 30 minutos. Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Coloque las avellanas en una bandeja para hornear y tueste en el horno durante 5-8 minutos hasta que estén doradas y aromáticas. Vierte 75 g de nueces en un procesador de alimentos (reserva el resto para más tarde) y déjalas enfriar durante 10 minutos. Mientras tanto, engrase la base y los lados de un molde para pastel rectangular de 20 x 30 cm con mantequilla y forre con papel de horno.","Batir las nueces enfriadas hasta que estén finamente picadas. Agregue los higos remojados y el café restante y vuelva a batir hasta obtener una pasta. Agrega el resto de los ingredientes del bizcocho al procesador con una buena pizca de sal. Licue hasta que esté bien combinado, raspando los lados una o dos veces y mezclando nuevamente. Vierta en el molde para pastel, nivele la superficie y hornee por 25 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro del pastel, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego voltee sobre una rejilla, retire el pergamino y déjelo enfriar.","Mientras el pastel se enfría, prepara el glaseado. Pon en un bol grande la mantequilla, la vainilla y la mitad del azúcar. Triture con una espátula y luego mezcle con un batidor eléctrico hasta que quede suave. Agrega el queso crema y el resto del azúcar glas, tritura y luego licúa nuevamente hasta que quede suave. Divida el glaseado en 2 tandas, una para capas y una capa de migas, y otra para una capa final. Puedes enfriar el glaseado mientras el pastel se enfría, pero sácalo del refrigerador 15 minutos antes de usarlo para que vuelva a temperatura ambiente.","Ahora monta el pastel. Transfiera el pastel enfriado a una tabla de cortar. Marque el bizcocho a intervalos de 10 cm a lo largo del bizcocho, marcando 3 secciones de 20 x 10 cm cada una. Corta y luego apila los pasteles uno encima del otro para comprobar que sean del mismo tamaño. Recorta los bordes irregulares y luego desapila.","Coloque 1 bizcocho en una tabla o plato para pasteles. Untar con un poco de glaseado y 3 cucharadas de mermelada de higos, manteniendo la mermelada a aproximadamente 1 cm de los bordes. Cubra con otro bizcocho, más glaseado y mermelada, luego haga un sándwich con el último bizcocho. Use una espátula para cubrir todo el pastel con el primer lote restante de glaseado (la capa de migas); no se preocupe si queda un poco sucio. Asegúrate de llenar los espacios entre las capas con glaseado. Una vez cubierto, déjelo enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos para que el glaseado se endurezca. Enfríe también el glaseado restante, pero sáquelo del refrigerador 10-15 minutos antes del pastel para que esté listo para untar.","Decora el pastel. Sácalo de la nevera y cúbrelo con el glaseado restante. Use una espátula para crear bordes suaves o déjelo bastante áspero, si lo desea. Cubra el bizcocho con los higos, con las puntas puntiagudas hacia arriba. Coloque el caramelo en una manga pastelera pequeña, corte la esquina y rocíelo sobre la parte superior del pastel, alentándolo hacia los lados (o simplemente rocíelo con una cuchara). Pica en trozos grandes las nueces tostadas restantes y espárcelas por encima. Sirva en rodajas con higos adicionales a un lado, si lo desea. Guarde las sobras en el refrigerador durante 3 días, pero déjelas a temperatura ambiente antes de comerlas."]','2026-01-11 12:57:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13344,9249,'es','Tarta de merengue de limón','Lleve el merengue de limón a un nuevo nivel con este bizcocho con infusión de caramelo, relleno de cuajada de limón y cubierto con merengue italiano.','["75 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","225 g de azúcar en polvo","ralladura de 3 limones","100 ml de jugo de limón, tamizado para quitar las semillas y la médula","3 huevos grandes","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","85 g de azúcar en polvo","300 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","200 g de azúcar en polvo","75 g de azúcar mascabado light","300 g de harina con levadura","5 huevos medianos, batidos","25 g de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","ralladura de 4 limones","1 limon","175 g de azúcar en polvo","300 g de azúcar en polvo","6 claras de huevo medianas","½ cucharadita de crémor tártaro"]','["Empiece por hacer la cuajada. Pon todos los ingredientes en una cacerola y bate. Parecerá que se ha cuajado, pero no te preocupes: simplemente pon la sartén a fuego lento y revuelve constantemente hasta que esté lo suficientemente suave y espesa como para cubrir el dorso de una cuchara. Pasar la mezcla por un colador a un bol. Dejar enfriar cubierto con film transparente. Mételo en el frigorífico hasta que esté listo para usar, preferiblemente durante la noche.","Para el almíbar de azúcar caramelizado, calienta el azúcar en polvo en un cazo a fuego medio hasta que se derrita y empiece a caramelizar. Revuelva hasta que quede suave y de un color dorado intenso. Retirar del fuego y verter con cuidado 50 ml de agua hirviendo. Saldrá vapor y escupirá un poco, así que ten cuidado. (Si el azúcar se endurece, vuelva a poner la sartén al fuego durante 1-2 minutos para que se derrita nuevamente). Revuelva, vierta inmediatamente en una jarra resistente al calor y complete con un poco más de agua hirviendo (aproximadamente 10 ml) para tener 100 ml de líquido en total. Dejar enfriar por un lado.","Para hacer el bizcocho, calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar 3 moldes para sándwich de 20 cm, forrar las bases y los lados con papel para hornear.","En un tazón grande, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave y esponjosa. Mezcle 1 cucharada de harina, luego agregue los huevos, poco a poco, batiendo después de cada adición hasta que estén completamente combinados.","Mezcle los ingredientes secos restantes, la ralladura de limón y 1/2 cucharadita de sal, luego incorpore a la mezcla de mantequilla con el almíbar de azúcar y caramelo. Divida la masa entre los moldes y nivele la parte superior con el dorso de una cuchara húmeda. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Deje que los pasteles se enfríen en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego colóquelos sobre una rejilla y retire el pergamino. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Mientras se hornean las tartas, hacemos las rodajas de limón caramelizadas. Cortar el limón en rodajas de 5 mm de grosor, desechando los extremos. En una cacerola antiadherente poco profunda, ponga a hervir 350 ml de agua y el azúcar. Agregue las rodajas de limón, hierva durante 10 minutos, luego reduzca el fuego a fuego lento durante 20-25 minutos hasta que el líquido se haya evaporado y las rodajas se hayan caramelizado. Retirar de la sartén y poner sobre un tapete de silicona antiadherente o papel para hornear para que se enfríe.","Para montar la tarta. Coloca un bizcocho boca arriba sobre una tabla para tartas o plato de presentación. Cubra con una capa uniforme de cuajada pero no llegue hasta el borde, deje aproximadamente 1 cm sin cubrir. Coloque con cuidado el siguiente bizcocho encima y repita el proceso, colocando el último bizcocho boca abajo encima.","Para hacer el merengue italiano, poner el azúcar y 175 ml de agua en una cacerola y llevar a ebullición a fuego alto. Continúe hirviendo hasta que alcance los 115 ° C en un termómetro de azúcar. Mientras tanto, ponga las claras de huevo y el crémor tártaro en un tazón grande (una batidora de mesa es ideal si tiene una). Batir las claras a punto de nieve (al levantar el batidor, los picos deben desaparecer lentamente en la mezcla). Batir las claras a velocidad alta y verter muy lentamente el almíbar caliente. El merengue comenzará a espesarse y ponerse brillante después de unos 10 minutos. Continúe batiendo hasta que todavía esté tibio. Utilice el merengue inmediatamente, ya que es más fácil trabajar con él mientras está caliente.","Con una espátula, extienda una fina capa de merengue alrededor del costado del pastel para nivelarlo y cuadrarlo, luego extienda una capa uniforme de aproximadamente 3 mm de espesor en la parte superior del pastel (consulte el paso a paso para obtener orientación). Coloque el merengue restante en una manga pastelera grande equipada con una boquilla de estrella pequeña y coloque columnas verticales hacia arriba por el costado del pastel, al nivel de la parte superior. Finalmente, coloca pequeñas estrellas de merengue en la parte superior de las columnas. Es más fácil hacer esto con el pastel sobre un plato giratorio.","Dorar el merengue con un soplete de cocina. Por último, corta las rodajas de limón caramelizado por la mitad y úsalas para decorar la parte superior del bizcocho. Se conservará durante 3 días en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 12:57:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13345,9250,'es','Bandeja horneada de guindas y almendras','Este pastel afrutado utiliza arroz molido y extracto de almendras para un horneado más económico, perfecto para una venta de pasteles o como delicia a la hora del té.','["300 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","375 g de harina con levadura, más un poco más para espolvorear","ralladura de 1 limón (guarde el jugo para el glaseado)","85 g de arroz molido o almendras molidas","4 huevos, ligeramente batidos","25 g de mazapán, enfriado hasta que esté firme y luego rallado","2 cucharaditas de extracto de almendras","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 cucharadas de leche entera","200 g de guindas glacé, lavadas, secas y cortadas en cuartos","500 g de azúcar glas para fondant","jugo de 1 limón (del limón de arriba)","50 g de mazapán","Geles colorantes alimentarios rojos y verdes (usamos el Dr. Oetker)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar una bandeja para hornear cuadrada grande, de unos 28 x 28 cm, con papel para hornear. Coloque todos los ingredientes del pastel (aparte de las cerezas) en un tazón grande o en una batidora de mesa y bata hasta que estén bien combinados. Mezcle las cerezas con un poco de harina y luego incorpórelas a la mezcla del pastel con una espátula. Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que el pastel esté dorado, elástico al tacto y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde.","Para hacer el glaseado, tamice el azúcar glas en un bol, luego agregue el jugo de limón y suficiente agua para hacer un glaseado espeso pero bastante fluido. Transfiera 3 cucharadas de glaseado a un tazón pequeño y reserve. Vierta el glaseado restante sobre el pastel enfriado; debe estar lo suficientemente líquido como para nivelarse; si no, utiliza un cuchillo para alisarlo. Amasar el mazapán para suavizarlo y luego incorporar suficiente colorante rojo para que adquiera un color rojo brillante. Forme 48 bolitas de cereza.","Cuando el glaseado esté casi listo, coloque 2 bolas directamente una al lado de la otra sobre el glaseado, en filas de 4, con suficiente espacio entre cada una para cortar 24 trozos iguales. Colorea el glaseado reservado con colorante alimentario verde, luego transfiérelo a una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla muy fina, o simplemente corta el extremo y coloca los tallos de cereza junto a las bolas de mazapán. Cuando todo el glaseado esté completamente cuajado, saca el bizcocho del molde y córtalo en 24 trozos."]','2026-01-11 12:57:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13346,6157,'es','Pastel marroquí de naranja y cardamomo','Reemplace el azúcar con xilitol y cambie la mantequilla y el aceite por un puré de naranja entera en este pastel ligero y picante, con almendras molidas y polenta.','["2 naranjas, lavadas","semillas de 6 vainas de cardamomo verde, trituradas","Paquete de 225 g de xilitol (nosotros usamos Total Sweet)","6 huevos grandes","Paquete de 200 g de almendras molidas","50 g de polenta","25 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharada de almendras laminadas","yogur griego o crema, para servir"]','["Poner las naranjas enteras en una cacerola, cubrir con agua y hervir tapadas durante 1 hora hasta que un cuchillo las traspase fácilmente. Si las naranjas no permanecen bajo el agua, coloca una tapa de cacerola pequeña directamente encima para mantenerlas sumergidas. Retire las naranjas del agua y enfríe, luego córtelas en cuartos y retire las semillas y la médula visible donde estaba el tallo. Triture las naranjas hasta obtener un puré con una batidora de mano o en un procesador de alimentos y colóquelas en un tazón grande.","Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3 y forre la base y los lados de un molde para pasteles de fondo suelto de 21 cm con papel para hornear. Batir el cardamomo, el xilitol y los huevos con el puré de naranja, luego mezclar las almendras molidas con la polenta, la harina y el polvo para hornear e incorporar hasta que estén bien mezclados. Vierta la mezcla en el molde, nivele la parte superior y hornee por 40 minutos.","Después de 40 minutos, esparce las almendras, regresa rápidamente al horno y hornea 20-25 minutos más hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Retirar del molde y dejar enfriar. Sirva en rodajas como pastel o con yogur griego o crema como postre."]','2026-01-11 12:57:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13347,9251,'es','Torta de capa de pasión','Prepárate para una cena o celebración con este delicioso pastel afrutado que se puede congelar hasta por 2 meses.','["225 g de mantequilla blanda, en cubos, más un poco más para engrasar","225 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos grandes","225 g de harina con levadura","50 g de coco rallado","ralladura fina 1 naranja","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","5 maracuyás grandes","225 g de mantequilla blanda, en cubitos","375 g de azúcar glas tamizada","280 g de queso crema entero","75 gramos de chocolate blanco"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Engrasar 2\r\nx moldes para sándwiches de base suelta de 20 cm y línea\r\nlas bases con discos de papel vegetal.\r\nPoner la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, la harina, el coco,\r\nralladura de naranja y levadura en polvo en un alimento\r\nprocesador o batidora de alimentos y licuar o batir\r\nhasta que esté bien combinado, espeso y cremoso. no\r\nlicuar demasiado o el pastel quedará duro\r\nque la luz. Si no tienes batidora, pon\r\ntodos los ingredientes en un bol y batir fuerte\r\ncon una cuchara de madera hasta que esté suave y cremoso.","Vierta la mezcla uniformemente en el\r\nlos moldes preparados y alisar la superficie. hornear\r\nen el mismo estante en el centro del horno\r\ndurante 25 minutos o hasta que haya subido bien y apenas\r\ncomenzando a alejarse de los lados de\r\nla lata. Sacar los moldes del horno y\r\ndejar enfriar durante 5 minutos antes de ejecutar un\r\ncuchillo alrededor del borde de los pasteles y\r\nvolcar sobre una rejilla. Despegue el\r\npergamino y dejar enfriar por completo.","Cuando las tartas estén completamente frías, muy\r\ncorte con cuidado horizontalmente a través de cada uno\r\ncon un cuchillo de sierra para hacer 4 finas\r\nesponjas. Para hacer el glaseado, corta el\r\nmaracuyás por la mitad y colóquelos en un colador.\r\nPasar por el colador para colar el jugo.\r\n– deberías tener 4 cucharadas. Reservar y\r\nreserva las semillas. Poner la mantequilla, el azúcar glas.\r\ny queso en un procesador de alimentos o batidora y\r\nlicua hasta que quede suave. No sobrepases o lo hará\r\nvolverse líquido. Agrega lentamente la maracuyá.\r\njugo y licue hasta que esté combinado.","Coloque uno de los bizcochos, con el lado cortado hacia abajo,\r\nsobre la base metálica del molde para sándwiches y\r\nponer en un bol volteado sobre una bandeja. esto será\r\nayuda a que sea más fácil glasear el pastel. difundir\r\ncon aproximadamente una quinta parte del glaseado, solo\r\nsuficiente para cubrir la esponja. Usa un remo\r\nmovimiento con una espátula o una espátula suave para\r\nel mejor resultado, intentando mantener el contacto con\r\nel bizcocho para evitar que se levante el bizcocho.","Cubrir con un segundo bizcocho, untar con\r\nglaseado y repetir las capas una vez más,\r\nterminando con el último bizcocho, con el lado cortado hacia abajo.\r\nEn esta etapa, deberías haber colocado 4 capas.\r\ntortas con glaseado de maracuyá entre\r\n3 de ellos. Utilice el glaseado restante para\r\nesparcir sobre la parte superior y los lados de los pasteles\r\npara cubrir completamente. No te preocupes si los lados\r\nquedan un poco sucios, como el chocolate rallado\r\ndebe cubrir cualquier imperfección.","Pon el bizcocho en el frigorífico durante 30-60 minutos.\r\npara permitir que el glaseado se asiente un poco. groseramente\r\nrallar el chocolate. Trabajando a tu manera\r\nlentamente alrededor del pastel, rallado\r\nchocolate en una espátula y barra\r\npor los lados del pastel, presionando hacia\r\nel glaseado suave.","Sacar el bizcocho del bol, deslizar el\r\nespátula entre el pastel y el\r\nbase de metal y transfiéralo suavemente a un plato o\r\nsoporte para pasteles. (Si el glaseado es demasiado blando para hacer esto,\r\nColoca el pastel en el congelador durante 30 minutos y\r\nluego inténtelo de nuevo). Enfríelo hasta que esté listo para servir.\r\nAntes de servir, rocíe 1 cucharadita de\r\nsemillas de maracuyá reservadas sobre la parte superior\r\nel pastel. Si se adelanta el día, cúbralo con\r\nun molde para pastel o un tazón lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir\r\nel pastel sin tocarlo, así el pastel\r\nno se daña en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 12:57:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13348,9252,'es','Pastel crujiente de frambuesa y amaretti','Delicioso bizcocho crujiente de frambuesa y amaretti','["175 g de mantequilla blanda","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos","140 g de harina con levadura","85 g de almendras molidas","140 g de galletas amaretti, partidas aproximadamente","250 g de frambuesas en canastilla","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear","Crema única de cartón de 142 ml"]','["Precalentar el horno a 140 ° C / convencional 160 ° C / gas 3. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm de fondo suelto. Ponga la mantequilla, el azúcar en polvo, los huevos, la harina y las almendras molidas en un bol grande. Batir con una batidora eléctrica de mano hasta que todos los ingredientes estén bien mezclados.","Extienda la mitad de la mezcla del pastel en el molde forrado. Distribuya la mitad de las galletas amaretti y luego un tercio de las frambuesas. Presione muy ligeramente sobre la mezcla del pastel.","Vierta cucharadas de postre de la mezcla de pastel restante sobre los amaretti y las frambuesas y extiéndalas uniformemente. Esparza los amaretti restantes y la mitad de las frambuesas restantes por encima. Hornee durante 55-60 minutos, hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio.","Dejar enfriar durante 15 minutos en el molde. Pasa un cuchillo por el borde y desmolda. Se mantendrá en un recipiente tapado en el refrigerador hasta por 2 días.","Para servir, sacar del frigorífico una hora antes de servir y espolvorear ligeramente con azúcar glas antes de llevarlo a la mesa. Servir con las frambuesas restantes y un poco de nata líquida."]','2026-01-11 12:57:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13349,9253,'es','Pastel helado de mousse de frutos rojos','Un postre helado como este siempre es útil para recibir invitados... ¡y la mousse rosa brillante será un tema de conversación!','["100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","100 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de harina con levadura","¾ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos","500 g de frutos rojos variados (frescos o congelados)","azúcar glas, para endulzar","3 hojas de gelatina en hojas","3 claras de huevo","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","300 ml de nata montada"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nBatir la mantequilla con el azúcar, luego batir.\r\nen la harina, el polvo para hornear, la vainilla y\r\nhuevos. Vierta la masa en un recipiente forrado de 24 cm.\r\nmolde para pastel de base suelta y hornee por\r\n30 minutos o hasta que haya subido y esté bien cocido.","Sacar el bizcocho del molde y\r\nenfriar sobre una rejilla, dejando la base\r\npapel en el fondo del pastel. cuando\r\nel bizcocho está completamente frío, córtalo por la mitad\r\nhorizontalmente. Limpiar el molde y forrar con\r\npelícula adhesiva. Pon la parte superior del pastel en\r\nla base de la lata.","Para hacer la mousse, ponga las bayas\r\nuna cacerola a fuego lento y llevar suavemente a\r\na fuego lento, no deberías necesitar más\r\nlíquido a medida que sueltan jugo. endulzar a\r\nprueba con azúcar glas – quieres un\r\nsabor ligeramente ácido ya que lo serán más tarde\r\nmezclado con un merengue dulce. genio\r\ncon una batidora de mano o póngalo en una licuadora\r\ny hacer puré, luego colar. deberías terminar\r\nCompletar con unos 250 ml de puré. Remojar el\r\ngelatina en agua hasta que esté blanda, revuelva con la\r\npuré de frutos rojos caliente y dejar enfriar.","Batir las claras a punto de nieve,\r\nluego agregue el azúcar en polvo en 4 tandas.\r\nContinúe batiendo hasta obtener una consistencia firme,\r\nmerengue brillante. Incorporar el puré de frutos rojos.\r\nseguido de la nata. Vierta sobre el\r\nbase de esponja, luego coloque con cuidado la otra\r\nun trozo de bizcocho encima, con el lado del papel hacia arriba.\r\nCongele hasta 40 minutos o 1 hora antes de que lo necesite.\r\nluego sáquelo del congelador y pélelo.\r\nfuera del papel. Retire la lata y adhiera.\r\npelícula. Cuando esté listo para servir, espolvoree\r\nla parte superior con azúcar glas."]','2026-01-11 12:57:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13350,9254,'es','Tarta de naranja y almendras con mascarpone de cítricos','Un postre increíblemente jugoso y delicioso.','["3 naranjas grandes","trozo de mantequilla sin sal","140 g de polenta, más 1-2 cucharadas","200 g de almendras laminadas","1 cucharada escasa de levadura en polvo","7 huevos grandes","2 yemas de huevo grandes","350 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","500 g de mascarpone en tarrina","3-4 cucharadas de Cointreau u otro licor de naranja, al gusto","3-4 cucharadas colmadas de mermelada de lima casera (o artesanal), al gusto"]','["Hervir dos de las naranjas (enteras) en agua, con\r\nla tapa de la sartén, durante aproximadamente 1 hora o hasta\r\nblando. Escurrir y dejar enfriar.","Unte con mantequilla un molde desmontable para pastel, de 23 cm/9 pulgadas de ancho\r\ny 7 cm/23?4 pulgadas de profundidad. Agregue 1-2 cucharadas de\r\npolenta, voltee los granos hasta que la lata esté\r\nrecubierto, luego elimine el exceso. Dejar de lado.","Batir las almendras en hojuelas hasta obtener un polvo granulado en\r\nun procesador de alimentos, luego mezcle en un bol con el\r\npolenta y levadura en polvo. Dejar de lado.","Cortar por la mitad las naranjas cocidas y quitarles\r\npepitas. Retire la ralladura de la tercera naranja. genio\r\nla ralladura y las mitades de naranja (con piel) a una\r\npuré suave en el procesador de alimentos. Dejar de lado.","Precalentar el horno a 180C/Gas 4/horno ventilador\r\n160C. Con una batidora o batidoras eléctricas, bata\r\nlos huevos, las yemas y el azúcar durante unos buenos 5-7 minutos hasta que la masa parezca un batido muy espeso.","Incorpora rápidamente la mezcla de almendras, luego la\r\nhaga puré hasta que esté mezclado. Vierta la masa en el\r\nestaño, dejando al menos 1,5 cm/5?8 pulgadas en la parte superior.","Hornea el bizcocho en medio del horno. después\r\n10 minutos, reducir la temperatura a 150C/\r\nHorno a gas 2/ventilador 130C, hornear durante 30 minutos,\r\nluego reduzca la temperatura a 140 ° C / horno con ventilador\r\n120C durante 30 minutos más (si tiene gas\r\nhorno, cocinar a gas 4 durante 10 minutos, luego a gas\r\n2 durante 11?4 horas hasta que esté listo sin reducir la\r\ntemperatura más). El pastel estará listo cuando\r\nha subido, es de color marrón dorado y el centro está justo\r\nfirme: no entre en pánico porque todavía se siente frágil.","Dejar enfriar el bizcocho en su molde (se hundirá un\r\npoco), luego pasa una espátula por el borde\r\nantes de soltar los lados. Solo intenta\r\ntransferirlo de la base de metal a un decorativo\r\nplato o soporte si tiene un levantador de pasteles adecuado.","Batir el licor y la mermelada en el\r\nmascarpone. Sirve el bizcocho en trozos gruesos.\r\ncon el mascarpone encima."]','2026-01-11 12:57:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13351,9255,'es','Pastel de frambuesa y arándanos con lima','La delicia perfecta para la hora del té, este pastel húmedo y afrutado es fácil de hornear en su máxima expresión.','["225 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para engrasar","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos medianos","2 limas, ralladura y jugo","250 g de harina con levadura tamizada con una pizca de sal y un poco más de harina","25 g de almendras molidas","100 g cada uno de arándanos y frambuesas","8 cucharadas de jugo de lima (unas 4 limas)","1 lima, ralladura","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado"]','["Forre la base y los lados de un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 cm (no de base suelta) con papel vegetal y unte con mantequilla el papel. Ponga el horno a 180C/Gas 4/horno con ventilador a 160C.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén suaves. Incorpora poco a poco los huevos añadiendo un poco de harina hacia el final para evitar que se cuajen. Incorpora la ralladura de lima y luego incorpora la harina y las almendras. Agregue suficiente jugo de limón (aproximadamente 3 cucharadas) para obtener una buena consistencia (la mezcla debe caer fácilmente de la cuchara cuando se golpea).","Incorpora tres cuartas partes de los arándanos y las frambuesas y colócalas en la lata preparada. Alise la superficie y luego esparza el resto de la fruta encima; se hundirá a medida que el pastel suba.","Hornee durante aproximadamente 1 hora (cubra con papel de aluminio si comienza a dorarse demasiado) o hasta que esté firme y se forme un suave pinchazo en el centro. Una brocheta empujada hacia el centro debe estar limpia cuando se retira.","Mientras tanto, haga el almíbar: ponga el jugo de lima, la ralladura y el azúcar en una cacerola pequeña. Poner a fuego suave y remover, sin dejar que burbujee. El azúcar debería disolverse un poco. Tan pronto como el bizcocho salga del horno, pincharlo por todas partes con una brocheta y verter el almíbar por encima. Para guardar, déjelo enfriar antes de envolverlo en papel y/o papel de aluminio.","Saca con cuidado el bizcocho del molde, desecha el papel de revestimiento y córtalo en 12 trozos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13352,9256,'es','Tarta de cerezas y almendras','No sólo para Semana Santa, este delicioso pastel es un buen centro de mesa durante todo el año.','["250 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","5 huevos batidos","250 g de harina con levadura, más 2 cucharadas extra","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","ralladura de 1 naranja, más 2 cucharadas de jugo","250 g de mazapán natural rallado grueso (más fácil si se enfría previamente)","½ cucharadita de esencia de almendras, opcional","200 g de cerezas glaseadas, partidas por la mitad","100 g de azúcar glas tamizada","50 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","12 cerezas glaseadas naturales","ralladura de 1 naranja"]','["Caliente el horno a 160 ° C / ventilador 140 ° C / gas 3 y mantequilla y forre un molde para pastel hondo, redondo y de fondo suelto, de 20 cm. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar con batidoras eléctricas o una batidora de mesa hasta que estén suaves y esponjosas. Añade los huevos, 250 g de harina, la levadura en polvo, la ralladura de naranja y el jugo y bate bien hasta que esté espeso, cremoso y uniformemente mezclado.","Agregue las cerezas a las 2 cucharadas adicionales de harina e incorpórelas a la masa junto con el mazapán rallado y la esencia de almendras (si se usa). Vierta en el molde preparado, nivele y hornee durante 1 hora 30 minutos, o hasta que esté bien leudado y dorado. Una brocheta saldrá limpia cuando esté lista. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos, luego colóquelo en una rejilla para enfriar por completo.","Mezcle el azúcar glas con poco más de 1 cucharada de agua para hacer un glaseado suelto pero no demasiado líquido. Esparcir las almendras por encima.\r\ndel pastel y coloque las 12 cerezas glaseadas alrededor del borde, usando un punto de glaseado para fijar. Rocíe el glaseado sobre el pastel y termine con un poco de ralladura de naranja."]','2026-01-11 12:57:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13353,9257,'es','Pastel de crema agria de arándanos con glaseado de tarta de queso','Los arándanos de esta receta estallarán en tu boca cuando muerdas la rebanada. El pastel es delicioso con una taza de té o servido como postre impresionante.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos grandes","225 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","Caja de 142 ml de crema agria","3 canastillas de 125 g de arándanos","Tarrina de 200 g de queso Philadelphia","100 g de azúcar glas"]','["Precalienta el horno a temperatura ambiente 160C/\r\nconvencional 180C/gas 4 y\r\nmantequilla y forrar la base de una\r\nbizcocho redondo de 22 cm de base suelta\r\nmolde con papel de horno antiadherente\r\no Bake-o-glide reutilizable.","Poner la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, la harina, la levadura y\r\nvainilla en un bol. batir con\r\nuna cuchara de madera para 2-3\r\nminutos, o con una mano eléctrica\r\nbatidor durante 1-2 minutos, hasta\r\nde color más claro y bien\r\nmixto. Batir 4 cucharadas de agrio\r\ncrema, luego agregue la mitad de la\r\narándanos con una cuchara grande.","Vierta la mezcla en la lata.\r\ny extiéndalo nivelado. Hornear por 50\r\nminutos hasta que suba, se siente\r\nfirme al tacto y muelles\r\nhacia atrás cuando se presiona ligeramente.\r\nDeje enfriar durante 10 minutos y luego tome\r\nsacar de la lata y pelar el\r\npapel o forro. dejar para terminar\r\nenfriando sobre una rejilla.","Para hacer el glaseado, batir\r\nel queso tierno con el glaseado\r\nazúcar y el resto\r\ncrema agria en un bol hasta\r\nsuave y cremoso. difundir\r\nsobre la parte superior del enfriado\r\npastel (no seas impaciente ya que\r\nel glaseado se derretirá si el\r\nel pastel está demasiado caliente) y esparcir\r\ncon el resto\r\narándanos. el pastel\r\nconservar en el frigorífico un par\r\nde días. Tráelo a la habitación\r\ntemperatura durante aproximadamente una hora\r\nantes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13354,9258,'es','Pastel crumble de albaricoque y arándanos','Este pastel crumble es ideal para un picnic, un pudín o para tomar el té de la tarde con amigos.','["200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","225 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 huevos batidos","2 cucharadas de leche","150 g de yogur de vainilla en bote","300 g de albaricoques, pelados, cortados por la mitad y sin hueso, o utilizar una lata de 410 g escurrida","225 g de arándanos en canastilla","25 g de mantequilla","3 cucharadas colmadas de harina con levadura","3 cucharadas de azúcar demerara","1 cucharadita de canela molida"]','["Forre una bandeja para hornear alargada (21 x 30 cm) con papel para hornear y caliente el horno a 180 ° C/ventilador 160 ° C/gas 4. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar, la harina, el polvo para hornear, los huevos y la leche hasta que estén cremosos. Vierta en el molde, nivele la parte superior y luego hornee durante 25 minutos hasta que esté casi listo.","Mientras tanto, prepara el yogur y la fruta y haz el crumble frotando todos los ingredientes.","Cuando el pastel se haya horneado durante 25 minutos, sácalo del horno. Trabajando rápidamente, vierta sobre el yogur, esparza sobre la fruta y luego cubra con el crumble. Regrese al horno durante 15-20 minutos hasta que al pinchar con una brocheta salga limpio. Sirva caliente como pudín o enfriado y cortado en cuadritos con té."]','2026-01-11 12:57:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13355,9259,'es','Pastel de naranja amarga y semillas de amapola','Este sencillo pastel todo en uno está hecho con yogur para obtener una textura ligera.','["3 cucharadas de mermelada espesa de buena calidad (usamos mermelada Oxford de corte grueso de Frank Cooper)","Bote 150g yogur natural bio","3 huevos","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","175 g de mantequilla, blanda","ralladura de 1 naranja","2 cucharaditas de semillas de amapola, tostadas","jugo ½ naranja","5 cucharadas de mermelada"]','["Caliente el horno a 160 ° C / ventilador 140 ° C / gas 3. Unte con mantequilla un molde para pan hondo de tamaño mediano (aproximadamente 20 x 10 cm, medido desde la parte superior), luego cubra la base con un rectángulo de papel de hornear antiadherente. Coloque la mermelada en una sartén pequeña, caliéntela suavemente hasta que se derrita (o use una jarra o tazón apto para microondas, luego cocine a temperatura alta durante 30 segundos). Incorpora el yogur y luego déjalo enfriar durante unos minutos.","Coloque los ingredientes restantes del pastel en un tazón grande y bata con un batidor eléctrico hasta que quede suave. Batir rápidamente en el\r\nMezcle el yogur y la mermelada y luego viértalo en el molde preparado. Estará bastante líquido. Deje la mezcla amontonada en el medio de la lata en lugar de nivelar la parte superior, para ayudar a que suba y se agriete en el medio.","Hornee durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 10 minutos hasta que esté dorado y bien leudado; una brocheta debe salir limpia. Mira el pastel después de 45 minutos; Si ha cogido mucho color cubrir sin apretar con papel de horno.  Mientras tanto, calentar el zumo de naranja y\r\nmermelada en una cacerola pequeña a fuego suave hasta que la mermelada se derrita (o usar el microondas como antes). Deje enfriar, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta obtener un glaseado espeso, pero aún líquido. Cuando el bizcocho esté listo, dejar enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego volcarlo sobre una rejilla. Vierta la cobertura sobre el pastel mientras esté tibio. El pastel se sirve mejor\r\nel día en que se hace, pero se conservará hasta por 3 días bien envuelto en un recipiente hermético. Se congelará hasta por 1 mes, sin glasear."]','2026-01-11 12:57:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13356,9260,'es','Pastel de capas de frambuesa','Prueba este pastel de frambuesa ligero y cremoso para disfrutar de un dulce placer veraniego','["200 g de azúcar en polvo","200 g de mantequilla blanda","4 huevos batidos","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","azúcar glas, para decorar","85 g de azúcar en polvo","50ml de licor Disaronno","Tarrina 284ml crema doble","Tarrina de 250 g de mascarpone","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","150 g de frambuesas en canastilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 190c/ventilador 170c/gas 5. Mantequilla\r\n2 moldes para sándwich de 20 cm y forrar cada uno con un círculo.\r\nde papel para hornear. En un bol grande batir\r\njunta todos los ingredientes del bizcocho hasta tener una\r\nmezcla suave y tersa. Vierta la mezcla en partes iguales\r\nen las dos latas, alisando la parte superior de cada una\r\ncon el dorso de la cuchara. Hornear en el horno durante\r\n20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y el bizcocho vuelva a crecer.\r\ncuando se presiona suavemente. Coloque los pasteles en un\r\nrejilla para enfriar.","Calentar el azúcar, 2 cucharadas de agua y Disaronno.\r\njuntos hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. dejar para\r\nfresco, unos 10 minutos. Utilice un cuchillo de sierra grande\r\npara cortar cada pastel por la mitad. Cepille el almíbar por todas partes.\r\nlos cuatro trozos de bizcocho con una brocha de repostería.","Para el relleno, batir la nata hasta que quede suave.\r\npicos. Batir el mascarpone y el azúcar en polvo\r\nun tazón grande para aflojar, luego agregue la crema y\r\nmezcle hasta que quede suave.","Vierta un tercio de la mezcla de crema sobre una de\r\nlas mitades del pastel. Esparcir un poco de fruta.\r\n(no querrás cubrir el pastel), luego haz un sándwich\r\notra mitad encima. Untar con nata y fruta\r\ncomo antes y cubra con otra mitad del pastel y\r\nmás crema y frutos rojos. Coloque la última mitad del pastel\r\narriba. Presione suavemente hacia abajo y luego envuélvalo bien con film transparente.\r\nfilmar y dejar en el frigorífico toda la noche. parar\r\nla crema se derrita, este pastel necesita ser\r\ntransportado al picnic en una nevera portátil. en el\r\npicnic, retire con cuidado el film transparente y espolvoree con\r\nAzúcar glas para decorar, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:57:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13357,9261,'es','Pastel de naranja y semillas de amapola con salsa de chocolate','Un pastel ligero y picante con un chorrito de chocolate y ralladura confitada para darle un toque final especial.','["250 g de mantequilla a temperatura ambiente, más 1 cucharada extra","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más 25 g","3 huevos","250 g de harina común, tamizada","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","jugo de 2 naranjas, ralladura de 4","50 g de semillas de amapola tostadas","100ml de nata doble","100 g de chocolate, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4.\r\nEngrase un molde desmontable de 20 cm o forre un\r\nmolde para pastel de tamaño similar con papel de hornear. Usando\r\nEn una batidora eléctrica, combine 200 g de mantequilla y\r\n200 g de azúcar en un bol grande. Batir hasta que esté ligero\r\ny cremoso, aproximadamente 2 minutos, luego agregue el\r\nhuevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de usted\r\nagrega cada uno. Vierta la harina y hornee.\r\npolvo, mezclar durante unos segundos, luego agregar el\r\njugo de naranja, ralladura de 2 naranjas y amapola\r\nsemillas. Revuelva todo junto y luego vierta en\r\nel molde para pastel. Hornear durante 50 minutos y luego retirar.\r\ndel horno. Dejar enfriar completamente en la lata.","Mientras tanto, hacer la naranja confitada.\r\nralladura combinando la ralladura restante (finamente cortada), 25 g\r\nAzúcar y 100 ml de agua en una cacerola pequeña. traer\r\nhasta que hierva y cocine por 5 minutos hasta que espese.\r\nRetire la ralladura con una espumadera sobre\r\nuna hoja de papel de horno antiadherente.","Para la salsa, calentar la nata en un cazo pequeño.\r\nsartén hasta que esté casi hirviendo. pon el chocolate\r\ny la mantequilla restante en un tazón, luego vierta\r\nla nata caliente encima y dejar reposar 1 min.\r\nderretir. Revuelva hasta que quede suave, luego déjelo reposar.\r\nhasta que el bizcocho esté frío (si se endurece, simplemente recaliéntalo)\r\nsuavemente). Rocíe la salsa sobre el pastel.\r\nespolvorear con la ralladura confitada y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13358,9262,'es','Crumble de pera y carne picada','Con un toque especiado y pequeñas bolsitas de carne picada, este es un delicioso pastel post-Navidad, excelente con natillas calientes.','["4 peras firmes, peladas, sin corazón y cortadas en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla salada, blanda (use un poquito para engrasar)","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla o pasta de vainilla","5 huevos grandes","200 g de harina con levadura","100 g de almendras molidas","7 cucharadas de harina común","6 cucharadas de carne picada"]','["Pon las peras en una sartén antiadherente.\r\ncon 2 cucharadas de azúcar y 2 cucharadas de agua. cubierta,\r\nLuego cocine a fuego medio durante 10 minutos.\r\nhasta que estén tiernos, revolviendo de vez en cuando.\r\nNo debería quedar jugo una vez que las peras\r\nestán cocidos. Agrega la especia; dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nLuego, cubra con mantequilla la base y los lados de un\r\nMolde para pasteles redondo y hondo de 20 cm. poner mantequilla,\r\nazúcar, vainilla y ¼ de cucharadita de sal en una cacerola grande\r\ncuenco. Batir con batidor de mano eléctrico\r\nhasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega los huevos y la harina,\r\nbatir hasta que quede suave, luego incorporar las almendras\r\ncon una cuchara. Retirar 85 g de masa y poner\r\nen un tazón pequeño. A esto agrega la llanura\r\nharina y picar en la mezcla con un cubierto\r\ncuchillo para hacer una mezcla suave y de aspecto quebradizo.","Vierta la mitad de la mezcla para pastel en el molde,\r\ncubra con la mitad de las peras, puntee sobre la mitad de las\r\ncarne picada, luego agregue el resto de la\r\nmezcla para pastel encima. Dispersar con el resto\r\nlas peras, la carne picada y luego la mezcla crumble.\r\nEspolvorea con la última cucharada de azúcar. Hornear para\r\n1½ horas, cubriendo con papel aluminio después de 1 hora, hasta que\r\ndorado, cocido y con una brocheta insertada en\r\nel medio sale limpio. fresco en el\r\nlata durante 10 minutos, luego deja enfriar sobre una rejilla. mantener\r\nen el papel de revestimiento, ya que esto ayudará\r\nmanténgase húmedo. Se mantendrá bien envuelto en un\r\nlata hermética, durante 5 días. Congelar por 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:57:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13359,9263,'es','Tarta de crema noruega','El lector de Good Food, Per Kind, comparte su receta para un enorme pastel relleno de frutas, perfecto para un gran buffet de Pascua','["10 huevos","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","300 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de mermelada de arándanos o fresa","1 litro de nata doble","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","100ml de leche","3 paquetes de arándanos de 180 g"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nEngrasar y forrar un molde para hornear de 20 cm x 30 cm.\r\n– el papel de revestimiento debe subir al menos\r\n2,5 cm por encima del borde de la lata. en tu\r\nbol más grande, bata los huevos y el azúcar\r\ndurante 8-10 minutos hasta que la mezcla esté pálida\r\ny engrosado.","Tamizar la harina y el polvo para hornear sobre\r\nla mezcla de huevo, luego use una cuchara de metal\r\npara doblar suavemente. Vierta esto en la masa para hornear.\r\nlata y hornea por 35 minutos hasta que se forme una brocheta.\r\ninsertado en el centro sale limpio\r\n– el bizcocho debe estar dorado y primaveral\r\nhacia atrás cuando se toca. Quitar del\r\nHorno y dejar reposar durante 5 minutos antes.\r\ncolóquelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe.","Una vez frío, toma un cuchillo afilado y divídelo.\r\nen 3. Mezcle la mermelada con 1 cucharada tibia\r\nagua y montar la nata con la\r\nesencia de vainilla y azúcar glas hasta que\r\nmantiene su forma. Transfiera una capa a una\r\nplato para servir y luego rocíe con ¹/³ de\r\nla leche. Untar con una fina capa de mermelada,\r\nluego crema, luego esparcir sobre 1 paquete de\r\narándanos. Cubrir con la segunda capa.\r\nde bizcocho y luego repetir con ¹/³ del\r\nleche, una capa de mermelada, la nata y 2º\r\npaquete de arándanos. Pon la tercera capa de\r\nbizcocho encima, rociar sobre el resto\r\nleche, luego cubrir con nata y puntear el\r\nColoque el paquete restante de arándanos encima."]','2026-01-11 12:57:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13360,9264,'es','pastel de pera anjou','Este pastel afrutado alcanza su mejor momento cuando se prepara con peras mantecosas y derretidas.','["50 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","500 g de peras mantecosas maduras, peladas, sin corazón y picadas en trozos grandes","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharada de licor de pera William (opcional)","75 g de harina común","1 cucharadita colmada de levadura en polvo","75 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos batidos","2 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque, para el glaseado","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","crème fraîche, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Línea\r\nun molde para pasteles de fondo suelto de 20 cm con\r\npapel para hornear y untar con mantequilla.","Ponga las peras preparadas en un bol con\r\nel jugo de limón y Poire William, si\r\nutilizar, para evitar que se decoloren.\r\nTamizar la harina y el polvo para hornear\r\nun bol, añadiendo una pizca de sal y la\r\nazúcar en polvo. Luego bata los huevos y\r\nmantequilla derretida. Finalmente, incorpora las peras.\r\ncon sus jugos. Vierta la mezcla del pastel\r\nen la lata. Hornee durante unos 50 minutos o\r\nhasta que al pinchar una brocheta salga limpia. Lugar\r\nsobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar un poco\r\nantes de sacarlo de la lata, suavemente\r\ndespegando el pergamino.","Para hacer el glaseado, derretir la mermelada de albaricoque.\r\ncon 1 cucharada de agua y pasar por un\r\ncolador para eliminar los grumos. Cepilla el\r\npastel con el glaseado, espolvorear con azúcar glas\r\ny servir caliente con crème fraîche."]','2026-01-11 12:57:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13361,9265,'es','Pastel de té de manzana y especias','Perfecto con una taza de té recién hecho, se ve y sabe tan bien como uno comprado en el mercado de agricultores.','["175 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","175 g de azúcar mascabado light, más 1 cucharadita","3 huevos grandes, batidos","1 manzana para comer","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de frutos secos de vid mixtos","85 g de almendras molidas","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","175 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de canela","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","chorrear jugo de limón o naranja","1 cucharada de mermelada o confitura de albaricoque"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4.\r\nUnte con mantequilla un molde para pan de 900 g/2 lb y forre con\r\nuna tira de papel de horno o utilizar un molde para pan\r\nrevestimiento (consulte el consejo a continuación). Batir juntos el\r\nmantequilla y azúcar hasta que esté pálido y cremoso,\r\nLuego bata los huevos uno por uno. rejilla\r\nla mitad de la manzana y mézclala con la masa\r\ncon la vainilla, los frutos secos y molido\r\nalmendras. Mezclar el polvo para hornear, la harina.\r\ny especias junto con una pizca de sal,\r\nluego incorporar a la mezcla hasta que quede uniforme. Cuchara\r\nen la lata y nivelar la parte superior.","Cortar en rodajas finas la mitad restante de la manzana.\r\nmezcle con el jugo de limón o naranja, pinche\r\nlas rebanadas un poco dentro de la masa, luego\r\nespolvorea con 1 cucharadita más de azúcar. Hornear para\r\n45 minutos, luego baje el horno a\r\n140C/ventilador 120C/gas 1. Cubrir el bizcocho\r\ncon papel de aluminio, luego hornee por otros 45 minutos\r\nhasta que se inserte una brocheta en el medio\r\nsale limpio. Dejar enfriar en la lata.","Para terminar el bizcocho, derretir la mermelada.\r\no mermelada en una cacerola pequeña, colar para retirar\r\ncualquier grumo, luego páselo sobre el pastel para\r\nglasear la parte superior. Servir cortado en rodajas gruesas,\r\ny untar con un poco de mantequilla, si quieres. Se congelará por hasta 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:57:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13362,9266,'es','Pastel Bakewell de frambuesa','Este sencillo pastel de almendras es una excelente manera de aprovechar las frambuesas que prefieras.','["140 g de almendras molidas","140 g de mantequilla, blanda","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de harina con levadura","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de frambuesas","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas","azúcar glas, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4\r\ny línea de base y engrasar una profundidad de 20 cm.\r\nmolde para pastel de fondo suelto. Bombardea el suelo\r\nalmendras, mantequilla, azúcar, harina, huevos y\r\nextracto de vainilla en un procesador de alimentos hasta\r\nbien combinado.","Extender la mitad de la mezcla sobre el molde para bizcocho.\r\ny alisar por encima. esparcir el\r\nframbuesas encima, luego vierta las\r\nresto de la mezcla de pastel encima y\r\ndistribuido aproximadamente: es posible que encuentres esto\r\nmás fácil de hacer con los dedos. dispersión\r\ncon almendras laminadas y hornear durante\r\n50 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Dejar enfriar, retirar de\r\nRetirar la lata y espolvorear con azúcar glas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13363,9267,'es','Pastel de cuajada de limón y arándanos','Los niños pueden ayudar a preparar esta sencilla delicia primaveral: deliciosa con más cuajada de limón y yogur como pudín, o sírvela con una taza de té.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda, más algo extra para engrasar","Tarrina de 500 ml de yogur griego (necesitas 100 ml/3½ fl oz en el bizcocho, el resto para servir)","Tarro de 300 g de buena cuajada de limón (necesitas 2 cucharadas en el bizcocho, el resto para servir)","3 huevos","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón, más ralladura extra para servir, si lo deseas","200 g de harina con levadura","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de canastilla de arándanos (necesitas 85 g/3 oz en el bizcocho, el resto para servir)","140 g de azúcar glas","flores comestibles, como prímulas moradas o amarillas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase un molde para pan de 2 libras y forre con un largo\r\ntira de papel para hornear. poner 100g\r\nyogur, 2 cucharadas de cuajada de limón, la parte blanda\r\nmantequilla, huevos, ralladura de limón, harina y ricino\r\nazúcar en un tazón grande para mezclar. rápidamente\r\nmezclar con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que la masa\r\nsimplemente se junta. Raspe la mitad en el\r\nestaño preparado. Pesar 85 g de arándanos de\r\nla canastilla y espolvorear la mitad en la lata,\r\nraspe el resto de la masa encima y luego\r\nesparcir la otra mitad de los 85 g de bayas\r\nencima. Hornear durante 1 h 10 min-1 h 15 min\r\nhasta que esté dorado, y se introduce una brocheta en el\r\nel centro sale limpio.","Deje enfriar en la lata, luego levante con cuidado sobre\r\nun plato para servir para congelar. Tamizar el azúcar glas\r\nen un tazón y agregue suficiente jugo de limón\r\npara hacer un glaseado espeso y suave. difundir\r\nsobre la parte superior del pastel, luego decorar\r\ncon ralladura de limón y flores comestibles, si\r\nte gusta. Servir en rodajas con extra de limón.\r\ncuajada, yogur griego y arándanos."]','2026-01-11 12:57:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13364,9268,'es','Bizcocho pegajoso de cítricos','Un excelente postre para alimentar a una multitud al final del almuerzo del domingo: es como una versión horneada de un bizcocho de almíbar al vapor.','["4 naranjas medianas","6 cucharadas de almíbar dorado, más algo extra para servir, opcional","200 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para engrasar","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de almendras molidas","4 huevos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nRallar finamente la ralladura de 2 naranjas.\r\nun tazón grande. Cortar la piel y la médula de\r\ntodas las naranjas con un cuchillo de sierra, y\r\ncortar en rodajas bastante gruesas.","Rocíe el almíbar dorado uniformemente\r\nla base de un bizcocho redondo de 23 cm engrasado\r\nestaño. No es necesario forrar la lata y\r\nno debería tener el fondo suelto\r\nde lo contrario, el almíbar burbujeará.\r\nColoca encima las mejores rodajas de naranja.\r\ndel almíbar y picar finamente lo que quede\r\nno encaja","Ponga todos los ingredientes restantes en el\r\nbol con la ralladura y la naranja picada.\r\nBatir con batidora eléctrica de mano hasta\r\nsuave. Vierta encima de las naranjas,\r\nextender ligeramente y hacer un hueco profundo\r\nen el centro de la mezcla con la espalda\r\nde una cuchara – esto asegurará que el pastel\r\nsube uniformemente.","Hornee durante 45-50 minutos hasta que esté firme cuando\r\npresionado. Deje reposar durante 5 minutos antes.\r\nresultando. Rociar con almíbar dorado\r\nsi lo deseas y sírvelo con natillas o\r\nhelado."]','2026-01-11 12:57:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13365,9269,'es','Tarta de pera, avellanas y chocolate','Pastel húmedo y afrutado de pera, avellanas y chocolate: pruébalo caliente con nata como delicia a la hora del té.','["100 g de avellanas blanqueadas","140 g de harina con levadura","175 g de mantequilla, cortada en trozos pequeños","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos grandes, batidos","5 peras Conferencia pequeñas y maduras","50 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos pequeños","2 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque"]','["Precalienta el horno a 140C/\r\nconvencional 160C/gas 3. Mantequilla y línea\r\nla base de un molde para pasteles redondo de 20 cm. moler\r\nlas avellanas en un procesador de alimentos hasta\r\nbastante bien. Agrega la harina y mezcla brevemente.\r\nAgrega la mantequilla y pulsa hasta que se forme.\r\nmigajas. Agrega el azúcar y los huevos y mezcla.\r\nbrevemente. Pelar, descorazonar y picar dos de las peras. \r\nRevuelve las peras y el chocolate.\r\nligeramente en la mezcla del pastel.","Vierta la mezcla en la lata preparada.\r\ny alisar la parte superior. Pelar, descorazonar y cortar en rodajas\r\nlas peras restantes y esparcirlas sobre el\r\nparte superior del pastel. Presione ligeramente hacia abajo y\r\nhornee durante 50-60 minutos, hasta que esté firme al\r\ntoque. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego\r\ndesmoldar y dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla. Calentar el\r\nmermelada y untar por encima. Servir caliente\r\no frío."]','2026-01-11 12:57:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13366,9270,'es','Tarta de calabacín, limón y tomillo','Inspirado en el huerto, este horneado moderno y fragante aprovecha al máximo una cosecha de calabacín de finales del verano.','["350 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para engrasar","350 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura de 2 limones sin cera","6 huevos grandes","400 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","4 calabacines (unos 600 g), rallados gruesos","2 cucharadas de hojas de tomillo picadas","250 g de mascarpone","250 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada a temperatura ambiente","ralladura de 2 limones sin cera","900 g de azúcar glas","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","12 ramitas de tomillo (use una combinación de ramitas más finas y más gruesas)","1 clara de huevo, ligeramente batida","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 limones sin cera, cortados en rodajas finas","pintura dorada y pan de oro (opcional)"]','["Empiece por hacer las decoraciones. Para el tomillo confitado, poner el azúcar en un plato, untar el tomillo con la clara de huevo y luego pasarlo por el azúcar. Sacuda un poco del exceso y luego deje las ramitas sobre un trozo de papel para hornear para que se sequen por completo.","Para las rodajas de limón confitadas, verter el azúcar en un cazo con 200ml de agua. Calentar suavemente para disolver el azúcar y luego llevar el almíbar a ebullición. Agregue las rodajas de limón y cocine por 15 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Retire con cuidado las rodajas del almíbar y colóquelas sobre un trozo de papel para hornear para que se sequen. (Levántelos con cuidado, ya que serán bastante delicados y, si es posible, deberá mantenerlos en rondas). Guarde el almíbar restante para untar el pastel.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160 ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar las bases de dos moldes desmontables de 20 cm. Haz los cuatro bizcochos en dos tandas. Para hacer la primera tanda, en una batidora de pie o en un tazón grande con un batidor de mano eléctrico, bata 175 g de mantequilla con 175 g de azúcar y la ralladura de 1 limón hasta que quede cremoso. Batir suavemente tres de los huevos en una jarra. Agrega poco a poco el huevo a la mezcla, raspando los lados y batiendo bien después de cada adición. En un recipiente aparte, mezcle 200 g de harina con levadura, 1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo y una pizca de sal, e incorpórelo a la mezcla del pastel. Finalmente, agregue 300 g de calabacín y 1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo. Divide la mezcla entre los moldes y hornea por 25 minutos o hasta que al insertar un palillo en el medio salga limpio.","Mientras los bizcochos aún están calientes, los pinchamos por todos lados con una brocheta y los untamos con un poco del almíbar de limón reservado. Una vez que esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, retírelo de las latas y colóquelo sobre una rejilla. Haga y cocine el segundo lote de pasteles con los ingredientes restantes; puede usar el mismo papel para hornear, solo vuelva a engrasar el papel y los lados de los moldes.","Cuando los pasteles estén fríos, prepara el glaseado. Batir todos los ingredientes con una pizca de sal hasta que quede suave y esponjoso.","Usando un plato giratorio para pasteles, si tienes uno, empareda los pasteles con un poco de glaseado. Con una espátula, extienda una fina capa de glaseado alrededor del pastel y déjelo enfriar durante 30 minutos para que cuaje. (Esta capa se conoce como “capa de migas” porque atrapa las migajas sueltas en la superficie del pastel, por lo que cuando coloques una segunda capa de glaseado, el pastel quedará agradable y suave). Si tienes poco tiempo, colócalo en el congelador durante 5 minutos.","Una vez frío, cubra completamente el pastel con una segunda capa de glaseado para lograr un acabado suave. Pegue el tomillo cristalizado y las rodajas de limón confitado sobre un lado del pastel y cubra como si estuvieran en cascada.","Regresa el bizcocho al frigorífico o congelador hasta que el glaseado se haya endurecido por completo. Para obtener un brillo adicional, use un pincel fino para aplicar un poco de pintura dorada sobre las rodajas de limón para obtener un efecto otoñal pulido y, si lo desea, puntee trozos de pan de oro a medida que avanza."]','2026-01-11 12:57:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13367,9271,'es','pastel de huertos','Pastel de zanahoria y calabacín en este horneado de verduras definitivo de la lectora de Good Food Katie Ready: cúbralo con glaseado de queso crema y termine con nueces picadas','["200 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 huevos batidos","200 ml de aceite de girasol","200 g de harina de espelta","¾ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","¾ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","¾ cucharadita de canela","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","200 g de zanahorias ralladas","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos batidos","125 ml de aceite de girasol","225 g de harina de espelta","¾ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","¾ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","¾ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","250 g de calabacines rallados","50 g de mantequilla, ablandada","250 g de queso crema","600 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar 4 moldes para pasteles de 20 cm con papel para hornear (o usar 2 y hacer primero los bizcochos de zanahoria y luego las capas de calabacín).","Empieza haciendo las capas de zanahoria. Ponga el azúcar, los huevos y el aceite en un tazón grande. Con una batidora eléctrica, batir hasta incorporar. Tamizar la harina y todos los ingredientes secos en el mismo bol, luego incorporarlos suavemente antes de agregar la zanahoria, una pizca de sal y el extracto de vainilla. Revuelva para combinar.","Divida la mezcla de pastel de zanahoria entre 2 de los moldes para pastel preparados y hornee durante 20-25 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y firme al tacto. Deje que los pasteles se enfríen en los moldes durante unos minutos, luego colóquelos sobre rejillas cuando estén lo suficientemente fríos como para manipularlos.","Mientras tanto, haz las capas de calabacín. Pon el azúcar, los huevos y el aceite en un tazón grande y usa un batidor de mano para combinar. Tamizar los ingredientes secos e incorporar, luego agregar los calabacines y mezclar.","Vierta la mezcla de pastel de calabacín en los 2 moldes restantes y hornee durante 20-25 minutos o hasta que estén dorados. Deje enfriar en las latas, luego colóquelo sobre rejillas para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer el glaseado, vierta la mantequilla en un tazón grande y bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave. Agrega el queso crema y vuelve a batir. Tamizar el azúcar glas y batir hasta que se combinen.","Coloque los pasteles en capas alternativamente, esparciendo un poco de glaseado entre cada capa a medida que avanza. Cubre todo el bizcocho con el resto del glaseado y sirve. Se conservará durante 2 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:57:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13368,9272,'es','Tarta de pistacho, calabacín y limón','Con mucho sabor pero textura ligera, este horneado fácil es igual de bueno empacado en una lata para un picnic o servido con yogur griego como postre.','["175 g de pistachos sin cáscara","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente, más un poco más para engrasar","280 g de harina común","1¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","3 huevos grandes","140 g de yogur entero estilo griego (compre una olla grande y guarde el resto para servir al lado)","ralladura y jugo de 3 limones","140 g de calabacines rallados gruesos","175 g de azúcar glas","2 cucharadas de cuajada de limón (opcional)"]','["Poner 150 g de pistachos y el azúcar en un robot de cocina y batir hasta que las nueces estén muy finas.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4, engrasar un molde para pasteles de 20 x 30 cm y forrar la base con papel para hornear. Vierta el azúcar de pistacho en un tazón grande con la mantequilla, la harina, el polvo para hornear y el bicarbonato, los huevos, el yogur y la ralladura y el jugo de 2 de los limones. Batir con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave y combinado.","Agrega el calabacín hasta que todo esté bien mezclado y luego viértelo en la lata preparada. Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que el pastel esté crecido y dorado, y al pinchar un pincho en el centro, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar.","Cuando el bizcocho se haya enfriado por completo, desmoldalo y retira el papel de horno. Tamice el azúcar glas en un tazón y agregue gradualmente suficiente jugo de limón hasta obtener una consistencia líquida. Si te quedas sin jugo, continúa mezclando con agua. Rocíe una capa espesa sobre el pastel y repita con cuajada de limón, si lo desea. Pica los pistachos restantes y espárcelos sobre el glaseado, junto con la ralladura de limón restante. Dejar reposar durante 10 minutos, luego cortar en cuadritos y servir con yogur griego. Se conservará durante 3 días en una lata hermética."]','2026-01-11 12:57:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13369,9273,'es','Tarta de calabacín y naranja con glaseado de queso crema','Olvídate del pastel de zanahoria, este pastel de calabacín ligero y húmedo está lleno de sabor y combina perfectamente con una taza de té.','["350 g de calabacines (no es necesario pelarlos)","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","125 ml de aceite de girasol","3 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos","ralladura 1 naranja","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100g de pasas","300 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","200 g de queso crema entero","100 g de azúcar glas tamizada"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar ligeramente y forrar un molde para pan de 1 kg con una tira de papel para hornear. Ralla finamente los calabacines y luego exprime todo el líquido que puedas con las manos (demasiado hará que el pastel quede empapado).","Revuelve los calabacines con el azúcar, el aceite de girasol, los huevos, la ralladura de naranja, la vainilla y las pasas, luego agrega la harina y la levadura en polvo hasta que desaparezcan, pero sin mezclar demasiado.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde y hornee durante 50 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el pastel, éste salga limpio. Retirar del molde y dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Mientras tanto, bata el queso crema con el azúcar glas (no bata demasiado, ya que esto puede hacer que la mezcla se ablande demasiado) y luego enfríe. Extienda sobre el pastel enfriado, espolvoree con la ralladura y enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir. Se conservará durante una semana en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 12:57:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13370,9274,'es','Pastel de tuétano y nueces con glaseado de arce','El uso de tuétano rallado en este pastel casero le da una textura excelente; cubra con glaseado de queso crema.','["250ml de aceite de girasol, más un extra para engrasar","300 g de harina con levadura","3 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","250 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","4 huevos grandes","ralladura fina y jugo de 1 naranja","300 g de pulpa de tuétano, rallada gruesa y sin líquido","200 g de nueces pecanas, picadas en trozos grandes","50 g de mantequilla, ablandada","250 g de queso crema","4 cucharadas de jarabe de arce"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase y forre un molde desmontable redondo de 22 cm.\r\nmolde para pastel con papel para hornear. tamizar el\r\nharina, especias y levadura en polvo en\r\nen un bol y desmenuzar en el azúcar. en un\r\nEn un bol aparte, batir los huevos con la\r\nralladura de naranja y jugo, luego vierta la\r\naceite. Añade el tuétano y 150g de\r\nnueces a la mezcla de aceite, luego batir\r\nen la harina hasta que se combinen. Inclínate hacia\r\nel molde para bizcocho, alisar la parte superior y hornear\r\npor 1 hr 20 min, o hasta que salga una brocheta\r\nsalir limpio. Dejar enfriar durante 30 minutos en\r\nla lata antes de retirarla y colocarla\r\nuna rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras el bizcocho se enfría, prepara el\r\nglaseado batiendo todos los ingredientes\r\njuntos. Cuando el bizcocho se haya enfriado,\r\nuse una espátula para esparcir el glaseado\r\nla parte superior. Espolvorear sobre el resto del\r\nnueces pecanas para decorar y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13371,9275,'es','pastel de calabaza de halloween','¿Te gusta el pastel de zanahoria? Luego intenta usar la calabaza sobrante en esta inteligente bandeja para hornear para Halloween.','["300 g de harina con levadura","300 g de azúcar mascabado light","3 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","175 g de pasas","½ cucharadita de sal","4 huevos batidos","200 g de mantequilla, derretida","ralladura de 1 naranja","1 cucharada de jugo de naranja","500 g (peso pelado) de pulpa de calabaza o calabacín, rallada","Paquete de 200 g de queso tierno","85 g de mantequilla, blanda","100 g de azúcar glas tamizada","ralladura de 1 naranja y jugo de la mitad"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4.\r\nUntar con mantequilla y forrar una fuente para hornear de 30 x 20 cm o pequeña\r\nfuente para asar con papel para hornear. poner\r\nla harina, el azúcar, las especias, el bicarbonato de sodio,\r\npasas y sal en un tazón grande y revuelva\r\npara combinar. Batir los huevos con el derretido.\r\nmantequilla, agregue la ralladura de naranja y el jugo, luego\r\nmezcle con los ingredientes secos hasta que se combinen.\r\nAgrega la calabaza. Vierta la masa en el\r\nlata y hornea por 30 minutos, o hasta que esté dorado y\r\nelástico al tacto.","Para hacer el glaseado, batir las\r\nqueso, mantequilla, azúcar glas, ralladura de naranja\r\ny 1 cucharadita de jugo hasta que quede suave y cremoso,\r\nLuego reservar en el frigorífico. cuando el pastel\r\nCuando esté listo, déjelo enfriar durante 5 minutos y luego colóquelo en una\r\nrejilla para enfriar. Pínchalo todo con un pincho.\r\ny rociar con el resto del jugo de naranja\r\nmientras aún está caliente. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Si quieres, recorta los bordes del bizcocho.\r\nDale un golpe rápido al glaseado para que se afloje.\r\nluego, con una espátula, extender sobre la\r\nparte superior del pastel en picos y remolinos. si eres\r\nPreparando el bizcocho con antelación, guárdalo en el frigorífico.\r\nluego saca tantas piezas como quieras\r\n30 minutos más o menos antes de servir. mantendrá,\r\ntapado, hasta por 3 días en el refrigerador."]','2026-01-11 12:57:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13372,9276,'es','Pastel de chirivía y jarabe de arce de Catherine Berwick','Ganador del concurso de tartas del 20 cumpleaños de Good Food, creemos que esta es la nueva tarta de zanahoria','["175 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","250 g de azúcar demerara","100 ml de jarabe de arce","3 huevos grandes","250 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","250 g de chirivías peladas y ralladas","1 manzana mediana, pelada, sin corazón y rallada","50 g de nueces pecanas, picadas en trozos grandes","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja pequeña","azúcar glas, para servir","Tarrina de 250 g de mascarpone","3-4 cucharadas de jarabe de arce"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase 2 moldes para sándwich de 20 cm y forre\r\nlas bases con papel para hornear.\r\nDerretir la mantequilla, el azúcar y el jarabe de arce en un\r\nSartén a fuego suave y luego deja enfriar un poco.\r\nBatir los huevos con esta mezcla, luego revolver.\r\nen la harina, el polvo para hornear y mezclar\r\nespecias, seguidas de la chirivía rallada,\r\nmanzana, nueces picadas, ralladura de naranja y\r\njugo. Dividir entre las latas y luego hornear.\r\ndurante 25-30 minutos hasta que la parte superior regrese\r\ncuando se presiona ligeramente.","Enfriar un poco las tartas en los moldes.\r\nantes de colocarlo sobre rejillas para\r\nenfriar completamente. Justo antes de servir, mezcle\r\njuntos el mascarpone y el arce\r\nalmíbar. Distribuir sobre un pastel y un sándwich.\r\ncon el otro. Espolvoree con azúcar glas solo\r\nantes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13373,9277,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: pastel de zanahoria','Angela Nilsen replantea los ingredientes y las técnicas de horneado tradicionales para crear una versión más saludable de un clásico','["1 naranja mediana","140 g de pasas","125 ml de aceite de colza","115 g de harina integral normal","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo, más una pizca","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de canela molida","140 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","280 g de zanahorias finamente ralladas (unos 375-400 g de zanahorias antes de pelarlas)","2 huevos","115 g de harina con levadura","100 g de queso tierno ligero, recién sacado de la nevera","100 g de requesón","3 cucharadas de azúcar glas tamizada","½ cucharadita de ralladura de naranja fina","1 ½ cucharadita de jugo de limón"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3. Para el bizcocho, rallar finamente la ralladura de la naranja y exprimir 3 cucharadas de jugo. Vierte el jugo sobre las pasas en un bol, agrega la ralladura y luego déjalas en remojo mientras haces el pastel. Engrase ligeramente y forre la base de un molde para pasteles cuadrado de 20 cm de profundidad. Mezclar las harinas con 1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo, bicarbonato de sodio y canela.","Separa uno de los huevos. Pon la clara en un bol pequeño y la yema en uno grande. Rompe el huevo entero restante con la yema y luego agrega el azúcar. Batir durante 1-2 minutos hasta que esté espeso y espumoso. Vierta lentamente el aceite y continúe batiendo a velocidad baja hasta que esté bien mezclado. Vierta la mezcla de harina, mitad a la vez, y revuélvala suavemente con la mezcla de huevo con una espátula de goma o una cuchara grande. La mezcla quedará bastante dura. Agrega la pizca extra de levadura en polvo con la clara de huevo y bate hasta obtener picos suaves.","Incorpora la zanahoria, las pasas (y cualquier líquido) a la mezcla de harina. Incorpora suavemente la clara de huevo batida y luego vierte en el molde. Mueve la lata para nivelar la mezcla. Hornee durante 1 hora hasta que suba y esté firme o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos, desmoldar sobre una rejilla, retirar el papel y dejar hasta que esté frío.","Para hacer el glaseado, mezcle el queso tierno, el quark, el azúcar glas y la ralladura de naranja; no bata demasiado. Agrega el jugo de limón. Agite el glaseado sobre el pastel y córtelo en 16 cuadrados. Este pastel es aún mejor si se deja bien envuelto durante uno o dos días antes de glasearlo y comerlo. Se conservará hasta 5 días sin congelar en una lata hermética o en el refrigerador si está helado."]','2026-01-11 12:57:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13374,5141,'es','Tarta de limón sin gluten','Con un ingrediente sorpresa especial, este pastel sin gluten se mantiene maravillosamente húmedo. ¡Para sorpresa de todos, es puré de patatas!','["200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos","175 g de almendras molidas (para que no tenga nueces, consulte más abajo)","250 g de puré de patatas","ralladura de 3 limones","2 cucharaditas de levadura en polvo sin gluten (Supercook hace una)","4 cucharadas de azúcar granulada","jugo 1 limon"]','["Calentar el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para pastel redondo y profundo de 20 cm. Batir el azúcar y la mantequilla hasta que estén suaves y esponjosos, luego agregar gradualmente el huevo.\r\nbatiendo después de cada adición. Incorpora las almendras, el puré de patatas frío y la ralladura de limón.\r\ny polvo para hornear.","Vierta en el molde, nivele la parte superior y luego hornee durante 40-45 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en el medio del pastel, éste salga limpio. Colóquelo sobre una rejilla después de 10 minutos de enfriamiento. Mezcle el azúcar granulada y el jugo de limón, luego vierta sobre la parte superior del pastel y deje que gotee por los lados. Deja enfriar el pastel\r\ncompletamente antes de cortar."]','2026-01-11 12:57:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13375,9278,'es','Pastel de calabacín','Utilice un exceso de jardín en este bizcocho dulce y especiado: las verduras ocultas lo mantienen húmedo y las nueces le dan un toque crujiente.','["mantequilla, para la lata","2 huevos grandes","125 ml de aceite vegetal","85 g de azúcar moreno blando","350 g de calabacines rallados gruesos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","300 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de canela","¼ cucharadita de nuez moscada","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","85 g de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes","140 g de pasas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nUnte con mantequilla y forre un molde para pan de 2 libras con masa para hornear.\r\npergamino. En un tazón grande, bata\r\nlos huevos, el aceite y el azúcar, luego añadir el\r\ncalabacines y vainilla.","En otro tazón, combine el resto\r\ningredientes con una pizca de sal.","Agrega los ingredientes secos a los húmedos.\r\nmezcla, luego vierta en la lata. Hornear para\r\n1 hora, o hasta que se inserte una brocheta en el\r\nel centro sale limpio. Dejar enfriar,\r\nluego sirva o congele por hasta 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:57:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13376,9279,'es','Pan de té de calabaza y jengibre','Un pan de pastel húmedo para servir en rodajas gruesas y untado con mantequilla; es bueno para las loncheras y con una taza de té.','["175 g de mantequilla, derretida","140 g de miel clara","1 huevo grande, batido","250 g de calabaza cruda pelada o calabacín, rallada gruesa (aproximadamente 500 g/1 libra 2 oz antes de pelar y quitar las semillas)","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","350 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharada de jengibre molido","2 cucharadas de azúcar demerara"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/gas 4/\r\nventilador 160C. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base.\r\ny dos lados largos de un pan de 1,5 kg\r\nlata con una tira de papel de horno.","Mezcle la mantequilla, la miel y el huevo y agregue la calabaza o el zapallo. Luego mezcle el azúcar, la harina y el jengibre.","Vierta en el molde preparado y espolvoree por encima con el azúcar demerara. Hornee durante 50-60 minutos, hasta que\r\nleudado y dorado. Dejar en el molde durante 5 minutos, luego desmoldar y dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla. servir\r\nen rodajas gruesas y untadas con mantequilla."]','2026-01-11 12:57:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13377,9280,'es','Tarta helada de calabacín y limón','Este delicioso pastel es ligero y con sabor a limón, con un toque cítrico extra gracias al chorrito de jarabe de limón.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla sin sal, muy blanda, más un extra para la lata","3 limones sin cera","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos","2 calabacines medianos, rallados gruesos (necesitarás 300 g/10 oz de pulpa)","1 cucharadita de semilla de amapola, más un poco para decorar","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de harina con levadura","100 g de harina integral normal","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","85 g de azúcar glas","Paquete de 200 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","4 cucharadas de cuajada de limón (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nMantequilla 2 moldes para sándwich de 20 cm y línea\r\nlas bases con papel para hornear. entusiasmo\r\n2 limones, luego exprime su jugo en un\r\nrecipiente aparte. Poner 200g de mantequilla, la rueda\r\nazúcar, huevos, calabacines, semillas de amapola,\r\nla ralladura de vainilla y limón en un tazón.\r\nBatir hasta obtener una masa cremosa. Agregue 1 cucharada\r\njugo de limón, las harinas, el polvo para hornear\r\ny ¼ de cucharadita de sal. Vierta la mezcla en el\r\nlatas, luego hornee por 25 minutos o hasta que suban,\r\ndorado y elástico en el medio.","Haga un chorrito mezclando otra cucharada\r\nJugo de limón con 25 g de azúcar glas. Pon el\r\nel resto del azúcar glas y la mantequilla en un\r\ntazón, agregue el queso tierno, el resto\r\njugo de limón (aproximadamente 2 cucharadas) y rallar\r\nla ralladura final del limón. Batir para hacer un\r\nglaseado cremoso y suave.","Cuando los pasteles estén listos, déjelos enfriar durante\r\n15 minutos en sus latas, luego pasar a una\r\nrejilla para enfriar. Pinchar varias veces con\r\nun palito de cóctel, vierta sobre la llovizna\r\ny enfriar completamente. Se puede congelar a\r\nesta etapa por hasta 1 mes. poner un pastel\r\nen un plato para servir y untar con solo\r\nmenos de la mitad del glaseado. Extender sobre el\r\ncuajada de limón, si la usa. Cubra con el segundo\r\npastel, esparza el glaseado restante sobre\r\nencima y espolvorear con semillas de amapola."]','2026-01-11 12:57:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13378,9281,'es','Pan picante de zanahoria y jengibre','Los amantes del pastel de jengibre y el pastel de zanahoria deberían disfrutar este. Se suaviza y mejora en un par de días.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un extra para la lata","100 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","50 g de melaza negra","50 g de almíbar dorado (o usa más melaza negra si te gusta el pastel de jengibre muy oscuro)","ralladura de 1 naranja","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","1 zanahoria grande, rallada (necesitarás 140 g/5 oz de pulpa)","5 bolas de jengibre de tallo de un frasco, finamente picadas","175 g de harina con levadura","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 cucharaditas de jengibre molido","¼ cucharadita de pimienta negra recién molida","2 huevos","140 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nLuego forre con mantequilla un molde para pan de 900 g con\r\ntira de papel para hornear. Pon la mantequilla,\r\nazúcar, melaza, almíbar y la mitad de las ralladuras\r\nen una cacerola grande. Calentar suavemente hasta\r\ntodo se ha derretido.","Agrega la zanahoria, ¾ de la picada\r\njengibre, toda la harina, bicarbonato, ¼ cucharadita de sal,\r\nel jengibre molido, la pimienta y los huevos a la\r\nsartén y revuelva bien hasta obtener una masa suave\r\nmasa. Vierta en el molde y hornee por\r\n45 minutos, o hasta que se dore y haya subido\r\ny un pincho insertado en el medio\r\nsale limpio. Deje enfriar durante 20 minutos en\r\nla lata y luego colóquela sobre una rejilla.","Tamizar el azúcar glas en un bol, añadir\r\nla ralladura restante, luego agregue suficiente\r\njugo de limón (aproximadamente 4 cucharaditas deberían ser suficientes) para\r\nhaga un glaseado suave y espeso. Cubrir el\r\nsuperficie del glaseado con film transparente hasta\r\nlisto para decorar el pastel.","Cuando el bizcocho esté completamente frío,\r\nextiende el glaseado por encima y déjalo\r\nregatear por los costados. Dispersarse con el\r\njengibre picado reservado. Permitir configurar,\r\nluego córtelo en rodajas y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:57:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13379,9282,'es','Brownies de remolacha','Con aproximadamente la mitad de grasa que los brownies normales, estos son un placer un poco menos culpable, pero aún tienen ese intenso toque de chocolate.','["500 g de remolacha entera cruda (3-4 remolachas medianas)","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un extra para la lata","200 g de barra de chocolate natural (70% cacao)","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos","100 g de harina común","25 g de cacao en polvo"]','["Use un par de guantes de goma para detener\r\ntus manos para que no se manchen, luego arriba, cola\r\ny pelar la remolacha; necesitarás aproximadamente\r\n400 g de pulpa. Picar en trozos grandes y poner en un\r\ntazón grande. Añade un chorrito de agua, tapa\r\ncon film transparente, luego cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta\r\ndurante 12 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nMientras se cocina la remolacha, luego la mantequilla.\r\nforrar una bandeja para hornear de 20 x 30 cm o pequeña\r\nlata para asar. Picar el chocolate en trozos grandes\r\ny cortar la mantequilla en cubos. Inclina el\r\nremolacha cocida en un colador, escurrir\r\nRetire el exceso de líquido y luego colóquelo en un recipiente para alimentos.\r\nprocesadora o licuadora con el chocolate,\r\nmantequilla y vainilla. Batir hasta que la mezcla esté\r\ntan suave como puedas conseguirlo. el chocolate\r\ny la mantequilla se derretirá mientras haces esto.","Poner el azúcar y los huevos en una cacerola grande.\r\nbol, luego batir con una mano eléctrica\r\nbata hasta que esté espeso, pálido y espumoso, aproximadamente\r\n2 minutos. Vierta la mezcla de remolacha en el\r\ntazón (no se verá muy bonito en este\r\netapa, pero tengan paciencia conmigo), luego use un gran\r\nCuchara de metal para incorporarla al batido.\r\nhuevos. Trate de conservar la mayor cantidad de aire en el\r\nmezcla lo más que puedas. Tamizar la harina y\r\ncacao en polvo, luego dóblelos suavemente\r\npara hacer una masa suave.","Vierta en el molde preparado y hornee.\r\ndurante 25 minutos o hasta que haya subido por completo, con\r\nsólo el más mínimo temblor debajo del centro\r\nde la corteza al agitar la sartén.\r\nDejar enfriar completamente en el molde y luego cortar.\r\nen cuadrados."]','2026-01-11 12:57:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13380,9283,'es','Manzanas chocolatadas','Prepare estas manzanas con chocolate como regalo para una fiesta infantil. Ideal para la noche de hogueras o Halloween, cúbralo con nueces picadas, chispas y trozos de panal.','["200 g de chocolate con leche, finamente picado","4 manzanas pequeñas para comer","hebras de azúcar, nueces finamente picadas, chispas, trozos de panal","50 g de cada chocolate blanco y negro, picados (opcional)","4 brochetas, palillos de madera o palitos de paleta grandes"]','["Coloque el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, teniendo cuidado de que el recipiente no toque el agua. Revuelva frecuentemente durante 10 minutos hasta que esté completamente derretido, suave y brillante. Retirar del fuego. Alternativamente, caliente el chocolate en ráfagas cortas en el microondas, revolviendo entre cada ráfaga, hasta que se derrita.","Coloque las manzanas en un recipiente resistente al calor y viértalas sobre agua hirviendo del hervidor. Escurrir con cuidado y lavar con agua caliente para eliminar los restos de cera de la piel. Esto ayuda a que el chocolate se pegue mejor. Seque con papel de cocina, retire los tallos y coloque un palito de paleta o una brocheta en su lugar.","Forre una bandeja para hornear o una tabla grande con papel para hornear. Sostenga las manzanas por los palitos y sumérjalas en el chocolate derretido. Usa una cuchara para cubrir la parte superior de las manzanas si lo deseas. Una vez que las manzanas estén completamente cubiertas, sosténgalas sobre el tazón durante unos segundos para que el exceso de chocolate vuelva a gotear y luego colóquelas, con el palo hacia arriba, en la bandeja preparada. Dejar reposar durante uno o dos minutos.","Coloca las decoraciones en tazones separados. Cuando el chocolate de las manzanas apenas comience a cuajar pero no esté completamente firme, espolvorea las decoraciones sobre las manzanas. Manténgalos de lado y gírelos con el palo para cubrirlos por completo. Volver a colocar en la bandeja y dejar hasta que cuaje por completo.","Si usas chocolate blanco y negro para decorar, calienta cada uno por separado, como hiciste con el chocolate con leche en el paso 1, luego déjalo enfriar un poco. Primero derrita el chocolate amargo, luego, cuando las manzanas de chocolate estén duras, use una cucharadita para rociarlo sobre ellas, nuevamente sosteniendo el palo de modo que la manzana quede de lado y girándola. Coloque una hoja de papel para hornear debajo para recoger las gotas. Vuelva a colocar en la bandeja y déjelo reposar, luego repita el proceso con el chocolate blanco. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético en un lugar fresco durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:57:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13381,9284,'es','pavlova de halloween','El mejor pastel de pavlova de Halloween, intercalado con crema y cubierto con decoraciones macabramente lindas. Este espectacular horneado es perfecto para una fiesta.','["500 g de azúcar en polvo","250 g de claras de huevo","1 cucharadita de cremor tártaro","600ml de nata doble","300 g de moras","300 g de frambuesas","100 g de bayas congeladas","un chorrito de miel","un chorrito de limon","Bolígrafo negro para escribir comida, para ojos de fantasma.","flores comestibles","macarrones blancos o negros","un chorrito de chocolate amargo","hoja de oro comestible","trozos de frambuesa liofilizados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner el azúcar en polvo en una bandeja para hornear pequeña forrada con papel para hornear. Agite para nivelar el azúcar y caliente en el horno durante unos 5 minutos hasta que esté caliente pero sin derretirse (esto ayuda a estabilizar las claras y a obtener un merengue suave y brillante).","Batir las claras en una batidora con el crémor tártaro. Batir lentamente al principio, aumentando gradualmente la velocidad hasta que las claras estén en la etapa de punto máximo, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Es importante no batir demasiado las claras. Retirar el azúcar del horno en cuanto las claras estén firmes.","Baje el horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼, dejando la puerta entreabierta para ayudar a que se enfríe rápidamente; sus merengues deben hornearse a baja temperatura.","Sube la batidora a máxima velocidad y empieza a añadir el azúcar una cucharada a la vez. Las claras de huevo deben mantener su volumen a medida que agregas azúcar; si ves que comienza a colapsar, deja de agregar azúcar y deja que la mezcla se endurezca y suba antes de agregar el resto, una cucharada a la vez.","Forre tres bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear y coloque las plantillas ''B''B'', ''O''O'' ''O''''O'' debajo para que pueda trazarlas. Llene su manga pastelera con el merengue, aproximadamente dos tercios de su altura. Evite llenar demasiado la bolsa o le resultará difícil canalizar; puede agregar más a la bolsa más tarde.","Haga un agujero en la punta de la bolsa, de aproximadamente 1 cm de ancho, y sostenga la bolsa cerca del fondo mientras con la otra mano sostiene la parte superior, manteniendo la parte superior de la bolsa cerrada para que no se derrame el merengue.","Comience con la manga pastelera directamente en posición vertical y apriete suavemente con la mano inferior para trazar el borde de las letras y hacer un borde de merengue; Una vez que tengas la forma, puedes rellenarla. Suaviza las líneas y bordes ásperos con el dorso de una cuchara o una mini espátula.","Para formar los fantasmas, sostén la bolsa firmemente aproximadamente 1 cm por encima de la bandeja y aprieta la bolsa desde arriba para comenzar a formar el cuerpo de tu fantasma. Mantenga la bolsa completamente quieta mientras aprieta, usando la mano inferior para mantener la bolsa firme. Deja de apretar una vez que el merengue llegue a la bandeja. Levante un poco la manga pastelera, sin crear una separación entre el merengue de la bandeja y el merengue que queda en la manga pastelera. Vuelve a dejar caer la bolsa y aprieta suavemente para formar la parte superior del cuerpo del fantasma; levanta la manga pastelera hacia arriba para dejar un lindo pico en la parte superior de las cabezas de tus fantasmas. Esto requerirá un poco de práctica, así que no te preocupes si no lo haces bien la primera vez, simplemente continúa y familiarízate.","Coloca las seis letras y los mini fantasmas en el horno durante 2 horas hasta que el merengue esté crujiente por fuera y malva por dentro. Apaga el horno y deja enfriar la pavlova en el horno. Si después de 2 horas su merengue está demasiado pegajoso en el medio, hornee por otros 30 minutos y luego déjelo enfriar en el horno nuevamente. Se mantendrá durante una semana almacenado sin apretar en una lata en algún lugar fresco y seco.","Para hacer el coulis de “sangre” de frambuesa, ponga las bayas congeladas en una sartén a fuego medio, luego agregue una cucharada de miel y un chorrito de jugo de limón. Cocine por 5 minutos. Para obtener una salsa suave, cuele a través de un colador fino y luego déjela enfriar. Se conservará hasta por tres días en el refrigerador.","Cuando esté listo para servir, coloque las letras inferiores en el tablero para deletrear \"BOO\" en una hermosa fuente o tablero para servir. Si tuviste suficiente mezcla para hacer mini fantasmas de merengue, agrega sus caras. Nos gusta dibujar dos ojos grandes y caídos y una boca abierta para que realmente puedas imaginarlos haciendo sonidos espeluznantes y fantasmales. Si no tienes un bolígrafo comestible, puedes derretir suavemente 50 g de chocolate amargo en el microondas y usar un pincel pequeño para pintar las caras.","Batir la nata doble hasta que se formen picos suaves. Llene su segunda manga pastelera con su crema batida y corte un pequeño agujero, de unos 2 cm, al final. Coloque manchas por todas las letras; en esta etapa, puede agregar algunas bayas en rodajas encima de la crema. Coloque con cuidado las segundas letras encima. Repita las gotas de crema en la capa superior. Decora con las moras, frambuesas, flores comestibles y merengues fantasma. Rocíe con un poco de coulis de \"sangre\" de frambuesa. Siéntete libre de agregar chispas, macarons, dulces de Halloween, un chorrito de chocolate amargo, pan de oro comestible o trozos de frambuesa liofilizados: ¡ve a la ciudad con lo que tienes! Recomendamos comerlo el mismo día, pero se conservará durante un día en el refrigerador."]','2026-01-11 12:57:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13382,9285,'es','monstruos de merengue','Crea un conjunto colorido y creativo de monstruos de merengue para completar tu fiesta de Halloween. Mezcla colores y diseños para hacer diferentes diseños.','["500 g de azúcar en polvo","250 g de claras de huevo camperas","1 cucharadita de cremor tártaro","colorante alimentario verde y morado (el colorante alimentario natural PME funciona bien)","3 mangas pasteleras","100 g de glaseado real (preparado siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete)","colorante alimentario en gel negro"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner el azúcar en polvo en una bandeja para hornear pequeña forrada con papel para hornear. Agite para nivelar el azúcar y caliente en el horno durante unos 5 minutos hasta que esté caliente pero sin derretirse. Esto ayuda a estabilizar las claras y da un merengue suave y brillante.","Ponga las claras de huevo y el crémor tártaro en el bol de una batidora. Batir lentamente al principio, aumentando gradualmente la velocidad hasta que las claras estén en la etapa de punto máximo, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Es importante no batir demasiado las claras. Retirar el azúcar del horno en cuanto las claras estén firmes.","Baje el horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼, dejando la puerta entreabierta para que se enfríe rápidamente; los merengues deben hornearse a una temperatura más baja.","Sube la batidora a máxima velocidad y empieza a añadir el azúcar una cucharada a la vez. Quieres que las claras mantengan su volumen mientras sigues agregando azúcar, así que si ves que comienza a colapsar, deja de agregar azúcar y deja que la mezcla se endurezca y suba antes de agregar el resto, una cucharada a la vez.","Una vez agregada toda el azúcar, sigue batiendo hasta obtener una mezcla firme y brillante. Está listo para usar cuando mantiene su forma, aproximadamente de 2 a 5 minutos después de agregar lo último del azúcar. También deberías poder ver picos en la mezcla a medida que retiras y giras el batidor.","Para agregar color a tus monstruos, necesitarás pintar tus mangas pasteleras. Esta mezcla será suficiente para dos mangas pasteleras, una verde y otra morada, pero siéntete libre de elegir tus propios colores de monstruo e incluso mezclarlos pintando rayas. Dale la vuelta a tus mangas pasteleras. Coloca las bolsas sobre jarras o botellas para que se sostengan solas. Pinte una capa gruesa de colorante alimentario desde la punta de la manga pastelera hasta la mitad de la bolsa. Invierta las bolsas, luego coloque con cuidado el merengue en mangas pasteleras; un lote debe llenar dos bolsas, agitando la mezcla hasta el fondo de la bolsa. Intente deshacerse de las burbujas de aire grandes que pueda ver en esta etapa, pero no sea demasiado brusco con la mezcla.","Corta un poco de papel para hornear del tamaño de tus bandejas para hornear. Corta la pulgada inferior de la manga pastelera (aproximadamente un agujero del tamaño de 50p) y exprime pequeñas porciones en la esquina de las bandejas para hornear para pegar el pergamino.","Sostenga la manga pastelera con ambas manos, colocando su mano dominante en la parte superior de la bolsa y la otra en la mitad de la bolsa. Sostén la bolsa con firmeza, unos 2 cm por encima de la bandeja y aprieta la bolsa desde arriba para empezar a formar el cuerpo de tus monstruos. Deja de apretar una vez que el merengue llegue a la bandeja. Levantar un poco la manga pastelera sin crear una separación entre el merengue de la bandeja y el merengue que queda en la manga pastelera. Vuelve a dejar caer la bolsa y aprieta suavemente para formar la parte superior del cuerpo del monstruo.","Repita hasta que haya canalizado toda la mezcla, trabajando rápidamente ya que la mezcla se aflojará con el tiempo. Hornee durante 40-50 minutos hasta que esté crujiente por fuera y suave por dentro. Dejar enfriar en las bandejas para horno.","Si quieres hacer tus propios ojos saltones, hazlo al menos con 24 horas de anticipación. Prepare 100 g de glaseado real rígido y coloree una cuarta parte de este negro con colorante en gel negro. Coloque el glaseado blanco y negro en dos mangas pasteleras separadas. Usa unas tijeras para hacer un pequeño agujero en la punta. Coloque con cuidado los puntos blancos en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino y luego déjelos reposar. Una vez seco, utiliza el glaseado negro para las pupilas. Coloca ojos de diferentes formas: algunos grandes, otros pequeños o quizás tres contiguos. Déjelos reposar durante la noche hasta que se despeguen fácilmente del papel para hornear. Use más glaseado para pegar los ojos a los merengues. Una vez listo, se mantendrá durante dos semanas en un lugar fresco y seco en un recipiente sin tapar."]','2026-01-11 12:57:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13383,9286,'es','brownies de halloween','Olvídese de los paquetes de dulces: si quiere un verdadero placer en Halloween, estos deliciosos y espeluznantes brownies serán la solución. Tanto a niños como a adultos les encantarán.','["200 g de mantequilla","200 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos grandes","4 huevos grandes","350 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de harina común","cacao en polvo","chocolate con leche, picado","chocolate blanco, picado","galletas sándwich de chocolate rellenas de crema","chocolates recubiertos de azúcar","bolígrafos de glaseado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para brownie de 24 x 20 cm con papel para hornear. Derrita la mantequilla y el chocolate amargo en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola pequeña con agua hirviendo. Revuelva hasta que esté completamente suave y luego déjelo enfriar durante 10 minutos.","Batir los huevos y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén espesos y pálidos; la mezcla debe duplicar su volumen y dejar un rastro cuando se levantan las batidoras. Vierta la mezcla de chocolate amargo enfriada alrededor del borde del tazón. Tamizar sobre la harina y el cacao, añadir el chocolate con leche y mezclar todo suavemente con una espátula o una cuchara grande de metal. Vierta en el molde preparado y hornee durante 35-40 minutos.","Mientras tanto, haz los ''globos oculares''. Derrita el chocolate blanco en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre la cacerola con agua hirviendo. Revuelva hasta que quede suave. Sumerge cada galleta en el chocolate para cubrir un lado. Pegue un chocolate recubierto de azúcar en el centro de cada uno y déjelo reposar. Cuando el chocolate esté completamente seco, coloca una pupila y venas rojas en cada globo ocular usando los rotuladores para glaseado.","Retire la bandeja para hornear del horno e inmediatamente empuje los globos oculares hacia la superficie en filas iguales; hágalo con cuidado, de modo que queden ligeramente empujados hacia adentro. Dejar enfriar por completo. Cortar en 12 cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 12:57:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13384,9287,'es','Pastel de Halloween','¿Qué dice mejor ''fiesta de Halloween'' que este pastel? Glaseado de fondant, mermelada de fresa y colorante rojo son los secretos detrás de la cobertura y el relleno de ''sangre''','["140 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco más para la lata","100 ml de aceite de semilla de uva u otro aceite sin sabor","200ml de leche","3 cucharadas de yogur","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","250 g de azúcar mascabado light","250 g de harina común","3 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","50 g de cacao en polvo","¾ x 340g tarro mermelada de fresa","1¼ kg de glaseado de fondant blanco listo para enrollar","600 g de azúcar glas tamizada y un poco más para espolvorear","300 g de mantequilla blanda","colorante alimentario rojo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar las bases de dos moldes para sándwich de 20 cm. Derretir la mantequilla en una sartén, luego retirar del fuego y agregar el aceite, la leche, el yogur, la vainilla y los huevos. Batir los ingredientes secos junto con una pizca grande de sal, aplastando los grumos de azúcar con los dedos. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos sobre los secos, luego bata hasta que quede suave.","Divida la masa entre los moldes y hornee durante 25-30 minutos en el mismo estante del horno hasta que suba y al insertar un pincho en el medio salga limpio. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos en las latas, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer la crema de mantequilla, bata el azúcar, la mantequilla y unas gotas de colorante rojo. Agregue 2-3 cucharadas de agua hirviendo si es necesario para suavizar la mezcla, hasta obtener un glaseado suave y untable.","Recorte los pasteles si es necesario, luego córtelos por la mitad con un cuchillo de sierra grande. Coloque una capa de pastel en una tabla o plato, extiéndala sobre una fina capa de crema de mantequilla y salpique sobre un tercio de la mermelada. Cubra con otra capa de bizcocho y repita con la crema de mantequilla, la mermelada y el bizcocho, terminando con una capa de bizcocho. Utilice la mayor parte de la crema de mantequilla restante para glasear todo el pastel, reservando una pequeña cantidad.","Extienda el glaseado de fondant sobre una superficie espolvoreada con azúcar glas hasta que quede lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir la parte superior y los lados del pastel. Levántelo con cuidado sobre el pastel y alíselo para que se pegue. Use un cuchillo afilado para hacer cortes en el glaseado, luego rocíe un poco de la crema de mantequilla reservada mezclada con un poco de agua en cada uno para que parezca sangre."]','2026-01-11 12:57:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13385,9288,'es','pastel fantasma','Vuélvete estacional y espeluznante con este simple pero efectivo pastel de fantasmas: el horneado perfecto para una fiesta de Halloween con amigos.','["300 ml de aceite de colza y más para las latas","325 g de harina con levadura","5 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","300 g de azúcar en polvo","4 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","4 huevos grandes, batidos","300ml de leche","750 g de glaseado de fondant blanco","colorante alimentario negro (o glaseado de fondant negro)","100 g de mantequilla, muy blanda","225 g de azúcar glas y algo más para espolvorear","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar la base de dos moldes para sándwich de 16 cm (o más pequeños) y un recipiente para pudín de 1,2 L. Mezclar en un bol la harina con levadura, el cacao en polvo, el bicarbonato de sodio y el azúcar. Haga un hueco en el centro y agregue el almíbar dorado, los huevos, el aceite y la leche con una batidora eléctrica, hasta que quede suave.","Vierta la mezcla en el recipiente para pudín hasta que esté lleno hasta ¾, luego divida el resto entre los dos moldes para sándwich y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que los pasteles hayan subido y estén firmes al tacto. La esponja en el recipiente para pudín puede necesitar más tiempo dependiendo de si el recipiente es de metal o de cerámica. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos antes de colocarlo sobre una rejilla para enfriar y dejar enfriar por completo.","Mientras tanto, para hacer el glaseado, bata la mantequilla hasta que esté cremosa, agregue el azúcar glas poco a poco, agregue el cacao en polvo y 2 cucharadas de agua.","Corta el bizcocho de pudín por la mitad horizontalmente y vuelve a unirlo con un poco de glaseado. Poner un bizcocho redondo sobre una tabla o plato para tartas, emparedar el siguiente encima con un poco de glaseado. Coloque el bizcocho de pudín sobre la parte superior del bizcocho redondo. Si el pastel inferior sobresale más allá del fondo del pastel de pudín, recorte el borde superior del pastel inferior en ángulo para que los lados queden más planos. Hielo el exterior del pastel con una fina capa de glaseado de chocolate, usándolo todo.","Extienda el fondant sobre una superficie espolvoreada con azúcar glas para formar una hoja que sea lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir todo el pastel. Colóquelo con cuidado sobre el pastel helado y presiónelo alrededor de la parte superior para hacer su fantasma, con volantes alrededor de los bordes, cortando el exceso alrededor de la base. Colorea parte del exceso de glaseado de negro amasando con colorante alimentario o utiliza el glaseado de fondant negro. Extiéndalo hasta que tenga unos pocos mm de espesor. Recorta unos ojos y una boca y pégalos."]','2026-01-11 12:57:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13386,9289,'es','Pastel de calabaza y caramelo','Este pastel utiliza algunos atajos, pero el resultado final es un delicioso e impresionante bizcocho relleno de dulce de leche y calabaza.','["80ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para engrasar","Paquete de 450 g de mezcla para pastel de vainilla o blanca (o haga su propia mezcla para pastel, consulte el consejo a continuación)","½ lata de 425 g de puré de calabaza","125 ml de leche entera","4 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de especias para pastel de calabaza (disponibles en uk.iherb.com, o mézclelas usted mismo combinando ½ cucharadita de canela molida, ¼ cucharadita de jengibre molido, ¼ cucharadita de nuez moscada y una pizca de clavo molido)","4 cucharadas de dulce de leche de un frasco","225 g de queso crema entero","125 g de azúcar glas tamizada","1 cucharadita de especias para pastel de calabaza","½ lata de 425 g de puré de calabaza","440ml de nata doble","70 g de nueces pecanas, tostadas y picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar las bases de dos moldes para pasteles de 23 cm. En un tazón grande, bata el aceite, la mezcla para pastel, el puré de calabaza, la leche, los huevos y la mezcla de especias hasta que quede suave. Vierta la mezcla en los moldes para pastel y hornee durante 22-25 minutos hasta que al insertar un palillo en el centro, éste salga limpio. Déjalo enfriar en los moldes mientras haces el relleno.","Batir brevemente el queso crema en un tazón mediano hasta que quede esponjoso, luego agregar el azúcar glas, las especias y el puré de calabaza y batir hasta que quede suave. Tenga cuidado de no batir demasiado o se pondrá líquido. En otro bol, bata la nata e incorpórela suavemente a la mezcla de queso crema.","Cuando los pasteles estén fríos, córtalos por la mitad horizontalmente para tener cuatro bizcochos finos. Coloque la capa inferior en un plato, unte con 1 cucharada de dulce de leche y luego alise una cuarta parte del relleno. Agrega la siguiente capa y repite hasta obtener una increíble torre de calabaza, pastel, caramelo y crema, luego espolvorea las nueces encima. Auge."]','2026-01-11 12:57:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13387,9290,'es','Pastel de tela de araña','Glaseado de crema de mantequilla de merengue suizo transformado en un espeluznante espectáculo de Halloween: este rico bizcocho de chocolate será el invitado de honor en cualquier fiesta de Halloween.','["110 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco para engrasar","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","140 ml de cerveza negra de chocolate (usamos Young''s Double Chocolate Stout, disponible en Tesco)","170 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","170 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos","100 g de chocolate negro, derretido y enfriado","280 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","3 claras de huevo grandes","240 g de azúcar en polvo","360 g de mantequilla sin sal, temperatura ambiente","200 g de chocolate blanco, derretido y enfriado","100 g de mini malvaviscos blancos","25 g de pasta de azúcar negra"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar tres moldes para pasteles redondos de 20 cm y forrar las bases con papel para hornear. Para hacer el bizcocho, poner el cacao en un bol, añadir 280ml de agua hirviendo y batir hasta que se disuelva. Vierta la cerveza negra, mezcle y deje enfriar.","En una batidora de pie o en un tazón grande con un batidor de mano eléctrico, bata la mantequilla, los azúcares y el extracto de vainilla hasta que esté suave y esponjoso (aproximadamente 5 minutos). Agrega los huevos poco a poco, mezclando hasta que estén completamente incorporados antes de agregar más. Una vez que se haya agregado todo el huevo, agregue el chocolate derretido y mezcle para combinar.","En otro bol mezcla la harina, el bicarbonato y 1/2 cucharadita de sal. Agrega esta mezcla a la mezcla de mantequilla en tres etapas, alternando con la mezcla fuerte (que quedará muy líquida). Vierta la masa en partes iguales entre los moldes preparados y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el pastel, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer la crema de mantequilla, ponga las claras de huevo y el azúcar en un recipiente resistente al calor y colóquelo sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento. Remueve con un batidor hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto y la mezcla esté tibia al tacto. Retiramos el bol del fuego y batimos con unas varillas eléctricas a velocidad alta hasta que la mezcla haya triplicado su volumen y se haya enfriado. Agregue lentamente la mantequilla 1 cucharada a la vez mientras continúa batiendo. Una vez que se haya agregado toda la mantequilla, la mezcla debe verse brillante y espesa; si no es así, siga batiendo hasta que lo haga, o si el tazón aún se siente caliente, enfríe durante 10 minutos antes de volver a batir. Una vez listo, incorpora el chocolate blanco derretido.","Para armar el pastel, coloque una de las capas de pastel en un soporte para pasteles y cubra con una capa de crema de mantequilla. Repita con las otras dos capas. Extienda la crema de mantequilla restante por todo el pastel, usando una espátula o espátula para alisar los lados. Enfríe durante 1 hora o hasta que la crema de mantequilla esté firme (consulte el consejo a continuación).","Para decorar, derrita los malvaviscos en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, revolviendo de vez en cuando. Retirar del fuego y dejar a un lado durante unos minutos hasta que la mezcla esté lo suficientemente fría como para manipularla. Use sus dedos para tomar una pequeña cantidad de malvavisco y estírelo para formar hebras largas (¡mojar los dedos en aceite vegetal o de girasol ayudará!). Coloque las hebras sobre el pastel en un patrón aleatorio, para que quede completamente cubierto. Crea una araña con la pasta de azúcar (enrolla dos bolas, una más grande que la otra, para el cuerpo y hebras finas para las patas) y colócala encima del bizcocho. Se conservará hasta por tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:57:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13388,9291,'es','pastelitos frankenstein','Crea tus propios monstruos este Halloween con nuestra sencilla receta para hornear: decora con glaseado verde y negro y mini malvaviscos.','["200 g de mantequilla blanda","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","¼ cucharadita de sal","¿3 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente?","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100ml de leche, a temperatura ambiente","300 g de azúcar glas tamizada","2-3 cucharadas de leche","¿Pasta colorante alimentario verde (usamos Party Green de Sugarflair)?","36 mini malvaviscos, 12 cortados por la mitad (para los ojos)","tubo de glaseado o gel negro"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre un molde para muffins de 12 orificios con moldes hondos para muffins. Batir la mantequilla con el azúcar hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Agrega los ingredientes restantes del pastel y bate hasta que quede suave. Vierta en los moldes para muffins y hornee por 20 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y al insertar una brocheta en uno de los pasteles del medio, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos en el molde y luego completamente sobre una rejilla.","Con un cuchillo de sierra pequeño y afilado, corte un trozo de pastel en forma de semicírculo a la izquierda y a la derecha de cada pastel, para hacer bordes escalonados, al nivel de la base del cupcake. A continuación, ¿hacer? un corte ancho a unos 3 cm de la parte superior del pastel, aproximadamente 1 cm de profundidad. Corta un trozo de 5 mm de la superficie del pastel para encontrar este corte, para hacer una cara plana y elevada y una frente prominente. Enfríe durante 10 minutos para que las migas se endurezcan.","Mezclar el azúcar glas, la leche y el colorante verde hasta obtener un glaseado muy espeso que fluye lentamente de la cuchara. Vierta 1 cucharada sobre un pastel y deje que comience a extenderse sobre la forma cortada. Fíjelo aquí y allá con una espátula para cubrir. Agregue tornillos y ojos de cuello de malvavisco. Repita para cada cupcake. Deje reposar y luego aplique la aplicación sobre la cara y el cabello."]','2026-01-11 12:57:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13389,9292,'es','Pastel de terciopelo rojo con dedos extraños','Aterroriza y deleita este Halloween con un espectacular pastel de chocolate de terciopelo rojo, acompañado de un fácil glaseado de queso crema.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco para engrasar","225 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","1 cucharada de pasta colorante alimentario rojo (usamos rojo navideño de Sugarflair)","200 g de harina común","50 g de cacao en polvo (nosotros usamos Green & Black''s)","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio?","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","¼ cucharadita de sal","150 g de yogur natural bajo en grasa, disuelto con 2 cucharadas de leche","unas 3 cajas de 114 g de dedos de chocolate blanco (los encontramos en Tesco)","140 g de azúcar glas","2 cucharaditas de leche","pequeña gota de pasta colorante rojo para alimentos","100 g de mantequilla blanda","300 g de queso crema entero, frigorífico frío (nosotros utilizamos Philadelphia porque tiene la textura más firme)","ralladura de 1 naranja (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Para el bizcocho, engrasar 2 moldes para sándwich de 20 cm y forrar las bases con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y la vainilla, luego agregar los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada huevo, hasta que quede esponjoso y ligero. Batir el colorante.","Mezclar los ingredientes secos para el bizcocho y tamizar la mitad sobre la mezcla de crema. Doblar con una espátula y luego la mitad del yogur diluido. Repita, luego vierta la masa suave en los moldes y nivele. Hornee durante 25 minutos o hasta que haya subido y esté elástico cuando se presione ligeramente en el centro. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos, luego colóquelo sobre una rejilla y déjelo enfriar por completo.","Para los dedos, forre una bandeja para hornear con papel pergamino. Corta un extremo de cada dedo de chocolate. Mezcle 50 g de azúcar glas, la leche y una pequeña gota de colorante para obtener un glaseado rojo espeso. El glaseado debe ser espeso para que se mantenga firme; agregue un poco más de azúcar si es necesario. Sumerja los extremos cortados de la galleta en el glaseado, deje que escurra el exceso y luego pinte una uña roja en el otro extremo con un pincel pequeño. Dejar secar sobre el pergamino.","Para el glaseado, use una batidora eléctrica para batir bien la mantequilla hasta que quede muy suave, luego agregue el queso crema y la ralladura (si la usa) hasta que quede uniforme. Tamice el azúcar glas restante y luego incorpórelo a la mezcla de queso con una espátula hasta que quede suave. No exageres. Enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","¿Sandwich y cubrir la parte superior y los lados? del pastel con el glaseado; solo necesitarás una capa delgada en los lados del pastel para pegar los dedos de chocolate. Coloque los dedos cortados alrededor del pastel formando un collar limpio, presionándolos ligeramente contra el glaseado. Te sobrarán unos cuantos para poner encima. Guarda el bizcocho en el frigorífico pero disfrútalo a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 12:57:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13390,9293,'es','Pastel de cementerio embrujado','La pieza central perfecta para una celebración de Halloween, este pastel seguramente hará que tu fiesta sea aún más espeluznante.','["1 clara de huevo","50 g de azúcar glas","200ml de nata líquida","200 g de chocolate negro, finamente picado","125 g de ricas galletas de té","100 g de galletas doble chocolate","25 gramos de chocolate blanco","bolitas plateadas, para decorar","85 g de cacao en polvo","200 g de harina con levadura","375 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","4 huevos","200ml de leche","175 ml de aceite vegetal"]','["Para hacer los fantasmas, calentar el horno a\r\n110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼. batir el huevo\r\nblanco en un recipiente limpio hasta obtener picos rígidos\r\nforma. Incorpora el azúcar una cucharada a la vez.\r\ny seguir batiendo durante un par de minutos.\r\nhasta que la mezcla esté espesa y parezca\r\nespuma de afeitar. Vierta suavemente la mezcla\r\nen una bolsa grande para congelar, luego corte un trozo de 1,5 cm\r\nagujero en una de las esquinas. Cubrir una hornada\r\nhoja con un poco de papel para hornear.\r\nApriete con cuidado un pequeño círculo de\r\nSaque la clara de huevo batida de la bolsa, sacando\r\nhacia arriba como lo haces para hacer un fantasma\r\nforma. Repetir hasta utilizar la mezcla.\r\narriba: deberías obtener unos 15 fantasmas.\r\nHornee durante 1½ horas hasta que esté crujiente. Se puede almacenar\r\nen un recipiente hermético por hasta 2 días.","Ahora haz el pastel. Calentar el horno a\r\n180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Inclinar el cacao\r\npolvo, harina con levadura y azúcar\r\nen un tazón grande, rompiendo cualquier\r\nterrones de azúcar. Mezclar los huevos,\r\nleche y aceite en una taza o tazón medidor,\r\nluego vierta sobre los ingredientes secos y\r\nrevuelva todo hasta que quede suave.\r\nEngrasar y forrar una fuente para horno honda.\r\n(20 x 30 x 5 cm) con papel para hornear.\r\nVierta la mezcla del pastel y hornee por\r\n30 minutos. Dejar enfriar y luego desmoldar.\r\nen un plato para servir. Alternativamente, envuelva\r\nbien y guárdelo por hasta 2 días.","Terminar de decorar la tarta: calentar la nata\r\nen una cacerola hasta que hierva. Coloque el\r\nchocolate amargo en un tazón grande y\r\nverter sobre la nata caliente. Revuelva hasta que\r\nel chocolate se derrite. Utilice un cepillo limpio para\r\npintar una capa de chocolate sobre 7 ricos\r\ngalletas de té y luego déjelas enfriar.\r\nVierte el resto de la mezcla de chocolate.\r\nsobre el bizcocho y alisar con un\r\ncuchillo. Batir las galletas de chocolate, o\r\ngolpear en una bolsa para congelador con un rodillo,\r\nhasta que se formen pequeñas migajas. espolvorear\r\nla parte superior del pastel.","Coloca el chocolate blanco en un pequeño\r\ntazón, colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo.\r\nDejar actuar 5 minutos o hasta que se derrita, luego\r\nVierta en una bolsa pequeña para congelador. Esperar\r\n10 minutos para que la mezcla no quede muy líquida,\r\nluego corte un pequeño agujero en una esquina del\r\nbolsa. Coloque 2 gotas pequeñas en cada una.\r\nfantasma, coloca una bola plateada en cada uno para hacer\r\nojos, luego diga las palabras adecuadas y\r\nformas en las lápidas. dejar para\r\n30 minutos para que cuaje, luego empuja la galleta.\r\nlápidas en el pastel y organizar\r\nlos fantasmas alrededor. Para hacer que los fantasmas\r\n''volar'', empuja un cable delgado (puedes conseguir estos\r\nen una floristería – recuerde\r\nretirar antes de comer) en el fondo del\r\nel fantasma, luego colóquelo en el pastel, escondiéndolo\r\nEl alambre detrás de una lápida."]','2026-01-11 12:57:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13391,9294,'es','Espeluznantes estallidos de globos oculares','Estas espeluznantes bolas de pastel de chocolate serán un éxito entre los niños en Halloween; también pueden ayudar a decorarlas','["100 g de tarta de Madeira","100 gramos de galletas Oreo","100 g de barra de chocolate con leche, derretido","200 g de barra de chocolate blanco, derretido","unos Smarties y bolígrafos de glaseado, para decorar","10 brochetas de madera","½ calabaza pequeña\n o calabaza, sin semillas, para reposar las paletas"]','["Romper el pastel de Madeira y las galletas.\r\nen el recipiente de un procesador de alimentos,\r\nvierta el chocolate con leche derretido\r\ny combine con rapidez.","Vierta la mezcla en un bol, luego\r\nuse sus manos para rodar aproximadamente\r\n10 bolitas del tamaño de una nuez. Enfriar durante 2 horas\r\nhasta que esté bien firme.","Introduce una brocheta en cada bola y luego\r\nvierta con cuidado el chocolate blanco\r\nsobre las bolas de pastel hasta cubrirlas por completo.\r\nColoca los cake pops en la calabaza,\r\nluego presione un Smartie sobre la superficie\r\nmientras está mojado. Enfriar nuevamente hasta que el chocolate\r\nha fijado. Antes de servir, utilizar el glaseado.\r\nbolígrafos, añade un alumno a cada Smartie y\r\nondulantes venas rojas en los globos oculares."]','2026-01-11 12:57:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13392,9295,'es','Búhos de Halloween ululando','Deliciosos y sencillos bizcochos de chocolate para hacer con los niños en Halloween: verdaderos placeres para el público','["280 g de mantequilla, blanda","280 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de harina con levadura, menos 1 cucharada colmada","1 cucharada colmada de cacao en polvo","6 huevos medianos","200 g de mantequilla, ablandada","280 g de azúcar glas tamizada","1 tubo de glaseado de naranja listo para usar","1 bolsa pequeña de Maltesers","1 tubo de choco M&Ms minis (use solo los dulces marrones) o mini botones de Cadbury","1 tarrina de diamantes de gelatina (solo los naranjas)"]','["Caliente el horno a 190 ° C / ventilador 170 ° C / gas 5. Forre un molde para muffins de 12 tazas con cajas marrones para muffins. Batir los primeros 5 ingredientes hasta obtener una masa suave y colocar entre las cajas, casi llenándolas hasta arriba. Quizás te sobra un poco. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que haya subido y esté esponjoso. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar glas hasta que quede suave. Corta la parte superior de los pasteles y corta cada trozo por la mitad. Extienda una generosa capa de glaseado sobre cada pastel.","Trabajando en un pastel a la vez, rocía una gota de glaseado de naranja del tamaño de un guisante sobre dos Maltesers y úsalo para fijar un M&M marrón en cada uno. Coloque los ojos, dos trozos de pastel (con el borde curvado hacia arriba) y un diamante de gelatina sobre el glaseado para hacer un búho."]','2026-01-11 12:57:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13393,9296,'es','Pasteles de araña espeluznantes','Los niños se divertirán mucho decorándolos en las fiestas de Halloween.','["200 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de harina con levadura","4 huevos","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","6 cucharadas de chispas de chocolate o chocolate picado","2 paquetes de ruedas Catherine de regaliz","12 cucharadas de Nutella u otra crema de chocolate","regaliz de todo tipo (los negros con el centro blanco)","tubo negro escritura glaseado","1 cordón rojo largo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4 y\r\nforrar un molde para muffins con 12 cajas, preferiblemente\r\nlos marrones. Poner la mantequilla, el azúcar y la harina.\r\nen un tazón para mezclar. Rompe los huevos en un\r\ntazón más pequeño, con cuidado de que no se le caiga ninguna cáscara\r\nen él, luego vierta encima de la mezcla de mantequilla.","Agrega el polvo para hornear y la vainilla a la\r\ntazón más grande, luego batir con una mano eléctrica\r\nbatir hasta que quede suave y cremoso. Agregue el\r\ngotas de chocolate o chocolate. Cuchara el\r\nmezcla de pastel uniformemente en las cajas y hornee\r\ndurante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado – un palito de cóctel\r\nempujado en medio de uno de los pasteles\r\ndebe salir limpio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Para decorar las tartas, desenredar el regaliz\r\nruedas y cortar en trozos con tijeras\r\npara hacer piernas colgantes. Pegue 8 en la parte superior de\r\ncada bizcocho, realizando pequeños cortes con la punta de\r\nun cuchillo afilado para que se introduzcan con mucha seguridad.","Coloque encima la crema de chocolate y\r\nesparcir ligeramente entre las patas de regaliz para\r\nHaz un cuerpo de araña redondo. Ahora corta el\r\nTodo tipo de cosas para hacer los ojos y los cordones rojos.\r\npara hacer bocas, luego pégalas en el\r\npasteles y puntee el glaseado para hacer globos oculares.\r\nSe conservará hasta por 2 días en un lugar fresco."]','2026-01-11 12:57:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13394,9297,'es','Muffins de dulce de chocolate con tela de araña','Pasteles de chocolate especiales de Halloween para los afortunados que hacen truco o trato: puedes prepararlos con anticipación y congelarlos','["50 g de chocolate negro (55% de cacao está bien)","85 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de leche, agua o café","200 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","85 g de azúcar mascabado light","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo","Caja de 142 ml de crema agria","100 g de chocolate negro (como arriba)","100 gramos de chocolate blanco"]','["Precalienta el horno a temperatura ventilada 170C/\r\nconvencional 190C/gas 5 y línea a\r\nMolde para muffins con 10 cajas de papel para muffins.\r\nRompe el chocolate en una fuente resistente al calor.\r\nEn un bol, añade la mantequilla y el líquido. derretir\r\nen el microondas a temperatura media durante 30 a 45 segundos (o coloque el tazón sobre una \r\ncacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento). Revuelva\r\ny dejar enfriar la mezcla.","Mezclar la harina, el bicarbonato de sodio.\r\ny ambos azúcares en un bol. Vencer el\r\nhuevo en otro tazón y agregue el\r\ncrema agria, luego viértala sobre el\r\nmezcla de harina y agregue lo enfriado\r\nchocolate. Revuelva solo para combinar –\r\nno mezcle demasiado o se pondrá duro.","Vierta la mezcla en las cajas para\r\naproximadamente tres cuartas partes de su capacidad. Hornear por 20\r\nminutos hasta que haya subido bien. Afloje el\r\nbordes con un cuchillo de hoja redonda, deje\r\nreposan en las latas durante unos minutos,\r\nluego sáquelo y déjelo enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Para la cobertura, haz dos ribetes.\r\nbolsas de papel vegetal (o\r\ncorta los extremos de dos plásticos limpios\r\nbolsas). Rompe el blanco y la oscuridad\r\nchocolate en tazones separados y\r\nDerretir en el microondas a temperatura media durante\r\n2 minutos (o sobre una sartén como en el paso 1).\r\nPon 2 cucharadas de chocolate amargo en\r\nuna bolsa y la misma de color blanco\r\nchocolate en el otro.","Trabajando con un panecillo a la vez,\r\nuntar con chocolate amargo de la\r\nbol, dejándolo escurrir un poco y luego\r\ntubo cuatro círculos concéntricos de color blanco\r\nchocolate encima. Usando un pequeño\r\nbrocheta, arrastre a través de los círculos en\r\nintervalos regulares, desde el centro hacia\r\nel borde, para crear un efecto de telaraña.\r\nRepita con cuatro muffins más. encendido\r\nlos cinco restantes, repartidos por el\r\nchocolate blanco y decorar con\r\nla oscuridad. Es mejor comerlos el día que se\r\nhecho – incluso mejor mientras el\r\nel chocolate es suave."]','2026-01-11 12:57:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13395,9298,'es','Fantasmas de malvavisco','Hechos con malvaviscos derretidos, estos pequeños y espeluznantes pasteles de Halloween son masticables y crujientes.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco más para la lata","300 g de malvaviscos rosados ​​y blancos","200 g de cereal de arroz (prueba Rice Krispies)","300 g de chocolate blanco, derretido, para cubrir","un poco de chocolate simple derretido o glaseado de escritura negro, para decorar","palitos de paleta de madera o agitadores de café (los agitadores son un poco más flexibles)"]','["Untar con mantequilla y forrar un panecillo suizo de 30 x 20 cm.\r\nlata con papel para hornear. Derretir el\r\nmantequilla en una cacerola antiadherente grande.\r\nVierta los malvaviscos y luego derrítalos muy.\r\nsuavemente durante unos 10 minutos, revolviendo regularmente\r\npara asegurarse de que no se peguen.","Una vez que esté suave, agregue el cereal hasta que esté todo\r\nde los granos están recubiertos. Vierta la mezcla\r\nen la lata, luego presione hacia abajo para hacer\r\nquede plano y liso. Enfríe hasta que se enfríe y cuaje.\r\nSe puede realizar con hasta 2 días de anticipación.","Haz que el fantasma tenga formas de dos maneras.\r\nCorta el pastel en rectángulos y luego úsalo.\r\nun cuchillo afilado para redondear la parte superior y\r\nHaga zigzag en la parte inferior. O, para hacer volar\r\nfantasmas, elimine círculos de unos 9 cm\r\na lo ancho y use un cuchillo afilado para dividir\r\nen fantasmas con forma de lágrima. Cortar piezas\r\nde bizcocho sobrante para hacer brazos, si gustas.","Introduzca con cuidado un palito de polo en el\r\nparte inferior de cada fantasma. Poner a enfriar\r\nestante. Si has hecho brazos, pégalos.\r\nusando un poco de chocolate blanco, luego con una cuchara\r\nsobre más chocolate y pintarlo\r\ny por los costados de los fantasmas con un\r\nbrocha de repostería. Dejar reposar. pipa en los ojos\r\ncon chocolate natural o glaseado."]','2026-01-11 12:57:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13396,9299,'es','Cuadrados aprensivos','Serán un gran éxito en Halloween: pegajosos, crujientes y masticables de un solo bocado.','["150 g de chocolate amargo, partido en trozos (un 70 % de sólidos de cacao es bueno)","100 g de mantequilla sin sal","4 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","100 g de cereal Rice Krispies","50 g de arándanos secos","50 g de arándanos secos","100 g de mini malvaviscos","50 g de chocolate blanco partido en trozos","culebras y chinches de gelatina, para decorar"]','["Forrar un molde cuadrado de 20 cm con horno.\r\npergamino o film transparente. Coloca la oscuridad\r\nel chocolate, la mantequilla y el almíbar dorado en una sartén a fuego lento y revuelva hasta que se derrita.","Ponga los Rice Krispies en un bol grande y\r\nmezcle los arándanos, los arándanos y\r\nmalvaviscos. Agregue el chocolate derretido\r\nmezcla hasta que todo esté bien cubierto. Cuchara\r\nla mezcla en el molde y extender\r\nuniformemente. Enfriar en la nevera durante una hora hasta que cuaje\r\n(o preparar el día anterior y dejar enfriar durante la noche).","Retirar del molde y retirar el papel.\r\no film transparente. Con un cuchillo afilado, córtelo en\r\n16 cuadrados o 32 trozos pequeños. Derretir el\r\nchocolate blanco en un tazón pequeño sobre una sartén\r\nde agua apenas hirviendo, o en el\r\nCocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 1 minuto, revolviendo.\r\na mitad de camino. Usando una cucharadita, rocíe el\r\nchocolate blanco sobre los cuadritos. dispersión\r\ncon los dulces de gelatina, luego dejar reposar\r\nantes de apilarlos en un plato para servir.\r\nGuárdelo en un recipiente hermético por hasta 2 días."]','2026-01-11 12:57:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13397,6159,'es','Bizcocho de frutas','La lectora Sue McGann ideó esta deliciosa receta de pastel bajo en grasa','["mantequilla o aceite, para engrasar","50 g de harina común","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","4 huevos, separados","175 g de azúcar en polvo","Lata de 295 g de gajos de mandarina, escurridos","Tarrina de 200g de queso fresco desnatado","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4.\r\nEngrase y luego forre la base y los lados de 2 x\r\nMoldes para sándwich de 20 cm con papel vegetal.\r\nTamizar las harinas y el polvo para hornear juntos.","Utilice batidores de mano eléctricos para batir la\r\nclaras de huevo hasta que estén firmes, luego agregue brevemente\r\nazúcar. Batir las yemas rápidamente y luego batir.\r\na los blancos. Incorporar los ingredientes secos.\r\nusando una cuchara grande de metal, luego vierta la\r\nmezcla en las latas y nivela la parte superior. hornear\r\ndurante 18-20 minutos hasta que suba, esté ligeramente dorado y\r\nsale un pincho insertado en el medio\r\nsalir limpio. Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 10 minutos y luego\r\nRetirar con cuidado y dejar enfriar por completo.","Mezclar las mandarinas y el queso fresco.\r\njuntos. Retire el papel vegetal,\r\nemparedar las tortas con la mezcla de mandarina,\r\nluego espolvoree con azúcar glas para servir.\r\nEs mejor comerlo el día de su elaboración."]','2026-01-11 12:57:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13398,9300,'es','Muffins de chocolate con crema de chocolate caliente','Estos clásicos pudines de cacao con salsa de chocolate caliente contienen solo 215 calorías cada uno, y también hay una versión con limón.','["1 cucharada de cacao en polvo","100 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100ml de leche desnatada","1 huevo","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol, más un poco más para engrasar","2 botes de 150 g de natillas bajas en grasa","25 g de chocolate amargo, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 170C/ventilador 150C/gas 5. Untar 6 agujeros de un molde para muffins con una gota de aceite. Tamiza el cacao en un bol grande y luego agrega el resto de los ingredientes secos. Revuelva para combinar, luego haga un hueco en el centro.","Batir la leche, el huevo y el aceite en una jarra, verter en el pozo y luego revolver rápidamente para hacer una masa. Vierta en el molde para muffins, luego hornee por 15 minutos o hasta que haya subido y esté firme al tacto. Calienta la natilla en el microondas según las instrucciones, o en una sartén, luego vierte el chocolate picado y revuelve hasta que quede suave. Coloque los pudines en tazones y vierta la crema pastelera por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:57:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13399,9301,'es','Rollito de mango y maracuyá','No hay necesidad de decir "no" a este rollito de frutas, los bizcochos batidos son famosos por su bajo contenido de grasa, especialmente si usas yogur en lugar de crema.','["3 huevos","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más 1 cucharada","85 g de harina común, tamizada","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear, tamizado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","pulpa de 2 maracuyá grandes y maduras","2 mangos, pelados y cortados en trozos pequeños","250 g de frambuesas congeladas y descongeladas","Tarrina de 200g de yogur griego al 2% o queso fresco muy bajo en grasas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Engrasar\r\ny forrar un molde para panecillos suizos de 30 x 24 cm con antiadherente\r\npapel. Poner los huevos y el azúcar en un\r\ntazón grande y batir con batidoras eléctricas.\r\nhasta que esté espeso y ligero, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Doblar en el\r\nharina y levadura en polvo, luego la vainilla. consejo\r\nen el molde, inclínelo para nivelar la mezcla, luego hornee por\r\n12-15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y elástico. girar\r\nen otra hoja de papel, espolvoreada con\r\n1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo. Enrolla el papel por dentro.\r\nel bizcocho y dejar enfriar por completo.\r\nEl bizcocho se puede congelar hasta por 1 mes.","Incorporar el azúcar, la pulpa de maracuyá y un tercio\r\ndel mango y las frambuesas en el yogur.\r\nDesenrollar el bizcocho, untarlo con el relleno y luego\r\nenrollar. Servir con el resto de la fruta en el\r\nlado. El rollo se puede rellenar y enrollar hasta\r\n2 horas antes de servir y conservar en nevera."]','2026-01-11 12:57:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13400,9302,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: tronco de chocolate','La versión más ligera de esta delicia festiva tan querida conserva toda la riqueza del chocolate.','["1 cucharadita de café instantáneo en gránulos","4 huevos, a temperatura ambiente","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más un poco más para enrollar","50 g de azúcar mascabado light","120 g de harina con levadura","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","50 g de chocolate natural, 70 % de cacao o más, muy finamente picado","250 g de mascarpone ligero","140 g de requesón","50 g de azúcar glas","1 ½ cucharada de cacao en polvo","1 cucharadita de café instantáneo en gránulos","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","ramitas de acebo"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nEngrase ligeramente y forre un rollo suizo de 23 x 32 cm.\r\nlata con papel de horno. Mezclar el café con\r\n1 cucharada de agua tibia. Batir los huevos, ambos.\r\nLos azúcares y el café se mezclan en una\r\ntazón grande para mezclar con batidor eléctrico\r\ndurante unos 8 minutos o hasta que la mezcla esté\r\nespeso y aireado como merengue y sostiene\r\nun rastro cuando levantas los batidores.","Tamizar la harina y el cacao en polvo\r\nla mezcla de huevo esponjosa, luego incorporar muy suavemente\r\nutilizando una cuchara grande de metal. Vierta el\r\nmezcle uniformemente en el molde forrado y\r\nInclínelo con cuidado para que se extienda uniformemente.\r\nsin desinflarse. Utilice un cuchillo si\r\nEs necesario introducirlo muy suavemente en el\r\nesquinas. Hornee durante 12-15 minutos o hasta que\r\nEl pastel se siente esponjoso pero firme al tocarlo.","Coloque una hoja de papel para hornear sobre\r\nsuperficie de trabajo y espolvorear con un poco\r\nazúcar en polvo. Incline la lata al revés\r\nsobre el papel y dejar caer el bizcocho.\r\nRetire con cuidado el papel. enrollar el\r\npastel a lo largo de uno de los cortos\r\nTermina con ayuda del papel, enrollándolo.\r\npor dentro para que no se pegue el bizcocho. Fresco.\r\nEl bizcocho se vuelve aún más húmedo.\r\nsi se deja toda la noche envuelto, luego helado\r\nal día siguiente.","Para el glaseado de chocolate, poner el\r\nchocolate picado en un tazón mediano.\r\nCalienta una cacerola pequeña con agua (hasta un tercio de su capacidad)\r\nhasta que hierva, retirar del fuego,\r\nluego coloque el tazón de chocolate sobre el\r\narriba. Dejar unos minutos fuera del fuego.\r\nhasta que se derrita. Retire el recipiente del\r\nsartén, luego dejar el chocolate hasta que esté\r\nfrío al tacto. Batir el mascarpone\r\ny quark juntos, luego tamizar y agregar\r\nel azúcar glas y el cacao en polvo. Revuelva\r\nen el chocolate derretido enfriado (manteniendo\r\nun par de cucharaditas para rociar), luego\r\nel café mezclado con el extracto de vainilla.","Desenrolle con cuidado el pastel, no\r\nPreocúpese si se agrieta un poco y deseche el\r\npapel. Extender la mitad del glaseado sobre\r\npastel desenrollado, luego vuelva a enrollarlo, terminando\r\ncon la unión debajo. colocar el pastel\r\nen un plato para servir. Agite el resto del\r\nglaseado por todo el pastel para cubrirlo, luego\r\nrocíe sobre el derretido reservado\r\nchocolate. Decorar con una ramita de acebo."]','2026-01-11 12:57:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13401,9303,'es','Pastel de limón y violetas','Un pastel todo en uno simple y dulce, ideal para el Domingo de la Madre','["100 g de mantequilla blanda","175 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos grandes","6 cucharadas de leche","cáscara finamente rallada de 1 limón grande","jugo de 1 limón grande (necesitas 3 cucharadas)","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","bolitas de mimosa y violetas cristalizadas, para decorar"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/Gas 4/horno ventilado 160C.  Unte con mantequilla y cubra la base de un molde oblongo poco profundo (aproximadamente 18x28 cm/7x11 pulgadas) con papel para hornear.  Vierta todos los ingredientes del pastel en un tazón grande y bata durante 2-3 minutos, hasta que la mezcla caiga.\r\nfácilmente de la cuchara.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde y alise la superficie con el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee durante 30-40 minutos, hasta que esté dorado y firme al tacto.  Mientras tanto, preparar el glaseado: batir el zumo de limón y el azúcar, verter la mezcla uniformemente sobre el bizcocho mientras aún esté caliente y dejar enfriar.","Corta el bizcocho en 15 cuadrados. Cubra cada uno con una violeta cristalizada y una bola de mimosa."]','2026-01-11 12:57:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13402,9304,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: pastel de café y nueces','Una versión deliciosa pero más ligera del pastel de nueces y café favorito de la hora del té.','["1 cucharada de café granulado, más 1 cucharadita","225 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de almendras molidas","85 g de azúcar mascabado light","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","25 g de nueces picadas","2 huevos batidos","250 gramos de yogur natural","75 ml de aceite de nuez","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","2 cucharaditas de café granulado","140 g de mascarpone ligero","100 g de requesón","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","140 g de azúcar glas para fondant","1 cucharadita de café granulado","1 cucharada de nueces finamente picadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase y forme una ronda de 20 cm (6 cm\r\nde profundidad) lata de fondo suelto. Para el pastel,\r\nmezclar el café con 2 cucharaditas de agua tibia\r\ny dejar a un lado. Vierta la harina en un recipiente grande\r\ntazón para mezclar. Agregue el polvo para hornear,\r\nalmendras molidas, ambos azúcares (usar\r\ndedos para frotar cualquier grumo del\r\nmoscovado) y nueces, luego hacer\r\nun chapuzón en el centro. Pon los huevos, el yogur,\r\nMezclar el aceite y el café con la salsa y revolver.\r\nla mezcla con una cuchara de madera para\r\ntodo está uniformemente mezclado. Cuchara el\r\nmezcla en el molde, alise la parte superior para\r\nnivelarlo, luego hornear durante 40-45 minutos, o hasta que\r\nuna brocheta insertada en el centro de la\r\nel pastel sale limpio. Deja enfriar el pastel\r\nen la lata brevemente, luego sácala y pélala.\r\nel papel de revestimiento. Dejar enfriar por completo\r\nmientras haces el relleno y el glaseado.","Hacer el almíbar para el relleno: poner el\r\nazúcar en polvo y café en un vaso pequeño,\r\ncacerola de base pesada, luego vierta\r\n3 cucharadas de agua. Calentar suavemente, revolviendo para\r\nayudar a que el azúcar se disuelva. Una vez disuelto,\r\nSube el fuego y luego hierve a fuego rápido.\r\nhervir durante unos 2½-3 minutos hasta que espese\r\ny almibarado. Vierta en un recipiente pequeño resistente al calor.\r\ntazón y dejar enfriar. cuando esta frio\r\nDebe tener la consistencia de melaza.","Mientras tanto, rematar el relleno y\r\nhacer el glaseado. Batir el mascarpone,\r\nquark, azúcar glas y vainilla juntos\r\nhasta que quede suave, luego agregue el café frío\r\nalmíbar. Dejar de lado. Para el glaseado, tamizar el\r\nazúcar glas para fondant en un bol. Mezclar el\r\ncafé con 1 cucharada de agua tibia, revuelva esto\r\nen el azúcar glas para fondant con aproximadamente\r\n1 cucharadita más de agua para obtener una mezcla suave y espesa.\r\npero glaseado untable. Dividir el pastel en\r\n3, luego vuelva a colocar el sándwich junto con\r\nel relleno. Extienda el glaseado por encima,\r\nesparcir sobre las nueces picadas y\r\ndejar reposar. Conservar en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 12:57:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13403,9305,'es','budín de verano','Este pudín británico por excelencia, repleto de jugosas bayas de verano, es mucho más fácil de lo que parece y perfecto para principiantes.','["300 g de fresas","250 g de moras","100 g de grosellas rojas","500 g de frambuesas","O 1¼kg/2lb 12oz de bayas y grosellas mixtas de su elección","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","7 rebanadas de pan blanco del día anterior, de una hogaza cuadrada de corte mediano"]','["Saque los jugos: Lave la fruta y séquela suavemente sobre papel de cocina; mantenga las fresas separadas. Ponga el azúcar y 3 cucharadas de agua en una cacerola grande. Caliente suavemente hasta que el azúcar se disuelva; revuelva unas cuantas veces. Deje hervir durante 1 minuto y luego agregue la fruta (no las fresas). Cocine durante 3 minutos a fuego lento, revolviendo 2-3 veces. La fruta quedará blanda, prácticamente intacta y rodeada de jugo de color rojo oscuro. Coloque un colador sobre un bol y vierta la fruta y el jugo.","Prepara el pan: Forra el recipiente de 1,25 litros con film transparente, ya que te ayudará a desmoldar el pudín. superponga dos piezas en el medio del tazón, ya que es más fácil que intentar que una hoja se adhiera a todas las curvas.  Deje que los bordes sobresalgan unos 15 cm. Corta las cortezas del pan. Corte 4 trozos de pan por la mitad, un poco en ángulo, para obtener 2 rectángulos torcidos por trozo. Corta 2 rebanadas en 4 triángulos cada una y deja la pieza final entera.","Prepare el pudín: sumerja todo el trozo de pan en el jugo durante unos segundos para cubrirlo. Empújelo hacia el fondo del lavabo. Ahora sumerja las piezas rectangulares torcidas una a la vez y presione alrededor de los lados del lavabo para que encajen perfectamente, colocando alternativamente los extremos anchos y estrechos hacia arriba. Si no cabe el último trozo de pan, no importa, simplemente córtelo en forma de triángulo, sumérjalo en el jugo y colóquelo. Ahora agregue la fruta blanda con una cuchara, agregando las fresas aquí y allá a medida que avanza.","Deje que los sabores se mezclen y luego sirva: sumerja los triángulos de pan en jugo y colóquelos encima; recorte el exceso con unas tijeras. Guarde el jugo sobrante para más tarde. Levante la película adhesiva y séllela sin apretar. Coloque un plato lateral encima y apoye el peso con latas. Enfríe durante 6 horas o toda la noche. Para servir, abra el film transparente, luego coloque un plato para servir boca abajo encima y déle la vuelta. servir con \r\njugo sobrante, bayas adicionales y crema."]','2026-01-11 12:57:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13404,4347,'es','muffins de frutas','Comience la mañana con un panecillo de desayuno bajo en grasa repleto de arándanos, arándanos, pasas y albaricoques.','["225 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 huevos grandes","50 g de mantequilla, derretida","175ml de leche desnatada","100ml de miel clara","140 g de arándanos frescos","85 g de arándanos secos","140 g de pasas sin semillas","140 g de orejones picados","1 cucharadita de ralladura de naranja","1 cucharadita de canela molida"]','["Precalentar el horno a 200C/gas 6/\r\nventilar 180C y untar con mantequilla muy ligeramente\r\nMolde para muffins de 12 hoyos. Tamizar la harina y\r\npolvo de hornear en un bol. en\r\nEn otro bol, batir ligeramente los huevos,\r\nluego agregue la mantequilla derretida, la leche\r\ny miel. Añadir a la harina con la\r\ningredientes restantes. combinar\r\nrápidamente sin trabajar demasiado (es\r\nbien si quedan algunos grumos –\r\nlo prefieres espeso en lugar de fluido).\r\nVierta la mezcla en el muffin.\r\nestaño. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que\r\nbien crecido y dorado pálido en la parte superior.","Dejar en la lata unos minutos.\r\nantes de salir. Cuando estén fríos,\r\nconservar en una lata hermética durante dos días.\r\n(Se puede congelar hasta por 1 mes)."]','2026-01-11 12:57:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13405,9306,'es','Pudines de caramelo pegajosos y sin culpa','Una versión más ligera del clásico pudín, lleno de dátiles pegajosos y sirope de arce. mmm','["175 g de dátiles secos sin hueso","150 ml de jarabe de arce","1 cucharada de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos grandes, separados","85 g de harina con levadura","0% yogur griego y jarabe de arce extra, para servir (opcional)"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/Gas 4/horno ventilado 160C. Ponga los dátiles y 175 ml/6 fl oz de agua en una cacerola y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.  Vierta en un procesador de alimentos, agregue 6 cucharadas de jarabe de arce y el extracto de vainilla y mezcle hasta que quede suave.","Transfiera a un bol y mezcle las yemas de huevo, seguidas de la harina. En otro bol, bata las claras a punto de nieve e incorpórelas a la mezcla de dátiles.","Coloque 1 cucharada de jarabe de arce en cada uno de los cuatro moldes para pudín de 200 ml/7 fl oz y agregue la mezcla. Cubra cada uno bien con papel de aluminio, colóquelo en una fuente refractaria y vierta agua caliente hasta la mitad de los lados de los moldes. Cocina durante 1 hora, hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro salga limpia.","Destape, pase un cuchillo por los bordes e invierta en platos. Rocíe sobre yogur y jarabe de arce para servir, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:57:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13406,9307,'es','Horneado de frutos rojos con llovizna de maracuyá','Un pudín familiar afrutado para el verano y, además, es bajo en grasas','["100 g/4 oz de crema para untar baja en grasa","85 g de azúcar en polvo","ralladura y jugo 1 limón","1 huevo","140 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","4 cucharadas de yogur natural bajo en grasa, más extra para servir (opcional)","200 g de salsa de manzana","140 g de frambuesas, arándanos o moras (o una mezcla)","50 g de azúcar demerara","2 maracuyás, cortados por la mitad y sin pulpa"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase ligeramente una fuente para horno mediana con\r\n1 cucharadita de pasta para untar. Pon el resto\r\ncrema para untar, azúcar en polvo, ralladura de limón, huevo,\r\nharina, levadura y yogur en un\r\ntazón para mezclar. Batir durante 2 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega la manzana\r\nsalsa – esto podría hacer que la mezcla se vea\r\ncuajado, pero no te preocupes. Doblar suavemente\r\nlas bayas, luego vierta la masa en el\r\nplato preparado y nivelar la superficie. hornear\r\ndurante 25-30 minutos hasta que el bizcocho esté dorado\r\nmarrón y firme en el centro.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el jugo de limón, demerara\r\nazúcar y pulpa de maracuyá juntos.\r\nRetire el pudín del horno, ligeramente\r\npinchar la superficie con un tenedor y rociar\r\nsobre la mezcla de maracuyá. Servir caliente\r\ncon helado de vainilla desnatado o el yogur."]','2026-01-11 12:57:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13407,9308,'es','Tarta pequeña de manzana y caramelo','Inspírese en la cocina para niños de 8 a 14 años preparando un té de la tarde','["3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol, y más para la lata","1 manzana grande","1 huevo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","110 g de harina con levadura","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 caramelos suaves"]','["Pregunta a tu\r\nayudante adulto para encender el horno\r\nen ventilador de 190C/170C/\r\ngas 5. Cepille un molde para pan pequeño (500 g/ 1 lb)\r\ncon un poco de aceite.","pelar la manzana\r\ncon una papa\r\npelador, luego córtelo\r\nen cuartos y\r\nCorta los núcleos. Pregúntale a un adulto.\r\nayuda si es necesario.","rallar la manzana\r\nusando un rotativo o\r\nrallador de caja y ponerlo\r\nen un tazón grande.","romper el huevo\r\nen un tazón pequeño.\r\nSi algún trozo de concha\r\ncaer, levantarlos\r\ncon una cuchara. Añadir\r\na la manzana, entonces\r\nagregue 3 cucharadas de aceite y\r\nla vainilla. Mezclar bien.","Agrega la harina\r\ny azúcar y\r\nrevuelva juntos. el\r\nla mezcla esta bastante dura\r\nasí que continúa hasta\r\ntoda la harina es\r\nmezclado. Raspe\r\nen estaño preparado.","Empuja 3 caramelos\r\nen la mezcla\r\nen una fila. pregunta un\r\nadulto para poner el\r\nlata en el horno para\r\n30-40 minutos o hasta\r\nbien cocido.\r\nEnfriar antes de volcar\r\nsacar y rebanar."]','2026-01-11 12:57:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13408,4583,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: muffins de arándanos','Hemos creado una versión deliciosamente ligera de este clásico muffin que prácticamente no contiene grasas saturadas.','["5 cucharadas de aceite de colza","225 g de harina con levadura","115 g de harina integral","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","ralladura de ½ limón y 1 cucharadita de jugo","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de azúcar mascabado light","1 plátano pequeño muy maduro con piel negra (unos 85 g de peso pelado)","1 huevo","Bote de 284 ml de suero de leche","225 g de arándanos frescos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nUse 1 cucharadita de aceite para engrasar ligeramente un muffin de 12 hoyos.\r\nhojalata (o utilice cajas de papel). Mezclar ambas harinas\r\ncon el polvo para hornear y la ralladura de limón.\r\nReserve 1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo y luego revuelva\r\nreposar en la harina con el moscovado.","Tritura bien el plátano. en otro cuenco\r\nbata el huevo, luego agregue el plátano,\r\nsuero de leche y aceite. Usando un metal grande\r\ncuchara, agregue muy ligeramente a la mezcla de harina,\r\nsolo para combinar. Mezclar demasiado hará\r\nlos muffins duros. Agregue los arándanos\r\ny darle unas cuantas vueltas de cuchara para\r\nrevuélvalos con cuidado sin aplastarlos.","Vierta la mezcla en la lata.\r\ncada hoyo debe estar muy lleno. Hornear para\r\n20-25 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorado.","Mezclar el azúcar en polvo reservado con\r\nel jugo de limón. Cuando los muffins están\r\nListo, sacar del horno y cepillar.\r\ncon la mezcla de azúcar y limón mientras\r\ntodavía están calientes. Afloje suavemente los bordes\r\nde cada muffin con un cuchillo, luego dejar\r\nen la lata durante 15 minutos para que se enfríe un poco\r\nson muy delicados cuando están calientes. Quitar\r\na una rejilla. Se come mejor el día de\r\npero se conservará hasta por 2 días."]','2026-01-11 12:57:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13409,6167,'es','pastel de té con sabor a fruta','Perfecto con una taza de té revitalizante, este pastel se conserva y estará feliz en una lata durante aproximadamente una semana.','["300 g de mezcla de frutos secos y cerezas","225 ml de té caliente","jugo de 1 naranja (aproximadamente 75 ml/2½ fl oz) más ralladura","50 g de mantequilla","100 g de azúcar moreno claro","1 huevo","225 g de harina con levadura","4 cucharadas de azúcar demerara"]','["Coloque los frutos secos en un bol y\r\nvierta sobre el té caliente, el jugo de naranja y\r\nentusiasmo. Cubrir con film transparente y dejar reposar.\r\nal menos 4 horas o mejor aún durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase y forre la base de un molde para pan de 2 libras.\r\nBatir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta\r\ncremoso, luego bata el huevo seguido de\r\nla harina. Revuelva con cuidado la fruta.\r\nmezcla. Vierta la mezcla en la lata,\r\nluego alise la superficie con el\r\ndorso de una cuchara. Espolvorea todo con un\r\ncapa gruesa de azúcar demerara.","Hornee por 1 hora o hasta que se inserte una brocheta.\r\nal centro sale limpio. dejar para\r\nenfriar en la lata, luego desmoldar, cortar en\r\nrebanadas y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13410,6169,'es','Muffins de plátano y arándanos','Un muffin bajo en grasa que sabe tan bien como parece: se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por 3 días o se congelará hasta por un mes.','["300 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","50 g de gachas de avena, más 1 cucharada para cubrir","2 plátanos medianos, cuanto más maduros mejor","Cartón de 284 ml de suero de leche","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva ligero","2 claras de huevo","150 g de arándanos en canastilla"]','["Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4 y forre un molde para muffins de 12 orificios con cajas de papel para muffins. Vierta la harina y el bicarbonato de sodio en un tazón grande. Reserva 1 cucharada de azúcar y luego mezcla el resto con la harina y 50 g de avena. Hacer un hueco en el centro. En un recipiente aparte, triture los plátanos hasta que queden casi suaves. Agrega el suero de leche, el aceite y las claras de huevo al puré de plátano hasta que se combinen uniformemente.","Vierta la mezcla líquida en el pozo y revuelva rápidamente y con moderación con una cuchara de madera. La mezcla se verá grumosa y es posible que todavía se vea alguna mota de harina, pero no caigas en la tentación de mezclar demasiado. Agregue los arándanos y revuelva solo una vez más. Divida la mezcla entre los moldes para muffins (quedarán bastante llenos) y luego espolvoree la parte superior con la última cucharada de avena y el resto del azúcar. Hornee durante 18-20 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorado oscuro. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos en la bandeja antes de levantarlo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:57:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13411,9309,'es','Muffins de pera y caramelo','Estos muffins pegajosos quedan deliciosos calientes cuando el caramelo aún está derretido; puedes recalentarlos en el microondas','["300 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250ml de leche","2 huevos batidos","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","2 peras maduras, peladas y cortadas en trozos pequeños","100 g de caramelos blandos, picados en trozos","25 g de almendras laminadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.\r\nForre un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos de profundidad con\r\ncasos de papel. Vierta la harina, la levadura en polvo,\r\ncanela y una pizca de sal en un recipiente grande\r\ntazón, luego agregue el azúcar. Mezclar juntos el\r\nleche, huevos y mantequilla derretida en una jarra grande\r\ny verter en la mezcla seca de una vez, junto con\r\ncon las peras y un tercio del caramelo\r\npiezas. Revuelva brevemente hasta que apenas comience a\r\ncombinar: la masa aún debería estar bastante\r\ngrumosos y con vetas de harina.","Dividir la mezcla entre los casos,\r\nluego espolvorear con el caramelo restante y\r\nlas almendras laminadas. Hornear durante 25-30 minutos\r\nhasta que los muffins hayan subido, estén dorados y se sientan\r\nfirme al presionarlo (el caramelo fundido quedará\r\nextremadamente caliente, así que tenga cuidado de no tocarlo).\r\nRetirar del molde y pasar a una rejilla para que se enfríe."]','2026-01-11 12:57:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13412,5237,'es','Pan de dátil, plátano y ron','Un pastel sabroso sin grasa ni azúcar añadidos: inténtalo para creerlo. Además, se prepara fácilmente sin gluten.','["Paquete de 250 g de dátiles deshuesados ​​y listos para consumir","2 plátanos pequeños o 1 grande (140 g/5 oz de peso)","100 g de nueces pecanas, 85 g/3 oz picadas en trozos grandes y el resto entero","200 g de uvas","200 g de pasas","100 g de polenta fina","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","2 cucharaditas de levadura en polvo (use sin gluten si es necesario)","3 cucharadas de ron oscuro","2 claras de huevo","unos chips de plátano y 1 cucharadita de azúcar (opcional), para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Línea\r\nun molde para pan de 900 g con antiadherente para hornear\r\npapel, utilizando un poco de aceite para que se pegue. poner\r\nlos dátiles en una cacerola pequeña con 200ml\r\nagua hirviendo y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Drenar\r\nel líquido en una jarra, luego ponga los dátiles en una\r\nprocesador de alimentos. Añade los plátanos y 100ml.\r\ndel líquido de dátiles y bata hasta que quede suave.\r\nMezclar las nueces, los frutos secos, la polenta, las especias y\r\npolvo de hornear en un bol, luego agregue el dátil\r\npuré y ron, y revuelva hasta que se combinen.","Batir las claras a punto de nieve y\r\nincorporar a la mezcla para pastel. Vierta en la lata (lo hará\r\nestar bastante lleno), luego cubra con el resto\r\nnueces pecanas y chips de plátano y azúcar,\r\nsi lo usa. Hornee por 1 hora hasta que esté dorado y\r\ncrujiente y al pincharla sale limpia.\r\nDeje enfriar completamente antes de cortar en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:57:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13413,6171,'es','Muffins de melocotón y almendras','Estas deliciosas delicias bajas en grasas son perfectas para un capricho de verano y se pueden servir calientes o frías.','["3 huevos grandes","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorada, más un poco más para espolvorear","unas gotas de extracto de almendras","25 g de mantequilla, derretida","100 g de harina con levadura","25 g de almendras molidas","2 melocotones pequeños","2 cucharaditas de conserva de durazno o mermelada de albaricoque","1 cucharada de almendras laminadas","crème fraîche media grasa, para servir"]','["Precaliente el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. En un tazón grande, use un batidor de mano para mezclar los huevos, el azúcar y el extracto de almendras durante un minuto hasta que estén espumosos. Vierta la mantequilla derretida y continúe batiendo hasta que se combinen. Incorpora suavemente la harina, las almendras molidas y una pizca de sal.","Cortar por la mitad, deshuesar y cortar en rodajas los melocotones. Divida la mezcla para muffins entre 6 agujeros de un molde para muffins antiadherente. Cubra cada uno con una gota de conserva o mermelada y coloque unas rodajas de melocotón encima. Esparce las almendras y un poco más de azúcar, luego hornea durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté inflado y dorado. Servir caliente con una cucharada de crema fresca media grasa o dejar enfriar. Es mejor consumirlos el día en que se preparan o congelarlos mientras aún están ligeramente calientes por hasta 1 mes."]','2026-01-11 12:57:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13414,7609,'es','Caponata con polenta con queso','Prepare algo diferente para la cena con caponata rica en vegetales y polenta con queso. Es saludable, sin gluten, lleno de nutrientes y seguro que te saciará.','["1-2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos finos","1 calabacín, cortado en rodajas","1 berenjena, cortada en trozos","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","¼ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","30 g de aceitunas verdes deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad","½ cucharada de alcaparras, escurridas y enjuagadas","½ manojo pequeño de albahaca, finamente picada, más un poco más para servir","100 g de polenta instantánea","un poco de leche, para aflojar (opcional)","40 g de queso duro parmesano o vegetariano estilo italiano, rallado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén mediana a fuego medio y sofríe la cebolla, el calabacín y la berenjena durante 5-10 minutos, o hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agregue el ajo, el orégano y las hojuelas de chile, seguido de los tomates, las aceitunas y las alcaparras. Sazone al gusto, luego cocine a fuego lento, tapado, durante 20 minutos o hasta que todas las verduras estén suaves y bien cocidas. Agregue la albahaca y pruebe para sazonar.","Mientras tanto, cocine la polenta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete; es posible que deba aflojarla con un poco de agua o leche si está demasiado espesa. Mezclar con el parmesano, luego verter y distribuir en dos platos. Cubra con la caponata y más albahaca. Estación."]','2026-01-11 12:57:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13415,9316,'es','Pastel sin harina de limón y polenta','Este pastel de cítricos sin gluten tiene un toque amargo adulto. Servir con mascarpone cremoso y café negro.','["2 limones","140 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","3 huevos","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de almendras molidas","175 g de polenta o harina de maíz fina","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten","mascarpone, para servir","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","jugo 1 limon"]','["Engrasar un molde para bizcocho de 23 cm y calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner los limones en una cacerola y cubrir con agua fría. Llevar a ebullición, escurrir, verter más agua fría y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante 1 hora hasta que los limones estén muy suaves, agregando más agua si es necesario. Escurre bien los limones. Cuando estén fríos, córtelos por la mitad, quíteles las pepitas y tritúrelos en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener un puré.","Agrega todos los demás ingredientes del pastel y continúa batiendo hasta obtener una masa suelta. Vierta la masa en el molde para pastel y hornee durante 40-50 minutos hasta que esté dorada y comience a encogerse de los lados. Mientras se hornea el bizcocho, haz el chorrito mezclando el azúcar con el jugo de limón. Cuando el bizcocho esté listo sacar del horno y dejar enfriar un poco. Mientras aún está caliente, vierte sobre el chorrito y deja enfriar por completo. Servir con mascarpone."]','2026-01-11 12:57:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13416,9317,'es','pastel de flor de cerezo','Un horneado ligero sin gluten que usa polenta en lugar de harina y azahar para darle sabor a un chorrito de almíbar.','["300 g de cerezas, deshuesadas y picadas en trozos grandes","250 g de polenta","Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos grandes","100 g de almendras molidas","2½ cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural","1 cucharadita de agua de azahar","jugo ½ naranja","jugo 1 naranja","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","½ cucharadita de agua de azahar","50 g de cerezas, sin hueso, más cerezas extra con tallo para servir","175 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nUsa un poco de mantequilla para engrasar un\r\nmolde para pastel de 23 cm de profundidad y forrar con horno\r\npergamino. Mezclar las cerezas y 50g de\r\nla polenta y luego reservar.","En un tazón grande, combine la mantequilla y\r\nazúcar con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté pálida y\r\nesponjoso. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, mezclando.\r\nbien entre cada adición. Añade el\r\npolenta restante, las almendras, hornear\r\npolvo, yogur, agua de azahar,\r\nmezcla de jugo de naranja y cereza y revuelve\r\ntodo hasta que esté combinado. Inclínate hacia\r\nEl molde, alisar la parte superior y hornear durante 45 minutos.\r\no hasta que al pinchar con una brocheta este salga limpio.","Mientras tanto, haz el almíbar. hervir el\r\njugo de naranja y azúcar por unos minutos hasta\r\nel azúcar se ha disuelto. Quitar del\r\nCalentar, añadir el agua de azahar y\r\ndejar enfriar. Cuando el bizcocho esté listo, retirar\r\ndel horno y verter sobre el almíbar.\r\nDejar enfriar en el molde durante 20 minutos y luego\r\ntransfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer el glaseado de cereza, poner el\r\ncerezas y azúcar glas en una comida pequeña\r\nprocesador y mezcle hasta que quede suave.\r\nRocíe todo el pastel y luego cubra con\r\ncerezas enteras. Se mantendrá hasta\r\n5 días en molde para tarta."]','2026-01-11 12:57:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13417,9318,'es','Pastel de polenta de naranja','Dale a tu postre un sabor italiano con este pastel de polenta húmedo y afrutado','["250 g de mantequilla sin sal","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos grandes","140 g de polenta","200 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","ralladura y jugo de 2 naranjas (menos 100 ml de jugo para el glaseado)","100ml de zumo de naranja","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Forrar la base y los lados de un bizcocho redondo de 23 cm.\r\nlata con papel para hornear. Crema la\r\nmantequilla y azúcar juntos hasta que estén suaves y\r\nesponjoso. Añade los huevos uno a uno y\r\nmezclar bien. Una vez que la mezcla esté\r\ncombinado, agregue todos los ingredientes secos\r\ny la ralladura y el jugo después de haber\r\nMidió 100 ml para el glaseado.","Transfiera la mezcla a la lata, extienda\r\nuniformemente, luego cocine durante unos 45 minutos o\r\nhasta insertar una brocheta en el centro\r\ndel bizcocho sale limpio. Quitar\r\ndel horno y desmoldar sobre un alambre\r\nrejilla para enfriar.","Para hacer el glaseado, poner el jugo y\r\nazúcar en una cacerola mediana y traer\r\na ebullición. Déjelo hervir a fuego lento durante 5 minutos y luego\r\nRetirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.\r\nRocíe el glaseado de naranja sobre la parte superior\r\nel pastel enfriado. Sirva con helado de limón, a continuación."]','2026-01-11 12:57:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13418,9319,'es','pastel de crema de coco','Un tentador pastel sin huevo con un sabor exótico','["jugo de 1 limón","50 g de coco rallado","Caja de 200 ml de crema de coco.","85 g de polenta fina o mediana","2 cucharaditas rasas de levadura en polvo","140 g de mantequilla a temperatura ambiente","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura fina de ½ limón","140 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de coco rallado tostado","140 g de azúcar glas tamizada"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/gas 4/ventilador\r\nhorno 160C. Forrar una ronda de 18 cm.\r\nmolde para pastel con papel para hornear.\r\nBatir la mantequilla y\r\nazúcar hasta que esté suave. Agregue 150 ml/1?4 pinta\r\nde la crema de coco y la\r\ningredientes restantes del pastel y\r\nbatir ligeramente para hacer una masa suave y\r\nmezcla ligeramente húmeda.","Vierta los ingredientes en el\r\nestañar y hornear durante 50-55 minutos,\r\nhasta que la parte superior del pastel esté dorada\r\ny viene un pincho insertado\r\nlimpio. Retirar del horno\r\ndejar enfriar en el molde para pastel.","Cuando esté frío retiramos el bizcocho.\r\nde la lata, retire la\r\npapel y poner el pastel en un\r\nplato. Poner el azúcar glas en un\r\ntazón y agregue suficiente\r\ncrema de coco reservada para\r\nmezcle hasta obtener una mezcla espesa pero fluida\r\nconsistencia. Extender el glaseado\r\nsobre el pastel, permitiéndole\r\nregatear por los costados, luego\r\nespolvorear el coco tostado\r\nalrededor del borde superior."]','2026-01-11 12:57:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13419,9320,'es','Pastel de limón más ligero','Angela Nilsen le da a uno de los pasteles más populares de nuestro sitio un cambio de imagen saludable al reducir la grasa.','["75 ml de aceite de colza, más un poco más para la lata","175 g de harina con levadura","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de almendras molidas","50 g de polenta","ralladura fina de 2 limones","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos grandes","225 g de yogur natural","85 g de azúcar en polvo","jugo de 2 limones (aproximadamente 5 cucharadas)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase ligeramente un bizcocho redondo de 20 cm x 5 cm de profundidad.\r\nestañar y forrar la base con papel para hornear.\r\nPara el bizcocho poner la harina, la levadura,\r\nalmendras molidas y polenta en una gran\r\ntazón para mezclar. Agregue la ralladura de limón y\r\nazúcar, luego hacer un baño en el centro. batir\r\nLos huevos en un bol y luego agrega el yogur.\r\nVierta esta mezcla junto con el aceite en el\r\ndip (ver paso a paso número 1), luego revuelva breve y suavemente con un\r\ncuchara grande de metal para que todo quede justo\r\ncombinados, sin mezclar demasiado.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde y nivele.\r\nla parte superior (paso 2). Hornee por 40 minutos o hasta que\r\nbrocheta insertada en el centro del\r\nel pastel sale limpio. Cubra sin apretar con\r\npapel de aluminio durante los últimos 5 a 10 minutos si comienza a\r\ndorarse demasiado rápido.","Mientras se cocina el bizcocho, haz el limón.\r\nalmíbar. Vierta el azúcar en polvo en un vaso pequeño\r\ncazo con el jugo de limón y\r\n75 ml de agua. Calentar a fuego medio,\r\nrevolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que el azúcar se haya\r\ndisuelto. Subir el fuego, hervir durante 4 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté ligeramente reducido y almibarado, luego\r\nretirar del fuego.","Sacar el bizcocho del horno y\r\ndéjelo enfriar brevemente en la lata. Mientras todavía está\r\ncaliente, desmoldarlo, quitarle la\r\nForrar papel y sentar el bizcocho sobre un alambre.\r\nrejilla colocada sobre una bandeja para hornear o similar.\r\nUsa una brocheta para hacer muchos agujeros pequeños.\r\npor toda la parte superior del pastel (paso 3). lentamente\r\nvierta sobre la mitad del almíbar de limón (paso 4) y\r\ndéjelo en remojo. Vierta sobre el resto en el\r\nDe la misma manera, cepillando los bordes y los lados.\r\ndel bizcocho también con lo último del almíbar."]','2026-01-11 12:57:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13420,9321,'es','Tarta de polenta de frambuesa y limón','Dale a tu bizcocho un toque italiano con el pastel de polenta fácil de preparar de Jane Hornby','["225 g de mantequilla muy blanda","225 g de azúcar en polvo, más 1 cucharada","4 huevos batidos","175 g de polenta fina","50 g de harina común","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","ralladura fina de 1½ limones","200 g de frambuesas congeladas, dejadas congeladas","azúcar glas o más al gusto (opcional)","100 g de queso tierno a temperatura ambiente (nosotros usamos Philadelphia)","1 cucharada de azúcar glas o más al gusto","ralladura fina de ½ limón y un chorrito de jugo","Tarrina 142ml crema doble","100 g de frambuesas congeladas y descongeladas"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5 y untar con mantequilla dos moldes para sándwich de 20 cm. Forre el fondo de los moldes con papel de horno. en\r\nEn un bol grande, bata la mantequilla y 225 g de azúcar en polvo hasta que esté cremoso y ligero. Agrega poco a poco el huevo, poco a poco, hasta que se incorpore todo el huevo y la mezcla esté pálida y esponjosa. Si parece que la mezcla está empezando a partirse, agrega 1 cucharadita de harina y continúa.","Coloque la polenta en otro bol y luego agregue la harina y el polvo para hornear. Batir el extracto de vainilla y la ralladura con la mezcla de huevo, luego incorporar los ingredientes secos. Vierta la mitad de la masa en cada molde y nivele la parte superior. Esparce todas las frambuesas menos un puñado sobre la mezcla y mételas suavemente. Espolvorea uno de los bizcochos con 1 cucharada de azúcar. Hornee durante 20 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorado, pero aún con un poco de bamboleo debajo de la corteza.","Abra el horno, saque el bizcocho con costra de azúcar y rápidamente introduzca las frambuesas congeladas restantes en la parte superior. Hornee ambos bizcochos durante 10 minutos más o hasta que estén elásticos en el medio. Si esto suena demasiado complicado, simplemente deja que los bizcochos se horneen durante 30 minutos; el pastel no se verá tan glamoroso, pero aún así tendrá un sabor delicioso (en su lugar, puedes agregar las bayas sobrantes al relleno).\r\nDeje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego enfríe completamente sobre una rejilla. Tenga cuidado al sacar el bizcocho con cubierta de frambuesa y deslícelo fuera de su base en lugar de darle la vuelta.","Cuando los bizcochos estén fríos batir el queso tierno con el azúcar glas, la ralladura de limón y un poco de jugo para que suelte si lo necesita. Batir muy ligeramente la nata para que mantenga su forma y luego incorporarla al queso. Incorpora las frambuesas descongeladas. Úselo para emparedar los bizcochos, con una costra de azúcar encima y sirva espolvoreado con más azúcar glas."]','2026-01-11 12:57:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13421,9322,'es','Dedos arremolinados con limón y llovizna','La polenta (a veces llamada harina de maíz fina) le da a este pastel su color amarillo y su textura suave.','["200 g de mantequilla, bien blanda, más un poco más","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos grandes","100 g de polenta fina o harina de maíz fina","140 g de harina con levadura","ralladura de 3 limones","4 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","5 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada o blanca","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4 y\r\nAsegúrate de que haya un estante listo en el medio.\r\ndel horno. Unte con mantequilla una bandeja para hornear rectangular\r\no una fuente para asar pequeña, de unos 20 cm x 30 cm.\r\nRecorta una hoja de papel de horno un poco más grande.\r\nque la lata, luego empújela y alísela\r\nSaque con las manos para que se pegue a la mantequilla.\r\nCorta las esquinas con unas tijeras.\r\npara que el papel quede limpio.","Pon todos los ingredientes del bizcocho y una pizca de\r\nsal en un tazón grande, luego usa batidoras eléctricas\r\nbatir hasta que esté cremoso y suave. Sacar en\r\nla lata, luego nivele la parte superior. Cuchara el limón\r\ncuajada sobre la masa en franjas gruesas. uso\r\nel mango de la cuchara para hacer girar la cuajada\r\nen el pastel – no demasiado o no lo harás\r\nvea los remolinos una vez que esté cocido. Hornear para\r\nunos 35 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y leudados. eso\r\ndebería haberse encogido lejos de los lados de\r\nla lata ligeramente y se siente elástica. no lo hagas\r\nAbra el horno antes de que terminen los 30 minutos de cocción.","Dejar el bizcocho en el molde durante 10 minutos o\r\nhasta que esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo. Levante con cuidado\r\nSacar del molde y colocar sobre una rejilla para enfriar.\r\nse sentó sobre una bandeja o algo similar para atrapar\r\ngotas de llovizna. Para hacer la llovizna, mezcle\r\n4 cucharadas de azúcar y el jugo de limón juntos\r\ny vierta sobre el pastel. echar el limon\r\nrallar con la última cucharada de azúcar y esparcir\r\npor encima. Deja que el bizcocho se enfríe por completo,\r\nluego levántelo sobre una tabla, retire los lados\r\ndel papel de horno y cortar el bizcocho en\r\ndedos. Se mantendrá en una lata hermética durante 3 días."]','2026-01-11 12:57:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13422,7936,'es','Koftas de ternera, aceitunas verdes y zumaque','Apila estas koftas especiadas en una fuente y deja que todos las disfruten. Una cena ideal para compartir, sírvelas con ensalada, chiles encurtidos y panes planos.','["800 g de carne picada de ternera 12% grasa","2 dientes de ajo, rallados","100 g de aceitunas verdes, deshuesadas y picadas en trozos grandes","50 g de pistachos, picados en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de zumaque","1 cucharada de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más extra para freír","1 cebolla morada, cortada en rodajas","1 limón, exprimido","1 pepino entero, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","2 puñados grandes de hojas de perejil (ver consejo a continuación)","50 g de semillas de granada","pizca de zumaque","1 cucharada de miel, para glasear","hummus, chiles encurtidos y panes planos"]','["Si está preparando con anticipación, cubra un recipiente apto para congelador con papel para hornear. Mezcle todos los ingredientes para el kofta en un tazón grande, junto con 1 cucharadita de sal y una pizca grande de pimienta negra. Forme aproximadamente koftas con las manos (usando aproximadamente 40 g por cada kofta); debería tener 24 en total. Se mantendrá refrigerado hasta por cuatro días o congelado hasta por tres meses. Llena el recipiente preparado con las koftas, colocando otra hoja de papel para hornear entre ellas si necesitas hacer una segunda capa.","Para hacer la ensalada, machaca la cebolla morada y el jugo de limón junto con una pizca de sal. Déjelo reposar durante 10 minutos para que se encurta ligeramente y luego mezcle el pepino, el perejil y las semillas de granada. Sazone al gusto. Vierta en un tazón para servir y espolvoree sobre el zumaque.","Para cocinar congelado, unte aceite de oliva sobre una sartén grande o una plancha, si tiene una, y caliente a fuego medio-alto. Fríe el kofta en tandas, volteándolo con frecuencia durante 5 a 7 minutos hasta que se dore por completo. Vierta 200 ml de agua y cubra con una tapa. Suba el fuego a alto y cocine durante 5-7 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido y el agua se haya evaporado. Retire del fuego y agregue la miel, revolviendo para cubrir. Si está cocinando frío, cocine durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido.","Extienda el hummus en una fuente para servir y apílelo sobre las koftas. Sirva con la ensalada, los chiles encurtidos y los panes planos."]','2026-01-11 12:57:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13423,9323,'es','Rollo ártico clásico','Sigue nuestra guía paso a paso de este postre helado retro de helado de vainilla envuelto en un bizcocho ligero, con mermelada de fresa casera','["2 huevos, separados","50 g de azúcar glas","1 vaina de vainilla, solo semillas","150ml de nata doble","200 g de fresas cortadas en cuartos y algunas más para decorar","jugo ½ limón","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","nuez de mantequilla, para engrasar","3 huevos","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorada, más un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Para hacer el helado, bate las claras en un bol con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que estén firmes. En otro bol, bate las yemas, el azúcar glas y las semillas de vainilla hasta que estén pálidas y esponjosas. En un tercer bol batir la nata doble hasta que mantenga su forma.","Incorpora la mezcla de yemas a la nata y luego incorpora las claras. Vierta en un molde para pan de 900 g forrado con una hoja de papel para hornear más grande de lo que necesitará; esto le ayudará más adelante. Congelar por 2 hrs.","Retire el helado del congelador y del molde cuando se sienta cuajado pero suave. Use una espátula para darle a la mezcla la forma de una salchicha rugosa, luego use el pergamino para enrollar la mezcla hasta formar un cilindro de unos 35 cm de largo.","Gira los extremos del papel para hornear como si fuera una galleta y regresa al congelador por 1 hora más.","Para hacer la mermelada, primero mete un platillo en el congelador. Pon las fresas, el jugo de limón y el azúcar en una cacerola de base pesada a fuego alto. Llevar a ebullición, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Hervir rápidamente durante 5 minutos y luego retirar del fuego.","Coloque 1/4 de cucharadita de mermelada en el platillo frío; si se arruga al empujarlo con el dedo, la mermelada está lista. Si todavía está líquido, regréselo al fuego y vuelva a hervir durante 2 o 3 minutos más, luego vuelva a probar. Una vez cuajada la mermelada dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forrar un molde para panecillos suizos de 24 x 32 cm con papel para hornear (con abundante exceso) y engrasar bien. Batir los huevos y el azúcar con un batidor de mano eléctrico durante 2-3 minutos o hasta que espese y esté pálido.","Incorpora la harina, el polvo para hornear y el extracto de vainilla a la mezcla de huevo con una cuchara de metal grande hasta que no queden bolsas de harina visibles.","Vierta suavemente la mezcla en el molde para panecillos suizos preparado y hornee en el horno durante 15 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y elástico al tacto.","Retirar del horno, dejar enfriar durante 1-2 minutos o hasta que esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, luego enrollar con cuidado el bizcocho mientras aún está caliente (manteniendo el papel para hornear adherido). Dejar enfriar completamente en su forma enrollada.","Desenrolla el bizcocho y extiende la mermelada por su interior. Trabajando rápidamente, desenvuelve el helado y ponlo encima de la mermelada. Enrolla el pastel a su alrededor.","Envuelva el rollo ártico en una nueva hoja de papel para hornear y también en una capa de papel de aluminio. Regresar a la\r\nCongele durante 20-30 minutos más, luego desenvuelva, corte en rodajas y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:57:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13424,9324,'es','Pasteles de hadas glamorosos','Un toque retro a un favorito de la infancia: aprende a hacer pasteles de hadas y luego decóralos para cualquier ocasión.','["140 g de mantequilla, muy bien blanda","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos medianos","100 g de harina con levadura","25 g de natillas en polvo o maicena","600 g de azúcar glas tamizada","6 cucharadas de agua, o mitad de agua y mitad de jugo de limón, colado","colorantes comestibles verdes y rosados","violetas cristalizadas","rosas cristalizadas o pétalos de rosa","flores de oblea comestibles"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Colocar las cajas de papel en moldes para panecillos. Pon todos los ingredientes del pastel en un tazón grande y bate durante unos 2 minutos hasta que quede suave. Divida la mezcla entre las cajas para que queden medio llenas y hornee durante 12-15 minutos, hasta que suba y esté dorada. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla.","Mezcle el azúcar glas y el agua hasta que quede suave y use un tercio en ocho de los pasteles. Divida el resto por la mitad y coloree una mitad de verde pálido y la otra mitad de rosa pálido. Decora las blancas con violetas cristalizadas, las rosadas con las rosas y las verdes con las flores de oblea. Dejar reposar. Se conservará hasta por 2 o 3 días almacenado en un recipiente hermético en un lugar fresco."]','2026-01-11 12:57:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13425,9325,'es','Cuadrados de simnel afrutados','Esta sencilla variación del clásico bizcocho de frutas produce muchos cuadrados, todos decorados con huevos de mazapán.','["250 g de frutos secos variados","100 g de orejones, picados","85 g de cerezas glaseadas, picadas","ralladura de 2 naranjas, jugo de 1 naranja (use la segunda en la cobertura)","200 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para la lata","200 g de azúcar mascabado light","4 huevos grandes","200 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","1 cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada recién rallada","500 g de mazapán, 200 g cortados en trozos de 2 cm y el resto para la cobertura","50 g de mantequilla","50 g de azúcar mascabado light","100 g de harina común","100 g de almendras laminadas","3 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","85 g de azúcar glas tamizada","2-3 cucharaditas de jugo de naranja"]','["Remojar todos los frutos secos en la naranja.\r\njugo durante 2 horas o toda la noche.","Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde de 20 x 30 cm con\r\npergamino para hornear. Precalentar el horno a 160C/\r\n140C ventilador/gas 3. En un bol grande, bata el\r\nmantequilla y azúcar con una batidora eléctrica\r\nhasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Agrega los huevos uno a uno\r\nun tiempo; mezcle bien entre cada adición.","Tamizar la harina en el bol y mezclar\r\nen el suelo almendras y especias.\r\nAgrega los trozos de mazapán, la ralladura y los secos.\r\nfruta con el jugo restante y déjela\r\ntodo un buen revuelto para combinar.","Vierta la mezcla para pastel en el molde preparado,\r\nnivelar la superficie y hornear por 45 minutos.\r\n– es posible que el pastel todavía esté un poco pegajoso\r\nel centro en este punto. Quitar de\r\nel horno y aumentar el fuego a 200C/\r\nVentilador/gas 180C 6.","Haz la cobertura. Frote la mantequilla, el azúcar.\r\ny enharinar con los dedos hasta obtener\r\ntextura de pan rallado quebradizo. rallar\r\n200g de mazapán reservado, añadir el desmenuzado\r\nalmendras y almíbar dorado. Mezclar\r\ntodo con un tenedor, asegurándose de que\r\npermanece desmenuzable y no se apelmaza. espolvorear\r\nsobre el pastel y regresar al horno para\r\n12-15 minutos. Mientras tanto, divida el resto de\r\nCortar el mazapán en 11 y formar bolitas.","Sacar el bizcocho del horno una vez\r\nbien cocido, disponer el mazapán\r\nColoque las bolitas encima y déjelas enfriar en el molde.\r\nMezclar el azúcar glas con suficiente naranja.\r\njugo para darle un glaseado líquido, rocíelo todo\r\nsobre el bizcocho, luego déjelo reposar un poco antes\r\ncortándolo."]','2026-01-11 12:57:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13426,9326,'es','Rollo ártico ondulado de nata y frambuesa','Una versión impresionante del clásico retro, completa con bayas de temporada, helado casero y bizcocho ligero.','["2 huevos grandes","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","Tarro de 227 g de nata cuajada","350ml de leche entera","semillas de 1 vaina de vainilla","100 g de frambuesas en canastilla","Tarro 300g mermelada de frambuesa","4 huevos grandes","125 g de azúcar en polvo dorada, más un poco más para espolvorear","125 g de harina con levadura"]','["Enfría el bol de tu heladera,\r\nsi usa uno. En un tazón grande, bata la\r\nhuevos (tenga en cuenta que esta receta contiene\r\nhuevos crudos) y azúcar hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos.\r\nAgrega la nata cuajada, la leche y la vainilla.\r\nsemillas y bata nuevamente hasta que quede suave.\r\nVierta en su heladera y\r\nbatir hasta que esté congelado. Alternativamente, puedes\r\nVierta la mezcla en una tina y congélela por\r\n2 horas, luego transfiéralo a un procesador de alimentos.\r\ny bombardee para eliminar los cristales de hielo.","Forrar un molde para pan de 900 g (de unos 20 cm de largo)\r\ncon film transparente. En esta etapa – mientras su\r\nEl helado es bastante flexible: aplasta el\r\nframbuesas con 2 cucharadas de mermelada\r\n(dejando algunos trozos gruesos), luego\r\nondula a través del helado. Transferir\r\na su molde para pan y congélelo nuevamente hasta\r\nsólido: aproximadamente 6 horas o toda la noche.","Ahora haz la esponja. Calentar el horno a\r\nVentilador/gas 190C/170C 5. Grasa y línea\r\nun molde para panecillos suizos de 25 x 35 cm con horneado\r\npergamino. Poner los huevos y el azúcar en un\r\ntazón grande y bata hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso\r\n– esto tomará unos 5 minutos. Tamizar sobre el\r\nharina y mezclar hasta que no queden\r\ngrumos visibles de harina. Vierta con cuidado en\r\nla lata y alisar por encima. hornear\r\ndurante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté elástico al tacto.","Mientras se cocina el bizcocho, coloque una hoja\r\nde papel para hornear, más grande que tu lata,\r\nen su superficie y espolvoree con ricino\r\nazúcar. Cuando el bizcocho esté cocido le damos la vuelta\r\nsobre el pergamino azucarado, enróllelo sin apretar\r\ndesde uno de los extremos más cortos y gírelo\r\nel pergamino para asegurar. Dejar enfriar.","Sacar el helado del congelador.\r\ny dejar reposar durante 10 min. Transferir\r\nel helado a una bandeja grande para hornear\r\npergamino, enrolle el pergamino alrededor del helado como una galleta, luego enrolle y\r\nexprimir el helado con las manos para\r\nDale forma de cilindro, de unos 25 cm de largo.","Desenvuelva y desenrolle la esponja, luego\r\nextender la superficie interior con la\r\nmermelada restante. Coloca el hielo sin envolver.\r\ncrema en el centro y envolver el bizcocho\r\na su alrededor para formar su rollo ártico. enrollar el\r\ntodo vuelve a estar en el horno\r\npergamino, tuerza los extremos con fuerza para\r\nAsegure, luego vuelva a congelar por 2 horas más.\r\nAntes de servir, desenvolver el panecillo ártico y\r\nCortar cada extremo con un cuchillo de sierra.\r\npara que se vea ordenado. (Tu oportunidad de conseguir\r\n¡Un sabor furtivo!) Se puede almacenar en el\r\ncongelador por hasta 1 semana."]','2026-01-11 12:57:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13427,9327,'es','Pan de malta de dátiles y jengibre','Un pastel oscuro, pegajoso y ligeramente especiado que fusiona pastel de jengibre jamaicano con pudín de caramelo pegajoso y pan de malta.','["200 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubos, más un poco para engrasar","140 g de dátiles deshuesados, picados","Lata de 410ml de leche evaporada","100 g de azúcar moreno oscuro blando","225 g de harina común","3 cucharadas de leche malteada en polvo (nosotros usamos Horlicks)","2 cucharaditas de jengibre molido","50 g de jengibre de tallo, picado (reservar el almíbar)","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","2 huevos grandes","50 g de jengibre de tallo, picado","5 cucharadas de jarabe de jengibre (del frasco de jengibre con tallo)","5 cucharadas de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase y forre un molde para pan de 900 g/2 lb.\r\ncon papel para hornear. Pon las fechas,\r\nleche evaporada y azúcar en un vaso pequeño\r\ncacerola, llevar a ebullición y cocinar durante\r\n5 minutos hasta que los dátiles estén blandos y\r\nel azúcar se ha disuelto. Dejar enfriar.","Poner la harina, la leche malteada en polvo,\r\njengibre molido, jengibre de tallo, bicarbonato\r\ny mantequilla en un procesador de alimentos,\r\ny revuelva hasta que la mezcla se parezca\r\nmigas de pan. Vierta el dátil enfriado.\r\nmezcla y los huevos, y pulsa brevemente\r\nhasta que la mezcla esté combinada. Inclínate hacia\r\nsu molde preparado y hornee por 1 hora 15 minutos\r\nhasta que al insertar una brocheta salga limpia.\r\nDejar enfriar 10 minutos en el molde y luego\r\ntransfiéralo a una rejilla. Combina todos los\r\ningredientes para la llovizna y vierta sobre\r\nel pastel. Dejar reposar antes de servir. Este bizcocho queda delicioso si se come ese mismo día.\r\nEstá hecho, pero mejorará después de un día.\r\no 2 en el molde para pastel."]','2026-01-11 12:57:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13428,9328,'es','Fantasias de fondant de limón y lavanda','Elegantes cuadrados de bizcocho, pequeños y bonitos como una imagen: impresionan con sabores ligeros y glaseado de mantequilla sedoso.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","250 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos grandes","100 g de yogur natural desnatado","275 g de harina común","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de lavanda seca, más un poco para decorar","100 g de mantequilla","100 g de azúcar glas","ralladura de 1 limón, más un poco para decorar","8 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque, tamizada y calentada en el microondas hasta que esté líquida","Paquete de 1 kg de azúcar glas para fondant.","colorante alimentario amarillo y morado"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrasar y forrar un molde cuadrado de 20 cm con\r\npergamino para hornear. Poner la mantequilla, el azúcar,\r\nhuevos, yogur, harina y levadura en polvo en\r\nun bol grande y batir con una varilla eléctrica.\r\nbatir hasta que quede suave. Vierta en el molde para pastel\r\ny alisar la parte superior. Hornear durante 45-50 minutos\r\nhasta que suba y esté dorado, y una brocheta\r\ninsertado sale limpio. dejar enfriar\r\ndurante 10 minutos en el molde y luego desmoldar\r\nuna rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Muele la lavanda hasta convertirla en polvo usando\r\nun mortero y un mortero. para hacer la mantequilla\r\nglaseado, batir la mantequilla y el azúcar glas\r\njuntos hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. dividir el\r\nmezcla en 2 tazones, agrega el limón\r\nralladura a un lote y la lavanda a\r\nel otro, luego mezcle cada uno para combinar.\r\nTransfiera el glaseado a 2 mangas pasteleras.","Cuando la esponja esté completamente\r\nenfriado, use un cuchillo de sierra grande para\r\nQuita la parte superior y te da un piso.\r\nsuperficie. Voltee el pastel para que\r\nel lado más plano se convierte en la parte superior. Recorta con cuidado los bordes y luego corta el bizcocho.\r\nen 16 cuadrados. Usa una regla si quieres.\r\nque sean del mismo tamaño. Cepilla la parte superior\r\ny lados de cada cuadrado de esponja con una\r\npequeña mermelada. Coloca una pequeña cúpula de mantequilla.\r\nglaseado en cada bizcocho, 8 con lavanda\r\nglaseado y 8 con limón. enfriar los pasteles\r\ndurante al menos 1 h.","Tamizar el azúcar glas para fondant en un recipiente grande\r\ntazón y agregue suficiente agua para hacer una\r\nglaseado espeso pero que se puede verter. Cuchara un poco\r\nglaseado blanco en una bolsa para sándwich o en una tubería\r\nbolsa para usarla más tarde. dividir el resto\r\nglaseado en 2 tazones, teñir un lote de limón\r\namarillo y el otro lila pálido.","Sacar los bizcochos de la nevera.\r\ny transfiéralo a una rejilla, sentando el\r\nrejilla en una bandeja para recoger las gotas. Cuchara\r\nun poco de glaseado sobre cada bizcocho, lila para\r\nlas fantasías con sabor a lavanda y\r\namarillo para el limón. Usa una paleta pequeña\r\ncuchillo para esparcir el glaseado por los lados\r\nde la esponja para cubrir completamente cada\r\nuno. Dejar reposar durante 30 minutos y luego tapar.\r\nlos pasteles con una segunda capa de glaseado\r\npara dar una superficie lisa. Rocíe el\r\nglaseado blanco sobre los pasteles y decorar\r\ncon un poco de ralladura de limón y lavanda\r\nbrotes. Dejar reposar durante 1 hora a temperatura ambiente.\r\ntemperatura antes de servir. Durará\r\n2-3 días en lata."]','2026-01-11 12:57:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13429,9329,'es','pastel de Battenberg','El tradicional pastel Battenberg de Sarah Cook es un proyecto delicioso para una tarde en la cocina','["175 g de mantequilla muy blanda","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","3 huevos medianos","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","¼ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","1 x ingredientes para bizcocho de almendras","colorante alimentario rosa, utilizamos ½ cucharadita de pasta alimentaria Squires Rose","200 g de mermelada de albaricoque","2 bloques de mazapán blanco de 500 g","un poco de azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y\r\nForrar la base y los lados de un cuadrado de 20 cm.\r\nlata con papel para hornear (el más fácil\r\nLa forma es cruzar 2 tiras de 20 cm de largo\r\nla base). Para hacer el bizcocho de almendras,\r\nponer la mantequilla, el azúcar, la harina, molida\r\nalmendras, levadura en polvo, huevos, vainilla\r\ny extracto de almendras en un tazón grande. batir\r\ncon unas varillas eléctricas hasta que la mezcla\r\nse une sin problemas. raspar en\r\nla lata, extendiéndose hasta las esquinas, y\r\nhornee durante 25-30 minutos – cuando introduzca\r\nuna brocheta, debe salir limpia.\r\nDeje enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego transfiéralo.\r\na una rejilla para que termine de enfriarse mientras\r\nHaz la segunda esponja.","Para el bizcocho rosa, forre la lata como\r\narriba. Mezclar todos los ingredientes juntos\r\ncomo arriba, pero no agregue la almendra\r\nextraer. Agrega un poco de colorante alimentario rosa.\r\nLuego, mételo todo en el molde y hornéalo.\r\ncomo antes. Fresco.","Para montar, calentar la mermelada en una pequeña\r\nsartén hasta que esté líquido, luego tamizar. Apenas recortar\r\ndos bordes opuestos de la almendra\r\nesponja, luego recorte bien un tercer borde.\r\nMida aproximadamente la altura del\r\nesponja, luego cortando de la\r\nborde bien recortado, use una regla para ayudar\r\ncortas 4 rebanadas cada una del mismo ancho que\r\nla altura de la esponja. Desechar o mordisquear\r\nesponja sobrante. Repita con pastel rosa.","Tome 2 x rodajas de almendra y 2 x rosa\r\nCortar en rodajas y recortar para que queden todas iguales.\r\nlongitud. Extienda un bloque de mazapán\r\nuna superficie ligeramente espolvoreada con azúcar glas\r\na poco más de 20 cm de ancho, luego manténgalo\r\nenrollando a lo largo hasta que el mazapán\r\nTiene aproximadamente 0,5 cm de espesor. Pincel con\r\nmermelada de albaricoque, luego poner una rosa y una\r\nrodaja de almendra una al lado de la otra en un extremo de\r\nel mazapán, untando mermelada en el medio\r\npara pegar esponjas, y dejando 4cm libres\r\nmazapán al final. Cepilla más mermelada\r\nencima de las esponjas, luego\r\nemparede las 2 rebanadas restantes encima,\r\nalternando colores para dar un tablero de ajedrez\r\nefecto. Recorta el mazapán a la\r\nlongitud de las tortas.","Levantar con cuidado el mazapán y\r\nalisa el pastel con las manos,\r\npero deja un pequeño pliegue de mazapán a lo largo del\r\nborde inferior antes de pegarlo al\r\nprimer lado. Recorta el lado opuesto para que coincida\r\ntamaño del pliegue, luego doble los bordes usando\r\ndedos y pulgar (o, más simplemente,\r\npresionar con las puntas de un tenedor). Si quieres,\r\nmarcar las 10 rebanadas usando las puntas de\r\nun tenedor.","Reúna el segundo Battenberg y\r\nconservar en caja hermética o bien envuelto\r\nen film transparente por hasta 3 días. puede ser\r\ncongelado hasta por un mes."]','2026-01-11 12:57:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13430,9330,'es','pastel de eccles','Una nueva versión de la pastelería tradicional, esta tarta quedará bien en cualquier ocasión.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","250 g de azúcar moreno claro blando","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","4 huevos grandes","100 g de harina común","250 g de harina con levadura","100 g de suero de leche","2 manzanas para comer, peladas, sin corazón y cortadas en trozos de aproximadamente 1 cm","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","¼ cucharadita de clavo molido","ralladura de 1 limón","2 cucharadas de mantequilla derretida","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno claro suave","85 g de grosellas","85 g de pasas","50 g de piel mixta","85 g de azúcar glas tamizada","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","unos cuantos terrones de azúcar, triturados toscamente"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrasar y forrar un molde para bizcocho hondo de 20 cm.\r\ncon papel para hornear. mezclar juntos\r\nlos ingredientes del relleno y reservar.","Poner en un bol la mantequilla, el azúcar y la vainilla.\r\ny bata hasta que esté pálido. Batir los huevos, luego\r\nagregue las harinas, el suero de leche y las manzanas.\r\nVierta la mitad de la mezcla en el molde. dispersión\r\nsobre el relleno, dejando un borde claro de 2,5 cm\r\ntodo alrededor del borde. Cuchara restante\r\nmezcla encima, empezando por repartir\r\nlos bordes, luego moviéndose hacia el medio.\r\nHornee por 1 hr 25 min o hasta que se forme una brocheta.\r\nmetido sale limpio. Dejar enfriar en la lata.","Mezclar el azúcar glas con suficiente limón.\r\njugo para hacer un glaseado líquido. Quitar\r\npastel del molde, rociar sobre el glaseado,\r\nluego espolvorear con terrones de azúcar triturados\r\ny ralladura de limón."]','2026-01-11 12:57:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13431,9331,'es','Pastel de piña al revés','Rocas retras. Este clásico pastel de piña al revés es un centro divertido para el té de la tarde y trae muchos recuerdos de la infancia.','["50 g de mantequilla blanda","50 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro","7 aros de piña en almíbar, escurridos y almíbar","cereza congelada","100 g de mantequilla blanda","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 huevos"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Para el\r\ncobertura, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar\r\nhasta que esté cremoso. Repartir sobre la base y un\r\nun cuarto de la altura de los lados de un 20-21 cm\r\nmolde para pastel redondo. Coloque los aros de piña encima,\r\nluego coloque las cerezas en el centro de los anillos.","Coloque los ingredientes del pastel en un bol junto\r\ncon 2 cucharadas de almíbar de piña y, usando\r\nCon una batidora eléctrica, bata hasta obtener una consistencia suave.\r\nVierta en la lata encima de la piña y\r\nalíselo para que quede nivelado. Hornee por 35 minutos.\r\nDejar reposar 5 minutos y luego desmoldar.\r\nun plato. Servir caliente con una bola de helado."]','2026-01-11 12:57:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13432,9332,'es','La reina de los budines','Súper rápidos de preparar, estos pequeños pasteles cubiertos de merengue fueron hechos para compartir','["200 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco para engrasar","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos","140 g de harina con levadura","50 g de natillas en polvo","5-6 cucharadas de mermelada de frambuesa","16 mini merengues","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrasar y forrar un molde para horno cuadrado de 20 cm.\r\nBatir la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos,\r\nharina y natillas en polvo hasta que estén bien\r\ncombinado y esponjoso. Extender en la lata\r\ny hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y\r\nresucitado. Dejar enfriar en la lata.","Retire el pastel enfriado del molde y\r\nuntar con la mermelada. Recorta los bordes,\r\nluego córtelo en 16 cuadrados. Agrega un merengue\r\na cada uno justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13433,9333,'es','Budín de arándanos y coco','La combinación de arándanos y coco hace que este delicioso postre sea increíblemente delicioso.','["50 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de mantequilla blanda","1 huevo grande","50 g de harina con levadura","50 g de coco rallado, más 2 cucharaditas","50 g de crème fraîche, más algo extra para servir","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","180 g de canastilla de arándanos"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Batir el azúcar y la mantequilla hasta que estén pálidos y cremosos, luego incorporar el huevo. Agrega la harina, el coco, la crema fresca y la ralladura de limón.","Coloque la mayoría de los arándanos en una fuente para horno (de unos 18 cm cuadrados) y exprima sobre el jugo de la mitad del limón. Vierta la mezcla del pastel y esparza sobre los arándanos restantes y 2 cucharaditas de coco. Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté dorado, levado y el bizcocho esté cocido. Sirva con una cucharada más de crema fresca."]','2026-01-11 12:57:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13434,9334,'es','Bollos helados fáciles','A los niños les encantarán estos bollos helados a la antigua usanza, ¡pídeles que te ayuden a decorarlos también!','["500 g de mezcla de pan blanco (nosotros usamos Wright''s)","100 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo","350 g de azúcar glas","chispas (más colorante alimentario, si lo desea)"]','["Mezcla la mezcla de pan y el azúcar.\r\nen un procesador de alimentos o batidora de mesa.\r\nMientras el motor está en marcha, agrega el huevo.\r\ny unos 250-300ml de agua tibia,\r\nhasta que se forme una masa suave. Amasar\r\nsobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta que quede suave, aproximadamente de 5 a 10 minutos. Dejar en un bol engrasado,\r\ncubierto con film transparente engrasado, en un recipiente tibio\r\ncolóquelo hasta que duplique su tamaño, aproximadamente 1 hora.","Derribar la masa aplastándola con\r\ntu puño y divídelo en 20 trozos del mismo tamaño.\r\ntrozos – manténgalos cubiertos con un té limpio\r\ntoalla para que no se sequen. Dar forma a cada uno\r\nen forma de salchicha y colocar sobre una fuente engrasada.\r\nbandeja para hornear. Cubrir con film transparente engrasado\r\ny suba hasta que vuelva a duplicar su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nRetire la película y cocine los bollos en el estante superior.\r\ndurante 8-10 minutos, hasta que esté dorado. Enfriar en un alambre\r\nestante. Para decorar, mezcla azúcar glas con un\r\nun poco de agua hasta que esté firme pero untable – agregue\r\ncolorante alimentario, si lo deseas. Sumérgete en la parte superior de\r\ncada panecillo y espolvoréelos con chispas."]','2026-01-11 12:57:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13435,9335,'es','pasteles galeses','Pice ar y maen, una delicia galesa a la hora del té transmitida de generación en generación y que sigue siendo tan popular como siempre. Perfecto para hacer con los niños','["225 g de harina común","85 g de azúcar en polvo","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de mantequilla, cortada en trozos pequeños","50 g de manteca de cerdo cortada en trozos pequeños y un poco más para freír","50 g de grosellas","1 huevo batido","salpicar leche"]','["Vierta la harina, el azúcar, la mezcla de especias, el polvo para hornear y una pizca de sal en un bol. Luego, con los dedos, frote la mantequilla y la manteca hasta que se desmorone. Incorpora las grosellas. Incorpora el huevo a la mezcla hasta obtener una masa suave, añadiendo un chorrito de leche si parece un poco seca; debe tener la misma consistencia que la masa quebrada.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada hasta alcanzar el grosor de su dedo meñique. Recorta círculos con un cortador de 6 cm y vuelve a enrollar los recortes. Engrase una sartén plana o una sartén pesada con manteca de cerdo y colóquela a fuego medio. Cocine los pasteles galeses en tandas, durante unos 3 minutos por cada lado, hasta que estén dorados, crujientes y bien cocidos. Delicioso servido caliente con mantequilla y mermelada o simplemente espolvoreado con azúcar en polvo. Los pasteles se mantendrán frescos en una lata durante 1 semana."]','2026-01-11 12:57:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13436,9336,'es','Mermelada roly-poly','Esta mermelada roly-poly es sencilla de preparar, reconfortante y seguro que te traerá recuerdos de las tradicionales cenas escolares.','["50 g de mantequilla salada, fría y cortada en trozos, más un poco más para engrasar","250 g de harina con levadura, más un poco para enrollar","1 vaina de vainilla, sin semillas","50 g de sebo rallado","150ml de leche, más una gota más si es necesario","100 g de mermelada de frambuesa o ciruela, o una mezcla","natillas, para servir"]','["Coloque una fuente para asar profunda en el fondo.\r\nestante del horno y asegúrese de que\r\nhay otro estante directamente encima.\r\nSaque la fuente para asar de su estante, llénela\r\ndos tercios con agua hirviendo del\r\nluego deslícela con cuidado nuevamente dentro. Calentar\r\nhorno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Corte un\r\nhoja grande de papel de aluminio y papel vegetal\r\n(unos 30 x 40 cm). Coloque la prueba de grasa\r\nencima del papel de aluminio y untar con mantequilla.","Vierta la mantequilla, la harina y las semillas de vainilla en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos; pulsa hasta que la mantequilla tenga\r\ndesapareció. Vierta en un tazón para mezclar. Revuelva\r\na través del sebo, verter la leche y\r\ntrabaje junto con un cuchillo para cubiertos hasta\r\nobtienes una masa pegajosa. Es posible que necesites un\r\nsuelte más leche, dependiendo de su harina.","Coloca la masa sobre una mesa enharinada.\r\nsuperficie, golpee rápidamente para alisar,\r\nluego extiéndalo hasta formar un cuadrado de aproximadamente 25 x\r\n25cm. Extender la mermelada por todas partes dejando un\r\nespacio a lo largo de un borde, luego enrolle hacia arriba desde el\r\nborde opuesto. Pellizque el borde libre de atascos\r\nen la masa donde se une y pellizca\r\nlos extremos también son toscos. Levante con cuidado sobre el\r\npapel engrasado, con el lado de unión hacia abajo (es posible\r\nle resultará útil una bandeja para hornear plana),\r\nlevante sin apretar el papel y el papel de aluminio alrededor\r\nluego apriételos a lo largo de los bordes.\r\ny termina para sellar. El roly-poly se hinchará\r\nbastante durante la cocción, así que no lo envuelvas\r\ncon fuerza. Levante el paquete directamente sobre el\r\nRejilla encima del molde y cocine durante 1 hora.","Deje reposar el pudín durante 5 minutos antes.\r\nDesenvolver, luego abrir con cuidado el papel de aluminio.\r\ny papel, y cortar en rodajas gruesas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:57:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13437,9337,'es','Tarta mármol de chocolate y naranja','Para un pastel deliciosamente nostálgico, combine una combinación de sabores clásica de naranja y chocolate en este horneado retro de dos tonos.','["225 g de mantequilla muy blanda, más un poco para engrasar","225 g de azúcar en polvo","225 g de harina con levadura","4 huevos grandes, batidos","2 cucharadas de leche","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo, tamizado","1 naranja grande, ralladura y 1 cucharada de jugo de naranja","unas gotas de colorante alimentario naranja (opcional)","50 g de chocolate con naranja (nosotros usamos Maya Gold de Green & Black), partido en trozos"]','["Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Engrase y forre la base de un molde para pan (8 x 21 cm / 2 lb) con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos y la harina en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica o en un procesador de alimentos hasta que no queden grumos.","Dividir la mezcla en dos tazones, batir la leche y luego el cacao en polvo en uno. Batir el jugo de naranja, la ralladura y el colorante alimentario de naranja, si se usa, en el otro.","Vierta cucharadas alternas de la mezcla en el molde para pastel, luego use una brocheta para crear un patrón de mármol arrastrándola a través de la mezcla en remolinos. Asegúrate de no mezclar demasiado o no verás el patrón. Alise la superficie si es necesario.","Hornee el pastel durante 45 a 55 minutos hasta que esté dorado y levado, y al pincharlo con una brocheta, este salga limpio.","Dejar enfriar el bizcocho en el molde y luego desmoldar. Derretir el chocolate en un bol sobre agua apenas hirviendo o suavemente en el microondas. Usa una cuchara para rociar el chocolate sobre el pastel."]','2026-01-11 12:57:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13438,9338,'es','Pastel de pan de Madeira','Un clásico bizcocho inglés, delicadamente aromatizado con limón y almendras, perfecto para el té de la tarde.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda y un poco más para engrasar","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos grandes","ralladura de 1 limón","unas gotas de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina con levadura","50 g de almendras molidas"]','["1 Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base de un molde para pan de 900 g con papel vegetal. Con una batidora eléctrica, bata la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén suaves y cremosos y luego agregue los huevos uno a la vez. Agrega la ralladura de limón y la vainilla. Ahora agrega la harina y las almendras hasta obtener una masa espesa. La masa debe quedar lo suficientemente suelta como para que se caiga de una cuchara de madera; si está demasiado espesa, mézclela con un chorrito de leche.","Vierta la masa en el molde y alise por encima. Hornee durante 55 minutos – 1 hora hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, ésta salga limpia. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar durante 15 minutos, luego desmoldar, retirar el papel y dejar sobre una rejilla que se enfríe por completo antes de cortarlo. El pan se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:57:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13439,9339,'es','Bollos de Eton','Tome la clásica combinación de fresa, crema cuajada y merengue y sírvala en bollos fáciles de preparar: irresistibles.','["400 g de harina con levadura, más un poco más para espolvorear","¼ cucharadita de sal","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubos","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo, más un poco más para espolvorear","200 ml de suero de leche","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","5 cucharadas de leche, más extra para cepillar","un buen puñado de fresas pequeñas, partidas por la mitad","tarro pequeño buena mermelada de fresa","2 nidos de merengue, desmenuzados en trozos","Tarro de 200ml de nata cuajada"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nMezclar la harina, la sal y el polvo para hornear.\r\njuntos en un tazón grande. Frote la mantequilla\r\no mezcle todo en un procesador de alimentos para\r\nmigajas finas, luego agregue el azúcar.","Calentar el suero de leche, la vainilla y la leche.\r\na temperatura manual, luego revuélvalo rápidamente\r\nen la mezcla de harina con un cuchillo. Usando\r\ntus manos, junta la masa,\r\nteniendo cuidado de no trabajar demasiado la mezcla.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.\r\nsuperficie de trabajo y déle palmaditas hasta obtener un espesor de 2,5 cm.\r\nredondo. Selle círculos de 12 x 5 cm.\r\nespolvorear el cortador con harina mientras\r\nsello: tendrás que volver a darle palmaditas a los recortes\r\npara hacer 12. Coloque las rodajas en una superficie enharinada.\r\nbandejas para hornear, unte la parte superior con leche\r\ny espolvorear con un poco más de azúcar.\r\nHornee durante 12-15 minutos hasta que esté dorado.","Para servir, triture ligeramente\r\nfresas con la mermelada y doblar\r\nlos merengues en la nata cuajada.\r\nVierta un poco de mezcla de fresas\r\ncada bollo dividido y cubra con una cucharada\r\nde crema de merengue."]','2026-01-11 12:57:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13440,7115,'es','Tartas de cerezas y almendras','Estos mini bocados Bakewell combinan masa y pastel y están diseñados para prepararse en lotes y cocinar congelados.','["Paquete de 375 g de hojaldre con mantequilla","75 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","12 cucharaditas de mermelada de guindas redondeadas","75 g de bizcocho natural o bizcocho de Madeira","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","75 g de almendras molidas","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos medianos","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","25 g de almendras laminadas","100 g de azúcar glas tamizada para decorar"]','["Extender la masa muy fina\r\nuna superficie ligeramente enharinada. sellar\r\nCírculos de 12 x 9 cm con un cortador acanalado, si\r\nTienes uno y úsalo para forrar una lata de panecillo.\r\nUnte 1 cucharadita colmada de mermelada de cerezas.\r\nen el fondo de cada tarta.","Batir el pastel hasta que quede desmenuzado en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos, luego viértalo en una mezcla\r\nbol y agregue la harina, la mantequilla, molida\r\nalmendras, azúcar en polvo, huevos y almendra\r\nextraer. Batir hasta que quede suave,\r\nluego dividir entre las tartas,\r\nextendiendo un poco con el dorso de una\r\ncucharadita para cubrir la mermelada. dispersión\r\nsobre las almendras laminadas y abrir el congelador\r\ndurante 2 horas, luego envuélvalo bien en film transparente\r\nfilmar y congelar por hasta 2 meses.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4\r\ncon una bandeja para hornear dentro. Desenvuelva el\r\ntartas del congelador y cubra sin apretar\r\ncon una hoja de papel de aluminio. Hornear a fuego lento\r\nbandeja para hornear durante 30-40 minutos hasta\r\ndorado, retirando el papel de aluminio hasta la mitad.\r\nEnfriar un poco las tartas y luego añadir un chorrito.\r\nde agua en el azúcar glas para hacer\r\nun glaseado líquido. Rociar sobre las tartas\r\ny dejar reposar."]','2026-01-11 12:57:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13441,9340,'es','Bizcocho','Parkin es un bizcocho tradicional del norte de Inglaterra aromatizado con melaza almibarada, avena y jengibre. ¡Un delicioso capricho a la hora del té!','["200 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","1 huevo grande","4 cucharadas de leche","200 g de almíbar dorado","85 g de melaza","85 g de azúcar moreno suave y claro","100 g de avena mediana","250 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharada de jengibre molido"]','["Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Engrase un molde para pastel cuadrado de 22 cm/9 pulgadas de profundidad y forre con papel para hornear. Batir el huevo y la leche junto con un tenedor.","Derrita suavemente el almíbar, la melaza, el azúcar y la mantequilla en una cacerola grande hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Retirar del fuego. Mezcle la avena, la harina y el jengibre y agregue la mezcla de almíbar, seguido del huevo y la leche.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde y hornee durante 50 minutos - 1 hora hasta que el pastel se sienta firme y un poco crujiente por encima. Déjelo enfriar en la lata, luego envuélvalo en más pergamino y papel de aluminio y guárdelo durante 3 a 5 días antes de comerlo, si puede; se volverá más suave y pegajoso cuanto más tiempo lo deje, hasta 2 semanas."]','2026-01-11 12:57:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13442,9341,'es','Pastel llovizna de Pimm','Utilice los sabores de una taza veraniega de Pimm en este sencillo horneado. Un cóctel en forma de pastel, cubierto con fresas y hojas de menta para un impresionante postre de verano.','["225 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","225 g de fresas, en cuartos","100ml Pimm''s","1 naranja, rallada y en jugo","275 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos","225 g de harina con levadura","125 g de azúcar glas","un puñado de hojas de menta"]','["Unte con mantequilla un molde para pan de 2 litros y forre con papel de hornear. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner las fresas en un bol y añadir la mitad de los Pimm, la mitad del zumo de naranja y 25 g de azúcar en polvo. Reserva para macerar mientras haces el bizcocho.","Batir la mantequilla, 225 g del resto del azúcar en polvo y la ralladura de naranja con una batidora eléctrica hasta que la mezcla esté espesa, cremosa y de color más claro. Batir los huevos, uno a la vez, añadiendo una cucharada de harina entre cada uno para evitar que se cuajen. Incorpora la harina restante, vierte en el molde y hornea durante 45 minutos a 1 hora, o hasta que al insertar un pincho en el medio salga limpio.","Mientras tanto, vierta el jugo de naranja restante, el Pimm''s y el azúcar en polvo en una cacerola pequeña. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 5-10 minutos hasta obtener un almíbar ligero. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Dejar enfriar el bizcocho en el molde durante 15 minutos. Mientras el pastel se enfría, cuela las fresas a través de un colador colocado sobre un bol. Pincha la parte superior del pastel con una brocheta y luego vierte sobre el almíbar de Pimm. Una vez que el pastel se haya enfriado por completo, combine el azúcar glas con suficiente líquido de maceración reservado para crear un glaseado líquido (necesitará aproximadamente 1 cucharada de líquido). Rocíe esto sobre el pastel y luego cubra con las fresas coladas y las hojas de menta."]','2026-01-11 12:57:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13443,9342,'es','Sándwich victoria de limón, frambuesa y almendras','Haz un pastel central para una reunión de verano. Esta versión de un sándwich victoria viene con un toque especial en forma de bizcocho de almendras y frambuesa.','["225 g de mantequilla salada, blanda, más un poco más para la lata","almendras tostadas","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla o almendras","2 limones, rallados","2 cucharadas de leche","4 huevos medianos, a temperatura ambiente (use huevos de \"yema dorada\" para obtener un rico bizcocho amarillo)","125 g de harina con levadura","100 g de almendras molidas","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","250 frambuesas","250ml de nata doble","100 g de mascarpone","2-3 cucharadas de azúcar glas, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla o almendras"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla dos moldes para pastel de 20 cm y forrar con papel para hornear. Esparce la mitad de las almendras tostadas sobre la base de una de las latas, asegurándote de que estén distribuidas uniformemente.","Vierta la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo en un tazón grande con el extracto de vainilla o almendras y la ralladura de limón, y bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave, suave y cremoso, aproximadamente de 3 a 4 minutos. Agrega la leche, luego los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien entre cada adición. Incorpora la harina, las almendras molidas, la levadura en polvo y una pizca de sal hasta que no queden rayas de harina.","Divide la mezcla entre las latas preparadas, teniendo cuidado de no alterar demasiado las almendras tostadas al esparcirla. Nivele la parte superior y luego introduzca la mitad de las frambuesas en la mezcla. Hornee en el centro del horno durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén dorados y leudados, y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Si queda algo de mezcla húmeda adherida a la brocheta, regrese al horno por otros 5 minutos y luego vuelva a probar. Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 30 minutos, luego retirar sobre una rejilla, retirar el papel de hornear y dejar enfriar por completo; los bizcochos quedarán bastante delicados. Una vez enfriados, los bizcochos se mantendrán envueltos y congelados hasta por tres meses.","Para el relleno, vierte en un bol grande la nata, el mascarpone, el azúcar glas y el extracto de vainilla o almendras. Batir durante unos minutos hasta que la crema mantenga su forma.","Coloque el bizcocho simple en un soporte para pasteles o en un plato. Vierta sobre el relleno de crema extendiéndolo hasta el borde. Esparce el resto de las bayas y las almendras tostadas. Haga un sándwich con el segundo bizcocho, con la almendra hacia arriba, luego espolvoree con azúcar glas. Se mantendrá frío en un recipiente hermético hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:57:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13444,9343,'es','Tarta tatin de melocotón','Este pudín hace que parezca que has pasado un verano en Francia aprendiendo el arte del pastelero, pero es simplemente hojaldre y melocotones comprados en una tienda.','["320 g de hojaldre comprado en la tienda","30 g de mantequilla sin sal","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","2 duraznos, deshuesados ​​y cortados en 16 gajos cada uno","helado de vainilla, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4. Utilizar una sartén refractaria de 18 cm como plantilla para cortar un círculo de hojaldre. Derretir la mantequilla en la sartén a fuego lento, agregar el azúcar durante unos minutos hasta que se disuelva y luego agregar los melocotones. Cocine a fuego medio-alto durante 5 minutos hasta que burbujee y la salsa espese.","Retire la sartén del fuego y luego coloque el círculo de hojaldre encima. Meta con cuidado los bordes usando una cucharada. Hornee por 25 minutos o hasta que la masa esté dorada. Dejar reposar 2 minutos antes de desmoldar en un plato. Sirva con helado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13445,9344,'es','pastel de mermelada','Usa toda la mermelada que tengas para hacer este horneado soleado, tal vez con un poco de helado al lado.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para la lata","2 naranjas sin cera","325-350 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos","80 g de mermelada","200 g de harina con levadura","crema doble o helado, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y untar con mantequilla un molde para bizcocho de 23 cm. Ralla las naranjas y luego retira la cáscara y la médula con un cuchillo de sierra pequeño. Dejar de lado. Corta las naranjas a lo largo del ecuador en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor. Espolvoreamos 25 g de azúcar sobre la base del molde y disponemos encima las rodajas de naranja. Reserva mientras preparas el almíbar y la masa para pastel.","Pesar las pieles de naranja en un cazo con la médula y añadir la misma cantidad de azúcar y agua (unos 100 g). Llevar a fuego lento, luego hervir durante 10 minutos hasta que se reduzca y espese. Reservar para infundir hasta que sea necesario, luego colar.","Batir la mantequilla y 200 g de azúcar en una batidora de pie o con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave y esponjosa, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Rompe los huevos, uno por uno, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Finalmente, agregue la ralladura de naranja y la mermelada antes de incorporar con cuidado la harina y una pizca de sal. Vierta la masa sobre las rodajas de naranja y nivele con cuidado la superficie. Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté dorado y al insertar un palillo en el medio, éste salga limpio.","Deje enfriar en el molde durante 15 a 20 minutos antes de invertirlo con cuidado en un plato. Unte un poco del almíbar de naranja amarga por encima (el almíbar sobrante se puede usar para cócteles). El almíbar se mantendrá frío durante dos semanas. Sirva caliente con crema o helado. Una vez completamente frío, el pastel se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:58:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13446,9345,'es','Tarta nevera de galletas y nata','Prepara este bizcocho frigorífico de galletas y nata sin cocinar con la ayuda de tu frigorífico; es ideal para las noches de verano cuando hace demasiado calor para encender el horno.','["aceite sin sabor (como vegetal), para la lata","600ml de nata doble","200ml mascarpone o queso tierno","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 cucharadas de azúcar glas","4 paquetes de 154 g de galletas tipo sándwich rellenas de crema de chocolate, más extra para servir","200 g de chocolate negro, partido en trozos pequeños"]','["Engrase un molde para pastel desmontable o de fondo suelto de 20 cm y cúbralo con papel para hornear, asegurándose de que el interior del molde esté completamente cubierto. Batir la crema, el mascarpone, la vainilla y el azúcar glas en un tazón grande hasta que quede suave y con picos suaves.","Forrar la base del molde con una sola capa de galletas, (no te preocupes si quedan pequeños huecos, ya que estos se rellenarán con la mezcla de crema). Vierta sobre un tercio de la mezcla de crema y alise con una espátula, extendiéndola hasta el borde. Repita dos veces con el resto de las galletas y la mezcla de crema. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos 24 horas, o hasta dos días.","Derrita el chocolate en ráfagas de 20 segundos en el microondas o en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una olla con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que la base del recipiente no toque el agua. Dejar enfriar durante 10 min. Desenvolver el bizcocho, desmoldarlo y quitarle el pergamino. Rocíe sobre el chocolate derretido, deje que gotee por los lados y desmenuce sobre las galletas adicionales. Sirva o enfríe por hasta 1 hora."]','2026-01-11 12:58:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13447,9346,'es','Esponja Victoria tradicional definitiva','Lleve el clásico bizcocho Victoria a un nivel completamente nuevo usando crema diplomática en lugar de crema batida estándar y bayas dulces maceradas.','["225 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para las latas","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","225 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","2 cucharadas de leche","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","½ limón, exprimido","1 vaina de vainilla, partida y semillas raspadas (la vaina se reserva, ver más abajo)","½ manojo pequeño de menta, con las hojas recogidas y machacadas","200 g de fresas, peladas y partidas por la mitad","125 g de frambuesas","500 g de natillas frescas","1 vaina de vainilla, solo la vaina","50 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de natillas en polvo","300ml de nata doble"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base y los lados de dos moldes para sándwich de 20 cm.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica durante 8 a 10 minutos, o hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos. Agrega los huevos uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada adición. Tamice la harina, el polvo para hornear y la sal e incorpore con una cuchara de metal grande. Agregue suficiente leche para crear una consistencia que gotee.","Divida la masa entre los moldes preparados y alise la parte superior con una espátula. Hornee en el estante medio del horno durante 25 a 30 minutos, o hasta que estén dorados y firmes al tacto. Deje enfriar un poco en las latas, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Mientras tanto, hacer las bayas maceradas. Mezcle el azúcar, el jugo de limón, la vainilla y la menta hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Agregue suavemente las fresas y las frambuesas hasta que estén cubiertas con la mezcla. Transfiera al refrigerador y enfríe durante 30-45 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Para hacer la crema diplomática, poner las natillas, la vaina de vainilla y el azúcar en una cacerola a fuego medio y llevar a ebullición, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Mezcle las natillas en polvo con 3 cucharadas de agua para diluir y revuelva hasta que quede suave. Batir con la natilla hirviendo, luego reducir el fuego a fuego lento y continuar batiendo durante 2-3 minutos hasta que espese. Poner en un recipiente resistente al calor y dejar enfriar un poco, luego enfriar hasta que se enfríe por completo. Batir la nata doble hasta obtener picos suaves y, cuando la crema esté fría, retirar la vaina de vainilla y agregar la nata hasta que la mezcla esté lo suficientemente espesa como para verter.","Escurrir las bayas maceradas, reservando el líquido. Para armar, esparza la mitad de la crema diplomática sobre uno de los bizcochos y luego cubra con tres cuartos de las bayas. Invierta el segundo bizcocho encima, de modo que la base plana del bizcocho quede hacia arriba y espolvoree con un poco de azúcar glas. Coloque la crema diplomática restante en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla de estrella y coloque rosetas alrededor del borde del pastel. Coloque el resto de las bayas entre las rosetas de crema y sirva con el líquido de maceración reservado al lado; no lo vierta antes de servir, ya que dividirá la crema diplomática. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:58:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13448,9347,'es','Tarta de té de frambuesa y pistacho','Agregue glaseado de frambuesa a este pastel de té de pistacho y no solo obtendrá un encantador toque de color sino también un sabor fabuloso. Es perfecto para el té de la tarde.','["150 g de pistachos sin cáscara","275 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250 g de mantequilla, ablandada","3 huevos","275 g de harina con levadura","75 g de yogur griego","un poco de leche, si es necesario","flores de azúcar, azúcar perlada o chispitas, para decorar (opcional)","150 g de frambuesas","300 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar un molde para bizcocho de 15 x 25 cm. Pon los pistachos en un procesador de alimentos con la mitad del azúcar y bate hasta que las nueces estén finamente picadas. Vierta en un bol, agregue el resto del azúcar y la mantequilla y bata con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede cremoso. Agrega los huevos uno a la vez, luego bate la harina y el yogur hasta que quede suave, agregando un poco de leche si está demasiado espesa.","Vierta la masa en el molde, nivele y hornee durante 50-55 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos y luego desmoldar el bizcocho sobre una tabla. Retire y deseche el papel para hornear, luego déjelo enfriar por completo. Cortar en cuadrados prolijos.","Para hacer el glaseado, poner las frambuesas en una cacerola con 2 cucharadas de agua y cocinar brevemente hasta que estén suaves y jugosas. Pasa la mezcla por un colador y desecha las pepitas. Agrega el azúcar hasta obtener un glaseado suave y rosado.","Vierta el glaseado sobre el bizcocho enfriado y luego decore con flores de azúcar, azúcar perlado o chispas, si lo desea. Dejar reposar antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13449,9348,'es','Tarta de queso con frutos rojos de tres capas','Prepare este espectacular pastel de queso para el entretenimiento del verano. Cubra con fresas o una mezcla de bayas frescas, además de un chorrito de chocolate para disfrutar aún más.','["100 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","200 g de galletas digestivas","2 hojas de gelatina","50 g de frambuesas","50 g de azúcar en polvo, más 2 cucharadas","350 g de fresas","500 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","250ml de nata doble","unas gotas de colorante alimentario rojo o rosa","1 cucharada de pasta de vainilla","50 g de chocolate blanco, derretido","unas gotas de extracto de limón (opcional)"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre la base y los lados de un molde desmontable de 20 cm. Mezcle los digestivos en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener migajas finas, o tritúrelos en una bolsa para sándwiches con un rodillo. Transfiera a un tazón y agregue la mantequilla derretida hasta que parezca arena húmeda. Vierta en la lata preparada y alise la mezcla con el dorso de una cuchara para formar una base uniforme, luego enfríe.","Remojar las hojas de gelatina en agua fría. Coloque las frambuesas en un procesador de alimentos o en una jarra con una batidora y mezcle hasta obtener un puré suave. Tamizar las semillas. Caliente la salsa de frambuesa en una cacerola pequeña con 1 cucharada de azúcar hasta que empiece a hervir, luego vierta sobre 1 hoja de gelatina escurrida en un tazón y revuelva para que se disuelva.","Mezcle 3 (aproximadamente 65 g) de fresas en un procesador de alimentos y caliéntelas con 1 cucharada de azúcar de la misma manera. Vierta en un tazón y agregue la otra hoja de gelatina escurrida.","Batir el queso tierno, la nata y el azúcar en polvo hasta que empiece a espesarse. Dividir en tres tazones (unos 260 g por tazón). Doble el puré de fresa en uno con unas gotas de colorante alimentario para que quede rosa claro, la mezcla de frambuesa con la gelatina en otro con más colorante alimentario para que quede rosa oscuro y la pasta de vainilla en el tercero.","Vierta el relleno de frambuesa sobre la base de galleta, alisando la superficie para que quede plana. Luego, agregue el relleno de fresa, alisando suavemente sin alterar la capa inferior, luego repita con la mezcla de vainilla, usando una cuchara limpia para nivelar la parte superior. Una espátula o un cuchillo pueden ayudar con esto para evitar arrastrar las capas inferiores. Enfríe durante 4 horas o toda la noche.","Pasa un cuchillo por los lados del molde para pastel entre la tarta de queso y el pergamino y afloja la base. Transfiera a una base para pasteles y alise los lados, usando una espátula, para ordenar las capas. Mezcla el chocolate con unas gotas de extracto de limón, si lo usas. Apila las fresas restantes, algunas en rodajas y otras enteras, encima y rocíalas con el chocolate para terminar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13450,9349,'es','Tarta de aceite de oliva con fresas y pistachos','Prueba este versátil bizcocho de fresas y pistachos elaborado con aceite de oliva y polenta o harina de maíz. Perfecto para el té de la tarde o como postre, además no contiene gluten.','["200ml de aceite de oliva, más un extra para la lata","225 g de pistachos sin cáscara","200 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos grandes","150 g de harina fina de maíz o polenta","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten","200 g de fresas picadas y un poco más para servir","azúcar glas y crema fresca o yogur, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar y forrar la base de un molde para bizcocho de 23 cm. Pon 200 g de pistachos en una licuadora y bate hasta que parezcan almendras molidas.","Batir el azúcar y los huevos con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos; esto debería tomar unos 5 minutos. Agrega el aceite de oliva, batiendo continuamente, luego incorpora los pistachos molidos, la harina de maíz o polenta y la levadura en polvo con una pizca de sal. Incorpora las fresas y luego mételas en la lata. Pica los pistachos restantes en trozos grandes y espárcelos por encima.","Hornee durante 50-55 minutos hasta que esté dorado y levado. Deje enfriar en el molde a temperatura ambiente antes de transferirlo a un soporte para pasteles o a un plato. Espolvoree con azúcar glas y sirva con crema fresca o yogur y más fresas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13451,9350,'es','tarta tropical','Crea un impresionante diseño geométrico en esta tarta de frutas tropicales usando triángulos de mango y kiwi o pitahaya y piña, o imagina el tuyo propio.','["100 g de mascarpone","140 g de queso crema","30 g de azúcar glas","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","¼ cucharadita de extracto de coco (opcional)","50 ml de crema de coco de lata, agitada primero (guarda el resto para otra receta)","1 caja de repostería dulce","fruta tropical de su elección, en rodajas, luego cada rebanada cortada en triángulos o en las formas requeridas para su diseño (usamos mangos, kiwis, piña y pitahaya)"]','["Con una batidora eléctrica, bata el mascarpone, el queso crema, el azúcar, la vainilla, el extracto de coco, si lo usa, y una pizca de sal hasta que quede suave. Incorpora la crema de coco.","Vierta el relleno en la masa de hojaldre, alise la parte superior y regrese al refrigerador por al menos 2 horas o toda la noche. Una vez lista, use la fruta tropical para decorar la parte superior de la tarta con el patrón geométrico que desee."]','2026-01-11 12:58:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13452,9351,'es','Tarta de arándanos y pistachos con crema de cardamomo','La lectora Janine Watkins comparte su receta para un sándwich de bizcocho de celebración ligero y con sabor a nuez, con notas florales y bayas explosivas.','["4 huevos grandes","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más un poco más para espolvorear","175 g de mantequilla, derretida y enfriada","200 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","85 g de pistachos molidos","50 g de arándanos","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","200 g de azúcar glas","semillas de 6 vainas de cardamomo, molidas","200ml de nata doble","85 g de pistachos, picados en trozos grandes","200 g de arándanos"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase ligeramente y forre la base de\r\n2 moldes para sándwiches de 20 cm con horneado\r\npergamino. Engrasar las latas nuevamente\r\nespolvorear con un poco de azúcar en polvo y un\r\nun poco de harina y luego saque el exceso.","Poner los huevos y el azúcar en un recipiente resistente al calor.\r\nbol y, con unas varillas eléctricas, mezclar\r\nbrevemente para combinar. Coloque el recipiente encima \r\nuna cacerola con agua humeante y continúe\r\nbatir hasta que la mezcla esté pálida y espesa\r\n– cuando se levanta la batidora, la mezcla\r\ndebe dejar un rastro en la superficie que dure\r\nunos 5 segundos. Retire el recipiente del\r\nsartén y continuar batiendo durante 2 minutos.","Continúe batiendo la mezcla mientras\r\nchorreando la mantequilla derretida alrededor del\r\nborde del recipiente. Tamizar la harina y\r\npistachos molidos, muy suavemente darle al\r\nmezcle 2-3 veces, luego agregue los arándanos\r\ny doblar de nuevo, teniendo cuidado de no golpear\r\nsacar todo el aire. Divida la mezcla entre\r\nlos moldes y hornear durante 25-30 minutos, hasta que\r\nAl insertar una brocheta, ésta sale limpia.","Para hacer el relleno, batir la mantequilla y\r\nel azúcar hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Añadir\r\nel cardamomo y luego rociar con la crema.\r\nContinúe batiendo hasta que esté suave y aireado.","Enfríe los pasteles en sus moldes durante 10 minutos y luego\r\ncolóquelo sobre una rejilla. quitar el revestimiento\r\npapel cuando esté completamente frío. Sándwich\r\nlas tortas junto con el cardamomo\r\ncrema, cubra con un poco más y luego\r\ndecorar con pistachos y arándanos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13453,9352,'es','Pastel de arándanos y crema cuajada','Bizcocho de arándanos y nata cuajada, el pastel de fiesta afrutado perfecto','["200 g de azúcar en polvo","200 g de mantequilla blanda","4 huevos batidos","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de leche","150 g de arándanos","50 g de azúcar en polvo","227 g de nata cuajada en bote","4 cucharadas de conserva de arándanos","un puñado de arándanos, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Untar con mantequilla dos moldes para sándwich de 20 cm y forrar con papel de horno antiadherente. En un tazón grande, bata todos los ingredientes del pastel hasta obtener una masa suave y tersa. Incorpora los arándanos a la masa cruda antes de hornear.","Divida la mezcla entre las latas, alise\r\nla superficie con una espátula o el dorso de una cuchara, luego hornee durante unos 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y el pastel salte hacia atrás al presionarlo. Colóquelo en una rejilla para enfriar y déjelo enfriar por completo.","Para hacer el relleno, bata la mantequilla hasta que quede suave y cremosa, luego agregue gradualmente el azúcar glas. Agrega el extracto de vainilla si lo estás usando. Unte la crema de mantequilla sobre el fondo de uno de los bizcochos, cúbralo con mermelada y coloque el segundo bizcocho encima. Espolvorea con un poco de azúcar glas antes de servir. Guárdelo en un recipiente hermético y cómelo dentro de los 2 días siguientes.","Para un relleno simple, agregue el azúcar en polvo a la crema cuajada.  Emparede los bizcochos con la confitura de arándanos y un tercio del relleno de nata cuajada. Cubra con la crema restante y decore con arándanos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13454,9353,'es','Pastel de ruibarbo y cuajada de limón','Un bizcocho de limón salpicado de tiernos trozos de ruibarbo de color rosa y cubierto con un delicioso glaseado de crema.','["225 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para la lata","225 g de azúcar en polvo","ralladura de 1 limón","4 huevos medianos a temperatura ambiente, batidos","75 g de almendras molidas","200 g de harina con levadura","140 g de ruibarbo forzado, lavado y cortado en trozos pequeños","1 cucharada de azúcar demerara","75ml de nata doble","3 cucharadas de cuajada de limón, más un poco más para rociar"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nUnte con mantequilla ligeramente un bizcocho hondo y redondo de 20 cm.\r\nestañar y forrar la base con un círculo de\r\npapel para hornear antiadherente.","Coloque la mantequilla en un tazón grande y\r\nbatir con una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté suave\r\ny esponjoso, luego agrega el azúcar en polvo y\r\nralladura de limón y volver a batir. agregue gradualmente\r\nlos huevos a la mezcla, batiendo bien con\r\ncada adición, hasta que esté completamente combinado. el\r\nLa mezcla comenzará a verse brillante – si al\r\nEn cualquier momento la mezcla cuaja, batir en un\r\ncucharada de almendras molidas y continuar\r\nagregar el huevo hasta que esté todo amalgamado.","Agregue las almendras molidas, luego el\r\nharina y doblar todo con cuidado\r\njuntos usando una cuchara grande. doblar\r\na través de la mitad del ruibarbo, luego transfiera\r\nla mezcla en el molde para pastel preparado\r\ny espolvorear con el ruibarbo restante.\r\nTerminar con el azúcar demerara espolvoreado\r\nencima. Hornea el pastel durante 45 minutos, o\r\nhasta que se inserte una brocheta en el medio\r\nsale limpio. Transfiera a una rejilla\r\ndejar enfriar un poco en el molde y luego retirar\r\nde la lata. Cuando el pastel esté frío,\r\nhacer la cobertura.","Montar la nata en un bol grande hasta que\r\nforma picos suaves. En un tazón pequeño, afloje\r\nla cuajada de limón con aproximadamente 1 cucharada de agua\r\ny doblarlo con cuidado por la nata,\r\nsin trabajar demasiado. Extender sobre el\r\nbizcocho, rociar con un poco más de limón\r\ncuajar y servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:58:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13455,9354,'es','Pastel de fresas y semillas de amapola','Un ligero bizcocho de vainilla salpicado de semillas y cubierto con glaseado de naranja y fresas frescas: celestial','["4 cucharadas de semillas de amapola","200 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida, más un poco más para engrasar","225 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","4 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","225 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja grande","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada de licor de naranja (opcional)","Bote de 170 g de yogur griego entero","Bote de 500 ml de crema fresca entera","350 g de fresas cortadas en rodajas y más para servir (opcional)"]','["Freír las semillas de amapola en una sartén\r\na fuego suave durante 2 minutos o hasta que esté aromático.\r\nDejar enfriar. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase y forre 2 moldes para sándwich de 20 cm.","Mezclar la harina y hornear.\r\npolvo, luego reservar. poner los huevos\r\ny el azúcar en un tazón grande para mezclar. Usando\r\nbatidoras eléctricas, bata hasta que esté espeso y pálido\r\ny espumoso. Vierta la mantequilla enfriada y\r\nextracto de vainilla y volver a batir brevemente.\r\nTamizar la mezcla de harina, agregar 3 cucharadas de amapola\r\nsemillas luego, usando una cuchara grande de metal,\r\nincorporar con cuidado a la mezcla del pastel hasta que\r\nIncluso. Vierta la mezcla en los moldes y\r\nhornee por 25 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y\r\nelástico al tacto. Enfriar en las latas\r\ndurante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla.","Para hacer el almíbar, calentar la naranja.\r\nzumo y 50 g de azúcar en el\r\nmicroondas durante 30 segundos. Agregue el licor,\r\nsi lo usa. Con un cuchillo de sierra grande, corte\r\ncada pastel por la mitad horizontalmente para hacer una\r\ntotal de 4 círculos. Cepille el lado cortado y\r\nbordes de cada círculo con abundante\r\nalmíbar de naranja tibio.","Para hacer el relleno, batir\r\nel yogur, la crème fraîche, el resto\r\nazúcar y ralladura de naranja hasta que espese y\r\nuntable. Apila los pasteles con el\r\nrelleno cremoso y fresas, acabado\r\ncon una capa cremosa encima. Espolvorea el\r\nlas semillas de amapola restantes por encima, luego\r\nDeje reposar el pastel durante 30 minutos antes de cortarlo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13456,9355,'es','pastel de rosas inglés','Un impresionante pastel de capas florales, aromatizado con agua de rosas y cubierto con crema de vainilla, glaseado de frambuesa y pétalos cristalizados.','["350 g de mantequilla blanda","500 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","6 huevos grandes","200 g de yogur natural desnatado","500 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharadita de agua de rosas","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1-2 cucharaditas de agua de rosas (según tu gusto)","85 g de frambuesas, descongeladas si están congeladas, más 100 g para decorar","250 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","300ml de nata doble","trozos de pétalos de rosa y pétalos de rosa cristalizados (ver paso a paso arriba), para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase y forre la base y los lados de\r\nPastel redondo de fondo suelto de 3 x 20 cm\r\nmoldes con papel para hornear. Dar propina a todos los\r\ningredientes para el pastel en un tazón grande\r\ny batir con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que esté bien\r\ncombinado. Divida la mezcla entre\r\nlos 3 moldes para pastel y alisar la parte superior. hornear\r\ndurante 45 minutos, cambiando las latas hasta la mitad\r\npara que se cocinen uniformemente. dejar enfriar\r\ndurante 10 minutos en los moldes, luego retirar y\r\ntransfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer el almíbar de rosas, pon el azúcar.\r\nen una cacerola con 100ml de agua y calentar hasta\r\nel azúcar se ha disuelto. Sube el calor\r\ny burbujear durante 1-2 minutos, luego retirar\r\ndel calor. Añade el agua de rosas: empieza\r\ncon 1 cucharadita y al gusto, como algunas variedades.\r\nson mucho más fuertes que otros – solo sé\r\nTenga cuidado porque el almíbar estará muy caliente.\r\nVierta la mitad del almíbar sobre los 3 bizcochos.\r\ny dejar a un lado.","Agrega 2 cucharadas de almíbar a las frambuesas.\r\ny aplastarlos con un tenedor. Empuje el\r\nframbuesas a través de un colador en un bol y\r\ndesecha las semillas. Tamizar el azúcar glas\r\ny mezcle hasta obtener un glaseado suave. en un segundo\r\ntazón, agregue otras 2 cucharadas de almíbar\r\ny la vainilla a la nata y batir\r\nhasta que forme picos suaves. Enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Para armar, coloque un pastel, con el lado plano\r\nhacia arriba, sobre un plato o soporte para pasteles, y cubra\r\ncon la mitad de la nata y un tercio de la\r\nframbuesas restantes (ver consejos,\r\na continuación). Coloca otro pastel encima\r\ny añadir la nata restante, otra\r\nun tercio de las frambuesas, luego la última\r\npastel. Alisar el glaseado de frambuesa.\r\npor encima, dejando que llovizne hacia abajo\r\nlos lados. Para decorar utilizamos un\r\nmezcla de trozos de pétalos de rosa (disponibles\r\nen tiendas de cocina o en línea), caseras\r\nPétalos de rosa cristalizados (ver paso a paso arriba) y\r\nlas frambuesas reservadas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13457,9356,'es','Bizcocho de melocotón, pistacho y chocolate blanco','Un bizcocho denso y delicioso estilo tienda de té con glaseado de chocolate blanco y queso crema.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda","200 g de azúcar en polvo","300 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","3 huevos grandes","200 g de yogur griego entero","200 g de chocolate blanco en barra, 50 g rallado y el resto partido en trozos","2 melocotones, deshuesados ​​y cortados en trozos de 1 cm o más pequeños","trozos de chocolate blanco (ver arriba)","Tarrina de 200 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","200 g de yogur griego","3 cucharadas de pistachos finamente picados"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nUntar con mantequilla y forrar la base y los lados.\r\nde un molde para bizcocho hondo de 22 cm con\r\npergamino, luego batir el resto del\r\nmantequilla y el azúcar juntos hasta que estén pálidos.\r\nAgrega la harina, el polvo para hornear, la vainilla,\r\nhuevos, yogur y chocolate rallado.\r\nBatir y luego agregar los duraznos.","Vierta en el molde y hornee por 1 hora.\r\nhasta que salga un pincho insertado\r\nlimpio. Dejar enfriar en la lata.","Para hacer el glaseado, derrite el chocolate.\r\ntrozos en un tazón sobre una cacerola de apenas\r\nagua hirviendo, luego retirar del\r\nel calor. Batir el queso tierno en un\r\ntazón para mezclar hasta que quede suave, luego bata\r\nel yogur hasta que quede suave. Raspe en el\r\nchocolate derretido y batir nuevamente. relajarse\r\nhasta que esté listo para usar.","Agite el glaseado sobre la parte superior del\r\npastel y esparcir sobre los pistachos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13458,9357,'es','Pastel de pomelo y semillas de amapola','Un molde para bizcocho le da un bonito acabado a este bizcocho de cítricos, rociado con un sabroso glaseado de mantequilla.','["175 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","300 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","300 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","225 ml de nata agria","ralladura de 2 pomelos y 3 cucharadas de jugo","4 cucharaditas de semillas de amapola, tostadas","100 g de azúcar en polvo","25 g de mantequilla","ralladura de 1 pomelo, más 4 cucharadas de jugo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEnmantecar y luego enharinar un Bundt o anillo de 1,5 litros.\r\nestaño. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar.\r\nhasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Batir los huevos, uno\r\na la vez, seguido de la vainilla, la harina,\r\nlevadura en polvo, crema agria, pomelo\r\nralladura y jugo, y semillas de amapola tostadas.\r\nRaspe la lata y nivele. hornear\r\ndurante 40-55 minutos, dependiendo de la forma\r\nde tu lata, hasta que al introducir un pincho salga\r\nsalir limpio. Dejar enfriar un poco en el molde\r\nmientras haces el glaseado.","Calentar suavemente el azúcar en polvo, la mantequilla y\r\nJugo de toronja para derretir la mantequilla. traer\r\nhasta que hierva, luego reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 3 min. Retirar del fuego, agregar\r\nla ralladura y dejar enfriar durante unos 10 minutos hasta\r\nespesa y almibarada.","Coloque el pastel caliente en una fuente para enfriar.\r\nrejilla y unte la mitad del glaseado sobre la\r\npastel. Vierta el resto, poco a poco,\r\nentonces se hunde."]','2026-01-11 12:58:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13459,9358,'es','Rodaja de lima y coco helado con fruta de verano','Este postre sin cocción se sirve directamente del congelador para disfrutar del verdadero placer del verano.','["300ml de nata doble","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","250 ml de crema de coco","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","800g de frutos rojos variados (nosotros utilizamos fresas, frambuesas y grosellas)","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","jugo 1 lima"]','["Forrar un molde para pan de 900 g con suficiente adhesivo.\r\npelícula para permitirle envolver los lados\r\nla parte superior de la lata más adelante. batir la nata\r\ncon el azúcar hasta que coja picos. batir\r\nen crema de coco y el zumo de lima y\r\nRalladura hasta que recupere su forma. Inclínate hacia\r\nestañar y alisar la parte superior, envolver el film\r\nVuelva a colocar la película y colóquela en el congelador durante\r\nal menos 4 horas pero preferiblemente durante la noche.\r\nSe puede hacer con hasta 2 semanas de anticipación.","Antes de servir, mezcle toda la fruta con\r\nel azúcar y la lima y reservar. Cuando esté listo para servir, saque la rebanada del congelador (no la saque antes como lo haría con la mayoría de los otros postres helados).\r\nDesmoldar la loncha sobre una bandeja larga y fría.\r\nplato, luego use un cuchillo mojado en agua muy\r\nagua caliente para cortar porciones gruesas. servir\r\nen platos para servir fríos con el\r\nfruta esparcida alrededor."]','2026-01-11 12:58:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13460,9359,'es','Tarta de moras y manzana','Un bizcocho de frutas húmedo, repleto de los mejores productos de temporada y con un toque de almendra y canela también.','["125 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","125 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos grandes, batidos","50 g de almendras molidas","100 g de harina con levadura","2 manzanas Discovery, Russet o Worcester, peladas y sin corazón, cada una cortada en 12 gajos","100 g de moras","1 pizca grande de canela","2 cucharadas de azúcar demerara","25 g de mantequilla, cortada en hojuelas pequeñas","25 g de avellanas peladas y tostadas, picadas en trozos grandes","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nUnte con mantequilla un trozo redondo de fondo suelto de 22 cm\r\nmolde para pastel y forrar la base con papel para hornear\r\npergamino. Batir la mantequilla y las ruedas.\r\nazúcar junto en un tazón grande hasta que\r\nes ligero y esponjoso. Vierta poco a poco y\r\nbatir los huevos, poco a poco, hasta\r\nhas usado dos tercios, agregando harina\r\nsi se cuaja. Incorpora el huevo restante,\r\nlas almendras molidas y finalmente la harina,\r\ny combinar todo suavemente.","Añade dos tercios de las manzanas a la\r\nmezcla de bizcocho y todas las moras.\r\nConvierte la mezcla en la lata preparada.\r\ny alisarlo uniformemente. esparcir el\r\nmanzanas restantes sobre la superficie del\r\npastel. Para la cobertura, espolvorear sobre\r\ncanela, azúcar demerara y mantequilla.\r\nHornee durante 50-55 minutos o hasta que se forme una brocheta.\r\nsale limpio. Retire el pastel de\r\nal horno y esparcir sobre las tostadas\r\navellanas. Cuando el bizcocho esté frío, espolvorear\r\nligeramente con azúcar glas. Servir en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13461,7665,'es','Tarta helada de tiramisú','Deleite a sus invitados con este impresionante postre de verano, perfecto para cenas al aire libre','["2 tarrinas de mascarpone de 250 g","115 g de azúcar en polvo","6 cucharadas de marsala","50 g de chocolate amargo, picado","Tarro de 142 ml de nata doble, ligeramente batida","5 cucharadas de café recién molido","85 g de azúcar en polvo","3 cucharadas de brandy","Bolsa de 200g de bizcochos italianos, nosotros utilizamos galletas Savoiardi Boudoir","cacao, para espolvorear","Tarro de 142 ml de nata doble, ligeramente batida","virutas o rizos de chocolate"]','["Forrar un molde para pan de 1 kg con film transparente. Batir el mascarpone, el azúcar y el marsala. \r\nluego agregue el chocolate y la crema.","Preparar el café con 600 ml de agua hirviendo, dejar reposar 5 minutos y colar en un \r\ntazón y agregue el azúcar y el brandy.","Reserva 2 galletas y sumerge rápidamente el resto en el café a medida que las uses. \r\nmezcla y colóquelos a lo largo de la base y hacia los lados largos de la lata (se mantendrán \r\npor encima del borde).","Vierta la mitad de la mezcla cremosa. Mojar las últimas galletas en el café y colocarlas de punta a punta. Vierta el resto de la mezcla cremosa encima, luego doble los dedos del bizcocho por encima del borde y presione ligeramente en el relleno. Cubrir y congelar. Para servir, desmoldar en un plato, quitar el film transparente y espolvorear generosamente con cacao. Vierta la nata por el centro y decore con el chocolate."]','2026-01-11 12:58:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13462,9360,'es','Pastel de grosella espinosa y naranja','Aproveche el exceso de jardín en esta sencilla y afrutada adaptación de un clásico: sírvala con natillas para obtener un pudín ganador.','["225 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","225 g de azúcar en polvo","225 g de harina con levadura","4 huevos grandes","ralladura y jugo 1 naranja","225 g de grosellas, sin cabeza ni cola","140 g de azúcar granulada"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nUnte con mantequilla y forre una bandeja para hornear de 20 x 30 cm.\r\ncon papel para hornear.","Poner la mantequilla, el azúcar en polvo, la harina,\r\nhuevos y ralladura de naranja en un bol. batir\r\nbien con una batidora eléctrica hasta\r\ncremoso y suave. Agregue el\r\ngrosellas, luego vierta en la lata\r\ny nivelar la superficie. Hornear por 35 minutos\r\nhasta insertar una brocheta en el bizcocho\r\nsale limpio.","Revuelva el jugo de naranja y granulado.\r\nazúcar juntos, verter sobre la superficie\r\ndel bizcocho caliente y dejar enfriar y\r\nconjunto. Cortar en cuadrados."]','2026-01-11 12:58:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13463,9361,'es','Receta clásica de sándwich Victoria','El bizcocho Victoria, el pastel de fiesta perfecto, es un horneado tradicional que a todos les encantará. También es fácil para preparar un pastel de bodas','["200 g de azúcar en polvo","200 g de mantequilla blanda","4 huevos batidos","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de leche","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","140 g de azúcar glas tamizada","gota de extracto de vainilla (opcional)","medio tarro de 340g de mermelada de fresa de buena calidad","azúcar glas, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Untar con mantequilla dos moldes para sándwich de 20 cm y forrar con papel de horno antiadherente.","En un tazón grande, bata 200 g de azúcar en polvo, 200 g de mantequilla blanda, 4 huevos batidos, 200 g de harina con levadura, 1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo y 2 cucharadas de leche hasta obtener una masa suave y tersa.","Dividir la mezcla entre los moldes, alisar la superficie con una espátula o el dorso de una cuchara.","Hornee durante unos 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y el pastel vuelva a su sitio al presionarlo.","Colóquelo en una rejilla para enfriar y déjelo enfriar por completo.","Para hacer el relleno, bata los 100 g de mantequilla blanda hasta que quede suave y cremoso, luego agregue gradualmente 140 g de azúcar glas tamizada y una gota de extracto de vainilla (si lo está usando).","Unte la crema de mantequilla sobre el fondo de uno de los bizcochos. Cúbralo con 170 g de mermelada de fresa y coloque el segundo bizcocho encima.","Espolvorea con un poco de azúcar glas antes de servir. Guárdelo en un recipiente hermético y cómelo dentro de los 2 días siguientes."]','2026-01-11 12:58:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13464,9454,'es','Pastel de boda sencillo y elegante','Para hacer un pastel de bodas de tres niveles, todo lo que necesitas hacer es multiplicar las mezclas y glaseados básicos para pasteles, ¡y tómate tu tiempo!','["Tarro de 340g de mermelada de fresa (opcional)","Tarro de 340 g de mermelada de albaricoque, calentada y tamizada","4 kg de glaseado blanco listo para enrollar","Tabla para tartas redonda fina de 15 cm, 23 cm y 30 cm.","Tabla para tartas redonda de 40 cm de grosor.","palitos de cóctel","espátula","un rollo de papel para hornear","una bandeja para hornear plana o un levantador de pasteles","azúcar glas, para extender","cuerda, para medir","8 x varilla larga de plástico","tijeras de cocina","Cinta de raso blanca de 3½ m x 1½ cm","tubo de cola UHU, o similar","Dummies de poliestireno para tartas de 12 y 15 cm.","Alambre para floristería de calibre 18, cortado en trozos de unos 20 x 10 cm","15-20 cabezas de hortensias blancas y verde pálido (consiga algunas más pequeñas, otras más grandes, si puede); tu florista puede aconsejarte","Cajas para tartas con tapa de 40 cm, 30 cm y 18 cm, si vas a transportar la tarta"]','["Para el nivel inferior, triplique las cantidades para la receta fácil de pastel de vainilla, luego vierta en un molde para pastel redondo, profundo y de 30 cm, ya forrado. Hornee durante 2 horas y 15 minutos en el estante del medio a la misma temperatura, hasta que suba y esté bien cocido. Mientras se cocina, prepare una tanda cuádruple del almíbar de la misma receta; esto será suficiente para los tres pasteles. Dejar enfriar y bañar el bizcocho con almíbar como antes.","Para los niveles medio y superior, duplique las cantidades para la receta fácil de pastel de vainilla, luego colóquelo en moldes para pastel de 15 cm y 23 cm ya forrados, llenando cada uno hasta aproximadamente dos tercios de su capacidad. Hornéelos juntos en el estante del medio, sacando el pastel pequeño después de 1 hora 15 minutos y dejando cocinar el pastel más grande durante 1 hora 30 minutos en total. Si sabes que tu horno tiene puntos calientes, mueve rápidamente los pasteles después de 50 minutos. Deje enfriar y moje con almíbar como antes.","Ahora, coloca capas y cubre los pasteles. Prepara la crema de mantequilla como en la receta fácil de pastel de vainilla. Necesitará 5 veces la cantidad básica; esto es mucho, así que divida las cantidades pesadas en dos antes de comenzar a mezclar. Quizás te sobra algo, pero mejor demasiado que muy poco. Pesa la crema de mantequilla: necesitarás aproximadamente 400 g para el bizcocho de 15 cm, 600 g para el bizcocho de 23 cm y 1,3 kg para el bizcocho de 30 cm. Unte un poco de crema de mantequilla sobre la tabla para tartas de 15 cm. Nivela la parte superior del pastel si es necesario y luego voltea el pastel de 15 cm sobre ella. Dividir en tres con un cuchillo para pan. Nos gusta marcar el frente del pastel en cada capa antes de levantarlo, usando palillos, para que podamos volver a armarlo exactamente de la manera correcta. Primero quita el tercio superior (lo que era la parte inferior del pastel) y reserva. Corta con cuidado la capa intermedia y déjala a un lado también. Una bandeja para hornear plana o un levantador de pasteles pueden ser muy útiles en este caso para deslizar las capas del pastel y luego volver a colocarlas una sobre otra.","Extienda una capa de crema de mantequilla sobre el pastel en la tabla. Devuelva la capa intermedia, alineando las marcas de los palillos, luego extienda otra capa de crema de mantequilla encima. Agregue un poco de mermelada si lo desea, salpique y luego distribuya uniformemente. Cubra con el último trozo de pastel y luego quite el polvo de las migajas que haya sobre o alrededor del pastel. Ahora unta todo el bizcocho con una fina capa de mermelada de albaricoque. Esto debería evitar que queden demasiadas migas en la crema de mantequilla. Coloque todo el pastel sobre una hoja grande de papel para hornear.","Extienda el resto de la crema de mantequilla, comenzando por la parte superior, luego alise y remueva por los lados y hasta la tabla. Repite todo el proceso con el resto de bizcochos, utilizando las tablas correspondientes y las diferentes cantidades de buttercream. Los pasteles ya están listos para ser glaseados. Puede dejarlos toda la noche si es necesario, cubiertos sin apretar con film transparente.","Cubre el pastel. Necesitarás unos 500 g de glaseado para el bizcocho de 15 cm, 1 kg para el bizcocho de 23 cm y 1,7 kg para el bizcocho de 30 cm. Espolvorea la superficie de trabajo con azúcar glas, amasa el glaseado hasta que esté flexible, luego usa el rodillo para enrollarlo formando un círculo lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir los lados y la parte superior del pastel, con un poco de sobrante. Utilice una cuerda para comprobar el tamaño. Usa tu rodillo para ayudarte a levantar el glaseado sobre el pastel.","Alise el glaseado alrededor del pastel con las manos, pasándolo por los bordes y bajando hasta la tabla. Luego, corte el exceso con un cuchillo afilado, al ras con el fondo de la tabla para pasteles. Suaviza cualquier marca con las palmas de las manos, puliendo el glaseado hasta obtener un ligero brillo.","Una vez que hayas glaseado todos los pasteles, cubre la base gruesa. Cepille ligeramente con agua hervida enfriada y luego coloque el glaseado encima. Recorta hasta el borde de la tabla con un cuchillo (hacemos esto como lo harías con una base de pastel, sosteniendo la tabla con la mano izquierda y el cuchillo con la derecha), luego deja que la tabla y los pasteles se sequen durante la noche.","Apila los pasteles. Los tacos, que son básicamente palos de plástico, brindan estabilidad y resistencia a los pasteles escalonados, y los bloques de poliestireno le permiten agregar una capa \"flotante\" de flores. Al medir y cortar las clavijas del mismo largo que el poliestireno, proporcionarás una plataforma uniforme para que se asiente el siguiente pastel, incluso si el pastel de abajo está un poco torcido.","Coloca el muñeco de 15 cm en el centro encima del pastel más grande. Inserta cuatro de los tacos en el pastel, alrededor del exterior del muñeco, en forma cuadrada. Empújelos hacia abajo hasta que se encuentren con el tablero del pastel. Marca con un bolígrafo hasta dónde llega la parte superior del chupete.","Saque con cuidado las clavijas; luego, usando unas tijeras, marca alrededor de cada clavija donde la marcaste. Rompe el plástico limpiamente. Vuelva a insertar las clavijas en sus orificios originales, con el extremo redondeado hacia abajo. Repite el proceso con la tarta de 23cm y el chupete de 12cm.","Coloque el pastel más grande en el medio de la tabla cubierta. Pase una fina línea de pegamento alrededor de la placa base y fije la cinta a su alrededor. Fija la cinta alrededor de cada pastel, usando un poco de pegamento en la cinta para asegurarlo a sí mismo. Si vas a trasladar el pastel a un lugar, colócalos en sus cajas ahora. Haz un pequeño kit para llevar contigo (pegamento, tijeras, etc.) en caso de que tengas que volver a hacer algo.","Un día, apilar y decorar. Usamos hortensias: son hermosas y puedes lograr un efecto dramático con relativamente pocas flores.","Ese día, deja de poner las flores en el pastel hasta lo más tarde que puedas. Corta los tallos de las hortensias a unos 2-3 cm. Divide la flor que menos te guste en trozos más pequeños; esto te ayudará a llenar los huecos incómodos más adelante. Asegúrate de guardar una hermosa flor para la parte superior.","Inserte un trozo de alambre de floristería en cada tallo (o enróllelo alrededor del tallo), dejando una punta de alambre de unos 3 cm de largo. Empuje esto dentro del muñeco de poliestireno. Repita hasta que los dos muñecos estén rodeados por un halo de flores. La torta inferior debería estar ahora en su posición permanente, alejada de la luz directa y de los radiadores. Levante el bizcocho de 23 cm sobre el muñeco de poliestireno inferior, con cuidado de no aplastar ningún pétalo, luego repita con el bizcocho superior. Llene los espacios con la cabeza de flor rota que reservó anteriormente. Coloca la flor final encima del pastel y ¡listo! Los pasteles se pueden congelar con antelación, sin glasear. Sin embargo, si los horneas tres días antes de la boda, la tarta estará bien hasta el gran día.","Corta el pastel a lo ancho, en forma de cuadrícula, en lugar de en gajos. Deberías poder obtener 50 porciones del bizcocho grande, 30 del medio y 12 de la parte superior, cuando lo cortas en trozos de 2,5 x 5 cm."]','2026-01-11 12:58:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13465,9362,'es','Pastel de bodas del día de verano de Frances Quinn','Frances crea su propia versión de la última tendencia nupcial: el pastel "desnudo". Se salta el tradicional glaseado de fondant y opta por mascarpone con bayas de temporada.','["1,375 kg de mantequilla ligeramente salada, ablandada, más algo extra para engrasar (comprar 6 paquetes de 250 g)","1,375 kg de azúcar en polvo dorado","21 huevos grandes","2 cucharadas de extracto de vainilla","1,375 kg de harina con levadura","210 g de almendras molidas","rallar 21 limones grandes, más 10 cucharadas de jugo de limón","600 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","700ml de zumo de limón (utiliza los limones de la mezcla del bizcocho)","manojo grande de menta fresca, hojas rotas","2 kilos de mascarpone","2 x 325 frascos de cuajada de limón de buena calidad","1 kg de frambuesas","azúcar glas, para espolvorear","aproximadamente 1,2 kg de bayas y cerezas variadas (nosotros utilizamos fresas, cerezas, arándanos, moras y grosellas rojas)","unas hojas de menta","surtido de flores sin rociar (ver consejo a continuación)","Molde para pastel de 30 cm de profundidad","Molde para pastel de 20 cm de profundidad","Molde para pastel de 10 cm de profundidad","coser algodón, para cortar pastel","Tablas para tartas finas de 20 y 10 cm.","paleta para pastel (opcional, pero muy útil)","unas 20 pajitas de plástico","2 rejillas grandes","soporte o tabla para pasteles grande","cinta floral o papel de cocina"]','["Para hacer los pasteles, calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3. Para el nivel inferior, engrase un molde para pasteles de 30 cm de profundidad con mantequilla, luego cubra la base y los lados con una doble capa de papel para hornear.","Con una batidora eléctrica, bata 400 g de mantequilla con 400 g de azúcar en polvo. Batir 6 huevos en una jarra con ½ cucharada de vainilla, luego agregar gradualmente a la crema de mantequilla, batiendo entre adiciones. Una vez combinado, tamizar 400 g de harina, mezclar con 60 g de almendras molidas y añadir la ralladura de 6 limones. Agrega suavemente 3 cucharadas de jugo de limón.","Vierta el molde para pastel preparado y nivele la parte superior con una espátula. Hornee en el estante medio del horno durante 1 hora. No te preocupes si la parte superior se ve un poco oscura, ya que se convertirá en la base. El pastel estará listo cuando la superficie se sienta elástica al tacto y al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 30 minutos, luego colóquelo sobre una rejilla grande o use 2 rejillas más pequeñas juntas.","Para hacer un nivel medio, forre un molde para pastel de 20 cm de profundidad como antes y haga el pastel siguiendo el método del paso 2, usando 4 huevos y 250 g de azúcar, harina y mantequilla cada uno. Añade la ralladura de 4 limones, 40 g de almendras molidas, 1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla y 1½ cucharada de jugo de limón. Hornee por 50 minutos, probando como antes.","Para el nivel superior, use un molde para pastel hondo de 10 cm y haga el pastel siguiendo el método anterior, usando 1 huevo, 75 g de azúcar, harina y mantequilla, 10 g de almendras molidas, la ralladura de 1 limón, 1 cucharadita de vainilla y ½ cucharadita de jugo de limón. Hornee por 30 minutos.","Repita los pasos 1 a 4 para tener 2 niveles inferiores, 2 niveles intermedios y 1 nivel superior. Dejar hasta que todos los bizcochos estén completamente fríos. Una vez enfriados, los pasteles se pueden envolver en una doble capa de film transparente y guardar en un lugar fresco hasta por 4 días, o congelar hasta por 1 mes. Para descongelar, deja los bizcochos a temperatura ambiente durante la noche.","Para hacer el almíbar. Poner el azúcar y el jugo de limón en una cacerola a fuego medio-alto. Cocine a fuego lento durante unos 10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Retirar del fuego, mezclar con la menta, luego dejar enfriar y reposar hasta por 5 horas. Colar en una jarra o bol, luego cubrir con film transparente y enfriar hasta que esté listo para usar. El almíbar ahora se conservará hasta por 1 semana.","Para hacer la crema de mascarpone. Vaciar el mascarpone en un bol grande. Batir con una batidora eléctrica para que se ablande un poco, luego incorporar 300 ml de almíbar de limón y menta enfriado hasta que esté completamente combinado (guarde el almíbar restante para armar). Enfríe hasta que esté listo para usar, pero déjelo a temperatura ambiente durante 20 minutos para que se ablande antes de usarlo. Se puede hacer 1 día antes del montaje.","Para montar la tarta. Dividir las dos tartas de 30 cm y las dos de 20 cm por la mitad por el centro, y la tarta de 10 cm en 4 capas. Use la paleta para pastel o una tabla de cortar grande para ayudar a mover los bizcochos y voltee una de las capas más grandes sobre un plato para servir o un soporte para pasteles, de modo que la parte superior del pastel ahora se convierta en la parte inferior. Vierta un poco del almíbar reservado y luego unte con un poco del relleno de mascarpone de limón con una espátula o un cuchillo pequeño. Rocíe un poco de cuajada de limón y luego espolvoree con frambuesas. Ahora cubra con la capa restante, de modo que la parte inferior del pastel se convierta en la parte superior, realineando los palillos para garantizar que el pastel esté nivelado. Luego, coloque más almíbar, mascarpone, cuajada de limón y frambuesas con los bizcochos de 30 cm restantes.","Introduzca 6 pajitas en el centro del pastel en forma de círculo, de no más de 20 cm de diámetro; estas servirán de soporte para el siguiente nivel. Corta las pajitas donde sobresalen del pastel, para que queden al ras de la parte superior. Repita el montaje con los dos pasteles de 20 cm, colocándolos en tablas delgadas para pasteles antes de colocarlos encima de los pasteles más grandes, luego introduzca más pajitas para sostener el lazo superior. Finalmente, ensambla la capa superior usando el mismo método. Extienda el mascarpone restante encima y luego espolvoree ligeramente los niveles con azúcar glas. Decore con una variedad de bayas variadas, ramitas de menta y flores (vea el consejo a la izquierda)."]','2026-01-11 12:58:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13466,9363,'es','Profiteroles de moca picantes','Una receta clásica de lucro con un toque añadido para los amantes del café: ¡prepare un lote como si fuera un pastel de bodas moderno!','["100 g de harina común","85 g de mantequilla sin sal","3 huevos batidos","4 cucharadas de natillas de ave en polvo","6 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","600ml de leche","2 cucharadas de esencia de café (disuelva 2 cucharadas de café instantáneo granulado en 2 cucharadas de agua caliente; usamos Nescafé Partners’ Blend)","284ml de nata doble","100 g de azúcar glas","100 g de chocolate negro, en trozos","50 g de mantequilla","50ml de cafe","1-2 cucharadas de licor de café como Kahlúa"]','["Tamiza la harina en un bol y agrega una pizca de sal. Poner la mantequilla y 200 ml de agua fría en una cacerola, llevar a ebullición y luego retirar del fuego. Agregue la harina y la sal y revuelva para formar una pasta suave. Ahora bate la mezcla hasta que empiece a despegarse de los lados del molde, luego vierte sobre un plato y deja enfriar.","Caliente el horno a 200 ° C/ventilador 180 ° C/gas 6. Regrese la pasta a la sartén, luego agregue gradualmente los huevos y mezcle bien. Coloque bolas del tamaño de una nuez en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 20 a 25 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Retirar del horno, pinchar la parte inferior con una cucharadita, darle la vuelta y luego hornear durante 5 minutos para que se seque. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla antes de rellenar.","Para el relleno, mezcla las natillas en polvo y el azúcar con un chorrito de leche hasta tener una pasta suave. Calienta la leche restante y luego agrega la pasta. Vierta la mezcla en una cacerola y llévela a ebullición, revolviendo. Cocine por 5 minutos hasta obtener una natilla espesa. Agregue el café y luego déjelo enfriar. Batir suavemente la nata, tamizar el azúcar glas y mezclar, luego incorporar a la\r\nnatillas. Coloca la crema en cada panecillo choux.","Para la salsa, derrita el chocolate y la mantequilla con el café en un bol en el microondas a temperatura media durante 1-2 minutos. Vierta el licor, mezcle bien y luego vierta sobre los bollos rellenos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13467,9364,'es','Pastel de vainilla fácil','Un bizcocho húmedo bañado con almíbar de vainilla. Úselo como base para una variedad de fabulosos pasteles de celebración.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","semillas raspadas de 1 vaina de vainilla o 1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","5 huevos grandes, partidos en una jarra","85 g de harina común","100 g de yogur griego entero (yo usé Total)","250 g de harina con levadura","3 cucharadas de leche semidesnatada","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","semillas ½ vaina de vainilla o ½ cucharadita de pasta de vainilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase un molde redondo de 20 cm de profundidad y luego\r\nforrar la base y los lados con antiadherente\r\npapel para hornear.","Usar batidores eléctricos o una mesa\r\nbatidora, batir la mantequilla, el azúcar, la vainilla y\r\n¼ de cucharadita de sal hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa,\r\nluego vierta los huevos, uno a la vez,\r\ndándole a la mezcla una muy buena paliza\r\nantes de agregar el siguiente. Agrega 1 cucharada de\r\nharina común si la mezcla comienza a verse viscosa\r\nen lugar de esponjoso. Incorpora el yogur.","Mezclar las harinas; luego, usando un metal grande\r\ncuchara, incorporarlos a la masa y seguir\r\npor la leche. Vierta la mezcla en la lata.\r\ny hornee por 1 hr 20 mins o hasta que esté bien\r\nLevantado y dorado – una brocheta insertada en\r\nel medio debe salir limpio.","Mientras tanto, haga el almíbar suavemente\r\ncalentar 50ml de agua con el azúcar y\r\nvainilla en una cacerola hasta que el azúcar se disuelva.\r\nDejar de lado. Una vez que el pastel esté fuera del\r\nhorno, dejar enfriar durante 30 minutos en el\r\nlata, luego use una brocheta para hacer agujeros en todos\r\nsobre el pastel, yendo directo al fondo.\r\nVierta el almíbar, dejándolo completamente\r\nremojar después de cada adición. dejar enfriar\r\ncompletamente, luego envuelva el pastel\r\nbien o llenarlo y ponerle hielo. Si lo envuelves con\r\npapel para hornear y film transparente, el\r\nEl pastel sin relleno se conservará bien hasta por 3\r\ndías, o en el congelador hasta por un mes.","Para obtener ideas sobre cómo decorar el pastel y probar algunas variaciones de esta mezcla básica para pastel, eche un vistazo a las recetas \"Combina bien con\" pastel de bodas simple y elegante, pastel de cumpleaños y pastel de celebración de verano."]','2026-01-11 12:58:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13468,9365,'es','Pastelitos de rosas románticos','Estos cupcakes decorativos son el centro de mesa perfecto para una boda o un bautizo, o un bonito regalo.','["Bote de 150ml de yogur natural","3 huevos batidos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","140 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de almendras molidas","175 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","100 gramos de chocolate blanco","140 g de mantequilla sin sal","140 g de azúcar glas"]','["Forrar un molde para muffins de 12 huecos con fundas de papel y calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. En una jarra, mezclar el yogur, los huevos y el extracto de vainilla. Pon los ingredientes secos, más una pizca de sal, en un tazón grande y haz un hueco en el medio.","Agregue la mezcla de yogur y la mantequilla derretida, y dóblelo rápidamente con una espátula o una cuchara de metal; no trabaje demasiado. Vierta en el\r\ncajas (estarán bastante llenas) y hornee durante 18-20 minutos o hasta que estén doradas, levadas y elásticas al tacto. Deje enfriar durante unos minutos, luego levante los pasteles sobre una rejilla para que se enfríen por completo. Guárdelo en un recipiente hermético hasta por 3 días o congélelo lo antes posible.","Glaseado de chocolate blanco: Derrita el chocolate en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 1½ minutos, revolviendo hasta la mitad. Dejar enfriar. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar glas en un tazón grande hasta que esté cremoso.  Incorpora el chocolate. Cubra y enfríe por hasta un mes.","Hasta 48 horas antes de servir (o el día anterior si hace mucho calor), deje que el glaseado vuelva a estar a temperatura ambiente y luego extiéndalo sobre los pasteles. Coloque la cinta alrededor de los pasteles ahora si lo desea, atándola o pegándola en su lugar. Manténgase fresco, alejado de la luz solar directa."]','2026-01-11 12:58:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13469,8781,'es','Creando tu pastel de bodas','El pastel de bodas de Jane Hornby es el más simple hasta ahora. Y cada nivel tiene un sabor diferente, por lo que hay algo para todos...','["1 x nivel superior, ver ''Combina bien con''","1 x nivel medio, ver ''Combina bien con''","1 x nivel inferior, ver ''Combina bien con''","Medio tarro de mermelada de albaricoque de 454g, el resto lo usarás más tarde.","Paquete de 500g de mazapán natural","500 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","1 kg de azúcar glas tamizada","tarro de cuajada de limón de buena calidad","Caja de 142ml de nata doble.","200 g de barra de chocolate natural (70% cacao), partido en trozos","PASTEL DE FRUTAS - 500g/1lb2oz glaseado blanco listo para enrollar, pasta colorante para alimentos en crema","PASTEL DE LIMÓN - 1kg/2lb4oz de glaseado blanco listo para enrollar, pasta colorante alimentario rosa empolvado","PASTEL DE CHOCOLATE - 1,7 kg/3 lb 10 oz de glaseado blanco listo para enrollar, pasta colorante alimentario color marfil","PARA LA TABLA: 800 g/1 lb 12 oz de glaseado blanco listo para enrollar, pasta de colorante alimentario color marfil","200 g de azúcar glas","1 clara de huevo","varillas de pasador","Molde redondo hondo de 15 cm, 23 cm y 30 cm","mucho papel vegetal","tambor de pastel plateado de 35 cm de diámetro (base) de espesor","tablero de pastel plateado delgado de 15 cm, 23 cm y 30 cm de diámetro","cuchillo de sierra largo","espátula","pastas colorantes alimentarios crema, marfil y rosa","rodillo largo","6 varillas de plástico estándar","tijeras de cocina fuertes","Cinta de color marfil de 1 m, 15 mm de ancho","pincel de artista mediano","rejilla de enfriamiento","cuerda para medir","Cajas para pasteles de 20 cm, 25 cm y 33 cm con tapa (si se transporta el pastel)"]','["CUBRIR LA TARTA DE FRUTAS CON EL MAZAPÁN: Cómo hacerlo: \r\nHervir la mermelada de albaricoque con 2 cucharadas de agua y colarla en un bol. Pincelamos la tabla de tarta de 15 cm con un poco de mermelada de albaricoque. Corta la parte superior redondeada del pastel y dale la vuelta sobre la tabla. Mida la parte superior y los lados del pastel con un hilo, córtelo a medida y reserve el hilo. Unte todo el bizcocho con una fina capa de mermelada de albaricoque.","Espolvorea la superficie de trabajo con azúcar glas y enrolla el mazapán formando un círculo lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir la parte superior y los lados del pastel, usando el hilo cortado como guía. Levantar sobre el bizcocho y alisar con las manos. Recorta el mazapán hasta la base del bizcocho (para que no se vea el tablero) y déjalo secar un día si es necesario. De lo contrario, el pastel se puede congelar inmediatamente.","LLENE Y CUBRA LAS TORTAS DE CHOCOLATE Y LIMÓN CON CREMA DE MANTEQUILLA: Agregar cuajada de limón de buena calidad o ganache de chocolate sedoso transforma la simple crema de mantequilla en un relleno delicioso.","Cómo se hace: Primero haz la crema de mantequilla. Batir la mantequilla hasta que esté cremosa y luego incorporar poco a poco la mezcla tamizada.\r\nazúcar glas. Pese 600 g/1 libra 5 oz de la mezcla y agregue 5 cucharadas de cuajada de limón.","En una cacerola pequeña, hierva la crema y luego vierta sobre el chocolate. Deje reposar durante 2 minutos y luego revuelva hasta que quede suave. Una vez que esté frío pero aún líquido, incorpórelo a la crema de mantequilla básica restante.","Una vez que cada pastel esté completamente frío, nivele la parte superior con un cuchillo de sierra largo. Extienda un poco de la crema de mantequilla correspondiente sobre la fina tabla de pastel a juego. Voltee el pastel sobre la tabla y úntelo con una fina capa de mermelada de albaricoque tamizada; esto ayuda a evitar que las migajas perdidas entren en la crema de mantequilla.","Corta en tres capas horizontalmente; no te preocupes si cortas las capas de manera desigual, ya que no afectará el pastel terminado. Si es un día caluroso o hace calor en tu cocina, refrigera los pasteles por un tiempo; esto los reafirmará y hará que cortarlos y levantarlos sea mucho más fácil. Levante cada capa a medida que la corte y déjela a un lado para que cuando vuelva a apilar las capas estén en el orden correcto.","Si has preparado la crema de mantequilla con antelación y se ha endurecido un poco, caliéntala en el microondas en modo Descongelar durante 10 segundos y bate bien. Con una espátula, esparza aproximadamente 1/4 de la crema de mantequilla sobre la primera capa del pastel. Para el pastel de limón, agregue otra cucharada de cuajada de limón sobre el glaseado. Apila las capas restantes de esta manera, extendiendo todo el glaseado restante sobre la parte superior y los lados del pastel, alisándolo hasta que se encuentre con la base de cartón del pastel. Alise todo con la espátula y reserve. Los pasteles ahora están listos para cubrirlos con glaseado listo para enrollar. Rellenos con crema de mantequilla y glaseados, los pasteles se conservarán hasta por 3 días.","CUBRIR TODAS LAS TORTAS CON HELADO LISTO PARA ENROLLAR: El siguiente paso es colorear sutilmente los diferentes niveles con las pastas colorantes marfil, rosa palo y crema.","Cómo hacerlo: solo para el pastel de frutas con mazapán, primero unte ligeramente con agua hervida fría para ayudar al glaseado.\r\npalo. Para todos los pasteles, espolvorea la superficie de trabajo con azúcar glas y amasa el glaseado hasta que esté flexible. Añade unas cuantas motas de colorante alimentario con un palillo o con la punta de una brocheta; sé muy moderado, ya que un poco es suficiente. Trabaja el color hasta obtener una pasta suave y de color uniforme. Agrega más y vuelve a amasar si quieres que el color sea más intenso.","Vuelva a espolvorear ligeramente la superficie de trabajo y enrolle el glaseado formando un círculo lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir los lados y la parte superior del pastel, con un poco de exceso. Utilice una cuerda para medir como antes. Levanta el glaseado sobre el pastel, ayudándote del rodillo.","Alise el glaseado alrededor del pastel con las manos y luego recorte el exceso con un cuchillo afilado. Dejar secar durante la noche. Una vez helado conservar durante 3 días.","Una vez que hayas glaseado las tartas, cubre la base de 35 cm. Unte ligeramente con agua hervida fría y cubra con glaseado de color marfil. Recortar y dejar secar durante la noche.","APILA LOS PASTELES: Los tacos dan estabilidad y resistencia a los pasteles escalonados. Midiendo y cortando\r\nCon las clavijas del mismo largo, estarás proporcionando una plataforma uniforme para que se asiente el siguiente pastel, incluso si tu pastel está un poco torcido. Para este pastel, los niveles están apilados como escalones, justo descentrados.","Cómo se hace: En un tazón grande, bata gradualmente el azúcar glas con la clara de huevo hasta que esté espeso y suave. Cubrir con\r\nfilm transparente hasta que esté listo para usar.","Comenzando con el pastel de chocolate, inserte tres varillas formando un triángulo, ligeramente desplazadas hacia un lado y no más anchas que la base del pastel de limón que se pondrá encima. Con un bolígrafo permanente, marque ligeramente en la clavija el lugar donde llega la parte superior del glaseado.","Saque con cuidado las clavijas y alinéelas sobre la superficie de trabajo. Usando una regla, vuelva a marcar cada varilla hasta el punto más alto. Marque los tacos con unas tijeras alrededor de las nuevas marcas y rompa el plástico limpiamente.","Vuelva a insertar las varillas en sus orificios originales, con el extremo redondeado hacia abajo. Corte la fina cinta de color marfil para que quepa alrededor de la base gruesa y asegúrela en la parte posterior con pegamento o cinta adhesiva de doble cara. Para apilar los pasteles, vierta un poco de glaseado real sobre cada uno de los agujeros para las clavijas. Levante con cuidado el pastel de chocolate sobre la tabla cubierta, luego apile los pasteles encima de uno.\r\notro, colocando cada pastel y bajando suavemente un lado sobre la base o pastel de abajo. Desliza la espátula debajo en este punto y baja suavemente el pastel. Saca el cuchillo en el último minuto. (Si vas a trasladar el pastel al lugar del evento, colócalos en sus cajas y llévate el glaseado).","EL PLAN DE TIEMPO: HASTA UN MES ADELANTADO: 1. Hacer el bizcocho de frutas y cubrir con mazapán.  2. Prepare los pasteles de chocolate y limón si los congela; se congelarán hasta por 1 mes (aunque, si puede, es mejor hacerlos frescos).","HASTA 4 DÍAS ADELANTE: 1. Prepare los pasteles de chocolate y limón si los hace frescos; manténgalos bien envueltos en papel para hornear y film transparente en un lugar fresco. 2. Hacer la buttercream de chocolate y limón y reservar en el frigorífico. 3. Haga los pasteles de chocolate y limón si los hace frescos; manténgalos bien envueltos en papel para hornear y film transparente en un lugar fresco. 4. Hacer la buttercream de chocolate y limón y reservar en el frigorífico.","HASTA 3 DÍAS ADELANTE: 1. Rellena y cubre los bizcochos de chocolate y limón con crema de mantequilla y cubre todos los bizcochos y la tabla con glaseado. 2. Inserte las varillas de fijación.","HASTA 2 DÍAS ADELANTE: 1. Escarcha los pétalos de rosa.","DEL DÍA: 1. Apilar los pasteles y decorar con pétalos una vez que estén en su lugar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13470,3710,'es','Ensalada Waldorf','Pica manzanas, apio y nueces para hacer esta clásica ensalada americana, llena de frescura y crujiente. Puedes hacer el aderezo hasta con dos días de antelación.','["50 g de nueces, tostadas y picadas en trozos grandes","2 manzanas (nosotros usamos Granny Smith), picadas en trozos grandes","1 limón, exprimido","100 g de mayonesa","2 cucharadas de yogur estilo griego","½ cucharada de mostaza Dijon","150 g de uvas rojas, partidas por la mitad","3 ramas de apio, finamente cortadas","1 lechuga romana o Little Gem, con las hojas separadas y rotas si son grandes"]','["Calienta una sartén seca a fuego medio-alto y tuesta las nueces durante 3-4 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente doradas y aromáticas. Verter en un bol y dejar enfriar.","Echa las manzanas con un chorrito de zumo de limón para evitar que se decoloren. Combine la mayonesa, el yogur, la mostaza y el jugo de limón restante en un tazón grande y sazone bien. El aderezo se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días. Mezcle las manzanas, las uvas y el apio con el aderezo y mezcle bien en un tazón grande para asegurarse de que todo quede cubierto uniformemente. Coloque las hojas de lechuga en una fuente para servir y vierta sobre la mezcla de manzana y el aderezo restante del tazón. Esparcir sobre las nueces tostadas antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13471,6909,'es','perritos de maíz','Prepare corndogs de inspiración estadounidense cubriendo salchichas de frankfurt con una masa de harina de maíz, luego fríelos y sírvalos con salsa de tomate y mostaza amarilla.','["100 ml de harina de maíz","100 g de harina común","1 huevo, ligeramente batido","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","150ml de leche entera","8 salchichas","aceite vegetal, para freír","ketchup y mostaza americana, para servir"]','["Vierta la harina de maíz, la harina, el huevo, el azúcar en polvo, la sal, el polvo para hornear y la leche en un bol y bata hasta obtener una masa suave y sin grumos. Vierta con cuidado la masa en una jarra o vaso alto.","Empuje una brocheta de madera a lo largo de cada salchicha, de modo que cubra aproximadamente las tres cuartas partes del camino. Llene una sartén no más de un tercio de su capacidad con aceite y caliéntela a 180 ° C, o hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 30 segundos.","Trabajando con una salchicha a la vez, sumérgela en la masa y gírala suavemente para cubrirla; debe quedar completamente cubierta. Eche con cuidado en el aceite y fría durante 2-3 minutos, o hasta que la masa esté crujiente y dorada. Escurrir sobre una hoja de papel de cocina. Repita con las salchichas restantes. Sirva con salsa de tomate y mostaza americana para mojar o rociar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13472,6911,'es','Carne salada simple','Hacer carne salada tierna y jugosa es más fácil de lo que cree. Sirva en sándwich con pan de centeno estilo Nueva York, pepinos encurtidos, mostaza y chucrut.','["1,6 kg de trozo plano de pechuga de ternera en escabeche","2 hojas de laurel","4 zanahorias grandes, peladas pero enteras","1 cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra","4 bayas de enebro","1-2 cucharaditas de azúcar (opcional)"]','["Si puede, deje que la carne en escabeche alcance la temperatura ambiente antes de comenzar dejándola en la encimera de la cocina durante una hora. Acelerará el tiempo de cocción. Pon la carne en una cacerola grande y cúbrela con agua fría. Llevar a ebullición, quitando la espuma espumosa que suba a la superficie. Una vez que se haya eliminado la mayor parte de la espuma, agregue todos los demás ingredientes. Agregarlos ahora significa que no interfieren con el hojeado.","Reduzca el fuego, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 horas 30 minutos - 3 horas 30 minutos o hasta que al introducir un tenedor en la carne se deslice fácilmente; debe estar muy suave. Empiece a comprobar después de 2 horas; no debe haber resistencia al sacar el tenedor de la carne. También puedes usar una brocheta para hacer la prueba; asegúrate de empujarla hacia la parte más gruesa de la carne.","Una vez que la carne esté tierna, apaga el fuego. Déjelo reposar en el licor de cocción si no está listo para comer (puede reposar así hasta por una hora), o use dos tenedores para levantar la carne, deje que se escurra el agua y luego colóquela en una tabla. Conserva el licor si planeas recalentar o congelar la carne salada. Cubra sin apretar con papel de aluminio y déjelo reposar durante 10 a 15 minutos. Para servir, córtela en rodajas gruesas a contrapelo de la carne o se desmoronará. Sirva caliente o frío. Las sobras se conservarán en el refrigerador por tres días y en el congelador hasta por seis semanas. Antes de congelarlo, es mejor cortarlo en rodajas y envolverlo primero en papel para hornear y luego en papel de aluminio. Asegúrate de congelar también la olla de licor de cocina. Cuando quieras comerlo, descongélalo y luego colócalo (con las rodajas dispuestas nuevamente en forma de pechuga entera) en una fuente refractaria con el licor descongelado. Cubrir con papel aluminio y recalentar a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 durante 20 minutos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13473,6913,'es','Pierna de cordero glaseada con arce y chile','Prepare un delicioso glaseado de arce y chile para untar sobre una pierna de cordero, listo para asar: una excelente opción cuando no tiene tiempo para marinar','["2,5 kg de pierna de cordero, en forma de mariposa (pídale a su carnicero que lo haga)","1 manojo de romero, cortado en trozos de 2 cm","100 ml de jarabe de arce","50 g de mostaza de Dijón","2 cucharadas de extracto de levadura","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","3 chiles verdes medianos, rebanados"]','["Coloque la pierna de cordero en mariposa sobre una tabla y use un cuchillo afilado para hacer unos 20 agujeros en todo el lado de la piel. Presione las ramitas de romero profundamente en los agujeros y luego sazone por todos lados.","Para hacer el glaseado, vierta todos los ingredientes en una cacerola pequeña, reserve algunos chiles en rodajas y déjelos hervir. Revuelva para combinar, luego retire del fuego y reserve. Enciende la barbacoa. Estará listo cuando las brasas estén cenicientas y puedas mantener la mano a 5 cm por encima de la parrilla durante al menos 5 segundos.","Coloque el cordero con la piel hacia abajo sobre la parrilla y cocine durante 10 minutos. Voltee con unas pinzas y cocine por 10 minutos más. Repita esto dos veces más durante 5 minutos por cada lado para que el cordero se cocine por un total de 30 minutos. Rocíe con el glaseado, voltee el cordero nuevamente y siga rociando durante otros 10 minutos hasta que esté dorado y pegajoso. Retirar a una tabla, tapar sin apretar y dejar reposar durante 20 minutos. Cortar en rodajas finas para servir y luego esparcir sobre los chiles en rodajas reservados."]','2026-01-11 12:58:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13474,4515,'es','Hamburguesas de ternera de siguiente nivel','Este verano, deléitese con nuestras mejores hamburguesas y panecillos de carne hechos desde cero. Valen la pena el esfuerzo y son perfectos para un entretenido placer de fin de semana.','["250 g de harina blanca normal y un poco más para espolvorear","20 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","5 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","150ml de leche","1 huevo batido","50 g de mantequilla, ablandada","semillas de sésamo, para espolvorear (opcional)","600 g de filete de lomo curado en seco, cortado en trozos grandes","aderezos de su elección, como queso, cebolla, tomate o lechuga","3 cucharadas de mayonesa","2 cucharadas de ketchup o sriracha (o use 1 cucharada de cada uno)","1 cucharada de mostaza americana","1 pepinillo pequeño, finamente picado, más un extra para servir","una pizca grande de ajo granulado"]','["Para hacer tus propios bollos, vierte la harina, el azúcar, la levadura y 1 cucharadita de sal en el tazón de una batidora de pie equipada con un accesorio de paleta. Con el motor en marcha a velocidad media, añade poco a poco la leche y luego la mitad del huevo. Deje mezclar durante unos minutos, luego agregue la mantequilla, poco a poco, hasta que la masa esté elástica y brillante, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Alternativamente, haga esto en un bol usando un batidor eléctrico.","Divida la masa en cuatro y enrolle cada pieza formando una ronda sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Colóquelos bien espaciados en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Presione suavemente para extenderlos un poco y déjelos en un lugar cálido durante 2 horas, o en el refrigerador durante la noche, hasta que dupliquen su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Unte el huevo restante sobre los panecillos y espolvoree con las semillas de sésamo, si las usa. Hornee durante 13-15 minutos hasta que suban y estén dorados. Dejar enfriar. Se puede preparar con un día de antelación.","Para la salsa, mezcle todos los ingredientes y reserve. Puede prepararse con hasta un día de anticipación y mantenerse fría.","Para hacer las hamburguesas, enfríe el filete en el congelador junto a la cuchilla y, si cabe, en el tazón de un procesador de alimentos durante 30 minutos hasta que la carne esté firme pero no congelada. Trabajando rápidamente, vierta la mitad de la carne fría en el procesador de alimentos y presione de ocho a 10 veces hasta que la carne esté picada, teniendo cuidado de no trabajarla demasiado. Vierta la carne picada en una bandeja y repita con el filete restante, luego mezcle ambos lotes con ½ cucharadita de sal. Divida en cuatro porciones y con cuidado forme con cada una una hamburguesa suelta un poco más ancha que los panecillos. No lo trabajes demasiado.","Cocine las hamburguesas lo antes posible después de formarlas. Coloca una sartén grande y pesada a fuego medio. Divida los panecillos y las tostadas, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, en la sartén (es posible que deba hacerlo en tandas). Retirar a un plato, luego dorar las hamburguesas, presionándolas con una espátula mientras se cocinan, durante 4 a 5 minutos por cada lado a fuego medio o de 6 a 7 minutos a fuego medio. Cubra con queso, si lo desea, después de darles la vuelta. Cuando las hamburguesas estén cocidas, armar como prefieras con los panecillos, los aderezos de tu elección y la salsa para hamburguesas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13475,6917,'es','patatas fritas al aire','Aprovecha al máximo una freidora con esta receta de patatas fritas súper crujientes. Son fáciles de hacer y freírlos al aire significa que usarás menos aceite que freírlos, por lo que es una alternativa más saludable.','["4-5 patatas grandes, aproximadamente 1 kg","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o de oliva"]','["Para hacer patatas fritas rectas y limpias, pela las patatas y recorta todos los bordes redondeados para que se conviertan en bloques rectangulares. Corta los bloques en bastones; deben quedar en algún lugar entre las patatas fritas y las patatas fritas gruesas, ya que si son demasiado finas podrían romperse; demasiado espesos y no se cocinarán bien (si lo desea, guarde los restos para hacer puré o agregarlos a las sopas). Alternativamente, corte las papas sin pelar en chips sin recortarlas, si no le molesta la limpieza. Enjuague las patatas fritas y séquelas con un paño de cocina limpio.","Coloque las patatas fritas en el fondo de una freidora (la parte con la paleta), agregue el aceite y mezcle las patatas fritas en el aceite para que queden cubiertas uniformemente. Programa la freidora para que se cocine durante 30 minutos usando la paleta. Pasado este tiempo, comprueba que las patatas fritas estén tiernas y bien cocidas. Si no es así, cocine por 5 minutos más. Sazone bien."]','2026-01-11 12:58:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13476,3986,'es','Salmón curado con pastrami','Sirva este salmón estilo gravadlax la mañana de Navidad con bagels o para canapés festivos. Está inspirado en un desayuno delicatessen de Nueva York.','["800 g de guarnición de salmón (el más fresco que puedas conseguir)","250 g de sal marina gruesa","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 cucharadas de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharada de semillas de alcaravea","1 cucharada de granos de pimienta negra","1 hoja de laurel","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado dulce","½ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","2 cucharadas de melaza negra","queso tierno, pan de centeno o bagels, pepinillos encurtidos y eneldo picado"]','["Tres días antes de servir el salmón, colóquelo con la piel hacia abajo en un plato con borde. Combine la sal y el azúcar, luego reserve.","Freír las semillas de cilantro, el cilantro molido, las semillas de alcaravea y los granos de pimienta en una sartén pequeña y seca a fuego medio durante 2-3 minutos. Vierta en un molinillo de especias o en un procesador de alimentos pequeño junto con el laurel y mezcle hasta que esté finamente molido. Agrega la mezcla de especias a la mezcla de sal y azúcar. Aplique la mezcla de sal especiada por todo el salmón y alrededor de él para que quede bien pegado a la pulpa. Envuélvalo bien en film transparente, luego coloque un plato o tabla y algo pesado (como un par de latas) encima para pesar el pescado. Enfriar durante 48 hrs.","Calentar el pimentón, la cayena y la melaza negra en una sartén hasta que se suelten, luego retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco hasta que esté tibio. Quite el exceso de sal del salmón y enjuáguelo con agua corriente fría. Seque con papel de cocina y luego transfiéralo a un plato limpio. Cepille con la mezcla tibia de melaza hasta que esté bien cubierto (es posible que deba cepillar generosamente el pescado varias veces antes de que la capa lo cubra bien), luego envuélvalo en una hoja nueva de film transparente. Enfriar por otras 24 horas.","Cuando esté listo para servir, coloque el salmón en una tabla y córtelo en rodajas finas con un cuchillo afilado, evitando la capa de piel en el fondo. Sirva con queso tierno, pan de centeno o bagels, pepinillos encurtidos y un poco de eneldo picado para que todos se sirvan."]','2026-01-11 12:58:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13477,6919,'es','Tostadas derretidas','Disfrute de estas tostadas derretidas para una comida reconfortante el viernes por la noche. Son perfectos cuando no puedes decidir entre una jugosa hamburguesa de ternera o una tostada de queso fundido...','["3 cucharadas de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, finamente cortada","200 g de carne picada","½ cucharadita de ajo granulado","2 cucharaditas de salsa inglesa","4 rebanadas de pan integral o pan blanco","100 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","100 g de queso suizo rallado","2 tsp Dijon mustard"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de mantequilla y la mitad del aceite en una sartén grande de base pesada a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla con una pizca de sal durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorada y pegajosa.","Vierta la carne picada en un tazón con los gránulos de ajo, la salsa inglesa y un poco de condimento, y combine con las manos; mezcle hasta que la carne picada tenga una textura fina. Divida en dos bolas, luego aplánelas para formar hamburguesas, teniendo en cuenta la forma del pan (es posible que desee hacerlas más oblongas si usa una hogaza).","Coloca las cebollas caramelizadas en un plato y calienta el aceite restante en la sartén a fuego alto. Fríe las hamburguesas, presionándolas con el dorso de una espátula, durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas y bien cocidas. Transfiera a un plato, raspando los trozos de la sartén por encima.","Reduzca el fuego a medio-bajo y derrita ½ cucharada de mantequilla en la sartén, girándola alrededor de la base. Fríe las cuatro rebanadas de pan por un lado, pesándolas con una prensa para parrilla o presionando con el dorso de la espátula para que queden uniformemente doradas y crujientes. Haga esto en dos tandas, agregando otra ½ cucharada de mantequilla para las dos últimas rebanadas. Mezclar los dos quesos en un bol.","Pon dos de las rebanadas de pan, con el lado tostado hacia arriba, sobre una tabla y unta sobre la mostaza. Agregue la mitad del queso y vierta uniformemente sobre las cebollas. Cubra con las hamburguesas y luego esparza el queso restante. Cubra con las rebanadas de pan restantes, con el lado tostado hacia abajo, de modo que los lados sin tostar queden en el exterior de los sándwiches. Presione bien para sellar. Calienta la mayor parte de la mantequilla restante en la sartén y fríe los sándwiches durante 2-3 minutos, presionándolos todo el tiempo, hasta que estén dorados y tostados. Voltee con cuidado y vuelva a freír, agregando lo último de mantequilla a la sartén alrededor de las tostadas. Cocine hasta que el queso se derrita y escurra, y el pan esté dorado y crujiente por ambos lados."]','2026-01-11 12:58:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13478,4034,'es','coliflor búfalo','Prepare "coliflor de búfalo" para obtener una versión vegetariana del clásico estadounidense picante. Servido con salsa ranchera, es un excelente regalo para compartir el viernes por la noche.','["1 cucharada de pimentón dulce ahumado","1⁄2 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharadita de ajo en polvo","100 g de harina común","200 ml de suero de leche o kéfir","1 cabeza de coliflor (500 g), partida en floretes","80 g de salsa picante","1½ cucharada de jarabe de arce","1 cucharada de mantequilla","palitos de apio, para servir","100 g de yogur griego","3 cucharadas de mayonesa","2 cucharadas de cebollino picado","1-2 cucharadas de leche"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Mezcle el pimentón, el comino, el ajo en polvo, la harina y ½ cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande. Haga un hueco en el centro y agregue el suero de leche. Vierta la coliflor y revuelva para cubrir. Extienda la coliflor en la bandeja para hornear y cocine durante 20-25 minutos, dándole vuelta a la mitad, hasta que esté crujiente en los bordes.","Caliente la salsa picante, el jarabe de arce y la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña a fuego lento, durante 2-3 minutos. Unte generosamente la coliflor y vuelva a meterla en el horno durante 8-10 minutos.","Para la salsa ranchera, mezcle el yogur, la mayonesa, el cebollino, la leche y una pizca de sal en un bol. Sirva con la coliflor junto con unos palitos de apio para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13479,6921,'es','Tortitas rellenas de brie con tocino crujiente','Disfrute de nuestros esponjosos panqueques estilo americano con un abundante relleno de queso y una cobertura de tocino crujiente. Son geniales para el Día de los Panqueques o un brunch de fin de semana.','["10 lonchas de tocino ahumado","300 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","pizca de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos medianos, ligeramente batidos","300ml de leche semidesnatada","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","25 g de mantequilla salada, más un poco más para servir","150 g de queso brie, en rodajas finas","50 g de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Calienta la parrilla a temperatura alta y asa el tocino durante 5 minutos hasta que esté crujiente, dándole vuelta a la mitad. Reservar y mantener caliente. Vierta la harina, el polvo para hornear, el azúcar y una pizca grande de sal en un tazón grande, luego bata gradualmente los huevos y la leche hasta obtener una masa suave y espesa.","Calentar un chorrito de aceite y una pequeña nuez de mantequilla en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio hasta que chisporrotee. Vierta 1 cucharada de la masa y extiéndala formando un círculo aproximado de 10 cm con el dorso de la cuchara. Cubra con unas cuantas rebanadas de queso brie, una pizca de queso cheddar rallado y 1½ cucharada más de masa para panqueques; la masa debe cubrir todo el queso. No te preocupes si la masa comienza a esparcirse; puedes darle forma empujando el queso hacia el centro con una espátula. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que comiencen a formarse burbujas en la superficie, luego voltee con cuidado y cocine por 2 minutos más. Mantén caliente mientras repites el proceso con el resto del aceite, la mantequilla, la masa y el queso. Sirva cubierto con un poco de mantequilla salada y tocino crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:58:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13480,4945,'es','Jalea de manzana de cangrejo','Invite a familiares y amigos a disfrutar de gelatina de manzana silvestre casera: prepare frascos y disfrútelos con carne y caza, o rellenos para pasteles.','["1½ kg de manzanas silvestres","1 limón, ralladura pelada y medio exprimido","unos 450 g de azúcar blanca o granulada","Bolsa de gelatina"]','["Lave y escurra la fruta, luego corte las manzanas por la mitad y agréguelas a una cacerola grande de base pesada con la misma cantidad de agua y la ralladura de limón pelada. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 20-25 minutos hasta que las manzanas estén pulposas. Revuelva ocasionalmente con el dorso de una cuchara de madera para ayudar a descomponer la fruta.","Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco. Coloque la pulpa de la fruta en una bolsa de gelatina y deje que el jugo gotee en un tazón grande (esto tomará varias horas, por lo que lo ideal es hacerlo durante la noche). Si fuerza la fruta, se creará una gelatina turbia.","Coloque dos platillos pequeños esterilizados en el congelador; los usará para probar el punto de fraguado de la mermelada. Puedes esterilizar los platillos lavándolos en un líquido jabonoso caliente, enjuagándolos y colocándolos en el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 durante 5 minutos. Retirar con cuidado y dejar enfriar.","Pesar el líquido afrutado y volver a colocarlo en una cacerola grande. Pese tres cuartos de azúcar respecto a su cantidad total de líquido (por ejemplo, si tiene 400 g de líquido, agregue 300 g de azúcar).","Agrega el azúcar al jugo con el jugo de limón y revuelve a fuego medio hasta que se disuelva por completo. Sube el fuego y lleva la fruta a ebullición. Revuelva ocasionalmente y deje hervir durante unos 8 minutos, quitando la espuma con una cuchara. Si usas un termómetro, buscas alcanzar los 105c. De lo contrario, verifique el punto de fraguado del líquido después de 8 minutos sacando un platillo del congelador y agregando una cucharadita de líquido al plato. Déjalo reposar por un minuto y luego pasa el dedo por el líquido. Si empieza a arrugarse, la gelatina está lista. Si no, vuelve a hervir y vuelve a intentarlo pasado un minuto más.","Vierta en frascos esterilizados y deje enfriar por completo. Conservar en un lugar fresco y oscuro."]','2026-01-11 12:58:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13481,6923,'es','buñuelos','Disfrute de estos buñuelos dorados y crujientes al estilo de Nueva Orleans. Elaborados con leche evaporada, es mejor servirlos calientes con una generosa capa de azúcar glas.','["4 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","250 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","25 g de azúcar en polvo","125 g de leche evaporada","1 huevo mediano","25 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","1,5 l de aceite de colza o vegetal, para el bol y para freír","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Mezcle la levadura, la harina, el azúcar y 1 cucharadita de sal marina en el bol de una batidora. Batir la leche evaporada y el huevo y verter en el bol con la mantequilla derretida y 60 ml de agua recién hervida. Amasar a velocidad media durante 2 minutos en la batidora de pie, o durante 5 minutos en una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada, hasta que quede suave. Forme una bola con la masa y colóquela en un bol grande ligeramente engrasado. Cubrir con un paño de cocina húmedo y dejar enfriar durante 8-24 horas.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un rectángulo de aproximadamente 20 x 25 cm y aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor. Cortar en cuadrados de 20 x 5 cm.","Vierta el aceite en una olla o cacerola profunda, de modo que no esté más profunda que un tercio de su capacidad. O utilice una freidora. Calentar el aceite a 175C. Forrar una bandeja para horno con papel de cocina. Freír los buñuelos en tandas durante 3 minutos, volteándolos de vez en cuando con unas pinzas, hasta que estén inflados y dorados. Levante los buñuelos sobre el papel para escurrirlos, luego páselos a una rejilla, espolvoree generosamente con azúcar glas y sirva calientes."]','2026-01-11 12:58:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13482,6925,'es','Filete De Pollo Frito','Pruebe un plato clásico del sur profundo de Estados Unidos que fusiona bistec con pollo frito sureño. El bistec se recubre con una mezcla de especias y se fríe para disfrutar de una cena deliciosa.','["2 filetes de cola (de unos 200 g cada uno) o 2 filetes de solomillo, sin grasa","2 huevos batidos","1⁄2 cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","verduras y mazorcas de maíz al vapor, para servir (opcional)","aceite vegetal, para freír","4 cucharadas de harina común","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de ajo en polvo","1 cucharadita de tomillo seco","1⁄2 cucharadita de comino molido","1⁄2 cucharadita de canela molida","1⁄2 cucharadita de pimienta negra","1 cucharada de harina","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","275ml de leche","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo","chorrito de jugo de limón"]','["Coloque los filetes en una tabla y golpéelos con un rodillo hasta aproximadamente la mitad del grosor original. Mezclar los huevos con la cayena en un bol. Combine los ingredientes para la mezcla de especias con una pizca grande de sal en un plato poco profundo aparte.","Sumerja los filetes en el huevo, luego en la mezcla de especias y voltéelos para cubrirlos. Vierta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande hasta cubrir la base de la sartén. Freír los filetes a fuego alto durante 2 minutos hasta que estén crujientes, luego darles la vuelta y freírlos durante 2 minutos más. Transfiera a un plato y manténgalo caliente.","Si está preparando la salsa, vierta todo menos 1 cucharada de aceite de la sartén y agregue la harina, cocinando hasta que se dore. Desmenuzar en la pastilla de caldo. Vierta lentamente la leche, batiendo hasta que quede suave y completamente incorporada. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine durante 4-5 minutos. Estación. Agrega el tomillo y mucha pimienta negra, luego exprime el jugo de limón al gusto. Sirva los filetes con la salsa y las verduras y el maíz, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13483,6929,'es','filete de queso Filadelfia','Apila filete, cebolla, pimientos, queso, ketchup y mostaza en panecillos para hacer estos filetes de queso Philly al estilo americano. Sólo la comida para una noche de cine en','["2 filetes de costilla de 150 g","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla, rebanada","1 pimiento rojo, rebanado","1 pimiento verde, rebanado","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","8 rebanadas de queso","50 g de mozzarella rallada","4 subrollitos blancos suaves","mostaza americana y ketchup, para servir"]','["Recorte y deseche el trozo largo de grasa que corre por los lados de los filetes. Corte cada filete por la mitad y colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear, luego transfiéralo al congelador y congélelo durante 40 minutos.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén o cacerola de base pesada a fuego medio. Añade la cebolla y los pimientos junto con una buena pizca de sal y sofríe durante 20 minutos, o hasta que las cebollas estén doradas y pegajosas. Agrega el vinagre y cocina por 5 minutos más. Sazone al gusto.","Con un cuchillo afilado, corte el filete lo más fino posible y apile las rodajas en cuatro porciones. Calienta una sartén a fuego alto hasta que casi humee. Coloque una porción de las rebanadas de bistec en la sartén en una pila que sea aproximadamente del largo de los panecillos. Freír durante 3 minutos a fuego alto hasta que parte del bistec esté bien cocido y queden trozos rosados. Apila encima una cuarta parte de la mezcla de cebolla, así como una cuarta parte de cada una de las rodajas de queso y la mozzarella. Continúe cocinando sin tocar a fuego medio durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que la carne esté dorada y crujiente en el borde y los quesos se hayan derretido. Abre uno de los panecillos y coloca con cuidado la mezcla de carne y queso. Repita con el resto de la carne, la cebolla, el queso y los panecillos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13484,6931,'es','pastel de calabaza','Llene una caja de tarta de masa quebrada dulce con calabaza ligeramente condimentada para hacer una delicia tradicional.','["750 g/1 lb 10 oz de calabaza o calabacín, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos","350 g de masa quebrada dulce","harina común, para espolvorear","140 g de azúcar en polvo","½ cucharadita de sal","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada fresca rallada","1 cucharadita de canela","2 huevos batidos","25 g de mantequilla, derretida","175ml de leche","1 cucharada de azúcar glas"]','["Coloca la calabaza en una cacerola grande, cúbrela con agua y deja que hierva. Cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir la calabaza; dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y úsela para forrar un molde para tarta de fondo suelto de 22 cm. Enfriar durante 15 minutos. Cubra la masa con papel para hornear y frijoles para hornear, luego hornee por 15 minutos. Retire los frijoles y el papel y cocine por 10 minutos más hasta que la base esté dorada pálida y como una galleta. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar un poco.","Aumente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Empuje la calabaza enfriada a través de un colador y colóquela en un tazón grande. En un recipiente aparte, combine el azúcar, la sal, la nuez moscada y la mitad de la canela. Agrega los huevos batidos, la mantequilla derretida y la leche, luego agrega al puré de calabaza y revuelve para combinar. Vierta en la base de la tarta y cocine durante 10 minutos, luego reduzca la temperatura a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Continúe horneando durante 35-40 minutos hasta que el relleno se haya endurecido.","Dejar enfriar y luego retirar la tarta del molde. Mezclar la canela restante con el azúcar glas y espolvorear sobre el pastel. Servir frío."]','2026-01-11 12:58:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13485,6933,'es','Pollo frito del siguiente nivel','Elija muslos deshuesados ​​para hacer el mejor pollo frito. Para el recubrimiento, hemos ideado un método que da como resultado el acabado más crujiente jamás creado.','["8 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","aceite de girasol, para freír","2 cucharadas de pimentón","2 cucharaditas de ajo granulado","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 cucharadita de pimienta negra","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","500ml de leche entera","2 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra o vino blanco","1 huevo","100 g de harina con levadura","100 g de harina de maíz","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma"]','["Para hacer la mezcla de especias, combine todos los ingredientes. Batir la leche con el vinagre, el huevo, ½ cucharadita de sal y 1 cucharada de la mezcla de especias en un bol o recipiente de plástico hondo para hacer la marinada de suero de leche. Abra los muslos de pollo y colóquelos entre dos trozos de papel para hornear, luego aplánelos con un rodillo. Transfiera a la marinada, luego cubra y enfríe durante 4 horas o toda la noche.","Haga la cobertura combinando las harinas y la cúrcuma con la mayor parte de la mezcla de especias restante (reservando 1 cucharadita) y una pizca generosa de sal. Escurre los muslos de pollo y reserva la marinada. Uno por uno, pase cada muslo por la harina, luego sumérjalo en la marinada reservada, luego vuelva a pasarlo por la harina, presionando tanto como pueda para cubrir. Transfiera los muslos rebozados a un plato grande.","Calentar una profundidad de 10 cm de aceite en una cacerola poco profunda o en una freidora hasta que alcance los 175 ° C. Baje dos o tres muslos a la vez y fríalos sin tocarlos durante 3 minutos, asegurándose de que la temperatura no baje de 160 ° C (debe permanecer en aproximadamente 170 ° C). Voltee los muslos, luego fríalos durante otros 2-3 minutos hasta que estén muy dorados y crujientes por ambos lados. Saca el pollo y transfiérelo a una bandeja forrada con papel de cocina para escurrir, luego colócalo sobre una rejilla y mantenlo caliente en el horno bajo mientras fríes los muslos restantes.","Cuando todo el pollo esté frito, combine la mezcla de especias reservada con 1 cucharada de sal marina en escamas y espolvoree sobre el pollo para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13486,6935,'es','hamburguesa con queso nacho','Apila hamburguesas con queso, guacamole, chipotle, salsa y nachos para darle un toque picante y picante a una hamburguesa con queso. Los nachos dan un toque crujiente adicional.','["2 hamburguesas de carne","2 rebanadas de queso cheddar","2 panes de hamburguesa con semillas de sésamo","2 cucharadas de guacamole","2 cucharadas de mayonesa de chipotle o chile","2 cucharadas de salsa","un puñado pequeño de nachos salados","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas arrancadas"]','["Calienta la parrilla a medio-alto. Coloque las hamburguesas en una bandeja para hornear y cocine a la parrilla durante 5 a 8 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén bien cocidas. Para el último minuto, cubra las hamburguesas con las rodajas de queso y cocine a la parrilla hasta que se derrita. Tuesta ligeramente los panecillos de hamburguesa. Divida el guacamole, las hamburguesas, la mayonesa de chipotle o chile, la salsa y los nachos, partidos, entre cada panecillo. Termine con una pizca de cilantro triturado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13487,6937,'es','Dip americano de cebolla quemada','Una sabrosa salsa vegetal con base de mayonesa y crema agria, ideal para verduras crudas o pan de pita tostado','["1 cebolla","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","150 ml de nata agria","50 g de mayonesa","verduras crudas, para servir"]','["Corta 1 cebolla y mezcla con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva. Extienda sobre una bandeja para hornear y cocine a la parrilla a fuego alto durante 6-8 minutos hasta que esté bien carbonizado, luego déjelo enfriar. Picar y mezclar con 150 ml de nata agria y 50 g de mayonesa. Sazone bien y enfríe hasta que sea necesario. Sirva con verduras crudas para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13488,6939,'es','Choc chip pecan pie','Una deliciosa delicia de chocolate y nueces con masa mantecosa y un relleno pegajoso en el que todos pueden quedar atrapados.','["300 g de harina común","75 g de mantequilla salada, en cubitos","100 g de queso crema","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","150 g de mantequilla salada","200 ml de jarabe de arce","250 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","4 huevos batidos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","400 g de nueces pecanas finamente picadas","200 g de chispas de chocolate amargo o una barra, picadas"]','["Primero, haz la masa. Vierta los ingredientes en un procesador de alimentos con 1/4 cucharadita de sal. Licue hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Rocíe 2-3 cucharaditas de agua fría en el embudo mientras la cuchilla está en funcionamiento; la mezcla debería comenzar a agruparse. Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo y junte, amasando brevemente hasta formar una bola. Forme un disco, envuélvalo en film transparente y déjelo enfriar durante al menos 20 minutos. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Sacar la masa del frigorífico y dejar a temperatura ambiente durante 5 minutos para que se ablande. Enharine la superficie de trabajo, luego desenvuelva la masa y extiéndala hasta formar un círculo del grosor de una moneda de £1. Use la masa para forrar una lata estriada redonda y profunda de 23 cm; la mía tenía unos 3 cm de profundidad. Presione la masa en las esquinas y los lados, asegurándose de que no queden espacios. Deje 1 cm de masa sobresaliendo (guarde algunos restos de masa para más adelante). Cubra con papel para hornear (arrújelo primero para hacerlo más flexible) y rellénelo con frijoles para hornear. Hornee a ciegas durante 15-20 minutos hasta que los lados estén listos, luego retire el pergamino y los frijoles y regrese al horno durante 5 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Recorta la masa para que quede al ras con la parte superior del molde; lo mejor para esto es un cuchillo de sierra pequeño. Si hay grietas, repáralas con los restos de masa.","Mientras tanto, pese la mantequilla, el almíbar y el azúcar en una cacerola y agregue 1/4 de cucharadita de sal. Calienta hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y el azúcar se disuelva, revolviendo hasta que quede suave. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos. Reducir el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.","Batir los huevos en un bol. Agregue la mezcla de almíbar, la vainilla y las nueces y mezcle hasta que estén bien combinados. Vierta la mitad de la mezcla en la tarta, esparza la mitad de las chispas de chocolate y luego cubra con el resto del relleno y las chispas de chocolate. Hornee en el estante del medio durante 50 a 55 minutos hasta que cuaje. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar, luego enfriar durante al menos 2 horas antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13489,6941,'es','Mezcla de barbacoa de Texas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una vez que hayas probado a ahumar y cocinar el pollo a fuego lento, quedarás totalmente convertido. La salmuera seca sazona la carne hasta el hueso y la mantiene suculenta durante la cocción.','["1 pollo grande","5 costillas de res (aproximadamente 3 kg), con las costillas separadas","2 kg de paleta de cerdo deshuesada y sin piel","Salsa barbacoa texana","cebollas blancas dulces en rodajas y pepinillos en rodajas, para servir","8 cucharadas de sal marina en escamas de buena calidad","2 cucharaditas de semillas de hinojo","1 cucharada de granos de pimienta negra","3 hojas de laurel","2 cucharaditas de pimienta de cayena","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharaditas de sal de ajo","150 g de azúcar moreno claro suave","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","astillas de madera (opcional)"]','["Deberá poner la carne en salmuera al menos 24 horas antes de la barbacoa. Primero, esparza el pollo. Dale la vuelta al pollo para que la columna mire hacia ti. Utilice un par de tijeras resistentes de cocina o para aves para cortar ambos lados de la columna y luego deséchelas. Voltee el pollo y presione firmemente el esternón hacia abajo para aplanarlo. Haz algunos cortes en cada articulación de la pierna. (Vea un video que muestra cómo preparar un pollo en bbcgoodfood.com/videos/spatchcock).","Coloque cada corte de carne en una bolsa grande con cierre aparte. Espolvorea 1 cucharada de sal en cada bolsa y masajea toda la carne. Exprime el aire de las bolsas, ciérralas bien y refrigéralas durante 24 horas.","Vierta el resto de la sal, las semillas de hinojo y los granos de pimienta en un mortero. Corta el laurel en trozos pequeños y agrégalo también. Triturar los ingredientes con el mortero hasta que estén finamente molidos. Agrega la cayena, el pimentón, la sal de ajo y los azúcares y mezcla bien. Saca la carne de las bolsas y sécala con papel de cocina. Cubre cada corte con el producto, asegurándote de llegar a todos los rincones. Regresa a la nevera por al menos 1-2 hrs mientras preparas la barbacoa, o hasta 24 hrs.","Deberá iniciar la barbacoa entre 7 y 8 horas antes de querer comer. Calentar las brasas y dejarlas hasta que estén cenicientas. Agregue sus astillas de madera, si las usa. Cuando las llamas se hayan apagado y queden cenizas humeantes, empuje las brasas y las astillas de madera a un lado del hoyo de la barbacoa, luego vuelva a colocar la parrilla y agregue la carne de res y de cerdo, colocándolas sobre el lado vacío del hoyo; esto asegurará que la carne humee pero no se queme. Baje la tapa y cocine la carne durante 30 a 40 minutos, volteándola de vez en cuando, hasta que se forme una costra oscura alrededor de la carne. No tengas miedo de llevarlo demasiado lejos, la corteza debe estar casi negra (pero caramelizada en lugar de quemada). Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1.","Transfiera la carne a fuentes para asar, envuélvala bien con papel de aluminio y cocine en el horno durante 5 a 6 horas hasta que esté muy tierna.","Cuando a la carne le queden entre 1 y 1 1/2 horas, vuelva a calentar la barbacoa y espere a que las brasas se vuelvan cenicientas antes de agregar más astillas de madera. Cuando las llamas se hayan apagado, empujar hacia un lado como antes. Coloque el pollo en la barbacoa, con el hueso hacia abajo, sobre el lado vacío del hoyo. Cocine durante 20-25 minutos por cada lado o hasta que esté bien cocido; verifique perforando una pierna para ver si los jugos están claros, o use un termómetro para carnes para verificar que la temperatura interna haya alcanzado los 70 ° C. Envuélvalo bien en papel de aluminio y déjelo reposar.","Después de 5-6 horas, la carne de res y de cerdo deben estar muy tiernas. Retirar del horno y dejar reposar 15 min. Si ha preparado una salsa BBQ (consulte la receta de salsa BBQ de Texas aquí), úntela sobre la carne para obtener un acabado brillante. Retire cualquier hilo de la carne de cerdo y desmenuce la carne. Corta el pollo en porciones y sírvelo todo en un plato grande con las cebollas dulces en rodajas, los pepinillos y los acompañamientos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13490,6943,'es','comensal descuidado joes','Un alimento básico americano sencillo en el que toda la familia puede quedar atrapada. Agregue una pizca de chipotle picante o salsa barbacoa ahumada para darle un toque picante.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 pimientos rojos o amarillos pequeños, finamente picados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","400 g de carne picada","2 latas de 400ml de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de chipotle o salsa barbacoa ahumada","4 rebanadas de queso","6 panes de hamburguesa","cebollas crujientes, para servir","lechuga iceberg, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén honda, luego sofreír la cebolla, el pimiento y el ajo durante 8-10 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega la carne picada, partiéndola con una cuchara de madera a medida que avanzas, y revuelve hasta que se dore por completo. Vierta los tomates y el chipotle, o salsa barbacoa, y agregue un poco de condimento. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos hasta que la salsa espese.","Coloque las rodajas de queso encima de la carne picada y cubra con una tapa durante 2 minutos para que se derrita en la salsa. Apila los panecillos con las cebollas crujientes y la lechuga a un lado para recoger la salsa extra."]','2026-01-11 12:58:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13491,6945,'es','pan de maíz','Puede preparar este pan de maíz con anticipación para tener un brunch sin calle en la mesa en minutos. Cubra con huevos rellenos y aguacate o chili con carne para un almuerzo abundante.','["50 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, derretida y un poco más para engrasar","250 g de polenta fina o harina de maíz, más un poco más para espolvorear","Lata de 325 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","250 ml de suero de leche","4 huevos grandes","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","100 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y untar un molde para pan de 900 g con mantequilla derretida, luego espolvorearlo con polenta y sacudir el exceso. Vierta 175 g de maíz dulce en un procesador de alimentos con los ingredientes restantes y 1 cucharadita de sal. Licue hasta que quede suave, luego retire la cuchilla y revuelva con la mayor parte del maíz dulce restante.","Vierta la masa en el molde, esparza sobre el resto del maíz dulce y hornee durante 45-50 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorado. Inserta una brocheta en el centro; debe salir con algunas migas húmedas, pero la mezcla no debe estar mojada. Regrese al horno por 5 a 10 minutos más si es necesario, luego pruebe nuevamente.","Enfríe el pan en su molde durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe. Se conservará envuelto en film transparente hasta por 3 días o se congelará en rodajas hasta por 2 meses."]','2026-01-11 12:58:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13492,6947,'es','Masa para galletas cruda segura para comer','¿A quién no le encanta la masa para galletas? Esta se prepara en solo unos minutos. Guarda una tanda en el refrigerador, cómela con cuchara, sírvela con helado o moldea, dale forma y coloréala con colorante alimentario como si fuera Play-Doh comestible.','["100 g de mantequilla, ablandada a temperatura ambiente","175 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","140 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de leche entera"]','["Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar, preferiblemente en una batidora. Agrega la vainilla, 1/2 cucharadita de sal y la harina, luego mezcla hasta que parezca pan rallado. Continúe mezclando mientras agrega la leche y listo: masa para galletas cruda, deliciosa y segura. Si no es lo suficientemente sorprendente como es, vuélvete loco con estos sabores:","Masa de caramelo salado: Agregue 1 cucharada de dulce de leche a la masa, más 1/2 cucharadita de sal y un puñado de chispas de chocolate amargo.","Masa para galletas S''more: Agrega 1 cucharada de Nutella, 2 galletas digestivas desmenuzadas y unos mini malvaviscos.","Masa de manzana y canela: Agregue algunos trozos pequeños de manzana seca y una pizca de azúcar con canela (1 cucharadita de canela mezclada con 1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave).","Masa de maní: agregue 1 cucharada de mantequilla de maní y un puñado de M&M de maní."]','2026-01-11 12:58:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13493,6949,'es','T-bone totalmente americano','Para una cena especial, pruebe este clásico corte americano de solomillo. El bistec tiene un hueso en forma de T con carne a cada lado, perfecto para compartir','["700 g de chuletón","2 dientes de ajo machacados","½ paquete pequeño de tomillo","½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","50 g de mantequilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner una plancha para horno a fuego alto. Sazone el filete por ambos lados y luego frótelo con los dientes de ajo, el tomillo y el aceite de oliva. Coloque el bistec en la sartén caliente y carbonice la parte inferior durante 2 minutos o hasta que aparezcan las líneas de la plancha. Voltee el bistec para que se dore por el otro lado, frote la parte superior con el tomillo nuevamente y luego coloque el tomillo y el ajo encima de la carne.","Una vez que esté uniformemente dorado con las líneas de la plancha, reserve el tomillo y el ajo, sostenga el bistec con unas pinzas para cocinar su lado graso y deje que quede suave en lugar de arenoso. Esto llevará unos minutos. Vuelva a colocar el filete plano, ponga el tomillo, el ajo y la mantequilla encima y transfiera la sartén al horno para terminar de cocinar durante 4-5 minutos, hasta que la carne alcance 62-65C en un termómetro de sonda (o hasta que esté cocida a su gusto).","Reposar la carne durante 5-6 minutos. Servir en una tabla o plato grande en el medio de la mesa."]','2026-01-11 12:58:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13494,6951,'es','S''mores de chocolate caliente con malta','Pruebe una versión diferente de los s''mores de chocolate y malvaviscos al estilo americano cambiando las tradicionales galletas saladas por galletas malteadas.','["16 galletas de leche malteada","8 cuadritos de chocolate con leche","8 malvaviscos (marca vegetariana, si es necesario)"]','["Precalienta la parrilla a fuego alto y cubre una bandeja para hornear grande con pergamino. Coloque las 16 leches malteadas en la bandeja con un cuadrado de chocolate con leche en 8 y un malvavisco en los 8 restantes. Ase hasta que ambos se derritan.","Coloque los dos tipos diferentes uno encima del otro hasta que rezumen por los bordes y cómelos calientes o sumergidos en chocolate caliente para obtener un sabor extra a chocolate."]','2026-01-11 12:58:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13495,6953,'es','Ensalada César con pollo crujiente','¿Te sobró pollo de la cena? Úselo en una ensalada crujiente con aderezo César cremoso.','["4 muslos de pollo crujientes, en rodajas (ver Consejo)","125ml mayonesa ligera","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharada de salsa inglesa","50 g de parmesano rallado y un poco más para servir (opcional)","1 diente de ajo, machacado","50 g de picatostes","1 lechuga Cos grande o 4 Little Gem, cortadas en trozos"]','["En un bol grande, mezcle la mayonesa,\r\njugo de limón, salsa inglesa,\r\nparmesano rallado y ajo, luego sazonar.\r\nCuando esté listo para comer, agregue el pollo.\r\nrodajas, picatostes y lechuga. Mezclar bien y\r\nespolvoree con parmesano extra, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13496,5722,'es','Ensalada Cobb con aderezo ranch de suero de leche','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Obtenga tres de sus cinco al día de esta ensalada de pollo y tocino, que se puede adaptar para usar sobras de pavo y está repleta de proteínas y vitaminas.','["2 lechugas Baby Gem, con las hojas separadas","1 aguacate, sin hueso y en rodajas","2 tomates pera, picados","3 lonchas de tocino cocido y crujiente","140 g/5 oz de pechuga de pavo o pollo cocido, cortado en trozos pequeños","2 huevos duros, picados en trozos","75 ml de suero de leche","2 cucharadas de mayonesa ligera","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharada de eneldo picado","½ diente de ajo machacado"]','["En un tazón pequeño, bata el aderezo\r\ningredientes junto con un poco de sal.\r\nColoca los ingredientes de la ensalada por separado.\r\nen 2 platos o en una fuente y sirva con\r\nel vendaje a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13497,6957,'es','Club de carne salada con papas cajún','Una deliciosa cena en solitario compuesta por un sándwich en capas con carne en rodajas, aderezo cremoso y patatas fritas caseras.','["1 papa grande, cortada en chips finos","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","½ cucharadita de condimento cajún","1 cucharada colmada de mayonesa","1 cucharadita de cebollino picado","1 tsp Dijon mustard","3 rebanadas de pan blanco o integral, ligeramente tostadas","2 rábanos, en rodajas finas","1 bebé o ½ aguacate, rebanado","2 rebanadas de carne salada","Par de hojas de lechuga Little Gem"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nColoca las patatas fritas sobre una superficie antiadherente.\r\nbandeja para hornear, mezcle con aceite y cajún\r\nsazonar, luego extender en un\r\nuna sola capa. Mételo en el horno y\r\nhornee, volteando una vez, durante 20-25 minutos\r\no hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Estación.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la mayonesa,\r\ncebollino y mostaza en un vaso pequeño\r\ntazón y sazonar. Unte la mezcla sobre 2 de las rebanadas de pan.\r\nCapa 1 rodaja para untar con rábanos\r\ny aguacate. Coloque la otra rebanada,\r\ncon el lado extendido hacia arriba, encima y agregue\r\nla carne salada y la lechuga. arriba\r\ncon el último trozo.","Cortar y asegurar con cóctel.\r\npalitos si lo desea, luego sirva\r\njunto a las patatas fritas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13498,6495,'es','Sopa de marisco sencilla','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). Una sopa cremosa y con trozos con salmón y eglefino ahumado, mezcla de mariscos y patatas: una comida abundante.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla grande, picada","100 g de tocino rayado, picado","1 cucharada de harina común","600 ml de caldo de pescado, elaborado con 1 pastilla de caldo de pescado","225 g de patatas nuevas, partidas por la mitad","maza de pellizco","pizca de pimienta de cayena","300ml de leche","Paquete de 320 g de mezcla para pastel de pescado (salmón, eglefino y eglefino ahumado)","4 cucharadas de nata líquida","Paquete de 250g de marisco mixto cocido","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande sobre\r\na fuego medio, luego agrega la cebolla y\r\ntocino. Cocine durante 8-10 minutos hasta que la cebolla\r\nesté suave y el tocino cocido. Agregue\r\nla harina, luego cocine por 2 minutos más.","Vierta el caldo de pescado y suba.\r\na fuego lento. Agrega las patatas,\r\ncubra, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10-12 minutos hasta que\r\nlas patatas estén bien cocidas.","Añade la macis, la pimienta de cayena y\r\nun poco de condimento y luego agregue la leche.","Vierta la mezcla para pastel de pescado en la sartén,\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 4 minutos. Añade el\r\ncrema y mariscos, luego cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 1 min más. Revisa el condimento.\r\nEspolvorear con el perejil y servir.\r\ncon un poco de pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:58:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13499,9455,'es','pastel de calabaza','Llene una caja de tarta de masa quebrada dulce con calabaza ligeramente condimentada para hacer una delicia tradicional americana.','["750 g/1 lb 10 oz de calabaza o calabacín, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos","350 g de masa quebrada dulce","harina común, para espolvorear","140 g de azúcar en polvo","½ cucharadita de sal","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada fresca rallada","1 cucharadita de canela","2 huevos batidos","25 g de mantequilla, derretida","175ml de leche","1 cucharada de azúcar glas"]','["Coloca la calabaza en una cacerola grande, cúbrela con agua y deja que hierva. Cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir la calabaza; dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y úsela para forrar un molde para tarta de fondo suelto de 22 cm. Enfriar durante 15 minutos. Cubra la masa con papel para hornear y frijoles para hornear, luego hornee por 15 minutos. Retire los frijoles y el papel y cocine por 10 minutos más hasta que la base esté dorada pálida y como una galleta. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar un poco.","Aumente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Empuje la calabaza enfriada a través de un colador y colóquela en un tazón grande. En un recipiente aparte, combine el azúcar, la sal, la nuez moscada y la mitad de la canela. Agrega los huevos batidos, la mantequilla derretida y la leche, luego agrega al puré de calabaza y revuelve para combinar. Vierta en la base de la tarta y cocine durante 10 minutos, luego reduzca la temperatura a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Continúe horneando durante 35-40 minutos hasta que el relleno se haya endurecido.","Dejar enfriar y luego retirar la tarta del molde. Mezclar la canela restante con el azúcar glas y espolvorear sobre el pastel. Servir frío."]','2026-01-11 12:58:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13500,6959,'es','Ensalada de mazorcas de maíz y pollo a la plancha','Ase el maíz dulce entero y sírvalo con pollo condimentado con pimentón y Little Gem crujiente para obtener una ensalada rápida y saludable.','["4 pechugas de pollo pequeñas sin piel","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de pimentón","jugo 1 limon","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 mazorcas de maíz","4 lechugas Little Gem, cortadas en cuartos a lo largo","½ pepino, cortado en cubitos"]','["Cortar las pechugas de pollo por la mitad.\r\na lo largo para que te quedes\r\n8 tiras de pollo. Mezclar el ajo,\r\npimentón, jugo de limón y 1 cucharada\r\naceite con un poco de condimento y\r\nmezcle con el pollo. dejar para\r\nmarinar durante al menos 15 minutos.","Calentar una plancha y cepillar\r\ncon la mitad del aceite restante y\r\ncocine el pollo durante 3-4 minutos cada uno\r\nlado hasta que esté bien cocido. Cepillar\r\nel aceite restante y asar el maíz\r\nmazorcas, volteándolas para que se cocinen uniformemente, durante aproximadamente\r\n5 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente carbonizado. Quitar\r\ny cortar los granos.","Mezcle la lechuga y el pepino, cubra\r\ncon el maíz y el pollo, y rociar\r\nsobre tu elección de vestir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13501,6961,'es','Tarta de lima','Este postre cremoso, sin lácteos, está endulzado naturalmente y utiliza ingredientes completamente crudos, con una corteza de dátiles, nueces y coco y un relleno cremoso de aguacate y anacardos.','["300 g de trozos de cocina","150 g de mantequilla, derretida","1 lata de 397 g de leche condensada (nosotros usamos Nestlé)","3 yemas de huevo medianas","ralladura fina y jugo de 4 limas","300ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","ralladura de lima extra, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3. Batir las galletas hasta obtener migajas en un procesador de alimentos (o ponerlas en una bolsa de plástico resistente y golpearlas con un rodillo). Mezclar con la mantequilla derretida y presionar hacia la base y hacia los lados de un molde para tarta de base suelta de 22 cm. Hornear en el horno durante 10 minutos. Retirar y enfriar.","Pon las yemas de huevo en un bol grande y bate durante un minuto con unas varillas eléctricas. Agrega la leche condensada y bate por 3 minutos, luego agrega la ralladura y el jugo y bate nuevamente por 3 minutos.\r\nVierta el relleno en la base enfriada y luego vuelva a colocarlo en el horno durante 15 minutos. Deje enfriar y luego enfríe durante al menos 3 horas o toda la noche si lo desea.","Cuando esté listo para servir, retire con cuidado el pastel del molde y colóquelo en un plato para servir. Para decorar, batir suavemente la nata y el azúcar glas. Vierta o coloque la crema sobre la parte superior del pastel y termine con ralladura de lima adicional."]','2026-01-11 12:58:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13502,6963,'es','Fideos picantes de cerdo y jengibre','Combine carne de cerdo picante, champiñones, bok choy y fideos de jengibre para una comida rápida entre semana en solo 25 minutos. Fácil y rápido, es ideal para los días laborables','["250 g de fideos al huevo medianos","½ cucharada de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","400 g de carne picada de cerdo","300 g de champiñones, cortados finamente","30 g de jengibre, finamente rallado","3 dientes de ajo, machacados","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","4 cebolletas, finamente cortadas, con las partes verde y blanca separadas","3 bok choy, hojas separadas, partes blancas finamente cortadas y puntas de hojas enteras","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 cucharadas de vino de arroz Shaoxing"]','["Cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrralos bien y reserve. Calienta ambos aceites en una sartén grande y profunda a fuego medio-alto. Agregue la carne picada de cerdo, partiéndola con el dorso de una cuchara de madera. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos, hasta que el agua se haya evaporado. Incorpora los champiñones y cocina durante 4-5 minutos más hasta que se doren. Agregue el jengibre, el ajo, la guindilla y las partes blancas de las cebolletas y el bok choy. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté fragante y suave.","Agrega las partes verdes del bok choy junto con la salsa de soja, el vino de arroz y los fideos cocidos. Mezcle todo para cubrirlo y luego sirva espolvoreado con las partes verdes restantes de las cebolletas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13503,6965,'es','Empanadillas de papel de arroz','Disfrute de estas albóndigas de cerdo y champiñones como entrante o acompañamiento como parte de un festín de inspiración vietnamita. Sirva con nuestra salsa de soja y sésamo.','["¼ de repollo blanco pequeño, sin corazón y picado en trozos grandes","1 zanahoria, rallada","100 g de champiñones shiitake, finamente picados","400 g de carne picada de cerdo","2 dientes de ajo, machacados","20 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado","2 tsp soy sauce","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","3 cebolletas, finamente cortadas","20-40 envoltorios de rollitos de primavera vietnamitas u hojas de papel de arroz","75ml de aceite vegetal, más un extra para la tabla.","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","½ cucharada de semillas de sésamo tostadas","2 cebolletas, finamente cortadas"]','["Coloca el repollo en un procesador de alimentos y tritura hasta que esté finamente picado. Sazone con ½ cucharadita de sal, revuelva bien y reserve durante 15 minutos. Vierta sobre un paño de cocina limpio y exprima tanta agua como pueda. Vierta en un bol con la zanahoria, los champiñones, la carne picada de cerdo, el ajo, el jengibre, la salsa de soja, el aceite de sésamo y las cebolletas. Sazone con pimienta negra. Triture todo con las manos, mezclando bien hasta que todo esté combinado.","Remoje las hojas de rollitos de primavera durante un par de segundos en un plato poco profundo con agua tibia y luego transfiéralas a una tabla de cortar engrasada. Trabajando con una hoja a la vez, vierta 1 cucharada colmada del relleno en el medio, luego doble la parte inferior hacia arriba y sobre el relleno. Dobla hacia abajo la parte superior de la hoja, luego los lados para cubrirla completamente y formar un cuadrado ordenado. Si la bola de masa se siente un poco frágil, remoja otra hoja y envuélvela nuevamente. Repita con las hojas restantes y el relleno, transfiriendo las albóndigas a un plato engrasado a medida que avanza.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande (asegurándote de que no esté más de un tercio de su capacidad) a fuego medio-alto y fríe las bolas de masa durante 3-5 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Use una espumadera o una araña para darles la vuelta, luego cúbralos con una tapa y cocine por otros 3-4 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Retire la tapa y cocine durante 1-2 minutos.","Mientras tanto, combine todos los ingredientes de la salsa en un tazón pequeño. Sirva las albóndigas con la salsa para mojar a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13504,6967,'es','kimchi casero','El kimchi existe en docenas de versiones y estas pueden variar aún más. La salsa de gambas o pescado también se utiliza tradicionalmente para preparar el kimchi, nosotros te ofrecemos una versión simplificada que también es apta para veganos.','["40,00 g de sal marina finamente molida","1,20 kg de col china cortada en cuadritos de unos 5 x 5 cm","370,00 g de cebolleta cortada en trozos de 5 cm","49,00 g de jengibre (fresco) trozo de 9 cm finamente rallado","10.00 diente de ajo machacado o picado","30,00 g de chile seco en polvo fino de chile coreano (kochukaru), se puede reemplazar con otro chile seco en polvo","1,50 cucharadas de azúcar granulada"]','["Disolver 30 g de sal en 2 litros de agua fría en una jarra.","Verter la col en un recipiente de al menos 2,5 litros de material inerte (vidrio, porcelana, loza, etc.). Vierta agua con sal para que el repollo quede sumergido. Cubrir con un plato y dejar a temperatura ambiente para que el repollo empiece a fermentar (esto tarda unas 12 horas, aparecerán burbujas en el líquido y el repollo se pondrá ligeramente ácido).","Escurre el repollo y guarda el pepinillo. En un bol, mezcle el repollo con la cebolleta, el jengibre, el ajo, el condimento de chile, el azúcar y el resto de la sal.","Pasar a un frasco esterilizado de 2 litros y cubrir con el barniz reservado para mantener el repollo sumergido.","Vierte un poco del resto de la marinada en una bolsa de plástico, ciérrala bien y colócala encima del repollo para que quede sumergido en el barniz.","Colocar en una habitación donde la temperatura no supere los 20°C para que fermente (levadura) a su gusto. Probablemente tardará entre 4 y 6 días.","Retirar la bolsa, cerrar el frasco y guardar en el frigorífico. Dura incluso 3 meses."]','2026-01-11 12:58:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13505,6969,'es','Pollo dorado con fideos de arroz y chalotas crujientes','Sirva estos fideos directamente del plato para que las personas puedan comerlos y servirse ellos mismos. La estrella del espectáculo es el pollo, con una fabulosa mezcla de sabores.','["400ml de leche de coco (batir bien para combinar la nata y el agua, si se ha separado en la lata)","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma molida","15 g de jengibre en trozos, finamente rallado","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","2 limas, 1 rallada y en jugo, 1 cortada en gajos para servir","½ chile rojo grande, congelado y finamente rallado (ver consejo a continuación)","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","2 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado","6 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","aceite vegetal, para freír","4 chalotes, finamente cortados en aros","180 g de fideos de arroz anchos (4 nidos)","2 zanahorias, cortadas en palitos","6 pepinos pequeños, en rodajas o ½ pepino, cortados por la mitad a lo largo y en rodajas","manojo pequeño de menta, hojas recogidas","manojo pequeño de albahaca tailandesa, hojas recogidas","100 g de maní salado, picado en trozos grandes"]','["En un tazón grande, combine la leche de coco, la cúrcuma, el jengibre, el ajo, la ralladura y el jugo de lima, la guindilla, el azúcar, la salsa de pescado y 1 cucharadita de sal. Agregue los muslos de pollo, revolviendo para cubrirlos, luego póngalos en el refrigerador para marinar durante la noche. Se mantendrá cubierto y refrigerado hasta por dos días.","Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Transfiera el pollo a una fuente para asar grande con lados altos. Ase durante 30 minutos, echando la salsa sobre el pollo varias veces durante la cocción, hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido y un poco carbonizado y la salsa se haya reducido. Al final, si el pollo necesita más color, asarlo unos minutos, si lo desea.","Mientras se cocina el pollo, caliente suficiente aceite vegetal para cubrir la base de una sartén grande y profunda, separe los aros de chalota y cocine en una sola capa durante 6 a 8 minutos, o hasta que estén dorados (es posible que deba hacerlo en tandas). Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y sazonar generosamente con sal.","Cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete (o hierva una cacerola con agua, agregue los fideos, retire del fuego y déjelos por 5 minutos, luego escurra y enjuague con agua fría).","Retire el pollo de la lata y córtelo en trozos. Mezcle los fideos escurridos con la salsa en la fuente para asar. Cubra con el pollo, las verduras, las chalotas crujientes, las hierbas y el maní. Sirva con rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13506,6971,'es','Salteado tailandés de cerdo con albahaca','Esta receta está inspirada en el picante y sabroso pad kra pao tailandés favorito. Puedes ajustar la cantidad de chiles a tu gusto.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 chalota grande, en rodajas","1 tallo de limoncillo, finamente cortado","2 chiles rojos, finamente picados, más un extra para servir (opcional)","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 cucharadas de salsa de ostras","½ cucharada de salsa de pescado","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","500 g de carne picada de cerdo","200 g de judías verdes, picadas en tercios","25 g de albahaca tailandesa, las hojas más grandes rotas","arroz jazmín cocido, para servir"]','["Este plato se prepara bastante rápido, así que tenga todos los ingredientes a mano. Vierta el aceite vegetal en una sartén grande o en un wok a fuego alto. Una vez que brille, agregue la chalota, la hierba de limón, las guindillas y el ajo. Cocine durante 5-6 minutos, revolviendo, hasta que se ablanden y los bordes estén dorados. Vierta la salsa de soja, la salsa de ostras, la salsa de pescado y el azúcar en un tazón o jarra pequeña y agregue 1 cucharada de agua para combinar.","Agrega la carne de cerdo a la sartén, luego vierte la salsa y las judías verdes. Cocine por 5-6 minutos más, revolviendo todo el tiempo. Cuando los frijoles estén tiernos y con un poco de sabor, agregue la albahaca tailandesa.","Sirva inmediatamente junto con el arroz, adornado con más chiles si desea más picante."]','2026-01-11 12:58:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13507,6973,'es','Espárragos y brócoli carbonizados con aderezo de chile ampollado','Estas verduras carbonizadas, mezcladas con un picante aderezo de chile, son un acompañamiento perfecto para la barbacoa: disfrútalo con nuestro pollo spatchcock glaseado con arce y mostaza.','["300 g de espárragos, con las puntas leñosas recortadas","300 g de brócoli de tallo largo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito","1 chile rojo","1 cucharadita de jarabe de arce","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","½ limón, rallado y en jugo"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua con sal. Eche los espárragos y el brócoli, hierva durante 1 minuto, luego escurra bien, deje enfriar y seque.","Cuando la barbacoa esté caliente, rocíe un poco de aceite sobre el chile y cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que se queme y se ablande. Retirar de la BBQ, dejar enfriar un poco, luego picar finamente y mezclar con el jarabe de arce, el aceite de oliva, la ralladura de limón y el jugo. Sazone al gusto y reserve.","Mezcle los espárragos y el brócoli en el aceite de oliva y cocínelos directamente en la barbacoa durante 3-4 minutos, volteándolos de vez en cuando, hasta que estén ligeramente carbonizados y ahumados. Transfiera las verduras a un plato para servir y sazone con sal marina en escamas. Sirva el aderezo de chile ampollado a un lado para servirlo con una cuchara."]','2026-01-11 12:58:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13508,6975,'es','adobo de pollo','Deje este guiso filipino picante en la olla durante la noche para darle aún más sabor. Disfrútalo con arroz jazmín al vapor.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal, más un chorrito si es necesario","2 muslos de pollo (unos 600 g)","2 muslos de pollo con piel y hueso (unos 300 g)","65 g de ajo, finamente picado (aproximadamente 1½ bulbos)","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","90 ml de vinagre de coco o de sidra","90 ml de salsa de soja ligera","2 hojas de laurel","10 granos de pimienta negra enteros","una pizca pequeña de azúcar moreno blando","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","arroz jazmín al vapor, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego alto y dora todo el pollo, con la piel hacia abajo, hasta que esté caramelizado, aproximadamente de 3 a 5 minutos. Voltee y dore el otro lado durante 2-3 minutos, luego retírelo de la sartén y reserve en un plato. (No es necesario que el pollo esté bien cocido en este punto).","Reduzca el fuego a medio y agregue un chorrito más de aceite si la sartén parece seca. Fríe el ajo hasta que empiece a dorarse y adquiera aroma, unos 2-3 minutos. Agregue la cebolla, luego cubra y cocine durante 3 a 5 minutos hasta que se ablande, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Regrese el pollo a la sartén, con la piel hacia abajo, y aumente el fuego a alto. Agregue el vinagre, luego hierva y cocine hasta que el líquido se haya reducido a una cuarta parte, aproximadamente de 4 a 5 minutos. El vinagre debe tener un olor fragante y ligeramente dulce, en lugar de crudo y acre.","Agrega la salsa de soja, deja hervir durante 2-3 minutos, luego agrega las hojas de laurel, los granos de pimienta negra y el azúcar. Tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 10-12 minutos. Revuelva suavemente, dé vuelta el pollo y continúe cocinando durante 6 a 10 minutos, tapado, hasta que el pollo esté tierno y bien cocido. Deje reposar el adobo en la olla durante al menos 5 minutos antes de sazonarlo con pimienta negra y servirlo cubierto con cebolletas junto con arroz jazmín al vapor. El adobo de pollo sobrante se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:58:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13509,6977,'es','Nihari','Disfrute de este guiso de cordero especiado cocinado a fuego lento de Pakistán. Es particularmente popular durante el Ramadán y es un elemento básico en bodas y celebraciones.','["4 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cucharadas de ghee","Trozo de jengibre de 2,5 cm, finamente rallado","2-3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","4 jarretes de cordero","1½ cucharada de chile rojo de Cachemira en polvo","1 cucharada de harina común","1 cucharada de harina integral","1 cucharada de semillas de hinojo","1 rama de canela","2 vainas de cardamomo negro","2 anís estrellado entero","1½ cucharada de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","2 hojas de maza o ½ cucharadita de maza molida","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","2 cucharadas de semillas de amapola azul (no negras)","15 dientes enteros","¾ cucharada de granos de pimienta negra o 2-3 pimientos largos pippali","un puñado grande de hojas de cilantro, picadas en trozos grandes","Trozo de jengibre de 5 cm, cortado en juliana","2 chiles verdes, finamente picados","6 cucharadas de cebolla frita crujiente","4 limones, cortados en gajos","naán"]','["En un molinillo de especias o un mini procesador de alimentos, agregue todos los ingredientes del nihari masala con 2 cucharadas de agua caliente y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta fina. Reserve 3 cucharaditas de la mezcla de especias nihari masala para servir.","Calienta el aceite y el ghee en una sartén grande de base pesada a fuego medio. Fríe el jengibre y el ajo hasta que estén fragantes, unos 2 minutos. Agrega el cordero y sofríe todo durante 10 minutos o hasta que esté bien dorado. Agregue el chile rojo de Cachemira en polvo, el nihari masala restante y 1 cucharadita de sal. Freír hasta que las especias estén fragantes, de 1 a 2 minutos, agregando un chorrito de agua si es necesario para evitar que se peguen. Agrega 1,5 litros de agua, o lo suficiente para sumergir la carne.","Deje hervir a fuego lento, luego cocine, tapado, a fuego medio-bajo durante 45 minutos a 1 hora. Retire 150 ml del líquido de cocción y bata con ambas harinas hasta que se combinen. Regrese a la sartén y revuelva bien. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 horas más, o hasta que la carne esté tierna y desmenuzada.","Sirva adornado con cilantro, jengibre, chiles, cebollas fritas, rodajas de limón y la mezcla de especias reservada, y naan como acompañamiento, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13510,6979,'es','hola hola','Disfrute de un postre tradicional filipino que se traduce como "mezcla-mezcla". Es una mezcla colorida y refrescante de sabores y texturas, ideal para los días calurosos.','["Lata de 410ml de leche evaporada","50 g de perlas de tapioca grandes","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","100 g de perlas de tapioca pequeñas","Aceite de sabor neutro, como vegetal, para el recipiente.","100 g de azúcar en polvo","7 g de agar-agar","1 cucharadita de extracto de pandan verde","100 g de nata de coco, escurrida","100 g de yaca, escurrida y cortada en rodajas","200 g de koong (semillas de palma)","200 g de frijoles mungo rojos, escurridos","200 g de pimientos halaya"]','["Forre un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Combine la leche evaporada con 820 ml de agua en un tazón grande, revolviendo bien. Vierta la mezcla en el molde preparado y congele durante 2 horas, o hasta que comience a congelarse en los bordes. Retirar del congelador y, con un tenedor, raspar la mezcla parcialmente congelada para crear cristales helados y esponjosos. Regresar al congelador. Repite este proceso cada 45 minutos hasta que toda la mezcla esté completamente congelada y tenga una textura similar a la del granizado; esto tomará algunas horas. Una vez listo, manténgalo congelado hasta que esté listo para servir, esponjando con un tenedor si es necesario antes de hacerlo.","Ponga a hervir 750 ml de agua y cocine las perlas de tapioca grandes durante 30 minutos. Tapar, apagar el fuego y dejar enfriar por completo.","Combina el azúcar moreno con 100 ml de agua en una cacerola y calienta a fuego medio hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 2-3 minutos hasta que espese un poco. Retirar del fuego y dividir en dos jarras. Dejar enfriar.","Escurrir las perlas grandes de tapioca y verterlas en una de las jarras de almíbar de azúcar moreno. Ponga a hervir 1 litro de agua en una cacerola aparte y cocine las pequeñas perlas de tapioca durante 20 minutos. Escurrir inmediatamente y transferir a la segunda jarra de almíbar de azúcar moreno.","Para la gelatina, primero engrase un recipiente reutilizable (de unos 15 x 10 cm). Ponga a hervir 570 ml de agua en una cacerola y agregue el azúcar en polvo hasta que se disuelva, luego agregue el agar agar hasta que también se haya disuelto. Agregue el extracto de pandan, luego vierta la mezcla en el recipiente preparado y déjela reposar, aproximadamente 1 hora. Una vez cuajado, cortar en cubos.","Para armar el halo-halo, divida la nata de coco, la yaca en rodajas, el kaong, los frijoles mungo rojos, el ube halaya y la mayoría de los cubos de gelatina de pandan entre cuatro vasos altos de postre. Vierta sobre las perlas de tapioca grandes, seguidas de las perlas de tapioca pequeñas. Vierta generosamente sobre el hielo de leche evaporada estilo granizado, luego esparza algunos cubos adicionales de gelatina de pandan encima, junto con cualquier aderezo adicional si lo desea (como un chorrito de almíbar extra marrón o una cucharada de ube halaya). Sirva inmediatamente y deje que los invitados mezclen todo mientras comen."]','2026-01-11 12:58:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13511,6981,'es','Tazón de arroz con salmón y freidora pegajosa','Fríe trozos de salmón al aire en una salsa hecha con soja, miel, jengibre y sriracha, luego sírvelos sobre arroz integral y cubre con vegetales frescos encurtidos para una comida rápida y fácil entre semana.','["500 g de filete de salmón","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja","15 g de jengibre rallado","2 cucharadas de miel","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharadas de sriracha","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","150 g de frijoles edamame congelados","1 cucharada de vinagre de manzana","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","½ pepino, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas","200 g de rábanos, finamente cortados","arroz integral cocido, para servir","15 g de jengibre rosado encurtido","4 hojas grandes de nori"]','["Calienta tu freidora a 175C. Retire la piel del salmón y córtelo en cubos de 2 cm. Combine 2 cucharadas de salsa de soja, el jengibre, la miel, el aceite de sésamo, la sriracha y la mitad de las semillas de sésamo en un bol. Agrega los cubos de salmón y revuelve bien. Deje marinar durante 10 minutos. Coloque en una capa uniforme en la canasta de la freidora, rocíe sobre la salsa restante y cocine a 175 ° C durante 5 a 7 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido y pegajoso.","Mientras tanto, cocine el edamame siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrralo bien y déjelo enfriar un poco. Mezcle las semillas de sésamo restantes con el vinagre, el azúcar y una pizca grande de sal. Agrega el pepino y el edamame enfriado y reserva.  Mezcla los rábanos con la salsa de soja restante.","Coloque el salmón encima del arroz integral cocido para servir, rociando sobre la salsa sobrante de la freidora. Agrega el edamame y el pepino, los rábanos y un poco de jengibre encurtido a un lado. Desmenuza el nori para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13512,6983,'es','Pasteles de pescado al estilo tailandés con fideos con pepino','Dale vida a una cena entre semana con estos pequeños pastelitos de pescado hechos en una freidora y servidos con arroz y pepinos machacados. También pueden funcionar como snack picante.','["250 g de filetes de trucha o salmón sin piel","1 cucharada de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","10 g de cilantro, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","1 lima, rallada y en jugo","1 cucharada de pasta de limoncillo","2 dientes de ajo, rallados","3 cucharadas de harina común","50 g de pan rallado panko","2 bolsas de 250 g de arroz integral ya cocido, cilantro y sriracha, para servir","1 pepino","1 diente de ajo rallado","2 tsp soy sauce","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino de arroz","2 cucharaditas de aceite de chile"]','["Pon el pescado y los demás ingredientes excepto la harina y el panko en el bol de un procesador de alimentos. Pulse para formar una pasta con trozos, luego transfiérala a un tazón y agregue la harina.","Con las manos ligeramente mojadas, déles forma de hamburguesas pequeñas, alrededor de 8-10. Coloque el pan rallado en un plato y enrolle las croquetas de pescado para cubrirlas. Se mantendrá frío durante dos días.","Calienta la freidora a 180C. Cocine durante 10-15 minutos, volteando hasta la mitad hasta que esté dorado y bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, para el pepino machacado, golpéelo ligeramente a lo largo con un rodillo, rompiendo un poco la pulpa sin convertirla en pulpa. Corta el pepino por la mitad y quítale las semillas, luego corta la pulpa en trozos pequeños. Espolvorea 1/2 cucharadita de sal, deja reposar 10 minutos, luego enjuaga bien con agua fría y escurre.","Mezcle los ingredientes restantes en un tazón mediano y mezcle el pepino.","Calienta el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego sírvelo con las croquetas de pescado, el pepino machacado, el cilantro espolvoreado y un poco de sriracha para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13513,6985,'es','Bowl diosa verde con tofu crujiente de sésamo','Use su freidora para hacer estos bastones de tofu cubiertos con semillas de sésamo; se sirven con quinua, además de ensalada de edamame, repollo blanco y manzana.','["1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 huevo, batido","3 cucharadas de harina","75 g de semillas de sésamo blancas y negras","450 g de tofu, bien secado con papel de cocina y cortado en tiras","2 bolsas de 250 g de quinua ya cocida","½ col blanca, rallada","160 g de edamame","1 manzana verde, cortada en palitos","hojuelas de chile, para servir (opcional)","1 aguacate, pelado y picado","15 g de cilantro","15 g de albahaca","100 g de yogur griego espeso","1 lima, rallada y en jugo"]','["Vierta la salsa de soja y el huevo batido en un tazón pequeño y bata para combinar. Poner la harina en otro bol y sazonar, luego poner las semillas de sésamo en un tercer bol. Con unas pinzas, sumerja los trozos de tofu primero en la harina, luego en el huevo, luego en las semillas de sésamo y gírelos para cubrirlos por todos lados.","Transfiera a la canasta forrada con papel de aluminio de una freidora. Cocine durante 10-15 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad, hasta que estén dorados y crujientes.","Mientras tanto, prepare el aderezo mezclando todos los ingredientes en una licuadora hasta que quede suave. Sazone, luego afloje con un poco de agua hasta que tenga una consistencia espesa pero que se pueda verter. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días.","Calienta la quinua siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego divídela en cuatro tazones. Coloque el repollo, el edamame y la manzana en un tazón grande y mezcle con el aderezo. Servir encima de la quinoa junto con el tofu crujiente. Espolvoree con hojuelas de chile, si lo desea, y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:58:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13514,6987,'es','Wraps pegajosos de lechuga con fideos de arroz y cerdo','Prepare estos wraps pegajosos de fideos de arroz y cerdo en la mesa para disfrutar de una forma divertida y festiva de comer. Cocine en una freidora y sirva con su aceite de chile favorito.','["450 g de tiras de panceta de cerdo, cortadas en trozos de 3 cm","150 g de fideos de arroz, cocidos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete","½ cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","2 limas, 1 en jugo y 1 cortada en gajos, para servir","5 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes y un poco más para servir","1 lechuga iceberg o 2 lechugas Little Gem, con las hojas separadas","1 zanahoria, cortada en tiras finas (usa una mandolina si tienes) 1/2 pepino, cortado en tiras finas (usa una mandolina, si tienes)","aceite de chile, para servir (opcional)","3 cucharadas de salsa de ostras","1 cucharada de salsa de soja ligera","1 cucharada de jarabe de arce","½ cucharada de vinagre de vino de arroz","2 dientes de ajo, rallados","5 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado"]','["Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la salsa en un tazón mediano, batiendo para combinar. Vierta la mayor parte de la salsa sobre la panceta de cerdo, asegurándose de que quede bien cubierta. Reserva el resto de la salsa para rociarla más tarde.","Cubra la canasta de la freidora con papel de aluminio y caliéntela a 200 ° C. Una vez caliente, coloca la panceta de cerdo en la canasta, espaciando los trozos lo mejor que puedas. Cocine durante 15-20 minutos, volteando cada 7 minutos. En la última vuelta, rocíe con el glaseado restante.","Mientras tanto, mezcla los fideos con el aceite de sésamo, el jugo de lima y el cilantro. Sazone al gusto.","Cuando la carne de cerdo esté cocida, lleva todo a la mesa y deja que todos llenen sus tazas de lechuga con algunos fideos, carne de cerdo y verduras. Espolvoree más cilantro y sirva con lima para exprimir y aceite de chile para rociar, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13515,6989,'es','Arroz con pollo de Hainan','Prepare esta sencilla cena de pollo de Hainan inspirada en el plato nacional de Singapur. Es reconfortante, nutritivo y curativo para el alma.','["1 pollo entero, alrededor de 1,2 kg, o muslos para una cocción más rápida","4 dientes de ajo, machacados o picados","150 g de jengibre fresco cortado en rodajas","1 ½ cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","210 g de arroz, lavado","un puñado pequeño de cilantro picado","pepino en rodajas, para servir","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente picado o rallado finamente","1 cebolla tierna, en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo, picado","pizca de azúcar","½ cucharadita de caldo de pollo en polvo","5 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 chiles rojos, picados","1 diente de ajo, picado o machacado","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado (opcional)","1 cucharadita de salsa de soja ligera","un chorrito de vinagre, limón o lima fresca (preferencia personal)","grasa de pollo, preparada con el pollo entero"]','["Retire el exceso de grasa y las tiras sueltas de piel del pollo (de lo contrario, mantenga la piel del pollo) y luego reserve. Reserva también los recortes. Frote sal gruesa por todo el pollo, luego escalfe en una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que esté completamente sumergido, con dos tercios del jengibre, tres cuartos del ajo machacado, 1 cebolleta y la cúrcuma durante 25 a 40 minutos, dependiendo del tamaño del pollo.","Coloque el pollo cocido en un recipiente con agua helada durante 15 minutos para detener el proceso de cocción. Vierte el caldo de pollo en una jarra y reserva.","Para la salsa de jengibre y cebolleta, combine el ajo, el jengibre, la cebolleta y el caldo de pollo en polvo en una fuente para servir y agregue una buena pizca de sal y azúcar. Calienta el aceite en una sartén pequeña hasta que esté caliente y luego vierte sobre los demás ingredientes.","Para hacer la salsa de chile rojo, combine todos los ingredientes en una cacerola pequeña con 100 ml del caldo de pollo reservado, lleve a fuego lento, luego retire del fuego y vierta en una fuente para servir.","Prepara el arroz calentando una sartén o cacerola a fuego medio y añadiendo la piel de pollo reservada y la grasa del paso 1. Una vez que se haya derretido (un poco derretido), añade el resto del ajo, el jengibre y la cebolleta y cocina durante 1-2 minutos hasta que empiece a dorarse. Agrega el arroz lavado y 1 litro de caldo de pollo reservado. Si no te queda suficiente, completa con agua o caldo de pollo. Deje que el arroz se cocine durante unos 10 a 15 minutos o según las instrucciones del paquete. Retire los huesos del pollo, córtelo en rodajas y sirva con el arroz y las salsas. Adorne con el cilantro y el pepino."]','2026-01-11 12:58:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13516,6991,'es','Salsa BBQ coreana','Prepare salsa barbacoa con un toque coreano agregando gochujang, una pasta de pimiento rojo que crea un picante ligeramente ahumado. Use la salsa como glaseado para costillas pegajosas o vierta sobre las hamburguesas.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cucharada de ajo rallado","500 g de puré","125 g de azúcar moreno blando","3 cucharadas de vinagre de manzana o vinagre de arroz","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","1½ cucharadita de gochujang"]','["Calentar el aceite vegetal en una cacerola a fuego lento y sofreír los ajos durante 3 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue los ingredientes restantes junto con ¼ de cucharadita de sal y deje hervir. Reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que espese, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Se conservará en un frasco o botella de vidrio esterilizado en el refrigerador hasta por un mes."]','2026-01-11 12:58:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13517,6993,'es','kimchi jjigae','Prepare esta reconfortante comida coreana picante y cálida con panceta de cerdo y kimchi maduro para obtener el máximo sabor.','["400 g de kimchi maduro","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","¼ de cebolla morada pequeña, finamente cortada","200 g de panceta de cerdo, finamente cortada","1½ cucharadita de gochugaru (hojuelas de pimiento rojo coreano)","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","150 g de tofu firme, escurrido","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas"]','["Escurre el kimchi en un colador sobre una jarra medidora (necesitarás unos 100 ml de salmuera, así que completa con más del frasco si es necesario). Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego alto y sofreír el kimchi escurrido, la cebolla dorada y la panceta de cerdo durante 5 minutos. Agrega el gochugaru y el azúcar, luego fríe durante 2 minutos más. Vierta 800 ml de agua y la salmuera de kimchi reservada y deje hervir. Cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, a fuego alto durante 15 minutos.","Corta el tofu en cuadrados de 5 cm y aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor y colócalos sobre el kimchi jjigae. Cubra la sartén con una tapa y cocine durante 3-4 minutos, o hasta que el tofu esté completamente caliente. Esparza sobre las cebolletas para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13518,6995,'es','kimbap','Adapte estos rollos de arroz al estilo coreano con casi cualquier cosa que desee: hemos usado palitos de mariscos y salchichas, pero la mayonesa de cerdo picante o atún también funcionan bien.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","1 zanahoria, cortada en palitos finos","2 huevos","100 g de danmuji (daikon encurtido coreano), o utilice pepinillos o pepino","60 g de palitos de marisco, cortados en trozos finos","2 hot dogs, cortados a lo largo en cuartos","6 láminas de alga gim o nori","100 g de espinacas tiernas","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo, más un poco más para cepillar","½ cucharadita de semillas de sésamo, más un poco más para espolvorear","500 g de arroz para sushi cocido","1½ cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo"]','["Primero, prepara las espinacas. Coloque las espinacas en un recipiente resistente al calor y viértalas sobre agua hirviendo del hervidor, empujando las hojas bajo el agua con una cuchara para asegurarse de que se marchiten. Escurrir, luego enjuagar con agua corriente fría y exprimir el exceso de líquido. Regresa las espinacas al bol y añade el aceite de sésamo, una pizca de sal y las semillas de sésamo. Mezclar y reservar.","Calienta la mitad del aceite vegetal en una sartén a fuego medio y fríe las zanahorias durante 2 minutos hasta que se ablanden un poco. Retirar a un plato y reservar.","Limpia la sartén y calienta el aceite restante a fuego alto. Rompe los huevos en un tazón y bate ligeramente, luego vierte en la sartén y agita la sartén para cubrir la base. Cocine brevemente hasta que esté listo, luego transfiera la tortilla a una tabla de cortar y córtela en tiras, de aproximadamente ½ cm de grosor. Coloque todos los ingredientes del relleno (el danmuji, los palitos de marisco, las salchichas, las zanahorias, la tortilla en rodajas y las espinacas) en la misma bandeja. Mezcla todos los ingredientes del arroz con ½ cucharadita de sal en un bol grande.","Coloque una hoja de algas con el lado brillante hacia abajo sobre una tabla y extienda una cuarta parte del arroz sobre las tres cuartas partes de la hoja en una capa uniforme, dejando el cuarto superior de la hoja al descubierto. Corta otra hoja de alga por la mitad y colócala en el medio del arroz. (Esto formará la capa base para todos los rellenos). Coloque unas pizcas de cada uno de los rellenos a lo largo de esa hoja de algas. Levante la parte inferior de la hoja de algas más grande hacia arriba y sobre los rellenos, luego enróllela firmemente, metiendo todo con los dedos a medida que avanza. Al final de la hoja, agregue algunos granos de arroz en la parte superior para que actúen como pegamento para sellar. Unte ligeramente con aceite de sésamo y espolvoree con semillas de sésamo, luego repita para hacer los panecillos restantes.","Corta en círculos de 1 cm de grosor con un cuchillo afilado; si el cuchillo empieza a pegarse, límpialo con un trozo de papel de cocina y aceite de sésamo para crear rodajas limpias. También puedes recortar los bordes si están un poco ásperos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13519,6997,'es','bibimbap coreano','Usa las sobras en un bibimbap coreano que significa "arroz mixto". Cambia las verduras con lo que tengas en el refrigerador, luego sírvelas sobre arroz con un huevo frito y adereza con una salsa gochujang dulce y picante.','["1 champiñón castaño, cortado finamente","½ calabacín, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas","¼ de zanahoria, cortada en palitos de fósforo","40 g de brotes de soja","30 g de espinacas","¼ cucharadita de aceite de sésamo, más un poco más para servir","½ cucharadita de semillas de sésamo, más un poco más para servir","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 huevo","150 g de arroz para sushi cocido","2 cucharadas de gochujang (pasta de pimiento rojo coreano)","1 cucharadita de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","½ cucharadita de aceite de sésamo"]','["Mezcle los ingredientes de la salsa bibimbap en un tazón pequeño con 1 cucharada de agua y reserve.","Ponga en un plato los champiñones cortados en rodajas, el calabacín, la zanahoria y los brotes de soja. Coloque un tazón o molde pequeño resistente al calor boca abajo en el medio de una sartén con tapa mediana. Agregue suficiente agua para llegar a la mitad del molde y deje hervir. Coloque con cuidado el plato de verduras encima del molde y tape la sartén. Cocine las verduras al vapor durante 3 minutos hasta que estén tiernas.","Mientras tanto, poner las espinacas en un bol y verter agua hirviendo por encima. Revuelva para que las hojas se marchiten, luego escurra y enjuague con agua fría. Exprime el exceso de agua de las espinacas y luego mezcla en un bol con el aceite de sésamo, una pizca de sal y las semillas de sésamo. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite vegetal en una sartén a fuego alto. Cascar el huevo y sofreír a tu gusto.","Llena un bol con el arroz. Cubra con el huevo frito y luego use unas pinzas para agregar las verduras al vapor alrededor. Servir con la salsa bibimbap, un poco más de aceite de sésamo y semillas de sésamo. Mezclar todo antes de comer. Cualquier salsa bibimbap sobrante se mantendrá fría hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:58:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13520,6999,'es','Carne de res con chile en una sartén súper fácil','Prepare esta versión súper fácil en una sola sartén de su carne crujiente con chile favorita para llevar en solo 30 minutos','["320 g de filete de ternera británica Morrisons, en rodajas","4 cucharadas de harina de maíz","5 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","2 pimientos rojos, rebanados","8 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","1 chile rojo, rebanado","3 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente rallados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","4 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","2 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco o de vino de arroz","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja oscura","600 g de fideos directos al wok","semillas de sésamo tostadas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Coloque la carne en un tazón grande y mezcle con la harina de maíz y ½ cucharadita de sal y pimienta negra molida. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande o en un wok a fuego medio y fríe la carne hasta que esté crujiente. Retirar de la sartén y reservar (no es necesario sacarla de la sartén, pero esto garantiza que la carne no se cocine demasiado y se mantenga lo más crujiente posible). Reserva el aceite en la sartén.","Agregue la cebolla y el pimiento rojo y fría durante unos minutos hasta que se ablanden, luego agregue las cebolletas, el chile, el ajo y el jengibre y cocine por un par de minutos más antes de agregar la salsa de chile, el ketchup, el vinagre y la salsa de soja. Mezcle todo y cocine durante 1 minuto, luego agregue los fideos y la carne crujiente. Cocine durante 2 minutos y luego sirva en tazones con un poco de semillas de sésamo, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13521,7001,'es','Salteado caliente de gambas con miel, naranja y sésamo','Este fragante salteado está lleno de gambas, pimientos y pak choi. Sirva con arroz o fideos para una victoria fácil entre semana.','["1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","2 naranjas grandes, ralladas y exprimidas (unos 150 ml)","4 cucharadas de miel","pizca generosa de hojuelas de chile","4 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","½ cucharadita de cinco especias chinas","400 g de langostinos pelados crudos de Morrisons Market Street","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","4 cebolletas, cortadas en trozos de 2 cm","2 pimientos rojos, cortados en trozos de 3 cm","2 pak choi, rebanados","arroz o fideos, para servir (opcional)"]','["Para hacer la salsa, combine el aceite, la ralladura y el jugo de naranja, la miel, la guindilla, la soja y el vinagre en un bol. Combine la harina de maíz, las semillas de sésamo, las cinco especias y una pizca de sal en otro bol. Pasa un cuchillo pequeño por la parte posterior de cada langostino pelado crudo de Morrisons Market Street, para que formen mariposas mientras se cocinan.","Pasa los langostinos por la mezcla de harina de maíz. Calienta el aceite vegetal en un wok grande o en una sartén a fuego medio-alto. Cuando esté caliente añade el ajo y el jengibre. Chisporrotea durante 10 segundos, pero no dejes que se dore. Añade las gambas y la harina y las semillas que queden en el bol. Sofreímos a fuego fuerte unos minutos hasta que las gambas estén rosadas y las semillas de sésamo doradas.","Coloca las gambas en un plato. Añade un chorrito más de aceite vegetal y las cebolletas, los pimientos y el pak choi. Sofríe durante 3-4 minutos hasta que esté cocido pero aún conserve algo crujiente.","Vierte la salsa en el wok. Burbujee durante unos minutos hasta que espese, luego agregue los langostinos nuevamente al wok y revuelva para cubrirlos con la salsa. Calienta durante otros 30 segundos y luego sirve con arroz o fideos, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13522,7003,'es','Curry de pescado de Julie (curry de pescado de Malasia)','Deléitese con este pescado al curry un viernes por la noche. Ligero y fresco, pero rico y picante, disfrútelo con un tazón grande de arroz al vapor, ¡idealmente con las manos!','["3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 chalotes de plátano, pelados y finamente picados","2 dientes de ajo, rallados","Trozo de jengibre de 2,5 cm, pelado y rallado","2 chiles rojos secos medianos, rehidratados y luego finamente picados","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo (curry de pescado en polvo de Malasia o cualquier curry en polvo mediano, más 1 cucharadita de fenogreco en polvo)","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 tomate grande, picado","200ml de leche de coco","2 cucharadas de pasta de tamarindo","2 tallos de limoncillo machacados","2 hojas de lima","1 berenjena, cortada en trozos de 3 cm","5 okra, cortada en trozos","500 g de filetes de pescado (caballa, pargo o cualquier pescado blanco firme), limpios y cortados en 3-4 trozos cada uno","un puñado pequeño de cilantro y arroz jazmín al vapor, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y profunda o en una cacerola ignífuga a fuego medio y fríe las chalotas hasta que estén transparentes, aproximadamente de 3 a 4 minutos. Agregue el ajo, el jengibre y la guindilla y fría durante otros 2-3 minutos hasta que estén fragantes y ligeramente dorados.","Agrega el curry en polvo y la cúrcuma. Cocine durante aproximadamente 1 minuto, revolviendo continuamente para evitar que las especias se quemen. Agregue el tomate y cocine hasta que se ablande, aproximadamente 2-3 minutos.","Vierta la leche de coco y 200 ml de agua, revolviendo para combinar. Agregue la pasta de tamarindo, la hierba de limón y las hojas de lima y cocine a fuego lento. Añade la berenjena y la okra y continúa cocinando a fuego lento durante unos 20 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas, añadiendo un chorrito de agua si la salsa de curry se ha reducido.","Reduzca el fuego y baje suavemente los trozos de pescado. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 a 10 minutos, o hasta que el pescado esté bien cocido y se desmenuce fácilmente al presionarlo suavemente con un tenedor. Sazone con sal al gusto. Retire los tallos de limoncillo y las hojas de lima, luego decore con cilantro y sirva caliente con arroz al vapor."]','2026-01-11 12:58:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13523,7005,'es','Sobras de arroz frito con gambas','Prepara este arroz frito con las sobras de nuestro arroz al horno con langostinos, chorizo ​​y calabacín. Es una cena fácil al día siguiente, ideal para los días ocupados de la semana.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","100 g de brócoli de tallo largo, recortado","450g sobras de arroz con gambas (ver receta más abajo)","Lata de 220 g de castañas de agua escurridas","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","25 g de anacardos","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio-alto y agrega el brócoli. Freír durante 5 minutos hasta que se dore, luego transferir a un plato. Mientras tanto, saca las gambas del arroz y reserva. Combine los ingredientes de la salsa en un tazón.","Rocíe el aceite restante en la sartén y agregue el arroz sobrante. Déjalo reposar durante 5 minutos y luego vuelve a mezclar los langostinos con el brócoli y las castañas de agua. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos, luego agregue la salsa y el cilantro y sirva con los anacardos esparcidos por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:58:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13524,7007,'es','Ramen de pollo clásico','Prepare este rápido ramen de pollo lleno de verduras. Está listo en menos de 20 minutos y es perfecto para una opción de almuerzo sabrosa.','["2 pechugas de pollo sin piel","2 puñados de verduras salteadas (unos 200g)","200 gramos de fideos ramen","1 huevo","500 ml de caldo de ramen de pollo","cebollino finamente picado, para servir","hojuelas de chile, para servir"]','["Calienta una plancha o sartén grande a fuego medio y cocina las pechugas de pollo durante 5-7 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Voltee y cocine por otros 4-5 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido. Cortar en rodajas finas y reservar. Cocine las verduras salteadas en la sartén durante 2 minutos hasta que se ablanden un poco.","Mientras tanto, cocine los fideos en una cacerola con agua hirviendo siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, agregando el huevo a la cacerola durante 5 a 6 minutos (dependiendo de qué tan líquida le guste la yema). Escurrir y reservar. Pelar el huevo, cortarlo por la mitad y reservar.","Calienta el caldo en una cacerola a fuego medio hasta que esté bien caliente, con cuidado de que no hierva.","Divida los fideos en dos tazones hondos, luego cubra con las verduras salteadas, el pollo en rodajas, las mitades de huevo y el caldo. Esparza sobre las cebolletas y las hojuelas de chile para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13525,7009,'es','Empanadillas fáciles de cerdo y cebollino','Pruebe estas albóndigas chinas rellenas de jugosa carne de cerdo y cebollino chino fresco. Son más fáciles de hacer de lo que crees y divertidos de montar como actividad grupal.','["500 g de carne picada de cerdo 20% grasa","200 g de cebollino chino al ajillo o cilantro u hoja china si no los encuentras, finamente cortados","1 ½ cucharada de salsa de soja ligera","1 cucharada de salsa de ostras","1 cucharadita de pimienta blanca","1 cucharadita de azúcar","1½ cucharadita de harina de maíz","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","40 envoltorios de dumplings prefabricados descongelados","aceite vegetal, para freír","1 cucharada de vinagre negro chino","1 cucharadita de aceite de chile","½ cucharada de aceite de sésamo","1 cebolleta pequeña, finamente cortada"]','["Vierta la carne de cerdo y el cebollino en un bol. Añade la salsa de soja ligera, la salsa de ostras, la pimienta blanca, 1 cucharadita de sal, el azúcar, la maicena y el aceite de sésamo y mezcla bien. Tapar y dejar marinar en el frigorífico durante 1 hora. Mientras tanto, combine los ingredientes de la salsa de bola de masa en un bol y refrigere hasta que los necesite.","Sumerge un dedo en agua fría, humedece la mitad inferior de los bordes de una envoltura de bola de masa y luego agrega ½ cucharada del relleno en el centro.","Doble la bola de masa de abajo hacia arriba y pellizque firmemente en el centro, luego comience a plisar cada lado desde la derecha hacia el centro, pellizcando firmemente a medida que avanza. Meta los lados y repita con el lado izquierdo. Pellizque firmemente la parte superior de la bola de masa para asegurar un sello hermético. Repita para hacer 40 bolas de masa.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua y cocine las albóndigas en tandas, alrededor de 10 a la vez. Cocine durante 3-4 minutos hasta que el agua comience a hervir a fuego lento o las bolas de masa floten hacia la superficie. Retirar con una espumadera y reservar. Repita hasta que todas las bolas de masa estén cocidas.","Añade un chorrito de aceite a una sartén y calienta a fuego medio-alto. Fríe las albóndigas hervidas por cada lado durante 4 minutos o hasta que estén doradas, luego sírvelas con la salsa para albóndigas, ya sea rociada por encima o para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13526,3724,'es','Tofu teriyaki','Marina el tofu con salsa teriyaki y sírvelo con brócoli y fideos o arroz para preparar esta sencilla comida vegetariana entre semana. Se necesitan menos de 30 minutos para hacerlo.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","400 g de tofu firme, cortado en cubos pequeños","1 cabeza grande de brócoli, cortada en floretes, con los tallos pelados y en rodajas finas","1 manojo de cebolletas, separadas en partes blancas y verdes y cortadas en rodajas finas","8-10 cucharadas de salsa teriyaki","arroz o fideos cocidos, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y fríe el tofu durante unos 8 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y dorado. Retirar de la sartén y reservar.","En la misma sartén, agregue los floretes de brócoli y las partes blancas de las cebolletas y cocine durante unos 4 minutos hasta que estén tiernos, pero no completamente cocidos. Agrega la salsa teriyaki y sazona bien.","Vuelva a colocar el tofu cocido en la sartén con el brócoli y revuelva bien para cubrirlo. Cocine durante 1 o 2 minutos más para que los sabores se mezclen. Espolvorea sobre las partes verdes reservadas de las cebolletas, retira del fuego y sirve con arroz o fideos cocidos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13527,7011,'es','Pollo al curry rojo tailandés','¿Después de un plato tailandés rápido y fácil? Tiene que ser curry rojo. Los sabores están tan bien equilibrados que te enamorarán aún más de la comida tailandesa.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","400 ml de leche de coco","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​(unos 250 g), cortados en trozos o en rodajas","1 calabacín, cortado en rodajas de 1,5 cm o picado en trozos grandes","1 berenjena, picada en trozos grandes","100 g de brotes de bambú, en rodajas","1 cucharadita de azúcar","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","½ cucharada de salsa de ostras","½ cucharadita de jugo de limón","arroz jazmín cocido y 1 chile rojo rebanado, para servir","3 chiles de árbol secos remojados en agua durante 10 minutos, sin semillas","½ chile rojo, rebanado","10 g de cilantro, tallos cortados en rodajas, hojas recogidas y reservadas para servir","1 tallo de limoncillo, en rodajas finas","½ lima, ralladura pelada","5 g de galanga, pelada y picada en trozos grandes","1 chalota, picada en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo, machacados","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","½ cucharada de pimentón","1 cucharadita de pasta de camarones (opcional)"]','["Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la pasta de curry en un procesador de alimentos con 2 cucharadas de agua y ¼ de cucharadita de sal hasta que quede suave.","Calienta el aceite vegetal en una cacerola mediana a fuego medio y fríe la pasta de curry durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté fragante. Vierta 3 cucharadas de leche de coco y vierta el pollo. Cocine, revolviendo, hasta que el pollo se dore pero no esté completamente cocido. Agrega el resto de la leche de coco, el calabacín, la berenjena y los brotes de bambú. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos. Agrega el azúcar, la salsa de pescado, la salsa de ostras y el jugo de limón. Sirva con arroz jazmín esponjoso y esparza sobre las hojas de cilantro y el chile rojo en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13528,7013,'es','ajwain puri','Disfrute de estos panes planos como parte de un festín indio. El puri es una masa frita que se hincha una vez sumergida en aceite caliente. Aquí están aromatizados con semillas de carambola.','["300 g de harina para chapatis","½ cucharadita de ajwain o semillas de comino","aceite de girasol, para freír"]','["Poner en un bol la harina, ½ cucharadita de sal y el ajwain y mezclar bien. Agrega poco a poco 160ml de agua, mezclando hasta tener una masa suave. (Es posible que necesites toda el agua, o incluso un poco más). Amasar la masa durante un par de minutos, luego tapar y dejar reposar durante 15 minutos.","Divida la masa en 20 trozos, forme una bola con cada uno y luego aplánelos formando círculos de aproximadamente 10 cm.","Caliente una profundidad de 5 cm de aceite en una freidora o en una sartén ancha y profunda a 180 ° C, o hasta que una pizca de la mezcla de puri chisporrotee inmediatamente al caer. Freír los puris uno a la vez durante 1 minuto por cada lado hasta que estén dorados. Sirva bien caliente con nuestro alu tamatar masala (ver más abajo)."]','2026-01-11 12:58:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13529,5349,'es','Brochetas de pollo pegajosas con jengibre y miel con ensalada de fideos','Estas brochetas de pollo con jengibre y miel son perfectas como cena de verano y se sirven sobre una cama de fideos marinados.','["6 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos grandes","5 dientes de ajo machacados","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","6 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo","3 cucharadas de miel","6 cucharadas de salsa de soja","3 limas, exprimidas, más gajos adicionales para servir","100g de tirabeques","275 g de fideos al huevo cocidos","1 zanahoria grande, pelada y cortada en tiras finas o rallada gruesa","½ manojo de cilantro picado","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo (opcional)"]','["Pon el pollo en un bol. En un recipiente aparte, mezcle el ajo, el jengibre, el aceite de sésamo, la miel, la salsa de soja y el jugo de lima. Agrega un tercio de esto al pollo y guarda el resto para los fideos. Mezclar todo y dejar enfriar durante la noche o durante unas horas.","Lleve una cacerola con agua a fuego lento. Agregue los tirabeques y cocine por 1 minuto, luego escúrralos y enjuáguelos con agua fría. Mezcle los fideos cocidos con los tirabeques, la zanahoria, el resto de la marinada, el cilantro y las semillas de sésamo.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio. Ensarte el pollo en tres o cuatro brochetas largas, colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear plana y cocine a la parrilla durante 12 minutos, volteando las brochetas hasta la mitad, hasta que esté cocido. Sirva las brochetas encima de una fuente de fideos con rodajas de lima adicionales para exprimirlas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13530,6201,'es','Lahori chanay ki daal','Pruebe esta versión de chanay ki daal para probar los puestos de comida callejera de Lahore en Pakistán: el cardamomo negro ayuda a imitar el sabor ahumado con carbón.','["350 g de chana daal","4 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cucharada de ghee (o mantequilla sin sal)","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino enteras","1 cardamomo negro (opcional)","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1⁄2 pulgada de jengibre, pelado","4 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1⁄2 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1⁄2 chile rojo en polvo o chile de Cachemira en polvo","1 cucharada de kasuri methi (fenogreco seco) (opcional)","1 chile verde, finamente picado","manojo pequeño de hojas de cilantro, picadas","1⁄2 pieza de jengibre, pelado y cortado en juliana","1 cucharadita de chaat masala (opcional)"]','["Lave y remoje el chana daal durante unos 30 minutos. Vierta en una cacerola grande, vierta sobre 2 litros de agua y hierva a fuego medio durante 20 minutos, hasta que esté suave pero no desmoronada ni blanda. Añade un poco más de agua si se seca. Drene el agua restante.","Caliente el aceite y el ghee en una cacerola a fuego medio hasta que se derrita. Agregue las semillas de comino y el cardamomo negro y cocine brevemente durante unos 15 a 20 segundos. Vierta la cebolla y cocine hasta que se dore, luego baje el fuego a medio-bajo y siga revolviendo durante 5 minutos.","Agrega el ajo y el jengibre, sofríe hasta por unos 30 segundos, revolviendo constantemente para evitar que se pegue.","Añadimos el puré de tomate, un chorrito de agua, la cúrcuma, una buena pizca de sal y la guindilla roja en polvo. Freír durante unos 2 minutos, revolviendo, hasta que el agua se haya reducido por completo.","Vierta las lentejas cocidas y vierta 150 ml de agua. Baje el fuego a bajo, tape y cocine durante 8-10 minutos, revolviendo regularmente para evitar que se queme el fondo.","Agregue el kasuri methi si lo usa, luego cubra y cocine durante unos 2-3 minutos más. Sirva con chile picado, cilantro, jengibre en juliana y chaat masala esparcidos, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13531,3849,'es','Gambas agridulces','Transforme las gambas en una delicia para llevar (gambas agridulces) en menos tiempo del que llevaría recibirlas. Alternativamente, prueba con pollo si lo prefieres.','["300 g de langostinos crudos","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","40 g de harina de maíz","aceite de girasol, para freír","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, picadas en trozos grandes","arroz cocido, para servir","1 cebolla morada, picada en trozos grandes","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y picados en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","100ml de vinagre de malta","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 cucharadas de salsa de tomate"]','["Coloca las gambas en un bol y mézclalas con la soja, luego déjalas reposar unos minutos. Agrega la harina de maíz.","Calentar el aceite a fuego alto hasta una profundidad de 3-4 cm. Cuando brille o cuando un termómetro de cocina marque 170 ° C, fríe los langostinos en tandas durante unos 2 minutos hasta que estén crujientes y dorados, dándoles la vuelta con una espumadera a la mitad. Levante con cuidado sobre un plato con la espumadera. Apaga el fuego. Deje la sartén unos minutos para que se enfríe.","Vierta con cuidado todo menos 1 cucharada de aceite del wok; guarde el resto para usarlo en otra receta o deséchelo.","Vuelve a poner el wok a fuego alto. Cuando el aceite brille, añade con cuidado la cebolla y los pimientos y sofríe durante 1 min. Agrega el ajo y el jengibre y continúa cocinando durante 30 segundos, luego esparce el azúcar y vierte el vinagre. Sube el fuego y deja hervir durante 2 minutos. Agregue la soja y el ketchup para hacer una salsa espesa y brillante. Cuando esté listo para servir, coloque los langostinos nuevamente en la sartén y revuelva para cubrirlos con la salsa. Esparza el cilantro picado y sirva con arroz cocido a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13532,3851,'es','Arroz frito con col rizada y kimchi','Dale vida al arroz frito en esta cena rápida con kimchi fermentado y picante. Si no tienes col rizada, puedes usar pak choi o las verduras que prefieras.','["100 g de col rizada","2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo","3 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","100 g de arroz basmati cocido","120 g de kimchi","2 huevos grandes","unas hojas de cilantro, para servir","shichimi togarashi y aceite de chile, para servir (opcional)"]','["Llevar a ebullición una cacerola con agua con sal, agregar la col rizada y cocinar durante 1 min. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio. Agregue las cebolletas y el ajo y cocine por 1 min. Suba el fuego a alto, agregue el arroz y cocine por 3 minutos. Agrega el kimchi y la col rizada y revuelve hasta que todo esté bien caliente.","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén aparte a fuego alto. Rompe los huevos y cocina sin tocarlos durante varios minutos o hasta que estén crujientes y dorados en los bordes y las yemas todavía estén un poco líquidas.","Divida el arroz en dos tazones poco profundos, cubra con los huevos fritos, el cilantro, luego el shichimi togarashi y el aceite de chile, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13533,3855,'es','Gambas fritas con salsa de pimiento picante al ajillo','Prueba este plato clásico coreano-chino; una variación de los langostinos agridulces. Los langostinos se rebozan, se fríen y se bañan en una salsa picante con ajo.','["aceite vegetal, para freír","700 g de gambas grandes, peladas, desvenadas y secas","65 g de harina de maíz","95 g de fécula de patata","50 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 clara de huevo","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","4½ cucharaditas de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","1 cucharadita de gochujang","1-2 cucharaditas de sriracha, salsa de chile o salsa de chile y ajo, dependiendo de qué tan picante te guste","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo tostado","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","3 cucharadas de cebolla picada","6 dientes de ajo, rallados o finamente picados","1 chile rojo coreano fresco o chile fresno, cortado en cubitos","1 chile verde coreano fresco o jalapeño, cortado en cubitos","un puñado de cebolletas, cortadas en ángulo","arroz blanco cocido"]','["En una sartén grande, ancha y de base pesada de al menos 13 cm de profundidad, calienta 5 cm de aceite vegetal a fuego medio-alto (asegúrate de que la sartén no esté más de dos tercios de su capacidad) hasta que alcance los 190 °C. Mientras se calienta el aceite, haz la masa. Mezcla en un bol la maicena, la fécula de patata, la harina y el bicarbonato con una pizca de sal. Añade la clara de huevo, el aceite vegetal y 120 ml de agua y bate hasta formar una masa espesa.","Trabajando en tandas, cubra las gambas con la masa, dejando que el exceso gotee en el recipiente. Sumerja con cuidado los langostinos en el aceite caliente, uno a la vez, y fríalos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que estén dorados, aproximadamente 1½ minutos. Transfiera a una rejilla o plato forrado con papel para escurrir. Repita con las gambas restantes, dejando que el aceite vuelva a 190 ° C entre tandas.","Deje que el aceite vuelva a 190C, luego vuelva a colocar con cuidado las gambas en el aceite y fríalas por segunda vez durante 1½-2 minutos hasta que estén muy crujientes. Transfiera a una rejilla o a un plato forrado con papel para escurrir. Dejar de lado.","Para hacer la salsa, mezcle en un bol el azúcar, el puré de tomate, la salsa de soja, el vinagre, el gochujang, la sriracha y el aceite de sésamo con el resto de la harina de maíz y 60 ml de agua hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite vegetal en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto y agrega la cebolla, el ajo, los chiles rojos y verdes. Cocine durante unos 30 segundos, revolviendo, hasta que esté fragante. Agregue la mezcla de salsa y cocine durante unos 45 segundos, revolviendo, hasta que la salsa espese y se vuelva brillante. Agregue los langostinos fritos, revuelva rápidamente para cubrirlos y transfiéralo a un plato. Esparza las cebolletas y sirva inmediatamente con arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:58:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13534,7015,'es','Aceite de maní, chile y ajo','Vierta este ardiente aceite de maní, chile y ajo sobre fideos instantáneos, ramen, huevos fritos crujientes sobre tostadas y ensalada de carne. Los cacahuetes añaden un delicioso crujido.','["2 dientes de ajo grandes","200 ml de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino de arroz","1-2 cucharaditas de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","40 g de maní finamente picado"]','["Cortar finamente los dientes de ajo. Calienta el aceite de sésamo en una sartén y chisporrotea el ajo hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Dejar enfriar. Agregue el vinagre de vino de arroz, las hojuelas de chile, la salsa de soja y el maní. Vierta en un frasco de 200 ml, sazone y agite bien."]','2026-01-11 12:58:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13535,4295,'es','Tazón de verduras teriyaki asadas','Disfrute de un tazón de verduras vegano equilibrado con arroz integral cubierto con verduras coloridas y garbanzos cocinados en salsa teriyaki. Ofrece cuatro de tus 5 al día.','["300 g de brócoli de tallo largo","2 baby pak choi, en cuartos","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos de 3 cm","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","4 zanahorias, picadas en gajos","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo o de oliva","4 cucharadas de salsa teriyaki","1 trozo grande de jengibre, del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","400 g de arroz integral cocido","4 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo blanco y negro tostadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Picar los tallos de brócoli, dejando los floretes enteros, y ponerlo todo en un bol grande. Añade el pak choi, la cebolla morada, los pimientos, las zanahorias, los garbanzos (secados con papel de cocina), el aceite, 3 cucharadas de salsa teriyaki y el jengibre. Revuelva hasta que todo esté cubierto y sazone ligeramente. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear antiadherente grande en una sola capa uniforme, usando dos bandejas si es necesario.","Hornee las verduras durante 35 a 40 minutos, revolviendo a la mitad hasta que comiencen a dorarse. Cuando queden 5 min de cocción, calentar el arroz. Divida el arroz entre los tazones y cubra con las verduras asadas. Rocíe sobre la salsa teriyaki reservada y espolvoree con las cebolletas y las semillas de sésamo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13536,5471,'es','Fideos udon con kimchi y sésamo','Disfrute de fideos udon con kimchi, rábano y cebolleta para una comida rápida entre semana que le proporcionará tres de sus 5 al día. Cubra con un huevo frito y hojuelas de chile.','["200 g de fideos udon directos al wok","1½ cucharada de aceite de sésamo","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","200 g de brócoli de tallo largo, con los tallos cortados en rodajas","75 g de kimchi finamente picado","100 g de rábanos, finamente cortados","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","½ cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal","2 huevos grandes","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo negro","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile (opcional)"]','["Coloque los fideos en un colador sobre el fregadero y viértalos en una tetera con agua hirviendo. Mezcle para separar y luego déjelo escurrir.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo en una sartén grande a fuego medio. Agrega la cebolla y el jengibre y sofríe durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden un poco. Agrega el brócoli, el kimchi y el rábano y continúa friendo durante 5 minutos. Agregue los fideos escurridos, las cebolletas y la salsa de soja.","Mientras tanto, ponga la ½ cucharada de aceite restante en una sartén pequeña y fría los huevos durante 3 minutos, o hasta que estén cocidos a su gusto. Sirve los fideos en tazones con un huevo encima y espolvorea con semillas de sésamo y unas hojuelas de chile, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:58:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13537,3926,'es','Curry de tomate y coco','Celebre los tomates (incluso mejor si son de cosecha propia) con este jugoso curry de coco que aporta mucho color y sabor a su plato.','["1 cucharadita colmada de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita colmada de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharadita colmada de semillas de hinojo","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o colza","10 hojas de curry","3 cebollas grandes, en rodajas finas","1 cucharadita colmada de semillas de mostaza negra","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas","4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile verde, finamente picado","1 kg de tomates maduros grandes, cortados en cuartos","250 g de tomates cherry o pera pequeños","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco.","2 cucharaditas colmadas de pasta de tamarindo","2 cucharaditas colmadas de azúcar moreno o de palma","arroz cocido, para servir"]','["Vierta las semillas de comino, cilantro e hinojo en una sartén grande y seca a fuego medio-alto y tueste hasta que estén fragantes y ligeramente doradas. Retirar inmediatamente del fuego y luego triturar con un mortero y un molinillo de especias.","Rocíe el aceite en la sartén. Agrega las hojas de curry y cocina durante un minuto, luego agrega las cebollas. Freír durante unos 5 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente dorados. Agrega las semillas de mostaza, la mezcla de especias molidas, la cúrcuma, la sal, el ajo y la guindilla y sofríe un par de minutos más. Vierta todos los tomates y fríalos un minuto más antes de agregar la leche de coco, el tamarindo y el azúcar.","Cocine el curry a fuego lento durante 25 minutos hasta que los tomates estén muy suaves y el líquido se haya espesado un poco. Pruebe el condimento y agregue un poco más de sal o azúcar si es necesario. Servir caliente con el arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:58:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13538,3962,'es','Fideos con huevos crujientes de aceite de chile','Haz tu propio aceite de chile crujiente y úsalo para condimentar fideos y pak choi. Cubra con huevos fritos para obtener la mejor comida reconfortante.','["1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","2 cabezas de pak choi, cada una partida por la mitad a través del corazón","2 cucharaditas de vinagre negro chino","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","pizca de azúcar","200 g de fideos cocidos (yo uso fideos directos al wok, fideos de huevo, udon o ramen)","2 huevos grandes","4 chalotas pequeñas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 cabeza de ajo (unos 8-10 dientes) en rodajas finas","1 rama de canela de 10 cm","anís de 4 estrellas","500 ml de aceite vegetal","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de granos de pimienta de Szechuan","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente picado","30 g de hojuelas de chile rojo triturado","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo"]','["Para hacer el aceite de chile, coloque las chalotas, el ajo, la ramita de canela, el anís estrellado y el aceite en una sartén ancha (una sartén honda es buena), luego déjela chisporrotear suavemente. Cocine durante 15-20 minutos a fuego medio-bajo, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que las chalotas y el ajo estén crujientes y dorados. Se quemarán fácilmente si el fuego es demasiado alto, así que ten cuidado con la sartén.","Mientras tanto, tuesta las semillas de sésamo en una sartén seca hasta que estén doradas, luego viértelas en un bol y reserva. Coloque las semillas de comino y los granos de pimienta de Szechuan en la sartén y tueste durante 1-2 minutos hasta que estén aromáticos. Vierta en un molinillo de especias con mortero y mortero y muela hasta obtener un polvo. Mezclar con las semillas de sésamo tostadas.","Añade el jengibre, las hojuelas de chile, la soja y el azúcar al bol con las especias tostadas y molidas. Cuando las chalotas y el ajo estén crujientes, cuela el aceite sobre el bol usando un colador. Deje los trozos crujientes de ajo y chalota en el colador para que se enfríen y queden aún más crujientes. Desecha la canela y el anís estrellado.","Revuelva las chalotas y el ajo enfriados con la mezcla de aceite especiado. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos semanas en un frasco esterilizado hermético.","Cuando esté listo para hacer los fideos, caliente el aceite vegetal en un wok. Añade el pak choi y sofríe un minuto con un chorrito de agua y una pizca de sal. Cubrir con una tapa (o una bandeja para hornear si no tienes). Cocine al vapor durante un minuto, luego retire las verduras del wok y deje que escurra el líquido. Reservar en un plato. Ponga el vinagre, la salsa de soja, el aceite de sésamo y el azúcar en la sartén junto con 2 cucharaditas de aceite de chile crujiente. Haga una burbuja, luego agregue los fideos y revuelva durante unos minutos a fuego alto hasta que la salsa se adhiera a los fideos y estén suaves y resbaladizos. Divide los fideos en dos tazones y pon el pak choi encima.","Limpia la sartén. Agregue otro chorrito de aceite de chile crujiente junto con aproximadamente 2 cucharaditas de sedimento del frasco. Cuando chisporrotee, rompa los huevos y fríalos hasta que estén crujientes por el borde, echando una cucharada de aceite mientras se cocinan. Desliza los huevos fritos sobre los fideos, agregando más trozos crujientes del frasco, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13539,3988,'es','Mrs curry al estilo Singapur','Suzanne Bloor, miembro de GF, comparte su plato favorito los viernes por la noche: un pollo al curry simplificado con influencias del sudeste asiático. Ideal para una familia de cuatro','["80 g de pasta de curry nyonya (disponible en línea y en Waitrose & Partners, o consulte el consejo a continuación)","500 g de muslos de pollo con hueso y sin piel","200 g de patatas, cortadas en cubos de 3 cm","150 g de zanahorias, cortadas en cubos de 3 cm","1 cebolla grande, picada en trozos grandes","100ml de leche de coco","arroz cocido y pan naan (opcional), para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner 200ml de agua y la pasta de curry en una cacerola grande apta para horno. Revuelva y cocine a fuego lento a fuego lento hasta que la mezcla esté fragante.","Agrega el pollo, las patatas, las zanahorias y la cebolla, sazona y revuelve bien para combinar. Suba el fuego a medio y deje que hierva, agregue la leche de coco y luego vuelva a hervir. Retire del fuego, cubra la sartén y transfiérala al horno para cocinar durante 1 hora y 15 minutos, retirando la tapa después de 45 minutos, o hasta que las verduras estén tiernas pero sin desmoronarse y el pollo esté bien cocido. El curry debe tener una consistencia parecida a la de un caldo. Verifique el condimento.","Sirva en tazones poco profundos sobre arroz, con algunos panes naan a un lado, si lo desea. Se mantendrá tapado en el refrigerador hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:58:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13540,7017,'es','Curry verde tailandés','Olvídese de comprar un frasco de salsa ya preparada y prepare un aromático curry verde tailandés desde cero. Esta receta produce más pasta de curry de la necesaria, pero puedes congelar el resto para la próxima vez.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2-3 cucharadas de pasta de curry verde (ver más abajo)","200 g de muslos de pollo, pelados, deshuesados ​​y cortados en trozos","lata de 400g de leche de coco","2 berenjenas tailandesas","50 g de berenjenas de guisantes","2 maíz tierno, cortado en ángulo","50 g de guisantes dulces","2-4 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","2-4 cucharaditas de azúcar o azúcar de palma","2 hojas de lima, sin tallos","¼ manojo de albahaca tailandesa","1 chile rojo, rebanado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","8 chiles verdes, finamente picados","5 g de raíz de cúrcuma fresca","1 tallo de limoncillo, machacado y finamente picado","25 g de galanga, finamente picada","2 tallos de raíz de cilantro, finamente picado","2 hojas de lima, picadas en trozos grandes","4 chalotas tailandesas, peladas y cortadas en rodajas finas","10 g de jengibre finamente picado (opcional)","½ cucharadita de pasta de camarones"]','["Para hacer la pasta de curry, combine gradualmente todos los ingredientes, excepto la pasta de camarones, usando un mortero y un mortero. Agregue los ingredientes uno a la vez y machaque vigorosamente después de cada uno para formar una pasta rugosa. Agrega la pasta de camarones y continúa machacando hasta obtener una pasta suave. La pasta estará lista cuando ya no pueda identificar ninguno de los ingredientes. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético en el refrigerador durante 3 a 5 días o en el congelador hasta por tres meses.","Para hacer el curry, calienta el aceite en una cacerola a fuego lento. Agrega la pasta de curry verde y revuelve hasta que esté fragante; no necesitarás toda la pasta. Aumente el fuego a medio y agregue los trozos de pollo, cubriendo con la pasta. Cuando el pollo se haya dorado, vierta la mitad de la leche de coco, evitando agregar agua en el fondo de la lata; esto dividirá el curry. Revuelve continuamente durante 10 minutos o hasta que el pollo esté completamente cocido y la salsa hierva a fuego lento.","Vierta el resto de la leche de coco, deseche el agua y suba el fuego hasta que hierva, luego regrese el fuego a medio. Agregue las berenjenas tailandesas y los guisantes con el maíz tierno y los guisantes dulces y cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo ocasionalmente, durante unos 10 minutos o hasta que los sabores se combinen, la salsa se espese un poco y las verduras estén tiernas.","Agregue gradualmente la salsa de pescado y el azúcar de palma, revolviendo y probando después de cada adición hasta que esté satisfecho. Agrega las hojas de lima y la mayor parte de la albahaca tailandesa, luego cocina durante 5 minutos más para que se infundan sus sabores. Para servir, vierta el curry en platos individuales y esparza sobre el chile en rodajas y las hojas restantes de albahaca tailandesa."]','2026-01-11 12:58:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13541,6863,'es','gulab jamun','Prepare uno de los postres festivos más preciados de la India, el gulab jamun. Estas albóndigas fritas están perfumadas con cardamomo y bañadas en almíbar de rosas y azafrán.','["4 vainas de cardamomo verde, perforadas","600 g de azúcar en polvo","unas gotas de agua de rosas","¼ de cucharadita de hebras de azafrán, remojadas en 2 cucharadas de agua tibia durante una hora","2 cucharaditas de pistachos picados","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","6 vainas de cardamomo verde, sin semillas","100 g de leche entera en polvo","40 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de ghee casero (ver más abajo) o mantequilla blanda sin sal","1 cucharada de yogur natural con toda la grasa","chorrito de jugo de limón","4-5 cucharadas de leche entera","aceite de girasol, para tus manos","1 kg de ghee comprado en la tienda, para freír"]','["Para hacer el almíbar, calentar en una cacerola el cardamomo, el azúcar y 500 ml de agua, sin dejar que el agua hierva antes de que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos y luego déjelo enfriar.","Añade el agua de rosas, el azafrán y un poco de su agua de remojo, añadiendo poco a poco para darle un sabor sutil. Reservar en la sartén.","Para hacer el gulab jamun, muele el cardamomo y el azúcar con un mortero y un mortero.","Tamice la leche en polvo, la harina y el polvo para hornear en un tazón y agregue el cardamomo molido. Frote el ghee o la mantequilla caseros con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca migajas gruesas.","Agrega el yogur, el jugo de limón y suficiente leche para formar una masa suave; ten cuidado de no trabajar demasiado la mezcla.","Engrasa tus manos con un poco de aceite de girasol y forma bolitas con pequeñas porciones de la masa del tamaño de una nuez pequeña, de unos 3cm de diámetro y 20g cada una. Deberías tener 16 bolas. Cuida que las empanadillas queden lisas y no tengan grietas ni pliegues.","Recalentar el almíbar. Una vez que hierva, apaga el fuego y tapa con una tapa.","Calentar el ghee en un wok o karahi a 130 ° C. Cuando un pequeño trozo de masa que se deja caer en el aceite se dore en unos 40 segundos, fríe las bolas en tandas a fuego medio, moviéndolas hasta que adquieran un color marrón uniforme y profundo, aproximadamente de 5 a 7 minutos. Retirar de la sartén con una espumadera y luego escurrir sobre papel de cocina. Agregue al almíbar tibio y déjelos en remojo durante 2-3 horas o preferiblemente durante la noche.","Cuando esté listo para comer, caliente el gulab jamun en una sartén ancha y vierta sobre el almíbar. Sirva bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:58:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13542,7019,'es','Atchara','Sirva atchara (papaya encurtida) con nuestro pollo asado de inspiración filipina para disfrutar de un fabuloso festín de fin de semana. Utilice mooli como sustituto si no puede conseguir papaya verde. Esta ensalada se conserva en el frigorífico cinco días.','["50 g de papaya verde o mooli, pelada y cortada en tiras muy finas","40 g de zanahorias peladas y cortadas en tiras muy finas","20 g de chalotes de plátano, cortados en tiras muy finas","1 chile rojo, cortado en tiras finas","Un trozo de 2,5 cm de jengibre, pelado y cortado en tiras finas","1 diente de ajo, pelado y dejado entero","300 ml de vinagre de sidra","210 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Mezclar la papaya, las zanahorias, las chalotas, la guindilla, el jengibre y el ajo con una buena pizca de sal marina y dejar escurrir en un colador durante 10 minutos. Enjuague la mezcla de verduras y escurra bien.","Mientras tanto, llevar a ebullición el vinagre de sidra, el azúcar en polvo y 90 ml de agua y luego apagar el fuego. Coloque las verduras en dos frascos esterilizados de 330 ml o en un recipiente hermético y vierta sobre el líquido de encurtido. Sirva con el pollo en asal (ver ''combina bien'', más abajo). Se conservará en el refrigerador durante cinco días."]','2026-01-11 12:58:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13543,4052,'es','bolas de boniato','Prepare uno de los bocadillos taiwaneses favoritos: las bolas de camote. Están hechos con almidón de camote y tapioca, se enrollan en bolas y se fríen hasta que estén dorados.','["175 g de boniato pelado y picado en trozos grandes (peso preparado)","35 g de azúcar en polvo","125 g de almidón de tapioca","aceite vegetal, para freír"]','["Cocine al vapor la batata al vapor a fuego medio durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté lo suficientemente suave como para insertar un cuchillo para cubiertos. Triture la batata con un machacador de papas o un tenedor hasta que quede suave. Agrega el azúcar, el almidón de tapioca y una buena pizca de condimento, luego mezcla bien con las manos. Vierta gradualmente 1-2 cucharadas de agua y luego mezcle bien hasta que se forme una masa flexible.","Divida la masa en cuatro y enrolle cada pieza en forma de salchicha larga de aproximadamente 2 cm de diámetro. Corte cada trozo de masa en trozos de 2 cm y enróllelos en bolas en la palma de su mano. No te preocupes si se desmoronan, simplemente sigue aplastándolos hasta que formen una bola.","Llene hasta la mitad una cacerola grande de base pesada con aceite. Calienta a temperatura media hasta que un termómetro de cocina marque 120 ° C. Sumerja tandas de bolas en el aceite (es posible que deba cocinarlas en dos o tres tandas) y fríalas durante 2 minutos hasta que comiencen a flotar. Cuando estén flotando bajamos un poco el fuego. Pasa las bolas por el aceite con una espumadera hasta que aumenten de tamaño, haciéndolo cada minuto, durante unos 3-4 minutos. Vuelva a subir el fuego y continúe friendo hasta que se doren.","Transfiera las bolas a papel de cocina con una espumadera. Dejar escurrir y enfriar un poco y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13544,7021,'es','Ramen de pollo vegano','Utilice las verduras sobrantes para hacer este ramen vegano fácil. También puede agregar maíz dulce congelado, edamame o verduras para una sabrosa comida entre semana.','["2 nidos de fideos ramen","1 caldo de verduras o cubito","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","Paquete de 160 g de trozos de pollo estilo What the Cluck","2 cucharadas de jengibre rallado o jengibre rallado congelado","2 cucharadas de maíz dulce, edamame o guisantes congelados","un puñado de verduras tiernas o un par de hojas de col, ralladas","½-1 zanahoria, rallada","aceite de chile o salsa de soja, para servir (opcional)"]','["Cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, escúrralos bien y reserve. Mezclar el caldo de verduras en una cacerola con 300 ml de agua y llevar a fuego lento. Mantener caliente a fuego lento.","Calienta ½ cucharada de aceite de sésamo en una sartén, luego fríe los trozos de pollo estilo What the Cluck hasta que se doren. Reservar en un plato.","Calentar el aceite restante en la sartén y sofreír el jengibre y el maíz dulce hasta que empiecen a tomar color. Pon las verduras en el caldo para que se calienten y añade la zanahoria rallada si la prefieres más tierna. Vuelva a llevar el caldo a fuego lento.","Divida los fideos en dos tazones, coloque las verduras y los trozos de pollo estilo What the Cluck encima, luego vierta sobre el caldo. Rocíe con aceite de chile o salsa de soja, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13545,6614,'es','Filete de cerdo hoisin pegajoso con hojas de sésamo y fideos','Disfrute del pegajoso filete de cerdo hoisin con hojas de sésamo y fideos para una cena fácil en las noches ocupadas. Es bajo en calorías y grasas, pero lleno de sabor.','["4 cucharadas de salsa hoisin, más extra para servir","1 filete de cerdo (unos 400 g), sin grasa ni tendones","4 nidos de fideos al huevo","3 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","300 g de col rizada, hojas tiernas o acelgas, picadas","100 g de cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","200 g de frijoles o guisantes edamame en vaina congelados, descongelados","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja baja en sal","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz"]','["Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cepille el hoisin por toda la carne de cerdo y transfiéralo a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel de aluminio. Ase, rociando cada 10 minutos, durante 25 a 30 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido. Retirar del horno y dejar reposar 5 min.","Mientras tanto, cocine los fideos de huevo siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, escúrralos y luego mezcle con 1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo para evitar que se peguen. Calienta el aceite de sésamo restante en un wok o en una sartén grande y fríe las verduras durante 4 minutos, añadiendo un chorrito de agua para ayudar a ablandar los tallos. Añade la mayoría de las cebolletas y todos los frijoles edamame. Freír durante 2 minutos más hasta que las verduras estén tiernas, luego agregar las semillas de sésamo, la salsa de soja y el vinagre de arroz. Mezcle todo para que se cubra bien.","Corta la carne de cerdo en rodajas gruesas y sírvela con los fideos, las hojas de sésamo y las cebolletas restantes espolvoreadas por encima. Sirva con más salsa hoisin, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13546,7023,'es','Aloo Tikki','Disfrute de estas hamburguesas indias de papa, rellenas de guisantes condimentados con polvo de mango afrutado, con salsa de tamarindo y condimento de cilantro fresco.','["500 g de patatas, Maris Piper o King Edwards, cortadas en trozos del mismo tamaño","3 cucharadas de pan rallado fresco","1 cucharada de harina común","3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol, más un poco más para freír","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","20 g de jengibre fresco, pelado y rallado fino","1 chile verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","½ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","½ cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de mango en polvo (amchoor) o jugo de ½ limón","75 g de guisantes congelados","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua con sal y cocine las patatas hasta que estén tiernas al pincharlas con un cuchillo. Escurrir las patatas, luego triturarlas y dejarlas enfriar antes de agregarles el pan rallado y la harina.","Ahora, haz el relleno. Calienta el aceite en una sartén y cocina la cebolla hasta que se ablande. Agregue el jengibre, el chile verde, las especias y el mango en polvo, luego agregue los guisantes congelados.","Cocine a fuego medio, revolviendo todo el tiempo, hasta que los guisantes se hayan descongelado y estén tiernos. Retirar del fuego, luego triturar los guisantes con un tenedor y agregar el cilantro picado. Dejar enfriar.","Divida la mezcla de papa en nueve porciones con las manos mojadas. Aplana una porción en un disco de 5 cm de diámetro con un grosor de 1 cm en la palma de tu mano. Coloque una cucharadita del relleno de guisantes especiados en el centro del disco, luego coloque suavemente el puré de papa alrededor del relleno para que quede completamente cubierto. Aplana el ''tikki'' para que parezca una hamburguesa. Repita con la papa restante y el relleno, luego colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear y enfríe durante 20 a 30 minutos para que se endurezca.","Calienta de 6 a 8 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén grande o en una plancha y cocina los tikkis en tandas a fuego medio hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Sirva inmediatamente con salsa de tamarindo y dátiles y condimento de cilantro (consulte \"combina bien\" a continuación)."]','2026-01-11 12:58:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13547,4080,'es','Siu Mai (dim sum)','Prepara uno de los tipos más populares de dim sum, el siu mai. Tradicionalmente se cubren con huevas de pescado, pero nosotros hemos optado por bayas de goji para darle un toque de color.','["40 g de castañas de agua, escurridas y finamente picadas","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","1 cebolla tierna, finamente picada","1½ cucharada de salsa de soja ligera premium Lee Kum Kee","¾ cucharada de vino de arroz Shaoxing o jerez seco","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo puro Lee Kum Kee","120 g de langostinos finamente picados","200 g de cerdo picado","1 clara de huevo","1 cucharada de harina de patata o maicena","20 envoltorios de wonton, de unos 8 cm de diámetro","20 bayas de goji, para la parte superior (opcional)","Salsa de soja dulce Lee Kum Kee mezclada con un poco de jengibre rallado y aceite de chile Lee Kum Kee Chiu Chow (opcional), para mojar"]','["Ponga las castañas de agua, el jengibre, la cebolleta, la Salsa de Soja Light Premium, el vino de arroz, el Aceite Puro de Sésamo, las gambas, la carne de cerdo, la clara de huevo y la harina de patata en un bol y mezcle bien con las manos para combinar. Deje marinar durante 20-30 minutos para que se mezclen los sabores.","Apile los envoltorios sobre una superficie de trabajo cubierta con un paño húmedo y forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear antiadherente. Coloca un envoltorio en la palma de tu mano y agrega 1 cucharada del relleno en el centro. Levante los lados del envoltorio alrededor del relleno para formar una canasta, pero no apriete la parte superior; aún debería poder ver el relleno.","Agregue más relleno si es necesario hasta que llegue a la parte superior del espacio, presionando suavemente con un dedo húmedo hasta que quede plano. Golpee la bola de masa en el banco para aplanar la base y colóquela en la bandeja preparada. Añade una baya de goji, si quieres. Repita con los envoltorios restantes y el relleno hasta tener unas 20 bolas de masa.","Poner un disco de pergamino antiadherente en una vaporera y rellenar con algunas de las bolas de masa, dejando un poco de espacio entre cada una. Cubra y cocine al vapor sobre un wok de agua hirviendo durante 8 a 10 minutos, o use una vaporera eléctrica. Repita con las albóndigas restantes. Sirva con la salsa para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13548,7025,'es','char siu cantonés','Disfrute de esta deliciosa carne de cerdo glaseada con miel con arroz jazmín, pak choi y cebolletas para una cena fácil. Elija filetes de cerdo más grasos para obtener más sabor.','["3 filetes de paleta de cerdo (elija filetes más grasos, si es posible)","arroz jazmín cocido y pak choi al vapor, para servir","1 cebolla tierna, finamente rebanada, para servir","2 cucharadas de salsa hoisin (también puedes usar salsa de ostras, pero necesitarás más miel porque es menos dulce)","1⁄2 cubo de tofu rojo de lata, más 3 cucharaditas de salsa de la lata","1⁄2 cucharadita de salsa de soja ligera","1⁄2 tsp dark soy sauce","1 cucharadita de vino de arroz Shaohsing (vino de cocina chino)","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","6 cucharadas de miel"]','["Primero, prepara la marinada. Batir la salsa hoisin, el tofu rojo (junto con la salsa de la lata), las salsas de soja, el vino de arroz, el ajo y 3 cucharadas de miel. Vierta la mitad en un tazón grande con la carne de cerdo y reserve el resto de la marinada para rociarla más tarde. Sazone la carne de cerdo, revuélvala para cubrirla y déjela enfriar durante 5 horas para que se marine.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Transfiera la carne de cerdo a una fuente para asar y ase durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el resto de la marinada con el resto de la miel. Cepille la carne de cerdo cada 10 minutos para que tenga un color uniforme. Sirva con el arroz, el pak choi y las cebolletas esparcidas por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:58:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13549,7029,'es','Rollos de papel de arroz arcoiris','Escápese de la rutina de los sándwiches a la hora del almuerzo con estos rollos de papel de arroz. La col lombarda y los rábanos añaden un bonito toque de color, o prueba la lechuga iceberg o Little Gem.','["50 g de fideos finos de arroz","12 envolturas de papel de arroz","un puñado de hojas de menta o cilantro, o cebollino picado (o una mezcla)","200 g de gambas cocidas o pollo cocido y desmenuzado","¼ de pepino, recortado y cortado finamente en palitos","1 zanahoria, pelada y cortada finamente en palitos","40 g de col lombarda cortada en rodajas muy finas","un puñado pequeño de rábanos, recortados y en rodajas finas","½ mango, deshuesado, partido por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","1 cucharada de tahini","1 cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo, más un poco más para rociar","½ lima, en jugo"]','["Remoja los fideos en agua hirviendo del hervidor, siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir y enjuagar con agua corriente fría para que se enfríen, luego agregar un poco de aceite de sésamo para evitar que se peguen.","A continuación, prepare la salsa para mojar mezclando todos los ingredientes. Dejar de lado.","Llena un plato ancho y poco profundo a unos centímetros de profundidad con agua tibia. Trabajando con una envoltura de papel de arroz a la vez, remójala durante unos segundos hasta que esté flexible y luego colócala sobre una tabla de cortar. Esparce algunas de las hierbas en el centro, luego cubre con un par de langostinos o un poco de pollo, luego algunos trozos de verduras y mango, y un pequeño manojo de fideos. Intenta mantener los rellenos en el centro y no los llenes demasiado. Meta los extremos de la envoltura sobre los ingredientes para encerrarlos ligeramente, luego enróllelos por los lados, manteniendo todo lo más apretado posible. Coloca los panecillos terminados en un plato cubierto con una hoja de papel de cocina húmeda hasta que hayas terminado de armar todos los panecillos. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta 24 horas. Sirva con la salsa de sésamo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13550,4125,'es','Huevos revueltos con kimchi','Prepare un brunch saludable con huevos revueltos y kimchi servidos sobre pan integral tostado. Espolvorea con cebolletas y una pizca de togarashi para terminar.','["2 huevos medianos","1 cucharada de leche","40 g de kimchi","1 rebanada de pan integral tostado","1 cebolla tierna, cortada finamente","pizca de togarashi, para servir (opcional)"]','["Batir los huevos y la leche junto con una pizca de sal. Vierte en una sartén antiadherente a fuego lento. Déjelo intacto durante 30 segundos, luego levante un poco la sartén y agite los huevos. Cocine por 2 minutos más, luego doble el kimchi y rompa los huevos para revolverlos.","Sirva los huevos revueltos con kimchi sobre la tostada y cubra con la cebolleta y el tograshi, si los usa."]','2026-01-11 12:58:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13551,4139,'es','Ensalada de sésamo, edamame y pollo con fideos','Prepare un picnic para la familia con este saludable almuerzo de fideos integrales con pollo, edamame, brócoli y semillas de sésamo. Hazlo en sólo 20 minutos.','["2 muslos de pollo, cocidos","1½ cucharada de semillas de sésamo","4 nidos de fideos integrales","160 g de frijoles edamame congelados","160 g de brócoli de tallo largo, cortado en floretes pequeños","1 cucharada de tahini","2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de miel","1½ cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sodio","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino de arroz"]','["Hervir la tetera. Retire la piel del pollo, luego desmenuce la carne y deseche los huesos. Dejar de lado. En una sartén grande, tuesta las semillas de sésamo durante 1 minuto hasta que estén doradas, luego viértelas en un tazón grande (lo suficientemente grande como para contener los fideos).","Llene la cacerola con agua del hervidor y vuelva a hervir. Agrega los fideos y cocina siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Agregue los frijoles y el brócoli durante los últimos 2 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el tahini, el aceite de sésamo, la miel, la salsa de soja y el vinagre con las semillas de sésamo. Escurre los fideos, reserva una taza del agua de cocción y pásalos por agua fría para que se enfríen. Escurrir nuevamente y mezclar con la salsa junto con el pollo. Agregue un chorrito de agua de cocción para que la salsa quede lo suficientemente fina como para cubrir los fideos (se espesará a medida que se enfríe). Transfiera a recipientes y enfríe hasta que esté listo para comer, si no se come de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 12:58:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13552,4147,'es','Fideos con pollo al jengibre y judías verdes','Pruebe este rápido pollo al jengibre en una sartén con fideos y judías verdes como una comida rápida y fácil entre semana. Es saludable, bajo en grasas y calorías también.','["½ cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel, en rodajas","200 g de judías verdes, peladas y cortadas por la mitad en forma transversal","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y cortado en palitos","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 bola de jengibre de tallo, finamente picado, más 1 cucharadita de almíbar del frasco","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz, mezclada con 1 cucharada de agua","1 cucharadita de salsa de soja oscura, más un poco más para servir (opcional)","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de arroz","200 g de fideos al huevo cocidos"]','["Calienta el aceite en un wok a fuego alto y sofríe el pollo durante 5 minutos. Agregue las judías verdes y saltee durante 4-5 minutos más hasta que las judías verdes estén tiernas y el pollo esté bien cocido.","Agregue el jengibre fresco y el ajo y sofría durante 2 minutos, luego agregue el tallo de jengibre y el almíbar, la mezcla de harina de maíz, la salsa de soja y el vinagre. Sofría durante 1 minuto y luego agregue los fideos. Cocine hasta que todo esté caliente y la salsa cubra los fideos. Rocíe con más soja, si lo desea, y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:58:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13553,7031,'es','Pato en una sartén con costra de cilantro, ciruelas asadas y verduras','Disfrute de este pato con costra de cilantro, ciruelas dulces asadas y pak choi como parte de un menú de verano. Es rápido y fácil y no necesitarás encontrar ningún ingrediente especial en las tiendas.','["2 cucharadas de semillas de cilantro, ligeramente trituradas","2 pechugas de pato pequeñas","2 ciruelas, deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad y cortadas en gajos","2 pak choi, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","100 ml de caldo de pollo","2 cucharadas de miel","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","¼ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y poner las semillas de cilantro en un plato. Marque la piel de las pechugas de pato tantas veces como pueda con un cuchillo pequeño y afilado, luego sazone con sal y presione la piel contra las semillas de cilantro. Calienta una sartén apta para horno y agrega las pechugas, con la piel hacia abajo. Coloque una sartén pesada encima para que pesen y cocine durante 7-8 minutos para eliminar la grasa, escurriendo ocasionalmente el exceso.","Agrega las ciruelas y el pak choi a la sartén, voltea las pechugas y agrega la mitad del caldo. Transfiera al horno y cocine por 4-5 minutos. Retire las pechugas de pato de la sartén y transfiéralas a un plato para que reposen junto con el pak choi.","Vuelve a poner la cacerola con las ciruelas al fuego y añade la miel, la soja, el vinagre y el caldo restante. Llevar a ebullición y continuar cocinando hasta que quede un almíbar. Corta cada pechuga de pato en cuatro trozos. Coloque dos mitades de pak choi sobre cada plato y coloque los trozos de pechuga de pato y las ciruelas entre las verduras. Rocíe con la salsa y luego espolvoree sobre las hojuelas de chile."]','2026-01-11 12:58:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13554,7033,'es','Salsa de chile dulce','Haz tu propia salsa de chile dulce para cocinar. Este condimento tailandés suele contener salsa de pescado, pero hemos mantenido nuestra versión vegetariana.','["20 chiles rojos, sin tallos y sin semillas para obtener una salsa más suave","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un dedo, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","5 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","100 ml de vino blanco o vinagre de sidra","200 g de azúcar blanca en polvo"]','["Vierta todos los ingredientes excepto el azúcar en una mini picadora o licuadora y mezcle hasta obtener una salsa espesa. Vierta el contenido en una cacerola poco profunda con el azúcar y 100 ml de agua y cocine a fuego lento.","Cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que quede espeso. Vigilándolo de cerca, continúe cocinando a fuego lento y revolviendo durante 5 minutos más hasta que cubra fácilmente el dorso de la cuchara y vea el fondo de la sartén cuando revuelva. Dejar enfriar e infundir durante 1-2 horas. Se conservará en un frasco pequeño esterilizado hasta por un mes."]','2026-01-11 12:58:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13555,5583,'es','Palitos de pescado a las hierbas con arroz a la china','Este almuerzo o cena saludable y sin gluten proporciona un equilibrio de carbohidratos y proteínas, lo que lo hace perfecto para reponer energías después del ejercicio.','["100 g de arroz basmati integral","160 g de guisantes congelados","50 g de judías verdes","3 cebolletas, finamente picadas","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile seco","un buen puñado de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de tamari","unas gotas de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharada de aceite de colza prensado en frío","2 huevos grandes","Paquete de 280g de lomos de bacalao sin piel cortados en tiras gruesas (cortados en 4 tiras por lomo)"]','["Cocine el arroz en una cacerola con agua durante 25 minutos, agregando los guisantes y los frijoles durante los últimos 6 minutos. Escurrir, luego regresar a la sartén y agregar las cebolletas, las hojuelas de chile, todo menos 1 cucharada de cilantro picado, el tamari y el aceite de sésamo. Cubrir.","Mientras tanto, calentar una sartén grande antiadherente con el aceite de colza. Batir los huevos con la cucharada restante de cilantro. Cortar el pescado en tiras gruesas, luego rebozarlas en huevo y freírlas en aceite durante un par de minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas. Retire el pescado de la sartén y agregue el arroz con el huevo restante y revuelva. Sirva en tazones y cubra con el pescado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13556,4185,'es','Pho de pavo en olla de cocción lenta','Reduzca el desperdicio de alimentos utilizando el pavo navideño sobrante para hacer caldo; queda excelente en nuestra sopa de fideos pho de inspiración asiática, llena de sabores frescos.','["50 g de jengibre, en rodajas gruesas","2 cebollas, partidas por la mitad","anís de 3 estrellas","2 ramas de canela","½ cucharada de semillas de cilantro","2 dientes","1 carcasa de pavo o pollo, sin carne","2-3 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","2 cucharadas de azúcar","200 g de fideos de arroz planos","400 g de pavo o pollo cocido y en rodajas","100 g de brotes de soja, zanahorias, mooli o brotes blanqueados o rallados","un puñado de hojas de albahaca tailandesa, menta y cilantro","2 chiles rojos, finamente picados","1 lima, cortada en gajos","salsa hoisin y salsa sriracha, para servir"]','["Freír el jengibre y la cebolla en una sartén seca a fuego alto hasta que adquieran un color intenso. Transfiera a la olla de cocción lenta y caliente a fuego lento. Freír las especias enteras durante unos minutos hasta que estén fragantes, luego verterlas en la olla de cocción lenta. Si tiene poco tiempo, simplemente póngalo en la olla de cocción lenta sin freír.","Agregue la carcasa, luego vierta 3-4 litros de agua hirviendo en la olla para que los huesos queden cubiertos, asegurándose de no llenarla demasiado. Tapa y cocina durante 8-10 horas, dependiendo de cuánto tiempo puedas dejarlo.","Colar el caldo, desechando los huesos y las especias. Sazone con la salsa de pescado y el azúcar. Para congelarlo para más tarde, déjelo enfriar por completo y congélelo en un recipiente hermético por hasta tres meses. Manténgalo caliente en la olla de cocción lenta si sirve inmediatamente.","Cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, escúrralos y divídalos en tazones. Cubra con el pavo y los brotes de soja o las verduras, luego transfiera el caldo a una jarra y vierta lo suficiente para llenar los tazones (tendrá más, que puede congelar como se indica arriba). Esparza las hierbas y el chile, luego sirva con las rodajas de lima y las salsas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13557,7035,'es','Larb de salchicha tramposa','Pruebe nuestra versión del larb, un plato tailandés elaborado tradicionalmente con carne picada. Aquí, hemos usado salchichas para simplificar un poco las cosas, pero aún está lleno de sabores de inspiración asiática.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo","2 limas, exprimidas","1 cucharada de salsa de chile","½ cucharada de salsa de pescado","3 salchichas de cerdo","1 cucharada de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas y ralladas","½ manojo de cilantro picado","pequeño manojo de menta, hojas recogidas y rotas","2 lechugas Little Gem, con las hojas separadas","1 pepino pequeño, cortado en palitos"]','["Mezcle 2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo, el jugo de lima, la salsa de chile y la salsa de pescado. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite restante en un wok o sartén antiadherente a fuego medio. Exprima la carne de la salchicha para quitarle la piel y colocarla en la sartén, partiéndola con una cuchara de madera y fríala durante 5 a 6 minutos, o hasta que esté dorada. Revuelva con la pasta de curry y fría durante 1 min. Mezcle la mitad de las cebolletas y la mitad de las hierbas.","Coloque la lechuga y el pepino en dos tazones, agregue la mezcla de salchicha y rocíe sobre el aderezo picante. Termina con las hierbas restantes."]','2026-01-11 12:58:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13558,7037,'es','Sopa cremosa de pollo al curry y arroz','Utilice las sobras de pollo para hacer esta sopa con arroz de inspiración asiática. Sencillo de hacer, es un cuenco abundante para las noches más frías.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","2 latas de 400 g de leche de coco","400 ml de caldo de pollo","100 g de arroz para risotto","4 huevos grandes","unos 200-300 g de pollo asado sobrante, desmenuzado","Lata de 340 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","2-3 limas, exprimidas","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola a fuego medio. Agrega la cebolla y sofríe durante 10 minutos o hasta que se ablande y se vuelva transparente. Agrega la pasta de curry y cocina por 1 min. Agregue la leche de coco, el caldo de pollo y el arroz para risotto y cocine a fuego lento. Cocine durante 15-20 minutos o hasta que el arroz esté tierno.","Lleve una cacerola con agua a fuego lento, agregue los huevos y cocine por 7 minutos. Agrega el pollo y el maíz dulce a la sopa y cocina durante 5 minutos para calentar todo. Sazona al gusto y termina con el jugo de lima. Quita con cuidado las cáscaras de los huevos y córtalos por la mitad. Cubra la sopa con los huevos y las cebolletas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13559,7039,'es','Arroz frito con gambas','Prepara este sencillo plato de inspiración asiática en solo 30 minutos. Es saludable y bajo en calorías pero tiene mucho sabor, lo que lo hace perfecto para una cena familiar rápida.','["250 g de arroz integral de grano largo","150 g de guisantes congelados","100g de tirabeques","1½ cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","150 g de langostinos crudos","3 huevos medianos, batidos","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal","½ cucharada de vinagre de arroz o de vino blanco","4 cebolletas, cortadas y en rodajas"]','["Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Hervir agua en una cacerola aparte y blanquear los guisantes y los tirabeques durante 1 minuto, luego escurrirlos y reservarlos con el arroz.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande o en un wok a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla durante 10 minutos o hasta que esté dorada. Agrega el ajo y el jengibre y sofríe un minuto más. Vierta las verduras escaldadas y fríalas durante 5 minutos, luego las gambas y fríalas durante 2 minutos más. Agrega el arroz a la sartén y luego empuja todo hacia un lado. Vierte los huevos batidos en el lado vacío de la sartén y revuelve para revolverlos. Doblar todo junto con las semillas de sésamo, la soja y el vinagre, luego terminar con las cebolletas esparcidas por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:58:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13560,7041,'es','Cócteles de gambas arcoíris','Sirva esta versión de inspiración asiática del clásico cóctel de gambas como entrante o canapés de fiesta durante el periodo festivo.','["7 cucharadas colmadas de mayonesa","1 lima, exprimida","3 cucharaditas de sriracha u otra salsa de chile","15 g de jengibre encurtido, finamente picado","3 lechugas Little Gem, con las hojas separadas","300 g de langostinos cocidos","3 cebolletas, ralladas","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo negro","un puñado de galletas de gambas trituradas","100 ml de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","1 zanahoria grande, pelada y cortada en juliana","½ pepino grande, pelado en tiras","6 rábanos, en rodajas finas"]','["Para los pepinillos, poner en una cacerola el vinagre, 50 ml de agua, el azúcar y 2 cucharaditas de sal marina y cocinar a fuego medio durante 5 minutos, revolviendo hasta que el azúcar y la sal se hayan disuelto. Dejar enfriar un poco. Ponga las verduras en un bol y vierta sobre el líquido del encurtido. Dejar en el frigorífico al menos 1 h.","Mezcle la mayonesa, el jugo de lima, la sriracha y el jengibre encurtido. Coloque las hojas de lechuga en seis tazones y luego cubra con las verduras encurtidas, las gambas y la salsa. Termine con cebolletas, semillas de sésamo y galletas de gambas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13561,7043,'es','Empanadillas bah-tzang taiwanesas','Pruebe estas tradicionales albóndigas taiwanesas: bah-tzang. Envueltos en aromáticas hojas de bambú, vienen con un delicioso relleno de cerdo, camarones y champiñones.','["500 gramos de arroz para sushi","150 g de cacahuetes piel roja enteros","20 hojas frescas de bambú, aproximadamente 50 g (ver consejo a continuación)","100 g de setas shiitake secas","20 g de camarones secos","150 g de paleta de cerdo magra, cortada en dados de 1 cm","150 g de panceta de cerdo grasa, cortada en dados de 1 cm","aceite vegetal, si es necesario","3 chalotes, en rodajas","4 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","40 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 cucharadas de chalotas fritas crujientes","50 g de yema de huevo de pato salada (opcional)","chile o rábano encurtido y salsa de soja dulce y salada, para servir"]','["El día anterior al que quieras servir, llena una cacerola grande con agua y deja que hierva. Añade los cacahuetes y cocina a fuego lento durante 25 minutos. Retire los cacahuetes, escúrralos y déjelos en remojo durante la noche en agua tibia y fresca. Enjuague el arroz en un colador con agua fría y déjelo en remojo durante la noche.","Para hacer el relleno, coloque los hongos shiitake secos y los camarones secos en dos tazones separados y cúbralos con agua hirviendo. Dejar actuar 15 minutos o hasta que esté completamente suave. Retire los champiñones del líquido con una espumadera y exprima el exceso de agua en el recipiente. Pica los champiñones en trozos grandes hasta que tengan un tamaño similar al de los camarones. Escurrir los camarones y reservar.","Cuece las hojas de bambú para que queden flexibles. Ponga a hervir agua en una cacerola grande, agregue las hojas y cocine a fuego alto durante 5 minutos. Apagar el fuego y mantener las hojas en el agua durante 20 minutos. El agua debe ponerse un poco marrón. Enjuague y escurra las hojas. Escurrir el arroz y el maní y mezclar en un tazón grande.","Mientras tanto, para el relleno, poner la carne de cerdo cortada en cubitos en una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Cocine a fuego lento durante hasta 1 hora o hasta que la carne esté tierna y se deshaga fácilmente. Escurrir y reservar. Calienta un wok grande a fuego medio-alto y agrega la carne de cerdo. Como una parte es bastante grasa, no hará falta añadir más aceite, pero si empieza a pegarse, añade un poco de aceite vegetal.","Una vez que la carne de cerdo esté dorada, agregue las chalotas en rodajas, los camarones y los champiñones. Agrega la salsa de soja y el azúcar. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos más hasta que la carne esté ligeramente caramelizada. Retirar el cerdo del fuego y añadir las chalotas crujientes. Usando un microplano o un rallador de caja, ralle la yema de huevo salada, si la usa, en la mezcla y mezcle. Estación.","Para envolver el bah-tzang, corte alrededor de 10 trozos de hilo de carnicero de unos 50 cm.","Coloque una hoja de bambú cocida encima de otra para darle el doble de espesor. Dobla las hojas por la mitad y usa tus manos para formar un cono puntiagudo. Sostén el cono en tu mano, con la punta hacia abajo, como un rollo de sushi o un cono de helado.","Empaque la mezcla de arroz y maní alrededor del exterior y la parte inferior del cono de hoja para formar una capa de arroz sobre toda la superficie. Continúe hasta que esté lleno en aproximadamente dos tercios. Vierta la mezcla de carne de cerdo, camarones y champiñones en el centro del arroz y apriételo bien. Agrega otra cucharada de arroz encima para cubrir completamente el relleno.","Para cerrar el bah-tzang, dobla el borde superior de las hojas de bambú sobre el arroz y mételo para sellar el espacio. Tire de las hojas con fuerza para que encierren el arroz y la carne de cerdo, metiendo los bordes sueltos. Utilice un trozo de cuerda para asegurar el paquete, envolviéndolo en la cuerda y dejando un trozo en la parte superior. Asegúrate de hacer los nudos lo más fuerte posible para que no se escape nada del relleno. Rellena las hojas de bambú restantes y átalas todas juntas.","Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua, bájela en el bah-tzang y cocine durante 45 minutos a 1 hora, luego retírela del agua, escúrrala y sirva inmediatamente. Desate el hilo y pele las hojas (no las coma) para revelar el arroz pegajoso y la carne tierna de cerdo. Sirva con chile o rábano encurtido y una salsa dulce y salada a base de soja. Hemos abierto nuestro bah-tzang para que puedas ver la sección transversal del interior, pero normalmente los servirías sin envolver."]','2026-01-11 12:58:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13562,7045,'es','Lubina al vapor','Pruebe esta lubina al vapor con fragantes ingredientes asiáticos como pieza central de un menú chino. Cocer al vapor garantiza que el pescado se mantenga húmedo y se desmenuce.','["30 g de jengibre, pelado y cortado en palitos (use un pelador en juliana si tiene uno)","1 lubina grande entera (unos 800 g), destripada y limpia (pídelo a tu pescadero), o 4 filetes de lubina","1 cucharada de salsa de soja ligera","1 cucharada de salsa de soja oscura","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de azúcar de palma","1 cebolla tierna, cortada en diagonal","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, recortado pero aún con la mayoría de los tallos","½ chile rojo, cortado finamente en diagonal"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Coloque la mitad del jengibre en la cavidad del pescado y luego colóquelo sobre papel de aluminio. Levante los lados del papel de aluminio alrededor del pescado para crear un recipiente de aluminio, luego agregue 1 cucharada de agua (esto cocinará el pescado al vapor), selle y cocine en el horno durante 15 a 20 minutos o en una vaporera de bambú grande hasta que el pescado se desmenuce.","Transfiera a una fuente para servir, dejando los jugos en el papel de aluminio. Calentar las salsas de soja, el aceite y el azúcar de palma en una cacerola con 1 cucharada de agua hasta que hierva y burbujee. Cubra el pescado con la cebolleta, la guindilla, la mayor parte del cilantro y el resto del jengibre. Vierta el líquido caliente sobre el pescado para \"cocinar\" los aromáticos encima. Esparza los tallos de cilantro sobrantes para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13563,7048,'es','Tortitas de caballa hoisin','¿Necesita una comida familiar rápida y casera? Prueba estas tortitas de caballa. Usar ingredientes dulces con pescados de sabor más fuerte, como la caballa, ayuda a tentar a los niños a probarlos.','["3 filetes de caballa, sin espinas, cortados en tiras del tamaño de un dedo","2 cucharadas de salsa hoisin, más un poco más para mojar","4 cebolletas","½ pepino","2 lechugas Little Gem","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","10 panqueques chinos (disponibles en Waitress, supermercados asiáticos o comida china para llevar)"]','["Marina la caballa en la salsa hoisin mientras preparas las verduras. Cortar las cebolletas y el pepino en palitos finos y separar las hojas de lechuga.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio. Añade la caballa y fríe durante 3-4 minutos hasta que esté pegajosa y caramelizada. Calienta los panqueques siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Sirve todo en el medio de la mesa y deja que cada uno se sirva solo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13564,7049,'es','Judías verdes con ajo salteadas','Estas judías verdes con ajo, fáciles y saludables, son un excelente acompañamiento para un festín chino y están hechas con solo 4 ingredientes en 15 minutos.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","Paquete de 200 g de judías verdes peladas","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de salsa de ostras o salsa de soja"]','["Calienta el aceite en un wok y luego sofríe las judías verdes durante 5 minutos hasta que empiecen a dorarse. Agregue el ajo y continúe cocinando hasta que se dore, luego agregue la salsa de ostras y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:58:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13565,7051,'es','Sopa picante de gambas y maíz dulce','El entrante cálido perfecto para las celebraciones del Año Nuevo Chino. Agregamos chile para calentar y usamos huevo en lugar de la tradicional harina de maíz.','["1½ l de caldo de pollo caliente","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo blanca","2 cucharadas de vinagre chino de arroz negro, de sidra o de vino blanco","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente cortado en palitos","½ chile rojo, en rodajas","½ paquete de tofu sedoso, cortado en cubitos","un puñado de maíz dulce congelado","150 g de gambas cocidas","2 huevos batidos con 1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","150 g de brotes de soja, enjuagados","cebolletas ralladas, para servir"]','["Poner el caldo en una cacerola a fuego lento, añadir el azúcar, el vinagre, el jengibre y la guindilla y dejar hervir a fuego lento. Agregue el tofu, el maíz dulce y los langostinos, cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos, luego vierta la mezcla de huevo en un chorro constante, revolviendo para formar hebras de huevo.","Apila algunos brotes de soja en cada tazón y sirve la sopa con un cucharón. Esparcir sobre las cebolletas y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13566,7053,'es','bocanadas de char sui','Hemos combinado rollos de salchicha con los sabores del cerdo char sui chino: ¡doblemente delicioso!','["225 g de harina común","125 g de mantequilla ligeramente salada, envuelta en papel de aluminio y fría","Paquete de 400 g de salchichas de cerdo","2 cucharaditas de polvo de cinco especias","2 cucharadas de salsa de ostras","2 cucharadas de salsa hoisin","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","un poco de harina, para espolvorear","1 huevo batido","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo blanco y negro"]','["Puedes hacer la masa hasta 2 días antes. Pesar la harina en un bol y añadir 1/2 cucharadita de sal. Sosteniendo la mantequilla por el papel de aluminio (para evitar que se caliente demasiado), rallarla directamente con la harina por el lado grueso del rallador. Sumerja el bloque de mantequilla en la harina de vez en cuando y mezcle la mantequilla rallada con la harina con un cuchillo para cubiertos para evitar que se apelmace en el bol. Cuando la mantequilla esté distribuida uniformemente por toda la harina, vierta 100 g de agua fría. Mezclar con el cuchillo hasta que se formen grumos. Inclínelo sobre la superficie de trabajo y amase brevemente para unir la masa; no trabaje demasiado o perderá las bolsas de mantequilla, que crearán las capas. Envolver en film transparente y enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forre dos bandejas para hornear con papel pergamino. Exprima la carne de la salchicha sin piel y póngala en un bol. Agrega las cinco especias, la salsa de ostras, el hoisin y el jengibre. Mezclar hasta que esté completamente combinado.","Enharina ligeramente tu superficie de trabajo. Extienda la masa hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de 50 peniques y luego utilice un cortador de galletas de 10 cm para hacer tantos círculos como pueda. Dobla los restos sobre sí mismos, pero no arrugues la masa o perderás las capas. Vuelve a enrollar y elimina algunos más si puedes; deberías hacer 18-20.","Con una cuchara, forme bolitas (del tamaño de tomates cherry) con la mezcla de salchicha y colóquelas en el medio de cada círculo de masa. Unte un poco de huevo batido sobre la masa, luego doble tres lados hacia adentro para cubrir parcialmente la salchicha y crear una forma de triángulo, juntando las esquinas. Unte más huevo sobre la masa y espolvoree con semillas de sésamo. Colocar en las bandejas y hornear por 25 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Déjelo enfriar en las bandejas, listo para empacar para un picnic, o sírvalo caliente. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta 2 días."]','2026-01-11 12:58:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13567,7055,'es','muffins ingleses','Sirva estos tradicionales muffins ingleses calientes, cortados por la mitad y untados con mantequilla, o tostados en un brunch con huevo escalfado y salsa holandesa.','["400 g de harina blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","5 g de levadura de acción rápida","250 ml de leche entera, tibia","sémola fina, para espolvorear"]','["Para hacer la masa combine la harina, el azúcar, la levadura y 1 cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande. Agrega poco a poco la leche, mezclando con las manos hasta que se una la masa. Amasar durante 8-10 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástico. Esto también se puede hacer en una batidora de mesa con gancho para masa.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y extiéndala hasta que tenga 1 cm de espesor. Recorta 8 círculos con un cortador de 7,5 cm y vuelve a enrollar la masa si es necesario. Colóquelos en bandejas para hornear espolvoreadas con sémola. Espolvoree la parte superior con más sémola, cúbrala sin apretar y déjela reposar en un lugar cálido durante aproximadamente 1 hora hasta que duplique su tamaño, o para obtener un mejor sabor, déjela reposar durante la noche en el refrigerador.","Para cocinar los muffins coloca una sartén o plancha de base pesada a fuego medio durante 6-7 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados. Haga esto en lotes. Si los muffins se doran demasiado rápido, baje el fuego y déjelos hasta que estén bien cocidos. Dejar enfriar un poco sobre una rejilla. Es mejor servirlo caliente. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días. Dejar enfriar primero."]','2026-01-11 12:58:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13568,7057,'es','Pescado y patatas fritas en freidora','Usa tu freidora para hacer este clásico británico. Elija pescado blanco como bacalao, eglefino o basa, y sírvalo con puré de guisantes y salsa tártara.','["60 g de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharadita de hierbas secas mixtas","2 filetes de pescado blanco, como bacalao, eglefino o basa","3 patatas medianas, como Desirée o Maris Piper","6-8 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","guisantes blandos y salsa tártara, para servir (opcional)"]','["Mezcle la harina de maíz, el pimentón y las hierbas mixtas con 1 cucharadita de sal y ¼ de cucharadita de pimienta negra recién molida y extiéndalos en un plato grande. Cubra los filetes de pescado con la mezcla de harina por ambos lados. Si prefieres cocinar en la encimera, consulta el consejo a continuación: los filetes de pescado ya están listos para freír.","Corta las patatas en trozos de 1 cm de grosor con un cuchillo grande y afilado. Déjales la piel o pélalos, si lo deseas.","Coloque las patatas fritas en un tazón grande, luego agregue 2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal y una buena pizca de sal y pimienta. Mezcle hasta que esté bien cubierto. Coloque la freidora a 200 ° C y cocine las patatas fritas durante unos 18-22 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad (o agite la cesta de la freidora) hasta que estén crujientes y cocidas. Alternativamente, puedes cocinarlos en el horno (ver el consejo a continuación). Manténgalo caliente mientras cocina el pescado o lo cocina en la segunda canasta de la freidora, si tiene una.","Extienda 4 cucharadas de aceite vegetal en un plato grande y drague el pescado rebozado en el aceite para cubrirlo. Configure la freidora a 200 ° C y cocine durante 8 a 10 minutos (dependiendo del tamaño de los filetes de pescado), dándoles la vuelta con cuidado hasta la mitad. Sirva con puré de guisantes y salsa tártara, si lo desea. Si congela el pescado con papas fritas, descongélelo completamente en el refrigerador y luego vuelva a calentarlo en el horno hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:58:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13569,7059,'es','reina de los budines','Prepare un delicioso pudín clásico británico, elaborado remojando pan rallado en leche caliente y agregando merengue y mermelada. Es el postre reconfortante perfecto.','["550ml de leche","25 g de mantequilla, más un extra para el plato","1 limón, rallado","100 g de pan rallado blanco fresco","240 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos, yemas y claras separadas","6-8 cucharadas de mermelada de frambuesa"]','["Calentar la leche en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento hasta que hierva a fuego lento, luego retirar del fuego y agregar la mantequilla, la ralladura de limón, el pan rallado y 40 g de azúcar en polvo. Déjelo en remojo durante 30 minutos hasta que las migas hayan absorbido el líquido y se hayan enfriado.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla un molde para hornear o para tarta mediano-grande (el nuestro medía 22 cm). Una vez que la mezcla de pan rallado se haya enfriado, agregue las yemas de huevo y vierta en la fuente para hornear. Hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que la mezcla se haya endurecido, similar a una natilla. Calentar la mermelada en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento para que se suelte y luego esparcirla por la base. Debe ser una capa fina, por lo que es posible que necesites menos mermelada si el plato es más profundo. Reducir la temperatura del horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 2.","Batir las claras de huevo a punto de nieve en un recipiente limpio usando una batidora eléctrica o una batidora de pie. Incorpora los 200 g restantes de azúcar en polvo, poco a poco, hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto y el merengue esté brillante y en posición vertical. Vierta o vierta el merengue sobre la capa de mermelada y hornee por otros 20-30 minutos hasta que el merengue esté dorado y cuajado. Es mejor servirlo caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:58:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13570,7061,'es','Bollos de ruibarbo y natillas','Estos deliciosos bollos presentan una de las combinaciones de sabores más queridas de Gran Bretaña: ruibarbo y natillas. Sirva con crema cuajada para disfrutar de un agradable té por la tarde en el jardín.','["300 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de natillas en polvo","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","50 g de azúcar en polvo","95 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en cubos","150-175 ml de leche entera","1 huevo batido","crema cuajada, para servir","250 g de ruibarbo, picado (o utilice ruibarbo congelado picado)","100 g de azúcar en polvo o granulada","1 limón, rallado","½ cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","gota de gel colorante alimentario rojo (opcional)"]','["Mezcle la harina, las natillas en polvo, ¼ de cucharadita de sal fina, el polvo para hornear y el azúcar en un tazón grande. Frote la mantequilla con los ingredientes secos con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino.","Incorpora poco a poco la leche con las manos hasta obtener una masa suave; es posible que no la necesites toda. Extienda suavemente la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta que tenga un grosor de 2 cm. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear, cubra y enfríe durante 30 minutos para que se endurezca, o hasta 1 hora si desea avanzar.","Mientras tanto, haz la compota de ruibarbo. Vierta todos los ingredientes en una salsa grande junto con 2 cucharadas de agua (omita el agua si está usando ruibarbo congelado). Cocine a fuego medio durante 10 a 15 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que el ruibarbo se ablande y casi se derrumbe, y la mezcla se haya espesado. Si está usando ruibarbo congelado, es posible que desee agregar una gota de colorante alimentario rojo para realzar el color rosado. Pasar la compota a un bol y dejar enfriar por completo.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y sacar la masa de la nevera. Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Saque tres o cuatro bollos de la masa con un cortador de galletas redondo de 7 cm (consulte el consejo a continuación). Coloca los bollos en la bandeja preparada, dejando un espacio de 2 cm entre cada uno.","Extienda la masa restante nuevamente como en el paso dos, luego saque tantos bollos como pueda (debe obtener alrededor de seis en total). Transfiera estos también a la bandeja, luego unte todos los bollos con el huevo batido (vea el consejo a continuación). Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que la parte superior esté dorada, luego déjela enfriar completamente en la bandeja. Sirva con la compota de ruibarbo y la nata cuajada. Es mejor consumirlos el día en que se preparan."]','2026-01-11 12:58:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13571,7063,'es','quiche de coronación','Una quiche profunda con una base de hojaldre crujiente y delicados sabores de espinacas, habas y estragón fresco. La masa incluye manteca de cerdo, pero puedes cambiarla por mantequilla para que sea vegetariana. Cómelo frío o caliente con una ensalada verde y patatas nuevas hervidas: ¡perfecto para un gran almuerzo de coronación!','["250 g de harina común y un poco para espolvorear","50 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubitos","50 g de manteca de cerdo (o usa mantequilla si lo prefieres)","4 cucharadas de leche, más un chorrito","O un bloque de 250 g de masa quebrada ya preparada","125ml de leche","175ml de nata doble","2 huevos medianos","1 cucharada de estragón fresco picado","100 g de queso cheddar rallado","180 g de espinacas cocidas, exprimidas y ligeramente picadas","60 g de habas o soja cocidas (si se desea, doble vaina las habas)"]','["Tamizar la harina en un bol con ½ cucharadita de sal. Agrega la mantequilla y la manteca de cerdo y frota la mezcla con las yemas de los dedos hasta obtener una textura arenosa parecida al pan rallado. Agrega la leche, poco a poco, y con un cuchillo comienza a formar la masa, usando las manos, asegurándote de que no tenga zonas secas y se sienta suave. Tapar y dejar reposar en el frigorífico durante 30-45 minutos.","Coloque un molde para tarta de fondo suelto de 20 cm o un aro de masa de 20 cm en una bandeja para hornear. Enharine ligeramente la superficie de trabajo y extienda la masa hasta formar un círculo un poco más grande que la parte superior del molde y de aproximadamente 5 mm de grosor. Levante con cuidado la masa dentro del molde y presione suavemente en las esquinas, teniendo cuidado de que no quede ningún agujero o la mezcla podría gotear. Tapar y dejar reposar 30 minutos más en el frigorífico. Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.","Forrar la funda de repostería con papel de horno. Para ello, corte un disco de papel de horno más grande que el molde, apriételo hasta formar una bola (esto la hace más flexible), luego desenvuélvalo y colóquelo en la funda de repostería. Debe quedar por encima de los lados. Rellénelo con frijoles para hornear o arroz crudo y hornee a ciegas durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté bien dorado y seco. Retire con cuidado el papel vegetal y las judías para hornear y vuelva a meterlas en el horno durante 5 minutos para que se seque la base. Reducir la temperatura del horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.","Batir la leche, la nata, los huevos y las hierbas con un poco de condimento. Esparce la mitad del queso rallado en la base horneada a ciegas, cubre con las espinacas y los frijoles picados y luego vierte sobre la mezcla líquida. Si es necesario, revuelva suavemente la mezcla para garantizar que el relleno se disperse uniformemente, pero tenga cuidado de no dañar la caja de masa. Espolvorea sobre el queso restante. Colóquelo en el horno y hornee durante 20-30 minutos hasta que cuaje y esté ligeramente dorado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13572,7065,'es','Pescado y patatas fritas clásicos','Evite la comida para llevar y dedique un poco de esfuerzo a perfeccionar el pescado y las patatas fritas en casa: será recompensado con un pescado crujiente y profundamente dorado y unas deliciosas patatas fritas.','["aproximadamente 1 litro de aceite de girasol, para freír","2 filetes gruesos y sin piel de merlán, maruca, abadejo, eglefino o bacalao (de unos 150 g cada uno)","2 patatas Maris Piper grandes","1 cucharadita de vinagre de malta, más un poco más para servir","75 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","25 g de harina de maíz","una pizca pequeña de cúrcuma molida","125 g de cerveza fría o agua con gas","4 pepinillos","1 cucharadita de alcaparras","1 chalota","un puñado de hojas de perejil picado","5 cucharadas de mayonesa"]','["Corta las patatas en chips y déjalas en remojo en agua fría durante 5 minutos, luego lávalas hasta que el agua salga clara. Vierta en una cacerola con agua fría con una pizca de sal y 1 cucharadita de vinagre. Deje hervir a fuego lento, luego baje el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido pero sin desmoronarse. Escurrir con cuidado, luego colocar en una bandeja en una sola capa y enfriar hasta que se necesite. Se puede preparar con un día de anticipación.","Para hacer la salsa tártara, pique los pepinillos, las alcaparras y las chalotas (píquelas finamente si prefiere una salsa suave), luego combine con el perejil, la mayonesa y una pizca de sal. Se mantendrá frío hasta por 24 horas.","Cuando estés listo para freír, prepara la masa. Vierta las harinas y la cúrcuma en un bol con una pizca de sal, vierta sobre la cerveza o el agua con gas y mezcle rápidamente hasta que todo tenga la consistencia de una crema doble; no bata demasiado, unos cuantos grumos están bien. Manténgase frío.","Vierta el aceite en una sartén ancha y profunda como un wok, o caliente una freidora a 180 ° C. Si utiliza una sartén o un wok, asegúrese de que no tenga más de dos tercios de su capacidad con aceite. Calienta el aceite hasta que brille y sumerge con cuidado las patatas fritas con una espumadera. Freír durante 8-10 minutos, revolviendo suavemente de vez en cuando hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Transfiera a papel de cocina para escurrir.","Pon un poco de harina en un plato, luego lleva el aceite que usaste para cocinar las patatas fritas a 185 ° C, si tienes un termómetro, o hasta que un chorrito de masa chisporrotee y esté crujiente en menos de un minuto. Trabajando rápidamente, espolvorea el pescado con harina y luego pásalo por la masa. Sostenga el filete sobre la masa para que el exceso gotee nuevamente en el tazón, luego bájelo con cuidado en el aceite. Fríe los filetes durante un minuto hasta que la masa comience a solidificarse, luego toma una cuchara y rocía los filetes con masa adicional para crear una capa aún más crujiente y tenue. Fríe el pescado durante unos 4 minutos, volteándolo una vez, hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Levantar sobre papel de cocina para que escurra un minuto y luego servir con las patatas fritas, la salsa tártara y abundante sal y vinagre."]','2026-01-11 12:58:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13573,5561,'es','Sopa de mariscos fácil','Prepare esta sopa cremosa de mariscos para uno usando las sobras que pueda tener en el refrigerador o el congelador. Adorne con perejil y sirva con pan crujiente.','["1 patata pequeña (unos 150 g), cortada en cubos de 2 cm","½ cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","1 chalota, pelada y finamente picada","1 diente de ajo rallado","1 cucharada de harina común","200ml de leche semidesnatada o entera","100 ml de caldo de verduras o pescado","80 g de gambas congeladas o pescado ahumado","75 g de maíz dulce o guisantes frescos o congelados (o use una mezcla)","1 limón pequeño, rallado y exprimido","½ cucharada de perejil de hoja plana picado, más un poco más para servir (opcional)","pan crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Vierta las patatas en una cacerola pequeña y cúbralas con agua fría con sal. Llevar a ebullición a fuego medio, luego reducir el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 5-6 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Escurrir y reservar.","Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana a fuego medio y cocina el apio y la chalota durante 3 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el ajo y sofríe por otros 30 segundos hasta que esté fragante.","Agregue la harina y cocine por 1 min. Reduce el fuego al mínimo y vierte lentamente la leche, batiendo hasta obtener una salsa espesa. Agregue el caldo y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos hasta que la salsa se espese un poco nuevamente.","Agregue el pescado, las verduras y las patatas cocidas y cocine a fuego lento durante 4-5 minutos hasta que las verduras se hayan descongelado (si están congeladas) y el pescado esté bien cocido. Cuando la mezcla esté cremosa y cubra el dorso de una cuchara, agregue la ralladura y el jugo de limón y hasta 50 ml de agua si la sopa está demasiado espesa. Sazone con pimienta negra, sal y perejil.","Vierta la sopa en un bol, cubra con más pimienta negra, más perejil y sirva con pan crujiente, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13574,3864,'es','Cena asada saludable','Cocine una versión saludable y baja en grasa de rosbif para dos, hecha con carne magra y jugosa y verduras asadas, además de salsa como acompañamiento','["285 g de patatas medianas, en rodajas gruesas","4 zanahorias pequeñas (160 g), cortadas por la mitad a lo largo","2 x 80 g de cebollas moradas, cortadas en cuartos","170 g de coles de Bruselas grandes (unas 8-10), recortadas","2½ cucharaditas de aceite de colza","2 cucharaditas de hojas de tomillo","2 cucharaditas de vinagre balsámico","1 diente de ajo grande, finamente rallado","2 pizcas de mostaza inglesa en polvo","170 g de filete magro y grueso","½ cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Llevar a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua y cocinar las patatas durante 5 minutos. Escurrir reservando el agua.","Mezcle las patatas, las zanahorias, las cebollas y los brotes con 2 cucharaditas de aceite para cubrirlos. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear antiadherente, espaciados. Espolvoree con 1 cucharadita de tomillo, muela sobre un poco de pimienta negra y luego ase durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcla 1 cucharadita de vinagre con el ajo, el resto del tomillo y el aceite, la mostaza y abundante pimienta negra. Frote esto sobre el bistec, póngalo en un plato poco profundo y reserve. Mezclar el resto del vinagre con el caldo y 125ml del agua reservada del paso 1, luego reservar. Después de 30 minutos, dé la vuelta a las verduras y ase durante 15 minutos más.","Mientras tanto, calienta una pequeña sartén antiadherente a fuego medio-alto. Saque el bistec de la marinada, sacuda el exceso y fríalo durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté cocido a su gusto. Retirar a una tabla y dejar reposar. Vierta la marinada sobrante en la sartén y burbujee hasta que espese un poco para hacer una salsa. Corta el bistec en rodajas y sírvelo con las verduras asadas y la salsa a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13575,3874,'es','mermelada de manzana','Prepare frascos de mermelada de manzana casera y regálelos a amigos y familiares. Es delicioso untado simplemente sobre una tostada o como relleno de tus pasteles y pasteles favoritos.','["1 kg de manzanas Bramley, peladas, sin corazón y picadas","250 g de azúcar en polvo","½ limón, exprimido","1 rama de canela"]','["Pon un plato pequeño en el congelador. Vierta la manzana picada y el azúcar en polvo en una salsa grande junto con 350 ml de agua y cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo para disolver el azúcar.","Cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo regularmente, durante 30 minutos hasta que las manzanas se derrumben.","Agregue el jugo de limón, agregue la ramita de canela y cocine a fuego lento durante otros 2-3 minutos hasta que la mezcla esté espesa y brillante.","Saca el plato pequeño del congelador y echa un poco de la mezcla sobre él. Déjelo por unos segundos; debe estar bastante firme. Si todavía está un poco líquido, vuelva a colocar la sartén del fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante otros 10-15 minutos. Vuelve a meter el plato en el congelador y prueba de nuevo, ya debería estar listo.","Divida entre frascos limpios y esterilizados y ciérrelos. Se conservará durante tres meses en un lugar fresco y seco. Una vez abierto, enfríe y use dentro de un mes."]','2026-01-11 12:58:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13576,6825,'es','Bollos de sultana fáciles','El horneado perfecto para el fin de semana: un lote de estos esponjosos bollos de sultana no durará mucho. Sirva con abundante mantequilla y mermelada para disfrutar de una merienda.','["500 g de harina con levadura, tamizada y un poco más para espolvorear","175 g de mantequilla blanda, cortada en trozos pequeños","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","150 g de pasas","2 huevos, ligeramente batidos","un chorrito de leche, más extra para el cepillado","crema cuajada y mermelada, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Forra una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Vierta la harina y la mantequilla en un tazón grande. Comience a frotar suavemente la mantequilla con la harina con las yemas de los dedos, dejando que caiga desde una altura corta por encima del tazón. Esto incorporará aire a los bollos, haciéndolos maravillosamente livianos. Continúe haciendo esto hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino.","Agrega una pizca de sal, el azúcar, las pasas, los huevos y suficiente leche para que la mezcla forme una masa suave. La cantidad de leche variará según el tamaño de los huevos, la suavidad de la mantequilla y la temperatura de la habitación. Tenga cuidado de no trabajar demasiado a los duros o se volverán duros.","Coloca la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Enharine generosamente un rodillo y extienda la masa hasta que tenga un grosor de 2 cm. Córtelos en cuadrados o triángulos con un cuchillo afilado, luego transfiera los bollos a la bandeja para hornear preparada, separándolos para dejar espacio para untar. Cepille la parte superior con un poco de leche y luego hornee por 10 minutos. Deje enfriar hasta que esté tibio, luego sirva con crema cuajada o mantequilla y mermelada, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13577,6345,'es','Tortitas de bacalao y estragón con guisantes a la menta','Estos pasteles de pescado de gran tamaño están llenos de pescado blanco rico en proteínas y se sirven encima de una sabrosa mezcla de guisantes con menta y puerros.','["aceite de colza, para la lata","900 g de patatas (nosotros utilizamos Maris Piper), peladas y cortadas en trozos medianos","2 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa en polvo","4 anchoas (10 g), finamente picadas","5 cebolletas, muy finamente picadas","2 cucharaditas de alcaparras (10 g)","1 ½ cucharada de estragón picado","2 paquetes de 280 g de lomo de bacalao sin piel y cortado en cubos","8 cucharaditas de harina integral","2 huevos","90 g de almendras molidas","320 g de guisantes congelados","320 g de puerros, partidos por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de menta finamente picada","4 cohetes","2 cucharaditas de jugo de limón","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y engrasar una bandeja para hornear antiadherente. Ponga a hervir agua en una cacerola y luego cocine las patatas durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrir bien, luego regresar a la sartén y triturar con la mostaza, las anchoas, las cebolletas, las alcaparras y el estragón hasta que se combinen. Revuelva el bacalao crudo.","Forme 8 pasteles, luego cúbralos ligeramente con harina, aproximadamente 1-2 cucharaditas cada uno. Batir los huevos en un recipiente poco profundo. Cubra los pasteles con huevo, luego espolvoree 1/2 cucharada de almendras sobre cada uno y colóquelos en la bandeja para hornear. Hornee durante 20 minutos, volteando cada uno a la mitad, hasta que comiencen a dorarse.","Mientras tanto, poner los guisantes y los puerros en una cacerola, sumergirlos en agua, tapar y hervir durante 10 minutos. Escurrir y revolver con la menta. Divida la mitad de la mezcla de guisantes y puerros en dos platos con 2 croquetas de pescado encima para cada uno. Mezcle la mitad de la rúcula con la mitad del jugo de limón y el aceite de oliva, luego apílela encima de las croquetas de pescado. Enfríe 4 croquetas de pescado y la mitad de la mezcla de guisantes y puerros, por separado, para comerlas otro día. Se mantendrán frías hasta por dos días. Vuelva a calentar las croquetas de pescado en una bandeja para hornear a 200 ° C/180 ° C con ventilador/gas 6 durante 15 a 20 minutos. Vuelva a calentar los guisantes y los puerros en el microondas. Aliñe la rúcula restante justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13578,4643,'es','Tortitas de salmón y boniato recubiertas de quinoa','Prepare unos pasteles de pescado de salmón fáciles y rápidos con una deliciosa capa de quinua. Perfecto servido con guisantes y verduras o ensalada','["750 g de batatas (unas 4 medianas)","65 g de quinoa (mezcla de roja y negra, si es posible)","1 cucharada de aceite, más un poco extra para cepillar","240 g de filetes de salmón sin piel y sin espinas","manojo pequeño de cebollino, picado","90g de berros","200 g de guisantes congelados, cocidos"]','["Lavar los boniatos, pincharlos unas cuantas veces con un tenedor y cocinarlos en el microondas durante unos 10 minutos (el tiempo varía según el tamaño). Alternativamente, hornee en el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 durante unos 45 minutos. Coloque la pulpa en un bol. Reserve las pieles para hacer patatas fritas, si lo desea (consulte el consejo a continuación).","Vierta la quinua en una cacerola y vierta sobre 150 ml de agua hirviendo, cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 15 minutos hasta que se absorba el agua. Escurrir bien, extender en un plato y reservar.","Rociamos un poco de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y luego sofreímos los filetes de salmón unos minutos por cada lado. Vierta en el bol con la batata y luego agregue las cebolletas. Mezclar bien para desmenuzar el pescado y sazonar al gusto.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forme con la mezcla ocho croquetas de pescado del mismo tamaño. Sumerja cada pastel de pescado en el plato de quinua y cúbralo completamente, presionando para que se pegue. Pincelar con un poco de aceite de oliva y colocar en una bandeja para horno forrada con papel de horno. Hornee durante unos 15-20 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Sirva con berros, guisantes y patatas fritas de camote, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13579,4056,'es','Pasteles galeses veganos','Haz una versión vegana de las tartas galesas, con todo el sabor de la receta tradicional pero sin lácteos. Espolvorea con azúcar para terminar y sirve tibio o frío.','["225 g de harina con levadura, más un poco más para espolvorear","¼ cucharadita de sal marina fina","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada rallada","100 g de mantequilla sin lácteos","50 g de azúcar en polvo y un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de grosellas","3-4 cucharadas de leche sin lácteos"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón grande y agregue la sal y la nuez moscada. Agregue la mantequilla y frótela con las yemas de los dedos para obtener una consistencia fina de pan rallado. Agregue el azúcar y las grosellas y agregue 3 cucharadas de leche hasta que se unan, agregue 1 cucharada más si la masa está un poco seca. Forme una bola, trate de no trabajar demasiado la masa ya que esto la endurecerá.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener un grosor de 5 mm y corte círculos con un cortador de 6 o 7 cm. Vuelva a enrollar los restos y corte más hasta que haya agotado toda la masa.","Coloque una sartén de hierro fundido o una sartén de base pesada a fuego medio para que se caliente mucho. Cocine durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado o hasta que estén ligeramente dorados; deberá bajar un poco el fuego si comienzan a prenderse. Agregue inmediatamente el azúcar y déjelo a un lado sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe durante 15 minutos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13580,7071,'es','Guisantes blandos fáciles','Disfrute de la comida reconfortante en su máxima expresión con guisantes blandos caseros. Su sutil sabor a menta y limón significa que son perfectos con pescado y patatas fritas.','["250 g de guisantes secos","2 cucharadas de polvo para hornear","25 g de mantequilla salada, en cubitos","¼ de manojo pequeño de menta, finamente picada","½ limón, exprimido"]','["Coloque los guisantes y el bicarbonato de sodio en un recipiente grande resistente al calor y cúbralos con agua hirviendo. Dejar en remojo durante 12 horas o toda la noche.","Escurre los guisantes y enjuágalos dos veces con agua fría para quitar el bicarbonato de sodio. Pon las judías en un cazo y cúbrelas con 650 ml de agua fría. Llevar a ebullición, reducir el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 30 minutos hasta que estén tiernos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Triture brevemente y agregue la mantequilla, la menta y el limón, sazonando al gusto."]','2026-01-11 12:58:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13581,7073,'es','huevos escoceses','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Utilice algunos trucos del chef para crear el bocadillo perfecto de salchicha y huevo con esta receta paso a paso.','["12 huevos grandes","800 g de salchichas Cumberland o Lincolnshire de buena calidad, sin piel","5 cucharadas de perejil rizado, finamente picado","2 cucharaditas de salsa inglesa","2 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa en polvo","2 cucharaditas de maza molida","12 lonchas de tocino ahumado","85 g de harina común","140-200 g/5-7 oz de pan rallado seco","aproximadamente 1 litro/1¾ pinta de aceite de girasol o vegetal, para freír","trozos de pan, para probar el aceite"]','["Pon 9 huevos en una cacerola grande. Cubrir con agua fría y llevar a ebullición. Una vez que hierva, configure el temporizador durante 5 minutos. Cuando hayan transcurrido 5 minutos, saque rápidamente los huevos con una espumadera y sumérjalos en un recipiente grande con agua fría.","Ponga la carne de la salchicha, el perejil, la salsa inglesa, la mostaza en polvo y la macis en un bol con abundante condimento. Rompe 1 de los huevos restantes y mezcla todo.","Rompe los 2 huevos restantes en un bol, bate con un tenedor y luego tamízalos en un plato. Vierta la harina en otro plato y sazone bien. Finalmente, vierte el pan rallado en un tercer plato.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua. Eche las lonchas de tocino, apague la sartén y saque el tocino con unas pinzas; debe estar recién cocido.","Cuando los huevos estén fríos, golpéelos ligeramente sobre una superficie dura para romper la cáscara y luego pélelos (Imagen A). Si sostienes los huevos sobre el recipiente con agua mientras los pelas, todos los trozos de cáscara se acumularán allí y podrás sumergirlos en el huevo para lavar los fragmentos. Envuelva una rebanada de tocino alrededor del centro de cada huevo, superponiéndola, como un cinturón (Imagen B).","Ahora termina de cubrir los huevos. Coloqué los ingredientes a lo largo de mi banco como una cinta transportadora: huevos, luego harina, carne picada, huevo batido y finalmente pan rallado, además de una bandeja forrada con papel para hornear al final para poner los huevos escoceses terminados.","Enrolle los huevos envueltos en tocino en la harina, sacudiendo el exceso. Tome un buen trozo de carne picada y déle palmaditas para cubrir finamente una mano. Coloque el huevo sobre la carne (Imagen C), luego moldee sobre la carne picada para cubrir, apretando y dando palmaditas para que tenga un espesor uniforme. Probablemente tendrás un espacio (dependiendo del tamaño de tus manos, simplemente parchea y acaricia con un poco más de carne picada). Sumérgelo en el huevo, sacudiendo el exceso, luego enrolla el pan rallado para cubrirlo y transfiérelo a tu bandeja. Repita para cubrir los 9 huevos, luego cubra con film transparente y enfríe durante 4 horas o toda la noche.","Para cocinar, vierte el aceite en una cacerola grande y profunda hasta unos 4 cm de profundidad. Calienta hasta que un pequeño trozo de pan se dore en aproximadamente 1 minuto. Sumerja con cuidado en un huevo escocés y fría durante unos 5 minutos, volteándolos suavemente, hasta que se dore uniformemente. Dependiendo de tu sartén, probablemente puedas hacer 2 o 3 a la vez, pero no abarrotes. Levante y coloque en una bandeja forrada con papel de cocina. (Si le gustan los huevos escoceses calientes, póngalos en el horno a temperatura baja mientras fríe el resto). Vigile el aceite: si los huevos escoceses comienzan a dorarse demasiado rápido, el aceite podría estar demasiado caliente y corre el riesgo de que la carne de cerdo no se cocine antes de que se dore el huevo escocés. Si el aceite se enfría demasiado, el huevo escocés puede cocinarse demasiado antes de dorarse. disfrutar caliente o frío; Es mejor consumirlo dentro de las 24 horas posteriores a la fritura."]','2026-01-11 12:58:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13582,7075,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: desayuno inglés completo','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). Angela Nilsen prepara una versión más saludable de una comida inglesa icónica, sin perder la nostalgia.','["4 lonchas de tocino magro sin ahumar de buena calidad","4 champiñones portabello de gorra marrón","12-16 tomates cherry en rama, temperatura ambiente","6 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 rebanadas de pan granero o integral, cortadas en diagonal","2 longanizas de cerdo campero de buena calidad, mínimo 86% carne de cerdo","2 huevos de gallinas camperas, ricos en omega-3, a temperatura ambiente","unas gotas de vinagre de sidra","2 vasos de 100 ml / 3½ fl oz de jugo de naranja recién exprimido, más 1 naranja cortada en gajos","un puñado de arándanos frescos (unos 50 g/2 oz)"]','["Coloque el tocino, los champiñones y los tomates en una bandeja forrada con papel de aluminio. Unte la parte superior de los champiñones con 3 cucharaditas de aceite y ambos lados del pan con el aceite restante. Dejar de lado. Calienta la parrilla a muy caliente. Coloque las salchichas en una bandeja pequeña forrada con papel de aluminio (es mejor no pinchar las salchichas de buena calidad o podrían perder humedad). Ase durante unos 10 minutos hasta que esté cocido, volteándolo ocasionalmente.","Mientras tanto, llene tres cuartas partes de una cacerola pequeña y de una cacerola ancha y profunda con agua. Llevar ambos a ebullición. Coloque un huevo en la sartén pequeña y retírelo después de 30 segundos. Rompe el huevo en una taza. Agregue vinagre a la cacerola más grande y luego, usando un batidor de varillas, agite el agua para crear un remolino. Retire el batidor e incline lentamente el huevo hacia el centro de la bañera de hidromasaje (vea la imagen superior). Cuando el agua vuelva a hervir, retira la cacerola del fuego, tapa y deja reposar 3 minutos, luego retira el huevo. Colóquelo en un recipiente con agua tibia mientras cocina el otro huevo, o cocine ambos huevos con una hora de anticipación, déjelos en un recipiente con agua helada y luego vuelva a calentar durante 1½ minutos en agua hirviendo a fuego lento antes de servir.","Mientras tanto, calienta una sartén a fuego muy caliente. Coloque los tomates, el tocino y los champiñones debajo de la parrilla durante 3-4 minutos sin darles vuelta. Al mismo tiempo, coloque el pan en la plancha y cocine hasta que esté crujiente, aproximadamente 1 minuto por cada lado. Escurrir todo sobre papel de cocina.","Retirar los huevos con una espumadera y escurrirlos brevemente sobre un paño. Disponer todo en un plato y servir con el jugo y la fruta."]','2026-01-11 12:58:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13583,6073,'es','Mini empanadas de cerdo con piccalilli','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Hoel Levieil, del restaurante londinense Frizzante, comparte esta receta de pastel de cerdo apta para picnic, que fue votada como la idea de receta de Jubileo favorita de nuestros usuarios.','["unos puntos de mantequilla","600 g de masa quebrada, comprada o casera","un poco de harina, para espolvorear","85 g de pan rallado blanco seco","400 g de buenas salchichas Cumberland (unas 6)","200 g de tocino ahumado","¼ de cucharadita de macis molida, pimienta molida y salvia seca","1 huevo batido con un tenedor","unas pizcas de semillas de sésamo","piccalilli, casero o comprado, para servir"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forre cada orificio de un molde para muffins de 12 orificios con una tira fina de papel para hornear en el medio que sea lo suficientemente larga como para que los extremos sobresalgan uno o dos centímetros; use un poco de mantequilla para pegarlos en su lugar. Extiende dos tercios de la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y corta círculos de 12 x 10 cm (es posible que tengas que volver a enrollar los recortes). Presione un círculo en cada agujero para alinear.","Espolvorea 1 cucharadita de pan rallado en la base de cada pastel. Vierta el resto de las migas en un tazón para mezclar. Exprima la carne de la salchicha, desechando la piel, junto con el tocino, la macis, la pimienta, la salvia y un poco de sal. Mete las manos y tritura y aplasta todo hasta que el pan rallado casi haya desaparecido. Divida la mezcla entre los agujeros, apretándola firmemente y dándole forma de cúpula en el medio.","Extienda el resto de la masa y haga círculos de 12 x 7 cm. Pincele con un poco de huevo y agregue una parte superior a cada pastel, con el lado del huevo hacia abajo para que se pegue, presionando con cuidado los bordes de la masa para sellar. Pincelar con más huevo (no tirar los sobrantes) y espolvorear con semillas de sésamo. Hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que estén dorados y luego retire con cuidado los pasteles del molde, usando los extremos de pergamino para ayudarlo a sacarlos. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino, cepille todos los lados con más huevo y vuelva a meterlo en el horno durante 8 minutos. Deje enfriar completamente y luego cómelo con piccalilli o su pepinillo favorito."]','2026-01-11 12:58:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13584,7079,'es','Estofado de Lancashire más ligero','Esta sencilla olla de cordero toma la comida reconfortante clásica y la hace más saludable, sin comprometer el sabor.','["650 g de paleta de cordero deshuesada y sin exceso de grasa","4 cucharaditas de harina común","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cebollas medianas, cortadas por la mitad a lo largo y en rodajas finas","3 zanahorias (350 g de peso total), cortadas por la mitad a lo largo y en trozos pequeños","225 g de colinabo, cortado en trozos pequeños","3 ramitas de tomillo y hojas adicionales para decorar","2 hojas de laurel","200 ml de caldo de pollo, elaborado con ½ pastilla de caldo de pollo","1½ cucharadita de salsa inglesa","750 g de patatas, como Maris Piper o Desirée, cortadas en rodajas muy finas"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Cortar el cordero en trozos grandes de 5-6 cm. Vierta la harina en un plato grande, sazone con pimienta y un poco de sal y mezcle el cordero con la harina para cubrirlo uniformemente y por completo. Dejar de lado.","Calienta 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén grande y profunda para freír o saltear. Ponga las cebollas, las zanahorias, el nabo, las ramitas de tomillo y las hojas de laurel en la sartén y sazone con pimienta. Cocine a fuego medio-alto durante 6-8 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente para que no se pegue, hasta que las verduras comiencen a dorarse en los bordes; el fondo de la sartén debe estar ligeramente dorado y caramelizado también. Vierta el caldo; debe chisporrotear y luego burbujear en la sartén. Retiramos inmediatamente la cacerola del fuego para que el caldo no reduzca su volumen. Agrega la salsa inglesa.","Superponga una sola capa de rodajas de patata en el fondo de una cacerola de 2 litros (aproximadamente 20 cm de diámetro x 10 cm de profundidad). Coloque la mitad del cordero sobre las patatas y luego vierta la mitad de la mezcla de verduras sobre la carne. Sazone con pimienta. Coloque el resto del cordero encima y luego vierta el resto de las verduras, las hierbas y todo el líquido sobre el cordero. Presione hacia abajo con el dorso de una cuchara, si es necesario, para dejar espacio para las patatas restantes. Comience a colocar las rodajas de papa en 3 capas muy superpuestas, sazone cada capa con pimienta y unte con aceite a medida que avanza; guarde un poco de aceite para la capa superior. Cubra el plato con una tapa hermética y hornee por 10 minutos.","Reducir el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Cocinar 2 horas más hasta que el cordero esté muy tierno y las patatas cocidas. Quita la tapa y colócala debajo de la parrilla durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que las patatas estén doradas y crujientes en los bordes. Retirar y dejar reposar la olla durante 5 a 10 minutos, luego servir espolvoreada con hojas de tomillo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13585,7081,'es','Pastel de San Clemente','Una versión muy británica del pastel de lima: una tarta cremosa y deliciosa con naranjas y limones picantes','["250 g de galletas digestivas ligeras","100 g de copos de maíz","85 g de mantequilla, derretida","140 g de azúcar en polvo","1 huevo grande, más 4 yemas de huevo grandes","Lata de 397g de leche condensada light","ralladura y jugo de 3 limones","ralladura y jugo de 2 naranjas","Bote de 150ml de nata doble extra espesa","100 g de yogur griego 0% grasa","4 cucharadas de azúcar glas","más ralladura de limón y naranja, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Siéntate\r\nuna lata redonda y estriada de fondo suelto de 20 cm\r\n(unos 5 cm de profundidad, o un poco menos profundo\r\nMolde de 22 cm) en una bandeja para horno. romper el\r\ngalletas en un tazón grande o en una bolsa doble\r\nen bolsas de comida y golpéalas a lo grande.\r\nmigajas con la punta de un rodillo o\r\ncacerola pequeña. Añade los copos de maíz y\r\nGolpee un poco más hasta obtener migajas. Mezclar con el\r\nmantequilla derretida y azúcar y presionar\r\nla base y los lados de la lata. Hornear para\r\n15 minutos, luego retirar y reducir el horno.\r\ntemperatura a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.","Batir el huevo y las yemas en un bol grande hasta\r\npálido y espumoso. Batir el condensado\r\nleche, seguida de las ralladuras y los jugos.\r\nVierta en el molde y hornee por 20 minutos.\r\nDeje enfriar en la lata y luego enfríe durante al menos\r\n5 horas o toda la noche.","Montar la nata, el yogur y el azúcar glas.\r\njuntos. Colocar sobre el pastel y esparcir.\r\ncon entusiasmo para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13586,7083,'es','Cordero asado con migas de hierbas tiernas','Este plato rico en hierro es ideal para un fin de semana con familiares y amigos','["100 g de pan blanco de buena calidad","2 dientes de ajo","ralladura de 1 limón","1 cucharadita de hoja de tomillo, picada","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","3-4 filetes de anchoa, picados (opcional)","5 zanahorias, cortadas en trozos","2 cebollas, cortadas en trozos","4 hojas de laurel","manojo pequeño de romero","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","pierna de cordero grande, alrededor de 3 kg/6 lb 8 oz","3 dientes de ajo, en rodajas gruesas, más un bulbo entero, cortado por la mitad","5 cucharadas de harina común","200ml de vino blanco, más un chorrito","600 ml de caldo de cordero"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nPara el cordero, esparcir las verduras, el laurel\r\nhojas y unas ramitas de romero en un\r\nfuente para asar grande y rociar con el\r\naceite de oliva. Utilice un cuchillo afilado para hacer poco\r\ncortes por todo el cordero. Picar una rebanada de\r\najo y una ramita pequeña de romero\r\ncada uno. Coloca el cordero encima de las verduras.\r\nen la fuente para asar, añadir un chorrito de vino,\r\nluego cocine por 2 horas si le gusta rosado, o\r\n2 horas 15 minutos para que esté bien cocido. Quitar\r\ndel horno, transferir a una tabla y\r\ncubra con papel de aluminio, luego deje reposar durante 45 minutos a 1 hora.","Para hacer la salsa, vierta la mayor parte del\r\ngrasa de la lata pero deje las verduras y cualquier\r\njugos de carne. Coloca la lata al fuego para\r\ncaramelizar las verduras y luego agregar la harina\r\ny cocinar hasta obtener una pasta. Agregue gradualmente el\r\nvino, cocine por un minuto, luego agregue el\r\ncaldo y cocine a fuego lento hasta que tenga\r\nuna salsa sabrosa. Empuje la salsa a través de un\r\ncolar en una cacerola pequeña y mantener caliente.","Encienda el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nPara las migas, mezcle todo lo que hay en una comida.\r\nprocesador y esparcir sobre una bandeja. hornear\r\nen el horno durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté crujiente,\r\nluego vuelve a atacar o rompe con los dedos\r\na migajas de nuevo. Estos se pueden hacer en\r\navance y se guarda en un recipiente hermético\r\ndurante 2 días. Servir el cordero troceado\r\nrodajas, espolvoreadas con migas y una jarra\r\nde salsa al lado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13587,7085,'es','Rosbif con salsa de cebolla caramelizada','La parte superior del asado poco hecho es la pieza central definitiva: hazlo aún más especial con Marmite y salsa de cebolla dulce','["1 cucharada de pimienta negra","1 cucharada de mostaza inglesa en polvo","1 cucharada de tomillo seco","1 cucharadita de semillas de apio","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","aproximadamente 2 kg/4 lb 8 oz de trozo de carne de res","4 cucharadas de harina común","2 cubitos de caldo de res","3 cucharadas de chutney o mermelada de cebolla caramelizada","2-3 cucharaditas de marmita"]','["Triturar los granos de pimienta, la mostaza.\r\npolvo, tomillo y semillas de apio juntos\r\ncon un poco de sal, utilizando un mortero.\r\nAgrega el aceite y luego frótalo por toda la carne.\r\n(Si tienes tiempo, tapa y enfría el porro\r\ndurante la noche para marinar. Saca la carne\r\ndel refrigerador 1 hora antes de asar).","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5\r\ny coloque el porro en una fuente para asar ajustada.\r\nAse durante 12 minutos por 450 g/1 libra (aproximadamente\r\n55 minutos para un porro de 2 kg/4 lb 8 oz) para\r\nmedio cocido, o 15 minutos por 450 g/1 libra\r\n(aproximadamente 1 hora y 10 minutos) a fuego medio.","Retirar del horno, levantar sobre una\r\nfuente, cubrir con papel aluminio y dejar reposar durante 30\r\nminutos. Si estás haciendo los Yorkies (p90),\r\naumentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.","Para la salsa, vierta el jugo de\r\nla fuente para asar en una jarra. deja que los jugos\r\nSepare, luego vierta 2 cucharadas de grasa.\r\nDe nuevo en la lata; si no hay grasa, use\r\n2 cucharadas de mantequilla en su lugar. Descartar cualquier otro\r\ngordo. Coloque la fuente para asar sobre la placa y revuelva.\r\nen la harina, los cubitos de caldo, el chutney de cebolla o\r\nmermelada y marmita. Cocine por 1 min,\r\nrevolviendo bien para raspar los trozos de carne\r\npegado a la lata, luego agregue gradualmente\r\n750ml de agua caliente de la tetera. burbuja\r\npara espesar hasta obtener una consistencia agradable, luego\r\nmanténgalo caliente suavemente hasta que esté listo para servir\r\ncon la carne cortada en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13588,7087,'es','Budín de carne, cerveza y chirivía','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Un pastel tradicional de bistec y cerveza con masa de sebo. Prepare el relleno la noche anterior y luego cocine el pudín al vapor a la mañana siguiente para disfrutar de un delicioso almuerzo dominical.','["1 cebolla grande, picada","100 g de tocino ahumado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","500 g de ternera magra para guisar, en cubos","2 cucharadas de harina común","3 chirivías, en cubos","500 ml de cerveza marrón","300 ml de caldo de carne","2 cucharadas de gelatina de arándano o grosella","4 ramitas de tomillo","verduras, para servir (opcional)","mantequilla, para engrasar","300 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa en polvo","140 g de sebo rallado"]','["Calienta una sartén grande y cocina la cebolla.\r\ny manteca juntos durante 5 minutos hasta\r\ndorado. Sacar con una espumadera\r\ny dejar a un lado. Agrega el aceite a la sartén,\r\nespolvorear la carne con harina y luego uniformemente\r\ndorar a fuego alto.","Añade las chirivías, la cerveza, el caldo, la gelatina,\r\nmezcla de tomillo y manteca de cerdo a la sartén.\r\nLlevar a ebullición, luego tapar y cocinar a fuego lento.\r\ndurante 1½ horas hasta que la carne esté tierna.","Untar con mantequilla generosamente un pudín de 1,5 litros\r\ncuenca. Para hacer la masa, mezcle\r\nla harina, la mostaza en polvo, el sebo y\r\n½ cucharadita de sal de mesa. Agregue suficiente agua fría,\r\nunos 150ml, para hacer una masa suave.\r\nRetire una cuarta parte de la masa y cubra\r\na un lado. Sobre una superficie muy enharinada,\r\nextender la masa restante para hacer una\r\nredondo grande, lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir el lavabo.","Coloque con cuidado la masa en el recipiente.\r\n(Trata de que sobresalga 1 cm de masa).\r\nel borde), luego presione los bordes de la unión\r\njuntos para sellar. Extienda el resto\r\nun cuarto en un círculo lo suficientemente grande como para\r\ncubrir la parte superior.","Vierta el líquido de cocción del\r\nllenar en una cacerola pequeña y reservar.\r\nDeseche los tallos de tomillo. Cuchara el\r\nllenar en el recipiente forrado y verter\r\n100ml del líquido de cocción. Doblar el\r\nmasa que sobresalga y untar con agua.\r\nColoque la tapa encima, presionando firmemente\r\nalrededor de los bordes para sellar.","Unte con mantequilla una hoja de papel para hornear,\r\ndoblar en un pliegue grande y colocar, con el lado de la mantequilla\r\nabajo, encima del pudín. Cubrir con\r\nuna capa plisada de papel de aluminio y finalmente atar con\r\ncuerda, haciendo un lazo para el mango de modo que\r\nPuedes levantar el pudín fácilmente.","Coloque un salvamanteles pequeño o un cortador de galletas grande\r\nen el fondo de una cacerola honda que esté\r\nLo suficientemente grande como para llevar el lavabo fácilmente.\r\nLlene la cacerola hasta la mitad con agua y lleve a\r\nel hervor. Sumerja el pudín, cubra y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 2 horas, completando con agua hirviendo\r\nagua cuando sea necesario.","Recalentar el líquido de cocción, burbujeándolo.\r\nbaje un poco para que se reduzca a una sabrosa\r\nsalsa. Saque con cuidado el pudín. correr\r\nun cuchillo alrededor del borde, luego voltearlo y\r\nsirva con salsa y verduras, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13589,7089,'es','Pasteles de pastor con chirivías especiadas','Para el pastel de pastor, pero no como lo conoces, intenta cocinar estos pasteles individuales picantes.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","pequeña nuez de jengibre, pelada y molida","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo mediano","500 g de carne picada de ternera o cordero","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","100 g de guisantes congelados","600 g de chirivías, peladas y picadas en trozos grandes","papa grande, pelada y cortada en trozos grandes","1 chile verde, sin semillas y picado","cilantro en manojo grande, picado","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma","jugo de 1 limón","50 g de mantequilla"]','["Para la salsa, calienta el aceite en una sartén y agrega la cebolla. Cocine hasta que esté suave, agregue el ajo, el jengibre y el curry en polvo, luego cocine hasta que esté aromático. Suba el fuego, agregue la carne picada, fría hasta que se dore, luego agregue los tomates y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que espese. Unos minutos antes del final, añade los guisantes.","Mientras tanto, vierta las chirivías y las patatas en una cacerola con agua fría, déjelas hervir y luego cocine durante 10 minutos. Escurrir, sazonar y triturar con el resto de los ingredientes.","Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 8. Armar las tartas en platos individuales (o uno grande) colocando un poco de salsa de carne.\r\nen el fondo y cubriendo con puré. Levante la parte superior con un tenedor y hornee durante 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante."]','2026-01-11 12:58:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13590,7091,'es','Carne Wellington','Actualice el centro de mesa de una cena de celebración usando prosciutto en lugar de panqueques para cubrir el relleno de carne y champiñones porcini.','["1 kg de filete de ternera: pídale a su carnicero que lo corte por la mitad del filete y dígale que no quiere la cola ni la cabeza (chateaubriand) del filete.","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más extra para engrasar","5 - 6 lonchas finas de prosciutto","harina común, para espolvorear","Paquete de 500 g de hojaldre con mantequilla","1 huevo batido","20 g de champiñones porcini secos","400 g de castañas o champiñones, cortados en rodajas grandes","1 cucharada de hoja de tomillo fresco","50 g de mantequilla","1 chalota grande, finamente picada","chorrito de salsa inglesa","2 cucharadas de parmesano recién rallado","25 g de mantequilla","1 chalota, finamente picada","ramita de tomillo","1 hoja de laurel","1 cucharada de harina común","chorrito de brandy (opcional)","copa de vino tinto","1 cubito de caldo de res"]','["Primero, remoje los boletus secos en 400 ml de agua caliente y reserve. Golpee el filete de res con papel de cocina para secarlo de la sangre, luego sazone con sal y luego con pimienta negra. Caliente el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande hasta que esté muy caliente, luego dedique de 8 a 10 minutos a dorar y girar el filete con unas pinzas hasta que esté bien dorado por todos lados. Sosténgalo hacia arriba para dorar ambos extremos también. Deje la carne a un lado en una bandeja para recoger los jugos y apague el fuego de la sartén, pero no la limpie.","Escurrir y exprimir los porcini secos, pero reservar el jugo y verter los porcini en un procesador de alimentos con los otros champiñones y el tomillo. Sazone todo con sal y pimienta y presione hasta que esté finamente picado pero no completamente suave. Vuelva a colocar la sartén para carne al fuego con la mantequilla y cuando empiece a chisporrotear agregue la chalota y cocine durante 2 minutos hasta que se ablande. Sube el fuego y vierte los champiñones, agrega un chorrito de salsa inglesa y cocina todo durante 10-12 minutos hasta que tengas una pasta que se desprenda de los lados de la sartén. Vierta en un tazón para que se enfríe, agregue el parmesano si lo usa y reserve. Apague el fuego de la sartén pero no la limpie.  La carne se puede dorar y la mezcla de champiñones se puede preparar con varias horas de anticipación.","Para la primera etapa del ensamblaje, tome una hoja grande de film transparente y superponga las rodajas de prosciutto en una fila, coloque la mezcla de champiñones encima y luego cubra con otra hoja de film transparente. Ya sea con las manos o con un rodillo, golpéelo o extiéndalo hasta obtener una capa fina que cubra apenas el prosciutto. Retire la hoja superior de film transparente y coloque el filete en el centro de los champiñones. Usando el borde del film transparente, levante y enrolle el prosciutto y los champiñones para cubrir la carne, luego use el film transparente para enrollar todo hasta formar una salchicha apretada. Para obtener mejores resultados, ahora coloque la salchicha en el congelador durante 30 minutos para que se endurezca; no la deje por más tiempo, ya que los tiempos de cocción se verán afectados.","Sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, enrolle la masa hasta formar un rectángulo un poco más grande que una revista, recorte los bordes para que quede limpio y guarde los recortes. Pincelar ligeramente toda la masa con huevo batido. Desenvuelva con cuidado el paquete de prosciutto y colóquelo en el medio de la masa. Como envolver un paquete o hacer un rollito de primavera, doble los bordes más cortos sobre el filete y luego enrolle todo alrededor del filete para encerrarlo. Para un acabado realmente limpio, consiga otra hoja limpia de film transparente y vuelva a enrollar la Wellington hasta formar una salchicha apretada. Colóquelo en el refrigerador y déjelo enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos o hasta un día.","Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 con una bandeja para hornear resistente y ligeramente engrasada. Vuelva a enrollar los recortes de masa y úselos para hacer 6 hojas. Desenvolver el Wellington, pincelarlo todo con huevo y decorar con las hojas. Pincelar las hojas con más huevo. Espolvoree con sal marina en escamas y transfiera, con el lado sellado hacia abajo, a la bandeja para hornear caliente. Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego reduzca el fuego del horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y continúe horneando durante 25 minutos para la carne poco cocida, 30 minutos para la carne poco cocida, 35 minutos para la carne medio cocida y unos 45 minutos para la carne bien cocida, asegurándose de que la masa no se queme (puede cubrirla con papel de aluminio si empieza a oscurecerse demasiado. Retirar del horno y dejar reposar durante 10 minutos.","Para hacer la salsa, calentar la mantequilla en la sartén para champiñones y sofreír la chalota, el tomillo y el laurel, raspando los trozos crujientes de la sartén con una cuchara de madera. Esparcir sobre la harina y dorar, luego agregar el brandy, chisporrotear durante un minuto, luego agregar el vino tinto y hervir hasta obtener una pasta de color púrpura. Vierta el líquido de remojo de los champiñones, evitando los trozos arenosos del fondo, desmenuce en el cubo de caldo y el jugo de la carne restante y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta obtener una salsa sabrosa, sazone al gusto.","Con un cuchillo muy afilado, corte con cuidado el Wellington en 6 rodajas gruesas. Puedes recortar los extremos de la masa y servirlos por separado. Sirva en platos calientes con una jarra de salsa."]','2026-01-11 12:58:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13591,7093,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: pastel de carne y riñones','El plato reconfortante definitivo recibe un cambio de imagen súper saludable','["200 g de riñones de cordero cortados por la mitad","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cebollas medianas, picadas","2 hojas de laurel","4 ramitas de tomillo","600 g de filetes magros para guisar, cortados en trozos","100 ml de vino tinto","2 cucharaditas de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de mostaza inglesa en polvo","2 cucharadas de harina común","1 zanahoria grande, picada","4 champiñones planos, cortados en cuartos o por la mitad si son pequeños","3 cucharadas de perejil picado","140 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de hojas de tomillo (opcional)","25 g de mantequilla muy fría (o congelada)","4 cucharadas de yogur griego con 2% de grasa","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Recorte y deseche los tubos delgados de\r\nlos riñones. Enjuague los riñones en frío.\r\nagua hasta que el agua salga clara, luego\r\npicarlos en trozos pequeños. Calentar el\r\naceite en una cacerola grande o saltear\r\nsartén. Agrega la cebolla, el laurel y el tomillo.\r\nramitas y sofreír a fuego medio durante\r\n8-10 minutos hasta que las cebollas estén realmente\r\ndorado, revolviendo con frecuencia. Pon la tetera a hervir.","Agrega el bistec y el riñón a la sartén.\r\ny sofreír brevemente, hasta que pierda su\r\ncolor rosa. Subir el fuego, verter el\r\nvino, revuelva para desglasar el fondo del\r\ncacerola, luego déjela hervir a fuego alto durante\r\n2-3 minutos hasta que se reduzca y se absorba en\r\nla carne. Agregue el puré de tomate y\r\nmostaza en polvo. Tamizar la harina, revolviendo,\r\nluego revuelva durante un par de minutos. Vierta\r\n400ml de agua hirviendo y seguir revolviendo\r\nhasta que la mezcla empiece a hervir y esté\r\nengrosado. Vierta la zanahoria y ambos.\r\nchampiñones, reducir el fuego, cubrir con\r\ntapar y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante\r\naproximadamente 1 hora, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Quitar\r\nla tapa y cocine a fuego lento otros 25-30 minutos\r\no hasta que la carne esté muy tierna y el\r\nla salsa se ha espesado un poco.","Retirar del fuego y retirar el\r\nhojas de laurel y ramitas de tomillo. Agregue el\r\nperejil, sazone al gusto y luego transfiera\r\na una tarta o fuente refractaria (22-23 cm de\r\ndiámetro, 6 cm de profundidad, 1,7 litros de capacidad\r\no similar), luego dejar enfriar un poco.\r\nCalentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Mientras la carne se enfría, prepare la\r\npastelería. Poner la harina, y tomillo si se usa,\r\nen un bol. Rallar en frío o congelado\r\nmantequilla, hacer un hueco en el centro y luego\r\nañade el yogur, el aceite de oliva, una pizca de sal\r\ny una buena molienda de pimienta negra.\r\nCon un cuchillo de hoja redonda, mezcle\r\ncon 2 cucharaditas de agua fría, luego junte suavemente\r\njunto con tus manos para formar un\r\nmasa. Retirar del bol y amasar\r\nbrevemente hasta que quede suave.","Extender la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.\r\nsuperficie por lo que es un poco más grande que la parte superior\r\ndel molde para pastel. Coloque la masa sobre\r\ncarne y recortar los bordes con unas tijeras para\r\nsobresale ligeramente del borde del plato.\r\nHaz 2 pequeños cortes en el centro. flauta la\r\nbordes, luego extienda los adornos y\r\nRecorta 6 hojas en forma de diamante. humedecer\r\nun lado y colóquelos sobre la tapa de masa.\r\nColoque el plato en una bandeja para hornear, luego\r\nhornee en el horno durante unos 25 minutos o\r\nhasta que la masa esté dorada."]','2026-01-11 12:58:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13592,7095,'es','Pollo asado y salsa gravy bañados en mantequilla con limón y tomillo','Suavizar la mantequilla debajo de la piel del ave ayuda a rociar el pollo y las hierbas le dan un sabor delicioso a la salsa.','["50 g de mantequilla, ablandada","manojo de tomillo fresco o tomillo limón, hojas recogidas, tallos reservados, más algo extra para servir","4 dientes de ajo, 1 machacado y los otros 3 enteros pero aplastados","2 limones, partidos por la mitad","1 pollo, aproximadamente 1½ kg","2 zanahorias, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cebolla, picada en trozos grandes","2 hojas de laurel","1 cucharada de harina común","250 ml de caldo de pollo","chorrito de salsa de soja (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEn un tazón pequeño, triture la mantequilla con\r\nun tercio de las hojas de tomillo, el\r\najo machacado y el jugo de medio\r\nlimón. Mezclar todo junto con\r\nun poco de condimento y reservar.","Usa tu mano para soltar el pollo.\r\npiel lejos del seno, luego empuje\r\nla mayor parte de la mantequilla se mezcla en el espacio.\r\nFrote el resto de la mantequilla por toda la\r\nfuera del pollo, luego rellene el\r\ncavidad con las mitades de limón restantes\r\nhojas y tallos de tomillo y el ajo.","Esparcir la zanahoria picada, la cebolla\r\ny hojas de laurel sobre la base de un pequeño\r\nlata para asar. Coloca el pollo encima\r\ncon la pechuga hacia arriba y asar por la mitad\r\nestante durante 1 h 30 min, rociando con el\r\njugos mantecosos después de unos 40 minutos. cuando\r\nel pollo está dorado oscuro y con la piel crujiente\r\ny el jugo sale claro, retirar del\r\nHorno y dejar en el molde 5 min. uso\r\nun par de pinzas para sacar los limones, el ajo\r\ny tomillo fuera de la cavidad y dentro del\r\nestaño. Levante el pollo, dejando que el jugo\r\ngotear en la lata y transferir el\r\npollo a una fuente para servir para que repose\r\nal menos otros 15 minutos.","Para hacer la salsa, exprime el jugo.\r\nde las mitades de limón cocidas y\r\ndesechar las pieles. Coloque la lata a fuego lento.\r\ncalentar, agregar la harina y chisporrotear hasta que esté suave\r\nmarrón. Vierta poco a poco el caldo y\r\ncocine por unos minutos. Si te gusta un mas oscuro\r\nsalsa, añadir un chorrito de salsa de soja a la\r\nestaño. Colar la salsa en una jarra y servir.\r\ncon el pollo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13593,7097,'es','Pastel de pastor sin complicaciones','Tenemos algunas versiones encantadoras del pastel de carne en el sitio, pero nos faltaba una versión definitiva de esta receta familiar clásica: ¡aquí está!','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla grande, picada","2-3 zanahorias medianas, picadas","Paquete de 500 g de carne picada de cordero","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","un chorrito grande de salsa inglesa","500 ml de caldo de carne","900 g de patatas cortadas en trozos","85 g de mantequilla","3 cucharadas de leche"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana,\r\nluego ablanda la cebolla y las zanahorias por\r\nunos minutos. Cuando esté suave, sube el fuego,\r\ndesmenuzar el cordero y dorar, inclinando\r\neliminar cualquier exceso de grasa. Agrega el tomate\r\npuré y salsa inglesa, luego\r\nfreír durante unos minutos. Vierta sobre el caldo,\r\nllevar a fuego lento, luego tapar y\r\ncocine por 40 minutos, destapando a la mitad.","Mientras tanto, calentar el horno a 180C/\r\nventilador 160C/gas 4, luego hacer el puré.\r\nHervir las patatas en agua con sal durante\r\n10-15 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir, luego\r\ntriturar con la mantequilla y la leche.","Poner la carne picada en una fuente apta para horno,\r\ncubra con el puré y revuelva con un tenedor.\r\nEl pastel ahora se puede enfriar y congelar.\r\nhasta por un mes. Hornear durante 20-25 minutos\r\nhasta que la parte superior comience a colorear y\r\nla carne picada burbujea en el\r\nbordes. (Para hornear congelado, cocine a\r\n160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3 durante 1 h-1 h 20\r\nminutos hasta que esté bien caliente en el centro. destello\r\ndebajo de la parrilla para que se dore, si lo desea).\r\nDejar reposar 5 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13594,7099,'es','Sapo herbívoro en el hoyo','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Este favorito de la familia combina salchichas carnosas con hierbas robustas y el tradicional y reconfortante pudín de Yorkshire.','["140 g de harina común","3 huevos","300ml de leche","2 tsp Dijon mustard","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","8 salchichas Cumberland","8 hojas de salvia","4 ramitas de romero"]','["Caliente el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9. En un procesador de alimentos, combine la harina, los huevos, la leche, la mostaza y un poco de sal y pimienta, mezcle hasta que quede suave y luego déjelo reposar durante 30 minutos.","Vierta el aceite en una fuente de metal para asar de unos 30 x 23 cm y 7,5 cm de profundidad. Unte con aceite todos los lados y el fondo, luego colóquelo en el horno. Cuando la fuente para asar esté muy caliente y humeante, coloque las salchichas adentro, distribuidas uniformemente y cocine por 5 minutos.","Revuelva la masa reposada y viértala en el molde muy caliente; tenga cuidado porque podría escupir. Espolvorea rápidamente sobre las hojas de salvia y el romero, luego colócalo en el medio del horno. No abra la puerta durante 25 minutos, luego verifique; si es necesario, cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos más. Cocine hasta que esté inflado y dorado y la masa esté completamente cocida. Servir directamente del plato."]','2026-01-11 12:58:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13595,6899,'es','Programa de estudios de limón','Un postre rápido que puede ser tan delicioso o saludable como quieras, experimenta con tus favoritos.','["284 tarrina de nata para montar","50 g de azúcar en polvo","50 ml de vino blanco","ralladura y jugo de ½ limón","almendras finas o bayas, para servir"]','["Batir la nata y el azúcar hasta que se formen picos suaves. Agregue el vino, la mayor parte del\r\nralladura de limón y el jugo. Vierta en vasos o tazones, espolvoree con la ralladura restante y sirva con almendras finas o bayas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13596,7101,'es','Pastel de pescado – en cuatro pasos','Delicioso y fácil: un pastel de pescado que cualquiera puede preparar. Aprenderás a escalfar pescado y también a hacer una salsa blanca.','["400 g de filete de pescado blanco sin piel","400 g de filete de eglefino ahumado sin piel","600 ml de leche entera","1 cebolla pequeña, en cuartos","4 dientes","2 hojas de laurel","4 huevos","manojo pequeño de perejil, solo las hojas, picado","100 g de mantequilla","50 g de harina común","pizca de nuez moscada recién rallada","1 kg de patatas harinosas, peladas y cortadas en trozos del mismo tamaño","50 g de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Escalfar el pescado. Pon el pescado en la sartén y vierte sobre 500 ml de leche. Clave cada cuarto de cebolla con un diente,\r\nluego añadir a la leche, con las hojas de laurel. Lleva la leche a ebullición; verás algunas burbujas pequeñas. Reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 8 minutos. Coloca el pescado en un plato y cuela la leche en una jarra para que se enfríe. Desmenuza el pescado en trozos grandes en la fuente para horno.","Hervir los huevos. Hierva suavemente una cacerola pequeña con agua y luego introduzca con cuidado los huevos con una espumadera. traer\r\nEl agua vuelve a hervir suavemente, con solo un par de burbujas subiendo a la superficie. Configure el cronómetro en 8 minutos, cocine, luego escurra y enfríe en un recipiente con agua fría. Pelar, cortar en cuartos y colocar encima del pescado, luego espolvorear con perejil picado.","Haz la salsa. Derrita la mitad de la mantequilla en una sartén, agregue la harina y cocine por 1 minuto a fuego moderado. Quítate el calor,\r\nvierta un poco de leche escalfada fría y luego revuelva hasta que se mezclen. Continúe agregando la leche poco a poco, mezclando bien hasta obtener una salsa suave. Regrese al fuego, lleve a ebullición y cocine por 5 minutos, revolviendo continuamente, hasta que cubra el dorso de una cuchara. Retirar del fuego, sazonar con sal, pimienta y nuez moscada y luego verter sobre el pescado.","Montar y hornear. Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Hervir las patatas durante 20 minutos. Escurrir, sazonar y triturar con el\r\nresto de mantequilla y leche. Úselo para cubrir el pastel, comenzando en el borde del plato y avanzando hacia adentro; empuje el puré hacia los bordes para sellar. Revuelva la parte superior con un tenedor, espolvoree con queso y luego hornee por 30 minutos. Prepare con un día de anticipación, enfríe y luego hornee por 40 minutos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13597,7103,'es','Salchichas con puré de manzana','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Dale a tus salchichas un cambio de imagen primaveral con puré de manzana; no hay comida reconfortante mucho mejor que esta.','["700 g de patatas harinosas cortadas en trozos","8 salchichas Cumberland","25 g de mantequilla","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","2 cucharaditas de harina común","250 ml de caldo de carne","2 manzanas (aproximadamente 280 g/10 oz), peladas y picadas en trozos pequeños","3 cucharadas de leche"]','["Cocine las patatas en ebullición,\r\nagua con sal durante 15 minutos hasta que estén tiernos.\r\nMientras tanto, calentar una sartén antiadherente.\r\ny agrega las salchichas. Cocine sobre un\r\nfuego medio durante 15-20 minutos, volteando\r\nocasionalmente, hasta que esté bien cocido.\r\nRetirar de la sartén y mantener caliente.","Añade una nuez de mantequilla y la cebolla.\r\na la sartén, luego cocine durante 15-20 minutos hasta que\r\nsuave. Agregue la harina y luego agregue gradualmente\r\nel caldo, revolviendo para hacer una salsa.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos y luego vierta en una jarra.\r\ny mantente caliente.","Cocine las manzanas en la mitad restante.\r\nmantequilla durante 5-10 minutos hasta que se ablande. Drenar\r\nlas patatas y triturarlas bien con\r\nresto de la mantequilla y la leche. Doblar\r\nla manzana, luego servir con las salchichas\r\ny salsa de cebolla."]','2026-01-11 12:58:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13598,7105,'es','Yorkies sin fallas','Perfectos para absorber la salsa, estos suaves pero crujientes pudines de Yorkshire se levantarán cada vez gracias a una excelente masa.','["450ml de leche","4 huevos grandes","250 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o vegetal"]','["Hasta 3-4 horas antes de cocinar, mezcle\r\njuntos la leche, los huevos, la harina y 2 cucharaditas\r\nsal en un procesador de alimentos o licuadora hasta\r\ntienes una masa suave. Si no lo haces\r\ntener un procesador de alimentos o licuadora, batir\r\nlos huevos en la harina y la sal, luego\r\nAgregue gradualmente la leche hasta que quede suave.\r\nPasar a una jarra, tapar y dejar en\r\ntemperatura ambiente durante al menos 15 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y cepillar 12 agujeros de un muffin.\r\nestaño con el aceite. Calentar la lata en el horno.\r\ndurante 5 minutos, luego levante con cuidado y\r\nVierta rápidamente la masa en los agujeros.\r\nHornee en el horno durante 5 minutos, luego reduzca\r\ntemperatura del horno a 200C/180C ventilador/\r\nGas 6 y cocinar por 30 minutos más.\r\nhasta que esté inflado, leudado y dorado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13599,7107,'es','Tartas de mazapán Eccles','Esta divertida versión de los tradicionales pasteles de frutas de Lancashire utiliza restos de mazapán para hacer irresistibles pasteles individuales.','["300 g de frutos secos sobrantes, como pasas, pasas, grosellas","2 manzanas o peras para comer, sin corazón y ralladas","50 g de azúcar demerara y un poco más para decorar","100 g sobrantes de mazapán rallado","½ cucharadita de clavo molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","500 g de masa de hojaldre en bloque","un poco de harina, para enrollar","1 huevo batido"]','["Mezclar los frutos secos, la manzana o pera rallada, el azúcar Demerara, el mazapán, el clavo y la canela.","Divida la masa en 6. Luego monte las tartas una por una. Corte por la mitad un trozo de masa y extienda cada mitad hasta formar un círculo del grosor de un trozo de 50 p sobre una superficie enharinada. Vierta una sexta parte del relleno en el centro de un círculo en una pila. Cepille los bordes con huevo y levante el segundo círculo de masa encima. Presione suavemente la fruta para expulsar la mayor cantidad de aire posible. Presione los bordes de la masa para sellar. Utilice un recipiente, vaso, etc. del tamaño adecuado para ayudarle a recortar los bordes hasta formar un círculo limpio. En esta etapa, puedes tapar y enfriar las tartas durante la noche o congelarlas durante 1 mes. Descongelar antes de continuar. Pincelar con huevo batido y luego hacer tres pequeños cortes seguidos con un cuchillo. Repita con el resto de la masa y el relleno.","Coloca las tartas en el frigorífico mientras calientas el horno a 200 C/180 C ventilador/gas 6. Cuando el horno esté bien caliente, unta las tartas con huevo y espolvorea cada una con un poco más de azúcar. Hornee durante 20 a 25 minutos, hasta que esté dorado, luego cómelo tibio con helado o natillas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13600,7109,'es','Pastel de hojaldre de pollo y champiñones','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esto es justo lo que necesitas en una noche fría. Servir con puré de papas cremoso.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","8 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","8 lonchas de tocino ahumado, cortado en trozos grandes","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","Paquete de 250 g de champiñones pequeños","un puñado de ramitas de tomillo","2 cucharadas de harina común","400 ml de caldo de pollo","200ml de leche","Paquete de 500g de hojaldre fresco, o congelado y descongelado","1 huevo batido"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande. Sazone el pollo al gusto y fríalo durante 5 a 8 minutos hasta que esté dorado, volteándolo de vez en cuando. Es posible que tengas que hacer esto en dos tandas, dependiendo del tamaño de tu molde. Levante el pollo sobre un plato y vierta el tocino en la sartén. Freír durante 5 minutos hasta que estén crujientes. Añade la cebolla, los champiñones y el tomillo, luego sofríe a fuego alto durante otros 3 minutos hasta que las cebollas empiecen a tomar color.","Vierta la harina en la sartén y cocine, revolviendo, durante 1 min. Con la sartén fuera del fuego, agregue o agregue gradualmente el caldo, seguido de la leche, luego agregue el pollo nuevamente a la sartén. Llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante 30 minutos. Vierta el relleno en una fuente grande para pastel o para hornear (aproximadamente 20 x 30 cm) con borde y déjelo enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. Sobre una superficie enharinada, extender la masa hasta obtener un grosor de dos monedas de £1. Cortar una tira larga del ancho del borde del molde para tarta y, con un poco de huevo, fijarla al borde del molde para tarta. Pincele con huevo, luego levante el resto de la masa sobre el pastel, usando el rodillo como ayuda. Presione suavemente los bordes con los dedos y recórtelos con un cuchillo afilado. Unte ligeramente con huevo para glasear, luego hornee durante 30 minutos o hasta que la masa haya subido y esté dorada oscura."]','2026-01-11 12:58:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13601,7111,'es','bollos azucarados','Una receta de bollo sencilla y rápida que tiene un excelente acabado dulce: la capa de azúcar crujiente también añade textura.','["85 g de mantequilla cortada en cubitos","350 g de harina con levadura","¼ cucharadita de sal","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","200 ml de leche, calentada a temperatura ambiente, más un chorrito extra","terrones de azúcar triturada, para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Batir la mantequilla con\r\nharina. Vierta en un bol y agregue la sal con el bicarbonato de sodio.\r\ny azúcar. Usando un cubierto\r\ncuchillo, agregue rápidamente la leche –\r\nno mezcle demasiado.","Vierta sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada.\r\ny darle la vuelta un par de veces a muy\r\njunte suavemente con las manos.\r\nGolpee suavemente hasta obtener aproximadamente 1 pulgada de grosor, luego selle\r\nSaque rondas con un cortador enharinado. palmadita\r\njunte los recortes para eliminar más.\r\nCepille la parte superior con un chorrito más\r\nleche, luego espolvorear con azúcar triturada\r\ncubos. Hornee en una bandeja para hornear durante\r\n10-12 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13602,7113,'es','Verduras de otoño asadas con queso Lancashire','Una cena vegetariana colorida y abundante para el otoño, preparada en una fuente para asar, de Roz Denny','["1 calabaza grande (aproximadamente 600-700 g/1 libra 5 oz - 1 libra 9 oz de peso)","1 cebolla morada mediana","6 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 ramita grande de salvia fresca","1 calabacín grande","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico o de jerez","100 g de queso lancashire"]','["Precalienta el horno a\r\nventilador180C/convencional 200C/\r\ngas 6. Con un cuchillo afilado, corte\r\nla calabaza por la mitad y sacar\r\nsacar las semillas. cortar las mitades\r\nen trozos más pequeños para que puedas\r\npelarlos más fácilmente. picar\r\nla pulpa en trozos grandes\r\npiezas, no es necesario\r\nser ordenado.","Cortar la cebolla por la mitad y recortar la\r\nextremo de la raíz dejando un poco en\r\nmantener unidos los segmentos.\r\nPelar y luego cortar cada mitad.\r\nen cuatro gajos. esparcir el\r\ncalabaza y cebolla en una cacerola grande\r\nfuente para asar para que tengan\r\nmucho espacio para asar, rociar\r\nmás de 5 cucharadas de aceite y revuelva\r\njuntos. Quitar las hojas de salvia\r\ndesde el tallo y aproximadamente\r\npicar – deberías tener aproximadamente\r\n2 cucharadas. Dispersarse sobre el\r\nverduras y sazonar.\r\nAse durante 20 minutos, revolviendo\r\nuna vez a mitad de camino.","Mientras tanto, cortar el\r\ncalabacín grueso y mezclar\r\ncon el aceite restante.\r\nRetire la fuente para asar de\r\nel horno y empuje parcialmente\r\ncalabaza y cebolla cocidas para\r\nel lado. Pon el calabacín\r\nrodajas planas sobre la base y\r\ntemporada. Asar por más\r\n10 minutos, hasta que todos los\r\nlas verduras estén tiernas.","Retire el molde del horno,\r\nespolvorear el vinagre sobre el\r\nverduras y revuelva. desmoronarse\r\nsobre el queso Lancashire.\r\nMezcle ligeramente para que el queso\r\nse derrite un poco y sirve."]','2026-01-11 12:58:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13603,7117,'es','Esponja de melaza fácil','Una versión horneada sencilla de este clásico pudín infantil, con una sabrosa salsa de melaza que forma un charco irresistible en el fondo.','["250 g de almíbar dorado","ralladura de 1 limón, más jugo de ½ limón","5 cucharadas de pan rallado","Paquete de 200 g de mantequilla blanda","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","3 huevos medianos","200 g de harina con levadura","5 cucharadas de leche"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Mezclar el almíbar, la ralladura de limón, el jugo y el pan rallado y esparcir sobre la base de una fuente para horno de 1,5 litros.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos, luego incorporar los huevos, uno por uno. Agregue la harina y la leche y vierta sobre el almíbar. Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté dorado y levado, y al pinchar una brocheta en el bizcocho, éste salga limpio. Coma con muchas natillas, nata o helado y un chorrito extra de almíbar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13604,3866,'es','Gambas al curry','Disfrute de estos langostinos al curry de inspiración jamaicana elaborados con leche de coco, tomates, chile y muchas especias para una cena llena de sabor. Servir con arroz','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal o de coco","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","Trozo de jengibre de 1 pulgada, rallado","2 tomates, picados","½ chile scotch bonnet (opcional)","24-36 langostinos enteros o cómpralos pelados","1½ cucharadita de cúrcuma en polvo","1 cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","5 dientes, molidos","½ cucharadita de fenogreco molido","1 cucharadita de pimentón","½ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica molida","1 cucharadita de pasta de tamarindo","400 ml de leche de coco","arroz cocido, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo. Agrega la cebolla y cocina durante 15 minutos hasta que esté suave y comience a caramelizar, revolviendo regularmente. Agrega el ajo, el jengibre, los tomates y la guindilla, si la usas. Sube el fuego a medio y cocina por otros 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, si vas a usar langostinos con cáscara, prepáralos ahora. Retira la cabeza y, con unas tijeras, corta la parte posterior del caparazón hasta llegar al último segmento de caparazón que está unido a la cola. Corta la capa superior de carne en la parte posterior de cada langostino para que sea fácil quitar la vena; aflójala del cuerpo, luego, con los dedos lo más cerca posible de la cola, tira suavemente para quitar la vena por completo. Puedes conservar las cabezas y las conchas para hacer un caldo.","Mezcle las especias molidas y la pasta de tamarindo con 2 cucharadas de agua, luego agréguelas a la mezcla de cebolla. Cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que las especias estén fragantes y la mayor parte del agua se haya evaporado.","Agregue la leche de coco y cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que se reduzca a una salsa espesa, luego agregue las gambas. Cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que estén rosados, luego retírelos del fuego. Servir con arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:58:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13605,5663,'es','Tortitas de camote y maíz con tocino de tamarindo y aguacate','Disfrute de pasteles dorados de batata y maíz de inspiración jamaicana con tocino dulce y pegajoso y aguacate triturado con chile','["2 batatas (500g)","1 patata (325g)","2 aguacates maduros, pelados y sin hueso","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","¼-½ chile scotch bonnet, finamente picado (opcional)","1 lima, exprimida","2 mazorcas de maíz (o 300 g de maíz dulce enlatado escurrido)","100 g de harina de yuca","1 cucharadita de extracto de tamarindo","½ cucharadita de miel","8 rebanadas de tocino grueso","100 ml de aceite vegetal","8 cucharadas de crema agria, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Pincha las batatas y las patatas con un cuchillo y ásalas hasta que estén blandas (aproximadamente 45 minutos a 1 hora para las patatas y 40 a 50 minutos para las batatas), dándoles la vuelta a la mitad. Retirar del horno, dejar hasta que se enfríe lo suficiente como para manipularlo, luego quitar la pulpa de la papa de la piel y triturarla ligeramente, pero no hasta que quede suave; manténgala con trozos.","Mientras se cocinan las patatas, coloca el aguacate en un bol y tritúralo ligeramente. Agregue la mitad de las cebolletas, el gorro escocés, si lo usa, el jugo de lima y una pizca de sal y pimienta. Manténgalo frío hasta que esté listo para servir.","Si usa maíz fresco, corte los granos de la mazorca y hierva en una cacerola con agua con sal durante 3 minutos. Enjuague con agua fría para enfriar. Añade el maíz dulce a la mezcla de patatas, con las cebolletas restantes y un poco de sal y pimienta. Mezcle suavemente y luego tome un puñado del tamaño de un tomate. Enrolle sobre la encimera y luego aplánelo ligeramente hasta que tenga aproximadamente 1 pulgada de grosor. Repita hasta que se acabe toda la mezcla, debería tener alrededor de 12-14 pasteles. Coloque la harina de yuca en un recipiente poco profundo y deje caer con cuidado los pasteles, uno por uno, luego enrolle ligeramente para cubrirlos con la harina.","Mezcla el tamarindo y la miel con 1 cucharada de agua tibia hasta que se disuelvan por completo. Calentar una sartén a fuego medio y agregar el tocino. Después de 1 minuto, unta la mezcla de tamarindo por la parte superior y dale la vuelta, untando el otro lado con un poco más de mezcla. Al principio parecerá que el tocino está hirviendo, pero sigue añadiendo la mezcla y volteándolo dos veces más y empezará a caramelizar. Una vez que esté bien dorado por ambos lados, retírelo de la sartén y manténgalo caliente.","Ponga el aceite en una sartén antiadherente, suficiente para que el aceite llegue hasta la mitad de las tortas. Calienta a fuego medio-alto y fríe los pasteles durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y mantener caliente mientras cocinas el resto de las tartas. Para servir, apile dos o tres pasteles en cada plato junto con un poco de puré de aguacate y ponga dos rebanadas de tocino encima. Sirva 2 cucharadas de crema agria a un lado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13606,5673,'es','Ackee y pescado salado','Cocine un plato tradicional jamaicano, ackee y bacalao salado, para disfrutar de un abundante brunch. Con pimientos, tomate y ajo junto con la fruta ackee, está lleno de sabor.','["600 g de bacalao salado deshuesado","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla mediana, finamente picada","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","3 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","1 pimiento escocés, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cucharadita de tomillo seco","1 cucharadita de pimiento molido (pimienta de Jamaica)","½ pimiento rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","½ pimiento verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 tomate grande, picado","2 latas de ackee de 540 g, escurridas"]','["Poner el bacalao en un recipiente y cubrir con agua fría. Llevar a ebullición, luego hervir durante 5 minutos, escurrir y agregar agua fría hasta cubrir.","Repita este proceso hasta que esté satisfecho con el sabor salado al probarlo; Recomendamos hervir el pescado tres veces en total para lograr un equilibrio perfecto de sal en el pescado. Escurrir y dejar enfriar. Utiliza un tenedor para desmenuzar el bacalao salado en trozos y reservar.","Ahora necesitarás una sartén grande. Vierte el aceite vegetal en la sartén y coloca a fuego alto. Una vez que el aceite esté muy caliente, baje el fuego a medio-bajo. Agregue la cebolla, el ajo, las cebolletas y el gorro escocés, luego cocine hasta que estén tiernos, durante unos 5-7 minutos.","Luego, agrega los pimientos rojos y verdes, junto con el tomate. Mezcle y cocine durante 2-3 minutos para ablandar un poco los pimientos. Estos ingredientes ayudan a equilibrar el calor, por lo que no es demasiado picante."]','2026-01-11 12:58:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13607,7119,'es','cabra al curry','Disfrute de este curry de cabra de inspiración jamaicana lleno de sabor para un festín familiar. Lleva la olla a la mesa y deja que cada uno se sirva.','["1 kg de carne de cabra, cortada en cubos (la nuestra la conseguimos en Cabrito Goat Meat)","4 cucharadas de curry en polvo","1 cucharada de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de pimienta negra","1 cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica (pimiento molido)","3 cucharaditas de sal, al gusto","1 cebolla mediana, rebanada","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas, y más para servir","2 cucharaditas de ajo picado","6-7 ramitas de tomillo","5 cucharadas de aceite (vegetal o de coco)","1 zanahoria mediana, cortada en cubos","1 papa mediana, cortada en cubos de 2 cm","1 chile Scotch Bonnet, dejado entero"]','["Poner la cabra en un bol grande y añadir todos los ingredientes excepto el aceite, la zanahoria, la patata y la guindilla. Frote todo en la carne hasta que esté bien cubierto. Poner en el frigorífico a marinar durante al menos 1 hora o toda la noche.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande de fondo grueso a fuego medio a alto y agrega la carne. Revuelva hasta que se dore por todos lados. Vierta suficiente agua caliente para cubrir la carne (unos 800 ml). Tapar y dejar cocinar a fuego lento durante 2 horas, o hasta que la carne esté suave y tierna. Sigue revisando y revolviendo cada 30 minutos y agrega un poco más de agua si se reduce demasiado, para evitar que la sartén se seque.","Durante los últimos 30 minutos de cocción, agregue las zanahorias, las patatas y el chile. Retire la tapa y cocine a fuego lento un poco más para que espese, si lo desea. Revuelva y sazone al gusto, luego esparza un poco más de cebolleta."]','2026-01-11 12:58:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13608,7121,'es','Arroz y guisantes','Sirva arroz y guisantes como acompañamiento con pollo Jerk al estilo caribeño u otras carnes asadas. Los ''guisantes'' son en realidad alubias','["Lata de 400 g de judías verdes, enjuagadas y escurridas","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco desnatada","½ cucharadita de tomillo seco","½ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica molida","6 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","200 g de arroz de grano largo"]','["Ponga los frijoles, la leche de coco, el tomillo, la pimienta de Jamaica, 4 de las cebolletas y 100 ml de agua en una cacerola y cocine a fuego lento. Sazona con abundante sal y pimienta negra.","Enjuague el arroz varias veces en un colador hasta que el agua salga clara. Vierta en la sartén y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos a fuego medio, revolviendo ocasionalmente, antes de bajar el fuego. Tape y cocine por otros 5 minutos hasta que los granos estén tiernos y el líquido se haya absorbido. Revuelva el arroz con un tenedor antes de servir y esparza con las cebolletas reservadas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13609,7123,'es','Jerk desmenuzado con salsa de plátano','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. El plato perfecto para compartir en fiestas se condimenta con condimentos caribeños y se sirve con una salsa gruesa afrutada.','["200 g de sal marina","300 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","2 kg de paleta de cerdo deshuesada y sin piel, pero sin grasa","4 cucharadas de condimento Jerk (usamos Bart), mezclado con 2 cucharaditas de canela molida","150 ml de jugo de piña","50 g de melaza","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y bien enjuagados","muchas tortillas de harina suaves (2-3 por persona dependiendo del tamaño y el apetito)","olla grande de yogur natural y lechuga rallada, para servir (opcional)","3 plátanos medianos, firmes a maduros, pelados y cortados en cubos de 1 cm","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","2 aguacates recién maduros","jugo 1 limon","jugo 2 limones","1-2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","paquete pequeño de cilantro, tallos finamente picados y hojas picadas en trozos grandes"]','["El día anterior, mezcle la sal marina y 200 g de azúcar en una bolsa de comida grande. Agrega la carne de cerdo y cúbrela bien, luego déjala en el frigorífico durante la noche.","Al día siguiente, retira la carne de cerdo y limpia la carne con papel de cocina para eliminar el exceso de azúcar o sal. Frote 3 cucharadas de especias Jerk por todas partes y coloque la carne sobre una rejilla, en una fuente para asar. Dejar marinar un poco en el frigorífico, luego 30 minutos antes de empezar a cocinar, sacarlo a temperatura ambiente.","Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1. Mezclar los 100 g restantes de azúcar con el jugo de piña, las especias Jerk restantes y la melaza, y frotar la mitad sobre la carne de cerdo. Vierta la otra mitad en el molde y ase durante 6 horas. Rocíe la carne con los jugos y ase durante 1 hora más hasta que el exterior esté carbonizado y el interior tierno. Deja reposar la carne de cerdo en una fuente durante 20 minutos y vierte el jugo de la lata en un separador de grasa.","Pon el plátano cortado en cubitos en un bol con la cebolla. Deshuesar, pelar y trocear los aguacates y añadirlos también. Agregue el jugo de limón y lima, los chiles, los tallos y hojas de cilantro y un poco de condimento.","Calienta los frijoles negros en el microondas y calienta las tortillas siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Agregue un par de tenedores a la carne de cerdo para desmenuzar, deseche la grasa de los jugos de la lata y sirva el resto al lado para verter. Sirve la carne de cerdo con los wraps, los frijoles, la salsa de plátano, el yogurt y la lechuga rallada, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13610,7125,'es','Costillas de Jerk pegajoso y azúcar moreno con arroz con piña','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Las pilas de costillas de cerdo son una alternativa al pollo en este festín caribeño con adobo pegajoso y acompañamiento de basmati afrutado.','["2 costillas de cerdo de 500 g","3 cucharadas de condimento Jerk","600 ml de jugo de piña","5 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave y oscuro","4 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","jugo 1 lima","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 chalote de plátano grande, finamente cortado","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","Paquete de 200 g de trozos de piña fresca, finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moreno","200 g de arroz basmati, cocido y enfriado","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado"]','["Coloque las costillas en una fuente para asar y frótelas con 2 cucharadas de la mezcla de especias Jerk. Dejar marinar durante al menos 2 horas, o preferiblemente durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Poner las costillas en una fuente para asar limpia, sazonar y verter sobre 500ml de jugo de piña. Cubre el molde con papel aluminio y hornea por 2 horas.","Mezcle el resto de la mezcla de especias Jerk, el jugo de piña, el azúcar, el vinagre, el jugo de lima y una buena pizca de sal en una cacerola. Caliente hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, luego burbujee hasta que esté espeso y pegajoso.","Para hacer el arroz, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande o en un wok. Agrega la chalota y la pimienta y sofríe hasta que se ablanden. Agrega la piña, el azúcar moreno y abundante condimento, y continúa cocinando hasta que la piña comience a caramelizar.","Retire las costillas del horno y vierta el líquido de cocción. Aumente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Seque las costillas con un poco de papel de cocina y luego unte la salsa Jerk por todas partes. Regrese al horno durante 20 minutos, untando con la salsa restante aproximadamente cada 5 minutos, hasta que las costillas estén muy pegajosas.","Agrega el arroz cocido a la sartén con la piña y las verduras, sofríe durante 2 minutos más, revolviendo ocasionalmente, luego agrega el cilantro. Sirva con las costillas pegajosas y algunas servilletas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13611,7127,'es','Jerk de cerdo con arroz y frijoles','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una versión rápida de la carne de cerdo jamaicana favorita: mucho sabor, no demasiado picante.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","3 cucharadas de salsa jamaicana","4 filetes pequeños de lomo de cerdo deshuesados, de unos 500 g/1 lb 2 oz en total","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","50 g de crema de coco (de un bloque)","1 manojo de cebollas para ensalada","2 paquetes de 250 g de arroz basmati puro Rizzazz (arroz ya cocido envasado al vacío)","Lata de 410 g de frijoles rojos, escurridos"]','["Llene la tetera hasta la mitad y póngala a hervir. Caliente el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego lento mientras vierte la salsa Jerk en un plato poco profundo y la usa para cubrir los filetes de cerdo por ambos lados. Colócalas en el aceite caliente (reserva la salsa que queda en el bol) y sube el fuego. Freír durante 4 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén cocidos y bien glaseados.","Mientras se fríe la carne de cerdo, vierta 150 ml de agua hirviendo en una sartén mediana a fuego alto y desmenúcela con la pastilla de caldo y la crema de coco. Recorta y corta en rodajas las cebolletas, manteniéndolas juntas como un manojo para que puedas picarlas todas de una vez. Agregue a la sartén, revuelva rápidamente y luego agregue el arroz y los frijoles. Revuelva y caliente suavemente, rompiendo los grumos de arroz con una cuchara. Si el arroz se ve un poco seco, agrega un chorrito extra de agua.","Vierta la salsa restante en la sartén para calentarla con la carne de cerdo. Apila el arroz en platos, cubre con la carne de cerdo y vierte el jugo de la sartén encima."]','2026-01-11 12:58:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13612,7129,'es','Empanadas de carne caribeña','Condimente la carne picada con cúrcuma, tomillo y salsa de pimiento picante antes de incorporarla a la masa quebrada para disfrutar de una deliciosa cena o almuerzo.','["chorrito de aceite","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","250 g de carne picada","1 papa, cortada en cubos de 1cm/½","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","unas ramitas de tomillo","2 cucharadas de salsa de pimiento picante","500 g de masa quebrada en bloque","1 huevo batido","ensalada verde, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén, agrega la cebolla y cocina por 5 minutos. Agrega el ajo y la carne, sube el fuego y cocina hasta que la carne se dore. Añade la patata, la mitad de la cúrcuma, el puré y el tomillo, más 200ml de agua. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, luego retire la tapa y cocine por 5 minutos más. Agrega la salsa de pimiento picante y deja enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Estirar la masa hasta que tenga el grosor de una moneda de £1. Recorta círculos de 6 x 15 cm, utilizando un plato pequeño como guía. Divida la carne picada entre los círculos, amontonándola de un lado. Mezcle el huevo con la cúrcuma restante, unte el borde de cada círculo, luego doble y use un tenedor para sellar los bordes. Colocar en una bandeja para horno forrada con papel de horno, pincelar con un poco más de huevo y hornear durante 20-25 minutos. Servir con una ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 12:58:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13613,7131,'es','Salmón Jerk pegajoso con ensalada de mango','Sirva filetes de salmón en trozos con un glaseado de miel caribeño picante sobre una ensalada de col casera con repollo, pimiento rojo, mango y cilantro.','["2 cucharadas colmadas de pasta jamaicana","2 cucharadas de miel clara","4 filetes de salmón","jugo 2 limones","½ col lombarda, sin corazón, en rodajas finas","1 mango firme pero maduro, sin piel, en rodajas finas","1 pimiento rojo, en rodajas finas","6 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas en ángulo","cilantro en manojo pequeño, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Calienta la parrilla a medio-alto. Mezcle la pasta Jerk y 1 cucharada de miel en un bol. Coloque los filetes de salmón en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel de aluminio y unte con la salsa. Cocine en el estante superior durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que esté bien cocido (mueva la bandeja hacia abajo si el salmón comienza a caramelizarse demasiado).","Mientras tanto, ponga el resto de la miel, el jugo de lima y un poco de condimento en un tazón grande y mezcle. Agregue la col lombarda, el mango, el pimiento, las cebolletas y el cilantro, y mezcle con el aderezo. Sirva el salmón sobre un montón de ensalada."]','2026-01-11 12:58:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13614,6547,'es','Tacos picantes de langostinos y mango con aderezo de coco','Use pasta de carne estilo caribeño para marinar mariscos y luego sírvala en crujientes tacos de maíz con una ensalada texturizada y una salsa ligera.','["300 g de langostinos crudos pelados","1½ cucharada de pasta jamaicana","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","1 mango grande, deshuesado, pelado y cortado en cubitos","½ cebolla morada, rebanada","½ pepino, picado","manojo de cilantro, hojas picadas en trozos grandes","8 tacos","½ cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 lechugas Little Gem, ralladas","Lata de 165ml de leche de coco.","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","2 pizcas de azúcar"]','["Revuelva los langostinos y la pasta de Jerk.\r\nen un bol y reservar. Mezclar juntos el\r\ningredientes del aderezo.","Vierta los frijoles en un bol junto con\r\nel mango, la cebolla, el pepino, la mayoría\r\ndel cilantro, el aderezo y\r\nalgún condimento. Calentar las tortillas para tacos\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande,\r\nAñade las gambas y cocina durante 2-3 minutos.\r\no hasta que esté bien cocido.","Para preparar los tacos, comience con un puñado.\r\nde lechuga, seguida de la ensalada de frijoles,\r\nluego cubra con los langostinos. espolvorear\r\nel cilantro restante y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13615,7133,'es','Pollo Jerk fácil con arroz y guisantes','Un clásico caribeño, esta receta es una comida deliciosa y satisfactoria entre semana.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 kg de muslos y muslos de pollo","1 botella de salsa barbacoa Jerk (Levi Roots o Walkerswood de Waitrose)","1 manojo de cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","200 g de arroz basmati","2 latas de 410 g de frijoles rojos","lata de 400g de leche de coco","1 manojo de cebolletas, picadas","1 ramita de tomillo","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nCalentar el aceite en una fuente para asar, luego\r\nAgrega con cuidado los trozos de pollo.\r\nDorarlos ligeramente por todos lados.\r\n– tardará entre 6 y 8 minutos. verter\r\nsobre la salsa Jerk, esparcir\r\nlas cebolletas cortadas en rodajas y luego revuelva\r\npara cubrir cada trozo de pollo.","Asa el pollo durante 30 minutos.\r\ngirando ocasionalmente para asegurar\r\nse vuelve agradable y pegajoso.","Mientras se cocina el pollo,\r\nHaz el arroz y los guisantes. Enjuague el\r\narroz en un colador hasta que corra el agua\r\nclaro. Lleve una cacerola con agua al\r\nhervir con el líquido sólo del\r\nlos frijoles, la leche de coco,\r\ncebolletas, tomillo, ajo, pimienta de Jamaica\r\ny un poco de sal, luego cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n10 minutos. Agrega los frijoles, luego\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos más hasta que\r\nel arroz está tierno. Escurrir y servir\r\ninmediatamente con el pollo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13616,7135,'es','Hamburguesa de ternera con salsa de piña y patatas fritas','Dale sabor a tu carne picada con especias jamaicanas y sírvela con un chutney tropical contrastante y papas fritas.','["4 patatas muy grandes","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla morada, ½ rallada y ½ finamente picada","1 zanahoria rallada","400 g/ 14 oz de carne picada","2 cucharaditas de condimento Jerk (usamos Bart)","200 g/7 oz de piña fresca (nosotros usamos paquete precortado), finamente picada","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","jugo 1 lima","panecillos de lechuga y hamburguesa, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nLavar las patatas y cortarlas en chips.\r\nColoque las patatas fritas en una sola capa sobre una bandeja para hornear.\r\nbandeja, rociar con aceite, sazonar y mezclar\r\nabrigo. Hornee durante 40 minutos hasta que esté crujiente.","Mezclar la cebolla rallada, la zanahoria,\r\ncondimento picado y Jerk en un tazón grande,\r\nluego forme 4 hamburguesas del mismo tamaño.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente hasta que esté caliente, luego\r\ncocine las hamburguesas durante 5-6 minutos por cada lado.","Para hacer la salsa, mezcle la carne picada\r\ncebolla, piña, chile, cilantro y\r\njugo de lima. Para servir colocar las hamburguesas.\r\nen panecillos partidos con un poco de lechuga y el\r\ncondimento picante. Servir con las patatas fritas crujientes."]','2026-01-11 12:58:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13617,7137,'es','Batatas picantes y picantes','Tenta tus cogollos con batatas picantes y picantes','["2 batatas grandes (aproximadamente 500 g/1 libra 4 oz cada una)","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de hojas frescas de tomillo, más 2 ramitas de tomillo fresco","1 chile rojo escocés, sin semillas y finamente picado"]','["Pelar los boniatos y cortarlos transversalmente en rodajas de 2,5 cm de grosor. Coloque cada papa sobre una hoja grande de papel de aluminio, manteniendo las rodajas juntas.","Rocíe cada papa con aceite de oliva, espolvoree con las hojas de tomillo, aproximadamente la mitad de la guindilla picada y sazone con abundante sal y pimienta. Con las manos, masajea los aromas en cada rebanada. Vuelva a colocar las rodajas en sus posiciones originales. Coloque una ramita de tomillo sobre cada papa y espolvoree con el chile restante. Envuelva bien el papel de aluminio alrededor de las patatas para formar dos paquetes. (Puede prepararse para esta etapa con hasta 24 horas de anticipación).","Coloque los paquetes de papel de aluminio en la rejilla sobre la parte más caliente de la barbacoa y cocine durante 45 minutos hasta que las patatas estén mantecosas y blandas. (Desenvolver y probar con la punta de un cuchillo para comprobar si están listos)."]','2026-01-11 12:58:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13618,7139,'es','Ensalada exótica de aguacate','Saboree sabores dulces y picantes en esta exótica ensalada de aguacate','["3 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza","2 papayas maduras","3 ripe avocados","Bolsa de 85g de berros recortados y lavados","Paquete de 20 g de menta fresca.","jugo de 1 lima","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Freír las semillas de calabaza en una sartén durante unos minutos, revolviendolas hasta que parezcan tostadas. Sácalos de la sartén y déjalos enfriar. Pelar las papayas, cortarlas por la mitad a lo largo y quitarles las semillas. Corta la pulpa en rodajas largas y finas. Cortar los aguacates por la mitad y quitarles los huesos, luego quitarles la piel y cortar la pulpa a lo largo en rodajas finas.","Pon las papayas, los aguacates, las semillas de calabaza y los berros en un bol grande. Pica aproximadamente 1 cucharada de hojas de menta y reserva. Recoge las hojas restantes de los tallos y córtalas en el bol.","Mezcla el jugo de lima y el aceite de oliva con el resto de la menta picada para hacer un aderezo y sazona con sal y pimienta al gusto. Vierta sobre la ensalada y mezcle suavemente todos los ingredientes con las manos. Pruebe y agregue más sal y pimienta si cree que la necesita, luego transfiérala a una fuente para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13619,7141,'es','Piña glaseada especiada con queso fresco y canela','Pruebe esta delicia tropical cuando quiera terminar una comida con una nota dulce sin demasiado esfuerzo ni demasiadas calorías.','["ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","2 cucharadas de miel clara","2 pizcas de canela molida","unas ralladas de nuez moscada entera","2 cucharaditas de azúcar glas, tamizada","200 g de queso fresco muy bajo en grasas","2 cucharaditas de mantequilla","1 piña fresca, cortada en 8 gajos largos, sin piel ni corazón"]','["Mezclar el jugo de lima y la mitad de la ralladura de lima.\r\ncon 1 cucharada de miel, una pizca de canela\r\ny nuez moscada. Reserva esta salsa. Revuelva el\r\nazúcar glas y una pizca de canela en\r\nel queso fresco.","Calentar la mantequilla y el resto de la miel.\r\nen una sartén antiadherente hasta que se derrita.\r\nAñade la piña y cocina a fuego alto.\r\ncalentar durante 8 minutos, volteando regularmente hasta\r\ncaramelizado. Vierta la lima especiada\r\nsalsa y burbujear durante unos segundos, revolviendo\r\nla piña para glasear en la salsa.","Servir inmediatamente, espolvoreado con el\r\nralladura de lima restante y acompañada de\r\nuna cucharada de queso fresco con canela"]','2026-01-11 12:58:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13620,7143,'es','Estofado de pescado trinitario de Natalie','Este plato de sol caribeño es perfecto para compartir con amigos; asegúrese de marinar el pescado en limón y lima para obtener un sabor realmente picante.','["2 limas, jugo y ralladura de 1, la otra cortada por la mitad para servir","1 filete de pescado blanco sin piel, como bacalao o hoki, de aproximadamente 175-200 g/6-8 oz cada uno","2 limones, solo jugo","2 paquetes de 15 g de tomillo fresco (necesitas mucho para el aroma)","¼ cucharadita de pimienta blanca","1 cucharada de ron oscuro","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, cortada en aros finos","un puñado de cilantro fresco picado","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 bistec o 3 tomates normales, rebanados","2 cucharaditas de azúcar mascabado oscuro","batido de amargo de angostura, opcional","arroz basmati o patatas hervidas y verduras al vapor, para servir"]','["Vierta el jugo y esparza la ralladura de la primera lima en un plato poco profundo lo suficientemente grande como para que quepa el pescado en una capa. Agite el jugo para que cubra toda la superficie del plato. Coloca el pescado encima y vierte el jugo de limón.","Quitar las hojas de tomillo de los tallos y triturarlas con una pizca de sal y pimienta blanca con un mortero hasta formar una pasta rugosa. Vierta la pasta de tomillo sobre el pescado y masajee suavemente, teniendo cuidado de no romper la carne en absoluto. Vierte el ron y dale una última frotación. Tapar y dejar macerar fuera de la nevera durante 1 hora aproximadamente.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén ancha y poco profunda con tapa. Eche los aros de cebolla y cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Vierta el cilantro, el ajo, las rodajas de tomate y el azúcar con las cebollas, revuelva y cocine durante unos 3-4 minutos hasta que los tomates comiencen a soltar su jugo y todo huela dulce.","Saque el pescado de su marinada y colóquelo en la sartén entre las cebollas y los tomates. Vierte sobre la marinada, 3 cucharadas de agua y el amargo de angostura, si lo estás usando.","Cubra la sartén y cocine suavemente durante 6-8 minutos hasta que el pescado se desmenuce fácilmente y las cebollas se ablanden pero aún tengan algo de sabor. Sazone con sal y pimienta. El auténtico plato de Trinidad es dulce y picante, con mucho sabor a tomillo y muy a lima, así que prueba la salsa y, si quieres más sabor, exprime sobre la lima restante. Sirva con arroz basmati o patatas hervidas y verduras al vapor."]','2026-01-11 12:58:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13621,7145,'es','plátanos asados','Cocine plátanos perfectos envolviéndolos en papel de aluminio y asándolos a la parrilla. Este pariente latinoamericano del plátano es delicioso en platos dulces y salados.','["2 plátanos maduros - la piel debe estar negra","2 cucharadas de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de azúcar demerara","8 cucharadas de jugo de naranja recién exprimido"]','["Pela los plátanos y córtalos transversalmente en rodajas de 2,5 cm de grosor. Coloca cada plátano sobre una hoja grande de papel de aluminio, manteniendo las rodajas juntas para que conserven su forma original.","Unte cada plátano con mantequilla (o salpique si está duro) y espolvoree con azúcar. Hacer una góndola alrededor de cada plátano con el papel de aluminio, luego verter sobre el jugo de naranja y moler sal y pimienta encima. Envuelve completamente los plátanos con papel de aluminio para que queden bien sellados por dentro. (Puede prepararse para esta etapa con hasta 24 horas de anticipación).","Coloque los paquetes de papel de aluminio en la parrilla y cocine por 30 minutos hasta que los plátanos se ablanden (para verificar si están listos, abra un paquete y pruebe con la punta de un cuchillo)."]','2026-01-11 12:58:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13622,6144,'es','Mezcla de especias Jerk','Esta combinación de especias caribeñas crea un sabor dulce y picante; puedes agregar chile Scotch Bonnet para hacerlo súper picante.','["2 cucharadas de canela molida o 2 ramas de canela","2 cucharadas de granos de pimienta negra","1 cucharada de tomillo seco","2 cucharaditas de bayas de pimienta de Jamaica","1½ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","½ nuez moscada"]','["Tostar las especias enteras en una sartén pequeña hasta que\r\nson aromáticos y han adquirido un matiz o\r\ndos más oscuros. No caigas en la tentación de saltarte esto\r\netapa, ya que realmente realza los sabores.","Vierta en un molinillo de especias (o use un mortero\r\ny mortero), luego agregue el molido listo\r\nespecias y hierbas secas si es necesario, y\r\ntriturar hasta obtener un polvo fino. Almacenar en un lugar sellado\r\nfrasco por hasta seis meses."]','2026-01-11 12:58:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13623,7149,'es','Pollo con mango, frijoles y arroz al horno','Las baquetas son ideales para hornear en bandeja todo en uno: el arroz, los frijoles y el condimento picante lo hacen un poco como el pollo Jerk caribeño.','["manojo pequeño de cebolletas, picadas","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, picado","3 dientes de ajo","1 chile rojo, sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, los tallos picados en trozos grandes y las hojas recogidas","1 cucharada de hoja de tomillo","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima, más 1 lima cortada en gajos para servir","1½ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica molida","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","8 muslos de pollo","300 g de arroz de grano largo","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes, enjuagadas y escurridas","500 ml de caldo de pollo","1 mango maduro, pelado, deshuesado y cortado en trozos pequeños","200 g de chutney de mango, más algo extra para servir (opcional)"]','["Ponga las cebolletas, el jengibre, el ajo,\r\nchile, tallos de cilantro, tomillo, ralladura de lima\r\ny jugo, pimienta de Jamaica y aceite en una comida\r\nprocesador, luego mezcle hasta obtener una pasta. verter\r\nsobre los muslos de pollo y dejar\r\nmarinar durante al menos 1 hora, o preferiblemente\r\nhasta 1 día.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nColoque el arroz y los frijoles en una cacerola grande.\r\nfuente para asar con lados profundos. Quitar\r\nel pollo de la marinada y listo\r\na un lado. Mezclar el caldo con la marinada.\r\nen el bol y revuelva bien. Vierta el caldo\r\nsobre el arroz y los frijoles, luego poner el\r\nmuslos de pollo y mango\r\npedazos encima. Cubra bien la bandeja\r\ncon papel aluminio y hornee por 30 minutos.","Saca la bandeja del horno y\r\nretire el papel de aluminio. Aumente la temperatura a 220 C/200 C ventilador/gas 7. Con una cuchara,\r\nchutney de mango sobre las baquetas\r\ny regresar al horno, destapado, por\r\n35-40 minutos, para dorar los trozos de pollo\r\ny dejar que el arroz absorba todo el líquido.\r\nAntes de servir, esponjar un poco el arroz.\r\ncon un tenedor y espolvorear con el cilantro\r\nhojas. Sirva con rodajas de lima y extra\r\nchutney de mango, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:58:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13624,7151,'es','Sopa sencilla de coco y frijoles','Esta comida vegetariana en un tazón muestra cómo se puede hacer algo delicioso a partir de ingredientes que se encuentran principalmente en las tiendas.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","½ manojo de cebolletas, las claras y las verdes separadas y cortadas en rodajas","1 pimiento rojo, cortado en cubitos","1 chile Scotch Bonnet, sin semillas y machacado hasta obtener una pasta","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 cucharadita de tomillo seco","1 cucharadita de curry en polvo mediano","1 cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica","3 tomates pera, picados","1 cubito de caldo de verduras","Lata de 410 g de frijoles, enjuagados y escurridos","Lata de 410 g de frijoles pintos, enjuagados y escurridos","Lata de 410 g de judías de ojo negro, enjuagadas y escurridas","2 latas de 400 g de leche de coco","jugo 2 limones"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande.\r\nChisporrotear las claras de cebolleta,\r\npimienta, pasta de chile y ajo para\r\n5-8 minutos hasta que esté suave y fragante.\r\nAñade el tomillo, el curry en polvo y\r\nespecias, luego cocine por 1 minuto más,\r\nAgregue los tomates y cocine durante\r\n2 minutos para que se ablande un poco.","Desmenuzar en la pastilla de caldo y luego\r\nAñade todos los frijoles y el coco.\r\nleche. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Apagar\r\nel fuego y agregue la mayor parte del\r\nhojas de cebolleta, el jugo de lima\r\ny algo de condimento. servir con un cucharón\r\ntazones y esparcir con el resto\r\ncebolletas justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13625,4813,'es','Batido de desayuno tropical','Comienza tu día con esta mezcla afrutada de maracuyá, mango, naranja y plátano. Es una buena fuente de vitamina C y también proporciona 1 de tus 5 al día.','["3 maracuyá","1 plátano, picado","1 mango pequeño, pelado, sin hueso y picado","300ml de zumo de naranja","cubitos de hielo"]','["Coloca la pulpa de las maracuyás en una licuadora y agrega el jugo de plátano, mango y naranja. Haga puré hasta que quede suave y bébalo inmediatamente, cubierto con cubitos de hielo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13626,7153,'es','nachos reggae reggae','Estos nachos agradan al público y son perfectos para compartir con amigos mientras toman un cóctel.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, picada","½ chile Scotch Bonnet, sin semillas y finamente picado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Botella ½ x 295g Levi Roots Love Apple Salsa de tomate o salsa de tomate con un buen chorrito Tabasco","½ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica","2 bolsas de 200 g de chips de tortilla","200 g de chiles jalapeños en rodajas","2 bolitas de 125 g de mozzarella, desmenuzadas","un puñado pequeño de cilantro picado","Tarrina de 230 g de guacamole fresco","½ bote de 300 ml de crema agria"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nCalentar el aceite en una sartén, luego\r\nablandar la cebolla y el chile por unos\r\nminutos. Agregue los tomates, el tomate\r\nsalsa y pimienta de Jamaica. Burbuja durante 1 min,\r\nluego retirar del fuego.","Tome una fuente grande para horno o\r\nplato y apile los chips de tortilla.\r\nCubrir con la salsa de tomate, luego\r\nespolvorear con los jalapeños en rodajas\r\ny muzzarella.","Colocar en el horno durante unos 15 minutos.\r\nhasta que el queso se derrita. Dispersión con\r\ncilantro. Servir con guacamole\r\ny crema agria al lado."]','2026-01-11 12:58:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13627,4363,'es','Jerk de batata y frijoles negros al curry','Sirva su curry de verduras al estilo caribeño, condimentado con tomillo, condimento picante y pimientos rojos; excelente con arroz y guisantes.','["2 cebollas, 1 cortada en cubitos y 1 picada en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","50 g de jengibre, picado en trozos grandes","manojo pequeño de cilantro, hojas y tallos separados","3 cucharadas de condimento Jerk","2 ramitas de tomillo","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","4 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","3 cucharadas de azúcar demerara","2 cubitos de caldo de verduras, desmenuzados","1 kg de batatas, peladas y cortadas en trozos","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, enjuagados y escurridos","Tarro de 450 g de pimientos rojos asados, cortados en rodajas gruesas"]','["Ablande suavemente la cebolla picada en el\r\nAceite de girasol en una sartén o cazuela grande.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los ingredientes aproximadamente\r\ncebolla picada, jengibre, tallos de cilantro\r\ny condimentos tipo Jerk con un\r\nlicuadora. Añadir a la cebolla blanda y sofreír.\r\nhasta que esté fragante. Agregue el tomillo picado\r\ntomates, vinagre, azúcar y cubitos de caldo\r\ncon 600ml de agua y llevar a fuego lento.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, luego agregue el\r\nbatatas y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos\r\nmás. Agregue los frijoles, los pimientos y un poco\r\nsazone y cocine a fuego lento durante otros 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que las patatas estén casi tiernas. genial\r\ny enfríe por hasta 2 días.","Para servir, calentar suavemente sobre la\r\nvitrocerámica. Pica la mayor parte del cilantro.\r\nhojas y revuelva, luego sirva esparcidas\r\ncon las hojas restantes."]','2026-01-11 12:58:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13628,7155,'es','Pollo agridulce','Pruebe una versión auténtica de este clásico plato chino para llevar, con dulzura natural y un cálido sabor a chile para darle sabor a las cosas.','["aceite de girasol o vegetal, para freír","100 ml de agua con gas, fría","140 g de harina con levadura","25 g de harina de maíz","4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en trozos","cebolletas, finamente ralladas, para servir","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y picado en trozos","3 chiles rojos, 1 cortado en trozos, 2 partidos por la mitad y sin semillas","Lata de 425 g de piña en trozos, escurrida y reservada el jugo","anís de 4 estrellas","50 g de pasta de tamarindo","100 g de azúcar en polvo","100 ml de vinagre de vino de arroz o vinagre chino"]','["Para la salsa, poner en una cacerola el pimiento rojo, los trozos de guindilla y el jugo de piña y llevar a ebullición. Tape y cocine durante 10 minutos, luego haga puré en un procesador de alimentos.","Regrese a la sartén con los trozos de piña, las mitades de chile, el anís estrellado, el tamarindo, el azúcar y el vinagre. Cocine a fuego lento durante 20-30 minutos hasta que se reduzca y esté pegajoso. Manténgalo caliente o recaliente para servir.","Llene una sartén grande de 1 cm de profundidad con aceite y caliéntela hasta que brille. Incorporar el agua con gas y 100 ml de agua fría a la harina con levadura con un poco de sal. Revuelve bien la masa.","Vierte la maicena en un plato, forra una bandeja con papel de cocina y enciende el horno a fuego lento. Espolvorea el pollo con harina de maíz y luego sumérgelo en la masa.","Uno a la vez, sumérjalos en el aceite caliente (alrededor de 5 a 6 por tanda). Suba el fuego para que el pollo siga friéndose, si es necesario, y cocine durante 5 a 6 minutos, volteándolo una vez.","Cuando esté cocido, escurrir en la bandeja y mantener caliente en el horno. Repita con el pollo restante.","Apilar en un plato con la salsa tibia a un lado y espolvorear con cebolletas ralladas."]','2026-01-11 12:58:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13629,7157,'es','Salsa Kung Pao','Prepara esta salsa originaria de Sichuan, China. Picante, dulce y picante con un toque de especia adormecedora procedente de los granos de pimienta de Sichuan, es delicioso combinado con pollo o gambas.','["1 cucharada de harina de maíz","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cucharada de ajo, finamente picado","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","½ cucharadita de granos de pimienta de Sichuan, tostados y molidos","2 chiles secos ''chao tian jiao''","1 cucharadita de salsa de chile y frijoles","1 cucharada de salsa hoisin","1 cucharada de salsa de tomate","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz negro Chinkiang","200 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo caliente"]','["Mezclar la harina de maíz con 2 cucharadas de agua en un bol y reservar. Calienta un wok a fuego medio. Una vez caliente, agregue el aceite, luego mezcle el ajo, el jengibre, la guindilla, los granos de pimienta de Sichuan y las guindillas secas. Freír durante unos segundos antes de agregar la salsa de chile, hoisin y ketchup. Una vez mezclado, vierte la salsa de soja, el vinagre y el caldo. Llevar a ebullición, luego rociar con la mezcla de harina de maíz y revolver bien. Retirar del fuego y verter en un recipiente resistente al calor. Deje enfriar y luego refrigere hasta que esté listo para usar. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:58:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13630,7159,'es','Salsa bang-bang','Utilice esta clásica salsa china dulce y picante para incorporarla a los fideos con pollo o a sus platos chinos favoritos. Combina bien con gambas, verduras fritas o tofu.','["1 diente de ajo rallado","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","1 chile rojo grande, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 pizca grande de granos de pimienta de Sichuan molidos","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní crujiente","½ tsp dark soy sauce","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera baja en sodio","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz negro","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo tostado","2 cucharadas de almíbar dorado"]','["Mezcla todos los ingredientes en una jarra grande y revuelve. Vierta 80 ml de agua caliente y bata bien para combinar. Sazone al gusto, agregando un poco más de azúcar o salsa de soja si es necesario. Úselo para aliñar pollo, gambas, verduras o tofu."]','2026-01-11 12:58:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13631,7161,'es','Tanghulu','Pruebe este clásico postre chino de bayas de espino o fruta bañadas en azúcar. Es crujiente, jugosa y fácil de hacer.','["300 g de fresas peladas","150 g de uvas, extraídas de la vid","350 g de azúcar blanca granulada","Brochetas de bambú de 18 cm o menos."]','["Lave la fruta y séquela bien. Enhebre la brocheta, alternando fresas y uvas, con una uva en cada extremo. Repita con la fruta restante y reserve.","Echar un poco de agua fría y hielo en un bol resistente al calor y engrasar ligeramente un plato o bandeja con un aceite neutro (como el de girasol) y reservar. Vierta el azúcar en una cacerola grande con 700 ml de agua. Deje hervir lentamente a fuego medio bajo, de 5 a 6 minutos, girando la sartén para asegurarse de que el azúcar se derrita de manera uniforme, pero no revuelva. Una vez derretido, déjelo burbujear durante 20-25 minutos, hasta que el almíbar se espese y se reduzca. Para probar, sumerja una brocheta en el almíbar y sumérjala inmediatamente en el agua helada; si se endurece y se agrieta, está lista.","Sumerja las brochetas de fruta preparadas en el almíbar con unas pinzas y luego inmediatamente en agua helada hasta que la capa exterior se endurezca. Transfiera a un plato o bandeja ligeramente engrasado. Asegúrate de reponer el hielo una vez derretido. Repita con las brochetas restantes. Si el almíbar de azúcar comienza a endurecerse en la sartén, vuelva a calentarlo suavemente; el truco consiste en hacerlo rápido."]','2026-01-11 12:58:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13632,7163,'es','estofado al estilo chino','Llene una olla con caldo, condimentado con pimienta de Sichuan y chile, luego invite a los invitados a escalfar los ingredientes que elijan: gambas, filete, tofu y pollo, todos funcionan bien.','["300 g de langostinos tigre, pelados y desvenados, sin cabeza ni cola","250 g de solomillo de ternera, sin exceso de grasa y cortado en rodajas finas","300 g de tofu ahumado, escurrido y cortado en cubos de 1 pulgada","300 g de filete de cerdo, sin tendones y en rodajas finas","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en tiras","300g de marisco variado (nosotros utilizamos vieiras, bolitas de pescado y anillas de calamar)","400 g de verduras variadas (nosotros utilizamos pak choi, col china, brócoli de tallo largo, zanahorias y pimientos rojos), picadas","300 g de champiñones variados (nosotros utilizamos ostra, castaña, botón, shiitake y hongo de oreja de madera), cortados por la mitad o cortados en trozos grandes","200 g de piel de tofu","400 g de fideos variados (nosotros usamos frijol mungo, fideos de arroz, fideos de huevo)","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","3-4 chiles largos secos ''chao tian jiao''","30 g de granos de pimienta de Sichuan","1 cucharada de salsa de chile y frijoles","1,7 l de caldo de pollo o de verduras, caliente","6 champiñones chinos secos","1 anís estrellado","un puñado pequeño de cáscara de mandarina seca (opcional)","50 ml de aceite de chile","5 cm de jengibre pelado y cortado en rodajas","½ col china, lavada, con las hojas separadas y cortada en trozos de 2,5 cm de grosor","3 cebolletas, cortadas en ángulo","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera baja en sodio","1 cucharada de salsa satay","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz negro","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo tostado","1 cucharadita de ajo machacado","1 cucharadita de jengibre rallado","1 cucharada de cilantro, finamente picado","2 cebolletas, finamente cortadas","1 yema de huevo (opcional)","1 cucharadita de semillas de sésamo blanco tostadas","1 cucharadita de ajo machacado","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera baja en sodio","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz negro","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo tostado"]','["Para hacer la base de la sopa, calienta un wok grande de 2 litros o una cacerola ancha y profunda a fuego alto y agrega el aceite. Agregue los chiles y los granos de pimienta de Sichuan y revuelva durante 5 segundos hasta que estén fragantes.","Agregue la salsa de chile y vierta el caldo. Agregue los champiñones chinos secos y el anís estrellado, la cáscara de mandarina seca (si se usa), luego vierta el aceite de chile, agregue el jengibre y deje hervir. Agregue el repollo chino y hierva durante 2 minutos antes de agregar las cebolletas.","Mezcle los ingredientes de ambas salsas en tazones separados y reserve.","Instale una placa de inducción eléctrica en el centro de su mesa de comedor y rodéela con platos con los ingredientes crudos que elija. Pon a hervir a fuego lento el wok lleno de caldo.","Cada uno puede añadir sus ingredientes a cocinar en el caldo y utilizar una cuchara de metal con alambre para pescarlos. Cocine los mariscos, el pollo y el cerdo hasta que estén completamente opacos y las verduras se pueden cocinar al gusto. Sirva con las salsas para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:58:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13633,7165,'es','Arroz frito con huevos dorados y cebolla','El tono dorado de los huevos revueltos y la cebolla asada en este plato simboliza la riqueza para el Año Nuevo Lunar. Cubra con aceite de chile crujiente para darle más sabor.','["300 g de arroz de grano largo cocido","2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo tostado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","3 huevos batidos","1 cebolla pequeña, picada en trozos grandes","½ tsp dark soy sauce","pizca de pimienta blanca molida","1 cebolla tierna, finamente cortada","1 cucharadita de aceite de chile crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Vierta el arroz cocido en un tazón y revuelva con 1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo. Coloque el chile en un tazón pequeño y revuelva con 2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera.","Calienta un wok a fuego alto y agrega la mitad del aceite de colza. Agregue una pizca de sal y luego vierta los huevos, revolviendo rápidamente para revolver durante unos 30 segundos. Retirar con una espumadera y reservar.","Regrese el wok al fuego y agregue el aceite de colza restante, caliéntelo durante 20 segundos. Agrega la cebolla y revuelve constantemente durante poco menos de un minuto hasta que esté dorada. Incorpora el arroz hasta que se desintegre. Sazone con salsa de soja oscura y revuelva bien. Vuelva a colocar los trozos de huevo revuelto en el wok y revuelva. Vierta el resto de la salsa de soja ligera, el aceite de sésamo y la pimienta blanca. Espolvorea sobre las cebolletas. Para servir, decore con el chile rojo aderezado y aceite de chile crujiente, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13634,7167,'es','es huevo foo','Disfruta de una versión de huevos revueltos chinos. Se prepara en solo 10 minutos y puedes agregar la proteína que elijas: gambas, pollo, tofu o cerdo char siu.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de maní","150 g de proteína de su elección, como langostinos crudos (sin cáscara y sin venas) o pollo cocido, cerdo char siu cocido o tofu prefrito, cortado en trozos pequeños","1 cebolla blanca pequeña, cortada en tiras","40 g de champiñones en rodajas","40 g de guisantes","¼ cucharadita de pimienta blanca","4 huevos batidos"]','["Calienta a fuego medio-alto. Una vez caliente, vierte el aceite, luego agrega la proteína de tu elección y extiéndela por el fondo del wok. Cuando comience a dorarse, agregue la cebolla en rodajas y continúe cocinando durante 1-2 minutos, revolviendo regularmente, para que se ablande un poco. Vierta los champiñones y revuelva.","Cuando los champiñones hayan empezado a ablandarse, añade los guisantes junto con la pimienta blanca y ½ cucharadita de sal. Sofría durante 1 minuto, luego agregue los huevos batidos. Trate de no revolver los huevos; en su lugar, tome el wok y agite los huevos con el resto de los ingredientes. Una vez que comiencen a cuajar, incorpórelos lentamente al resto del plato. Retirar del fuego tan pronto como los huevos estén casi cocidos por completo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13635,5445,'es','Chow mein de ternera saludable','Cambie su comida para llevar semanal por este saludable chow mein de carne: es rápido de cocinar y bajo en grasas y calorías.','["2 nidos de fideos integrales (85g)","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza o sésamo","200 g de filete magro, sin grasa y cortado en tiras","1 cebolla morada pequeña (100 g), finamente picada","15 g de jengibre pelado y finamente picado","160 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas gruesas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","160 g de brotes de soja listos para comer","1½ cucharadita de tamari","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz integral","4 cebolletas (65 g), cortadas en trozos diagonales"]','["Cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén y sofríe la carne a fuego alto durante 30 segundos hasta que se dore. Vierta sobre un plato, reserve y luego agregue el aceite restante al wok. Sofríe la cebolla y el jengibre hasta que se ablanden. Agregue una gota de agua para evitar que se queme, si es necesario y cocine tapado durante 2-3 minutos.","Agregue los champiñones y el ajo y fría hasta que comiencen a ablandarse (alrededor de 3 minutos), luego agregue los brotes de soja y cocine por uno o dos minutos más hasta que estén bien calientes.","Mezcle el tamari y el vinagre en un tazón pequeño con 2 cucharadas de agua. Agrega los fideos escurridos al wok, revuelve bien, luego agrega la mezcla de tamari, las cebolletas y la carne. Sofría durante unos minutos hasta que esté completamente caliente. Sazona con abundante pimienta negra y sirve."]','2026-01-11 12:58:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13636,4527,'es','Arroz frito en el frigorífico','Incluye verduras con este saludable arroz frito con pollo, que utiliza alimentos cotidianos que encontrarás en el refrigerador para una cena familiar rápida y fácil.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla blanca, finamente picada","1 zanahoria, finamente picada","100 g de judías verdes picadas","1 pimiento rojo o amarillo, finamente picado","½ brócoli mediano, picado en floretes pequeños","150 g de pollo cocido (o cualquier otra carne), picado en trozos grandes","300 g de arroz cocido frío","2 huevos batidos","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharada de salsa de ostras","1 cebolla tierna, cortada finamente","1 cucharadita de semillas de sésamo tostadas"]','["Calienta la mitad del aceite vegetal en una sartén awokor a fuego medio-alto y sofríe las cebollas, las zanahorias y las judías verdes durante 5 minutos. Agrega los pimientos, el brócoli y el pollo y sofríe durante 3 minutos más.","Vierta el arroz y saltee durante otros 4 minutos hasta que todos los granos de arroz se hayan separado. Empuje el arroz y las verduras a un lado, luego agregue el aceite vegetal restante al otro. Rompe el huevo y revuelve brevemente antes de agregarlo a la mezcla de verduras y pollo.","Agregue el aceite de sésamo y la salsa de ostras para cubrir, luego decore con las cebolletas y las semillas de sésamo."]','2026-01-11 12:58:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13637,5780,'es','Olla caliente de costillas pegajosas','Combine costillas pegajosas y una olla caliente para hacer esta fabulosa cazuela de tamaño familiar. Está lleno de sabor, con costillas de cerdo, boniato, pimientos rojos y tirabeques.','["3 cucharadas de salsa Lee Kum Kee Hoisin","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja oscura premium Lee Kum Kee","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz sazonado Lee Kum Kee","3 cucharadas de caldo de pollo sin sal o agua (opcional, ver consejo)","500-600 g de costillas de cerdo, cortadas en costillas individuales","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo para wok Lee Kum Kee","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","4 cebolletas, cortadas en trozos largos, las puntas verdes finamente cortadas para servir","1 pimiento rojo, cortado en trozos","1 batata pequeña, cortada en trozos","100 g de tirabeques cortados en tiras"]','["Combine la salsa Hoisin, la salsa de soja oscura premium, el vinagre de arroz sazonado y el caldo de pollo o agua en un tazón, luego agregue las costillas. Deje marinar durante al menos 30 minutos; si lo desea, puede guardar las costillas en el refrigerador durante la noche.","Calienta el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 3. Escurre bien las costillas (reserva la marinada) y agrega la harina de maíz. Calentar el aceite de sésamo para wok, luego agregar las costillas, el ajo, el jengibre y la cebolleta y sofreír hasta que las costillas estén doradas, con cuidado de no quemar el ajo. Sazone bien. Añade el resto de la marinada junto con 100 ml de agua y deja hervir. Vierta la mezcla en una cazuela y luego agregue el pimiento rojo y la batata. Cubra con una tapa hermética. Coloque un trozo de pergamino debajo de la tapa si no está bien ajustada; esto ayudará a sellar el vapor.","Cocine en el horno durante 50 minutos, luego agregue los tirabeques y cocine por 10 minutos más. Espolvoree sobre la cebolleta restante para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:58:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13638,7169,'es','Arroz frito con piña','Agrega trozos de piña fresca al arroz frito para transformarlo en algo especial. Sirva solo para una cena familiar o como parte de un banquete chino.','["1½ cucharada de aceite de girasol o vegetal","2 huevos batidos","2 dientes de ajo machacados","manojo pequeño de cebolletas, picadas","1⁄2 cucharadita de cinco especias chinas en polvo","400 g de arroz de grano largo cocido","85 g de guisantes congelados","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja baja en sal","400 g de piña fresca, cortada en trozos grandes (aproximadamente 1⁄2 piña mediana)"]','["1 Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en un wok. Agrega los huevos, girándolos por los lados, para hacer una tortilla fina. Una vez cocida, enrolle la tortilla sobre una tabla de cortar y córtela en tiras.","Calienta el aceite restante. Agrega el ajo, la cebolla y las cinco especias. Sofría hasta que chisporrotee, luego agregue el arroz (si usa bolsitas, exprímalas primero para separar los granos), los guisantes, el aceite de sésamo y la soja. Cocine a fuego alto hasta que el arroz esté caliente, luego revuelva con la piña y las cintas de tortilla."]','2026-01-11 12:58:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13639,7171,'es','Ternera con tirabeques y anacardos','Enciende tu wok para preparar esta rápida carne china con tirabeques y anacardos. Un platillo rico para toda la familia, solo toma 15 minutos prepararlo','["50 g de anacardos sin sal","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","1½ cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal","4 cucharadas de salsa de ostras","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","1 cucharada de miel","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o vegetal","280 g de filete de lomo, en rodajas finas","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y cortado en palitos"]','["Tuesta los anacardos en un wok seco o en una sartén, revolviendo, hasta que se doren. Vierta sobre un plato y reserve. Mezcla la harina de maíz con la salsa de soja hasta formar una pasta, luego agrega la salsa de ostras, el vinagre y la miel. Cuando estés listo para cocinar, ten todos los ingredientes preparados y a mano; solo te llevará 5 minutos.","Calienta el wok hasta que esté muy caliente. Agregue el aceite, gírelo para cubrir la base de la sartén, luego use unas pinzas para colocar los trozos de carne en el wok en una sola capa. Cocine sin voltear durante 30 segundos a 1 minuto, hasta que comience a formarse una costra oscura en la carne. Agrega el jengibre y el ajo, revuelve todo rápidamente, luego agrega el tirabeque y la salsa. Cocine por otros 30 segundos o 1 minuto hasta que la carne esté bien cocida y la salsa esté espesa y brillante. Espolvorea sobre los anacardos y sirve con arroz o fideos."]','2026-01-11 12:58:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13640,7173,'es','Tofu con sal y pimienta','Utilice ambos tipos de granos de pimienta para nuestro tofu con sal y pimienta, si puede, para darle un hormigueo en la lengua y un calor picante. El plato es fantástico para un banquete chino.','["Paquete de 396 g de tofu firme","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de granos de pimienta de Sichuan o negra (o una mezcla de ambas), molidos hasta obtener un polvo","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o vegetal","2 pimientos rojos, rebanados","¼ de cabeza de brócoli, cortada en floretes muy pequeños","100 g de brotes de soja","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja baja en sal","aceite de sésamo, para rociar","un puñado de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Escurre el tofu, envuélvelo sin apretar en papel de cocina y colócalo en un plato. Coloca una tabla de cortar encima. Si utiliza una tabla de cortar liviana, pésela con un par de latas; una tabla de cortar más pesada será suficiente por sí sola. Déjelo durante 10 a 20 minutos hasta que el paño se sienta mojado por el exceso de líquido. Presionar el tofu de esta manera ayuda a darle una textura más firme una vez cocido.","Corta el tofu por la mitad por el centro como si fuera un libro. Corta cada pieza en cuatro triángulos, como lo harías con una tostada, luego nuevamente por la mitad para obtener 16 piezas en total. Mezcle la harina de maíz, la pimienta molida y 1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas en un plato. Voltee suavemente cada trozo de tofu en la mezcla de harina de maíz para cubrirlo.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en un wok. Sofríe los pimientos y el brócoli durante unos minutos, para que se ablanden un poco. Agrega los brotes de soja y la salsa de soja. Cocine por otros 1-2 minutos, asegurándose de que las verduras todavía estén crujientes. Rociar con un poco de aceite de sésamo.","Calienta el aceite de girasol restante en una sartén antiadherente grande y fríe el tofu rebozado durante 5 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté crujiente. Sirva encima de las verduras, espolvoreadas con el cilantro."]','2026-01-11 12:58:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13641,7175,'es','Gambones con miel, sésamo y naranja','Disfruta de nuestros langostinos con miel, sésamo y naranja como parte de un festín chino que encantará a toda la familia. Cubra con cebolletas y sirva con arroz.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","1 naranja grande, rallada y en jugo","3 cucharadas de miel","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja baja en sal","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","una pizca generosa de polvo de cinco especias chinas","300 g de langostinos crudos","3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o vegetal","1 diente de ajo, en rodajas finas","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","200 g de arroz de grano largo, cocido, para servir"]','["Mezcle el aceite, la ralladura y el jugo de naranja, la miel, la soja y el vinagre en un bol, luego combine la harina de maíz, las semillas de sésamo, las cinco especias y una pizca de sal en otro bol. Pasa un cuchillo pequeño por la parte posterior de cada langostino, para que salgan como mariposas mientras se cocinan, lo que ayudará a que se adhiera más salsa.","Pasa los langostinos por la mezcla de harina de maíz. Calienta el aceite en un wok o sartén grande. Cuando esté bien caliente añadimos el ajo. Chisporrotee durante 10 segundos, pero no deje que se dore. Añade las gambas y la harina y las semillas que queden en el bol. Sofreímos a fuego fuerte unos minutos, hasta que las gambas estén rosadas y las semillas de sésamo doradas. Coloca las gambas en un plato y vierte la mezcla de salsa en el wok. Burbujee durante unos minutos hasta que espese. Vuelva a agregar los langostinos al wok y revuelva para cubrirlos con la salsa. Calienta durante otros 30 segundos. Cubra con cebolletas y sirva con arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:58:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13642,7177,'es','Galletas de la fortuna de chocolate blanco','Hornea estas galletas de la fortuna caseras para Nochevieja. Si bien requieren un poco de esfuerzo, mantendrán entretenidos a los entusiastas cocineros de la familia y los resultados son realmente impresionantes.','["2 claras de huevo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","3 cucharadas de aceite de semilla de uva","100 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","150 g de chocolate blanco, picado","chispitas, para decorar"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forra una bandeja para hornear grande con una bandeja para hornear de silicona. Escribe la fortuna en trozos de papel blanco de 6 cm de largo por 1 cm de ancho.","Con una batidora eléctrica, bata las claras, la vainilla y el aceite con ½ cucharada de agua fría hasta que estén espumosas, aproximadamente 30 segundos. Poner en un bol la harina, la maicena, el azúcar y una buena pizca de sal, luego verter en un colador y tamizar con la mezcla de clara de huevo. Batir hasta obtener una masa suave y enfriar durante 1 hora.","Coloque ½ cucharada de la mezcla en la bandeja para hornear preparada. Con una espátula pequeña, empuje la mezcla hasta formar un círculo fino de 8 cm. Repita con otra ½ cucharada de la mezcla para hacer dos galletas, espaciándolas bien para que se esparzan. Hornea dos galletas a la vez, ya que tendrás que darles forma mientras estén calientes. Hornee durante 8 minutos hasta que los bordes se doren.","Con una espátula, levante las galletas una a la vez sobre una tabla y voltéelas. Coloque una fortuna en el medio del círculo, luego dóblelo por la mitad, juntando los dos bordes para sellar. Levante la galleta sobre el borde de una taza o sartén y tire muy suavemente de las dos esquinas hacia abajo para darle forma. Mantenga durante 10 segundos, luego transfiera las galletas a moldes para muffins para que mantengan su forma mientras se enfrían y fraguan. Repita con la mezcla de galletas restante.","Derrita el chocolate blanco en el microondas o en un recipiente colocado sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Vierta las chispas en tazones pequeños y profundos. Sumerja los dos extremos de cada galleta en el chocolate, sacuda el exceso y luego sumérjalos en las chispas. Dejar secar sobre una tabla. Se conservará durante tres días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:58:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13643,4211,'es','Carne fácil en salsa de frijoles negros','Pruebe este sencillo salteado con filete tierno, pimientos, jengibre, chile y ajo. Opte por una salsa de frijoles negros de buena calidad: marcará la diferencia','["2 filetes de grupa de 250 g","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo","1 cebolla blanca grande, cortada en gajos finos","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo gordos, machacados","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y rallado","1-2 chiles rojos, finamente picados","5 cucharadas de salsa de frijoles negros","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino de arroz","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","arroz pegajoso, para servir","hojas de cilantro, para servir (opcional)"]','["Retire la capa gruesa de grasa que corre por los lados de los filetes y deséchela. Corta el filete en tiras largas de 1 cm de grosor y mézclalo con la harina de maíz y un poco de condimento.","Caliente el aceite en una sartén grande o en un wok a fuego alto, luego agregue el bistec y fríalo durante 3-5 minutos o hasta que esté dorado por fuera. Retirar con una espumadera y transferir a un plato.","Agrega la cebolla y los pimientos a la sartén y sofríe durante 6-7 minutos o hasta que comiencen a ablandarse. Agregue el ajo, el jengibre y la guindilla y cocine por un minuto más. Regrese la carne a la sartén y revuelva con la salsa de frijoles negros, el vinagre de vino de arroz, el azúcar y 2 cucharadas de agua para que se afloje un poco. Llevar a fuego lento y luego retirar del fuego.","Sirva el salteado en tazones hondos con montones de arroz pegajoso y cubra con cilantro, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:58:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13644,7179,'es','Aceite de jengibre y chile','Agregamos chile a este acompañamiento tradicional para darle un poco más de picante. Sirva con algunas verduras chinas salteadas y nuestro pollo cristal en una olla.','["partes blancas de un manojo de cebolletas","un trozo grande de jengibre","chile rojo entero","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal"]','["Pique finamente las cebolletas, un trozo grande de jengibre y un chile rojo entero y viértalos en un plato pequeño. Calienta 3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal hasta que esté humeante, luego viértelo en el plato y déjalo chisporrotear. Se puede preparar con un día de antelación cubierto con film transparente."]','2026-01-11 12:58:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13645,7181,'es','Salteado picante de cerdo y pimientos','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). Un plato fresco y sencillo con un toque refrescante de lima, y ​​además es súper saludable. Entonces, ¿qué es lo que no te encanta?','["100 g de arroz jazmín tailandés","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol","250 g de filete de cerdo, cortado en tiras del ancho de un dedo","1 pimiento rojo y 1 amarillo, sin semillas y en rodajas","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","2 tsp soy sauce","jugo 1 lima","2 cucharadas de miel clara","½ chile rojo, en rodajas"]','["Coloca el arroz en una cacerola con 300ml de agua hirviendo. Llevar a ebullición, revolver una vez, tapar y reducir el fuego a bajo. Cocine durante 15 minutos, momento en el que el arroz debería haber absorbido todo el líquido y estar perfectamente cocido. Freír en seco las semillas de sésamo hasta que estén doradas, luego verterlas en un tazón pequeño y reservar.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente o en un wok, agrega la carne de cerdo y los pimientos y sofríe durante 5-6 minutos a fuego alto hasta que la carne de cerdo esté ligeramente dorada y bien cocida. Mezcle la harina de maíz y la salsa de soja en un bol, luego agregue el jugo de lima, la miel, la guindilla y las semillas de sésamo, además de 6 cucharadas de agua fría. Vierta en el wok y cocine hasta que la salsa se espese un poco, revolviendo la sartén para cubrir la carne de cerdo y los pimientos. Servir con el arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13646,7183,'es','Cerdo salteado con jengibre y miel','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Este saludable plato de fideos es deliciosamente bajo en grasa y con una excelente mezcla de sabores asiáticos: la cena perfecta entre semana.','["2 nidos de tallarines al huevo medianos","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de miel","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","250 g/9 oz de lomo de cerdo, cortado en trozos pequeños","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y en rodajas","100g come de todo","1 cucharadita de semillas de sésamo"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola con agua con sal y cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, mezcle la harina de maíz con 1 cucharada de agua, luego agregue la salsa de soja y la miel y reserve.","Calienta el aceite en un wok a fuego alto. Agregue la carne de cerdo y cocine por 2 minutos hasta que se dore por completo. Agregue el jengibre, el ajo, la pimienta y los tirabeques y cocine por 2 minutos más. Reduzca el fuego, luego agregue la mezcla de soja y miel, revolviendo y cocinando hasta que la salsa burbujee y espese. Divida los fideos escurridos en 2 tazones. Cubra con la carne de cerdo y las verduras y termine con una pizca de semillas de sésamo."]','2026-01-11 12:59:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13647,7185,'es','col rizada al estilo chino','Dale un toque asiático a un buen favorito británico con unos simples batidos de las salsas adecuadas','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 diente de ajo grande, rebanado","Bolsa de 200 g de col rizada.","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de salsa de ostras"]','["Calienta el aceite en un wok grande o en una sartén, luego agrega el ajo y cocina por unos segundos. Eche la col rizada y revuélvala en la sartén para cubrirla con el aceite con ajo.","Vierta 100 ml de agua hirviendo y cocine durante 7 minutos más hasta que la col rizada se ablande y esté bien cocida.","Agregue las salsas de soja y ostras y caliente para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13648,7187,'es','Panceta de cerdo con jengibre estofado rojo y chiles encurtidos','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. El vinagre negro chino malteado es una excelente base para una olla cocinada a fuego lento con jengibre, chile y un corte de carne económico.','["2½ kg de panceta de cerdo, sin piel y cortada en trozos de 5 cm","1 cucharada de salsa de soja oscura","200 ml de vino de arroz Shaohsing","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, cortado en palitos","pizca de hojuelas de chile","100 ml de vinagre negro chino (disponible en Waitrose)","140 g de azúcar moreno blando","700 ml de caldo de verduras","semillas de sésamo tostadas","cebolletas en rodajas","2 chiles rojos, cortados en rodajas y remojados en vinagre de vino de arroz durante 1 hora, luego escurridos","arroz blanco al vapor"]','["Mezcle la carne de cerdo con la soja y 1 cucharada de vino de arroz. Dejar reposar 1 hora o, mejor aún, toda la noche en el frigorífico.","Calienta un poco de aceite en una cacerola de base mediana y pesada. Dorar la carne, en tandas, por ambos lados y reservar. Agrega un poco más de aceite y cocina el ajo, el jengibre y la guindilla durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén dorados.","Vierta el vinagre, el vino de arroz restante, el azúcar y el caldo en la cacerola y deje hervir. Agrega la carne de cerdo, luego baja el fuego, tapa y cocina a fuego lento durante 2 horas o hasta que la carne esté tierna. Durante los últimos 30 minutos, retira la tapa, aumenta el fuego y deja que el líquido se reduzca hasta que esté espeso y almibarado. Sirva espolvoreado con semillas de sésamo, cebolletas y chiles en rodajas, con arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13649,7189,'es','Cerdo hoisin con ajo y jengibre','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Marina los filetes de lomo magro con salsa china y luego sírvelos con abundante repollo bok choi para una cena saludable.','["500 g de lomo de cerdo cortado en rodajas de 2 cm de grosor","4 cucharadas de salsa hoisin","1 cucharada de salsa de soja ligera, más un chorrito","350 g de brócoli de tallo fino","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","Jengibre en trozos de 5 cm, rallado","1 manojo de cebolleta, cortada por la mitad a lo largo","350 g de bok choi, cortado por la mitad a lo largo","arroz o fideos, para servir (opcional)"]','["Ponga la carne de cerdo, el hoisin y la salsa de soja en un bol y déjela reposar durante 10 minutos. Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto, sacude el exceso de salsa y luego coloca la carne de cerdo en una bandeja. Ase durante 5 minutos, volteando hasta la mitad, hasta que esté bien cocido. Retirar y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 5 minutos.","Mientras tanto, coloque el brócoli en un recipiente apto para microondas con 4 cucharadas de agua, cúbralo con film transparente y luego cocínelo en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 3 minutos. Calentar el aceite en un wok, añadir el ajo y el jengibre y sofreír durante 1 min. Añade las cebolletas y el bok choi y sofríe durante 2 minutos más. Agregue el brócoli con una pizca de salsa de soja y saltee durante 1 o 2 minutos más hasta que las verduras estén bien calientes. Sirva la carne de cerdo con las verduras, un chorrito de los jugos de carne de cerdo reposados ​​y arroz o fideos, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13650,7191,'es','Albóndigas de cerdo orientales en caldo hoisin','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Bajas en calorías y económicas de preparar, estas albóndigas con sabor chino se sirven en un caldo claro y nutritivo con muchas verduras.','["Paquete de 500 g de carne magra de cerdo picada","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de polvo de cinco especias chinas","Lata de 225 g de castañas de agua, escurridas, la mitad finamente picadas y la mitad en rodajas","500 ml de caldo de pollo","3 cucharadas de salsa hoisin","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","2 zanahorias grandes, cortadas en tiras con un pelador de patatas","8 hojas chinas, parte gruesa cortada en rodajas y hojas ralladas","Paquete de 300 g de brotes de soja.","manojo de cebolletas, cortadas en trozos largos, además de algunas puntas picadas para servir"]','["Vierta la carne picada en un bol con la soja, la harina de maíz, las cinco especias, las castañas de agua picadas y un poco de pimienta negra. Trabaja todo junto y luego forma 12 albóndigas.","Vierta el caldo en una cacerola ancha y profunda y agregue el hoisin y el jengibre. Añade las albóndigas, tapa y pocha durante 5 minutos. Agregue las zanahorias, las hojas chinas, los brotes de soja, las cebolletas y las castañas en rodajas, luego tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Sirva en tazones y luego sirva espolvoreado con la parte superior de cebolleta."]','2026-01-11 12:59:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13651,7193,'es','Salteado de cerdo, judías verdes y ostras','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). Un rico plato asiático de fideos o arroz que está listo en 20 minutos: una cena familiar saludable entre semana.','["1 cucharada de jugo de lima","1 cucharada de pasta de chiles o salsa de chiles","75 ml de salsa de ostras","1 tsp soy sauce","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","400 g de filete de cerdo cortado en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cebolla morada, cortada en trozos grandes","140 g de judías verdes partidas por la mitad","arroz o fideos al vapor, para servir"]','["En un tazón pequeño, mezcle el jugo de limón, la pasta de chile, la salsa de ostras y la mitad de la salsa de soja. Dejar de lado. Calienta un wok grande con 1 cucharada de aceite. Sazone la carne de cerdo y mezcle con la salsa de soja restante. Dorar la carne rápidamente y luego retirar de la sartén.","Agrega el aceite restante y sofríe el ajo, la cebolla y los frijoles durante 2 minutos. Regrese la carne a la sartén con la salsa y saltee durante otros 3 minutos, hasta que la salsa espese. Sirva con arroz o fideos al vapor."]','2026-01-11 12:59:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13652,7195,'es','Cerdo estofado chino con cebolletas dobles','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Use cebolletas como verdura por derecho propio en este plato de cerdo cocido a fuego lento.','["4 piezas de osobuco de cerdo (aproximadamente 850 kg/1 lb 14 oz) o el equivalente a paleta de cerdo","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","250 ml de vino de arroz Shaohsing o jerez seco","100 g de jengibre, finamente cortado","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","12 cebolletas, 8 gordas y 4 más finas","1 chile rojo seco (busque chiles de Cachemira para obtener un buen sabor)","500 ml de caldo de pollo o verduras","1 cucharada de pasta de miso (opcional)","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","arroz al vapor y bok choi, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nDorar la carne de cerdo por ambos lados en el aceite,\r\nluego transfiéralo a una cacerola grande.\r\nDesglasa la sartén que usaste para dorar.\r\ncon el vino de arroz o Jerez y añadirlo a\r\nla cazuela. Agrega el jengibre y el ajo.\r\nCorta los extremos de las 8 cebolletas gordas.\r\ny agréguelos a la sartén enteros\r\ncon chile, caldo, pasta de miso (si se usa)\r\ny salsa de soja. Lleva todo a un\r\ncocine a fuego lento, luego tape y ponga la cazuela\r\nen el horno por 2 hrs.","Retire la tapa de la cacerola y\r\ncocine por 20 minutos más. Picar el\r\n4 cebolletas más finas y añadirlas a\r\nla cazuela justo antes de servir con\r\narroz al vapor y bok choi."]','2026-01-11 12:59:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13653,7198,'es','Cerdo estofado con ciruelas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Carne tierna y derretida en una salsa picante y afrutada, esta comida seguramente impresionará','["aproximadamente 1,6 kg/3 lb 8 oz de paleta de cerdo","5 cucharadas de vino de arroz","5 cucharadas de salsa de soja clara para darle sabor, 1 cucharada de salsa oscura para darle color","Un trozo generoso del tamaño de un pulgar y raíz de jengibre fresco.","5 dientes de ajo","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","manojo de cebolletas, cortadas finamente","anís de 2 estrellas","1 ½ cucharadita de polvo de cinco especias","1 rama de canela","2 cucharadas de azúcar, cualquier tipo","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","500 ml de caldo de pollo","6 ciruelas maduras, partidas por la mitad y sin hueso"]','["Corta la carne de cerdo en trozos grandes del largo de tu pulgar y el doble de ancho. Poner en un bol o bolsa de comida y añadir el vino, las salsas de soja, la mitad del jengibre, la mitad del ajo y la mitad de la guindilla. Marinar durante al menos 1 hora o hasta 24 horas.","Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3, luego calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande. Agregue la mitad de las cebolletas, el jengibre y el ajo restantes, el anís estrellado, las cinco especias en polvo y la canela. Freír suavemente hasta que estén fragantes y suaves. Agregue el azúcar, suba el fuego, luego levante la carne de cerdo de la marinada y agregue la mezcla de cebolla durante unos 3 minutos hasta que la carne esté sellada pero no dorada. Vierta la marinada, el puré de tomate y el caldo, revuelva, cubra y luego cocine a fuego lento en el horno durante 2 horas.","Después de que pase la primera hora, agregue las ciruelas a la sartén. Quitar la tapa y seguir cocinando sin tapar. La carne debe estar completamente tierna y dorarse donde rompe la superficie de la salsa. Retire el exceso de grasa de la superficie con una cuchara y luego saque con cuidado la carne y las ciruelas de la sartén con una espumadera. Sube el fuego y hierve la salsa durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que se reduzca y quede ligeramente almibarada. Regrese todo a la sartén, caliéntelo suavemente y luego esparza el resto de las cebolletas por encima para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13654,7200,'es','Cerdo chino crujiente','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. La panza es el asado de cerdo más barato y, como es rica, con un poco es suficiente, lo que la hace perfecta para los domingos y cenas.','["Pieza de 1,3 kg de panceta de cerdo deshuesada, con piel y rayada, pedir al carnicero el extremo fino","2 cucharaditas de polvo de cinco especias chinas","4 cucharadas de salsa de soja (nosotros usamos Kikkoman)","Jengibre de raíz fresca en trozos pequeños, rallado","1 cucharada de salsa de chile dulce tailandesa","1 cebolla tierna, finamente picada"]','["Frote la carne de cerdo con las cinco especias y 2 cucharaditas de sal marina y luego déjela descubierta en el frigorífico durante al menos 2 horas, pero preferiblemente durante la noche. Cuando esté listo para cocinar, caliente el horno a su máxima potencia. Coloque la carne de cerdo sobre una rejilla sobre una fuente para asar, asegurándose de que la piel quede expuesta. Ase durante 10 minutos antes de bajar el fuego a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4, luego déjelo cocinar durante 1½ horas más. Eche un vistazo a la carne de cerdo: si la piel no está crujiente, suba el fuego a 220 °C/ventilador 200 °C/gas 7, luego cocine por otros 30 minutos hasta que esté crujiente. Dejar reposar sobre una tabla durante al menos 10 min.","Para hacer la salsa, mezcle todos los ingredientes con 2 cucharadas de agua. Corta la carne de cerdo en trozos pequeños y luego sírvela con la salsa, además de arroz hervido y verduras al vapor, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13655,7202,'es','Wontons de cerdo y gambas al vapor','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Baja en grasa pero muy impresionante: puedes encontrar los envoltorios en los congeladores de las tiendas de alimentos asiáticos o en las salas de comidas especializadas.','["175 g de carne de cerdo picada","85 g de gambas peladas, descongeladas si están congeladas y finamente picadas","2 cebolletas, picadas pequeñas","2 dientes de ajo gordos, machacados","2 cucharaditas de raíz de jengibre rallado o puré","2 cucharadas de salsa de ostras","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","5 castañas de agua (de lata), escurridas y finamente picadas","unos 36 envoltorios de wonton, de 9 cm cuadrados, descongelados si están congelados","hojas grandes de lechuga o papel para hornear, para cocinar al vapor","2 tbp soy sauce","2 cucharadas de jerez seco","2 cucharaditas de raíz de jengibre fresco rallado o puré","trozos de cebolleta o semillas de sésamo, para decorar"]','["Mezclar la carne de cerdo, las gambas, las cebolletas, el ajo, el jengibre, la salsa de ostras, el aceite y las castañas de agua.","Retire una envoltura de wonton y, con una brocha de repostería, cepille ligeramente el exterior con agua fría. Coloque 1 cucharadita de mezcla en el centro y apriétela formando una bolsa, apretando para sellar. No llene demasiado. Repita hasta que tenga alrededor de 35-40. (Se pueden enfriar hasta por 1 hora en una bandeja forrada con papel para hornear).","Para la salsa, mezcle la salsa de soja, el jerez y el jengibre en un tazón pequeño. Para cocinar al vapor, hierva una cacerola grande con agua. Forre una canasta humeante de bambú o metal con hojas de lechuga para que quepan.","Coloca la mitad de las bolsitas en la cesta (sin que se toquen), tapa y cocina al vapor durante 5 minutos. Retirar con unas pinzas a un plato y cocinar el resto al vapor; comprobar el nivel del agua. Sirva, espolvoreado con cebolleta o semillas de sésamo, junto con el plato de salsa."]','2026-01-11 12:59:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13656,7204,'es','Carne de res salteada con salsa de ostras','Marina rebanadas de filete de carne magra y luego fríelas con trozos de pimiento rojo y una salsa sabrosa en este clásico plato chino.','["450 g de filete magro de ternera","1 cucharada de salsa de soja ligera","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharada de vino de arroz Shaoxing o jerez seco","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","3 cucharadas de aceite de maní","1 pimiento rojo, cortado en dados gruesos","1 pimiento verde, cortado en dados gruesos","3 cucharadas de salsa de ostras","2 cebolletas, finamente ralladas, para decorar"]','["Cortar la carne en rodajas de 5 cm de largo y 5 mm de grosor, cortando a contrapelo de la carne. Ponlos en un bol. Incorpora la salsa de soja, el aceite de sésamo, el vino de arroz o el jerez y la harina de maíz. Dejar marinar durante 20 min.","Calienta un wok hasta que esté muy caliente, luego agrega el aceite de maní. Cuando esté ligeramente humeante, agregue las rodajas de carne y saltee durante 5 minutos o hasta que estén ligeramente doradas. Retire la carne del wok y escúrrala bien en un colador colocado dentro de un bol. Deseche el aceite drenado.","Limpia el wok y vuelve a calentarlo a fuego alto. Agrega los pimientos y cocina durante 3-4 minutos o hasta que se ablanden. Añade la salsa de ostras y deja que hierva a fuego lento. Devuelva las rodajas de carne escurridas al wok y mézclelas bien con la salsa de ostras. Coloque la mezcla en una fuente para servir, cubra con las cebolletas y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13657,7206,'es','chow mein','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). Un plato chino clásico de fideos de huevo salteados con pechuga de pollo desmenuzada; experimente con diferentes pescados, carnes o verduras.','["225 g de fideos al huevo frescos o secos","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo, más 1 cucharadita","100 g de pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en tiras finas","2½ cucharadas de aceite de maní","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","50 g de tirabeques, finamente rallado","50 g de jamón de Parma o jamón cocido, finamente rallado","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja ligera","2 tsp dark soy sauce","1 cucharada de vino de arroz Shaoxing o jerez seco","½ cucharadita de pimienta blanca recién molida","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja ligera","2 cucharaditas de vino de arroz Shaoxing o jerez seco","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","½ cucharadita de pimienta blanca recién molida"]','["Cocine los fideos en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo durante 3-5 minutos, luego escúrralos y póngalos en agua fría. Escurrir bien, mezclarlos con 1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo y reservar.","Combine el pollo con todos los ingredientes de la marinada y ½ cucharadita de sal, mezcle bien y luego déjelo marinar durante unos 10 minutos.","Calienta un wok a fuego alto. Agrega 1 cucharada de aceite de maní y, cuando esté muy caliente y ligeramente humeante, agrega el pollo desmenuzado. Sofría durante unos 2 minutos y luego transfiéralo a un plato. Limpia el wok. Vuelva a calentar el wok hasta que esté muy caliente, luego agregue el aceite de maní restante. Cuando el aceite humee ligeramente, añade el ajo y sofríe durante 10 segundos. Luego añade el tirabeque y el jamón y sofríe durante 1 min aproximadamente.","Añade los fideos, las salsas de soja, el vino de arroz o el jerez, la pimienta, el azúcar, las cebolletas y 1 cucharadita de sal. Sofría durante 2 minutos. Regrese el pollo y el jugo a la mezcla de fideos. Sofría durante unos 3-4 minutos o hasta que el pollo esté cocido. Agregue 1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo y revuelva la mezcla unas cuantas veces más. Poner en un plato caliente y servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13658,7208,'es','Gambas picantes al estilo de Sichuan','Mariscos salteados con salsa picante de tomate, jengibre y chile para un plato clásico de mariscos chino','["1½ cucharada de aceite de maní","2 cm de jengibre, finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","1 cebolla tierna, finamente picada","450 g de gambas crudas, peladas y desvenadas","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","3 cucharaditas de salsa de chile y frijoles","2 cucharaditas de vinagre negro chino o vinagre de sidra","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, para servir","cebollino en rodajas, para servir"]','["Calienta un wok a fuego alto. Añade el aceite de cacahuete y, cuando esté muy caliente y ligeramente humeante, añade el jengibre, el ajo y las cebolletas. Sofría durante 20 segundos y luego agregue las gambas. Sofría durante aproximadamente 1 minuto, luego agregue todos los ingredientes de la salsa, junto con ½ cucharadita de sal y ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra molida. Continúe salteando durante otros 3 minutos a fuego alto. Sirva de inmediato, espolvoreado con cilantro y cebolleta."]','2026-01-11 12:59:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13659,7210,'es','Pollo con anacardos','Tiernos trozos de pechuga de pollo salteados con anacardos dulces y crujientes en este plato clásico chino','["450 g de pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en trozos grandes","1 clara de huevo","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","300 ml de aceite de maní o agua, más 2 cucharaditas de aceite de maní","100 g de anacardos","1 cucharada de vino de arroz Shaoxing o jerez seco","1 cucharada de salsa de soja ligera","1 cebolla tierna rallada, para decorar"]','["Pon el pollo en un bol con la clara de huevo, el aceite de sésamo, la maicena y 1 cucharadita de sal y mezcla bien. Enfriar durante 20 minutos.","Si usas aceite para aterciopelar el pollo, calienta un wok hasta que esté muy caliente y luego agrega el aceite. Cuando esté bien caliente retiramos el wok del fuego e inmediatamente añadimos el pollo, removiendo enérgicamente para evitar que se pegue. Después de unos 2 minutos, cuando el pollo se ponga blanco, escúrrelo rápidamente junto con todo el aceite en un colador de acero inoxidable colocado sobre un bol. Deseche el aceite. Si usa agua en lugar de aceite, haga exactamente lo mismo pero hierva el agua en una cacerola antes de agregar el pollo. El pollo tardará unos 4 minutos en ponerse blanco en el agua.","Si ha utilizado un wok, límpielo. Caliéntalo hasta que esté muy caliente, luego agrega las 2 cucharaditas de aceite de maní. Agrega los anacardos y sofríe durante 1 min. Añade el vino de arroz o el Jerez seco y la salsa de soja. Regrese el pollo al wok y saltee durante 2 minutos. Esparza las cebolletas y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13660,7212,'es','Carne de res estofada china con jengibre','La pechuga o la pechuga de res cocinadas a fuego lento con especias aromáticas asiáticas brindan un plato principal que se derrite en la boca y que es delicioso con arroz al vapor y vegetales crujientes salteados.','["2 - 3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","1¼ kg de pechuga o pechuga de res, cortada en trozos muy grandes","2 cebollas","50 g de jengibre","3 dientes de ajo","cilantro en manojo pequeño","2 cucharaditas de polvo de cinco especias chinas","6 anís estrellado entero","1 cucharadita de pimienta negra","100 g de azúcar mascabado moreno oscuro","50 ml de salsa de soja ligera","50ml dark soy sauce","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","caldo de carne","Jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado en palitos","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal o de girasol","arroz jazmín cocido"]','["Calentar un poco de aceite en una fuente grande resistente al fuego. Agrega los trozos de carne, en tandas, y fríe hasta que se doren. Cuando cada lote esté dorado, transfiera la carne a otro plato. Picar en trozos grandes la cebolla, el jengibre, el ajo y los tallos de cilantro. Colóquelo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta.","Limpie el aceite del plato en el que doró la carne. Agregue la pasta con un buen chorrito de agua y fría suavemente, raspando los trozos de carne, hasta que la pasta esté fragante y suave (agregue más agua si la pasta se pega). Agregue las cinco especias, el anís estrellado y los granos de pimienta, cocine por 1 minuto, luego agregue el azúcar, las salsas de soja y el puré de tomate. Regrese la carne y el jugo al plato, luego agregue suficiente caldo para cubrirla. Llevar a fuego lento. Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Tapar la fuente, meter en el horno y cocinar durante 21?2 horas hasta que la carne esté muy tierna.","Saque la carne de la salsa y colóquela en un plato para mantenerla caliente. Hervir la salsa hasta que se reduzca aproximadamente a la mitad y espese. Mientras tanto, sofreír el jengibre en el aceite hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Regrese la carne a la salsa. sirva la carne sobre arroz y espolvoreada con jengibre crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13661,9456,'es','Pollo agridulce','Esta salsa agridulce casera es mucho mejor que una comida para llevar. Genial con arroz o fideos','["2-3 pechugas de pollo grandes, sin piel y deshuesadas (aproximadamente 400 g/14 oz de peso total)","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","Aceite de maní o girasol, para freír, y extra para sofreír.","masa de tempura (ver más abajo)","1 pimiento rojo pequeño, sin corazón, sin semillas y picado en trozos grandes","1 zanahoria mediana, cortada en rodajas finas en diagonal","2 dientes de ajo gordos, picados","2 cucharaditas de raíz de jengibre fresco finamente picado","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja","3 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","3 cucharadas de jerez","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz"]','["Corta el pollo en trozos pequeños y mézclalo con la salsa de soja y el aceite de sésamo. En una jarra o bol mezclar los ingredientes de la salsa con 100ml de agua fría. Forra un plato grande con papel de cocina.","Calienta el aceite de maní en una freidora a unos 180 ° C. Luego sumerja algunos trozos de pollo a la vez en la masa, luego colóquelos en el aceite caliente con unas pinzas o una espumadera, pero sin abarrotar la sartén. Freír hasta que estén crujientes y doradas, aproximadamente 2 minutos. Es posible que tengas que hacer esto en tandas, así que recalienta el aceite cada vez. Mientras se cocinan los trozos, sáquelos con unas pinzas o una cuchara y colóquelos en un plato forrado con papel para que escurran.","Calienta un wok, agrega unas 3 cucharadas de aceite y sofríe las verduras con el ajo y el jengibre durante unos 3 minutos. Revuelva rápidamente la salsa por última vez y viértala en el wok, mezclando mientras se cocina hasta obtener una salsa ligera y brillante. Burbujee durante 1 minuto, luego vierta sobre el pollo y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:59:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13662,7214,'es','Envuelve tus propios rollitos de primavera','Una receta súper saludable ideal para cocinar con niños pequeños','["Paquete de 300 g de fideos de arroz cocidos del refrigerador (ver consejos)","unos 400 g/14 oz de verduras mixtas, cortadas en rodajas finas y colocadas en tazones separados, como pimientos rojos, brotes de soja, zanahorias, col china rallada y cebolletas","140 g de gambas cocidas","100 g de pollo o pato cocido y desmenuzado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","jengibre en trozos pequeños, finamente picado","salpicar salsa de soja ligera","Polvo chino de cinco especias, para espolvorear","8-10 láminas de masa brik o filo (ver consejos)","1 huevo batido","semillas de sésamo, para espolvorear si quieres","100 g de ketchup reducido en sal y azúcar","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","jengibre en trozos pequeños, rallado","pizca de azúcar en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Antes de que los niños cocinen, ponga los fideos, las verduras, las gambas y el pollo en tazones individuales para que todos se sirvan. Lávese las manos, póngase delantales, siente a los niños y déles su propio tazón y cuchara. Déjeles elegir qué ingredientes quieren (los fideos son esenciales) en sus panecillos y si quieren pastar como quieran, está bien: todos los ingredientes están cocidos o se pueden comer crudos. Agrega un poco de ajo y jengibre, una pizca de soja y una pizca de cinco especias a cada tazón y deja que se mezclen todo.","Aparta el bol y coloca una hoja de masa delante de cada niño. Pídeles que viertan el relleno por un lado de cada hoja y luego dales el huevo batido y un cepillo para que puedan cepillar los bordes. Luego ayúdelos a enrollarlos cuidadosamente doblando ambos lados sobre el relleno y luego enróllelos.","Levante los rollitos de primavera sobre una bandeja para hornear, con la costura hacia abajo, unte con un poco más de huevo y espolvoree con semillas de sésamo, si lo desea. ¡Intenta recordar qué niño hizo cada tirada para guardar cualquier argumento al final! Hornea los panecillos durante 20-25 minutos o hasta que estén dorados.","Mientras los panecillos están en el horno, prepara la salsa para mojar. Haga que los niños mezclen todos los ingredientes hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Cuando los rollitos de primavera estén dorados y crujientes, retíralos del horno. Déjelo hasta que esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, córtelo en trozos para los niños más pequeños y luego déjelos comer, sumergiendo los panecillos en la salsa."]','2026-01-11 12:59:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13663,7216,'es','Chow mein de gambas','Esta receta de salteado bajo en grasa está repleta de verduras crujientes y salsa picante de ostras.','["3 nidos de fideos al huevo medianos","140 g de brócoli, picado en floretes pequeños","140 g de maíz tierno, cortado por la mitad","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 pimiento rojo, rebanado","300g de gambas","3 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","2 cucharadas de salsa de ostras"]','["Cocine los fideos, el brócoli y el maíz en agua hirviendo durante 3-4 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir y reservar. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande o wok y fríe el pimiento durante 3 minutos, hasta que empiece a ablandarse.","Agregue los fideos y las verduras junto con las gambas y mezcle. Agregue los ingredientes de la salsa y caliente todo durante 2-3 minutos, hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13664,7218,'es','Lubina al vapor con salsa de judías negras','No es necesario comer comidas chinas en envases de cartón para llevar: este plato de pescado especial es una cena inteligente para dos','["1 lubina, con cabeza, eviscerada","2 cm de jengibre en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de vino de arroz Shaohsing","arroz jazmín cocido, para servir","1 cucharada de aceite de maní","2 dientes de ajo","2 cucharadas de jengibre rallado","2 cucharadas de frijoles negros fermentados, enjuagados y triturados con el dorso de una cuchara (o use 100 g de salsa de frijoles negros en su lugar)","1 cucharada de vino de arroz Shaohsing","3 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo tostado","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","2 cebolletas, ralladas","1 puñado pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Lavar el pescado con agua corriente fría.\r\nSeque con papel de cocina y luego corte\r\n3-4 cortes en la piel en ambos lados.\r\nSazone todo con sal y tierra.\r\npimienta blanca. Coloque las rodajas de jengibre en el\r\nhendiduras del pescado y dentro de la cavidad.","Coloca el pescado en un plato que quepa dentro.\r\ntu wok. En tu wok coloca un pudin\r\nrecipiente boca abajo y vierta agua\r\nllegar hasta la mitad. Coloque el wok\r\nel fuego y llevar el agua a ebullición.","Verter el vino de arroz sobre el pescado, poner\r\nel plato sobre el recipiente al revés y\r\nColoca la tapa del wok encima. vapor encendido\r\nCalentar a fuego alto durante 8-9 minutos y luego dejar reposar.","Mientras se cocina el pescado, haga el\r\nsalsa de frijoles negros. Agrega el maní\r\naceite a un wok o sartén caliente. cuando\r\nempieza a humear, agrega el ajo, el jengibre\r\ny frijoles (o use 100 g ya preparados\r\nsalsa de frijoles negros) y sofreír durante unos\r\nsegundos. Añade el vino de arroz, el aceite de sésamo y\r\nsalsa de soja ligera, luego llevar a la burbuja.","Retire con cuidado el pescado (puede conservarlo\r\nen el plato donde lo cocinaste).\r\nAdorne con las cebolletas y\r\ncilantro, luego rocíe sobre el negro\r\nsalsa de frijoles y servir con arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13665,7220,'es','Gambas a la sal y pimienta','Use granos de pimienta de Sichuan para darle sabor a los mariscos con un sabor parecido al apio, luego cree una salsa de chile y ajo al estilo chino.','["2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","aceite vegetal, para freír","24 langostinos grandes, pelados y desvenados, con cola","brotes de guisantes u hojas tiernas de ensalada, para servir (opcional)","1 cucharada de granos de pimienta de Sichuan","4 granos de pimienta negra","2 cucharadas de sal marina en escamas","una pizca grande de hojuelas de chile","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de hojas de cilantro picadas","1 chile rojo pequeño, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","jugo 3 limones","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado"]','["Primero, prepara la salsa para mojar. aplastar\r\nel ajo, el cilantro y la guindilla con ayuda de un\r\nmortero y mortero. (Si no tienes\r\nuno, simplemente pique finamente). Agregue el azúcar\r\nhasta que se disuelva, luego agregue el jugo de lima\r\ny salsa de pescado. Debe tener un sabor dulce\r\nsalado y picante.","Para hacer la mezcla de especias, tuesta las\r\nSichuan y granos de pimienta negra en una fritura\r\nsartén a fuego medio durante 1 min o hasta que\r\nfragante. Moler finamente en un molinillo de especias o\r\nusando un mortero y luego agregue el\r\nsal y hojuelas de chile y mezclar.\r\nTransfiera a un tazón.","Combine la mezcla de especias con la\r\nharina de maíz. Calentar 7,5 cm de aceite en un wok grande.\r\no cacerola profunda de base pesada. tu puedes\r\nPruebe la temperatura friendo una pequeña\r\ntrozo de pan – debe chisporrotear al instante\r\ny tarda 20 segundos en dorarse. Tira el\r\ngambas con la mezcla de especias, sacudir\r\nexceso y freír, en tandas, durante\r\n1-2 minutos o hasta que estén crujientes en los bordes y\r\nempezando a rizarse. Retirar con una ranura\r\ncuchara, escurrir en una bandeja para hornear forrada con\r\npapel de cocina y manténgalo caliente mientras\r\nCocine los langostinos restantes. dispersarse\r\nlos brotes de guisantes o las hojas de lechuga, si se prefiere,\r\ny sirva con la salsa para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:59:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13666,7222,'es','Pollo en pólvora con chiles rojos secos y maní','Este plato clásico de la provincia china de Sichuan no es tan picante si le quitas las semillas de chile y se completa con una salsa pegajosa, dulce y rica.','["12 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel (unos 900 g), cortados en trozos","1 cucharada de salsa de soja oscura","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","15 chiles ojo de pájaro enteros secos","1 cucharadita de pimienta de Sichuan, molida","manojo de cebolletas, cortadas en trozos de 2½ cm","50 g de maní entero tostado","5 cucharadas de salsa de soja oscura","2 cucharadas de vino de arroz Shaohsing","4 cucharadas de vinagre negro chino","4 cucharadas de caldo de pollo","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de harina de maíz, mezclada con 1 cucharada de agua"]','["Marinar el pollo con la soja y\r\ndejar reposar 1 h. Si no tienes tiempo\r\npara marinar, no te preocupes, pero agrega\r\nsabor extra. Mezclar los ingredientes de la salsa en\r\nun tazón pequeño y reservar.","Usando un wok y una pequeña cantidad de\r\naceite, dorar el pollo en tandas. cuando es\r\ntodo dorado, retirar de la sartén y\r\ndejar de lado. Corta los tallos de los chiles.\r\ny sacuda las semillas. Añade el\r\naceite restante y cocinar los chiles por\r\n1 min, agitando la sartén constantemente para\r\nevitar que se quemen. Agrega el pollo\r\nDe vuelta con los granos de pimienta, primavera.\r\ncebollas y maní, luego saltee durante\r\n1 min más. Agrega la salsa y revuelve para\r\nunos minutos más hasta que espese."]','2026-01-11 12:59:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13667,7224,'es','Tofu dulce de jengibre con pak choi','Si pensabas que el tofu era suave, esta es la receta para convencerte de lo contrario','["250 g de tofu fresco y firme, escurrido","2 cucharadas de aceite de maní","1 cm de jengibre cortado en rodajas","200 g de pak choi, con las hojas separadas","1 cucharada de vino de arroz Shaohsing","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile seco","arroz jazmín cocido, para servir","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","1 tsp dark soy sauce","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno"]','["Pinche suavemente algunos agujeros en el tofu con\r\nun palillo (esto ayudará a que la marinada se\r\nempaparse en él, dándole mejor sabor), luego\r\ncortar en cubos del tamaño de un bocado.","Mezclar los ingredientes de la marinada\r\nen un tazón y agregue los trozos de tofu.\r\nDejar marinar durante 10-15 minutos.","Calienta un wok a fuego alto y agrega la mitad.\r\nel aceite de maní. Cuando el aceite comienza a\r\nahumar, añadir las rodajas de jengibre y sofreír\r\ndurante unos segundos. Agrega las hojas de pak choy\r\ny sofreír durante 1-2 minutos. Añade un pequeño\r\nchorrito de agua para crear un poco de vapor\r\ny cocine por 2 minutos más. cuando el\r\nlas hojas se han marchitado y los tallos están\r\ncocido pero aún un poco crujiente, sazonar\r\ncon sal y transfiéralo a una fuente para servir.","Enjuague el wok con agua fría y luego\r\nVuelva a calentarlo y agregue el aceite restante. cuando\r\nempieza a humear, agrega los trozos de tofu\r\n(reteniendo el líquido de la marinada) y sofreír\r\ndurante 5-10 minutos. Ten cuidado de no romper\r\nel tofu mientras lo tiras para que se dore\r\nuniformemente por todos lados. Sazone con el arroz\r\nVinagre de vino y arroz. Agrega el resto\r\nlíquido de marinar, llevar a la burbuja y\r\ndejar que el líquido se reduzca. Espolvorear sobre el\r\nhojuelas de chile y revuelva bien. Vierta sobre\r\nel pak choy y servir inmediatamente\r\ncon arroz jazmín, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:59:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13668,7226,'es','Pollo dorado festivo con cinco especias','Las cinco especias chinas le dan a este pollo un sabor maravillosamente cálido y aromático que encantará a adultos y niños.','["8 muslos de pollo y 8 muslos de pollo, con piel","3 cebolletas, ralladas, para terminar","4 cucharadas de aceite de maní","6 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","trozo del largo de un dedo de raíz de jengibre fresco, rallado","4 cucharadas de vino de arroz Shaohsing o jerez seco","4 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","4 cucharadas de miel clara","4 cucharaditas de cinco especias en polvo"]','["Batir los ingredientes de la marinada,\r\nponer el pollo en un plato y luego verterlo\r\nla marinada, mezclando para cubrir. Cubrir, entonces\r\nenfríe durante al menos 20 minutos, o hasta un día si\r\ntienes tiempo.","Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4, y\r\nSaque el pollo de la marinada y colóquelo en un\r\nlata para asar. Ase durante 40 minutos, vierta\r\nla marinada restante, luego cocine por\r\nOtros 30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y pegajoso.\r\nEspolvorea con la cebolleta y luego sirve."]','2026-01-11 12:59:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13669,7228,'es','Arroz frito especial con gambas y chorizo','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Un plato de fusión que combina paella española con arroz asiático frito con huevo: una excelente manera de hacer que los niños coman verduras.','["100 g de arroz basmati o arroz de grano largo","85 g de guisantes congelados","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 huevo batido","50 g de chorizo, tocino o jamón finamente picados","1 diente de ajo, picado","3 cebolletas, cortadas en ángulo","½ pimiento rojo, sin semillas y picado","buena pizca de cinco especias en polvo","1 tsp soy sauce","100 g de brotes de soja (opcional)","50 g de gambas peladas"]','["Hervir el arroz del siguiente paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, añadiendo los guisantes\r\nel minuto final. Drenar.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en un wok. Vierta\r\nel huevo y sofreír hasta que esté revuelto.\r\nVierta sobre un plato y reserve.","Limpia el wok con papel de cocina.\r\nLuego calentar el aceite restante. Agregue\r\nla carne, el ajo, las cebolletas y\r\npimienta y sofreír hasta que la pimienta\r\ncomienza a ablandarse. Agrega las cinco especias,\r\narroz, guisantes y soja, luego sofreír durante\r\n5 minutos más. Finalmente agregue el\r\nbrotes de soja, si los usa, el huevo y\r\nlos langostinos y sofreírlos para que se calienten."]','2026-01-11 12:59:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13670,7230,'es','Fideos chinos con tofu y avellanas','Sabores emocionantes impregnan esta sencilla receta vegetariana','["Paquete de 250 g de fideos al huevo medianos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","un puñado de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","300g de tirabeques","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","un puñado de avellanas tostadas, picadas en trozos grandes","Paquete de 349 g de tofu sedoso, cortado en cubos","3 cucharadas de salsa china de frijoles amarillos"]','["Coloque los fideos en una cacerola con agua hirviendo, cocine durante 4 minutos y luego escurra. Rocíe un poco de aceite y mezcle con la mitad del cilantro.","Calienta un wok a fuego medio. Vierta el aceite restante, luego agregue los tirabeques y saltee durante 2 minutos. Agrega el chile y cocina por 2 minutos más hasta que los frijoles estén tiernos.","Vierta las avellanas, el tofu y la salsa de frijoles amarillos en el wok y revuelva para calentar. Finalmente, agregue el cilantro restante, sazone si lo desea y sirva con los fideos."]','2026-01-11 12:59:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13671,7232,'es','Salteado de carne','Pruebe este salteado rápido y fácil con limoncillo, jengibre y chile para darle un gran impacto. Cocina todo en una sola sartén y disfrútalo como comida entre semana.','["500 g de grupa de ternera, despuntada y cortada en tiras finas","1 cucharadita de polvo de cinco especias chinas","Paquete de 300 g de fideos de arroz ya cocidos.","1 chile rojo grande","1 diente de ajo gordo, picado","Trozo de 4 cm de jengibre, pelado y cortado en palitos","1 barra de limoncillo, cortado y rebanado","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","100 g de guisantes dulces, cortados en tiras finas","8 maíz tierno, cortado en diagonal","6 cebolletas, peladas y cortadas en rodajas diagonales","½ lima","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado","2 cucharadas de maní tostado","cilantro picado, para servir"]','["Mezcle la carne y las cinco especias en un bol.\r\nluego reserve para marinar. Suavizar el\r\nfideos en agua hirviendo siguiente paquete\r\ninstrucciones, escurrir y reservar. finamente\r\nCortar la guindilla roja en rodajas, dejando las semillas si\r\nprefieres un poco más de calor. Mezclar con\r\nel ajo, el jengibre y la hierba de limón en\r\nun cuenco pequeño. Calentar la mitad del aceite en un wok,\r\nagrega la mezcla de chiles y sofríe durante 1 min.\r\nhasta que esté suave pero sin color. Quitar\r\ncon una espumadera y reservar mientras\r\ncocinas la carne.","Calentar el aceite restante, agregar la carne.\r\ny sofreír a fuego alto durante 1 min.\r\nhasta que se dore y esté bien cocido.","Regrese la mezcla de chile a la sartén con\r\nlos dulces, el maíz tierno y la mitad del\r\ncebolletas. Sofreír 1 min más\r\nantes de agregar los fideos escurridos. Mezclar\r\npara combinar bien, retirar del fuego\r\ny añadir un chorrito de zumo de lima, la soja\r\nsalsa y salsa de pescado.","Dividir en cuatro platos. dispersión\r\ncon el maní, decore con el resto\r\ncebolletas y cilantro picado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13672,7234,'es','Lubina china al vapor con repollo','Lleno de sabor y libre de culpa, este plato de pescado bajo en grasa está lleno de omega 3 y cuenta como 1 de tus 5 al día. Una comida perfecta entre semana','["2 filetes de lubina u otro pescado blanco","1 chile verde o rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cucharadita de raíz de jengibre fresco","300 g de coles verdes, finamente ralladas","2 cucharaditas de aceite de girasol","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja baja en sal"]','["Espolvorea el pescado con la guindilla, el jengibre y\r\nun poco de sal. Cocine el repollo al vapor durante 5 minutos.\r\nColoque el pescado encima del repollo y cocine al vapor.\r\ndurante 5 minutos más hasta que esté bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, calentar los aceites en una sartén pequeña,\r\nagregue el ajo y cocine rápidamente, revolviendo hasta\r\nligeramente dorado. Transfiera el repollo y\r\npescado a platos para servir, espolvoree cada uno con 1 cucharadita\r\nde salsa de soja, luego vierta sobre el aceite con ajo."]','2026-01-11 12:59:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13673,7236,'es','Alitas chinas pegajosas y pepino','Alitas de pollo al estilo chino con un toque americano con solo 5 ingredientes','["16 alitas de pollo grandes","125ml de salsa de soja reducida en sal","140 g de azúcar moreno suave y oscuro","5 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","medio pepino, pelado en tiras finas"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. En un\r\nbandeja para asar, mezcle las alitas con la soja\r\nsalsa, 125 g de azúcar, 2 cucharadas de vinagre\r\ny un poco de pimienta negra molida. asado para\r\n40 min, volteando de vez en cuando hasta que esté barnizado.","Mientras tanto, añadir el resto del azúcar y\r\nvinagre a ebullición durante aproximadamente 1 min, hasta que\r\nel azúcar se disuelve. Dejar enfriar y luego mezclar con\r\nlas cintas de pepino. Sirve las alitas pegajosas\r\ncon el pepino y un poco de arroz hervido."]','2026-01-11 12:59:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13674,6234,'es','Verduras salteadas con salsa de ostras','Una excelente guarnición para una comida china casera para llevar o una comida rápida abundante.','["100 g de fideos de arroz","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","3 cucharadas de salsa de ostras","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","4 cebolletas picadas","3 dientes de ajo picados","1 chile rojo sin semillas y picado","100 g de setas shiitake o castañas en rodajas finas","200 g de floretes de brócoli","2 cabezas de pak choi picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Remojar los fideos de arroz en agua hirviendo durante 4 minutos. Escurrir, refrescar con agua fría, escurrir nuevamente y reservar.","Mezcle la soja, la salsa de pescado y la salsa de ostras en un bol. Calentar el aceite de girasol en un wok grande, añadir las cebolletas, los dientes de ajo picados y la guindilla picada y sin semillas.","Sofría durante 20 segundos antes de agregar los shiitake o los champiñones castaños en rodajas finas y los floretes de brócoli. Sofría durante 1 minuto, luego agregue el pak choi y la mezcla de salsa. Remueve y cocina durante unos 2 minutos a fuego alto, añadiendo un chorrito de agua si la salsa se vuelve demasiado espesa.","Vierta los fideos, retírelos del fuego y revuelva para mezclar bien. Sirva en tazones calientes y métalo con los palillos."]','2026-01-11 12:59:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13675,7240,'es','Pato asado chino con tortitas','Coloca todos los elementos de esta receta clásica china en la mesa y deja que tus invitados se sirvan ellos mismos.','["1 pato listo al horno","2 cucharaditas de cinco especias chinas","anís de 2 estrellas","1 naranja, con la piel cortada en tiras y luego la naranja partida por la mitad","2 cucharadas de vinagre negro chino (usamos Merchant Gourmet) (opcional)","75 ml de vino de arroz Shaohsing o jerez seco","100 ml de caldo de pollo","30 panqueques chinos (comprados en la tienda o consulte la receta en ''Combina bien'')","6 cebolletas, cortadas en tiras largas y ralladas, ½ pepino, cortado en palitos, salsa hoisin, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1.\r\nAfloje la piel del pato moviéndolo\r\nprimero tus dedos, luego tu mano\r\nentre él y la carne hasta que tira\r\nlejos – tenga cuidado de no romper la piel.\r\nRecorte el exceso de grasa de la cavidad y\r\npiel alrededor del cuello. Frote toda la piel\r\nSe acabó las cinco especias más un buen\r\nespolvoreado de sal. Pon el pato en un\r\nfuente para asar y empujar el anís estrellado,\r\ncáscara de naranja y mitades de naranja por dentro.\r\nVierta el vinagre, el vino de arroz y el caldo.\r\nen la cavidad, no te preocupes si se derrama\r\notra vez. Cubra la fuente para asar con una carpa.\r\nde papel aluminio y cocine por 2 hrs.","Encienda el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nRetire el papel de aluminio, escurra el jugo (consérvelo durante\r\nlos fideos, ver ''Combina bien'') y\r\nRegrese el pato al horno durante 30-40 minutos.\r\no hasta que la piel esté dorada y crujiente.","Una vez cocido déjalo reposar durante 10 minutos. rebanada\r\nQuitar las pechugas y desmenuzar la carne y la piel.\r\nApilar en un plato, manteniendo la carne y la piel.\r\nseparar. Mantener caliente en horno bajo, cubriendo\r\ncarne con papel de aluminio para evitar que se seque, pero la piel\r\ndestapado para que quede más crujiente. (Retire el\r\nresto de la carne en trozos para los fideos; consulte ''Combina bien con'').","Calentar las tortitas y servir el pato.\r\ncon acompañamientos."]','2026-01-11 12:59:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13676,7242,'es','Caldo agridulce con gambas','Este entrante saludable se prepara en solo 15 minutos y es una forma limpiadora de comenzar una comida china.','["3 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz o vinagre de vino blanco","500 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1-2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y cortado en rodajas finas","2 chiles rojos pequeños y picantes, en rodajas finas","3 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","300g de gambas pequeñas crudas peladas, de origen sostenible"]','["Poner el vinagre, el caldo, la salsa de soja, el azúcar.\r\n(comience con 1 cucharada y agregue la segunda a\r\nal final si quieres la sopa más dulce),\r\njengibre, chiles y cebolletas en un\r\ncacerola y llevar a fuego lento. cocinar\r\ndurante 1 min, luego agrega las gambas a calentar\r\na través. Sirva en tazones o tazas pequeñas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13677,6240,'es','Arroz frito con huevo oriental','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. El arroz frito, fácil y rápido de Sara Buenfeld, es una deliciosa cena china.','["una taza llena de arroz americano de grano largo","una taza de guisantes congelados","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 lonchas de tocino, picadas en trozos grandes","1 pimiento rojo pequeño, picado","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","2 huevos grandes","1 cucharadita colmada de cinco especias chinas en polvo"]','["Llene una cacerola espaciosa con agua, déjela hervir y agregue una cucharadita colmada de sal; el agua burbujeará furiosamente. Vierta el arroz, revuelva una vez y vuelva a hervir, luego baje un poco el fuego para que el agua hierva de manera constante, pero no vigorosamente.","Hierva sin tapar, sin revolver (esto hace arroz pegajoso) durante 10 minutos.  después de las 8\r\nminutos, agregue el congelado\r\nguisantes, hervir\r\ndurante 2 minutos y escurrir (no enjuagar).","Calentar el aceite de girasol en un wok y remover.\r\nFríe el tocino durante 3-4 minutos hasta que esté crujiente. Consejo en \r\nel pimiento rojo y los dientes de ajo y sofreír durante 2\r\nminutos.","Batir los huevos, verter en\r\nla sartén y sofreír hasta que el huevo esté apenas\r\nconjuntos. Agregue las 5 especias chinas"]','2026-01-11 12:59:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13678,7246,'es','si son langostinos','Prepare este favorito chino económico en solo 20 minutos','["1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","400 g de langostinos crudos grandes, congelados, en forma de mariposa (ver el consejo a continuación)","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz chino","1 cucharada colmada de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o maní","85 g de maní tostado y sin sal","6 chiles secos enteros pequeños o 3 grandes","2 latas de 225 g de castañas de agua, escurridas","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados"]','["Mezcle la harina de maíz y 1 cucharada de salsa de soja, agregue las gambas y reserve durante 10 minutos. Mezcle el vinagre, el resto de la salsa de soja, el puré de tomate, el azúcar y 2 cucharadas de agua para hacer una salsa.","Cuando esté listo para cocinar, caliente una sartén grande o un wok hasta que esté muy caliente, luego agregue 1 cucharada de aceite. Freír los langostinos hasta que estén dorados en algunos lugares y se hayan abierto; luego sáquelos de la sartén.","Calentar el aceite restante y añadir los cacahuetes, las guindillas y las castañas de agua. Sofríe durante 2 minutos o hasta que el maní comience a tomar color, luego agrega el jengibre y el ajo y sofríe por 1 min más. Vierta las gambas y la salsa y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos hasta que espese un poco. Servir con arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13679,7248,'es','Lubina con jengibre chisporroteado, chile y cebolletas','Los aromas que se desprenden al cocinar este plato harán que todos se lamen los labios con anticipación.','["6 filetes de lubina, de aproximadamente 140 g/5 oz cada uno, con piel y escamas","aproximadamente 3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","trozo grande de jengibre, pelado y rallado en palitos","3 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","3 chiles rojos frescos, grasos, sin semillas y finamente rallados","manojo de cebolleta, rallada a lo largo","1 cucharada de salsa de soja"]','["Sazona el pescado con sal y pimienta y luego corta la piel 3 veces. Calienta una sartén de base pesada y agrega 1 cucharada de aceite. Una vez caliente, fríe el pescado, con la piel hacia abajo, durante 5 minutos o hasta que la piel esté muy crujiente y dorada. El pescado estará casi cocido. Voltee, cocine por otros 30 segundos-1 min, luego transfiéralo a un plato para servir y manténgalo caliente. Tendrás que freír el pescado en 2 tandas.","Calienta el aceite restante, luego fríe el jengibre, el ajo y los chiles durante unos 2 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Retire del fuego y agregue las cebolletas. Salpimentar el pescado con un poco de salsa de soja y verter sobre el contenido de la sartén."]','2026-01-11 12:59:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13680,7250,'es','Ensalada de pato desmenuzado, berros y naranja','Una ensalada de influencia china de pato tierno, rábano crujiente, achicoria y naranja dulce: una cena informal','["2 patas de pato","1 cucharadita de polvo de cinco especias","5 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","5 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 naranjas grandes, segmentadas, jugo reservado","2 bolsas de 100 g de berros.","Bolsa de 200 g de rábanos, en rodajas finas","Paquete de 140 g de achicoria, hojas separadas","manojo pequeño de cebolleta, cortada en diagonal"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Pat\r\nSecar los muslos de pato con papel de cocina.\r\ny frote las cinco especias y un poco\r\ncondimento. Vierta el vinagre, la soja y\r\njugo de naranja en una fuente para asar pequeña y\r\nponer el pato encima. Cubrir con papel de aluminio y\r\ncocine por 30 minutos, luego retire el papel de aluminio\r\ny aumente el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/\r\ngas 9, o poner debajo del grill y cocinar\r\nhasta que la piel esté crujiente. Retirar y colar\r\nel líquido a través de un colador. deja que el pato\r\nDeje enfriar hasta que pueda desmenuzar la carne.\r\nlos huesos. Quite la grasa del líquido.","Mientras tanto, mezcle suavemente los\r\nnaranjas, berros, rábanos, achicoria\r\ny cebolletas. Vierta sobre lo reservado\r\nlíquido de cocción, luego agregue el pato y\r\ndisponer en un plato."]','2026-01-11 12:59:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13681,7252,'es','Carne de res estofada al estilo chino en una olla','Ideal para entretenimiento informal, cuando te apetece un estofado de carne caliente pero con sabores más vibrantes.','["3-4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","6 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","un buen trozo del tamaño de un pulgar, raíz de jengibre fresco, pelado y rallado","1 manojo de cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","1½ kg de ternera para estofar cortada en trozos grandes (nosotros utilizamos carrillera de buey)","2 cucharadas de harina común, bien sazonada","1 cucharadita de polvo de cinco especias chinas","2 anís estrellado (opcional)","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moscabado light (o usa la que tengas)","3 cucharadas de vino de cocina chino o jerez seco","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja oscura y más para servir","500ml de caldo de res (nosotros usamos Knorr Touch of Taste)","bok choi al vapor y arroz basmati al vapor, para servir"]','["Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una cacerola grande.\r\ncazuela poco profunda. Sofreír el ajo, el jengibre,\r\ncebollas y chile durante 3 minutos hasta que estén suaves\r\ny fragante. Vierta sobre un plato. Tira el\r\ncarne de res en la harina, agregar 1 cucharada más de aceite\r\na la sartén, luego dore la carne en\r\nlotes, agregando la última cucharada de aceite si\r\nnecesito. Debería tomar unos 5 minutos.\r\npara dorar cada lote correctamente.","Agregue las cinco especias y el anís estrellado (si\r\nusando) a la sartén, vierta la mezcla de jengibre,\r\nluego freír durante 1 min hasta que las especias estén\r\nfragante. Agrega el azúcar, luego la carne.\r\ny revuelva hasta que se combinen. mantener el calor\r\nalto, luego rocíe el vino o el jerez,\r\nraspando los trozos de carne. calentar el horno\r\na 150C/ventilador 130C/gas 2.","Vierta la soja y el caldo (no\r\ncubrir la carne completamente), llevar a\r\ncocine a fuego lento, luego cubra bien, transfiera\r\nal horno y cocinar durante 1½-2 horas,\r\nrevolviendo la carne a mitad de cocción.\r\nLa carne debe quedar muy blanda y cualquier\r\nLos trozos nervudos deberían haberse derretido.\r\nSazone con más soja. esto ahora puede\r\nenfriarse y congelarse hasta por 1 mes.","Coloque el bok choi cocido en el\r\nsartén, luego llevar a la mesa con el\r\narroz basmati de inmediato y mételo."]','2026-01-11 12:59:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13682,7254,'es','Sopa de pollo con fideos agridulce, rápida y fácil','Sigue probando el caldo y agrega tanto chile y vinagre de arroz como quieras para obtener el equilibrio adecuado de sabores.','["140 g de fideos integrales secos","1 cucharada de aceite de maní","2 cucharadas de jengibre rallado","1 chile rojo mediano, sin semillas y finamente picado","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos pequeños","1 cucharada de vino de arroz Shaohsing","700 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","4 champiñones castaños, rebanados","1 tsp dark soy sauce","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","1 cucharada de harina de maíz mezclada con 2 cucharadas de agua fría para hacer una pasta","1 puñado de brotes de soja","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola pequeña con agua.\r\ny cocinar los fideos siguiente paquete\r\ninstrucciones. Escurrir, enjuagar con agua fría.\r\nagua corriente para evitar que se cocinen\r\nmás, luego rocíe un poco de aceite para\r\nevitar que se peguen. dividir\r\nentre 2 tazones hondos.","Calienta un wok a fuego alto y agrega el\r\nresto del aceite. Cuando empieza a fumar,\r\nagregue el jengibre y la guindilla, luego saltee durante\r\nunos segundos. Agrega el pollo y sofríe\r\ndurante 2 min. Cuando la carne comienza a girar\r\ndorar, agregar el vino de arroz y cocinar\r\ndurante 3 minutos más. Agrega la verdura\r\ncaldo, llevar a fuego lento, luego agregar el\r\nchampiñones. Sazone con la soja oscura,\r\nVinagre ligero de soja y arroz.","traer de vuelta a\r\ncocine a fuego lento, luego agregue la pasta de harina de maíz.\r\nCocine a fuego lento y revuelva hasta que espese. Agregue\r\nlos brotes de soja y la mayor parte de la primavera\r\ncebollas, luego sirva la sopa con un cucharón\r\nfideos. Servir inmediatamente, esparcido\r\ncon las cebolletas restantes."]','2026-01-11 12:59:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13683,7256,'es','Sopa de fideos con pollo y huevo','Estos fideos rápidos y saludables son el alimento básico ideal entre semana','["2 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en cubitos","1,2 l de caldo de pollo bajo en sal","140 g de fideos integrales","140 g de maíz tierno, cortado por la mitad a lo largo o de maíz dulce congelado","2 huevos batidos","exprimir el jugo de limon","½ cucharadita de vinagre de jerez","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas"]','["Coloque el pollo y el caldo en una fuente grande.\r\ncacerola y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.\r\nMientras tanto, cocine los fideos siguiendo\r\ninstrucciones del paquete.","Agrega el maíz al caldo y cocina.\r\ndurante 2 min. Revuelva el caldo vigorosamente, luego\r\nmientras todavía está girando, sostenga un tenedor sobre el\r\nsartén. Vierta los huevos sobre las puntas en un\r\nflujo lento. Revuelva nuevamente en el mismo\r\ndirección y luego apague el fuego. Añadir un\r\nchorrito de jugo de limón y el vinagre.","Escurrir los fideos y dividirlos entre\r\ncuatro tazones. Sirva con un cucharón sobre la caída de huevo\r\ncaldo, espolvorear con la cebolla y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13684,7258,'es','Plátanos con caramelo y sésamo','Los plátanos toffee tradicionales se fríen, pero esta es una versión más ligera, servida con salsa de caramelo.','["6 plátanos grandes, pelados y cortados en cuartos","8 cucharadas de azúcar moscabado light","2 cucharadas de mantequilla","200ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo, tostadas","helado de vainilla de buena calidad, para servir"]','["Mezcle los plátanos con 2 cucharadas de azúcar.\r\nCalienta una plancha a fuego medio, luego cocina la\r\nplátanos, unos cuantos trozos a la vez, hasta que estén pegajosos\r\ny mostrando marcas de plancha. mantener caliente\r\nen horno bajo.","Para la salsa poner el azúcar restante,\r\nen un cazo la mantequilla y la nata y\r\nrevolver a fuego suave hasta que el azúcar se haya\r\nderretido. Agrega las semillas de sésamo. puede ser\r\ncompensado con un día de antelación. Para servir poner un\r\nunos trozos de plátano en 8 platos para servir,\r\nvierta sobre un poco de caramelo, luego cubra\r\ncon una bola de helado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13685,7260,'es','Carne de res crujiente con chile','Deshazte de la comida para llevar y prepara este bistec chino frito con salsa dulce de jengibre y pimientos rojos.','["350 g de filete diminuto, cortado en tiras muy finas","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","2 cucharaditas de polvo de cinco especias chinas","100 ml de aceite vegetal","1 pimiento rojo, en rodajas finas","1 chile rojo, en rodajas finas","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas, partes verdes y blancas separadas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, cortado en palitos","4 cucharadas de vinagre de vino de arroz o vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","2 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","fideos cocidos, para servir (opcional)","galletas de gambas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Coloque la carne en un bol y agregue la\r\nharina de maíz y cinco especias. Calentar el aceite en un\r\nwok o sartén grande hasta que esté caliente, luego agregue\r\nla carne y sofreír hasta que esté dorada y crujiente.\r\nSaque la carne y escúrrala en la cocina.\r\npapel. Vierta todo menos 1 cucharada de aceite.","Agrega el pimiento, la mitad de la guindilla, la\r\npuntas de las cebolletas, el ajo y\r\njengibre a la sartén. Sofríe durante 3 minutos para\r\nAblanda, pero no dejes que el ajo y el jengibre se quemen. Mezclar el vinagre, la soja y la salsa de chile.\r\ny ketchup en una jarra con 2 cucharadas de agua,\r\nluego vierta sobre las verduras. Burbuja para\r\n2 minutos, luego agregue la carne nuevamente a la sartén.\r\ny revuelva bien para cubrir. Servir la carne\r\nfideos con galletas de gambas, si quieres,\r\nesparcido con el chile restante y\r\nlas partes verdes de las cebolletas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13686,7262,'es','Condado de Gougeres','Llene estos gougères con el comté crèmeux opcional y transfórmelos de un refrigerio o bebida a un entrante: son un excelente comienzo para un menú francés.','["100ml de leche","50 g de mantequilla","125 g de harina común","4 huevos","150 g de condado rallado","35 g de mantequilla","20 g de harina común","100ml de leche entera","100ml de nata doble","200 g de Comté rallado y más Comté rallado extra fino para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 220/200C ventilador/gas 8. Poner la leche, 100ml de agua y la mantequilla en una cacerola mediana a fuego lento y calentar hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y el líquido hierva a fuego lento. Agregue la harina y continúe cocinando, revolviendo, hasta que la mezcla se desprenda limpiamente de los lados de la sartén. Transfiera a un tazón y agregue los huevos, uno a la vez, luego agregue el queso y un poco de condimento.","Vierta la mezcla en una manga pastelera, corte el extremo y coloque unas 20 rondas sobre dos bandejas para hornear forradas con papel para hornear. Use un dedo o un tenedor humedecido en agua para presionar suavemente los picos. Hornee durante 20 minutos o hasta que las gougères estén infladas, doradas y crujientes. Dejar enfriar.","Si vas a hacer el relleno, derrite la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo. Incorpora la harina para formar una pasta arenosa. Incorpora lentamente la leche y la nata y continúa cocinando hasta que la mezcla espese. Agregue el queso para que se derrita, sazone, luego retire del fuego y deje enfriar por completo. Una vez frío, transfiéralo a una segunda manga pastelera. Corta el extremo.","Con una brocheta, haga agujeros en la parte inferior de las gougères que sean lo suficientemente grandes como para caber en el extremo de la manga pastelera. Coloque el relleno, luego coloque cuatro en cada plato y esparza sobre más queso rallado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13687,7264,'es','pan de chocolate','Pruebe a preparar estos populares pasteles franceses para el desayuno rellenos de chocolate. Son perfectos para acompañar una taza de café o como capricho a media mañana.','["420 g de harina común","8 g de sal marina","60 g de azúcar en polvo","220 g de mantequilla sin sal (al menos un 82 % de grasa funciona mejor), 20 g blanda","20 g de levadura fresca o 10 g de levadura seca","1 huevo, batido","110ml de leche entera","16 barras de chocolate amargo"]','["Haz la masa en una batidora de pie. Combine la harina, la sal, el azúcar y 20 g de mantequilla blanda. Disuelva la levadura en unos 80 ml de agua tibia, a unos 38 ° C, no demasiado caliente o matará la levadura. Añade 20 g de huevo batido y la leche al bol de la batidora. Vierta la mezcla de levadura y agua y encienda a velocidad baja con un gancho para masa durante aproximadamente 5 minutos hasta que la masa se una para formar una bola áspera. Aumente la velocidad a media-alta y amase durante 6-10 minutos más hasta que la masa esté suave. El tiempo exacto dependerá de su batidora de pie.","Envuelva bien la masa y deje reposar a temperatura ambiente durante 10 minutos. Desenvuelva y extienda la masa formando un rectángulo de unos 4 mm de grosor, unos 40 x 30 cm. Envolver el rectángulo de masa y meter en el congelador durante 1 hora para que repose o en el frigorífico toda la noche.","Mientras tanto, en una hoja de papel para hornear, forme un rectángulo plano con los 200 g restantes de mantequilla (de unos 20 x 30 cm) con un rodillo. Debe tener aproximadamente la mitad del largo del rectángulo de masa, pero del mismo ancho. Mételo en el frigorífico hasta que lo necesites; quieres que esté frío pero flexible.","Saca la masa fría del frigorífico o congelador y coloca la mantequilla en el centro. Dobla los bordes de la masa para que se junten en el centro, cubriendo la mantequilla. Gire la masa 90 grados y extiéndala hasta unos 40 cm de largo, manteniendo el mismo ancho. Manipule la masa con cuidado y regrésela al refrigerador durante 10 a 20 minutos si comienza a calentarse demasiado.","Repita el proceso de doblar los bordes de la masa hacia el centro, luego dóblela nuevamente sobre sí misma como un libro (esto se conoce como doble vuelta). Enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Gira la masa nuevamente 90 grados. Extiéndalo nuevamente y doble los bordes para que se junten en el medio. Enfriar durante 30 minutos más.","Estirar la masa a 32 x 30 cm y cortar 8 rectángulos de 8 x 15 cm cada uno. Coloque una barra de chocolate en un borde largo de cada rectángulo, doble la masa hacia adentro, luego coloque la segunda barra de chocolate al lado de la masa doblada y enrolle la masa alrededor del chocolate, con las costuras de la masa ahora hacia abajo.","Pruebe el dolor de chocolate a 26-29°C (esto es muy importante ya que si lo prueba a una temperatura más alta, la mantequilla entre las capas se derretirá) durante aproximadamente 2-3 horas, hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calienta el horno a 175C/155C ventilador/gas 4, unta el dolor de chocolate con el huevo restante y hornea durante 15-18 minutos hasta que esté dorado y bien cocido. Es mejor comerlo ese mismo día, pero se conserva en un recipiente hermético durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13688,6262,'es','Crema catalana de vainilla','¿Quién mejor para enseñarnos a crear este clásico postre francés que Michel Roux Jr?','["250ml de nata doble","75 ml de leche entera","1 vaina de vainilla, raspada","4 yemas de huevo","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo, más 3-4 cucharadas para la cobertura","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","hoja de hojaldre","½ huevo batido","almendras finamente picadas","azúcar en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1. Poner la nata, la leche y la vaina de vainilla en una cacerola y calentar hasta el punto de ebullición. Tapar y dejar en infusión durante 10 minutos. Batir las yemas de huevo y 3 cucharadas de azúcar hasta que estén pálidas y espesas. Agrega el extracto de vainilla y vierte la nata hirviendo sobre la mezcla. Revuelva bien y luego vierta en dos moldes. Coloque los moldes al baño María y cocine en el horno durante unos 40 minutos o hasta que estén listos. Dejar enfriar.","Calienta la parrilla. Espolvorear la brulée fría con una capa fina y uniforme de azúcar y caramelizar al grill muy caliente (o utilizar un soplete). Repita varias veces hasta obtener una cobertura dorada y crujiente. Deje enfriar y sirva dentro de 2 horas con palitos de hojaldre de almendras tibios (ver más abajo)."]','2026-01-11 12:59:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13689,7268,'es','Crema brulée definitiva','Con una rica y cremosa natilla de vainilla y una cobertura crujiente y caramelizada, nuestra crème brûlée es el postre más placentero. Sigue nuestros consejos profesionales para dominar este clásico dulce francés.','["2 cartones de nata doble, 1 grande (284 ml) más 1 pequeño (142 ml)","100ml de leche entera","1 vaina de vainilla","5 yemas de huevo","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más un poco más para la cobertura"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Coloque cuatro moldes de 175 ml en una fuente para asar de al menos 7,5 cm de profundidad (o un molde para pasteles grande y profundo), una que permita que una bandeja para hornear quede bien encima de los moldes cuando se coloque sobre la parte superior del molde.","Vierta los cartones grandes y pequeños de crema doble en una cacerola mediana con la leche.","Coloque la vaina de vainilla sobre una tabla y córtela a lo largo por la mitad con un cuchillo afilado para partirla en dos. Usa la punta del cuchillo para raspar todas las semillas pequeñas y agregarlas a la mezcla de crema. Echa también la vaina de vainilla y reserva.","Ponga las yemas de huevo y el azúcar en un bol y bata durante 1 minuto con un batidor de mano eléctrico hasta que tenga un color más pálido y un poco esponjoso.","Poner la cacerola con la nata a fuego medio y llevar casi a ebullición. Tan pronto como veas que aparecen burbujas en el borde, retira la sartén del fuego.","Vierta la nata caliente en las yemas de huevo batidas, revolviendo con un batidor de varillas mientras lo hace y raspando las semillas de la sartén.","Coloque un colador fino sobre una jarra o tazón grande y ancho y vierta la mezcla caliente para colarla, fomentando que las semillas de vainilla extraviadas pasen al final.","Con una cuchara grande, retire toda la espuma pálida que se encuentra en la superficie del líquido (serán varias cucharadas) y deséchela. Revuelve la mezcla.","Vierta suficiente agua caliente (del grifo) en la fuente para asar hasta que suba aproximadamente 1,5 cm por los lados de los moldes. Vierta la crema caliente en los moldes para llenarlos hasta arriba; es más fácil echar el último poquito con una cuchara.","Mételos en el horno y coloca una bandeja para hornear sobre la parte superior del molde de modo que quede bien por encima de los moldes y los cubra por completo, pero no todo el molde, dejando un pequeño espacio a un lado para permitir que circule el aire.","Hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que la mezcla esté suave. Para comprobarlo, balancee suavemente la fuente para asar y, si las crème brûlées están listas, se tambalearán un poco como una gelatina en el medio. No dejes que se pongan demasiado firmes.","Saque los moldes de la fuente para asar con guantes de horno y colóquelos sobre una rejilla para que se enfríen solo durante un par de minutos, luego póngalos en el refrigerador para que se enfríen por completo. Esto se puede hacer durante la noche sin afectar la textura.","Cuando esté listo para servir, limpie el borde superior de los platos, espolvoree 1½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo sobre cada molde y extiéndalo con el dorso de una cuchara para cubrirlo por completo.","Rocíe con un poco de agua usando un spray fino (de los que se compran en una tienda de manualidades) para humedecer el azúcar y luego use un soplete para caramelizarlo. Mantén el fuego justo encima del azúcar y sigue moviéndolo una y otra vez hasta que se caramelice. Sirva cuando la brûlée esté firme, o dentro de una o dos horas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13690,7270,'es','Flamenco','Prueba este plato francés a medio camino entre una pizza y una quiche. La crème fraîche mezclada con queso y huevos es un aderezo sabroso junto con deliciosos puerros mantecosos.','["250 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","5 g de sal","5 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, para el bol","20 g de mantequilla","500 g de puerros, solo la parte blanca y verde pálida, en rodajas finas","2 huevos batidos","150 g de crème fraîche o nata agria","80 g de queso comté, gruyere o queso cheddar (use queso cheddar para vegetarianos), rallado","1 ramita grande de tomillo o romero, con las hojas recogidas","¼ de nuez moscada entera, rallada","20 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado","ensalada, para servir (opcional)"]','["Mezcle la harina y la sal en un tazón grande. Mezclar la levadura con 175 ml de agua tibia y dejar reposar 5 minutos para que se espume un poco, luego agregar a la harina y mezclar vigorosamente con una cuchara de metal. Amasar la masa tan pronto como se una sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada durante unos 5 minutos hasta que quede suave. Alternativamente, use una batidora equipada con un gancho para amasar, trabaje la masa durante unos 5 minutos a velocidad media y luego agregue la sal hacia el final del tiempo de mezcla. Déjelo en un recipiente ligeramente engrasado cubierto con un paño de cocina limpio y húmedo hasta que casi duplique su tamaño, aproximadamente 1 hora.","Mientras tanto, calienta la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio y cocina los puerros hasta que se ablanden, unos 8 minutos. No dejes que se coloreen. Cuando esté suave, retira del fuego y deja enfriar. Batir los huevos, la crema fresca, el queso rallado, las hierbas y la nuez moscada y sazonar bien con abundante pimienta y un poco de sal. Incorpora los puerros.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Forrar una bandeja para hornear de 40 x 30 cm con papel para hornear. Enharine ligeramente la superficie de trabajo y extienda la masa para que quepa en la bandeja para hornear; debe tener unos 5 mm de grosor. Haga un pequeño borde alrededor del borde de la masa doblando la masa hacia adentro. Distribuya uniformemente la mezcla de puerros sobre la masa, dejando un borde de 1 cm. Espolvorea sobre el parmesano.","Cocine el flamiche en el horno durante unos 25 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado por encima y la base crujiente. Retirar del horno, cortar en cuadritos y servir con ensalada, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13691,7272,'es','Canapés de higos, burrata y jamón','Utilice rebanadas más grandes de masa madre para nuestras tartinas de higos, burrata y prosciutto para obtener un almuerzo o entrante de aspecto impresionante que sea engañosamente fácil.','["4 rebanadas de masa madre","aceite de oliva, para rociar","2 cucharadas de chutney de higos","2 bolas de 100 g de burrata, escurridas","8 lonchas de prosciutto o jamón de parma","4-6 higos maduros, rasgados o cortados por la mitad","un puñado de tomillo u orégano, hojas recogidas","vinagre balsámico, para servir"]','["Caliente una sartén a fuego alto o caliente la parrilla a fuego alto. Rocíe cada lado del pan con un poco de aceite de oliva, luego tueste en la sartén o debajo de la parrilla durante 2 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté dorado.","Untar el chutney de higos sobre el pan tostado. Corte o pique la burrata en trozos grandes y colóquelos sobre la tostada, cree pequeños nidos de prosciutto encima y luego agregue los trozos de higo. Espolvorea con tomillo y luego rocía con más aceite de oliva y un poco de vinagre balsámico."]','2026-01-11 12:59:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13692,7274,'es','tarta de manzana francesa','¿Busca un postre espectacular para una cena? Si tienes tiempo, merece la pena preparar una tarta de manzana francesa, un clásico de la pastelería de escaparate.','["125 g de mantequilla fría, en cubos","200 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 huevo batido","1 ¾ kg (aproximadamente 12) comiendo manzanas, como Cox''s, Russet o Granny Smith","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada de calvados, coñac o brandy (opcional)","25 g de mantequilla, derretida","3 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque","azúcar glas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Para la masa, frote la mantequilla con la harina, el azúcar y una pizca de sal en un bol hasta que se desmorone. Mezcle el huevo hasta formar una masa, luego forme forma de disco. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos. Se mantendrá frío durante dos días.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener aproximadamente el grosor de una moneda de £1 y úsela para forrar un molde para tarta estriado de 23 cm, dejando algo que sobresalga. Forre con un disco de papel para hornear lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir los bordes y rellénelo con algunos frijoles para hornear para darle peso (use arroz seco o lentejas si no tiene frijoles para hornear). Hornee durante 15 minutos, luego retire el pergamino y los frijoles y hornee durante 10-15 minutos más hasta que la masa esté dorada. Recorte la masa que sobresalga con un cuchillo de sierra. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, reserve cuatro de las manzanas, luego pélelas, descorazone y pique el resto en trozos grandes. Póngalos en una cacerola poco profunda con 2 cucharadas de agua, todo menos 1 cucharada de azúcar y alcohol, si lo usa. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 25-30 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente y agregando más agua si es necesario, hasta que las manzanas se hayan convertido en un puré. Prueba la mezcla y endulza con más azúcar, si es necesario.","Enciende el horno a 210C/190C ventilador/gas 8. Pela, quita el corazón y corta por la mitad las manzanas reservadas, luego córtalas en rodajas del mismo tamaño. Extienda el puré de manzana sobre la base de la tarta y luego coloque las rodajas de manzana en círculos concéntricos limpios, comenzando desde el exterior. Unte las manzanas con mantequilla, luego esparza sobre el azúcar reservada y hornee por otros 20-25 minutos hasta que estén doradas.","Mezcla la mermelada con 1 cucharada de agua caliente de un hervidor recién hervido. Cuando la tarta haya terminado de hornearse, glasear generosamente con la mermelada y dejar enfriar un poco. Sirva caliente o frío, espolvoreado con azúcar glas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13693,7276,'es','Ensalada De Huerto','Aproveche al máximo los espárragos y rábanos de la nueva temporada en una vibrante ensalada con aderezo estilo francés. Genial para una barbacoa','["8 espárragos cortados por la mitad","250 g de judías verdes partidas por la mitad","250 g de brócoli de tallo largo, cortado en trozos de 2 cm","200 g de guisantes, frescos o congelados","8 rábanos, rebanados","1 repollo puntiagudo, rallado","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","un puñado de hojas de menta picadas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","1 limón, exprimido"]','["Para hacer el aderezo, combine todos los ingredientes en un bol y sazone bien.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola con agua con sal y llene un recipiente con agua helada. Cocine los espárragos durante 2 minutos, luego transfiéralo al agua helada con una espumadera. Cocine los frijoles por 4 minutos y repita, luego haga lo mismo con el brócoli (cocine por 2½ minutos) y los guisantes (cocine por 1 min). Escurrir y secar con papel de cocina.","Vierta en un bol con los rábanos, el repollo, las cebolletas y la menta. Sirve el aderezo a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13694,7278,'es','Mocha madeleines','Dale un toque moderno al clásico postre francés con estas bonitas mini magdalenas de moca. Estos pasteles fáciles son el regalo perfecto para el té de la tarde.','["100 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para la lata","85 g de harina común","15 g de cacao en polvo","2 huevos, separados","2 cucharaditas de miel","1 ½ cucharada de café granulado","80 g de azúcar en polvo","15 g de azúcar demerara","25 gramos de chocolate blanco"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y unte con mantequilla un molde para magdalenas de 12 orificios o un molde para mini magdalenas de 24 orificios. En una sartén pequeña, calienta la mantequilla a fuego medio hasta que esté espumosa y dorada con aroma a nuez. Dejar enfriar.","Tamice la harina y el cacao en un tazón grande, luego agregue las yemas de huevo, la miel, el café, la mantequilla derretida y ambos azúcares. Batir las claras a punto de nieve y luego incorporarlas a la mezcla de cacao.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde, llenando hasta la mitad cada uno de los agujeros de las magdalenas. Enfriar en la nevera durante 1 h.","Hornee durante 7 minutos si usa un molde para mini magdalenas de 24 orificios, o durante 10 a 12 minutos si usa un molde de 12 orificios. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar.","Derretir el chocolate blanco en el microondas en ráfagas cortas y luego rociar sobre las magdalenas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13695,7280,'es','Filete picado con papas fritas y salsa bearnesa trampa','Una receta francesa clásica de hamburguesas con patatas fritas y sin pan, que se puede encontrar en todas las brasseries y bistrós. A los niños les encantará y es fácil de crear juntos en casa.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","4 chalotas, muy finamente picadas","600 g de carne de res recién molida (pídele al carnicero algo que tenga aproximadamente un 15 % de grasa; nosotros usamos carne de res)","8 ramitas de tomillo, hojas recogidas y picadas","2 tsp Dijon mustard","2 cucharadas de harina común","200 ml de crema fresca","1 yema de huevo","6 ramitas de estragón, con las hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","ensalada verde aliñada, para servir","4 patatas grandes para asar (como Maris Piper o Russet), peladas","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén y añadir aproximadamente 3/4 de las chalotas. Cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que estén suaves y comiencen a caramelizarse en algunos lugares. Dejar enfriar.","En un tazón grande, combine la carne, el tomillo, 1 cucharadita de Dijon y las chalotas enfriadas. Sazone con pimienta negra pero no con sal en esta etapa (esto puede hacer que la carne se seque). Forme cuatro hamburguesas y espolvoree con harina. Poner en un plato, cubrir con film transparente y enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos (o hasta 2 horas).","Mientras tanto, prepara las patatas fritas. Corta las patatas en trozos finos y viertelas en un recipiente grande con agua fría a medida que avanzas. Escurrir, luego transferir a una cacerola grande y cubrir con agua fresca y sazonar con sal. Llevar a fuego lento, hervir durante 1 minuto y luego escurrir bien. Coloca las patatas fritas sobre un paño de cocina limpio o sobre papel de cocina y extiéndelas en una sola capa para que se sequen y se enfríen rápidamente. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Vierta las patatas fritas en un bol con el aceite vegetal y 1 cucharadita de sal. Mezcle para cubrir y luego extiéndalo en dos bandejas para hornear grandes. Cocine durante 45 minutos o hasta que estén crujientes y doradas.","Cuando las patatas fritas estén a unos 15 minutos de estar cocidas, calienta una sartén grande con un chorrito de aceite. Sazone las hamburguesas con sal por ambos lados y cocínelas durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que tengan una corteza de color marrón oscuro pero todavía estén ligeramente rosadas por dentro (o cocínelas un poco más si las prefiere bien cocidas). Transfiera a un plato, cubra con papel de aluminio y reserve para mantener el calor mientras prepara la salsa.","Regrese la sartén al fuego y agregue las chalotas restantes. Freír durante 1-2 minutos para que se ablanden, luego retirar la sartén del fuego y agregar la crema fresca, el Dijon restante, la yema de huevo y el estragón, así como el jugo restante de las hamburguesas de carne. Sazone bien. Sirve el bistec con patatas fritas y una ensalada verde, con la salsa bearnesa al lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13696,5511,'es','Cassoulet más ligero','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta cazuela francesa, tradicionalmente rica y cocida a fuego lento, se hace más saludable con filete de jamón magro y paleta de cerdo para una comida abundante y cálida.','["500 g de judías secas","7 dientes de ajo","5 ramitas de tomillo","3 ramitas de romero","200 g de filete de jamón ahumado, sin piel ni grasa","1 hoja de laurel","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla mediana, picada","1 zanahoria grande (200 g de peso total), picada en trozos de 1 cm","2 cucharaditas de mantequilla","500 g de paleta de cerdo, cortada en trozos de 4 a 5 cm y sin exceso de grasa","125ml de vino blanco","Lata de 230 g de tomates pera","3 salchichas de Toulouse","25 g de panko o pan rallado seco grueso","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de ralladura de limón finamente rallada","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza"]','["Pon los frijoles en un bol muy grande. Echar más de 3 veces su volumen de agua para que queden bien cubiertas, ya que se absorberán mucho. Cubrir con film transparente y dejar en remojo durante la noche.","Coloca los frijoles en un colador grande para escurrirlos, desechando el agua. Ponlos en una cacerola grande y profunda y cúbrelos con agua fría y fresca (unos 2 litros), de modo que quede unos 3 cm por encima de los frijoles. Agrega 3 de los dientes de ajo, 2 ramitas de tomillo y 1 ramita de romero. Llevar a ebullición, tapar la cacerola hasta la mitad y dejar hervir a fuego lento durante 1 hora y media, comprobando el nivel del agua de vez en cuando. Cortar el jamón en trozos del tamaño de manteca. Poner los mantecas de cerdo con las judías, comprobando que aún quede agua suficiente para cubrirlo todo. Cocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos más.","Envuelva las ramitas restantes de tomillo y romero en la hoja de laurel y átelas con una cuerda para hacer un bouquet garni. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y profunda para saltear, apta para horno, o en una cacerola ignífuga. Poner la cebolla y la zanahoria en la sartén y sofreír a fuego medio durante 5 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando. Pica finamente los 4 dientes de ajo restantes. Derretir la mantequilla en la sartén, añadir el ajo y sofreír durante 2 minutos. Sube el fuego, añade la paleta de cerdo y fríe durante 2-3 minutos hasta que ya no esté rosada. Vierta el vino y déjelo burbujear durante 1 min hasta que se reduzca ligeramente. Agregue los tomates, agregue el bouquet garni y cocine a fuego lento durante 3 minutos hasta que esté picante. Sazone bien con pimienta y 2 pizcas de sal. Retirar y reservar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Escurrir los frijoles en un colador grande colocado sobre un tazón grande para poder reservar el líquido de cocción (debe tener unos 850 ml). Retire y deseche los tallos de las hierbas. Aplaste los dientes de ajo ablandados con una cuchara y luego revuelva con los frijoles y la manteca. Vierta esta mezcla en la sartén con la paleta de cerdo y luego vierta 600 ml del líquido de cocción reservado. Cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 30 minutos hasta que tenga una consistencia húmeda y espeso.","Mientras tanto, coloque las salchichas en una bandeja para hornear pequeña antiadherente y ase durante 20 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad, hasta que se doren. Retirar, cortar en rodajas diagonales de 1 cm de grosor y bajar el horno a 160ºC/140ºC ventilador/gas 3.","Introduzca las rodajas de salchicha en los frijoles, transfiera el cassoulet al horno y hornee durante 11/2 horas, sin tapar. Mientras tanto, mezcle el panko rallado, el ajo, la ralladura de limón, el aceite y un poco de pimienta. A estas alturas la carne debería estar casi tierna y el cassoulet húmedo y jugoso, no seco. (Si es necesario, vierta un poco del líquido de cocción reservado). Esparza la mezcla de migajas y regrese al horno durante 20 a 25 minutos hasta que la cobertura esté dorada."]','2026-01-11 12:59:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13697,7282,'es','Cerdo en una olla con naranja, aceitunas y laurel','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una cazuela de cerdo al estilo provenzal con vibrantes sabores cítricos, chalotas dulces, patatas nuevas y tomates secos.','["85 g de tomate seco en aceite, picado en trozos grandes, más 2-3 cucharadas de aceite del frasco","1 kg de paleta de cerdo, cortada en cubos gruesos","2 cucharadas de harina común, sazonada","400 g de chalota (ver consejo a continuación)","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","3 hojas de laurel","unas ramitas de tomillo","5 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","400 ml de vino tinto","tira de ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","350 ml de caldo de pollo","Lata de 400g de tomate pera picado","800 g de patata nueva grande, pelada y cortada por la mitad o cortada en rodajas gruesas, según el tamaño","Paquete 70g aceituna negra seca"]','["Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite de tomate seco en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego. Mezcle la carne de cerdo con la harina, elimine el exceso, luego dórela en 2 tandas y transfiérala a un tazón grande una vez que esté dorada y con costra. Use un poco más de aceite para el segundo lote si es necesario.","Vierta 1 cucharada de aceite, chalotes, cebolla, hojas de laurel y tomillo en la sartén y fríalos durante 5 minutos hasta que estén dorados aquí y allá. Agregue el ajo y los tomates secos, cocine por 1 minuto más y luego vierta sobre la carne de cerdo.","Vierta el vino y el jugo de naranja en el plato, agregue la ralladura de naranja y deje hervir durante 5 minutos. Vuelva a agregar la carne y la cebolla.","Cuando esté listo para cocinar, caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Agregue el caldo, los tomates enlatados, las patatas y las aceitunas a la cacerola y luego cocine a fuego lento. Empuja las patatas lo más que puedas por debajo de la superficie del líquido. Cubra, dejando un pequeño espacio a un lado, luego cocine en el horno durante 2½ horas, o hasta que la carne esté lo suficientemente tierna como para cortarla con una cuchara. Retire el exceso de grasa con una cuchara y deje reposar el guiso durante unos minutos antes de servirlo en tazones poco profundos."]','2026-01-11 12:59:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13698,6280,'es','La cassoulet de Raymond Blanc','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. El cassoulet rústico de Raymond Blanc es rico y cálido: lo mejor es cocinar a fuego lento.','["140 g de chicharrón","140 g de tocino ahumado","300 g de salchicha de ajo","600 g de judías secas, remojadas durante la noche en 3 veces su volumen de agua","1 rama de apio","1 cebolla pequeña, preferiblemente suave de piel blanca","1 zanahoria grande","6 dientes de ajo","2 tomates pera maduros","25 g de grasa de ganso o 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 ramo de guarnición","8 pizcas de sal marina","2 pizcas de pimienta negra recién molida","1 diente, ligeramente machacado","2 cucharaditas de jugo de limón","4 muslos de pato confitados","60 g de grasa de ganso o 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","40 g de pan rallado seco","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","un puñado de perejil fresco, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Para cortar las carnes, enrolle el chicharrón como si fuera un panecillo suizo. Con la costura debajo, use un cuchillo muy afilado para cortar el rollo en rodajas finas y luego corte las rodajas enrolladas en dados. Picar el tocino en cubos pequeños (lardons). Cortar la salchicha de ajo en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor.","Escurre los frijoles remojados y desecha el agua de remojo. Vierta los frijoles en una cacerola grande, agregue el chicharrón cortado en cubitos y la manteca de cerdo y cubra con agua fresca y fría. Llevar a ebullición y blanquear durante 15-20 minutos. Escurrir los frijoles, la cáscara y la manteca en un colador y desechar el agua de cocción.","Pica el apio, la cebolla y la zanahoria en trozos grandes. Pelar los dientes de ajo pero dejarlos enteros. Corta cada tomate en ocho gajos. (Nunca se ven tomates en una cassoulet tradicional, pero al chef Raymond Blanc le gustan por su color y dulzura, así que les pone un par). Precalienta el horno a 120 °C/ventilador a 100 °C. (Si cocina en un horno a gas, use la marca 2).","Calentar la grasa de oca o el aceite de oliva en una cazuela ignífuga de 26 cm o en una sartén honda resistente al fuego a fuego lento y sudar el apio, la cebolla, la zanahoria y el ajo durante 5 minutos. Agregue los tomates y el bouquet garni y cocine lentamente para obtener una caramelización azucarada (aproximadamente 5 minutos). Agrega la salchicha, los frijoles, el chicharrón y los mantecas y vierte 1,2 litros/2 pintas de agua. Llevar a ebullición, quitar la espuma y añadir la sal, la pimienta, el clavo y el zumo de limón.","Pasar la cazuela al horno y cocinar, destapado, durante 2 horas, revolviendo cada hora. Al final de este tiempo, los frijoles estarán suaves y de textura cremosa y el jugo debería haberse espesado. Es posible que tengas que cocinarlo durante más de 2 horas (digamos hasta 2½ horas) para llegar a esta etapa; depende","Sacar la cassoulet del horno. Enterrar los muslos de pato en las judías y espolvorear por encima la grasa de oca o el aceite de oliva, el pan rallado y el ajo. Regrese al horno y cocine por 2 horas más. Sirve el cassoulet en tazones, espolvoreado con perejil picado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13699,7286,'es','Magdalenas de naranja sanguina y chocolate negro','Estas delicadas magdalenas, que se disfrutan mejor recién salidas del horno, bañadas en chocolate amargo y espolvoreadas con polvo de naranja sanguina, son un postre delicioso.','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco para engrasar","2 huevos grandes","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura de 2 naranjas sanguinas más el jugo de ½ (aproximadamente 2 cucharadas)","100 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","140 g de chocolate negro (60-70% cacao), finamente picado","polvo de naranja sanguina (opcional, ver más abajo)"]','["Coloque la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña a fuego medio hasta que forme espuma y adquiera un color marrón nuez; observe la sartén con atención, ya que la mantequilla puede quemarse rápidamente. Vierta en un bol y deje enfriar.","Batir los huevos, el azúcar y la ralladura en un tazón grande con un batidor eléctrico durante unos 5 minutos hasta que estén espesos y pálidos. Agregue el jugo y mezcle para combinar. Mezcle la harina y el polvo para hornear, luego tamice la mezcla de masa, un tercio a la vez, e incorpore.","Agregue una cucharada grande de la masa a la mantequilla y mezcle hasta que quede suave y combinada. Vierta esto en la masa y dóblelo suavemente hasta que esté completamente combinado. Presione una hoja de film transparente sobre la superficie de la mezcla y déjela enfriar durante la noche.","Unos 30 minutos antes de que quieras hornear las magdalenas, engrasa un molde para magdalenas de 12 agujeros con un poco más de mantequilla y espolvorea con un poco de harina. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y poner el molde en el congelador para que se enfríe durante 30 minutos. Retire la masa del refrigerador y agregue aproximadamente 1 cucharada colmada a cada agujero de magdalena; tenga cuidado de no llenar demasiado, ya que se hornearán por el borde y no formarán la joroba característica. Dependiendo del tamaño de su lata, le quedará un poco de masa; hornee en tandas o guarde el resto en el refrigerador y hornee dentro de tres días.","Hornee en el horno durante 10-12 minutos o hasta que estén dorados en los bordes. Coloque inmediatamente las magdalenas sobre una rejilla y déjelas enfriar por completo. Coloque el chocolate en un recipiente apto para microondas y caliéntelo en el microondas a potencia alta en ráfagas de 30 segundos hasta que aproximadamente tres cuartas partes del chocolate se hayan derretido. Retirar del microondas y revolver vigorosamente hasta que el chocolate restante se derrita (este es un método simple de atemperar y solo garantiza que el chocolate se endurezca correctamente a temperatura ambiente). Sumerja cada magdalena hasta la mitad en el chocolate derretido, dejando que escurra el exceso, luego colóquelas sobre una hoja de papel para hornear. A medida que el chocolate comience a fraguar, pero aún un poco pegajoso, espolvoree con un poco de polvo de naranja sanguina (abajo), si lo usa, y déjelo enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:59:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13700,7288,'es','Patatas salteadas con tocino, manteca y perejil','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta fabulosa guarnición francesa de papas fritas y tocino ahumado salado está terminada con ajo y hierbas y combina perfectamente con carnes y aves asadas.','["1 kg de patatas, cortadas en trozos de 2 cm/¾","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","300 g de manteca de tocino ahumado","25 g de mantequilla sin sal","paquete pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado","2 cucharaditas de perifollo picado","1 ramita de estragón, hojas picadas","1 chalote de plátano, finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo machacados"]','["En una cacerola grande a fuego alto, cocine a fuego lento las patatas durante 5 minutos en suficiente agua para cubrirlas, luego escúrralas en un colador y déjelas durante 1 minuto para que escape el vapor.","En un tazón pequeño, mezcle todos los ingredientes para el persillade y reserve. Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego alto, añadir los mantecas de cerdo y cocinar durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente caramelizadas. Agrega las patatas, luego la mantequilla.","Sazone con sal y pimienta negra recién molida y cocine durante 10 minutos, revolviendo regularmente, hasta que esté completamente dorado. Retire el exceso de grasa con una cuchara y agregue el persillade. Pruebe y ajuste la sazón si es necesario."]','2026-01-11 12:59:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13701,7290,'es','Tartas de manzana chinon','Estas pequeñas tartas francesas son maravillosamente mantecosas y crujientes, y están glaseadas con gelatina de vino tinto: el final perfecto para una cena especial para dos.','["375 ml de vino tinto, como Chinon","200 g de azúcar para mermelada","1 anís estrellado","1 diente","Pieza de 2½ cm de canela en rama","pizca de pimienta de Jamaica","½ vaina de vainilla partida, sin semillas","Paquete de 320 g de hojaldre con mantequilla ya enrollado","4 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","2-3 manzanas comiendo (yo usé Pink Lady)","3 cucharadas de gelatina de vino tinto (ver receta anterior)","100ml de crema fresca","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","3 vainas de cardamomo, desechadas las vainas y molidas las semillas"]','["Para hacer la gelatina de vino tinto, ponga el vino tinto, la mermelada, el azúcar, el anís estrellado, el clavo, la rama de canela, la pimienta de Jamaica, la vaina de vainilla partida y las semillas en una cacerola mediana. Revuelva y luego caliente suavemente para disolver el azúcar. Sube el fuego y deja hervir durante 20 minutos hasta que se reduzca y quede almibarado. Colar en un tarro pequeño de mermelada esterilizado y dejar enfriar por completo. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta 1 mes.","Sacar la masa del frigorífico y dejarla a temperatura ambiente durante 10 minutos, luego desenrollarla. Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto y calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Corta círculos de masa de 2 x 13 cm, usando un plato como guía, y colócalos en una bandeja para hornear antiadherente. Espolvorea cada círculo con 1 cucharada de azúcar y hornea durante 5 minutos para que se caramelicen, vigilando con atención para que el azúcar no se queme. Retirar de la parrilla. Se puede preparar con unas horas de antelación y dejar tapado y fuera del frigorífico.","Pelar, cortar en cuartos y descorazonar las manzanas, cortarlas en rodajas de 2 mm de grosor y colocarlas encima de la masa. Espolvorea el azúcar restante y mételo en el horno durante 20-25 minutos hasta que la masa esté bien cocida y dorada y las manzanas se ablanden. Retirar y dejar enfriar un poco. Caliente 3 cucharadas de gelatina de vino tinto en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento con 1 cucharadita de agua para que quede un poco más líquida, luego unte la parte superior de las tartas.","Vierta la crème fraîche en un bol, tamice el azúcar glas y el cardamomo y mezcle. Levante con cuidado las tartas calientes sobre platos para servir y sírvalas con la crema fresca de cardamomo."]','2026-01-11 12:59:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13702,4675,'es','pesto de verano','Un cruce entre sopa y guiso, este saludable plato francés está repleto de verduras y frijoles, perfecto como almuerzo ligero. Si se prepara con antelación, se conservará en el frigorífico un par de días.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 puerros, finamente cortados","1 calabacín grande, finamente picado","1 litro de caldo de verduras hirviendo (hecho desde cero o con caldo reducido en sal)","Lata de 400 g de cannellini o judías verdes escurridas","200 g de judías verdes picadas","3 tomates, picados","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","paquete pequeño de albahaca","40 g de parmesano recién rallado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y sofreír los puerros y el calabacín durante 5 minutos para que se ablanden. Vierta el caldo, agregue tres cuartos de las judías con las judías verdes, la mitad de los tomates y cocine a fuego lento durante 5-8 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los frijoles y los tomates restantes, el ajo y la albahaca en un procesador de alimentos (o en un tazón con una batidora) hasta que quede suave, luego agregue el parmesano. Agregue la salsa a la sopa, cocine durante 1 minuto, luego sirva la mitad en tazones o viértala en un termo para un almuerzo para llevar. Enfríe el resto. Se conservará durante un par de días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13703,7292,'es','Dauphinoise de hinojo','Las patatas gratinadas son un clásico del bistró francés y esta versión cremosa para dos tiene un suave sabor a anís gracias al hinojo añadido.','["225 g de patatas medianas, en rodajas muy finas","1 bulbo de hinojo pequeño, en rodajas, las hojas reservadas","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","75ml de leche entera","100ml de nata doble","mantequilla, para moldes","2 cucharadas de parmesano finamente rallado (o alternativa vegetariana)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner\r\npatatas, hinojo y ajo en una sartén antiadherente mediana.\r\nVierta la leche y la nata doble, sazone bien y cocine a fuego lento.\r\nsuavemente, tapado, durante 10 minutos, revolviendo hasta la mitad\r\nhasta que las patatas estén tiernas.","Divida la mezcla entre 2 pequeñas\r\n(unos 150 ml) de moldes untados con mantequilla y\r\nespolvorear con parmesano. Hornear durante 40 minutos hasta que las patatas estén\r\ndorado y tierno al pincharlo con un\r\ncuchillo. Corta las hojas de hinojo reservadas.\r\nantes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13704,7294,'es','Crema brûlée ligera','El secreto de este pudín francés más saludable es hacer que la crema esté muy espesa al principio ya que, a diferencia de la receta normal, no se hornea después.','["4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada de natillas en polvo","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","200ml de leche semidesnatada","2 yemas de huevo grandes","125ml de nata líquida","1 vaina de vainilla","140 g de crema fresca semidesnatada"]','["Revuelva 2 cucharadas de azúcar, las natillas\r\npolvo y harina de maíz en un tazón mediano\r\ncon 2 cucharadas de leche para hacer una masa suave\r\npegar. Batir las yemas con un tenedor.\r\nhasta que esté bien combinado. Vierta el resto\r\nleche en una cacerola, preferiblemente antiadherente, luego\r\nvierte la nata. Cortar la vaina de vainilla.\r\na lo largo y raspar las semillas\r\nla leche. Deje caer la vaina en la sartén y\r\nllevar la leche cremosa a ebullición –\r\ntan pronto como veas algunas burbujas subiendo\r\na la superficie, retirar del fuego.","Vierta y revuelva lentamente la leche caliente.\r\nen la mezcla de harina de maíz, incluida la\r\nvaina de vainilla, asegurándose de que las yemas\r\nestén bien mezclados. Transfiera a un recipiente limpio.\r\nsartén. Cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo\r\ncontinuamente con una cuchara de madera, durante\r\nunos 15-20 minutos hasta que la mezcla esté muy\r\ngrueso – cuando arrastras la cuchara\r\nel fondo de la cacerola, debe dejar\r\nuna línea limpia. debería\r\nserá mucho más espeso después de unos 10 minutos,\r\npero sigue revolviendo hasta que la mezcla tenga\r\nlo suficientemente espesa como para parecer suave\r\ncrema batida o mayonesa. Sigue ajustando el calor\r\npara que no se venga la mezcla\r\nhasta que hierva o se sobrecaliente, ya que puede cuajar y formar grumos. si esto\r\nsucede, bata la mezcla hasta que quede suave\r\ncon un batidor de varillas.","Retirar del fuego, transferir a un\r\nbol y dejar enfriar durante 15-20 minutos,\r\nrevolviendo ocasionalmente para evitar que se forme piel\r\nde formar. Retire la vaina de vainilla.\r\nAgregue la crème fraîche y divida\r\nla mezcla entre 4 moldes pequeños\r\n(aproximadamente 125-150 ml de capacidad cada uno). difundir\r\nnivelar las mezclas, luego enfriar, sin tapar,\r\ndurante la noche. Al no taparlos, se forma una fina\r\nse puede formar piel encima de las brûlées,\r\nlo que ayudará a sostener la capa de caramelo.","Antes de servir, vierta el resto\r\nazúcar sobre la parte superior de cada brûlée\r\n(deje 1½ cucharadita por molde) y alise\r\ncon el dorso de la cuchara. a\r\ncaramelizar, utilizar un soplete. Espera\r\nla llama justo encima del azúcar y mantener\r\nmoviéndolo hasta que esté uniformemente caramelizado (no\r\ntarda demasiado o calentarás el\r\ndemasiada crema pastelera). Si la natilla se ve\r\ncomo si se hubiera ablandado un poco, poner\r\nlos moldes en el frigorífico durante 5-10 minutos\r\npara reafirmarlo nuevamente. Servir mientras el\r\nel caramelo todavía está quebradizo."]','2026-01-11 12:59:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13705,7298,'es','Guiso de pescado de verano con rouille','Evoca pensamientos sobre las vacaciones en el Mediterráneo con esta comida ligera pero placentera para dos','["6 langostinos grandes, crudos y con cáscara","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva suave","150 ml de vino blanco seco","200 ml de caldo de pescado (un cubo está bien)","1 bulbo de hinojo pequeño (aproximadamente 140 g/5 oz) cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 cebolla pequeña, en rodajas finas","3 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","1 patata grande, de unos 200 g/8 oz (yo usé King Edward)","1 naranja","1 anís estrellado","1 hoja de laurel","1½ cucharadita de pasta de harissa (yo usé Belazu)","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","un puñado de mejillones o almejas","200 g de pescado blanco sin piel, capturado de forma sostenible (yo usé lomo de bacalao), cortado en trozos muy gruesos","pocas hojas de tomillo","3 cucharadas de mayonesa de aceite de oliva comprada","pan crujiente de buena calidad"]','["Retuerce las cabezas de las gambas y luego\r\npelar las patas y las cáscaras, pero dejar\r\nlas colas intactas. Desvenar cada langostino. Freír las conchas en 1 cucharada.\r\naceite durante 5 minutos, hasta que esté rosado oscuro y dorado\r\nen parches. Añadir el vino, reducir a\r\ndos tercios y luego vierta el caldo. Cepa\r\nen una jarra, desechando las cáscaras.","Calentar el resto del aceite en una freidora.\r\nsartén o cazuela. Agrega el hinojo, la cebolla\r\ny ajo, sazonar, luego tapar y\r\ncocine suavemente durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden.\r\nMientras tanto, pela la patata y córtala en\r\nTrozos de 2 cm. Poner en una cacerola fría.\r\nAgua, llevar a ebullición y cocinar durante 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté casi tierno. Escurrir en un colador.","Pelar una tira de ralladura de naranja.\r\nPoner la ralladura, el anís estrellado, el laurel y ½ cucharadita.\r\nharissa en la sartén. Freír suavemente, sin tapar,\r\ndurante 5-10 minutos, hasta que las verduras estén\r\nsuave, dulce y dorado.","Agregue el puré de tomate, cocine por 2 minutos,\r\nluego agregue los tomates y el caldo. cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que la salsa espese\r\nligeramente. Sazone al gusto. la salsa puede\r\nprepararse con anticipación y luego recalentarse más tarde\r\nel dia. Mientras tanto, fregar los mejillones o\r\nalmejas y retire las barbas fibrosas.\r\nCualquiera que esté abierto debe ser tocado.\r\nbruscamente en la encimera – si no lo hacen\r\nCierra después de unos segundos, deséchalos.","Vuelva a calentar la salsa si es necesario, luego revuelva\r\nla patata, los trozos de pescado y las gambas\r\nmuy suavemente en el guiso. traer de vuelta a\r\nhervir, luego tapar y cocinar a fuego lento\r\ndurante 3 min. Esparcir los mejillones o las almejas\r\nsobre el guiso, luego cubra y cocine por\r\n2 minutos más o hasta que las cáscaras tengan\r\nabierto de par en par. Descartar los que queden\r\ncerrado. Los trozos de pescado deben desmenuzarse.\r\nfácilmente y las gambas deben quedar rosadas\r\na través. Esparcir con las hojas de tomillo.","Para hacer la rouille rápida, revuelve el resto.\r\nde la harissa por la mayonesa.\r\nSirva el guiso en tazones y cubra con\r\ncucharadas de rouille, que se derretirá\r\nla salsa y enriquecerla. tener algo bueno\r\npan listo, como definitivamente querrás\r\nLimpiar los jugos."]','2026-01-11 12:59:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13706,7300,'es','Baguette rellena Niçoise','Para obtener el mejor sándwich transportable, ahueque un palito francés y rellénelo con atún, aceitunas, anchoas y huevos.','["3 huevos grandes","Lata de 130g de atún en aceite de oliva, aceite reservado","1 flauta grande o baguette de aproximadamente 54 cm","2 cucharadas de mayonesa","3 tomates, con las puntas cortadas y en rodajas gruesas","12-24 hojas de albahaca (dependiendo de cómo te guste)","12 aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas","8 filetes de anchoa","1 chalota, finamente picada","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","½  tsp Dijon mustard"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola pequeña con agua.\r\nAgrega los huevos y deja hervir durante 10 minutos. drenaje,\r\nluego pase los huevos bajo el grifo frío para\r\nenfriar rápidamente. Descascara y corta con cuidado\r\nlos huevos en cuartos en forma de cuña.\r\nMientras tanto, mezcle todos los ingredientes para\r\nla vinagreta de chalota con condimento\r\ny agregue el aceite del atún.","Cortar el pan por la mitad a lo largo, pero no\r\nhasta el final, por lo que se abre como un\r\nlibro. Use sus dedos para sacar cualquier\r\npan que se desprende fácilmente del\r\nmitad superior para ahuecar un poco el pan.","En la mitad inferior del pan, rocíe\r\nsobre la vinagreta. Revuelve la mayonesa\r\nen el atún y esparcir por encima. Ahora\r\ncoloque una capa de tomates, albahaca, aceitunas,\r\nhuevos y anchoas.","Enrollar bien en papel para hornear\r\ny asegurar a lo largo con elástico\r\nbandas o cuerdas. Presione muy bien todo\r\nel camino hacia abajo del pan, luego enfríe\r\ndurante la noche. Cortar en rodajas si se alimenta\r\nuna multitud, o en 4 longitudes."]','2026-01-11 12:59:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13707,7302,'es','Tarta tatin de tomate y cebolla caramelizada','Una versión vegetariana y salada de tarta tatin: perfecta para una cena ligera','["50 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, cortada en gajos finos","1 cucharadita de azúcar","85 g de mantequilla","175 g de harina con levadura","50 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","un puñado pequeño de hojas frescas de tomillo","1 yema de huevo grande de corral","25 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de azúcar","1 diente de ajo gordo, en rodajas finas","5 tomates pera, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","varias ramitas de tomillo","300 g de tomates cherry"]','["Calentar la mantequilla y el aceite en una sartén.\r\nsartén hasta que la mantequilla se derrita.\r\nCocine la cebolla a fuego medio.\r\ncalentar durante unos 10 minutos hasta que\r\nmaravillosamente dorado, revolviendo con frecuencia.\r\nAgregue el azúcar y cocine por\r\nun par de minutos más. consejo\r\nla cebolla y el jugo en un bol\r\ny dejar a un lado. Precalienta el horno a\r\n200C/gas 6/ventilador 180C.","Para la masa, frote la mantequilla con la harina para obtener migajas finas. Revuelva\r\nen el parmesano, el tomillo y un\r\npizca de sal. Añade la yema de huevo y\r\n2 cucharadas de agua fría, luego mezcle para hacer\r\nuna masa. Envolver en film transparente.","Para los tomates, calentar la mantequilla.\r\ny aceite en un molde para tarta tatin de 20 cm sobre la\r\nhornilla hasta que esté bastante caliente. Agrega el azúcar\r\ny ajo, luego poner la ciruela\r\ntomates cortados hacia abajo con unos cuantos\r\nramitas de tomillo y chisporrotear para no más\r\nde 1 minuto. Dispersión en el todo\r\ntomates cherry y mételos un poco\r\nmás tomillo. Quitar el fuego y\r\nesparcir las cebollas encima. Temporada\r\ncon sal y pimienta.","Extiende la masa hasta que sea un poco más grande que la parte superior del molde. Colóquelo sobre las cebollas y meta el exceso por los lados.","Hornee en una bandeja para hornear durante 25 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos, invierta un plato encima y voltee la tarta sobre él. Espolvoree con más tomillo y pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 12:59:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13708,7304,'es','Mini canutillos','El té de la tarde se vuelve glamuroso con estos dedos de masa choux estilo pastelería parisina con relleno de crema de licor de frutos rojos','["150ml de leche","100 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubitos","200 g de harina común, tamizada","4 huevos grandes, batidos","200ml de leche","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla, o 1 vaina de vainilla, dividida por la mitad","2 yemas de huevo grandes","4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de harina común","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","200ml de nata doble","Paquete de 500 g de azúcar glas para fondant, tamizada","colorante alimentario","chispas y decoración comestible para pasteles (usamos Smarties y Mini Smarties)"]','["Para hacer los bollos calentar la leche,\r\nmantequilla y 150 ml de agua muy suavemente en\r\nuna cacerola mediana hasta que todos los\r\nla mantequilla se ha derretido. Consigue la harina y\r\nun poco de sal lista, luego aumentar el fuego\r\ny llevar el líquido a ebullición. tan pronto\r\nmientras esté hirviendo retirar del fuego y\r\nincorporar la harina y una pizca de sal con\r\nuna cuchara de madera. Sigue batiendo hasta que\r\nla mezcla es suave y se desprende\r\nlos lados de la sartén. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos.","Batir los huevos, poco a poco, hasta obtener\r\nmasa suave y brillante. Vierta en una tubería\r\nbolsa con boquilla lisa de 1,5-2 cm y set\r\na un lado hasta que esté listo para hornear.","Para hacer el relleno, trae la leche justo\r\na hervir en un cazo con la vainilla\r\npegar o dividir la vaina. Mientras tanto, bata\r\nJuntar las yemas, el azúcar y la harina.\r\nen un tazón para mezclar. Vierta la leche caliente\r\nmientras se bate continuamente el huevo\r\nmezcla. Deseche la vaina (si la usa) y\r\nRegrese la mezcla a una cacerola limpia.\r\nCocine a fuego suave, revolviendo, hasta que\r\nla mezcla es más espesa que una natilla: obtendrá\r\ntiene grumos, pero sigue revolviendo y batiendo.\r\nsacar los grumos. Transferir a otra mezcla.\r\nrecipiente y coloque film transparente directamente sobre\r\nsuperficie. Dejar enfriar y luego enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nForre un par de bandejas para hornear con\r\npergamino para hornear. Tubo de 8-10 cm de largo\r\nlongitudes de masa, de unos 2 cm de ancho\r\n– dejando espacio para expandirse entre cada uno\r\nuno. Llevar al horno por 5 minutos, luego\r\nreduzca el calor a 200C/200C ventilador/gas 6\r\ny hornee por 10 minutos más hasta que esté dorado,\r\ninflado y crujiente. Con una brocheta, pinche\r\n3 pequeños agujeros a lo largo de la base de cada uno\r\nbollo. Vuelva a colocar en las bandejas para hornear, base\r\narriba y regresar al horno por un tiempo más.\r\n8-10 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente crujientes. Fresco. puede\r\ncongelarse hasta por un mes o almacenarse en un recipiente hermético hasta por 3 días –\r\nsimplemente vuelva a dorar en un horno caliente cuando\r\nlisto para llenar.","Añade la nata a las natillas espesas.\r\nRellenar y batir con batidora eléctrica.\r\nhasta que recupere su propia forma. poner en\r\nuna manga pastelera con una boquilla pequeña, luego coloque\r\nun poco de relleno en el fondo de los bollos\r\nusando los agujeros para brochetas que hiciste antes\r\n(ver Secretos del éxito, más abajo). cuando\r\nsale chorros, esa parte probablemente esté llena.","Revuelva el azúcar glas y la cantidad suficiente de agua para hacer un glaseado bastante espeso. Divide entre tantos tazones como quieras de colores y colorea cada lote como quieras. (Dependiendo de su color, es posible que necesite agregar una gota más de agua a los glaseados para que queden espesos pero líquidos).","Sumerge la parte superior de cada canutillo en glaseado para cubrirlo, o usa una cucharadita para untar un poco; usa menos al principio y espera a que se extienda y se asiente. Agregue chispas y adornos, luego colóquelos suavemente sobre rejillas de alambre para que se asienten. Es mejor comer los canutillos el día en que se rellenan y decoran, antes de que se empapen."]','2026-01-11 12:59:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13709,7306,'es','Brie envuelto en prosciutto y brioche','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Este delicioso horneado de Paul Hollywood combina pan francés ligeramente dulce con un relleno cremoso de jamón y queso.','["375 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","50 g de azúcar en polvo","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","75ml de leche","3 huevos grandes, más 2 huevos batidos para glasear","185 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","250 g de queso brie redondo","8 rebanadas de prosciutto"]','["Mezcle la harina, 1 cucharadita de sal, el azúcar en polvo, la levadura, la leche y los huevos en una batidora usando el accesorio para masa durante 5 minutos hasta que la masa esté suave. Agrega la mantequilla y mezcla durante 4 minutos más a velocidad media. Raspar el bol de masa y volver a mezclar durante 1 min. Colocar la masa en un recipiente, tapar con film transparente y dejar en el frigorífico al menos 6 horas antes de usar.","Envuelva el queso Brie en el prosciutto y reserve. Coloca la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Enrollar hasta formar un círculo de 25 cm. Coloque el Brie envuelto en el medio del círculo y doble los bordes cuidadosamente. Coloque el paquete en una bandeja para horno forrada con papel de horno y unte con huevo batido. Enfriar en el frigorífico durante 30 minutos, luego volver a pintar con huevo batido y dejar enfriar durante 30 minutos más. Dejar reposar durante 1 hora a temperatura ambiente. Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6, luego hornee por 22 minutos. Servir caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13710,7308,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: sopa de cebolla francesa','Angela Nilsen le da un cambio de imagen al clásico francés, eliminando la mantequilla y el caldo de res para hacer una sopa más ligera y aún llena de sabor.','["4 cebollas españolas grandes (unos 900 g/2 lb)","3 cucharadas de aceite de colza virgen extra","4 ramitas de tomillo","2 hojas de laurel","300 ml de vino blanco seco","1 cucharada colmada de harina común","1 cucharada de caldo de verduras suizo","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de aceite de colza virgen extra","4 rebanadas largas de baguette","25 g de parmesano, o alternativa vegetariana, rallado grueso","50 g de gruyere, rallado grueso"]','["Corta las cebollas por la mitad a lo largo y luego córtalas en rodajas.\r\nen rodajas muy finas. Calentar una muy grande\r\nsartén, agregue el aceite cuando esté caliente, agregue las cebollas,\r\n3 de las ramitas de tomillo y las hojas de laurel, luego\r\nsazone con un poco de sal. parecerá mucho\r\nde cebollas, pero se reducen muy bien. cocinar\r\na fuego alto durante 5 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia. el\r\nLas cebollas no deberían dorarse todavía, solo empezar a ablandarse.\r\nBaje el fuego y cocine lentamente durante 35 minutos.\r\ndescubierto, revolviendo con frecuencia hasta que las cebollas estén\r\nreducidos hacia abajo y son muy suaves.","Mientras se cocinan las cebollas, trae el vino.\r\nhervir en una cacerola pequeña, luego dejar hervir durante\r\n30 segundos. Retirar y dejar enfriar. Inclina la harina\r\nen una sartén pequeña y pesada y tuesta a fuego medio.\r\nCaliente durante unos minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que\r\nde color marrón claro. Dejar de lado.","Cuando las cebollas estén muy blandas y reducidas,\r\nsubir el fuego para que se caramelicen y cocinar\r\ndurante otros 12-15 minutos, revolviendo a lo largo del\r\nfondo de la cacerola de vez en cuando para mezclar\r\ntrozos pegajosos de color marrón. Cuando el fondo de la sartén\r\ny todas las cebollas están pegajosas y de un rico color marrón.\r\ncolor, agregue la harina. Con el calor aún alto,\r\nvierta gradualmente el vino, revolviendo nuevamente con el\r\npedazos del fondo. Vierta 1,2 litros de frío.\r\nagua. Agregue el caldo y luego agregue lentamente\r\ntodo a ebullición. Quite la espuma de\r\nla superficie. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos para que todos los\r\nLos sabores pueden mezclarse.","Mientras la sopa hierve a fuego lento, prepara la cobertura.\r\nCalentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Mezclar el\r\nel ajo y el aceite juntos. Cepille por todo el\r\nrebanadas de pan, luego corte cada una en cubos.\r\nDistribuya sobre una bandeja para hornear, luego hornee por\r\n8-10 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Dejar de lado. Línea a\r\nbandeja para hornear con papel para hornear o una\r\nlámina de silicona antiadherente. quitar las hojas\r\nde la ramita de tomillo restante, luego mezcle\r\ncon el parmesano rallado. Dispersar y esparcir\r\nsobre la bandeja para hornear forrada en un molde de 13 x 8 cm.\r\nrectángulo. Hornee durante unos 8 minutos hasta que se derrita.\r\ny volviéndose dorado. Retirar, dejar endurecer,\r\nluego rompa en pedazos irregulares.","Para servir, retire y deseche las hierbas de\r\nla sopa. Sirva la sopa en tazones – esparza\r\nsobre unos cuantos picatostes, el gruyere y un molido\r\nde pimienta, luego coloque un crujiente de parmesano encima\r\narriba. Sirva los picatostes restantes por separado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13711,7310,'es','Tortilla francesa definitiva','La tortilla es uno de los platos más fundamentales en el arsenal de cualquier cocinero, y esta receta te enseñará cómo hacerlo bien en todo momento.','["3 huevos, lo más frescos posible, preferiblemente orgánicos y de corral, a temperatura ambiente","2 pizcas de mantequilla sin sal","1 cucharadita de parmesano recién rallado fino (o alternativa vegetariana)","2-3 hojas de estragón picadas","1 cucharada de cebollino picado y perifollo o perejil picado","3 cucharadas colmadas de gruyere finamente rallado"]','["Ten todo listo. Calentar una sartén antiadherente de 20 cm (medidos en la parte superior) a fuego medio. Rompe los huevos en un bol y bátelos con un tenedor para que se rompan y se mezclen, pero no tan completamente como lo harías con los huevos revueltos. Con el fuego a medio-alto, echa una nuez de mantequilla en la sartén. Debe burbujear y chisporrotear, pero no dorarse. Sazona los huevos con parmesano y un poco de sal y pimienta y vierte en la sartén.","Deje que los huevos burbujeen ligeramente durante un par de segundos, luego tome un tenedor de madera o una espátula y extraiga suavemente la mezcla de los lados de la sartén unas cuantas veces, de modo que se forme pliegues en el centro. Déjelo por unos segundos, luego revuelva nuevamente para combinar ligeramente el huevo crudo con el cocido. Dejar brevemente de nuevo, y cuando esté medio cocido, remover un poco más rápido, parando mientras quede un poco de huevo apenas cocido. Con la sartén sobre el fuego, agítala unas cuantas veces para que la mezcla se asiente. Debe deslizarse fácilmente en la sartén y verse suave y húmedo en la parte superior. Una rápida ráfaga de calor dorará la parte inferior.","Agarre el asa que se encuentra debajo. Inclina la sartén hacia abajo y deja que la tortilla caiga hasta el borde. Doble el lado más cercano a usted en un tercio con el tenedor y manténgalo girando para que la tortilla caiga sobre un plato, o dóblela por la mitad, si le resulta más fácil. Para un acabado prolijo, cubre la tortilla con un trozo de papel de cocina y engorda un poco con los dedos. Frote la otra nuez de mantequilla para glasear. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13712,7312,'es','Bisque de gambas e hinojo','Una lujosa sopa de mariscos rica en sabor, perfecta para eventos formales y también baja en calorías.','["450 g de gambas tigre crudas con concha","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","1 bulbo de hinojo grande, picado, las hojas reservadas","2 zanahorias, picadas","150 ml de vino blanco seco","1 cucharada de brandy","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 litro de caldo de pescado","2 pizcas generosas de pimentón","Bote de 150ml de nata doble","8 langostinos tigre, sin cáscara, pero sin las puntas de la cola (opcional)","hojas de hinojo (opcional)"]','["Pele las gambas y luego fríalas en aceite en una sartén grande durante unos 5 minutos. Añade la cebolla, el hinojo y las zanahorias y cocina durante unos 10 minutos hasta que las verduras empiecen a ablandarse. Vierta el vino y el brandy, burbujee con fuerza durante aproximadamente 1 minuto para eliminar el alcohol, luego agregue los tomates, el caldo y el pimentón. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos. Mientras tanto, troceamos las gambas.","Triture la sopa lo más finamente que pueda con una batidora o un procesador de alimentos, luego presione a través de un colador en un tazón. Dedica un poco de tiempo a pasar la mezcla por el colador, ya que esto le dará a la sopa su textura aterciopelada.","Vierta nuevamente en una sartén limpia, agregue los langostinos y cocine durante 10 minutos, luego mezcle nuevamente hasta que quede suave. Puede prepararlo y enfriarlo con un día de anticipación o congelarlo durante 1 mes. Descongelar durante la noche en el frigorífico. Para servir, recalentar suavemente una sartén con la nata. Para decorar, cocer las 8 gambas en un poco de mantequilla. Vierta en tazones pequeños y cubra con las gambas y las hojas de hinojo cortadas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13713,7314,'es','Pithiviers de pistacho y frambuesa','Paquetes individuales de hojaldre de frangipane y frutos rojos: para darle un toque especial, decóralos con las iniciales de tus invitados.','["140 g de pistachos pelados y sin sal","100 g de azúcar en polvo","100 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubitos","2 huevos medianos","3 cucharadas de harina común, más un poco más para espolvorear","Paquete de 500 g de hojaldre","24 frambuesas, descongeladas si están congeladas","brillantina comestible roja y spray dorado para decorar (opcional)"]','["Mezclar los pistachos,\r\nazúcar, mantequilla, 1 huevo y la harina\r\nen un procesador de alimentos hasta casi\r\nfrangipano suave.","Haga una bola con la masa (para romperla).\r\nalgunas de las capas), luego extiéndalo\r\nmuy finamente sobre una superficie espolvoreada con harina.\r\nRecorta círculos de 4 x 11 cm y 4 x 13 cm.\r\ncírculos: probablemente tendrás que volver a tirar\r\nuna vez. Guarda todos los adornos.","Pon 6 frambuesas en el centro de cada una.\r\nde los 4 círculos más pequeños, luego coloque\r\nun poco de frangipane de pistacho. Usando un pequeño\r\npaleta o cuchillo de hoja redonda, extender y\r\nalise la mezcla hasta formar una cúpula, cubriendo\r\ny encerrando las frambuesas – dejar un\r\nBueno, 1 cm de masa limpia alrededor del borde.\r\nBatir el segundo huevo y pintar un poco.\r\nalrededor de los bordes de la masa. Coloque con cuidado el\r\ncírculos más grandes de masa encima, suavizando y\r\npresionándolos poco a poco sobre el relleno,\r\ntodo el contorno, para exprimir cualquier\r\naire. Remodela los pithiviers para darles un bonito\r\nforma de cúpula redonda, presione los bordes para\r\nselle, luego recorte el exceso de masa alrededor\r\nlos bordes si es necesario. Cepille el huevo\r\ntodos los pithiviers.","Decora la parte superior marcando ligeramente.\r\nun patrón con la punta de un cuchillo afilado.\r\nApriete los bordes para sellar, luego engarce para\r\ndar un borde estriado. Si quieres, pincela con huevo.\r\nsobre algunos de los adornos desplegados,\r\nluego cepille con brillantina comestible. usar letra\r\ncortadores para recortar las iniciales de su\r\ninvitados, o cualquier otra forma que te guste.\r\nRocíe otros adornos con spray dorado.\r\ny eliminar más formas. decorar\r\ncon las formas y cubrir sin apretar con\r\npelícula adhesiva. Enfriar durante al menos 2 horas, pero más.\r\nsi puedes. Se puede realizar con 1 día de antelación.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nHornea los pithiviers durante 20-25 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado y crujiente. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13714,7318,'es','Tostada francesa de albaricoque','Dale un toque dulce al pan con huevo con esta deliciosa receta para el brunch','["50 g de mantequilla","6 albaricoques, partidos por la mitad y sin hueso","200 g de salsa de caramelo (nosotros utilizamos mermelada de caramelo Bonne Maman)","350 g de natillas de vainilla ya preparadas","8 rebanadas pequeñas y gruesas de brioche o pan blanco, o 4 rebanadas grandes, cortadas en diagonal"]','["Derrita 1 cucharada de mantequilla en una sartén mediana.\r\nsartén. Ponga los albaricoques, cortados.\r\nhacia abajo y sofreír durante 2-3 minutos. Voltear\r\nvoltee y cocine por 1 min más hasta que esté ligeramente\r\ndorado. Añade el caramelo a la sartén y\r\nderrita hasta que esté picante, si todavía está demasiado espeso para cubrirlo\r\nla fruta, añadir un chorrito de agua. Manténgase caliente.","Mezclar las natillas con 4 cucharadas de agua.\r\npara aflojar, luego mojar en las rebanadas de pan,\r\nvolteándolo para cubrirlo completamente. Derretir la mitad del\r\nmantequilla restante en una sartén grande antiadherente\r\nsartén. Sacuda ligeramente el exceso\r\nmezcla de natillas de la mitad del pan\r\nCortar en rodajas y freír en mantequilla durante 2 minutos.\r\ncada lado hasta que esté dorado. Repita con\r\nresto de mantequilla y pan, luego sirva\r\nCaliente con los albaricoques acaramelados."]','2026-01-11 12:59:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13715,7320,'es','Pollo a la francesa con guisantes y tocino','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Este cremoso plato de pollo en una sola olla es una forma económica de alimentar a toda la familia.','["6 lonchas de tocino ahumado, picado","8 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","1 manojo de cebolletas, picadas en trozos grandes","300 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","250 g de guisantes congelados","1 lechuga Little Gem, triturada aproximadamente","2 cucharadas de crema fresca"]','["En una sartén grande, sofreír el tocino.\r\na fuego medio durante 3 minutos hasta que\r\nSe suelta grasa y el tocino queda dorado.\r\nTransfiera el tocino a un tazón pequeño.\r\ndejando la grasa en la sartén. Añade el\r\npollo y dórelo durante 4 minutos por cada lado.","Empuja el pollo a un lado de la sartén.\r\ny agregue el ajo y las cebolletas,\r\ncocinar durante unos 30 segundos, justo hasta que\r\nLos tallos de la cebolleta son de color verde brillante. verter\r\nen el caldo de pollo, devuelva el tocino a\r\nla sartén, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos.","Aumente el fuego debajo de la sartén. Inclina el\r\nguisantes y lechuga en la salsa y cocinar\r\ndurante 4 minutos, tapado, hasta que los guisantes estén\r\ntierna y la lechuga acaba de marchitarse.\r\nVerifique que el pollo esté bien cocido. Revuelva\r\nen la crème fraîche justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13716,6711,'es','Pollo Marengo','Prueba una cazuela de pollo diferente y prepara esta versión con champiñones, aceitunas, tomate y perejil.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","Paquete de 300 g de taza de champiñones, cortados por la mitad","4 muslos de pollo, sin piel","Tarro de 500 g de passata de ajo y hierbas","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","100 g de aceitunas kalamata negras deshuesadas","perejil picado, para servir (opcional)","pasta y ensalada, o puré y verduras verdes, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una olla grande a prueba de fuego.\r\ncazuela y sofreír la\r\nchampiñones hasta que empiecen a ablandarse.\r\nAgrega las piernas de pollo y cocina brevemente.\r\nde cada lado para darles color un poco.","Vierta la passata, desmenúcela en el\r\ncubo de caldo y agregue las aceitunas. Temporada\r\ncon pimienta negra – no deberías necesitar\r\nsal. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 40 minutos hasta que\r\nel pollo está tierno. espolvorear con\r\nperejil y servir con pasta y ensalada,\r\no puré y verduras verdes, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13717,7322,'es','Soufflés de tres quesos','Con doble capa de queso de cabra y una capa de crema, estas horneadas estilo bistró quedan auténticamente ricas','["50 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para engrasar","25 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), finamente rallado","300 ml de leche entera","2 hojas de laurel","5 cucharadas de harina común","½ cucharadita de mostaza inglesa en polvo","pizca de pimienta de cayena","140 g de gruyere (o alternativa vegetariana), rallado","3 huevos, separados","8 rebanadas de queso de cabra (ver ''Probar'', más abajo)","150ml de nata doble","hojas de ensalada, para servir (ver ''Probar'', más abajo)"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/ventilador de 180C/\r\ngas 6 y mantequilla 4 pequeños (aproximadamente\r\n200 ml) moldes. Espolvorea el\r\nqueso parmesano en los moldes, volteándolos\r\nhasta que todos los lados estén cubiertos. Lugar\r\nla leche y las hojas de laurel en un recipiente grande\r\ncacerola a fuego suave y\r\nllevar a ebullición. Apaga el fuego\r\ny dejar en infusión durante 15 min.","Desechar las hojas de laurel, añadir el\r\nmantequilla y harina, y regresar a un\r\nfuego lento. Cocine a fuego lento muy suavemente,\r\nrevolviendo continuamente con un globo\r\nbatir durante unos 6 minutos hasta obtener\r\nuna salsa blanca suave y espesa. hacer\r\nAsegúrate de entrar directamente en el\r\nesquinas de la sartén para detener la salsa\r\nse enganche o se vuelva grumoso.","Una vez espesa, transferir la\r\nsalsa a un tazón grande y\r\nagregue la mostaza en polvo,\r\npimienta de cayena, gruyere y huevo\r\nyemas hasta que estén completamente combinadas.","En un recipiente impecablemente limpio\r\ny con un batidor limpio,\r\nbatir las claras apenas\r\nhasta que comiencen a formarse picos.","Incorporar con cuidado las claras\r\nen la salsa de queso en tres\r\netapas asegurándose de doblar,\r\nen lugar de revolver, para mantener el huevo\r\nblancos luminosos y aireados. llenar lo preparado\r\nmoldes con la mezcla de soufflé.","Cubra cada soufflé con una rebanada\r\nde queso de cabra, luego colocar\r\nen una bandeja para hornear. Hornear para\r\n20-25 minutos o hasta que esté elástico y bien\r\nlevado pero bien cocido.","Dejar enfriar y luego pasar un cuchillo.\r\nalrededor del borde de cada plato\r\ny retire los soufflés. Si los prepara con anticipación, coloque los soufflés\r\nal revés (para una presentación ordenada), en\r\nuna bandeja. Cubra la bandeja con film transparente. Relájate para\r\nunos días o congelar hasta por 1 mes.","Cuando esté listo para volver a hornear, calentar\r\nhorno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nColoque el al revés\r\nsoufflés en una fuente para horno poco profunda,\r\ncubra con el queso de cabra restante\r\nrodajas y verter sobre la nata (esto\r\nevita que se sequen cuando\r\nhorneado por segunda vez). cocinar\r\ndurante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté dorado. servir\r\ninmediatamente junto a algunos\r\nensalada simplemente aderezada."]','2026-01-11 12:59:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13718,7324,'es','Cordero asado con ajo y hierbas sobre patatas boulangère','Cocinar suculentos cordero y patatas con hierbas juntas significa que las patatas absorben todos sus deliciosos jugos.','["2 kg de pierna de cordero","4 dientes de ajo, rebanados","unas ramitas de romero","unas ramitas de tomillo","2 kg de patatas grandes, como King Edwards","2 cebollas, en rodajas finas","600 ml de caldo de pollo","50 g de mantequilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nCorta pequeños bolsillos en la piel y la carne.\r\ndel cordero pinchándolo con la punta del\r\nun cuchillo afilado. Rellena cada bolsillo con un\r\nuna rodaja de ajo y unas hojas de romero,\r\no espolvorear con tomillo. Poner en un asador\r\nlata, sazonar bien con sal y recién\r\npimienta negra molida y luego cubrir con papel de aluminio.","Pelar y cortar las patatas en rodajas finas, enjuagar\r\nbajo el grifo de agua fría y apilar en una gran\r\nfuente refractaria o fuente para asar. Mezcle con\r\nlas cebollas, el resto de las rodajas de ajo y\r\nun buen esparcimiento de hierbas.","Calentar el caldo y la mantequilla juntos y luego\r\nvierte sobre las patatas. Cubrir el plato\r\ncon papel aluminio y hornear en el horno con la\r\ncordero durante 1 h. Destapar, poner el cordero\r\nencima de las patatas y asar sin tapar\r\ndurante 45 minutos más. Dejar reposar el cordero\r\nantes de tallar, durante unos 15 minutos. salir\r\nlas patatas al horno (tapadas, si\r\nempezando a dorarse demasiado) hasta que esté listo\r\npara servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13719,3674,'es','frijoles al estilo griego','Prepare un guiso de frijoles, tomate y queso feta para una comida rápida y saludable entre semana. Disfrútelo con masa madre tostada a un lado para absorber toda la salsa.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada grande, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1½ cucharadita de orégano seco","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","300 ml de caldo de verduras bajo en sal","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","2 latas de 400 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","½ limón, exprimido","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","un puñado pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","masa madre tostada, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén profunda a fuego medio-alto. Agrega las cebollas con una pizca de sal y cocina por 5 minutos, hasta que comiencen a ablandarse y los bordes se doren. Incorpora el ajo, el orégano y el puré de tomate. Reduzca el fuego a medio y cocine durante 3-4 minutos, revolviendo, hasta que el puré adquiera un color rojo oscuro.","Incorpora los tomates, el caldo y el azúcar. Lave la lata con un chorrito de agua y luego viértala también en la sartén. Déjelo hervir a fuego lento durante 10 a 12 minutos a fuego medio-bajo, luego mezcle los frijoles. Revuelva bien, luego déjelo hervir a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos antes de sazonar al gusto con sal, pimienta y un poco de jugo de limón. Sirva con queso feta y eneldo esparcidos por encima, con masa madre tostada a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13720,7325,'es','Moussaka de siguiente nivel','Evoque recuerdos de unas vacaciones griegas con esta maravillosa moussaka preparada con anticipación, ideal para alimentar a una multitud, servida con una sencilla ensalada.','["100 ml de aceite de oliva","500 g de carne picada de cordero","1 cebolla, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","½ cucharadita de azúcar moreno blando","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","200 ml de vino tinto","1 cucharada de orégano seco","1 rama de canela","2 hojas de laurel","3 berenjenas","hojas de ensalada mixtas, para servir","500 ml de yogur griego","1 huevo, más 1 yema, ligeramente batidos (congela la clara para otra receta)","50 g de parmesano rallado","pizca de nuez moscada rallada","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo, desmenuza la carne picada y cocina durante 15-20 minutos. Liberará un poco de líquido, pero una vez que haya burbujeado, la carne picada chisporroteará en su propia grasa y comenzará a dorarse y caramelizarse. En este punto, revuelve la carne picada con una cuchara de madera.","Agrega la cebolla y continúa cocinando durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agrega el ajo y cocina por un minuto más. Esparza el azúcar, luego agregue el puré de tomate y cocine hasta que esté tostado y comience a pegarse a la sartén. Echar el vinagre y dejar cocer a fuego lento un minuto. Vierta los tomates enlatados, luego use el vino para beber la lata y vierta la salsa. Sazone con sal y pimienta, esparza el orégano, agregue la ramita de canela y las hojas de laurel, lleve a fuego lento y cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo ocasionalmente, durante 40 minutos hasta obtener un ragú espeso. Retire del fuego, retire el laurel y la canela y revuelva con otra cucharada de aceite de oliva.","Mientras se cocina el ragú, corte la parte superior de las berenjenas y luego córtelas a lo largo en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor. Poner en un bol y un poco de sal y dejar reposar durante 20 minutos hasta que se ablanden y se cuelguen. Rocíe abundantemente con el resto del aceite de oliva y revuelva bien. Calienta una sartén a fuego alto y cocina las rodajas por ambos lados durante unos minutos hasta que estén suaves y ligeramente carbonizadas. Deberá hacer esto en lotes. Dejar enfriar un poco en un plato. (Esto también se puede hacer en una barbacoa si tienes tiempo).","Para la cobertura, vierte el yogur en un bol con el huevo entero y la yema, la mitad del parmesano, la nuez moscada y un poco de sal y pimienta, luego bate hasta que se combinen. Coloque un tercio de la carne en una fuente rectangular grande para horno (la nuestra medía aproximadamente 20 x 30 cm) y extiéndala uniformemente, coloque la mitad de la berenjena encima, luego otro tercio de la salsa de carne y luego las rodajas restantes de berenjena. Vierta lo último de la salsa de cordero, luego vierta sobre la mezcla de yogur alisando los bordes. Distribuya el queso feta junto con el resto del parmesano. Se mantendrá frío durante dos días.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180 ventilador/gas 4. Hornea la moussaka durante 50 minutos o hasta que esté bien dorada. Déjelo enfriar durante al menos 10 minutos antes de servirlo con una ensalada, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13721,7327,'es','Gyros de pollo BBQ con ensalada de repollo y eneldo','Impresiona en tu próxima barbacoa con estas brochetas de pollo marinado de inspiración griega y ensalada crujiente de eneldo y repollo blanco, o simplemente asa a la parrilla en el interior si está lloviendo.','["½ col blanca, sin corazón y finamente rallada","10 g de eneldo, picado en trozos grandes","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 tomates, partidos por la mitad y en rodajas","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","500 g de yogur griego entero","125 ml de aceite de oliva","1 limón grande, rallado y exprimido","4 dientes de ajo, machacados","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharada de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","1 cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de pimienta negra triturada","1 kg de filetes de muslo de pollo Morrisons","patatas fritas, pan pita o plano y tzatziki"]','["Combine todos los ingredientes para el pollo, excepto el pollo, en un bol con 1 cucharadita de sal. Incorpora el pollo y revuelve bien para cubrirlo, luego déjalo marinar en el refrigerador hasta por 24 horas, o al menos 2 horas.","Una vez marinado, pase el pollo Morrisons en 2 brochetas de metal grandes, de modo que ambas brochetas atraviesen la carne. Deseche la marinada restante. Mezcle todos los ingredientes para la ensalada en un tazón grande y sazone al gusto.","Calienta tu barbacoa a fuego medio-alto si usas gas, o para barbacoas de carbón, enciéndela y deja que las llamas se apaguen y las brasas se pongan blancas. Coloque las brochetas de pollo en la barbacoa, cubra con la tapa y cocine durante 15-20 minutos, volteándolas hasta que estén carbonizadas por todos lados, o hasta que un termómetro de cocina insertado en la parte más gruesa marque 70 ° C. Retirar a una bandeja para hornear para que repose, tapado, durante 15-20 minutos. Alternativamente, colóquelo en una bandeja forrada con papel de aluminio y cocine a la parrilla durante 15 minutos por cada lado hasta que se queme y esté bien cocido.","Una vez reposadas, levanta y corta las brochetas en rodajas finas y lleva a la mesa junto con la ensalada. Para servir, amontone las pitas con la ensalada, las patatas fritas y un poco de tzatziki, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13722,5649,'es','Sándwiches abiertos de ensalada al estilo griego','Disfrute de estos sándwiches abiertos de ensalada estilo griego con queso feta, aceitunas y tomates para el almuerzo o la merienda. Son perfectos para cenar al aire libre en verano.','["125 g de queso feta","120 g de yogur natural espeso","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 tomates medianos, sin semillas, finamente picados","200 g de pepino, finamente picado","10 aceitunas negras sin hueso, picadas en trozos grandes","½ cebolla morada, cortada en rodajas finas","1 cucharada de menta finamente picada, más hojas adicionales para decorar","½ limón, exprimido","8 rebanadas gruesas de masa madre"]','["Pon el queso feta, el yogur y el ajo en un mini procesador de alimentos. Licue hasta que esté espeso y suave, luego sazone con un poco de pimienta negra.","Mezcle los tomates, el pepino, las aceitunas, la cebolla morada y la menta en un tazón grande con el jugo de limón. Sazone al gusto.","Extienda el queso feta batido sobre las rodajas de masa madre y acompañe cada una con la ensalada. Adorne con las hojas de menta restantes y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:59:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13723,6189,'es','pastitsio vegetariano','En nuestra versión vegetariana de este plato de pasta griega, las lentejas económicas reemplazan la carne y hemos usado un poco de vinagre balsámico en lugar de uva.','["2 cebollas grandes (330 g), partidas por la mitad y en rodajas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 hojas de laurel","2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharadita de canela molida","250 g de pasta penne","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","4 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 latas de lentejas verdes de 400 g","ensalada de tomates, cebolla y eneldo salteados con limón y aceitunas, para servir","500ml de leche o leche vegetal","50 g de harina integral","1 huevo, separado","40 g de queso feta vegetariano, desmenuzado","½ cucharadita de orégano"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Poner en una cacerola grande la cebolla y el aceite con el caldo, las hojas de laurel, el vinagre, el ajo, el orégano y la canela. Agregue una taza de agua (aproximadamente 250 ml), luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave. Destape y cocine por 10 minutos más, revolviendo con frecuencia. El agua debe evaporarse pasado este tiempo y las cebollas deben estar blandas.","Mientras tanto, cocine la pasta en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, o durante 10 minutos hasta que esté al dente. Escurrir y reservar.","Agrega los tomates, el puré de tomate y las lentejas, junto con su líquido, a las cebollas. Revuelva bien, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Retire las hojas de laurel.","Para hacer la salsa blanca, vierte la leche y 200 ml de agua en una cacerola con la harina, bate bien para evitar que se formen grumos y sigue revolviendo hasta que espese, durante unos 8-10 minutos.","Agrega la clara de huevo a la pasta y vierte sobre la base de una fuente para horno. Cubra con la mezcla de lentejas. Agrega la yema de huevo a la salsa blanca, luego vierte sobre las lentejas, esparce sobre el queso feta y el orégano y luego hornea durante 40 minutos hasta que burbujee.","Sirva la mitad con la ensalada de tomate y cebolla y enfríe el resto para otro día. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días. Vuelva a calentar en el microondas en platos hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13724,3892,'es','Tortitas de queso feta con ensalada griega','Trae un poco de sol de verano a tu cocina con estos pasteles de papa y queso feta servidos con ensalada griega. Las hierbas aportan mucho sabor y valiosos nutrientes, como vitamina C y hierro.','["una gota de aceite de colza, para la bandeja para hornear","700 g de patatas peladas y cortadas en trozos","1 limón, rallado, medio jugo","6 cebolletas, muy finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de menta picada","3 cucharadas de perejil picado","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","1 huevo grande","6 cucharadas de harina integral","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","320 g de tomates cortados en gajos","1 pepino (unos 320 g), cortado en cubitos","1 cebolla morada finamente picada","12 aceitunas Kalamata, en cuartos","1-2 cucharadas de menta finamente picada","2 cucharaditas de jugo de limón","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y engrasar una bandeja para hornear antiadherente. Ponga a hervir agua en una cacerola, agregue las patatas y cocine durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrir muy bien, luego volver a la sartén y triturar con mucha pimienta negra, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, las cebolletas, la menta y 2 cucharadas de perejil. Revuelva el queso feta.","Batir el huevo en un recipiente poco profundo, luego mezclar la harina, el pimentón y la cucharada restante de perejil en otro. Forme ocho pasteles con la mezcla de papa, luego cúbralos con cuidado con el huevo y luego con la mezcla de harina, dándoles otra forma si es necesario. Coloque los pasteles en la bandeja para hornear y hornee por 15 minutos hasta que comiencen a dorarse. Use una espátula para darles la vuelta con cuidado a cada uno y hornee por otros 10-15 minutos hasta que estén dorados.","Mientras tanto, mezcla la mitad de la ensalada con la mitad del limón y el aceite. Sirva con cuatro pasteles y enfríe el resto para un día más, mezclando la ensalada restante con el resto del limón y el aceite justo antes de servir. Se mantendrá tapado hasta por dos días en el refrigerador. Para recalentar los pasteles, cocínelos en una bandeja para horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 durante 15-20 minutos."]','2026-01-11 12:59:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13725,5467,'es','Macarrones con pisto y ricota','Esta es una versión deconstruida de macarrones con queso con una capa de vegetales mediterráneos usando ricotta italiana, para que no tengas que hacer una salsa tradicional.','["400 g de tomates picados","3 cucharadas de puré de tomate","4 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","12 aceitunas Kalamata, en cuartos","1 cucharadita de caldo en polvo","1 berenjena grande (350 g), cortada en cubitos","2 calabacines (325 g), partidos por la mitad y en rodajas","200 g de ricota","Paquete de 20 g de albahaca, las hojas pequeñas reservadas para decorar y el resto picado","400 g de penne integral","20 g de parmesano finamente rallado"]','["Pon los tomates en una cacerola con una lata de agua, el puré de tomate, el ajo, las aceitunas y el caldo. Añade la berenjena y los calabacines, tapa y cocina a fuego lento durante 30 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la ricota y la albahaca en un tazón pequeño con abundante pimienta negra.","Hervir la mitad de la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escurrir y reservar un poco del agua de cocción. Vierta en un tazón y mezcle con la mitad de la mezcla de ricotta y un par de cucharadas de agua de pasta, agregando más para aflojar si es necesario. Vierta la mitad del pisto y el penne en dos tazones de pasta y espolvoree con la mitad del parmesano y las hojas de albahaca. Cubra y enfríe el resto del pisto, la albahaca y la ricota durante otra noche. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. Cuando esté listo para servir nuevamente, caliente el pisto en una sartén a fuego lento y continúe con el método del paso 3."]','2026-01-11 12:59:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13726,3916,'es','Pastel de espiral de espinacas filo','Estas espirales filo de espinacas de aspecto impresionante son engañosamente fáciles de hacer. Una versión de la spanakopita griega, servida con ensalada para un almuerzo de fin de semana','["300 g de espinacas tiernas","50 g de mantequilla con sal, derretida, más una nuez para freír","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","200 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","7 hojas filo compradas en la tienda","1 cucharada de semillas de nigella"]','["Calienta una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio. Vierta las espinacas y cocine, revolviendo, hasta que se ablanden (no necesitará aceite ni agua, ya que se cocinarán al vapor en su propia humedad). Dejar enfriar un poco, luego verter sobre un paño de cocina limpio y exprimir la mayor cantidad de agua posible. Picar y poner en un bol.","Calentar la nuez de mantequilla en una sartén antiadherente. Agrega la cebolla y cocina durante unos 10 minutos hasta que se ablande. Vierta el tazón con las espinacas y luego agregue el queso feta con un tenedor hasta que esté completamente combinado. Gusto por sazonar.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Untar un molde para pastel de metal de 24 x 4 cm de profundidad con un poco de mantequilla.","Coloque una hoja de filo sobre su superficie de trabajo. Unte con un poco de mantequilla derretida, luego extienda aproximadamente 2 cucharadas del relleno en una línea a lo largo del borde más largo de la masa. Enrolle sin apretar hasta formar una salchicha larga (no la enrolle demasiado, ya que esto podría hacer que la masa se parta), luego enrolle la masa y colóquela en el centro del molde.","Repetir con el resto de la masa y el relleno, disponiendo las espirales alrededor de la central. Unte la parte superior con más mantequilla y luego espolvoree con las semillas de nigella. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13727,5483,'es','Chuletas de cordero con tomillo, guindilla y htipiti griego','Sirva chuletas de cordero con htipiti para obtener un delicioso plato de inspiración griega con sabores fabulosos. Las patatas baby asadas con aceite de oliva son un excelente acompañamiento','["12 chuletas de cordero","3 ramitas de tomillo, hojas recogidas","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","235 g de pimientos rojos asados ​​de un frasco, escurridos","175 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas","2 dientes de ajo muy finamente picados","2 ramitas de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","chorrito de jugo de limón (opcional)"]','["Poner las chuletas de cordero en un bol con el tomillo, las hojuelas de guindilla y el aceite. Mezcle para cubrir y luego déjelo marinar en el refrigerador durante 30 minutos a 1 hora.","Para el htipiti, corta los pimientos en trozos pequeños. Poner en un bol y añadir todos los demás ingredientes. Déjelo durante unos 15 minutos para que se infunda el sabor.","Calentar una sartén o una plancha. Cuando esté muy caliente, saca las chuletas de la marinada. Cocínelos, unos pocos a la vez, durante 3 minutos por cada lado, sazonando a medida que avanza. Sirve las chuletas con la salsa y unas patatas baby, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:59:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13728,7329,'es','Spanakopita de cordero y espinacas','Prepara esta impresionante spanakopita, "pastel de espinacas". Elaborado tradicionalmente con masa filo, queso feta y espinacas, aquí le hemos añadido cordero cocido a fuego lento en caldo.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","800 g de cuello o paleta de cordero, cortado en trozos","500 ml de caldo de cordero o pollo","1 rama de canela","1 hoja de laurel","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cebolla, finamente cortada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharada colmada de comino molido","1 cucharadita colmada de canela molida","500 g de espinacas","150 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","1⁄2 manojo pequeño de menta, con las hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de piñones tostados","1 huevo, ligeramente batido","100 g de mantequilla, derretida","270 g de masa filo","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo"]','["Calienta la mitad del aceite en una cacerola a fuego medio-alto y fríe el cordero durante 5-7 minutos, o hasta que esté completamente dorado. Cubrir con el caldo, luego agregar la ramita de canela y la hoja de laurel y dejar hervir a fuego lento. Tape y cocine durante 11/2 horas, o hasta que el cordero esté tierno y se deshaga.","Calienta el aceite restante y la mantequilla en una sartén, luego fríe las cebollas con una pizca grande de sal durante 15-20 minutos, o hasta que estén doradas y pegajosas. Agrega el ajo y las especias y cocina por 3 minutos más. Retire el cordero del líquido del guiso (reservando el líquido), transfiéralo a una tabla de cortar y desmenúcelo con dos tenedores. Agrega la carne desmenuzada a la mezcla de cebolla, junto con 50 ml del líquido reservado.","Coloque las espinacas en una sartén con 1 cucharada de agua y cocine durante 3-4 minutos o hasta que se ablanden. Envuélvalo en un paño de cocina limpio y exprima el exceso de líquido, o colóquelo en un colador fino y presiónelo con el dorso de una cuchara de madera. Pique las espinacas en trozos grandes y luego agregue la mezcla de cordero y cebolla junto con el queso feta, la menta, los piñones y el huevo. Estación.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y unta un molde desmontable redondo de 22 cm con un poco de mantequilla derretida. Coloque cuatro hojas de masa filo sobre el molde y luego unte con más mantequilla derretida. Vierta el relleno y doble la masa que sobresale por encima. Triture las hojas de masa restantes, colóquelas encima del pastel y unte con la mantequilla derretida restante. Espolvorea con las semillas de sésamo. Hornee durante 45-50 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Se mantendrá en el refrigerador hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13729,4131,'es','bouyiourdi griego','Disfrute de este queso feta al horno con tomates, ajo y chile como parte de un almuerzo meze. Es perfecto para acompañar pan pita caliente junto con una ensalada griega.','["3 tomates maduros grandes","1 diente de ajo, machacado","200 g de queso feta en bloque","1 chile verde suave grande o 1 pimiento verde, en rodajas","1 cucharadita de hojas de orégano picadas en trozos grandes","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","panes pita calientes, para servir"]','["Corta 1 tomate por la mitad, luego corta dos rodajas del centro y reserva. Saque las semillas del resto del tomate y luego ralle la pulpa, desechando la piel. Quite las semillas y ralle el resto de los tomates de la misma forma, luego mezcle la pulpa rallada con el ajo. Sazone y vierta en una fuente para horno de 16 cm.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloca el bloque de queso feta en los tomates con ajo, luego cubre con los tomates en rodajas, la guindilla, el orégano, el aceite de oliva y una pizca de sal marina. Cubra el plato y hornee por 15 minutos, luego destape y hornee por 15 minutos más. Sirva caliente con el pan pita a un lado para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:59:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13730,4161,'es','Bandeja de queso feta griego','Prepare esta bandeja horneada de inspiración griega con queso feta, aceitunas, pan de pita y tomates para una comida fácil entre semana, luego use las sobras para el almuerzo del día siguiente.','["2 panes pita","3 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos finos","Lata de 400 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","2 calabacines, cortados por la mitad a lo largo y en rodajas en ángulo","100 g de tomates cherry en rama","20 g de aceitunas Kalamata, deshuesadas y partidas por la mitad","100 g de queso feta, cortado en trozos pequeños","1 limón, cortado en gajos"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cortar o partir los panes de pita en trozos o triángulos y colocarlos en una bandeja para hornear grande. Rocíe 1 cucharadita de aceite y esparza la mitad del orégano y un poco de pimienta negra, luego mezcle para combinar. Coloque los trozos de pita en una sola capa y hornee durante 10 minutos hasta que estén dorados y crujientes.","Retire los chips de pita de la bandeja, luego agregue los gajos de cebolla, los frijoles y los calabacines. Cubra con el resto del aceite y el orégano, sazone y ase durante 10 minutos.","Agregue los tomates y las aceitunas, luego esparza el queso feta por encima. Ase durante otros 10 minutos, hasta que las verduras estén suaves y el queso feta comience a dorarse. Esparza los chips de pita sobre la parte superior o alrededor del costado de la bandeja y exprima sobre las rodajas de limón antes de servir la mitad de la bandeja horneada. Deje que el resto de la bandeja se enfríe para usarlo en las loncheras; consulte el consejo a continuación."]','2026-01-11 12:59:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13731,7331,'es','Tarta de puerros y alcachofas','Prepare este pastel de inspiración griega como plato central para una ocasión especial. Envuelto en una fabulosa masa filo, está repleto de puerros, alcachofas y queso.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 puerros, recortados, lavados y cortados en aros finos","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","255 g de corazones de alcachofa cocidos (escurridos de aceite), en rodajas","250 g de ricota, escurrida","55 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado","1 huevo mediano","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado","½ manojo pequeño de perejil picado","Paquete de 250 g de masa filo (10-12 láminas)","85 g de mantequilla, derretida","½ cucharada de semillas de sésamo"]','["Calentar el aceite de oliva en una sartén de fondo grueso y añadir los puerros y la cebolla. Sazona y cocina a fuego medio hasta que los puerros y la cebolla estén suaves, revolviendo frecuentemente. Agrega el ajo y cocina por otros 2 minutos. Asegúrate de que la mezcla no esté demasiado \"húmeda\" o empapará el pastel. Si es así, suba el fuego para eliminar el exceso de humedad. Agrega la alcachofa y deja enfriar.","Mezcle la ricota, el parmesano, el huevo y las hierbas en un tazón grande, luego agregue las verduras enfriadas. Sazone y mezcle con un tenedor.","Despeja un gran espacio en tu superficie de trabajo o mesa de cocina: vas a construir una masa de un metro de ancho. Tome un trozo de filo, colóquelo sobre la superficie de trabajo con el lado largo hacia usted y unte con mantequilla. Pon dos trozos más encima, untando cada uno con mantequilla. Ahora vuelve a hacer lo mismo con tres capas, superponiendo las hojas anteriores hacia el lado izquierdo unos 3 cm. Continúe haciendo esto hasta que tenga un metro de láminas de masa untadas con mantequilla superpuestas.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y poner en una bandeja para hornear para que se caliente. Vierta el relleno en una capa fina sobre la masa, a unos 2,5 cm del borde. Continúe hasta que haya llenado toda la longitud. Enrolle esto con cuidado, trabajando desde el borde más cercano a usted, hasta que tenga una forma de salchicha larga. Debes quedar firme, pero no enrollar demasiado fuerte o el filo se partirá. Deberían quedarte un par de hojas de filo sin usar, así que úsalas para arreglar las cosas, si es necesario.","Trabajando desde un extremo de la forma de salchicha, enrolle la masa y luego transfiérala con cuidado a una bandeja para hornear (aproximadamente del mismo tamaño que la que se calienta en el horno).","Unte el pastel con mantequilla, espolvoree las semillas de sésamo y luego deslice la bandeja para hornear sobre la que ya está en el horno (esto ayuda a garantizar una cocción uniforme). Hornee durante 30-35 minutos o hasta que esté dorado. Dejar enfriar un poco la tarta antes de comerla."]','2026-01-11 12:59:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13732,7333,'es','Albóndigas de cordero griegas','Prepare estas reconfortantes albóndigas de cordero griegas con verduras y patatas asadas en solo cinco minutos. Un favorito familiar garantizado, perfecto para las noches ocupadas','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","500 g de albóndigas de cordero","300 g de patatas tiernas, en rodajas gruesas","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","185 g de verduras a la brasa, escurridas si están en aceite","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados con hierbas","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moreno suave","100 g de aceitunas negras","40 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","½ manojo pequeño de menta, finamente rallada","1 limón, rallado"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola o sartén grande y poco profunda a prueba de fuego a fuego medio. Agrega las albóndigas y fríe por 5 minutos o hasta que estén doradas. Reservar en un plato.","Calienta el aceite restante en la misma sartén y fríe las patatas a fuego medio durante 5 minutos, o hasta que empiecen a dorarse.","Agrega el ajo a la sartén y sofríe durante 1 min. Agregue las verduras asadas, los tomates y el azúcar, así como las aceitunas. Estación. Vuelva a colocar las albóndigas en la sartén, cubra y cocine a fuego medio-bajo durante 30-35 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Retire la tapa a la mitad, las patatas deben estar bien cocidas y el líquido ligeramente reducido.","Retirar la sartén del fuego y servir en la mesa con el queso feta, la menta y la ralladura de limón esparcidos por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:59:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13733,7335,'es','Moussaka de alcachofas, berenjenas y cordero','Cordero al horno ligeramente especiado con corazones de alcachofa, ragú de tomate cherry y capas de berenjena y patatas fritas','["aceite de oliva, para freír","1 kg de carne picada de cordero","2 cebollas grandes, finamente picadas","3 dientes de ajo, picados","2 latas de 395 g de tomates cherry en jugo espeso","2 hojas de laurel","1 rama de canela","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","pizca de azúcar","2 berenjenas medianas","700 g de patatas grandes","2 latas de 390 g de corazones de alcachofa, muy bien escurridos (ver consejo)","100 g de mantequilla","100 g de harina común","900ml de leche","ralladura muy generosa de nuez moscada","125 g de gruyere rallado","25 g de parmesano rallado","3 huevos medianos, ligeramente batidos"]','["Calienta 1 1/2 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén amplia de fondo grueso hasta que esté caliente, luego fríe el cordero hasta que esté dorado por todas partes, aproximadamente 10 minutos (es importante que el aceite esté caliente, de lo contrario terminarás cocinando el cordero al vapor en lugar de freírlo). Retirar con una espumadera y reservar en un bol grande. Vierta todo menos 2 cucharadas de aceite en la sartén (el cordero se soltará bastante). Calentar esto y sofreír las cebollas a fuego medio hasta que estén suaves y doradas. Agrega el ajo y cocina por unos minutos más, luego agrega los tomates, el laurel, la canela, el orégano, el azúcar y los condimentos. Llevar a ebullición y luego bajar a fuego lento. Regresar la carne a la sartén, tapar y cocinar durante 40 minutos a fuego lento. Quita la tapa y cocina hasta obtener una salsa espesa (no debe quedar demasiado “espeso”).","Mientras se cocina la carne, corta las berenjenas en rodajas. Cortar las patatas en rodajas finas. Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva en una sartén y cocina las berenjenas en tandas hasta que estén doradas por ambos lados (consigue dos sartenes si tienes), luego baja el fuego y cocina hasta que estén suaves. Sazona y retira de la sartén. Agrega un poco más de aceite y cocina las papas en tandas, por ambos lados, hasta que estén doradas pálidas, retirándolas a medida que avanzas. Tendrás que agregar más aceite a la sartén cuando fríes cada tanda. Sazone y reserve.","Freír los corazones de alcachofa en aceite de oliva a fuego fuerte para que cojan un poco de color, pero con cuidado de que no se deshagan. Estación.","Retire las hojas de laurel y la ramita de canela de la carne y pruebe para sazonar. Coloque la moussaka en capas en un plato de aproximadamente 32 x 23 x 6 cm. Empieza poniendo todas las patatas en el fondo, luego añade la mitad de la carne. Colocar encima una capa de berenjena y luego el resto de la carne. Coloque los corazones de alcachofa encima.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Para hacer la salsa, derrita la mantequilla en una sartén de fondo grueso y agregue la harina hasta que quede ligeramente seca y de color arenoso. Retiramos del fuego y comenzamos a añadir la leche, poco a poco. Batir bien después de cada adición y mantener la mezcla suave. Sigue agregando hasta que hayas agotado toda la leche. Vuelva a poner la cacerola a fuego medio y lleve a ebullición, revolviendo continuamente, hasta que espese para formar una salsa. Agrega mucha nuez moscada, sal y pimienta. Baje el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 5 minutos; esto solo ayuda a cocinar la harina en la salsa. Agrega tres cuartas partes del queso y revuelve para ayudar a que se derrita. Verifique el condimento: necesita un condimento firme. Dejar enfriar un poco y luego incorporar los huevos.","Vierta esto sobre las capas del plato y esparza el queso restante encima. Hornee en el horno durante 30 minutos hasta que la parte superior esté dorada y burbujeante. Déjelo enfriar durante unos 10 minutos (los griegos nunca lo comen bien caliente) y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:59:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13734,4225,'es','Pescado asado al estilo griego','Filetes de pescado blanco al horno con patatas, tomates y hierbas para una cena saludable y sin gluten entre semana','["5 patatas pequeñas (unos 400 g), lavadas y cortadas en gajos","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","½ cucharadita de orégano seco o ½ cucharada de orégano fresco picado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","½ limón, cortado en gajos","2 tomates grandes, cortados en gajos","2 filetes de abadejo frescos y sin piel (unos 200 g)","un puñado pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque las patatas, la cebolla, el ajo, el orégano y el aceite de oliva en una fuente para asar, sazone y luego mezcle con las manos para cubrir todo con el aceite. Ase por 15 minutos, voltee todo y hornee por 15 minutos más.","Agregue el limón y los tomates y ase durante 10 minutos, luego cubra con los filetes de pescado y cocine por 10 minutos más. Sirva con perejil esparcido."]','2026-01-11 12:59:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13735,7337,'es','Cordero kleftiko','Selle una pierna de cordero en un paquete y luego ásela a fuego lento y largo con ajo, limón, hierbas y patatas para absorber sus deliciosos jugos.','["6 dientes de ajo","3 cucharadas de orégano picado","1 cucharada de romero picado","ralladura de 1 limón y jugo de 2","½ cucharadita de canela molida","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 kg de pierna de cordero","1 kg de patatas Desiree, partidas por la mitad o en cuartos","5 hojas de laurel","250 g de yogur griego","jugo ½ limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","un puñado de menta, rallada","1½ cucharadita de vinagre de vino tinto","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","100 g de espinacas tiernas","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","½ cebolla morada, cortada finamente","175 g de tomates cherry cortados por la mitad","½ pepino, cortado por la mitad a lo largo, sin semillas y en rodajas","75 g de aceitunas kalamata negras, deshuesadas y cortadas en cuartos"]','["Triturar los dientes de ajo\r\ny 1 cucharadita de sal con un mortero.\r\nAgrega las hierbas, la ralladura de limón, la canela,\r\nun poco de pimienta negra, triturar un poco más,\r\nluego agregue 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva.\r\nCon un cuchillo afilado, crea muchos agujeros.\r\npor todo el cordero y frotar con la pasta,\r\nempujándolo profundamente en los agujeros. Transferir\r\nel cordero a una bolsa de comida grande, vierta el\r\njugo de limón y dejar marinar durante la noche.","Al día siguiente, sacar el cordero del\r\nRefrigera 1 hora antes de querer cocinarlo.\r\nCalentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Colocar\r\n2 trozos largos de papel para hornear encima\r\nde 2 trozos largos de papel de aluminio – uno a lo ancho,\r\nel otro a lo largo para formar una cruz.\r\nColoca las patatas en el centro de la\r\npergamino y mezcle con el resto\r\naceite y un poco de condimento. Saca a relucir el\r\nlados del papel de aluminio, luego vierta la marinada\r\ndel cordero sobre las patatas y echar las hojas de laurel. Pon el cordero\r\nencima de las patatas y arrugar el papel de aluminio\r\njuntos firmemente para encerrar completamente\r\nel cordero. Colóquelo en una fuente para asar y ase.\r\nen el horno durante 4½ horas hasta que estén muy tiernos.","Retirar el molde del horno y aumentar\r\nla temperatura a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nDesenvuelve el paquete y arruga el papel de aluminio.\r\ny pergamino bajo el borde de la lata,\r\nrociar el cordero con los jugos y regresar\r\nal horno por 20 minutos más hasta que\r\ndorado. Sacar el cordero de la lata,\r\nenvolver en papel de aluminio y reposar. dar la vuelta a las patatas\r\nDar la vuelta y regresar al horno por 30 minutos.\r\nluego sazone con sal.","Mientras se cocinan las patatas, revuelva\r\njunta todos los ingredientes para el\r\nyogur. Combine el vinagre de vino tinto, el aceite.\r\ny un poco de condimento para hacer un aderezo\r\npara la ensalada. Mezcle el resto\r\ningredientes de la ensalada, agregando el aderezo\r\ncuando estés listo para comer. servir el cordero\r\ncon las patatas y los jugos carnosos, con\r\nla ensalada y el yogur al lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13736,6553,'es','Brochetas picantes de cordero y queso feta con ensalada griega de arroz integral','Brochetas estilo kofta con queso feta, harissa y cebolla, servidas con un saludable arroz basmati aromatizado con perejil y menta','["300 g de arroz basmati integral","500 g de carne picada de cordero","1 cucharada de harissa","50 gramos de queso feta","1 cebolla morada grande, ½ rebanada fina, ½ rallada","un puñado grande de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","un puñado grande de menta, picada en trozos grandes","85 g de aceitunas kalamata negras deshuesadas y cortadas en cuartos","1 pepino, cortado en cubitos","300 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","jugo 1 limon"]','["Remojar 12 brochetas de madera en agua.\r\ndurante 30 min. Cocine el arroz siguiente paquete\r\ninstrucciones, luego enjuague con agua fría\r\ny escurrir bien.","Calienta la parrilla. Mezclar la carne picada con\r\nharissa, queso feta, cebolla rallada y condimentos.\r\nForme 12 formas de salchicha y enhebre\r\nen las brochetas. Colocar sobre una bandeja para hornear antiadherente.\r\nbandeja y cocine a la parrilla durante 6-8 minutos, volteando hasta que\r\nbien cocido y ligeramente dorado.","Mezclar el arroz integral con el resto.\r\nIngredientes y algo de condimento. servir\r\njunto con las brochetas calientes."]','2026-01-11 12:59:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13737,7339,'es','Hamburguesas de cordero con tzatziki','Las hamburguesas caseras siempre son un ganador: prueba esta versión griega baja en calorías con yogur de pepino y menta y hamburguesas picantes.','["25 g de trigo bulgar","500 g de carne picada de cordero extra magra","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 diente de ajo, muy finamente machacado (opcional)","aceite, para cepillar","panecillos de hamburguesa grandes, tomate rebanado y cebolla morada, para servir","Pepino en trozos de 5 cm, sin semillas y rallado grueso","200 g de yogur griego espeso en bote","2 cucharadas de menta picada, más un puñado de hojas para servir"]','["Vierta el bulghar en una sartén, cubra\r\ncon agua y hervir durante 10 min. Drenar\r\nmuy bien en un colador, exprimiendo cualquier\r\nexceso de agua.","Para hacer el tzatziki, exprime y\r\ndesechar el jugo del pepino,\r\nluego mezcle con el yogur con el\r\nmenta picada y un poco de sal.","Introduzca el bulghar en el cordero con\r\nlas especias, el ajo (si se usa) y el condimento,\r\nluego forme 4 hamburguesas. Pincel con\r\nun poco de aceite y freír o asar durante unos\r\n5 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté completamente cocido\r\na través. Sirva en los panecillos (tostados si lo desea).\r\ncomo) con el tzatziki, tomates, cebolla\r\ny unas hojas de menta."]','2026-01-11 12:59:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13738,5109,'es','Pollo a la plancha con ensalada griega de quinoa','Un plato ligero de filetes de pollo a la plancha y auténtica ensalada con aceitunas Kalamata, queso feta, tomate y menta','["225 g de quinua","25 g de mantequilla","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","400 g de mini filetes de pollo","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","300 g de tomates en rama, picados en trozos grandes","un puñado de aceitunas kalamata negras sin hueso","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","manojo pequeño de hojas de menta, picadas","jugo y ralladura de ½ limón"]','["Cocer la quinua siguiendo las\r\ninstrucciones del paquete, luego enjuague\r\nagua fría y escurrir bien.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la mantequilla,\r\nchile y ajo hasta formar una pasta. tirar\r\nlos filetes de pollo en 2 cucharaditas de\r\naceite de oliva con un poco de condimento.\r\nColóquelo en una sartén caliente y cocine.\r\ndurante 3-4 minutos por cada lado o hasta que\r\nbien cocido. Transfiera a un plato, salpique con la mantequilla picante.\r\ny dejar a un lado para que se derrita.","A continuación, volcar los tomates, las aceitunas,\r\ncebolla, queso feta y menta en un bol.\r\nAgregue la quinua cocida. Revuelva\r\npor el aceite de oliva restante,\r\njugo y ralladura de limón y sazonar\r\nbueno. Servir con el pollo\r\nfiletes encima, rociados con cualquier\r\njugos de pollo con mantequilla."]','2026-01-11 12:59:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13739,7341,'es','Cordero griego y macarrones al horno','Un cruce entre moussaka y macarrones con queso, este económico horneado de pasta mediterránea es una comida abundante.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","500 g de carne magra de cordero","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 pastilla de caldo de ternera o cordero","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de orégano seco","400 g de macarrones","250 g de ricota en tarrina","50 g de parmesano rallado","50ml de leche","pan de ajo, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, agregar el\r\ncebolla y cocine por 10 minutos hasta que esté suave.\r\nAgrega el ajo y cocina por 1 min más,\r\nluego agregue la carne picada de cordero, suba el\r\nCalentar y dorar, rompiendo la carne picada.\r\ncon una cuchara de madera.","Una vez dorado el cordero añadir\r\nla canela, la pastilla de caldo desmenuzado,\r\ntomates y orégano. Revuelva bien y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, tapado, luego durante\r\n15 minutos, destapado, hasta que la salsa\r\nha espesado y los tomates tienen\r\ncocido.","Mientras tanto, cocine los macarrones.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir bien.\r\nCalentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Mezclar la ricota, la mayor parte del\r\nparmesano y la leche con abundante\r\nsazone y agregue los macarrones.\r\nColoque la carne picada en una fuente para hornear grande, cubra\r\ncon la mezcla de macarrones y esparcir\r\nsobre el queso parmesano restante. Hornear para\r\n30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante. servir\r\nCaliente con pan de ajo, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13740,7343,'es','Cordero griego con patatas y aceitunas','Entretenga de manera fácil con esta olla rústica de preparación rápida: simplemente sírvala con pan crujiente','["800 g de patatas medianas, con piel y en rodajas finas","4 tomates grandes, en rodajas finas","1 berenjena, en rodajas finas","4 dientes de ajo, picados","3 cucharadas de hojas de orégano, más un poco más para espolvorear","85 g de aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","4 filetes de cordero"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nColoque en capas la mitad de la patata, el tomate y\r\nberenjena en una fuente para horno, esparciendo\r\ncon ajo, orégano y aceitunas, y\r\nrociando con aceite y sazonando a medida que avanza.","Distribuya sobre el queso feta y luego repita el proceso.\r\ncapas hasta utilizar todos los ingredientes\r\narriba. Terminar con patatas y un poco de aceite.","Hornee por 50 minutos o hasta que las verduras estén\r\ntiernos (cubra con papel de aluminio si se están poniendo\r\ndemasiado marrón). Cubra con los filetes de cordero,\r\nfrotando con un poco más de aceite y\r\ncondimento. Hornee por 15-20 minutos más\r\nhasta que el cordero esté cocido. dejar reposar\r\ny enfriar un poco antes de esparcir con\r\norégano y servir con pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13741,7345,'es','Lucknowi masala paneer pulao','Marina el paneer con ajo y chile para obtener un pulao aromático con especias enteras: una receta fácil ideal para alimentar a una multitud en este Diwali.','["80ml de aceite vegetal, más 3 cucharadas","2 cebollas medianas, picadas","4 dientes de ajo grandes, picados en trozos grandes","Trozo de jengibre de 2 pulgadas, picado en trozos grandes","400 g de paneer, cortado en cubos","2 chiles ojo de pájaro verdes, cortados a lo largo","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","5 vainas de cardamomo verde","2 hojas de laurel secas","1 rama de canela","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma en polvo","250 g de arroz basmati","20 g de mantequilla, derretida","1 cucharadita de garam masala","1 lima, exprimida","2 cucharadas de hojas de cilantro, finamente picadas","raita, servir","3 cucharadas de yogur griego","1 cucharada de gramo de harina","1½ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","½ cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharada de kasoori methi seco (hojas de fenogreco)"]','["Calentar 80 ml de aceite vegetal en una sartén a fuego lento y sofreír las cebollas durante 30-35 minutos hasta que se doren. Retirar de la sartén con una espumadera, escurrir sobre papel de cocina y reservar.","Muele el ajo y el jengibre hasta obtener una pasta suave con un chorrito de agua usando un mortero.","Coloque todos los ingredientes de la marinada en un tazón junto con la mitad de la pasta de ajo y jengibre. Mezcle bien y agregue los cubos de paneer, revolviendo para cubrir. Deje marinar durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, en una sartén antiadherente grande, caliente 3 cucharadas de aceite a fuego medio. Agrega los chiles verdes, las semillas de comino, el cardamomo, las hojas de laurel y la canela, luego sofríe unos segundos. Agrega el resto de la pasta de ajo y jengibre, sofríe durante 1 minuto y agrega la cúrcuma, la mitad de las cebollas fritas y el arroz basmati. Revuelve bien y sazona al gusto. Vierta 500 ml de agua, lleve a ebullición y cocine a fuego lento con la tapa puesta durante 17-18 minutos. Apagar el fuego y dejar reposar con la tapa puesta durante 15 minutos.","Coloque los cubos de paneer en una bandeja para hornear forrada. Caliente la parrilla a fuego medio-alto y cocine el paneer durante 3-4 minutos, luego mezcle con mantequilla derretida y continúe cocinando durante 4-6 minutos más hasta que se ablande y esté ligeramente carbonizado.","Agrega el paneer asado al arroz y revuelve bien. Cubra con las cebollas fritas restantes, el garam masala, el jugo de lima y el cilantro. Sirva con raita, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13742,7347,'es','rasmalai','Disfruta de este cremoso postre indio elaborado con leche, azafrán, cardamomo, pistachos y almendras. Es un plato fabuloso para servir al final de un banquete indio.','["1,5 litros de leche","4 cucharadas de vinagre blanco","700ml de leche","pizca de hebras de azafrán","20 g de almendras picadas","20 g de pistachos sin cáscara, en rodajas","½ cucharadita de cardamomo molido","100 g de azúcar en polvo","200 g de azúcar en polvo","4 vainas de cardamomo verde","20 g de pistachos, finamente picados","20 g de almendras, finamente picadas"]','["Pon 1 cucharada de agua en una cacerola (esto evitará que la leche se queme), luego vierte la leche y deja hervir a fuego medio. La leche formará espuma; sigue mezclando la película que crea en la parte superior y lateral. Cuando rompa a hervir, apaga el fuego.","Mezcle 4 cucharadas de agua con el vinagre, luego agréguelo a la leche además, revolviendo suavemente entre cada uno. Deje reposar durante 10 minutos, sin tocar, para que el vinagre comience a cuajar la leche (esto dará como resultado trozos más grandes de cuajada de leche). Si no ves que la mezcla se separa, vuelve a poner a fuego lento durante 5 minutos más.","Forre un colador grande con una gasa, muselina o un paño de cocina limpio y vierta la leche cuajada a través de él. Una vez que todo el suero se haya filtrado y solo le quede la cuajada de leche, enjuague la cuajada con agua fría para eliminar el sabor a vinagre. Dejar escurrir.","Cuando la mayor parte del agua haya drenado a través de la cuajada, levanta el paño y exprímelo hasta que hayas eliminado la mayor parte de la humedad. Ata el paño al grifo y déjalo colgado para que se escurra por completo.","Mientras tanto, prepara los rabidi. Vierte la leche en un cazo y lleva a ebullición a fuego medio. Reducir el fuego, remover y añadir el azafrán, las almendras, los pistachos y el cardamomo. Sigue removiendo suavemente y, una vez que la leche comience a burbujear, agrega el azúcar. Cocine por otros 5 minutos más o menos hasta que hierva. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","En este momento, la cuajada de leche debe estar completamente drenada del exceso de humedad. Retírelo de la estopilla y colóquelo sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia. Divídalo en pequeñas migajas y, con la palma de la mano, amase la cuajada como lo haría con el pan durante unos 7-8 minutos para unirla, asegurándose de no trabajarla demasiado.","Para darle forma al rasmalai, extienda la cuajada de leche en forma de tronco y divídala en 10 a 14 trozos del mismo tamaño. Enrolla cada pieza entre la palma de tu mano hasta obtener una bola lisa y sin grietas. Aplana suavemente cada bola (no te preocupes si quedan algunas grietas en el borde una vez aplanada).","Para hacer el almíbar, poner el azúcar, el cardamomo y 950 ml de agua en una cacerola ancha y profunda a fuego medio-alto y cocinar hasta que el azúcar se derrita. Suba el fuego a alto y déjelo hervir, luego retire las vainas de cardamomo y agregue con cuidado el rasmalai. Cubra con una tapa y cocine por 10 minutos, luego reduzca el fuego a medio-alto y cocine por 2-3 minutos más. Retirar la sartén del fuego, quitar la tapa y dejar que el rasmalai se enfríe completamente en el almíbar.","Vuelva a calentar un poco el rabdi y luego viértalo en un bol. Saque el rasmalai cocido del almíbar de azúcar y exprímalo suavemente entre las palmas de las manos para escurrir el almíbar de azúcar, teniendo cuidado de no romperlos. Agregue el rasmalai al rabdi tibio, luego cubra y déjelo reposar en la leche a temperatura ambiente durante 5 a 6 horas antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13743,7349,'es','charla de pollo','Prepare un plato indio sencillo con pollo, verduras y especias. Sirva como parte de una variedad más grande o disfrútelo solo como plato principal.','["2 cucharadas de ghee o aceite vegetal","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos pequeños","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo grande, triturado","2 chiles verdes, finamente picados","4 cucharadas de pasta de tamarindo","1 cucharada de garam masala","2 cucharaditas de chaat masala","1 tomate grande, finamente picado","¼ de pepino, finamente picado","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 cebolla tierna, finamente cortada","rodajas de limón, para servir"]','["Calienta la mitad del aceite en un wok o sartén grande a fuego alto. Agregue el pollo y cocine durante 5-6 minutos hasta que se dore por completo. No es necesario que esté bien cocido en este punto. Retirar a un plato con una espumadera y reservar.","Vierte el aceite restante en la sartén y pon a fuego medio. Agrega la cebolla y fríe durante 2-3 minutos, luego agrega el ajo y los chiles. Cocine durante 7-9 minutos más hasta que las cebollas estén blandas y traslúcidas. Regrese el pollo a la sartén, junto con la pasta de tamarindo, el garam masala y el chaat masala. Sazone y revuelva bien para cubrir. Tape y cocine por 5 minutos o hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido.","Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 2 minutos antes de agregar el tomate y el pepino. Adorne con cilantro y cebolleta y sirva con rodajas de limón a un lado para exprimirlas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13744,7351,'es','Chargha de pollo Kadhai','Disfrute de esta receta sencilla de pollo kadhai chargha, que incluye pollo tierno marinado, cocinado con especias calientes y servido con una refrescante raita de menta.','["6-8 dientes de ajo","2 cucharadas de yogur griego","1 cucharadita de chile cachemira en polvo","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","¼ cucharadita de garam masala","700 g de pollo con hueso, sin piel y cortado en trozos medianos","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","2-3 chiles rojos de Cachemira secos","Trozo de 1½ pulgada de jengibre rallado grueso","1 chile rojo, en rodajas finas","cilantro, para adornar","naans, servir","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","200 gramos de yogur natural","40 g de hojas de menta","10 g de hojas de cilantro","1 diente de ajo"]','["Agrega el ajo y 1 cucharada de yogur a una licuadora y mezcla hasta obtener una pasta suave. Vierta la pasta en un bol con el chile en polvo, el cilantro molido, la cúrcuma molida, el garam masala y una pizca de sal y mezcle. Agregue la 1 cucharada de yogur restante y el pollo y mezcle hasta que el pollo esté cubierto. Reserva el pollo para marinar en el frigorífico durante 2-3 horas o preferiblemente durante la noche.","En un wok o sartén honda calienta el aceite vegetal a fuego medio. Agrega las semillas de comino y los chiles secos y déjalos chisporrotear y darle sabor al aceite durante 10 segundos. Vierta los trozos de pollo marinados y fríalos durante 5 a 7 minutos, revolviendo continuamente. Baje el fuego a bajo y cocine durante 20 minutos más con la tapa puesta para ayudar a crear vapor en el wok.","Mientras tanto, haz la raita. Agregue las semillas de comino y 1/2 cucharadita de pimienta negra a un mortero y muela hasta obtener un polvo fino. Ahora agregue 2 cucharadas de yogur junto con los demás ingredientes en una licuadora y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave. Vierta en un tazón para servir y mezcle con el resto del yogur. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir.","Una vez que el pollo esté completamente cocido y tierno, agregue el jengibre grueso y los chiles en rodajas y espolvoree sobre el cilantro. Mezclar bien y servir caliente con la raita de menta y el naan."]','2026-01-11 12:59:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13745,7353,'es','Tabla de bhaji de cebolla','Disfrute de esta tabla para compartir con familiares y amigos, con una mezcla de bhajis de cebolla, chutney verde, raita de pepino, ensalada de granada y mini poppadoms.','["2 cebollas, rebanadas","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas","100 gramos de harina","½ cucharadita de levadura en polvo, sin gluten si es necesario","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 chile verde, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado","aceite vegetal, para freír","pequeño manojo de menta, hojas recogidas","manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de comino","1 cucharadita de azúcar","1 chile verde, picado","1 limón, exprimido","½ pepino , rallado grueso","150 gramos de yogur natural","2 cucharadas de menta finamente picada","4 cucharadas de semillas de granada","½ pepino, cortado en cubitos","2 tomates en rama de invierno o de temporada, picados (opcional)","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","un puñado de cilantro picado","½ limón, exprimido","mini poppadoms","Chutney dulce (nosotros usamos mango)","pepinillo de lima"]','["Echar las cebollas en un bol con sal y dejar reposar 5 minutos. Mientras tanto, bata la harina, el polvo para hornear y las especias en otro bol. Agregue 100 ml de agua para hacer una masa espesa. Incorpora las cebollas, el chile y el cilantro.","Vierta el aceite vegetal en una sartén profunda, asegurándose de que no esté más de un tercio de su capacidad. Calienta a 180 °C o hasta que un trozo de cebolla chisporrotee al dejarlo caer y se dore en 20 segundos. Agregue unas cucharadas de la mezcla a la vez y fría durante 3-4 minutos, luego voltee con una araña y cocine por 1-2 minutos más. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y sazonar. Manténgalo caliente en el horno bajo mientras continúa cocinando o recaliente más tarde en una freidora.","Mezcla los ingredientes para el chutney verde con una pizca de sal y un chorrito de agua en una licuadora pequeña hasta que quede suave. Vierta en un tazón pequeño para servir.","Mezclar los ingredientes de la raita en otro bol y sazonar. Mezcle los ingredientes de la ensalada en un tercer tazón. 5 Sirva los bhajis en el medio de una fuente o tabla grande con los tazones de chutney verde, ensalada y raita al lado, además de extras como mini poppadoms, chutney de mango y pepinillo de lima."]','2026-01-11 12:59:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13746,7355,'es','Biryani de cordero al horno','Prepara un plato que una a la gente con un biriyani clásico. Es ideal como centro de mesa para un banquete cuando invitas a familiares y amigos a cenar.','["5 vainas de cardamomo verde","5 dientes","2 cm de canela en rama","450 g de grupa de cordero, cortada en cubos de 2 cm","250 g de tomates, picados en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de yogur griego","1 cebolla grande, picada en trozos grandes","3 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","10 g de jengibre, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","1 chile verde, sin semillas y picado en trozos grandes","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","2½ cucharaditas de ghee","½ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","200 g de arroz basmati","3 vainas de cardamomo verde","Hoja de pandan de 2 cm (opcional)","75 g de anacardos crudos","2 ramitas de hojas de curry, hojas recogidas","4 huevos fríos en heladera"]','["Coloca las vainas de cardamomo, los clavos y la canela en una sartén pequeña a fuego medio y tuesta durante 1-2 minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Triture hasta obtener un polvo grueso con un mortero y deseche las cáscaras de cardamomo. Ponga el cordero en un bol grande con los tomates, el yogur y 1/2 cucharadita de sal marina fina. Agrega las especias trituradas y mezcla bien. Dejar marinar durante al menos 2 horas o toda la noche.","Para el biryani, mezcle la mitad de la cebolla con el ajo, el jengibre, la guindilla y el cilantro en un procesador de alimentos pequeño hasta que estén finamente picados. Dejar de lado. Derrita 11/2 cucharadita de ghee en una cacerola profunda con tapa a fuego medio y cocine las cebollas restantes durante 7 a 9 minutos hasta que estén suaves y los bordes dorados. Agrega el chile en polvo, la cúrcuma, la mezcla de cebolla picada y una pizca de sal. Revuelva bien, luego agregue el cordero y el adobo sobrante. Revuelva bien, cubra con la tapa, reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, ponga a hervir una cacerola con 300 ml de agua. Vierta el arroz, las vainas de cardamomo y la hoja de pandan, si las usa, y hierva durante 4-5 minutos. Escurrir y retirar las vainas de cardamomo y la hoja de pandan. Dejar de lado.","Derrita el ghee restante en una sartén pequeña a fuego medio-alto y fría los anacardos durante 3-4 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Vierta en un tazón pequeño y reserve. Agrega las hojas de curry a la sartén y cocina por un minuto, luego reserva con los anacardos.","Destapa el cordero. Esparcir sobre el arroz, los anacardos y las hojas de curry. Tapar nuevamente y cocinar a fuego lento durante 20 minutos, o hasta que el arroz esté suave y esponjoso.","Mientras tanto, hierva una cacerola pequeña con agua, agregue con cuidado los huevos y cocine durante 6-7 minutos. Escurrir bien, pelar y luego cortar por la mitad. Agrega el arroz, los anacardos y las hojas de curry a la carne, luego vierte en una fuente para servir y sirve con los huevos duros encima."]','2026-01-11 12:59:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13747,7357,'es','Kebab rey de pollo tandoori con cúrcuma y biryani de judías verdes','Haga una versión casera de su plato favorito para llevar utilizando muslos de pollo económicos y conviértalos en un kebab tandoori grande para compartir.','["3 cucharadas de pasta tandoori","2 cucharadas de yogur natural","manojo pequeño de cilantro","600 g de filetes de muslo de pollo deshuesados ​​Morrisons","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","25 g de mantequilla","1 cebolla, finamente cortada","300 g de arroz basmati, remojado en agua fría durante 30 minutos y luego escurrido","3 vainas de cardamomo, ligeramente trituradas","1 rama de canela","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","750 ml de caldo de pollo","200 g de judías verdes, peladas","2 limones, cortados en mejillas"]','["Mezcle la pasta tandoori y el yogur en un tazón grande. Pique finamente la mitad del cilantro y revuelva, luego agregue el pollo y revuelva para cubrir. Cubrir y reservar. Se mantendrá frío hasta por un día.","Calienta el aceite y la mantequilla en una cacerola mediana a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla durante 5-8 minutos hasta que esté suave y dorada. Agrega el arroz, luego agrega el cardamomo, la canela y la cúrcuma y sazona con sal.","Vierta sobre el caldo de pollo, esparza sobre las judías verdes y deje hervir. Cubra con una tapa, luego reduzca el fuego a bajo y cocine por 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, alinee los muslos de pollo sobre una tabla con los lados más largos uno contra el otro, metiendo cada muslo en una forma oblonga y ordenada. Empuje dos brochetas de metal largas paralelas a la línea de filetes para que se mantengan juntas y forme un kebab grande. (Si no tienes brochetas largas, puedes usar brochetas más cortas y hacer dos brochetas separadas).","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto y asa el kebab durante 20 minutos, volteándolo ocasionalmente para asegurarte de que se dore uniformemente. (O haga esto en una sartén caliente). Verifique que el pollo esté bien cocido observando los espacios donde los muslos descansan uno contra el otro; si todavía está crudo, continúe cocinando, revisando cada pocos minutos, luego introduzca un cuchillo en la parte más grasa para asegurarse de que los jugos salgan claros. Coloque el biryani en una fuente para servir y cubra con el kebab. Pica el cilantro restante y espárcelo, luego sírvelo con las carrilleras de limón para exprimirlas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13748,7359,'es','Tarta de jalfrezi de champiñones','Inspírate en el clásico curry indio y prepara este pastel lleno de sabor, que se vuelve muy especial al incorporar especias a la masa. Seguro que complacerá a la multitud','["1 kg de champiñones, en rodajas","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","1 cebolla, en rodajas","1 pimiento rojo, picado","3 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente rallados","1-2 chiles verdes, finamente picados (sin semillas, si lo desea)","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","120 g de espinacas","200 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de harina integral (o utilice más harina normal)","150 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","1 cucharada de semillas de alcaravea","1 yema de huevo o ½ cucharada de leche vegetal (si usa yema de huevo, congele la clara para usarla en otra receta), más extra para pintar"]','["Para la masa, poner las harinas y la mantequilla en un procesador de alimentos. Bate hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino (también puedes frotarlas con los dedos). Agregue las semillas de alcaravea y presione para combinar. Agrega la yema de huevo o la leche vegetal y pulsa nuevamente hasta tener una masa suave. Si es necesario, agregue más leche vegetal o agua, ½ cucharadita a la vez, solo para unir la masa. Enfriar durante 20 minutos.","Coloca los champiñones en una sartén grande. Cocine a fuego medio hasta que el líquido se suelte y se evapore, unos 15 minutos. Rocíe el aceite y luego agregue las cebollas y los pimientos. Freír durante 8-10 minutos hasta que los champiñones estén dorados y las verduras se ablanden.","Agregue el ajo y los chiles y cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Agrega las especias, revuelve y cocina por 1 min antes de agregar los tomates y media lata de agua. Revuelva, luego cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que espese un poco, agregando un poco de agua si es necesario para aflojar. Agregue las espinacas y cocine por unos minutos para que se ablanden.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta la mezcla en un molde para pastel. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta que tenga ½ cm de espesor y sea lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir el plato. Colóquelo encima y doble los bordes para sellar. Haz un par de agujeros en la parte superior para que escape el vapor y luego unta con un poco de yema de huevo o leche vegetal. Hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13749,7361,'es','Hara Bhara Kabab','Disfrute de estas hamburguesas veganas que son un refrigerio popular en el norte de la India, con un tinte verde debido a las espinacas. Sirva con su chutney favorito; nosotros optamos por el mango.','["500 g de patatas Maris Piper, cortadas en cuartos","130 ml de aceite de girasol","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","50 g de col rizada, finamente picada","50 g de espinacas, finamente picadas","50 g de guisantes congelados","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de amchur (mango en polvo)","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","chutney, para servir"]','["Vierte las patatas en una cacerola con agua fría. Sal bien y lleva a ebullición, luego cocina a fuego lento durante 12-15 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir bien y dejar enfriar.","Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y agrega los dientes de ajo. Después de unos segundos, agrega la col rizada, tapa y reduce el fuego a bajo durante 5 minutos. Agrega las espinacas y los guisantes, tapa y cocina a fuego lento durante 5 minutos más. Retirar del fuego y verter en un procesador de alimentos. Bate hasta obtener una pasta gruesa.","Vierta la pasta en un bol con las patatas hervidas, las especias, la harina de maíz y ½ cucharadita de sal. Triture bien y divida en 12 bolas ligeramente aplanadas.","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén honda y cocina las brochetas durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas. Sirva con un chutney de su elección."]','2026-01-11 12:59:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13750,7363,'es','Dhal de coco al horno con coliflor especiada y paneer','Deje que el horno haga el trabajo en este dhal de coco, coliflor y paneer, donde la cúrcuma le da un hermoso color dorado. Disfruta con nuestras cebollas encurtidas caseras.','["1 cebolla morada grande, picada","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o vegetal","2 latas de 400 g de leche de coco","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","1 cucharada de puré de ajo (unos 6 dientes de ajo)","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry (nosotros usamos pasta de korma)","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma molida","2 cucharaditas de semillas de nigella","100 g de lentejas rojas","150 g de chana dhal o guisantes partidos","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 limón, exprimido","½ coliflor grande (unos 500 g), partida en floretes, tallos y hojas picadas en trozos grandes","225 g de paneer, cortado en cubos","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 chile verde, finamente cortado","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, hojas recogidas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle las cebollas en una fuente para asar grande y honda con el aceite. Ase durante 15 minutos, hasta que se ablanden.","Coloque 3 cucharadas de crema de coco sobre la leche de coco y reserve. Agrega el jengibre, el ajo, 1 cucharada de pasta de curry, 1 cucharadita de cúrcuma, las semillas de nigella, las lentejas, el chana dhal, los tomates y el resto de la leche de coco con las cebollas. Llene la lata vacía con 400 ml de agua, gírela y viértala en la fuente para asar. Sazone y mezcle bien, luego envuelva la bandeja en papel de aluminio y regrese al horno para cocinar durante 50 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el resto de la pasta de curry y la cúrcuma con la crema de coco reservada. Agregue un chorrito de limón y sazone, luego mezcle la coliflor y el paneer hasta que estén bien cubiertos.","Desenvuelva el dhal, revuelva y agregue un poco más de agua si se ve demasiado seco. Esparce los trozos de coliflor y paneer encima y regresa al horno sin tapar durante 40 minutos. Mientras tanto, mezcle la cebolla morada y el chile en rodajas con un chorrito de jugo de limón y una pizca de sal. Reservar para encurtir.","Cuando el dhal esté cocido, las lentejas deben estar suaves y la coliflor y el paneer deben estar carbonizados. Deje reposar durante 10 minutos y luego sirva con la cebolla encurtida y el chile, con un poco de hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 12:59:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13751,7365,'es','Saag de frijoles mantecosos','Disfrute de esta versión del saag, repleta de espinacas y especias. Es perfecto como acompañamiento en un festín indio o como plato independiente servido con chapatis.','["25 g de ghee o mantequilla","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","20 g de jengibre rallado","3 dientes de ajo rallados","1 chile verde (sin semillas si prefieres menos picante), finamente picado","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de hojas secas de fenogreco (opcional)","400 g de espinacas congeladas","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes, escurridas y enjuagadas","½ limón, exprimido","chapatis y chutney de mango, para servir"]','["Calienta el ghee o la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio-alto. Agregue la cebolla y las semillas de mostaza y fría durante 5 minutos, hasta que los bordes estén dorados y las semillas de mostaza salten. Incorpora el jengibre, el ajo, la guindilla verde y el puré de tomate. Cocine durante 4-5 minutos, hasta que esté fragante y caramelizado.","Agregue las especias restantes, las hojas de fenogreco, si las usa, y las espinacas congeladas con un chorrito de agua. Dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, hasta que las espinacas se hayan descongelado por completo y el líquido se haya espesado y reducido. Agrega los frijoles y el jugo de limón y luego sazona al gusto. Sirva con chapatis y chutney de mango."]','2026-01-11 12:59:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13752,7367,'es','Rasgulla','Prepare este postre tradicional indio con requesón casero enrollado en bolas y luego remojado en almíbar con aroma a rosas; el resultado es dulce, esponjoso y ligero.','["2 litros de leche entera","2-3 cucharadas de vinagre destilado","hebras de azafrán o pistachos picados, para servir","200 g de azúcar granulada","4 vainas de cardamomo","1 cucharada de extracto de agua de rosas (o al gusto, según la marca)"]','["Forre un colador grande de malla fina con un paño de muselina y colóquelo sobre un tazón grande. Lleva la leche a ebullición en una cacerola grande a fuego medio, revolviendo para evitar que se pegue o se queme. Agregue lentamente 2-3 cucharadas de vinagre, revolviendo hasta que la leche se cuaje. Retirar inmediatamente del fuego y dejar reposar hasta que los sólidos de la leche se hayan separado del suero. Cuele la mezcla usando el colador preparado, luego enjuague los sólidos de la leche en el paño con agua corriente fría (esto eliminará cualquier sabor a vinagre persistente). Junte los bordes del paño para encerrar los sólidos de la leche y apriételo suavemente para eliminar el exceso de líquido. Hacer un nudo en el paño, colgarlo sobre el grifo del fregadero y dejar colar 1 hora.","Vierta los sólidos de la leche colada en un tazón y amase suavemente hasta que formen una masa suave, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Tenga cuidado de no amasar demasiado o puede quedar duro. Enrolle una pequeña porción de la masa hasta formar una bola suave con las palmas de las manos (la bola debe medir unos 2-3 cm y unos 25 g). Repita con la masa restante.","Para hacer el almíbar, ponga en una cacerola el azúcar, 1 litro de agua, las vainas de cardamomo y la cantidad suficiente de extracto de agua de rosas para impartir un ligero sabor floral, sin que sea demasiado fuerte (es posible que no necesite 1 cucharada completa). Calentar a fuego medio hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, luego llevar a ebullición y cocinar durante unos 10 minutos hasta que la mezcla se espese y se convierta en un almíbar pegajoso.","Agrega con cuidado las bolas de masa al almíbar, luego cubre con una tapa y cocina durante 10 minutos más hasta que las rasgullas hayan duplicado su tamaño. Retirar a un plato con una espumadera y dejar enfriar por completo, luego espolvorear con hebras de azafrán o pistachos picados. Enfríe hasta que esté listo y frío, luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:59:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13753,7369,'es','gobi manchuriano','Invite a sus amigos o familiares a este popular entrante indochino en el que los floretes de coliflor crujientes se mezclan con una salsa agridulce picante.','["1 coliflor, cortada en floretes","Aceite neutro como el de girasol o vegetal, para freír.","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 chile verde, picado","1 cebolla morada, picada","2 cebolletas, finamente cortadas, y más para servir","½ pimiento rojo, cortado en cubitos","½ pimiento verde, cortado en cubitos","2 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","1 cucharada de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharada de pimienta negra molida","100 g de harina común","20 g de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo"]','["Cocine los floretes de coliflor en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo durante 8 a 10 minutos, hasta que estén tiernos, luego escúrralos en un colador y reserve.","Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la masa en un tazón grande con 1 cucharadita de sal, luego vierta lentamente 200 ml de agua, revolviendo todo el tiempo para obtener una masa suave y lo suficientemente espesa como para cubrir la coliflor.","Coloque los floretes en la masa y revuelva suavemente para cubrirlos. Vierta suficiente aceite en una cacerola grande para llenarla hasta la mitad y luego póngala a fuego medio-alto hasta que alcance los 180 ° C, o un cubo de pan que se dore en 30 segundos. Freír los floretes de coliflor en tandas durante unos 6 minutos hasta que estén dorados y crujientes, luego dejar escurrir en un colador.","Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en un wok grande a fuego lento, luego agregue el ajo, el chile picado, la cebolla morada, la cebolleta, los pimientos rojos y verdes y cocine, revolviendo, durante 2 minutos.","Agregue el ketchup, la salsa de chile, la salsa de soja, el vinagre de arroz, las hojuelas de chile, la pimienta negra y 1 cucharadita de sal y pimienta y caliente durante 1 minuto. Mezcle los floretes fritos en la salsa para cubrirlos. Sirva en un bol, espolvoreado con cebolletas picadas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13754,7371,'es','tonto','No consuma carne con este curry de papa indio. Aromático y lleno de sabor, puede funcionar como guarnición o plato principal vegetariano con tus guarniciones favoritas.','["500 g de patatas baby peladas","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","1 cebolla, finamente picada","3 vainas de cardamomo","3 hojas de laurel","2 ramas de canela","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de semillas de kalonji (semillas de nigella), más un poco más para servir","1 tomate mediano, picado","1 cucharadita de pasta de jengibre y ajo","1 cucharadita de fenogreco","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de comino","1 cucharada de harina de gramo (harina de garbanzos)","250 g de yogur griego","cilantro picado, garam masala y anacardos, para servir"]','["Ponga las patatas en una cacerola con agua con sal, déjelas hervir y cocine durante 10 minutos, hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrir y reservar.","Rocíe el aceite en la sartén y fría las patatas durante 3-4 minutos a fuego medio-alto hasta que estén ligeramente doradas por todas partes. Retirar de la sartén y reservar.","Agregue la cebolla, las vainas de cardamomo, el laurel, la rama de canela, las semillas de comino y las semillas de kalonji (nigella). Freír durante 6-8 minutos hasta que estén dorados.","Agregue el tomate picado, la pasta de jengibre y ajo, el fenogreco, el chile en polvo, la cúrcuma, el cilantro molido y el comino. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que el tomate se ablande.","Mezcle la harina de garbanzos y el yogur griego hasta que quede suave, luego agregue la mezcla de masala. Vierta 100 ml de agua, cocine a fuego lento durante 1 minuto y luego agregue las patatas para cubrirlas con la salsa masala. Cubra y cocine al vapor durante 8-10 minutos a fuego lento. Espolvorea con más semillas de kalonji, cilantro picado, garam masala y anacardos para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13755,7373,'es','pan vegano','Haga una versión vegana de naan para disfrutar con sus platos indios favoritos sin carne usando un bloque de origen vegetal sin lácteos en lugar de ghee.','["Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal, más un poco más para el bol","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","500 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de bloque de mantequilla vegetal salada vegana","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado"]','["Combine la levadura, el azúcar, el aceite y 300 ml de agua tibia en una jarra. Mezcle el polvo de hornear, la harina y 1 cucharadita de sal marina fina en un tazón grande, haga un hueco en el centro y vierta la mezcla de levadura. Mezcle bien para combinar y luego colóquelo sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Amasar durante 5-7 minutos, o hasta que la masa esté elástica y suave. Transfiera a un recipiente ligeramente engrasado, cubra con un paño de cocina y déjelo reposar en un lugar cálido durante 45 minutos a 1 hora hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Incline la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia y golpéela un par de veces. Dividir en ocho o 10 trozos (de unos 75 g cada uno) y formar bolas. Tapar y dejar reposar durante 30-45 minutos hasta que vuelva a duplicar su tamaño.","Calienta una sartén seca de hierro fundido o de base pesada a fuego medio-alto. Extienda una bola de masa a la vez hasta darle forma ovalada sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, dejando el resto cubierto. Cepille ligeramente la parte superior con agua y colóquela en la sartén caliente, con el lado húmedo hacia abajo. Cepille el otro lado con agua y cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que se hinche y forme ampollas. Voltee y cocine por el otro lado, luego envuélvalo en un paño de cocina para mantenerlo caliente. Repita con las bolas de masa restantes.","Mezcle la mantequilla vegetal y el ajo en una cacerola pequeña y caliente a fuego lento durante unos minutos hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y el ajo esté chisporroteante, de color marrón claro y fragante. Retirar del fuego y agregar el cilantro. Cepille esto sobre los naans calientes y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:59:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13756,7375,'es','Pollo Dhansak','Haga que el pollo vaya más allá con este curry parsi donde las lentejas crean una textura sustanciosa y cremosa. También tiene notas de sabor agridulces.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de sabor neutro (como el de colza) o ghee","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","1 rama de canela","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ calabaza, pelada y cortada en cubos","1 cucharadita de ajo finamente picado","400 g de pechuga o muslo de pollo cortado en cubos","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","Lata de 150 g de lentejas rojas, escurridas y enjuagadas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1-2 cucharadas de pasta de tamarindo o al gusto","1 cucharadita de hojas secas de fenogreco","chorrito de jugo de limón, para servir","un puñado de cilantro picado, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite o el ghee en una sartén grande de base pesada a fuego medio y cocina las cebollas y la rama de canela durante unos minutos hasta que las cebollas empiecen a dorarse. Agrega las semillas de comino y mezcla bien.","Vierta la calabaza y continúe cocinando por unos minutos más, luego agregue el ajo y cocine por 1 minuto. Agregue el pollo y dórelo durante unos minutos, luego agregue la cúrcuma, el cilantro molido, el chile en polvo y el puré de tomate, revolviendo para cubrir el pollo con las especias.","Vierta las lentejas y los tomates enlatados, moje la lata de tomate con agua dos veces y agregue esto también. Sazone con sal al gusto y cocine a fuego lento.","Agregue el tamarindo al gusto, desmenuce las hojas de fenogreco y revuelva para combinar. Tape y cocine por 20 minutos más, revolviendo a la mitad.","Destape y cocine por unos minutos más hasta que el curry se haya reducido a la consistencia deseada; cuanto más se cocine, más espeso se volverá, ya que las lentejas se desintegrarán en la salsa. Exprime un chorrito de jugo de limón y espolvorea sobre cilantro fresco para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13757,7377,'es','pollo de manchuria','Disfrute de este popular plato de pollo frito Hakka (indochino) con un poco de picante y algo de dulzura.','["1 clara de huevo (guarda la yema para otra receta)","2 tsp soy sauce","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","350 g de muslos de pollo deshuesados, cortados en tiras","aceite neutro, para freír poco profundo","fideos de huevo cocidos, para servir (opcional)","6 cucharadas de harina de maíz","2 cucharadas de harina común","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 cucharada de aceite neutro","2 cucharaditas de jengibre rallado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados o machacados","3 cebolletas, picadas","2 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de salsa de chile dulce o de ajo (agregue ½ cucharadita de azúcar si su salsa de chile no es dulce)","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz"]','["Combine la clara de huevo con la salsa de soja y la harina de maíz en un tazón grande. Agregue el pollo y mezcle bien para cubrir.","Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la cobertura con ½ cucharadita de sal en un bol y reserve.","Hacer la salsa calentando el aceite en una sartén y sofreír el jengibre, el ajo y la mayoría de las cebolletas (guarda algunas para servir) a fuego medio durante 1 min. Agregue el ketchup, la salsa de soja y la salsa de chile más 3 cucharadas de agua y cocine por 1 min. Agrega la harina de maíz a 1 cucharada de agua fría para hacer una pasta y agrégala a la salsa. Baje el fuego a bajo y cocine durante aproximadamente un minuto; la salsa debe espesarse de inmediato. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Pon unas cucharadas de aceite en una sartén grande y poco profunda a fuego medio. Sumerja los trozos de pollo, sacudiendo el exceso de marinada, en el tazón de cobertura y revuelva para cubrir. Sacuda el exceso de harina y sumerja el pollo en el aceite caliente. Repita esto hasta que tenga una sola capa de pollo en la sartén. Fríe los trozos de pollo durante unos 4-5 minutos por cada lado, hasta que estén crujientes por ambos lados y ligeramente dorados; deben estar crujientes y bien cocidos. Sáquelos y colóquelos en un colador colocado sobre un tazón para recoger el exceso de grasa. Repita con el pollo restante.","Mientras tanto, recalienta la salsa a fuego lento. Agrega todo el pollo frito a la salsa y revuélvelo suavemente para cubrirlo. Espolvorea sobre las cebolletas restantes para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13758,7379,'es','bhaji de hongos','Ase el ajo a fuego lento en este plato con cardamomo para que quede ahumado y caramelizado, y disfrútelo con arroz o naan.','["1 cabeza de ajo grande","2 vainas de cardamomo negro","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","400 g de mezcla de hongos exóticos, los champiñones más grandes desmenuzados","1 cebolla pequeña, picada en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de jengibre finamente rallado o picado","1 chile verde, rebanado (opcional)","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1-2 cucharaditas de chile de Cachemira en polvo","½ limón, exprimido","30 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","arroz cocido o naan, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Cortar la cabeza de ajo por la mitad horizontalmente por el centro y colocar sobre una hoja de papel de aluminio. Coloque 1 vaina de cardamomo encima de cada mitad y rocíe con 3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva. Envuélvalo en papel de aluminio y hornee en el horno durante 35 a 40 minutos, o en una freidora durante 20 a 25 minutos, hasta que esté suave, confitado y comenzando a caramelizarse por encima.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto, agrega los champiñones y fríelos hasta que estén ligeramente dorados, esto tomará de 3 a 4 minutos. Retirar de la sartén y reservar.","Agrega la cebolla a la misma sartén con una cucharada más de aceite y una pizca de sal y cocina a fuego medio hasta que esté suave y apenas comience a dorarse, agrega las vainas de cardamomo (del ajo) y las semillas de comino, mezcla bien y agrega el jengibre y la guindilla verde, si la usas. Revuelva durante 30 segundos.","Exprime los dientes de ajo del bulbo en la sartén. Aplastarlos ligeramente con el dorso de una cuchara.","A continuación añade el puré de tomate, las especias molidas y sal al gusto y cocina unos minutos a fuego medio. Añade un chorrito de agua si es necesario para que no se pegue.","Finalmente, agregue el jugo de limón, el cilantro picado y los champiñones cocidos. Sirva inmediatamente con arroz o naan, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13759,7381,'es','Dhal de coliflor asada con naan casero sin gluten','Empaque cuatro de sus cinco al día con un plato de estas lentejas vegetales especiadas. Haga su propio naan sin gluten para prepararlo o úselo comprado en la tienda.','["1 cucharada de aceite de ajo","½ puerro (unos 100 g) de puerro, finamente picado","1 cucharada de pasta de jengibre","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile seco","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma","2 cucharaditas de curry en polvo","1 cucharadita de garam masala","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco.","500 ml de caldo de verduras sin gluten","200 g de lentejas rojas secas, crudas (asegúrese de que no contengan gluten si es necesario)","2 puñados de espinacas frescas (unos 120 g), lavadas","250 g de harina con levadura sin gluten","260 g de yogur griego (o cualquier yogur natural espeso)","1 coliflor, cortada en floretes","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cucharaditas de garam masala"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Para preparar el naan, pon la harina, el yogur griego (revuelve bien antes de usarlo) y una pizca de sal en un tazón grande para mezclar. Mezcle con una espátula y, cuando comience a unirse, use sus manos para formar una bola ligeramente pegajosa. Cubrir y reservar.","Para hacer la coliflor asada, coloque la coliflor en una bandeja para hornear grande, rocíe con aceite y luego espolvoree con garam masala y una pizca de sal y pimienta. Mezclar para que la coliflor quede bien cubierta y reservar.","Para hacer el dhal, coloque una sartén grande con tapa a fuego medio y agregue el aceite. Vierta el puerro y cocine por unos minutos para que se ablande. Agregue la pasta de jengibre, las hojuelas de chile, la cúrcuma, el curry en polvo y el garam masala y cocine por 1 min. Vierta los tomates picados, la leche de coco, el caldo y las lentejas, luego revuelva. Deje hervir a fuego lento y cocine durante 20 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente para que no se pegue.","Mientras tanto, mete la coliflor en el horno y ástala durante unos 25-30 minutos hasta que esté más suave y empiece a tomar color, dándole la vuelta a la mitad.","Para hacer el naan, amase brevemente la masa sobre una superficie bien enharinada hasta que esté suave, combinada y ya no pegajosa. Divide la masa en cuatro porciones iguales. Con un rodillo ligeramente enharinado, extienda una porción de masa hasta formar un óvalo de 3 mm de grosor. Calienta una sartén grande a fuego alto. Cuanto más alto sea el fuego, más burbujas formarán el naan. Una vez caliente, transfiera con cuidado el naan a la sartén seca usando una rodaja de pescado. Deje cocinar por un lado durante 2 minutos o hasta que esté bien dorado, luego voltee y cocine por 1 minuto. Después de darle la vuelta, presione firmemente el naan con una espátula; esto hará que se hinche un poco. Repita usando el resto de la masa.","Una vez que el dhal esté listo, las lentejas estarán tiernas. Revuelva las espinacas hasta que se ablanden y sazone al gusto. Cubra el dhal con coliflor asada y sírvalo con un naan a un lado. Para congelar, congele el dhal y el naan por separado. Vuelva a calentar el dhal en el microondas y el naan en el horno."]','2026-01-11 12:59:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13760,7383,'es','Dhal cremoso de coco y espinacas','"Esta comida es un abrazo completo en un tazón. Sustituir la quinua por la mitad del arroz no solo agrega beneficios adicionales a los cereales integrales, sino que también aumenta el contenido de fibra y proteínas de la comida. Alternativamente, el arroz integral integral sirve como una excelente alternativa. Un chorrito de jugo de limón es una excelente manera de incluir vitamina C, que ayuda a la absorción del hierro de las lentejas y las espinacas". - Dr. Chintal Patel','["300 g de lentejas rojas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","2 tomates grandes (alrededor de 225 g), picados en trozos grandes","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco.","100g de quinua","320 g de espinacas tiernas","100 g de arroz basmati","25 g de hojas de cilantro picadas para servir","½ pepino, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 tomates, finamente picados","½ cebolla morada, finamente picada","½ limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 chiles verdes, cortados por la mitad","6 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo (opcional)"]','["Enjuague y escurra bien las lentejas rojas al menos tres veces y remójelas en agua fría hasta que las necesite.","Calienta el aceite de oliva en una cacerola grande a fuego medio. Agrega la cebolla y fríe hasta que se ablande y empiece a dorarse, aproximadamente de 5 a 6 minutos. Agrega las semillas de comino y fríe durante 1 min.","Agrega una pizca de sal y la cúrcuma, revuelve bien y luego agrega los tomates. Escurrir las lentejas y añadirlas a la sartén junto con 350ml de agua y la leche de coco. Revuelva para combinar y deje hervir. Tapar y dejar cocer a fuego medio-bajo durante 15 minutos.","Enjuague y escurra la quinua y el arroz al menos tres veces para eliminar el exceso de almidón. Vierta en una cacerola grande con 1,5 litros de agua hirviendo con sal. Vuelva a hervir, cocine a fuego lento durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y luego escurra.","Mezcle todos los ingredientes del kachumber en un bol y sazone al gusto. Dejar de lado.","Retire el dhal del fuego, destape y agregue las espinacas, dejando que se ablanden. Sazone al gusto.","Para hacer el tadka, calienta el aceite en una cacerola a fuego medio-alto, agrega las guindillas y el ajo. Justo antes de que el ajo comience a dorarse, 1-2 minutos, agregue el chile en polvo, si lo usa. Remueve unos segundos y retira del fuego. Dejar de lado.","Sirva la quinua y el arroz en tazones cubiertos con dhal, tadka y cilantro picado, y el kachumber a un lado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13761,7385,'es','ruedas','Constituye un pilar de muchas comidas del norte de la India. Los rotis (o chapatis) vienen en todos los tamaños y grosores y se sirven calientes con mantequilla o ghee casero.','["250 g de harina de chapati (chapati atta) o 125 g de harina integral y 125 g de harina común, más algo extra para espolvorear y enrollar","1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol","2 cucharadas de mantequilla salada o ghee, para servir"]','["Mezcle la harina, el aceite y ½ cucharadita de sal marina fina en un bol. Añade poco a poco suficiente agua fría (unos 120 ml) para hacer una masa firme pero no seca.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie enharinada y amase bien durante unos 7 a 10 minutos, hasta que quede suave. Regrese la masa a un recipiente limpio y seco, cúbrala con un plato o paño volteado y déjela reposar durante 30 minutos.","Amasar con un poco más de chapati o harina común si la masa se ve pegajosa y luego dividirla en 12 bolas del mismo tamaño. Espolvorea cada uno con harina.","Calienta una plancha seca en la estufa a fuego medio. Pon 3 cucharadas de harina en un tazón pequeño. Con las palmas de las manos, aplana una de las bolas de masa hasta formar un disco circular y sumerge ambos lados en la harina. Ahora gírelo con un movimiento circular para formar un círculo de 12 a 14 cm de diámetro con el grosor de una moneda de £1. Puede resultar más fácil utilizar un rodillo de madera fino para esto, del tipo que se utiliza para extender la pasta.","Coloque la masa en la plancha caliente y cocine por 1 minuto, o hasta que comiencen a formarse pequeñas bolsas de aire en su superficie. Voltee el chapati con una espátula o unas pinzas y continúe cocinando durante unos 90 segundos más, hasta que el chapati adquiera motas de color.","Presione con cuidado el pan con un paño limpio mientras se cocina en la plancha; el chapati debe hincharse con el aire caliente. Sigue girando el pan mientras se cocina. Es mejor servir estos rotis de inmediato con una cucharada de mantequilla o ghee en el medio, pero también puedes envolverlos en papel de aluminio y llevar el paquete a la mesa."]','2026-01-11 12:59:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13762,7387,'es','Curry cremoso de tofu con roti casero','Prepare un curry de tofu engañosamente rico y abundante que sea completamente vegano. El roti tardará solo 10 minutos en prepararse mientras el curry hierve a fuego lento.','["400 g de tofu firme","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","4 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","5 cucharadas de pasta tikka o madrás","2 cebollas blancas, en rodajas finas","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","500 g de puré de tomate","200 g de crema de coco","15 g de cilantro, picado (opcional)","100 g de harina normal o integral, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal"]','["Calentar el horno a 230C/210C ventilador/gas 8. Escurrir el tofu sobre papel de cocina y cortarlo por la mitad horizontalmente, dándole palmaditas a medida que avanza para absorber la mayor cantidad de humedad posible. Corte el tofu en trozos, viértalo en un bol y revuélvalo para cubrirlo con la harina de maíz, 1 cucharada de aceite vegetal y ½ cucharadita de sal. Extender sobre una bandeja para hornear y hornear en el horno durante 25 minutos.","En el mismo bol, haz el roti. Mezclar la harina, una pizca de sal y el aceite junto con suficiente agua (unos 65 ml) para hacer una masa suave y no pegajosa. Amasar sobre una superficie enharinada durante 3 minutos, luego tapar y dejar reposar mientras se prepara la salsa.","Caliente las 3 cucharadas de aceite restantes en una sartén a fuego medio y cocine la pasta tikka hasta que esté fragante, aproximadamente 1 min. Agregue las cebollas y cocine durante 4-5 minutos, agregando un chorrito de agua si es necesario para evitar que se pegue, luego cubra y cocine hasta que estén completamente blandas (aproximadamente 8-10 minutos más), revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Añade el puré de tomate, la passata y una pizca de sal. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos más antes de agregar la crema de coco. Reduce el fuego a bajo mientras haces el roti. Afloje la salsa de vez en cuando con un chorrito de agua si empieza a verse demasiado espesa.","Divida la mezcla de roti en cuatro bolas iguales. Extienda las bolas sobre una superficie enharinada con un rodillo enharinado hasta que tengan un grosor de 2-3 mm. Calienta una sartén seca hasta que esté muy caliente, luego cocina cada roti durante 1 minuto por cada lado hasta que se queme en algunos lugares. Envuélvalos en un paño de cocina cuando se retiren del fuego para mantenerlos suaves.","Retire el tofu de la bandeja para hornear y revuélvalo con la salsa para cubrirlo antes de espolvorearlo con cilantro y servir con el roti."]','2026-01-11 12:59:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13763,7389,'es','vindaloo de pollo','Sube el fuego con esta receta para miembros de vindaloo de pollo casero elaborado con muchas especias aromáticas. Sirva con panes planos calientes para una cena sencilla y satisfactoria.','["4 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 rama de canela ligeramente machacada o triturada","2 cucharaditas de hojuelas de chile","pizca de pimienta de cayena","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 lata de tomates picados (400g)","hojas de cilantro, cebollas crujientes, chile fresco y panes planos o arroz calientes, para servir (opcional)","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en cubitos","1 cucharadita de ajo machacado o rallado, aproximadamente 2-3 dientes de ajo grandes","2 cucharaditas de jengibre finamente rallado","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","pimienta de cayena","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra"]','["Para preparar el pollo, mezcle el jugo de limón, el pollo cortado en cubitos, el ajo y el jengibre en un tazón grande con las especias secas y 2 cucharaditas de sal. Tapar y dejar marinar en el frigorífico durante al menos 3-4 horas, o toda la noche.","Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio-alto. Añade una cucharadita de cúrcuma para darle un toque de color y sabor, seguido de puré de tomate para realzar la riqueza del plato. Espolvorea hojuelas de chile al gusto para darle un toque picante. Retirar de la sartén y reservar en un plato, en este punto no estará bien cocido. Agrega el aceite restante y la cebolla picada, cocina durante 10-15 minutos a fuego medio hasta que esté suave y traslúcida. Agregue las especias restantes y cocine por 2 minutos. Agregue los tomates picados y 200 ml de agua, devuelva el pollo a la sartén, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Revisa el condimento.","Adorne con un poco de cilantro, chile fresco y cebollas crujientes y sirva con panes planos o arroz, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13764,7391,'es','pepinillo de lima','Combine este pepinillo de lima agrio, picante y refrescante con una comida sencilla de dhal y arroz hervido. La receta sale en un tarro de 500g y dura tres meses.','["500 g de limas (unas 7)","8 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de chile de Cachemira en polvo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","30 g de sal marina fina","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","½ cucharadita de semillas de fenogreco","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 anís estrellado","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","125 ml de aceite vegetal, más 30-50 ml extra, si es necesario","30 g de raíz de jengibre, pelado y finamente picado","3 chiles verdes, sin semillas y picados","50 ml de vinagre de vino blanco","70 g de azúcar granulada"]','["Pon las limas en una cacerola y cúbrelas con agua. Coloque un plato pequeño resistente al calor encima de las frutas para mantenerlas sumergidas y luego déjelas hervir a fuego medio y cocine a fuego lento durante 20-30 minutos hasta que las limas estén tiernas. Saque las limas, séquelas con papel de cocina y deseche el agua de cocción.","Una vez que las limas estén lo suficientemente frías para manipularlas, córtelas (incluidas la cáscara y la médula) en trozos de 3 cm y vierta todo, incluido el jugo, en un tazón para mezclar. Agrega el ajo picado, la guindilla en polvo, la cúrcuma y la sal y déjalo reposar durante 1 hora.","Calienta una sartén resistente y seca a fuego medio-bajo y agrega las semillas de mostaza, el fenogreco, el comino y el anís estrellado. Revuelve y tuesta las especias durante unos 40 segundos hasta que estén aromáticas. Viértalos en mortero, agregue 1 cucharadita de azúcar y tritúrelos hasta obtener un polvo con un mortero; también puede usar un molinillo de especias eléctrico para esto.","Agregue esta mezcla de especias molidas a las limas, revuelva bien, vierta todo en un frasco esterilizado y luego ciérrelo. Deje el pepinillo en un lugar cálido o en el alféizar de una ventana soleada durante 2 o 3 días para que maduren los sabores. Revuelve las limas una vez al día con una cuchara de metal para asegurarte de que queden cubiertas uniformemente con la mezcla de especias.","Calienta el aceite en awokor karahi a fuego medio-alto y fríe el jengibre y los chiles verdes durante 2-3 minutos, hasta que el jengibre comience a dorarse. Agregue el vinagre y el azúcar y cocine a fuego medio-bajo hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, luego hierva durante 2 minutos.","Apague el fuego y agregue las limas remojadas y el masala. Deje enfriar por un lado y luego vuelva a colocar el pepinillo en el mismo frasco. Con una cuchara de metal, empuja las limas dentro del frasco para que queden cubiertas por el aceite picante; es posible que necesites agregar un poco más de aceite. Selle el frasco y deje el pepinillo durante 3-4 días antes de probarlo. Se conservará durante 3 meses a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13765,3754,'es','Khichdi','Disfruta de este clásico dhal indio. Conocida por sus propiedades ayurvédicas, nuestra versión es fácil de preparar y llena de sabor.','["1½ cucharada de semillas de comino","250 g de moong dhal","250 g de arroz de grano medio o corto (el basmati también está bien)","1½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 tomate mediano, cortado en cubos de 1 cm","150 g de guisantes congelados","½ cucharadita de asafétida","1 cucharadita de azúcar","2½ cucharadas de ghee","1 hoja de laurel","1 chile rojo seco","3 vainas de cardamomo, sin semillas y trituradas, sin cáscara","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado"]','["Tuesta 1 cucharada de semillas de comino en una sartén pequeña a fuego medio hasta que suelten los aromas. Deje enfriar y luego colóquelo en un molinillo de café o especias y muela hasta obtener un polvo fino. Esto producirá aproximadamente 4 cucharaditas de comino molido, de las cuales ½ cucharadita se usará al final del plato. El resto se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por una semana para usarlo en otro plato.","Tostar en seco el moong dhal en una sartén a fuego medio durante unos 5 minutos. Sigue revolviendo la sartén para que el dhal no se queme. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Lave suavemente el arroz con agua fría dos o tres veces para quitar el almidón. Agregue el moong dhal asado en seco al arroz y lave nuevamente. Coloque ambos en una fuente grande para horno y llénelo con suficiente agua para que quede 1½ pulgadas por encima de la mezcla de arroz. Llevar a ebullición a fuego medio. Retire con una cuchara la espuma que se forme encima del agua y deséchela.","Agregue la cúrcuma molida y el tomate, vuelva a hervir a fuego lento y luego vierta 500 ml de agua. Vuelva a hervir a fuego lento, reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos más con la tapa puesta. Verifique que el dhal y el arroz estén cocidos; deberían haberse fusionado para formar una consistencia similar a la de una papilla. Agregue más agua si es necesario y cocine a fuego lento por más tiempo. Una vez cocido mantener a fuego lento y añadir los guisantes congelados, la asafétida, 1 cucharadita de sal y el azúcar. Revuelva bien y mantenga a fuego lento.","Mientras tanto, ponemos una sartén pequeña a fuego medio. Agregue 2 cucharadas de ghee, las semillas de comino restantes, la hoja de laurel, el chile seco y las semillas de cardamomo trituradas, y deje que se liberen los aromas, teniendo cuidado de no quemar las especias, alrededor de 2-3 minutos. Agrega el jengibre y cocina por 2 minutos a fuego medio, revolviendo constantemente para que no se pegue al fondo de la sartén. Agrega la mezcla de jengibre y comino al khichdi y cocina a fuego lento durante los últimos 2 minutos antes de retirar del fuego. Deje caer la última ½ cucharada de ghee por encima y espolvoree con ½ cucharadita de semillas de comino tostadas y molidas (también conocidas como bhaja moshla). Cierra la tapa hasta que esté listo para servir. Justo antes de servir, revuelve bien una vez más y el khichdi estará listo para servirse caliente. Sirva con poppadoms y chutney de mango, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13766,7393,'es','Empanadas de pollo tikka','Prepara estas deliciosas empanadillas para un picnic. Son fáciles de empacar y llevar consigo, y están inspirados en los sabores de una rebanada de pollo tikka.','["½ cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados o triturados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos pequeños","5 cucharadas de pasta de curry tikka","Lata de 227 g de tomates picados","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moreno suave","100ml de nata doble","350 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","175 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en cubos","1 cucharadita de semillas de alcaravea (opcional)","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino (opcional)","1 yema de huevo (congela la clara para otra receta), más 1 huevo batido"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla hasta que esté blanda, unos 6-8 minutos. Agregue el ajo y el jengibre y cocine por 1 minuto más antes de agregar los trozos de pollo. Cocine durante 8-10 minutos hasta que el pollo esté dorado por completo. Agregue la pasta de curry, revuelva y luego mezcle los tomates picados y el azúcar moreno. Cocine durante 10-12 minutos hasta que el líquido se reduzca y tenga un curry bastante seco. Agregue la crema doble y cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que se reduzca ligeramente; desea una salsa espesa para que no se salga de la masa terminada. Dejar enfriar.","Para hacer la masa, vierta la harina en un procesador de alimentos junto con la mantequilla, la alcaravea y las semillas de comino, si las usa, y presione hasta obtener migajas finas. (También puedes hacer esto en un tazón frotando todo con las yemas de los dedos). Agrega la yema de huevo y un chorrito de agua fría, si es necesario, para formar una masa. Envuelva y mantenga frío durante 20 minutos mientras se enfría el relleno.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas. 6. Extienda la masa fría sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta que tenga aproximadamente ½ cm de espesor. Sellar los discos con un cortapastas de 10-12 cm, o utilizar un plato pequeño como plantilla y cortar con un cuchillo. (Deberías obtener unas ocho en total). Pon un par de cucharadas del relleno sobre cada círculo de masa, justo descentrado, luego unta el relleno con huevo batido y dobla la masa para que los bordes se junten. Engarce los bordes o séllelos con un tenedor. Colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear, corte algunos cortes pequeños en la parte superior de cada masa, unte con un pincel el huevo batido restante y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que estén crujientes y doradas. Deje enfriar un poco y luego sirva. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13767,7395,'es','Pulao de paneer y garbanzos','Haga que el pulao, un plato de arroz sencillo y rápido, sea muy especial añadiendo paneer y garbanzos.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza","8 hojas de curry (opcional)","2 chiles verdes, finamente picados","2 cebollas medianas, en rodajas finas","5 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 tomates, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo (asegúrese de que no contenga gluten, si es necesario)","1 cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharadita de comino molido","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","225 g de paneer, cortado en rectángulos pequeños","300 g de arroz basmati","10 g de hojas de cilantro finamente picadas","yogur (para servir)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén que tenga tapa. Agrega el comino y las semillas de mostaza y déjalos chisporrotear hasta que estén fragantes. Luego agregue las hojas de curry, los chiles y la cebolla y cocine a fuego medio durante 5-8 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo y cocine por un minuto más antes de agregar los tomates. Cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que los tomates comiencen a ablandarse.","Agrega las especias y 1½ cucharadita de sal y cocina por 1 min. Agrega los garbanzos y el paneer, seguido del arroz, luego vierte 700 ml de agua hirviendo del hervidor. Lleva la mezcla a ebullición, cubriendo la cacerola con la tapa.","Cocine a fuego lento durante 12 minutos y luego, antes de quitar la tapa, déjelo reposar durante 10 minutos. Sirva con una pizca de cilantro y una cucharada de yogur."]','2026-01-11 12:59:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13768,7399,'es','Kitchari','Prepare un lote de kitchari, un plato relajante parecido a un dhal vinculado a las limpiezas ayurvédicas (un antiguo sistema de medicina alternativa de la India) para una cena saludable.','["1 cucharada de ghee","1 coliflor pequeña, con tallos y floretes finamente picados","2 zanahorias, finamente picadas","15 g de jengibre pelado y rallado","1 cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","½ cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","150 g de moong dal, enjuagado y escurrido (disponible en tiendas especializadas y grandes superficies)","100 g de arroz basmati, enjuagado y escurrido","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 lima, cortada en gajos"]','["Derrita el ghee en una cacerola o cacerola grande resistente al fuego a fuego medio. Agrega toda la coliflor y las zanahorias y sazona ligeramente. Freír a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que las verduras se ablanden y cojan un poco de color.","Agregue todas las especias y fría durante 2 minutos más hasta que estén fragantes. Vierta el moong dal y el arroz y revuelva para cubrir con las especias. Sazone con sal y vierta 1,25 litros de agua. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 45 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que los frijoles y el arroz estén completamente tiernos y se hayan desmenuzado. La textura debe ser parecida a la de una papilla. Sazone al gusto y espolvoree sobre el cilantro. Sirva con las rodajas de lima a un lado para exprimirlas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13769,7401,'es','Paneer crujiente, espinacas y curry de coco','Prepare este curry vegetariano fácil para una comida rápida entre semana. Puedes agregar más o menos chiles dependiendo de qué tan picante te guste tu comida.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","200 g de paneer, en cubos","1 cebolla, picada","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 chiles frescos, sin semillas si prefieres menos picante","1 pimiento rojo, rebanado","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry","400 ml de leche de coco","80 g de brócoli de tallo largo, al vapor o en el microondas hasta que esté tierno","100 g de espinacas tiernas","naan, arroz, poppadoms y rodajas de lima, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio. Freír los cubos de paneer durante 2 minutos por cada lado, volteándolos con unas pinzas, hasta que estén dorados. Retirar de la sartén y reservar en un plato forrado con papel de cocina para que escurra.","Vierte la cebolla en el aceite sobrante de la sartén y fríe durante 5 minutos a fuego medio hasta que se ablande. Agrega el ajo y los chiles, sofríe durante 2 minutos, luego agrega el pimiento en rodajas y fríe durante 3 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Haga un hueco en el medio de la mezcla de cebolla y pimiento y agregue la pasta de curry, revolviendo durante 2 minutos para que se caliente antes de verter la leche de coco y mezclar para combinar. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 a 10 minutos o hasta que espese, luego agregue el paneer frito, el brócoli y las espinacas. Revuelva bien y cocine a fuego lento hasta que las espinacas se ablanden.","Sirva con su elección de naans, arroz o poppadoms y rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13770,7403,'es','chaat samosa','Pruebe esta fantástica forma de servir samosas para una comida más sustanciosa. Es un buen entrante para una cena y para celebrar festivales como el holi.','["1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente cortada","1 limón grande, exprimido","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal, de girasol o de colza","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino, más una pizca para probar el aceite","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","¾ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 ½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 bolsita de té","4 samosas vegetarianas (usar las compradas en la tienda o ver más abajo)","200-300 ml de yogur griego batido","3-4 cebolletas, finamente picadas","un puñado de sev fino o mezcla de Bombay (opcional)"]','["Coloque la cebolla morada en rodajas en un recipiente resistente al calor lleno de agua recién hervida. Dejar reposar 10 minutos, escurrir y luego mezclar con el jugo de limón y una pizca de sal. Dejar de lado. Las cebollas adquirirán un maravilloso color magenta.","Para hacer los garbanzos condimentados, calienta el aceite en una cacerola a fuego medio. Para probar que está listo, agregue algunas semillas de comino; si comienzan a chisporrotear, agregue el resto, seguido de los garbanzos escurridos. Esparza 1 cucharadita de sal y la cúrcuma, el chile en polvo, el comino molido y 60 ml de agua. Rompe el contenido de la bolsita de té y revuelve todo. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 15 minutos, o hasta que todos los sabores se hayan infundido. Triture suavemente algunos de los garbanzos en la sartén para hacer una salsa; es posible que necesite agregar un poco más de agua.","Coloque los garbanzos condimentados en una fuente para servir. Corta las samosas en trozos y colócalas encima. Rocíe sobre el yogur y luego cubra con las cebollas encurtidas en rodajas. Espolvoree sobre las cebolletas picadas y sev o mezcla Bombay."]','2026-01-11 12:59:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13771,7405,'es','Dhal paneer especiado','Omite el chile si prefieres menos picante o si estás preparando este paneer dhal especiado para niños. Así es una comida entre semana equilibrada y sabrosa para la familia.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","150 g de paneer, cortado en cubos de 1 cm","5 vainas de cardamomo, machacadas","1 rama de canela","1 cebolla grande, finamente cortada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","15 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado","1 chile verde, finamente picado y sin semillas (opcional)","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","300 g de lentejas rojas enjuagadas","850 ml de caldo de verduras","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas","naan o chapati y yogur de coco, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola a fuego medio. Freír el paneer hasta que esté dorado, unos 5-7 minutos. Transfiera a un tazón y reserve. Pon el cardamomo y la canela en la sartén y fríelos durante 1-2 minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Agrega la cebolla, el ajo, el jengibre, la guindilla y la cúrcuma. Cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden antes de agregar las lentejas y el caldo. Sazone y cocine a fuego lento, luego cocine a fuego medio durante 15-20 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas y espesas.","Sazone el dhal y vierta el paneer. Sirva con cilantro espolvoreado y chapati o naan y yogur de coco, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13772,7407,'es','Dhal huevos escalfados con raita de hierbas','Pruebe esta nueva versión del dhal con huevos escalfados para disfrutar de una comida saludable y rica en nutrientes. Servido con una raita de hierbas, ofrece cuatro de tus 5 al día.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas (320 g), partidas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino y cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza","2 cucharadas de garam masala","4 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","175 g de lentejas rojas","400g lata de garbanzos","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo, mezclado con 700 ml de agua hirviendo","320 g de espinacas tiernas","8 huevos grandes","150g yogur natural bio","1 diente de ajo","rodaja fina de jengibre pelado","20 g de hojas de cilantro, más algunas hojas extra para servir (opcional)","10 g de hojas de menta"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas durante 5 minutos hasta que empiecen a tomar color. Agregue las especias, el ajo y la guindilla y cocine por unos segundos más hasta que estén aromáticos.","Agrega las lentejas, los garbanzos y el caldo, luego cocina, sin tapar, durante 15 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas. Agregue las espinacas hasta que se ablanden.","Retire la mitad del dhal de la sartén y déjelo enfriar. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. Rompe 4 huevos, espaciados entre sí, en las lentejas que quedan en la sartén, tapa y cocina a fuego medio durante 8-10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, ponga todos los ingredientes para la raita en un bol y mezcle con una batidora de mano.","Sirva los huevos y el dhal con la mitad de la raita y esparza algunas hojas de cilantro adicionales, si lo desea. La raita restante se mantendrá fría hasta por tres días. Vuelva a calentar el dhal restante en una sartén a fuego medio hasta que burbujee. Agregue una gota de agua si parece seco, luego cocine los huevos en el dhal caliente como se describe en el paso 3 y sirva con la raita restante."]','2026-01-11 12:59:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13773,7409,'es','Dhal de garbanzos y coco fácil y rápido','Pruebe esta versión rápida y sencilla de dhal. Está repleto de ingredientes saludables, como garbanzos, lentejas y espinacas.','["aceite, para cocinar","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","pequeño trozo de jengibre, pelado y finamente picado","5 cebolletas, finamente picadas","10 tomates cherry, 5 picados","½ manojo de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas y los tallos finamente picados","lata de 400g de leche de coco","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos y enjuagados","Lata de 400 g de lentejas cocidas, escurridas y enjuagadas","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 lima, exprimida","puñado de espinacas","pittas integrales, para servir"]','["Calienta un chorrito de aceite en una olla o sartén antiadherente grande a fuego alto. Agrega el ajo y el jengibre, reduce el fuego a medio y cocina durante 3-5 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Agregue las cebolletas, todos los tomates cherry, las hojas y los tallos de cilantro y 1 cucharadita de sal. Cocine por 3 minutos más.","Agrega la leche de coco, los garbanzos y las lentejas y revuelve bien, luego agrega el curry en polvo, la cúrcuma, el comino, ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra y el jugo de lima. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir a fuego lento y cocinar durante 5 minutos. Añade las espinacas y deja que se ablanden durante unos minutos. Verifique la sazón y luego sirva con pitas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13774,7411,'es','Curry picante de pollo y garbanzos','Pruebe nuestro curry de pollo y garbanzos para disfrutar de un plato con un sabor intenso pero que no requiere mucho esfuerzo para prepararlo. Es genial congelarse para los días ocupados.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 cebollas, en rodajas finas","6 dientes de ajo","2 chiles verdes, finamente picados","3 cucharadas de puré de tomate","8 muslos de pollo sin piel y con hueso","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 cucharadita de garam masala","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","un puñado de hojas de cilantro","arroz cocido o naans, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola y agrega las cebollas. Cocine a fuego medio durante 10 minutos hasta que estén dorados, luego agregue el ajo y los chiles y cocine por 1 minuto hasta que estén fragantes. Agrega el puré de tomate y cocina por 1 min. Mueva la mezcla a un lado de la sartén, luego agregue los muslos de pollo. Extienda la mezcla de tomate sobre el pollo y cocine a fuego alto durante 5 minutos.","Añade las especias, 1 cucharadita de sal y 150 ml de agua recién hervida y mezcla bien. Tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 45 minutos hasta que el pollo esté cocido. Agregue los garbanzos y cocine por los últimos 5 minutos. Para congelar porciones, divídalas en recipientes congelables y déjelas enfriar primero. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por tres meses. Descongele durante la noche en el refrigerador, luego vuelva a calentar en una cacerola hasta que esté bien caliente. Esparza el cilantro y sirva con arroz o naans calientes, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13775,7413,'es','paneer de chile','Disfrute de este sabroso paneer con chile con arroz y sus acompañamientos vegetarianos favoritos para una cena deliciosa y ligeramente especiada para dos.','["4 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","2 cucharadas de harina común","½ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","226 g de paneer, cortado en cubos de 1 cm","1 cebolla tierna, cortada finamente","arroz cocido, para servir","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","1 cucharada de salsa de soja oscura","1½-2 cucharadas de salsa de chile picante, al gusto","1½ cucharada de salsa de tomate","1 cucharadita de vinagre de arroz","1 cucharadita de miel","25 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado fino","4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile verde, finamente picado (sin semillas si lo desea)","½ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","1 cebolla morada, picada en trozos grandes","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta el aceite vegetal en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio. Combine la harina de maíz, la harina común, el chile en polvo, 1 cucharadita de sal marina fina, ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra recién molida y 2 cucharadas de agua en un tazón hasta obtener una pasta suave, agregando un chorrito más de agua si está demasiado espesa. Agregue los cubos de paneer y revuelva para cubrir. Vierta con cuidado el paneer recubierto en el aceite caliente de la sartén y fríalo, revolviendo, hasta que esté crujiente y dorado por todos lados. Transfiera a un plato forrado con papel de cocina y reserve.","Para hacer la salsa, vierte la maicena en una jarra y bate poco a poco la salsa de soja hasta que quede suave. Añade la salsa de chile, el ketchup, el vinagre de arroz, la miel y 90 ml de agua, vuelve a batir y reserva. Escurre la mayor parte del exceso de aceite de la sartén y vuelve a poner a fuego medio. Freír el jengibre, el ajo y la guindilla picada durante unos minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Agregue el chile en polvo, la cebolla y el pimiento, suba el fuego a medio-alto y fría hasta que estén ligeramente dorados. Vierta la burbuja de la mezcla de salsa de soja hasta que espese un poco.","Retire del fuego y agregue el paneer, asegurándose de que esté bien cubierto con la salsa. Añade un chorrito más de agua si es necesario y sazona al gusto. Espolvoree sobre la cebolleta y sirva con arroz, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13776,6413,'es','Saag de pollo','Crea una versión baja en grasa de pollo saag. Este plato no solo está lleno de sabor, sino que se presenta en tres de sus 5 al día y también se puede congelar para los días ajetreados.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla (200 g), finamente picada","10 g de jengibre, pelado y finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente picados","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","2 filetes de pechuga de pollo sin piel (300 g), sin grasa y cortados en trozos","2 tomates, picados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","160 g de espinacas tiernas picadas","3 cucharadas de yogur bio","120 g de arroz basmati integral","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","3 vainas de cardamomo, trituradas y sin semillas"]','["Pon en una cacerola el arroz, la cúrcuma y las semillas de cardamomo con una pizca de sal y agua suficiente para cubrir generosamente el arroz. Coloque la tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos. Apagar el fuego y reservar.","Mientras tanto, caliente el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-bajo y agregue la cebolla, el jengibre y el ajo. Tape y cocine por 5 minutos hasta que comience a dorarse. Revuelva bien, luego agregue las especias y continúe cocinando brevemente hasta que esté tostado y fragante.","Vierta el pollo y saltee durante unos minutos. Agrega los tomates picados, el puré de tomate y las espinacas. Cocine, revolviendo durante 5 minutos hasta que las espinacas se ablanden. En esta etapa, puede retirar el curry del fuego, enfriar completamente y congelar por hasta tres meses. Descongela completamente antes de recalentar. Agrega el yogur y luego caliéntalo durante 1 min. Escurre el arroz, si es necesario, y sírvelo con el pollo."]','2026-01-11 12:59:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13777,7415,'es','Paneer makhani','¿Organizar una cena? Ninguna comida o celebración de temática india está completa sin paneer, y esta delicia con queso es solo el boleto.','["2 cucharaditas de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","4 tomates picados, o utilizar una lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate","6-7 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","4-5 vainas de cardamomo, toscamente machacadas","1 rama pequeña de canela","1 hoja de laurel","4 anacardos, finamente picados y remojados en agua hasta que estén blandos","Trozo de 1 cm de jengibre, pelado y rallado fino","1 cucharadita de chile rojo en polvo, como Kashmiri Mirch","1 chile, cortado por la mitad a lo largo (opcional)","250 g de paneer, cortado en cubos medianos","1 cucharada de hojas de fenogreco","1 cucharadita de garam masala","80 ml de nata líquida para servir (opcional)"]','["Derrita 1 cucharadita de mantequilla y 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio-bajo hasta que chisporrotee (observe con atención para que la mantequilla no se queme). Añade los tomates, el puré de tomate, el ajo, las vainas de cardamomo, la rama de canela y el laurel. Cubra con una tapa y cocine durante 10 minutos a fuego medio, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Después de 10 minutos, retirar del fuego, dejar enfriar y luego retirar el laurel, la rama de canela y las vainas de cardamomo.","Una vez enfriado, vierta la mezcla y los anacardos en la mezcla y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave. Dejar de lado.","Regresa la sartén a fuego medio, agrega el resto de la mantequilla y el aceite y cocina el jengibre por un minuto. Reduzca el fuego a bajo, agregue el chile en polvo y revuelva durante 2 minutos. Vierta la pasta de tomate y anacardos y cocine por 5 minutos más.","Agrega el chile en rodajas, si lo usas, 1½ cucharadita de azúcar y el paneer. Mezclar bien y cocinar unos minutos más. Agrega las hojas de fenogreco y el garam masala. Mezclar bien. Agregue hasta 100 ml de agua para aflojar, luego retire del fuego, agregue la crema, si la usa, y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:59:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13778,7417,'es','Curry de champiñones sencillo','Sirva estos champiñones al ajillo en un rico masala de tomate condimentado con jengibre molido, semillas de hinojo y comino para una cena otoñal. Disfrútalo con arroz o naan.','["50 g de mantequilla sin sal","500 g de champiñones castaños cortados en cuartos","4-6 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","½ cucharadita de garam masala","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de yogur griego espeso y entero","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado","arroz cocido o naan, para servir"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en un wok grande, karahi o sartén antiadherente a fuego medio-alto y cocine los champiñones durante 10 minutos, o hasta que la humedad se haya evaporado y comiencen a dorarse. Transfiera a un tazón y reserve.","Calienta el aceite en la misma sartén a fuego medio-alto y fríe el comino y las semillas de hinojo, revolviendo continuamente durante unos 30 segundos hasta que suelten un aroma a nuez. Agregue la cebolla y cocine durante 12-15 minutos hasta que esté dorada. Reduce el fuego a medio, luego agrega el ajo y continúa friendo por 1 min. Agrega el jengibre, la cúrcuma, el chile en polvo y el garam masala, seguido de los tomates y el azúcar. Cocine, sin tapar, durante 5 a 7 minutos, o hasta que el masala espese y se forme una capa de aceite alrededor del borde de la sartén.","Vierta el yogur en un tazón pequeño, agregue un cucharón pequeño de masala caliente y mezcle bien antes de agregar el yogur a la cacerola de masala. Vierta 100 ml de agua caliente y cocine a fuego lento durante 3-4 minutos hasta que el curry tenga la consistencia de una crema doble. Sazone al gusto, luego devuelva los champiñones a la sartén y revuelva para que se calienten. Espolvoree con cilantro picado y sirva con arroz hervido o naan, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13779,7421,'es','Pollo a la mantequilla clásico','Cambie su comida para llevar habitual por pollo con mantequilla casero. El plato se elabora en dos partes y combina pollo tandoori con una rica salsa mantecosa.','["3 cucharadas de jugo de limón","2-3 cucharadas de chile de Cachemira en polvo o pimentón","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel u 8 filetes de muslo, picados en cubos de 5 cm","3 cucharadas de mantequilla derretida o ghee, para rociar las brochetas","200 ml de yogur natural","1 cucharada de ajo machacado","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente rallado","2 cucharadas de cilantro molido","2 cucharadas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de amchoor en polvo (polvo de mango seco)","1 cucharada de hojas secas de fenogreco, trituradas","1 cucharada de hojas de menta secas","½ cucharadita de sal negra (opcional, ver más abajo)","½ cucharadita de sal común (use 1 cucharadita si no tiene sal negra)","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","4-8 chiles verdes picantes, en rodajas","90 g de mantequilla o ghee","2 cebollas medianas, finamente picadas","4 vainas de cardamomo verde, partidas","½ cucharada de ajo machacado","½ cucharada de jengibre rallado","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","2 cucharaditas de hojas secas de fenogreco, trituradas","500 ml de passata, diluidos con 150 ml de agua","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","100ml de nata líquida","una pizca grande de hojas de cilantro, para decorar"]','["Frote el jugo de limón y el chile en polvo o pimentón en el pollo con una pizca de sal, luego enfríe durante 1 hora. Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la marinada en un tazón, pruebe el condimento y luego agregue el pollo frío. Mezclar bien y enfriar por otras 2 horas.","Ensarte los trozos de pollo marinado en brochetas de metal y reserve los restos de la marinada. Ase sobre una barbacoa caliente durante 5 minutos, volteándolos de vez en cuando y rociándolos con mantequilla derretida o ghee. Alternativamente, cocine bajo una parrilla caliente durante 8 a 10 minutos, volteando ocasionalmente. No te preocupes si el pollo queda un poco poco cocido, ya que terminará de cocinarse en la salsa. Retire las brochetas a una tabla.","Para hacer la salsa, caliente 2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal en una sartén grande awokor y agregue algunas semillas de comino. Cuando empiecen a chisporrotear, vierta el resto de las semillas. Mueve la sartén, reduce el fuego y agrega los chiles verdes. Revuelva una o dos veces hasta que la piel de los chiles se forme ampollas, luego agregue la mantequilla o el ghee. Suba el fuego a alto y continúe cocinando hasta que toda la mantequilla o ghee se haya derretido. Vierta las cebollas y fríalas durante 10 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente doradas y suaves. Si prefiere una salsa suave, vierta la mezcla en una licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Alternativamente, viértalo en un tazón y reserve.","Limpia la sartén con papel de cocina y calienta el aceite restante. Agregue las vainas de cardamomo trituradas. Cuando se hayan hinchado y hayan adquirido un color más claro, reducir el fuego, añadir el ajo y el jengibre y sofreír durante 30 segundos, revolviendo continuamente hasta que ya no se perciba el olor a ajo y jengibre crudos. Regrese la mezcla de cebolla cocida a la sartén y mezcle bien. Agrega la cúrcuma y la mitad de las hojas de fenogreco. Sazone con sal. Pruebe y ajuste el condimento si es necesario; si lo desea, puede agregar un poco de chile en polvo. Vierta la passata diluida, mezcle bien y lleve a ebullición. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine, tapado y revolviendo ocasionalmente, durante unos 20 minutos. El aceite eventualmente subirá a la superficie cuando la salsa esté cocida.","Retire los trozos de pollo de las brochetas y córtelos en trozos pequeños. Agréguelos a la salsa junto con el jugo restante. Vierta unos 125 ml de agua tibia en el recipiente con la marinada reservada, revuelva para aflojar y luego agregue la salsa. Lleva la salsa a ebullición y reduce el fuego a fuego lento. Espolvoree con garam masala y continúe cocinando durante 3-4 minutos, o hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Si lo desea, agregue un chorrito de agua hirviendo para soltar la salsa y luego pruebe para sazonar. Vierta la mitad de la nata y mezcle bien.","Transfiera el pollo con mantequilla a un tazón para servir, rocíe con la crema restante, espolvoree con las hojas de fenogreco restantes y decore con las hojas de cilantro fresco."]','2026-01-11 12:59:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13780,7423,'es','Curry kofta de cordero fragante','Prepare nuestro curry de albóndigas de cordero en una sartén, que utiliza nuestra propia mezcla de especias especialmente creada. Es ideal para un capricho del viernes por la noche para compartir en familia.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","500 g de carne picada de cordero","1 chile verde o rojo, en rodajas, para servir (opcional)","arroz basmati, para servir","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","1½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de chile rojo en polvo","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","1 chile verde, finamente picado (opcional)","manojo pequeño de cilantro, hojas y tallos separados, tallos finamente picados, hojas reservadas","Lata de 400g de tomates finamente picados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","300 ml de caldo de cordero","Lata de 200ml de crema de coco"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla durante 8 minutos hasta que esté suave pero no dorada. Retirar a un bol y dejar enfriar. Vierta la carne picada de cordero y la mitad de la mezcla de especias en un tazón mediano con 1/2 cucharadita de sal y pimienta negra y las cebollas enfriadas. Amase con las manos para combinar uniformemente y luego forme 16 albóndigas iguales. Regrese la sartén a fuego medio y dore las albóndigas por todas partes. Retirar a un plato con una espumadera.","Para hacer la salsa, sofreír la cebolla en la sartén durante 5 minutos hasta que comience a ablandarse, luego agregar el jengibre, el ajo, el chile picado (si se usa) y los tallos de cilantro, y cocinar por 3 minutos más. Esparza la mezcla de especias restante y cocine durante 1 minuto, luego agregue los tomates, el puré de tomate, el caldo y tres cuartas partes de la crema de coco. Revuelva para combinar, lleve a fuego lento y cocine durante 15 minutos hasta que la salsa se haya reducido a una cuarta parte.","Regrese las albóndigas a la sartén y cocine por 15 minutos más, rociando las albóndigas con la salsa cada pocos minutos hasta que la salsa se haya reducido en un cuarto más y las albóndigas estén bien cocidas. Rocíe sobre el resto de la crema de coco, luego esparza sobre las hojas de cilantro y el chile en rodajas y sirva con arroz basmati cocido."]','2026-01-11 12:59:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13781,6849,'es','Chana daal halva con azafrán, clavo y cardamomo','Haga halva usando chana daal (garbanzos tiernos partidos). Con una infusión de sabores de azafrán, clavo y cardamomo y salpicada de nueces, es un dulce delicioso.','["400 g de chana daal, remojado durante la noche","750ml de leche entera (o utilizar leche de soja o de almendras)","2 cucharadas de ghee o 1 cucharada de mantequilla sin sal y 1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","6 vainas de cardamomo verde, ligeramente trituradas","6 dientes","340 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","una pizca pequeña de azafrán","2 cucharadas de pistachos picados","2 cucharadas de almendras picadas"]','["Coloque el chana daal en un tazón grande, viértalo con agua hasta cubrirlo y déjelo toda la noche. Escurrir y luego verter en una cacerola grande. Vierta sobre la leche y lleve a ebullición, luego reduzca el fuego a medio y cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo con frecuencia, durante 25-30 minutos, hasta que la leche se absorba por completo.","Dejar enfriar durante 20-30 minutos, hasta que alcance la temperatura ambiente. Vierta en el tazón de un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que se convierta en una pasta suave; es posible que deba aflojarla con un chorrito de agua si está demasiado espesa.","Calienta el ghee (o aceite y mantequilla) en una cacerola a fuego medio-bajo. Cuando esté caliente, añade el cardamomo y el clavo y sofríe unos segundos hasta que estén fragantes.","Agregue la pasta de lentejas licuada y cocine durante 15 minutos, revolviendo constantemente, hasta que comience a oler a nuez y adquiera un color marrón claro. Retire la sartén del fuego.","En otra cacerola (o puedes lavar la cacerola usada para la leche), calienta el azúcar y 100 ml de agua a fuego medio durante 10-12 minutos hasta que el azúcar se disuelva y alcance una temperatura de 104 ° C en un termómetro de azúcar. Debe verse almibarado. Retirar del fuego.","Vierta en la mezcla de lentejas, agregue el azafrán y mezcle bien hasta que quede suave. Deje que la halva se enfríe en la sartén durante unos 30 minutos hasta que esté lo suficientemente fría como para manipularla.","Con las manos, forme cucharadas de halva en forma cilíndrica, luego colóquelas en un plato y esparza sobre las nueces picadas. Sirva inmediatamente o enfríe completamente y manténgalo frío hasta por cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13782,5355,'es','Muslos de pollo con anacardos y cúrcuma (kalmi kebab)','Prepare este favorito del norte de la India: muslos de pollo marinados en yogur con ajo, crema y pasta de anacardos y condimentados con cúrcuma y jengibre.','["75 g de anacardos","1 limón, exprimido, más gajos adicionales para servir","150 g de yogur griego colado (use yogur griego normal si no lo encuentra colado)","50 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado fino","8 dientes de ajo machacados","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma en polvo","1 cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","½ cucharadita de semillas de carambola (ajwain), opcional","1 cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharadita de comino molido","¾ cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra molidos","50ml de nata doble","12 muslos de pollo, sin piel","50 g de ghee o 75 ml de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en aros"]','["Coloque los anacardos en un bol y cúbralos con suficiente agua hirviendo del hervidor para cubrirlos. Dejar reposar durante al menos 2 horas para que se ablande. Escurre las nueces, luego licúa hasta que quede suave en un procesador de alimentos pequeño con el jugo de limón.","Mezcle la pasta de nueces con el yogur en un tazón grande y agregue el limón, el jengibre, el ajo, la cúrcuma, el chile en polvo, las semillas de carambola (si las usa), el garam masala, el comino, la pimienta negra y la crema.","Con un cuchillo afilado, haga 2 o 3 cortes en cada muslo de pollo y cúbralos con el yogur especiado. Tapa el bol y deja marinar el pollo en el frigorífico durante 1-2 horas, o toda la noche si tienes tiempo.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Poner el ghee o el aceite en una fuente para asar más grande y calentarlo en el horno hasta que esté muy caliente.","Coloque el pollo en una sola capa en la fuente para asar. Vierta la mitad de la marinada sobre las piernas y regrese la lata al horno.","Después de 15 minutos, voltee las piernas y extiéndalas sobre el resto de la marinada. Mételo en el horno durante 15 minutos más, hasta que el jugo del pollo salga claro al pincharlo con un cuchillo.","Precalienta la parrilla a su temperatura más alta y asa el pollo durante 3-4 minutos hasta que se dore. Transfiera a una fuente para servir, espolvoree con aros de cebolla morada y sirva con rodajas de limón a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13783,5661,'es','Wraps de paneer a la parrilla (rollitos de kathi paneer)','Disfrute de estos rollos de chapati recubiertos de tortilla como refrigerio o regalo en Diwali. Están untados con salsa de cilantro y rellenos de paneer sazonado con mango.','["300 g de paneer","150 ml de yogur griego entero","30 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado fino","6 dientes de ajo machacados","¼ cucharadita de semillas de carambola (ajwain; opcional)","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","¾ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","1 cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharadita de mango en polvo (amchoor)","1 lima, exprimida","3-4 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente cortada","1 zanahoria, rallada gruesa","1 chile verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 lima, exprimida","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de hojas de menta ralladas","6-8 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o ghee derretido","8 chapatis","4 huevos, ligeramente batidos","salsa de cilantro, para servir (ver ''Combina bien'', más abajo)"]','["Coloque el paneer en un recipiente resistente al calor, cúbralo con agua hirviendo del hervidor y déjelo en remojo durante 10 minutos para que se ablande. Escurre y desecha el agua, luego corta el queso en tres rectángulos de 2 cm.","Mezcle el yogur con el jengibre, el ajo, las semillas de carambola (si las usa), la cúrcuma, el chile en polvo, el garam masala, el mango en polvo y el jugo de lima. Mezcle suavemente el yogur especiado con el paneer y déjelo marinar a temperatura ambiente durante 30 minutos. Para la ensalada, combine la cebolla en rodajas con la zanahoria rallada, el chile verde, el jugo de lima, el azúcar y la menta. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén de base pesada a fuego medio y fríe el paneer durante 3-4 minutos hasta que se ablande, volteando los trozos de vez en cuando con una rodaja de pescado. Retirar del fuego, tapar con una tapa y reservar.","Para el pan, caliente una plancha o sartén de base pesada a fuego medio y agregue 1 cucharadita de aceite o ghee. Coloque un chapati en la plancha y vierta sobre 1-2 cucharadas de huevo batido. Rocíe otra cucharadita de aceite o ghee alrededor del borde del pan y, usando una rodaja de pescado, voltee rápidamente el chapati para que el lado con huevo quede hacia abajo. Parte del huevo se derramará al darle la vuelta y se puede raspar debajo del chapati mientras se cocina. Cocine por un minuto, luego retire los chapati de la sartén y cocine los chapatis restantes de la misma manera. Apila el pan, con la tortilla hacia arriba y envuélvelo sin apretar en papel de aluminio para mantenerlo caliente.","Coloque las tortillas-chapatis en la encimera y esparza generosamente un poco de salsa de cilantro sobre el huevo. Coloque cuatro o cinco trozos de paneer en fila en el centro de cada chapati y cubra con 1 cucharada de ensalada. Enrolle el ''roti'' alrededor del relleno y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13784,7425,'es','Empanadas de cordero y lentejas picadas (shami kebab)','Cocine kebabs de fiesta indios populares para Diwali hechos con carne picada de cordero y lentejas, sazonados con especias y aderezados con cilantro fresco, jengibre y chiles.','["80 g de gramo de Bengala partido (chana dal)","30 g de ghee","1 cebolla, finamente picada","500 g de carne picada de cordero","10 dientes de ajo","50 g de jengibre, pelado y finamente picado","1 cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","1 cucharadita de garam masala","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino negro (shahi jeera) o ½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 huevo, ligeramente batido","1 lima, exprimida","4 cucharadas de cilantro picado","2 chiles verdes, finamente picados","50 ml de aceite de girasol","150 ml de yogur griego entero","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","2 cucharadas de hojas de menta ralladas","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","jugo de lima, para condimentar"]','["Coloque el gramo de Bengala partido en un recipiente pequeño resistente al calor, cúbralo con agua hirviendo del hervidor y déjelo en remojo durante 3 horas o, idealmente, toda la noche, si tiene tiempo.","Derretir el ghee en una cazuela resistente al fuego a fuego medio y sofreír las cebollas durante 7-10 minutos hasta que empiecen a dorarse. Agrega la carne picada de cordero. Pele los dientes de ajo enteros y viértalos en el plato junto con el jengibre y cocine, revolviendo con frecuencia, durante 10 minutos más hasta que se evapore el líquido del cordero. Escurre el gramo de Bengala remojado y agrégalo al plato con el chile en polvo, el garam masala y las semillas de comino negro o comino molido.","Vierta 300 ml de agua caliente hasta cubrir apenas la carne picada, cubra con una tapa, reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 20-25 minutos hasta que la carne picada esté tierna. Retire la tapa y continúe cocinando, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que toda el agua se haya evaporado y el gramo de Bengala esté tierno. A estas alturas, la carne picada estará seca y de textura quebradiza. Extienda la mezcla en una bandeja para hornear y déjela enfriar por completo antes de transferirla a un procesador de alimentos grande.","Agrega el huevo batido, el jugo de lima, el cilantro y los chiles verdes al procesador y licúa hasta que quede suave. Con las manos húmedas, enrolle la mezcla de cordero en unas 20 bolas del tamaño de una nuez. Aplana cada bola en la palma de tu mano hasta formar una hamburguesa de 4 cm (con un grosor de 1 cm) con los dedos. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Para la raita de menta, mezcla el yogur con el ajo, la menta, el comino y el azúcar y añade suficiente zumo de lima para realzar el sabor. Pruebe para sazonar y luego reserve.","Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén de base pesada a fuego medio y fríe las brochetas en tandas durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado hasta que se doren. Vierta el exceso de aceite entre tandas y limpie la sartén con un paño de cocina antes de agregar aceite nuevo. Escurrir las brochetas sobre papel de cocina y servir calientes con la raita de menta."]','2026-01-11 12:59:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13785,6855,'es','pieza shahi','Disfrute de un postre clásico mogol de rebanadas de pan frito, bañadas en leche de cardamomo endulzada, perfumada con azafrán y agua de rosas y cubierta con nueces picadas.','["¼ cucharadita de azafrán","7 vainas de cardamomo, sin semillas, más 1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","4 rebanadas de pan blanco, de grosor medio, de 2 días","aceite de girasol, para freír","1 litro de leche entera","75 g de azúcar en polvo","125ml de nata doble","unas gotas de agua de rosas","1 cucharada de almendras picadas","pan de plata (opcional)"]','["Pon el azafrán en un bol pequeño con 2 cucharadas de agua tibia y déjalo reposar durante 1 hora. Mientras tanto, muele las semillas de cardamomo hasta convertirlas en polvo con el azúcar en polvo usando un mortero y un mortero.","Quitar la corteza del pan y cortar las rebanadas por la mitad en diagonal.","Vierte el aceite en una sartén de lados altos, hasta que tenga 2 cm de profundidad, y coloca a fuego medio. Una vez que el aceite alcance los 180 °C, o cuando un cubo de pan se dore en 30 segundos, agregue con cuidado las rebanadas de pan en tandas y cocine hasta que estén doradas por ambos lados. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y reservar.","Calienta la mezcla de leche y cardamomo molido en awokor karahi a fuego medio-alto, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Una vez que hierva, enciende el fuego a medio y continúa cocinando la leche durante unos 15 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que se reduzca a la mitad.","Mezclar un cucharón de leche caliente con la nata en un bol y luego verterlo nuevamente en la sartén. Agregue el azafrán y el agua de remojo y suficiente agua de rosas para darle un suave sabor floral.","Añade el pan frito en una sola capa a la leche cremosa; probablemente tendrás que hacerlo en dos tandas. Ablande el pan a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos, luego retírelo con una espumadera y colóquelo en una sola capa en un plato para servir.","Encienda el fuego a medio y reduzca la leche que queda en la sartén durante unos minutos, revolviendo todo el tiempo hasta que esté cremosa; debe tener la consistencia de una crema doble.","Deje que la leche se enfríe y espese durante 15 minutos y luego viértala sobre el pan. Enfriar durante la noche para que el pan se ablande.","Espolvorea con almendras picadas y pan de plata, si lo usas, para una ocasión especial. Servir frío."]','2026-01-11 12:59:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13786,3858,'es','Kalakand','Prepare este aromático dulce indio como delicia. Tiene una textura suave y granulada y está impregnado de cardamomo y agua de rosas.','["6 vainas de cardamomo, sin semillas","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","250 g de paneer casero, desmenuzado (ver recetas relacionadas a continuación)","397g lata de leche condensada","unas gotas de agua de rosas","3 cucharadas de pistachos picados"]','["Machaca las semillas de cardamomo hasta convertirlas en polvo con el azúcar usando un mortero y un mortero.","Calienta la mezcla de paneer, leche condensada y cardamomo en awokor karahi a fuego medio, revolviendo con frecuencia para evitar que se pegue. Una vez que hierva, baje el fuego y cocine, revolviendo continuamente, durante 5-7 minutos, hasta que la mezcla espese y se despegue de los lados de la sartén. Trate de obtener una consistencia suave y gomosa con una textura granulada.","Apague el fuego y agregue suficiente agua de rosas para darle un sabor sutil. Dejar enfriar y espesar en el molde durante 10 minutos.","Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Extienda el kalakand hasta formar un rectángulo de 2 cm de grosor. Presione los pistachos sobre la superficie y déjelos enfriar antes de enfriarlos en el frigorífico.","Una vez que el kalakand esté firme, córtelo en cuadrados de 3 cm y sírvalo a temperatura ambiente. Se conservará hasta cuatro días en un recipiente hermético en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 12:59:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13787,6857,'es','boondi laddu','Celebre Diwali con boondi laddu, un dulce tradicional indio, elaborado con gotas de harina de garbanzos fritas empapadas en cardamomo y jarabe de azafrán.','["¼ cucharadita de hebras de azafrán","8 vainas de cardamomo verde, solo semillas","225 g de azúcar en polvo, más 1 cucharadita","125 gramos de harina","1 litro de aceite de girasol o 500 g de ghee, para freír, más un poco más para las manos","2 cucharadas de pistachos picados","1 cucharada de piñones, picados o semillas de melón secas (char magaz)","225 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Muele las hebras de azafrán con un mortero y un mortero, luego transfiérelas a un tazón pequeño y déjalas en remojo en 2 cucharadas de agua tibia durante 1 hora.","Mientras tanto, usando el mismo mortero, machaque las semillas de cardamomo hasta convertirlas en polvo con 1 cucharadita de azúcar.","Tamice la harina de garbanzos en un tazón grande y agregue suficiente agua para obtener una masa con la consistencia de una crema doble.","Llene el awokor karahi hasta la mitad con aceite y caliéntelo a 180 ° C. Estará listo cuando un cubo de pan se dore en 30 segundos.","Para las gotas de harina de garbanzos, necesitará una espumadera o usar un colador de metal grueso, aunque las gotas de harina de garbanzos no tendrán una forma redonda cuando se fríen. Sostenga la cuchara o colador metálico 2 cm por encima del aceite caliente. Con un cucharón, vierta con cuidado un cucharón de masa en la cuchara, empujando suavemente la masa a través de los agujeros de la cuchara o del colador con un movimiento circular con la base redondeada del cucharón.","Si la masa es demasiado fina, las gotas se aplanarán, así que agregue un poco más de harina tamizada si es necesario. Si es demasiado espesa, las gotitas se alargarán y tendrán colas tenues; una cucharada de agua aflojará la masa.","Freír las gotas de harina en tandas durante 30-40 segundos sin que se doren, luego escurrir sobre papel de cocina. Si está usando una espumadera, límpiela con papel de cocina entre cada tanda.","Una vez que las gotas se hayan enfriado, rompa los grumos con los dedos y transfiéralas a un tazón grande. Agregue el cardamomo molido, los pistachos y los piñones (o semillas de melón) y reserve.","Para el almíbar, disolver el azúcar en 225ml de agua y hervir durante unos 10 minutos a fuego medio, hasta que empiece a espesar. La temperatura debe alcanzar los 110 ° C en un termómetro para azúcar.","Agrega el azafrán y el agua de remojo y deja hervir el almíbar durante 1 minuto más. Retirar del fuego y verter el almíbar caliente sobre las gotitas de harina de garbanzos. Con el dorso de una cuchara de madera, triture aproximadamente un tercio de las gotas en el almíbar. Cubra el recipiente y déjelo enfriar antes de enfriar la mezcla durante 1-2 horas. Esto espesará el almíbar y hará que sea más fácil darle forma a los laddus.","Engrase ligeramente sus manos y exprima firmemente y forme porciones de la mezcla en 14-16 bolas, aproximadamente del tamaño de una nuez. Colóquelos en una bandeja forrada con papel pergamino y guarde los laddus en una caja hermética en el refrigerador. Se mantendrán fríos hasta por una semana. Sirva a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13788,6861,'es','Fideos condimentados con cardamomo (semiya payasam)','Deléitese con un popular postre indio elaborado con hebras de fideos fritos cocidos a fuego lento en leche de cardamomo. Un regalo perfecto para festividades, es cremoso, dulce y dorado.','["10 vainas de cardamomo verde, sin semillas","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 litro de leche entera","75 g de ghee","75 g de fideos finos, triturados aproximadamente","100 g de azúcar moreno o azúcar moscabado light","250 ml de leche de coco","50 g de pasas, remojadas en agua caliente durante 10 minutos y luego escurridas","50 g de anacardos, fritos hasta que estén dorados en 1 cucharadita de ghee"]','["Machaca las semillas de cardamomo hasta convertirlas en polvo con el azúcar en polvo usando un mortero y un mortero. Vierta en una cacerola con la leche y deje hervir a fuego medio, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Calienta el ghee en awokor karahi a fuego medio y fríe los fideos durante 3-5 minutos, revolviendo continuamente, hasta que se oscurezcan.","Vierta la leche hirviendo sobre los fideos y continúe cocinando a fuego lento, revolviendo todo el tiempo, durante 5 minutos o hasta que espese. Agregue el azúcar moreno o el azúcar moscovado y cocine por 2-3 minutos más.","Batir la leche de coco para deshacer los grumos y verterla en la sartén. Deje hervir a fuego lento y luego agregue las pasas. Vierta en tazones pequeños y esparza sobre los anacardos fritos antes de servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13789,3860,'es','Aloo chaat','Disfrute de un refrigerio popular del festival indio. Estas patatas fritas al limón se sazonan con comino y chaat masala, con chile verde, cebolla morada y granada.','["750 g de patatas (Maris Piper o King Edward)","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","30 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado fino","2 chiles verdes, sin semillas y finamente picados","1 cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de chaat masala","½ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","½ cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra molidos gruesos","1 limón, exprimido","1 litro de aceite de girasol, para freír","2 cucharadas de salsa de cilantro (ver \"combina bien\" a continuación)","4 cucharadas de salsa de dátiles y tamarindo (ver \"combina bien\" a continuación)","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado","3 cucharadas de semillas de granada"]','["Pela las patatas, córtalas en trozos de 3 cm y enjuágalas con agua fría durante 2 minutos. Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua con sal, agregue las patatas y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, hasta que estén tiernas. Escurre y coloca las patatas sobre una rejilla para enfriar. Déjelos enfriar y luego enfríelos durante 30 minutos; esto secará la superficie.","Mezclar la cebolla con el jengibre, los chiles verdes, el comino, el chaat masala, el chile en polvo y la pimienta negra. Agrega el jugo de limón y reserva.","Calienta el aceite en awokor karahi a 180C, o cuando un cubo de pan se dore en 30 segundos. Freír las patatas en tandas hasta que estén doradas, escurrirlas sobre papel de cocina y sazonar con sal.","Mezclar las patatas calientes con la mezcla de cebolla y chile. Rocíe con salsa de dátiles y tamarindo, vierta sobre la salsa de cilantro y espolvoree con cilantro y semillas de granada. Servir de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 12:59:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13790,4297,'es','Dhal de coco en una sartén','Prepara un versátil dhal de coco. Es la comida vegana más reconfortante, todo preparado en una sola sartén, y también se puede utilizar como base para hacer otros curry.','["300 g de lentejas rojas","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol, más un poco más para rociar","2 cebollas, finamente cortadas","4 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente picados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente picado","5 hojas de curry (opcional)","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de cilantro en polvo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 chile rojo seco, dejado entero","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","lata de 400g de leche de coco","hojas de cilantro, jengibre en rodajas y chile verde en rodajas, para servir"]','["Enjuague las lentejas hasta que el agua salga clara y luego escúrralas. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y poco profunda y cocina las cebollas a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que empiecen a dorarse, añadiendo más aceite si la sartén parece seca. Agrega el ajo y el jengibre y cocina por otros 30 segundos. Esparza las hojas de curry, si las usa, y todas las especias y cocine por unos minutos más, luego agregue el puré de tomate y cocine por un minuto más.","Agrega las lentejas, asegurándote de que estén bien cubiertas con las especias, luego vierte sobre la leche de coco y 850 ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición, revolviendo ocasionalmente, luego cocinar a fuego lento durante unos 30 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén suaves y espesos. Saque todo el chile y deséchelo, luego sazone generosamente con sal. Ahora se puede dejar enfriar el dhal y luego congelarlo en porciones o como un solo lote en un recipiente de plástico grande. Descongela completamente antes de recalentar en una sartén a fuego lento, agregando más agua para aflojar si es necesario.","Sirva con una pizca de cilantro, jengibre en rodajas y chile, y rocíe con un poco más de aceite."]','2026-01-11 12:59:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13791,4513,'es','Pollo en una olla y arroz al curry','Prepare esta sencilla cena familiar en una sola olla, con pollo, coliflor, frijoles y guisantes con suaves sabores de curry. Sirva con yogur y chutney de mango a un lado.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o ghee","2 cebollas grandes, finamente cortadas","4 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente picado","4 cucharadas colmadas de pasta de curry suave","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","4 vainas de cardamomo, machacadas","1 rama de canela","4 pechugas de pollo pequeñas sin piel u 8 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel (unos 600 g), cortados en trozos pequeños","250 g de arroz basmati, enjuagado","600 ml de caldo de pollo","200ml de leche de coco","75 g de guisantes congelados","150 g de judías verdes, sin bordes y partidas por la mitad","½ coliflor (unos 225 g) partida en floretes pequeños","50 g de pasas o pasas","hojas de cilantro, almendras en hojuelas, yogur natural y chutney de mango, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande (que tenga tapa) a fuego medio, luego fríe la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre hasta que estén dorados y fragantes, aproximadamente 10 minutos. Agrega la pasta de curry, la cúrcuma, el cardamomo y la canela y revuelve durante unos minutos. Agregue el pollo y cocine por un par de minutos más, revolviendo para que adquiera color por todos lados.","Agregue el arroz, revuelva bien, luego agregue el caldo, la leche de coco, una pizca generosa de condimento, las verduras y las pasas. Deje hervir, luego reduzca a fuego lento, cierre la tapa y cocine durante unos 25-30 minutos hasta que el agua se haya absorbido, el pollo y el arroz estén bien cocidos y las verduras estén tiernas. Sazone al gusto. Retire el cardamomo y la canela en rama, luego esparza sobre las almendras y el cilantro. Sirva con yogur y chutney de mango como acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 12:59:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13792,7429,'es','Choleh bhature ''naan''','Disfrute de un sabroso plato punjabi de garbanzos especiados servidos con bhature; aquí están fritos en seco, lo que los hace más parecidos a un naan, y se combinan con raita y una ensalada de kachumber.','["¼ de pepino, cortado en cubitos","3 tomates, cortados en cubitos","1 cebolla morada grande, picada","2 cucharaditas de salsa de menta","1 limón, exprimido","175 g de pepino rallado","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","500ml de yogur natural","500ml de leche","10 g de cilantro, finamente picado","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 cebollas medianas, finamente picadas","5 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","4 chiles verdes, finamente picados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","2 cucharaditas de pimentón","1 cucharadita de methi (fenogreco seco)","4 latas de 400 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","un puñado de cilantro picado para servir","1 kg de harina con levadura","250ml de yogur natural","2 cucharadas de papa en polvo (Smash o alternativa)","100ml de aceite sin sabor y un poquito más","1 cucharadita de azúcar","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de ajwain","50 g de mantequilla salada","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharada de cilantro fresco, picado","2 cucharaditas de calonge (Nigella Seeeds)"]','["Para hacer la ensalada kachumber, mezcle todos los ingredientes en un tazón grande y reserve.","Para hacer la raita, mezcla todos los ingredientes en un bol grande y reserva. Cuando esté listo para servir, agregue 1 cucharadita de sal si es necesario y mezcle bien (si agrega la sal antes de esto, extraerá el agua, así que agréguela solo justo antes de servir).","Para hacer el choleh, caliente el aceite en una cacerola grande, luego agregue las cebollas y cocine durante 8 a 10 minutos a fuego medio-bajo, hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo, el jengibre y los chiles y cocine por 2-3 minutos más. Agrega un chorrito de agua a la sartén si la mezcla se pega al fondo. Agrega los tomates y otro chorrito de agua, continúa cocinando durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que las cebollas y los tomates estén bien combinados. Agrega 2 cucharaditas de sal y las especias y cocina por 10 minutos más hasta que la mezcla esté bien incorporada y el aceite se separe. Agregue un poco más de agua si es necesario para evitar que se pegue al fondo de la sartén.","Vierta los garbanzos y 500 ml de agua. Cocine a fuego medio durante 10 minutos. Una vez que estén blandos, con un machacador de papas, triture los garbanzos hasta que se deshagan parcialmente (esto ayuda a espesar la salsa) y luego cocine a fuego lento durante otros 10 minutos. Esparcir con el cilantro para servir.","Para hacer el bhature, mezcle todos los ingredientes con una cuchara de metal en un tazón grande, hasta formar una masa peluda. Engrasa un bol grande y tu mano con un poco de aceite sin sabor. Luego, amase hasta que la masa esté elástica y bien combinada. Si la masa parece seca, agregue más agua tibia a medida que avanza. Unte un poco de aceite en la superficie de la masa, transfiérala al recipiente engrasado y cúbralo con un paño de cocina húmedo. Dejar reposar 2-3 horas.","Mientras tanto, si prepara la mantequilla, derrita la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña y agregue el ajo. Freír hasta que estén aromáticos, agregar el cilantro picado y las semillas de nigella y reservar hasta que se necesiten.","Divide la masa en 16 porciones iguales. Tome un trozo de masa, forme una bola y, con un rodillo, enrolle hasta que tenga aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor y forma ovalada. Calienta una sartén/thava seca hasta que esté caliente y deja caer la masa. Las burbujas subirán a la superficie después de aproximadamente un minuto. Dale la vuelta y cocina por el otro lado durante 2 minutos. Unte un poco de mantequilla encima y sirva con todos los acompañamientos."]','2026-01-11 12:59:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13793,6481,'es','pakoras de pollo','Prepare un lote de estas pakoras doradas y crujientes como refrigerio o como parte de una comida india. Sirva caliente con salsa de chile dulce o chutney verde.','["700 g de pollo deshuesado, cortado en trozos pequeños","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","50 g de harina de arroz","40 g de harina tamizada","3 chiles secos triturados o 3 chiles verdes finamente picados","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","½ cucharadita de curry en polvo","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de comino","2 cebollas pequeñas, picadas","manojo pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","aceite vegetal, para freír","salsa de chile dulce o chutney verde, para servir"]','["Coloque el pollo en un tazón grande y luego use las manos para cubrir los trozos con harina de maíz. Agregue la harina de arroz, seguida de la harina de garbanzos. Agrega los chiles, las especias, la cebolla, el cilantro y 1 cucharadita de sal. Mezclar bien con las manos.","Agregue gradualmente alrededor de 150 ml de agua hasta que los ingredientes se humedezcan y estén ligeramente mojados. Es posible que no necesite toda el agua (agregar demasiada evitará que la mezcla de pakora se una).","Llene una sartén honda no más de un tercio de su capacidad con aceite vegetal y caliéntela a 180 ° C. Exprime una pequeña cantidad de la mezcla de pakora antes de sumergirla con cuidado en el aceite caliente con una cuchara. Freír durante 8-10 minutos, volteando regularmente, hasta que estén bien cocidos y dorados por completo. Reserva en un plato forrado con papel de cocina mientras repites con el resto de la mezcla, fríe en tandas pequeñas. Sirva caliente con salsa de chile dulce o chutney verde."]','2026-01-11 12:59:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13794,3886,'es','Pollo asado bengalí','Sirva este pollo especiado en un masala aromático como entrante en un banquete familiar. Lleno de sabor, es un plato bengalí popular, uno que seguramente cocinarás una y otra vez.','["4-6 muslos o muslos de pollo con hueso, con la carne cortada","1 cucharadita de curry suave en polvo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","2 cucharadas de yogur griego","5 cucharadas de ghee o aceite","3 hojas de laurel","2 ramas grandes de canela","3 vainas de cardamomo","2 cebollas grandes, finamente cortadas","6 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de jengibre rallado","2 cucharaditas de curry suave en polvo","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","5 chiles verdes, rebanados, para servir","cilantro picado, para servir"]','["Pon el pollo en un bol, agrega las especias de la marinada y el yogur con ½ cucharadita de sal y mezcla bien. El pollo se puede dejar marinar durante unas horas o cocinarlo inmediatamente; dejarlo marinar lo hará más tierno.","Derrita el ghee en una sartén antiadherente. Fríe el pollo durante 5 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté dorado. Retirar de la sartén y transferir al bol, dejando el ghee en la sartén.","Mantenga la sartén al fuego y raspe para soltar los trozos caramelizados pegados al fondo. Añade las hojas de laurel, la canela y las vainas de cardamomo y sofríe hasta que empiecen a oler aromáticos. Agrega las cebollas y el ajo, seguidos del jengibre y 1-1½ cucharadita de sal. Revuelva, cubra y cocine hasta que esté suave y traslúcido, aproximadamente de 8 a 10 minutos.","Agrega el resto de las especias y sofríe a fuego lento durante 5-8 minutos. Añade 200 ml de agua, tapa y cocina durante 3-4 minutos más, o hasta que el ghee se separe del masala (debe estar burbujeando en los bordes de la sartén).","Vuelva a colocar el pollo en la sartén, incluidos los jugos de la carne. Vierta un poco de masala sobre el pollo y cubra. Cocine durante 10 a 15 minutos más o hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Agregue los chiles verdes en rodajas y el cilantro picado y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13795,7431,'es','Halwa','Intente preparar un poco de halwa, un postre tradicional indio elaborado con sémola o zanahorias, además de nueces y cardamomo. El nuestro está hecho con sémola.','["100 g de azúcar en polvo","unas gotas de colorante alimentario naranja (opcional)","6 vainas de cardamomo","100 g de ghee","50 g de pistachos picados","175 g de sémola (gruesa o fina)","puris o parathas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Caliente 250 ml de agua en una sartén hasta que hierva, luego agregue el azúcar y el colorante alimentario, si lo usa.","Retire las semillas de las vainas de cardamomo y deséchelas, luego agregue 3 de las cáscaras de cardamomo a la sartén. Hierva durante varios minutos y luego transfiéralo a una jarra o tazón resistente al calor.","Calienta el ghee en la misma sartén, luego agrega el resto de las hojas de cardamomo y los pistachos. Freír durante 1 min y luego añadir la sémola. Tuesta durante unos minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente para evitar que se queme. Regrese el almíbar de azúcar caliente a la sartén, revolviendo continuamente para evitar que se formen grumos hasta que se haya absorbido todo el líquido. El halwa cocido debe moldearse fácilmente. Saque las cáscaras de cardamomo y sírvalas calientes con puris o parathas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13796,3888,'es','mano','Prepare una tanda de handesh dulce y dorado, un bocadillo bengalí frito hecho con harina y melaza de dátiles. Delicioso con una taza de té o con leche tibia como cereal','["320 g de harina de arroz","145 g de harina común","320 g de melaza de dátil (morsa gur)","50 g de azúcar blanca granulada","aceite vegetal, para freír"]','["Mezcle las harinas, la melaza y el azúcar en un tazón grande hasta que estén bien combinados.","Agregue gradualmente hasta 150 ml de agua tibia para obtener una masa muy espesa, mezclando con las manos limpias. Desmenuza los trozos grandes de harina, melaza o azúcar con los dedos. Agregue otros 250 ml de agua, poco a poco, hasta obtener una masa que se vierta en un chorro constante sin romperse; la cantidad de agua variará según la consistencia de la melaza. Si la masa todavía parece demasiado espesa, agrega un poco más de agua hasta obtener la consistencia adecuada. Si agregas demasiada agua, agrega más harina hasta tener la consistencia adecuada. Tapar el bol y dejar reposar a temperatura ambiente durante 4-5 horas o toda la noche.","Calienta una cantidad generosa de aceite en un wok grande a fuego alto (alrededor de 200 ° C si usas un termómetro). Cuando esté muy caliente, reduzca el fuego a medio; esto asegurará que el aceite esté lo suficientemente caliente como para que el handesh se hinche inmediatamente sin quemarse. Vierte un poco de la masa directamente en el centro del wok con una jarra o cucharón y espera unos segundos a que se hinche lentamente y suba a la superficie del aceite. Aléjelo del centro de la sartén con una cuchara y cocínelo durante 25 a 30 segundos por cada lado hasta que se dore por completo y esté cocido por dentro; puede abrir uno para comprobar que esté bien cocido. Retirar del wok con una espumadera y colocar en un plato forrado con papel de cocina. Repita con la masa restante. Disfrútelo caliente con una taza de té o córtelo en trozos pequeños y cúbralo con leche tibia para comerlo como cereal."]','2026-01-11 12:59:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13797,7433,'es','Curry de coliflor y judías verdes','Pruebe este curry aromático con dos mezclas de especias: garam masala y polvo chino de cinco especias. El yogur de coco da una textura cremosa sin calorías adicionales.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar (unos 30 g), cortado en tiras finas","1 cucharada de hojas de curry","320 g de calabaza cortada en cubitos (peso preparado)","250 g de patatas baby, partidas por la mitad o en cuartos","225 g de arroz basmati integral","chiles rojos, sin semillas y finamente picados","4 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","1 cucharada de garam masala","1 cucharadita de cinco especias chinas (revise la etiqueta para asegurarse de que no tengan sal agregada)","4 tomates, picados","400 g de coliflor, floretes grandes y hojas picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","320 g de judías verdes, peladas y cortadas en trozos","150 g de yogur de coco","15 g de cilantro fresco picado","½ lima, en jugo"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego lento. Añade el jengibre y las hojas de curry y sofríe, revolviendo, durante aproximadamente un minuto. Agrega la calabaza y las patatas, sube el fuego a medio y fríe durante 5 minutos más. Mientras tanto, poner el arroz a hervir durante 20 minutos hasta que esté tierno.","Esparce el chile sobre la calabaza y las patatas junto con el ajo, el garam masala y las cinco especias. Revuelva brevemente y luego agregue los tomates, la coliflor, 400 ml de agua y el caldo en polvo. Llevar a ebullición, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Agregue los frijoles y cocine por otros 10 minutos hasta que todas las verduras estén tiernas, pero aún mantengan su forma.","Apague el fuego y agregue el yogur, el cilantro y el jugo de lima. Servir la mitad con la mitad del arroz. Enfríe las dos porciones restantes de curry y arroz para otra noche. Se mantendrán tapadas en el refrigerador hasta por dos días. Vuelve a calentar el arroz en el microondas y el curry en una sartén a fuego lento hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13798,3936,'es','Empanadillas de lentejas en yogur (dahi bhalla)','Prepare estas suaves albóndigas de lentejas como refrigerio o guarnición. Están cubiertos con yogur y servidos con salsa de cilantro, además de nuestra salsa de tamarindo y dátiles.','["65 g de urad dal blanco sin piel (dhuli urad), remojado durante la noche","65 g de mung dal amarillo, remojado durante la noche","¾ cucharadita de comino molido","¼ cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra molidos gruesos","40 g de jengibre, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","2 chiles verdes, sin semillas y picados en trozos grandes","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","aceite vegetal o de girasol para freír","1 caja de 268 ml de suero de leche","300ml de yogur griego o natural","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","3-4 cucharadas de leche","1 cucharadita de comino molido","¼ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","2 cucharadas de salsa de cilantro","4 cucharadas de salsa de dátiles y tamarindo","unas hojas de cilantro"]','["Escurre ambos lotes de lentejas con un colador y desecha el agua del remojo. Vierta en un procesador de alimentos y agregue el comino molido, los granos de pimienta, el jengibre y los chiles verdes. Mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave, agregando 1-2 cucharadas de agua según sea necesario.","Vierta la mezcla de lentejas en un tazón y bata vigorosamente durante 5 a 7 minutos, o hasta que la mezcla se vuelva ligera y esponjosa. Es más fácil hacer esto en una batidora equipada con una batidora.","Calienta el aceite en awokor karahi a fuego medio, asegurándote de que no esté más de dos tercios de su capacidad. Agrega el bicarbonato de sodio a la mezcla de lentejas, luego usa dos cucharas de postre para sacar y dar forma con cuidado a bolas de masa del tamaño de una nuez pequeña. Trabajando en tandas, sumerja las bolas de masa en el aceite con una espumadera.","Freír las bolas de masa durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado, volteándolas con una espumadera, hasta que estén doradas. Sacar y escurrir sobre papel de cocina. Deberías tener entre 22 y 24 bolas de masa cuando se acabe toda la masa. Dejar de lado.","Batir el suero de leche con una cantidad igual de agua fría en una fuente para hornear grande y poco profunda. Cubra las albóndigas con la mezcla de suero de leche y déjelas durante la noche en el refrigerador (se ablandarán a medida que se remojen).","Al día siguiente, presione suavemente las bolas de masa para eliminar el exceso de suero de leche y colóquelas en un plato para servir.","Para servir, bata el yogur con el azúcar y suficiente leche para crear una consistencia lo suficientemente espesa como para cubrir las albóndigas. Cubrir las albóndigas con el yogur y espolvorear con el comino molido y la guindilla en polvo. Rocíe un poco de salsa de cilantro y dátiles y tamarindo, luego espolvoree con las hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 12:59:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13799,7435,'es','Tortitas indias con crema de azafrán y agua de rosas (malpua y rabri)','Disfrute de los panqueques fritos indios como un dulce. A menudo se sirven en el festival Holi, están bañados en jarabe de azafrán y cardamomo y cubiertos con una crema de agua de rosas.','["1 litro de leche Jersey entera","25 g de azúcar en polvo","¼ cucharadita de hebras de azafrán remojadas en 1 cucharada de leche","1 cucharadita de agua de rosas","75 g de harina común","¼ cucharadita de sal fina","75 g de leche entera en polvo","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","250ml de leche entera","ghee, para freír poco profundo","250 g de azúcar en polvo","6 vainas de cardamomo verde, perforadas","½ cucharadita de hebras de azafrán, remojadas en 4 cucharadas de agua tibia durante 1 hora","25 g de pistachos picados","pétalos de rosa secos (opcional)"]','["Para hacer el rabri, calienta la leche a fuego medio, luego hierve hasta que se reduzca a una crema. Es mejor usar awok, karahi o una cazuela resistente para esto; desea que la leche se reduzca rápidamente para que conserve su color cremoso sin dorarse. Revuelva continuamente, raspando los lados de la sartén mientras se cocina.","Después de unos 20 minutos, la leche se habrá reducido a dos tercios y tendrá la consistencia de una nata doble. Agregue el azúcar en polvo y continúe cocinando hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Añade las hebras de azafrán junto con la leche de remojo y el agua de rosas. Vierta la nata en un bol y déjela enfriar antes de trasladarla al frigorífico.","Para hacer la masa de malpua, tamice la harina y la sal en un tazón mediano y mezcle con la leche en polvo y las semillas de hinojo. Haga un hueco en el medio de la harina y agregue suficiente leche para hacer una masa suave; busque la consistencia de una crema doble. Tapar y dejar reposar a temperatura ambiente durante 20 minutos.","Para hacer el almíbar, poner el azúcar en una cacerola con 300ml de agua, calentar suavemente, revolviendo, hasta que se disuelva (no dejar que el agua hierva). Agregue las vainas de cardamomo y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Apagar el fuego y remover poco a poco el azafrán junto con el agua de remojo. Tapa la sartén y mantén el almíbar caliente mientras haces los panqueques.","Caliente suficiente ghee en una sartén profunda para crear una profundidad de 3 cm cuando se derrita. Batir la masa; se habrá espesado un poco y ahora debería tener una consistencia de cobertura. Agrega un poco más de leche si es necesario.","Una vez que el ghee alcance los 130 ° C, o cuando un cubo de pan se dore en 1 minuto, agregue con cuidado cucharadas de la masa, dejando espacio para que se esparzan. Cada panqueque debe tener unos 7 cm de diámetro cuando se extienda. Tenga cuidado de no sobrecargar la sartén.","Cocine los panqueques en tandas durante 2-3 minutos. Una vez que la masa se haya endurecido, aumenta ligeramente el fuego y continúa cocinando hasta que los panqueques estén dorados. Retirar del aceite con una rodaja de pescado y escurrir sobre papel de cocina.","Agregue los panqueques calientes al almíbar tibio en tandas, dejándolos reposar durante 2-3 minutos. Escurre los panqueques, luego transfiérelos a un plato para servir y cúbrelos para mantenerlos calientes. Repita el proceso con el resto de la masa y el almíbar; debe haber entre 14 y 16 panqueques pequeños.","Vierta el exceso de jarabe de azafrán y cardamomo alrededor de los panqueques y cubra cada uno con una generosa ración de rabri frío. Para servir, espolvoree con pistachos picados y pétalos de rosa, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13800,3938,'es','Brócoli asado con comino y yogur de limón en conserva','Disfrute de este brócoli asado con comino con yogur de limón en conserva como guarnición vibrante. Es una hermosa combinación de especias, texturas y colores.','["500 g de brócoli de brotes morados, recortado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cucharada de comino molido","2 rebanadas pequeñas de pan blanco duro","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado dulce","1⁄2 cucharadita de comino molido","1⁄2 cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","1 limón en conserva, finamente picado, sin semillas","100 g de yogur entero","1 cucharada de hojas de cilantro finamente picadas","1 cucharada de hojas de perejil finamente picadas","1⁄2 diente de ajo, finamente rallado"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Verifica que los tallos del brócoli tengan aproximadamente el mismo grosor; de lo contrario, corta por la mitad los tallos más grandes del brócoli a lo largo. Frote el brócoli con aceite y luego espolvoree el comino y un poco de condimento. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear en una sola capa y ase durante unos 15 a 20 minutos, o hasta que estén tiernos y ligeramente carbonizados, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad.","Para el pan rallado, caliente el horno a 180 C/160 C ventilador/gas 4. Corte el pan en trozos pequeños y hornee durante 5 a 10 minutos, o hasta que esté crujiente, luego viértalo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle con el pan rallado.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego lento, luego agrega el ajo, las especias, el pan rallado y un poco de condimento. Freír, revolviendo regularmente, durante unos 5 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Transfiera a un plato forrado con papel de cocina para absorber el exceso de aceite.","Para el yogur, mezcla todos los ingredientes y sazona al gusto. Sirve el brócoli con el pan rallado esparcido por encima y el yogur a un lado para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:59:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13801,7437,'es','cordero asado','Prepare este impresionante bhuna de cordero uno o dos días antes de un gran festín familiar; el curry cocinado a fuego lento es mejor cuando los sabores tienen tiempo de desarrollarse.','["600 g de filete o paleta de cordero, cortado en trozos grandes","6 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","2 cucharadas de vinagre de malta","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol, más un poco más si es necesario","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","10 hojas de curry","2 chiles secos o ½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de semillas de fenogreco o fenogreco molido","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de garam masala"]','["Para hacer la marinada, combine los ingredientes con una pizca grande de sal en un tazón grande. Agregue el cordero, cubra y deje marinar durante 1 hora a temperatura ambiente o enfríe durante la noche.","Para la salsa, calentar el aceite en una cazuela refractaria y sofreír las cebollas durante 10 minutos, revolviendo hasta que estén suaves y doradas. Rocíe más aceite si la sartén se seca. Agrega las hojas de curry y los chiles y sofríe por unos minutos, luego agrega las especias y cocina por 5 minutos más hasta que las cebollas comiencen a caramelizar.","Vierta el cordero junto con la marinada y suba el fuego a alto. Cocine, revolviendo, durante 5 minutos hasta que el cordero se dore. Añade el puré de tomate y cocina durante 1 minuto, luego agrega los tomates y 100 ml de agua. Llevar a fuego lento, reducir el fuego, tapar y cocinar, revolviendo de vez en cuando, durante 1 hora y 20 minutos hasta que el cordero esté tierno.","Destape y cocine durante 8-10 minutos más hasta que la salsa se reduzca y espese. Retirar del fuego, agregar el garam marsala y sazonar. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días o congelado durante dos meses."]','2026-01-11 12:59:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13802,5680,'es','Pavo tikka masala','¿Se te antoja algo picante después del tradicional almuerzo navideño? ¿Quieres convertir las sobras de pavo en un plato completamente nuevo? Este sabroso pavo tikka masala es para ti','["aceite de girasol","cebolla, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente rallados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de pimentón","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","400g de lata de passata o tomates picados","1 cucharada de chutney de mango","100ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de yogur natural (opcional)","unos 600 g de restos de pavo asado, cortado en trozos grandes","cilantro picado, almendras tostadas en hojuelas, arroz al vapor y pan naan con ajo, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cazuela o sartén poco profunda a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Agregue el ajo, el jengibre, la guindilla y todas las especias y cocine por 2 minutos más hasta que la mezcla parezca una pasta. Agregue el puré de tomate, la passata o los tomates picados y el chutney de mango y cocine a fuego lento. Cocine por 10 minutos más.","Agregue la mayor parte de la crema y el yogur, si lo usa, y vuelva a hervir la mezcla a fuego lento. Agregue el pavo y continúe cocinando a fuego lento hasta que esté bien caliente. Retirar del fuego, rociar sobre la nata restante y revolver brevemente. Esparza un poco de cilantro y almendras en hojuelas y sirva con el arroz y el pan naan a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13803,6219,'es','Pilaf de zanahoria con chutney de cilantro','Pruebe este saludable pilaf relleno para una comida sencilla entre semana. Con anacardos, verduras y especias, no sólo es sabroso sino también económico. Cubra con chutney de cilantro','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla grande, finamente cortada","2 cucharadas de jengibre rallado","2 chiles verdes, rebanados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de semillas de cilantro, trituradas","4 vainas de cardamomo machacadas","½ rama de canela","1 cucharada de garam masala","400 g de zanahorias, peladas y ½ ralladas gruesas, ½ cortadas en ángulo","300 g de arroz basmati, bien enjuagado","600 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","manojo grande de cilantro, finamente picado (tallos incluidos)","60 g de anacardos, tostados y picados","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla grande, finamente cortada","2 cucharadas de jengibre rallado","2 chiles verdes, rebanados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de semillas de cilantro, trituradas","4 vainas de cardamomo machacadas","½ rama de canela","1 cucharada de garam masala","400 g de zanahorias, peladas y ½ ralladas gruesas, ½ cortadas en ángulo","300 g de arroz basmati, bien enjuagado","600 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","manojo grande de cilantro, finamente picado (tallos incluidos)","60 g de anacardos, tostados y picados"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande que tenga tapa hermética. Freír las cebollas con una pizca de sal a fuego medio durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén doradas y crujientes. Retirar de la sartén con una espumadera y escurrir sobre papel de cocina, dejando el aceite en la sartén.","Agrega la mitad del jengibre, la mitad del chile, todo el ajo, las especias y ambos tipos de zanahorias a la sartén y fríe durante 6 a 8 minutos hasta que las rodajas de zanahoria comiencen a dorarse. Agrega el arroz, remueve brevemente, luego agrega el caldo, un puñado de cilantro, una buena pizca de sal y pimienta negra molida. Llevar a fuego lento y, en cuanto empiece a hervir, bajar el fuego al mínimo, tapar y dejar cocer durante 12-15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, ponga el jengibre restante y la guindilla verde, la mayor parte de los anacardos y la mayor parte del cilantro restante en una licuadora pequeña con 50 ml de agua. Licue hasta que quede suave y agregue otras 2-3 cucharadas de agua, si es necesario, para hacer una salsa que se pueda tomar con una cuchara.","Cuando todo el líquido haya sido absorbido por el pilaf y el arroz esté tierno, esponja los granos con un tenedor. Vierta sobre el chutney de cilantro y espolvoree con las cebollas fritas, el cilantro reservado y los anacardos restantes para servir.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande que tenga tapa hermética. Freír las cebollas con una pizca de sal a fuego medio durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén doradas y crujientes. Retirar de la sartén con una espumadera y escurrir sobre papel de cocina, dejando el aceite en la sartén.","Agrega la mitad del jengibre, la mitad del chile, todo el ajo, las especias y ambos tipos de zanahorias a la sartén y fríe durante 6 a 8 minutos hasta que las rodajas de zanahoria comiencen a dorarse. Agrega el arroz, remueve brevemente, luego agrega el caldo, un puñado de cilantro, una buena pizca de sal y pimienta negra molida. Llevar a fuego lento y, en cuanto empiece a hervir, bajar el fuego al mínimo, tapar y dejar cocer durante 12-15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, ponga el jengibre restante y la guindilla verde, la mayor parte de los anacardos y la mayor parte del cilantro restante en una licuadora pequeña con 50 ml de agua. Licue hasta que quede suave y agregue otras 2-3 cucharadas de agua, si es necesario, para hacer una salsa que se pueda tomar con una cuchara.","Cuando todo el líquido haya sido absorbido por el pilaf y el arroz esté tierno, esponja los granos con un tenedor. Vierta sobre el chutney de cilantro y espolvoree con las cebollas fritas, el cilantro reservado y los anacardos restantes para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13804,4006,'es','Barfi de pistacho','Disfrute de este dulce tradicional indio en ocasiones especiales como Diwali. Con la textura del mazapán suave, es ricamente indulgente y maravillosamente especiado.','["75 g de pistachos sin cáscara","6 vainas de cardamomo verde","1 litro de leche entera Jersey","75 g de azúcar en polvo","hoja de plata o pistachos extra picados, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Mezcle los pistachos en un procesador de alimentos pequeño hasta que estén finamente picados. Tenga cuidado de no trabajarlos demasiado o se volverán grasosos. Dejar de lado.","Partir las vainas de cardamomo y quitar las semillas. Machaca las semillas hasta convertirlas en polvo en un mortero y con 1 cucharadita de azúcar.","Caliente la leche en un wokor karahi grande a fuego medio y hierva, revolviendo todo el tiempo con una cuchara de metal, hasta que se reduzca a una crema espesa; desea que la leche se reduzca rápidamente para que conserve su color cremoso sin dorarse, aproximadamente 20-30 minutos. Siga raspando los lados de la sartén para evitar que se queme. La leche debería haberse despegado de los lados de la cacerola y tener la consistencia de huevos revueltos.","Vierta esta pasta espesa en un bol y déjela enfriar antes de enfriar durante 2-3 horas. Ahora debería tener entre 225 y 250 g de sólidos lácteos reducidos, conocidos como \"khoya\".","Ralla el khoya en trozos grandes en un rallador de caja y colócalo en una cacerola resistente o en un wok. Agregue el cardamomo en polvo y el resto del azúcar en polvo y cocine a fuego suave, revolviendo todo el tiempo, hasta que el azúcar se disuelva y la mezcla se espese, aproximadamente 10 minutos.","Retira la sartén del fuego, añade las nueces picadas y mezcla bien. Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear y transfiera la mezcla tibia de barfi al papel, dándole palmaditas hasta formar un rectángulo. Cubrir con otra hoja de pergamino y enrollar suavemente el barfi hasta formar un rectángulo de 16 x 19 cm con aproximadamente ½ cm de grosor con un rodillo. Dejar reposar durante 3-4 horas. Si en tu cocina hace mucho calor, mete la bandeja en el frigorífico durante 30 minutos.","Retire la hoja de papel superior. Apoye una hoja de hoja de plata, si la usa, sobre el barfi, con el lado plateado hacia abajo. Frote suavemente la parte posterior del papel con los dedos, la hoja de plata debe transferirse a la mezcla; trate de no tocar la hoja de plata con los dedos, ya que se pegará a ellos. O presione los pistachos picados sobre la mezcla mientras aún están calientes, si lo desea.","Corta el barfi firme en forma de rombos de 3 x 4 cm. Se conservará a temperatura ambiente en una caja hermética durante 3-4 días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13805,7441,'es','Arroz con leche indio (kheer)','Celebre Diwali con este delicioso arroz con leche indio cocinado a fuego lento. Salpicado de frutos secos, tiene un sabor floral dulce y especiado y una cremosidad encantadora.','["½ cucharadita de hebras de azafrán","2 litros de leche entera","20 vainas de cardamomo verde, perforadas con la punta de un cuchillo","100 g de arroz basmati o de grano largo","100 g de azúcar en polvo","100ml de nata doble","2 cucharaditas de agua de rosas pura","2 cucharadas de almendras blanqueadas, ralladas","50 g de pasas remojadas en agua caliente"]','["Pon las hebras de azafrán en un tazón pequeño y remójalas en 2-3 cucharadas de agua tibia. Golpee los tallos con el dorso de una cucharadita; esto ayudará a liberar el sabor y el color.","Calentar la leche con las vainas de cardamomo verde perforadas en una cacerola resistente. Cuando llegue al punto de ebullición, esparza el arroz en la leche, baje el fuego y cocine a fuego lento hasta que el arroz se deshaga y esté muy suave, unos 40 minutos. Revuelva con frecuencia para evitar que el arroz se queme en el fondo de la sartén.","Agrega el azúcar al arroz cocido y calienta hasta que se disuelva. Si quieres, puedes sacar las vainas de cardamomo.","Agregue la crema y agregue gradualmente el agua de rosas y suficiente azafrán y su líquido de remojo para darle un ligero sabor al kheer. Agregue las almendras ralladas y las pasas escurridas y sirva bien caliente o frío."]','2026-01-11 12:59:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13806,4008,'es','Ladoo de harina de garbanzos especiada (besan ladoo)','Prueba este clásico dulce indio en Diwali. Besan ladoo está elaborado con harina de garbanzos frita con nueces y enriquecida con aromático azafrán, anacardos picados y ghee casero.','["6 vainas de cardamomo verde","100 g de azúcar glas tamizada","50 g de anacardos sin sal","125 g de ghee (ver consejo a continuación)","200 gramos de harina, tamizada","¼ de cucharadita de azafrán remojado en 1 cucharada de leche tibia","1 cucharada de pistachos picados"]','["Partir las vainas de cardamomo y quitar las semillas. Muele las semillas hasta obtener un polvo con 1 cucharadita de azúcar glas usando un mortero y un mortero. Dejar de lado.","Calienta una sartén pequeña y resistente y tuesta los anacardos a fuego medio, revolviendo todo el tiempo, hasta que cojan motas de color. Transfiera a una tabla de cortar y, una vez enfriado, pique finamente.","Derretir el ghee en awokor karahi a fuego lento, añadir la harina de garbanzos tamizada y freír, revolviendo todo el tiempo, hasta que se oscurezca y suelte un aroma tostado, unos 15-20 minutos. Agregue los anacardos tostados y transfiéralo a un tazón para mezclar. Déjelo hasta que esté lo suficientemente caliente para manipularlo.","Agrega el resto del azúcar, el cardamomo molido y el azafrán con su líquido de remojo. Amasar la pasta hasta que quede suave y luego dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente.","Con la mezcla de harina de garbanzos, forme bolitas (ladoos) con las manos, de unos 3 cm de diámetro. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Si los ladoos están un poco blandos, déjelos enfriar durante 10 minutos para que se endurezcan. Para servir, presione algunos pistachos picados en la parte superior de cada uno. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético a temperatura ambiente durante 7 a 10 días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13807,7443,'es','Curry de gambas y tamarindo','Nuestro curry de gambas y tamarindo se convertirá rápidamente en el favorito de la familia. Es rápido, saludable y bajo en grasas y calorías.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, picada","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry.","1-2 cucharadas de pasta de tamarindo (ver consejo a continuación)","250 g de langostinos crudos","250 g de arroz basmati cocido","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y cocina la cebolla durante 5-8 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorada. Agrega la guindilla, el ajo y el jengibre y sofríe durante un minuto más antes de agregar las especias. Vierta los tomates cherry, agite la lata con un chorrito de agua y revuélvala también en la sartén.","Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que los tomates revienten y la salsa espese. Agregue el tamarindo y los langostinos y cocine a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos hasta que los langostinos estén cocidos. Sirve el curry encima del arroz, con el cilantro esparcido por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:59:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13808,4036,'es','Jalebí','Prepare estas delicias indias friendo la masa en espirales crujientes y luego sumergiéndolas en un almíbar azucarado hecho con cardamomo y azafrán.','["1 litro de aceite vegetal, para freír","almendras en hojuelas o pistachos finamente picados, para servir","200 g de azúcar en polvo","una pizca pequeña de azafrán","1⁄4 cucharadita de cardamomo verde en polvo, o use cardamomo molido normal","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","125 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","1⁄2 cucharadita de jugo de limón","2 cucharaditas de yogur natural","1⁄2 cucharadita de cúrcuma o unas gotas de colorante alimentario amarillo natural","1 cucharada de ghee","1⁄4 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1⁄4 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio"]','["Primero, haz el almíbar. Poner en un cazo el azúcar y 100ml de agua a fuego medio. Cuando el azúcar se haya disuelto añadir el azafrán y llevar a ebullición. Continúe hirviendo durante 5 a 6 minutos hasta que espese y quede almibarado; la consistencia debe ser como la miel. Retirar del fuego y añadir el cardamomo y el zumo de limón (el zumo de limón evita que el azúcar cristalice). Dejar de lado.","Para la masa, poner todos los ingredientes excepto el polvo para hornear y el bicarbonato, en un bol grande. Agregue lentamente 150 ml de agua y bata durante unos minutos hasta que quede suave, luego agregue el polvo para hornear y el bicarbonato y revuelva bien; debe quedar tan espeso como la masa para panqueques. Vierta en una botella exprimible con una punta angosta, o colóquela en una manga pastelera y corte la punta para tener una pequeña abertura. Vierta el aceite en una cacerola grande de fondo grueso hasta que no esté más de dos tercios de su capacidad y caliéntela a 170-180 °C, o hasta que una gota de la masa chisporrotee cuando la agregue.","Exprima o coloque con cuidado remolinos de la masa directamente en el aceite caliente; hágalo en tandas (debería poder freír cuatro o cinco a la vez). Freír durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados. Retire el jalebi con una espumadera y colóquelo en un plato forrado con papel de cocina para escurrirlo, luego, mientras aún está caliente, sumérjalo en el almíbar con unas pinzas o un tenedor, volteándolo para cubrirlo. Espolvorea sobre las almendras laminadas o los pistachos picados. Servir inmediatamente o dejar enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:59:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13809,7445,'es','Bhajis al horno','Ofrezca sabor con estos bhajis al horno servidos con arroz con limón y ensalada de garbanzos. Es una cena saludable para cuatro personas baja en grasas y calorías.','["80 g de harina de garbanzos (gramos)","1 cucharada de curry en polvo mediano","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 huevos","1 zanahoria grande, rallada gruesa (unos 150 g)","2-3 cebollas (320 g), partidas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de jengibre picado","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza, más un poco más para la lata","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","150 g de arroz integral de fácil cocción","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de canela","400 ml de caldo de verduras caliente, elaborado con ½ cucharadita de caldo en polvo","2 tiras gruesas de cáscara de limón (del limón de la ensalada, a continuación)","70 g de yogur de coco","½ limón, exprimido","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","⅓ paquete de cilantro picado","4 tomates, picados","170 g de zanahorias, cortadas en tiras finas o ralladas gruesas","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezclar la harina con las especias y el caldo, y el puré de tomate con los huevos. Agrega la zanahoria, la cebolla y el jengibre a la mezcla de harina. Vierta los huevos, mezcle bien y agregue el aceite.","Engrase una bandeja para hornear grande. Vierta 12 montones limpios de masa. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado.","Para el arroz, calentar el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofreír el arroz y las especias durante 1 min. Añade el caldo y pela. Cocine a fuego lento durante 20-25 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno y se absorba el líquido.","Mezcle los ingredientes de la ensalada y sirva con los hajis y el arroz. Si sigue un plan de dieta saludable, sirva la mitad de los bhajis y el arroz con la mitad de la ensalada. Enfríe los bhajis y el arroz restantes y manténgalos fríos con el resto de la ensalada hasta por tres días. Vuelva a calentar los bhajis a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén bien calientes. Recalentar el arroz en el microondas. Sirve con la ensalada. Esta receta es parte de nuestro plan de dieta saludable gratuito de 7 días. Para acceder al plan de alimentación completo, haga clic aquí."]','2026-01-11 12:59:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13810,6612,'es','Gambas tikka masala','Olvídese de la comida para llevar y deléitese con una comida entre semana que complacerá a toda la familia con nuestro tikka masala de gambas, fácil y bajo en calorías. Servir con panes naan','["1 cebolla grande, picada en trozos grandes","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y rallado","2 dientes de ajo grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2-3 cucharadas de pasta de curry tikka","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","½ cucharada de azúcar moreno blando","3 vainas de cardamomo machacadas","200 g de arroz basmati integral","3 cucharadas de almendras molidas","300 g de langostinos crudos","1 cucharada de crema doble","½ manojo de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","panes naan, calentados, para servir (opcional)"]','["Coloque la cebolla, el jengibre y el ajo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave. Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a prueba de fuego o en una cacerola a fuego medio. Agrega la pasta de cebolla y sofríe durante 8 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente dorada. Agrega la pasta de curry y fríe durante 1 minuto más. Añade los tomates, el puré de tomate, el azúcar y las vainas de cardamomo. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar, tapado, durante otros 10 minutos.","Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Saque el cardamomo de la salsa de curry y deséchelo, luego bátalo con una batidora de mano o en un procesador de alimentos limpio. Regrese a la sartén, agregue las almendras y los langostinos y cocine por 5 minutos. Sazone al gusto y revuelva con la crema y el cilantro. Sirva con arroz y pan naan, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13811,7447,'es','boondi raita','Pruebe esta sencilla guarnición india que incluye boondi (pequeñas bolas de harina de garbanzos fritas) en yogur con menta y comino.','["300 gramos de yogur natural","¼ cucharadita de comino molido, más una pizca","60 g de boondi (disponible en muchos supermercados indios o en línea)","unas cuantas hojas de menta, ½ finamente picadas y la otra mitad enteras"]','["Batir el yogur con 100 ml de agua hasta que quede suave. Agrega el comino, ¼ de cucharadita de sal y una pizca de pimienta negra molida.","Agregue el boondi y mezcle bien para combinar. Déjelo reposar durante 10 minutos o hasta 2 horas hasta que el boondi haya absorbido un poco del líquido y se haya ablandado un poco (no más, ya que el boondi se ablandará demasiado). Espolvoreamos por encima las hojas de menta enteras y picadas y una pizca de comino."]','2026-01-11 12:59:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13812,5263,'es','Pan plano con azafrán relleno de lentejas y azúcar moreno (puran poli)','Llene panes planos indios con lentejas endulzadas y especiadas como refrigerio que a menudo se sirve durante el festival Holi de la India.','["100 g de lentejas amarillas partidas (gramo de bengala o chana dhal)","125 g de azúcar moreno o azúcar moscabado ligero","2 cucharaditas de semillas de hinojo","¼ cucharadita de nuez moscada rallada","½ cucharadita de cardamomo molido","250 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de sal fina","1 cucharada de ghee derretido, más un poco más para enrollar y cocinar","¼ de cucharadita de hebras de azafrán remojadas en 2 cucharadas de agua tibia"]','["Lavar las lentejas y cubrir con agua fría en un bol. Dejar en remojo durante la noche.","Escurrir las lentejas y ponerlas en una olla a presión. Vierta suficiente agua para cubrirlos unos 3 cm. Cocine durante 20-30 minutos, hasta que esté completamente suave. Alternativamente, cocínelos en una sartén mediana durante aproximadamente 1 a 1½ horas hasta que estén tiernos, agregando más agua según sea necesario para evitar que se peguen. Escurrir y dejar enfriar.","Coloque las lentejas enfriadas en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta. Transfiera la pasta a una sartén de fondo grueso y agregue el azúcar moreno, las semillas de hinojo, la nuez moscada y el cardamomo. Cocine a fuego medio durante 5-7 minutos, revolviendo todo el tiempo, hasta que la pasta espese. Dejar enfriar.","Para hacer la masa, tamiza la harina y la sal en un bol. Frote el ghee en la harina con las yemas de los dedos, luego agregue el azafrán y el agua de remojo seguido de suficiente agua fría (aproximadamente 100-125 ml) para hacer una masa suave, pero no pegajosa. Amasar en el bol hasta que quede suave, luego tapar y dejar reposar durante 30 minutos.","Amasar la masa durante 1 minuto y luego dividirla en nueve porciones de 40 g. Con las manos, forme con cada uno una bola de 4 cm de diámetro. De la misma forma, forma bolitas de 3 cm un poco más pequeñas con la pasta de lentejas.","Haga una hendidura en el medio de una de las bolas de masa con los dedos, presionándola para darle forma de cuenco. Coloque una de las bolas de lentejas en la cavidad y tire de la masa alrededor de ella, juntando los bordes para que la bola de lentejas quede completamente cerrada. Aplánelo hasta formar un disco de 2 cm de grosor y extiéndalo sobre una superficie ligeramente engrasada hasta formar un círculo de 17 cm de diámetro. Apunta al grosor de una moneda de £1.","Calienta una plancha o una sartén pesada a fuego medio y levanta con cuidado el disco sobre la plancha. Rocíe 1 cucharadita de ghee derretido alrededor de los bordes y cocine por un lado durante 2-3 minutos, hasta que comience a tomar color. Voltee usando una rodaja de pescado y vierta otras 1-2 cucharaditas de ghee derretido alrededor de los bordes. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos más hasta que esté dorado. Repite este proceso con las bolas de masa restantes. Sirva inmediatamente con un vaso de leche fría o masala chai."]','2026-01-11 12:59:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13813,4531,'es','Puris con patata masala (alu puri)','Intente preparar este plato tradicional indio: un almuerzo popular durante las festividades de Holi en primavera.','["500 g de patatas, Maris Piper o King Edwards, en cuartos","2 tomates, blanqueados, picados en trozos grandes","2 cebollas, picadas","4 dientes de ajo","4 cucharadas de aceite de girasol, más un poco más para enrollar","1½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","3 hojas de laurel indio (tez patta) o 4 cm de canela en rama","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","2 cucharadas de cilantro fresco picado","125 g de harina de chapati (chapati atta) o harina integral","125 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de sal fina","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol, más un poco más para freír"]','["Para hacer el alu masala, poner en una sartén las patatas con los tomates picados, la cebolla y el ajo. Vierta suficiente agua fría para cubrir las patatas 3 cm y hierva hasta que estén tiernas.","Saque las patatas y tritúrelas ligeramente con un tenedor; trate de mantener la textura áspera y con trozos. Cuela el líquido de cocción en una jarra, reservando tanto el líquido como la mezcla de cebolla que queda en el colador.","Calentar el aceite de awokor karahi a fuego medio y sofreír las semillas de comino y las hojas de laurel o canela durante unos segundos, hasta que el comino suelte su aroma.","Agrega la mezcla de cebolla reservada y continúa friendo durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que las cebollas se doren. Baja el fuego y agrega la cúrcuma, el chile en polvo y el cilantro molido y cocina por 1 min más, revolviendo todo el tiempo.","Agrega las patatas junto con el líquido de cocción reservado. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos, luego apague el fuego y agregue el cilantro picado. Tapa y deja que los sabores se infusionen mientras haces los puris.","Para hacer los puris, tamizamos las harinas y la sal en un bol. Incorpora el aceite a la harina con los dedos, luego agrega suficiente agua fría para hacer una masa muy firme. Amasar durante unos 5 minutos hasta que quede suave y luego formar una bola. Poner en un bol ligeramente engrasado, tapar y reservar durante al menos 30 minutos.","Amasar la masa nuevamente durante 1 minuto y luego dividirla en partes iguales en 20-22 bolas, cada una de aproximadamente 2,5 cm de diámetro. Aplana ligeramente la parte superior de cada bola y extiéndela sobre una superficie engrasada hasta formar discos de 11 cm de diámetro, aproximadamente del grosor de una moneda de 1 libra. Puedes darle la vuelta a la masa una o dos veces mientras la enrollas.","Llene un karahi o wok con aceite hasta que no esté más de dos tercios de su capacidad y caliéntelo a 180 ° C, o hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 30 segundos. Sumerja suavemente un puri en el aceite. Chisporroteará y subirá a la superficie en unos segundos. Presiona ligeramente la parte superior con una rodaja de pescado para que se hinche mientras se cocina. Freír durante 1 min, luego darle la vuelta y freír por el otro lado durante 1 min más. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y repetir con las bolas de masa restantes.","Para servir, caliente bien la papa masala y cómela con los puris al lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13814,4533,'es','Chole con arroz con comino y raita','Prepare un curry de garbanzos servido con raita para una excelente comida familiar económica. Además de rápido y fácil, también es saludable.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","4 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de jengibre finamente rallado","4 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 cucharaditas de curry en polvo","2 latas de garbanzos de 400 g","100 g de puré de tomate","30 g de cilantro fresco picado","300 g de arroz basmati","¼ de pepino","200 g de yogur estilo griego","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino, tostadas y trituradas","un puñado pequeño de menta fresca, picada","un puñado de semillas de granada, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y sofreír las cebollas a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que empiecen a dorarse. Agrega 3 cucharaditas de comino, jengibre, ajo y curry en polvo. Revuelve por un minuto para evitar que se quemen las especias.","Echar los garbanzos y el líquido de la lata, junto con el puré de tomate, 20g de cilantro y un poco de condimento. Cocine a fuego lento durante unos 10 minutos. Agrega un chorrito de agua si se ve demasiado seco.","Mientras tanto, enjuague y escurra el arroz, agregue la cucharadita restante de semillas de comino, 2 litros de agua hirviendo y el condimento. Cocine durante unos 10 minutos o hasta que el arroz esté tierno. Drenar.","Para la raita, ralla el pepino y revuélvelo con el yogur con el comino, la menta y el cilantro restante. Sazone, esparza las semillas de granada y sirva junto con el chole y el arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13815,7449,'es','Fritura de paneer y garbanzos','Disfrute de este fragante paneer y garbanzos fritos con guarnición de pepinillos encurtidos como parte de un festín de inspiración india.','["2 cucharadas de ghee (o use aceite de girasol o mantequilla)","250 g de paneer, picado","1 cebolla, rebanada","3 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","½ cucharadita de semillas de cardamomo","1 chile rojo, rebanado","5 hojas de curry","1 pimiento verde, cortado en trozos grandes","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","½ manojo de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","½ limón, exprimido","½ cebolla morada, rebanada"]','["Primero, haz el pepinillo. Combine el jugo de limón, la cebolla y una pizca de sal en un tazón pequeño. Dejar de lado.","Calienta la mitad del ghee en una sartén y fríe el paneer durante 10 minutos, revolviendo hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y crujiente por todos lados. Saque y coloque en un plato con una espumadera.","Calienta el resto del ghee en la sartén a fuego alto y fríe las cebollas durante 5 minutos hasta que empiecen a dorarse en los bordes. Añade el ajo, la cúrcuma, el chile en polvo, las semillas de cardamomo, el chile, las hojas de curry y la pimienta y sofríe durante 5 minutos hasta que las cebollas estén caramelizadas.","Regrese el paneer a la sartén junto con los garbanzos y un chorrito grande de agua, y cocine todo a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que el líquido se haya evaporado y la mezcla esté pegajosa. Sazone con sal, luego vierta en un plato y cubra con el cilantro y las cebollas encurtidas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13816,4068,'es','ghee','Prepara un poco de ghee casero para usarlo en tus platos favoritos. El ghee aporta riqueza y sabor mantecoso y se puede calentar a una temperatura alta sin quemarse.','["250 g de mantequilla sin sal"]','["Caliente la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña y resistente y cocine a fuego lento sin revolver durante 15 a 20 minutos, o hasta que los sólidos de la leche comiencen a dorarse y la mantequilla esté dorada. Apague el fuego y deje la sartén en reposo durante unos minutos.","Forre un colador de metal con muselina o papel de cocina fuerte y colóquelo sobre un recipiente resistente al calor. Vierta la mantequilla derretida, teniendo cuidado de dejar los sólidos de la leche dorada en la sartén. Déjelo gotear unos minutos en el recipiente y luego transfiéralo a un frasco. Debido a que el ghee no tiene humedad ni sólidos lácteos, se conservará hasta tres meses a temperatura ambiente, pero también se puede almacenar en el refrigerador para mayor longevidad."]','2026-01-11 12:59:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13817,6865,'es','La zanahoria no es buena.','Prepare un delicioso gajar halwa, un postre popular en el norte de la India. A menudo se sirve en Diwali para marcar el cambio de estaciones y tiene una textura casi blanda.','["500 g de zanahorias ralladas gruesas","8 vainas de cardamomo verde, perforadas con un cuchillo","500ml de leche entera","125 g de mantequilla sin sal","100 g de azúcar en polvo","25 g de uvas","25 g de almendras blanqueadas o pistachos picados, picados en trozos grandes"]','["Poner las zanahorias, las vainas de cardamomo perforadas y la leche en una cacerola de base pesada y llevar a ebullición. Reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 1 hora, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que la leche se haya evaporado.","Calienta la mantequilla en una sartén honda y sofríe la mezcla de zanahoria durante unos 15 a 20 minutos hasta que se oscurezca y pierda su aspecto húmedo y lechoso.","Agrega el azúcar, las pasas y las almendras o pistachos y sofríe el halwa durante otros 5 minutos. Sirva caliente. Se conservará tapado en el refrigerador hasta por una semana o en el congelador hasta por seis meses."]','2026-01-11 12:59:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13818,4072,'es','Salsa de dátiles y tamarindo (sonth)','Sirva esta salsa picante de dátiles y tamarindo con todo, desde samosas y pakoras hasta crujientes bocadillos callejeros y ensaladas.','["150 g de tamarindo húmedo, preferiblemente sin semillas","125 g de dátiles sin hueso","175 g de azúcar moreno, azúcar de palmera datilera o azúcar moscovado ligero","1 cucharadita de jengibre en polvo","½ cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharadita de comino molido"]','["Troceamos el tamarindo y los dátiles y los ponemos en una cacerola con el azúcar moreno y agua suficiente para cubrirlos, unos 500ml. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 20 minutos o hasta que el tamarindo esté muy suave.","Retire la sartén del fuego y pase la pulpa por un colador para eliminar las fibras. La salsa debe tener una consistencia de cobertura; agregue un poco de agua si está demasiado espesa.","Agrega el jengibre en polvo, el garam masala y el comino molido. La salsa debe tener un sabor dulce y agrio; agregue un poco más de azúcar moreno si no tiene un sabor lo suficientemente dulce. Enfríe antes de servir. Se conservará en el refrigerador durante tres o cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13819,7453,'es','Sémola punjabi halwa (suji halwa)','Sirve este postre indio en ocasiones especiales como Diwali. Con almendras, cardamomo y pasas, tiene un rico sabor mantecoso y aroma a sémola tostada.','["6 vainas de cardamomo verde","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","125 g de ghee","125 g de sémola, harina de chapati o harina integral","25 g de pasas remojadas en agua caliente","25 g de almendras cortadas en rodajas con piel"]','["Divida las vainas de cardamomo con un cuchillo afilado y retire las semillas. Muele las semillas hasta convertirlas en polvo con 1 cucharadita de azúcar usando un mortero y un mortero. Guarde las vainas vacías para el almíbar.","Calentar el azúcar restante en una cacerola a fuego medio con 600ml de agua hasta que se disuelva. Agregue las vainas de cardamomo vacías y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 5 minutos. Apagar el fuego, tapar la cacerola y reservar.","Calienta el ghee en un wok o karahi a fuego medio, luego agrega la sémola o la harina. Reduzca el fuego a bajo y cocine, revolviendo todo el tiempo, hasta que suelte un aroma tostado y adquiera un color dorado como una galleta, aproximadamente 10 minutos.","Retira la sartén del fuego. Deseche las vainas de cardamomo vacías del almíbar tibio y viértalas sobre la sémola en un chorro fino y constante, revolviendo todo el tiempo. Tenga cuidado, chisporroteará. Regrese la sartén a fuego medio y cocine, revolviendo constantemente, hasta que la sémola espese. Debe tener la consistencia de un puré de patatas cremoso. Agregue el cardamomo molido, las pasas escurridas y la mayoría de las almendras rebanadas. Sirva bien caliente con las almendras restantes esparcidas por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:59:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13820,7455,'es','Gallina de guinea asada al tandoori','Haz un asado diferente con esta gallina de guinea asada tandoori. Delicioso servido con panes planos y raita, disfrute de las sobras envueltas en pan naan.','["1 gallina de guinea","panes planos y raita, para servir (opcional)","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","5 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","1 limón, exprimido","1 cucharadita de pimentón","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","½ cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","150ml de yogur natural","100ml de nata doble","chorrito de jugo de limón"]','["Primero, haz la marinada. Combina todos los ingredientes con 1 cucharadita de sal y una cantidad generosa de pimienta negra recién molida. Coloque la gallina de Guinea en un tazón o recipiente grande y frote la marinada por todas partes, incluso debajo de la piel de la pechuga. Transfiera al refrigerador para marinar durante al menos 1 hora o hasta 24 horas.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Poner la pintada marinada en una fuente pequeña para asar y verter sobre el adobo sobrante. Vierta un vaso pequeño de agua en la lata alrededor de la gallina de Guinea y ase durante 50 minutos a 1 hora hasta que esté bien cocida y ligeramente carbonizada. Levante con cuidado la gallina de Guinea sobre una tabla, escurra el jugo de cocción de la cavidad en la lata y déjela reposar durante unos 10 minutos mientras prepara la salsa.","Añade un chorrito de agua a la fuente para asar. Si la lata es resistente al fuego, colóquela a fuego medio y déjela hervir a fuego lento. Si la lata no es resistente al fuego, coloque todo en una cacerola y cocine a fuego lento. Añade la nata y lleva a ebullición. Sazone al gusto, agregando un poco más de jugo de limón si es necesario. Vierta la salsa en un plato para servir o pásela por un colador a un plato si prefiere una salsa más suave. Cortar la pintada y servir con la salsa, unas tortas y raita, si se desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13821,5573,'es','Curry de pescado con coco y col rizada','Cocine por lotes este sencillo curry de col rizada, bacalao y langostinos y congélelo en porciones para las noches ocupadas. Con base de leche de coco y especias, está lleno de sabor.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla, rebanada","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, cortado en palitos","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","3-4 cucharadas de pasta de curry suave (Keralan funciona bien)","150 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","150 g de col rizada picada","1 chile rojo, cortado a la mitad","325 ml de leche de coco desnatada","300ml de caldo bajo en sal","250 g de arroz integral","100 g de langostinos congelados","2 filetes de bacalao, cortados en trozos","2 limas, exprimidas","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado","un puñado de hojuelas de coco tostado (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cazuela. Cuece la cebolla con una pizca de sal durante 10 minutos hasta que empiece a caramalizarse. Agregue el jengibre, la cúrcuma y la pasta de curry y cocine durante 2 minutos.","Agrega los tomates, la col rizada y la guindilla y vierte la leche de coco y el caldo. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 a 15 minutos o hasta que los tomates comiencen a ablandarse. Saque el chile y deséchelo.","Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Revuelva suavemente las gambas y el bacalao con el curry y luego cocine durante otros 3-5 minutos. Exprima sobre la lima y revuelva con la mitad del cilantro. Para servir, esparza el cilantro restante y las hojuelas de coco, si lo desea. Servir con el arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13822,7457,'es','Bethrot Birian del tramposo','Cocine este biriyani de remolacha y congele las sobras para las noches ocupadas. Con la colorida remolacha como protagonista, está llena de especias y es un plato sabroso.','["3 remolachas crudas grandes (500 g sin preparar), peladas y cortadas en cubos de 2 cm","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla grande, finamente cortada","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","2 dientes de ajo pequeños, machacados","1 hoja de laurel","4 vainas de cardamomo","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma","2 cucharadas de garam masala","250 g de arroz basmati, enjuagado","500 ml de caldo de verduras bajo en sal","100 ml de yogur sin grasa","manojo pequeño de cilantro","tu chutney o pepinillo favorito, para servir (opcional)"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle la remolacha con la mitad del aceite y un poco de condimento, luego viértala en una fuente para asar y cocine durante 25-30 minutos, revolviendo a la mitad, hasta que esté tierna.","Mientras tanto, caliente el aceite restante en una cacerola grande y poco profunda o en una sartén apta para horno. Freír la cebolla a fuego medio durante 10 minutos hasta que esté dorada. Agrega el jengibre y la mitad del ajo y cocina por 1 min. Revuelva con el laurel, las vainas de cardamomo, la cúrcuma y el garam masala, luego cocine por 2 minutos. Agrega el arroz y la remolacha y luego sazona. Verter el caldo y llevar a ebullición.","Mételo en el horno sin tapar y cocina durante 20-25 minutos hasta que el arroz esté bien cocido. Revuelve cuando esté fuera del horno.","Pon el yogur, el cilantro y el ajo restante en un procesador de alimentos y bate hasta que quede suave. Sazone al gusto. Sirve el biriyani con el yogur de cilantro y el pepinillo."]','2026-01-11 12:59:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13823,7459,'es','Pollo asado y arroz especiado','Prepare este saludable pollo horneado en bandeja para la familia, ligeramente condimentado con un poco de pasta de curry, en solo 15 minutos de preparación. El chutney de mango añade un sabor afrutado','["1 cubito de caldo de pollo","4 cucharadas de pasta de curry suave o mediana (nosotros usamos korma)","2 cucharadas de mantequilla o aceite, más extra para freír","350 g de arroz basmati","1 rama de canela","6-8 muslos de pollo, con hueso y con piel","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","20 g de almendras tostadas","350 g de judías verdes","un puñado de hojas de cilantro","chutney de mango, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta 800 ml de agua recién hervida en una jarra resistente al calor, desmenuce la pastilla de caldo y revuelva junto con la mitad de la pasta de curry y la mantequilla o el aceite. Vierta la mezcla en una fuente para hornear grande o en una fuente para asar (la nuestra era de 25 x 35 cm y 5 cm de profundidad) y vierta el arroz y la rama de canela. Sazone y revuelva bien.","Haga algunos cortes profundos en cada muslo de pollo y luego frótelo con el resto de la pasta de curry y un poco de condimento. Colóquelo encima de la mezcla de arroz, luego cubra el plato o lata con papel de aluminio y hornee por 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, calienta un chorrito de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofríe la cebolla durante 10-15 minutos, o hasta que esté blanda y caramelizada.","Destapa el pollo y el arroz. El arroz aún debe estar húmedo, si no, rellenar con 50-100ml más de agua. Esparza las almendras y hornee, sin tapar, durante 10 a 15 minutos más hasta que el pollo se dore, se haya absorbido todo el líquido y el arroz esté bien cocido y crujiente en los bordes. Mientras tanto, cocine las judías verdes en agua hirviendo durante 2-3 minutos y luego escúrralas. Esparza el cilantro y las cebollas fritas sobre el pollo y el arroz, vierta unas cucharadas de chutney sobre el plato y sirva con las judías verdes."]','2026-01-11 12:59:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13824,4104,'es','Curry de gambas y berenjenas','Disfrute de este vibrante curry de gambas y berenjenas con panes planos para una comida rápida y fácil para dos entre semana. Es ideal en noches ocupadas cuando tienes poco tiempo.','["1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","1 berenjena, cortada en trozos de 1 cm","1-2 chiles rojos o verdes, en rodajas","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry o tomates picados","150 g de gambas crudas","2 cucharadas de yogur de coco sin lácteos","1 lima, exprimida","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro picado","2 rotis o panes planos, calentados"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén honda a fuego medio-alto y sofreír las berenjenas con una pizca de sal durante 5 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente doradas. Agregue el chile, el jengibre, la cúrcuma y el comino, cocine por un minuto más y luego vierta los tomates cherry. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que espese.","Agregue las gambas y cocine a fuego lento durante 2-4 minutos hasta que estén rosadas. Retire del fuego, agregue el yogur de coco, el jugo de lima y el cilantro, luego sirva con los rotis calientes."]','2026-01-11 12:59:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13825,7461,'es','Pilaf fácil de salchicha y calabacín','Prepara este rápido plato de salchicha, calabacín y arroz en sólo 20 minutos. Lleno de sabor, es ideal para cuando quieres algo rápido y fácil.','["100 g de arroz basmati","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","3 salchichas, la carne exprimida de la piel","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo, semillas de cebolla negra o semillas de cilantro trituradas","1 calabacín, cortado en medias lunas","100 g de guisantes congelados","200 ml de caldo de verduras","½ manojo pequeño de menta, con las hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de yogur sin grasa"]','["Enjuague el arroz un par de veces hasta que el agua salga clara y luego déjelo en remojo. Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana con tapa hermética y fríe la carne de la salchicha durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y dorada. Agrega las semillas y el calabacín y sofríe durante 2 minutos más a fuego alto para que se evapore el agua del calabacín.","Agregue el arroz escurrido, los guisantes, el caldo y la mitad de las hierbas picadas. Llevar a fuego lento, luego reducir el fuego a bajo y cubrir con una tapa. Cocine durante 10-12 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno.","Incorpora la mayoría de las hierbas restantes al arroz. Sirva con un poco de las hierbas restantes encima y el yogur a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13826,6267,'es','Paneer jalfrezi con arroz con comino','Dale sabor a tu semana con este curry vegetal satisfactorio, saludable y bajo en calorías. Aporta calcio, hierro, vitamina C y fibra, además de tres de tus 5 al día.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza prensado en frío","1 cebolla grande y 1 mediana, la grande finamente picada y la mediana cortada en gajos","2 dientes de ajo grandes, picados","50 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de caldo de verduras en polvo","135 g de paneer, picado","2 pimientos grandes, sin semillas y picados","1 chile rojo o verde, sin semillas y en rodajas","25 g de cilantro picado","260 g de arroz basmati integral","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino"]','["Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande y fríe la cebolla picada, el ajo y la mitad del jengibre durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el cilantro molido y las semillas de comino y cocina por 1 minuto más, luego agrega los tomates, media lata de agua y el caldo. Mezcle todo con una batidora hasta que quede muy suave y luego cocine a fuego lento. Tape y cocine por 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, cocine el arroz y las semillas de comino en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 25 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos.","Calentar el aceite restante en un wok antiadherente y freír el paneer hasta que tenga un color claro. Retirar de la sartén y reservar. Agregue los pimientos, las rodajas de cebolla y el chile a la sartén y saltee hasta que las verduras estén tiernas, pero aún conserven algo de sabor. Mezcle las verduras salteadas y el paneer con la salsa con el cilantro picado y luego sirva con el arroz. Si sigue nuestro plan de dieta saludable, coma dos porciones de curry y arroz y luego enfríe el resto para otro día. Se conservará hasta tres días, tapado, en el frigorífico. Para servir la segunda noche, recaliente las porciones sobrantes en el microondas hasta que estén bien calientes."]','2026-01-11 12:59:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13827,7463,'es','Jalfrezi de cordero con arroz al comino','Satisfaga sus antojos de curry con esta versión saludable de una popular comida para llevar, servida con arroz integral. Incluye tres de tus 5 al día junto con hierro, vitamina C y fibra.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza prensado en frío","600 g de filete de pierna de cordero magro, sin toda la grasa visible y cortado en cubitos","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo grandes, picados","50 g de jengibre rallado","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 pimientos grandes, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","1 cebolla mediana, cortada en gajos","1 chile rojo o verde, sin semillas y en rodajas","25 g de cilantro fresco picado","250 g de arroz basmati integral","1-2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino"]','["Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande y ancha y fríe el cordero durante unos 4 minutos, revolviendo hasta que se dore. Sacar de la sartén y reservar.","Agrega la cebolla picada, el ajo y la mitad del jengibre rallado a la sartén y sofríe durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Si las cebollas empiezan a prenderse, añade un chorrito de agua. Agrega las especias y cocina por un minuto más. Vierta los tomates y media lata de agua junto con el caldo, luego mezcle todo en la sartén con una batidora de mano hasta que quede muy suave. Agregue el cordero, luego cubra y cocine a fuego medio-bajo durante 25 minutos hasta que esté tierno.","Mientras tanto, hierva el arroz con las semillas de comino en una cacerola con agua durante 25 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Drenar.","Calienta el aceite restante en un wok antiadherente. Añade los pimientos, los gajos de cebolla, la guindilla y el jengibre restante y sofríe todo junto durante unos 5 minutos o hasta que esté tierno, pero aún con un poco de sabor. Agrega el curry con el cilantro y sirve con el arroz. Si sigue nuestro plan de dieta saludable, coma dos porciones de curry y arroz ahora y luego enfríe el resto para otro día. Para servir la segunda noche, simplemente recaliente porciones en el microondas en platos."]','2026-01-11 12:59:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13828,7465,'es','Baath na bhajia (pakoras de arroz)','Disfrute de estas deliciosas pakoras de arroz como entrante en un festín indio o solas como refrigerio. Sirva en una fuente para compartir con abundante salsa de tomate para mojar.','["400 g de arroz basmati cocido","1 cebolla morada mediana, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","2-3 chiles verdes, finamente picados","1½ cucharadita de azúcar","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","150 gramos de harina","3 cucharadas de yogur natural","manojo grande de cilantro, finamente picado","aceite vegetal o de girasol, para freír","salsa de tomate, para servir"]','["Mezcle el arroz cocido, la cebolla, el ajo, los chiles, el azúcar, la cúrcuma, la harina y el yogur en un tazón grande. Agrega el cilantro, 1-1½ cucharadita de sal (al gusto) y 100 ml de agua, luego deja reposar la mezcla durante 15 minutos.","Calienta una sartén honda con no más de dos tercios de su capacidad de aceite a 180 °C. Si no tienes un termómetro, echa una cucharada pequeña de la mezcla en el aceite; estará lista cuando se dore en 1 minuto. Coloque cucharaditas colmadas de la mezcla en el aceite en tandas y cocine durante 2-3 minutos, o hasta que estén uniformemente dorados y crujientes. Transfiera a papel de cocina para escurrir.","Vierta en un plato y sirva con abundante salsa de tomate para mojar."]','2026-01-11 12:59:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13829,7467,'es','Curry de ternera en olla a presión','Prepare este curry de carne en una olla a presión para una comida fácil entre semana. Sirva con arroz o pan naan para absorber los jugos.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","500 g de filete de ternera, para guisar o estofar","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","¼ cucharadita de chile picante en polvo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","3 vainas de cardamomo, trituradas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","500 ml de caldo de carne","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","2 cucharadas de crema doble (opcional)","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","pan naan o arroz, para servir"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una olla a presión. Sazone la carne y fríala en tandas durante 5 a 8 minutos, volteándola ocasionalmente hasta que se dore uniformemente. Reservar en un plato.","Calentar el resto del aceite y la mantequilla en una sartén y sofreír la cebolla a fuego lento durante 10 minutos o hasta que esté dorada y caramelizada. Agrega el ajo, el jengibre, la guindilla, la cúrcuma, el cilantro y el cardamomo y sofríe durante 2 minutos. Agregue la carne y cocine durante 1 minuto para cubrir la carne con las especias.","Vierta los tomates, el caldo y el azúcar y cocine a fuego lento. Cierra la tapa de la olla y aumenta la presión. Cocine por 15 minutos, luego apague el fuego y deje que la presión baje naturalmente. Revuelve bien todo y agrega más agua si la salsa ya está espesa.","Vuelva a cerrar la tapa en su lugar y espere otros 10 minutos, luego deje que la presión baje naturalmente. Compruebe que la carne esté tierna; dependiendo del corte, es posible que necesite 5 minutos más.","Retírelo del fuego, revuelva con el garam masala y la crema, si lo desea. Sazone al gusto. Esparce el cilantro y sirve con pan naan o arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13830,7469,'es','curry de ternera','Prepare nuestro sencillo curry de carne y sírvalo con un trozo de pan naan para absorber los deliciosos jugos. Si lo prefieres menos picante, simplemente agrega menos chile en polvo.','["2 cucharadas de aceite","500 g de filete para estofar cortado en cubitos","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","¼ cucharadita de chile picante en polvo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","3 vainas de cardamomo, trituradas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","300 ml de caldo de carne","1 cucharadita de azúcar","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","2 cucharadas de crema doble (opcional)","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","pan naan o arroz, para servir"]','["Calienta una cucharada de aceite en una cacerola a fuego medio-alto. Sazone la carne y fríala en la olla durante 5 a 8 minutos, volteándola con unas pinzas hasta la mitad hasta que se dore uniformemente. Reservar en un plato.","Calienta el resto del aceite y la mantequilla en una sartén y agrega las cebollas. Freír a fuego lento durante 15 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y caramelizados. Agrega el ajo, el jengibre, la guindilla, la cúrcuma, el cilantro molido y el cardamomo y sofríe durante dos minutos. Vierta los tomates, el caldo y el azúcar y cocine a fuego lento.","Agrega la carne, tapa el curry y cocina a fuego lento durante 1 ½ – 2 horas o hasta que la carne esté tierna y se deshaga. Retire la tapa durante los últimos 20 minutos de cocción.","Agregue el garam masala y la crema (si se usa) y sazone al gusto. Esparza el cilantro y sirva con pan naan o arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13831,7471,'es','Curry de berenjena especiado de las Indias Occidentales','Aprovecha al máximo las berenjenas con este curry vegano. Bajo en grasa pero lleno de sabor, puedes servirlo con arroz o roti.','["1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 berenjena grande","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","½ chile verde, finamente picado","1 cm de jengibre, pelado y finamente picado","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","½-1 cucharada de aceite de colza","3 cebolletas, picadas","½ manojo de cilantro rallado","arroz cocido, yogur natural, roti y gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Mezcle las especias secas y 1 cucharadita de sal en un bol y reserve.","Cortar la berenjena en rodajas de 1 cm y luego marcar ambos lados de cada ronda con la punta de un cuchillo afilado. Frote con la mezcla de especias hasta que esté bien cubierto (debe usar toda la mezcla), luego transfiéralo a una tabla. Ponga 150 ml de agua en el recipiente de especias vacío con el puré de tomate, la guindilla, el jengibre y el azúcar. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio y coloca las berenjenas en la sartén, superponiendo las rodajas si es necesario. Freír durante 5 minutos por cada lado o hasta que estén dorados. Añade la mezcla líquida del bol, lleva a fuego lento, tapa y cocina durante 15-20 minutos, volteando la berenjena de vez en cuando hasta que esté bien cocida. Si parece seco, es posible que tengas que añadir hasta 100 ml más de agua para que quede más picante. Estación.","Esparza las cebolletas y el cilantro y sirva con arroz, yogur, roti y rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13832,4151,'es','Sobras de cordero al curry','Aprovecha al máximo las sobras de cordero asado con este sabroso curry de cordero sobrante. Sirva con pan naan y arroz basmati para un festín indio.','["2 cebollas, picadas en trozos grandes","1 diente de ajo grande, picado","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y picado","2 cucharadas de aceite","4 cucharadas de pasta de curry mediana","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 chile rojo, cortado por la mitad y sin semillas","1 rama de canela","200 ml de caldo de cordero","500-700 g de sobras de cordero asado, picado en trozos grandes","1 manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","arroz basmati cocido, pan naan y yogur natural, para servir"]','["Batir la cebolla, el ajo, el jengibre y 200 ml de agua en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener una pasta suave.","Calentar el aceite en una cazuela y sofreír la mezcla de cebolla durante 10-15 minutos o hasta que se haya absorbido todo el líquido y la cebolla empiece a dorarse. Agrega la pasta de curry y sofríe 1 min más. Agrega los tomates, la canela y el chile. Vierta el caldo y deje hervir a fuego lento. Agrega el cordero y cocina tapado durante 1 hora.","Retire la tapa y cocine a fuego lento sin tapar durante 15 minutos para que se reduzca un poco. Sazone al gusto y revuelva con el cilantro. Sirva con arroz basmati esponjoso, pan naan y yogur."]','2026-01-11 12:59:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13833,4171,'es','tortilla de patatas bombay','Disfrute del sabor con esta frittata de inspiración india. Perfecto para un almuerzo saludable, es bajo en calorías y grasas y lleno de nutrientes.','["4 patatas nuevas, cortadas en rodajas de 5 mm","100 g de espinacas tiernas picadas","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","1 diente de ajo grande, finamente rallado","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de comino molido","¼ cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma","3 tomates, picados en trozos grandes","2 huevos grandes","½ chile verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 manojo pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 cucharada de chutney de mango","3 cucharadas de yogur griego sin grasa"]','["Cocine las patatas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 6 minutos o hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor. Mientras tanto, ponga las espinacas en un recipiente resistente al calor con 1 cucharada de agua. Cubra y cocine en el microondas durante 3 minutos a temperatura alta o hasta que se ablanden.","Calienta el aceite de colza en una sartén antiadherente mediana. Agrega la cebolla y cocina a fuego medio durante 10 minutos hasta que esté dorada y pegajosa. Agregue el ajo, el cilantro molido, el comino molido, las semillas de mostaza y la cúrcuma y cocine por 1 minuto más. Añade los tomates y las espinacas marchitas y cocina durante 3 minutos más, luego añade las patatas.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio. Batir ligeramente los huevos con la guindilla y la mayor parte del cilantro fresco y verter sobre la mezcla de patatas. Ase durante 4-5 minutos, o hasta que esté dorado y recién cuajado, con una ligera oscilación en el medio.","Deje enfriar y luego córtelo en gajos. Mezcle el chutney de mango, el yogur y el cilantro fresco restante. Sirva con los trozos de frittata."]','2026-01-11 12:59:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13834,7473,'es','Siguiente nivel dhal makhani','No pongas excusas por lo rico que es este delicioso dhal negro: este plato de lentejas con mantequilla está pensado para disfrutarlo como un reconfortante plato de celebración.','["200 g de urad dhal entero (también llamados frijoles urad, urid dhal o lentejas negras)","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, ⅓ en rodajas finas, ⅓ rallado y ⅓ cortado en palitos finos","2 chiles verdes, 1 entero, 1 picado","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","100 g de mantequilla","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 cucharadas de hojas secas de fenogreco","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","5 dientes de ajo machacados","100 g de puré de tomate","Lata de 400 g de frijoles rojos, sin escurrir","¼ cucharadita de garam marsala","50ml de nata doble"]','["Coloque el dhal en un colador y enjuáguelo con agua fría varias veces hasta que el agua salga limpia. Poner en un tazón u olla grande y cubrir con el doble de su volumen de agua tibia. Agrega el bicarbonato de sodio y déjalo en remojo a temperatura ambiente durante al menos 12 horas.","Escurrir el dhal (pero no enjuagar), verter en una cacerola y cubrir con 1,5 litros de agua. Agregue el jengibre en rodajas, la guindilla entera y la cúrcuma, luego deje hervir, retire la espuma que suba a la superficie y reduzca el fuego. Cocine a fuego lento durante 1 hora hasta que esté muy tierno, o cocine en una olla a presión durante 20 minutos. Retire el jengibre y la guindilla.","Calienta la mantequilla en una sartén aparte a fuego medio-alto hasta que forme espuma y adquiera un color marrón nuez. Vierta la mitad en un recipiente pequeño y reserve. Regrese la sartén y el resto de la mantequilla al fuego y agregue las semillas de comino, las hojas de fenogreco, el cilantro molido, el ajo, el jengibre rallado y el puré de tomate y cocine por 2 minutos más. Agrega la mezcla de especias al dhal cocido, luego agrega los frijoles junto con el líquido de la lata.","Triture aproximadamente la mezcla de dhal con un machacador de papas hasta que algunas de las legumbres estén trituradas. Cocine, revolviendo, a fuego muy lento durante 15-20 minutos hasta que el dhal esté espeso y cremoso. Revuelva con la mayor parte de la mantequilla marrón reservada, el garam marsala y la mitad de la crema. Coloque el dhal en una fuente para servir y rocíe sobre la crema restante y la mantequilla dorada. Esparza sobre las cerillas de jengibre y chile picado y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:59:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13835,7475,'es','paneer korma','Cocina esta receta inspirada en saag paneer en solo 30 minutos. Es un curry de verduras sabroso y embriagador con jengibre fresco y cardamomo. Servir con arroz o pan naan.','["3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","225 g de bloque de paneer, cortado en cubos de 2 cm","1 cebolla grande, picada en trozos grandes","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado","2 dientes de ajo grandes","5 cucharadas de pasta korma","3 vainas de cardamomo, trituradas","70 g de almendras molidas","500 ml de caldo de verduras","150 g de espinacas","100 g de yogur griego","arroz o pan naan, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén profunda a fuego medio-alto. Agregue los cubos de paneer y fríalos durante 5 minutos, volteándolos regularmente, para que cada lado esté dorado. Retirar con unas pinzas y poner en un plato forrado con papel de cocina.","Pon la cebolla, el jengibre y el ajo en un procesador de alimentos con un chorrito de agua y tritura hasta que quede completamente suave. Calienta el aceite restante en la sartén a fuego medio-bajo. Agrega la mezcla de cebolla y una pizca de sal y sofríe durante 10 minutos o hasta que estén ligeramente doradas. Añade la pasta de korma y el cardamomo y sofríe durante 1 min. Agregue las almendras molidas y fríalas durante 1 minuto para hacer una pasta espesa.","Agregue el caldo, cocine a fuego lento y cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos, sin tapar, o hasta que se reduzca un poco. Agrega las espinacas a la salsa y cocina por 5 minutos. Agregue el yogur y el paneer y sazone generosamente. Sirva con arroz o pan naan caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13836,7477,'es','Brócoli especiado, paneer y guisantes con anacardos garam masala','Sirva este plato de brócoli y paneer sutilmente condimentado con pan naan o rotis. Un plato principal sin carne y lleno de verduras, perfecto para el viernes por la noche','["2 cucharadas de aceite de maní","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharada de garam masala, más 1 cucharadita adicional","225 g de paneer en bloque, cortado en cubos de 2 cm","manojo pequeño de cilantro picado","100 g de yogur natural sin grasa","50 g de anacardos","1 cabeza grande de brócoli, cortada en floretes y el tallo cortado en trozos de 2 cm","400 g de coles de Bruselas, partidas por la mitad o en cuartos","250 g de guisantes descongelados","1 lima, en jugo, más gajos para servir","chutney de mango y pan naan o rotis, calentados, para servir"]','["Batir 1 cucharada de aceite con el jengibre, el ajo, el comino, la cúrcuma, 1 cucharada de garam masala y un poco de condimento en un bol. Agregue el paneer y agregue la mezcla para cubrirlo, luego déjelo marinar en el refrigerador durante al menos 2 horas o toda la noche.","Licua el cilantro y el yogur con una batidora de mano o en un procesador de alimentos pequeño con una pizca de sal hasta obtener una salsa verde. Reservar en el frigorífico para servir más tarde.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio. Coloque los anacardos en una bandeja para hornear poco profunda y luego mezcle con 1 cucharadita de garam masala y ½ cucharadita de sal marina. Ase durante 2 minutos hasta que esté tostado y dorado, revolviendo nuevamente a la mitad. Vierta en un tazón y reserve.","Mezcle el brócoli y los brotes con el aceite restante. Sazone y extiéndalo en la bandeja que usó para los anacardos y cocine a la parrilla durante 10 minutos hasta que comience a estar tierno, revolviendo a la mitad. Mezcle el paneer junto con su marinada y cocine nuevamente durante 10 minutos, hasta que esté dorado y ligeramente carbonizado. Esparcir los guisantes y mezclar todo bien. Caliente durante 1-2 minutos debajo de la parrilla (no lo deje por mucho tiempo o los guisantes se arrugarán).","Distribuya sobre los anacardos condimentados y luego exprima sobre el jugo de lima. Rocíe con el aderezo de yogur y sirva con chutney, pan naan o rotis y rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13837,7479,'es','Pollo asado Kolhapuri (pollo asado kala masala)','Este pollo asado indio con especias es una excelente alternativa al tradicional asado dominical. Pruebe con gajos de batata con pimienta negra y ajo.','["1 pollo entero (aproximadamente 1,4 kg)","50 ml de aceite de colza, más un poco más para la lata, si es necesario","100 g de yogur colado","gajos de lima, para servir","1 cucharada de pasta de ajo","1 cucharada de pasta de jengibre","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 lima, exprimida","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal, para freír","1 chile rojo seco entero pequeño","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra","½ ramita de canela pequeña","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharadita de macis","1 cucharadita de clavo entero","1 vaina de cardamomo negro, sin semillas","1 cucharadita de semillas de alcaravea","1 hoja de laurel","1 anís estrellado pequeño","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada rallada","2 vainas de cardamomo verde, sin semillas","½ cucharadita de granos de pimienta de Sichuan"]','["Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la marinada con 1 cucharadita de sal, frote todo el pollo para cubrirlo y luego enfríe durante al menos 4 horas o hasta 24 horas.","Para hacer la mezcla de especias, calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y agrega todas las especias. Freír durante 3-5 minutos hasta que huela a tostado, luego escurrir a través de un colador y enfriar, desechando el aceite. Muela hasta obtener un polvo fino en una licuadora de especias o con un mortero y guárdelo en un frasco hermético.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel de aluminio o engrasar ligeramente una fuente para asar. Seque el pollo con papel de cocina, retirando el exceso de marinada. Mezcle el yogur, el aceite y toda la mezcla de especias y luego frótelo sobre el pollo y debajo de la piel. No te preocupes si la mezcla se parte un poco.","Poner el pollo, con la pechuga hacia arriba, en la bandeja o en la lata. Ase durante 1 h 30-1 h 40 min, rociando a mitad del tiempo de cocción y cubriendo con papel de aluminio si se oscurece demasiado, hasta que los jugos salgan claros cuando se pincha un muslo con una brocheta.","Retirar del horno, cubrir con papel aluminio y dejar reposar 10 minutos antes de servir. Rocíe con el jugo de la sartén y sirva con rodajas de lima y rodajas de camote, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 12:59:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13838,7481,'es','Aloo masala del sur de la India (relleno de dosa)','Disfrute de estas patatas indias picantes como relleno de dosa (panqueques hechos con harina de arroz) para una reconfortante cena vegana, o sírvalas como guarnición.','["4 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza","10-15 hojas de curry","¼ cucharadita de asafétida","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","1 cucharada colmada de puré de tomate","3 cucharaditas de sambar masala mezcladas con ¼ de taza de agua","4 patatas grandes, hervidas y cortadas en trozos pequeños","un puñado de cilantro fresco, finamente picado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio. Freír las semillas de mostaza, las hojas de curry y la asafétida hasta que empiecen a crujir, luego añadir las cebollas. Cocine durante 3-4 minutos hasta que las cebollas estén ligeramente doradas.","Agrega el puré de tomate junto con el sambar masala diluido. Agregue las patatas, 1¼ cucharadita de sal y mezcle bien. Triture ligeramente las patatas con una cuchara de madera y cocine durante 3-4 minutos más. Gusto por sazonar. Sirva adornado con el cilantro."]','2026-01-11 12:59:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13839,7483,'es','dosa','Haz tu propia dosa: panqueques de arroz indio hechos con masa fermentada. Requieren un poco de esfuerzo, pero son deliciosos si se sirven con aloo masala y otros rellenos.','["50 g de lentejas urad partidas y lavadas","1 cucharada de channa dal / gramo de bengala","190 g de arroz basmati","1 cucharada de semillas de fenogreco (opcional)","aceite vegetal, para freír"]','["Lavar todos los ingredientes, excepto el aceite, tres o cuatro veces y escurrir. Dejar en remojo en agua fría en un bol durante la noche.","Escurre el agua de los ingredientes, pero guárdala y reserva. Transfiera los ingredientes remojados a un procesador de alimentos y muela hasta obtener una pasta suave. Asegúrate de que la masa no luzca granulada; puedes usar un poco de agua de remojo si es necesario. Debe quedar como una masa espesa y suave para panqueques y debe cubrir el dorso de una cuchara. Vacíe en un tazón grande y cubra. Manténgalo en un lugar cálido durante la noche para permitir que la masa fermente (consulte el consejo a continuación). Habrá duplicado su cantidad y tendrá un aspecto burbujeante. Si no vas a usar la masa de inmediato, déjala enfriar para más tarde. Se conservará hasta cinco días.","Revuelve muy suavemente la masa. Su consistencia se habrá espesado, por lo que puedes agregar un poco de agua para darle una consistencia espesa pero que se pueda verter.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio o bajo durante 5 minutos. Rocíe unas gotas de aceite y luego limpie la sartén con papel de cocina para eliminar el exceso de aceite.","Espolvorea un puñado de agua sobre la sartén caliente para enfriarla y luego sécala con un poco de papel de cocina. Vierta un cucharón de masa de dosa en el medio de la sartén. Usando la parte inferior del cucharón, muévalo rápidamente con un movimiento circular, permitiendo que la masa se extienda hacia afuera desde el centro hacia el borde del molde, para formar un panqueque redondo y delgado.","Rocíe unas gotas de aceite por toda la dosa y aumente la temperatura a fuego alto. Cuando se dore ligeramente y los bordes comiencen a levantarse, agregue cualquier relleno (como el relleno de papa dosa masala) en el medio. Continúe cocinando hasta que la parte inferior se vea completamente dorada y crujiente. Use una espátula plana para aflojar los bordes, luego enrolle el relleno de papa y colóquelo en un plato.","Antes de hacer la siguiente dosa, baje la temperatura de la sartén a fuego medio y repita los pasos anteriores."]','2026-01-11 12:59:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13840,5509,'es','tikka masala saludable','Disfrute de los ricos y picantes sabores del tikka masala con esta versión más ligera para toda la familia, saludable y sin gluten. Es un placer para el público garantizado','["1 cebolla grande, picada","4 dientes de ajo grandes","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","4 pechugas de pollo pequeñas sin piel, cortadas en trozos","2 cucharadas de especias tikka en polvo","1 cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","40 g de almendras molidas","200 g de espinacas","3 cucharadas de yogur natural sin grasa","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro picado","arroz basmati integral, para servir"]','["Coloque la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola ignífuga a fuego medio. Agrega la mezcla de cebolla y sofríe por 15 minutos. Vierta en un bol y limpie la sartén.","Agrega el aceite restante y el pollo y fríe durante 5-7 minutos, o hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Agregue la especia tikka y la cayena y fríalos por un minuto más. Vuelva a colocar la mezcla de cebolla en la sartén, junto con los tomates y 1 lata llena de agua. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir a fuego lento y cocinar, sin tapar, durante 15 minutos. Agregue las almendras y las espinacas y cocine por 10 minutos más. Sazone y luego revuelva con el yogur y el cilantro. Servir con arroz integral."]','2026-01-11 12:59:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13841,7485,'es','Gambas coronación sobre naan tostado','Cree una cena rápida y llena de sabor con langostinos al curry y garbanzos servidos sobre naan con ajo. Puedes hacerlo en solo 11 minutos, por lo que es perfecto para días ajetreados.','["2 cucharaditas de curry suave en polvo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos","60 g de langostinos cocidos","2 cucharadas de yogur griego sin grasa","1 cucharada de mayonesa","1 cucharada de chutney de mango","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado","1⁄2 pan naan grande con ajo","15 g de almendras laminadas, tostadas"]','["Calienta una sartén pequeña a fuego alto, agrega el curry en polvo y la cúrcuma y tuesta durante 1 min. Enjuague los garbanzos con agua fría y luego séquelos con papel de cocina. Poner en un bol con las gambas, el yogur, la mayonesa, el chutney de mango, las especias tostadas y el cilantro. Mezclar todo hasta que esté bien combinado y sazonar al gusto.","Corta el pan naan por la mitad y tuéstalo en una tostadora o debajo de una parrilla durante 1-2 minutos. Cubra con la mezcla de gambas y garbanzos, luego termine con las almendras laminadas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13842,6486,'es','Cansado especiado y dulce','Lassi es una refrescante bebida india sin alcohol, ideal para acompañar cualquier menú de cena india.','["yogur bajo en grasa","agua","unas semillas de comino tostadas","un poco de cilantro fresco picado","azúcar, al gusto","unas gotas de agua de rosas, al gusto"]','["Para el lassi especiado, bata cantidades iguales de yogur bajo en grasa con agua usando un batidor de globo para crear una espuma espumosa, luego sirva espolvoreado con unas semillas de comino tostadas y un poco de cilantro fresco picado. Para una versión dulce, bate el yogur y el agua con un poco de azúcar al gusto y unas gotas de agua de rosas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13843,7491,'es','Korma cremoso de verduras','Cremoso y saludable: una combinación ganadora para este curry, que se puede adaptar fácilmente para toda la familia si algunos quieren añadirle carne.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, finamente picada","3 vainas de cardamomo, machacadas","2 cucharaditas de comino molido y cilantro","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 chile verde, sin semillas (si se desea) y finamente picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente picado","800 g de verduras mixtas, como zanahoria, coliflor, patata y calabacín, picadas","300-500 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","200 g de guisantes congelados","200ml de yogur","2 cucharadas de almendras molidas (opcional)","½ pechuga de pollo cruda pequeña por porción","almendras laminadas tostadas, cilantro picado, arroz basmati o pan naan"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. cocinar cebolla\r\ncon las especias secas a fuego lento durante\r\n5-6 minutos hasta que la cebolla esté ligeramente dorada.\r\nAgrega la guindilla, el ajo y el jengibre y cocina.\r\ndurante 1 min, luego agregue la mezcla\r\nverduras y cocine por 5 minutos más.","Divida la mezcla adecuadamente.\r\nentre dos sartenes si sirve a vegetarianos\r\ny consumidores de carne. Picar el pollo en\r\ntrozos pequeños y revuelva en una sartén. Añadir\r\nel caldo, repartiendo entre las cacerolas\r\napropiadamente y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos (si solo cocina la versión vegetariana en una sartén, use 300 ml de caldo; si divide entre dos sartenes, agregue 250 ml a cada una).\r\nDivida los guisantes, si es necesario, y agregue,\r\ncocinar por 3 minutos más hasta que las verduras estén\r\ntierno y el pollo bien cocido.","Retirar del fuego y revolver.\r\nel yogur y las almendras molidas, si se usan.\r\nServir espolvoreado con las almendras tostadas.\r\ny cilantro, con arroz basmati o naan\r\npan al lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13844,7493,'es','paneer especiado','El paneer de queso indio es un excelente plato vegetariano, ya que mantiene su forma y sabor con fenogreco y garam masala.','["aceite vegetal, para freír","400 g de paneer, cortado en trozos pequeños","1 cucharadita de semilla de cilantro","nuez de jengibre, pelada y picada","1 cebolla mediana, picada","4 tomates maduros grandes, picados","1½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 cucharadita de semilla de fenogreco","1 cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharada de miel clara","un puñado pequeño de cilantro fresco, picado","trozo pequeño de jengibre, pelado y rallado en palitos","1 pimiento rojo pequeño y 1 pimiento verde pequeño, sin semillas y finamente picados","3 cebolletas, finamente ralladas"]','["Calentar 1 cm de aceite en una sartén grande.\r\ny freír el paneer en tandas hasta\r\ndorado – cuidado con el aceite\r\nescupe. Colóquelo sobre papel de cocina.","Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén y\r\nsofreír las semillas de cilantro,\r\njengibre, chile y cebolla durante aproximadamente 8-\r\n10 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Consejo en el\r\ntomates y cocinar por otros 5\r\nminutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse.\r\nAgrega las otras especias y la miel.\r\nrevuelva y cocine a fuego lento durante unos minutos.","Vierta el paneer en la salsa y\r\nrevuelva. Cocine a fuego lento durante unos minutos, luego\r\nañadir el cilantro picado y\r\njengibre rallado. Servir espolvoreado\r\ncon pimientos y cebolletas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13845,7495,'es','Dorada con especias tandoori','Fácil de preparar pero con resultados bastante especiales, este menú de inspiración india del ganador de MasterChef, Dhruv Baker, es una comida romántica para dos.','["rociar aceite de oliva, para freír","2 filetes de dorada","1 cucharadita de pasta de ajo (mezcle mucho ajo pelado con un poco de aceite vegetal y luego congélelo en cubiteras)","1 cucharadita de pasta de jengibre (hecha como se indica arriba)","2 chiles verdes","¼ cucharadita de chile rojo en polvo","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","½ cucharadita de garam masala","jugo ½ lima","100 g de mantequilla sin sal"]','["Mezclar los ingredientes de la mantequilla tandoori,\r\nmás un poco de condimento, en una comida pequeña.\r\nprocesador o con una batidora de mano\r\nhasta que quede suave. Raspe sobre film transparente y luego\r\nUsa el film transparente para ayudarte a enrollarlo.\r\nun cilindro. Gire los extremos para sellar el\r\nmantequilla y enfriar hasta que esté firme. La mantequilla\r\ndurar en el frigorífico una semana, o en el\r\nCongelador por hasta 3 meses.","Calentar una sartén de base pesada con\r\nun chorrito de aceite hasta que esté bien caliente. Temporada\r\nel pescado, luego colóquelo en la sartén, con la piel\r\nhacia abajo y cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que estén crujientes.\r\ny casi cocido. Con cuidado\r\ndar la vuelta, añadir una buena cucharada de tandoori\r\nmantequilla a la sartén y viértala sobre la\r\npescado mientras se derrite. Servir inmediatamente con\r\nlas patatas trituradas al azafrán y las verdes\r\nfrijoles con coco (recetas a continuación),\r\ncon los jugos de la sartén vertidos."]','2026-01-11 12:59:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13846,7497,'es','Brochetas de pollo masala','Estas brochetas quedan estupendas con una cucharada de chutney de mango o raita y también se pueden cocinar en la barbacoa para los calurosos días de verano.','["150ml de yogur griego 0% grasa","2 cucharadas de pasta masala","un puñado de hojas de cilantro picadas y hojas adicionales para servir","jugo de 1 lima, una pizca de ralladura y gajos para servir","4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cada una cortada en 6 trozos","chapatis integrales, para servir","Paquete de 250 g de tomates cherry pelados o en cuartos","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 pepino, cortado en trozos"]','["En un bol grande mezcle el yogur, la pasta,\r\nla mitad del cilantro picado, la mitad de la lima\r\nJugo y toda la ralladura. Punta en el pollo,\r\nrevuelva para cubrir y deje en el refrigerador para\r\nmarina durante 30 minutos si tienes tiempo.","Ensartar el pollo en 8 brochetas.\r\ny cocinar en tandas en una plancha caliente\r\nsartén, sartén o barbacoa durante aproximadamente\r\n10-12 minutos, volteando hasta que esté cocido.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los ingredientes de la ensalada.\r\ncon el resto del zumo de lima y el cilantro\r\nen un bol y sazonar. Espolvorea con más\r\ncilantro y servir junto con las brochetas.\r\ncon chapatis integrales calientes."]','2026-01-11 12:59:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13847,7499,'es','Malai kofta con salsa picante','Este plato del norte de la India se sirve a menudo en Diwali y es el plato perfecto para una cena.','["800 g de patatas peladas","5 cucharadas de harina común","2 huevos batidos","100 g de pan rallado fino","aceite para freír","2 cucharadas colmadas de queso paneer rallado","5 anacardos, picados","1 cucharada de pasas","2-3 chiles verdes, finamente picados","¼ cucharadita de azúcar","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido, comino y chile en polvo","½ cucharadita de cardamomo en polvo","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o ghee","2 cebollas medianas, picadas","3 dientes de ajo machacados","jengibre en trozos grandes, rallado","2 cucharaditas de semillas de amapola, trituradas hasta convertirlas en polvo","1 cucharada de maní o anacardos","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","3 tomates grandes, hechos puré","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo","½ cucharadita de garam masala, cilantro molido, comino y azúcar","almendras en hojuelas y nata líquida, para servir"]','["Hervir las patatas hasta que estén tiernas, luego\r\nescurrir, volver a la cacerola y poner sobre un\r\nA fuego lento para secar al vapor durante unos minutos.\r\nTriture con un poco de condimento y deje enfriar.","Mezclar todos los ingredientes del relleno.\r\nHaz 12 bolas de patata. Toma uno, presiona\r\nIntroduce el dedo en él para hacer un pequeño agujero,\r\nluego coloca un poco de la mezcla del relleno\r\nhacia el centro. Pellizca la papa hacia atrás\r\nVoltee para sellar y darle forma redonda.\r\nRepita con las bolas de papa restantes y\r\nrelleno. Enrolle cada kofta en harina, sumérjala en\r\nhuevo batido y luego pasarlo por pan rallado.\r\nLlene una cacerola honda hasta la mitad con aceite y\r\ncalentar hasta que se dore un pequeño trozo de pan\r\nen 20 segundos. Freír las koftas en tandas durante\r\nunos minutos hasta que esté dorado, luego reservar\r\nsobre papel de cocina.","Para la salsa, mezcle la\r\ncebolla, ajo, jengibre, semillas de amapola y\r\nnueces en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener un puré. Calor\r\nel aceite, luego sofreír el puré de cebolla hasta que\r\nvolviéndose marrón. Agrega los tomates en puré,\r\nespecias y azúcar. La salsa debe ser\r\nbastante espeso, pero si quieres adelgazarlo\r\nun poco, agrega un poco de agua.","Cuando la salsa hierva, agregue\r\nlos koftas. Calentar y servir con\r\nun chorrito de nata líquida y un poco desmenuzado\r\nalmendras esparcidas por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:59:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13848,7501,'es','Cordero asado indio especiado','Los adobos a base de yogur crean una corteza fina y deliciosa cuando se carbonizan, por lo que son ideales para barbacoas.','["1 pierna de cordero en mariposa, aproximadamente 2½ kg/5 lb 8 oz (pídale a su carnicero que lo haga por usted)","jengibre en trozos, del tamaño de un dedo, picado","4 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de cúrcuma, garam masala y semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de pimentón","un puñado de hojas de cilantro y ramitas adicionales para servir","jugo 1 limon","150ml de yogur natural"]','["Usar una batidora de mano o minialimentos\r\nprocesador, mezclar los ingredientes de la marinada\r\nhasta obtener una pasta suave y luego sazonar con sal.\r\nColocar el cordero en una fuente de cerámica y rebozar.\r\ncon la marinada. Cubrir con film transparente\r\ny dejar macerar en el frigorífico durante\r\nal menos 4 horas o preferiblemente durante la noche.","Si utiliza una barbacoa de carbón,\r\nesperar a que las brasas se pongan blancas y\r\nencendido (enciende la barbacoa aproximadamente una hora antes de que quieras cocinar el cordero). Si utilizas una barbacoa de gas, cocina el cordero a fuego medio. Saque el cordero de la marinada.\r\ny ase a la parrilla, con la carne hacia abajo, durante aproximadamente\r\n25 minutos. Dale la vuelta y dale el lado graso.\r\nunos 15 minutos. Cuando el cordero tiene un tono oscuro.\r\nSe dora la corteza y se cocina a tu gusto,\r\ndéjalo reposar sobre una tabla durante 15 min. (Si el clima lo obliga a quedarse adentro, el cordero se puede asar a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 durante aproximadamente una hora para obtener una carne rosada; los panes se pueden cocinar en una plancha muy caliente).","Para servir, corte el cordero en trozos gruesos.\r\nrodajas y espolvorear con el cilantro\r\ny un poco de cebolla morada en escabeche (ver\r\na continuación). Sirva la cebolla restante en\r\nun plato junto con la raita y panes\r\n(ver recetas a continuación)."]','2026-01-11 12:59:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13849,7503,'es','Biryani de verduras aromáticas y anacardos','Un delicioso plato principal vegetariano o acompañamiento de otro curry, ideal para un buffet de curry o un festín picante.','["500 g de arroz basmati","2 cebollas grandes, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","4 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","raíz de jengibre fresco del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","65 g de pasta de curry korma en sobre (nosotros usamos Sharwood''s)","2 ramas de canela","6 vainas de cardamomo verde","anís de 3 estrellas","250 g de patatas cortadas en cubitos","1 coliflor pequeña, cortada en floretes pequeños","250 g de yogur griego","225 g de guisantes congelados","2 buenas pizcas de azafrán","½ cucharadita de agua de rosas","mantequilla, para engrasar","100 g de anacardos tostados y salados","2 cebollas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas muy finas","3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","buen puñado de cilantro"]','["Enjuagar el arroz en varios cambios de agua.\r\npara quitar el exceso de almidón, luego poner en un bol\r\nde agua fría y dejar en remojo durante 30 min.","Mientras tanto, sofreír las cebollas en el aceite durante\r\n8 minutos hasta que esté suave y comience a tomar color. Añadir\r\nel jengibre, luego cocine por 2 minutos más. Agregue\r\nla pasta de curry seguida de las especias enteras,\r\ncocine por 1 minuto más, luego agregue las papas\r\ny coliflor. Vierta 300 ml de agua, cubra\r\ny hervir durante unos 5-7 minutos hasta que las verduras estén\r\nsimplemente tierno, pero todavía tiene un poco de resistencia.\r\nAgrega el yogur y los guisantes con 1 cucharadita de sal.","Mezclar el azafrán, el agua de rosas y 3 cucharadas.\r\nagua hirviendo y revuelva bien. Escurrir el\r\narroz, verter en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal,\r\nluego cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que esté casi tierno.\r\nEscurrir nuevamente. Saca una fuente grande para horno.\r\ncon tapa y untar con mantequilla la base. Inclina el curry\r\nsalsa en la base, esparcir sobre las nueces,\r\nluego vierta sobre el arroz. Rocíe sobre el\r\nmezcla de agua de rosas, luego cubra con papel de aluminio\r\nseguido de la tapa. Se puede enfriar durante la noche\r\nhasta que esté listo para cocinar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Poner\r\nel biryani en el horno durante 45 minutos-1 hora hasta que\r\ncompletamente calentado. Para comprobar que es\r\nlisto, prueba con una cucharada del centro del\r\narroz. Para la guarnición, sofreír lentamente la cebolla en\r\nel aceite hasta que esté muy dorado y crujiente (esto puede\r\nhacerse con antelación). Cuando el biryani está caliente\r\ny listo para servir, mezcle suavemente por el\r\ncebollas y cilantro."]','2026-01-11 12:59:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13850,6806,'es','Tartas de patatas y espinacas de Bombay','Estas tartas de filo picantes son ideales para un almuerzo con ensalada o como parte de un buffet','["1¼ kg de patatas cerosas grandes como Charlotte, cortadas por la mitad","85 g de mantequilla","2 cebollas picadas","1 cucharada de semilla de comino","1 cucharada de semilla de mostaza negra","2 cucharadas de jengibre finamente picado","2 chiles rojos, cortados por la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas","3 cucharadas de pasta Korma","Bolsa de 400 g de espinacas frescas","4 tomates, picados","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","Paquete de 270 g de masa filo (6 láminas grandes)","50 g de mantequilla derretida","1 cucharadita de semilla de mostaza negra"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nPara hacer el relleno, calentar una cacerola con sal\r\nagua. Cuando hierva añadir las patatas y\r\nhervir durante 15 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Derretir el\r\nmantequilla y luego sofreír las cebollas durante unos minutos.\r\nAñade el comino, las semillas de mostaza, el jengibre y\r\nchiles y sofreír, revolviendo ocasionalmente, por\r\nunos 7 minutos hasta que esté suave. Agrega la pasta de curry.","Cocine las espinacas en el microondas a\r\nAlto durante 5 minutos. Escurrir y exprimir\r\ntanto líquido como puedas, luego córtalo.\r\nEscurre las patatas y viértelas en el\r\nmezcla de especias. Aplastar ligeramente para romper\r\ncórtelos en trozos en lugar de hacerlos puré.\r\nAgregue la mezcla de especias con abundante\r\nsal para cubrirlos, luego agrega las espinacas,\r\ntomates y cilantro.","Desenrollar con cuidado la masa y cepillar\r\n2 moldes para sándwiches de fondo suelto de 20 cm\r\ncon un poco de mantequilla. Cepille la primera hoja de\r\nmasa y colóquela dentro y a lo ancho del molde de modo que\r\nque cuelgue por el costado. haz lo mismo\r\ncon otra hoja de masa para cubrir la\r\notro lado de la lata (para que los dos formen un\r\ncruz), mantequilla y doblar la hoja final en\r\nla mitad y colocarla en la base del molde para\r\ncrear una base firme. Haz lo mismo con el\r\nel resto de hojalata y la masa restante.","Vierta el relleno en el molde y dóblelo.\r\nla masa que sobresale para que quede\r\ncubre el relleno. Cepille generosamente con\r\nla mantequilla restante y espolvorear con\r\nsemillas. Hornee por 35 minutos hasta que esté dorado y\r\ncrujiente. Servir con ensalada y mango.\r\nchutney o raita hecha mezclando simple\r\nyogur con salsa de menta o gelatina, si gustas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13851,7505,'es','Naans de pollo coronación con ensalada india','Cubra el pan indio con carne desmenuzada, salsa de curry suave y afrutada y ensalada de zanahoria y repollo.','["1 pollo ya asado, unos 950 g","2 paquetes de 4 mini pan naan de cilantro y ajo","150ml de yogur","150ml mayonesa ligera","1 cucharada de curry suave en polvo","4 cucharadas de chutney de mango","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes, y extra para servir","2 zanahorias grandes, ralladas","1 repollo rojo, rallado","2 cucharaditas de semillas de mostaza negra"]','["Triturar la carne del pollo.\r\ny dejar a un lado. Para hacer la salsa,\r\nmezclar el yogur, la mayonesa,\r\ncurry en polvo, chutney y algo\r\nsazona con la mitad del cilantro.\r\nPasa esto por el pollo.","Para hacer la ensalada, mezcle la\r\nzanahorias, repollo y semillas de mostaza en un tazón grande con el\r\nel cilantro restante y luego sazonar.","Calentar los panes naan en el\r\ntostadora. Permitir 2 por persona y\r\ncubra con un poco de ensalada, luego el\r\nmezcla de pollo. Servir espolvoreado\r\ncon cilantro, con extra de ensalada\r\nen el costado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13852,7507,'es','Curry de gambas de Goa y coco con arroz al comino','Dale sabor a tus comidas de mitad de semana con un curry rápidamente: agrega un puñado de especias con mariscos, tomates y espinacas.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","1 cucharada de jengibre recién rallado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","10 hojas de curry","1 papa grande, cortada en cubitos","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco desnatada","8 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","un puñado de espinacas tiernas","Paquete de 200 g de gambas crudas peladas","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","175 g de arroz basmati"]','["Calentar el aceite y sofreír la cebolla, el jengibre,\r\najo y chile durante 5 minutos hasta comenzar\r\npara suavizar. Agrega las especias, las hojas de curry.\r\ny la papa, luego cocine por 1 min más.\r\nAgregue la leche de coco y los tomates.\r\ntapar y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 10 minutos\r\nhasta que la patata esté tierna.","Añade las espinacas y las gambas. cocinar\r\ndurante 1 min más hasta que las espinacas se ablanden\r\ny las gambas se ponen rosadas.","Mientras tanto, haz el arroz. Inclina el\r\ncomino en una sartén y tostar sobre una superficie seca\r\ncalentar durante 30 segundos. Añade el arroz, la sal\r\nprobar y 400ml de agua, luego tapar\r\ny cocine durante 8-10 minutos hasta que el arroz esté\r\ntierna y el agua ha sido absorbida.\r\nServir con el curry."]','2026-01-11 12:59:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13853,7509,'es','Pollo asado tandoori','Sirva este ave india especiada con arroz, papas y verduras para una cena asada alternativa.','["1,8 kg de pollo","2 cebollas, en rodajas gruesas","1 limón, partido por la mitad","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y cortado en rodajas gruesas","lata de 400g de leche de coco","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharadita de chile picante en polvo, cúrcuma, cilantro molido, comino molido, garam masala y canela molida","6 dientes de ajo, batidos hasta formar una pasta con el jengibre","½ trozo de jengibre, del tamaño de un dedo, batido hasta formar una pasta con el ajo","unas gotas de colorante alimentario rojo (opcional)"]','["Mezclar los ingredientes de la marinada con\r\n2 cucharaditas de sal y 1 cucharadita de pimienta negra. barra diagonal\r\nlas piernas del pollo unas cuantas veces, luego\r\nfrote la marinada por todas partes, incluso debajo\r\nla piel del pecho. Marinar en el\r\nRefrigerador por hasta 24 hrs.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner\r\nlas cebollas, las mitades de limón y el jengibre en\r\nuna fuente para asar. Coloca el pollo encima y\r\nAse durante 1½ horas o hasta que el muslo esté jugoso.\r\nsale claro cuando se prueba con una brocheta.","Cuando el pollo esté listo, sáquelo de\r\nla lata, reposar en un plato nuevo, tapar sin apretar\r\ncon papel aluminio y dejar reposar. pescar el\r\njengibre de la lata y deséchelo. raspar\r\nsacar los medios asados de los limones\r\nen un procesador de alimentos, agregue las cebollas\r\ny el jugo de la sartén y mezclar hasta obtener un puré.\r\nVuelva a colocar el puré en el molde y\r\nsiéntate en la encimera. Agrega la leche de coco.\r\ny burbujee suavemente, raspando cualquier\r\ntrozos de pollo que se hayan pegado. tu puedes\r\nañade un chorrito de agua si la salsa está\r\ndemasiado grueso. Agregue el cilantro y\r\nservir con el pollo."]','2026-01-11 12:59:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13854,7511,'es','kedgeree definitivo','Hay un millón de versiones de kedgeree, pero creemos que esta es la mejor y más fácil de todas.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","2 cebollas medianas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas muy finas","350 g de eglefino ahumado sin teñir","175 g de filete de salmón ligeramente ahumado","1 chile rojo seco (Angela usó Kashmiri)","½ litro de leche entera","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","1 cebolla mediana, picada","unas 14 hojas de curry frescas o liofilizadas","4 vainas de cardamomo, partidas","1 rama de canela, partida en trozos","280 g de arroz basmati","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","50 g de mantequilla","2 huevos","un puñado de hojas de cilantro y unas rodajas de lima, para servir"]','["Para las cebollas crujientes, caliente el aceite en una sartén, agregue las cebollas con una pizca de sal (que ayuda a evitar que se quemen), luego cocine a fuego medio, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que estén doradas, aproximadamente 20-25 minutos. Cuando esté listo, extiéndalo sobre toallas de papel y déjelo crujiente. Mientras se fríen las cebollas, poner ambos pescados en una sartén con la guindilla. Vierta la leche, tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 4 minutos. Retirar del fuego y dejar reposar tapado durante 10 minutos para terminar de cocinar suavemente el pescado.","Mientras tanto, calentar las 3 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén profunda o saltear (con tapa). Agrega la cebolla, las hojas de curry, el cardamomo y la canela y sofríe hasta que la cebolla esté suave y dorada, aproximadamente de 7 a 8 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia. Saque el pescado de la leche con una espumadera, deseche la piel y las espinas, tápelo para mantenerlo caliente y reserve. Completar la leche hasta 600ml/1pt con agua. Enjuague el arroz en agua tibia en un colador, escúrralo y luego revuélvalo con la cebolla. Sigue revolviendo durante 1 minuto para que el arroz quede cubierto. Vierta la mezcla de leche y agregue la cúrcuma. Deje hervir, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, tapado, bajando el fuego si comienza a pegarse en el fondo.","Cuando el arroz esté tierno, retirar del fuego, echar la mantequilla encima para que se derrita y luego colocar los trozos enteros de pescado sobre el arroz. Tapar y dejar que se mezclen los sabores. Mientras tanto, poner los huevos en una cacerola, cubrir con agua fría y llevar a ebullición, luego hervir durante 6 minutos (si están ligeramente hervidos). Retirar del fuego y sumergir en agua fría, rompiendo las cáscaras contra el costado de la sartén. Quitar las cáscaras y cortar los huevos en cuartos.","Para servir, rompa el pescado en trozos grandes con un tenedor, agregue el cilantro y revuelva suavemente para mezclar sin romper el pescado, agregando los huevos al final. Sazone, esparza cebollas crujientes encima y sirva con rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13855,7513,'es','Pollo con mantequilla de cardamomo','Un curry casero que rivaliza con tu comida india favorita para llevar: una rica mezcla de especias mezcladas con ghee cremoso','["2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, picado","2 chiles verdes, picados (deja las semillas si te gusta picante)","manojo pequeño de cilantro, hojas recogidas y tallos picados en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de ghee o aceite vegetal","2 cebollas, rebanadas","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma, garam masala y comino molido","1 cucharadita de fenogreco molido","4 pechugas de pollo, cortadas en cubos de 2½ cm","4 dientes","12 vainas de cardamomo, sin semillas","1 rama de canela","400 g de tomates en lata","150ml de yogur en bote","50ml de nata doble","chapatis y arroz, para servir"]','["Coloque el ajo, el jengibre, los chiles y\r\ntallos de cilantro en el tazón pequeño de\r\nun robot de cocina con una buena pizca de\r\nsal y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta fina, o muela hasta obtener una pasta con un mortero.","Calienta 2 cucharadas de ghee o aceite en un\r\nsartén grande, agregue las cebollas y cocine\r\nlentamente durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y\r\ncaramelizado. Consejo en el ajo-jengibre\r\npegar, subir el fuego y cocinar durante\r\n5 minutos más. Agrega el suelo\r\nespecias y cocine por 2 minutos más hasta que\r\nfragante. Saque la mezcla de cebolla picante.\r\nde la sartén a un bol.","Agregue el resto del ghee o el aceite a la\r\nsartén y cocine el pollo sobre una\r\nfuego medio-alto hasta que se dore por completo.\r\nVierta en un bol, cubra y reserve.","Regrese la mezcla de cebolla a la sartén.\r\njunto con las especias enteras, los tomates\r\ny una lata llena de agua (400ml). traer\r\nhasta que hierva, luego tapar y cocinar a fuego lento\r\nsuavemente durante 40 minutos.","Regrese el pollo a la sartén y\r\ncocine, sin tapar, durante 10 minutos más\r\nhasta que la salsa espese y\r\nel pollo esté bien cocido. Revuelva\r\nen el yogur y la nata, sazonar bien\r\ny espolvorear con hojas de cilantro.\r\nSirva con chapatis y arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13856,7515,'es','pan plano','Los panes planos indios (naan) se pueden freír o hornear y solo necesitan 15 minutos para cocinarse. Perfecto para absorber la salsa de un delicioso curry casero','["500 g de harina blanca fuerte","2 cucharaditas de sal","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","300ml de agua"]','["Mezcle la harina, la sal, la levadura y el aceite en un tazón grande y agregue suficiente agua para hacer una masa suave, pero no descuidada. Amasar bien. Poner en un recipiente ligeramente engrasado para que suba durante 1 hora hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Divida la masa en 8 trozos, de unos 250 g cada uno, y utilice un rodillo para aplanar cada uno hasta formar un círculo, de 15 cm de diámetro y aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor. Luego, deje reposar los trozos en una bandeja para hornear ligeramente enharinada durante 5 minutos. Calienta una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe cada pieza hasta que se dore por ambos lados, aproximadamente 5 minutos en total. Deje enfriar un poco antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13857,7517,'es','Wraps de patatas indias especiadas','Las batatas son una verdura versátil y mucho más saludable que las patatas de todos los días.','["4 batatas, cortadas en gajos gruesos","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","1 cucharada de garam masala","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas finas","jugo 1 lima","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","6-9 chapati","150ml de yogur natural","cilantro en manojo grande"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nMezcle las batatas con chile,\r\n1 cucharadita de aceite, semillas de comino, garam masala\r\ny mucho condimento para asar\r\nbandeja. Ase durante 25-35 minutos, volteando\r\ngajos hasta la mitad, hasta que estén tiernos y dorados.","Mientras tanto sofreír la cebolla en el aceite restante.\r\ndurante unos minutos hasta que se ablande parcialmente, revuelva\r\nen el jugo de lima y el azúcar con un poco\r\nsazonar, luego apagar el fuego.","Siguiente paquete de chapatis calientes\r\ninstrucciones, luego ensamble agregando\r\nun par de gajos de batata para\r\ncada uno, seguido de un puñado de cebollas,\r\nuna cucharada de yogur y un puñadito de\r\nhojas de cilantro. Enrollar y comer."]','2026-01-11 12:59:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13858,7519,'es','Balti de pollo especiado','Los elogios por esto llegaron casi tan pronto como la revista salió a la venta. Pruébalo y cuéntanos tu opinión.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","2 cebollas grandes, en rodajas gruesas","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","4 cucharadas de pasta de curry balti","200 g de quinua","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 litro de caldo de pollo","50 g de anacardos tostados y salados","manojo pequeño de cilantro, hojas picadas"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, sofreír las cebollas.\r\ndurante 5 minutos hasta que esté dorado y suave, luego\r\nvolcar sobre un plato. Agrega las pechugas de pollo,\r\ndorar durante unos minutos por cada lado, luego\r\nagregue la pasta balti, la quinua y la cebolla.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante unos minutos y luego vierta el\r\ntomates y caldo y darle todo\r\nuna buena mezcla. Burbuja durante 25 minutos hasta que\r\nLa quinua es tierna y picante.","Agregue los anacardos y la mayor parte del\r\ncilantro con un poco de condimento, luego apile\r\nen tazones y esparcir sobre el resto de la\r\ncilantro para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13859,5992,'es','Cremas de coco afrutadas','Un pudín rápido, bajo en grasas, fácil de preparar y de adaptar.','["1 sobre de crema de coco de 50 g/2 oz","500g de yogur griego 0% o quark en tarrina","85 g de azúcar glas tamizada","unas gotas de extracto de vainilla","2 kiwis","Lata de 400g de piña en trozos."]','["Disolver la crema de coco en 50ml hirviendo.\r\nagua, luego dejar enfriar. Vierta el quark o\r\nyogur en un tazón para mezclar, luego agregue el glaseado\r\nazúcar y vainilla. Combinar con el coco.\r\nmezcle y luego sirva en vasos individuales. relajarse\r\nhasta que esté listo para servir.","Pelar y picar el kiwi en trozos pequeños.\r\nEscurre la piña y luego pícala en trozos.\r\npiezas pequeñas. Mezcle la fruta y luego vierta con una cuchara.\r\nsobre la crema de coco para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13860,7521,'es','Pollo tikka con arroz especiado','La comida india no tiene por qué ser un placer culpable: este saludable pollo al horno con arroz fresco y aromático es nutritivo y sabroso.','["4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","Bote de 150g de yogur natural desnatado","50 g de pasta tikka","100 g/4 oz de pepino, cortado en cubitos","1 cucharada de hojas de menta picadas en trozos grandes","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos finos","140 g de arroz de grano largo fácil de cocinar","1 cucharada de curry en polvo mediano","50 g de guisantes congelados","1 pimiento rojo pequeño, cortado en cubitos"]','["Corta profundamente cada pechuga de pollo con\r\nun cuchillo 3-4 veces por un lado. poner en un\r\nbol y añadir 50g del yogur y el\r\npasta tikka. Mezclar bien, tapar y marinar.\r\nen el frigorífico durante 30 min. hacer la raita\r\nrevolviendo el pepino y la mayor parte del\r\nmenta al resto del yogur. Temporada\r\ncon pimienta negra, tapar y enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9.\r\nDistribuya los gajos de cebolla sobre un\r\nbandeja para hornear forrada con papel de aluminio. Retire el\r\npollo de la marinada, sacudir\r\ncualquier exceso y colocar encima de la\r\ngajos de cebolla. Cocine por 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, vierta el arroz, el curry en polvo,\r\nguisantes y pimienta en una cacerola hirviendo\r\nagua y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos o hasta\r\nel arroz está tierno. Escurrir bien y\r\ndivide el arroz en 4 platos.\r\nAgrega el pollo, la cebolla asada y\r\nmenta restante. Servir con el\r\nraita de pepino."]','2026-01-11 12:59:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13861,7523,'es','Arroz pilau con pistachos','Esta guarnición vibrante y ligeramente especiada es el acompañamiento perfecto para el curry.','["1 cebolla, rebanada","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","300 g de arroz basmati","600 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","manojo de cebolletas, en rodajas","50 g de pistachos, picados en trozos grandes"]','["Freír la cebolla en el aceite en una sartén grande.\r\nsartén o cacerola hasta que se ablanden. Agregue\r\nla cúrcuma, luego el arroz y reservar\r\nrevolviendo hasta que los granos estén dorados.","Verter el caldo caliente, llevar a ebullición,\r\nluego reduzca el fuego, cubra y cocine por\r\n15 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno. Quitar\r\ndel calor y revolver durante la primavera\r\ncebollas, pistachos y algún condimento\r\nantes de servir caliente o dejar enfriar."]','2026-01-11 12:59:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13862,7525,'es','Curry cremoso de remolacha','Pruebe un enfoque original para servir remolacha en rodajas gruesas combinándola con especias de Madrás, semillas de mostaza y chile verde.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas, muy finamente picadas","2 cucharaditas de semillas de mostaza amarilla","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry madrás","1 kg (peso pelado) de remolacha cruda, pelada, cortada por la mitad y en rodajas gruesas","1 chile verde, cortado por la mitad a lo largo","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","3 cucharadas de almendras molidas","4 cucharadas de yogur natural bajo en grasa, más extra para servir","arroz basmati, para servir (opcional)"]','["Caliente el aceite en una cacerola grande con tapa, revuelva\r\nen las cebollas y cocine por 8 minutos hasta que\r\nsuave. Vierta las semillas de mostaza y cocine.\r\ndurante 1 min hasta que se tueste. Revuelva a través del\r\npasta de curry y chisporrotee durante 3 minutos.","Mezclar la remolacha con el picante.\r\ncebollas, luego agregue el chile, los tomates\r\ny 2 latas de agua. Cubra y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 30 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que\r\nla remolacha está tierna. Retire la tapa,\r\nsubir el fuego y cocinar hasta que\r\nla salsa está espesa.","Retire del fuego y luego revuelva.\r\nlas almendras, el yogur y un poco de condimento.\r\nCubra con yogur y sirva con basmati.\r\narroz, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:59:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13863,7527,'es','Garbanzos al curry','Sirva este lado como parte de una comida india para darle un toque picante saludable.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1-2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y picados","1 diente","1 rama pequeña de canela","1 hoja de laurel","1 cebolla, finamente picada","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","1 cucharadita de pimentón","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","2 tomates pequeños, picados","1 cucharada de cilantro picado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén de fondo grueso.\r\nFreír el comino, las guindillas, el clavo, la canela.\r\ny laurel juntos hasta que el comino\r\ncomienza a crujir. Añade la cebolla y la cúrcuma.\r\ny una pizca de sal. Cocine por 2 minutos hasta que\r\ncomenzando a ablandarse, luego agregue el ajo.","Continúe cocinando 4-5 minutos hasta que\r\nla cebolla esté blanda, luego agregue los garbanzos, el pimentón,\r\npimienta negra y cilantro molido. dar\r\ntodo un buen removedor para que los garbanzos\r\nestán bien cubiertos de especias.","Agrega los tomates y 2 cucharadas de agua.\r\nCocine a fuego medio hasta que los tomates\r\nestén suaves y la salsa espesa y\r\npulposo. Retirar del fuego y espolvorear\r\nsobre el cilantro."]','2026-01-11 12:59:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13864,7529,'es','chuletas de cordero indias','Este plato aromático hará la boca agua a todos.','["50 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","1 cucharada de curry en polvo (usamos curry suave en polvo Schwartz)","4 chuletas de cordero","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","chutney de tomate, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Mezclar\r\nel parmesano y el curry en polvo juntos.\r\nSazone el cordero, luego presione la carne\r\nla mezcla de queso para cubrir. Calentar el aceite en un\r\nsartén para horno o bandeja para hornear pesada\r\ny sofreír las chuletas durante 2 minutos por cada lado\r\npara dorar.","Transfiera al horno durante 5 minutos a temperatura media,\r\no más por bien hecho. Delicioso servido\r\ncon una cucharada de chutney de tomate y un poco\r\npuré aromatizado con cilantro picado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13865,7531,'es','Carne picada india con ensalada de tomate fresco','Este plato lleno de sabor, súper económico y rápido de preparar, la comida familiar perfecta','["1 cebolla morada, en rodajas","300 g de carne picada","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo medio o suave","100 g de lentejas rojas secas","700 ml de caldo de ternera caliente","3 tomates","un puñado de hojas de cilantro","4 mini pan naan"]','["En una sartén antiadherente sofreír la cebolla\r\ny picar a fuego alto durante 2 minutos,\r\nrompiendo la carne picada a medida que avanza. Agregue\r\nel curry en polvo y las lentejas, vierta\r\ncaldo, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Mientras se cocina la carne picada\r\nlos tomates y picar los\r\ncilantro, luego mezcle en una pequeña\r\ncuenco. Pon los naans brevemente en una tostadora.\r\npara calentar, luego coloque uno en cada\r\nplato. Vierta una cuarta parte de la carne picada\r\ncada naan, luego cubra con una cucharada de\r\nla ensalada de tomate fresco y cilantro."]','2026-01-11 12:59:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13866,7533,'es','Curry de pescado frito y tomate','Utilice un pescado blanco sostenible como el abadejo en este curry de coco y tomate al estilo del sur de la India con cilantro fresco.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal, más 2 cucharaditas","2 cebollas, en rodajas finas","8 tomates en rama grandes, picados en trozos grandes","4 dientes de ajo","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, picado en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry madrás","Lata de 165ml de leche de coco.","un puñado grande de cilantro, finamente picado, más ramitas adicionales para servir","500 g de filetes de abadejo sin piel","6 cucharadas de harina común","arroz basmati, para servir"]','["Calienta 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén. Punta en las cebollas\r\ny una pizca de sal. Cocine durante unos 8 minutos.\r\nhasta que estén suaves y doradas.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los tomates, el ajo\r\ny jengibre en un procesador de alimentos a un\r\npuré suave. Agrega la pasta de curry\r\na las cebollas y sofreír por 3 minutos más.\r\nAgregue la mezcla de tomate y cocine a fuego lento.\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que espese. Añade el\r\nleche de coco y cilantro picado.\r\nCocine a fuego lento nuevamente para espesar.","Espolvorea los filetes de pescado con un poco de\r\nharina. Calentar el aceite restante en una sartén antiadherente.\r\nsartén. Cocine los filetes, en tandas,\r\na fuego alto durante 1 minuto más o menos en cada uno\r\nlado, hasta que comiencen a dorarse. Con cuidado\r\ncolocar el pescado en la mezcla de tomate y\r\ncocine a fuego lento hasta que esté bien cocido. dispersión\r\nsobre ramitas de cilantro y sírvelo con arroz."]','2026-01-11 12:59:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13867,7535,'es','Dhal de lentejas agridulces con berenjena asada','Dale sabor a la cena con esta receta súper saludable, rica en fibra, rica en hierro y que cuenta como 4 de tus 5 al día. ¡También es barata!','["100 g de lentejas rojas, enjuagadas","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharada de pasta de tamarindo (nosotros usamos Bart)","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla mediana, en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","3 cm/1¼ pulgada de jengibre rallado","1 cucharadita de curry en polvo","1 berenjena mediana, cortada en rodajas de 2 cm","arroz basmati cocido, chutney de lima o mango y unas hojas de cilantro, para servir, si lo desea"]','["Cubrir las lentejas, la cúrcuma y la pasta de tamarindo con 500ml de agua. Agrega un poco de sal y deja hervir durante 15 minutos o hasta que esté muy suave. Retire la espuma que se forme en la parte superior. Mientras tanto, calienta 1 cucharada de aceite y cocina la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre hasta que estén dorados, aproximadamente 5 minutos.","Agrega el curry en polvo y cocina por 2 minutos más. Vierta la mezcla de lentejas y cocine por otros 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, calienta una sartén hasta que esté muy caliente. Frote el aceite restante sobre las rodajas de berenjena y sazone. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté bien cocido y carbonizado. Cómelo con arroz basmati, chutney de lima o mango y un poco de cilantro, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 12:59:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13868,7537,'es','Paneer con brócoli y sésamo','Sirva este plato vegetariano elaborado con queso indio, paneer, como parte de una noche de curry o con arroz como cena entre semana.','["200 g de brócoli germinado","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","pellizco asafétida","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","1 chile verde grande, finamente picado","½ cucharadita de semillas de mostaza marrón","6 hojas de curry","1 cebolla mediana, rebanada","140 g de queso paneer, cortado en tiras","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","½ cucharadita de maza molida"]','["Recorte el brócoli y hierva o cocine al vapor.\r\ndurante 5-6 minutos hasta que estén tiernos pero firmes al\r\nmorder. Escurrir y enfriar bajo funcionamiento en frío.\r\nagua. Calentar el aceite en un wok o en una fritura grande.\r\nsartén, luego agregue la asafétida, el comino\r\nsemillas, semillas de sésamo, chile, mostaza\r\nsemillas y las hojas de curry. cocinar para\r\n1 min hasta que esté fragante, luego agregue la cebolla\r\ny cocine otros 2 minutos.","Eche el paneer, el jengibre y el ajo.\r\ny temporada. Cocine a fuego medio durante\r\n4-5 minutos hasta que el paneer se dore.\r\nAñade el brócoli y mezcla con el\r\npaneer y especias, luego agregue jugo de limón,\r\nmacis y una rodaja de pimienta."]','2026-01-11 12:59:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13869,7539,'es','Pilaf de coliflor y garbanzos','Delicioso servido solo o como guarnición con pechugas de pollo asadas untadas con un poco de pasta de curry.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","2 cebollas grandes, cortadas en rodajas","1 cucharada de pasta de curry de tu elección","200 g de arroz basmati","350 g de floretes de coliflor","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","500 ml de caldo de verduras","50 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","un puñado de cilantro picado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande antiadherente.\r\ny agrega las cebollas. Cocine a fuego medio\r\ncalentar durante 5 minutos hasta que empiece a girar\r\ndorado. Agregue la pasta de curry y cocine.\r\ndurante 1 min. Añade el arroz, la coliflor y\r\ngarbanzos, revolviendo para cubrirlos con la pasta.","Vierta el caldo y revuelva. Cubrir y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos hasta que el arroz y\r\nla coliflor está tierna y todo el liquido\r\nha sido absorbido. Agrega las almendras\r\ny cilantro, luego servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13870,7541,'es','Curry de verduras para una multitud','Este curry vegetariano es excelente para alimentar a un grupo de amigos con poco presupuesto o para preparar un lote para congelar.','["1 papa grande, cortada en cubitos","1 calabaza pequeña, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en cubitos","1 berenjena, cortada en cubitos","6 cucharadas de pasta tikka masala","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas, rebanadas","Tarro de 680g-700g de puré de tomate","lata de 400g de leche de coco","2 pimientos rojos, rebanados","2 calabacines, cortados en cubitos","unas ramitas de cilantro, para servir","arroz o pan naan, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEcha la patata, la calabaza y\r\nberenjena con 2 cucharadas de pasta de curry\r\ny 2 cucharadas de aceite en una fuente para asar grande.\r\nSazone y luego ase durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, haz la salsa. freír\r\nlas cebollas en el aceite restante en\r\nuna sartén grande hasta que se ablanden y\r\ndorado – añade un chorrito de agua\r\nsi empiezan a secarse. Agregue el\r\npasta de curry restante, cocine por\r\n3 minutos, luego agregue la passata,\r\nleche de coco y 100ml de agua.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante unos minutos.","Cuando las verduras estén asadas,\r\nViértelos en la salsa con el\r\npimientos y calabacines. cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. dispersión\r\ncon cilantro y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13871,7543,'es','Biryani de pollo al horno','Mantenga este biryani horneado en el congelador para disfrutar de un sencillo impulso saludable a mitad de semana.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel, picadas en trozos","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos","2 cebollas, rebanadas","4 cucharadas de pasta de curry (nosotros usamos Korma y Tikka Masala)","300 g de coliflor picada en floretes pequeños","700 ml de caldo de pollo","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","200 gramos de yogur natural","300 g de espinacas","400 g de arroz basmati, cocido siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete","5 cucharadas de almendras laminadas"]','["Empiece por hacer el curry. Calentar 1 cucharada\r\ndel aceite en una sartén grande y profunda. Temporada\r\nel pollo y freír hasta que se dore, luego\r\nretirar y reservar. Freír la cebolla en\r\nel resto del aceite durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté suave\r\ny empezando a caramelizar.","Agrega la pasta y la coliflor, revolviendo.\r\npara cubrir todo, luego devolver el pollo.\r\nVierta el caldo, los tomates y los garbanzos.\r\ny cocine todo a fuego lento durante 30 minutos hasta que\r\nla coliflor está casi tierna. allí\r\ndebe quedar suficiente líquido para cubrir\r\ntodo así que agrega un chorrito más de agua\r\no stock si es necesario. Quitar del\r\nCalienta y agrega el yogur.","Ensamble el horneado en 1 grande o\r\n2 platos hondos más pequeños para horno. Empezar\r\ncon ¹/³ de las hojas de espinaca, sazonar,\r\nluego cubra con ¹/³ de curry. terminar\r\ncon ¹/³ del arroz y luego repetir dos veces\r\nmás. Espolvorear sobre las almendras y\r\nDeje enfriar completamente para congelar o caliente el horno.\r\na 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y cocinar durante\r\n20-25 minutos hasta que la cobertura esté crujiente\r\nhacia arriba y el plato estará bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13872,7545,'es','Comidas familiares: pollo al curry suave','Un curry ligeramente especiado con una rica salsa de yogur que atraerá tanto a adultos como a niños','["1-1½ cucharadita de aceite de coco (nosotros usamos Fushi) o aceite de girasol","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo gordos, machacados","1 cm de jengibre fresco, rallado o finamente picado","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de semilla de mostaza amarilla","1 cucharadita de garam masala","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 paquete de 500 g de trozos de pollo (muslos y muslos), o muslos","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","1 rama de canela","250 g de yogur griego a temperatura ambiente","2 cucharadas de pasas","un puñado de cilantro picado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén de base pesada. Freír las cebollas suavemente durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que estén blandas. Agregue el ajo, el jengibre, el cilantro, las semillas de mostaza, el garam masala y el comino y cocine durante 1 a 2 minutos, permitiendo que se liberen los aromas.","Agrega el pollo y cocina durante 10 minutos a fuego suave, volteándolo de vez en cuando y asegurándote de que las especias no se peguen. Vierta unos 300 ml de agua hirviendo hasta casi cubrir. Agregue la pastilla de caldo y la ramita de canela. Cocine a fuego lento durante unos 45 minutos - 1 hora con la tapa quitada para que quede una pequeña cantidad de salsa espesa en el fondo de la sartén. Retire la ramita de canela.","Agregue el yogur y las pasas, caliente suavemente y sirva. Espolvoree con cilantro, si lo usa."]','2026-01-11 12:59:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13873,6066,'es','saludar','Las nutritivas espinacas son la base de esta tradicional y saludable guarnición india, combinadas con patatas y especias.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 cucharada de jengibre picado","500 g de patatas, cortadas en trozos de 2 cm, ¾ en trozos","1 chile rojo grande, cortado por la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","½ cucharadita de cada una de semillas de mostaza negra, semillas de comino y cúrcuma","250 g de hojas de espinaca"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, agrega la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre y sofríe durante unos 3 minutos. Agregue las papas, el chile, las especias y media cucharadita de sal y continúe cocinando y revolviendo durante 5 minutos más. Agrega un chorrito de agua, tapa y cocina durante 8-10 minutos.","Comprueba que las patatas estén listas pinchándolas con la punta de un cuchillo y, si lo están, añade las espinacas y deja que se marchiten en la sartén. Retirar del fuego y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13874,4847,'es','Balti de pollo más saludable','Una versión más ligera del clásico indio para llevar de Angela Nilsen, este curry a base de tomate está repleto de espinacas y pimientos adicionales.','["450 g de pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en trozos pequeños","1 cucharada de jugo de lima","1 cucharadita de pimentón","¼ cucharadita de chile picante en polvo","1½ cucharada de aceite de girasol o maní","1 rama de canela","3 vainas de cardamomo, partidas","1 chile verde pequeño a mediano","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cebolla mediana, rallada gruesa","2 dientes de ajo, muy finamente picados","2½ cm de jengibre rallado","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de garam masala","250ml de puré orgánico","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas, cortado en trozos pequeños","1 tomate mediano, picado","85 g de hojas tiernas de espinacas","un puñado de cilantro fresco, picado","chapatis o arroz basmati, para servir (opcional)"]','["Pon el pollo en un tazón mediano. Mezclar\r\nen el jugo de lima, pimentón, chile en polvo\r\ny una pizca de pimienta negra (paso 1), luego\r\ndejar marinar durante al menos 15 minutos,\r\npreferiblemente un poco más.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola grande.\r\nwok o sartén antiadherente. Consejo en\r\nla rama de canela, las vainas de cardamomo,\r\nsemillas enteras de chile y comino, y\r\nsofreír brevemente solo para colorear y soltar\r\nsu fragancia (paso 2). Agregue la cebolla,\r\najo y jengibre y sofreír sobre una\r\nfuego medio-alto durante 3-4 minutos hasta que\r\nla cebolla comienza a dorarse. Añade el\r\naceite restante, luego agregue el pollo\r\ny sofreír durante 2-3 minutos o hasta que ya no esté\r\nya no parece crudo. Mezclar la cúrcuma, el comino, el cilantro molido y el garam.\r\nmasala juntos. Vierta en la sartén, baje\r\nel fuego a medio y cocine por 2 minutos\r\n(paso 3). Vierta la passata y 150ml.\r\nagua, luego agregue los trozos de\r\npimienta. Cuando empiece a burbujear, baje\r\nel fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos o\r\nhasta que el pollo esté tierno.","Agregue el tomate y cocine a fuego lento durante 2-3\r\nminutos, luego agregue las espinacas y voltee\r\nDéjalo en la sartén para que se ablande. Temporada\r\ncon un poco de sal. si quieres adelgazar\r\nbajar la salsa, agregar un poco más\r\nagua. Retire la ramita de canela, la guindilla.\r\ny vainas de cardamomo, si lo deseas, antes\r\nsirviendo. Espolvorear con cilantro fresco\r\ny sirva con chapatis calientes o\r\narroz basmati, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 12:59:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13875,7547,'es','Pollo al curry casero','Una olla india rápida, rústica y auténtica, repleta de toneladas de especias asiáticas picantes y cilantro aromático.','["1 cebolla grande","6 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","50 g de jengibre, picado en trozos grandes","4 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de semilla de hinojo","5 cm de canela en rama","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","8 muslos de pollo, sin piel y deshuesados ​​(unos 800 g)","250 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado"]','["Pique la cebolla en trozos grandes, transfiérala a un procesador de alimentos pequeño y agregue 3 cucharadas de agua; procese hasta obtener una pasta blanda. Puedes usar una batidora de mano para esto o rallar la cebolla en trozos grandes en un tazón; no es necesario agregar agua si estás rallando la cebolla. Vierta en un tazón pequeño y déjelo a un lado.","Coloque el ajo y el jengibre picados en el mismo procesador de alimentos y agregue 4 cucharadas de agua; procese hasta que quede suave y vierta en otro tazón pequeño. Alternativamente, triture el ajo hasta obtener una pasta con un cuchillo o una prensa de ajos y ralle finamente el jengibre.","Calienta el aceite en un wok o sartén resistente a fuego medio. Combine el comino y las semillas de hinojo con la canela y las hojuelas de chile y agréguelos a la sartén de una sola vez. Agite todo durante unos 30 segundos hasta que las especias liberen un aroma fragante.","Agrega la pasta de cebolla; chisporroteará al principio.  Freír hasta que el agua se evapore y las cebollas adquieran un hermoso color dorado oscuro; esto debería tomar entre 7 y 8 minutos.  Agregue la pasta de ajo y jengibre y cocine por otros 2 minutos, revolviendo todo el tiempo.","Agregue el garam masala, la cúrcuma y el azúcar y continúe cocinando durante 20 segundos antes de verter los tomates. Continuar cocinando a fuego medio durante unos 10 minutos sin tapar hasta que los tomates se reduzcan y se oscurezcan.","Corta los muslos de pollo en trozos de 3 cm y agrégalos a la sartén una vez que los tomates se hayan espesado hasta formar una pasta. Cocine durante 5 minutos para cubrir el pollo con masala y sellar los jugos, y luego vierta sobre el caldo de pollo caliente. Cocine a fuego lento durante 8 a 10 minutos sin tapa hasta que el pollo esté tierno y el masala ligeramente espeso; es posible que deba agregar un cucharón extra de caldo o agua si el curry lo necesita. Espolvoree con cilantro picado y sirva con panes planos indios o arroz basmati esponjoso y una taza de yogur como acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 12:59:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13876,4849,'es','Paquetes de pescado al curry con coco','Cocine al vapor pescado sostenible como la tilapia en paquetes de papel de aluminio con pasta de curry, coco y lima y luego sírvalo con arroz para una cena saludable.','["2 filetes grandes de tilapia, de aproximadamente 125 g/4½ oz cada uno","2 cucharaditas de pasta de curry amarillo o rojo","2 cucharaditas de coco rallado","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima, más gajos para servir","1 tsp soy sauce","140 g de arroz basmati","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","1 chile rojo, rebanado","200 g de brócoli cocido de tallo fino, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nCorte 4 trozos grandes de papel de aluminio, doble\r\nluego coloque un filete de pescado en el\r\nmedio de cada uno. Repartir sobre el curry\r\npegar. Divida el coco y la ralladura de lima.\r\ny jugo, y soya entre cada uno\r\nfilete. Levante los lados del papel de aluminio,\r\nluego arruga los bordes y los lados\r\njuntos para hacer 2 paquetes sellados.","Coloque los paquetes en una bandeja para horno y\r\nhornee durante 10-15 minutos. Inclina el arroz\r\nuna cacerola con abundante agua y hervir durante\r\n12-15 minutos o hasta que esté cocido. Escurrir bien.\r\nSirva el pescado sobre el arroz, rocíe sobre el\r\nsalsa de chile y espolvorear con chile en rodajas.\r\nSirva con brócoli y rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 12:59:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13877,6325,'es','Repollo gujarati con coco y patata','Esta guarnición súper saludable y salteada es una deliciosa cena vegetariana servida con arroz y dhal.','["500 g de patatas Charlotte u otras patatas nuevas, sin pelar y cortadas por la mitad","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 pizca de asafoetida (disponible en Bart o steenbergs.co.uk, ver consejo)","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 chiles rojos secos","1 chile rojo o verde fresco, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","1 repollo puntiagudo, finamente rallado","jugo ½ limón","2 cucharadas de coco fresco desecado o rallado, tostado","manojo de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Cocer las patatas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo y sal.\r\nagua durante 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir bien\r\ny regresar a la sartén. Triturar ligeramente con la\r\ndorso de un tenedor, sólo para romper, no para triturar.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y\r\nluego agregue la asafétida, las especias y los secos\r\nchiles. Cocine por unos minutos hasta que\r\nlas especias explotan y los chiles se oscurecen.","Añade el chile fresco, el repollo y un poco\r\nsal y sofríe durante 3-4 minutos. Agrega el tibio\r\npatatas a la sartén y cocinar durante 2-3 minutos.\r\nmás hasta que el repollo esté tierno, pero aún así\r\ntiene algo de mordisco. Agregue el jugo de limón,\r\ncoco y cilantro y servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13878,7549,'es','Guarnición de salmón asado especiado','Sirva salmón con pimentón, jengibre y glaseado de mostaza y miel para obtener un asado original de inspiración india.','["1½ kg de guarnición de salmón, con piel","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para cepillar","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de pimentón","½ cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra molidos gruesos","1 cucharada de mostaza integral","1 cucharadita de miel","1 limón, cortado en gajos, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nForre una fuente grande para hornear con\r\npergamino o papel de aluminio: esto ayuda a prevenir\r\nque el pescado se pegue a la lata mientras\r\ncocineros. Pincelar la piel del salmón con aceite y\r\ncolóquelo, con la piel hacia abajo, sobre el papel.","Mezclar el jengibre molido con el pimentón,\r\npimienta, mostaza, miel y 1 cucharada de aceituna\r\naceite. Extiéndalo uniformemente sobre el lado carnoso.\r\ndel pescado.","Ase, sin tapar, durante unos 20 minutos.\r\nhasta que el salmón esté bien cocido –\r\nCompruébalo metiendo un cuchillo en el filete.\r\ny asegurándose de que el pescado se desmenuce fácilmente.","Sirva directamente de la lata o use\r\nun par de rodajas de pescado para levantar con cuidado\r\nel salmón en un plato grande. Cortar en\r\nporciones y servir con rodajas de limón\r\nen el costado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13879,7551,'es','Ensalada nueva de patatas y tamarindo','El tamarindo se usa comúnmente para dar sabor a las papas en la India y hace que esta ensalada baja en grasa sea auténtica y contundente.','["1½ cucharada de pulpa o pasta de tamarindo","50 g de azúcar mascabado dorado","1 cucharada de comino molido","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, picado","1,2 kg de patatas nuevas","3 cucharadas de yogur natural desnatado","4 cucharadas de cilantro picado"]','["Para hacer el aderezo, pon el tamarindo.\r\npulpa en una cacerola pequeña, verter sobre 75 ml\r\nagua hirviendo y agregar el azúcar, el comino\r\ny jengibre. Cocine a fuego lento, sin tapa, hasta\r\nel apósito se espesa y se vuelve\r\nalmibarado, unos 10-15 minutos. Debería tener un\r\nSabor agradable: agregue más azúcar si es necesario.","Mientras se cocina el tamarindo, traiga un\r\ncacerola grande con agua con sal hasta que hierva y\r\nañade las patatas. Volver a hervir y\r\ncocine durante 15 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir, luego\r\ndéjelos enfriar un poco antes de partirlos por la mitad. Transferir\r\na un tazón grande para mezclar y vierta sobre el\r\naderezo, revolviendo suavemente para asegurarse de que\r\nlas patatas estén bien cubiertas. Rocíe sobre el\r\nyogur, espolvorear por encima el cilantro y\r\nsirva tibio o a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 12:59:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13880,7553,'es','Pollo al curry adecuado','Impresiona con este plato indio especiado con tandoori masala, pimientos, coco y cilantro fresco.','["6 cucharadas de tandoori masala en polvo","2 cucharadas de pasta de jengibre","2 cucharadas de pasta de ajo","500 g de yogur de coco en bote, más algo extra para servir","4 cebollas, 2 cortadas en gajos, 2 picadas","2 pimientos, cortados en trozos grandes","1¼ kg de muslos de pollo sin piel y cortados en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","manojo grande de cilantro, con los tallos picados","2-3 cucharaditas de chile picante en polvo","Tarro de puré de 680ml","Lata de 160ml de crema de coco","arroz y pan naan, para servir"]','["En un bol muy grande, mezcle la mitad de la\r\nmezcla de especias, 1 cucharada de cada una de las pastas,\r\ntres cuartas partes del yogur y\r\nun poco de sal. Agregue las rodajas de cebolla,\r\npimientos y pollo, luego dejar reposar\r\nmarinar durante la noche en el refrigerador.","Freír las cebollas picadas en el aceite.\r\nhasta que esté muy suave. Agrega el resto\r\nmezclas y pastas de especias, el cilantro\r\ntallos y chile en polvo. cocinar para\r\n1 min, luego agregue 100 ml de agua y\r\nla passata. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos,\r\nluego agrega la crema de coco y\r\nyogur restante. dejar trozos\r\no mezclar con una licuadora.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nExtienda el pollo y las verduras sobre una\r\nbandeja para hornear. Ase durante 15-20 minutos\r\nhasta que esté cocido y ligeramente carbonizado. consejo\r\nen la salsa. Sirva con arroz, naan,\r\nextra de yogur y hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 12:59:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13881,5774,'es','Sopa india de garbanzos y verduras','Saludable, llena de sabor y económica, esta sopa es ideal para llevar al trabajo en el almuerzo.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla grande, picada","1 cucharadita de raíz de jengibre fresco finamente rallado","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 cucharada de garam masala","850 ml de caldo de verduras","2 zanahorias grandes, cortadas en cuartos a lo largo y picadas","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","100 g de judías verdes picadas"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana, luego agrega\r\nla cebolla, el jengibre y el ajo. Freír durante 2 minutos,\r\nLuego agrega el garam masala, dale 1 min.\r\nmás, luego agregue el caldo y las zanahorias. cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 10 minutos, luego agrega los garbanzos. usa un palo\r\nlicuadora para batir un poco la sopa. Agregue el\r\nlos frijoles y cocine a fuego lento durante 3 minutos. Empacar en un matraz\r\no, si tienes un microondas en el trabajo, enfríalo y\r\ncalentar para el almuerzo. Genial con pan naan."]','2026-01-11 12:59:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13882,6552,'es','Arroz indio picante','El delicioso arroz picante de Sara Buenfeld es perfecto para acompañar tu curry favorito','["una taza llena de arroz americano de grano largo","2 cebollas, rebanadas","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 rama de canela","6 vainas de cardamomo","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","un puñado grande de pasas y anacardos tostados"]','["Freír las cebollas en el aceite de girasol.\r\nen una sartén grande durante 10-12\r\nminutos hasta que esté dorado.","Llene una cacerola espaciosa con agua, déjela hervir y agregue una cucharadita colmada de sal; el agua burbujeará furiosamente. Añade la cúrcuma y\r\nla ramita de canela al agua. Vierta el arroz, revuelva una vez y vuelva a hervir, luego baje un poco el fuego para que el agua hierva de manera constante, pero no vigorosamente.\r\nHierva sin tapar, sin revolver (esto hace arroz pegajoso) durante 10 minutos. Saque un poco con una espumadera y mordisquee uno o dos granos. Si están muy crujientes, cocínalas un minuto más y prueba nuevamente. Deben quedar tiernos pero con un poco de mordisco.\r\nEscurrir el arroz en un colador grande y enjuagar vertiendo sobre una tetera con agua muy caliente.","Revuelva las semillas trituradas\r\nde las vainas de cardamomo en las cebollas con\r\nlas semillas de comino y sofreír brevemente.","Agregue un puñado grande de pasas y\r\nanacardos tostados, luego el caliente\r\narroz escurrido. Esto es genial con curry.\r\ny también dará un toque exótico a la carne o al pescado a la parrilla."]','2026-01-11 12:59:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13883,7557,'es','Pasteles de pescado con especias indias','Dale sabor al salmón cocido sobrante en estos sencillos pasteles de pescado congelables con raita refrescante','["600 g de patatas, en cuartos si son grandes","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado","1 huevo batido","100 g de salmón sobrante cocido, desmenuzado en trozos grandes","harina común, para rebozar","25 g de mantequilla y 1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","sobras de mayonesa de aguacate, raita o chutney de mango, para servir"]','["Hervir las patatas. Mientras tanto, sofreír los\r\nsemillas de comino durante un par de segundos en una olla grande\r\nsartén antiadherente. Cuando esté blanda, escurrir la\r\npatatas, volver a la cacerola, añadir el\r\ncomino, cebolla, chile y cilantro con\r\nmucho condimento, luego triture bien.\r\nCuando se enfríe un poco, agregue 2 cucharadas de\r\nel huevo, luego revuelva con cuidado a través del\r\nsalmón. Forme 4 tortas ásperas, luego\r\ncubrir con harina. Si se congela, congélelo en un\r\nbandeja para hornear hasta que esté sólida, luego empacar.","En la sartén derretir la mantequilla con\r\nel aceite. Freír las tartas durante unos 2 minutos.\r\ncada lado hasta que esté dorado. Servir con el\r\nmayonesa, raita (receta a continuación) o mango\r\nchutney y unas hojas de ensalada."]','2026-01-11 12:59:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13884,7559,'es','Verduras especiadas indias','Esta receta se adapta a cualquier verdura que tengas a mano, desde col rizada rallada hasta coles de Bruselas. Para los menos aventureros, se puede utilizar menos chile.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de semilla de mostaza","4 chiles verdes, finamente picados","Un trozo grande de raíz de jengibre fresco, rallado.","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","500 g de verduras ralladas, como col rizada, coles de Bruselas o cualquier otra","100 g de guisantes","jugo 1 limon","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de coco rallado sin azúcar"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande o en un wok.\r\nchisporrotear el comino y las semillas de mostaza durante 1 min,\r\nluego agrega la guindilla, el jengibre y la cúrcuma. freír\r\nhasta que esté aromático, luego agregue las verduras, una pizca\r\nde sal, un chorrito de agua y los guisantes.","Cubra la sartén y cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que las verduras\r\nse han marchitado. Agrega el jugo de limón molido.\r\ncilantro, la mitad del cilantro fresco y la mitad\r\nel coco desecado, luego tirar todo\r\njuntos. Apilar en una fuente para servir y esparcir.\r\ncon el resto del coco y el cilantro."]','2026-01-11 12:59:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13885,7561,'es','Kulfi de agua de rosas y pistachos con mangos asados','El kulfi suele elaborarse con leche hervida durante varias horas. Esta versión furtiva está hecha con leche condensada, por lo que todo el trabajo duro ya está hecho por ti.','["450g lata de leche condensada","2 cucharadas de agua de rosas","50 g de pistachos muy finamente picados, más pistachos picados en trozos grandes para servir","Tarrina 284ml crema doble","3 mangos pequeños y maduros"]','["Exprime la leche condensada en un bol.\r\ny agregue el agua de rosas y los pistachos.\r\nBatir ligeramente la nata hasta que mantenga su\r\nDéle forma y luego incorpórelo a la mezcla de pistacho.","Vierta en 6 moldes pequeños o pirámide.\r\nmoldes. Congelar y luego cubrir con film transparente.","Para servir: corte cada mango a cada lado del hueso para formar 6 mitades, pero no los pele. Puntuación\r\nHaz una cruz en la carne, pero no cortes la piel. Puedes hacer esto con varias horas de anticipación. Cocine en la barbacoa con la carne hacia abajo hasta que comience a caramelizar. Déjelo como está o déle la vuelta para que los segmentos queden orgullosos. Sirva con el kulfi espolvoreado con los pistachos (y un chorrito de lima,\r\nsi quieres)."]','2026-01-11 12:59:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13886,7563,'es','Chutney de tomate fresco','Un acompañamiento indio fresco que combina bien con pan naan o poppadums, ideal para un buffet de Año Nuevo o Diwali.','["6 tomates grandes maduros en rama","1 cebolla morada grande, finamente picada","2 puñados de cilantro fresco, finamente picado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino"]','["Cortar los tomates por la mitad, quitarles las semillas, picar la pulpa y colocarlos en un colador sobre un bol para que se escurra el exceso de jugo.","Pon la cebolla y el cilantro en un bol. Calienta el aceite y fríe las semillas de comino durante unos 30 segundos y luego viértelas en el bol. Incorpora los tomates, tapa y deja enfriar.","Para servir, agregue un poco de sal (vea el consejo a continuación) y sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:59:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13887,7565,'es','Carbonara auténtica','Esta auténtica e infalible receta de carbonara te muestra cómo conseguir una salsa perfecta y sedosa en todo momento, sin huevos revueltos ni estrés.','["340 g de tocino","2 huevos, más 5-6 yemas (congela las claras sobrantes para usarlas en otra receta)","150 g de pecorino romano rallado y más para servir","400 g de medio rigatoni o espagueti"]','["Retire la cáscara del guanciale y deséchelo. Cortar el guanciale en rodajas de ½ cm de grosor y luego en tiras gruesas. Freír el guanciale en una sartén a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos para que la grasa se vaya deshaciendo lentamente; cuando esté listo, el guanciale estará crujiente y dorado. Retire el guanciale de la grasa con una espumadera y séquelo con papel de cocina. Deseche la mitad de la grasa en la sartén y reserve el resto; no enjuague la sartén.","Para el sabayón, bata los huevos, las yemas y el queso rallado en un bol grande resistente al calor con un buen toque de pimienta negra y la grasa guanciale reservada. Coloque el recipiente sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, asegurándose de que el recipiente no toque el agua, y cocine durante 2-3 minutos, batiendo hasta que la mezcla tenga una consistencia espesa, parecida a una natilla (si tiene un termómetro de cocina, el sabayón estará listo cuando alcance los 64 ° C). No dejes que el agua hierva o se revolverán los huevos.","Cocine la pasta en una olla grande con agua hirviendo con sal siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que esté al dente. Escurrir, reservando una taza de agua de cocción.","Pon la pasta cocida en la sartén que usaste para cocinar el guanciale y mezcla bien con la grasa residual a fuego lento. Retirar del fuego y agregar el sabayón, seguido de un chorrito del agua de cocción de la pasta reservada para que se afloje y cree una consistencia cremosa y picante. Revuelva y agregue la pasta a la salsa para asegurarse de que quede bien cubierta.","Agrega el guanciale crujiente y abundante pimienta negra recién molida. Sirva en tazones grandes para pasta y cubra con queso rallado extra."]','2026-01-11 12:59:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13888,7567,'es','Muffuletta rellena italiana','Pruebe nuestra versión del clásico sándwich italoamericano de Nueva Orleans. Empaquételo para un picnic: el sabor y la textura mejoran cuando se deja enfriar durante la noche.','["400 g de pan redondo","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","300 g de encurtidos de verduras mixtas, picados en trozos grandes","60 g de aceitunas con ajo y chile deshuesadas, picadas en trozos grandes","2 filetes de anchoa, finamente picados","10 g de albahaca, picada en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","9 rodajas de emmental","85 g de lonchas de salami","150g mortadela Morrisons The Best"]','["Corta con cuidado un círculo de 15 cm de la parte superior de la barra de pan y resérvalo. Retire la mayor parte del pan del interior de la hogaza hasta que quede casi hueco, dejando una cáscara de aproximadamente 1 a 2 cm de grosor (puede congelar el pan extraído para hacer pan rallado o picatostes para otra receta).","Rocíe el interior del pan con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva. Combine los pepinillos, las aceitunas, las anchoas, la albahaca, el vinagre y el aceite restante en un tazón mediano. Sazone con sal y pimienta, luego vierta unas cucharadas de la mezcla sobre la base del pan ahuecado.","Cubra la base con 3 rodajas de emmental, 4-5 rodajas de salami y 3 rodajas de mortadela antes de cubrir con más mezcla de verduras. Repita, colocando capas de los ingredientes hasta que se hayan utilizado todas las verduras, la carne y el queso. Vuelva a colocar la ''tapa'' cortada en rodajas en la parte superior del pan y luego envuélvala bien.","Coloque el pan en un plato y luego péselo apilando otro plato con un par de latas encima. Déjelo enfriar durante 1 a 2 horas (o toda la noche, si tiene tiempo) antes de cortarlo y servirlo."]','2026-01-11 12:59:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13889,7569,'es','Caponata de siguiente nivel','Prepare este clásico italiano con anticipación y sírvalo como celebración de los ingredientes veraniegos de temporada. Sírvelo a temperatura ambiente como entrante o acompañamiento.','["2 berenjenas grandes o 3 pequeñas, cortadas en trozos pequeños","200ml de aceite de oliva, o el necesario","1 diente de ajo (úsalo primero para el crostini, si lo haces)","4 palitos de apio, hojas cortadas y ralladas, palitos cortados en trozos pequeños","1 cebolla, finamente picada","una pizca de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto (asegúrese de que sea vegano, si es necesario)","Lata de 400 g de tomates finamente picados (o utilizar estilo passata)","1 cucharada de alcaparras, picadas en trozos grandes","un puñado grande de aceitunas verdes sin hueso, picadas en trozos grandes","un pequeño puñado de hojas de albahaca, hojas cortadas y cortadas toscamente, tallos atados","2 cucharadas de piñones tostados","1 pan pequeño de baguette o ciabatta, cortado en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor"]','["Coloque los trozos de berenjena en un colador, sazone generosamente con sal y luego revuelva para cubrir. Coloque el colador en el fregadero o sobre un tazón, luego coloque un platillo o plato pequeño encima y péselo con algunas latas (esto ayudará a extraer el exceso de humedad, por lo que necesitará menos aceite al freír). Dejar reposar durante al menos 30 minutos o hasta 1 hora.","Seque la berenjena con papel de cocina y luego caliente 3-4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto. Freír la berenjena en dos tandas durante unos minutos hasta que esté dorada y suave, añadiendo más aceite según sea necesario para que la sartén nunca se seque. Vierta la berenjena cocida en un bol y reserve.","Para el crostini, calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Colocar las rebanadas de baguette en una bandeja para horno en una sola capa, luego rociar generosamente con un poco de aceite de oliva. Hornee durante 12-15 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad, hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Mientras aún está caliente, frota el diente de ajo sobre las rodajas. Dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente. El crostini se puede preparar con un día de anticipación y guardarlo en un recipiente hermético. Mientras tanto, calentar otro chorrito de aceite en la sartén utilizada para las berenjenas y sofreír el apio picado durante unos 6 minutos, o hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Esparza la cebolla y cocine durante 8-10 minutos más hasta que esté suave y dorada. Pica finamente el diente de ajo que usaste para el crostini y espárcelo junto con las hojuelas de chile, si las usas. Cocine por un minuto más, luego agregue el azúcar y el puré de tomate. Cocine durante 2 minutos, luego agregue el vinagre y deje hervir durante 10-15 minutos hasta que espese y se reduzca.","Agregue los tomates enlatados y cocine a fuego lento, luego agregue las berenjenas, las alcaparras, las aceitunas y los tallos de albahaca en manojos. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos más, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que esté espeso, rico y brillante. Apague el fuego y agregue otra cucharada de aceite de oliva, luego pruebe y ajuste el condimento; desea un equilibrio de sabores agridulces, con un toque salado de las aceitunas y las alcaparras. Deje enfriar a temperatura ambiente antes de retirar y desechar los tallos de albahaca. Revuelva la mayor parte de la albahaca desmenuzada. Se mantendrá frío durante tres días o, si se sirve al día siguiente, déjelo en un recipiente hermético a temperatura ambiente. (La caponata se sirve mejor a temperatura ambiente)."]','2026-01-11 12:59:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13890,6381,'es','Tagliatelle de espinacas con gambas al ajillo','Necesitarás una máquina de pasta para hacer los tallarines de Matty, que contienen espinacas para darle un impulso nutritivo. Una salsa ligera con tomates y gambas crea un plato vibrante','["100 g de espinacas","2 huevos grandes","300 g de harina para pasta ''00'', más un poco más para espolvorear","250 g de tomates cherry","6 dientes de ajo, 4 con piel, 2 pelados","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","165 g de langostinos crudos","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado"]','["Para hacer la pasta, agregue las espinacas y los huevos a un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que las espinacas estén finamente picadas. Vierta la harina sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia y haga un hueco en el centro. Vierta la mezcla de espinacas y huevo en el pozo y use un tenedor para combinar los ingredientes. Cuando comience a formarse una masa, use sus manos para darle forma de bola y amase durante 5 a 10 minutos, o hasta que la masa quede suave. Forme una bola limpia, cubra y deje reposar durante 30 minutos.","Para hacer la salsa de tomate, calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Poner los tomates en una fuente para horno pequeña. Golpea ligeramente los dientes de ajo sin pelar con el dorso del cuchillo y agrégalos al plato. Mezcle con 4 cucharadas de aceite y un poco de condimento, luego ase durante 30 minutos, hasta que los tomates revienten.","Mientras tanto, machaque los dientes de ajo pelados restantes, mezcle la ralladura de limón y la mitad del jugo, las hojuelas de chile y un poco de condimento. Incorpora las gambas y déjalas marinar en el frigorífico durante 10 a 15 minutos mientras extiendes la pasta.","Espolvorea una superficie de trabajo limpia con harina. Divide la masa de pasta reposada en tercios y aplana ligeramente con la palma de tu mano. Coge un trozo de masa y deja los otros dos tapados. Comience con la posición más espesa de su máquina para hacer pasta y enrolle la masa. Avanza por los ajustes, reduciendo uno cada vez y espolvoreando la masa con harina adicional según sea necesario para evitar que se pegue, hasta alcanzar el espesor deseado. Espolvorear con un poco más de harina, doblar muy holgadamente formando un rectángulo y cortar en tiras de 1 cm de grosor. Mezcle cada tira con un poco más de harina y luego déjela a un lado en una bandeja para hornear espolvoreada. Repita con los trozos restantes de masa.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua con sal y agregue la pasta. Cocine durante 3 minutos, hasta que esté al dente, luego escurra bien y reserve una taza de agua para la pasta. Mientras se cocina la pasta, pon una sartén grande a fuego medio. Echa 1 cucharada de aceite en la sartén y, una vez caliente, añade las gambas. Freír durante 3-4 minutos, revolviendo bien, hasta que estén rosados ​​y bien cocidos. Incorpora los tomates asados, la pasta cocida, la mitad del perejil y un chorrito del agua de cocción. Mezcle para combinar y sazone al gusto con sal, pimienta y el jugo de limón restante. Adorne con el perejil restante y una pizca de pimienta negra para servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13891,7571,'es','Raviolis de espinacas y ricotta con mantequilla de salvia','Matty rellena estos raviolis simples con espinacas cremosas y ricotta, luego los mezcla con una salsa fragante y mantecosa. (Necesitarás una máquina de pasta para esto)','["400 g de harina para pasta ''00'', más un poco más para espolvorear","4 huevos grandes","200 g de espinacas","500 g de ricota","1⁄2 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1⁄4 cucharadita","50 g de parmesano rallado","100 g de mantequilla","12 hojas de salvia","50 g de parmesano, finamente rallado"]','["Vierta la harina sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia y haga un hueco en el centro. Rompe los huevos en el pozo y usa un tenedor para combinar los ingredientes. Cuando comience a formarse una masa, use sus manos para darle forma de bola y amase durante 5 a 10 minutos, o hasta que la masa quede suave. Forme una bola limpia, cubra y deje reposar durante 30 minutos.","Hervir una tetera llena de agua. Para hacer el relleno, agregue las espinacas a un colador y vierta sobre el agua hervida hasta que se ablanden. Deje que se enfríe un poco, luego colóquelo sobre una toalla limpia y úsela para exprimir las espinacas sobre un fregadero para eliminar el exceso de agua. Vierta sobre una tabla de cortar y pique finamente. Agrega la ricota a un bol con las hojuelas de chile, la nuez moscada y el parmesano, y sazona con sal y pimienta. Mezcle con un tenedor y luego agregue las espinacas. Tapar y reservar en el frigorífico.","Una vez reposada la masa, divídela en cuartos y aplana ligeramente cada uno con la palma de tu mano. Coge uno de los trozos de masa y deja los otros tres tapados. Comience con la posición más espesa de su máquina para hacer pasta y enrolle la masa. Avanza a través de los ajustes, reduciendo uno cada vez y espolvoreando la masa con harina adicional según sea necesario para evitar que se pegue, hasta llegar al ajuste más fino. Repita con los trozos restantes de masa.","Espolvorea una superficie de trabajo limpia con harina y extiende todas las láminas de pasta. Coge una hoja y puntea cucharaditas de relleno en el centro, dejando 2 cm entre cada una. Cepille los bordes de la pasta con un poco de agua y luego coloque otra hoja encima. Comience por un extremo y presione hacia abajo alrededor de cada cucharadita de relleno para eliminar el aire y sellar la pasta. Repita con el resto del relleno y las láminas de pasta. Use un cuchillo o un cortador de pasta para recortar los bordes de la pasta y luego corte cada ravioli. Espolvorea una bandeja para hornear grande con harina y coloca los ravioles en la bandeja.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua con sal. Reduzca a fuego lento, agregue con cuidado los raviolis y cocine durante 4-5 minutos. Agrega la mantequilla a una sartén grande a fuego medio. Una vez derretida y espumosa, agrega la salvia y cocina hasta que la mantequilla esté ligeramente dorada. Con una espumadera, agregue los ravioles cocidos a la sartén con mantequilla y revuelva suavemente para cubrirlos. Sirva con queso parmesano esparcido por encima."]','2026-01-11 12:59:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13892,7573,'es','Espaguetis al ajillo y aceite con bacon crujiente','Disfrute de esta cena de espagueti súper simple y súper rápida, con ajo, perejil y tocino mezclados con pasta. Es ideal para los días en los que tu frigorífico está vacío.','["75 ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","4 lonchas de tocino rayado","400 g de espaguetis","6 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","25 g de perejil fresco, finamente picado"]','["Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente y cocina el tocino a fuego medio durante 5-6 minutos hasta que esté crujiente. Retirar del fuego dejando el aceite. Deje escurrir sobre papel de cocina y, cuando esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, pique finamente.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua con sal y cocine los espaguetis siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Unos minutos antes de que la pasta esté lista, vierte el resto del aceite en la sartén y cocina el ajo a fuego medio-bajo durante 1-2 minutos hasta que esté fragante y comience a dorarse (no dejes que se queme o tendrá un sabor amargo).","Escurrir la pasta, reservar un poco de agua para la pasta y verterla en el aceite de ajo. Esparza el perejil y dóblelo, agregando un chorrito de agua de pasta para aflojar, si es necesario. Vierta en tazones y esparza sobre el tocino."]','2026-01-11 12:59:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13893,7575,'es','milanesa de berenjena','Dale a las suaves berenjenas un toque extra de sabor con alcaparras, chile y mucho queso en esta milanesa. Sirva junto con nuestros espaguetis con tomate y alcaparras.','["2 berenjenas grandes, sin tallos y cortadas en cuartos a lo largo","aceite de oliva, para freír","4 cucharadas de harina","2 huevos","100 g de pan rallado seco, como panko","½ cucharadita de ajo granulado","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","20 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado y virutas adicionales para servir","350 g de espaguetis","un puñado de albahaca, para servir","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","1 cucharada de alcaparras","una pizca grande de hojuelas de chile"]','["Espolvoree 1 cucharadita de sal fina sobre los lados carnosos de las berenjenas y déjelas reposar durante 1 hora.","Secar las berenjenas con una hoja de papel de cocina. Calentar 1-2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofreír las berenjenas unos minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas. Pasar a un plato con unas pinzas y dejar enfriar.","Para la salsa de tomate, calienta el aceite de oliva en la misma sartén a fuego medio (no es necesario limpiarlo primero) y sofríe los ajos un minuto. Agregue el puré de tomate, los tomates enlatados, el orégano, el azúcar, las alcaparras, las hojuelas de chile y una pizca de sal. Burbujee, cubierto con una tapa, durante 30 minutos hasta que esté rico y picante.","Vierta la harina en un plato y sazone. Batir los huevos con un chorrito de agua en un recipiente poco profundo, luego combinar el pan rallado, el ajo granulado, el orégano y el parmesano en otro plato o recipiente poco profundo. Pasar las berenjenas por harina, sacudir el exceso y pasarlas por huevo y luego por pan rallado. Si te sobra pan rallado, puedes repetir el proceso solo con el huevo y el pan rallado. En esta etapa, las berenjenas se pueden enfriar hasta por un día.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C/gas 4. Llena la base de una sartén grande con aceite y calienta a fuego medio. Freír las berenjenas durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén crujientes y doradas, luego transferirlas a una bandeja para hornear y hornear durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Mientras tanto, cocine los espaguetis en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo con sal siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, o hasta que estén al dente. Levante los espaguetis directamente en la salsa con unas pinzas, de modo que unas gotas de agua de la pasta caigan en la sartén. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos en la salsa para cubrir, luego divida en platos y cubra con las berenjenas, la albahaca y las virutas de parmesano."]','2026-01-11 12:59:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13894,7577,'es','Focaccia de siguiente nivel','Reserva un tiempo para un poco de terapia en la cocina y hornea este clásico pan italiano para disfrutar de un sabroso manjar. Es mejor comerlo inmediatamente, pero se conserva durante dos días.','["200 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","½ sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","400 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","½ sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","10 g de sal fina","100 ml de aceite de oliva","1 cabeza de ajo","2 ramitas de romero, hojas recogidas","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas"]','["Para hacer el prefermento, mezclar la harina con la levadura y 200 g de agua a temperatura ambiente en un bol pequeño, tapar el bol y dejar fermentar durante 12-24 horas. No te preocupes por que suba y baje nuevamente: se trata solo de crear sabor.","Para la masa, verter el prefermento en un bol grande y verter sobre 225 g de agua tibia. Revuelva con una espátula para combinar. Vierta la harina y el resto de la levadura y mezcle todo para formar una masa rugosa. Asegúrate de que toda la harina esté mezclada y que no queden trozos secos en los lados del tazón. Tapar y dejar reposar durante al menos 30 minutos o hasta 1 hora.","Esparce la sal fina sobre la masa, sumerge una mano en agua y tritura la sal en la masa para mezclarla por completo. Cubrir nuevamente y dejar reposar durante 20-30 minutos.","Mójate las manos, toma la masa por un lado y estírala sobre sí misma. Repetir con el otro lado, debe quedar muy elástico. Enrolle la masa sobre sí misma para que quede suave y flexible, luego cubra y déjela por otros 20-30 minutos. Repita este proceso dos veces más, luego cubra y deje reposar durante 2-3 horas hasta que suba aproximadamente un 40 por ciento; la masa debe estar burbujeante y suave.","Rocíe una bandeja para hornear profunda de aproximadamente 20 x 30 cm con 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y raspe la masa sobre la bandeja. Incorporar el aceite a la masa estirándola y doblándola sobre la bandeja. No te preocupes si al principio está un poco fibroso, sigue estirándolo y volviendo a colocarlo sobre sí mismo. Cuando la masa esté unida y aceitosa, tapar y dejar reposar a temperatura ambiente durante 2 horas, o para un sabor mucho mejor, hasta 48 horas en el frigorífico. Retirar de la nevera 1 hora antes de hornear.","Calienta el horno a 230C/210C ventilador/gas 7. Mientras tanto, corta la parte superior de la cabeza de ajo para exponer los dientes. Coloque el ajo sobre un trozo de papel de aluminio, rocíelo con 1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva y sazone con sal. Envuelva el bulbo en papel de aluminio para crear un paquete, colóquelo en una bandeja y ase durante 25 minutos. Retirar del horno y dejar hasta que se enfríe lo suficiente como para manipularlo, luego quitar la piel de los dientes de ajo; no es necesario que estén completamente suaves en este punto.","Use sus dedos para estirar la masa para que encaje uniformemente en la bandeja, luego haga hoyuelos en la superficie con las yemas de los dedos. Introduzca los dientes de ajo y las hojas de romero profundamente en la masa, espaciados uniformemente. Rocíe con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva y haga hoyuelos unas cuantas veces más para crear charcos de aceite en la superficie. Esparce sobre 1 cucharadita de hojuelas de sal marina, dale un último toque a la masa y hornea durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté inflada y dorada. Retirar del horno, rociar con el aceite de oliva restante y dejar enfriar durante al menos 40 minutos antes de cortar y servir. Es mejor consumirlo de inmediato, pero se conservará durante dos días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 12:59:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13895,7579,'es','Arancini para freidora de aire','Utilice su freidora para hacer estas bolas de arroz doradas y crujientes: son un acompañamiento ideal para un festín de inspiración italiana.','["15 g de mantequilla sin sal","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo grande, triturado","200 g de arroz para risotto","700 ml de caldo de pollo o de verduras caliente","50 g de parmesano, finamente rallado, y un poco más para servir","125 g de queso mozzarella","100 g de harina común","2 huevos batidos","100 g de pan rallado seco (nosotros usamos panko)","spray de aceite de oliva, para nebulizar"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola grande a fuego medio y cocine la cebolla y el ajo durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el arroz y cocine por 1 minuto, luego agregue la mitad del caldo, revolviendo bien.","Continúe cocinando el risotto durante 20 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente y agregando más caldo a medida que se absorba, hasta que el arroz esté tierno y cremoso. Agregue el parmesano y luego sazone al gusto. Extender sobre una bandeja y dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente.","Corta la mozzarella en 12 trozos y sécala con papel de cocina.","Forme 12 bolas del mismo tamaño con el risotto. Aplana una de las bolitas en la palma de tu mano y añade un trozo de mozzarella. Levante los bordes para encerrarlo y luego forme una bola ordenada. Repita para hacer 12 bolas.","Pasa cada bola de risotto por la harina, luego por el huevo y finalmente por el pan rallado hasta que quede cubierta uniformemente. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para freír al aire, o hasta que esté listo y mantenga bien su forma.","Calentar la freidora a 190C. Rocíe los arancini con aceite de oliva en aerosol y cocínelos en tandas durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que estén crujientes y dorados. Espolvorea con parmesano antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 12:59:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13896,7581,'es','Espaguetis con ajo y aceite','Mezcle ajo dorado y aceite de oliva sedoso con los espaguetis para preparar este clásico plato italiano, listo en el tiempo que lleva hervir la pasta. Es sencillo, sabroso y perfecto para los días ajetreados.','["200 g de espaguetis","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","3-4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1/2 chile rojo pequeño, finamente picado (opcional)","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado"]','["Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua bien salada y cocine los espaguetis durante unos 10 minutos, o hasta que estén al dente; deben conservar un poco de mordisco.","Cuando la pasta esté casi lista, caliente el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y chisporrotee el ajo y el chile, si lo usa, durante 1 minuto hasta que esté fragante y el ajo esté ligeramente dorado pero no dorado (el ajo tendrá un sabor amargo si se oscurece demasiado).","Escurrir los espaguetis y añadirlos al aceite de ajo con el perejil. Sazone y revuelva para combinar, luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 12:59:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13897,7583,'es','Focaccia de aceitunas, tomate cherry y queso feta','Hornea esta deliciosa focaccia con los sabores del Mediterráneo; es ideal para un picnic. O pruébelo sin aceitunas, tomates y queso feta para obtener una focaccia simple muy confiable.','["500 g de harina fuerte para pan, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para la lata","200 g de tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad (una mezcla de colores queda bien)","un manojo pequeño de orégano, con las hojas recogidas o use 1 cucharadita de orégano seco","150 g de aceitunas kalamata, sin hueso","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón grande con la levadura y 2 cucharaditas de sal y mezcle. Agrega 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, luego vierte lentamente 350 ml de agua tibia y continúa mezclando hasta obtener una masa ligeramente pegajosa. Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada, raspando los lados del tazón. Amasar durante 5-10 minutos hasta que la masa esté suave y menos pegajosa, luego poner en un recipiente limpio, cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar durante 1 hora hasta que doble su tamaño.","Engrase generosamente un molde para hornear rectangular poco profundo (el nuestro medía 20 x 30 cm). Vierta la masa y luego use las manos para estirarla hasta que llegue a las esquinas del molde. Cubrir con un paño de cocina limpio y dejar reposar durante 35-45 minutos más. Mientras tanto, vierta los tomates en un bol, sazone, agregue el orégano y rocíe con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva. Mezcle y reserve.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Presiona las mitades de tomate uniformemente en la masa, luego haz lo mismo con las aceitunas. Desmenuza el queso feta y luego vuelve a presionarlo ligeramente con las yemas de los dedos. Rocíe con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva y espolvoree con sal marina, luego hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté bien dorado e inflado. Mientras el pan aún está caliente, rocíe la cucharada restante de aceite de oliva. Dejar enfriar completamente en el molde y luego cortar en rodajas. Puede envolverlo en la lata para llevarlo de picnic o envolverlo en cuadrados individuales. Se mantendrá envuelto o en un recipiente hermético hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13898,7585,'es','galletas ricciarelli','Prepara estas galletas de almendras de inspiración italiana. Regálalo a familiares y amigos en Navidad o haz un lote para tu propia lata de galletas como regalo.','["2 claras de huevo (usa las yemas en otra receta, como arroz frito)","½ cucharadita de extracto de almendras","1 limón, rallado","200 g de azúcar glas y un poco más para espolvorear","260 g de almendras molidas"]','["Batir las claras de huevo a punto de nieve en un recipiente limpio, luego agregar el extracto de almendras y la ralladura de limón.","En un bol aparte, tamizamos el azúcar glas, las almendras molidas y una pizca de sal. Incorpora esto suavemente a las claras de huevo batidas hasta que todo forme una masa. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos 4 horas, o idealmente durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Colocar la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo espolvoreada generosamente con azúcar glas. Enrolle hasta obtener una salchicha larga y gruesa (de unos 40 cm de largo) y corte rodajas de 2 cm de grosor a lo largo (debe obtener unas 20). Forme un óvalo con cada rebanada y golpee un poco la parte superior; las galletas deben tener unos 4-5 cm de ancho y 5-6 cm de largo. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear y espolvoree con más azúcar glas.","Hornee durante 20-23 minutos hasta que las galletas se doren. Estarán suaves, pero se endurecerán a medida que se enfríen. Dejar enfriar completamente en la bandeja. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 12:59:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13899,7587,'es','Gajos de col asada al estilo italiano con lentejas con tomate','Repollo asado como centro vegetal, con hojas crujientes y caramelizadas por fuera y un centro suave y dulce. Sirva con nuestras lentejas de inspiración italiana y patatas nuevas doradas asadas.','["100ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","4 dientes de ajo, machacados","2 coles verdes pequeñas, sin hojas exteriores, cada una cortada en 6 gajos","750 g de patatas tiernas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 limones, rallados","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","2 tallos de apio, finamente picados","250 g de lentejas rojas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cubitos de caldo de verduras","3 cucharadas de puré de tomates secos","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","manojo pequeño de albahaca, finamente picada, más unas cuantas hojas enteras para servir","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, machacado","½ -1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","3 rebanadas gruesas de pan duro crujiente o de masa madre, sin corteza y rebozadas en pan rallado (aproximadamente 120 g)","1 limón, rallado","100 g de aceitunas Kalamata, deshuesadas y picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Llevar a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua y blanquear las patatas durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén tiernas, luego escurrir y dejar enfriar.","Para el repollo, mezcle el aceite y el ajo, frote los gajos, sazone y luego extiéndalos en una bandeja para hornear grande. Ase en el estante superior durante 15 minutos.","Mientras se cocina el repollo, coloque las patatas nuevas en una bandeja para hornear grande y tritúrelas suavemente con el dorso de una cuchara o un machacador para que se abran un poco. Rocíe el aceite y un poco de condimento, luego agregue la ralladura de limón. Una vez que el repollo haya tenido 15 minutos, coloque las patatas en el estante superior del horno y mueva el repollo al fondo. Cocine por 45 minutos, volteando todo a la mitad.","Para las lentejas, calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana y fríe las cebollas y el apio hasta que estén suaves y traslúcidos, aproximadamente de 10 a 15 minutos. Agregue las lentejas, los tomates, 450 ml de agua, los cubitos de caldo, el puré de tomate y el vinagre, lleve a ebullición y cocine a fuego lento sin tapar durante 30-35 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que las lentejas estén suaves y bien cocidas. Si la mezcla se seca un poco, añade un chorrito de agua para que no se pegue. Agregue la albahaca y 50 ml adicionales de agua hirviendo para aflojar la mezcla. Sazone bien.","Mientras se cocinan las lentejas, haz el pangrattato. Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, sofreír el ajo y la guindilla durante 30 segundos y luego añadir el pan rallado. Tuesta hasta que esté dorado y crujiente, luego agrega la ralladura de limón y las aceitunas y fríe durante 3 minutos más. Dejar enfriar.","Para servir, coloque las lentejas en cada plato, coloque una rodaja de repollo encima y espolvoree sobre el pangrattato. Adorne con albahaca extra y sirva las patatas a un lado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13900,7589,'es','Lasaña de berenjena y parmesana','Combine dos clásicos italianos (parmigiana y lasaña) en este horneado de verduras. Es ideal para cocinar por lotes, ya que puedes congelarlo antes o después de hornearlo.','["3 berenjenas grandes, recortadas y cortadas en rodajas finas a lo largo","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","250 g de mozzarella vegetariana, escurrida y rallada gruesa","50 g de queso duro vegetariano estilo italiano, rallado","1 manojo de albahaca, con las hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes, más algo extra para servir","8 láminas de lasaña seca (las láminas de lasaña al huevo son las mejores para esto)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","6 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","¼ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","3 latas de 400 g de tomates picados"]','["Para la salsa, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe los ajos durante 1 min hasta que estén dorados. Agrega el azúcar y el vinagre, cocina a fuego lento durante 30 segundos y luego agrega los tomates. Sazone con sal y vuelva a hervir a fuego lento. Burbujee durante 10 minutos, luego retírelo del fuego y reserve. Puede prepararse con hasta dos días de anticipación y enfriarse.","Calienta una plancha o una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto. Cepille las rodajas de berenjena por ambos lados con aceite de oliva y sazone con un poco de sal, luego cocine a la plancha en tandas hasta que las rodajas estén blandas y ligeramente carbonizadas (asegúrese de que el fuego no sea demasiado alto o la berenjena se quemará antes de que se ablande). Transfiera las rodajas cocidas a un plato sobre la marcha.","Para montar, coloque un tercio de las rodajas de berenjena sobre la base de una fuente rectangular o cuadrada para gratinar y luego vierta un tercio de la salsa. Espolvorea con un pequeño puñado de ambos quesos (querrás conservar la mayor parte del queso para la parte superior) y la mitad de la albahaca, luego cubre con la mitad de las láminas de lasaña. Repita una vez más y luego termine con una capa final de berenjenas cubiertas con el resto de la salsa. Esparza sobre el queso restante. Después de dejar enfriar por completo, el plato se puede tapar y enfriar hasta por dos días o congelar hasta por tres meses. Descongele completamente antes de cocinar.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloca el plato en una bandeja para horno y hornea durante 30 minutos hasta que el queso esté dorado y la salsa burbujee en los bordes. Deje enfriar durante al menos 10 minutos, luego espolvoree con la albahaca reservada y sirva. La lasaña cocida se mantendrá congelada hasta por tres meses, cubierta con papel de aluminio. Descongelar bien, destapar y hornear como se indica arriba. O para cocinar congelado, hornee a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 durante 40 minutos. Retire el papel aluminio, encienda el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y hornee por 30 minutos más."]','2026-01-11 12:59:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13901,6525,'es','Ribollita al estilo toscano','Guarda pan duro y transfórmalo en este guiso espeso, con trozos y delicioso, bajo en grasas y calorías, que contiene tomates, frijoles y cavolo nero.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","1 zanahoria, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","pizca de hojuelas de chile","1 ramita de romero","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","500 ml de caldo de pollo o de verduras caliente","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","1 corteza de parmesano (opcional)","250 g de col rizada o col rizada picada","150 g de pan duro y crujiente cortado en trozos (consulte el consejo a continuación)","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","unas hojas de albahaca (opcional) y parmesano rallado o una alternativa vegetariana, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande o cazuela refractaria a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla, el apio y la zanahoria con una pizca de sal durante 15 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Agrega el ajo y las hojuelas de chile y cocina por 1 min.","Agregue la ramita de romero, los tomates, el caldo, los frijoles y la ralladura de parmesano, si se usa, y deje hervir a fuego lento. Agrega el cavolo y cocina tapado durante 10 minutos. Revuelva el pan y cocine por varios minutos más para que se caliente, luego agregue el vinagre y sazone. Vierta en tazones, rocíe con un poco más de aceite y espolvoree con albahaca, si la usa, y el queso rallado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13902,5427,'es','lasaña saludable','Disfrute de nuestra versión más ligera del clásico familiar: lasaña. Tiene muchísimo sabor, pero tiene menos de 500 calorías por porción, además de contener cuatro de las cinco raciones al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande (250 g), finamente picada","320 g de zanahorias finamente picadas","2 ramas de apio (140 g), finamente picadas","2 hojas de laurel","500 g de carne picada de ternera al 5%","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1½ cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","400ml de leche semidesnatada","30 g de harina integral","pizca generosa de nuez moscada","6 láminas de lasaña integral (125g)","25 g de parmesano finamente rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla, las zanahorias, el apio y una de las hojas de laurel durante 8-10 minutos hasta que las verduras se ablanden y empiecen a dorarse. Agregue la carne picada y el ajo y saltee hasta que la carne se dore, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Vierta los tomates y una lata de agua, el puré de tomate y el caldo, lleve a ebullición, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos, retirando la tapa después de 10 minutos para reducir ligeramente la mezcla.","Mientras tanto, vierte la leche en una cacerola mediana con la harina y bate a fuego lento hasta que la mezcla quede sin grumos. Añade la segunda hoja de laurel y una buena pizca de nuez moscada y continúa cocinando, batiendo, durante 8-10 minutos hasta que espese.","Retire el laurel de la carne picada y la salsa blanca y deséchelo. Vierta un tercio de la carne picada en la base de una fuente para horno de 19 x 24 cm y cubra con dos hojas de lasaña. Vierta sobre la mitad de la carne picada restante, luego cubra con dos hojas de lasaña más, el resto de la carne picada y las hojas de lasaña restantes. Vierta sobre la salsa blanca y espolvoree con el queso. Hornee por 40 minutos hasta que burbujee y esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 12:59:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13903,5039,'es','Pasta con salmón sin gluten','Utilice pasta sin gluten para hacer esta pasta cremosa de salmón y judías verdes de la lectora de GF Aimee Vivian. Es ideal para celíacos o intolerantes al gluten.','["1 pastilla de caldo de verduras sin gluten","200 g de pasta sin gluten, como penne o fusilli","100 g de judías verdes, peladas","100 g de salmón ahumado, picado en trozos grandes","50 g de espinacas tiernas","1 cebolla tierna, cortada finamente","50 g de queso tierno (asegúrate de que no contenga gluten)","½-1 limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de parmesano rallado"]','["Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande de agua con sal, desmenúcela en la pastilla de caldo y revuelva para que se disuelva. Vierta la pasta y cocine siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, aproximadamente de 8 a 10 minutos. Agrega las judías verdes 1 min antes de que finalice el tiempo de cocción.","Escurre la pasta y las judías verdes reservando un poco del agua de cocción. Vuelva a colocar la pasta y los frijoles en la sartén, luego agregue el salmón ahumado, las espinacas, la cebolleta y el queso tierno. Agrega un poco del agua de la pasta para soltar el queso y crear una salsa, luego sazona con sal y pimienta negra recién molida. Exprima el jugo de limón al gusto y revuelva bien. Sirva cubierto con el parmesano."]','2026-01-11 12:59:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13904,4497,'es','Bruschetta de tomate y nduja','Utilice tomates maduros para hacer estos bocados de bruschetta dulces y picantes. Son ideales para una fiesta en el jardín, cuando no importa si haces un poco de desorden.','["1 baguette grande, recortada y cortada en 16 rebanadas","300 g de tomates maduros, picados en trozos grandes","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","un puñado pequeño de perejil picado","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","8-10 nduja"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque las rebanadas de baguette en una bandeja para hornear grande y hornee durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén crujientes y ligeramente doradas. (Es posible que tengas que hacer esto en dos tandas). Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar.","Combine los tomates, los frijoles, el perejil, el vinagre y el aceite en un bol, sazone bien y reserve.","Extienda aproximadamente ½ cucharadita de nduja sobre cada rebanada de baguette y colóquelas en una fuente para servir. Vierta la mezcla de tomate y frijoles sobre las rebanadas de baguette y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:00:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13905,7591,'es','salsa arrabiata','Prepare nuestra versión de una clásica salsa para pasta italiana, repleta de tomates, chile rojo y ajo. Mézclelo con espaguetis o linguini para obtener una cena fácil y deliciosa.','["2 dientes de ajo pequeños, pelados y triturados","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 lata de 400 g de tomates picados"]','["Vierta el aceite en una cacerola y fría el ajo a fuego medio durante 1-2 minutos hasta que esté fragante, pero no dorado. Agrega la guindilla, sofríe un minuto más, luego agrega los tomates junto con 1 cucharadita de sal y ½ cucharadita de azúcar. Revuelva bien para combinar los ingredientes y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos, revolviendo regularmente. La salsa se espesará lentamente a medida que se cocina.","Pruebe y ajuste la sazón si es necesario. Sirva revuelto con la pasta o mezcle primero para crear una salsa más suave si lo prefiere. Se mantendrá frío hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 13:00:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13906,7593,'es','pesto rojo','Mezcle piñones, tomates secos, parmesano y aceite de oliva para hacer un pesto rojo, perfecto para mezclar con pasta o para darle sabor a platos de pollo.','["50 g de piñones","200 g de tomates secos semiblandos, escurridos","125 ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","25 g de parmesano rallado","1 diente de ajo grande, pelado y triturado","1 limón, exprimido (opcional)"]','["Empezamos tostando los piñones. Viértelos en una sartén a fuego medio. Agite la sartén o revuelva suavemente las nueces para que se tuesten uniformemente. Cuando las nueces estén doradas, retiramos del fuego y reservamos.","Ponga todos los ingredientes restantes en la licuadora con ½ cucharadita de sal marina y los piñones tostados, luego mezcle hasta que la salsa esté bastante suave pero conserve algo de textura. Si es necesario, puede agregar 2-3 cucharadas de agua fría y mezclar para que se afloje un poco. Pruebe, ajuste la sazón si es necesario y sirva inmediatamente. Se conservará en un frasco en el refrigerador durante una semana."]','2026-01-11 13:00:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13907,3831,'es','pesto fácil','Mezcla piñones o anacardos, albahaca, parmesano, ajo y aceite de oliva para hacer tu propio pesto. Es perfecto para pizzas, pastas y sándwiches.','["50 g de piñones o anacardos","manojo grande de albahaca, hojas recogidas","50 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana","1 diente de ajo, picado","100 ml de aceite de oliva"]','["Tostar las nueces en una sartén a fuego lento. Vierta en una mini picadora con los ingredientes restantes, o use un mortero grande, luego triture o triture hasta obtener una salsa espesa. Se conservará durante tres días en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 13:00:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13908,5245,'es','Huevos al horno con espinacas, tomates, ricotta y albahaca','Sirva esta versión de shakshuka de inspiración italiana para un brunch sencillo. Si no eres vegetariano también puedes añadir chorizo','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","pizca de hojuelas de chile","3 latas de 400 g de tomates finamente picados (o mezcle tomates picados enlatados normales con un procesador de alimentos o una batidora de mano)","3 cucharadas de pesto de tomates secos (asegúrese de que sea vegetariano, si es necesario)","200 g de espinacas, picadas en trozos grandes","8 huevos","100 g de ricota","40 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, finamente rallado","un puñado de hojas de albahaca","pan crujiente o focaccia, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola o sartén grande, poco profunda y ignífuga a fuego medio-bajo y sofreír la cebolla con una pizca de sal durante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave y traslúcida. Agrega el ajo y la guindilla en hojuelas y sofríe 1 min más. Agregue los tomates, 1 cucharadita de azúcar y el pesto. Sazone y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 10 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia. Agregue las espinacas y cocine por otros 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Haga ocho huecos en la salsa con el dorso de una cuchara y rompa un huevo en cada uno. Salpique la ricota y espolvoree con el parmesano. Tape y cocine por 5 minutos, luego deslícelo debajo de la parrilla caliente durante unos minutos hasta que las claras estén cuajadas y las yemas líquidas. Espolvorea con albahaca y sirve con pan crujiente para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:00:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13909,7595,'es','Espaguetis con pimiento rojo y anchoa','Aprovecha al máximo las anchoas combinándolas con pimientos rojos en este rápido plato de pasta. La dulzura de los pimientos complementa muy bien las anchoas umami.','["300 g de espaguetis","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","4 dientes de ajo, rebanados","4 anchoas","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","Tarro de 300 g de pimientos rojos asados, escurridos y cortados en rodajas","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","un puñado de albahaca, finamente cortada"]','["Hierva una cacerola grande con agua con sal y luego agregue los espaguetis. Cocine por 1 minuto menos que las instrucciones del paquete. Vierta el aceite, el ajo, las anchoas y las hojuelas de chile en otra cacerola o en una sartén de lados altos a fuego medio. Cocine durante aproximadamente 1 minuto, hasta que el aceite esté caliente y el ajo haya comenzado a chisporrotear ligeramente.","Agrega los pimientos asados ​​y el puré de tomate. Revuelva bien. Continúe cocinando la mezcla de anchoas y pimientos hasta que los espaguetis estén listos, agregando un cucharón del agua de cocción de la pasta mientras se cocina para aflojarla y hacer una salsa.","Cuando los espaguetis estén listos, use unas pinzas para transferirlos directamente del agua de cocción a la salsa, agregando un poco más de agua para aflojar si es necesario. Cocine los espaguetis en la salsa durante 30 segundos, revolviendo para cubrirlos, luego retírelos del fuego y mezcle con la albahaca. Servir inmediatamente, rociado con un poco de aceite de oliva."]','2026-01-11 13:00:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13910,4305,'es','Minestrone de albóndigas con pesto','Combine las albóndigas con sopa minestrone para que esto sea fácil, llenando una olla. Se necesitan solo 25 minutos desde la preparación hasta el plato, por lo que es una comida ideal entre semana.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","12 albóndigas de ternera","1 zanahoria, picada","1 rama de apio, picada","1 cebolla, picada","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1⁄2 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 hoja de laurel","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, enjuagadas y escurridas","100 g de formas de pasta o arroz","800 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo bajo en sal","un chorrito de vinagre o una pizca de azúcar (opcional)","4 cucharadas de pesto","1⁄2 manojo pequeño de albahaca, con las hojas recogidas (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande y freír las albóndigas hasta que se doren. Retirar y reservar en un plato. Agrega la zanahoria, el apio y la cebolla a la sartén y sofríe durante 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Agregue el ajo, el orégano y el laurel. Agregue los tomates, los frijoles, la pasta y el caldo. Llevar a fuego lento.","Vuelva a colocar las albóndigas en la sartén y cocine hasta que la pasta esté tierna y las albóndigas bien cocidas. Sazona y añade un chorrito de vinagre o una pizca de azúcar para equilibrar la acidez de los tomates, si lo deseas. Sirva en cuatro tazones y luego mezcle una cucharada de pesto en cada uno. Cubra con la albahaca para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13911,5361,'es','Pesto de col rizada y ñoquis de pollo','Vuélvete ecológico con nuestro pesto de col rizada y ñoquis de pollo, repletos de ingredientes nutritivos. Un plato equilibrado y fácil, ideal para días ajetreados y en tan solo 20 minutos.','["65 g de col rizada, lavada y picada en trozos grandes","100 g de espinacas","1 diente de ajo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","½ manojo pequeño de albahaca, más hojas adicionales para servir","15 g de piñones","1 cucharada de parmesano, más extra para servir","25 ml de aceite de oliva","250 g de pechuga de pollo cocida y desmenuzada","200 g de guisantes congelados","50 g de crema fresca ligera","150 ml de caldo de verduras","300 g de bolas de masa"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola mediana con agua y reserve un recipiente con agua helada. Ponga la col rizada y las espinacas en agua hirviendo y cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Retirar con una espumadera y sumergir en agua fría. Escurrir y luego exprimir el exceso de agua.","Coloque las verduras en un procesador de alimentos con el ajo, el jugo y la ralladura de limón, la albahaca, los piñones, el parmesano y el aceite de oliva, luego mezcle hasta que quede suave. Sazone ligeramente.","Vierta el pesto en una cacerola con el pollo, los guisantes, la crema fresca y el caldo y déjelo hervir. Vierta los ñoquis y cocine durante 3-4 minutos hasta que estén bien cocidos. Esparza las hojas de albahaca adicionales y ralle un poco de parmesano para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13912,3924,'es','Malfatti','Haga nuestra versión del malfatti toscano: bolas de masa de espinacas y ricotta que se parecen un poco a ñoquis grandes y de forma tosca. Sirva cubierto con una aromática mantequilla de salvia y abundante queso.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","500 g de espinacas frescas o congeladas (ver consejo a continuación)","250 g de ricota","50 g de pan rallado fresco","50 g de parmesano finamente rallado o una alternativa vegetariana, más algo extra para servir","2 huevos grandes, batidos","1 cucharada de sémola o harina común, más un poco más para espolvorear","nuez moscada, para rallar","60 g de mantequilla","25 g de hojas de salvia"]','["Caliente el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego alto y ablande las espinacas, aproximadamente 2-3 minutos. Coloque las espinacas en un colador y presione el exceso de líquido con el dorso de una cuchara. Dejar enfriar por completo. Exprime el líquido restante con las manos y luego pica finamente las espinacas.","Vierta las espinacas picadas en un bol con la ricota, el pan rallado y el parmesano. Agrega el huevo y la sémola o harina. Sazona y ralla por encima un poco de nuez moscada. Revuelva para formar una mezcla pegajosa y uniformemente combinada.","Pon un par de cucharadas de harina en una bandeja grande y agita suavemente para esparcir la harina. Vierta alrededor de ½ cucharada de la mezcla de espinacas en la bandeja enharinada y forme una bola. Repita con el resto de la mezcla de espinacas, transfiriendo las bolas a una segunda bandeja para hornear limpia a medida que avanza.","Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1. Llevar a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua con sal. Agregue los malfatti (es posible que deba hacerlo en tandas) y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos, o hasta que floten hacia la superficie. Saque los malfatti con una espumadera y escúrralos bien. Transfiera a una fuente para servir refractaria y manténgala caliente en el horno.","Haga mantequilla de salvia derritiendo la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña. Añade las hojas de salvia y sofríe suavemente, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que estén crujientes. Vierta la mantequilla de salvia sobre los malfatti y cubra con más queso rallado."]','2026-01-11 13:00:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13913,5669,'es','Orecchiette con brócoli de brotes morados y pesto de Calabria','Prepare un poco de pesto casero y sírvalo con orecchiette y brócoli. Este no solo es bueno con pasta: también puedes servirlo con pollo o pescado y servirlo sobre focaccia tibia.','["400 g de brócoli de brotes morados","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","375 g de orecchiette u otras formas de pasta","parmesano rallado o pecorino (o alternativa vegetariana), para servir","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","½ cebolla morada pequeña, picada","1 tomate pera, picado","75 g de berenjena cortada en trozos pequeños","125 g de pimientos asados ​​de un frasco, escurridos","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 chile rojo, cortado por la mitad, sin semillas y picado (deja las semillas si quieres un pesto más picante)","40 g de almendras blanqueadas y ligeramente tostadas en una sartén seca","60 g de ricota","10 g de hojas de albahaca o perejil"]','["Primero, haz la base del pesto. Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén y añadir la cebolla, el tomate y la berenjena. Freír a fuego medio-bajo durante 8-10 minutos hasta que la cebolla esté dorada pálida y los tomates y la berenjena estén suaves. Agrega los pimientos y cocina por un par de minutos, luego agrega el ajo y la guindilla y cocina por otros 2 minutos. Pasar a un plato y dejar enfriar.","Calienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Recorta el brócoli por la base y luego corta por la mitad los trozos grandes a lo largo. Poner en una fuente para asar, rociar con aceite de oliva y sazonar. Agrega el ajo y voltea todo con las manos; asegúrate de que el ajo esté debajo del brócoli para que se tueste sin quemarse. Cocine en el horno durante 15-20 minutos (verifique que esté cocido durante la cocción).","Mientras tanto, cocine la pasta en agua hirviendo con sal hasta que esté al dente. Suele tardar un poco menos de lo que dice en el paquete.","Para el pesto, vierte todo lo que hay en el plato en un procesador de alimentos junto con las almendras y las 2 cucharadas restantes de aceite de oliva virgen extra. Sazone y presione para mezclar todo. Agregue la ricota y pruebe para sazonar. Rompe la albahaca y revuélvela también.","Escurre la pasta y mézclala con el brócoli (incluido el jugo de ajo de la fuente para asar), luego usa tanto pesto como sea necesario para cubrir la pasta y sirve el resto a un lado. Moler un poco de pimienta negra y servir inmediatamente con el queso rallado."]','2026-01-11 13:00:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13914,5671,'es','Queso y pimienta negra','Prepare un cacio e pepe sencillo para un almuerzo rápido. Con cuatro ingredientes simples (espaguetis, pimienta, parmesano y mantequilla), este es uno de los favoritos de la despensa.','["200 g de bucatini o espagueti","25 g de mantequilla","2 cucharaditas de granos de pimienta negra entera, molida o 1 cucharadita de pimienta negra recién molida","50 g de queso pecorino o parmesano, finamente rallado"]','["Cocine la pasta durante 2 minutos menos de lo que indican las instrucciones del paquete, en agua hirviendo con sal. Mientras tanto, derrita la mantequilla en una sartén mediana a fuego lento, luego agregue la pimienta negra molida y tueste por unos minutos.","Escurrir la pasta, reservando 200ml del agua de la pasta. Vierta la pasta y 100 ml de agua de la pasta en la sartén con la mantequilla y la pimienta. Mezcle brevemente, luego esparza el parmesano uniformemente, pero no revuelva; espere a que el queso se derrita durante 30 segundos y luego, una vez derretido, mezcle todo bien y revuelva. Esto evita que el queso se aglomere o se vuelva fibroso y produce una salsa suave y brillante. Agrega un chorrito más de agua para la pasta si es necesario, para soltar la salsa y cubrir la pasta. Servir inmediatamente con una buena ralladura de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:00:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13915,4004,'es','biscotti fáciles','Prepare estos biscotti fáciles para servir con café o sumérjalos en chocolate y preséntelos en una lata para dárselos a familiares y amigos.','["300 g de harina común","100 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","80 g de aceite vegetal","1 huevo grande","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","chocolate con leche o amargo, derretido, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Ponga la harina, el azúcar, el polvo para hornear y una pizca grande de sal en un tazón grande y revuelva.","En un recipiente aparte, mezcle el aceite, el huevo, la vainilla y 3 cucharadas de agua caliente. Mezcle gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos con los secos hasta que la mezcla forme una masa. Amasar suavemente la masa hasta que quede suave; estará bastante seca, así que agregue otra cucharada de agua si es demasiado difícil amasar después de unos minutos. Dividir la masa en dos trozos iguales, dándoles a cada uno forma de tronco de 25 x 8 cm. Coloque los troncos en la bandeja para hornear preparada y hornee durante 25-30 minutos. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar en la bandeja unos 15 minutos.","Con un cuchillo afilado, corte transversalmente los troncos ligeramente enfriados en rodajas de 1 a 2 cm de grosor. Regrese los biscotti a la bandeja para hornear forrada y hornee por 15-20 minutos más (el horno aún debe estar a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4), girando la bandeja a la mitad. Dejar enfriar un poco en la bandeja, luego transferir los biscotti a una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo. Si lo desea, sumerja un extremo de cada biscotti en un poco de chocolate derretido y luego déjelo reposar en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 13:00:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13916,7597,'es','Canelones de salchichas y verdes invernales','Estira un paquete de salchichas y alimenta a toda la familia con estos canelones. La salsa ragú carnosa está reforzada con verduras de invierno ricas en nutrientes.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas","6 salchichas de cerdo","3 dientes de ajo machacados","manojo pequeño de tomillo, hojas recogidas","pizca de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","Lata de 400g de tomates pera","200 g de cavolo nero u otras verduras de invierno","75 g de mantequilla","75 g de harina común","850ml de leche","nuez moscada, para rallar","50 g de parmesano rallado","12 láminas de lasaña","ensalada verde, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego a fuego medio y cocina las cebollas durante 8-10 minutos hasta que se ablanden y empiecen a caramelizar. Mientras tanto, exprima la carne de la salchicha para quitarle la piel.","Empuje las cebollas a un lado de la cazuela y luego agregue la carne de salchicha al otro. Aplástalo en trozos más pequeños con una cuchara de madera, revolviendo ocasionalmente durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que esté cocido y comience a dorarse en algunos lugares. Vuelva a mezclar las cebollas y luego agregue el ajo, el tomillo, las hojuelas de chile y el puré de tomate. Cocine por otros 1-2 minutos. Vierta los tomates pera, triturándolos con el dorso de la cuchara. Sazone y hierva durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que los tomates se desintegren y la salsa se reduzca a un ragú espeso.","Pon la tetera a hervir. Si usa cavolo nero, retire y deseche los tallos duros y pique las hojas en trozos grandes. Para verduras más suaves como las espinacas o las acelgas, puedes dejar los tallos puestos. Coloque un colador sobre el fregadero y viértalo sobre una tetera con agua recién hervida, luego enjuague las hojas con agua corriente fría hasta que se enfríen lo suficiente como para manipularlas. Exprime toda el agua que puedas, transfiérala a una tabla y pícala finamente. Agrega las verduras al ragú de salchicha, cocina durante 1-2 minutos hasta que el exceso de líquido se haya evaporado (la mezcla debe estar bastante seca), retira del fuego y deja enfriar un poco.","Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola aparte a fuego medio. Cuando esté chisporroteando, agregue la harina para hacer una pasta arenosa. Batir la leche, poco a poco, hasta que esté completamente incorporada. Cuando la salsa esté suave y con consistencia de natilla, sazonar bien, rallar una buena cantidad de nuez moscada y añadir la mitad del parmesano. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Coloque las láminas de lasaña en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo con sal, una a la vez para evitar que se peguen, luego cocine durante 5 a 6 minutos, revolviendo hasta que estén lo suficientemente suaves como para enrollarse pero no completamente cocidas. Escurrir y sumergir en un recipiente con agua fría para detener el proceso de cocción.","Si la salsa bechamel se ha espesado al enfriarse, agregue un chorrito más de leche. Vierta un tercio de la salsa sobre la base de una fuente para horno de aproximadamente 25 x 35 cm. Saque una hoja de lasaña del recipiente con agua fría y colóquela sobre una tabla con uno de los extremos cortos hacia usted. Coloque una cucharada generosa de salchicha ragú sobre un extremo, luego enróllelo para encerrar el relleno, formando un canelón corto; quedará un poco de pasta superpuesta. Colóquelo en la fuente para horno, luego continúe con el resto de las láminas de ragu y lasaña, disponiéndolas en la fuente para horno en dos filas de seis canelones. Vierta el ragú restante por encima y luego vierta sobre la salsa bechamel para cubrir todos los canelones. Espolvorea con el queso parmesano restante. Se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado hasta dos días o congelado hasta dos meses. Primero déjalo enfriar completamente. Descongela bien en el refrigerador durante la noche antes de cocinar. Calienta el horno a 200 C/180 C ventilador/gas 6, luego hornea los canelones durante 40 minutos hasta que burbujeen en los bordes y se doren por encima. Muela un poco de pimienta negra, si lo desea, y sírvala con una ensalada verde crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13917,7599,'es','Horneado de pasta con salchicha','Un clásico italoamericano, este horneado de pasta con salchicha congelable es un plato familiar ideal para preparar con anticipación para los días ocupados.','["400 g de rigatoni o penne","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, picada en trozos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","6 salchichas de cerdo","4 dientes de ajo, rebanados","una pizca de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cucharada de harina común","350ml de leche","50 g de parmesano rallado y un poco más para servir"]','["Para hacer el ragú, caliente el aceite en una sartén grande y poco profunda o en una cacerola resistente al fuego. Exprima la carne de la salchicha de su piel en bolitas directamente en la sartén. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que se dore (no se preocupe si la carne se rompe). Agregue el ajo y cocine por un minuto más hasta que comience a dorarse, luego agregue las hojuelas de chile, si las usa, el puré de tomate y el vinagre. Vierta los tomates y cocine a fuego lento. Reduzca el fuego a bajo y burbujee durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, prepara la salsa blanca. Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola y agregue la harina para hacer una pasta suelta. Cocine a fuego lento durante un minuto y luego bata gradualmente la leche. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, batiendo ocasionalmente para asegurarse de que la salsa se mantenga suave. Sazone y agregue el parmesano. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Cocine la pasta en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo durante 9 minutos, o un minuto menos de lo que indican las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir y volver a la sartén. Agregue la mayor parte de la salsa blanca a la pasta y revuelva para cubrir. Vierta la mayor parte del ragu y la mayor parte de la mozzarella y revuelva hasta que estén combinados. Vierta la mezcla de pasta en una fuente para hornear grande y vierta sobre la salsa blanca restante y el ragú. Salpique con el resto de la mozzarella y espolvoree con parmesano extra. Deje que se enfríe por completo, luego envuélvalo y enfríelo por hasta un día, o congélelo por hasta dos meses. Descongelar en el frigorífico durante 24 horas antes de hornear.","Calienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Hornea durante 25-30 minutos hasta que la parte superior esté ligeramente crujiente en los bordes y el queso se derrita. Déjelo reposar durante 5 a 10 minutos, luego lleve la fuente para hornear directamente a la mesa para que la gente la sirva en sus platos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13918,7601,'es','Pasta con pollo y tocino','Mezcle el pollo y el tocino con tiras de tallarines en una salsa deliciosamente cremosa para preparar este sencillo plato de pasta. Sirva con una ensalada verde para una cena fácil.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo grande, finamente rallado","200ml de nata doble","100 g de mascarpone","75 g de parmesano finamente rallado","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","2 pechugas de pollo cocidas (unos 210 g), desmenuzadas","8 lonchas de tocino cocido (unos 25 g), picado en trozos grandes","300 g de fideos","¼ manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","ensalada verde, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite y la mantequilla en una cacerola mediana a fuego lento y fríe la cebolla durante 10 minutos, o hasta que esté blanda y traslúcida. Agrega el ajo y cocina por 2 minutos más. Añade la nata, el mascarpone, el parmesano y la pastilla de caldo. Revuelva y agregue el pollo cocido y el tocino para calentar.","Mientras tanto, cocina la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Reservar 100ml del agua de la pasta. Mezcle la pasta con la salsa cremosa y suficiente agua reservada para que se suelte. Sazone con pimienta negra. Cubra con el perejil y sirva con una ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 13:00:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13919,7603,'es','Risotto de calabacín y habas con pesto de albahaca','Prepare este vibrante risotto con calabacines y habas para aprovechar al máximo las verduras de verano. Agite pesto casero para obtener un entrante o plato principal fabuloso','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de mantequilla","2 calabacines medianos (unos 350 g), cortados en dados de 1-2 cm","una pizca de hojuelas de chile o pul biber","pizca de nuez moscada rallada","2 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","½ limón, rallado","150 g de arroz para risotto","75ml de vino blanco seco o vermú","750 g de caldo de verduras o pollo tibio","80 g de habas, blanqueadas y peladas","flores de calabacín, sin estambres y pétalos arrancados (opcional)","20 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado, y extra para servir","1 diente de ajo","1 cucharada de piñones tostados","un puñado grande de hojas de albahaca y más para servir","un puñado de hojas de menta","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de parmesano rallado o alternativa vegetariana"]','["Para hacer el pesto, machaque el ajo hasta obtener una pasta con una pizca de sal usando un mortero. Agrega los piñones y machaca hasta obtener una pasta gruesa, luego agrega la albahaca y la menta, machacando nuevamente hasta que se descompongan. Agregue el aceite y el queso, luego pruebe para sazonar; agregue más queso si lo desea.","Calienta el aceite y la mantequilla en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio. Añade los calabacines, espolvorea las hojuelas de chile y la nuez moscada y sazona con sal y pimienta. Freír durante 3-5 minutos hasta que los calabacines estén dorados y tiernos. Agregue las cebolletas y la ralladura de limón y revuelva durante uno o dos minutos. Vierta el arroz y revuelva para cubrirlo con el aceite hasta que esté transparente, aproximadamente 2 minutos.","Vierta el vino y luego cocine por un par de minutos hasta que se haya evaporado casi por completo. Añade un cucharón de caldo y remueve unos minutos hasta que se absorba. Continúe agregando un cucharón a la vez durante 20 a 30 minutos, revolviendo continuamente, hasta que se absorba todo el caldo.","Agregue las habas blanqueadas y las flores, si las usa, y caliente durante 2 minutos. Retire del fuego y revuelva con el parmesano. Deje reposar durante unos 5 minutos y luego mezcle la mitad del pesto. El pesto restante se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días.","Divida el risotto en tazones y esparza con las hojas de albahaca extra, el queso extra y otra cucharada de pesto, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13920,7605,'es','Panzanella','Prepara tu propia versión de uno de los platos más famosos de la Toscana, la panzanella. Es una buena manera de aprovechar las sobras, ya que se hace con pan duro; simplemente mézclelo con tomates maduros y un aderezo de aceite de oliva.','["1 kg de tomates maduros mixtos, cortados por la mitad si son pequeños y en cuartos si son grandes","300 g de masa madre o chapata del día anterior, cortada en trozos grandes","100ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","50 ml de vinagre de vino tinto","1 chalota pequeña, finamente picada","50 g de anchoas en lata, escurridas y picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de aceitunas negras sin hueso","un puñado grande de hojas de albahaca, cortadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner los tomates en un colador y espolvorear 1 cucharadita de sal marina, luego dejar reposar durante 15 minutos.","Extienda los trozos de pan en una bandeja para hornear y mezcle con 1 cucharada de aceite. Hornee durante 10 a 15 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente tostado.","En un bol, mezcle el aceite restante, el vinagre y la chalota. Sazone al gusto. Mezcle las anchoas con los tomates, los picatostes, el aderezo de aceite de oliva, las aceitunas y la mitad de la albahaca en un tazón grande. Coloque la panzanella en un plato para servir y cubra con la albahaca restante."]','2026-01-11 13:00:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13921,7607,'es','Risotto de espárragos','Ponga los espárragos en el centro del escenario en este satisfactorio risotto. Cubra con una pizca de parmesano para una comida fácil entre semana para dos','["1 manojo de espárragos (unos 200 g)","800 ml de caldo de verduras","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","25 g de mantequilla","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","175 g de arroz para risotto","100ml de vino blanco o vermú (opcional)","25 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, finamente rallado"]','["Quite los extremos leñosos de los tallos de espárragos y viértalos en una cacerola con el caldo. Poner a fuego lento para que hierva a fuego muy suave. Mientras tanto, cortar las puntas de los espárragos y añadir al caldo durante exactamente 1 min. Sacar con una espumadera y reservar. Corta finamente el resto de los tallos en rodajas.","Calienta el aceite y la mitad de la mantequilla en una sartén ancha y pesada. Cocine las cebollas a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que estén suaves, revolviendo con frecuencia. Agrega los tallos de espárragos picados y cocina por 2 minutos más. Agrega el arroz y revuelve continuamente durante unos minutos hasta que se vuelva semitransparente y emita un silbido.","Agregue el vino, si lo usa; se evaporará casi de inmediato. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento. Agregue el caldo, un cucharón a la vez, revolviendo entre cada adición hasta que se absorba, aproximadamente 15 minutos.","Pruebe el arroz; debería sentirse recién cocido con un ligero mordisco. Agregue las puntas de los espárragos y los últimos restos de caldo y cocine por 1 o 2 minutos más. Retirar del fuego y cubrir con la mantequilla restante y la mayor parte del parmesano. Sazonar generosamente, tapar y dejar reposar unos minutos.","Revuelva bien el risotto para incorporar la mantequilla y el queso y sirva de inmediato con el parmesano restante para espolvorear."]','2026-01-11 13:00:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13922,7611,'es','Calzone de mozzarella, pimiento y berenjena','Pruebe estos saludables calzones de mozzarella, pimiento y berenjena de inspiración italiana para un almuerzo de trabajo, o empaque y coma al aire libre en un día cálido.','["400 g de harina integral fuerte para pan, más un poco más para espolvorear","⅛ cucharadita de sal (opcional)","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza, más un poco más para la bandeja para hornear","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 pimiento rojo y 1 amarillo, sin semillas y cortados en trozos pequeños","1 berenjena grande, cortada por la mitad a lo largo y en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente picados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","manojo pequeño de albahaca, desmenuzado","8 aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad","125 g de mozzarella en bolas (peso escurrido), en cuartos","leche o huevo batido, para untar"]','["Ponga la harina, la sal (si la usa), la levadura, el aceite y 300 ml de agua tibia en un bol y mezcle hasta que esté suave. Amasar hasta formar una bola (intenta no agregar más harina); quedará pegajosa pero la harina absorberá algo de humedad. Regresar al bol, tapar y dejar en un lugar cálido.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande y luego sofríe los pimientos durante aproximadamente 1 minuto hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agrega la berenjena y el ajo y continúa cocinando a fuego medio durante 8-10 minutos, presionando suavemente las verduras con una cuchara de madera hasta que se deshagan un poco. Si no es así, fríalo tapado durante unos minutos más.","Agrega el puré de tomate, el vinagre y 2 cucharadas de agua. Cuando las verduras estén blandas, retire la sartén del fuego y revuelva con la albahaca.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cortar en cuartos la masa leudada y extender cada pieza hasta formar un círculo de 20 cm sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada. Vierta una cuarta parte del relleno por un lado, esparza una cuarta parte de las aceitunas, cubra con una cuarta parte del queso y unte los bordes con leche o huevo batido. Doble la masa sobre el relleno y junte los bordes a un lado, un poco como si hiciera una empanada de Cornualles. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear ligeramente engrasada y unte con más leche o huevo batido. Repita con el resto de la masa y el relleno para hacer cuatro calzones, luego hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Dejar enfriar un poco y servir a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13923,7613,'es','Albóndigas a la puttanesca al horno','Esta pasta horneada de preparación rápida con alcaparras, hojuelas de chile, aceitunas y calabacines es la comida ideal entre semana. Sabroso y abundante, satisfará a toda la familia','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","24 albóndigas ya preparadas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","una pizca de hojuelas de chile seco (opcional)","2 anchoas, picadas (opcional)","2 calabacines pequeños (unos 250 g), rallados gruesos","2 cucharadas de alcaparras, enjuagadas, escurridas y picadas en trozos grandes","70 g de aceitunas negras deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad","500ml en puré","300 g de penne (u otras formas de pasta)","2 cucharadas de parmesano rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Calentar el aceite en una sartén y sofreír las albóndigas hasta que se doren por completo, luego verterlas en un plato. Agregue el ajo y la guindilla, si los usa, al aceite sobrante en la sartén y cocínelos brevemente junto con las anchoas, si las usa. Freír hasta que las anchoas casi se derritan, luego añadir los calabacines y cocinar hasta que se evapore el líquido que desprenden. Agregue las alcaparras, las aceitunas y la passata y cocine a fuego lento. Agregue las albóndigas y cocine por 5 minutos más, luego sazone si es necesario.","Mientras tanto, cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, escúrrala bien y luego viértala en una fuente para horno de unos 25 cm de ancho. Vierta sobre la mezcla de albóndigas, agregue la pasta y nivele la superficie tanto como sea posible. Espolvorea sobre el parmesano y hornea por 30 minutos, o hasta que la parte superior se dore un poco y la salsa burbujee. Descanse 5 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13924,7615,'es','Gnudi de ricota y espinacas','Pruebe estas albóndigas ligeras de ricotta y hierbas de Lina Stores para disfrutar de un plato principal italiano clásico. Sirve tu gnudi con abundante salsa y parmesano.','["500 g de espinacas, con las puntas cortadas","500 g de ricota (debe estar seca, así que cuela durante la noche si está húmeda)","75 g de yemas de huevo","75 g de pan rallado seco","50 g de harina común","nuez moscada entera, para rallar","125 g de Grana Padano rallado, más un poco más para la salsa y para servir","50 g de mantequilla","20 g de salvia, cortada en rodajas si las hojas son grandes"]','["Vierta agua hirviendo sobre las espinacas, luego déjelas enfriar un poco antes de exprimir el exceso de líquido. Picar finamente las espinacas. Escurrir y exprimir nuevamente el exceso de agua. Poner en un bol las espinacas con la ricota, las yemas de huevo, el pan rallado, la harina, una ralladura de nuez moscada, una pizca de sal y el queso. Mezclar bien.","Saque 24 trozos del mismo tamaño de la mezcla, usando una bola de helado si tiene una, y forme un tronco con cada uno girándolo entre sus manos. Coloque cada tronco en una bandeja para hornear, luego enfríe durante 30 minutos o hasta que sea necesario.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua con sal. Sumerja el gnudi en el agua, baje el fuego y cocine durante 3-4 minutos (haga esto en tandas si es necesario). Mientras tanto, calentar la mantequilla en una sartén grande, añadir la salvia y sofreír hasta que esté crujiente. Escurrir bien el gnudi y luego verterlo en la sartén con la salvia, junto con un buen queso rallado. Remueve todo junto, haciéndolo en tandas si te resulta más fácil. Coloque cuatro gnudi en cada plato para servir, vierta más salsa y espolvoree con más queso rallado."]','2026-01-11 13:00:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13925,7617,'es','Raviolis con nueces, queso de cabra y salsa cavolo nero','Prepare este plato de pasta con láminas de lasaña y una pasta de queso de cabra casera. Si tienes tiempo, vale la pena usar nueces recién peladas para obtener un sabor más dulce.','["200 g de col negra","75 ml de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para mezclar la pasta","1 diente de ajo pequeño","1 limón, exprimido","8-12 láminas de lasaña fresca o seca, según el tamaño","queso pecorino finamente rallado, parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, para servir","140 g de nueces","un puñado de hojas de salvia, picadas","120 g de queso de cabra","jugo de limón, al gusto","50 ml de aceite de oliva"]','["Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua ligeramente salada y luego agregue el cavolo nero. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que la col rizada adquiera un color verde brillante y se ablande. Saque con unas pinzas y colóquelo en un colador, manteniendo el agua de cocción para hervir la pasta. Deje correr agua fría sobre la col rizada, exprima el exceso de agua y luego transfiérala a un procesador de alimentos. Agregue el aceite, el ajo, el jugo de limón y 1 cucharadita de sal, luego mezcle hasta obtener un pesto fino. Sazone al gusto y transfiera a una cacerola pequeña. Calentar suavemente a fuego medio-bajo.","Limpia el procesador de alimentos. Para la pasta de queso de cabra, agregue las nueces, la salvia, el queso de cabra, un buen chorrito de jugo de limón y el aceite, luego mezcle hasta obtener una pasta. Sazone y luego caliente en otra sartén pequeña a fuego medio-bajo, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Vuelva a hervir la cacerola con agua de cavolo y agregue más agua si es necesario. Agregue las láminas de pasta y cocine a fuego lento siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir, reservando una taza de agua de la pasta para añadir a la salsa (unos 400 ml). Corta las láminas de pasta por la mitad y añade un poco de aceite de oliva.","Revuelva el agua de la pasta reservada con la salsa cavolo y mantenga a fuego lento. Si la salsa se ve espesa, diluya con un poco más de agua o aumente un poco el fuego si está demasiado líquida; Debe poder verterse como una crema doble. Vierta un charco de salsa en cada plato. Coloque capas de lasaña encima con cucharadas de pasta de queso de cabra entre cada capa. Cubra con la última hoja de pasta y vierta un poco más de salsa, luego esparza sobre el queso."]','2026-01-11 13:00:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13926,7619,'es','Hamburguesa italiana de cerdo con salsa de tomate fresco','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Condimente la carne picada de cerdo con hinojo, chile y orégano y sírvala en panecillos ciabatta con queso mascarpone y aderezo de tomate y aceitunas.','["500 g de carne picada de cerdo","1 cucharadita de semilla de hinojo","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","chorrito de aceite de oliva","2 tomates grandes, picados","6 aceitunas negras, picadas","chorrito de vinagre balsámico","4 panecillos ciabatta, partidos y tostados","4 cucharadas de mascarpone","un puñado de espinacas tiernas"]','["Mezcla la carne picada de cerdo con las semillas de hinojo, las hojuelas de chile, el orégano y un poco de condimento. Mezcle bien con las manos hasta que esté bien combinado, luego forme 4 hamburguesas. Calienta un chorrito de aceite en una sartén grande (o enciende la barbacoa y unta las hamburguesas con un poco de aceite) y cocina las hamburguesas durante 5 a 7 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén bien cocidas.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los tomates, las aceitunas, el vinagre balsámico y un chorrito más de aceite con un poco de condimento para hacer una salsa. Cubra la base de cada panecillo con 1 cucharada de mascarpone, unas hojas de espinaca, una hamburguesa y una cucharada de salsa, luego emparéjelo todo con la tapa."]','2026-01-11 13:00:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13927,7621,'es','Ñoquis con perejil, mantequilla y hinojo marino','Evite la pasta e intente hacer sus propios ñoquis de papa: busque hinojo marino para preparar un plato principal fresco y frugal sin carne.','["900 g de patatas harinosas, aproximadamente del mismo tamaño o partidas por la mitad si son grandes, sin pelar","50 g de mantequilla salada","1 huevo mediano, batido","225-280 g de harina blanca normal","100 g de mantequilla salada","6 chalotes, finamente picados","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","200g de hinojo marino","2 paquetes pequeños de perejil picado"]','["Para hacer los ñoquis, cocine las patatas en agua hirviendo durante 40-50 minutos hasta que estén muy tiernas y luego escúrralas bien. Retire la piel y presione a través de un colador o un pasapurés en un bol.","Mientras las patatas aún están calientes, añade 1 cucharadita de sal, la mantequilla, el huevo y la mitad de la harina. Mezcle ligeramente y colóquelo sobre una tabla enharinada. Amasar gradualmente una cantidad suficiente de la harina restante para hacer una masa suave, pero ligeramente pegajosa.","Estirar la masa formando salchichas de 2,5 cm de diámetro. Cortar en trozos de unos 2 cm y colocar sobre un paño de cocina enharinado para evitar que los ñoquis se peguen.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua. Coloque los ñoquis en el agua en tandas y déjelos cocinar durante 2-3 minutos hasta que floten hacia la superficie. Retirar con una espumadera y mantener caliente mientras cocinas el resto.","Mientras tanto, caliente suavemente la mantequilla en una sartén grande de base pesada, agregue las chalotas y el ajo y ablande suavemente durante 5-6 minutos. Agrega el hinojo marino y cocina durante 4-6 minutos más.","Agrega los ñoquis a la sartén con la mayor parte del perejil. Mezcle todo suavemente y sazone. Servir inmediatamente, espolvoreado con el resto del perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:00:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13928,7623,'es','Tarta de taleggio con hojaldre de nueces','La delicada masa con sabor a nuez proporciona el telón de fondo perfecto para el relleno cremoso de este delicioso plato principal sin carne.','["200 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de nueces (peso sin cáscara)","50 g de mantequilla fría, picada en trozos pequeños","25 g de queso duro vegetariano (o parmesano si no estás haciendo una versión estrictamente vegetariana), rallado","1 huevo mediano, batido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","6 chalotes, en rodajas","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente picados","1 huevo entero y 2 yemas","200ml de nata doble","140 g de taleggio vegetariano, sin cáscara y cortado en trozos de 1 cm/½","1 berro en canastilla","ralladura de 1 limón y un poco más para servir"]','["Para hacer la masa, bate la harina y las nueces en un procesador de alimentos hasta que las nueces estén muy finas. Agrega la mantequilla y el queso y bate nuevamente hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Agrega el huevo batido y 1 cucharadita de agua fría. Pulsa hasta que la mezcla forme una masa, agregando un poco más de agua si es necesario. Envolver en film transparente y enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada, extienda la masa hasta obtener el grosor de un trozo de 50p y úsela para forrar un molde para tarta de 23 cm. Pincha la base varias veces con un tenedor y regresa a la nevera para que se enfríe durante 15 minutos más. (No caiga en la tentación de omitir este paso; ayudará a evitar que se encoja).","Calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén a fuego medio y agrega las chalotas y el ajo. Freír durante 5-10 minutos hasta que las chalotas se ablanden y estén doradas. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.","Forre la masa con papel para hornear, rellénela con frijoles para hornear y hornee por 15 minutos. Retire el pergamino y regrese al horno por 10 minutos más; esto permitirá que la base se seque antes de agregar el relleno. Reducir el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.","Rompe el huevo en un tazón mediano y agrega las yemas. Batir ligeramente con un tenedor antes de verter la nata. Agrega las chalotas y el ajo, así como tres cuartos del Talegio, tres cuartos de los berros y la ralladura de limón. Estación.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde para tarta, agregue el queso restante y sazone con pimienta.","Hornee durante 40-50 minutos hasta que el relleno esté listo y se sienta firme al tacto. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos. Esparcir sobre el resto de los berros y la ralladura de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:00:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13929,7625,'es','Gnudi de ortiga con pesto salvaje','Estas albóndigas italianas son como bolas ligeras de ñoquis de ricotta o el relleno de ravioles; utilice ortigas recién recolectadas para una salsa sencilla.','["2 tarrinas de ricota de buena calidad de 250 g","200 g de hojas tiernas de ortiga (recolectadas - ver consejo)","50 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), más extra para servir","2 yemas de huevo","nuez moscada, para rallar","350 g de harina de sémola o sémola fina","6 cucharadas de pesto salvaje (ver receta en Combina bien con)"]','["Forrar un colador con un trozo de muselina y colocar sobre un bol. Vierta la ricota, junte los extremos de la muselina y átelos suavemente. Dejar escurrir durante 4 horas o preferiblemente toda la noche.","Mientras tanto, ponga a hervir una cacerola con agua. Blanquear las hojas de ortiga rápidamente, luego escurrirlas y enfriarlas bajo el grifo de agua fría. Vuelva a escurrir bien y exprima la mayor cantidad de agua posible de las hojas, luego pique muy finamente y enfríe hasta que las necesite.","Para hacer el gnudi, transfiera la ricota colada a un tazón grande. Batir un poco, luego añadir todo menos unas cucharadas de parmesano, las yemas de huevo, las ortigas, una buena ralladura de nuez moscada y mucho condimento. Revuelva bien para combinar. Vierta la sémola en una bandeja para hornear grande (más tarde deberá caber en el refrigerador). Mójese las manos, sumérjalas en la sémola y, trabajando rápidamente, vierta 1 cucharadita colmada de la mezcla de ricotta en las manos y forme una bola con cuidado. Coloca la bola en la bandeja de sémola y enrolla para que quede completamente cubierta. Recógelo y hazlo rodar entre las palmas de tus manos para crear una bola suave, luego vuelve a colocarlo en la sémola. Continúa con el resto de la mezcla; deberías tener unas 28 bolas en total. Dejando las bolas en la sémola, asegúrese de que estén bien espaciadas y luego cúbralas sin apretar con film transparente. Enfríe durante 12 a 24 horas (cuanto más tiempo, mejor) hasta que se forme una piel en el gnudi.","Para cocinar, hierva una cacerola grande con agua. Mientras tanto, vierta el pesto en una sartén. Una vez que el agua esté hirviendo, agregue tandas de gnudi y cocine a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos o hasta que suban a la superficie. Sacar con una espumadera y transferir a un colador. Repita con el gnudi restante. Calentar el pesto en la sartén con unas cucharadas del agua de cocción del gnudi para que se suelte. Vierta el gnudi cocido en la sartén y gire suavemente las bolas en el pesto. Dividir en platos y esparcir sobre el queso parmesano restante y una buena pizca de pimienta negra antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13930,7627,'es','Mantequilla de ajo silvestre sobre pan de papel musical','Este pan delicado y súper fino está inspirado en un clásico sardo, la carta di musica; sírvelo con mantequilla aromatizada como entrante o acompañamiento especial.','["200 g de harina ''00'', más un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de harina de sémola o sémola fina","aceite de oliva, para cepillar","8 rodajas de mantequilla de ajo silvestre (ver receta en Combina bien), para servir","sal marina en escamas, para servir"]','["En un bol, mezcle las harinas y 1/2 cucharadita de sal. Vierta 175 ml de agua y mezcle hasta obtener una masa suave. Vierta sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase durante unos 5 minutos o hasta que quede suave. Envolver en film transparente y dejar reposar 30 minutos. Mientras tanto, coloque una piedra para pizza o una o dos bandejas para hornear grandes en el horno, luego caliéntelo a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9 o tan alto como sea posible.","Dividir la masa en 8 y darles forma de bolitas. Sobre una superficie enharinada, extienda las bolas muy finas formando círculos rugosos de unos 20-22 cm de diámetro.","Recorta 8 cuadrados de papel para hornear un poco más grandes que los círculos de masa. Coloca los círculos de masa encima y unta con aceite de oliva. Cocine los panes, 1 o 2 a la vez, en la piedra para pizza caliente o en la bandeja para hornear (aún sobre el papel para hornear) durante 6 a 8 minutos o hasta que burbujeen en algunos lugares, estén dorados y crujientes. Retirar y dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla mientras se cuece el resto. Vuelva a colocar todos los panes en el horno durante 1 minuto para que se calienten. Retirar y cubrir con una rodaja de mantequilla de ajo (ver Combina bien) y sal marina."]','2026-01-11 13:00:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13931,7629,'es','Focaccia de patata nueva y romero','Este sencillo pan de estilo italiano está inspirado en el clásico chip buttie, perfecto como alternativa a una canasta de pan para una cena.','["250 g de patatas nuevas (nosotros utilizamos Jersey Royals)","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","8 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para engrasar","500 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para amasar y espolvorear","paquete pequeño de romero"]','["Cocine las patatas en agua hirviendo durante 15 minutos, luego escúrralas y déjelas enfriar por completo. Mientras tanto, hierve la tetera.","Vierta 175 ml de agua hirviendo y 100 ml de agua fría en un recipiente grande. Espolvorea sobre la levadura, 1 cucharadita de sal y 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva. Mezcle bien, luego agregue la harina y agregue un poco más de agua si la mezcla se siente demasiado seca.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia y amase durante 15 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástica (espolvoree la superficie con un poco de harina si la masa está pegajosa), luego forme una bola. Engrase el interior de un tazón grande con aceite de oliva, luego agregue la masa al tazón y voltee varias veces para cubrirla con el aceite. Cubrir con film transparente y dejar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Engrase una fuente para asar grande (de unos 26 cm x 35 cm) con aceite de oliva y espolvoree con un poco de harina. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Estirar con cuidado la masa para que quepa en el molde, presionándola en las esquinas. Corta las patatas cocidas en gajos y mételas en la masa a intervalos regulares, junto con unas ramitas de romero, y esparce unas cuantas ramitas por encima. Cubrir el molde con film transparente y dejar reposar otros 45 minutos. Retirar el film transparente, verter 3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y espolvorear un poco de sal. Hornear en el horno\r\ndurante 30-35 minutos o hasta que el pan esté dorado y las patatas ligeramente doradas.","Cuando el pan esté cocido, retíralo del horno y rocía rápidamente otras 3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva mientras aún esté caliente. Dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una tabla, cortar en rodajas y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13932,7631,'es','Artichoke & olive calzones','Estos paquetes italianos son una excelente cena vegetariana entre semana; use una mezcla de pan comprada en la tienda para ahorrar tiempo','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","Lata de 390 g de corazones de alcachofa en agua, escurridos y cortados en rodajas","4 ramitas de romero, solo las hojas, picadas","½ tarrina de 250 g de ricota","2 dientes de ajo machacados","300 g de mezcla de pan","75 g de aceitunas verdes, en rodajas","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, cortada en cubitos","hojas mixtas, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Calentar el aceite en una sartén y cocinar las alcachofas y el romero durante unos minutos hasta que las alcachofas estén un poco doradas. Mezcle la ricota y el ajo y sazone.","Vacíe la mezcla de pan en un bol y prepare siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Dividir en 4 bolas y extender cada una hasta formar un círculo de 20 cm. Unte un lado de cada uno con ricotta, espolvoree con las aceitunas, las alcachofas y el romero, luego cubra con la mozzarella. Cepille los bordes de la masa con agua y doble la mitad descubierta sobre el relleno. Presione los bordes para sellar. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 12 a 15 minutos hasta que esté inflado y dorado, luego sirva con hojas mixtas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13933,7633,'es','Pappardelle con ragú de conejo y castañas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta es la mejor comida reconfortante para los días lluviosos: tiras de pasta plana mezcladas con un rico ragu carnoso, castañas cremosas y ralladura de naranja aromática.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza o de oliva","1 conejo, cocido (pídele a tu carnicero que lo haga por ti)","2 cucharadas de harina común","200 g de tocino ahumado","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 zanahoria, finamente picada","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de bayas de enebro, trituradas con un mortero","3 hojas de laurel, arrugadas en la mano para liberar el sabor","2 ramitas de romero, hojas recogidas y picadas","200 ml de vino tinto","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","200 g de castañas cocidas, picadas en trozos grandes","400 g de pappardelle","3 cucharadas de leche","ralladura de ½ naranja o 1 clementina","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","Parmesano, para servir (opcional)"]','["Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén grande y ancha o en una cacerola ignífuga con tapa. Sazona el conejo y añade la harina. Agregue al aceite caliente y dore por todos lados; es posible que deba hacerlo en tandas. Cuando esté completamente dorado, transfiéralo a un plato. Agregue el aceite restante y los lardons a la sartén y cocine por 10 minutos hasta que estén crujientes y dorados. Agregue la cebolla, la zanahoria y el apio y revuelva durante 10 minutos, raspando los trozos crujientes del fondo, hasta que las verduras se ablanden. Agrega el ajo y cocina por 1 min más.","Luego, agregue la canela, el enebro, las hojas de laurel y el romero. Después de 1 minuto, vierte el vino y desmenúzalo en la pastilla de caldo. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos, luego agregue los tomates y devuelva el conejo a la sartén. Coloque el conejo en la salsa, cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 horas, revolviendo una o dos veces.","Retire el conejo, revuelva bien la salsa y vuelva a tapar. Continúe cocinando la salsa a fuego lento mientras desmenuza la carne de los huesos con 2 tenedores. Deseche los huesos y vuelva a agregar la carne a la sartén, junto con la mitad de las castañas. Cocine, sin tapar, durante otros 30 minutos hasta que se reduzca a una salsa espesa y rica. Agrega las castañas restantes. Ahora se puede enfriar y enfriar durante la noche o congelar hasta por 2 meses.","Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Agrega la leche, la ralladura de naranja y el perejil a la salsa y vuelve a calentarla, si está fría. Cuando la pasta esté cocida, agrégala a la salsa y cocina juntos por 1 min más. Sirva con parmesano, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13934,7635,'es','pastel de la abuela','Dale un toque delicioso a esta tarta toscana añadiendo chocolate amargo al tradicional relleno de natillas y delicados pasteles dulces.','["280 g de harina común","175 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en cubos","75 g de azúcar glas y un poco más para espolvorear","2 yemas de huevo, ligeramente batidas","1 litro de leche entera","1 vaina de vainilla, partida","8 yemas de huevo grandes","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","85 g de harina ''00''","100 g de ricota","ralladura de 2 naranjas","200 g de barra de chocolate negro rallado","75 g de piñones"]','["Para hacer la masa, ponga la harina, la mantequilla y el azúcar glas en un procesador de alimentos y presione hasta que parezca pan rallado. Con el motor en marcha, agrega lentamente las yemas de huevo. Si la mezcla parece demasiado seca, rocíe con 1 o 2 cucharadas de agua fría. Inclínelo sobre la superficie de trabajo y amase suavemente. Aplana la masa hasta formar un disco, envuélvela en film transparente y deja enfriar durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Vierta la leche en una cacerola. Raspe las semillas de vainilla de la vaina partida en la leche y agregue la vaina también. Calentar la leche\r\na fuego medio hasta que empiece a burbujear por los bordes. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.","Batir las yemas de huevo, el azúcar y la harina con una batidora eléctrica durante 5-10 minutos hasta que estén pálidos y como una mousse. Retire la vaina de vainilla de la leche enfriada y vierta constantemente sobre las yemas batidas, batiendo constantemente.","Vierta la mezcla de natillas en una cacerola limpia. Calentar a fuego medio-bajo, batiendo todo el tiempo. Cocine las natillas durante 10 minutos, sin dejar de batir, hasta que estén muy espesas. Retirar del fuego y pasar por un colador hasta colocar en un plato ancho. Cubrir la superficie con film transparente para evitar que se forme piel en las natillas. Deja enfriar mientras preparas la masa de hojaldre.","Extienda la masa entre 2 trozos de papel para hornear para forrar un molde para tarta estriado de fondo suelto de 24 cm. Cubrir con film transparente y enfriar durante 30 minutos. Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cubra la caja de la tarta con papel de aluminio o papel para hornear y rellénela con frijoles para hornear. Hornear en el horno durante 15 minutos. Retire con cuidado los frijoles para hornear y el papel de aluminio, luego regrese al horno durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que la masa esté dorada. Dejar enfriar en el molde sobre una rejilla mientras terminas el relleno.","Reducir el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Batir suavemente las natillas con la ricota, la ralladura de naranja y el chocolate rallado hasta que estén combinados y esparcir uniformemente sobre la base de la tarta. Espolvoree sobre los piñones y hornee durante 35 a 40 minutos; el relleno aún estará bastante tambaleante pero se endurecerá a medida que se enfríe. Enfríe durante al menos 3 horas o toda la noche. Espolvoree con azúcar glas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13935,4369,'es','aguacota','Esta sopa tradicional toscana, que significa "agua cocida", se sirve con un huevo escalfado para darle más sabor: un entrante perfecto o un almuerzo ligero.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 ramas de apio, picadas","2 zanahorias pequeñas, picadas","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de hojas de tomillo, más un poco más para servir","50 g de champiñones porcini secos","225 g de tomates pera, sin semillas y picados","850 ml de caldo de pollo","2 cucharadas de perejil picado","3 rebanadas de buen pan crujiente, tostadas y cortadas en trozos","6 huevos"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva en una cacerola grande y sofríe el apio, las zanahorias, la cebolla, el ajo y el tomillo durante 10-15 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Mientras tanto, cubra los porcini con agua caliente y déjelos en remojo durante 15 minutos hasta que se ablanden y se hinchen. Escurre los champiñones, reserva el líquido de remojo y pícalos en trozos grandes. Agregue a las verduras ablandadas junto con el líquido de remojo y cocine por otros 5 minutos.","Agregue los tomates y cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que comiencen a descomponerse, luego vierta el caldo y cocine a fuego lento.","Escalfa los 6 huevos en una cacerola grande aparte con agua hirviendo durante 3-4 minutos hasta que cuajen, luego retíralos con una espumadera. Agregue el perejil y un poco de condimento a la sopa y mezcle con el pan tostado desmenuzado. Divide la sopa en 6 tazones y coloca un huevo encima de cada uno. Sirva espolvoreado con tomillo extra."]','2026-01-11 13:00:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13936,7637,'es','Espaguetis con gambas al chile, salami y pan rallado de gremolata','Saltee los chiles rojos con ajo, semillas de hinojo y tomates para obtener una base de salsa para pasta fácil y deliciosa; termine con pan rallado crujiente y perejil.','["4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 chiles rojos del tamaño de un pulgar, cortados en rodajas y sin la mayoría de las semillas","3 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","10 rodajas de salami de hinojo, picado","140 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","400 g de espaguetis o pasta bucatini","300 g de gambas crudas grandes, sin cáscara","2 rebanadas de pan crujiente, trituradas hasta obtener migajas","un puñado grande de perejil de hoja plana, picado","ralladura de 1 limón"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. En una sartén grande, calentar 3 cucharadas de aceite. Agregue los chiles y la mayor parte del ajo (ahorre 1 cucharadita para el pan rallado) y saltee hasta que estén dorados, aproximadamente 2-3 minutos. Agrega las semillas de hinojo y el salami y revuelve durante 1 min. Agregue los tomates y una pizca de sal, luego saltee durante 10 minutos más.","Coloca el pan rallado en una bandeja para hornear, vierte sobre el aceite restante, sazona y hornea durante 7 minutos. Mezcle el ajo restante con las migas y hornee por 3 minutos más. Retirar y añadir el perejil y la ralladura de limón.","Cocine la pasta en agua hirviendo con sal según las instrucciones del paquete, aproximadamente 9 minutos. Calienta la salsa y justo antes de que la pasta esté lista, agrega las gambas para que se cocinen bien. Escurrir la pasta y mezclar con la salsa, luego espolvorear con las migas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13937,5533,'es','panzanella de aguacate','Con solo 20 minutos de preparación y sin tiempo de cocción podrás preparar esta colorida ensalada de aguacate y pan en poco tiempo.','["1 diente de ajo, machacado","1½ cucharada de alcaparras, escurridas y enjuagadas","1 aguacate maduro, deshuesado, pelado y picado","1 cebolla morada pequeña, en rodajas muy finas","175 g de chapata o pan crujiente","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca"]','["Corta los tomates por la mitad o pícalos (según el tamaño) y ponlos en un bol. Sazona bien y agrega el ajo, las alcaparras, el aguacate y la cebolla, y mezcla bien. Reservar durante 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, corte o corte la ciabatta en trozos de 3 cm y colóquelos en un tazón grande para servir o en una fuente. Rocíe con la mitad del aceite de oliva, la mitad del vinagre y agregue un poco de condimento. Cuando esté listo para servir, vierta sobre los tomates y el jugo. Espolvoree con las hojas de albahaca y rocíe con el aceite y el vinagre restantes. Revuelva por última vez y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13938,7639,'es','Panna cotta de fresa','Sirva este cremoso postre italiano con una capa superior de salsa de fresa fresca y nuestras galletas caseras de almendras saladas a un lado.','["3 hojas de gelatina","450ml de nata doble","200ml de leche entera","100 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","1 vaina de vainilla","400 g de fresas, peladas y partidas por la mitad o en cuartos si son muy grandes","1½ cucharadita de harina de maíz","50 g de azúcar blanca en polvo"]','["Para la panna cotta, ponga las hojas de gelatina en un recipiente pequeño con agua fría para que se ablanden; esto llevará unos 5 minutos. Mientras tanto, verter la nata, la leche y el azúcar en una cacerola, partir la vaina de vainilla, raspar las semillas y añadir, junto con la vaina, a la mezcla de nata. Calienta suavemente hasta que esté caliente, pero sin burbujear. Retire las hojas de gelatina del agua, exprima el exceso de líquido y agréguelas, una a la vez, a la nata caliente. Revuelva hasta que se disuelva. Déjelo reposar durante 20 a 30 minutos hasta que se enfríe; en este punto, las vainas de vainilla deben estar suspendidas en el líquido. Cuele la mezcla a través de un colador y vierta en 6 vasos para servir, luego enfríe durante al menos 3 horas.","Mezcle las fresas con la maicena y el azúcar en una cacerola. Coloca a fuego medio y cocina durante 4-5 minutos, hasta que el jugo liberado espese y las fresas se ablanden. Dejar enfriar. Una vez que estén completamente frías, cubra las panna cottas con la mezcla de fresas. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13939,7641,'es','Tagliolini de berenjena y chile','Taglioni es una pasta fina y plana, similar a los tagliatelle. Si no puede encontrarlo, utilice linguini para este plato de pasta vegetariana.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 berenjena grande, cortada en cubos pequeños","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","400 g de tomates frescos, picados en trozos grandes o 400 g de tomates en lata picados","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","400 g de pasta taglioni o linguini secos","manojo pequeño de albahaca, picada en trozos grandes","50 g de queso pecorino rallado o alternativa vegetariana"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva en una cacerola grande y cocina la berenjena durante 5 minutos hasta que empiece a dorarse y ablandarse.","Agrega la cebolla, el ajo, la guindilla y el orégano y cocina por unos minutos. Agregue los tomates, el vinagre balsámico y unos 200 ml de agua, luego reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 20 minutos, hasta que los tomates se reduzcan y se ablanden mucho y la salsa se espese.","Mientras tanto, hierva una cacerola grande con agua y cocine los tagliolini siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurre la pasta y regresa a la sartén. Agregue la salsa y mezcle bien con la pasta con la albahaca. Servir con el queso pecorino rallado."]','2026-01-11 13:00:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13940,7643,'es','Berenjena con carne a la parmesana','Pruebe una versión carnosa del tradicional horneado italiano de berenjena agregando un rico ragú de carne. Cubra con mascarpone, mozzarella y queso parmesano.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para cepillar","800 g de carne picada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","3 ramitas de tomillo","3 ramitas de romero","3 hojas de laurel","2 latas de 400g de tomate picado","copa de vino tinto","1 cubito de caldo de res","1 cucharada de azúcar","5 berenjenas cortadas a lo largo en rodajas de 5 mm","2 bolitas de 125 g de mozzarella, cortadas en trozos pequeños","50 g de parmesano rallado","Tarrina de 250 g de mascarpone"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande o en una cacerola ignífuga. Agrega la carne picada y dora a fuego alto, rompiendo con una cuchara de madera a medida que avanzas. (Es posible que tengas que hacer esto en tandas). Una vez que esté bien dorado, viértelo en un plato.","Añade el aceite restante, el ajo y las hierbas a la sartén y cocina a fuego lento durante 1 min. Vierta los tomates y el vino tinto y cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo los trozos de carne pegados al fondo de la sartén. Regrese la carne picada a la sartén, desmenúcela en el cubo de caldo y agregue el azúcar y los condimentos. Cocine a fuego lento durante al menos 1 hora, revolviendo ocasionalmente y agregando más agua para mantenerlo picante si es necesario. Si tienes tiempo para cocinar a fuego lento durante más tiempo, hazlo: cuanto más tiempo, mejor. Saque los tallos de las hierbas y las hojas de laurel.","Mientras tanto, calienta una plancha o sartén. Unte las rodajas de berenjena por ambos lados con aceite de oliva y luego cocine a la plancha en tandas. Desea que cada rebanada esté blanda y ligeramente carbonizada, así que no la caliente demasiado o la berenjena se quemará antes de ablandarse. Retirar a un plato a medida que avanza.","Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Reserve un poco de cada queso para colocarlo encima. En una fuente para horno grande, esparza una cucharada de salsa picada sobre la base, luego cubra con una capa de berenjenas y sazone bien. Vierta un poco más de salsa picada y luego esparza un poco de mozzarella, parmesano y gotas de mascarpone. Agrega otra capa de berenjenas y un poco de condimento. Repita, colocando todo en capas y termine con una capa de salsa de carne. Cubra con el queso reservado y hornee durante 30-40 minutos hasta que la parte superior esté crujiente y dorada y la carne picada burbujee."]','2026-01-11 13:00:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13941,7645,'es','Ragú cremoso de polenta y champiñones','La polenta de parmesano cubierta con una rica mezcla de champiñones y queso Taleggio derretido lo convierte en un plato principal vegetariano diferente.','["un puñado pequeño de hongos porcini secos","25 g de mantequilla","1 chalota, finamente cortada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","5 ramitas de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","500 g de champiñones grandes, en rodajas","200 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas","vaso pequeño de vino tinto","125 ml de caldo de verduras","100 g de queso taleggio (o alternativa vegetariana), en rodajas","500ml de leche","1 hoja de laurel","3 ramitas de tomillo","250 g de polenta instantánea","50 g de mantequilla","75 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), rallado"]','["Remojar los champiñones secos en 150 ml de agua tibia. Dejar reposar durante 20 minutos, luego escurrir y exprimir, reservando el líquido de remojo. Calienta la mantequilla en una sartén grande. Cuando chisporrotee, agregue la chalota y cocine por unos minutos hasta que esté suave. Agrega el ajo y las hojas de tomillo, cocina 1 min más, luego sube el fuego y agrega los champiñones remojados. Pasado 1 minuto, añade todos los demás champiñones y sofríe a fuego muy alto durante 5 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Rocíe el vino tinto y hierva rápidamente durante 1 min. Vierta el caldo y el líquido de champiñones reservado y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta obtener un guiso espeso. Apaga el fuego.","Para la polenta, llevar a ebullición la leche con 500ml de agua, el laurel y el tomillo. Apague el fuego y déjelo en infusión durante 20 minutos, luego retire las hierbas y vuelva a hervir. Agrega la polenta en un chorro constante, batiendo constantemente. Cocine durante 1 minuto hasta que espese, luego agregue la mantequilla y el queso parmesano. Coloque un \"cráter\" de polenta en una bandeja para hornear y rellénelo con el ragú. Cubra con rodajas de Taleggio, colóquelas debajo de una parrilla caliente hasta que se derrita y rezume, luego deje que todos se sirvan ellos mismos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13942,7647,'es','Orecchiette con anchoas y brócoli de brotes morados','Este humilde plato del sur de Italia condimentado con chile y jugo de limón está cubierto con pan rallado frito para darle un toque más crujiente.','["200 g de orecchiette","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","6 filetes de anchoa en aceite, picados (reservar 1 cucharada de aceite)","4 dientes de ajo gordos, en rodajas finas","1 chile rojo, en rodajas finas","ralladura de 1 limón y ½ jugo","50 g de pan rallado fresco","200 g de brócoli germinado morado"]','["Cocine las orecchiette siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, calentar en una sartén 3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y 1 cucharada de aceite de anchoas. Agregue el ajo y la guindilla y cocine a fuego lento durante 3-4 minutos hasta que el ajo empiece a dorarse. Agrega las anchoas y el jugo de limón y cocina durante 1 o 2 minutos más hasta que las anchoas se derritan en la salsa. Pon el resto del aceite de oliva, el pan rallado y la ralladura de limón en otra sartén, revuelve y cocina hasta que esté crujiente.","Cuando a la pasta le queden de 4 a 5 minutos, agregue el brócoli a la sartén. Cuando esté cocida la escurrimos reservando una taza de agua de la pasta y la añadimos a la sartén con los ajos y las anchoas. Remueve y cocina a fuego lento durante 2 minutos más, añadiendo un chorrito de agua de la pasta si se ve seca. Sazone y luego sirva en tazones de pasta con las migajas de limón espolvoreadas por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13943,7648,'es','Conchiglioni al horno con salchicha, salvia y calabaza','El queso fontina derretido, el rico aceite de trufa y una salsa cremosa de calabaza y parmesano convierten estas conchas de pasta rellenas en una cena deliciosa.','["1 calabaza pequeña, pelada, sin semillas y con la pulpa cortada en cubos pequeños","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","Salvia en paquetes pequeños, hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes","8 salchichas de buena calidad","buena nuez moscada rallada, aproximadamente ¼ de nuez moscada entera","350 g de conchiglioni, ver más abajo","50 g de mantequilla","50 g de harina común","850ml de leche","50 g de parmesano rallado y un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de fontina rallada o 125 g de mozzarella en bolas, picada","chorrito de aceite de trufa"]','["Coloque la calabaza en un recipiente apto para microondas con 1 cucharada de agua. Cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 10 minutos o hasta que esté suave. Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén, añadir las hojas de salvia y cocinar a fuego lento durante 1 min. Retire las salchichas de la piel y divídalas en bolitas del tamaño de avellanas sin cáscara. Añadir a la sartén y freír hasta que se dore. Agrega la mitad de la calabaza y reserva. Triture la calabaza restante con el líquido del bol, la nuez moscada y el condimento.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cocer la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola, luego agregue la harina y revuelva hasta obtener una pasta. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos, revolviendo todo el tiempo, luego mezcle gradualmente con la leche hasta obtener una salsa suave. Agrega el puré de calabaza, el parmesano y abundante condimento. Agrega 3-4 cucharadas de salsa a la mezcla de salchicha para humedecerla un poco.","Extienda el resto de la salsa de calabaza sobre la base de una fuente para hornear grande y poco profunda. Escurre la pasta, pero deja un poco de líquido en la sartén para evitar que las cáscaras se peguen. Saque los trozos de pasta rotos de la sartén y espárcelos sobre la salsa. Alinee las conchas encima, empujándolas hacia abajo en la salsa de modo que solo sobresalga la parte superior de las conchas. Rellena cada concha con la mezcla de salchicha. Esparcir con fontina o mozzarella, rallar un poco más de parmesano y rociar con un poco de aceite de trufa, si lo desea. Hornee por 30 minutos o hasta que estén dorados."]','2026-01-11 13:00:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13944,7650,'es','Ragu de pato veneciano','La canela agrega complejidad a esta salsa para pasta cocida a fuego lento, que combina perfectamente con pasta paccheri tubular grande o cintas de pappardelle.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 patas de pato","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","2 dientes de ajo gordos, machacados","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","2 cucharaditas de harina común","250 ml de vino tinto","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 pastilla de caldo de pollo, hasta 250 ml","3 ramitas de romero, hojas recogidas y picadas","2 hojas de laurel","1 cucharadita de azúcar","2 cucharadas de leche","600 g de pasta paccheri o pappardelle","parmesano rallado para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Agregue las piernas de pato y dore por todos lados durante unos 10 minutos. Retirar a un plato y reservar. Agrega las cebollas a la sartén y cocina durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo y cocine por 1 minuto más, luego agregue la canela y la harina y cocine por 1 minuto más. Regrese el pato a la sartén, agregue el vino, los tomates, el caldo, las hierbas, el azúcar y los condimentos. Llevar a fuego lento, luego bajar el fuego, tapar y cocinar durante 2 horas, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Saque con cuidado las piernas de pato de la salsa y colóquelas en un plato; estarán muy tiernas, así que trate de no perder nada de carne. Retire y deseche la grasa, luego desmenuce la carne con 2 tenedores y deseche los huesos. Vuelva a agregar la carne a la salsa con la leche y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 10 a 15 minutos más mientras cocina la pasta.","Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrrala, reserve una taza de agua de la pasta y agregue la pasta al ragú. Revuelve para cubrir toda la pasta con la salsa y cocina por 1 minuto más, agregando un chorrito de líquido de cocción si se ve seco. Sirva con parmesano rallado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13945,7653,'es','Pasta italiana con salchichas y castañas','Una mezcla de carne de salchicha y trozos de castaña crea una salsa para pasta rica y con sabor a nuez, lo que la convierte de un plato cotidiano en algo especial.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","Paquete de 450 g de salchichas Lincolnshire, con la carne exprimida","200 g de castañas envasadas al vacío de una lata o frasco, picadas en trozos grandes (consulte el consejo a continuación)","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de romero picado","1 cucharadita de semilla de hinojo","1 vaso de vino tinto con cuerpo","500 g de puré de cartón","500 g de pasta grande o pappardelle","paquete pequeño de perejil rizado, finamente picado","Parmesano o Grana Padano, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y\r\nsofreír la cebolla durante 5 min. Una vez iniciado\r\npara que se ablande, agregue la carne de la salchicha y\r\ncastañas y sofreír durante otros 10-12 minutos,\r\nromper la carne con un palo de madera\r\nespátula o cuchara mientras lo fríes. Mantenga el\r\nCaliente bastante alto y revuelva con frecuencia.","Cuando la carne y las castañas estén\r\ndorado, agregar el ajo, el romero\r\ny semillas de hinojo, y cocine por 2 minutos.\r\nmás. Rocíe el vino, deje que la mayor parte\r\nhierva y luego agregue la passata. Portada\r\ny cocine a fuego lento la salsa durante 10 minutos mientras\r\nSe hierve la pasta en abundante sal.\r\nagua, siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Reserva una taza de la pasta cociendo.\r\nagua, luego escurrir bien la pasta. tirar\r\nla pasta, 3 cucharadas de agua, el ragú\r\ny la mayor parte del perejil juntos, luego\r\nsazone al gusto. Compartir entre tazones,\r\nañadir una pizca de pimienta negra, la\r\nperejil restante, luego un puñado de\r\nVirutas de parmesano."]','2026-01-11 13:00:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13946,7655,'es','Ensalada de pera laminada, queso y bresaola','Una ensalada rústica con carne curada, queso azul y achicoria acompañada de peras dulces y aderezada con una vinagreta de vino tinto.','["100 g de nueces en mitades","2 peras crujientes, de color rosa si es posible","2 cabezas de achicoria roja o achicoria, partidas en hojas","100 g de bresaola (ternera curada en rodajas finas)","140 g de dolcelatte o tu queso azul suave local favorito, en rodajas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen o de colza","2 cucharadas de vino tinto o oporto","2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada"]','["Tostar las nueces y hacer el aderezo.\r\nPrimero, ya que necesitarán enfriarse. Calor\r\nhorno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner el\r\nnueces en una bandeja para hornear y tostarlas\r\n5 minutos o hasta que esté dorado oscuro. Fresco. Pon el\r\nvino o Oporto en una cacerola pequeña con\r\nel vinagre y el azúcar. Hervir durante 3 minutos\r\no hasta que esté ligeramente almibarado (se espesará a medida que\r\nenfría, así que no te dejes llevar), entonces\r\nRetirar del fuego y reservar.","Cuando esté listo para servir, afeite en rodajas finas.\r\nde las peras con un cuchillo grande y afilado,\r\nmandolina o pelador de patatas. Mezclarlos\r\njunto con las hojas, bresaola,\r\nqueso y nueces en un plato grande.\r\nSazone el aderezo y luego rocíelo\r\nla ensalada, seguida del aceite. disfruta\r\nde inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:00:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13947,7657,'es','Bolas de risotto margarita','Estas hamburguesas de arancini fritas, hechas con arroz arborio con tomate, tienen una deliciosa base de queso mozzarella derretido.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","500ml en puré","850 ml de caldo de verduras","1 diente de ajo, machacado","300 g de arroz arbóreo","vaso pequeño de vino blanco","25 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), rallado","nuez de mantequilla","3 cucharadas de albahaca picada en trozos grandes","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, cortada en 12 trozos","75 g de harina sazonada","2 huevos batidos","Paquete de 125 g de pan rallado seco","1½ l de aceite, para freír","rúcula, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite de oliva en una olla de base pesada.\r\ncacerola. Agrega la cebolla, tapa y suda.\r\nhasta que esté suave. En otra cacerola mezclar la passata.\r\ny el caldo, y calentar a fuego lento.","Agregue el ajo a la cebolla, cocine por\r\n30 segundos, luego vierta el arroz y revuelva para\r\ncubrir con el aceite. Aumentar el fuego, verter\r\nel vino y dejar cocer a fuego lento hasta que se absorba.\r\nManteniendo la sartén a fuego medio,\r\ncomience a agregar la mezcla de caldo de tomate\r\nal arroz un cucharón a la vez, dejando que\r\nel arroz absorbe la mayor parte del líquido después de cada\r\nadición. Continúe revolviendo a medida que avanza, agregando\r\nlíquido hasta que el arroz esté al dente – puedes\r\nNo hace falta todo el líquido. no quieres\r\nque quede tan húmedo como un risotto normal,\r\nasí que sigue cocinando hasta que estés de madera.\r\nLa cuchara puede mantenerse de pie en ella. Apague el\r\ncalentar, revolver con el parmesano,\r\nmantequilla y albahaca, luego tapar durante 5 minutos.\r\nSazone y vierta sobre una bandeja para que se enfríe.\r\ncompletamente, luego enfríe hasta que esté firme.","Forma 12 bolas grandes con el risotto.\r\nHaz un agujero en el centro con tu dedo.\r\ny rellenar con un trozo de mozzarella, luego\r\ndarle forma de bola. Ahora empieza un poco\r\nlínea de producción, sumergiendo las bolas en el\r\nharina, luego el huevo y rebozar con la\r\npan rallado; luego enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Calentar el aceite a 160 ° C en una olla grande y profunda.\r\ncacerola y calentar el horno a 180C/160 ventilador/gas 4. Freír las bolas de risotto\r\ndurante 8 a 10 minutos; deberás hacer esto en\r\nlotes. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y luego\r\ntransferir a una bandeja y meter en el horno durante\r\n6-8 minutos para asegurarse de que la mozzarella esté\r\ncompletamente derretido. Espolvorear con sal,\r\nluego dejar enfriar unos instantes\r\nantes de comer. Sirva con un poco\r\ncohete vestido."]','2026-01-11 13:00:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13948,4483,'es','Amatriciana de tuétano al horno','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. La médula tiene un sabor suave, así que anímelo con una picante salsa de tomate italiana con tocino, chile y tomillo.','["1 tuétano, cortado en rodajas de 6 cm de grosor","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, rallada","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","Paquete de 125 g de cubitos de tocino","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 dientes de ajo, picados","tomillo ramita grande","1 hoja de laurel","espolvorear azúcar en polvo dorado","2-3 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","2 latas de 400g de tomate picado","vaso grande de vino tinto","una pizca de hojuelas de chile seco"]','["Para la salsa, calentar la mitad del aceite en una sartén.\r\ny chisporrotear la panceta durante 5 minutos, hasta que\r\napenas empezando a estar crujiente. Luego agrega la cebolla,\r\najo, tomillo, laurel y azúcar, y cocinar\r\nhasta que las cebollas estén doradas. chapotear en el\r\nvinagre, chisporrotee por un momento y luego vierta\r\nlos tomates. Agita el vino\r\nlas latas de tomate para lavar hasta el último momento\r\nun poco y verter en la salsa. Sazone con\r\nguindilla y una pizca de sal y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 30 minutos hasta que esté rico y espeso.","Mientras tanto, calentar el horno a\r\nVentilador/gas 200C/180C 6. Saque el\r\nmitad de la médula, dejando un poco\r\nen la parte inferior para formar una base. Rocíe una fuente para hornear con un\r\npoco aceite, disponer el tuétano en el\r\nplato y ase durante 30 minutos.","Vierta la salsa en el medio de\r\ncada rodaja de tuétano, cubrir con papel de aluminio y\r\nhornee por 30 minutos. Retire el papel de aluminio, esparza\r\nsobre la mozzarella y regresar a la\r\nHorno durante 10 minutos hasta que el queso esté\r\nderretido y el tuétano está tierno."]','2026-01-11 13:00:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13949,7659,'es','Pizza Margarita en 4 sencillos pasos','Incluso un cocinero novato puede dominar el arte de la pizza con nuestra sencilla guía paso a paso. bellísimo','["300 g de harina fuerte para pan","1 cucharadita de levadura instantánea (de bolsita o tarrina)","1 cucharadita de sal","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","100ml en puré","un puñado de albahaca fresca o 1 cucharadita seca","1 diente de ajo, machacado","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, en rodajas","un puñado de parmesano rallado o rallado","un puñado de tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","un puñado de hojas de albahaca (opcional)"]','["Haga la base: ponga la harina en un tazón grande, luego agregue la levadura y la sal. Hacer un hueco, verter 200ml de agua tibia y el aceite de oliva y mezclar con una cuchara de madera hasta obtener una masa suave y bastante húmeda. Colóquelo sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase durante 5 minutos hasta que quede suave. Cubrir con un paño de cocina y reservar. Puedes dejar que la masa suba si quieres, pero no es imprescindible para obtener una masa fina.","Prepare la salsa: mezcle la passata, la albahaca y el ajo machacado y luego sazone al gusto. Dejar reposar en\r\ntemperatura ambiente mientras continúas dando forma a la base.","Estire la masa: si dejó que la masa suba, amase rápidamente y luego divídala en dos bolas. Sobre una superficie enharinada, extienda la masa en círculos grandes, de unos 25 cm de ancho, con un rodillo. La masa tiene que quedar muy fina porque en el horno subirá. Levante las rondas sobre dos bandejas para hornear enharinadas.","Cubra y hornee: Caliente el horno a 240 ° C / ventilador 220 ° C / gas 8. Coloque otra bandeja para hornear o una bandeja para hornear volteada hacia el horno.\r\nen el estante superior. Alise la salsa sobre las bases con el dorso de una cuchara. Espolvorea con queso y tomates, rocía con aceite de oliva y sazona. Coloque una pizza, todavía en su bandeja para hornear, encima de la bandeja o bandeja precalentada. Hornee durante 8-10 minutos hasta que\r\ncrujiente. Sirva con un poco más de aceite de oliva y hojas de albahaca si las usa. Repita el paso para la pizza restante."]','2026-01-11 13:00:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13950,7661,'es','Pizzettas de higos y jamón','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Impresiona cuando entretienes con estas mini pizzas cubiertas con mozzarella cremosa, fruta dulce y jamón italiano salado.','["nuez de mantequilla","3 chalotas, finamente picadas","250 g de crema fresca entera","50 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","4 higos maduros, cortados en trozos","125 g de mozzarella de búfala de buena calidad, desmenuzada","2 puñados de rúcula","6 rebanadas de prosciutto, cortadas en tiras","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharadas de buen vinagre balsámico","400 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de sal","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Para hacer la masa, mezclar la harina,\r\nlevadura y sal en un bol. Medida\r\n250 ml de agua tibia en una jarra, agregue\r\nel aceite, luego vierta en la mezcla de harina. Mezclar\r\njunto con una cuchara de madera, seguido\r\ncon tus manos, para hacer una masa húmeda –\r\nagregue un chorrito más de agua tibia si es necesario.\r\nCubrir con film transparente engrasado y dejar\r\nen algún lugar cálido para que suba durante 1 hora\r\no hasta que duplique su tamaño. Calentar la mantequilla,\r\nluego ablandar las chalotas y reservar.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nColoca la masa sobre una superficie enharinada,\r\namase brevemente para suavizar, luego divida en\r\n6-8 bolas. Extienda cada uno hasta formar un círculo delgado,\r\nluego colocar sobre horno espolvoreado con harina\r\nhojas. Mezclar la crème fraîche, el parmesano\r\ny chalotas con un poco de sal y mucha\r\nde pimienta negra. Extender sobre la masa y hornear durante\r\n10-15 minutos hasta que los bordes estén crujientes\r\ny ligeramente hinchado.","Mezcle los higos y la mozzarella con la\r\ncohete. Espolvorea sobre las pizzettas con\r\nel prosciutto. Mezclar el aceite y el vinagre,\r\nrocíe sobre las pizzettas y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:00:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13951,7663,'es','Raviolis de boniato y queso de cabra','La pasta fresca es increíblemente satisfactoria de hacer y mucho más fácil de lo que piensas.','["2 batatas","2 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza, más extra para servir","125 g de queso de cabra desmenuzado","sémola, para espolvorear","aceite de chile, parmesano rallado, para servir","300 g de harina para pasta ''00'', más algo extra para amasar y espolvorear","3 huevos grandes"]','["Para el relleno, hornee, cocine al vapor o en el microondas.\r\npapas, luego tritúrelas. Mezclar con\r\nlas semillas de calabaza y el queso de cabra.","Para la pasta, coloca la harina y una pizca de sal.\r\nun procesador de alimentos y casque los huevos.\r\nPulse hasta que la mezcla tenga un aspecto pegajoso.\r\nmigajas. Coloque la mezcla en una\r\nsuperficie ligeramente enharinada y juntar\r\nhasta formar una masa firme. Amasar durante 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que la masa se sienta suave, envuélvala en film transparente\r\nfilmar y enfriar durante 30 minutos. Para hacer a mano,\r\nforme un \"anillo\" con la harina sobre una superficie de trabajo,\r\nRompe los huevos por la mitad y luego, poco a poco.\r\nMezcle la harina en los huevos con los dedos.","Cortar la pasta en cuartos y luego enrollar.\r\nSaque cada pieza con una máquina de pasta.\r\nEspolvorea con harina a medida que avanzas y muévelo.\r\nbajando una muesca a una configuración más delgada\r\ncada segundo rollo. Continúe hasta llegar\r\nal penúltimo escenario. Si te gusta tu\r\npasta muy fina y delicada, puedes ir\r\npara el ajuste más fino. Si no tienes\r\nuna máquina, use un rodillo pesado para enrollar\r\nla masa lo más fina posible.","Selle las rondas usando un cortador de ravioles o\r\nun cortador de galletas de 6 cm; trabaje rápido para\r\nla pasta no se seca. Coloca los círculos\r\nsobre una superficie espolvoreada con sémola y cubrir\r\nCon film transparente mientras cortas el resto.","Coloque una cucharadita pequeña de relleno en el centro.\r\nde cada ronda. Humedecer los bordes\r\ncon agua, luego intercale otra ronda\r\nencima. Utilice las yemas de los dedos para sellar el\r\nbordes, intentando expulsar todo el aire a medida que avanzas.\r\nColoque los ravioles sobre una superficie espolvoreada con sémola.\r\npaño de cocina para secar durante unos minutos.","Cocine los raviolis en una sartén grande a fuego lento.\r\nHervir agua con sal durante 4-5 minutos. no\r\nuse un hervor completo, ya que es probable que haga\r\nravioles partidos. Escurrir y servir con un poco\r\naceite de guindilla, parmesano y semillas de calabaza."]','2026-01-11 13:00:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13952,7667,'es','Turrón de chocolate, pistacho y semifrío','Esta barra de helado tradicional italiana es la solución perfecta para un postre cremoso y helado sin esfuerzo.','["mantequilla, para la lata","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos medianos","250 g de chocolate amargo, finamente picado","450ml de nata doble","140 g de turrón duro o turrón cortado en trozos de ½ cm","50 g de pistachos, picados en trozos grandes"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde para pan de 900 g/2 lb con\r\npelícula adhesiva. Lleve una cacerola con agua a fuego suave.\r\ncocine a fuego lento. Poner el azúcar y los huevos en un\r\nrecipiente resistente al calor, luego colóquelo sobre\r\nagua hirviendo y batir hasta que esté pálido,\r\nespesa y duplica su volumen. Quitar\r\ndel fuego, sumerja el fondo de\r\nel recipiente en agua fría y continuar\r\nbatiendo hasta que la mezcla esté fría.","Derretir el chocolate en el microondas\r\nBaja, revuelve y luego incorpora la mezcla de huevo.\r\nBatir la nata hasta obtener picos suaves y doblar.\r\nen la mezcla de huevo de chocolate con el\r\nturrón y pistachos.","Vierta la mezcla en el molde para pan,\r\nalisar la superficie con una cuchara y luego\r\ncubra y congele hasta que esté firme. esto puede ser\r\nhecho hasta con 2 semanas de anticipación. para servir,\r\ndesmoldar en una fuente para servir, retirar\r\nfilm transparente y dejar en el frigorífico durante\r\n15 minutos para que se ablande un poco antes de cortarlo."]','2026-01-11 13:00:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13953,7669,'es','cazador de conejos','''Cacciatore'' significa cazador en italiano y, aunque ahora lo consideramos un plato de pollo, es una forma especialmente buena de cocinar conejo.','["900 g/2 lb de trozos de conejo","2 cucharadas de harina sazonada con sal y pimienta","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas picadas","3 dientes de ajo, picados","manojo grande de perejil, picado","300 ml de vino blanco","2 latas de 400 g/14 oz de tomates cherry","unas 20 aceitunas verdes grandes","1 cucharada de azúcar"]','["Pasar el conejo por la harina. Calentar 1 cucharada\r\naceite de oliva en una sartén grande y poco profunda y dore\r\nel conejo en 3 tandas, añadiendo otra\r\ncucharadas de aceite para cada lote. Saque todos los\r\nel conejo en un plato y reservar. Añadir\r\nla cebolla y el ajo a la sartén con el\r\naceite restante, luego cocine suavemente durante 15 minutos\r\nhasta que se ablanden. Agrega la mayor parte del perejil.\r\ny cocine por unos minutos más. Devolver el\r\nel conejo a la sartén y verter el vino.\r\nSube el fuego y burbujea el vino.\r\nhasta que esté medio reducido, luego agregue la cereza\r\ntomates. Si el conejo no está completamente\r\ntapado, añadir un chorrito de agua.","Tapar la cacerola y cocinar a fuego lento durante 40 minutos.\r\nhasta que el conejo esté tierno – el tiempo puede\r\nvariar, pero si todavía es difícil, simplemente continúa\r\ncocine, agregando más agua si es necesario, y\r\nla carne eventualmente comenzará a salir\r\nlejos del hueso. cuando la carne esta\r\nlisto, echar las aceitunas, tapar y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 5-10 minutos más. Sazone con\r\nazúcar, sal y pimienta, luego esparcir\r\ncon el perejil restante para servir.\r\nServir con polenta, puré o mantequilla,\r\npasta plana, como tagliatelle"]','2026-01-11 13:00:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13954,7671,'es','sopa de verduras italiana','Calienta tu semana con esta sopa de verduras saludable que es fácil de congelar con anticipación','["2 de cada uno de cebollas y zanahorias, picadas","4 ramas de apio, picado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de azúcar","4 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 hojas de laurel","unas ramitas de tomillo","3 calabacines, picados","Lata de 400 g de alubias, escurridas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1,2 l de caldo de verduras","100 g de parmesano o equivalente vegetariano, rallado","140 g de formas pequeñas de pasta","manojo pequeño de albahaca, rallada"]','["Cocine suavemente la cebolla, las zanahorias y\r\napio en el aceite en una cacerola grande durante\r\n20 minutos, hasta que esté suave. Salpique en agua si\r\npalo. Agrega el azúcar, el ajo, el puré y las hierbas.\r\ny calabacines y cocinar durante 4-5 minutos a temperatura\r\na fuego medio hasta que se doren un poco.","Vierta los frijoles, los tomates y el caldo.\r\nluego cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos. Si te estás congelando\r\nDéjalo enfriar y hazlo ahora (congela hasta por tres meses). Si no, añade la mitad de\r\nparmesano y la pasta y cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n6-8 minutos hasta que la pasta esté cocida. espolvorear con\r\nalbahaca y el resto del parmesano para servir.\r\nSi está congelado, descongélelo y vuelva a calentarlo antes.\r\nagregando pasta y queso y continuando\r\ncomo arriba."]','2026-01-11 13:00:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13955,7673,'es','Semifreddo de ciruela y amaretti','Una ondulación de puré de ciruela dulce y trozos de galleta de almendras convierten este helado italiano en un postre todo en uno.','["450 g de ciruelas moradas maduras, partidas por la mitad y sin hueso","350 g de azúcar en polvo","2 claras de huevo grandes","300ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de licor Disaronno","85 g de galletas amaretti blandas, partidas aproximadamente"]','["Forrar una bandeja de 30 x 20 cm con film transparente.\r\nPon las ciruelas en una cacerola con 2 cucharadas de agua.\r\ny 110g de azúcar. Cubrir con una tapa y\r\nguisar a fuego medio durante 10 minutos\r\nhasta que esté suave. Deje que se enfríe un poco y luego bátelo\r\ncon una batidora de mano. Pasar por un colador\r\npara quitar la piel de las ciruelas. Dejar enfriar.","Poner el azúcar restante en una cacerola con\r\n150 ml de agua y disolver a fuego lento.\r\ncalor. Hervir durante 5 minutos o hasta que la mezcla\r\nalcanza los 120 ° C en un termómetro de cocina.","Para hacer la base del merengue, batir\r\nlas claras hasta que estén firmes. con el\r\nbatidoras en marcha, vierta con cuidado\r\nmezcla de azúcar sobre la clara de huevo,\r\nbatiendo hasta que espese. En otro cuenco,\r\nbatir suavemente la nata y luego incorporarla suavemente\r\nen el licor, pulpa de ciruela, galletas y\r\nel merengue. Vierta en la lata, cubra\r\ncon film transparente y congelar por unas horas\r\nhasta que cuaje. Para servir, retirar del\r\nCongele el congelador 5 minutos antes de formar bolas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13956,7675,'es','pastel casero italiano','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Agregue un poco de ''mamma mia'' a un estofado de ternera con panceta y orégano y una cobertura crujiente de patatas recubiertas de parmesano.','["700 g de patatas harinosas, en rodajas","25 g de mantequilla","50 g de parmesano rallado","140 g de panceta o tocino rayado, cortado en tiras","2 ramitas de orégano, sin hojas, o 2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","½ cantidad de ternera con vino tinto y zanahorias (ver ''Combina bien'')"]','["Primero haga la carne con vino tinto y zanahorias (ver ''Combina bien con''). Necesitarás la mitad del guiso terminado para esta receta.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nCocer las patatas en ebullición, saladas.\r\nagua durante 10 minutos hasta que esté casi listo.\r\nEscurrir bien y luego mezclar con la mantequilla.\r\ny la mitad del parmesano.","En una cacerola grande sofreír la panceta.\r\no tocino hasta que esté dorado. Agregue el fresco\r\nhojas de orégano u orégano seco, luego\r\nagregue el estofado de ternera y caliente. consejo\r\nen una fuente apta para horno y cubra con la\r\npatatas con queso, superpuestas. espolvorear\r\ncon el parmesano restante y hornear\r\ndurante 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente por encima.\r\nServir con una ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 13:00:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13957,5844,'es','Canelones de espinacas y queso feta','Un plato bajo en grasas y rico en hierro que es una excelente comida de mitad de semana para toda la familia.','["4 láminas grandes de lasaña sin precocción (nosotros utilizamos lasaña de huevo fresco de Sainsbury''s de un paquete de 250 g)","1 kg de espinacas congeladas, descongeladas","Paquete de 200 g de queso feta bajo en grasa","nuez moscada rallada generosa","un puñado grande de aceitunas, deshuesadas y picadas","1 cucharada de alcaparras, enjuagadas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","25 g de parmesano rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Poner las láminas de lasaña en un bol grande y cubrir con agua hirviendo. Remoje durante 5 minutos o prepárelo según las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, exprime la mayor cantidad de agua posible de las espinacas y luego mézclalas con el queso feta, la nuez moscada y un poco de condimento. Escurre la pasta y luego corta cada hoja por la mitad verticalmente. Coloque 4 cucharadas del relleno en el centro de cada mitad y luego enróllelas para cerrarlas. Colóquelo en una fuente para horno ligeramente engrasada.","Mezcle las aceitunas, las alcaparras y los tomates en un bol, sazone y luego vierta sobre los canelones. Espolvorear con parmesano,\r\ncubra con papel aluminio y luego hornee por 20 minutos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13958,7677,'es','frijoles italianos','Esta guarnición saludable le da sabor mediterráneo al pollo o las chuletas a la parrilla.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo machacados","400 g de tomates picados en lata","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","2 latas de 400 g de alubias, enjuagadas y escurridas","manojo pequeño de albahaca, picada"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana.\r\nFreír el ajo durante 1 min, luego añadir el\r\ntomates, azúcar y un poco de condimento.\r\nVierta las judías y un chorrito de agua.\r\nTape y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos, luego revuelva\r\nen la albahaca y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13959,7679,'es','Rollitos de berenjena con espinacas y ricotta','Esta versión de la ''melanzane alla Parmigiana'' italiana se prepara rápidamente y hace un horneado vegetariano deliciosamente cremoso.','["2 berenjenas, cortadas en rodajas finas a lo largo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","500 g de espinacas","250 g de ricota en tarrina","rallado de nuez moscada","Salsa de tomate tarro 350g","4 cucharadas de pan rallado fresco","4 cucharadas de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana)"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cepillar\r\nambos lados de las rodajas de berenjena con\r\naceite, luego colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear grande. hornear\r\ndurante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén tiernos, volteándolos una vez.","Mientras tanto, ponga las espinacas en una cacerola grande.\r\ncolador y verter sobre una tetera hirviendo\r\nagua para que se marchite. Deje enfriar y luego exprima el\r\nexceso de agua, para que quede seco. Mezclar con el\r\nricota, nuez moscada y mucho condimento.","Echa una cucharada de espinacas con queso.\r\nmezclar en el centro de cada berenjena\r\ncortar, doblar para formar un paquete y colocar,\r\nCon el lado sellado hacia abajo, en una fuente apta para horno.\r\nVierta sobre la salsa de tomate, espolvoree con\r\npan rallado y queso, y hornear durante\r\n20-25 minutos hasta que estén dorados y bien calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:00:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13960,7681,'es','Tagliata de cordero con berros y tomates','Tradicionalmente, este plato italiano utiliza carne de res en rodajas finas, rúcula y parmesano, pero esta versión tiene un toque simple con productos británicos de temporada.','["un puñado de romero fresco, agujas picadas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","4 filetes gruesos de pierna de cordero británica deshuesada o filetes cortados de cuartos de cordero (aproximadamente 450 g/1 libra en total)","250 g de tomates pera británicos","1 cucharada de gelatina de grosella","2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","2 cucharadas de alcaparras, escurridas y enjuagadas","Bolsa de 100 g de berros británicos, sin tallos gruesos","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","buen pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Frote el romero y 1 cucharada de\r\naceite sobre el cordero y dejar marinar\r\ndurante 30 minutos a temperatura ambiente.","Calienta una sartén hasta que esté muy caliente. limpiar\r\nla mayor parte del romero del cordero,\r\nluego sazona los filetes con abundante\r\nde sal en escamas y negra recién molida\r\npimienta. Añade los filetes y el\r\ntomates a la sartén. Dorar la carne por\r\n2 minutos por un lado hasta que esté dorado, luego\r\nvoltee y cocine por 2 minutos más. esto será\r\ndar cordero rosado. Transfiera la carne y\r\nColocar los tomates en un plato y dejar reposar.","Retira la sartén del fuego. Cuchara\r\nla gelatina de grosella, verter el vinagre\r\ny el aceite restante, luego bata para hacer\r\nun aderezo cálido. Agrega las alcaparras, más\r\ncualquier jugo del plato de cordero.","Cortar el cordero en rodajas gruesas en ángulo.\r\nExtender en un plato grande con el\r\nberros y tomates, luego terminar\r\ncon un desmoronamiento de queso. Vierta sobre\r\nel aderezo tibio y disfrutar directamente\r\nlejos del pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13961,7685,'es','Zabaglione de mora','El zabaglione italiano queda delicioso con algunas bayas trituradas para un postre rápido y excelente.','["400 g de moras","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","6 yemas de huevo","1 vaina de vainilla","3 cucharadas de marsala o vino dulce"]','["En un bol triturar ligeramente las bayas con\r\n25 g de azúcar. Añade una cucharada a la\r\nfondo de 6 vasos pequeños, luego coloque el\r\nAparte el resto de la mezcla de bayas.","Lleve un poco de agua a fuego lento en\r\nuna cacerola mediana y volcar el huevo\r\nyemas en un tazón grande resistente al calor. Reducir a la mitad\r\ny raspar las semillas de la vainilla\r\nvaina en las yemas de huevo y agrega la\r\nazúcar restante. Usando una batidora eléctrica,\r\nbatir hasta que esté suave y aireado. chapotear en el\r\nMarsala, coloca el bol sobre la cacerola de\r\nagua hirviendo, luego bate tu corazón\r\ndurante 10-12 minutos hasta que las yemas de huevo estén\r\nespeso y espumoso y el batidor deja un\r\nsendero definido. Escurrir un poco del jugo,\r\nluego, ondee las bayas restantes\r\nla mousse y verter en los vasos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13962,7687,'es','Café affogato (helado de vainilla y café)','Esta combinación celestial es tan simple pero impresionante.','["12 bolas de helado de vainilla de buena calidad","6 tragos de café expreso caliente"]','["Con varias horas de antelación, coloque el helado\r\nuna bandeja apta para congelador y coloque la bandeja\r\nnuevamente en el congelador.","Para servir, ponga bolas de helado en\r\n6 vasos o cuencos pequeños y verter un\r\ntrago de café expreso caliente sobre\r\ncada uno. Servir enseguida removiendo\r\nhelado de vainilla en el café caliente\r\npara que se derrita un poco."]','2026-01-11 13:00:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13963,7689,'es','Bizcocho de albaricoque y ratafía','Un sencillo pastel de frutas aromatizado con almendras y galletas Amaretti, perfecto para acompañar té o como postre servido con crema o natillas.','["200 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para la lata","200 g de azúcar en polvo","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","4 huevos grandes","½-1 cucharadita de esencia de almendras (opcional)","Lata de 410 g de mitades de albaricoque en jugo natural, escurridas, 100 g cortadas en trozos grandes y el resto partido por la mitad","85 g de galletas ratafía o amaretti (mantener las ratafías enteras o romper los amaretti)","25 g de almendras laminadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nUnte con mantequilla la base y los lados de un molde de 22 cm.\r\nmolde para pastel de fondo suelto y forre con\r\npergamino para hornear.","Poner la mantequilla, el azúcar, la harina y hornear.\r\npolvo en un tazón grande. irrumpir en el\r\nhuevos, agregar la esencia de almendras, si se usa,\r\nluego batir con batidora eléctrica hasta\r\nsuave y cremoso. Reserva un cuarto\r\nde la mezcla, luego revuelva el picado\r\nalbaricoques y 25 g de galletas en el\r\nresto. Vierta en la lata y ligeramente\r\nalise con el dorso de la cuchara. hornear\r\ndurante 25 minutos hasta que el pastel esté casi listo.\r\nMientras tanto, revuelva las mitades de albaricoque,\r\nresto de galletas y almendras laminadas\r\nen la mezcla de pastel reservada hasta que esté bien\r\nmixto. Salpique rápidamente la mezcla de pastel extra.\r\nsobre el pastel recién horneado, luego regrese a\r\nal horno por 20 min más o hasta que\r\nbrocheta insertada en el centro del\r\nel pastel sale limpio."]','2026-01-11 13:00:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13964,7691,'es','pollo relleno italiano','Las recetas de pollo siempre se encuentran entre las más buscadas en bbcgoodfood.com, por lo que el equipo de cocina creó especialmente este plato rápido y fácil para la cena.','["2 cucharadas de aceitunas picadas o tomates secos - lo que tengas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","½ cucharadita de hierbas secas mixtas","Tarrina de 200 g de queso tierno con toda la grasa","4 pechugas de pollo regordetas, deshuesadas y sin piel","4 tomates maduros, rebanados","aceite de oliva, para rociar"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7.\r\nBatir las aceitunas o los tomates secos,\r\najo y casi todas las hierbas en el\r\nqueso, luego sazonar. Cortar una hendidura a lo largo del\r\nlado de cada pechuga de pollo, luego use\r\nsu cuchillo para abrirlo y guardarlo en un bolsillo.","Rellenar cada pechuga con un cuarto de\r\nla mezcla de queso, luego presione para cerrar. ascensor\r\nen una bandeja para hornear engrasada. Sazone el\r\nencima del pollo, luego superponga el tomate\r\nrodajas sobre la parte superior de cada trozo de\r\npollo. Sazone y luego esparza con el\r\nhierbas restantes. Rocíe con aceite de oliva.","Ase durante 20 minutos hasta que el pollo\r\nestá dorado alrededor de los bordes y el\r\nLos tomates parecen un poco arrugados. servir\r\ncon ensalada verde y pan crujiente\r\npara absorber los jugos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13965,7693,'es','Ensalada rápida de arroz al estilo japonés','Use el arroz sobrante para hacer una ensalada con langostinos, frijoles edamame, rábanos, pepino, aguacate y cebolletas, aderezado con un aderezo de mirin y jengibre.','["250 g de arroz basmati cocido","150 g de langostinos pelados y cocidos","¼ de pepino, cortado en cubitos","2 cebolletas, picadas","50 g de frijoles edamame, descongelados si están congelados","6 rábanos, picados","½ aguacate, cortado en cubitos","semillas de sésamo negro, para servir (opcional)","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo tostado","1 cucharada de mirín","1 cucharada de jengibre encurtido"]','["Batir los ingredientes del aderezo en un tazón pequeño.","Si usa una bolsa, caliente el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego viértalo en un tazón, divídalo y déjelo enfriar hasta que esté tibio. Como alternativa, utilice el arroz sobrante frío. Revuélvalo, luego agregue la mitad del aderezo y revuelva.","Agrega los langostinos y las verduras y revuelve nuevamente. Divida en dos platos y vierta sobre el resto del aderezo. Espolvorea con semillas de sésamo negro para decorar, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13966,7695,'es','Pollo al curry al estilo japonés','Combine una salsa de curry fácil y reconfortante con nuestro tierno y jugoso pollo en salmuera para hacer un pollo al curry al estilo japonés; sírvalo con arroz blanco y pepinillos japoneses.','["1 pollo asado preparado (ver receta a continuación)","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas, en rodajas gruesas","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","25 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado","45 g de mantequilla sin sal","30 g de harina común","1 cucharada de curry en polvo mediano","½ cucharadita de garam masala","850 ml de caldo de verduras","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de miel","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino de arroz","500 g de patatas Maris Piper, cortadas en octavos","3 zanahorias grandes, cortadas en diagonal","arroz blanco cocido de grano corto","cebolletas en rodajas","Encurtidos japoneses (opcional)"]','["Para la salsa, calienta el aceite en una cacerola o sartén grande resistente al fuego a fuego medio y cocina las cebollas durante 10 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente doradas. Agregue el ajo y el jengibre y cocine a fuego lento durante un par de minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Agrega la mantequilla y, una vez que esté chisporroteando, agrega la harina, el curry en polvo y el garam masala. Cocine durante 3-4 minutos hasta que la mezcla se haya oscurecido. Agregue gradualmente el caldo, revolviendo bien después de cada adición.","Llevar a fuego lento y agregar la salsa de soja, la miel y el vinagre. Agregue las papas y las zanahorias, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 15 a 20 minutos hasta que la salsa espese y las verduras estén cocidas. Sazone al gusto, agregando un poco más de caldo si está demasiado espeso. Cortar el pollo en rodajas y servir con el arroz. Vierta sobre la salsa y esparza sobre las cebolletas. Sirva con encurtidos japoneses, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13967,7697,'es','Helado de matcha-mochi','Prepare helado vegano con tofu, crema de coco y matcha, luego envuélvalo en una suave masa de mochi para obtener este delicioso dulce originario de Japón.','["300 g de tofu suave y sedoso orgánico, escurrido","320 g de crema de coco","1 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla","1 cucharadita de arrurruz en polvo (opcional)","60 ml de jarabe de arce","35 g de harina de maíz y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de matcha en polvo","100 g de harina de arroz blanco dulce glutinoso","80 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Para hacer el helado, ponga todos los ingredientes en la licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Enfríe la mezcla durante al menos 1 hora o toda la noche. Retirar del refrigerador, revolver y verter en una máquina para hacer helados y batir durante 45 minutos, o hasta que espese y esté congelado. Alternativamente, vierta en un recipiente congelable y congele durante 90 minutos. Retirar del congelador y batir la mezcla, congelar durante 45 minutos más y luego volver a batir la mezcla. Vuelva a colocarlo en el congelador por otros 30 minutos. Repita esto 2-3 veces más, congelando durante 30 minutos cada vez. Luego, congélelo durante las últimas 2 o 3 horas.","Retire el helado del congelador para que se ablande un poco y luego use una bola de helado de 5 cm para hacer 8 bolas. Colóquelos en una bandeja forrada con papel para hornear y luego congélelos durante al menos 30 minutos o toda la noche. Si son difíciles de sacar, deja el helado unos minutos para que se ablande o usa las manos para darles forma.","Espolvorea una bandeja para horno de 30 x 20 cm con la mitad de la maicena. Vierta 200 ml de agua en una cacerola de 1 litro junto con el polvo de matcha. Mezclar bien, luego agregar la harina de arroz y el azúcar en polvo y poner a fuego medio. Use un batidor para romper los grumos, luego cambie a una espátula cuando comience a espesarse después de 2-3 minutos. Revuelva rápidamente durante otros 30 segundos hasta que comience a unirse como una bola de masa pegajosa.","Transfiera la masa a la bandeja para hornear preparada y aplánela con cuidado con la espátula. Una vez que esté lo suficientemente frío como para tocarlo, espolvoree la harina de maíz restante y use las manos para aplanarla hasta aproximadamente el tamaño de la bandeja. Déjelo enfriar, tápelo y guárdelo en el refrigerador durante 30 minutos. Se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado hasta por tres días.","Extienda la masa de mochi sobre una tabla de cortar seca espolvoreada con un poco más de harina de maíz hasta que tenga un espesor de 5 mm. Recorta círculos de 10 cm con un cortador de galletas o un vaso. Coloque una bola de helado encima de un círculo de masa, luego doble con cuidado la masa alrededor del helado, pellizcando en la parte superior para sellar, luego déle la vuelta para que la parte superior se convierta en la parte inferior. (Esto será más fácil si se espolvorea las manos con harina de maíz). Repita hasta usar todo el helado y la masa, luego congélelo durante al menos 2 horas antes de servir. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por un mes. Saque el mochi del congelador y déjelo a temperatura ambiente durante unos 3-5 minutos para que se ablande antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13968,7699,'es','Arroz de sushi perfecto','Aprende a hacer arroz de sushi perfecto con esta sencilla receta paso a paso. Haga un lote y cree su propio plato de selección de sushi para entretener','["120 ml de vinagre de arroz o vinagre de arroz integral","3 cucharadas de azúcar","450 g de arroz japonés (3 tazas japonesas)"]','["Para hacer el arroz, primero lávalo bien en un colador durante 4 minutos, dándole la vuelta suavemente con la mano hasta que el agua salga clara. Escurrir el arroz y ponerlo en una cacerola con 540ml de agua.","Déjalo reposar un mínimo de 30 minutos. Se puede dejar toda la noche, pero para obtener mejores resultados, déjelo durante 30 minutos a 1 hora. Dejar el agua de remojo en la cacerola con el arroz y llevar a ebullición, tapar, reducir el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 8-9 minutos. Apagar el fuego y dejar reposar con la tapa puesta durante 5 minutos más. No levante la tapa.","Mientras se cuece el arroz, para hacer el sushi-su, poner en una cacerola el vinagre de arroz, el azúcar y 1 cucharada de sal y dejar a fuego lento hasta que el azúcar y la sal se hayan disuelto. Ten cuidado de no dejar que hierva o se estropeará el sabor. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Coloque el arroz en un plato ancho y plano, como un oke para sushi, una fuente para hornear o una bandeja para asar. Vierte el sushi-su sobre el arroz e incorpóralo con cuidado con una cuchara de madera mientras se enfría, teniendo cuidado de no dañar los granos. Puedes usar un ventilador o un secador de pelo en la posición más fría para acelerar el proceso de enfriamiento, dirigiéndolo hacia el arroz. El sushi-su le da al arroz más sabor y ese familiar aspecto glaseado pegajoso.","Si no quieres utilizar el arroz inmediatamente, cúbrelo con un paño húmedo para que no se seque. Dejar en un lugar fresco, pero no refrigerar. El refrigerador endurecerá y secará el arroz, y el sushi-su ayuda a conservar el arroz sin refrigeración. Se conservará por un día."]','2026-01-11 13:00:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13969,7701,'es','Arroz para sushi','Prepara arroz para sushi para acompañar tus platos favoritos de inspiración japonesa, desde cajas bento hasta sushi y curry katsu. El secreto está en la proporción de arroz y agua.','["1 taza de arroz para sushi (unos 220 g)","condimento para arroz de sushi, al gusto (opcional)"]','["Lo más importante que hay que hacer bien al cocinar arroz para sushi es la proporción de arroz y agua. Es mejor utilizar una medida de volumen en lugar de pesar. Utilice una taza medidora de cocinero de 250 ml si tiene una, o un vaso corto, una taza de té o una taza pequeña. Una vez que haya preparado un lote, sabrá cuánto arroz cocido rinde con esa medida; debe ser aproximadamente 2½ tazas.","Mida 1 taza de arroz en una cacerola, enjuague el arroz, gírelo alrededor de la cacerola y luego escurra el agua. Intenta no perder nada del arroz. Agregue 1½ tazas de agua (aproximadamente 375 ml).","Lleve el arroz a fuego lento rápidamente, tape con una tapa hermética y reduzca el fuego a bajo. Cocine durante 13 minutos, no retire la tapa.","Verifique un par de granos en la parte superior; el arroz debe estar casi cocido y el agua evaporada. De lo contrario, continúe cocinando y verifique a intervalos de 2 minutos, cada marca de arroz será diferente. Apagar el fuego y dejar reposar el arroz con la tapa puesta durante 10 minutos para que se absorba toda la humedad. Agregue el condimento para el arroz de sushi, si lo desea, y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:00:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13970,7703,'es','Curry katsu vegano','Disfrute de una versión vegana del curry katsu, con tofu dorado y crujiente. Sirva con arroz, hierbas frescas y tiras de pepino y zanahoria.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza o aceite vegetal","200 g de arroz cocido (nosotros usamos basmati)","¼ de pepino grande, pelado en tiras","1 zanahoria, pelada en tiras","un puñado de hojas de menta o de cilantro, o ambas","gajos de lima, para servir","1 cucharada de aceite de colza o aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, picada","1 zanahoria grande, picada","1 diente de ajo grande, triturado","2 cm de jengibre pelado y rallado o finamente picado","½ cucharada de curry en polvo, suave o medio","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","200ml de leche de coco","2 cucharaditas de jarabe de arce (o miel si no se cocina para veganos)","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","280-300 g de tofu firme en bloque","200g de pan rallado seco, nosotros utilizamos panko (sin gluten si es necesario)"]','["Primero, haz la salsa de curry. Calienta el aceite en una sartén y cocina la cebolla y la zanahoria hasta que estén suaves y empiecen a caramelizar, unos 8 minutos. Agregue el ajo y el jengibre y cocine a fuego lento durante aproximadamente un minuto más, luego agregue el curry en polvo y la cúrcuma. Una vez que las especias estén bien calientes, añade la leche de coco, el jarabe de arce y 100 ml de agua. Sazona bien, tapa y cocina a fuego lento durante 20 minutos, añadiendo más agua si queda demasiado espesa.","Mientras tanto, corte el tofu por la mitad por el centro. Corta con cuidado cada pieza en cuatro triángulos. En un tazón amplio, mezcle la harina de maíz con 3 cucharadas de agua y un poco de condimento hasta que se combinen. Pon el pan rallado en un segundo bol. Sumerja un trozo de tofu en la mezcla de harina, luego en el pan rallado, volteándolo hasta que esté bien cubierto. Si las migas no se pegan bien, espese un poco la mezcla de harina de maíz y vuelva a intentarlo. Presione firmemente.","Cuando la zanahoria en la salsa de curry esté suave, mezcle con una batidora o una batidora de mesa. Si la salsa queda demasiado espesa, añade un poco más de agua. Pruebe y agregue más sal, jarabe de arce o un poco de jugo de lima, si lo desea. Manténgase caliente.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén y cocina el tofu durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté dorado y bien caliente. Para servir, coloque el arroz en tazones y cubra con la salsa de curry, el tofu crujiente, las tiras de pepino y zanahoria, las hierbas y las rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13971,5700,'es','Ensalada de arroz con pollo y wasabi','Utilice las sobras de pollo para preparar este sencillo plato de arroz para el almuerzo. Con un potente aderezo de wasabi, lima y yogur, está lleno de sabor y además es saludable.','["70 g de edamame congelado","½ cucharadita de pasta de wasabi","2 cucharadas de yogur natural sin grasa","1 lima, exprimida","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","70 g de arroz cocido","3 rábanos, en cuartos","1 cucharadita de semillas de sésamo","1 pechuga de pollo cocida, deshuesada y sin piel, en rodajas","¼ de hoja de algas secas cortadas en tiras"]','["Pon el edamame en un recipiente resistente al calor y cúbrelo con agua hirviendo. Dejar actuar 10 minutos y luego escurrir. Mezclar la pasta de wasabi con el yogur, el zumo de lima y el aceite de sésamo.","Mezcle el arroz con el edamame y los rábanos. Cubra con las semillas de sésamo, el pollo y las algas, luego rocíe con el aderezo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13972,4173,'es','Sopa de fideos con miso, champiñones y tofu','Prepare esta sopa de fideos con miso, champiñones y tofu con solo seis ingredientes simples. Saludable y bajo en calorías, es un delicioso almuerzo o cena ligero.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","70 g de champiñones variados, en rodajas","50 g de tofu ahumado, cortado en cubos pequeños","½ cucharada de pasta de miso de arroz integral","50 g de fideos secos de trigo sarraceno o huevo","2 cebolletas, ralladas"]','["Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén a fuego medio. Agrega los champiñones y fríelos durante 5-6 minutos o hasta que estén dorados. Transfiera a un tazón con una espumadera y reserve. Agrega el aceite restante a la sartén y fríe el tofu durante 3-4 minutos, o hasta que esté uniformemente dorado.","Mezclar la pasta de miso con 325 ml de agua hirviendo en una jarra. Cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escurra y transfiera a un tazón. Cubra con los champiñones y el tofu, luego vierta sobre el caldo de miso. Esparza las cebolletas justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13973,7705,'es','Huevos rellenos furikake','Pruebe el furikake, un condimento japonés, en este sencillo canapé retro con un toque de wasabi y jengibre encurtido. El condimento se espolvorea tradicionalmente sobre el arroz.','["6 huevos grandes","2 cebolletas, recortadas","2 cucharadas de mayonesa kewpie (disponible en Sainsbury''s, Waitrose y en línea) o crema para ensalada","2 cucharaditas de pasta de wasabi","½ cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharada de jengibre para sushi encurtido, finamente picado, más 1 cucharadita de vinagre del frasco","3 cucharadas de furikake (disponible en línea), más una pizca"]','["Lleve una cacerola grande con agua a fuego lento y luego introduzca suavemente los huevos. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a un recipiente con agua helada para que se enfríe. Mientras tanto, corte finamente las cebolletas en tiras largas y finas y agréguelas al agua helada con los huevos. Formarán espirales y se acurrucarán con el frío.","Pelar los huevos y cortarlos por la mitad a lo largo. Con una cucharadita, coloque las yemas de huevo en un bol y agregue la mayonesa, el wasabi, el aceite de sésamo, el vinagre de jengibre y un poco de sal y pimienta, y triture con un tenedor hasta que quede suave. Para obtener una textura más suave, mezcle con una batidora de mano hasta obtener una mezcla que se pueda pipetear.","Coloque el furikake en un plato pequeño y sumerja las mitades de huevo, con el lado redondeado hacia abajo, en el condimento para que algunas se peguen a la clara del huevo. Coloque o vierta la mezcla de yema de huevo en el medio y luego cubra con el jengibre encurtido. Seque la cebolleta con papel de cocina y luego úsela para decorar los huevos junto con una pizca más de furikake."]','2026-01-11 13:00:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13974,7707,'es','sopa de miso','Haga su propia sopa de miso con suaves cubos de tofu, crujientes rizos de algas y aromáticas cebolletas. Disfrútalo como entrante o como snack.','["5 g de alga wakame seca","1 litro de dashi (comprado en tienda o ver sugerencia)","200 g de tofu sedoso fresco, o firme si lo prefieres, cortado en cubos de 1 cm","2 cucharadas de pasta de miso blanca","3 cucharadas de pasta de miso roja","cebolla tierna, finamente picada, para servir"]','["Pon el wakame en un bol pequeño y cúbrelo con agua fría, luego déjalo durante 5 minutos hasta que las hojas se hayan expandido por completo.","Prepare el dashi (vea el consejo a continuación) o caliéntelo hasta que hierva. Agrega el tofu y cocina por 1 min antes de agregar las algas.","Reducir el fuego. Pon ambos tipos de miso en un cucharón o colador y sumérgelos en la olla. Afloje lentamente el miso con una cuchara dentro del cucharón o colador; la pasta se derretirá lentamente en el dashi. Una vez que todo el miso se disuelva en la sopa, apaga el fuego inmediatamente. Espolvoree con cebolletas picadas para agregar color y fragancia."]','2026-01-11 13:00:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13975,7709,'es','Pollo al curry katsu de siguiente nivel','Prepare este plato de inspiración japonesa con pollo crujiente y una salsa rica y especiada. Nuestra versión definitiva es fácil de hacer pero tiene mucho sabor.','["2 pechugas de pollo grandes","400ml de leche","100 g de harina común","2 huevos batidos","150 g de pan rallado panko o pan rallado seco grueso","espolvoreando shichimi togarashi o chili power, y más para servir","splash of soy sauce","aceite de girasol, para freír","50 g de mantequilla","1 zanahoria grande, picada","1 cebolla, picada","4 dientes de ajo, picados","trozo grande de jengibre, picado","2 cucharadas de curry suave en polvo","1 cucharada de miel","1 cucharada de salsa de tomate","1 cucharada de pasta de miso roja o marrón","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","repollo blanco rallado, nori rallado, semillas de sésamo y arroz cocido, para servir"]','["Corta cada pechuga de pollo por la mitad a lo largo, creando cuatro filetes. Coloque cada filete entre dos hojas de papel para hornear y bata con un rodillo para igualar el grosor.","Vierta la leche en un bol y sazone con una pizca grande de sal, luego agregue los filetes de pollo. Tapar y dejar en el frigorífico al menos 20 minutos o hasta 24 horas (cuanto más tiempo dejes el pollo en la leche, más suculento quedará).","Cuando esté listo para cubrir el pollo, vierta la harina, los huevos y el pan rallado en tres tazones separados, luego sazone la harina con el togarashi y agregue la salsa de soja a los huevos. Saque un filete de pollo de la leche y cúbralo con la mezcla de harina, luego sumérjalo en la mezcla de huevo y cúbralo con pan rallado. Colocar en un plato y repetir con el resto de los filetes de pollo. Se puede preparar con hasta un día de anticipación y congelar hasta por un mes.","Para hacer la salsa de curry, calienta la mantequilla en una cacerola y chisporrotea la zanahoria y la cebolla durante 5 minutos, luego añade el ajo y el jengibre y cocina unos minutos más. Esparza el curry en polvo y cocine durante 1 minuto, luego agregue la miel, el ketchup, la pasta de miso y la salsa de soja para crear una pasta pegajosa. Cocine durante 1 minuto más, luego vierta 700 ml de agua hirviendo y desmenuce en la pastilla de caldo. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que la zanahoria esté suave. Vierta la salsa en una licuadora y mezcle hasta que esté completamente suave (como alternativa, use una batidora de mano). Sazone al gusto. Se puede preparar con hasta tres días de anticipación y enfriar o congelar hasta por tres meses.","Para cocinar el katsu, caliente una buena capa de aceite en una sartén grande, luego agregue tantos filetes de pollo como pueda y fríalos durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Transfiera a una bandeja y manténgalo caliente en el horno bajo mientras cocina los filetes restantes.","Mezcle el repollo y las algas y espolvoree algunas semillas de sésamo, si las usa. Cubra el katsu con la salsa de curry y sirva con arroz y ensalada, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13976,7711,'es','Cerdo katsu con arroz pegajoso','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Desmenuce el filete de cerdo con panko, al estilo japonés, luego sírvalo con una salsa de curry ligera, dulce y picante y arroz para sushi.','["200 g de arroz de grano corto o para sushi, enjuagado","100 g de pan rallado panko","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 clara de huevo","450 g de filete de cerdo, desmenuzado y cortado en 8 trozos","ramitas de cilantro, para decorar (opcional)","jengibre encurtido, para servir (opcional)","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, picada","1 zanahoria mediana, rallada","2 manzana para comer, como Braeburn, pelada, sin corazón y picada en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo gordos, rebanados","2 cucharaditas de curry en polvo mediano","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharaditas de miel clara","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","350 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo"]','["Para hacer la salsa, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y agrega la cebolla, la zanahoria y las manzanas. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden, revolviendo un par de veces. Destapa la sartén, sube el fuego, agrega el ajo y cocina por 1 min.","Agrega el curry en polvo y el jengibre. Cocine por 1 minuto más, luego agregue el puré de tomate, la miel, la soja y la harina de maíz. Agregue gradualmente el caldo y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que las verduras estén totalmente suaves y la salsa se espese. Bate con una batidora o en una licuadora hasta que quede suave y luego sazona al gusto con aceite de sésamo, sal y pimienta. La salsa se puede preparar con hasta 3 días de anticipación.","Mientras se cocina la salsa, coloque la carne de cerdo entre 2 hojas de film transparente y golpee con un rodillo hasta que la carne tenga aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor. En un recipiente poco profundo, mezcle las migajas, la cúrcuma y el aceite con un poco de condimento. Batir la clara con un tenedor hasta que esté un poco espumosa y tener preparada una bandeja de horno antiadherente.","Poner el arroz en un cazo con 400ml de agua fría y una pizca de sal. Llevar a ebullición, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Retirar del fuego y reservar hasta el momento de servir el cerdo.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Sumergir cada trozo de carne de cerdo en el huevo, luego en las migas, presionándolos sobre la superficie antes de transferir la carne a la bandeja. Hornee la carne de cerdo durante 10 a 15 minutos o hasta que esté dorada y crujiente, volteándola una vez si es necesario. Sirva con arroz y salsa katsu, adornado con cilantro, si lo usa, y jengibre encurtido, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13977,7713,'es','Arroz integral al estilo japonés','Una guarnición sencilla y saludable de arroz integral servida con jengibre, ajo, cebolletas, salsa de soja y habas de soja.','["250 g de arroz integral","175 g de habas de soja congeladas","1 cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharaditas de jengibre finamente rallado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas en diagonal"]','["Cocine el arroz integral del siguiente paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, añadiendo las semillas de soja durante\r\nlos últimos 2 minutos de cocción. Mientras tanto,\r\nmezclar la salsa de soja, el aceite de oliva,\r\njengibre y ajo.","Escurrir el arroz y los frijoles cocidos.\r\ntransfiéralo a un tazón para servir y revuelva\r\nen la mezcla de salsa de soja. dispersión\r\ncon las cebolletas y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13978,7715,'es','Caja bento de estilo japonés','Esta lonchera de inspiración asiática con sushi de caballa, frijoles edamame y fruta fresca te mantendrá activo toda la tarde.','["100 g de edamame fresco en vaina (o habas de soja congeladas)","un puñado de una fruta favorita, como piña fresca, arándanos o fresas","100 gramos de arroz para sushi","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 hoja de nori","1 filete de caballa ahumada, de unos 75 g, desmenuzado","1 cucharada de mayonesa ligera","2 cebolletas, picadas","wasabi en forma de gota del tamaño de un guisante (opcional)","¼ de pimiento rojo, cortado en rodajas finas a lo largo, aproximadamente 6 rodajas"]','["Poner a hervir una cacerola con agua y cocinar el\r\nedamame durante 3-4 minutos (o 1-2 minutos si se usa congelado\r\nhabas de soja) hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrir, espolvorear con sal.\r\ny dejar a un lado.","Enjuague bien el arroz en agua fría hasta que el agua\r\ncorre claro. Poner el arroz en una cacerola de base pesada con\r\ntapar bien y cubrir con 200 ml de agua.\r\nLlevar a ebullición, luego tapar, girar el\r\ncalentar hasta su punto más bajo y cocinar durante 15-20 minutos,\r\nhasta que se absorba el líquido. Quitar del\r\nCalentar y dejar tapado otros 10 min.","Vierta el arroz cocido en un tazón ancho y\r\ndejar enfriar un poco. Mezcle el vinagre de arroz,\r\nazúcar y una pizca pequeña de sal, hasta que el azúcar\r\ny la sal se disuelve. Mézclalo con el arroz enfriado.\r\nColoque la hoja de nori sobre una lámina o tapete para enrollar sushi.\r\nde film transparente. Con las manos húmedas esparcir el arroz.\r\nmás de dos tercios de la hoja de nori.","Mezclar la caballa ahumada, la mayonesa y\r\ncebolletas, sazone bien con pimienta negra.\r\nExtienda una línea de wasabi en el medio del\r\narroz, si lo usa, y coloque capas sobre los trozos de pimiento rojo,\r\nluego la mezcla de pescado. Enrolle el sushi, comenzando\r\ndesde el final cubierto con arroz. Humedezca el\r\nextremo descubierto para ayudar a que se pegue. Cortar en aproximadamente\r\nPiezas de 6 x 3cm de espesor.","Coloque los rollos de sushi en una caja bento o\r\nlonchera, agregando el edamame y la fruta\r\na los demás compartimentos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13979,7717,'es','Tempura de verduras con soja y salsa para mojar','Estas delicias crujientes de estilo japonés son excelentes para picar o como plato principal vegetariano.','["100 g (aprox) de cada una de una mezcla de verduras firmes, cortadas en trozos pequeños, como berenjena, brócoli, calabacín, champiñones, pimiento rojo y batatas.","masa de tempura (ver más abajo)","aceite de maní o girasol, para freír","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja","3 cucharadas de jerez seco","1 cucharada de azúcar","1 limón, solo la ralladura"]','["Caliente el horno a 150C/ventilador 130C/gas 2. Mezcle los ingredientes de la salsa en un tazón pequeño. Haz la masa (ver a la derecha). Cubre una bandeja para horno con hojas de papel de cocina. Empieza a calentar una sartén profunda o un wok grande con un tercio de su capacidad de aceite y ten a mano el cestillo para freír o una espumadera.","Cuando el aceite alcance los 190 °C, sumerja brevemente algunas de las verduras preparadas en la masa, sacuda el exceso y luego bájelas directamente al aceite caliente. No llenes la cesta para freír. Freír durante unos 2 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente dorados y crujientes, luego escurrir sobre papel de cocina.","Repita con las verduras restantes en tandas, sumergiéndolas en la masa justo antes de freírlas y recuerde dejar que el aceite vuelva a calentarse a temperatura entre cada tanda. Mantén la tempura caliente en el horno, dejando la puerta entreabierta para que quede crujiente. Es mejor servirlos inmediatamente en un plato caliente con la salsa al lado para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:00:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13980,4597,'es','Ensalada de pollo y arroz integral con miso','Baja en grasas y una gran fuente de hierro, esta comida de inspiración japonesa recibe la etiqueta de "súper saludable"','["120 g de arroz basmati integral","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel","140 g de brócoli germinado","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas diagonales","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo tostadas","2 cucharaditas de pasta de miso","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","1 cucharada de mirín","1 cucharadita de jengibre rallado"]','["Cocine el arroz siguiendo el paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, luego escurrir y mantener caliente.\r\nMientras se cocina coloca el pollo\r\npechugas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo para\r\nestán completamente cubiertos. hervir durante\r\n1 min, luego apagar el fuego, colocar\r\ntapar y dejar reposar durante 15 minutos. cuando\r\nbien cocido, cortado en rodajas.","Hervir el brócoli hasta que esté tierno. drenaje,\r\nenjuagar con agua fría y escurrir nuevamente.","Para el aderezo, mezcla el miso, el arroz\r\nvinagre, mirin y jengibre juntos.","Dividir el arroz en dos platos.\r\ny esparcir sobre las cebolletas y\r\nsemillas de sésamo. Coloque el brócoli y\r\nrodajas de pollo encima. Para terminar, rociar\r\nsobre el aderezo."]','2026-01-11 13:00:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13981,4827,'es','Ensalada de fideos soba y edamame con tofu asado','Esta cena súper saludable y baja en grasas te hará sentir virtuoso toda la semana. Si no puede conseguir frijoles edamame, use habas en su lugar.','["140 g de fideos soba","300 g de frijoles edamame (soja) frescos o congelados","4 cebolletas, ralladas","Bolsa de 300 g de brotes de soja.","1 pepino, pelado, cortado por la mitad a lo largo, sin semillas con una cucharadita y cortado en rodajas","250 g de tofu firme en bloque, seco y en rodajas gruesas","1 cucharadita de aceite","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, para servir","3 cucharadas de mirín","2 cucharaditas de tamari","2 cucharadas de jugo de naranja","1 chile rojo, sin semillas, si quieres, y finamente picado"]','["Caliente los ingredientes del aderezo en su\r\ncacerola más pequeña, cocine a fuego lento durante 30 segundos,\r\nluego dejar a un lado.","Hervir los fideos siguiendo el paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, agregando los frijoles edamame\r\ndurante los últimos 2 minutos de cocción. Enjuague\r\nbajo agua muy fría, escurrir bien\r\ny verter en un tazón grande con el resorte\r\ncebollas, brotes de soja, pepino, sésamo\r\naceite y aderezo tibio. Sazone si lo desea.","Unte el tofu con aceite vegetal, sazone y\r\nplancha o parrilla durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado –\r\nEl tofu es muy delicado así que dale la vuelta con cuidado.\r\nCubra la ensalada con el tofu, esparza con\r\ncilantro y servir"]','2026-01-11 13:00:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13982,6804,'es','Rollitos de sushi de salmón y pepino','Sigue nuestra sencilla guía paso a paso para preparar tu propio sushi japonés, saludable y bajo en grasas.','["2 hojas de nori","100 g de filetes de salmón sin piel (use muy fresco), cortados en rodajas finas a lo largo","¼ de pepino, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas a lo largo","exprimir wasabi y más para servir","jengibre para sushi encurtido, para servir","salsa de soja ligera, para servir","huevas de salmón, para servir (opcional)","100 gramos de arroz para sushi","2 cucharaditas de sake o mirin (opcional)","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo (omítala si usa mirin)","25 ml de vinagre de arroz"]','["Primero, haz el arroz. Enjuague el sushi\r\narroz en un colador, masajeándolo con la\r\nmanos hasta que el agua salga clara. salir\r\nescurrir durante 15 min.","Poner el arroz en un cazo con 200ml.\r\nagua y sake o mirin, si se usa.\r\nLlevar a ebullición, luego cubrir con una tapa.\r\nreduzca el fuego a bajo y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 20 minutos hasta que se absorba el líquido.\r\nRetirar del fuego. Deja a un lado,\r\ntapado, durante 15-20 minutos.","Transfiera a un tazón grande. disolver el\r\nazúcar, si se usa, en el vinagre con una buena\r\nUna pizca de sal, verter sobre el arroz y mezclar.\r\nCubrir con un paño de cocina húmedo y reservar.\r\na temperatura ambiente hasta que esté listo para usar.","Coloque 1 hoja de nori sobre una estera de bambú y\r\nCubrir la superficie con la mitad del líquido enfriado.\r\narroz. Coloca la mitad del salmón y el pepino.\r\nrodajas a lo largo del arroz en forma de\r\ntira, teniendo cuidado de no llenarla demasiado. correr\r\nuna gota de wasabi del tamaño de un guisante (más si\r\ncomo si estuviera muy caliente) a lo largo del borde del relleno con el dedo.","Enrollar bien y apretar para sellar.\r\ncuando llegues al final. Repetir con el\r\nresto de nori, salmón y pepino,\r\ny más wasabi. Corta cada rollo en\r\n6 piezas y servir con wasabi extra,\r\njengibre, salsa de soja y huevas de salmón, si\r\nMe gusta. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante 1 día."]','2026-01-11 13:00:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13983,7719,'es','Salmón marinado en miso','¿Alguna vez te has preguntado qué hacer con la pasta de miso japonesa? Esta variación de un plato clásico de pescado Nobu es un excelente lugar para comenzar.','["3 cucharadas de pasta de miso pálida (shiro)","2 cucharadas de mirín","1 cucharada de azúcar","1 cucharada de sake (opcional)","2 filetes de salmón de 100 g","medio pepino","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","pizca de azúcar en polvo"]','["Mezcle el miso, el mirin, el azúcar y\r\nbien, si se usa. Coloque los filetes de salmón en una\r\nplato o en una bolsa de comida mediana y tapar\r\ncon la marinada de miso. dejar en la nevera\r\ndurante al menos 30 minutos o, mejor aún, toda la noche.","Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Ligeramente\r\nengrase una bandeja para hornear. Utilice papel de cocina para limpiar\r\nde la marinada (no caiga en la tentación de lavarla\r\nquítelo porque perderá algo del sabor).\r\nColoque los filetes en la bandeja para hornear, por el lado de la piel.\r\nabajo. Cocine en el horno durante 15 minutos hasta que\r\nEl pescado se desmenuza fácilmente y se cocina bien.","Mientras tanto, prepara la ensalada de pepino.\r\nCon un pelador de verduras, afeite las\r\npepino en tiras largas y delgadas. batir\r\nJunto el vinagre de vino de arroz, el aceite y el azúcar.\r\nMezcle las tiras de pepino con el aderezo.\r\nluego enróllelos en dos platos. servir\r\ncon salmón y algo de blanco liso\r\narroz espolvoreado con semillas de sésamo tostadas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13984,7723,'es','Teriyaki de salmón a la plancha con ensalada de pepino','Los filetes de salmón se cocinan directamente congelados para mayor comodidad: el glaseado pegajoso ayuda a mantener el pescado húmedo mientras se cocina.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","5 cucharadas de salsa de soja","5 cucharadas de mirin o jerez seco","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 pieza de raíz de jengibre fresco, pelado y finamente rallado","2 dientes de ajo machacados hasta formar una pasta","4 filetes de salmón congelados, deshuesados ​​y sin piel","1 pepino pequeño","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo tostadas"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto y cepilla una superficie resistente.\r\nbandeja para hornear con aceite. En un tazón grande, mezcle\r\nla soja, el mirin, el azúcar, el jengibre y el ajo\r\njuntos hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto,\r\nluego mezcle el salmón congelado con la soja\r\nmezcle hasta que esté cubierto. Dar propina al resto\r\nmarinar en una cacerola pequeña y\r\nllevar a fuego lento.","Coloque la bandeja a unas 4 pulgadas de distancia del\r\nCaliente, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 20 minutos. Cepilla el pescado\r\ncada pocos minutos con la cocción a fuego lento\r\nmarinar hasta que esté bien cocido y\r\nvidriado. Si los filetes están gruesos, puedes\r\nEs necesario ponerlos de lado para que\r\ncocine uniformemente. Retirar de la parrilla.\r\nCocine a fuego lento la marinada hasta que esté pegajosa, luego\r\nviértalo sobre el salmón cocido.","Para la ensalada de pepino, utiliza un giratorio.\r\npelador de cuchillas para pelar el pepino\r\nrebanadas. Hacer el aderezo mezclando la\r\nvinagre con la salsa de soja, el azúcar y\r\nsemillas de sésamo. Mezcle el pepino con\r\nel aderezo y servir con el salmón\r\ny arroz hervido."]','2026-01-11 13:00:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13985,7725,'es','Verduras japonesas picantes con arroz pegajoso de sésamo','Sirva brócoli de tallo largo y pak choi asiático con arroz para sushi con sésamo y aderezo de miso y jengibre.','["1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","140 gramos de arroz para sushi","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo, tostadas","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","250 g de brócoli de tallo largo, como Tenderstem o brotes morados","Paquete de 90 g de baby pak choi, cada uno partido por la mitad a lo largo","6 cebolletas, cortadas por la mitad a lo largo","2 cucharadas de pasta de miso marrón","1 cucharada de mirín","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","2 cucharaditas de jengibre finamente rallado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos"]','["Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la salsa.\r\ncon 1 cucharada de agua. Dejar de lado.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua.\r\ncon el azúcar en polvo y ½ cucharadita de sal. Añadir\r\nel arroz y hervir durante 15 minutos (o siguiendo\r\ninstrucciones del paquete) hasta que esté cocido. Drenar\r\nbien y volver a la sartén. espolvorear\r\nlas semillas de sésamo y el aceite de sésamo, luego\r\ntapar y reservar para mantener el calor.","Calentar el aceite de girasol en un wok hasta\r\nmuy caliente, luego agregue el brócoli y\r\nsaltee durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté casi tierno,\r\nagregando salpicaduras de agua de vez en cuando\r\npara crear vapor. Añade el pak choi y\r\ncebolletas y sofreír durante 30 segundos,\r\nluego agregue la salsa y cocine por un\r\n1-2 minutos más, revolviendo constantemente.","Extienda el arroz en 2 platos, divida\r\nsobre el sofrito y servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13986,7727,'es','Gambas con aguacate y aliño de wasabi','Wasabi, la pasta que añade un toque picante al sushi, anima esta cremosa combinación de aguacate y gambas.','["2 cucharaditas de pasta de wasabi","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de jugo de lima, más 6 gajos, para servir","1 cucharadita de miel clara","2 aguacates grandes, maduros pero firmes","Paquete de 250 g de gambas grandes peladas refrigeradas","2 cabezas de achicoria, roja si es posible, separadas en hojas","unas ramitas de berros","galletas de gambas, para servir"]','["En un tazón grande, mezcle los ingredientes del aderezo hasta que se mezclen. Sazone con sal y luego reserve.","Para servir, corte por la mitad y deshuese los aguacates. Corte la pulpa en dados mientras todavía está con la piel y luego colóquela en un tazón. Agrega los langostinos y agrega el aderezo. Forre seis tazones o vasos pequeños para servir con dos o tres hojas de achicoria. Apila la mezcla de aguacate y langostinos. Cubra con berros y rodajas de lima. Servir con galletas de gambas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13987,7729,'es','Ensalada japonesa con aderezo de soja y jengibre','Sirva esta ensalada junto con atún o bistec a la parrilla o disfrútela como un almuerzo súper saludable.','["4 lechugas tiernas, cortadas por la mitad a lo largo","200 g de frijoles edamame (soja) sin cáscara congelados, descongelados","4 zanahorias, cortadas en palitos largos","140 g de rábanos, en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino de arroz","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja reducida en sal","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","½ cebolla pequeña, picada","2 cucharaditas de jengibre picado","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal"]','["Coloque todos los ingredientes del aderezo en un\r\nlicuadora o procesador de alimentos y agregue 1 cucharada\r\nagua. Licue hasta que quede suave. Organizar el\r\nlechuga cortada por la mitad, edamame, zanahoria y\r\nrábanos en 4 platos o 1 plato grande.\r\nCuando esté listo para servir, rocíe el\r\nvestirse."]','2026-01-11 13:00:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13988,7731,'es','Atún con soja y puré de wasabi','Disfruta de este platillo de inspiración japonesa con alguien especial','["3 cucharadas de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","2 filetes de atún, cada uno de unos 140 g/5 oz","500 g de patatas","100ml de leche semidesnatada","2 cucharaditas de pasta de wasabi (ver Saber hacer)","1 cebolla tierna, cortada finamente","habas o soja congeladas, para servir"]','["Mezclar la salsa de soja, el vinagre y\r\nazúcar. Vierta sobre el atún y deje marinar durante\r\nal menos 20 minutos o hasta 2 horas en el frigorífico.\r\nColocar las patatas en una cacerola con un poco de sal.\r\nagua hirviendo, luego cocine durante 10-15 minutos hasta que\r\nsuave. Escurrir bien. Calentar la leche en la cacerola y\r\nincorporar el wasabi, devolver las patatas a la\r\nsartén, luego triture hasta que quede suave. Revuelva\r\nla cebolleta y mantener caliente.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente hasta que humee.\r\ncaliente. Retire el atún de la marinada.\r\nCocine en la plancha durante 2-3 minutos cada uno.\r\nlado hasta que se queme por fuera, pero aún\r\nrosa por dentro. Cocer las habas o las habas de soja.\r\nsegún las instrucciones del paquete, luego sirva\r\njunto con el atún y el puré."]','2026-01-11 13:00:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13989,4743,'es','Fideos soba con pollo','Rápido y fácil de preparar, ya sea que los estés empacando para ir al trabajo o comiendo algo en casa.','["Paquete de 85 g de fideos soba o de trigo sarraceno","chorrito de aceite de sésamo","8 tirabeques","1 zanahoria pequeña","½ chile rojo","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo tostadas","un puñado de pollo cocido desmenuzado","soy sauce"]','["Cocine los fideos, escúrralos bien y luego\r\nmezcle con un chorrito de aceite de sésamo.","finamente\r\ncortar los tirabeques en rodajas, cortar la zanahoria\r\nen palitos, quitarles las semillas y cortar en rodajas\r\nel chile rojo.","Añadir a los fideos con\r\nlas semillas de sésamo tostadas y un poco\r\npollo cocido desmenuzado, si tiene\r\neso. Empaque con una pequeña porción de salsa de soja."]','2026-01-11 13:00:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13990,6567,'es','Langostinos teriyaki y fideos con brócoli','Esta cena japonesa de mariscos baja en grasa utiliza fideos soba más saludables hechos con trigo sarraceno.','["50 ml de salsa de soja baja en sodio","50 ml muertos","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","1½ cucharada de azúcar en polvo","200 g de fideos soba","140 g de brócoli de tallo fino","140 g de gambas cocidas","1 chile rojo pequeño, en rodajas finas"]','["En una cacerola pequeña calentar la soja.\r\nsalsa, mirin, jugo de limón y azúcar.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que esté almibarado, luego\r\nretirar del fuego. Trae un grande\r\ncazo de agua con sal a ebullición,\r\nluego cocina los fideos y el brócoli\r\ndurante unos 3 minutos, añadiendo las gambas\r\nunos segundos antes de escurrir. dividir el\r\nmezcla entre 2 platos, verter la\r\nsalsa teriyaki tibia por encima,\r\nespolvorea con el chile rojo y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:00:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13991,4884,'es','filete de miso','El bistec no tiene por qué ser una comida pesada: dale un adobo al estilo japonés para una cena baja en grasas.','["2 cucharadas de pasta de miso marrón","1 cucharada de jerez seco o sake","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","2 dientes de ajo machacados","300 g/11 oz de filete magro","espinacas tiernas, pepino en rodajas, apio, rábano y semillas de sésamo tostadas, para servir"]','["Poner la pasta de miso, Jerez o sake,\r\nazúcar y ajo en una bolsa de comida con cierre hermético.\r\nSazone con una generosa molienda de negro.\r\npimienta, luego aplástalo todo junto hasta\r\ncompletamente mezclado. Añade el bistec, suavemente\r\nmasajear la marinada en el bistec\r\nhasta que esté completamente cubierto, luego selle el\r\nbolsa. Introduce la bolsa en el frigorífico y déjala\r\ndurante al menos 1 hora, pero hasta 2 días está bien.","Para cocinar, calentar una sartén de base pesada,\r\nsartén o barbacoa hasta que esté muy caliente.\r\nLimpia el exceso de marinada del bistec,\r\nluego dore durante 3 minutos por cada lado para\r\nmedio cocido o unos minutos más si\r\nPrefiero la carne más cocida. dejar de lado\r\ndurante 1 min para reposar. Cortar la carne en\r\nrebanadas gruesas y servir con un crujiente\r\nensalada hecha con espinacas, pepino,\r\napio, rábano y semillas de sésamo."]','2026-01-11 13:00:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13992,7733,'es','Fideos de trucha ahumada y pepino con sésamo','La trucha, que rápidamente se está volviendo tan popular como el salmón, ha sido una joya olvidada durante mucho tiempo. Aprovecha al máximo en esta fresca ensalada','["1,2 l de caldo de verduras","nuez de jengibre de raíz fresca, pelada y rallada","100 g de fideos soba","1 cucharada de salsa de soja reducida en sal, más algo extra para servir si lo deseas","1 cucharada de pasta de tahini o mantequilla de maní","Paquete de 125 g de filetes de trucha ahumada, desmenuzados","½ pepino grande, rebanado","6 cebolletas, finamente cortadas","semilla de sésamo, para servir","aceite de sésamo, para servir"]','["Llevar el caldo y el jengibre rallado a\r\nhervir en una cacerola grande, agregar los fideos,\r\nluego cocine a fuego lento durante 4 minutos hasta que estén tiernos.","Escurrir y luego enfriar con agua corriente fría. \r\nMezclar la soja, el tahini y 2 cucharadas.\r\nagua (o más si es necesario) para hacer una\r\naderezar la consistencia de una sola crema.\r\nMezcle los fideos enfriados y el pescado con el\r\naderezo y pepino. Dispersarse con el\r\ncebolletas y semillas de sésamo, luego\r\nrocíe con un poco de aceite de sésamo, si lo usa."]','2026-01-11 13:00:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13993,7735,'es','Sopa de miso fácil','Una sopa baja en grasas lista en menos de 5 minutos','["bolsita de sopa de miso japonesa","un chorrito de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de tofu sedoso cortado en cubitos","una buena ramita de berros"]','["Disolver un sobre de mezcla de sopa de miso japonesa en un bol con agua hirviendo. Añade un chorrito de salsa de soja, tofu sedoso cortado en cubitos y una buena ramita de berros."]','2026-01-11 13:00:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13994,7737,'es','tempura de coliflor','Un snack saludable al estilo japonés','["1 coliflor pequeña, cortada en floretes medianos","100 g de harina común","2 huevos, separados","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","aceite vegetal para freír"]','["Cuece la coliflor en agua hirviendo durante 2 minutos. Vierta en un colador, enjuague \r\nbajo el grifo de agua fría, escurrir bien y reservar.","Poner la harina en un bol grande con una pizca.  \r\nde sal. Batir las yemas y 175 ml de glaseado.  \r\nagua juntos, luego mezcle con la harina con el \r\naceite para hacer una masa suave. En un lugar separado y limpio \r\nEn un tazón, batir las claras a punto de nieve y luego incorporarlas. \r\nen la masa.","Calienta el aceite en una freidora o en un wok grande para \r\n190C. Cubra un poco de coliflor con la masa. \r\nluego use una espumadera para levantar con cuidado el interior del \r\naceite caliente. Freír la coliflor durante 2-3 minutos hasta que \r\ndorado e hinchado.  Escurrir sobre un paño de cocina y \r\nContinuar con el resto por tandas. Espolvorea el \r\ncoliflor con sal y servir con un bol de  \r\nalioli o mayonesa."]','2026-01-11 13:00:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13995,4585,'es','Sushi de salmón ahumado y aguacate','¿Te apetece hacer sushi en casa? Esta sencilla receta produce 32 pequeños bocados saludables, ideales para el almuerzo o para servir como canapés.','["300 gramos de arroz para sushi","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz o vino blanco","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 aguacate grande","jugo ½ limón","4 hojas de alga nori","4 lonchas grandes de salmón ahumado","1 manojo de cebollino","salsa de soja dulce (salsa de soja dulce), para servir"]','["Pon el arroz en una cacerola pequeña con 600ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar durante 10 minutos hasta que se absorba el agua y el arroz esté tierno. Revuelva con el vinagre y el azúcar, cubra y enfríe.","Pelar, deshuesar y cortar en rodajas el aguacate. Poner en un bol y exprimir sobre el jugo de limón, volteando el aguacate para asegurar que los trozos queden cubiertos.","Divida el arroz entre las hojas de nori y extiéndalo uniformemente, dejando un borde de 1 cm en la parte superior e inferior. Coloque el salmón sobre el arroz, seguido de las cebolletas y finalmente coloque el aguacate en el centro.","Dobla el borde inferior de las algas sobre el relleno y luego enróllalo firmemente. Humedece el borde superior con un poco de agua para ayudar a sellar el rollo. Repita para hacer 4 rollos. En esta etapa, los panecillos se pueden envolver individualmente en film transparente y enfriar hasta que estén listos para servir.","Con un cuchillo de sierra, corte cada rollo en 8 rondas. Sirva con salsa de soja dulce para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:00:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13996,6734,'es','Fideos soba con cítricos','Sencillo, picante y rápido. Añade tus verduras favoritas o un poco de pollo para convertirlo en una comida, o sírvelo como acompañamiento sencillo de comidas de inspiración asiática.','["250 g de fideos soba (consulte los conocimientos técnicos a continuación)","4 cebolletas, ralladas","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","1 cucharada de salsa de soja"]','["Cocine los fideos en agua hirviendo según las instrucciones del paquete, aproximadamente 7 minutos.\r\nluego enjuague con agua corriente fría hasta\r\ngenial. Escurrir bien.","Vierta en un tazón y mezcle con las cebolletas, la ralladura y el jugo de lima y la salsa de soja."]','2026-01-11 13:00:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13997,4589,'es','katsu de pollo','Katsu es un método japonés de pollo empanizado; esta versión se sirve con una rica salsa de curry.','["4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","1 huevo grande, batido","8 cucharadas de copos de maíz finamente triturados o panko rallado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1-2 cucharadas de pasta Korma","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","4 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","2 cucharadas de miel","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Sumergir\r\nel pollo en el huevo, luego cubrir con el\r\ncopos de maíz o migas. espaciar el pollo\r\ncolocar en una bandeja para hornear antiadherente y cocinar\r\ndurante 15-20 minutos o hasta que esté bien cocido.","Pon los ingredientes restantes en una sartén.\r\nVierta 500 ml de agua y caliente, revolviendo,\r\nhasta que hierva y espese. Cubrir y\r\ndejar cocer a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.","Vierta un poco de salsa en 4 platos, corte en rodajas\r\nlas pechugas de pollo y colocar encima.\r\nGenial servido con un poco de arroz y soja.\r\nfrijoles con chile rojo finamente picado."]','2026-01-11 13:00:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13998,7741,'es','Arroz japonés con salmón y aguacate','Este plato contiene las bondades del sushi pero te ahorra el minucioso enrollado y moldeado.','["300 gramos de arroz para sushi","350 g de filetes de salmón sin piel","2 aguacates pequeños y maduros, rebanados","jugo 1 limon","4 cucharaditas de salsa de soja ligera","4 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo tostadas","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","un puñado pequeño de hojas de cilantro"]','["Enjuague el arroz en un colador hasta que el agua\r\ncorre claro. Escurrir y poner en una cacerola grande.\r\ncon 400ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición, dar vuelta\r\nel fuego a bajo, tapar, luego cocinar por\r\n10-12 minutos hasta que el arroz esté casi\r\ncocido. Retirar del fuego, luego\r\ndéjelo tapado durante otros 10 minutos.","Cortar el salmón en rodajas finas y disponerlo\r\nun plato con el aguacate en rodajas. llovizna\r\nsobre el jugo de limón y la soja, haciendo\r\nAsegúrese de que todo esté cubierto uniformemente. salir\r\nen el frigorífico para marinar durante 10 minutos.","Verter con cuidado los jugos del salmón.\r\nplato en el arroz, luego agregue con un\r\npoca sal. Divida el arroz en 4 tazones.\r\nEsparcir las semillas de sésamo, las cebolletas,\r\nchile y cilantro sobre el salmón y\r\naguacate, luego sírvelo con el arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:00:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(13999,7743,'es','Brochetas de atún teriyaki','Coloridas y rápidas, ¡estas sencillas brochetas saben tan bien como parecen!','["30ml soy sauce","50 ml de mirin (ver conocimientos a continuación)","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","1 mango, pelado","3 cebolletas","Paquete de 250 g de filetes de atún"]','["Haga una salsa teriyaki mezclando la salsa de soja, el mirin y el azúcar en un plato poco profundo. Coloque los filetes de atún en la fuente, déles la vuelta varias veces para que se cubran con la salsa, luego déjelos marinar en el refrigerador durante al menos 1 hora y hasta 2 horas.","Para cocinar, calienta una sartén grande. Saque los filetes de atún de la marinada y séquelos, luego frótelos con aceite. Freír el atún durante 2 minutos por cada lado, para que todavía esté rosado en el medio. Retirar de la sartén, luego verter la marinada y 2-3 cucharadas de agua. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar durante unos minutos para que se caliente. Colar a través de un colador en un tazón pequeño.","Para servir, corte el atún cocido, el mango y la cebolleta en trozos pequeños. Ensártelos en brochetas de madera y luego sirva tibio o frío con la salsa para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:00:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14000,7745,'es','Abadejo con miso y ensalada de pepino y cebolleta','Cambie el bacalao por un pescado blanco sustentable como el abadejo y sírvalo con sabores japoneses para una cena baja en calorías con la que se sentirá bien.','["2 cucharadas de pasta de miso blanca","1 cucharadita de salsa de soja baja en sodio","4 cucharadas de vinagre de vino de arroz","2 x 125 g/4½ oz de filetes de abadejo sin piel","1 manojo de cebolletas, cortadas en diagonal","½ pepino pelado en tiras con un pelador de patatas","140 g / 5 oz de brotes de soja","100 g/ 4 oz de rábanos, en rodajas","1 chile rojo, picado (sin semillas si lo desea)","3 limas, 2 en jugo, 1 cortada en gajos","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo"]','["Mezclar la pasta de miso, la salsa de soja.\r\ny la mitad del vinagre. Cubrir el pescado en el\r\nmarinar y dejar actuar al menos 15 minutos,\r\no idealmente durante la noche en el frigorífico.","Mezclar las cebolletas, el pepino,\r\nbrotes de soja y rábanos. hacer un\r\naderezo con chile, jugo de lima y\r\nvinagre restante. Vierta sobre la ensalada\r\ny reserva mientras cocinas el pescado.","Calentar el aceite de sésamo en una sartén.\r\ny cocine el pescado durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado.\r\nRetirar y transferir a un plato. Inclina el\r\nmarinar en la sartén, llevar a ebullición\r\ny hervir rápidamente para reducir a la mitad. verter\r\nsobre el pescado y servir con la ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:00:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14001,7747,'es','Filete de chile miso con batatas crujientes','Pruebe este toque asiático de bistec con patatas fritas: sirva carne de res a la plancha con una salsa de miso con chile y batatas con sésamo.','["2 batatas grandes, cortadas en gajos","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal, más un poco extra","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharada de pasta de miso","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharada de salsa de chile picante (la sriracha es buena)","1 cucharada de mirín","2 bavette u otros filetes magros (de unos 200 g cada uno)","un puñado grande de hojas de berro, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPon las patatas en gajos en una bandeja para horno.\r\ny frotar con el aceite. Espolvorea el sésamo\r\nsemillas y un poco de condimento. hornear\r\ndurante 25 minutos o hasta que los bordes estén crujientes.","En un tazón pequeño, mezcle el miso,\r\njugo de limón, salsa de chile y mirin. frotar\r\nlos filetes con un poquito de aceite y un poco\r\ncondimento. Vierta 1 cucharada de salsa\r\nsobre cada filete y frótelo por ambos lados.","Calienta una sartén hasta que esté muy caliente, cocina\r\nlos filetes durante 2 minutos por cada lado, o más\r\nsi lo prefieres bien hecho. Cepillar más\r\nde la salsa después de darles la vuelta.\r\nTransfiera a un plato, cubra sin apretar con\r\npapel de aluminio y dejar reposar durante 5 minutos. servir\r\nlos filetes cortados en rodajas, con salsa extra, el\r\npatatas y berros."]','2026-01-11 13:00:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14002,7749,'es','Albóndigas de pollo teriyaki con arroz y verduras','Pruebe una cena familiar diferente con estas hamburguesas de pollo servidas en salsa dulce japonesa y basmati.','["2 chalotes","1 zanahoria, cortada en trozos","500 g de pechugas o muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","un poco de aceite","200 g de arroz basmati","200 g de verduras tiernas picadas","100ml de mirín","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPulse las chalotas y la zanahoria en un recipiente para alimentos.\r\nprocesador hasta que esté finamente picado. Añade el\r\npollo, ralladura de limón y un poco de condimento,\r\ny presione nuevamente hasta que se mezcle. Usando aceitado\r\nCon las manos, forme pequeñas albóndigas.\r\nPoner en una bandeja para horno forrada con masa para hornear.\r\npergamino y hornee por 10 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado y bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, hierve el siguiente paquete de arroz.\r\ninstrucciones, agregando las hojas verdes de primavera para\r\nLos últimos 4 minutos. Escurrir bien.","Añade el mirin, la soja, el zumo de limón y\r\nazúcar a una cacerola. Llevar a ebullición,\r\nluego cocine a fuego lento hasta que esté picante. Quitar de\r\nel fuego, agrega las albóndigas a la sartén\r\ny enrollarlos en la salsa. dividir\r\nel arroz y las verduras entre platos o\r\ntazones y vierta las albóndigas encima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14003,6745,'es','Ensalada crujiente de pepino y rábano','Agregue crujiente y frescura a cualquier comida de inspiración asiática con esta sencilla guarnición','["1?2 pepino","1?2 manojos de rábanos","2 g de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino de arroz"]','["Cortar en rodajas finas el pepino y los rábanos y colocarlos en un plato.","Batir el aceite vegetal y el vinagre de vino de arroz y rociar sobre las verduras para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14004,7753,'es','Wraps de ternera con sésamo','El refrigerio perfecto antes de la cena de inspiración asiática, perfecto para una reunión navideña con amigos','["1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","175 g de filete de ternera cortado en tiras finas","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","Un trozo de 2 cm de raíz de jengibre fresco, en rodajas finas y cortado en palitos","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 lechugas baby gem","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Cuando la sartén esté\r\nmuy caliente, agregue la carne y la pimienta, luego cocine\r\ndurante unos minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y el\r\nla carne esté bien cocida. Añade el ajo y el jengibre.\r\ny semillas de sésamo, luego cocine por 1-2 minutos más,\r\nrevolviendo con frecuencia hasta que comiencen a dorarse.","Vierta sobre la salsa de soja y 2 cucharadas de agua, deje\r\nburbujea un poco hasta que empieza a verse almibarado,\r\nluego rocíe con el aceite de sésamo. Separar el\r\nlas hojas de las lechugas y disponerlas en un plato.\r\nVierta un poco de la mezcla de carne en cada hoja,\r\nrocíe con el jugo de la sartén y sirva caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14005,7755,'es','Ajiaco','Esta sopa clásica colombiana se sirve con crema, alcaparras, aguacate, mote (maíz hervido) y pechuga de pollo desmenuzada, todo mezclado justo antes de comer','["2 pechugas de pollo sin piel","2 mazorcas de maíz choclo (una variedad de maíz amarillo de grano grande) o mazorcas de maíz regulares","4 dientes de ajo, en rodajas","½ cebolla blanca, picada en cubos","1 pimiento amarillo, picado en cubos","4 papas medianas (rojas o blancas), peladas y picadas en cubos","2 cebolletas, picadas","6 ramitas de cilantro, picadas, y un poco más para servir","12 papas criollas (papas amarillas pequeñas), cortadas por la mitad","8 cdas de guascas","100ml de nata simple o doble","4 cdas de alcaparras, escurridas","1 aguacate, pelado, deshuesado y cortado en cubos pequeños"]','["Poner el pollo, las mazorcas de maíz, el ajo, la cebolla, el pimiento, las papas, las cebolletas y el cilantro en una olla con 2 litros de agua y llevar a ebullición, sazonar bien, luego cocinar a fuego lento durante aproximadamente 45 minutos a fuego medio.","Retirar el maíz y el pollo y transferirlos a un plato. Licuar los ingredientes restantes en la olla con una batidora de mano hasta obtener una consistencia cremosa.","Agregar las papas criollas y las guascas a la olla y cocinar a fuego medio durante unos 10-12 minutos, o hasta que las papas criollas comiencen a ablandarse pero no se desintegren.","Mientras tanto, desmenuzar las pechugas de pollo finamente con las manos y cortar las mazorcas de maíz en rodajas gruesas. Poner en pequeños cuencos separados.","Poner la crema, las alcaparras, el aguacate y el cilantro picado extra en pequeños cuencos también, para que cada uno pueda servirse lo que quiera. Verter la sopa en cuatro platos hondos y servir junto con los otros ingredientes. No olvides servilletas para comer las rodajas de maíz."]','2026-01-11 13:00:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14006,7757,'es','Bandeja de merluza a la puttanesca','Compra merluza sostenible para cocinar este horneado en una sartén al estilo mediterráneo con aceitunas verdes y tomates.','["1 cebolla, en rodajas","500 g de patatas baby, cortadas en monedas gruesas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 dientes de ajo, ligeramente machacados pero aún con piel","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","60g de aceitunas deshuesadas, nosotros utilizamos nocellara, en rodajas","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharadas de alcaparras, escurridas y picadas en trozos grandes","3 filetes de anchoa, finamente picados","4 filetes de merluza de unos 100 g cada uno","10 g de perejil, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/190C ventilador/gas 6. Poner la cebolla y las patatas en una fuente para asar, rociar con aceite y cubrir con el ajo. Sazone bien con sal y pimienta. Ase durante 25-30 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad, hasta que estén dorados y bien cocidos. Quitar los ajos de la piel y exprimirlos sobre las patatas.","Cuando las patatas estén cocidas, mezcla los tomates enlatados troceados con una buena pizca de sal y pimienta. Esparza las aceitunas, las hojuelas de chile, las alcaparras y las anchoas sobre las patatas y mezcle bien. Vierta sobre los tomates enlatados sazonados. Colocar encima los filetes de merluza.","Cubra con papel aluminio y luego regrese al horno durante 10 a 15 minutos, hasta que el pescado esté cocido. Debe quedar opaco y desmenuzarse fácilmente al empujarlo ligeramente con un tenedor.","Esparcir con el perejil y servir directamente de la bandeja."]','2026-01-11 13:00:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14007,7759,'es','Ensalada mediterránea con aderezo de hummus','Dale vida a tu ensalada habitual con calabacines asados, alcachofas, garbanzos y queso feta en un aderezo cremoso de hummus','["2 calabacines","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de hierbas secas mixtas","100 g de alcachofas a la brasa, picadas en trozos grandes","½ pepino, picado en trozos grandes","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","300 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","100 g de aceitunas deshuesadas, picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 limón, exprimido","100 g de hummus"]','["Recorta los calabacines y luego córtalos por la mitad a lo largo, de modo que tengas dos mitades largas. Marque la pulpa de los calabacines en cruz. Espolvoree una pizca grande de sal sobre el lado cortado de los calabacines y déjelos reposar durante 10 minutos. Seque con palmaditas, luego unte con aceite de oliva y espolvoree sobre la mezcla de hierbas en el lado cortado.","Calienta una sartén seca a fuego medio-alto. Coloque los calabacines, con el lado marcado hacia abajo, en la sartén y cocínelos durante 8 a 10 minutos, hasta que estén bien dorados. Voltee y cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que los calabacines estén completamente suaves.","Mientras tanto, combine los ingredientes del aderezo en un tazón ancho y poco profundo para servir y sazone al gusto. Agrega el resto de los ingredientes, reserva un poco de perejil y revuelve bien para combinar. Cubra con los calabacines y espolvoree con el perejil restante para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14008,7761,'es','Paquetes de bocadillos de hummus','Guarda el líquido de una lata de garbanzos para hacer un hummus cremoso. Lo hemos servido con crudités de verduras para un refrigerio saludable que contribuye a tus 5 al día.','["Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y reservado el líquido","1 diente de ajo","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1-2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 bolsas de 200 g de zanahorias arcoíris o 4 zanahorias normales","2 bolsas de 200 g de pepinos tiernos o 4 pepinos normales"]','["Vierta los garbanzos y el ajo en un bol con el comino, el cilantro, 1 cucharada de jugo de limón y el aceite. Agregue 2 cucharadas del líquido reservado de los garbanzos, luego mezcle con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Si la licuadora tiene problemas, agregue otro chorrito de líquido. Sazona y agrega un poco más de jugo de limón si es necesario.","Coloque el hummus en cuatro recipientes pequeños. Se mantendrá tapado y frío hasta por tres días. Corte las zanahorias y el pepino en bastones cuando esté listo para comer y sírvalos con el hummus."]','2026-01-11 13:00:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14009,5353,'es','Pasta al horno con pollo saludable','Pruebe esta saludable pasta con pollo horneada con pimientos, calabacín y ricotta para una cena nutritiva entre semana. Seguro que será un éxito para todos.','["300 g de penne integral","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 pimientos (nosotros usamos 1 amarillo y 1 naranja), sin semillas y picados","1 calabacín grande (160 g), rallado grueso","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","500 g de puré de cartón","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","1½ cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo (opcional)","25 g de aceitunas Kalamata (unas 8), en rodajas","400 g de pechugas de pollo (2 grandes), cortadas en trozos","un puñado grande de albahaca picada y más para servir","100 g de ricota","20 g de queso cheddar maduro finamente rallado"]','["Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe los pimientos durante 8 minutos, revolviendo hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agregue el calabacín y el ajo, revuelva durante unos minutos más, luego agregue la passata y agregue el pimentón ahumado, el caldo, la guindilla, si se usa, y las aceitunas. Cocine a fuego lento durante 3-4 minutos.","Escurrir la pasta, reservando el agua de la pasta. Vierta la pasta en la mezcla de passata junto con el pollo, media taza de agua de pasta y la albahaca. Mezcle bien y luego viértalo en una fuente para hornear.","Mezclar la ricota en un bol con 5 cucharadas de agua de la pasta y esparcir por la parte superior de la pasta. Espolvoree sobre el queso cheddar y luego hornee por 35 minutos. Espolvoree con algunas hojas de albahaca extra, si lo desea, y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:00:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14010,3914,'es','Ensalada de cuscús gigante y tomate con aderezo estilo zhoug','Prepara esta ensalada de cuscús gigante y tomate como acompañamiento de verano. Zhoug es una salsa verde picante de Oriente Medio que le da vida a este plato','["4 tomates en rama grandes, cortados en cubos","½ cebolla roja, finamente picada","150g de tobogán gigante gigante","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","puñado de hojas de perejil, picadas en trozos grandes","1 limón, exprimido","2 chiles verdes, picados","1 diente de ajo, picado en trozos grandes","½ cdta de comino molido","½ cdta de azúcar extrafino","3 cdas de aceite de oliva"]','["Poner los tomates y la cebolla en un bol grande con ½ cdta de sal marina. Mezclar y dejar reposar.","Cocinar el cuscús en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté tierno (no lo cocines demasiado, quieres que quede un poco firme para que pueda absorber los jugos del tomate), luego escurrir muy bien. Enfriar durante 10 minutos y luego mezclar con la mezcla de tomate y cebolla.","Licuar todos los ingredientes del aderezo con 1 cda de agua y ½ cdta de sal marina hasta que quede suave. Rociar un poco sobre el cuscús, luego servir el resto a un lado para que la gente se sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:00:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14011,3918,'es','Espinacas con garbanzos, piñones y pasas','Disfrute de esta sencilla guarnición de espinacas con platos de pollo al estilo español. Las almendras tostadas también funcionan bien','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito","1 chalota grande y larga, cortada en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","½ cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","4 cucharadas de pasas doradas o flameadas","200 g de espinacas","2 cucharadas de piñones tostados"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén antiadherente grande. Agregue la chalota y el ajo y cocine hasta que se ablanden. Agrega las especias, los garbanzos y las pasas y cocina por 2 minutos.","Vierta las espinacas y cocine hasta que se ablanden. Agrega los piñones y sirve con un chorrito extra de aceite."]','2026-01-11 13:00:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14012,4539,'es','Sabich','Viste este sándwich con salsas tahini y amba para darle un sabor a Israel. Está lleno de sabor, con berenjena, hummus, huevos, pepinillos y más.','["2 tomates, cortados en cubitos","½ pepino pequeño, cortado en cubitos","2 cebolletas, picadas","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva, más extra para freír","chorrito de jugo de limón","2 berenjenas, peladas y cortadas en rodajas de 1 cm","4 panes pita","4 huevos medio duros, pelados y cortados en rodajas","200 g de humus","150 g de rábanos, cortados y cortados por la mitad si son grandes","250 g de zanahorias, cortadas en rodajas diagonales","4 chalotes, finamente picados","250 g de floretes pequeños de coliflor","500 ml de vino blanco o vinagre de sidra","3½ cucharadas de azúcar granulada","¾ cucharada de sal marina en escamas","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza amarilla","2 cucharaditas de semillas de alcaravea","1 cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra, machacados","½ cucharada de semillas de cilantro machacadas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","3 dientes de ajo, picados","1 chile rojo, cortado a la mitad, sin semillas y picado","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","½ cucharadita de semillas de fenogreco","pizca de pimienta de cayena","2 mangos firmes, pelados y con la pulpa picada (unos 375 g)","50 ml de vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","chorrito de jugo de lima","100 g de tahini"]','["Para hacer los encurtidos, pon todas las verduras en un tarro esterilizado de 1 litro. Poner el vinagre, el azúcar, la sal y las especias en una cacerola con 400ml de agua y llevar a ebullición. Dejar enfriar y luego verter sobre las verduras. Sellar y dejar encurtir a temperatura ambiente durante 48 hrs. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta cuatro semanas.","Para hacer la salsa amba, caliente el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio, luego cocine el ajo y la guindilla hasta que estén tiernos. Agregue las especias y cocine por 1 minuto, agregue el mango y revuelva para cubrir, luego agregue el vinagre, el azúcar y 100 ml de agua. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos hasta que el mango esté suave. Sazone al gusto y exprima sobre el jugo de lima. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta una semana.","Para la salsa tahini, combine los ingredientes con 80 ml de agua y sazone al gusto. Debe tener la consistencia de una nata doble.","Mezcle los tomates, el pepino y las cebolletas con el aceite, sazone y exprima sobre el jugo de limón.","Calienta un poco de aceite de oliva en una sartén a fuego medio-alto y cocina las berenjenas en tandas durante 5-8 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas. Sazone, luego reduzca el fuego y continúe cocinando hasta que esté suave.","Tuesta y abre las pitas, luego rellénalas con las rodajas de berenjena, los huevos, el hummus, la ensalada, los pepinillos y la salsa amba. Rocíe sobre la salsa tahini para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14013,5696,'es','Lonchera de falafel','Haga que esta ensalada de falafel sea divertida con una lonchera estilo bento. Es ideal para niños pequeños que prefieren almuerzos con muchos elementos individuales. Utilice falafel comprado en la tienda o prepare nuestro falafel Edamame','["Bolsa de 250 g de cereales o lentejas cocidas (nosotros utilizamos quinoa roja y blanca)","un puñado de espinacas tiernas","¼ de pepino, picado","un puñado de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","2 zanahorias ralladas","1 granada, solo semillas","10 aceitunas (opcional)","12 falafels","4 cucharadas de hummus","chorrito de aceite de oliva (opcional)","½ limón, en cuartos"]','["Divida los granos entre las loncheras. Cubra cada uno con las verduras, el falafel, una cucharada de hummus y un chorrito de aceite, si lo usa, o divida los ingredientes entre los compartimentos de una lonchera estilo bento. Coloque un limón en cada caja para exprimirlo justo antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 13:00:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14014,6247,'es','Envolturas de hummus arcoíris','Prepare estos coloridos wraps de arcoíris con hummus, remolacha, zanahoria, queso feta y espinacas tiernas para un almuerzo vegetariano rápido y fácil para toda la familia.','["3-4 envolturas (½ envoltura será suficiente para un niño más pequeño)","6 cucharadas de hummus","2 zanahorias ralladas","4 remolachas cocidas, ralladas","un puñado grande de espinacas tiernas","100 g de queso feta desmenuzado (opcional)"]','["Unte los wraps con hummus y luego rellénelos con zanahoria, remolacha, espinacas y queso feta, para quienes lo deseen. Envuélvalo y guárdelo para la hora del almuerzo o cómelo inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14015,4145,'es','Wrap de falafel relleno estilo delicatessen','Prepare este wrap de falafel estilo delicatessen relleno de espinacas, pepinillos, pepino y col lombarda en solo 10 minutos para una cena rápida y fácil para uno.','["½ diente de ajo pequeño","2 cucharadas de yogur sin grasa","¼ de limón, en jugo","1 pan plano o wrap","un puñado grande de espinacas o lechuga, rallada","2-3 falafel listos para comer","¼ de pepino pequeño, cortado a la mitad, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas","1 tomate, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas","1 pepinillo o chile encurtido, cortado a la mitad","1 cucharada de repollo rojo encurtido, salsa de chile escurrida, para servir (opcional)"]','["Mezclar el ajo, el yogur y el jugo de limón en un bol. Sazone y luego afloje con 1 cucharada de agua fría si parece demasiado espesa. Caliente el pan plano en la tostadora, si lo desea.","Coloque el pan plano sobre un trozo de papel para hornear y cubra con las espinacas o la lechuga. Coloque el falafel en una línea por el centro y luego cubra con las rodajas de pepino y tomate. Agregue el pepinillo, el repollo y un chorrito de salsa de chile, si lo usa. Vierta sobre la mezcla de yogur.","Use el papel para hornear para ayudarlo a doblar ambos extremos de la envoltura, luego enróllelo firmemente en forma de burrito. Corta el papel para hornear por la mitad con un cuchillo para pan y rómpelo para comerlo."]','2026-01-11 13:00:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14016,7763,'es','Calamares crujientes con caponata','Los calamares son baratos, abundantes, rápidos de cocinar y deliciosos con el clásico plato de verduras italiano, la caponata.','["800 g de tubos de calamar limpios (unos 3 tubos grandes)","150 g de harina común","1 cucharada de pimienta de cayena o chile en polvo","aceite de girasol, para freír","1 berenjena grande","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cebolla, picada","3 ramas de apio, en rodajas","250 g de tomates cherry","3 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","150 g de aceituna verde deshuesada","30 g de alcaparras, enjuagadas si están saladas","un puñado de hojas de albahaca, ralladas"]','["Para preparar los calamares, colóquelos sobre una tabla. Inserta un cuchillo largo y delgado en la abertura y córtalo con cuidado a lo largo de un lado. Ábralo en una sábana plana y raspe los restos de membrana. Utilice la punta del cuchillo para marcar ligeramente la carne en forma de diamante, teniendo cuidado de no cortar el calamar por completo. Cortar los calamares rayados en triángulos grandes listos para enharinar y freír.","Para la caponata, hay que cortar la berenjena en dados uniformes: cortarla a lo largo de aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor, cortar tiras largas del mismo tamaño y luego cortarlas en cuadrados.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén grande. Freír las cebollas durante 3-4 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse, agregar la berenjena y luego continuar cocinando durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén doradas y suaves. Vierta en un colador sobre un tazón.","Vierta el aceite del recipiente nuevamente en la sartén y rellénelo con un chorrito de aceite fresco. Freír juntos el apio, los tomates y el ajo machacado. Espolvoree el azúcar, agregue el vinagre y cocine durante 3-4 minutos hasta que los tomates comiencen a soltar su jugo.","Vuelva a colocar la berenjena y la cebolla con el apio. Agrega las aceitunas, las alcaparras y la albahaca, luego revuelve todo bien. Cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que hierva a fuego lento, luego sazone al gusto. Apagar el fuego, rociar con el resto del aceite y reservar.","Justo antes de cocinarlos, vierta los calamares en un tazón grande. Tamizar la harina y la pimienta de cayena sobre los calamares, luego mezclar bien y sazonar con sal. Vuelva a colocar los calamares en el colador y sacuda todo el exceso de harina.","Vierta suficiente aceite de girasol en una sartén grande hasta que tenga aproximadamente 1 cm de profundidad. Calentar el aceite hasta que chisporrotee al espolvorearlo con un poco de harina. En tandas, fríe los calamares durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Cuando estén cocidos, utiliza unas pinzas para levantar los calamares y colocarlos en un plato forrado con papel de cocina. Ahora estás listo para servir.","Coloque la caponata dentro de un anillo de metal de 10 cm de ancho (o simplemente haga una pila ordenada) en el medio de un plato mediano. Utilice el dorso de la cuchara para presionar ligeramente la caponata y nivelar la parte superior de la pila. Levante con cuidado el anillo, manteniendo la torre de caponata circular. Coloque cinco o seis trozos de calamar alrededor de la caponata como si fueran pétalos de una flor y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14017,7765,'es','Polenta, verduras asadas y patatas fritas de parmesano con pimienta','Emma Booth ganó nuestro concurso del Mes de la cocina casera con este suntuoso y cremoso plato de polenta, cubierto con vibrantes calabazas asadas y remolacha.','["1 calabaza pequeña (unos 450 g), pelada y cortada en cubos de 2 cm","3 remolachas crudas (unos 200 g), cortadas en cubos de 2 cm","2 cebollas moradas pequeñas, cortadas en gajos finos","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","jugo de ½ limón","200 g de polenta fina","½ cucharadita de sal","50 g de mantequilla","60 g de queso rallado (nosotros utilizamos una mezcla 50/50 de parmesano y taleggio)","un puñado grande de rúcula, para servir","2 cucharaditas de hojas de tomillo recién cortadas","50 g de parmesano rallado"]','["Para hacer las patatas fritas, baje el horno a 200 C/180 C ventilador/marca de gas 6. Sazone el parmesano rallado con una pizca grande de pimienta negra y esparza uniformemente sobre una bandeja para hornear cubierta con una lámina de silicona o papel vegetal ligeramente engrasado y hornee durante 5 minutos, hasta que estén dorados pero no dorados.  Después de enfriar durante cinco minutos, córtelo en trozos crujientes con los dedos.","Encienda el horno a 220 ° C/ventilador de 200 ° C/ marca de gas 7. Mezcle los trozos de calabaza y remolacha en el jugo de limón y el aceite, sazone ligeramente con sal y pimienta y hornee en una fuente para asar durante 20 minutos. Agrega los gajos de cebolla y continúa horneando por 25 minutos más.","Mientras tanto, ponga a hervir a fuego lento un litro de agua, sal y la mitad de la mantequilla en una olla grande, luego agregue lentamente la polenta en un chorro fino, revolviendo todo el tiempo.  Continúe cocinando a fuego lento durante 35 minutos (o según las instrucciones si usa polenta de cocción rápida), revolviendo con frecuencia para evitar que se pegue al fondo.  La polenta debe estar espesa pero aún suave en este punto.  Si empieza a secarse demasiado, añade una taza de agua.  Cuando esté cocido, revuelva con el resto de la mantequilla, el parmesano y el taleggio y una pizca de pimienta blanca.","Para servir, vierta la polenta sobre una tabla o en platos, esparza sobre las verduras y el jugo asado, luego la rúcula y el tomillo.  Coloque las patatas fritas de parmesano entre las verduras y cómelas calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:00:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14018,7767,'es','Higos al horno especiados con mascarpone de jengibre','Este plato es el final perfecto para una cena relajada, especial pero sin estrés.','["8 higos, partidos por la mitad","2 cucharadas de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de miel clara","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","2 cucharadas de jugo de naranja","anís de 2 estrellas","dedos de mantequilla, para servir","1 bola de jengibre de tallo, muy finamente picado","1 cucharada de jarabe de jengibre del frasco","½ tarrina de mascarpone de 250g"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Colocar\r\nlos higos en una fuente para horno apta para horno, salpique\r\nsobre la mantequilla y rociar con miel.\r\nEspolvorea sobre el azúcar y la canela,\r\nluego vierte sobre el jugo de naranja y mezcla ligeramente. Coloque el anís estrellado entre los higos y ase durante 15-20 minutos.","Cuando esté listo para servir, mezcle el jengibre.\r\ny almíbar por el mascarpone.\r\nColoque 4 mitades de higos, rociadas con almíbar,\r\nen un plato con una cucharada de mascarpone\r\ny unos dedos de mantequilla."]','2026-01-11 13:00:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14019,7769,'es','Ensalada de sandía y queso feta con pan crujiente','Una combinación fresca y refrescante para las cálidas noches de verano.','["½ sandía (aproximadamente 1½ kg), pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos","200 g de queso feta en bloque, en cubos","un puñado grande de aceitunas negras","un puñado de perejil de hoja plana y hojas de menta, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada en aros","aceite de oliva y vinagre balsámico, para servir","½ paquete de 500 g de mezcla para pan blanco","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","harina común, para espolvorear","1 clara de huevo batida","una mezcla de semillas de sésamo, semillas de amapola y semillas de hinojo, para esparcir"]','["Preparar el pan según el paquete.\r\ninstrucciones con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva. salir\r\nLevantar en un lugar cálido durante aproximadamente 1 hora.\r\nhasta que duplique su tamaño. Calentar el horno a\r\n220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Golpear el pan\r\nRegrese y divida en 6 pedazos. en un\r\nsuperficie enharinada, extienda los panes como\r\nlo más fino posible, luego transfiéralo a hornear\r\nbandejas. Pincelar con la clara de huevo y\r\nespolvorear con las semillas mixtas. Hornear para\r\nunos 15 minutos hasta que estén crujientes y doradas; si\r\nse hinchan, incluso mejor. Puede que necesites\r\npara hacer esto en lotes. Los panes pueden ser\r\nelaborado el día anterior y conservado en un\r\nrecipiente hermético.","En un tazón grande para servir, mezcle ligeramente\r\nel melón con el queso feta y las aceitunas.\r\nEsparcir sobre las hierbas y los aros de cebolla,\r\nluego servir con el aceite de oliva y el balsámico.\r\npara rociar. Sirve el montón de\r\npanes crujientes a un lado para romper\r\nLevante y use para sacar la ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:00:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14020,5093,'es','Ensalada mediterránea de queso feta con aderezo de granada','La melaza de granada del Medio Oriente le da a esta ensalada un sabor delicioso','["2 pimientos rojos","3 berenjenas medianas cortadas en trozos o 15 pequeñas partidas por la mitad","6 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","cucharadita de canela","200 g de judías verdes escaldadas (utilícelas congeladas si puede)","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en medias lunas","200 g de queso feta, escurrido y desmenuzado","semillas 1 granada","un puñado de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Calentar\r\nla parrilla a su posición más alta. cortar los pimientos\r\nen cuartos, luego colóquelos, con la piel hacia arriba,\r\nen una bandeja para hornear. Ase hasta que esté ennegrecido.\r\nColocar en una bolsa de plástico, sellar y dejar reposar.\r\n5 minutos. Cuando esté lo suficientemente frío para manipularlo, raspe\r\nQuite la piel, deséchelo y luego reserve los pimientos.","Colocar las berenjenas en una bandeja para horno,\r\nrocíe con aceite de oliva y canela, luego\r\nsazone con sal y pimienta. Asar hasta\r\ndorado y ablandado – unos 25 minutos.","Mientras tanto, combine todo el aderezo.\r\ningredientes y mezclar bien. Para servir, coloque el\r\nberenjenas, judías verdes, cebolla y pimientos\r\nen un plato grande para servir. Esparcir con el queso feta\r\ny semillas de granada. Vierta el aderezo\r\nTerminar y terminar con el perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:00:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14021,7771,'es','Alioli','Un golpe cremoso de ajo, una salsa perfecta para verduras de primavera al vapor','["una pizca pequeña de hebras de azafrán","3 dientes de ajo machacados","2 yemas de huevo","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","300 ml de aceite de oliva"]','["En un tazón pequeño vierta 1 cucharada de agua hirviendo \r\nel azafrán y reservar. Poner el ajo, las yemas de huevo. \r\ny mostaza en un procesador de alimentos o licuadora. bombardeo \r\nhasta formar una pasta y rociar muy lentamente con el aceite de oliva. \r\npara hacer una salsa espesa estilo mayonesa. cuando \r\nya está todo unido añadimos el azafrán, azafrán \r\nagua y jugo de limón, luego sazone al gusto. el \r\nEl alioli se mantendrá tapado en el refrigerador hasta por 2 días."]','2026-01-11 13:00:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14022,4865,'es','Ensalada de patatas mediterránea','Omita la mayonesa y opte por un aderezo de aceite de oliva al estilo italiano para patatas nuevas calientes. Dales sabor con albahaca, parmesano y tomates secos.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla pequeña, en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharadita de orégano, fresco o seco","½ lata de 400 g de tomates cherry","100 g de pimientos rojos asados, de un frasco, en rodajas","300 g de patatas nuevas, partidas por la mitad si son grandes","25 g de aceitunas negras, en rodajas","un puñado de hojas de albahaca, rasgadas"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola, agregar la cebolla.\r\ny cocine durante 5-10 minutos hasta que esté suave. Añade el\r\najo y orégano y cocinar por 1 min. Añadir\r\nlos tomates y los pimientos, sazonar bien\r\ny cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, cocine las patatas en una sartén.\r\nde agua hirviendo con sal durante 10-15 minutos hasta que\r\ntierno. Escurrir bien, mezclar con la salsa y\r\nsirva caliente, espolvoreado con aceitunas y albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:00:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14023,7773,'es','Chorizo pilaf','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. A medio camino entre una paella y un risotto, esta olla de arroz basmati cocinada a fuego lento tiene un intenso sabor a pimentón.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, en rodajas finas","250 g de chorizo ​​para cocinar baby, en rodajas","4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","250 g de arroz basmati","caldo de 600ml","1 limón, sin ralladura en tiras gruesas, más gajos para servir","2 hojas de laurel frescas","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande con tapa.\r\nAgrega la cebolla y cocina durante 5-8 minutos.\r\nhasta que estén suaves y doradas. Empuje hacia el lado de\r\nla sartén y agrega el chorizo. Cocine hasta\r\nligeramente dorado y algunos de los aceites están\r\nliberado en la sartén.","Añade el ajo y el pimentón, luego el\r\ntomates. Burbuja a fuego medio.\r\ndurante 5 minutos, luego agregue el arroz, el caldo,\r\nralladura de limón y hojas de laurel. Revuelva\r\ntodo junto bien y llevar a\r\nel hervor. Ponga la tapa y cocine.\r\na fuego muy lento durante 12 min.","Apagar el fuego y dejar reposar y\r\nCocine al vapor durante 10-15 minutos. Revuelva a través del\r\nperejil y servir con rodajas de limón\r\npara apretar."]','2026-01-11 13:00:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14024,7775,'es','Espinacas con guindilla y migas de limón','Deje que las verduras frescas se ablanden y luego sírvalas con pan rallado crujiente, chile y ajo como guarnición saludable y baja en grasas.','["25 g de mantequilla","100 g de pan rallado fresco","ralladura de 1 limón","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","500 g de espinacas"]','["Derretir la mantequilla en una sartén grande,\r\nluego, cuando empiece a hacer espuma, incline el\r\npan rallado, ralladura, ajo y guindilla.\r\nCocine hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Quitar\r\nde la sartén, sazonar y reservar.","Agregue las espinacas a la sartén y deje que se marchiten.\r\nrevolviendo. Sazone y sirva con el\r\nmigajas crujientes espolvoreadas por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14025,7777,'es','Horneado en bandeja de pollo mediterráneo','Un colorido horneado todo en uno lleno de sabor veraniego','["2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en trozos","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","4 pechugas de pollo con piel","½ paquete de 150 g de queso tierno entero con ajo y hierbas","Paquete de 200 g de tomates cherry.","un puñado de aceitunas negras"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezclar\r\nlos pimientos y la cebolla en una fuente grande para hornear\r\nbandeja con la mitad del aceite. Transferir al horno\r\ny cocine en el estante superior durante 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, haz con cuidado un bolsillo.\r\nentre la piel y la carne de cada uno\r\npechuga de pollo, pero sin quitarle la piel\r\ncompletamente. Empuje cantidades iguales de\r\nqueso debajo de la piel, alisar la piel\r\nhacia abajo, cepíllelo con el resto del\r\naceite, sazonar, luego agregar a la bandeja junto\r\ncon los tomates y las aceitunas. Volver a\r\nel horno y cocine por 25-30 minutos más\r\nhasta que el pollo esté dorado y cocido.\r\nSirva con papas al horno, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14026,6837,'es','Mejillones con tomate y guindilla','Esta receta de mariscos picantes es una comida fantástica para dos, pero se puede ampliar fácilmente para un entrante elegante para una cena.','["2 tomates maduros","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 chalota, finamente picada","1 chile rojo o verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","vaso pequeño de vino blanco seco","1 cucharadita de pasta de tomate","pizca de azúcar","1 kg de mejillones limpios","un buen puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Pon los tomates en un recipiente resistente al calor.\r\nCubrir con agua hirviendo, dejar actuar 3 minutos,\r\nluego escurrir y pelar. Cuartos los tomates\r\ny saque y deseche las semillas usando\r\nuna cucharadita. Pica la pulpa del tomate en trozos grandes.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande con un puño bien apretado.\r\ntapa de ajuste. Agrega el ajo, la chalota y la guindilla,\r\nluego fríalos durante 2-3 minutos hasta que se ablanden.\r\nVierta el vino y agregue los tomates,\r\npasta, azúcar y condimentos (mejillones\r\nson naturalmente salados así que tenga cuidado con el\r\nsal). Revuelva bien y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos.","Vierta los mejillones y revuélvalos.\r\nCubra bien y cocine al vapor durante 3-4 minutos.\r\nagitando la sartén a mitad de cocción, hasta que\r\nlas conchas se han abierto.","Deseche los caparazones que queden cerrados y luego\r\ndividir los mejillones en dos tazones y\r\nagrega las hojas de albahaca. Proporcione un tazón grande para\r\nlas conchas vacías."]','2026-01-11 13:00:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14027,7779,'es','Pollo mediterráneo con verduras asadas','Un plato saludable, lleno de sabores de sol','["250 g de patatas tiernas, cortadas en rodajas finas","1 calabacín grande, cortado en rodajas diagonales","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos","1 pimiento amarillo, sin semillas y cortado en trozos","6 tomates pera firmes, cortados por la mitad","12 aceitunas negras, sin hueso","2 filetes de pechuga de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, de aproximadamente 150 g/5 oz cada uno","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada colmada de pesto verde"]','["Precalentar el horno a 200C/\r\nHorno a gas 6/ventilador 180C.\r\nExtender las patatas,\r\ncalabacín, cebolla, pimiento\r\ny tomates en un recipiente poco profundo\r\nlata para asar y\r\nesparcir sobre las aceitunas.\r\nSazone con sal y\r\nnegro molido grueso\r\npimienta.","Corta la carne de cada uno.\r\npechuga de pollo 3-4 veces\r\nusando un cuchillo afilado, luego\r\ncoloque el pollo encima\r\nlas verduras.","Mezclar el aceite de oliva y el pesto.\r\njuntos hasta que estén bien mezclados\r\ny vierta uniformemente sobre el\r\npollo. Cubrir la lata con\r\npapel de aluminio y cocine por 30\r\nminutos.","Retire el papel de aluminio del\r\nestaño. Regresar al horno y\r\ncocinar por 10 más\r\nminutos hasta que\r\nlas verduras son jugosas y\r\nparece tentador para comer y el\r\nel pollo está bien cocido\r\n(El jugo debe salir claro al pincharlo con una brocheta)."]','2026-01-11 13:00:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14028,5061,'es','Pimientos rellenos de calabacín y quinoa','Tome solo 5 ingredientes y cree este saludable horneado vegetariano al estilo mediterráneo para una cena baja en calorías y grasas.','["4 pimientos rojos","1 calabacín, cortado en cuartos a lo largo y en rodajas finas","2 paquetes de 250 g de quinua lista para comer","85 g de queso feta, finamente desmenuzado","un puñado de perejil, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nCorta cada pimiento por la mitad a través del\r\ntallo y quitar las semillas. Pon el\r\npimientos, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, en una bandeja para hornear,\r\nrocíe con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva y sazone\r\nbueno. Ase durante 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, caliente 1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva en\r\nen una sartén pequeña, añadir el calabacín\r\ny cocine hasta que esté suave. Quitar del\r\ncalentar, luego revolver con la quinua,\r\nqueso feta y perejil. Sazone con pimienta.","Divida la mezcla de quinua entre\r\nlas mitades de pimiento, luego regrese a la\r\nHornee durante 5 minutos para que se caliente. servir\r\ncon ensalada verde, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:00:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14029,7781,'es','Pescado envuelto en panceta con patatas al limón','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Envuelva pescado blanco sustentable en tocino crujiente y sírvalo como una bandeja horneada todo en uno con papas.','["300 g de patatas nuevas","100 g de judías verdes","un puñado pequeño de aceitunas negras kalamata","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 filetes de abadejo en trozos u otro pescado blanco sostenible","4 rebanadas de panceta o tocino ahumado en rodajas finas","algunas ramitas de estragón, hojas recogidas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nColoque las patatas en una cacerola con agua y\r\nhervir durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Añade el\r\nfrijoles durante los últimos 2-3 minutos. Escurrir bien\r\ny cortar las patatas por la mitad. Inclínate hacia\r\nuna fuente para hornear espaciosa y mezcle con\r\naceitunas, ralladura de limón y aceite. Sazone bien.","Sazona el pescado y envuélvelo con el\r\npanceta o tocino. Colocar encima de\r\nlas patatas. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que\r\nbien cocido, luego agregue un chorrito\r\nde jugo de limón y espolvorear con\r\nestragón antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14030,7783,'es','Chuletas de cordero a las hierbas con verduras asadas','Una saludable bandeja horneada al estilo mediterráneo con batata, pimientos, calabacines y cebolla picada','["2 pimientos, de cualquier color, sin semillas y cortados en trozos grandes","1 batata grande, pelada y cortada en trozos grandes","2 calabacines, cortados en trozos","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","8 chuletas magras de cordero","1 cucharada de hoja de tomillo, picada","2 cucharadas de hojas de menta, picadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Poner\r\nlos pimientos, la batata, los calabacines\r\ny cebolla en una bandeja para hornear grande y\r\nrocíe sobre el aceite. Sazone con mucha\r\npimienta negra molida. Ase durante 25 minutos.","Mientras tanto, recorte el cordero\r\nlo más gordo posible. Mezclar las hierbas con unas cuantas\r\ngiros de pimienta negra molida y palmaditas\r\npor todo el cordero.","Sacar las verduras del horno,\r\nvoltéelo y empújelo hacia un lado del\r\nbandeja. Coloca las chuletas en la bandeja caliente.\r\ny regresar al horno por 10 min.","Voltee las chuletas y cocine por un tiempo más.\r\n10 mins o hasta que las verduras y el cordero\r\nestán tiernos y ligeramente carbonizados. Mezclar\r\ntodo en la bandeja y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14031,7785,'es','Tostadas de habas y queso feta','Corta una baguette, tuesta y luego úsala como base de bruschetta para frijoles y queso griego salado para un bocado saludable.','["350 g de habas, frescas o congeladas","100 g de queso feta (o alternativa vegetariana), escurrido","2 cucharadas de hojas de menta picadas o ralladas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","Bolsa de 50 g de hojas de ensalada mixta","10 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","4 rebanadas finas de baguette (blancas o marrones)"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola pequeña con agua.\r\nAñade las judías, vuelve a hervir y\r\ncocine por 4 minutos. Escurrir en un colador\r\nbajo agua corriente hasta que esté frío. prensa\r\nRetire cada frijol de su piel y colóquelo en un bol.","Desmenuzar sobre el queso feta y esparcir.\r\nsobre las hojas de menta. Sazone con un\r\nbien molido de pimienta negra y rociado\r\ncon 2 cucharaditas de aceite. Mezcle.","Mezcle las hojas de ensalada y los tomates.\r\ncon el resto del aceite de oliva y el limón\r\njugo. Dividir en 2 platos. Brindis\r\nel pan bajo la parrilla o en una tostadora\r\nhasta que estén dorados y crujientes por ambos lados.\r\nPara servir, vierta los frijoles y el queso.\r\nmezcla sobre las tostadas calientes y coloca\r\njunto a la ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:00:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14032,7787,'es','Pimientos rellenos fáciles','Una cena de quince minutos que no te dejará lleno','["4 pimientos rojos","2 bolsas de 250 g de arroz con tomate cocido (nosotros utilizamos tomate mediterráneo Tilda Rizazz)","2 cucharadas de pesto","un puñado de aceitunas negras sin hueso, picadas","200 g de queso de cabra, en rodajas"]','["Utilice un cuchillo pequeño para cortar la parte superior\r\nlos pimientos, luego saque las semillas. Siéntate\r\npimientos en un plato, con el lado cortado hacia arriba y cocine\r\nen el microondas a temperatura alta durante 5-6 minutos hasta que\r\nse han marchitado y ablandado.","Mientras se cocinan los pimientos, mezcle los\r\narroz junto con el pesto y las aceitunas y\r\ndos tercios del queso. Coloque el arroz en\r\nlos pimientos, cubra con el resto de la cabra\r\nqueso y continuar cocinando durante 8-10 minutos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14033,7789,'es','Rebanadas mediterráneas','Mantenga los pimientos asados ​​en rodajas, el hojaldre y las alcachofas en el congelador y nunca más se quedará sin un entrante inteligente.','["Paquete de 375 g de hojaldre ya enrollado","4 cucharadas de pesto verde","140 g de pimientos asados ​​en rodajas congelados","140 g de alcachofas congeladas (unas 3 gajos por ración)","125 g de mozzarella en bolas o 85 g de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.  \r\nDesenrolla la masa y córtala en 4 rectángulos. \r\nTome un cuchillo afilado y marque un borde de 1 cm. \r\ndentro de cada rectángulo, cuidando que \r\nno cortes toda la masa. \r\nColóquelo en una bandeja para hornear.","Unte 1 cucharada de pesto en cada rebanada, \r\npermanecer dentro de la frontera, luego acumular el \r\npimientos y alcachofas. Cocer en el horno durante \r\n15 minutos hasta que la masa empiece a dorarse.","Corta la bola de mozzarella en trozos pequeños, \r\nluego espárcelo (o usa queso cheddar, si lo prefieres) \r\nsobre las verduras. Regresar al horno por 5-7 minutos. \r\nhasta que la masa esté crujiente y el queso \r\nderretido. Servir con una ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 13:00:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14034,7790,'es','bollos mediterráneos','Nuevos sabores en un viejo favorito: ideal para tomar café por la mañana o una merienda','["350 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","¼ cucharadita de sal","50 g de mantequilla cortada en trozos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","8 mitades de tomates italianos secos, picados en trozos grandes","100 g de queso feta, en cubitos","10 aceitunas negras, deshuesadas y partidas por la mitad","300 ml de leche entera","1 huevo, batido, para glasear"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. Untar con mantequilla una bandeja para hornear grande. En un tazón grande, mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear y la sal. Frote la mantequilla con el aceite hasta que la mezcla parezca migajas finas, luego agregue los tomates, el queso y las aceitunas. Hacer un hueco en el centro, verter la leche y mezclar con un cuchillo, con movimientos cortantes, hasta obtener una masa blanda y pegajosa. (Use toda la leche; ayuda a darle una textura ligera). No manipule demasiado la masa.","Enharínate bien las manos y la superficie de trabajo y dale forma redonda a la masa, de unos 3-4 cm de grosor. Córtelo en ocho gajos y colóquelos bien separados en la bandeja para hornear. Pincelar con huevo batido y hornear durante 15-20 minutos hasta que suba, esté dorado y elástico al tacto. Transfiera a una rejilla y cubra con un paño de cocina limpio para mantenerlos suaves. Es mejor servirlos calientes y untados con mantequilla. Se conservará durante 2-3 días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 13:00:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14035,7792,'es','Ensalada mediterránea de higos y mozzarella','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Si desea que esto sea más sustancioso, puede acompañarlo con un poco de prosciutto o jamón serrano.','["200 g de judías verdes finas, peladas","6 higos pequeños, en cuartos","1 chalota, en rodajas finas","1 bola de 125 g de mozzarella, escurrida y cortada en trozos","50 g de avellanas tostadas y picadas","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca, rasgadas","3 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","1 cucharada de mermelada o condimento de higos","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["En una cacerola grande con agua con sal,\r\nBlanquear los frijoles durante 2-3 minutos. Escurrir, enjuagar\r\nen agua fría y luego escurrir sobre papel de cocina.\r\nDisponer en un plato. Cubra con los higos,\r\nchalotas, mozzarella, avellanas y albahaca.","En un tazón pequeño o tarro de mermelada con tapa ajustada,\r\nañadir el vinagre, la mermelada de higos, el aceite de oliva y\r\nalgún condimento. Agitar bien y verter\r\nsobre ensalada justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14036,7794,'es','Pimientos asados ​​con tomate y anchoas','Este vibrante plato tiene todos los sabores del Mediterráneo para cenar en casa durante las fiestas.','["4 pimientos rojos, cortados por la mitad y sin semillas","Lata de 50g de anchoas en aceite escurridas","8 tomates pequeños, cortados por la mitad","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","2 ramitas de romero","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nPon los pimientos en una fuente para hornear grande.\r\nplato, mezclar con un poco del aceite del\r\nlata de anchoas y luego voltéela con el lado cortado hacia arriba. asado\r\ndurante 40 minutos, hasta que esté suave pero no colapsado.","Cortar 8 anchoas a lo largo de su\r\nlongitud. Poner 2 mitades de tomate, varias\r\nrodajas de ajo, unas ramitas de romero\r\ny dos trozos de anchoa en el hueco\r\nde cada pimiento. Rocíe sobre el aceite de oliva,\r\nLuego ase nuevamente durante 30 minutos hasta que\r\nlos tomates están suaves y los pimientos\r\nlleno de charcos de jugo sabroso. dejar enfriar\r\ny servir tibio o a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14037,7796,'es','Pasta horneada de elote (maíz callejero mexicano)','Pruebe esta versión de pasta horneada, inspirada en los sabores del elote favorito de la comida callejera mexicana: mazorcas de maíz carbonizadas cubiertas con mayonesa, queso, hierbas y chiles.','["50 g de mantequilla salada","1 cucharadita de mostaza en polvo","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","20 g de harina común","350ml de leche entera","175 g de queso cheddar suave rallado","100 g de crema agria","25 g de jalapeños encurtidos, finamente picados","250 g de pasta (nosotros usamos espirales)","Morrisons 2 mazorcas de maíz dulce","2 cebolletas, finamente cortadas","125 g de mozzarella rallada"]','["Derrita 20 g de mantequilla en una sartén grande a fuego medio y, una vez que esté espumosa, agregue la mostaza en polvo y las especias y tueste durante 30 segundos. Espolvorea la harina y cocina durante 2 minutos, revolviendo continuamente. Vierte lentamente la leche, revolviendo continuamente hasta obtener una salsa suave. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego a fuego lento y burbujear hasta que espese un poco.","Retire del fuego y agregue el queso cheddar y la crema agria hasta que el queso se derrita y todo esté incorporado. Agrega los jalapeños y sazona bien con sal y pimienta. Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego escúrrala bien.","Mientras tanto, derrita los 30 g restantes de mantequilla en una sartén aparte a fuego medio y, una vez que esté espumoso, cocine el maíz dulce durante 5-6 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia hasta que esté dorado y carbonizado. Vierta la mayor parte del maíz dulce en la salsa de queso junto con la pasta cocida y las cebolletas. Mezclar bien y sazonar al gusto.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Vierta la pasta en una fuente para horno grande y espolvoree sobre la mozzarella y el maíz dulce carbonizado restante. Deslícelo debajo de la parrilla durante 5 a 6 minutos, o hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante. Deje reposar durante 10 minutos y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:00:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14038,7798,'es','Flan','Prepare este flan cremoso y delicioso inspirado en la receta clásica mexicana: es fácil de preparar y se puede preparar con un día de anticipación.','["120 g de azúcar en polvo","5 huevos medianos, a temperatura ambiente","½-1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","Lata de 397g de leche condensada.","400ml de leche evaporada","150ml de leche entera"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Vierta el azúcar en polvo en una cacerola grande junto con 2 cucharadas de agua y cocine a fuego alto sin revolver hasta que el azúcar comience a disolverse. Una vez que el azúcar haya comenzado a disolverse, puedes agitar la sartén de vez en cuando hasta obtener un caramelo dorado y de color uniforme, aproximadamente 5 minutos. (Es fundamental que el azúcar se disuelva por completo para lograrlo). Tan pronto como la mezcla se haya convertido en caramelo, viértala en un molde para flan de 20 cm (no debe ser un molde con fondo suelto), inclinando el molde hacia adelante y hacia atrás para cubrir completamente la base. Dejar enfriar.","Batir los huevos y la vainilla en un tazón grande, luego agregar vigorosamente las leches condensada, evaporada y entera hasta que estén bien combinadas. Vierta la natilla en el molde y cúbrala con papel de aluminio, sellando bien en el borde. Coloque el molde en una bandeja para hornear de lados altos (de unos 5 cm de profundidad) y vierta agua hirviendo del hervidor en la bandeja hasta que llegue aproximadamente a la mitad del costado del molde. Transfiera la bandeja al horno y hornee por 50 minutos.","Retire con cuidado la lata de la bandeja y retire el papel de aluminio. Coloque el molde sobre una superficie de trabajo y déjelo enfriar durante unos 30 minutos. Una vez que esté tibio, cubra y enfríe durante al menos 6 horas o toda la noche.","Cuando esté listo para servir, pase un cuchillo para cubiertos por el borde de la lata, luego coloque un plato grande para servir (use un plato con borde, ya que el caramelo se acabará) sobre la lata e inviértalo rápidamente. Cortar en gajos para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14039,7800,'es','Pasilla mole','Prepara una de las recetas más emblemáticas de México, el mole, una salsa hecha con chiles, especias y chocolate amargo. Úselo como aderezo para enchiladas y carne.','["4 chiles pasilla secos, sin semillas ni tallos","3 chiles guajillos secos, sin semillas ni tallos","2 tomates medianos","1 cebolla, en cuartos","1 pera, partida por la mitad pero sin corazón","2 dientes de ajo","40 g de semillas de sésamo","60 g de maní blanqueados","5 g de canela en rama","3 dientes","½ cucharadita de orégano","½ cucharadita de cilantro","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","10 granos de pimienta negra","3 cucharadas de manteca de cerdo o aceite de girasol","300-400 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","45 g de chocolate negro"]','["Enciende la parrilla a fuego alto. Coloque los chiles secos en una bandeja y cocine a la parrilla para que se quemen durante 1 minuto por cada lado. Transfiérelos a una jarra o bol y cúbrelos con agua caliente para que se rehidraten durante 10 minutos.","Poner los tomates, la cebolla, la pera y el ajo en una bandeja y ponerlos bajo el grill para que se ennegrezcan durante unos 10 minutos, volteando los tomates hasta la mitad. Esto puede llevar más o menos tiempo, dependiendo de tu parrilla, así que vigílalas. Sácalos y resérvalos.","Mientras se carbonizan las verduras, tuesta las semillas de sésamo y el maní en una sartén seca a fuego medio. Retirar de la sartén y reservar.","En la misma sartén, agrega todas las especias y tuesta por 1 min. Retíralas del fuego y reserva con las nueces.","Pon los chiles remojados (reservando el líquido), las verduras carbonizadas, la pera, las nueces y las especias en una licuadora de alta velocidad agregando unos 200 ml del agua de los chiles y licua hasta que quede muy suave.","En una olla grande de hierro fundido o en una sartén con tapa, derrita la manteca de cerdo o el aceite de girasol a fuego alto. Vierte el mole y fríe por 3 minutos, revolviendo continuamente. Añadimos unos 100ml de caldo de verduras y bajamos el fuego, dejando cocer a fuego lento unos minutos.","Agrega el puré de tomate, el chocolate y ½ cucharada de sal marina, mezcla para combinar todo bien. Añade un poco más de caldo (50-100 ml) y mezcla. Cuece el mole durante 1 hora, incorporando caldo de verduras de vez en cuando para evitar que se queme o se seque. Quieres que tenga la consistencia de una pasta suelta. El mole estará listo cuando aparezca una capa de aceite en la superficie. Sirva sobre carne con arroz o úselo para cubrir enchiladas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14040,7802,'es','enchiladas de carne','Sirva enchiladas para un banquete familiar de inspiración mexicana. Rellenos con carne picada y frijoles negros y cubiertos con queso derretido, son un deleite para el público garantizado.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva o de colza","1 cebolla, finamente picada","400 g de carne picada","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados o finamente rallados","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","½-1 cucharadita de chile en polvo (opcional)","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400g de frijoles negros","1 cubito de caldo de verduras o pollo","8 tortillas medianas","100 g de queso cheddar maduro rallado","hojas de cilantro, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén o cacerola grande a fuego medio-bajo y fríe la cebolla durante 6-8 minutos hasta que esté blanda pero no dorada. Vierta la carne picada y continúe friendo hasta que la carne se dore, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Agregue el ajo y cocine durante 1-2 minutos antes de agregar el orégano, el comino, el pimentón y el chile en polvo, si lo usa. Cocine por 1 min más.","Agrega el puré de tomate, los tomates y los frijoles negros, incluyendo el líquido de la lata de frijoles. Desmenuzar en la pastilla de caldo. Revuelva bien, luego agregue media lata de agua y cocine a fuego lento. Cocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos hasta que la salsa espese. Retirar del fuego.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta un octavo de la mezcla de carne en el centro de una de las tortillas, luego doble los lados hacia adentro para encerrar el relleno. Coloque la costura hacia abajo en una fuente grande para horno y repita hasta que se hayan usado todo el relleno y las tortillas, colocando las enchiladas una al lado de la otra cómodamente. Esparce el queso por encima y hornea durante 15-20 minutos hasta que el queso se derrita y las tortillas estén doradas. Esparce las hojas de cilantro para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14041,7804,'es','Chicken tinga tacos','Prueba un platillo clásico mexicano; un delicioso guiso de pollo deshebrado con un toque de chipotle. Se puede comer encima de tostadas de maíz o en tacos.','["3 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel (unos 650 g)","3 tomates pera cortados por la mitad (unos 300 g)","1 cebolla, cortada por la mitad","3 dientes de ajo machacados","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2-3 chiles chipotles en adobo, picados","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","12 tortillas tostadas de maíz de 12 cm","cebollas rojas en escabeche (ver receta a continuación)","200 g de queso fresco o queso feta, desmenuzado","un puñado de hojas de cilantro","4 limas, cortadas en gajos"]','["Pon el pollo en una cacerola mediana, añade los tomates, una de las mitades de cebolla, el ajo, 1 cucharadita de sal y 500 ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición a fuego alto, luego bajar el fuego a fuego lento. Coloque la tapa y cocine durante 15-20 minutos hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Apagar el fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.","Corta la cebolla restante en rodajas finas. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-bajo y fríe las rodajas de cebolla hasta que estén traslúcidas y ligeramente doradas, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Mientras tanto, desmenuza el pollo cocido con dos tenedores o con las manos, reservando el caldo y las verduras cocidas. Dejar de lado.","Coloque los tomates cocidos, la cebolla guisada y el ajo en una licuadora con los chiles chipotles y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Mezclar la salsa, 150ml del caldo de pollo reservado y el orégano seco en la sartén con las cebollas fritas. Mezcle bien y reduzca el fuego a bajo, cubra la sartén y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, para que los sabores se mezclen. Agregue el pollo desmenuzado para que se caliente, alrededor de 1 a 2 minutos. Retire la sartén del fuego y déjela enfriar un poco, unos 3-5 minutos. Sirva la tinga de pollo sobre tortillas calientes o tostadas de maíz o espolvoree sobre sus aderezos favoritos (usamos queso feta desmenuzado, cebollas moradas encurtidas y cilantro). Sirva las rodajas de lima a un lado para exprimirlas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14042,3760,'es','Ensalada de tacos con tomate y frijoles negros','Disfrute de esta refrescante ensalada de tacos en una tarde cálida cuando se le antoje algo rápido, fresco y crujiente, o como acompañamiento para un festín al estilo mexicano.','["1 lima, exprimida","12 g de cilantro, finamente picado","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 chile jalapeño (sin semillas si prefieres menos picante), finamente picado","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","200 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","1 lechuga romana, picada","Lata de 198 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","1 pimiento rojo, finamente picado","4 tacos crujientes","25 g de semillas de calabaza"]','["Combine el jugo de lima, el cilantro, el comino, el jalapeño y el aceite en un bol. Sazone bien.","Agregue los frijoles, los tomates, la lechuga, el maíz y el pimiento rojo. Mezcle para combinar. Desmenuce las tortillas para tacos y mezcle para cubrir todo con el aderezo. Esparce las semillas de calabaza y sirve inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14043,7806,'es','Pimientos rellenos al estilo mexicano','Rellene los pimientos con arroz y frijoles negros, luego cubra con queso con chile y guacamole fresco para una comida familiar vegetariana fácil. Si a los niños no les gustan las especias, utilice un queso suave.','["3 pimientos grandes mixtos, cortados por la mitad","aceite, para rociar","2 bolsas de 250 g de arroz con lima y cilantro, cocido","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","6 rebanadas de queso con chile estilo mexicano (use cheddar normal o monterey jack, si lo desea)","150 g de guacamole fresco"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Retire las semillas y la médula blanca de los pimientos y colóquelos, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, en una fuente para asar. Rocíe con aceite y sazone, luego hornee por 20 minutos.","Combine el arroz y los frijoles. Retira los pimientos del horno y rellena con la mezcla de arroz. Cubra cada uno con una rebanada de queso y hornee durante 10 a 15 minutos más, hasta que el arroz se derrita y el relleno esté caliente. Cubra con cucharadas de guacamole."]','2026-01-11 13:00:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14044,5655,'es','Tazón de taco de carne picante','Obtenga los cinco de sus cinco al día en este taco de carne picante de inspiración mexicana. Lleno de texturas y sabores, se puede preparar parcialmente con anticipación.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 pimiento rojo grande, sin semillas y finamente picado","500 g de carne picada de ternera al 5 % de grasa","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","Lata de 200g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","20 g de cilantro, tallos picados, hojas reservadas","2 cebollas moradas, en rodajas finas","2 limas, exprimidas","2 bolsas de 250 g de arroz basmati integral cocido en microondas","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros escurridos","200 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","Lata de 198 g de maíz dulce (sin sal ni azúcar)","2 aguacates pequeños, rebanados"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y sofreír el pimiento durante 5 minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Agrega la carne, la pasta de chipotle y las especias y cocina, revolviendo, para descomponer la carne durante unos minutos. Agregue los tomates, el puré de tomate, los tallos de cilantro, 150 ml de agua y un poco de condimento, luego cubra. Deje hervir a fuego lento durante 20 minutos para que se cocine bien y se reduzca un poco. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días o congelado hasta por tres meses. Descongelar bien y recalentar hasta que esté bien caliente.","Mientras tanto, mezcle las cebollas con el jugo de limón en un tazón y reserve para encurtir.","Cuando la carne picada esté lista, calienta el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Vierta el arroz cocido en cuatro tazones para servir, luego agregue la carne y cubra cada uno con una cuarta parte de los frijoles negros, los tomates cherry y el maíz, medio aguacate (separe las rodajas, si lo desea) y las hojas de cilantro. Coloque encima las cebollas encurtidas junto con el jugo de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14045,3868,'es','chocolate caliente mexicano','Asegúrese de agregar un acabado espumoso a este chocolate caliente mexicano, cálido y condimentado con canela, vainilla y chile.','["500ml de leche entera","2 ramas de canela (use ramas de canela mexicana para obtener un sabor más dulce y claramente floral), y más para servir","2 cucharadas de cacao oscuro en polvo (ver consejo a continuación)","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","¼ cucharadita de chile en polvo","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno"]','["Vierta la leche en una cacerola mediana, agregue las ramitas de canela y revuelva frecuentemente a fuego medio (no deje que hierva) hasta que la leche esté fragante, aproximadamente 5 minutos.","Retire y deseche las ramas de canela, luego agregue el cacao, la vainilla, la guindilla en polvo y el azúcar. Retire del fuego y bata hasta que la mezcla esté suave y espumosa; esto solo tomará un par de minutos. Divida en dos tazas y decore con ramas de canela frescas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14046,4311,'es','Wraps de enchilada de pollo','Utilice panes planos integrales caseros en lugar de tortillas compradas en esta receta, perfectas para envolver nuestro pollo magro y picante. También cuenta como 3 de tus 5 al día','["90 g de harina integral, más un poco más para espolvorear","3 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","120g de yogur biológico","2 cucharaditas de chile suave en polvo","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","1 lima, rallada y medio exprimida","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel, en rodajas (300 g)","1 aguacate pequeño","15 g de cilantro fresco picado"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón pequeño. Mezclar 1 cucharadita de aceite con 60 ml de agua, añadir a la harina y remover con la hoja de un cuchillo hasta que la mezcla empiece a unirse. Use sus manos para formar una bola con la mezcla, luego córtela por la mitad y cúbrala con un paño de cocina.","Mezcle 2 cucharadas de yogur con el chile en polvo, el ajo y la ralladura de lima, luego agregue la cebolla, el pimiento y el pollo y revuelva bien para cubrir. Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio, agrega la mezcla de pollo y cocina, revolviendo de vez en cuando, durante unos 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, enharina ligeramente la superficie de trabajo y calienta una sartén antiadherente muy grande a fuego medio, pero sin añadir aceite. Extienda una de las bolas de masa hasta formar un círculo aproximado de unos 25 cm de ancho hasta que quede fina como el papel, luego retire con cuidado la superficie de trabajo y colóquela en la sartén. La masa se cocinará en un minuto, luego se dará vuelta y se cocinará por unos segundos más. Levantar sobre un plato y cocinar la otra bola de masa de la misma forma.","Triture el aguacate con el jugo de limón y extiéndalo sobre los panes planos, cubra con la mezcla de pollo y el yogur restante y esparza sobre el cilantro. Enrolla las enchiladas y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:00:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14047,6215,'es','Burritos de arroz picantes','Los wraps integrales caseros rellenos de arroz con tomate picante y aguacate son el aperitivo perfecto','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza, más 2 cucharaditas","2 cebollas (320 g), finamente picadas","150 g de arroz basmati integral","2-3 cucharaditas de chile suave en polvo","1 cucharadita de cilantro y comino molidos","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros escurridos","180 g de harina integral de espelta, más un poco para espolvorear y un poco para espolvorear","2 aguacates","1 lima, exprimida","4 hojas grandes de lechuga iceberg (unos 120 g)","Lata de 198 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","Yogurt bio bote 120g","15 g de cilantro, finamente picado","12 aceitunas Kalamata, partidas por la mitad"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén antiadherente, agrega las cebollas y cocina durante 10 minutos a fuego medio. Agregue el arroz y las especias, agregue los tomates con una lata de agua y el puré de tomate, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 25 minutos. Agregue los frijoles, retire la tapa, vuelva a hervir a fuego lento y cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos más hasta que el arroz esté tierno. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, vierta la harina en un tazón pequeño. Mezcle las 2 cucharaditas de aceite con 115 ml de agua fría, luego con la harina y revuelva con la hoja de un cuchillo hasta que la mezcla comience a formar una masa suave. Use sus manos para formar una bola con la mezcla, luego corte en cuartos y cubra con un paño de cocina mientras espera que el arroz se cocine y se enfríe.","Enharina ligeramente la superficie de trabajo y calienta una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio, pero no agregues aceite. Extienda una de las bolas de masa hasta formar un círculo fino de unos 25 cm. Retire con cuidado la superficie de trabajo y colóquela en la sartén. La masa se cocinará en un minuto, luego se dará vuelta y se cocinará por unos segundos más. Levante sobre un plato y cocine el resto de la masa de la misma manera. Cubre las envolturas hasta que las necesites.","Triture los aguacates con el jugo de lima. Coloque las hojas enteras de lechuga sobre los wraps, luego agregue una capa de arroz, espolvoree con maíz dulce y luego cubra con aguacate, yogur, cilantro y aceitunas. Enrolle con cuidado formando burritos. Envuelva dos de los burritos en papel para hornear y guárdelos en el refrigerador durante la noche. Se mantendrán fríos hasta por un día. Si los coloca en una lonchera, use una bolsa de hielo para mantenerlos frescos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14048,5359,'es','Pollo desmenuzado y chile con frijoles negros','Prepare una tanda de pollo desmenuzado y chile con frijoles negros de inspiración mexicana, que se puede duplicar fácilmente y guardar en el congelador. Sirva con arroz o tortillas.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 cebollas, rebanadas","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharada de orégano","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","3 cucharadas de chipotle en adobo o 1 cucharadita de pasta de chipotle","350 g de puré","1⁄2 trago o cubito de caldo de pollo","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos pero sin enjuagar","1⁄2 lima, en jugo","arroz cocido o tortillas, cilantro, queso feta, rodajas de limón y cebolla morada picada, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola poco profunda con tapa. Vierta las cebollas y cocine a fuego medio-bajo durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el pollo y sube el fuego a medio. Agrega el ajo, una pizca de azúcar, el orégano, las semillas de comino y un poco de condimento. Cocina por un par de minutos, luego agrega el chipotle y cocina por unos minutos más. Vierta la passata, 100 ml de agua y agregue el caldo. Sazone y lleve a fuego lento.","Cubra con una tapa y cocine durante 40-50 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que el pollo esté tierno. Triture el pollo en la salsa con dos tenedores y luego revuelva con los frijoles. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos más, luego apague el fuego. Exprima el jugo de lima. Puede conservarse refrigerado durante tres días y congelado hasta dos meses. Descongelar bien y recalentar. Sirva con arroz o tortillas y, si lo desea, un poco de cilantro, queso feta, rodajas de lima y cebolla morada como acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 13:00:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14049,7808,'es','Enchiladas de rollo de repollo','Aumente el sabor con estas enchiladas de carne picantes más ligeras. Deliciosas y sin gluten, están hechas con hojas de col en lugar de las habituales tortillas.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva o de colza","2 pimientos, sin semillas y finamente picados","500 g de carne picada de 5 % de grasa","2 cucharadas de pimentón ahumado, más un poco más para servir","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","400 g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de caldo de verduras en polvo (asegúrese de que no contenga gluten si es necesario)","3 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado, más extra para servir","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, sin escurrir","1 repollo grande, con las hojas peladas (necesitarás 12 hojas)","150g de yogur biológico","25 g de queso cheddar maduro finamente rallado","un puñado de cilantro picado y gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente honda y sofreír los pimientos brevemente hasta que se ablanden. Agrega la carne y continúa friendo, partiéndola con una cuchara de madera hasta que se dore, luego agrega las especias y cocina por 1 minuto más. Agregue los tomates, el puré de tomate, el caldo, el polvo, el ajo, el chile y los frijoles (junto con el líquido de las latas) y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 15 minutos, revolviendo hasta que la carne esté cocida y la mezcla espesa.","Mientras tanto, hierva una cacerola grande con agua. Agrega las hojas de col y cocina sumergidas durante 2 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Enjuague con agua corriente fría para enfriar. Drenar.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Trabajando con una hoja de col a la vez, vierte un poco de la mezcla de carne en el centro. Enrollar para que quede cerrado el relleno. Colóquelo con la costura hacia abajo en una fuente para hornear grande y poco profunda. Repita con el resto de las hojas y el relleno, colocando los panecillos uno contra el otro en el plato.","Mezclar el yogur y el queso. Distribuir sobre los panecillos. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que burbujee. Espolvorea sobre el cilantro, más chile y pimentón. Sirva con rodajas de lima a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:00:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14050,6535,'es','Pastel de tamal de pan de maíz','Prueba este chile de inspiración mexicana con cobertura de pan de maíz. Requiere un poco de esfuerzo, pero se puede congelar para los días en los que necesites una cena reconfortante y rápida.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o maní","900 g de carne picada","200 g de chorizo ​​para cocinar, picado","2 cebollas, picadas en trozos grandes","2 pimientos rojos, partidos por la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas","2 chiles, sin semillas y finamente picados","3 dientes de ajo rallados","1 cucharada de comino","½ cucharadita de canela molida","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros escurridos","500 ml de caldo de ternera o pollo","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 cucharaditas de azúcar blanda morena oscura","½ lima, en jugo","10 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","1-2 cucharaditas de salsa picante de búfalo u otra salsa picante, al gusto","150 g de harina de maíz o polenta","130 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","3 chiles verdes, cortados por la mitad, sin semillas y finamente cortados","3 cebolletas, cortadas y picadas","3 cucharadas de cilantro finamente picado","155ml de leche","45 g de mantequilla, derretida y enfriada","2 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos","100 g de maíz dulce","115 g de queso cheddar extra maduro, rallado","2 aguacates maduros, deshuesados, pelados, partidos por la mitad y picados","1 lima, exprimida","15 g de cilantro, hojas recogidas","crema agria o yogur griego"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cazuela a fuego medio-alto y fríe la carne picada hasta que se dore por completo; es posible que tengas que hacerlo en tandas. Transfiera la carne picada dorada a un bol con una espumadera. Añade el chorizo ​​a la sartén y dóralo todo durante unos minutos, luego agrégalo al bol con la carne picada.","Agrega las cebollas y los pimientos a la sartén y sofríe a fuego medio hasta que las cebollas estén doradas y los pimientos suaves, unos 15 minutos. Agrega los chiles, el ajo, el comino y la canela y cocina por un par de minutos más.","Regrese la carne y el chorizo ​​a la sartén, luego agregue los tomates enlatados, los frijoles negros escurridos, el caldo y el puré de tomate. Lleve a punto de ebullición y luego reduzca el fuego a fuego lento. Agrega el azúcar, el jugo de lima y un poco de condimento. Cubra ligeramente, dejando solo una pequeña abertura en un lado para que escape el vapor, y cocine durante 50 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. En los últimos 10 minutos de cocción, agregue el cilantro, la salsa picante y un poco más de condimento. El chile debe estar espeso pero no seco; si está demasiado seco, rocíelo con un poco de agua. Vierta en un molde para pastel de aproximadamente 1,5 litros o en una fuente para hornear honda. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Para hacer la cobertura del pan de maíz, mezcle la harina de maíz o polenta, la harina, una pizca grande de sal, el azúcar, los chiles, las cebolletas y el cilantro. Mezclar la leche, la mantequilla y los huevos en una jarra. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos sobre los secos, luego agregue el maíz dulce y el queso. Revuelva hasta que esté combinado, teniendo cuidado de no mezclar demasiado, luego vierta cucharadas sobre la superficie del chile. En esta etapa, el pastel se puede congelar. Primero déjelo enfriar por completo, luego envuélvalo en una capa de papel para hornear y luego en una doble capa de papel de aluminio. Se mantendrá en el congelador hasta por dos meses.","Hornee durante 25 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el pan de maíz (con cuidado de no atravesar el chile) salga limpio. Para hornear congelado, caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Desenvuelva el pastel y hornee durante 1 hora-1 hora 10 minutos, o hasta que el relleno esté bien caliente y la cobertura esté bien cocida. Si la parte superior comienza a oscurecerse demasiado, cúbrala con papel de aluminio.","Cuando esté casi listo para servir, coloque el aguacate en un tazón, exprímalo sobre el jugo de limón, luego agregue las hojas de cilantro y mezcle suavemente. Sirva junto con el pastel con un poco de crema agria o yogur griego, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14051,7810,'es','Brochetas de fajita halloumi BBQ','¿Te encantan las fajitas? Estas versiones de halloumi a la parrilla serán las ganadoras. Cocinar el queso, los pimientos y las cebollas en la barbacoa le da un sabor ahumado.','["3 pimientos (de cualquier color), cortados en gajos","2 cebollas moradas grandes, cortadas en gajos","2 bloques de halloumi de 250 g, partidos por la mitad y luego cortados en cuartos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 aguacates maduros, partidos por la mitad y sin hueso","1 lima grande, exprimida","8 tortillas suaves","manojo pequeño de cilantro, hojas recogidas","120 g de crema agria","salsa de chile chipotle, para servir (opcional)","1 ½ cucharada de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","½ cucharadita de ajo en polvo","4 brochetas metálicas"]','["Combine todos los ingredientes para la mezcla de especias. Enciende la barbacoa y espera hasta que las brasas estén cenicientas.","Ponga los pimientos, las cebollas y el halloumi en un bol, rocíe con aceite, espolvoree sobre la mezcla de especias y sazone con sal y pimienta. Mezcle suavemente para cubrir las verduras y el queso, teniendo cuidado de no romper el halloumi. Pase los pimientos, las cebollas y el queso alternativamente en las brochetas.","Coloca la pulpa del aguacate en un bol junto con el jugo de lima y una pizca de sal. Triture todo con un tenedor y reserve hasta que esté listo para comer.","Cocina las brochetas en la barbacoa durante 5-8 minutos por cada lado (esto dependerá del calor de la barbacoa). Los pimientos, las cebollas y el halloumi deben estar suaves y carbonizados en algunas partes. Mientras tanto, caliente las tortillas en la barbacoa y luego envuélvalas en un paño de cocina limpio para mantenerlas calientes.","Sirva las brochetas junto con las tortillas, el aguacate machacado, el cilantro y la crema agria, y un poco de salsa de chile chipotle, si lo desea, luego deje que todos preparen sus propias fajitas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14052,7812,'es','Chili con carne de pollo','¿No te gustan mucho las carnes rojas? Prueba nuestra versión de pollo del chili con carne, con toda la riqueza del plato clásico. Es la cena perfecta en el sofá en las noches frías.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, rebanada","2 pimientos mixtos, en rodajas (use pimientos rojos, amarillos o naranjas)","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","1 manojo pequeño de cilantro, con los tallos finamente picados y las hojas picadas en trozos grandes","½ cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharada de comino molido","1-2 cucharaditas de pasta de chipotle","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","300 ml de caldo de pollo","1 rama pequeña de canela","4 muslos de pollo, con hueso","Lata de 400g de frijoles negros","Lata de 400 g de frijoles rojos, escurridos","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","20 g de chocolate negro (al menos 70% de cacao)","arroz cocido o chips de tortilla","guacamole y crema agria (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cazuela a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla y los pimientos durante 10-12 minutos, o hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el ajo, los tallos de cilantro, el cilantro molido, el comino y la pasta de chipotle y fríe por 2 minutos más. Vierta los tomates, el puré de tomate y el caldo, luego agregue la ramita de canela. Coloque los muslos de pollo en la mezcla, luego reduzca el fuego a bajo y cocine a fuego lento, tapado, durante 45 minutos o hasta que el pollo esté tierno. Retire el pollo de la cacerola y transfiéralo a una tabla de cortar, luego desmenuce la carne del hueso con dos tenedores.","Regrese el pollo desmenuzado a la sartén, luego agregue los frijoles negros junto con el líquido de la lata, los frijoles escurridos, el vinagre y el chocolate. Revuelva bien para combinar todos los ingredientes y derretir el chocolate, luego suba el fuego a medio y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 10 a 15 minutos, o hasta que la mezcla se espese un poco.","Retire la ramita de canela, sazone al gusto y revuelva con la mayoría o todas las hojas de cilantro (puede reservar algunas hojas para esparcirlas al final, si lo desea). Sirva el chile con arroz o totopos, cubierto con guacamole y crema agria, si lo usa, y espolvoree sobre el cilantro restante."]','2026-01-11 13:00:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14053,7814,'es','Chile con carne ahumado','Agregue chipotle y dore primero la carne picada para obtener un chili con carne fuera de este mundo. Con toneladas de sabor, esta pronto se convertirá en tu receta favorita de chile...','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","400 g de carne picada","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharada de vinagre de sidra","1-2 cucharaditas de pasta de chipotle","1 cucharada de pasta de tomate","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","¼ cucharadita de extracto de levadura","1 cubito de caldo de res","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros o rojos.","arroz cocido","crema agria","jalapeños rebanados de un frasco, escurridos","un puñado de hojas de cilantro","1 cebolla pequeña, picada"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola o cacerola poco profunda a fuego medio, luego fríe la carne durante unos 10 minutos hasta que se suelte la grasa y la carne comience a dorarse. Añade la cebolla y sofríe durante otros 8-10 minutos hasta que se ablanden y empiecen a dorarse ligeramente. Agrega el ajo y revuelve por un minuto más.","Agregue las semillas de comino, el cilantro molido, el orégano y un buen molido de pimienta negra, y continúe friendo la mezcla durante unos minutos hasta que esté fragante. Agrega el vinagre, luego las pastas de chipotle y tomate, y revuelve todo. Vierta los tomates y una lata de agua, luego agregue el extracto de levadura y desmenuce en la pastilla de caldo. Revuelva bien y lleve la mezcla a fuego lento. Cocine durante 20 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Cuando el chile se haya espesado, vierta los frijoles y la mitad del líquido de la lata. Cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos más, pruebe el condimento, luego sirva con arroz y cubra con la crema agria, los jalapeños, las hojas de cilantro y la cebolla."]','2026-01-11 13:00:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14054,7816,'es','Tacos crujientes de pollo y piña','Disfrute de una ronda de tacos de pollo crujientes y picantes el viernes por la noche con una picante salsa de piña y chile.','["6 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y con piel","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2½ cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 cucharadas de mayonesa","100 ml de crema agria","½ cucharada de pasta de chipotle","1 aguacate grande y maduro","1 lima, exprimida","8 tortillas de harina pequeñas","½ piña mediana","½ cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","manojo pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 lima, exprimida"]','["Retire la piel del pollo y déjela a un lado. Corta el pollo en tiras. Echa en un bol el pimentón, el cilantro molido, 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y una buena pizca de sal. Tapar y dejar marinar durante al menos 1 hora o hasta 24 horas.","Para la salsa, corte la piña a lo largo, corte el corazón y luego corte la pulpa en cubos pequeños. Mezcle en un bol con la cebolla morada, la guindilla, el cilantro y el jugo de lima.","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén antiadherente. Sazona la piel del pollo con sal y fríe a fuego alto durante 3-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté dorada y crujiente. Reservar en un plato forrado con papel de cocina. Vierta el pollo marinado en la sartén y fríalo a fuego medio-alto durante 10-12 minutos, dándole vuelta a la mitad.","Mezcle la mayonesa, la crema agria y la pasta de chipotle en un tazón. Triture el aguacate con el jugo de lima y un poco de condimento en otro bol.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y calienta las tortillas en una bandeja para horno durante 5-7 minutos, o en el microondas durante 1-2 minutos. Deje que cada uno llene el suyo con crema agria picante, aguacate, pollo, salsa y piel de pollo desmenuzada."]','2026-01-11 13:00:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14055,7818,'es','Tacos de carne desmenuzada con barbacoa','Invite a familiares y amigos con estos sabrosos tacos de carne desmenuzada marinados en una salsa picante con chipotle, jugo de limón y ajo. Es un gran plato para compartir.','["100 ml de vinagre de sidra","2 limas, exprimidas","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","6 dientes de ajo machacados","pizca de clavo molido","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","2 hojas de laurel, desmenuzadas","1 cucharadita de azúcar moreno suave","1 kg de pierna de ternera deshuesada, cortada en trozos grandes","300 ml de caldo de carne","6 tacos blandos grandes o 12 pequeños","un puñado pequeño de cilantro picado","cebolla morada encurtida, rábanos en rodajas o queso feta desmenuzado"]','["Vierta el vinagre y el jugo de lima en un tazón grande (debe poder contener toda la carne). Agrega la pasta de chipotle, el ajo, las especias, las hierbas, el azúcar y un poco de condimento. Agregue la carne, asegurándose de que esté bien cubierta, luego cubra y déjela marinar durante 1 a 2 horas, o enfríe durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Poner la carne en un plato, luego verter la marinada en una cacerola apta para horno, junto con los trozos que se hayan pegado al bol. Vierta el caldo y deje hervir a fuego lento. Agregue la carne y cocine a fuego lento durante 1 minuto, luego cubra y cocine en el horno durante 2 horas.","Si la carne no está lo suficientemente tierna para desmenuzar, cocine por 15 minutos más y luego verifique nuevamente. Déjelo hasta que esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, luego levántelo sobre una tabla con una espumadera. Llevar la salsa a ebullición y reducir a unos 300 ml. Mientras tanto, desmenuce la carne en trozos grandes, desechando la grasa o el cartílago. Vuelva a agregar la salsa para recalentar, luego sirva en la cacerola con los tacos, el cilantro y los aderezos a un lado para que todos se sirvan ellos mismos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14056,6237,'es','fajitas halloumi','Pruebe estas tortillas de halloumi con aguacate para una comida fácil y rápida después de la escuela. Servir con salsa picante o crema agria.','["2 bloques de 225 g de halloumi ligero.","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","2 pimientos mixtos, rebanados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 lima, exprimida","8 tortillas pequeñas o 4 grandes (use maíz o harina)","1 aguacate, sin hueso, pelado y rebanado","un puñado pequeño de hojas de cilantro","salsa de chile o crema agria, para servir (opcional)"]','["Divida cada bloque de halloumi por la mitad a lo largo (deben tener una costura natural). Corta cada mitad en cuatro tiras. Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y fríe las tiras de halloumi durante unos minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas. Transfiera a un plato y reserve.","Calienta el aceite restante en la sartén a fuego alto y fríe la cebolla y los pimientos durante 5 minutos hasta que estén suaves y empiecen a carbonizarse. Agrega el ajo, el pimentón y el cilantro con un poco de condimento y cocina por 1 min más. Vierta el jugo de lima y el halloumi frito y revuelva muy suavemente para que el halloumi no se rompa. Se mantendrá a temperatura ambiente durante unas horas. Vuelve a calentar a fuego lento con un poco de agua.","Calienta los wraps en horno bajo envueltos en papel de aluminio. Alternativamente, caliéntelos de dos en dos durante 10 segundos en el microondas (sin envolverlos en papel de aluminio) o sosteniéndolos directamente sobre una llama de gas con unas pinzas (esto le dará sabrosos bordes carbonizados).","Apila el relleno de halloumi en los wraps calientes, con unas rodajas de aguacate cada una, algunas hojas de cilantro y cucharadas de salsa picante o crema agria, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14057,7820,'es','Vegan fajitas','Haz una versión vegana de fajitas con todos los sabores del clásico platillo mexicano. Es un excelente plato para compartir donde todos pueden servirse.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 pimientos rojos o amarillos, cortados en tiras","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo o hojuelas de chile","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 lima, exprimida","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, enjuagados y escurridos","cilantro en manojo pequeño, finamente picado","4 tortillas grandes o 8-12 pequeñas","1 aguacate, en rodajas","yogur sin lácteos, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén y fríe los pimientos y las cebollas a fuego medio alto hasta que estén tiernos y empiecen a dorarse, unos 6-8 minutos. Agrega el ajo y las especias y sofríe durante 1 minuto más hasta que estén fragantes. Agrega la mitad del jugo de lima y sazona. Transfiera a un plato para servir y manténgalo caliente mientras calienta los frijoles.","Vierta los frijoles negros en la misma sartén y agregue el jugo de lima restante. Sazone bien y revuelva hasta que esté bien caliente y cubierto con las especias restantes de la sartén. Agrega la mayor parte del cilantro.","Calienta las tortillas en el microondas o envueltas en papel de aluminio a fuego lento, luego cúbrelas con un paño de cocina para mantenerlas calientes. Sirva los wraps con pimientos, frijoles, aguacate, yogur sin lácteos, cilantro extra y rodajas de lima extra para exprimir, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14058,7822,'es','Tacos de cerdo desmenuzado con salsa de piña','Pon la carne de cerdo para estos tacos de cerdo desmenuzado en la olla de cocción lenta por la mañana y tendrás un festín familiar para la cena. Servir con repollo, aguacate y salsa.','["1½ kg de paleta de cerdo deshuesada, sin piel y cortada en 6 trozos","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","1 naranja, en jugo","2 limas, exprimidas","Lata de 432 g de piña, solo jugo (guarde los trozos para la salsa, a continuación)","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","rallado de nuez moscada fresca","Lata de 432 g de piña, escurrida","½ cebolla morada, finamente picada","un puñado de cilantro picado","1 lima, exprimida","1 chile rojo, picado (opcional)","8-10 tacos o wraps","½ col lombarda, finamente rallada","1 aguacate, en rodajas","100 ml de nata agria (opcional)"]','["Coloque la carne de cerdo en una fuente grande para horno con tapa con los ingredientes restantes y mezcle bien para cubrir. Si puede, enfríe y deje marinar durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1. Tapar el recipiente y cocinar en el estante del medio durante 4 horas. Verifique después de 2 horas y vierta sobre los jugos. Compruebe que la carne esté tierna separándola con dos tenedores. Si se resiste, cocina 1-2 horas más.","Mezcla los ingredientes para la salsa en un bowl y calienta los tacos. Desmenuzar la carne de cerdo y quitarle la grasa o los tendones. Sirva con repollo, aguacate, crema agria y salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:00:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14059,6245,'es','Tortilla de camote, espinacas y queso feta','Prepare esta tortilla la noche anterior para un almuerzo tipo picnic rápido y fácil para la familia. Con batata, espinacas y queso feta, está lleno de sabor.','["3 batatas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","100 g de espinacas tiernas","6 huevos grandes","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Perfora las patatas unas cuantas veces por cada lado. Cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 5 a 8 minutos hasta que esté suave, luego déjelo enfriar un poco.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén refractaria de 20 cm y deja que las espinacas se ablanden durante uno o dos minutos (es posible que tengas que hacerlo en tandas). Corta cada papa por la mitad a lo largo y usa una cuchara para sacar la pulpa, manteniéndola en trozos grandes. Batir los huevos.","Agregue la batata a la sartén y revuelva para combinar con las espinacas; no la rompa demasiado. Vierta el huevo y gírelo para llenar los huecos en la sartén. Esparza sobre el queso feta y cocine durante 4-5 minutos a fuego lento hasta que el fondo y los lados estén firmes.","Colóquelo debajo de la parrilla durante 1 a 2 minutos para cocinar la parte superior; introduzca un cuchillo en el centro para asegurarse de que esté bien cocido. Déjelo enfriar antes de cortarlo en gajos. Se mantendrá frío hasta por un día."]','2026-01-11 13:00:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14060,7824,'es','Buñuelos de maíz dulce con bacalao al chipotle','Prepare unos buñuelos de maíz dulce para disfrutar con bacalao en una salsa de tomate picante para una comida rápida entre semana. Está listo en sólo 20 minutos.','["3 huevos grandes","2 cucharadas de harina común","lata de 200g de maíz dulce","3 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","200 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","1-2 cucharadas de salsa de chile chipotle","1 lima, rallada y en jugo","2 filetes de bacalao sin piel","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro picado"]','["Batir los huevos y la harina hasta que quede suave. Agregue el maíz, la cebolleta y un poco de condimento.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén antiadherente mediana. Vierte la masa y fríe a fuego medio durante 3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén y cocina el ajo y los tomates durante 5 minutos. Agrega el chipotle, el jugo y la ralladura de lima.","Mientras tanto, cocine el pescado en una bandeja para hornear debajo de la parrilla, ajuste a fuego medio-alto y cocine durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado.","Corta el buñuelo de maíz en cuatro y divídelo en dos platos. Espolvorea sobre el cilantro y sirve con el pescado y los tomates chipotles."]','2026-01-11 13:00:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14061,7826,'es','Chuletas de cordero marinadas a la barbacoa','Frote las chuletas de cordero con esta marinada tradicional del norte de México hecha con chile ancho, ajo y chile chipotle. La marinada le da al cordero un delicioso sabor.','["2 chiles anchos secos","1 chile chipotle seco","6 dientes de ajo","1⁄2 cebolla","100 ml de aceite de oliva","8 chuletas de cordero","microhierbas, para decorar"]','["El día anterior, retira las semillas y el tallo de los chiles ancho y chipotle. Poner con la piel hacia abajo en una sartén seca a fuego medio, volteando hasta que se ablanden y se tuesten sin quemarse.","En la misma sartén, cocina el ajo y la cebolla a fuego medio hasta que estén ligeramente ennegrecidos por todos lados. Una vez enfriado, colocar en una licuadora con los chiles, el aceite de oliva y una pizca de sal. Batir hasta obtener una pasta.","Frote las chuletas de cordero con la marinada al menos 12 horas antes de cocinarlas, preferiblemente durante la noche, y guárdelas en el frigorífico. Retíralos al menos una hora antes de cocinarlos para que alcancen la temperatura ambiente.","Calienta una sartén o plancha a fuego medio. Cocine las chuletas de cordero hasta que la grasa se dore y comience a derretirse (alrededor de 7 minutos), luego cocine el otro lado durante al menos 5 minutos más; esto necesitará al menos dos tandas, dependiendo del tamaño de su sartén. Nos gusta servirlos rosados, espolvoreados con sal marina y hierbas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14062,7828,'es','guacamole clasico','Disfrute de un guacamole de inspiración mexicana del chef Edson Díaz-Fuentes, con jalapeños verdes, cilantro y lima. Es perfecto para servir con totopos.','["1⁄4 cebolla morada","2 tomates maduros","unas ramitas de cilantro","2 green jalapeños","2 aguacates maduros, cortados a la mitad","1 lima, exprimida","chips de tortilla, para servir"]','["Pica finamente la cebolla morada, los tomates, el cilantro y los jalapeños por separado. Mezclar la cebolla, los tomates, el cilantro y una pizca de sal. Deja los jalapeños a un lado.","Saque toda la pulpa del aguacate en un bol y tritúrela con un tenedor, dejándola en trozos; no se debe hacer puré. Agregue la mezcla de jugo de limón y cebolla, combinando suavemente.","Agregue jalapeños al gusto y más sal marina si es necesario. Servir con los totopos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14063,7830,'es','Cóctel de mariscos mexicano','Prepara este entrante clásico de la costa del Pacífico de México. Aquí se utilizan gambas y vieiras, pero cualquier marisco o pescado funcionará bien.','["300 g de gambas cocidas","200g de vieiras crudas (puedes cocinarlas si lo prefieres)","20 g de salsa de tomate","1 cucharadita de salsa Tabasco (agrega más si quieres)","1 cucharadita de salsa inglesa","50 ml de jugo de tomate","25 ml de jugo de lima","50ml de jugo de naranja","1 aguacate maduro, cortado en cubitos","unas ramitas de cilantro picadas","berro de cilantro o micro cilantro (opcional)","tortillas de maíz o galletas saladas"]','["Pelar todas las gambas y picar las vieiras crudas. Mezcle el ketchup, la salsa Tabasco, la salsa inglesa, el jugo de tomate, el jugo de lima y el jugo de naranja en un tazón. Sazone, agregando más Tabasco si lo prefiere picante. Incorpora los mariscos y algunos cubos de aguacate, teniendo cuidado de mezclarlos suavemente para que no queden blandos.","Vierta en tazones o vasos y agregue un poco de cilantro picado. Sirva con un poco de berro de cilantro encima, si lo usa, y tortillas de maíz o galletas saladas para sacar."]','2026-01-11 13:00:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14064,7834,'es','Papas fritas veganas con chile y frijoles','Invite a familiares y amigos con papas fritas cargadas de inspiración mexicana. Este plato a base de plantas es ideal para recibir invitados, ya sea para una noche de cine o una fiesta.','["400 g de patatas fritas congeladas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla finamente picada","1 ripe avocado","½ lima, en jugo, más gajos para servir","½ cebolla morada pequeña finamente picada","1 tomate finamente picado","1 diente de ajo machacado","½ cucharada de pasta de chipotle","½ cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","Lata de 400 g de frijoles mixtos, escurridos","½ lata de 400 g de tomates picados","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro picado","2 cucharadas de crema fresca sin lácteos","2 cucharadas de cebolla frita crujiente"]','["Cocine las papas fritas siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite de oliva en una sartén y sofreír la cebolla durante 10 minutos. Prepare el guacamole triturando el aguacate y mezclando con el jugo de lima, la cebolla morada y el tomate picado.","Agrega el ajo, la pasta de chipotle, el comino molido y el cilantro molido a las cebollas, que deben quedar blandas y traslúcidas. Freír durante 1 minuto, luego verter los frijoles mezclados y los tomates picados. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, luego agregue la mayor parte del cilantro y sazone. Coloque las papas fritas en un tazón y cubra con el chile con frijoles, el guacamole, la crema fresca y las cebollas fritas crujientes. Esparza el cilantro restante y sirva con rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14065,7836,'es','Tacos ahumados de berenjena desmenuzada y frijoles negros','Estos veraniegos tacos vegetarianos están rellenos con berenjena ahumada y carbonizada y ragú de frijoles negros, cubiertos con cremoso queso feta y crujientes cebollas rosadas en escabeche. También contienen cuatro de tus 5 al día: ¡bonificación!','["2 berenjenas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 hoja de laurel","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cebolla morada, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","400 g de tomates frescos, picados","una pizca de orégano o tomillo seco","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","pizca de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino tinto","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, 1 escurrida y enjuagada","½ lima, en jugo, más gajos para servir","8 tortillas pequeñas, calentadas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, con las hojas recogidas","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","½ lechuga iceberg, rallada","cebollas rosadas en escabeche, para servir (ver consejo a continuación)"]','["Pinche las berenjenas por todas partes con un tenedor, luego colóquelas a fuego medio (o sobre las brasas de una barbacoa o debajo de la parrilla) y cocine, volteándolas ocasionalmente con unas pinzas, hasta que se ennegrezcan y colapsen, aproximadamente de 20 a 25 minutos. Pasar a un plato y dejar enfriar. Pele la piel de las berenjenas enfriadas o saque la pulpa con una cuchara. Intente quitar la mayor parte de la piel, pero no se preocupe si quedan algunas motas.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calentar el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande apta para horno con la hoja de laurel y las semillas de comino. Cuando empiecen a chisporrotear, añade la cebolla y el ajo. Freír durante unos 5 minutos hasta que esté fragante pero no coloreado, luego agregue el puré de tomate y cocínelo durante un par de minutos.","Agrega los tomates y el orégano seco y cocina unos minutos más hasta que se derrumben en la salsa. Agregue la pulpa de berenjena, el chile en polvo, las hojuelas de chile y el vinagre, y cocine, revolviendo, durante 1 minuto, luego vierta las latas de frijoles negros, una escurrida y la otra todavía con su líquido. Exprima un poco de jugo de limón y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que se reduzca y burbujee, luego transfiéralo al horno y ase durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que esté profundo, oscuro y completamente reducido.","Sazone con más jugo de limón, si lo desea, y vierta la mezcla de berenjena en las tortillas calientes con el cilantro, el queso feta desmenuzado, la lechuga y las cebollas rosadas encurtidas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14066,7838,'es','Tres leches cake','Hornee un clásico pastel de tres leches mexicano para disfrutar de un capricho por la tarde o un café por la mañana; recibe su nombre de los tres tipos de leche que se utilizan.','["aceite sin sabor, para la lata","4 huevos, separados","200 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100ml de leche","Lata de 410g de leche evaporada","200ml de leche condensada azucarada","300ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas","pizca de canela"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Engrasar ligeramente y forrar la base y los lados de un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 cm.","Pon las claras en un bol grande con una pizca de sal. Batir con un batidor eléctrico hasta que esté espumoso, aproximadamente 3 minutos. Sigue mezclando mientras añades 150 g de azúcar, una cucharada a la vez, hasta que quede espeso y brillante.","En otro tazón, mezcle las yemas de huevo, el azúcar restante y la vainilla (no es necesario limpiar los batidores primero) durante 2 minutos, o hasta que estén pálidos y espumosos. Agrega la harina, la levadura en polvo y la leche a las yemas de huevo y usa una espátula para mezclar todo.","Agregue una cucharada grande de clara de huevo a la mezcla para pastel, bata para aflojar la mezcla, luego incorpore suavemente las claras de huevo restantes con una cuchara de metal grande (teniendo cuidado de no revolver demasiado para no perder demasiado aire), hasta obtener una masa suave.","Vierta en el molde, alise la parte superior y hornee durante 40-45 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro, éste salga limpio. Mezclar la leche evaporada, la leche condensada y 3 cucharadas de crema.","Deje que el pastel se enfríe durante 10 minutos en el molde, luego pase un cuchillo por los lados. Haz agujeros en la superficie con una brocheta y luego vierte sobre la mitad de la mezcla de leche. Después de aproximadamente 5 minutos, la mayor parte debería haberse empapado en el pastel. Dejar reposar otros 5 minutos, luego transferir a un plato y verter sobre un poco de la leche restante hasta que empiece a gotear un poco. (La leche sobrante que no se absorba en el pastel se puede servir a un lado). Dejar enfriar.","Batir la nata restante y el azúcar glas hasta obtener picos suaves. Untar la nata sobre el bizcocho y espolvorear con un poco de canela. Se puede preparar y enfriar con un día de anticipación. Sirva en cuadritos con la leche de remojo restante."]','2026-01-11 13:00:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14067,7840,'es','Tacos de atún curados con especias','Utilice el pescado más fresco posible en estos tacos. En lugar de atún, puedes usar salmón fresco o ahumado, vieiras en rodajas, carne de cangrejo blanco encurtida o langostinos cocidos picados.','["400 g de atún fresco pescado con sedal","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 limas, ralladas, 1 en jugo","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","1 cucharada de semillas de cilantro","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","3 aguacates maduros, deshuesados ​​y pelados","3 cucharadas de hojas de cilantro","1 cucharada de licor de pepinillos de los chiles jalapeños encurtidos","8 tacos pequeños de harina blanda","aceite vegetal, para cepillar y rociar","chiles jalapeños encurtidos","50 g de semillas de granada","1 manojo de cilantro, picado, dejando algunas hojas enteras","4 cebolletas ralladas","2 limas, cortadas en gajos"]','["Cortar el atún en tiras de 1 cm y luego cortarlo en cubos de 1 cm. Rocíe con aceite de oliva y esparza sobre la ralladura de lima, revuelva y reserve en el frigorífico durante unos 20 minutos. Tuesta suavemente el comino y el cilantro en una sartén pequeña, luego vierte en un mortero con una pizca de sal y las hojuelas de chile y tritúralo hasta obtener un polvo grueso. Agrega la mezcla de especias al atún con el jugo de limón y vuelve a colocar el recipiente en el refrigerador durante al menos 10 minutos o hasta 1 hora.","Para hacer el puré de aguacate, poner todos los ingredientes en un procesador de alimentos con una pizca de sal y triturar hasta obtener un puré suave, añadiendo un poco de aceite si está demasiado espeso para triturar. Vierta la mezcla en un recipiente.","Si te gustan los tacos crujientes, calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4, úntalos con un poco de aceite, colócalos en una bandeja para horno y cocina durante 10-15 minutos. Para preparar cada taco, vierta un poco de puré de aguacate y extiéndalo hasta el borde. Vierta el atún especiado y espolvoree sobre los chiles, las semillas de granada, el cilantro y las cebolletas, rocíe con más aceite y agregue una rodajita de lima al plato. Cómelo con las manos, si está blando, o con cuchillo y tenedor si está crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:00:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14068,7842,'es','Tacos ahumados de cerdo y frijoles negros','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Chile de cerdo mexicano con sabor ahumado a parrilla, servido en tortillas crujientes con aguacate maduro.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","½ cebolla morada, picada","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado y comino molido","Paquete de 500 g de carne magra de cerdo picada","300ml en puré","5 cucharadas de salsa barbacoa","Lata de 400 g de frijol negro escurrido","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","8 tacos","1 aguacate maduro, pelado y rebanado","½ lechuga iceberg, finamente rallada","crema agria, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, agrega la cebolla y cocina por 5 minutos hasta que se ablande. Espolvoree las especias y cocine por 1 min más. Agregue la carne picada, partiéndola con el dorso de una cuchara de madera y revuelva hasta que esté bien cocida.","Agrega la passata y la salsa barbacoa a la sartén junto con 4 cucharadas de agua. Aumente el fuego y deje que la salsa burbujee y reduzca hasta que se adhiera a la carne. Agregue los frijoles, sazone y cocine por 2 minutos más, luego agregue el cilantro. Calienta los tacos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Use la mezcla de carne de cerdo y frijoles para rellenar los tacos, cubra con rodajas de aguacate, lechuga iceberg rallada y una cucharada de crema agria, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14069,7844,'es','Cerdo desmenuzado con salsa mexicana de mole y almendras','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Popular en la cocina mexicana, el mole es una salsa espesa con sabores complejos. Excelente comida para fiestas de autoservicio','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","750 g de paleta de cerdo desmenuzada y cortada en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate","200 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","tiras de ralladura y jugo 1 naranja","1 rama de canela","2 ramitas de tomillo","2 cebollas, cortadas en trozos","2 dientes de ajo","Paquete de 250g de tomate cherry","2-3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 paquetes de tortillas de maíz de 335 g","50 g de almendra laminada","50 g de pasas","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido y comino","1-2 cucharaditas de pasta de chipotle","25 g de chocolate natural, finamente picado","200 g de rábano, recortado y en rodajas finas","2 aguacates, picados","jugo 2 limones","manojo de cilantro, solo las hojas","1-2 chiles verdes, finamente picados"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cazuela. Dorar la carne de cerdo durante unos 10 minutos hasta que esté completamente dorada, agregar el puré de tomate y cocinar durante 1 minuto. Vierta sobre el caldo de pollo, luego agregue las tiras de ralladura y jugo de naranja, la canela y el tomillo. Llevar a ebullición, reducir el fuego, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 1½ horas.","Mientras tanto, haz la salsa. Calienta una sartén antiadherente y fríe en seco las cebollas y los dientes de ajo enteros durante unos 5 minutos, volteándolos con frecuencia hasta que se ablanden y estén ligeramente carbonizados. Vierta en una licuadora. Agrega los tomates a la sartén. Cocine durante 3 minutos hasta que comience a formar ampollas y carbonizarse, luego viértalo en la licuadora. Agrega 1 cucharada de aceite a la sartén. Fríe 1 de las tortillas durante 1 min por cada lado hasta que estén doradas. Cortar en pedazos y verter en la licuadora. Añadiendo más aceite si es necesario, sofreír las almendras durante 3 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Agrega a la licuadora. Finalmente agregue las pasas, el cilantro y el comino a la sartén y cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que las pasas estén espesas. Agrégalos a la licuadora junto con la pasta de chipotle y el chocolate finamente picado. Batir hasta que se forme una pasta áspera.","Con una espumadera, retire la carne de la sartén y colóquela en una tabla, déjela enfriar un poco y luego use tenedores o los dedos para desmenuzarla. Retire la canela, la ralladura de naranja y las ramitas de tomillo de la sartén y deséchelas. Vierta un poco del líquido de cocción en la licuadora y luego mezcle con cuidado con la salsa de mole. Vierta la salsa en la sartén con el resto de los jugos de cocción del cerdo. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos, luego devuelva la carne de cerdo desmenuzada a la sartén y cocine por 20 minutos más. Sazone al gusto. Se puede preparar hasta este punto con hasta 2 días de antelación y conservar en el frigorífico o congelar hasta por 3 meses.","Justo antes de servir, calienta las tortillas en el microondas durante 1 minuto para calentarlas. Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la salsa y sazone bien. Coloca todo sobre la mesa. Para servir, vierta un poco de mole de cerdo sobre una tortilla, cubra con un poco de salsa, luego enrolle y coma."]','2026-01-11 13:00:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14070,7846,'es','Lomo de cerdo con salsa chipotle y cebolla morada encurtida','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. La mejor comida del viernes por la noche, estos wraps con sabor ahumado traerán el sabor de México a tu mesa.','["2 cebollas moradas, una gruesa y otra finamente cortada","jugo 2 limones","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","8 dientes de ajo gordos, sin pelar","6 tomates pera medianos, cortados por la mitad","2 cucharadas de pasta de chipotle (usamos Discovery, disponible en Waitrose)","2 cucharadas de chile en polvo","3 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","2 lomos de cerdo de unos 500 g cada uno","ramitas de cilantro y tortillas suaves y calientes (harina o maíz), para servir"]','["Coloca la cebolla en rodajas finas en un bol con el jugo de 1 lima, la mitad del orégano y una pizca de sal y una pizca de pimienta. Dejar de lado.","Fríe el ajo entero en una sartén antiadherente hasta que esté ennegrecido por ambos lados, aproximadamente 8 minutos, luego pélalo. Calienta la parrilla. Coloque la cebolla en rodajas gruesas en una bandeja para hornear con los tomates, con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Sazone y ase hasta que se ennegrezca, aproximadamente 8 minutos. Vierta en un tazón con el ajo, la pasta de chipotle, 1 cucharadita de chile en polvo, 1 cucharada de azúcar y el jugo de limón restante. Sazone y bata en una licuadora hasta que quede suave. Calentar suavemente en una sartén.","Frote la carne de cerdo con el resto del chile en polvo, el orégano, el azúcar y los condimentos. Ase durante 5 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté cocido. Sirva en rodajas en tortillas calientes con un poco de salsa, las cebollas encurtidas y el cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:00:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14071,7848,'es','olla de cena mexicana','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Ayude a sus hijos a aprender a cocinar con esta sencilla y sabrosa comida en una sola olla: sírvala con chips de tortilla para una comida práctica.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o vegetal","1 cebolla, picada","450 g de carne picada de cerdo (o pavo)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","3 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 sobres de 250 g de arroz mexicano ya cocido (ver consejo)","un puñado de perejil fresco, picado en trozos grandes","chips de tortilla simples, para servir"]','["Caliente el aceite en una cacerola mediana hasta que esté caliente, agregue la cebolla y déjela chisporrotear y dorarse (4-5 minutos) mientras revuelve ocasionalmente. Agrega la carne picada y cocina hasta que ya no esté rosada, revolviendo para desmenuzarla y raspando el fondo de la sartén para que no se pegue. Si es así, añade un chorrito de aceite.","Vierta los tomates en la carne picada, luego llene la lata con agua y vierta esto. Agregue el puré de tomate, revuelva bien y deje que hierva. Cocine a fuego lento, tapado, durante 25 minutos para cocinar bien la carne picada.","Agrega el arroz de ambos paquetes y deja que se caliente suavemente, luego agrega el perejil. Sirva con totopos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14072,7850,'es','Filete mexicano con frijoles refritos caseros','Todos los sabores de un buen chili con carne de res en una fracción de tiempo, cocínalo en una sartén o en la barbacoa.','["2 filetes pequeños de solomillo o lomo, o 1 grande","2 cucharaditas de aceite de girasol","1 cucharadita de pasta de chipotle (nosotros usamos Discovery)","aproximadamente 2 pimientos rojos asados ​​enteros de un frasco, cortados en cuartos","1 aguacate maduro pequeño, deshuesado y cortado en cubitos","1 lima, cortada en gajos","algunas ramitas de cilantro, hojas recogidas","unas cucharadas de crema agria","1 cebolla, picada","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o vegetal","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","½ cucharadita de pimentón picante, más una pizca extra (opcional)","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharaditas de pasta de chipotle, azúcar moreno y vinagre de vino (rojo o blanco)","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","Lata de 400 g de judías pintas o rojas, escurridas y enjuagadas"]','["Pon los filetes en un plato y frótalos todos.\r\ncubrir con el aceite, la pasta de chipotle y ½ cucharadita\r\npimienta negra recién molida. dejar en la habitación\r\ntemperatura mientras comienzas a preparar los frijoles.","Para los frijoles, ablanda la cebolla en la\r\naceite en una sartén. Una vez ablandado, revuelva\r\nen las especias durante 2 minutos, seguido de\r\nel puré de tomate, el chipotle, el azúcar y\r\nvinagre. Vierta todos los frijoles con 1 cucharadita.\r\nsal, un poco de pimienta y media lata de\r\nagua. Burbujee suavemente hasta que el agua esté\r\ncasi evaporado.","Calentar una plancha o sartén antiadherente (o\r\nuna barbacoa). Sazone los filetes con sal.\r\nFreír, con los pimientos al lado, durante unos\r\n2 minutos por cada lado, hasta que los filetes estén\r\nse cocina a tu gusto y los pimientos se\r\ncarbonizado. Levante los filetes y colóquelos en un plato limpio.\r\nreposar unos minutos mientras machacas\r\ndos tercios de los frijoles. Revuelva todo\r\nfrijoles y comprobar la sazón.","Cortar los filetes. Extender un buen montón de\r\nfrijoles en 2 platos y cubra con rodajas\r\nbistec y pimientos. Agrega el aguacate, un\r\nun chorrito grande de jugo de lima, un poco de cilantro\r\nhojas, una buena cucharada de crema agria\r\ny una pizca más de pimentón, si queréis."]','2026-01-11 13:00:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14073,7852,'es','Tacos de salmón a la parrilla con yogur de lima chipotle','Asa pescado saludable con chipotle y luego sírvelo con ensalada de repollo, cilantro y chile en tortillas suaves.','["1 cucharadita de sal de ajo","2 cucharadas de pimentón ahumado","buena pizca de azúcar","500 g de filetes de salmón","200 ml de yogur sin grasa","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle o salsa de chile picante","jugo 1 lima","8 tortillas pequeñas de harina suaves, calientes","¼ de repollo verde pequeño, finamente rallado","cilantro en manojo pequeño, cortado en ramitas","unos chiles jalapeños encurtidos, rebanados","gajos de lima, para servir","salsa de chile picante para servir (opcional)"]','["Frote el ajo, sal, pimentón, azúcar.\r\ny un poco de condimento en la carne\r\ndel filete de salmón. Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto.","Mezclar el yogurt, la pasta de chipotle o caliente\r\nsalsa y jugo de limón juntos en un tazón\r\ncon un poco de condimento y reservar.\r\nColoca el salmón en una bandeja para horno forrada\r\ncon papel de aluminio y parrilla, con la piel hacia abajo, para\r\n7-8 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido. Quitar\r\nde la parrilla y pelar con cuidado\r\ny desechar la piel.","Desmenuzar el salmón en trozos grandes y\r\nservir con las tortillas calientes, chipotle\r\nyogur, repollo rallado, cilantro,\r\njalapeños y rodajas de lima. Agrega un batido\r\nde salsa picante, si te gusta picante."]','2026-01-11 13:00:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14074,7854,'es','Fajitas de pollo con aguacate y aderezo César','Una cena familiar divertida, ligera y saludable en la que los niños también pueden participar','["4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel","1 lima pequeña","2 dientes de ajo","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo (opcional)","1 pimiento rojo grande","15 g de cilantro fresco","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 corazón de lechuga romana","2 ripe avocados","8 tortillas de harina","aderezo césar"]','["Cortar el pollo en una tabla.\r\ncon un cuchillo afilado, luego coloque un\r\ntazón grande. Rallar la ralladura de lima\r\ny exprime el jugo. aplastar\r\nel ajo, luego agregar al pollo\r\ncon cilantro molido, guindilla\r\npolvo (si se usa) y condimento\r\nal gusto. Revuelva bien, cubra y luego enfríe.\r\nhasta que esté listo para cocinar. tu podrías hacer\r\nesto la noche anterior.","Sobre una tabla de cortar limpia,\r\ny con un cuchillo limpio cortar el\r\nel aguacate en cuartos. Facilitar el\r\ncuartos de distancia de la piedra,\r\nluego retire la piel. Rebanar o\r\npicar la carne. Cortar finamente el\r\nlechuga. Cortar el pimiento por la mitad, retirar\r\nsemillas y tallo, luego rebanar o picar\r\nla carne.","Picar el cilantro fresco y luego revolver.\r\nen el pollo. Calentar el aceite en\r\nun wok o una sartén grande. Añadir\r\nel pimiento, luego revuelva, continuamente,\r\na fuego alto durante 2 minutos. esto es\r\nllamado salteado. Agrega el pollo,\r\nluego sofreír a fuego alto durante\r\n5 minutos hasta que el pollo esté cocido.","Calienta una sartén grande y seca.\r\nhasta que esté caliente, luego agrega las tortillas una\r\na la vez para calentar y dorar un poco.\r\nDarles la vuelta con unas pinzas para que\r\nambos lados se calientan.","Toma una tortilla caliente y\r\nuntar con un poco de César\r\nvestirse. Agrega un poco de lechuga\r\ny aguacate, luego un poco de\r\nmezcla de pollo y pimientos\r\ny un poco más de aderezo César\r\nsi quieres.","Doblar los lados del\r\ntortilla, luego enrolle con cuidado\r\npara que el relleno quede completamente\r\ncerrado. Alternativamente, ponga el\r\nplatos de ensalada, pollo\r\ny tortillas en la mesa para\r\nla familia para formar la suya propia."]','2026-01-11 13:00:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14075,7856,'es','Pollo con chile mexicano','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una excelente cena picante que se puede preparar con anticipación.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","2 cucharaditas de chile en polvo y comino molido","2 latas de 400 g de tomates pera pelados","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","200 g de chorizo ​​en trozos, sin piel y cortado en cubitos","8 muslos de pollo, sin piel","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en trozos","2 latas de 300 g de judías cannellini, escurridas","1 aguacate grande, sin hueso, pelado y rebanado","zumo de lima","un puñado de cilantro fresco","4 cucharadas grandes de crema agria"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y sofreír la cebolla hasta que se ablande. Agregue las especias y cocine por unos segundos. Vierta los tomates y 2 latas de agua, luego desmenúcelos en la pastilla de caldo. Llevar a ebullición y añadir el chorizo ​​y los muslos de pollo. Empuje el pollo bajo el líquido, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos.","Agrega los pimientos a la sartén y luego cocina por 20 minutos más. Añade los frijoles cannellini.","Para comer ahora: Caliente bien para calentar los frijoles. Mezcle el aguacate con la lima y un poco de sal y sirva encima de la cazuela con una pizca de cilantro. Cubra cada porción con crema agria. Sirva con arroz, patatas asadas o un puñado de totopos picantes.","Para comer más tarde: Enfriar y conservar en el frigorífico hasta 48 horas. Caliente encima de la estufa hasta que burbujee y sirva como se indica arriba."]','2026-01-11 13:00:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14076,4837,'es','guiso de pollo mexicano','Dale un toque de sabor mexicano a tu comida entre semana con esta cena baja en grasa en una sola sartén','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla mediana, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","½ cucharadita de azúcar moreno oscuro","1 cucharadita de pasta de chipotle (nosotros usamos Discovery)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en aros","unas hojas de cilantro","tortillas de maíz o arroz para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana. Añadir\r\nla cebolla y cocinar por 5 minutos o hasta\r\nsuavizado y empezando a dorarse,\r\nagregando el ajo para el último min. Agregue\r\nel azúcar, la pasta de chipotle y los jitomates.\r\nColoque el pollo en la sartén, vierta sobre\r\nla salsa y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos.\r\nhasta que el pollo esté cocido (añadir un\r\nchorrito de agua si la salsa se seca demasiado).","Retire el pollo de la sartén y\r\ntriture con 2 tenedores, luego revuelva nuevamente con el\r\nsalsa. Espolvorear con un poco de cebolla morada, la\r\ncilantro y sirva con el resto del color rojo.\r\ncebolla, tortillas o arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:00:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14077,6632,'es','Hamburguesas mexicanas de frijoles con yogur de lima y salsa','Estas hamburguesas vegetarianas son muy fáciles de hacer y los aderezos las hacen maravillosamente jugosas; cocínalas congeladas para ahorrar tiempo.','["2 latas de 400 g/14 oz de frijoles rojos, enjuagados y escurridos","100 g de pan rallado","2 cucharaditas de chile suave en polvo","manojo pequeño de cilantro, tallos y hojas picados","1 huevo","200 g de salsa fresca en tarrina","150ml de yogur natural desnatado","jugo ½ lima","6 panes de hamburguesa integrales, aguacate en rodajas, cebolla morada en rodajas y hojas de ensalada, para servir"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Inclina los frijoles\r\nun tazón grande, luego triture con un\r\nmachacador de patatas. Agrega el pan rallado,\r\nchile en polvo, tallos de cilantro y ½\r\nhojas, huevo y 2 cucharadas de salsa, sazonar\r\nPruebe y luego mezcle bien con un tenedor.","Divide la mezcla en 6, luego moja tu\r\nmanos y darles forma de hamburguesas. las hamburguesas\r\nahora se puede congelar. Colocar sobre una superficie antiadherente.\r\nbandeja para hornear, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 4-5 minutos en cada una\r\nlado hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. para cocinar\r\ncongelado, hornear a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6\r\ndurante 20-30 minutos hasta que esté completamente caliente.","Mientras se cocinan las hamburguesas, mezcle\r\nel resto de las hojas de cilantro con\r\nyogur, zumo de lima y un buen molido de\r\npimienta negra. Partir los panecillos por la mitad y\r\nuntar las bases con algo de\r\nyogur. Cubra cada uno con hojas, aguacate,\r\ncebolla, una hamburguesa, otra cucharada de\r\nyogur de lima y un poco de salsa, luego servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14078,5556,'es','Pollo a la lima mexicano','Una receta llena de sabores picantes','["2 pechugas de pollo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro trituradas","1 cucharadita de ralladura de lima","½ cucharadita de pimentón","½ cucharadita de azúcar mascabado","1 lima","6 dientes de ajo sin pelar","2 chiles rojos frescos"]','["Mezcle 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva con 1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro trituradas y ralladura de lima rallada y 1,2 cucharaditas de pimentón y azúcar moscabado ligero.","Coloque 2 pechugas de pollo en una fuente para horno, vierta la marinada encima y luego exprima un poco de jugo de lima. Cubra y deje marinar durante 30 minutos.","Desliza 1 o 2 rodajas de lima debajo de la piel de cada pechuga y sazona. Coloque 6 dientes de ajo sin pelar y 2 chiles rojos frescos alrededor del pollo.","Ase las pechugas de pollo en una fuente para horno, sin tapar, durante 30-35 minutos en un horno precalentado (190C/gas 5/horno ventilado 170C).  Para comprobar si están cocidos, pincha el pollo con el dedo; si todavía está un poco blando, espera un poco más.","Servir con ensalada y salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:00:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14079,7858,'es','Salmón a la parrilla con glaseado de chile y crema fresca de lima','Dale sabor a tu comida entre semana con esta fragante receta mexicana','["6 dientes de ajo, sin pelar","1 cebolla pequeña, cortada en rodajas gruesas","1 chile ancho o chile rojo seco grande, sin semillas y recortado","4 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","4 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","4 filetes de salmón sin piel de 150 g","1 lima, rallada y luego cortada en gajos","200 g de crème fraîche o nata agria","cilantro picado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Ennegrecer el ajo entero y la cebolla.\r\nrebanadas por todos lados en una fuente antiadherente grande y seca\r\nsartén. Retirar, enfriar brevemente y luego\r\npelar los dientes de ajo. Remojar el ancho\r\nchile en agua hirviendo durante 15 minutos, escurrir,\r\nluego colocar en una licuadora con el azúcar,\r\nvinagre de sidra, ajo, cebolla y un poco de sal\r\ny pimienta. Batir hasta obtener una salsa suave.","Calienta la parrilla. Cepille cada filete de salmón\r\ngenerosamente con la salsa y guarde cualquier\r\nrestante. Ase durante 8 minutos. Mientras tanto,\r\nMezclar la ralladura de lima con la crème fraîche.\r\nSirva el pescado con salsa extra de chile,\r\nuna cucharada de crème fraîche y lima\r\ncuñas para apretar. espolvorear con\r\ncilantro, si quieres, y sírvelo con\r\njudías verdes o arroz y ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:00:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14080,7860,'es','papas mexicanas','Patatas fritas picantes con crema agria para mojar, excelentes como parte de una comida Tex-Mex','["800 g de patatas cortadas en cubos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","½ cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","½ cucharadita de pimentón","1 cucharadita de comino","½ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","crema agria, para servir"]','["Hervir las patatas durante 5 minutos.\r\nMientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén.\r\ny sofreír la cebolla durante 8 min.\r\nAñade el ajo y las especias y sofríe durante\r\n2 minutos más.","Escurrir las patatas y verterlas en el\r\nmezcla de cebolla. Sube el fuego y agita\r\nlas patatas alrededor para que queden todas\r\ncubierto. Cocine por 10 minutos más hasta que\r\ntierno, luego sirva con crema agria,\r\nespolvoreado con un poco de cayena."]','2026-01-11 13:00:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14081,7862,'es','Chile de frijol negro','Este chile es excelente para entretenimiento informal: simplemente coloque todo y deje que la gente agregue sus propios ingredientes.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cebollas grandes, picadas","3 cucharadas de pimentón dulce (pimentón español) o chile suave en polvo","3 cucharadas de comino molido","3 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno","2 latas de 400 g (2 x 14 oz) de tomates picados","2 latas de 400 g (2 x 14 oz) de frijoles negros, enjuagados y escurridos","algunos o uno de los siguientes para servir: queso feta desmenuzado, cebolletas picadas, rábanos en rodajas, trozos de aguacate, crema agria"]','["En una olla grande calentar el aceite de oliva y sofreír.\r\nel ajo y la cebolla durante 5 minutos hasta\r\ncasi suavizado. Añade el pimentón y\r\ncomino, cocine por unos minutos, luego agregue el\r\nvinagre, azúcar, tomates y algo\r\ncondimento. Cocine por 10 minutos.","Vierta el\r\nfrijoles y cocine por otros 10 minutos.\r\nServir con arroz y los acompañamientos.\r\nde tu elección en tazones pequeños."]','2026-01-11 13:00:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14082,6770,'es','Spicy bean & avocado tostados','Haga que los niños participen en la preparación de este sencillo buffet mexicano de verduras con frijoles y aguacate saludables','["4 tortillas de harina","Lata de 400g de frijoles refritos","una pizca grande de pimienta de cayena","Lata de 200 g de frijoles en agua, enjuagados","2 puñados de tomates cherry, cortados en cuartos","50 g de queso cheddar vegetariano","1 chile verde, en rodajas finas","1 aguacate, partido por la mitad, sin hueso y en rodajas","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, para servir"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio-alto. Coloque 2 tortillas en una bandeja para hornear grande y luego cocine a la parrilla durante 2 minutos. En un tazón, mezcle los frijoles refritos, la pimienta de cayena, los frijoles y los tomates cherry, luego divida la mitad de la mezcla entre las tortillas. Espolvorea con la mitad del queso y la mitad del chile en rodajas, luego asa nuevamente hasta que el queso se derrita. Colóquelo en platos y cubra con la mitad del aguacate y el cilantro para servir. Repita con las tortillas restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:00:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14083,7864,'es','Chile de res mexicano','Una deliciosa olla de carne de res estofada picante es una manera excelente y sin estrés de saciar a una multitud hambrienta','["hasta 6 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","4 kg de ternera para guisar","4 cebollas blancas, rebanadas","4 cucharadas de pasta de chipotle","8 dientes de ajo machacados","50 g de jengibre rallado","1 cucharada de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","1 cucharada de harina común","2 litros de caldo de res","3 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de orégano seco","5 latas de 400 g de frijoles pintos o rojos, escurridos"]','["Calentar un pequeño chorrito de aceite en una\r\nfuente ignífuga extra grande. marrón\r\nla carne en tandas, añadiendo una gota\r\nmás aceite, retirar del plato y poner\r\na un lado. Agregue 1 cucharada de aceite al plato, luego\r\nlas cebollas y cocine durante 7-10 minutos o\r\nhasta caramelizar.","Revuelve la pasta de chipotle, el ajo, el jengibre,\r\ncomino, canela y harina con el\r\ncebollas y cocine por un par de minutos.\r\nAñade poco a poco el caldo, removiendo todo\r\ntiempo, por lo que está completamente mezclado con el otro\r\ningredientes. Añade los tomates y\r\norégano, sazone y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Ahora agregue la carne, cubra y cocine a fuego lento.\r\nmuy suavemente durante aproximadamente 1 hora y 45 minutos hasta que\r\ntierno, quitando la tapa y añadiendo el\r\nfrijoles durante los últimos 15 minutos. si la salsa\r\nestá fina, déjela hervir durante 5-10 minutos más.\r\nminutos con la tapa cerrada. Antes de servir,\r\najustar el condimento. Servir con el\r\npan de ajo y salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:00:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14084,7866,'es','Estofado de albóndigas mexicanas ahumadas','Una receta sencilla de albóndigas picantes que es una excelente alternativa al chile con carne','["1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","400 g de carne picada","50 g de pan rallado blanco fresco","1 cucharadita de comino molido y cilantro","1½ cucharada de pasta de chipotle","200 g de arroz basmati","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes, escurridas y enjuagadas","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, para servir"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola grande.\r\nsartén. cocinar la cebolla\r\ndurante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté suave, luego\r\nretirar de la sartén.","Mientras tanto, coloque la carne picada,\r\npan rallado, especias y chipotle\r\npegar en un bol, sazonar generosamente\r\ny mezclar bien. mezcla de rollo\r\nen 20 albóndigas del tamaño de una nuez.\r\nAgregue el aceite restante al\r\nsartén y sofreír las albóndigas por\r\nunos 8 minutos hasta que se dore por completo.","Mientras tanto, cocine el arroz.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Regresar\r\nla cebolla a la sartén, añadiendo la\r\ntomates, así como una lata llena de\r\nagua. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos, luego agregue\r\nlos frijoles y cocine por un\r\n10 minutos más, hasta que la salsa\r\nha espesado y las albóndigas\r\nestán bien cocidos. Sazone el\r\nalbóndigas, espolvoreadas con cilantro\r\ny servir con el arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:00:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14085,7868,'es','filetes de pescado tex-mex','Una buena forma de condimentar el pescado si a los niños no les gusta mucho, pedirles que ayuden a cocinar','["4 filetes de pescado blanco deshuesados, como eglefino, hoki y abadejo (aproximadamente 140 g cada uno)","2 cucharadas de condimento para fajitas o condimento Tex-Mex","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","200 g de guacamole en bote","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, picadas en trozos grandes","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Espolvoree el pescado con el condimento y luego déjelo a un lado.\r\nCalentar el aceite en una sartén poco profunda y luego freír.\r\ndurante 3-4 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén crujientes. servir\r\ncada trozo de pescado con una cucharada de\r\nguacamole encima, un poco de queso picado\r\ncilantro y una rodajita de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14086,7870,'es','wraps vegetales mexicanos','Reúne a tus amigos para una cena de autoensamblaje. Estas fajitas sin carne también son súper saludables','["½ calabaza, pelada y cortada en gajos grandes","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 cucharada de mezcla de condimentos cajún","1 cucharada de aceite","Lata de 400g de frijoles refritos","2 tomates, picados","4 cucharadas de yogur","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","rúcula bolsa 50g","8 tortillas de harina"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. En\r\nuna bandeja para asar, mezcle la calabaza con\r\nel chile, las especias, el aceite y el condimento, luego\r\nAse durante 25 minutos hasta que esté tierno. Calentar suavemente\r\nlos frijoles refritos con el picado\r\ntomates hasta que estén bien calientes. Mezclar\r\nel yogur con ralladura de lima y jugo.","Fajas calientes según pack\r\ninstrucciones y extender con una capa fina\r\nde frijoles. Cubra con calabaza, un poco de rúcula,\r\ny una cucharada de yogur de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14087,7872,'es','Nachos de pollo caseros','Un snack mexicano súper rápido para disfrutar el día del partido','["200 g de chips de tortilla de maíz simples","2 pechugas de pollo cocidas, desmenuzadas en trozos pequeños","6 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","140 g de queso rojo Leicester, rallado","1 frasco pequeño de chiles jalapeños encurtidos rojos o verdes en rodajas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, con las hojas picadas en trozos grandes","su elección de salsa, salsa picante (como Chipolte Tabasco), crema fresca, guacamole o jalapeños extra, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Capa\r\nColocar los chips de tortilla en una fuente apta para horno.\r\no bandeja para horno con el pollo troceado,\r\ncebolletas, queso y encurtidos\r\njalapeños. Hornee por 8 minutos o hasta que\r\nel queso se derrite.","Para servir, espolvorear con\r\nel cilantro y come con tu favorito\r\nacompañamientos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14088,4989,'es','Chilli con carne recipe','Esta excelente receta de chile tiene que ser uno de los mejores platos para servir a amigos en una reunión informal. Un favorito fácil de compartir que utiliza todos los ingredientes de la despensa.','["1 cucharada de aceite","1 cebolla grande","1 pimiento rojo","2 dientes de ajo, pelados","1 cucharadita colmada de chile picante en polvo (o 1 cucharada rasa si solo tienes suave)","1 cucharadita de pimentón","1 cucharadita de comino molido","500 g de carne magra picada","1 cubito de caldo de res","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","½ cucharadita de mejorana seca","1 cucharadita de azúcar","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","Lata de 410 g de judías rojas.","arroz de grano largo hervido, para servir","crema agria, para servir"]','["Prepara tus verduras. Picar 1 cebolla grande en dados pequeños,\r\nunos 5 mm cuadrados. lo mas facil\r\nLa forma de hacerlo es cortando la cebolla.\r\npor la mitad desde la raíz hasta la punta, pélalo\r\ny cortar cada mitad en trozos gruesos\r\ncerillas a lo largo, no\r\nbastante cortante hasta el final\r\nextremo de la raíz para que todavía se mantengan\r\njuntos. Cortar a lo largo del\r\ncerillas en dados limpios. Cortar 1 pimiento rojo por la mitad\r\na lo largo, quitar el tallo y\r\nLave las semillas y luego pique. Pelar y picar finamente 2 dientes de ajo.","Empiece a cocinar. Pon tu sartén\r\nla encimera a fuego medio. Añadir\r\nel aceite y dejarlo durante 1-2\r\nminutos hasta que esté caliente (un poco\r\nmás tiempo para una placa eléctrica). Añadir\r\nlas cebollas y cocine, revolviendo\r\ncon bastante frecuencia, durante aproximadamente\r\n5 minutos, o hasta que las cebollas\r\nson suaves, resbaladizas y ligeramente\r\ntranslúcido. Agregue el ajo, el pimiento rojo, 1 cucharadita colmada de chile picante en polvo o 1 cucharada rasa de chile suave en polvo, 1 cucharadita de pimentón y 1 cucharadita de comino molido. Revuelve bien y luego\r\ndéjalo cocinar por otros 5\r\nminutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Dorar los 500 g de carne magra picada. Bajar el fuego.\r\nsubir un poco, agregar la carne a la sartén\r\ny rómpelo con tu cuchara\r\no espátula. La mezcla debe\r\nchisporrotea un poco cuando agregas el\r\npicar. Sigue revolviendo y\r\npinchando durante al menos 5 minutos,\r\nhasta que esté toda la carne picada\r\ngrumos uniformes del tamaño de una carne picada\r\ny ya no quedan pedacitos rosados.\r\nAsegúrate de mantener el calor caliente.\r\nsuficiente para freír la carne y\r\nvolverse marrón, en lugar de solo\r\nguiso.","Hacer la salsa. Desmenuza 1 cubito de caldo de res en 300 ml de agua caliente. Vierta esto en la sartén con la mezcla de carne picada. Abre 1 lata de tomates picados (lata de 400 g) y añádelos también. Agregue ½ cucharadita de mejorana seca y 1 cucharadita de azúcar, si la usa (vea el consejo en la parte inferior), y agregue una buena pizca de sal y pimienta. Rocíe aproximadamente 2 cucharadas de tomate\r\nHaga puré y revuelva bien la salsa.","Cocine a fuego lento. trae el\r\ntodo hasta que hierva, darle un\r\nRevuelva bien y tape la sartén.\r\nBajar el fuego hasta que esté\r\nburbujear suavemente y dejarlo por\r\n20 minutos. deberías comprobar\r\nen la sartén de vez en cuando para revolverlo\r\ny asegúrate de que la salsa no\r\nse engancha en el fondo de la sartén o\r\nno se está secando. Si es así, agregue un\r\nun par de cucharadas de agua\r\ny asegúrate de que el calor\r\nrealmente es lo suficientemente bajo. después\r\nhirviendo a fuego lento, la salsa\r\nla mezcla de carne picada debe verse\r\nespeso, húmedo y jugoso.","Trae los frijoles. Escurrir y\r\nEnjuague 1 lata de frijoles rojos (lata de 410 g) en un colador y\r\nrevuélvelos en la olla de chile.\r\nLlevar nuevamente a ebullición y\r\nburbujee suavemente sin la tapa durante\r\notros 10 minutos, añadiendo un\r\nun poco más de agua si se ve demasiado\r\nseco. Prueba un poco de guindilla y\r\ntemporada. Probablemente tomará un\r\nmucho más condimento que tú\r\npiensa. Ahora vuelva a colocar la tapa, gire\r\napaga el fuego y deja tu chile\r\nreposar durante 10 minutos antes\r\nservir y relajarse. Dejando\r\ntu chile para reposar es realmente\r\nimportante ya que permite\r\nsabores para mezclar y la carne.","Sirva con crema agria y arroz de grano largo hervido."]','2026-01-11 13:00:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14089,7874,'es','Ensalada picante de pollo, mango y jalapeño','Condimente las pechugas de pollo con cilantro, chile y lima y luego sírvalas con chips de maíz mexicano y una ensalada fresca y crujiente.','["Paquete de 250 g de tomates cherry, cortados en rodajas o en cuartos","2 cucharadas de jalapeños finamente picados","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","jugo de 1 lima, más las mitades para servir","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","4 pechugas de pollo cocidas, cortadas en tiras pequeñas","2 lechugas Little Gem, cortadas en trozos pequeños","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","1 mango maduro, deshuesado, pelado y cortado en cubitos","un puñado de chips de tortilla, un poco partidos"]','["Pon los tomates cherry, los jalapeños,\r\ncilantro, jugo de lima, cebolla y aceite en\r\nun tazón grande con un poco de condimento.","Pop los ingredientes restantes, excepto\r\nlos chips de tortilla, encima del aderezo.\r\nMezcle suavemente la ensalada para cubrirla.","Espolvorea los chips de tortilla por encima.\r\ny sirva inmediatamente con mitades de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14090,7876,'es','Dip caliente de frijoles mexicanos con chips de tortilla','Un baño de fiesta rápido y fácil que es súper saludable, se puede congelar y cuenta para tus cinco comidas al día. ¿Qué más se puede pedir?','["1 cebolla, picada","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de azúcar moreno suave","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino","1 cucharadita de condimento cajún","400 g de frijoles mixtos en lata, enjuagados y escurridos","Lata de 400 g de tomates picados, con ajo","un puñado de queso cheddar rallado","100 g de totopos","servir con aguacate picado (opcional)"]','["Freír la cebolla picada en aceite de oliva.\r\nhasta que esté suave. Añadir marrón suave\r\nazúcar, vinagre de vino y condimento cajún.\r\nCocine por 1 min y luego agregue la mezcla.\r\nfrijoles y tomates picados\r\ncon ajo. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos hasta que\r\nla salsa se haya espesado y luego sazone.","Esparza un puñado de queso cheddar rallado sobre\r\nchips de tortilla. Microondas a temperatura alta\r\ndurante 1 min hasta que el queso se derrita.\r\nSirva junto con la salsa (cubra con un poco\r\naguacate picado si quieres). seguir adelante\r\ny recalentar la salsa antes de que lleguen los invitados."]','2026-01-11 13:00:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14091,7878,'es','Parrillas de nachos de pollo','Una forma divertida de servir pechugas de pollo y mantener el interés de los niños. ¿Por qué no pedirles que ayuden?','["Bolsa de 40 g de totopos","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","200 g de salsa de tomate picante en tarrina","Bote de 142 ml de crema agria","un puñado de queso cheddar maduro rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Triturar\r\nlas totopos. Poner las pechugas de pollo.\r\nuna bandeja para hornear antiadherente, sazone y luego corte\r\ncada 3 veces con un cuchillo. Cuchara 1 cucharada de\r\nsalsa encima de cada uno, luego 1 cucharada de crema agria.","Espolvoree las patatas fritas sobre el pollo y luego\r\nel queso. Ase durante 15-20 minutos hasta que\r\nla cobertura está dorada y derritiéndose."]','2026-01-11 13:00:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14092,7880,'es','Tortitas de maíz con salsa de aguacate','Una merienda-cena ligera y fácil de preparar con sabores mexicanos','["50 g de harina con levadura","1 huevo batido","200 g de maíz dulce enlatado o congelado","manojo de cebolletas, peladas y finamente picadas","1 aguacate, cortado en trozos pequeños","1 lima, ½ exprimida y el resto cortada en 4","un puñado de hojas de cilantro picadas","1-2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","frijoles refritos, para servir"]','["En un bol, combine la harina, el huevo, el maíz.\r\ny la mitad de la cebolla con un poco de condimento,\r\nluego mezcle bien. Mezclar el aguacate con el\r\ncebollas restantes, jugo de limón, cilantro\r\ny sazonar, luego reservar.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén antiadherente.\r\nEche cucharadas de la mezcla de maíz en el\r\nsartén, alisándolas hasta\r\nformar pasteles. Cocine durante unos 2-3 minutos en\r\ncada lado a fuego medio, agregando el\r\naceite restante si es necesario. Servir caliente\r\ncon la salsa de aguacate, gajos de lima y unos frijoles refritos calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:00:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14093,7882,'es','ensalada de frijoles mexicana','No es alguien que te deje la barriga retumbando, esta ensalada abundante realmente da en el clavo y tiene un toque picante.','["4 huevos","2 aguacates, pelados y sin hueso","2 latas de frijoles de 400 g (nosotros usamos frijoles pintos y frijoles rojos, enjuagados y escurridos)","cebolla morada pequeña, finamente cortada","manojo grande de cilantro, solo las hojas, picado en trozos grandes","250 g de tomates cherry en canastilla, cortados por la mitad","botella de aderezo comprado de buena calidad (usamos aderezo de lima y cilantro de English Provender Company)","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","½ cucharadita de comino"]','["Colocar los huevos en agua hirviendo y hervir.\r\ndurante 6½ minutos, luego poner en un recipiente con agua fría\r\nagua para enfriar. Cortar los aguacates y colocarlos en\r\nun bol grande con los frijoles, la cebolla y el cilantro\r\ny tomates. Mide 3 cucharadas del aderezo.\r\nen un tazón pequeño, luego mezcle el chile y\r\ncomino. Una vez que los huevos se hayan enfriado pero estén\r\ntodavía caliente, pelar las cáscaras y cortar en\r\ncuartos. Mezcle la ensalada con el aderezo.\r\ny anidar en los huevos. Servir de inmediato\r\n– delicioso con tortillas tostadas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14094,7884,'es','wraps de pescado mexicano','Los niños pueden tomar uno de estos deliciosos wraps de pescado mientras viajan, un excelente refrigerio bajo en grasas.','["ralladura fina y jugo de 1 lima","700 g de filete de pescado blanco sin piel, cortado en tiras","2 claras de huevo batidas con un tenedor","100 g de pan rallado fresco grueso","4 chorros de aceite en spray","200 g de tzatziki de olla","8 tortillas de harina pequeñas y suaves","trozos pequeños de lechuga iceberg o repollo blanco, rallado"]','["Espolvoree la ralladura de lima sobre los trozos de pescado y luego sazone. Sumerja el pescado en las claras, luego cúbralo con pan rallado y colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear. Rocíe el pescado con 2 chorros de aceite y luego cocine a la parrilla durante 2 minutos. Voltéelos, rocíelos con más aceite y luego cocínelos durante 2 minutos más hasta que el pescado esté cocido y el pan rallado esté dorado y crujiente.","Exprime el jugo de lima en el tzatziki y revuelve. Calienta las tortillas según las instrucciones del paquete. Para armar los wraps, coloque un puñado de repollo o lechuga en los dos tercios superiores de una tortilla, luego coloque 3 palitos de pescado encima con una buena cucharada de tzatziki de lima. Levante el tercio inferior de la tortilla y doble los lados para envolver el relleno."]','2026-01-11 13:00:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14095,7886,'es','Hacer tus propias fajitas','Siempre es divertido preparar fajitas en la mesa y también facilita que las personas elijan los ingredientes según las necesidades dietéticas.','["2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","pizca de pimienta de cayena","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","3 pimientos rojos, cortados en tiras","300 g de filetes de lomo, en rodajas","un puñado pequeño de hojas de cilantro fresco","8 tortillas enrolladas","100 g de queso cheddar rallado","tarrinas de guacamole y crema agria"]','["Mezclar el comino, el cilantro y la cayena con\r\nun poco de sal y pimienta, luego reservar. Calentar la mitad\r\nel aceite en una sartén, luego echar la cebolla,\r\npimientos y la mitad de la mezcla de especias. Cocine por aproximadamente 3\r\nminutos. Coloca las verduras en un bol.","Vuelva a colocar la sartén al fuego con el aceite restante,\r\nluego freír el bistec y el resto de la mezcla de especias\r\njuntos durante 4 minutos hasta que estén bien cocidos. Inclina el\r\nfilete en un recipiente aparte, adornando con\r\ncilantro. Calienta las envolturas. Trae todo a\r\nla mesa y dejar que cada uno se sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:00:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14096,7888,'es','Fajitas de verduras picantes','Aquí tienes un plato picante, vegetariano y de autoservicio ideal para adolescentes hambrientos.','["8 panqueques (ver el enlace de la receta a continuación)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","1 coliflor pequeña, cortada en floretes pequeños","Lata de 410 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados.","Tarro de 400 g de salsa de tomate arrabbiata (nosotros usamos Loyd Grossman)","3 cucharadas de cilantro fresco picado","Tarrina de 150g de yogur natural desnatado","50 g de hojas tiernas de espinacas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/gas 4/ventilador\r\n160C. Envolver los panqueques en papel de aluminio.\r\ny calentarlos en el horno\r\ndurante 10 minutos. Alternativamente, envuelva\r\nen film transparente y recalentar en el\r\nmicroondas a temperatura media (750 W) durante\r\n2-3 minutos.","Calentar el aceite en una cacerola, agregar\r\nla cebolla y sofreír durante 5 minutos hasta\r\nsuavizado. Punta en la coliflor\r\nfloretes y sofreír brevemente hasta que tomen\r\nen un poco de color. Agregue 5 cucharadas\r\nagua, tapar la cacerola y cocinar durante\r\n5 minutos hasta que la coliflor esté\r\nsimplemente tierno.","Agrega los garbanzos a la sartén.\r\ncon la salsa arrabbiata y traer\r\na ebullición. Cocine a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos,\r\nluego agregue el cilantro y\r\nretirar del fuego.","Transfiera la salsa a una porción.\r\nbol y poner sobre la mesa con el\r\npanqueques calientes, yogur y\r\nhojas de espinaca. Que cada uno ponga un\r\nunas cuantas hojas de espinaca en el centro de\r\ncada panqueque, vierta el relleno\r\nencima y cubre con un poco de yogur. el\r\nLuego los lados se pueden doblar hacia la\r\nmedio y los panqueques comidos\r\ncon cuchillo y tenedor."]','2026-01-11 13:00:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14097,7890,'es','sopa mexicana con pollo','Todos esos sabores típicamente mexicanos (limón, cilantro, chile) combinados en una sopa con el crujido de los chips de tortilla.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 ancho u otro chile seco grande, sin semillas y ablandado en agua hirviendo durante unos 10 minutos","½ cucharadita de comino molido","Lata de 400g de tomates pera","1½ l de caldo de pollo","2 pechugas de pollo, en rodajas","jugo 2 limones","chips de tortilla o tiras de tortilla casera (ver más abajo), aguacate picado, rodajas de limón, cebolla morada y cilantro, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande. Añade el\r\ncebolla y ajo, ablande durante 5 minutos, luego revuelva\r\nen el chile seco, el comino, los tomates y el pollo\r\nvalores. Mezclar en un procesador de alimentos en tandas, o\r\nuse una batidora de mano para hacer puré hasta que quede suave.","Regrese a la cacerola y luego déjela hervir.\r\nAgregue el pollo, reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento.\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido. Agregue el\r\njugo de lima y un poco de condimento, luego sirva con un cucharón\r\nen tazones. Pon los ingredientes en el medio.\r\nde la mesa para que todos se sirvan."]','2026-01-11 13:00:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14098,7892,'es','Fajitas de langostinos con crema de aguacate','Los sabores mexicanos de lima, ajo, chile y cilantro infunden estas deliciosas tortillas servidas con guacamole cremoso.','["jugo de 2 limas, más gajos para servir","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","225 g de gambas grandes crudas peladas","1 aguacate, sin hueso y sin piel","1 cucharada colmada de crema agria, más un poco más para servir","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","4 tortillas de harina y un buen puñado de hojas de ensalada mixta, para servir"]','["Mezclar la mitad del jugo de limón, la mitad del chile,\r\nla mitad del ajo y la mitad del cilantro\r\ncon un poco de condimento en un recipiente poco profundo.\r\nplato. Añade los langostinos y mezcla para cubrir.\r\ntodos ellos. Déjalo marinar mientras\r\nPrepara el aguacate.","Picar el aguacate en trozos grandes y reventar.\r\nen un pequeño procesador de alimentos con el\r\nel resto del zumo de lima, la guindilla, el ajo, el\r\ncrema agria y un poco de condimento.\r\nBatir hasta que quede suave, luego agregar el\r\ncilantro restante. (También puedes usar\r\nuna batidora de mano para esto.)","Calentar el aceite en una sartén y\r\nCocine el pimiento por unos minutos, hasta que\r\nempezando a ablandarse. Añade las gambas y\r\nfreír, en una sola capa, durante 1-2 minutos cada una\r\nlado – sabrás que están cocidos\r\ncuando se vuelven rosados y se sienten firmes\r\nel tacto. Sirva en tortillas calientes con\r\nhojas de ensalada, si lo desea, junto con el\r\ncrema de aguacate, crema agria y\r\nunas rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14099,7894,'es','Enchiladas de pollo con salsa de mole rojo','Prueba un favorito tradicional mexicano con esta receta picante y variada.','["4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel","4 chiles anchos","2 tomates pera, cortados por la mitad","2 cucharadas de aceite o manteca","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo","3 cucharadas de almendras blanqueadas, más un extra para servir","2 cucharaditas de pasas","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de canela molida","pequeño trozo de chocolate amargo","Paquete de 375 g de tortillas frescas"]','["Coloque el pollo en la sartén y luego vierta 300 ml de agua fría. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir a fuego lento y cocinar durante 20 minutos, volteando una vez, hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Retire el pollo del agua (guardando el líquido) y cuando esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, desmenúcelo con los dedos o con un tenedor.","Corta los chiles por la mitad, quítales las semillas y deséchalos. Colóquelo en un tazón pequeño y cubra con agua hirviendo. Déjelos en remojo durante 20 minutos hasta que se ablanden, luego deseche el agua, pique los chiles en trozos grandes y póngalos en una licuadora.","Calentar una sartén y verter el tomate. Cocine durante 5 minutos, hasta que la piel del tomate comience a formar ampollas y se dore. Agrega a la licuadora. Calentar el aceite o manteca en la misma sartén y sofreír la cebolla, el ajo y las almendras durante 5 min. Agregue las pasas, el orégano, el comino y la canela, luego cocine 2 minutos más hasta que la cebolla se ablande, las almendras estén doradas y las pasas se hayan inflado. Vierta en la licuadora con 100 ml del líquido para escalfar pollo y déle un buen batido.","Vierta la mezcla nuevamente en la sartén, agregue 350 ml del líquido para escalfar y el chocolate y déjelo hervir a fuego lento durante 20 minutos. Para servir, ablande las tortillas en el microondas durante 30 segundos, luego apile el pollo encima, vierta la salsa sobre ellas y enrolle. Sirva espolvoreado con hojas de cilantro, limas y más almendras picadas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14100,7896,'es','Crab & avocado tostadas','Use una tortilla de maíz como base y luego cubra con carne de cangrejo, salsa mexicana estilo guacamole y ensalada.','["1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en aros finos","jugo de 2 limas, más gajos para servir","pizca de azúcar en polvo","Lata de 170 g de carne de cangrejo blanco en salmuera, escurrida","2 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 aguacate muy maduro, pelado, sin hueso y picado","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","2 tortillas de maiz","un puñado de hojas de ensalada mixta"]','["Poner la cebolla en un bol y tapar.\r\ncon la mitad del zumo de lima y un buen\r\nuna pizca de azúcar y sal. salir\r\npara suavizar mientras obtienes todo\r\nmás listo.","Mezclar la carne de cangrejo,\r\ncebolletas y la mitad del chile.\r\nSazonar con pimienta negra\r\ny dejar a un lado. Triturar el aguacate con el\r\nel resto del zumo de lima, el ajo y\r\nalgún condimento. puedes irte\r\nbien grueso o tritúrelo hasta\r\nsuave. Agrega el resto del chile.","Dobla cada tortilla por la mitad y\r\ntostar en una tostadora durante 1 min. poner\r\nen 2 platos y cubra con la ensalada\r\nhojas, luego puré de aguacate.\r\nTerminar con la carne de cangrejo y\r\ncebolla encurtida escurrida. Servir con\r\ngajos de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14101,7898,'es','Ensalada mexicana con picatostes de tortilla','Los frijoles negros son una excelente base para ensalada; mézclelos con aguacate, tomates y cilantro al estilo latinoamericano.','["3 tortillas de harina, cortadas en trozos del tamaño de un crutón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de mezcla de condimentos cajún o mexicano","1 lechuga iceberg, rallada","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, enjuagados y escurridos","Paquete de 200 g de tomates cherry cortados por la mitad","2 aguacates, sin hueso, pelados y rebanados","jugo 1 lima","½ manojo de cilantro, solo las hojas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nColoque los trozos de tortilla en una bandeja para hornear,\r\nmezcle con el aceite y la mezcla de condimentos,\r\nluego cocine durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté crujiente. en\r\nun tazón grande, mezcle el iceberg, los frijoles\r\ny tomates. Eche el aguacate en el\r\nJugo de lima y agréguelo al bol.","Rocíe sobre el aderezo elegido y\r\nrevuelva para cubrir todos los ingredientes. Cubra con\r\nlos picatostes y el cilantro, luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:00:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14102,7900,'es','galletitas de almendras','Estas delicadas galletas mexicanas cubiertas de nieve son ricas, quebradizas y se derriten en la boca.','["50 g de almendras enteras","100 g de mantequilla blanda","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de ron oscuro","140-175 g de harina común, más un poco más para extender","azúcar glas, para servir (unos 100 g)"]','["Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3\r\ny tostar las almendras durante 5-10 minutos\r\nhasta que tengan un color dorado pálido.\r\nBatir la mantequilla, el azúcar y el ron.\r\ny una pizca de sal, luego agrega la harina\r\nhasta que la masa se una\r\nquedará suave. Picar las almendras en trozos grandes\r\ny agregarlos a la masa. Con cuidado\r\nextender la masa sobre una mesa bien enharinada\r\nsuperficie a un espesor de 4-5 mm y corte\r\nSaque galletas pequeñas de aproximadamente 3-4 cm de ancho.\r\nCongela las galletas en una bandeja para hornear.\r\ndurante 20 minutos para que se endurezca.","Hornea las galletas en el horno durante\r\nunos 20 minutos hasta que estén listos; lo harán\r\nTodavía estará muy pálido. Colocar sobre una rejilla\r\ny espolvorear azúcar glas por ambos lados mientras\r\ntodavía están calientes, teniendo cuidado de no\r\nrómpelos a medida que los giras. el glaseado\r\nel azúcar se derretirá. Cuando estén fríos,\r\nespolvoréalos muy generosamente\r\ncon más azúcar glas para que queden\r\ncompletamente blanco. Almacenar en un lugar hermético\r\nrecipiente por hasta 2 días, o congelar\r\nhasta por 2 meses."]','2026-01-11 13:00:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14103,7902,'es','Arroz con leche con sirope de pasas y canela','Conocido como Arroz con Leche en México, se sirve perfecto en vasos pequeños.','["200 g de arroz con leche","ralladura de 1 limón","ralladura de 1 naranja","1 litro de leche entera","100 g de azúcar en polvo","85 g de pasas o pasas","1 rama de canela","100 g de azúcar mascabado moreno claro","3 cucharadas de crema doble"]','["Poner el arroz en una cacerola grande con 500ml.\r\nagua y la ralladura de limón y naranja.\r\nLlevar a ebullición, tapar, bajar el fuego,\r\nluego cocine durante unos 15 minutos hasta que todos los\r\nel agua ha sido absorbida. Destape, agregue\r\nla leche y el azúcar, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 20-25\r\nminutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que el arroz esté\r\ntierna y la salsa espesa. genial,\r\nluego dejar a temperatura ambiente.","Pon las pasas en una cacerola pequeña.\r\ncon la canela, moscovado\r\ny 100ml de agua. Calentar suavemente\r\nhasta que el azúcar se haya derretido,\r\nluego burbujee durante un minuto hasta\r\nalmibarado. Agregue la crema,\r\nluego enfriar en la sartén.","Sirva en el último minuto: agregue un poco de leche a la mezcla de arroz si se ha vuelto \"sólida\" después de reposar por un tiempo. Para servir, divida el arroz\r\npudín entre 8 vasos\r\no tazones pequeños y cubra con un\r\ncucharada de pasas almibaradas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14104,7904,'es','enchiladas de pollo','Ligeramente picantes y saciantes, estas enchiladas fáciles rellenas con frijoles refritos, cebolla y pimiento rojo serán populares entre toda la familia.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas, rebanadas","2 pimientos rojos, rebanados","3 chiles rojos, 2 sin semillas y picados, 1 en rodajas","manojo pequeño de cilantro, tallos finamente picados y hojas picadas en trozos grandes, más algo extra para servir (opcional)","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","6 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos pequeños","Lata de 415 g de frijoles refritos (nosotros usamos Discovery)","Lata de 198 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","Botella de 700ml en puré","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","10 tortillas","2 botes de nata agria de 142 ml","200 g de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en tu vaso más grande.\r\nsartén, luego sofreír las cebollas, los pimientos picados\r\ntallos de chile y cilantro con la mitad del\r\nel ajo durante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave. Agregue 2 cucharaditas\r\ncilantro molido y 2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino,\r\nluego freír por 1 min más. Mientras tanto, en\r\nEn otra sartén, sofreír el pollo en la\r\naceite restante, en tandas, hasta que se dore\r\n– agréguelo a la sartén de verduras mientras está listo.","Revuelva los frijoles, el maíz dulce y el cilantro.\r\nhojas y 150 ml de passata en el\r\nverduras y pollo. En un bol mezclar el resto\r\nde la passata con el otro triturado\r\ndiente de ajo, el resto de las especias y el\r\nazúcar, luego reservar.","Para armar, coloque las tortillas sobre\r\nuna tabla y dividir la mezcla de pollo\r\nentre ellos, doblando los extremos\r\ny enrollar para sellar. Dividir la passata\r\nsalsa en los platos que estás usando, luego\r\ncubra con las enchiladas. Punto sobre el\r\ncrema agria, espolvorear con rallado\r\nqueso y espolvorear con el chile en rodajas.","Enfriar y congelar (consulte los consejos de congelación a continuación)\r\no, si va a comer inmediatamente, calentar el horno\r\na 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6, luego hornee por\r\n30 minutos, espolvoreando con más cilantro\r\ndeja para servir, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:00:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14105,7906,'es','Labneh','Prepara el queso casero más fácil en minutos. Es una adición común a los platos de meze como salsa.','["900 g de yogur entero (normal o griego)","aceite de oliva, para rociar","za''atar, para rociar"]','["Mezclar el yogur con ½ cucharadita de sal marina gruesa. Coloque un colador sobre una jarra o tazón medidor grande y cúbralo con un paño de muselina. Vierta el yogur, junte los lados del paño y átelo bien con hilo de cocina, dejando suficiente hilo para poder suspenderlo. Haz un lazo con el sobrante y cuelga el paquete de muselina del grifo del fregadero de la cocina, poniendo el bol o jarra debajo. Dejar reposar durante 12-24 horas hasta que se haya escurrido todo el líquido. (Si el clima es cálido, enfríelo en un colador sobre un tazón).","Cuando el labneh esté listo, estará firme; cuanto más lo dejes, más firme se volverá, así que escúrrelo durante un poco menos de tiempo si quieres comerlo como salsa. Vierta el labneh en un bol o recipiente y sírvalo rociado con aceite de oliva y sazonado con za''atar."]','2026-01-11 13:00:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14106,7908,'es','Croissants de za''atar y queso feta','Utilice masa ya preparada para crear croissants hojaldrados con especias del Medio Oriente. El za''atar de hierbas y el queso feta cremoso se combinan para obtener un bocado deliciosamente sabroso.','["Paquete de 350 g de masa para croissant","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","1 cucharada de za''atar","1 huevo, batido"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Desenrolla la masa del croissant y utiliza un cuchillo para separar los triángulos de masa. Esparce el queso feta y ½ cucharada de za''atar sobre los triángulos de masa, presionándolo todo con las manos.","Comenzando desde la base de un triángulo, enrolle la masa hacia el punto estrecho. Doble cada extremo ligeramente hacia adentro para formar un croissant. Repita con la masa restante. Coloque los croissants en la bandeja para horno forrada, unte cada uno con huevo batido y espolvoree sobre el za''atar restante. Hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté bien dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:00:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14107,7910,'es','Pan plano de espárragos asados ​​y labneh con dukkah de almendras saladas','Inspírate con los sabores del Medio Oriente: estos panes planos están cubiertos con espárragos asados ​​y dukkah de almendras saladas. Guarde el dukkah sobrante para otras recetas.','["250 g de yogur griego espeso","70 g de almendras tostadas y saladas","50 g de semillas mixtas","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","350 g de espárragos, sin las puntas leñosas","2 dientes de ajo, rallados","25 g de mantequilla salada","10 g de eneldo, hojas recogidas y ramitas adicionales para servir","4 panes planos al estilo griego"]','["Empiece por hacer el labneh. Mezcle el yogur griego con 1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas, luego viértalo en un colador forrado con un paño de muselina limpio y colóquelo sobre un bol. Enfriar durante al menos 1 hora. Se mantendrá frío durante la noche.","Para la dukkah, calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Mezclar las almendras con las semillas en una bandeja para horno forrada. Sazone con sal y pimienta, luego hornee durante 6 a 8 minutos. Dejar enfriar completamente en la bandeja.","Pon una sartén amplia a fuego medio-alto. Rocíe el aceite de oliva y esparza los espárragos. Cocine durante 5-6 minutos, revolviendo, hasta que se queme y comience a ablandarse. Agrega el ajo, la mantequilla y el eneldo. Revuelva bien y apague el fuego cuando la mantequilla comience a dorarse y a oler a nuez.","Para armar, extienda el labneh sobre un pan plano caliente, cubra con los espárragos, una pizca de dukkah y las ramitas de eneldo adicionales."]','2026-01-11 13:00:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14108,7950,'es','Escuchar','Prueba este maqlooba de inspiración iraquí. Significa "al revés", y es un plato especial que combina chuletas de cordero, berenjena, tomates, arroz basmati y patatas.','["4-6 chuletas de cordero","2-3 cucharaditas de pul biber (hojuelas de pimienta turca)","3 cucharadas de melaza de dátil o jarabe de dátil (ver consejo a continuación)","2 berenjenas medianas, cortadas en rodajas de 1 cm","300 g de arroz basmati","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de mezcla de especias baharat","6½ cucharadas de aceite de oliva","5 cucharadas de melaza de granada","2 cebollas medianas, cortadas en aros de 1 cm","4 patatas medianas, cortadas en rodajas de 1 cm","4-5 tomates (suficientes para cubrir la base de la sartén), cortados en rodajas de 1 cm","rodajas de limón, para servir (opcional)"]','["Pon las chuletas de cordero en un bol. Combine 2 cucharaditas de sal, ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra, el pul biber (al gusto) y 2 cucharadas de melaza de dátil o jarabe de dátil, si lo usa. Frote todo el cordero, cúbralo y déjelo marinar a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora. Se mantendrá frío durante la noche.","Mientras tanto, remoja las rodajas de berenjena en un recipiente con agua con sal durante 20 minutos. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Calentar una cazuela ignífuga de 23 cm a fuego medio. Añade el arroz y luego vierte 700 ml de agua hirviendo del hervidor. Agrega una pizca de sal junto con 1 cucharadita de cúrcuma, la especia baharat y ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra. Cocine durante 3-5 minutos hasta que el arroz comience a ablandarse, luego escurra y reserve.","Escurrir y enjuagar la berenjena, luego mezclar con 4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, una pizca de sal y 2 cucharadas de melaza de granada. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y comiencen a dorarse. Además, coloque las cebollas en una bandeja para hornear aparte, mezcle con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, 2 cucharadas de melaza de granada y una pizca de sal, y hornee durante 20 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Coloque las patatas en una tercera bandeja para hornear y mezcle con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, el resto de la cúrcuma y una pizca de sal. Hornee por 20 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado.","Mientras tanto, retira las chuletas de cordero de la marinada y agítalas suavemente para eliminar el exceso. Calienta la ½ cucharada de aceite de oliva restante en una sartén a fuego medio-alto y fríe las chuletas durante 2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas pero aún rosadas en el medio.","Forre la base de la cazuela con un círculo de papel para hornear. Colocar las rodajas de tomate, ligeramente superpuestas, en círculos concéntricos sobre el pergamino, seguido de los aros de cebolla, luego las chuletas de cordero, las patatas y las berenjenas. Coloque el arroz encima y aplane suavemente la superficie hasta formar una capa uniforme.","Pon la cazuela a fuego medio. Disuelva 1 cucharadita de sal en 150 ml de agua y viértala sobre el arroz, seguido de la 1 cucharada restante de melaza de dátil y 1 cucharada de melaza de granada. Tape y cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos, luego reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que el arroz esté bien cocido y las verduras se hayan caramelizado ligeramente.","Retirar del fuego, poner un paño de cocina limpio sobre la cacerola y cubrir con la tapa (para evitar que la condensación vuelva a gotear en el arroz). Dejar reposar 10 min. Retire la tapa, coloque un plato grande sobre la sartén e invierta rápidamente. Golpee la base y levante la bandeja con cuidado para mantener las capas apiladas. Retire el papel para hornear y sirva con rodajas de limón, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14109,7952,'es','Tagine de cordero en una sartén con garbanzos','Prepare este tagine de cordero con uno o dos días de anticipación para desarrollar realmente los sabores. Hace que el entretenimiento sea un poco más fácil, ya que todo lo que tendrás que hacer es recalentarlo.','["1 kg de filete de cuello de cordero, cortado en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de ras el hanout","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito opcional","2 cebollas picadas","4 zanahorias, cortadas en trozos grandes","6 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","2 cucharadas de pasta de rosa harissa, más 1 cucharadita para servir","½ limón en conserva, finamente picado o una tira de ralladura de limón pelada","1 rama de canela","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","600 ml de caldo de pollo o cordero","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos pero sin enjuagar","100 g de orejones, picados (opcional)","150 gramos de yogur natural","manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","un puñado pequeño de almendras laminadas, tostadas","cuscús cocido"]','["Mezcle los trozos de cordero con el ras el hanout y una pizca grande de sal para cubrirlos. Se mantendrán fríos hasta por 4 horas. Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Calentar el aceite en una cazuela grande refractaria a fuego medio y dorar el cordero por todos lados. (Tendrá que hacer esto en tandas). Colóquelas en un plato con una espumadera y reserve, luego cocine las cebollas y las zanahorias en la sartén durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que estén suaves y doradas, agregando un chorrito más de aceite si la sartén está seca. Agregue el ajo y el jengibre y cocine por 2 minutos más, luego agregue las 2 cucharadas de harissa y el limón en conserva. Cocine por un minuto más hasta que las verduras estén cubiertas por la mezcla y pegajosas. Agregue la canela, luego agregue los tomates y cocine a fuego lento.","Cocine por unos minutos más hasta que se reduzca a una pasta espesa. Vuelva a colocar el cordero y su jugo reposado en la sartén y vierta sobre el caldo. Sazone y vuelva a hervir a fuego lento. Tapar la cacerola y llevar al horno para que se cocine durante 1 hora.","Agrega los garbanzos y los albaricoques, si los usas, tapa nuevamente y regresa al horno por 1 hora hasta que el cordero esté tierno. Sazone y luego deje reposar el tajine durante 10 minutos. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días o congelado durante tres meses. Dejar enfriar primero. Descongelar en el frigorífico durante la noche antes de recalentar a fuego lento hasta que esté bien caliente. Revuelva 1 cucharadita de harissa en el yogur, luego esparza el tagine con el cilantro y las almendras en hojuelas. Sirva con el cuscús y el yogur especiado como acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 13:00:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14110,4855,'es','Brochetas veganas','Rellenos con hamburguesas de tempeh marinadas y repollo encurtido, estos kebabs veganos están listos en solo 16 minutos. Son saludables, llenos de fibra y uno de tus cinco al día.','["100 g de tempeh","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de orégano seco","2 cucharadas de mayonesa vegana","½ diente de ajo pequeño, machacado","2 panes planos","4 cucharadas de col roja encurtida, escurrida","150 g de hojas de ensalada"]','["Cortar el tempeh en rodajas de 1⁄2 cm de grosor. Mezclar 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en un bol con el pimentón, el orégano, una pizca de sal, una pizca de pimienta negra y 1 cucharada de agua. Agregue el tempeh y revuelva para cubrir. Tapa y deja en el frigorífico toda la noche si puedes, o reserva a temperatura ambiente mientras continúas con la receta.","Batir la mayonesa con 1⁄2 cucharada de agua y el ajo machacado en un bol pequeño. Calienta los panes planos en una sartén seca a fuego medio durante 30 segundos por cada lado. Unte la mayonesa de ajo sobre ambos panes planos y cubra con el repollo encurtido y la mitad de las hojas de ensalada.","Calienta la cucharada de aceite restante en una sartén grande a fuego alto. Freír el tempeh marinado durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado a fuego medio hasta que esté crujiente y dorado. Apile encima de los panes planos, dóblelos y sirva junto con la ensalada restante."]','2026-01-11 13:00:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14111,7954,'es','albóndigas','Prueba nuestro meze de albóndigas con hummus, tzatziki, cebolla, pepino y tomate. Es ideal como plato familiar entre semana si las personas comen en diferentes momentos.','["100 g de pan rallado","50ml de leche","400 g de carne picada de ternera o cordero","1 huevo","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, finamente picado","1 cebolla, rallada gruesa","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 cucharadas de harina común","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","½ pepino, picado en trozos","12 tomates cherry, en cuartos","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","humus","tzatziki","4 pitas"]','["Pon el pan rallado en un bol y añade la leche. Dejar actuar 5 minutos o hasta que la leche se haya absorbido. Agrega el resto de ingredientes de las albóndigas, excepto la harina y el aceite. Sazone bien con sal y pimienta y mezcle todo bien con las manos, luego forme albóndigas un poco más grandes que un tomate cherry. Deberías tener unas 24. Cubra y enfríe las albóndigas durante al menos 30 minutos. Se mantendrá cubierto y refrigerado hasta por 24 horas.","Cuando esté listo para cocinar, vierta la harina en un recipiente poco profundo. Enrolle las albóndigas en harina para cubrirlas, luego caliente el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio. Fríe las albóndigas durante 10-12 minutos, girándolas por la sartén hasta que estén bien doradas por todos lados y bien cocidas. Para servir, colóquelo en un plato con un poco de ensalada picada hecha con pepino, tomates y cebolla morada, y tazones de hummus y tzatziki al lado. Tueste las pitas y deje que cada uno haga su propio kebab de albóndigas, rellenando las albóndigas, la ensalada y las salsas en las pitas."]','2026-01-11 13:00:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14112,7956,'es','Fatteh makdous (berenjenas tiernas rellenas de cordero en salsa de tomate y tahini)','Disfrute de estas deliciosas berenjenas tiernas rellenas de cordero en salsa de tomate y tahini como parte de un menú inspirado en el Medio Oriente. Cubra con anacardos para servir.','["aceite, para freír","8 berenjenas tiernas","2 panes planos redondos grandes, cortados en cuadritos","anacardos, para servir","aceite, para freír","¼ cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de pasta de tomate","½ cucharadita de polvo de madrás suave","½ cucharadita de pimienta negra","½ cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de siete especias en polvo (ver consejo a continuación)","100 g de carne picada de cordero","aceite de oliva, para freír","25 g de piñones","200 ml de yogur griego","4 cucharadas de tahini","½ limón, exprimido","1 diente de ajo, machacado"]','["Primero, haz la salsa roja. Calentar un poco de aceite en una sartén, luego agregar las semillas de comino y sofreír hasta que huelan fragante. Agrega el resto de los ingredientes junto con ½ cucharadita de sal y 200 ml de agua, y cocina hasta que la salsa espese un poco; debe tener la consistencia de una nata líquida.","Recorte la parte superior de las berenjenas tiernas, luego quíteles tiras de piel en tiras y ahueque el corazón con un cuchillo pequeño y afilado o con la punta de una cucharadita. Remojar las berenjenas en agua fría con sal para que conserven su color, luego escurrirlas bien, exprimirlas ligeramente y secarlas.","Llene una sartén hasta un tercio de su capacidad con aceite y caliéntela hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 30 segundos. Fríe los trozos de pan plano hasta que estén crujientes y dorados, pero no quemados, entre 30 y 40 segundos. Escurrir bien. Freír las berenjenas en tandas durante 4-5 minutos hasta que estén doradas y tiernas, luego escurrirlas sobre papel de cocina.","Freír el cordero picado en una sartén con un poco de aceite de oliva hasta que esté dorado y bien cocido, luego añadir los piñones y sazonar. Rellena las berenjenas con la mezcla de carne picada de cordero; puedes rellenar la carne picada en el agujero de cualquiera de los extremos o dividir las berenjenas y luego agregar el relleno (de esta manera podrás introducir más cordero). Pon las berenjenas rellenas en una sartén con 6 cucharadas de salsa roja y cocina por 5 minutos.","Pon en un bol el yogur griego, el tahini, el zumo de limón, el ajo y un poco de sal y mezcla bien. Si se siente un poco espeso, agregue un poco de agua fría. Puede prepararlo con anticipación y enfriarlo en el refrigerador hasta que esté listo para servir.","Para servir, vierta el yogur tahini en un tazón grande. Cubra con un puñado de chips de pan plano, las berenjenas y toda la salsa roja. Termine con una pizca de anacardos y luego sirva el resto de las patatas fritas a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:00:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14113,5455,'es','Muhammara (dip de pimiento rojo y nueces)','Sirva una salsa de pimiento rojo y nueces de inspiración siria como guarnición en un festín del Medio Oriente. Cubra con nueces enteras y cilantro y disfrútelo con panes planos.','["3 pimientos rojos","70 g de nueces en mitades","1 cucharada de melaza de granada","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile picante","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de pasta de tomate","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","un puñado de pan rallado","¾ cucharadita de sal marina fina","aceite de oliva, para servir","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8. Ase los pimientos durante 25-30 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad, hasta que estén tiernos y empiecen a formar ampollas (si no se forman ampollas, asarlos a la parrilla durante unos minutos). Dejar enfriar un poco, luego pelar y desechar la piel. Deseche las semillas y pique finamente la pulpa. Tuesta las nueces durante 5 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente doradas.","Muele todas las mitades de nueces menos cuatro en un molinillo de especias hasta que estén bastante finas pero aún tengan algo de textura. Mezcla las nueces molidas con los pimientos, luego agrega la melaza, las especias, la pasta de tomate, el ajo, el pan rallado y la sal marina, mezcla bien y sazona.","Sirve la muhammara en un plato pequeño, rociándola con un poco de aceite de oliva. Agrega las nueces enteras al centro y un poco de cilantro alrededor del borde."]','2026-01-11 13:00:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14114,6851,'es','Nidos de pájaro pistacho','Prepare estos "nidos de pájaro" de pistacho, hechos con masa kataifi (una masa filo rallada muy fina disponible en línea) y un jarabe de azúcar con limón para un dulce placer.','["40 g de pistachos","400 g de azúcar","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","300 g de masa kataifi","375 g de mantequilla, derretida"]','["Remojar los pistachos en agua durante 30 minutos. Disuelva el azúcar en 500 ml de agua en una cacerola a fuego medio, luego hierva y burbujee durante 15-20 minutos o hasta que se reduzca y esté ligeramente almibarado. Agrega el limón y deja hervir por un minuto más.","Cubre el kataifi con un paño húmedo para que no se seque. Tome un trozo de masa de 30 cm finamente retorcido y envuélvalo con un movimiento circular alrededor de dos dedos en forma de nido. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear, luego repita con el resto de la masa.","Escurre los pistachos y presiona suavemente cuatro o cinco en el centro de cada nido. Cubra los nidos con una capa de papel para hornear, luego coloque otra bandeja para hornear encima y coloque un peso de 1 kg encima. Dejar a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora, luego retirar el pergamino y dejar secar una hora más.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Vierte la mantequilla sobre y alrededor de los nidos, de modo que queden sobre una capa de mantequilla derretida. Cocine durante 20-25 minutos hasta que se doren, volteando la bandeja de vez en cuando para asegurarse de que los nidos tengan un color uniforme. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una bandeja para hornear limpia y vierta sobre el almíbar. Dejar enfriar completamente en el almíbar y luego servir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14115,7958,'es','Adobo de harissa y miel','Pruebe esta marinada de harissa y miel en brochetas de pollo o halloumi y úsela como glaseado. Harissa es una pasta de chile picante tunecina hecha con pimientos rojos y especias.','["2 cucharadas de harissa rosa","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo machacado","3 cucharadas de miel"]','["Combine la rosa harissa, el aceite de oliva, el diente de ajo y la miel. Sazone con sal."]','2026-01-11 13:00:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14116,4293,'es','Tazón de falafel de espinacas y hummus','Prepare esta ensaladera vegana fácil con falafels de espinacas caseros y hummus servidos junto con pita y ensalada. Está lleno de nutrientes para una cena saludable.','["150 g de espinacas tiernas","1⁄2 pepino, rebanado","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","4 pitas integrales, tostadas, para servir","150 g de espinacas tiernas","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1⁄2 manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de harina común","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para enrollar","400 g de garbanzos escurridos","40 ml de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para servir","1 diente de ajo, picado en trozos grandes","1 limón, exprimido, más extra para servir (opcional)","2 cucharadas de tahini"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel pergamino antiadherente. Pon todos los ingredientes del falafel, excepto el aceite, en un procesador de alimentos y sazona ligeramente. Pulse hasta obtener una mezcla rugosa.","Engrase ligeramente las manos, luego tome cucharadas de la mezcla de falafel, forme unas 16 bolas y colóquelas en la bandeja para hornear. Presione cada uno ligeramente hacia abajo con la palma de su mano. Cepille con 1 cucharada de aceite y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté firme y dorado, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad.","Mientras se cocina el falafel, prepara el hummus. Pon todos los ingredientes del hummus en un procesador de alimentos con 50 ml de agua y mezcla hasta que quede suave y sedoso.","Coloque las espinacas, el pepino, la cebolla morada y el falafel en diferentes secciones de cada tazón, junto con un poco de hummus, luego rocíe con aceite de oliva extra. Muele un poco de pimienta negra. Sirva con las pittas a un lado y más limón para exprimir, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:00:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14117,6217,'es','Berenjena, halloumi y harissa horneadas en sartén','Prepare esta sartén vegetariana especial de berenjena, halloumi, tomate y harissa para una comida para dos entre semana. Es una cena fácil de compartir en una sola sartén.','["2-4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito","1 berenjena grande, cortada en rodajas de aproximadamente ½ cm de grosor","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de pasta de harissa","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","225 g de halloumi en bloque, cortado en 8-9 trozos","pizca de menta seca","panes planos, arroz o cuscús, para servir"]','["Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén o sartén refractaria de aproximadamente 22 cm y luego agregue las rodajas de berenjena en una sola capa (deberá hacerlo en tandas). Cocine durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté dorado y suave, agregando otra cucharada de aceite entre cada tanda. Transfiera a un plato.","Si la sartén está seca, agregue otra cucharada de aceite. Freír el ajo hasta que chisporrotee pero no tome color. Agrega los tomates, la harissa, el azúcar y una pizca de sal. Burbujear durante un minuto, aplastando los tomates. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.","Mientras tanto, corta por la mitad cada trozo de halloumi (no te preocupes si se deshacen). Coloque las rodajas de berenjena y halloumi en círculos concéntricos superpuestos sobre la mezcla de tomate, asegurándose de que haya uno o dos trozos de halloumi entre cada rodaja de berenjena. Rociar con un poco más de aceite y espolvorear con la menta. Cubra el molde con papel de aluminio y hornee durante 20 minutos a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4, luego retire el papel de aluminio y hornee durante 5-10 minutos más hasta que el halloumi haya comenzado a dorarse. Sirva con panes calientes, arroz o cuscús."]','2026-01-11 13:00:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14118,6084,'es','Garbanzos chipotle con berenjena y pitta','Dale un toque picante a los garbanzos y la berenjena con chipotle. Sirva encima de pittas con tahini y crème fraîche y termine con rodajas de lima y cilantro.','["4 pitas integrales, cortadas en triángulos","150 g de crema fresca ligera","3 cucharadas de tahini","2 limas ralladas y en jugo, más ralladura y gajos adicionales para servir","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 berenjenas pequeñas, finamente cortadas","400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes, más un poco más para servir"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque las pitas en una sola capa en una bandeja para hornear y tuéstelas durante 10 minutos hasta que estén crujientes.","Mientras tanto, prepara la cobertura. Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y sofreír la cebolla y la berenjena a fuego medio durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega los garbanzos y la pasta de chipotle y cocina por otros 5 minutos. Retirar del fuego y agregar el cilantro y un poco de condimento.","Batir la crema fresca, el tahini, el jugo y la ralladura de lima y el ajo en un bol, junto con 50 ml de agua para que se suelten.","Para servir, cubra las pitas tostadas con la salsa de tahini y lima, agregue la berenjena y los garbanzos y termine con una pizca de cilantro, la ralladura de lima extra y las rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:00:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14119,3922,'es','Ensalada de calabacín a la plancha y halloumi con aderezo de alcaparras y limón','Aliña esta ensalada de calabacín y halloumi mientras todo esté bastante caliente, luego los calabacines absorberán los sabores del aderezo de alcaparras y limón.','["10-12 calabacines tiernos, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","225 g de halloumi en bloque, en rodajas finas (unas 16 rodajas)","1 chalota larga, finamente picada","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","2 cucharadas de alcaparras","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes del aderezo en un bol con 1 cucharada de agua fría y sazona con una pizca de sal. Mezclar y reservar.","Pon los calabacines en un bol grande y rocíalos con aceite. Agrega una pizca de sal y luego revuelve.","Caliente un panto a la plancha y agregue los calabacines, con el lado cortado hacia abajo (es mejor hacerlo en tandas). Cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que aparezcan marcas de carbonilla y la carne se ablande, luego déle la vuelta y cocine por otros 3 minutos. Retirar a un recipiente poco profundo y cubrir con papel de aluminio para mantenerlo caliente.","Mientras tanto, caliente una sartén antiadherente grande aparte y agregue el halloumi. Cocine por unos minutos hasta que estén dorados por ambos lados.","Coloque los calabacines y el halloumi en un plato o fuente grande y luego vierta sobre el aderezo."]','2026-01-11 13:00:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14120,3940,'es','Falafel de hierbas congelable','Prepare estos deliciosos falafels con garbanzos secos, en lugar de enlatados, para obtener los mejores falafels. Rellénelos en pitas o pan plano, o póngalos en una lonchera.','["250 g de garbanzos secos","2 cucharaditas de semillas de cilantro, trituradas","3 cucharaditas de comino molido","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","pizca de pimienta de Jamaica","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","manojo pequeño de perejil, hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes","manojo pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes","¾ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","30 g de semillas de sésamo (opcional)","aceite de girasol, para freír","panes planos calientes, hummus, pepinillos, rábanos en rodajas, menta, cilantro, tahini, za''atar o hojuelas de chile y salsa de chile, para servir"]','["Poner los garbanzos en un bol, cubrir con agua fría y dejar en remojo al menos 12 h.","Al día siguiente, escurrimos los garbanzos y los secamos con papel de cocina. Vierta en un procesador de alimentos y presione hasta que comiencen a descomponerse. Tuesta todas las especias en una sartén pequeña y seca durante 1 o 2 minutos. Viértelos en el procesador de alimentos con el ajo, las hierbas y 1½ cucharadita de sal marina. Bate hasta que quede suave y flexible (compruébalo apretando un trozo en tu mano; cuando esté listo, debe permanecer unido). Vierta la mezcla en un tazón, agregue el polvo de hornear, cubra y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Forme 12 discos pequeños y luego cubra cada uno ligeramente con las semillas de sésamo, si las usa. Enfríe durante 15 minutos más. El falafel ahora se puede congelar hasta por tres meses (ver más abajo).","Calienta 1 cm de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio hasta que se formen pequeñas burbujas en la superficie. Fríe el falafel en tandas durante 6 minutos hasta que esté bien dorado, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad con una espátula o una espumadera. Transfiera a un plato forrado con papel de cocina. Dejar escurrir. Una vez enfriado, el falafel se puede congelar hasta por tres meses (ver más abajo). Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8. Coloque el falafel en una bandeja para hornear ligeramente engrasada y unte con un poco de aceite. Hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté crujiente. Sirva sobre los panes planos con los rellenos de su elección."]','2026-01-11 13:00:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14121,7960,'es','Pilaf crujiente de pollo za’atar con granada','Coloque crujientes trozos de pollo za''atar entre arroz pilaf con pistacho para disfrutar de una cena irresistible. Es un derroche de color, textura y sabor.','["8 muslos de pollo con piel","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 limón, exprimido","3 cucharadas de za''atar","70 g de semillas de granada","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","50 g de mantequilla","2 cebollas grandes, cortadas en rodajas","220 g de arroz basmati","350 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","70 g de pistachos picados","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile"]','["Mezcle el aceite de muslos de pollo, 1 cucharadita de sal, el ajo y el jugo de limón en un tazón grande. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos 1 hora o hasta 12 horas.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y calentar una sartén a fuego alto. Fríe el pollo, con la piel hacia abajo, durante 5 a 7 minutos, o hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear y espolvoree con el za''atar, luego ase durante 10 minutos.","Para el arroz, caliente el aceite y la mantequilla en una cacerola o sartén grande y poco profunda a fuego medio-bajo. Freír las cebollas con una pizca de sal durante 15 minutos hasta que estén caramelizadas y pegajosas. Agregue el arroz, el caldo, los pistachos y las hojuelas de chile. Estación. Coloque los muslos de pollo asados ​​encima del arroz y vierta sobre el jugo asado de la bandeja. Cocine en el horno durante 45 minutos o hasta que el arroz esté tierno. Retirar del horno, tapar y reposar durante 5 minutos.","Esparza el pilaf de pollo con las semillas de granada y el perejil y sirva en tazones poco profundos."]','2026-01-11 13:00:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14122,7962,'es','Pilaf de coliflor harissa','Evoque el Medio Oriente con nuestro pilaf de coliflor y harissa vegetariana con una embriagadora combinación de frutas, nueces y especias. Cocínelo en el horno para obtener un arroz delicioso y esponjoso.','["300 g de arroz basmati","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","2 limones, 1 en jugo y 1 cortado en gajos","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","4 cucharadas de harissa","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 coliflor grande o 2 medianas, partidas en floretes grandes, con el tallo picado y las hojas grandes picadas en trozos grandes","pizca de azafrán","2 hojas de laurel","700 ml de caldo de verduras vegano caliente","100g de pasas","100 g de almendras laminadas, tostadas hasta que estén doradas","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado, más algo extra para servir","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","50 g de semillas de granada (opcional)"]','["Lavar muy bien el arroz y dejar en remojo en agua fría durante 1 hora. Pon la cebolla en un bol pequeño y mezcla con el jugo de limón, el azúcar y una pizca de sal. Déjalo encurtir mientras haces el pilaf.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Batir 2 cucharadas de harissa, el ajo y el aceite en un tazón grande, luego agregar la coliflor y mezclar para cubrir con la salsa. Sazone, luego viértalo en una fuente para asar y ase durante 30 minutos hasta que esté tierno y dorado.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el azafrán, las hojas de laurel, el caldo y 2 cucharadas de harissa en una sartén a fuego muy lento para mantener el calor mientras se asa el cauli.","Retire el cauli del horno, viértalo en un plato y exprima sobre el jugo de una de las rodajas de limón. Escurrir el arroz y verterlo en la fuente para asar. Vierta sobre el caldo infundido y mezcle bien. Agrega las pasas, la mitad de las almendras, el eneldo, los garbanzos y la mitad de la coliflor. Cubra el molde con una doble capa de papel de aluminio, sellándolo bien, luego hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno y se absorba el caldo.","Revuelva el arroz con un tenedor y luego agregue la coliflor restante (esto crea un contraste de texturas de coliflor). Esparza sobre el eneldo extra, las almendras restantes, las semillas de granada, si las usa, las cebollas rojas encurtidas y las rodajas de limón restantes para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14123,7964,'es','Coliflor asada con salsa harissa y garbanzos','Aprovecha al máximo la coliflor de temporada con este plato principal inspirado en el Medio Oriente. Las verduras asadas se sirven con una salsa de garbanzos especiada hecha con cebolla, tomates y harissa.','["1 coliflor grande","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un extra para la lata","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cebolla grande, cortada en rodajas","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de harissa rosa","35 g de mantequilla","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas, tostadas","ensalada, para servir (opcional)","200 gramos de yogur natural","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de cebolla granulada","una pizca de hojas de tomillo frescas o secas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","½ limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharadas de tahini","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","4 cucharadas de yogur natural natural"]','["Prepare la marinada combinando todos los ingredientes con 1½ cucharadita de sal marina en un tazón y revolviendo hasta que estén bien combinados. Retire las hojas de la coliflor y córtelas en rodajas a lo largo. Pon las rodajas de hojas de coliflor en un bol con una pizca de sal. Reservar para más tarde.","Corta la coliflor en rodajas gruesas de aproximadamente 1½ cm-2 cm de grosor; no te preocupes si algunos de los floretes se rompen, se está asando todo. Engrase una bandeja grande para asar y vierta las rodajas y floretes de coliflor. Vierta sobre la marinada y revuelva para cubrir, luego cubra con papel aluminio y deje marinar durante al menos 2 horas, pero puede dejarla en el refrigerador todo el día o toda la noche si lo desea.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Asar la coliflor cubierta con papel de aluminio durante 40-45 minutos. Mientras tanto, haz la salsa. Calentar el aceite de oliva con las semillas de comino en una sartén de fondo grueso a fuego medio. Añadimos la cebolla y una pizca de sal y sofreímos, revolviendo, durante 8-10 minutos hasta que empiece a caramelizar. Agregue los tomates picados y un poco de condimento. Suba un poco el fuego y cocine, sin dejar de revolver, durante 6 a 8 minutos hasta que se reduzca, luego agregue el ajo, la harissa y la mantequilla, y revuelva para combinar. Mezcle en un procesador de alimentos hasta que quede suave, luego vierta nuevamente en la sartén, agregue los garbanzos y las hojas de coliflor y caliente durante uno o dos minutos.","Retira el papel de aluminio de la coliflor y regresa la bandeja al horno durante 10 minutos para que se caramelice. Agrega el tahini y el aceite de oliva al yogur en un bol y sazona. Una vez que la coliflor esté lista, divide la salsa tibia en platos, luego cubre con las rodajas de coliflor y el yogur tahini. Esparcir sobre las almendras. Servir con una ensalada de hojas crujientes bien aderezada."]','2026-01-11 13:00:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14124,7966,'es','Pollo con garbanzos harissa triturados','¿Necesitas algo rápido para cenar? Pruebe este pollo, cubierto con sabroso za''atar y servido con garbanzos especiados. Es simple, pero realmente delicioso.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla, picada","1 pimiento rojo, finamente picado","1 pimiento amarillo, finamente picado","4 pechugas de pollo","1 cucharada de za''atar","400g lata de garbanzos","1½ cucharada de pasta de harissa roja","150 g de espinacas tiernas","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","rodajas de limón, para servir"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas y los pimientos durante 7 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y dorados.","Mientras tanto, coloque el pollo entre dos hojas de papel para hornear y golpéelo ligeramente hasta que tenga unos 2 cm de espesor. Mezcle el aceite restante y el za''atar y luego frótelo sobre el pollo. Sazone al gusto.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Coloque el pollo en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel de aluminio y cocine a la parrilla durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que esté dorado y bien cocido.","Caliente los garbanzos en una sartén con la pasta de harissa y 2 cucharadas de agua hasta que estén bien calientes, luego tritúrelos con un machacador de patatas. Derretir las espinacas en una sartén con 1 cucharada de agua o en el microondas en un recipiente resistente al calor. Revuelva la mezcla de pimiento y cebolla, las espinacas y el perejil con los garbanzos. Sirva con el pollo en rodajas y las rodajas de limón para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:00:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14125,7968,'es','Manti de ternera y guinda con mantequilla de tomate y chile','Regálate un festín turco y pon estos manti (albóndigas) de carne y cereza ácida en el centro del escenario. Puedes preparar previamente el manti y congelarlo para mayor facilidad.','["300 g de harina inci turca o harina para pasta ''00'', más algo extra para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de sal fina","1 huevo grande, batido","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","sémola fina, para espolvorear","piñones tostados, para servir","hojas de tomillo, para servir","125 g de carne picada","30 g de cebolla (½ pequeña), muy finamente picada","20 g de perejil muy finamente picado","20 g de guindas secas, picadas","½ cucharadita de semillas de hinojo, molidas con un mortero","200 g de mantequilla sin sal","pizca de orégano seco","1½ cucharada de puré de tomate","500 g de puré de tomate","vinagre de jerez, para condimentar","azúcar en polvo, para condimentar","1 cucharada de pul biber (hojuelas de chile turco)","125 g de yogur griego","½ diente de ajo pequeño, finamente rallado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","una máquina de pasta"]','["Para hacer la masa, poner la harina y la sal en una batidora de pie con un gancho para amasar. Agrega el huevo y el aceite, luego mezcla a velocidad baja. Agregue gradualmente unas 2 cucharadas de agua. Una vez que la mezcla comience a formar grumos, colóquela sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase durante unos 10 minutos hasta obtener una masa firme y suave. Cortar en cuatro porciones, envolver cada una y reposar en el frigorífico durante 30 min.","Para hacer el relleno, combina todos los ingredientes con un poco de sal y mezcla bien con las manos. Freír una pequeña cantidad para comprobar la sazón.","Pase un trozo de masa por la posición más grande de una máquina para hacer pasta, luego dóblelo por la mitad antes de volver a enrollarlo. Continúe hasta llegar al ajuste 2/3. Extiende la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo espolvoreada con sémola y córtala en cuadrados de unos 6 x 6 cm. Vierta 1 cucharadita del relleno en el centro de cada uno. Cepille un poco de agua alrededor de los bordes y júntelos en el centro para formar una manti (ver imagen superior). Continúe hasta que se acabe el relleno y coloque el manti terminado en una bandeja muy espolvoreada con sémola. Mantenga la pasta restante envuelta mientras trabaja. Tendrá más de lo que necesita (consulte el consejo a continuación). Enfríe el manti por hasta 24 horas.","Para hacer la mantequilla de tomate y chile, derrita la mitad de la mantequilla en una sartén, agregue el orégano y el puré de tomate y cocine brevemente antes de verter la passata con una pizca de sal. Cocine a fuego lento durante unos 20 minutos. Terminar con un chorrito de vinagre de jerez y una pizca de azúcar en polvo. Calentar el resto de la mantequilla hasta que se dore, verterla por un colador fino, dejar enfriar 2 minutos y luego añadir el pul biber. Combine la salsa y la mantequilla de chile y manténgala caliente. Prepara el yogur de ajo batiendo los ingredientes con 2 cucharadas de agua.","Cocine el manti en agua hirviendo durante unos 5 minutos hasta que esté tierno y la carne esté cocida. Escurrir y servir el manti con la salsa de yogur y mantequilla de chile, y espolvorear con piñones y tomillo."]','2026-01-11 13:01:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14126,7970,'es','Baklava de pistacho, almendras, limón y rosas','Termine un menú de inspiración turca o del Medio Oriente con un fragante baklava casero de postre. La receta de Diana Henry presenta sabores de pistacho, almendra, rosa y limón.','["125 g de almendras molidas","300 g de pistachos, picados en un procesador de alimentos (algunos gruesos, otros finamente)","1 limón, finamente rallado y exprimido, más 4 tiras anchas de ralladura","500 g de azúcar granulada, más 3 cucharadas","200 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para el molde","2 paquetes de masa filo de 250g (no usarás todas las láminas)","aproximadamente 2 cucharaditas de agua de rosas (agregue al gusto ya que las marcas varían en intensidad)","un puñado de pétalos de rosa rosada, sin rociar (opcional)"]','["Mezcle las almendras molidas y los pistachos picados en un bol, reservando 3 cucharadas de pistachos para decorar. Agrega la ralladura de limón finamente rallada, las 3 cucharadas de azúcar y 5 cucharadas de mantequilla derretida. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar el interior de un molde para asar o para hornear (30 x 20 cm) con mantequilla.","Cualquiera que sea el tamaño de hojas de filo que tengas, córtalas para que quepan en la lata. Coloque una hoja de filo encima, unte con mantequilla y continúe hasta tener 6 hojas de filo. Coloque la mezcla de nueces encima y presione con el dorso de una cuchara, como si fuera una base de galleta, luego coloque 8 hojas de filo encima, untando nuevamente con mantequilla cada una. Con un cuchillo afilado, corte un enrejado de diamantes en la parte superior y luego hornee durante 1 hora hasta que se doren.","Hacer el almíbar poniendo en un cazo el azúcar, el zumo de limón y las tiras de ralladura con 250ml de agua. Deje hervir, revolviendo para ayudar a que el azúcar se disuelva, luego baje un poco el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. La mezcla se verá bastante almibarada. Retire la ralladura de limón y agregue el agua de rosas al gusto.","Mientras el baklava y el almíbar aún están calientes, vierte el almíbar con cuidado sobre la masa. Regrese el baklava al horno por 5 minutos más.","Espolvorea los pistachos restantes sobre el baklava y luego déjalo enfriar durante la noche para que el baklava pueda absorber todo el almíbar. Si estás preparando esto para una ocasión especial, es bueno esparcir algunos pétalos de rosa rasgados (tienen que ser trozos pequeños) justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14127,6429,'es','Caballa con dátil, berenjena y salsa de limón en conserva','Disfrute de filetes de caballa con una deliciosa salsa de dátiles, berenjena y limón en conserva para saborear el sabor de Marruecos. Servir con arroz, cuscús o trigo bulgur.','["½ cucharada de semillas de comino","½ cucharada de semillas de cilantro","8 filetes de caballa","½ limón, exprimido","2 berenjenas (unos 550 g)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más extra para freír","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 tomates pera, finamente picados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharada de miel líquida","1 limón en conserva, más 4 cucharaditas de jugo del frasco","8 dátiles, deshuesados ​​y finamente picados","8 ramitas de menta, con las hojas rotas","cuscús o trigo bulgur y ramitas de cilantro, para servir (opcional)"]','["Primero, haz el condimento. Corta los tallos de las berenjenas y luego corta la pulpa en cubos de 1 cm. Calienta 1½ cucharada de aceite en una sartén grande y fríe las berenjenas en tandas a fuego medio durante 8-10 minutos, o hasta que estén blandas y doradas. Es posible que necesites agregar más aceite. Transfiera a un plato y reserve.","Agrega otra ½ cucharada de aceite a la sartén y fríe la cebolla hasta que esté tierna y dorada, aproximadamente 10 minutos. Vierta el tomate y cocine por otros 10 minutos, o hasta que se derrumbe, luego agregue el ajo, la guindilla, el comino y el jengibre y cocine por 2 minutos más. Regresar la berenjena a la sartén, añadir la miel, el jugo del tarro de limones en conserva y los dátiles. Estación. Baje el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 10 minutos, o hasta que espese pero no esté rígido; agregue un chorrito de agua si es necesario. Pica el limón en conserva (tanto la pulpa como la piel), desechando las semillas, luego agrega la mitad a la salsa. Pruebe para ver si necesita más; debe ser asertivo, dulce y salado. Es posible que también quieras más miel. Deje enfriar y luego agregue la menta.","Tostar las semillas de comino y cilantro en una sartén seca a fuego lento hasta que las semillas empiecen a crujir y saltar en la sartén. Transfiera a un mortero y triture hasta obtener una mezcla gruesa. Agrega sal y pimienta.","Frote aceite de oliva por todos los filetes de caballa y luego espolvoréelos con la mezcla de especias. Calienta una sartén o plancha y, cuando esté bien caliente, añade los filetes de pescado con la piel hacia abajo. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos. Voltéalos y cocina por 2 minutos más. Exprime jugo de limón sobre todos los filetes y sírvelos con la salsa. Sirva con trigo bulgur o cuscús y cilantro, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14128,7972,'es','Pasteles de queso feta, dátiles y espinacas','Aprovecha al máximo los dátiles con estos pasteles filo dulces y salados de inspiración del Medio Oriente. Llenos de queso feta, dátiles y espinacas, son una excelente guarnición.','["500 g de espinacas, sin los tallos gruesos","115 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","½ cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","4 cebolletas, finamente picadas","8 dátiles, deshuesados ​​y finamente picados","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, las hojas finamente picadas","8 ramitas de menta, con las hojas rotas","25 g de piñones tostados","150 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","1 huevo mediano, ligeramente batido","Paquete de 250 g de láminas de masa filo","semillas de sésamo negro, para espolvorear"]','["Pon las espinacas en una cacerola con 2 cucharadas de agua a fuego medio-bajo y tapa. Revuelve las espinacas un par de veces hasta que se ablanden, aproximadamente 4 minutos, y luego escúrrelas. Cuando esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, exprima firmemente el exceso de agua de las espinacas con las manos y luego pique en trozos grandes.","Calentar 10 g de mantequilla y todo el aceite en una sartén grande. Agrega la cebolla y cocina a fuego medio-bajo hasta que esté pálida y suave. Agregue las espinacas escurridas y el ajo, sazone y cocine durante unos 5 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Dejar enfriar.","Transfiera la mezcla de espinacas a un tazón, luego agregue las cebolletas, los dátiles, el perejil, la menta, los piñones, el queso feta y el huevo. Estación.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Desenrollar la masa filo y cortarla en tiras de 9-10cm de ancho. Derrita el resto de la mantequilla, luego unte una tira con un poco antes de poner otra tira encima y cepillarla también. Mantenga el resto de la masa cubierta con un paño de cocina mientras trabaja. Pon dos cucharaditas colmadas de relleno en el extremo de la tira más cercana a ti. Dobla la esquina inferior de la masa en diagonal sobre el relleno, de modo que lo que era el borde inferior ahora se encuentre con el borde derecho de la masa. Dobla el triángulo relleno y continúa así con toda la tira, untando con mantequilla a medida que avanzas, hasta obtener un paquete filo triangular limpio. Repite el proceso con toda la masa y el relleno. Unte la parte superior de cada uno con mantequilla y luego colóquelos en bandejas para hornear. Espolvorea con las semillas de sésamo negro y hornea durante 25-30 minutos, o hasta que la masa esté dorada."]','2026-01-11 13:01:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14129,7974,'es','Rollitos de repollo al estilo del Medio Oriente','Añade este plato vegano a tu repertorio. Hemos rellenado hojas de col con arroz integral y lentejas junto con menta, limón, tahini y piñones.','["16 hojas grandes de col rizada, sin tallos (430 g de peso preparado)","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cebollas grandes (360 g), finamente picadas","40 g de piñones","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1½ cucharadita de canela","150 g de arroz basmati integral","1½ cucharada de caldo de verduras en polvo","Lata de 390 g de lentejas verdes escurridas","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","4 cucharadas de menta picada","2 cucharadas de tahini","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","6 tomates, rebanados","¼ de pepino (150 g), en rodajas","12 aceitunas Kalamata, deshuesadas y cortadas en rodajas","1 cucharada de menta picada"]','["Ponga a hervir agua en una cacerola grande, agregue las hojas de col y coloque un cucharón pesado encima para mantenerlas sumergidas. Hervir durante 4 minutos, luego escurrir y reservar el agua.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente. Reserva 2 cucharadas de cebolla y sofríe el resto durante 10 minutos hasta que esté dorada. Agrega los piñones y cocina hasta que empiece a tomar color. Agrega las especias y el arroz, luego vierte 450 ml del agua reservada. Agregue el caldo en polvo, cubra y cocine durante 15 minutos hasta que el arroz esté casi tierno y se absorba el líquido. Agrega la ralladura y la menta.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner una cucharada de arroz en el centro de una hoja de col, enrollar y poner en una cazuela poco profunda. Repita con el resto del arroz y las hojas. Tapar y hornear durante 30 minutos hasta que el arroz esté completamente tierno.","Mientras tanto, combine el tahini, el jugo de limón, el ajo y 3 cucharadas de agua y mezcle los ingredientes de la ensalada con la cebolla reservada. Si sigues nuestro Plan de Dieta Saludable, sirve la mitad de los panecillos con la mitad de la salsa y la mitad de la ensalada. Tapar y enfriar el resto para comer otro día. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante dos o tres días. Vuelva a calentar en el microondas hasta que esté caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14130,7976,'es','Albóndigas al estilo libanés con mujadara','El arroz integral, las lentejas y la cebolla son una base deliciosa para esta cena saludable. Hemos utilizado carne picada de cordero magra y muchas hierbas y especias para añadir sabor.','["250 g de carne picada de cordero (10 % de grasa o menos)","2 cebollas grandes (320 g), 1 muy finamente picada, 1 partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","3 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 limón, medio rallado y exprimido, medio cortado en cuatro gajos para servir","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","200 g de arroz basmati integral","1 cucharada de caldo en polvo","Lata de 390 g de lentejas verdes escurridas","2 cucharadas de tahini","4 tomates, cortados en gajos","¼ de pepino (unos 150 g), en rodajas","12 aceitunas Kalamata, en cuartos","1 cucharada de menta picada, más unas hojas pequeñas para servir"]','["Vierta el cordero en un bol con ¼ de cebolla picada, el ajo, ½ cucharadita de comino, la ralladura de limón y un poco de pimienta negra. Mezcle bien con las manos y luego forme 16 albóndigas pequeñas. Enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos.","Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio-alto. Reserva la mayor parte de la cebolla picada restante para la ensalada y luego fríe el resto durante 5 minutos hasta que esté dorada. Agregue el comino restante, luego agregue el arroz, el caldo en polvo, 500 ml de agua y un poco de pimienta negra. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento, luego cubra y cocine a fuego medio durante 30 minutos. Vierta las lentejas, vuelva a tapar y cocine durante 5-10 minutos más hasta que el arroz esté tierno y se haya absorbido toda el agua.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite restante en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio-alto. Agrega las albóndigas y la cebolla en rodajas, tapa y cocina por 5 minutos. Revuelva, luego cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que las albóndigas estén bien cocidas y las cebollas doradas. Revuelve el tahini y el jugo de limón con 3-4 cucharadas de agua para hacer una salsa.","Mezcla todos los ingredientes de la ensalada con la cebolla picada reservada. Si sigues nuestro Plan de Dieta Saludable, divide la mitad de la mujadara en dos platos y cubre con la mitad de las albóndigas y la cebolla. Vierta sobre la mitad de la salsa tahini y sirva con la mitad de la ensalada, dos rodajas de limón y unas hojas de menta. Cubra y enfríe las porciones restantes para comer otro día. Se conservará durante dos o tres días en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 13:01:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14131,7980,'es','Calamares a la plancha, lentejas, pimiento asado y limón en conserva con tahini','Combine salsa tahini casera con calamares a la plancha, lentejas y pimientos para una cena sabrosa. La salsa también combina bien con verduras asadas o pescado.','["3 pimientos rojos grandes, cortados por la mitad y sin semillas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un poco más para asar y freír","½ cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","1 rama de apio, cortada en cubitos","225 g de lentejas puy","1 limón, exprimido","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","600 g de calamares limpios y preparados","2 chiles verdes y 2 rojos, cortados por la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 limón en conserva, sin pulpa y desechada, cáscara en rodajas muy finas","4 cucharadas de tahini","2 cucharadas de yogur griego","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 dientes de ajo machacados","½ limón, exprimido","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner los pimientos en una bandeja para horno y untar con un poco de aceite de oliva. Ase durante 25-30 minutos, hasta que esté suave y con ampollas. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Para hacer el aderezo, combine todo hasta obtener la consistencia de crema doble. Si queda demasiado espeso, agrega un poco de agua y ajusta la sazón al gusto. Dejar de lado. Corta los pimientos en tiras.","Calentar un poco de aceite de oliva en una sartén mediana y sofreír la cebolla y el apio durante 10 minutos hasta que estén suaves pero sin color. Vierta las lentejas y cubra con agua. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, o hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas, agregando más agua si es necesario.","Escurre las lentejas y luego colócalas en un tazón para servir. Sazone bien, luego agregue 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, la mitad del jugo de limón y el perejil. Dejar enfriar un poco y luego añadir los pimientos.","Corta las “alas” de los calamares y resérvalas con los tentáculos. Corta los cuerpos por un lado para que se abran y luego limpia el interior pasando la hoja de un cuchillo firmemente sobre la carne. Marque la pulpa por dentro, asegurándose de no cortarla por completo. Seque con papel de cocina y luego transfiéralo a un recipiente con suficiente aceite de oliva para humedecer los trozos (aproximadamente 2 cucharadas). Calienta una plancha hasta que esté muy caliente.","Sazone los calamares y cocine a la plancha en tandas durante 20-30 segundos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados. Córtelo en trozos pequeños, luego agregue la ensalada de lentejas y rocíe con el jugo de limón restante.","En una sartén pequeña calentar 1 cucharada de aceite y sofreír los chiles y el ajo hasta que estén dorados. Vierta sobre los calamares y luego agregue el limón en conserva. Sirva con el aderezo encima o a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14132,7982,'es','Chuletas de cordero con hummus y tomates asados','Introduzca un poco de sol en su día sin importar el clima con chuletas de cordero al estilo mediterráneo servidas sobre una cama de hummus, tomates asados, aceitunas y queso feta.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","4 dientes de ajo machacados","8 chuletas de cordero","200 g de tomates cherry en rama mixtos","40 g de piñones","un puñado de berros","12 aceitunas negras, deshuesadas y partidas por la mitad","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","un puñado de menta fresca, finamente picada, para servir","2 panes planos, calientes, para servir","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","½ limón, exprimido","1 diente de ajo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes","1½ cucharadita de tahini","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva"]','["Mezcle el aceite y el ajo y luego frote la mitad sobre las chuletas de cordero. Sazone bien y luego déjelo marinar. Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.","Coloque los tomates en una bandeja para hornear, luego rocíelos con la mezcla de aceite restante y sazone. Cocine durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté suave, agregando los piñones durante los últimos 2-3 minutos para tostar.","Haga el hummus mezclando todos los ingredientes con 2-3 cucharadas de agua hasta que quede suave.","Calienta una sartén a fuego medio-alto y cocina el cordero durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que esté cocido a tu gusto. Mantenga el lado graso de la carne contra la sartén durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté crujiente. Cubra y deje reposar durante 5 minutos.","Repartir el hummus en una fuente o cuatro platos y cubrir con los tomates, un chorrito de aceite de oliva, el cordero y los berros. Esparza las aceitunas, los piñones, el queso feta y la menta y sirva con los panes planos."]','2026-01-11 13:01:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14133,5714,'es','Kishir','Disfrute de esta ensalada de trigo bulgur como plato principal vegano o guarnición para acompañar con una pierna de cordero, chuletas o berenjena asada.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada pequeña en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, muy finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 chile rojo, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y cortado en tiras finas","1 chile verde, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y cortado en tiras finas","1¾ cucharada de puré de tomate","250 g de trigo bulgur","4 tomates pera, picados","15 g de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes","semillas de granada de ½ granada (unos 60 g)","30 g de perejil de hoja plana, finamente picado","un puñado grande de hojas de menta, rasgadas","1 limón grande, exprimido","85 ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1¾ cucharada de melaza de granada"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana y saltea la cebolla hasta quitarle el borde crudo. Agregue el ajo y cocine por otros 30 segundos más o menos. Agrega el comino y los chiles y cocina por 1 min más. Agrega el puré de tomate y 175 ml de agua hirviendo. Añade el bulgur, sazona, revuelve todo, retira del fuego, tapa y deja reposar unos 15 minutos. El agua debería haber sido absorbida.","Bifurca los granos para separarlos y airearlos, luego agrega los tomates, las nueces, las semillas de granada y las hierbas y bifurca. Mezcla el jugo de limón, el aceite de oliva virgen extra y la melaza de granada en un tazón pequeño. Agregue tres cuartas partes de esto, luego pruebe para ver si necesita más (si parece tener buen sabor y lo suficientemente húmedo, déjelo).","El kisir puede reposar a temperatura ambiente durante unas horas o taparse en el frigorífico, pero déjelo que alcance la temperatura ambiente antes de servirlo."]','2026-01-11 13:01:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14134,7984,'es','Baba ganush','Una deliciosa salsa de berenjena ahumada, perfecta con panes planos o pitas calientes, o sírvela con otros platos del Medio Oriente como parte de una comida para compartir.','["2 berenjenas medianas","40ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","¼ cucharadita de cilantro molido","¼ cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharadas de tahini","1 limón grande, exprimido","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","panes planos o pan de pita, para servir"]','["Calienta la parrilla a su temperatura más alta. Coloque las berenjenas en una bandeja para hornear y cocine a la parrilla durante 35 a 40 minutos o hasta que estén completamente blandas, ennegrecidas y ampolladas, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad con unas pinzas. Reservar y dejar enfriar por completo.","Una vez que las berenjenas estén lo suficientemente frías como para manipularlas, retire suavemente la piel carbonizada y deséchelas. Transfiera la pulpa al bol grande de un procesador de alimentos junto con 30 ml de aceite, el cilantro, el comino, el tahini, el limón y la mitad del perejil. Sazone y presione la pulpa tres o cuatro veces para crear una salsa de textura gruesa.","Transfiera la salsa a un tazón y rocíe con el aceite restante, esparza sobre el perejil sobrante y sirva con panes planos calientes o pita."]','2026-01-11 13:01:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14135,7986,'es','huevos turcos','¿Busca un plato caliente de comida reconfortante para dos? Estos fáciles huevos escalfados turcos vegetarianos pueden estar listos en solo 20 minutos','["1 chile rojo, finamente cortado","50 g de mantequilla","1 diente de ajo, machacado","200 g de yogur griego","½ limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","2 huevos medianos","2 cucharaditas de zumaque","cilantro en paquete pequeño, hojas recogidas","tostadas, para servir"]','["Pon el chile y la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña y derrítelos a fuego muy suave para asegurar que el sabor del chile se impregne mientras preparas el resto del plato.","Batir el ajo con el yogur. Sazona bien y agrega el jugo de limón. Lleve una cacerola grande con agua a fuego lento. Agrega el vinagre, haz un remolino con una cuchara grande y luego rompe cada huevo en el agua. Escalfar durante 3 minutos hasta que cuaje, luego escurrir sobre papel de cocina.","Para servir, ponga la mitad del yogur en cada tazón, agregue un huevo escalfado a cada uno y luego rocíe con la mantequilla de chile derretida. Sazone, cubra con zumaque y hojas de cilantro y sirva con tostadas."]','2026-01-11 13:01:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14136,7988,'es','Brochetas turcas con salsa de tomate y chile','Estas brochetas de pollo picantes se pueden marinar el día anterior para darle más sabor. Envuélvalo en un pan plano tibio y cubra con chile encurtido y yogur refrescante.','["2 dientes de ajo","200 g de yogur griego","1 limón, exprimido","2 cucharaditas de puré de tomate","2 cucharaditas de hojuelas de chile (las de Alepo son buenas)","2 cucharaditas de zumaque","4 pechugas de pollo, cortadas en trozos","300 g de tomates pera pequeños","1 chile rojo del tamaño de un pulgar, sin tallo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en rodajas","1 cucharada de melaza de granada","4 panes planos del Medio Oriente","guindillas largas en escabeche (guindillas)","un puñado de cilantro fresco","un puñado de perejil fresco de hoja plana"]','["Triture 1 diente de ajo y mezcle con 3 cucharadas de yogur, el jugo de limón, 1 cucharadita de puré de tomate, la mitad de las especias y un poco de condimento en un tazón mediano. Agrega el pollo, revuelve, tapa y deja enfriar en el refrigerador durante al menos 1 hora o toda la noche.","Prepara la salsa de chile. Ponga 100 g de tomates, la guindilla roja entera, el resto de las especias, el diente de ajo y el puré de tomate, más 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, la mitad de la cebolla morada y la melaza de granada en un procesador de alimentos. Agregue un poco de condimento y presione hasta obtener un puré, luego reserve.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y calentar una plancha. Enhebre el pollo en brochetas de metal o de madera que hayan sido remojadas y luego limpie el exceso de marinada. Ensarta los tomates restantes en una brocheta aparte. Engrase ligeramente la plancha con el aceite de oliva restante y dore el pollo por ambos lados, luego transfiéralo a una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 10 minutos, o hasta que esté bien cocido. Mientras tanto, asa los tomates a la plancha durante 1-2 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad para que tengan marcas de plancha en ambos lados.","Sirva el pollo y los tomates sobre panes planos con la cebolla morada restante, los chiles encurtidos, el yogur griego restante, el perejil y el cilantro con una cucharada de salsa de chile."]','2026-01-11 13:01:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14137,7990,'es','Pan plano de cordero turco','Un aperitivo perfecto para una fiesta: prepara este pan plano de cordero especiado, cortado en cuadritos y observa cómo desaparece en minutos','["1 cucharadita de levadura seca","400 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de sal","un poco de aceite","sémola, para espolvorear","500 g de carne magra de pierna de cordero, finamente picada (o carne picada magra)","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de hojuelas de chile turco o 1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile turco","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","4 cucharadas de puré de tomate","Lata de 400 g de tomates pera, escurridos","4 cucharadas de melaza de granada, más un poco más para rociar","2 cebollas moradas pequeñas, cortadas en medias lunas","50 g de piñones","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","2 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana picado","50 g de semillas de granada"]','["Mezcle la levadura y 250 ml de agua tibia en un tazón pequeño y déjelo reposar durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que esté espumoso; esto significa que la levadura está funcionando. Coloque la harina y la sal en un tazón grande para mezclar (o use una batidora de mesa equipada con un gancho para masa y a velocidad baja). Agrega la mezcla de levadura y mezcla a mano o a máquina hasta que la masa forme una bola. Si la mezcla está demasiado pegajosa para formar una bola, agregue 2 cucharadas de harina y mezcle nuevamente. Amasar durante 12 minutos a mano, o de 8 a 10 minutos a alta velocidad en la batidora, hasta que quede suave, luego poner en un bol ligeramente engrasado. Voltee para cubrir la masa con aceite, cubra con film transparente y déjela en un lugar cálido durante 2-4 horas hasta que doble su tamaño. (También puedes meterlo en el frigorífico durante la noche, golpearlo y dejarlo crecer nuevamente a temperatura ambiente).","Calienta el horno a 240C/220C/gas 9. Coloca una bandeja para hornear o una piedra para pizza en el estante del medio. Si usa carne de pierna de cordero, tritúrela en un procesador de alimentos hasta que esté finamente picada. Calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto hasta que esté caliente. Agrega la cebolla y el ajo y cocina por 10 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Agregue el cordero y cocine durante 5 minutos o hasta que se dore, rompiendo los grumos con una cuchara, luego retire el exceso de aceite. Agrega las especias, un poco de condimento, el puré de tomate, los tomates y la melaza de granada, y cocina por 5 minutos más, mezclando todo bien y rompiendo los tomates con una cuchara. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar por completo. Se puede realizar con uno o dos días de antelación.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie enharinada hasta formar un rectángulo grande de unos 30 x 40 cm. Espolvoree aproximadamente 1 cucharadita de sémola en una bandeja para hornear. Pon la masa encima y asegúrate de que pueda moverse. Agregue primero el cordero picante, luego cubra con las cebollas moradas, los piñones y el queso feta. Deslícela sobre la bandeja para hornear caliente o piedra para pizza y cocine durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que esté crujiente en el fondo.","Retirar y rociar con un poco más de melaza de granada, luego espolvorear sobre el perejil y las semillas de granada. Transfiera a una tabla grande y córtela en diamantes para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14138,7994,'es','Pilaf turco con azafrán y bayas de goji','Hemos elaborado la receta definitiva para la salud del cerebro, repleta de nutrientes que estimulan el cerebro, como canela, almendras y bayas de goji.','["2 dientes de ajo grandes","pizca generosa de azafrán","3 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","200 g de muslo de pavo sin piel cortado en cubitos","85 g de arroz basmati integral","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras","3 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo fresco","1 cucharada de bayas de goji secas","1 cebolla mediana, partida por la mitad y en rodajas muy finas","100 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca","25 g de almendras laminadas"]','["Pica finamente el ajo y reserva para que se active (ver consejo). Mientras tanto, vierta 2 cucharadas de agua hirviendo sobre el azafrán y reserve para infusionar. Caliente 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén grande antiadherente con tapa, luego agregue el pavo y fríalo durante 5 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que comience a dorarse.","Agrega el arroz y la canela a la sartén, luego vierte 400 ml de agua hirviendo y el caldo, y revuelve bien. Agrega el apio, el tomillo, las bayas de goji y mucha pimienta negra molida. Tapar bien la cacerola para evitar que se escape el vapor y cocinar a fuego lento durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite restante en una sartén antiadherente y añade la cebolla. Cuando empiece a ablandarse, tapa la sartén durante 5 minutos para que se cocine un poco más al vapor. Retire la tapa y fría lentamente durante 12-15 minutos hasta que estén dorados, revolviendo con frecuencia.","Después de que el arroz se haya cocinado durante 20 minutos, verifique el nivel del agua; si el arroz todavía tiene demasiado sabor a nuez y se ha absorbido todo el líquido, agregue hasta 100 ml más de agua. Agregue el azafrán, cubra nuevamente y cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno.","Agrega el ajo y las espinacas, cocina brevemente para que las hojas se ablanden y luego apaga el fuego. Agregue las cebollas fritas y las almendras. Tapar la cacerola y dejar reposar 5 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14139,7996,'es','Huevos de Oriente Medio con merguez y pistachos','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). Aporta algunos sabores atrevidos a este brunch para dos con harissa, zumaque y pistachos; cámbialos por chipolatas o chorizo ​​si lo prefieres.','["un chorrito de aceite de oliva o de colza","1 cebolla morada pequeña, picada","4 salchichas merguez","15 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","una pizca de azúcar (cualquiera servirá)","2 cucharaditas de pasta de harissa (preferiblemente harissa de rosas, ya que es fragante y no demasiado picante)","2 huevos","2 panes pita integrales","pizca de zumaque o pimentón (opcional)","2 cucharadas de yogur griego","unas ramitas de perejil picado","1 cucharada de pistacho sin cáscara, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta un chorrito de aceite en una sartén pequeña de fondo grueso (una de hierro fundido es perfecta). Agrega la cebolla y cocina por unos minutos hasta que esté suave, luego empújala hacia un lado de la sartén. Añade las salchichas y fríelas durante 5-10 minutos, dándoles vueltas en la sartén hasta que estén doradas. Añade los tomates, el azúcar y la harissa, sazona bien y añade un chorrito de agua. Cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que los tomates se hayan cocido hasta obtener una salsa espesa y con trozos.","Aparta las salchichas en la sartén para que puedas crear 2 agujeros grandes en la salsa con una cuchara. Rompe los huevos en los agujeros y cocina durante 4-5 minutos hasta que las claras estén cuajadas y la yema aún líquida. Mientras tanto, tuesta los panes pita.","Espolvorea cada huevo con un poco de zumaque, añade un poco de yogur y luego espolvorea el perejil y los pistachos. Corta cada pan de pita por la mitad y sírvelo a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14140,7998,'es','hamburguesas de falafel','Prepare garbanzos con ajo, especias y hierbas para preparar deliciosas hamburguesas vegetarianas para el almuerzo o la cena.','["250 g de garbanzos de lata","1 cebolla mediana, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","paquete pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado","2 cucharadas colmadas de harina común","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","100g hummus","4 panes para hamburguesa, cortados por la mitad","berros, para servir"]','["Escurrir, enjuagar y secar bien los garbanzos, luego verterlos en el recipiente de un procesador de alimentos. Pulse hasta que se rompa ligeramente en migajas gruesas.","Agrega la cebolla, el ajo, las especias, el perejil, la harina y un poco de condimento, y continúa pulsando hasta que se combinen. Con las manos, forme suavemente con la mezcla 4 hamburguesas de unos 10 cm de diámetro y 2 cm de grosor.","En una sartén grande, calienta el aceite y fríe los falafels por cada lado durante 2-3 minutos o hasta que estén dorados (es posible que tengas que hacerlo en tandas). Asa ligeramente los panes de hamburguesa por el lado cortado en una sartén o tuéstalos debajo de la parrilla.","Unte un lado de cada panecillo con hummus, cubra con una hamburguesa de falafel, agregue un puñado de berros y luego coloque la mitad restante del panecillo encima."]','2026-01-11 13:01:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14141,4545,'es','Falafels de guisantes con ensalada de cuscús y menta','Dale un cambio de imagen al falafel usando una mezcla de garbanzos y guisantes congelados, sírvelo con cuscús y una cucharada de yogur para una comida económica pero sabrosa.','["400 g de guisantes congelados","400 g de garbanzos escurridos","3 cucharadas de harina, más un poco para espolvorear","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní suave o tahini","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","manojo pequeño de menta, picada","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","200 g de cuscús","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 tomates grandes, picados","100ml de yogur natural"]','["Pon los guisantes en un colador y pásalos bajo el grifo de agua caliente para descongelarlos. Escurrir bien, luego\r\nPon la mitad en un procesador de alimentos. Agrega los garbanzos, la harina, el ajo, las semillas de comino, la mantequilla de maní o tahini, el perejil, la ralladura de limón y abundante condimento. Batir los ingredientes\r\nhasta obtener una pasta, agregando un chorrito de agua si se ve demasiado quebradiza. Con las manos mojadas, forme 8 hamburguesas con la mezcla, espolvoree con harina, luego colóquelas en un plato y déjelas enfriar durante 10 minutos, o más si tiene tiempo. Hervir la tetera.","Coloque el cuscús en un tazón grande, sazone y luego viértalo con suficiente agua hirviendo para cubrirlo. Reservar durante 5 minutos.","Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén grande. Cocine los falafels durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado, hasta que estén crujientes y dorados; es posible que tenga que hacerlo en tandas, así que manténgalos calientes en el horno bajo mientras lo hace. Agrega el aceite restante, el jugo de limón, la menta, los tomates y los guisantes al cuscús. Sirve la ensalada y los falafels con una cucharada de yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:01:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14142,8000,'es','wraps de pollo libanés','Marina el pollo en yogur, limón y pimienta de Jamaica antes de asarlo y envolverlo en pan plano con ensalada para disfrutar de una comida ligera y deliciosa entre semana.','["4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","200 g de yogur griego","jugo y ralladura de 1 limón","1 cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo machacados","25 g de piñones tostados","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","2 tomates, cortados en cubitos","½ pepino, cortado en cubitos","4 tortillas grandes o panes planos grandes","ensalada mixta, para servir"]','["Coloque las pechugas de pollo sobre una hoja de papel para hornear, cúbralas con otra hoja de papel y luego aplánelas golpeándolas con un rodillo. Mezcla en un bol grande la mitad del yogur con la mitad del zumo de limón, la ralladura de limón, la pimienta de Jamaica, el aceite de oliva, el ajo y una pizca de sal. Mezcle bien, luego agregue el pollo, asegurándose de que quede bien cubierto con la mezcla. Cubra y enfríe durante 30 minutos para marinar.","Calienta una sartén a fuego alto y cocina el pollo durante 5 a 6 minutos por cada lado o hasta que esté bien cocido (es posible que tengas que hacerlo en tandas). Transfiera a una tabla y corte. Extiende el resto del yogur sobre los wraps y rellena con los piñones, el pollo cocido, el perejil, los tomates y el pepino. Rociar con el resto del jugo de limón y enrollar. Vuelva a colocar los wraps en la plancha durante 30 segundos por cada lado para que se tuesten ligeramente y luego sirva con una ensalada mixta."]','2026-01-11 13:01:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14143,4740,'es','Falafels con hummus y tabulé','Haga sus propios buñuelos de garbanzos y judías blancas y sírvalos con una ensalada de cuscús con hierbas; la receta es suficiente para dos comidas.','["1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","Lata de 400 g de alubias, escurridas","jugo ½ limón","cilantro en paquetes pequeños, incluidos los tallos","¼ de chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 yema de huevo batida","perejil en paquete pequeño","4 cucharadas de harina integral","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 cucharada de pasta de tahini","pizca de comino molido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","jugo ½ limón","50 g de cuscús de cebada","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","jugo 1 limon","paquete pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","paquete pequeño de menta, finamente picada","cilantro en paquetes pequeños, finamente picado","2 cebolletas, solo las partes blancas, cortadas finamente","½ pepino, sin semillas y cortado en trozos pequeños","3 tomates, cortados en cuartos, sin semillas y cortados en trozos pequeños"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y poner dentro una bandeja de horno antiadherente. Para los falafels, caliente una sartén antiadherente grande, agregue el comino y las semillas de cilantro y fríalos hasta que estén fragantes (1-2 minutos), revolviendo ocasionalmente para evitar que se quemen. Retirar de la sartén.","Coloque las semillas, el resto de los ingredientes del falafel y un poco de condimento en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta con trozos. Si parece demasiado seco, agregue 1 cucharadita de agua y vuelva a mezclar hasta obtener la consistencia de arena húmeda. Con las manos, divida la mezcla en 12 bolas de falafel y déjela enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente. Cuando esté caliente, agregue las bolas de falafel, presionando hacia abajo en la sartén para hacer hamburguesas. Deje cocinar, sin voltear, durante 2-3 minutos, luego verifique que estén dorados y crujientes. Voltee y cocine el otro lado por 2 minutos más. Retirar de la sartén, transferir a la bandeja para hornear en el horno y cocinar por 10 minutos más. Mientras tanto, prepara el cuscús de cebada siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Para el hummus, ponga todos los ingredientes, excepto el limón, en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta formar una pasta firme. Con el motor en marcha, agregue lentamente el jugo de limón y hasta 3 cucharadas de agua para obtener la consistencia que desee.","Para el tabulé, mezcla el aceite de oliva, el jugo de limón y un poco de pimienta negra en un bol pequeño. En un tazón más grande, combine el resto de los ingredientes del tabulé junto con el cuscús cocido y agregue el aderezo. Mezclar bien.","Guarde 4 falafels y 4 cucharadas de hummus en el refrigerador para las pittas marroquíes rellenas (ver \"combina bien\", a la derecha). Sirva los falafels restantes con el hummus restante y el tabulé."]','2026-01-11 13:01:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14144,8002,'es','Falafels con salsa picante de tomate y anacardos y verduras de primavera escalfadas','Un festín de garbanzos vegano y sin gluten con una deliciosa salsa y espárragos, zanahorias, rábanos y habas escalfados','["200 g de garbanzos secos","25 g de perejil, hojas recogidas y tallos reservados para el caldo","2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","1 chalote de plátano, picado en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","1½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","¼ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","½ cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten","aceite de girasol o de colza, para freír","chorrito de vino blanco (vegano si es necesario, opcional)","1 hoja de laurel","1 chalote de plátano, picado en trozos grandes","1 corazón de apio o 2 tallos, cortados en trozos","pizca de pimienta entera","200 g de zanahorias baby, peladas (si las partes verdes están intactas, deja un tallo corto)","1 bulbo de hinojo, recortado y cortado en gajos finos","20 puntas de espárragos (unos 200 g)","12 rábanos rosados ​​(unos 100 g), cortados por la mitad","100 g de habas frescas o congeladas, sin vainas y sin piel","100 g de semillas de granada en tarrina","25 g de anacardos","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile o al gusto","1 cucharada de aceite de colza o girasol prensado en frío","300 g de tomates cortados en trozos","4 dientes de ajo","1 cucharada de sirope de agave o azúcar moreno"]','["Prepara los garbanzos. Ponlos en un bol grande y cúbrelos con al menos 3 veces su volumen de agua fría. Cubra y déjelo en remojo durante al menos 8 horas o toda la noche.","Para hacer la mezcla de falafel, escurre los garbanzos y luego colócalos en un procesador de alimentos con un poco de condimento. (No se preocupe si los garbanzos todavía se sienten bastante firmes en esta etapa; así es como deben estar. Agregue las hojas de perejil al procesador de alimentos junto con el resto de los ingredientes del falafel. Batir a velocidad alta, agregando 2-3 cucharadas de agua, hasta que se forme una mezcla suave pero bastante sólida. Vierta en un tazón y cubra.","Poner todos los ingredientes para el caldo de escalfar, más 1 cucharadita de sal, 800 ml de agua y los tallos de perejil reservados, en una cacerola mediana y llevar a ebullición. Cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos y reserve.","Mientras tanto, haz la salsa. Pon los anacardos, las semillas de sésamo, el comino y las hojuelas de guindilla en una sartén seca a fuego medio. Tuesta, revolviendo frecuentemente, hasta que las semillas de sésamo comiencen a dorarse. Retirar a un plato para que se enfríe. Agrega el aceite a la sartén y vuelve al fuego, agregando los tomates y el ajo. Cocine a fuego medio hasta que los tomates se colapsen, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Deje enfriar durante unos minutos, luego transfiéralo a una licuadora junto con las nueces tostadas y las especias, el agave o el azúcar y una pizca generosa de sal. Batir a velocidad alta hasta que quede suave. Dejar en la licuadora y reservar.","Mientras tanto, haz las bolas de falafel. Use las manos mojadas para formar bolas del tamaño de cerezas grandes y colóquelas en una bandeja; debería tener suficiente para hacer de 20 a 24 bolas. Las bolas se pueden preparar con un día de anticipación y enfriar.","Aproximadamente 15 minutos antes de servir, cuele el líquido para escalfar, luego devuelva el líquido a la sartén y deje hervir a fuego lento. Calienta una profundidad de 5 cm de aceite para freír en una sartén grande de base pesada a fuego medio. Cuando el aceite esté lo suficientemente caliente, un pequeño trozo de pan que se le caiga debería dorarse en 20-30 segundos. Sumerja con cuidado las bolas de falafel en el aceite y cocínelas en tandas de 6 a la vez. Freír hasta que estén completamente dorados, aproximadamente 3 minutos. Retirar con una espumadera y escurrir sobre papel de cocina, y mantener caliente en el horno mientras cocinas las tandas restantes. Deja a un lado el aceite de forma segura.","Por último, pochar las verduras. Agregue las zanahorias al líquido para escalfar y cocine durante 3-5 minutos dependiendo del tamaño, luego agregue las verduras restantes. Vuelva a hervir y cocine a fuego lento durante 3 minutos más. Colar las verduras desechando el líquido.","Para servir, primero bata la salsa una vez más (tiene tendencia a separarse). Coloque cucharadas de salsa en cada plato caliente (una cucharada por cada falafel queda bien). Divida el falafel y las verduras tiernas entre los platos, espolvoree con semillas de granada y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14145,8004,'es','Ensalada de zanahoria y queso feta del Medio Oriente','Una ensalada sencilla repleta de sabores soleados, desde comino, canela y cilantro hasta limones, pasas y queso.','["Bolsa de 1 kg de zanahorias, peladas, partidas por la mitad a lo largo y cortadas en trozos","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","2 cucharadas de miel líquida","jugo 2 limones","50 g de pasas o pasas","Paquete de 200 g de queso feta.","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro o perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua. Agregue las zanahorias y cocine durante unos 8 a 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Mientras tanto, en un tazón grande, mezcle las semillas de comino, las especias molidas, la miel y el jugo de limón, con un poco de condimento, usando un batidor o tenedor pequeño.","Escurre las zanahorias, déjalas secar al vapor durante unos minutos en el colador y luego mézclalas con el aderezo con las pasas o las pasas. Dejar a temperatura ambiente.","Para servir, desmenuce el queso feta y espolvoréelo con las hierbas. Mezcle suavemente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14146,6118,'es','Huevos escoceses de falafel','Combine dos platos ganadores en esta receta apta para picnic de huevos cubiertos con garbanzos con hierbas y especias.','["9 huevos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para enrollar","2 cebollas grandes, picadas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, solo las hojas","200 g de pan rallado integral","5 cucharadas de harina común, más un poco más para espolvorear","25 g de panko o pan rallado seco","3 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","aceite de girasol o vegetal, para freír"]','["Pon 8 de los huevos en una cacerola con agua fría. Llevar a ebullición, cocinar durante 5 minutos, luego sacar rápidamente de la sartén y sumergir en un recipiente grande con agua fría para que se enfríe. Una vez que esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, pélelo.","Mientras se enfrían los huevos, poner en una sartén el aceite, la cebolla y el ajo. Freír muy suavemente hasta que estén muy suaves y empiecen a dorarse. Agrega las especias y sofríe unos minutos más. Vierta en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta, luego agregue los garbanzos y las hojas de cilantro y presione hasta que estén finamente picados pero no pastosos. Agrega el pan rallado integral, la harina y el último huevo, batido primero con un tenedor, con una buena cantidad de condimento.","Divida la mezcla en 8. Tome una porción a la vez y aplánela entre las manos (frótelas con un poco más de aceite si se pega demasiado a los dedos). Enrolle 1 de sus huevos pelados en un poco de harina, agítelo para eliminar el exceso, luego envuélvalo con la mezcla de falafel, moldeándolo para cubrir completamente el huevo y aplastándolo en las uniones para sellarlo. Repita para cubrir todos los huevos. Coloque el panko o el pan rallado seco en un plato y mezcle las semillas de sésamo. Enrolle cada huevo para cubrirlo. Se puede preparar con 1 día de anticipación, cubrirlo ligeramente con film transparente y enfriar.","Consigue una cacerola grande y profunda y llénala hasta la mitad con aceite, o utiliza una freidora. Calienta hasta que un poco de pan se dore en unos 30 segundos. Agregue un par de huevos a la vez y fríalos, volteándolos, hasta que estén muy dorados y crujientes, aproximadamente 2 minutos. Levante sobre papel de cocina para escurrir mientras cocina el resto de los huevos en tandas. Sazona con un poco más de sal y come tibio o frío."]','2026-01-11 13:01:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14147,8006,'es','Falafel de arándanos y castañas','Añade un poco de espíritu de temporada a tus bocados de garbanzos con frutas y frutos secos. Sirva con una salsa cremosa de yogur y cilantro fresco.','["1 camote, pelado y cortado en trozos grandes","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","200g de castañas ya cocidas y envasadas al vacío","1 huevo grande","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","1 diente de ajo","paquete pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes y un poco más para servir","85 g de arándanos, descongelados si están congelados y cortados a la mitad si tienes tiempo","4 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","150 g de yogur cremoso estilo griego, para servir"]','["Coloque la batata en un recipiente apto para microondas, agregue 1 cucharadita de agua y cocine a temperatura alta durante 2 minutos. Triture en un tazón grande.","Pon los garbanzos y las castañas en un procesador de alimentos y pulsa hasta que estén bien picados pero no pastosos. Coloque encima la batata, luego agregue el huevo, las especias, el ajo y el cilantro. Sazone generosamente y mezcle bien con las manos. Agrega los arándanos. Forme bolas de la mezcla del tamaño de una cuchara de postre para formar unas 20 hamburguesas. Se puede preparar con anticipación y enfriar hasta por 3 días.","Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande. Freír la mitad de los falafels durante 2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados. Levantar sobre papel de cocina para escurrir. Repita con el segundo lote. Se puede preparar con hasta 2 días de anticipación y recalentar. Deje que el falafel se enfríe durante unos minutos antes de servirlo con el yogur y un poco de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:01:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14148,8008,'es','Ensalada de zanahoria del Medio Oriente','Una ensalada rallada, ligera y vibrante, aromatizada con agua de azahar, comino y menta, que se sirve junto con carnes especiadas.','["½ cucharadita de agua de azahar","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","jugo ½ limón","500 g de zanahorias ralladas o ralladas","un puñado grande de hojas pequeñas de menta"]','["Poner el agua de azahar, el comino,\r\naceite, jugo de limón y un poco de condimento\r\nen un frasco. Enrosque la tapa y agite.\r\nbien para combinar.","Vierta las zanahorias y la menta en un bol.\r\nVierta sobre el aderezo, sazone y revuelva.\r\ntodo junto."]','2026-01-11 13:01:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14149,4481,'es','Poussin libanés con pilaf de berenjena especiado','Esta comida al estilo del Medio Oriente es una cena deliciosa para dos: sirva a sus pollitos con un acompañamiento de arroz picante y aromático.','["1 berenjena, cortada en cubitos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco extra","2 poussin pequeños","¼ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica, más 2 pizcas buenas","2 hojas de laurel","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","100 g de arroz basmati","2 cucharadas de piñones","½ cucharadita de canela molida","una buena pizca de clavo molido","200 ml de caldo de pollo caliente (o alternativa sin gluten)","2 cucharadas de grosellas","1 tomate grande, picado","1 cucharada de menta picada, más unas cuantas hojas y ramitas para servir","1 cucharada de eneldo picado, más unas cuantas hojas y ramitas para servir","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada","zumaque, para espolvorear (opcional; usamos Bart)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4. Mezcle\r\nla berenjena en 1 cucharada de aceite hasta que esté bien\r\nrecubierto. Vierta en una fuente para asar grande y luego\r\nEmpuje hacia los lados de la lata para hacer una\r\nespacio para los poussins. Frote un poco de aceite sobre\r\nla piel de los poussins, espolvorear con la\r\npizcas de pimienta de Jamaica, sal y mucho negro\r\npimienta, introducir una hoja de laurel dentro de cada ave,\r\nluego ase durante 35 minutos. (Dejar cocer durante\r\nunos 10 minutos antes de empezar el pilaf\r\npara que estén listos al mismo tiempo.)","Para hacer el pilaf, calentar el\r\n1 cucharada de aceite restante en una sartén mediana\r\ny sofreír la cebolla durante 5-8 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado. Añade el arroz y los piñones.\r\nrevuelva durante aproximadamente 1 minuto, luego agregue las especias,\r\nincluyendo ¼ de cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica. Vierta el\r\ncaldo, agregue las grosellas y luego cubra\r\nla sartén y cocine por 7 minutos.","Quitar la tapa de la cacerola, agregar el\r\ntomate, menta y eneldo, luego tapar y\r\ncocine 2-3 minutos más hasta que el caldo tenga\r\nse ha absorbido y el arroz está tierno.\r\nReservar tapado para mantener el calor.","Mientras tanto, una vez que los poussins\r\nhayan tenido sus 35 minutos, rocíe el\r\nmelaza de granada encima y\r\ndevolverlos al horno por 10 minutos más\r\nhasta que estén tiernas ellas y las berenjenas.","Deja los poussins a un lado para que reposen unos\r\nminutos mientras echas la berenjena\r\nel pilaf. Sirva los poussins enteros o\r\nporcione y sirva encima del pilaf.\r\nEsparcir con el eneldo y las hojas de menta y\r\nespolvorea con un poco de zumaque, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:01:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14150,8010,'es','Halloumi con tabulé de brócoli y aderezo de harissa y miel','El cuscús es una base excelente para una ensalada rápida. Condimente con harissa ahumada, miel dulce y hierbas, luego cubra con rodajas de queso frito','["140 g de cuscús","300 g de floretes de brócoli","6 cebolletas, finamente cortadas","150 g de tomates cherry cortados en cuartos","manojo grande de perejil, finamente picado","manojo pequeño de menta, finamente picada","jugo de 2 limones, ralladura de ½ limón","2½ cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1½ cucharada de harissa","1 cucharada de miel clara","2 paquetes de 250 g de queso halloumi, cortado en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor","25 g de almendras laminadas tostadas"]','["Poner el cuscús en un bol y\r\ncubrir con agua hirviendo. Cubrir con\r\nfilm transparente y dejar reposar durante 5 minutos.","Blanquear el brócoli durante 2 minutos y luego\r\nescurrir bien. Cortarlo en trozos pequeños o bombardearlo.\r\nen un procesador de alimentos.","Con un tenedor el brócoli, las cebolletas,\r\ntomates, hierbas, ralladura de limón, el jugo\r\nde 1½ limones y 2 cucharadas de aceite por el\r\ncuscús. Sazone y mezcle bien.","Para hacer el aderezo, combine el\r\nharissa, miel, jugo de limón restante\r\ny aceite y un poco de condimento.","Calentar una sartén antiadherente y cocinar.\r\nel halloumi durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado\r\nhasta que esté dorado. Dividir el cuscús\r\nentre los platos, cubra con el\r\nrodajas de halloumi y aderezo, luego\r\nesparcir sobre las almendras."]','2026-01-11 13:01:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14151,8012,'es','Pizza turca con carne de granada especiada y queso feta','La pizza casera siempre gana a la comida para llevar: pruebe esta nueva idea de aderezo con carne picada especiada, pimientos dulces Peppadew, queso feta y piñones.','["Paquete de 500 g de mezcla para pan","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva, más un poquito extra para la masa","2 cebollas medianas, picadas","2 dientes de ajo, picados","250 g de carne picada extra magra","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","1 cucharada de hojuelas de chile rojo","5 cucharadas de puré de tomate","6 cucharadas de melaza de granada","Frasco de 400 g de pimientos peppadews dulces en escabeche, picados en trozos grandes","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","1 cucharada de piñones"]','["Mezclar la masa siguiente paquete.\r\ninstrucciones (deje unas 2 cucharadas de\r\nmezcla de pan en la bolsa para espolvorear y\r\nimplementar más tarde). Amasar durante 8-10 minutos,\r\nluego cubrir la masa con aceite, colocar en un\r\ntazón grande y tapa. Dejar leudar hasta\r\nduplicó su tamaño. Cuanto más cálida sea tu cocina\r\nes decir, más rápido aumentará, pero generalmente\r\ndebería tomar 1-2 horas.","Caliente el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9 (o\r\nel ajuste más alto). Espolvorea 2 bandejas para horno con un poco de la harina reservada.\r\ny meter en el horno para que se caliente.","Calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande hasta que\r\ncaliente. Agregue las cebollas y el ajo y cocine por\r\nunos minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega la carne y\r\ndéjelo dorar durante unos 5 minutos, rompiéndolo\r\nla carne picada mientras se cocina. Retirar el exceso\r\naceite. Agregue las especias, la guindilla, 2 cucharadas de\r\npuré de tomate, 5 cucharadas de granada\r\nmelaza y algún condimento. cocinar\r\ndurante 1 min, luego retirar del fuego.","Dividir la masa en 6 bolas. Espolvorea el\r\nharina restante sobre una superficie de trabajo y enrollar\r\nSaque la masa, cada una de unos 25 cm de ancho.\r\nRetirar las bandejas del horno y colocar\r\n2 bases de pizza para cada una (necesitarás cocinar\r\nen lotes). Untar el tomate restante\r\nhacer puré en cada base. Cubra con la carne\r\nmezcla, pimientos, queso feta y piñones.\r\nCocine por 10 minutos o hasta que las bases estén\r\nbien cocido y dorado alrededor\r\nlos bordes. Rocíe sobre el resto\r\nmelaza de granada y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14152,8014,'es','tabulé','Esta ensalada fresca y saludable utiliza principalmente hierbas con un poco de trigo bulgur.','["50 g de trigo bulgar","50 g de perejil de hoja plana, picado","50 g de menta picada","200 g de tomates maduros, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","3 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","jugo 1 limon","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Enjuagar el trigo bulgar en un colador.\r\nhasta que el agua salga clara. Escurrir bien,\r\nluego transfiéralo a un tazón. Vierta más de 200 ml\r\nagua hirviendo, cubrir con film transparente y\r\ndejar en remojo durante 30 minutos más o menos mientras\r\nTú preparas el resto de los ingredientes.","Reservando el perejil en manojo, picarlo.\r\nlas hojas con brusquedad. No te preocupes por el\r\ninclusión de algunos de los tallos; todo esto suma\r\nal sabor. Ahora haz lo mismo con el\r\nmenta. Ponga las hierbas picadas en una cacerola grande.\r\nen un bol y añade el tomate y la cebolleta.","Escurra bien el bulghar y luego agréguelo a\r\nmezcla de hierbas, junto con jugo de limón y aceituna\r\naceite. Mezclar bien, sazonar y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14153,8016,'es','Bolsillos de falafel de calabaza','Haz algo de magia en tu microondas con estos bolsillos de calabaza o calabaza moscada fáciles de preparar','["1 kg de calabazas o calabacines, sin semillas y cortados en gajos","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos, enjuagados y secos","1 diente de ajo, picado","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharadita de comino molido","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","2 rebanadas de pan blanco, desmenuzado","2 zanahorias, ralladas gruesas","½ cebolla morada pequeña, finamente cortada","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","4 panes pita integrales para servir"]','["Pon la calabaza en un recipiente apto para microondas.\r\nbol y cubrir con film transparente. cocinar en\r\nAlto durante 10 minutos o hasta que esté suave. Inclina el\r\ngarbanzos, ajo, hojuelas de guindilla, comino y\r\nla mitad del perejil en un procesador de alimentos,\r\nluego bate hasta que los garbanzos estén finamente\r\npicado pero no suave.","Deje que la calabaza se enfríe un poco y luego\r\nretire la pulpa de la piel y agréguela\r\nla mezcla de garbanzos con un poco de condimento\r\ny el pan rallado. Dale a todo un\r\nrevuelva bien, luego forme 12 hamburguesas pequeñas\r\ncon tus manos. Pon los falafels en un\r\nemplatar y enfriar durante 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el perejil restante.\r\ncon zanahoria rallada, cebolla y queso feta\r\nqueso, luego reservar. Calienta la parrilla para\r\nA fuego medio, luego cocina los falafels en una\r\nbandeja para hornear durante 3-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que\r\ndorado. Divida los panes pita a lo largo.\r\ny rellenar con los falafels calientes y un poco\r\nde la ensalada de queso feta."]','2026-01-11 13:01:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14154,4602,'es','Falafels de camote con ensalada de col','Los pittas repletos de falafels caseros y ensalada son un almuerzo o una cena ligera bajos en grasa por menos de medio kilo por porción.','["1 batata grande o 2 pequeñas, aproximadamente 700 g/1 lb 9 oz en total","1 cucharadita de comino molido","2 dientes de ajo, picados","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","un puñado de hojas de cilantro picadas","jugo ½ limón","100 g de harina normal o de garbanzos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 panes pita integrales","4 cucharadas de humus bajo en grasa","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente cortada","1 zanahoria mediana, rallada","¼ de repollo blanco y rojo, rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nBatata entera al microondas para\r\n8-10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. dejar enfriar\r\nun poco y luego pelar. Poner la patata, el comino,\r\najo, cilantro molido y fresco, limón\r\njugo y harina en un tazón grande. temporada,\r\nluego triture hasta que quede suave. Usando un\r\ncucharada, forme 20 bolas con la mezcla.\r\nColoque en una bandeja para hornear engrasada y hornee durante\r\nunos 15 minutos hasta que las bases estén\r\ndorado, luego darle la vuelta y hornear por\r\n15 minutos más hasta que se dore por completo.","Mientras tanto, revuelva el vinagre y el azúcar.\r\njuntos en un tazón grande hasta que el azúcar\r\nse haya disuelto, echar la cebolla,\r\nzanahoria y repollo, luego dejar reposar\r\nmarinar durante 15 minutos. Para servir, tostar el\r\npittas, luego dividir. Rellenar con ensalada, una cucharada\r\nde hummus y falafels."]','2026-01-11 13:01:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14155,8018,'es','Falafel de remolacha','Dale vida a un favorito vegetariano de todos los tiempos agregando remolacha vibrante: sírvelo con salsa de yogur tahini y remolacha en escabeche.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas picadas","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos","500 g de remolacha cruda, pelada, cortada y rallada gruesa","100 g de pan rallado fresco","1 huevo","1 cucharada de pasta de tahini","aceite vegetal, para untar o freír","1 cucharada de pasta de tahini","2 botes de yogur natural de 150ml","pizca de azúcar","panes planos","unas cuantas remolachas doradas en escabeche, cortadas en cubitos (ver ''Combina bien'')","3 puñados de hojas de remolacha o una bolsa de ensalada de remolacha"]','["Calentar el aceite de oliva en una sartén y\r\nsofreír las cebollas hasta que estén tiernas pero no\r\ncoloreado. Agregue el comino y cocine por\r\n1 min, luego raspar la mezcla\r\nun robot de cocina con los garbanzos,\r\ndos tercios de la remolacha rallada, la\r\npan rallado, huevo y tahini. genio\r\nhasta obtener una pasta áspera, luego raspe hasta obtener\r\ntazón y agregue el resto rallado\r\nremolacha con mucho condimento.","Con las manos húmedas, forme\r\nunas 20 bolas y espacio para hornear\r\nbandejas para hornear forradas con pergamino. relajarse\r\nhasta que esté listo para servir.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPincelar los falafels con un poco de verdura.\r\naceite y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté crujiente\r\ny caliente. Alternativamente, calentar\r\n2,5 cm de aceite en un wok hondo y sofreír\r\nlotes, volteándolos, hasta que estén crujientes y calientes.","Para servir, mezcla el tahini con el yogur,\r\nazúcar y un poco de condimento, luego agregue una cucharada\r\nsobre los panes planos con la salsa tibia o\r\nfalafels a temperatura ambiente, cortados en cubitos\r\nremolacha y hojas de remolacha o ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:01:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14156,8020,'es','Ensalada de cuscús y falafel con yogur de menta','Este plato estilo mezze, sin cocción, se puede preparar en poco tiempo usando ingredientes del supermercado o de delicatessen.','["300 g de cuscús","300 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo caliente","250g de aceitunas en tarrina y queso feta en aceite de oliva","1 cucharada colmada de pasta harissa","2 paquetes de falafel de 200 g","Tarro de 290 g de pimientos rojos asados, escurridos y en rodajas finas","300 g de yogur sin grasa","manojo de menta, picada en trozos grandes"]','["Pon el cuscús en un bol grande.\r\ny verter sobre el caldo. Portada\r\ncon film transparente y dejar actuar 5 min.\r\nhincharse. Escurrir las aceitunas y el queso feta.\r\nreservando un poco del aceite. Revuelva más\r\nde la harissa en el cuscús\r\ncon el aceite reservado, luego sazonar.","Coloca el cuscús en una fuente.\r\ny esparcir sobre el falafel. pila\r\nlos pimientos, las aceitunas y el queso feta a uno\r\nlado. Mezclar el yogur y la mayoría.\r\nde la menta con un poco de condimento en un tazón pequeño, extienda\r\nel resto de la harissa y esparcir\r\nsobre la menta restante. servir\r\ncon ensalada de cuscús y falafel."]','2026-01-11 13:01:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14157,8022,'es','Trigo bulgur con zanahorias y avellanas','Dale gran textura a tu ensalada agregando semillas de calabaza, pasas y avellanas al trigo cocido en caldo.','["600 g de trigo bulgar","140 g de pasas","1 litro de verduras calientes o caldo de pollo","4 zanahorias medianas, ralladas gruesas","100 g de semillas de calabaza","100 g de avellanas tostadas picadas","jugo 1 limón grande","5 cucharadas de aceite de colza"]','["Poner el bulghar y las pasas en un bol.\r\ny verter sobre el caldo caliente. Cubrir con\r\nfilm transparente y dejar reposar durante 20-30 minutos.\r\nel líquido a absorber. una vez\r\nabsorbido, pase un tenedor por los granos\r\nsepararse. Dejar enfriar.","Agrega las zanahorias, las semillas de calabaza,\r\navellanas, jugo de limón y colza\r\naceite y sazonar. Mezclar bien y transferir\r\na un tazón grande para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14158,8024,'es','Bocaditos de falafel de espinacas y queso feta','Estos sencillos canapés se pueden preparar con anticipación y servir en tu fiesta de Navidad.','["200 g de espinacas tiernas","Lata de 400g de garbanzos escurridos","100 g de queso feta","2 cucharaditas de comino","100 g de harina común","aceite vegetal, para freír","tzatziki, servir"]','["Vierta una tetera con agua hirviendo sobre\r\nespinacas tiernas en un colador.\r\nCuando esté lo suficientemente frío para manipularlo, exprima\r\nSaque el agua: haga esto muy bien o\r\nTus falafels quedarán demasiado blandos. Pulso en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos con escurrido\r\ngarbanzos, queso feta, comino y\r\nharina común hasta que esté combinada.\r\nForme bolas del tamaño de una cucharada con bien enharinadas.\r\nmanos, luego aplánelas para formar hamburguesas.","Freír en tandas en aceite vegetal durante 2-3\r\nminutos por cada lado y luego dejar enfriar. Lugar\r\nen una bandeja para horno, cubrir con film transparente\r\ny congelar. Para servir, descongelar en el frigorífico.\r\ntoda la noche y cocinar a 180C/160C ventilador/\r\ngas 4 durante 5-10 minutos. Sirva con tzatziki."]','2026-01-11 13:01:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14159,8026,'es','Cordero al estilo turco','Lleva el sabor del pavo a tu cocina con estas divertidas pittas de cordero, excelente comida preparada para llevar','["4 filetes de pierna de cordero","2 cucharaditas de condimento (usamos el condimento Schwartz Lamb Simply Shake)","1 cucharadita de orégano seco o una mezcla de hierbas sería suficiente","manojo pequeño de menta, solo las hojas, picada","2 tarrinas de 150 g de yogur natural desnatado","4 panes pita, blancos o integrales","½ lechuga iceberg, rallada","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas finas","1 limón, cortado en gajos para exprimir, opcional"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Sazone el cordero, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 2 minutos por cada lado hasta que se dore, pero aún muy crudo. Mientras tanto,\r\nMezcle el condimento, el orégano y la mitad de la menta en uno de los tarrinas de yogur, unte esto sobre el cordero y luego vuelva a la parrilla por otros 2-3 minutos o hasta que el yogur forme ampollas y la carne esté cocida a su gusto.","Deja reposar la carne sobre una tabla durante unos minutos mientras tuestas las pitas, trituras la lechuga y cortas en rodajas finas la cebolla morada. Agrega el resto de la menta al segundo bote de yogur. Cortar la carne en rodajas gruesas y rellenar el pan de pita con la ensalada y el yogur con menta. Si lo desea, exprima jugo de limón antes de servirlo."]','2026-01-11 13:01:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14160,4403,'es','Huevos y pimientos turcos en una sartén (Menemen)','Este atrevido plato es auténtica comida callejera y un fantástico plato familiar para el brunch, el almuerzo o la cena.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, rebanadas","1 pimiento rojo o verde, cortado a la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas","1-2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y rebanados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1-2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","6 cucharadas de yogur espeso y cremoso","2 dientes de ajo machacados"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén de base pesada.\r\nsartén. Agregue las cebollas, el pimiento y\r\nchiles. Cocine hasta que comiencen a ablandarse.\r\nAgrega los tomates y el azúcar, mezclando bien.\r\nCocine hasta que el líquido haya reducido, sazone.","Con una cuchara de madera, crea 4 bolsillos.\r\nen la mezcla de tomate y cascar los huevos\r\nen ellos. Tapar la cacerola y cocinar el\r\nhuevos a fuego lento hasta que cuajen.","Batir el yogur con el ajo y\r\ntemporada. Espolvorea el menemen con\r\nperejil y servir de la sartén\r\ncon un chorrito de yogur con sabor a ajo."]','2026-01-11 13:01:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14161,8028,'es','Pilau de cordero turco','Sirva una olla de arroz basmati aromatizado con canela, menta y albaricoque, adornado con cordero tierno.','["un puñado pequeño de piñones o almendras laminadas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","2 ramas de canela, partidas por la mitad","500 g de filete magro de cuello de cordero cortado en cubitos","250 g de arroz basmati","1 pastilla de caldo de cordero o de verduras","12 orejones listos para comer","un puñado de hojas de menta fresca, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Freír los piñones o las almendras en una sartén grande hasta que estén ligeramente tostados y luego verterlos en un plato. Agrega el aceite a la sartén, luego sofríe la cebolla y la canela juntas hasta que empiecen a dorarse. Subir el fuego, incorporar el cordero, freír hasta que la carne cambie de color, luego verter el arroz y cocinar durante 1 min, revolviendo todo el tiempo.","Vierta 500 ml de agua hirviendo, desmenúcela en la pastilla de caldo, agregue los albaricoques y luego sazone al gusto. Baje el fuego, tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 12 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno y se haya absorbido el caldo. Agregue los piñones y la menta y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:01:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14162,8030,'es','Tabulé de falafel con yogur de limón','Un plato de ensalada perfecto para compartir con toda la familia','["16 falafel ya preparados","200 g de cuscús","2 limones grandes, 1 rallado, el jugo de ambos","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","manojo de cebolletas, cortadas finamente","1 pepino, partido por la mitad y en rodajas","manojo pequeño de menta, hojas picadas en trozos grandes","perejil en manojo grande, con las hojas picadas en trozos grandes","Tarrina de 150ml de yogur natural"]','["Cocine los falafels según el paquete.\r\ninstrucciones y hervir la tetera. Inclina el\r\ncuscús en un tazón grande, vierta sobre\r\n325 ml de agua hirviendo, tapar y dejar\r\ndejar reposar durante 5 minutos hasta que toda el agua\r\nes absorbido.","Revuelva el cuscús con un tenedor y luego\r\nrevuelva con la ralladura de limón, el jugo de\r\n1½ limones, aceite de oliva, cebolletas,\r\npepino, menta y tres cuartos\r\ndel perejil con abundante condimento.\r\nVierta sobre un plato grande.","Mezclar el jugo de limón restante y\r\nperejil en el yogur, luego vierta en\r\nun cuenco pequeño. Distribuya el falafel caliente\r\nla ensalada de cuscús, luego sirva el\r\nsalsa de yogur al lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14163,6461,'es','falafels picantes','Baratos y muy fáciles de preparar: rellénelos en pitas con ensalada o sírvalos con cuscús y hummus.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o vegetal","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, lavados y escurridos","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido (o use más comino)","un puñado de perejil picado o 1 cucharadita de hierbas secas mixtas","1 huevo batido"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén grande, luego sofreír \r\ncebolla y ajo a fuego lento durante 5 minutos \r\nhasta que se ablanden. Vierta en un tazón grande para mezclar \r\ncon los garbanzos y las especias, luego triturar \r\njunto con un tenedor o machacador de patatas hasta \r\nlos garbanzos están totalmente desmenuzados. Revuelva \r\nen perejil o hierbas secas, con condimento \r\nal gusto. Agrega el huevo, luego aplasta el \r\nmezcla junto con las manos.","Moldee la mezcla en 6 bolas, luego aplánelas \r\nempanadas. Calentar el aceite restante en la sartén, \r\nLuego sofreír los falafels a fuego medio durante \r\n3 minutos por cada lado, hasta que estén dorados y \r\nfirme. Sirva frío o caliente con cuscús, pitta \r\npan o ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:01:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14164,8032,'es','Ensalada de pan y queso de cabra de Oriente Medio','La versión de Barney del fattoush: una ensalada de pan clásica del Medio Oriente. Fattoush normalmente no contiene queso de cabra, pero lo convierte en una comida principal.','["2 panes pita","1 diente de ajo","jugo 1 limon","3 tomates pera maduros, cortados en trozos","1?2 pepino, cortado en trozos","6 rábanos, rebanados","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada por la mitad y en rodajas","un puñado grande de hojas de menta, picadas muy toscamente","1 lechuga Cos pequeña, picada en trozos grandes","1 lechuga Baby Gem, picada en trozos grandes","2 puñados grandes de rúcula","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","200 g de queso de cabra firme, desmenuzado en trozos grandes"]','["Cocine el pan pita en una plancha o en\r\nuna tostadora hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. cuando esté frío\r\nlo suficiente como para manipularlo, córtelo en trozos pequeños.","Triturar el diente de ajo con una pizca de sal,\r\nluego viértalo en un tazón grande y agregue el\r\njugo de limón. Inclina todos los demás ingredientes,\r\nexcepto el aceite de oliva y el queso de cabra, en\r\nel tazón, luego rocíe sobre el aceite. suavemente\r\nmezcle todo hasta que se mezcle y\r\nvestido. Servir la ensalada en montones con carne de cabra.\r\nel queso se desmoronó sobre cada porción."]','2026-01-11 13:01:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14165,8034,'es','Crema de rosas y jaleas de frambuesa','Con todos los sabores de las delicias turcas, estos fragantes pudines al estilo del Medio Oriente son un final ligero para un menú entretenido.','["Paquete de 135g de gelatina de frambuesa","500ml de nata doble","1 cucharadita de agua de rosas","12 frambuesas, partidas por la mitad","chorrito de miel clara","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta","1 cucharada de pistacho, picado"]','["Hervir una tetera. Rompe los cubos de gelatina en\r\nuna jarra, verter sobre 100ml de agua hirviendo y\r\nrevuelva para disolver. Calentar suavemente la nata en\r\nuna cacerola pequeña, luego retirar del fuego\r\ny vierte la mezcla de gelatina. Agregue el\r\nagua de rosas, luego vierta la mezcla nuevamente en\r\ntu jarra. Divida la gelatina entre 6 pequeñas\r\nvasos y enfríe durante 2 horas o hasta que cuaje. Se puede preparar con 1 día de anticipación.","Sacar las gelatinas de la nevera.\r\nunos 20 minutos antes de servir. dividir el\r\nframbuesas entre ellas, luego agregue un\r\nun chorrito de miel, unas hojas de menta y\r\nuna pizca de pistachos para cada uno."]','2026-01-11 13:01:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14166,8036,'es','Salsa espesa de yogur y hierbas','Pruebe esta salsa inspirada en el Medio Oriente, también conocida como labneh, con crujientes palitos de zanahoria','["400 g de yogur griego","4 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","1 cucharada de eneldo y menta, picadas","aceite de oliva virgen extra, para rociar"]','["Vierta el yogur en un colador fino colocado sobre una\r\nluego dejar escurrir en el frigorífico durante\r\n1 hora. Deseche cualquier líquido que se haya escurrido.\r\nVierta en un tazón para mezclar, luego agregue el\r\ncebollas y la mayoría de las hierbas. cuando esté listo\r\npara servir, rociar con un poco de aceituna virgen extra\r\naceite y espolvorear con las hierbas restantes\r\ny un poco de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:01:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14167,8038,'es','Chuletas de cordero con chile y jengibre','Marina las chuletas con jengibre, limón, chile y comino y luego asa a la parrilla hasta que queden jugosas en el medio.','["4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 cucharadita de comino","8 chuletas de cordero"]','["Poner en un bol el ajo con el jengibre,\r\njugo de limón, aceite, especias y condimentos.\r\nBatir con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave,\r\nluego úsalo para cubrir las chuletas de cordero en ambos\r\nlados. Dejar marinar en el frigorífico durante\r\nun par de horas o toda la noche.","Calienta una barbacoa hasta que esté caliente. Barbacoa\r\nlas chuletas sobre las brasas durante 3 minutos\r\ncada lado hasta que esté cocido pero aún rosado y\r\njugoso en el centro."]','2026-01-11 13:01:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14168,8040,'es','Lío de albaricoque y delicias turcas','Pruebe una versión del Medio Oriente del clásico británico Eton Mess, servido con té de menta fresca','["100 g de mascarpone","50 g de yogur griego","25 g de azúcar glas tamizada","2 cucharadas de agua de azahar","1 nido de merengue, partido en trozos grandes","3 albaricoques, deshuesados ​​y picados","2 cubos de delicias turcas, con sabor a naranja si está disponible, picadas","25 g de almendras con piel, picadas en trozos grandes","4 hojas de menta, ralladas y más para decorar (opcional)"]','["Colocar el mascarpone, el yogur, el azúcar y\r\nagua de azahar en un recipiente grande y\r\nbatir hasta que espese. Dobla el resto\r\ningredientes, luego divida la mezcla\r\nentre 2 vasos o tazones de postre y\r\ndecora con menta extra, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:01:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14169,8042,'es','Pollo al estilo marroquí con guindas y aceitunas','Al agregar frutas secas, Tom Kerridge aporta una dulzura sutil a este tagine de pollo del norte de África. Además, puedes duplicar y congelar la mitad para más tarde.','["8 muslos de pollo de corral, con piel y con hueso","2 cucharadas de ras el hanout","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito","2 cebollas picadas","2 zanahorias, cortadas en trozos grandes","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","1 cucharada de pasta de harissa (ver consejo a continuación)","½ limón en conserva, finamente picado o 1 tira de cáscara de limón","1 rama de canela","2 hojas de laurel","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","500 ml de caldo de pollo","300 g de aceitunas verdes deshuesadas y escurridas","100 g de guindas secas o cualquier otra fruta seca (como arándanos, albaricoques, pasas o pasas)","cilantro picado y cuscús cocido (ver consejos a continuación), para servir"]','["Sazone bien el pollo y mezcle con el ras el hanout para cubrirlo. Puede prepararlo la noche anterior y mantenerlo frío. Calienta el aceite en una cacerola o sartén grande resistente al fuego a fuego medio y pasa de 15 a 20 minutos dorando el pollo por todos lados. (Puede hacer esto en tandas para evitar que se llene la sartén). Transfiera el pollo a un plato con una espumadera y reserve.","Cocine las cebollas y las zanahorias en la sartén durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén suaves y doradas, agregando un chorrito más de aceite si la sartén está seca. Agrega el ajo y el jengibre y cocina por 2 minutos más. Agregue la harissa y el limón en conserva. Cocine por un minuto más hasta que las verduras estén bien cubiertas y pegajosas. Agregue la canela y las hojas de laurel, luego agregue los tomates y cocine a fuego lento.","Cocine por unos minutos hasta que el líquido se haya reducido a una pasta espesa. Vuelva a colocar el pollo y el jugo restante en la sartén y vierta sobre el caldo. Agregue las aceitunas y las cerezas y vuelva a hervir a fuego lento. Coloque la tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 45 minutos a 1 hora hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido y tierno.","Esparza sobre el cilantro picado y sirva con cuscús. Una vez completamente frío, se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días o congelado por tres meses. Descongelar en el frigorífico durante la noche antes de recalentar a fuego lento o en el microondas hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14170,5345,'es','Estofado de pollo especiado','Agregue especias suaves y albaricoques para elevar esta cazuela de pollo a un plato que recuerda a un tagine marroquí. También es saludable, con cuatro de tus cinco al día.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas (400 g), partidas por la mitad y en rodajas gruesas","2 berenjenas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas gruesas","40 g de jengibre cortado en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","40 g de cúrcuma fresca, rallada o 1 cucharadita molida","¼ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","400g lata de garbanzos","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","2 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo","50 g de orejones cortados por la mitad","Paquete de 600 g de filetes de muslo de pollo sin piel, sin toda la grasa visible y cortados en trozos grandes","Paquete de 20 g de cilantro picado","560 g de patatas grandes, cortadas en rodajas muy finas (no es necesario pelarlas)"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4, luego calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva en una cacerola ignífuga grande y profunda con una base pesada y una tapa. Añadimos la cebolla y un chorrito de agua, tapamos y dejamos cocer a fuego medio durante 5 minutos, hasta que se ablanden un poco. Revuelva bien, luego agregue las berenjenas en rodajas y cocine, tapado, durante 5 minutos para que se ablanden.","Agrega el jengibre, el ajo, la cúrcuma y las especias secas. Remueve bien y vierte los garbanzos junto con su agua, luego los pimientos, el caldo, los albaricoques, el pollo y una lata llena de agua (400 ml). Agregue el cilantro y luego coloque las papas encima, superponiéndolas ligeramente en forma de espiral. Presione suavemente para compactarlos y unte con la cucharadita de aceite restante. Hornee durante 1-1 ½ horas con la tapa puesta. Retira la tapa a la mitad y continúa cocinando hasta que las patatas estén tiernas y el jugo burbujeante."]','2026-01-11 13:01:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14171,8044,'es','Cordero ras el hanout asado a fuego lento y cuscús','Deja que tu horno haga todo el trabajo con esta paletilla de cordero. Está embriagador con especias del norte de África y el cuscús se empapa en el jugo de la sartén.','["5 dientes de ajo","1 limón, exprimido","6 cucharadas de mezcla de especias ras el hanout (comprada en la tienda o consulte el consejo a continuación)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","paletilla de cordero pequeña (unos 2 kg)","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos grandes","400 g de cuscús","100 g de pasas","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","manojo pequeño de perejil picado","manojo pequeño de cilantro picado","1 limón en conserva, finamente picado o el jugo de ½ limón"]','["Con un mortero y un mortero o una mini picadora, triture o pique el ajo con una pizca generosa de sal, luego agregue el jugo de limón, la mezcla de especias ras el hanout y el aceite de oliva, luego machaque o pique hasta obtener una pasta rugosa. Utilice un cuchillo pequeño para hacer pequeñas incisiones por todo el cordero. Coloque el cordero en una cacerola grande y poco profunda o en una fuente honda para asar, luego frote la pasta por todo el cordero y en los cortes. Dejar a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora, o mejor aún, tapar y enfriar durante la noche.","Cuando esté listo para cocinar, caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Esparza los gajos de cebolla alrededor del cordero, luego cubra el plato con una tapa o bien con papel de aluminio y ase durante 3 horas. Retirar del horno y destapar. Revuelva las cebollas y rocíe el cordero con el jugo, luego encienda el horno a 180 C/160 C ventilador/gas 4 y continúe asando el cordero, sin tapar, durante 25-30 minutos hasta que se dore.","Levante el cordero y la cebolla sobre una tabla para que reposen y ponga la tetera. Agrega el cuscús y las pasas al plato de cordero para que queden cubiertos con el jugo del asado. Vierta suficiente agua hirviendo del hervidor para cubrir el cuscús, luego cubra el plato y déjelo por 5 minutos. Destape y esponje el cuscús con una cuchara de madera, luego revuelva con los garbanzos, las hierbas picadas y el limón en conserva o el jugo de limón, y sazone al gusto. Lleva el cordero, la cebolla y el cuscús a la mesa para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14172,4511,'es','al hilo','Prepare un plato caliente de harira, la sopa marroquí llena de legumbres, tomate, carne de res y especias. Es abundante, saciante y lleno de sabor, perfecto para los días fríos.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","300 g de ternera para estofar o de ternera deshuesada, sin exceso de grasa y cortada en trozos de 3 cm","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de pimienta negra molida","¼ cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharada de perejil fresco picado","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","pizca de azafrán","70 g de garbanzos secos, remojados durante la noche y escurridos (o 140 g de garbanzos enlatados, escurridos)","6 tomates grandes, rallados o triturados en un procesador de alimentos","100 g de apio (2 tallos), finamente picado","80 g de lentejas verdes secas","3 cucharadas de maicena o harina común","2 cucharadas de cilantro fresco picado y rodajas de limón, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego a fuego medio. Agrega la carne, la cebolla y las especias con 1½ cucharadita de sal. Deje que la carne se dore ligeramente durante 5-10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Agrega el resto de los ingredientes excepto las lentejas, la maicena, el cilantro y las rodajas de limón. Agrega 1 litro de agua hirviendo, lleva a ebullición, tapa con una tapa y reduce el fuego al mínimo. Dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 1 h.","Añade las lentejas a la cazuela, tapa con una tapa y cocina durante 20 minutos más. Cuando los garbanzos, la carne y las lentejas estén cocidos, mezcle la harina de maíz en un tazón pequeño con 3 cucharadas de agua y revuelva hasta que quede suave. Agrega la mezcla de harina de maíz a la cazuela. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que la harira se espese y adquiera una textura aterciopelada.","Esparza el cilantro y sirva caliente con rodajas de limón a un lado para exprimirlas."]','2026-01-11 13:01:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14173,8046,'es','Estofado de cordero marroquí en olla de cocción lenta','Caliéntate con nuestro guiso de cordero fácil de cocinar a fuego lento, con especias aromáticas y mucho sabor. Este plato sencillo y que agradará a todo el mundo se prepara en solo 10 minutos.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva o aceite de colza","1 kg de paleta de cordero cortada en cubitos","2 cebollas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas","5 dientes de ajo machacados","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y rallado o finamente picado","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","una pizca de azafrán (o cúrcuma, para darle color)","½ limón grande o 1 pequeño en conserva, solo la piel, finamente picado","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","600 ml de caldo de ternera o de cordero caliente","1 cucharada de miel","1 limón, probado, más un chorrito de jugo","80 g de aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas","un puñado de menta, cilantro o perejil picado (o una combinación)","cuscús o arroz, para servir"]','["Pon la olla de cocción lenta a fuego lento. Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén y dora el cordero en tandas, transfiriéndolo a la olla de cocción lenta a medida que avanzas. Agrega el aceite restante y las cebollas a la sartén y cocina durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo y el jengibre y revuelva durante 1-2 minutos, luego agregue las especias, el limón en conserva y el puré de tomate. Caliente bien y luego vierta en la olla de cocción lenta. Agite un poco de agua alrededor de la sartén y luego viértala en la olla de cocción lenta junto con el caldo. Sazone, cubra y cocine durante 6-8 horas.","Una vez que la carne esté muy tierna, sube el fuego a alto. Agrega la miel, el limón y las aceitunas y cocina durante 20-30 minutos. Cubra con las hierbas y sirva con cuscús o arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14174,8048,'es','Guiso de salchicha marroquí','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Ras el hanout es una especia aromática del norte de África. Combina perfectamente con salchichas de cerdo en salsa de tomate con dátiles y cebolla.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","8 salchichas de cerdo de buena calidad","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharadas de mezcla de especias marroquíes o ras el hanout","100 g de dátil blando sin hueso, picado en trozos grandes","Lata de 400g de tomate picado","175 ml de caldo de ternera caliente","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","puré de papa, para servir"]','["En una cacerola grande o cazuela ignífuga, calentar el aceite y dorar las salchichas con la cebolla durante 10 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Añade la mezcla de ajo y especias con 75 ml de agua para evitar que se quemen y cocina durante 2 minutos hasta que esté fragante. Agregue los dátiles y los tomates, mezcle bien y luego extiéndalos en 2 platos para que se enfríen antes de verterlos en una bolsa para congelador y congelarlos por hasta 3 meses.","Para cocinar congelado, coloque el guiso en una cacerola grande o una cacerola resistente al fuego con todo menos 2 cucharadas de caldo. Cubra con una tapa y caliente suavemente para descongelar durante 25 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Una vez que el guiso esté completamente descongelado, mezcla la maicena con el caldo reservado y vierte en la sartén. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 5 minutos hasta que espese y esté bien caliente. Servir con puré de papa."]','2026-01-11 13:01:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14175,8050,'es','Pitta marroquí rellena','Rellene pan sin trigo con falafels, hummus, pimiento rojo y hojas de rúcula para un almuerzo saludable y abundante.','["2 bolsitas de pan pita sin trigo","4 falafels, partidos por la mitad (de Falafels con receta de hummus, en ''combina bien'')","4 cucharadas de hummus (de Falafels con receta de hummus, ver \"combina bien\")","½ pimiento rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","un puñado de hojas de rúcula"]','["Extienda el hummus en el interior de cada pita, luego cubra con los falafels, la pimienta y la rúcula."]','2026-01-11 13:01:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14176,8052,'es','Tagine de cordero, albaricoque y chalota','Adaptado del pescado de cordero asado marroquí “mechoui”, este plato cocinado a fuego lento tiene un adobo aromático y una salsa irresistiblemente afrutada.','["1 pierna grande de cordero, con hueso (unos 2 kg)","600 g de chalotas, partidas por la mitad si son muy grandes","400 g de albaricoques pequeños, partidos por la mitad y sin hueso","85 g de almendras enteras sin piel","2 limones en conserva, pulpa desechada, cáscara y médula finamente picadas","1 cucharada de ras el hanout","1 cucharada de miel clara","150 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","cilantro en paquete pequeño, hojas recogidas","cuscús y yogur natural, para acompañar","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de comino molido","2 cucharadas de miel clara","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","2 cucharaditas de jengibre molido","2 cucharaditas de semillas de cilantro","pizca de hebras de azafrán"]','["Corta la pierna de cordero por todas partes y colócala en una bolsa de comida grande o en una cazuela grande. Aplasta los ingredientes de la marinada con un mortero. Añade un poco de pimienta negra y frota todo el cordero. Deje marinar durante la noche o hasta 24 horas.","Caliente el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1. Coloque el cordero en una fuente para asar grande, raspando los restos de marinada de la parte superior. Cubra la lata con papel de aluminio, pellizcando los bordes para sellar. Cocine durante 6 a 7 horas, rociando aproximadamente cada hora, hasta que la carne esté increíblemente tierna.","Retire la fuente para asar del horno y aumente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta el jugo del cordero en una jarra medidora, enfríe un poco y retire la grasa. Coloque las chalotas en la lata con el cordero y revuelva para cubrirlas con un poco de jugo. Ase durante 15 minutos, luego agregue los albaricoques y las almendras. Batir el jugo de la cocción con el limón, el ras el hanout, la miel y el caldo, luego verter sobre el cordero y asar durante otros 20 minutos.","Deje reposar 10 minutos, luego esparza las hierbas y sirva con cuscús y yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:01:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14177,8054,'es','Harira marroquí y sopa de pollo','Esta sopa de inspiración norteafricana está aromatizada con harissa y especias. Sirva con tostadas de hummus y yogur refrescante.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","1 puerro, lavado y cortado finamente","4 palitos de apio gordos, picados en trozos pequeños","3 zanahorias grandes, picadas en trozos pequeños","2 chirivías grandes, peladas y picadas en trozos pequeños","paquete pequeño de cilantro, tallos finamente picados, hojas reservadas para servir","1 cucharada de semilla de comino","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma molida","2 cucharadas de harissa (nosotros usamos Belazu)","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","2 cubitos de caldo de pollo, desmenuzados","85 g de lentejas verdes crudas","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","yogur natural, tostadas y hummus, para acompañar"]','["Calentar la mitad del aceite en una sartén, salpimentar los muslos y dorar muy bien por ambos lados. Retirar a un plato. Vierta una taza de agua en la sartén y cocine a fuego lento, raspando todos los trozos dorados. Vierta este líquido en una jarra medidora para más tarde.","Pon el resto del aceite, las verduras y los tallos de cilantro en una cacerola grande. Cocine suavemente hasta que las verduras se ablanden, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Agregue las especias, suba el fuego y cocine por unos minutos. Agregue la harissa, seguido de los tomates, el pollo, los cubitos de caldo y las lentejas. Llena tu jarra de jugo de pollo hasta 500 ml con agua y luego agrégala también. Llevar a fuego lento, tapar y cocinar durante 30 minutos.","Saque el pollo de la sopa y desmenúcelo finamente con un par de tenedores. Regresar a la sopa con la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el azúcar y sazonar al gusto. Sirva en tazones con una cucharada de yogur y las hojas de cilantro, y sirva con tostadas, untado con hummus y rociado con aceite."]','2026-01-11 13:01:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14178,4750,'es','Huevos marroquíes picantes','Este plato de brunch rápido y picante está repleto de calabacines, garbanzos, tomates y espinacas saludables. Dale sabor a tu salsa con harissa rosa','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla grande, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","3 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 cucharada de harissa rosa","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","150 ml de caldo de verduras","400g lata de garbanzos","2 latas de 400 g de tomates cherry","2 calabacines, finamente picados","Bolsa de 200 g de espinacas tiernas","4 cucharadas de cilantro picado","4 huevos grandes"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y honda y sofreír la cebolla y el ajo durante unos 8 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que empiecen a dorarse. Agrega la harissa y el cilantro molido, revuelve bien, luego vierte el caldo y los garbanzos con su líquido. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos, luego triture aproximadamente un tercio de los garbanzos para espesar un poco el caldo.","Vierta los tomates y los calabacines en la sartén y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que los calabacines estén tiernos. Incorpora las espinacas para que se ablanden en la sartén.","Agrega el cilantro picado, luego haz 4 huecos en la mezcla y rompe los huevos. Tapar y cocinar durante 2 minutos, luego retirar del fuego y dejar reposar durante 2 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14179,4465,'es','Ensalada marroquí de granada y verduras asadas','Repleta de delicias vegetales, esta ensalada arcoíris baja en grasa con camote, cebolla morada, chirivía y zanahorias es un festín para la vista.','["2 batatas pequeñas, cortadas en trozos","2 cebollas moradas, con las raíces intactas, cortadas en gajos","1 chirivía grande, pelada y picada en trozos","2 zanahorias grandes, peladas y cortadas en trozos","1 cucharada de ras-el-hanout","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","Bolsa de 100g de espinacas tiernas","Paquete de 110 g de semillas de granada.","50 g de queso feta ligero, desmenuzado","4 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6, forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. En un tazón grande, mezcle todas las verduras con el ras el hanout, el aceite de oliva, la sal y la pimienta. Disponer en una sola capa sobre la bandeja para hornear. Ase, volteando una vez, durante 40 minutos hasta que esté tierno y comience a carbonizarse.","Una vez cocido, déjelo enfriar durante 10 minutos y luego mezcle con las hojas de espinaca, las semillas de granada, el queso feta y el vinagre."]','2026-01-11 13:01:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14180,6024,'es','Sopa marroquí de verduras asadas','Las raíces asadas son perfectas para hacer sopa; usamos chirivías, calabaza y zanahorias, aromatizadas con una mezcla de especias ras el hanout.','["1 cebolla morada, cortada en 8 gajos","300 g de zanahorias, cortadas en trozos de 2 cm","300 g de chirivías, cortadas en trozos de 2 cm","300 g de calabaza pelada y cortada en trozos de 2 cm","1 patata pequeña, cortada en trozos de 2 cm","2 dientes de ajo","1 cucharada de ras el hanout","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","1,3 l de caldo de verduras caliente","6 cucharadas de yogur estilo griego y 1 cucharada de menta finamente picada, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta todas las verduras y el ajo en una fuente para asar. Espolvorea el ras el hanout y un poco de condimento, rocía el aceite y revuelve todo bien. Ase durante 30-35 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a las verduras hasta la mitad, hasta que estén tiernas y empiecen a caramelizarse un poco.","Transfiera las verduras asadas a una cacerola grande, vierta sobre el caldo caliente y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Haga puré la sopa en un procesador de alimentos, o en la sartén con una batidora de mano, hasta que quede suave, luego viértala en un matraz para trabajar. Si come en casa, sírvalo con una cucharada de yogur, un poco de menta y un poco de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:01:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14181,8056,'es','Piernas de cordero dulces y especiadas con membrillo','Un cruce entre un guiso persa y tajine marroquí, las especias en esta olla cocinada a fuego lento son suaves. Servir con arroz, cuscús o panes planos.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 jarretes de cordero","trozo grande de mantequilla","2 cebollas grandes, partidas por la mitad y luego cortadas en gajos","4 dientes de ajo machacados","4 tiras de ralladura de 1 limón sin cera, más el jugo","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de comino molido","una buena pizca de hebras de azafrán (opcional)","1 cucharada colmada de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de miel clara","400 ml de buen caldo de cordero o ternera","2 membrillos, pelados, cortados en cuartos y sin corazón"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Temporada\r\nlas piernas, luego dorarlas en el aceite durante\r\n10 minutos, o hasta que esté completamente dorado.","Mientras tanto, en una cazuela o cacerola grande\r\nsartén, derretir la mantequilla. ablandar las cebollas\r\ndurante 10 minutos a fuego medio hasta que estén\r\ndorándose, luego agregue el ajo. Calor\r\nhorno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.","Agrega las tiras de ralladura de limón y las especias.\r\na la sartén de cebolla. Cocine por 1 min, luego revuelva\r\nen el puré de tomate, la miel, el caldo y la mitad\r\nel jugo de limón. Coloca las piernas en la sartén,\r\nluego mete los cuartos de membrillo y\r\nalrededor de la carne. (Puede que quede bastante apretado\r\ncabe, pero la carne se encogerá a medida que se cocina).\r\nLlevar a fuego lento y luego cubrir con una tapa.\r\ny cocer en el horno durante 2 horas.","Retire la tapa y cocine por 30 minutos.\r\nmás. Retire el exceso de grasa con una cuchara. el\r\nLa salsa quedará bastante fina, así que si prefieres una\r\nguiso más espeso, retirar el cordero y los membrillos\r\na un plato para servir, luego hierva la cocción\r\njugos hasta que espese. Sazone, agregue el\r\njugo de limón y servir con el cordero."]','2026-01-11 13:01:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14182,4477,'es','sopa de garbanzos marroquí','Esta sopa baja en grasas está repleta de legumbres de despensa, cereales saludables y especias del norte de África: utilice comino, ras el hanout, jengibre y canela.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de jengibre fresco rallado","1 cucharadita de comino","1 cucharadita de sp-ellos","¼ cucharadita de canela","200 g de pimientos rojos asados, de un frasco","2 latas de 400g de tomate picado","400 ml de caldo de verduras","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","2 limones en conserva, con cáscara picada (deseche la pulpa y las semillas)","1 cucharada de miel clara","50 g de cuscús integral"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande con tapa. Añade el\r\ncebolla y ajo, tapar y cocinar durante\r\n5 minutos, revolviendo a la mitad. Revuelve el chile,\r\njengibre, comino, ras el hanout y canela en\r\nla sartén y cocinar por 1 min. Agrega los pimientos,\r\ntomates y caldo. Llevar a ebullición, bajar\r\na fuego lento, tapar y cocinar durante 10 minutos.","Mezcle la sopa con una batidora o en un recipiente para alimentos.\r\nprocesador hasta que quede suave. Regresar a la sartén y\r\nagregue más líquido para diluir la sopa, si lo desea. Revuelva\r\nen los garbanzos, los limones en conserva, la miel y\r\nalgún condimento. Si come inmediatamente, agregue el\r\ncuscús y calentar durante 5 minutos. (Si toma\r\npara que funcione, agregue el cuscús justo antes de recalentar)."]','2026-01-11 13:01:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14183,8058,'es','Tagine de pescado con azafrán y almendras','Un guiso de pescado marroquí bajo en calorías aromatizado con azafrán, almendras, canela, jengibre y más. Es ideal para entretener: haga un lote con anticipación y congélelo.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","buena pizca de azafrán","600 ml de caldo de pescado o pollo caliente","2 dientes de ajo machacados","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y rallado","½ chile verde (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante), cortado finamente","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de canela","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","10 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","2 cucharadas de almendras molidas","ralladura de 1 naranja, jugo de ½","1 cucharada de miel","700 g de pescado blanco cortado en trozos grandes","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","un puñado de almendras en hojuelas, tostadas","½ chile verde (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante), para servir","cuscús y yogur natural, para acompañar (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Añade el\r\ncebolla y cocine por unos minutos hasta que esté suave.\r\nMientras tanto, poner el azafrán en el fuego\r\ncaldo y dejar reposar. Agrega el ajo,\r\njengibre y chile a la sartén y cocinar por\r\nunos minutos más. Agregue las especias y\r\npuré de tomate, revuelva durante unos minutos hasta que\r\nfragante, luego agregue los tomates molidos\r\nalmendras, ralladura y zumo de naranja, miel y\r\ncaldo con aroma a azafrán, procurando que\r\nUsas todas las hebras de azafrán.\r\nCocine a fuego lento, descubierto, durante 10 minutos, hasta que\r\nlos tomates se han roto y el\r\nla salsa se ha espesado un poco.","Agrega el pescado a la sartén, asegurándote\r\nTodas las piezas están ubicadas debajo del\r\nsalsa. Cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento en una\r\nA fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté cocido.\r\nComprobar sazón, agregar el cilantro.\r\ny espolvorear con las almendras tostadas.\r\nSirva esparcido con el chile, junto\r\ncon un poco de cuscús y una gota de\r\nyogur natural, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:01:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14184,8060,'es','Pollo asado marroquí con albaricoques','Llueva o haga sol, sirva este ave marinada en zumaque, que se puede asar a la parrilla o al horno, con un acompañamiento dulce y afrutado.','["2 pollos pequeños","6 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","cilantro en manojo pequeño","2 cucharadas de zumaque (ver consejo a continuación)","1 cucharada de semilla de comino","1 cucharada de semilla de hinojo","2 cucharaditas de hojuelas de chile","2 dientes de ajo","ralladura y jugo de 2 limones","4 cucharadas de melaza de granada","250 g de yogur natural, mezclado con 1 o 2 pizcas de azafrán, para servir","12 albaricoques, partidos por la mitad y sin hueso","2 limones en conserva, enjuagados, sin semillas y finamente picados","3 cucharadas de miel clara","1 cucharada de agua de azahar","4 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco"]','["Spatchcock las gallinas – ver\r\nconsejo, a continuación, o pídale a su carnicero que\r\nhazlo por ti. Poner el aceite de oliva, el cilantro,\r\nzumaque, comino, hinojo, guindilla, ajo, limón\r\nralladura y jugo, melaza de granada\r\ny un poco de pimienta negra molida en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos o licuadora y mezcle hasta\r\npegar. Divida entre 2 bolsas grandes de comida,\r\nagregue un pollo a cada uno, luego exprima\r\nel aire y sellar antes de dar todo\r\nun buen silenciador para cubrir completamente.\r\nMarinar durante 24-48 horas en la nevera,\r\ngirando y aplastando de vez en cuando.","Enciende una barbacoa y deja que las llamas\r\napagar o calentar el horno a 220C/200C\r\nventilador/gas 7. Saque el pollo de las bolsas.\r\ny sazonar bien con sal. Barbacoa o\r\nAse el pollo durante 25-30 minutos en cada uno.\r\nlado hasta que estén crujientes y bien cocidos. conjunto\r\nreservar en un plato, cubrir sin apretar con papel de aluminio,\r\nreposar mientras haces los albaricoques. si tu\r\nasado en lugar de asado, mantenga el\r\njugos de lata calientes para servir.","Coloque los albaricoques en un recipiente pequeño y\r\nlata para asar. Batir el limón en conserva,\r\nmiel, azahar y vinagre\r\ncon algún condimento. Vierta sobre el\r\nalbaricoques y asarlos, o sentarse en el\r\nasa a la parrilla durante 20 minutos hasta que esté suave.","Sirve el pollo con cualquier cocción.\r\nzumos, los albaricoques y el yogur de azafrán."]','2026-01-11 13:01:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14185,6367,'es','Pollo marroquí en una olla','No necesitas una olla de barro para preparar un fragante tagine del norte de África: tíralo todo en una cacerola y cúbrelo con queso feta, menta y limón.','["4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, 1 picada en trozos grandes y 1 en rodajas","100 g de tomates","100 g de jengibre, picado en trozos grandes","3 dientes de ajo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharada de comino molido, cilantro y canela","1 calabaza grande, sin semillas y cortada en trozos grandes","600 ml de caldo de pollo","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","100 g de cerezas secas","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","ralladura de 1 limón","un puñado de hojas de menta","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","cuscús y yogur natural"]','["Sazona el pollo. Calentar 2 cucharadas de\r\naceite en una fuente ignífuga y luego dorar el\r\npollo por todos lados. quitar el pollo\r\na un plato. Batir la cebolla picada,\r\ntomates, jengibre y ajo en una masa áspera\r\npegar. Sofreír la cebolla cortada en\r\naceite restante en el plato hasta que se ablande,\r\nluego agrega las especias y sofríe por 1 min.\r\nmás hasta que esté fragante. Agrega la pasta y\r\nFreír durante unos minutos más para que se ablanden.","Regrese el pollo al plato con el\r\ncalabaza, caldo, azúcar y vinagre. traer\r\na fuego lento, luego cocine durante 30 minutos hasta que\r\nel pollo esté bien cocido. Levante el\r\nSaque el pollo y agregue las cerezas.\r\nluego continúa cocinando la salsa a fuego lento\r\npara espesar mientras desmenuzas el pollo\r\nen trozos pequeños. revuelve el pollo\r\nVuelva a colocarlo en la salsa y sazone.","Mezclar la cebolla morada, la ralladura de limón, la menta y\r\nqueso feta. Esparcir sobre el plato y servir.\r\ncon un poco de cuscús y yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:01:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14186,8062,'es','Pastel especiado marroquí','El complemento perfecto para tu comida del día de Navidad, y es apto para verduras','["2 cucharaditas de semillas de cilantro y comino","1 cucharadita de pimentón, más un poco para espolvorear","½ cucharadita de canela molida","150 ml/¼ litro de aceite de oliva","900 g de calabaza, pelada y cortada en trozos pequeños (de unos 2 cm)","12 chalotes, en cuartos","4 cm/1½ trozos de raíz de jengibre, finamente picados","140 g de almendras enteras blanqueadas","140 g de pistachos sin cáscara","Paquete de 75 g de arándanos secos","6 cucharadas de miel clara","Paquete de 225 g de espinacas frescas","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","2 dientes de ajo","1 cucharadita de comino molido","3 cucharadas de jugo de limón","4 cucharadas de cilantro fresco picado","100 g de mantequilla","8 láminas grandes de masa filo","rodajas de limón para servir","200 g de yogur griego en cartón","6 cucharadas de leche","3 ramitas grandes de menta, hojas picadas","2-3 cucharadas de pasta de harissa"]','["Precalienta el horno a temperatura ventilada 180C/\r\nconvencional 200C/gas 6. Freír en seco\r\nlas semillas brevemente en una sartén pequeña a fuego medio hasta que estén tostadas – no\r\ndéjalos arder. Muela gruesa usando\r\nun mortero y un mortero (o un cuenco y\r\nla punta de un rodillo), luego mezcle\r\nel pimentón, la canela, 1?2 cucharadita de sal\r\ny 4 cucharadas de aceite. Incline la calabaza en un\r\nfuente para asar, verter sobre el aceite especiado\r\ny tirar. Ase durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, calentar 2 cucharadas de aceite en un\r\nsartén, añadir las chalotas y\r\ncocine, revolviendo, hasta que comiencen a\r\nmarrón. Agregue el jengibre y\r\n100g/4oz cada una de almendras y\r\npistachos. Cuando estén dorados, agregue el\r\narándanos, 2 cucharadas de miel y el\r\nespinacas para que se ablanden. Quítate el calor\r\ny agregue la calabaza, cuando esté\r\nsale del horno. Dejar de lado.","En un procesador de alimentos, bata el\r\ngarbanzos con ajo, comino,\r\naceite restante, jugo de limón, 2 cucharadas\r\nagua y sal y pimienta para hacer\r\nhumoso. Agrega el cilantro.","Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña. poner\r\nuna lata para quiche de 28 cm con fondo suelto\r\nen una bandeja para hornear y untar con\r\nun poco de mantequilla. Manteniendo el filo cubierto\r\ncon un paño húmedo para que no se seque\r\nhacia afuera, coloque una hoja sobre la mitad de la\r\nlata de manera que cuelgue sobre el borde\r\nunos 10cm. Coloque otra hoja\r\nel otro lado, por lo que se superpone al\r\nprimero en el centro y cuelga sobre\r\nel borde opuesto. Pincel con\r\nmantequilla. Coloque dos hojas de filo más\r\nen la dirección opuesta de la misma manera y untar con más mantequilla.","Construye dos capas más en este\r\nmanera, entonces usas un total de ocho\r\nhojas de filo. Apila la mitad de la calabaza.\r\nmezcla en el centro de la masa.\r\nRepartir sobre el hummus y luego\r\nel resto de la mezcla de calabaza.\r\na la vez, acerca el borde de cada\r\nhoja filo hasta el centro para cubrir\r\nel relleno, creando voluptuosos pliegues\r\na medida que avanzas. Cepille cuidadosamente con\r\nmás mantequilla. (Si adelanta un día,\r\ncubrir ahora con film transparente y\r\nfrío. Para recalentar, retire el pastel.\r\nde la nevera, calentar el horno, luego\r\nhornee durante 35-40 minutos).","Hornee durante 30-35 minutos, hasta que esté crujiente.\r\ny dorado. Justo antes de que el pastel esté\r\nlisto, recalentar la mantequilla restante\r\nen la sartén, vierta el resto de las nueces\r\ny freír hasta que estén dorados. Cuchara en el\r\n4 cucharadas restantes de\r\ncariño y, cuando\r\nse derrite, quítese el\r\ncalentar y verter\r\nel pastel. Servir con\r\nSalsa de yogur harissa (mezcle el yogur y la leche para hacer una salsa fina, agregue las hierbas y sazone. Agregue la harissa al gusto) y rodajas de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:01:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14187,8064,'es','Arroz marroquí picante','Dale sabor al pollo viejo con un sabor exótico','["4 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en cubitos","1 cucharada de condimento de especias marroquíes","1 cebolla, finamente cortada","50 g de mantequilla","300 g de arroz","12 orejones, cortados por la mitad","cubo de caldo de pollo","Lata de 410 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados.","Paquete de 15 g de perejil de hoja plana, picado"]','["Cubra el pollo con la especia marroquí. Freír la cebolla en mantequilla hasta que esté blanda.","Vierta el pollo y luego cocine por unos minutos más. Agregue el arroz y los albaricoques, luego vierta la pastilla de caldo con 700 ml de agua hirviendo y los garbanzos.","Tapa la cacerola y cocina a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno y haya absorbido la mayor parte del líquido. Agregue el perejil de hoja plana picado y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:01:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14188,8066,'es','Zanahorias especiadas marroquíes','Crea una sensación de zanahoria con esta sencilla idea para un aderezo y experimenta con tus verduras favoritas.','["500 g de zanahorias, cortadas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","pasta de harissa","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","un puñado de cilantro picado y más"]','["Coloque las zanahorias en una vaporera colocada sobre\r\nuna cacerola con agua hirviendo y cocine durante 7-10 minutos\r\nhasta que esté suave. Mezclar el resto\r\ningredientes, luego mezcle las zanahorias calientes\r\na través del vendaje.","Espolvoree con cilantro picado extra para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14189,5057,'es','Pescado marroquí especiado con puré de jengibre','Condimente los filetes de pescado blanco con mantequilla aromatizada y sírvalos con puré de camote esponjoso.','["2 batatas grandes, peladas y cortadas en trozos","2 cucharaditas de mantequilla, ablandada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","½ -1 cucharadita de harissa (Belazu es buena)","ralladura de 1 limón","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, la mayor parte picado, el resto entero","raíz de jengibre fresco del tamaño de la punta de un dedo, finamente rallado","2 filetes de pescado blanco sin piel (busque pescado capturado de forma sostenible)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.\r\nCocine las batatas en ebullición, saladas.\r\nagua durante unos 10 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos\r\ncuando se perfora con un cuchillo. Mientras tanto, mezcla\r\njunto la mantequilla con el ajo, la harissa,\r\nralladura de limón, cilantro picado y un poco\r\ncondimento. Cuando las patatas estén listas,\r\nescurrir bien, triturar con el jengibre y\r\ncondimente y luego manténgalo caliente.","Coloque el pescado en una fuente para asar, sazone,\r\nluego unte la mitad de la mantequilla aromatizada\r\ncada filete. Ase durante unos 8 minutos hasta que\r\nbien cocido. Servir con el puré de jengibre.\r\ny algunas verduras verdes."]','2026-01-11 13:01:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14190,4567,'es','Sopa marroquí de coliflor y almendras con especias','Una sopa saciante y reconfortante es la mejor comida en un tazón, como esta mezcla suave y picante del norte de África.','["1 coliflor grande","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","½ cucharadita de canela molida, comino y cilantro","2 cucharadas de pasta de harissa, más un chorrito extra","1 litro de caldo de verduras o pollo caliente","50 g de almendras laminadas tostadas, más algo extra para servir"]','["Corta la coliflor en floretes pequeños.\r\nFreír aceite de oliva, canela molida, comino y cilantro.\r\ny pasta de harissa durante 2 minutos en\r\nuna sartén grande. Agrega la coliflor, el caldo y las almendras. Tape y cocine por 20 minutos hasta que\r\nla coliflor está tierna. licuar sopa\r\nhasta que quede suave, luego sirva con un extra\r\nllovizna de harissa y una pizca de\r\nalmendras tostadas."]','2026-01-11 13:01:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14191,8068,'es','Cordero aromático con dátiles','Una receta cálida con un toque marroquí, perfecta para acompañar con cuscús.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","500 g de cordero magro deshuesado y cortado en cubitos, preferiblemente de pierna","300 g de batatas, cortadas en trozos pequeños","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","50 g de dátiles sin hueso","2 cucharadas de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, agrega la cebolla.\r\ny cordero, luego sofreír rápidamente hasta que el cordero esté\r\nligeramente dorado.","Agrega las batatas y\r\nespecias, luego mezcle bien. Vierta 425 ml hirviendo\r\nagua y el puré de tomate, luego llevar a\r\nel hervor.","Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta que\r\nlas batatas y el cordero estén tiernos, añadiendo\r\nlas fechas de los últimos 10 minutos. espolvorear con\r\ncilantro y servir con cuscús."]','2026-01-11 13:01:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14192,7066,'es','Inmersión versátil','Utilice harissa picante para preparar una salsa rápida y fácil para verduras y piel de papa.','["225 g de yogur natural espeso y cremoso, colado","3-4 cucharadas de harissa (según el gusto)","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","un puñado pequeño de menta fresca, finamente picada"]','["Vierta el yogur en un bol y agregue tanta harissa como desee. Agregue la mayor parte del cilantro y la menta y sazone si lo desea. Vierta en un tazón para servir, decore con el resto de las hierbas y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:01:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14193,8072,'es','Tagine de pollo fácil','Las ollas simples son perfectas para el cocinero ocupado. Este tagine de pollo es excelente para acompañarlo con cous cous si quieres algo que llene un poco más.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","8 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados a la mitad si son grandes","1 cebolla, picada","2 cucharaditas de raíz de jengibre fresco rallado","una pizca de azafrán o cúrcuma","1 cucharada de miel","400 g de zanahorias cortadas en palitos","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","rodajas de limón, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y ancha con tapa, agregar el pollo y freír rápidamente hasta que adquiera un color claro. Agrega la cebolla y el jengibre y sofríe durante 2 minutos más.","Añade 150 ml de agua, el azafrán, la miel y las zanahorias, sazona y revuelve bien. Llevar a ebullición, tapar bien y cocinar a fuego lento durante 30 minutos hasta que el pollo esté tierno. Destapa y aumenta el fuego durante unos 5 minutos para reducir un poco la salsa. Espolvorea con perejil y sirve con limón.\r\ncuñas para apretar."]','2026-01-11 13:01:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14194,8074,'es','Tagine de cordero, calabaza y albaricoque','Un pilar marroquí, esta cazuela cocinada a fuego lento está aromatizada con cilantro y especias ras-el-hanout.','["2 cucharadas de aceite","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharada de ras-el-hanout","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","600 g de pierna de cordero, cortada en trozos de 2 cm y sin exceso de grasa","200 g de calabaza, cortada en cubitos","200 g de orejones blandos","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","500 ml de caldo de cordero o ternera","ralladura de 1 limón","cilantro en manojo pequeño","cuscús y yogur natural, para acompañar"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nCalentar el aceite en una cazuela ignífuga.\r\nplato, agregue la cebolla y cocine por 5 minutos\r\nhasta que se ablanden. Agrega el ajo y las especias.\r\ny cocine por un par de minutos más,\r\nrevolviendo para evitar que se peguen y\r\nardiendo.","Añade el cordero, la calabaza y los albaricoques.\r\na la cazuela, verter sobre la\r\ntomates y caldo, sazonar bien\r\ny llevar a ebullición. Pon la tapa\r\ny transferir al horno. Después de 1 hora,\r\nrevuelva el tagine y regrese al\r\nHorno, destapado, por 30 minutos más.\r\nminutos.","Revisa el condimento. espolvorear\r\nla ralladura y el cilantro y servir en\r\ntazones calientes con cuscús y\r\nyogur."]','2026-01-11 13:01:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14195,6642,'es','Tagine de albóndigas marroquí con limón y aceitunas','Una cazuela de cordero del norte de África maravillosamente aromática con un sabor cítrico, ideal para cenas','["3 cebollas, peladas","500 g de cordero picado","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón sin cera, cortado en cuartos","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","pizca de pimienta de cayena","manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y rallado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","pellizcar hebras de azafrán","250 ml de caldo de cordero","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","100 g de aceitunas kalamata negras deshuesadas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","cuscús o pan fresco crujiente, para servir"]','["Pon las cebollas en un procesador de alimentos y\r\nrevuelva hasta que esté finamente picado. Pon el cordero\r\nralladura de limón, especias, perejil y la mitad de\r\ncebollas en un tazón grande y sazone. Usando\r\ntus manos, mezcla hasta que esté bien combinado,\r\nluego forme bolas del tamaño de una nuez.","Calentar el aceite en un plato grande resistente al fuego, o\r\ntagine con tapa, luego agregue el resto\r\ncebolla, jengibre, guindilla y azafrán. cocinar para\r\n5 minutos hasta que la cebolla se ablande y\r\nempezando a colorear. Agrega el jugo de limón,\r\ncaldo, puré de tomate y aceitunas, luego\r\nllevar a ebullición. Agrega las albóndigas, una\r\na la vez, luego reduzca el fuego, cubra\r\ncon la tapa y cocine por 20 minutos, volteando\r\nlas albóndigas un par de veces.","Retire la tapa, luego agregue el cilantro y\r\nrodajas de limón, metiéndolas entre ellas\r\nlas albóndigas. Cocine, descubierto, por un\r\n10 minutos más hasta que el líquido se haya\r\nreducido y ligeramente espesado. Servir caliente\r\ncon cuscús o pan fresco crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14196,8076,'es','Ensalada picante de cuscús','Prepare una ensalada de cuscús deliciosamente picante y súper saludable en solo 10 minutos','["300 g de cuscús o trigo bulgar","caldo de verduras","2 calabacines","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","Paquete de 20 g de perejil picado","jugo 1 limon"]','["Cocine el cuscús o el trigo bulgar en caldo de verduras según las instrucciones del paquete. Recorta los extremos de los calabacines y luego córtalos en rodajas.","Calienta una plancha o parrilla. Rocíe las rodajas de calabacín con aceite y luego sazone. Cocine durante 2 minutos, luego déle la vuelta y cocine 1-2 minutos más hasta que se ablanden y se doren. Vierta en un tazón grande junto con el cuscús cocido o el trigo bulgar, luego mezcle el resto de los ingredientes. Servir a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14197,4886,'es','ensalada de pavo marroquí','Aprovecha abundante carne asada en una saludable ensalada con berenjena, tomate, granada y menta','["2 panes pita","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 berenjena picada","1 cucharada de harissa","250 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","500 g de pechuga de pavo sobrante desmenuzada","100 g de rúcula","semillas 1 granada o 110 g de semillas de granada en tarrina","unas hojas de menta"]','["Cortar el pan pita en trozos y freírlo en aceite de oliva hasta que esté crujiente. Vierta en un bol y fría la berenjena durante 10 minutos hasta que esté blanda. Agregue al pitta con la harissa, los tomates, el pavo y la rúcula. Mezcle bien. Esparcir sobre las semillas de granada y las hojas de menta."]','2026-01-11 13:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14198,8078,'es','Albóndigas marroquíes rápidas','Una gran variación de las albóndigas para una cena rápida y sabrosa','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","Paquete de 350 g de albóndigas de ternera o pollo ya preparadas (unas 16)","1 cebolla grande, cortada en rodajas","100 g de orejones cortados por la mitad","1 rama pequeña de canela","Lata de 400g de tomates picados con ajo","25 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","un puñado de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y honda, luego fríe las albóndigas durante 10 minutos, volteándolas de vez en cuando hasta que estén bien cocidas. Saque de la sartén y reserve, luego cocine la cebolla durante 5 minutos, hasta que se ablande.","Agregue los orejones, la rama de canela, los tomates y media lata de agua a la cacerola, luego hierva y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Retire la ramita de canela. Regrese las albóndigas a la sartén y cúbralas bien con la salsa de tomate. Servir espolvoreado con las almendras y el cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14199,8080,'es','Fritura marroquí de acelgas y cordero','Un plato rápido y exótico en una sola sartén','["1 manojo de acelgas","1 onza de aceite de oliva","600 g de paletilla de cordero cortada en cubitos","1 cebolla, rebanada","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida, semillas de comino y semillas de cilantro","pizca de hojuelas de chile","400 ml de caldo, cordero o pollo","un puñado de pasas","un puñado de piñones tostados"]','["Quitar las hojas de acelgas del tallo. Cortar el \r\ntallo en bastones y triturar las hojas en trozos grandes. \r\nReservar por separado.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén y sofreír el cordero durante \r\n5-6 minutos a fuego alto hasta que se dore. Añade el \r\ncebolla, ajo, tallos de acelgas y especias y continuar \r\ncocinar durante 3-4 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Vierta sobre el \r\nCaldo y esparcir las pasas, luego cocinar a fuego lento durante  \r\n4-5 minutos para hacer una salsa. Las hojas de acelgas se marchitan \r\nel caldo, sazonar y servir espolvoreado con piñones."]','2026-01-11 13:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14200,8082,'es','Trigo bulgur especiado con pimientos asados','Esta abundante ensalada vegetariana tiene los sabores picantes del comino y la cálida canela.','["200 g de trigo bulgar","250 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias marroquíes, o una pizca grande de comino molido y canela molida","ralladura de 1 limón, jugo de ½ limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","½ cebolla morada, cortada finamente","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","210 g de pimientos asados, escurridos y desmenuzados","cilantro en manojo pequeño, solo las hojas"]','["En un recipiente grande apto para microondas, cubra el trigo bulhar con caldo. Cubra con film transparente y cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 4 minutos. Reservar cubierto; absorberá el caldo en otros 5 minutos. Haga un aderezo con una mezcla de especias, ralladura y jugo de limón y aceite de oliva, luego sazone al gusto. Agregue la cebolla, los garbanzos, los pimientos y el cilantro, mezcle con el trigo bulghar cocido y sirva tibio o frío."]','2026-01-11 13:01:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14201,6815,'es','Sopa marroquí de tomate y garbanzos con cuscús','Esta sopa abundante es saludable y está repleta de sabores del norte de África: harissa, jengibre, limón y cilantro.','["75 g de cuscús","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","750 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","1 zanahoria, picada en cubos pequeños","4 dientes de ajo machacados","medio dedo de jengibre, pelado y finamente picado","1-2 cucharadas de ras-el-hanout","1 cucharada de pasta harissa, más un poco más para servir","400 g de tomates picados en lata","400 g de garbanzos en lata","jugo ½ limón","cilantro picado, para servir"]','["Vierta el cuscús en un bol, sazone con sal y pimienta y revuelva con 1 cucharada de aceite. Vierta suficiente caldo caliente para cubrir y cubra el recipiente con film transparente y reserve.","Calienta el resto del aceite en una cacerola y cocina la cebolla y la zanahoria a fuego lento durante 8 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo y el jengibre y cocine por 2 minutos más, luego agregue el ras el hanout y la harissa y cocine por un minuto más. Vierta los tomates y el caldo y revuelva bien todo. Sazone, agregue los garbanzos y cocine todo a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que espese un poco y luego exprima sobre el limón.","Destape el cuscús y revuélvalo con un tenedor. Vierta la sopa en tazones, cubra cada uno con un montón de cuscús, espolvoree con cilantro y sirva con harissa extra para quienes lo deseen."]','2026-01-11 13:01:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14202,4933,'es','Hummus de nueces y harissa','Ase la calabaza con mucho ajo y luego añádala con una salsa estilo marroquí con harissa picante y pasta de sésamo.','["½ calabaza (unos 400 g), pelada y cortada en trozos de 2 cm","3 dientes de ajo, sin pelar","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 cucharadas de pasta tahini","1 cucharada de harissa, más un poco más para rociar","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPoner la calabaza y el ajo.\r\nclavos en una fuente para asar, sazonar bien\r\ny añadir 100ml de agua. Cubrir la lata\r\ncon papel aluminio y hornee por 45 minutos, hasta que\r\nla calabaza está muy tierna. Dejar enfriar.","Coloca la calabaza en un procesador de alimentos.\r\ncon el jugo de la lata. Añade el\r\ndientes de ajo, exprimidos de su\r\npieles. Agrega los ingredientes restantes,\r\nsazone con sal y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta.","Vierta el hummus en un bol.\r\nRocíe con más harissa antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14203,8084,'es','Tagine de gallina de Guinea con garbanzos, calabaza y albaricoques','Esta ave de caza se parece mucho al pollo, por lo que se puede cocinar de la misma manera: pruébala en esta fragante cazuela con especias marroquíes.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 gallinas de guinea, unidas como un pollo (pídele a tu carnicero que lo haga o mira nuestro video sobre cómo unir un pollo, en ''Prueba'', a continuación)","2 cebollas, picadas en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 calabaza moscada o calabaza pequeña, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de ras-el-hanout","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","¼ cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 rama de canela grande","pequeño chorrito de miel clara","una pizca grande de azafrán, remojada en 1 cucharada de agua hirviendo","jugo 1 limon","850 ml de caldo de pollo","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","200 g de orejones","cilantro en manojo pequeño","cuscús o arroz, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una olla grande y poco profunda a prueba de fuego.\r\ncazuela. Sazone la gallina de guinea\r\ntrozos y dorarlos, en tandas, si\r\nSi es necesario, luego retírela y colóquela en un plato.","Freír las cebollas en el mismo plato hasta\r\nablandado, luego agregue el ajo y la calabaza,\r\ncocinar durante 1-2 minutos. Consejo en las especias\r\ny cocine por unos minutos antes de agregar\r\nla miel, el azafrán y el zumo de limón. verter\r\nen el caldo de pollo y los garbanzos.","Sumergir los trozos de gallina de guinea en\r\nel caldo y añadir los albaricoques. Cubrir el\r\nplato y cocine todo a fuego lento muy suavemente\r\ndurante 50 minutos-1 hora, hasta que el ave y la calabaza\r\nAmbos son tiernos. Revuelva con el cilantro\r\ny servir con cuscús o arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14204,8086,'es','Cuscús de pollo marroquí con dátiles','Los cereales integrales te mantienen lleno durante más tiempo: condimenta con dátiles, limón, comino y canela.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","500 g de muslos de pollo sin piel","140 g de cuscús integral","2 cebollas, rebanadas","4 dientes de ajo, rebanados","ralladura de 2 limones, jugo de 1","350 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","6 dátiles grandes, deshuesados ​​y picados (los Medjool son buenos)","50 g de almendras laminadas","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/ventilador de 160C/\r\ngas 4. Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en un\r\nsartén grande a fuego alto.\r\nSazone el pollo, luego cocínelo\r\n10 minutos o hasta que ambos se doren\r\nlados. Retirar y poner en una fuente grande.\r\nfuente para horno con el cuscús seco.","Calentar el aceite restante en el\r\nsartén, agregue la cebolla y el ajo, y\r\ncocine durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Añadir\r\nla ralladura y el jugo de 1 limón junto\r\ncon el caldo, comino, canela\r\ny los dátiles, luego llevar a ebullición.","Vierta la mezcla de dátiles sobre el\r\npollo y cuscús, espolvorear\r\nsobre las almendras, cubrir con\r\npapel de aluminio y hornee por 20 minutos. servir\r\nespolvoreado con el resto\r\nralladura y perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:01:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14205,5119,'es','Ensalada de zanahoria, pistacho y queso feta','Una ensalada vegetariana con zanahorias asadas con comino, garbanzos, menta, nueces, espinacas y queso salado: excelente para acompañar la comida marroquí.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","500 g de zanahorias partidas por la mitad y en trozos","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","jugo ½ limón","1 cucharada de miel clara","manojo pequeño de menta, picada","2 puñados grandes de espinacas","Bolsa de 100 g de pistachos sin cáscara, picados en trozos grandes","Paquete de 200 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEcha 1 cucharada de aceite, las zanahorias,\r\ngarbanzos y comino en una hornada\r\nbandeja, sazone y revuelva para cubrir. asado\r\ndurante 30 minutos o hasta que las zanahorias estén tiernas.","Mezclar el jugo de limón, la miel.\r\ny el aceite restante, luego vierta por todo el\r\nzanahorias y garbanzos asados. dejar para\r\nenfriar. Puedes enfriar la ensalada en esta etapa,\r\npor hasta 1 día; simplemente sácalo del\r\nrefrigerar 1 hora antes de servir.","Mezclar con la menta y las hojas de espinaca.\r\ny pistachos, y comprobar la sazón.\r\nEsparza el queso feta y rocíelo con un\r\nun poco de aceite extra."]','2026-01-11 13:01:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14206,8088,'es','Gambas al ajillo','Prepare este plato de tapas en poco tiempo, evocando los bares tranquilos de la costa española. Tradicionalmente se cocina en una cazuela de terracota ignífuga.','["12 langostinos crudos grandes","3 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","100 ml de aceite de oliva","3 chiles de cayena secos (u otro chile seco)","1 cucharada de perejil de hoja plana picado"]','["Pelar las gambas dejando intactas las colas y, con la ayuda de un palillo, retirar los tractos digestivos. O, si utilizas una sartén en lugar de una olla de barro, puedes cocinar las gambas con cáscara. Sazona con un poco de sal marina.","Poner el ajo, el aceite de oliva y las guindillas en una cacerola o sartén de barro ignífugo y poner a fuego alto. Cuando el ajo comience a dorarse, agregue las gambas y cocine durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén rosadas. Espolvoree perejil picado y un poco de pimienta negra recién molida y sirva inmediatamente. Si utilizas una olla de barro, puedes llevarla directamente a la mesa, pero ten cuidado con ella porque el aceite y la barro permanecerán calientes durante varios minutos."]','2026-01-11 13:01:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14207,8090,'es','Crema Catalana','Son los cítricos de la natilla los que distinguen a este clásico postre español, cubierto con azúcar dorado caramelizado. La manera perfecta de completar un menú de tapas','["400ml de leche entera","150ml de nata doble","1 rama de canela","1 naranja, ralladura cortada en tiras","1 limón, ralladura cortada en tiras","7 yemas de huevo (congela las claras para usarlas en otra receta)","100 g de azúcar en polvo, más 6 cucharadas para la cobertura","45 g de harina de maíz"]','["Poner en un cazo la leche, la nata, la ramita de canela y toda la ralladura de cítricos a fuego medio. Cocine, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que la leche esté humeando pero no hirviendo, aproximadamente de 3 a 5 minutos. Retirar del fuego, tapar con un plato y dejar infusionar durante al menos 30 minutos.","Cuando la mezcla de crema se haya infundido, bata las yemas de huevo, el azúcar y la harina de maíz en un recipiente aparte durante 3 a 5 minutos, o hasta que estén claras y de color pálido. Vierta la leche infundida a través de un colador en la mezcla de huevo, batiendo continuamente. Regresa la mezcla a la cacerola.","Pon la cacerola a fuego medio-alto y bate durante unos 10-12 minutos. La mezcla debe comenzar a espesarse hasta obtener una consistencia similar a la de una natilla; puedes saber que está lista sumergiendo una cuchara de madera en la mezcla y luego pasando un dedo por la mezcla en el dorso de la cuchara. Si la línea aguanta, está listo. Tamizar la mezcla en una jarra para eliminar la espuma.","Divida la natilla entre seis moldes de 150 ml o pequeños platos de terracota, luego déjela enfriar durante 1 hora a temperatura ambiente hasta que cuaje con una ligera oscilación. Enfriar durante la noche.","Justo antes de servir, espolvoree 1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo sobre cada molde y caramelice con un soplete de cocina. Alternativamente, deslice los moldes debajo de una parrilla caliente hasta que el azúcar se dore y comience a burbujear. Sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:01:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14208,8092,'es','Ensaimada','Pruebe este horneado español como desayuno o merienda para disfrutar con café o como refrigerio salado. Su forma de espiral es icónica, al igual que su textura ligera como una pluma.','["5 g de levadura seca (o 16 g de levadura fresca)","200 g de azúcar en polvo","2 huevos medianos de corral","600 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","Aceite vegetal, para la superficie de trabajo y el rodillo.","100 g de manteca de cerdo blanda (o 50 g si se utiliza sobrasada como relleno)","50g sobrasada de Mallorca (cured, spreadable sausage)","200 ml de nata montada","3 cucharadas de azúcar glas (opcional)"]','["Vierte 230ml de agua tibia en un bol y añade la levadura. Deje reposar durante 3 minutos, luego agregue el azúcar en polvo, los huevos, la harina y 1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas. Mezcle para formar una masa, luego amase durante 10 minutos en una batidora de pie con un gancho para masa (o 15 minutos a mano) hasta que la masa esté lo suficientemente elástica como para ser casi transparente cuando se estire. Cubra y deje reposar durante 30 minutos, luego córtelo en cuatro trozos iguales. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Dejar reposar otros 30 min.","Engrase la superficie de trabajo y un rodillo con aceite vegetal. Trabajando con una porción de masa a la vez, aplánela contra la superficie con la palma de la mano y luego extiéndala hasta formar un rectángulo delgado, de unos 30 x 50 cm. Déjalo reposar durante 2 minutos mientras esparces un cuarto de la manteca por encima. (Si quieres rellenar tu masa con sobrasada de Mallorca, mezcla 50 g de manteca de cerdo con la sobrasada y, en su lugar, espárcela sobre la masa). Tira de una esquina de la masa aplanada y estírala todo lo que puedas sin que se rompa. Repita aproximadamente cada 10 cm alrededor del rectángulo de masa en todas direcciones hasta que alcance unos 50 x 70 cm.","Corta una tira de cada uno de los lados más cortos y colócalas una al lado de la otra a lo largo de uno de los lados más largos del rectángulo; esto es lo que llamamos el corazón de la ensaimada. A partir de ahí, comienza a enrollar la masa hasta obtener una serpiente de hojaldre larga. Repita con las porciones restantes de masa.","Coge el primer rollo de masa y estíralo hasta que tenga más de un metro de largo. Luego, enróllala formando una espiral, dejando 1 cm entre cada vuelta de la espiral para que la masa se expanda. Aplana un poco y transfiérelo a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Repita con la masa restante. Dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante al menos 12 horas, o idealmente 24 horas.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner las ensaimadas en el tercio superior del horno y reducir inmediatamente la temperatura a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Hornear durante 18 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla. Para rellenar tu ensaimada con nata montada, corta y abre, luego extiende sobre la nata y cierra. Espolvoree con una cantidad generosa de azúcar glas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14209,8094,'es','Paella trampa al microondas','Pruebe esta versión abreviada de la clásica paella española, con pollo y chorizo ​​para una comida entre semana. La receta se basa en un microondas con una potencia de 750W.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente rallados","700 ml de caldo de pollo","pizca de azafrán (opcional)","½ cucharada de pimentón dulce ahumado","300 gramos de arroz para paella","200 g de pollo, en rodajas finas","200 g de chorizo, picado","150 g de guisantes congelados","½ limón, en jugo, más gajos para servir","un puñado pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Ponga el aceite de oliva, la cebolla, el ajo y una pizca de sal en un plato grande apto para microondas, mezcle bien y caliente a temperatura alta durante 3 minutos. Mientras tanto, combine el caldo de pollo y el azafrán en una jarra y déjelo en infusión un par de minutos.","Agrega el pimentón, el arroz, el pollo y el chorizo ​​a la cebolla y el ajo, luego vierte el caldo de pollo y el azafrán antes de sazonar bien. Tape y cocine a temperatura alta durante 15 minutos. Revuelva, cubra y cocine por 5 minutos más.","Destape, teniendo cuidado con el vapor, luego agregue los guisantes congelados y otros 100 ml de agua si se ve un poco seco. Cocine, sin tapar, durante 3 minutos antes de rociar con jugo de limón y espolvorear sobre el perejil. Sirva con rodajas de limón para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14210,6409,'es','paella vegana','Consiga cuatro de sus cinco comidas al día con esta paella vegana: es una cena saciante pero baja en calorías. Hemos incluido habas, una valiosa fuente de proteína vegetal.','["2 pizcas generosas de azafrán","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas (320 g), finamente picadas","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","3 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 cucharadas de hojas suaves de tomillo","200 g de arroz basmati integral","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","320 g de habas congeladas","320 g de calabacines, partidos por la mitad y en rodajas","15 g de perejil de hoja plana, picado","1 limón, cortado en gajos"]','["Pon la tetera a hervir. Vierta el azafrán, el puré de tomate y el caldo en polvo en un recipiente grande resistente al calor, luego vierta sobre 1 litro de agua hirviendo y reserve.","Calentar el aceite en una paellera grande a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla durante 5 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Agrega los pimientos, el ajo y el tomillo y cocina unos minutos más. Agregue el arroz y el pimentón y continúe cocinando, revolviendo durante aproximadamente un minuto. Vierta el caldo de azafrán, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Destape y revuelva suavemente, luego agregue los frijoles y los calabacines congelados. Vuelva a hervir a fuego lento, luego cubra y cocine por otros 10 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno y haya absorbido el caldo. Deje reposar durante 5 minutos y luego agregue el perejil. Sirva la mitad de la paella inmediatamente con rodajas de limón para exprimir. La otra mitad se mantendrá fría hasta por tres días. Para disfrutarlo otro día, recaliéntalo en el microondas hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14211,8096,'es','Pollo español fácil','Disfrute de nuestra receta española de pollo: un guiso clásico y reconfortante hecho con muslos de pollo en salsa de tomate y pimentón ahumado con chorizo ​​y judías blancas.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","150 g de chorizo ​​cortado en aros","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en tiras","1 pimiento amarillo, sin semillas y cortado en tiras","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado dulce","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","150 g de aceitunas verdes deshuesadas","Lata de 400 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","8 muslos de pollo con hueso y piel","un puñado pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calentar el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande apta para horno a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla, el chorizo ​​y los pimientos junto con una pizca de sal y pimienta durante 15 minutos hasta que las verduras se ablanden y el chorizo ​​haya soltado su aceite. Agregue el pimentón y el ajo y cocine por unos minutos más hasta que estén fragantes.","Agregue los tomates picados, las aceitunas y los frijoles, revuelva para combinar y sazone. Coloque los muslos de pollo y sazone bien. Transfiera al horno y hornee durante 40 minutos hasta que la piel del pollo esté crujiente y la carne bien cocida y tierna. Esparcir con el perejil y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14212,4301,'es','Guiso de verano con chorizo ​​y garbanzos','Combine tomates, garbanzos, pimientos rojos y espinacas con chorizo ​​y pimentón ahumado para preparar este guiso familiar lleno de nutrientes, rico en vitamina C y fibra.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 ramitas de tomillo","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","200 g de aros de chorizo, cortados en monedas finas","1 cucharada de vinagre de jerez","600 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","Tarro de 450 g de pimientos rojos asados, escurridos y cortados en tiras grandes","100 g de espinacas","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos","un chorrito de aceite de oliva virgen extra y pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio, agrega el ajo, el tomillo y el pimentón ahumado y revuelve por unos minutos, luego vierte el chorizo ​​y revuelve por un par de minutos más hasta que suelte su aceite. Rocíe el vinagre de jerez y déjelo burbujear durante aproximadamente un minuto.","Añade los tomates, los pimientos, las espinacas y los garbanzos junto con 100ml de agua y una pizca de condimento. Deje hervir, luego reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine hasta que los tomates se ablanden y quede una salsa espesa, aproximadamente 15 minutos. Rectifica la sazón y finaliza con un chorrito de aceite de oliva virgen extra. Servir con pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14213,8098,'es','Albóndigas de patatas bravas','Inspírate en las clásicas tapas patatas bravas con esta receta. La adición de albóndigas de cerdo caseras lo convierte en el regalo familiar ideal para los viernes por la noche.','["3½ cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","1½-2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado picante (dependiendo de lo picante que te guste)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","100 g de aceitunas negras deshuesadas","400 g de carne picada de cerdo","70 g de pan rallado fresco","1 yema de huevo","pizca de hojuelas de chile","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","1 kg de patatas blancas, cortadas en cubos de 3 cm","alioli, para servir (opcional; consulte el consejo a continuación)"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una cacerola y fríe las cebollas con una pizca de sal durante 10 minutos hasta que estén blandas. Agrega dos tercios del ajo y cocina por 1 minuto más. Agregue el pimentón y cocine por un minuto más, luego agregue los tomates y el azúcar. Sazone al gusto. Cocine durante 15 minutos hasta que espese. Retirar del fuego, mezclar con las aceitunas y reservar.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8. Poner la carne picada en un bol grande con el pan rallado, el resto del ajo, la yema de huevo, las hojuelas de guindilla y la mitad del perejil. Estación. Mezclar con las manos hasta que esté bien combinado. Divídalo en 12 trozos, pese para mayor precisión si lo desea, luego enróllelo en albóndigas. Tapar y meter en el frigorífico para que se enfríe mientras preparas las patatas.","Mezcle las patatas en una fuente para asar con 1½ cucharada del aceite restante y un poco de condimento. Ase durante 40 minutos hasta que esté dorado, revolviendo a la mitad. Calienta el resto del aceite en una sartén a fuego medio-alto y fríe las albóndigas durante 5 minutos, revolviendo hasta que se doren uniformemente. Añade las albóndigas al molde con las patatas y asa durante 10 minutos más. Vuelva a calentar la salsa de tomate, si es necesario, luego vierta sobre las albóndigas y las patatas. Cubra con el perejil picado restante y sirva con un poco de alioli, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14214,8100,'es','Paella mixta','Prueba nuestra versión de paella, elaborada con una combinación de carnes y mariscos. Con langostinos, mejillones, chorizo ​​y pollo, cada bocado es una delicia que recuerda a las fiestas españolas.','["Lata de 400g de tomates picados","600 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cucharadita colmada de pimentón ahumado","2 pizcas de azafrán","1 cebolla, picada","3 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente picados","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","300 gramos de arroz para paella","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados por la mitad","200 g de chorizo, en rodajas","85 g de guisantes congelados","150 g de langostinos crudos, pelados si quieres","250 g de mejillones limpios","1 limón, cortado en cuartos (opcional)"]','["Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Combine los tomates, el caldo, el pimentón y el azafrán en una jarra grande resistente al calor, luego cocine en el microondas durante 5 minutos a temperatura alta o hasta que esté humeante. O calentar en una sartén sobre la encimera.","Coloque la cebolla y el ajo en una sartén grande para horno o en una fuente para asar, rocíe con aceite de oliva y revuelva para cubrir. Ase durante 20 minutos o hasta que las verduras comiencen a dorarse.","Agregue la mezcla de arroz, pollo, chorizo ​​y caldo caliente. Sazone y hornee por 20 minutos (sin tapar la sartén).","Agregue suavemente los guisantes, salpique las gambas y presione los mejillones, con el lado con las bisagras hacia abajo, para que queden de pie. Coloque las rodajas de limón alrededor del borde, si las usa. Hornee durante 5-10 minutos más hasta que el arroz, el pollo y las gambas estén cocidos y los mejillones se hayan abierto (deseche los que queden cerrados). Comprobar la sazón y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14215,6827,'es','La paella más fácil','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. ¿Crees que la paella es un gran desafío? Piénselo de nuevo, esta receta fácil la hace infalible y está llena de un sabor fantástico.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 puerro o cebolla, en rodajas","Paquete de 110 g de chorizo, picado","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","300 g de arroz de grano largo","1 litro de caldo de pescado o pollo caliente","200 g de guisantes congelados","400 g de mezcla de mariscos congelados y descongelados"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén honda y luego ablandar el puerro durante 5 minutos sin que se dore. Añade el chorizo ​​y sofríe hasta que suelte sus aceites. Agregue la cúrcuma y el arroz hasta que estén cubiertos por los aceites, luego vierta el caldo. Llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Agregue los guisantes y cocine durante 5 minutos, luego agregue los mariscos para calentarlos durante 1 a 2 minutos finales o hasta que el arroz esté cocido. Verifique la sazón y sirva inmediatamente con rodajas de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14216,8102,'es','Bacalao asado con paella y aceite de oliva con azafrán','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Impresiona a tus amigos con el lujoso arroz con mariscos de Jason Atherton, cubierto con jugoso bacalao y rociado con azafrán.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","200 g de chorizo ​​crudo, cortado en cubitos","3 chalotes grandes, en rodajas finas","3 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de pimentón dulce ahumado (pimentón)","300 gramos de arroz para paella","1 litro de caldo de pescado","nuez de mantequilla sin sal","300 g de gambas picadas en trozos pequeños","un puñado de mejillones cocidos y sin cáscara, más 18 con cáscara","jugo de ½ limón (opcional)","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","75 ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","jugo ½ limón","pellizcar hebras de azafrán","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","nuez de mantequilla sin sal","6 x 175 g/6 oz de filetes de bacalao, con piel","exprimir el jugo de limon"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nPara hacer la paella, poner el aceite de oliva,\r\nchorizo, chalotas y ajo en una cacerola grande\r\nsartén y freír durante 7-8 minutos hasta que el chorizo\r\nsuelta su aceite y las chalotas tienen\r\nsuavizado. Agrega el pimentón y cocina,\r\nrevolviendo, durante 5 minutos, luego agregue el arroz,\r\nmezcle bien y cocine por unos minutos más.","Verter 600 ml de caldo, sazonar y\r\nmezcle bien para combinar. Cubrir y poner\r\nal horno por 15 min. descubrir, dar\r\ntodo bien revuelto, luego regresa al\r\nHorno por 10 min. Cuando esté casi cocido,\r\nRetirar del horno y extender sobre\r\nuna bandeja para enfriar. Enfríe y reserve para más tarde. Puede prepararlo con un día de anticipación.","Para hacer el aceite de azafrán, bata el\r\naceite de oliva y jugo de limón juntos en\r\nuna cacerola pequeña. Añade el azafrán y\r\ncalentar suavemente durante 5 minutos, luego retirar de\r\nEl calor y dejar infundir y enfriar. Puedes preparar esto con un día de anticipación.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPara el bacalao, poner el aceite de oliva y la mantequilla.\r\nen una sartén apta para horno a fuego alto\r\nCalienta, pero no dejes que se queme. Sazone el\r\nbacalao con sal marina y pimienta negra, luego\r\ncocine, con la piel hacia abajo, en la sartén caliente, durante\r\n4 minutos, luego voltea el pescado con cuidado.\r\ny mete la sartén en el horno un rato más.\r\n3 min, terminando con un poco más de mar.\r\nsal y un chorrito de zumo de limón.","Mientras tanto, volver a poner la paella en el\r\nsartén, agregue el caldo de pescado restante y\r\ncocine durante 2 minutos hasta que esté completamente caliente\r\na través. Revuelva con una nuez de mantequilla, las gambas y los mejillones sin cáscara. gusto,\r\nsazone con jugo de limón, sal y pimienta\r\nsi es necesario, y terminar con el troceado\r\nperejil. Servir con el bacalao asado,\r\nmejillones con concha y al vapor\r\nbrócoli morado o una verdura verde,\r\nsi quieres. Finalmente rociar todo\r\ncon el aderezo de azafrán."]','2026-01-11 13:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14217,8104,'es','Churros con salsa de chocolate','Pruebe una nueva versión de las donas preparándolas al estilo español y sirviéndolas con una espesa y deliciosa salsa de chocolate amargo.','["50 g de mantequilla, derretida","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","aproximadamente 1 litro de aceite de girasol","unos trozos de pan","200 g de barra de chocolate negro, no demasiado amargo, partido en trozos","100ml de nata doble","100ml de leche entera","3 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla, si tienes","100 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de canela"]','["Hervir la tetera, luego medir 350 ml de agua hirviendo en una jarra y agregar la mantequilla derretida y el extracto de vainilla. Tamiza la harina y el polvo para hornear en un tazón grande con una pizca grande de sal. Hacer un hueco en el centro, luego verter el contenido de la jarra y muy rápidamente incorporar la harina con una cuchara de madera hasta que no queden grumos. Reposa durante 10-15 minutos mientras preparas la salsa.","Coloque todos los ingredientes de la salsa en una sartén y derrítalos suavemente, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta obtener una salsa suave y brillante. Mantener caliente a fuego lento.","Llene una cacerola grande y profunda hasta un tercio de su capacidad con aceite. Calienta hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 45 segundos – 1 min. Cubre una bandeja con papel de cocina y mezcla el azúcar en polvo y la canela.","Coloque una boquilla de estrella en una manga pastelera; 1,5-2 cm de ancho es un buen tamaño. Rellene con la masa reposada, luego coloque 2-3 tiras directamente en el molde, cortando cada tira de masa con un par de tijeras de cocina. Freír hasta que estén doradas y crujientes, luego retirar con una espumadera y escurrir en la bandeja forrada con papel de cocina. Continúa cocinando el resto de la masa por tandas, espolvoreando sobre los churros cocidos un poco de azúcar con canela. Una vez que hayas cocinado todos los churros, mezcla con el resto del azúcar y canela y sirve con la salsa de chocolate para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14218,8106,'es','Ensalada templada de hígados de pollo, pimentón ahumado y Jerez','Una deliciosa ensalada tibia, llena de sabores ahumados y con ajo.','["Bolsa de 100 g de avellanas blanqueadas, menos 3 cucharadas para la salsa, abajo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","pequeña nuez de mantequilla","Paquete de 450 g de hígados de pollo, cortados en trozos pequeños","Vaso 125ml Jerez Oloroso","jugo ½ limón","Bolsa de 120 g de ensalada de rúcula","vinagre de jerez, para aliñar las hojas","2 dientes de ajo","Paquete de 20 g de perejil de hoja plana, solo las hojas","3 cucharadas de avellanas blanqueadas","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado picante","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes para la salsa.\r\nen un procesador de alimentos, luego pase a un\r\npasta rugosa. Caliente el horno a 200C/ventilador de 180C/\r\ngas 6. Poner el resto de las avellanas en una\r\nbandeja para hornear, ase durante 5 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente\r\ntostado, picado en trozos grandes y luego reservado.","Ahora haz la ensalada – agrega el aceite de oliva.\r\ny mantequilla en una sartén grande sobre una\r\nfuego medio-alto. Freír rápidamente los hígados.\r\nen 2 tandas hasta que se dore, aproximadamente 2 minutos\r\npor lote. Agregue el jerez, luego burbujee durante\r\nunos minutos a fuego alto. Agregue el\r\nSalsa y dejar espesar y calentar.\r\na través. Rocíe el jugo de limón y luego\r\nsazone al gusto. Viste las hojas de ensalada\r\ncon un poco de vinagre de Jerez. Cuchara el\r\nhígados y salsa en platos para servir,\r\nespolvorear con las tostadas picadas\r\navellanas, luego esparcirlas sobre el aderezo\r\nensala las hojas y sirve inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14219,8108,'es','pastel de pollo español','Los pimientos asados, las aceitunas y el pimentón le dan a este horneado mucho sabor. También es una excelente manera de aprovechar las sobras del pollo cocido.','["1 kg de patatas picadas","3 cucharaditas de pimentón (use pimentón ahumado si lo tiene)","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, rebanadas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","300 g de pollo cocido y desmenuzado","140 g de pimientos asados ​​de un frasco, en rodajas (nos gustan los Karyatis)","un puñado de aceitunas Kalamata, partidas por la mitad"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Hervir\r\nlas patatas durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén tiernas.\r\nEscurrir, volver a la sartén y luego triturar con\r\nun poco de condimento y 2 cucharaditas de pimentón.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén grande,\r\nLuego sofreír la cebolla y el ajo durante unos\r\nminutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el resto\r\npimentón durante 1 min, añadir los tomates,\r\nluego, llevar a fuego lento. Incline hacia un gran\r\nfuente refractaria, luego agregue el pollo,\r\npimientos, aceitunas y algún condimento.","Vierta sobre el puré y luego hornee por\r\n15 minutos hasta que el puré esté dorado.\r\nencima y la salsa burbujea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14220,4833,'es','Arroz español con marisco','Esta versión rápida de paella es súper saludable y, además, se cocina en una sola sartén, por lo que requiere un mínimo lavado.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 pimiento rojo y 1 amarillo, sin semillas y en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","250 gramos de arroz para paella","850 ml de caldo de verduras caliente (nosotros utilizamos caldo Kallo muy bajo en sal)","pizca de azafrán","400 g de mezcla de mariscos (nosotros usamos una bolsa de mezcla de mariscos congelados, descongelados antes de usar)","jugo ½ limón pequeño","un puñado pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande y\r\nAblanda la cebolla durante 6-7 minutos. Añade el\r\npimienta y ajo, cocine por 2 minutos\r\nmás, luego agregue el arroz para paella y\r\ncocine por 1 minuto, revolviendo para cubrir.","Verter el caldo, añadir el azafrán y\r\nllevar a ebullición. Cocine, descubierto, a\r\nuna suave burbuja, durante 20 minutos, revolviendo\r\nDe vez en cuando hasta que el arroz esté tierno.","Agregue los mariscos y el jugo de limón y\r\ncocine por 2 minutos o hasta que esté bien caliente y\r\ncompletamente cocido. servir en\r\ntazones calientes esparcidos con el perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:01:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14221,8110,'es','Gambas al ajillo al jerez','A los amantes de los mariscos les encantará esta sencilla receta estilo tapas, baja en grasas y rápida de cocinar.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","400 g de gambas grandes, crudas","2 cucharadas de jerez seco (fino)","un puñado de perejil picado"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande. Vierta las rodajas de ajo y cocine por unos segundos.\r\nLuego revuelve las gambas y cocina durante un par de minutos hasta que empiecen a ponerse rosadas.","Vierta sobre el jerez y cocine unos minutos más, hasta que las gambas estén cocidas.\r\na través. Espolvorea con perejil antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14222,8112,'es','tortilla especiada','Perfecta para cenas, almuerzos y refrigerios, esta tortilla especiada es un excelente recurso para guardar en el refrigerador en muchas ocasiones.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla, rebanada","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y rallado","2 cucharaditas de especias de curry (nosotros usamos cilantro, comino y cúrcuma)","300 g de tomates cherry","500 g de patatas cocidas, en rodajas","manojo de cilantro, tallos finamente picados y hojas picadas en trozos grandes","8 huevos batidos"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Freír la cebolla y la mitad del chile durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Incorpora las especias y fríe durante 1 min.\r\nmás, luego agrega los tomates cherry, las papas y los tallos de cilantro a la sartén. Sazone bien los huevos, viértalos sobre las verduras y déjelos cocinar a fuego lento durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén casi cuajados.","Caliente la parrilla y cocine la tortilla por debajo durante 1-2 minutos hasta que la parte superior esté firme. Esparcir las hojas de cilantro y el resto.\r\nchile por encima, cortarlo en gajos y\r\nsirva con una ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 13:01:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14223,8114,'es','Bolas españolas de higos y almendras','Una versión festiva del Pan de Higo, un pastel de higos secos que los españoles comen tradicionalmente con queso y un chorrito de miel.','["100 g de almendras enteras tostadas","Paquete de 500 g de higos enteros secos, sin el tallo duro ni el centro de la base","85 g de orejones cortados en trozos pequeños","50 g de arándanos secos","1 cucharada de brandy","1 cucharada de miel clara","1 cucharadita de clavo molido","100 g de semillas de sésamo tostadas"]','["Batir las almendras en un procesador de alimentos hasta que la mayoría esté finamente picada, luego verterlas en un tazón grande. Picar los higos en trozos grandes y luego batirlos hasta \r\nuna pasta suave y pegajosa. Raspe las almendras y luego, con las manos, mezcle bien con los frutos secos, el brandy, la miel y el clavo.","Divida la mezcla en 6 y forme bolitas. Coloca las semillas de sésamo en una bandeja y luego enrolla las bolas hasta cubrirlas. Cubra la bandeja sin apretar con un paño de cocina limpio y luego deje secar las bolas de higo durante una semana antes de empaquetarlas. Se mantendrá en un lugar fresco durante 2 meses."]','2026-01-11 13:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14224,5796,'es','One-pot de arroz español y gambas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una comida rápida y fácil llena de sabores festivos mediterráneos.','["1 cebolla, rebanada","1 pimiento rojo y 1 verde, sin semillas y en rodajas","50 g de chorizo, en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","250 g de arroz basmati de cocción fácil (nosotros usamos Tilda)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","200 g de gambas crudas peladas y descongeladas si están congeladas"]','["Hervir la tetera. En una sartén antiadherente o\r\nsartén poco profunda con tapa, sofreír la cebolla,\r\npimientos, chorizo y ajo en el aceite sobre\r\na fuego alto durante 3 min. Agregue el arroz y\r\ntomates picados con 500ml hirviendo\r\nagua, tapar y luego cocinar a fuego alto\r\ndurante 12 min.","Destape y revuelva; el arroz debe estar\r\ncasi tierno. Agregue las gambas, con un\r\necha más agua si el arroz se ve\r\nsecar, luego cocinar por otro minuto hasta que\r\nlas gambas están rosadas y el arroz tierno."]','2026-01-11 13:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14225,8116,'es','Sopa de chorizo ​​y garbanzos','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Sopa chisporroteante de chorizo ​​y garbanzos.','["Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Paquete de 110 g de chorizo ​​(sin lonchas)","140 g de coles de Saboya en gajos","espolvorear hojuelas de chile seco","Lata de 410 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados.","1 cubito de caldo de pollo o verduras","pan crujiente o pan de ajo, para servir"]','["Pon una sartén mediana al fuego y vierte  \r\nen los tomates, seguido de una lata de agua. \r\nMientras los tomates se calientan, rápidamente  \r\npicar el chorizo en trozos grandes \r\n(quitando la piel) y desmenuzar la col.","Coloca el chorizo y el repollo en la sartén. \r\ncon las hojuelas de guindilla y los garbanzos, luego \r\ndesmenuzar en la pastilla de caldo. Revuelva bien, cubra \r\ny dejar burbujear a fuego alto durante \r\n6 minutos o hasta que el repollo esté tierno. \r\nSirva en tazones y cómelo con crujiente o  \r\npan de ajo."]','2026-01-11 13:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14226,4917,'es','Sardinas españolas sobre tostadas','Disfrute del sabor del Mediterráneo con esta cena fresca y saludable que utiliza un pescado azul rico en omega-3 y un alimento básico bueno y económico.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 limón, ralladura y jugo","2 latas de 120 g de sardinas en aceite de girasol, escurridas","4 rebanadas de pan integral","medio manojo pequeño de perejil, picado"]','["Calentar el aceite de oliva en un\r\nsartén, luego chisporrotear\r\nel diente de ajo y la guindilla roja. Agrega la ralladura de limón.","Añade el\r\nsardinas y calor\r\ndurante unos minutos hasta que esté tibio.","Tostar el pan integral. Agrega el perejil al\r\nsardinas, añadir un chorrito de zumo de limón,\r\nluego dividir entre las tostadas y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14227,8118,'es','Ensalada de chorizo ​​y huevo pasado por agua','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta ensalada de verano en cualquier momento estará en la mesa en solo 30 minutos.','["Bolsa de 500 g de patatas nuevas cortadas por la mitad","4 huevos","225 g de judías verdes, peladas","225 g de aros de chorizo, en rodajas","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","2 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","2 cucharadas de perejil picado"]','["Cocine las patatas en una cacerola grande de\r\nHervir agua con sal durante 12 minutos y agregar.\r\nlos huevos después de 6 minutos y los frijoles\r\ndurante los últimos 2 minutos. Escurrir todo y\r\nEnfríe los huevos con agua corriente fría.","Mientras tanto sofreír las lonchas de chorizo durante\r\n1-2 minutos, hasta que empiece a estar crujiente. Quitar\r\nde la sartén con una espumadera y\r\nreservar, dejando el aceite del chorizo\r\nen la sartén. Añade el ajo a la sartén y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 1 min.","Retire la sartén del fuego, revuelva\r\nen el vinagre y el perejil, luego mezcle\r\ncon las patatas, frijoles, chorizo\r\ny condimento. Pelar los huevos, cortarlos en\r\ncuartos y agregar a la ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:01:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14228,8120,'es','Tortilla de chorizo, patatas y queso','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Bata los huevos con salchicha española y patatas para preparar un delicioso almuerzo de tortilla para uno.','["1 patata pequeña, cortada en dados de 2 cm","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","50 g de chorizo, picado","2-3 huevos","perejil picado","25 g de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Cocine la papa en agua hirviendo durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que esté tierna. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor. Calienta el aceite en una sartén para tortilla, agrega el chorizo ​​y cocina por 2 minutos. Agregue la papa y cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que la papa comience a estar crujiente. Saque el contenido de la sartén, límpiela y cocine una tortilla de 2 o 3 huevos en la misma sartén. Cuando esté casi cocido, espolvorear con el chorizo ​​y la patata, el perejil y el queso. Dobla la tortilla en la sartén y cocina por 1 min más para derretir el queso."]','2026-01-11 13:01:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14229,8122,'es','pollo español','Para obtener el máximo sabor y un mínimo de lavado, pruebe este sabroso plato de una sola olla.','["8 muslos de pollo, con piel y hueso","3 cebollas, en rodajas finas","2 cucharaditas de pimentón","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","un buen puñado de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","caldo de 150 ml","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nColoque todos los ingredientes en una fuente grande y ancha.\r\nfuente apta para horno. Mezclar todo junto\r\ncon tus manos y sazona.","Hornee por 45 minutos, revolviendo las cebollas.\r\ndespués de 20 minutos, hasta que el pollo esté dorado\r\ny las cebollas tiernas. Servir con arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14230,5758,'es','Ensalada de chorizo ​​y tomate','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. La combinación de tomates dulces y ácidos con chorizo ​​salado y picante y vinagre de jerez picante es una combinación perfecta.','["3 tomates de res maduros, cortados en gajos","½ cebolla morada, cortada en rodajas finas","algunas ramitas de tomillo, hojas recogidas","1 cucharada de vinagre de jerez","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","100 g de chorizo, cortado en diagonal"]','["Poner los tomates en un bol con el\r\ncebolla y tomillo. Sazonar y luego rociar\r\ncon el vinagre y el aceite. Deja que los sabores\r\nmézclalos mientras cocinas el chorizo.","En una sartén seca y caliente sofreír las rodajas de chorizo.\r\nhasta que se dore por ambos lados. servir el\r\ntomates con chorizo frito, rociados\r\ncon un poco de aceite de la sartén."]','2026-01-11 13:01:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14231,8124,'es','gazpacho rápido','Repleto de vitamina C, bajo en grasas y cuenta como dos de cinco al día: ¡esto debería estar en el menú todas las semanas!','["250 g de puré","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharadita de vinagre de jerez","jugo ½ lima"]','["En una licuadora (o con una batidora de mano), mezcle \r\njuntos la passata, el pimiento rojo, la guindilla, el ajo, \r\nvinagre de jerez y jugo de lima hasta que quede suave. \r\nSazone al gusto y luego sirva con cubitos de hielo."]','2026-01-11 13:01:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14232,7122,'es','Gambas con salsa romesco','Suculentos langostinos tigre condimentados con chile y pimientos en este plato de tapas al estilo español.','["1 pimiento rojo, preferiblemente del tipo romano, de piel larga y fina","3 dientes de ajo gordos","1 chile rojo fresco y graso","1 tomate maduro grande","10 avellanas sin cáscara","10 almendras blanqueadas","3 ramitas de perejil","rebanada pequeña de pan del día anterior","8 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","Paquete de 400 g de langostinos tigre grandes, cocidos y pelados, descongelados si están congelados"]','["Prepárese con anticipación: corte el pimiento por la mitad a lo largo y quítele las semillas y el tallo. Forre una sartén con papel de aluminio y coloque las mitades de pimiento, con la piel hacia arriba, en la sartén junto con los dientes de ajo enteros, la guindilla y el tomate. Ase durante 2 minutos, dé la vuelta al tomate y luego ase durante 2 minutos más. Retirar el tomate con una cuchara grande, luego pelarlo, cortarlo en cuartos y quitarle las semillas. Luego pica el tomate en trozos grandes.","Continúe asando el pimiento, el chile y el ajo durante 4-5 minutos, hasta que la piel del pimiento y el chile se hayan ennegrecido y el ajo comience a ablandarse (la piel del ajo comenzará a partirse cuando esté listo). Cuando esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, pele y corte el chile por la mitad, raspe y deseche las semillas. Pelar el pimiento y picar en trozos grandes tanto el pimiento como la guindilla.","Extienda las nueces sobre el papel de aluminio y cocine a la parrilla hasta que estén tostadas. Pica finamente las nueces y el perejil en un procesador de alimentos. Vierta en un tazón pequeño.","Calentar 3 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén, añadir el pimiento, el ajo y la guindilla y sofreír durante 3 minutos. Rompe el pan y agrégalo a la sartén, revolviendo en el aceite hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Pulse en un procesador de alimentos con los tomates, la sal, el vinagre y el aceite hasta que estén picados en trozos grandes. Vierta en un tazón. Dejar enfriar y guardar en el frigorífico hasta por 3 días.","Ese mismo día añade las nueces y el perejil a la salsa y mezcla. Servir en un bol pequeño en un plato con las gambas peladas. Proporcione palitos de cóctel para pinchar las gambas."]','2026-01-11 13:01:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14233,8128,'es','Guiso de garbanzos, chorizo ​​y espinacas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Para una cena saludable y cálida que requiera poco esfuerzo y tiempo, no hay nada mejor que este sencillo plato de una sola sartén.','["3-4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cebolla, picada","1 zanahoria, finamente picada","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","unas ramitas de tomillo","2 hojas de laurel","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","200 g de chorizo, cortado en cubitos","¼ cucharadita de canela","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado picante","2 latas de 410 g/14 oz de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","1-2 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","Bolsa de 400 g de hojas de espinaca, lavadas y escurridas."]','["Caliente el aceite en una sartén grande y luego, suavemente\r\nsofreír la cebolla durante 3-4 minutos hasta que empiece\r\npara suavizar. Agregue la zanahoria, el apio y el tomillo.\r\ny hojas de laurel. Sazone, luego cocine por\r\n2-3 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Añade el\r\najo, chorizo, canela y ahumado\r\npimentón. Freír hasta que las verduras\r\nse ablanda y el chorizo empieza a soltarse\r\nsus aceites y quedar crujiente.","Agrega los garbanzos, el vinagre y\r\n150 ml de agua, luego llevar a fuego lento durante\r\n1-2 minutos hasta que los garbanzos se hayan calentado\r\narriba. Agregue las espinacas, luego revuelva con la\r\ngarbanzos hasta que se ablanden un poco. Quitar\r\ndel fuego, sazonar al gusto, luego\r\nsirva caliente con pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14234,8130,'es','Calamares crujientes con alcaparras','Un toque de mayonesa de ajo hace que todo sea un poco más delicioso, y estos calamares crujientes no son una excepción.','["300 g de chipirones limpios","200 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de alcaparras, escurridas y finamente picadas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","5 cucharadas de mayonesa","aceite vegetal o de girasol, para freír","rodajas de limón, para servir"]','["Cortar los calamares en aros de aproximadamente ½ cm de grosor. Vierta la harina en una bolsa para congelador y sazone bien. Agrega las alcaparras, luego agita todo bien para que se mezcle. Introduce los calamares en la bolsa y vuelve a agitar hasta que todos los aros queden bien cubiertos. Mezcle el ajo y la mayonesa y luego colóquelos en un tazón para servir.","Vierta un poco de aceite en una sartén grande hasta que suba unos 7 cm por los lados, pero la sartén no esté llena a más de un tercio. Coloca a fuego medio y deja que el aceite se caliente. Para comprobar que el aceite está listo, coloca un pequeño trozo de pan en la sartén; debe chisporrotear al tocar el aceite.","Retirar un puñado de calamares de la harina y sacudir el exceso. Caiga suavemente en\r\nel aceite, luego cocine durante unos 3 minutos hasta que esté crujiente. Retirar con una espumadera y\r\ncolocar sobre papel de cocina. Repita con los calamares restantes. Servir inmediatamente con\r\nla mayonesa y las rodajas de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:01:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14235,8132,'es','Pollo con azafrán, pasas y piñones','Este plato español lleno de sabor es ideal para la familia o para recibir a amigos entre semana.','["1¼kg de pollo, desarticulado y con hueso (pídelo a tu carnicero o consulta Know-how)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas picadas","3 dientes de ajo, picados","una buena pizca de azafrán (unas 20 hebras)","125ml de vaso de jerez seco (como Fino o Manzanilla)","200 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo","50 g de pasas","2 cucharadas de piñones","un puñado de perejil de hoja plana picado, para servir"]','["Calienta una sartén grande a fuego alto.\r\ny sazonar el pollo. Agrega el aceite de oliva\r\na la sartén, luego el pollo. Marrón para\r\nunos 5 minutos por cada lado, retirar\r\nun plato y luego reservar.","Baja el fuego a medio. en el\r\nresto de grasa, sofreír las cebollas\r\n3 minutos, luego añade el ajo y el azafrán.\r\nCocine por 3-4 minutos más. Añade el jerez,\r\nluego cocine a fuego lento durante 3-5 minutos hasta que esté almibarado.","Vuelva a colocar los trozos de muslo de pollo\r\nla sartén, verter el caldo, el tomillo y\r\npasas, tapar y cocinar suavemente a fuego lento.\r\ncalentar durante 20 min. Agrega la carne de pechuga\r\ny el jugo que quede en el plato, cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 10 minutos más hasta que esté bien cocido\r\ny la salsa de la sartén se ha reducido.","Mientras se cocina el pollo, calentar el horno.\r\na 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Esparcir el pino\r\nnueces sobre una bandeja para hornear, luego ástalas\r\n10 minutos hasta que estén doradas y tostadas. una vez\r\nel pollo esté bien cocido, sazone\r\nal gusto, espolvorear con piñones y\r\nperejil, luego sirva con arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14236,7130,'es','Patatas bravas','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Un plato de tapas clásico: cubos de papa en salsa de tomate picante.','["175 g de chorizo ​​en rodajas","350 g de patatas nuevas en rodajas","½ cucharadita de semilla de comino, 1 sin semillas","chile rojo fresco en rodajas","1 diente de ajo picado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados"]','["Cortar el chorizo ​​en rodajas y sofreírlo en una sartén grande durante un minuto. Agrega las patatas nuevas en rodajas y cocina durante 5 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Luego agregue las semillas de comino, 1 chile rojo fresco sin semillas y en rodajas y un diente de ajo picado y cocine por 2 minutos. Vierta la lata de tomates picados y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que las patatas estén tiernas."]','2026-01-11 13:01:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14237,7132,'es','Pan español con tomate y jamón serrano','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Estas deliciosas tapas están listas en solo 5 minutos, el acompañamiento perfecto para una fiesta de bebidas.','["4 tomates maduros, picados","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","sal","pimienta","20 rebanadas de baguette","5-6 lonchas de jamón serrano"]','["Mezclar los tomates picados, el diente de ajo, el aceite de oliva, la sal y la pimienta. Mantener en el frigorífico hasta que sea necesario.","Para servir, tuesta 20 rebanadas de baguette. Coloque un poco de cobertura de tomate sobre cada tostada. Corta 5-6 rebanadas de jamón serrano en trozos y pon un trozo en cada rebanada de pan."]','2026-01-11 13:01:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14238,8138,'es','Espaguetis con sabores españoles','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). Un plato de 10 minutos que infunde a los espaguetis los sabores de España; también puedes hacer una versión vegetariana.','["Paquete de 80 g de chorizo ​​​​en lonchas","Bolsa de 300g de espaguetis frescos","Paquete de 20g de perejil de hoja plana (un buen puñado)","2 pimientos rojos de frasco, en salmuera o aceite","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","50 g de parmesano fresco finamente rallado, más un poco más para servir"]','["Ponga una cacerola con agua a fuego alto.\r\ncalentar hasta hervir. Mientras tanto, corta el\r\nchorizo en tiras con unas tijeras,\r\ny picar el perejil y los pimientos\r\n(primero compruebe si hay semillas perdidas).","Cuando el agua hierva rápidamente,\r\nañade los espaguetis con un buen\r\nmedida de sal, remover y regresar a\r\nel hervor. Cocine por 3 minutos.","En una sartén grande calentar el aceite,\r\nañadir el chorizo y los pimientos y\r\nmucha pimienta negra. cocinar por un\r\nminuto más o menos, hasta que esté completamente caliente\r\ny los jugos se tiñen de rojo por\r\nel pimentón en el chorizo. primicia\r\nmedia taza de agua de pasta de\r\nla cacerola, escurrir el resto y\r\nColoca los espaguetis en la sartén.","Agrega el perejil y el parmesano,\r\nmezcle bien y agregue la pasta\r\nagua, para humedecer. Ronda de mano extra\r\nparmesano en la mesa."]','2026-01-11 13:01:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14239,8140,'es','té tailandés','Si es posible, intente encontrar una auténtica mezcla de té tailandés para esta receta. Una mezcla de té y leche condensada y servida con hielo, es una bebida dulce y deliciosa.','["90 g de hojas de té tailandés (nosotros usamos ChaTraMue)","Lata de 397 g de leche condensada (o leche de coco condensada para una opción vegana)","Lata de 410g de leche evaporada (o leche de avena)","hielo, para servir"]','["Mezcle con cuidado el té suelto y 1,5 litros de agua hirviendo en un recipiente grande resistente al calor. Dejar reposar durante 8 minutos. Mientras tanto, coloque un colador sobre una jarra grande y cubra con muselina.","Después de 8 minutos, vierte con cuidado el té a través del colador forrado y exprímelo para extraer todo el sabor (estará caliente, así que ten cuidado). Agrega las leches condensada y evaporada y luego enfría por 1 hora. Llene una jarra para servir con hielo, vierta el té y luego sirva en vasos altos con hielo y pajitas reutilizables."]','2026-01-11 13:01:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14240,8142,'es','Ensalada de manzana rallada al estilo tailandés','El mango verde es un elemento más tradicional de las ensaladas estilo tailandés, pero cuando no está disponible, las manzanas Granny Smith funcionan bien como sustituto.','["90 g de fideos de arroz (unos 2 nidos)","2 zanahorias grandes, ralladas","100 g de tirabeques, rallado","manojo pequeño de cebolletas, finamente cortadas","25 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes y un poco más para servir","50 g de maní tostado, picado en trozos grandes y un poco más para servir","2 manzanas Granny Smith, sin corazón y cortadas en palitos","100 g de rábanos, finamente cortados","50 g de mantequilla de maní suave","2 limas, ralladas y en jugo, más gajos adicionales para servir","1 cucharada de jarabe de arce","2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","1 cucharada de salsa de soja o tamari","1 cucharadita de jengibre finamente rallado"]','["Coloque los fideos de arroz en un recipiente resistente al calor, cúbralos con agua hirviendo y déjelos reposar durante 3 minutos hasta que se ablanden un poco, luego escúrralos. Batir todos los ingredientes del aderezo hasta que quede suave.","Ponga los fideos cocidos, las zanahorias, los tirabeques, las cebolletas, el cilantro, el maní, las manzanas y los rábanos en un bol y mezcle con el aderezo hasta que todo esté cubierto. Sirva cubierto con más cilantro y maní, con rodajas de lima a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14241,8144,'es','Fideos borrachos (pad kee mao)','Picantes, sabrosos y llenos de ponche, estos "fideos borrachos" tailandeses son la comida rápida definitiva y están listos en solo 20 minutos.','["200 g de fideos de arroz planos (elija fideos anchos, si es posible)","2 cucharadas de aceite de sabor neutro (como vegetal)","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","3 chiles ojo de pájaro, finamente picados","225 g de solomillo cortado en rodajas finas","100 g de brócoli de tallo largo, cortado en trozos de 3 a 4 cm","un puñado grande de hojas de albahaca tailandesa","3½ cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","3½ cucharadas de salsa de ostras","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","1 cucharada de azúcar"]','["Prepare los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escurra y reserve. Combine todos los ingredientes para la salsa en un tazón o jarra pequeña y reserve.","Calienta el aceite en un wok grande o sartén a fuego alto y sofríe el ajo y la guindilla durante 20 segundos hasta que empiecen a dorarse. Agregue el bistec y saltee durante 1 minuto hasta que se dore y comience a dorarse. Agrega el brócoli y sofríe por un minuto más, luego vierte los fideos y agrega la salsa. Sofría durante 1-2 minutos más hasta que esté bien combinado y bien caliente.","Revuelva la albahaca y apague el fuego. Sirva inmediatamente para evitar que se cocine demasiado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14242,8146,'es','Pasteles de pescado de salmón al estilo tailandés con salsa de mayonesa de lima','Prepara estos sencillos pasteles de pescado para la cena. También son un excelente refrigerio para el almuerzo durante la Pascua judía. Usa la mejor mayonesa que puedas encontrar para la salsa.','["2 latas de 220 g de salmón rojo","4 cebolletas, finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de cilantro fresco, picado en trozos grandes","1 lima, rallada y en jugo","2 huevos batidos","75 g de harina mediana de matzá","1 cucharada de coco rallado (opcional)","1-2 cucharadas de aceite neutro","100 g de mayonesa","1 cucharadita de ralladura de lima (aproximadamente 1 lima)","1 cucharada de jugo de lima (aproximadamente ½ lima)"]','["Escurre el salmón y tritúralo en un tazón mediano. Agregue las cebolletas, el cilantro, la ralladura y el jugo de lima, los huevos, la harina de matzá y el coco, si se usa. Sazone generosamente con sal y pimienta y mezcle hasta que se combinen uniformemente.","Calienta tu freidora a 180C. Mientras tanto, unte la parte superior de las croquetas de pescado con un poco de aceite.","Coloque las croquetas de pescado en una sola capa, con el lado engrasado hacia abajo, y cepille ligeramente el otro lado de cada una. Si no puede colocarlos todos de una vez, puede hacerlo en lotes. Freír al aire a 180C durante 8 minutos, luego darles la vuelta y freír durante otros 7-10 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente dorados y crujientes.","Mientras tanto mezcle la mayonesa con la ralladura de lima y el jugo. Gusto por sazonar. Sirve las croquetas de pescado calientes con la salsa o a temperatura ambiente. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:01:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14243,8148,'es','Pad tailandés de tempeh','Agregue tempeh rico en proteínas a este pad Thai para una comida familiar sencilla entre semana. Cambia por tofu, pollo o gambas, si quieres','["150 g de fideos de arroz","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","200 g de tempeh, en cubos","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","300 g de brotes de soja","3 pimientos pequeños, de diferentes colores idealmente, cortados en rodajas","3 huevos","un puñado de maní tostado y salado, picado en trozos grandes","1 chile rojo en rodajas, unas hojas de cilantro y 1 lima, cortada en gajos, para servir (opcional)","2 cucharadas de azúcar de palma o azúcar moreno","3 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","3 cucharadas de pasta de tamarindo","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharadita de ajo finamente picado (unos 4 dientes)"]','["Remoja los fideos en agua según las instrucciones del paquete. Una vez ablandado, escurrir y reservar.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y fríe el tempeh durante unos minutos hasta que se dore. Retirar y reservar en un plato.","En la misma sartén, sofríe las cebolletas, los brotes de soja y los pimientos durante unos minutos, asegurándote de que las verduras queden crujientes.","Rompe los huevos en un bol y bate ligeramente con un tenedor. Empuje las verduras a un lado de la sartén y luego vierta los huevos. Revuelva los huevos suavemente, luego agregue los fideos y el tempeh. Revuelve todo hasta que esté bien combinado.","En una cacerola aparte, combine todos los ingredientes de la salsa con 100 ml de agua. Cocine a fuego medio, revolviendo constantemente hasta que el azúcar se disuelva y la salsa espese un poco. Vierta la salsa sobre los fideos y las verduras y mezcle bien para asegurarse de que todos los ingredientes queden cubiertos uniformemente. Para servir, espolvoree con maní, junto con el chile rojo en rodajas y el cilantro, y rodajas de lima a un lado para exprimirlas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14244,8150,'es','Salteado de pollo fragante con hierba de limón y coco','Prepare una cena rápida y saludable en los días ocupados: este pollo salteado de inspiración tailandesa le ofrece dos de sus cinco comidas al día.','["1 rama de limoncillo, sin cáscara exterior, finamente picada (ver consejo a continuación)","15 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado","2 dientes de ajo, machacados","1 lima, exprimida","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moreno suave","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera reducida en sal","60ml de agua de coco (o usar agua)","1 chile ojo de pájaro, finamente picado (opcional)","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 calabacín, picado","2 pechugas de pollo, en rodajas finas","200 g de guisantes dulces, cortados","15 g de coco rallado","Bolsa de 250 g de arroz integral para microondas"]','["Combine la hierba de limón, el jengibre, el ajo, el jugo de lima, el azúcar, la salsa de soja, el agua de coco y el chile, si lo usa, y reserve. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande de lados altos awokor a fuego alto y sofríe el calabacín y el pollo durante 4 minutos hasta que se doren. Agregue los guisantes y el coco y cocine durante 1 o 2 minutos, revolviendo bien para asegurarse de que el coco no se queme.","Vierta la mezcla de limoncillo alrededor del borde de la sartén y luego revuelva para combinar. Continúe cocinando a fuego alto durante aproximadamente 1 o 2 minutos, hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido y la salsa se haya reducido. Sazone al gusto. Calienta el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego sírvelo con el salteado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14245,8152,'es','Sopa tom yum con gambas','Disfrute de una impresionante sopa tailandesa tom yum casera que es saludable y fácil de preparar: es vibrante, fresca y llena de sabor.','["200 g de cebollas, picadas en trozos grandes","150 g de tomates, picados en trozos grandes","20 g de chile rojo, en rodajas","15 g de galanga, pelada y cortada en rodajas","2 tallos de limoncillo, machacados","270 g de langostinos crudos enteros, pelados y desvenados, sin cabezas y reservados","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","120 g de champiñones ostra, en rodajas","8 hojas de lima","5 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado","5 cucharaditas de jugo de lima","70 ml de leche de coco tailandesa","1 cucharada de mermelada de chile tailandés (opcional)","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes (opcional)"]','["Vierta 1,3 litros de agua en una cacerola grande a fuego alto. Añade la cebolla, el tomate, la guindilla, la galanga, la hierba de limón, las cabezas de gambas y la pastilla de caldo de pollo. Revuelva y deje hervir, luego reduzca el fuego a medio y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que el líquido se reduzca.","Cuela con cuidado el caldo caliente en un recipiente o jarra grande resistente al calor y luego desecha las cabezas de gambas. Regrese la mezcla de verduras y hierbas coladas a la cacerola y vierta sobre el caldo. Agregue los champiñones y las hojas de lima, luego cocine durante 3 minutos hasta que los champiñones estén tiernos.","Agrega 1 cucharada de azúcar, la salsa de pescado, el jugo de lima, la leche de coco y las gambas. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar hasta que los langostinos estén bien cocidos, aproximadamente 1-2 minutos. Retirar del fuego. Retire la hierba de limón y luego agregue la mermelada de chile tailandés, si la usa. Esparce cilantro para terminar, si quieres, y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:01:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14246,8154,'es','Fideos vegetarianos al curry rojo fáciles','Pruebe nuestros fideos vegetarianos de curry rojo tailandés para disfrutar de una comida abundante entre semana repleta de pimiento rojo, tirabeques y maíz tierno.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","½ frasco de 170 g de pasta de curry rojo tailandés Blue Dragon","200ml de leche de coco","1 cucharadita de azúcar moreno","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas","250 g de verduras tiernas mixtas (tirabeques, maíz tierno, brócoli, etc.), corte por la mitad los trozos grandes","100 g de fideos al huevo medianos secos"]','["Coloca una sartén o wok ancho y profundo a fuego medio y agrega el aceite vegetal.","Agregue la pasta de curry rojo tailandés Blue Dragon al aceite y cocine durante 1 minuto, o hasta que la pasta huela fragante. Agrega la leche de coco y deja hervir. Agregue el azúcar, luego reduzca a fuego lento y cocine por 1 min.","Agregue las verduras (si está usando tirabeques, guárdelas) y suba el fuego a medio, cocinando hasta que estén tiernos pero conservando un bocado, aproximadamente de 6 a 8 minutos. 2 minutos antes de que finalice el tiempo de cocción añadir los tirabeques.","Mientras tanto, cocina los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y divídelos en dos tazones. Agrega algunas verduras a los tazones y cubre con la salsa de curry."]','2026-01-11 13:01:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14247,8156,'es','Curry verde tailandés fácil de pollo y champiñones','Lleno de pollo tierno, champiñones abundantes y verduras frescas, este curry tailandés se prepara en un instante en los días ajetreados.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","½ frasco de 170 g de pasta de curry verde tailandés Blue Dragon","1 pechuga de pollo grande o 2 pequeñas, cortadas en rodajas","½ cebolla morada, rebanada","200 g de champiñones, cortados por la mitad o en cuartos","200ml de leche de coco","50 g de tirabeques cortados por la mitad a lo largo o 50 g de floretes pequeños de brócoli","arroz cocido para servir"]','["Pon el aceite vegetal en una sartén y calienta a fuego alto. Sazone las rodajas de pollo con sal y dórelas a fuego alto hasta que estén doradas, luego retírelas de la sartén y reserve. No es necesario cocinar el pollo por completo, solo dejarlo bien dorado.","Agrega la pasta de curry verde tailandés Blue Dragon, sofríe durante 1 minuto, luego agrega la cebolla y reduce el fuego a medio. Sofría durante 2 minutos o hasta que la cebolla se ablande.","Agrega los champiñones y cocina a fuego medio-alto durante 5 minutos. Agrega la leche de coco y deja hervir. Reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento, tapado durante 5 minutos, agregue las tiras de pollo. Cocine por otros 3 minutos, o hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido y la salsa bien caliente, luego agregue los tirabeques y cocine por 1 minuto.","Divida el arroz cocido en dos tazones. Vierta sobre la mezcla de pollo al curry para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14248,5559,'es','Curry dorado de patatas nuevas y guisantes','Adapta nuestro curry de patatas y guisantes a tu gusto, por ejemplo, puedes añadir gambas o trozos de rape durante unos minutos hacia el final de la cocción.','["3 chalotes de plátano, pelados y picados","5 dientes de ajo grandes, picados","4 chiles rojos tailandeses","Un trozo de 5 cm de galanga, pelado y picado, o 1 cucharada de pasta de galanga","Trozo de 5 cm de jengibre, pelado y finamente picado","1 tallo de limoncillo, sin las hojas exteriores y recortado el extremo","2 cucharaditas de curry en polvo mediano","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharadas de semillas de cilantro","900 g de patatas nuevas, cortadas por la mitad (ver consejo a continuación)","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza o vegetal","2 cucharadas de salsa de pescado (opcional)","2 latas de 400 g de leche de coco entera","3 hojas de lima","200 g de guisantes frescos","2-3 limas, exprimidas","arroz jazmín pegajoso, para servir"]','["Vierta las chalotas, el ajo, la mitad de los chiles, la galanga, el jengibre, la hierba de limón y las especias en un procesador de alimentos con 50 ml de agua y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave. Cocine las patatas nuevas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden y luego escúrralas.","Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio, luego vierte la pasta y fríe durante 10 minutos, revolviendo regularmente con una cuchara de madera. Agrega las patatas, la salsa de pescado (si la usas), la leche de coco y las hojas de lima. Corta por la mitad los chiles restantes y agrégalos junto con 100 ml de agua. Lleve la mezcla a fuego lento, cubra con una tapa y cocine durante 15 minutos, o hasta que las patatas estén tiernas pero aún mantengan su forma. Agrega los guisantes y cocina por otros 5 minutos.","Sazone al gusto con sal, pimienta y jugo de limón, luego sirva el curry sobre un plato de arroz glutinoso."]','2026-01-11 13:01:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14249,3904,'es','Muslos de pollo pegajosos con lima y coco','Estos muslos de pollo pegajosos son perfectos para un picnic o una fiesta. Puedes servirlos calientes o dejarlos enfriar antes de guardarlos en un recipiente.','["Lata de 400g de crema de coco","1-2 cucharadas de pasta de curry verde tailandés (dependiendo de lo picante que te guste)","1 lima, rallada y en jugo","3 cucharadas de miel","6 muslos de pollo"]','["Mezcle la crema de coco, la pasta de curry, la ralladura y el jugo de lima y 1 cucharada de miel en un tazón grande, luego vierta una cuarta parte de la marinada en un segundo tazón más pequeño y reserve. Agregue el pollo al tazón grande y déjelo marinar durante al menos 2 horas, o enfríelo hasta por 24 horas.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel de aluminio. Coloque el pollo en la bandeja y hornee por 30 minutos, dándole la vuelta a la mitad.","Mezcle la miel restante en el tazón pequeño de marinada reservado. Unte la mitad de esto sobre el pollo y luego regrese al horno por 10 minutos más. Voltee el pollo y unte con el resto de la marinada, luego hornee por otros 10 minutos. Sirva caliente o déjelo enfriar por completo antes de guardarlo en un recipiente para un picnic."]','2026-01-11 13:01:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14250,5481,'es','Ensalada crujiente de gambas al coco y mango','Agregue un poco de entusiasmo a su día con esta fresca y afrutada ensalada crujiente de mango y langostinos con coco. Lleno de sabor y color, seguro alegrará el almuerzo.','["160 g de langostinos crudos, pelados","200ml de leche de coco","1 lima grande, ½ jugosa, ½ cortada en gajos para servir","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo o miel","2 puñados grandes de berros o espinacas tiernas (o use una mezcla)","½ mango, deshuesado, pelado y cortado en rodajas o en trozos","1 aguacate pequeño, sin hueso, pelado y rebanado","½ cebolla morada pequeña, cortada por la mitad y en rodajas finas","½ manojo pequeño de menta, con las hojas recogidas","1 chile rojo grande, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","aceite vegetal, para freír","2 cucharadas de coco desecado","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz"]','["Pasa un cuchillo afilado por la parte posterior de cada langostino y quita la línea gris que va desde la cabeza hasta la cola. Batir la leche de coco hasta que quede suave, luego verter la mitad en un bol con las gambas. Agrega la mitad del jugo de lima y una pizca de sal, mezcla bien y reserva durante 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcla el resto de la leche de coco con el resto del zumo de lima, el aceite de sésamo, el azúcar o miel y una pizca de sal.","Divida los berros o las espinacas en dos platos, luego cubra con las rodajas de mango, aguacate y cebolla morada, la menta y los chiles en rodajas.","Vierta una capa de aceite de 1 a 2 cm en una cacerola grande a fuego medio. Combina el coco rallado con la harina de maíz y un poco de condimento. Escurrir los langostinos y añadir la mezcla de harina de maíz para cubrirlos, sacudiendo el exceso.","Echa un langostino en el aceite; si chisporrotea, agrega un poco más, pero no llenes demasiado la sartén. Freír durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén crujientes y doradas, luego transferir a un plato forrado con papel de cocina. Cuando todos los langostinos estén fritos, repártelos sobre la ensalada y rocía con el aderezo."]','2026-01-11 13:01:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14251,5365,'es','Muslos de pollo al horno con coco y cúrcuma','Disfrute de estos muslos de pollo al horno con coco y cúrcuma, con verduras tiernas y arroz para una comida familiar nutricionalmente equilibrada y llena de sabor.','["6-8 muslos de pollo, con piel","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de comino","2 dientes de ajo rallados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","200ml de leche de coco","1 cebolla, finamente cortada","250 g de verduras tiernas o espinacas, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de jarabe de arce o miel","400 g de arroz cocido, para servir"]','["Pon los muslos de pollo en un bol y añade la cúrcuma, el comino, el ajo, el jengibre y 3 cucharadas de leche de coco. Frote la marinada y déjela durante al menos 15 minutos, o más si tiene tiempo.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Esparcir la cebolla y las hojas verdes en una bandeja para horno, añadir el resto de la leche de coco, el sirope de arce y 150 ml de agua. Cocine en el horno durante 10 minutos, revolviendo regularmente para que las verduras se ablanden. Coloque los muslos de pollo encima y luego regrese al horno durante 20 minutos, revolviendo las verduras de debajo de vez en cuando.","Calienta la parrilla y cocina durante 8-10 minutos más hasta que la piel esté crujiente. Servir con arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14252,8158,'es','Bandeja horneada aromática de coco, salmón y gambas','Inspírate con los sabores tailandeses con este fragante "fakeaway" de coco, salmón y gambas. Es fácil con un método todo en uno y también funciona con bacalao.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","5 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","2 dientes de ajo rallados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","2 latas de 400 ml de leche de coco","1 chile rojo, cortado a la mitad","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado","3 hojas de lima (opcional)","4 filetes de salmón gruesos, sin piel","4 baby pak choi, cortados en cuartos","150g de tirabeques","150 g de langostinos crudos","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","2-3 limas, cortadas en gajos para servir","arroz jazmín cocido, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calentar el aceite en una sartén honda o wok y sofreír la pasta de curry, el ajo y el jengibre durante 1 min. Agregue la leche de coco y la guindilla y cocine a fuego lento. Agrega la salsa de pescado y las hojas de lima, si las usas.","Vierta la mezcla en una fuente para asar a fuego medio y agregue el salmón, el pak choi y el tirabeque. Tapar y cocinar en el horno durante 15 minutos. Distribuya las gambas y cocine durante 10 minutos más. Adorne con el cilantro y sirva con las rodajas de lima y el arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14253,8160,'es','Pad tailandés de pollo','Disfruta de nuestra versión del clásico plato de fideos con cebolletas, huevo, brotes de soja y maní. Agregue chile a su gusto y sirva con rodajas de lima.','["150 g de fideos de arroz planos secos","4 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","2 pechugas de pollo, cortadas en rodajas finas","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas y los tallos finamente picados","60 g de cebolletas ralladas (reservar algunas para servir)","2 cucharadas de nabo encurtido picado (opcional)","50 ml de caldo de pollo","100 g de brotes de soja","2 huevos","60 g de maní tostado sin sal, picado","salsa de soja, para servir","chile rojo fresco, en rodajas, para servir (opcional)","2 cucharadas de pasta de tamarindo","2 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","1 lima, mitad exprimida y mitad cortada en gajos para servir","½ cucharada de siracha","una pizca de chile en polvo (opcional)"]','["Remoja los fideos en agua tibia durante unos 20 minutos o hasta que estén al dente y luego escúrrelos. Mientras tanto, prepara la salsa mezclando la pasta de tamarindo, la salsa de pescado, el azúcar, la lima y la siracha hasta que quede suave.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén o wok a fuego medio. Agrega el ajo y la guindilla y sofríe durante 30 segundos hasta que estén fragantes. Vierta el pollo y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Añade los tallos de cilantro, las cebolletas y el nabo (si se usan) y sofríe durante 1 min. Añade los fideos remojados, 50 ml de caldo de pollo y la salsa preparada. Sigue salteando los fideos hasta que empiecen a secarse, luego agrega la salsa. Revuelva todo y cocine a fuego alto durante 3 minutos hasta que los fideos estén cocidos. Añade un chorrito más de agua si es necesario.","Cuando la salsa se haya reducido, esparce los brotes de soja e incorpóralos a los fideos. Empuje todo hacia un lado de la sartén, luego vierta el resto del aceite en el lado vacío y rompa los huevos. Freír durante 2 minutos hasta que la clara esté cuajada y comience a crujir en los bordes, luego mezcle las yemas líquidas con las claras. Cuando los huevos estén recién cuajados, combínelos con los fideos.","Esparza más de la mitad de los cacahuetes y mezcle rápidamente. Divida en dos platos con el resto de los cacahuetes y la cebolleta, las rodajas de lima y la salsa de soja a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14254,6281,'es','Fideos tailandeses de tofu verde','Prepare un plato de fideos verdes tailandeses con tofu en solo 30 minutos. Es bajo en calorías y contiene un equilibrio de nutrientes para saciarte y hacerte bien.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","Paquete de 280 g de tofu firme, cortado en cubos","Bolsa de 300 g de verduras salteadas","150 g de maíz tierno, cortado por la mitad a lo largo","150g de tirabeques","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry verde tailandés","1-2 chiles verdes, en rodajas finas","250 ml de leche de coco ligera","250 g de fideos al huevo frescos","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente o en un wok. Agrega el tofu y fríelo, volteándolo periódicamente, a fuego alto durante 6-7 minutos o hasta que esté dorado. Retirar con una espumadera y reservar.","Vierta las verduras salteadas, el maíz y los tirabeques en la sartén y cocine durante 5 minutos. Agregue la pasta de curry, el chile, la leche de coco y los fideos, luego cocine a fuego lento y cocine durante 5 minutos. Regresa el tofu a la sartén. Divida en tazones y cubra con la cebolleta. Sirva con las rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14255,8162,'es','Curry rojo tailandés con pepino encurtido rápido','Incluye tres de tus 5 al día con este curry rojo tailandés vegano. Es un plato fragante y abundante que contiene calabaza, un toque de chile y coco cremoso.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","1 chalota, finamente picada","4 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés vegano","400 ml de bebida de coco Alpro, sin azúcar","400ml de caldo de verduras vegano","300 g de calabaza, cortada en cubos de 2 cm","150 g de patatas baby cortadas por la mitad","150 g de judías verdes, peladas","60 g de hojas tiernas de espinacas","100 g de frijoles edamame sin cáscara","1 cucharada de salsa de soja o tamari baja en sodio","2 limas, exprimidas","hojas de cilantro o albahaca tailandesa, para servir (opcional)","arroz integral cocido, para servir","1 pepino grande","4 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","pizca de hojuelas de chile"]','["Para hacer el pepino encurtido, parte el pepino por la mitad, retira el corazón con una cucharadita y deséchalo. Corta las mitades de pepino en semicírculos finos y luego mézclalas en un bol con el vinagre, la guindilla y una pizca de sal. Déjalo encurtir mientras haces el curry.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén honda a fuego medio. Agrega la chalota y fríela durante 5 minutos hasta que esté suave, luego agrega la pasta de curry y cocina durante 2 o 3 minutos hasta que esté fragante. Vierta la leche de coco y el caldo y deje hervir a fuego lento.","Añade la calabaza y las patatas y cocina sin tapar durante 20 minutos hasta que las patatas estén tiernas y la salsa se haya reducido y espesado un poco.","Agregue las judías verdes, las espinacas y el edamame y cocine durante 4 minutos más hasta que estén tiernos. Sazone con soja y jugo de lima y espolvoree sobre cilantro o albahaca tailandesa, si lo usa. Sirva en tazones sobre el arroz con el pepino encurtido al lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14256,8164,'es','Pad tailandés del siguiente nivel','Lleva el clásico pad thai a nuevos niveles añadiendo langostinos y tofu, nabos encurtidos y pasta de tamarindo: un plato para dos lleno de sabor.','["200 g de fideos de arroz planos secos","2 cucharadas de pasta de tamarindo","3 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","1 lima, mitad exprimida y mitad cortada en gajos para servir","una pizca de chile en polvo (opcional)","4 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","100 g de tofu firme, cortado en cubitos","200 g de langostinos crudos, en mariposa","100 g de brotes de soja","2 huevos","100 g de maní tostado y salado, picado","2 cebolletas, ralladas","2 cucharadas de nabo encurtido picado (rábano en conserva)","salsa de soja, para servir"]','["Remoje los fideos en agua tibia durante unos 20 minutos hasta que se ablanden pero con mucho sabor, luego escúrralos. Mientras tanto, mezcle la pasta de tamarindo, la salsa de pescado, el azúcar y el jugo de limón hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Sazona con una pizca de chile en polvo si te gusta picante. Se puede preparar con hasta dos semanas de anticipación y conservar en el refrigerador. Si preparas pad thai con regularidad, duplica la cantidad y quédate con la mitad.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén y cocina el tofu por cada lado hasta que esté dorado. Añade las gambas y fríelas hasta que empiecen a ponerse rosadas. Vierta los fideos en la sartén y rocíe sobre la mezcla de tamarindo con aproximadamente 5 cucharadas de agua. Revuelva todo y cocine a fuego alto durante 3 minutos hasta que los fideos estén cocidos. Añade un chorrito más de agua si es necesario.","Cuando la salsa se haya reducido, esparce los brotes de soja e incorpóralos a los fideos. Empuje todo hacia un lado de la sartén, luego vierta el resto del aceite en el lado vacío y rompa los huevos. Freír durante 2 minutos hasta que la clara esté cuajada y comience a crujir en los bordes, luego mezcle las yemas líquidas con las claras. Cuando los huevos estén recién cuajados, combínelos con los fideos.","Esparza la mitad de los cacahuetes, la mitad de la cebolleta y todo el nabo, y mezcle rápidamente. Divida en dos platos con el resto del maní, la cebolleta, el chile en polvo, las rodajas de lima y la salsa de soja a un lado, para decorar como prefiera."]','2026-01-11 13:01:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14257,8166,'es','Hamburguesas tailandesas delgadas con chips de batata y salsa de piña','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una saludable hamburguesa de ternera de inspiración asiática con batatas fritas y un condimento afrutado: una versión vibrante de un clásico.','["4 batatas, sin pelar y cortadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","400-500 g de carne de cerdo o de ternera extra magra picada","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","6 cebolletas, picadas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","200 g de piña en trozos, cortada en cubitos","jugo ½ lima","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce, más un poco más para mojar las papas fritas","1 lechuga pequeña joya","4 panecillos tostados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle los chips de camote con el aceite y un poco de condimento en una bandeja para hornear. Ase durante 40-45 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente.","Mezclar la carne picada con la pasta de curry, la mitad de las cebolletas, la mitad del cilantro y un poco de condimento. Forme 4 hamburguesas.","Mezcle las cebolletas y el cilantro restantes con la piña, el jugo de lima, el chile rojo y la salsa de chile dulce.","Cuando a las patatas fritas les falten 10 minutos, calienta una sartén o plancha antiadherente y cocina las hamburguesas durante 3-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas y bien cocidas. Sirva las hamburguesas en panecillos con hojas de lechuga y salsa encima, los chips de camote y salsa de chile extra para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:01:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14258,8168,'es','Curry tailandés de cerdo y maní','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Use pasta de curry rojo picante y fragante como base para este plato de curry de coco con maíz dulce, cilantro y soja.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","manojo de cebolletas, en rodajas","manojo pequeño de cilantro, tallos finamente picados y hojas recogidas","400 g de lomo de cerdo en rodajas","4 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","4 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco light","Paquete de 175 g de maíz tierno","jugo 1 lima","arroz jazmín al vapor, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande o cazuela resistente al fuego. Agregue las cebolletas y los tallos de cilantro y cocine por 1 min. Agrega las rodajas de cerdo y cocina por 5 minutos hasta que empiece a dorarse.","Agrega la pasta de curry y la mantequilla de maní. Después de 30 segundos, agrega el azúcar, la soja y la leche de coco, más ½ lata de agua. Mezclar bien, tapar y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Retire la tapa, agregue el maíz tierno y aumente el fuego. Burbujee durante 3 minutos hasta que el maíz esté cocido y la salsa se haya espesado un poco. Agrega el jugo de lima y revisa la sazón. Ahora se puede congelar hasta por 2 meses. Para cocinar congelado: descongele completamente, luego caliente en una sartén sobre la placa hasta que el curry esté completamente caliente. Servir espolvoreado con las hojas de cilantro y el arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14259,8170,'es','Fideos al curry de Chiang Mai (khao soi gai)','Este curry cremoso y picante del norte de Tailandia, con leche de coco y jugosos muslos de pollo, está cubierto con chalotas encurtidas y fideos crujientes.','["400 ml de aceite vegetal, más 1 cucharada","4 cucharadas de pasta de curry tailandés rojo o amarillo","2 cucharaditas de curry suave en polvo","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile rojo","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco.","150 ml de crema de coco","200 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo","2 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","jugo 2 limones","500 g de muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","300 g de fideos chinos al huevo secos (medio o finos)","1 chile rojo largo (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante), en rodajas","3 chalotes pequeños, cortados en cuartos","150 ml de vinagre de vino de arroz","cilantro en paquetes pequeños, picado en trozos grandes","100 g de brotes de soja, recortados","3 cebolletas picadas","aceite de chile"]','["Primero, prepare el chile y las chalotas en escabeche: coloque el chile y las chalotas en un tazón pequeño y vierta el vinagre. Agrega un poco de sal y déjalo reposar mientras preparas el curry.","En una cacerola grande, calienta 1 cucharada de aceite vegetal. Agrega la pasta de curry y baja el fuego a medio. Cocine durante 5 minutos, luego agregue el curry en polvo y las hojuelas de chile. Cocine por 1 minuto más, luego agregue la leche de coco, la crema de coco, el caldo, la salsa de pescado y el jugo de lima. Llevar a fuego lento.","Pica el pollo en trozos y agrégalo al curry. Cocine por 15 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos.","Hervir un poco de agua en una cacerola grande para los fideos. Mientras tanto, caliente el aceite vegetal en un wok pequeño; estará listo cuando un pequeño trozo de pan chisporrotee al dejarlo caer. Agregue 75 g de fideos al wok en 4 tandas hasta que burbujeen y queden crujientes. Utilice un cucharón de rejilla o una espumadera para retirarlos y escurrirlos sobre papel de cocina.","Hierva los fideos restantes durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén al dente, luego escúrralos. Divide los fideos en 4 tazones. Vierta el curry sobre cada uno y cubra con cilantro, brotes de soja, un poco de chile y chalotes encurtidos escurridos, cebolletas y un chorrito de aceite de chile. Cubra con los fideos crujientes y devore mientras esté caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14260,8172,'es','Rollitos de primavera de guisantes, queso feta y quinoa con tomate asado nam prik','Sirva estos canapés vegetarianos de masa filo con nam prik, una pasta de chile tailandesa que hemos mezclado con tomates asados ​​al horno para hacer una salsa.','["50g de quinua","200 g de petit pois congelados","85 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","manojo pequeño de hojas de menta, picadas","3 cebolletas, finamente picadas","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","6 láminas de masa filo (paquete de 270g)","1 huevo batido","aceite de girasol, para freír","6 tomates grandes, cortados por la mitad","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 diente de ajo, picado","½ chile rojo, picado","2 cucharaditas de jengibre rallado","½ manojo de cilantro, incluidos los tallos, picado en trozos grandes","¼ de manojo de hojas de menta, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de jugo de lima","1 cucharada de pasta de tamarindo","1 cucharadita de azúcar de palma"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nPara hacer el nam prik, coloque el\r\ntomates, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, sobre una bandeja para hornear\r\nhoja. Rocíe con 1 cucharada de aceituna\r\naceite, sazonar y luego asar durante 1½-2 horas\r\nhasta que esté semiseco. Retirar del horno,\r\ndejar enfriar, luego verter en un procesador de alimentos\r\ncon los ingredientes restantes y\r\nmezcle hasta obtener un puré mediano.","Cocine la quinua en una cacerola a fuego lento.\r\nagua con sal siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.\r\nVierta en un tazón y deje enfriar.\r\nCocine los guisantes durante 1 min en agua hirviendo,\r\nluego escurrir y dejar correr bajo agua fría durante\r\nunos minutos. Escurrir bien, verter en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos y pulsar hasta obtener un trozo\r\npuré. Agrega esto a la quinua enfriada.\r\njunto con el queso feta, la menta y las cebolletas.\r\ny ralladura y jugo de limón. Mezclar bien para\r\ncombine y sazone al gusto, agregando\r\nmás jugo de limón si es necesario.","Coloque una hoja de filo\r\nfrente a ti, manteniendo el resto\r\ncubierto con un paño de cocina húmedo. cortar\r\nel filo por la mitad a lo ancho para hacer\r\n2 cuadrados. Con una esquina apuntando\r\nhacia ti (por lo que estás mirando un\r\nforma de diamante en lugar de un cuadrado),\r\nvierta 2 cucharadas del relleno justo debajo del\r\nlínea central y darle forma de tronco. cepillo\r\nlos bordes de la masa con huevo, luego doblar\r\nlas 2 esquinas laterales. Manteniendo tus dedos\r\nen las esquinas, trae la esquina inferior\r\narriba sobre el relleno hacia el centro,\r\nluego enrolle firmemente hacia la esquina superior.\r\nEs importante enrollar lo más apretado posible,\r\npara que los rollitos de primavera se cocinen uniformemente. repetir\r\ncon las hojas de filo restantes y el relleno.","Calentar unos 3 cm de aceite de girasol en una olla grande.\r\nsartén o wok y sofreír los rollitos de primavera, en\r\nlotes, durante 2-3 minutos o hasta que estén dorados\r\nmarrón. Retirar con una espumadera\r\ny escurrir sobre papel de cocina. Transferir\r\nlos rollitos de primavera a un plato y servir\r\ncon el nam prik."]','2026-01-11 13:01:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14261,8174,'es','Ensalada tailandesa de pollo picado','Conocido como larb gai en Tailandia, el picante de esta receta de ensalada de pollo combina muy bien con las verduras crujientes, creando un equilibrio perfecto entre sabor y picante.','["2 limoncillo","4 hojas de lima, sin tallos","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas","3 dientes de ajo","trozo del largo de la yema del dedo raíz de jengibre fresco","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo","50 ml de salsa de pescado","1 cebolla morada, picada","3 cucharadas de jugo de lima","un puñado de hojas de menta, albahaca y cilantro, picadas en trozos grandes","3 lechugas Baby Gem, con las hojas separadas","1 pepino, sin semillas y cortado en tiras a lo largo","200 g de brotes de soja","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Picar en trozos grandes la hierba de limón, las hojas de lima,\r\nchiles rojos, ajo y jengibre, luego tira\r\nPonlos todos en un procesador y bate hasta que\r\ntodo está muy finamente picado.\r\nPica las pechugas de pollo en trozos pequeños.","Calentar un wok a fuego alto y agregar el\r\naceite vegetal y el aceite de sésamo. tirar en\r\nla mezcla de limoncillo y sofreír brevemente antes\r\nagregando el pollo picado y la guindilla\r\npolvo. Luego sofreír el pollo durante 4 minutos.\r\nagregue la salsa de pescado. Baja el calor\r\nun poco y dejar que la salsa de pollo y pescado\r\nburbujear juntos durante otros 4 minutos,\r\nrevolviendo, luego agregue la cebolla morada picada\r\ny cocine por otro min.","Retirar del fuego, verter sobre la lima.\r\njugo y agregue las hierbas. Servir con el\r\nensalada de verduras y una rodaja de lima a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14262,8177,'es','Ensalada tailandesa de fideos de arroz','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta ensalada está llena de sabor y también es saludable, ya que se sirve con un aderezo sin aceite.','["½ paquete de 250 g de fideos finos de arroz","Bolsa de 200 g de brotes de soja","ralladura y jugo de 2 limas","2-3 cucharadas de pescado o salsa de soja, al gusto","1 cucharadita de azúcar mascabado o azúcar moreno blando","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 corazones de lechuga Little Gem, con las hojas separadas y rasgadas toscamente","500 g de carne de cerdo picada","jengibre rallado en trozos pequeños","pizca de pimienta de cayena","1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharadita de aceite","4 filetes de solomillo de 175 g","1 chile rojo sin semillas y rallado"]','["Coloque los fideos y los brotes de soja en una\r\nrecipiente resistente al calor y cúbralo con agua hirviendo.\r\nDejar actuar 4 minutos o hasta que los fideos estén\r\ntierno. Escurrir y luego enfriar bajo funcionamiento en frío.\r\nagua y escurrir nuevamente. Regrese al bol.","Mezcle la ralladura de lima y el jugo, el pescado\r\no salsa de soja y azúcar. Agregue los fideos\r\ncon la cebolla morada y la lechuga.","Para hacer con carne picada calentar un poco\r\nAceite en una sartén antiadherente y sofreír 500g.\r\ncarne de cerdo picada, una nuez pequeña de jengibre rallado\r\ny una pizca de pimienta de cayena o chile en polvo\r\ndurante 10 minutos, hasta que la carne picada esté dorada y\r\nbien cocido. Mezclar con los fideos, dividir.\r\nentre cuatro tazones y sirva caliente.","Para preparar el bistec, prepare la ensalada de fideos de arroz. Calentar 1 cucharadita\r\naceite de girasol en una sartén. Consejo 2 cucharadas de sésamo\r\nsemillas en un plato. Frote 1 cucharadita de aceite en 4 x 175 g\r\nfiletes de solomillo y presiónelos sobre las semillas de sésamo. freír\r\ndurante 5 minutos a fuego medio, volteando hasta la mitad.\r\nDéjelo reposar durante 5 minutos y luego córtelo en rodajas finas. Lanzamiento 1\r\nguindilla roja sin semillas y rallada, y un puñado\r\nhojas de menta en fideos. Cubra con el bistec para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14263,8179,'es','Pad tailandés fácil','Casi un plato nacional de Tailandia, la versión simplificada de Mary Cadogan hace que sea fácil de comprar y con un sabor muy auténtico.','["125 g (medio paquete de 250 g) de fideos de arroz","3 cucharadas de jugo de lima aproximadamente 2 limas","½ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","2 cucharaditas de azúcar mascabado ligero","2 cucharadas de salsa de pescado (nam pla)","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","200 g de langostinos tigre cocidos y pelados, sin cola","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","140 g de brotes de soja","25 g de maní salado, finamente picado","un pequeño puñado de hojas de cilantro","1 o 2 limas, cortadas en gajos","salsa de chile dulce"]','["Coloque los fideos en un recipiente grande resistente al calor, vierta agua hirviendo sobre ellos y déjelos durante 4 minutos, luego escúrralos y refrésquelos con agua corriente fría.","Ponga el jugo de lima, la cayena, el azúcar y la salsa de pescado en un bol y mezcle bien. Tenga todos los demás ingredientes listos junto a la olla.","Calentar el aceite y sofreír las gambas hasta que estén bien calientes. Agregue las cebolletas y los fideos y revuelva. Vierta la mezcla de jugo de limón, luego agregue los brotes de soja, la mitad del maní y el cilantro. Cocine durante 1 minuto hasta que todo esté bien caliente.","Apilar en un plato grande, espolvorear con el resto del maní y el cilantro y servir con rodajas de lima y salsa de chile dulce."]','2026-01-11 13:01:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14264,8181,'es','Ensalada tailandesa de pollo desmenuzado y judías verdes','Esta ensalada baja en grasa pero satisfactoria está llena de auténtico sabor asiático y agregará mucho entusiasmo a una cena al aire libre.','["200 g de judías verdes (o cualquier otra judía verde), sin cabeza ni cola","1 chile rojo, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas; use un chile ojo de pájaro para darle más picante","2 chalotes, finamente picados","1 limoncillo, finamente cortado","2 cm de jengibre rallado","2 pechugas de pollo cocidas y sin piel","manojo pequeño de hojas de menta","manojo grande de albahaca tailandesa o cilantro","1 lima cortada en gajos o carrilleras, para servir","arroz jazmín al vapor, para servir","100 ml de crema de coco","1 diente de ajo, machacado","3 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","1 cucharadita de azúcar","jugo 1 lima","1 chile ojo de pájaro, finamente picado"]','["Pasa un pelador de patatas por cada lado de\r\nlos frijoles para quitar los trozos fibrosos. cortar\r\nen tiras con un cortador de judías, o en la\r\ndiagonal en trozos de 2 cm. cocinar los frijoles\r\nen agua hirviendo con sal durante 4 minutos o\r\nhasta que estén tiernos pero aún de color verde brillante. Drenar\r\ny poner en un bol con la guindilla, las chalotas,\r\nlimoncillo y jengibre. tirar el pollo\r\npechugas en pedazos usando los dedos\r\ny añadir al bol.","Haz el aderezo. mezclar el coco\r\ncon ajo, salsa de pescado, azúcar, lima\r\ny chile. Rasga la menta y la albahaca tailandesa.\r\nsobre el pollo y echar todo\r\njuntos. Apilar en un plato y verter\r\nel aderezo. Servir con la lima para\r\nexprimir y arroz jazmín."]','2026-01-11 13:01:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14265,8184,'es','Pad thai con gambas','Este salteado de fideos udon tiene salsa de maní y tamarindo; está en la mesa en solo 20 minutos','["250 g de fideos udon","2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","100 g de gambas crudas peladas","4 cebolletas, picadas","2 huevos batidos","2 cucharadas de maní tostado, picado","un puñado pequeño de hojas de cilantro","gajos de lima, para servir","2 cucharadas de pasta de tamarindo","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado","jugo 1 lima","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave"]','["Hervir los fideos en agua con sal durante\r\n3 minutos hasta que esté suave. Escurrir y enjuagar en frío.\r\nagua. Para hacer la salsa, mezclar todo el\r\ningredientes juntos en un tazón pequeño.","Calentar un wok con la mitad del aceite. Añade el\r\ngambas y cebolletas y cocinar,\r\nrevolviendo rápidamente, durante 1 min o hasta que\r\nlas gambas se vuelven rosadas. Empuje hacia un lado y\r\nagregue el aceite restante. Agrega el huevo y\r\ndéjelo reposar durante 30 segundos, luego revuelva hasta\r\ncocido. Agrega los fideos y la salsa y\r\ncocine, revolviendo continuamente, durante 3 minutos.\r\no hasta que todo esté caliente.","Sirve los fideos con el maní.\r\ny cilantro espolvoreado por encima, y\r\ngajos de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14266,8186,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: pollo al curry verde tailandés','Este curry normalmente súper rico se puede convertir en uno más saludable pero aún cremoso.','["20 g de manojo de cilantro, tallos y hojas separados","2 chalotes, finamente picados","1 limoncillo, finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","Un trozo de 1 cm de raíz de jengibre fresco, finamente picado","3 chiles verdes pequeños y picantes, finamente picados (incluye las semillas)","1 chile verde más grande, de suave a mediano, finamente picado (incluya las semillas)","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca","½ cucharadita de comino molido y cilantro","¼ cucharadita de pimienta negra","1 cucharadita de hojas de lima kaffir liofilizadas desmenuzadas","1 cucharada de jugo de lima","1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","Lata de 400 ml/14 fl oz de leche de coco baja en grasa","3 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel (450 g/1 libra de peso total), cortadas en trozos pequeños","2 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado","½ cucharadita de palma granulada o azúcar moscabado light","4 hojas de lima liofilizadas","100 g de sarna cortada en rodajas finas a lo largo","100 g de judías verdes, partidas por la mitad a lo largo","2 cebolletas, finamente ralladas","250 g de arroz aromático tailandés, cocido","gajos de lima"]','["Para la pasta de curry, pique finamente el\r\ntallos de cilantro y ponerlos en un mini\r\nlicuadora de alimentos o procesador de alimentos pequeño\r\ncon las chalotas, la hierba de limón, el ajo y\r\njengibre. Pulsa hasta que esté lo más suave que puedas.\r\nConsíguelo. Agrega los chiles, la albahaca, tres cuartos.\r\nde las hojas de cilantro, el\r\ncomino molido, cilantro, pimienta, lima\r\nhojas y jugo de lima, luego presione nuevamente.\r\nIncorpora el aceite y reserva. tu solo lo harás\r\nEstaré usando la mitad de esta pasta, el resto puede\r\nenfriar durante un par de días o congelar\r\nhasta por un mes.","Para el curry, calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente.\r\nwok o sartén profunda, agregue la mitad de la\r\npasta de curry, luego sofríe durante 1 min. Agitar\r\nla leche de coco en su lata, ábrela y luego\r\nvierta dos tercios en la sartén. Déjalo burbujear\r\ndeje reposar durante 4-5 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando,\r\nhasta que reduzca y espese un poco.","Vierta el pollo y luego saltee durante\r\n1-2 minutos hasta que ya no esté rosado. Agregue el\r\nsalsa de pescado y azúcar, luego vierta la\r\nresto de la leche de coco para adelgazar,\r\nsalsa cremosa. Bajar el fuego, agregar el\r\nhojas de lima, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos para\r\nTermine de cocinar suavemente el pollo. puede ser\r\ncongelado en este punto por hasta 1 mes.","Mientras el pollo hierve a fuego lento, cocine al vapor el\r\ntirabeques y frijoles por un par de\r\nminutos. Sirve el curry en tazones con un poco\r\nde las verduras apiladas encima (sirve el resto\r\npor separado) junto con las cebolletas\r\ny el resto de las hojas de cilantro.\r\nSirva con un plato de arroz aromático tailandés.\r\ny rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14267,8188,'es','Bandeja de pollo tailandesa desmenuzada con coco','Pollo empanizado con calabaza, tomates y berenjena, aromatizado con pasta de curry rojo tailandés picante','["1 calabaza, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en cubitos","1 berenjena grande, en cubos","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","3 cucharadas de coco rallado","4 cucharadas de pan rallado fresco","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","1 huevo batido","300 g de tomates cherry","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, picadas en trozos grandes","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEn una fuente para asar grande y poco profunda, mezcle la\r\ncalabaza y berenjena en el aceite, luego\r\nSazone y extienda en una sola capa.\r\nAse durante 30 minutos, volteando una vez.","En un plato mezclar el coco y\r\npan rallado con un poco de condimento.\r\nPasar las pechugas de pollo por el huevo y luego\r\npresione las migas para cubrir, agitando\r\ncualquier exceso.","Agregue los tomates y la pasta de curry.\r\ncon las verduras asadas y darle todo\r\nun buen revuelo. Coloca las pechugas de pollo\r\nen las verduras y volver a meter en el horno para\r\nOtros 25-30 minutos hasta que el pollo\r\nesté bien cocido, agitando la sartén una vez\r\no dos veces. Espolvorear por encima el cilantro y\r\nsirva con rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14268,4979,'es','Salteado tailandés de gambas, jengibre y cebolleta','Este salteado tiene un toque picante bienvenido. Una vez que hayas hecho la pasta, solo tardarás 10 minutos en cocinarse.','["200 g de gambas tigre crudas y peladas de origen sostenible","1 chile tailandés verde, picado","3 dientes de ajo, 1 machacado y 2 finamente picados","1 manojo de cilantro, hojas y tallos separados","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","jugo 1 lima","3 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","2 cucharadas de aceite de maní","Un trozo de 3 cm de jengibre, cortado en rodajas finas y luego rallado","8 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","1 pimiento rojo, en rodajas finas","85 g de castañas de agua cortadas en rodajas","100 g de brotes de soja","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","fideos de huevo o arroz, para servir","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Pon las gambas en un bol. Pon el chile,\r\najo machacado, tallos de cilantro (cortar\r\nestos arriba usando tijeras primero) y rueda\r\nazúcar en un molinillo de especias o comida pequeña\r\nprocesador y mezclar juntos. Añadir la mitad\r\ndel jugo de lima y la salsa de pescado, luego\r\nvierte esto sobre las gambas.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en un wok, agrega el jengibre.\r\ny las cebolletas y sofreír durante 1 min. Añadir\r\nel pimiento rojo y sofreír durante 1 min, hasta que\r\nla pimienta comienza a ablandarse. agrega el agua\r\ncastañas y brotes de soja, y revuelva\r\njuntos hasta que los brotes de frijol comiencen a\r\nmarchitarse. Agrega la salsa de soja y una muy buena\r\nmoler pimienta negra, luego verter todo en\r\nun plato para servir.","Calentar el aceite restante en el wok y\r\nañadir las gambas, sacándolas de su\r\njugos. Revuelva durante 1-2 minutos hasta que giren.\r\nrosa, agrega la marinada y revuelve el wok.\r\nrápidamente, luego vierta todo sobre las verduras. recortar\r\nsobre las hojas de cilantro y espolvorear\r\nla lima restante. Sirve sobre fideos\r\ncon lima extra para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14269,8190,'es','Fideos tailandeses de salmón','Este plato rápido, fragante y abundante es justo lo que necesitas después de un duro día de trabajo.','["200 g de fideos de huevo o arroz","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","2-3 cucharaditas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","2 cebolletas, picadas","1 camote, en cubos","200 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo","100ml de leche desnatada","2 filetes de salmón sin piel, cortados por la mitad y luego en tiras finas","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Cocine los fideos siguiendo el paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, enjuagar y escurrir. Calentar el aceite\r\nen una cacerola honda y sofreír el curry\r\npegar durante 1 min hasta que esté fragante. Añade el\r\ncebolletas, reservando 1 cucharada, la\r\nboniato, caldo y leche, traer\r\nrápidamente hasta que hierva y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos\r\nhasta que la patata esté tierna. Agrega el salmón\r\ntrozos y cocine por 2 minutos, luego agregue\r\nla mitad del cilantro.","Divida los fideos en 4 tazones.\r\ny vierta sobre el salmón y la salsa.\r\nEspolvorea sobre el cilantro restante.\r\ny cebolletas."]','2026-01-11 13:01:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14270,6736,'es','Paquetes de pollo y boniato al estilo tailandés','Un plato de pollo individual envuelto en pergamino aromatizado con especias asiáticas y coco cremoso','["25 g de crema de coco (de un bloque)","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moreno suave","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","2 cucharaditas de pasta de curry verde tailandés","½ camote, pelado y cortado en cubos pequeños","1 pimiento rojo pequeño, sin semillas y cortado en cubos pequeños","1 pechuga de pollo sin piel","un puñado de hojas de cilantro y unas rodajas de lima, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nDisolver la crema de coco.\r\ncon 3 cucharadas de agua hirviendo y mezclar\r\nhasta obtener una pasta suave. Agregue el\r\nazúcar, salsa de pescado y pasta de curry.","Coloque un trozo grande de horneado.\r\npergamino en una bandeja para hornear.\r\nDisponer el boniato y\r\npimienta en medio del papel,\r\ndespejando un espacio en el centro. Coloca la pechuga de pollo en el espacio.\r\ny verter sobre la salsa. Doblar\r\nlos bordes superiores del pergamino para\r\nformar un sello y arrugar el\r\ntermina como un envoltorio de dulce.","Cocine en el horno durante 25-30 minutos.\r\no hasta que el pollo esté cocido\r\na través y las verduras están\r\ntierno. Sienta el paquete en una cena.\r\nplato o tazón poco profundo y con cuidado\r\nabierto. Espolvorear con cilantro\r\ny exprimir un poco de lima\r\njugo, al gusto."]','2026-01-11 13:01:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14271,6638,'es','Salteado de ternera tailandés','Una lista de compras sencilla y súper rápida de preparar, la comida perfecta para después del trabajo','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","400 g de tiras de ternera o filete cortado en tiras finas","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de salsa de ostras","un puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Calienta un wok o una sartén grande hasta que humee. \r\ncaliente. Vierta el aceite y revuelva alrededor de la sartén. \r\nluego agregue las tiras de carne y el chile. cocinar, \r\nrevolviendo todo el tiempo, hasta que la carne esté ligeramente \r\ndorado, aproximadamente 3 minutos, luego vierta sobre \r\nla salsa de ostras. Cocine hasta que esté completamente caliente \r\ny la salsa cubre la carne. revuelva en el \r\nhojas de albahaca y sírvalas con arroz simple."]','2026-01-11 13:01:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14272,8192,'es','Caldo de pescado al estilo tailandés con verduras','Una sopa de fideos estilo ramen con abadejo sostenible, gambas y verduras saludables: un plato bajo en grasas y calorías','["100 g de fideos de arroz integral","500 ml de caldo de pollo o pescado","1 cucharada de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","4 hojas de lima kaffir secas o frescas","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado","200 g de pescado blanco sostenible sin piel, como el abadejo","100 g de langostinos crudos","2 pak choi, hojas separadas","un puñado de hojas de cilantro"]','["Cocine los fideos del siguiente paquete.\r\ninstrucciones. Refrescar en agua fría\r\ny escurrir bien.","Poner el caldo en una cacerola grande y\r\nagregue la pasta de curry, las hojas de lima y el pescado.\r\nsalsa y 250ml de agua fría. traer a\r\ncocine a fuego lento y cocine durante 5 minutos.","Cortar el pescado en cubos de aproximadamente 3 cm.\r\ny agregar a la sartén. Volver a hervir a fuego lento,\r\nluego cocine por 2 minutos sin tapar.","Agregue los fideos, las gambas y el pak.\r\nchoi y cocine a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos o hasta que\r\nel pescado y las gambas están recién cocidos.\r\nSirva en tazones espolvoreados con cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:01:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14273,8194,'es','Caldo tailandés de coco y verduras','Pruebe el sabor tailandés con esta sopa de fideos rápida y fácil cocinada todo en una sola sartén.','["1½ cucharada de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","1 litro de caldo de verduras","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco desnatada","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moreno","175 g de fideos al huevo medianos","2 zanahorias, cortadas en palitos","½ cabeza de hoja china, cortada en rodajas","½ bolsa de 300 g de brotes de soja","6 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","jugo 1 lima","3 cebolletas, partidas por la mitad y luego cortadas finamente a lo largo","un puñado de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Coloque la pasta de curry en una fuente grande.\r\ncacerola o wok con el aceite. freír\r\ndurante 1 min hasta que esté fragante. Consejo en el\r\ncaldo de verduras, leche de coco y\r\nazúcar moreno. Cocine a fuego lento durante 3 minutos.","Añade los fideos, las zanahorias y\r\nhoja china y cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n4-6 minutos, hasta que todos estén tiernos. Mezclar\r\nen brotes de soja y tomates. Añadir\r\njugo de lima al gusto y un poco más\r\ncondimento, si lo deseas. Vierta en\r\ntazones y espolvorear con primavera\r\ncebollas y cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:01:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14274,6565,'es','Curry tailandés fácil de gambas','Comida perfecta para el viernes por la noche, un calentito curry de gambas bajo en grasa listo en solo 20 minutos','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, picada","1 cucharadita de raíz de jengibre fresco","1-2 cucharaditas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés (usamos Sharwood''s)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","50 g de crema de coco sobre","400 g de gambas crudas congeladas","cilantro, picado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana. consejo  \r\nen la cebolla y el jengibre, luego cocine por unos \r\nminutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue la pasta de curry, \r\nluego cocine por 1 min más. Vierta sobre el \r\ntomates picados y crema de coco.  \r\nLlevar a ebullición y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante  \r\n5 min, añadiendo un poco de agua hirviendo si \r\nla mezcla se vuelve demasiado espesa.","Vierta las gambas y cocine durante 5-10 minutos. \r\nmás, dependiendo de su tamaño. \r\nSirva junto con un poco de arroz simple y espolvoree. \r\ncon un poco de cilantro picado, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:01:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14275,6046,'es','sopa de calabaza tailandesa','Aumente su consumo de verduras con esta fragante sopa de calabaza condimentada con sabores asiáticos','["1 cebolla, picada","1 tallo de limoncillo, machacado y rallado","1-2 chiles rojos, picados en trozos grandes","1 kg de calabaza, pelada y cortada en cubitos","jugo 1 lima","125 ml de leche de coco","cilantro en manojo pequeño, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Freír la cebolla, el limoncillo y la mayor parte\r\nla guindilla en una sartén grande con un chorrito de\r\nagua durante 2-3 minutos hasta que se ablande – agregue\r\nmás agua si empieza a engancharse. Consejo en el\r\naplastar y revolver. Cubrir con 1 litro de agua,\r\nllevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos\r\nhasta que la calabaza esté tierna. Agregue jugo de lima,\r\nRetirar del fuego y triturar con un\r\nbatidora de mano hasta que quede suave.","Vierta la leche de coco, sazone y luego\r\nRegrese al fuego para calentar suavemente.\r\nSirva en tazones y sirva con cilantro.\r\ny el chile restante."]','2026-01-11 13:01:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14276,6839,'es','Empanadas tailandesas de pavo con especias y ensalada de fideos','Date un capricho con este plato tailandés saludable y bajo en grasas después de un duro día de trabajo, es rápido y fácil de preparar.','["400 g de pechuga o filete de pavo, picado en trozos grandes","1 tallo de limoncillo, finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja baja en sodio","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","2 nidos de fideos de trigo medianos","Paquete de 300g de pimientos variados y verduras salteadas","salsa de chile dulce, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta la parrilla a temperatura media. Pon el\r\npavo en un procesador de alimentos y pulso\r\nhasta que esté picado. Agrega la hierba de limón,\r\nralladura de ajo y lima y la mitad de la soja\r\nsalsa, cilantro y chile, luego pulse\r\nnuevamente hasta que se combinen. Vierta la mezcla en\r\nen un bol y añadir un poco de pimienta negra.\r\nForme 8 hamburguesas y luego transfiéralas a\r\nuna bandeja para hornear antiadherente y cocine a la parrilla durante 3-4\r\nminutos por cada lado, hasta que esté bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, remoje los fideos siguiendo\r\ninstrucciones del paquete, luego escurrir y agregar\r\nlas verduras, el resto de la salsa de soja\r\ny el jugo de lima. Mezclar bien, dividir\r\nentre platos y espolvorear con el\r\nel resto del cilantro y el chile. Servir con\r\nlas hamburguesas de pavo y un poco de chile dulce\r\nsalsa para mojar, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14277,8196,'es','Pollo al curry verde tailandés','Hacer tu propia pasta de curry aromática requiere algunos ingredientes asiáticos especiales y un poco de tiempo, pero notarás la diferencia.','["225 g de patatas nuevas, cortadas en trozos","100 g de judías verdes, peladas y partidas por la mitad","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal o de girasol","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 cucharada colmada o 4 cucharaditas de pasta de curry verde tailandés (no cabe la cucharada en algunos de los frascos)","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco.","2 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado tailandesa","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","450 g de pollo deshuesado y sin piel (pechugas o muslos), cortado en trozos pequeños","2 hojas frescas de lima kaffir finamente ralladas o 3 tiras anchas de ralladura de lima y un poco más para decorar","buen puñado de hojas de albahaca","arroz hervido, para servir"]','["Poner las patatas en una cacerola de\r\nagua hirviendo y cocine por\r\n5 minutos. Echar los frijoles\r\ny cocine por 3 más\r\nminutos, momento en el cual ambos\r\ndebe quedar tierno pero no demasiado\r\nsuave. Escurrir y reservar.","En un wok o sartén grande,\r\ncalentar el aceite hasta que esté muy caliente, luego\r\nagregue el ajo y cocine hasta\r\ndorado, esto debería tomar sólo un\r\nunos segundos. No lo dejes pasar muy\r\noscuro o arruinará el sabor.\r\nVierta la pasta de curry y\r\nrevuélvelo durante unos segundos\r\ncomenzar a cocinar las especias y\r\nLibera todos los sabores. A continuación,\r\nverter la leche de coco y dejar\r\nse trata de una burbuja.","Agregue la salsa de pescado y\r\nazúcar, luego los trozos de\r\npollo. Baje el fuego a un\r\ncocine a fuego lento y cocine, tapado, durante\r\nunos 8 minutos hasta que\r\nel pollo está cocido.","Vierta las patatas y los frijoles.\r\ny dejar que se calienten\r\nla leche de coco caliente, luego agregue un\r\nencantador sabor cítrico por\r\nagregando la lima rallada\r\nhojas (o ralladura de lima). la albahaca\r\nlas hojas entran a continuación, pero solo salen\r\nbrevemente al fuego o\r\nperderán rápidamente su\r\nbrillo. Dispersarse con el\r\ndecorar con lima y servir\r\ninmediatamente con arroz hervido."]','2026-01-11 13:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14278,8198,'es','Pad Thai súper rápido','Este clásico plato tailandés de la lectora de Good Food Emily Cramer se elabora principalmente con ingredientes de despensa y está en la mesa en menos de 15 minutos.','["200 g de fideos de arroz","140 g de guisantes congelados","200 g de gambas congeladas","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","100 g de brotes de soja","manojo pequeño de cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","2 huevos batidos","3 cucharadas de maní tostado","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","cilantro en manojo pequeño, solo las hojas"]','["Poner a hervir agua en una cacerola, añadir la\r\nfideos y cocine por 3 minutos, agregando el\r\nguisantes y gambas para el último min. drenaje,\r\ny reserva mientras calientas el aceite en una\r\nsartén grande.","Freír los fideos, las gambas,\r\nguisantes, brotes de soja y cebolletas,\r\nrevolviendo para cubrir el aceite durante unos minutos.\r\nEmpuja todo hacia un lado de la sartén.\r\ny vierte el huevo. Revuelva hasta que esté cocido,\r\nLuego mezcla todo bien. tirar a través\r\nla salsa de maní, soja y chile dulce\r\nasí todo queda combinado. Dispersión con\r\nel cilantro y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14279,6459,'es','Pescado al vapor al estilo tailandés','Sirva con arroz jazmín tailandés para disfrutar de una comida baja en grasas y llena de sabor.','["2 filetes de trucha, cada uno con un peso aproximado de 140 g/5 oz","una nuez pequeña de raíz de jengibre fresca, pelada y picada","1 diente de ajo pequeño, picado","1 chile rojo pequeño (no ojo de pájaro), sin semillas y finamente picado","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","3 baby pak choi, cada uno cortado en cuartos a lo largo","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja"]','["Coloque los filetes de pescado al lado\r\nal lado en un gran cuadrado de papel de aluminio\r\ny esparcir el jengibre, el ajo,\r\nencima la ralladura de chile y lima.\r\nRocíe el jugo de limón encima y\r\nluego esparce los trozos de pak choi\r\nalrededor y encima del pescado.\r\nVierta la salsa de soja encima\r\nel pak choi y selle sin apretar el\r\npapel de aluminio para hacer un paquete, haciendo\r\nAsegúrate de dejar espacio en\r\nla parte superior para que circule el vapor\r\nmientras se cocina el pescado.","Cocer al vapor durante 15 minutos. (Si no tienes vaporera, pon la\r\npaquete sobre una placa resistente al calor sobre\r\ncacerola con agua hirviendo a fuego lento,\r\ncubrir con una tapa y cocinar al vapor)."]','2026-01-11 13:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14280,8200,'es','Brochetas de pollo al curry rojo','El pollo y los kebabs son dos de nuestras opciones más populares, por lo que esta antigua estrella de portada es un verdadero ganador, ya sea para barbacoas o a la parrilla.','["2 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","2 cucharadas de leche de coco","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y picado en trozos","1 calabacín, partido por la mitad y cortado en trozos","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos grandes","1 lima, partida por la mitad, para servir"]','["Enciende la barbacoa o calienta una plancha a fuego alto. Vierta el pollo, la pasta de curry y la leche de coco en un tazón, luego mezcle bien hasta que el pollo esté cubierto uniformemente. Ensarte las verduras y el pollo en las brochetas. cocinar las brochetas \r\nen la barbacoa o plancha durante 5 a 8 minutos, volteándolo de vez en cuando, hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido y carbonizado. Sirva con arroz con hierbas, ensalada y media lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14281,8202,'es','Arroz frito tailandés con gambas y guisantes','Similar al pad Thai pero con arroz integral, mejor para ti, esta olla asiática de mariscos con huevo, cilantro y guisantes es abundante y fresca.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 chile rojo, rebanado","250 g de gambas grandes peladas crudas","300 g de arroz integral cocido (unos 140 g de arroz crudo)","75 g de guisantes congelados","1 cucharada de salsa de soja oscura","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado","un manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes, más unas cuantas hojas para servir","4 huevos grandes","salsa de chile, para servir (opcional, usamos sriracha)"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en un wok,\r\nagrega la cebolla, el ajo y el chile,\r\ny cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté dorado.\r\nAñade las gambas y cocina durante\r\n1 min. Añade el arroz y los guisantes.\r\ny seguir revolviendo hasta que esté muy caliente.\r\nAgrega la salsa de soja y pescado, luego\r\nrevuelva con el cilantro picado.\r\nMantén caliente mientras fríes los huevos.","Calentar el aceite restante en una sartén.\r\nsartén y sofreír los huevos con un poco\r\ncondimento. Dividir el arroz frito\r\nmezclar entre 4 tazones y cubrir\r\ncada uno con un huevo frito. servir\r\nespolvoreado con cilantro, con\r\nsalsa de chile, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:01:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14282,8204,'es','Curry de ternera tailandés','Un curry verde tailandés auténtico y picante para tu olla de cocción lenta, ideal para eliminar el estrés de última hora del entretenimiento.','["2-3 cucharadas de aceite de maní","2 kg de costillas de res (las costillas con hueso se dejan enteras) o pechuga, cortadas en trozos grandes","cilantro en manojo grande","2 tallos de limoncillo, 1 machacado y 1 picado en trozos grandes","3 dientes de ajo, picados","1-2 chiles verdes, picados en trozos grandes y sin semillas si lo desea","Trozo de 2 cm de galanga o jengibre, pelado y picado","50 ml de vinagre de vino de arroz","50 ml de salsa de pescado","2 cucharadas de azúcar de palma o moreno claro","lata de 400g de leche de coco","anís de 2 estrellas","6 hojas de lima kaffir","jugo de 2 limas, más gajos para servir"]','["Calentar un poco de aceite en una sartén grande y\r\ndore la carne en tandas, removiendo para\r\nun plato después, reservando el jugo. si tu\r\nla olla de cocción lenta tiene una función para dorar,\r\nusa esto en su lugar. Mientras tanto, en un mini\r\npicadora o procesador de alimentos, mezcle la mitad\r\nel cilantro, el limoncillo picado,\r\najo, guindillas y galanga con el resto\r\ndel aceite hasta tener una pasta rugosa.","Enciende la olla de cocción lenta a temperatura Alta. Calor\r\nla pasta durante unos minutos, luego agregue la\r\ncarne de res y todos los ingredientes restantes,\r\naparte del cilantro restante\r\ny jugo de lima. Encienda la olla de cocción lenta\r\nBaja y cocina durante 8 horas, o hasta que\r\nla carne se cae del hueso.","Si usa costillas de res, retire los huesos de\r\nla carne, luego desmenuzar la carne con\r\n2 tenedores. Si la salsa queda muy fina, colar\r\nSe retira y se deja hervir para que reduzca. Agregue el\r\nel resto del cilantro y el jugo de lima, luego\r\nsazone con más salsa de pescado o azúcar."]','2026-01-11 13:01:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14283,8206,'es','Fideos tailandeses picantes con gambas','Estos fideos bajos en grasa son una cena sencilla y estarán en la mesa en 30 minutos.','["200 g de fideos de arroz tailandeses","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","2 huevos batidos","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","450 g de gambas del Atlántico cocidas y peladas","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes","½ manojo pequeño de menta, picada en trozos grandes","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","un puñado pequeño de maní tostado, picado"]','["Cocine los fideos siguiendo el paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, escurrir y reservar para más tarde.\r\nCalentar el aceite en una sartén grande y\r\nvierte el huevo batido. Gira alrededor del\r\nsartén para hacer una tortilla fina, cocinar durante\r\n1-2 minutos, luego voltee y cocine el\r\notro lado durante 1 min. Inclinar y cortar\r\nen tiras finas.","Agrega la guindilla y el jengibre a la sartén.\r\nfreír durante 1-2 minutos y luego verter los fideos.\r\ngambas y huevo. Rociar con la salsa de soja\r\ny sofreír durante 1 min más. Eche el\r\nHierbas picadas y verter sobre la lima.\r\njugo y ralladura, luego espolvorear sobre el\r\nmaní picado y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14284,8208,'es','Sopa de pollo verde tailandesa','Utilice muslos de pollo para esto: son más sabrosos y tienen mejor precio que las pechugas.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla, finamente picada","Paquete de 500 g de filetes de muslo de pollo sin piel y finamente picados","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","Tarro de 285 g de pasta de curry verde tailandés.","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco.","1¾ litro de caldo de pollo","5 hojas de lima kaffir","2 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","1 manojo de cebolletas, la blanca cortada en diagonal y la verde finamente picada","Paquete de 280 g de judías verdes finas, peladas y partidas por la mitad","Paquete de 150 g de brotes de bambú.","jugo de 2 limas, más gajos para servir","manojo pequeño de albahaca"]','["Calienta el aceite en tu sartén más grande, agrega el\r\ncebolla y sofreír durante 3 minutos para que se ablande. Añadir\r\nel pollo y el ajo, y cocinar hasta que\r\nel pollo cambia de color.","Agrega la pasta de curry, la leche de coco,\r\ncaldo, hojas de lima y salsa de pescado, luego\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 12 minutos. Agrega el picado\r\ntapas de cebolla, judías verdes y bambú\r\nbrotes y cocine durante 4-6 minutos, hasta que\r\nlos frijoles están tiernos.","Mientras tanto, poner el jugo de lima y\r\nalbahaca en una jarra estrecha y mezclar con un\r\nbatidora de mano para hacer un color verde suave\r\npegar. Vierta en la sopa con el\r\ncebolla tierna en rodajas y calentar bien.\r\nSirva con rodajas de lima para un almuerzo ligero.\r\no cena o como entrante para preparar con antelación."]','2026-01-11 13:01:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14285,8210,'es','Bocaditos de espinacas tailandesas','Estos pequeños bocaditos tailandeses están listos en sólo 10 minutos','["2 limas segmentadas y picadas","2 cm de jengibre picado","1 chalota finamente cortada","½ chile picado","1 cucharada de hojas de cilantro","2 cucharadas de maní","salsa de pescado","espolvorear azúcar","8-12 hojas tiernas de espinaca"]','["mezclar juntos\r\nlimas, jengibre, chalota, chile,\r\nhojas de cilantro y\r\nmaní. Condimentar con un chorrito de pescado\r\nsalsa y una pizca de azúcar.","Coloque las hojas de espinaca sobre una\r\nplato. Coloque una cucharada de la mezcla\r\ncada uno, luego entreguen y reúnan a todos.\r\nenrollarlos antes de comerlos de un solo bocado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14286,8212,'es','Sopa tailandesa de pollo y batata','Una sopa de pollo suave y picante con un color vibrante y repleta de aromas asiáticos.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva o de colza","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","Raíz de jengibre en trozos de 2 cm, picada","1 tallo de limoncillo, machacado","1 paquete de 25 g de cilantro, hojas y tallos picados por separado","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","750 ml de caldo de pollo (hecho con 2 cubitos de caldo)","1 lata pequeña (160ml) de crema de coco","500 g de batatas, peladas y picadas en trozos grandes","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel, en rodajas","1 lima, solo jugo","1 cucharadita de azúcar","½ cucharadita de salsa de pescado","pan crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande. Agregue el ajo, la guindilla, el jengibre, la hierba de limón, los tallos de cilantro y la pasta de curry y cocine durante 2 a 3 minutos hasta que se liberen los aromas.","Agrega el caldo de pollo, la crema de coco y los camotes y cocina por 15 minutos o hasta que las papas estén suaves. Retire la hierba de limón y deséchela. Transfiera con cuidado a una licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Si se congela, para obtener mejores resultados, congélelo en este punto; de lo contrario, como opción más fácil, congele la receta completa.","Regrese a la cacerola, agregue el pollo y cocine suavemente durante 5 a 10 minutos o hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido.  Agrega el jugo de lima, el azúcar y la salsa de pescado, espolvorea con las hojas de cilantro y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:01:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14287,8214,'es','Muslos tailandeses fragantes','Marina los muslos de pollo en una aromática pasta de curry rojo tailandés y chile dulce para comer con los dedos súper sabroso','["2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","ralladura 1 naranja, más 2 cucharadas de jugo","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de pasta de curry rojo tailandés de buena calidad","8 muslos de pollo, sin piel y con la carne cortada"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6\r\ny forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel de aluminio. Mezclar el\r\nsalsa de chile con ralladura de naranja y\r\njugo, ajo, pasta de curry y ¼ de cucharadita de sal.\r\nAgrega el pollo y cúbrelo muy bien.","Coloca las baquetas sobre el papel de aluminio.\r\nespaciados. Cubra el pollo con cualquier\r\nmarinada que queda en el tazón, luego ase durante\r\n35-40 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Envolver en papel de aluminio o\r\nempacar en un recipiente de comida."]','2026-01-11 13:01:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14288,8216,'es','Estofado de ternera al limoncillo con fideos','Pruebe el sudeste asiático con este fragante salteado rico en hierro con chile, jengibre, limoncillo y cilantro.','["1 cucharada de jengibre, picado","2 dientes de ajo, picados","3 tallos de limoncillo, sin hojas exteriores, finamente picados","2 cucharadas de hojas de cilantro, más extra para servir","2 chiles rojos, en rodajas finas (deja las semillas si te gusta picante)","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","250 g de ternera para guisar, cortada en cubos de 2½ cm","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja oscura","1 cucharadita de cinco especias en polvo","1 cucharadita de azúcar moreno","400 ml de caldo de carne","100 g de fideos de arroz anchos","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Pon el jengibre, el ajo, la hierba de limón,\r\ncilantro y 1 chile en un procesador de alimentos,\r\nluego pulsa hasta hacer puré. Calentar el aceite en\r\nuna sartén a fuego lento. Agrega el puré\r\ny cocine por 5 minutos. Agregue la carne,\r\nsoja, cinco especias, azúcar y caldo. Ponte un\r\nTapar y llevar a ebullición, luego bajar el fuego.\r\ny cocine a fuego lento durante 1 hora 15 minutos. Quitar\r\ntapa y cocina por 15 minutos más.\r\nhasta que la carne esté tierna.","Justo antes de servir, prepare los fideos.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir bien,\r\nluego divídalo en 2 tazones y una cuchara\r\nsobre el estofado de ternera. Servir espolvoreado con\r\nel resto de las hojas de chile y cilantro,\r\ncon rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14289,8218,'es','Pollo salteado de Ken Hom con chiles y albahaca','Un plato tradicional tailandés lleno de sabores aromáticos, fácil de preparar y lleno de sabor aromático.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","450 g de muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos","3 cucharadas de ajo picado grueso","3 cucharadas de chalotas finamente picadas","3 chiles verdes o rojos frescos, sin semillas y finamente rallados","2 cucharadas de salsa de pescado (nam pla)","2 tsp dark soy sauce","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","un puñado grande de hojas de albahaca tailandesa o común"]','["Calentar un wok o una fritura grande\r\nsartén hasta que esté bien caliente, luego\r\nagregue 1 cucharada de aceite. cuando\r\nestá muy caliente, agrega el pollo\r\ny sofreír a fuego alto durante\r\n8-10 minutos, hasta que se dore\r\npor todas partes. Usando una espumadera,\r\nsaca el pollo de la sartén\r\ny dejar a un lado.","Vuelva a calentar el wok y agregue el\r\naceite restante. Agregue el ajo\r\ny chalotes y sofreír durante 3\r\nminutos, hasta que estén doradas.","Regrese el pollo a la\r\nwok y agregue los chiles, el pescado\r\nsalsa, salsa de soja oscura y\r\nazúcar. Saltear a fuego alto\r\ndurante 8-10 minutos más o\r\nhasta que el pollo esté cocido\r\na través. Agregue las hojas de albahaca\r\ny servir de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:01:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14290,8220,'es','Pide de pimienta y halloumi','Pruebe esta comida callejera turca utilizando una mezcla de pan comprada en la tienda para mayor comodidad. Cubierto con halloumi especiado y pimientos, es un delicioso almuerzo para preparar en familia.','["250 g de mezcla para pan ciabatta","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo, machacados","½ pimiento rojo pequeño, cortado en cubitos","½ pimiento verde pequeño, cortado en cubitos","½ cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de canela molida","un puñado de perejil picado","1 bloque de halloumi, cortado en cubitos","harina común, para espolvorear","25 g de mantequilla, derretida"]','["Haga la masa de ciabatta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y déjela reposar mientras hace el relleno.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla, el ajo y los pimientos durante 10 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Agrega las especias y un poco de condimento y cocina por unos minutos, luego agrega el perejil y retira del fuego. Agrega el halloumi.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Divida la masa en cuartos y luego extiéndala sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada en formas ovaladas largas (aproximadamente 22 cm x 9 cm). Colóquelos en dos bandejas para hornear forradas con papel para hornear. Esparcir con la mezcla de pimientos y queso dejando bordes de 1 cm. Pellizque en cada extremo para darle forma de zapatilla.","Hornee durante 20-25 minutos o hasta que esté inflado y dorado. Unte los pides con mantequilla derretida y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:01:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14291,8222,'es','Arroz turco (arroz con fideos)','Esta guarnición turca clásica utiliza arroz blanco de grano largo con caldo de pollo y pasta de fideos tostados.','["300 g de arroz blanco de grano largo","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","70 g de hebras de fideos triturados","30 g de mantequilla sin sal","625 ml de caldo de pollo, elaborado con una pastilla de caldo"]','["Vierta el arroz en un recipiente muy grande con agua corriente fría y escurra con cuidado el agua del recipiente a través de un colador. Repita varias veces hasta que el agua del recipiente esté clara, luego llénelo con agua fría y deje el arroz en remojo durante 10 minutos mientras cocina los fideos.","Pon el aceite en una sartén mediana a fuego medio. Agregue los fideos y revuelva continuamente hasta que las hebras adquieran un color dorado intenso, 2-3 minutos. Retire del fuego, revuelva con la mantequilla hasta que se derrita y deje que los fideos se enfríen durante 1-2 minutos.","Escurrir bien el arroz a través de un colador. Agrega el arroz a la sartén y revuelve bien. Vierta el caldo caliente en la sartén, espolvoree ½ cucharadita de sal, revuelva bien y luego regrese la sartén a la encimera a fuego alto. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego al mínimo posible, tapar la sartén y cocinar a fuego lento durante 7-9 minutos. Retire la sartén del fuego, cúbrala con un par de hojas de papel de cocina o un paño de cocina ligero y la tapa de la sartén, y deje reposar el arroz en la sartén durante 10 minutos. Revuelva con un tenedor antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14292,8224,'es','kebabs de Adana','Estos kebabs turcos utilizan ingredientes mínimos para que resalte el sabor del cordero, complementados con pimientos rojos y pul biber picante.','["2 pimientos romanos rojos grandes, sin corazón, sin semillas y cortados en trozos grandes","800 g de carne picada de cordero al 20 % de grasa","3 cucharadas de pasta de pimiento rojo turco suave (dulce)","1 cucharada de pul biber","3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol"]','["Pica finamente los pimientos en un procesador de alimentos, luego colócalos en un colador y presiónalos contra el colador para que los pimientos suelten todo su jugo. Vierta en un bol junto con la carne picada, la pasta de pimiento rojo, el pul biber, 1½ cucharadita de sal marina en escamas y 2 cucharadas de aceite. Mezcle, amasando bien durante al menos 2-3 minutos. Si es necesario, moja tus manos con agua fría para evitar que la mezcla se pegue. La mezcla debe estar pegajosa cuando esté lista. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos 2 horas o hasta 12 horas.","Cuando esté listo para cocinar, caliente la parrilla a temperatura alta o el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 6. Divida la mezcla en 12 porciones iguales, de aproximadamente 85 g cada una. Si desea ensartarlos, divídalos en 8 porciones iguales y forme bolitas. Con las manos mojadas, pase las bolas por el extremo de las brochetas y masajee la mezcla entre las palmas de las manos hasta que se distribuya uniformemente. Asegúrese de que la mezcla esté completamente envuelta alrededor de las brochetas sin ningún metal expuesto. Alternativamente, colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear grande forrada con papel pergamino si los cocina en el horno, o con papel de aluminio si los cocina bajo la parrilla. Forme un köfte de 20 cm de largo. Moja tus dedos con un poco de agua fría y haz hendiduras a lo largo del köfte para darle la forma tradicional.","Unte suavemente cada köfte con la cucharada de aceite restante y cocine debajo de la parrilla, en el estante superior durante 10 a 12 minutos, volteándolos regularmente, o cocine en el horno durante 16 a 18 minutos, hasta que esté crujiente por fuera y jugoso por dentro."]','2026-01-11 13:01:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14293,8226,'es','Dolma (falso peluche)','Disfrute de una versión sin carne de hojas de parra rellenas, con tomate y cebolla. Una vez que domines la receta, intenta experimentar con otros rellenos.','["250 g de arroz blanco de grano largo","6 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cebolla grande, muy finamente picada","4 cucharadas de puré de tomate","25 g de hojas de menta fresca, finamente picadas","30 g de perejil fresco de hoja plana, finamente picado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de melaza de granada","100 ml de zumo de limón fresco, unos 3 limones","2 cucharadas de menta seca","1 x 420 g de hojas de vid envasadas al vacío."]','["Lave el arroz en un colador con agua corriente fría hasta que el agua salga clara, luego déjelo escurrir completamente en un colador.","Mientras tanto, calienta 3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva a fuego lento y añade la cebolla. Ablandar durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté transparente y caramelizado. Agregue 3 cucharadas de puré de tomate a las cebollas, dividiéndolas suavemente en los jugos aceitosos, aproximadamente 2 minutos. Agrega el arroz, cubriendo completamente los granos con la mezcla de tomate y cebolla, luego retira la sartén del fuego y transfiere el contenido a un plato grande, el nuestro medía 22 cm. Agrega la menta fresca y el perejil al plato, junto con los tomates picados, la melaza de granada, el jugo de limón, la menta seca, 1½ cucharadita de sal marina fina y ¾ cucharadita de pimienta negra recién molida. Revuelva para combinar, luego deje que se enfríe a temperatura ambiente. Enfríe durante 1 hora para permitir que los sabores se unan.","Mientras la mezcla se enfría, prepara las hojas de parra. Ponlos en la cacerola más ancha que tengas y luego lávalos bien con agua fría 3-4 veces. Llena la cacerola con agua fría, colócala en el fuego a fuego medio y deja que hierva durante 10 minutos. Apague el fuego, luego cubra la cacerola y deje las hojas reposar en el agua hirviendo durante otros 10 minutos. Escurre con cuidado el agua caliente de la sartén, luego llénala con agua fría y escúrrela un par de veces más para eliminar la salmuera de las hojas. Vuelve a llenar la cacerola con agua fría para que las hojas queden cubiertas; esto hará que sea más fácil sacar las hojas de la cacerola sin romperlas. Reserva 4 o 5 hojas de parra grandes para más tarde y luego usa el resto para hacer la dolma.","Disuelva la cucharada restante de puré de tomate en una jarra resistente al calor con 200 ml de agua hirviendo, luego complete con 300 ml de agua fría y revuelva bien.","Coloque una hoja de parra en un plato grande con el lado más ancho de la hoja hacia usted y la punta más alejada. Si las hojas todavía tienen un tallo adherido, córtelas. Cubrir con una cucharadita colmada de la mezcla por la parte más ancha, dejando poco más de 1 cm (½ pulgada) de espacio a los lados y a lo largo del borde más cercano a usted. Dobla este borde más cercano sobre el relleno, dobla los lados y luego enrolla la dolma lejos de ti hasta que tengas un rollo bien apretado con forma de cigarro.","Agregue un par de hojas reservadas en el fondo de una sartén grande, luego coloque la dolma enrollada (con el extremo puntiagudo de la hoja hacia la parte inferior de la sartén para evitar que la dolma se deshaga mientras se cocina) en el fondo de la sartén y repita con las hojas restantes y el relleno. Coloque las dolma cómodamente, pero asegúrese de dejar suficiente espacio para que se expandan mientras se cocinan, en capas.","Rocíe las 3 cucharadas restantes de aceite de oliva en la sartén y luego cubra la dolma con las hojas restantes reservadas. Agregue un par de platos resistentes al calor encima de las hojas para pesar ligeramente el contenido de la sartén, luego vierta suficiente líquido de tomate para que quede justo por encima del borde de los platos 2 cm (¾ de pulgada). No dudes en añadir un poco más de agua si la cantidad de líquido no es suficiente, o contenerla si es demasiado. Coloca la sartén a fuego medio, deja que hierva y luego reduce el fuego lo más bajo posible. Tapa la sartén y cocina durante unos 20-25 minutos hasta que la mayor parte del agua se haya reducido, pero aún puedas ver una pequeña cantidad burbujeando. Retire la sartén del fuego y déjela enfriar durante al menos 2 horas (preferiblemente unas cuantas más) antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14294,8228,'es','Panes planos de huevo turco','Disfrute de estos panes planos turcos con huevo para un almuerzo o cena rápido y fácil. Asegúrate de romper los huevos en aceite caliente para obtener un fondo delicioso y crujiente.','["175 g de yogur griego 0% grasa","1 diente de ajo rallado","½ limón, rallado","1 ½ cucharadita de zaatar","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","2 panes planos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 huevos","30 g de queso feta vegetariano, desmenuzado","25 g de aceitunas verdes, en rodajas","una pizca grande de hojuelas de chile de Alepo o aceite de chile (opcional)","½ pepino, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas finas"]','["Combina el yogur con el ajo, la ralladura de limón, la mitad del za''atar, la mitad del perejil y un poco de sal y pimienta. Calentar una sartén seca a fuego medio y untar ligeramente los panes planos con un poco de aceite. Freír cada lado durante 1 minuto, luego transferir a dos platos y reservar.","Calienta el aceite de oliva restante en la sartén. Una vez bien calientes, cascamos los huevos en la sartén y los sofreímos unos minutos hasta que la clara esté cuajada y los bordes crujientes. Extienda el yogur especiado de manera uniforme sobre los dos panes planos y cubra con los huevos crujientes, el queso feta, las aceitunas, el perejil y el za''atar restantes, el chile, si se usa, y los pepinos a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14295,8230,'es','katmer de pistacho','Pruebe este fabuloso postre turco de helado intercalado entre masa filo y espolvoreado con pistachos. Sirve el katmer con fruta fresca.','["2 láminas de masa filo de unos 37 x 30 cm cada una","30 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","80 g de pistachos sin cáscara, tostados y molidos, y un poco más para decorar","4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","40 g de nata cuajada","4 bolas de helado de vainilla","gajos de pomelo o naranja (u otra fruta fresca), para servir"]','["Coger 1 hoja de filo y untar con un poco de mantequilla derretida. Espolvorea sobre la mitad de los pistachos para formar un cuadrado de unos 12 x 12 cm en el centro de la hoja. Espolvoree la mitad del azúcar y coloque la mitad de la nata cuajada encima de los pistachos. Comenzando en la esquina superior izquierda, dobla la esquina hacia el centro y luego dobla la esquina inferior derecha hacia el centro. Dobla las dos esquinas restantes hacia el centro, superponiéndolas ligeramente para terminar con un cuadrado.","Coloque una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto y unte con la mitad de la mantequilla derretida restante, luego coloque el katmer en la sartén con la costura hacia abajo. Cocine por ambos lados durante 1-2 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Repite el proceso para el otro katmer.","Corta el katmer crujiente por la mitad, para tener cuatro trozos. Divida el helado entre dos de ellos, presionándolo ligeramente y luego cubra con los trozos de masa restantes para hacer dos sándwiches. Córtelos por la mitad nuevamente para hacer cuatro pedazos. Sirva inmediatamente, espolvoreado con más pistachos, gajos de pomelo u otra fruta de temporada."]','2026-01-11 13:01:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14296,8232,'es','pan simple','Los panes simit son aros de pan de sésamo que se parecen a los bagels. Se venden en todas las esquinas de Turquía y son populares para el desayuno o la merienda.','["250 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","1 cucharadita de sal","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita (5 g) de levadura seca de acción rápida","100 g de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharada de melaza de granada o jarabe de melaza"]','["Vierta la harina, la sal y el azúcar en un bol y mezcle. Agrega la levadura y 150 ml de agua tibia, mezcla y luego amasa durante unos minutos para que todo se junte hasta formar una masa suave. Inclínelo sobre la superficie de trabajo y continúe amasando durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que la masa se sienta elástica. Regresar a un recipiente limpio, tapar y dejar reposar durante una o dos horas hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Mientras tanto, tuesta las semillas de sésamo en una sartén seca hasta que estén doradas. Reservar en la sartén. Mezcle el jarabe de melaza o la melaza de granada con 50 ml de agua en un recipiente ancho y poco profundo.","Divide la masa en cuatro trozos iguales. Enrolle cada uno hasta formar una salchicha de unos 45 cm de largo. Voltee la cuerda de masa sobre sí misma, luego gire las dos hebras y forme un anillo, apretando los extremos para asegurarlos. Una vez formado, sumerja cada pieza en el agua de melaza, volteándola para cubrirla, luego en las semillas de sésamo, asegurándose de que cada una quede bien cubierta. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear, cubra y deje reposar durante otros 45 minutos a 1 hora. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Cuando los panes se hayan inflado, destápalos y hornéalos durante 15-18 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Déjelos enfriar y luego envuélvalos en un paño de cocina para mantenerlos frescos. Se puede preparar con hasta un día de anticipación y calentar suavemente antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14297,8234,'es','Alitas de pollo con comino, limón y ajo','Elija algunos extras de la tienda de delicatessen y conviértalo en un mezze del Medio Oriente para compartir con amigos.','["12 alitas de pollo","2 dientes de ajo machacados","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de miel"]','["Con un par de tijeras de cocina afiladas, corte cada ala a la altura del nudillo en dos pedazos. Mezcle el ajo, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el comino y el aceite con abundante condimento, luego viértalo en un plato con las alitas de pollo y revuelva para cubrir. Tapar y meter en el frigorífico para marinar durante al menos 1 hora, o toda la noche si tienes tiempo.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6, o calienta una barbacoa al aire libre. Hornee las alitas de pollo en una bandeja para horno durante 45 a 50 minutos hasta que estén crujientes, o cocine a la parrilla durante 20 minutos, rociando miel durante los últimos 10 minutos de cada método. Servir en un plato con abundantes servilletas de papel. Llene tazones pequeños con aceitunas, pistachos o almendras, dátiles, chiles encurtidos y panes planos para acompañar, junto con los platos a continuación."]','2026-01-11 13:01:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14298,8236,'es','Berenjena al horno rellena de calabaza asada, queso feta y nueces con calabacines a la menta','El chef neozelandés Peter Gordon muestra sabores de temporada en esta impresionante y saludable comida vegetariana.','["2 berenjenas grandes","200 g/7 oz de calabaza o calabacín (pruebe con kabocha o calabaza moscada)","100 g de cebollas moradas, en rodajas finas","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino (o use un poco menos de comino molido)","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","4 cucharadas de colza virgen o aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de hierbas frescas (el tomillo, el orégano, la salvia o el romero funcionan bien)","100 g de queso feta, cortado en cubitos","un puñado grande de nueces, ligeramente tostadas y partidas por la mitad","4 calabacines","1 limon","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta, picadas","un puñado pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nCortar las berenjenas por la mitad a lo largo,\r\ndejando el tallo en su lugar (esto puede ser\r\nse retira al comer). Usando un pequeño\r\ncuchillo afilado, saque la carne interior\r\ndejando una cáscara de aproximadamente 1 cm de espesor. picar\r\nla pulpa y poner en un bol.","Pelar la calabaza o zapallo, retirar\r\nlas semillas, luego cortarlas en dados de 1-2 cm y\r\nmezclar con la berenjena picada y el rojo\r\ncebolla. Incorpora el comino, el ajo y 2 cucharadas.\r\naceite y mezclar con un poco de sal y\r\npimienta negra. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear forrada\r\ncon papel pergamino. Frote 1 cucharada de aceite\r\nlas mitades de berenjena y sazonar. lugar,\r\ncon el lado cortado hacia abajo, en otra bandeja forrada con\r\npapel pergamino. Hornee durante 15-20 minutos,\r\nhasta que las cáscaras de calabaza y berenjena\r\nestán casi cocidos.","Vuelva a colocar la mezcla de calabaza en el\r\ntazón y revuelva con la mezcla de hierbas,\r\nqueso feta y nueces. Dar la vuelta a la berenjena\r\nmitades, luego amontone la mezcla en el interior.\r\nRocíe con la cucharada de aceite restante y\r\nhornee durante 20 minutos, momento en el cual\r\nLa calabaza estará completamente cocida. Si empieza a\r\ncoloree demasiado, cúbralo sin apretar con papel de aluminio.","Mientras tanto, prepara la ensalada de calabacín.\r\nCubra y coloque la cola sobre los calabacines, luego córtelos\r\nmuy finamente en cintas anchas. Mezcle con\r\nla ralladura, el zumo de medio limón y la\r\naceite. Dejar actuar 10 minutos para que\r\nlos calabacines se ablandan un poco.","Para servir, mezcle las hierbas por el\r\ncalabacines y cortar el limón restante\r\nla mitad en gajos. Colocar una mitad de berenjena\r\nEn cada plato, amontona la ensalada al lado.\r\ny servir con una rodajita de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:01:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14299,8238,'es','Hamburguesas kofta caseras','Con estas koftas rápidas, fáciles y económicas, no hay excusa para subirte a la furgoneta de kebab','["1 kg de carne picada de cordero","2 cebollas, ralladas gruesas","1 cabeza de ajo, partida en dientes y finamente picada o rallada","6 cucharadas de garam masala","manojo de cilantro, picado (opcional)","1 cucharada de salsa de chile, más extra para servir","8 panes pita","4 tomates, partidos por la mitad y en rodajas","media col lombarda, rallada","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas (opcional)","yogur natural en bote pequeño"]','["Vierta la carne picada en un tazón grande (use un\r\nLimpie el recipiente para fregar si no tiene\r\ncualquier cosa lo suficientemente grande) con todos los demás\r\nIngredientes de la hamburguesa y una buena pizca de sal.\r\nArremángate, mete las manos en el\r\nmezclar y silenciar todo junto a través\r\ncon los dedos hasta que esté completamente mezclado. acaricia el\r\nmezcle en 16 hamburguesas pequeñas. Estos pueden ahora\r\ncongelarse hasta por 1 mes o enfriarse\r\na un día de antelación.","Para cocinar, caliente la parrilla a su temperatura más alta y\r\nColoque las hamburguesas en una sola capa sobre una bandeja para hornear.\r\nbandeja (es posible que deba hacer esto en lotes,\r\ndependiendo del tamaño de tu bandeja). Parrilla encendida\r\nel estante más alto durante 5-6 minutos en cada lado\r\nhasta que esté dorado y bien cocido. pila\r\nhamburguesas en un plato y sírvalas con todas\r\nlos acompañamientos, para que todos puedan\r\nconstruir su propio sándwich."]','2026-01-11 13:01:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14300,8240,'es','Gozleme de cordero especiado y feta con salsa de tomate especial','Un sabroso pastel turco hecho con pan. Rellenar con cordero, queso feta, pasas y piñones y servir con salsa de granada.','["Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","250 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para terminar","Paquete de 500 g de carne picada de cordero","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","50 g de pasas","ralladura de 1 limón","3 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","50 g de piñones tostados","100 g de queso feta","8 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada","1 cucharada de cebolla morada muy finamente picada"]','["Para la masa, mezclar la levadura, el azúcar.\r\ny 175ml de agua tibia en un vaso pequeño\r\ncuenco. Revuelva para disolver la levadura, luego\r\ndejar reposar durante 10 minutos o hasta que el líquido\r\nempieza a hacer espuma.","Mezclar la harina con ½ cucharadita de sal en un recipiente grande.\r\ncuenco. Hacer un hueco en el centro, verter\r\nen la mezcla de levadura y aceite de oliva, y\r\nmezclar hasta obtener una masa. Amasar durante 10 minutos,\r\nLuego poner la masa en un recipiente ligeramente engrasado.\r\nbol y cubrir con film transparente engrasado.\r\nDejar en un lugar bastante cálido hasta\r\nduplicó su tamaño.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Calentar el\r\nEn una sartén con aceite, añadir la carne picada y\r\nfreír, rompiendo grumos a medida que avanza, hasta\r\nbien dorado. Agregue el ajo, las especias.\r\ny pasas, y sofreír unos minutos más,\r\nluego apague el fuego y agregue el\r\nralladura de limón, cebolletas, piñones\r\ny condimento. Reservar para que se enfríe un poco.","Dividir la masa en 4. Trabajando un\r\npieza a la vez, extiéndala sobre una superficie ligeramente\r\nsuperficie enharinada a 25 x 30cm, sin\r\nla masa partiéndose. Con un borde largo\r\nde la masa que está frente a ti, cuchara\r\n¼ de la carne picada en la mitad inferior –\r\ndejando un borde de 2 cm en todo el contorno. desmoronarse\r\nmás de ¼ del queso feta. Dobla la otra mitad de\r\nla masa sobre el relleno, doblando y\r\npellizcando los bordes para sellar el cordero.\r\nRepita con los ingredientes restantes.","Calienta una sartén grande a fuego alto.\r\ny unte todo el gozleme con aceite.","Cocine en tandas durante 3-5 minutos en cada una.\r\nlado, o hasta que esté dorado y completamente caliente.\r\nMezclar rápidamente el ketchup de tomate,\r\ngranada y cebolla, y servir con\r\nel gozleme caliente y crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14301,6764,'es','Ensalada de camote','Esta sencilla y saludable ensalada de trozos de papa al horno es una excelente alternativa a las versiones a base de mayonesa.','["1,2 kg de batatas, peladas y cortadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 chalotes (o media cebolla morada pequeña), finamente picados","4 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","cebollino en manojo pequeño, cortado en cuartos o use mini","5 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharadas de miel"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle los trozos de batata con el aceite de oliva y un poco de condimento, y extiéndalos sobre una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino. Ase durante 30 a 35 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y dorados. Enfriar a temperatura ambiente.","Cuando esté casi frío, mezcle todos los ingredientes del aderezo con un poco más de condimento y mezcle suavemente los trozos de papa; use las manos para evitar romperlos."]','2026-01-11 13:01:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14302,8242,'es','Imam bayildi con cordero BBQ y tzatziki','Existen cientos de versiones de este plato turco de berenjena. Es auténticamente bastante aceitoso, pero reduce el aceite si lo prefieres.','["3 berenjenas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para cepillar","1 cebolla española, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de canela","8 tomates maduros, pelados","manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado","12 chuletas o chuletas de cordero","pimentón, para condimentar","1 limón, partido por la mitad","Tarrina de 150 g de yogur griego","½ pepino, sin semillas y rallado","2 cucharadas de menta picada"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nCortar las berenjenas por la mitad a lo largo y\r\nMarque profundamente el lado de la pulpa, cepille con un\r\nbuena capa de aceite de oliva y poner a hornear\r\nhoja. Ase durante 20 minutos o hasta que la pulpa\r\nes lo suficientemente suave como para sacarlo.","Freír la cebolla en un poco de aceite hasta que esté blanda, agregar\r\nel ajo y la canela y sofreír durante 1 min.\r\nUna vez que las berenjenas estén lo suficientemente frías como para\r\nmango, saque los centros. Aproximadamente\r\nPicar la pulpa y agregarla a las cebollas.\r\nCortar los tomates por la mitad, sacar las semillas.\r\ny el jugo en un colador colocado sobre un bol,\r\nluego pique la pulpa. Agrega el picado\r\ntomates a la sartén y cocinar todo\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave y agradable. agrega un poco\r\nmás aceite si es necesario. Agregue el perejil,\r\ndejando un poco para esparcir al final.","Coloque las mitades de berenjena en una fuente para horno.\r\nplato y dividir la mezcla de tomate\r\nentre ellos. Vierta sobre el jugo de\r\nlos tomates, rociar con más aceite de oliva\r\ny hornear durante 30 min hasta que las berenjenas\r\nse han derrumbado.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los ingredientes del tzatziki.\r\njuntos y poner en un tazón pequeño para servir.","Sazone el cordero con sal negra.\r\npimienta y una pizca de pimentón. plancha,\r\nasar o asar a la parrilla durante 3 minutos por cada lado\r\no hasta que la grasa esté bien dorada, luego\r\nponer en una fuente para servir y exprimir\r\nlas mitades de limón. Esparcir las berenjenas\r\ncon perejil, luego servir con el cordero\r\ny tzatziki."]','2026-01-11 13:01:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14303,8244,'es','Pastelitos de almendras y miel con crema de naranja','Sirva estos pudines preparados con anticipación con café, vino de postre o té de menta fresca para disfrutar de un verdadero placer después de la cena.','["200 g de almendras enteras blanqueadas, tostadas y picadas en trozos grandes","85 g de azúcar glas, más un poco más para servir","85 g de mantequilla, derretida","2 cucharaditas de agua de azahar","1 cucharadita de canela","1 yema de huevo","Paquete de 190 g de masa brik","miel clara, para servir","ralladura de 1 naranja","300 g de yogur griego","Tarrina 300ml crema doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas, tamizada"]','["Reserva una cuarta parte de las almendras. poner\r\nel resto en un procesador de alimentos con el glaseado\r\nazúcar, la mitad de la mantequilla, flor de naranjo\r\nagua, canela y yema de huevo. zumbido para\r\nuna pasta. Vierta en un tazón y agregue\r\nla mayoría de las nueces picadas restantes.","Desenrolle una hoja de masa brik a una\r\ntiempo, unte todo con mantequilla derretida\r\ny dividir por la mitad en 2 semicírculos. Forma\r\n1 cucharada colmada de la mezcla de nueces para lucir\r\ncomo una delgada forma de cuña a lo largo de la mitad del\r\nborde de masa que acabas de cortar (dejando 2,5 cm\r\nborde en el lado redondeado), por lo que parece\r\ncomo si estuvieras cortando el semicírculo de\r\nmasa en trozos como si fuera un pastel. enrollar como\r\nun cono de repostería, sellando la mezcla de nueces\r\npor dentro, luego unte todo con más mantequilla\r\ny doble el extremo ancho y abierto para sellar.\r\nSiéntese en una bandeja para hornear, con el extremo de la solapa hacia abajo para\r\nayúdelo a permanecer cerrado y repita hasta que la tuerca\r\nla mezcla se agota. Cubrir con film transparente\r\ny relájate. Ponle ralladura, yogur, nata y glaseado.\r\nazúcar en un tazón para mezclar. Cubrir y enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6, meter los pasteles y hornear durante 15 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Justo antes de que sean\r\nListo, bate la mezcla de yogur.\r\nhasta que espese. Apila los pasteles en una porción.\r\nplato, rociar con miel y espolvorear con\r\nnueces restantes. Servir con la naranja\r\ncrema y naranja y pomelo con miel (ver ''Combina bien con'')."]','2026-01-11 13:01:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14304,8246,'es','Albóndigas de cordero y albaricoque','Nadie puede resistirse a las albóndigas, y esta receta es tan deliciosa que quizás quieras hacerla doble y congelarla para otro momento.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas, muy finamente picadas","4 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de comino molido y cilantro (o 4 cucharaditas de mezcla de especias marroquíes)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","½ cucharadita de azúcar","½ paquete de 20 g de menta, finamente picada","Paquete de 500 g de carne magra de cordero","8 orejones, finamente picados","50 g de pan rallado fresco","pan pita y ensalada, para servir"]','["Calentar 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén y ablandar la\r\ncebollas durante 5 minutos. Agrega el ajo y\r\nespecias y cocine por unos minutos más.\r\nVierta la mitad de la mezcla de cebolla en un bol.\r\ny dejar enfriar. Agrega los tomates,\r\nazúcar y condimentos al resto\r\ncebollas en la sartén y cocine a fuego lento durante aproximadamente\r\n10 minutos hasta que se reduzca.","Mientras tanto, añade la menta, el cordero,\r\nalbaricoques y pan rallado a lo enfriado\r\ncebollas, sazone y mezcle bien con su\r\nmanos. Forme pequeñas albóndigas.","Calentar el resto del aceite en una sartén antiadherente.\r\nsartén y sofreír las albóndigas hasta que estén doradas\r\n(en lotes si es necesario). Agregue el\r\nsalsa con un chorrito de agua y suavemente\r\nCocine todo por unos minutos hasta que\r\nlas albóndigas estén bien cocidas.\r\nServir con pan pita y ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:01:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14305,8248,'es','Wrap de cordero picante con comino, ensalada de repollo crujiente y mayonesa picante','Un pan plano de kebab saludable: haga el doble de ensalada de repollo y zanahoria y tenga las sobras para el almuerzo.','["4 filetes pequeños de pierna de cordero","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita colmada de comino molido","1 cucharada de azúcar","3 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","2 zanahorias, ralladas gruesas","2 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","400 g/14 oz de col blanca, cortada en rodajas muy finas","5 pimientos dulces, 2 en rodajas gruesas","3 cucharadas de mayonesa","4 panes de pita o planos grandes, calentados"]','["Calienta una plancha. Frote los filetes de cordero\r\ncon el aceite, el comino y un poco de condimento.\r\nPlancha durante unos 3-4 minutos por cada lado\r\no hasta que esté cocido a tu gusto. lugar a uno\r\nlado en un plato para reposar.","En un tazón grande, agregue el azúcar al\r\nvinagre hasta que se disuelva. Agrega las zanahorias,\r\ncebolletas, repollo y algo\r\nsazonar y mezclar.","Blitz los pimientos enteros y la mayonesa.\r\nen un procesador de alimentos. Añade un montón de\r\nensalada a cada pan plano. Cortar el cordero,\r\nrecortando el exceso de grasa y recostándose\r\nencima de la ensalada, rociando con el resto\r\njugos. Vierta sobre la mayonesa y esparza.\r\ncon algunos de los pimientos cortados en rodajas. enrollar\r\ny comer. Si usa pitta, divídalo y demás.\r\nSirva cualquier ensalada extra a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14306,8250,'es','Parrilladas de berenjena y hummus','Prueba algo nuevo con las berenjenas y conviértelas en la parte principal de tu comida con este plato vegetariano.','["2 berenjenas, cortadas en rodajas gruesas a lo largo","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal, más un extra para cepillar","3 rebanadas de pan integral o blanco, sin corteza","Hummus en tarrina de 300g","100 g de nueces tostadas","Medio paquete de 80 g de perejil de hoja plana, las hojas picadas en trozos grandes","Paquete de 200 g de tomates cherry cortados en cuartos","jugo ½ limón","chorrear aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Coloque la berenjena en una capa sobre una bandeja para hornear grande. Unte con moderación con aceite vegetal y luego sazone generosamente. Ase durante 15 minutos, volteándolos dos veces y untándolos con aceite hasta que las rodajas estén suaves y bien cocidas. Mientras tanto, bata el pan hasta obtener migajas. Agregue 2 cucharaditas de aceite y vuelva a batir brevemente para cubrir.","Unte un par de cucharaditas de hummus encima de cada rodaja de berenjena. Coloque el pan rallado en un plato grande, luego presione el lado humeante de las berenjenas contra las migajas para cubrirlas. Ase nuevamente, con el lado rallado hacia arriba, durante unos 3 minutos hasta que esté dorado.","Mezcle las nueces, el perejil y los tomates cherry en un bol, sazone, luego agregue el jugo de limón y el aceite de oliva y mezcle nuevamente. Sirve las parrilladas con la ensalada, una cucharada más de hummus y un poco de pan pita."]','2026-01-11 13:01:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14307,8252,'es','Berenjena asada con queso de cabra y pan plano tostado','Sabores intensos y muy crujiente: ni siquiera notarás que estás comiendo una ensalada súper saludable','["2 berenjenas, cortadas en rodajas finas a lo largo","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","12 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","1 pan plano o pita del Medio Oriente","3 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","un puñado de hojas de menta","2 chalotas, 1 finamente picada y la otra en rodajas finas","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","50 g de queso de cabra desmenuzado","un puñado de rúcula salvaje, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nUnte las rodajas de berenjena con 1 cucharada\r\ndel aceite, luego sazone. Organizar en un\r\nbandeja para hornear o bandeja y asar durante 20 minutos\r\nhasta que se dore, colocando los tomates\r\nla bandeja durante los últimos 5 minutos. rasgar el\r\npan plano en trozos y colocar sobre una\r\nbandeja para hornear separada. Dorar en el horno\r\ndurante 8 minutos o hasta que esté crujiente, luego retírelo.","Para el aderezo, en un tazón pequeño, mezcle\r\nel vinagre, la menta, las chalotas picadas, la guindilla,\r\naceite restante y un poco de sal y pimienta.","Esparcir las rodajas de berenjena, los tomates,\r\nchalota en rodajas y pan plano crujiente en una\r\ntazón para servir. Vierta sobre el aderezo,\r\nespolvorear con el queso de cabra y\r\nesparcir sobre un pequeño cohete."]','2026-01-11 13:01:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14308,8254,'es','Cordero a la parrilla con ensalada de arroz invernal','Una cena llena de sabor y súper saludable. Las sobras también son excelentes para el almuerzo.','["2 cebollas rojas","1 cucharadita de canela","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","400 g de filete magro de cordero","140 g de arroz salvaje y basmati","un puñado de menta picada","un puñado de perejil picado","Paquete de 120 g de semillas de granada frescas.","50 g de pistachos picados","50 g de arándanos secos","jugo ½ naranja","jugo ½ limón"]','["Ralla 1 cebolla en un plato poco profundo.\r\nagrega la canela y ½ cucharada de aceite de oliva,\r\nluego mezclar. Coloque los filetes de cordero en el\r\nplato, frote con la marinada y luego cubra\r\ny reserva mientras haces el arroz.","Colocar el arroz y 600ml de agua en un\r\nsartén. Llevar a ebullición y luego bajar.\r\ny cocine a fuego lento, tapado, hasta que toda el agua\r\nse ha evaporado – unos 20 minutos. tomar\r\nRetire la tapa y enfríe. Picar finamente el\r\ncebolla morada restante y mezclar con la\r\narroz junto con las hierbas, granada,\r\npistachos y arándanos. Finalmente mezclar\r\nen el jugo de naranja y limón, el\r\naceite de oliva restante y sazonar bien.","Retire el cordero de la marinada,\r\nsacudiendo cualquier exceso. Plancha por aproximadamente\r\n5 minutos por cada lado, dependiendo de cómo\r\nte gusta la carne y sírvela con un\r\ncucharada grande de arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14309,8256,'es','Berenjenas a la plancha con aderezo de sésamo','Aliña berenjenas a la brasa con tahini, ajo, cilantro y yogur para obtener una guarnición vegetal versátil que puedes cocinar en la hornilla o en la barbacoa.','["2 berenjenas grandes, cortadas en rodajas de 2 cm","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","250 g de yogur griego desnatado","3 cucharadas de pasta tahini","1 diente de ajo grande, triturado","jugo 1 limon","un puñado de cilantro, perejil y menta picados, además de hojas adicionales para servir"]','["Unte cada rodaja de berenjena con un poco\r\naceite, luego sazonar. Calentar una plancha\r\no barbacoa. Cuando esté caliente, asar la\r\nrodajas de berenjena durante 2-3 minutos en cada una\r\nlado hasta que estén dorados y tiernos.","Mezclar el yogur con el tahini, el ajo,\r\njugo de limón y hierbas, luego sazone.\r\nCubra las berenjenas con el aderezo.\r\ny esparza sobre hojas de hierbas adicionales."]','2026-01-11 13:01:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14310,8258,'es','Puré de berenjena ahumada','Esto queda excelente si se sirve con carne o pollo a la parrilla y también es un almuerzo sencillo para vegetarianos.','["2 berenjenas medianas","jugo 1 limon","2-3 dientes de ajo machacados","Bote de 150 ml de yogur espeso","manojo pequeño de eneldo, hojas picadas"]','["Calienta la parrilla a muy caliente. Cortar las berenjenas en\r\nhasta la mitad a lo largo, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 25 minutos, volteando\r\nocasionalmente, hasta que esté suave – la piel permanecerá firme,\r\npero la carne se ablandará. Quitar las berenjenas\r\nla parrilla y déjelo hasta que esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo.","Con un cuchillo afilado, corte la carne asada.\r\ny sacar la pulpa con una cuchara. Inclínate hacia un\r\ntazón y triture con un tenedor hasta obtener una consistencia espesa.\r\npulpa. Incorpora el jugo de limón y el ajo. Añade el\r\nyogur y eneldo, y sazonar. Sirva mientras aún está caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14311,8260,'es','Panes planos de cordero con menta','Sirva estas pizzas al estilo turco para una cena sencilla y rápida para amigos','["400 g de carne picada de cordero","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 puñados de hojas de menta, medio picadas","2 tomates grandes, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","4 panes planos Khobez pequeños o 4 tortillas de harina suaves (puedes comprar panes planos Khobez en Sainsbury''s más grande)","4 cucharadas de yogur natural desnatado"]','["Cocine la carne picada de cordero durante 5-6 minutos en\r\nuna sartén antiadherente a fuego alto.\r\nCuando empiece a dorarse, agregue el ajo.\r\ny especias, luego cocine por 2-3 minutos más\r\nhasta que la carne esté dorada y no quede\r\nlíquido que queda en la sartén. Agregue lo picado\r\nmenta, tomates y algún condimento.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Organizar el\r\npanes planos en una bandeja para hornear y untar\r\nla mezcla de carne picada sobre ellos. Parrilla para\r\n2-3 minutos. Para servir esparcir por todo el\r\nhojas de menta y rociar con yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:01:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14312,8262,'es','Ensalada de cuscús de berenjena','Un puñado de hojas de menta realmente le da vida a esta ensalada, a las verduras les encantará, pero si necesitas un poco de carne, las chuletas de cordero son el complemento perfecto.','["1 berenjena grande, cortada en rodajas de 1 cm","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","140 g de cuscús","225 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","200 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","un puñado de hojas de menta, picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de queso de cabra firme, en cubos","jugo 1?2 limón"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Poner la berenjena en un\r\nbandeja para hornear, untar con aceite y sazonar. parrilla\r\ndurante unos 15 minutos, volteando y cepillando con\r\nmás aceite hasta la mitad, hasta que se dore y se ablande.","Mientras tanto, vierta el cuscús en una cacerola grande.\r\ntazón, vierta sobre el caldo, luego cubra y\r\ndejar actuar 10 min. Mezclar los tomates, la menta,\r\nel queso de cabra y el aceite restante juntos. pelusa\r\nel cuscús con un tenedor, luego agregue el\r\nberenjenas, mezcla de tomate y jugo de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:01:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14313,6511,'es','Receta fácil de hummus','Una suave salsa de garbanzos mezclada con tahini y ajo que es versátil y buena para ti; este hummus fácil es un excelente refrigerio o almuerzo.','["1 lata de 400 g de garbanzos, sin escurrir","1 cucharada de pasta de tahini","1 diente de ajo gordo, picado","3 cucharadas de yogur griego 0% grasa","buen jugo de limon exprimido"]','["Escurrir los garbanzos en un colador colocado sobre un bol o jarra para recoger el líquido. Coloca los garbanzos, el tahini, el ajo y el yogur en un procesador de alimentos o licuadora y bate hasta que quede suave. Agregue una cucharada del líquido de garbanzos a la vez hasta obtener una consistencia agradable, luego viértalos en un tazón, agregue un chorrito de jugo de limón y sazone al gusto."]','2026-01-11 13:01:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14314,8263,'es','Cordero asado a fuego lento con canela, hinojo y cítricos','Para un cordero que se deshará en tu boca y sorprenderá tu paladar, sigue la receta fácil de Sarah Cook','["1 pierna de cordero","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón y 1 naranja","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de miel clara","1 cucharada de canela, semillas de hinojo y comino molido","3 dientes de ajo machacados"]','["Coloque el cordero en una bolsa grande para comida con\r\ntodo el jugo y dejar marinar durante la noche.","Al día siguiente, sacar el cordero del\r\nRefrigera 1 hora antes de querer cocinarlo.\r\nCalentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Llevar\r\nel cordero fuera del adobo (reservar\r\nmarinada restante) y secar. Frote con\r\nla mitad del aceite y asar durante 15-20 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado. Retire el cordero y reduzca el horno.\r\na 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.","Mezclar la ralladura, el aceite restante, la miel,\r\nespecias y ajo con mucho condimento.\r\nColoque una hoja grande de papel para hornear sobre\r\nuna hoja grande de papel de aluminio. Sienta la pierna de cordero\r\nencima, frotar todo con la pasta y tirar\r\npor los lados del papel de aluminio. Rocíe la marinada\r\nen la base y apriete el papel de aluminio para sellar.","Ase durante 4 horas, hasta que esté muy tierno. Descanse,\r\ntodavía envuelto, durante 30 minutos. Desenvolver y\r\nservir con jugos."]','2026-01-11 13:01:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14315,8265,'es','Brochetas de pollo ahumado','Un canapé estilo tapas de brochetas de pollo marinadas y asadas, que se sirve mejor con salsa de mayonesa con ajo ahumado','["6 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel (aproximadamente 500 g/1 lb 2 oz)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de semilla de hinojo, triturada","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de pimentón dulce ahumado (pimentón)","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino tinto","alioli ahumado, para servir (consulte los consejos a continuación)"]','["Necesitas 15 brochetas: si son de madera, remojarlas\r\nen agua durante 10 min. cortar el pollo en\r\nTrozos de 3 cm y colocar en un bol. Añadir\r\n1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, las especias, el ajo y\r\nVinagre, revuelva bien y sazone. tu puedes\r\nHaga esto hasta un día antes y refrigere.","Enhebre 2-3 piezas en cada brocheta.\r\nVierta el aceite restante en una sartén o frote\r\nen una plancha. Calienta la sartén y\r\ndorar el pollo durante 3-4 minutos en cada uno\r\nlado: es posible que tengas que hacer esto en lotes,\r\nmantener calientes las brochetas cocidas en un\r\nhorno bajo. Sirva con alioli ahumado si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14316,8267,'es','Pollo asado con salsa cremosa de nueces','Esta salsa de inspiración turca es una maravillosa alternativa a la clásica salsa de pan.','["8 muslos de pollo, con piel y hueso","1 cucharadita de comino","½ cucharadita de pimentón","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","6 panes pita","150 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","175 g de nueces","1 cebolla pequeña, picada","2 dientes de ajo, picados","50ml de nata líquida","jugo 1 limon","un puñado de cilantro picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEn una fuente para asar, mezcle los\r\npollo, comino, pimentón, 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva\r\ny condimento. Cocine durante 40 minutos hasta que\r\nel pollo está crujiente y bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, rompa 1 pan de pita y\r\ncolóquelo en un tazón pequeño. Vierta sobre un par\r\nde caldo de pollo y dejar en remojo.\r\nFreír las nueces en una sartén durante\r\nunos 3 minutos hasta que esté dorado y tostado.\r\nDejar de lado. Calentar el aceite restante en el\r\nsartén y cocinar la cebolla y el ajo hasta\r\nsuavizado. Coloque el pan pita ablandado,\r\nmezcla de cebolla y la mayoría de las nueces en\r\nuna licuadora. Vierta sobre el resto del\r\ncaldo de pollo y mezcle hasta\r\nse forma una pasta rugosa. devolver la mezcla\r\na la sartén. Añade la nata y el limón.\r\nJugo, sazonar y mantener caliente.","Cuando el pollo esté cocido, disponer\r\nen un plato. Revuelva el cilantro\r\nla salsa y verter en un bol. Aproximadamente\r\nPicar las nueces restantes y esparcirlas.\r\nsobre el pollo. Tostar las pittas, cortarlas\r\nen gajos y servir junto"]','2026-01-11 13:01:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14317,8272,'es','Café con huevo vietnamita','Este café dulce para después de cenar es como beber tiramisú líquido y es nuestra nueva delicia con cafeína favorita.','["4 yemas de huevo","150ml de leche condensada","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 ml de espresso fuerte (aproximadamente 4 x espressos dobles)","chocolate amargo rallado (opcional)"]','["Pon las yemas de huevo, la leche condensada y el extracto de vainilla en un tazón grande. Batir con batidoras eléctricas durante al menos 5 minutos o hasta que esté pálido y espumoso.","Coloque 4 vasos o moldes resistentes al calor en tazones un poco más grandes que hayan sido llenos hasta la mitad con agua hirviendo (esto mantendrá caliente el café en los vasos por más tiempo).","Vierta el café recién hecho en los vasos, reservando 2 cucharadas, luego cubra con cucharadas de la mezcla de huevo. Rocíe el resto del café encima para que manche la cobertura y se hunda. Esparza una pizca de chocolate amargo rallado, si lo desea. Servir inmediatamente, con cucharas."]','2026-01-11 13:01:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14318,8274,'es','Hamburguesas vietnamitas de cerdo y maní','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Mezcle su menú de entre semana con estas hamburguesas de estilo asiático, hechas con carne picada de cerdo y condimentadas con salsa de ostras, jengibre y lima.','["500 g de carne picada de cerdo","2 cucharadas de salsa de ostras","6 cebolletas, peladas y finamente picadas (tanto la parte verde como la blanca)","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","½ -1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1 lima, rallada y cortada en gajos","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo o girasol","hojas de lechuga iceberg o Baby Gem, para servir","4 panes de hamburguesa con sésamo","25 g de maní tostado sin sal, picado en trozos grandes","mayonesa o salsa de chile dulce, para servir (opcional)"]','["En un tazón grande, mezcle la carne de cerdo, la salsa de ostras, las cebolletas, el jengibre, las hojuelas de chile y la ralladura de lima. Forma 4 hamburguesas con la mezcla con las manos. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio, agrega las hamburguesas y cocina durante 8 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén bien cocidas.","Para servir, coloque hojas de lechuga en las mitades inferiores de los panecillos y exprímalas con un poco de jugo de limón. Agrega las hamburguesas, espolvorea sobre el maní y cubre con las mitades superiores de los panecillos. Sirva con las rodajas de lima restantes y mayonesa o salsa de chile dulce, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14319,8276,'es','Cerdo caramelizado al estilo vietnamita','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Saltee trozos de carne de cerdo con chalotas, jengibre y chile en un wok y luego agregue salsa de pescado y azúcar moreno para obtener una salsa dulce, pegajosa y picante.','["1½ cucharada de aceite de maní","500 g de filetes de paleta de cerdo, cortados en trozos pequeños","2 chalotes, finamente picados","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente rallado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","75 g de azúcar moreno","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado y más al gusto","1-2 cucharaditas de salsa de chile (nosotros usamos sriracha)","4 cebolletas, partidas por la mitad y ralladas a lo largo","arroz al vapor, para servir","pak choi, para servir"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en un wok a fuego alto y sofríe la carne de cerdo en tandas hasta que se dore por completo. Retirar con una espumadera y reservar.","Baje el fuego y agregue el aceite restante, luego agregue las chalotas, el jengibre y la guindilla. Cocine a fuego lento durante un par de minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Añade el azúcar, la salsa de pescado y 200 ml de agua a la cacerola y revuelve todo. Llevar a ebullición, revolviendo para que el azúcar se disuelva, luego devolver la carne de cerdo a la sartén. Burbujee vigorosamente durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que la salsa se espese para cubrir la carne y se vuelva brillante. Pruebe y agregue un poco más de salsa de pescado, si es necesario, junto con la salsa de chile. Espolvorea con las cebolletas y sirve con arroz al vapor y pak choi."]','2026-01-11 13:01:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14320,8278,'es','Panceta de cerdo pegajosa con ensalada estilo vietnamita y maní triturado','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Saborea la carne de cerdo con hoisin, miel, soja y jengibre y sírvela con una crujiente ensalada de pepino, rábano y hierbas con un picante aderezo de chile.','["600 g de panceta de cerdo","6 cucharadas de salsa hoisin","3 cucharadas de miel clara","3 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja","4 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","2½ cm de jengibre, pelado y finamente picado","Arroz con coco, para servir (ver consejo a continuación)","¼ de pepino, cortado en tiras con un pelador de verduras","6 rábanos, rebanados","75 g de guisantes dulces, cortados por la mitad horizontalmente","2 cebolletas, en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de hojas de menta, hojas grandes cortadas","2 cucharadas de albahaca tailandesa, hojas grandes cortadas (use cilantro si no puede encontrarlo)","1 cucharada de maní salado, tostado y ligeramente machacado en un mortero","1 chile rojo pequeño, finamente picado","½ diente de ajo rallado","jugo ½ lima (sobrante de pasteles de cangrejo)","1½ cucharadita de azúcar moreno claro","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz"]','["Retire la cáscara de la carne de cerdo y coloque la carne en una bolsa de comida grande con cierre hermético o en una cacerola. En un bol mezclar el hoisin, la miel, el vinagre, la soja, el ketchup y el jengibre, luego verter sobre la carne de cerdo y masajear bien. Sellar la bolsa o tapar el recipiente y dejar marinar en el frigorífico durante al menos 4 horas, o toda la noche.","Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Transfiera la carne de cerdo y su marinada a una fuente para asar ajustada, forrada con papel de aluminio. Vierta 50 ml de agua, cubra con papel de aluminio y ase durante 2 horas o hasta que estén tiernos, rociándolos a la mitad. Saque la carne de cerdo y aumente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Retire el papel de aluminio y vierta la salsa en una cacerola pequeña. Lleve la salsa a ebullición y déjela burbujear hasta que esté espesa y almibarada. Unte un poco de salsa por toda la carne de cerdo y vuelva a meterla en el horno, sin tapar, durante 20 minutos hasta que esté pegajosa y caramelizada en algunos lugares. Transfiera a una tabla de cortar, cubra ligeramente con papel de aluminio y déjelo reposar durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, prepara la ensalada. Mezcle todos los ingredientes, excepto el maní, en un tazón. Para hacer el aderezo, combine todos los ingredientes y reserve. Vuelva a calentar el resto de la salsa, añadiendo un chorrito de agua si se ha vuelto demasiado espesa. Mezcle el aderezo con la ensalada y divídalo en 2 platos, luego cubra con el maní triturado. Corta la carne de cerdo en rodajas gruesas, colócala junto a la ensalada y luego rocíala con la salsa. Sirva con arroz con coco (consulte el consejo a continuación)."]','2026-01-11 13:01:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14321,8280,'es','Ensalada de cerdo vietnamita','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. La ensalada vietnamita de Tom Kime se puede preparar con anticipación, lo que le permitirá relajarse en una cálida tarde de verano.','["1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","jugo de 2 limones","1 chile rojo fresco, sin semillas y finamente picado","un puñado de tallos o raíces de cilantro, picados","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo, salsa de pescado tailandesa y salsa de soja ligera","50 g de semillas de sésamo, tostadas en seco hasta que estén doradas","500 g de lomo de cerdo, sin grasa","aceite vegetal, para cepillar","¼ de col blanca, rallada","1 pepino, cortado en palitos","5 tallos de apio, cortados en palitos","3 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 tallos recortados de limoncillo, finamente cortados","ralladura de 1 lima","un puñado de hojas de cilantro y de menta, picadas"]','["El día anterior: hacer el aliño. Poner el azúcar y el jugo de lima en una cacerola con 1 cucharada de agua y llevar a ebullición para disolver el azúcar. Agrega el chile y el cilantro y revuelve bien, luego licúa en una licuadora hasta que quede suave. Vierta en un tazón, luego agregue el aceite de sésamo, la salsa de pescado, la salsa de soja y las semillas de sésamo para hacer un aderezo. Cubra y enfríe hasta que sea necesario.","Dos horas antes de servir: calentar una plancha. Precalentar el horno a 200C/gas 6/ventilador 180C. Unte la carne de cerdo con aceite y cocine a la plancha por todos lados durante unos minutos hasta que se dore. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear y colóquelo en el horno durante unos 10-12 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido. Deje enfriar y corte en rodajas finas a contrapelo de la carne. Vierta en un bol y vierta sobre la mitad del aderezo.","Para servir: mezcle los ingredientes restantes de la ensalada en un tazón con el aderezo restante. Colóquelos en una fuente, cubra con las rodajas de cerdo y vierta sobre el jugo."]','2026-01-11 13:01:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14322,8282,'es','Bollos de cerdo a la barbacoa','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Más sabrosa que una comida para llevar y excelente para picar y compartir. Estos dim sum impresionarán a tus invitados.','["85 g de azúcar","Paquete de 500 g de mezcla para pan blanco.","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","12 lonchas de tocino rayado, tocino o panceta sin ahumar, picados","jengibre en trozos, pelado y picado","2 dientes de ajo, picados","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","3 cucharadas de miel clara","3 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 huevo batido, para glasear"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas. Mezcle el azúcar con la mezcla para pan en un tazón grande, luego agregue agua como se indica en el paquete. Junte la masa con una cuchara de madera, luego amase sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada durante 5 minutos hasta que quede suave. Poner en un bol grande, cubrir con film transparente engrasado y dejar en un lugar cálido hasta que doble su tamaño.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén y luego fríe el tocino hasta que esté crujiente, unos 5 minutos. Agrega el jengibre y el ajo y sofríe durante 1 minuto hasta que estén tiernos, luego agrega el puré de soja, miel y tomate y revuelve bien. Se puede realizar con hasta 3 días de anticipación.","Saque la masa y amase brevemente, luego forme 12 bolas del mismo tamaño. Aplana con las manos y luego coloca una gota de relleno del tamaño de una cucharadita en el medio. Levante la masa y ciérrela como si fuera un bolso, luego dé la vuelta al panecillo y colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear grande. Cubrir con film transparente engrasado y dejar reposar durante unos 30 minutos hasta que la masa se sienta esponjosa. Pincelar con huevo y hornear durante 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Sirva caliente con salsa para mojar. Se puede congelar después del segundo aumento por hasta 1 mes o hornear hasta un día antes y volver a calentar."]','2026-01-11 13:01:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14323,8284,'es','Cerdo asiático con ensalada de fideos de arroz','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una cena entre semana llena de color, especias y todo lo bueno, y lista en solo 20 minutos.','["1 cucharadita de pasta de limoncillo (nosotros usamos Bart''s)","1 cucharadita de raíz de jengibre fresco finamente rallado","½ chile rojo, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol","3 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","4 chuletas de cerdo","200 g de fideos de arroz finos","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","½ pepino","un puñado de hojas de menta picadas"]','["Mezcle la pasta de limoncillo, el jengibre, la guindilla, el aceite y 1 cucharada de salsa de pescado. Unte la mezcla sobre las chuletas de cerdo y luego déjelas marinar mientras prepara la ensalada.","Coloca los fideos en un tazón grande. Vierta agua hirviendo sobre una tetera y déjelo reposar durante 5 minutos hasta que los fideos estén suaves (o prepárelos según las instrucciones del paquete). Escurrir los fideos en un colador. Pasar bajo el grifo de agua fría hasta que se enfríe, luego escurrir nuevamente y verter nuevamente en el recipiente. Batir las 2 cucharadas restantes de salsa de pescado con la ralladura de lima, el jugo y el azúcar. Vierta sobre los fideos fríos. Corta el pepino en tiras finas y luego revuélvelo en la ensalada junto con las hojas de menta.","Calienta una sartén hasta que esté humeante. Cocine las chuletas a la plancha durante 5 minutos por cada lado o hasta que estén bien cocidas, luego sírvalas junto con la ensalada de fideos."]','2026-01-11 13:01:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14324,8286,'es','Wraps de pollo vietnamita','Rellene tortillas de harina suaves con pollo frito, pepino ligeramente encurtido y zanahoria para un almuerzo o cena al estilo asiático.','["½ pepino, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas","1 zanahoria pequeña, rallada","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","8 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en tiras finas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","25 g de jengibre (peso pelado), finamente rallado","3 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","8 tortillas de harina mini o 4 grandes suaves","2 lechugas Little Gem, con las hojas separadas y cortadas por la mitad"]','["Pon el pepino, la zanahoria y el vinagre en un bol pequeño y reserva. Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén grande, agrega el pollo y fríelo a fuego medio hasta que esté dorado y bien cocido. Retirar y reservar. Vierte el aceite restante en la sartén y baja el fuego. Agregue el ajo y el jengibre y cocine durante 2 minutos hasta que se ablanden pero no tomen color. Agregue el azúcar, la salsa de soja y 150 ml de agua y deje hervir durante 5 minutos hasta que esté picante. Regrese el pollo a la sartén y caliéntelo.","Calienta las tortillas siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Cubra las tortillas con la lechuga, el pollo y el pepino y la zanahoria encurtidos."]','2026-01-11 13:01:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14325,8288,'es','Ensalada de ternera al estilo vietnamita','Aligere la carne picada con esta ensalada de fideos de inspiración asiática con zanahorias crujientes, brotes de soja y maní triturado.','["500 g de carne picada","2 chiles rojos, 1 finamente picado y el otro en rodajas finas","4 dientes de ajo machacados","100 ml de salsa de ostras","3 limas, jugo de 2, 1 cortada en gajos","Bolsa de 300 g de fideos de arroz cocidos","3 zanahorias, cortadas en juliana fina","Bolsa de 300 g de brotes de soja.","manojo pequeño de menta, hojas recogidas","50 g de maní sin sal, picados en trozos grandes"]','["Fríe la carne en seco en una sartén hasta que esté bien dorada y comience a estar crujiente, luego retira la grasa. Agrega la guindilla picada y el ajo y sofríe unos minutos más. Agregue la salsa de ostras y el jugo de limón y cocine por otros 5 minutos hasta que esté pegajoso.","Para preparar la ensalada, divida los fideos de arroz en tazones, cubra con la carne y luego coloque un puñado de zanahoria, brotes de soja y hojas de menta alrededor de cada tazón. Espolvorea con maní y el chile en rodajas. Antes de comer, mezcle todos los ingredientes."]','2026-01-11 13:01:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14326,8290,'es','Trucha caramelizada vietnamita','Una base de caramelo equilibra los ingredientes picantes y salados de este plato de pescado de inspiración asiática para dos personas.','["50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado tailandesa","1 chile rojo, finamente cortado","trozo grande de jengibre, finamente cortado","2 filetes de trucha arcoiris","2 cabezas de bok choi, cortadas a la mitad","jugo ½ limón","ramitas de cilantro","arroz al vapor, para servir"]','["Ponga el azúcar en una cacerola grande y poco profunda, junto con un chorrito de agua. Calentar suavemente, moviendo la sartén, hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Aumente el fuego y burbujee el almíbar hasta que adquiera un color ámbar oscuro. Agregue la salsa de pescado, la mayor parte del chile y el jengibre, luego agregue 1 cucharada de agua para diluir. Hierva nuevamente hasta que esté espeso, luego agregue los filetes de pescado, con la piel hacia abajo, y el bok choi, con el lado cortado hacia abajo.","Cubra la sartén con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 4-5 minutos hasta que el pescado esté cocido y el bok choi se haya marchitado. Apagar el fuego, exprimir sobre el limón y espolvorear con el resto de la guindilla, el jengibre y las ramitas de cilantro. Servir con arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14327,8292,'es','Baguettes de pollo vietnamita (Bhan Mi)','Rellena tu sándwich con pollo, zanahoria, pepino, cebolleta y aderezo de chile dulce para darle un toque asiático.','["1 pechuga de pollo pequeña","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de vinagre de arroz","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","jugo ½ lima","½ zanahoria pequeña, pelada y rallada","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","Pieza de pepino de 2½ cm, sin semillas y en rodajas","½ chile rojo, cortado en rodajas finas","1 baguette tipo sándwich","3-4 hojas de lechuga Little Gem, lavadas","1-2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce"]','["Coloque la pechuga de pollo entre 2 trozos de\r\nfilm transparente y golpear con un rodillo hasta aproximadamente\r\n1 cm de espesor. Calienta una plancha hasta que esté caliente. Frote el\r\npollo con el aceite, cocinar durante 2-3 minutos por lado,\r\no hasta que esté bien cocido. Dejar enfriar.","Mezclar el vinagre de arroz, el azúcar y la lima.\r\njugo, revolviendo hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Añade el\r\nzanahoria, cebolletas, pepino y guindilla.","Divida una barra de pan tipo sándwich por la parte superior. Cosas\r\ncon las hojas de Gemita y desmenuzar el pollo\r\nencima. Apilar sobre la mezcla de zanahoria y envolver o\r\ncolocar en una caja de plástico. Pon la salsa de chile dulce.\r\nen una pequeña olla portátil y cuando llegue el momento de\r\nalmuerzo, vierta sobre la salsa justo antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 13:01:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14328,8294,'es','Ensalada de mariscos vietnamita','Un aderezo picante y picante convierte una bolsa de pescado descongelado y algunos ingredientes frescos en una cena estupenda y para sentirse bien que está lista en solo 10 minutos.','["Paquete de 400 g de mezcla de mariscos cocidos","Paquete de 300 g de fideos de arroz finos cocidos","Paquete de 300 g de brotes de soja cocidos","3 zanahorias, en rodajas finas","1 manojo de cebolletas, cortadas a lo largo","manojo de menta y cilantro, hojas picadas","5 cucharadas de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 chile rojo, picado","1 barra de limoncillo, en rodajas","1 cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sodio"]','["Para hacer la ensalada, ponga todas las verduras y mariscos en un tazón grande, reservando algunas hierbas para la parte superior. Mezclar todo para que se combinen los mariscos y los fideos.","Prepare el aderezo mezclando todos los ingredientes, mézclelo con la ensalada, luego divídalo en 5 tazones hondos o apílelo en un plato grande y deje que todos se sirvan solos. Esparza las hierbas reservadas por encima para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14329,4859,'es','Ensalada de gambas vietnamita','Inspirada en el plato vietnamita Bun xao, esta ensalada de sabor fresco tiene muy poca grasa pero es muy saciante.','["1 diente de ajo pequeño, finamente picado","1 chile rojo pequeño, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","jugo 2 limones","250 g de fideos de arroz finos","Paquete de 150 g de langostinos tigre cocidos, cortados por la mitad a lo largo del lomo","½ pepino, pelado, sin semillas y cortado en palitos","1 zanahoria, cortada en palitos o rallada","6 cebolletas, ralladas","un puñado de hojas de cilantro y/o menta","1 cucharada de maní tostado, picado"]','["Para hacer el aderezo, machaca el ajo,\r\nchile y azúcar con un mortero.\r\nAñade el jugo de lima y 3 cucharadas de agua y\r\nrevuelva juntos. Dejar de lado.","Enciende la tetera, pon los fideos en\r\nun bol y luego cubrir con agua hirviendo.\r\nDejar reposar 10 minutos hasta que esté tierno.\r\nluego escurrir y dividir en 2 tazones.\r\n3 Mezcle las gambas y las verduras y\r\ndivídalo también entre los tazones. Terminar por\r\ncubriendo cada ensalada con las hierbas y\r\nmaní, luego vierta sobre el aderezo\r\npara servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14330,8296,'es','Ensalada de pollo vietnamita','Una ensalada de plato principal sin cocción con todos los sabores ligeros y fragantes del sudeste asiático, como maní, chile, menta y soja.','["140 g de fideos de arroz tailandeses","1 zanahoria","½ pepino","2 pechugas de pollo cocidas, desmenuzadas","50 g de rábanos, en rodajas finas","½ cebolla morada, cortada finamente","manojo pequeño de menta, hojas recogidas","25 g de maní tostado natural, picado en trozos grandes","1 chile rojo pequeño, sin semillas y finamente picado","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","1½ cucharada de salsa de pescado, salsa de soja baja en sodio y aceite de sésamo"]','["Para hacer el aderezo, bata todo el\r\ningredientes juntos en una porción grande\r\ncuenco. Cocine los fideos del siguiente paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, luego escurrir y agregar a la\r\nbol con el aderezo.","Pele la zanahoria en tiras largas usando\r\nun pelador de verduras. Haz lo mismo para el\r\npepino, hasta llegar a las semillas\r\n(deséchelos). Agrega la zanahoria y\r\npepino a la mezcla de fideos junto\r\ncon el pollo desmenuzado, los rábanos,\r\ncebolla morada y menta. Mezcle bien para cubrir\r\nen el aderezo, esparcir sobre el maní\r\ny servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14331,8298,'es','Calamares a la sal y pimienta','Una capa crujiente y picante y unos calamares tiernos y picantes forman una combinación irresistible','["85 g de harina de maíz","85 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de pimienta negra molida","2 cucharadas de granos de pimienta de Szechuan molidos, triturados aproximadamente","aceite de girasol o vegetal, para freír","400 g de calamares, limpios y cortados en tiras (ver consejos a continuación)","cebolla tierna finamente picada y chile verde, para servir","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","medio pepino, finamente picado","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","100 ml de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado"]','["Para hacer la salsa, mezcle todos los ingredientes en un tazón pequeño hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, luego reserve. Mezcle la harina de maíz y la harina común con ambos pimientos y 2 cucharaditas de sal marina en un tazón grande, luego reserve. Forra una bandeja con papel de cocina y asegúrate de tener más sal para espolvorear.","Calentar unos 7 cm de aceite a 180 ° C en una freidora, wok o sartén honda. Si no tienes termómetro, puedes probarlo con un cubo de pan; debería dorarse en 20 segundos. Cubra bien los calamares con la mezcla de harina y fríalos en tandas durante unos 2 minutos cada uno o hasta que estén crujientes. Utilizar una espumadera para sacar los calamares, luego escurrirlos sobre papel de cocina y espolvorear con un poco más de sal. Sirva los calamares espolvoreados con la cebolleta y la guindilla, con la salsa para mojar a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14332,8300,'es','Ensalada picante de zanahoria, col lombarda y cebolla','Esta ensalada otoñal es una guarnición fresca y saludable y queda excelente si se sirve con halloumi a la parrilla o hamburguesas.','["4 zanahorias, cortadas en palitos finos o ralladas","½ col lombarda, finamente rallada","2 cebollas moradas pequeñas, finamente cortadas","un puñado de hojas de menta","un puñado de hojas de cilantro","un puñado de maní tostado, picado en trozos grandes","jugo 2 limones","1 cucharada de aceite de maní","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave"]','["Coloca las zanahorias, el repollo y la cebolla en\r\nun cuenco. Hacer el aderezo revolviendo el\r\ningredientes juntos hasta que el azúcar se haya\r\ndisuelto. Vierta sobre la ensalada, revolviendo\r\nverduras en el aderezo. Agrega las hierbas,\r\nmezcle nuevamente y luego esparza sobre los maní."]','2026-01-11 13:01:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14333,8302,'es','Ensalada crujiente de fideos con gambas','Es mejor preparar este aderezo al estilo vietnamita justo antes de servirlo para conservar el color vibrante de la menta.','["100 g de fideos de arroz","100 g de guisantes dulces, rallados","2 zanahorias, ralladas gruesas","100 g de espinacas tiernas","85 g de gambas peladas y cocidas, descongeladas si están congeladas","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","3 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","1 cucharada de menta picada en trozos grandes"]','["Vierta agua hirviendo sobre los fideos para cubrirlos.\r\ndejar actuar durante 4 minutos y luego enfriar en frío\r\nagua. Escurrir bien. Mezclar los dulces,\r\nzanahorias, espinacas, fideos y gambas en\r\nun recipiente poco profundo. Mezclar el aderezo\r\ningredientes hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto,\r\nvierta sobre la ensalada, luego mezcle todo\r\njuntos. Servir de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14334,8304,'es','Rollitos de verano de gambas vietnamitas','Rollos de papel de arroz de sabor fresco llenos de mariscos, fideos ligeros, zanahorias, pepino y hierbas, con una salsa dulce de jengibre y chile','["2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 chile rojo pequeño (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante), finamente picado","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente picado","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","3 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","jugo 1 lima","100 g de fideos de arroz o fideos de hilo de frijol","Envoltorios redondos de papel de arroz de 12 x 20 cm (consulte el consejo a continuación)","un puñado de hojas de menta","18 langostinos cocidos, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","2-3 hojas grandes de lechuga iceberg, cortadas en 12 trozos","1 zanahoria, cortada en bastones finos","un puñado de cilantro","un puñado de albahaca tailandesa","un puñado de cebollino largo","50 g de brotes de soja"]','["Prepare la salsa para mojar\r\nmachacando el ajo, la guindilla,\r\njengibre y azúcar juntos\r\nusando un mortero y luego revuelva\r\nen la salsa de pescado y el jugo de lima.\r\nAlternativamente, simplemente bombardea todo\r\njuntos en una mini licuadora.","Remojar los fideos de arroz en\r\nun recipiente con agua caliente para\r\n15 minutos, luego escurrir bien.\r\nMontar todo el relleno preparado.\r\ningredientes – una vez que empieces,\r\nnecesitarás tener todo a mano.","Cuando estés listo para hacer\r\nlos rollitos, mojar uno de arroz\r\npapeles en un recipiente con agua caliente,\r\nmoviéndolo hasta que todo\r\nel envoltorio está suave – unos 10-15 segundos\r\n– luego escurrir sobre un paño de cocina.","Colocar un envoltorio de papel de arroz.\r\nen una tabla y en un borde\r\ndel envoltorio, añadir un poco de menta\r\nhojas, luego tres mitades de gambas.","Coloca un poco de lechuga encima\r\nde las gambas, seguido de\r\nunos fideos, unas tiras de\r\nzanahoria y pepino, un poco más\r\nhierbas y finalmente unos brotes de soja.\r\nNo llenes demasiado los panqueques o\r\nSerá difícil rodar.","Levanta el borde del arroz.\r\nenvoltorio de papel más cercano\r\na ti sobre el relleno\r\ny, sosteniendo el relleno\r\nposición con los dedos,\r\nEmpiece a enrollar con fuerza.","Cuando estés a mitad de camino,\r\ndoblar los extremos del papel de arroz\r\ndentro y sobre el relleno para que\r\nestá completamente cerrado.","Continúe rodando con fuerza hasta\r\nel envoltorio entero de papel de arroz\r\nestá enrollado. Para servir, cortar el\r\nrueda por la mitad en diagonal."]','2026-01-11 13:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14335,8306,'es','Ensalada crujiente de col asiática y gambas','Este plato principal sin cocción está repleto de ingredientes buenos para ti.','["250 g/9 oz de col china","175g/60z de col blanca","2 palitos de apio","2 zanahorias","un puñado pequeño de menta, picada","un puñado pequeño de cilantro picado","200 g de gambas grandes cocidas y peladas","4 cucharadas de maní tostado, picado","1-2 chiles rojos pequeños, en rodajas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","3 cucharadas de jugo de lima","3 cucharadas de salsa de pescado"]','["Triture las coles, el apio y la zanahoria.\r\nfinamente sobre una mandolina o rallarlos por la\r\nagujeros más grandes en un rallador. Agrega la menta\r\ny cilantro a las verduras junto\r\ncon las gambas. Mezcle todo junto.","Hacer el aderezo batiendo todo el\r\ningredientes juntos. Viste la ensalada\r\ny volcarlo en un bol, espolvorear sobre el\r\nmaní y servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14336,8308,'es','Ensalada vietnamita de gambas y fideos con chalotas crujientes','Hacer chalotes fritos para esta ensalada súper saludable es opcional, pero vale la pena: son increíblemente deliciosos.','["200 g de fideos de arroz finos","200 g de gambas grandes cocidas y peladas","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada por la mitad y en rodajas","1 chile rojo pequeño, en rodajas","1 pepino pequeño, afeitado en tiras (use un pelador)","1 puñado grande de cilantro y menta","2 cucharadas de maní tostado, picado en trozos grandes","jugo 3 limones","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","2 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","5 chalotes, en rodajas finas","aceite vegetal, para freír","harina, para espolvorear"]','["Para las chalotas crujientes, calentar 5 cm de aceite.\r\nhasta que esté caliente en un wok. Sabrás que el aceite es\r\nlo suficientemente caliente cuando un trozo de chalota\r\nchisporrotea tan pronto como se deja caer.\r\nlas rodajas de chalota con harina, sacudir\r\nsobrante y sofreír en el aceite hasta que estén doradas. ellos\r\nfreír rápidamente, aproximadamente 1 min. Drenaje en la cocina\r\npapel, espolvorear con sal y reservar.","Para hacer el aderezo, mezcla la lima.\r\nzumo, azúcar, salsa de pescado y ajo y cuaja\r\na un lado. En un tazón grande, vierta hirviendo\r\nagua sobre los fideos. Déjalos para\r\n2 minutos o hasta que estén recién cocidos, luego\r\nenjuague con agua fría. Escurrir bien, agitando\r\nel tamiz varias veces para sacar el\r\nexceso de agua, luego colóquelo nuevamente en el\r\ncuenco. Añade las gambas, la cebolla, la guindilla y el pepino.\r\ny hierbas. Vierta el aderezo, mezcle,\r\nluego espolvorea con las chalotas y el maní."]','2026-01-11 13:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14337,8310,'es','Paquetes de verduras vietnamitas','¿Te apetece algo un poco diferente? Prueba estos saludables paquetes de verduras, a base de rollitos vietnamitas','["Paquete de 2 tortitas de harina de arroz de 50 g","50 g de fideos de arroz finos","1 pechuga de pollo cocida y sin piel, desmenuzada","1 zanahoria, cortada finamente","½ pepino, finamente rallado","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado finamente","Lechuga Baby Gem, cilantro y hojas de menta, para servir","4 cucharadas de salsa de pescado tailandesa","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino de arroz","exprimir lima","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas"]','["Remojar las tortitas en harina de arroz según pack\r\ninstrucciones o en agua hirviendo durante 30 segundos. Quitar\r\ny dejar enfriar sobre papel de cocina. Remojar los fideos de arroz\r\nsegún las instrucciones del paquete, luego escurrir y cortar\r\nen tiras de 2 cm.","Coloque una tortita de arroz sobre una tabla y coloque un poco\r\nfideos de arroz, pollo, verduras y hojas de hierbas\r\naproximadamente un tercio de la altura, dejando un borde de 1 cm en\r\nel lado. Dobla los lados sobre las verduras y luego\r\nenrollar a lo largo para hacer un cigarro. Conservar en el frigorífico,\r\ncubierto con papel de cocina húmedo por hasta 1 día.","Mezclar los ingredientes para la salsa.\r\nsalsa y poner en un bol. Para servir, disponga la\r\nrueda en un plato junto con las hojas y las hierbas.\r\nPara comer, envuelva cada rollo en un trozo de lechuga con una\r\nramita de hierbas y mojar en la salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14338,6124,'es','Ensalada asiática de gambas y piña','Esta ensalada de plato principal sin cocción se puede mezclar y servir sola o con arroz al vapor o fideos hervidos.','["1 piña pequeña o 350 g de piña en trozos","140 g de brotes de soja","250 g de langostinos cocidos","½ pepino, pelado, sin semillas y cortado en ángulo","200 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","un puñado de hojas de menta, picadas muy toscamente","50 g de anacardos sin sal, tostados si quieres","½ chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","1 diente de ajo","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","jugo 2 limones","1½ cucharadita de salsa de pescado"]','["Triture la guindilla, el ajo y el azúcar para\r\nuna pasta usando un mortero o\r\npequeño procesador. Agrega el jugo de lima.\r\ny salsa de pescado, luego reserve.","Pelar, cortar en cuartos, descorazonar y cortar en rodajas la piña.\r\nen ángulo. Mezcle con los brotes de soja,\r\ngambas, pepino y tomate y unas\r\ndel aderezo. Apilar en tazones y esparcir\r\ncon menta y anacardos. Rocíe con el\r\nresto del aderezo y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14339,8312,'es','Ensalada de fideos','Ensalada fresca y saludable para un picnic','["½ paquete de 250 g de fideos de arroz medianos","200 g de guisantes dulces, cortados a lo largo","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas en diagonal","paquete de cilantro, cortado en trozos grandes","Paquete de 150 g de salmón desmenuzado ahumado en caliente","pretzel o panecillo, para servir","3 cucharadas de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de miel clara","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","1 cucharada de aceite de maní o girasol","1 diente de ajo gordito, finamente rallado","jengibre de raíz perilla, rallado grueso"]','["Coloque los fideos en un tazón grande y luego viértalos con suficiente agua hirviendo para cubrirlos. Vierta los caramelos de azúcar en rodajas y déjelos durante 4 minutos. Escurrir en un colador, poner bajo agua corriente fría para que se enfríe y luego escurrir nuevamente. Vierta en un tazón y agregue el aceite de sésamo.","Mezclar los ingredientes del aderezo. Apile cebolletas, cilantro y salmón sobre los fideos, vierta sobre el aderezo y mezcle todo. Sirva con un pretzel o panecillo."]','2026-01-11 13:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14340,8314,'es','Ensalada asiática de pollo con menta','Anímate a una ensalada de pollo, hazla mentolada y luego agrega algunos sabores asiáticos.','["Paquete de 250 g de fideos de arroz finos","2 pechugas de pollo cocidas y sin piel, desmenuzadas","½ pepino, partido por la mitad y en rodajas","3 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","4 cucharadas de salsa de soja o pescado","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","Paquete de 20 g de menta, solo las hojas, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Remoja los fideos durante 5 minutos en agua hirviendo o según las instrucciones del paquete, hasta que se ablanden. Escurrir y luego enfriar bajo el grifo. Escurrir bien nuevamente y luego verter en un tazón grande junto con el pollo, el pepino, las cebolletas y la guindilla.","Mezcle la salsa de soja o pescado, la ralladura de lima, el jugo y el azúcar, luego vierta sobre los fideos. Mezcle las hojas de menta y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14341,6042,'es','Rollitos de primavera de gambas','Estos bocados saludables son un excelente almuerzo o refrigerio ligero con un tazón pequeño de salsa de chile dulce.','["1 manojo de fideos de arroz secos (unos 60 g)","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","Paquete de 300 g de verduras frescas salteadas; opte por una mezcla de hojas","raíz de jengibre fresco, de medio dedo, rallado","manojo pequeño de cilantro, tallos finamente cortados y hojas picadas en trozos grandes","200 g de gambas crudas peladas y partidas por la mitad","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce, y más para servir","8 láminas pequeñas de masa filo","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. Cocer\r\nlos fideos según las instrucciones del paquete.\r\nCalentar 1 cucharadita de aceite en un wok grande o en una sartén antiadherente.\r\nsartén. Sofreír las verduras, el jengibre y\r\ntallos de cilantro durante 3-4 minutos hasta que casi\r\ncocido, pero todavía con un poco de crujiente. tirar en\r\nlos langostinos durante 1 minuto hasta que estén rosados, luego agregue el\r\nsalsa de chile dulce, hojas de cilantro y\r\nfideos, luego retirar del fuego.","Pincelar 4 láminas de filo con un poco de aceite,\r\nluego cubra con las hojas restantes. apilar un\r\ncuarto de la mezcla de gambas a lo largo del estrecho\r\nborde de cada hoja, doble los bordes y luego\r\nenrolle para obtener 4 rollitos de primavera grandes. Estos\r\nahora se puede congelar hasta por 1 mes; descongelar\r\nbien antes de cocinar como se muestra a continuación. cepillo\r\ncon el aceite restante, espolvorear con sésamo\r\nsemillas si las usa, luego hornee en una bandeja para hornear,\r\ncon la costura hacia abajo, durante 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y\r\ncrujiente. Servir con una ensalada verde y una buena\r\nuna cucharada de salsa de chile extra a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14342,8316,'es','Ensalada de pato oriental','¿Quién dice que una cena de pato tiene que ser cara? Haz que tu carne llegue más lejos con esta ensalada llena de sabor','["1 pierna de pato","1 cucharadita de polvo de cinco especias chinas","140 g de fideos de arroz","1 rama de apio, cortada en palitos","1 zanahoria, cortada en palitos","½ pepino, sin semillas y cortado en palitos","2 cebolletas, cortadas a lo largo","2 cucharadas de salsa hoisin","1 cucharada de salsa de soja"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nFrote toda la pierna de pato con\r\ncinco especias y condimentos, colocar en\r\nen una bandeja para hornear y asar durante 25 minutos.","Mientras tanto, cocina los fideos de arroz.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Drenar\r\ny enfriar con agua corriente fría,\r\nluego escurrir bien nuevamente y tirar\r\ncon apio, zanahoria, pepino\r\ny cebolletas. cuando esté frío\r\nsuficiente para manipular, retire el\r\ncarne de pato y piel crujiente de\r\nel hueso y desmenuzar finamente.","Para hacer el aderezo, mezcle\r\nel hoisin y la salsa de soja con\r\n2 cucharadas de agua. dividir los fideos\r\nentre dos placas y la parte superior\r\ncon el pato desmenuzado. llovizna\r\nsobre el aderezo y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14343,8318,'es','Ensalada de gambas bang bang','Lista en 20 minutos, esta deliciosa ensalada se puede preparar fácilmente con pollo si no te apetece mariscos.','["140 g de fideos de arroz planos","3 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní crujiente","4 cucharadas de leche de coco semidescremada","3 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","3 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","1 pepino, pelado, cortado por la mitad a lo largo, sin semillas y en rodajas","Paquete de 300 g de brotes de soja.","Paquete de 200 g de gambas cocidas peladas"]','["Cocine los fideos del siguiente paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, luego enjuague con agua fría\r\ny escurrir bien. En una cacerola pequeña\r\nderretir la mantequilla de maní, el coco\r\nleche, salsa de chile dulce y la mitad de la\r\ncebolletas, agregando 1-2 cucharadas de agua\r\npara aflojar la mezcla hasta obtener una llovizna\r\nconsistencia.","Mezclar los fideos, el pepino y\r\nbrotes de soja en una fuente para servir. Cubra con\r\nlas gambas, rociar sobre el maní\r\nsalsa y esparcir sobre el resto\r\ncebolletas."]','2026-01-11 13:01:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14344,8320,'es','Salteado de tofu, verduras y anacardos','Saludable, ligero y rápido: justo lo que necesitas en una comida después del trabajo','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cabeza de brócoli, cortada en floretes pequeños","4 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","1 manojo de cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","140 g de habas de soja","2 cabezas de pak choi, en cuartos","2 paquetes de 150 g de trozos de tofu marinado","1 ½ cucharada de salsa hoisin","1 cucharada de salsa de soja reducida en sal (agregue más según su gusto)","25 g de anacardos tostados"]','["Calienta el aceite en un wok antiadherente. Añade el\r\nbrócoli, luego sofreír a fuego alto durante 5 minutos\r\no hasta que estén tiernos, agregando un poco de agua si\r\nempieza a coger. Agrega el ajo y la guindilla,\r\nfreír durante 1 minuto, luego revolver durante la primavera.\r\ncebollas, soja, pak choi y tofu.\r\nSofría durante 2-3 minutos. Agrega el hoisin, la soja.\r\ny nueces para calentar."]','2026-01-11 13:01:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14345,8322,'es','Sopa asiática de fideos y pavo','Esta sopa se parece un poco al pho, un caldo vietnamita elaborado tradicionalmente con carne de res y servido con un plato de picantes hierbas frescas, chile y lima como acompañamiento.','["1½ l de caldo de pavo o pollo","raíz de jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelada y cortada en rodajas","anís de 2 estrellas","1 rama de canela","3 dientes","200 g de fideos de arroz secos, de cualquier tipo","2-3 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","2 limas, una en jugo y otra en gajos","400 g de pavo asado, desmenuzado","Bolsa de 100 g de brotes de soja","manojo de cilantro","manojo de menta","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","2 chiles rojos, en rodajas (deja las semillas si te gusta picante)"]','["Vierta el caldo en una cacerola grande, agregue el\r\njengibre y especias, dejar cocer a fuego lento y\r\ninfundir durante 10 minutos. Remojar los fideos según\r\nSegún las instrucciones del paquete, luego escurrir y enjuagar.","Añade la salsa de pescado y el jugo de lima a la\r\ncaldo y gusto para sazonar – agregar más\r\nsalsa de pescado si quieres. dividir los fideos\r\nentre cuatro tazones, luego cubra con el\r\ncarne desmenuzada, brotes de soja y un trozo\r\nde hierbas, cebollino y chiles. sirva el\r\ncaldo caliente sobre los fideos, luego sirva con\r\nmás hierbas y rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14346,8324,'es','Estofado de verduras vietnamita','Un plato de cena caliente, aromático sin ser picante, para que los niños también puedan disfrutarlo.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","raíz de jengibre fresco del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","2 dientes de ajo, picados","½ calabaza grande, pelada y cortada en trozos","2 tsp soy sauce","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moreno suave","200 ml de caldo de verduras","100 g de judías verdes, peladas y en rodajas","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","hojas de cilantro y arroz basmati o jazmín cocido, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una olla mediana con tapa.\r\ncacerola. Agrega el jengibre y el ajo, luego\r\nsofreír durante unos 5 minutos. Agrega la calabaza, la soja.\r\nsalsa, azúcar y caldo. Cubra y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 10 min. Retire la tapa, agregue el verde.\r\nfrijoles, luego cocine por 3 minutos más hasta que\r\nla calabaza y los frijoles estén tiernos. Revuelve la primavera\r\ncebollas en el último minuto, luego\r\nespolvorea con cilantro y sirve con arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:01:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14347,4413,'es','ensalada de pollo asiática','Esta ensalada fácil de preparar está llena de sabores picantes; la versión simplificada también es excelente para las loncheras de los niños.','["1 pechuga de pollo deshuesada y sin piel","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado","ralladura y jugo de ½ lima (aproximadamente 1 cucharada)","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","Bolsa de 100 g de hojas de ensalada mixta","un puñado grande de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","¼ de cebolla morada, en rodajas finas","½ chile, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","¼ de pepino, cortado por la mitad a lo largo, en rodajas"]','["Cubrir el pollo con agua fría,\r\nllevar a ebullición y luego cocinar durante 10 minutos.\r\nRetirar de la sartén y cortar en\r\njirones. Mezcle la salsa de pescado, la lima\r\nralladura, jugo y azúcar hasta que el azúcar se disuelva.","Coloque las hojas y el cilantro en un\r\nrecipiente, luego cubra con el pollo,\r\ncebolla, chile y pepino. Coloque el\r\nvestirse en un recipiente aparte y tirar\r\na través de la ensalada cuando esté listo para comer."]','2026-01-11 13:01:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14348,8326,'es','Sopa de fideos con salmón','Esta saludable sopa de fideos es baja en grasas, saludable para el corazón y está repleta de sabrosos ingredientes.','["1 litro de caldo de pollo bajo en sal","2 cucharaditas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","100 g de fideos de arroz planos","Paquete de 150 g de setas shiitake, en rodajas","Paquete de 125 g de maíz tierno, en rodajas","2 filetes de salmón sin piel, en rodajas","jugo 2 limones","1 cucharada de salsa de soja reducida en sal","pizca de azúcar moreno","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado"]','["Vierta el caldo en una cacerola grande, lleve\r\nhasta que hierva, luego agregue la pasta de curry.\r\nAgrega los fideos y cocina por 8 minutos.\r\nVierta los champiñones y el maíz y cocine.\r\ndurante 2 minutos más.","Agrega el salmón a la sartén y cocina.\r\ndurante 3 minutos o hasta que esté bien cocido.\r\nRetirar del fuego y agregar el\r\nzumo de lima, salsa de soja y una pizca de\r\nazúcar. Sirva en 4 tazones y espolvoree\r\nsobre el cilantro justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14349,7321,'es','Piernas de cordero vietnamita con batatas','Estas piernas de cordero, tiernas y llenas de sabores asiáticos clásicos, son perfectas para congelar.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de maní","4 muslos de cordero de unos 350 g cada uno","2 cebollas partidas por la mitad y cortadas en medias lunas","2 cucharadas de raíz de jengibre fresco finamente picado","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 chiles rojos, ambos sin semillas, uno picado y otro en rodajas finas","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave, más 1 cucharadita","anís de 3 estrellas","2 tallos de limoncillo, sin las hojas exteriores duras y luego machacados","1,2 l de caldo de cordero","1½ cucharada de puré de tomate","4 batatas, peladas y cortadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de salsa de pescado","jugo 2 limones","un puñado grande de hojas de menta, rasgadas","un puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola de fondo grueso, sazone las piernas, luego dórelas de 2 en 2 por todos lados, agregando el aceite restante para el segundo lote. Retire el cordero y agregue las cebollas. Fríelos bastante rápido, unos 30 segundos, añade el jengibre, el ajo y la guindilla picada, luego baja el fuego y cocina durante 1 minuto. Agregue 1 cucharada de azúcar, revuelva, luego agregue el anís estrellado, la hierba de limón, el caldo, el puré y los condimentos. Llevar a ebullición.","Tape y cocine en el horno por 1½ horas, luego agregue los camotes y cocine por 1 hora más. El cordero debe estar completamente tierno y casi despegándose de los huesos. Agregue la salsa de pescado, el jugo de limón y 1 cucharadita de azúcar para realzar el sabor, luego espolvoree con la menta, la albahaca y el chile en rodajas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14350,3652,'es','Tabulé de lombarda y naranja sanguina','Disfruta de esta vibrante ensalada tabulé con tus parrilladas favoritas. Con col lombarda, arándanos secos y semillas de granada, es perfecto para Navidad','["200 g de trigo bulgur","50 g de arándanos secos","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","1 chalota, finamente cortada","½ col lombarda, cortada finamente","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","un pequeño puñado de ramitas de menta, las hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","2 naranjas sanguinas, sin piel ni médula y cortadas en rodajas finas","75 g de semillas de granada","75 g de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes","¼ cucharadita de canela molida","¼ cucharadita de comino molido","1 naranja sanguina, en jugo","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","50 ml de aceite de oliva"]','["Coloque el bulgur y los arándanos en un recipiente resistente al calor y vierta suficiente agua hirviendo para cubrir unos 2 cm. Cubra el recipiente y déjelo en remojo durante 15 minutos. Escurrir y transferir a un tazón para servir. Agrega la ralladura de limón, las chalotas y el repollo. Mezcle bien.","Vierte el jugo de limón en un bol pequeño con los ingredientes del aderezo, excepto el aceite. Revuelva bien, luego vierta el aceite lentamente, batiendo continuamente hasta que se combinen. Sazone al gusto.","Agrega el perejil, la menta y las naranjas sanguinas a la mezcla de bulgur con la mayoría de las semillas de granada y las nueces. Mezcle todo junto con el aderezo y sazone nuevamente al gusto. Sirva en un tazón grande con las semillas de granada restantes y las nueces esparcidas por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:01:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14351,3654,'es','Zanahorias glaseadas con miso con salsa de ricotta batida','Pruebe estas deliciosas zanahorias glaseadas con miso con salsa cremosa de ricotta y cobertura de pistachos triturados. Será una gran adición a un plato de fiesta navideña.','["1 kg de zanahorias, partidas por la mitad o en cuartos si son gruesas","½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","75 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","3 dientes de ajo, machacados","½ cucharada de miso rojo","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharadas de miel","250 g de ricota","½ limón, rallado y en jugo","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","25 g de pistachos, picados en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloca las zanahorias en una bandeja para asar con un poco de condimento y aceite de oliva. Mezcle y ase durante 15 minutos hasta que se dore muy ligeramente.","Mientras tanto, calienta la mantequilla y el aceite de sésamo en una cacerola a fuego medio. Una vez derretido y espumoso, agregue el ajo, el miso, las hojuelas de chile y la miel. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que se reduzca y espese un poco. Vierta esto sobre las zanahorias asadas y revuelva bien para que queden bien cubiertas. Regrese al horno y ase por 30 minutos más.","Para hacer la salsa, mezcle la ricota, la ralladura de limón y el aceite de oliva hasta que quede suave. Sazone al gusto con sal, pimienta y jugo de limón. Extienda sobre una fuente para servir y cubra con las zanahorias calientes, rociando el jugo asado por encima. Esparce los pistachos por encima para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:01:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14352,3656,'es','La reina de los pudines de Angela Hartnett','Me encanta una reina de los budines. Pan rallado remojado en leche, huevo aromatizado con vainilla, mermelada por encima y luego merengue. Y cuando se hace bien, queda delicioso. También es una excelente manera de usar pan viejo o mermeladas sobrantes, por lo que es básicamente un elemento esencial en la despensa. No utilices mermelada azucarada, ya que todo se volverá increíblemente dulce.','["25 g de mantequilla sin sal, más un poco para engrasar","570ml de leche entera","100 g de azúcar en polvo","3 huevos, separados","ralladura fina de 1 limón sin cera","5 cucharadas de mermelada de frambuesa","nata sola, para servir"]','["Precalentar el horno a 170°C/150°C ventilador/Gas 3 y engrasar una fuente ovalada para horno de 24 cm con un poco de mantequilla.","Calienta la leche en una cacerola a fuego lento hasta que esté ligeramente tibia. Poner el pan rallado en un bol, verter sobre la leche y dejar el pan rallado en remojo durante 30 minutos hasta que se haya absorbido todo el líquido.","Batir ligeramente las yemas con un tenedor, luego añadirlas al pan rallado remojado junto con 50 g de azúcar en polvo, los 25 g de mantequilla y la ralladura de limón. Revuelva para combinar bien, luego transfiéralo al plato para servir y hornee durante 20-25 minutos, hasta que esté dorado y listo. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar.","Reducir la temperatura del horno a 140°C/120°C ventilador/Gas 1.","Calentar suavemente la mermelada en una cacerola pequeña para aflojarla y esparcirla uniformemente sobre el pan rallado.","Vierta las claras de huevo en un recipiente limpio y, con una batidora eléctrica de mano, bata hasta obtener picos suaves. Agregue los 175 g restantes de azúcar en polvo poco a poco, batiendo entre cada adición, hasta obtener un merengue hermoso y brillante con picos suaves. Coloca el merengue sobre la mermelada, usando la cuchara para hacer pequeños picos, como los picos de la corona de la reina, o puedes poner el merengue en una manga pastelera y colocarlo por encima.","Hornea el pudín durante 30 minutos más, hasta que el merengue esté dorado. Servir con nata aún caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14353,3658,'es','Ensalada de puré de patatas, eneldo, queso feta y cebolla morada encurtida','Busque patatas pequeñas de Morrisons Market Street para hacer esta ensalada con queso feta picante; funciona bien como acompañamiento con carne o pescado a la parrilla.','["1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","3 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto o blanco","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","750 g de patatas baby Morrisons Market Street","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para la bandeja para hornear","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 tsp Dijon mustard","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Pon la cebolla en un bol pequeño, no metálico, y añade el vinagre, el azúcar, una pizca de sal y 2 cucharadas de agua hirviendo del hervidor. Cubrir y dejar encurtir durante al menos 30 minutos.","Cocine las patatas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén tiernas; un cuchillo debería poder perforarlas fácilmente. Escurrir bien. Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Colocar las patatas en una bandeja para asar y presionar con la base engrasada de un vaso, molde o espátula hasta que las patatas queden aplastadas. Asegúrese de que las papas estén en una sola capa en la bandeja, luego rocíe 4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y sazone. Ase durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente en los bordes.","Escurre las cebollas encurtidas y reserva el líquido del encurtido. Batir el aceite de oliva virgen extra, la mostaza de Dijon y la mayor parte del eneldo en el líquido reservado. Coloca las patatas trituradas en una fuente para servir. Desmenuza el queso feta y vierte sobre el aderezo. Esparza el eneldo restante y las cebollas encurtidas."]','2026-01-11 13:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14354,3660,'es','Orzo de limón','Haz este orzo para usarlo como base. Reserve tiempo el fin de semana para prepararlo y luego sírvalo más tarde durante la semana usando nuestras ideas de recetas a continuación.','["50 g de mantequilla","500 g de oro","2 cubitos de caldo de pollo","1 limón, rallado","un puñado grande de hierbas suaves finamente picadas, como cebollino, eneldo y albahaca","buen chorrito de jugo de limón"]','["Calienta la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio. Vierta el orzo y revuelva bien para combinar. Tuesta durante 4-5 minutos hasta que esté dorado, luego desmenuza sobre los cubitos de caldo de pollo.","Aumente el fuego a alto y vierta sobre 1,3 litros de agua hirviendo y cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos, añadiendo un chorrito más de agua si es necesario.","Deje enfriar a temperatura ambiente, luego agregue la ralladura de limón y las hierbas suaves finamente picadas. Sazona al gusto y añade un buen chorrito de zumo de limón. Deje enfriar, luego transfiéralo a recipientes herméticos y reserve en el refrigerador hasta que lo necesite. Se mantendrá frío hasta por cuatro días. Úselo para preparar nuestro orzo de limón con trucha o pollo marinado con orzo y queso feta."]','2026-01-11 13:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14355,3664,'es','Nectarinas escalfadas con jengibre y cardamomo','Muestre nectarinas de temporada con un toque especiado en un fragante jarabe de rosas. Disfrútalo con helado, nata o mascarpone.','["12 vainas de cardamomo verde","200 g de azúcar granulada","30 g de jengibre fresco, cortado en rodajas de 2 cm de grosor y machacado","4 nectarinas grandes, firmes y recién maduras, lavadas, partidas por la mitad y sin hueso",", crema batida, nata cuajada o mascarpone (o alternativa vegana), para servir"]','["Triturar el cardamomo con un mortero. Una vez que se hayan soltado las semillas, reserve las vainas y triture las semillas hasta obtener un polvo grueso.","En una cacerola ancha (lo suficientemente grande como para acomodar las nectarinas partidas por la mitad en una sola capa), combine 625 ml de agua, el azúcar, la mitad del jengibre, la mitad de las vainas de cardamomo y las semillas trituradas y una pizca de sal. Llevar a ebullición a fuego medio-alto, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, aproximadamente de 8 a 10 minutos.","Reduzca el fuego a medio-bajo y, con una espumadera, agregue con cuidado las nectarinas, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, al almíbar. Escalfar durante unos 3 minutos, luego darle la vuelta suavemente con la espumadera; el almíbar comenzará a cambiar de color y se volverá de color rosa claro. Continúe escalfando durante 3-4 minutos, o hasta que esté suave; un cuchillo afilado en el centro debe deslizarse fácilmente con solo un toque de resistencia. La piel también puede comenzar a desprenderse. El tiempo de cocción variará dependiendo del tamaño y madurez de la fruta.","Con una espumadera, transfiera las nectarinas a un recipiente lo suficientemente grande para contener la fruta y el almíbar. Déjelo hasta que se enfríe lo suficiente como para manipularlo y, si lo desea, retire con cuidado la piel y deséchelo.","Deje hervir el almíbar a fuego medio-alto hasta que se reduzca y quede algo almibarado, aproximadamente 10 minutos. Apague el fuego y agregue el jengibre restante, las semillas de cardamomo y las vainas. Tapar y dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente.","Colar el almíbar a través de un colador de malla fina en el recipiente con las nectarinas. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos 30 minutos. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. Sirva las nectarinas con almíbar tibias, a temperatura ambiente, o frías con helado, nata o mascarpone de su elección."]','2026-01-11 13:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14356,3666,'es','Ensalada dulce de melón, hojas de curry y burrata','Haz esta ensalada una vez y la prepararás durante todo el verano. Melón, hoja de curry y burrata puede ser una combinación improbable, pero es dulce, picante, cremosa y aromática.','["1 melón maduro, o una mezcla de melón dulce y melón funciona bien (aproximadamente 700 g en total, peso preparado)","1 chalote de plátano, finamente cortado","2 bolas de burrata (125 g cada una)","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","10 hojas frescas de curry","2 cucharaditas de semillas de nigella","1 chile verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","3 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharaditas de miel"]','["Para el aderezo, calienta el aceite en una sartén pequeña a fuego medio. Agregue las hojas de curry y cocine a fuego lento durante 1-2 minutos hasta que estén aromáticas (tenga cuidado porque chisporrotearán). Agrega las semillas de nigella durante los últimos 30 segundos. Vierta el aceite caliente, las hojas de curry y las semillas en un bol y déjelo enfriar.","Mezcle los ingredientes restantes para el aderezo con el aceite de hoja de curry y sazone bien.","Coloque el melón y las chalotas en un plato, rocíe con la mayor parte del aderezo y mezcle ligeramente con las manos. Dejar macerar durante 20-30 min a temperatura ambiente.","Coloque la burrata en la ensalada, abra suavemente cada bola y sazone con un poco de sal marina en escamas. Vierta sobre el aderezo restante."]','2026-01-11 13:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14357,3668,'es','Tacos crujientes de champiñones con chiles encurtidos','Sirva estos tacos con aguacate cremoso y chiles encurtidos picantes. Ase una variedad de champiñones para darle una textura carnosa al plato.','["600 g de champiñones, desmenuzados (nosotros utilizamos una mezcla de castaña, ostra, ostra, enoki y botón)","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos finos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de cilantro seco","2 cucharaditas de menta seca","150 g de yogur estilo griego","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","10 g de cebollino, finamente picado","12 tortillas de maiz","1 aguacate, en rodajas, para servir","2 chiles rojos, finamente cortados","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","1 lima, exprimida","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo"]','["Empiece por hacer los chiles encurtidos. Pon los chiles en un tazón pequeño, vierte sobre el vinagre de vino blanco, el jugo de lima y el azúcar en polvo, junto con una pizca de sal. Reservar durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, calentar el horno a 220C/200C/gas 7. Distribuir los champiñones y la cebolla morada en una fuente para asar, rociar con aceite y luego espolvorear con cilantro, menta, sal y pimienta. Ase durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado, crujiente y encogido, revolviendo hasta la mitad.","Mezclar el yogur con el vinagre de vino blanco y el cebollino y sazonar con sal, pimienta y una pizca de azúcar.","Calentar las tortillas en el horno durante unos minutos, luego agregar los champiñones, un poco de yogur de hierbas y aguacate, y espolvorear sobre los chiles encurtidos."]','2026-01-11 13:01:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14358,3670,'es','Patatas nuevas ahumadas con cebolletas carbonizadas','Sirva esta guarnición de patatas nuevas como parte de una salsa para asar. Combina perfectamente con nuestra receta de pollo Spatchcock glaseado con arce y mostaza.','["1,2 kg de patatas nuevas, partidas por la mitad y las grandes en cuartos","6 cebolletas, recortadas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","50 g de mantequilla sin sal","astillas de madera (opcional)"]','["Coloque las patatas en una cacerola, cúbralas con agua fría con sal, déjelas hervir y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrir bien y dejar enfriar. Se mantendrá frío durante 24 horas.","Cuando la barbacoa esté caliente, echa las cebolletas en el aceite de oliva y sazona. Colóquelo directamente en la barbacoa a fuego alto y cocine durante 2-3 minutos, volteándolo hasta que esté suave y carbonizado. Déjelo hasta que se enfríe lo suficiente como para manipularlo, luego pique finamente y reserve. Calienta una sartén grande apta para barbacoa o una fuente para asar a fuego directo. Agregue la mantequilla hasta que forme espuma, luego agregue las papas, sazone bien y cocine por 10 minutos, agitando la sartén de vez en cuando.","Para darle un sabor ahumado a las patatas, añade unas astillas de madera a las brasas y cierra la tapa de la barbacoa mientras se cocinan las patatas. Agregue las cebolletas carbonizadas y cocine durante los últimos 5 minutos. Vierta en un tazón grande y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:01:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14359,3672,'es','Tortitas fáciles de pastel de zanahoria','Combine un pastel clásico con la simplicidad de un panqueque para crear un pudín, desayuno o brunch especial. Sirva con yogur, nueces y un chorrito de jarabe de arce o miel.','["225 g de harina con levadura","½ cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","3 cucharadas de azúcar glas dorada o azúcar moreno suave","400ml de leche","2 cucharadas de queso tierno, más 100 g para servir","1 huevo","1 zanahoria mediana (unos 115 g), rallada","1 naranja, rallada","50 g de nueces pecanas picadas y un poco más para servir (opcional)","150ml de yogur natural","aceite vegetal o de girasol, para freír","jarabe de arce o miel, para servir"]','["Tamiza la harina, la canela, la nuez moscada y el azúcar en un bol grande. Combine la leche, 2 cucharadas de queso tierno y el huevo en una jarra o tazón grande, luego vierta en la mezcla seca mientras bate hasta obtener una masa suave. Agregue la zanahoria rallada, la ralladura de naranja y las nueces, si las usa. Dejar reposar unos minutos.","Mientras tanto combina 100g de queso tierno y el yogur natural, además de un chorrito de zumo de naranja rallado, si quieres. Dejar en el frigorífico hasta que sea necesario.","Calienta una cucharadita de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo, luego agrega un cucharón de masa y cocina hasta que el panqueque se vea firme en los bordes y la superficie comience a burbujear. Si tu sartén es lo suficientemente grande, puedes cocinar más de uno a la vez. Voltee el panqueque y cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido. Repita con la masa restante, agregando un poco de aceite entre cada panqueque si es necesario.","Sirva los panqueques con cucharadas de la mezcla de yogur, un poco de nueces y un chorrito de jarabe de arce o miel, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14360,3676,'es','Lentejas con salsa de coco, hojas de curry y cúrcuma','Asalta tu alacena de especias para preparar nuestro plato de lentejas, que puedes usar como base para preparar otras tres comidas: usa puy o lentejas verdes, ya que mantienen su forma.','["3 cucharadas de ghee o aceite de coco para hacerlo vegano","2 cebollas grandes, finamente picadas","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","8 hojas frescas de curry","6 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","40 g de jengibre rallado","1 chile verde, sin semillas si quieres","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma molida","1½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 cucharadita de semillas de nigella","1,2 litros de caldo de verduras (asegúrate de que sea vegano, si es necesario)","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco.","600 g de puy seco o lentejas verdes enjuagadas"]','["Calienta el ghee o el aceite en una cacerola grande y profunda a fuego medio-alto. Agregue las cebollas, las semillas de mostaza y las hojas de curry con una pizca de sal y cocine durante 8 a 10 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que las cebollas estén un poco caramelizadas en los bordes y las semillas de mostaza hayan reventado. Incorpora el ajo, el jengibre, el chile, la cúrcuma, el cilantro, el comino y las semillas de nigella. Baje el fuego a medio y cocine durante 3-4 minutos, hasta que esté fragante.","Vierta el caldo de verduras, la leche de coco y las lentejas. Enjuague la lata de leche de coco con agua y agréguela a la sartén. Llevar a ebullición y luego agregar las lentejas. Cocine durante 30-40 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas y se haya reducido. Sazone al gusto y divida en tres tandas. Se mantendrá refrigerado durante cinco días en un recipiente hermético o congelado hasta por tres meses."]','2026-01-11 13:01:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14361,3678,'es','Sopa garam masala de gambas y maíz','Prepare una cena ligera pero sabrosa con esta sopa de garam masala, gambas, patatas nuevas y maíz dulce. Sirva con rodajas de lima para exprimir y pan crujiente.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","3 cebolletas, finamente cortadas","2 dientes de ajo, machacados","15 g de jengibre rallado","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","1½ cucharadita de curry en polvo mediano","600 ml de caldo de pollo bajo en sal","500 g de patatas nuevas, cortadas en trozos pequeños","200 g de maíz dulce congelado","300 g de gambas, descongeladas si están congeladas","200ml de leche","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 lima, cortada en gajos","pan crujiente"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola a fuego medio. Agregue las cebolletas, el ajo y el jengibre y cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que chisporrotee y esté fragante. Mezcle todas las especias y cocine por un minuto más hasta que estén aromáticas. Añade el caldo y las patatas nuevas. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento durante 12-14 minutos, hasta que las patatas estén casi tiernas.","Agregue el maíz dulce, las gambas y la leche y cocine durante 2 a 4 minutos más hasta que las gambas estén bien cocidas. Sazone al gusto, espolvoree con cilantro y sirva con rodajas de lima para exprimir y un poco de pan crujiente a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:01:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14362,3680,'es','Dhal con coliflor asada con comino','Use toda la coliflor y ase las hojas también para hacer este delicioso plato dhal. Puedes cambiar el cauli por brócoli asado, si lo prefieres.','["200 g de lentejas rojas","1 coliflor, partida en floretes, hojas grandes picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma","2 cucharaditas de semillas de mostaza negra","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, rallados","25 g de jengibre, la mayor parte finamente picado, algunos cortados en palitos","1 cucharadita de chile de Cachemira","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate","1 lata de 400 g de tomates picados","manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes (guarde un puñado pequeño de hojas enteras para servir)","4 cucharadas de yogur natural, para servir (opcional)"]','["Hervir la tetera, verter las lentejas en un recipiente grande resistente al calor y verter sobre el agua hervida. Déjalo en remojo mientras asas la coliflor.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4. Extienda la coliflor y sus hojas en una bandeja para horno grande forrada. Rocíe 1 cucharada de aceite vegetal, luego esparza sobre la cúrcuma, las semillas de mostaza y comino y un poco de sal y pimienta, y masajee bien. Hornee por 30 minutos. Una vez que la coliflor esté dorada y blanda, escurrimos las lentejas.","Mientras tanto, calienta una cacerola grande a fuego medio. Vierta la cucharada de aceite restante y luego esparza la cebolla. Cocine durante 10-12 minutos o hasta que se ablanden, agregue el ajo y el jengibre finamente picado y cocine por 2-3 minutos más.","Echar la guindilla y el cilantro molido y añadir el puré de tomate, removiendo bien para evitar que se queme. Vierta los tomates y luego 2 latas de agua. Vierta las lentejas y mezcle bien. Cocine durante 15-20 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas y la salsa espese. Es posible que tengas que agregar un poco más de agua mientras se cocina, dependiendo de la consistencia que prefieras.","Agregue el cilantro picado y un poco de sal y pimienta, luego divida en tazones. Cubra con una cucharada de yogur, la coliflor y las semillas de mostaza y comino que queden en la bandeja, las cerillas de jengibre y las hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14363,3682,'es','Espaguetis con champiñones y col rizada','Mezcle una lata de frijoles mantecosos con esta salsa de champiñones y col rizada para obtener una base cremosa que agrega fibra, nutrientes y una porción adicional de sus cinco al día.','["250 g de espaguetis","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","1 chile rojo, en rodajas finas","400 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas finas","150 g de col rizada, sin tallos y picada en trozos grandes","Lata de 400 g de judías con mantequilla, escurridas","2 cucharadas de pasta de miso blanca","1 limón, exprimido","125 ml de crema fresca (opcional)"]','["Cocine los espaguetis en agua hirviendo con sal según las instrucciones del paquete, hasta que estén al dente. Reserva una taza de agua de pasta y luego escúrrela.","Mientras se cocina la pasta, calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande a fuego medio. Freír el ajo y la guindilla durante 1-2 minutos hasta que el ajo empiece a dorarse. Agrega los champiñones y cocina durante 4-5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue la col rizada y cocine hasta que se ablande, aproximadamente de 3 a 4 minutos.","Vierta los frijoles, el miso y 150 ml de agua de la pasta en una licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave, agregando más agua de la pasta si es necesario.","Agregue la salsa de frijoles a la col rizada y los champiñones y cocine por otros 2-3 minutos, agregando más agua para la pasta si la salsa está demasiado espesa. Sazone con sal, pimienta negra y jugo de limón al gusto. Agregue la crema fresca si la usa. Agregue los espaguetis escurridos a la salsa y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14364,3684,'es','Caballa ahumada sobre bollos tostados','Pruebe nuestro entrante fácil: el relleno se puede preparar con mucha antelación y enfriar. Una vez que lleguen tus invitados, tuesta los bollos y apila el relleno encima.','["2 filetes de caballa ahumada listos para comer","90 g de crema fresca","½ limón, exprimido","2 ramitas de eneldo, finamente picadas","2 ramitas de perejil, finamente picadas","1 manzana Granny Smith, sin corazón y cortada en palitos (opcional)","4 bollos","mantequilla, para untar","4 rodajas de pepino","1-2 rábanos, rebanados","un puñado pequeño de cebollino finamente picado"]','["Retire la piel de la caballa y desmenuce la pulpa en un bol. Agregue la crème fraîche, el jugo de limón, el eneldo y el perejil y mezcle suavemente hasta que estén bien combinados. Sazone al gusto y luego agregue los palitos de manzana, si los usa.","Tueste los bollos en una tostadora o caliente la freidora a 180 ° C durante 2 minutos antes de agregar los bollos durante 3-4 minutos. Retirarlas y untarlas generosamente con mantequilla. Extienda la mezcla de caballa sobre los bollos. Adorne con rodajas de pepino, rábanos y una pizca de cebollino, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14365,3686,'es','Huevo frito en freidora','Sí, puedes usar tu freidora para hacer huevos fritos y cocinar la yema a tu gusto. Con algunos modelos, es posible que solo necesites girar la bandeja a la mitad.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","2 huevos"]','["Rocíe el aceite en un plato o lata resistente al calor que quepa en su freidora; un molde para pastel funciona bien o puede usar moldes individuales. Coloque la lata o fuente en la freidora y cocine a 180C durante 2 minutos para calentar el aceite.","Rompe los huevos en la lata o fuente y cocina a 180C durante 4-8 minutos, o hasta que la yema esté cocida a tu gusto. Algunas freidoras no cocinan de manera uniforme; para asegurarse de que el huevo lo haga, gire la lata o el plato a la mitad de la cocción."]','2026-01-11 13:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14366,3688,'es','Adorno de gachas de sultana y manzana con especias chai','Mejora tu avena matutina con trozos de manzana y pasas sultanas empapadas en chai. Añade un chorrito de crema doble, si lo deseas también, para disfrutar aún más.','["100g de pasas","2 manzanas, sin corazón y picadas en trozos grandes","½ limón, exprimido","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","¾ cucharadita de jengibre molido","¾ cucharadita de canela molida","¼ cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","5 vainas de cardamomo machacadas","2 dientes","200 g de gachas de avena","400ml de leche","un chorrito de crema doble para servir (opcional)"]','["Poner en un cazo las pasas, las manzanas, el zumo de limón, el azúcar, las especias molidas y enteras y una pizca de pimienta negra. Vierta 75 ml de agua y luego cocine a fuego lento a fuego medio. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos hasta que la fruta se ablande y el líquido se reduzca. Retirar del fuego y reservar. Una vez frío, se mantendrá frío en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días.","Para hacer la papilla, vierte en un cazo la avena, la leche y 800 ml de agua junto con una pizca de sal. Cocine, revolviendo con frecuencia, a fuego medio durante 8-10 minutos hasta que espese y esté cremoso; cocine por un poco más de tiempo si prefiere una papilla más espesa, o agregue un chorrito de agua si la prefiere más líquida.","Sirva la papilla en tazones cubiertos con la mezcla de manzana y pasas con especias chai y un chorrito de crema doble, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14367,3690,'es','Brochetas de miel, sésamo y halloumi','¿Estás aburrido de las mismas viejas brochetas de verduras? Con un glaseado de miel y sésamo, estas versiones de halloumi tienen mucho sabor.','["2 bloques de halloumi de 250 g","1 cucharada de aceite neutro","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharada de aceite neutro","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de ajo granulado","1 cucharada de hojuelas de chile","100ml de miel","1 cucharada de vinagre de manzana"]','["Comience haciendo el glaseado de miel. Mezclar todos los ingredientes en un bol y sazonar con sal y pimienta. Corta cada bloque de halloumi en tercios, paralelo al pliegue, luego pártelo por la mitad en el pliegue. Deberías terminar con 12 piezas en total. Enrósquelos con cuidado en brochetas de metal.","Unte con aceite neutro las barras de la barbacoa y luego unte el halloumi con el glaseado de miel. Ase, cepillando de vez en cuando y volteando con cuidado cada 2-3 minutos, hasta que esté dorado por completo. También puedes cocinarlos al fuego en una plancha a fuego alto si lo prefieres. Sirva con el glaseado restante en un recipiente a un lado para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:01:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14368,3692,'es','Brochetas de repollo carbonizado con mantequilla de harissa','Reimagina las brochetas de verduras con estas versiones de col tierna carbonizada servidas con una deliciosa mantequilla de harissa, yogur griego y cebollas crujientes.','["100 g de mantequilla salada","2 cucharadas de harissa (usamos harissa rosa)","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","2 dientes de ajo, machacados","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","1 col tierna puntiaguda","1 cucharada de aceite neutro","200 g de yogur griego espeso","50 g de cebollas crujientes"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola, luego agregue la harissa, la ralladura de limón, el jugo de limón y el ajo, y cocine durante 2-3 minutos, hasta que chisporrotee. Sazone con pimienta y agregue la mayor parte del perejil, reservando un poco para decorar.","Lave y deseche las hojas exteriores del repollo dañadas o con imperfecciones. Córtelo por la mitad, manteniendo la raíz intacta, luego corte cada mitad en 2 gajos, manteniendo la raíz unida a cada extremo. Enrosque con cuidado las brochetas de metal, unte cada trozo con mantequilla de harissa y luego reserve en una bandeja para hornear.","Unte las barras de la barbacoa con aceite neutro y ase el repollo, untándolo con mantequilla de vez en cuando, volteándolo con cuidado cada 3-5 minutos, hasta que esté suave y carbonizado por completo. Alternativamente, puedes cocinarlos bajo una parrilla caliente.","Extienda el yogur en una fuente para servir y cubra con las brochetas, rociando con la mantequilla restante, luego espolvoree con las cebollas crujientes y el perejil reservado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14369,3694,'es','Pollo al curry con coco en olla de cocción lenta','Haga que su olla de cocción lenta haga el trabajo duro de este curry al estilo indio. Agregamos pollo y batata, luego servimos con naans y arroz.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal o de girasol (opcional)","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada o en rodajas","8 muslos de pollo sin piel y deshuesados, cortados en trozos","4 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente rallados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","6 cucharadas de pasta de curry","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco.","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","500 g de batata o calabaza, picada en trozos grandes","un puñado de cilantro fresco, picado en trozos grandes, para servir","1 chile rojo, en rodajas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Para un sabor más intenso, si tienes tiempo, calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla durante 6-8 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agregue el pollo y fríalo durante unos minutos hasta que esté dorado (pero no bien cocido), luego agregue el ajo y el jengibre y cocine durante 2 minutos hasta que esté fragante. Agrega la pasta de curry y cocina por 1 min.","Vierta en su olla de cocción lenta junto con la leche de coco, los tomates y la batata o la calabaza. Alternativamente, ponga todo menos el aceite, el cilantro y el chile en su olla de cocción lenta y revuelva para combinar. Cocine a temperatura alta durante 5 horas o a temperatura baja durante 8 horas, hasta que el pollo esté tierno y bien cocido. Retire la tapa durante la última hora para espesar la salsa. Sirva sobre arroz o con pan naan con un poco de cilantro y chile rojo, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14370,3696,'es','Guiso de judías verdes de verano','Disfruta de este guiso de verano con trozos de pan para mojar. También es perfecto para acompañar chuletas de cordero o pescado blanco.','["50 ml de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, en rodajas finas","280 g de judías verdes","4 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","4 anchoas, más un chorrito de aceite de lata (opcional)","2 pizcas de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","400 g de tomates en rama grandes, picados","4 ramitas de orégano, hojas cortadas o 1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","Lata de 400 g de cannellini o judías blancas, escurridas","un puñado de albahaca, hojas recogidas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-bajo. Agrega la cebolla con una pizca de sal y cocina lentamente hasta que esté caramelizada, unos 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, prepare las judías verdes. Si las judías verdes son jóvenes y pequeñas, simplemente córtelas en diagonal. Si son más viejas, tendrán un hilo resistente a lo largo de cada lado. Para quitarlo, recorte el extremo del tallo y retire los hilos fibrosos, luego córtelo en diagonal.","Agregue el ajo, las anchoas y las hojuelas de chile, si las usa, a la cebolla. Cocine durante unos minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que las anchoas se hayan disuelto y el ajo esté cocido pero no dorado.","Agrega las judías verdes, los tomates, el orégano, el vinagre, el azúcar y una buena pizca de sal. Tape y cocine durante 15 minutos a fuego lento, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que los tomates se deshagan y los frijoles estén suaves.","Agrega los cannellini o frijoles mantecosos a la sartén, llena la lata hasta la mitad con agua y agrega esto también. Cocine otros 10 minutos destapado, hasta que el líquido se haya reducido un poco. Verifique la sazón y agregue las hojas de albahaca. Sirva con un generoso chorrito de aceite de oliva virgen extra y una pizca extra de hojuelas de chile, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14371,3698,'es','Buñuelos de piel de verduras','Haga que las cáscaras de verduras sean la estrella del espectáculo con estos sencillos buñuelos. Son perfectos el día después de una gran cena familiar, como por ejemplo en época navideña.','["500ml de aceite vegetal, para freír","1 huevo","100 g de harina (de garbanzos)","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de semillas de nigella","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","150g de pieles de verduras, nosotros utilizamos una mezcla de patata, zanahoria y chirivía","½ cebolla pequeña, finamente cortada","pepinillo de lima, chutney de mango y raita, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola honda a fuego medio-bajo, procurando que no esté más de dos tercios de su capacidad. Vierte 100ml de agua en un bol y mezcla con el huevo. Agregue la harina de garbanzos, el polvo para hornear, las especias y 1 cucharadita de sal marina fina, luego revuelva hasta que se forme una pasta espesa. Agregue las cáscaras de verduras y la cebolla. Agregue otro chorrito de agua para aflojar si es necesario.","Para comprobar si el aceite está lo suficientemente caliente, agregue una pequeña cantidad de masa. Si sube a la superficie rodeado de burbujas y empieza a dorarse, el aceite está lo suficientemente caliente para freír. Si no, aumenta el fuego a medio-alto. Una vez que esté lo suficientemente caliente, coloque con cuidado cucharadas colmadas de la mezcla en el aceite, unas pocas a la vez, luego aplánelas con el dorso de la cuchara. Cocine durante unos minutos, volteando una vez, hasta que esté uniformemente dorado y crujiente, aproximadamente de 3 a 4 minutos. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y espolvorear con un poco de sal. Sirva caliente con pepinillo de lima, chutney de mango y raita."]','2026-01-11 13:02:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14372,3700,'es','Pastel de limón con freidora','¿Alguna vez probaste tu freidora para hornear? Si bien no es ideal para pasteles perfectamente uniformes, es excelente para un pastel de pan sin complicaciones, como este chorrito de limón.','["250 g de mantequilla, a temperatura ambiente","250 g de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos","250 g de harina con levadura","3 limones, rallados y exprimidos","100 g de azúcar glas"]','["Forre un molde para pan con papel para hornear. Vierta la mantequilla, el azúcar, los huevos, la harina, una pizca de sal y dos tercios de la ralladura de limón en un bol, luego bata con una batidora eléctrica durante 4-5 minutos hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso.","Calienta la freidora a 160 ° C. Vierta la mezcla del pastel en el molde preparado, alisando la superficie. Cocine durante 1 hora-1 hora 10 minutos hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro salga limpia (puede cubrir la superficie con papel de aluminio si comienza a oscurecerse demasiado). Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos.","Mientras tanto, combine el azúcar glas, la ralladura de limón restante y el jugo suficiente para hacer un glaseado suave y que se pueda verter. Levante con cuidado el pastel caliente sobre una rejilla colocada sobre una bandeja y haga agujeros profundos por toda la parte superior con una brocheta. Rocíe lentamente sobre el glaseado, dejando que escurra por los bordes. Dejar reposar antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14373,3702,'es','Pollo a la cúrcuma con hummus de frijoles y pimientos asados','Pruebe este saludable pollo con cúrcuma estilo meze con hummus de frijoles, pimientos asados ​​y brócoli. Asa el pollo y los pimientos, si quieres.','["1 pimiento rojo grande, cortado por la mitad y sin semillas","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","160 g de brócoli de tallo largo","un puñado de hojas de menta, para servir","2 filetes grandes de pechuga de pollo sin piel (de unos 125 g cada uno)","120 gramos de yogur natural","3 cucharadas de cúrcuma finamente rallada","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","1 cucharadita de miel","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva virgen extra","Lata de 400 g de judías con mantequilla, escurridas y reservando el líquido","1 cucharada de ralladura de limón, más 1 cucharada de jugo de limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un chorrito","1 diente de ajo, picado en trozos grandes","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido"]','["Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Forra una bandeja para hornear con papel de aluminio. Haga algunos cortes pequeños alrededor de los bordes de las mitades de pimiento con un cuchillo afilado y luego aplánelos lo más que pueda con la palma. Frote con aceite vegetal y ase en la bandeja para hornear forrada durante 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, corte las pechugas de pollo por la mitad a lo largo en ángulo para obtener cuatro filetes finos. Mezcla en un bol el yogur, la cúrcuma, las semillas de comino, el cilantro molido, el ajo, el jugo de limón, la miel y el aceite de oliva con un poco de pimienta negra y 1 cucharadita de sal. Agrega el pollo y voltéalo para cubrirlo con la marinada. Cuando los pimientos hayan tenido 10 minutos, dales la vuelta, agrega los filetes de pollo a la bandeja, espaciándolos ligeramente y vierte el resto de la marinada sobre ellos. Ase durante 20 minutos, volteando los filetes de pollo hasta la mitad, hasta que estén bien cocidos.","Para el hummus, use una licuadora de mano para mezclar los frijoles, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el aceite de oliva, el ajo, las semillas de comino y el cilantro con 6 cucharadas de líquido de la lata, ¾ de cucharadita de sal y abundante pimienta negra. Debe quedar completamente liso.","Cuando el pollo se haya cocinado durante 10 minutos, cocine el brócoli al vapor durante 6 minutos hasta que esté tierno. Vierta el hummus en dos platos y luego cubra con los pimientos asados ​​y el pollo. Espolvoree con menta, rocíe con aceite de oliva y sirva con el brócoli a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14374,3704,'es','Fideos udon de pollo y jengibre','Sirva estos fideos ligeros y aromáticos con pollo, brotes de soja y repollo en 30 minutos. Con jengibre picante y chile rojo, está lleno de sabor.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol","3 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en cubitos","¼ de col blanca, cortada finamente","25 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado fino","1 chile rojo (sin semillas si lo desea), finamente picado","1 cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de arroz","2 cucharaditas de mirín","100 g de brotes de soja listos para comer","3 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","300 g de fideos udon directos al wok","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 cucharada de jengibre encurtido (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto y, una vez caliente, sofríe el pollo y el repollo durante 5 a 7 minutos hasta que se doren y estén casi cocidos. Agregue el jengibre y la guindilla y cocine unos minutos más hasta que estén fragantes.","Agrega el resto de los ingredientes, excepto el cilantro y el jengibre encurtido, y fríe hasta que el pollo esté cocido y los fideos tiernos, aproximadamente 1 o 2 minutos más. Sazone, agregando más soja, vinagre o mirin, si lo desea. Cubra con cilantro y jengibre encurtido, si lo usa."]','2026-01-11 13:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14375,3706,'es','Sopa de tomate y panes crujientes de hummus','Organízate para la próxima semana y prepara esta sopa un domingo; se conserva bien en el refrigerador. Hemos incluido verduras junto con lentejas rojas para agregar proteínas.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas grandes (325 g), picadas","320 g de zanahorias, en rodajas","4 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","100 g de lentejas rojas secas","botella de 690 g de passata","1 litro de caldo de verduras elaborado con 1 cucharada de caldo en polvo","4 panes crujientes multicereales","100 g de hummus bajo en grasas","¼ de pepino, rebanado","6 aceitunas Nocellara deshuesadas, en rodajas","pizca de hojas de tomillo","pizca de pimentón ahumado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande y fríe las cebollas y las zanahorias durante unos 10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que se ablanden.","Agregue el ajo y el pimentón ahumado junto con las lentejas y cocine por aproximadamente un minuto más.","Vierta la passata y el caldo, lleve a ebullición, luego cubra y cocine a fuego medio durante 30 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que las verduras estén tiernas. Retirar del fuego y batir hasta que quede suave con una batidora de mano. Coma la mitad ahora y enfríe el resto. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. Para recalentar, cocine porciones en una sartén a fuego lento con un chorrito de agua hasta que esté bien caliente.","Para servir junto con la sopa, unte 2 panes crujientes por persona con la mitad del hummus. Cubra con la mitad del pepino y esparza sobre la mitad de las aceitunas, el tomillo y el pimentón ahumado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14376,3708,'es','Curry rápido de lentejas y coco','Este curry rápido y fácil tiene un sabor tan profundo: sabe como si hubiera sido cocinado durante horas. También es saludable, además de ser bajo en grasas y calorías.','["1 cebolla, picada en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","1 chile rojo o verde, picado en trozos grandes","1 zanahoria, picada en trozos grandes","10 g de jengibre pelado y picado","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","1 ½ cucharada de pasta de curry tikka masala","Lata de 400g de lentejas verdes cocidas","220ml de leche de coco light","200 g de guisantes congelados","10 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","200 g de arroz integral cocido","4 cucharadas de coco light o yogur natural, para servir"]','["Coloque la cebolla, el ajo, el chile, la zanahoria y el jengibre en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave.","Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana a fuego medio y cocina la pasta de verduras durante 4-5 minutos hasta que esté fragante y comience a ablandarse. Agrega la pasta de curry y cocina por 1 minuto más, luego agrega las lentejas y revuelve para combinar.","Vierta la leche de coco y 150 ml de agua y deje hervir. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que espese y esté cremoso. Agrega los guisantes en los últimos 5 minutos y sazona bien.","Agrega la mayor parte del cilantro y luego divide el curry en cuatro tazones junto con el arroz. Espolvorea el cilantro restante y cubre con el yogur para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14377,3712,'es','Calabacín, guindilla y menta con cuscús de perlas','Prepare nuestra sencilla cena entre semana en 25 minutos. Los calabacines y el cuscús requieren una preparación mínima, y ​​la menta, el chile, el ajo y el limón se combinan para crear un aderezo contundente.','["100 g de cuscús perlado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","400 g de calabacines, picados en trozos grandes","½ cebolla morada, rebanada","1 chile rojo (sin semillas si prefieres menos picante), finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","10 g de menta, con las hojas recogidas y finamente picadas, más algunas enteras para servir","½ limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de miel","50 g de queso ligero para ensalada estilo griego"]','["Cocine el cuscús siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrralo y reserve. Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio-alto. Agregue los calabacines y la cebolla y fríalos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que se doren y se ablanden, aproximadamente de 8 a 10 minutos. Agregue el chile y el ajo y cocine por 2-3 minutos más hasta que esté fragante.","Retire del fuego y agregue la menta picada, el jugo de limón, la miel y los condimentos. Divida el cuscús en platos, cubra con la mezcla de calabacín, desmenuce sobre el queso y espolvoree con las hojas de menta enteras para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14378,3714,'es','Sopa miso de lentejas y repollo','Prepare una sopa abundante con la ayuda de lentejas verdes, panceta, repollo blanco y champiñones, junto con sabores de miso. Se incluye en tres de tus 5 al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","150 g de panceta o tocino picado","300 g de champiñones en rodajas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla picada","4 dientes de ajo picados","4 zanahorias en rodajas sin pelar","3 ramas de apio en rodajas","2 cucharadas de miso","500 ml de caldo de verduras","200 g de lentejas verdes secas lavadas y escurridas","½ cabeza de col blanca picada","cucharada de yogur espeso"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén profunda a fuego medio-alto. Puede hacer esto completamente vegetariano, pero si tiene alrededor de 150 g de panceta o tocino picado para usar, inclínelo y dórelo por completo antes de retirarlo con una espumadera. Agregue los champiñones en rodajas y dórelos por todos lados antes de transferirlos a un tazón.","Vierta el aceite de oliva, luego agregue la cebolla picada, los dientes de ajo, las zanahorias en rodajas y las ramas de apio, con las hojas y todo. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, hasta que se ablanden un poco. Agregue el miso, preferiblemente rojo o marrón, el caldo de verduras y 1 litro de agua y cocine a fuego lento.","Finalmente, agregue las lentejas verdes secas lavadas y escurridas y la col blanca picada. Vuelva a colocar el tocino y los champiñones. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 30-35 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas. Sazona bien y sirve con una cucharada de yogur espeso."]','2026-01-11 13:02:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14379,3716,'es','Salsa de pan croissant','No desperdicies los croissants rancios de la mañana de Navidad; úsalos para hacer una rica salsa de pan. Para un placer total, termine con una nuez de mantequilla para que se derrita por encima.','["50 g de mantequilla, más algo extra para servir (opcional)","1 cebolla pequeña, cortada en rodajas","400ml de leche entera","una pizca grande de clavo molido","2 croissants duros, cortados en rodajas gruesas (unos 80 g)"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo, luego agregue la cebolla y cocine tapada durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablande pero no tome color. Agrega la leche y el clavo molido. Cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 15 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Agrega los trozos de croissant y revuelve para que absorban todo el líquido.","Vierta todo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Se mantendrá tapado y frío durante dos días. Vierta la salsa en una sartén y cocine a fuego medio-bajo hasta que espese y esté completamente caliente; agregue un chorrito de leche para aflojar, si es necesario. Sazone y sirva caliente junto con el pavo y las guarniciones con un poco de mantequilla encima, si lo desea, y un poco de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:02:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14380,3718,'es','Tazón de arroz con pollo y fajitas con lima quemada','Prepare fajitas que agradarán a todos de manera fácil con esta receta de una sola bandeja que está llena de nutrientes y baja en grasas y calorías. Es una comida rápida entre semana.','["2 pechugas de pollo grandes","2 pimientos, rebanados","2 cebollas moradas, rebanadas","200 g de maíz tierno","3 cucharaditas de pasta de chile chipotle","1 lima, rallada y luego cortada a la mitad","2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros escurridos","15 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","400 g de arroz integral cocido","4 cucharadas de salsa, para servir"]','["Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y cubre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Coloque el pollo, los pimientos, las cebollas moradas y el maíz tierno en la bandeja y vierta sobre la pasta de chipotle. Sazone y luego revuelva para combinar. Coloque las mitades de lima en la bandeja, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, luego rocíe el aceite sobre el pollo y las verduras. Ase durante 20 minutos o hasta que todo esté bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, calienta los frijoles en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento y sazona. Mezclar los frijoles con la mitad del cilantro y la ralladura de lima, luego exprimir sobre el jugo de la lima asada. Corte el pollo en rodajas finas en diagonal y divídalo en cuatro tazones junto con las verduras y el arroz integral. Espolvorea el cilantro restante y sirve con la salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:02:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14381,3720,'es','Granola de manzana, cardamomo y jengibre','Regale esta granola en Navidad como regalo reflexivo. Lleno de frutos secos, nueces y tallo de jengibre, se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por un mes.','["100 g de frutos secos (nosotros utilizamos avellanas enteras, pistachos, almendras y nueces pecanas)","15 vainas de cardamomo o ½ cucharadita de cardamomo molido","50 ml de aceite vegetal","100 ml de jarabe de arce","75ml de miel","3 bolas de tallo de jengibre, picadas, más 2 cucharadas de almíbar","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","300 g de copos de avena","50g de semillas mixtas (nosotros utilizamos girasol, calabaza y linaza)","1 cucharadita de canela","50 g de aros de manzana secos y blandos, picados en trozos grandes","50 g de pasas o arándanos secos"]','["Calienta el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3 y cubre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Pica las nueces en trozos grandes, dejando muchos trozos gruesos. Abra las vainas de cardamomo y muela ligeramente las semillas con un mortero y un mortero para liberar su aroma.","Mezcle el aceite, el jarabe de arce, la miel, el jarabe de jengibre y la vainilla en un tazón grande. Agrega el jengibre picado, la avena, las semillas, la canela, las nueces picadas, el cardamomo y ½ cucharadita de sal marina. Mezcle todo hasta que esté bien cubierto con la mezcla de almíbar.","Vierta sobre la bandeja para hornear y extiéndala uniformemente. Hornee por 20 minutos, luego revuelva y regrese al horno por 10 minutos más. Para obtener granola en trozos, déjela enfriar sin revolver y luego córtela en pedazos. Si prefieres una textura más fina, revuelve de vez en cuando mientras la granola se enfría. Incorpora los frutos secos. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por un mes."]','2026-01-11 13:02:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14382,3722,'es','Gachas de canela con plátanos al horno','Añade plátanos ricos en fibra y yogur bio a tus papillas de desayuno. Incluir yogur vivo en su dieta puede apoyar el sistema digestivo y ayudar a las defensas inmunes.','["80 g de gachas de avena","150ml de leche semidesnatada","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 plátano maduro grande (120 g), partido por la mitad a lo largo y cortado por la mitad","½ naranja, rallada y en jugo","200g yogur natural bio","2 cucharaditas de mezcla de tres semillas tostadas"]','["Pon en una cacerola la avena, la leche, 450ml de agua y la canela. Llevar a ebullición, luego bajar el fuego, revolviendo con frecuencia, durante 5 minutos hasta que espese.","Mientras tanto, poner los plátanos en un plato con la ralladura de naranja y el jugo. Cubra y cocine en el microondas a potencia alta durante 1½-2 minutos hasta que se ablande. Vierta la papilla en tazones y cubra con el yogur, el plátano y las semillas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14383,3726,'es','Caviar de vaquero','Haga que los niños se entusiasmen con las verduras con esta salsa que se puede adaptar fácilmente. Si lo vas a llevar de picnic, añade el aguacate y el cilantro en el último momento.','["Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","Lata de 200 g de maíz dulce, escurrido o congelado (descongelado si está congelado)","2 tomates grandes, cortados en cuartos, sin semillas y finamente picados","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","1 pimiento (de cualquier color), sin semillas y finamente picado","1 aguacate grande, partido por la mitad, pelado, sin hueso y finamente picado (opcional)","manojo pequeño de cilantro picado (opcional)","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 lima, en jugo o 2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","chips de tortilla, para servir (sin gluten, si es necesario)"]','["Vierta los frijoles, el maíz, los tomates, la cebolla, el pimiento, el aguacate y el cilantro, si los usa, en un tazón grande. (Si no sirve inmediatamente, agregue el aguacate y el cilantro justo antes).","Rocíe sobre el aceite de oliva y el jugo de lima o vinagre y revuelva suavemente para combinar. Sazone al gusto. Se mantendrá a temperatura ambiente durante dos horas o se enfriará durante la noche, sin el aguacate ni el cilantro. Sirva con chips de tortilla para recoger."]','2026-01-11 13:02:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14384,3728,'es','manzanas de fuegos artificiales','Ilumina las caritas en Bonfire Night con estas coloridas manzanas de caramelo; a los niños también les encantará ayudar a decorarlas.','["250 g de malvaviscos","50 g de mantequilla","8 manzanas rojas","chispitas multicolores","frambuesas liofilizadas","merengues rosados, triturados","dulces de encaje de fresa"]','["Calienta suavemente los malvaviscos y la mantequilla en una cacerola mediana a fuego lento, revolviendo hasta que se derrita.","Retire los tallos de las manzanas y empújelas profundamente con un palito de madera, asegurándose de no atravesarlas por completo. Coloca los ingredientes en tazones pequeños separados.","Trabajando una a la vez, sumerja las manzanas en el malvavisco derretido, revolviendo hasta que estén cubiertas uniformemente. Decore rápidamente con chispas, frambuesas liofilizadas o envuélvalas con uno o dos cordones de fresa. Colóquelo sobre papel para hornear y enfríe hasta que cuaje."]','2026-01-11 13:02:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14385,3730,'es','Sopa de guisantes y jamón en olla de cocción lenta','Aproveche al máximo las sobras de jamón navideño con esta sencilla sopa de guisantes y jamón hecha en una olla de cocción lenta que utiliza solo seis ingredientes. Disfruta con pan crujiente','["1 cebolla, picada","250 g de puerros cortados en rodajas","2 hojas de laurel","450 g de jamón cocido (para obtener mejores resultados, consérvelo como porro)","1½ l de caldo de verduras caliente bajo en sal (o utilizar agua)","750 g de guisantes frescos o congelados (descongelados si están congelados)"]','["Coloca la cebolla, los puerros, las hojas de laurel y el jamón en una olla de cocción lenta. Vierta sobre el caldo de verduras caliente y cocine a temperatura alta durante 2 horas o a temperatura baja durante 6 horas. Si tiene un porro de jamón crudo, puede usarlo, pero deberá cocinar la sopa durante 45 minutos más a temperatura alta o 2 horas a temperatura baja.","Retirar el jamón y reservar. Vierta los guisantes en la olla de cocción lenta y cocine a temperatura alta durante 30 minutos más hasta que estén bien cocidos. Mientras tanto, desmenuza el jamón. Si se ha enfriado lo suficiente, puedes hacerlo con las manos o con dos tenedores.","Retire las hojas de laurel de la sopa y deséchelas, luego transfiera la sopa a la licuadora y bátala. Una vez que esté completamente fría, la sopa de guisantes (sin jamón) se puede congelar hasta por tres meses. Descongela completamente en el refrigerador durante la noche, luego vuelve a calentar en una sartén hasta que esté bien caliente para servir. Sazona al gusto, luego divídelo en tazones y esparce un poco de jamón rallado sobre cada tazón antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14386,3732,'es','Granola casera saludable','Endulce granola casera con ciruelas pasas para darle una versión más saludable a este favorito del desayuno. Las ciruelas pasas también están llenas de fibra, lo que favorece la salud intestinal.','["Lata de 290 g de ciruelas pasas sin hueso en jugo natural, escurridas","1 naranja, rallada y en jugo","2 cucharadas de tahini","350 g de avena","25 g de almendras laminadas","25 g de semillas de girasol","25 g de semillas de calabaza","2 botes de 400g de soja fortificada o yogur natural bio"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y cubre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Pon las ciruelas pasas, la ralladura de naranja y el jugo en un tazón pequeño, agrega el tahini y tritúralo todo para formar una pasta. Vierta la avena en un tazón grande, luego agregue la mezcla de ciruelas pasas y amase todo con las manos, como si estuviera haciendo una cobertura desmenuzada, hasta que toda la avena esté cubierta y pegajosa. Extiéndela en la bandeja preparada y hornea durante 20 minutos, volteando la avena cada 5 minutos para ayudarla a cocinar de manera uniforme y eliminar la mayor cantidad de vapor posible.","Retirar del horno y agregar las almendras y las semillas a la bandeja, luego enfriar rápidamente revolviendo la mezcla. Una vez completamente fría, la granola se conservará durante dos semanas en un recipiente hermético.","Mida 50 g de granola por ración y disfrútela con 100 g de yogur de soja."]','2026-01-11 13:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14387,3734,'es','Caramelo Macchiato','Ahorre pan preparando su bebida favorita de cafetería en casa; tampoco necesita equipos costosos para obtener resultados profesionales','["250ml de leche entera o semidesnatada","60-70 ml de espresso (un trago doble)","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1-2 cucharadas de salsa de caramelo"]','["Calienta la leche usando un espumador de leche o una varilla de vapor. Alternativamente, caliéntelo en la placa hasta que esté humeante (no hierva) y use un espumador de mano; debe apuntar a una temperatura entre 60 ° C y 70 ° C.","Vierta el espresso en una taza o taza de café, luego agregue la vainilla y hasta 1 cucharada de salsa de caramelo, según sus gustos. Vierta sobre la leche y luego rocíe sobre la salsa de caramelo en forma cruzada antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14388,3736,'es','Tortilla de espinacas vegana','Pruebe una tortilla hecha con harina de garbanzos: es rica en proteínas y no contiene gluten. Las cantidades aquí son para uno, pero la receta se duplica fácilmente.','["30 g de harina (de garbanzos)","¼ cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharada de levadura nutricional","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","80 g de espinacas tiernas"]','["Batir la harina de garbanzos, el orégano y la levadura nutricional en un bol con 80 ml de agua.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente de 19 cm. Vierta la masa de tortilla y gire la sartén para cubrir la base. Apila las espinacas frescas encima, luego tapa la sartén y cocina a fuego lento durante 5-6 minutos hasta que las espinacas se ablanden y la base de la tortilla esté cocida pero aún húmeda. Enrolle la tortilla en la sartén para encerrar las espinacas, luego deslícela sobre un plato y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14389,3738,'es','Barras de tarta de manzana','Aproveche al máximo las manzanas Bramley de temporada en el verano británico y prepare estas magníficas barras de tarta de manzana. Son perfectos para acompañar una taza de once','["250 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","350 g de harina común","150 g de azúcar moreno blando, más 3 cucharadas","1 cucharada de extracto de vainilla","4 manzanas Bramley medianas (unos 900 g), peladas, sin corazón y cortadas en trozos","1¼ cucharadita de canela molida (opcional)","½ limón, exprimido","75 g de azúcar glas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar un molde para hornear de 18 x 28 cm con papel para hornear. Ponga la mantequilla, la harina, 150 g de azúcar moreno y el extracto de vainilla en un procesador de alimentos con 1 cucharadita de sal y mezcle hasta que la mezcla se una. Presione dos tercios de la masa en el molde en una capa uniforme, luego hornee durante 12 a 15 minutos hasta que esté dorada. Mantén la masa restante fría mientras preparas las manzanas.","Vierta las manzanas en una sartén con 3 cucharadas de azúcar moreno, 1 cucharadita de canela (si se usa) y el jugo de limón. Cocine a fuego medio durante 15-20 minutos hasta que las manzanas se ablanden pero no se rompan.","Incline las manzanas sobre la base de la masa, luego rompa la masa restante y colóquela por encima. Hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que la cobertura esté cocida y dorada. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar en el molde.","Combine el azúcar glas y la ¼ de cucharadita de canela restante con suficiente agua para crear un glaseado espeso (necesita alrededor de 2 cucharaditas). Rocíe el glaseado sobre las barras de tarta de manzana y luego córtelas en 12 a 16 cuadrados. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14390,3740,'es','Hamburguesa de ternera a la barbacoa','Una hamburguesa de ternera clásica es imprescindible en una barbacoa. Empaque queso azul en el centro para hacerlo un poco más especial y sírvalo con sus acompañamientos favoritos.','["400 g de carne picada","1 chalote de plátano, finamente picado","1 cucharada de salsa de rábano picante fuerte","1 cucharadita de hierbas secas mixtas","1 diente de ajo grande, finamente rallado","40 g de queso azul (opcional)","2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","4 panes para hamburguesa, partidos","hojas de lechuga iceberg, rodajas de tomate y condimentos, para servir"]','["Vierta la carne picada, la chalota, la salsa de rábano picante, las hierbas y el ajo en un bol y sazone bien con sal y pimienta negra. Combine todo bien con las manos, apretando la mezcla con los dedos repetidamente para ayudar a que se una.","Dividir la mezcla en cuatro porciones y darles forma de hamburguesa de 3 cm de grosor a cada una. Presione un trozo pequeño de queso azul del tamaño de 50 peniques en el medio de cada hamburguesa, si la usa, y empaquete la carne alrededor para encerrar el queso; esto se derretirá durante la cocción.","Coloque las hamburguesas en un plato, tápelas y déjelas enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos o toda la noche. Enciende la barbacoa y espera a que las brasas se pongan cenizas. O caliente una barbacoa de gas a fuego medio.","Engrase ligeramente las hamburguesas por todas partes y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que empiecen a carbonizarse. Voltee con cuidado y cocine por 4-5 minutos más (a fuego medio) o más si lo prefiere bien cocido. Retirar las hamburguesas a una tabla y dejar reposar unos minutos antes de servir. Alternativamente, fríe las hamburguesas a fuego medio durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén bien cocidas (un termómetro de sonda debe marcar 70 ° C).","Sirva las hamburguesas en panecillos con lechuga, rodajas de tomate y condimentos (consulte la receta a continuación), o cualquier otro acompañamiento de su elección."]','2026-01-11 13:02:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14391,3742,'es','Wraps de lechuga y salmón con chile dulce','Ligeras, sencillas y tres de tus cinco al día, estas inteligentes tazas de lechuga son el portador perfecto para salmón con chile dulce desmenuzado y finas rodajas de rábano y zanahoria.','["2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce reducida en azúcar (ver el consejo a continuación)","1 lima, exprimida","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja reducida en sal o tamari sin trigo","2 filetes de salmón","1 zanahoria, cortada finamente","½ rábano daikon, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas","100 g de rábanos, finamente cortados","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 lechuga Little Gem, con las hojas separadas"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Combina la salsa de chile dulce con la mitad del jugo de lima y la mitad de la salsa de soja o tamari. Seque los filetes de salmón con papel de cocina, colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear y vierta sobre la mezcla de salsa de chile. Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego caliente la parrilla a temperatura alta y deslice el salmón debajo de la parrilla caliente durante los últimos 2 a 5 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido y caramelizado. Desmenuza suavemente la pulpa del salmón presionándola con el dorso de un tenedor.","Mezcle la zanahoria, el daikon, los rábanos y el cilantro con el resto de la salsa de soja y el jugo de lima. Estación. Rellena las hojas de lechuga con la ensalada y el salmón desmenuzado para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14392,3744,'es','Ensalada picante de atún, calabacín y garbanzos','Prepare esta ensalada rápida con atún enlatado, calabacín y garbanzos, aderezada con alcaparras, guindilla y ajo. Funciona como plato independiente o como acompañamiento.','["1 limón, rallado y exprimido","15 g de perejil, finamente picado","10 g de albahaca, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, machacados","1 cucharada de alcaparras, enjuagadas y finamente picadas","1 chile rojo (sin semillas, si prefieres menos picante), finamente picado","Lata de 160g de atún en aceite de oliva","2 calabacines, en rodajas finas","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados"]','["Pon la ralladura y el jugo de limón en un bol y mezcla con el perejil, la albahaca, el ajo, las alcaparras, la guindilla y un poco de condimento. Colar el aceite de la lata de atún (unas 2 cucharadas) y luego incorporar los calabacines. Mezcle bien para cubrir completamente el aderezo, luego déjelo a un lado para que se ablande durante 15 minutos.","Agregue los garbanzos y revuelva para combinar todo antes de desmenuzar el atún y revolver nuevamente. Sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:02:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14393,3746,'es','Frijoles horneados saludables','Pruebe nuestra receta rápida y saludable de frijoles horneados caseros. Gana sin lugar a dudas en cuanto a sabor y textura, y ofrece tres de tus cinco al día.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","1 cebolla grande (185 g), finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","500 g de puré","3 dátiles sin hueso (unos 15 g), picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","2 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo","1 hoja de laurel","3 x 400 g de judías verdes, escurridas","4 patatas asadas medianas cocidas"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola antiadherente a fuego lento y sofreír la cebolla durante 5 minutos hasta que esté dorada. Añade una gota de agua si parece que empieza a arder.","Agregue el ajo, luego agregue la passata, los dátiles, el vinagre, el caldo y la hoja de laurel. Muele abundante pimienta negra y cocina a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.","Vierta los frijoles y 400 ml de agua, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando hasta que espese. Para congelar, déjelo enfriar por completo, luego divídalo en bolsas para congelar y congélelo por hasta tres meses. Descongelar bien en el frigorífico durante la noche y volver a calentar en una sartén hasta que esté bien caliente. Sirva sobre patatas asadas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14394,3748,'es','Bacalao a la cúrcuma con bandeja de garbanzos','Prepare una cena sencilla de bacalao con garbanzos rellenos aromatizados con jengibre, ajo y cúrcuma. Es una cena saludable baja en grasas y calorías.','["Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","2 cucharaditas de aceite de girasol","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 chalotes, finamente picados","15 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","200 ml de caldo de pollo caliente, compuesto con 1⁄2 pastilla de caldo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1⁄4 - 1⁄2 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 x 125 g de bacalao","200 g de espinacas congeladas","10 g de cilantro, picado o unas cuantas hojas enteras, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta los garbanzos, el aceite, el ajo, las chalotas, el jengibre, el puré de tomate, el caldo y la mayor parte de la cúrcuma y las hojuelas de chile en una fuente para asar de 20 x 30 cm. Revuelva y sazone bien, luego hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que la mezcla burbujee y el líquido se haya reducido.","Mientras tanto, seque el bacalao. Vierta el resto de las hojuelas de cúrcuma y chile, así como una pizca grande de sal y pimienta negra recién molida, en un plato poco profundo y presione el bacalao en la mezcla para cubrirlo. Retire la fuente para asar del horno y coloque el bacalao y las espinacas congeladas en los garbanzos. Cocine durante 10 minutos, luego agregue con cuidado las espinacas a los garbanzos. Regrese al horno por 5 minutos más hasta que el bacalao esté bien cocido y opaco. Vierta en tazones y esparza el cilantro para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14395,3750,'es','frijoles refritos','Prueba esta receta de frijoles refritos caseros. Funcionan igual de bien como salsa para fiestas servida con nachos o como acompañamiento de una comida más grande estilo Tex-Mex.','["Lata de 400g de judías negras, pintas o rojas","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 chile verde, picado (opcional)","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","cilantro picado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Escurre ligeramente los frijoles, reservando el jugo de la lata, pero no los enjuagues (los frijoles deben estar en aproximadamente la mitad del líquido de la lata). Dependiendo de la textura que prefieras, tritúralos en un tazón o bátelos con una licuadora hasta que quede suave. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén o cacerola grande y cocina las cebollas durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén suaves y doradas. Esparza el ajo, la guindilla y las semillas de comino y cocine todo durante 2 minutos más. Añade los frijoles, el orégano, el pimentón y una pizca de sal. Cocine todo junto durante 5 minutos hasta que los frijoles se hayan calentado; agregue más jugo de frijoles reservado si está demasiado espeso. Sirva inmediatamente con una pizca de cilantro, si lo desea, o déjelo enfriar y manténgalo frío. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días o congelado durante un mes. Vuelva a calentar con un chorrito de agua mezclado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14396,3752,'es','Buñuelos de maíz dulce','Aprovecha al máximo el maíz dulce con estos crujientes buñuelos. Disfrútalos para el brunch, el almuerzo o como guarnición.','["150 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","160ml de leche entera","1 huevo","550 g de maíz dulce","2 cebolletas picadas, más un poco más cortada en tiras finas para servir (opcional)","10 g de cebollino en rodajas","un puñado de perejil picado","aceite de colza, para freír"]','["Mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear, el pimentón y la leche en un tazón grande. Incorpora el huevo, seguido del maíz dulce, las cebolletas picadas, el cebollino, el perejil, 1 cucharadita de sal y un poco de pimienta negra recién molida.","Calienta 1 cm de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio hasta que una pequeña cantidad de la mezcla de buñuelos chisporrotee cuando se deja caer. Para buñuelos más grandes, deja caer 2 cucharadas colmadas de la mezcla en la sartén a la vez en el sentido de las agujas del reloj (esto te ayudará a recordar el orden en que se agregaron a la sartén, para que puedas darles la vuelta en el momento correcto). Para buñuelos más pequeños, haz lo mismo, pero con 1 cucharada colmada de mezcla a la vez.","Después de 2 minutos, voltea los buñuelos en el mismo orden en que fueron agregados a la sartén. Cocine por otros 2 minutos, y continúe volteándolos de vez en cuando para asegurarse de que ambos lados estén dorados uniformemente. Cuando estén listos, los buñuelos deben tener un color marrón más oscuro y trozos de maíz crujientes en los bordes; tenga cuidado, ya que algunos de los granos pueden reventar durante el proceso de cocción. Retirar sobre una rejilla y quitar el exceso de aceite con papel de cocina. Sirva inmediatamente con unas tiras de cebolleta esparcidas por encima, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14397,3756,'es','pasta halloumi','Agregue los fuertes sabores del halloumi a la pasta junto con aceitunas, calabacín y tomate. El halloumi tiene más sal que el queso cheddar, por lo que un poco es suficiente','["250 g de penne integral","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","120 g de halloumi, partido por la mitad a través de la costura y cortado en cubos","325 g de tomates pera en rama, cortados por la mitad","320 g de calabacines cortados en cubos","3 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","6 aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas y cortadas en cuartos","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","10 g de perejil picado"]','["Hervir la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, profunda y antiadherente a fuego medio y fríe el halloumi, revolviendo ocasionalmente durante 3 minutos hasta que se dore. Vierta sobre un plato, luego cocine los tomates en la sartén durante 1-2 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Vierta en el tazón de halloumi.","Vierta los calabacines y el ajo en la sartén, saltee brevemente, luego vierta los tomates enlatados y agregue las aceitunas y el orégano. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Escurre la pasta y agrega la salsa junto con el perejil, el halloumi y los tomates pera pequeños. Sirva la mitad inmediatamente y luego deje el resto para otro día. Se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado hasta por tres días. Vuelve a calentar en una sartén con un chorrito de agua a fuego medio hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:02:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14398,3758,'es','magdalenas saladas','Prepare un lote de estos sencillos y sabrosos muffins para su próximo picnic o un almuerzo sencillo. Estos bocados de queso con verduras de temporada son excelentes para las loncheras','["1 calabacín (unos 175 g de peso rallado)","4 cebolletas, finamente picadas","225 g de harina con levadura","1 pimiento rojo asado de un frasco, escurrido y finamente picado","100 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","unas ramitas de romero, agujas recogidas y finamente picadas","2 huevos batidos","90 ml de aceite de girasol","50-100 ml de leche entera"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar un molde para muffins de ocho agujeros con moldes para muffins. Ralla el calabacín en trozos grandes en un colador fino y usa las manos limpias para exprimir la mayor cantidad de líquido posible sobre el fregadero. Vierta en un bol con las cebolletas, la harina, el pimiento rojo asado, la mayor parte del queso y el romero, junto con mucha pimienta negra y una pizca de sal.","Rompe los huevos en una jarra, vierte el aceite y completa con suficiente leche para obtener 300 ml. Batir, luego verter en la mezcla de calabacín y mezclar hasta obtener una masa suave. Divida entre las cajas, cubra con el queso restante y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que suba, esté firme y dorado por encima. Dejar enfriar completamente sobre una rejilla. Se conservará hasta tres días en un recipiente hermético en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 13:02:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14399,3762,'es','Timbal de calabacín y salchicha','Disfruta de este timballo de salchicha, mozzarella y calabacín frío o caliente. Es una excelente manera de consumir un exceso de calabacines si ha cultivado un cultivo en el jardín.','["nuez de mantequilla, para la lata","6 calabacines","2-3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","4 salchichas de tu elección","2-3 cucharadas de pasta de nduja (dependiendo de su preferencia por el chile picante)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de hierbas secas mixtas","300 g de penne","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, escurrida y cortada en trozos"]','["Unte con mantequilla un molde desmontable de 20 cm y reserve. Corte finamente 5 de los calabacines a lo largo con un cuchillo afilado o una mandolina; debe obtener de 6 a 8 rodajas de cada calabacín. Calienta 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-bajo y fríe las rodajas de calabacín durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas (deberás hacerlo en tandas, añadiendo un chorrito de aceite entre cada tanda). Retirar sobre una hoja de papel de cocina o un paño de cocina limpio para escurrir. Dejar enfriar y luego utilizar para forrar el molde, dejando los extremos sobresaliendo del borde. Te deberían sobrar algunas rodajas; déjelos a un lado para usarlos en la parte superior más tarde. Pon el molde en una bandeja para horno. Dejar de lado.","Picar finamente el calabacín restante. Calienta 2 cucharaditas de aceite en la misma sartén a fuego medio y sofríe la cebolla durante 5 minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Exprima la carne de la salchicha sin piel en la sartén y continúe friendo durante unos minutos más, aplastando la salchicha con el dorso de la cuchara hasta que comience a dorarse. Agregue el calabacín picado y cocine de 5 a 8 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Agrega la pasta de nduja y fríe durante 2 minutos más, luego agrega los tomates y las hierbas y fríe durante 4-5 minutos más hasta que todo esté combinado y bien caliente. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cocine el penne en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, escúrralo, vuelva a colocarlo en la cacerola y agregue la salsa de calabacín y tomate junto con los trozos de mozzarella. Vierta la pasta en la lata forrada con calabacines, apretándola para que quede bien ajustada. Doble los calabacines que sobresalen sobre la pasta, luego coloque las rodajas de calabacín restantes encima, metiéndolas hacia los lados si es posible. Hornee durante 35-45 minutos hasta que esté bien caliente y las rodajas de calabacín estén doradas. Déjelo enfriar en el molde durante 20 minutos, luego inviértalo en un plato grande para servir, levante el molde y córtelo en gajos para servir. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días y se puede comer frío o caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:02:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14400,3764,'es','Horneado de bacalao y tomates cherry','Pruebe este nutritivo horneado de bacalao, tomate, frijoles y papas que es fácil de preparar y cuenta como dos de sus cinco comidas al día. Puede estar listo en menos de 30 minutos.','["200 g de tomates cherry en rama, cortados por la mitad","3 cucharadas de hojas de albahaca finamente picadas","6 aceitunas Kalamata, partidas por la mitad","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 lomos de bacalao de unos 130 g cada uno","300 g de patatas nuevas, partidas por la mitad","180 g de judías verdes finas, con las puntas cortadas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle los tomates cherry con 2 cucharadas de albahaca, las aceitunas, el ajo y el aceite, en una fuente pequeña para horno, poco profunda, antiadherente, para asar. Añade los lomos de bacalao y hornea durante 15-18 minutos hasta que el bacalao esté bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, hierva las patatas en una sartén con una vaporera encima para cocinar los frijoles, ambos durante 15 minutos, hasta que estén tiernos.","Disponer las judías en el centro de dos platos y colocar encima el bacalao. Echar los tomates y todo su jugo en un bol y mezclar con el resto de la albahaca, el aceite de oliva virgen extra y el vinagre balsámico. Vierta sobre el bacalao y sirva las patatas a un lado. Espolvoree un poco de pimienta negra molida, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14401,3766,'es','Asados ​​de verduras de verano','Prepara estas coloridas tostadas de verduras en solo 30 minutos. Llenos de verduras de verano, son una comida entre semana sabrosa, saludable y baja en calorías.','["4 mini tortillas","4 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","1 calabacín, cortado por la mitad a lo largo, en cuartos y luego cortado en trozos de 3 cm","Lata de 198 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","80 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","2 cebolletas, cortadas y cortadas finamente","250 g de guisantes congelados y descongelados","1 diente de ajo, pelado","2 ramitas de menta, con las hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes, y más para servir","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","2 limas, 1 en jugo y 1 cortada en gajos para servir","80 gramos de yogur natural"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Unta las tortillas con 2 cucharaditas de aceite y colócalas en dos bandejas para hornear. Sazone ligeramente. Hornee durante 5 minutos, luego déles la vuelta, gire las bandejas y cocine durante 3 minutos más hasta que estén crujientes y doradas. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto. Agregue el calabacín y el maíz dulce y cocine, revolviendo un par de veces hasta que comiencen a tomar color en los bordes, aproximadamente de 6 a 8 minutos. Agrega el pimentón ahumado y cocina por un minuto más. Deje enfriar un poco antes de agregar los tomates y las cebolletas y luego un poco de condimento al gusto.","Coloque los guisantes, el ajo, la menta, la mayor parte del cilantro, el jugo de limón y el aceite restante en un mini procesador de alimentos con un poco de condimento y presione hasta obtener una consistencia similar a la del guacamole. Agrega un chorrito de agua si está demasiado espesa.","Para servir, unte cada tortilla con la salsa de guisantes y cubra con las verduras. Adorne con el cilantro restante y una cucharada de yogur. Sirva con rodajas de lima a un lado para exprimirlas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14402,3768,'es','sopa de maíz dulce','Combine diferentes alliums para darle un sabor a cebolla en capas a esta sopa de maíz dulce vegetariana. La dulzura del maíz combina maravillosamente con la cebolla.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla pequeña, picada","8 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","400 g de patatas nuevas, peladas y partidas por la mitad","1 litro de caldo de verduras","500 g de granos de maíz dulce","200ml de leche","manojo pequeño de cebollino, picado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola a fuego medio. Agregue las cebollas pequeñas picadas y la mayoría de las cebolletas en rodajas (reservando unas 2 cucharadas) y fríalas durante 6 a 8 minutos, hasta que estén suaves pero no doradas. Esparcir las patatas y sofreír durante 4 minutos, para que se ablanden un poco, luego verter el caldo y llevar a ebullición. Reduzca el fuego a medio-bajo y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos. Sazone al gusto, luego agregue el maíz dulce y vierta la leche. Cocine durante 3-4 minutos hasta que el maíz esté tierno. En este punto, puedes servirlo en trozos o mezclarlo con una batidora de mano para desmenuzarlo un poco. Divida en tazones y luego esparza las cebolletas antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14403,3770,'es','Tazón de batido','Prepara un colorido tazón de batido de frutos rojos para el desayuno. Puedes cambiar mango, piña y kiwi y sustituir la leche de avena por agua de coco para obtener una versión tropical.','["200 g de frutos rojos congelados","1 plátano maduro","75ml de leche de avena","1 cucharadita de jarabe de arce","½ cucharada de proteína de vainilla en polvo, versión vegana si es necesario","kiwis en rodajas, plátanos y bayas frescas","25 g de granola","1 cucharada de nueces y semillas mixtas","1 cucharada de mantequilla de almendras"]','["Coloque las bayas, el plátano, la leche de avena, el jarabe de arce y la proteína en polvo en una licuadora potente y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Añade un chorrito más de leche si es necesario, pero recuerda que tiene que quedar bastante espesa.","Vierta el batido en un tazón y salpique sobre la fruta fresca, la granola y la mezcla de nueces y semillas. Rocíe sobre la mantequilla de almendras para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14404,3772,'es','Perritos calientes al estilo de Nueva York con cebollas callejeras','Pruebe estos hot dogs inspirados en la ciudad de Nueva York: salchichas cubiertas con la clásica cebolla caramelizada, ketchup, mostaza americana y un poco de chucrut.','["4 salchichas grandes","4 panes para hot dog, partidos","chucrut, para servir","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas grandes, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas","1⁄4 cucharadita de canela molida","una pizca grande de chile en polvo","2 cucharadas de miel","2 cucharaditas de mostaza estilo americano, más extra para servir","2 cucharaditas de salsa de tomate, más extra para servir","2 cucharaditas de puré de tomate","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de sidra o de vino blanco","1 cucharadita de salsa inglesa"]','["Primero, haz las cebollas. Caliente el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo y cocine las cebollas durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén doradas y ligeramente carbonizadas en algunos puntos.","Agrega la canela, el chile en polvo, la miel, la mostaza, el ketchup, el puré de tomate, el vinagre, la salsa inglesa, 2-3 cucharadas de agua y una pizca de sal. Cocine a fuego lento durante 1-2 minutos hasta que las cebollas estén picantes, agregando un chorrito más de agua si parecen secas. Prueba y añade un poco más de guindilla en polvo, mostaza o una pizca de azúcar, si quieres. Mantenga las cebollas calientes si las va a servir inmediatamente o déjelas enfriar. Se conservarán en un recipiente hermético en el refrigerador hasta por cinco días. Vuelva a calentar a fuego lento antes de servir, agregando un chorrito de agua para aflojar según sea necesario.","Enciende una barbacoa y espera hasta que las brasas estén cenicientas, pon una barbacoa de gas a fuego medio o calienta una plancha a fuego medio. Alternativamente, ponga una cacerola con agua a fuego lento. Cocine las salchichas durante 15 minutos en la barbacoa o en una plancha hasta que se quemen, o durante 8 minutos en una cacerola con agua hirviendo. Si usa una barbacoa, caliente los panecillos sobre las brasas, si lo desea. Coloque un poco de chucrut en cada panecillo, cubra con una salchicha y vierta sobre las cebollas. Rocíe un poco más de mostaza y ketchup."]','2026-01-11 13:02:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14405,3774,'es','Tarta filo de gambas, pimientos y garbanzos','Pruebe una versión más ligera de un pastel tradicional cubierto de masa, con relleno de gambas, pimientos y garbanzos. La masa filo también le aporta un crujido excelente.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más 1 cucharadita","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1-2 cucharaditas de harissa, al gusto","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","300 g de langostinos crudos","3 pimientos rojos asados ​​de un frasco, finamente picados","300 ml de caldo de verduras","1 limón, cortado en gajos","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","6 láminas de masa filo"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén refractaria a fuego medio y agrega la cebolla y el ajo. Cocine a fuego lento durante unos minutos hasta que se ablanden un poco. Agregue la harissa y el puré de tomate y cocine por 3 minutos más. Agregue los garbanzos, las gambas, los pimientos y el caldo.","Llevar a fuego lento, luego sazonar, revolver con un chorrito de jugo de limón y perejil. Extienda las láminas de masa encima y unte con el aceite de oliva restante. Hornee por 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante. Servir con rodajas de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:02:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14406,3776,'es','Rollitos de verano crujientes de tofu con salsa de anacardos','Haga veganos estos vibrantes rollitos de verano de tofu llenos de verduras simplemente cambiando la salsa de pescado por una variedad vegana','["2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo","200 g de tofu ahumado, cortado en cubos de 1 cm","200 g de fideos de arroz","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado vegetariana","14 envolturas de papel de arroz","½ manojo pequeño de menta, con las hojas recogidas","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas","1 zanahoria grande, cortada en palitos finos","½ pepino, cortado en palitos finos","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","100 g de mantequilla de anacardo suave","1 cucharada de salsa de soja ligera","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio. Seque el tofu con palmaditas y luego fríalo durante 5 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Retirar a un bol y reservar.","Vierta los fideos de arroz en un recipiente hondo resistente al calor y cúbralos con agua hirviendo del hervidor. Dejar en remojo durante 15 minutos, luego escurrir y enjuagar con agua fría para detener el proceso de cocción. Batir el aceite de sésamo restante, el vinagre de arroz, el azúcar moreno y la salsa de pescado, luego verter los fideos y mezclar para cubrirlos.","Para la salsa, combine la mantequilla de anacardo, la salsa de soja, el vinagre y el ajo, luego agregue lentamente 50 ml de agua hirviendo del hervidor para aflojar.","Para armar los panecillos, sumerja uno de los envoltorios de papel de arroz en un recipiente con agua caliente, agitándolo hasta que el envoltorio esté suave, aproximadamente de 10 a 15 segundos. Transfiera a un paño de cocina limpio para escurrir. Transfiera el envoltorio a una tabla y coloque algunas hojas de menta y cilantro a lo largo de un borde, seguido de algunos palitos de zanahoria y pepino, un poco de tofu frito y algunos de los fideos aliñados. Levante el borde del envoltorio hacia arriba y sobre el relleno y, manteniendo el relleno en su posición con los dedos, comience a enrollarlo con fuerza. Cuando esté aproximadamente a la mitad, doble los extremos del envoltorio para encerrar el relleno, luego continúe enrollando para sellar. Repita con los envoltorios restantes y el relleno.","Para servir, corte los panecillos por la mitad en diagonal. Espolvorea las semillas de sésamo sobre la salsa y sírvela junto para mojarla."]','2026-01-11 13:02:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14407,3778,'es','galletas de mantequilla escocesas','Haz unos sencillos cuadrados de galletas de mantequilla escocesas para la lata de galletas usando solo cuatro ingredientes. Son perfectos para disfrutarlos con una taza de té a media mañana.','["250 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para la lata","350 g de harina común","50 g de harina de arroz","100 g de azúcar en polvo, más 1 cucharada"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde de 28 x 18 cm. En un procesador de alimentos, mezcle la mantequilla, ambas harinas, ½ cucharadita de sal y los 100 g de azúcar hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino. Pulse unas cuantas veces más hasta que forme una bola áspera. Alternativamente, ponga todos los ingredientes en un bol y frótelos con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino. Forme una masa flexible y presione hacia abajo en el molde preparado. Con un cuchillo afilado, marque la masa en 16 barras.","Espolvoree el azúcar restante y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y cuajado. Retirar y pinchar la masa por todos lados. Deje enfriar en el molde durante 5 minutos antes de transferirlo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo. Con un cuchillo afilado, corte las puntuaciones anteriores para separarlas por completo."]','2026-01-11 13:02:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14408,3780,'es','ensalada capresse','Prepare esta clásica ensalada tricolor italiana como entrante o acompañamiento. Es increíblemente sencillo pero, cuando se hace con tomates perfectamente maduros, es una auténtica delicia.','["8 tomates pera maduros, rebanados","2 bolas de mozzarella (o alternativa vegetariana), en rodajas","un puñado de hojas de albahaca","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico"]','["Coloca las rodajas de tomate y mozzarella en un plato, alternando entre rodajas de cada uno, y espolvorea sobre las hojas de albahaca. Sazone generosamente con sal y pimienta negra, luego rocíe con aceite de oliva y vinagre. Sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:02:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14409,3782,'es','Patatas fritas de calabacín','Deshazte de las patatas y prueba estas deliciosas patatas fritas con calabacín como aperitivo o guarnición. Espolvorear con parmesano antes de servir.','["2 cucharadas de harina común","2 calabacines, cortados en bastones de 1 cm","aceite, para freír","15 g de parmesano rallado"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón, rocíe con 2 cucharadas de agua y mezcle hasta formar una masa espesa. Sazone con abundante sal y pimienta negra recién molida y luego mezcle los calabacines.","Vierta aceite en una sartén hasta que tenga unos 4 cm de profundidad, asegurándose de que la sartén no esté más de dos tercios de su capacidad. Colóquelo a fuego medio hasta que alcance 180 ° C o un poco de masa chisporrotee y se dore en 30 segundos. Sumerja la mitad de los calabacines rebozados en el aceite caliente y fríalos, volteándolos después de 1 minuto con una espumadera, durante 5-6 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Si comienzan a pegarse, sepárelos suavemente con unas pinzas. Retirar del aceite caliente y escurrir en un plato forrado con una hoja de papel de cocina. Repita con la mitad restante, luego espolvoree con el parmesano antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14410,3784,'es','Strogonoff de cerdo','Disfrute de nuestro stroganoff para una cena principal informal. Un excelente plato para llevar, lo hemos preparado con carne de cerdo y le agregamos mostaza Dijon y champiñones adicionales para darle más sabor.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","500 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas","400 g de filete de cerdo, cortado en trozos de 1 cm","2 cebollas, cortadas en medias lunas","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharaditas de mostaza Dijon","200 ml de caldo de cerdo o pollo","Bote de 284 ml o 300 ml de crema agria","2 cucharadas de perejil picado","arroz cocido, patatas o tallarines, para servir"]','["Calentar 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y sofreír la mitad de los champiñones durante unos minutos hasta que suelte su líquido y se evapore. Retirar de la sartén y reservar, luego repetir con los champiñones restantes y otras 2 cucharaditas de aceite. Dejar de lado. En la misma sartén, sofreír la carne de cerdo durante 5-8 minutos en 2 cucharaditas de aceite hasta que se dore. Dejar de lado.","Freír las cebollas en la cucharada de aceite restante a fuego medio-bajo hasta que comiencen a caramelizarse, alrededor de 10 a 12 minutos, luego colocar los champiñones junto con la carne de cerdo. Espolvoree sobre el pimentón y agregue la mostaza de Dijon. Dale a todo una buena mezcla para combinar. Vierta el caldo, sazone bien con sal y pimienta y vuelva a mezclar. En este punto, puede retirar del fuego, dejar enfriar, luego tapar y enfriar. Se mantendrá frío durante tres días o congelado hasta por tres meses. Cuando esté listo para servir, descongélelo completamente antes de llevarlo a fuego lento y continuar con la receta.","Revuelva con la crema agria. Cocine durante unos 2 minutos más para asegurarse de que la carne esté bien caliente, luego esparza el perejil picado. Sirva con arroz, patatas o tallarines, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14411,3786,'es','sopa de apio nabo','Deja que esta abundante sopa de apio nabo te caliente en los días fríos. Cubra con nuestro crumble de avellanas para darle un toque más crujiente y sirva para el almuerzo o como entrante de un menú de invierno.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, rebanada","2 ramas de apio, cortadas en cubitos","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 apio nabo pequeño (unos 800 g), pelado y cortado en cubitos","500 ml de caldo de verduras","¼ cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","50 ml de crema fresca baja en grasas","2 cucharadas de avellanas, picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de pan rallado panko","un puñado pequeño de cebollino, finamente picado"]','["Calienta la mitad del aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio-bajo. Sudar la cebolla, el apio y el ajo con la sartén parcialmente tapada durante 15 minutos, hasta que se ablanden. Vierta el apio y vierta sobre el caldo. Llevar a fuego lento, tapar y cocinar durante 15-20 minutos, hasta que el apio esté tierno. Retirar del fuego, agregar la nuez moscada, la crema fresca y un poco de condimento. Bate con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite restante en una sartén a fuego medio. Freír las avellanas y el pan rallado a fuego lento durante unos minutos, hasta que estén tostadas. Poner en un bol, agregar las cebolletas y sazonar. Sirva la sopa en tazones y vierta sobre el crumble de avellanas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14412,3787,'es','flapjacks de manzana','Estos flapjacks añaden un toque afrutado a los clásicos pasteles de avena con una mezcla de manzana fresca y seca, y son un refrigerio ganador para toda la familia cuando estás de viaje o de picnic.','["175 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para la lata","2-3 manzanas (unos 350 g), peladas, sin corazón y cortadas en trozos pequeños","200 g de almíbar dorado","150 g de azúcar moreno blando","300 g de gachas de avena","50 g de manzanas secas, picadas","1/2 cucharadita de canela molida (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla la base de un molde cuadrado de 20 x 20 cm y forrar con papel de horno. Vierta las manzanas picadas en una cacerola pequeña con 2 cucharaditas de agua y cocine a fuego medio durante 3-4 minutos hasta que las manzanas estén lo suficientemente suaves como para triturarlas, pero todavía quede un poco de agua en la cacerola. Si es necesario, añade un poco más de agua y cocina las manzanas un poco más. Retirar del fuego y triturar las manzanas con un machacador de patatas o un tenedor para que se rompan un poco, luego verterlas en un bol y reservar.","Vierta la mantequilla, el almíbar dorado y el azúcar en la sartén y caliente a fuego lento hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y el azúcar se disuelva. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Combine la avena, la manzana seca y la canela, si la usa, en un tazón grande. Vierta la mezcla de almíbar mantecoso y las manzanas cocidas, luego revuelva para combinar. Vierta la mezcla de flapjack en el molde preparado y presione firmemente. Nivele la superficie con una espátula, luego hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorada y burbujeante por los lados. Dejar enfriar. Cortar en 16 trozos. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14413,3789,'es','Rollito de tiramisú y merengue','Combine tiramisú y merengue para hacer un postre impresionante. El merengue crujiente contrasta maravillosamente con la sedosa crema de café en esta receta.','["4 claras de huevo grandes a temperatura ambiente","200 g de azúcar en polvo","azúcar glas y cacao en polvo, para espolvorear","200ml de nata doble","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","150 g de mascarpone","3 cucharadas de licor de café masala o licor de café normal (opcional)","4 cucharadas de café instantáneo, disuelto en 50 ml de agua hirviendo y dejado enfriar un poco","100 g de chocolate negro, derretido y dejado enfriar un poco"]','["Primero, haz la ganache. Batir el café y el chocolate derretido hasta obtener una mezcla suave y brillante. Dejar enfriar y espesar, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar una bandeja para hornear de 23 x 32 cm con papel para hornear. Para el merengue, batir con unas varillas eléctricas las claras y una pizca de sal hasta que estén ligeramente firmes.","Agregue 1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo a las claras de huevo, luego bata nuevamente hasta obtener picos rígidos. Repetir con el resto del azúcar, cucharada a cucharada, hasta que la mezcla esté espesa y brillante. Distribuya uniformemente en la bandeja, luego hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos, o hasta que esté crujiente al tacto y ligeramente dorado en algunos lugares. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Para el relleno de crema de mascarpone, poner la nata, el azúcar, el mascarpone y el licor, si se usa, en un tazón mediano y batir hasta que espese.","Para armar, tamice un poco de azúcar glas sobre una hoja grande de papel para hornear y luego voltee con cuidado el merengue enfriado sobre ella. Retire el molde y retire el papel para hornear. Con el extremo corto hacia ti, marca una línea de 2 cm en el borde del merengue. Extienda la ganache uniformemente sobre el merengue, luego cubra con la crema, alisándola con una espátula, luego enrolle con cuidado hasta formar un rollo, comenzando por el extremo marcado y usando el pergamino como ayuda. Transfiera a un plato para servir y espolvoree con cacao en polvo."]','2026-01-11 13:02:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14414,3793,'es','Ensalada de manzana y queso feta','Combine manzanas, hojas mixtas y queso feta para hacer esta ensalada versátil con aderezo de limón, aceite de oliva y miel; también puede espolvorear un poco de pul biber, si lo desea.','["3 manzanas rojas pequeñas (como Braeburn o Gala), sin corazón, cortadas en cuartos y cortadas en 4 rodajas por cuarto","100 g de hojas mixtas","200 g de queso feta, partido en trozos pequeños","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas colmadas de miel clara","un par de pizcas de pul biber (opcional)"]','["Mezcle las manzanas y las hojas y colóquelas en un plato. Salpique con queso feta y luego esparza sobre la ralladura de limón.","Combina el jugo de limón, el aceite de oliva, la miel, una generosa pizca de pimienta negra recién molida y una buena pizca de sal. Rocíe el aderezo sobre la ensalada y espolvoree con un poco de pul biber, si lo usa."]','2026-01-11 13:02:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14415,3795,'es','Halloumi freidora de aire','Cocinar halloumi en una freidora en lugar de en una parrilla o sartén ayuda a reducir el contenido de grasa. Sazone con pimentón ahumado o hierbas mixtas, si lo desea, para darle una explosión adicional de sabor.','["225 g de halloumi, cortado en rodajas de 6 cm x 1 cm de grosor","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado, hierbas mixtas u otros saborizantes (opcional)"]','["Calienta tu freidora a 200 ° C durante 2 minutos. Seque con cuidado el halloumi con papel de cocina o un paño limpio, luego cepille o frote con aceite. Sazone con sal y pimienta y cualquier saborizante, si lo usa.","Coloque el halloumi en la canasta de la freidora y cocine durante 8 minutos hasta que comience a dorarse. Voltee y cocine durante 2-5 minutos más hasta que esté crujiente y dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14416,3797,'es','gofres clásicos','Prepare gofres salados o dulces con esta mezcla de masa todo en uno. Para obtener gofres aún más ligeros, bata la clara de huevo hasta que quede esponjosa y luego incorpore la masa.','["1 huevo","225 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada (opcional)","250ml de leche","50 g de mantequilla, derretida y enfriada","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla (opcional)","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o vegetal","jarabe de arce y azúcar glas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Rompe el huevo (para gofres más esponjosos, usa solo la yema en esta etapa) en un tazón grande, luego agrega la harina y una pizca generosa de sal. Agregue el azúcar, si lo usa, luego agregue gradualmente la leche y luego la mantequilla derretida hasta que quede suave. Incorpora la vainilla, si la usas. Si ha elegido hacer gofres más esponjosos, bata la clara de huevo hasta obtener picos suaves y luego incorpórelo suavemente a la masa. Alternativamente, prepare la masa mezclando todos los ingredientes con una batidora de mano o una licuadora. Puede prepararse con 1 o 2 horas de anticipación y enfriarse.","Caliente una máquina para hacer gofres siguiendo las instrucciones del fabricante, unte con un poco de aceite y luego vierta con un cucharón suficiente masa para cubrir la superficie. Cocine siguiendo las instrucciones del fabricante (generalmente de 5 a 6 minutos) hasta que los gofres estén dorados y crujientes. Sirva inmediatamente o manténgalo caliente en el horno bajo mientras prepara el resto. Rocíe con jarabe de arce o espolvoree con azúcar glas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14417,3799,'es','Chile de verduras y frijoles','Este saludable chile vegetal es una cena rápida y satisfactoria, repleta de legumbres y coloridas verduras frescas.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","jengibre, finamente picado","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 calabacines, cortados en cubitos","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 pimiento amarillo, sin semillas y picado","1 cucharada de chile en polvo","100 g de lentejas rojas lavadas y escurridas","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2x latas de tomates picados","Lata de 195 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","Lata de 420 g de judías con mantequilla, escurridas","Lata de 400 g de frijoles en agua, escurridos"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Cocine el ajo, el jengibre, la cebolla, los calabacines y los pimientos durante unos 5 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agrega el chile en polvo y cocina por 1 min más.","Agrega las lentejas, el puré de tomate, los tomates y 250 ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar durante 15-20 minutos.","Agrega el maíz dulce y los frijoles y cocina por 10 minutos más."]','2026-01-11 13:02:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14418,3801,'es','Pan de plátano sin azúcar','Esta receta está endulzada naturalmente con fruta y un chorrito opcional de jarabe de agave, lo que significa que se requiere menos azúcar agregada en este pan de plátano.','["125 g de harina integral con levadura","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","75 g de pasas","50 g de mantequilla, derretida","2 cucharaditas de esencia de vainilla","1 huevo","1 cucharada de leche","3 plátanos maduros, triturados","rocíe jarabe de agave para servir (opcional)"]','["Adultos: Precaliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador de 160 ° C / marca de gas 4. Engrase y forre un molde de 450 g / 1 libra con papel para hornear.","Niños: Pesar en un bol la harina, la levadura, la canela y las pasas y mezclar con una cuchara de madera. Luego pesa la mantequilla, la esencia de vainilla, el huevo, la leche y el puré de plátano y ponlo en otro bol o jarra y mezcla con un batidor de globo pequeño o un tenedor. Vierta la mezcla de plátano \"húmeda\" en la mezcla de harina \"seca\" y combine bien con una cuchara de madera. El pesaje debe ser muy preciso al hornear, así que ayude a los niños mayores a medir con cuidado. Los niños más pequeños también pueden participar sirviéndolos con cuchara o vertiéndolos en la báscula bajo la supervisión de un adulto. Los niños más pequeños también pueden batir el huevo con un tenedor y triturar el plátano con un machacador de patatas.","Adultos: Vierta la mezcla del pastel en el molde preparado y hornee durante 30 a 40 minutos o hasta que al insertar un pincho en el medio, éste salga limpio. Retirar del horno, dejar enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego desmoldar.","Niños: Rocíe con jarabe de agave si lo usa."]','2026-01-11 13:02:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14419,3809,'es','Brócoli frito al jengibre con anacardos','Pruebe nuestro brócoli frito con jengibre para una cena vegetariana saludable. Es un poco como arroz frito pero con brócoli rico en antioxidantes.','["320 g de cabeza de brócoli, tallos y floretes separados","40 g de anacardos, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","15 g de jengibre, finamente cortado","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en tiras finas","1 zanahoria grande (160 g), cortada en tiras finas","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado, más rodajas adicionales, para servir","1 cucharada de tamari","1 lima, exprimida y rallada","7 g de cilantro picado y un poco más para servir","2 huevos batidos"]','["Mezcle los tallos de brócoli en un procesador de alimentos hasta que estén finamente picados. Agregue los floretes y presione nuevamente para lograr una textura similar a la del arroz.","Tuesta ligeramente los anacardos en una sartén awokor, luego viértalos en un plato y reserva. Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego alto y agrega el jengibre, la cebolla, el pimiento, la zanahoria, el ajo y la guindilla. Sofríe durante 2-3 minutos hasta que empiece a dorarse, luego tapa y cocina por otros 2 minutos.","Agrega el brócoli y 3 cucharadas de agua y sofríe durante 3 minutos hasta que todas las verduras estén tiernas. Vierta el tamari, el jugo de lima, la ralladura y el cilantro, revuelva bien, luego vierta los huevos y saltee muy brevemente hasta que cuaje. Sirva con anacardos, cilantro extra y chile en rodajas extra esparcidos, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14420,3811,'es','Ensalada de quinua con verduras ralladas y pasas','Muestre la quinua en esta maravillosa ensalada, con verduras, aguacate, queso feta y pasas. Más que un grano, la quinua es una semilla y es una gran fuente de proteínas.','["150g quinua","3 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","200 g de col rizada, rallada","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y picado en trozos pequeños","30g de uvas","2 aguacates pequeños, picados","40 g de queso feta vegetariano"]','["Enjuague la quinua en un colador con agua corriente hasta que el agua salga clara, luego cocínela durante 20 minutos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Dejar reposar 5 min. Enjuagar nuevamente y escurrir bien presionando en el colador.","Mientras tanto, poner el vinagre y el aceite en un bol grande, añadir el cavolo nero y masajear el aderezo con las manos para suavizarlo.","Agrega la quinua, la cebolla, el pimiento y las pasas, luego revuelve bien. Coloque la mitad en platos, esparza sobre 1 aguacate picado, desmenuce la mitad del queso feta y revuelva. El resto se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. Cubra con el aguacate y el queso feta restantes, luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:02:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14421,3815,'es','Palomitas de maíz picantes para microondas','Disfrute de un refrigerio que es más saludable que las patatas fritas. El aceite de sésamo agrega sabor y ayuda a que las especias se adhieran a las palomitas de maíz, pero puedes usar aceite de oliva o de colza en su lugar.','["50 g de granos de maíz","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharadita de ajo granulado","2-3 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado"]','["Vierta los granos de maíz en un tazón grande resistente al calor, tápelos y cocínelos en el microondas durante 5 a 8 minutos, o hasta que deje de estallar.","Agregue el aceite y las especias y revuelva bien para cubrir. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 13:02:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14422,3819,'es','Huevos revueltos al microondas','Prepare un delicioso desayuno con huevos revueltos en un abrir y cerrar de ojos: este plato rico en proteínas tarda solo cuatro minutos en el microondas.','["2 huevos","2 cucharadas de leche entera","tostadas, para servir"]','["Utiliza un tenedor para batir los huevos, la leche y una pizca de sal en una jarra apta para microondas. Cocine en el microondas a potencia Alta durante 30 segundos, luego vuelva a batir y regrese al microondas por otros 30 segundos.","Vuelva a batir, rompiendo los grumos de huevo. Cocine en el microondas por otros 15 segundos, luego vuelva a batir; Los huevos estarán sueltos en esta etapa, así que sírvelos inmediatamente si así te gustan. Si prefieres que los huevos estén un poco más firmes, mételos en el microondas durante 15 segundos más, bate y luego sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:02:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14423,3821,'es','taramasalata','Prepare taramasalata casera en lugar de comprarla en la tienda. Es más fácil de lo que piensas y es una excelente adición a un plato para pastar.','["100 g de pan blanco duro sin corteza (unas 5-6 rebanadas)","250 g de huevas de bacalao ahumadas","½ cebolla morada, picada","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 limón, exprimido","75 ml de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito para servir","75 ml de aceite de girasol","pitas tostadas, para servir"]','["Remoje el pan en un recipiente con agua fría, luego exprima el exceso y viértalo en un procesador de alimentos o licuadora. Corta la piel gruesa de los lóbulos de las huevas, raspa las huevas blandas de debajo y viértelas en el procesador de alimentos con el pan. Agregue la cebolla, el ajo, el jugo de limón y un buen molido de pimienta negra, luego mezcle hasta obtener una pasta.","Con el motor en marcha, vamos añadiendo poco a poco el aceite de oliva, luego el de girasol, hasta que todo se incorpore y quede una pasta un poco más espesa. Coloque la taramasalata en un tazón para servir, rocíe con un poco más de aceite de oliva y sirva con pittas tostadas para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:02:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14424,3823,'es','Salchichas para freidora','Cocine salchichas de forma rápida y sencilla utilizando una freidora y sin necesidad de aceite adicional','["6 salchichas de tu elección"]','["Perfore las salchichas varias veces con un cuchillo afilado (esto es opcional, pero ayudará a liberar más grasa). Coloque las salchichas en una sola capa en una canasta de freidora.","Configure la freidora a 180 ° C y cocine durante 10 a 15 minutos, volteándola cada 5 minutos, hasta que las salchichas estén bien cocidas. Si tienes un termómetro para carnes, comprueba que hayan alcanzado los 75 ° C en el medio. Sirva como acompañamiento para el desayuno o en panecillos."]','2026-01-11 13:02:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14425,3825,'es','Pechugas de pollo freidora','Utilice una freidora para crear este tentador plato de tiernas pechugas de pollo cubiertas con ajo, pimentón dulce y hierbas. Mezcle las especias para darle interés o manténgalo simple si lo prefiere.','["4 pechugas de pollo","½ cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cucharadita de sal","1 ½ cucharadita de ajo granulado","1 cucharadita de pimentón dulce ahumado","2 cucharaditas de hierbas mixtas","½ cucharadita de pimienta","arroz al vapor y verduras como brócoli o judías verdes o una ensalada verde, para servir (opcional)"]','["Cubra el pollo con aceite y reserve. En un bol, combine la sal, el ajo, el pimentón y las hierbas mixtas con un buen molido de pimienta negra y luego esparza en un plato.","Enrolle cada pechuga de pollo engrasada en el condimento y colóquela en la canasta de su freidora. Cocine a 180C durante 18-20 minutos, volteando después de 10 minutos. Para comprobar que está cocido, pincha el pollo con un cuchillo en la parte más gruesa para ver si el jugo sale claro. O inserte un termómetro de temperatura y debería indicar 70 ° C. Sirva con arroz y verduras o una ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:02:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14426,3827,'es','Salmón freidora','Los filetes de salmón se cocinan maravillosamente en una freidora y son una comida deliciosa cuando se cubren con un condimento de hierbas y se sirven con verduras y granos.','["1 cucharadita de sal","1 cucharadita de pimienta","1 cucharadita de hierbas mixtas","1 cucharadita de ajo granulado (opcional)","4 filetes de salmón (nosotros utilizamos 4 filetes de 130 g), con piel o sin piel","½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","verduras y granos cocidos de temporada, como quinua o arroz integral, para servir (opcional)"]','["Combine la sal, la pimienta, las hierbas mixtas y los gránulos de ajo, si los usa, en un tazón, luego esparza en un plato. Frote cada filete de salmón con un poco de aceite de oliva y enrolle el condimento para cubrirlo.","Coloque en la cesta de la freidora en una capa y cocine a 180 ° C durante 8 a 10 minutos, hasta que esté bien cocido. Si tiene filetes de salmón más grandes, será necesario cocinarlos por más tiempo; siga revisando después de 10 minutos y cocine en ráfagas de 1 a 2 minutos, hasta que estén listos. Sirva con verduras y quinua o arroz, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14427,3829,'es','Muslos de pollo freidora','Cocinar muslos de pollo en una freidora es una forma rápida de lograr una carne suculenta con una piel deliciosa y crujiente. Una capa picante da el toque final perfecto.','["1 cucharadita de pimentón","½ cucharadita de hierbas mixtas","½ cucharadita de ajo granulado (opcional)","4 muslos de pollo, con hueso","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva"]','["Combine el pimentón en un bol con las hierbas y el ajo granulado, si lo usa, junto con ½ cucharadita de sal y ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra molida. Distribuir en un plato. Frote los muslos de pollo con aceite y luego cúbralos con la mezcla de especias.","Colóquelo en la canasta de su freidora y cocine, con la piel hacia abajo, durante 10 minutos. Voltee y cocine por 10-15 minutos más hasta que esté bien cocido y la piel esté crujiente. Para comprobar que están cocidos, pinchamos con un cuchillo la parte más gruesa del muslo para ver si el jugo sale claro. Retirar de la freidora inmediatamente para evitar que la piel se ablande."]','2026-01-11 13:02:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14428,3835,'es','Pavlova de vainilla con piña y maracuyá','Prepara todos los elementos para estas pavlovas y deja que los niños las construyan. La piña y la maracuyá son una excelente combinación para la primavera, o pruebe las bayas en el verano.','["3 claras de huevo","115 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","200 g de crema fresca","25 g de azúcar glas","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de piña picada en trozos pequeños","2 maracuyás, sin semillas","hojas de menta, ralladas (opcional)"]','["Calienta el horno a 130C/110C ventilador/gas 1. Forra una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Dibuje cuatro círculos, de 8 a 10 cm de diámetro, en el papel para hornear y luego déles la vuelta. Bate las claras en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que se formen picos rígidos. Agregue gradualmente el azúcar hasta que esté espeso y brillante, luego la harina de maíz y el jugo de limón. Apila el merengue en remolinos sobre los círculos marcados, formando un baño en el medio, luego hornea en el estante más bajo durante 55 minutos a 1 hora hasta que esté crujiente por fuera y seco por dentro. Apague el horno, deje la puerta entreabierta y deje que los merengues se enfríen por completo. Se puede preparar con un día de anticipación y guardar en un recipiente hermético.","Batir la crème fraîche en un bol con el azúcar glas y el extracto de vainilla hasta que quede espesa y esponjosa. Mezcle la piña y la maracuyá en un recipiente aparte. Para armar, vierta una cuarta parte de la mezcla de crema fresca sobre cada merengue, cubra con piña y maracuyá y rocíe con el jugo de maracuyá. Termine con hojas de menta para servir, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14429,3837,'es','Tortitas de tarta de banoffee','Este Día de los Panqueques prueba una nueva versión del pastel banoffee. El pegajoso dulce de leche y los plátanos dulces son un aderezo irresistible para panqueques esponjosos','["3 huevos","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","100 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","80ml de leche","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","5 tbsp dulce de leche","2 plátanos, en rodajas","1 galleta digestiva, desmenuzada","chocolate rallado, para servir"]','["Separa los huevos, poniendo las claras en un bol y 2 de las yemas en otro bol (usa la tercera yema en otra receta). Mezclar las yemas con el azúcar, la harina, la levadura en polvo y la leche hasta formar una pasta suave.","Batir las claras y una pizca de sal con unas varillas eléctricas (o a mano) hasta que queden esponjosas y mantengan su forma. Incorpore suavemente la mezcla de yemas, teniendo cuidado de no perder el aire.","Calienta la mantequilla y el aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio. Vierta una cuarta parte (o la mitad si va a hacer dos panqueques más grandes) de la mezcla en la sartén y cocine por cada lado durante 1 a 2 minutos o hasta que estén dorados. Repita con la mezcla restante para hacer un total de 4 (o 2) panqueques. Mantenlos cubiertos.","Calienta suavemente el dulce de leche en una cacerola pequeña hasta que se suelte. Sirve los panqueques en dos platos y cubre con el plátano en rodajas, el dulce de leche, la galleta desmenuzada y el chocolate rallado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14430,3839,'es','Hummus de boniato picante','Evite el desperdicio y disfrute de un refrigerio abundante usando las sobras de batatas en esta receta de hummus: tiene un toque picante gracias al pimentón ahumado y las hojuelas de chile.','["2 batatas medianas (unos 400 g), peladas y cortadas en cubos de 2 cm","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","1⁄2 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile, más un poco más para servir (opcional)","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","3 dientes de ajo, sin pelar","2 cucharadas de tahini","1 limón, exprimido","crudités de verduras, palitos de pan o galletas saladas y aceitunas deshuesadas, para servir"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloca las batatas en una bandeja para hornear y rocía con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva. Espolvoree sobre las hojuelas de chile, si las usa, y el pimentón, luego mezcle para cubrir con el aceite especiado. Extender en una sola capa. Quite la raíz de los dientes de ajo y luego colóquelos entre las batatas. Ase durante 30-35 minutos hasta que las patatas se ablanden, revolviendo a la mitad.","Retirar la bandeja del horno y dejar enfriar por completo. Coloca las batatas en un procesador de alimentos y exprime el ajo de la piel. Agrega el tahini y el jugo de limón, luego bate durante 1 minuto hasta que las papas se deshagan.","Con el motor en marcha, vierte poco a poco el aceite de oliva restante. Continúe batiendo durante hasta 4 minutos o hasta obtener una pasta suave. Vierta 50-60 ml de agua fría para aflojar, mezcle nuevamente para combinar y luego sazone al gusto. Coloque el hummus en un tazón y revuélvalo con el dorso de una cucharadita, luego rocíe un poco más de aceite de oliva y espolvoree con hojuelas de chile adicionales, si lo desea. Sirva con su elección de verduras crudités, palitos de pan o galletas saladas y aceitunas para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:02:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14431,3841,'es','Crostini de frijoles cannellini triturados','Agregue un poco más de aceite a esta salsa de frijoles cannellini triturados, si lo prefiere; cuanto más agregue, más sedoso se vuelve','["4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar (opcional)","12 hojas de salvia (opcional)","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1⁄2 cucharadita de pimienta negra molida","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","1⁄2 limón, en jugo","12 crostini o palitos de pan, para servir (ver consejo a continuación)"]','["Caliente la mitad del aceite en una cacerola poco profunda a fuego medio-bajo y esparza las hojas de salvia, si las usa. Freír durante 2 minutos hasta que estén crujientes, colocar en un plato con una espumadera. Vierta la cebolla en la sartén y cocine por 3 minutos hasta que esté suave, luego agregue el ajo y cocine por 1 minuto más. Espolvoree la pimienta y tueste durante 1 minuto, luego agregue los frijoles. Apaga el fuego. Agrega el jugo de limón.","Sazone la mezcla con sal, luego viértala en un procesador de alimentos o mini picadora con el aceite restante. Mezcle todo hasta obtener la consistencia deseada; puede ser una pasta suave o rugosa. Se mantendrá tapado en el refrigerador durante dos días. Llevar a temperatura ambiente 1 hora antes de servir.","Sirva la salsa como está con crostini o palitos de pan, o rocíe con un poco más de aceite de oliva y cubra con las hojas crujientes de salvia, si las usa."]','2026-01-11 13:02:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14432,3843,'es','Ensalada de hinojo y rúcula raspada','Sirva nuestra ensalada de hinojo y rúcula como acompañamiento: el hinojo crudo puede ser fibroso, pero si lo corta en rodajas finas antes de encurtirlo ligeramente en jugo de limón, se descompone.','["1 bulbo de hinojo","1⁄2 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo (opcional)","1⁄2 limón, en jugo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","50g de rúcula"]','["Retire las hojas del bulbo de hinojo y reserve. Corte los tallos duros y luego corte el bulbo en rodajas finas con un cuchillo afilado o, idealmente, con mandolina. Vierta las rodajas de hinojo en un bol y, con las manos, triture una pizca grande de sal, las semillas de hinojo, si las usa, y el jugo de limón. Cubra y déjelo reposar a temperatura ambiente durante al menos 10 minutos, o enfríelo hasta por unas horas.","Para servir, rocíe el hinojo encurtido con aceite de oliva, luego mezcle la rúcula y las hojas de hinojo reservadas. Sirva directamente del tazón o apílelo en platos."]','2026-01-11 13:02:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14433,3847,'es','Ensalada verde primaveral con perejil y queso azul','Sirva esta vibrante ensalada con queso azul como cena ligera o guarnición. La col rizada o las acelgas también funcionarán en lugar de las hojas verdes de primavera.','["300 g de hojas verdes tiernas, sin tallos duros y hojas finamente cortadas","½ manojo grande de perejil picado","250 g de quinua ya cocida","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente cortada","100 g de queso azul, desmenuzado (asegúrese de que sea vegetariano si es necesario)","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","1 tsp Dijon mustard","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","35 g de nueces picadas (opcional)"]','["Pon la tetera a hervir. Coloque las verduras tiernas en un recipiente grande resistente al calor y cúbralas con agua hirviendo del hervidor, luego déjelas reposar durante 2 minutos para que se ablanden un poco. Escurrir bien y luego verter sobre un plato forrado con papel de cocina. Extienda las verduras en una sola capa para que el papel pueda absorber la mayor cantidad posible de exceso de agua. Dejar enfriar durante 2 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el perejil, la quinua y la cebolla morada. Mezcle las verduras tiernas, luego esparza sobre el queso y mezcle suavemente con las manos para combinar.","Batir la ralladura y el jugo de limón, la mostaza y el aceite de colza en una jarra para hacer un aderezo. Vierta esto sobre la ensalada verde primaveral y revuelva suavemente para combinar. Vierta la ensalada en una fuente grande para servir o sirva con una cuchara en tazones individuales y esparza sobre las nueces, si las usa. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:02:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14434,3853,'es','Kugel de patata y apio','Aligera la carga de carbohidratos reemplazando la mitad de la papa con apio nabo en este kugel de papa. El kugel de patata es un acompañamiento tradicional judío del sábado.','["6 cucharadas de aceite de colza, más un poco más para el plato","2 cebollas medianas, picadas","450 g de patatas con almidón, ralladas","450 g de apio nabo, cortado, pelado y rallado","1 huevo, ligeramente batido","2 cucharadas de perejil finamente picado, más un poco más para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y engrasar ligeramente una fuente para horno o una fuente para asar de 25 x 20 cm.","Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio. Freír las cebollas hasta que estén ligeramente doradas y suaves, unos 10 minutos. Retirar de la sartén y reservar.","Coloque la papa rallada y el apio en un tazón grande apto para microondas. Agregue una cucharada de agua y cocine a temperatura alta durante 1 minuto (o cocine al vapor en una vaporera escalonada durante 2-3 minutos).","Escurre la humedad de las verduras y añade las cebollas fritas, 3 cucharadas de aceite de colza, el huevo batido y el perejil. Sazone con 1 cucharadita de sal y un poco de pimienta negra. Revuelva bien para combinar y vierta en el plato preparado. Presione ligeramente para compactar las verduras y unte la cucharada restante de aceite por encima.","Hornee durante 45 minutos a 1 hora hasta que la parte superior esté dorada y crujiente y el centro suave. Esparce un poco más de perejil para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14435,3862,'es','Plato de frutas extraño','Deléitate con macabras serpientes de uva, colmillos de manzana, globos oculares de lichi y más con este extraño plato de frutas, ¡seguro que hará cosquillas y aterrorizará a los invitados de Halloween!','["70 g de chocolate blanco, más un extra para pegar en los globos oculares","3 plátanos pequeños, pelados y cortados por la mitad transversalmente","decoraciones de pastel con forma de globo ocular o glaseado de escritura negro o bolígrafo de tinta comestible","pequeño trozo de apio","6 mandarinas pequeñas, peladas","1 manzana roja, sin corazón y cortada en 6 gajos","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de nueces (nosotros usamos almendras)","25 g de pasas recubiertas de yogur","Lata de 425 g de lichis en jugo, escurridos","150 g de arándanos","decoraciones de pastel de globo ocular o brochetas","250 g de uvas negras y verdes","brochetas cortas de madera","glaseado de escritura negro o bolígrafo de tinta comestible, o adornos para pasteles con forma de globo ocular"]','["Para los plátanos momia, derrita el chocolate en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola pequeña con agua hirviendo o en el microondas en períodos de 20 segundos. Dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente. Coloque los plátanos en una bandeja forrada con papel para hornear y rocíelos sobre el chocolate en forma de cruz para hacer \"vendas\". Pegue las decoraciones de los globos oculares o use glaseado negro o un bolígrafo de tinta comestible para dibujar los ojos en los plátanos, luego enfríe hasta que cuaje, aproximadamente 30 minutos (comenzarán a decolorarse después de aproximadamente 2 horas).","Para las calabazas mandarinas, corte pequeños \"tallos\" del trozo de apio y empújelos hacia la parte superior de las mandarinas, donde se unen los gajos.","Para los colmillos de manzana, corte un trozo pequeño del lado de la cáscara de los trozos de manzana para hacer los labios, luego llene la \"boca\" con la mantequilla de nueces. Empuja las pasas en la boca para que parezcan dientes torcidos.","Para los globos oculares de lichi, rellene cada lichi con un arándano. Pegue las decoraciones del globo ocular sobre el arándano usando un poco del chocolate blanco derretido del paso 1, o ensarte las frutas en una brocheta. Si lo desea, colóquelos en una ponchera.","Para las serpientes de uva, enhebre uvas rojas y verdes alternadas en las brochetas, luego pegue adornos de globos oculares con chocolate blanco como en el paso cuatro.","Coloca las extrañas frutas en una fuente grande para servir. Llene los espacios con los arándanos sobrantes y decórelos con espeluznantes figuras y adornos de Halloween, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14436,3878,'es','batido de piña','Licue piña y plátano frescos con jugo de lima para preparar este batido de piña picante. Es genial para el desayuno y a los niños también les encantará.','["150 g de piña, pelada, cortada y picada","1 plátano pequeño, pelado y rebanado","1 lima, exprimida","hielo (opcional)"]','["Mezcla la piña en licuadora con el plátano, el jugo de lima y 50 ml de agua fría hasta que quede suave.","Llena un vaso alto con hielo, si lo deseas, vierte sobre el batido y sirve inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:02:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14437,3880,'es','batido de sandia','Disfrute de un batido de sandía en un cálido día de verano. Mezclada con jugo de plátano y manzana, esta bebida está repleta de vitamina C.','["150 g de sandía, pelada y picada","1 plátano pequeño, pelado y rebanado","100 ml de zumo de manzana frío"]','["Mezcle la sandía en licuadora con el jugo de plátano y manzana hasta que quede suave.","Vierte el batido en un vaso alto y sirve inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:02:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14438,3882,'es','Cómo cortar un mango','Los mangos son deliciosos, pero muy difíciles de preparar. Descubra cómo pelar la piel, quitar el hueso y cortar la pulpa en trozos pequeños.','["1 mango"]','["Coloque el mango de modo que uno de los extremos puntiagudos quede hacia usted, con las mejillas a cada lado.","Corta hacia abajo usando un cuchillo de sierra para quitar una de las mejillas, guiando el cuchillo alrededor de la piedra en el medio. Dale la vuelta al mango y repite del otro lado.","Marque la pulpa del mango en un patrón diagonal a lo largo de la mejilla con la punta del cuchillo. Gire 90 grados y marque nuevamente para formar un patrón entrecruzado.","Voltee la mejilla de mango marcada y presione la piel con los dedos para que sobresalga el lado carnoso; se verá un poco como un erizo, con los trozos de mango marcados sobresaliendo. Corta los trozos de carne de la piel con un cuchillo.","Corta la pulpa de ambos lados, siguiendo la curva del hueso. Marque los trozos con un cuchillo como antes, luego pase el cuchillo por la piel para soltar los trozos. Agréguelos al resto de los trozos de mango."]','2026-01-11 13:02:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14439,3884,'es','Nunor bora','Disfrute de estos deliciosos bocadillos de harina de arroz con curry o salsa de chile. Nunor bora es un refrigerio popular en Bangladesh y a menudo se sirve para Eid','["2 cebollas grandes o 4 pequeñas, picadas","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado","1½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","½ cucharadita de panch puran, molido (opcional)","300 g de harina de arroz, más un poco para enrollar","120 g de arroz molido","3 cucharadas de cilantro picado (opcional)","aceite vegetal, para freír","salsa de tomate o chile, para servir (opcional)"]','["Ponga a hervir 570 ml de agua en una cacerola grande. Licue la cebolla y el jengibre en un procesador de alimentos pequeño hasta formar una pasta, agregando un chorrito de agua si es necesario. Alternativamente, ralla finamente la cebolla y el jengibre.","Agrega la cebolla y el jengibre al agua hirviendo junto con 2 cucharaditas de sal, la cúrcuma y el panch puran, si lo usas. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que las cebollas estén traslúcidas y bien cocidas.","Reduzca el fuego a bajo y agregue la harina de arroz, seguida del arroz molido; se absorberán en el líquido inmediatamente. Revuelva bien para asegurarse de que no queden zonas secas. Agrega el cilantro picado, si lo deseas. Mezcle bien, cubra (idealmente con una tapa de vidrio) y cocine durante 15-20 minutos más hasta que se formen gotas aromáticas y de agua en la tapa. Para comprobar que la masa está completamente cocida, enrolle un poco de ella hacia adelante y hacia atrás entre sus dedos, debería unirse con bastante facilidad. Si se siente demasiado pegajoso, agregue un poco más de harina de arroz para absorber la humedad; Si se siente demasiado seco, rocíe un poco de agua y déjelo cocer al vapor durante unos minutos más.","Saque alrededor de una séptima parte de la mezcla de la sartén y déjela enfriar un poco sobre una superficie de trabajo espolvoreada con un poco de harina de arroz. Amasar la mezcla con la base de la palma hasta formar una masa. Sigue amasando hasta tener varias bolas de masa.","Extienda la masa hasta obtener un grosor de 3-4 mm, luego corte rondas con un cortador de masa redondo o acanalado de unos 7 cm de ancho, comenzando en el borde de la masa y trabajando hacia adentro. Decore con un estampador de galletas, si lo desea. Repita con la masa restante. El nunor bora ahora se puede congelar: colóquelos sobre tablas de cortar de plástico y congélelos hasta que estén duros, luego transfiéralo a bolsas o recipientes para congelar y congélelo por completo. Descongelar durante 1-2 minutos antes de freír.","Para cocinar la nuna bora, calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande y profunda. Freír en tandas durante 2 minutos por cada lado o hasta que estén inflados y crujientes. Pasa a un plato forrado con papel de cocina mientras cocinas el resto. Sirva con ketchup, salsa picante o su curry favorito."]','2026-01-11 13:02:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14440,3896,'es','Repollo con hinojo, guindilla y ajo','Disfrute de esta guarnición picante y sabrosa con una tierna carne asada. El repollo se puede asar o cocinar en la encimera si no tienes espacio en el horno.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","½ chile rojo, cortado finamente","1 repollo puntiagudo o hispi, cortado en 6 gajos"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande o en un wok y chisporrotea las semillas de hinojo, el ajo y la guindilla durante 1 o 2 minutos hasta que las semillas empiecen a crujir y el ajo se dore. Agrega el repollo; no te preocupes si parece demasiado para la sartén, pronto comenzará a marchitarse.","Cocine durante 3-4 minutos hasta que el repollo comience a tomar color en los bordes, luego suba el fuego y agregue unos 50 ml de agua a la sartén. Fríe el repollo al vapor durante unos minutos hasta que se haya evaporado toda el agua y el repollo se haya marchitado pero aún mantenga su forma. Transfiera a una fuente para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14441,3898,'es','Hamburguesas veganas de remolacha y quinoa','Disfrute de estas hamburguesas veganas de remolacha y quinua con ensalada de rúcula para una comida saludable pero abundante entre semana','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","200 g de quinua cocida","2 remolachas grandes cocidas (150 g), finamente ralladas y reservadas el líquido","50 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de linaza molida","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, más unas cuantas hojas para servir","25 ml de líquido conservante de remolacha","½ limón, exprimido","100 g de yogur de soja desnatado","50ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","rúcula 200 g"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Poner 1 cucharada de aceite de colza en una sartén pequeña y verter la cebolla, el comino y el ajo, luego freír a fuego medio durante 8 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y dorados. Vierta en un tazón. Agregue la quinua cocida, la remolacha, la harina, la linaza y el cilantro y mezcle hasta que se combinen. Sazone ligeramente. Dejar reposar durante 5 minutos para que se una.","Divida la mezcla en cuatro (quedará bastante suelta) y luego, con las manos mojadas, déles forma de hamburguesas. Coloca las hamburguesas en una bandeja para horno forrada y mételas al horno durante 15 minutos. Darles la vuelta y cocinar por otros 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, prepare el aderezo para la ensalada. Mezcle el líquido de remolacha, el jugo de limón, el yogur y el aceite y sazone.","Para servir, apile la rúcula en platos y coloque una hamburguesa encima. Rocíe sobre el aderezo y esparza el cilantro extra."]','2026-01-11 13:02:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14442,3900,'es','Mini chorizo, pea & potato frittatas','¿Vas al parque a hacer un picnic con la familia? A niños y adultos les encantarán estas mini frittatas.','["4 patatas nuevas (unos 150 g)","6 huevos batidos","60 g de chorizo ​​cortado en cubitos","75 g de guisantes congelados y descongelados","unas ramitas de perejil finamente picado","50 g de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Cocine las patatas en una cacerola pequeña con agua hirviendo durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrir, luego dejar secar al vapor y enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forrar un molde para muffins de seis agujeros con fundas de papel o silicona. Vierta los huevos, el chorizo, los guisantes, el perejil y un poco de condimento en un tazón grande. Corta las patatas enfriadas en rodajas del grosor de una moneda de £1 y agrégalas al bol. Mezclar suavemente.","Vierta la mezcla en las cajas, asegurándose de que cada una tenga un poco de papa, chorizo ​​y guisantes. Espolvorea el queso encima y hornea durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y cuajado en el medio. Compruebe que las frittatas estén listas agitando suavemente la lata; no debe tambalearse. Déjelo enfriar un poco y cómelo tibio, o déjelo enfriar completamente y enfríelo por hasta 24 horas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14443,3902,'es','Subs de cóctel de gambas especiadas','Olvídate de los aburridos sándwiches en un picnic: en su lugar, prepara estos sándwiches de cóctel de gambas. Si viajas, prepáralos cuando llegues para que estén súper frescos (consulta el consejo a continuación)','["3 cucharadas de mayonesa","1 cucharada de chutney de mango","¼ cucharadita de curry suave en polvo","chorrito de jugo de limón o lima","150 g de gambas del Atlántico norte cocidas","6 subrollitos pequeños","1 lechuga pequeña Little Gem, con las hojas recogidas","trozo pequeño de pepino, en rodajas finas"]','["Mezcle la mayonesa, el chutney de mango y el curry en polvo con un chorrito de jugo de limón o lima en un bol. Agrega los langostinos y luego enfríalos hasta que estés listo para armar.","Para servir, divida los panecillos por la parte superior, cubra cada uno con una hoja de lechuga y unas rodajas de pepino, luego agregue el relleno de gambas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14444,3906,'es','Ensalada de col casera clásica','Olvídese de las versiones compradas en la tienda y haga una ensalada de repollo casera. Es un acompañamiento ideal para barbacoas o para acompañar hamburguesas, ensaladas, sándwiches y más.','["1 repollo blanco pequeño o ½ grande","4 zanahorias, peladas","1 cebolla morada grande","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, cebollino, perejil o cilantro, finamente picado (opcional)","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","50 g de mayonesa","50 g de yogur, crema agria o más mayonesa","1-2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","unas pizcas de pimentón"]','["Retire las hojas exteriores de repollo magulladas o dañadas. Corte el tallo por la mitad, retire el núcleo denso con un cuchillo afilado y deséchelo. Coloque el lado cortado hacia abajo sobre una tabla de cortar y córtelo lo más fino que pueda en trozos finos. También puedes hacer esto en mandolina (es posible que desees cortarla en cuartos antes de cortarla) o en un procesador de alimentos con el accesorio para triturar. Vierta en un tazón.","Ralle las zanahorias en un rallador de caja para triturarlas en trozos grandes o córtelas en tiras finas usando una juliana pelada o el rallador del procesador de alimentos. Vierta en el tazón. Corta la cebolla en rodajas finas y lo más finas que puedas y agrégala al bol con las otras verduras. Agregue las hierbas si las usa. Una mezcla es buena si tienes algo para usar.","En una jarra batir la mostaza, la mayonesa, el yogur y el vinagre. Sazone bien y pruebe si está picante y cremoso. Agrega más vinagre si lo deseas.","Vierta el aderezo en el tazón de verduras y mezcle todo bien con una cuchara grande. Revuelva para que todas las verduras queden ligeramente cubiertas con el aderezo. Espolvorea con unas pizcas de pimentón y sirve de inmediato. Se puede tapar y enfriar hasta por 3 días. Mezclar bien antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14445,3908,'es','kimchi','Haga una versión vegana de kimchi (o kimchee) con esta sencilla receta coreana. Disfruta de los sabores umami de las algas, sigas o no una dieta basada en plantas','["2-3 hojas chinas (2 kg de peso preparado)","40-60 g de sal marina (3% del peso de la col)","1 cucharada de algas (yo uso wakame), ligeramente enjuagadas","1 zanahoria","½ puerro","2 cebolletas","40 g de cebolla picada","40 g de ajo (10 dientes), pelados","5 g de jengibre, picado","1 pera pequeña, sin corazón y picada","40 g de hojuelas de chile coreano (usa menos si lo prefieres más suave)","un frasco esterilizado de 2 litros"]','["Picar la hoja china en trozos pequeños, pesarla hasta obtener 2 kg y luego lavar con agua corriente. Mezclar la hoja china con la sal y las algas en un bol grande. Dejar de lado.","De vez en cuando, durante 3-4 horas, mezcle con las manos la hoja china salada y las algas. (Comenzarás a ver que se libera líquido). Deseas poder doblar la hoja china sin romper los pedazos.","Mientras tanto, tritura la zanahoria y el puerro y pica las cebolletas. Dejar de lado. Haga la pasta de chile triturando la cebolla, el ajo, el jengibre y la pera en un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener un puré. Agregue las hojuelas de chile y luego mezcle nuevamente para combinar. Escurre la mezcla de hojas chinas, quitando la mayor cantidad de agua que puedas. Esto puede tardar unos 10 minutos.","Mezcle la mezcla de hojas chinas con las otras verduras, luego agregue la pasta de chile para cubrir todo. Vierta en un frasco esterilizado de 2 litros. Trate de no tener demasiadas bolsas de aire y deje un espacio de 1 pulgada debajo de la tapa. Coloque un peso de fermentación encima o, si no tiene uno, intente usar algunos frijoles para hornear en una bolsa. Mantenga un plato debajo del frasco en caso de que se desborde. Después de 24 a 48 horas, comenzará a ver aparecer burbujas. Eso significa que la fermentación está en marcha.","En cualquier momento de la fermentación puedes probar el kimchi para ver si te gusta el sabor. Yo prefiero guardar el mío en el frigorífico después del día 3 para ralentizar el proceso y empezar a disfrutarlo. Puedes transferir el kimchi a frascos más pequeños para acceder fácilmente desde el refrigerador. También es un gran regalo para familiares y amigos."]','2026-01-11 13:02:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14446,3912,'es','Tomates en rama cocidos a fuego lento con ajo','Disfrute de los tomates en rama cocidos a fuego lento con ajo como guarnición de verano. También se pueden agregar hierbas leñosas como tomillo, romero o laurel para darle sabor al aceite.','["300 g de tomates cherry en rama","1 o 2 cabezas de ajo pequeñas, cortadas por la mitad para exponer la pulpa","150 ml de aceite de oliva","pan crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2. Coloque los tomates y el ajo en una fuente para horno que quede bien ajustada. Sazone bien. Vierta sobre el aceite de oliva y cubra con papel de aluminio. Hornee durante 1¼ horas, luego aplaste el ajo y revuelva con el aceite. Cómelo caliente con pan crujiente. Se conserva en un recipiente hermético en el frigorífico hasta dos semanas. Dejar enfriar primero."]','2026-01-11 13:02:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14447,3930,'es','Sopa minestrone clásica','Prepare esta clásica sopa de verduras italiana con una rica base de tomate y pasta. Es bajo en calorías y rico en fibra y vitamina C.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más extra para servir","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","1 zanahoria, pelada y finamente picada","1 calabacín, finamente picado","70 g de panceta ahumada cortada en cubitos","1 diente de ajo grande, triturado","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","1 lata de 400 g de judías cannellini","1 lata de 400 g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1,2 litros de caldo de verduras","1 hoja de laurel","70 g de pasta pequeña","100 g de verduras: col rizada, acelgas o cavolo nero funcionan bien","puñado de albahaca","parmesano finamente rallado, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola o cacerola grande a fuego medio-bajo y sofreír la cebolla, el apio, la zanahoria, el calabacín y la panceta durante 10 minutos. Agrega el ajo y el orégano y cocina por 1 min. Agregue los frijoles, los tomates picados, el puré, el caldo y la hoja de laurel. Sazone al gusto. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 30 minutos.","Agregue la pasta y las verduras y cocine por 10 minutos más. Sirva en tazones y esparza con la albahaca y un poco de parmesano."]','2026-01-11 13:02:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14448,3934,'es','papas fritas','Papas fritas perfectas con nuestra receta fácil: terminarás con papas fritas crujientes y ligeramente doradas. Son excelentes como refrigerio o guarnición para un banquete del viernes por la noche.','["1 kg de patatas Maris Piper o King Edward","aceite vegetal, para freír"]','["Pelar las patatas y cortarlas en bastones de 1 cm de grosor. Poner en un recipiente con agua fría y dejar en remojo durante al menos 2 horas para quitar el almidón de las patatas; esto ayudará a que queden crujientes mientras se fríen.","Escurrir bien las patatas y secarlas con papel de cocina. Llene una sartén profunda con aceite a no más de un tercio de su capacidad y caliéntela a 140 ° C, o hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 60 segundos. Freír las patatas fritas en tandas durante 6 minutos por tanda hasta que estén doradas, bien cocidas y ligeramente crujientes. Escurrir bien sobre papel de cocina.","Sube el fuego hasta que el aceite alcance los 180 ° C o un cubo de pan se dore en 30 segundos. Fríe las papas fritas nuevamente durante 2-3 minutos por tanda hasta que estén ligeramente doradas y muy crujientes. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina e inmediatamente sazonar con sal marina."]','2026-01-11 13:02:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14449,3942,'es','Pastel de panqueques de chocolate y mantequilla de maní','Perfecto para el Día de los Panqueques, todos pueden ayudar a preparar este “pastel” de panqueques de chocolate y mantequilla de maní. Mientras cocinas los panqueques, deja que los niños los extiendan y apilen.','["200 g de mantequilla de maní","200 g de chocolate para untar","azúcar glas y crema chorreante, para servir","5 huevos","750ml de leche","250 g de harina común","50 g de mantequilla"]','["Primero, haz la masa para panqueques. Vierta los huevos, la leche, la harina y una pizca de sal en la licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Alternativamente, bata los huevos y la harina hasta que quede suave, luego agregue lentamente la leche y una pizca de sal, luego vierta en una jarra grande.","Calentar una sartén o crepera de unos 20 cm a fuego medio y, con papel de cocina, frotar con cuidado un poco de mantequilla por toda la sartén. Vierta suficiente masa para hacer un panqueque fino y cocine durante aproximadamente 1 minuto por cada lado hasta que esté dorado. Deslice el panqueque en un plato para servir, luego úntelo inmediatamente con un poco de mantequilla de maní y luego con chocolate para untar. Repita con un segundo panqueque, luego apílelo encima del primero. Continúe cocinando, untando y apilando hasta que se use toda la masa, la mantequilla de maní y el chocolate para untar.","Cuando todos los panqueques estén apilados formando un “pastel”, espolvorea la parte superior con un poco de azúcar glas. Córtelo en gajos y sírvalo cubierto con un poco de crema chorreante. Se mantendrá a temperatura ambiente hasta por un día."]','2026-01-11 13:02:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14450,3944,'es','caldo escocés','Disfrute de un abundante plato de sopa de caldo escocés para disfrutar de un almuerzo o cena saludable. Repleto de verduras y cereales, sírvalo con un trozo de pan crujiente.','["250 g de mezcla de caldo (o una mezcla de 75 g de cebada perlada, 75 g de guisantes amarillos partidos, 50 g de lentejas rojas partidas y 50 g de guisantes verdes partidos o de tuétano)","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal o de oliva","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","1 puerro, lavado y rebanado","1 nabo mediano, pelado y finamente picado","3 zanahorias, finamente picadas","3 ramas de apio, peladas y finamente picadas","3 litros de caldo de cordero","200 g de col rizada picada"]','["Enjuague la mezcla de sopa y déjela en remojo en agua fría durante 8 horas o toda la noche, tapada en un lugar fresco. Escurrir y enjuagar bien.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y sofreír la cebolla, el puerro, el nabo, las zanahorias y el apio durante 10 minutos, tapado, hasta que estén tiernos pero no dorados. Añadimos una pizca generosa de sal y un buen molido de pimienta.","Vierta el caldo en la sartén y cocine a fuego lento. Agregue la mezcla de sopa escurrida y cocine a fuego lento durante 1 hora parcialmente tapado, hasta que la cebada y los guisantes estén tiernos. Sazone nuevamente si es necesario. Agregue la col rizada y cocine durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que esté tierna, luego sirva en tazones para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14451,3946,'es','pudín de chía','Prepare este sencillo "pudín" para el desayuno o el postre. Las semillas de chía son ricas en proteínas, antioxidantes y omega 3, además de muchos otros nutrientes.','["2 cucharadas de semillas de chía","125 ml de leche de avena, o sustituto de cualquier leche de frutos secos, leche de arroz o leche de vaca","2 cucharaditas de jarabe de arce, más un chorrito para servir","fruta, como bayas, plátano, kiwis o mango, para servir"]','["Combine las semillas de chía, la leche y 2 cucharaditas de jarabe de arce en un frasco o tazón. Cubra y enfríe durante la noche o durante al menos 8 horas.","Cuando esté listo para servir, cubra con fruta y un chorrito de jarabe de arce."]','2026-01-11 13:02:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14452,3948,'es','jugo de apio','Haga suyo este simple jugo de apio agregando chile verde para darle un poco de picante, cúrcuma o un poco de jarabe de arce para endulzar, si lo desea.','["1 cabeza de apio (unos 500 g)","1 manzana verde (unos 120 g), pelada, cortada en cuartos y sin corazón","½-1 limón, exprimido","20 g de jengibre, finamente rallado"]','["Separar los tallos de apio y lavar bien. Recorte los extremos de las raíces y pique en trozos grandes, manteniendo entero uno de los tallos tiernos y tiernos para servir.","Coloque el apio picado, la manzana, la mitad del jugo de limón y el jengibre en un procesador de alimentos o licuadora y presione para picar finamente. Con el motor en marcha, añade 50-100 ml de agua fría y licúa hasta que quede suave.","Colar el jugo a través de un colador de malla fina en una jarra, presionando con el dorso de una cuchara para extraer todo el jugo. Cubra y enfríe o sirva de inmediato. Remueve bien el jugo, agrega un poco más de limón si lo deseas y sirve en vasos con un trozo del tallo de apio reservado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14453,3954,'es','Sopa mulligatawny','Cocine una tanda de sopa mulligatawny, repleta de verduras y arroz y condimentada suavemente con curry en polvo y especias. Cubra con cilantro y yogur.','["20 g de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 ramas de apio, picadas","3 zanahorias, peladas y picadas","1 chirivía, pelada y picada","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y rallado","1 manzana para comer, sin corazón y picada","1½-2 cucharadas de curry en polvo mediano","1 cucharadita de comino molido","¼ cucharadita de pimentón dulce ahumado","1,2 l de caldo de pollo caliente","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","100 g de arroz basmati","1 cucharada de chutney de mango","½ limón, exprimido","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro rallado","yogur, para servir"]','["Calentar la mantequilla y el aceite de oliva en una cazuela y sofreír la cebolla y el apio con una pizca de sal durante 10-12 minutos, o hasta que estén tiernos y traslúcidos. Agregue las zanahorias, la chirivía, el ajo, el jengibre y la manzana y cocine por 1 minuto más. Agrega el curry en polvo, el comino y el pimentón. Agrega el caldo y el puré de tomate y sazona al gusto. Reducir a fuego lento, tapar y cocinar durante 40 minutos.","Enjuague el arroz y cocine durante 10 minutos en agua hirviendo. Bate la sopa hasta que quede suave con una licuadora. Escurre el arroz y revuelve la sopa con el chutney de mango, el jugo de limón y la mitad del cilantro. Verifique el condimento, luego sirva en tazones y cubra con el cilantro y el yogur restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:02:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14454,3956,'es','Bowl de mantequilla de garbanzos, espinacas y almendras','Combine garbanzos y espinacas con mantequilla de almendras y especias para preparar esta cena familiar repleta de verduras. Listo en sólo 25 minutos, sírvelo con arroz','["aceite vegetal, para freír","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","Trozo de jengibre de 2½ cm, pelado y rallado","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de fenogreco","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","300 ml de caldo de verduras","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de almendras sin sal","200 g de espinacas, picadas en trozos grandes","arroz cocido, para servir"]','["Calienta un poco de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofríe la cebolla durante 5 minutos. Agregue 50 ml de agua y cocine por 7 minutos más hasta que se dore. Agrega el ajo y el jengibre.","Combine el cilantro, el comino, la cúrcuma, el fenogreco y un poco de pimienta con 2 cucharadas de agua y viértalo en la sartén. Cocine por 5 minutos más, luego agregue los garbanzos.","Agregue el caldo y la mantequilla de almendras, luego agregue las espinacas y cocine durante 3-5 minutos más hasta que las espinacas se ablanden. Sirva sobre arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:02:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14455,3958,'es','Pakoras de zanahoria','Olvídese del desperdicio de comida y use trozos de verduras blandas para hacer estas sensacionales pakoras. El brócoli, la coliflor, las judías verdes, los calabacines y el repollo también funcionan bien.','["3 zanahorias medianas, ralladas gruesas a lo largo","2 chalotas o 1 cebolla, cortadas finamente","25 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","una pizca de chile picante en polvo (opcional)","1 huevo batido","100 g de harina de maíz","aceite de girasol, para freír","100 gramos de yogur natural","2 cucharadas de pepinillo de lima (picar en trozos grandes si queda demasiado grueso)","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Coloque las zanahorias, las chalotas o la cebolla en un colador colocado sobre un fregadero y mezcle con 1 cucharadita de sal marina. Dejar marchitar durante 10 minutos. Mientras tanto, para la salsa, combine el yogur, los pepinillos y la menta. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para usar.","Cuando las verduras se hayan marchitado, envuélvalas en un paño de cocina limpio y exprima el exceso de agua. Vierta en un bol junto con el cilantro, las especias y el huevo y mezcle bien. Agregue la harina de maíz y revuelva hasta que todas las verduras estén cubiertas uniformemente con una masa espesa; es importante que toda la harina de maíz se mezcle correctamente.","Llene una sartén ancha y profunda con no más de dos tercios de su capacidad con aceite y caliéntela a 180 ° C, o hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 20 segundos. Trabajando en tandas, agregue con cuidado dos cucharadas de la mezcla de pakora a la vez, bien espaciadas, y fría durante 2 minutos por un lado, luego 1-2 minutos más por el otro lado hasta que estén doradas y crujientes. Transfiera a papel de cocina usando una espumadera para escurrir. Servir caliente con la salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:02:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14456,3960,'es','Tabulé de invierno','Combine coliflor, hinojo, trigo bulgur, nueces y semillas de granada para hacer esta versión invernal del tabulé. Está delicioso servido como guarnición.','["60 g de pasas","200 g de trigo bulgur mediano","175 g de floretes de coliflor finamente picados","1 bulbo de hinojo pequeño, recortado, sin las hojas exteriores gruesas y picado","1 limón, exprimido","25 g de perejil picado","20 g de hojas de menta picadas","3 cebolletas, finamente picadas","50 g de nueces picadas y tostadas","15 g de agracejo seco","100 g de semillas de granada","1 diente de ajo pequeño, finamente picado","¼ cucharadita de comino molido","¼ cucharadita de canela molida","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada","1 cucharadita de miel","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Coloque las pasas en un recipiente resistente al calor y cúbralas con agua hirviendo del hervidor. Dejar en remojo durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, coloque el bulgur en un segundo recipiente resistente al calor y vierta suficiente agua hirviendo del hervidor para cubrirlo unos 2 cm. Cubra el recipiente y déjelo en remojo durante 15 minutos. Escurrir y transferir a un tazón para servir. Agregue la coliflor, el hinojo y el jugo de limón y revuelva para combinar.","Para hacer el aderezo, ponga el ajo, el comino, la canela, la melaza de granada y la miel en un bol y revuelva. Vierta poco a poco el aceite, batiendo continuamente hasta que se combinen. Gusto por sazonar.","Escurrir las pasas y añadirlas a la mezcla de bulgur con el perejil, la menta, las cebolletas, las nueces y los agracejos. Mezcla todo junto con el aderezo. Pruebe nuevamente el condimento y luego agregue las semillas de granada."]','2026-01-11 13:02:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14457,3964,'es','Tarta de manzana y rosa pastel','Impresiona a tus invitados con nuestra tarta de manzana y natillas. Con una base de repostería casera y una bonita cobertura de “rosas” de manzana, es un postre llamativo','["1 limón, exprimido","6-8 manzanas","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","200 g de harina común","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, fría y en cubos, más un poco más para la lata","65 g de azúcar glas","1 yema de huevo grande","800ml de leche entera","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla","5 yemas de huevo grandes","100 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de natillas en polvo"]','["Ponga la harina y la mantequilla en un bol y frótelas con las yemas de los dedos hasta que parezcan pan rallado. Incorpora el azúcar glas y una pizca de sal, seguido de la yema de huevo. Si la masa se siente demasiado seca para formar una masa, agregue 1-2 cucharadas de agua.","Extienda la masa entre dos hojas de papel para hornear hasta que forme un círculo de aproximadamente 28 cm. Mételo en el frigorífico durante 20 minutos para que se endurezca y luego reposa sobre un molde para tarta de 23 cm untado con mantequilla. Empuje hacia abajo en las esquinas y recorte la parte superior para que sobresalga entre 1 y 2 cm de masa. No te preocupes si se rompe un poco, simplemente repara los desgarros con los recortes. Pinche la base varias veces con un tenedor y luego enfríe en el frigorífico durante 45 minutos. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Coloque una hoja de papel para hornear sobre la base de la tarta fría y rellénela hasta arriba con frijoles para hornear. Hornee a ciegas durante 15 minutos. Retire los frijoles para hornear y el pergamino y hornee por otros 10-15 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Deje enfriar en el molde y luego corte el exceso de masa en la parte superior con un cuchillo pequeño.","Mientras tanto, hierva la leche y la vainilla en una cacerola a fuego medio. Batir las yemas de huevo, el azúcar en polvo y las natillas en polvo hasta que estén bien combinados.","Vierta la leche caliente sobre la mezcla de huevo y azúcar, batiendo continuamente, hasta que la mezcla esté suave y bien combinada. Regresa la mezcla a la sartén a fuego medio-bajo. Revuelva continuamente durante 2-3 minutos hasta que la mezcla esté muy espesa. Dejar enfriar un poco, batiendo de vez en cuando para que no se formen grumos.","Vierta la mezcla de natillas en la masa de hojaldre cocida, extendiéndola para nivelarla. Mételo en el frigorífico durante 2 horas para que cuaje por completo.","Vierte la mitad del jugo de limón en un recipiente mediano con agua, luego corta finamente las manzanas en el recipiente, usando una mandolina si lo deseas. Espolvoree con el azúcar en polvo y cocine en el microondas durante 3-4 minutos a temperatura alta, luego transfiéralo a un recipiente con agua fría con el jugo de limón restante.","Envuelva 3 o 4 rodajas de manzana entre sí para formar una rosa: enrolle la primera y luego envuelva las otras rodajas alrededor. Presione las flores de manzana en la natilla, avanzando hasta cubrir toda la tarta."]','2026-01-11 13:02:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14458,3966,'es','Alitas de pollo fritas al aire','Use una freidora para hacer estas alitas de pollo fáciles y agregue el condimento o la salsa de su elección. Son perfectos para un buffet o simplemente para un refrigerio en una noche de cine.','["1 kilo de alitas de pollo","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o de oliva","condimento de su elección (use sal y pimienta, o ½-1 cucharadita de BBQ ahumado, ras-el-hanout, ajo granulado, sal de apio o garam masala)","salsa para mojar, para servir (opcional)"]','["Separe cada ala de pollo en dos en la articulación, quitando las puntas de las alas si lo desea con unas tijeras de cocina afiladas. Mezcle las alitas de pollo con el aceite y el condimento, luego viértalas en una freidora (puede usar una con paleta o colocarlas en la bandeja de su freidora si no tiene paleta).","Programe la freidora para que se cocine durante 35 minutos. Verifique que las alitas estén tiernas y bien cocidas (casi deberían desprenderse del hueso) y cocínelas durante 5 minutos más si es necesario. La piel debería haber burbujeado y crujiente, y el exceso de grasa del pollo habrá goteado en la base de la freidora (deséchelo). No dejes el pollo en la freidora o el vapor volverá a suavizar la piel. Vierta inmediatamente en un tazón y sirva con salsa para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:02:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14459,3968,'es','Ensalada César de brócoli','Prepare esta ensalada César de brócoli como entrante fácil y sofisticado. Listo en sólo 10 minutos, es ideal para una cena o almuerzo navideño.','["1 diente de ajo pequeño","2 anchoas en aceite","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más extra para servir","1 cucharada de mayonesa","½ limón, exprimido","10 g de parmesano finamente rallado y un poco más para servir","1 tsp Dijon mustard","300 g de brócoli de tallo largo","2 crostini comprados en la tienda, triturados"]','["Machacar los ajos con las anchoas. Vierta en un tazón pequeño y mezcle con el aceite, la mayonesa, el jugo de limón, el parmesano y la mostaza de Dijon.","Cocine el brócoli en una fuente de agua hirviendo con sal durante 3-4 minutos hasta que esté tierno. Drenar. Distribuya el brócoli en cuatro platos y luego rocíe con el aderezo. Triture los crostini y esparza sobre la ensalada, luego rocíe con un poco más de aceite de oliva y espolvoree con parmesano rallado extra."]','2026-01-11 13:02:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14460,3970,'es','Peras a la plancha con aderezo de queso de cabra y avellanas','Impresione a sus invitados con este entrante aparentemente sencillo, elaborado con peras, queso de cabra, berros y avellanas. Está listo en sólo 15 minutos y perfecto en Navidad.','["40 g de avellanas tostadas, finamente picadas o trituradas","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico o de vino tinto","2 peras, sin corazón","un puñado de berros, para servir","100 g de queso de cabra desmenuzado"]','["Combina las avellanas con el aceite, el vinagre y una pizca de sal marina en escamas. Corta cada pera en seis gajos.","Caliente una sartén a fuego alto y cocine las rodajas de pera hasta que estén ligeramente carbonizadas. Coloque tres en fila en cada plato. Coloque un poco de berros alrededor de las peras y luego desmenúcelos sobre el queso de cabra. Ponga encima el aderezo de avellanas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14461,3972,'es','Diablos de salvia y cebolla a caballo','Haz un pequeño y divertido juego con cerdos envueltos en mantas para tu cena de Navidad, agregándole un sabroso relleno de salchicha. Hacen el acompañamiento festivo perfecto','["25 g de mantequilla","1 cebolla, picada","4 salchichas de cerdo","1⁄2 cucharadita de salvia seca","rallado de nuez moscada","12 ciruelas pasas blandas sin hueso","12 lonchas de tocino ahumado","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña a fuego lento y fría la cebolla durante 10 minutos hasta que esté blanda y dorada. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Exprima la carne de la salchicha y póngala en un bol, agregue las cebollas fritas y la salvia, ralle un poco de nuez moscada y sazone con abundante pimienta negra. Use sus manos para mezclar hasta que los ingredientes se combinen, luego divida en 12 porciones y forme bolas. Divida cada ciruela pasa por la mitad a lo largo para que pueda abrirse como un libro. Presione una bola de salchicha en el medio de cada ciruela y envuélvala con cuidado para cubrir el relleno. Envuelva una loncha de tocino alrededor de cada ciruela rellena y luego pase un palito por los extremos sueltos para asegurar el tocino. Coloque los diablos a caballo sobre una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Se mantendrá tapado en el refrigerador hasta por 24 horas.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 7. Unta los diablos a caballo con el aceite y hornea durante 15-20 minutos hasta que el tocino esté crujiente y dorado, y el relleno esté bien cocido."]','2026-01-11 13:02:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14462,3974,'es','Patatas asadas al tomillo y castañas','Agregue los sabores festivos de la castaña y el tomillo para llevar las papas asadas estándar a un nivel navideño o dos.','["1,5-2 kg de patatas harinosas, como King Edward o Maris Piper, cortadas en trozos iguales","150 ml de aceite vegetal","manojo de tomillo, picado en trozos grandes","Bolsa de 180 g de castañas cocidas, desmenuzadas"]','["Pon las patatas en una cacerola grande y cúbrelas con agua fría con sal. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego a fuego lento y cocinar durante 5 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Drenar.","Coloque el aceite en una fuente para asar más grande, luego transfiera la fuente al horno con el pavo durante 10 minutos. Retire la lata del horno y vierta con cuidado las papas y el tomillo, volteándolas para cubrirlas con el aceite caliente. Cuando el pavo esté bien cocido, enciende el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y asa las patatas durante 40 minutos. Voltee las patatas y ase durante 10-15 minutos más hasta que estén doradas por completo. Espolvoree sobre las castañas y ase durante los últimos 10 minutos hasta que las castañas estén completamente calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:02:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14463,3976,'es','Panes planos revueltos de salmón','Pruebe una alternativa más saludable al salmón ahumado y los huevos revueltos que es igual de deliciosa, pero hecha con espinacas frescas y servida sobre panes planos caseros.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","90 g de harina integral, más un poco más para espolvorear","160 g de espinacas tiernas","3 huevos grandes","1 cucharada de eneldo picado, más algo extra para servir","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","1½ cucharadita de alcaparras, escurridas y picadas","100 g de salmón salvaje sin piel, cortado en trozos pequeños"]','["Para hacer panes planos, frote el aceite con la harina con los dedos. Agregue 60 ml de agua tibia con un cuchillo para cubiertos y luego amase brevemente sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta que la masa esté suave y elástica. Cortar por la mitad.","Estire cada mitad de la masa con un rodillo enharinado hasta que quede muy fina (aproximadamente 21 cm de diámetro). Calienta una sartén antiadherente a fuego alto y cocina uno de los panes planos durante 1 min. Voltee y cocine por el otro lado durante 30 segundos, presionándolo con una espátula hasta que se dore ligeramente en algunos lugares y esté bastante seco sin estar crujiente. Repita con el segundo pan plano. Cubra ambos con un paño de cocina y manténgalos calientes.","Coloque las espinacas en la sartén y cocine a fuego medio durante 1-2 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Vierta en un colador sobre un tazón y presione el exceso de líquido con el dorso de una cuchara, luego pique en trozos grandes.","Batir los huevos con el eneldo y abundante pimienta negra y reservar. Enjuague la sartén y póngala a fuego medio. Agregue las alcaparras, luego el salmón y revuelva hasta que el pescado comience a volverse opaco en los bordes. Vierta la mezcla de huevo y revuelva para revolver los huevos. Cuando el salmón esté casi cocido y el huevo casi cuajado, agregue las espinacas para calentar. Sirva sobre los panes planos calientes con el eneldo extra esparcido por encima y un buen molido de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:02:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14464,3978,'es','El mágico pastel de Navidad de Jessica','Deslumbra a tus invitados con este fabuloso pastel. Diseñado por Jessica Whitlow, de ocho años, en nuestro mágico concurso de pasteles navideños, presenta tres bizcochos de sabores.','["500 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada, más un poco más para las latas","700 g de azúcar moscabado light","10 huevos medianos","400 g de chocolate negro, derretido y enfriado","1 cucharada de extracto de vainilla","340 g de harina común","2 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque suave","750 g de pasta de azúcar azul cielo o glaseado de fondant","200 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos medianos","200 g de harina con levadura, tamizada","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","5 limones, rallados, 4 en jugo","1 cucharada de mermelada de frambuesa","colorantes alimentarios rosa y rojo","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, ablandada","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 huevos medianos","100 g de harina con levadura, tamizada","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de leche","120 g de arándanos, mezclados con un poco de harina común","1-2 cucharadas de cuajada de limón","colorantes alimentarios azul oscuro y claro","200 g de chocolate negro (al menos 70 % de cacao), picado","100 g de nata doble","800 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","1,6 kg de azúcar glas y un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharadas de extracto de vainilla","2 cuadritos crujientes de arroz","150 g de pasta de azúcar blanca, más un poco más para las nubes","pastas de azúcar negras, verdes, marrones, naranjas y de otros colores","bolígrafo de escritura comestible negro","pegamento comestible","150 g de pasta de azúcar amarilla, más un extra para las estrellas","bolas plateadas comestibles (opcional)","2 palitos de galleta recubiertos de chocolate","Tambores para tartas de 26 cm, 18 cm y 10 cm","palitos de cóctel","8-10 tacos para pastel","cortadores en forma de nube y cortadores en forma de estrella en diferentes tamaños"]','["Calienta el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3. Para hacer la capa de brownie, unta con mantequilla tres moldes para pasteles de fondo suelto de 26 cm y cúbrelos con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y una pizca de sal durante 7 minutos hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada uno. Incorpora el chocolate y la vainilla, luego la harina. Vierta en los moldes y hornee durante 40 minutos hasta que el exterior esté ligeramente escamoso con una corteza de brownie y el centro esté firme sin migajas húmedas cuando se inserte una brocheta en el medio. Dejar enfriar completamente en los moldes. Sube el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Para hacer el nivel medio, unte con mantequilla y forre dos moldes para pasteles de fondo suelto de 18 cm. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y una pizca de sal durante 7 minutos hasta que esté suave y esponjosa. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada uno. Incorpora la harina, el polvo para hornear, la ralladura de 2 limones y una cuarta parte del jugo de limón. Vierta en los moldes y hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y firme al tacto. Deje enfriar en los moldes durante 5 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para hacer la capa de arándanos, unte con mantequilla y forre dos moldes para pasteles redondos de 10 cm. Batir la mantequilla, el azúcar y una pizca de sal durante 7 minutos hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien después de cada uno. Incorpora la harina, el polvo para hornear, la leche y los arándanos. Vierta en los moldes y hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente dorados y firmes al tacto. Déjelo en las latas durante 5 minutos, luego transfiéralo a una rejilla para que se enfríe por completo.","Para la ganache, poner el chocolate en un bol resistente al calor. Llevar la nata a ebullición a fuego medio, luego verterla sobre el chocolate, batiendo continuamente hasta que se derrita y quede suave. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Para hacer la crema de mantequilla, bata la mantequilla, el azúcar glas y la vainilla durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que esté pálida y esponjosa. Ponga 850 g de crema de mantequilla en un bol y agregue la ganache. Extienda una pequeña gota de crema de chocolate sobre el centro del bizcocho de 26 cm y cubra con un bizcocho de brownie. Unte la parte superior del bizcocho con 2-3 cucharadas de crema de mantequilla de chocolate y luego emparéjelo con un segundo bizcocho de brownie. Repita con 2-3 cucharadas de crema de mantequilla de chocolate y el último bizcocho. Extienda el resto de la crema de chocolate por encima y por los lados en una capa gruesa con una espátula. Enfriar durante al menos 1 hora.","Agrega el resto de la ralladura de limón y el jugo a la crema de mantequilla restante. Extienda una pequeña gota de crema de mantequilla de limón sobre el centro del bizcocho de 18 cm y cubra con un bizcocho de limón. Unte la parte superior del bizcocho con 2 cucharadas de crema de mantequilla de limón y mermelada de frambuesa, luego cubra con el segundo bizcocho. Unte 400 g de crema de mantequilla de limón por encima y por los lados. Enfriar durante 1 hora.","Extienda una pequeña gota de crema de mantequilla de limón sobre el centro del bizcocho de 10 cm y cubra con un bizcocho de arándanos. Unte la parte superior del bizcocho con la cuajada de limón y 1 cucharada de crema de mantequilla de limón, luego cubra con el segundo bizcocho. Unte 200 g de crema de mantequilla de limón por encima y por los lados. Enfriar durante 1 hora. Tiñe 250 g de la crema de mantequilla restante de color gris intenso/azul con colorantes alimentarios azules. Extienda esto sobre la base del pastel de arándanos. Enfriar durante 1 hora.","Tiñe el resto de la crema de mantequilla de color rojo intenso con los colorantes alimentarios rosa y rojo. Extienda esto sobre la capa de pastel de limón. Enfriar durante 1 hora.","Retire la capa de brownie del refrigerador. Caliente la mermelada de albaricoque en una sartén para que se suelte, enfríe un poco y luego unte la parte superior y los lados del pastel. Extienda la pasta de azúcar azul cielo sobre una hoja de papel para hornear ligeramente espolvoreada con azúcar glas hasta 40 cm (5 mm de espesor). Úselo para cubrir la capa de brownie, alisándola por los lados. Enfriar durante la noche.","Para la decoración, empieza por el muñeco de nieve. Enrolle 1 cuadrado de arroz crujiente hasta formar una bola grande. Enrolle dos tercios del segundo cuadrado hasta formar una bola mediana y el resto hasta formar una bola pequeña. Estirar la pasta de azúcar blanca. Use esto para cubrir las bolas, luego enróllelas en sus manos para suavizarlas. Crea un sombrero con las pastas de azúcar negra y verde. Utilice dos palitos de cóctel y moldee pasta de azúcar morena alrededor de cada uno para formar brazos con dedos ramificados. Dejar reposar a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora. Dibuja ojos y una boca en la bola más pequeña con un bolígrafo negro y haz una pequeña nariz de zanahoria con pasta de azúcar de naranja. Monta el muñeco de nieve, empuja los brazos hacia los lados y pega el sombrero y la nariz con un poco de pegamento comestible. Dibuja botones en el centro del muñeco de nieve con el bolígrafo.","Para apilar los niveles de pastel, primero mida unas cinco clavijas contra el costado del nivel inferior y tres o cuatro contra el costado del nivel medio. Corta las clavijas a la misma altura que las gradas. Inserte las clavijas en un círculo en el medio de los niveles; esto sostendrá el nivel de arriba. Apile con cuidado los niveles del pastel de mayor a menor.","Corta pequeñas estrellas de pastas de azúcar de diferentes colores. Extienda un poco de pasta de azúcar blanca y elimine algunas nubes. Pegue las estrellas en el nivel inferior en forma de arcoíris (use un poco de pegamento comestible, si es necesario), luego pegue las nubes a un lado. Extiende la pasta de azúcar amarilla y saca estrellas de diferentes tamaños, luego pégalas en el nivel del medio. Extienda un poco de pasta de azúcar verde y corte la forma de un árbol con un cuchillo pequeño, luego cree un soporte de árbol marrón con pasta de azúcar. Decora el árbol con recortes de pasta de azúcar y bolas de plata comestibles, si lo deseas. Extienda un poco más de pasta de azúcar, corte dos banderines pequeños y envuélvalos alrededor de los palitos de galleta. Escriba mensajes en las banderas con un bolígrafo y péguelos en el nivel medio. Cubra el pastel con el muñeco de nieve y asegúrelo en el nivel superior con un palillo. Es mejor consumirlo un día después de decorarlo. Se conservará hasta cinco días. NIVEL INFERIOR(15) 1332 kcal • grasa 69 g • grasa saturada 41 g • carbohidratos 164 g • azúcares 141 g • fibra 5 g • proteína 11 g • sal 0,2 g NIVEL MEDIO (10) 856 kcal • grasa 46 g • saturada 28 g • carbohidratos 104 g • azúcares 88 g • fibra 1 g • proteínas 5 g • sal 0,4 g NIVEL SUPERIOR (con decoración) (6) 953 kcals • grasas 42 g • alimentos saturados 26 g • carbohidratos 137 g • azúcares 113 g • fibra 1 g • proteínas 6 g • sal 0,5 g"]','2026-01-11 13:02:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14465,3980,'es','Granada especiada y jamón glaseado con naranja','Sirve nuestro jamón glaseado caliente en lonchas finas junto al pavo navideño. Este tiene un glaseado agridulce pegajoso hecho con melaza de granada y naranja.','["1,5-2 kg de porro de jamón atado, deshuesado y sin fumar","2 hojas de laurel, más extra para servir (opcional)","anís de 3 estrellas","4 dientes enteros, más un extra para untar el jamón","8 bayas de pimienta de Jamaica","10 granos de pimienta enteros","1 litro de jugo de granada","2 naranjas pequeñas, 1 partida por la mitad, 1 en rodajas, más 1 cucharadita de jugo","1 cucharada de melaza de granada","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno","1 cucharada de miel","80 g de semillas de granada para servir (opcional)","Picar en trozos y mezclar con los macarrones con queso, junto con los puerros y la mostaza.","Cortar en rodajas gruesas y freír hasta que estén crujientes y doradas, luego servir con un huevo frito líquido y un poco de burbujas y chirridos.","Triture en trozos grandes y agregue a un pastel con pavo.","Triture y mezcle con un poco de ensalada de brotes. Agregue picatostes o semillas adicionales, si lo desea.","Mezcle con una cobertura galesa y apílelo sobre pan crujiente. Ase hasta que esté dorado."]','["Ponga el jamón en una sartén grande con las hojas de laurel, el anís estrellado, los clavos, 6 bayas de pimienta de Jamaica y 8 granos de pimienta. Vierta sobre el jugo de granada para cubrir el jamón (es posible que deba completar con agua). Agregue una de las mitades de naranja, luego cocine a fuego lento y cubra parcialmente con una tapa. Cocine durante 2 horas y 30 minutos, agregando agua según sea necesario para mantener el jamón cubierto. Deje enfriar en el líquido durante 20 minutos, luego sáquelo y colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cortar la piel del jamón dejando una capa de 1 cm de grasa. Marque líneas en la grasa a intervalos de ½ cm con un cuchillo. Hornee durante 15 minutos hasta que la grasa comience a estar crujiente.","Mientras tanto, triture las bayas de pimienta de Jamaica y los granos de pimienta restantes con un mortero y un mortero. Combine las especias trituradas con la melaza, la mostaza, el azúcar y 1 cucharadita de jugo de naranja. Retire el jamón del horno y unte sobre la mezcla de melaza. Coloca las rodajas de naranja sobre el jamón, asegurándolas con unos clavos.","Enciende el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y regresa el jamón al horno por otros 20 minutos. Unte la miel sobre las rodajas de naranja y hornee por otros 5 a 10 minutos, o hasta que el glaseado burbujee. Deje reposar durante al menos 20 minutos y luego sirva con hojas de laurel y semillas de granada esparcidas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14466,3982,'es','Ñoquis de salchicha y brotes con mostaza','¿Sobras de brotes en tu nevera? Aprovechalos al máximo con nuestros ñoquis de salchicha a la mostaza para la cena. Solo toma 25 minutos prepararlo.','["250 g de albóndigas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","3 salchichas de cerdo (200g)","250 g de brotes, rallados","100 ml de caldo de pollo","2 cucharaditas de mostaza integral","2 cucharadas de crema fresca media grasa","½ manojo pequeño de perejil picado, más un poco más para servir","parmesano rallado (opcional)"]','["Cocine los ñoquis en una cacerola con agua con sal siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir y reservar.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y fríe la cebolla a fuego medio durante 8 minutos, o hasta que se ablande y se dore. Exprima la carne de la salchicha para quitarle la piel y colocarla en la sartén, rompiéndola con una cuchara de madera. Cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que se doren. Revuelva los brotes y cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el caldo y la mostaza y deja hervir. Agregue la crema fresca y el perejil. Estación. Vierta los ñoquis, mezcle con 100 ml de agua para aflojar la salsa y cocine a fuego lento durante 3 minutos. Para servir, espolvoree con perejil y parmesano extra, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14467,3984,'es','Arroz picante de coliflor y halloumi','Prepare este arroz picante de coliflor, espinacas y halloumi para una cena rápida y sencilla. Nutritivo y equilibrado, es ideal para las noches ocupadas','["1 coliflor de cabeza pequeña (500 g), partida en floretes medianos","150 g de espinacas tiernas","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas","120 g de halloumi, cortado en cubos","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharada de curry en polvo mediano","2 bolsas de 250 g de arroz basmati integral","1 chile rojo, finamente cortado"]','["Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua con sal y cocine la coliflor durante 5 minutos a fuego alto, agregando las espinacas durante los últimos 2 minutos. Escurrir y reservar.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande o cazuela poco profunda y sofreír la cebolla a fuego medio durante 5 minutos. Suba el fuego, agregue el halloumi, cocine por 5 minutos más, luego agregue el ajo, el jengibre, la cúrcuma y el curry en polvo y cocine por 1 minuto más. Revuelva el arroz, la coliflor y las espinacas para calentar todo, agregando 1 cucharada de agua si se ve un poco seco. Sazona y esparce sobre el chile."]','2026-01-11 13:02:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14468,3990,'es','Corona de rollo de salchicha sin gluten','Cree esta maravilla de rollo de salchicha sin gluten colocando molinetes de salchicha y chutney en forma de corona festiva. Es perfecto para un buffet navideño.','["6 salchichas de cerdo sin gluten","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","280 g de hojaldre enrollado sin ASDA","2 cucharadas de chutney de cebolla morada y más para servir","1 huevo batido para glasear"]','["Exprima la carne de las salchichas de la piel y póngalas en un bol. Sazone con sal y pimienta y espolvoree sobre la mezcla de especias. Mezclar bien a mano.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Desenredar el hojaldre enrollado sin ASDA sobre una superficie de trabajo, manteniéndolo sobre el papel para hornear. Extender el chutney en una fina capa por toda la masa. Extender encima la carne de la salchicha cubriendo toda la superficie. Golpee y presione la carne contra la masa con las palmas para formar una capa fina y uniforme.","Trabajando con el lado largo más cercano a usted, enrolle la masa, dejando atrás la hoja de pergamino, para crear una espiral de salchicha larga y delgada. Corte en secciones de 3 cm, debería tener aproximadamente 10. Presione los extremos en los bordes para limpiarlos si lo desea. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, para formar una corona, dejando un espacio de 5 mm entre los rollos para permitir que se hinchen.","Unte el huevo batido sobre la parte superior y los lados de los panecillos, luego cocine durante 25-30 minutos hasta que la masa esté dorada y crujiente y la salchicha esté bien cocida. Deje enfriar un poco y transfiéralo a una tabla o plato para servir con más chutney de cebolla morada o mostaza y pepinillos."]','2026-01-11 13:02:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14469,3992,'es','Chorizo croquetas with aïoli','Prueba una nueva forma de utilizar el chorizo, con estas fabulosas croquetas servidas con mayonesa de ajo. Requieren un poco de esfuerzo, pero son un excelente entrante o refrigerio para una fiesta.','["50 g de mantequilla","½ cebolla mediana, finamente picada","70 g de harina común","435ml de leche entera","135 g de chorizo, cortado en trozos pequeños","50 g de manchego rallado","2 cucharadas de perejil finamente picado","3 huevos, ligeramente batidos","150 g de pan rallado seco","aceite de maní, para freír","4 dientes de ajo machacados","2 yemas de huevo grandes (congela las claras para otra receta)","250-300 ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","chorrito de jugo de limón"]','["Calienta la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo y sofríe la cebolla durante 8 minutos hasta que esté blanda pero sin color. Agrega la harina hasta que se incorpore a la grasa y la cebolla. Reduzca el fuego a bajo y cocine durante 4 minutos, revolviendo, no deje que se dore. Calienta la leche en una cacerola mediana a fuego lento hasta que esté humeante.","Retire la mezcla de cebolla del fuego y agregue la leche, poco a poco, revolviendo después de cada adición hasta que quede suave. Cuando se haya agregado toda la leche, regrese la cacerola a fuego medio-bajo y deje hervir, revolviendo constantemente. Reduzca el fuego a bajo y cocine durante 6 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia para evitar que se pegue. Dejar de lado.","Cocine el chorizo ​​en una sartén a fuego medio durante 3 minutos; no necesita grasa, ya que el chorizo ​​​​liberará grasa a medida que se cocina. Agrega el chorizo ​​frito a la salsa junto con el queso, el perejil y el condimento. Vierta la salsa en un plato y déjela enfriar por completo, luego cubra y enfríe durante al menos 3 horas, o toda la noche.","A continuación, haz el alioli. Poner en un bol el ajo y las yemas de huevo y batir con unas varillas eléctricas, añadiendo poco a poco el aceite, gota a gota. A medida que la mezcla comience a espesarse, puedes agregar el aceite más rápidamente y en mayores cantidades. Exprime un poco de jugo de limón y sazona, probando a medida que avanzas para asegurarte de que el sabor esté equilibrado (también puedes agregar una gota de vinagre de vino blanco además de jugo de limón, si lo deseas). Cubra y enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir.","Con las manos mojadas, enrolle la mezcla de chorizo ​​frío en bolas del tamaño de una nuez. Pon el huevo en un recipiente poco profundo y el pan rallado en un plato poco profundo. Enrolle las croquetas en el huevo y luego en las migajas, asegurándose de que cada una quede bien cubierta. Coloque las croquetas en una bandeja para hornear, luego tápelas sin apretar y déjelas enfriar durante unas horas para que se endurezcan y no se rompan al freírlas.","Vierta el aceite de maní en una sartén hasta que no esté llena más de un tercio y caliéntela a 180 ° C, o hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 30 segundos. Freír las croquetas en tandas durante 2-3 minutos por tanda, vigilando la temperatura. Si el aceite está demasiado caliente, las croquetas se oscurecerán por fuera antes de que esté caliente por dentro; deberían estar doradas. Pasar las croquetas con una espumadera a un plato forrado con papel de cocina, dejar escurrir unos minutos y servir con el alioli."]','2026-01-11 13:02:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14470,3996,'es','Patatas asadas con hierbas','Cocine estas mejores papas asadas en una bandeja para hornear con lados bajos para obtener resultados dorados y crujientes. Sirva con un asado dominical.','["4 cucharadas de aceite de colza","1½ kg de patatas Maris Piper, cortadas en cuartos, reservando la piel","50 g de mantequilla","½ manojo de hierbas leñosas (tomillo, romero o laurel)","6 dientes de ajo, ligeramente machacados"]','["Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8. Añade el aceite a una bandeja para hornear grande resistente al fuego y mételo en el horno para que se caliente.","Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua con sal, agregue las patatas y su cáscara (para darle más sabor) y cocine a fuego lento durante 8-10 minutos. Escurrir las patatas y desechar la piel. Deje que se sequen al vapor durante 15 minutos, luego regrese las papas a la sartén, tape y agite suavemente para raspar ligeramente los bordes.","Retirar la bandeja del horno y poner directamente al fuego a fuego medio. Agrega la mantequilla al aceite caliente y, con unas pinzas, agrega las patatas a la bandeja, una a una, volteándolas en la grasa, dejando un poco de espacio entre cada una. Reducir el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Colocar las hierbas alrededor de las patatas, junto con el ajo. Espolvorea 1 cucharada de sal marina y regresa al horno durante 1 hora, volteando de vez en cuando, hasta que esté dorado y crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:02:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14471,3998,'es','Sopa de col rizada y garbanzos al curry','Prepare esta sopa saludable y económica para una comida fácil y nutritiva entre semana. Está lleno de col rizada, garbanzos, batata y mucho sabor.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de colza o de coco","1 cebolla, picada","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 batata (unos 200 g), pelada y cortada en cubos de 2 cm","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo mediano o picante","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos enjuagados","150 ml de leche de coco desnatada","500 ml de caldo de verduras (ver consejo a continuación)","160 g de col rizada picada","1 lima, exprimida","1 chile rojo, finamente picado (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y sofreír la cebolla durante 5 minutos. Agrega el jengibre y el ajo, sofríe durante 1 minuto más, luego agrega la batata, las especias y los garbanzos. Cocine por otros 5 minutos, agregando un poco de agua si las especias se pegan a la sartén.","Vierta la leche de coco y 400 ml de caldo, luego cocine a fuego lento y cocine durante 8 minutos. Sazone, luego transfiera una cuarta parte de la sopa a la licuadora y bata hasta que quede suave. Vierta el caldo reservado para aflojar, si es necesario, luego vuelva a agregarlo a la sartén con el resto de la sopa. Agregue la col rizada y cocine por 5 minutos. Agregue el jugo de limón, luego sirva en tazones y esparza sobre el chile, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14472,4000,'es','Risotto rápido de calabaza y cebada','Cambie el arroz por cebada para hacer este sencillo "risotto" de calabaza con espinacas y salvia. Es saludable y bajo en calorías y grasas, perfecto para una cena rápida.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 chalota grande o cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","300 g de zapallo o calabaza, cortada en cubos de 1 cm","2 dientes de ajo machacados","un puñado pequeño de hojas de salvia, finamente picadas","½ cucharadita de macis molida o una buena ralladura de nuez moscada","160 g de hojas de espinaca","2 latas de 400 g de cebada en agua, escurridas","300 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","40 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, finamente rallado","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 chalota grande o cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","300 g de zapallo o calabaza, cortada en cubos de 1 cm","2 dientes de ajo machacados","un puñado pequeño de hojas de salvia, finamente picadas","½ cucharadita de macis molida o una buena ralladura de nuez moscada","160 g de hojas de espinaca","2 latas de 400 g de cebada en agua, escurridas","300 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","40 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, finamente rallado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofreír la chalota con una pizca de sal durante 5 minutos hasta que esté blanda. Agregue la calabaza, el ajo, la salvia y el macis, y fría, revolviendo continuamente, durante otros 6-8 minutos hasta que la calabaza comience a ablandarse y el ajo esté fragante.","Agregue las espinacas y la cebada con un poco de condimento y el caldo. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 4-5 minutos hasta que las espinacas se ablanden. Añade un chorrito más de caldo o agua, si quieres. Cuando el ''risotto'' esté espeso y cremoso, pruebe para ver si necesita un poco más de macis o nuez moscada y condimentos. Agregue la mayor parte del parmesano, luego cubra con el parmesano restante y muela un poco de pimienta negra para servir.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofreír la chalota con una pizca de sal durante 5 minutos hasta que esté blanda. Agregue la calabaza, el ajo, la salvia y el macis, y fría, revolviendo continuamente, durante otros 6-8 minutos hasta que la calabaza comience a ablandarse y el ajo esté fragante.","Agregue las espinacas y la cebada con un poco de condimento y el caldo. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 4-5 minutos hasta que las espinacas se ablanden. Añade un chorrito más de caldo o agua, si quieres. Cuando el ''risotto'' esté espeso y cremoso, pruebe para ver si necesita un poco más de macis o nuez moscada y condimentos. Agregue la mayor parte del parmesano, luego cubra con el parmesano restante y muela un poco de pimienta negra para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14473,4002,'es','Ponche de huevo sin alcohol','Comienza tu Navidad con ponche de huevo, un cóctel cremoso clásico. Esta versión no contiene alcohol, pero aún conserva todo el lujo del original.','["1 vaina de vainilla, partida y sin semillas","4 yemas de huevo","100 ml de jarabe de azúcar","100ml de nata doble","500ml de leche entera","hielo"]','["Pon las semillas de vainilla en un tazón grande. Agrega las yemas de huevo y el almíbar de azúcar y bate con una batidora eléctrica hasta que estén pálidos, aproximadamente 2-3 minutos. Agrega la nata y la leche y vuelve a batir hasta que estén combinados.","Llene una jarra grande con hielo y luego cuele la mezcla de ponche de huevo. Revuelva suavemente hasta que el exterior de la jarra se sienta frío, luego vierta el ponche de huevo en vasos para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14474,4010,'es','Cazuela de judías verdes','Prepare esta cazuela fácil de judías verdes y champiñones como guarnición vegetal para acompañar un plato principal. Puedes agregar queso a la salsa blanca si te apetece.','["50 g de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","250 g de castañas o champiñones cortados en rodajas","500 g de judías verdes, peladas","50 g de harina","500ml de leche","100 g de cebollas crujientes"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de mantequilla y aceite en una sartén grande y freír los champiñones durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Agregue las judías verdes y cocine por otros 3-4 minutos hasta que las judías adquieran un color verde brillante. Saque las verduras y colóquelas en un plato.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Derretir la mantequilla restante en la sartén hasta que forme espuma. Retirar del fuego brevemente y espolvorear sobre la harina, revolviendo con la mantequilla para hacer una pasta dorada. Vuelve al fuego y agrega la leche, poco a poco, revolviendo continuamente hasta que se haya agregado toda la leche y obtengas una salsa blanca suave y espesa. Sazone bien. Agrega los frijoles y los champiñones a la salsa blanca y vierte en una fuente mediana para horno.","Esparza sobre las cebollas crujientes, luego hornee durante 20-30 minutos hasta que burbujee y esté dorada, cubriendo si las cebollas se doran demasiado rápido."]','2026-01-11 13:02:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14475,4012,'es','Bocaditos de macarrones con queso','¿Catering para huéspedes con diferentes dietas o gustos? Estos bocados de macarrones con queso son comida ideal para fiestas. Desde champiñones hasta aceitunas, cubre con lo que quieras','["25 g de mantequilla, más un extra para la lata","25 g de harina común","400ml de leche","200 g de macarrones u otra pasta corta","200 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","100 g de champiñones tiernos, en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de perejil finamente picado","20 g de pan rallado seco","8 aceitunas negras deshuesadas y cortadas en rodajas","4 tomates secos, rebanados","100 g de mozzarella o cheddar rallado"]','["Para hacer los aderezos, calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén a fuego alto y cocina los champiñones durante 10 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Agrega la mitad del ajo y el perejil y sofríe 1 minuto más. Sazone y transfiera a un tazón. Calienta el resto del aceite en una sartén y fríe el ajo restante y el pan rallado durante 3-5 minutos, revolviendo hasta que estén crujientes. Pasar a un segundo tazón.","Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola a fuego medio, luego agregue la harina para hacer una pasta espesa. Agrega poco a poco la leche, poco a poco, batiendo hasta que esté toda incorporada. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos más hasta que espese. Mientras tanto, cocine los macarrones en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 5-6 minutos. Agrega el queso cheddar a la salsa blanca hasta que todo el queso se derrita, luego agrega los macarrones.","Unte con mantequilla un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos y divida los macarrones con queso entre los hoyos, empacándolos con el dorso de una cuchara. Cubra con la mezcla de champiñones, aceitunas o rodajas de tomate seco, luego esparza sobre el queso rallado y el pan rallado con ajo. Se conservará tapado en el refrigerador hasta por 24 horas.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Hornea durante 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y bien caliente. Dejar enfriar durante 10-15 minutos en el molde y luego aflojar pasando una cuchara por los bordes. Transfiera a un plato."]','2026-01-11 13:02:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14476,4014,'es','Palitos de mozzarella con salsa de tomate y chile','Prepare estos deliciosos palitos de mozzarella con anticipación para disfrutar de una comida de fiesta sin complicaciones. Simplemente mételos en el horno cuando lleguen los invitados y sírvelos con nuestra salsa de tomate y chile.','["30 g de harina común","1 huevo batido","100 g de pan rallado seco","pizca de orégano seco","pizca de ajo granulado","250 g de mozzarella firme en bloque (no en agua), cortada en tiras de 1 cm de grosor, del tamaño de un dedo","unos 500ml de aceite vegetal, para freír","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1-2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y finamente picados","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharadita de azúcar"]','["Coloque la harina, el huevo y el pan rallado en tres tazones separados y sazone cada uno. Agrega el orégano seco y los gránulos de ajo al pan rallado.","Cubrir los palitos de mozzarella con harina, quitar el exceso y luego sumergirlos en el huevo batido. Agite suavemente para eliminar el exceso de huevo y luego agregue el pan rallado hasta que esté bien cubierto. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear y colóquela en una sola capa, luego congele durante 1 hora hasta que esté completamente sólida.","Para hacer la salsa, caliente el aceite en una cacerola y fría los chiles y el ajo durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Agregue los tomates, el vinagre, el azúcar y un poco de condimento. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine durante 12-15 minutos hasta que esté espeso y picante. Si prefiere una salsa suave, bátala con una batidora. Sazone al gusto; es posible que necesite agregar un poco más de azúcar, vinagre o sal. Dejar enfriar. Se conservará tapado en el frigorífico hasta por tres días o en el congelador hasta por tres meses.","Llene una cacerola de base pesada con no más de un tercio de su capacidad con aceite y caliéntela a 180 ° C, o hasta que un cubo de pan chisporrotee cuando se deja caer en el aceite y se dore en unos 30 segundos. Sumerja suavemente los palitos de mozzarella congelados (deberá hacer esto en dos tandas para asegurarse de que la temperatura se mantenga alta) y fríalos durante 2-3 minutos hasta que el centro del queso se derrita y el exterior esté crujiente y dorado. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina. Sirva inmediatamente o déjelo enfriar. Se conservará tapado en el refrigerador hasta por tres días o en el congelador hasta por tres meses.","Para recalentar, caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y hornee en una bandeja durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté completamente caliente. Sazone y sirva con salsa tibia."]','2026-01-11 13:02:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14477,4018,'es','Grupos de caminos rocosos','Invite a familiares y amigos a estos deliciosos grupos de caminos rocosos. Son un gran regalo en Navidad o un dulce para servir con una taza de té.','["100 g de mantequilla salada, picada","200 g de chocolate amargo, picado","2 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","150 g de galletas digestivas","100 g de mini malvaviscos","50 g de nueces pecanas, picadas en trozos grandes","50g de pasas","brillo de oro comestible, para espolvorear (opcional)"]','["Derrita la mantequilla, el chocolate y el almíbar dorado en un recipiente resistente al calor sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Rompe las galletas en pedazos en otro tazón, luego agrega los malvaviscos, las nueces y las pasas. Vierta el chocolate derretido y revuelva todo suavemente hasta que esté bien cubierto. Deje caer cucharadas de la mezcla en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear, luego espolvoree cada una con un poco de brillo dorado comestible, si lo usa. Enfríelo durante 1 hora antes de envasarlo. Se mantendrá en el refrigerador hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14478,4022,'es','Rodajas secas de naranja y limón','Rodajas secas de naranja y limón para usar como decoración en Navidad. Hacen hermosas decoraciones para árboles, mesas o coronas, o se colocan en un frasco como regalo.','["1 naranja y 1 limón, ambos sin pelar y cortados en rodajas finas de 2 mm de grosor","palitos de canela, hojas de laurel, ramitas de romero o vainas de cardamomo, para decorar (opcional)"]','["Coloque las rodajas de cítricos sobre dos bandejas para hornear forradas con papel para hornear de modo que queden en una sola capa. Calentar el horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas ¼. Hornear durante 2 horas hasta que esté firme y seco, volteando las bandejas a la mitad. Verifique después de 1 hora y 15 minutos, retire las rodajas de naranja que se sequen demasiado rápido y luego continúe cocinando el resto.","Dejar enfriar completamente en la bandeja, luego envasar con las guarniciones de tu elección."]','2026-01-11 13:02:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14479,4026,'es','agua de cabra','Prepara nuestra versión del agua de cabra, un guiso elaborado con carne de cabra que es el plato nacional de Montserrat. Es un reflejo directo de los ancestros africanos e irlandeses de la isla.','["1 limón, exprimido","1 kg de carne de cabra, cortada en trozos de 5 cm","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno o melaza","2 cucharaditas de clavo","2 cucharaditas de pimienta de Jamaica","2 cucharaditas de maza molida","unas ramitas de tomillo","½ cabeza de ajo, dientes pelados y triturados","1 chile Scotch Bonnet, picado","1 rama de apio, picada","½ pimiento verde, picado en trozos de 1½ cm","1 cebolla, picada","1 cucharadita de salsa para dorar","2-4 hojas de laurel","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","1 cucharada de ron (opcional)","pan, para servir"]','["Mezcla el jugo de limón en un recipiente grande con agua. Enjuague la carne de cabra en agua con limón y luego escúrrala. Seque la carne de cabra con papel de cocina. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio-alto, luego agrega el azúcar y cocina por unos minutos hasta que esté dorado y caramelizado. Agregue la carne de cabra y cocine, volteándola, hasta que se dore por completo. Agregue las especias, el tomillo, el ajo, la guindilla, el apio, el pimiento, la cebolla, la salsa para dorar, el laurel y 1 litro de agua. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante aproximadamente 2-2½ horas hasta que la carne esté muy tierna.","Combine la harina de maíz con 50 ml de agua y luego agréguela a la sartén. Cocine a fuego lento durante otros 10 minutos, sin tapar, hasta que la salsa se espese un poco; tendrá la consistencia de una crema líquida. Agregue el ron y luego sirva con pan a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14480,4028,'es','Salsa vegana definitiva','Termine sus esfuerzos de la mañana de Navidad recalentando esta salsa preparada con anticipación. Es el complemento perfecto para todos tus adornos favoritos en la mesa festiva.','["6 champiñones portobello grandes","3 cebollas, sin pelar, en cuartos","4 zanahorias, sin pelar, picadas en trozos grandes","3 ramas de apio, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cabeza de ajo, partida por la mitad","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 cucharadas de sirope de agave","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","100 g de harina común","25 g de champiñones secos","150ml de oporto rubí","2 litros de caldo de verduras","3 hojas de laurel","manojo pequeño de tomillo"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Vierta los champiñones portobello, las cebollas, las zanahorias, el apio y el ajo en una fuente para asar, agregue el aceite de girasol y luego extiéndalos en una sola capa. Ase durante 40 minutos, sin tocarlas; las verduras deben estar ligeramente carbonizadas.","Rocíe sobre el agave, el vinagre, el puré de tomate, la soja y 2 cucharadas de agua. Mezcle hasta que esté completamente cubierto, luego regrese al horno durante 5 minutos hasta que esté pegajoso y caramelizado. Agregue la harina y los champiñones secos y regrese al horno por los últimos 10 minutos.","Si la lata es ignífuga, poner al fuego a fuego lento, agregar el oporto y cocinar hasta obtener una pasta espesa mezclada con todos los ingredientes. Vierta dos tercios del caldo, agregue las hierbas, deje hervir y cocine durante 10 minutos. Si la lata no es ignífuga, rocíe sobre el oporto, revuelva para aflojar todos los trozos quemados, luego vierta todo en una sartén y continúe con el caldo y las hierbas.","Apaga el fuego y tritura todo con un machacador de patatas para extraer el máximo sabor posible. Pasar con cuidado el contenido por un colador colocado sobre otra cacerola, empujando hacia abajo para que suelte todo el líquido. Agregue el resto del caldo y cocine a fuego lento hasta que la salsa esté espesa y rica. Dejar enfriar. Para servir, simplemente recaliente. Se mantendrá refrigerado y cubierto por hasta tres días o congelado por hasta dos meses."]','2026-01-11 13:02:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14481,4030,'es','natillas veganas','Prepara nuestra natilla de coco vegana para verter sobre tus postres favoritos. Elaborado con leche de coco, combina a la perfección con nuestro pudín de zanahoria, coco y dátiles.','["4 cucharadas de natillas en polvo","4 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 latas de 400 ml de leche de coco desnatada","200ml de agua"]','["Combine las natillas en polvo con el azúcar. Agregue 2-4 cucharadas de leche de coco de una lata de 400 ml y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave. Calentar el resto de la leche de coco de la lata en una sartén con otra lata de 400 ml de leche de coco y el agua hasta que casi hierva. Batir un poco de la mezcla de leche de coco con la mezcla de natillas en polvo hasta que parezca una salsa de natillas suave, luego verter esto en la sartén con el resto de la leche de coco caliente. Vuelva a hervir a fuego lento, revolviendo continuamente, hasta obtener una natilla espesa y suave."]','2026-01-11 13:02:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14482,4038,'es','Zanahoria y coliflor asadas con comino y aderezo de tahini verde','Ideal para un picnic o una barbacoa, esta abundante ensalada funciona como plato principal o acompañamiento vegetariano. Puedes usar zanahorias tiernas y enteras de temporada nueva; simplemente resta los primeros 15 minutos del tiempo de cocción y ásalas con la coliflor.','["1 kg de zanahorias, lavadas, peladas y picadas en trozos de 3 cm","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de miel (o use azúcar moreno claro para hacerla vegana)","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","2 cucharaditas de semillas de hinojo","cucharadita de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","1 coliflor, picada en floretes (aprox. 500 g), manteniendo las hojas y picadas en trozos pequeños","60 g de hojas de rúcula","100 g de tahini","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 limón, exprimido","1 diente de ajo","2 puñados de hojas de cilantro"]','["Primero haz el aderezo. Vierta los ingredientes en una licuadora o mini picadora con una pizca grande de sal y 6 cucharadas de agua fría. Mezcle para obtener un aderezo suave (o lo más suave posible), pruebe el condimento y reserve. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8. Vierte las zanahorias en un bol con 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, la miel, el comino y las semillas de hinojo, un poco de condimento y chile, si lo usas. Forre 2 bandejas para asar poco profundas con papel para hornear y divida las zanahorias entre ambas. Asar durante 15 minutos hasta que empiece a caramelizar. Retirar del horno y agregar los floretes y las hojas de coliflor entre las zanahorias, asegurándose de que todas las verduras queden cubiertas con el glaseado, luego rociar sobre el aceite de oliva restante. Ase durante 30 minutos, revolviendo una vez, hasta que todo esté tierno y pegajoso. Dejar enfriar a temperatura ambiente. Se mantendrá tapado durante un día.","Si va a tomar esto al aire libre, coloque las verduras en un recipiente y tome las hojas de rúcula y el aderezo en recipientes separados. Justo antes de que esté listo para comer, mezcle la rúcula a través de las raíces, luego rocíe sobre el aderezo, dejando un poco para servir a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14483,4040,'es','Carne de cerdo desmenuzada en olla a presión','¿Sabías que puedes cocinar carne de cerdo desmenuzada en una olla a presión en solo una cuarta parte del tiempo? ¡Es una solución inteligente para reducir los costos de combustible en invierno!','["3 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de ajo granulado","2 cucharaditas de cebolla granulada","100 g de salsa de tomate","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","1 kg de paleta de cerdo, sin piel y deshuesada","300ml de jugo de manzana","baps blancos esponjosos, o patatas asadas y ensalada de col, para servir"]','["Combine el vinagre, el azúcar, las especias, el ajo y la cebolla granulados, el ketchup y la mostaza con una pizca de sal en un bol y sumerja la carne de cerdo en él. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos 1 hora; durante la noche es mejor, si tiene tiempo.","Vierta la carne de cerdo y la marinada en la olla a presión, luego vierta el jugo de manzana. Revuelve bien todo. Cierre la tapa y aumente la presión a alta presión a fuego medio-alto y cocine durante 50 minutos. Deje que la presión baje naturalmente. La carne debe quedar tierna y desmenuzada. Si todavía está un poco duro, vuelva a tapar, vuelva a poner a presión alta y cocine durante 10-20 minutos más.","Cuando la carne esté lista, retirar a una tabla y dejarla tapada, para que repose. Mientras tanto, reduzca la salsa en la olla a presión. Ajuste el condimento, luego cocine a fuego lento y revuelva con la tapa cerrada durante unos 20 minutos hasta que espese y esté un poco pegajoso.","Justo antes de que la salsa esté lista, desmenuza la carne y sepárala entre dos tenedores. Vuelva a colocar la carne en la sartén y revuelva para cubrirla con la salsa. La carne de cerdo desmenuzada se puede mantener fría hasta por tres días o congelada hasta por un mes. Descongela y recalienta bien antes de servir.","Sirva el cerdo desmenuzado relleno en bollos esponjosos con ensalada de col al lado, si lo desea, o como relleno para papas asadas, tacos o tortillas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14484,4042,'es','Tortillas de tofu con aderezo de soja','Disfruta de una tortilla de tofu para una cena equilibrada y baja en calorías. Sirva con arroz, brócoli y un chorrito de aderezo de chile para una comida fácil y sabrosa entre semana.','["100 ml de salsa de soja baja en sal","1 lima, exprimida","4 dientes de ajo","280 g de tofu extra firme, escurrido","300 g de brócoli congelado","5 g de jengibre pelado","½ chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cucharada de miel","3 huevos","2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","2 bolsas de 250 g de arroz basmati integral"]','["Pon 50 ml de salsa de soja y la mitad del zumo de lima en un plato llano. Triture 2 dientes de ajo. Corta el tofu en cuatro cuadrados iguales y agrégalo a la marinada. Tapar y dejar marinar en el frigorífico durante al menos 20 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad.","Mientras tanto, llena una cacerola mediana hasta un cuarto de su capacidad con agua y luego ponla a fuego medio hasta que empiece a hervir a fuego lento. Coloque un colador sobre la sartén, agregue el brócoli, cubra y cocine al vapor durante 10 minutos o hasta que esté tierno. Mientras tanto, ralla el resto del ajo y el jengibre en un bol pequeño. Agrega el resto de la salsa de soja y el jugo de lima, el chile rojo y la miel. Dejar de lado.","Escurre el tofu y sécalo bien. Batir los huevos en un bol con una pizca de sal.","Calienta ½ cucharadita de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio-alto. Una vez caliente, añade un trozo de tofu a la sartén y vierte un cuarto del huevo por encima. Utilice una rodaja de pescado para empujar el huevo hacia el tofu; debería terminar con un pequeño cuadrado de tofu con huevo. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados, volteándolos con cuidado. Reserva, tapa para mantener el calor y repite con el resto del aceite, el tofu y el huevo.","Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Sirve las tortillas de tofu con el arroz, el brócoli y un chorrito de aderezo de chile."]','2026-01-11 13:02:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14485,4044,'es','donas polacas','Haga una tanda de donas glaseadas esponjosas, cubiertas con almendras picadas crujientes para una ocasión especial. La masa incluye mermelada para darle un dulzor sutil.','["7 g de levadura","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de harina","125 ml de leche calentada","7 yemas de huevo","15 g de azúcar","5 g de azúcar de vainilla (o 5 g de azúcar en polvo más 1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla)","500 g de harina","200 ml de nata doble, tibia","15 g de mantequilla, muy blanda","125ml de mermelada de rosa mosqueta (u otra mermelada)","5 g de almendras molidas","manteca o aceite, para freír","75 g de azúcar glas","½ limón, exprimido","unas gotas de esencia de almendras","50 g de almendras picadas"]','["Para hacer la levadura, mezcle la levadura con el azúcar y la harina y agregue la leche tibia. Reservar en un lugar cálido durante 30 minutos.","Para la masa, poner las yemas de huevo en un bol resistente al calor y añadir el azúcar y el azúcar de vainilla. Coloque el tazón sobre una cacerola con agua hirviendo y bata hasta que quede suave y espeso.","Tamizar la harina en el bol de una batidora, añadir las yemas batidas y la nata tibia, mezclar bien, luego añadir una pizca de sal y la levadura. Reúna para hacer una masa y amase durante 10 minutos (o 15-20 si lo hace a mano).","Cuando la masa deje de pegarse a tus manos, vierte la mantequilla derretida enfriada y amasa por unos minutos más. Cubrir con un paño y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante al menos 1 h-1 h 30 min.","Mezcle la mermelada con las almendras molidas y vierta en una manga pastelera o jeringa de mermelada. Dividir la masa en 16 trozos y darles forma de rosquillas. Tapar y dejar reposar durante 30 minutos.","Llene una sartén profunda o una freidora hasta un tercio de su capacidad con aceite o manteca de cerdo derretida y caliéntela hasta que alcance 180 ° C; si no tiene un termómetro, agregue un pequeño trozo de pan. El aceite estará listo cuando se dore en unos 30 segundos. Agregue las donas y fríalas, volteándolas una vez durante aproximadamente 1 a 2 minutos por cada lado (debe formarse un anillo delgado y más claro en el medio). Después de retirarlos, escurrimos los donuts del exceso de grasa sobre un poco de papel de cocina.","Mezclar el azúcar glas, el jugo de limón y la esencia de almendras, agregando un poco de agua si es necesario para diluir el glaseado. Cuando los donuts se hayan enfriado un poco, verter la mezcla de mermelada, glasearlos con el glaseado y espolvorear con las almendras picadas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14486,4048,'es','Rábanos triturados con mantequilla de chile','Combine el sabor suave de los rábanos cocidos con mantequilla de chile para obtener una guarnición suntuosa. ¿No eres fanático de los rábanos? Cambiarás de opinión después de probar esta receta','["100 g de mantequilla sin sal","1 cucharada de hojuelas de chile","500 g de rábanos, sin hojas, triturados con el borde plano de un cuchillo (o cortados por la mitad o en cuartos si le resulta difícil hacerlo)","1⁄2 limón, en jugo"]','["Calienta la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña con las hojuelas de chile hasta que comience a formar espuma y se dore. Agregue los rábanos y cúbralos bien con la mantequilla, volteándolos con frecuencia hasta que se ablanden, aproximadamente de 10 a 15 minutos.","Sube el fuego, agrega el jugo de limón, deja que chisporrotee, luego sazona al gusto y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:02:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14487,4050,'es','Nduja arancini picante','Prepare estas deliciosas bolas de arroz con salchicha nduja picante, un pegajoso relleno de mozzarella y una crujiente capa de pan rallado para un refrigerio del Día de San Valentín.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1⁄2 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo grande, triturado","1⁄2 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo, trituradas","300 g de arroz para risotto","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","800 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","80 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","50 g de salchicha nduja, finamente picada","150 g de mozzarella, cortada en cubos","100 g de harina común","3 huevos medianos, batidos","200 g de pan rallado panko","aceite vegetal, para freír"]','["Calentar el aceite de oliva en una cazuela a fuego lento y sofreír la cebolla con una pizca de sal durante 10-12 minutos, o hasta que esté blanda. Agrega el ajo y las semillas de hinojo y cocina por 1 min más. Agregue el arroz y cocine por un minuto más.","Vierte los tomates y la mitad del caldo y enciende el fuego a medio-alto. Cocine, revolviendo continuamente, hasta que el caldo se evapore casi por completo. Agregue el caldo restante, un cucharón a la vez, agregando más cuando el arroz absorba la adición anterior. Cocine hasta que el arroz esté al dente, unos 15-20 minutos.","Agregue el parmesano y la nduja, luego extienda el risotto sobre una bandeja para hornear y déjelo enfriar a temperatura ambiente.","Saque el risotto enfriado en 20 porciones iguales, un poco más grandes que una pelota de golf. Aplana una de las bolitas formando un disco con la mano, pon un trozo de mozzarella en el centro y envuélvelo con el arroz. Apelotonar. Repita con el resto del risotto y la mozzarella.","Vierta la harina, los huevos y el pan rallado panko en tres tazones poco profundos separados. Pasar cada bola de risotto por harina, luego por huevo y finalmente por pan rallado. Transfiera las bolas a una bandeja para hornear. Llene hasta la mitad una cacerola grande de base pesada con aceite vegetal y caliéntela a fuego medio-bajo a 170 ° C, o hasta que un trozo de pan se dore en el aceite en 45 segundos. Sumerja con cuidado las bolas de risotto en el aceite en tandas y fría cada tanda durante 8 a 10 minutos, o hasta que estén doradas y pegajosas en el centro. Escurrir en un plato forrado con papel de cocina."]','2026-01-11 13:02:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14488,4054,'es','Carne de res y frijoles al horno Boston','Disfrute de estos frijoles horneados de Boston con papa asada o pan crujiente. El tiempo hace su magia en este plato, pero hay muy poco trabajo práctico que hacer','["300 g de judías cannellini secas","1 hoja de laurel fresca","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","500 g de pierna de ternera, cortada en trozos de 4 cm","120 g de manteca de cerdo ahumada","1 cebolla grande, cortada en gajos","2 dientes de ajo grandes, en rodajas finas","100 g de melaza","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de mostaza en polvo","pizca de clavo molido","patatas asadas o pan y ensalada de col, para servir"]','["Vierta los frijoles en una cacerola grande y luego vierta suficiente agua para cubrir los frijoles 5 cm. Agrega el laurel y deja en remojo toda la noche. Al día siguiente, escurre los frijoles, vuelve a colocarlos en la cacerola y vierte suficiente agua fresca para cubrir los frijoles 3 cm. Llevar a ebullición, reducir el fuego a fuego lento y cocinar durante 20 minutos hasta que los frijoles estén tiernos (es posible que deba agregar un poco de agua mientras se cocinan).","Calienta el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 2. Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande o en una cacerola resistente al horno y fríe la carne durante 5 minutos a fuego alto hasta que se dore uniformemente (deberás hacerlo en tandas). Transfiera a un plato con una espumadera. Agregue los lardons y la cebolla a la sartén y cocine a fuego medio-alto durante 5-7 minutos hasta que las cebollas se doren y los lardons comiencen a estar crujientes.","Revuelva la carne nuevamente en la sartén. Agregue los frijoles junto con el líquido de cocción y agregue el ajo, la melaza, el puré de tomate, la mostaza en polvo y los clavos. Sazone y luego complete con un poco de agua para que los frijoles queden cubiertos entre 2 y 3 cm. Cubra y deje hervir a fuego lento, luego transfiera al horno durante 2 horas y 30 minutos. Retire la tapa, revuelva y regrese al horno durante 1 hora y 30 minutos hasta que la carne esté tierna y la salsa rica. Una vez enfriados, los frijoles se pueden congelar por hasta tres meses (ver más abajo). Sirva con papas asadas o pan y ensalada de col."]','2026-01-11 13:02:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14489,4060,'es','Pasteles de coco (gujiya)','Prepare esta versión de un popular dulce indio relleno de coco, almendras y pasas suavemente condimentados. Generalmente se hacen para celebrar el festival de Holi.','["275 g de harina","35 g de ghee, derretido y enfriado","aceite de girasol, para amasar y freír","1 litro de leche entera (nosotros usamos leche Jersey)","125 g de azúcar en polvo","200 g de coco rallado congelado y descongelado","50 g de almendras blanqueadas y finamente picadas","50 g de pasas","½ cucharadita de cardamomo molido","¼ cucharadita de nuez moscada rallada"]','["Primero, haz el relleno. Vierta la leche en una cacerola a fuego medio y hierva durante unos 25-30 minutos hasta que se reduzca a una crema espesa. (Es mejor usar awok, karahi o una cazuela resistente para esto, porque desea que la leche se reduzca rápidamente sin quemarse ni dorarse). Revuelva continuamente, raspando los lados de la sartén mientras se cocina. Cuando tenga la consistencia de huevos revueltos suaves y despegándose de los lados de la sartén, apague el fuego.","Transfiera la leche reducida a una cacerola limpia, agregue el azúcar y cocine a fuego lento durante 3-4 minutos, revolviendo todo el tiempo, hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Agrega el coco, las almendras, las pasas, el cardamomo y la nuez moscada y baja el fuego a medio. Continúe cocinando durante 3-4 minutos hasta que la mezcla espese. Apagar el fuego y dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, haz la masa. Tamice la harina y ¼ de cucharadita de sal fina en un tazón, luego agregue el ghee derretido enfriado. Con las yemas de los dedos, frote el ghee con la harina hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado grueso. Agregue suficiente agua fría para unir la mezcla hasta formar una masa muy firme y amase bien hasta que quede suave. Tapar y dejar a temperatura ambiente durante al menos 30 minutos.","Divida la masa y forme 17-18 bolas de unos 20 g cada una y de aproximadamente 3 cm de diámetro. Mantén la masa tapada para evitar que se seque.","Extienda cada bola sobre una superficie ligeramente engrasada hasta formar un círculo de unos 10 cm de diámetro (la masa quedará más fina si las bolas se extienden individualmente). No te preocupes si no tienes círculos perfectos.","Calienta el aceite en un wok o karahi a fuego medio a 130°C o hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 1 min. Freír las gujiyas en tandas durante 6-8 minutos hasta que la masa esté dorada por ambos lados. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y dejar enfriar antes de servir a temperatura ambiente. Se conservará en una lata hermética durante 3-4 días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14490,4062,'es','Pollo frito al aire','Use una freidora para hacer estos muslos de pollo fáciles y agregue el condimento o la salsa de su elección. Es una manera fácil de cocinar pollo cuando estás ocupado.','["4 muslos de pollo grandes u 8 pequeños, con piel","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o de oliva","1 cucharada de harina común","condimento de su elección (use sal y pimienta, o ½-1 cucharadita de BBQ ahumado, ras-el-hanout, ajo granulado, sal de apio o garam masala)"]','["Mezcle los muslos de pollo en el aceite, asegurándose de que queden bien cubiertos.","Mezcle la harina con el condimento, luego mezcle con los muslos de pollo; quedará una capa muy ligera, pero puede duplicar la harina y el condimento si prefiere una capa más espesa.","Acomoda el pollo en una capa sobre la bandeja de una freidora sin paleta y programa para cocinar por 35 minutos. Compruebe que los muslos estén cocidos separando la pulpa de la parte inferior de uno del hueso; debe desprenderse fácilmente y no debe quedar ningún resto rosado. Cocine por otros 5 a 10 minutos si es necesario. La piel debería haber burbujeado y crujiente, y el exceso de grasa del pollo habrá goteado en la base de la freidora (puedes desechar esto). No dejes el pollo en la freidora o el vapor volverá a suavizar la piel."]','2026-01-11 13:02:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14491,4064,'es','Cerdos gigantes en mantas','Haga cerdos de gran tamaño en mantas para una guarnición navideña muy especial. Unte con jarabe de arce al final de la cocción para disfrutar aún más','["6 salchichas de cerdo","6 ramitas pequeñas de romero","6 lonchas de tocino ahumado","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o vegetal"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Trabajando con una salchicha a la vez, coloque una ramita de romero encima y envuélvala con una loncha de tocino.","Coloque las salchichas envueltas en una bandeja para hornear y rocíe con aceite. Ase durante 25-30 minutos, hasta que estén dorados y bien cocidos."]','2026-01-11 13:02:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14492,4070,'es','huevos rellenos','Prepare huevos rellenos para servir en un buffet del Boxing Day. Están rellenos de mostaza, cebolletas, mayonesa, yogur y una pizca de cayena. Cubra con cebollino, si lo desea.','["6 huevos grandes","2 cucharadas de mayonesa","2 cucharadas de yogur griego entero","1 tsp Dijon mustard","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas","¼ cucharadita de sal de apio","pizca de pimienta de cayena","cebollino picado"]','["Coloque los huevos en una cacerola con agua hirviendo y cocine durante 10 minutos. Apaga el fuego y deja reposar los huevos en el agua caliente durante 2 minutos. Escurrir, luego transferir los huevos a un recipiente con agua helada y dejar enfriar. Pele los huevos y córtelos por la mitad, luego saque las yemas y póngalas en un bol con la mayonesa, el yogur, la mostaza, las cebolletas, la sal de apio y la pimienta de cayena. Triture todo hasta que quede suave y luego colóquelo en una manga pastelera equipada con una boquilla redonda y lisa.","Vierta la mezcla en los huevos ahuecados o vierta con cuidado en el centro con una cuchara pequeña. Espolvoree algunas cebolletas, si las usa, y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:02:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14493,4074,'es','Mini hasselbacks con crema agria, eneldo y cebolla rosada encurtida','Cubra estos mini hasselbacks con crema agria, cebollas rosadas en escabeche y eneldo para comer con los dedos fácilmente. Son ideales para fiestas y buffets.','["1,5 kg de patatas nuevas","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","8 cucharadas de crema agria","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado","50 g de azúcar","100 ml de vinagre de sidra o vino blanco","1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas","1 cebolla morada mediana, finamente rebanada"]','["Prepare las cebollas encurtidas al menos 4 horas antes de servir. Combine el azúcar y 100 ml de agua hirviendo en un recipiente no metálico resistente al calor. Agrega el vinagre y la sal. Agrega las cebollas y presiona con una cuchara para sumergirlas. Cubra y deje encurtir durante al menos 4 horas, o enfríe durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cortar finamente las patatas a intervalos regulares a lo largo sin cortarlas. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear, rocíe con aceite, sazone, agregue el ajo y ase durante 1 hora a 1 hora y 20 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que estén tiernos y dorados.","Batir la crema agria con la mayor parte del eneldo y luego sazonar. Transfiera las papas a un plato para servir y vierta una cucharadita de la mezcla de crema agria sobre cada una. Escurre las cebollas encurtidas (si lo deseas, usa el líquido de encurtido para aderezos para ensaladas) y agrega unos trozos a cada papa. Esparcir con el eneldo restante."]','2026-01-11 13:02:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14494,4076,'es','Ensalada de chirivías, espinacas, alcachofas y arroz salvaje','Disfrute de esta ensalada vegetariana de arroz salvaje con espinacas, alcachofas y chirivías como parte de un buffet del Boxing Day.','["350 g de arroz salvaje (use una mezcla o arroz negro funciona bien)","200 g de chirivías (unas 2 medianas), peladas y cortadas en tiras finas con un pelador de verduras","8 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino, trituradas","2 limones, exprimidos","2 cucharadas de mostaza Dijon","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","200 g de espinacas tiernas picadas","300 g de alcachofas a la brasa en aceite, escurridas y cortadas en rodajas","manojo pequeño de menta, hojas recogidas y finamente picadas"]','["Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego escúrralo. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle las chirivías con 2 cucharadas de aceite y colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear grande forrada con papel para hornear en una sola capa. Espolvorea con un poco de condimento y la mitad de las semillas de comino. Ase durante 25-30 minutos, revolviendo a la mitad, hasta que esté dorado y crujiente.","Batir el jugo de limón, la mostaza, las semillas de comino restantes y el orégano en un tazón grande, luego agregar el aceite restante, batiendo continuamente, hasta que espese. Sazone bien. Agregue el arroz cocido.","Incorpora las espinacas, las alcachofas y la menta a la mezcla de arroz y sazona al gusto. Espolvoree con las patatas fritas de chirivía para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14495,4084,'es','Salsa de arándanos especiada','Prepare esta salsa de arándanos especiada para servir en su mesa festiva. Es espeso y con trozos como el chutney; para obtener una consistencia más fina, simplemente agregue 100 ml de agua.','["250 g de arándanos frescos o congelados","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada o vinagre balsámico","½ naranja, finamente rallada y exprimida","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada, más extra si es necesario","pizca de pimienta de Jamaica molida"]','["Vierta todos los ingredientes en una cacerola y cocine a fuego lento a fuego lento. Cocine durante 10 minutos o hasta que los arándanos revienten y la salsa esté espesa, brillante y pegajosa.","Si prefieres una salsa más dulce, añade un poco más de azúcar. Dejar enfriar. Se conservará tapado en el frigorífico hasta una semana o congelado durante dos meses."]','2026-01-11 13:02:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14496,4086,'es','Sopa de tomate ahumado, chipotle y maíz carbonizado','Saca la pasta de chipotle y prepara esta potente sopa de tomate ahumado, chipotle y maíz dulce carbonizado. Una comida fácil entre semana, puedes congelar las sobras.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, picados","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","manojo pequeño de cilantro, tallos picados y hojas enteras","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","600 ml de caldo de verduras","1-1½ cucharada de pasta de chile chipotle","2 mazorcas de maíz","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","4 cucharadas de yogur griego sin grasa"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cazuela y sofreír la cebolla durante 10 minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Agrega el ajo, el cilantro molido y los tallos de cilantro y cocina por 1 min. Revuelva los tomates, el caldo y el chipotle y cocine a fuego lento. Cocine tapado a fuego lento durante 20 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Mientras tanto, hierva una cacerola con agua y cocine el maíz durante 4 minutos. Escurrir y dejar enfriar un poco. Corta los granos de la mazorca con un cuchillo afilado. Calienta una sartén antiadherente a fuego alto. Agrega el maíz y fríe durante 5-7 minutos o hasta que se queme, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Sirva la sopa en tazones. Cubra con el queso feta, el yogur, el maíz carbonizado y las hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:02:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14497,4088,'es','Semillas de calabaza tostadas','No tires las semillas si estás cocinando una calabaza; intenta asarlas con esta receta sencilla. Son un refrigerio sabroso con un poco de condimento o una guarnición llamativa.','["semillas de calabaza frescas, extraídas de la calabaza","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Lavar bien las semillas y quitar los trozos fibrosos de pulpa de calabaza. Secar bien con papel de cocina.","Pon las semillas en una bandeja para horno y mezcla con el aceite de oliva. Ase durante 10 minutos. Sirva con un poco de condimento como refrigerio, si lo desea, o úselo como guarnición para ensaladas o sopas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14498,4090,'es','Sopa de calabaza vegana','Aprovecha al máximo la temporada de calabazas a principios de otoño con esta saludable sopa de calabaza vegana. Tostar las semillas de calabaza y utilizarlas como guarnición para añadir textura.','["1 calabaza mediana o grande (aproximadamente 1½ kg)","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","½ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica molida","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","1 cucharada de jengibre picado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1-1,2 litros de caldo vegano","1 cucharada de miso blanco vegano","3 cucharadas de crema de soja o yogur de coco","3 cucharadas de hojuelas de coco","3 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro picado","1 lima, rallada y en jugo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Pelar, quitar las semillas y picar la calabaza en trozos de 3 cm (reservar las semillas para la salsa – ver consejo). Coloque la calabaza en una bandeja para hornear, rocíe la mitad del aceite, espolvoree con la pimienta de Jamaica y revuelva bien. Sazone y ase durante 30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y tierno. Mientras tanto, tuesta los copos de coco para la salsa en una sartén seca a fuego lento durante unos minutos hasta que estén ligeramente dorados. Retirar de la sartén y dejar enfriar, luego agregar las semillas de calabaza, la guindilla, el cilantro y la ralladura de lima.","Calienta el aceite restante en una cacerola grande a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla durante 5 minutos hasta que esté tierna pero no dorada. Añade el jengibre y el ajo y sofríe un minuto más, luego añade 1 litro de caldo y el miso. Coloque la calabaza asada en la sartén y déjela hervir a fuego lento. Retirar del fuego y licuar la sopa con una batidora hasta que quede suave. Si prefieres una sopa más líquida, añade el caldo restante. Vuelva a hervir la sopa a fuego lento, luego sazone bien y agregue el jugo de lima. Sirva en tazones y sirva cubierto con un remolino de crema de soja y una pizca de salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:02:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14499,4092,'es','Tortitas de cangrejo y tartar de hierbas','Usa cangrejo para llevar tus pasteles de pescado al siguiente nivel. Son ideales para compartir y mojar en nuestra picante salsa tártara. Si puedes, usa carne de cangrejo fresca.','["2 patatas grandes (unos 600 g)","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol, más extra para freír","100 g de carne de cangrejo marrón","200 g de carne de cangrejo blanco","1 limón, rallado","pizca de pimienta de cayena","pizca de mostaza en polvo","50 g de harina común","2 huevos, ligeramente batidos","100 g de pan rallado panko o pan rallado fresco","rodajas de limón, para servir","120 g de mayonesa","1 tsp Dijon mustard","1 cucharadita de alcaparras, escurridas y picadas en trozos grandes","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","¼ manojo pequeño de estragón, finamente picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Pinchar las patatas por todas partes con un tenedor, frotar con el aceite, poner en una bandeja para horno y hornear durante 1 h 30 min, o hasta que se pueda insertar un cuchillo fácilmente. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Pon toda la carne de cangrejo, la ralladura de limón, la cayena y la mostaza en polvo en un bol con una pizca grande de sal. Corta las patatas por la mitad y coloca la pulpa en el bol. Doble todo con cuidado y luego forme 12 hamburguesas pequeñas con las manos.","Vierta la harina en un recipiente poco profundo, vierta el huevo en un segundo y el pan rallado en un tercero. Pasar cada hamburguesa por harina, luego por huevo y finalmente por pan rallado. Coloque las croquetas de pescado en un plato y déjelas enfriar durante 10 minutos.","Para la salsa tártara, combine todos los ingredientes en un bol. Dejar de lado.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calentar un buen chorro de aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y freír la mitad de las croquetas de cangrejo durante 3 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que estén doradas y crujientes. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 8 a 10 minutos, o hasta que esté bien cocido.","Sirva los pasteles de cangrejo en una fuente con un tazón de salsa tártara a un lado para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:02:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14500,4094,'es','Ensalada de repollo y chile','Sirva esta ensalada de repollo y chile con doner kebabs. Déjelo enfriar durante uno o dos días y se ablandará y se transformará en una ensalada de repollo más ligera estilo kimchi.','["½ col blanca, cortada finamente","½ cantidad de salsa de chile ahumado (consulte la receta en \"Combina bien\", a continuación)","½ limón, exprimido","8 cebolletas, peladas y cortadas finamente en ángulo"]','["Mezcle el repollo en un bol con ½ cucharadita de sal. Dejar reposar durante 30 minutos y luego enjuagar con agua corriente fría. Dejar secar en un colador.","Regrese el repollo al tazón y mezcle con la salsa de chile, el jugo de limón y las cebolletas. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14501,4096,'es','Salsa de chile ahumado','Prepare esta salsa de chile ahumado para acompañar doner kebabs, hamburguesas o perritos calientes caseros. Lleno de ajo y picante, promete agregar sabor a tus platos.','["12 chiles rojos","10 dientes de ajo","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito extra","pizca de azúcar en polvo"]','["Retire los tallos de los chiles y luego colóquelos sobre una hoja de papel de aluminio con los dientes de ajo, un chorrito de aceite de oliva, azúcar en polvo y un poco de sal. Levante los lados del papel de aluminio y apriételo para cerrarlo.","Ase en la barbacoa (o ase a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3) durante 30 minutos hasta que el ajo esté suave. Vierta en un mortero grande o en un procesador de alimentos con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva y triture o mezcle hasta obtener una salsa espesa. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14502,4098,'es','Pavlova de plátano, tahini y caramelo salado','Sorprenda a sus invitados con esta pavlova, que incluye una fabulosa cobertura de plátano, tahini y caramelo salado. Es un postre deliciosamente decadente para un festín de verano.','["½ limón exprimido (reserva la otra mitad)","6 claras de huevo grandes","350 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","400ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de tahini","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas","3 plátanos, en rodajas","3 cucharadas de caramelo salado","2 brochetas de sésamo"]','["Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Usando un molde o plato redondo de 18 cm como guía, dibuja un círculo en el pergamino y luego dale la vuelta. Calentar el horno a 130C/110C ventilador/gas ½.","Frote la mitad del limón reservada por el interior de un tazón grande o una batidora de pie, luego limpie con papel de cocina para eliminar la mantequilla o el aceite. Vierta las claras y bata con una batidora eléctrica o con la batidora a velocidad baja hasta que las claras formen pequeñas burbujas espumosas, aproximadamente 1-2 minutos. Continúe hasta que la mezcla parezca espuma de afeitar, luego agregue el azúcar, 1 cucharada a la vez, hasta obtener un merengue espeso y brillante. Frote un poco entre los dedos; si nota algún grano de azúcar, siga batiendo durante unos minutos. Agrega la harina de maíz, el jugo de limón y la vainilla y bate por otros 30 segundos.","Coloque el merengue sobre el papel para hornear preparado, en el centro del círculo, y extiéndalo hasta los bordes con una espátula. Pase el cuchillo por el borde y luego alise la parte superior.","Hornee por 15 minutos, luego baje el horno a 100C/80C ventilador/gas ¼ y hornee por 1 hora. Apague el horno y deje enfriar la pavlova dentro durante al menos 2 horas, o toda la noche.","Cuando esté listo para servir, invierte con cuidado la pavlova y retira el pergamino. No te preocupes si se agrieta un poco, quedará cubierto por la cobertura.","Para hacer la cobertura, bata la nata doble, el tahini y el azúcar glas hasta obtener picos suaves. Vierta sobre la pavlova y cubra con los plátanos en rodajas, luego rocíe sobre caramelo salado y desmenuce sobre las galletas de sésamo. Es mejor servirlo de inmediato, pero las sobras se conservarán en el refrigerador durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14503,4100,'es','Pavlova de azúcar de sandía, lima y menta','Pruebe una versión diferente de la pavlova con cobertura de sandía, lima y menta. Con merengue crujiente y centro de malvavisco, este es un postre que seguramente impresionará','["½ limón exprimido (reserva la otra mitad)","6 claras de huevo grandes","350 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","un puñado de hojas de menta y más para servir","50 g de azúcar en polvo","400ml de nata doble","200 gramos de yogur natural","1 lima, rallada","sandía pequeña, cortada en gajos y sin cáscara"]','["Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Utilizando un molde o plato para pastel redondo de 18 cm como guía, dibuja un círculo en el pergamino y luego dale la vuelta. Calentar el horno a 130C/110C ventilador/gas ½.","Frote la mitad del limón reservada por el interior de un tazón grande o una batidora de pie, luego limpie con papel de cocina para eliminar la mantequilla o el aceite. Vierta las claras y bata con una batidora eléctrica o con la batidora a velocidad baja hasta que las claras formen pequeñas burbujas espumosas, aproximadamente 1-2 minutos. Continúe hasta que la mezcla parezca espuma de afeitar, luego agregue el azúcar, 1 cucharada a la vez, hasta obtener un merengue espeso y brillante. Frote un poco entre los dedos; si nota algún grano de azúcar, siga batiendo durante unos minutos. Agrega la harina de maíz, el jugo de limón y la vainilla y bate por otros 30 segundos.","Coloca el merengue en la bandeja para hornear preparada, en el centro del círculo, y extiéndelo hasta los bordes con una espátula. Pase el cuchillo por el borde y luego alise la parte superior.","Hornee durante 15 minutos, luego baje el horno a 100 ° C/80 ° C con ventilador/gas ¼ y hornee durante 1 hora. Apague el horno y deje enfriar la pavlova dentro durante al menos 2 horas, o toda la noche.","Invierta con cuidado la pavlova y retire el pergamino. No te preocupes si se agrieta un poco, quedará cubierto por la cobertura.","Para hacer la cobertura, mezcla la menta con el azúcar en polvo. Batir con unas varillas eléctricas la nata doble y el yogur natural hasta que mantenga su forma. Espolvoree sobre la ralladura de lima y el azúcar de menta, luego incorpórelo a la mezcla de crema con una cuchara grande de metal para que se ondula. Vierta sobre la pavlova. Cubra con el resto del azúcar de menta, la sandía y más menta. Sirva con rodajas de lima para exprimir. Es mejor servirlo de inmediato, pero las sobras se conservarán en el refrigerador durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14504,4106,'es','Piccata de pollo con verduras al ajillo y patatas nuevas','Aprovecha el tiempo entre semana con nuestra sabrosa piccata de pollo con alcaparras, verduras y patatas nuevas. Listo en 20 minutos, es saludable y además bajo en calorías','["200 g de patatas nuevas, partidas por la mitad o en cuartos","300 g de judías verdes, peladas","200 g de verduras tiernas, ralladas","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel","3 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","100 ml de caldo de pollo o agua","1 cucharada de alcaparras escurridas","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","2 dientes de ajo pequeños, rebanados","1 cucharada de parmesano rallado"]','["Cocine las patatas nuevas en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo con sal durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Agregue las judías verdes y las verduras tiernas durante los últimos 3 minutos. Escurrir y luego separar las verduras de las patatas.","Mientras se cocinan las patatas, corta las pechugas de pollo por el centro a lo largo, dejando un lado unido para que se abra como un libro. Unte cada uno con 1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva y luego sazone.","Calienta una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto y cocina el pollo durante 4 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté dorado. Vierta sobre el caldo, las alcaparras, el jugo de limón y la ralladura, luego cocine a fuego lento durante unos minutos para reducir. Añade las patatas cocidas y cocina a fuego lento durante un minuto más.","Calienta la cucharadita de aceite restante en otra sartén y fríe el ajo durante 1 minuto hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y fragante. Agregue las verduras escurridas y agregue el aceite con ajo. Sazone, luego esparza el parmesano y sirva con el pollo y las patatas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14505,4107,'es','Polos de frutas arcoiris','Lleva fruta con estos divertidos polos arcoíris, hechos con mango, plátano, kiwi y bayas. Si quieres un color más vivo, añade colorante alimentario a las mezclas frutales.','["100 g de mango, pelado, deshuesado y picado","2 plátanos","400 g de yogur","2 kiwis, pelados y picados en trozos grandes","100 g de frambuesas congeladas","100 g de moras congeladas"]','["Mezcla el mango con ½ plátano y 100 g de yogur en una licuadora hasta que quede suave. Divida entre seis moldes para paletas de hielo e inserte un palito en cada uno. Sostenga cada palito en posición vertical dentro del molde y asegúrelo por ambos lados con cinta adhesiva. Congele durante 1 hora hasta que cuaje.","Repita con otro ½ plátano, 100 g más de yogur y el kiwi, y viértalo sobre la capa de plátano. Congele por 1 hora más hasta que cuaje. Repita con las frambuesas, luego con las moras, congelando cada capa antes de cubrir con la siguiente. Cubra y congele los caramelos durante la noche. Pasar por agua tibia para desmoldar. Se mantendrá en el congelador hasta por dos meses."]','2026-01-11 13:02:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14506,4109,'es','Espaguetis arcoiris','Intente preparar estos espaguetis arcoíris como actividad sensorial para bebés y niños pequeños, o sírvalos como un almuerzo divertido; simplemente cúbralos con su aderezo favorito y disfrútelos con una ensalada.','["200 g de espaguetis","una mezcla de colorantes alimentarios (usamos rojo, amarillo, verde y azul)","aderezo para ensalada o mantequilla derretida","50 g de queso cheddar rallado","ensalada mixta de hojas y verduras"]','["Cocine los espaguetis siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escúrrelo y luego divídelo en tazones, según la cantidad de colores que quieras usar (hicimos cinco colores). Agregue una gota de colorante alimentario a cada tazón o combine dos colores (como rojo y amarillo para obtener naranja). Mezcla bien y agrega un chorrito de agua para ayudar a que el color se disperse, si es necesario. Déjelo durante 5 minutos, luego enjuague los espaguetis con agua corriente fría para fijar el color.","Si desea utilizar los espaguetis únicamente como actividad sensorial, inclínelos en una bandeja grande o recipiente de plástico y deje que sus pequeños se sumerjan. Si lo desea, agregue cubitos de hielo o déles a los niños mayores (de dos a cuatro años) tijeras de seguridad para practicar sus habilidades de corte.","Si va a servir los espaguetis, mézclelos con un poco de aderezo para ensalada o mantequilla derretida, luego cubra con un poco de queso rallado y una ensalada de hojas y verduras mixtas."]','2026-01-11 13:02:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14507,4111,'es','''Donuts'' de manzana','Haga estos aros de manzana estilo donut para un picnic con los niños. A los niños les encantará ayudar a preparar, decorar y comer estas delicias frutales, y no es necesario cocinarlas.','["150 g de queso tierno","2 cucharaditas de miel","3 manzanas (use una variedad para comer crujiente)","3-4 cucharadas de mantequilla de almendras o maní (opcional)","chispitas de colores, para decorar"]','["Mezclar el queso tierno con la miel y reservar. Pele las manzanas y luego córtelas desde el corazón en cinco o seis aros, de aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor. Utilice un descorazonador de manzanas o un cortador de galletas pequeño y redondo para hacer un círculo en el centro de cada rebanada, quitando el corazón y creando formas de \"rosquilla\". Seque las rebanadas con papel de cocina; deben estar lo más secas posible para ayudar a que los ingredientes se peguen.","Unte un poco de mantequilla de nueces sobre las rodajas, si las usa, luego cubra con el queso tierno endulzado. Decora con las chispas y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:02:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14508,4113,'es','Pizzas de bollos','Ayude a los niños más pequeños a preparar estas sencillas pizzas de bollos para el almuerzo o deje que los niños mayores las preparen ellos mismos. Usa cualquier verdura que tengas en el refrigerador para los aderezos.','["6 bollos","Pasaron 4 cucharadas","4 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","aderezos de su elección (pimientos, tomates cherry, cebolla morada, maíz dulce, aceitunas, jamón y albahaca, todos funcionan bien)","75 g de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Tuesta ligeramente los bollos en una tostadora o bajo la parrilla. Mientras tanto, mezcle la passata, el ketchup y el orégano en un bol. Estación. Pica los ingredientes elegidos en trozos pequeños; los niños pequeños pueden partir la albahaca o picar verduras suaves en una taza con unas tijeras de seguridad.","Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel de aluminio. Unte la salsa sobre los bollos y luego cubra con las verduras y el queso. Colóquelos en la bandeja y cocine a la parrilla durante 3-4 minutos, hasta que el queso esté dorado y burbujeante. Dejar enfriar un poco antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 13:02:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14509,4115,'es','Ensalada de remolacha asada y miel cruda','Sirva un almuerzo o guarnición rico en fibra con esta ensalada de remolacha, queso feta y lentejas verdes. Rebosante de color, está lleno de sabor y nutrientes.','["3 remolachas grandes, cortadas en gajos","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","5 ramitas de tomillo","25 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","1 cucharada de miel","200 g de lentejas verdes enlatadas, escurridas","50g de rúcula","30 g de semillas mixtas","un puñado pequeño de eneldo, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8. Mezcle la remolacha, ½ cucharada de aceite y el tomillo en una fuente para asar. Estación. Ase durante 30-35 minutos o hasta que esté tierno, agregando el queso feta durante los últimos 10 minutos. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Batir el aceite restante con la miel, un chorrito de agua fría para soltar y un poco de condimento. Calienta las lentejas en una sartén o en el microondas y luego sazona. Mezcle la remolacha y el queso feta con la rúcula y el aderezo, luego sirva encima de las lentejas con las semillas y el eneldo esparcidos por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:02:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14510,4119,'es','paletas de sandía','Pruebe una forma nueva y divertida de servir sandía a los niños. También puedes colocar uvas verdes y negras en palitos de kebab y terminar con una fresa.','["1 sandía grande"]','["Corta la sandía en rodajas de 2 cm de grosor. Corta cada rebanada en una cuña triangular.","Haga una pequeña incisión en el centro de la piel de cada pieza, lo suficientemente grande como para introducir un palito de paleta."]','2026-01-11 13:02:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14511,4121,'es','Sorbete de mango','Aprovecha al máximo los mangos dulces con este refrescante sorbete de mango. Bajo en grasas, es el postre perfecto para los días cálidos y templados.','["3 mangos grandes y maduros","200 g de azúcar en polvo","1 lima, exprimida"]','["Pela los mangos con un pelador de verduras, corta la mayor cantidad posible de pulpa del hueso y ponla en un procesador de alimentos o licuadora.","Añade el azúcar, el zumo de lima y 200 ml de agua. Licúa por unos minutos, hasta que el mango esté muy suave y el azúcar se haya disuelto – frota un poco de la mezcla entre tus dedos, si aún se siente arenoso, licúa por un poco más. Vierte en un recipiente y mete en el congelador unas horas.","Vuelva a colocar el sorbete en la licuadora (si está muy sólido, déjelo a temperatura ambiente durante 5 a 10 minutos primero). Batir hasta obtener una mezcla granizada, luego verter nuevamente en el molde y congelar durante aproximadamente una hora más.","Repita el paso 3. Congele hasta que esté sólido (una o dos horas más). Se mantendrá tapado en el congelador durante tres meses."]','2026-01-11 13:02:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14512,4123,'es','Flaps de miel fáciles','Disfrute de estos sencillos flapjacks de miel para las once o la depresión de la tarde. Perfecto para picnics, almuerzos para llevar y venta de pasteles.','["225 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para la lata","75 g de azúcar en polvo","4 cucharadas de miel","350 g de gachas de avena"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde rectangular de 30 x 15 cm con papel para hornear. Derrita la mantequilla, el azúcar y la miel en una sartén a fuego medio, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que la mantequilla se derrita y la mezcla esté suave.","Pon la avena en un tazón y luego vierte sobre la mezcla de mantequilla y miel. Revuelve hasta que toda la avena esté cubierta. Vierta la lata preparada y use una espátula o el dorso de una cuchara para distribuir uniformemente la mezcla. Cocine durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Dejar enfriar en el molde, luego retirar antes de cortar en cuadritos."]','2026-01-11 13:02:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14513,4127,'es','Buñuelos de sésamo, halloumi y calabacín con un chorrito de miel y chile','Aprovecha el exceso de calabacines con estos sencillos y rápidos buñuelos hechos con halloumi y semillas de sésamo. Sirva con un delicioso chorrito de miel y chile.','["2 calabacines medianos, rallados","½ cucharadita de sal marina, más un poco más para servir","30 g de harina con levadura","20 g de arroz o maicena","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo tostadas","¼ cucharadita de pimienta blanca molida","2 cucharaditas de hojas de menta, finamente picadas","80 g de halloumi rallado","2 huevos grandes","2 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","aceite vegetal, para freír","2 cucharadas de miel","½ cucharadita de pul biber u otras hojuelas de chile","2 limones, rallado"]','["Para rociar la miel de chile, caliente la miel, 2 cucharadas de agua, las hojuelas de chile y la ralladura de limón en una cacerola pequeña hasta que burbujee y esté almibarada, aproximadamente 3 minutos. Poner los calabacines en un colador y espolvorear con sal. Deje escurrir durante 30 minutos, luego use las manos para exprimir el líquido; las quiere lo más secas posible.","Combine las harinas, las semillas de sésamo y la pimienta en un bol. Añade la menta, el halloumi y el calabacín y revuelve ligeramente para combinar. Rompe los huevos y usa un tenedor para incorporarlos a la mezcla junto con las cebolletas. Revuelve hasta tener una masa espesa.","Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande de fondo grueso y revuelva para cubrir la base. Añade 2 cucharadas colmadas de masa por cada buñuelo, aplanándolos con una espátula y sofríe un par de minutos hasta que estén dorados. Dales la vuelta y presiona con la espátula, luego fríelos unos minutos más hasta que estén dorados y completamente cocidos. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y sazonar con unas escamas de sal marina. Rocíe con miel de chile para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14514,4133,'es','Pizzas de hojaldre','Diviértete preparando estas pizzas de hojaldre con los niños. Corta las verduras que tengas en trozos pequeños y deja que cada uno elija sus propios ingredientes.','["Hoja de 320 g de masa de hojaldre ligera ya laminada","6 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de salsa de tomate","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","75 g de mozzarella o queso cheddar","maíz dulce, aceitunas, pimientos, cebolla morada, tomates cherry, espinacas, albahaca"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Desenrollar la masa, cortarla en seis cuadrados y colocarla sobre dos bandejas para horno forradas con papel para hornear. Utilice un cuchillo para cuchillos para marcar un borde de 1 cm alrededor del borde de cada cuadrado de masa. Hornee durante 15 minutos, hasta que esté inflado pero no completamente cocido.","Mientras se cocina la masa, prepara la salsa y prepara los aderezos. Mezclar el puré de tomate, el ketchup, el orégano y 1 cucharada de agua. Ralla el queso y pica en trozos pequeños las verduras o hierbas que quieras poner encima. Dejar de lado.","Retire la masa del horno y aplaste el centro con el dorso de una cuchara. Divida la salsa entre los cuadritos de masa y extiéndala hasta los bordes inflados. Espolvorea con el queso y luego agrega los aderezos. Hornee por otros 5-8 minutos y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:02:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14515,4137,'es','Sopa cremosa de tomate de 5 verduras','Disfrute de esta sopa llena de verduras para una deliciosa comida familiar ligera, con las sobras para el día siguiente. Sirva con pan o nuestros molinetes de queso, marmita y espinacas.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas picadas","2 zanahorias, picadas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 pimientos rojos, picados","1 batata grande, pelada y picada","2 latas de tomates de 400 g","1 pastilla de caldo de pollo o verduras bajo en sal","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","3 ramitas de romero, hojas recogidas y picadas","70ml de nata doble"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y cocina la cebolla durante 8-10 minutos hasta que se ablande y empiece a tomar un poco de color. Agrega las zanahorias, el ajo, los pimientos y el boniato. Cocine por 10 minutos más, revolviendo con frecuencia y con cuidado de no quemar el ajo. Añade los tomates, el caldo, las hierbas y 1 litro de agua. Llevar a fuego lento. Tapar y cocinar durante 20 minutos hasta que el camote esté suave.","Use una batidora de mano para batir la sopa hasta que quede suave. Agrega la crema y sazona al gusto. Se puede enfriar por tres días o congelar hasta por tres meses."]','2026-01-11 13:02:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14516,4141,'es','Frijoles ahumados y huevos al horno','Agregue los nutrientes con frijoles ahumados y huevos horneados. Ideal para un almuerzo o cena vegetariana en familia, sírvelo con panes planos o tostadas para obtener más sustento.','["2 cucharadas de aceite","1 cebolla, picada","1 pimiento rojo, rebanado","3 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de salsa de tomate","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros o pintos, escurridos","4-6 huevos, dependiendo del hambre que tengas (los adultos pueden querer 2 huevos cada uno)","un puñado de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén amplia y poco profunda y cocina la cebolla durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agregue el pimiento y cocine por otros 5 minutos, revolviendo regularmente, hasta que se ablande. Agregue el ajo, el pimentón y el ketchup, luego agregue los tomates, cubra y deje hervir a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Retire la tapa y cocine por unos minutos más para que espese, luego agregue los frijoles. En esta etapa se puede enfriar y congelar en porciones.","Use una cuchara para hacer de 4 a 6 espacios en la mezcla para los huevos; debería poder ver parte del fondo de la sartén. Rompe los huevos uno por uno en una taza o tazón y deja caer suavemente uno en cada agujero. Tapa la sartén y reduce el fuego a bajo. Cocine durante 3-5 minutos hasta que las claras estén bien cocidas pero las yemas aún estén líquidas. Espolvoree el cilantro para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14517,4149,'es','Hamburguesa de remolacha','¿Buscas una hamburguesa vegana con bocado y mucho sabor? No busques más: estamos seguros de que tanto a los carnívoros como a los vegetarianos y veganos les encantará esta receta de hamburguesa de remolacha.','["1 cebolla, en cuartos","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para cepillar","2 dientes de ajo machacados","200 g de champiñones castaños","250 g de tofu ahumado o normal","2 (unos 100 g) de remolacha cocida (no en vinagre)","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros escurridos","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de mayonesa vegana","1 cucharada de pasta de miso","100 g de harina de avena","2 cucharadas de linaza molida","50 g de nueces","Bolsa de 200 g de arroz integral para microondas, cocido","8 lonchas de queso, vegano si es necesario (opcional)","8 panes para hamburguesa, partidos (consulte la etiqueta si es para veganos)","Mermelada de tomate y chile (ver receta a continuación)","unas hojas de lechuga crujientes","1 aguacate, sin hueso, pelado y triturado aproximadamente","½ lima, en jugo"]','["Pon la cebolla en un procesador de alimentos y pulsa hasta que parezca arroz. Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén grande, agregue la cebolla y fría durante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave y dorada. Agrega el ajo y sofríe 1 minuto más. Vierta la mezcla en un tazón grande.","Coloque los champiñones en el procesador de alimentos y presione hasta que también se parezcan al arroz. Calentar el aceite restante en la sartén, agregar los champiñones y freír durante 10-15 minutos, hasta que el líquido que haya soltado se haya evaporado y los champiñones estén tiernos. Vierta en el bol con las cebollas.","Coloque el tofu, la remolacha, los frijoles, el puré de tomate, la mayonesa, el miso, la harina y la linaza en el procesador de alimentos con un poco de condimento y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Vierta en el tazón con las verduras. Agrega las nueces y la mitad del arroz al procesador de alimentos y pulsa hasta que estén finamente picadas, o un poco más gruesas, si lo prefieres. Vierta en el bol con la mezcla de verduras y tofu, junto con el resto del arroz.","Use sus manos para darle forma a la mezcla en hamburguesas aproximadamente del mismo tamaño que los panes de hamburguesa. Las hamburguesas estarán delicadas, así que déjelas enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos antes de cocinarlas. Si desea asarlos a la parrilla, congélelos primero durante 30 a 45 minutos hasta que estén firmes.","Calienta una sartén a fuego medio o enciende la barbacoa y unta ambos lados de las hamburguesas con un poco de aceite. Cocine durante 5 a 8 minutos por cada lado, volteándolos una vez que se haya formado una costra, hasta que esté carbonizado y caliente hasta el centro. Evite moverlas o girarlas con demasiada frecuencia, ya que quedarán más delicadas que las hamburguesas de carne. Cubra con el queso, si lo usa, durante el último minuto más o menos (consulte el consejo a continuación). Tuesta los panecillos en la barbacoa o en la sartén y luego unta cada uno con un poco de mermelada de guindilla. Rellenar con unas hojas de lechuga, las hamburguesas y un poco de aguacate triturado mezclado con un chorrito de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:02:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14518,4153,'es','Tacos de pollo y maíz dulce','Sirva estos saludables tacos de pollo y maíz dulce para disfrutar de una comida sencilla y llena de sabor entre semana. También te sobrará para hacer wraps de pollo y maíz dulce para el almuerzo de mañana.','["250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 cucharadas de condimento para tacos o fajitas (ver el consejo a continuación)","5-6 pechugas de pollo sin piel, en rodajas","¼ de col lombarda, finamente rallada","3 limas, 1 en jugo y 2 cortadas en gajos","manojo pequeño de cilantro picado","4 mazorcas de maíz dulce, con los granos cortados en rodajas o 400 g de maíz dulce congelado","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","4 cucharadas de yogur sin grasa, para servir","salsa de chile, para servir"]','["Combina la harina con la mitad del aceite y una pizca de sal en un bol. Vierta sobre 125-150 ml de agua tibia y luego forme una masa suave con las manos. Córtelo en seis trozos iguales, luego corte cuatro de los trozos nuevamente por la mitad, de modo que tenga ocho trozos pequeños y dos grandes. Extienda todas las piezas sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada hasta que estén lo más finas posible.","Calienta una sartén seca a fuego medio-alto y cocina las tortillas pequeñas y grandes durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas y tostadas (haz esto una a la vez). Deje enfriar las tortillas grandes, luego cúbralas y reserve para usarlas en las loncheras (consulte el consejo a continuación). Mantenga calientes las tortillas pequeñas en papel de aluminio.","Espolvorea el condimento para tacos sobre el pollo en un tazón y revuelve para combinar. Mezcle el repollo con el jugo de limón, la mitad del cilantro y un poco de condimento en otro tazón, luego déjelo encurtir.","Mientras tanto, calienta dos sartenes a fuego alto. Divide el aceite restante entre las cacerolas y fríe el maíz dulce y una pizca de sal hasta que chisporrotee y se dore, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Lo ideal es que el maíz dulce se queme un poco, ya que esto le da sabor, por lo que es posible que tengas que dejarlo cocinar sin tocarlo por un rato. Mientras el maíz dulce se cocina y se asa, fríe el pollo en la sartén más grande hasta que esté bien cocido y dorado (es posible que tengas que hacerlo en tandas).","Vierta los frijoles negros y el ajo en el maíz dulce y revuelva para calentar. Exprima dos de las rodajas de lima.","Reserve dos cucharadas de pollo (aproximadamente 1 pechuga de pollo) y mezcla de maíz dulce para usar en las loncheras (consulte el consejo a continuación), luego sirva el resto en tazones junto con el repollo, el yogur, las rodajas de limón, el cilantro restante, la salsa de chile y las tortillas para que todos puedan disfrutar."]','2026-01-11 13:02:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14519,4155,'es','Salteado de fideos con cerdo y berenjena','Disfrute de este rápido y saludable salteado de cerdo y berenjena en las noches ocupadas. Esta receta para dos también te da sobras para hacer tazas de lechuga con cerdo y berenjena para el almuerzo del día siguiente.','["½ cucharada de aceite de maní","100 g de carne magra de cerdo picada","1 berenjena, cortada en cubos pequeños","2 nidos de fideos al huevo medianos (unos 100 g)","1 cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal","3 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","½ cucharada de harina de maíz","trozo grande de jengibre, pelado y ½ rallado, ½ cortado en palitos","3 dientes de ajo machacados","½ -1 chile rojo, finamente picado","manojo de cebolletas, cortadas finamente","2 pak choi, hojas separadas o en rodajas"]','["Calienta el aceite en un wok o en una sartén alta y fríe la carne picada durante 5 a 8 minutos, hasta que se dore y comience a estar crujiente en los bordes. Agrega la berenjena y sofríe durante otros 15 minutos hasta que esté suave y traslúcida.","Mientras tanto, cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego escúrralos. Mezcle la salsa de soja, el vinagre, la harina de maíz y 2 cucharadas de agua en un tazón pequeño y reserve.","Añade el jengibre rallado y las cerillas de jengibre, el ajo y la guindilla a la carne picada y sofríe durante un minuto antes de añadir la cebolleta y el pak choi. Sofríe unos minutos más antes de agregar la salsa. Llevar a burbujas y cocinar hasta que la salsa se espese un poco y cubra la berenjena. Coloque la mitad del salteado en un tazón y déjelo enfriar para las tazas de lechuga de berenjena y cerdo sobrantes. (Consulte el consejo a continuación).","Mezcle los fideos escurridos con el resto del salteado en el wok hasta que los fideos estén cubiertos con la salsa. Divida entre tazones calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:02:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14520,4157,'es','Tortilla de ricotta, brócoli y patatas nuevas','Prepare esta frittata rápida y saludable con ensalada de frijoles en 30 minutos. Con sabor a brócoli y ricota, también te quedarán sobras que podrás disfrutar al día siguiente','["100 g de patatas nuevas","200 g de brócoli de tallo largo","200 g de judías verdes, peladas y partidas por la mitad","Lata de 400 g de frijoles mixtos, escurridos","3 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","2 dientes de ajo machacados","una pizca de hojuelas de chile, semillas de comino o semillas de hinojo","4 huevos grandes","50 g de ricota","1 cucharadita de vinagre de jerez","½ manojo pequeño de albahaca, picada en trozos grandes (opcional)"]','["Hervir las patatas durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Agrega el brócoli durante los últimos 2 minutos de cocción. Escurrir y cortar en rodajas gruesas las patatas.","Mientras tanto, poner las judías verdes y los frijoles mixtos en una cacerola y cubrir con agua. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 3-4 minutos, o hasta que las judías verdes estén tiernas. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor en la sartén.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Calienta 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén mediana antiadherente y fríe el ajo durante 1 minuto, luego agrega las hojuelas de chile o las semillas de comino o hinojo y cocina por 1 minuto más. Agregue las papas, el brócoli y los condimentos, y revuelva para cubrirlos con el aceite aromatizado.","Batir los huevos en una jarra, sazonar y verter sobre la mezcla de patatas. Cocine a fuego medio durante 2 minutos o hasta que la base esté firme. Coloque cucharaditas de ricotta encima y luego cocine a la parrilla durante 4-5 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, rocíe otra cucharadita de aceite sobre la mezcla de frijoles con vinagre. Agregue la albahaca, si la usa, y sazone. Corta la frittata en cuatro gajos y sirve dos con la mitad de la ensalada de frijoles a un lado. Enfríe los trozos restantes y la ensalada de frijoles para usarlos en las loncheras a continuación."]','2026-01-11 13:02:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14521,4159,'es','Risotto de gambas, panceta y berros','Prepare nuestro risotto de gambas, panceta y berros en las noches ocupadas entre semana cuando necesite algo rápido. También te sobrará para almorzar el día siguiente.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más 1 cucharadita","3 rebanadas de panceta","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","200 g de arroz para risotto","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 litro de caldo de verduras caliente","200 g de berros, con los tallos picados","25 g de parmesano finamente rallado y un poco más para servir","½ limón, rallado y en jugo","180 g de langostinos crudos, pelados y desvenados"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén amplia y fríe la panceta durante 2 minutos por cada lado. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y luego desmenuzar. Freír la cebolla en la misma sartén durante 5 minutos hasta que esté blanda.","Agregue el arroz y el ajo durante 2 minutos para cubrirlos con el aceite. Agregue la mitad del caldo, lleve a ebullición y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que se absorba. Agregue el caldo restante, un cucharón a la vez, revolviendo constantemente hasta que el arroz esté tierno, aproximadamente 20 minutos.","Agrega la mayor parte de los berros y el parmesano. Sazone bien. Agrega la ralladura de limón y un chorrito de jugo.","Coloque la mitad del risotto en un plato (úselo para el almuerzo del día siguiente; consulte el consejo a continuación). Agrega los langostinos a la sartén y cocina durante 2 minutos hasta que estén rosados. Mezcle el resto de los berros con 1 cucharadita de aceite y jugo de limón. Servir sobre el risotto con un poco de panceta y parmesano."]','2026-01-11 13:02:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14522,4163,'es','Orzo de coliflor carbonizada, limón y alcaparras','Prepare este sencillo plato de orzo y coliflor en solo 25 minutos. Sirve uno para la comida principal y hay sobras para disfrutar en el almuerzo del día siguiente.','["½ coliflor, partida en floretes y con el tallo cortado en cubos","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","100 g de orzo","2 cucharaditas de alcaparras, escurridas y enjuagadas","1 diente de ajo pequeño, rebanado","½ limón, rallado y en jugo","100ml de caldo de verduras bajo en sal (comprobar que sea vegano, si es necesario)","un puñado de hojas de rúcula, para servir"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Mezcle la coliflor con la mitad del aceite y un poco de condimento. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear y cocine a la parrilla durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado, carbonizado y tierno por completo.","Mientras tanto, cocine el orzo en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 8 minutos o hasta que esté al dente. Drenar.","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén y fríe las alcaparras y el ajo hasta que estén dorados. Agregue el orzo, la coliflor, la ralladura y el jugo de limón y el caldo. Burbujee durante 1 minuto, luego vierta la mitad en un tazón y cubra con la rúcula. Deje que las sobras se enfríen para la lonchera; consulte el consejo a continuación."]','2026-01-11 13:02:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14523,4165,'es','Tiras de pollo crujientes','Sirva estos bocados de pollo crujientes para toda la familia con ensalada de zanahoria, salsa de tomate y papa al horno. Utilice pan rallado panko si puede, ya que son más grandes y crujientes.','["150 ml de suero de leche o leche desnatada mezclada con 2 cucharaditas de jugo de limón y luego dejada durante 5 minutos","2 pechugas de pollo grandes sin piel o 4 trozos pequeños de escalope de cerdo","50 g de pan rallado panko","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","1 tsp soy sauce","½ cucharadita de vinagre de vino blanco","2 zanahorias grandes o 4 pequeñas (unos 300 g), peladas y ralladas","½ limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","papas al horno, para servir"]','["Vierta el suero de leche en un recipiente ancho y poco profundo. Corta cada pechuga de pollo por la mitad horizontalmente y sécalas con papel de cocina. Voltéelos en el suero de leche, déjelos en el plato y déjelos enfriar durante 1 hora. Mientras tanto, para la ensalada, mezcla la zanahoria con el jugo de limón y el aceite de oliva. Mezcle los ingredientes de la salsa en otro tazón y reserve ambos.","Caliente una sartén antiadherente grande, agregue el pan rallado y tueste en la sartén seca durante 2-3 minutos hasta que se dore pálido, revolviendo regularmente para que no se quemen. Vierta en un tazón y rompa los grumos grandes.","Caliente el horno a 230C/210C ventilador/gas 8. Coloque las migajas en un plato grande, luego levante las pechugas de pollo del suero de leche y enróllelas en las migajas, asegurándose de que queden cubiertas uniformemente.","Calienta ½ cucharada de aceite en una sartén antiadherente. Freír el pollo durante 1-2 minutos a fuego medio-alto, luego darle la vuelta, añadir el resto del aceite y freír 1 min más.","Transfiera el pollo a una bandeja para hornear y hornee por 5 minutos, luego descanse por 5 minutos y córtelo en tiras. Sirve el pollo y la ensalada de zanahoria con la salsa y las patatas al horno."]','2026-01-11 13:02:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14524,4167,'es','Pisto fácil','Un plato lleno de este pisto vegetal saludable y cálido proporciona los cinco nutrientes necesarios al día y tiene mucho sabor. Servir con pasta o pan fresco.','["2 berenjenas","3 calabacines medianos","2 pimientos rojos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de orégano seco, albahaca o hierbas italianas mixtas","manojo pequeño de albahaca, picada y unas cuantas hojas para servir","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","1-2 cucharadas de azúcar"]','["Cortar la berenjena, el calabacín y el pimiento en trozos de 3 cm. Calienta el aceite de oliva en una cazuela grande o sartén honda a fuego medio. Freír la cebolla durante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave y traslúcida. Añade las verduras picadas, sube el fuego a alto y fríe durante otros 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Agrega el ajo a la sartén, mezcla todo y fríe durante 1 minuto más. Agrega los tomates picados, más media lata de agua (200 ml), las hierbas secas y la albahaca picada. Cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos a fuego medio, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que las verduras estén tiernas y los tomates espesos y cubran las verduras. Sazona y agrega el vinagre y el azúcar para equilibrar el dulzor y la acidez de los tomates. Espolvorea con las hojas de albahaca y sirve con pan rústico o pasta."]','2026-01-11 13:02:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14525,4169,'es','pizza de tortilla','¿Necesitas una cena rápida para dos que esté lista en un instante? Usa todos tus ingredientes favoritos en esta sencilla pizza de tortilla, con abundante mozzarella derretida','["Pasaron 4 cucharadas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","½ cucharadita de hierbas secas (las hierbas mixtas, la albahaca o el orégano funcionan bien)","2 tortillas simples","50 g de mozzarella rallada","6-8 rebanadas de pepperoni","6-8 rodajas de jalapeño en escabeche"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Mezclar la passata, el ajo, el aceite de oliva, las hierbas y sazonar bien. Coloque las tortillas en una bandeja para hornear grande o en dos más pequeñas. Repartir sobre la salsa de tomate dejando un borde de 1cm en los bordes. Espolvorea con la mozzarella, agrega el pepperoni y los jalapeños. Hornee durante 6-8 minutos hasta que los bordes de las tortillas estén crujientes y dorados, y el queso se haya derretido y burbujee."]','2026-01-11 13:02:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14526,4175,'es','Huevos horneados con frijoles y salsa','Prepare estos huevos horneados de cinco ingredientes con tomates y frijoles usando alimentos básicos de la despensa. Es un plato rápido, fácil, rico y saludable.','["2 latas de 400 g de tomates cherry","Lata de 400 g de ensalada mixta de frijoles, escurrida","200 g de espinacas tiernas","4 huevos medianos","50 g de jamón ahumado en rodajas finas, desmenuzado","pan de centeno integral, para servir (opcional)"]','["Coloque los tomates y la ensalada de frijoles en una sartén resistente al horno o en una cacerola poco ignífuga. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos o hasta que se reduzca. Agregue las espinacas y cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que se ablanden.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio. Haga cuatro hendiduras en la mezcla con el dorso de una cuchara y luego rompa un huevo en cada una. Coloque el jamón en la mezcla, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 4-5 minutos, o hasta que las claras estén cuajadas y las yemas líquidas. Sirva con pan de centeno, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14527,4177,'es','Papas fritas marinadas con albóndigas','Cubra las papas fritas cocidas al horno con marinara de albóndigas para disfrutar de un plato para compartir que agradará a todos. Ideal para una velada con amigos.','["300 g de patatas fritas congeladas","½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","½ cebolla finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","½ cucharada de azúcar","150 g de albóndigas de ternera","40 g de mozzarella rallada","40 g de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Cocine las papas fritas siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite de oliva en una sartén y sofreír la cebolla durante 10 minutos. Agrega el ajo y las hojuelas de chile y sofríe durante 5 minutos más. Agregue los tomates, el orégano y el azúcar, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","En otra sartén, fríe las albóndigas de res durante 5 minutos hasta que se doren, luego agrégalas a la salsa y deja hervir durante 5 minutos o hasta que estén bien cocidas. Pon las patatas fritas en una fuente resistente al calor y cubre con las albóndigas y la salsa. Esparcir sobre la mozzarella y el queso cheddar. Ase durante 2-3 minutos hasta que el queso se derrita. Sazone y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:02:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14528,4179,'es','Fideos de Singapur fáciles','Atiende a toda la familia con nuestros fideos Singapur. Son saludables y veganos, por lo que son un acompañamiento ideal para una comida china o simplemente solos.','["200 g de fideos de arroz","1 cucharada de curry suave en polvo","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de aceite de sésamo","2½ cucharadas de salsa de soja baja en sal","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o vegetal","1 cebolla, rebanada","1 pimiento cortado en rodajas (nosotros usamos ½ verde y ½ naranja)","200 g de brotes de soja","1 chile rojo, en rodajas (opcional)"]','["Hervir la tetera y poner los fideos en una cacerola o bol grande. Vierta suficiente agua hervida para cubrirlos, empujando los fideos bajo el agua para ayudar a que se ablanden de manera uniforme. Déjelo reposar durante 5 a 10 minutos, hasta que los fideos estén completamente suaves. Mezcle el curry en polvo, la cúrcuma, el azúcar, el aceite de sésamo, la salsa de soja y 1 cucharada de agua en un bol.","Calienta el wok hasta que esté muy caliente. Agrega el aceite de girasol, la cebolla y el pimiento. Sofría durante 3-4 minutos hasta que se ablanden y comiencen a dorarse en algunos lugares. Escurre los fideos y agrégalos a la sartén, junto con la mezcla de salsa y los brotes de soja. Sofríe durante 3-4 minutos más, mezclando todo con la salsa, hasta que esté caliente. Ajusta el condimento con un poco más de soja o azúcar, si quieres, y esparce sobre la guindilla, si te gusta más picante."]','2026-01-11 13:02:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14529,4181,'es','Ensalada de pavo','Disfrute de esta ensalada Cobb de pavo como plato de fiesta saludable para aprovechar las sobras navideñas. Está lleno de sabores vibrantes como panceta, aguacate, huevos, achicoria y tomates.','["6 huevos grandes","50 g (unas 7) rebanadas finas de panceta","50 ml de aceite de colza","3 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","1⁄2 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","1 cucharada de perejil finamente picado","1 diente de ajo pequeño, finamente rallado","500 g de pechuga de pavo cocida, en rodajas","3 cabezas de achicoria mixta, con las hojas separadas","2 aguacates medianos, pelados, sin hueso y rebanados","4 tomates medianos, en cuartos","2 cucharadas de semillas mixtas"]','["Cocine los huevos en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo durante 8 minutos. Escurrir, pasar a un recipiente con agua fría y dejar enfriar.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Coloque la panceta en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel de aluminio y cocine a la parrilla durante 3-4 minutos, o hasta que esté crujiente. Pasar papel de cocina para quitar el exceso de aceite y dejar enfriar.","Batir el aceite, el vinagre, la mostaza, el perejil y el ajo. Pelar y cortar por la mitad los huevos.","Coloque el pavo, la achicoria, el aguacate, los tomates, la panceta y los huevos en un plato grande. Rocíe sobre el aderezo, sazone y sirva con las semillas a un lado para espolvorear."]','2026-01-11 13:02:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14530,4183,'es','Estofado cremoso de pollo','Cocine este guiso cremoso y reconfortante para servir con nuestras mini patatas asadas trituradas. Esta olla caliente con pollo, guisantes y puerros es perfecta para una comida familiar especial.','["3 puerros, partidos por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más extra si es necesario","1 cucharada de mantequilla","8 muslos de pollo pequeños","500 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","75 g de crema fresca","200 g de guisantes congelados","3 cucharadas de pan rallado seco o fresco","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado"]','["Echar los puerros y el aceite en una cazuela ignífuga a fuego lento, añadir la mantequilla y cocinar todo muy a fuego lento durante 10 minutos o hasta que los puerros estén blandos.","Coloque el pollo, con la piel hacia abajo, en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio, cocine hasta que la piel se dore, luego déle la vuelta y dore el otro lado. No debería necesitar aceite pero si la piel empieza a pegarse, añade un poco. Agrega el pollo a los puerros, dejando la grasa en la sartén.","Agregue el caldo al plato y cocine a fuego lento, sazone bien, cubra y cocine durante 30 minutos a fuego lento. Agregue la mostaza, la crema fresca y los guisantes y cocine a fuego lento. Debería quedarte bastante salsa.","Cuando estés listo para servir, pon la parrilla. Mezclar el pan rallado y el perejil, espolvorearlos sobre el pollo y asarlo hasta que se dore."]','2026-01-11 13:02:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14531,4187,'es','Risotto de espinacas y cebada','Este plato cremoso utiliza una lata de cebada para reducir el tiempo de cocción a solo 25 minutos. Es una opción de cena saludable y baja en calorías que proporciona tres de tus cinco calorías al día.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 puerro grande (315 g), en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo, picados","2 latas de 400 g de cebada, sin escurrir","1 cucharada de caldo de verduras en polvo","1 cucharadita de salvia finamente picada","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo","160 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","160 g de espinacas","50 g de queso duro vegetariano estilo italiano finamente rallado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y sofreír el puerro y el ajo durante 5-10 minutos, removiendo frecuentemente, hasta que se ablanden, añadiendo un chorrito de agua si se pega.","Vierta las latas de cebada y su líquido, luego agregue el caldo en polvo, la salvia y el tomillo. Cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo con frecuencia, durante 4-5 minutos. Agregue los tomates y las espinacas y cocine durante 2-3 minutos más hasta que las espinacas se ablanden, agregando un chorrito más de agua si es necesario. Agregue la mayor parte del queso y luego sirva con el queso restante esparcido por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:02:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14532,4189,'es','Tortilla de frijoles negros con salsa','Prepare esta frittata como opción de almuerzo rápida, fácil y saludable, aprovechando al máximo los ingredientes de la despensa y empaquetando tres de sus cinco comidas al día.','["Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 chile rojo, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","15 g (½ paquete) de cilantro finamente picado","6 aceitunas Kalamata, en rodajas finas","½ limón o lima, en jugo","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos","3 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","6 huevos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","4 puñados generosos de rúcula"]','["Coloca los tomates en una sartén y agrega la cebolla, la mitad de la guindilla y el pimentón ahumado. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Vierta ¾ en un tazón, luego agregue 2 cucharadas de cilantro, las aceitunas y el jugo de limón.","Mientras tanto, calienta la parrilla. Vierta los frijoles en un tazón y agregue el chile restante, el ajo, el comino y el cilantro. Batir los huevos, luego agregar el ¼ de la salsa reservado y el cilantro fresco restante con un poco de sal al gusto. Mezcle un poco con una batidora de mano o triture algunos de los frijoles con un machacador de patatas.","Calentar una sartén antiadherente de 24 cm con el aceite. Vierta la mezcla de frijoles y déjela cocinar suavemente durante 5-7 minutos hasta que la base esté firme, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 5 minutos. Sacar y cortar en 4 gajos. Si sigues nuestro Plan de Dieta Saludable, sirve dos gajos con la mitad de la salsa restante y la rúcula. Enfriar el resto para el día siguiente."]','2026-01-11 13:02:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14533,4191,'es','Sopa de maíz y guisantes partidos','Cocine esta saludable sopa vegana y agregue cuatro de sus cinco al día junto con bolsitas de sabor de jengibre, chiles, ajo, tomillo y yogur de coco.','["200 g de guisantes amarillos secos","3 ramas de apio (unos 160 g), en rodajas","1 ramita de tomillo, más 1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo","2 cebollas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas (350 g)","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","50 g de jengibre, finamente rallado","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y rebanados","3 dientes de ajo grandes, picados","1 pimiento verde grande, picado en trozos pequeños","1 patata grande (unos 215 g), sin pelar, cortada en trozos de 1 a 2 cm","2 cucharadas de caldo de verduras en polvo","320 g de maíz dulce congelado","150 g de yogur de coco sin lácteos"]','["Coloque los guisantes partidos, el apio y la ramita de tomillo en una cacerola mediana con 1 litro de agua hirviendo, vuelva a hervir y cocine a fuego lento, tapado, durante 25 minutos.","Mientras tanto, sofreír la cebolla en aceite en una sartén grande durante 10 minutos. Agregue el jengibre, la guindilla y el ajo. Vierta el pimiento y la patata y vierta ½ litro de agua hirviendo con el caldo y el tomillo restante. Vierta la mezcla de guisantes partidos y el maíz, lleve a ebullición, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 30-35 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas.","Saque un tercio de las verduras y luego triture el resto en la sartén con una batidora de mano. Regrese las verduras a la sartén con el yogur y revuelva bien. Si sigue nuestro Plan de dieta saludable, coma dos porciones ahora y enfríe el resto para otro día. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14534,4193,'es','Ensalada de queso feta, remolacha y granada','Disfrute de algo más ligero para el almuerzo con esta brillante ensalada. Es bajo en calorías y lleno de sabor gracias a la menta, el perejil, la canela y el comino.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 cucharada de melaza de granada","pizca de canela molida","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino, tostadas","chorrito de jugo de limón","un puñado de perejil, finamente picado","un puñado de hojas de menta, rasgadas","2 remolachas cocidas, cortadas en gajos finos","30 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","un puñado de hojas de rúcula","½ lechuga romana, cortada en trozos pequeños","20 g de semillas de granada"]','["Batir el aceite, la melaza de granada, la canela, las semillas de comino y el jugo de limón en un bol. Agregue 1 cucharada de agua para aflojar y sazone.","Agregue las hierbas, la remolacha, el queso feta, la rúcula y la lechuga, y revuelva para cubrir con el aderezo. Espolvorea sobre las semillas de granada para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14535,4195,'es','tinga de pollo al chipotle','Sirva este pollo con chile con nuestra salsa de tomate, chips de tortilla, guacamole y cilantro para una comida fácil entre semana.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, rebanadas","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","2-3 cucharadas de pasta de chile chipotle","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","6 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","3 tomates maduros, finamente picados","1 lima, rallada y en jugo","1 manojo pequeño de cilantro, hojas y tallos finamente picados, más hojas adicionales para servir","chips de tortilla y guacamole, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola o cacerola grande antiadherente y resistente al fuego. Freír las cebollas con una pizca de sal durante 10 minutos o hasta que estén tiernas. Agrega el ajo y sofríe 1 min más. Agrega la pasta de chipotle, los tomates y el azúcar con media lata de agua. Coloca los muslos de pollo en la salsa. Lleve a fuego lento y cocine, tapado, durante 20-25 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que el líquido se haya reducido ligeramente y el pollo esté bien cocido.","Con dos tenedores, desmenuce el pollo y revuélvalo con la salsa. Sazone al gusto. Si la salsa está demasiado líquida, vuelva al fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que la salsa se reduzca más. Para congelar, déjelo enfriar por completo y transfiéralo a bolsas grandes aptas para congelador.","Para hacer la salsa, combine la cebolla morada, los tomates, la ralladura y el jugo de lima, las hojas y los tallos de cilantro. Sazone al gusto. Sirva el pollo con la salsa de tomate, los totopos, el guacamole y un poco de hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:02:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14536,4197,'es','Sopa de tajín de garbanzos','Descubra los sabores rústicos del tajín en una sopa. Llena de garbanzos, pimientos y col rizada, además de albaricoques para darle dulzura, esta satisfactoria sopa es súper saludable.','["2 pimientos rojos","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharadas de pasta de rosa harissa","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","1½ l de caldo de verduras bajo en sal","150 g de col rizada picada","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","50 g de orejones, finamente picados","1⁄2 manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","yogur natural sin grasa, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta la parrilla a su temperatura más alta. Corte los pimientos por la mitad y quíteles las semillas, luego colóquelos con el lado cortado hacia abajo en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel de aluminio. Ase durante 10 a 15 minutos, o hasta que se formen ampollas y se ablanden. Déjelo hasta que se enfríe lo suficiente como para manipularlo, luego retire y deseche la piel. Corta los pimientos asados ​​en tiras finas.","Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego lento. Freír la cebolla durante 8-10 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agregue el ajo, el cilantro, el comino y la pasta de harissa y cocine por 1 minuto más. Añade los garbanzos y el caldo, lleva a ebullición y cocina a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, tapado.","Revuelva los pimientos en la sopa con la col rizada, la ralladura y el jugo de limón y los albaricoques y cocine, tapado, durante otros 5 minutos. Sirva la sopa en tazones y sírvala con el perejil picado esparcido y una cucharada de yogur, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14537,4199,'es','Okonomiyaki vegetariano','Potencia tu dieta con este okonomiyaki vegetariano con huevos, repollo, pak choi y cebolletas. Es una opción de almuerzo saludable y baja en calorías.','["3 huevos grandes","50 g de harina común","50ml de leche","4 cebolletas, cortadas y en rodajas","1 pak choi, en rodajas","200 g de col rizada, rallada","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado, más extra para servir","½ cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal","½ cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cucharada colmada de mayonesa baja en grasa","½ lima, en jugo","jengibre para sushi, para servir (opcional)","wasabi, para servir (opcional)"]','["Batir los huevos, la harina y la leche hasta que quede suave. Añade la mitad de las cebolletas, el pak choi, el repollo, la guindilla y la salsa de soja. Calienta el aceite en una sartén pequeña y vierte la masa. Cocine tapado a fuego medio durante 7-8 minutos. Voltee el okonomiyaki en una segunda sartén, luego regréselo al fuego y cocínelo durante 7-8 minutos más hasta que al insertar una brocheta, éste salga limpio.","Mezcle la mayonesa y el jugo de lima en un tazón pequeño. Transfiera el okonomiyaki a un plato, luego rocíe con mayonesa de lima y cubra con el chile extra, la cebolleta y el jengibre para sushi, si lo usa. Sirva con el wasabi a un lado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14538,4201,'es','Latkes de remolacha','Haga de la remolacha el ingrediente estrella con estos saludables latkes que le proporcionan tres de sus cinco al día. La raíz morada está repleta de vitamina C y folato.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","4 cucharadas de yogur griego sin grasa","½ manojo pequeño de hojas de menta, finamente picadas","150 g de hojas de ensalada mixta de rúcula","130 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","400 g de remolacha cruda, pelada, cortada y rallada gruesa","1 huevo grande, batido","1 cucharada de harina común","1 diente de ajo grande, rallado","1 cucharadita de semillas de alcaravea","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 limón, rallado"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Haz los lakes combinando todos los ingredientes.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande. Vierta la mezcla para hacer seis lakes redondos. Freír durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado, luego transferir a una bandeja para hornear y hornear durante 10 minutos.","Combine el yogur y la menta en un tazón pequeño. Mezcle las hojas de ensalada y los tomates, luego sirva los latkes con el yogur de menta y la ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:02:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14539,4203,'es','Rollitos de salchicha de harissa y cordero','Dale sabor a tus rollos de salchicha con los sabores de harissa, hierbas y especias. Son la comida de picnic perfecta para el verano y un éxito cuando estás alimentando a una multitud.','["600 g de carne picada de cordero","2 cucharadas de harissa comprada en la tienda, o úsela casera (consulte nuestra receta)","¼ cucharadita de jengibre molido","1⁄2 cucharadita de canela molida","1⁄2 cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado","1 diente de ajo rallado","1 limón en conserva, cáscara finamente picada (deseche la pulpa)","harina común, para espolvorear","325 g de hojaldre ya enrollado","1 huevo grande, ligeramente batido","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo negro (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle el cordero, la harissa (consulte nuestra receta), las especias, el cilantro, el ajo, el limón en conserva y los condimentos en un bol. Golpéalo con las manos para asegurarte de que esté bien combinado.","Espolvorea ligeramente la superficie de trabajo con harina y coloca el hojaldre encima. Córtelo por la mitad a lo largo, luego enrolle cada pieza con un rodillo para que cada pieza mida aproximadamente 14 x 42 cm.","Divida la mezcla de cordero en cuatro y enrolle cada uno en forma de salchicha con las manos. Coloca dos de ellos, uno al lado del otro, sobre una de las piezas de masa. Cepille un poco de huevo a lo largo de uno de los lados largos de la masa, justo por el borde. Levante el otro lado para encerrar las formas de salchicha y presione los lados para juntarlos. Haz lo mismo con el resto de la carne y la masa.","Corta cada paquete de masa en cuatro. Transfiérelos a una bandeja para hornear, luego unte cada rollo de salchicha con el huevo y espolvoree sobre las semillas de sésamo, si las usa. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos, o hasta que la masa esté inflada y dorada."]','2026-01-11 13:02:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14540,4205,'es','Tomate, pimiento y judías en una olla','Prepare una tanda de este guiso el fin de semana y luego enfríelo o congélelo en porciones para almuerzos fáciles entre semana. Vea nuestros diferentes ingredientes para mantenerlo interesante.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","3 zanahorias, finamente picadas","3 pimientos rojos, rebanados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, enjuagadas y escurridas","400 g de frijoles pintos, enjuagados y escurridos","400 g de frijoles borlotti, enjuagados y escurridos","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 cubito de caldo de verduras (revisa la etiqueta si eres vegano)","2 hojas de laurel","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno","½ cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén o cazuela grande a fuego medio. Freír la cebolla, el apio y las zanahorias durante 10 minutos hasta que estén suaves y dorados, luego agregar los pimientos y sofreír durante otros 5 minutos.","Incorporamos el ajo un minuto, luego añadimos el puré de tomate, todas las judías y los tomates picados, después removemos las latas de tomate con un chorrito de agua y añadimos a la sartén con la pastilla de caldo, las hojas de laurel, el azúcar y el vinagre. Sazone y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 25 minutos hasta que la salsa se reduzca para cubrir los frijoles y los pimientos estén suaves. Dejar enfriar antes de guardar en contenedores transportables. Se mantendrá en el refrigerador durante 3 a 4 días o se congelará en porciones y se descongelará en el refrigerador durante la noche. Elija sus ingredientes Dulce y picante Agregue orejones cortados en cubitos y 1 cucharada de harissa. Cubra con yogur mezclado con más harissa y almendras tostadas en hojuelas. Tex-Mex Agregue ½ - 1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle, las sobras de pollo asado desmenuzado si tiene y cubra con aguacate cortado en cubitos, queso cheddar rallado y cilantro. Frijoles BBQ ahumados Agregue 1 cucharada de salsa BBQ ahumada y desmenúcelo sobre tocino crujiente comprado en la tienda, una cucharada de crema agria o yogur y algunas hierbas picadas.Verduras agregadas Agregue un poco de espinacas y cubra con un huevo cocido en rodajas. Frijoles sobre pan tostado Sirva los frijoles sobre pan tostado o pan, agregue una pizca de Tabasco o hojuelas de chile, desmenuce sobre queso feta y rocíe con aceite de oliva. De inspiración italiana Cubra con picatostes tostados, romero picado, ralladura de limón y parmesano."]','2026-01-11 13:02:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14541,4207,'es','Ensalada de miso, brócoli, huevo y quinoa','Prepare un almuerzo que le dará fuerzas para toda la tarde con esta saludable ensalada de miso y aderezo de lima con brócoli, guisantes, huevo cocido y rábanos. Es sabroso y lleno de bondad.','["100 g de brócoli de tallo fino","1 huevo mediano","2 cucharaditas de pasta de miso blanca","1 lima, exprimida","125 g de quinua cocida","70 g de guisantes congelados y descongelados","3 rábanos, en rodajas finas","½ cucharada de semillas de sésamo"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola con agua. Agregue el brócoli y cocine por 3 minutos, luego sáquelo con una espumadera y déjelo enfriar. Sumerja el huevo en el agua y cocine a fuego lento durante 6 minutos. Escurrir y colocar en un recipiente con agua fría para que se enfríe.","Batir el miso y el jugo de lima en un tazón pequeño, luego mezclar con la quinua, los guisantes, los rábanos y el brócoli cocido. Coloca la ensalada en tu lonchera o en un recipiente hermético. Pele el huevo, córtelo por la mitad y colóquelo encima de la quinua, luego espolvoree con las semillas de sésamo."]','2026-01-11 13:02:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14542,4209,'es','Olla de mango y garbanzos al curry','Prepare esta ensalada especiada de mango, col lombarda, espinacas y garbanzos como un almuerzo rápido para llevar para uno. No sólo es sabroso, sino también saludable, ya que te ofrece tres de tus 5 al día.','["200 g de garbanzos escurridos y enjuagados","2 cucharadas de yogur griego sin grasa","½ limón, exprimido","1 cucharada colmada de pasta de curry korma","½ zanahoria, en juliana o rallada","70 g de col lombarda, rallada","50 g de espinacas tiernas, ralladas","40 g de mango, finamente picado","½ cucharadita de semillas de nigella","½ chile rojo pequeño, cortado finamente (sin semillas si quieres menos picante)"]','["Combine los garbanzos, el yogur, el limón y la pasta de korma en un bol, luego mezcle con la zanahoria, el repollo, las espinacas y el mango. Vierta en su lonchera o en un recipiente hermético y esparza con las semillas de nigella y el chile rojo."]','2026-01-11 13:02:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14543,4213,'es','Tilapia piri-piri al horno con patatas trituradas','Un plato de pescado saludable, bajo en grasas y calorías, lleno de sabor y rico en fibra, ácido fólico, hierro y vitamina C.','["600 g de patatas nuevas pequeñas","2 pimientos rojos, cortados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","chorrito de aceite de oliva virgen extra","4 trozos grandes de tilapia o bacalao","ensalada verde, para servir","6 pimientos picantes encurtidos (yo usé Peppadew)","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 dientes de ajo","jugo y ralladura de 1 limón","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Hervir las patatas hasta que estén tiernas y luego escurrirlas. Extiéndalo en una bandeja para hornear grande y triture suavemente con el dorso de una espátula. Agrega los pimientos, rocía con vinagre y aceite, sazona bien y asa durante 25 minutos.","Pon los ingredientes del piri-piri en un procesador de alimentos con un poco de sal. Haga puré hasta que esté fino y luego vierta en un bol. Coloque el pescado en una bandeja para horno y vierta un poco de salsa piri-piri. Sazone y hornee durante los últimos 10 minutos del tiempo de cocción de las papas. Sirve todo con la salsa extra y una ensalada verde como acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 13:02:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14544,4215,'es','Maki rollitos de caballa ahumada','Haz tu propio sushi para un almuerzo bajo en calorías que puedes llevar al trabajo. Sé la envidia de la oficina con estos rollitos de caballa y verduras, ¡no olvides la salsa de soja!','["150 gramos de arroz para sushi","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino de arroz","4 hojas de nori","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en palitos","½ zanahoria, pelada y cortada en palitos","¼ de pepino, cortado en palitos","100 g de caballa ahumada, sin piel y cortada en trozos pequeños","salsa de soja, para mojar"]','["Pon el arroz en un bol pequeño, cúbrelo con agua fría y masajea los granos con las manos para quitar el almidón. Escurrir y repetir el proceso hasta que el agua salga clara.","Coloque el arroz en una cacerola pequeña con tapa hermética. Cubrir con 2,5 cm de agua fría, tapar y cocinar a fuego medio durante 10 minutos. Retirar del fuego y dejar tapado otros 15 minutos. Revuelva con el vinagre y luego déjelo enfriar por completo.","Llene un recipiente pequeño con agua fría y extienda una estera de sushi (alrededor de £1 en cualquier supermercado grande). Coloque una hoja de nori, con el lado brillante hacia abajo, encima de la estera de sushi. Extienda una cuarta parte del arroz sobre el nori, dejando un borde de 1 cm en la parte superior.","Ponga una cuarta parte de la guindilla y la zanahoria en línea en el fondo del arroz. Colocar una cuarta parte del pepino y la caballa en una tira a lo largo del centro.","Humedece el borde superior con un poco de agua para ayudar a sellar el rollo. Dobla el borde inferior de las algas sobre la primera línea del relleno, luego usa la estera de sushi para enrollar el maki. Repita para hacer cuatro rollos. Con un cuchillo de sierra, corte cada rollo en ocho rondas. Sirva con salsa de soja para mojar. ¿Quieres un poco de ayuda con esta receta? Mira nuestro vídeo sobre cómo hacer sushi."]','2026-01-11 13:02:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14545,4217,'es','Frittata de espárragos y patatas nuevas','Un plato principal primaveral sencillo y bajo en calorías que utiliza los mejores ingredientes de la temporada y está listo en solo 20 minutos.','["200 g de patatas nuevas, en cuartos","100 g de puntas de espárragos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","6 huevos batidos","40 g de queso cheddar rallado","rúcula u hojas mixtas, para servir"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Poner las patatas en una cacerola con agua fría con sal y llevar a ebullición. Una vez que hierva, cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que estén casi tiernos, luego agregue los espárragos durante 1 minuto final. Drenar.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén apta para horno y añadir la cebolla. Cocine durante unos 8 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Mezclar en una jarra los huevos con la mitad del queso y sazonar bien. Vierta sobre la cebolla en la sartén, luego esparza sobre los espárragos y las patatas. Cubra con el queso restante y colóquelo en la parrilla durante 5 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y bien cocido. Cortar en gajos y servir de la sartén con ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:02:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14546,4219,'es','berenjenas miso','Una receta de berenjena muy fácil, baja en grasas y calorías, con un delicioso sabor a umami. ¡Este plato es tan rico y carnoso que es difícil creer que sea vegano!','["2 berenjenas pequeñas, partidas por la mitad","aceite vegetal, para asar y freír","50 g de miso marrón","100 g de cuscús gigante","1 chile rojo, en rodajas finas","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, hojas picadas"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Con un cuchillo afilado, cruce la pulpa de las berenjenas en forma diagonal y luego colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear. Unte la pulpa con 1 cucharada de aceite vegetal.","Mezcla el miso con 25 ml de agua para hacer una pasta espesa. Extienda la pasta sobre las berenjenas, luego cubra la bandeja con papel de aluminio y ase en el centro del horno durante 30 minutos.","Retire el papel de aluminio y ase las berenjenas durante 15-20 minutos más, dependiendo de su tamaño, hasta que estén tiernas.","Mientras tanto, hierva una cacerola con agua con sal y caliente 1/2 cucharada de aceite vegetal a fuego medio-alto en una sartén. Agregue el cuscús a la sartén, tueste durante 2 minutos hasta que esté dorado, luego viértalo en la olla con agua hirviendo y cocine durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté tierno (o siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete). Escurrir bien. Sirve las berenjenas con el cuscús, coronadas con la guindilla y un poco de hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:02:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14547,4221,'es','Tacos de pollo chipotle con salsa de piña','Un pollo picante y ahumado relleno de tortillas suaves, esta cena deliciosa y baja en calorías está en la mesa en solo 20 minutos.','["500 g de muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla mediana, picada","2 cucharaditas de pimentón dulce ahumado","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","200ml en puré","2 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","½ piña pequeña, sin corazón, pelada y picada","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, picado","tortillas de maíz o harina","salsa picante (me gusta Tabasco Chipotle), para servir"]','["En un procesador de alimentos, mezcle los muslos de pollo hasta obtener carne picada en trozos. Alternativamente, córtelo en trozos pequeños.","Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande. Agrega la mitad de la cebolla y el pollo picadito. Sazone bien y cocine durante unos 5 minutos a fuego alto para que se dore, rompiendo la carne con una cuchara. Agrega las especias, el vinagre, la pasta de chipotle, la passata y el azúcar. Cocine por otros 5 minutos, luego retire del fuego.","En un tazón pequeño, mezcle el resto de la cebolla, la piña y el cilantro. Sirve el pollo y la salsa de piña con tortillas calientes y salsa picante."]','2026-01-11 13:02:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14548,4223,'es','Guiso de pescado sencillo','Esta receta rápida y saludable contiene filetes de pescado blanco, langostinos, una rica salsa de tomate y suficientes verduras para 3 de tus 5 al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","2 zanahorias, cortadas en cubitos","2 ramas de apio, cortadas en cubitos","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 puerros, en rodajas finas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","500 ml de caldo de pescado caliente","2 filetes de abadejo sin piel (unos 200 g), descongelados si están congelados y cortados en trozos","85 g de langostinos crudos sin cáscara"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, agrega las semillas de hinojo, las zanahorias, el apio y el ajo y cocina durante 5 minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Agregue los puerros, los tomates y el caldo, sazone y deje hervir, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas y la salsa se espese y se reduzca ligeramente.","Añade el pescado, espárcelo sobre las gambas y cocina 2 minutos más hasta que esté ligeramente cocido. Sirva en tazones y sirva con una cuchara."]','2026-01-11 13:02:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14549,4227,'es','Ensalada templada de chorizo ​​y garbanzos','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Llena de sabores atrevidos como chorizo, tomates secos y cebolla morada, esta ensalada está completa con garbanzos para dar 3 de tus 5 al día.','["Paquete de 280 g de chorizo ​​para cocinar, en rodajas","1 cebolla morada grande, finamente cortada","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en tiras","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","12 tomates semisecos","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","Bolsa de 100 g de rúcula, para servir"]','["En una sartén grande, fríe el chorizo ​​hasta que esté dorado durante unos 10 minutos, luego usa una espumadera para sacarlo de la sartén y reservar.","Agrega la cebolla y los pimientos a la sartén y ablanda en la grasa del chorizo ​​durante 10 minutos. Agregue los garbanzos y los tomates, calentando bien.","Vierta el vinagre de vino tinto y sazone. Sirva en tazones con un puñado de rúcula encima."]','2026-01-11 13:02:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14550,4229,'es','Ensalada asiática de pollo desmenuzado','Separe un pollo ya asado para preparar este plato saludable, vibrante y bajo en calorías en solo 20 minutos.','["1 pollo asado pequeño, de 1 kg aproximadamente","½ col lombarda, sin corazón y cortada en rodajas finas","3 zanahorias, ralladas gruesas o finamente ralladas","5 cebolletas, cortadas finamente en diagonal","2 chiles rojos, cortados por la mitad y en rodajas finas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes, incluidos los tallos","2 cucharadas colmadas de maní tostado y salado, triturado grueso","3½ cucharadas de salsa hoisin","1½ cucharada de aceite de sésamo tostado"]','["Combine los ingredientes del aderezo en un tazón pequeño y reserve.","Retire toda la carne del pollo, desmenúcela en trozos grandes y colóquela en un tazón grande. Agrega el repollo, las zanahorias, las cebolletas, los chiles y la mitad del cilantro. Mezcle con el aderezo y apile en un plato para servir, luego esparza sobre el cilantro y el maní restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:02:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14551,4231,'es','Cacciatore de pollo más ligero','El clásico "estofado de cazador" italiano recibe un cambio saludable con pechugas de pollo bajas en grasa, prosciutto y una rica salsa de tomate con hierbas.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","3 rebanadas de prosciutto, sin grasa, picadas","1 cebolla mediana, picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 ramitas de salvia","2 ramitas de romero","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel (550 g de peso total), preferiblemente orgánicas","150 ml de vino blanco seco","Lata de 400g de tomates pera en zumo natural","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","225 g de champiñones castaños, cortados en cuartos o por la mitad si son grandes","un puñado pequeño de perejil de hoja plana picado, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande. Vierta el prosciutto y fríalo durante unos 2 minutos hasta que esté crujiente. Retirar con una espumadera, dejar que la grasa se escurra nuevamente en la sartén y reservar. Pon la cebolla, el ajo y las hierbas en la sartén y sofríe durante 3-4 minutos.","Extienda la cebolla en la sartén y luego coloque las pechugas de pollo encima. Sazona con pimienta y sofríe durante 5 minutos a fuego medio, volteando el pollo una vez, hasta que empiece a dorarse por ambos lados y la cebolla se caramelice en el fondo de la sartén. Retire el pollo y reserve en un plato. Sube el fuego, revuelve rápidamente y, cuando chisporrotee, vierte el vino y deja que burbujee durante 2 minutos para que se reduzca un poco.","Baje el fuego a medio, regrese el prosciutto a la sartén, luego agregue los tomates (rompiéndolos con la cuchara), el puré de tomate y los champiñones. Vierta 4 cucharadas de agua en la lata de tomate vacía, gírela y luego viértala en la sartén. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 a 20 minutos o hasta que la salsa se espese y se reduzca ligeramente, luego regrese el pollo a la sartén y cocine, sin tapar, durante unos 15 minutos o hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Sazone y esparza sobre el perejil para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14552,4233,'es','Calabacín a la boloñesa','Los calabacines en espiral son una alternativa más saludable a la pasta en los clásicos espaguetis a la boloñesa: use carne picada de pavo para obtener una salsa baja en calorías.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","500 g de carne picada de pavo (muslo o pechuga)","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 zanahorias grandes, peladas y cortadas en cubitos","Paquete de 150 g de champiñones, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","2 cubitos de caldo de pollo","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","4 calabacines grandes","queso pecorino o parmesano rallado, para servir","un puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una cacerola grande y agrega la carne picada de pavo. Freír hasta que se dore, luego colocar en un bol y reservar.","Agrega la cebolla a la sartén y cocina a fuego lento durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté tierna. Luego agregue el ajo, revolviendo durante aproximadamente 1 minuto, seguido de la zanahoria y los champiñones, revolviendo durante aproximadamente 3 minutos, hasta que se ablanden. Vuelva a colocar la carne picada de pavo en la sartén, agregue el puré de tomate, revuelva todo rápidamente y agregue los tomates picados. Llene 1 lata con agua y viértala en la sartén. Desmenuzar sobre los cubitos de caldo de pollo y llevar a ebullición. Una vez que hierva, baje el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante aproximadamente 1 hora, hasta que la salsa espese y las verduras estén tiernas.","Cuando la boloñesa esté casi lista, agregue la salsa de soja y un poco de condimento. Haga espirales con los calabacines sobre el accesorio para fideos grandes. Calienta una sartén grande con la cucharada restante de aceite de oliva y agrega el calabacín. Cocine hasta que esté ligeramente suave, durante 2-3 minutos. Sazone con sal y sirva cubierto con el pavo a la boloñesa, queso pecorino rallado y hojas de albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:02:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14553,4235,'es','Fideos espiralizados de Singapur','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Los fideos vegetales no solo elevan este plato a 4 de 5 al día, sino que también reducen las calorías y aumentan la nutrición de esta cena picante.','["1 mooli grande (rábano daikon), 2 calabacines o 3 zanahorias","2 cucharaditas de aceite de coco o aceite vegetal","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, picado","1 chile rojo graso, ½ finamente picado, ½ cortado en aros finos","2 dientes de ajo gordos, machacados","6 cebolletas, finamente cortadas","1½ cucharada de curry en polvo","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de salsa teriyaki","Paquete de 150 g de gambas crudas, picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de jamón cocido, rallado","2 puñados grandes de brotes de soja","cilantro, para servir","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Utilice un cortador en espiral o un pelador en juliana para crear fideos de verduras; utilice el accesorio para fideos grande. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite en un wok a fuego alto. Cuando esté caliente agregue el jengibre, el chile picado, el ajo y las cebolletas, saltee durante 30 segundos a 1 minuto hasta que se ablanden. Añade el curry en polvo, la salsa de soja, el teriyaki, las gambas y el jamón y cocina durante 2 minutos más, hasta que las gambas se pongan rosadas.","Agregue los fideos de verduras y los brotes de soja, revuelva en la sartén durante 1 minuto más hasta que los fideos se ablanden un poco pero aún tengan un buen mordisco; no los cocine por mucho tiempo o se volverán aguados. Sirva espolvoreado con cilantro y chile en rodajas, con rodajas de lima a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:02:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14554,4237,'es','Risotto de gambas, hinojo y rúcula','Este risotto de gambas e hinojo recibe un toque extra gracias a la ralladura de limón y la rúcula, perfecto para una cena.','["1,2 l de caldo de verduras","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo grande, finamente picado","1 bulbo de hinojo pequeño, sin corazón y finamente picado","300 g de arroz para risotto","300 g de langostinos crudos pelados","1 limón, ½ rallado y 1 cucharada de jugo","rúcula bolsa 70g"]','["Coloque el caldo en una cacerola grande, déjelo hervir y luego baje a fuego lento. Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande. Añade la cebolla, el ajo y el hinojo y cocina a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que las verduras se ablanden pero no cojan color. Agregue el arroz y revuelva durante 2 minutos hasta que los granos estén calientes y emitan crujidos. Aumente el fuego a medio y comience a agregar el caldo, un cucharón a la vez, revolviendo constantemente y asegurándose de que el caldo se haya absorbido en el arroz antes de agregar el siguiente cucharón.","Cuando el arroz esté casi cocido añadimos las gambas, la ralladura de limón y un poco de condimento. Continúe agregando caldo y cocinando durante otros 3-4 minutos hasta que los langostinos estén rosados ​​y el arroz esté cocido. Retirar del fuego y mezclar con la rúcula y el jugo de limón. Verifique la sazón, deje reposar el risotto en la sartén durante 2 minutos y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:02:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14555,4239,'es','Pizzas de huevo y rúcula','Utilice tortillas sin semillas como base de pizza para un almuerzo rápido y saludable: rompa un huevo en el centro y hornee para aumentar la ingesta de proteínas.','["2 wraps sin semillas","un poco de aceite de oliva, para cepillar","1 pimiento rojo asado, de un frasco","2 tomates","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de eneldo picado","2 cucharadas de perejil picado","2 huevos","Paquete de rúcula de 65 g.","½ cebolla morada, cortada en rodajas muy finas"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque las tortillas en dos bandejas para hornear, unte con moderación con aceite y luego hornee durante 3 minutos. Mientras tanto, pique el pimiento y los tomates y mézclelos con el puré de tomate, los condimentos y las hierbas. Voltee las tortillas y unte con la mezcla de tomate, dejando el centro libre de trozos grandes de pimiento o tomate.","Rompe un huevo en el centro y luego regresa al horno por 10 minutos o hasta que el huevo esté listo y la tortilla esté crujiente en los bordes. Servir espolvoreado con la rúcula y la cebolla."]','2026-01-11 13:02:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14556,4241,'es','Sopa de lentejas rojas y zanahoria','Esta sopa vegetariana cálida y económica es perfecta envasada en una petaca para el almuerzo. También es fácil duplicar las cantidades y congelar la mitad para más tarde.','["1 cebolla blanca, finamente rebanada","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","3 dientes de ajo, rebanados","2 zanahorias, lavadas y cortadas en cubitos","85 g de lentejas rojas","1 cubito de caldo de verduras, desmenuzado","ramitas generosas de perejil picado (aproximadamente 2 cucharadas) más algunas hojas adicionales"]','["Pon a hervir la tetera mientras cortas finamente la cebolla. Calienta el aceite en una sartén mediana, agrega la cebolla y sofríe durante 2 minutos mientras cortas el ajo y las zanahorias en dados. Agréguelos a la sartén y cocine brevemente a fuego.","Vierta 1 litro de agua hirviendo del hervidor, agregue las lentejas y la pastilla de caldo, luego cubra la sartén y cocine a fuego medio durante 15 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas. Retire del fuego y agregue el perejil. Sirva en tazones y espolvoree con más hojas de perejil, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14557,4243,'es','paella de marisco','Esta impresionante olla española, con rape, langostinos y mejillones, es perfecta para alimentar a una multitud en una cena.','["20-24 langostinos crudos con cáscara","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","500 g de rape cortado en trozos","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","500 gramos de arroz para paella","4 dientes de ajo, rebanados","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de pimienta de cayena (opcional)","pizca de azafrán","½ lata de 400 g de tomates picados (guarde el resto para el caldo, a continuación)","500 g de mejillones limpios","100 g de guisantes congelados","100 g de habitas tiernas congeladas","un puñado de hojas de perejil, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada en trozos grandes","½ lata de 400 g de tomates picados","6 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","1 anís estrellado"]','["Pelar y desvenar las gambas, reservando las cabezas y la cáscara. devolver las gambas\r\na la nevera.","Para hacer el caldo, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto y agrega la cebolla, los tomates, el ajo y las cáscaras y cabezas de los langostinos reservados. Cocine durante 3-4 minutos, luego vierta 2 litros de agua y agregue la pastilla de caldo y el anís estrellado. Llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante 30 minutos. Deje enfriar un poco y luego mezcle en tandas en una licuadora o procesador de alimentos. Colar por un colador fino.","Calienta el aceite en una paellera grande o en una sartén extra grande. Dorar el rape durante unos minutos por cada lado, luego retirarlo y reservarlo. Agrega la cebolla y sofríe durante 4-5 minutos hasta que se ablande.","Agregue el arroz y cocine durante 30 segundos para que se tueste. Agregue el ajo, el pimentón, la cayena (si se usa) y el azafrán, cocine por otros 30 segundos, luego agregue los tomates y 1,5 litros de caldo de pescado. Deje hervir, luego baje a fuego lento y cocine, revolviendo, durante unos 10 minutos (el arroz aún debe estar al dente). Devolver el rape a la sartén con las gambas, los mejillones, los guisantes y las habas.","Cubra la sartén con una bandeja para hornear grande o papel de aluminio y cocine a fuego lento durante otros 10 a 15 minutos hasta que los mejillones estén abiertos y los langostinos bien cocidos. Esparcir por encima el perejil antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14558,4245,'es','Ensalada de pollo, brócoli y remolacha con pesto de aguacate','Esta cena de superalimento está repleta de ingredientes para estimular tu cuerpo, como cebolla morada, semillas de nigella, nueces, aceite de colza y limón.','["250 g de brócoli de tallo fino","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","3 pechugas de pollo sin piel","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas finas","Bolsa de 100g de berros","2 remolachas crudas (unos 175 g), peladas y cortadas en juliana o ralladas","1 cucharadita de semillas de nigella","paquete pequeño de albahaca","1 aguacate","½ dientes de ajo machacados","25 g de nueces en mitades, desmenuzadas","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","jugo y ralladura de 1 limón"]','["Ponga a hervir agua en una cacerola grande, agregue el brócoli y cocine por 2 minutos. Escurrir y luego refrescar con agua fría. Caliente una sartén, mezcle el brócoli con 1 o 2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza y cocine a la plancha durante 2-3 minutos, volteándolo, hasta que esté un poco carbonizado. Dejar enfriar. Unte el pollo con el aceite restante y sazone. Cocine a la plancha durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado o hasta que esté bien cocido. Deje enfriar y luego córtelo o tritúrelo en trozos grandes.","A continuación, haz el pesto. Recoge las hojas de albahaca y reserva un puñado para cubrir la ensalada. Pon el resto en el tazón pequeño de un procesador de alimentos. Saque la pulpa del aguacate y agréguela al procesador de alimentos con el ajo, las nueces, el aceite, 1 cucharada de jugo de limón, 2-3 cucharadas de agua fría y un poco de condimento. Mezcle hasta que quede suave y luego transfiéralo a un plato pequeño para servir. Vierta el jugo de limón restante sobre las cebollas cortadas en rodajas y déjelas por unos minutos.","Apila los berros en un plato grande. Mezcle el brócoli y la cebolla, junto con el jugo de limón en el que se remojaron. Cubra con la remolacha, pero sin mezclarla, y el pollo. Esparza sobre las hojas de albahaca reservadas, la ralladura de limón y las semillas de nigella, luego sirva con el pesto de aguacate."]','2026-01-11 13:02:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14559,4247,'es','Paillard de pollo con limón y hierbas','Machacar la carne hasta que quede fina y plana es una excelente técnica para la pechuga de pollo asada, ya que garantiza que no se seque. Prueba esta versión con limón y hierbas.','["6 pechugas de pollo sin piel","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1?2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","rúcula bolsa 140g","25 g de parmesano","rodajas de limon","2 dientes de ajo","3 ramitas de romero, hojas finamente picadas","6 hojas de salvia, finamente ralladas","ralladura de 1 limón y jugo de ½","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Coloque cada pechuga de pollo entre 2 hojas de film transparente o papel para hornear. Utilice un mazo para carne o un rodillo para\r\nGolpee cada trozo de pollo y aplánelo hasta obtener una capa uniforme de aproximadamente 0,5 cm de grosor. Transfiera a un plato.","Para hacer el adobo, machacar los ajos con una buena pizca de sal utilizando un mortero. Agrega el romero y la salvia y dale un buen golpe a todo. Agrega la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el aceite de oliva y un poco de pimienta negra molida. Vierta la marinada sobre el pollo, asegurándose de que quede bien cubierto. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos 2 horas.","Calienta la barbacoa. Una vez que las llamas se hayan apagado, extienda las brasas en una capa uniforme. Cocine el pollo durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado. Pasar a una tabla y dejar reposar unos minutos.","Mientras tanto, vierte el aceite y el vinagre balsámico en un bol grande. Agrega la rúcula y un poco de condimento. Mezcle y luego afeite sobre el parmesano. Sirva la ensalada con el pollo, con rodajas de limón para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14560,4249,'es','Pollo y arroz escalfados chinos','Un plato saludable de inspiración asiática ideal para una cena fácil. Usa las sobras para hacer nuestra ensalada fría de pollo con fideos para el día siguiente.','["trozo grande de jengibre, 1 cucharada finamente rallado y el resto cortado en rodajas","3 dientes de ajo","1 cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra","1 cucharada de salsa de soja, más 2-3 cucharaditas (opcional)","8 muslos de pollo","3 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo","2 manojos de cebolletas, picadas","4 pak choi, reducidos a la mitad","arroz de grano largo cocido, para servir"]','["Pon el jengibre en rodajas, el ajo, los granos de pimienta y la mitad de la soja en una sartén grande con las piernas de pollo. Agrega suficiente agua para cubrir y sazona con un poco de sal. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir a fuego lento, tapar y escalfar durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, calienta una sartén y añade el aceite de sésamo y las cebolletas. Ablanda durante 1 minuto, luego retira del fuego y agrega el jengibre rallado y el resto de la salsa de soja para hacer un condimento.","Cuando el pollo esté listo, retíralo de la sartén, reserva 4 patas y déjalo enfriar para mañana. Añade el pak choi al líquido para escalfar y cocina durante 3-4 minutos. Cuela el líquido de escalfar para quitar el jengibre, el ajo y los granos de pimienta, reservando el líquido. Retire la piel de las 4 patas de pollo restantes y deséchelas. Corta la carne en trozos gruesos. Sirva en tazones con arroz, el pak choi, un cucharón de caldo de pollo caliente, la salsa de cebolleta y salsa de soja extra, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14561,4251,'es','Risotto cremoso de tomate','Un plato de arroz económico aromatizado con romero, albahaca y tomates cherry dulces. Una cena ideal entre semana','["Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 litro de caldo de verduras","nuez de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 ramita de romero, finamente picada","250 g de arroz para risotto","300 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","albahaca en paquete pequeño, cortada en trozos grandes","4 cucharadas de parmesano rallado"]','["Coloca los tomates picados y la mitad del caldo en un procesador de alimentos y pulsa hasta que quede suave. Verter en una cacerola con el caldo restante, llevar a fuego lento y mantener a fuego lento.","Mientras tanto, coloca la mantequilla y el aceite en el fondo de una cacerola grande y calienta suavemente hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Agrega la cebolla y cocina suavemente durante 6-8 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agregue el ajo y el romero, luego cocine por 1 minuto más. Agrega el arroz y cocina, revolviendo, durante 1 min.","Comience a agregar la mezcla de caldo caliente y tomate aproximadamente un cuarto a la vez. Deje que el risotto se cocine, revolviendo con frecuencia y agregando más caldo a medida que se absorba. Después de haber añadido la mitad del caldo, añade los tomates cherry. Después de 20-25 minutos, el arroz debe estar cremoso y tierno, los tomates cherry blandos y todo el caldo debe haberse agotado.","Cubra y déjelo por 1 minuto, luego agregue la albahaca. Servir espolvoreado con parmesano y un buen molido de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:02:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14562,4253,'es','Lubina asada y bandeja de verduras al horno','Dale un toque sencillo al pescado en este horneado todo en uno de inspiración italiana con patatas crujientes, pimientos asados ​​y aceitunas.','["300 g de patatas de piel roja, cortadas en rodajas finas","1 pimiento rojo, cortado en tiras","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 ramita de romero, sin hojas y picada muy fina","2 filetes de lubina","25 g de aceitunas negras deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad","½ limón, cortado en rodajas finas","un puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Coloque las rodajas de papa y pimiento en una bandeja para hornear antiadherente grande. Rocíe 1 cucharada de aceite y espolvoree con el romero, una pizca de sal y una buena pizca de pimienta. Mezcle todo bien y ase durante 25 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad, hasta que las patatas estén doradas y crujientes en los bordes.","Colocar encima los filetes de pescado y esparcir sobre las aceitunas. Coloca un par de rodajas de limón encima del pescado y rocía con el aceite restante. Ase durante 7-8 minutos más hasta que el pescado esté bien cocido. Sirva espolvoreado con hojas de albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:02:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14563,4255,'es','Pimientos rellenos de chile con cobertura de queso feta','Una cena vegetariana satisfactoria que contiene 4 de tus 5 al día. Rellenar pimientos con queso crema, frijoles, berenjena y queso feta.','["2 pimientos grandes, cortados por la mitad, sin semillas pero sin tallos","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 berenjena pequeña, cortada en cubos pequeños","Lata de 220 g de alubias (no escurrirlas)","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","1 huevo grande","25 g de queso feta bajo en grasa, finamente rallado","50 g de queso fresco bajo en grasas","2 puñados de rúcula","gajos de lima, para exprimir"]','["Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Coloque las mitades de pimiento en una fuente para horno poco profunda, con la piel hacia arriba, y ase durante 15-20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, vierte las especias en una sartén y caliéntalas brevemente para que suelten su sabor. Vierta los tomates y agregue la cebolla, el ajo, la guindilla, la berenjena y las judías con su jugo. Tape la sartén y cocine por 20 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Trate de no agregar ningún líquido extra; la mezcla debe quedar bastante seca. Agrega el cilantro.","Mientras tanto, bata el huevo con el queso feta y el queso fresco. Dale la vuelta a los pimientos y apila la mezcla de berenjena en cada uno, apretándolo tanto como puedas. Cubra con la mezcla de queso feta y regrese al horno por 10 minutos más hasta que la cobertura se haya endurecido ligeramente. No te preocupes si algo se escurre, ya que simplemente se asentará en el plato. Sirva los pimientos sobre la rúcula con rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14564,4257,'es','Ensalada de pollo con sésamo','Una ensalada fresca y saludable al estilo asiático con albahaca tailandesa y cilantro, soja, zanahoria y tomate.','["2 pechugas de pollo sin piel","85 g de soja congelada","1 zanahoria grande, finamente cortada en palitos finos","4 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","140 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca tailandesa o común, picadas si son grandes","85 g de hojas de ensalada de hierbas o tiernas","1 cucharadita de semillas de sésamo tostadas","ralladura y jugo 1 lima pequeña","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de salsa de chile dulce"]','["Pon el pollo en una sartén y vierte sobre agua fría hasta cubrirlo. Coloca las semillas de soja en una vaporera. Lleve la sartén a fuego lento, luego cocine el pollo durante 8 minutos con los frijoles encima.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los ingredientes del aderezo en un tazón grande. Cuando el pollo esté cocido, córtelo en rodajas y agregue el aderezo junto con los frijoles, la zanahoria, la cebolla, los tomates, el cilantro y la albahaca. Mezclar muy bien, apilar sobre las hojas de ensalada y espolvorear con las semillas de sésamo."]','2026-01-11 13:02:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14565,4259,'es','Lentejas de Puy con tofu ahumado','Benefíciese de la energía de liberación lenta de las lentejas y los cereales integrales combinada con el rico sabor del tofu ahumado, el pimentón y los pimientos dulces.','["Aceite en aerosol de 1 cal.","1 calabacín grande, finamente picado","100 g de tofu ahumado finamente picado","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1½ cucharada de vinagre balsámico","Bolsita de 250 g de lentejas puy cocidas","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 pimiento rojo asado mediano de un frasco (no en aceite), unos 85 g, en rodajas","un buen puñado de brotes de guisantes o de rúcula"]','["Rocía una sartén antiadherente con 3 chorros de aceite y añade los calabacines, el tofu y el pimentón ahumado. Cocine durante unos minutos para ablandar los calabacines. Agregue el vinagre balsámico y deje chisporrotear y reducir.","Mientras tanto, vierta las lentejas, la cebolla y el pimiento en un bol y revuelva suavemente para romper los grumos de lentejas. Agrega el tofu y los calabacines y revuelve nuevamente. Se conservará durante 2 días en el frigorífico. Esparcir sobre los brotes de guisantes justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14566,4261,'es','Mulligatawny de nuez moscada con trozos','Esta sopa picante con arroz basmati y manzanas es espesa, cálida y saludable, además de ser baja en grasas y calorías.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva o de colza","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","2 manzanas de postre, peladas y finamente picadas","3 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","½ calabaza pequeña, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos pequeños","2-3 cucharadas colmadas de curry en polvo sin gluten (dependiendo de lo picante que te guste)","1 cucharada de canela molida","1 cucharada de semillas de nigella (también llamadas cebolla negra o semillas de kalonji)","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1½ l de caldo de pollo o de verduras sin gluten","140 g de arroz basmati","paquete pequeño de perejil, picado","3 cucharadas de chutney de mango, más un poco para servir, si lo deseas (opcional)","yogur natural, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en tu cacerola más grande. Agrega las cebollas, las manzanas y el apio con una pizca de sal. Cocine durante 10 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que se ablanden. Agregue la calabaza, el curry en polvo, la canela, las semillas de nigella y un poco de pimienta negra. Cocine por 2 minutos más, luego agregue los tomates y el caldo. Cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos.","A estas alturas las verduras deberían estar tiernas pero no blandas. Agregue el arroz, vuelva a tapar y cocine a fuego lento durante otros 12 minutos hasta que el arroz esté bien cocido. Pruebe y agregue más condimento si es necesario. Agregue el perejil y el chutney de mango, luego sirva en tazones con yogur y chutney de mango adicional encima, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14567,4263,'es','Fideos Singapur especiados con coliflor, pollo y gambas','Un salteado magro de fideos de arroz al estilo asiático condimentado con soja, chile y cilantro y repleto de delicias vegetales.','["jugo ½ limón","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo mediano","300 g de floretes de coliflor","100 g de pechugas de pollo sin piel y cortadas en cubitos","100 g de cebolletas, claras y verdes cortadas por separado","200 g de coles blancas cortadas en trozos","25 g de chiles rojos frescos, finamente picados","100 g de fideos de arroz finos directos al wok (nosotros usamos Amoy)","50 g de gambas crudas peladas y picadas","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","5 g de hojas de cilantro"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nForrar una bandeja para hornear con\r\npergamino. Mezclar el jugo de limón con\r\n½ cucharada de curry en polvo y revuelva\r\ncon la coliflor al horno\r\nbandeja. Ase durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén tiernos.\r\ny ligeramente dorado.","Calentar un wok o una sartén antiadherente.\r\ny añadir el pollo, las claras de cebolleta,\r\nrepollo, chile rojo, curry restante\r\npolvo y un chorrito de agua. freír,\r\nañadiendo chorritos de agua si empieza\r\npegajoso o con aspecto seco, hasta que el pollo\r\nesté bien cocido y el repollo\r\nablandamiento. Añade los fideos, las gambas,\r\nsalsa de soja y azúcar, y sofreír por otro\r\nunos minutos hasta que estén bien calientes y las gambas\r\nestán cocidos. Esparcirse sobre la primavera\r\nhojas de cebolla, coliflor asada y\r\nhojas de cilantro y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14568,4265,'es','Hamburguesas de salmón súper saludables','Si buscas algo un poco más ligero que los pasteles de pescado rellenos de patatas, prueba estas sencillas hamburguesas de estilo oriental.','["4 filetes de salmón deshuesados ​​y sin piel, aproximadamente 550 g/1 lb 4 oz en total, cortados en trozos","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","Un trozo del tamaño de un pulgar de raíz de jengibre fresco, rallado.","1 tsp soy sauce","1 manojo de cilantro, la mitad picado y la mitad de las hojas recogidas","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","rodajas de limón, para servir","2 zanahorias","medio pepino grande o 1 pequeño","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada"]','["Coloca el salmón en un procesador de alimentos con\r\nla pasta, el jengibre, la soja y el cilantro picado.\r\nPulse hasta que esté picado. Inclina la mezcla\r\ny forme 4 hamburguesas. Calentar el aceite en un\r\nsartén antiadherente, luego freír las hamburguesas durante\r\n4-5 minutos por cada lado, volteando hasta que estén crujientes\r\ny bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, use un pelador giratorio para pelar\r\ntiras de zanahoria y pepino en un bol.\r\nMezcle con el vinagre y el azúcar hasta que\r\nel azúcar se haya disuelto, luego revuelva por el\r\nhojas de cilantro. Divida la ensalada entre\r\n4 platos. Servir con las hamburguesas y el arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:02:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14569,4267,'es','Tabulé de quinua','Disfruta de esta ensalada llena de nutrientes, con jugosos tomates y pepino, como un delicioso y saludable almuerzo.','["200 g de quinua","jugo 1-2 limones","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","manojo pequeño de menta, picada","manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado","manojo de cebolletas, en rodajas","½ pepino, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","un puñado de nueces picadas"]','["Enjuague bien la quinua y colóquela en un\r\nsartén con aproximadamente el doble del volumen de\r\nagua. Llevar a ebullición, tapar, reducir.\r\nel fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos\r\no hasta que el grano se desenvuelva. girar\r\nRetirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.\r\nluego drene el agua restante.","Sazone la quinua, agregue el limón.\r\nJugo y aceite y dejar enfriar por completo. Revuelva\r\nen los demás ingredientes y luego servir."]','2026-01-11 13:02:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14570,4269,'es','Ensalada de pollo picante con brócoli','Esta receta de ensalada de pollo queda perfecta con una patata asada esponjosa o unos fideos al huevo y también baja en grasas','["2 cabezas de brócoli, cortadas en floretes","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","5 chalotes, finamente picados","un puñado de aceitunas negras sin hueso","4 pechugas de pollo asadas, en rodajas","4 cucharadas de salsa de soja","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y rebanados","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados"]','["Cocine el brócoli al vapor durante 4 minutos hasta que\r\ntierno, viértalo en un tazón grande y luego sazone.\r\nMientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén, luego sofreír los\r\nchalotes durante 2 minutos. Agrega los chiles y el ajo,\r\nluego cocine por 4 minutos más hasta que se ablanden.","Retire las chalotas, la guindilla y el ajo con\r\nuna espumadera, luego mezclar con el brócoli,\r\naceitunas y pollo. Añade la salsa de soja a la\r\nsartén, calentar a fuego medio, luego verter\r\nsobre la ensalada. Coma caliente o frío."]','2026-01-11 13:02:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14571,4271,'es','Ensalada de salmón súper saludable','Supersaludable por nombre, supersaludable por naturaleza: esta ensalada tiene un alto contenido de omega-3, hierro y calcio y cuenta como 2 de tus 5 al día.','["100 g de cuscús","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 filetes de salmón","200 g de brócoli germinado, desmenuzado y sin los tallos más grandes","jugo 1 limon","semillas de media granada","un puñado pequeño de semillas de calabaza","2 puñados de berros","aceite de oliva y gajos de limón extra, para servir"]','["Calentar agua en una vaporera grada. Sazone el \r\ncuscús, luego mezcle con 1 cucharadita de aceite. Vierta hirviendo \r\nagua sobre el cuscús para que lo cubra \r\n1 cm, luego reservar. Cuando el agua en el \r\nLa vaporera hierve, vierte el brócoli. \r\nen el agua, luego coloque el salmón en el nivel \r\narriba. Cocine por 3 minutos hasta que el salmón esté \r\ncocido y el brócoli tierno. Escurrir el \r\nbrócoli y páselo por agua fría para que se enfríe.","Mezclar el aceite restante y el limón. \r\njugo. Mezcle el brócoli, las semillas de granada. \r\ny semillas de calabaza a través del cuscús \r\ncon el aderezo de limón. En el último momento, \r\npique los berros en trozos grandes y revuélvalos \r\nel cuscús. Servir con el salmón, el limón. \r\ngajos para exprimir y aceite de oliva extra \r\npara rociar, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:02:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14572,4273,'es','Fish & chips saludables con salsa tártara','Una comida especial para dos perfectamente saludable el viernes por la noche: pescado y patatas fritas','["450 g de patatas peladas y cortadas en tiras","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco extra para cepillar","2 filetes de pescado blanco de unos 140 g/5 oz cada uno","ralladura y jugo 1 limón","un puñado pequeño de hojas de perejil, picadas","1 cucharada de alcaparras, picadas","2 cucharadas colmadas de yogur griego 0%","rodajita de limón, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.\r\nMezcle las patatas fritas en aceite. Extender sobre una bandeja para hornear en\r\nuna capa uniforme, hornee por 40 minutos hasta que se dore\r\ny crujiente. Poner el pescado en un plato llano, cepillar\r\nligeramente con aceite, sal y pimienta. espolvorear con\r\nla mitad del jugo de limón, hornee por 12-15 minutos. después\r\n10 minutos espolvorear un poco de perejil y limón.\r\nralladura para terminar de cocinar.","Mientras tanto, mezcle las alcaparras, el yogur, el perejil restante y el jugo de limón, reserve y sazone si lo desea.\r\ndeseo. Para servir, divida las patatas fritas en platos, levante el pescado sobre los platos y sirva con un\r\ncucharada de mezcla de yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:02:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14573,4275,'es','Salmón y espinacas con crema tártara','El siempre versátil salmón es tan popular en nuestras listas de compras como el pollo. Aprovecha al máximo con esta impresionante receta','["1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol o vegetal","2 filetes de salmón sin piel","250g bolsa de espinacas","2 cucharadas de crema fresca reducida en grasa","jugo ½ limón","1 cucharadita de alcaparras, escurridas","2 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana, picado","rodajas de limón, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén, sazonar el salmón.\r\npor ambos lados, luego freír durante 4 minutos por cada lado\r\nhasta que esté dorado y la pulpa se desmenuce fácilmente. salir\r\nreposar en un plato mientras cocinas las espinacas.","Coloca las hojas en la sartén caliente, sazona.\r\nbueno, luego tapar y dejar marchitar 1 min,\r\nrevolviendo una o dos veces. Cuchara las espinacas\r\nen platos, luego cubra con el salmón. suavemente\r\nCalentar la crème fraîche en la sartén con un\r\nexprimir el zumo de limón, las alcaparras y\r\nperejil, luego sazone al gusto. Ten cuidado no\r\ndejarlo hervir. Vierta la salsa sobre el pescado,\r\nluego sirva con rodajas de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:02:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14574,4277,'es','Cazuela picante de raíces y lentejas','Las patatas de esta receta adquieren maravillosamente los sabores picantes: nuestra idea de la cena vegetariana perfecta.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o vegetal","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","700 g de patatas peladas y cortadas en trozos","4 zanahorias, en rodajas gruesas","2 chirivías, en rodajas gruesas","2 cucharadas de pasta o polvo de curry","1 litro/1¾ litro de caldo de verduras","100 g de lentejas rojas","un manojo pequeño de cilantro fresco, picado en trozos grandes","yogur bajo en grasa y pan naan, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y\r\nCocine la cebolla y el ajo sobre una\r\nfuego medio durante 3-4 minutos hasta que\r\nablandado, revolviendo ocasionalmente.\r\nVierta las patatas, las zanahorias y\r\nchirivías, subir el fuego y cocinar\r\ndurante 6-7 minutos, revolviendo, hasta que\r\nlas verduras están doradas.","Agregue la pasta o el polvo de curry,\r\nvierta el caldo y luego lleve a\r\nel hervor. Reducir el fuego, añadir el\r\nlentejas, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15-20\r\nminutos hasta que las lentejas y\r\nlas verduras están tiernas y el\r\nla salsa se ha espesado.","Agregue la mayor parte del cilantro,\r\nsazone y caliente durante un minuto o\r\nentonces.Cubra con yogur y el resto de\r\nel cilantro. Sirva con pan naan."]','2026-01-11 13:02:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14575,4279,'es','Huevo y patatas fritas saludables','¡Uno que a los papás les encantará! Esta comida para cualquier momento es perfecta con una ración de frijoles horneados.','["500 g de patatas cortadas en cubitos","2 chalotes, rebanados","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco triturado o 1 cucharadita de hojas frescas","200 g de champiñones pequeños","4 huevos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Incline el\r\npatatas y chalotes en una fuente grande antiadherente\r\nfuente para asar, rociar con aceite, espolvorear\r\nel orégano, luego mezclar todo junto\r\nbueno. Hornee por 15 minutos, agregue los champiñones,\r\nluego cocine por 10 minutos más hasta que\r\nlas patatas estén doradas y tiernas.","Haga cuatro huecos en las verduras y rompa\r\nun huevo en cada espacio. volver al horno\r\ndurante 3-4 minutos o hasta que los huevos estén cocidos\r\ntu gusto."]','2026-01-11 13:02:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14576,4281,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: salmón en croute','Angela Nilsen hace una versión súper saludable del clásico paquete de pescado envuelto en hojaldre sin perder el factor sorpresa','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 chalotes grandes, finamente picados","140 g de champiñones castaños, finamente picados","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","jugo ½ limón","Paquete de 100 g de berros, picados","2 cucharadas de eneldo cortado","1 cucharada de cebollino picado","2½ cucharadas de crema fresca media grasa","6 láminas de masa filo de unos 38 x 30 cm cada una (125 g de peso total)","2 x 350 g de filetes de salmón sin piel"]','["Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande. Vierta las chalotas y fríalas durante 2-3 minutos para que se ablanden, luego agregue los champiñones y el ajo, y saltee a fuego alto durante otros 3-4 minutos, o hasta que los champiñones y las chalotas estén dorados y el líquido de los champiñones se haya evaporado. Vierta el jugo de limón; después de unos segundos, también debería haberse evaporado. Retirar del fuego, luego agregar los berros para que se ablanden con el calor de la sartén (ver paso 1). Agrega el eneldo y el cebollino y sazona con un poco de sal y pimienta. Dejar enfriar.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Cuando la mezcla de champiñones esté fría, agregue la crema fresca. Coloque una de las hojas de filo sobre la encimera con el extremo corto hacia usted. Pincelar todo con un poco del aceite restante. Coloque 4 hojas más de filo en capas de la misma manera, untando cada una con un poco de aceite.","Coloque uno de los filetes de salmón, con la piel hacia arriba, a lo ancho del filo, colocándolo aproximadamente a un tercio de su altura. Condimente con pimienta. Con una cuchara, esparza la mezcla de champiñones enfriada sobre la parte superior del filete (consulte el paso 2). Coloque el otro filete de salmón encima, con la piel hacia abajo. Sazone nuevamente. Doble el extremo corto de la masa más cercana a usted sobre el salmón, luego lleve el otro extremo para encerrar completamente el salmón (ver paso 3), levantándolo para que la unión pueda meterse debajo. Dobla ambos extremos de la masa lo más prolijamente posible.","Cepille el exterior con un poco más del aceite restante. Arrugue la última hoja de filo, presionándola ligeramente hacia arriba formando pliegues grandes (ver paso 4), luego unte con cuidado con lo último del aceite. Se puede preparar con 3-4 horas de anticipación hasta este punto y enfriar. Transfiera el paquete de salmón a la bandeja para hornear. Hornee durante 25 minutos hasta que la masa esté crujiente y dorada. Verifique mientras se cocina y si la parte superior comienza a dorarse demasiado rápido, coloque una hoja de papel de aluminio sin apretar sobre ella. Retirar del horno y dejar reposar el salmón durante 2-3 minutos antes de cortarlo."]','2026-01-11 13:02:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14577,4283,'es','Guiso de gambas y tomate con cobertura de gremolata','Una cazuela de pescado con gambas saludables, cubierta con una guarnición italiana de perejil y ralladura de limón; también es baja en grasas y calorías.','["500 g de patatas nuevas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, cortada en rodajas","4 ramas de apio, cortadas en trozos","2 dientes de ajo, picados","2 filetes de anchoa, picados","pizca de hojuelas de chile","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","250 ml de vino blanco","200 ml de caldo de verduras","400 g de langostinos crudos, pelados","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","1 cucharadita de alcaparras tiernas saladas, enjuagadas","un puñado grande de perejil picado","pan tostado, para servir"]','["Poner las patatas en una cacerola de\r\nagua fría con sal y llevar a ebullición.\r\nReduzca el fuego a medio y cocine a fuego lento.\r\ndurante 15-20 minutos o hasta que esté cocido pero aún\r\nfirme. Escurrir y, cuando esté lo suficientemente frío como para\r\nmango, rebanada gruesa.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande.\r\ncacerola a fuego medio-bajo.\r\nAgrega la cebolla, el apio, el ajo, la anchoa.\r\ny chile, sazonar y cocinar por 8 minutos.\r\no hasta que se ablanden. aumentar el calor\r\na medio-alto, agregue los tomates,\r\nvino y caldo, y cocine por 15 minutos.\r\nAgrega las gambas, el zumo de limón, las alcaparras.\r\ny patatas. Cocine por 5 minutos más,\r\no hasta que los langostinos se pongan rosados y estén\r\nrecién cocinado. Mezclar el perejil y\r\nralladura de limón, luego esparcir sobre el guiso,\r\nluego sírvelo con pan tostado, para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:02:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14578,4285,'es','Espaguetis a la puttanesca con verduras','Añade una porción extra de verduras en forma de calabacines en esta versión vegetariana de puttanesca. En 35 minutos, es un almuerzo bajo en grasas y calorías.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas (320 g), finamente picadas","320 g de calabacines rallados gruesos","3 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","¼-½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","8 aceitunas Kalamata, deshuesadas y cortadas por la mitad a lo largo","2 cucharadas de alcaparras, escurridas","300 g de espaguetis integrales","15 g de perejil de hoja plana, finamente picado","40 g de queso duro italiano vegetariano, finamente rallado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio. Agrega las cebollas y sofríe durante 5-8 minutos hasta que empiecen a tomar color. Agregue el calabacín, el ajo y las hojuelas de chile, si los usa, y cocine durante 3-5 minutos más hasta que el calabacín comience a ablandarse.","Agregue los tomates, una lata llena de agua, el puré de tomate, el vinagre, el caldo, las aceitunas y las alcaparras, cocine a fuego lento y cocine, sin tapar, durante 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, hierva una cacerola grande con agua con sal. Cocine los espaguetis siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escurra y mezcle con la salsa y el perejil. Si sigue el plan de dieta saludable, sirva dos porciones con la mitad del queso esparcido encima y enfríe el resto para otro día. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. Recalentar porciones en el microondas hasta que estén bien calientes, o en la encimera, tapados, a fuego medio con un chorrito de agua para que se suelten."]','2026-01-11 13:02:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14579,4287,'es','Huevos al horno con salsa verde','Sumerja panes planos en estos huevos horneados con salsa verde para absorber sus deliciosos jugos. Saludable y baja en calorías, se prepara en tan solo 15 minutos','["5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry.","200 g de tomates cherry frescos","2 dientes de ajo","1 manojo pequeño de perejil","1 manojo pequeño de albahaca","½ manojo pequeño de menta, con las hojas recogidas","2 cucharadas de alcaparras","1 tsp Dijon mustard","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","200 g de espinacas tiernas, lavadas","4 huevos","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","panes planos, para servir (opcional)"]','["Rocíe 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén y fría el pimentón y el comino durante 30 segundos a fuego medio. Agregue los tomates enlatados y los tomates frescos, lleve a ebullición, luego cocine a fuego lento con tapa a fuego medio durante 5-6 minutos hasta que los tomates se ablanden.","Mientras tanto, ponga el ajo, la mayor parte del perejil, la albahaca, la menta, las alcaparras, la mostaza, el vinagre de vino blanco, 4 cucharadas de aceite y 3 cucharadas de agua fría en un mini procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave. Estación.","Agrega las espinacas a la sartén con los tomates hasta que se ablanden (vuelve a tapar durante unos minutos y luego revuelve nuevamente para ayudar a que se ablanden). Haga cuatro salsas en la mezcla y rompa suavemente un huevo en cada una. Cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego medio durante 6-8 minutos, o hasta que los huevos estén listos. Destape la sartén y luego rocíe con la salsa de hierbas. Esparza sobre el perejil reservado y las hojuelas de chile, si las usa. Sirva con panes planos, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:02:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14580,4289,'es','Filete de miso con ensalada de fideos','¿Busca un plato rápido y nutritivo para los días ajetreados? Pruebe nuestro filete de miso, fácil y rápido, con ensalada de fideos y verduras: es saludable, bajo en calorías y sabe delicioso.','["2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de jengibre","2 filetes de solomillo (aproximadamente 375 g), sin toda la grasa visible y luego cortados en tiras","1 1/2 cucharada de pasta de miso marrón","320 g de brócoli, con los tallos cortados en rodajas gruesas y los floretes enteros","3 fideos integrales (132 g de peso seco)","1 1/2 cucharada de pasta de miso marrón","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","3 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","2 cucharadas de jengibre finamente picado","1 1/2 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","2 zanahorias (150 g), cortadas en palitos","4 tomates, cortados en gajos","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo"]','["Para la ensalada, cocine a fuego lento el brócoli en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo durante 3-4 minutos. Mientras tanto, cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escurra ambos y reserve.","Para el aderezo, bata la pasta de miso en un bol grande con el jugo de limón, el vinagre, el jengibre y el aceite. Mezcle con el brócoli cocido, los fideos, la cebolla morada, las zanahorias, los tomates y las semillas de sésamo.","Para el bistec, calienta una sartén awokor a fuego medio y sofríe brevemente el ajo y el jengibre hasta que empiecen a tomar color. Agrega el filete y sofríe durante unos minutos hasta que se dore. Apila la mitad encima de la ensalada de fideos. Agrega el miso al wok con 2 cucharadas de agua para levantar el jengibre y el ajo de la sartén, luego vierte sobre la carne. Sirve la mitad y deja enfriar el resto para otro día. Puede disfrutar las sobras frías o recalentarlas en el microondas o en el horno hasta que estén bien calientes. Se mantendrá fría durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:02:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14581,4291,'es','Pasta de remolacha y queso feta','Dale color a tu mesa con nuestra cremosa pasta de remolacha y queso feta. Lleno de nutrientes, es un almuerzo o cena vegetariano satisfactorio para la familia.','["2 remolachas grandes, peladas y cortadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","4 ramas de apio, finamente picadas, las puntas de apio mantenidas separadas","4 zanahorias, peladas y finamente picadas","1 manojo pequeño de albahaca","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","400 g de pasta integral","75 g de crema fresca baja en grasas","100 g de queso feta"]','["Poner una cacerola grande con agua con sal a fuego alto, llevar a ebullición y añadir los trozos de remolacha. Hierva durante 5 minutos, luego transfiera la remolacha a un plato con una espumadera. Deja la olla con agua de cocción a un lado.","Mientras tanto, ponga el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande a fuego medio, luego agregue las cebollas, el apio y las zanahorias, y cocine por 8 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Pique finamente los tallos de albahaca y las puntas del apio, luego agréguelos a la sartén junto con el ajo y fríalos por otros 30 segundos.","Vierta la pasta en la cacerola con agua de remolacha y cocine a fuego lento durante 13 a 15 minutos (dependiendo de la pasta que esté usando) hasta que esté cocida pero conservando un poco de mordisco. Escurrir, reservar 200 ml de agua de la pasta y verter la pasta nuevamente en la sartén.","Mientras tanto, coloque la remolacha con la mitad de las verduras fritas en el tazón de un procesador de alimentos con la mayoría de las hojas de albahaca y la crema fresca, luego mezcle hasta que quede suave. Agrega poco a poco el agua de la pasta reservada para que se suelte hasta tener una mezcla espesa.","Agrega esta salsa a la pasta junto con las verduras fritas restantes y un poco de condimento. Divida en tazones, desmenuce sobre el queso feta y luego esparza con las hojas de albahaca restantes. Muele un poco de pimienta negra, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:02:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14582,4299,'es','Sopa de asalto al frigorífico','Haz tuya esta receta de sopa usando todos los detalles que tengas. Prepare una sopa de tomate con las verduras sobrantes y termínela con aderezos sabrosos.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 zanahorias, finamente picadas","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 ramita de tomillo","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 litro de caldo de verduras o pollo","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 latas de 400 g de judías cannelini, escurridas","un puñado grande de verduras verdes (unos 150 g, utilice cualquier verdura de temporada que tenga: calabacín, judías verdes, acelgas, espinacas, etc.), picadas en trozos grandes","1 papa grande, pelada y cortada en cubos de 2 cm","perejil picado, queso feta desmenuzado, aceitunas trituradas, hojuelas de chile (opcional), aceite de oliva virgen extra, pan crujiente"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y cocina la cebolla, la zanahoria y el apio hasta que estén suaves, unos 10 minutos, luego agrega el ajo, el tomillo y el puré de tomate. Vierta el caldo junto con los tomates, reduzca el fuego al mínimo y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Añade las judías cannelini, las verduras y los trozos de patata, junto con una pizca generosa de condimento. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante otros 15-20 minutos más o menos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas y la sopa se haya espesado. Cubra con un poco de perejil, queso feta desmenuzado, aceitunas, hojuelas de chile (para quienes gustan de las especias) y un chorrito de aceite de oliva virgen extra. Sirva con pan crujiente a un lado para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:03:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14583,4303,'es','Hamburguesas de berenjena BBQ desmenuzada y frijoles negros','Haz que los niños te ayuden a preparar las verduras para estas hamburguesas familiares. Estos panecillos vegetales tienen todas las texturas reconfortantes de la carne pero son completamente veganos.','["2 berenjenas grandes, pinchadas por todas partes con un tenedor","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, en rodajas finas","1 cucharadita colmada de ajo granulado","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de azúcar demerara","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","5 cucharadas de salsa barbacoa","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros escurridos","4 panes de hamburguesa, tostados y ligeramente untados con mantequilla","cebolla morada o cebolla rosada encurtida, lechuga rallada, ensalada de col y mazorcas de maíz, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta la parrilla a temperatura alta y asa la berenjena, volteándola ocasionalmente, hasta que esté ennegrecida y suave por todas partes, aproximadamente de 20 a 30 minutos. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, caliente el aceite en una sartén grande refractaria a fuego medio, agregue la cebolla y fría hasta que esté blanda y dorada, aproximadamente 10 minutos. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Pele la piel de la berenjena enfriada y deséchela, o saque la pulpa con una cuchara y luego póngala en la sartén con la cebolla. Agrega el ajo granulado, el pimentón, el azúcar, el orégano, 1 cucharadita de sal marina y 1 cucharadita de pimienta negra. Revuelva hasta que esté aromático, luego mezcle la salsa barbacoa junto con los frijoles negros. Sazone y hornee hasta que la salsa esté rica y espesa, y la berenjena parezca carne de cerdo desmenuzada, aproximadamente de 10 a 15 minutos.","Apile los panes de hamburguesa con la cebolla morada o la cebolla rosada en escabeche y cualquier otro relleno de hamburguesa que desee. Disfrútelo con ensalada de col y mazorcas de maíz como acompañamiento, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14584,4307,'es','Brócoli, coliflor y halloumi asados','Enciende la barbacoa para preparar nuestro plato de brócoli, coliflor y halloumi y cuscús. Es una cena de verano sencilla y apta para toda la familia.','["2 tomates, finamente picados","½ cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 limón, exprimido","1 cucharadita de vinagre de sidra","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","1 coliflor, cortada en floretes y tallos cortados en trozos de 5 cm","1 brócoli, cortado en floretes y tallos cortados en trozos de 5 cm","3 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","450 g de halloumi, cortado en cubos de 2,5 cm","cuscús cocido, para servir (opcional)"]','["Mezcle los tomates, la cebolla, el jugo de limón, el vinagre de sidra, la mitad del orégano seco y ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra en un bol.","Enciende la barbacoa. Ponga a hervir agua en una cacerola y cocine los floretes de coliflor junto con el tallo y los trozos de brócoli durante 3 minutos. En el último minuto, vierta los floretes de brócoli. Escurrir las verduras y luego mezclar con 2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva, el resto del orégano y el pimentón.","Cuando las brasas estén cenicientas, coloque los trozos de verduras en la parrilla, cocine por 2 minutos y luego muévalos a una parte más fría de la parrilla. Sigue moviendo las verduras para que no se quemen.","Coloque el halloumi en la parrilla y cocínelo durante 1 minuto, luego déle la vuelta. Repita hasta que todos los lados estén dorados.","Vierta todas las verduras y el halloumi en un tazón para servir, rocíe con el aceite de oliva restante, sazone y sirva inmediatamente con cuscús."]','2026-01-11 13:03:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14585,4309,'es','Salmón al cilantro con quinoa al curry y granada','Debería intentar comer pescado azul al menos una vez a la semana, ya que el cuerpo no puede producir los ácidos grasos omega-3 beneficiosos que favorecen la salud del corazón.','["120 g de quinua, enjuagada","320 g de judías verdes finas, peladas y cortadas en tercios","paquete de 15 g de cilantro","15 g de jengibre fresco, pelado y picado","1 limón, exprimido","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 chile verde o rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","4 filetes de salmón salvaje sin piel (460g)","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2-3 calabacines (320 g), partidos por la mitad y en rodajas","2 cebollas rojas, finamente picadas","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","150 g de semillas de granada"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Hervir una cacerola con agua, agregar la quinua y cocinar por 5 minutos. Agregue los frijoles, vuelva a hervir y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Retirar del fuego y dejar reposar 5 minutos, luego escurrir, enjuagar y escurrir nuevamente.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el cilantro fresco, el jengibre, el jugo de limón, el comino, la guindilla y el cilantro molido en un tazón pequeño con una batidora de mano. Coloca los filetes de salmón en la bandeja para hornear, luego esparce una cucharadita de la mezcla de cilantro en cada uno y guarda el resto para más tarde. Hornee durante 8-10 minutos, dependiendo del grosor del salmón.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y sofreír los calabacines y la cebolla durante 8-10 minutos a fuego medio hasta que se ablanden y empiecen a tomar color. Agrega el garam masala, el caldo en polvo y el resto de la mezcla de cilantro, luego agrega los garbanzos y cocina por un minuto. Vierta en un tazón para servir y revuelva con la quinua enfriada, las judías verdes y las semillas de granada. Coloque la mitad en dos platos y desmenuce 2 de los filetes de salmón.","Reserve las dos porciones restantes de ensalada de quinua y salmón para comerlas frías en el almuerzo del día siguiente, si lo desea. Se mantendrán frías hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:03:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14586,4313,'es','Ensalada de pasta con mayonesa de atún','Esto se prepara rápidamente y es perfecto como almuerzo para el almuerzo, ya sea que estés de picnic o en tu escritorio.','["250 g de penne integral","240 g de yogur orgánico","2 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa en polvo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","4 cucharaditas de vinagre de manzana","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","un puñado de hojas de albahaca, finamente picadas","320g de atún en agua de manantial","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","Lata de 340 g de maíz dulce, escurrido"]','["Hervir la pasta durante 10 minutos hasta que esté al dente, luego escurrir y enjuagar con agua fría. Escurrir nuevamente. Mientras tanto, mezcle el yogur, la mostaza, el aceite de oliva, el vinagre, la cebolla y la albahaca en un tazón grande, luego agregue el atún, los pimientos rojos y el maíz dulce.","Revuelva la pasta y sírvala en tazones o empaquete en recipientes para el trabajo o un picnic. Se mantendrá tapado en el refrigerador para comer al día siguiente."]','2026-01-11 13:03:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14587,4315,'es','Ensalada de quinua con huevos y eneldo','La quinua es una proteína completa que contiene los ocho aminoácidos esenciales. Disfrútalo aquí como parte de una ensalada.','["120 g de quinua, enjuagada","6 huevos","320 g de espárragos, con las puntas leñosas recortadas y partidas por la mitad si son demasiado largas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de manzana","6 cebolletas, finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de eneldo picado","2 cucharadas de albahaca picada, más unas cuantas hojas para servir","15 g de alcaparras enjuagadas","320 g de tomates cherry cortados por la mitad"]','["Hervir la quinoa en abundante agua durante 20 minutos. Dejar actuar 5 minutos, luego enjuagar y escurrir bien. Mientras tanto, hervir los huevos durante 7 minutos en otra cacerola con los espárragos encima en una vaporera. Si los huevos están listos y los espárragos no están del todo tiernos, retira los huevos de la sartén y ponlos en agua fría mientras continúas cocinando los espárragos unos minutos más. Pelar los huevos.","Para hacer el aderezo, mezcle el aceite de oliva virgen extra y el vinagre de manzana con las cebolletas picadas, las hierbas y las alcaparras.","Vierta la quinua en un tazón y agregue tres cuartas partes del aderezo y los tomates. Vierta la mitad en platos y el resto en dos recipientes. Coloque los espárragos encima de las ensaladas con tres mitades de huevo en cada una, luego vierta el resto del aderezo y espolvoree con las hojas de albahaca. Selle y enfríe las ensaladas empaquetadas. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético en el refrigerador hasta por un día."]','2026-01-11 13:03:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14588,4323,'es','Brotes fritos con mantequilla con chalotas crujientes y almendras','Sirva un festín el día de Navidad y agregue estos brotes mantecosos con chalotes crujientes y almendras a su mesa festiva.','["50 ml de aceite de girasol","4 chalotes pequeños, pelados y cortados en aros finos","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","50 g de almendras fileteadas","50 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","500 g de coles de Bruselas cortadas por la mitad"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén a fuego lento. Freír las chalotas, revolviendo durante 10 minutos, hasta que estén doradas y doradas en los bordes. Agrega el ajo y las almendras. Freír 5 minutos más hasta que los ajos estén dorados. Vierta en un tazón.","Derretir la mantequilla y sofreír los brotes durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden y empiecen a dorarse, añadiendo un chorrito de agua si empiezan a prenderse. Estación. Mezcle con la mitad de la mezcla de chalotas y almendras, vierta en un plato y luego esparza sobre la otra mitad."]','2026-01-11 13:03:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14589,4325,'es','Barra de batido de vainilla','¿Qué podría ser más emocionante que una barra de batidos para niños (y niños grandes)? Perfecto para una fiesta o celebración, deja que los invitados elijan sus propios ingredientes.','["200 g de helado de vainilla","500ml de leche semidesnatada o entera","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","chocolate blanco derretido (opcional)","mini galletas, confites, malvaviscos, pretzels, palomitas de maíz, chocolates y una variedad de dulces","cerezas marrasquino","crema chorreante","4 vasos de batido o postre","pajitas de papel de colores"]','["Coloque las mini galletas, chispas, malvaviscos y otros dulces de su elección en tazones para servir separados y colóquelos en la mesa junto a la crema chorreante.","Mezcle el helado, la leche y la vainilla en la mezcla hasta que estén combinados y cremosos. Vierta en una jarra grande.","Si lo desea, sumerja los bordes de los vasos en el chocolate derretido y luego un poco de chispas. Deje reposar un poco y luego divida el batido en vasos. Deje que todos personalicen su batido con los aderezos y la crema chorreante, y sírvalo con pajitas de papel."]','2026-01-11 13:03:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14590,4327,'es','Biscotti de café expreso y chocolate amargo','Disfrute de estos deliciosos biscotti o guárdelos como regalo. Este giro agrega espresso a la mezcla, realzando la riqueza cremosa del chocolate.','["300 g de harina común","100 g de azúcar en polvo","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","80 g de aceite vegetal","1 huevo grande","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","2½ cucharadas de café instantáneo en gránulos, disueltas en 3 cucharadas de agua caliente y enfriadas","250 g de chispas de chocolate amargo"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Dejar de lado. Ponga la harina, el azúcar, el polvo para hornear y una buena pizca de sal en un tazón grande, luego revuelva para combinar.","Batir el aceite, el huevo, el extracto de vainilla y el café en un tazón pequeño aparte. Vierte lentamente los ingredientes húmedos sobre los secos, mezclando hasta tener una masa seca. Incorpora 100 g de chispas de chocolate. Amasar la masa hasta que quede suave; estará bastante seca, pero si es demasiado difícil de amasar, agregue otra cucharada de agua. Divida la masa por la mitad, dándole forma a cada pieza en un tronco de 25 x 8 cm, y transfiera ambos a la bandeja preparada. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos, luego déjelo enfriar en la bandeja durante 15 minutos.","Reduce el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Corta los troncos de biscotti en rodajas transversales de 1-2 cm de grosor con un cuchillo afilado, deberías tener unas 16. Regresa a la bandeja y hornea durante 15-20 minutos más, girando la bandeja a la mitad. Dejar enfriar un poco en la bandeja, luego transferir a una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo. Derrita las chispas de chocolate restantes en el microondas en ráfagas de 20 segundos hasta que queden suaves, o en un recipiente resistente al calor colocado sobre una cacerola con agua apenas hirviendo, luego sumerja un extremo de los biscotti enfriados en el chocolate derretido. Transfiera a una hoja de papel para hornear y déjelo reposar. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 13:03:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14591,4331,'es','Amaretto sour sin alcohol','Disfrute de un cóctel sin alcohol amaretto, con todos los sabores dulces, picantes y a nuez del cóctel clásico, sin alcohol.','["100ml de jugo de piña","50 ml de jugo de limón","½ clara de huevo","10 ml de almíbar de cerezas cóctel (o más si lo prefieres), más cerezas para servir","unas gotas de extracto de almendras"]','["Ponga el jugo de piña, el jugo de limón, la clara de huevo, el almíbar de cereza y el extracto de almendras en la batidora. Batir la mezcla unas cuantas veces a alta velocidad, hasta que la mezcla esté pálida y empiece a aumentar de volumen. Si su licuadora es adecuada para usar con hielo, agregue unos puñados y presione dos veces más para enfriar la mezcla. Alternativamente, agregue el hielo hasta que el exterior de la jarra se sienta frío. Vierta en vasos y decore con las cerezas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14592,4333,'es','Zapatero de gulash de cerdo y calabaza','Combine carne de cerdo con calabaza y champiñones en esta abundante comida baja en calorías para dos. Si agrega el repollo para servir, cuenta como cinco de sus 5 al día.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","250 g de filete de cerdo magro, sin grasa visible y cortado en trozos","3 ramas de apio, picadas (160 g)","160 g de calabaza, pelada y cortada en cubos","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","100 g de champiñones, sin tallos y los grandes cortados por la mitad","½ cucharadita de semillas de alcaravea, más una pizca para espolvorear","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","160 g de repollo cocido, para servir","100 g de harina integral de espelta","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","100g de yogur natural en bote","gota de leche, para glasear (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente apta para horno y luego sofríe la carne de cerdo durante 5 a 7 minutos hasta que empiece a dorarse. Agregue el apio, la calabaza, el pimiento y los champiñones con sus tallos, luego cocine por unos minutos más.","Agregue la alcaravea y el pimentón, luego vierta 350 ml de agua hirviendo, el caldo, el puré de tomate y el ajo. Tape la sartén y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas, luego retire la tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante otros 5 minutos para reducir un poco.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Para la cobertura de zapatero, poner la harina en un bol y agregar el polvo de hornear. Combine el aceite y el yogur, luego incorpórelos a la harina. Combine la mezcla hasta formar una masa con un cuchillo para cubiertos. Amasar muy ligeramente sobre una superficie de trabajo limpia, luego darle forma de salchicha del ancho de un pepino grande. Cortar uniformemente en seis rodajas y colocarlas encima del gulash. Unte con un poco de leche para glasear, si lo desea, y esparza una pizca de semillas de alcaravea. Hornee durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que estén dorados y cocidos; puede saberlo levantando uno para ver si la mezcla se ha endurecido debajo. Sirva con el repollo cocido a un lado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14593,4335,'es','Dulce de azúcar clásico','Disfrute de un dulce de azúcar que se derrite en la boca. El regalo perfecto para todo el año, también es fantástico envuelto como regalo para familiares y amigos.','["125 g de mantequilla salada, más un poco más para la lata","Lata de 397g de leche condensada.","460 g de azúcar mascabado light","150ml de leche entera","2 cucharaditas de pasta de vainilla"]','["Unte con mantequilla y forre un molde para pastel cuadrado de 20 cm con papel para hornear. Pon en una cacerola grande a fuego lento la mantequilla, la leche condensada, el azúcar y la leche. Revuelve continuamente hasta que el azúcar se disuelva.","Aumentar el fuego y llevar a ebullición. Burbujee durante 10 minutos, revolviendo todo el tiempo hasta que la mezcla alcance los 115 ° C en un termómetro de azúcar o de sonda. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar a 110ºC. Agrega la vainilla, luego bate en una batidora de pie o con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que se enfríe a 60 ° C. Esto ayudará a romper los cristales de azúcar grandes. El dulce de azúcar debe quedar espeso y de aspecto mate.","Vierta el dulce de azúcar en el molde preparado y presione con una cuchara para alisar la superficie. Déjelo reposar y luego córtelo en cuadritos. Se conservará hasta por tres semanas en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 13:03:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14594,4337,'es','Ensalada de verduras de otoño con aderezo de azafrán','Disfrute de esta impresionante ensalada de otoño como guarnición en una cena. Incluye zanahorias, calabacines, brócoli, tomates y aceitunas en un delicioso aderezo de azafrán.','["12 zanahorias arcoíris, sin la parte superior, lavadas y peladas","1 calabacín mediano, en rodajas","8 tallos de brócoli de tallo largo, los tallos gruesos cortados por la mitad a lo largo","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","100 g de tomates cherry mixtos, cortados por la mitad","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas en ángulo","3 tomates pera, partidos, escaldados, pelados, sin semillas y cortados en trozos pequeños","un puñado de aceitunas negras, deshuesadas y en rodajas","½ pepino, cortado a lo largo, sin semillas y cortado en ángulo","3 cucharadas de albahaca picada en trozos grandes","20 ml de vinagre de sidra","½  tsp Dijon mustard","pellizcar hebras de azafrán","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","50 ml de aceite de colza virgen extra","1 chalota pequeña, finamente picada"]','["Calienta una plancha a fuego medio-alto. Vierta las zanahorias, los calabacines y el brócoli en un tazón grande, sazone ligeramente y mezcle con el aceite de colza. Una vez que la plancha esté caliente, agregue las verduras en tandas y déjelas carbonizarse ligeramente durante unos 3-4 minutos, luego transfiéralas nuevamente al tazón. Cuando todas las verduras estén carbonizadas, agregue los ingredientes restantes de la ensalada, mezcle y reserve.","Para hacer el aliño de azafrán, bate en un bol el vinagre, la mostaza, el azafrán y el azúcar con una pizca de sal hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Agregue el aceite gradualmente y luego agregue las chalotas. Aliña la ensalada y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:03:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14595,4339,'es','Curry de pescado con tomate y tamarindo','Utilice un pescado blanco sostenible como la merluza y sirva esta saludable olla de especias india con judías verdes y cilantro.','["6 dientes de ajo","1 chile rojo, picado en trozos grandes (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante)","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de semilla de hinojo","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","200 g de judías verdes, peladas y partidas por la mitad","1 cucharada de pasta de tamarindo","4 filetes firmes de pescado blanco (nosotros utilizamos merluza)","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, picadas en trozos grandes","arroz basmati cocido, para servir"]','["Mezcle el ajo, la guindilla, el jengibre,\r\ncúrcuma y cilantro molido con\r\n3 cucharadas de agua. Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande.\r\ny tostar las semillas de comino e hinojo,\r\ndejándolos chisporrotear hasta que estén aromáticos. Añadir\r\nla pasta de jengibre y sofreír durante 3 minutos.","Vaciar los tomates en la especia.\r\nsartén, además de una lata de agua. Agrega los frijoles,\r\nllevar a ebullición, luego bajar la temperatura\r\nCaliente y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Agregue\r\nla pasta de tamarindo. Agrega los filetes de pescado,\r\nsazone generosamente con negro molido\r\npimienta, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.\r\nQuitar la tapa, dar la vuelta con cuidado a los filetes,\r\nluego burbujee la salsa hasta que el pescado esté\r\nbien cocido y la salsa espesa.\r\nEspolvorear sobre las hojas de cilantro y\r\nservir con arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:03:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14596,4341,'es','Ensalada de quinoa tostada, lentejas y salmón escalfado','Excelente si sigues una dieta baja en colesterol, este plato fresco de verduras contiene nueces, supercereales tostados y un sabroso limón y hierbas.','["140g quinua","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","400ml de caldo de verduras ligero (nosotros utilizamos caldo)","250 g de espárragos, recortados","100 g de soja congelada","140 g de brócoli, floretes recortados y cortados por la mitad (nosotros usamos Tenderstem)","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 filetes de salmón (de unos 150 g cada uno)","½ diente de ajo machacado","Paquete de 250g de lentejas puy ya cocidas","6 cebolletas, cortadas en diagonal","un puñado grande de menta y perejil, picados en trozos grandes","85 g de hojas tiernas de espinacas","25 g de almendras laminadas, tostadas"]','["Enjuague la quinua y viértala en una cacerola grande.\r\nsartén antiadherente. Enciende el fuego\r\nmedio y secar los granos, revolviendo\r\npara moverlos por la sartén. Una vez todo\r\nel líquido se ha evaporado, agregue el aceite.\r\nContinuar cocinando la quinua hasta que tenga\r\nse volvió marrón nuez y comenzó a \"explotar\"\r\n– esto tardará entre 10 y 15 minutos. Revuelva de vez en cuando\r\na menudo para evitar que la quinua se queme. verter\r\nsobre el caldo y cocine a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos.\r\nhasta que se haya absorbido todo el líquido.\r\nVierta en un bol y deje enfriar.","Mientras tanto, traiga una cacerola grande con agua.\r\na ebullición. Echar las habas de soja,\r\nespárragos y brócoli y cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n2 minutos. Retirar usando una espumadera\r\ny sumergir en un recipiente con agua helada.\r\nEscurrir las verduras.","Agrega 1 cucharadita de jugo de limón al\r\ncacerola con el agua vegetal, luego\r\nBaje el fuego a fuego lento.\r\nSazona los filetes de salmón y sumérgelos.\r\ncompletamente en el agua. Escalfar durante 6-8 minutos\r\nhasta que esté recién cocido. Retirar, dejar\r\nenfriar, luego quitar la piel y desmenuzar\r\nen trozos grandes.","Hacer un aderezo mezclando\r\nel ajo, la mayor parte de la ralladura de limón y\r\njugo de limón restante. Mezclar la quinua,\r\nlentejas, verduras escurridas, cebolletas,\r\nhierbas, espinacas y aderezo juntos en\r\nun tazón grande y luego sazone. Apilar sobre un\r\nplato para servir, cubra con el salmón y luego\r\nesparcir sobre las almendras y el resto\r\nralladura de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:03:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14597,4343,'es','Estofado de ternera al estilo italiano','Un guiso fácil, súper saludable y lleno de vitamina C','["1 cebolla, rebanada","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","Paquete de 300 g de tiras de ternera salteadas o utilice filete de ternera cortado en rodajas finas","1 pimiento amarillo, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","ramita de romero, picada","un puñado de aceitunas deshuesadas"]','["En una cacerola grande, cocine la cebolla y el ajo en aceite de oliva durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden y se doren. Agregue las tiras de carne, el pimiento, los tomates y el romero, luego deje hervir. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta que la carne esté bien cocida, agregando un poco de agua hirviendo si es necesario. Revuelva las aceitunas y sirva con puré o polenta."]','2026-01-11 13:03:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14598,4345,'es','Sopa cremosa de zanahoria al curry y frijoles con mantequilla','Una suave sopa de verduras mezclada con especias indias que se deja hervir a fuego lento durante horas, perfecta para alimentar a una multitud.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 cebollas picadas","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharada de curry en polvo mediano","1¼ kg de zanahorias, 1 kg/2 lb 4 oz en rodajas gruesas, el resto rallado grueso","3 latas de 400 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","1,2 l de caldo de verduras","400ml de leche entera","cebollino cortado, si lo desea, para servir, más 2 panes crujientes"]','["Poner el aceite y la cebolla en el más grande.\r\ncazo o cazuela que tengas y\r\nablandar durante 10 minutos. Agregue las especias y\r\ncocine por 2 minutos, luego agregue las rodajas\r\nzanahorias con la mitad de los frijoles y el\r\ncaldo de verduras. Llevar a fuego lento,\r\nluego cubra y cocine durante 15-20 minutos\r\nhasta que las zanahorias estén tiernas.","Batir la sopa hasta obtener un puré con una mano.\r\nlicuadora o hacer puré en tandas en una licuadora\r\no procesador de alimentos. Inclínelo nuevamente en la sartén.\r\n(Viértalo a través de un colador o colador si\r\nque te guste) y agrega los frijoles restantes\r\ny zanahoria rallada con 500ml de agua caliente.\r\nVuelva a hervir a fuego lento, luego cubra y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Agregue la leche y sazone al gusto.\r\nluego mantener a fuego muy suave hasta\r\nnecesario. Si quieres, corta unas cuantas cebolletas.\r\nVoltear y servir con pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:03:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14599,4349,'es','Risotto de setas y tomillo','Usar una mezcla de quinua y arroz le da una textura ligera y un delicioso sabor a nuez a este plato.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","350 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas","100g de quinua","1 litro de caldo de verduras caliente","175 g de arroz para risotto","un puñado de hojas de tomillo","un puñado de parmesano rallado o una alternativa vegetariana","Bolsa de 50 g de rúcula, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén mediana, sofreír el\r\nchampiñones durante 2-3 minutos, luego agregue el\r\nquinua. Mantener el caldo de verduras\r\ncalentar en una sartén aparte a fuego lento,\r\nañadir un cucharón de caldo y remover hasta\r\nabsorbido. Agrega el arroz y repite.\r\nnuevamente con el caldo, hasta que todo el caldo\r\nse ha agotado y el arroz y\r\nLa quinua está tierna y cocida.","Agregue las hojas de tomillo y luego divida.\r\nentre 4 platos o tazones. Servir cubierto\r\ncon parmesano rallado y hojas de rúcula."]','2026-01-11 13:03:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14600,4351,'es','Ragú de pollo, hinojo y tomate','Este ragú con trozos se puede acompañar con lo que quieras, cuscús, pasta, arroz o una bonita chaqueta, o simplemente un buen trozo de pan.','["1 bulbo de hinojo grande","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 pollos deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos","1 diente de ajo, picado","200 g de patatas nuevas, cortadas en trozos","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","150 ml de caldo de pollo o verduras","3 pimientos rojos asados ​​en salmuera, de un frasco o de una charcutería, picados"]','["Recorta las puntas verdes del hinojo y reserva. Reducir a la mitad y luego a un cuarto \r\nCortar el hinojo, quitarle el corazón y cortarlo a lo largo en rodajas. Calentar el \r\nEn una sartén con aceite, añade el pollo y sofríe rápidamente hasta que adquiera un color claro. \r\nAgrega el hinojo y el ajo, luego revuelve brevemente hasta que el hinojo brille.","Vierta las patatas, los tomates, el caldo y un poco de condimento, y \r\nllevar a ebullición. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que las patatas \r\nson tiernos. Agregue los pimientos y caliente. picar en trozos grandes \r\nlas hojas de hinojo reservadas y luego espolvorear sobre el ragú. servir \r\ncon pan crujiente para absorber los jugos."]','2026-01-11 13:03:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14601,4353,'es','Tagine de verduras con garbanzos y pasas','Hemos simplificado los cinco días con este saludable tagine','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas picadas","½ cucharadita de canela molida, cilantro y comino","2 calabacines grandes, cortados en trozos","2 tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","4 cucharadas de pasas","425 ml de caldo de verduras","300 g de guisantes congelados","cilantro picado, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén, luego sofreír las cebollas durante 5 minutos hasta que estén blandas. Revuelva  \r\nen las especias. Añade los calabacines, los tomates, los garbanzos, las pasas y \r\nCaldo, luego llevar a ebullición. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Agregue \r\nlos guisantes y cocine por 5 minutos más. Espolvoree con cilantro para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14602,4355,'es','Risotto rápido de tomate','Hacer risotto no tiene por qué implicar horas de revolver en la estufa, como lo demuestra esta sencilla receta de tomate.','["250 g de arroz para risotto","1 cebolla, finamente picada","50 g de mantequilla","250 ml de caldo de verduras","Cartón de puré de 500 ml","500 g de tomates cherry en canastilla","100 g de mozzarella en bolas, escurrida y cortada en trozos grandes","parmesano rallado (o una alternativa vegetariana) y albahaca rallada, para servir"]','["Vierta el arroz, la cebolla y la mitad de la mantequilla en un recipiente grande apto para microondas. Tape y cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 3 minutos. Agregue el caldo y la passata, luego continúe cocinando, sin tapar, durante 10 minutos. Revuelva bien y mezcle los tomates y la mozzarella. Cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 8 minutos más hasta que el arroz esté cocido y los tomates se ablanden.","Deje que el risotto se relaje durante unos minutos, luego agregue el resto de la mantequilla, el parmesano y la albahaca. Sazone al gusto y sirva directamente del bol."]','2026-01-11 13:03:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14603,4357,'es','Filetes de pavo con salsa de cítricos y jengibre','Utilice filetes de pavo de cocción rápida para esta receta, ya que se cocinan en unos minutos y cambie el pollo.','["2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","4 filetes de pechuga de pavo de cocción rápida, con un peso total aproximado de 300 g/10 oz","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","3 naranjas, jugo de 2 y una pelada y cortada en gajos","1 cucharadita de jengibre fresco rallado","1 cucharadita de miel clara","1 pomelo rosado, pelado y cortado en gajos","1 cucharada de cebollino fresco cortado o perejil picado","arroz salvaje o de grano largo y brócoli al vapor, para servir"]','["Espolvorea una cucharadita\r\nharina de maíz en un plato, luego\r\npresione los filetes de pavo en\r\nla maicena para espolvorearlos\r\nligeramente. Calentar el aceite en una olla grande\r\nsartén antiadherente, hasta que esté\r\nmuy caliente. Agrega el pavo y\r\nfreír durante 3-4 minutos, volteando\r\nuna vez hasta que estén dorados en ambos\r\nlados – cocine en tandas si\r\nes necesario. Transfiera a un plato.","Agrega el jugo de naranja, el jengibre.\r\ny miel a la sartén. suavemente\r\nllevar a ebullición. Mezclar el\r\nharina de maíz restante con 1\r\ncucharada de agua fría y revuelva\r\nla salsa. Siga revolviendo en un\r\nfuego suave hasta que espese y\r\nalmibarado, como un dulce y amargo\r\nsalsa. Estación.","Regresa el pavo a la sartén.\r\nAgrega la naranja y el pomelo.\r\nsegmentos y calentar a través\r\nsuavemente. Esparcir sobre cebollino o\r\nperejil y servir solo\r\nlejos del arroz y el brócoli."]','2026-01-11 13:03:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14604,4359,'es','Curry de guisantes y patatas nuevas','Un curry de verduras bajo en grasas y calorías elaborado con especias de Madrás y yogur.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas, rebanadas","3 chiles rojos, sin semillas y cortados finamente","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, picado en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de curry de Madrás en polvo","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","750 g de patatas nuevas, partidas por la mitad","jugo 1 lima","Bote de 500ml de yogur natural","manojo pequeño de cilantro, tallos y hojas finamente picados","200-300 ml de caldo de verduras o caldo de guisantes (consulte el consejo a continuación)","300 g de guisantes frescos sin vaina (o úselos congelados)","gajos de lima, para servir","2 pan naan, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y profunda.\r\nAgrega las cebollas y cocina a fuego lento.\r\ndurante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté suave. Agregue los chiles, el jengibre y las especias y cocine por\r\nunos minutos. Agrega las patatas y la lima.\r\njugo, cubriendo con la mezcla de especias.","Añade el yogur, los tallos de cilantro y\r\nla acción. Cocine a fuego lento durante 35-40 minutos.\r\nhasta que las patatas estén blandas y la salsa\r\nha reducido. Revuelva los guisantes y\r\ncocine por otros 5 minutos. espolvorear\r\nlas hojas de cilantro y servir con lima\r\ngajos y pan naan caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:03:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14605,4361,'es','Gumbo de pollo cajún','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una auténtica cazuela de Luisiana con especias criollas, verduras, jamón y una rica salsa, en una sola olla con un bocado.','["4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","5 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos grandes","1 cebolla, picada","2 palitos de apio, rebanados","3 hojas de laurel","5 cucharadas de harina común","4 cucharaditas de mezcla de especias cajún (o 1 pimentón, comino molido, chile molido y albahaca seca)","600 ml de caldo de pollo (hecho con 2 cubitos de caldo)","2 pimientos verdes, sin semillas y cortados en trozos","300 g de jamón en rodajas gruesas, sin grasa y cortado en cubitos","3 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","2 cucharadas de perejil muy picado"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en una cazuela amplia o sartén grande y freír el pollo durante unos minutos para que se dore. Vierta sobre un plato. Agrega la cebolla a la sartén con 1 cucharada más de aceite y sofríe durante 5 minutos hasta que casi se ablande. Agrega el apio y fríe durante otros 2 minutos, luego inclínalo para unirlo al pollo. Agregue el aceite restante, las hojas de laurel y la harina a la sartén y cocine hasta formar una pasta. Continúe cocinando, revolviendo constantemente (con un chorrito de agua si es necesario), hasta que esté dorado, luego agregue las especias durante 2 minutos.","Agregue gradualmente el caldo hasta que quede suave y picante. Regrese el pollo y las verduras a la sartén, junto con los pimientos, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos. Agregue el jamón, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos más. Comprobar la sazón y servir, espolvoreado con las cebolletas mezcladas con el perejil picado."]','2026-01-11 13:03:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14606,4365,'es','Gachas de avena con compota de arándanos','Agregue gachas de avena ricas en fibra con cremoso yogur griego y arándanos saludables; cómprelas congeladas para ayudar a reducir el costo de este abundante desayuno.','["6 cucharadas de gachas de avena","poco menos de ½ tarrina de 200 ml de yogur estilo griego sin grasa","½ paquete de 350 g de arándanos congelados","1 cucharadita de miel (opcional)"]','["Poner la avena en una sartén antiadherente con 400ml de agua y cocinar al fuego, revolviendo ocasionalmente durante unos 2 minutos hasta que espese. Retirar del fuego y añadir un tercio del yogur.","Mientras tanto, vierte los arándanos en una cacerola con 1 cucharada de agua y miel, si la usas, y escalfalos suavemente hasta que los arándanos se hayan descongelado y estén tiernos, pero aún manteniendo su forma.","Vierta la papilla en tazones, cubra con el yogur restante y vierta sobre los arándanos."]','2026-01-11 13:03:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14607,4367,'es','Sopa verde de brócoli y col rizada','Esta sopa súper saludable combina brócoli y col rizada con jengibre, cilantro y cúrcuma para un almuerzo rico en nutrientes y bajo en grasas.','["500 ml de caldo, elaborado mezclando 1 cucharada de caldo en polvo y agua hirviendo en una jarra","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, en rodajas","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","Un trozo de 3 cm de raíz de cúrcuma fresca, pelada y rallada, o ½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","una pizca de sal rosa del Himalaya","200 g de calabacines, cortados en rodajas grandes","85 g de brócoli","100 g de col rizada picada","1 lima, rallada y en jugo","paquete pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes, reservando algunas hojas enteras para servir"]','["Poner el aceite en una sartén honda, agregar el ajo, el jengibre, el cilantro, la cúrcuma y la sal,\r\nFreír a fuego medio durante 2 minutos, luego agregar 3 cucharadas de agua para darle un poco más de humedad a las especias.","Agrega los calabacines, asegurándote de mezclar bien para cubrir las rodajas con todas las especias y continúa cocinando durante 3 minutos. Añadimos 400 ml de caldo y dejamos cocer a fuego lento durante 3 minutos.","Agrega el brócoli, la col rizada y el jugo de lima con el resto del caldo. Dejar cocinar de nuevo otros 3-4 minutos hasta que todas las verduras estén blandas.","Retirar del fuego y añadir el perejil picado. Vierte todo en una licuadora y licua a velocidad alta hasta que quede suave. Será de un hermoso verde con toques oscuros (que es la col rizada). Adorne con ralladura de lima y perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:03:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14608,4371,'es','Ensalada especiada de pollo y piña','Esta colorida ensalada está llena de sabores y texturas contrastantes: adereza con chile dulce y cilantro.','["Lata de 227g de piña en jugo","Paquete de aproximadamente 140 g de pechuga de pollo cocida y en rodajas (el chile dulce, picante y especiado o BBQ funcionan bien)","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada por la mitad y en rodajas finas","Bolsa de 90g de hojas mixtas.","cilantro en manojo pequeño, con las hojas recogidas","un puñado de tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharada de salsa de chile dulce"]','["Escurre la piña reservando el jugo. Si está en aros, córtelo en trozos. Mezclar con el pollo, la cebolla, las hojas, el cilantro y los tomates, y dividir en 2 recipientes si se toma como almuerzo.","Para el aderezo, mezcle 2 cucharadas de jugo de piña, el chile rojo, el vinagre y la salsa de chile dulce con un poco de condimento en un frasco pequeño de mermelada o en un recipiente con tapa, y mezcle esto con la ensalada antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14609,4373,'es','Gambas tailandesas con piña y judías verdes','Este salteado entre semana está repleto de las bondades de las verduras crujientes. Está aromatizado con lima, albahaca tailandesa y jengibre.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 tallos de limoncillo, sin las hojas exteriores duras y el resto finamente picado","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","100 g de trozos de piña fresca","100 g de judías verdes","100 g de tomates cherry enteros","200 g de langostinos crudos","paquete pequeño de hojas de albahaca tailandesa o de hojas de albahaca normales","4 cucharadas de jugo de lima, más gajos para servir","2 cucharadas de caldo de pollo líquido","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave"]','["Mezcle los ingredientes de la salsa en un tazón pequeño. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite en un wok grande. Saltee la hierba de limón y el jengibre hasta que estén dorados. Agrega la piña, los frijoles y los tomates cherry y sofríe durante 3 a 5 minutos hasta que los frijoles estén recién cocidos. Añade las gambas y la salsa. Sofría durante otros 3-5 minutos hasta que los langostinos estén cocidos, luego agregue la mayoría de las hojas de albahaca. Sirva con rodajas de lima y las hojas de albahaca restantes esparcidas por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:03:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14610,4375,'es','Frittata de espinacas y pimientos','Un plato equilibrado, parecido a una tortilla, de huevos ricos en proteínas horneados con queso, ajo, tomates, pimientos y espinacas.','["5 huevos grandes","Tarrina de 300g de requesón natural bajo en grasas","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","15 g de parmesano finamente rallado (o alternativa vegetariana)","225 g de hojas de espinacas congeladas, descongeladas, exprimidas y finamente picadas","2 pimientos rojos asados ​​(no en aceite), cortados en tiras","ralladura generosa de nuez moscada","100 g de tomates cherry enteros"]','["Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Forre un molde para sándwich de 20 cm con una sola hoja de papel para hornear si su molde tiene el fondo suelto.","Batir los huevos en un bol grande con el requesón, el ajo, la mitad del parmesano, las espinacas, los pimientos, la nuez moscada y un poco de pimienta negra. Vierta en la lata, cubra con los tomates y espolvoree con el queso parmesano restante. Hornee durante 40 minutos hasta que esté completamente cocido y comience a inflarse. Cortar en gajos y servir frío o caliente. Se conservará durante 3-4 días en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 13:03:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14611,4377,'es','Sopa mediterránea de tomate con trozos','Utilice verduras asadas en esta sopa rápida y baja en calorías: utilizamos pimientos, berenjenas, cebollas y calabacines. Sirva con pan de centeno cubierto de ricotta y hierbas.','["400 g de mix de verduras asadas congeladas (pimientos, berenjena, cebolla, calabacín)","2 cucharadas de ajo picado","un puñado de hojas de albahaca","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 pastilla de caldo de verduras reducido en sal","50 g de ricota por persona, batida con cebollino picado y albahaca, untados sobre una rebanada de pan de centeno"]','["Caliente una sartén antiadherente grande, vierta la mitad de las verduras y el ajo y cocine, revolviendo, a fuego alto hasta que empiecen a ablandarse, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Agregue la albahaca, los tomates, la pastilla de caldo y 2 latas de agua, luego mezcle con una batidora de mano para obtener la mezcla lo más suave posible.","Agregue las verduras congeladas restantes, cubra la sartén y cocine durante 15-20 minutos más hasta que las verduras estén tiernas. Sirva en tazones. Sirva con ricotta de hierbas sobre pan de centeno."]','2026-01-11 13:03:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14612,4379,'es','Tarta de verduras y queso feta a la plancha','La masa filo crujiente es una base ligera para una tarta vegetariana rellena de verduras mediterráneas y queso feta.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 berenjena, en rodajas","2 calabacines, rebanados","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos gruesos","3 hojas grandes de masa filo","10-12 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","chorrito de vinagre balsámico","85 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","bolsa grande de hojas de ensalada mixta y aderezo bajo en grasa, para servir"]','["Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Coloque una bandeja para hornear de 33 x 23 cm en el horno para calentar. Cepille una sartén con aproximadamente 1 cucharadita de aceite y cocine las berenjenas hasta que estén bien carbonizadas, luego retírelas. Repita con los calabacines y la cebolla, usando un poco más de aceite si es necesario.","Retiramos la bandeja del horno y untamos con un poco de aceite. Unte una hoja grande de filo con aceite, cubra con otra hoja, agregue un poco más de aceite y repita con la hoja final. Transfiera la masa a la bandeja caliente, empujándola un poco hacia los bordes.","Coloque las verduras asadas encima y luego sazone. Agregue los tomates, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, luego rocíe el vinagre y el aceite restante. Desmenuza el queso feta y espolvorea con orégano. Cocine durante unos 20 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y dorado. Sirva con las hojas de ensalada mixta aliñadas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14613,4381,'es','Ensalada de lentejas y remolacha con mostaza','Un acompañamiento rústico y saludable para acompañar platos principales como salchichas, pollo asado o cordero.','["200 g de lentejas puy (o utilizar 2 paquetes de 250 g de lentejas precocidas)","1 cucharada de mostaza integral (o alternativa sin gluten)","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","Paquete de 300 g de remolacha cocida (no en vinagre), en rodajas","un puñado grande de estragón, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Si no utilizamos lentejas precocidas, cocine las\r\nlentejas siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, escurrir\r\ny dejar enfriar. Mientras tanto, combine\r\nla mostaza, el aceite y un poco de condimento para\r\nhacer un aderezo.","Vierta las lentejas en un bol, vierta sobre\r\naderezo y mezcle bien. Revuelva a través del\r\nremolacha, estragón y algún condimento,\r\nluego servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14614,4383,'es','Sopa cremosa de calabaza y lentejas','Ya sea que estés tallando una calabaza de Halloween o hayas comprado una calabaza barata, usa la abundante pulpa y semillas de esta sopa.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más 1 cucharadita","2 cebollas picadas","2 dientes de ajo, picados","aproximadamente 800 g de pulpa de calabaza picada, más las semillas","100 g de lentejas rojas partidas","½ paquete pequeño de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas y más para servir","1 litro de caldo de verduras caliente","pizca de sal y azúcar","50 g de crème fraîche, más algo extra para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. freír el\r\ncebollas hasta que se ablanden y comiencen a girar\r\ndorado. Agregue el ajo, la pulpa de calabaza,\r\nlentejas y tomillo, luego vierta el agua caliente\r\nvalores. Sazone, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n20-25 min hasta que las lentejas y\r\nlas verduras estén tiernas.","Mientras tanto, lava las semillas de calabaza.\r\nRetire la carne que aún esté adherida a ellos,\r\nLuego sécalas con papel de cocina.\r\nCalienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente.\r\ny sofreír las semillas hasta que empiecen a\r\nsalta y explota. Revuelva con frecuencia, pero cubra\r\nla sartén en el medio para mantenerlos en ella.\r\nCuando las semillas tengan un aspecto de nuez y tostadas,\r\nañadir una pizca de sal y una pizca de\r\nazúcar y revuelva bien.","Batir la mezcla de calabaza cocida\r\ncon una batidora de mano o en una comida\r\nprocesador hasta que quede suave, luego agregue\r\nla crème fraîche y vuelva a mezclar.\r\nGusto por sazonar.","Servir con una cucharada de crème fraîche,\r\nunas hojas de tomillo y las tostadas\r\nsemillas esparcidas encima."]','2026-01-11 13:03:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14615,4385,'es','Tostadas de frijoles picantes con cebollas encurtidas y ensalada de rábanos','El Tex-Mex se vuelve saludable con estas tortillas de maíz cubiertas con frijoles chipotles, cebollas rojas encurtidas, cilantro y lima.','["2 cebollas moradas, 1 en rodajas finas y 1 finamente picada","2 limas, jugo de 1 y 1 cortadas en gajos","1½ cucharada de aceite de girasol","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes, escurridas y enjuagadas","4 tortillas de maiz","140 g de rábanos, en rodajas finas","un puñado grande de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nPoner la cebolla cortada en rodajas, el zumo de lima y\r\nsazone en un tazón y reserve.","Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén y sofreír.\r\nla cebolla y el ajo picados hasta que estén tiernos.\r\nAgrega el comino y sofríe 1 minuto más.\r\nAgrega el puré de tomate, la pasta de chipotle y\r\nfrijoles, revuelva y luego vierta media lata de agua.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos, sazone y luego aproximadamente\r\ntriturar hasta obtener un puré. (Puedes cocinar durante unos\r\nminutos más si está un poco líquido, o agregue algunos\r\nsalpicaduras de agua para diluir).","Mientras tanto, unte las tortillas con\r\nel aceite restante y colocar en una bandeja para hornear.\r\nhoja. Hornee durante 8 minutos hasta que esté crujiente. difundir\r\nlas tortillas con la mezcla de frijoles.\r\nMezclar los rábanos y el cilantro con\r\nlas cebollas encurtidas y luego vierta encima.\r\nSirva con rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:03:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14616,4387,'es','Salmón al horno y huevos','Haga algo diferente con sus huevos y salmón ahumado horneándolos en un panecillo para un brunch muy especial.','["6 panecillos blancos crujientes (los de semillas de amapola quedan deliciosos)","25 g de mantequilla, derretida","6 lonchas de salmón ahumado o gravadlax","6 huevos medianos","unas cuantas cebolletas picadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nCorta la parte superior de cada rollo y luego, con cuidado\r\nRetirar el pan del interior hasta que quede\r\nun agujero lo suficientemente grande para acomodar\r\nuna rodaja de salmón y un huevo. Organizar\r\nlos panecillos en una bandeja para hornear, reservando el\r\ncimas. (Si lo desea, mezcle los medios en\r\nmigajas y conservar en el congelador durante\r\notra receta.)","Cepille el interior y los bordes de los rollos.\r\ncon un poco de mantequilla derretida, luego disponer\r\nuna rodaja de salmón dentro de cada uno. grieta\r\nun huevo en cada uno y sazonar. Hornear para\r\n10-15 minutos o hasta que los huevos estén cocidos\r\ntu gusto. Esparcir con cebollino cortado.\r\nTostar la parte superior, untar con el resto\r\nmantequilla, luego cortar en soldados y usar\r\npara mojar en huevos."]','2026-01-11 13:03:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14617,4389,'es','Pilaf de champiñones al limón','Si busca una alternativa más ligera al risotto, este pilaf de champiñones bajo en grasa es la solución ideal.','["500 ml de caldo de verduras","1 cebolla, rebanada","300 g de champiñones variados, en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","200 g de arroz basmati mixto y arroz salvaje","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","manojo pequeño de cebollino cortado","6 cucharadas de queso tierno ligero con ajo y hierbas"]','["Poner 2 cucharadas de caldo en una sartén antiadherente,\r\nLuego cocine la cebolla durante 5 minutos hasta que\r\nablandado – agregue un poco más de caldo si así lo desea.\r\ncomienza a secarse. Añade los champiñones y\r\nel ajo y cocine por 2 minutos más. Añade el\r\narroz y ralladura y jugo de limón, mezclando bien.\r\nVierta el caldo restante y el condimento.\r\ny llevar a ebullición. Bajar, cubrir\r\ny cocine a fuego lento durante 25-30 minutos hasta que el arroz esté\r\ntierno. Revuelva la mitad de cada una de las cebolletas.\r\ny queso tierno, luego sirva cubierto con\r\nel resto del cebollino y el queso tierno."]','2026-01-11 13:03:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14618,4391,'es','Ensalada de fideos con gambas y pomelo rosa','Adopte un enfoque vietnamita saludable para las ensaladas utilizando fideos fríos con aderezo dulce, mariscos, cilantro y menta.','["200 g de fideos de arroz finos (fideos)","12 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado","jugo 1 lima","2 cucharaditas de azúcar de palma o azúcar moreno suave","1 chile rojo grande, ½ cortado en cubitos, ½ en rodajas","2 pomelos rosados, segmentados","½ pepino, pelado, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","2 zanahorias, cortadas en palitos","3 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","400 g de gambas grandes cocidas","un puñado grande de menta, con las hojas recogidas","un puñado grande de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Poner los fideos en un bol, rompiéndolos.\r\nsubirlas un poco y cubrir con agua hirviendo.\r\nagua de la tetera. Dejar en remojo durante\r\n10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir, enjuagar debajo\r\nagua corriente fría, luego deje el\r\nfideos para escurrir bien.","En el mismo bol aplastar ligeramente\r\ntomates cherry – usamos el final de\r\nun rodillo. Agregue la salsa de pescado, la lima.\r\njugo, azúcar y chile picado. gusto por el\r\nequilibrio adecuado entre dulce, ácido y picante\r\n– ajústelo si es necesario (consulte el consejo a continuación).","Mezcle los fideos y luego agregue\r\ntodos los ingredientes restantes, excepto el\r\nchile en rodajas. Sazona y dale todo\r\nRevuelva bien, luego divida la ensalada de fideos.\r\nentre 6 platos para servir y espolvorear\r\nsobre el chile antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14619,4393,'es','Ensalada de pollo con arándanos','Utilice los restos de salsa de arándanos en esta ensalada saludable. Agrega una lata de frijoles cannellini si quieres darle volumen.','["2 pechugas de pollo sin piel","4 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas, en rodajas finas","200 g de hojas mixtas","½ pepino, sin semillas y en rodajas","25 g de arándanos secos","85 g/3 oz de salsa de arándanos","jugo 1 lima"]','["Corta cada pechuga de pollo por la mitad.\r\nhorizontalmente para dar 4 senos delgados,\r\nluego frotar con la mitad del aceite y\r\ntemporada. Calentar una fritura antiadherente\r\nSartén y fríe el pollo durante 3 minutos.\r\nde cada lado hasta que esté bien cocido.\r\nReservar en un plato.","Calentar el aceite restante en el\r\nSartén y sofreír las cebollas durante 5 minutos.\r\nCortar el pollo en rodajas, recogiendo el resto\r\njugos y cubrir con capas con\r\ncebollas, hojas, pepino y\r\narándanos secos. Mezclar el\r\nsalsa de arándanos, jugo de lima, 2 cucharadas\r\nagua y cualquier pollo reposando\r\njugos y rociar sobre la ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:03:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14620,4395,'es','Pastel de champiñones, espinacas y patatas','Una comida vegetariana entre semana, baja en grasas y súper saludable; incluso puedes congelar las sobras para más tarde.','["400 g de espinacas tiernas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","500 g de champiñones, como castaña, shiitake y botón","2 dientes de ajo machacados","250 ml de caldo de verduras (elaborado con media pastilla de caldo de verduras bajo en sodio)","300 g de patatas nuevas cocidas, cortadas en trozos pequeños","1 cucharada de mostaza en grano","1 cucharadita de nuez moscada recién rallada","2 cucharadas colmadas de crema fresca ligera","3 láminas de masa filo","300 g de judías verdes y brócoli, al vapor"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Dejar secar las espinacas en un colador vertiendo una tetera con agua caliente encima.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén grande antiadherente y fríe los champiñones a fuego alto hasta que estén dorados. Agregue el ajo y cocine por 1 minuto, luego agregue el caldo, la mostaza, la nuez moscada y las papas. Burbujee durante unos minutos hasta que se reduzca. Sazone y luego retire del fuego; agregue la crema fresca y las espinacas. Vierta en un molde para pastel y deje enfriar.\r\ndurante unos minutos.","Unte el filo con el aceite restante, corte los cuartos de hoja, luego arrugue sin apretar y colóquelo encima del relleno de pastel. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Servir con verduras."]','2026-01-11 13:03:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14621,4397,'es','Ensalada mediterránea de sardinas','Una ensalada súper saludable y llena de sabores intensos con pescado azul, aceitunas y alcaparras','["Bolsa de 90 g de hojas de ensalada.","un puñado de aceitunas negras, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de alcaparras, escurridas","2 latas de 120 g de sardinas en salsa de tomate, escurridas y reservadas la salsa","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto"]','["Divida las hojas de ensalada en 4 platos,\r\nluego espolvorea sobre las aceitunas y las alcaparras.\r\nDivida las sardinas en trozos grandes y agréguelas a\r\nla ensalada. Mezclar la salsa de tomate con la\r\naceite y vinagre y rociar sobre la ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:03:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14622,4399,'es','pollo cazador','Dale sabor a las pechugas de pollo con salsa de tomate italiana con romero y ajo, horneadas como una cazuela: también es una opción saludable','["1 cebolla, rebanada","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de hojas de romero picadas","4 pechugas de pollo","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca","verduras de temporada favoritas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Freír la cebolla y el ajo en el aceite.\r\nhasta que se ablanden. Agrega los tomates,\r\nromero y condimentos, y cocinar\r\ndurante 10-15 minutos hasta que espese.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nColoque el pollo en una bandeja para hornear, encima\r\ncon la salsa y hornear durante 15-20 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté bien cocido. Servir dispersos\r\ncon albahaca, con tus verduras favoritas,\r\nsi quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:03:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14623,4401,'es','Huevos al horno con espinacas y tomate','Un platillo rústico con una deliciosa combinación de sabores y solo cuatro ingredientes, prueba a prepararlo para el brunch.','["100g bolsa de espinacas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","4 huevos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner\r\nlas espinacas en un colador, luego vierte\r\nsobre una tetera con agua hirviendo para que se ablande\r\nhojas. Exprima el exceso de agua y\r\ndivida entre 4 fuentes pequeñas para horno.","Mezclar los tomates con las hojuelas de chile.\r\ny un poco de condimento, luego agregue a la\r\nplatos con espinacas. hacer un pequeño\r\nbien en el centro de cada uno y grieta\r\nun huevo. Hornee durante 12-15 minutos o más\r\ndependiendo de cómo te gusten tus huevos.\r\nSirva con pan crujiente, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14624,4405,'es','tuétano relleno español','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Al igual que su primo más pequeño, el calabacín, los calabacines en trozos quedan excelentes asados ​​con un relleno de sabor fuerte como pimentón y chorizo.','["1 tuétano","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","100 g de chorizo, picado","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","½ cucharadita de orégano seco y tomillo seco","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","140 g de pimientos rojos asados ​​de un frasco, en rodajas","un puñado de perejil picado","85 g de pan rallado fresco","100 g de manchego rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cortar\r\nla médula por la mitad a lo largo y sacar\r\npor el medio. Coloque las mitades, con el lado cortado\r\narriba, en una fuente grande para asar y sazonar.","Calentar el aceite en una cacerola, agregar el\r\ncebolla y sofreír a fuego lento durante\r\n10 minutos hasta que esté suave. Agrega el ajo,\r\nchorizo, especias y hierbas secas. cocinar\r\ndurante unos minutos, luego agregue los tomates\r\ny pimientos. Bajar a un nivel bajo\r\ncocine a fuego lento y cocine durante 10 minutos, luego\r\nrevuelve el perejil.","Vierta la mezcla de tomate en el\r\nmitades de tuétano, cubrir con papel de aluminio y\r\nhornee por 30 minutos. Espolvorear sobre el\r\npan rallado y manchego, y\r\nRegrese al horno por 10 minutos hasta que\r\nlas migas quedan doradas y crujientes,\r\ny la médula está tierna."]','2026-01-11 13:03:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14625,4407,'es','Lasaña de calabacín y marisco a la plancha','Súper saludable y baja en grasas que una lasaña tradicional, esta versión también es mucho más rápida de preparar.','["1 cucharadita de aceite","4 calabacines, cortados a lo largo","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","½ tarro de 680ml passata con cebolla y ajo","Bolsa de 400 g de mezcla de mariscos, descongelada si está congelada","4 láminas de lasaña fresca, cortadas por la mitad","3 cucharadas de parmesano rallado","3 cucharadas de pan rallado seco","350 g de judías verdes, para servir"]','["Calentar una plancha y untar un poco de aceite.\r\nsobre los calabacines. Cocine en tandas\r\nhasta que esté ligeramente carbonizado. Temporada y\r\nespolvorear sobre el chile y luego reservar.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nVierta un poco de passata en una fuente mediana.\r\nfuente apta para horno. Coloque la mitad del\r\nmariscos encima, luego sazonar y\r\ncubra con un tercio de los calabacines.","Cubra con 2 hojas de pasta, luego\r\nmás salsa de tomate, mariscos,\r\ncalabacines, otra capa de pasta,\r\nmás salsa de tomate y terminar con\r\nel resto de calabacines. Mezclar el\r\nparmesano y pan rallado,\r\nluego esparcir encima y cocinar durante\r\n25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado. vapor\r\no hervir las judías verdes y servir\r\ncon la lasaña."]','2026-01-11 13:03:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14626,4409,'es','Tortilla de ricota, tomate y espinacas','Bocados de verduras saludables y llenos de sabor: imprescindibles entre semana','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, finamente cortada","300 g de tomates cherry","100 g de hojas de espinaca","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca","100 g de ricota","6 huevos batidos","ensalada, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nCalentar aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande.\r\ny cocine la cebolla durante 5-6 minutos hasta que\r\nsuavizado y ligeramente dorado. Añade el\r\ntomates y revuelva durante 1 minuto para que se ablanden.","Retirar del fuego, agregar las espinacas.\r\nhojas y albahaca, y mezcle hasta que se marchiten.\r\nun poco. Transfiera todos los ingredientes a un\r\nhorno rectangular engrasado de 30cm x 20cm\r\nestaño. Tome pequeñas cucharadas de ricotta y\r\nsalpique sobre las verduras.","Sazonar los huevos y batir bien, luego\r\nvierta sobre las verduras y el queso.\r\nCocine en el horno durante 20-25 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado pálido y cuajado. Servir con ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:03:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14627,4411,'es','Patatas asadas con frijoles caseros','Las noches frías requieren comida reconfortante y no hay nada mejor que las patatas asadas: mejora la salud de las tuyas con frijoles caseros','["4 patatas asadas","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 zanahoria, cortada en cubitos","1 tallo de apio, cortado en cubitos","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes escurridas","2 tomates, picados","1 cucharadita de pimentón (elija dulce o picante según el gusto)","1 cucharadita de salsa inglesa","2 cucharadas de cebollino picado, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nFrote las patatas y séquelas bien, luego\r\npinchar en varios lugares con un tenedor. hornear\r\ndirectamente en la parrilla del horno durante 1-1½ horas,\r\nhasta que se sientan suaves al apretarlos.","Después de 30 minutos, calentar el aceite en una sartén y\r\nCocine suavemente la zanahoria y el apio durante\r\n10 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega los frijoles,\r\ntomates y pimentón y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 5 minutos más hasta que los tomates\r\nquedan blandas y pulposas. Agregue 100 ml\r\nagua y la salsa inglesa,\r\ncocine por 5 minutos más, luego cubra y\r\nmanténgase caliente.","Abra las patatas y vierta\r\nlos frijoles. Espolvorear con cebollino y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14628,4415,'es','Pilafs de pimientos especiados','Esta colorida cena vegetariana es súper saludable y se puede congelar en porciones individuales, para que puedas descongelar tantas como necesites.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 trozo de jengibre finamente picado","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de garam masala","200 g de arroz basmati","850 ml de caldo de verduras","140 g de lentejas rojas, lavadas y escurridas","Bolsa de 200 g de hojas de espinaca picadas","un puñado de hojas de menta, picadas","8 pimientos"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande con\r\nuna tapa. Agrega la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre,\r\nluego cocine suavemente durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden.\r\nAgregue el puré de tomate y las especias y\r\ncocine por 1 min más. Agrega el arroz, revuelve\r\npara cubrir, luego vierta el caldo. traer a\r\nhervir, verter las lentejas, cubrir con el\r\ntapar y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante\r\n15 minutos, hasta que las lentejas y el arroz estén\r\ncocido. Agregue las espinacas y la menta (consulte el consejo a continuación, si está congelado).","Use un cuchillo afilado para cortar la parte superior.\r\ncada pimiento. Corta el tallo del medio\r\ny saque las semillas. Con cuidado\r\nRecorte ligeramente la parte inferior para que quede firme.\r\nen posición vertical, pero el relleno no se caerá.\r\nRellena cada pimiento con la mezcla de arroz y\r\ncoloque la tapa encima. Hornee o envuélvalo bien en film transparente o en bolsas para congelar y congele.","Para cocinar, descongele los pimientos por completo si\r\ncongelado. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nColoque los pimientos sobre una bandeja ligeramente engrasada.\r\nbandeja para hornear y cocine durante 25-30 minutos o\r\nhasta que los pimientos se hayan ablandado. servir\r\ncon ensalada verde mezclada con pepino,\r\nhierbas y una cucharada de yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14629,4417,'es','Mover','Utilice trigo bulgur como base para esta ensalada del Medio Oriente con verduras súper saludables, queso feta y especias.','["100 g de trigo búlgaro","100 g de col rizada","manojo grande de menta, picada en trozos grandes","manojo de cebolleta, en rodajas","½ pepino, cortado en cubitos","4 tomates, sin semillas y picados","pizca de canela molida","pizca de pimienta de Jamaica molida","6 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","jugo y ralladura de ½ limón","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","4 lechugas Baby Gem, con las hojas separadas, para servir"]','["Incline el trigo búlgaro en un\r\nrecipiente resistente al calor y simplemente cúbralo con\r\nagua hirviendo, luego cubrir con film transparente\r\nfilmar y dejar reposar durante 10-15 minutos o\r\nhasta que estén tiernos. Pon la col rizada en una comida.\r\nProcesador y pulso para picar finamente.","Revuelva la col rizada, la menta, las cebolletas,\r\npepino y tomates a través\r\nel trigo búlgaro. Sazone con el\r\ncanela y pimienta de Jamaica, luego aliñar con\r\nel aceite de oliva y el jugo de limón al gusto.\r\nEsparcir sobre la ralladura de limón y el queso feta.\r\nPara servir, deja que todos saquen la ensalada.\r\nsobre hojas de lechuga Baby Gem."]','2026-01-11 13:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14630,4419,'es','Tortilla de patata y pimentón','Esta tortilla española tradicional y espesa está rellena con patatas nuevas y aromatizada con hierbas.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","250 g de patatas nuevas, con las puntas cortadas y en rodajas gruesas","1 cebolla pequeña, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, picados","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharadita de orégano seco o 3 cucharadas de perejil picado, más unas cuantas hojas extra para decorar (opcional)","6 huevos grandes"]','["Calentar el aceite en una fuente antiadherente de 20 cm de profundidad.\r\nsartén. Sofreír las patatas, la cebolla y\r\nel ajo durante 10 minutos hasta que esté tierno. Agregue el\r\npimentón y sofreír 1 min más.","Batir las hierbas secas o frescas en el\r\nhuevos con condimento, luego vierta en\r\nla sartén. Revuelva un par de veces mientras el huevo\r\ncomienza a asentarse en el fondo de la sartén,\r\nluego déjelo cocinar lentamente sobre un\r\nfuego muy lento durante 10 minutos hasta que cuaje, excepto\r\npara lo más alto.","Desliza con cuidado la tortilla sobre una\r\nplato. Deslícelo nuevamente en la sartén, con el\r\nla parte superior cruda ahora en la parte inferior, y\r\ncocine por 1-2 minutos más. Adorne con\r\nperejil, si lo usa, envuélvalo en papel de aluminio y sirva\r\ntibio o frío."]','2026-01-11 13:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14631,4421,'es','Coliflor al horno cremosa con migas de almendras','Pruebe nuestra coliflor entera al horno con migas de almendras para obtener un excelente centro de mesa vegetariano en un festín familiar. El pan de ajo crujiente combina muy bien con','["1 coliflor grande, con las hojas exteriores recortadas","4 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas, muy finamente picadas","3 dientes de ajo machacados","½ cucharadita de maza molida","4 ramitas de tomillo, hojas recogidas de 2, 2 dejadas enteras","4 cucharadas de harina común","750 ml de leche de almendras sin azúcar","150ml de crema de soja","1 cucharada de mostaza integral","25 g de pan rallado seco (asegúrese de que sea apto para veganos, si es necesario)","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas","pan de ajo vegano y ensalada verde con aderezo de limón, para servir"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Corta una cantidad suficiente del tallo de coliflor para que quede plano, luego corta una cruz profunda en la base del tallo. Coloque la coliflor sobre un trozo de papel de aluminio y luego frótela con 1 cucharada de aceite. Espolvoree 2 cucharadas de agua, sazone bien, luego cubra bien con papel de aluminio, sellando el agua y la coliflor dentro del paquete. Poner en una fuente para horno y cocinar durante 1 hora 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, cocine las cebollas con una pizca de sal y 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén hasta que estén suaves y traslúcidas. Agregue el ajo, la macis, las hojas de tomillo y la harina y revuelva durante 2 minutos, luego agregue la leche de almendras. Llevar a fuego lento, revolviendo y luego sazonar. Cuando espese un poco, retirar del fuego y añadir la crema de soja y la mostaza.","Frote el pan rallado con el aceite restante. Agrega las almendras.","Destapa la coliflor y regresa al plato. Vierta la salsa por toda la coliflor y en el plato. Esparce las migas encima y corta las dos ramitas enteras de tomillo. Encienda el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Hornee durante 15-20 minutos más, hasta que la salsa burbujee y espese un poco, y las migajas y la coliflor estén doradas. Cortar en gajos y servir con ensalada verde y un poco de pan de ajo."]','2026-01-11 13:03:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14632,4423,'es','Tarta de manzana, queso y patatas','Dale un toque sabroso a la tarta de manzana con patatas, queso y cebolla, además de mostaza y tomillo. Los sabores dulces y salados crean un pastel impresionante.','["30 g de mantequilla salada","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas grandes, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","½ manojo de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","30 g de harina común","500 ml de caldo de verduras","1 cucharada de mostaza integral","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","450 g de patatas (nosotros utilizamos Maris Piper), cortadas en trozos de 2-3 cm","3 manzanas, peladas, sin corazón y picadas en trozos de 1-2 cm","150 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","300 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","70 g de queso cheddar rallado","150 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","1 huevo batido"]','["Primero, haz la masa. Vierta la harina, el queso y una pizca de sal en una mezcla para un tazón grande. Agrega la mantequilla y frótala con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Mezcle 4-5 cucharadas de agua fría y forme una masa. Envuelva y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Para hacer el relleno, derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola mediana a fuego medio, luego agregue el aceite y la cebolla y cocine durante 10-15 minutos hasta que se caramelice. Agrega el tomillo y sofríe 1 min más. Agregue la harina y revuelva para combinar. Incorpora poco a poco el caldo, agregándolo en pequeñas cantidades para evitar que se formen grumos. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Agregue la mostaza y el vinagre hacia el final del tiempo de cocción.","Mientras tanto, ponga las patatas en una cacerola grande con agua fría, déjelas hervir y cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que estén cocidas y aún mantengan su forma. Escurrir bien y luego incorporar a la salsa. Agrega las manzanas, el queso cheddar y un poco de condimento y revuelve nuevamente. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Vierta el relleno en una fuente para horno ovalada de 28 cm (la nuestra era de 28 x 18,5 x 6,5 cm). Mientras se enfría, extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente espolvoreada con harina hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de £1. Cortar en tiras de aproximadamente 1 cm de ancho. Coloque la mitad de las tiras a lo largo del plato en horizontal, dejando espacios de unos pocos milímetros entre ellas, luego, una a una, entreteje las tiras restantes en vertical, usando una técnica por encima y por debajo, espaciándolas también unos pocos milímetros. Vuelva a enrollar los recortes y córtelos en flores, hojas u otras formas para decorar, si lo desea (consulte el consejo a continuación). Coloque las formas de hojaldre encima y luego unte con el huevo batido.","Hornee durante 50 minutos, vigilándolo; es posible que deba cubrir la parte superior con papel de aluminio si comienza a dorarse demasiado rápido. Dejar enfriar al menos 10 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14633,4425,'es','batido de cerezas','Intente usar cerezas congeladas para preparar fácilmente este vibrante batido. Sirva solo o con brunch. A los niños también les encantará','["300 g de cerezas frescas o congeladas, sin hueso","150 gramos de yogur natural","1 plátano grande, en rodajas","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Vierta todos los ingredientes en una licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Ajusta el espesor a tu gusto con 50-100ml de agua fría. Sirva en cuatro vasos o enfríe por hasta 24 horas, revolviendo bien antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14634,4427,'es','Batido energético de arándanos y plátano','Agrega tofu rico en proteínas a este batido de arándanos y plátano para hacerlo realmente cremoso y mantenerte lleno hasta la hora del almuerzo. Servir con tostadas o algún cereal.','["2 plátanos maduros, pelados","125 g de arándanos (frescos o congelados)","Paquete de 300 g de tofu sedoso, escurrido","2 cucharadas de gachas de avena"]','["Batir todos los ingredientes en una licuadora con 300 ml de agua. Beba inmediatamente o transfiéralo a un biberón para más tarde, agitando bien antes de beber."]','2026-01-11 13:03:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14635,4429,'es','Kofte de cerdo y patatas en freidora','Los kofte son una comida fácil entre semana y, si preparas la mezcla con anticipación, la cena puede estar lista en solo 15 minutos; usamos papa para que la carne dure más.','["500 g de carne picada de cerdo","1 patata roja grande, de unos 250 g, lavada y rallada gruesa","1 cebolla morada, rallada gruesa","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","25 g de perejil fresco, finamente picado","spray de aceite de oliva, para la freidora","150 g de trigo bulgur o cuscús","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 limón, cortado en seis gajos","½ pepino, cortado en cubitos","4 tomates, picados","2 cucharadas de menta fresca o cilantro, hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes","Tarrina de 200 g de queso feta, tzatziki o hummus batido, para servir"]','["Para preparar la ensalada, ponga el trigo bulgur o el cuscús en un recipiente resistente al calor y vierta sobre 300 ml de agua recién hervida. Cubrir con un plato y reservar hasta que se ablanden.","Calienta la freidora a 190C. Pon la carne picada de cerdo en un bol grande y añade la patata rallada, la cebolla y el ajo, las semillas de comino, el pimentón ahumado, la guindilla, el perejil y un poco de sal y pimienta. Mezcle bien para combinar y luego divídalo en ocho bolas del mismo tamaño.","Exprime firmemente cada albóndiga hasta darle forma de salchicha, no te preocupes si no quedan perfectamente regulares. Colóquelo en la canasta de la freidora, rocíe con aceite y cocine durante 15 a 18 minutos, volteándolo hasta la mitad hasta que se dore y esté completamente cocido.","Para preparar el aderezo para ensalada, agregue el aceite de oliva y el jugo de dos rodajas de limón al trigo bulgur junto con un poco de sal y pimienta. Mezcle el pepino, los tomates y las hierbas y divídalo en platos para servir. Cubra con el kofte y sirva con una cucharada de queso feta o hummus batido y las rodajas de limón restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:03:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14636,4431,'es','Calabacín al horno y tomate gratinados','Aprovecha al máximo el calabacín y los tomates en este gratinado, con mozzarella derretida, albahaca fresca y una cobertura de pan rallado crujiente. Es un gran plato helado.','["2 calabacines medianos, cortados a lo largo de aproximadamente ½ cm de grosor","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para el plato y para rociar","Lata de 400 g de tomates picados, triturados en un procesador de alimentos","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","un puñado de albahaca fresca (opcional)","50 g de polenta o harina de sémola","50 g de harina común","1 huevo grande, batido","1 bola de mozzarella, en rodajas (225 g)","10 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado","50 g de pan rallado"]','["Espolvorea los calabacines con una pizca de escamas de sal marina y colócalos en un plato con otro plato encima. Coloque un peso o una lata encima para ayudar a expulsar el líquido.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén antiadherente y agrega los tomates y el ajo. Cocine a fuego medio, revolviendo, durante 5 minutos hasta que espese. Corte la albahaca, si la usa, y sazone.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y engrasar una fuente para asar. Combina las harinas en un bol. Retirar el agua del calabacín. Pasar las rodajas de calabacín por el huevo, luego por la harina y colocarlas formando una capa sobre el fondo del plato. Cubra con unas rodajas de mozzarella, seguidas de una capa de salsa de tomate y repita con otra capa de calabacín, mozzarella y salsa. Mezcle el queso y el pan rallado y luego esparza por encima.","Rocíe con un poco más de aceite de oliva y hornee durante 40-45 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante. Sirva con una ensalada de cebolla morada con hierbas y un poco de pan para limpiarlo, si lo desea. Se puede congelar hasta por dos meses."]','2026-01-11 13:03:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14637,4433,'es','Envolturas de falafel de edamame','Prepare falafels con frijoles edamame y garbanzos para hacer estos sabrosos wraps. Si tienes poco tiempo, puedes utilizar hummus y falafels comprados en la tienda.','["100 g de frijoles edamame congelados","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 diente de ajo pequeño, picado","1 cucharadita de comino molido","un puñado pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes, más un poco más para servir (opcional)","1 cucharada de harina común","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para enrollar y cepillar","¼ de col lombarda, finamente rallada","½ limón, exprimido","4 panes planos o wraps","4 cucharadas de hummus","¼ de pepino, picado","1 chile rojo, en rodajas finas (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Pon todos los ingredientes del falafel, excepto el aceite, en una licuadora y sazona ligeramente. Licue hasta obtener una mezcla suave; unos cuantos trozos de edamame están bien.","Con las manos engrasadas, tome porciones del tamaño de una cucharada de la mezcla, forme bolitas (debe obtener 16) y colóquelas en la bandeja para hornear. Presiona suavemente cada falafel con la palma de tu mano. Unte cada falafel con un poco de aceite y luego hornee durante 20 minutos hasta que esté firme y dorado.","Mezclar el repollo con una pizca de sal y el jugo de limón y dejar reposar durante 5 minutos para que se encurta. Calentar los wraps y untar con hummus. Cubra con repollo, falafel (5 para adultos, 3 para niños), pepino, perejil extra, si lo usa, y chile para aquellos a quienes no les importa la comida picante."]','2026-01-11 13:03:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14638,4435,'es','Gachas de pastel de zanahoria','Pruebe una versión diferente de las gachas con nuestra versión de pastel de zanahoria, con sabores de zanahoria, pasas, canela y nuez moscada. Lleno de energía, te preparará para el día.','["2 zanahorias pequeñas, peladas y ralladas","180 g de avena avena","1 cucharadita de canela","rallado de nuez moscada fresca","75 g de pasas","850 ml de leche (la leche de vaca o vegetal funciona bien)","1 cucharada de mantequilla de nueces, como la de almendras (opcional)","miel, para servir (opcional)"]','["Ponga todos los ingredientes menos la miel en una sartén y cocine a fuego medio durante 10-15 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que la avena y las zanahorias estén suaves y la papilla cremosa.","Agregue un poco más de leche mientras se cocina si está demasiado espesa. Sirve con un chorrito más de leche y un chorrito de miel, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:03:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14639,4437,'es','Ensalada de pollo al pesto','Sirva esta ensalada de pollo al pesto y cuscús en hojas de lechuga para una cena saludable. Con tomates secos y piñones, tiene mucha textura.','["50 g de cuscús","2 cucharadas de pesto","2 cucharadas de yogur sin grasa","2 pechugas de pollo cocidas y sin piel, desmenuzadas, o 200 g sobrantes de pollo asado, desmenuzado","½ manojo pequeño de albahaca, con las hojas cortadas y cortadas, más unas cuantas hojas pequeñas para servir","½ pepino, picado","2 tomates secos en aceite, escurridos y cortados en rodajas","2 lechugas Little Gem, con las hojas separadas","2 cucharaditas de piñones tostados"]','["Ponga el cuscús en un recipiente grande resistente al calor y cúbralo con 100 ml de agua hirviendo. Agrega 1 cucharada de pesto. Tapar y dejar actuar 8 min.","Revuelva el cuscús con un tenedor y luego agregue el resto del pesto, el yogur y un poco de condimento. Agregue el pollo, la albahaca, el pepino y los tomates.","Vierta la mezcla de cuscús en las hojas de lechuga y cómala con los dedos, o sírvala sobre la lechuga como una ensalada. Esparce los piñones y más albahaca antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14640,4439,'es','Merluza ahumada, judías y verduras','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Asa filetes de pescado blanco y sírvelos encima de chorizo, frijoles cannellini y espinacas para una cena rápida que incluye 3 de tus 5 al día.','["aceite de oliva suave","Paquete de ½ x 200 g de chorizo ​​crudo para cocinar (usamos ahumado al aire libre desenterrado)","1 cebolla, finamente picada","260 g de espinacas en bolsa","2 x 140g filetes de merluza sin piel","½ cucharadita de pimentón dulce ahumado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y rallado","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas","jugo ½ limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","Mayonesa rápida de ajo (opcional) - ver receta en consejo"]','["Hierva una tetera llena de agua y caliente la parrilla a fuego alto. Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén grande. Exprime la carne del chorizo ​​directamente en la sartén. Agrega la cebolla y sofríe durante 5 minutos, triturando la carne con una espátula hasta que se deshaga, quede dorada y rodeada de su jugo. La cebolla también quedará tierna y dorada.","Mientras tanto, ponga las espinacas en un colador, vierta lentamente sobre el agua hervida para que se ablanden y luego páselas bajo el grifo de agua fría. Exprime el exceso de agua con las manos y luego reserva. Forrar una bandeja de horno con papel de aluminio, untar con un poco de aceite y colocar encima el pescado. Sazona, espolvorea por encima el pimentón ahumado y rocía con un poco más de aceite.","Echar la guindilla en la sartén con las salchichas, sofreír 1 min más, luego añadir las judías, las espinacas, el zumo de limón y el aceite de oliva virgen extra. Déjelo calentar suavemente y luego sazone al gusto.","Ase el pescado durante 5 minutos o hasta que esté escamoso pero no seco; no será necesario darle la vuelta. Vierta la mezcla de frijoles en platos, luego cubra con cuidado con el pescado y el jugo de la bandeja. Sirva con una cucharada de mayonesa rápida de ajo (ver receta a la derecha), si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14641,4441,'es','Ensalada de hummus y verduras asadas con menta','Combine verduras asadas con garbanzos y queso feta en esta ensalada de inspiración griega que proporciona 4 de sus 5 al día.','["4 chirivías, peladas y cortadas en gajos","4 zanahorias, cortadas en gajos","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","Paquete de 500 g de remolacha cocida (no en vinagre), escurrida y cortada en gajos","2 cucharadas de miel clara","hummus tarro 200g","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","manojo pequeño de menta, hojas recogidas","200 g de queso para ensalada estilo griego o feta"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle las chirivías, las zanahorias, las semillas de comino y los garbanzos con el aceite y un poco de condimento en una fuente para asar grande. Cocine durante 30 minutos, revolviendo a mitad de la cocción.","Agrega la remolacha al molde y rocía con la miel, luego regresa al horno por 10 minutos. Extienda el hummus en una fuente fina o divídalo en 4 platos. Cuando las verduras estén listas, rocíe con vinagre y mezcle en la lata. Coloque las verduras asadas encima del hummus, esparza la menta y el queso, rocíe con el jugo de la lata y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:03:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14642,4443,'es','Verduras asadas picantes y lentejas','Empaque un impresionante 3 de sus 5 al día con este plato vegetariano picante de lentejas relleno con calabaza asada, pimientos y cebollas.','["1 calabaza pequeña o mediana (aproximadamente 950 g/2 lb 2 oz)","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas gruesas","3 pimientos (una mezcla de rojo, naranja y amarillo de un paquete), sin semillas y cortados en tiras de 1 cm o ½ pulgada de ancho","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry","2 latas de 400 g de lentejas puy, escurridas y enjuagadas","150 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","un puñado grande de cilantro picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Con un cuchillo afilado, pelar la calabaza. Córtelo por la mitad a lo largo, quítele las semillas y luego córtelo en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor a lo ancho de la calabaza.","Coloque las rodajas de calabaza en una fuente grande para asar con la cebolla, los pimientos y el ajo. Mezclar el aceite con la pasta de curry y rociar sobre las verduras. Mezcle bien para cubrir con la mezcla de curry y sazone.","Ase durante 30 minutos hasta que las verduras comiencen a ablandarse. Añade las lentejas y el caldo a la fuente para asar y mezcla. Regrese al horno por 5-10 minutos más hasta que las verduras estén tiernas. Agrega el cilantro y sirve de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:03:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14643,4445,'es','Burritos de maratón','Si eres un aficionado a correr, consume comidas nutritivas que se adapten a tu programa de entrenamiento. Estas envolturas mexicanas que aumentan la energía son el alimento perfecto para el fitness','["300 g de arroz integral","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, picado","jugo 1 lima","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","2 cucharadas de comino molido","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno","1 cucharada de vinagre de sidra","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 tomates grandes, picados","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, picado","jugo 2 limones","2 aguacates, sin hueso y pelados","wraps de tortilla integral grandes, yogur natural, mitades de lima para exprimir y queso cheddar rallado (opcional)"]','["Pon el arroz en una cacerola mediana con 600ml de agua fría y una pizca de sal si quieres. Llevar a ebullición, luego bajar el fuego, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante unos 20 minutos hasta que se haya absorbido toda el agua. Apagar el fuego y dejar reposar otros 10 minutos. Revuelve el arroz y agrega el cilantro y el jugo de lima.","Para los frijoles negros, calienta el aceite en un sartén grande y agrega el ajo, el chipotle, el comino, el azúcar y el vinagre, y cocina todo por 1 min. Agregue los frijoles y los tomates, revuelva todo y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 20 minutos hasta que espese.","Para la salsa y el guacamole, mezcla los tomates con la cebolla, el cilantro, el jugo de lima y los condimentos. Vierta la mitad de la salsa en otro tazón y triture los aguacates para hacer guacamole. Envuelve todo junto en tortillas integrales calientes cubiertas con yogur natural, jugo de limón y queso rallado, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14644,4447,'es','Wraps de buñuelos de cordero y garbanzos','Las empanadas especiadas de cordero y garbanzos con yogur, cilantro y ensalada son el relleno perfecto para pan plano','["1 lata de 400 g y 1 lata de 210 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","1 huevo","Paquete de 250 g de carne magra de cordero","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","¼ cucharadita de canela molida","3 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","¼ de paquete pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 tortillas grandes","1 lechuga romana, rallada","4 tomates, rebanados","1 cebolla morada pequeña, en rodajas finas","Bote de 150g de yogur griego 0% grasa","chips de horno, para servir (opcional)"]','["En un procesador de alimentos, bate los garbanzos con el huevo durante unos minutos hasta casi un puré, pero quedan algunos pedacitos. Vierta en un tazón y agregue la carne picada, las especias, dos tercios del ajo, la guindilla y el cilantro. Sazone bien y forme 12 buñuelos pequeños.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y cocina los buñuelos en tandas durante 4 minutos por cada lado, hasta que estén crujientes por fuera y bien cocidos.","Cubra cada wrap con un buen puñado de lechuga rallada, tomate, cebolla morada y 3 buñuelos. Mezclar el yogur con el resto de los ajos y verter un poco sobre los buñuelos. Envuélvalo y métalo, con papas fritas a un lado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14645,4449,'es','Fajitas de champiñones con hummus de aguacate','Obtén cuatro de tus 5 al día de una sola vez gracias a estas tortillas con champiñones picantes, hummus de aguacate y cebollas asadas','["1 aguacate grande, sin hueso, pelado y picado","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","1 diente de ajo, machacado","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 tomates, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","1 cebolla morada, cortada en rodajas gruesas","2 champiñones planos grandes cortados en rodajas gruesas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de mezcla de especias para fajitas","4 tortillas","lechuga Little Gem rallada y salsa Tabasco, para servir (opcional)"]','["Coloque el aguacate, los garbanzos, el ajo, la ralladura de limón y el jugo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una consistencia grumosa. Vierta en un tazón, sazone y agregue los tomates.","Rocíe la cebolla y los champiñones con el aceite y espolvoree sobre el condimento para fajitas. Calienta una sartén a fuego alto y cocina la cebolla durante 2 minutos por cada lado, luego retírala de la sartén y mantenla caliente. Cocine los champiñones durante 2 minutos por cada lado o hasta que se ablanden y se doren en algunos lugares.","Extienda un poco de hummus de aguacate en el medio de cada envoltura y cubra con los champiñones y la cebolla. Añade lechuga rallada y un chorrito de Tabasco, si quieres, y termina."]','2026-01-11 13:03:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14646,4451,'es','Nachos más ligeros','Reduzca la grasa de este plato mexicano para compartir con algunos cambios simples. Nuestros chips de tortilla están cubiertos con frijoles y salsa.','["5 tortillas de maíz suaves","1½ cucharadita de aceite de colza","1 chile jalapeño, sin semillas, cortado en tiras finas","100 g de mozzarella rallada","2 cucharadas de crema fresca media grasa","½ paquete pequeño de hojas de cilantro, picadas","2 aguacates medianos maduros, partidos por la mitad, sin hueso, pelados y picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de jugo de lima","2 cebolletas, con las puntas cortadas y finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado","unas gotas de salsa tabasco","Lata de 400 g de judías rojas, escurridas y enjuagadas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","¼ cucharadita de chile en polvo suave o mediano","¼ cucharadita de comino molido","4 tomates, sin semillas, finamente picados","¼ de cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 cucharada de jugo de lima","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Para cada tortilla, unte ambos lados con un poco de aceite y córtela en 12 gajos. Repetir. Coloque todos los trozos en 2 bandejas para hornear grandes y hornee durante unos 10 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Retirar y reservar. Sube el horno a 200C/180C/gas 6.","Para el guacamole, ponga los aguacates picados en un bol y tritúrelos con un tenedor, manteniendo algo de textura. Agregue el jugo de limón, las cebolletas, el cilantro y sazone con Tabasco y el condimento. Dejar de lado.","Para los frijoles, viértalos en un tazón, agregue el ajo, el chile y el comino en polvo, tritúrelos con un tenedor y luego mezcle con aproximadamente 2 cucharadas de agua, o lo suficiente para hacer un puré. Sazone y reserve.","Para la salsa, combine los tomates, la cebolla, el ajo, el jugo de limón y el aceite. Sazone y reserve.","Diez minutos antes de que esté listo para servir, esparza los chips de tortilla sobre una bandeja para hornear grande o una fuente resistente al horno. Coloque los frijoles en pequeños montículos sobre las papas fritas, luego vierta sobre la salsa (si la salsa se preparó con anticipación, use una espumadera para dejar cualquier líquido de tomate que pueda ablandar las papas fritas). Esparcir sobre el chile jalapeño y la mozzarella.","Hornee durante 4-5 minutos, el tiempo suficiente para derretir el queso y calentar las cosas, pero sin dorar demasiado los chips de tortilla. Retirar y verter sobre la crème fraîche y espolvorear con cilantro, y poner el guacamole en 1 o 2 platos pequeños a un lado. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:03:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14647,4453,'es','Curry de verduras de invierno con raita afrutada','Utilice vegetales de raíz resistentes en este recipiente para especias de inspiración asiática. Usamos calabaza, zanahorias y chirivías, combinadas con tomates.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas, en rodajas finas","½ calabaza, zapallo de invierno o calabacín, cortado en cubos","4 zanahorias, cortadas en bastones","2 chirivías, cortadas en bastones","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry (o alternativa sin gluten)","8 tomates maduros grandes, 2 cortados en gajos","6 dientes de ajo, pelados","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y picado","cilantro en paquete pequeño, picado","200 g de arroz basmati integral","6 cucharadas de yogur natural desnatado","100 g de mangos, cortados en cubos","1 cucharada de chutney de mango","paquete pequeño de almendras laminadas tostadas"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande con tapa. Agregue las cebollas y cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que estén suaves. Agregue la calabaza, las zanahorias y las chirivías y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que comiencen a ablandarse. Agrega la pasta de curry y cocina por otros 3 minutos.","En un bol, mezcle los tomates enteros, el ajo y el jengibre hasta que quede suave, luego vierta sobre las verduras y agregue 200 ml de agua. Guarde un puñado de cilantro para servir y agregue el resto. Coloque la tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 40 minutos o hasta que las verduras estén tiernas. Destape, revuelva con los gajos de tomate y reduzca hasta espesar la salsa.","Mientras tanto, cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mezcla el yogur, el mango y el chutney en un bol pequeño. Coloca el arroz en una fuente para servir y esparce el curry con el cilantro restante y las almendras. Sazone y sirva junto con el arroz y el yogur de frutas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14648,4455,'es','Bandeja de espinacas, ricota y pollo al horno','Esta saludable cena de pollo viene con pimientos asados, calabacines, cebollas y tomates (cuatro de los cinco alimentos recomendados al día).','["3 x bolsas de espinacas tiernas","4 cucharadas de ricota","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","un poco de nuez moscada","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","50 g de pan rallado fresco, sazonado","3 calabacines, cortados en bastones","2 pimientos, rebanados","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos, con las raíces intactas","250 g de tomates cherry en rama","4 dientes de ajo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner las espinacas en un colador grande y verter sobre 1-2 teteras de agua hirviendo para que se ablanden. Deje escurrir durante unos minutos y luego exprima la mayor cantidad de agua posible. Picar, poner en un bol y añadir la ricota, la ralladura de limón, la nuez moscada y abundante condimento.","Con un cuchillo afilado, haga un corte en el costado de cada pechuga de pollo y use los dedos para hacer un pequeño bolsillo. Vierta la mezcla en las 4 pechugas. Frote con 2 cucharaditas de aceite y presione el pan rallado encima, luego coloque el pollo en una fuente para asar.","Pon las verduras en otra bandeja y rocía con el aceite restante y sazona bien. Hornee el pollo y las verduras durante unos 30 minutos, revolviendo las verduras una vez. Retirar cuando el pollo esté bien cocido y el pan rallado esté dorado.","Retire el ajo ablandado de las verduras y tritúrelo con el jugo de limón, luego revuelva con las verduras asadas y sirva con el pollo."]','2026-01-11 13:03:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14649,4457,'es','Pittas de huevo y verduras','Mezcle bolsitas de pan integral con berenjena, remolacha y zanahoria saludables, luego agregue yogur con ajo y eneldo y huevos.','["1 berenjena, cortada en rodajas gruesas","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de harissa","2 huevos","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharaditas de néctar de agave o azúcar en polvo dorada","1 remolacha cruda, rallada","1 zanahoria grande, pelada y cortada en juliana","½ cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en rodajas muy finas","4 cucharadas de yogur griego 0% grasa","1 cucharada de eneldo picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 panes pita integrales"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Poner las rodajas de berenjena en una bandeja para horno, sazonar, untar con aceite y hornear durante 15 minutos. Voltear, untar con la harissa y hornear por otros 5 minutos.","Mientras tanto, coloque con cuidado los huevos en una cacerola con agua hirviendo, baje el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Pasar por agua fría para que se enfríe, pelar y reservar.","En un bol, mezcle el vinagre y el agave o el azúcar con un poco de condimento, luego agregue la remolacha, la zanahoria y la cebolla. En otro bol, mezcle el yogur, el eneldo, el ajo y los condimentos. Tostar las pitas y partirlas por la mitad. Cortar los huevos en rodajas y ponerlos dentro de las pittas con las rodajas de berenjena picantes y un poco de ensalada de remolacha. Vierta el yogur y sirva con el resto de la berenjena, la ensalada y el yogur a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:03:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14650,4459,'es','Pimentón de champiñones','Esta salsa vegetariana está aromatizada con alcaravea, pimentón y perejil. Sirva sobre pasta o patatas asadas.','["½ cucharadita de semilla de alcaravea","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","300 g de taza de champiñones, cortados en cuartos","1 pimiento verde grande, sin semillas y cortado en trozos","2 cucharaditas de pimentón dulce ahumado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 pastilla de caldo de verduras (o alternativa sin gluten)","4 cucharadas de crema agria","perejil picado (opcional)","pasta, patatas asadas para microondas o pan de ajo crujiente, para servir"]','["¿Calentar un salteado grande? sartén o wok, añadir las semillas de alcaravea y tostar ligeramente al fuego durante unos segundos. Agregue el aceite, luego agregue la cebolla, los champiñones y el pimiento, y sazone bien (la sal ayudará a extraer la humedad de los champiñones). Cocine, revolviendo con frecuencia, durante unos 6-8 minutos hasta que las verduras se ablanden y la cebolla comience a dorarse.","Agrega el pimentón a las verduras, vierte los tomates, el caldo y media lata de agua y deja cocinar durante 5 minutos. Cubra las porciones con crema agria y perejil, si lo usa, y sirva con pasta, papas asadas o pan con ajo."]','2026-01-11 13:03:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14651,4461,'es','Ensalada de quinua, calabaza y brócoli','Combine este grano saludable con ingredientes vegetarianos. El queso feta, las semillas de calabaza, los arándanos, el perejil y la calabaza son una delicia.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","175 g de trozos de calabaza congelada","140 g de brócoli, con los tallos cortados en rodajas y la parte superior cortada en floretes pequeños","1 cucharada de hoja de tomillo fresco","Paquete de 250g de quinoa roja y blanca lista para comer","2 cucharadas de perejil picado","25 g de arándanos secos","un puñado de semillas de calabaza (opcional)","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Calentar el aceite en un wok con tapa, agregar la cebolla y el ajo y sofreír durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden, luego retirar del wok con una espumadera. Añade la calabaza, revuelve en el wok hasta que empiece a tomar color y luego añade el brócoli. Espolvoree 3 cucharadas de agua y el tomillo, cubra la sartén y cocine al vapor durante unos 5 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas.","Mientras tanto, vierte la quinua en un bol y revuélvela. Agregue el perejil, los arándanos, las semillas (si las usa), la cebolla y el ajo cocidos y el vinagre balsámico y mezcle bien. Mezcle las verduras con el queso feta. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante 2 días."]','2026-01-11 13:03:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14652,4463,'es','Empanadas de garbanzos con ensalada de zanahoria y pasas','Estas hamburguesas vegetarianas con harissa se sirven con una ensalada crujiente de berros, calabacines y rábanos con un aderezo ligero.','["Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 huevo grande","1 cucharada de almendra molida","2 cucharaditas de harissa","1 cucharadita de comino molido","3 cucharadas de perejil picado","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza, para freír","1 cucharada de pasas","1 zanahoria, cortada en tiras con un pelador","1 calabacín, cortado en tiras con un pelador","5 rábanos, en rodajas finas","2 puñados de una bolsa de berros, rúcula y espinacas","1 cucharadita de aceite de cáñamo o colza y vinagre de vino blanco o rodajas de limón (opcional)"]','["Vierta los garbanzos, el ajo, el huevo, las almendras, la harissa y el comino en un bol y mezcle con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Agrega el perejil. Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y verter la mezcla en 8 cucharadas grandes, espaciadas. Cocine durante 5 minutos por cada lado.","Para la ensalada, mezcle las pasas y todas las verduras, pero no aderece con aceite y vinagre hasta que esté a punto de comer. Si va a trabajar, agregue una rodaja de limón para exprimir en lugar del aderezo."]','2026-01-11 13:03:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14653,4467,'es','Tazón de chili de carne y frijoles con yogur de chipotle','El chile con carne se rellena con una mezcla saludable de frijoles aromatizados con pasta de chile ahumado.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","Paquete de 250 g de carne picada extra magra","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle, más un poco más para servir","1 cucharada de mezcla de condimentos cajún","2 latas de 400 g de ensalada mixta de frijoles, escurrida","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 pastilla de caldo de res bajo en sodio","2 cuadritos de chocolate negro 70% cacao","cilantro en paquete pequeño, picado","arroz integral cocido y yogur griego bajo en grasa, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén y cocina la cebolla a fuego medio hasta que se ablande. Agrega la carne con un poco de pimienta negra y un poco de sal, rompiendo los grumos con una cuchara de madera y cocina hasta que se dore. Agrega el chipotle y el condimento cajún. Revuelva bien y cocine por 1 minuto más.","Vierta los frijoles y los tomates y luego desmenúcelos sobre el cubo de caldo. Agregue una lata de agua y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 20-30 minutos, hasta que espese. Agrega el chocolate y revuelve hasta que se derrita, luego agrega la mayor parte del cilantro.","Sirve el chile en tazones encima del arroz espolvoreado con el resto del cilantro, con una cucharada de yogur bajo en grasa y un chorrito extra de pasta de chipotle encima."]','2026-01-11 13:03:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14654,4469,'es','Pisto para congelar','Prepare una tanda de nuestra saludable mezcla de verduras y luego sírvala de tres maneras: con queso feta, como se muestra en la imagen, con patatas asadas o con pimientos rellenos.','["250 g de cebollas moradas, cortadas en trozos de 3 cm","250 g de cebollas blancas, cortadas en trozos de 3 cm","600 g de pimientos rojos y amarillos; después de quitarles las semillas y los tallos, córtelos en trozos","1 kg de calabacín cortado en trozos de 3 cm","1 kg de berenjena","20 g de dientes de ajo machacados","800 g de tomates cherry","3 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de azúcar","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharadita de tomillo u orégano seco, más una pizca extra","1 cucharada de pan rallado integral","25 g de queso feta ligero","30 g de hojas de lechuga Little Gem","25 g de cebolletas en rodajas","50 g de pepinos en rodajas","chorrito de jugo de limón","1 patata pequeña para asar de 100 g","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado","25 g de yogur griego sin grasa","10 g de hojas de rúcula","chorrito de jugo de limón","2 pimientos pequeños de cualquier color","25 g de queso cheddar maduro más ligero","200 g de brócoli cocido","20 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEsparcir las cebollas en una fuente para asar,\r\nsazone y ase durante 25 minutos, revolviendo\r\nocasionalmente, hasta que se queme y se ablande.\r\nRepita con los pimientos durante 20 minutos,\r\nluego el calabacín durante sólo 15 minutos.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente. Cortar el\r\nberenjenas en rodajas de 2-3 cm de grosor y\r\ndisponer en la sartén (solo corta lo que\r\npuede caber en su sartén a la vez – cocinar\r\nLas rebanadas recién cortadas en lotes deben\r\nevitar que se doren). cocinar más\r\na fuego alto hasta que se queme por ambos lados,\r\nluego retírela y colóquela en un plato apto para microondas.\r\nRepita en tandas hasta que todos estén bien.\r\ncrujiente y dorado. Cubrir el plato\r\ncon film transparente, hacer un par de agujeros,\r\nLuego cocine las berenjenas en el microondas a temperatura alta.\r\ndurante unos 5 minutos hasta que esté suave. Puede que necesites\r\npara hacer esto en lotes. Cuarto las rebanadas,\r\no cortar en trozos. (Porque eres\r\nfreír sin aceite, se queman antes\r\nestán bien cocidos, por lo que terminar en\r\nun microondas es ideal. Si no tienes\r\nuno, solo agrega a la salsa para el final\r\n10-15 minutos a fuego lento, pero es posible que\r\nromper un poco.)","Mientras asas las verduras, pon el ajo.\r\nen la sartén antiadherente o en una sartén grande\r\ncon un vaso pequeño de agua. Cocine a fuego lento hasta\r\nel agua casi se ha acabado, luego vierta en el\r\ntomates cherry y picados, azúcar,\r\nvinagre y mucho condimento. cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 20 minutos hasta que espese y esté picante.\r\nProbar para sazonar, luego apagar y\r\ncombinar con las verduras. Dejar enfriar, dividir en\r\n10 porciones y congelar.","Para servir como verduras griegas horneadas con queso feta (para 1 persona, prepare 10 minutos, cocine 15 minutos): revuelva las hierbas en 1 porción descongelada.\r\npisto y verter en un plato pequeño.\r\nEspolvorea con pan rallado y luego agrega\r\nqueso feta con una pizca\r\nmás hierbas. Hornear a\r\n200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 durante 15 minutos si\r\ndescongelado o 25-30 minutos congelado.\r\nMezcle las hojas de Baby Gem\r\ncon cebolleta,\r\njugo de pepino y limón. Servir con el horneado. Por ración: 236 kcal, proteínas 13 g, carbohidratos 34 g, grasas 5 g, grasas saturadas 3 g, fibra 10 g, azúcar 20 g, sal 1,0 g","Para servir como chaquetas de chile vegetarianas (para 1 persona, preparar 5 minutos, cocinar aproximadamente 1 hora): Hornee las papas en el horno. Agrega algunos\r\ncucharadas de agua en una cacerola con semillas de comino y chile en polvo.\r\nCocine a fuego lento y justo antes del agua.\r\nse evapora, agregue 1 porción de descongelado\r\nratatouille. Calienta bien y luego agrega el cilantro.\r\nCortar la papa por la mitad y cubrir con chile vegetal.\r\ny yogur griego. Servir con hojas de rúcula aliñadas\r\ncon jugo de limón. Por ración: 270 kcal, proteínas 14 g, carbohidratos 50 g, grasas 3 g, grasas saturadas 0 g, fibra 12 g, azúcar 20 g, sal 0,4 g","Para servir como pimientos rellenos con queso (para 2 personas, preparar 15 minutos, cocinar 20 minutos): Cortar los pimientos por la mitad, bajar los tallos y raspar.\r\ncualquier semilla. Divida 1 porción de\r\npisto descongelado entre\r\nlas mitades de pimiento. Rallar sobre queso cheddar y luego hornear durante 15 a 20 minutos a\r\n200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Servir con\r\nbrócoli y espinacas mezclados\r\ncon vinagre balsámico.Por ración: 173 kcal, proteínas 12 g, carbohidratos 21 g, grasas 4 g, grasas saturadas 2 g, fibra 10 g, azúcar 20 g, sal 0,4 g"]','2026-01-11 13:03:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14655,4471,'es','Ensalada de gambas, aguacate y soja','La combinación de mariscos, cilantro, salsa de chile dulce y pepino es ganadora en esta ensalada verde llena de delicias.','["85 g de soja congelada","85 g de langostinos cocidos y pelados","2 cucharaditas de salsa de chile dulce","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva virgen extra","½ aguacate maduro pequeño, deshuesado, pelado y cortado en trozos pequeños","¼ de pepino, picado en trozos pequeños","paquete pequeño de hojas de cilantro","paquete pequeño de hojas de ensalada baby"]','["Cocer las habas de soja en una sartén.\r\nde agua hirviendo durante 2-3 minutos hasta que\r\ntierno, luego escurrir y enfriar bajo\r\nagua fría. Mezclar los langostinos con\r\nla guindilla dulce y la ralladura de lima.\r\nBatir el aceite, la lima\r\njugo y algo de condimento\r\npara hacer un aderezo.","Mezclar la soja, el aguacate,\r\npepino y cilantro. verter\r\nsobre el aderezo y revuelva\r\nabrigo. Cubra con las gambas y\r\nhojas de ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:03:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14656,4473,'es','cuscús 5 al día','Rebecca Roberts sirve calabacín asado, zanahorias, cebolla morada, tomates y champiñones con cuscús y pollo en esta receta para uno.','["1 calabacín mediano, cortado en trozos pequeños","1 zanahoria mediana, cortada en trozos pequeños","1 cebolla morada mediana, cortada en gajos","85 g de champiñones cortados en cuartos","un puñado de tomates cherry (unos 8)","2 dientes de ajo, pelados","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","½ cucharadita de pimentón","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile seco","2 muslos de pollo con hueso y con piel","50 g de cuscús","½ paquete pequeño de perejil o menta, picado en trozos grandes","rocíe salsa de chile dulce (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPon las verduras y el ajo en una bandeja para hornear.\r\nbandeja. Sazone bien, rocíe con 1 cucharada de aceituna\r\naceite y mezclar hasta que todo esté cubierto.","Espolvorea las especias y un poco\r\nsazonar los muslos de pollo,\r\nluego frote la piel y la carne. llovizna\r\nun poco de aceite sobre la piel y colocar la\r\nmuslos entre las verduras. asado en el\r\nHornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que las verduras\r\nestán empezando a estar crujientes y el pollo está\r\nbien cocido.","Unos 10 minutos antes del pollo.\r\ny las verduras están listas, poner el\r\ncuscús en un bol y solo tapar\r\ncon agua hirviendo, cubrir con film transparente\r\nfilmar y dejar reposar durante 5 minutos.","Pasa el cuscús con un tenedor para separarlo.\r\nlos granos. Mezcle las verduras y\r\nperejil o menta en el cuscús, sazone y luego transfiera a un plato para servir.\r\nCubra con el pollo y rocíe sobre\r\nsalsa de chile dulce, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:03:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14657,4475,'es','gordo','Esta ensalada clásica del Medio Oriente es una guarnición ligera y crujiente o un relleno para la lonchera: está espolvoreada con zumaque, menta y perejil.','["2 tomates, picados en trozos","¼ de pepino, sin semillas y rebanado","½ cebolla morada, rebanada","1 cabeza pequeña de lechuga romana, rallada","un puñado de hojas de menta, picadas en trozos grandes","un puñado de hojas de perejil, picadas en trozos grandes","2 panes pita","1 cucharadita de zumaque","½ diente de ajo machacado","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","jugo ½ limón"]','["La noche anterior, mezcla toda la ensalada.\r\ningredientes excepto el pan pita y el zumaque.\r\nPrepara el aderezo y sazona al gusto. salir\r\nestos se separan hasta la mañana.","A la mañana siguiente, tuesta los panes pita hasta que\r\nligeramente dorado. Cuando esté frío, córtelo en pedazos y\r\ncombine con la ensalada y el aderezo. Vierta en\r\n2 cajas de plástico y espolvorear sobre el zumaque."]','2026-01-11 13:03:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14658,4479,'es','Ensalada de chimichurri de frijoles negros','Esta sencilla ensalada de legumbres de despensa, apta para el almuerzo, está aderezada con chimichurri, una salsa sudamericana de perejil, cilantro y chile.','["Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","1 tomate, picado en trozos grandes","¼ de cebolla morada, picada en trozos grandes","½ aguacate, picado","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado en trozos","un puñado grande de cilantro","un puñado grande de perejil","2 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","½ diente de ajo, picado en trozos grandes","¼ cucharadita de chile en polvo","¼ cucharadita de comino molido"]','["Batir todos los ingredientes del chimichurri en\r\nuna licuadora o el tazón pequeño de un procesador de alimentos,\r\nhasta que se combinen. Sazone al gusto y reserve.","En un bol o recipiente de plástico mezcle todo\r\nlos ingredientes de la ensalada. Rocíe sobre el aderezo,\r\no manténgalo separado en un frasco pequeño para revolver\r\nla ensalada justo antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 13:03:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14659,4485,'es','Tomates asados ​​harissa con cuscús','Condimente el versátil cuscús con menta, perejil y almendras y luego sírvalo con tomates asados ​​condimentados con chile y salsa de yogur con ajo.','["12 tomates pera grandes, cortados por la mitad","1 cucharada de harissa","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 cebollas, en rodajas muy finas","4 cucharadas de yogur estilo griego","1 cucharada de pasta de tahini","1 diente de ajo, machacado","200 g de cuscús","½ paquete pequeño de menta, picada en trozos grandes","½ paquete pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","50 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle\r\nlos tomates en harissa y 2 cucharadas de\r\naceite. Sazone y extienda en una fuente para asar,\r\ncon el lado cortado hacia arriba y hornee durante 40-45 minutos.","Calentar el aceite restante en una sartén grande.\r\nsartén. Vierta las cebollas y chisporrotee durante un\r\nun par de minutos. Baja el fuego,\r\nsazone y cocine por 15 minutos o hasta\r\ndorado y caramelizado. En un bol mezclar\r\nel yogur, el tahini y el ajo con un poco\r\ncondimento. Dejar de lado.","Vierta el cuscús en un tazón grande.\r\nVierta sobre 400 ml de agua hirviendo. Portada\r\ncon film transparente y dejar reposar\r\n10 minutos o hasta que toda el agua haya sido\r\nabsorbido. Pasa las hierbas con un tenedor,\r\nalmendras, garbanzos y la mitad de la cebolla.\r\nCubra con los tomates y el resto.\r\ncebollas y sirva con una cucharada de\r\nsalsa de yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:03:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14660,4487,'es','Horneado de berenjenas y lentejas en capas','Las lentejas Puy completan este horneado vegetariano bajo en calorías con queso mozzarella, salsa de tomate y albahaca y berenjenas asadas.','["2 berenjenas cortadas en rodajas de ½ cm a lo largo","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","140 g de lentejas puy","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","300 g de calabaza cocida","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","½ paquete pequeño de hojas de albahaca","125 g de bola de mozzarella, desmenuzada"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nCepille ambos lados de las rodajas de berenjena.\r\ncon 2 cucharadas de aceite, poner a hornear\r\nhojas, sazonar y hornear durante 15-20 minutos.\r\nhasta que estén tiernos, volteándolos una vez. Cocine el\r\nlentejas siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Calentar el aceite restante en una sartén grande.\r\nsartén. Agregue las cebollas y el ajo y cocine.\r\nhasta que esté suave. Revuelva la calabaza y el\r\ntomates, más ½ lata de agua. Cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n10-15 minutos hasta que la salsa espese.\r\nAgrega las lentejas, la albahaca y los condimentos.","Coloque una capa de lentejas en un recipiente pequeño\r\nfuente para hornear. Cubra con rodajas de berenjena\r\ny repetir, terminando con una capa de\r\nberenjena. Espolvorear con mozzarella y\r\nhornee por 15 minutos más hasta que\r\nel queso está dorado y burbujeante."]','2026-01-11 13:03:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14661,4489,'es','Curry de pollo y boniato','Este condimento indio aromatizado con pasta de korma es lo suficientemente suave para los niños; la batata lo estira un poco más','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla, picada","450 g de muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos pequeños","Pasta Korma tarro 165g","2 dientes de ajo machacados","500 g de batatas, cortadas en trozos pequeños","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","100 g de espinacas tiernas","arroz basmati, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén, agregar la cebolla y\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante unos 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que se ablanden. Aumenta ligeramente el fuego,\r\nagregue los trozos de pollo y dore.","Agregue la pasta de curry y el ajo.\r\ncocinar durante 2 minutos antes de agregar\r\n100ml de agua, las batatas\r\ny tomates picados. Cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n20-30 minutos hasta que el pollo esté cocido\r\nbien y el boniato está tierno\r\n– añade un chorrito más de agua si empieza a hervir\r\nlucir seco. Sazone al gusto y agregue el\r\nespinacas, retirando la sartén del fuego\r\ny revolviendo hasta que las espinacas se ablanden.\r\nServir con arroz basmati."]','2026-01-11 13:03:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14662,4491,'es','Fajitas de boniato al horno','Los vegetarianos no deben perderse el placer de las tortillas: usamos pimientos, cebollas y batatas cubiertas con queso feta y crema agria.','["2 batatas grandes","1 cebolla","2 cebollas rojas","1 pimiento rojo grande, sin semillas","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra o vino blanco","30 g de sazonador para fajitas en sobre","8 tortillas pequeñas","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, picado","½ bote pequeño de crema agria baja en grasa","lechuga iceberg pequeña, rallada","100 g de queso feta bajo en grasa, desmenuzado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPicar las verduras en gajos gruesos y\r\nmezcle en un tazón grande con el aceite, el vinagre\r\ny condimento para fajitas. Organizar en un solo\r\ncoloque una capa en una bandeja para hornear grande y cocine\r\ndurante 40 min, dando vuelta a la mitad.","Mientras tanto, caliente los wraps siguiendo\r\ninstrucciones del paquete. Una vez que las verduras estén\r\ncocido, espolvorear con cilantro, luego enrollar\r\nenvueltos con una cucharada de agrio\r\nnata, un poco de lechuga y desmenuzada\r\nqueso feta encima."]','2026-01-11 13:03:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14663,4493,'es','Desmoronamiento del huerto','¿Tienes exceso? Utilice la generosidad de esta temporada para hornear este magnífico pudín: elegimos ciruelas, higos, manzanas y moras.','["400 g de manzanas peladas, sin corazón y cortadas en trozos pequeños","400 g de ciruelas deshuesadas, cortadas en gajos gruesos","2 cucharadas de azúcar, cualquier tipo","300 g de higos, con los tallos leñosos recortados y cortados en cuartos","300 g de moras o zarzas, bien lavadas","crema, natillas o helado, para servir","140 g de harina común","140 g de harina integral","175 g de mantequilla, cortada en trozos pequeños","100 g de azúcar moreno blando"]','["Primero haz la cobertura. Pon el\r\nharinas en un bol con una pizca de sal,\r\nluego frota la mantequilla con tu\r\nyemas de los dedos para formar migajas. Revuelva\r\nen el azúcar con un tenedor, y\r\nenfríe hasta que sea necesario.","Caliente el horno a 180C/ventilador de 160C/\r\ngas 4. Incline las manzanas, ciruelas\r\ny azúcar en un vaso grande\r\ncacerola con 50ml de agua\r\ny cocine, revolviendo, durante\r\nunos 5 minutos, hasta que\r\nlas manzanas son suaves y\r\njugoso. Agregue los higos\r\ny moras, y\r\nVierta en una fuente para hornear.\r\nDispersarse sobre el\r\ndesmenuzar y hornear\r\ndurante 45-55 minutos\r\nhasta la cobertura\r\nes dorado y el\r\nla fruta está burbujeando."]','2026-01-11 13:03:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14664,4495,'es','Berenjenas rellenas al estilo italiano','Olvídate de los pimientos rellenos y sirve a tus invitados vegetarianos este sofisticado plato de berenjenas rellenas.','["2 berenjenas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","12 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","50 g de aceitunas verdes deshuesadas y picadas","un puñado de hojas de albahaca, picadas","125 g de mozzarella vegetariana en bolas, cortada en trozos pequeños","un puñado de pan rallado blanco fresco"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nCortar las berenjenas por la mitad a lo largo,\r\ndejando el tallo intacto. Usando un pequeño\r\ncuchillo, cortar un borde dentro de cada berenjena\r\nalrededor de ½-1 cm de espesor. Usando una cucharadita,\r\nSaque la pulpa de la berenjena, para que\r\nque tienes 4 conchas. Cepilla estos\r\ncon un poco de aceite, sazonar y colocar\r\nen una fuente para horno. Cubrir con papel de aluminio y\r\nhornee por 20 minutos. Picar la carne y\r\nlugar a un lado.","Mientras tanto, agregue el aceite restante.\r\na una sartén antiadherente. Punta en la cebolla\r\ny cocine hasta que esté suave. Agrega el picado\r\npulpa de berenjena y cocine bien. consejo\r\nen el ajo y los tomates y cocinar\r\ndurante 3 minutos más. Agregue las aceitunas, la albahaca,\r\nmozzarella y condimentos.","Cuando las cáscaras de berenjena estén tiernas,\r\nRetirar del horno y reducir el fuego.\r\na 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Relleno de pila\r\nen conchas, espolvorear con pan rallado\r\ny rociar con un poco más de aceite. hornear\r\ndurante 15-20 minutos, hasta que el queso esté\r\npegajoso y el pan rallado está dorado.\r\nServir con una ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 13:03:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14665,4499,'es','Curry de coco y maíz','Disfrute de este curry calentito de coco y maíz para disfrutar de una comida fácil y sin carne para dos. Llena de cálidas especias, es una cena vegana rápida y reconfortante.','["150 g de lentejas rojas","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, finamente cortada","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rebanado, y más para servir","1 cucharada de cúrcuma","1 cucharada de curry en polvo (verifique que no contenga gluten si es necesario)","250 g de maíz tierno, cortado por la mitad en diagonal","110 g de yogur de coco, más algo extra para servir","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Pon las lentejas en un colador y enjuágalas hasta que el agua salga limpia. Ponga el aceite en una cacerola a fuego medio, agregue la cebolla y cocine por 8 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agregue el jengibre, la cúrcuma y el curry en polvo y cocine por un minuto más hasta que esté fragante. Agrega las lentejas.","Vierta 400 ml de agua caliente y lleve a ebullición. Baje el fuego a medio y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta que se haya absorbido la mayor parte del agua. Añade el maíz tierno y 100 ml de agua, tapa y continúa cocinando a fuego lento durante 5-10 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén suaves y el maíz todavía tenga un poco de mordisco. Agrega el yogur de coco para calentar, pero no dejes que hierva. Sirva cubierto con más yogur de coco, si lo desea, y espolvoree hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:03:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14666,4501,'es','Avena con plátano durante la noche','Prepare esta sencilla avena nocturna hecha con plátanos, mantequilla de nueces y almendras para un delicioso desayuno. Preparados la noche anterior, son ideales para mañanas ocupadas.','["2 plátanos, pelados","100 g de gachas de avena","¼ cucharadita de canela molida, más una pizca para servir","1 cucharada de jarabe de arce","300ml de leche de tu elección, más un chorrito","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní o de almendras, más extra para servir","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas o picadas","2-4 cucharadas de yogur natural, para servir (opcional)"]','["Triture 1 plátano en un bol con un tenedor hasta que quede suave. Agrega la avena, la canela, el jarabe de arce, la leche y la mantequilla de maní. Mezcle bien, luego cubra y enfríe durante la noche.","A la mañana siguiente, remueve la papilla, añadiendo otro chorrito de leche si la mezcla está bastante espesa. Dividir en dos tazones. Corta el plátano restante en rodajas y espárcelo sobre la papilla, rocía con más mantequilla de nueces y espolvorea sobre las almendras. Cubra con cucharadas de yogur, si lo usa, y espolvoree con una pizca más de canela antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14667,4503,'es','Ensalada picante de clementina, pavo y maní','Utilice las sobras de Navidad de forma inteligente con esta ensalada saludable y picante, que aprovecha al máximo los restos de pavo, las clementinas sobrantes y los cacahuetes.','["200 g de frijoles edamame congelados","2 limas, ralladas y en jugo","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja ligera","2 cucharaditas de miel","¼ de col lombarda (unos 220 g), finamente rallada","1 pimiento rojo, en rodajas finas","200 g de sobras de pavo o pollo cocido, desmenuzado","manojo pequeño de cilantro (o use menta o una mezcla), hojas recogidas","4 clementinas, peladas y cortadas en rodajas","50 g de maní, tostado y picado en trozos grandes"]','["Cocine el edamame en una cacerola pequeña con agua hirviendo durante 2-3 minutos. Escurrir, luego enjuagar con agua corriente fría y escurrir nuevamente.","Combine la ralladura y el jugo de lima, la mantequilla de maní, la salsa de soja, la miel y un poco de condimento en un tazón grande para hacer un aderezo, agregando un chorrito de agua si es necesario para aflojar. Agregue el edamame, el repollo rallado, el pimiento en rodajas y el pavo desmenuzado al tazón y mezcle todo hasta que esté bien cubierto.","Coloque la ensalada en un plato y luego espolvoree con las rodajas de cilantro y clementina. Mézclalos suavemente con la ensalada con ensaladas, teniendo cuidado de no romper demasiado la fruta. Esparza los cacahuetes justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14668,4507,'es','Sopa de miso y nueces','Haga que el almuerzo sea más emocionante con esta sedosa y profundamente sabrosa sopa de miso y nueces. Ofreciendo todos sus cinco al día, también está lleno de bondad','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla grande, picada","400 g de calabaza, con piel y cortada en trozos","2 dientes de ajo, picados","Lata de 210 g de judías con mantequilla, escurridas","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras","80 g de col rizada rallada y finamente picada","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo tostadas","2 cucharaditas de jengibre finamente rallado","1 cucharada de miso de arroz integral"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y fríe la cebolla durante 5 minutos para que se ablande. Agrega la calabaza y el ajo y revuelve por un minuto. Agrega los frijoles y el caldo junto con un litro de agua, luego tapa y cocina a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que la calabaza esté tierna.","Mientras tanto, cocine la col rizada al vapor durante 10 minutos y luego mezcle con el aceite de sésamo, las semillas y el jengibre.","Agregue el miso a la sopa, luego mezcle hasta que quede suave con una batidora de mano. Vierta en tazones y cubra con la mezcla de col rizada y sésamo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14669,4509,'es','Bocaditos de muffin de huevo al pesto','Prepare estos bocados de muffins de huevo con pesto y queso feta para el desayuno, la merienda o como parte de una cesta de picnic. Sencillos de hacer, ¡a los niños les encantarán!','["spray para cocinar bajo en calorías, para la lata","18 tomates cherry, en cuartos","80 g de queso feta o de cabra, desmenuzado","6 huevos medianos","30ml de leche","2 cucharadas de pesto (revisa la etiqueta si eres vegetariano)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Rociar un molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con aceite en aerosol. Divida los tomates uniformemente entre los agujeros y cubra cada uno con alrededor de 2 cucharaditas de queso feta o de cabra.","Rompe los huevos en un tazón grande, luego agrega la leche, el pesto y el condimento y bate para combinar. Vierta la mezcla uniformemente en cada hoyo.","Hornea por 20 minutos o hasta que el huevo esté cuajado. Dejar enfriar durante 2-3 minutos en el molde, luego retirar y dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 13:03:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14670,4517,'es','Pimientos asados ​​con huevos ''mermelada'' y aderezo de almendras y perejil','Prepare un almuerzo rápido con pimientos asados ​​con huevos tiernos, servidos con aderezo de almendras y perejil. Disfruta con pan crujiente','["20 g de almendras blanqueadas, picadas","1 manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado","1 diente de ajo grande, finamente picado","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico blanco o vinagre de jerez","7 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","8 huevos medianos","250 g de pimientos rojos asados ​​de un frasco, escurridos y cortados en tiras de pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Haga el aderezo machacando las almendras, el perejil, el ajo y un poco de condimento con un mortero y un mortero. Quieres crear una mezcla ligeramente espesa. Agrega el vinagre y el aceite de oliva, batiendo suavemente a medida que avanzas. Gusto por el condimento, teniendo en cuenta que el aderezo puede quedar bastante fuerte al echarlo sobre los huevos.","Hervir una cacerola con agua, agregar los huevos y cocinar durante 7-8 minutos. Esto le dará lo que algunas personas llaman huevos \"con mermelada\": son lo suficientemente firmes como para considerarse duros y el centro todavía está un poco blando. Pon los huevos en agua fría y luego pélalos tan pronto como estén lo suficientemente calientes como para manipularlos. Corta los huevos por la mitad y colócalos en un plato para servir. Sazone, luego coloque los pimientos alrededor de los huevos y vierta el aderezo por encima. Se come con un buen pan crujiente, mientras los huevos aún están calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:03:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14671,4519,'es','Kedgeree fácil','Una versión minimalista del kedgeree, esta sencilla pero deliciosa receta de cinco ingredientes también es baja en grasas y calorías.','["2 cucharadas de curry en polvo de tu elección (nosotros usamos madrás)","300 g de arroz basmati","600 ml de caldo de pollo","400 g de eglefino ahumado sin piel","100 g de guisantes congelados"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Calentar una cacerola refractaria o una cacerola ignífuga a fuego medio y tostar el curry en polvo durante 1 min. Agrega el arroz para cubrirlo con el curry en polvo y luego vierte sobre el caldo. Llevar a ebullición y luego colocar el eglefino encima. Cubrir. Cocinar en el horno durante 30 min.","Retirar con cuidado del horno. Déjelo reposar por un minuto, luego revuelva con los guisantes mientras rompe el eglefino y esponja el arroz. Sazone al gusto y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:03:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14672,4521,'es','Pollo horneado en bandeja con limón y hierbas, frijoles mantecosos y gajos de papa','Prepare esta versátil bandeja horneada para una abundante comida familiar. Saciante y repleta de ingredientes sabrosos y sencillos, esta es la mejor comida económica en su máxima expresión.','["800 g de patatas","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","4 dientes de ajo, picados","400 g de tomates en lata","2 latas de 400 g de alubias, escurridas","2 cucharaditas de hierbas secas mixtas","1 kg de muslos de pollo con piel y hueso","1 limón, cortado en rodajas"]','["Corta las patatas en trozos grandes y luego revuélvelas bien en un tazón grande con 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y un poco de sal. Extienda las rodajas en una bandeja para hornear.","Freír la cebolla y el ajo en el aceite de oliva restante a fuego lento hasta que estén tiernos y traslúcidos. Agregue los tomates, los frijoles y un poco de condimento. Cocine a fuego lento durante unos minutos y luego vierta en un molde o fuente para horno.","Mezclar una pizca de sal con las hierbas. Rellene cantidades iguales debajo de la piel de cada muslo de pollo. Coloque una rodaja de limón encima de cada muslo y luego colóquela encima de la mezcla de tomate y frijoles en el molde para hornear.","Hornee los gajos y la bandeja de pollo en el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 durante 45 minutos hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Revise las patatas después de unos 30 minutos, agitándolas en la bandeja; dependiendo del tamaño de los gajos, es posible que ya estén bien cocidas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14673,4523,'es','Salsa verde de salmón con ensalada de garbanzos triturados','Sirva esta saludable salsa verde de salmón con ensalada de garbanzos triturados, col rizada y pimiento rojo asado para una comida rápida y nutritiva entre semana.','["3 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","2 filetes de salmón con piel","manojo pequeño de perejil","1/2 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","1 chalota, finamente picada","1/2 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","2 pimientos rojos asados ​​de un frasco, picados","50 g de col rizada"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Batir 1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva con la ralladura de naranja, un chorrito de jugo y un poco de condimento. Coloque los filetes de salmón con la piel hacia abajo en una bandeja para hornear antiadherente y vierta sobre la marinada. Dejar marinar a temperatura ambiente.","Ponga el perejil, la mostaza de Dijon, la mitad de la chalota picada, el vinagre de vino tinto, 1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva y el jugo de naranja restante en un procesador de alimentos pequeño y mezcle hasta obtener una salsa espesa, agregando un chorrito de agua para aflojar si es necesario.","Calentar 1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva en una sartén y sofreír el resto de la chalota picada durante 5 minutos. Agrega los garbanzos y sazona. Sube el fuego y revuelve hasta que los garbanzos estén crujientes. Triture y agregue los pimientos rojos asados ​​y la col rizada. Agrega un chorrito de agua y tapa hasta que la col rizada se ablande. Manténgase caliente. Ase el salmón durante 4-6 minutos hasta que esté cocido a su gusto. Divida el puré en platos y cubra con el salmón y la salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:03:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14674,4525,'es','Sopa de zanahoria y chirivía','Prepare una tanda de sopa cremosa de chirivía y zanahoria para un almuerzo o cena caliente. Sírvelo con pan crujiente y congela las sobras que tengas para los días ajetreados.','["½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","½ manojo pequeño de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","3 zanahorias grandes, peladas y picadas en trozos grandes","2 chirivías grandes, peladas y picadas en trozos grandes","1 litro de caldo de verduras","100ml de nata doble","¼ manojo de perejil finamente picado (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande y fríe la cebolla y el apio durante 10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que se ablanden. Si empiezan a prenderse, añade un pequeño chorrito de agua. Agrega el ajo, el tomillo y ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra y cocina por 2 minutos. Añade las zanahorias, las chirivías y el caldo y deja hervir. Reduzca a fuego lento y cocine durante 20 minutos hasta que las verduras estén suaves, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Licue con una batidora hasta que quede suave. Agregue la crema y mezcle nuevamente hasta que se combinen, luego pruebe para sazonar. Para servir, sirva en tazones y esparza un poco de perejil picado, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14675,4529,'es','Hummus de judías blancas con remolacha encurtida y col rizada','Haga un poco de hummus casero y cubra con remolacha en escabeche y col rizada para que sea más especial. Es ideal para un buffet o como entrante o acompañamiento de crudités.','["600 g de remolacha cocida, cortada en cubos pequeños","200 ml de aceite de oliva, más 2 cucharadas y más para rociar","100 ml de vinagre de vino tinto","2 chalotes, pelados y finamente picados","2 hojas de laurel","1 limón, ralladura pelada en tiras y exprimida","2 latas de 400 g de judías verdes o judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","140 gramos de yogur natural","3 dientes de ajo, 2 machacados, 1 rebanado","150 g de col rizada rallada"]','["Mezclar la remolacha, 100 ml de aceite, el vinagre, las chalotas, el laurel y la ralladura de limón. Sazone, cubra y enfríe durante la noche.","Coloca los frijoles en un procesador de alimentos con el jugo de limón, el yogur, el ajo machacado, 100 ml de aceite y un poco de condimento. Mezcle hasta que quede suave y agregue un chorrito de agua para aflojar si es necesario.","Calienta las 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén grande y fríe el ajo laminado durante 1-2 minutos. Agrega la col rizada y un chorrito de agua, luego revuelve y fríe durante 8 a 10 minutos más hasta que la col rizada esté de color verde oscuro y los tallos tiernos. Agregue un chorrito más de agua si es necesario para marchitar la col rizada. Escurre la mezcla de remolacha y agrega la col rizada hasta que esté bien caliente. Retirar del fuego.","Vierta la salsa de frijoles en un tazón grande, luego vierta sobre la mezcla de remolacha y col rizada. Rocía un poco más de aceite de oliva y sirve el hummus a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 13:03:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14676,4535,'es','Pasta cremosa con pesto de edamame y ensalada de rúcula','Prepare una comida familiar económica con nuestra rápida y fácil pasta con pesto de edamame. Use espaguetis integrales para agregar fibra si lo prefiere','["300 g de espaguetis","350 g de frijoles edamame congelados, sin cáscara","50ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","50 g de anacardos","2 dientes de ajo","50 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, más extra para servir","90 g de hojas de rúcula"]','["Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, coloque el edamame congelado en un bol, vierta 2 cucharadas de agua y cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante unos 5 minutos. Dejar en el agua tapado durante 2 minutos más. Alternativamente, cocine a fuego lento el edamame en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 2-3 minutos.","Para hacer el pesto, ponga 150 g de edamame, el aceite, los anacardos, el ajo, el parmesano y un poco de condimento en la mezcla y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave. Puede agregar hasta 6 cucharadas de agua para ayudar a que se mezcle si la mezcla está demasiado espesa.","Una vez que la pasta esté cocida, agregue el pesto y el resto del edamame, luego sirva con la rúcula a un lado y una ralladura extra de queso, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14677,4541,'es','Ensalada de quinoa, queso de cabra y melocotón','Prepare esta ensalada de quinua, acelgas, queso de cabra y durazno asado inspirada en el tabulé como algo diferente para el almuerzo. Está lleno de texturas y sabores frescos.','["200 g de quinua","100 g de acelgas finamente ralladas","4 melocotones o nectarinas, sin hueso, 2 en cuartos y 2 en rodajas finas","1-2 limones, exprimidos","4-5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","50 g de avellanas, picadas en trozos grandes","25 g de perejil, hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","25 g de menta, con las hojas recogidas y finamente picadas, más hojas de menta adicionales para servir","4 cucharadas de alcaparras, escurridas","2 cucharadas de zumaque (opcional)","1-2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","100 g de queso de cabra tierno, desmenuzado","2-3 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo tostadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y cocinar la quinua siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir, mezclar con las acelgas y dejar enfriar y marchitar.","Ponga los melocotones en rodajas en un bol, rocíelos con el jugo de limón y reserve. Pon los melocotones cortados en cuartos en una bandeja para horno. Mezcle con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva. Ase durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté suave. Esparce las avellanas en una segunda bandeja para hornear y tuesta en el horno durante los últimos 5 minutos hasta que estén doradas.","Combine la mezcla de quinua, las hierbas, los duraznos en rodajas y el jugo del tazón, las alcaparras, el zumaque (si lo usa), el vinagre y el aceite restante. Estación. Colóquelo en un plato grande para servir y cubra con los melocotones asados, el queso de cabra, las avellanas, las semillas de sésamo y las hojas extra de menta."]','2026-01-11 13:03:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14678,4543,'es','Curry de frijoles','Una receta de rescate para cuando no hay nada en la nevera, o cuando te apetece algo barato, rico y saciante','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente picado","1 paquete pequeño de cilantro, los tallos finamente picados y las hojas trituradas aproximadamente","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de pimentón molido","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes en agua.","arroz basmati cocido, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-bajo. Añade la cebolla y una pizca de sal y cocina lentamente, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que se ablande y empiece a tomar color. Agregue los tallos de ajo, jengibre y cilantro y cocine por 2 minutos más, hasta que estén fragantes.","Agregue las especias a la sartén y cocine por 1 minuto más, momento en el cual todo debería oler aromático. Vierta los tomates picados y los frijoles en el agua y luego déjelos hervir.","Baje el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta que el curry esté agradable y espeso. Sazone al gusto y sirva con el arroz basmati y las hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:03:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14679,4547,'es','Curry de coliflor, paneer y guisantes','Esta receta fácil de curry vegetariano, lista en menos de una hora, hecha con queso indio frito y verduras, también es económica de preparar.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","Paquete de 225 g de paneer, cortado en cubos","1 cabeza de coliflor, partida en floretes pequeños","2 cebollas, en rodajas gruesas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharadas colmadas de pasta tikka masala","500 g de puré de cartón","200 g de guisantes congelados","cilantro en paquetes pequeños, picado en trozos grandes","arroz basmati o pan naan, para servir","raita o tu chutney favorito, para servir"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande, agregar el paneer y sofreír hasta que esté crujiente. Retirar con una espumadera y reservar. Agrega el aceite restante y la coliflor a la sartén y cocina durante 10 minutos hasta que se dore. Añade las cebollas y un poco más de aceite si es necesario y cocina durante 5 minutos más hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo y la pasta de curry, luego vierta la passata y 250 ml de agua y sazone. Deje hervir a fuego lento, luego cubra y cocine durante 18 a 20 minutos o hasta que la coliflor esté tierna.","Agregue los guisantes congelados y el paneer crujiente a la sartén y cocine por 5 minutos más. Revuelva la mayor parte del cilantro y decore con el resto. Sirva con arroz basmati o pan naan, raita o su chutney favorito."]','2026-01-11 13:03:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14680,4549,'es','Pasteles indios de batata y dhal','El dhal de lentejas rojas especiadas se cubre con puré cremoso de batata en estos pasteles vegetarianos individuales: una opción económica para cenar entre semana','["650 g de batatas, peladas y cortadas en trozos pequeños","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 zanahorias, lavadas, cortadas por la mitad y cortadas a lo largo","15 g de jengibre, finamente rallado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 cucharaditas de aceite","1 cucharada de curry en polvo","1 cubito de caldo de verduras","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","85 g de lentejas rojas","un buen puñado de cilantro picado y unas ramitas para servir","cucharada generosa de yogur estilo griego 0% grasa","brócoli, para servir (opcional)"]','["Coloque la batata en una olla con agua hirviendo y cocine por 15 minutos o hasta que esté tierna.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén y sofreír la cebolla y la zanahoria, por 2 minutos, luego agregar el ajo y el jengibre y cocinar, revolviendo por 1 min más. Vierta el curry en polvo, revuelva la sartén y luego agregue 750 ml de agua hirviendo con la pastilla de caldo, el puré de tomate y las lentejas. Tapa la cacerola y deja hervir durante 20 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas y el líquido se haya absorbido. Agrega el cilantro picado.","Cuando los boniatos estén cocidos, escurrirlos y triturarlos con el yogur y el condimento.","Vierta la mezcla de lentejas en uno o dos platos individuales grandes, luego cubra con la mezcla de batata, espolvoree con cilantro y sirva con brócoli, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14681,4551,'es','Tazón de desayuno de frutas y nueces','Gachas de avena saludables y económicas con naranjas frescas picadas, yogur griego y una pizca de frutos secos, nueces y semillas','["6 cucharadas de gachas de avena","2 naranjas","poco menos de ½ tarrina de 200 ml de yogur estilo griego sin grasa","60 g de pasas, nueces, bayas de goji y semillas"]','["Pon la avena en una sartén antiadherente con 400 ml de agua y cocínala al fuego, revolviendo ocasionalmente durante unos 4 minutos hasta que espese.","Mientras tanto, corta la cáscara y la médula de las naranjas y luego córtalas por la mitad, cortando cada lado, lo más cerca posible de donde estaría el tallo, ya que esto eliminará una sección bastante dura de la membrana. Ahora sólo pica las naranjas.","Vierta la papilla en tazones, vierta el yogur y luego agregue las naranjas y la mezcla de frutas, nueces y semillas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14682,4553,'es','Baps de huevo y tomate','Rellene panecillos integrales con tomates jugosos y una tortilla de hierbas para un desayuno o brunch abundante pero económico','["2 tomates, partidos por la mitad","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","4 huevos","un par de ramitas de perejil picado","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","2 bollos integrales"]','["Unte el lado cortado de los tomates con un poco de aceite y luego cocínelos a fuego lento, con el lado cortado hacia abajo en una sartén pequeña antiadherente. Mientras se cocinan, bate los huevos con el condimento y el perejil picado en un bol pequeño. Voltee los tomates para calentarlos brevemente por el otro lado y luego reserve.","Limpia la sartén, luego agrega el aceite restante y cocina el ajo a fuego medio durante unos segundos, revolviendo todo el tiempo hasta que se ablande. Vierta la mezcla de huevo y cocine, revolviendo ocasionalmente sobre el fuego. Una vez que esté casi listo, dale la vuelta para cocinar el otro lado durante unos segundos más.","Cortar por la mitad los baps y aplastar los tomates, cortar en cuartos la tortilla y servir, 2 trozos dentro de cada bap."]','2026-01-11 13:03:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14683,4555,'es','Pilaf de pollo, edamame y jengibre','Prepare esta saludable olla de arroz para una cena a mitad de semana, repleta de fibra y vitamina C','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","3 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos pequeños","250 g de arroz basmati","600 ml de caldo de verduras","100 g de edamame o soja congelados","hojas de cilantro y yogur griego sin grasa (opcional), para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana,\r\nluego agrega la cebolla, el jengibre y la guindilla,\r\njunto con un poco de condimento. cocinar para\r\n5 minutos, luego agrega el pollo y el arroz.\r\nCocine por 2 minutos más, luego agregue el\r\ncaldo y llevar a ebullición. Gire el\r\ncalentar a fuego lento, tapar y cocinar durante\r\n8-10 minutos hasta que el arroz esté cocido.\r\nDurante los últimos 3 minutos de cocción,\r\nagrega los frijoles edamame. espolvorear\r\nunas hojas de cilantro encima y\r\nsirva con una cucharada de yogur griego,\r\nsi quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:03:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14684,4557,'es','Sopa de lentejas rojas, garbanzos y guindilla','Vuelve a casa con un plato caliente lleno de esta abundante sopa baja en grasa.','["2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","una pizca grande de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, picada","140 g de lentejas rojas partidas","850 ml de caldo de verduras o agua","Lata de 400 g de tomates, enteros o picados.","200 g de garbanzos en cartón o ½ lata, enjuagados y escurridos (congelar los sobrantes)","manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes (guarde algunas hojas para servir)","4 cucharadas de yogur griego 0%, para servir"]','["Calentar una cacerola grande y sofreír los\r\nsemillas de comino y hojuelas de chile durante 1 min,\r\no hasta que empiecen a saltar por la sartén\r\ny liberar sus aromas. Añade el aceite y\r\ncebolla y cocine por 5 minutos. Agregue el\r\nlentejas, caldo y tomates, luego traer\r\na ebullición. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta que\r\nlas lentejas se han ablandado.","Batir la sopa con una batidora\r\no en un procesador de alimentos hasta que quede áspero\r\nhacer puré, verter nuevamente en la sartén y agregar\r\nlos garbanzos. Calentar suavemente, sazonar bien\r\ny agregue el cilantro. Terminar con\r\nuna cucharada de yogur y hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:03:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14685,4559,'es','Musaca baja en grasas','Un clásico griego rico y reconfortante sin calorías, ¿a quién no le encanta?','["200 g de pimientos congelados en rodajas","3 dientes de ajo machacados","200 g de carne picada extra magra","100 g de lentejas rojas","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco, más un poco más para espolvorear","Cartón de puré de 500 ml","1 berenjena cortada en rodajas de 1½ cm","4 tomates, cortados en rodajas de 1 cm","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","25 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","Bote de 170g de yogur griego 0% grasa","nuez moscada recién rallada"]','["Cocine los pimientos suavemente en una olla grande.\r\nsartén antiadherente durante unos 5 minutos – el agua\r\nde ellos debería evitar que se peguen. Añadir\r\nel ajo y cocinar por 1 min más, luego\r\nagregue la carne, partiéndola con un tenedor, y\r\ncocine hasta que se dore. Vierta las lentejas, la mitad del\r\norégano, la passata y un chorrito de agua.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén\r\ntierno, agregando más agua si es necesario.","Mientras tanto, calienta la parrilla a temperatura media.\r\nDisponer las rodajas de berenjena y tomate.\r\nen una bandeja para hornear antiadherente y untar con\r\nel aceite. Espolvorea con el orégano restante.\r\ny un poco de condimento, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 1-2 minutos\r\ncada lado hasta que esté ligeramente carbonizado; puede\r\nNecesito hacer esto en lotes.","Mezclar la mitad del parmesano con el yogur y\r\nalgún condimento. Divida la mezcla de carne\r\nentre 4 fuentes pequeñas para horno y la parte superior\r\ncon la berenjena cortada en rodajas y el tomate.\r\nVierta sobre la cobertura de yogur y espolvoree.\r\ncon el extra de orégano, parmesano y\r\nnuez moscada. Ase durante 3-4 minutos hasta que burbujee.\r\nSirva con una ensalada, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14686,4561,'es','Puré de patatas con berros','El puré cremoso mezclado con verduras saludables es un acompañamiento sencillo y bajo en grasa que también es económico','["650 g de patatas harinosas cortadas en trozos","100ml de leche","25 g de mantequilla","Bolsa de 170g de berros"]','["Cocine las patatas en una cacerola grande de\r\nagua con sal durante 15 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos.\r\nEscurrir bien y luego volver a la sartén para\r\nsecar al vapor durante unos minutos antes de triturar.","Apartar las patatas a un lado y\r\nagrega la leche y la mantequilla al otro lado\r\nde la sartén. Calentar suavemente hasta que la mantequilla\r\nse derrita, luego agregue las papas con\r\nlos berros y un poco de condimento."]','2026-01-11 13:03:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14687,4563,'es','Sopa de cangrejo y maíz dulce','Esta sopa baja en grasa está llena de sabor y es muy sencilla de cocinar.','["1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 puerro, las partes verde y blanca separadas y cortadas en rodajas","2 zanahorias, picadas","850 ml-1 litro/1½ pintas - 1¾ pintas de caldo de pollo o de verduras bajo en sodio","1 papa grande, cortada en cubitos","175 g/ 6 oz de maíz dulce congelado","Lata de 170 g de carne de cangrejo blanca, escurrida","4 cucharadas de crema fresca ligera","1 cucharadita de cebollino picado"]','["Poner la cebolla, la parte blanca del puerro.\r\ny zanahorias en una cacerola grande y verter\r\nunas cucharadas de caldo. Cocine sobre un\r\nfuego medio durante unos 10 minutos, revolviendo\r\nregularmente hasta que esté suave. Añade un chorrito más\r\ncaldo si las verduras empiezan a pegarse.","Añade la patata, el puerro verde y la mayor parte\r\ndel caldo y cocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos,\r\nhasta que la patata esté tierna. Consejo en el\r\ncarne de maíz dulce y cangrejo, luego cocinar\r\ndurante 1-2 minutos más. Quitar del\r\ncalentar y agregar la crème fraîche y\r\nalgún condimento. Añade el resto del\r\ncaldo si la sopa está demasiado espesa. espolvorear\r\ncon el cebollino y servir con dorar\r\npan, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:03:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14688,4565,'es','Batatas y frijoles al horno','Una cena súper saludable que es perfecta para una noche ocupada entre semana. Intente preparar el doble de frijoles y congelarlos para la próxima vez.','["4 batatas pequeñas","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado, más un poco más para servir","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","un chorrito de salsa Worcestershire (la salsa Lancashire es una opción vegetariana)","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles mezclados en agua, escurridos","400 g de tomates picados","4 cucharadas de crema agria ligera, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPerforar las batatas unas cuantas veces.\r\ncon un tenedor, luego cocínalos en el\r\nmicroondas a temperatura alta durante 8 minutos o hasta\r\nsuave. Frote con 1 cucharadita de pimentón, 1 cucharadita\r\ndel aceite y un poco de condimento. Transferir\r\na una bandeja para horno, meter al horno y cocinar\r\ndurante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté crujiente.","Mientras tanto, haz los frijoles. cocinar\r\nla cebolla en el aceite restante hasta\r\nsuave. Agrega el ajo, el azúcar, el vinagre,\r\nsalsa inglesa y el resto\r\npimentón y cocine por 1-2 minutos más.\r\nhasta que esté pegajoso. Agregue los frijoles y los tomates.\r\ny un chorrito de agua, y dejar cocer a fuego lento hasta\r\nLas batatas están listas.","Sirve las batatas con el\r\nfrijoles encima, una cucharada de crema agria\r\ny una pizca de pimentón, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:03:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14689,4569,'es','Tostadas de frijoles negros con salsa de aguacate','Para mejorar rápidamente la salud de los vegetales, prepare esta cena rápida con sabrosas tortillas de maíz, que son un muy buen cambio con respecto a las tortillas de harina.','["8 tortillas de maíz (búscalas cerca de los otros wraps o junto a la comida mexicana)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","3 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de comino molido","5 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","3 cucharadas de miel clara","3 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, enjuagados y escurridos","elija algunos ingredientes: tomates picados, cebolla morada en rodajas, aguacate cortado en cubitos, pimientos jalapeños en rodajas, ramitas de cilantro","crème fraîche o salsa chipotle Tabasco, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPincelar las tortillas con un poco de aceite.\r\ny colocar en una sola capa al hornear.\r\nhojas. Cocine durante 8 minutos hasta que esté crujiente.","En una sartén grande, calentar el resto\r\naceite. Agrega la cebolla y el ajo y cocina.\r\ndurante 5 min. Añade las especias, el vinagre y\r\ncariño. Cocine por 2 minutos más. Añade el\r\nfrijoles y condimentos, y calentar bien.","Retirar del fuego y triturar\r\nfrijoles suavemente con el dorso de la cuchara\r\nhasta obtener un puré con trozos. Untar unos frijoles\r\nsobre las crujientes tortillas de maíz, esparcir\r\ncon los ingredientes que elijas y agrega un\r\ncucharada de crème fraîche para enfriar, o\r\nun chorrito de chipotle Tabasco para darle sabor."]','2026-01-11 13:03:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14690,4571,'es','Curry de lentejas amarillas y coco con coliflor','Este curry vegetal saludable es apto para la dieta y es una excelente fuente de hierro y fibra.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente picado","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry (usamos pasta de curry Bart Veeraswamy Gujurat Masala)","200 g de lentejas amarillas enjuagadas","1½ litro de caldo de verduras","3 cucharadas de coco rallado sin azúcar, más algo extra para espolvorear si lo deseas","1 coliflor, partida en pequeños floretes","arroz basmati cocido y hojas de cilantro, además de chutney de mango y pan naan (opcional), para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande, luego\r\nagrega la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre. cocinar\r\ndurante 5 minutos, agregue la pasta de curry, luego\r\nsofreír durante 1 minuto antes de agregar las lentejas,\r\ncaldo y coco. trae la mezcla\r\nhasta que hierva y cocine a fuego lento durante 40 minutos o\r\nhasta que las lentejas estén blandas.","Durante los últimos 10 minutos de cocción, revuelva\r\nen la coliflor para cocinar. Vierta el arroz en\r\n4 tazones, cubrir con curry y espolvorear\r\ncon hojas de cilantro y coco si\r\ncomo. Servir con chutney de mango y naan.\r\npan (opcional)."]','2026-01-11 13:03:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14691,4573,'es','Sopa de cebolla caramelizada y cebada con picatostes de queso','La cebada nutritiva y con sabor a nuez agrega sustancia real a esta versión de la clásica sopa de cebolla francesa','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas medianas, en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","6 ramitas de tomillo, picadas","buena pizca de azúcar","500 ml de caldo de verduras","60 g de cebada","60 g de cavolo nero o col rizada, sin los tallos gruesos y las hojas cortadas en rodajas","4 rebanadas de baguette, tostadas","4 cucharadas de queso gruyere rallado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola, luego agregar\r\nla cebolla, el ajo, el tomillo, el azúcar y un\r\nbuena pizca de sal. Cocine a fuego medio-bajo\r\ncalentar durante 15-20 minutos o hasta que esté dorado\r\ncoloreado. Agregue el caldo y cocine a fuego lento durante\r\notros 10 minutos.","En una cacerola grande aparte con sal\r\nagua hirviendo, cocer la cebada durante 15 minutos,\r\nagregando el cavolo nero o kale para el\r\nÚltimos 3 minutos de cocción. Escurrir y enjuagar\r\nbajo agua fría, luego agregue a la sopa\r\ny calentarse.","Calienta la parrilla. Cubra el pan tostado\r\ncon queso y colocar bajo el grill hasta\r\nestá burbujeante y derretido. Servir en 2 grandes\r\ntazones con los picatostes con queso encima."]','2026-01-11 13:03:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14692,4575,'es','Gachas de canela con plátano y frutos rojos','Comience el día de una manera súper saludable con avena y fruta fresca que aumentan la energía','["100 g de gachas de avena","½ cucharadita de canela, más un poco más para servir","4 cucharaditas de azúcar demerara","450 ml de leche desnatada","3 plátanos, en rodajas","400 g de fresas en canastilla, peladas y cortadas por la mitad","Bote de 150g de yogur natural sin grasa"]','["En una cacerola mediana,\r\nmezclar la avena, la canela, el azúcar, la leche\r\ny la mitad de los plátanos en rodajas. traer\r\nhasta que hierva, revolviendo ocasionalmente.\r\nBajar el fuego y cocinar.\r\ndurante 4-5 minutos, revolviendo todo el tiempo.","Retirar y dividir entre\r\n4 tazones, cubrir con el resto\r\nplátano, fresas, una cucharada de\r\nyogur y una pizca de canela."]','2026-01-11 13:03:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14693,4577,'es','Col tierna con semillas de mostaza','Dale a tus verduras un aspecto nuevo y fresco mezclándolas con mostaza, jengibre, cebolla y ajo.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de semilla de mostaza","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente cortada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","500 g/1 libra 2 oz de col tierna, rallada"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén, luego cocinar el\r\nsemillas de mostaza hasta que estén fragantes y\r\nempezando a estallar. Agrega la cebolla, el ajo y\r\njengibre, luego sofreír hasta que esté dorado. Consejo en el\r\nrepollo y revuelva para cubrir con las especias,\r\nluego cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Temporada\r\ny servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:03:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14694,4579,'es','Pasta cremosa con espárragos y guisantes','Toma cinco ingredientes y prepara esta sencilla cena de fusilli de vegetales verdes para dos, además consume 3 de tus 5 al día.','["250 g de fusilli o tu forma de pasta favorita","300 g de espárragos, sin las puntas leñosas y cortados en trozos","175 g de guisantes congelados","ralladura y jugo de ½ limón","100 g de queso tierno con cebollino"]','["Cocine la pasta siguiendo el paquete.\r\ninstrucciones. Dos minutos antes del final\r\ndel tiempo de cocción, agregar los espárragos\r\ny guisantes. Hervir todo junto para\r\núltimos 2 minutos, luego saque y reserve\r\nuna taza del líquido de cocción de la sartén\r\nantes de escurrir la pasta y las verduras.","Regrese la pasta y las verduras a la sartén.\r\ny añadir la ralladura de limón, el queso tierno y\r\ncondimento. Agrega un chorrito de jugo de limón\r\nal gusto y agregue 2-3 cucharadas de la cocción\r\nlíquido para soltar la salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:03:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14695,4581,'es','Espaguetis al limón con atún y brócoli','15 minutos es todo lo que necesitas para preparar esta pasta de pescado fresca, ligera y saludable con aceitunas, alcaparras y verduras.','["350 g de espaguetis","250 g de brócoli, cortado en floretes pequeños","2 chalotes, finamente picados","85 g de aceitunas verdes deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad","2 cucharadas de alcaparras, escurridas","Lata de 198g de atún en aceite.","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar"]','["Hervir los espaguetis en agua con sal.\r\ndurante 6 min. Agrega el brócoli y\r\nhervir durante 4 minutos más o hasta que ambos\r\nson simplemente tiernos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle las chalotas, las aceitunas,\r\nalcaparras, atún y ralladura y zumo de limón\r\nen un tazón espacioso para servir. Escurrir la pasta\r\ny brócoli, agregue al tazón y revuelva\r\nmuy bien con el aceite de oliva y mucho\r\npimienta negra. Servir con un poco más\r\nrociado con aceite de oliva."]','2026-01-11 13:03:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14696,4587,'es','Wraps de pavo y cebolleta','Date un capricho bajo en grasa con estas tortillas de sándwich súper rápidas: una manera fabulosa de aprovechar las sobras de pavo','["2 cucharadas de mayonesa baja en grasa","2 cucharadas de pesto","4 hojas de lechuga rizada","250 g de pavo cocido y desmenuzado","6 cebolletas, ralladas","Pepino en trozos de 12 cm, rallado","4 tortillas de harina"]','["Mezclar la mayonesa y el pesto. Divida las hojas de lechuga, el pavo, las cebolletas y el pepino entre las tortillas. Rociar con el aderezo de pesto, enrollar y comer."]','2026-01-11 13:03:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14697,4591,'es','Frittata inglesa completa con frijoles ahumados','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta saludable tortilla horneada con ingredientes clásicos para freír es lo suficientemente versátil para el brunch o la cena.','["2 salchichas bajas en grasa, en rodajas","4 lonchas de tocino extra magro, sin grasa, picado","Paquete de 150 g de champiñones, partidos por la mitad o más grandes en cuartos","8 claras de huevo, o utilizar 350 ml de claras de huevo líquidas de un cartón","3 cucharadas de leche","140 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","2 latas de 400 g de alubias cocidas reducidas en sal y azúcar","1½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","cebollino en manojo pequeño, cortado en tiras"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Línea\r\nuna fuente para asar del tamaño de una hoja A4\r\ncon suficiente papel para hornear para cubrir\r\nla base y los lados. Freír las salchichas y\r\ntocino en una sartén antiadherente hasta que esté dorado,\r\nrevolviéndolos con frecuencia para evitar que se peguen.\r\nVierta en la lata.","Vuelve a poner la sartén al fuego y fríe.\r\nlos champiñones durante unos 5 minutos hasta que\r\ndorados, luego agrégalos a la bandeja también.\r\nBatir las claras con la leche y\r\nmucho condimento. Vierta en la lata, luego\r\nsalpique los tomates encima.","Hornee en el horno durante 20-25 minutos, hasta que\r\nconjunto. Mientras tanto, vierte los frijoles en una sartén.\r\ncon el pimentón y calentar bien.\r\nEsparcir la frittata con el cebollino y\r\nsirva con los frijoles a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:03:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14698,4593,'es','Albóndigas de pavo al horno con brócoli y patatas crujientes','La carne picada de pavo es la más magra de su tipo y queda excelente enrollada en bolas y servida con salsa de tomate y verduras.','["1 cebolla rallada","1 zanahoria grande, rallada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de hojas de romero, picadas","Paquete de 350 g de carne picada de pavo","4 patatas grandes, con piel y cortadas en cubos pequeños","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry.","2 cucharadas de parmesano rallado","350 g de brócoli de tallo fino","manojo de hojas de albahaca, ralladas"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nEn un tazón grande, combine la cebolla,\r\nzanahoria, la mitad del ajo y la mitad del\r\nromero con el pavo y un poco\r\ncondimento. Forme 16 albóndigas\r\ny poner en una bandeja para hornear pequeña. tirar\r\nlas patatas con el ajo restante,\r\nromero y el aceite, colocar en una fuente para hornear\r\nbandeja, luego cocine ambos durante 20 minutos, con\r\nlas patatas en el estante superior.","Después de 20 minutos, escurra el jugo del\r\nalbóndigas, verter encima los tomates cherry,\r\nespolvorear con el parmesano y sazonar.\r\nMezcle las patatas y colóquelas en el fondo.\r\nestante con las patatas encima. cocinar para\r\nOtros 20 minutos hasta que las patatas estén\r\ncrujiente y la salsa de albóndigas burbujea.","Cuando las patatas y las albóndigas estén\r\ncasi listo, cocina el brócoli durante 3-4\r\nminutos, hasta que estén tiernos. Espolvorea la albahaca\r\nencima de las albóndigas y servir con el\r\npatatas crujientes y brócoli."]','2026-01-11 13:03:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14699,4595,'es','Tagliatelle con ragú de verduras','Esta salsa vegetariana estilo boloñesa queda excelente si se sirve con pasta y mermeladas en tres de sus cinco comidas al día.','["1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","2 zanahorias, cortadas en cubitos","4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate y vinagre balsámico","250 g de verduras cortadas en cubitos, como calabacines, pimientos y champiñones","50 g de lentejas rojas","2 latas de 400g de tomates picados con albahaca","250 g de tallarines (o tu pasta favorita)","2 cucharadas de parmesano rallado (opcional)"]','["Incorpora la cebolla, el apio y las zanahorias.\r\nuna cacerola antiadherente grande y agregue\r\n2-3 cucharadas de agua o caldo, si tienes\r\nalgunos. Cocine suavemente, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta\r\nlas verduras están suaves.","Añade el ajo, el puré de tomate y\r\nvinagre balsámico, cocinar a fuego alto durante\r\n1 minuto más, agregue las verduras picadas, las lentejas,\r\ntomates y luego llevar a ebullición.","Lleve a fuego lento y cocine durante aproximadamente\r\n20 minutos. Mientras tanto, cocine la pasta.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escurrir.\r\nSazona el ragú y sírvelo con pasta.\r\ny queso parmesano encima, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:03:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14700,4599,'es','Ensalada de guisantes y soja con eneldo fresco','Una ensalada ligera y primaveral que combina de maravilla con pescados o carnes a la brasa','["200 g de guisantes y de soja congelados","un puñado pequeño de eneldo, las hojas picadas y unas ramitas adicionales para servir","1½ cucharada de aceite","1 cucharada de vinagre de jerez","1 cucharadita de mostaza integral","1 cucharadita de miel clara"]','["Cocer los guisantes y la soja en\r\nHervir agua con sal durante 3-4 minutos hasta que\r\nsimplemente tierno. Escurrir y luego dejar pasar por agua fría.\r\nagua hasta que esté completamente frío.","Mientras tanto, haz el aderezo. Mezclar\r\ntodos los ingredientes juntos, sazonar, luego\r\nrevuelva hasta que esté bien combinado. Mezcle los frijoles\r\ny guisantes en el aderezo con el troceado\r\neneldo y esparza sobre las ramitas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14701,4601,'es','Trigo bulgur con ajo y hierbas','Esta ensalada de verano es una guarnición abundante para un picnic o una barbacoa, y además es baja en grasas.','["200 g de trigo bulgur","175 g de guisantes congelados","6 cucharadas de aceite de ajo","jugo 1 limon","un puñado de hierbas, como (menta, perejil, cebollino), picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Cocine el trigo bulgur en agua hirviendo con sal.\r\nagua durante 15 minutos o hasta que estén tiernas, agregando\r\nlos guisantes durante los últimos 3 minutos de cocción.","Haga el aderezo combinando el aceite,\r\njugo de limón y condimento. Revuelve las hierbas\r\na través del trigo bulgur escurrido y\r\nguisantes con el aderezo."]','2026-01-11 13:03:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14702,4605,'es','Pavo a la brasa con tabulé de quinoa y aderezo de tahini','Esta cena súper saludable está repleta de ingredientes frescos y vibrantes.','["200 g de quinua","½ pepino, cortado en trozos de 1 cm","175 g de tomates cherry cortados por la mitad","3 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","un puñado de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","un puñado de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más 1 cucharadita","jugo 1 limon","4 filetes de pavo","1½ cucharada de pasta de tahini","1½ cucharada de yogur bajo en grasa","jugo ½ limón","½ diente de ajo machacado","½ cucharadita de miel clara"]','["Vierta la quinua en una cacerola y\r\nvierta más de 600 ml de agua. Cubrir con un\r\ntapar y llevar a ebullición. Baja y\r\ncocine a fuego lento hasta que el agua se haya evaporado\r\n(tal como cocinarías arroz): unos 20 minutos.\r\nQuitar la tapa y dejar enfriar mientras\r\npreparas el pavo y la ensalada.","Incline el pepino, los tomates, la primavera.\r\ncebollas y hierbas en un tazón grande para mezclar.\r\nVierta sobre 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva y jugo de limón.\r\nsazone bien y mezcle todo.","Calentar una plancha y, al fumar\r\ncaliente, frote los filetes de pavo con 1 cucharadita de aceituna\r\naceite. Cocine durante unos 5 minutos por cada lado,\r\ndependiendo del espesor. Revuelva juntos\r\ntodos los ingredientes del aderezo junto con\r\n3 cucharadas de agua. Mezcle la quinua\r\ncon la ensalada y disponer en platos.\r\nCortar el pavo en rodajas gruesas y apilarlas\r\nla quinua y rociar sobre el aderezo."]','2026-01-11 13:03:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14703,4607,'es','Ensalada de calabaza y cebada con vinagreta balsámica','Una ensalada inusual y llena de sabor, deliciosa tanto fría como caliente; funciona muy bien como parte de un buffet','["1 calabaza, pelada y cortada en trozos largos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","250 g de cebada perlada","300 g de brócoli de tallo tierno, cortado en trozos medianos","100 g de tomates SunBlush, en rodajas","1 cebolla morada pequeña, picada","2 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza","1 cucharada de alcaparras pequeñas, enjuagadas","15 aceitunas negras, sin hueso","Paquete de 20 g de albahaca picada","5 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","6 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Colocar\r\nla calabaza en una bandeja para hornear y mezcle con\r\naceite de oliva. Ase durante 20 minutos. Mientras tanto,\r\nhervir la cebada durante unos 25 minutos en sal\r\nagua hasta que esté tierna, pero al dente. Si bien esto es\r\nesto sucede, mezcle los ingredientes del aderezo\r\nun tazón pequeño, luego sazone con sal y pimienta.\r\nEscurre la cebada, luego viértela en un bol y\r\nvierta sobre el aderezo. Mezclar bien y dejar enfriar.","Hervir el brócoli en agua con sal hasta que\r\ntiernos, luego escurrir y enjuagar con agua fría.\r\nEscurrir y secar. Agrega el brócoli y\r\ningredientes restantes a la cebada y mezclar\r\nbueno. Esto se conservará durante 3 días en el frigorífico.\r\ny está delicioso caliente o frío."]','2026-01-11 13:03:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14704,4609,'es','Col de Saboya con almendras','Una guarnición súper saludable con almendras ligeramente tostadas para darle un toque crujiente al repollo','["1 col rizada, finamente cortada","25 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","1 ramita de romero, hojas finamente picadas","100 g de almendras blanqueadas"]','["Cocine al vapor o en el microondas el repollo hasta que\r\nrecién cocinado. Derretir la mantequilla con el aceite.\r\nen una sartén grande o wok, luego agregue el\r\najo, romero y almendras. cocinar,\r\nrevolviendo las almendras durante unos 2 minutos o\r\nhasta que empiecen a dorarse. Vierta sobre un plato.\r\nAgregue el repollo a la sartén, agregue el\r\njugos mantecosos sobrantes, luego regresar\r\nla mezcla de almendras a la sartén. Temporada\r\nbien y verter en una fuente para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14705,4611,'es','Espaguetis con sardinas','Esta cena de despensa es súper rápida y súper saludable','["400 g de espaguetis","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo machacados","pizca de hojuelas de chile","Lata de 227 g de tomates picados","2 latas de 95g de sardinas en salsa de tomate sin piel y deshuesadas","100 g de aceitunas negras sin hueso, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de alcaparras, escurridas","un puñado pequeño de perejil picado"]','["Cocine los espaguetis en una cacerola grande de\r\nagua hirviendo con sal según el paquete\r\ninstrucciones. Mientras tanto, haz la salsa.\r\nCalienta el aceite en una sartén mediana y cocina.\r\nel ajo durante 1 min. Agrega las hojuelas de chile,\r\ntomates y sardinas, partiendo\r\naproximadamente con una cuchara de madera. Calor para\r\n2-3 minutos, luego agregue las aceitunas y las alcaparras.\r\ny la mayor parte del perejil. Mezclar bien para\r\ncombinar.","Escurrir la pasta reservando un par de\r\ncucharada de agua. Añade la pasta a la\r\nsalsa y mezclar bien, agregando lo reservado\r\nagua si la salsa queda un poco espesa. dividir\r\nentre 4 tazones y espolvorear con el\r\nperejil restante."]','2026-01-11 13:03:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14706,4613,'es','Ensalada picante de salmón y arroz integral','Esta receta veraniega tiene la combinación ideal de carbohidratos de liberación lenta, proteínas magras y grasas beneficiosas para el corazón.','["200 g de arroz basmati integral","200 g de habas de soja congeladas y descongeladas","2 filetes de salmón","1 pepino, cortado en cubitos","manojo pequeño de cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","1 chile rojo, cortado en cubitos, sin semillas si lo deseas","4 cucharaditas de salsa de soja ligera"]','["Cuece el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y 3 minutos antes de que esté cocido añade las semillas de soja. Escurrir y enfriar con agua corriente fría.","Mientras tanto, coloque el salmón en un plato y luego cocínelo en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 3 minutos o hasta que esté bien cocido. Dejar enfriar un poco, quitar la piel con un tenedor y luego desmenuzar.","Incorpora suavemente el pepino, las cebolletas, el cilantro y el salmón al arroz y los frijoles. En un recipiente aparte, mezcle la ralladura y el jugo de lima, el chile y la soja, luego vierta sobre el arroz antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14707,4615,'es','Quinua especiada con almendras y queso feta','Usa quinua en lugar de cuscús para hacer una deliciosa ensalada sin gluten','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","300 g de quinua enjuagada","50 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","un puñado de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","jugo ½ limón"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Agrega las especias,\r\nluego freír durante aproximadamente un minuto hasta que esté fragante.\r\nAñade la quinua y sofríe durante un rato más.\r\nmin hasta que puedas escuchar un suave estallido\r\nsonidos. Agregue 600 ml de agua hirviendo y luego\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos hasta que\r\nel agua se ha evaporado y la quinua\r\nLos granos tienen un \"halo\" blanco a su alrededor.\r\nDeje que se enfríe un poco y luego revuelva con el\r\notros ingredientes. Servir tibio o frío."]','2026-01-11 13:03:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14708,4617,'es','Tortitas de avena sin semillas','Estas galletas rápidas son una excelente adición a una tabla de quesos o a una cesta de regalo casera gourmet.','["50 g de mantequilla","100 g de avena mediana","100 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 cucharaditas de semillas de amapola","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nDerrita la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña, luego déjela\r\nque se enfríe un poco. Volcar todos los ingredientes secos.\r\nen un bol, con ½ cucharadita de sal, luego vierta\r\nla mantequilla. Agregue 5-6 cucharadas de agua hirviendo\r\ny combine para hacer una masa firme.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente\r\nsuperficie enharinada, luego extiéndala hasta aproximadamente\r\n0,5 cm de espesor. Cortar en cuadritos pequeños, luego\r\nhornee durante 12-15 minutos hasta que esté dorado. salir\r\ndejar enfriar durante unos minutos, luego transferir a\r\nuna rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo."]','2026-01-11 13:03:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14709,9457,'es','Chile de verduras y frijoles','Este saludable chile vegetal es una cena rápida y satisfactoria, repleta de legumbres y coloridas verduras frescas.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente picado","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 calabacines, cortados en cubitos","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 pimiento amarillo, sin semillas y picado","1 cucharada de chile en polvo","100 g de lentejas rojas, lavadas y escurridas","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","Lata de 195 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","Lata de 420 g de judías con mantequilla, escurridas","Lata de 400 g de frijoles en agua, escurridos"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Cocine el ajo, el jengibre, la cebolla, los calabacines y los pimientos durante unos 5 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agrega el chile en polvo y cocina por 1 min más.","Agrega las lentejas, el puré de tomate, los tomates y 250 ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar durante 15-20 minutos.","Agrega el maíz dulce y los frijoles y cocina por 10 minutos más."]','2026-01-11 13:03:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14710,4619,'es','Ensalada de salmón y soja','Lleno del tipo de grasa que es bueno para usted, esto hace una comida ligera pero aún satisfactoria.','["1 huevo grande rico en omega-3 (consulte la sección PRUEBA al final de la receta)","200 g de habas de soja congeladas y descongeladas","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 cucharadas de aceite de linaza (nosotros usamos granoVita)","Bolsa de 250 g de lentejas Puy.","manojo pequeño de cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","2 filetes de salmón escalfados, sin piel"]','["Poner el huevo en una cacerola, cubrir con agua fría y llevar a ebullición. Cocine durante 4 minutos (u 8 para los duros), agregue las semillas de soja a la sartén durante el último minuto, luego escúrralas y páselas por agua fría para que se enfríen. Pele y corte el huevo en 6 gajos, luego reserve.","Mezcle el jugo y la ralladura de limón con el aceite, sazone y luego revuelva con las habas de soja, las lentejas y las cebolletas.","Dividir en 2 platos, luego romper con cuidado el salmón en hojuelas grandes y poner encima de las lentejas junto con el huevo. Pruébalo con pan integral sin semillas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14711,4621,'es','Bacalao al limón con puré de judías y albahaca','Una cena saludable para el corazón que es la comida perfecta para dos entre semana','["2 manojos pequeños de tomates cherry, en rama","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","trozos de bacalao sin piel u otro filete de pescado blanco","ralladura de 1 limón y el jugo de ½","Paquete de 240g de habas de soja congeladas","1 diente de ajo","manojo de albahaca, hojas y tallos separados","100 ml de caldo de pollo o verduras"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Poner \r\nlos tomates en una bandeja para horno, frote con \r\nun poco de aceite y un poco de condimento, luego asar \r\ndurante 5 minutos hasta que la piel comience a partirse. \r\nAgregue el pescado a la bandeja, cubra con la mayor parte  \r\nla ralladura de limón y un poco más de condimento, \r\nLuego rocíe con un poco más de aceite. asado para  \r\n8-10 minutos hasta que el pescado se desmenuce fácilmente.","Mientras tanto, cocine los frijoles en una cacerola de \r\nagua hirviendo durante 3 minutos hasta que esté tierna. \r\nEscurrir, luego verter en un procesador de alimentos con el \r\nresto del aceite, ajo, tallos de albahaca, jugo de limón \r\ny caldo, luego presione hasta obtener una consistencia espesa, ligeramente \r\npuré áspero. Sazone al gusto.","Divida los tomates y tritúrelos entre \r\ndos platos, cubrir con el bacalao y luego esparcir \r\ncon hojas de albahaca y el resto del limón \r\nentusiasmo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14712,4623,'es','Curry de verduras de verano','Dale un cambio de imagen saludable a tu curry del viernes por la noche con este plato vegetariano, súper saludable y bajo en grasas.','["1-2 cucharadas de pasta de curry rojo tailandés (según el gusto)","500 ml de caldo de verduras bajo en sodio","2 cebollas picadas","1 berenjena, cortada en cubitos","75 g de lentejas rojas","Lata de 200ml de leche de coco desnatada","2 pimientos rojos o amarillos, sin semillas y cortados en gajos","140 g de guisantes congelados","Bolsa de 100 g de espinacas tiernas, picadas en trozos grandes","arroz basmati integral y chutney de mango, para servir"]','["Calentar la pasta de curry en una cacerola grande.\r\ncacerola antiadherente con un chorrito\r\nde la acción. Agrega las cebollas y sofríe\r\ndurante 5 minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse.\r\nAgregue la berenjena y cocine por\r\n5 minutos más – agrega un poco más\r\nstock si comienza a pegarse.","Añade las lentejas, la leche de coco y\r\nel resto del caldo y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 15 minutos o hasta que las lentejas estén\r\ntierno. Agrega los pimientos y cocina\r\ndurante 5-10 minutos más. Revuelva a través del\r\nguisantes y espinacas y cocine hasta\r\nlas espinacas acaban de marchitarse. servir el\r\ncurry con arroz y chutney de mango."]','2026-01-11 13:03:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14713,4625,'es','Fideos con pavo, judías verdes y hoisin','¿Un largo día de trabajo? Prepare esta cena sustanciosa pero baja en grasas y disfrútela en el sofá.','["100 gramos de fideos ramen","100 g de judías verdes partidas por la mitad","3 cucharadas de salsa hoisin","jugo 1 lima","1 cucharada de salsa de chile","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","250 g de carne picada de pavo","2 dientes de ajo, picados","6 cebolletas, cortadas en diagonal"]','["Hervir los fideos del siguiente paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, agregando las judías verdes\r\ndurante los últimos 2 minutos. Escurrir y reservar.","En un tazón pequeño, mezcle el hoisin,\r\njugo de lima y salsa de chile. En un wok o\r\nsartén, calentar el aceite y luego sofreír\r\npica hasta que esté bien dorado. Añade el\r\nel ajo y sofreír 1 min más. Agregue el\r\nmezcla hoisin y cocine por unos minutos.\r\nmás hasta que esté pegajoso. Finalmente, agregue el\r\nfideos, frijoles y la mitad de la primavera\r\ncebollas para calentar. dispersarse\r\nlas cebolletas restantes para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14714,4627,'es','Dip de edamame y chile con verduras crudas','La comida de fiesta no tiene por qué engordar. Sumérgete en este snack fresco y saludable tantas veces como quieras','["300 g de soja congelada","150 g de yogur natural desnatado","1 chile rojo, picado","jugo 1 lima","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","un puñado de cilantro picado","rábanos cortados por la mitad, palitos de zanahoria, apio y pimientos, para servir"]','["Cocer las habas de soja en ebullición.\r\nagua con sal durante 4 minutos. Escurrir y enfriar\r\nbajo agua corriente fría. Blitz con el yogur rojo picado.\r\nchile, jugo de lima y ajo machacado\r\nclavo hasta que quede suave. Incorporar lo finamente picado\r\ncebolla morada y un puñado picado\r\ncilantro. Servir con rábanos partidos por la mitad\r\ny palitos de zanahoria, apio y\r\npimientos. La salsa se mantendrá cubierta\r\nEn el frigorífico hasta por 3 días."]','2026-01-11 13:03:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14715,4629,'es','Sopa india de invierno','Esta cálida sopa de invierno es rica en fibra, baja en grasas y se puede congelar para mayor comodidad.','["100 g de cebada perlada","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","½ cucharadita de semillas de mostaza marrón","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 chiles verdes, sin semillas y finamente picados","1 hoja de laurel","2 dientes","1 rama pequeña de canela","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 chirivía, cortada en trozos","200 g de calabaza, cortada en trozos","200 g de batatas, cortadas en trozos","1 cucharadita de pimentón","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","225 g de lentejas rojas","2 tomates, picados","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","1 cucharadita de jengibre rallado","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón"]','["Enjuagar la cebada perlada y cocinar.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. cuando es\r\ntiernas, escurrir y reservar. Mientras tanto,\r\nCalentar el aceite en un recipiente profundo y de fondo grueso.\r\nsartén. Freír las semillas de mostaza, el comino.\r\nsemillas, chiles, laurel, clavo, canela\r\ny la cúrcuma hasta que esté fragante y las semillas\r\nempieza a crujir. Vierta la cebolla y\r\najo, luego cocínelo durante 5 a 8 minutos hasta que esté suave.\r\nAgregue la chirivía, la nuez y el dulce.\r\npapa y mezcle bien, asegurándose\r\nlas verduras están completamente cubiertas con\r\naceite y especias. Espolvorea el pimentón,\r\ncilantro molido y condimentos, y\r\nrevuelva nuevamente.","Añade las lentejas, la cebada perlada y los tomates.\r\ny 1,7 litros de agua. Llevar a ebullición\r\nluego baje y cocine a fuego lento hasta que\r\nlas verduras estén tiernas. cuando las lentejas\r\nestán casi cocidos, agregue lo picado\r\ncilantro, jengibre y jugo de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:03:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14716,4631,'es','Brochetas de tofu endiabladas','Un kebab vegetariano bajo en grasas para sacar el diablo que llevas dentro','["8 chalotes o cebollas","8 patatas nuevas pequeñas","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cucharada de miel clara","1 cucharada de mostaza integral","300 g de tofu ahumado firme, en cubos","1 calabacín, pelado y rebanado","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos"]','["Ponga las chalotas o las cebollas en un bol, cúbralas con agua hirviendo y déjelas reposar durante 5 minutos. Cocine las patatas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 7 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrir y secar. Poner puré de tomate, soja. \r\nen un bol la salsa, el aceite, la miel, la mostaza y los condimentos, luego mezcle bien. Mezcle el tofu en la marinada. conjunto \r\na un lado durante al menos 10 minutos.","Calienta la parrilla. Escurrir y pelar las chalotas o las cebollas, luego cocinar en agua hirviendo durante 3 minutos. Escurrir bien. Ensarte el tofu, las chalotas, las patatas, el calabacín y el pimiento en brochetas de 8 x 20 cm. Ase durante 10 minutos, volteándolos con frecuencia y untándolos con la marinada restante antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14717,4633,'es','Linguini de cangrejo con chile y perejil','Mantenlo simple con este platillo estilo restaurante que toma algunos ingredientes de buena calidad y los deja brillar.','["400 g de linguini","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cangrejo entero cocido, picado, o aproximadamente 100 g/4 oz de carne de cangrejo marrón y 200 g/7 oz de carne de cangrejo blanca fresca","un chorrito pequeño, unas 5 cucharadas, de vino blanco","un chorrito pequeño de limón (opcional)","un puñado grande de hojas planas de perejil, muy finamente picadas"]','["Lleve una cacerola grande con agua con sal a\r\nhervir y agregar los linguini. dale\r\nRevuelva bien y hierva durante 1 minuto menos de\r\ndice el paquete. Revuelva bien de vez en cuando\r\npara que no se pegue.","Mientras se cocina la pasta, calentar suavemente\r\n3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva con la guindilla y el ajo\r\nen una cacerola lo suficientemente grande como para contener todos los\r\npasta cómodamente. Cocine el chile y\r\najos muy suavemente hasta que empiecen a chisporrotear,\r\nLuego sube el fuego y añade la clara.\r\nvino. Cocer todo a fuego lento hasta que el vino\r\ny el aceite de oliva se unen. Entonces toma\r\nRetire del fuego y agregue la carne de cangrejo dorada,\r\nusando una espátula o cuchara de madera para\r\nTritúrelo con aceite de oliva para hacer una\r\nsalsa espesa.","Cuando la pasta se haya cocido.\r\ntiempo, pruebe una hebra; debe tener una\r\nmordida muy leve. Cuando esté listo, apágalo\r\nel calor. Coloque la salsa a fuego muy bajo.\r\ncalentar y utilizar un par de pinzas de cocina para levantar\r\nla pasta del agua a la salsa.","Fuera del fuego, añade la carne de cangrejo blanca.\r\ny perejil a la pasta con una pizca\r\nde sal marina. Revuelve todo junto de verdad.\r\nBueno, añadiendo una gota de agua de pasta.\r\nsi empieza a estar nublado. Gusto por\r\ncondimentar y, si necesita un ligero toque,\r\nañade un chorrito pequeño de limón. servir\r\ninmediatamente girado en tazones de pasta\r\ny rociado con el aceite restante."]','2026-01-11 13:03:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14718,4635,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: pastel de pescado','Esta comida reconfortante tradicionalmente rica en grasas se ha transformado en un plato saludable para el corazón.','["500ml de leche semidesnatada","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","100g de gambas cocidas con cáscara","varias ramitas de tomillo, preferiblemente tomillo limón","2 hojas de laurel","1 diente de ajo, en rodajas finas","750 g de patatas nuevas, como Charlotte (no es necesario pelarlas)","1 puerro mediano, en rodajas finas (175 g de peso preparado)","400 g de filete de eglefino sin piel","350 g de filete de salmón sin piel","175 g de filete de eglefino ahumado sin piel","Tarrina de 125 g de queso tierno bajo en grasa con ajo y hierbas","2 cucharadas de perejil finamente picado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de cebollino picado"]','["Mezclar 3 cucharadas de leche con la harina de maíz.\r\ny dejar a un lado. Vierta el resto de la leche.\r\nen una cacerola. Pelar las gambas,\r\nreserve la carne, luego deje caer las cáscaras\r\ny cabezas (lávelas primero si es necesario)\r\nen la leche junto con las ramitas de tomillo,\r\nhojas de laurel, ajo y un poco de pimienta molida.\r\nLlevar a ebullición y luego retirar del fuego.\r\ny dejar en infusión durante 20 min.","Mientras tanto, poner las patatas en un\r\ncacerola grande con agua, llevar a ebullición y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Drenar.\r\nCuece el puerro cortado al vapor durante 3 minutos y luego\r\nRetirar del fuego y reservar.","Colar la leche infusionada por un colador.\r\nen una sartén grande y poco profunda. Coloque todos los\r\nlos filetes de pescado (no las gambas) en la leche.\r\nLlevar a ebullición, luego bajar el fuego y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 3 minutos. Quitar de\r\nBajar el fuego y dejar tapado durante 5 min.\r\nUtilice una espumadera para transferir todo el pescado.\r\na un plato y dejar enfriar un poco. Calor\r\nhorno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Revuelva la harina de maíz aflojada y luego revuelva.\r\nen la leche caliente en la sartén.\r\nRegrese la sartén al fuego y revuelva hasta que\r\nengrosado. Agregue brevemente el queso tierno,\r\nRetirar del fuego, luego agregar el\r\nperejil y sazone con pimienta negra.\r\nAgregue cualquier líquido que se haya drenado\r\nel pescado. Rompe el pescado en trozos grandes como\r\nlos pones en una fuente refractaria de 2 litros\r\npara que las diferentes variedades queden uniformemente\r\ndistribuido. Repartir por encima las gambas y\r\npuerro, luego sazone con pimienta. Vierta el\r\nsalsa y revuelva suavemente para\r\ndistribuir uniformemente la salsa y combinar\r\ntodo sin desmenuzar el pescado.","Con un tenedor grande, tritura las patatas.\r\nrompiéndolos (no triturándolos)\r\nen trozos grandes. Incorporar el aceite, el cebollino.\r\ny un poco de pimienta negra. Cuchara el\r\ntriturar las patatas sobre el pescado. Sienta el plato\r\nuna bandeja para hornear y hornear durante 25-30 minutos,\r\no hasta que la salsa burbujee y el\r\npatatas doradas. Alternativamente, haga\r\nel plato completamente, refrigérelo por\r\nvarias horas o toda la noche, luego hornee a temperatura\r\nMisma temperatura que la anterior durante 45 minutos."]','2026-01-11 13:03:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14719,4637,'es','Ensalada de calabacín con cinta','Esta ensalada se prepara en solo 10 minutos y está llena de garbanzos, calabacín, maíz dulce y queso feta. Es lo suficientemente sustancial como para disfrutarlo solo o servirlo como acompañamiento veraniego.','["10 g de perejil, finamente picado","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","½ cucharada de miel","2 calabacines","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","½ lata de 198 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","80 g de queso feta (comprobar que sea vegetariano, si es necesario)","2 cucharaditas de semillas mixtas","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas"]','["Ponga la mayor parte del perejil, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el aceite de oliva y la miel en un bol y bata junto con un poco de condimento al gusto.","Con un pelador de verduras, pele los calabacines en tiras, desechando el centro con semillas. Vierta en un bol grande con los garbanzos y el maíz dulce. Vierta sobre el aderezo, mezcle y deje marinar durante 5 minutos. Desmenuza el queso feta y dale una última sacudida ligera. Sazone con una pizca de pimienta negra.","Divida la ensalada en cuatro platos. Esparza el perejil restante y espolvoree junto con las semillas mixtas y las cebolletas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14720,4639,'es','Ensaladera vegana','Prepare una ensalada vegana fácil con frijoles, rábanos, repollo encurtido y cuscús. Rebosante de sabor, es una cena o un almuerzo satisfactorio para llevar.','["200 g de cuscús","Lata de 400g de frijoles mixtos","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1⁄2 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","3⁄4 manojo pequeño de eneldo, partido en ramitas","2 rábanos sandía o 6 pequeños, en rodajas","1⁄2 pepino, pelado en tiras","1 cebolla morada grande, finamente cortada","1⁄4 col lombarda pequeña, cortada finamente","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco o vinagre de manzana","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","1⁄4 manojo pequeño de eneldo, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Primero, haz el pepinillo. Mezcle todos los ingredientes en un tazón grande con 1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas, luego cubra y reserve hasta que sea necesario.","Mezclar el cuscús con 280 ml de agua hirviendo en un bol, tapar y dejar reposar 4 minutos, luego esponjar con un tenedor. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Mientras tanto, escurra y enjuague los frijoles, viértalos en un tazón y luego agregue el aceite de oliva y las hojuelas de chile junto con un poco de condimento.","Mezcle la mayor parte del eneldo con el cuscús y sazone. Para armar, vierta el pepinillo encurtido, el cuscús, los rábanos, los frijoles y el pepino en partes separadas de cada tazón. Cubra el pepinillo con el eneldo reservado y muela un poco de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:03:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14721,4641,'es','Brocheta grande de pollo a la barbacoa','¿Hacer barbacoas para más de cuatro personas? Prepare un kebab de pollo grande para trinchar, luego la cocción estará lista de una sola vez y podrá disfrutar de la fiesta.','["12 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","500 g de yogur griego","2 limones, exprimidos, ½ limón rallado","100 ml de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo, rallados muy finos o machacados","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharada de pimentón dulce","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharadita de tomillo seco","1 cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","1 cucharadita de pimienta negra triturada","½ cucharadita de canela molida","2 cebollas moradas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","4 tomates (ciruela funcionan bien) cortados por la mitad y en rodajas"]','["Primero, mezcle todos los ingredientes de la marinada junto con 1 cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande o, mejor aún, en un recipiente de plástico grande que tenga tapa. Abra cada muslo de pollo, cúbralo con un trozo de papel para hornear y aplánelo con la mano, luego levante el papel y corte el muslo por la mitad. Vierta la marinada y mezcle para que quede completamente cubierta. Cubra, enfríe y deje marinar durante al menos 1 hora o hasta 24 horas; cuanto más tiempo, mejor.","Enrosque todo el pollo en dos brochetas de modo que ambas pasen por cada trozo de carne, apretándolas firmemente a medida que avanza para hacer un kebab compacto (consulte el consejo a continuación).","Enciende una barbacoa con tapa y deja que las llamas se apaguen. Una vez que las brasas se hayan vuelto cenicientas, apílalas en un lado y una sola capa de brasas esparcidas por el otro lado. Coloque el kebab de pollo a un lado de la barbacoa con solo unas pocas brasas debajo. Baje la tapa y cocine durante 45 minutos, volteando cada 15 minutos. Para terminar, levante la tapa y gire el kebab hacia el lado más caliente para quemar la carne, dándole vuelta cada pocos minutos hasta que esté bien dorado y bien cocido. Separe los trozos de pollo en el centro para verificar que estén cocidos, o use un termómetro de cocina digital; debe marcar 70 ° C o más. Déjelo reposar durante 5 a 10 minutos mientras cocina las pitas (ver receta al lado). Lleva el kebab a la mesa y córtalo en rodajas finas con un cuchillo de sierra. Apila la carne cortada en las pitas calientes, luego las cebollas y los tomates rojos en rodajas, las patatas fritas y el tzatziki (consulta nuestras recetas a continuación)."]','2026-01-11 13:03:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14722,4645,'es','Batido potenciador de vitaminas','Aumente su cuota de vitaminas con la ayuda de este batido fresco y brillante. La naranja, la zanahoria, el apio y el mango son un aporte nutritivo','["1 naranja, pelada y picada en trozos grandes","1 zanahoria grande, pelada y picada en trozos grandes","2 ramas de apio, picado en trozos grandes","50 g de mangos, picados en trozos grandes","200ml de agua"]','["Pon toda la naranja, la zanahoria, el apio y el mango en la licuadora, completa con agua y luego bate hasta que quede suave."]','2026-01-11 13:03:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14723,4647,'es','Batido ayudante del corazón','Mezcla remolacha, manzana, arándanos y jengibre para crear una bebida suave y nutritiva con profundidad y chispa.','["2 remolachas pequeñas crudas, peladas y picadas en trozos grandes","1 manzana pequeña pelada, cortada en cuartos y sin corazón","50 g de arándanos","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado","300ml de agua"]','["Coloque la remolacha, la manzana, los arándanos y el jengibre en una licuadora, complete con agua y luego mezcle hasta que quede suave."]','2026-01-11 13:03:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14724,4649,'es','Ensalada de naranja, garbanzos y prosciutto','Si puedes, busca mozzarella de búfala para usar en esta ensalada. Con garbanzos, prosciutto y avellanas, es un derroche de color y textura.','["50ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 limón, exprimido","1 cucharadita de miel","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro, trituradas","2-3 naranjas pequeñas, peladas y cortadas en rodajas","50g de rúcula","2 bolitas de 125 g de mozzarella de búfala","80 g de jamón","30 g de avellanas tostadas y picadas","pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Batir el aceite, el jugo de limón y la miel en un bol y luego sazonar. Mezcle con los garbanzos, el perejil y las semillas de cilantro, seguido de las rodajas de naranja y la rúcula. Extienda la ensalada en un plato grande para compartir.","Corte la mozzarella sobre la ensalada y luego espolvoree con el prosciutto y las avellanas. Servir con pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:03:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14725,4651,'es','Conchas de pasta con brócoli','A los niños les encantará esta versión más saludable de pesto y pasta, en la que el brócoli aumenta su consumo de verduras. Se prepara en sólo 20 minutos y es bajo en calorías.','["1 cabeza de brócoli, picada en floretes","1 diente de ajo, sin pelar","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","250 g de conchas de pasta","½ paquete pequeño de perejil","½ paquete pequeño de albahaca","30 g de piñones tostados","½ limón, rallado y en jugo","30 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), más extra para servir"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle el brócoli y el ajo en 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una bandeja para asar y ase en el horno durante 10-12 minutos, hasta que se ablanden.","Vierta las cáscaras de pasta en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal. Cocine según las instrucciones del paquete y escurra. Coloca el perejil, la albahaca, los piñones, el jugo de limón y el parmesano en una licuadora. Una vez que el brócoli esté listo, reserva algunos de los trozos más pequeños. Exprime el ajo de la piel, agrégalo a la licuadora junto con el resto del brócoli, tritura hasta obtener un pesto y sazona bien.","Mezcle la pasta con el pesto. Añade los floretes de brócoli reservados, repartidos en dos tazones y cubre con un poco más de parmesano, la ralladura de limón y un buen molido de pimienta negra, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14726,4653,'es','Ensalada de salmón salvaje con salsa de maíz y pimientos','Marina pescado saludable para el corazón con especias y sírvelo con colorido maíz dulce y aguacate; los vegetarianos pueden usar halloumi en su lugar.','["1 diente de ajo","½ cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","¼ cucharadita de comino molido","1 lima, ralladura y jugo, más gajos para servir (opcional)","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","2 filetes de salmón salvaje","1 mazorca de maíz, sin cáscara si está adherida","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 aguacate, sin hueso, pelado y finamente picado","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 chile rojo, cortado a la mitad, sin semillas y picado","½ paquete de cilantro, finamente picado"]','["Ralla finamente el ajo en un bol para aderezar las especias. Hierva el maíz para la ensalada de salsa durante 6 a 8 minutos hasta que esté tierno, luego escúrralo y corte los granos con un cuchillo afilado.","Agrega las especias, 1 cucharada de jugo de limón y el aceite al ajo para hacer una mezcla de especias y luego úsalo para cubrir el salmón.","Mezcle la ralladura de lima y el jugo restantes con el maíz y agregue todos los ingredientes restantes. Calienta una sartén y cocina el salmón durante 2 minutos por cada lado para que todavía esté un poco rosado en el centro. Sirva con la ensalada de salsa con gajos de lima adicionales, si lo desea, para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14727,4655,'es','Abadejo al limón con chips de camote y puré de brócoli','El pescado y las patatas fritas se renuevan de forma saludable con un sabroso aderezo de alcaparras y guisantes blandos con menta; reemplácelos con berenjena si prefiere una opción vegetariana.','["2 dientes de ajo","2 batatas (175 g/6 oz), lavadas y cortadas en chips","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza, más un poco más para el pescado","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","2 filetes de abadejo (aproximadamente 100 g/4 oz cada uno)","½ limón sin cera","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1½ cucharadita de alcaparras, enjuagadas y picadas","1 cucharada de eneldo picado","1 puerro, picado","4 brócoli (aproximadamente 200 g/7 oz)","85 g de guisantes congelados","puñado de menta"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Picar finamente el ajo, poner la mitad en un bol para el aderezo y reservar el resto para las patatas fritas. Mezcle las batatas con el aceite y extiéndalas en una bandeja para hornear grande. Hornee por 25 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad.","Coloque el pescado sobre una hoja de papel para horno sobre una bandeja para horno, unte con un poco de aceite, luego ralle la ralladura de limón y sazone con pimienta negra. Dejar de lado.","Hervir el puerro durante 5 minutos, luego agregar el brócoli y cocinar 5 minutos más. Vierta los guisantes durante 2 minutos más. Escurrir, volver a la cacerola y batir con una batidora hasta obtener un puré espeso. Agrega la menta y luego vuelve a mezclar.","Mientras tanto, mezcla el ajo y el pimentón con las patatas fritas y regresa al horno con el pescado durante 10 minutos. Agrega el aceite de oliva al ajo, con las alcaparras y el eneldo y 1 cucharada de agua. Servir todo junto con el aderezo de alcaparras sobre el pescado."]','2026-01-11 13:03:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14728,4657,'es','Ensalada de pollo y aguacate con aderezo balsámico de arándanos','Una cena o almuerzo saludable y sin gluten, perfecto para aprovechar las sobras del pollo asado. Hazlo vegetariano cambiando la carne por un puñado de semillas de calabaza.','["1 diente de ajo","85 g de arándanos","1 cucharada de aceite de colza virgen extra","2 cucharaditas de vinagre balsámico","125 g de habas tiernas frescas o congeladas","1 remolacha grande cocida, finamente picada","1 aguacate, sin hueso, pelado y rebanado","Bolsa de 85 g de ensalada mixta de hojas tiernas","175 g de pollo cocido"]','["Picar finamente el ajo. Triture la mitad de los arándanos con el aceite, el vinagre y un poco de pimienta negra en una ensaladera grande.","Hervir las habas durante 5 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrirlas, dejándolas sin piel.","Agrega el ajo al aderezo, luego agrega los frijoles calientes y los arándanos restantes con la remolacha, el aguacate, la ensalada y el pollo. Mezcle para mezclar, pero no se exceda o el jugo de la remolacha pondrá todo rosado. Apílelos en platos o tazones poco profundos para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14729,4659,'es','Albóndigas vegetales con calabacín y tomate','Haga espirales de calabacines para preparar este plato de "pasta" más saludable y sin gluten. Las albóndigas vegetarianas utilizan almendras molidas en lugar de pan rallado para aumentar la proteína.','["3 dientes de ajo","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza, más un poco más para engrasar","1 cebolla pequeña, muy finamente picada","2 cucharaditas de vinagre balsámico","100 g de judías rojas enlatadas","1 cucharada de huevo batido","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita colmada de chile en polvo","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","15 g de almendras molidas","40 g de maíz dulce cocido","2 cucharaditas de hojas de tomillo picadas","2 tomates grandes o 3 normales, picados","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico","2 calabacines cortados en ''fideos'' con un espiralizador, un pelador en juliana o a mano"]','["Picar finamente el ajo. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y fríe la cebolla, revolviendo frecuentemente, durante 8 minutos. Agregue el vinagre balsámico y cocine por 2 minutos más. Mientras tanto, poner las judías en un bol con el huevo, el puré de tomate y las especias y triturar hasta que quede suave. Agrega las almendras y el maíz dulce con el tomillo, un tercio del ajo picado y las cebollas balsámicas. Mezcle bien y forme unas 8 bolas del tamaño de una nuez y colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear engrasado.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y hornea las albóndigas vegetales durante 15 minutos hasta que estén firmes. Mientras tanto, ponga los tomates, el puré de tomate y el vinagre balsámico en una sartén y cocine con 2-3 cucharadas de agua hasta que estén pulposos, luego agregue el resto del ajo y el calabacín. Apague el fuego ya que desea calentar los fideos en lugar de cocinarlos. Servir con las albóndigas vegetales."]','2026-01-11 13:03:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14730,4661,'es','Pollo asado con ensalada gremolata de boniato','Ase un pollo entero para este almuerzo o cena bajo en calorías y guarde las sobras para más tarde; cambie el pollo por huevos duros por una versión vegetariana.','["1 limon","1½ kg de pollo entero (crio o orgánico), sin grasa del interior de la cavidad del cuello","3 cucharadas de hojas de perejil finamente picadas (reservar los tallos)","2 batatas (175 g/6 oz cada una)","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","7 dientes de ajo enteros","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza virgen extra","Bolsa de 125 g de espinacas tiernas, lavadas","4 cucharadas colmadas de semillas de granada"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Rallar la ralladura y exprimir el jugo del limón en 2 tazones, luego empujar los gajos dentro de la cavidad del pollo con los tallos de perejil. Coloque el pollo en una fuente para asar y ase durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, lava los boniatos (no es necesario pelarlos) y córtalos en trozos. Ponga en otra fuente para asar con la cebolla, el hinojo y 6 dientes de ajo enteros, luego mezcle con el aceite. Cuando el pollo haya cumplido sus 30 minutos, mete las patatas en el horno y asa durante 30-40 minutos más.","Mientras tanto, pique finamente el diente de ajo restante para la gremolata y luego mezcle con la ralladura de limón y el perejil. Mezclar en un bol el zumo de limón, el aceite y un poco de pimienta negra.","Saca el pollo y las patatas del horno. Tapar el pollo y dejar reposar. Agrega la mitad de la mezcla de gremolata al jugo de limón y al aceite. Revuelva las espinacas con la mezcla de papa y regrese al horno durante 2 minutos para que se ablanden. Vierta el aderezo de limón y revuelva bien. Corte un trozo de pechuga de pollo (necesita unos 140 g), quítele la piel y luego córtelo en trozos. Mézclelo con la ensalada con las semillas de granada y sirva espolvoreado con el resto de la gremolata."]','2026-01-11 13:03:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14731,4663,'es','Pilau de verduras picante con raita de pepino','Reemplace el arroz con freekeh para obtener una receta deliciosamente diferente y baja en calorías con pimiento rojo y pasas dulces.','["2 dientes de ajo","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla grande, cortada en cuartos y en rodajas","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, picado","1 rama de canela","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","semillas de 8 vainas de cardamomo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 chile rojo, cortado a la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas","1 pimiento rojo grande, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","50 g de freekeh","350 ml de caldo de verduras (elaborado con 2 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo reducido en sal)","25g de pasas","½ paquete de cilantro picado","40 g de anacardos","1 diente de ajo","Bote de 150ml de bioyogur","¼ de pepino rallado","2 cucharadas de menta picada"]','["Picar los ajos para el pilau y reservar. Rallar finamente los ajos para la raita y poner en un bol. Calienta el aceite para el pilau en una sartén grande abierta y fríe la cebolla y el jengibre durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue las especias enteras y molidas y cocine por unos segundos para liberar sus aromas. Agregue el chile, el pimiento rojo y el freekeh, revuelva brevemente y luego agregue el caldo y las pasas. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta que el freekeh esté tierno pero aún con sabor a nuez, agregando el ajo picado durante los últimos 2 minutos. El stock debería haberse reducido y absorbido en el freekeh ahora.","Mientras tanto, termine la raita agregando el yogur, el pepino y la menta al ajo rallado.","Cuando el pilau esté cocido, agregue el cilantro y los anacardos y sirva con la raita."]','2026-01-11 13:03:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14732,4665,'es','Filete de cordero a las hierbas con caponata','Marque los 5 de sus 5 al día con este asado dominical súper saludable. Para hacerlo vegetariano, omite el cordero y añade garbanzos a la caponata.','["3 dientes de ajo","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos","1 berenjena, cortada en rodajas y en cuartos","500 g de puré de cartón","1 pimiento verde, cortado en cuartos, sin semillas y en rodajas","6 aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad y enjuagadas","2 cucharaditas de alcaparras, enjuagadas","1 cucharadita de romero picado","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico","4 patatas tiernas, cortadas por la mitad","1 cucharadita de romero picado","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","250 g de filete de lomo de cordero magro, sin toda la grasa visible","Bolsa de 240 g de espinacas tiernas","perejil finamente picado (opcional)"]','["Cortar 2 dientes de ajo para la caponata, rallar finamente el otro para el cordero y reservar. Calentar el aceite para la caponata en una sartén amplia, agregar la cebolla y sofreír durante 5 minutos para que se ablande. Vierta la berenjena y cocine, revolviendo, durante 5 minutos más. Agrega la passata y la pimienta con las aceitunas, las alcaparras, el romero y el vinagre balsámico, luego tapa y cocina por 15 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente.","Mientras tanto, calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Hervir las patatas durante 10 minutos y luego escurrir. Mezclar el ajo rallado con el romero y un poco de pimienta negra y frotar todo el cordero. Mezcle las patatas en el aceite con un poco más de pimienta negra, colóquelas en una fuente pequeña para asar con el cordero y ase durante 15-20 minutos. Mientras tanto, marchite las espinacas en el microondas o en una sartén y exprima para escurrir el exceso de líquido.","Agrega el ajo a la caponata y sírvela con el cordero, entero o en rodajas, enrollado en perejil si lo deseas, con las patatas y las espinacas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14733,4667,'es','Hummus de maní con palitos de frutas y verduras','Esta saludable salsa de nueces, con tahini y pimentón ahumado, es perfecta para untar; cómela con rodajas de manzana y verduras para un almuerzo o refrigerio rápido.','["380 g de garbanzos en cartón","ralladura y jugo de ½ limón (use la otra ½ para exprimir sobre la manzana y evitar que se dore, si lo desea)","1 cucharada de tahini","½ -1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharadas de maní tostado sin sal","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","2 manzanas rojas crujientes, sin corazón y cortadas en rodajas","2 zanahorias, cortadas en palitos","4 ramas de apio, cortadas en bastones a lo largo"]','["Escurrir los garbanzos reservando el líquido. Vierta tres cuartas partes de los garbanzos en un procesador de alimentos y agregue la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el tahini, el pimentón, el maní y el aceite con 3 cucharadas de líquido de garbanzos. Mezcle en un procesador de alimentos hasta que quede suave y luego agregue los garbanzos reservados. Servir con los palitos de frutas y verduras."]','2026-01-11 13:03:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14734,4669,'es','Ensalada de espárragos y lentejas con arándanos y queso feta desmenuzado','Las puntas de espárragos toman el protagonismo en esta saludable ensalada de temporada con cebolletas, tomates cherry y queso salado desmenuzado','["1 diente de ajo","125 g de lentejas puy","Paquete de 100g puntas de espárragos finos","3 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","25 g de arándanos secos","1 cucharada de aceite de colza virgen extra, más un poco más (opcional)","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de sidra de manzana orgánico","140 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","50 g de queso feta (lea el reverso del paquete para ver la opción vegetariana)"]','["Rallar finamente los ajos y poner en un bol. Hervir las lentejas durante 25 minutos y poner los espárragos en una vaporera encima durante los últimos 5 minutos hasta que estén tiernos.","Mientras tanto, ponga las cebollas, los arándanos, el aceite y el vinagre en el bol con el ajo y revuelva bien. Cuando las lentejas estén listas, escúrrelas y mézclalas con el aderezo junto con los tomates. Vierta en recipientes de plástico (para un almuerzo para llevar) o en platos, luego cubra con los espárragos y desmenuce sobre el queso feta. Rocíe con un poco más de aceite, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14735,4671,'es','Wraps de tortitas de hierbas con queso de cabra','Reemplace las tortillas de harina con tortillas finas y luego acompáñelas con sabrosos aderezos vegetarianos para un almuerzo bajo en calorías: disfrútelo caliente o frío.','["1½ cucharadita de aceite de colza","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas","1 calabacín grande, rallado grueso y exprimido hasta secar","2 huevos grandes","2 cucharadas de albahaca picada","2 cucharaditas de hojas de tomillo","50 g de queso de cabra tierno","2 tomates medianos, picados","6 aceitunas Kalamata, enjuagadas y partidas por la mitad","2 puñados de col rizada o berros","rábanos, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén y añadir las cebolletas y el calabacín. Cocine, revolviendo con frecuencia, para ablandar el calabacín y eliminar el exceso de humedad. Vierta las verduras en un bol y lave la sartén.","Batir un huevo con 1 cucharada de agua, la mitad de las hierbas y un poco de pimienta negra. Calienta el aceite restante en la sartén, vierte la mezcla de huevo y gira la sartén para que se asiente finamente sobre la base. Cocine por un par de minutos, vierta sobre un plato y repita con el otro huevo, 1 cucharada de agua y las hierbas restantes.","Extienda el queso de cabra en el centro de cada panqueque y cubra con la mezcla de calabacín, esparza sobre los tomates, las aceitunas y la col rizada, luego enrolle y corte por la mitad. Alternativamente, unte el queso de cabra sobre los panqueques, cubra con el relleno y sirva abierto. Cómelo con algunos rábanos a un lado, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14736,4673,'es','Cuscús de cebada y tabulé de gambas','El pepino crujiente y las jugosas nectarinas añaden frescura a este almuerzo saludable y rico en fibra. Para una versión vegetariana, cambie las gambas por anacardos o nueces.','["125 g de cuscús de cebada","ralladura de 1 limón, jugo de ½","1 cucharada de aceite de colza virgen extra","½ paquete pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","un buen puñado de hojas de menta picadas","½ pepino, picado","2 nectarinas, picadas","125 g de gambas peladas o un puñado de anacardos o nueces para una versión vegetariana."]','["Vierta el cuscús en un tazón y vierta suficiente agua hirviendo para cubrirlo, siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Dejar reposar no más de 5 minutos, escurrir bien, luego esponjar con un tenedor y verter en un bol. Agrega la ralladura y el jugo de limón con el aceite, el eneldo y la menta, luego agrega el pepino y las nectarinas.","Mezcle los langostinos o las nueces y sirva en platos o empaquete en recipientes para el almuerzo."]','2026-01-11 13:03:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14737,4677,'es','Granola de dátiles y trigo sarraceno con nueces y semillas','Esta granola totalmente natural está endulzada con puré de dátiles para hacer racimos crujientes de avena, semillas de cereales y nueces ricos en nutrientes.','["85 g de trigo sarraceno","4 dátiles Medjool, empedrados","1 cucharadita de canela molida","100 g de avena tradicional","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","25 g de semillas de girasol","25 g de semillas de calabaza","25 g de almendras laminadas","50 g de nueces pecanas, partidas aproximadamente en mitades","50 g de pasas (sin aceite añadido)","2 botes de 150ml de yogur natural bio desnatado","2 nectarinas o melocotones maduros, sin hueso y en rodajas"]','["Remojar el trigo sarraceno durante la noche en agua fría. Al día siguiente, escurrir y enjuagar el trigo sarraceno. Pon los dátiles en una cacerola con 300 ml de agua y la canela, y bate con una batidora hasta que estén completamente suaves. Agregue el trigo sarraceno, lleve a ebullición y cocine, sin tapar, durante 5 minutos hasta que esté pulposo. Mientras tanto, caliente el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2 y forre dos bandejas para hornear grandes con papel para hornear.","Agrega la avena y el aceite a la mezcla de dátiles y trigo sarraceno, luego vierte pequeños racimos de la mezcla en las bandejas para hornear. Hornee durante 15 minutos, luego raspe con cuidado los racimos del pergamino si se han pegado y voltéelos antes de extenderlos nuevamente. Regrese al horno por otros 15 minutos, volteando con frecuencia, hasta que esté firme y dorado.","Cuando la mezcla esté lo suficientemente seca, viértala en un bol, mezcle las semillas y las nueces con las pasas y mezcle bien. Cuando esté frío, sirva a cada persona un puñado generoso con yogur y fruta, y guarde el exceso en un recipiente hermético. Se mantendrá durante una semana. El resto de días puedes variar la fruta o servir con leche o una alternativa sin lácteos en lugar del yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:03:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14738,4679,'es','gachas de quinua','Recargue su mañana con quinua rica en proteínas y semillas de chía ricas en omega-3 para un desayuno cremoso cubierto con fruta de temporada.','["175 g de quinua","½ vaina de vainilla, partida y sin semillas, o ½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","15 g de crema de coco","4 cucharadas de semillas de chía","125 g de yogur de coco","125 g de yogur de coco en bote","280 g de bayas de verano variadas, como fresas, frambuesas y arándanos","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas (opcional)"]','["Activa la quinua remojándola durante la noche en agua fría. Al día siguiente, escurre y enjuaga la quinua con un colador fino (los granos son tan pequeños que se pasarían por uno grueso).","Vierta la quinoa en una cacerola y agregue la vainilla, la crema de coco y 600 ml de agua. Tape la cacerola y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos. Agrega la chía con otros 300 ml de agua y cocina a fuego lento durante 3 minutos más. Agrega la olla de yogur de coco. Vierta la mitad de la papilla en un bol para otro día. Se conservará tapado durante 2 días en el frigorífico. Sirva la papilla restante cubierta con otra taza de yogur, las bayas y las almendras, si lo desea.","Para tener la papilla otro día, verter en una cacerola y recalentar suavemente, con leche o agua. Cubra con fruta, por ejemplo, rodajas de naranja y semillas de granada."]','2026-01-11 13:03:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14739,4681,'es','Panes integrales con judías y huevo escalfado','Este plato saludable y sabroso lo convierte en un brunch realmente sustancioso; si desayunas más temprano, puedes servir la mitad de los frijoles.','["2 huevos","500 g de puré de cartón","2 cebollas pequeñas, en cuartos","1 dátil Medjool, apedreado","3 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes escurridas","100 g de harina integral","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 gramos de yogur natural"]','["Coloca la passata en un procesador de alimentos con la cebolla, los dátiles y el pimentón, y mezcla hasta que esté completamente suave. Caliente en una sartén mediana, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, para hacer una salsa espesa y pulposa. Pruebe para asegurarse de que la cebolla esté completamente cocida. Si no, añade un chorrito de agua y cocina un poco más. Agrega el vinagre y los frijoles y luego retira del fuego.","Para hacer panes planos, vierta la harina y el polvo para hornear en un tazón, luego agregue el yogur para hacer una masa suave. Vierta sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase ligeramente, incorporando completamente la harina que quede en el tazón. Reduce la mezcla a la mitad y aplana cada pieza hasta obtener un óvalo rugoso, usando las manos o un rodillo, hasta obtener un grosor de dos monedas de £1. Haz cortes en el centro de los óvalos un par de veces con un cuchillo afilado, teniendo cuidado de no cortar un borde.","Caliente una sartén grande antiadherente, agregue un pan plano y cocine durante 1 minuto por cada lado hasta que esté firme y ligeramente inflado, luego repita con el otro. Mientras tanto, calienta una cacerola grande con agua y escalfa los huevos a tu gusto.","Calienta los frijoles y sírvelos encima de cada pan plano con un huevo escalfado y un poco de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:03:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14740,4683,'es','Ensalada de hinojo, granada y habas','Esta ensalada de trigo bulgur y hierbas picadas es una guarnición deliciosa para llevar a un picnic: rocíe el aderezo antes de servir.','["200 g de trigo bulgar","manojo pequeño de menta, finamente picada","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","manojo pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","1 bulbo de hinojo, cortado en cuartos, sin corazón y en rodajas finas","200 g de semillas de granada","350 g (peso sin pelar) de habas frescas o congeladas","2 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza","un puñado grande de rúcula o berros","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","5 cucharadas de aceite de colza o de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon"]','["Hervir la tetera y poner en un bol el trigo bulgar con una buena pizca de sal. Vierta suficiente agua hirviendo para cubrir el bulghar, cubra con film transparente y reserve durante 10 minutos.","Pon los ingredientes para el aderezo en un tarro de mermelada o en una botella pequeña con un poco de condimento, enrosca la tapa y agita bien. Destape el trigo bulgar y, si queda algo de agua en el recipiente, escúrralo y luego viértalo en un recipiente grande para transportarlo. Agregue las hierbas, el hinojo, las semillas de granada, las habas y las semillas de calabaza, y mezcle todo. Cubra con las hojas de ensalada y empaquete el frasco de mermelada del aderezo para ensalada por separado.","Antes de servir, rocíe el aderezo y mezcle todo."]','2026-01-11 13:03:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14741,4685,'es','Bandeja horneada de pollo y patatas nuevas','Coloque los muslos de pollo y las papas en una olla y áselos con aceitunas, limón, ajo y hojas de laurel para un almuerzo o cena tranquilo de fin de semana.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","500 g de patatas nuevas","140 g de aceitunas verdes grandes sin hueso","1 limón, en cuartos","8 hojas de laurel frescas","6 dientes de ajo, sin pelar","4 muslos de pollo grandes","bolsa de berros u hojas de ensalada, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta el aceite de oliva en una fuente grande para asar y agregue las patatas, las aceitunas, los cuartos de limón, las hojas de laurel y el ajo. Mezcle todo para que quede cubierto de aceite y distribuido uniformemente. Agrega los muslos de pollo, con la piel hacia arriba, y sazona.","Coloque la fuente para asar en el horno y ase durante 1 hora, rociando con el jugo de la fuente a mitad de la cocción. Después de 1 hora, verifique que las papas estén suaves y que el pollo esté bien cocido, luego regrese al horno por los últimos 15 minutos para que la piel del pollo quede crujiente.","Retire la fuente para asar del horno. Presione los dientes de ajo asados ​​con el dorso de una cuchara, deseche la piel y mezcle el puré de ajo con los jugos de la carne. Sirva con berros o sus hojas de ensalada favoritas como acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 13:03:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14742,4687,'es','Ensalada de cinta de calabacín','Utilice un espiralizador para crear esta ensalada cruda, fresca y picante: perfecta con pollo o pescado a la parrilla y cubierta con queso feta o de cabra desmenuzado.','["jugo 1 limon","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","½ paquete pequeño de cebollino, picado","½ paquete pequeño de menta, picada","300 g de calabacines"]','["En un bol grande vierte el jugo de limón y sazona bien con sal y pimienta. Agrega el aceite de oliva y luego agrega las hierbas picadas.","Pase el calabacín por el espiralizador sobre su accesorio grande para fideos e incline las cintas en el recipiente con el aderezo. Mezcle todo y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:03:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14743,4689,'es','Curry caribeño afrutado','Los frijoles y las verduras hacen que los muslos de pollo vayan más allá con este curry dulce y picante: incluya 4 de sus 5 al día en una abundante comida familiar.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","4 muslos de pollo, sin piel","2 cebollas rojas grandes, picadas","2 pimientos (cualquier color servirá), picados","3-4 cucharadas de curry suave en polvo","Lata de 425 g de piña en trozos en jugo sin azúcar","lata de 400g de leche de coco","Lata de 400 g de frijoles rojos, escurridos","2-4 cucharadas de salsa de pimiento picante (dependiendo de qué tan picante te guste)","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","arroz cocido, para servir (usamos arroz con coco Tilda)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Agregue el pollo y dórelo bien por todos lados, luego transfiéralo a un plato. Agregue las cebollas y los pimientos a la sartén y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que las verduras comiencen a ablandarse. Regresa el pollo a la sartén y espolvorea el curry en polvo, luego agrega la piña con su jugo y la leche de coco. Sazone y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 40 minutos hasta que el pollo esté tierno y la salsa se haya reducido y espesado un poco.","Agrega los frijoles y la salsa de pimienta a la sartén. Cocine a fuego lento durante otros 2-3 minutos hasta que los frijoles estén bien calientes, luego espolvoree con cilantro y sirva con arroz cocido."]','2026-01-11 13:03:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14744,4691,'es','Gumbo de pollo fácil','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una cazuela cálida de inspiración cajún con tocino ahumado, pimientos y okra, perfecta para servir con arroz y frijoles.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","200 g de tocino ahumado","1 cebolla, rebanada","Paquete de 130g de pimientos de Padrón, sin rabo y cortados en rodajas (o 1 guindilla verde y 100g de pimiento verde)","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos pequeños","3 cucharadas de harina común","1 cucharada de mezcla de especias cajún","3 dientes de ajo machacados","500 ml de caldo de pollo","Paquete de 175 g de okra, en rodajas (o 2 calabacines, en rodajas)","500 g de puré de cartón","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","arroz cocido y frijoles negros, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, agrega los mantecas y la cebolla y fríe durante 5 minutos hasta que el tocino comience a estar crujiente y la cebolla esté suave. Agrega los pimientos, el pollo y la harina y sofríe durante 5 minutos más o hasta que el pollo esté dorado y la harina empiece a tomar un color bizcocho.","Agregue la mezcla de especias cajún y el ajo, luego agregue lentamente el caldo de pollo, revolviendo todo el tiempo. Agregue la okra, la passata y un poco de condimento y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos, sin tapar, a fuego medio. Revuelva con frecuencia durante la cocción para soltar la harina de la base de la sartén.","Espolvoree sobre las cebolletas y sirva con arroz y frijoles negros."]','2026-01-11 13:03:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14745,4693,'es','Lubina asada con miel y naranja con lentejas','Dale vida a tus comidas entre semana con esta cena de pescado baja en calorías y sin gluten, lista en menos de media hora.','["2 filetes grandes de lubina con piel (u otro pescado blanco - ver consejo)","ralladura y jugo de ½ naranja","2 cucharaditas de miel clara","2 cucharaditas de mostaza integral","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","Bolsa de 250 g de lentejas puy listas para comer.","100 g de berros","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque cada filete de lubina, con la piel hacia abajo,\r\nen cuadrados individuales de papel de aluminio. Mezcle la ralladura de naranja, la miel, la mostaza, 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva y un poco de condimento, y rocíelo sobre los filetes. Levante los lados del papel de aluminio y junte los bordes para formar paquetes individuales. Coloque los paquetes en una bandeja para hornear y hornee en el horno durante 10 minutos hasta que el pescado esté apenas cocido y se desmenuce fácilmente al presionarlo con un cuchillo.","Calienta las lentejas siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego mézclalas con el jugo de naranja, el aceite restante, los berros, las hierbas y los condimentos. Divida las lentejas en 2 platos y cubra cada uno con un filete de lubina. Rocíe sobre los jugos tostados que queden atrapados en el papel de aluminio y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:03:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14746,4695,'es','Sopa especiada de pollo y frijoles negros con col rizada','Utilice las sobras de pollo asado o ya cocido en esta saludable y cálida sopa estilo sudamericano, condimentada con comino y chile.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva suave","2 dientes de ajo gordos, machacados","manojo pequeño de tallos de cilantro finamente picados y hojas recogidas","rallar 1 lima y luego cortarla en gajos","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, enjuagados y escurridos","600 ml de caldo de pollo","175 g de col rizada, sin tallos gruesos y hojas ralladas","250 g sobras de pollo asado o ya cocido","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado, para servir","tortillas de harina y maíz, tostadas, para servir (ver consejo)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande, agrega el ajo, los tallos de cilantro y la ralladura de lima, luego fríe durante 2 minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Agregue el comino y las hojuelas de chile, fría durante 1 minuto más y luego agregue los tomates, los frijoles y el caldo. Llevar a ebullición y luego triturar los frijoles contra el fondo de la cacerola unas cuantas veces con un machacador de patatas. Esto espesará un poco la sopa.","Agrega la col rizada a la sopa, cocina a fuego lento durante 5 minutos o hasta que esté tierna, luego agrega el pollo y deja que se caliente. Sazone al gusto con sal, pimienta y jugo de media lima, luego sirva en tazones poco profundos, espolvoreado con queso feta y algunas hojas de cilantro. Sirva la lima restante en gajos para la mesa, con las tortillas tostadas a un lado. Cuanto más tiempo dejes el pollo en la sartén, más espesa se volverá la sopa, así que agrega un poco más de caldo si no puedes servir la sopa de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:03:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14747,4697,'es','Crepes de coco con salsa de frambuesa','Salpicados con coco desecado para darle más textura, estos panqueques rociados con una salsa de frutas son un delicioso brunch o postre bajo en azúcar.','["200 g de frambuesas","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz","2 cucharaditas de jarabe de arce","140 g de harina común","2 huevos grandes","300ml de leche de coco","2 cucharadas de coco rallado tostado","un poco de aceite de girasol, para freír"]','["Reserva 6 de las frambuesas. Mezclar la harina de maíz con 1 cucharada de agua hasta que quede suave. Mida 300 ml de agua en una cacerola y agregue la pasta de harina de maíz. Calentar, revolviendo, hasta que espese. Agregue las frambuesas restantes y cocine a fuego lento, triturando las bayas hasta obtener una pulpa. Cuele la mezcla a través de un colador en un tazón para quitar las semillas, empujando la mayor cantidad de mezcla que pueda. Corta en cuartos las frambuesas reservadas y agrégalas a la salsa, junto con el jarabe de arce.","Para hacer las crepes, vierta la harina y una pizca de sal en una jarra grande, luego agregue los huevos, la leche de coco, 200 ml de agua y 11/2 cucharada de coco tostado para obtener una masa con la consistencia de una nata doble. Diluir con un poco más de agua si queda demasiado espesa. Calentar una sartén pequeña con un chorrito de aceite, luego verter un poco de masa, moviendo la sartén para que cubra completamente la base. Dejar reposar al fuego durante 1 minuto, luego darle la vuelta con cuidado y cocinar el otro lado unos segundos más. Transfiera a un plato y repita con la masa restante hasta tener al menos 12. Revuelva la masa para redistribuir el coco a medida que lo use. Sirve 2 crepes por persona con un chorrito de la salsa y un poco del coco tostado restante."]','2026-01-11 13:03:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14748,4699,'es','Sopa de col rizada y manzana con nueces','Aprovecha al máximo la col rizada de temporada y dale profundidad a esta sopa con manzana dulce y una cobertura crujiente de nueces: perfecta como almuerzo saludable.','["8 mitades de nueces, partidas en pedazos","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 zanahorias, ralladas gruesas","2 manzanas rojas, sin pelar y finamente picadas","1 cucharada de vinagre de sidra","500 ml de caldo de verduras reducido en sal","200 g de col rizada, picada en trozos grandes","Paquete de 20 g de chips de manzana secos (opcional)"]','["En una sartén antiadherente seca, cocina los trozos de nuez durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén tostados, volteándolos con frecuencia para que no se quemen. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Poner la cebolla, las zanahorias, las manzanas, el vinagre y el caldo en una cacerola grande y llevar a ebullición. Reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Una vez que la cebolla esté traslúcida y las manzanas comiencen a ablandarse, agregue la col rizada y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos más. Transfiera con cuidado a una licuadora o licuadora y mezcle hasta que esté muy suave. Vierta en tazones y sirva cubierto con nueces tostadas y una pizca de patatas fritas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:03:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14749,4701,'es','Panzanella de invierno de manzana y calabaza','Dale un toque de temporada a la clásica ensalada italiana de tomate y pan duro con avellanas, arándanos, calabaza y manzana.','["½ calabaza grande, cortada en trozos","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","6 hojas de salvia, picadas","2 manzanas, sin corazón y cortadas en gajos finos","3 cucharadas de miel clara","4 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","200 g de pan crujiente sobrante (nosotros usamos ciabatta), cortado en trozos","100 g de avellanas, picadas en trozos grandes","Bolsa de 200 g de col rizada picada","100 g de arándanos secos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque la calabaza en una bandeja para hornear, rocíe con 1 cucharada de aceite y esparza sobre la salvia y un poco de condimento. Mezcle y luego hornee por 30 minutos.","Agrega las rodajas de manzana a la bandeja, rocía con la miel y mezcla con la calabaza. Pon el pan en una bandeja aparte y regresa ambas bandejas al horno. Hornee por otros 10-15 minutos hasta que la calabaza y la manzana estén tiernas y comiencen a caramelizarse, y el pan esté crujiente. Mientras tanto, tuesta las avellanas en una sartén pequeña hasta que estén doradas. Retirar las bandejas del horno y dejar enfriar un poco.","Batir el aceite restante, la miel y el vinagre en un bol grande con un poco de condimento. Agrega la col rizada, los arándanos, las avellanas, las calabazas y el pan tostado. Mezcle todo y luego transfiéralo a un plato o platos para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14750,4703,'es','Guiso brasileño de gambas y coco','Dale a los langostinos un toque brasileño en este guiso picante de coco, langostinos y judías verdes, cubierto con maní salado y servido con arroz.','["300 g de arroz de grano largo","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1-2 chiles rojos (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante), finamente picados","200ml de leche de coco","400 g de tomates cortados en cubitos","200 g de judías verdes, cubiertas y cortadas por la mitad","300 g de langostinos crudos pelados","jugo 1 lima","cilantro en paquete pequeño, picado","50 g de maní tostado sin sal, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Ponga a hervir agua en una cacerola y cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, agrega la cebolla, el ajo y los chiles y cocina durante 10 minutos a fuego lento hasta que estén tiernos. Agrega la leche de coco y deja hervir durante otros 4 minutos.","Agregue los tomates y los frijoles y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que los tomates comiencen a colapsar. Agregue los langostinos y cocine durante 3 minutos hasta que estén rosados ​​y bien cocidos.","Agrega el jugo de lima, espolvorea sobre el cilantro y las nueces y sirve con el arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:03:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14751,4706,'es','Wraps picantes de pollo y aguacate','Freír la pechuga de pollo magra con lima, chile y ajo y luego apilarla sobre tortillas sin semillas. Déjelo enfriar antes de armar si empaca para el almuerzo.','["1 pechuga de pollo (aproximadamente 180 g), cortada en rodajas finas en ángulo","jugo generoso exprimido ½ lima","½ cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","2 wraps sin semillas","1 aguacate, partido por la mitad y sin hueso","1 pimiento rojo asado de un frasco, en rodajas","unas ramitas de cilantro picado"]','["Mezclar el pollo con el jugo de limón, el chile en polvo y el ajo.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y luego fríe el pollo durante un par de minutos; se cocinará muy rápido, así que mantente atento. Mientras tanto, calienta los wraps siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete o, si tienes placa de gas, caliéntalos al fuego para que se quemen ligeramente. No dejes que se sequen o serán difíciles de enrollar.","Aplasta medio aguacate en cada wrap, agrega los pimientos a la sartén para calentarlos, luego apila los wraps con el pollo y espolvorea sobre el cilantro. Enrollar, cortar por la mitad y comer con los dedos."]','2026-01-11 13:03:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14752,4708,'es','Buñuelos verdes','Disfrute de un desayuno saludable que lo mantendrá satisfecho por más tiempo, con huevos y brócoli y calabacines de un verde vibrante para obtener proteínas, vitaminas y minerales.','["140 g de calabacines rallados","3 huevos medianos","85 g de floretes de brócoli, finamente picados","paquete pequeño de eneldo, picado en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de harina sin gluten o harina de arroz","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol, para freír"]','["Exprime los calabacines entre tus manos para eliminar el exceso de humedad, o colócalos sobre un paño de cocina limpio y gíralo para exprimir la humedad.","Batir los huevos en un bol, añadir el brócoli, los calabacines y la mayor parte del eneldo y mezclar. Agrega la harina, vuelve a mezclar y sazona.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente. Coloque una cucharada grande de la mezcla en la sartén, luego agregue 2 cucharadas más para tener 3 buñuelos. Déjelo durante 3-4 minutos a fuego medio hasta que esté dorado por un lado y lo suficientemente sólido como para darle la vuelta, luego déle la vuelta y déjelo dorar por el otro lado. Repita para hacer 3 buñuelos más (no es necesario agregar más aceite a la sartén después del primer lote). Espolvorea con el eneldo restante para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14753,4710,'es','Filetes de berenjena asada al miso con boniato','Ase rodajas gruesas de berenjena con miso, ajo y jengibre, luego sírvalas con trozos de batata para una cena vegetariana abundante.','["1 berenjena grande (unos 375 g)","2 cucharadas de pasta de miso marrón (usamos Clearspring)","350 g de batatas, sin pelar y cortadas en gajos gruesos","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","1 diente de ajo rallado","una pizca de sal rosa del Himalaya","8 cebolletas, cortadas en diagonal","paquete pequeño de perejil, hojas picadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Pela la berenjena con un pelador de patatas y esparce la pasta de miso por todas partes; la mejor forma de hacerlo es con el dorso de una cuchara.","Ponlo en una fuente para asar junto con los gajos de boniato. Vierta 225 ml de agua hirviendo en la base del molde, luego agregue el aceite, el jengibre y el ajo. Espolvorea una pizca de sal sobre los gajos y colócalos en el horno.","Después de 30 minutos, vierte otros 125 ml de agua hirviendo en la base del molde y hornea durante otros 20 minutos. Repita, añadiendo 50 ml de agua hirviendo y las cebolletas, y ase durante 10 minutos más. Compruebe que la berenjena esté cocida insertando un cuchillo en el centro; si está lista, se deslizará fácilmente hacia adentro y hacia afuera y la berenjena estará suave por dentro.","Espolvoree el perejil picado sobre las patatas gajos, corte la berenjena en filetes de 2 cm de grosor y sirva encima de las patatas. Si no hay salsa en el fondo de la lata, agregue 3 cucharadas de agua para aflojar el miso, luego vierta la salsa de miso sobre los filetes de berenjena y espolvoree con pimienta negra molida."]','2026-01-11 13:03:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14754,4712,'es','Sopa de nueces con crutones crujientes de salvia y manzana','La manzana y la salvia contrastan maravillosamente con la calabaza naturalmente dulce en este entrante para cena festiva bajo en grasa y sin gluten.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 calabaza, aproximadamente 1 kg, pelada, sin semillas y picada","3 cucharadas de Madeira o Jerez seco","500ml de caldo de verduras sin gluten, y un poco más si es necesario","1 cucharadita de salvia picada, más 20 hojas pequeñas, limpias y secas","aceite de girasol, para freír","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 manzana grande para comer, pelada, sin corazón y cortada en cubitos","unas pizcas de azúcar en polvo dorado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, agregar la cebolla y sofreír durante 5 minutos. Agrega el ajo y la calabaza y cocina por 5 minutos más. Vierta el Madeira y el caldo, agregue la salvia picada, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que la calabaza esté tierna.","Bate con una batidora de mano o en un procesador de alimentos hasta que esté completamente suave. Deje enfriar en la sartén, luego enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir. Se conservará durante 2 días o se congelará durante 3 meses. Para hacer salvia crujiente, caliente un poco de aceite (a una profundidad de aproximadamente 2 cm) en una sartén pequeña, luego agregue las hojas de salvia hasta que estén crujientes; deberá hacerlo en tandas. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina. Se mantendrá durante varias horas.","Justo antes de servir, recalienta la sopa en una sartén. La textura debe quedar bastante espesa y aterciopelada, pero diluyéndola con un poco de caldo si queda demasiado espesa.","Para los picatostes de manzana, calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, añadir la manzana y sofreír hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Espolvorea con el azúcar y revuelve hasta que esté ligeramente caramelizado.","Para servir, sirva la sopa en tazones pequeños y cubra con la manzana, la salvia y un poco de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:03:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14755,4714,'es','Gajos de batata especiados','Mezcle la batata con comino, chile y zumaque, luego hornee con limón y ajo para obtener chips gruesos que quedan crujientes pero esponjosos.','["2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharaditas de zumaque","2 cucharadas de hojas de tomillo, picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de hojas de romero, picadas en trozos grandes","3 dientes de ajo","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1¼ kg de batatas, cortadas en gajos"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Con un mortero, mezcle las especias, las hierbas, el ajo y un poco de condimento.","Vierta en un tazón grande y agregue la ralladura y el jugo de limón y el aceite. Agregue las papas y mezcle. Colóquelos, con la piel hacia abajo, en 2 bandejas para hornear y hornee durante 30 a 40 minutos hasta que estén suaves por dentro y crujientes por fuera."]','2026-01-11 13:03:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14756,4716,'es','Buñuelos de avena especiados con peras con caramelo de coco','Estos pasteles densos y con sabor a nuez no contienen lácteos, con leche de almendras, nuez moscada y canela, perfectos para un brunch o un capricho de fin de semana.','["250ml de leche de almendras","½ cucharadita de clavo molido","1 cucharadita de nuez moscada molida","4 cucharaditas de canela molida","100 g de copos de avena","3 huevos grandes","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","75 g de mantequilla de coco","2 peras Williams firmes, peladas, sin corazón y en rodajas finas","200 g de yogur de coco, para servir"]','["En una cacerola grande, combine la leche de almendras, los clavos, la nuez moscada y 3 cucharaditas de canela. Llevar a fuego lento. Agregue la avena y cocine durante 6 minutos a fuego lento, revolviendo constantemente, hasta que esté espesa y cremosa, como una papilla. Vierta en un tazón, cubra y deje enfriar durante 20 minutos.","Mientras esperas, prepara las peras acarameladas. Espolvorea el azúcar uniformemente sobre una sartén puesta a fuego lento. No lo revuelvas, espera hasta que comience a derretirse, volviéndose dorado oscuro aquí y allá. Cuando la mayor parte del azúcar se haya derretido, revuélvala suavemente para incorporar las zonas secas. Agrega 25 g de mantequilla de coco. Agrega las rodajas de pera con la canela restante, luego agrégalas al caramelo y cocina durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Dejar de lado.","Vuelva a la avena ahora, batiendo los huevos y ½ cucharadita de sal para hacer una masa suelta parecida a un panqueque. Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1 y poner los platos a calentar.","Derrita un poco de la mantequilla de coco restante en una sartén. Cuando esté caliente, agregue medio cucharón de masa espaciados y cocine durante 4 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que estén dorados. Retirar a un plato y mantener caliente en el horno. Continúe friendo los buñuelos y agregue más mantequilla de coco según sea necesario. Sirva los buñuelos cubiertos con una cucharada de yogur de coco seguido de las peras calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:03:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14757,4718,'es','Ensalada de papaya, brotes de soja y tirabeques','Combine verduras crujientes y nueces con papaya dulce en esta interesante guarnición, perfecta con platos principales con sabor asiático.','["175 g de tirabeques","175 g de brotes de soja","1 papaya, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en cubos","jugo 1 lima","25 g de maní sin sal","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca, rasgadas","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta, picadas"]','["Calienta una sartén grande a fuego alto. Agregue los tirabeques, los brotes de soja y 1 cucharada de agua y cocine durante 2-3 minutos. Retirar del fuego y agregar la papaya y el jugo de lima. Sirva espolvoreado con maní y hierbas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14758,4720,'es','Tortilla de espinacas y boniato','El camote le da un sabor diferente a esta saludable tortilla de inspiración española. Es perfecto para preparar antes de una noche de tapas.','["Bolsa de 300 g de hojas tiernas de espinacas.","8 cucharadas de aceite de oliva ligero","2 cebollas grandes, en rodajas finas","4 batatas medianas (800 g/ 1 lb 12 oz), peladas y cortadas en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","8 huevos grandes"]','["Coloque las espinacas en un colador grande y viértalas sobre una tetera con agua hirviendo. Escurrir bien y, cuando se enfríe un poco, exprimir hasta secar, procurando no triturar demasiado las espinacas.","Caliente 3 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén antiadherente de 25 cm con tapa, luego sude las cebollas durante 15 minutos hasta que estén muy suaves pero sin color. Agrega otras 3 cucharadas de aceite y agrega las patatas y el ajo. Mezclar con las cebollas, sazonar bien, tapar y cocinar a fuego suave durante otros 15 minutos más o menos hasta que las patatas estén muy tiernas. Remueve de vez en cuando para evitar que se peguen.","Batir los huevos en un tazón grande, agregar la papa y la cebolla cocidas y mezclar. Separar los grumos de espinacas, agregar a la mezcla y mezclar, tratando de no romper demasiado la papa.","Agrega 2 cucharadas más de aceite a la sartén y vierte la mezcla de batata y huevo. Cubra y cocine a fuego medio-bajo durante 20 minutos hasta que la base y los lados estén dorados y el centro esté casi cuajado. Pasa una espátula por los lados para evitar que se pegue.\r\n5 Para darle la vuelta a la tortilla, coloca un plato boca abajo sobre la sartén y luego dale la vuelta. Vuelva a colocar la tortilla en la sartén y cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos más hasta que esté cocida y dorada por completo. (No se preocupe si se rompe un poco en los bordes al darle la vuelta; se verá perfecto cuando esté bien cocido y listo). Continúe cocinando por el otro lado hasta que esté listo y dorado por completo. Nuevamente use una espátula para soltar la tortilla de los lados. Déjelo reposar durante 5 minutos, luego inclínelo sobre una tabla antes de cortarlo en gajos."]','2026-01-11 13:03:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14759,4722,'es','gazpacho verde','Pruebe esta versión deslumbrante de la clásica sopa española fría: esta versión está hecha con vegetales verdes, hierbas y yogur. Agregue cubitos de hielo de flores comestibles para una presentación muy especial.','["Bolsa de 100g de espinacas tiernas","2 dientes de ajo","1 pepino grande, sin semillas y picado","½ chile verde, sin semillas","½ paquete pequeño de perejil","½ paquete pequeño de albahaca","½ paquete pequeño de menta","1 aguacate maduro, sin hueso y pelado","4 cebolletas, cubiertas y con cola","200 gramos de yogur natural","2 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","un chorrito de aceite de oliva virgen extra o de colza","un puñado de brotes de guisantes","cubitos de hielo de flores comestibles, para servir (ver el consejo a continuación)"]','["Ponga todos los ingredientes, excepto el aceite, los brotes de guisantes y los cubitos de hielo, en un procesador de alimentos con una buena pizca de sal y pimienta y mezcle, agregando suficiente agua para obtener una consistencia espesa. Pruebe y agregue un poco más de vinagre y condimentos si es necesario. Enfríe por hasta 24 horas, o al menos 2 horas.","Para servir, divídalo en tazones de sopa poco profundos, coloque unos cuantos cubitos de hielo en cada tazón (vea el consejo a continuación) y agregue\r\nun poco de brotes de guisantes y un chorrito de aceite antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14760,4724,'es','Ensalada de calamares a la brasa','Marinar los calamares antes de cocerlos en la barbacoa o plancha les da un toque de sabor. Acompaña con ensalada de mango, aguacate y frijoles negros.','["800 g de calamares frescos preparados","ralladura de 3 limas (reserva el jugo para la ensalada y los gajos para servir)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","3 dientes de ajo, aplastados","1½ cucharadita de granos de pimienta mezclados, triturados","1 cebolla morada grande, finamente cortada","1 mango grande, cortado en trozos pequeños","1 chile rojo grande, finamente rallado (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante)","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, bien enjuagados y secos","3 ripe avocados","cilantro en paquete pequeño, solo las hojas, rasgado","aceite de oliva virgen extra, para rociar"]','["Calienta la barbacoa. Mientras tanto, marina los calamares durante al menos 30 minutos o hasta 4 horas. Primero, corta los tubos de calamar por todos lados a intervalos de 5 mm a 1 cm en cada lado, cortando la mayor parte de la carne pero dejando los lados intactos. Si hay tubos particularmente grandes, córtelos por la mitad a lo ancho. Poner en un bol no metálico con el resto de ingredientes de los calamares y dejar macerar.","Para la ensalada, mezcle la cebolla, el mango y la guindilla con el jugo de lima (de las limas utilizadas para los calamares) y una pizca de\r\nsal y déjalo por al menos 10 minutos, o hasta que la cebolla se ponga rosada. Agrega los frijoles a un lado del tazón.","Corte por la mitad, deshuese y coloque el aguacate en la ensaladera, luego agregue abundante condimento y sazone los calamares con sal marina.","Cuando la barbacoa esté lista, asa los tubos y tentáculos de los calamares durante no más de 11,2 minutos en total; la carne debería cambiar de grisácea a opaca y encogerse hasta formar una espiral en el lugar donde hiciste los cortes. Mezcle los ingredientes de la ensalada de manera muy grosera, apílelos en un plato y cubra con la\r\ncalamares picantes y cilantro. Rociar con aceite de oliva virgen extra y servir con\r\nrodajas de lima a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:03:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14761,4726,'es','tortilla de frutos rojos','Una tortilla de un huevo es un desayuno rico en proteínas. Si las bayas que estimulan el cerebro no son lo suficientemente dulces, agregue 1 cucharadita de miel','["1 huevo grande","1 cucharada de leche desnatada","3 pizcas de canela","½ cucharadita de aceite de colza","100 g de requesón","175 g de fresas, arándanos y frambuesas picadas"]','["Batir el huevo con la leche y la canela. Calienta aceite en una sartén antiadherente de 20 cm y vierte la mezcla de huevo, revolviendo para cubrir uniformemente la base. Cocine por unos minutos hasta que cuaje y se dore por debajo. No es necesario darle la vuelta.","Colóquelo en un plato, extiéndalo sobre el queso y luego espolvoree con las bayas. Enrollar y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14762,4728,'es','Bacalao especiado con ensalada de quinoa y chutney de menta','El pescado blanco sustentable y saciante, pero bajo en grasa, es una opción saludable. Sirva con una marinada de yogur de cilantro de inspiración india y ensalada de cereales.','["40g de quinoa (o 85g de quinoa precocida)","3 cucharadas de menta picada","3 cucharadas de cilantro picado","Bote de 150g yogur 0% natural","1 diente de ajo","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma","pizca de semillas de comino","2 x 150 g de filetes de pescado blanco sin piel, como el bacalao sostenible","¼ de pepino, finamente picado","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","4 tomates, picados","buen chorrito de jugo de limón"]','["Vierta la quinua (si no está precocida) en una sartén, cubra con agua y hierva tapada durante 25 minutos, verificando el nivel del agua para asegurarse de que no se seque. Escurrir bien.","Mientras tanto, ponga 2 cucharadas de menta y cilantro en un bol. Agrega el yogur y el ajo y bate con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Revuelva 2 cucharadas de yogur de hierbas con la cúrcuma y el comino, luego agregue el pescado y agregue la mezcla para cubrir completamente.","Enciende la parrilla a temperatura alta. Coloque el pescado en una fuente poco profunda resistente al calor y cocine a la parrilla durante 8 a 10 minutos, dependiendo del grosor, hasta que se desmenuce. Mezcle la quinua con el pepino, la cebolla, los tomates, el jugo de limón y las hierbas restantes. Vierta en un plato, agregue el pescado y vierta alrededor del chutney de menta, o agréguelo en la mesa."]','2026-01-11 13:03:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14763,4730,'es','Hummus de pimientos y nueces con salsas vegetarianas','Acompañe las verduras con esta salsa rápida de preparar, acompañada de pimientos rojos dulces asados ​​y servida con bastones de calabacín, apio y zanahoria.','["Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 diente de ajo","1 pimiento rojo asado grande de un frasco (no en aceite), unos 100 g","1 cucharada de pasta de tahini","jugo ½ limón","4 mitades de nuez, picadas","2 calabacines, cortados en bastones","2 zanahorias, cortadas en bastones","2 ramas de apio, cortadas en bastones"]','["Pon en un bol los garbanzos, el ajo, la pimienta, el tahini y el zumo de limón. Bate con una batidora de mano o en un procesador de alimentos para hacer un puré espeso. Agrega las nueces. Empaque en ollas, si lo desea, y sirva con los palitos de verduras. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante 2 días, aunque es mejor preparar las verduras frescas para conservar sus vitaminas."]','2026-01-11 13:03:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14764,4732,'es','Batido de aguacate y fresa','Una mezcla cremosa apta para el desayuno, rica en calcio y baja en calorías.','["½ aguacate, deshuesado, pelado y cortado en trozos","150 g de fresas partidas por la mitad","4 cucharadas de yogur natural desnatado","200ml de leche semidesnatada","jugo de limón o lima, al gusto","miel, al gusto"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes en una licuadora y bate hasta que quede suave. Si la consistencia es demasiado espesa, agrega un poco de agua."]','2026-01-11 13:03:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14765,4734,'es','Chana masala (curry de garbanzos) con espinacas','Un curry súper saludable lleno de verduras con garbanzos, espinacas y tomates. Sirva este delicioso plato indio con relleno de arroz basmati integral.','["75 g de arroz basmati integral de cocción rápida","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla mediana, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 cm de jengibre, pelado y finamente picado o rallado","½ chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de pimentón","1 cucharadita de garam masala","Lata de 400g de tomates pera enteros","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","jugo ½ limón","Bolsa de 220 g de espinacas tiernas"]','["Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, caliente una sartén antiadherente grande o un wok y fría las semillas de comino durante 1 minuto, revolviendo con frecuencia, mientras revientan. Retirar y reservar.","En la misma sartén calentar el aceite, agregar la cebolla, el ajo, el jengibre y la guindilla y sofreír a fuego medio durante unos 3 minutos. Reduzca el fuego, agregue todas las especias, revuelva bien y cocine por 2 minutos más. Agregue los tomates, revolviendo y use el lado de una cuchara para partirlos en trozos más pequeños. Añade los garbanzos y 200ml de agua.","Deje hervir, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos antes de agregar el jugo de limón y las espinacas. Deje que las espinacas se ablanden y luego retire la sartén del fuego.","Divida el arroz en 2 tazones y sirva el curry. (Los sabores se intensifican a medida que se enfría, por lo que para obtener un sabor más completo, prepárelo más temprano en el día y vuelva a calentar lentamente antes de servir)."]','2026-01-11 13:03:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14766,4736,'es','Pollo cajún a la parrilla con ensalada de frijoles carita y lima y guacamole','Condimente su pollo con cayena, orégano, pimentón y tomillo y luego sírvalo en una ensalada tipo salsa y salsa de aguacate; esta receta es suficiente para el almuerzo del día siguiente.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","½ cucharadita de tomillo seco","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado o normal","¼ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel (cada una pesa 140 g)","200 g de judías de ojo negro en lata, escurridas (o mantequilla o judías cannellini)","2 tomates, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","85 g de maíz dulce en lata, escurrido","2 cebolletas, peladas y finamente picadas","25 g de tomates semisecos en aceite de un frasco, picados en trozos grandes","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 aguacate, sin hueso y pelado","¼ de chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","jugo 1 lima","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado"]','["Mezcle el aceite, las hierbas, las especias y el ajo en una bolsa grande con cierre hermético. Coloque las pechugas de pollo en la bolsa y mezcle bien hasta cubrir. Golpee el pollo con un rodillo para aplanarlo un poco, luego déjelo marinar durante al menos 15 minutos.","En un tazón grande, mezcle todos los ingredientes para la ensalada de frijoles. Revuelva bien y reserve.","Para el guacamole, saca la pulpa del aguacate y colócala en un tazón mediano, cortándola en trozos grandes con el costado de la cuchara. Agrega el resto de los ingredientes y mezcla bien. Si prefieres que tu guacamole quede más suave, machaca bien el aguacate con el aceite de oliva y el jugo de limón hasta que tenga la consistencia preferida antes de agregar los demás ingredientes.","Calienta la parrilla. Forre una bandeja para asar con papel de aluminio, coloque las pechugas de pollo encima y cocine a la parrilla durante 5 minutos, revisando ocasionalmente. Una vez que estén doradas, déles la vuelta y ase durante 5-7 minutos más. Revise la mitad de las pechugas después de 5 minutos y, si están bien cocidas, retírelas del fuego.","Reserva 2 pechugas de pollo y 2 cucharadas de guacamole para el sándwich abierto de centeno (ver \"combina bien\", a la derecha). Coloque 1 pechuga de pollo caliente en cada plato, con un poco de ensalada de frijoles y una cucharada de guacamole a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:03:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14767,4738,'es','Batido de piña y menta','Los batidos son más que frutas: esta mezcla verde también contiene espinacas, avena, semillas de lino y anacardos.','["200 g de piña, pelada, sin corazón y cortada en trozos","unas hojas de menta","50 g de hojas tiernas de espinacas","25 g de avena","2 cucharadas de linaza","un puñado de anacardos sin sal y sin tostar","jugo de limón fresco, al gusto"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes en una licuadora con 200 ml de agua y procesa hasta que quede suave. Si queda demasiado espesa, añade más agua (hasta 400ml) hasta conseguir la mezcla adecuada."]','2026-01-11 13:03:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14768,4742,'es','Ensalada de espárragos con huevo escalfado y líquido','Una ensalada estilo bistró sencilla y equilibrada, baja en calorías pero rica en sabor, textura y nutrición.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","200 g de remolacha cocida pelada (no en vinagre), cortada en trozos pequeños","2 puñados de hojas mixtas","¼ de pepino, cortado en bastones","8 espárragos, recortados","2 huevos grandes"]','["Vierta el aceite de oliva y el vinagre en un bol pequeño, mezcle bien y agregue la remolacha. Divida la mezcla de hojas y pepino en 2 platos.","Blanquear los espárragos en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 2 minutos, luego retirarlos y reservar. Rompe los huevos en la sartén y cocina a fuego lento durante 3 minutos hasta que las claras estén cocidas y las yemas comiencen a cuajar, pero aún líquidas. Retirar con una espumadera y escurrir sobre papel de cocina.","Mientras tanto, agregue la remolacha a los platos de ensalada, vierta sobre el aderezo y mezcle ligeramente. Cubra cada plato con espárragos y un huevo escalfado para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:03:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14769,4744,'es','Crepes de canela con mantequilla de nueces, plátano en rodajas y frambuesas','Utilice harina sin gluten en estos finos panqueques de desayuno servidos con mantequilla de almendras, fruta y limón.','["75 g de harina pan integral sin gluten","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 huevo mediano","225ml de leche semidesnatada","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza, para freír","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de almendras y nueces","1 plátano, en rodajas","140 g de frambuesas","rodajas de limon"]','["Vierta la harina en un tazón grande para mezclar con la canela. Agrega el huevo y la leche y bate vigorosamente hasta obtener una consistencia suave y fluida.","Coloca una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y añade un poco de aceite. Cuando el aceite empiece a calentarse, limpia la mayor parte con papel de cocina. Una vez que la sartén esté caliente, vierte una pequeña cantidad de la masa en el centro de la sartén y agítala hacia los lados de la sartén en una capa delgada. Deje cocinar, sin tocar, durante unos 2 minutos. Cuando esté dorado por debajo, darle la vuelta y cocinar 1 min más.","Transfiera a un plato caliente y cubra con papel de aluminio para mantenerlo caliente. Repita con la masa restante. Divide los panqueques calientes en 2 platos y sírvelos con la mantequilla de nueces, el plátano, las frambuesas y el limón para armar en la mesa."]','2026-01-11 13:03:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14770,4746,'es','Brunch de huevos al horno','Este desayuno vegetariano bajo en calorías con tomates secos, espinacas, puerros y queso es la forma perfecta de empezar el fin de semana.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 puerros, en rodajas finas","2 cebollas, en rodajas finas","2 bolsas de 100 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca","un puñado de pan rallado integral fresco","25 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), finamente rallado","4 tomates secos, picados","4 huevos medianos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calentar el aceite en una sartén y agregar los puerros, la cebolla y los condimentos. Cocine durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté suave y comience a caramelizar.","Mientras tanto, ponga las espinacas en un colador y vierta sobre una tetera con agua hirviendo. Cuando esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, exprima la mayor cantidad de líquido posible. Mezcle el pan rallado y el queso.","Coloque la mezcla de puerro y cebolla entre 4 fuentes para horno, luego espolvoree con las espinacas y los trozos de tomate seco. Haga un hueco en el medio de cada plato y rompa un huevo en él. Sazone y espolvoree con queso rallado. Coloque los platos en una bandeja para horno y cocine durante 12-15 minutos, hasta que las claras estén cuajadas y las yemas cocidas a su gusto."]','2026-01-11 13:04:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14771,4748,'es','Sabrosas albóndigas de pavo','Cambie la carne picada y el pan rallado por pavo magro y avena. Sirva en salsa de tomate con pasta o papas. Vea el consejo para hacer una versión vegetariana: Penne con hinojo y parmesano.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 zanahorias, finamente picadas","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","1 bulbo de hinojo, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas, reservando las hojas","Cartón de tomate puré de 500 g","500 ml de caldo de pollo reducido en sal","2 cucharadas de perejil picado","brócoli y patatas o pasta y ensalada, para servir","Paquete de 400 g de carne magra de pechuga de pavo picada","4 cucharadas de gachas de avena","1 cucharadita de semilla de hinojo, triturada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","spray de aceite"]','["Caliente el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande con tapa, luego agregue la cebolla, las zanahorias, el apio, el ajo y el hinojo y revuelva bien. Tapa la cacerola y cocina a fuego medio durante 8 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando. Verter la passata y el caldo, tapar y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, vierte la carne picada en un tazón grande. Agrega la avena, las semillas y hojas de hinojo, el ajo y abundante pimienta negra y mezcla con las manos. Forme ligeramente 25 albóndigas del tamaño de una nuez. Rocía o frota una sartén antiadherente con un poco de aceite y cocina suavemente las albóndigas hasta que cojan un poco de color. Revuelve la salsa, luego agrega las albóndigas y el perejil. Tape y cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que estén bien cocidos y las verduras en la salsa estén tiernas. Sirva con brócoli y patatas tiernas con piel, o pasta y ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:04:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14772,4752,'es','Ensalada de quinua y frutas de verano','Mejora este grano tan saludable con algunas frutas de hueso como albaricoques, melocotones y nectarinas; agrega un poco de menta y perejil para darle color y sabor.','["100g de quinua","3 melocotones o nectarinas, o 6 albaricoques, cortados en cubitos","50 g de avellanas tostadas, picadas en trozos grandes","un puñado de menta, picada en trozos grandes","un puñado de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón"]','["Pon la quinua en una cacerola mediana.\r\ny cubrir con 300ml de agua. llevar a la\r\nhervir y cocinar a fuego lento durante 20 minutos o hasta que\r\nla quinua está tierna. Escurrir cualquier exceso\r\nlíquido y dejar enfriar.","Añade la fruta, las avellanas, las hierbas y\r\nsazonar a la quinua enfriada.","Batir el aceite de oliva, el limón.\r\nralladura y jugo. Vierta sobre la ensalada\r\ny mezclar bien."]','2026-01-11 13:04:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14773,4754,'es','Guiso de tomate y calabacín','Sirva una guarnición sencilla y saludable de verduras cocidas a fuego lento con albahaca, ajo y queso parmesano.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","3 calabacines, el corte","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","manojo pequeño de albahaca, desmenuzado","25 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), finamente rallado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande sobre una\r\nfuego medio. Agregue la cebolla y cocine por\r\nunos 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden y comiencen\r\npara que se dore. Agrega el ajo y\r\ncocine por 5 minutos más.","Añade los calabacines y cocina durante\r\nunos 5 minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse. consejo\r\nen los tomates y darle a todo un\r\nbuen revuelo. Cocine a fuego lento durante 35-40 minutos o hasta\r\nSe reducen los tomates y los calabacines.\r\nsuave, luego agregue la albahaca y el parmesano."]','2026-01-11 13:04:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14774,4756,'es','Tortitas veganas de tomate y champiñones','No hay nada mejor que los panqueques para el brunch. Prueba a preparar esta deliciosa receta sin lácteos y sin huevo con una cobertura cremosa de tomate y champiñones.','["140 g de harina blanca con levadura","1 cucharadita de harina de soja","400ml soya milk","aceite vegetal, para freír","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","250 g de champiñones","250 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","2 cucharadas de crema de soja o leche de soja","un puñado grande de piñones","cebollino picado, para servir"]','["Tamizar las harinas y una pizca de sal\r\nuna licuadora. Añade la leche de soja y licúa.\r\npara hacer una masa suave.","Calentar un poco de aceite en una sartén mediana antiadherente.\r\nsartén hasta que esté muy caliente. verter sobre\r\n3 cucharadas de masa en la sartén y cocinar\r\na fuego medio hasta que aparezcan burbujas\r\nen la superficie del panqueque. Voltear el\r\npanqueque con una espátula y\r\ncocine el otro lado hasta que esté dorado.\r\nRepita con la masa restante,\r\nmantener calientes los panqueques cocidos\r\na medida que avanzas. Harás unos 8.","Para la cobertura calentar el aceite en una sartén.\r\nsartén. Cocine los champiñones hasta que estén tiernos,\r\nagregue los tomates y cocine por un par\r\nde minutos. Vierta la crema de soja o la leche.\r\ny piñones, luego cocine suavemente hasta\r\ncombinado. Divida los panqueques entre\r\n2 platos, luego vierta sobre los tomates.\r\ny setas. Espolvorear con cebollino."]','2026-01-11 13:04:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14775,4758,'es','Flan de tomate cherry, tomillo y bacon','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Un plato sabroso y abundante especialmente adecuado para quienes siguen una dieta sin lácteos.','["50 g de harina integral","85 g de margarina vegetal para hornear","100 g de harina común","1 huevo grande, batido","150g de Yofu natural (un yogur 100% sin lácteos)","1 cebolla pequeña, picada","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","4 cucharadas de leche de soja","hojas de 2 ramitas de tomillo, más algunas ramitas adicionales","150 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","2 lonchas gruesas de tocino sin ahumar, picado"]','["Precalentar el horno a 220C/gas 7/\r\nventilador 200C. Pon las harinas en un bol.\r\ny frotar con la margarina hasta que\r\nse parece al pan rallado. Mezclar\r\n4-5 cucharaditas de agua para suavizar\r\nmasa. Encender a fuego ligeramente enharinado.\r\nsuperficie, extender y utilizar para forrar un molde para flan de 20 cm. Línea con horneado\r\npergamino, cubrir con hornear\r\nfrijoles y hornee por 5 minutos.\r\nRetire el papel y los frijoles y\r\nhornee por 5 minutos más. Permitir\r\nenfriar sobre una rejilla. reducir el horno\r\na 160C/gas 3/horno con ventilador 140C.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén y cocinar.\r\nel tocino y la cebolla hasta que estén crujientes.\r\nRetirar del fuego.","Mezclar la leche de soja, Yofu,\r\nhuevos y hojas de tomillo. Temporada\r\nbueno. Poner la cebolla, el tocino y\r\ntomates en el caso del flan. Añadir\r\nla mezcla de leche y cubra con\r\nramitas adicionales de tomillo encima. hornear\r\ndurante 30 minutos hasta que cuaje."]','2026-01-11 13:04:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14776,4760,'es','Panna cotta con compota de albaricoque','Una panna cotta sin lácteos y con leche de soja. La textura perfecta y la combinación de sabores hacen que este plato sea difícil de criticar.','["3 cucharaditas rasas de gelatina (o agar agar)","500 ml de leche de soja (nosotros usamos So Good)","ralladura de 1 limón","1 vaina de vainilla, partida","chorrito de brandy de ron","25 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","350 g de albaricoques maduros","50 g de azúcar en polvo"]','["Espolvoree la gelatina sobre 3 cucharadas de agua y déjela en remojo durante 5 minutos. Poner en una cacerola la leche de soja, la ralladura, la vaina de vainilla, el azúcar y el ron. Calentar hasta que el líquido empiece a hervir, luego retirar del fuego y agregar la gelatina. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos. Cuela la mezcla de leche y luego divídela en 4 moldes. Cubra y refrigere hasta que cuaje (aproximadamente 1½ horas).","Cortar por la mitad y deshuesar los albaricoques. Poner el azúcar y 150 ml de agua en una cacerola y calentar hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Agrega los albaricoques y cocina a fuego suave durante 12-15 minutos o hasta que los albaricoques estén suaves, luego déjalos enfriar. Servir en un plato junto con la panna cotta."]','2026-01-11 13:04:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14777,4762,'es','Ensalada caliente de carne BBQ, rábano picante y pasta','Un plato de pasta apto para alérgicos que todos disfrutarán. Perfecto para huéspedes con intolerancias alimentarias.','["450 g de filetes magros de lomo","2 cucharadas de salsa inglesa sin lácteos ni trigo","2 cucharaditas de pimienta negra molida gruesa","250 g de pasta fusilli ''libre de'' (usamos Sainsbury''s)","1 manojo de cebolleta, en rodajas finas","3 pimientos rojos, asados ​​para quitarles la piel, sin semillas y en rodajas gruesas","manojo pequeño de albahaca, desmenuzado","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","2-3 cucharadas de rábano picante recién rallado, al gusto"]','["Marine el bistec en la salsa inglesa durante 10 minutos y espolvoree con pimienta negra.","Cocine la pasta según las instrucciones del paquete, escúrrala y luego mezcle con las cebolletas, los pimientos y la albahaca. mezclar el aderezo\r\ningredientes juntos, sazonar y luego reservar.","Calienta la barbacoa o una plancha hasta que esté muy caliente. Cocine el bistec durante 3 minutos por cada lado o hasta que esté cocido a su gusto. Córtelo en rodajas gruesas y luego mézclelo con la pasta con el aderezo. Rectifica el condimento al gusto y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14778,4764,'es','Arroz cremoso con doble albaricoques','¡Prueba de que puedes preparar un pudín sencillo sin lácteos para que lo disfrute toda la familia!','["50 g de arroz con leche","Caja de 500 ml de alternativa a la leche de soja endulzada con sabor a vainilla de larga duración (nosotros utilizamos vainilla ecológica UHT Provamel)","50 g de orejones listos para comer, cortados en trozos pequeños","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","Alternativa a la crema única de soja en cartón de 250 ml (nosotros utilizamos UHT Provamel Soya Dream)","8 cucharadas de compota de albaricoque o 4 cucharadas de conserva de albaricoque","1 cucharada de pistachos sin cáscara, picados"]','["Pon el arroz y la leche de soja en una cacerola mediana, revuelve y deja hervir. Reduzca el fuego inmediatamente o la soja burbujeará y se desbordará fácilmente. Cubra la sartén hasta la mitad y cocine a fuego lento durante 40-45 minutos a fuego muy lento, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que el arroz se haya hinchado y esté muy tierno. La mezcla debe quedar espesa y cremosa.","Mientras se cocina el arroz, mezcle\r\njuntos los albaricoques, el azúcar\r\ny alternativa de crema única.","Retire el arroz del\r\ncalentar, dejar enfriar durante 15\r\nminutos, luego agregue el albaricoque\r\nmezcla. Vierta en 4 pequeños\r\nvasos o platos de cristal.\r\nTapar y enfriar en el frigorífico durante\r\n30 minutos (o más si\r\ntener tiempo).","Para servir, vierta dos cucharadas de\r\ncompota de albaricoque o 1 cucharada de\r\nconservar encima de cada uno\r\npostre y esparcir el\r\npistachos encima."]','2026-01-11 13:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14779,4766,'es','Pastel de arándanos y coco','Este postre sin lácteos es un placer para el público garantizado e incluso se puede congelar.','["250 ml de aceite de salvado de arroz, más un poco más para la lata","3 huevos","225 g de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","300 g de harina con levadura","50 g de coco rallado","175 ml de leche de soja","140 g de arándanos frescos o congelados, más un extra para servir","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4\r\ny engrasar un molde Bundt o de aro de 22 cm.\r\nBatir el aceite, los huevos, el azúcar y la vainilla.\r\nun tazón grande. Combine la harina y\r\ncoco. Alternativamente, doble la mezcla de harina\r\ny leche de soja en los ingredientes húmedos,\r\ncomenzando y terminando con la harina.","Vierta una cuarta parte en la lata. Doblar el\r\narándanos en la masa restante, luego\r\nvierta en la lata. Hornee durante 1-1¼ horas, o\r\nhasta que al pinchar una brocheta salga limpia. Portada\r\nel pastel con papel de aluminio si se dora demasiado rápido.","Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 10 minutos y luego desmoldar.\r\nsobre una rejilla y dejar enfriar por completo. Rellenar\r\ncentro del pastel con arándanos extra\r\ny espolvorear con azúcar glas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14780,4768,'es','Fricassée de pollo con patatas nuevas y espárragos','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Deliciosa cazuela sin lácteos con salsa cremosa de sidra.','["1 cucharada de aceite de maní","4 lonjas magras de tocino ahumado, picadas y sin cáscara","6 filetes de pechuga de pollo sin piel","700 g de patatas nuevas, en rodajas gruesas","250 g de espárragos, recortados y cortados en diagonal (mantenga las puntas enteras)","225 ml de sidra afrutada seca (o ½ lata)","1 cucharada de harina de maíz, licuada con un poco de agua","Caja de 250ml Soja Sueño","2 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana picado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, luego fríe el tocino durante 5 minutos a fuego medio hasta que esté dorado. Retirar con una espumadera y reservar. Agregue el pollo a la sartén, luego fríalo durante 4-5 minutos para que se dore por ambos lados (es posible que deba dorar el pollo en dos tandas si su sartén no es lo suficientemente grande).","Mientras tanto, cocine las patatas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 10 minutos o hasta que estén tiernas. Cocine los espárragos en una vaporera sobre las patatas durante 6-8 minutos o en el microondas en un plato tapado con 2 cucharadas de agua durante 4-5 minutos.","Vierta la sidra sobre el pollo, déjelo hervir y reduzca el fuego. Vuelva a colocar el tocino en la sartén y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Agregue la pasta de harina de maíz hasta que espese ligeramente, luego agregue Soya Dream y sazone. Agregue las verduras escurridas y espolvoree con perejil picado antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14781,4770,'es','Pollo al horno cremoso al estragón','Sin gluten, huevo ni lácteos: este es el plato perfecto para cenas para personas con intolerancias.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cucharada de harina de arroz (nosotros usamos Doves Farm)","300ml de leche de soja (nosotros usamos So Good)","4 pechugas de pollo, sin piel","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos","250 g de tomates cherry en canastilla, cortados por la mitad","250 g de espárragos escaldados","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","150ml de caldo de verduras (nosotros utilizamos caldo de verduras sin levadura Kallo)","3 cucharadas de estragón picado","4 cucharadas de pan rallado sin gluten (usamos muffins ingleses ''Free From'' de Sainsbury)","1 cucharada de lácteos rallado y queso sin lactosa (nosotros usamos Cheezly)"]','["Mezclar la mitad del aceite y la harina en una cacerola (fuera\r\nel fuego), luego mezcle la leche de soja (debe\r\nestar bien mezclado antes de calentar). trae el\r\nsalsa lentamente hasta que hierva, batiendo constantemente,\r\nluego cocine a fuego lento durante 1 min. Retirar del fuego,\r\ncubrir con papel vegetal y reservar.","Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Calentar\r\naceite restante en una sartén, agregue el pollo,\r\nluego freír durante 2-3 minutos o hasta que se dore (no\r\nestar bien cocido). Transfiera a una refractaria para horno.\r\nplato gratinado. Agrega las cebollas a la sartén y sofríe.\r\ndurante 2-3 minutos. Vierta sobre el pollo, luego\r\ncubra con los tomates y los espárragos. conjunto\r\na un lado mientras preparas la salsa.","Pon el azúcar y el vinagre en la sartén.\r\nRevuelva a fuego medio hasta que el azúcar esté oscuro.\r\ncolor caramelo y luego añadir el caldo. traer a\r\nhierva y cocine a fuego lento durante 1 min. Batir en el\r\nsalsa lechosa hasta que se mezcle, sazone y luego agregue\r\nel estragón. Vierta la salsa sobre el pollo.\r\ny verduras, espolvorear con migas y queso,\r\nluego hornee por 20 minutos o hasta que esté bien cocido."]','2026-01-11 13:04:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14782,4772,'es','Ensalada de frijoles y tomate','Esta ensalada francesa vegana, fácil y rápida, combina sabores deliciosos: el plato perfecto para el verano','["Lata de 420 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","500 g de tomates cherry cortados en cuartos","2 calabacines pequeños, verdes o amarillos (unos 300 g en total), cortados en dados pequeños","1 cebolla morada pequeña, picada","Paquete de 15-20 g de cilantro fresco, picado","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de comino molido"]','["Vierta todos los ingredientes en un bol con un poco de sal y pimienta y mezcle bien. Tapar y dejar a temperatura ambiente hasta el momento de servir. Esta ensalada se puede preparar felizmente el día anterior y enfriar.","Ese día, lleve la ensalada a temperatura ambiente y revuelva bien antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14783,4774,'es','Tarritos de chocolate crujiente y frambuesa','Nunca imaginarías que se trata de un postre libre de alergias: sin nueces, lácteos, gluten ni huevos. La solución perfecta para esos menús complicados','["250 g de frambuesas en canastilla","2 cucharadas de Cointreau (o Grand Marnier)","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja pequeña","Paquete de 100 g de chocolate \"libre de\" sin lácteos, gluten ni trigo (usamos la barra de chocolate negro de lujo Kinnerton)","3 cucharadas de leche de soja","50 g de azúcar en polvo","6 cucharadas de muesli muesli sin gluten, trigo ni frutos secos (nosotros utilizamos cereal The Food Doctor, sin frutos secos)"]','["Divide las frambuesas en 4 vasos.\r\nEspolvorea ½ cucharada de Cointreau y un poco\r\nralladura de naranja y jugo sobre cada uno, luego reserve.","Derretir el chocolate y mezclar con la soja.\r\nleche, luego reservar. Vierte el azúcar en una cacerola.\r\njunto con 3 cucharadas de agua. A fuego suave,\r\ncocine sin revolver durante unos 7 minutos hasta que\r\nel azúcar se derrite y empieza a dorarse\r\nmarrón. Vierta el muesli, revuelva y luego vierta.\r\nen una bandeja forrada con papel para hornear.\r\nDéjelo enfriar y luego tritúrelo en trozos finos.","Divida la mezcla de chocolate entre los vasos y déjela enfriar, pero no la refrigere.\r\nEsparza sobre el caramelo crujiente para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14784,4776,'es','Panqueques sin lácteos','Salta la leche normal y sustitúyela por leche de coco o cáñamo en estas tortitas ligeras aptas para personas con intolerancia a los lácteos o a la lactosa.','["125 g de harina común","1 huevo","300 ml de leche de cáñamo o de coco (ver consejo)","aceite de girasol o salvado de arroz, para freír"]','["Poner la harina en un bol y hacer un hueco en el centro. Rompe el huevo por la mitad y vierte un cuarto de la leche. Utilice un batidor eléctrico o de globo para combinar bien la mezcla. Una vez que tenga una pasta, mezcle con otro cuarto y una vez que no tenga grumos, mezcle con la leche restante. Dejar reposar durante 20 min. Revuelva nuevamente antes de usar.","Calentar una sartén pequeña antiadherente con un chorrito de aceite. Cuando esté caliente, vierte una pequeña cantidad de la mezcla en la sartén y revuélvela para cubrir la base; lo que quieres es una capa fina. Cocine durante unos minutos hasta que se dore en el fondo, luego déle la vuelta y cocine hasta que esté dorado por el otro lado. Repita hasta que haya usado toda la mezcla, revolviendo la mezcla entre panqueques y agregando más aceite para freír según sea necesario. Apila los panqueques entre hojas de papel para hornear o cocínalos al gusto. Sirva con el relleno de panqueques de su elección."]','2026-01-11 13:04:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14785,4777,'es','mermelada de cítricos','¿Tienes algunos cítricos que amenazan con ablandarse en tu frutero? Haz una mermelada picante: además de untarla sobre las tostadas, es un bonito regalo.','["1 kg de cítricos sin cera (nosotros utilizamos una mezcla de pomelo, limones y limas)","2,25 kg de azúcar granulada"]','["Enfríe un platillo en el congelador, listo para comprobar el punto de fraguado de la mermelada más adelante. Lavar los cítricos y quitarles las partes superiores que estaban adheridas a los tallos.","Pon los cítricos enteros en una cacerola grande con 2½ litros de agua fría. Llevar a ebullición, luego tapar la cacerola y cocinar a fuego lento durante 2 horas y 30 minutos, o hasta que la piel se pueda perforar fácilmente con un cuchillo pequeño.","Use una espumadera para sacar las frutas del líquido y déjelas enfriar durante al menos 10 a 15 minutos. Mide 1,5 litros de licor y viértelo nuevamente en la cacerola. Si no tienes suficiente, rellena con agua.","Cortar los cítricos por la mitad, quitarles las pepitas y reservar. Corta la piel y la pulpa en tiras finas de 0,2 cm (dependiendo del grosor que quieras que quede). Vuelva a colocar toda la pulpa y la piel, junto con el jugo, en la sartén con el líquido. Pon las pepitas en un pequeño trozo de muselina y átalas con un cordel. Agregue esto también a la sartén, lo que ayudará al proceso de fraguado.","Agregue el azúcar y deje hervir, revolviendo con frecuencia. Continúe hirviendo rápidamente durante 45 a 50 minutos; debe alcanzar los 105 ° C. Pruebe el punto de fraguado dejando caer un poco de mermelada en el platillo frío, dejándolo enfriar durante 1 minuto, luego presione suavemente con el dedo. Si se arruga, ha llegado al punto de fraguado. Si no es así, continúe hirviendo y verifique nuevamente después de 5 a 10 minutos.","Deje que la mermelada se enfríe en la sartén durante 10 a 15 minutos y luego saque con cuidado la bolsa de muselina con una espumadera. Revuelva suavemente la mermelada en una dirección para dispersar las burbujas de aire, luego viértala en frascos esterilizados y ciérrelos con una tapa. Descubra cómo esterilizar frascos. Se mantendrá hasta por un año."]','2026-01-11 13:04:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14786,4779,'es','Receta de batido de arándanos','Prepare un batido de arándanos rápido y sencillo con yogur, plátano y jugo de manzana para las mañanas ocupadas. Puedes hacerlo vegano fácilmente usando yogur de coco.','["175 g de arándanos","1 plátano pequeño, en rodajas","1 cucharada de yogur natural o griego","100 ml de zumo de manzana, frío","3-4 hojas de menta (opcional), y más para decorar"]','["Coloque los arándanos, el plátano, el yogur, el jugo de manzana y la menta, si los usa, en una licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Añade un chorrito de agua si te parece demasiado espesa.","Vierta el batido en un vaso alto con una pajita para servir. Adorne con una ramita de menta, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:04:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14787,4783,'es','Tocino freidora','Cocine el tocino en una freidora para lograr una textura crujiente con menos grasa. El sándwich de tocino perfecto comienza aquí','["6 lonchas de tocino rayado o 3 lonchas de tocino"]','["Coloque el tocino en una sola capa en la base de una freidora; asegúrese de que las capas no se superpongan. El tamaño de la canasta de la freidora determinará cuántas lonchas puede cocinar a la vez.","Configure la freidora a 200 ° C y cocine las lonchas de tocino rayadas durante 6 a 10 minutos; el tocino recién cocido tardará 6 minutos, pero el tocino más crujiente tardará entre 9 y 10 minutos. Cocine las lonchas de tocino durante 4 a 8 minutos, según su preferencia. Si está cocinando en tandas, recuerde que la segunda tanda generalmente será más rápida ya que la freidora se ha calentado.","Retire el tocino con unas pinzas y póngalo sobre papel de cocina para que escurra antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14788,4785,'es','Piperrada de panceta y pimientos','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Los huevos se parten en una rica salsa de tomate y panceta en este plato tradicional de inspiración vasca, perfecto para el brunch o una comida entre semana.','["2 paquetes de 70 g de trozos de panceta","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","3 pimientos, 1 de cada uno de verde, 1 rojo y 1 amarillo, sin semillas y finamente picados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","4 huevos medianos","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca, ralladas","pan crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Pon la panceta y la cebolla en una sartén grande y profunda. Cocine durante 7 minutos hasta que la cebolla comience a ablandarse.","Agrega los pimientos, los tomates y el puré de tomate a la sartén y mezcla bien. Sazone, cubra y cocine durante 10-15 minutos.","Haga 4 pocillos pequeños en la mezcla. Rompe un huevo en cada pocillo y cocina durante 5-6 minutos más o hasta que los huevos se hayan cuajado. Espolvoree con albahaca y sirva inmediatamente, con pan crujiente, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:04:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14789,4787,'es','Frijoles mejores que horneados con gajos picantes','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. La cocina de los estudiantes puede ser el blanco de muchas bromas, pero con estos frijoles baratos, bajos en grasa y llenos de nutrientes, ellos se ríen los últimos.','["1 cucharadita de aceite","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 lonchas de tocino rayado, cortado en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de azúcar, morena si la tienes","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","200 ml de caldo de un cubo","Lata de 410g de judías cannellini, mantequilla o judías en agua","1 cucharada de harina blanca (normal o con levadura)","½ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena, pimentón o chile suave en polvo","1 cucharadita de hierbas secas mixtas (opcional)","2 patatas para asar, cada una cortada en 8 gajos","2 cucharaditas de aceite"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Para el\r\ngajos, mezcle la harina, la cayena y las hierbas (si\r\nusando), agregue un poco de sal y pimienta, luego mezcle\r\ncon las patatas y el aceite hasta que estén bien cubiertos.\r\nVierta en una fuente para asar y luego hornee por aproximadamente\r\n35 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente,\r\nluego sofreír la cebolla y el tocino juntos\r\ndurante 5-10 minutos hasta que las cebollas se ablanden y\r\napenas empezando a dorarse. Agregue el azúcar,\r\ntomates, caldo y condimentos al gusto, luego\r\ncocine a fuego lento la salsa durante 5 minutos. Agrega los frijoles,\r\nluego cocine a fuego lento durante otros 5 minutos hasta que la salsa\r\nse ha espesado. Servir con los gajos."]','2026-01-11 13:04:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14790,4789,'es','Croquetas de patata con chirivía','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Estas crujientes croquetas de patata se pueden preparar con anticipación y recalentar congeladas, ideales para visitas navideñas inesperadas.','["450 g de patatas cerosas (como Charlotte)","350 g de chirivías u otras hortalizas de raíz","1 cebolla pequeña, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 huevo batido","4-5 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","6 lonchas de tocino rayado o lonchas de prosciutto","6 tallos de tomates cherry en rama","6 huevos"]','["Pela y ralla en trozos grandes las patatas y las chirivías; si estás usando un procesador de alimentos, coloca el rallador mediano. Exprime la mayor cantidad de líquido posible con las manos y ponlos en un bol.","Agrega la cebolla, el ajo, el huevo y sazona si quieres. Divida la mezcla en seis y forme tortitas planas. Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande y fríe tres de los bizcochos a fuego lento durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados y tiernos. Pasar a papel de cocina con una espumadera y dejar enfriar mientras se fríe el resto, añadiendo el aceite restante según sea necesario. Mientras tanto asa el tocino y los tomates, escalfa los huevos y sirve junto."]','2026-01-11 13:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14791,4791,'es','Champiñones al horno todo en uno','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una excelente comida entre semana o desayuno de fin de semana horneado en una bandeja para ahorrar lavar los platos.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 setas de campo muy grandes","4 lonchas de jamón cocido de buena calidad","4 huevos"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. Rociar \r\nun poco de aceite de oliva sobre la base de una cerámica \r\nfuente para hornear, luego agregue los champiñones.","Rocíe con el aceite restante y el condimento. \r\nHornee por 15 minutos hasta que esté suave, luego retírelo. \r\ndel horno.","Coloca las lonchas de jamón alrededor de los champiñones. \r\npara crear pequeños bolsillos. Rompe los huevos en el \r\nbolsillos, luego regresar al horno por 10 minutos. \r\nhasta que la clara esté cuajada y la yema aún \r\nun poco líquido. Sirva sacado directamente del \r\nplato. Genial con frijoles horneados y patatas fritas."]','2026-01-11 13:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14792,4793,'es','Ensalada de pomelo, agave y pistacho','Las ensaladas de frutas se preparan rápidamente y son una de las formas más saludables de comenzar el día: endulzarlas con una alternativa al azúcar.','["1 pomelo rosado","1 pomelo blanco","1 cucharada de néctar de agave","1 cucharadita de pistacho picado"]','["Segmente los pomelos, quitando la mayor cantidad de médula posible. Divida los gajos en dos tazones y cubra con agave y pistachos."]','2026-01-11 13:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14793,4795,'es','Ensalada de huevo pasado por agua, bacon y berros','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). El tocino crujiente y un huevo perfectamente cocido con yema amarilla rezumante son un alimento básico para el brunch; esta versión lo combina con berros.','["2 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","1 chalota, muy finamente picada","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharadita colmada de mostaza integral","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","un puñado de cebollino, cortado (opcional)","4 lonchas gruesas de tocino ahumado curado en seco","2 rebanadas de buen pan blanco crujiente (idealmente de masa madre)","2 buenos puñados de berros británicos, sin tallos gruesos"]','["Pon los huevos en una cacerola con agua fría.\r\ny llevar a ebullición. Hervir durante 3 minutos,\r\nluego póngalo en un recipiente con agua helada y\r\nenfriar completamente. Pelar con mucho cuidado\r\nlejos las conchas. Deja los huevos en el\r\nagua helada hasta terminar la receta,\r\no hasta con 1 hora de anticipación.","Mezclar la chalota con el vinagre y\r\nuna pizca de sal y luego dejar reposar unos minutos para que se ablanden. Batir en el\r\nmostaza, aceite y cebollino, si se usa,\r\npara hacer un aderezo.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio-bajo y\r\nCocine el tocino hasta que esté completamente crujiente.\r\nRetire el tocino, luego cepille el\r\njugo de tocino y grasa por todo el pan.\r\nAsa el pan durante aproximadamente 1 minuto en cada uno.\r\nlado hasta que estén crujientes, luego córtelos en soldados\r\ny mantente caliente.","Justo antes de servir, llevar la sartén\r\nde agua nuevamente a ebullición y agregar el\r\nhuevos. Hervir durante 1 minuto para recalentar. tirar\r\nel aliño con los berros y\r\ndividir entre 2 platos. Cubra con un\r\nhuevo y 2 lonchas de tocino, con el\r\ntostadas a un lado. Las yemas de huevo\r\ntodavía estará líquido por dentro."]','2026-01-11 13:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14794,4797,'es','Ensalada de pomelo, naranja y albaricoque','Una ensalada de frutas súper sencilla para el desayuno y más, endulzada con miel y repleta de nutrientes.','["2 pomelos, pelados y sin médula","4 naranjas, peladas y sin médula","4 albaricoques, deshuesados ​​y rebanados","1 cucharada de miel clara"]','["Segmentar los pomelos y las naranjas.\r\nen un tazón grande para recoger los jugos. Revuelva\r\nen los albaricoques y la miel y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14795,4799,'es','shakshuka','Varíe este popular plato de brunch condimentando la sencilla salsa de tomate con lo que tenga a mano: curry en polvo, pesto o hierbas frescas.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas rojas, picadas","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","manojo pequeño de cilantro, tallos y hojas picados por separado","2 latas de 400g de tomates cherry","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","4 huevos"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén que tenga\r\ntapa, luego ablanda las cebollas, el chile, el ajo y\r\nlos tallos de cilantro durante 5 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Revuelva\r\nen los tomates y el azúcar, luego burbujear\r\ndurante 8-10 minutos hasta que espese. Se puede congelar por\r\n1 mes.","Con el dorso de una cuchara grande, prepare\r\n4 salsas para mojar y luego cascar un huevo\r\ncada uno. Tapa la sartén y luego cocina.\r\na fuego lento durante 6-8 minutos, hasta que los huevos\r\nse hacen a tu gusto. Dispersarse con el\r\nhojas de cilantro y servir con pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14796,4801,'es','Ensalada de naranja y menta','La lectora de Good Food, Hannah Measures, comparte su receta para una ensalada de frutas fresca y saludable para el desayuno.','["4 naranjas","12 dátiles blandos, deshuesados ​​y cortados a lo largo","manojo pequeño de menta, las hojas finamente picadas y algunas que quedan enteras","1 cucharada de jarabe de rosas o agua de rosas"]','["Pelar y segmentar las naranjas,\r\nquitando la médula blanca. Colocar en un bol\r\njunto con los jugos, luego agregue los dátiles,\r\nmenta picada y almíbar de rosas y revuelva\r\nsuavemente. Divida en 4 tazones de postre,\r\nesparcir sobre las hojas de menta y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14797,4803,'es','Horneados de desayuno vegetarianos','Haz 3 de tus 5 al día con esta fritura alternativa: está repleta de verduras y horneada','["4 champiñones grandes","8 tomates, partidos por la mitad","1 diente de ajo, en rodajas finas","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","200g bolsa de espinacas","4 huevos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPoner los champiñones y los tomates en\r\n4 fuentes para horno. Divida el ajo entre\r\nlos platos, rociar con aceite y un poco\r\nsazone, luego hornee por 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, ponga las espinacas en una cacerola grande.\r\ncolador, luego vierta sobre una tetera de\r\nagua hirviendo para que se marchite. Exprime cualquier\r\nexceso de agua, luego agregue las espinacas a\r\nlos platos. Haga un pequeño espacio entre el\r\nverduras y cascar un huevo en cada una\r\nplato. Regrese al horno y cocine por un\r\n8-10 minutos más o hasta que el huevo esté\r\ncocinado a tu gusto."]','2026-01-11 13:04:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14798,4805,'es','Huevos al horno con jamón y espinacas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Sirva este plato adaptable al estilo mexicano para el brunch, el desayuno o la cena con salsa de tomate picante.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 chile verde pequeño, sin semillas y finamente picado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","100 g de pimientos asados ​​de un frasco, escurridos y cortados en rodajas","Paquete de 180 g de jamón, corvejón desmenuzado o desmenuzado","50 g de espinacas tiernas","2 huevos medianos","pizca de pimienta de cayena","pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nCalentar el aceite en un pequeño salteado apto para horno.\r\nsartén. Agrega la cebolla y cocina por 6 minutos.\r\nhasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo y la guindilla,\r\ny cocine por un par de minutos más. Añadir\r\nlos tomates y 100ml de agua. Temporada\r\nbien y revuelva los pimientos y\r\njamón. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante\r\n10 minutos hasta que la salsa haya comenzado.\r\npara espesar. Agrega las espinacas, revolviendo\r\nhasta marchitarse.","Hacer 2 huecos en la salsa y\r\nRompe tus huevos en ellos. Agrega una pizca\r\nde cayena, pasar al horno y\r\nhornee por 10 minutos hasta que las claras\r\nlos huevos se han puesto. Servir de inmediato\r\ncon pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14799,4807,'es','Tostada de mantequilla de maní y plátano','Mantenga a raya el hambre a media mañana con esta tostada de desayuno nutricionalmente equilibrada','["2 rebanadas de pan granero","1 plátano pequeño","½ cucharadita de canela","1 cucharada de mantequilla de maní crujiente"]','["Tostar pan y rebanar\r\nplátano. Capa de plátano en una\r\nrebanada de pan tostado y espolvorear con\r\ncanela. Extiende la segunda rebanada\r\ncon mantequilla de maní,\r\nluego intercala los dos juntos y\r\ncomer de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:04:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14800,4809,'es','Mermelada de naranja de Sevilla','Aprovecha la corta temporada de naranjas de Sevilla y prepara mermelada casera para ponerla en tus tostadas y usarla en las recetas de Jane.','["1 kg de naranjas de Sevilla, bien lavadas y partidas por la mitad","1 limón sin cera","2 kilos de azúcar granulada"]','["Exprimir las naranjas y conservarlas.\r\njugo. Quitar la médula y las pepitas con\r\nuna cuchara de metal, guardando nuevamente todo.\r\nExprima el limón también, luego ponga el limón.\r\ncáscaras, médula de naranja y semillas en un\r\ncuadrado de muselina de unos 30 x 30 cm, y\r\nátalo con una cuerda. Deja la cuerda larga –\r\nde esa manera puedes atarlo a tu madera.\r\ncuchara, lo que hará que sea más fácil levantarla\r\nsalir más tarde.","Corta cada cáscara de naranja en 3 pétalos,\r\nluego triture finamente con un cuchillo grande y afilado.\r\ncuchillo. Ponga la cáscara en una fuente para conservas.\r\nVierta los jugos y luego coloque la bolsa en el\r\njugo. Vierta 2,4 litros/4 pintas de agua fría\r\ny dejar reposar durante la noche.","Al día siguiente, dejando la bolsa en la sartén,\r\nllevar el líquido a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento.\r\ndurante aproximadamente 1 hora, o hasta que la cáscara esté suave y\r\ntranslúcido y el líquido se ha reducido\r\nun tercio. Apagar el fuego y levantar el\r\nbolsa de muselina en un tazón grande. Deja el\r\nbolsa hasta que esté lo suficientemente fría como para manipularla.","Mientras esperas, prepara tus frascos.\r\nLave 8 frascos de 450 g/1 libra (o el equivalente\r\nfrascos de mayor o menor volumen) en agua caliente,\r\nagua con jabón, luego dejar en horno bajo\r\nque se seque por completo. Mantenlos calientes.\r\nAlternativamente, si tienes lavavajillas\r\nPuedes ejecutar los frascos y las tapas.\r\nun ciclo caliente, luego déjelos secar. Pon un\r\nplatillo en el congelador en este momento también.","Ahora, lo complicado: me gusta ponerme un\r\npar de guantes de goma en este punto. Espera\r\nla bolsa sobre su recipiente, y apriete y\r\nGolpéalo hasta que hayas extraído cada\r\núltima gota de jugo y atraviese el\r\nmuselina. Esto contiene pectina.\r\nel ingrediente crucial para el conjunto perfecto.\r\nAhora puedes tirar lo que quede\r\nla bolsa y lavar la muselina, lista para\r\nreutilizar.","Revuelva el contenido del bol, más todo\r\nel azúcar, en la sartén. Revuelva de vez en cuando\r\na menudo a fuego muy suave hasta que\r\nel azúcar se haya disuelto por completo. no lo hagas\r\nhervir antes de que se haya derretido todo el azúcar.","Lleve la cacerola a ebullición lentamente. después\r\n10 minutos hirviendo, vierta una pequeña gota de\r\nmermelada en el platillo frío. salir\r\ndurante unos segundos, luego empuja la mermelada\r\ncon tu dedo. Si se arruga, está listo.\r\nDe lo contrario, hierva durante 10 minutos más y vuelva a intentarlo.\r\nIncluso si tienes un termómetro de azúcar\r\n(busque 105C o donde dice \"mermelada\"), yo\r\nTodavía recomiendo la prueba del platillo. si el tuyo\r\nParece que está tardando un poco, no te preocupes.\r\npuede tardar desde 10 minutos hasta\r\n45 minutos para que la mermelada alcance su fraguado\r\npunto, dependiendo de tus naranjas. hojear\r\nQuitar cualquier espuma que salga a la superficie.\r\nmientras tanto.","Una vez que haya alcanzado el punto de ajuste,\r\nvierta la mermelada en los frascos calientes\r\ny sellar. Un embudo es muy útil si\r\ntener uno. La mermelada seguirá subiendo.\r\na 1 año en un lugar fresco y oscuro, y durante\r\nhasta un mes en el frigorífico una vez abierto."]','2026-01-11 13:04:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14801,4811,'es','Arroz frito picante','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). Dale un toque picante a tu inglés completo con esta deliciosa receta de brunch: la pasta de chile se puede congelar con anticipación.','["2 cebollas medianas","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal, más un poco más para freír los huevos","400 g de arroz basmati, bien enjuagado","12 salchichas cóctel o 6 chipolatas retorcidas y luego cortadas por la mitad","6 lonchas de tocino rayado curado en seco, cortado en trozos pequeños","140 g de champiñones castaños, cortados por la mitad","2 chiles rojos o verdes, sin semillas","3 dientes de ajo, machacados para quitarles la piel","6 huevos","paquete de 20 g de cilantro","salsa de soja y salsa de chile, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nCortar media cebolla en rodajas finas y mezclar con 1 cucharadita\r\naceite en una bandeja para hornear, luego cocinar en el horno\r\ndurante 15 minutos, volteando una vez, hasta que esté dorado\r\ny empezando a estar crujiente. Mientras tanto, pon el\r\narroz en una cacerola grande con suficiente agua\r\ncubrir con la yema del dedo. Llevar a ebullición,\r\nrevuelva una vez, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 10\r\nminutos. Retirar del fuego, dejar tapado durante\r\n10 minutos y luego esponjar con un tenedor.","Mientras se cocina el arroz y la cebolla, agrega 1 cucharadita\r\naceite a una sartén. Freír las salchichas por\r\nun par de minutos. Ahora vierte el tocino\r\ny chisporrotee durante otros 5-7 minutos hasta que\r\nel tocino esté dorado y las salchichas cocidas.\r\nVierta en un plato grande. Freír los champiñones durante\r\n3 minutos hasta que esté dorado, luego inclínelo con el\r\ntocino y salchicha. Limpia la sartén.","Ponga los chiles, el ajo y las cebollas restantes.\r\ny 1 cucharada de aceite en un procesador de alimentos pequeño,\r\nluego mezcle hasta obtener una pasta. La pasta puede ser\r\npreparado con hasta 1 mes de anticipación y congelado.\r\nFreír suavemente la pasta durante unos 3 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté fragante, revolviendo. Punta en el arroz,\r\nrevuelva bien, luego agregue la carne y el\r\nchampiñones. Añade un chorrito de agua y\r\nrevuelve todo junto. Vierta en el plato,\r\ntapar y luego mantener caliente en el horno mientras\r\ntu fríes los huevos.","Limpie la sartén y luego caliente una fina capa de\r\naceite a fuego lento y romper como sea\r\nCuantos huevos puede contener la sartén. Freír suavemente,\r\nechando un poco de aceite caliente ahora\r\ny nuevamente, hasta que esté cocido a tu gusto.\r\nSaca el plato del horno. Aproximadamente\r\nPicar el cilantro y bifurcarlo.\r\nel arroz con un chorrito de soja, luego verter\r\nen platos. Cubra cada uno con un huevo, luego\r\nsalpique con más salsa de soja y chile para\r\ngusto. Esparcir sobre las cebollas crujientes."]','2026-01-11 13:04:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14802,4815,'es','Hombres de huevo de peluche','Una delicia de decoración y desayuno en uno: complace a los niños hambrientos con estos huevos horneados y pan casero, ¡ellos también disfrutarán haciéndolos!','["400 g de harina blanca fuerte","½ cucharadita de sal","pizca de azúcar","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente"]','["Pon la harina en un tazón grande y agrega la sal, el azúcar y la levadura. Vierta 250 ml de agua y el aceite y mezcle hasta obtener una masa suave. Añade un poco más de agua si es necesario.","Amasar la masa durante unos minutos hasta que quede suave y luego poner en un bol, tapar y dejar en un lugar cálido durante aproximadamente 1 hora o hasta que doble su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Colocar la masa sobre una tabla, amasar brevemente y luego cortar en cuatro. Tome una pieza, corte una cuarta parte y forme una bola para la cabeza. Con la otra pieza, dale forma de salchicha. Une la cabeza al cuerpo usando un poco de agua fría.","Coloque la masa en una bandeja para hornear antiadherente. Con un cuchillo afilado, corte la mitad inferior de la salchicha para formar dos patas, luego corte los lados hasta los hombros para formar dos brazos. Con unas tijeras, corte a intervalos alrededor de la parte superior de la cabeza para hacer el cabello y haga un corte para la boca. Usa una brocheta de madera para hacer dos ojos.","Tome un huevo y colóquelo sobre la barriga del masajista. Dobla los brazos sobre el huevo y asegura con un poco de agua fría. Haz tres hombres de huevo más con la masa restante. Dejar reposar unos 10 minutos.","Hornee en el horno durante 20 minutos hasta que esté bien leudado y dorado. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla durante unos minutos antes de pelar el huevo y comerlo con el pan caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14803,3818,'es','Cubitos de batido','Una gran idea para una bebida rápida, refrescante y saludable, especialmente para el desayuno.','["moras, fresas, frambuesas, maracuyá, mango, cualquier otra fruta que te guste"]','["Haga puré una fruta (pruebe con moras, fresas, frambuesas, maracuyá y mango, en un procesador de alimentos, deje las pepitas o colar.","Congele en bandejas de hielo listas para preparar (3 por porción) con un plátano, un bote de 150 ml de yogur natural y leche y miel al gusto."]','2026-01-11 13:04:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14804,4821,'es','Cazuela de pollo y jamón con empanadillas de mostaza','Sirva bolas de masa a la mostaza con nuestra cazuela de pollo y jamón para disfrutar de un reconfortante y abundante banquete familiar. También puedes congelar las sobras, ¡si las hay!','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cebolla, picada","2 puerros, en rodajas gruesas","2 zanahorias, peladas y picadas","6 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos grandes","200ml de sidra","800 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","½ manojo de tomillo, atado","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","150 g de corvejón o jamón cocido, desmenuzado en trozos grandes","100 g de guisantes congelados","1 cucharada de mostaza inglesa o de Dijon","200 g de harina con levadura","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","2 cucharadas de mostaza inglesa en polvo","100 g de sebo o mantequilla fría rallada","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado"]','["Calentar el aceite y la mantequilla en una cazuela apta para horno a fuego medio. Añade la cebolla, los puerros y las zanahorias y una pizca de sal y sofríe durante 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y traslúcidos. Agrega el pollo, sube el fuego y sofríe durante 5 minutos. Vierta la sidra, cocine por 3 minutos, luego vierta el caldo de pollo y agregue el manojo de tomillo. Llevar a fuego lento, sazonar al gusto, luego reducir a fuego lento y tapar la sartén. Cocine por 30 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C con ventilador de gas 4. Haz las albóndigas mezclando la harina, el polvo para hornear, la mostaza en polvo, el sebo o mantequilla, el perejil y ½ cucharadita de sal. Mezcle rápidamente con 8-10 cucharadas de agua y junte con las manos. La masa debe quedar firme y maleable. Divídalo en ocho trozos del mismo tamaño y pese para mayor precisión si lo desea.","Retire el manojo de tomillo del guiso y deséchelo. Vierta un poco del líquido en un bol y mezcle con la maicena, luego agregue la mezcla a la cazuela. Añade el corvejón, los guisantes y la mostaza. Coloca las bolas de masa encima del guiso y luego mételas al horno tapadas durante 30 minutos. Retire la tapa y cocine por 10 minutos más hasta que las bolas de masa estén infladas y doradas. Sirva en tazones. Para congelar el guiso, déjelo enfriar por completo y luego transfiéralo a un recipiente apto para congelador. Se conservará hasta por tres meses. Descongele bien y luego vuelva a calentar hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14805,4823,'es','Chuletas de cordero picantes con frijoles machacados','Mejore las chuletas de cordero con ralladura de limón y luego sírvalas con puré de frijoles rojos con chile y ajo para una cena rápida entre semana.','["8 chuletas de cordero","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","jugo y ralladura de 1 limón","1-2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y finamente picados","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 latas de 400 g de judías rojas, escurridas","paquete pequeño de menta, hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","hojas verdes mixtas como rúcula y berros, para servir"]','["Calienta una sartén a fuego alto. Unte las chuletas de cordero con 1 cucharada de aceite y luego frótelas con ralladura de limón y un poco de condimento. Cocine a la plancha durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado para obtener una carne ligeramente rosada, o un poco más para que esté bien cocida. Es posible que tengas que hacer esto en 2 tandas. Retirar de la sartén, envolver en papel aluminio y dejar reposar 10 minutos.","Freír el aceite restante, las guindillas y el ajo en una cacerola durante 2-3 minutos. Agregue los frijoles y tritúrelos suavemente con un machacador de papas, luego continúe cocinando durante 3 minutos hasta que los frijoles estén calientes. Agregue el jugo de limón, la menta y los condimentos y sirva con las chuletas y las hojas mixtas."]','2026-01-11 13:04:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14806,4825,'es','Pizza florentina sin lácteos','Alcanza tu objetivo de 5 al día de una sola vez con esta pizza crujiente repleta de verduras, apta para personas intolerantes a la lactosa','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","400 g de espinacas congeladas y descongeladas","aderezos de su elección: anchoas, aceitunas, alcaparras, pepperoni, corazones de alcachofa, pimientos asados","2 huevos","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca","2 puñados de rúcula","jugo ½ limón","350 g de harina blanca fuerte","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de sémola gruesa o fina"]','["Para hacer la base, vierte la harina en\r\nel tazón de una batidora de mesa (o comida\r\nprocesador con un accesorio para masa). Añadir\r\n1 cucharadita de sal a un lado del bol y el\r\nlevadura al otro. Añadir 275 ml tibios\r\nagua y mezclar a fuego lento hasta obtener una masa pegajosa\r\nformas. Suba la batidora durante 5-6 minutos hasta que\r\nuna muesca empujada en la masa aparece\r\nsalir rápidamente. Poner la masa en un recipiente ligeramente\r\nrecipiente engrasado, luego tapar y dejar en un\r\nreposar en un lugar cálido hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén.\r\ny chisporrotear el ajo durante unos segundos, luego\r\nAgregue los tomates, sazone y cocine a fuego lento.\r\ndurante 5 minutos hasta que la salsa se espese.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nAmasar la masa durante unos minutos y luego\r\nCortar por la mitad y enrollar cada mitad tan fina como\r\nposible. Coloque cada base sobre una bandeja para hornear.\r\nhoja espolvoreada con sémola. dividir\r\nla salsa de tomate entre las pizzas,\r\nextendiéndose casi hasta el borde. Punto encima\r\nlas espinacas, agregue los ingredientes y rocíe\r\ncon un poco de aceite. Cocine durante 5 minutos, luego rompa\r\nun huevo en cada pizza. Cambia la cocción\r\nhojas, luego cocine por 10 minutos más o hasta que\r\nlas bases estén bien cocidas. Rocíe la albahaca\r\ny rúcula con un chorrito de aceite y el limón\r\njugo. Esparcir sobre la pizza antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 13:04:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14807,4829,'es','Curry rojo tailandés vegetariano','Este fragante plato tailandés seguramente pondrá en acción tu paladar y estará listo en menos de una hora.','["200 g de tofu firme, en cubos","4-5 cucharadas de salsa de soja","jugo 3 limones","2 chiles rojos, 1 finamente picado, 1 cortado en rodajas","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco desnatada","1 calabacín, picado en trozos","1 berenjena pequeña, picada en trozos","½ pimiento rojo, sin semillas y picado en trozos","140 g de champiñones cortados por la mitad","140 g de guisantes dulces","Paquete de 20 g de albahaca, hojas recogidas","1 cucharadita de azúcar moreno","arroz jazmín, para servir","3 chiles rojos","1 limoncillo, picado en trozos grandes","3 chalotes, picados en trozos grandes","½ pimiento rojo, sin semillas y picado en trozos grandes","ralladura de 1 lima","tallos de cilantro en paquete de 20 g","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","2 dientes de ajo","1 cucharadita de pimienta recién molida","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido"]','["Batir los ingredientes de la pasta en una comida.\r\nprocesador. Marinar el tofu en 2 cucharadas de soja.\r\nsalsa, el zumo de 1 lima y la guindilla picada.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén grande. Añadir\r\n3-4 cucharadas de pasta y freír durante 2 minutos. Agregue\r\nla leche de coco con 100ml de agua, la\r\ncalabacín, berenjena y pimiento y\r\ncocine durante 10 minutos hasta que esté casi tierno.","Escurrir el tofu, secarlo y freírlo en el\r\nEl aceite restante en una sartén pequeña hasta que esté dorado.","Añade los champiñones, los dulces\r\ny la mayor parte de la albahaca al curry, luego\r\nsazone con el azúcar, la lima restante\r\njugo y salsa de soja. Cocine durante 4 minutos hasta que\r\nlos champiñones estén tiernos, luego añadir el\r\ntofu y calentar. Esparcir con rodajas\r\nchile y albahaca y sirva con arroz jazmín."]','2026-01-11 13:04:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14808,4831,'es','Pollo al romero con pisto asado al horno','No hay nada mejor que esta receta baja en grasa en una sola olla para una comida fácil, llena de color y sabor veraniego.','["1 berenjena, cortada en trozos grandes","2 calabacines cortados en medias lunas","3 pimientos mixtos, sin semillas y picados en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de romero finamente picado, más 4 ramitas pequeñas","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel","250 g de tomates cherry o pera pequeños, cortados por la mitad"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEn una fuente para asar grande, mezcle los\r\nberenjenas, calabacines y pimientos con\r\nla mitad del romero picado, la mitad del ajo,\r\n2 cucharadas de aceite y un poco de condimento. difundir\r\nSaque las verduras en una capa uniforme y luego\r\nAse en el horno durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el romero restante,\r\najo y aceite juntos. Corta cada uno de los\r\npechugas de pollo 4-5 veces con un filo\r\ncuchillo, unte sobre el aceite aromatizado, sazone\r\ny enfriar durante 15 minutos.","Después de que las verduras se hayan cocinado durante 20 minutos,\r\nagregue los tomates. hacer espacios en\r\nla fuente para asar y colocar el pollo\r\npechugas entre las verduras. Lugar\r\nuna ramita de romero encima de cada pollo\r\npecho. Regrese la lata al horno para\r\n18-20 minutos, hasta que el pollo esté cocido\r\nbien y las verduras estén ligeramente\r\ncaramelizado. Servir con algo nuevo\r\npatatas, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:04:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14809,4835,'es','Curry de espinacas y garbanzos','Un plato vegano indio bajo en grasas y calorías que está lleno de deliciosos sabores de sol y especias picantes.','["2 cucharadas de pasta de curry suave","1 cebolla, picada","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry.","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","Bolsa de 250 g de espinacas tiernas","exprimir el jugo de limon","arroz basmati, para servir"]','["Calentar la pasta de curry en una cacerola grande.\r\nsartén antiadherente. Una vez que comienza\r\npara dividir, agregar la cebolla y cocinar por\r\n2 minutos para ablandar. Punta en los tomates\r\ny burbujee durante 5 minutos o hasta que\r\nla salsa se ha reducido.","Añade los garbanzos y un poco\r\nsazone, luego cocine por 1 minuto más.\r\nRetire del fuego y luego agregue las espinacas.\r\ny deje que el calor de la sartén ablande el\r\nhojas. Sazone, agregue el jugo de limón y\r\nsirva con arroz basmati."]','2026-01-11 13:04:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14810,4839,'es','Chile con frijoles y pimientos','Utilice las legumbres de su elección en esta saludable receta vegetariana en una sola olla.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","350 g de pimientos, sin semillas y en rodajas","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharada de chile en polvo","1 cucharada de pimentón dulce ahumado","Lata de 400 g de frijoles en salsa de chile","Lata de 400 g de frijoles mixtos, escurridos","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","arroz, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Añade el\r\ncebolla y pimientos y cocine por 8 minutos.\r\nhasta que se ablanden. Agregue las especias y\r\ncocine por 1 min.","Vierta los frijoles y los tomates, traiga\r\nhasta que hierva y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos o\r\nhasta que el chile se espese. Temporada y\r\nsirva con arroz, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:04:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14811,4841,'es','Brochetas harissa de cordero y pimientos','Disfrute del cordero con especias marroquíes para una cena especial después del trabajo: también es bajo en grasas','["2 cucharadas de pasta de harissa","400 g de filete de cordero, sin grasa y cortado en trozos","2 pimientos rojos, picados en trozos grandes","2 cebollas moradas, cada una cortada en 8 gajos a través de la raíz para que no se deshagan","250 g de cuscús, aromatizado o natural","MÁS 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva"]','["Calienta la parrilla. En un tazón grande, mezcle\r\nla harissa con el aceite, luego verter la\r\ncordero, pimientos y cebollas. Agrega algunos\r\nsalpimentar y mezclar todo\r\njuntos para cubrir bien.","Enhebrar el cordero, los pimientos y\r\ncebollas uniformemente en 8 brochetas y\r\ncolóquelo en una bandeja para hornear. Raspe\r\ncualquier adobo sobrante.","Ase durante 8-10 minutos, volteando con frecuencia.\r\ny rociando con cualquiera de los jugos que\r\nsalir corriendo. Mientras tanto, prepara el\r\ncuscús siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.\r\nDivida el cuscús en 4 platos,\r\ncubra con un par de brochetas cada una y\r\nrocíe sobre el jugo de la sartén."]','2026-01-11 13:04:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14812,4843,'es','Guiso de quinoa con calabaza, ciruelas y granada','Obtenga una dosis de hierro y proteínas de esta saludable cazuela de calabaza llena de textura y sabor.','["1 calabaza pequeña, sin semillas y en cubos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente picado","1 cucharadita de ras-el-hanout o mezcla de especias del Medio Oriente","200 g de quinua","5 ciruelas pasas, picadas en trozos grandes","jugo 1 limon","600 ml de caldo de verduras","semillas de 1 granada","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPoner la calabaza en una bandeja para horno y\r\nmezcle con 1 cucharada de aceite. Sazone bien\r\ny ase durante 30-35 minutos o hasta que esté suave.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite restante en\r\nuna cacerola grande. Agrega la cebolla, el ajo\r\ny jengibre, sazone y cocine por 10 minutos.\r\nAgregue las especias y la quinua y cocine por\r\nOtro par de minutos. Añade las ciruelas pasas,\r\njugo de limón y caldo, llevar a ebullición,\r\nluego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 25 minutos.","Cuando esté todo tierno removemos el\r\naplastar el guiso. Vierta en\r\ntazones y espolvorear con granada\r\nsemillas y menta para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14813,4845,'es','Calabaza con guindilla y verduras asiáticas','Este plato de calabaza asada con cinco especias es saludable y sencillo: la cena perfecta entre semana.','["1 calabaza pequeña o ½ calabaza, cortada en trozos (sin semillas), sin necesidad de pelar","2 cucharaditas de aceite de girasol o vegetal","1 cucharadita de chile suave en polvo y cinco especias en polvo","175 g de brócoli de tallo fino","175 g de bok choi, en cuartos","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja baja en sodio","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 cucharada de miel","1 lima, ½ jugo, ½ cortada en gajos","pocas hojas de cilantro"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Mezcle\r\nla calabaza en el aceite, luego espolvorear sobre\r\nchile en polvo, cinco especias, 1 cucharadita de pimienta negra\r\ny una pizca de sal y mezclar bien. Inclínate hacia un\r\nbandeja para asar en una sola capa y cocinar durante\r\n25-30 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y empezando a\r\ncaramelizar por los bordes.","Unos 5 minutos antes de la calabaza.\r\nesté cocido, calentar un wok o sartén grande\r\ny agrega el brócoli más 1-2 cucharadas de agua.\r\nCocine durante 2-3 minutos, luego agregue\r\nel bok choi, la soja, el vinagre y la miel, y\r\ncocine durante 2-3 minutos más hasta que las verduras estén\r\ntierno. Agrega el jugo de lima y luego divide.\r\nentre 2 platos con la calabaza,\r\nhojas de cilantro y rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:04:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14814,4851,'es','One-pot italiano de lubina y mariscos','Un guiso de pescado en una sola olla con mariscos y todos los sabores frescos del Mediterráneo: sírvelo con abundante pan para mojar','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 bulbo de hinojo, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas, las hojas separadas para decorar","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","½ chile rojo, picado","250 g de calamares limpios y cortados en aros","Manojo de albahaca, hojas y tallos separados, tallos atados y hojas cortadas en trozos grandes.","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","150 ml de vino blanco","2 puñados grandes de mejillones o almejas","8 langostinos crudos grandes (enteros quedan mejor)","4 filetes de lubina (aproximadamente 140 g/5 oz cada uno)","pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande con un\r\ntapa bien ajustada, luego agregue el hinojo, el ajo\r\ny chile. Freír hasta que se ablanden, luego agregar el\r\ncalamares, tallos de albahaca, tomates y vino.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante 35 minutos hasta que\r\nlos calamares están tiernos y la salsa tiene\r\nespese un poco y luego sazone.","Repartir los mejillones y las gambas\r\nla salsa, colocar encima los filetes de lubina\r\ntapar, tapar, subir el fuego y cocinar\r\nduro durante 5 minutos. Servir esparcido con\r\nlas hojas de albahaca y las hojas de hinojo,\r\ncon pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14815,4853,'es','Sopa vegana de puerros y patatas','Pruebe esta versión vegetal y sin lácteos de la clásica sopa de puerros y patatas. Ideal para el almuerzo o como entrante, cubra con cebollino picado y disfrútelo con pan crujiente.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza, más un chorrito para servir (opcional)","2 dientes de ajo grandes, picados","500 g de puerros, en rodajas finas","500 g de patatas cortadas en cubos","500 ml de caldo de verduras vegano, elaborado con 1½ cucharadita de caldo en polvo","500 ml de leche de almendras sin azúcar","cebollino picado y pan, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe el ajo y los puerros, revolviendo, hasta que las verduras empiecen a ablandarse. Añade las patatas y el caldo, tapa y cocina a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta que los puerros y las patatas estén suaves.","Vierta la leche de almendras, luego retírela del fuego y mezcle con una batidora de mano hasta que esté casi suave y con una textura ligeramente grumosa. O, si lo prefieres, bate hasta que quede completamente suave. Vuelva a calentar a fuego lento si es necesario, luego sirva en tazones y espolvoree con cebollino, rocíe con un poco de aceite y sirva con pan, si lo desea. Se puede congelar hasta por tres meses."]','2026-01-11 13:04:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14816,4857,'es','Hamburguesas y ensalada del lunes por la noche','Siéntese a disfrutar de una cena sencilla entre semana a base de hamburguesas veganas a la parrilla servidas con ensalada de zanahoria y repollo. Hemos utilizado las hamburguesas sin carne Tesco Plant Chef para una comida rápida, lista en solo 20 minutos.','["2 hamburguesas sin carne Tesco Plant Chef","2 panes para hamburguesa, partidos","1 tomate rama grande, rebanado","un puñado pequeño de rúcula o espinacas","¼ de repollo (blanco, rojo, verde o verde), finamente cortado","1 zanahoria rallada","½ cebolla morada, cortada finamente","4 cucharadas de mayonesa vegana, más extra para servir","chorrito de jugo de limón","1 tsp Dijon mustard","un puñado pequeño de cebollino, perejil o cilantro, finamente picado"]','["Calienta la parrilla a medio-alto. Coloque las hamburguesas sin carne Tesco Plant Chef en una bandeja para hornear y cocine a la parrilla durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas y crujientes. Tuesta los panecillos con el lado cortado hacia arriba junto a las hamburguesas en la bandeja durante los últimos 2 o 3 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los ingredientes de la ensalada con un poco de condimento. Pruebe y agregue un poco más de limón o mostaza, si lo desea.","Unta un poco de mayonesa sobre las bases del pan de hamburguesa, agrega una rodaja de tomate y una hamburguesa. Agrega una cucharada de ensalada de repollo. Cubra con un poco de rúcula o espinacas y agregue las tapas de las hamburguesas. Sirva con la ensalada restante a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:04:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14817,4861,'es','Brochetas de gambas al miso con ensalada de arroz vegetal','Para una nueva forma de preparar gambas, marinarlas en soja, servirlas como kebabs y combinarlas con un saludable basmati.','["200 g de arroz basmati integral","175g come de todo","200 g de soja congelada","1½ cucharada de aceite de sésamo","4 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","un puñado grande de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","1 chile verde, finamente picado","400 g de gambas grandes peladas crudas","3 cucharadas de pasta de miso dulce (la encontrarás con los ingredientes japoneses. Nosotros usamos miso blanco Clearspring)","2 tsp soy sauce","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de arroz japonés","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moreno suave"]','["Coloca el arroz integral en una sartén con mucha\r\nde agua fría. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento.\r\ndurante 20-25 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Mientras tanto,\r\nRemojar las brochetas de madera en un poco de agua fría.\r\nagua (para evitar que se quemen). Añade el\r\ntirabeques y soja al arroz para\r\nlos últimos 5 minutos de cocción. Enjuague debajo\r\nagua fría, escurriendo bien.","Mezcle el arroz con el aceite de sésamo y\r\nmezclar en un tazón grande con la primavera\r\ncebolla, cilantro, chile y condimentos.","Calienta una parrilla. Coloca la brocheta\r\ningredientes en un bol con un poco de molienda\r\npimienta negra. Dale todo un buen revuelo,\r\nasegurándonos de que los langostinos queden bien cubiertos.\r\nEnsartar los langostinos en las brochetas y colocarlos\r\nen una bandeja para hornear. Asa por un par de\r\nminutos por cada lado, volteándolos, hasta que los langostinos estén\r\nbien cocido. Servir con la ensalada de arroz.\r\ny rocíe sobre cualquiera de los jugos de cocción."]','2026-01-11 13:04:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14818,4863,'es','Hinojo asado con aderezo de aceitunas negras','Corte el hinojo en rodajas y cocínelo a la parrilla como base para una ensalada aderezada con aceitunas Kalamata, perejil, albahaca y ajo.','["2 bulbos de hinojo, cortados a lo largo en trozos de 1 cm de grosor","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de aceitunas Kalamata negras finamente picadas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","jugo 1 limon","un puñado pequeño de perejil y albahaca, finamente picados"]','["Calienta una barbacoa o una plancha. Tira el\r\nhinojo en 1 cucharada de aceite, cubriendo bien.\r\nCocine durante 5 minutos por cada lado hasta que\r\ndorado y carbonizado.","Para hacer el aliño poner las aceitunas,\r\najo, jugo de limón y aceite restante\r\nen un bol. Añade las hierbas picadas y\r\ncombinar. Coloca el hinojo en una fuente.\r\ny verter sobre el aderezo. comer caliente\r\no a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14819,4867,'es','Ensalada de sandía, gambas y aguacate','¿Demasiado calor para cocinar? Esta ensalada súper saludable es un almuerzo o entrante ligero y refrescante.','["1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo gordo, machacado","1 chile rojo pequeño, finamente picado","jugo 1 lima","1 cucharada de arroz o vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","rodaja de sandía, sin semillas y cortada en cubitos","1 aguacate, cortado en cubitos","manojo pequeño de hojas de cilantro, picadas","200 g de langostinos tigre cocidos, descongelados si están congelados"]','["Pon la cebolla en un tazón mediano con\r\nel ajo, la guindilla, el zumo de lima, el vinagre y el azúcar\r\ny algo de condimento. dejar marinar\r\ndurante 10 min.","Agrega la sandía,\r\naguacate, cilantro y gambas, luego\r\nrevuelva suavemente para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14820,4869,'es','Tajín de 5 al día','Obtén tu cuota de verduras del día de una sola vez. Ideal para alimentar a un grupo o congelar porciones','["4 zanahorias, cortadas en trozos","4 chirivías pequeñas o 3 grandes, cortadas en trozos","3 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en trozos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de comino molido, pimentón, canela y chile suave en polvo","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 puñados pequeños de orejones tiernos","2 cucharaditas de miel"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Esparcir\r\nlas verduras en un par de bandejas para hornear, rocíe\r\ncon la mitad del aceite, sazonar y luego frotar el aceite\r\nlas verduras con las manos para cubrirlas. asado para\r\n30 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y comiencen a dorarse.","Mientras tanto, sofreír las especias en el aceite restante.\r\ndurante 1 min – deberían chisporrotear y empezar a oler\r\naromático. Añade los tomates, los albaricoques y la miel.\r\ny una lata de agua. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que\r\nse reduce ligeramente la salsa y los albaricoques\r\nregordete, luego agregue las verduras y un poco de condimento.\r\nSirva con cuscús o patatas asadas."]','2026-01-11 13:04:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14821,4872,'es','Pilaf de verduras especiadas','Obtenga cuatro de sus cinco al día en un tazón colorido. Varíe las verduras según la temporada.','["6 zanahorias, cortadas a lo largo en 6-8 gajos","3 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","4 vainas de cardamomo","1 rama de canela","200 g de arroz basmati integral, enjuagado","400 ml de caldo de verduras","Lata de 400 g de lentejas doradas, enjuagadas y escurridas","200 g de espinacas tiernas","un puñado de almendras tostadas en hojuelas o unas cuantas almendras enteras (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEn agua hirviendo, cocine las zanahorias durante 4 minutos,\r\nagregando cebollas durante el último minuto de\r\ncocinando. Escurrir y mezclar en una fuente para asar.\r\ncon 4 cucharaditas de aceite, el comino y el condimento.\r\nAse durante 30 minutos, mientras cocina el arroz.","Caliente las 2 cucharaditas de aceite restantes en una sartén grande.\r\nAgrega el cardamomo y la canela durante 30 segundos.\r\nluego agregue el arroz y tueste por 1 min. verter\r\nsobre caldo y 100 ml de agua, luego cocine a fuego lento,\r\ntapado, durante 25-30 minutos, hasta que el arroz esté\r\ntierna y el agua absorbida. Quitar\r\ncanela y cardamomo.","Vierta las lentejas y bifurque antes.\r\ncubriendo con espinacas. Vuelva a colocar la tapa y\r\ncocine a fuego lento, revolviendo una vez, hasta que\r\nlas espinacas se han marchitado y las lentejas se han calentado\r\na través. Bifurca de nuevo antes\r\nvolcar las verduras asadas con comino sobre el\r\ncubra y espolvoree con almendras, si las usa."]','2026-01-11 13:04:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14822,4874,'es','Sopa minestrone con trozos','¿La solución perfecta para una noche fría en casa? Un plato caliente de esta sopa con trozos casera.','["3 zanahorias grandes, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cebolla grande, picada en trozos grandes","4 ramas de apio, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 patatas grandes, cortadas en dados pequeños","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 litros de caldo de verduras","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de mantequilla o judías cannellini","140 g de espaguetis, cortados en trozos cortos","1 o 2 cabezas de col de Saboya, rallada","pan crujiente, para servir"]','["En un procesador de alimentos, licúa las zanahorias,\r\ncebolla y apio en trozos pequeños. Calentar el\r\naceite en una sartén, agregar las verduras procesadas,\r\najo y patatas, luego cocine a fuego alto\r\nCaliente durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablande.","Incorpora el puré de tomate, el caldo y\r\ntomates. Llevar a ebullición y luego bajar.\r\nEl fuego y cocine a fuego lento, tapado, durante 10 minutos.","Agregue los frijoles y la pasta, luego cocine por\r\n10 minutos más, añadiendo el repollo durante\r\nLos últimos 2 minutos. Sazone al gusto y sirva.\r\ncon pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14823,4876,'es','Ensalada tibia de coliflor','A menudo se pasa por alto la coliflor, pero pruébala asada en esta ensalada de invierno para disfrutar de un plato lleno de delicias crujientes.','["1 coliflor, partida en floretes","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas finas","3 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","1½ cucharada de miel","3 cucharadas de pasas","manojo pequeño de eneldo, cortado","3 cucharadas de almendras tostadas y laminadas","50 g de espinacas tiernas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nMezcle la coliflor con el aceite de oliva,\r\nsazone y ase durante 15 minutos. Agregue\r\nla cebolla morada y seguir asando\r\ndurante 15-20 minutos más hasta que estén tiernos.","Mientras se asa la coliflor,\r\nmezclar el vinagre, la miel y las pasas\r\ncon algún condimento.","Cuando la coliflor esté lista, revuelve\r\nen el aderezo, eneldo, almendras y\r\nespinacas y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14824,4878,'es','Ensalada mixta de frijoles y arroz salvaje','Busque en su despensa legumbres y maíz dulce para formar la base de este acompañamiento sencillo con aderezo dulce y picante.','["375 g de mezcla de arroz, usamos basmati integral y arroz salvaje","2 latas de 400 g de judías mixtas, escurridas y enjuagadas","Lata de 340 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente cortada","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","2 cucharaditas de miel","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.\r\nUna vez cocido, enjuagar con agua fría.\r\npara enfriarse. Una vez frío combine en un\r\ntazón con los frijoles, el maíz dulce y la cebolla\r\ny pimientos rojos.","Mezclar la ralladura y el jugo de lima, la miel y\r\nchile. Vierta sobre la mezcla de arroz y mezcle.\r\nbueno, luego sazona al gusto. Revuelva\r\nel cilantro se va justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14825,4880,'es','Cuscús enjoyado','Sirva el grano con pepino, albaricoque, pimientos, aceitunas y tomates y luego rocíe con aceite de limón para darle un acabado suave.','["400 g de cuscús","2 cucharadas de aceite de limón","500 g de orejones blandos, picados","1 pepino, sin semillas y picado","1 pimiento amarillo grande, sin semillas y picado","140 g de aceitunas negras deshuesadas y picadas","140 g de tomates secos, picados","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","12 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad"]','["Colocar el cuscús en un bol y tapar.\r\ncon 700ml de agua hirviendo. Cubrir con adhesivo\r\nfilmar y dejar actuar 10 min, hasta que esté todo\r\nEl líquido ha sido absorbido.","Vierta sobre el aceite y un poco de condimento.\r\nmezcle y esponje el cuscús con un tenedor.","Revuelva suavemente el resto\r\ningredientes y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14826,4882,'es','Ensalada de hierbas, apio y bulgur','Esta ensalada rápida se conserva en el refrigerador durante unos días: es un excelente almuerzo o refrigerio saludable para tener a mano.','["200 g de trigo búlgaro","1 manojo de apio","1 manzana de postre","jugo 1 limon","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","un puñado de avellanas tostadas, picadas en trozos grandes","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","un puñado grande de semillas de granada","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","manojo pequeño de menta, picada","estragón en manojo pequeño, picado"]','["Ponga el trigo búlgaro en una olla grande.\r\ntazón y simplemente cubra con agua hirviendo.\r\nCubrir el bol con film transparente y dejar\r\ndurante 30 minutos para absorber toda el agua.","Mientras tanto, separe los palitos de\r\napio y reserve las hojas. muy\r\nCortar finamente el apio y picarlo en trozos grandes.\r\nlas hojas. Cortar la manzana en finas\r\ncerillas y agregue un poco de limón\r\njugo. En un bol mezclar el resto\r\njugo de limón con el aceite y un poco\r\ncondimento para hacer un aderezo.","Esponje suavemente el bulghar con un tenedor.\r\nMezcle el apio en rodajas y la manzana.\r\nel búlgaro, seguido de las nueces, la guindilla,\r\nsemillas de granada y hierbas. llovizna\r\nsobre el aderezo y tirar todo\r\njuntos suavemente. Esparcir con el apio\r\ndeja y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:04:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14827,4888,'es','Ensalada crujiente de gambas y fideos','Una vibrante ensalada de mariscos al estilo vietnamita con cilantro, zanahorias y cebolletas','["100 g de fideos de arroz","2 zanahorias pequeñas, cortadas en palitos finos","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","un puñado pequeño de cilantro y menta, picados","140 g de gambas cocidas en guindilla, lima y cilantro (nosotros utilizamos Waitrose)","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja reducida en sal","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","2 cucharaditas de azúcar moreno suave y claro","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima"]','["Remojar los fideos en agua hirviendo.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Drenar\r\ny pasar por agua fría hasta que se enfríe, luego\r\nescurrir bien nuevamente. Mezclar los fideos con\r\nlas zanahorias, las cebolletas, el cilantro,\r\nmenta y gambas.","En un tazón pequeño, bata el resto\r\ningredientes juntos, verter sobre el\r\nensalada de fideos y revuelva bien para cubrir.\r\nGuárdelo en recipientes hasta que esté listo para comer."]','2026-01-11 13:04:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14828,4890,'es','Ensalada de gambas, granada y pomelo','Evite los picatostes de pan y un aderezo de crema espesa y, en su lugar, sirva una ensalada crujiente y afrutada con mariscos.','["2 pomelos rosados, ralladura y jugo de 1, gajos cortados del otro","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","2 cucharadas de eneldo picado","300 g de gambas cocidas y peladas","½ pepino, cortado por la mitad a lo largo, sin las semillas con una cucharadita, cortado en cubitos","2 chalotes, finamente picados","2 puñados rizados, desgarrados","2 puñados de rúcula","Paquete de 100 g de semillas de granada."]','["Batir la ralladura de pomelo\r\ny jugo, aceite, vinagre, azúcar y eneldo\r\npara hacer un aderezo. Mezclar la mitad con el\r\nlos langostinos y dejar marinar durante 10 minutos.","Justo antes de servir, mezcle suavemente el\r\npepino, chalotas, frisée y rúcula\r\ncon el aderezo restante. Agregar una pila\r\na cada uno de los 6 platos iniciales, junto con el\r\ngambas y gajos de pomelo. dispersión\r\nsobre las semillas de granada y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14829,4892,'es','Sopa de calabaza al curry, lentejas y coco','Dale sabor a la calabaza con especias indias para esta sopa vegetariana cálida y saludable.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 calabaza, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en cubitos","200 g de zanahorias cortadas en cubitos","1 cucharada de curry en polvo que contenga cúrcuma","100 g de lentejas rojas","700 ml de caldo de verduras","1 lata de leche de coco baja en grasa","cilantro y pan naan, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande, agregar\r\nla calabaza y las zanahorias, chisporrotear durante 1 min,\r\nluego agregue el curry en polvo y cocine\r\ndurante 1 min más. Echa las lentejas, las\r\ncaldo de verduras y leche de coco\r\ny revolver todo bien. traer\r\nhasta que hierva, luego baje el fuego\r\ny cocine a fuego lento durante 15-18 minutos hasta que\r\ntodo es tierno.","Usando una batidora de mano o en una comida\r\nprocesador, mezcle hasta que esté tan suave como usted\r\ncomo. Sazone y sirva esparcido con\r\ncilantro picado y un poco\r\npan naan al lado."]','2026-01-11 13:04:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14830,4894,'es','Ensalada de pasta con atún, alcaparras y aderezo balsámico','Actualice la ensalada de pasta con atún omitiendo la mayonesa y agregando vinagre balsámico, aceite de oliva, tomates coloridos y apio.','["350 g de pasta orecchiette","Tarro de 225 g de atún aprobado por MSC en agua de manantial, escurrido","1 cucharada de alcaparras, escurridas","15 pimientos peppadew de un frasco, picados","1 corazón de apio, rebanado","140 g de tomates cherry amarillos, rojos o una mezcla de tomates cortados por la mitad","75 ml de vinagre balsámico","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","Bolsa de 100 g de hojas de rúcula.","un buen puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Cocine la pasta siguiente paquete\r\ninstrucciones, luego escurrir y enjuagar en agua fría.\r\nagua. Después de drenar nuevamente, transferir a un\r\ntazón grande. Agrega los ingredientes restantes\r\nexcepto la albahaca, sazone bien y revuelva\r\ncombinar. Espolvorea con albahaca y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:04:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14831,4896,'es','Sopa especiada de zanahoria y lentejas','Una mezcla deliciosa y picante, repleta de hierro y, además, baja en grasas. Está listo en menos de media hora o se puede preparar en una olla de cocción lenta.','["2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","pizca de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","600 g de zanahorias lavadas y ralladas gruesas (no es necesario pelarlas)","140 g de lentejas rojas partidas","1 litro de caldo de verduras caliente (en cubitos está bien)","125ml de leche","yogur natural y pan naan, para servir"]','["Calienta una cacerola grande y fríe las semillas de comino y las hojuelas de chile durante 1 minuto, o hasta que\r\nEmpiezan a saltar por la sartén y a liberar sus aromas. Saque aproximadamente la mitad de las semillas con\r\nuna cuchara y reservar. Agrega el aceite, la zanahoria, las lentejas, el caldo y la leche a la sartén y deja hervir. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta que las lentejas se hinchen y se ablanden.","Batir la sopa con una batidora o en un procesador de alimentos hasta que quede suave (o dejarla en trozos si lo prefiere). Sazone al gusto y termine con una cucharada de yogur y una pizca de las especias tostadas reservadas. Sirva con panes naan calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:04:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14832,4899,'es','hummus de castañas','Prepare un poco de hummus festivo utilizando castañas en lugar de los garbanzos habituales. Sirva con crudités como entrante, refrigerio o complemento navideño fácil para el buffet.','["180g de castañas cocidas al vacío","1 limón, exprimido","1 diente de ajo","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","patatas fritas de pita y crudités de verduras, para servir"]','["Saca una castaña del paquete y resérvala. Echa el resto de las castañas en una batidora o batidora con el zumo de limón, el ajo, el aceite y un poco de agua recién hervida de la tetera. Estación. Mezcle hasta obtener un puré suave, luego vierta en un tazón o distribuya en cuatro platos.","Ralla finamente sobre las castañas reservadas y luego sirve con patatas fritas de pita y crudités de verduras."]','2026-01-11 13:04:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14833,4901,'es','Trufas veganas','Prepare estas magníficas trufas veganas como refrigerio o como regalo comestible para familiares y amigos. Están elaborados con chocolate sin lácteos y leche de origen vegetal.','["200 g de chocolate negro sin lácteos, finamente picado","100ml de leche vegetal (nosotros utilizamos de avena)","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de cacao en polvo"]','["Pon el chocolate en un recipiente mediano resistente al calor. Vierta la leche, el azúcar y la vainilla en una cacerola pequeña, luego hierva a fuego medio, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Vierta la mezcla de leche caliente sobre el chocolate, déjelo reposar durante 1 minuto, luego revuelva hasta que el chocolate se derrita y la mezcla esté suave. Cubra y enfríe durante 4 horas hasta que cuaje.","Haga bolas con cucharaditas de la mezcla con las manos y luego transfiéralas a una bandeja o plato para hornear pequeño; es posible que desee usar guantes. Deberías tener unas 20 bolas.","Coloque el cacao en polvo en un plato poco profundo y enrolle las trufas frías hasta que estén bien cubiertas, quitando el exceso, si es necesario. Enfríelo hasta que esté listo para regalar. Se conservará en el refrigerador hasta por cuatro días."]','2026-01-11 13:04:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14834,4903,'es','Galletas indias especiadas (mathri)','Prepare una tanda de estos crujientes bocadillos indios sazonados con comino y luego disfrútelos con una cucharada de su pepinillo indio favorito y una taza de masala chai.','["100 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de sal fina","¾ cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra molidos","15 g de ghee, derretido y enfriado","aceite vegetal o de girasol para enrollar y freír","pepinillo indio, para servir"]','["Tamice la harina y la sal en un bol, luego agregue las semillas de comino y los granos de pimienta.","Agregue el ghee enfriado (pero aún líquido) a los ingredientes secos y mezcle con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado grueso.","Mezcle aproximadamente 2-3 cucharadas de agua fría para hacer una masa firme, luego amase durante 3-4 minutos hasta que quede suave. Tapar y dejar reposar 20 minutos a temperatura ambiente.","Amasar la masa reposada durante 1 minuto, luego dividirla en 15 porciones (pesar para mayor precisión, si lo desea; cada porción debe pesar aproximadamente 10 g). Enrolle cada porción en una bola del tamaño de una canica y cúbrala con un paño mientras trabaja para evitar que se sequen.","Extienda cada bola sobre una superficie ligeramente engrasada hasta formar un disco de 4 cm que tiene aproximadamente el grosor de una moneda de 20 peniques. Pinche todo con un tenedor para evitar que el mathri se hinche mientras se cocina.","Calienta el aceite en awokor karahi a fuego medio, asegurándote de que no esté más de dos tercios de su capacidad, a 130°C, o hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 1 min. Trabajando en tandas, sumerja el mathri en el aceite con una espumadera plana. Baje el fuego a bajo y cocine el mathri durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté dorado pálido. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y dejar enfriar. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por dos semanas. Cubra el mathri con pepinillo indio y sirva a temperatura ambiente con masala chai."]','2026-01-11 13:04:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14835,4905,'es','Pastel de zanahoria sin azúcar','Este bizcocho de zanahoria sin lácteos y sin azúcar utiliza xilitol natural para endulzarlo y es muy sencillo de hacer','["100 g de nueces","140 g de harina con levadura, tamizada","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","140 g de xilitol (ver consejo a continuación)","2 huevos grandes (a temperatura ambiente)","140 ml de aceite de colza","175 g de zanahorias ralladas","100g de pasas","un chorrito de sirope de agave (opcional)"]','["Precaliente el horno a 180 ° C / 160 ° C con ventilador / marca de gas 4. Engrase y forre un molde para pastel redondo de 18 cm con papel para hornear. Reserva 12 nueces y pica el resto en trozos grandes.","En un tazón grande, mezcle la harina, la canela, el bicarbonato de sodio, el xilitol y las nueces picadas.","En un recipiente o jarra aparte, bata los huevos y el aceite de colza. Vierta en la mezcla de harina y revuelva hasta que se combinen. Agrega la zanahoria y las pasas. Vierta en la lata forrada, alise la superficie y presione las nueces enteras para formar un círculo alrededor del borde.","Cocine durante 1 hora - 1 hora y 10 minutos hasta que la parte superior se sienta elástica al tacto y al insertar una brocheta en el pastel, ésta salga limpia. Verifique después de 50 minutos, si el pastel se está oscureciendo demasiado, cúbralo sin apretar con papel de aluminio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla durante 10 minutos, luego desmoldar y dejar enfriar. Sirva ligeramente tibio o frío. Este bizcocho se conserva hasta cinco días en una lata. Antes de servir, rocíe con jarabe de agave si le gustan los dulces."]','2026-01-11 13:04:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14836,4907,'es','Dip de camote con chorizo ​​y achicoria','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Atiende a todos los asistentes a tu fiesta con este saludable canapé de salsa de pimentón y salchicha española; no contiene gluten ni lácteos.','["2 batatas grandes","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","½ cucharadita de pimentón dulce ahumado","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","un puñado pequeño de cilantro o perejil, picado, y un poco más para servir","250 g de chorizos mini para cocinar (para dietas especiales, consulte el consejo a continuación)","pocas cabezas de achicoria roja y blanca, hojas separadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner\r\nlas patatas en una bandeja para horno y hornear\r\ndurante 50 minutos hasta que esté muy suave. Dejar enfriar.","Saque la pulpa de la papa y conviértala en un alimento.\r\nprocesadora, desechando la piel. Añadir\r\nel aceite, pimentón, vinagre, cilantro o\r\nperejil y un poco de condimento y mezclar\r\nuna pasta suave. Transfiera a un tazón, cubra\r\ncon film transparente y dejar enfriar hasta que sea necesario. el\r\nLa salsa se mantendrá durante 2 días en el refrigerador, solo\r\nllevar a temperatura ambiente antes de servir.","Cocine el chorizo en una sartén pequeña.\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido. Drenar\r\nsobre papel de cocina. Esparcir cilantro extra\r\no perejil sobre la salsa y sirva con el\r\nchorizo y hojas de achicoria para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:04:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14837,4909,'es','Pepitas energéticas de frutos secos','Dale un verdadero impulso a tus niveles de energía con estos bocados de frutas saludables y nutricionalmente equilibrados','["50 g de orejones blandos","100 g de dátiles secos y blandos","50 g de cerezas secas","2 cucharaditas de aceite de coco","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo tostadas"]','["Batir los albaricoques con\r\nfechas y\r\ncerezas en un procesador de alimentos hasta que estén muy\r\nfinamente picado. Vierta en un tazón y use\r\ntus manos para trabajar en aceite de coco.\r\nForme bolitas del tamaño de una nuez con la mezcla,\r\nluego enrollar en sésamo\r\nsemillas. Guardar en un recipiente hermético\r\nhasta que necesites una dosis rápida de energía."]','2026-01-11 13:04:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14838,4911,'es','Nueces dulces y picantes','Almendras tostadas, nueces de Brasil y anacardos con sabores especiados y luego empacados en bolsas como regalo casero','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","400 g de frutos secos (pruebe con almendras, nueces de Brasil y anacardos)","2 cucharadas de miel"]','["Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1. Mezclar el aceite con las especias, luego agregar las nueces y rociar sobre la mitad de la miel. Extienda sobre una bandeja para hornear y cocine por 10 minutos.","Retirar del horno y rociar con la miel restante, luego regresar al horno y cocinar por 10 minutos más. Dejar enfriar por completo."]','2026-01-11 13:04:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14839,4913,'es','Dip picante de frijoles y maíz','Convierta los productos básicos de la despensa de maíz dulce enlatado, frijoles rojos y frijoles mixtos en algo especial.','["Lata de 395 g de frijoles en salsa de chile","Lata de 400 g de frijoles mixtos, escurridos","Lata de 326 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","cebolla morada pequeña, picada","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","350 g de palitos de verduras y totopos, para servir"]','["En un procesador de alimentos, mezcle tres cuartos\r\nde los frijoles y\r\nla mitad de los frijoles mezclados hasta que quede suave.\r\nVierta en un bol y agregue el resto.\r\ningredientes con algún condimento.\r\nServir con palitos de verduras crujientes\r\ny chips de tortilla para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:04:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14840,4915,'es','Gran guacamole','Un aguacate con trozos, un poco de chile y un toque picante de lima no pueden dejar de hacer un guacamole fantástico.','["cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de chiles jalapeños de un frasco, escurridos y finamente picados","jugo de 2 limas, o al gusto","4 aguacates"]','["En un tazón mediano, mezcla el cilantro, el ajo y los jalapeños con el jugo de lima. Pela, deshuesa y machaca los aguacates con un machacador de papas, agrégalos al bol con los demás ingredientes y un poco de condimento, y sírvelos con las fajitas o con unos totopos para empezar."]','2026-01-11 13:04:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14841,4919,'es','Mezcla de semillas con especias chinas','Pruebe estos deliciosos bocados de girasol y calabaza, una opción más saludable para una noche frente al televisor','["1 clara de huevo","2 cucharaditas de polvo de cinco especias chinas","½ cucharadita de sal","85 g de semillas de girasol y de calabaza cada una"]','["Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2. Ligeramente\r\nbatir la clara de huevo, luego agregar\r\nCinco especias chinas y sal. Agrega el girasol y la calabaza.\r\nsemillas y cubrir bien. Extenderse en un\r\nuna sola capa sobre una bandeja para hornear ligeramente engrasada\r\ny hornee por 12 min. Dejar enfriar antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 13:04:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14842,4921,'es','Hummus de verduras a la brasa con salsas','Haz 3 de tus 5 al día con esta salsa de garbanzos y crudités: perfecta para un almuerzo o merienda rápida','["350 g de verduras a la brasa congeladas y descongeladas","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 diente de ajo, picado","jugo ½ limón","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","2 panes pita integrales, tostados y rebanados","100 g de rábanos, lavados","2 zanahorias, cortadas en bastones","3 ramas de apio, cortadas en bastones"]','["Inclina las verduras, la mayoría\r\ngarbanzos, ajo y jugo de limón en\r\nel bol de un procesador de alimentos con un poco\r\ncondimente, luego mezcle hasta que quede suave.","Coloque el hummus en un recipiente para servir.\r\nEsparcir sobre los garbanzos reservados y\r\nel aceite de oliva. Servir con pita tostada\r\nrodajas y las verduras para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:04:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14843,4923,'es','Paté de lentejas rojas y boniato','La salsa vegetariana de Rosie Clewlow es una alternativa saludable al hummus y excelente con crudités en una lonchera','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","½ cebolla, finamente picada","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado y un poco más","1 batata pequeña, pelada y cortada en cubitos","140 g de lentejas rojas","3 ramitas de tomillo, hojas picadas y un poco más para decorar (opcional)","500 ml de caldo de verduras bajo en sodio","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino tinto","pan de pita y palitos de verduras, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, agregar el\r\ncebolla y cocine lentamente hasta que esté suave y\r\ndorado. Vierta el pimentón y cocine por\r\n2 minutos más, luego agrega el dulce\r\npatata, lentejas, tomillo y caldo. traer\r\na fuego lento, luego cocine durante 20 minutos o\r\nhasta que la patata y las lentejas estén tiernas.","Agrega el vinagre y un poco de condimento.\r\ny triturar la mezcla hasta que\r\nobtienes una textura que te gusta. Enfriar durante 1 hora,\r\nluego rociar con aceite de oliva, espolvorear con\r\npimentón extra y espolvorear con tomillo\r\nramitas, si quieres. Servir con pan pita\r\ny palitos de verduras."]','2026-01-11 13:04:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14844,4925,'es','Papas fritas al horno','Una guarnición sencilla de patatas fritas caseras no siempre es poco saludable: esta versión también cubre las patatas con especias.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cucharaditas de harina de maíz fina o polenta","½ cucharadita de pimentón","¼ cucharadita de ajo en polvo","2 patatas grandes, cortadas en trozos de 1 cm de grosor"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEchar el aceite en una bandeja para horno y poner\r\nen el horno durante 3 min. Mezclar la harina de maíz\r\no polenta, pimentón y ajo en polvo\r\njuntos y sazonar. Tira las patatas fritas\r\nen la mezcla, luego viértalo sobre la bandeja. Agitar\r\nBueno, luego cocine por 40 minutos, agitando.\r\nA mitad de cocción, hasta que esté crujiente y dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:04:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14845,4927,'es','Rodajas crujientes de ajo y romero','Estas patatas con hierbas al estilo mediterráneo saben tan bien que cuesta creer que sean bajas en grasas','["4 patatas grandes, en rodajas finas","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 cucharada de agujas de romero"]','["Caliente la parrilla a fuego medio y cocine a fuego lento\r\npatatas en agua con sal durante 3 minutos.\r\nEscurrir bien, verter en una fuente para hornear poco profunda.\r\nbandeja, luego mezcle suavemente con el aceite, el ajo,\r\nromero y condimento. extenderse\r\nen una capa y cocine a la parrilla durante 10-15 minutos o\r\nhasta que esté crujiente y dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:04:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14846,4929,'es','Ensalada de remolacha y manzana','Un poco como una ensalada Waldorf, estas ollas verdes individuales con nueces, apio y perejil son excelentes para una fiesta.','["250 g de remolacha cocida, cortada en cubos de 1 cm","2 manzanas, cortadas en cubos de 1 cm","2 ramas de apio, finamente cortadas","50 g de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes","un puñado de perejil picado","3 cucharadas de aceite de nuez","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto"]','["Poner la remolacha, las manzanas, el apio, las nueces.\r\ny perejil en un bol. Batir juntos el\r\naceite de nuez, vinagre y algún condimento,\r\nvierta sobre la ensalada de remolacha y mezcle\r\nbueno. Dividir en vasos pequeños o\r\ntazas de té y enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir. Se puede preparar con hasta 3 horas de anticipación."]','2026-01-11 13:04:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14847,4931,'es','Sorbete de lichi y jengibre','Este refrescante postre preparado con anticipación es una forma refrescante de terminar una cena de temática china.','["2 latas de 400g de lichis en almíbar","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, en rodajas","1 clara de huevo","2 piezas de jengibre en almíbar, rallado y un poco de almíbar para servir"]','["Escurrir el almíbar de dos latas de\r\nlichis en una cacerola pequeña. Agrega el azúcar\r\ny disolver a fuego suave. traer\r\na ebullición durante 1 min. Bombardea a los drenados\r\nlichis, rodajas de jengibre fresco y lichi\r\nalmíbar en una licuadora hasta que esté muy fino\r\npicado. Pasar por un colador. Inclínate hacia\r\nun recipiente de 1 litro y congelar durante al menos\r\n6 horas hasta que esté sólido.","Rompa la mezcla congelada y luego póngala en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos. Vierta la clara de huevo y\r\nBatir hasta que esté espeso, pálido y suave. Regresar\r\nal recipiente y volver a congelar, idealmente\r\ndurante la noche. Servir en bolas con rodajas de\r\ntallo de jengibre y almíbar, con galletas de la fortuna chinas o galletas finas de mantequilla o almendras."]','2026-01-11 13:04:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14848,4935,'es','Gajos de patata con salsa de curry','Esta cremosa salsa de curry es la compañera perfecta para acompañar crujientes gajos de papa.','["6 patatas grandes para asar","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry tikka masala","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","Lata de 400 g de leche de coco desnatada","un puñado de hojas de cilantro picadas (opcional)","jugo ½ limón"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Cortar las patatas en gajos. Vierta el aceite en una fuente para asar grande (no es necesario pelarla), agregue los gajos hasta que estén completamente cubiertos y luego sazone con pimienta. Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y dorado.","Poner en un cazo la pasta de curry y el puré de tomate, remover bien y sofreír durante 1 min. Agregue la leche de coco, lleve a ebullición y luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Se puede congelar o preparar con hasta un día de anticipación. Sazone al gusto y termine con un chorrito de jugo de limón y un poco de cilantro, si lo usa."]','2026-01-11 13:04:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14849,4937,'es','Palomitas de maíz dulces y picantes','Listo en menos de 10 minutos, este refrigerio es excelente para comerlo caliente o guardarlo como refrigerio para evitar el hambre entre comidas.','["Bolsa de 100g de palomitas de microondas saladas","¼ cucharadita de chile en polvo","½ cucharadita de canela","1 cucharada de sirope de agave"]','["Cocine las palomitas de maíz para microondas según las instrucciones del paquete. Vierta en un tazón grande. Espolvorea las especias y luego vierte sobre el jarabe de agave. Revuelva y sirva caliente o vierta en una bolsa y llévelo al trabajo como merienda."]','2026-01-11 13:04:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14850,4939,'es','Patatas fritas de manzana especiadas','Mantenga a raya el hambre comiendo frutas secas saludables: esta versión hornea Granny Smiths con canela','["2 abuelas smith","canela, para espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/ marca de gas 3. Descorazonar la manzana y cortarla a lo largo del ecuador en rodajas muy finas de 1 a 2 mm de grosor. Espolvoree con canela y colóquelo sobre una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino.","Cocine durante 45 minutos – 1 hora, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad y retirando las patatas fritas que se hayan vuelto marrones. Continúe cocinando hasta que las manzanas se hayan secado y estén ligeramente doradas. Deje enfriar, guárdelo en un recipiente hermético y disfrútelo como refrigerio."]','2026-01-11 13:04:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14851,4941,'es','Panes planos sin semillas','Panes estilo marroquí con nigella y semillas de sésamo, ideales para envolver y mojar','["Error 500 (Server Error)!!1500.That’s an error.There was an error. Please try again later.That’s all we know.","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","400 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte","200 g de harina integral para pan","aceite, para engrasar","1 cucharada de semillas de kalonji (también llamadas semillas de cebolla negra o semillas de nigella)","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo"]','["Mezclar la levadura con 2 cucharadas de agua tibia.\r\ny el azúcar, y dejar reposar unos minutos. consejo\r\nlas harinas en un tazón grande con 1 cucharadita de sal\r\ny hacer un pozo en el centro. Vierta el\r\nmezcla de levadura y 500 ml de agua tibia. Mezclar\r\ncon una cuchara de madera hasta que salga\r\njuntos como una masa, luego volcar sobre una obra\r\nsuperficie y amase durante 5-10 minutos hasta que\r\nsuave y elástico – añade un poco más\r\nharina si la masa está demasiado pegajosa. Pon el\r\nmasa en un recipiente engrasado, cubrir con un té\r\ntoalla y dejar en un lugar cálido para que suba\r\ndurante 1 hora hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Coloca la masa sobre tu superficie de trabajo.\r\ny sacar todo el aire. Amasar las semillas\r\nen la masa hasta que esté bien distribuida. dividir\r\nla masa en 12 trozos, luego extienda cada uno\r\nlo más fino que puedas. Calentar una sartén grande,\r\nCocine los panes planos durante 2 minutos o hasta que\r\nAparecen burbujas en la superficie, luego voltea.\r\nvoltee y cocine por 2 minutos más. Una vez todo\r\nestán cocidos, envolver en papel de aluminio y reservar hasta\r\na un día. Mételo en un horno tibio para recalentar."]','2026-01-11 13:04:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14852,4943,'es','Pizza sin lactosa','Prepara una pizza familiar fácil y cúbrela con passata, Grana Padano y tus ingredientes favoritos. Delicioso para todos, es ideal para cualquier persona intolerante a la lactosa.','["100ml en puré","1 diente de ajo, machacado","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","50 g de Grana Padano, 40 g finamente rallado, 10 g afeitados con un pelador de verduras","un puñado pequeño de alcaparras, aceitunas deshuesadas, pepperoni en rodajas o jalapeños encurtidos (opcional)","puñado de cohetes","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","300 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","Sobre de 7 g de levadura de acción rápida.","1 cucharadita de sal marina fina","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, y más para el bol"]','["Para hacer la masa de pizza, verter la harina en un bol, poner la levadura por un lado y la sal por el otro. Hacer un hueco en el centro y verter 200 ml de agua tibia y el aceite de oliva. Mezcle con las manos para formar una masa rugosa, luego colóquela sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada y amase durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que quede suave y elástica. Poner en un recipiente engrasado, cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar hasta que doble su tamaño, aproximadamente 1 hora.","Calentar el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9 y poner una bandeja de horno dentro para que se caliente. Vuelva a colocar la masa en el bol y luego divídala en dos bolas. Presione las bolas de masa hasta formar círculos planos sobre una superficie de trabajo enharinada, luego enrolle hasta formar bases de pizza de 5 mm de grosor y unos 25 cm de ancho. Transfiera a dos hojas de papel para hornear.","Mezcla la passata, el ajo y el orégano en un tazón pequeño con un poco de condimento. Vierta la salsa sobre las bases dejando un borde de 1 cm. Espolvorea con el Grana Padano finamente rallado y cualquiera de los aderezos, si lo deseas. Transfiera las pizzas, cocinándolas una a la vez, a la bandeja precalentada con el papel para hornear. Hornee durante 10 minutos hasta que las cortezas estén doradas y crujientes. Repita con la pizza restante.","Cubra las pizzas con la rúcula y las virutas de Grana Padano y luego rocíe con aceite para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14853,4947,'es','caldo de pavo','Aprovecha al máximo tu pavo usando los huesos para hacer un caldo. Se puede guardar en el congelador para usarlo en sopas, risottos y más.','["1 canal de pavo, sin carne","2 cebollas picadas","2 zanahorias, picadas","2 tallos de apio, picados","1 cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra","3 ramitas de tomillo","1 hoja de laurel"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes en una olla grande o en tu cacerola más grande y completa con 2 litros de agua. Agregue más agua para cubrir todos los ingredientes si es necesario.","Llevar a ebullición a fuego alto, quitando con una cuchara la espuma que aparezca encima del líquido. Reduzca a fuego medio, luego cocine a fuego lento, medio tapado, durante 3 horas; el caldo se habrá reducido y concentrado sus sabores. O, si prefiere un caldo más ligero, cubra completamente mientras hierve a fuego lento.","Apagar el fuego y dejar enfriar unos minutos, luego colar con cuidado en un recipiente o bol para que se enfríe por completo. Se conservará en el frigorífico una semana y tres meses en el congelador."]','2026-01-11 13:04:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14854,4949,'es','Tarta navideña sin gluten','Prepara este pastel navideño sin lácteos, gluten, nueces ni huevos. ¡Este es un pastel festivo para todos y la mejor parte es que nadie adivinará que está libre de contenido!','["150 g de pasas","100g de pasas","125 g de grosellas","200 g de pieles confitadas mixtas","100 g de cerezas glaseadas, partidas por la mitad","2 naranjas, ralladas y en jugo","100 ml de brandy o té negro, más 4 cucharadas","175 g de margarina sin lácteos, más un extra para la lata","175 g de azúcar moreno blando","50 g de melaza","200ml de leche de soja","2 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra","400 g de harina sin gluten","2 cucharaditas de goma xantana","¾ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","2 cucharaditas de especias mixtas","2 cucharaditas de canela molida"]','["El día antes de hornear el pastel, combine las pasas, las sultanas, las grosellas, la mezcla de cáscaras confitadas, las cerezas glaseadas, el jugo de naranja y 100 ml de brandy en un tazón grande. Tapar y dejar en remojo toda la noche.","Unte con mantequilla un molde para pastel redondo de 20 cm de profundidad y cubra la base y los lados con papel para hornear. Batir la margarina, el azúcar, la melaza y la ralladura de naranja en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica hasta que quede suave y esponjosa. Incorpora poco a poco la leche y el vinagre (la mezcla se dividirá en este punto, pero se volverá a unir cuando se agreguen los ingredientes secos, así que no te preocupes). Mezcle la harina, la goma xantana, el bicarbonato de sodio, la mezcla de especias y la canela en un segundo tazón grande. Mezcle gradualmente los ingredientes húmedos con los secos hasta que quede suave. Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2.","Incorpora la fruta remojada a la mezcla del pastel hasta que se combinen, luego vierte en el molde y nivela la parte superior con el dorso de una cuchara. Hornee durante 45 minutos, luego reduzca el fuego a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1 y hornee durante 2-3 horas más hasta que el pastel esté profundamente dorado y firme al tacto (cubra la parte superior del pastel con papel de aluminio si comienza a oscurecerse demasiado). El bizcocho estará listo cuando al introducir un pincho en el medio éste salga limpio.","Haga agujeros en toda la parte superior del pastel caliente con una brocheta, luego vierta 4 cucharadas de brandy y déjelo enfriar en el molde durante 1 hora. Pasar a una rejilla, retirar el pergamino y dejar enfriar por completo. Cuando el pastel esté frío, envuélvalo en una capa de papel para hornear y luego en una capa de papel de aluminio antes de guardarlo. Se conservará en un armario seco y fresco hasta por tres meses, o en el congelador hasta por seis meses."]','2026-01-11 13:04:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14855,4951,'es','Salchichas veganas en mantas','Envuelve salchichas veganas en hojaldre sin lácteos para hacer estos fáciles cerdos en mantas. Un excelente acompañamiento en Navidad, también son perfectos para fiestas y buffets.','["½ cucharada de aceite vegetal","½ hoja de hojaldre sin lácteos ya enrollado","16 salchichas veganas estilo chipolata","1 cucharada de salvia seca","1 cucharada de leche de soja","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","¼ de nuez moscada rallada","½ diente de ajo rallado"]','["Utilice el aceite para cubrir una bandeja para hornear grande. Desenrolla el hojaldre sobre una superficie de trabajo para que quede plano y luego córtalo en tiras de 16 x 10 cm de largo.","Enrolle una tira de masa alrededor de cada salchicha, de modo que parezca un sacacorchos. Transfiera a la bandeja preparada y enfríe durante 15 minutos. Se mantendrá en el refrigerador durante la noche o en el congelador hasta por dos semanas.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Para hacer el glaseado, combinar en un bol la leche de soja, el aceite, la nuez moscada, el ajo, una pizca de sal y abundante pimienta negra. Cepille el glaseado sobre las espirales de masa con una brocha de repostería y luego espolvoree con salvia. Hornee durante 25 a 30 minutos, o hasta que la masa esté inflada y dorada y las salchichas estén bien cocidas."]','2026-01-11 13:04:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14856,4953,'es','Lubina al horno con aderezo de alcaparras al limón','Este plato principal elegante y sin gluten es lo suficientemente especial para una cena, pero simple y rápido de preparar para entretener sin complicaciones.','["4 filetes de lubina de 100 g/4 oz","aceite de oliva, para cepillar","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","ralladura de 1 limón, más 2 cucharadas de jugo","2 cucharadas de alcaparras pequeñas","2 cucharaditas de mostaza Dijon sin gluten","2 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana picado, más algunas hojas extra (opcional)"]','["Para hacer el aderezo, mezcla el aceite con la ralladura y el jugo de limón, las alcaparras, la mostaza, un poco de condimento y 1 cucharada de agua. No agregue el perejil todavía (a menos que sirva inmediatamente), ya que el ácido del limón desvanecerá el color si se dejan juntos por mucho tiempo.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Forrar una bandeja para horno con papel para hornear y poner encima el pescado, con la piel hacia arriba. Cepille la piel con aceite y espolvoree con un poco de sal en escamas. Hornee durante 7 minutos o hasta que la carne se desmenuce al probarla con un cuchillo. Coloque el pescado en platos calientes para servir, vierta sobre el aderezo y espolvoree con hojas adicionales de perejil, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:04:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14857,4955,'es','Biriyani vegano de verduras con ensalada de zanahoria','Un plato de arroz basmati de inspiración india, sin carne ni lácteos, con coliflor, judías verdes, guisantes, patatas, pasta de curry casera y ensalada de zanahoria.','["400 g de arroz basmati","pellizcar hebras de azafrán (opcional)","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 coliflor, cortada en floretes","2 patatas, cortadas en trozos","100 g de lentejas rojas","100 g de judías verdes, peladas y cortadas por la mitad","un puñado de hojas de curry","2 puñados de guisantes congelados","cilantro en manojo pequeño","50 g de anacardos tostados, picados en trozos grandes","poppadoms y pan naan, para servir","1 cebolla grande, picada en trozos grandes","jengibre en trozos grandes, picado en trozos grandes","5 dientes de ajo","2 cucharaditas de curry en polvo","1 cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 chile verde pequeño","4 zanahorias","pizca de azúcar en polvo dorado","exprimir el jugo de limon","un puñado de anacardos, picados en trozos grandes","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, picadas en trozos grandes","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado en palitos","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino, tostadas"]','["Remojar el arroz durante 30 minutos y luego enjuagar.\r\nvarios cambios de agua hasta que corra\r\nclaro. Cubrir con aproximadamente 1 cm de agua, agregar\r\nel azafrán (si se usa), tapar la sartén, traer\r\nhasta que hierva, revuelva una vez y luego apague el\r\ncalor. Dejar reposar 10 minutos tapado y luego\r\nRevuelva nuevamente y deje reposar tapado.","Para hacer la pasta, bombardea todos los\r\ningredientes juntos en un procesador de alimentos.\r\nCalentar el aceite en una cacerola. Consejo en el\r\npegar, luego agregar la coliflor y\r\npatatas. Cocine en la pasta para colorear,\r\nluego agregue las lentejas y las judías verdes, y\r\ncubrir con unos 400ml de agua. Añade el\r\nhojas de curry, sazonar con sal, cubrir con\r\ntapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que\r\nlas lentejas y las verduras estén tiernas Añade el\r\nguisantes durante los últimos 2 minutos para descongelarlos. Revuelva\r\nel arroz por el curry hasta que esté completamente\r\nmezclado y caliente, luego vierta en un plato\r\ny espolvorear con cilantro y anacardos.","Para la ensalada de zanahoria, usa un pelador para rallar.\r\nlas zanahorias en tiras. Espolvorear con el\r\nazúcar y aliñar con el jugo de limón, luego\r\nmezcle con los otros ingredientes. servir el\r\nbiryani en un plato grande para que todos lo coman\r\nsírvanse ellos mismos, con la ensalada de zanahoria\r\nal lado, poppadoms para cualquier vegano y\r\npan naan para los vegetarianos."]','2026-01-11 13:04:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14858,4957,'es','Ensalada de trigo bulgur, dátiles y clementinas','Una mezcla de cítricos, cereales saludables y legumbres nutritivas al estilo del Medio Oriente, sin carne ni lácteos, ideal para loncheras.','["140 g de trigo búlgaro","1 cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica molida","1 cucharadita de comino molido","6 dátiles sin hueso, picados","un puñado pequeño de perejil picado","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","2 cucharadas de almendras tostadas en láminas","Bolsa de 100g de espinacas tiernas","2 clementinas, sin piel, cortadas en rodajas","jugo 1 limon","2 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Poner el trigo búlgaro y las especias.\r\nun tazón grande, sazone con sal y vierta\r\nmás de 140 ml de agua hirviendo. Cubrir con adhesivo\r\nfilmar y dejar reposar 10 minutos. Pelusa con\r\nun tenedor, luego agregue los dátiles picados,\r\nperejil, garbanzos y la mayor parte del\r\nalmendras. Vierta los ingredientes del aderezo.\r\nen un frasco de vidrio con tapa ajustada y agregue\r\nalgún condimento. Agitar bien y verter\r\nsobre la ensalada.","Justo antes de comer, mezcle las espinacas.\r\nhasta el final, cubra con las rodajas de clementina\r\ny espolvorear con las almendras restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:04:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14859,4959,'es','Cócteles de aguacate, gambas e hinojo','Una versión moderna y más ligera del entrante retro, el cóctel de gambas.','["4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 naranja gajos, más el jugo de los recortes","jugo 1 limon","1 bulbo de hinojo, recortado, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 aguacate, cortado en cuartos, pelado y rebanado","200 g de langostinos cocidos","3 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","Bolsa 55g rúcula salvaje"]','["Hacer el aderezo mezclando el aceite y\r\njugos de cítricos juntos en un tazón pequeño con\r\nun poco de sal y pimienta, luego reservar.","En un bol, mezcle todos los demás ingredientes,\r\nexcepto la rúcula, junto con la naranja\r\ngajos y la mitad del aderezo. dispersión\r\nlas hojas de rúcula en 4 copas de Martini o\r\nen tazones pequeños, apile la ensalada en el centro,\r\nluego rocíe con el aderezo restante\r\njusto antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14860,4963,'es','Ensalada bistró de espinacas tiernas y tocino','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta sencilla ensalada estilo francés es un maravilloso almuerzo ligero.','["140 g de judías verdes finas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","6 lonchas de tocino ahumado, picado en trozos pequeños","2 rebanadas gruesas de pan blanco sin corteza, cortadas en cubos","200 g de champiñones, en rodajas","1 aguacate, partido por la mitad y en rodajas","250 g de espinacas tiernas","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","1 cucharada de mostaza integral","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Mezclar los ingredientes del aderezo\r\ncon 1 cucharada de agua y sazonar con sal\r\ny pimienta. Hervir los frijoles durante 3 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté cocido, escurrir en agua fría,\r\nluego escurrir nuevamente.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, luego\r\nChisporrotea el tocino durante 4 minutos hasta que esté crujiente.\r\nUse una espumadera para sacar el tocino.\r\nen una ensaladera grande. Utilice la grasa en el\r\nsartén para freír los cubos de pan hasta que estén crujientes,\r\nluego inclínelos con el tocino. Dar una propina\r\necha más aceite en la sartén, muy brevemente\r\nFreír los champiñones sólo para deshacerlos.\r\nsu crudeza, luego apague el fuego.\r\nCuando los champiñones se hayan enfriado\r\nligeramente, viértalos en la ensaladera\r\njunto con los frijoles y el aguacate.\r\nMomentos antes de servir, agrega las espinacas.\r\ny vestirse, luego mezclar muy bien para\r\ntodo está recubierto."]','2026-01-11 13:04:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14861,4965,'es','Filetes de pescado con costra de limón y romero','Utilice el pan sobrante en este aderezo crujiente para darle vida al pescado blanco.','["4 filetes de pescado blanco (la merluza es sostenible)","2 ramitas de romero, hojas picadas o 1 cucharadita seca","50 g de pan (unas 2 rebanadas), partido en trozos","rallar 2 limones y gajos para servir","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio. colocar el pescado\r\nfiletes, con la piel hacia arriba, en una bandeja para hornear, luego\r\nasa durante 4 minutos. Mientras tanto, coloque el\r\nromero, pan, ralladura de limón y un poco\r\nsazonar en un procesador de alimentos, luego mezclar\r\npara hacer migas finas.","Voltee el pescado y luego presione un cuarto.\r\nde las migas sobre la parte superior de cada filete.\r\nRocíe con aceite de oliva y luego cocine a la parrilla durante 4 minutos.\r\nhasta que la corteza esté dorada y el pescado\r\nbien cocido y apenas desmenuzándose. servir\r\ncon patatas nuevas con mantequilla y limón\r\ncuñas para apretar."]','2026-01-11 13:04:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14862,4967,'es','Tomates rellenos de pimientos asados ​​y queso de cabra','Disfruta de un plato sin lácteos','["25 g de piñones, más 2 cucharadas extra para espolvorear","Paquete de 225 g de espinacas tiernas","200 g de pimientos rojos asados, escurridos y cortados en cubitos","125 g de queso de cabra galés sin corteza con ajo y hierbas, más 50 g para desmenuzar","6 tomates grandes de res"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Cortar la parte superior de los tomates y desecharlos. Saque las semillas y deséchelas. Coloque los tomates en una fuente para hornear poco profunda y ligeramente engrasada.","Dorar todos los piñones en una sartén seca o bajo el grill hasta que estén dorados. Deje que las espinacas se ablanden en una sartén caliente durante un minuto. Escurrir bien en un colador, exprimir el exceso de líquido y luego picar en trozos grandes.","Combine las espinacas, los pimientos, 25 g/1 oz de nueces tostadas y 125 g/41?2 oz de queso desmenuzado en un bol y luego sazone al gusto. Divida la mezcla entre las cáscaras de tomate. Cubra cada tomate con más queso de cabra desmenuzado y el resto de los piñones, luego hornee por 20 minutos hasta que el relleno esté caliente y la piel de los tomates comience a arrugarse y partirse. Servir caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14863,4969,'es','batido vegano','Un batido vegano sin lácteos con jugo de frutas, tofu y avena para energizarte en el desayuno o brindarte sustento para hacer ejercicio.','["100 ml (¼ de vaso alto) de jugo de cereza (nosotros usamos Cherrygood)","200ml (½ vaso alto) de leche de soja sin azúcar","1 cherry soya yogurt","3 cucharadas o 50 g de tofu sedoso firme","75 g (1 bote de yogur vacío) de cerezas congeladas","2 cucharadas de gachas de avena"]','["Mide todos los ingredientes exactamente o utiliza un vaso alto y tu bote de yogur vacío para acelerar; no es necesario que sean exactos. Póngalos en una licuadora y bátalos hasta que quede suave. Vierte en 1 vaso alto (tendrás suficiente para rellenar) o en dos vasos cortos."]','2026-01-11 13:04:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14864,4971,'es','lasaña','Contiene carne de cerdo – la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Poco es más satisfactorio que cocinar un clásico a la perfección – Sarah Cook nos da una lección sobre cómo hacer lasaña','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 zanahoria (aproximadamente 100 g/4 oz) finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","Paquete de 140 g de cubitos de tocino","Paquete de 500 g de carne picada de ternera (nosotros utilizamos 10% de grasa)","Paquete de 500 g de carne picada de cerdo o ternera británica","200ml de leche","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","2 hojas de laurel","1 ramita de romero","2 ramitas de tomillo","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","2 cubitos de caldo de res","500 ml de vino tinto","unos 400 g de láminas de pasta seca","50 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","1½ litro de leche","1 cebolla, en rodajas gruesas","3 hojas de laurel","3 dientes","100 g de mantequilla","100 g de harina común","buen rallado de nuez moscada"]','["Primero infusionamos la leche para la salsa bechamel. Ponga la leche, la cebolla, el laurel y los clavos en una cacerola grande y lleve muy suavemente hasta que hierva. Apagar el fuego y dejar reposar durante 1 hora para infundir.","Para la salsa de carne, poner en otra cacerola grande el aceite, el apio, la cebolla, la zanahoria, el ajo y la panceta. Cocine juntos suavemente hasta que las verduras estén suaves pero sin color. Vierta toda la carne picada, la leche y los tomates. Con una cuchara de madera, mezcle, rompa y triture los trozos de carne picada contra los lados de la sartén. Cuando la carne picada esté casi desmenuzada, agregue todas las hierbas, los cubitos de caldo y el vino, y deje hervir a fuego lento. Tape y cocine durante 1 hora, revolviendo ocasionalmente para evitar que se pegue el fondo. Destape y cocine a fuego lento durante otros 30 minutos a 1 hora hasta que la carne esté tierna y picante. Pruebe y sazone.","Para terminar la bechamel, colar la leche por un colador fino en una o dos jarras. Derrita la mantequilla en la misma sartén y luego, con una cuchara de madera, mezcle la harina y cocine por 2 minutos. Agregue la leche colada, poco a poco; la mezcla se espesará al principio hasta formar una pasta pastosa, pero continúe agregando leche gradualmente para evitar grumos. Cuando esté toda la leche, cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo constantemente (si tiene grumos, bata rápidamente). Burbujee suavemente durante unos minutos hasta que espese. Sazone con sal, pimienta y nuez moscada.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Extienda una cucharada de salsa de carne sobre la base de una fuente para horno de aproximadamente 3,5 litros. Cubra con una sola capa de láminas de pasta, partiéndolas para que quepan si es necesario, luego cubra con una cuarta parte de la bechamel. Vierta un tercio de la salsa de carne y esparza un poco de parmesano. Repite las capas (pasta, bechamel, carne y parmesano) dos veces más para usar toda la salsa de carne. Agrega una última capa de pasta, lo último de la bechamel y el resto del parmesano. Coloque el plato en una bandeja para hornear para recoger los derrames y hornee durante 1 hora hasta que burbujee, se dore y esté crujiente por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:04:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14865,4975,'es','Muffins crumble de ruibarbo','Los sabores de un ruibarbo se desmoronan en forma de un delicioso panecillo húmedo.','["175 g de azúcar en polvo","175 g de ruibarbo, cortado por la mitad a lo largo y luego cortado en cubitos","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 huevo","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","125 ml de suero de leche","200 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","50 g de azúcar mascabado light","50 g de harina común","25 g de gachas de avena","1 cucharadita de canela molida","50 g de mantequilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nForrar un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con papel.\r\ncajas de muffins. Revuelva el azúcar y el ruibarbo.\r\njuntos y reserve mientras hace\r\nla cobertura crumble. Mezclar juntos el\r\nazúcar mascabado con la harina, avena\r\ny canela, luego frote con la mantequilla\r\nhasta que quede grumoso con las yemas de los dedos.","Remueve el aceite y el huevo, la vainilla y\r\nsuero de leche en el ruibarbo azucarado\r\n(no os preocupéis si queda un poquito jugoso).\r\nAhora, agrega la harina, el polvo para hornear.\r\ny bicarbonato de sodio y revuelva bien.","Vierta rápidamente en las cajas y luego\r\nesparcir cada uno con una capa gruesa de\r\nmezcla desmenuzada. Hornee durante 15-18 minutos\r\nhasta que esté dorado y pinchado con un palito\r\nen el centro de un muffin viene\r\nsalir limpio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 13:04:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14866,4977,'es','Bobotie','El plato nacional de Sudáfrica, pronunciado ba-boor-tea, es una deliciosa mezcla de carne al curry y fruta con una cobertura cremosa y dorada, no muy diferente a la moussaka.','["2 rebanadas de pan blanco","2 cebollas picadas","25 g de mantequilla","2 dientes de ajo machacados","Paquete de 1 kg de carne magra picada","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry madrás","1 cucharadita de hierbas secas mixtas","3 dientes","5 bayas de pimienta de Jamaica","2 cucharadas de chutney de melocotón o mango","3 cucharadas de pasas","6 hojas de laurel","300ml de leche entera","2 huevos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Vierta agua fría sobre el pan y déjelo en remojo.","Mientras tanto, sofreír las cebollas en la mantequilla, revolviendo regularmente durante 10 minutos hasta que estén suaves y empiecen a tomar color. Agrega el ajo y la carne y revuelve bien, triturando la carne picada en granos finos hasta que cambie de color. Agregue la pasta de curry, las hierbas, las especias, el chutney, las pasas y 2 hojas de laurel con 1 cucharadita de sal y abundante pimienta negra molida.","Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Exprime el agua del pan y luego incorpora la mezcla de carne hasta que esté bien mezclado. Vierta en una fuente ovalada para horno (23 x 33 cm y unos 5-6 cm de profundidad). Presiona bien la mezcla y alisa la parte superior. Puedes hacer esto y relajarte con 1 día de anticipación.","Para la cobertura, bata la leche y los huevos con el condimento y luego vierta sobre la carne. Cubra con las hojas de laurel restantes y hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que la cobertura esté firme y comience a dorarse."]','2026-01-11 13:04:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14867,4981,'es','Ensalada de cuscús de 10 minutos','Esto es un excelente relleno para la lonchera para un día y es igualmente bueno en casa desde el refrigerador.','["100 g de cuscús","200 ml de caldo de verduras caliente bajo en sal (en cubitos está bien)","2 cebolletas","1 pimiento rojo","½ pepino","50 g de queso feta, en cubos","2 cucharadas de pesto","2 cucharadas de piñones tostados"]','["Vierta el cuscús en un tazón grande y vierta\r\nvalores. Cubra, luego déjelo por 10 minutos, hasta que\r\nesponjosa y se haya absorbido todo el caldo.\r\nMientras tanto, cortar la cebolla y el pimiento.\r\ny cortar el pepino en dados. Añade estos al\r\ncuscús, pasar el pesto con un tenedor, desmenuzar\r\nqueso feta, luego espolvoree sobre piñones para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14868,4983,'es','Sopa de calabaza con chile y crema fresca','Pasa del frío a un cálido cuenco de otoño','["1 calabaza, aproximadamente 1 kg, pelada y sin semillas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de mantequilla","2 cebollas, picadas","1 diente de ajo, en rodajas finas","2 chiles rojos suaves, sin semillas y finamente picados","850 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","4 cucharadas de crema fresca y más para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nCortar la calabaza en cubos grandes, de aproximadamente\r\n4 cm/1½ pulgadas de ancho, luego agregue una\r\nfuente para asar con la mitad del aceite de oliva. asado\r\ndurante 30 minutos, volteando una vez durante la cocción,\r\nhasta que esté dorado y suave.","Mientras se cocina la calabaza, derrita la\r\nmantequilla con el aceite restante en una cacerola grande\r\ncacerola, luego agregue la cebolla, el ajo y\r\n¾ del chile. Tapar y cocinar a fuego muy\r\nfuego lento durante 15-20 minutos hasta que las cebollas\r\nson completamente suaves.","Vierta la calabaza en la sartén, agregue la\r\ncaldo y la crème fraîche, luego mezclar\r\ncon una batidora hasta que quede suave. Para\r\nuna sopa muy sedosa, ponga la sopa en un\r\nlicuadora y bátela en tandas. Regresar\r\na la sartén, recalentar suavemente y luego sazonar\r\ngusto. Sirve la sopa en tazones con remolinos.\r\nde crème fraîche y un poco de\r\nchile picado restante."]','2026-01-11 13:04:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14869,4985,'es','rollitos de pollo','Introduzca a los niños pequeños a la cocina permitiéndoles preparar su propio almuerzo con esta receta sencilla y segura.','["1 wrap o tortilla","1-2 cucharadas de hummus","3 rebanadas gordas de pechuga de pollo cocida","¼ de aguacate, sin piel","3 tomates cherry","queso cheddar rallado para hacer aproximadamente 1 cucharada"]','["ponerle una envoltura\r\nuna tabla o plato.\r\nDifundir el hummus\r\nhacia el medio de\r\nusando una cuchara o\r\ncuchillo de mantequilla.","Rompe el\r\npollo (o pedir un\r\nayudante adulto\r\nhacer esto) y ponerlo en un\r\nlínea por el medio\r\nde la envoltura. picar\r\nel aguacate con un\r\ncuchillo de mantequilla (orask\r\ntu ayudante) y pon\r\njunto al pollo.","aplastar el\r\ntomates\r\nen la envoltura por\r\napretándolos y\r\npartiéndolos por la mitad\r\n(podrían chorrear,\r\nasí que cuida tu\r\nropa). espolvorear\r\nsobre un poco de queso.","Enrollar la envoltura\r\ny presiónelo\r\nabajo firmemente.Pregunte\r\ntu adulto\r\nayudante para cortarlo\r\nla mitad para ti."]','2026-01-11 13:04:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14870,4987,'es','Tortilla de queso feta y tomates semisecos','Cocinar huevos con queso y tomate es una comida súper rápida que está lista en 10 minutos.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","2 huevos, ligeramente batidos","4 tomates semisecos, picados en trozos grandes","25 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","hojas de ensalada mixtas, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén pequeña, agregar\r\nlos huevos y cocine, revolviendo los huevos\r\ncon un tenedor mientras se endurecen. cuando los huevos\r\ntodavía están ligeramente líquidos en el medio,\r\nesparcir sobre los tomates y el queso feta,\r\nluego dobla la tortilla por la mitad. cocinar para\r\n1 min más antes de deslizar sobre un plato.\r\nSirva junto con una ensalada de hojas mixtas."]','2026-01-11 13:04:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14871,4991,'es','Hamburguesa con queso y patatas fritas','Las hamburguesas y patatas fritas caseras siempre superan a las compradas en la tienda. ¿Por qué no hacer el doble y congelar un lote?','["1¼ kg de carne picada magra","1 cebolla, finamente picada","140 g de pan rallado","100 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","1 cucharada de salsa inglesa","1 huevo, ligeramente batido con un tenedor","1 cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","Bolsa de 2½ kg de patatas cortadas en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de harina común","10 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva o girasol","panecillos para hamburguesa, lechuga, cebolla morada en rodajas, tomates, pepinillos y salsas o condimentos, para servir"]','["Vierta la carne picada en un tazón grande con\r\nla cebolla, el pan rallado, el queso, el perejil,\r\nSalsa inglesa, huevo, chile en polvo,\r\n½ cucharadita de sal y un poco de pimienta. mezclar juntos\r\nbien con las manos, luego divide la\r\nmezcle hasta formar 10 y forme hamburguesas.","Lleve 2 cacerolas grandes con agua a\r\nhervir (o preparar las patatas fritas en tandas\r\nsi no tienes suficientes cacerolas grandes). Añadir\r\nlas patatas fritas, devuelva el agua al\r\nhierve y programa el cronómetro en 3 minutos. después\r\n3 min, escurrir bien las patatas y volcar\r\nen uno o dos grandes cubiertos con papel de cocina\r\nbandejas. Espolvoree con harina y un poco de condimento y revuelva suavemente para cubrir.","Congele las hamburguesas y las patatas fritas (ver\r\nconsejos para congelar, a continuación) o cocinar directamente\r\nde distancia, calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEn una bandeja para horno, echa las patatas fritas un poco.\r\naceite, luego ase durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté crujiente\r\ny dorado. Mientras tanto, calentar una plancha\r\nsartén, parrilla o barbacoa hasta que esté caliente, luego\r\nCocine las hamburguesas durante unos 5-8 minutos.\r\npor cada lado, o hasta que esté cocido a su gusto.\r\ngusto. Sandwich las hamburguesas en tostadas\r\nbollos con ensalada y salsas, luego servir\r\ncon las patatas fritas."]','2026-01-11 13:04:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14872,4993,'es','Chaquetas de boniato y atún','Si su cena de reserva son papas al horno con atún, cámbiela por batatas y un aderezo fresco y picante, económico y bajo en grasas.','["4 batatas pequeñas (de unos 200 g cada una)","Lata de 185 g de atún en agua de manantial, escurrido","½ cebolla morada, cortada finamente","1 chile rojo pequeño, sin semillas y picado","jugo 1 lima","6 cucharadas de yogur griego","un puñado de hojas de cilantro"]','["Lavar los boniatos y pincharlos todos.\r\nencima con un tenedor. Colocar en un recipiente apto para microondas.\r\nplato y cocine a temperatura alta durante 18-20 minutos, o\r\nhasta que estén tiernos. Partir por la mitad y colocar cada uno.\r\nuno, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, en un plato para servir.","Desmenuzar el atún escurrido con un tenedor\r\ny dividir entre las batatas.\r\nCubra con la cebolla morada y el chile, luego\r\nexprime sobre el jugo de lima. Cubra con\r\nuna cucharada de yogur y esparcir por encima\r\ncilantro, para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14873,4995,'es','Ensalada de atún, espárragos y judías blancas','Una nutritiva ensalada primaveral, lista en minutos','["1 manojo grande de espárragos","2 latas de 200 g de filetes de atún aleta amarilla en agua, escurridos","2 latas de 400 g de judías cannellini en agua, escurridas","1 cebolla morada, muy finamente picada","2 cucharadas de alcaparras","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharadas de estragón, finamente picado"]','["Cocine los espárragos en una cacerola grande de\r\nagua hirviendo durante 4-5 minutos hasta que estén tiernas.\r\nEscurrir bien, enfriar con agua corriente,\r\nluego córtelo en trozos del largo de un dedo. tirar\r\njuntos el atún, frijoles, cebolla, alcaparras\r\ny los espárragos en un tazón grande para servir.","Mezclar el aceite, el vinagre y el estragón.\r\njuntos, luego vierta sobre la ensalada.\r\nEnfríe hasta que esté listo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14874,4997,'es','Ensalada tibia de pollo','Esta receta de ensalada de pollo es un excelente plato principal para un día caluroso, o llévala al trabajo y sé la envidia de tus colegas.','["2 pechugas de pollo, cortadas en trozos pequeños","½ baguette pequeña, cortada en trozos pequeños","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","Bolsa de 150 g de hojas de ensalada mixta","1 paquete de 250 g de remolacha cocida, cortada en trozos pequeños","100 g de queso de cabra"]','["Caliente el horno a 200 ° C/ventilador 180 ° C/gas 6. Extienda los trozos de pollo y la baguette sobre una bandeja para asar poco profunda. rociar con\r\n2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y revuelva para cubrir. Sazone, luego póngalo en el horno durante 15 minutos hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido y el pan esté dorado y crujiente.","Batir el aceite de oliva restante y el vinagre balsámico para hacer un aderezo. Dividir la bolsa de hojas en dos porciones.\r\nplatos, agregue la remolacha y luego esparza el queso. Mezcle con el pollo tibio y el pan, rocíe con el aderezo y sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:04:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14875,4999,'es','Muesli de miel con frambuesas y avellanas','Prepare su propio muesli y acompáñelo con fruta fresca para disfrutar de un desayuno completamente satisfactorio y saludable que le permitirá seguir adelante durante el día.','["225 g de gachas de avena, las jumbo dan buena textura","125ml de zumo de naranja recién exprimido","225ml de yogur natural, puede ser bajo en grasas","3 cucharadas de miel clara","ralladura fina de 1 limón","2 manzanas de postre rojas o rosadas","2x canastillas de 125 g de frambuesas","50 g de avellanas con piel, ligeramente tostadas y picadas en trozos grandes","crema integral, para servir (opcional)"]','["Mezclar avena, zumo de naranja y 300ml/½ litro\r\nagua fría en un bol. Cubrir con film transparente\r\ny dejar en el frigorífico toda la noche.","A la mañana siguiente, agregue el yogur,\r\nmiel y ralladura de limón. Cuarto y núcleo\r\nlas manzanas, rallarlas y revolver bien.\r\nVierta en tazones y cubra con frambuesas y avellanas tostadas. Vierta un poco\r\ncrema única, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:04:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14876,5001,'es','Patatas crujientes al horno','Las chaquetas de piel crujiente y carne esponjosa son una forma económica y alegre de alimentar a una multitud; excelentes con frijoles y salchichas.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","8 patatas grandes para asar","Bote de 300 ml de crema agria"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Frotar\r\nun poco de aceite sobre cada papa y poner\r\nel estante superior del horno. Hornee por 20 minutos,\r\nluego baje el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/\r\ngas 5 y hornee por 45 minutos-1 hora más\r\nhasta que la piel esté crujiente y la pulpa suave.\r\nRetirar del horno. hacer una cruz\r\nen el centro de cada papa, coloque una cucharada\r\nla crema agria y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14877,5003,'es','Panes de malta pegajosos','Hay algo muy satisfactorio en una taza de té con una rebanada de pan de malta con mantequilla: esta versión simple y saludable rinde dos y mejora la conservación.','["aceite de girasol, para engrasar","150 ml de té negro caliente","175 g de extracto de malta, más algo extra para glasear (ver consejo)","85 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","300 g de frutos secos mixtos","2 huevos grandes, batidos","250 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio"]','["Caliente el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2. Forre la base y los extremos de dos moldes para pan antiadherentes de 450 g/1 libra engrasados ​​con tiras de papel para hornear.","Vierta el té caliente en un bol con la malta, el azúcar y los frutos secos. Revuelve bien y luego agrega los huevos.","Vierta la harina, luego agregue rápidamente el polvo de hornear y el bicarbonato de sodio y vierta en los moldes preparados. Hornee durante 50 minutos hasta que esté firme y bien leudado. Mientras aún esté caliente, untar con un poco más de malta para glasear y dejar enfriar.","Retirar de las latas. Si puede soportar no comerlo de inmediato, se volverá más pegajoso después de envolverlo y conservarlo durante 2 a 5 días. Sirva en rodajas y untado con mantequilla, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:04:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14878,5005,'es','Plato de antipasti de melocotón','Un plato de verano fácil de cocinar y excelente para recibir invitados','["4 de los duraznos más maduros, deshuesados ​​y cortados en octavos","12 rebanadas de prosciutto","50 g de parmesano en trozos, rallado con un pelador","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y muy finamente picado","2 puñados de rúcula","aceite de oliva de muy buena calidad","palito de grissini, para servir"]','["Disponer los melocotones, el prosciutto y\r\nqueso parmesano en un plato grande, espolvorear\r\nsobre la guindilla y esparcir la rúcula\r\npara terminar. Justo antes de servir, rocíe\r\ncon un poco de aceite. Servir con palitos de pan\r\npara agregar crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14879,5007,'es','batido de moca','Un delicioso café helado para una tarde soleada. Sirva en vasos altos para disfrutar de un capricho retro.','["85 g de chocolate natural, 70% u 80%","1 cucharada de café granulado","700ml de leche","4 bolas de helado de vainilla, más extra para servir (opcional)"]','["Picar aproximadamente 75 g de chocolate y\r\nPoner en una jarra grande con el café. traer\r\n300ml de leche justo a punto de hervir, luego\r\nvierta sobre la mezcla de chocolate y café,\r\nrevolviendo para derretir. Una vez derretido, enfriar.","Vierta la leche moca enfriada en el\r\nlicuadora con el helado y el resto\r\nleche. Mezcle hasta que se mezclen, luego vierta en\r\n4 vasos altos. Añade una bola extra de hielo.\r\nnata a cada uno, si se quiere, luego rallar un\r\nun poco del chocolate restante encima."]','2026-01-11 13:04:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14880,5009,'es','Helado de vainilla definitivo','¿Es el helado de vainilla de Angela Nilsen el helado casero más suave y cremoso de la historia?','["Caja de 284ml de crema doble.","300 ml de leche entera","115 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 vaina de vainilla","3 yemas de huevo camperas grandes","tenga muchos cubitos de hielo listos"]','["Coloca el bote de la máquina en el congelador un día antes de que quieras hacer el helado. Al día siguiente, vierta la nata y la leche en una cacerola de base mediana y luego agregue la mitad del azúcar. Corta la vaina de vainilla a lo largo con un cuchillo pequeño y afilado y saca tantas pequeñas semillas negras como puedas en la mezcla de crema. Corta la vaina en tres y colócala en la sartén.","Calienta la nata y la leche a fuego lento, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que casi hierva (verás unas burbujas en el borde). Retirar del fuego y dejar reposar durante 30 minutos para que se infunda la vainilla.","Pon las yemas en un bol con el resto del azúcar y bate con una batidora eléctrica de mano durante unos 2 minutos hasta que la mezcla espese, tenga un color más pálido y caiga en tiras gruesas al levantar las batidoras. Con una jarra medidora, saque unos 125 ml/4 onzas líquidas de la mezcla de crema y bátalas con las yemas de huevo para ablandarlas. Vuelva a calentar la nata hasta que hierva, retire del fuego y agregue la mezcla de yemas de huevo.","Regrese la sartén a fuego lento y cocine, revolviendo todo el tiempo con una cuchara de madera, durante 8 a 10 minutos, hasta que la crema esté lo suficientemente espesa como para cubrir el dorso de la cuchara. Vigila que no hierva; tan pronto como veas burbujas a punto de estallar en la superficie, debe estar lo suficientemente espesa, así que retira la sartén del fuego para que la mezcla no se cuaje.","Vierta la crema pastelera en un recipiente resistente al calor, luego colóquela en un recipiente más grande con un tercio de agua helada para que se enfríe (esto demora unos 20 minutos). Revuelva ocasionalmente para evitar que se forme costra. Pon el bol de natillas en el frigorífico durante 3-4 horas, preferiblemente durante la noche, para que se enfríe mucho.","Encienda la máquina de helado, saque los trozos de vaina de vainilla y luego vierta lentamente la crema fría. Déjelo batir durante 10 a 30 minutos (dependiendo de su máquina). Cuando se detenga, probablemente esté demasiado blando para comerlo, así que colóquelo en un recipiente de plástico, cúbralo con film transparente, luego con una tapa y congélelo durante un mínimo de 3 horas. (Se mantendrá en el congelador durante 3 meses, pero no lo saque y luego vuelva a congelarlo). Sáquelo del congelador 15 minutos antes de servir.","Para hacerlo a mano: en el paso 1, calentar la leche, la vainilla y la mitad del\r\nazúcar sin la nata (las natillas quedarán un poco más espesas). en\r\nAl comienzo del paso 6, bata la crema para que quede ligera y blanda, no demasiado.\r\ntieso e incorporarlo a la natilla fría. Congelar durante 3-4 horas, revolviendo.\r\nuna vez por hora hasta que esté casi congelado, luego congélelo como se indica arriba."]','2026-01-11 13:04:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14881,5011,'es','Gachas perfectas','Gachas perfectas para empezar el día de forma saludable','["50 g de gachas de avena","350ml de leche o agua, o una mezcla de las dos","Yogur griego, diluido con un poco de leche y miel clara, para servir"]','["Pon la avena en un\r\ncazo, vierte la leche o el agua y\r\nespolvorea una pizca de sal. Llevar a ebullición\r\ny cocine a fuego lento durante 4-5 minutos, revolviendo\r\nde vez en cuando y vigilando atentamente que\r\nno se pega al fondo de la sartén. O puedes probar esto en un microondas. Mezclar la avena, la leche o el agua.\r\ny una pizca de sal en un recipiente grande apto para microondas.\r\ntazón, luego cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 5\r\nminutos, revolviendo a la mitad. salir\r\ndejar reposar 2 minutos antes de comer.","Para servir. Vierta en tazones, vierta el yogur con una cuchara.\r\nencima y rociar con miel."]','2026-01-11 13:04:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14882,5013,'es','Pisto fácil con huevos escalfados','Esta valiente receta en una sola olla se puede preparar con anticipación: simplemente rompa los huevos al final.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","1 pimiento rojo o naranja, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharada de romero picado","1 berenjena, cortada en cubitos","2 calabacines, cortados en cubitos","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico","4 huevos grandes","un puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Añadir\r\nla cebolla, el pimiento, el ajo y el romero,\r\nluego cocine por 5 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente,\r\nhasta que la cebolla se haya ablandado. Añade el\r\nberenjenas y calabacines, luego cocinar\r\ndurante 2 minutos más.","Agrega los tomates, luego llena la lata con\r\nagua, gírela y viértala en la sartén.\r\nLlevar a ebullición, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante\r\n40 min, destapando después de 20 min, hasta\r\nreducida y pulposa.","Agrega el vinagre al pisto y luego\r\nhaz 4 espacios para los huevos. romper un huevo\r\nen cada hoyo y sazone con negro\r\npimienta. Cubra, luego cocine durante 2-5 minutos.\r\nhasta que cuaje tan suave o firmemente como desee.\r\nEsparcir sobre la albahaca y servir con\r\nun poco de pan crujiente para absorber los jugos."]','2026-01-11 13:04:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14883,5015,'es','batido de desayuno','Aprovecha al máximo la temporada de frutos rojos con una copa de delicias afrutadas','["1 plátano pequeño maduro","unos 140 g de moras, arándanos, frambuesas o fresas (o use una mezcla), más algo extra para servir","jugo de manzana o agua mineral, opcional","miel líquida, para servir"]','["Corta el plátano en tu licuadora o procesador de alimentos y agrega las bayas de tu elección. Batir hasta que quede suave. Con las cuchillas zumbando, vierte el jugo o agua para obtener la consistencia que desees. Agregue algunas frutas adicionales encima, rocíe con miel y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:04:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14884,5017,'es','Compota de frutas de verano','Agregue frambuesas de verano, arándanos y ciruelas jugosas al jugo de naranja para obtener una mezcla nutritiva para el desayuno.','["4 ciruelas grandes, deshuesadas y cortadas en gajos","200g punnet blueberries","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","25 g de azúcar moreno claro suave","150 g de frambuesas en canastilla","yogur espeso y miel, para servir (opcional)"]','["Cuece las ciruelas y los arándanos en una\r\ncacerola pequeña con la ralladura de naranja y el jugo,\r\nazúcar y 4 cucharadas de agua hasta que estén ligeramente\r\nsuavizado pero no blando. Agregue suavemente el\r\nframbuesas y cocine por 1 min más.","Retirar del fuego y dejar\r\nenfriar a temperatura ambiente. Servir con\r\nyogur y un chorrito de miel, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:04:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14885,5019,'es','Frittata de salmón y brócoli con menta','Lleno y rápido, e igual de bueno al día siguiente en tu lonchera','["500 g de patatas nuevas","1 cabeza pequeña de brócoli, cortada en floretes","2 filetes de salmón sin piel","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","un puñado pequeño de menta, finamente picada","8 huevos batidos"]','["Hervir las patatas en una sartén grande durante 10-12 minutos,\r\nañadiendo los trozos de brócoli para el final\r\n4 min hasta que todo esté tierno. Escurrir bien.\r\nMientras tanto, coloque los filetes de salmón en una\r\nplato apto para microondas, salpimentar con un poco\r\nagua, luego cubra con film transparente y cocine en el microondas.\r\na temperatura alta durante 2½ minutos hasta que el pescado se desmenuce.","Calienta la parrilla. Calentar el aceite en una fritura\r\nsartén. Cortar las patatas en rodajas gruesas,\r\nluego cocine rápidamente en la sartén a fuego alto\r\nhasta que estén doradas en los bordes. Desmenuzar el salmón\r\nen trozos grandes y hurgar entre los\r\npatatas con el brócoli. Revuelva la menta y\r\nun poco de condimento en los huevos, luego vierta\r\nen la sartén. Dejar actuar 6 minutos a fuego lento.\r\ncalentar hasta que los lados estén firmes y solo el\r\nel centro se tambalea un poco, luego parpadea debajo del\r\nAse hasta que cuaje por completo y se dore. servir en\r\ngajos con una gran ensalada verde al lado."]','2026-01-11 13:04:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14886,5021,'es','Huevo al horno y patatas fritas','Esta comida deliciosamente sencilla se puede preparar en una sola sartén con un mínimo de lavado.','["2 patatas medianas para asar, cortadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","2 tomates, partidos por la mitad","2 huevos"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nColoca las rodajas de papa en una fuente para asar.\r\nRocíe el aceite y espolvoree sobre el\r\npimentón. Sazone y mezcle bien para cubrir.\r\nlas patatas. Ase durante 25 minutos, volteando\r\na mitad de cocción, hasta que esté casi tierno.","Coloque los tomates, con el lado cortado hacia arriba,\r\nentre las patatas. Haz 2 espacios\r\nen la lata y cascar un huevo en cada uno\r\nuno. Regresar al horno por 6-8 minutos.\r\nhasta que los huevos estén cuajados."]','2026-01-11 13:04:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14887,5023,'es','huevos en cualquier momento','Fantástico plato para huevos de una sola sartén, ¿por qué no usar lo que tengas en el refrigerador para hacerlo tuyo?','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2-3 patatas cocidas, en rodajas","un puñado de tomates cherry, rebanados","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","1 huevo","pocas hojas de albahaca"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén, luego agregar el\r\nrodajas de patata y freír por ambos lados hasta\r\nmarrón. Añade los tomates y las cebolletas.\r\ny freír durante aproximadamente 1 min hasta que se ablanden.\r\nSazone con sal y pimienta, luego haga un\r\nespacio en la sartén. Rompe suavemente el huevo en\r\nel espacio y freír hasta que esté cocido a tu gusto.\r\nEsparcir sobre las hojas de albahaca y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14888,5025,'es','Tortitas sin gluten','Utilice harina especializada en estos crepes fáciles y rápidos y atienda de forma segura a quienes siguen una dieta sin gluten','["125 g de harina común sin gluten (nosotros usamos Doves Farm)","1 huevo","250ml de leche","mantequilla, para freír"]','["Poner la harina en un bol y hacer un hueco en el centro. Rompe el huevo por la mitad y vierte un cuarto de la leche. Utilice un batidor eléctrico o de globo para combinar bien la mezcla. Una vez que tenga una pasta, mezcle con otro cuarto y una vez que no tenga grumos, mezcle con la leche restante. Dejar reposar durante 20 min. Revuelva nuevamente antes de usar.","Calentar una sartén pequeña antiadherente con una nuez de mantequilla. Cuando la mantequilla comience a formar espuma, vierta una pequeña cantidad de la mezcla en la sartén y gírela para cubrir la base; desea una capa delgada. Cocine durante unos minutos hasta que se dore en el fondo, luego déle la vuelta y cocine hasta que esté dorado por el otro lado. Repita hasta haber usado toda la mezcla, revolviendo la mezcla entre los panqueques y agregando más mantequilla para freír según sea necesario.","Sirva con jarabe de agave y un chorrito de jugo de naranja o el relleno de panqueques que prefiera."]','2026-01-11 13:04:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14889,5027,'es','Frutas de hueso asadas con vainilla','Esta compota queda deliciosa si se sirve tibia con helado o fría para el desayuno con yogur.','["175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 vaina de vainilla, partida en dos","5 vainas de cardamomo","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","6 albaricoques, partidos por la mitad y sin hueso","3 duraznos, cortados en cuartos y sin hueso","3 nectarinas, en cuartos y sin hueso"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 8. Verter el azúcar, la vaina de vainilla, el cardamomo y la lima. \r\nralladura y jugo en un procesador de alimentos, luego mezcle hasta que se mezclen o triture con un \r\nmortero y mortero. Coloque la fruta en una fuente para hornear poco profunda y luego agregue el azúcar espesa.","Ase durante 20 minutos hasta que las frutas se ablanden, pero no se desplomen y el azúcar \r\ny los jugos de frutas han hecho una salsa pegajosa. Las sobras se conservarán en el frigorífico.  \r\npor hasta 2 días."]','2026-01-11 13:04:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14890,5029,'es','Batido de plátano, clementina y mango','Comienza tu día con esta bebida deliciosamente refrescante, elaborada con fruta fresca y yogur. Es rico en vitamina C y cuenta como uno de tus 5 al día.','["unas 24 clementinas jugosas, más una extra para decorar","2 mangos pequeños, muy maduros y jugosos","2 plátanos maduros","Tarrina de 500g de leche entera o yogur desnatado","un puñado de cubitos de hielo (opcional)"]','["Cortar las clementinas por la mitad y exprimirlas.\r\nJugo: deberías tener unos 600 ml/1 litro.\r\n(Esto se puede hacer la noche anterior). Pelar\r\nmangos, corte la fruta sin hueso en\r\nel centro, luego pique la pulpa en trozos grandes\r\npiezas. Pelar y cortar los plátanos.","Poner el jugo de clementina, la pulpa de mango,\r\nplátanos, yogur y cubitos de hielo en un\r\nlicuadora y licuar hasta que quede suave. verter en\r\nseis vasos y servir. (Es posible que necesites\r\nHaga esto en dos tandas, dependiendo de la\r\ntamaño de su licuadora.) Si no agrega hielo\r\ncubos, enfríe en el refrigerador hasta que esté listo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14891,5031,'es','Receta perfecta de huevos revueltos','Aprende a hacer huevos revueltos perfectos con esta receta fácil. Un desayuno rápido repleto de proteínas, cortesía de Bill Granger.','["2 huevos grandes de corral","6 cucharadas de nata entera o leche entera","una nuez de mantequilla"]','["Batir ligeramente los huevos, la nata.\r\ny una pizca de sal juntos\r\nhasta que todos los ingredientes estén justo\r\ncombinado y la mezcla tiene\r\nuna consistencia.","Calentar una pequeña fritura antiadherente.\r\nsartén durante aproximadamente un minuto, luego agregue\r\nla mantequilla y dejar que se derrita. no lo hagas\r\nDeje que la mantequilla se dore o\r\ndecolorará los huevos. Vierta\r\nla mezcla de huevo y dejar reposar,\r\nsin revolver, durante 20 segundos.\r\nRevuelva con una cuchara de madera, levantando\r\ny doblándolo desde el\r\nfondo de la sartén. Déjalo reposar\r\notros 10 segundos y luego revuelva\r\ny doblar de nuevo.","Repita hasta que los huevos estén\r\nde fraguado suave y ligeramente líquido en\r\nlugares, luego retírela del\r\ncalentar y dejar reposar unos\r\nsegundos para terminar de cocinar.\r\nRevuelva por última vez y sirva\r\nrevuelta aterciopelada sin demora."]','2026-01-11 13:04:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14892,5033,'es','polenta cremosa','Apila pepperonata sobre esta polenta suave y cremosa o sírvela junto con tus guisos favoritos. Es naturalmente libre de gluten.','["250 g de polenta","30 g de mantequilla salada","40 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado"]','["Vierta 1 litro de agua en una cacerola grande y profunda y déjela hervir. Agrega la polenta, un puñado a la vez, batiendo continuamente (agregarla lentamente ayuda a evitar que se formen grumos) durante 1-2 minutos hasta que comience a espesarse un poco. Reduzca el fuego y continúe cocinando durante unos 25-30 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia para evitar que se pegue, hasta que la polenta se espese y se desprenda de los lados de la sartén.","Añade la mantequilla, el queso, una generosa pizca de pimienta negra y 1 cucharada de sal. Batir para combinar. Sirva inmediatamente; la polenta se espesará a medida que se enfríe."]','2026-01-11 13:04:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14893,5035,'es','Pastel de pan de maíz con chile','Use harina de garbanzos para hacer la corteza de pan de maíz en este pastel de chile para una cena sin gluten. La harina de garbanzos también contiene más vitaminas y minerales que la harina de trigo.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas moradas (320 g), finamente picadas","2 ramas de apio (unos 150 g), en rodajas","1 cucharada de chile picante en polvo","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de comino molido","3 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","500 g de puré de cartón","2 latas de 400g de ensalada de tres judías en agua","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo sin gluten","20 g de cilantro, hojas recogidas y picadas","50 g de harina de maíz fina","100 g de harina (de garbanzos)","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten","1 cucharadita de chile picante en polvo","1 huevo","150ml de yogur biológico","50ml de leche","50 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado grueso","1 cebolla morada pequeña (unos 80 g), finamente picada","12 aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas, picadas en trozos grandes","4 cucharaditas de vinagre balsámico","2 latas de 198 g de maíz dulce, escurridas","1 bolsa de ensalada de hojas mixtas"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla y el apio durante 8 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia. Agregue las especias y el ajo, luego vierta la passata, la ensalada de frijoles (junto con el líquido de las latas) y el caldo. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, luego agregue el cilantro. Vierta en una fuente poco profunda apta para horno y enfríe un poco.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Vierta la harina de maíz, la harina de garbanzos, el polvo para hornear y el chile en polvo en un bol y mezcle bien. Batir el huevo, el yogur y la leche en un recipiente aparte, luego verterlos en los ingredientes secos y mezclar para hacer una masa. Agregue el queso, luego viértalo sobre el chile con frijoles y hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que el pan de maíz esté inflado y dorado. Combine la mitad de los ingredientes para la ensalada de maíz y sirva con la mitad del chile, reservando el resto para otro día. El pastel se mantendrá tapado y frío durante cuatro días. Vuelva a calentar en el microondas hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14894,5037,'es','Arroz y frijoles veganos en una olla','Sin gluten y bajo en grasas, este vibrante plato de arroz vegano está repleto de frijoles, aceitunas verdes y pimientos.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas (320 g), finamente picadas","1 pimiento naranja, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y cortado en 4-5 trozos gruesos","1 pimiento rojo, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y cortado en 4-5 trozos gruesos","3 dientes de ajo grandes, rebanados","300 g de arroz integral de fácil cocción","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo","2 cucharadas de pimentón ahumado","650 ml de caldo de verduras caliente, elaborado con 2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","10 aceitunas verdes deshuesadas","Lata de 400 g de judías rojas, escurridas","½ limón, cortado en gajos"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas durante 5 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que se ablanden. Agrega los pimientos y el ajo y cocina por 5 minutos más, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Agregue el arroz, el tomillo y el pimentón, luego vierta el caldo y agregue las aceitunas. Tapar y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 15 minutos. Agregue los frijoles, luego cubra y cocine durante 20 a 30 minutos más hasta que el arroz esté tierno. Cubra con las rodajas de limón, luego cubra y déjelo por 5 minutos. Vierta dos porciones en tazones y sirva. Deje enfriar y enfríe el resto para comerlo otro día. Se mantendrá frío por un día. Para servir, vuelva a calentar en una sartén o en el microondas hasta que esté bien caliente (retire las rodajas de limón antes de calentar). Esta receta es parte de nuestro plan de dieta saludable gratuito de 7 días. Para acceder al plan de alimentación completo, haga clic aquí."]','2026-01-11 13:04:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14895,5041,'es','Coliflor asada con hinojo y quinoa','Coloque esta colorida ensalada de vegetales y quinua en un plato, cubra con coliflor asada y rocíe sobre yogur de ajo para una cena saludable y sin gluten.','["1 coliflor grande o 2 pequeñas, separadas en floretes","1 cucharada de semillas de hinojo","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, picada","2 pimientos (mezcla de rojo, amarillo o naranja), picados","1 calabacín, cortado por la mitad a lo largo, sin corazón y picado","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","1 limón, exprimido y rallado","4 cucharadas de yogur","250 g de quinua cocida"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Llevar a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua con sal y cocinar la coliflor durante 5 minutos. Escurrir y extender sobre una superficie para que se evapore el exceso de agua.","Triture las semillas de hinojo y cilantro con un mortero y mezcle con el pimentón y una pizca de condimento. Coloque la coliflor en un tazón grande, rocíe con la mitad del aceite de oliva y espolvoree sobre la mezcla de especias. Mezcle los floretes para cubrirlos por completo.","Coloque los floretes en una bandeja para hornear y sepárelos. Coloque las cebollas rojas, los pimientos y los calabacines en una bandeja para hornear aparte, rocíe con el aceite restante y cocine ambos durante 30-35 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad para que se doren por completo y queden ligeramente crujientes en algunos lugares.","Mezcle el ajo con jugo de limón y revuelva con el yogur, agregando un poco más de agua para aflojar si es necesario. Agrega las cebollas, los pimientos y los calabacines asados ​​a la quinua cocida junto con la ralladura de limón y una pizca de sal.","Apila la ensalada de quinua en un plato y luego cubre con los floretes de coliflor. Rocíe sobre el yogur de ajo."]','2026-01-11 13:04:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14896,5043,'es','Guiso español de albóndigas y alubias','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta abundante receta está llena de sabor mediterráneo, con carne de cerdo, cebolla morada, pimientos y pimentón ahumado: una impresionante cantidad de 4 de tus 5 al día.','["350 g de carne magra de cerdo picada","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada grande, picada","2 pimientos, en rodajas, de cualquier color servirá","3 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de pimentón dulce ahumado","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de alubias, escurridas","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo dorado","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","pan crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Sazone la carne de cerdo, mezcle el condimento con las manos y luego forme pequeñas albóndigas. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, agrega las albóndigas y cocina durante 5 minutos, hasta que estén doradas por todas partes. Empuje hacia un lado de la sartén y agregue la cebolla y los pimientos. Cocine durante 5 minutos más, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que las verduras se ablanden, luego agregue el ajo y el pimentón. Revuelve todo en la sartén durante 1 minuto y luego agrega los tomates. Cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Destape, agregue los frijoles, el azúcar y un poco de condimento, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos más, sin tapar. Justo antes de servir, agregue el perejil. Sirva con pan crujiente para mojar, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:04:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14897,5045,'es','Calabaza asada con guindas, semillas especiadas y queso feta','Sirva este plato de calabaza como plato principal vegetariano inteligente o acompañamiento para una cena, lleno de sabores contrastantes como miel dulce, guindas y queso salado desmenuzado.','["1 calabaza grande o 2 pequeñas, con las semillas retiradas y reservadas, luego cortadas en trozos o gajos (deje la piel si no está demasiado dura)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva o de colza","100 ml de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharadas de miel clara","100 g de guindas secas","2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo tostado","manojo de menta, hojas recogidas","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","100 g de semillas de calabaza (si no tienes suficientes de tu calabaza, añade semillas de un paquete)","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro","una buena pizca de pimienta de Jamaica molida","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva o de colza"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear. Coloca los trozos de calabaza o calabaza en la bandeja y rocía con aceite. Sazone bien, póngalo en el horno y ase durante 35-45 minutos o hasta que esté tierno (las diferentes variedades tardarán diferentes períodos de tiempo, así que verifique presionando la pulpa con un cuchillo; debe estar muy tierna cuando esté cocida).","Mientras tanto, prepara las semillas especiadas. Lave y seque las semillas de la calabaza, quitando los trozos fibrosos. Mezcle las semillas, las especias y el aceite en otra bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear, sazone bien y mezcle. Colóquelas en el estante debajo de la calabaza y áselas juntas durante los últimos 10 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que estén tostadas.","Pon el vinagre, la miel y las cerezas en una cacerola pequeña. Cocine a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos hasta que las cerezas estén gruesas y el aderezo se haya reducido a la mitad. Agrega una pizca de sal y el aceite de sésamo, retira del fuego y deja enfriar durante 10 minutos.","Para servir, coloque una capa de gajos calientes en un plato. Rocíe sobre el aderezo almibarado y las cerezas, las semillas y las hojas de menta. Finalmente, esparza con queso feta."]','2026-01-11 13:04:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14898,5047,'es','Tajín de cordero persa','Este guiso caliente está condimentado con canela y comino y endulzado con albaricoques y dátiles, perfecto con cuscús esponjoso.','["2 kg de filetes de cuello de cordero","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva suave o aceite de girasol","3 cebollas medianas, cortadas en gajos finos","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","4 cucharaditas de comino molido","4 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de chile picante en polvo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","una pizca grande de azafrán","2 ramas de canela","2 limones en conserva (de un frasco), escurridos y cortados en gajos finos","300 g de orejones listos para comer","250 g de dátiles secos sin hueso, listos para comer","100 g de pistachos sin cáscara","2 cucharaditas de agua de rosas","25 g de harina de maíz","cilantro en manojo pequeño, con las hojas picadas en trozos grandes","cuscús cocido o arroz basmati, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Quitar la grasa dura del cordero, cortarlo en trozos y sazonar por completo. Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego y dora el cordero en 3 o 4 tandas a fuego alto durante 1 o 2 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente coloreado. Agregue 1 cucharada más de aceite entre cada lote y transfiéralo a un tazón cada vez que se dore un lote.","Calienta el aceite restante en el mismo plato a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas durante 5 minutos o hasta que estén tiernas y ligeramente coloreadas. Agregue el ajo, el comino, el cilantro, el chile en polvo, la cúrcuma, 1 cucharadita de pimienta negra molida y 1 cucharadita de sal marina en hojuelas. Cocine por 1 min, revolviendo. Regresar el cordero al plato y añadir 1,5 litros de agua, el azafrán, la canela y los limones. Llevar a fuego lento, revolviendo unas cuantas veces. Cubrir con una tapa y transferir al horno. Cocine por 1 hora.","Retire con cuidado la fuente del horno y agregue los albaricoques, los dátiles y la mitad de los pistachos, luego cubra una vez más y regrese al horno. Cocine por 30 minutos más o hasta que el cordero esté muy tierno.","Pasar el plato al fuego y rectificar el condimento al gusto. Mezcle la harina de maíz con el agua de rosas y 3 cucharadas de agua fría, luego agregue el tagine. Cocine a fuego medio durante 1-2 minutos o hasta que la salsa espese. (Espesar la salsa con harina de maíz no es tradicional, pero ayuda a que el tagine se congele mejor). Cuando esté listo para servir, pique las nueces restantes y espolvoréelas por encima. Adorne con cilantro y sirva con cuscús o arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:04:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14899,5049,'es','Salmón con ensalada de patatas nuevas, maíz y aderezo de albahaca','Una cena de pescado sencilla elaborada con ingredientes saludables pero saciantes, para ayudarte a comer bien durante toda la semana.','["400 g de patatas tiernas","2 mazorcas de maíz dulce","4 filetes de salmón sin piel","2 tomates muy grandes, como bistec","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 chalota, finamente picada","1 cucharada de alcaparras, finamente picadas","un puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Cocine las patatas en agua hirviendo hasta que\r\ntierno, agregando maíz durante los últimos 5 minutos,\r\nluego escurrir y dejar enfriar un poco.","Para el aderezo, mezcla el vinagre, el aceite,\r\nchalota, alcaparras, albahaca y algún condimento.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Frote un poco de aderezo\r\nsobre el salmón y cocinar con el lado sin piel\r\nabajo, durante 7-8 minutos. Cortar los tomates y\r\ncolóquelo en un plato para servir. Cortar las patatas,\r\ncortar las mazorcas de maíz y disponerlas\r\nsobre los tomates. Cubra con el salmón,\r\nluego rocíe sobre el aderezo restante."]','2026-01-11 13:04:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14900,5051,'es','Pizza recién cubierta','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta pizza sin gluten seguramente se convertirá en la favorita de la familia.','["200 g de harina sin gluten","½ sal","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de romero picado","1 cucharadita de pimienta negra molida","125-150 ml de agua tibia","Tarro de 210 g de cobertura para bruschetta de tomates (nosotros usamos Napolina)","140 g de mozzarella, en rodajas gruesas","½ aguacate, en rodajas gruesas","Paquete de rúcula de 70 g.","tomate cherry, cortado a la mitad","4 lonchas de jamón de Parma","4 rebanadas de jamón","aceite de oliva","vinagre balsámico"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. Poner la harina, la sal, el aceite de oliva, la levadura, el romero y la pimienta en un procesador de alimentos. Pulse hasta que esté bien mezclado. Con el motor en marcha, agregue suficiente agua para que la harina obtenga una masa suave, pero no pegajosa. Vierta sobre una superficie de trabajo y amase hasta que se una.","Corta la masa por la mitad. Si solo tiene un estante en su horno y está cocinando en tandas, envuelva la mitad en film transparente. Extienda cada mitad directamente sobre bandejas para hornear ligeramente engrasadas en rondas muy finas de 25 cm/10 pulgadas. No forme un borde en el borde. Extienda la cobertura de tomate sobre cada trozo de masa, casi hasta el borde. Dejar reposar 15 min. Hornee en horno caliente durante 12-15 minutos o hasta que la masa esté crujiente.","Levante cada ronda sobre un plato y sirva caliente. Pase los ingredientes y deje que cada comensal prepare su propia pizza."]','2026-01-11 13:04:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14901,5053,'es','Pollo relleno de champiñones con risotto de tomillo limón','¿Alguna vez has probado el risotto como guarnición? Queda perfecto con estas pechugas de pollo con un rico relleno de boletus','["25 g de champiñones porcini secos, remojados en 250 ml de agua durante 30 minutos, reservando el líquido de remojo","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","Paquete de 150 g de champiñones tiernos, finamente picados","2 ramitas de tomillo o tomillo limón, sin hojas y picadas","175 ml de vino blanco","4 pechugas de pollo con piel","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","140 g de arroz para risotto","600 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","2 ramitas de tomillo o tomillo limón, sin hojas y picadas","jugo y ralladura de ½ limón","50 g de parmesano rallado y 1 cucharada extra para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4.\r\nPrimero, haz el relleno. Picar finamente el\r\nlos boletus remojados y reservar. Calentar el aceite\r\nen una sartén poco profunda, luego cocine suavemente\r\ncebolla durante 5 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.\r\nAñade los boletus, los champiñones y\r\nhojas de tomillo, sazonar, subir el fuego,\r\nluego cocine por otros 5 minutos hasta que\r\nlos champiñones se han ablandado.","Agrega el vino a la sartén, luego reduce.\r\ncon fuerza hasta que esté casi seco. Añade 50 ml de\r\nlíquido de remojo de boletus, luego continúe\r\nreducir durante un par de minutos hasta que\r\ntener una salsa almibarada. Dejar enfriar durante\r\nun par de minutos, luego vierta con cuidado\r\nentre la piel y la carne del\r\npechugas de pollo. Se puede hacer un dia\r\nadelante y refrigerado o congelado durante 1 mes.\r\nDescongelar en el frigorífico antes de cocinar. temporada,\r\ncolóquelo en una bandeja para hornear, con la piel hacia arriba, luego\r\ncocinar en el horno durante 20 minutos, hasta que\r\nel pollo esté bien cocido y dorado.","Mientras se cocina el pollo, prepare\r\nel risotto. Calentar la mantequilla y el aceite de oliva.\r\nen una cacerola. Agrega el apio y la cebolla,\r\nLuego cocine a fuego medio durante 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que se ablanden. Agrega el arroz, cúbrelo bien.\r\nen el aceite, luego cocine por 1 min. Poco a poco\r\nagregue el caldo un cucharón a la vez, revolviendo\r\ncon cada adición hasta que se absorba.\r\nContinúe agregando el caldo y revolviendo.\r\nhasta que el risotto esté rezumante y espeso –\r\nunos 20 minutos. Agregue el tomillo, el limón.\r\njugo, ralladura y parmesano.","Cuando el pollo esté bien cocido\r\ny dorado, retirar del horno.\r\nColoque el risotto en platos para servir,\r\nespolvorear con el parmesano extra y\r\ncubra con una pechuga de pollo. Vierta sobre\r\nlos jugos de la sartén del pollo, luego\r\nservir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14902,5055,'es','Lomo de grupa con salsa rápida de champiñones y vino tinto','Prepare una salsa estilo restaurante para su bistec en 15 minutos: perfecta con puré cremoso','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","2 filetes de lomo (aproximadamente 200 g/8 oz cada uno)","140 g de champiñones en cuartos","2 ramitas de tomillo, sin hojas","150 ml de vino tinto","1 cucharada de mantequilla"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén. Sazone los filetes,\r\nluego freír durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado a fuego medio.\r\npoco cocido o cocínelo más a su gusto. Quitar\r\nde la sartén, luego déjelo reposar.","Añade los champiñones y las hojas de tomillo.\r\na la sartén, luego cocine por un par de minutos.\r\nhasta que estén tiernos y dorados. Vierta el\r\nvino y burbujee hasta que esté almibarado, luego voltee\r\nRetire del fuego y agregue la mantequilla. Estación.","Servir los filetes con los champiñones.\r\nsalsa vertida encima, junto con crema\r\npuré y unas verduras tiernas crujientes."]','2026-01-11 13:04:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14903,5059,'es','Pollo al romero con salsa de tomate','Esta cazuela de estilo italiano te calentará y además tiene una excelente relación calidad-precio','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","8 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","1 ramita de romero, hojas finamente picadas","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","3 dientes de ajo, rebanados","2 filetes de anchoa, picados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de alcaparras, escurridas","alcaparras con 75ml de agua"]','["Calentar la mitad del aceite en una sartén antiadherente, luego\r\ndora el pollo por todas partes. Añade la mitad del\r\nromero picado, revuelva para cubrir, luego\r\nreservar en un plato.","En la misma sartén calentar el resto del aceite,\r\nLuego cocine suavemente la cebolla durante unos 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté suave. Añadimos los ajos, las anchoas y\r\nel resto del romero, luego sofreír durante unos minutos\r\nmás hasta que esté fragante. Vierta los tomates\r\ny alcaparras con el vino, si se usa, o 75ml\r\nagua si no. Llevar a ebullición y luego devolver el\r\ntrozos de pollo a la sartén. Cubra, luego cocine\r\ndurante 20 minutos hasta que el pollo esté cocido\r\na través. Sazone y sirva con un toque verde crujiente.\r\nensalada y pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14904,5063,'es','Budín al vapor con tallo de jengibre y calabaza','El secreto del delicioso postre sin gluten de Jodie Montgomery-Cranny es la calabaza rallada','["mantequilla, para engrasar","3 bolas de jengibre de un frasco, finamente picadas, más 4-6 cucharadas de almíbar del frasco","3 huevos grandes","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200 g de calabaza pelada y rallada fina","ralladura de 1 limón grande","175 g de harina de arroz","50 g de almendras molidas","2 cucharaditas de jengibre molido","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear"]','["Unte con mantequilla un poco de mantequilla un recipiente para budín de 1,5 litros.\r\nPoner un tercio del tallo de jengibre y todo\r\nel almíbar de jengibre en el fondo. Dejar de lado.","En un bol batir los huevos y el azúcar con\r\ncon una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso.\r\nIncorpora la calabaza, la ralladura de limón.\r\ny el jengibre de tallo restante. Doblar el\r\ningredientes secos en la mezcla de huevo con\r\nuna cuchara grande de metal hasta que esté bien combinado.","Llena el recipiente con la mezcla del bizcocho.\r\nCubrir con una capa de mantequilla para hornear.\r\npergamino y papel de aluminio, haciendo un pliegue en\r\nel centro para permitir que el pudín suba.\r\nÁtelo firmemente con una cuerda y luego colóquelo.\r\nuna vaporera o una cacerola grande con la boca hacia arriba\r\ncuenco en el fondo. Agregue agua hirviendo hasta la mitad de los lados del recipiente,\r\ncubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 1½ horas.\r\nCompruebe el nivel del agua de vez en cuando.\r\nluego, y recarga si es necesario.","Para comprobar cuando la esponja esté lista, inserte\r\nuna brocheta en el centro. debería venir\r\nSalga limpio y sin rastros de mezcla cruda.\r\nDesenvolver y servir caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:04:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14905,5065,'es','Polenta al horno con espinacas y queso de cabra','Esta receta vegetariana italiana es lo suficientemente inteligente para una cena, pero solo tiene seis ingredientes.','["3 dientes de ajo, picados","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","300 g de espinacas frescas","Error 500 (Server Error)!!1500.That’s an error.There was an error. Please try again later.That’s all we know.","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","100 g de queso de cabra con corteza, partido en trozos"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y\r\nhervir la tetera. En un bol mezclar el ajo\r\ny tomates con condimento, luego vierte\r\nen una fuente para hornear grande. Coloca las espinacas\r\nen un colador grande y verter agua hirviendo\r\nhasta que se ablanden. Enjuague con agua fría y\r\nexprime todo el exceso de agua que puedas\r\ncon tus manos. Picar en trozos grandes, sazonar,\r\ny esparcir encima de los tomates.","Cortar la polenta en rodajas y luego superponerla encima.\r\nde las espinacas. Rociar con el aceite y\r\nHornee en el horno durante 10-15 minutos. dispersión\r\nsobre el queso y regresar al horno\r\ndurante 5 minutos más, o hasta que el queso esté\r\ndorado y burbujeante."]','2026-01-11 13:04:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14906,5067,'es','Ensalada de quinua con halloumi a la parrilla','Pruebe esta sencilla ensalada de verduras como excelente fuente de hierro y disfrútela como almuerzo o cena ligera. Utiliza quinua sin gluten para obtener una dosis extra de proteína.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en rodajas","1 pimiento asado grande de un frasco, en rodajas gruesas, o un puñado de pimientos en rodajas ya asados","200 g de quinua","500 ml de caldo de verduras","manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","pizca grande de azúcar","Paquete de 250 g de queso halloumi, cortado en 6 rodajas"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite a fuego medio.\r\ncacerola. Cocine la cebolla y el pimiento por\r\nunos minutos, luego agrega la quinua\r\ny cocine por 3 minutos más. Añade el\r\nCaldo, tapar y bajar el fuego.\r\na fuego lento. Cocine por 15 minutos o hasta\r\nsuave, luego revuelva con la mitad del perejil.\r\nCalienta la parrilla.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la ralladura de limón y\r\njugo con el perejil restante y\r\naceite, y una pizca grande de azúcar y sal.\r\nAsa el halloumi hasta que ambos lados estén\r\ndorado y crujiente. Servir la ensalada con\r\nel halloumi a la parrilla y el aderezo\r\nderramado sobre todo."]','2026-01-11 13:04:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14907,5069,'es','Paletilla de cordero desmenuzada con glaseado pegajoso de granada','Cocinar la carne muy lentamente en jugo de frutas la hace tierna y los jugos se duplican como un glaseado dulce.','["4 dientes de ajo, picados","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 cucharada de orégano seco","1 limón, cortado en cuartos y sin pepitas","1½ kg de paletilla de cordero con hueso","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos","1 litro de zumo de granada","2 cucharadas de miel clara","250 gramos de yogur natural","100 g de semillas de granada en bote o semillas de 1 granada fresca","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta, picadas"]','["Poner el ajo, la canela, el comino,\r\norégano y limón en una licuadora con\r\n1 cucharadita de sal y 2 cucharaditas de pimienta negra. Mezclar\r\nhasta que quede suave. Poner el cordero en una fuente grande.\r\nfuente para asar y verter la marinada sobre la\r\narriba. Masajear todo el cordero y dejar\r\ndurante 24 horas en el frigorífico, o hasta 2 días.","Sacar el cordero de la nevera 1 hora antes.\r\ncocinando. Caliente el horno a 160C/ventilador de 140C/\r\ngas 3. Esparcir las cebollas alrededor del\r\ncordero, metiendo un poco debajo, luego\r\nvierta sobre el jugo de granada. Portada\r\nel cordero con papel aluminio y cocinar por 4 hrs.","Retire el papel de aluminio, vierta con cuidado el\r\njugos carnosos de granada de lata\r\nen una cacerola grande y agrega la miel.\r\nAumente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7,\r\nVuelva a tapar el cordero y continúe cocinando durante\r\n30 minutos. Mientras tanto, burbujear la cocción.\r\nLíquido a fuego alto hasta que se reduzca y espese.\r\ny almibarado; esto puede tardar hasta 30 minutos.","Vierta el glaseado pegajoso de granada sobre\r\nel cordero y la cebolla y volver a la\r\nHornee por otros 30 minutos, sin tapar,\r\nhasta que el glaseado burbujee y apenas\r\nempezando a carbonizarse, y el cordero está realmente\r\ntierno. Mezclar el yogur, la mayor parte del\r\nsemillas de granada y hojas de menta en\r\nun cuenco pequeño. Desmenuzar el cordero en la mesa\r\ny servir con las cebollas pegajosas y la\r\nyogur de granada y menta. dispersarse\r\nlas semillas de granada restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:04:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14908,5071,'es','Judías verdes con ajo','Un simple salteado de frijoles frescos con ajo ligeramente frito y un toque de aceite de oliva es un acompañamiento saludable y versátil.','["300 g de judías verdes, peladas","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Cocer las judías verdes en agua hirviendo.\r\ndurante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén tiernos, luego escurrir\r\nbien y secar al vapor durante un min.","Mientras tanto, sofreír los ajos en la\r\naceite hasta que esté dorado pálido, no más. tirar\r\ncon los frijoles, sazonar y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14909,5073,'es','Patatas fondant con hierbas','Recorta las papas, fríelas enteras y luego cocínalas a fuego lento con caldo, romero, tomillo y limón para crear una guarnición perfectamente tierna.','["1½ kg de patatas pequeñas harinosas, como Desirée o Maris Piper, peladas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 dientes de ajo, machacados","3 ramitas de tomillo","3 ramitas de tomillo limón","2 ramitas de romero","3 hojas de laurel","ralladura de 1 limón, pelado con un pelador de verduras","unos 600 ml de caldo de pollo o de verduras sin gluten ni trigo (consulte la etiqueta)"]','["Recorta la parte superior e inferior de cada papa.\r\npara que queden planos por ambos lados. Calor\r\nel aceite en una sartén grande o resistente al fuego\r\ncazuela y sofreír las patatas por ambos\r\nlados hasta que estén dorados oscuros, 10-15 minutos.","Introducir el ajo, el tomillo, el romero,\r\nhojas de laurel y ralladura, luego vierta suficiente\r\ncaldo hasta la mitad del costado del\r\npatatas. Cocine a fuego lento durante 20-30 minutos, luego\r\nDar la vuelta a las patatas y cocinar por el otro lado.\r\ndurante 20-30 minutos más, completando con\r\nmás caldo si se evapora. Continuar\r\ncocinar hasta que las patatas estén realmente\r\nlicitación y la mayor parte del stock se ha agotado.\r\nSazone bien y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:04:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14910,5075,'es','Chuletas de cordero asadas al romero','Esta cena de chuletas de cordero en una sartén solo requiere un montaje rápido: agregue los sabores mediterráneos y luego deje que el horno haga el trabajo.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","8 chuletas de cordero","1 kg de patatas picadas en trozos pequeños","4 ramitas de romero","4 dientes de ajo, dejados enteros","250 g de tomates cherry","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico"]','["Enciende el horno para ventilar 200C/\r\nconvencional 220C/gas 7. Calentar la mitad\r\nel aceite en una fuente para asar resistente al fuego o\r\nsartén para saltear resistente al horno. Dorar el cordero\r\ndurante 2 minutos por cada lado, luego levante\r\nde la sartén y reservar. agrega el resto\r\ndel aceite a la sartén, agrega las papas,\r\nluego freír durante 4-5 minutos, hasta que comience\r\npara dorar. Agrega el romero y el ajo,\r\nluego devuelva el cordero a la sartén también.","Asar en el horno durante 20 minutos,\r\nluego esparcir sobre los tomates y\r\nrocíe con el vinagre balsámico. Lugar\r\nDe nuevo en el horno durante 5 minutos, hasta que\r\nlos tomates apenas comienzan a partirse. Quitar\r\ndel horno y servir directamente\r\ndel plato."]','2026-01-11 13:04:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14911,5077,'es','Pollo pegajoso con jerez, almendras y dátiles','Tiernos muslos de pollo asados ​​cubiertos con un delicioso glaseado: ideal para alimentar a una multitud','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","8 muslos de pollo","2 cebollas medianas, picadas","15 dientes de ajo, dejados enteros con piel","1 cucharadita de comino molido","250ml sherry, such as Oloroso or Manzanilla","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón, más ralladura adicional para servir","50 g de almendras enteras blanqueadas (nosotros usamos Marcona), picadas en trozos grandes","12 dátiles grandes y suaves, picados","Paquete de 20 g de perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.\r\nCalentar 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén grande.\r\nsartén. Sazone el pollo y luego dórelo.\r\ntodos los lados. Retire el pollo, colóquelo en\r\nuna fuente para hornear grande y luego reserve. Añade el\r\nel aceite restante, la cebolla y el ajo a la\r\nsartén, luego sazone. Freír durante 10 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado. Agregue el comino, el jerez y el limón.\r\nralladura y jugo. Llevar a ebullición y luego agregar.\r\nlas almendras, los dátiles y la mitad del perejil.","Vierta la salsa sobre el pollo. Portada\r\ncon papel de aluminio, luego ase durante 1 hora hasta que estén tiernos,\r\nQuitar el papel de aluminio después de 15 minutos. Cuchara el\r\nlíquido sobre el pollo un par de veces\r\ndurante el tostado. Sirva amontonados en una fuente grande.\r\nplato con la salsa vertida, el\r\ndientes de ajo, el perejil restante y un poco\r\nralladura de limón extra."]','2026-01-11 13:04:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14912,5079,'es','Dorada entera asada con patatas y aceitunas','Asar el pescado junto con las patatas significa que todos los deliciosos sabores se mezclan.','["400g de patatas nuevas o pequeñas","un puñado grande de aceitunas negras pequeñas","1 diente de ajo, picado","manojo grande de perejil de hoja plana, las hojas picadas en trozos grandes y los tallos reservados","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","rallar medio limón","1 dorada entera, de unos 450 g/1 libra, destripada y con la cabeza","vaso pequeño de vino blanco"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7.\r\nCocine las patatas en agua hirviendo durante aproximadamente\r\n10 minutos, cortar en rodajas gruesas y luego enfriar. en un\r\ntazón, mezcle las patatas con las aceitunas, el ajo,\r\nla mitad del perejil picado, la mitad del aceite de oliva,\r\nla ralladura de limón y sal y pimienta. Consejo esto\r\nmezcle sobre el fondo de un plato mediano para gratinar.","Sazona el pescado y coloca los tallos de perejil.\r\nen la cavidad. Coloca el pescado encima de las patatas.\r\ny rociar con el resto del aceite de oliva. hornear\r\ndurante 15 minutos hasta que las patatas empiecen a estar crujientes\r\nalrededor de los bordes. Vierta el vino y luego\r\nRegrese al horno por 10 minutos más hasta que\r\nlas patatas se han dorado y el pescado está cocido.","Retirar la fuente del horno, esparcir\r\nel resto del perejil y llevar el plato a la\r\nmesa. Cuando sirvas, no olvides el\r\ndeliciosos jugos de vino blanco en el fondo del\r\nplato. Delicioso con un simple plato de espinacas."]','2026-01-11 13:04:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14913,5081,'es','Ensalada César de pollo flaco','Renueve el típico aderezo César cambiando la mayonesa por yogur griego, bajo en grasas y calorías, pero aún deliciosamente cremoso.','["4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","jugo 1 limon","1 lechuga romana o cos grande, picada en trozos grandes","1 punnet salad cress","4 huevos duros, pelados y cortados en cuartos","25 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","50 g de filetes de anchoas, la mitad picada y la otra mitad entera","Bote de 170 g de yogur griego sin grasa"]','["Coloque las pechugas de pollo en un tazón grande con el aceite de oliva y 1 cucharada de jugo de limón, luego sazone. Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Coloque las pechugas de pollo en una bandeja forrada con papel de aluminio y cocínelas bajo la parrilla durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que estén doradas y bien cocidas, volteándolas una vez durante la cocción. Transfiera a un plato o tabla y corte en rodajas.","Coloque la lechuga, los berros y los huevos en una fuente o plato para servir y cubra con el pollo cocido. Mezclar el parmesano, las anchoas picadas, el yogur y el jugo de limón restante, sazonar al gusto y verter sobre la ensalada. Coloca los filetes de anchoa enteros encima de cada ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:04:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14914,5083,'es','Frittata de col rizada y queso de cabra','Esta tortilla rellena, con cebolla morada, col rizada y queso de cabra, es vegetariana, no contiene gluten y es lo suficientemente rápida para prepararla entre semana.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas, en rodajas finas","200 g de col rizada picada","2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","8 huevos grandes, ligeramente batidos con un poco de condimento","100 g de queso de cabra firme partido en trozos"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Calentar el aceite en una sartén apta para horno de 25 cm. Agrega las cebollas y cocina durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén suaves y caramelizadas. Agregue la col rizada y 1 cucharada de agua y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que la col rizada se ablande. Vierta el vinagre balsámico y burbujee durante 1 minuto, luego agregue los huevos. Revuelva todo rápidamente, luego déjelo cocinar a fuego medio-bajo durante 5 minutos hasta que el huevo esté casi listo y la frittata se dore en el fondo.","Esparce el queso de cabra sobre la frittata. Cocine en el horno durante 10-15 minutos hasta que el queso burbujee y la frittata esté firme en el centro."]','2026-01-11 13:04:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14915,5085,'es','Ensalada de patatas con anchoas y huevos de codorniz','Esta ensalada saludable y satisfactoria es un sabroso almuerzo para llevar o una cena ligera con judías verdes, perejil, cebollino y limón.','["4 huevos de codorniz","100 g de judías verdes","100 g de patatas nuevas, partidas por la mitad o en cuartos si son muy grandes","1 anchoa, finamente picada","1 cucharada de perejil picado","1 cucharada de cebollino picado","jugo ½ limón"]','["Lleve una cacerola mediana con agua a fuego lento. Sumerja los huevos de codorniz en el agua y cocine por 2 minutos. Saque los huevos con una espumadera y póngalos en un recipiente con agua fría. Agregue los frijoles a la sartén, cocine a fuego lento durante 4 minutos hasta que estén tiernos, luego retírelos de la sartén con una espumadera y sumérjalos en el recipiente con agua fría.","Pon las patatas en la sartén y hiérvelas durante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Escurre las patatas en un colador y déjalas enfriar. Mientras las patatas se enfrían, pela los huevos y córtalos por la mitad. Mezcle las patatas y los frijoles con la anchoa picada, las hierbas y el jugo de limón. Cubra con los huevos de codorniz para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:04:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14916,5087,'es','Ensalada de caballa súper verde','Las judías verdes, las espinacas y el brócoli son una excelente base para un almuerzo saludable con pescado azul y aderezo de yogur.','["85 g de judías verdes","85 g de brócoli de tallo fino","un puñado grande de hojas tiernas de espinacas","2 filetes de caballa ahumados en caliente (unos 75 g), sin piel y desmenuzados","2 cucharaditas de semillas de girasol, tostadas","75ml de yogur natural desnatado","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","1 cucharadita de mostaza integral","2 cucharaditas de eneldo picado y más para servir"]','["Hervir una cacerola con agua. Agrega el verde\r\nfrijoles y cocine por 2 minutos, luego agregue\r\nel brócoli y cocinar por 4 minutos más.\r\nEscurrir, pasar por agua fría hasta que se enfríe.\r\nluego escurrir bien.","Para hacer el aderezo, combine todo\r\nlos ingredientes en un pequeño tarro de mermelada con\r\nun toque de pimienta negra, tapar\r\ny dale una buena sacudida.","Para servir, mezcle lo cocido\r\nverduras con espinacas y caballa y\r\nempacar en una lonchera. Justo antes de comer,\r\nverter sobre el aderezo, esparcir sobre el\r\nsemillas de girasol y agregue un poco de negro\r\npimienta y eneldo extra."]','2026-01-11 13:04:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14917,5089,'es','Quiche de queso de cabra y berros','Una quiche de queso de cabra y berros sin gluten y muy sabrosa','["225 g de harina sin gluten, más un poco para enrollar","100 g de mantequilla","1 huevo grande, batido, más huevo batido extra para pintar","1 cebolla mediana, finamente picada","1 cucharada de aceite","100 g de berros, picados en trozos grandes","2 huevos grandes","150ml de leche","150 ml de queso de cabra tierno y sin corteza, en trozos gruesos","nuez moscada recién rallada, opcional"]','["Pon la harina y una pizca de sal en un bol grande. Frote la mantequilla hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado. Agregue el huevo y aproximadamente 1 o 2 cucharadas de agua para formar una masa suave. Amasar bien, envolver y enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos.","Precalentar el horno a 200C/gas 6/ventilador 180C. Amasar la masa nuevamente y extenderla para forrar un molde para flan de fondo suelto de 20 cm (la masa no se encogerá, por lo que no es necesario enfriarla). Tapar los agujeros con masa sobrante y pincelar la base y los lados con huevo.","Para el relleno, sofreír la cebolla en el aceite hasta que esté blanda, agregar los berros y cocinar hasta que se ablanden. Batir los huevos y la leche y agregar la mezcla de berros y el queso de cabra.","Sazona y si quieres añade una pizca de nuez moscada. Coloque el molde para flan en una bandeja para hornear y hornee la masa a ciegas durante 5 minutos. Agrega el relleno y hornea por 15 minutos. Reduzca el fuego a 180C/gas 4/ventilador 160C y cocine durante 25-30 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente cuajado."]','2026-01-11 13:04:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14918,5091,'es','Ensalada de lentejas, zanahoria y jamón','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Utilice legumbres como base para su ensalada dulce aderezada con mostaza para crear un almuerzo saludable lleno de fibra y vitamina C.','["250 g de jamón rallado","Lata de 400 g de lentejas escurridas","2 zanahorias, finamente picadas","4 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","un puñado de perejil, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","buena pizca de azúcar","1 cucharadita de mostaza integral"]','["Combine los ingredientes de la ensalada en un\r\ntazón grande para mezclar. Para hacer el aderezo,\r\nbatir los ingredientes con\r\n1 cucharada de agua y un poco de condimento.\r\nVierta el aderezo sobre la ensalada y\r\nrevuelva bien para combinar."]','2026-01-11 13:04:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14919,5095,'es','Ensalada templada de verano de alcachofas y espárragos','Este plato tiene que ver con verduras en el pico de su temporada.','["4 alcachofas, recortadas","2 limones, partidos por la mitad","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de semillas de cilantro","1 anís estrellado","ramita grande de tomillo","4 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","manojo grande (alrededor de 30) espárragos","4 puñados de hojas pequeñas de ensalada como microhojas","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","2 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","manojo pequeño de cebollino, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico (me gusta usar vinagre balsámico blanco)"]','["Cuando las alcachofas estén peladas,\r\nencuentre una bandeja lo suficientemente ancha como para contener\r\nellos en una sola capa. Apretar\r\nJugo de limón hasta la mitad y llenar hasta la mitad con\r\nagua fría. Añade 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, el\r\nespecias, tomillo, vinagre, alcachofas y un\r\npizca generosa de sal. Llevar a ebullición,\r\nluego baje el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante\r\nunos 15 minutos hasta que esté suave. Apaga el fuego\r\ny déjelo enfriar (consulte los consejos a continuación).","Prepara los espárragos. Primero,\r\ncorte los extremos leñosos, luego\r\nuse un pelador de hoja giratoria para recortar\r\nlos extremos, rotándolos a medida que avanzas para que\r\nterminarán del mismo grosor que las puntas.","Traiga una cacerola grande con sal\r\nagua hasta que hierva. Cocine el\r\nespárragos durante 2 minutos, luego escurrir\r\ny viértalo directamente en agua muy helada.\r\nDejar hasta que esté completamente frío, escurrir nuevamente,\r\nluego dejar a un lado.","Para hacer el aderezo calentar\r\n2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva en una sartén,\r\nluego cocine suavemente la cebolla morada\r\ndurante 5 minutos hasta que esté suave. Apaga el fuego\r\nagregue la cebolleta y el cebollino, luego\r\nverter en una jarra. Rociar el resto del aceite.\r\ny el vinagre en el aderezo, luego\r\nsazone al gusto.","Prepara las verduras. Drenar\r\nlas alcachofas, luego córtelas en\r\n6 cuñas. Cortar cada espárrago\r\nen el ángulo en 3 pedazos.","Limpia el aderezo\r\ny calentar la aceituna restante\r\naceite. Freír los espárragos con un poco\r\nsazone hasta que esté brillante y comience a\r\ncoloree y luego colóquelo en un plato. Lugar\r\nVuelva a poner la sartén al fuego y luego cocine.\r\nlos gajos de alcachofa hasta que empiecen\r\npara dorar. Apaga el fuego y tu\r\nestán listos para emplatar.","Vierta un charco de aderezo en\r\nel centro de cada plato. Equilibrar los trozos de espárragos.\r\nuno contra el otro para rodear\r\nel aderezo. Disponer las alcachofas entre\r\nlos espárragos para que queden uniformes\r\ndistribuidos sobre el plato. Esparcir sobre las hojas de ensalada y\r\nrocíe sobre el aderezo restante."]','2026-01-11 13:04:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14920,5097,'es','Chaqueta picante de atún y requesón','Para un almuerzo energético bajo en grasas, pruebe una papa al horno rica en carbohidratos con un relleno ligero y nutritivo.','["Lata de 225 g de atún escurrido.","½ chile rojo, picado","1 cebolla tierna, en rodajas","un puñado de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado","1 papa asada mediana","150 g de requesón bajo en grasa"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/Gas 4/horno ventilado 160C. Pincha la patata varias veces con un tenedor y colócala directamente sobre una rejilla en la parte más caliente del horno. Hornea durante aproximadamente 1 hora, o hasta que esté suave por dentro.","Mezclar atún con guindilla, cebolleta y cereza.\r\ntomates y cilantro. Chaqueta dividida\r\npatata y rellenar con la mezcla de atún y\r\nrequesón."]','2026-01-11 13:05:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14921,5099,'es','Panes planos de comino tostado','Una receta de pan sin gluten, ideal como merienda con unas salsas','["400 g de harina con levadura sin gluten, más un poco más para espolvorear (nosotros usamos Palomas)","1 cucharada de semillas de comino, tostadas","300ml de yogur natural"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio y espolvorea.\r\nuna bandeja para horno con un poco de harina. Mezclar el\r\nharina y semillas de comino en un bol, luego\r\ntemporada. Agrega el yogur y 100 ml.\r\nagua, luego mezcle bien para formar una masa suave.","Dividir la masa en 8 trozos iguales,\r\nluego forme círculos u óvalos aproximadamente\r\n½ cm de espesor. Espolvorear ligeramente con un poco de harina.\r\nAse en la bandeja para hornear durante 3-5 minutos.\r\nde cada lado hasta que estén dorados e inflados.\r\nServir caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14922,5103,'es','Fideos de arroz con tomates secos, parmesano y albahaca','Una excelente alternativa sin gluten a la pasta. Busque también los fideos soba sin trigo','["250 g de fideos de arroz medianos","85 g de tomates secos más 2 cucharadas de su aceite","3 dientes de ajo","25 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), rallado o rallado","un puñado grande de hojas de albahaca, rasgadas"]','["Prepara los fideos según el paquete.\r\ninstrucciones, luego escurrir. Calentar el aceite, luego\r\nsofreír los tomates y el ajo durante 3 minutos.\r\nMezcle los fideos y la mayor parte del queso.\r\ny albahaca en la sartén, sazonar y luego esparcir\r\nsobre el resto del queso y la albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:05:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14923,5105,'es','Ensalada picante de atún y quinua','Las bolsas de cereales listas para comer te permiten disfrutar de un almuerzo saludable en cuestión de minutos: mézclalas con verduras y pescado sostenible.','["1 cebolla, rebanada","350 g de pimientos cortados en rodajas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","Bolsa de 225 g de quinua lista para comer","350 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","un puñado de aceitunas negras picadas","Tarro de 225g de atún blanco en aceite de oliva, desmenuzado"]','["Freír la cebolla y los pimientos en el aceite.\r\nhasta que esté suave. Agrega la guindilla y deja enfriar un poco.","Mezclar la quinua, la mezcla de cebolla, la cereza.\r\ntomates, aceitunas y atún juntos. dividir\r\nentre 4 platos, verter un poco de la\r\naceite de la tarja de atún, salpimentar y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14924,5107,'es','Ensalada de caballa y patatas con aderezo de alcaravea y limón','Empaca tu lonchera con pescado ahumado rico en omega-3, patatas nuevas, remolacha y un aderezo ligero de cítricos.','["175 g de patatas nuevas pequeñas","200 g de filetes de caballa ahumada, sin piel","4 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","140 g de remolacha cocida pequeña, cortada en gajos","manojo pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","jugo de 1 limón, ralladura de la mitad","¼ cucharadita de semillas de alcaravea"]','["Coloque las patatas en un pequeño\r\ncacerola con agua hirviendo y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 15 minutos o hasta que esté tierno. genial\r\ny cortar en rodajas gruesas.","Desmenuzar la caballa en un bol\r\ny añadir las patatas enfriadas, primavera\r\ncebolla, remolacha y eneldo.","En un recipiente aparte, mezcle las\r\naceite de oliva, jugo de limón, semillas de alcaravea y\r\nalgún condimento. Vierta sobre la ensalada\r\ny revuelve todo bien para cubrir. dispersión\r\nsobre la ralladura de limón. Empacar en plástico\r\nrecipientes y enfríelos o cómalos inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14925,5111,'es','Ensalada de tomate, sandía y queso feta con aderezo de menta','Esta delicia roja y blanca es un acompañamiento veraniego que combina con todo.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","¼ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharadas de menta picada","4 tomates, picados","500 g/1 libra 2 oz de sandía, cortada en trozos","Paquete de 200 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Haga el aderezo mezclando el aceite, el vinagre, las hojuelas de chile y la menta con un poco de condimento.","Pon los tomates y la sandía en un bol. Vierta sobre el aderezo y déjelo reposar durante 10 minutos para que la fruta quede muy jugosa. Revuelva suavemente el queso feta y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:05:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14926,5113,'es','Mini frittatas de jamón y espárragos','Contiene carne de cerdo (la receta es solo para no musulmanes). Estos sencillos bocadillos son una excelente adición a tu primer picnic del año, o como un almuerzo ligero, sin importar el clima.','["12 rebanadas de prosciutto","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","Puntas de espárragos paquete 125g","6 huevos","100ml de leche","85 g de parmesano rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros y forre\r\ncada hoyo con una rodaja de prosciutto para\r\ncubrir la base y los lados. Calentar aceite en un\r\nsartén pequeña y cocine la cebolla por\r\n5 minutos, hasta que esté suave. Mientras tanto, rompa el\r\nTermina con la punta los espárragos y reserva.\r\nCortar finamente los tallos y añadirlos a las cebollas cuando estén blandas. Cocine por 2-3 minutos\r\nmás, luego retirar y enfriar.","Batir los huevos, la leche y ¾ de la\r\nparmesano juntos. Agrega un poco de cebolla\r\nmezcle en cada hoyo de muffin. dividir\r\nla mezcla de huevo, luego cubra con los espárragos\r\ntermina la punta. Espolvorear sobre el resto\r\nparmesano y cocine durante 18-20 minutos o\r\nhasta que cuaje.","Dejar enfriar unos minutos y luego\r\nsacar de la lata y comer tibio o\r\nfrío."]','2026-01-11 13:05:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14927,5115,'es','Ensalada de calabaza','Obtén 4 de tus 5 al día con esta ensalada súper saludable, ¿por qué no hacer más para tu lonchera también?','["1 calabaza, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en cubitos","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","50 g de arroz salvaje y integral","50 g de lentejas del Puy","1 cabeza de brócoli, cortada en floretes","50 g de arándanos secos","25 g de semillas de calabaza","jugo 1 limon"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nExtienda la calabaza sobre una fuente grande para hornear.\r\nhoja, rociar sobre el aceite y hornear\r\ndurante 30 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos.","Mientras tanto, cuece el arroz y las lentejas.\r\nen agua hirviendo con sal durante 20 minutos,\r\nagregando el brócoli durante los últimos 4 minutos\r\nde cocinar. Escurrir bien y luego agregar el\r\narándanos y semillas de calabaza con\r\nalgún condimento. Agrega la calabaza, vierte\r\nsobre el jugo de limón y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14928,5117,'es','Ensalada de quinoa, queso feta y granada con hierbas','Un meze bowl al estilo del Medio Oriente con cereales saludables, perejil, menta y cilantro.','["300g de quinua","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","85 g de pasas o pasas","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","200 g de semillas de granada de tarrina o fruta","85 g de piñones tostados o almendras laminadas tostadas","paquete pequeño de cada uno: cilantro, perejil de hoja plana y menta, picados en trozos grandes","jugo 3 limones","1 cucharadita de azúcar"]','["Cocine la quinua siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete; debe quedar tierna pero con un poco de mordisco. Escurrir bien y extender sobre una fuente o tazón ancho y poco profundo para que se enfríe rápidamente y se seque al vapor.","Cuando la quinua esté casi fría, revuelva todos los ingredientes restantes con abundante condimento."]','2026-01-11 13:05:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14929,5121,'es','Ensalada de quinoa y queso feta con verduras asadas','La quinua es un grano fino y rico en proteínas que ayuda a mantenerte satisfecho hasta tu próxima comida, lo que hace que esta ensalada de verduras sea un excelente relleno para la lonchera.','["200 g de quinua","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, pelada pero entera, luego cortada en rodajas redondas de 1 cm de grosor","2 pimientos, rojos, amarillos o una mezcla, sin semillas y cortados en gajos largos y gruesos","200 g de calabacines tiernos, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","3 dientes de ajo, sin pelar","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","pizca de azúcar","paquete pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes","Paquete de 200 g de queso feta."]','["Cocine la quinua siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrrala muy bien y reserve.","Mientras tanto, caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle la cebolla y los pimientos con 1 cucharada de aceite y los condimentos en una bandeja para asar, luego ase durante 15 minutos.","Mezcle los calabacines y el ajo con el resto de las verduras y ase durante otros 15 minutos.","Exprima los dientes de ajo asados ​​para quitarles la piel y tritúrelos con un poco de condimento. Agrega el aceite restante, el jugo de limón y la ralladura y sazona con azúcar al gusto. Rocíe sobre la quinua y mezcle con las verduras asadas y el perejil. Desmenuce el queso feta, revuelva suavemente y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:05:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14930,5127,'es','Gajos de calabaza con costra de Dukkah','Cubra los trozos de calabaza con una capa crujiente y picante de avellanas, semillas de cilantro, semillas de sésamo y comino y hornee hasta que estén tiernos.','["50 g de avellanas blanqueadas","1 cucharada de semillas de cilantro","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 calabaza grande","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Tostar las avellanas en una sartén a fuego medio hasta que estén doradas. Agrega el cilantro y las semillas de sésamo y tuesta por 1 min más. Reservar y dejar enfriar, luego agregar el comino molido y triturar con un mortero.","Pelar la calabaza, quitarle las semillas y cortarla en gajos. Mezcle las rodajas con el aceite y luego mezcle con la capa de dukkah. Extienda en una sola capa sobre una bandeja para hornear y cocine durante 30-40 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad, hasta que estén tiernos."]','2026-01-11 13:05:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14931,5129,'es','patatas fritas de manzana','Este saludable refrigerio horneado tiene un solo ingrediente: perfecto para adornar postres, bebidas calientes afrutadas o para tomar como estimulante.','["1 manzana"]','["Caliente el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1. Corte finamente la manzana a través del corazón; use una mandolina, si tiene una, para obtener rodajas finas. Coloca las rebanadas en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino y hornea por 40 minutos. Deje enfriar hasta que esté crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14932,5131,'es','Rollitos de salchicha con queso Glamorgan','Estos bocadillos festivos que se derriten en la boca brindan una alternativa sabrosa para sus invitados vegetarianos; además, no contienen gluten.','["175 g de harina sin gluten (usamos Doves Farm, ampliamente disponible)","85 g de mantequilla","pizca de pimienta de cayena","1 yema de huevo mezclada con 3 cucharadas de agua fría","100 g de pan rallado sin gluten (nosotros utilizamos pan sin gluten Dietary Specials)","100 g de queso Caerphilly rallado","1 puerro pequeño, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza, trituradas","3 yemas de huevo","un puñado de hojas de estragón o tomillo (opcional)"]','["Para hacer la masa poner la harina, la mantequilla\r\ny pimienta de cayena en un procesador de alimentos,\r\nluego mezcle hasta obtener pan rallado fino. espolvorear\r\nla mezcla de huevo y agua sobre la harina y\r\nPulse nuevamente hasta que la mezcla comience a salir.\r\njuntos. Vierta la mezcla sobre una tabla, luego\r\nexprimir suavemente la masa hasta que empiece a\r\nformar una bola, agregando más agua\r\nsi se siente seco. Dividir la mezcla por la mitad, enrollar\r\ncada pieza en un rectángulo de 12 x 30 cm y\r\ndeslizar sobre una bandeja para hornear. No te enfríes.","Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.\r\nMezcle los ingredientes del relleno, excepto\r\nuna yema de huevo, que necesitas para glasear,\r\nen un procesador de alimentos. Dividir en dos y enrollar.\r\ncada uno en forma de salchicha de 30 cm de largo. poner\r\nuna salchicha de queso en un lado de la masa.\r\nUnte la salchicha y la masa con yema de huevo.\r\ny doblar la masa por encima para cubrir la\r\nsalchicha. Sellar los dos bordes, recortar los extremos,\r\nLuego córtelo en trozos de 2 cm. Organizar en un\r\nbandeja para hornear y enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Pincelar los rollitos con un poco más de yema de huevo,\r\ncoloque hierbas encima, si lo desea, luego hornee por\r\n12-15 minutos hasta que se doren."]','2026-01-11 13:05:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14933,5133,'es','Patatas mini asadas','Hornee algunas papas nuevas y cubra con crema agria y cebollino para obtener un canapé simple del tamaño de un bocado.','["Bolsa de 500 g de patatas nuevas.","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","sal marina","75 ml de nata agria media grasa","cebollino en manojo pequeño, cortado en tiras"]','["Caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Pinche las patatas con un tenedor, frótelas con aceite y luego mezcle con sal marina. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear y hornee por 1 hora. Deje que las papas se enfríen durante 10 a 15 minutos, luego corte una pequeña cruz en la parte superior de cada una y pellizca las bases para abrir un poco. Agrega una cucharadita de crema agria a cada uno, un poco de pimienta negra recién molida y una pizca de cebollino. Sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:05:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14934,5135,'es','Pastel de zanahoria sin gluten','La cocinera junior Emily comparte su receta sencilla y sencilla de pastel de zanahoria sin gluten','["140 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para engrasar","200 g de azúcar en polvo","250 g de zanahorias ralladas","140 g de pasas","2 huevos, ligeramente batidos","200 g de harina con levadura sin gluten","1 cucharadita de canela","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten","50 g de nueces mixtas, picadas","75 g de mantequilla, ablandada","175 g de azúcar glas","3 cucharaditas de canela, más un poco para espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrase y forre un molde para pan de 900 g/2 lb.\r\ncon papel para hornear.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar hasta que estén suaves\r\ny cremoso, luego agregue el rallado\r\nzanahoria y pasas. Vierta los huevos en\r\nla mezcla poco a poco.","Agrega la harina, la canela, la cocción.\r\npolvo y la mayoría de las nueces picadas\r\ny mezclar bien. Vierte la mezcla en el pan.\r\nlata, luego hornee durante 50-55 minutos o hasta que\r\nsale una brocheta metida en el medio\r\nlimpio. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante 15 minutos.\r\nluego sacar del molde y dejar enfriar\r\ncompletamente sobre una rejilla.","Mientras tanto, prepara el glaseado. Vencer el\r\nmantequilla en un tazón grande hasta que esté muy suave,\r\nagrega el azúcar glas y la canela, luego\r\nbatir hasta que esté espeso y cremoso. cuando el\r\nel pastel esté frío, extienda el glaseado encima y luego\r\nespolvorear con un poco más de canela y\r\nel resto de las nueces picadas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14935,5137,'es','Tarta de limón y naranja','Este centro de mesa cítrico tiene un ingrediente secreto que le da al pastel una textura encantadora, pero lo hace libre de gluten y trigo.','["Paquete de 250 g de mantequilla blanda","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos","250 g de harina con levadura sin gluten (nosotros utilizamos Doves Farm, que tampoco contiene trigo)","2 cucharaditas de levadura en polvo sin gluten","250 g de puré de patatas, bifurcado para que no quede en un solo grumo","2 limones, ralladura y jugo","1 naranja, ralladura y jugo","175 g de azúcar glas","exprimir el jugo de limón (guardar un poco de la cantidad del bizcocho)","huevos de chocolate, para decorar, si quieres (comprueba que no contengan gluten)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nEngrasar y forrar un bizcocho redondo y profundo de 20 cm.\r\nestaño. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar\r\nhasta que esté pálido y esponjoso, luego bata gradualmente\r\nen los huevos, uno por uno. Incorporar la harina,\r\nlevadura en polvo, puré de patatas, ralladura y\r\njugos. Raspe la lata y nivele la parte superior.\r\nHornear por 45 min hasta que esté dorado y una brocheta.\r\nmetido sale limpio. Enfriar en la lata\r\ndurante 10 minutos, luego páselo a una rejilla.","Tamizar el azúcar glas y luego mezclar con suficiente\r\ndel jugo de limón para hacer una masa firme, pero aún así\r\nglaseado líquido. Extender sobre el bizcocho para que\r\ngotea un poco por los lados. Añadir\r\nalgunos huevos de chocolate, si los usa. Dejar hasta\r\nel glaseado se haya endurecido, luego córtelo y sirva.\r\nDeliciosas con una cucharada de yogur natural."]','2026-01-11 13:05:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14936,5139,'es','Tortitas de sésamo y guindilla con tzatziki','Una opción tentadora y sabrosa sin gluten para los invitados a tu fiesta. Son un poco como blinis pequeños.','["100 g de harina sin gluten (usamos Doves Farm, ampliamente disponible)","1 huevo","150ml soya yogurt","1 chile verde y 1 rojo, sin semillas y finamente picados","1 manojo de cebolletas, finamente picadas, y más para servir","2 cucharadas de cilantro picado","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","un poco de aceite para freír","150 g de yogur griego","Pepino de 13 cm, sin semillas y rallado","2 cucharadas de menta picada"]','["Batir la harina, el huevo, el yogur y 2 cucharadas.\r\nagua juntos en un procesador de alimentos para formar\r\nuna masa suave. Vierta en un tazón, luego agregue\r\nlos chiles, las cebolletas, el cilantro y\r\nsemillas de sésamo. Cubra y enfríe hasta que sea necesario.","Para hacer el tzatziki, mezcla el yogur,\r\npepino y menta juntos, sazonar al gusto,\r\nluego relájate.","Calentar una sartén pequeña con un chorrito\r\nde aceite, limpiando el exceso de aceite con papel de cocina.\r\nfreír la mezcla de panqueques una cucharada de postre a\r\nuna vez, durante 1 min por cada lado, hasta que esté ligeramente\r\ndorado. Vierta sobre un plato y manténgalo caliente.\r\napilar en un plato grande, cubrir con una cucharada de\r\ntzatziki y algunas cebolletas extra cortadas en rodajas\r\ny servir caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14937,5143,'es','Bollos cruzados calientes sin gluten','Los pasteles afrutados de Paul Hollywood son igual de deliciosos cuando haces algunos cambios simples para que no contengan trigo','["300 ml de leche entera, más 2 cucharadas más","50 g de mantequilla","500 g de harina de pan blanco sin gluten ni trigo (nosotros utilizamos harina de pan blanco sin gluten ni trigo de Doves Farm)","1 cucharadita de sal","75 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","2 cucharaditas de levadura rápida o de acción rápida","1 huevo grande, batido","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","75 g de pasas","50 g de piel mixta","ralladura de 1 naranja","1 manzana, pelada, sin corazón y finamente picada","1 cucharadita de canela molida","30 g de harina común sin gluten ni trigo, más un poco más para espolvorear","3 cucharadas de mermelada de albaricoque"]','["Llevar la leche a ebullición, luego retirar del fuego y agregar la mantequilla. Dejar enfriar hasta que alcance la temperatura de las manos. Mezclar la harina, la sal, el azúcar y la levadura con la leche tibia y el huevo en una batidora con un accesorio para masa o con una cuchara de madera, luego juntar la masa con las manos. No amasar.","Pon la masa en un bol ligeramente engrasado. Cubrir con film transparente engrasado y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 1 hora o hasta que duplique su tamaño y al presionarlo con el dedo se deje una abolladura.","Agregue el aceite de oliva, las pasas, la cáscara mixta, la ralladura de naranja, la manzana y la canela y mezcle con la masa. Forme bollos engrasándose ligeramente las manos y dividiendo la masa en trozos de 100 g antes de formar bolas. Dejar reposar una hora más.","Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Mezcle la harina con aproximadamente 3 cucharadas de agua para hacer la pasta para la cruz; agregue el agua 1 cucharada a la vez, de modo que agregue lo suficiente para obtener una pasta espesa. Vierta en una manga pastelera con una boquilla pequeña. Haz una línea a lo largo de cada fila de bollos, luego repite en la otra dirección para crear cruces. Hornee durante 20 minutos en el estante medio del horno, hasta que estén dorados.","Caliente suavemente la mermelada de albaricoque para que se derrita y luego tamícela para eliminar los trozos. Mientras la mermelada aún esté caliente, unte la parte superior de los bollos calientes y déjelos enfriar."]','2026-01-11 13:05:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14938,5145,'es','Espárragos a la plancha con almendras laminadas y mantequilla','Un refrigerio, entrante o guarnición perfecto de espárragos crujientes con nueces y un glaseado mantecoso.','["200 g de espárragos","un poco de aceite de oliva","nuez de mantequilla","1 cucharadita de almendras tostadas en hojuelas"]','["Cocine los espárragos en ebullición.\r\nagua con sal durante 2 minutos. Escurrir y luego tirar\r\ncon un poco de aceite de oliva. Calentar una plancha\r\na muy caliente, coloque los tallos en el\r\nplancha y cocine por unos minutos, volteando\r\npara conseguir un bonito efecto carbonizado por todas partes.\r\nMientras tanto, derrita una nuez de mantequilla en\r\nuna sartén. Divida los espárragos entre\r\n2 platos, sazone y cubra cada montón con\r\nun chorrito de mantequilla derretida y almendras laminadas tostadas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14939,5147,'es','Mezcla de palomitas de maíz Bombay','Un fantástico refrigerio casero y económico de palomitas de maíz saladas con garbanzos, pasas, nueces y especias indias.','["Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos y secos","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","50 g de mantequilla","2 cucharaditas de garam masala","1 cucharadita de curry en polvo","Bolsa de 70g de palomitas saladas","85 g de maní","100g de pasas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nColoca los garbanzos en una bandeja para horno con el aceite. Sazonar, agitar\r\nbien para cubrir, luego hornee por 25 minutos.","Mientras tanto, derrita la mantequilla en\r\nun microondas. Mezclar con el garam\r\nmasala, curry power y\r\nun poco de sal y pimienta. Vierta las palomitas de maíz, el maní y las pasas en un bol, agregue el\r\ngarbanzos al horno y verter sobre el\r\nmantequilla especiada. Revuelve todo bien para cubrir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14940,5149,'es','Mini croquetas de pescado de salmón y limón','Estos pasteles de pescado ofrecen una sabrosa alternativa sin gluten a su comida festiva.','["2 patatas grandes para asar","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","ralladura y jugo de ½ limón","1 yema de huevo","140 g de guarniciones de salmón ahumado, más algo extra para servir","1 cucharada de perejil picado, más extra","2 cucharadas de harina sin gluten mezcladas con 1 cucharadita de pimienta molida gruesa","un poco de aceite, para freír"]','["Cocine las papas en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Deje enfriar durante 5 minutos, saque la pulpa en un bol, luego tritúrela y déjela enfriar. Sazone con aceite de oliva, ralladura de limón y jugo al gusto, luego mezcle el huevo, el salmón y el perejil. Forme círculos pequeños de 3 cm de ancho y 1 cm de profundidad. Enfriar durante 15 minutos.","Espolvorear cada bizcocho con harina pimentada y freír a fuego lento en un poco de aceite durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y servir adornado con salmón y perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:05:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14941,5151,'es','Garbanzos picantes','Haga que toda la familia coma esta alternativa baja en grasa al maní','["Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos y secos","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","1 cucharada de chile en polvo"]','["Coloca los garbanzos en un bol con la verdura.\r\naceite y chile en polvo y mezclar\r\nhasta que los garbanzos estén cubiertos de guindilla.\r\nTransfiera a una bandeja para hornear, extienda\r\nlos garbanzos, luego cocine por 25 minutos.\r\nRetirar del horno y dejar enfriar.\r\nEspolvorea con sal marina antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14942,5153,'es','Brochetas de calabacín y halloumi','Marinar el queso con menta, limón y aceite de oliva, ensartarlo en brochetas de kebab con verduras y asar.','["½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","un puñado pequeño de menta, picada","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 calabacines, cortados en rodajas de 1 cm","Paquete de 225 g de queso halloumi, en cubos"]','["Mezclar la guindilla, la mitad de la menta, la ralladura de limón.\r\ny zumos, aceite, calabacines y halloumi.\r\nDejar marinar durante 30 min. remojar\r\n8 brochetas de madera durante 20 min.","Enhebrar los calabacines y el halloumi.\r\nen las brochetas. Cocine en la barbacoa, o\r\ndebajo de una parrilla, durante 7-8 minutos, volteando hasta la mitad\r\na través y rociando con el resto\r\nadobo. Distribuya sobre la menta restante."]','2026-01-11 13:05:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14943,5155,'es','mazorca de maíz mexicana','Condimente el maíz dulce asado con chile, lima y un montón de mantequilla derretida','["4 mazorcas de maíz","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","ralladura de 1 lima","2 cucharaditas de chile fresco picado o 1 cucharadita de chile en polvo, suave o picante, dependiendo de qué tan picante te guste","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Remojar el maíz en agua fría durante 15 minutos.\r\nCalentar una plancha o barbacoa y,\r\ncuando esté caliente, coloque el maíz directamente sobre\r\nlas barras. Cocine durante 30-40 minutos, volteando\r\nregularmente, hasta que el maíz esté tierno y\r\ncarbonizado en algunos puntos.","Mientras tanto, triturar la mantequilla con la\r\nralladura de lima y chile. Cuando las mazorcas están\r\nlisto, cubra cada uno con una nuez de saborizado\r\nmantequilla y servir con rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:05:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14944,5157,'es','Twists de parmesano, semillas de amapola y alcaravea','Estos giros vegetarianos y sin gluten son perfectos para servir con bebidas festivas.','["175 g de harina sin gluten (usamos Doves Farm, ampliamente disponible)","85 g de mantequilla","pizca de pimienta de cayena","1 yema de huevo mezclada con 3 cucharadas de agua fría","1 huevo batido","3 cucharadas de parmesano recién rallado (o alternativa vegetariana)","1 cucharada de cada una de semillas de amapola y semillas de alcaravea"]','["Para hacer la masa poner la harina, la mantequilla\r\ny pimienta de cayena en un procesador de alimentos,\r\nluego mezcle hasta obtener pan rallado fino. espolvorear\r\nla mezcla de huevo y agua sobre la harina, luego\r\nPulse nuevamente hasta que la mezcla comience a salir.\r\njuntos. Vierta la mezcla sobre una tabla y\r\nexprimir suavemente la masa hasta que empiece a\r\nformar una bola, agregando más agua\r\nsi se siente seco.","Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. rollo\r\nla masa en un rectángulo grande de tamaño a4,\r\nAproximadamente 20 x 30 cm. Cepille la hoja con\r\nel huevo batido y cortar por la mitad a lo ancho.\r\nEspolvorea la mitad con el parmesano y el\r\nsegunda mitad con semillas de amapola y alcaravea.\r\nPase ligeramente el rodillo por la parte superior para\r\npresione el queso y las semillas en el\r\npastelería. Corta cada mitad en 12-15 palitos. arreglar\r\nen una bandeja para hornear y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos.","Hornee durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté dorado.\r\nluego enfríe durante 5 minutos antes de levantarlo sobre un\r\nrejilla de alambre."]','2026-01-11 13:05:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14945,5159,'es','Brochetas de queso feta originales','El queso y la piña en barra obtienen una transformación totalmente tropical: use sandía y mango y espolvoree con semillas de amapola','["1 mango grande, pelado y cortado en 10 trozos","unos 300 g de pulpa de sandía, cortada en 10","Paquete de 200 g de queso feta, cortado en 20 cubos","1 cucharadita de semilla de amapola, tostada","20 mini brochetas, para servir","1 fruta cítrica, para servir (opcional)","1 lima"]','["Ponga el mango en un plato, el melón en\r\notro y queso feta en un tercero. Esparce un poco\r\nsemillas de amapola sobre cada una y revuelva suavemente\r\npara que las semillas se peguen. Armar 10 brochetas\r\ncon cubitos de mango y queso feta, y\r\n10 brochetas con cubitos de melón y\r\nqueso feta. Opta por los cítricos, si lo deseas.\r\no disponer en un plato y exprimir\r\nsobre la lima. Cubra y enfríe hasta aproximadamente\r\n20 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14946,5161,'es','Galletas de mantequilla crujientes de naranja','Los celíacos no deben perderse los dulces con esta receta de galletas de mantequilla sin gluten que se deshacen en la boca.','["100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","50 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura de ½ naranja","175 g de harina sin gluten (pruebe Doves Farm)","½ cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten (nosotros usamos Supercook)"]','["Caliente el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Engrase ligeramente una bandeja para hornear. Batir la mantequilla, luego batirla con el azúcar y la ralladura de naranja hasta que esté suave. Agregue la harina y el polvo para hornear y mezcle para formar una masa.","Divida la mezcla en 10 bolas y colóquelas en una bandeja para hornear. Presione cada bola hasta que quede plana con la punta de un cuchillo de hoja redonda. Enfríe durante 15 minutos, luego hornee durante 12-15 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Déjelo en la bandeja para hornear durante 2 minutos antes de soltarlo con una espátula. Deslícelo sobre una rejilla para que se enfríe. Se mantendrá almacenado en un recipiente hermético hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 13:05:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14947,5163,'es','Bizcocho victoria sin gluten','Suave, ligero y tan festivo como el clásico horneado británico, esto irá bien a todos en una ocasión especial.','["200 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para las latas","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","4 huevos medianos","200g de harina leudante sin gluten con goma xantana (ver consejo)","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten","2 cucharadas de leche","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200ml de nata doble","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas, más un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de mermelada de fresa o frambuesa"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar con mantequilla dos moldes para sándwich de 20 cm y forrar con papel para hornear. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en polvo en un tazón grande con una batidora eléctrica durante 5 a 6 minutos, o hasta que estén pálidos y esponjosos.","Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo bien entre cada adición y agregando una cucharada de harina con cada huevo para evitar que la mezcla se cuaje.","Incorpora el resto de la harina y el polvo para hornear con una espátula, luego agrega la leche y la vainilla. Divida la mezcla entre las latas y nivele las superficies. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que estén dorados, elásticos al tacto y al insertar una brocheta en el centro salga limpia (si queda algo de la mezcla de pastel húmeda pegada a la brocheta, devuelva los bizcochos al horno por otros 5 minutos y luego verifique nuevamente). Dejar enfriar en los moldes durante 5 minutos, luego desmoldar sobre una rejilla, retirar el papel de horno y dejar enfriar por completo. Una vez que estén completamente fríos, los bizcochos se pueden envolver y congelar hasta por un mes. Descongelar a temperatura ambiente antes de montar.","Batir la nata y el azúcar glas con una batidora eléctrica hasta que la nata mantenga su forma. Para armar, coloque un bizcocho en un plato o soporte para pasteles. Unte sobre la mermelada y luego vierta sobre la nata montada. Haga un sándwich con el segundo bizcocho y luego espolvoree con azúcar glas. Se disfruta mejor el día en que se ensambla."]','2026-01-11 13:05:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14948,5165,'es','Galletas de Pascua con trozos de chocolate y almendras para freidora','Prepare estos sencillos pasteles sin gluten para Pesaj. Si usa chocolate sin lácteos, será parev (una ley dietética judía que excluye la leche o los productos cárnicos)','["60 g de azúcar moreno blando","60 g de azúcar en polvo","½ cucharadita de esencia de vainilla","1 huevo, batido","180 g de harina de almendras o almendras molidas (o la mitad de cada una)","80 g de harina de patata","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear kosher","¼ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio kosher","100-150 g de trozos o chips de chocolate amargo sin lácteos"]','["En un bol mediano, mezcla los azúcares, la vainilla y el huevo batido. En un bol aparte mezcla las almendras y la harina de patata. Agrega el polvo para hornear, el bicarbonato de sodio y una pizca de sal. Batir para combinar.","Agregue los ingredientes húmedos a los secos y revuelva hasta que se combinen. Incorpora los trozos de chocolate hasta que estén distribuidos uniformemente.","Calienta tu freidora a 170 ° C y toma un trozo de papel para hornear que quepa en la canasta de tu freidora. Haz algunos pequeños agujeros en el pergamino con la punta de un cuchillo para permitir que el aire circule mejor.","Mientras la freidora se calienta, saque cucharadas colmadas de la mezcla (aproximadamente 40 g) y colóquelas sobre el papel para hornear, presionándolas un poco hacia abajo para aplanarlas.","Hornee a 170 ° C durante 12-15 minutos, revisando después de 12 minutos, hasta que las galletas estén doradas y ligeramente doradas por debajo, luego transfiéralas a una rejilla para que se enfríen (usando el pergamino como ayuda, ya que estarán suaves). Espere al menos 10 minutos para que se enfríen y se endurezcan. Repita con la mezcla restante. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético durante tres a cinco días."]','2026-01-11 13:05:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14949,5167,'es','Galletas de mantequilla sin gluten','Hornee una versión sin gluten de galletas de mantequilla para servir con té o para acompañar un postre','["45 g de harina de maíz","155 g de harina común sin gluten, más un poco más para espolvorear","¼ cucharadita de goma xantana","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","125 g de mantequilla fría sin sal, cortada en cubos"]','["Forre un molde para hornear de 20 cm x 20 cm con papel para hornear y reserve. Vierta las harinas, la goma xantana y el azúcar en un procesador de alimentos y presione para combinar.","Agregue la mantequilla y presione hasta que la mezcla alcance una textura similar a la del pan rallado. Vierta sobre la superficie de trabajo y junte la masa con las manos. Presione en el molde preparado en una capa uniforme y enfríe durante al menos 20 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Hornea las galletas de mantequilla durante 18-22 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente doradas. Retirar del horno y marcar a lo largo de la masa cocida para formar 12 rectángulos. Deje enfriar durante 10 minutos antes de cortar completamente las líneas marcadas. Dejar enfriar completamente antes de servir. Se conservará en una lata de galletas hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 13:05:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14950,5169,'es','Tarta de pudín de chocolate y pera sin gluten','Impresione a sus invitados con este pastel de chocolate blando sin harina cubierto con jugosas peras: es perfecto como postre o como dulce por la tarde.','["200 g de mantequilla, picada en trozos pequeños, más un poco más para el molde","200 g de chocolate negro para cocinar, picado en trozos pequeños","3 huevos","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","100 g de mascarpone o queso tierno","¼ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","100 g de almendras molidas","30 g de cacao en polvo, más algo extra para servir","4 peras Morrisons Market Street muy maduras, peladas, partidas por la mitad y sin corazón","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Untar con mantequilla y forrar un molde para bizcocho redondo de 25 cm. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Derretir el chocolate y la mantequilla en un bol sobre una cacerola con agua caliente, o hacerlo en breves períodos en el microondas, luego dejar enfriar. Batir los huevos y el azúcar con una batidora eléctrica durante 4-5 minutos, o hasta que espese y la batidora deje un rastro en la mezcla. Agrega el mascarpone o queso tierno y la vainilla y bate hasta que se combinen. Incorpora ligeramente el chocolate derretido enfriado hasta que se incorpore, luego incorpora las almendras. Tamice el cacao en polvo y una pizca de sal e incorpore para combinar.","Vierta la mezcla para pastel en el molde preparado. Coloque las peras Morrison encima, con el lado cortado hacia abajo y presione suavemente. Hornee durante 45-50 minutos, hasta que el pastel haya subido alrededor de las peras y se haya partido por encima. Déjelo enfriar en el molde durante 30 a 40 minutos; se desinflará a medida que se enfríe. Espolvoree con azúcar glas y cacao y sirva caliente o déjelo enfriar por completo para obtener una consistencia más parecida a la de un brownie."]','2026-01-11 13:05:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14951,5171,'es','Fideos con pollo y anacardos','Prepare este rápido plato de fideos con pollo, anacardos, zanahorias y pimientos rojos en menos de 25 minutos: no contiene gluten y es rico en proteínas.','["250 g de fideos de arroz planos secos","1 cucharada de aceite con infusión de ajo","2 pimientos rojos, picados en tiras finas","2 zanahorias medianas, cortadas en rodajas finas en diagonal","2 pechugas de pollo, picadas en tiras finas","150 g de anacardos","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile seco (opcional)","cebolletas cortadas en rodajas y cilantro picado, para servir","4½ cucharadas de salsa de soja sin gluten","1½ cucharadita de pasta de miso blanca o roja sin gluten","1 cucharadita de pasta de jengibre","1½ cucharada de azúcar moreno oscuro","1 cucharadita de harina común sin gluten"]','["Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la salsa con 1 cucharada de agua en un tazón pequeño y reserve.","Cocine los fideos secos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego reserve.","Coloca un wok grande a fuego alto y agrega el aceite. Agrega los pimientos y las zanahorias y sofríe durante unos minutos hasta que se doren ligeramente. Incorpora el pollo y sofríe hasta que esté ligeramente dorado, aproximadamente 2 minutos. Agregue los fideos de arroz cocidos y revuelva para combinar. Vierta la salsa y agregue los anacardos, luego continúe salteando hasta que todo esté bien cubierto y un poco pegajoso. Termine con una pizca de hojuelas de chile, si las usa, cebolletas y cilantro picado."]','2026-01-11 13:05:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14952,5173,'es','Crumble de manzana sin gluten','Haga un crumble de manzana sin gachas de avena. Es el pudín perfecto para los meses más fríos, servido con natillas, helado o nata.','["600 g de manzanas Bramley, cortadas en dados de 2 cm","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas molidas o canela","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","helado de crema o vainilla, para servir","100 g de mantequilla, cortada en cubitos","150 g de harina común sin gluten","75 g de azúcar mascabado light","3 cucharadas de gachas de avena sin gluten"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Poner la manzana, las especias y el azúcar en polvo en una cacerola con 2 cucharadas de agua. Cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que las manzanas comiencen a ablandarse, luego transfiéralas a una fuente refractaria.","Mientras tanto, frote la mantequilla con la harina, luego agregue el azúcar moscabado ligero, la avena y una pizca de sal. Espolvorea la mezcla uniformemente sobre las manzanas.","Coloque el plato en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 35 a 40 minutos hasta que la parte superior esté dorada y las manzanas tiernas. Dejar enfriar 5 minutos antes de servir con nata, helado o natillas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14953,5175,'es','Pudín de caramelo pegajoso sin gluten','Disfrute de una versión sin gluten del pudín de caramelo pegajoso. Remojar los dátiles en café agrega un maravilloso y profundo sabor a caramelo tostado al bizcocho.','["125 g de mantequilla con sal, blanda y un poco más para la lata","225 g de dátiles medjool deshuesados ​​y finamente picados","200 ml de café, elaborado con 1 cucharada de espresso instantáneo en polvo","150ml de leche entera","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","225 g de azúcar moreno blando","250 g de harina con levadura sin gluten","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas molidas","¼ cucharadita de goma xantana (opcional)","3 huevos medianos, batidos","helado, crema o natillas, para servir","300ml de nata doble","50 g de mantequilla salada","100 g de azúcar moreno blando","75 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","1 cucharadita de café expreso en polvo"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Unte con mantequilla un molde para pastel cuadrado de 23 cm de profundidad (o use un molde rectangular de aproximadamente 20 x 28 cm) y forre con papel para hornear. Coloque los dátiles en una cacerola mediana con el café, la leche y el bicarbonato y cocine a fuego medio-bajo durante 5-7 minutos hasta que los dátiles se hayan descompuesto en su mayor parte.","Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar en una batidora de pie o con una batidora eléctrica. Tamice la harina, las especias y la goma xantana (si la usa), luego agregue los huevos. Batir hasta que esté combinado, luego agregar la mezcla de dátiles y mezclar nuevamente. Vierta la masa en el molde y hornee por 40 minutos hasta que suba, esté firme y al insertar un pincho en el medio, éste salga limpio.","Mientras se hornea el bizcocho, prepara la salsa. Vierta 150 ml de nata en un cazo con el resto de los ingredientes y caliente a fuego medio-bajo hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Cocine a fuego lento durante 4-5 minutos para que espese. Retire del fuego y luego agregue la crema restante. Corta el bizcocho en cuadrados o rectángulos y sírvelo tibio cubierto con la salsa y helado o nata. Una vez frío, el bizcocho se mantendrá en una lata hermética durante tres días o congelado durante tres meses (sin la salsa). La salsa se mantendrá fría durante una semana o congelada durante tres meses. Descongelar la salsa en el frigorífico durante la noche y el bizcocho a temperatura ambiente. Para recalentar, cubra el bizcocho con papel de aluminio y hornee durante 20-30 minutos a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Caliente la salsa suavemente en una sartén. O bien, cocine en el microondas porciones individuales en tazones resistentes al calor a temperatura alta durante 1 minuto hasta que la salsa se derrita y el bizcocho esté completamente caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14954,5183,'es','Mini bocados de pizza de polenta','Haga que los más pequeños le ayuden a preparar estos bocados de pizza sin gluten. Son ideales para una fiesta infantil en la que algunos niños pueden ser celíacos o tener intolerancia al gluten.','["2 caldo de verduras o cubitos","500 g de polenta instantánea","aceite de oliva, para rociar, más extra para la bandeja","250 g de salsa para pizza","200 g de queso vegano, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","aderezos opcionales (por ejemplo, pimiento picado, maíz dulce, aceitunas o champiñones)"]','["Llevar a ebullición 1½ litro de agua y añadir las cacerolas y ½ cucharadita de sal. Vierta la polenta, batiendo continuamente, lleve a ebullición y reduzca el fuego a bajo, luego revuelva cada minuto para evitar que se pegue, durante unos 8 minutos (o según las instrucciones del paquete).","Mientras tanto, engrasamos una bandeja de horno antiadherente (la nuestra era de 30 x 40 cm). Coloque la polenta cocida en la bandeja y nivele con una cuchara para formar una losa grande y plana que llene toda la bandeja (aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor). Puedes usar las palmas mojadas para presionarlo firmemente después de unos minutos. Dejar enfriar y endurecer durante al menos 1 hora.","Coloca la polenta sobre tu superficie de trabajo y córtala en tiras. Cortar las tiras por la mitad en diagonal para hacer pequeños gajos y volver a colocarlas en la bandeja. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Cubra cada base de polenta con 1 cucharadita de salsa para pizza, un poco de queso vegano y una pizca de orégano. Agregue ingredientes adicionales, si lo desea. Rocíe con aceite de oliva y hornee durante 20-25 minutos. Servir tibio o frío."]','2026-01-11 13:05:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14955,5187,'es','bollos sin gluten','Atiende a los invitados intolerantes al gluten con estos bollos fáciles. Agregue pasas si lo desea y sirva con montones de mermelada y crema cuajada.','["250 g de harina con levadura sin gluten","½ cucharadita de sal fina","1 cucharadita de goma xantana","1 cucharadita de levadura en polvo sin gluten","50 g de azúcar en polvo","40 g de mantequilla fría, en cubos","75ml de leche entera","1 huevo grande y 1 yema de huevo","50 g de pasas (opcional)"]','["Mezclar en un bol la harina, la sal, la goma xantana, el polvo para hornear y el azúcar. Frote la mantequilla con las yemas de los dedos hasta obtener pan rallado fino. También puedes hacer esto pulsando gradualmente la mezcla en un procesador de alimentos hasta que parezca pan rallado.","Batir la leche y el huevo entero y mezclar poco a poco con la mezcla de harina con las manos hasta obtener una masa suave. Incorpora las pasas, si las usas. Amasar brevemente hasta formar una bola.","Extienda con cuidado la masa de bollos hasta que tenga un grosor de 2 cm. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino y enfríe durante 30 minutos para que la masa se endurezca; esto hace que sea más fácil cortarlas.","Retire la masa del frigorífico y, con un cortador de 5 cm, corte de 6 a 8 bollos (presione los restos y vuelva a enrollarlos cuando sea necesario). Coloque los bollos boca abajo (esto significará que obtendrá una parte superior más limpia cuando se hornee) en otra bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear, con una separación de 2 cm.","Batir la yema de huevo y cepillar uniformemente la parte superior de los bollos, asegurándose de que el huevo batido no corra por los lados de los bollos, de lo contrario se elevarán de manera desigual. Coloque los bollos en una bandeja y transfiéralo al congelador durante 15 minutos. Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Retire los bollos del congelador y unte la parte superior con el huevo batido nuevamente, luego hornee durante 12-15 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Cómelo solo tibio o frío, cubierto generosamente con mermelada y crema, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14956,5189,'es','pizza sin gluten','Prepara nuestra versión sin gluten de una pizza clásica. La base es fácil, se unta sobre una rica salsa de tomate casera y luego termina con mozzarella de búfala y albahaca fresca.','["400 g de harina panificable sin gluten","2 cucharaditas colmadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","2 cucharaditas de levadura en polvo sin gluten","1 cucharadita de sal fina","1 cucharadita colmada de goma xantana","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","1 lata de 400 g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","½ manojo pequeño de albahaca, hojas ralladas","2 bolitas de 125 g de mozzarella de búfala"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200 ventilador/gas 7 y meter dos bandejas para hornear dentro.","Hacer la salsa: calentar el aceite en una cacerola pequeña y cocinar la cebolla con una pizca generosa de sal durante 10 minutos a fuego lento hasta que se ablande. Añade los tomates picados, el puré y el azúcar y deja hervir a fuego lento. Cocine, sin tapar, durante 25 a 30 minutos o hasta que se reduzca y espese, revolviendo regularmente. Bate la salsa con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Sazone al gusto y revuelva con la albahaca. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Hacer la masa: mezclar la harina, el azúcar, el polvo para hornear, la sal y la goma xantana en un bol grande. Hacer un hueco en el centro y verter 250 ml de agua tibia y el aceite de oliva. Combine rápidamente con las manos para crear una textura espesa, húmeda y pastosa, agregando 20 ml adicionales de agua tibia si la masa se siente un poco seca. Guárdelo en un recipiente hermético o en un recipiente tapado en el refrigerador hasta por 24 horas antes de usarlo.  Enharine ligeramente dos bandejas para hornear más. Dividir la masa en dos y aplanar con los dedos en círculos de 20 a 25 cm sobre las hojas.","Terminar las bases con una fina capa de salsa y mozzarella desmenuzada. Coloque las bandejas para hornear encima de las bandejas para hornear calientes en el horno y cocine durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que estén crujientes en los bordes."]','2026-01-11 13:05:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14957,5193,'es','Salmón especiado con remolacha, queso feta y arroz salvaje','Una ensalada de pescado sin gluten y rica en omega-3, folato y fibra. Sazonado con comino y alcaravea, el salmón combina bien con la vibrante y dulce remolacha y el queso feta salado.','["Paquete de 120 g de filete de salmón individual","¼ cucharadita de comino molido","¼ cucharadita de semillas de alcaravea","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva virgen extra más extra para servir","60 g de arroz salvaje","100 g de remolacha ya cocida, cortada como quieras","2 cebolletas, cortadas en diagonal","jugo ½ limón","25 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Antes de preparar las verduras, cubra el filete de salmón con las especias y el aceite y luego déjelo marinar. En una cacerola pequeña con tapa hermética, cocine a fuego lento el arroz a fuego medio durante 25 minutos.","Después de 15 minutos, sazone el salmón, luego coloque el pescado, con la piel hacia abajo, en una sartén antiadherente fría (esto asegurará que obtenga una piel uniformemente crujiente). Coloca a fuego medio-alto y cocina el salmón durante 5 minutos, luego dale la vuelta y cocina del otro lado durante 1-2 minutos más, dependiendo de cómo te guste.","Escurrir el arroz, luego devolverlo a la cacerola y mezclar con la remolacha, las cebolletas, el jugo de limón y sazonar al gusto. Sirve el arroz junto con el salmón especiado con el queso feta desmenuzado y un chorrito de aceite de oliva por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:05:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14958,5195,'es','Berenjenas y pimientos con costra de especias y pilaf','Esta receta está repleta de delicias sabrosas, es baja en grasas, baja en calorías, rica en folato, fibra, vitamina C y hierro, además es un delicioso plato principal sin carne, 3 de tus 5 al día. ¿A quién no le encanta?','["2 berenjenas grandes, partidas por la mitad","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 pimientos rojos, en cuartos","2 cucharaditas de canela molida","2 cucharaditas de hojuelas de chile","2 cucharaditas de za''atar","4 cucharadas de melaza de granada","140 g de lentejas del Puy","140 g de arroz basmati","semillas de 1 granada","paquete pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes","Yogur griego o de coco, para servir"]','["Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Con un cuchillo afilado, marque un patrón de diamante en las berenjenas. Unte con 1 cucharada de aceite, sazone bien y colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear, con el lado cortado hacia abajo. Cocine en el horno durante 15 minutos. Añade los pimientos a la bandeja, da la vuelta a las berenjenas y rocía todo con el aceite restante. Espolvoree las especias, 1 cucharada de melaza de granada y un poco de sal. Ase en el horno por 15 minutos más.","Hervir las lentejas en abundante agua hasta que estén al dente. Después de que hayan estado hirviendo durante 5 minutos, agrega el arroz. Cocine durante 10 minutos o hasta que esté bien cocido pero con un poco de sabor. Escurrir y volver a colocar en la sartén, tapado con una tapa para mantenerlo caliente.","Agrega las semillas de granada y el perejil al arroz de lentejas. Divida en cuatro platos o colóquelo en un plato grande. Cubra con las verduras asadas, una cucharada de yogur y el resto de la melaza de granada rociada."]','2026-01-11 13:05:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14959,5197,'es','Chalotas y zanahorias balsámicas con queso de cabra','Las chalotas dulces y el vinagre balsámico picante forman una combinación perfecta en esta deliciosa guarnición. Desmenuzar sobre un puñado de queso de cabra tierno y perejil para servir.','["2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de miel clara","4 ramitas de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","300 g de zanahorias baby, sin pelar y lavadas","300 g de chalotes tipo plátano, cortados por la mitad a lo largo y con la raíz intacta","50 g de queso de cabra tierno","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Mezclar el balsámico, el aceite, la miel, el tomillo y un poco de condimento. Agregue las verduras al aderezo y extiéndalas en una bandeja para hornear grande. Ase durante 45 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y comiencen a caramelizarse. Desmenuza sobre el queso de cabra y el perejil para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14960,5199,'es','Eglefino ahumado y patatas fritas','Una cena de pescado sencilla, rápida de preparar y económica de preparar. Disfrute de este eglefino ahumado en una salsa cremosa y satisfactoria con brócoli de tallo tierno y patatas fritas fáciles','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","300 g de patatas Maris Piper","2 filetes de eglefino ahumado, sin hueso, sin piel y sin teñir (aproximadamente 300 g/11 oz)","140 g de brócoli de tallo tierno","100ml de nata doble"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y calentar el aceite en una sartén grande. Agrega las patatas y sofríe durante 10 minutos hasta que empiecen a estar crujientes. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear y hornee mientras cocina el eglefino.","Pon el eglefino, el brócoli y la nata en la sartén que usaste para las patatas y deja hervir a fuego lento. Cubra con una tapa y cocine durante 8-10 minutos, rociando el eglefino de vez en cuando hasta que esté cocido y el brócoli tierno. Servir con las patatas fritas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14961,5201,'es','Pollo frito de Sri Lanka y tolvas','Nuestra versión de un alimento básico de Sri Lanka. El pollo suculento y ligeramente condimentado es el compañero perfecto para las tortitas (panqueques de arroz) servido con una suave y sedosa salsa de cebolla y coco.','["250 ml de leche de coco","1 diente de ajo, machacado","pizca de jengibre molido","2 vainas de cardamomo, trituradas","pizca de pimienta blanca","500 g de pechugas de pollo sin piel, cada una cortada en 3 trozos","250 g de harina de arroz","1 ½ cucharadita de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 ½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","500 ml de leche de coco","aceite de colza, para cepillar","4-6 huevos","1 litro de aceite de girasol o de colza","75 gramos de harina","25 g de harina de maíz","100 g de polenta de cocción rápida","25 g de coco rallado","pizca de pimentón ahumado","pizca de pimienta de cayena","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","1 chile verde pequeño, cortado por la mitad a lo largo","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de semillas de fenogreco molidas","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","2 cucharaditas de azúcar de caña o moreno claro","400 ml de leche de coco entera","Bolsa de 125 g de espinacas tiernas, picadas","jugo de 1 lima","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","2 chiles rojos, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de jugo de lima"]','["Para preparar el pollo, vierta la leche de coco en una jarra y agregue el ajo, las especias y 1 cucharadita de sal. Coloque el pollo en un recipiente de plástico o en una fuente para asar y viértalo sobre la mezcla de salmuera hasta cubrirlo. Cubrir con film transparente y enfriar durante 24 horas.","Para las tolvas, pon la harina de arroz en un bol grande. En una jarra combina 125ml de agua con la levadura y el azúcar, y deja reposar unos 8 minutos hasta que veas un poco de espuma. Vierta la leche de coco y mezcle los ingredientes húmedos con la harina de arroz para hacer una masa suave, ligeramente más delgada que la masa para panqueques. Sazonar, tapar y dejar fermentar durante la noche en el frigorífico.","Para hacer el kiri hodi, pon todos los ingredientes (excepto la leche de coco, el jugo de lima y las espinacas) en una cacerola de base pesada. Agregue 1 cucharada de agua y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos o hasta que la cebolla se ablande. Vierta la leche de coco y cocine durante 1-2 minutos más (no hierva). Agregue las espinacas, revuelva hasta que se ablanden y luego retírelas del fuego. Sazone al gusto con sal y agregue el jugo de lima.","Para hacer el sambol, use un mortero o un mini procesador para moler las cebollas con los chiles, una pizca grande de sal y pimentón ahumado, hasta formar una pasta gruesa. Sazone con jugo de limón y más sal, si es necesario.","Para cocinar, retire la mezcla de pollo y tolvas del refrigerador durante aproximadamente 1 hora para que alcance la temperatura ambiente. Para cocinar el pollo, calienta el aceite en una freidora o cacerola hasta que alcance los 180C en un termómetro de cocina. Para hacer la cobertura de pollo frito, combine todos los ingredientes con 1/4 cucharadita de sal en un bol. Pieza por pieza, retire el pollo de la salmuera, deje que escurra el exceso y luego sumérjalo en la capa. Sacuda el exceso y fría en aceite durante 6-8 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina, luego reposar en horno lento mientras haces las tolvas.","Haz las tolvas. Batir la base de las tolvas para eliminar los grumos. Agregue un chorrito más de agua para diluirlo si es necesario. Caliente una sartén antiadherente, una sartén con tolva o un wok pequeño de lados altos y unte un poco de aceite de colza con papel de cocina. Agregue un cucharón de mezcla a la sartén e inmediatamente gírelo alrededor y hacia arriba por los bordes para crear un panqueque en forma de tazón. Cocine por 1 min, luego agregue un huevo y cubra con una tapa. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos más hasta que el huevo esté cocido y los bordes comiencen a dorarse. Repita con la masa restante y los huevos. Sirve las tolvas con el pollo, el sambol y el kiri hodi."]','2026-01-11 13:05:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14962,5203,'es','Muslos de pollo confitados con picadillo de patatas y huevo escalfado','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Un sabroso plato de pollo que se complementa perfectamente con papas fritas, tocino y col rizada, y luego se cubre con un huevo líquido.','["4 ramitas de tomillo, más 1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo recogidas","25 g de sal marina","ralladura de 1 limón","2 muslos de pollo","1 chalota","1 cabeza de ajo, partida por la mitad","1 ramita de estragón","600 ml de aceite de oliva","400 g de patatas cortadas en cubitos","50 g de tocino rayado, cortado en mantecas","1 puerro, limpio y rebanado","1 chile verde, picado","50 g de espinacas","25 g de col rizada, rallada","½ perejil de hoja plana pequeño, un puñado reservado para servir","½ cucharada de vinagre de jerez o vermú","2 huevos"]','["Mezclar las hojas de tomillo con la sal y la ralladura de limón. Frote las piernas de pollo y luego enfríe durante 1 hora. Calentar el horno a 140C/120C ventilador/gas 1.","Seque el pollo con papel de cocina. Colóquelo en una fuente para asar pequeña con el resto de los ingredientes confitados. Hornee en el horno durante 2-2 1/2 horas hasta que estén tiernos, luego retírelos del aceite y escúrralos sobre una rejilla. Reserve y cuele el aceite; esto es excelente para asar verduras o hacer más confitados. Reserva la chalota y el ajo.","Para hacer el picadillo, calienta 1 cucharada de aceite infundido en una sartén de fondo grueso. Agrega las patatas y cocina durante unos 10 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agrega el tocino y cocina, revolviendo, hasta que esté crujiente. Añade los puerros, la guindilla, la chalota confitada y el ajo (exprimido sin piel). Cocine por otros 5 minutos hasta que los puerros se ablanden y las patatas estén bien cocidas. Sazone, luego agregue las espinacas, la col rizada y el perejil. Revuelva hasta que las hojas se ablanden. Añade un chorrito de vinagre.","Escalfar los huevos en agua apenas hirviendo durante 3 minutos y luego escurrirlos sobre papel de cocina. Sirve el pollo con el picadillo, los huevos y un poco de perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:05:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14963,5205,'es','Budines de Yorkshire sin gluten','El vehículo perfecto para salsa y delicias asadas: el pudín de Yorkshire. Esta versión no contiene gluten, pero no temas, aún obtendrás ese característico color dorado y esponjoso.','["140 g de harina común sin gluten","50 g de harina de maíz","3 huevos","175ml de leche semidesnatada","aceite de girasol, para rociar"]','["Prepara la mezcla de masa. Vierta las harinas en un bol con 1/2 cucharadita de sal, haga un hueco en el medio y rompa los huevos en él. Bátelo y luego agrega lentamente la leche, batiendo todo el tiempo hasta que no queden grumos. Dejar reposar hasta que esté listo para cocinar.","Caliente el horno a 230C/210C ventilador/gas 8. Rocíe un poco de aceite uniformemente en dos moldes para muffins antiadherentes de 12 orificios y póngalos en el horno para que se calienten.","Vierta la masa en una jarra y luego retire las latas calientes del horno. Vierta la masa con cuidado y de manera uniforme en los agujeros. Vuelva a colocar las latas en el horno y déjelas reposar durante 20-25 minutos hasta que los pudines se hayan inflado y dorado. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14964,5207,'es','Puerros a la plancha y queso de cabra','Una forma sencilla pero atractiva de servir puerros, en trozos largos con queso de cabra desmenuzado y un chorrito de balsámico, aumenta las cantidades para una excelente guarnición para una cena.','["4-5 puerros finos, recortados y cortados por la mitad a lo largo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","25 g de piñones tostados","25 g de queso de cabra desmenuzado","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico"]','["Unte el lado cortado de los puerros con 1 cucharada de aceite y sazone con sal marina y pimienta negra. Calienta una sartén a fuego medio y coloca los puerros, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, en la sartén. Cocine a la plancha durante 5 minutos hasta que los puerros tengan marcas distintivas de carbonización y estén tiernos.","Use el aceite restante para cepillar la parte superior de los puerros, luego déles la vuelta y cocine por 5 minutos más. Esparcir por encima los piñones y el queso de cabra. Rocíe con vinagre balsámico para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14965,5209,'es','Pilau de berenjena con yogur al ajillo','Este plato de pilau, saludable y terroso, lleno de espinacas y berenjena, utiliza arroz integral ya cocido para una comida súper rápida.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo gordos, 1 finamente picado y el otro finamente rallado","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente picado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","1 berenjena (unos 350 g), cortada en cubitos","Bote de 150g de yogur natural natural","Bolsa de 250 g de arroz pilau integral cocido","2 puñados grandes de espinacas tiernas (unos 75 g)","1 cucharada de menta picada, más unas cuantas hojas extra"]','["Calienta el aceite en un wok antiadherente o en una sartén honda y agrega el ajo picado, el jengibre, la guindilla y las semillas de comino. Cocine, revolviendo, hasta que el ajo se ablande. Agrega la berenjena y sofríe durante aproximadamente 1 minuto más, luego tapa la sartén y deja que se fría al vapor durante unos 7 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando hasta que la berenjena esté tierna, pero aún mantenga su forma. Mientras se cocina mezcla el yogur con el ajo rallado y un poco de condimento.","Agregue el arroz y las espinacas a la sartén y cocine brevemente para calentar el arroz y marchitar las espinacas. Agregue la menta y sirva con el yogur con ajo espolvoreado con algunas hojas de menta adicionales."]','2026-01-11 13:05:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14966,5211,'es','Pera envuelta en serrano con queso de cabra','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Estos canapés se ven elegantes, pero son increíblemente fáciles de preparar y lucen deliciosos como parte de un plato para compartir o como bocadillo para una fiesta.','["6 lonchas de jamón serrano","1 pera","un trozo pequeño (125 g) de queso de cabra (no lo usarás todo)","½ paquete de hoja de rúcula"]','["Parte 6 lonchas de jamón serrano por la mitad. Descorazona una pera y córtala en 12 rodajas. Coloca un trozo de pera en el fondo de la loncha de jamón. Añadimos un trozo de 3 cm de queso de cabra y unas hojas de rúcula. Enrollar y asegurar con un palillo."]','2026-01-11 13:05:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14967,5213,'es','Pavlova de piña y jengibre','Apila crema batida y piña carbonizada sobre una base de merengue para crear un postre impresionante para una cena que puedes preparar con anticipación.','["4 claras de huevo grandes","225 g de azúcar blanca en polvo","1 cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino blanco","½ piña grande, pelada, sin corazón y cortada en 4-5 gajos","3 cucharadas de jarabe de jengibre del frasco (ver más abajo), más un poco más para rociar","6 bolas de jengibre en almíbar, picado en trozos grandes","500ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de azúcar glas, más un poco más para espolvorear un puñado de hojas de menta, ralladas"]','["Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2. Coloque las claras de huevo en un tazón grande muy limpio y bata hasta obtener picos rígidos con un batidor de mano eléctrico. Continúe batiendo mientras agrega el azúcar, 1 cucharada a la vez, hasta que la mezcla esté espesa y brillante. Continúe batiendo mientras agrega el jengibre, la harina de maíz y el vinagre.","Dibuja un círculo de 23 cm en un trozo de papel para hornear, luego dale la vuelta y colócalo en una bandeja para hornear grande. Extienda la mezcla de merengue para llenar el círculo, creando una inmersión en el medio y los lados superiores. Pasa una espátula por los bordes a intervalos regulares si quieres crear crestas. Hornear durante 1 hora, luego dejar en el horno con la puerta cerrada durante 8 horas hasta que la Pavlova esté completamente fría.","Mientras se hornea la Pavlova, caliente una plancha limpia a fuego medio-alto hasta que esté caliente. Cepille las rodajas de piña con el jarabe de jengibre y cocine a la plancha durante 2 minutos hasta que aparezcan líneas carbonizadas y la piña se ablande un poco. Dejar enfriar por completo y luego cortar en trozos. (La piña se puede asar a la plancha el día anterior y enfriar. Déjela que alcance la temperatura ambiente antes de armar la Pavlova. La base de Pavlova se puede preparar hasta 2 días antes de servir, guardar en un recipiente hermético y luego cubrir con crema y piña justo antes de servir).","Cuando esté listo para servir, mezcle el tallo de jengibre y 2 cucharadas de almíbar en el tazón pequeño de un procesador de alimentos hasta obtener una pasta grumosa. Añade la nata y el azúcar glas y bate hasta obtener picos suaves, luego vierte en el cráter del merengue. Cubra con la piña, rocíe con un poco más de almíbar de jengibre, esparza la menta y espolvoree con azúcar glas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14968,5217,'es','Pasteles de carne picada con cubierta desmenuzada','Estos pasteles de carne crujiente satisfacen las dietas sin gluten y sin huevo. El complemento perfecto para una taza de té o una copa de vino caliente.','["125 g de mantequilla sin sal, fría y cortada en cubitos","200 g de harina sin gluten (nosotros usamos Doves Farm), más un poco más para enrollar","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","ralladura 1 naranja","200 g de carne picada sin gluten (nosotros utilizamos carne picada de lujo de Sainsbury''s)","25 g de almendras molidas","25 g de almendras laminadas","pizca de canela molida","25 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","25 g de azúcar moreno claro suave"]','["Para hacer la masa, frote la mantequilla con la harina hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino. Añade el azúcar glas y\r\nralladura de naranja. Vierta 4 cucharadas de agua y mezcle con un cuchillo hasta que la masa comience a unirse. Amasar ligeramente, aplanar hasta formar un disco, envolver en film transparente y enfriar durante al menos 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada, extienda la masa hasta obtener un grosor de 2-3 mm. Usando\r\nCon un cortador acanalado de 9-10 cm, saque los discos de la masa. Vuelva a enrollar los recortes y saque más discos hasta que se acabe la masa. Forre dos moldes para muffins de 8 hoyos con los discos de masa, luego llene cada base de masa con 1 cucharadita colmada de carne picada y extiéndala para que quede suave. Se puede congelar, crudo, en bandejas hasta por 1 mes.","Combine los ingredientes del crumble en un tazón pequeño y luego espolvoree un poco sobre cada pastel de carne picada. Hornee en el estante medio del horno durante unos 20 minutos hasta que la masa esté cocida y dorada. Deje enfriar en las latas durante 5 minutos y luego sirva con mantequilla de brandy o crema fresca."]','2026-01-11 13:05:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14969,5219,'es','Pastel de pollo y puerros','Un abundante pastel sin gluten ni trigo para calentar esas noches de invierno','["175 g de harina sin gluten","85 g de mantequilla fría, rallada gruesa","50 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","1 cucharadita de mostaza de grano grueso","500 g de pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en trozos","25 g de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 puerros, en rodajas gruesas","350 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","1 cucharada de harina sin gluten","85 g de berros, picados","4 cucharadas de crema fresca","1 cucharada de leche para glasear"]','["Mezclar la harina, una pizca de sal.\r\ny la mantequilla en un bol, luego\r\nagregue el queso. Licuar 2 cucharadas\r\nagua fría con la mostaza\r\ny revuelva. Forme una masa.\r\nEnvuelva y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Freír el pollo en caliente.\r\nmantequilla y aceite durante 5 minutos\r\nhasta que esté dorado. Agrega los puerros\r\ny freír durante 2 -3 minutos hasta\r\nsuavizado. Añade el caldo, trae\r\nhasta que hierva, tapar y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos.","Precalienta el horno a 200C/gas 6/ventilador 180C. Transfiera el pollo y los puerros a un molde para pastel de 1,2 litros con una espumadera; deje el caldo en el molde. Hacer una pasta con la harina y 1 cucharada de agua fría. Diluya con 2 cucharadas de caldo, luego agréguelo a la sartén y revuelva en el fuego sin parar hasta que espese. Retirar del fuego, añadir los berros y la crème fraîche, sazonar y verter sobre el pollo y los puerros. Fresco.","Extienda la masa entre 2 trozos de film transparente hasta que sea un poco más grande que el plato. Retire el trozo superior de film y levante la masa sobre un rodillo con el film transparente debajo. Coloque la masa con la masa hacia abajo sobre el relleno. Retire la película y luego recórtela alrededor del borde. Haz un pequeño agujero en el centro. Unte la masa con leche. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:05:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14970,5221,'es','Pudín de chocolate con salsa propia','Aquellos que siguen una dieta sin gluten no deben perderse los deliciosos postres bizcochos gracias a algunos cambios inteligentes.','["100 g de mantequilla derretida y un poco más para engrasar","200 g de harina común sin gluten","50 g de harina de trigo sarraceno","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de cacao","1 cucharada de levadura en polvo sin gluten","2 cucharaditas de goma xantana","4 cucharadas de café con leche, preparado en una taza como si lo fueras a beber","3 huevos grandes","150ml de leche","100 g de chocolate con leche, partido en trozos","helado de vainilla o crema integral, para servir","200 g de azúcar mascabado light","25 g de cacao"]','["Engrasar una fuente para horno de 2 litros y calentar\r\nhorno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Hervir el\r\nhervidor de agua. Poner las harinas, el azúcar en polvo,\r\ncacao, levadura en polvo, goma xantana\r\ny una pizca de sal en un tazón grande.\r\nBatir el café, los huevos derretidos.\r\nmantequilla y leche, luego verter sobre el seco\r\ningredientes y mezclar hasta que\r\nsuave. Agregue los trozos de chocolate y\r\nraspe todo en la fuente para hornear.","Mezclar 300 ml de agua hirviendo del hervidor.\r\ncon el azúcar y el cacao para la salsa,\r\nLuego vierte esto sobre toda la masa del pudín.\r\n– no te preocupes si esto parece puro\r\nescenario! Hornee en el estante medio del\r\nHornee durante 30 minutos hasta que la superficie se vea\r\nfirme, leudado y crujiente. mientras recoges\r\ncucharadas en tazones para servir, debes\r\nencontrar una salsa de chocolate rica y brillante\r\ndebajo de la esponja. comer inmediatamente\r\ncon helado de vainilla o nata líquida."]','2026-01-11 13:05:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14971,5223,'es','Tartas de carne picada desmenuzada','Tartas de carne picada de masa quebrada con un toque especial: un crumble extra crujiente y con sabor a nuez encima','["225 g de carne picada","225 g de harina común","100 g de mantequilla, fría y cortada en cubos grandes","3 cucharadas de azúcar mascabado light","satsuma, ralladura y jugo de","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas","1 cucharada de jarabe de jengibre de tallo","azúcar glas para espolvorear"]','["Para hacer la masa, vierta la harina en un tazón grande y frote la mantequilla fría con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado grueso. Agrega el azúcar y la ralladura de satsuma.","Saque 4 cucharadas de la mezcla de hojaldre y reserve. Agregue aproximadamente 4 cucharadas del jugo de las satsumas a la mezcla de pastelería principal para hacer una masa bastante suave, amasando suavemente hasta que quede suave. Envolver en film transparente y enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Enharine ligeramente una superficie y extienda la masa hasta que tenga un grosor de moneda de £1. Con un cortador acanalado de 9 cm, corte 12 círculos de masa. Presiónelos suavemente en moldes para tartaletas individuales; la masa debe sobresalir justo por encima de los moldes para permitir que se encoja cuando se cocine. Vierta la carne picada en las cajas de hojaldre con cuidado de no llenar demasiado.","Espolvoree la mezcla de hojaldre sobre la carne picada para cubrirla ligeramente, cubra con las almendras en hojuelas y rocíe sobre el jarabe de jengibre. En este paso puedes taparlos con film transparente y congelar toda la bandeja lista para hornear.","Cuando esté listo para hornear los pasteles de carne picada, caliéntelos a 200 ° C/ventilador 180 ° C/gas 6. Retire el film transparente de la bandeja y hornee los pasteles de carne picada directamente del congelador durante 25 minutos hasta que estén dorados y bien cocidos. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla y servir espolvoreado con azúcar glas. Hornee las tartas descongeladas durante 18 a 20 minutos."]','2026-01-11 13:05:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14972,5225,'es','Rollito de merengue de mango y maracuyá','¿Organizar una cena? ¿Qué tal preparar este rollito de merengue deliciosamente rico y cremoso? La mejor parte es que es bajo en grasas y no contiene gluten.','["3 claras de huevo grandes","175 g de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita rasa de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de vinagre de malta","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear","200 g de yogur griego sin grasa","1 mango maduro grande, pelado, sin hueso y cortado en cubitos","4 maracuyás, solo pulpa","azúcar glas (opcional) y un poco de physalis, para decorar","salsa de frambuesa, para servir (ver ''Probar'' a continuación)"]','["Precalentar el horno a 150C/\r\ngas 2/ventilador 130C. Forrar un 33x23cm\r\nmolde para panecillos suizos con horno antiadherente\r\npergamino. Batir las claras\r\ncon una batidora eléctrica hasta que esté espumoso\r\ny se duplicó en volumen. batir lentamente\r\nen el azúcar en polvo hasta que espese y\r\nbrillante. Mezclar la maicena, el vinagre.\r\ny extracto de vainilla, luego mezcle con\r\nlas claras de huevo.","Vierta en la lata y nivele la\r\nsuperficie con cuidado, para no empujar\r\nfuera del aire. Hornee por 30 minutos hasta que\r\nla superficie del merengue es simplemente firme.","Retirar del horno y cubrir con papel vegetal húmedo durante\r\n10 minutos. Espolvoree otra hoja de\r\npapel vegetal con azúcar glas.\r\nDeseche el papel húmedo y gire\r\nel merengue sobre el azucarado\r\npapel. Retire el revestimiento\r\npapel, luego esparza yogur sobre el\r\nmerengue y espolvorear con mango\r\ny maracuyá. Usa el papel para\r\nenrollar el rollito desde un punto corto\r\nfin. Mantenga la unión debajo. tamizar\r\nun poco de azúcar glas por encima si quieres,\r\ndecorar con physalis y servir\r\ncon salsa de frambuesa."]','2026-01-11 13:05:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14973,5227,'es','Clafoutis de frutos del bosque','Un postre delicioso, elaborado con harina sin gluten','["500 ml de frutas de la Selva Negra congeladas y descongeladas","5-6 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorado","15 g de crema para untar pura sin lácteos","85 g de harina normal sin gluten de Doves Farm","½ cucharadita de canela molida","4 huevos","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco.","3 cucharadas de calabaza de grosella negra o frutos rojos","½ cucharadita de arrurruz, licuado con un poco de agua","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Escurrir la fruta reservando el jugo. Mezcle las bayas con 1 cucharada de azúcar y luego extiéndalas en una capa uniforme en una fuente para horno redonda de 24 cm, engrasada con crema vegetal.","Tamiza la harina y la canela en un tazón grande y agrega el azúcar restante. En una jarra, bata los huevos y la leche de coco, luego mezcle con la mezcla de harina para hacer una masa suave. Vierta la masa lentamente sobre la fruta y luego hornee durante 40 a 45 minutos.","Calienta la calabaza y el jugo reservado en una sartén. Agregue el arrurruz hasta que espese. Espolvorea los clafoutis con azúcar glas y sírvelos rociados con el coulis."]','2026-01-11 13:05:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14974,5229,'es','Bandeja de pollo harissa horneada','A todo el mundo le encanta hornear en bandeja, este plato de pollo con pasta de harissa picante se asa a la perfección con ajo, patatas y tomates cherry.','["3 cucharadas de harissa","½ bote de 500g de yogur natural desnatado","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en rodajas","1 calabaza pequeña, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en gajos largos","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/ventilador de 180C/\r\ngas 6. Mezclar 2 cucharadas de harissa\r\ncon 3 cucharadas de yogur. frotar\r\npor todas partes las pechugas de pollo y\r\ndejar marinar mientras\r\nempiezas las verduras.","Echa la calabaza y el\r\ncebollas con el resto de la harissa,\r\nmezclado con 2 cucharadas de aceite (girasol,\r\nvegetal u oliva está bien), y algunos\r\nsazonar en una fuente grande para asar.\r\nAse durante 10 minutos.","Retire las verduras del horno, agregue\r\nel pollo a la lata, luego asarlo por\r\nOtros 20-25 minutos hasta que el pollo\r\ny las verduras estén bien cocidas. Servir con\r\nel yogur restante a un lado y\r\nun plato grande de cuscús o arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:05:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14975,5231,'es','Bruschetta de polenta con tapenade','Ideal para quienes siguen dietas sin trigo o sin gluten.','["700 ml de caldo de verduras (el caldo de verduras suizo de caléndula no contiene gluten ni lácteos)","140 g de polenta instantánea","2 cucharadas de albahaca fresca picada","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","9 cucharaditas (aproximadamente medio frasco de 190 g) de tapenade de aceitunas","9 tomates SunBlush o semisecos, cortados por la mitad","100 g de hojas de ensalada mixta"]','["Lleve el caldo a ebullición en una cacerola y luego reduzca a fuego lento. Revolviendo continuamente, vierta la polenta a vapor constante y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que espese. Agrega la albahaca y sazona con pimienta negra y sal, si lo deseas. Extender sobre una lata poco profunda engrasada de 24 x 18 cm. Dejar reposar durante 1 h.","Corta la polenta en 9 rectángulos, cada uno de 8 x 6 cm, luego córtala por la mitad en diagonal para formar triángulos. Caliente una plancha hasta que esté caliente, unte cada triángulo con aceite y cocine a la parrilla durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado, hasta que estén crujientes y dorados.","Cubra cada triángulo con 1?2 cucharadita de tapenade y medio tomate. Sirva caliente sobre hojas de ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:05:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14976,5233,'es','Rollitos de halloumi y tocino','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Impresiona a tus amigos con estos sabrosos bocadillos sin gluten: bocadillos ideales para un buffet.','["250 g de queso halloumi en bloque","10 lonchas de panceta o tocino ahumado","1 cucharada de cebollino picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Cortar\r\nel halloumi en 20 palitos. estirar cada uno\r\nlonjas de panceta con el dorso de un cuchillo,\r\nluego córtelo por la mitad. sazone la panceta con\r\nsolo pimienta negra, luego espolvorear con\r\ncebollino picado.","Enrolle la panceta alrededor del halloumi en\r\nen espiral y colocar en una bandeja para hornear. hornear\r\ndurante 10-12 minutos o hasta que la panceta esté dorada\r\ny empezando a estar crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14977,5239,'es','Huevos al pesto saludables sobre tostadas','Pruebe un pesto rápido y bajo en grasa como una deliciosa alternativa al aceite para freír huevos; también agrega un gran sabor al plato para preparar un brunch o almuerzo perfecto.','["2-4 rodajas finas de masa madre de centeno (unos 70 g en total, dependiendo del tamaño de la barra)","2 huevos","170 g de tomates en rama","160 g de espinacas tiernas","una pizca de hojuelas de chile (opcional)","1 diente de ajo","10 g de albahaca","1 cucharada de piñones","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cucharada de parmesano finamente rallado o una alternativa vegetariana"]','["Para hacer el pesto, pela el diente de ajo y ponlo en un procesador de alimentos pequeño junto con la albahaca, los piñones, el aceite y 2 cucharadas de agua. Mezcle hasta que quede suave y luego agregue el queso. O bien, bátelo con una batidora de mano.","Tostar el pan y dividirlo en dos platos. Cuece el pesto en una sartén a fuego medio durante 30 segundos, revolviendo. Rompe los huevos en un lado de la sartén, pon los tomates en el otro y fríelos en el pesto hasta que los huevos estén cocidos a tu gusto.","Saca los huevos y pon cada uno sobre una tostada. Agregue las espinacas a la sartén con los tomates, suba el fuego a alto y cocine hasta que se ablanden, aproximadamente 2-3 minutos. Los tomates deben estar blandos. Coloque las verduras sobre la otra rebanada de pan tostado y espolvoree con hojuelas de chile, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:05:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14978,5241,'es','Revuelto de tofu','Pruebe nuestro tofu vegano especiado con tomates cherry para obtener una versión de tostada revuelta sin huevo. Perfecto para el desayuno, servido sobre pan de centeno.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente cortada","1 diente de ajo grande, triturado","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de pimentón dulce ahumado","280 g de tofu extra firme","100 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","pan de centeno, para servir, (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofríe la cebolla durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que esté dorada y pegajosa. Agregue el ajo, la cúrcuma, el comino y el pimentón y cocine por 1 min.","Triture el tofu en un tazón con un tenedor, manteniendo algunos trozos gruesos. Agrega a la sartén y fríe durante 3 minutos. Suba el fuego, luego agregue los tomates y cocine por 5 minutos más o hasta que comiencen a ablandarse. Incorpora el perejil a la mezcla. Sirva solo o con pan de centeno tostado (no sin gluten), si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:05:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14979,5243,'es','Granola de matzá con coco, anacardos y arándanos','Disfrute de esta granola en el desayuno durante la fiesta judía de Pesaj, cuando muchos panes están fuera del menú. Pruébalo espolvoreado sobre un bol de yogur griego y fruta.','["5 hojas de matzá (cualquier tipo: integral, de centeno, de espelta, sin gluten)","150 g de anacardos, picados en trozos grandes","150 g de almendras blanqueadas o regulares, picadas en trozos grandes","6 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","80 ml de jarabe de arce","½ cucharadita de canela molida","75 g de hojuelas de coco","100 g de arándanos secos"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Desmenuza la matzá en trozos pequeños en un tazón grande y mézclala con las nueces picadas.","Mezcle el aceite de girasol, el jarabe de arce, la canela y ½ cucharadita de sal en un recipiente aparte, luego viértalo sobre los ingredientes secos mezclados. Mezcle bien para cubrir y vierta sobre la bandeja para hornear.","Hornee durante 10 a 15 minutos, volteando un par de veces para que la granola se dore uniformemente. Después de 10 minutos, agregue las hojuelas de coco para cocinar durante los últimos 5 minutos. Esté atento a él, ya que rápidamente puede oscurecerse demasiado. Cuando esté dorado, sacar del horno y dejar enfriar en la bandeja del horno. Quedará crujiente a medida que se enfríe. Agregue los arándanos y luego transfiéralo a un recipiente limpio cuando esté completamente frío.","Servir con leche o yogur griego y fruta picada. Si puedes dejar de comerlo, debería haber suficiente para pasar la Pascua."]','2026-01-11 13:05:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14980,5247,'es','panqueques de espinacas','Disfrute de estos panqueques a base de espinacas con frutos rojos y jarabe de arce, o retire el azúcar de la masa y sírvalos salados con tocino y huevo escalfado.','["125 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharada de azúcar (cualquier tipo)","2 huevos","1 cucharada de mantequilla derretida, más extra para freír","100ml de leche","50 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca, lavadas y picadas","bayas y jarabe de arce, para servir"]','["Ponga la harina, el polvo para hornear, el azúcar, los huevos, la mantequilla, la leche y las espinacas en una licuadora y mezcle hasta obtener una masa suave y de color verde brillante.","Calienta un poco más de mantequilla en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y agrega pequeñas porciones a la sartén, 2-3 a la vez. Cocine durante 2 minutos hasta que los bordes estén firmes y las burbujas suban a la superficie, luego voltee y cocine por 1-2 minutos más. Manténgalo caliente mientras cocina los lotes restantes.","Sirva con frutos rojos y un chorrito de almíbar para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14981,5249,'es','Panqueques americanos de trigo sarraceno','Prepare estos panqueques americanos hechos con harina de trigo sarraceno para un desayuno o brunch de fin de semana. Disfrútelo con arándanos o chispas de chocolate y jarabe de arce.','["150 g de harina común","150 g de harina de trigo sarraceno","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","50 g de mantequilla, derretida","2 huevos grandes","400 ml de suero de leche","aceite vegetal, para freír","arándanos","jarabe de arce"]','["Combine la harina común, la harina de trigo sarraceno, el azúcar, ½ cucharadita de sal, el polvo para hornear y el bicarbonato de sodio en un tazón grande. Combine la mantequilla derretida, los huevos y el suero de leche en una jarra y bata para combinar. Agregue los ingredientes húmedos lentamente a los ingredientes secos hasta que se combinen, para hacer una masa espesa.","Caliente una sartén o sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio y unte con una capa ligera de aceite vegetal. Agrega unas cucharadas colmadas de la mezcla a la sartén y forma un círculo. Si su sartén es lo suficientemente grande, puede hacer 2 o 3 a la vez, pero no abarrote demasiado la sartén. Una vez que los bordes estén firmes y aparezcan burbujas en la superficie (alrededor de 2-3 minutos), voltee y cocine por 2 minutos más. Los panqueques deben tener un color dorado intenso por ambos lados. Transfiera a un horno tibio a temperatura baja y repita el proceso hasta que se use toda la masa.","Sirva acompañado de arándanos frescos y jarabe de arce rociado generosamente por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:05:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14982,5251,'es','Arroz de desayuno de vainilla y canela','¿Te apetece cambiar las gachas de avena? Este saludable desayuno de vainilla y canela a base de arroz está cubierto con albaricoques y nueces y te llenará para la mañana.','["200 g de arroz basmati integral","200ml de leche entera","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","3 hojas de laurel","1 manojo de canela","12 orejones partidos por la mitad a lo ancho (para que se vean enteros)","4 botes de yogur bio de 100ml","12 mitades de nueces, partidas en pedazos"]','["Vierta el arroz en una sartén antiadherente grande y profunda con 600 ml de agua, la leche, la vainilla, las hojas de laurel y la ramita de canela. Llevar a ebullición, luego tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 25-30 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno. Vigílelo para asegurarse de que no se seque hacia el final de su tiempo de cocción.","Mientras tanto, vierta los albaricoques en una cacerola pequeña con 300 ml de agua y cocine a fuego medio-bajo hasta que estén tiernos, unos 10-15 minutos. Dejar de lado.","Retire las hojas de laurel y la rama de canela del arroz y luego agregue la mitad del yogur. Tanto el arroz como los albaricoques se mantendrán fríos, por separado, hasta por 24 horas. Coloca el arroz en tazones y cubre con el resto del yogur, los albaricoques y su jugo y las nueces. Si has preparado el arroz y los albaricoques el día anterior, cómelos fríos o recaliéntalos hasta que estén tibios, añadiendo un chorrito de leche al arroz para que se suelte."]','2026-01-11 13:05:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14983,5255,'es','Tortitas proteicas fáciles','Aumenta tus proteínas con estos panqueques hechos con huevos, avena, leche y proteína en polvo. Un excelente desayuno después de hacer ejercicio, disfrútelo con mantequilla de nueces o fruta.','["1 plátano","75 g de avena","3 huevos grandes","2 cucharadas de leche (las leches láctea, de soja, de avena o de frutos secos funcionan)","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","pizca de canela","2 cucharadas de proteína en polvo (suero, guisantes o la que prefieras)","aceite de coco, o un aceite sin sabor, para freír","mantequilla de nueces, jarabe de arce y bayas o plátano en rodajas para servir"]','["Batir el plátano, la avena, los huevos, la leche, el polvo para hornear, la canela y la proteína en polvo en una batidora durante 1-2 minutos hasta que quede suave. Verifica que la avena se haya descompuesto, si no, licúa por un minuto más.","Calentar un chorrito de aceite en una sartén. Vierta o sirva con un cucharón 2-3 rondas de masa, dejando un poco de espacio entre cada una para esparcirla. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos, hasta que comiencen a aparecer burbujas en la superficie y la parte inferior esté dorada. Voltee y cocine por un minuto más hasta que esté bien cocido. Transfiera a un horno precalentado y repita con la masa restante. Sirva en pilas con mantequilla de nueces, jarabe de arce y fruta."]','2026-01-11 13:05:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14984,5257,'es','soufflé de panqueques','Pruebe estos panqueques estilo soufflé para obtener los panqueques más ligeros, esponjosos y soñadores. Servir con mantequilla, un poco de azúcar glas y un poco de sirope de arce.','["2 huevos grandes, separados","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo dorada","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de leche","2 cucharadas de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","mantequilla, azúcar glas y jarabe de arce, para servir"]','["Batir las claras en un recipiente limpio con 1 cucharada de azúcar usando una batidora eléctrica o una batidora de pie hasta formar picos firmes.","Batir las yemas de huevo, 1 cucharada de azúcar y la vainilla en un recipiente aparte hasta que estén pálidas y espumosas, y quede un rastro de cinta en la superficie cuando se retiran los batidores. Incorpora suavemente la leche y la harina hasta que se incorporen.","Incorpora las claras a la mezcla de yemas y voltea suavemente la masa para mezclar, usando el costado de una cuchara o espátula de metal para mantener todo el aire en la mezcla.","Trabajando con bastante rapidez, caliente una sartén antiadherente grande con tapa a fuego muy lento. Rocía un poco de aceite en la sartén y luego límpiala con un trozo de papel de cocina; solo quieres que quede una pequeña película en la base de la sartén. Haga tres panqueques altos apilando tres cucharadas de masa en la sartén, usando aproximadamente dos tercios de la mezcla. Manténgalos apilados bastante alto, no incline la sartén ni los extienda como lo haría con los panqueques normales. Cubra con una tapa y cocine durante 2-4 minutos, el vapor ayudará a que se endurezcan. Retire la tapa y agregue otra cucharada de masa a cada panqueque, esto creará la altura y el grosor clásicos. Vuelva a tapar y cocine por otros 4-6 minutos hasta que la parte superior se sienta ligeramente firme.","Con mucho cuidado y cuidado, voltea los panqueques en la sartén con una rodaja de pescado o una espátula. Las bases deben tener un color dorado claro. Vuelva a colocar la tapa y cocine por otros 4-6 minutos hasta que ambos lados estén dorados y se tambaleen ligeramente, pero no se colapsen ni estén pegajosos. Servir con un poco de mantequilla, un poco de azúcar glas y un poco de sirope de arce."]','2026-01-11 13:05:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14985,5261,'es','Avena horneada vegana con almendras y bayas','Pruebe nuestra avena horneada con almendras y frutos rojos para el desayuno o como un delicioso y ligero pudín. Las bayas congeladas son una opción económica, incluso en verano','["150 g de gachas de avena","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","225 ml de leche de almendras sin azúcar, más algo extra para servir (opcional)","1 plátano grande, muy maduro, pelado","185 g de frutos rojos congelados (el nuestro tenía una combinación de fresas, moras y grosellas)","1 cucharadita de jarabe de arce (opcional)","1-2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas tostadas"]','["Calienta el horno a 190 °C/170 °C con ventilador/gas 5. Vierte la avena en un recipiente resistente al calor y luego vierte 450 ml de agua hirviendo del hervidor. Revuelva bien y luego agregue la vainilla y la leche de almendras.","Triture el plátano, luego extiéndalo sobre la base de una fuente para hornear mediana (la nuestra era un óvalo de 20 x 28 cm) y agregue la fruta congelada para combinar completamente. Quieres que el plátano endulce las bayas, pero puedes agregar 1 cucharadita de jarabe de arce, si lo deseas. Vierta sobre la mezcla de avena y espolvoree con las almendras. Hornee durante 30 a 40 minutos hasta que cuaje y los jugos de frutas burbujeen en los bordes del plato. Vierta en tazones y sirva con un poco de leche extra, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:05:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14986,5265,'es','Bollos de desayuno de chía y avena con yogur y frutos rojos','Estos bollos saludables para el desayuno tienen una textura ligeramente más elástica que los tradicionales, pero son un excelente comienzo del día y aportan folato, vitamina C y fibra.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza prensado en frío, más un poco para los moldes","50ml de leche","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","160 g de harina integral de espelta","2 cucharadas de semillas de chía","25 g de avena","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 botes de 120g de yogur griego bio","400 g de fresas, peladas y en rodajas"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forre la base de 4 moldes de 185 ml con un disco de papel para hornear y engrase los lados con aceite de colza. Mide la leche en una jarra y completa hasta 300ml con agua. Agrega el jugo de limón, la vainilla y las 2 cucharaditas de aceite. Mezcle la harina, las semillas y la avena y luego mezcle en un procesador de alimentos para que la mezcla quede lo más fina posible. Agrega el polvo para hornear.","Vierta el líquido, luego revuelva con la hoja de un cuchillo hasta obtener una masa muy húmeda como una masa. Vierta uniformemente en los moldes y luego hornee en una bandeja para hornear durante 20 minutos hasta que suban; no es necesario que estén dorados, pero deben sentirse firmes. Deje enfriar durante unos minutos, luego pase un cuchillo por el interior de los moldes para aflojar los bollos y luego retírelos con cuidado.","Los bollos se pueden comer inmediatamente o enfriar y guardar para más tarde. Si sigues nuestro Plan de dieta saludable, esta receta se puede usar para dos personas en dos comidas; usa inmediatamente dos bollos partidos por la mitad y sírvelos cubiertos con la mitad del yogur y dos porciones de bayas. Deje enfriar y empaquete el resto para comerlo otro día del plan."]','2026-01-11 13:05:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14987,5267,'es','Tazón de avena saludable','Comience bien el día con este abundante plato de avena, bayas, plátano y semillas. Es saludable y está lleno de nutrientes para alimentar el cuerpo y la mente.','["100 g de frambuesas congeladas","1 naranja, ½ rebanada y ½ jugo","150 g de gachas de avena","100ml de leche","½ plátano, en rodajas","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de almendras suave","1 cucharada de bayas de goji","1 cucharada de semillas de chía"]','["Vierta la mitad de las frambuesas y todo el jugo de naranja en una sartén. Cocine a fuego lento hasta que las frambuesas se ablanden, aproximadamente 5 minutos.","Mientras tanto, revuelva la avena, la leche y 450 ml de agua en una cacerola a fuego lento hasta que quede cremoso. Cubra con la compota de frambuesa, las frambuesas restantes, las rodajas de naranja, el plátano, la mantequilla de almendras, las bayas de goji y las semillas de chía."]','2026-01-11 13:05:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14988,5269,'es','shakshuka saludable','Comience el día con una nota más ligera con este satisfactorio shakshuka, una maravillosa sartén llena de tomates, pimientos, espinacas y huevos. Se incluye en cuatro de tus 5 al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza prensado en frío","1 cebolla morada, cortada en gajos finos","1 pimiento rojo, finamente picado","1 pimiento amarillo, finamente picado","3 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro, trituradas","1 cucharadita colmada de pimentón dulce ahumado","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry.","115 g de espinacas tiernas","4 huevos medianos","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande. Agrega la cebolla y los pimientos y sofríe a fuego medio durante 8-10 minutos hasta que las verduras comiencen a ablandarse. Agrega el ajo, el comino, el cilantro y el pimentón y sofríe 1 min más. Vierta los tomates, las espinacas y 100 ml de agua y burbujee hasta que las espinacas se ablanden, luego baje a fuego lento y cocine, sin tapar, durante 10 minutos. Sazone al gusto.","Haga cuatro hendiduras en la mezcla de tomate y rompa suavemente un huevo en cada una. Cubra con una tapa o papel de aluminio y cocine a fuego suave durante 8 a 10 minutos, o hasta que los huevos estén listos. Destapar, espolvorear con las hierbas frescas y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14989,5271,'es','Huevos de aguacate y frijoles negros','Prepárate para el día con este saludable desayuno vegetariano con huevos, aguacate y frijoles negros. Solo toma 10 minutos prepararlo y también es un excelente almuerzo.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo grande, rebanado","2 huevos grandes","Lata de 400g de frijoles negros","½ lata de 400 g de tomates cherry","¼ cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 aguacate pequeño, partido por la mitad y en rodajas","un puñado de cilantro fresco picado","1 lima, cortada en gajos"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande. Añade la guindilla y el ajo y cocina hasta que se ablanden y empiecen a tomar color. Rompe los huevos a ambos lados de la sartén. Una vez que empiecen a cuajar, vierte los frijoles (con su jugo) y los tomates alrededor de la sartén y espolvorea sobre las semillas de comino. El objetivo es calentar los frijoles y los tomates en lugar de cocinarlos.","Retira la sartén del fuego y esparce por encima el aguacate y el cilantro. Exprime más de la mitad de las rodajas de lima. Sirva con los trozos restantes a un lado para apretarlos."]','2026-01-11 13:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14990,5273,'es','burrito de desayuno','Prepare un capullo nutritivo para los ingredientes del desayuno con una envoltura integral: hemos incluido huevos ricos en proteínas y aguacate para agregar grasas buenas a este burrito.','["1 cucharadita de pasta de chipotle","1 huevo","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","50 g de col rizada","7 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","½ aguacate pequeño, en rodajas","1 tortilla integral, calentada"]','["Bate en una jarra la pasta de chipotle con el huevo y un poco de condimento. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, agrega la col rizada y los tomates.","Cocine hasta que la col rizada se ablande y los tomates se ablanden, luego empuje todo a un lado de la sartén. Vierta el huevo batido en la mitad limpia de la sartén y revuelva. Coloque todo en capas en el centro de su envoltura, cubra con el aguacate, luego envuélvalo y cómelo inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14991,5275,'es','avena durante la noche','Adapte esta receta de avena fácil durante la noche a sus gustos. Puedes añadirle frutos secos, semillas y frutos secos, manzana o pera rallada o frutas tropicales picadas.','["¼ cucharadita de canela molida","50 g de avena arrollada","2 cucharadas de yogur natural","50 g de frutos rojos variados","chorrito de miel","½ cucharada de mantequilla de nueces (nosotros usamos almendras)"]','["La noche antes de servir, agrega la canela y 100 ml de agua (o leche) a la avena con una pizca de sal.","Al día siguiente, aflojar con un poco más de agua (o leche) si es necesario. Cubra con el yogur, las bayas, un chorrito de miel y la mantequilla de nueces."]','2026-01-11 13:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14992,5277,'es','Tortitas de plátano y avena','Prepare nuestros panqueques más saludables con copos de avena y plátano para obtener un dulzor natural. Sirva con una cucharada de yogur cremoso y fruta fresca.','["125ml de leche de avena","2 huevos, separados","1 plátano pequeño","100 g de copos de avena","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","unas gotas de extracto de vainilla","spray de aceite","yogur bajo en grasa y fruta por encima"]','["Coloque la leche de avena, las yemas de huevo, el plátano, la avena, el polvo para hornear y la vainilla en una licuadora y procese hasta obtener una mezcla lo más suave posible. Batir las claras a punto de nieve. Incorpora 1 o 2 cucharadas de claras a la masa y luego incorpora el resto.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y rocía con un poco de aceite, vierte aproximadamente 2 cucharadas de masa en la sartén y cocina durante 1-2 minutos, hasta que la base cuaje y aparezcan burbujas por toda la parte superior. Voltee y cocine el otro lado por un minuto. Repita en tandas, asegurándose de que la parte superior se vea seca antes de intentar darle la vuelta, o el centro colapsará."]','2026-01-11 13:05:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14993,5279,'es','Tortilla de hierbas con tomates fritos','Prepare un brunch o desayuno perfecto y rico en proteínas para dos personas. Esta tortilla saludable puede estar en la mesa en tan solo 10 minutos, servida con jugosos tomates','["1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","3 tomates, partidos por la mitad","4 huevos grandes","1 cucharada de perejil picado","1 cucharada de albahaca picada"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén pequeña antiadherente, luego cocinar los tomates con el lado cortado hacia abajo hasta que empiecen a ablandarse y tomar color. Mientras tanto, bata los huevos con las hierbas y abundante pimienta negra recién molida en un bol pequeño.","Saque los tomates de la sartén y colóquelos en dos platos para servir. Vierta la mezcla de huevo en la sartén y revuelva suavemente con una cuchara de madera para que el huevo que se asienta en la base de la sartén se mueva y permita que el huevo crudo fluya hacia el espacio. Deja de revolver cuando esté casi cocido para permitir que se forme una tortilla. Cortar en cuatro y servir con los tomates."]','2026-01-11 13:05:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14994,5281,'es','Gachas de tres cereales','Este desayuno saludable, elaborado con avena tostada, espelta y cebada, es súper sencillo de preparar y se puede conservar hasta por seis meses.','["300 g de avena","300 g de hojuelas de espelta","300 g de copos de cebada","néctar de agave y fresas en rodajas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Trabajando en tandas, tuesta la avena, los copos de espelta y la cebada en una sartén grande y seca durante 5 minutos hasta que estén dorados, luego déjalos enfriar y guárdalos en un recipiente hermético.","Cuando quieras comerlo, simplemente combina 50 g de la mezcla de papilla en una cacerola con 300 ml de leche o agua. Cocine durante 5 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, luego cubra con un chorrito de miel y fresas, si lo desea (opcional). Se conservará durante 6 meses."]','2026-01-11 13:05:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14995,5283,'es','Gachas de verano','Una papilla vegana saludable y veraniega con avena gigante y semillas de granada de color rosa brillante','["300ml de leche de almendras","200 g de arándanos","½ cucharada de jarabe de arce","2 cucharadas de semillas de chía","100 g de avena gigante","1 kiwi, cortado en rodajas","50 g de semillas de granada","2 cucharaditas de semillas mixtas"]','["En una licuadora, mezcle la leche, los arándanos y el jarabe de arce hasta que la leche adquiera un tono morado. Pon en un bol la chía y la avena, vierte la leche de arándanos y revuelve muy bien. Déjalo en remojo durante 5 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que el líquido se haya absorbido y la avena y la chía se espesen y se hinchen.","Revuelva nuevamente y luego divida en dos tazones. Coloque la fruta encima y luego espolvoree sobre las semillas mixtas. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante 1 día. Agregue los ingredientes justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14996,5285,'es','Gachas de cardamomo y melocotón y quinua','Un desayuno saludable de avena y quinoa con melocotón fresco maduro. La leche de almendras la hace adecuada para dietas veganas y sin lácteos','["75g de quinua","25 g de gachas de avena","4 vainas de cardamomo","250 ml de leche de almendras sin azúcar","2 duraznos maduros, cortados en rodajas","1 cucharadita de jarabe de arce"]','["Poner la quinoa, la avena y las vainas de cardamomo en un cazo pequeño con 250ml de agua y 100ml de leche de almendras. Llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Vierta el resto de la leche de almendras y cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que esté cremoso.","Retire las vainas de cardamomo, vierta en tazones o frascos y cubra con los melocotones y el jarabe de arce."]','2026-01-11 13:05:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14997,5287,'es','Bircher de naranja y arándanos','Remojar la avena y las semillas durante la noche las hace fácilmente digeribles. Agregue la fruta y tendrá un comienzo nutritivo del día con el tipo adecuado de grasas, fibra, vitaminas y minerales.','["70 g de gachas de avena","2 cucharadas de linaza dorada","ralladura de ½ naranja","¾ de yogur en tarrina de 175g","2 naranjas peladas y picadas","4 puñados de arándanos de un paquete de 150 g"]','["Mezclar 70 g de avena y 2 cucharadas de linaza dorada con la ralladura de 1/2 naranja. Vierta 300 ml de agua hirviendo y déjelo toda la noche. Al día siguiente, agregue tres cuartos de un bote de yogur de 175 g, vierta en vasos o tazones, cubra con 2 naranjas peladas y picadas, el yogur restante y 4 puñados de arándanos de un paquete de 150 g."]','2026-01-11 13:05:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14998,5289,'es','Huevos revueltos con albahaca, espinacas y tomates','Olvídese de las tostadas y sirva sus huevos revueltos con tomates frescos y espinacas para un desayuno rápido y sobrecargado.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza, más 1 cucharadita","3 tomates, partidos por la mitad","4 huevos grandes","4 cucharadas de yogur natural bio","? paquete pequeño de albahaca, picada","175 g de espinacas tiernas, bien secas (si es necesario lavarlas)"]','["Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande, agrega los tomates y cocina, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, a fuego medio. Mientras se cocinan, bate los huevos en una jarra con el yogur, 2 cucharadas de agua, abundante pimienta negra y la albahaca.","Transfiera los tomates a platos para servir. Agrega las espinacas a la sartén y deja que se ablanden, revolviendo un par de veces mientras cocinas los huevos.","Calienta el resto del aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio, vierte la mezcla de huevo y revuelve de vez en cuando hasta que esté revuelto y cuajado. Coloque las espinacas en los platos y cubra con los huevos revueltos."]','2026-01-11 13:05:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(14999,5291,'es','Muesli Bircher con manzana y plátano','Remojar la avena y las semillas durante la noche las hace más fáciles de digerir y el muesli quedará más cremoso. Ideal para un desayuno rápido recién sacado del frigorífico.','["1 manzana para comer, rallada gruesa","50 g de gachas de avena gigantes","25 g de semillas mixtas (como girasol, calabaza, sésamo y linaza)","25 g de nueces mixtas (como nueces de Brasil, avellanas, almendras, pecanas y nueces), picadas en trozos grandes","¼ cucharadita de canela molida","100g de bioyogur natural desnatado","1 plátano mediano, en rodajas","25 g de pasas orgánicas"]','["Pon en un bol la manzana rallada y añade la avena, las semillas, la mitad de las nueces y la canela. Mezcle bien. Agrega el yogur y 100 ml de agua fría, tapa y deja enfriar durante varias horas o toda la noche. Vierta el muesli en dos tazones y cubra con el plátano en rodajas, las pasas y las nueces restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:05:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15000,5293,'es','Huevos escalfados con brócoli, tomates y pan integral','Los huevos llenos de proteínas con brócoli rico en antioxidantes hacen de esta una opción de desayuno saludable y satisfactoria.','["100 g de brócoli de tallo fino, cortado y cortado por la mitad","200 g de tomates cherry en rama","4 huevos medianos de corral (fríos en la nevera)","2 panes planos integrales (consulte Combina bien para ver la receta)","2 cucharaditas de semillas mixtas (como girasol, calabaza, sésamo y linaza)","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza prensado en frío","una buena pizca de hojuelas de chile"]','["Hervir la tetera. Calentar el horno a 120C/100C ventilador/gas 1/2 y poner una placa refractaria dentro para que se caliente. Llene una cacerola de base ancha hasta un tercio de su capacidad con agua del hervidor y déjela hervir. Agrega el brócoli y cocina por 2 minutos. Agrega los tomates, vuelve a hervir y cocina por 30 segundos. Saque con unas pinzas o una espumadera y colóquelo en el plato caliente en el horno mientras escalfa los huevos.","Vuelva a hervir el agua a fuego lento. Rompe los huevos en la sartén, uno a la vez, y cocina durante 2 1/2 a 3 minutos o hasta que las claras estén cocidas y las yemas líquidas.","Divida los panes planos entre los dos platos y cubra con el brócoli y los tomates. Use una espumadera para escurrir los huevos y luego colóquelos encima. Espolvorea con las semillas y rocía con el aceite. Sazona con un poco de pimienta negra y las hojuelas de guindilla y sirve inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15001,5295,'es','Granola de naranja y frambuesa','Haz tu propia leche de avena con esta receta de granola sin azúcar añadida o sírvela con leche de vaca o yogur orgánico','["400 g de avena gigante","jugo de 2 naranjas (150 ml), más ralladura de ½","1 cucharadita de canela molida","2 cucharadas de frambuesas o fresas liofilizadas (ver consejo)","25 g de almendras laminadas, tostadas","25 g de semillas mixtas (como girasol, calabaza, sésamo y linaza)","2 naranjas grandes, peladas y segmentadas","hojas de menta (opcional)"]','["Ponga 200 g de avena y 500 ml de agua en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle durante 1 min. Forrar un colador con muselina limpia y verter la mezcla de avena. Deje escurrir durante 5 minutos, luego gire los extremos de la muselina y exprímala bien para capturar la mayor cantidad posible de leche de avena; debe tener la consistencia de una crema única. Es mejor enfriarlo al menos 1 hora antes de servir. Se puede conservar en una jarra sellada o tapada en el frigorífico hasta por 3 días.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Pon el jugo de naranja en una cacerola mediana y deja que hierva. Hierva rápidamente durante 5 minutos o hasta que el líquido se reduzca a la mitad, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Mezclar los 200 g de avena restantes con la ralladura de naranja y la canela. Retire la sartén del fuego y agregue la mezcla de avena al jugo. Extienda sobre la bandeja forrada en una capa fina y hornee durante 10 a 15 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y crujiente, volteando la avena cada pocos minutos. Dejar enfriar en la bandeja.","Una vez fría, mezcla la avena con las frambuesas, las almendras en copos y las semillas. Se puede conservar en un frasco cerrado hasta por una semana. Para servir, vierta la granola en tazones, vierta sobre la leche de avena y cubra con los gajos de naranja y las hojas de menta, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:05:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15002,5297,'es','Tostadas de frijoles ahumados','Olvídese de las latas de frijoles horneados compradas en la tienda, esta versión casera es más sabrosa y saludable, con la impresionante cantidad de 4 de sus 5 al día.','["½ cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","½ cebolla pequeña, cortada en rodajas","½ pimiento rojo pequeño, cortado en tiras finas","1 diente de ajo, partido por la mitad","Lata de 227 g de tomates picados","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino tinto","Lata de 210 g de judías o garbanzos, escurridos","¼ cucharadita de azúcar","1 rebanada de pan con semillas","unas ramitas de perejil finamente picado"]','["Caliente el aceite en una sartén pequeña, agregue la cebolla y el pimiento y fríalos hasta que estén tiernos, unos 10-15 minutos. Tritura la mitad del ajo y agrégalo a la sartén, junto con los tomates, el pimentón, el vinagre, las judías, el azúcar y un poco de condimento. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 10-15 minutos o hasta que se reduzca un poco y espese.","Tostar el pan, frotar con el resto de los ajos y rociar con un poco de aceite. Coloca los frijoles sobre la tostada, rocía con un poco más de aceite y esparce el perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:05:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15003,5299,'es','Tostada de champiñones a la mostaza cremosa con un vaso de zumo','Un desayuno vegetariano rápido y saludable con salsa ligera de queso crema','["1 rebanada de pan integral","1½ cucharada de queso crema ligero","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","3 puñados de champiñones pequeños y planos, rebanados","2 cucharadas de leche desnatada","¼ cucharadita de mostaza integral","1 cucharada de cebollino picado","150ml de zumo de naranja recién exprimido o en cartón"]','["Tuesta el pan y luego unta con un poco de queso (no uses mantequilla).","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y cocina los champiñones, revolviendo frecuentemente, hasta que se ablanden. Vierta la leche, el queso restante y la mostaza. Revuelva bien hasta que esté cubierto. Vierta sobre la tostada, cubra con cebollino y sirva con el jugo."]','2026-01-11 13:05:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15004,5301,'es','Tortilla de champiñones y albahaca con tomate triturado','Un desayuno vegetariano con bocado, prueba este plato de huevo con queso crema, hierbas y tomates asados','["2 tomates, partidos por la mitad","3 huevos medianos","1 cucharada de cebollino picado","300 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas","1 cucharadita de mantequilla sin sal","2 cucharadas de queso crema bajo en grasa","1 cucharada de hojas de albahaca finamente picadas"]','["Calienta la parrilla a su temperatura más alta y coloca los tomates sobre un cuadrado de papel de aluminio debajo, volteándolos ocasionalmente para evitar que se quemen. Cuando los tomates estén ligeramente chamuscados, los retiramos de la parrilla aplastándolos ligeramente para que suelten su jugo.","Rompe los huevos en un bol y mezcla con un tenedor. Añade un pequeño chorrito de agua y mezcla. Añade el cebollino y un poco de pimienta negra y bate un poco más. Reserva mientras preparas los champiñones.","En una sartén antiadherente, calentar la mantequilla a fuego medio hasta que forme espuma. Agregue los champiñones y cocine durante 5 a 8 minutos hasta que estén tiernos, revolviendo cada pocos minutos. Retirar y reservar.","Revuelva enérgicamente la mezcla de huevo, luego agréguela a la sartén caliente (inclinándola para que la mezcla cubra toda la base) y déjela por 10 segundos aproximadamente hasta que comience a cuajar. Con un tenedor, revuelva suavemente el huevo aquí y allá para que se cocine la mezcla que no esté cuajada.","Mientras la mezcla de huevo aún esté ligeramente suelta, vierta la mezcla de champiñones en un lado de la tortilla y cubra con el queso crema y las hojas de albahaca. Dale la vuelta al otro lado de la tortilla para cubrirla, si lo deseas. Dejar cocinar 1 min más, luego cortar por la mitad y deslizar cada mitad en un plato. Sirva inmediatamente con los tomates a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:05:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15005,5303,'es','Kedgeree con huevo escalfado','Este plato de arroz y pescado al curry es apto para el brunch, el desayuno o como plato principal a la hora de cenar. Sustituye los tradicionales huevos duros por escalfados','["300 g de arroz de grano largo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","Paquete de 390 g de mezcla para pastel de pescado, descongelada si está congelada","1 cucharada colmada de curry en polvo suave o medio","jugo 1 limon","¼ paquete pequeño de perejil, picado","4 huevos"]','["Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrralo y reserve. Mientras tanto, calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén antiadherente y cocina la cebolla y el ajo durante 5 minutos. Mezcle los trozos de pescado con el curry en polvo y el aceite restante. Añadir a la sartén. Cocine por otros 5 minutos, revolviendo con cuidado y volteando el pescado.","Agrega el arroz a la sartén y sube el fuego, luego revuelve bien (el pescado se romperá un poco). Cocine durante 1-2 minutos, luego agregue el limón y el perejil. Baje el fuego al mínimo posible y tape.","Pon a hervir agua en una cacerola, baja el fuego y escalfa los huevos. Sazone el kedgeree y divídalo en platos, cubriendo cada uno con un huevo escalfado."]','2026-01-11 13:05:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15006,5305,'es','Cuscús de clementina y miel','Los pistachos, las clementinas, la miel y la canela hacen del cuscús un plato perfecto para el desayuno. Servir con fruta y yogur.','["100 g de pistachos u otros frutos secos","300 g de cuscús","¼ de cucharadita de canela molida y más para servir","8 clementinas (mejor sin semillas)","1 cucharadita de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de miel líquida y más para servir","1 cucharadita de agua de azahar (opcional)","300 g de frambuesas frescas o congeladas","500 g de yogur estilo griego bajo en grasa, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Extienda las nueces sobre una bandeja para hornear y tueste durante 5-8 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Mientras tanto, ponga el cuscús y la canela en un bol grande. Ralla finamente la ralladura de 2 clementinas y luego exprime su jugo en una cacerola con la ralladura. Añade la mantequilla, la miel y 200 ml de agua y deja hervir. Vierta esto sobre el cuscús, cubra con film transparente y déjelo absorber durante 10 minutos.","Con un cuchillo de sierra, pele y luego corte en rodajas finas las clementinas restantes. Espolvorea con agua de azahar, si la usas. Pica las nueces en trozos grandes.","Revuelva el cuscús con un tenedor y luego mezcle la mayoría de las nueces. Sirva el cuscús en tazones y cubra con las clementinas y las frambuesas. Cómelo con una cucharada de yogur, una pizca extra de canela y un chorrito de miel."]','2026-01-11 13:05:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15007,5307,'es','Pan de higos, nueces y semillas con ricotta y frutas','Comience bien el día con este pan de desayuno de frutas y nueces, untado con queso crema y cubierto con naranja o manzana. También dura un mes.','["400 ml de té negro fuerte y caliente","100 g de higos secos, sin tallos duros y en rodajas finas","140 g de pasas","50 g de gachas de avena","200 g de harina integral con levadura","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de frutos secos mixtos (almendras, nueces, avellanas, brasiles), más 50 g para la cobertura","1 cucharada de linaza dorada","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo, más 2 cucharaditas para espolvorear","25 g de semillas de calabaza","1 huevo grande","25 g de ricota por persona","1 manzana naranja o verde, en rodajas gruesas, por persona"]','["Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3½. Vierta el té en un tazón grande y agregue los higos, las pasas y la avena. Reservar para remojar.","Mientras tanto, cubra la base y los lados de un molde para pan de 1 kg con papel para hornear. Mezclar la harina, el polvo para hornear, las nueces y las semillas. Batir el huevo con la mezcla de frutas enfriada, luego agregar los ingredientes secos a los húmedos. Vierta en la lata, luego nivele la parte superior y espolvoree con las nueces y las semillas de sésamo adicionales.","Hornee durante 1 hora, luego cubra la parte superior con papel de aluminio y hornee durante 15 minutos más hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el centro del pan, éste salga limpio. Retirar del molde para que se enfríe, pero dejar el pergamino hasta que esté frío. Cortar en rodajas, untar con ricotta y servir con fruta. Se conserva en el frigorífico durante 1 mes o se congela en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15008,5309,'es','muffins de desayuno','Haga muffins más saludables con puré de plátano y salsa de manzana para obtener un dulzor natural, además de arándanos y semillas para darle un toque extra nutritivo.','["2 huevos grandes","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural desnatado","50 ml de aceite de colza","100 g de compota de manzana o puré de manzanas (encontrarlas con la papilla)","1 plátano maduro, triturado","4 cucharadas de miel clara","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina integral","50 g de copos de avena, más un poco más para espolvorear","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1½ cucharadita de canela","100 g de arándanos","2 cucharadas de semillas mixtas (nosotros usamos calabaza, girasol y linaza)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Línea\r\nun molde para muffins de 12 hoyos con 12 muffins grandes\r\ncasos. En una jarra mezclar los huevos, el yogur, el aceite,\r\npuré de manzana, plátano, miel y vainilla.\r\nIncline el resto de los ingredientes, excepto el\r\nsemillas, en un tazón grande, agregue una pizca de\r\nsal y mezcle para combinar.","Vierta los ingredientes húmedos en los secos.\r\ny mezcla brevemente hasta tener una masa suave\r\nmasa – no mezcle demasiado ya que esto hará\r\nlos muffins pesan. dividir la masa\r\nentre los casos. Espolvorea las magdalenas\r\ncon la avena extra y las semillas. hornear\r\ndurante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y bien leudado,\r\ny un pincho insertado en el centro de\r\nun muffin sale limpio. Quitar de\r\nhorno, pasar a una rejilla y\r\ndejar enfriar. Se puede conservar en un recipiente sellado.\r\ncontenedor por hasta 3 días."]','2026-01-11 13:05:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15009,5311,'es','Huevos Dippy con soldados Marmite','Empieza bien el día con este desayuno rápido, fácil y nutritivo','["2 huevos","4 rebanadas de pan integral","una nuez de mantequilla","marmita","semillas mixtas"]','["Lleve una cacerola con agua a fuego lento. Añadir\r\n2 huevos, cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos si está a temperatura ambiente,\r\n3 minutos si está frío en el refrigerador, luego apague el fuego.\r\nTapar la cacerola y dejar reposar 2 minutos más.","Mientras tanto, tuesta 4 rebanadas integrales.\r\npan y untar finamente con mantequilla, luego\r\nMarmita. Para servir, cortar en soldados y\r\nsumérjalo en el huevo y luego en algunas semillas mixtas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15010,5313,'es','Granola buena para ti','Pruebe este desayuno de granola que aumenta la energía para comenzar el día: ¡es bueno para usted!','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","125 ml de jarabe de arce","2 cucharadas de miel","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","300 g de copos de avena","50 g de semillas de girasol","4 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","50 g de semillas de calabaza","100 g de almendras laminadas","100 g de frutos secos (encuéntrelos en el pasillo de horneado)","50 g de coco en hojuelas o coco rallado"]','["Caliente el horno a 150 ° C/ventilador 130 ° C/gas 2. Mezcle el aceite, el jarabe de arce, la miel y la vainilla en un tazón grande. Agregue todos los ingredientes restantes, excepto los frutos secos y el coco, y mezcle bien.","Coloca la granola en dos bandejas para hornear y extiéndela uniformemente. Hornee durante 15 minutos, luego mezcle el coco y los frutos secos y hornee durante 10-15 minutos más. Retirar y raspar sobre una bandeja plana para que se enfríe. Servir con leche fría o yogur. La granola se puede almacenar en un recipiente hermético hasta por un mes."]','2026-01-11 13:05:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15011,4314,'es','gachas de avena plus','Comience el día con el estómago calentito: esta papilla está repleta de avena energética y yogur griego sin grasa.','["suficiente avena para 1","leche semidesnatada","yogur griego sin grasa","plátano, en rodajas","avellanas, picadas en trozos grandes","Miel"]','["Hacer papilla con leche semidesnatada según las instrucciones del paquete.","Cubra con yogur griego sin grasa, rodajas de plátano y avellanas picadas y rocíe con miel."]','2026-01-11 13:05:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15012,4316,'es','Muffin de huevos revueltos','Los huevos revueltos saludables no tienen por qué ser insípidos, prueba esta sencilla receta vegetariana, ideal para el Boxing Day','["2 huevos","unos cuantos tomates secos","albahaca fresca, desmenuzada","muffins ingleses"]','["Revuelva los huevos sin mantequilla ni crema, agregue el tomate seco picado y la albahaca fresca triturada y apílelo sobre las mitades de muffins ingleses tostados."]','2026-01-11 13:05:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15013,5319,'es','Tortitas de arándanos y limón','Haga que los niños le ayuden a preparar un lote de pasteles al estilo americano: el aderezo de bayas picantes los convierte en una opción saludable para el brunch.','["200 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de cremor tártaro","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de almíbar dorado","75 g de arándanos","ralladura de 1 limón","200ml de leche","1 huevo grande","mantequilla, para cocinar"]','["Primero poner la harina, la nata.\r\nde sarro y bicarbonato de\r\nrefresco en el tazón. mezclarlos\r\nbien con el tenedor. suelta el dorado\r\njarabe en los ingredientes secos\r\njunto con los arándanos y\r\nralladura de limón.","Vierta la leche en un\r\njarra medidora. Ahora rompe\r\nen el huevo y mezclar bien\r\ncon un tenedor. Vierta la mayor parte de la leche.\r\nmezcla en el bol y mezcle\r\nbien con una espátula de goma. mantener\r\nagregando más leche hasta obtener una\r\nmasa suave, espesa y fluida.","Calentar la sartén y\r\nuntar con un poco de mantequilla.\r\nLuego vierta la masa,\r\n1 cucharada a la vez, en montones. Burbujas\r\naparecerán encima como los panqueques\r\ncocinar – darles la vuelta en esta etapa,\r\nusando la espátula de metal para ayudar\r\nusted. Cocine hasta que se dore en el\r\nsegundo lado, luego manténgalo caliente\r\nun plato cubierto con papel de aluminio. repetir\r\nhasta que se acabe toda la mezcla."]','2026-01-11 13:05:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15014,5321,'es','Compota de frutos secos','Una saludable compota de frutas con yogur sin grasa para el desayuno mantendrá tus energías hasta la hora del almuerzo','["140g de frutos secos (nosotros utilizamos albaricoques, cerezas y pasas)","½ cucharadita de canela","300ml de jugo de manzana","Tarrina de 200 g de yogur griego sin grasa","100 gramos de granola"]','["Pon los frutos secos en una cacerola pequeña.\r\ncon la canela y el jugo de manzana, dar\r\nRevuelva todo y luego cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que el jugo de manzana esté almibarado. Quitar\r\ndel fuego y dejar enfriar.","Divida el yogur en 4 tazones.\r\nluego cubra con la compota y la granola."]','2026-01-11 13:05:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15015,5323,'es','Tortilla flaca de pimientos, tomate y jamón','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Si necesita un refuerzo de proteínas, intente preparar esta tortilla saludable para el desayuno; usar menos yemas reduce el colesterol.','["2 huevos enteros y 3 claras","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 cebolletas, las partes blanca y verde separadas y finamente picadas","unas lonchas de jamón extra magro finas como una oblea, desmenuzadas","25 g de queso cheddar maduro bajo en grasa","tostadas integrales, para servir"]','["Mezclar los huevos y las claras.\r\ncon un poco de condimento y reservar.\r\nCalentar el aceite en una sartén mediana antiadherente.\r\nsartén y cocinar el pimiento durante\r\n3-4 minutos. Echa las partes blancas.\r\nde las cebolletas y cocinar durante\r\n1 min más. Vierta los huevos y\r\ncocinar a fuego medio hasta que\r\ncasi completamente fijado.","Espolvorear sobre el jamón y el queso.\r\ny continúe cocinando hasta que esté listo\r\nen el centro o cocinarlo bajo fuego caliente.\r\nAsar si os gusta más bien hecho.\r\nServir directamente de la sartén con\r\nla parte verde de la cebolleta\r\nespolvoreado encima y un poco\r\ntostadas integrales."]','2026-01-11 13:05:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15016,5325,'es','Potes de melón y salvado crujiente','No sólo para el desayuno, este saludable pote de yogur, fruta y semillas es un verdadero estimulante del hambre a media tarde y está listo en 10 minutos.','["½ paquete de 200 g de mezcla de melón","150 g de yogur sin grasa en bote","2 cucharadas de cereal de frutas y fibra","1 cucharada de semillas mixtas","1 cucharadita de miel clara"]','["Cubra la mezcla de melón con\r\nyogur, luego espolvorear\r\nsobre cereal mezclado\r\ncon semillas. Rocíe con miel y coma inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15017,5327,'es','Tomates al pesto asados ​​sobre tostadas','Es colorido, lleno de sabor y bajo en grasas: podría ser el refrigerio rápido perfecto.','["2 tomates medianos","1 cucharada de salsa pesto","una rebanada de pan campestre"]','["Corta los tomates por la mitad. Diluir la salsa pesto con un poco de agua y untar la mitad sobre los tomates. Cocine bajo una parrilla caliente durante 5-7 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Al mismo tiempo, tuesta la rebanada de pan y luego unta con el resto de la mezcla de pesto. Cubra con los tomates calientes, aplastándolos ligeramente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15018,4328,'es','Mermelada baja en azúcar','Una versión saludable de la clásica conserva de desayuno con intenso sabor a fruta','["900 g de naranjas de Sevilla","600 ml de zumo de manzana puro sin azúcar","900 g de azúcar para mermelada (disponible en todos los grandes supermercados)"]','["Corta las naranjas en rodajas finas. Quitar las pepitas y atarlos en una bolsa de muselina. Coloca las rodajas de naranja en una fuente para conservas con el jugo de manzana y las pepitas. Llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante 30 a 40 minutos, o hasta que la cáscara de naranja se pueda perforar fácilmente con un tenedor. La mezcla quedará muy espesa, con poco líquido.","Agrega el azúcar de la mermelada y revuelve a fuego lento hasta que se haya disuelto por completo, unos 5 minutos. Llevar a ebullición y luego burbujear durante 4 minutos. Retire la sartén del fuego y retire la espuma de la superficie. (Para disolver el exceso de espuma, deje caer una pequeña cantidad de mantequilla sobre la superficie y revuelva suavemente).","Retirar la bolsa de muselina y dejar reposar la mermelada en la sartén durante 15 minutos para que se enfríe un poco y permita que la cáscara se asiente; bote en frascos esterilizados, sellar y etiquetar."]','2026-01-11 13:05:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15019,5331,'es','Levántate y ve a desayunar muffins','Con manzana, arándano, plátano y semillas, este desayuno para llevar sabe delicioso, es bajo en calorías y utiliza miel en lugar de azúcar.','["2 huevos grandes","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural desnatado","50 ml de aceite de colza","100 g de salsa de manzana o puré de manzanas","1 plátano maduro, triturado","4 cucharadas de miel","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina integral","50 g de copos de avena, más un poco más para espolvorear","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1½ cucharadita de canela","100 g de arándanos","2 cucharadas de semillas mixtas, nosotros usamos calabaza, girasol y linaza"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Forre una bandeja para muffins de 12 orificios con 12 moldes grandes para muffins. En una jarra mezcla los huevos, el yogur, el aceite, el puré de manzana, el plátano, la miel y la vainilla. Vierta los ingredientes restantes, excepto las semillas, en un tazón grande, agregue una pizca de sal y mezcle para combinar.","Vierta los ingredientes húmedos en los secos, mezcle brevemente hasta obtener una masa suave, no mezcle demasiado ya que esto hará que los muffins se vuelvan pesados. Coloque la masa entre las cajas. Espolvorea los muffins con la avena extra y las semillas. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y bien leudado, y al insertar una brocheta en el centro de un muffin, éste salga limpio. Retirar del horno, pasar a una rejilla y dejar enfriar. Guárdelo en un recipiente sellado por hasta 3 días."]','2026-01-11 13:05:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15020,5333,'es','Granola crujiente con frutos rojos y cerezas','Haga de su desayuno un festín frutal: esta receta está llena de bondades crujientes','["175 g de nueces mixtas (mitades de nueces y maní con piel roja)","450 g de copos de avena","50 g de semillas de sésamo","50 g de semillas de girasol","125 ml de aceite de girasol","100 ml de miel líquida (prueba una de las de flores de sabor ligero)","medio paquete de 170 g de frutos secos y cerezas"]','["Precalentar el horno a 190C/Gas 5/ventilador\r\nhorno 170C. Reducir a la mitad algunas de las nueces, dejar\r\nalgunos enteros. Mezclar con maní, avena, sésamo.\r\nsemillas, pipas de girasol y una pizca de sal en\r\nun tazón grande. En una jarra medir el aceite y\r\nvierta en la mezcla, luego mida la\r\ncariño, se deslizará fácilmente. Revuelva juntos\r\ncon un tenedor para romper los grumos grandes de avena.","Vierta en una bandeja para hornear grande con\r\nlados, preferiblemente antiadherentes, en una capa fina.\r\nHornee durante 20-25 minutos, revolviendo bien a\r\nal menos dos veces y llevando la mezcla\r\ndesde los bordes, hasta que esté dorado.\r\nTransfiera a un tazón grande y déjelo enfriar.","Incorpora las bayas y las cerezas.\r\ny servir con abundante leche fría.","Almacene por hasta 1 mes en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 13:05:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15021,5335,'es','Pan de plátano saludable','Come tu pastel y cómelo con este pan de plátano saludable y bajo en grasa, perfecto para el desayuno y más.','["crema para untar baja en grasa, para la lata, y extra para servir","140 g de harina integral","100 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","300 g de puré de plátanos negros demasiado maduros","4 cucharadas de sirope de agave","3 huevos grandes, batidos con un tenedor","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural desnatado","25 g de nueces pecanas o nueces picadas (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nEngrase y forre un molde para pan de 2 libras con horneado.\r\npergamino (deje que llegue 2 cm por encima\r\nparte superior de estaño). Mezclar las harinas, el bicarbonato, hornear.\r\npolvo y una pizca de sal en un tazón grande.","Mezclar los plátanos, el almíbar, los huevos y el yogur.\r\nIncorpora rápidamente los ingredientes secos y luego suavemente\r\nraspar en la lata y espolvorear con nueces,\r\nsi lo usa. Hornear durante 1 h 10 min-1 h 15 min\r\no hasta que al pinchar con una brocheta este salga limpio.","Dejar enfriar en un molde sobre una rejilla. comer caliente o\r\na temperatura ambiente, con untable bajo en grasas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15022,5337,'es','Muesli rico en fibra','Haga su propio muesli lleno de fibra y gran sabor usando avena gigante para liberar energía lentamente, linaza y albaricoques. Un desayuno fácil y saludable','["300 g de avena gigante","100g de Allbran","25 g de germen de trigo","100 g de pasas oscuras","140 g de albaricoques listos para comer, cortados en trozos","50 g de linaza dorada"]','["Mezclar todo en un bol grande.","Vierta mucha leche fría.\r\nvoltea y déjalo en remojo mientras haces\r\nté. Si quieres endulzarlo ralla\r\nsobre una manzana sin pelar y\r\nespolvorear con azúcar moscabado oscuro.","Almacenar hasta por 2 meses, herméticamente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15023,5339,'es','Huevos al horno con tomate','Prepare estos huevos horneados fáciles con salsa de tomate con ajo y sírvalos con pan crujiente para un brunch de fin de semana o un almuerzo ligero que seguramente satisfará','["900 g de tomates en rama maduros","3 dientes de ajo","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 huevos grandes de corral","2 cucharadas de perejil y/o cebollino picado"]','["Precalienta el horno a temperatura ventilada 180C/\r\nconvencional 200C/gas 6. Cortar el\r\ntomates en cuartos o gruesos\r\ncuñas, dependiendo de su tamaño,\r\nluego extiéndalos en una superficie bastante\r\nFuente para horno poco profunda de 1,5 litros.\r\nPelar los ajos, cortarlos en rodajas finas y\r\nespolvorea sobre los tomates.\r\nRociar con el aceite de oliva, sazonar.\r\nbien con sal y pimienta y revuelva\r\ntodo junto hasta el\r\nLos tomates brillan.","Introduzca el plato en el horno y\r\nhornee por 40 minutos hasta que\r\nlos tomates se han ablandado y están\r\nteñido de marrón.","Haga cuatro espacios entre los tomates, rompa un huevo en cada espacio y cubra el plato con una hoja de papel de aluminio. Regrésalo al horno durante 5-10 minutos hasta que los huevos estén cuajados a tu gusto. Esparza las hierbas y sirva bien caliente con rebanadas gruesas de pan tostado o ciabatta tibia y una ensalada verde como acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 13:05:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15024,5341,'es','Pollo y arroz en una olla','Prepare una cena de pollo saludable para toda la familia en menos de una hora. Además, solo necesitas una sartén, por lo que tendrás que lavar menos','["1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","600 g de muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados por la mitad","700 ml de caldo de verduras caliente, elaborado con 2 cucharaditas de polvo","250 g de arroz integral de fácil cocción","320 g de puerros, lavados y cortados en rodajas","1 cucharadita de orégano seco o 1 cucharada de tomillo fresco","2 hojas de laurel (opcional)","320 g de verduras mixtas congeladas (nosotros utilizamos zanahorias en rodajas, floretes de brócoli y maíz dulce)"]','["Pon las especias, el ajo y el aceite en un bol grande y mezcla bien. Agregue el pollo y agregue la mezcla hasta que esté bien cubierto. Calienta una sartén antiadherente grande con tapa, luego fríe el pollo, descubierto (sin aceite extra) a fuego medio-alto durante 5 minutos hasta que se dore, volteando el pollo hasta la mitad para que se dore por ambos lados. Retirar de la sartén y reservar en un plato.","Vierta el caldo en la sartén, revolviendo bien para incorporar los trozos de ajo que puedan haberse pegado a la base de la sartén, luego agregue el arroz, los puerros, el orégano o el tomillo y el laurel, si lo usa. Coloque el pollo encima, luego cubra la sartén y déjelo hervir. Baje el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos.","Agregue las verduras congeladas, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 5 minutos para que se calienten por completo. Deje reposar durante unos 5 a 10 minutos, luego mezcle ligeramente y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:05:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15025,5343,'es','Salteado de pollo saludable','Prepare este nutritivo salteado lleno de verduras cuando necesite cenar rápido y, si le gusta un toque picante, agregue un poco de chile al rico aderezo de maní.','["65 g de arroz basmati integral","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","15 g de jengibre, pelado y cortado en palitos finos","2 cebollas moradas pequeñas (160 g), cortadas en gajos","160 g de brócoli, partido en floretes y con el tallo finamente picado","2 zanahorias (160 g), partidas por la mitad a lo largo y luego cortadas en rodajas diagonales","1 chile rojo, finamente picado (opcional)","200 g de pechuga de pollo cortada en tiras finas","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharada de mantequilla de maní crujiente","1 cucharada de tamari sin trigo","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz integral"]','["Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego escúrralo. Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego alto y sofreír el jengibre y la cebolla morada durante 2 minutos. Agrega el tallo de brócoli, las zanahorias y el chile, si lo usas, y cocina por 1 min.","Agregue el pollo y el comino, saltee brevemente, luego agregue los floretes de brócoli y 3 cucharadas de agua. Tapar y dejar cocer al vapor durante 3-4 minutos, o hasta que los floretes de brócoli estén tiernos y el pollo bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, mezcla la mantequilla de maní con el tamari y el vinagre. Agrega la salsa a las verduras y el pollo, luego sirve sobre el arroz cocido."]','2026-01-11 13:05:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15026,5351,'es','Ensalada de pollo al pesto y orzo','Mejore la ensalada de pasta estándar usando orzo y pesto. El plato también ofrece una buena manera de aprovechar al máximo los espárragos mientras están en temporada en primavera.','["2 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","3 dientes de ajo, 2 machacados y 1 dejado entero","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","25 g de almendras laminadas","manojo grande de perejil de hoja plana","manojo pequeño de albahaca","manojo pequeño de menta, hojas recogidas","25 g de parmesano rallado y parmesano extra rallado para servir","100ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un chorrito para servir","250 g de cebada","16 lanzas de espárragos"]','["Coloque las pechugas de pollo en una tabla y cúbralas con una hoja de papel para hornear. Utilice un rodillo o un mazo para carne para golpear hasta obtener un grosor uniforme de unos 2 cm, teniendo cuidado de no romper el pollo en pedazos.","Combine la ralladura de limón, el ajo machacado, el aceite de oliva y un poco de condimento en un tazón mediano, luego agregue el pollo y agregue la marinada para cubrirlo. Transfiera al refrigerador mientras prepara el pesto.","Tuesta las almendras laminadas en una sartén seca a fuego medio durante 2-3 minutos, agitando la sartén con frecuencia hasta que las almendras estén doradas. Vierta en un procesador de alimentos pequeño o en una licuadora. Pele el diente de ajo entero y viértalo en el procesador de alimentos junto con el perejil, la albahaca, la mayor parte de las hojas de menta, el parmesano, el aceite de oliva virgen extra y el jugo de limón. Sazone y luego mezcle hasta obtener una textura fina.","Cocine el orzo en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo con sal siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, o hasta que esté al dente. Caliente una sartén a fuego medio-alto y cocine el pollo marinado durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté bien cocido con líneas carbonizadas. Escurre el orzo y transfiere el pollo a un plato para que repose.","Rocíe los espárragos con un poco de aceite de oliva virgen extra y sazone con sal, luego cocine a la plancha durante 3 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Mezcle la mayor parte del pesto por el orzo cocido junto con el jugo restante del pollo. El pesto restante se mantendrá cubierto en el refrigerador hasta por cinco días. Corte las pechugas de pollo. Coloque el orzo en una fuente grande para servir y apile los espárragos y el pollo encima, luego espolvoree con las hojas de menta restantes, algunas virutas de parmesano y un poco de pimienta negra. Rociar con un poco de aceite de oliva virgen extra y servir caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15027,5357,'es','Pollo cajún horneado en bandeja con gajos de batata y salsa de cebollino','Las batatas nunca son tan crujientes como las patatas normales, pero se suman a tus 5 al día. Hemos utilizado kéfir en esta receta por su rico aporte de bacterias intestinales beneficiosas.','["1 cucharadita de comino molido y 1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo fresco o 1 cucharadita seca","8 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel (900 g)","1 pimiento rojo y 1 amarillo, sin semillas y picados","3 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos de 1 cm de grosor","2 ramas de apio (125 g), finamente picadas","1 cucharada de aceite de colza, más 1 cucharadita","2 batatas (375 g de peso peladas), cortadas en 16 gajos","150g kéfir o yogur bio","2 cucharadas de cebollino picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezclar en un bol el comino, el pimentón, el orégano y el tomillo, con un buen molido de pimienta negra. Reserva 1 cucharada para las patatas. Usa el resto para frotar todos los muslos de pollo.","Coloque los pimientos, las cebollas y el apio en una fuente grande para asar y mezcle con 1 cucharada de aceite. Extienda las verduras para que se cocinen uniformemente y luego colóquelas en el pollo. Cubra con papel aluminio y ase durante 40 minutos.","Mientras tanto, cubra las rodajas de papa con 1 cucharadita de aceite y las especias restantes y colóquelas bien espaciadas en una bandeja para hornear antiadherente. Mételo en el horno, en un estante más alto, cuando te queden 35 min para el pollo. Revuelva el kéfir y las cebolletas para hacer una salsa, agregando hasta 1 cucharada de agua para aflojar, si es necesario. Dejar de lado.","Retire la fuente para asar y las patatas del horno y suba el fuego a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Retire el pollo a un plato caliente y déjelo reposar durante 5 minutos. Regrese las verduras al horno, sin tapar, durante 5 a 10 minutos para que tomen un poco de color. Sirva la mitad de los gajos en platos con la mitad de la salsa de cebollino y la mitad de las verduras y el pollo. Cubra y enfríe las porciones restantes. Se mantendrá refrigerado hasta por tres días. Para recalentar, calienta suavemente las patatas en una sartén antiadherente, teniendo cuidado de que no se quemen. Calienta el pollo hasta que esté bien caliente en un microondas o en una sartén a fuego medio. Si se congela, déjelo descongelar completamente antes de recalentarlo en una sartén a fuego medio hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15028,5363,'es','Albóndigas de pollo, limón y ricotta con linguini','Llena de sabor, fácil de preparar y nutritiva: nuestras sabrosas albóndigas de pollo cumplen todos los requisitos para una comida familiar','["2 pechugas de pollo","2 limones, rallado","200 g de ricota","3 cucharadas de perejil picado","150 g de pan rallado fresco","100ml de leche, más 2 cucharadas","1 huevo mediano, batido","25 g de harina común, para espolvorear","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","300 g de linguini","320 g de judías verdes, peladas y cortadas por la mitad"]','["Corta el pollo en trozos muy pequeños con un cuchillo afilado. Puedes usar un procesador de alimentos, pero pulsa para que no se convierta en una pasta. Poner en un bol y añadir la mitad de la ralladura de limón, la mitad de la ricota, la mitad del perejil, el pan rallado y mezclar. Agrega las 2 cucharadas de leche, el huevo y una buena pizca de condimento. Mezclar nuevamente.","Espolvoree ligeramente un plato con harina. Mójate las manos, toma un trozo de la mezcla de albóndigas del tamaño de una pelota de golf y forma una bola. Colocar en el plato enharinado y repetir hasta que se acabe toda la mezcla.","Calienta una sartén de base pesada a fuego medio, agrega el aceite y luego las albóndigas, procurando que no se toquen entre sí. Cocine durante 10-15 minutos, volteándolos para que se doren por todos lados. Transfiera a un plato.","Mientras tanto, caliente una cacerola grande con agua con sal y agregue los linguini. Cocine siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y 3 minutos antes de que finalice el tiempo de cocción, agregue las judías verdes. Escurrir, guardando el agua de la pasta. Enjuague los linguini y los frijoles con agua fría para evitar que se cocinen más.","Agrega la ricota restante a la sartén, partiéndola lo más posible. Vierta los 100 ml de leche y 2 cucharadas de agua de pasta reservada, luego cocine hasta que espese un poco durante un par de minutos. Agrega la pasta, los frijoles y el resto de la ralladura de limón y el perejil. Sazone al gusto, agregue las albóndigas y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:05:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15029,5367,'es','Bolitas de pollo agridulces','Prueba a hacer estas bolas de pollo agridulces en casa con esta receta fácil. Estos deliciosos bocados de pollo combinados con una salsa picante son irresistibles.','["125 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 huevos","160ml de leche semidesnatada","1 cucharada de aceite de maní, más un poco más para freír","4 filetes de pechuga de pollo, cortados en cubos de 3 cm","240ml de zumo de naranja","3 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de salsa de tomate","3 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz, mezclada con 6 cucharadas de agua"]','["Primero, haz la salsa. Pon el jugo de naranja, el azúcar, el puré de tomate, el ketchup y el vinagre en una cacerola grande a fuego medio. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Vierta lentamente la mezcla de harina de maíz, poco a poco, revolviendo continuamente hasta obtener la consistencia deseada. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear y 1 cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande. Batir los huevos, la leche y 1 cucharada de aceite en un recipiente aparte. Vierta los ingredientes húmedos en los secos y mezcle bien para crear una pasta suave. Agregue los trozos de pollo y mezcle, asegurándose de que cada trozo esté bien cubierto.","Llene una cacerola profunda o un wok con aceite a no más de un tercio de su capacidad y caliéntelo a 170 ° C, o hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 30 segundos. Sumerja con cuidado los trozos de pollo rebozados en el aceite, un trozo a la vez, y fríalos en tandas de cinco durante unos 5 a 6 minutos en cada tanda hasta que estén dorados y bien cocidos. Si tiene un termómetro de sonda para alimentos, la temperatura interna debe alcanzar los 78 ° C. Si no tienes un termómetro, corta un trozo de pollo por la mitad para asegurarte de que el jugo salga claro.","Escurrir el pollo frito sobre una rejilla colocada sobre una bandeja para horno forrada con papel de cocina o sobre un plato forrado con papel de cocina. Sirva con la salsa agridulce para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:05:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15030,5369,'es','Pastel navideño con verduras asadas','Cocine una comida especial del día de Navidad para uno con este pastel. Está relleno de pollo, salchichas y salsa de arándanos, y es una manera fácil de disfrutar sabores festivos sin tener que preparar una gran cena.','["200 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","2 hojas de salvia, finamente picadas","rallado de nuez moscada","110 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","1 yema de huevo","salsa, para servir","1 pechuga de pollo sin piel","1 salchicha de cerdo","1 cucharada de pan rallado fresco","2 cucharadas de salsa de arándanos, más extra para servir","1 papa grande harinosa, como Maris Piper o King Edward, cortada en 4-6 trozos","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o de colza","80 g de coles de Bruselas, recortadas y sin hojas exteriores, cortadas por la mitad","2 zanahorias pequeñas","3 chirivías pequeñas, peladas"]','["Para hacer la masa, poner en un bol la harina, la salvia, una pizca de sal y nuez moscada rallada. Frote la mantequilla con los dedos hasta que quede arenosa. Batir la yema de huevo con 1-2 cucharadas de agua. Agregue la mayor parte a la masa, reservando 1 cucharadita. Mezclar y luego formar una masa con las manos. Aplanar hasta formar un disco. Envoltura. Enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Para el relleno, coloca el pollo sobre una tabla y, con la palma de la mano presionando hacia abajo, corta por la mitad a lo largo desde un lado sin llegar hasta el final. Ábrelo como un libro y córtalo en seis tiras. Exprima la carne de la salchicha para quitarle la piel.","Corta un tercio de la masa y reserva. Extiende el resto de la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de 10 peniques. Forre un molde para pastel de 10 cm (aproximadamente 3 cm de profundidad), dejando que sobresalga el exceso. Esparce el pan rallado en la base y luego cubre con la mitad del pollo. Estación. Vierta la mitad de la salsa de arándanos, la carne de la salchicha, el resto de la salsa de arándanos y el resto del pollo. Estación.","Extienda la masa reservada para que sea lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir el plato. Cepille un poco del huevo reservado alrededor del borde del pastel, luego cubra con la tapa de masa, presionando el borde para sellar. Recorta cualquier exceso. Pincelar con el resto del huevo y cortar un pequeño agujero de vapor en el centro. Se mantendrá frío hasta por 24 horas o congelado durante dos meses.","Cocine las patatas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 5 a 8 minutos hasta que estén esponjosas pero aún mantengan su forma. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle las patatas en la mitad del aceite en una bandeja para hornear grande. Estación. Hornea con el pastel durante 30 minutos.","Empuje las patatas hacia un extremo de la bandeja y luego agregue el resto de las verduras al otro extremo. Mezcle con el resto del aceite y sazone. Hornee por 20 minutos más, cubriendo el pastel con papel de aluminio si se oscurece demasiado rápido. Retire el pastel del horno y ase las verduras durante 10 a 15 minutos más hasta que estén tiernas y las patatas crujientes. Sirva con salsa gravy y salsa extra de arándanos."]','2026-01-11 13:05:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15031,5371,'es','Pollo relleno de arroz con ajo y nduja','Haga algo diferente con el pollo asado sirviéndolo con un relleno a base de arroz lleno de sabores de ajo y nduja. También queda genial con verduras verdes y salsa','["4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","5 dientes de ajo machacados","1½ cucharadita de comino","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de pimiento rojo","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","30-40 g de nduja (o 50 g de chorizo), según lo picante que te guste","130 g de arroz blanco o integral de grano largo, enjuagado","60 g de mantequilla sin sal","1 limón, rallado","1 pollo entero (aproximadamente 1,5 kg)"]','["Calienta la mitad del aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio y cocina la cebolla hasta que esté suave y comience a dorarse, aproximadamente 10 minutos. Agrega 3 dientes de ajo machacados, 1 cucharadita de comino, las hojuelas de pimiento rojo, el pimentón ahumado, ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra y la nduja, partiéndola mientras la mezclas. Cocine durante 5 minutos más hasta que la nduja haya soltado sus aceites.","Agregue el arroz hasta que esté completamente cubierto de aceite y luego vierta 250 ml de agua. Cocine el arroz, sin tapar, siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete hasta que esté casi cocido pero conservando algo de sabor, luego retírelo del fuego. Dejar de lado.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezclar la mantequilla con el ajo restante, la ralladura de limón, el comino restante y una pizca de sal. Afloje la piel de la pechuga de pollo con las manos, con cuidado, para no rasgar la piel. Trabaja desde la parte más ancha del ave y acércate al cuello, pero no completamente, y trata de aflojar la piel por encima de las patas también. Empuje suavemente la mantequilla de ajo debajo de la piel hasta donde pueda. Rellena la cavidad con la mezcla de arroz y luego ata las patas para evitar que se derrame.","Frote la piel con el aceite restante y espolvoree con un poco de sal. Ase el pollo entre 1 hora y 1 hora y 15 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido y el jugo salga claro. Retirar del horno y dejar reposar durante 10 minutos antes de cortar. Sirva con vegetales verdes y una salsa hecha con los jugos, si lo desea. Pruebe una de nuestras recetas de salsa aquí."]','2026-01-11 13:05:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15032,5373,'es','Pollo Jerk Jamaiquino','Haga su propio condimento para salsa picante y utilícelo como adobo para pollo. Los pimientos escoceses y las especias aportan calidez y mucho sabor.','["2 muslos de pollo","2 muslos de pollo","2-3 cucharaditas de pimienta de Jamaica triturada o en polvo (pimento)","1 cucharadita de sal fina","4 cebolletas, recortadas","1 cebolla blanca mediana","1- 2 pimientos escoceses","6-8 dientes de ajo","2-3 cucharadas de hojas de tomillo recogidas","240ml de zumo de lima o de naranja o piña","60 ml de vinagre blanco o de malta","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","1-2 cucharadas de azúcar oscura"]','["Batir todos los ingredientes para la marinada en blender hasta formar una pasta espesa. No debe quedar demasiado líquido, similar a la consistencia de la salsa de chile dulce. Pruebe y ajuste la sazón si es necesario. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético en el refrigerador hasta por tres semanas.","Corta la piel del pollo con un cuchillo afilado y luego colócala en un recipiente. Vierta sobre la marinada de Jerk, asegurándose de que el pollo esté completamente cubierto. Quizás no necesites toda la marinada. Tapa el pollo y colócalo en el frigorífico durante al menos 4 horas, pero idealmente 24 horas.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Poner el pollo en una fuente refractaria, cubrir con papel aluminio y cocinar durante 30-45 minutos. Retire el papel de aluminio y rocíe el pollo con los jugos del plato, luego cocine por 10 minutos más. La piel debería empezar a endurecerse. Compruebe que la carne esté cocida cortando la parte más profunda del pollo. Si los jugos salen rojos, regresa al horno por 10 minutos más, o hasta que los jugos salgan claros. Sirva con arroz y guisantes o cualquiera de sus guarniciones favoritas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15033,5375,'es','Tacos de pollo más ligeros','El mismo plato mexicano sabroso con la mitad de grasa que los tacos estándar. Agregue pollo, salsa y guacamole y prepárese una comida deliciosa.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","450 g de pechugas de pollo sin piel, preferiblemente ecológicas","4 tomates medianos, preferiblemente en rama, cortados por la mitad","1 pimiento rojo, en cuartos","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en 8 gajos","¼ cucharadita de aceite de colza","2 cucharaditas de jugo de lima","¼ cucharadita de comino molido","una buena pizca de hojuelas de chile","2 aguacates maduros de tamaño mediano, sin hueso, pelados y picados en trozos grandes","4 cucharaditas de jugo de lima","2 cebolletas, con las puntas cortadas y finamente picadas","3 cucharadas de cilantro picado","una buena pizca de hojuelas de chile","8 tacos de maíz","8 cucharaditas de yogur griego 0%","2 lechugas Little Gem, ralladas","cilantro picado","gajos de lima, para exprimir"]','["Mezclar el aceite con el comino y el pimentón en un plato grande. Coloque el pollo en el plato y frótelo con aceite especiado. Sazona con pimienta y una pizca de sal, luego tapa y reserva mientras preparas la salsa.","Calienta la parrilla a temperatura alta durante 10 minutos. Mientras tanto, forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel de aluminio y coloque encima los tomates (con el lado cortado hacia arriba), junto con el pimiento y la cebolla morada. Unte la cebolla con aceite y sazone los tomates y la cebolla con pimienta. Ase durante 12-15 minutos, volteando los tomates y la cebolla a la mitad, hasta que estén bien carbonizados. Retirar (dejando la parrilla encendida) y dejar enfriar; poner el pimiento en un bol y cubrir con film transparente para que luego sea más fácil pelarlo.","Para el guacamole, ponga el aguacate en un bol y tritúrelo brevemente con un tenedor, dejando algunos trozos gruesos para darle textura. Mezcle suavemente el jugo de lima, las cebolletas, el cilantro y las hojuelas de chile. Sazone con pimienta y una pizca de sal.","Vuelva a forrar la bandeja para hornear con papel de aluminio y coloque el pollo encima, con el lado regordete hacia arriba. Ase durante unos 10 minutos hasta que esté cocido; no es necesario darle la vuelta. Mientras tanto, saque y deseche la mayor cantidad posible de semillas y jugo de los tomates (para que la salsa no quede demasiado húmeda), dejando la pulpa y la piel carbonizada. Cuando el pimiento esté lo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo, pélelo y deseche la piel. Picar los tomates y la cebolla y cortar el pimiento en dados. Combine en un bol con el jugo de lima, el comino, las hojuelas de chile, un poco de pimienta y una pizca de sal.","Cuando el pollo esté cocido, retírelo de la parrilla, cúbralo sin apretar con papel de aluminio y déjelo reposar durante 5 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Cortar el pollo en rodajas gruesas y verter sobre los jugos. Cuando esté listo para servir, coloque los tacos en una bandeja para hornear y caliéntelos durante 2-3 minutos. Sirva el pollo, los tacos, el yogur, la lechuga, el cilantro y las rodajas de lima en tazones separados, para que todos puedan preparar sus propios tacos."]','2026-01-11 13:05:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15034,5377,'es','Guiso especiado de pollo, espinacas y boniato','¡Una receta saludable con especias calientes, baja en grasas y calorías, 3 de tus 5 al día y también llena de fibra!','["3 batatas, cortadas en trozos","190g bolsa de espinacas","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","8 muslos de pollo, sin piel y deshuesados","500 ml de caldo de pollo","2 cebollas picadas","1 chile rojo, picado","1 cucharadita de pimentón","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","400 g de tomates en lata","2 limones en conserva, sin semillas y picados","semillas de calabaza, tostadas","2-3 limones en conserva, sin semillas y picados","4 pan naan, calentado"]','["Pon la batata en una cacerola grande y profunda a fuego alto. Cubrir con agua hirviendo y dejar hervir durante 10 minutos. Mientras tanto, poner todos los ingredientes de la pasta en un procesador de alimentos y licuar hasta que estén muy finamente picados. Reservar hasta que sea necesario.","Coloque las espinacas en un colador grande en el fregadero y vierta las batatas y el agua de cocción encima para escurrir las patatas y marchitar las espinacas al mismo tiempo. Dejar secar al vapor.","Regrese la cacerola al fuego (no es necesario lavarla primero), luego agregue el aceite, seguido de la pasta de especias. Fríe la pasta durante unos 5 minutos hasta que espese, luego agrega el pollo. Freír durante 8-10 minutos hasta que el pollo empiece a tomar color. Verter sobre el caldo, llevar a ebullición y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Verifique que el pollo esté cocido cortándolo en uno de los muslos y asegurándose de que esté completamente blanco sin signos de color rosado. Sazone con pimienta negra y luego agregue la batata. Dejar cocer a fuego lento 5 minutos más. Mientras tanto, pique las espinacas en trozos grandes y agréguelas al guiso. En este punto puedes dejar enfriar el guiso y congelarlo hasta por 3 meses, si lo deseas.","Esparza sobre las semillas de calabaza y los limones en conserva y sirva con pan naan caliente a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:05:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15035,5379,'es','pollo desmenuzado','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Rehaga una comida callejera favorita, la carne de cerdo desmenuzada, con muslos de pollo jugosos para reducir las calorías y obtener un relleno de taco saludable.','["8 muslos de pollo con hueso, sin piel, desechados y sin grandes trozos de grasa","2 cucharadas de pasta de chipotle","250ml en puré","75 g de salsa barbacoa","1 cebolla, picada","jugo de 3 limas, más gajos adicionales para servir (opcional)","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","Lata de 215g de frijoles refritos","1 aguacate pequeño, maduro, cortado en cubitos","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, solo las hojas","3 lechugas Baby Gem, ralladas","8-12 tacos, o arroz cocido, para servir"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Frote los muslos de pollo con 1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle y un poco de condimento. Mezcla el resto de la pasta de chipotle con la passata, la salsa barbacoa, 100ml de agua y la mitad de la cebolla. Vierta la salsa en una fuente para asar en la que quepa cómodamente el pollo en una sola capa y agregue los muslos de pollo. Cubra bien con papel aluminio y hornee por 1 hora, luego destape, suba el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y hornee por otros 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la cebolla restante con el jugo de limón y un poco de sal y reserve mientras se cocina el pollo. Mezclar todos los frijoles en una cacerola con 100ml de agua, listos para calentar para servir.","Cuando el pollo esté muy tierno, use dos tenedores para desmenuzar la carne en la salsa (deseche los huesos). Manténgalo cubierto con papel de aluminio mientras calienta los frijoles durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que estén bien calientes y no demasiado húmedos, y caliente los tacos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Agrega las hojas de aguacate y cilantro a la mezcla de lima y cebolla.","Sirva el pollo desmenuzado y los frijoles con lechuga rallada y tacos, o arroz y rodajas de limón para exprimir, si lo desea. Cubra con una cucharada de salsa de aguacate."]','2026-01-11 13:05:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15036,5381,'es','Risotto de pollo y cebada perlada','El pollo tierno y la saludable cebada perlada con un aderezo ligero de hierbas hacen de esta una excelente cena entre semana baja en calorías y grasas.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol","2 muslos de pollo, sin piel y con hueso","2 zanahorias, picadas","2 ramas de apio, picadas","1 cebolla, picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","140 g de cebada perlada","½ bolsa de 60 g de hojas frescas de rúcula","un puñado pequeño de menta, solo las hojas","un puñado pequeño de perejil de hoja plana","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharadita de alcaparras"]','["Calienta una cacerola grande a fuego medio-alto y agrega el aceite. Agrega el pollo y fríe durante 5 minutos o hasta que esté bien dorado por todos lados. Vierta las verduras y cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que comiencen a ablandarse. Añade el ajo y la cebada perlada y luego vierte 500 ml de agua. Tapar y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 25-30 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Mientras tanto, ponga todos los ingredientes del aderezo en el tazón pequeño de un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que estén finamente picados. Transfiera a un tazón y reserve hasta servir.","Cuando la cebada perlada esté suave, pero aún con un poco de mordisco, y la mayor parte del líquido haya sido absorbido, estará lista para servir. Sazona al gusto y divide el risotto en dos platos, añadiendo cucharadas del aderezo, para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15037,5383,'es','Ensalada peruana de pollo, aguacate y quinua','¿Estás harto de la ensalada de pasta? Esta alternativa sin gluten está repleta de proteínas magras del pollo y grasas saludables y beneficiosas para el corazón del aguacate.','["50 g de quinua cruda","100 g de maíz dulce congelado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","75 g de tomates cherry cortados en cuartos","paquete pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas picadas en trozos grandes","2 cebolletas, cortadas y cortadas finamente","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","½ chile rojo largo, finamente picado (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante)","1 aguacate maduro pero firme","200 g de pollo asado cocido, frío y sin piel, cortado en trozos grandes"]','["Llene una cacerola mediana hasta la mitad con agua y déjela hervir. Enjuague la quinua en un colador fino, luego agréguela al agua, revuelva bien y cocine a fuego lento durante 12 minutos o hasta que esté tierna.","Mientras se cocina la quinua, poner el maíz dulce en una sartén seca a fuego medio-alto. Cocine durante 5 minutos, volteando de vez en cuando, hasta que esté descongelado y ligeramente tostado. Dejar de lado.","Enjuague la quinua cocida en un colador con agua fría, luego presione con fuerza con una cuchara para servir para eliminar el exceso de agua.","Vierta la quinua en un bol y mezcle con el aceite de oliva, el maíz dulce, los tomates, el cilantro, las cebolletas, la ralladura de lima y la guindilla. Sazone bien con pimienta negra.","Cortar por la mitad y deshuesar el aguacate. Saque la pulpa con una cuchara grande de metal, córtela en rodajas y combínela con el jugo de lima. Agregue los trozos de pollo y el aguacate a la ensalada y mezcle suavemente antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15038,5385,'es','Pollo asado y raíces','Este plato de pollo asado, vibrante y rico en verduras, de una sola bandeja, proporciona cuatro de sus cinco comidas al día.','["1,6 kg de pollo entero","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza prensado en frío","4-5 ramitas de tomillo, hojas picadas en trozos grandes","500 g de calabaza, cortada en trozos","300 g de zanahorias cortadas en trozos","300 g de chirivías, peladas y cortadas en bastones largos","1 cebolla morada mediana, cortada en gajos finos","1 cabeza de ajo, dientes separados","100 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque el pollo en una fuente para asar grande. Retire cualquier elástico y vuelva a atar las patas del pollo con una cuerda, si lo desea. Frote el jugo de limón en el pollo, luego frote con 1 cucharada de aceite y espolvoree con tomillo y abundante condimento. Ase durante 25 minutos.","Mezcle la calabaza, las zanahorias, las chirivías y la cebolla en un bol con el aceite restante, la ralladura de limón y abundante pimienta negra molida, y mezcle bien.","Saca el pollo del horno y ponlo en un plato. Distribuya las verduras en la lata, coloque los dientes de ajo debajo y luego coloque el pollo encima. Regrese al horno por 45 minutos más, volteando las verduras después de 20 minutos hasta que el pollo esté cocido y las verduras tiernas y ligeramente doradas.","Saque el pollo y colóquelo en un plato caliente. Cubrir con papel aluminio y dejar reposar 10 minutos. Cuece las espinacas en un cazo con un chorrito de agua y sazona con pimienta negra. Esparce las verduras alrededor del pollo y sírvelo con las espinacas. Exprime el ajo de la piel y unta sobre el pollo, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15039,5387,'es','Pollo salteado con brócoli y arroz integral','Combine pollo magro con brócoli, jengibre y ajo súper saludables para una cena rápida y económica entre semana.','["200 g de floretes de brócoli recortados (unas 6), cortados por la mitad","1 pechuga de pollo (aproximadamente 180 g), cortada en cubitos","15 g de jengibre cortado en tiras","2 dientes de ajo, cortados en tiras","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas","1 pimiento rojo asado, de frasco, cortado en cubos","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","1 cucharada de salsa de soja reducida en sal","1 cucharada de miel","Paquete de 250 g de arroz integral cocido"]','["Pon la tetera a hervir y vierte el brócoli en una cacerola mediana lista para calentar. Vierta el agua sobre el brócoli y luego hiérvalo durante 4 minutos.","Calienta el aceite de oliva en un wok antiadherente y sofríe el jengibre, el ajo y la cebolla durante 2 minutos, añade la guindilla suave en polvo y revuelve brevemente. Agrega el pollo y sofríe durante 2 minutos más. Escurre el brócoli y reserva el agua. Vierta el brócoli en el wok con la soja, la miel, el pimiento rojo y 4 cucharadas de agua de brócoli y luego cocine hasta que esté completamente caliente. Mientras tanto, calienta el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y sirve con el sofrito."]','2026-01-11 13:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15040,5389,'es','Pollo a la granada con cuscús de almendras','Dale sabor a las pechugas de pollo con esta salsa afrutada y dulcemente especiada con semillas de granada, almendras tostadas y pasta de tajín.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","200 g de cuscús","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","1 cebolla morada grande, cortada por la mitad y en rodajas finas","600 g de mini filetes de pollo","4 cucharadas de pasta de especias tagine (disponible en Tesco o Marks & Spencer) o 2 cucharadas de harissa","Botella de 190 ml de zumo de granada (sin endulzar; nosotros utilizamos Pom Wonderful)","Paquete de 100 g de semillas de granada.","Paquete de 100g de almendras laminadas tostadas","paquete pequeño de menta, picada"]','["Hervir la tetera y calentar el aceite en una sartén grande. Pon el cuscús en un bol con un poco de condimento y desmenúzalo en la mitad de la pastilla de caldo. Agrega la cebolla a la sartén y sofríe durante unos minutos para que se ablande. Vierta agua hirviendo sobre el cuscús hasta cubrirlo, luego cubra el recipiente con un paño de cocina y reserve.","Empuje la cebolla a un lado de la sartén, agregue los filetes de pollo y dore por todos lados. Agregue la pasta de tajín o harissa y el jugo de granada, luego desmenuce el resto del cubo de caldo y sazone bien. Cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 10 minutos hasta que la salsa espese y el pollo esté bien cocido. Revuelva las semillas de granada y guarde algunas para esparcirlas antes de servir.","Después de 5 minutos, esponja el cuscús con un tenedor y revuelve con las almendras y la menta. Sirva el pollo sobre el cuscús con la salsa por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:05:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15041,5391,'es','Brochetas de fajitas de pollo a la parrilla','Haga que los niños vayan a la cocina a preparar esta receta fácil de pollo a la barbacoa y luego prepárelo con guacamole cremoso sobre tortillas','["2 limas, más gajos para servir","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente rallados","4 pechugas de pollo","3 pimientos de colores variados","1 cebolla morada","2 ripe avocados","1 lima","6 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","tortillas calientes, cilantro picado, crema agria o yogur, además de salsa picante para los mayores, para servir"]','["Haz la marinada. En un tazón grande, exprima ambas limas. Agrega el orégano, las especias, el aceite de oliva y el ajo y mezcla. Corte el pollo en dados, luego pídale a su hijo que lo revuelva con la marinada y reserve.","Prepara las verduras. Quitar las semillas de los pimientos y cortar la cebolla por la mitad es complicado, así que hazlo tú mismo. Los niños a partir de siete años pueden cortarlos en trozos con un cuchillo apto para niños.","Haz tus brochetas. Enhebre con cuidado trozos alternos de pollo, pimientos y cebolla en las brochetas. A los niños más pequeños puede resultarles un poco difícil, por lo que la mejor manera es pinchar los ingredientes y empujarlos hacia las brochetas. Cuando hayas agotado todos los ingredientes, reserva. Se puede preparar con varias horas de anticipación y enfriar hasta que esté listo para cocinar.","Prepara el guacamole. Deshuesar y pelar los aguacates, luego verterlos en un bol con los demás ingredientes. Haga que su hijo use un machacador de papas para triturar todo y verterlo en un plato para servir.","Cocina las brochetas. Calienta una parrilla o sartén. Cocine las brochetas durante 10 a 12 minutos, volteándolas, hasta que estén completamente cocidas. Un niño a partir de ocho años puede vigilar una plancha y girar las brochetas con unas pinzas. Sirva las brochetas sobre tortillas calientes con guacamole, crema agria, cilantro picado, rodajas de limón a un lado y salsa de chile para quienes gustan de un toque picante."]','2026-01-11 13:05:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15042,5393,'es','Ensalada de pollo Jerk con papaya','Dale a la ensalada de pollo un toque caribeño con especias Jerk, aguacate cremoso y papaya exótica.','["3-4 (según el tamaño) de achicoria roja","4 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, sin toda la grasa visible","3 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 lima, jugo de ½, el resto cortado en 2 gajos","1 cucharadita de mezcla de especias Jerk","2 cucharaditas de orégano fresco","2 cucharaditas de gelatina de grosella","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino tinto","1 papaya, partida por la mitad, sin semillas, pelada y picada","1 aguacate, sin hueso, pelado y picado","papas nuevas, para servir (opcional)"]','["La achicoria se compone de hojas adheridas a una base bastante sólida, así que siente dónde comienzan las hojas y córtalas. Cortar la base en rodajas gruesas y reservar.","Abre los muslos de pollo y ponlos en un bol con 1 cucharadita de aceite, el jugo de lima, el condimento Jerk y el orégano. Revuelva bien, luego cocine el pollo a la plancha durante 10 minutos, volteándolo una vez. Retirar la plancha, tapar con un plato y dejar reposar mientras asas rápidamente las rodajas de achicoria.","Mientras tanto, ponga la gelatina de grosella, el vinagre y el aceite restante en un bol grande y mezcle bien. Agrega la papaya y el aguacate, luego las hojas de achicoria, pero no mezcles todavía. Picar el pollo, añadirlo a la ensalada con la achicoria asada y mezclar bien. Apilar en platos, exprimir sobre la lima restante y servir mientras aún está caliente, con patatas nuevas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:05:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15043,5395,'es','Ensalada de pollo con aderezo de flor de saúco','Una ensalada verde británica con mucho sabor de rábanos crujientes, guisantes dulces, espárragos y lechuga Little Gem.','["manojo de espárragos (alrededor de 8 tallos), sin los extremos leñosos y desechados (o guárdelos para hacer sopa), cortados por la mitad a lo largo","Paquete de 200 g de guisantes dulces","140 g de guisantes frescos o congelados","1 pollo pequeño cocido, sin piel ni huesos, carne desmenuzada","250 g de rábanos (si puedes, utiliza colores y formas variadas), cortados en rodajas","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 lechuga grande y redonda y rizada o 2 Little Gems, partidas","un puñado de brotes de guisantes (opcional)","2 cucharadas de cordial de flor de saúco","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón grande","3 cucharadas de aceite de colza virgen extra"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola mediana con agua y llene un tazón grande con agua helada. Echa los espárragos en la sartén. Después de 1 minuto, agregue los dulces. Después de otros 30 segundos, agregue los guisantes. Cocine durante 30 segundos más, luego escurra y vierta las verduras en el agua helada; esto las enfriará rápidamente y ayudará a mantener su sabor y su color vibrante. Después de 1-2 minutos, escurre y reserva en el colador mientras preparas los demás ingredientes.","Seca tu tazón, vierte los ingredientes del aderezo con abundante condimento y bate. Agregue el pollo, los rábanos, la cebolla, las verduras enfriadas y escurridas y la lechuga, y mezcle todo suavemente hasta que esté bien cubierto con el aderezo; la forma más fácil es usar las manos. Apila la ensalada en un plato grande y espárcela sobre los brotes de guisantes, si los usas. Servir de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:05:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15044,5397,'es','Pollo aromático y especiado con sambal de plátano','Este plato picante de inspiración asiática está aromatizado con cilantro, comino, cúrcuma, almendras y cardamomo. Sirva con una refrescante ensalada picada.','["2 cebollas grandes, en cuartos","4 dientes de ajo","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","600 ml de caldo de pollo reducido en sal","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","4 vainas de cardamomo verde","1 chile rojo grande, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 cucharadas de almendras molidas","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","500 g de pechugas de pollo sin piel y en cubos","cilantro en paquete pequeño, picado","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","¼ de pepino, pelado, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","1 plátano pequeño, cortado en cubitos","ralladura y jugo de ½ lima","Paquete de 250 g de arroz basmati integral ya cocido"]','["Pon las cebollas en un procesador de alimentos con el ajo y el jengibre. Mezcle hasta que quede lo más suave posible, luego vierta la mitad del caldo y mezcle nuevamente.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente grande, espolvorea las especias y tuesta durante 1 min. Vierta la mezcla de cebolla, el caldo restante y todo menos ½ cucharadita de chile picado. Agrega las almendras y el puré de tomate y revuelve bien. Cocine a fuego lento durante 35 minutos hasta que esté completamente suave, revolviendo de vez en cuando y agregando un poco de agua si la mezcla comienza a atascarse en el fondo de la sartén.","Agrega el pollo y la mitad del cilantro fresco. Calienta muy suavemente durante 10 minutos para cocinar bien el pollo. Mezcla todos los ingredientes del sambal con el resto del cilantro y la guindilla y calienta el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Sirve el pollo y el sambal con el arroz integral."]','2026-01-11 13:05:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15045,5399,'es','hamburguesa de pollo Jerk','Condimente el pollo magro con un condimento picante de inspiración jamaicana, cocínelo a la plancha y sírvalo en un panecillo con mango, tomate, lechuga y salsa.','["2 pechugas de pollo sin piel","algunas ramitas de tomillo, hojas recogidas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de condimento Jerk","jugo 1 lima","2 panecillos grandes","½ mango pequeño, deshuesado, pelado y rebanado","1 tomate, rebanado","1 corazón de lechuga Little Gem, rallado","2 cucharadas de mayonesa y ketchup, para servir (opcional)"]','["Pon las pechugas de pollo en el medio.\r\ntrozos de film transparente y golpear con\r\nun rodillo para aplanar. Mezclar juntos el\r\ntomillo, aceite, condimento Jerk y la mitad del\r\nJugo de lima en un bol. Agrega el pollo y\r\ndejar marinar durante 5 minutos.","Calentar una sartén hasta que esté caliente y cocinar.\r\nel pollo durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado\r\no hasta que esté bien cocido. Quitar de\r\nel calor. Mientras tanto, tuesta los lados cortados.\r\nde los bollos durante 1-2 minutos.","Poner el pollo sobre los panecillos y cubrir.\r\ncon el mango, el tomate y un puñado de\r\nlechuga. Exprimir sobre el resto de la lima.\r\ny cubra con mayonesa y ketchup, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:05:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15046,5401,'es','Sopa de pollo, maíz dulce y fideos','Este tazón súper saludable se puede preparar con anticipación y congelar, listo para descongelar y usar cuando más lo necesite.','["2 zanahorias grandes, picadas","2 puerros grandes, recortados y finamente cortados","2 mazorcas de maíz, los granos de maíz cortados","200 g de fideos fideos","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","2 cebollas, en cuartos","1 puerro, cortado en trozos","2 zanahorias, en rodajas gruesas","2 hojas de laurel","6 granos de pimienta negra","tallos de perejil","4 ramas de apio, picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de caldo de verduras o 1 pastilla de caldo de verduras","1,3 kilos de pollo"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes del caldo y el pollo en una cacerola muy grande, luego cubre todo con unos 3 litros de agua fría. Deje hervir, luego baje a fuego lento y cocine durante 1 hora a 1½ horas, hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Quite la espuma cada 20 minutos aproximadamente. Retire el pollo a un plato para que se enfríe. Colar el caldo por un colador, quitando la mayor cantidad de grasa posible.","Enjuague la sartén y vuelva a poner el caldo, luego cocine a fuego alto hasta que se reduzca un poco; necesita unos 2 litros en total. Añade las zanahorias y los puerros y cocina a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, desmenuza la carne del pollo, desechando la piel y los huesos. Agrega a la sartén con el maíz dulce. Agregue los fideos, a menos que desee congelar la sopa, y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 7 minutos más, hasta que el maíz y la pasta estén cocidos. Sirva en tazones y espolvoree con perejil. Para congelar, deje que la sopa se enfríe por completo antes de congelarla (consulte el consejo) y, cuando esté listo para comer, deje que la sopa se descongele antes de volver a hervir a fuego lento en una sartén. Agregue los fideos y cocine a fuego lento hasta que estén cocidos."]','2026-01-11 13:05:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15047,5403,'es','Ensalada crujiente de pollo y manzana','El pollo empanizado no tiene por qué ser grasoso: esta versión horneada con acompañamientos vegetales es apta para dietas','["½ repollo blanco, rallado","½ cebolla pequeña, finamente cortada","4 ramas de apio, en rodajas","2 manzanas Granny Smith, cortadas en cuartos, sin corazón y en rodajas finas","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","200 g de yogur griego sin grasa en bote","2 pechugas de pollo cocidas, en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de harina común","1 huevo batido","100 g de pan rallado seco con ajo y hierbas","4 mazorcas de maíz congeladas","salsa barbacoa, para servir"]','["Mezcle los ingredientes de la ensalada junto con\r\nun poco de condimento, luego reserve. esto\r\nse puede hacer hasta con un día de anticipación y\r\nenfriado. Lleve una cacerola grande con agua a la\r\nhervir, luego cocinar las mazorcas de maíz durante 8-10\r\nminutos hasta que estén tiernos y bien cocidos.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Vierta la harina,\r\nhuevo y pan rallado\r\nplatos separados. Sumerge el pollo en\r\nla harina, luego el huevo, luego rebozar con el\r\nmigas de pan. Coloque el pollo sobre una\r\nbandeja para hornear y asar durante 2 minutos en cada una\r\nlado o hasta que estén crujientes y bien cocidos.\r\nSirve el pollo crujiente con la ensalada.\r\ny mazorcas de maíz, y un plato de barbacoa\r\nsalsa para mojar a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:05:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15048,5405,'es','pollo tandoori','Este pollo al curry bajo en grasa está lleno de sabor. Se cocina rápido y la marinada hace todo el trabajo. ¿Quién necesita comida para llevar?','["jugo 2 limones","4 cucharaditas de pimentón","2 cebollas rojas, finamente picadas","16 muslos de pollo sin piel","aceite vegetal, para cepillar","300 ml de yogur griego","jengibre en trozos grandes, rallado","4 dientes de ajo machacados","¾ cucharadita de garam masala","¾ cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma"]','["Mezclar el jugo de limón con el pimentón.\r\ny cebollas moradas en un plato grande y poco profundo.\r\nCorta cada muslo de pollo tres veces,\r\nluego voltearlos en el jugo y dejarlos listos.\r\na un lado durante 10 minutos.","Mezclar todos los ingredientes de la marinada.\r\njuntos y verter sobre el pollo.\r\nMezcla bien todo y luego tapa.\r\ny enfriar durante al menos 1 hora. esto puede ser\r\nhecho hasta con un día de anticipación.","Calienta la parrilla. Levanta los trozos de pollo\r\nsobre una rejilla sobre una bandeja para hornear. cepillo\r\nsobre un poco de aceite y gratinar durante 8 minutos\r\ncada lado o hasta que estén ligeramente carbonizados y\r\ncompletamente cocido."]','2026-01-11 13:05:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15049,5407,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: pastel de pollo','Angela Nilsen reinventa una receta clásica para hacer del pastel de pollo una opción saludable para ti','["450 ml de caldo de pollo, en cubos (yo uso Kallo, orgánico)","100 ml de vino blanco","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","3 ramitas de tomillo","1 ramita de estragón, más 1 cucharada de hojas de estragón picadas","225 g de zanahorias, cortadas en bastones","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel, 500 g/1 lb 2 oz de peso total","225 g de puerros cortados en rodajas","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz, mezclada con 2 cucharadas de agua","3 cucharadas de crema fresca","1 cucharadita colmada de mostaza Dijon","1 cucharada colmada de perejil de hoja plana o rizado picado","70 g de masa filo (yo usé tres láminas de 39 x 30 cm)","1 cucharada de aceite de colza"]','["Vierta el caldo y el vino en una fuente grande,\r\nsartén ancha. Agrega el ajo, el tomillo,\r\nramita de estragón y zanahorias, llevar a la\r\nhervir, luego bajar el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante\r\n3 minutos. Poner el pollo en el caldo, triturar.\r\nsobre un poco de pimienta, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante\r\n5 minutos. Distribuir las rodajas de puerro sobre\r\npollo, tapar nuevamente y cocinar a fuego lento\r\ndurante 10 minutos más, para que los puerros se cocinen\r\nmientras se cocina el pollo. Quitar de\r\nel fuego y dejar reposar el pollo en el\r\ncaldo durante unos 15 minutos, para que se mantenga\r\nhúmedo mientras se enfría un poco.","Cuela el caldo en una jarra; deberías\r\ndisponer de 500ml (si no, completar con agua).\r\nVierta el pollo y las verduras en un recipiente de 1,5 litro.\r\nmolde para pastel y deseche las ramitas de hierbas. verter\r\nel caldo nuevamente en la sartén, luego\r\nvierta lentamente la mezcla de harina de maíz. Regresar\r\nla sartén al fuego y llevar a la\r\nhervir, revolviendo constantemente, hasta que espese.\r\nRetirar del fuego y agregar el\r\ncrème fraîche, mostaza, picada\r\nestragón y perejil. Sazone con pimienta.\r\nCalentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Rasga o corta el pollo en trozos\r\njirones. Vierte la salsa sobre el pollo.\r\nmezcla, luego revuelva todo junto.","Corta cada hoja de filo en 4 cuadrados.\r\no rectángulos. Colóquelos encima de\r\nel relleno, pincelando cada hoja con\r\nun poco de aceite a medida que avanza. ligeramente\r\naprieta el filo para que no mienta\r\ncompletamente plano y meta los bordes en\r\nlos lados del plato, o colóquelos en el\r\nbordes si el plato tiene borde. Moler sobre un\r\nun poco de pimienta, colocar la fuente sobre una bandeja para hornear\r\nluego hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que\r\nla masa está dorada y la salsa\r\nburbujeante. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15050,5409,'es','Pollo de adentro hacia afuera Kiev','Una receta rápida, fácil y baja en grasas con sólo 3 ingredientes','["4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel","25 g de mantequilla de ajo, blanda","25 g de pan rallado crujiente"]','["Coloque el pollo en una bandeja para horno, frótelo con un poco de mantequilla, sazone y cocine bajo la parrilla durante 15 minutos, volteándolo una vez hasta que esté bien cocido.","Mezcle el resto de la mantequilla de ajo y el pan rallado. Retire el pollo de la parrilla y cubra cada pechuga con un poco de mantequilla pan rallada. Regrese a la parrilla y cocine de 3 a 5 minutos hasta que el pan rallado esté dorado y la mantequilla derretida. Sirva los jugos mantecosos, junto con papas nuevas y guisantes o habas."]','2026-01-11 13:05:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15051,5411,'es','pollo chipotle','Mantenga un frasco de pasta de chile chipotle ahumado en su alacena para darle un toque especial a un guiso de pollo saludable.','["1 cebolla, picada","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1-2 cucharadas de pasta de chipotle (ver consejo a continuación)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de vinagre de sidra","8 filetes de muslo de pollo sin piel","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","crema agria y arroz, para servir"]','["Freír la cebolla y el ajo en el aceite en una\r\nsartén profunda y ancha hasta que esté suave. Añade el\r\npasta de chipotle (use 1 cucharada para obtener una textura suave)\r\nsabor y 2 cucharadas para un sabor más picante y fuerte.\r\nuno). Revuelva y cocine por 1 min, luego agregue\r\nlos tomates y el vinagre de sidra. traer a\r\nhervir a fuego lento y cocinar durante 10 minutos con el\r\ntapa hasta la mitad. Revuelva para asegurarse de que no se\r\ndemasiado seco.","Agregue el pollo y cocine por\r\n10 minutos o hasta que esté bien cocido, volteando\r\nuna vez. Espolvorear con cilantro y servir.\r\ncon arroz y crema agria."]','2026-01-11 13:05:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15052,5413,'es','Jambalaya de pollo y chorizo','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una receta de olla de arroz de inspiración cajún con salchicha española picante, pimientos dulces y tomates.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 pechugas de pollo, picadas","1 cebolla, picada","1 pimiento rojo, en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","75 g de chorizo, en rodajas","1 cucharada de condimento cajún","250 g de arroz de grano largo","Lata de 400g de tomates pera","350 ml de caldo de pollo"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande con\r\nTapar y dorar el pollo durante 5-8 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté dorado. Retirar y reservar.\r\nAgregue la cebolla y cocine por 3-4 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté suave. Luego agregue la pimienta, el ajo,\r\nchorizo y condimento cajún y cocinar\r\ndurante 5 minutos más.","Revuelva el pollo con el arroz, agregue\r\nlos tomates y el caldo. Cubra y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 20-25 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno."]','2026-01-11 13:05:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15053,5415,'es','Guiso picante de pollo y frijoles','Esta abundante y satisfactoria receta en una sola olla es baja en grasas y fácil de lavar.','["1¼ kg de muslos y muslos de pollo (peso aproximado, utilizamos un paquete mixto de 1,23 kg)","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, rebanadas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y picados","250 g de pimientos congelados y descongelados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 420 g de frijoles en salsa de chile","2 latas de 400 g de alubias, escurridas","400 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","150 ml de crema agria y pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Quitarle la piel al pollo\r\ny descartar. Calentar el aceite en una olla grande\r\ncazuela, dorar el pollo\r\npor todas partes, luego retírela con una ranura\r\ncuchara. Agregue las cebollas, el ajo y\r\nchiles, luego fríelos durante 5 minutos hasta que\r\ncomenzando a ablandarse y dorarse.","Añade los pimientos, los tomates,\r\nfrijoles y caldo caliente. Pon el\r\npollo encima, tapando hasta la mitad\r\ncon una tapa de sartén y cocine por 50 minutos,\r\nhasta que el pollo esté cocido\r\ncompleto y tierno.","Revuelva con el cilantro y\r\nservir con crema agria y\r\npan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15054,5417,'es','Sopa mexicana de pollo y arroz salvaje','Un plato que añade un factor de bienestar: esta sopa llena de vitamina C es el estimulante ideal para después del trabajo.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 pimiento verde, cortado en cubitos","200 g de maíz dulce, congelado o en lata","1-2 cucharadas de pasta de chipotle (usamos Discovery)","Bolsa de 250 g de mezcla de arroz salvaje y de grano largo ya preparada (nosotros usamos la del tío Ben)","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros en agua, enjuagados y escurridos","1,3 l de caldo de pollo bajo en sodio","2 pechugas de pollo cocidas y sin piel, desmenuzadas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","crema agria baja en grasa y guacamole reducido en grasa, para servir, si lo desea"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande y cocina la cebolla durante 5 minutos. Eche el pimiento y cocine por 2 minutos más, luego agregue el maíz dulce, la pasta de chipotle y el arroz. Revuelva bien y cocine durante 1-2 minutos.","Agrega los frijoles negros y el caldo. Llevar a ebullición, bajar a fuego lento y luego agregar la mitad del pollo y el cilantro. Deje enfriar durante 2-3 minutos y luego sirva en tazones.","Esparcir por encima el resto del pollo y el cilantro. Sirva con una cucharada de guacamole y crema agria encima si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:05:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15055,5419,'es','Pollo harissa con ensalada de garbanzos','Una cena baja en grasas y rica en fibra con un acompañamiento súper saludable: ideal para mitad de semana','["250 g de tomates cherry en canastilla, cortados por la mitad","½ cebolla morada pequeña, picada","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","jugo 1 limon","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas por la mitad a lo largo por la mitad","1 cucharada de harissa","yogur natural descremado y pan pita integral, para acompañar"]','["Mezcle los tomates, la cebolla y los garbanzos, agregue el perejil y el jugo de limón y sazone.","Cubra el pollo con la harissa. Calentar una plancha o sartén o barbacoa. Cocine el pollo durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté ligeramente carbonizado y bien cocido.","Divida la ensalada en 2 platos, cubra con el pollo harissa y sirva con una cucharada de yogur y pan pita caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15056,5421,'es','chile pavo','Logre los cinco de sus cinco al día con este chile de pavo. Lleno de ingredientes saludables y especias saludables, no te equivocarás con un plato para la cena.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","500 g de muslo de pavo picado (7% de grasa)","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","1 chile, sin semillas y picado","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","500 g de puré de cartón","2 latas de 400 g de judías rojas escurridas (reservando el líquido)","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","4 batatas pequeñas (de unos 140 g cada una)","2 aguacates","1 lima, exprimida"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio, luego vierte la carne picada y desmenúzala con una cuchara de madera. Agregue el ajo y la guindilla y cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que la carne esté bien cocida. Agregue las hierbas y especias y cocine por un minuto más.","Vierta la passata, el líquido reservado de los frijoles, el caldo en polvo y los pimientos. Tape y cocine durante 15-20 minutos hasta que espese un poco. Vierta los frijoles y cocine por 3-5 minutos más.","Mientras tanto, pinche dos batatas por todas partes con un tenedor y luego cocínelas en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 7 a 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Triture uno de los aguacates con la mitad del jugo de lima en un tazón pequeño.","Para servir, corte las papas por la mitad y vierta sobre la mitad del chile, luego termine con el puré de aguacate. Enfríe el resto para otro día. El chile se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado durante cuatro días o congelado durante tres meses. Vuelva a calentar en un microondas o sartén a fuego lento hasta que esté bien caliente. Sirva con las batatas restantes, puré de aguacate y jugo de lima, como se describe arriba."]','2026-01-11 13:05:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15057,5423,'es','Brochetas de cerdo y piña sazonadas con Jerk, frijoles negros y arroz','Prepare estos saludables kebabs en una plancha o en la barbacoa: están llenos de especias criollas y son una delicia magra.','["400 g de filete de cerdo, cortado en trozos de 4 cm","2 cucharadas de condimento Jerk o Criollo","1 cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica molida","1 cucharada de salsa de chile picante, más un poco más para servir (opcional)","3 limas, ralladura y jugo de 1, otras 2 cortadas en gajos para servir","½ piña pequeña, pelada, sin corazón y cortada en trozos de 4 cm","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","200 g de arroz basmati","Lata de 400 g de frijol negro, escurrido y enjuagado"]','["Mezcle la carne de cerdo, el condimento Jerk, la pimienta de Jamaica, la salsa de chile, si la usa, la ralladura y el jugo de lima y un poco de condimento. Ensarte la carne de cerdo y la piña en brochetas de metal (o brochetas de madera previamente remojadas) y unte con aceite.","Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir bien y volver a poner en la cacerola con los frijoles, remover y mantener caliente.","Mientras tanto, caliente una sartén hasta que esté muy caliente. Cocine las brochetas durante 3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén bien carbonizadas y la carne de cerdo esté bien cocida. Sirva las brochetas con los frijoles y el arroz, salsa de chile extra, si lo desea, y rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15058,5425,'es','Biryani fragante con bacalao al cilantro','Prueba este delicioso biryani servido con filetes de bacalao. El pescado blanco es una excelente proteína magra, lo que lo convierte en un plato saludable bajo en calorías y grasas.','["2 cebollas grandes (320 g), partidas por la mitad y en rodajas","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","25 g de jengibre, pelado y cortado en palitos finos","1-2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y rebanados","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","250 g de arroz basmati integral","1½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de canela molida o media rama de canela","3 vainas de cardamomo, sin semillas y molidas","320 g de espinacas tiernas","Bote de 120g de yogur natural bio","150 g de guisantes congelados","15 g de cilantro y un poco más para servir","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","4 lomos de bacalao en trozos (560g)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner la cebolla, el aceite y el jengibre en una sartén a fuego medio. Agregue 100 ml de agua, cubra, lleve a fuego lento y cocine durante 10 minutos. Retire la tapa, agregue los chiles y 1 cucharadita de caldo, luego cocine por 10 minutos más; el agua debe evaporarse.","Mientras tanto, vierta el arroz en una cacerola, cubra con 500 ml de agua fría y agregue 1 cucharadita de semillas de comino, la canela, el cardamomo molido y la 1 cucharadita de caldo restante. Llevar a ebullición, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 20-25 minutos hasta que el arroz esté cocido y se absorba el agua.","Vierta la mezcla de cebolla en un bol y reserve. Coloque las espinacas en la sartén con la ½ cucharadita de semillas de comino restante y cocine hasta que las espinacas se ablanden. Vierta 1 cucharada de la mezcla de cebolla en un bol con 1 cucharada de yogur y reserve. Vierta la mitad del arroz cocido en una fuente para horno que tenga tapa. Cubra con las espinacas marchitas y luego la mitad de la mezcla de cebolla restante. Luego, agregue los guisantes al arroz restante, luego extiéndalo en una capa, seguido por el resto de la mezcla de cebolla y luego el resto del yogur. Cubra y hornee por 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, agregue el cilantro a la mezcla de cebolla y yogur que reservó en el paso 3 junto con el jugo de limón y 1 cucharada de agua. Bate hasta que quede suave con una batidora de mano y luego úsala para cubrir el bacalao. Después de que el biryani se haya cocinado durante 15 minutos, coloque el bacalao encima junto con la marinada. Cubra y hornee por otros 15-18 minutos hasta que el pescado se desmenuce. Sirva la mitad cubierta con más cilantro y enfríe el resto para otro día. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días. Vuelva a calentar en el microondas hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:05:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15059,5429,'es','Cena de pollo piri piri en una sartén','Pruebe este pollo piri piri en una sartén para una cena familiar y ajuste los niveles de chile para adaptarlos a la tolerancia de su familia. Puedes usar un pollo entero en su lugar, si quieres.','["1 kg de muslos y muslos de pollo con hueso (cantidades iguales de cada uno ahorran argumentos)","500 g de patatas baby, en rodajas gruesas","2 pimientos (1 rojo, 1 amarillo), en rodajas gruesas","200 g de tomates cherry","un puñado de hojas de cilantro picadas","mazorcas de maíz con mantequilla, para servir","1½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","25 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 lima, rallada y en jugo","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile seco (use menos si prefiere menos picante)","2 dientes de ajo, picados","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","½ manojo de orégano fresco, con hojas picadas o 1 cucharada de orégano seco","1 chile rojo (opcional), sin semillas y picado","1 cucharada de vino tinto o oporto (opcional)"]','["Machaca todos los ingredientes de la marinada junto con 1 cucharadita de sal usando un mortero grande, o tritura en una mini picadora para crear una pasta suelta. Corte cada trozo de pollo varias veces, luego viértalo en un tazón y cúbralo con la marinada. Cubra y enfríe durante al menos 1 hora o hasta 24 horas.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Vierta el pollo junto con la marinada y las patatas en una fuente para asar. Mezcle y luego coloque el pollo encima de las papas, con los muslos con la piel hacia arriba. Ase durante 35-40 minutos hasta que el pollo se dore.","Retirar el molde del horno y mezclar los pimientos con las patatas, rociar el pollo con un poco del jugo del molde y dar la vuelta a los muslos. Coloque los tomates cherry entre el pollo y ase durante otros 20-25 minutos hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido, la piel crujiente y las verduras bien asadas. Espolvoree con cilantro y un poco de sal marina en escamas, si lo desea, y sirva directamente de la lata con el maíz untado con mantequilla a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:05:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15060,5431,'es','Ñoquis de boniato con salsa de tomate','Prueba estos sabrosos ñoquis elaborados tanto con batata como con patatas blancas. Las batatas cuentan para tus cinco al día, al igual que la salsa de tomate que las acompaña.','["350 g de batatas","4 patatas asadas (950g)","200 g de harina de espelta integral, más un poco si es necesario","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","1-2 chiles frescos, sin semillas y finamente picados","600 g de tomates grandes maduros, finamente picados","15 g de albahaca, medio picada","50 g de queso duro vegetariano estilo italiano finamente rallado"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque ambos tipos de patatas en una bandeja para hornear, pínchelas con un tenedor y hornee durante 50-60 minutos hasta que un cuchillo se deslice fácilmente en ellas. Corta todas las patatas por la mitad para permitir que escape el exceso de vapor mientras se enfrían.","Mientras tanto, haz la salsa. Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y fríe el ajo y las guindillas hasta que se ablanden. Agregue los tomates, agregue la mitad de la albahaca picada, luego cubra y deje cocinar a fuego lento durante 20-30 minutos para hacer una salsa espesa.","Cuando las papas horneadas estén lo suficientemente frías como para manipularlas, pélelas con cuidado y deseche la piel, luego tritúrelas bien hasta que quede suave. Agrega la harina, luego amasa brevemente con las manos para crear una masa, agregando un poco más de harina si la mezcla está pegajosa.","Corta la masa por la mitad, luego envuelve la mitad y guárdala en el refrigerador por un día más. Se mantendrá fría hasta por tres días. Corta la masa restante en cuartos, luego enrolla cada pieza en una salchicha de unos 28 cm de largo y córtala en trozos del tamaño de un bocado. Presione ligeramente con el dorso de un tenedor para crear crestas, si lo desea, luego reserve, espaciadas.","Hierva una cacerola grande con agua, luego agregue los ñoquis y cocine durante 2 a 4 minutos hasta que suban a la superficie, luego sáquelos con una espumadera. No dejes que se cocinen demasiado o se desmoronarán. Mezcle con la mitad de la salsa de tomate, corte la mitad de la albahaca restante y esparza sobre la mitad del queso. El resto se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. Prepare el resto de los ñoquis como se describe en el paso 4, luego vuelva a calentarlos en la salsa y sirva como se indicó anteriormente con la albahaca y el queso restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:05:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15061,5433,'es','Hamburguesas de coliflor y mayonesa al curry','Pruebe estas hamburguesas vegetarianas en su próxima barbacoa: contienen dos de las cinco al día y un toque de curry picante.','["1 coliflor pequeña","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo mediano","2 tomates grandes, finamente picados","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","½ manojo de cilantro, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de mayonesa","3 cucharadas de yogur griego","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry","4 panes de hamburguesa","2 puñados de mezcla de bombay (opcional)"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Quita las hojas de la coliflor y corta la base, luego córtala en filetes de 2 cm de grosor. Mezclar el aceite con el curry en polvo. Coloque los filetes de coliflor en una bandeja para hornear plana forrada con papel de aluminio. Unte cada uno generosamente con aceite de curry por ambos lados y espolvoree con sal antes de asarlos durante 25 a 30 minutos hasta que estén tiernos.","En un bol mezcla los tomates, la cebolla, el cilantro y una pizca de sal. En un segundo bol mezcle la mayonesa, el yogur y la pasta de curry.","Tuesta los panecillos con el lado cortado hacia abajo en una sartén seca. Cubra cada panecillo con una cucharada de mayonesa al curry, el filete de coliflor, un poco más de mayonesa al curry, la mezcla de tomate y cebolla y un poco de mezcla de bombay, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:05:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15062,5435,'es','Batatas asadas al horno','Prepare batatas perfectamente asadas, esponjosas por dentro y ligeramente doradas en los bordes para obtener una guarnición colorida. Agregue algunas cebollas moradas en rodajas a la fuente para asar, si lo desea.','["4 batatas (aproximadamente 1,2 kg), peladas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","cebollas moradas en rodajas, dientes de ajo sin pelar, ramitas de tomillo u otras verduras o hierbas de su elección (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 230C/210C ventilador/gas 8. Picar las batatas en cubos de 2-3 cm.","Vierta en una fuente para asar grande y poco profunda, rocíe con aceite y sazone con sal y pimienta. Si agrega verduras o hierbas adicionales, como cebollas moradas en rodajas, dientes de ajo y tomillo, inclúyalas también. Mezcle todo para cubrirlo con el aceite y luego ase durante 20 minutos. Mezcle nuevamente para asegurarse de que las papas se cocinen uniformemente y ase durante otros 15 a 20 minutos hasta que las papas estén ligeramente doradas por fuera y tiernas al pincharlas con un tenedor o cuchillo."]','2026-01-11 13:05:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15063,5437,'es','Pasta cremosa de champiñones y espinacas','Mezcle tallarines, champiñones y espinacas en una salsa de parmesano y crema fresca para preparar una cena rápida y baja en calorías que solo toma 25 minutos.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","150 g de champiñones cortados por la mitad","150 g de tallarines","2 dientes de ajo machacados","200 g de crema fresca baja en grasas","15 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado","120 g de espinacas tiernas","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla y los champiñones durante 10 minutos, o hasta que se ablanden y se doren ligeramente. Mientras tanto, cocina la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Agrega el ajo a la sartén con los champiñones y cocina por 2 minutos más. Agregue la crema fresca y el parmesano, revuelva para combinar y luego agregue las espinacas tiernas. Dejar de lado.","Retirar la pasta del fuego y escurrir reservando 25ml de agua. Mezcle la pasta con la salsa cremosa de champiñones, vuelva a ponerla al fuego y cocine a fuego lento hasta que las espinacas se ablanden, aproximadamente 5 minutos. Vierta suficiente agua reservada para que se afloje un poco. Sazone con pimienta negra y termine con una pizca de hojuelas de chile, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:05:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15064,5439,'es','Arroz al horno paneer con hierbas','Mezcle arroz basmati, paneer, tirabeques y guisantes para preparar esta cena vegetariana rápida y fácil para dos. Es una excelente opción para las noches ocupadas','["150 g de arroz basmati","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","400 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","½ paquete pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","65 g de paneer, cortado en cubos de 1½ cm","100 g de tirabeques, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","100 g de guisantes congelados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta el arroz y el aceite de colza en una cacerola mediana (alrededor de 25 x 20 cm), sazone y mezcle para cubrir el arroz con el aceite. Agrega el caldo, la mayor parte del perejil, la mayor parte de la ralladura de limón y todo el jugo, revuelve y sazona.","Coloque los cubos de paneer por toda la parte superior del arroz y hornee durante 20 minutos hasta que el arroz esté casi cocido y el paneer comience a dorarse por encima. Mezcle los tirabeques y los guisantes, luego vuelva a colocarlos en el horno durante 5 a 7 minutos hasta que las verduras estén cocidas pero aún de color brillante. Espolvorea sobre el perejil reservado y la ralladura de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:05:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15065,5443,'es','Rábanos con queso feta batido con hierbas','Sirva esta cremosa salsa de queso feta batida como plato para compartir. Rocíe un poco de aceite de oliva y sirva con rábanos para mojar junto con zanahorias y pepino.','["130 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","150 g de yogur espeso estilo griego","½ limón, rallado","¼ manojo de eneldo","¼ manojo de albahaca","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un poco más para rociar","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharadita de za''atar o hojuelas de chile","1 manojo de rábanos (ver consejo a continuación)"]','["Coloque el queso feta, el yogur, la ralladura de limón, las hierbas y el aceite en un procesador de alimentos o licuadora de alta velocidad y presione hasta que la mezcla tenga una textura cremosa y suave. Vierta en un tazón para servir poco profundo y reserve.","Tuesta suavemente las semillas de cilantro en una sartén seca a fuego medio bajo durante unos minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Esparce las semillas sobre la salsa, junto con el za''atar o las hojuelas de chile. Rocíe un poco de aceite de oliva y sirva con los rábanos para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:05:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15066,5447,'es','Salmón frito con Little Gem estofado','Si buscas una cena de pescado rápida y saludable, prueba este salmón frito con verduras y una salsa cremosa ligera. Se tarda menos de 15 minutos en hacerlo.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","4 lechugas Little Gem, cortadas por la mitad a lo largo","200 ml de caldo de verduras","4 filetes de salmón de 130 g","200 g de guisantes frescos o congelados (descongelados si están congelados)","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado","1 cucharada de crema fresca media grasa","1 tsp Dijon mustard"]','["Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén grande con tapa a fuego medio. Coloque las mitades de lechuga en la sartén, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, y fríalas durante 2 minutos hasta que comiencen a dorarse. Vierta el caldo, cubra con la tapa y cocine por 6 minutos.","Mientras tanto, sazona el salmón con una buena pizca de sal y pimienta por ambos lados de los filetes. Calienta el aceite restante en una segunda sartén a fuego medio y fríe el salmón, con la piel hacia abajo, durante 3 minutos. Voltee con cuidado usando una rodaja de pescado y cocine por 3 minutos más hasta que esté bien cocido y la carne se desmenuce fácilmente.","Vierta los guisantes y el eneldo en la sartén con la lechuga y cocine durante 2 minutos, tapado, hasta que la lechuga esté tierna pero aún conserve su estructura. Coloque los filetes de salmón y las mitades de lechuga en platos para servir.","Agrega la crema fresca y la mostaza a la lechuga y cocina a fuego lento para que se caliente. Vierta la salsa y los guisantes sobre la lechuga y el salmón."]','2026-01-11 13:05:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15067,5449,'es','Carré de cordero asado en una sartén y patatas con aceitunas verdes','Sirva una comida sencilla y romántica para dos con nuestro costillar de cordero asado. Hemos añadido aceitunas y anchoas, pero omítalas si quieres que sea aún más sencillo.','["1 costillar de cordero (6 huesos es ideal)","25 g de mantequilla","1 cebolla, finamente cortada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 anchoa, triturada con un mortero (opcional)","un pequeño puñado de ramitas de romero, picadas en trozos grandes","500 g de patatas Maris Piper o King Edward, finamente cortadas (use una mandolina si tiene una)","10 aceitunas verdes deshuesadas, picadas","100 ml de caldo de pollo o cordero"]','["Calentar el horno a 210C/190C ventilador/gas 7. Sazonar generosamente todo el cordero y calentar la mantequilla en una sartén grande apta para horno a fuego medio. Dorar todo el cordero durante 10-15 minutos, especialmente el lado graso. Retirar y reservar en un plato.","Vuelva a poner la sartén al fuego y fría la cebolla durante 5-7 minutos hasta que se ablande, luego agregue el ajo, la anchoa (si se usa) y el romero, y fría durante 2 minutos más. Coloque con cuidado las patatas en la sartén con las aceitunas, sazone, luego déles la vuelta para que queden completamente cubiertas con la mezcla y luego extiéndalas en una capa uniforme. Vierta sobre el caldo y luego póngalo en el horno durante 30 minutos hasta que las patatas empiecen a estar crujientes en los bordes.","Coloque el cordero encima de las patatas, con la grasa hacia arriba, y rocíe con el jugo del plato. Vuelva a colocar la sartén en el horno durante 20 minutos para el cordero poco cocido, 25 minutos para el cordero rosado pero bien cocido y 30 minutos para el cordero bien cocido. Cuando el cordero esté cocido a su gusto, levántelo sobre una tabla para trinchar y déjelo reposar durante 10 minutos. Durante este tiempo, vuelve a meter las patatas en el horno para que queden más crujientes. Corta el cordero en chuletas y sírvelo con las patatas, el cavolo nero y el aderezo de perejil y alcaparras (ver \"combina bien\", más abajo)."]','2026-01-11 13:05:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15068,5451,'es','Calabaza con orzo, ajo asado y salsa feta','Disfrute de gajos de calabaza asados ​​servidos con orzo y salsa de ajo asado, limón y queso feta. Llena de sabor, es una excelente cena vegetariana para dos.','["1 cabeza de ajo","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 calabaza mediana (unos 800 g), pelada, cortada por la mitad y cortada en trozos de 2-3 cm","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","200 g de cebada","1 puerro grande, cortado por la mitad a lo largo y en rodajas finas","½ cucharada de mantequilla sin sal","1 limón en conserva, finamente picado","150 ml de caldo de pollo o verduras","1 manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, finamente picado","200g feta","3½ cucharadas de yogur","½ limón, exprimido"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Retire las capas exteriores del bulbo de ajo y corte el extremo de la raíz, teniendo cuidado de no cortar demasiado los dientes. Colóquelo en una hoja pequeña de papel de aluminio, rocíelo con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva y espolvoree con una pizca de sal. Triture para encerrar el ajo en el papel de aluminio y hornee por 45 minutos. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar aún envuelto en papel de aluminio.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la calabaza con 2 cucharadas de aceite, el pimentón y un poco de condimento. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear y ase durante 30-40 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad, hasta que la calabaza esté tierna y tenga algo de color.","Para la salsa, combine el queso feta, el yogur, el jugo de limón y 4 dientes de ajo asados ​​(exprimiendo la pulpa de la piel) para crear una pasta suave. Debe quedar espeso pero que se pueda verter; agregue hasta 2 cucharadas de agua para aflojarlo si es necesario. Dejar de lado.","Cocine el orzo en una cacerola con agua con sal a fuego medio durante 4-5 minutos hasta que esté cocido pero aún tenga sabor. Escurrir, reservar una taza de agua de orzo y enfriar en un colador bajo agua corriente fría.","Cocine el puerro con 1 cucharada de aceite y la mantequilla a fuego medio en una sartén grande, revolviendo regularmente, durante 5 minutos. Agregue el limón en conserva y la pulpa de 3 dientes de ajo asados, luego tritúrelos bien. Una vez que los puerros estén traslúcidos, vierta el orzo cocido, el caldo y un chorrito de agua de cocción de la pasta. Revuelva durante un minuto para calentar el orzo. Incorpora la mitad del perejil.","Coloque el orzo y los puerros en platos, cubra con la calabaza y rocíe sobre la salsa feta. Espolvorea con el perejil restante y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:05:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15069,5457,'es','Pasta cremosa de calabaza','Aprovecha al máximo las calabazas este otoño. Cuando se hace puré y se combina con mascarpone y parmesano, su pulpa se transforma en una salsa para pasta deliciosa y sedosa.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","500 g de calabaza o calabacín, pelados y cortados en cubos de aproximadamente 3 cm","50-100 ml de leche entera","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de mascarpone","350 g de pasta corta (rigatoni o penne funcionan bien)","40 g de parmesano rallado o alternativa vegetariana, más extra para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola o sartén grande, poco profunda y resistente al fuego a fuego medio-bajo y sofreír la cebolla con una pizca de sal durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté blanda y traslúcida. Agrega el ajo y sofríe 1 min más. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.","Mientras tanto, cocine la calabaza en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté tierna al pincharla con un cuchillo. Escurrir y verter en una licuadora (o usar una batidora de mano). Mezcle con 50 ml de leche y las cebollas hasta que estén completamente suaves, agregando gradualmente más leche hasta que la mezcla esté lo suficientemente espesa como para cubrir el dorso de una cuchara (es posible que no necesite toda la leche). Vierta en una sartén grande con el puré de tomate y el mascarpone y cocine a fuego lento.","Cocine la pasta en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo con sal siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir reservando una taza del agua de cocción. Mezcle la pasta con la salsa de calabaza, el parmesano y 50-100 ml del agua reservada para que se suelte. Sazone y espolvoree con parmesano extra."]','2026-01-11 13:05:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15070,5459,'es','pechuga de granada','Agregue las notas agridulces de la melaza de granada para darle una increíble profundidad de sabor a este plato de carne de res cocido a fuego lento. Este es un plato popular en las fiestas judías.','["pechuga de res (si está enrollada, desenróllela)","cebollas rojas, cortadas finamente","½ granada, solo semillas","cuscús gigante cocido mezclado con 10 g de hojas de cilantro, un poco de chile urfa, rodajas de pepino y ralladura de limón (opcional), para servir","120 ml de melaza de granada","60 ml de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de primavera","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile urfa"]','["Mezcle los ingredientes de la marinada en un tazón pequeño con ¾ de cucharadita de sal fina. Coloque la carne en una fuente grande para horno. Vierta la mitad de la marinada sobre la carne y extiéndala uniformemente, luego déle la vuelta y vierta el resto sobre la carne para cubrirla. Cubra y enfríe durante la noche.","Retire la carne del refrigerador hasta 1 hora antes de cocinarla para que alcance la temperatura ambiente. Si es un día caluroso, puedes reducirlo a 30 minutos. Calentar el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9.","Voltee la carne en la marinada para asegurarse de que esté bien cubierta, dejando la capa de grasa en la parte superior. Coloque la mitad de las cebollas cortadas debajo de la carne y esparza el resto por encima. Cubra el plato sin apretar con papel de aluminio, asegurándose de que esté bien cubierto.","Ase durante 15 minutos, luego baje el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3 y cocine durante 2 horas 30 minutos-3 horas más. Compruébalo para ver qué tan tierno está: un tenedor debe entrar y salir fácilmente y la carne debe desmenuzarse bien; si no, vuelve a colocarla en el horno por otros 30 minutos.","Deje reposar la pechuga durante 15 minutos, aún cubierta con papel de aluminio, luego transfiérala a una tabla. Decorar con las semillas de granada. Sirva con el cuscús gigante, si lo desea, o triture con dos tenedores, luego vierta un poco de salsa de granada y luego sirva con pan pita y salsas de su elección."]','2026-01-11 13:05:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15071,5461,'es','Tarta de champiñones','Crea una llamativa tarta de champiñones para un plato principal vegetariano fácil pero impresionante. Pruebe una sabrosa combinación de champiñones terrosos, queso crema y masa de nueces','["175 g de Flora 100% ingredientes naturales más 2 cucharadas","300 g de harina integral","Un puñado pequeño de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas.","600 g de champiñones variados, limpios y cortados en rodajas","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","125 g de queso tierno","1/2 manojo pequeño de cebollino, picado","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 huevo batido para glasear"]','["Ponga 175 g de Flora 100% Natural Ingredients, harina integral, la mitad del tomillo y una pizca de sal en un procesador de alimentos y presione hasta que comience a formar grumos. Agrega 2-3 cucharadas de agua fría y pulsa nuevamente hasta que se forme una bola. Envuelva y enfríe durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, calienta las 2 cucharadas restantes de untar en una sartén y fríe los champiñones y la cebolla durante 10 minutos hasta que estén suaves y ligeramente dorados. Sazona bien y retira del fuego.","Calienta el horno a 220C/ventilador 200C/gas 7. Añade una bandeja para hornear grande y plana al horno para calentar. Batir el queso tierno con la mitad del cebollino, el tomillo restante y todo el ajo. Sazone bien.","Extienda la masa entre dos hojas de pergamino hasta obtener una forma rectangular rugosa, del grosor de una moneda de £ 1, de unos 30 x 40 cm. Retire la capa superior de pergamino y alise sobre la mezcla de queso tierno, dejando un borde de 5 cm. Vierta sobre los champiñones, en una capa uniforme sobre el queso tierno, luego doble los 4 lados del borde para superponer ligeramente el relleno. Recorte los lados antes de doblarlos si es necesario, pero quedarán deliciosos cuando se horneen de cualquier manera. Glasear la masa con huevo.","Con la ayuda del pergamino, desliza la tarta sobre la bandeja caliente con el papel. Hornee durante 35-40 minutos hasta que la pasta esté bien cocida y crujiente. Esparza las cebolletas restantes para servir, junto con una ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 13:05:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15072,5463,'es','Sopa de verano con judías y bulgur','Aquí tienes una porción de cinco de tus cinco al día en una sopa deliciosa y rápida de preparar. Si lo preparas con anticipación, el bulgur absorberá bastante líquido, así que agrega un chorrito de agua para aflojar un poco (o simplemente cómelo como un guiso veraniego).','["Lata de 400g de judías borlotti.","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","160 g de calabaza, cortada en cubitos (peso preparado)","1 puerro (unos 160 g), en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","1 cucharadita de hojas frescas de tomillo","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","1 calabacín (170 g), partido por la mitad y en rodajas","80 g de tomates cherry enteros","40 g de trigo bulgur","20 g de hojas de albahaca picadas","25 g de queso duro vegetariano parmesano o estilo italiano, finamente rallado"]','["Escurrir los frijoles y reservar. Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande antiadherente, añadir la calabaza y sofreír unos minutos a fuego alto para que se ablande. Añade el puerro y el ajo y cocina unos minutos más. Vierta 2 latas de agua (usando la lata de frijoles). Agrega el tomillo, el puré de tomate y el caldo junto con el calabacín en rodajas y los tomates cherry enteros, el bulgur y las judías. Llevar a ebullición y luego agregar la mitad de la albahaca. Tape la sartén y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas.","Agrega la albahaca restante y tres cuartas partes del queso. Sirva en tazones y sirva con el queso restante esparcido por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:05:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15073,5465,'es','Albóndigas de cerdo con ensalada de bulgur, queso feta y menta','Las albóndigas con bajo contenido de grasa a menudo pueden quedar secas, pero agregar zanahoria y cebolla ralladas no solo las humedece, sino que les agrega sabor y textura.','["100 g de zanahoria rallada","2 cebollas blancas (280 g), 130 g ralladas gruesas y el resto finamente picado","500 g de carne picada de cerdo al 5 % de grasa","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","½ cucharada de aceite de colza","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","125 g de trigo bulgur","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","160 g de pepino, finamente picado","100 g de tomates cherry cortados en cuartos","6 aceitunas Kalamata, en rodajas","15 g de hojas de menta, algunas pequeñas reservadas para esparcir y el resto picadas en trozos grandes","75 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Mezclar la zanahoria y la cebolla ralladas con el cerdo, la mitad del orégano y abundante pimienta negra. Forme 16 albóndigas grandes. Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande y profunda y fríe las albóndigas durante unos 5 a 8 minutos, volteándolas de vez en cuando hasta que estén firmes y empiecen a tomar color. Retirar de la sartén y reservar.","Vierte la cebolla picada en la sartén y sofríe a fuego medio hasta que empiece a ablandarse, unos 5 minutos. Agrega el ajo, luego agrega los tomates junto con el puré de tomate, una lata de agua, el caldo en polvo y el orégano restante. Cocine a fuego lento, tapado, durante 15 minutos, luego agregue las albóndigas. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos más.","Mientras tanto, hierva el bulgur durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que esté tierno y luego escúrralo. Vierta en un tazón y agregue la ralladura de limón y 2-3 cucharadas de jugo, la cebolla morada, el pepino, los tomates, las aceitunas y la menta picada. Apila la mitad en dos platos y cubre con la mitad de las albóndigas y la salsa. Esparcir sobre las hojas de menta y la mitad del queso feta. Enfríe el resto para otra noche. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. Vuelva a calentar las albóndigas a fuego lento hasta que estén bien calientes, luego sírvalas con la ensalada. Si están congeladas, déjelas descongelar por completo y vuelva a calentarlas suavemente hasta que estén bien calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:05:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15074,5469,'es','Horneado de bacalao y anchoas','Consigue tu ración semanal de pescado blanco con esta saludable receta todo en uno elaborada con anchoas, tomates, espinacas y pimiento rojo. Entrega cuatro de tus cinco al día.','["1 patata grande o 2 medianas, cortadas en rodajas de 5 mm de grosor (unos 280 g)","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas (unos 160 g)","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo","10 g de anchoas, finamente picadas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva o de colza","1 pimiento rojo, cortado en cuartos, sin semillas y en rodajas","2 tomates grandes, picados (unos 250 g)","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino blanco","½ cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","2 lomos de bacalao deshuesados ​​y sin piel (280g)","25 g de queso cheddar, finamente rallado","250 g de espinacas tiernas, marchitas, para servir"]','["Cocine las patatas y las cebollas en agua hirviendo durante 5-7 minutos. Escurrir y mezclar suavemente con el tomillo, las anchoas y un poco de pimienta negra.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén y cocina el pimiento, tapado, durante 5 minutos. Agregue los tomates, el vinagre, el caldo y el ajo y cocine durante 8-10 minutos más, sin tapar, hasta que los tomates se ablanden. No querrás que quede demasiado húmedo, así que continúa cocinando hasta que se haya evaporado el exceso de líquido, si es necesario.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque los lomos de bacalao en una fuente poco profunda refractaria y vierta sobre la mezcla de tomate, luego la mezcla de papa y cebolla, en capas uniformes. Espolvorea sobre el queso. Hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que el queso esté dorado y el pescado esté desmenuzado pero húmedo. Sirva con las espinacas a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:05:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15075,5473,'es','Curry de pescado con cúrcuma, jengibre y coco','Sirva este saludable curry de pescado, con vibrantes sabores de cúrcuma, jengibre y coco, para una comida sencilla entre semana. Solo toma 30 minutos desde la preparación hasta el plato.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, finamente cortadas","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","½ cucharada de cúrcuma","1 cucharada de garam masala","½ cucharadita de cayena","325 ml de leche de coco ligera","400 g de lomo de bacalao deshuesado y sin piel, cortado en trozos","300 g de guisantes congelados","300 g de guisantes dulces","400 g de arroz basmati integral, cocido, para servir","1 chile rojo, finamente cortado","1 lima, cortada en gajos, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio, luego fríe la cebolla durante 8 minutos hasta que esté transparente. Agregue el jengibre y las especias y cocine por un minuto más. Vierta la leche de coco y 100 ml de agua, revuelva y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Agregue el bacalao, los guisantes congelados y los guisantes dulces, y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que el pescado esté escamoso. Sirva con arroz, chile en rodajas, un buen molido de pimienta negra y unas rodajas de lima a un lado para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:05:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15076,5475,'es','Pierna de cordero asada fácil','Asa una pierna de cordero para un banquete familiar. Es ideal para acompañar asados ​​y tus verduras de primavera favoritas.','["2 kg-2,5 kg de pierna de cordero","manojo pequeño de romero, cortado en ramitas cortas de 2 cm","4-5 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","4-6 filetes de anchoa marrón, picados (opcional)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas grandes, en rodajas gruesas"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Retire todo el envoltorio del cordero y anote el peso para calcular el tiempo de asado. Haga incisiones en el cordero con un cuchillo pequeño y afilado, en ángulo, de unos 5 cm en la carne. Hacer los agujeros en ángulo significará que la carne tendrá más sabor y los aromas estarán menos tentados a salir al asar.","Inserte una ramita corta de romero, una rodaja de ajo y un pequeño trozo de anchoa (si se usa) en cada uno de los agujeros, presionando bien con el dedo. Sazone toda la carne con sal y pimienta, luego frote el cordero con aceite de oliva. Transfiera a una fuente para asar, colóquelas sobre las rodajas de cebolla. Ase durante 20 minutos.","Baje el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5 y cocine durante otros 15-20 minutos por 500 g (1 hora – 1 hora 20 minutos para 2 kg de pierna), dependiendo de qué tan rosado le guste el cordero. También puedes comprobar la temperatura interna del cordero si prefieres una carne más rosada: será de 55 °C para una carne mediana (rosada) y de 70 °C para una carne bien cocida.","Cubra con papel aluminio y deje reposar durante 15 minutos antes de cortar. Guarde los jugos de la bandeja y las rodajas de cebolla para hacer salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:05:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15077,5477,'es','Paté de trucha ahumada y rábano picante','Prepare esta salsa de pescado con notas picantes de mostaza, queso crema, limón y eneldo: ideal para un plato de fiesta de último momento.','["140 g de queso crema","1 cucharadita de crema de rábano picante","ralladura y jugo de ½ limón","1 cucharada de eneldo finamente picado, más hojas adicionales para servir","2 filetes de trucha ahumada","500 g de pan de centeno, en rodajas, para servir","1 lechuga Baby Gem, con las hojas separadas, para servir"]','["Coloque el queso crema, el rábano picante, la ralladura y el jugo de limón en un tazón y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Estación.","Agregue el eneldo picado y desmenuce la trucha ahumada, quitando las espinas o la piel a medida que avanza. Revuelva bien para combinar y agregue más condimentos al gusto. El paté se conservará en el refrigerador hasta por 2 días. Sirva adornado con hojas de eneldo y espolvoreado con pimienta negra molida. Comer con pan de centeno y hojas de lechuga."]','2026-01-11 13:05:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15078,5485,'es','Muslos de pato asados ​​en una sartén con frijoles blancos y zanahorias','Haga una versión minimalista del cassoulet asando a fuego lento muslos de pato con frijoles blancos y zanahorias. Es un plato con mucho sabor pero con pocos ingredientes.','["4 patas de pato","un puñado de ramitas de tomillo","aceite de girasol, para rociar","500 g de zanahorias, en rodajas","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 latas de 400 g de judías blancas escurridas"]','["Si tiene tiempo, sal ligeramente las piernas de pato uno o dos días antes de cocinarlas, espolvoréelas con algunas ramitas de tomillo, luego cubra y enfríe hasta que las necesite. (Si no tiene tiempo, este no es un paso esencial). Calienta el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Calienta un poco de aceite en una cacerola poco ignífuga o para asar. Si los muslos de pato han sido salados previamente, séquelos con papel de cocina. Cocine las piernas en la lata o cazuela, con la piel hacia abajo, hasta que estén doradas y se haya derretido la grasa. Voltéelos y cocínelos durante 10 a 15 minutos para que se doren por completo.","Retire las piernas de pato a un plato y retire la mitad de la grasa de la cazuela o lata (puede guardarla para asados). Vuelve a ponerlo al fuego y sofríe las zanahorias, el ajo y el tomillo junto con un poco de condimento durante 5 minutos hasta que las zanahorias empiecen a ablandarse. Coloque las piernas de pato encima, con la piel hacia arriba, luego vierta unos 100 ml de agua sobre las verduras. Llevar a fuego lento, tapar y transferir al horno para cocinar durante 1 hora 30 minutos.","Retiramos la cazuela del horno y destapamos. Enciende el horno a 200C/180C/gas 6. Saca el pato y colócalo en un plato y mezcla los frijoles con las zanahorias y el tomillo. Vuelva a colocar el pato encima, luego regrese al horno, sin tapar, para cocinar durante otros 20 a 30 minutos hasta que la piel del pato esté crujiente y los frijoles hiervan a fuego lento. Retirar del horno y dejar reposar durante 10 minutos, luego servir directamente del plato."]','2026-01-11 13:05:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15079,5487,'es','Pasta a la norma','Pruebe esta versión sencilla de alla norma, que utiliza berenjena asada en lugar de frita. Luego se mezcla con espaguetis y una rica salsa de tomate y albahaca.','["2 berenjenas, cortadas en trozos de 3 cm","1 cucharadita colmada de sal","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","pizca de hojuelas de chile","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de azúcar","350 g de espaguetis (sin huevo, si es necesario)","manojo pequeño de albahaca, rallada y unas cuantas hojas para servir","1 cucharada colmada de alcaparras","ricotta salata o parmesano, finamente rallado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Mezcle las berenjenas con la sal y luego viértalas en un colador sobre un tazón durante 30 minutos para extraer la humedad.","Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una cazuela o cacerola. Echa la cebolla y una pizca de sal y cocina a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Agrega el ajo y la guindilla y cocina por 1 min. Agregue los tomates y el azúcar y cocine a fuego lento. Cocine, descubierto, durante 20 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.","Seque la berenjena con papel de cocina y luego mezcle con el aceite restante. Extiéndalo en una bandeja para hornear y ase durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté suave y dorado en los bordes. Mientras tanto, cuece la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, reservando 100ml del agua de cocción.","Agrega la berenjena a la salsa con la albahaca y las alcaparras. Sazone al gusto, luego mezcle los espaguetis en la sartén con la salsa y un chorrito de agua de la pasta. Divida en cuatro tazones y cubra con ricotta y albahaca adicional, si la usa."]','2026-01-11 13:06:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15080,5489,'es','Bacalao al horno','Disfrute de bacalao al horno con limón y tomillo para una comida sencilla entre semana. Sirva con sus verduras favoritas para una cena familiar saludable y sin complicaciones.','["3 cucharadas de harina común","4 filetes de bacalao","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 limón, en rodajas","½ manojo pequeño de tomillo"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Vierta la harina en un bol y agregue un poco de condimento. Pasa cada filete de bacalao por la harina hasta que esté uniformemente cubierto.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio-alto. Agrega el bacalao y sofríe por cada lado durante 2 minutos o hasta que esté dorado.","Transfiera el bacalao a una fuente para asar. Coloque las rodajas de limón y el tomillo sobre y alrededor del pescado y rocíe con el aceite restante. Hornee por 10 minutos o hasta que esté bien cocido."]','2026-01-11 13:06:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15081,5493,'es','Panes planos de calabaza y halloumi con mermelada de remolacha y chile dulce','Haga algo diferente para una cena familiar con panes planos de calabaza y halloumi con mermelada de remolacha y chile dulce. Otras calabazas o batatas también funcionan bien','["1 calabaza","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","225 g de halloumi","100 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca","1 remolacha pequeña cocida (unos 125 g)","3 cucharadas de azúcar moreno","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile rojo","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","300 g de harina con levadura y un poco más para espolvorear","150-200g yogurt"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Prepara la calabaza partiéndola por la mitad, quitándole las semillas y luego cortándola en rodajas de 1 cm de grosor. Poner en un bol grande con el aceite de oliva, el pimentón ahumado y una pizca de sal. Mezcle bien para cubrir la calabaza, luego colóquela en una bandeja para hornear y hornee a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 durante unos 40 minutos hasta que esté suave y comience a dorarse en la superficie.","Para la mermelada de chile, ralla la remolacha (usa guantes para no mancharte las manos) y pon en una cacerola con el azúcar, el vinagre, las hojuelas de chile, las semillas de comino y sal al gusto. Cocine durante unos minutos a fuego medio hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Para hacer los panes planos, vierta la harina en un bol y agregue 150 g de yogur, o hasta 200 g si la masa parece demasiado seca, luego mezcle con un cuchillo hasta formar una bola. Coloca la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo y amasa durante 2 minutos hasta que quede suave. Divídalo en cuatro bolas, luego espolvoree la superficie de trabajo con harina y enrolle cada una en un pan plano grande (o haga ocho mini). Freír los panes planos en una sartén a fuego medio durante un par de minutos por cada lado.","Justo antes de servir, corta el halloumi en 8 rodajas finas. Cocine en una sartén un par de minutos por cada lado. Coloque capas de espinacas, calabaza y halloumi sobre los panes planos, luego rocíe con mermelada de remolacha y chile para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15082,5495,'es','Cucharas de alitas de pollo','Sirva estos aderezos de alitas de pollo con salsas para preparar fácilmente un buffet o una comida de fiesta. Pruebe nuestras deliciosas salsas teriyaki y curry dulce a continuación, funcionan muy bien.','["1 kg de alitas de pollo, sin las puntas y divididas en dos trozos","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de aceite de girasol"]','["Coloque las alitas en un tazón grande y mezcle con 1 cucharadita de sal, la harina de maíz y el polvo para hornear; esto ayudará a que la piel quede crujiente al hornear. Enfríe, tapado, durante al menos 1 hora, o idealmente durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Mezcle las alitas con el aceite y luego colóquelas en una sola capa sobre una rejilla colocada sobre una bandeja para hornear. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén doradas, luego dé vuelta las alitas y hornee durante 25-30 minutos más hasta que estén crujientes. Transfiera a un plato con salsas para mojar (consulte los consejos a continuación), o coloque un tazón grande en la mesa al lado de cada salsa y mezcle las alitas con las salsas."]','2026-01-11 13:06:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15083,5497,'es','Horneado de bacalao ahumado, brócoli y orzo','Disfrute de este sencillo y rápido horneado en bandeja de bacalao, brócoli y orzo durante las noches ocupadas. Es saludable y bajo en grasas, y como se hornea en bandeja, ¡hay un mínimo de lavado!','["½ cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito","1 cebolla, picada","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado, más una pizca","½-1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","200 g de brócoli de tallo largo","400 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","150 g de oro","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado","½ manojo pequeño de perejil picado","50 g de guisantes congelados","2 filetes de bacalao sostenibles sin piel","4 cucharadas de yogur sin grasa"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calentar el aceite en una sartén honda apta para horno y sofreír la cebolla durante 5 minutos hasta que esté tierna. Agrega el pimentón, la pasta de chipotle, el brócoli y el caldo. Agregue el orzo y transfiéralo al horno durante 10 minutos.","Agregue la mitad de las hierbas y los guisantes y coloque el pescado en el orzo. Espolvorea una pizca de pimentón y rocía con aceite, luego sazona. Cocine durante 8-10 minutos hasta que el pescado esté cocido y el orzo tierno. Mezclar las hierbas restantes con el yogur. Aflojar con un poco de agua si es necesario, luego servir con el orzo y el pescado."]','2026-01-11 13:06:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15084,5499,'es','Curry de coco, anacardo y calabaza','Cocine por lotes este curry vegano de calabaza y anacardos y congélelo para los días ocupados cuando necesite algo rápido y nutritivo. Es perfecto para una comida familiar.','["1 cucharada de aceite","1 cebolla, finamente picada","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cm de jengibre pelado y rallado","2 cucharadas de curry suave en polvo","lata de 400g de leche de coco","Lata de 200g de tomates picados","75 g de anacardos, triturados hasta obtener un polvo fino","4 cucharadas de pasas","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 calabaza grande, pelada y cortada en trozos (aproximadamente 750 g de peso preparado)","arroz, pan naan y pepinillos, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio. Agregue la cebolla y cocine, revolviendo regularmente, hasta que se ablande, aproximadamente 10 minutos. Agregue el ajo, el jengibre y el curry en polvo y cocine durante unos 20 segundos, sin dejar de revolver.","Agregue la leche de coco, los tomates, los anacardos, las pasas, los garbanzos y la calabaza. Vierta 200 ml de agua, luego hierva y reduzca inmediatamente el fuego a bajo. Cocine a fuego lento sin tapar hasta que la calabaza esté tierna, aproximadamente 20 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente para evitar que se pegue. Sazone al gusto. Si se congela, primero déjelo enfriar por completo. Se puede congelar hasta por un mes. Vuelva a calentar congelado a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 durante 10-15 minutos. Sirva con arroz, naan y pepinillos, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15085,5501,'es','Hot dogs con queso, salsa de mostaza y pepinillos y cebolla crujiente','Utilice salchichas estilo bratwurst para hacer hot dogs en una barbacoa y condimente con nuestra salsa de mostaza y pepinillos. Las cebollas crujientes añaden textura','["8 salchichas grandes estilo bratwurst","80 g de mozzarella rallada","8 panecillos brioche para hot dog","50 g de cebollas crujientes","salsa de tomate, para servir (opcional)","50 g de mayonesa","2 cucharadas de mostaza amarilla estilo americano","5 pepinillos, finamente picados"]','["Prepare la salsa de mostaza y pepinillos combinando la mayonesa, la mostaza y los pepinillos en un bol. Enfriar hasta que sea necesario.","Calienta la barbacoa y espera hasta que las brasas se pongan cenicientas. Alternativamente, calienta una sartén a fuego alto. Cocine las salchichas durante 7-8 minutos, volteándolas regularmente hasta que estén uniformemente doradas y bien cocidas, luego junte las salchichas en la parrilla o en la sartén y esparza con la mozzarella rallada. Cocine sin revolver durante 2 minutos más o hasta que el queso se derrita.","Abre los panecillos para hot dog y rellénalos con una salchicha cubierta de queso. Rocíe sobre la salsa de mostaza y pepinillos y cubra con cebollas crujientes y salsa de tomate, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15086,5503,'es','Estofado de pollo primaveral','Prepara este reconfortante guiso de pollo con verduras de temporada para alimentar a toda la familia','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","8 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados por la mitad","60 g de mantequilla sin sal","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 zanahorias grandes, picadas","60 g de harina común","1,2 litros de caldo de pollo","2 cucharadas de mostaza Dijon","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","300 g de guisantes congelados","150ml de nata doble","200 g de harina con levadura","¼ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de sebo o mantequilla fría sin sal, rallada","manojo pequeño de cebollino, finamente picado (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego a fuego alto y fríe el pollo durante 5-7 minutos hasta que esté dorado por completo. Retirar a un plato y reservar.","Derrita la mantequilla en la misma sartén, luego reduzca el fuego a medio y fría la cebolla y las zanahorias durante 5 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Espolvoree la harina y cocine por 2 minutos más. Agregue lentamente el caldo, revolviendo a medida que avanza. Agrega la mostaza y el vinagre y cocina a fuego medio-bajo durante 30 minutos, revolviendo regularmente. Sazone al gusto, luego agregue los guisantes y cocine por 5 minutos más. Agrega la crema.","Haga las albóndigas mezclando la harina con el polvo para hornear, el sebo o mantequilla, el cebollino (si lo usa) y ½ cucharadita de sal. Agregue rápidamente de 8 a 10 cucharadas de agua con un cuchillo y luego junte la masa con las manos; debe quedar firme y flexible. Divídalo en ocho trozos del mismo tamaño y pese para mayor precisión si lo desea. Coloque las albóndigas encima del guiso, luego cubra con la tapa y cocine durante 15 minutos a fuego lento. Retire la tapa y deslice la sartén debajo de una parrilla caliente durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que las bolas de masa estén infladas y doradas. Sirva en tazones para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15087,5505,'es','Fideos aromáticos de cerdo y limoncillo','En tan solo 20 minutos podrás estar disfrutando de un embriagador salteado con limoncillo, jengibre y lima. Si prefieres fideos más gruesos, también funcionarán en lugar de fideos.','["2 nidos de fideos de arroz fideos","3 dientes de ajo machacados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y rallado","4 cucharaditas de pasta de limoncillo","1 lima rallada y en jugo, más gajos adicionales para servir (opcional)","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 zanahorias medianas, ralladas gruesas","8 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","500 g de carne picada de cerdo","200 g de acelgas, cortadas finamente","2 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Prepare los fideos fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego reserve. Mientras tanto, mezcle el ajo, el jengibre, la hierba de limón, la ralladura de lima y la guindilla. Calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto y fríe la mezcla durante 2 minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Esparza las zanahorias y las cebolletas y fríalas durante 2 minutos más, revolviendo con frecuencia. Agregue la carne picada de cerdo y cocine por otros 3 minutos, luego mezcle las acelgas y cocine por 2 minutos más hasta que la carne de cerdo esté bien cocida.","Rocíe la salsa de pescado y el jugo de limón, luego esparza el cilantro. Cocine todo durante 1 minuto, revolviendo para combinar. Vierta los fideos, revuelva bien y sirva inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15088,5507,'es','Derretir cebollas medianas','Impresione a los invitados a la cena con estas cebollas rellenas de queso vegetal. Llenos de mozzarella, piñones, pan rallado y hierbas, están llenos de sabor.','["8 cebollas marrones grandes","40 g de mantequilla","70 g de piñones","150 g de pan rallado blanco suave","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","5 ramitas de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","1 huevo mediano, batido","100 g de scarmoza (mozzarella ahumada) o mozzarella normal"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas. 4. Corta un disco pequeño de la parte inferior de la raíz de cada cebolla para que queden en posición vertical. Corte rodajas de 1 cm de la parte superior (se usarán como tapas) y luego vuelva a colocarlas encima de las cebollas. Envuelva cada cebolla en papel de aluminio, transfiérala a una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 1 hora hasta que esté tierna.","Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén. Vierta en un tazón. Agrega los piñones a la sartén y tuesta a fuego lento durante 2 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Añadir a la mantequilla con el pan rallado, el ajo, el tomillo, el perejil y el huevo. Revuelva y luego sazone.","Corta el queso en 8 cubos gruesos. Cuando las cebollas estén lo suficientemente frías como para manipularlas, saque los centros blandos, dejando algunas capas de cebolla en los bordes. Pique finamente los centros de 2 cebollas y agréguelos a la mezcla de pan rallado (reserve el resto para usarlo en otra receta, como ragú). Vierta la mezcla de pan rallado en las cebollas ahuecadas hasta que estén hasta la mitad, luego coloque un trozo de queso en el medio de cada una y complete con más mezcla de pan rallado. Cubra cada cebolla con su “tapa”, luego ase durante 35 a 40 minutos más hasta que esté tierna y el queso se derrita."]','2026-01-11 13:06:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15089,5514,'es','Cerdo agridulce más ligero','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Este favorito chino para llevar de la familia se puede hacer mucho más saludable: reduzca los niveles de azúcar, grasa y sal con esta receta fácil.','["225 g de lomo de cerdo","1 zanahoria (140 g), cortada en tiras de aproximadamente 5 cm de largo","1 cucharada de aceite de colza, más 2 cucharaditas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de jengibre finamente picado","3 cebolletas, con los extremos recortados y cortadas en rodajas diagonales largas","½ pimiento rojo, sin semillas, cortado en tiras largas y finas","200 g de arroz de grano largo, cocido","1 clara de huevo","¼ cucharadita de polvo de cinco especias chinas","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","1½ cucharadita de harina con levadura","1 tsp dark soy sauce","½ cucharadita de aceite de sésamo","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz blanco chino o vinagre de sidra","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de harina de maíz, mezclada con 1 cucharadita de agua","175 ml de caldo de verduras, elaborado con 1,2 cucharadita de polvo (nosotros utilizamos caldo de verduras suizo de caléndula)"]','["Cortar el cerdo en cubos de 2-3 cm. En un tazón mediano, prepara la masa. Batir la clara de huevo ligeramente con un tenedor hasta que esté ligeramente espumosa, luego incorporar el polvo de cinco especias, la maicena, la harina y un buen molido de pimienta hasta que quede espeso y suave. Agregue la carne de cerdo para que cada pieza quede cubierta uniformemente y luego reserve.","Ahora haz la salsa. En un tazón pequeño, mezcle la salsa de soja, el aceite de sésamo, el vinagre, el azúcar, el puré de tomate, la maicena mezclada con agua y el caldo. Sazone con pimienta y reserve. Blanquear la zanahoria en un poco de agua hirviendo durante unos 2 minutos hasta que esté tierna pero aún crujiente. Escurrir y luego poner bajo el chorro de agua fría para detener la cocción. Escurrir nuevamente y reservar.","Vierta 1 cucharada de aceite de colza en un wok antiadherente o en una sartén grande. Cuando esté muy caliente (pruebe echando un trozo de carne; debería chisporrotear inmediatamente), agregue la carne de cerdo. Revuelva para separar todas las piezas, luego saltee durante unos 5 minutos a fuego medio-alto hasta que la carne ya no esté rosada por dentro al cortarla y el exterior esté dorado y crujiente. Retirar con una espumadera y reservar.","Vierta las 2 cucharaditas restantes de aceite de colza en el wok y agregue el ajo, el jengibre, las cebolletas y la pimienta. Sofríe durante unos 2 minutos hasta que empiece a dorarse (aún a fuego bastante alto). Vierta la salsa (inmediatamente debería comenzar a burbujear rápidamente) y agregue la zanahoria. Tan pronto como la salsa se haya espesado un poco, aproximadamente entre 30 segundos y 1 minuto, agregue la carne para cubrirla y calentarla rápidamente. Retirar la sartén del fuego, sazonar con una pizca de sal y servir inmediatamente, con el arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:06:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15090,5515,'es','Cerdo asado a las hierbas con verduras asadas y salsa de manzana','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta cena asada magra utiliza pierna de cerdo cubierta con prosciutto. Sirva con patatas asadas, zanahorias y apio, además de muchas hierbas y salsa de manzana.','["1¼kg de pierna de cerdo asada deshuesada","1 cucharada de mostaza integral","2 cucharadas de perejil picado","2 cucharadas de tomillo picado, más unas cuantas ramitas extra","1 cucharadita de salvia picada","paquete de 80 g de jamón","4 buenos sprays de aceite","3 zanahorias, partidas por la mitad a lo largo y luego cortadas a lo ancho","6 patatas pequeñas (500 g), partidas por la mitad","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos","12 dientes de ajo","1 apio nabo pequeño (650 g), pelado y cortado en 12 gajos","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","600 ml de caldo de pollo reducido en sal","1 manzana Bramley pequeña, cortada en cubitos","Col de Saboya y guisantes, para servir"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Corta toda la corteza y la grasa de la carne de cerdo y deséchala para que quede un trozo de carne magra. Untar con mostaza, espolvorear con las hierbas picadas y sazonar con pimienta negra. Coloque las rodajas de prosciutto encima de la carne de cerdo para proteger la carne donde se ha eliminado la grasa.","Rocíe una fuente grande para asar con aceite y coloque la carne de cerdo en el centro. Rodear con todas las verduras, espolvorear con las ramitas de tomillo, luego rociar nuevamente y cubrir con papel de aluminio. Ase durante 1 hora, luego suba el fuego a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Destape, rocíe nuevamente y ase durante 20 minutos más.","Mientras tanto, prepara la salsa. Mezcle la harina de maíz con un poco de agua para hacer una pasta húmeda, caliente el caldo en una sartén, agregue la mezcla de harina de maíz y cocine, revolviendo, hasta que espese. Agrega la manzana y cocina durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablande pero aún mantenga su forma.","Retire la carne de la lata y vierta el jugo de la lata en la salsa. Rocíe las verduras con aceite y ase durante 20 minutos más (mientras la carne reposa) para dorarlas. Sirve el cerdo con las verduras frescas y asadas y la salsa de manzana."]','2026-01-11 13:06:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15091,5517,'es','Curry de pescado más ligero del sur de la India','Utilice leche de coco baja en grasa y filetes de pescado blanco para preparar un curry bajo en grasa y calorías que siga siendo lujosamente cremoso.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cebolla mediana, cortada por la mitad a lo largo y cortada en gajos finos","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente picado (un trozo de aproximadamente 2½ cm/1 pulgada)","12 hojas secas de curry","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","2 chiles verdes pequeños, cortados por la mitad a lo largo y sin semillas (o deja algunas semillas si quieres un poco de picante)","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de garam masala","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma","Lata de 400 g de leche de coco desnatada","¼ cucharadita de pimienta negra molida","500 g de filetes de pescado blanco firme y sin piel, como bacalao o eglefino","100 g de judías verdes finas, peladas y cortadas por la mitad a lo largo","1 mango maduro","un puñado generoso de cilantro picado, solo las hojas","200 g de arroz basmati, cocido, para servir","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén o sartén antiadherente grande. Agrega las semillas de comino y sofríe por 1 min, luego agrega la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre y sofríe por 1 min más. Agregue las hojas de curry y las semillas de mostaza y fría\r\n3-4 minutos a fuego medio, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que las cebollas se doren. Agregue los chiles, el cilantro, el garam masala y la cúrcuma y fría durante 30 segundos.","Agrega la leche de coco a la lata y luego vierte la mitad en la cacerola. Debería comenzar a burbujear y espesarse, así que déjelo cocinar a fuego lento hasta que espese bastante, aproximadamente 3 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Vierte el resto de la leche de coco, añade la pimienta y una pizca de sal y baja el fuego.","Sienta el pescado en la leche de coco y presiónalo hasta sumergirlo hasta la mitad. Tapa la sartén y cocina a fuego lento durante 4-5 minutos (dependiendo del grosor de los filetes) hasta que el pescado esté casi cocido. No revuelva o el pescado se romperá; simplemente vierta un poco de salsa sobre la parte superior del pescado a la mitad, luego retire la sartén del fuego y deje que el pescado repose durante otros 3-4 minutos para terminar de cocinarse lentamente. Cuando termine, debería sentirse firme y ya no estar opaco. Si quieres una salsa más fina, vierte una o dos cucharadas de agua.","Mientras tanto, cocine las judías verdes al vapor durante unos 4 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Deshuesar el mango y cortar la pulpa en gajos finos (ver consejo abajo a la izquierda), luego esparcir sobre el pescado para que se caliente.","Para servir, parta el pescado en trozos grandes colocándolo en tazones para servir con una espumadera y luego vierta la salsa sobre y alrededor. Sirva con los frijoles, un poco de cilantro y el arroz, con rodajas de lima a un lado para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15092,5519,'es','Sopa de ajos silvestres y ortigas','Busque algunas verduras frescas de primavera y cocínelas a fuego lento con verduras finamente picadas para preparar esta sopa verde vibrante, saludable y baja en grasa.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza, más un poco más para rociar","25 g de mantequilla","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 puerro, finamente picado","2 palitos de apio, en rodajas finas","1 zanahoria, finamente picada","1 papa pequeña, pelada y cortada en cubitos","1,2 l de caldo de verduras de buena calidad","300 g de hojas tiernas de ortiga","200 g de hojas de ajo silvestre (guarda las flores si las tienes)","3 cucharadas de leche"]','["Calienta el aceite y la mantequilla en una cacerola grande. Añadimos la cebolla, el puerro, el apio, la zanahoria, la patata y una buena pizca de sal, y removemos hasta que quede todo bien cubierto. Cubra y sude suavemente durante 15 a 20 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando para asegurarse de que las verduras no se peguen al fondo de la sartén.","Vierta el caldo y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Agregue las ortigas en varias tandas, revolviendo, luego agregue las hojas de ajo silvestre y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos.","Retirar del fuego y licuar con una batidora de mano o verter en una licuadora. Regrese al fuego y revuelva con la leche, luego pruebe para sazonar. Sirva en tazones y rocíe con un poco más de aceite, luego cubra con algunas flores de ajo silvestre, si las tiene."]','2026-01-11 13:06:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15093,5521,'es','Ensalada de rábanos, lentejas y menta','Una combinación de ingredientes agridulces y de nuez realza las diferentes variedades de hermosos rábanos en esta receta.','["50 g de nueces en trozos","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas","1 cucharadita de melaza negra","2 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","paquete pequeño de menta, con las hojas recogidas y medio picadas","Lata de 400 g de lentejas verdes, escurridas y enjuagadas","½ pepino, picado","300 g de rábanos, algunos se dejan enteros y otros cortados en rodajas y picados (intente utilizar una mezcla de variedades, como mooli y rábanos de carne roja; consulte el consejo)"]','["Tuesta los trozos de nuez en una sartén grande a fuego medio hasta que estén fragantes y empiecen a carbonizarse en los bordes. Vierta en un tazón y reserve.","En la misma sartén, baje el fuego y agregue 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva. Añade la cebolla, sofríe durante unos 10 minutos hasta que esté blanda y luego retira la sartén del fuego. Añade la melaza negra, el vinagre de Jerez y el resto del aceite de oliva, mezcla y deja enfriar. Agrega la menta picada a la sartén y sazona bien.","En un tazón grande, mezcle las lentejas, el pepino y la mitad de los rábanos, luego vierta sobre el aderezo de cebolla y menta enfriado. Mezcle todo y apílelo en una fuente para servir. Esparcir sobre los trozos de nuez y el resto de la menta y los rábanos, luego servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15094,5523,'es','Pato rojo tailandés con arroz pegajoso de piña','Marina las pechugas de pato con pasta de curry rojo y lima, luego sírvelas con arroz con coco, guisantes y brotes de soja para una cena saludable entre semana.','["2 pechugas de pato, sin piel y desechadas","1 cucharada de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima, más gajos adicionales para servir","140 g de arroz jazmín","125 ml de leche de coco light, de lata","140 g de guisantes congelados","50 g de brotes de soja","½ cebolla morada, picada","100 g de piñas frescas, en cubos","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","¼ de paquete pequeño de cilantro, los tallos finamente picados y las hojas picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Coloque una pechuga de pato entre 2 hojas de film transparente sobre una tabla de cortar. Utiliza un rodillo para machacar el pato hasta que tenga 0,5 cm de grosor. Repita con la otra pechuga y luego póngalas en un plato. Mezclar la pasta de curry con la ralladura de lima y el jugo y frotar todo el pato. Dejar marinar a temperatura ambiente durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, vierte el arroz en una cacerola pequeña con un poco de sal. Vierta sobre la leche de coco con 150ml de agua. Llevar a fuego lento, luego tapar la sartén, bajar el fuego y cocinar durante 5 minutos más. Agregue los guisantes, luego cubra, apague el fuego y déjelo por otros 10 minutos. Revise el arroz: todo el líquido debe absorberse y el arroz debe estar bien cocido. Hervir la tetera, poner los brotes de soja y la cebolla morada en un colador y verter sobre una tetera con agua hirviendo. Agrega los brotes de soja y la cebolla al arroz con los tallos de piña, chile y cilantro, y un poco más de sal si es necesario, y vuelve a tapar para mantener el calor.","Calienta una sartén y cocina el pato durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado o hasta que esté cocido a tu gusto. Corte el pato en rodajas, mezcle la mayor parte de las hojas de cilantro con el arroz con un tenedor para esponjarlo y sirva junto con el pato, espolvoreado con el cilantro restante."]','2026-01-11 13:06:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15095,5525,'es','Gratinados de pescado mediterráneo','Estas porciones individuales de pescado en salsa de tomate, cubiertas con pan rallado con hierbas, se congelan maravillosamente, perfectas para recibir invitados sin complicaciones.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, en rodajas finas","1 bulbo de hinojo (aproximadamente 250 g/9 oz), recortado y en rodajas finas","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente picados","1 cucharadita colmada de semillas de cilantro, ligeramente trituradas","150 ml de vino blanco","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados con hierbas","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","buena pizca de azafrán","1 hoja de laurel","1 cucharada de jugo de limón fresco","1 manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, las hojas picadas en trozos grandes","900 g de filetes de pescado mixtos sin piel (lo que quieras) cortados en trozos","350 g de langostinos crudos pelados","75 g de parmesano finamente rallado","50 g de panko o pan rallado seco grueso","ensalada verde, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola o sartén antiadherente grande y ancha y sofreír la cebolla, el hinojo, el ajo y las semillas de cilantro durante 15 minutos, revolviendo regularmente hasta que las verduras estén blandas y ligeramente coloreadas. Vierte el vino en la sartén y añade los tomates, el puré de tomate, el azafrán y el laurel. Sazone y lleve a fuego lento. Cocine durante unos 15 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que espese.","Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Agregue el jugo de limón y la mayor parte del perejil a la mezcla de tomate, coloque los trozos de pescado crudo y las gambas encima y revuelva bien. Cubra bien con una tapa y cocine a fuego medio durante 4-5 minutos o hasta que el pescado esté casi cocido. Revuelve un par de veces mientras se cocina el pescado, teniendo cuidado de que no se rompa.","Sirva la mezcla caliente de tomate y pescado en 6 moldes para tarta individuales; cada uno deberá contener alrededor de 350 ml. Mezcle el queso, el pan rallado, el perejil restante y un poco de pimienta negra molida y espolvoree por encima. Hornee en una bandeja para hornear durante 20 minutos o hasta que las tartas estén doradas y burbujeantes. Sirva con ensalada verde, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15096,5527,'es','Guiso de pescado con ajos asados ​​y azafrán','Pruebe esta versión más sencilla y ligera de bullabesa, una sopa de pescado clásica; sírvala con rebanadas de baguette tostadas para absorber la salsa a base de tomate.','["3 cabezas de ajo enteras","150 ml de buen aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","unas buenas pizcas de sal marina en escamas","Perno 50ml","una buena pizca de hebras de azafrán","1 bulbo de hinojo","4 palitos de apio","1 cebolla","1 chile rojo, sin semillas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo","2 cucharadas de semillas de hinojo","pizca de azafrán","2 hojas de laurel","Perno 50ml","200 ml de vino blanco","750ml en puré","3 filetes de salmonete (unos 500 g en total), con piel y cortados en trozos grandes","300 g de filetes de rubio, con piel y cortados en trozos grandes","200 g de calamares y tentáculos preparados, limpios y cortados en aros","jugo 1 limon","4 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana picado, más un poco más para servir","rebanadas tostadas de baguette, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Para hacer la pasta de azafrán y ajo, cortar las cabezas de ajo enteras por la mitad de forma horizontal. Coloque las cabezas de ajo, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, en una bandeja para hornear pequeña. Rociar con un poco de aceite de oliva y sazonar con sal. Cubra con papel aluminio y hornee durante 40-50 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Retire el papel de aluminio y regrese al horno por 15-20 minutos más hasta que el ajo se dore.","Mientras tanto, haz la base de la sopa. Picar el hinojo, el apio y la cebolla en dados pequeños y la guindilla roja en rodajas finas. Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande y agrega las verduras picadas. Ralla el ajo en la sartén y añade las semillas de hinojo. Revuelva bien, luego cubra y sude durante 10 minutos. Añade el azafrán y las hojas de laurel y cocina 10 minutos más hasta que las verduras empiecen a ablandarse. Vierta el Pernod y el vino, lleve a ebullición, luego agregue la passata y 400 ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición y luego bajar el fuego a fuego lento. Tapar y cocinar durante 45 minutos hasta que todos los sabores comiencen a combinarse, luego retirar la sartén del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco.","Transfiera la sopa a una licuadora de vaso y mezcle hasta que quede suave, luego pásela por un colador fino a una cacerola limpia; es posible que deba hacerlo en tandas. Si la sopa necesita espesarse, reduzca a fuego medio. Cuando tenga la consistencia de nata líquida, retirar del fuego y reservar, o dejar enfriar y enfriar en el frigorífico hasta que sea necesario. La base de la sopa se puede preparar con 3 días de antelación.","Mientras tanto, para la pasta, vierte el Pernod en una cacerola pequeña y añade el azafrán. Llevar a ebullición, añadir el aceite de oliva y calentar suavemente. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Cuando el ajo esté dorado, retira la bandeja del horno y exprime los dientes en el recipiente de un mortero. Agregue una pizca grande de sal marina en escamas y triture hasta obtener una pasta. Agregue lentamente el aceite de oliva con infusión de azafrán, revolviendo constantemente. Transfiera a un recipiente limpio y enfríe hasta que sea necesario.","Lleve la base de la sopa a ebullición en una cacerola grande, luego baje a fuego lento y pruebe el condimento. Agrega los trozos de pescado y calamares preparados y escalfa suavemente el pescado en la sopa durante 10 minutos o hasta que esté recién cocido. Retirar del fuego y agregar el jugo de limón y el perejil. Sirva la sopa en tazones, amontonando el pescado en el centro. Vierta la pasta de azafrán y ajo y espolvoree un poco más de perejil. Sirva con rebanadas tostadas de baguette y la pasta extra de azafrán y ajo a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:06:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15097,5529,'es','Jalfrezi de gambas','Satisfaga un antojo de curry de forma saludable con este plato indio de gambas: mezcle las cebollas y las especias hasta obtener una salsa auténtica, espesa pero baja en grasas.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas medianas, picadas","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de comino molido","¼ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile (o menos si no te gusta demasiado picante)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","chorrito de miel clara","1 pimiento verde grande, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y picado","manojo pequeño de cilantro, tallos y hojas separados, picados","140 g de gambas tigre grandes cocidas y peladas","Bolsa de 250 g de arroz integral cocido","yogur de menta o chutney, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y fríe las cebollas, el jengibre y el ajo durante 8-10 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que se ablanden y empiecen a tomar color. Añade las especias y las hojuelas de chile, revuelve brevemente y luego vierte los tomates con media lata de agua y la miel. Mezcle todo lo que hay en la sartén con una batidora de mano hasta que esté casi suave (o use un procesador de alimentos). Agrega los tallos de pimiento y cilantro, tapa la cacerola y deja cocer a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. (La mezcla quedará muy espesa y chisporroteará un poco, así que revuelva con frecuencia).","Agrega las gambas y esparce sobre las hojas de cilantro. Calienta el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Sirva ambos con yogur de menta o chutney, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15098,5531,'es','Pescado asado entero relleno con hinojo','Este plato de pescado asado se inspiró en Sicilia, donde las especias aromáticas y los frutos secos de la cocina árabe se combinan con el pescado y las verduras frescas del Mediterráneo.','["2 bulbos de hinojo, partidos por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 cebolla grande, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un poco más para rociar","2 limones, 1 rallado y luego exprimido, 1 cortado en gajos","200 g de cuscús","pizca de hebras de azafrán","250 ml de caldo de pollo o verduras","2 pescados enteros más grandes o 4 más pequeños, limpios y sin escamas (nosotros usamos lubina Anglesey)","paquete pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de piñones tostados","250 g de tomates pera pequeños, cortados por la mitad","1 cucharada de grosellas"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque el hinojo y la cebolla en una fuente para asar grande y mezcle con 2 cucharadas de aceite, 1 cucharada de jugo de limón y abundante condimento. Ase durante 20 minutos hasta que esté casi tierno y comience a caramelizarse. Mientras tanto, pon el cuscús en un bol mediano. Mezclar el azafrán y el caldo caliente, verter sobre el cuscús y cubrir con film transparente.","Enjuague el pescado con agua fría por dentro y por fuera y luego séquelo. Corta profundamente por ambos lados y sazona con sal, pimienta y una pizca de ralladura de limón. Después de 10 minutos de remojo, esponja el cuscús con un tenedor y añade 2 cucharadas de jugo de limón, la ralladura restante, el eneldo, 1 cucharada de piñones y sazona al gusto. Rellena el cuscús en la cavidad de cada pescado y reserva el cuscús sobrante para más tarde.","Agrega los tomates y las grosellas a la lata. Coloca el pescado encima y ásalo durante unos 30 minutos, dependiendo de su tamaño. Busque jugos que salgan de los cortes en la pulpa. Tire suavemente de la aleta trasera; si se desprende fácilmente, el pescado está cocido.","4 Esparcir con el resto de los piñones y servir en la lata, con rodajas de limón para exprimir. Sirva un pescado relleno por persona, o si ha cocinado pescado grande, primero levante suavemente los filetes de la parte superior del pescado, luego déles la vuelta y repita. Reparta el relleno de cuscús y las sobras de cuscús."]','2026-01-11 13:06:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15099,5535,'es','Lubina en papillote con sabores tailandeses','Haga un paquete con papel para hornear y deje que el pescado se cocine al vapor a la perfección mientras lo infusiona con ajo, jengibre, chile y lima.','["2 lubinas pequeñas, escamadas y evisceradas","12 patatas nuevas, limpias","mantequilla salada en trozos pequeños","hojas de cilantro, para servir","2 tallos de limoncillo","100 g de jengibre fresco en trozos","3 dientes de ajo","3 chiles rojos pequeños, finamente picados","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima, más gajos adicionales para servir, si lo desea"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160 ventilador/gas 4. Para\r\npreparar la mezcla del relleno, golpear la\r\nlimoncillo con el lado romo de tu\r\ncuchillo para magullarlo y luego cortarlo en rodajas finas\r\nanillos. Cortar finamente el jengibre (a lo largo de\r\ngrano) – puedes dejar la cáscara puesta.\r\nAplastar los dientes de ajo sin pelar para\r\nliberar su aroma. poner todo el relleno\r\ningredientes en un tazón y mezcle.","Tome un trozo de papel para hornear aproximadamente\r\n50cm de largo y colocar las 2 lubinas\r\nen todo su ancho. Llenar las cavidades del estómago.\r\ncon ¾ de la mezcla de relleno, esparciendo\r\nel resto sobre el pescado y luego sazonar. doblar\r\nlos lados del pergamino sobre el\r\ncabezas y colas del pescado, luego enróllelo\r\nun paquete. Esto ahora se puede almacenar en el\r\nRefrigerar por unas horas, si lo desea. cuando\r\nlisto para cocinar, colocar en una bandeja en el horno\r\ny hornee durante 20-25 minutos, hasta que la pulpa\r\nse desprende del hueso.","Mientras se hornea el pescado, ponga el nuevo\r\npatatas en agua fría y llevar a la\r\nhervir. Una vez cocido, escurrir bien y cortar por la mitad.\r\ny volver a la sartén con una nuez de mantequilla.","Disponer las patatas nuevas y la lubina\r\nen el plato, todavía en el paquete, si quieres,\r\ny espolvoreado con las hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:06:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15100,5537,'es','Filete teriyaki con ensalada de hinojo','Este sabroso plato de estilo asiático es bajo en grasas y fácil de preparar.','["2 cucharadas de salsa de soja reducida en sal","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharadita de miel clara","4 filetes de solomillo o lomo, sin toda la grasa visible, cada uno de unos 125 g","1 zanahoria grande, rallada gruesa","1 bulbo de hinojo, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","un puñado de hojas de cilantro","jugo 1 lima"]','["Mezclar la soja, el vinagre y la miel, añadir\r\nlos filetes y luego déjelos marinar durante 10 a 15 minutos.","Mezcle la zanahoria, el hinojo y la cebolla.\r\ny cilantro, luego enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir.","Cocine los filetes en una sartén durante un\r\nunos minutos por cada lado, dependiendo de la\r\nespesor y que tan bien hecho te gusta\r\nellos. Deje la carne a un lado para que repose sobre una\r\nplato, luego agregue el resto de la marinada\r\na la sartén. Burbujear la marinada hasta que\r\nse reduce un poco para hacer una salsa pegajosa.","Aliña la ensalada con el jugo de lima,\r\nluego apílelos en platos y sirva con el\r\nfiletes. Vierta la salsa sobre la carne."]','2026-01-11 13:06:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15101,5539,'es','Tarta de albaricoque y frambuesa','Deliciosa y servida fría o caliente, esta tarta utiliza masa filo para mantener bajas las calorías.','["3 láminas grandes de masa filo (o 6 pequeñas)","2 cucharadas de mantequilla, derretida","3 cucharadas de conserva de albaricoque","6 albaricoques maduros, deshuesados ​​y cortados en rodajas grandes","85 g de frambuesas","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo"]','["Deja que el filo alcance la temperatura ambiente.\r\ndurante unos 10 minutos antes de su uso. Pon un\r\nbandeja para hornear en el horno y calentar el horno\r\na 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Cepille cada hoja grande de filo con\r\nmantequilla derretida, capas una encima de la otra,\r\nLuego dobla por la mitad para que tengas un tamaño más pequeño.\r\nrectángulo de 6 capas de espesor. Si usa pequeño\r\nlas hojas simplemente se apilan una encima de la otra.\r\nDoblar los bordes de la base de masa para\r\nhacer un borde de 2 cm, luego extender el\r\nConserva de albaricoque dentro del borde.\r\nDesliza con cuidado la base de masa sobre\r\nla bandeja para hornear caliente y hornee por 5 minutos.","Retirar del horno, disponer los albaricoques.\r\nsobre la tarta y untar con el resto\r\nmantequilla derretida. Hornee por otros 10 minutos,\r\nluego espolvorear sobre frambuesas y espolvorear\r\ncon azúcar. Hornee por los últimos 10 minutos hasta que\r\nla masa está dorada y crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15102,5541,'es','Tarros de mousse de chocolate y frutos rojos','El postre no tiene por qué ser diabólico, como lo demuestra este pudín saludable.','["75 g de chocolate negro 70% rallado","4 cucharadas de yogur bajo en grasa","2 claras de huevo grandes","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","350 g de bayas (pruebe con arándanos, frambuesas, cerezas o una mezcla)"]','["Derretir el chocolate en una refractaria\r\ntazón sobre una cacerola a fuego lento\r\nagua, asegurándose de que el recipiente\r\nNo toca directamente el agua.\r\nUna vez derretido, déjelo enfriar durante\r\n5 a 10 minutos, luego agregue el yogur.","Batir las claras a punto de nieve,\r\nluego agregue el azúcar y bata\r\nhasta que vuelva a estar rígido. Doblar las claras en\r\nla mezcla de chocolate – aflojar la\r\nmezclar primero con una cucharada de huevo\r\nblanco, luego doble con cuidado el resto,\r\nmanteniendo la mayor cantidad de aire posible.","Pon las bayas en vasos pequeños.\r\no moldes, luego divida la mousse\r\nencima. Enfriar en la nevera hasta que cuaje."]','2026-01-11 13:06:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15103,5543,'es','Pastel de pescado con cobertura de nabo y patatas','Hacer pastel de pescado puede ser una palabrería, ¡ésta no! Tranquilizadoramente simple y listo en poco más de una hora','["500 g de patatas harinosas, cortadas en trozos","1 colinabo mediano (que pesa alrededor de 600 g/1 libra 5 oz), cortado en trozos","Tarrina de 200 g de queso tierno desnatado con ajo y hierbas","150 ml de caldo de verduras","4 cucharaditas de harina de maíz, mezclada con 2 cucharadas de agua fría","650 g de bacalao deshuesado y sin piel, cortado en trozos grandes","100 g de gambas cocidas peladas","1 cucharadita de perejil fresco picado"]','["Cocine las patatas y el nabo en agua hirviendo hasta que estén tiernos (unos 20 minutos).","Precaliente el horno a 190C/gas 5/ventilador 170C. Mientras se cocinan las patatas y el nabo, ponga el queso tierno y el caldo en una cacerola grande y caliente suavemente, revolviendo con una cuchara de madera, hasta que se mezclen y queden suaves. Ahora agregue la harina de maíz licuada y cocine hasta que espese.","Incorpora el pescado a la salsa con las gambas y el perejil. Sazone con un poco de pimienta.","Vierta la mezcla en una fuente para horno de 1,5 litros/2¾ pinta. Escurrir las patatas y el nabo, triturarlos bien y sazonar con pimienta negra. Vierta el puré sobre el pescado para cubrirlo por completo. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté bien caliente, luego transfiéralo a una parrilla caliente durante unos minutos para dorar la parte superior. Sirva con guisantes congelados o maíz dulce."]','2026-01-11 13:06:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15104,5545,'es','Ensalada de judías verdes con menta','Solo 5 ingredientes en esta ensalada vegana veraniega; también puedes prepararla con un día de anticipación','["600 g de judías verdes, peladas","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo gordos, en rodajas finas","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","3 cucharadas de menta fresca picada"]','["Cocine los frijoles en agua hirviendo con sal durante 5 a 6 minutos, hasta que estén tiernos, luego escurra y refresque con agua corriente fría. Agite bien para eliminar el exceso de agua y luego seque con papel de cocina. Puedes hacerlo el día anterior y guardar las judías cocidas en el frigorífico, en un bol tapado con film transparente.","Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén pequeña, añadir el ajo y sofreír rápidamente hasta que esté crujiente y ligeramente dorado. Verter en un bol con el aceite de la sartén y dejar enfriar. Esto se puede hacer el día anterior, cubrir con film transparente y enfriar.","Ese día, mezcle el resto del aceite, el vinagre, la menta, la sal y la pimienta. Vierta sobre los frijoles y mezcle bien. Vierta en un tazón para servir y esparza sobre el ajo en su aceite."]','2026-01-11 13:06:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15105,5549,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: Dauphinoise de patata','La crème fraîche, el caldo y la leche semidesnatada reemplazan los ingredientes tradicionales para hacer de esta Dauphinoise la más saludable hasta el momento.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","150ml de leche semidesnatada","1 diente de ajo gordito, pelado y cortado por la mitad","4 ramitas de tomillo, más unas extra para espolvorear","1 hoja de laurel","1 chalota, picada en trozos grandes","buena pizca de nuez moscada recién rallada","1 kg de patatas cerosas (prueba Desirée)","140 g de crema fresca entera","75 ml de caldo de verduras (caldo de caléndula)","1 cucharadita de hojas de tomillo","25 g de gruyere o alternativa vegetariana, rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nCepille el aceite sobre el fondo y los lados.\r\nde una fuente refractaria de 25 x 19 x 5 cm. poner\r\nla leche, el ajo, 4 ramitas de tomillo, el laurel\r\nhoja y chalota en una cacerola. traer\r\nhasta que hierva, luego retírelo del\r\ncalentar y añadir la nuez moscada y un poco\r\npimienta. Reservar para infundir.","Pelar y luego cortar las patatas en rodajas muy finas.\r\nSéquelos con palmaditas. Coloque la mitad de las rodajas en la\r\nplato, superponiéndolos ligeramente, luego sazone.","Cuela la leche infusionada en una jarra. poner\r\nla crème fraîche en un bol, luego\r\nvierta gradualmente la leche, batiendo hasta\r\nsuave. Agrega el caldo y las hojas de tomillo.\r\nRegrese este líquido a la jarra, luego vierta\r\nla mitad sobre las patatas en el plato.\r\nColoque el resto de las patatas en capas y luego\r\nagregue el líquido restante, el queso y un\r\nmoler pimienta. Sienta el plato sobre una bandeja para hornear.\r\nbandeja y hornee durante 1¼-1½ horas hasta que esté dorado.\r\ny tierno – pruebe insertando un cuchillo afilado\r\nCorta las patatas con un cuchillo. Dejar reposar 5 minutos\r\nantes de servir, espolvoreado con ramitas de tomillo."]','2026-01-11 13:06:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15106,5551,'es','Sopa de guisantes y menta','Un entrante o refrigerio súper saludable, excelente, frío o caliente.','["1 manojo de cebolletas, peladas y picadas en trozos grandes","1 papa mediana, pelada y cortada en cubitos","1 diente de ajo, machacado","850 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo","900 g de guisantes tiernos en la vaina (para obtener unos 250 g de guisantes sin cáscara)","4 cucharadas de menta fresca picada","pizca grande de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de jugo de lima o limón fresco","150 ml de suero de leche o nata agria"]','["Pon las cebolletas en una sartén grande con la patata, el ajo y el caldo. Llevar a ebullición, bajar el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos o hasta que la papa esté muy suave. Para la guarnición, blanquear 3 cucharadas de\r\nlos guisantes sin cáscara en agua hirviendo durante\r\n2-3 minutos, escurrir, poner en un recipiente con agua fría y reservar. Agregue los guisantes restantes a la base de sopa y cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n5 minutos – no más, o perderás el delicioso sabor fresco de los guisantes.","Agrega la menta, el azúcar y el jugo de limón o lima, deja enfriar un poco, luego vierte en un procesador de alimentos o licuadora y bate hasta que quede tan suave como desees. Agregue la mitad del suero de leche o la crema agria, pruebe y sazone con sal y pimienta.","Para servir la sopa fría, enfríe rápidamente y luego enfríe; es posible que deba agregar más caldo a la sopa antes de servir, ya que se espesará a medida que se enfríe. Para servir caliente, regrese la sopa a la sartén enjuagada y vuelva a calentarla sin que hierva (para evitar que el suero de leche o la crema agria se cuajen).","Sirva la sopa en tazones, adornada con el resto del suero de leche y los guisantes escurridos."]','2026-01-11 13:06:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15107,5553,'es','Pasta de atún saludable','Prueba nuestra pasta de atún saludable, fácil y rápida. Es reconfortante, pero también incluye tres de sus cinco al día y puede duplicarse para alimentar a una familia.','["150 g de penne integral","1 puerro grande (200 g), partido por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","160 g de tomates cherry, preferiblemente en rama","Lata de 198 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","75 g de ricota","Lata de 160 g de atún en agua de manantial, escurrido","un puñado de albahaca picada y unas cuantas hojas enteras para servir"]','["Hervir el penne con el puerro en una cacerola grande con agua con sal siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, hasta que esté al dente.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto y fríe los tomates durante unos minutos, hasta que empiecen a reventar y ablandarse. Agregue el maíz dulce y cocine durante 2-3 minutos para que se caliente. Escurrir la pasta y los puerros reservando un poco del agua de la pasta. Vierta la pasta escurrida y los puerros en la sartén con los tomates, luego agregue la ricota y el atún.","Sazone con abundante pimienta negra. Si desea aflojar la consistencia, agregue un poco del agua de la pasta reservada junto con la albahaca picada. Sirva esparcidas con las hojas enteras de albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:06:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15108,5555,'es','Perritos calientes con palitos de pescado','Una versión diferente del clásico sándwich de palitos de pescado que encantará a toda la familia. Pruebe el truco de Paul AInsworth de salar ligeramente el bacalao para endurecerlo antes de cocinarlo: es un punto de inflexión','["300-400 g de abadejo o bacalao sin piel y huesos, cortado en 4 palitos de pescado en trozos","25 g de harina común","1 huevo batido","100 g de pan rallado panko","aceite de girasol, para freír","1 pepinillo, finamente picado","4 cucharadas de mayonesa","1 cucharada de jugo de limón y gajos de limón, para servir","4 panecillos brioche para hot dog","½ lechuga iceberg, rallada"]','["Si tiene tiempo, sazone ligeramente el pescado con hojuelas de sal marina hasta una hora antes de cubrirlo, luego cúbralo y enfríelo para que se endurezca. Ponga la harina mezclada con un poco de sal y pimienta en un bol poco profundo, luego el huevo batido y el pan rallado en otros dos boles. Trabajando en tandas, cubra primero el pescado con la harina sazonada, luego sacuda el exceso y sumérjalo en el huevo, seguido del pan rallado, luego coloque los palitos de pescado rebozados en un plato. Se puede preparar con un día de anticipación y mantenerlo frío durante la noche.","Vierte suficiente aceite en una sartén grande para que cubra la base. Calienta el aceite a fuego medio-alto, luego fríe los palitos de pescado en tandas hasta que estén dorados por cada lado y bien cocidos (aproximadamente 3-4 minutos por cada lado). Escurrir sobre papel de cocina, sazonar con sal marina y luego transferir a horno lento para mantener el calor mientras se prepara la salsa.","Pon los pepinillos en un bol y mézclalos con la mayonesa y el jugo de limón. Divida los panecillos para hot dog, tueste el lado cortado debajo de la parrilla, luego unte cada panecillo con 1 cucharada de la mezcla de mayonesa, agregue un puñado de lechuga y luego un dedo de pescado caliente encima. Sirva con las rodajas de limón para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15109,5557,'es','Atún braseado y espárragos niçoise','Obtenga atún de una pescadería de buena calidad para hacer esta impresionante ensalada niçoise de atún braseado y espárragos. Debe ser apto para sashimi, por lo que se puede comer crudo de forma segura.','["300 g de patatas nuevas pequeñas, partidas por la mitad","250 g de espárragos","3 huevos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","200 g de lomo de atún de corte grueso apto para sashimi o 2 filetes de atún","3 tomates grandes, en cuartos","50 g de aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad","10 alcaparras","5 filetes de anchoa","½ diente de ajo pequeño, machacado","70ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","½ limón, exprimido"]','["Cocine las patatas en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal durante 12 minutos, o hasta que se pueda insertar fácilmente un cuchillo para cubiertos. Pasar a un bol con una espumadera y dejar secar al vapor. Agregue los espárragos a la sartén y hierva durante 2 minutos, luego póngalos en un recipiente con agua helada y reserve.","Ponga a hervir otra cacerola con agua a fuego medio-alto y cocine los huevos durante 7½ minutos. Escurrir, luego agregar los huevos al recipiente con agua con los espárragos.","Para el aderezo, machacar las anchoas y los ajos con un mortero y un mortero hasta obtener una pasta muy suave. Vierta esto en un tazón, luego agregue el aceite de oliva virgen extra y el jugo de limón. Estación.","Para dorar el atún, caliente el aceite de oliva en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio-alto y cocine durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado, hasta que tenga un color ligeramente dorado. Cortar en trozos gruesos (aún debe estar rosado en el medio), luego pelar y cortar los huevos por la mitad.","Mezcle las papas, los espárragos, los tomates, las aceitunas, las alcaparras y el aderezo en una fuente grande para servir. Cubra con los huevos y las rodajas de atún, luego sazone bien y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:06:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15110,5563,'es','Dauphinoise de eglefino ahumado','Agregue eglefino ahumado a la dauphinoise para hacer un pastel de pescado más fácil de congelar. Es una cena estupenda y sin complicaciones cuando invitas a familiares o amigos.','["1 kg de patatas Maris Piper o King Edward, peladas y cortadas en rodajas lo más finas posible","300ml de nata doble","1 cucharadita de hojas de tomillo, más extra para servir","25 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","300 g de eglefino ahumado sin piel, cortado en trozos finos","pequeña nuez de mantequilla, para el plato","berros, para servir"]','["Ponga las patatas en una cacerola con agua fría con sal y déjelas hervir, luego apague el fuego. Escurrir bien. Vuelva a colocar las patatas en la sartén y vierta sobre la nata, luego agregue el tomillo, dos tercios del parmesano y el eglefino. Sazone y mezcle todo suavemente.","Unte con mantequilla una fuente para gratinar de tamaño mediano y luego agregue la mezcla de papas. Espolvoree con el queso parmesano restante. Se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado durante un día o congelado durante tres meses. Descongele completamente antes de cocinar.","Calienta el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Hornea durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante en los bordes. Deje enfriar durante al menos 5 minutos y luego sirva directamente del plato con una ensalada de berros aderezada al lado, si lo desea. Espolvoree con un poco más de tomillo y muela un poco de pimienta negra para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15111,5565,'es','pastel de pescado harissa','Agregue harissa al pastel de pescado y cubra con batata para darle un toque diferente a un clásico. Nutricionalmente equilibrado y saciante, es ideal para una comida familiar.','["700 g de batatas (3-4 pequeñas o 2 grandes)","3 cucharadas de aceite de colza","pizca de comino","pizca de pimentón ahumado","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 pimiento rojo, finamente picado","350ml de leche semidesnatada","350 g de mezcla para pastel de pescado (asegúrate de que contenga eglefino ahumado)","225 g de langostinos congelados y descongelados","2½ cucharadas de pasta de harissa","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","30ml de nata doble","200 g de espinacas, picadas en trozos grandes","judías verdes al vapor, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Pinchar las batatas con un tenedor y cocinar durante 50 minutos-1 hora o hasta que la pulpa esté suave (o en el microondas a potencia alta durante 5-7 minutos). Quitar la piel y triturar la pulpa con 2 cucharadas de aceite, el comino y el pimentón. Reservar y mantener caliente.","Mientras tanto, caliente una sartén con la cucharada de aceite restante y cocine las cebollas y los pimientos a fuego medio hasta que estén suaves, aproximadamente 7 minutos. Calentar la leche en una cacerola a fuego medio-bajo y agregar la mezcla de pastel de pescado y los langostinos. Cocine durante 4 minutos hasta que los langostinos se pongan rosados, luego saque el pescado y los langostinos. Reserva la leche.","Agregue la pasta de harissa a las cebollas y los pimientos y cocine por 2 minutos. Incorpora la maicena, luego añade poco a poco la leche reservada, removiendo a medida que avanzas, seguida de la nata. Agrega las espinacas y cocina por 2 minutos hasta que se ablanden, luego agrega el pescado y los langostinos, revolviendo con cuidado para evitar que se rompan.","Vierta la mezcla de pescado en una fuente refractaria de aproximadamente 25 x 18 cm. Coloque con cuidado la batata encima, de un extremo a otro y juntándose en el medio. Extiéndalo con cuidado con un cuchillo y luego revíselo con un tenedor para formar crestas. Hornee durante 20 minutos, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 10 minutos en la temperatura más alta. Servir con las judías verdes."]','2026-01-11 13:06:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15112,5567,'es','Bacalao al horno con cremoso de champiñones y orzo de puerros','Prepara nuestro bacalao al horno con orzo, cremoso de champiñones y puerros en tan solo 20 minutos. Es una cena súper rápida: una excelente opción para los días de trabajo ocupados.','["3 cucharadas de harina común","4 filetes de bacalao","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 limón, rallado y en rodajas","½ manojo pequeño de tomillo","2 puerros, rebanados","200 g de champiñones, en rodajas","300 g de oro","500 ml de caldo bajo en sal","2 cucharadas de crema fresca"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Verter la harina en un bol y sazonar. Sumerja cada filete de bacalao en la harina hasta que esté uniformemente cubierto. Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio-alto y fríe el bacalao por cada lado durante 2 minutos, o hasta que esté dorado. Transfiera a una fuente para asar con las rodajas de limón encima y la mitad del tomillo. Hornee por 10 minutos.","Calentar el aceite restante en una sartén y sofreír los puerros y los champiñones durante 5 minutos a fuego medio-alto. Agrega el orzo y el caldo y cocina durante 10 minutos a fuego alto, revolviendo continuamente hasta que estén tiernos. Revuelva con la crema fresca y la ralladura de limón. Estación. Servir el orzo con el bacalao encima, junto con las rodajas de limón asadas."]','2026-01-11 13:06:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15113,5569,'es','Pescado a la brasa con limón y romero','Invierte en una jaula para peces si eres amante de los mariscos, ya que esto hace que hacer barbacoas sea mucho más fácil. Si no tienes uno, sala el pescado o cocínalo con limón.','["2 doradas o lubinas medianas (de unos 600 g cada una), o 4 caballas, escamas y evisceradas (quítales las aletas y las cabezas, si lo prefieres)","un puñado de ramitas de romero","2 limones, 1 en rodajas finas y 1 partido por la mitad","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar"]','["Encienda la barbacoa; desea una capa uniforme de brasas cenicientas a fuego medio. Si tienes una barbacoa de gas, ponla a fuego medio. Sazone las cavidades del pescado con sal y pimienta, luego rellénelas con la mayoría de las ramitas de romero y las rodajas de limón. Cepille o frote la piel del pescado con aceite de oliva y sazone bien con escamas de sal marina. Si tiene una jaula para peces, coloque el pescado dentro con las rodajas de limón restantes y las ramitas de romero y colóquelo en la parrilla. Alternativamente, esparza las rodajas de limón y las ramitas de romero directamente sobre la parrilla y coloque el pescado encima (consulte el consejo a continuación para cocinar en el interior).","Cocine el pescado durante 8 a 10 minutos por cada lado hasta que la piel esté ligeramente carbonizada y con ampollas y el pescado esté bien cocido. Mientras se cocina, coloque las mitades de limón con el lado cortado hacia abajo en la parrilla y cocine hasta que aparezcan marcas de carbonilla. Sirva el pescado rociado con extra de aceite y los limones carbonizados para exprimirlos."]','2026-01-11 13:06:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15114,5571,'es','Guiso de huevos de la huerta con plátano verde cocido','Pruebe algo diferente para la cena con este abundante guiso de huevos de la huerta (también conocidos como berenjena blanca) de inspiración africana con huevos y pescado salado. Disfruta con plátano verde','["1 tilapia (koobi) entera seca y salada","11 berenjenas blancas pequeñas, recortadas y partidas por la mitad","2 chiles Scotch Bonnet","2 cebollas moradas indias o pequeñas, 1 picada, 1 en rodajas","4-6 plátanos verdes, pelados, cada uno cortado en 2-3 trozos","2 huevos grandes","2-4 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní","½ cubito de camarones (opcional)","½ cucharadita de aromat (opcional)","30 g de pescado salado fermentado (momoni)","120 ml de aceite de colza y fruto de palma roja (usamos aceite de cocina Carotino Mild & Light, disponible en Morrisons y Tesco)","120 g de lata de sardinas en aceite escurridas","1 aguacate, deshuesado, partido por la mitad, pelado y en rodajas"]','["El día anterior, poner la tilapia entera seca en un bol grande, cubrir con agua fría y dejar en remojo durante la noche.","Al día siguiente, poner las berenjenas blancas y los chiles Scotch Bonnet en una cacerola, cubrir con agua fría y tapar, luego llevar a ebullición a fuego medio-alto. Cocine durante 10-12 minutos, luego escurra y reserve.","Mientras tanto, ponga la cebolla picada en una olla asanka y muela hasta obtener una pasta. Si no tiene una olla asanka, puede usar un procesador de alimentos o una licuadora; si usa una licuadora, escurra el agua después de licuar.","Escurre el agua de la tilapia y luego enjuaga el pescado con agua corriente fría para eliminar el exceso de sal.","En una sartén aparte a fuego medio-alto, hierva los plátanos verdes, los huevos y suficiente agua para cubrirlos. Una vez que hierva, agrega la tilapia. Cocine durante 10-12 minutos, luego retire del fuego. Saque el pescado de la sartén con una espumadera y transfiéralo a un plato. Dejar reposar. Escurrir los plátanos y los huevos, luego llenar la cacerola con agua fría y dejar reposar durante 5 minutos.","Mientras tanto, poner los chiles en la olla asanka o procesador de alimentos con la cebolla y triturar. Cuando la mezcla esté suave, añade 2-3 berenjenas y vuelve a triturar. Continuar este proceso hasta haber añadido todas las berenjenas. Agregue la mantequilla de maní, luego sazone con la mitad del cubo de camarones, si lo usa, y el aroma, si es necesario (pruebe el condimento antes de agregar el aroma).","Enjuague el pescado salado fermentado con agua corriente fría. Calentar el fruto de la palma roja y el aceite de colza en una sartén a fuego medio y freír el pescado salado fermentado durante unos 3-5 minutos. Retire el pescado de la sartén con una espumadera o una rodaja de pescado y retire las espinas visibles. Agrega el pescado a la olla asanka y muele con la mezcla de berenjena. Deseche las espinas de pescado.","Agrega las cebollas cortadas en rodajas a la sartén y sofríe durante 3-5 minutos, luego agrega la mezcla de berenjena y revuelve bien. Reduzca el fuego a bajo y cocine durante 3-5 minutos. Incorpora las sardinas. Cocine a fuego lento durante unos 2 minutos más y mezcle todo bien.","Transfiera la mezcla a una olla asanka o a un tazón para servir. Escurre los plátanos, pela y corta por la mitad los huevos duros, luego agrégalos a la olla. Cubra con el aguacate y la tilapia, luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:06:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15115,5575,'es','Salmón entrantes','Convierta una guarnición de salmón en un magnífico centro de mesa con solo unos pocos ingredientes de antipasti mediterráneos. Hornee en el horno o cocine en la barbacoa para obtener un excelente plato de verano.','["100 g de tomates secos en aceite, escurridos y finamente picados","un puñado pequeño de albahaca, finamente picada, más unas cuantas hojas enteras de albahaca","un puñado pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado, más unas cuantas hojas de eneldo para servir","2 cucharadas de alcaparras, escurridas y enjuagadas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 limón, rallado y en rodajas","150 g de mantequilla blanda","600 g de guarnición de salmón, desescamado y sin espinas","3 cucharadas de aceitunas negras deshuesadas","100 g de corazones de alcachofa a la plancha, escurridos y picados en trozos grandes"]','["Ponga los tomates, la mitad de las hierbas, 1 cucharada de alcaparras, el ajo, la ralladura de limón y la mantequilla en un bol y tritúrelos con una cuchara. Alternativamente, vierta en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que se combinen. La mantequilla aromatizada se mantendrá fría hasta por dos días.","Coloque una capa de papel para hornear lo suficientemente grande como para envolver sin apretar el salmón sobre una hoja de papel de aluminio del mismo tamaño. Colocar encima el salmón y luego cortar el pescado en porciones, sin cortar hasta la piel, para que el filete quede intacto. Haga las porciones tan grandes o pequeñas como desee, dependiendo de cuántos esté alimentando. Unte la mantequilla aromatizada sobre el salmón, luego cubra con las alcaparras restantes, las rodajas de limón, las aceitunas y las alcachofas. Envuelva el papel de aluminio y el pergamino sobre el salmón y apriete los extremos para sellar, creando un paquete suelto.","Para hornear el salmón, calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Colocar el paquete en una bandeja para horno y cocinar durante 30 minutos, luego dejar reposar unos minutos antes de desenvolverlo. Alternativamente, encienda la barbacoa, espere a que las llamas se apaguen, coloque el paquete directamente en la parrilla y cocine durante 8 a 15 minutos, o hasta que el salmón esté bien cocido. Compruebe que el salmón esté cocido empujando la pulpa con un tenedor; debería desmenuzarse fácilmente. Sirva en un plato, espolvoree con las hierbas restantes y vierta por encima los jugos mantecosos."]','2026-01-11 13:06:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15116,5577,'es','Espaguetis de Amalfi con limón, chile y anchoas','Pruebe Italia con este plato de espaguetis inspirado en la costa de Amalfi y condimentado con limones, anchoas, chile, ajo y parmesano.','["120ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","3 dientes de ajo grandes","350 g de espaguetis, bucatini o linguini","1-2 chiles rojos (dependiendo de qué tan picante los quieras), sin semillas y finamente picados","8 filetes de anchoa, finamente picados","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","1 limón Amalfi grande o sin cera, rallado y exprimido","un puñado grande (unos 40 g) de parmesano finamente rallado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego lento y fríe el ajo durante 2-3 minutos, o hasta que esté dorado en los bordes. Retirar del fuego y dejar reposar 15 minutos para que el ajo se infusione en el aceite.","Mientras tanto, cocina la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete hasta que esté al dente. Escurrir reservando 150ml del agua de cocción. Retire el ajo del aceite infundido, luego agregue los espaguetis cocidos, los chiles, las anchoas, el perejil, la ralladura y el jugo de limón y el parmesano. Agregue 50 ml del agua reservada y mezcle con unas pinzas hasta que se combinen. Agrega un poco más de agua para aflojar, si lo deseas. Estación. Divida en cuatro tazones poco profundos."]','2026-01-11 13:06:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15117,5579,'es','Bandeja horneada con salmón y tomate especiado','Disfrute de este saludable horneado en bandeja de tomate y salmón especiado con un suave sabor a curry para una comida rápida y fácil entre semana. Servir con pan naan y rodajas de limón.','["1 cebolla morada, en rodajas","200 g de tomates cherry","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry suave o madrás","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","2 filetes de salmón sin piel","1 pan naan grande o 2 pequeños","2 cucharadas de yogur sin grasa","rodajas de limón y unas hojas de cilantro, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle la cebolla, los tomates, 2 cucharadas de pasta de curry, los garbanzos y 200 ml de agua en una fuente para asar profunda de 20 x 25 cm. Ase durante 15 minutos hasta que las cebollas estén tiernas y los tomates apenas revienten.","Revuelve todo y luego sazona. Unte el resto de la pasta de curry sobre los filetes de salmón y sazone. Coloque el salmón en las verduras en la lata y ase durante otros 8 a 10 minutos, o hasta que esté cocido a su gusto.","Mientras tanto, caliente los panes naan; puede hacerlo colocándolos directamente en la rejilla del horno debajo de la fuente para asar. Corta los panes naan calientes en gajos. Mezcle el yogur con las verduras en la lata, luego sirva con las rodajas de naan para mojar, unas cuantas hojas de cilantro espolvoreadas, si lo desea, y las rodajas de limón, si las usa, para exprimirlas."]','2026-01-11 13:06:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15118,5581,'es','Cataplana de merluza y marisco','Deléitate con este plato de inspiración portuguesa con mejillones y langostinos. Es saludable, bajo en calorías y proporciona tres de las cinco calorías diarias, junto con hierro, ácido fólico, vitamina C y fibra.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza prensado en frío","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","250 g de patatas para ensalada, cortadas en trozos","1 pimiento rojo grande, sin semillas y picado","1 calabacín (200 g), en rodajas gruesas","2 tomates picados (150 g)","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","1 cucharada de vinagre de sidra (opcional)","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 filetes de merluza sin piel (paquete de 240g)","Paquete de 150g de mejillones cocidos (sin concha)","60 g de gambas peladas","un puñado grande de perejil picado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén ancha antiadherente con tapa hermética. Freír las cebollas y las patatas durante unos 5 minutos o hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agregue los pimientos, los calabacines, los tomates y el ajo, luego agregue el vinagre, si lo usa, el caldo y 200 ml de agua. Llevar a fuego lento, tapar y cocinar durante 25 minutos, o hasta que los pimientos y los calabacines estén muy tiernos (si su sartén no tiene una tapa hermética, humedezca una hoja de papel para hornear y colóquela sobre el guiso antes de tapar; esto ayuda a retener los jugos).","Agrega los filetes de merluza, los mejillones y las gambas, luego tapa y cocina durante 5 minutos más, o hasta que el pescado se desmenuce fácilmente al probarlo con un tenedor. Esparcir por encima el perejil y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15119,5585,'es','Tortitas de pescado al curry','Prepare un lote de estos pasteles de bacalao con especias y congélelos para las noches ocupadas de la semana. Sirva con ensalada y ensalada de col para una sabrosa comida familiar.','["500 g de patatas Maris Piper, peladas y cortadas en trozos de 3 cm","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","1 trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y rallado","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","2-3 cucharadas colmadas de curry en polvo mediano","4 filetes de bacalao con piel","400ml de leche semidesnatada","1 limón pequeño, rallado y exprimido","150 g de harina común","2 huevos medianos, batidos","150 g de pan rallado panko","hojas de ensalada y ensalada de repollo, para servir"]','["Pon las patatas en una cacerola grande, cúbrelas con agua fría y déjalas hervir. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine durante 8-10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor durante 5 minutos. Triture ligeramente las patatas con un machacador de patatas hasta que queden ligeramente grumosas.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio. Freír el ajo, el jengibre, las semillas de mostaza y el curry en polvo durante 1 min. Agrega las especias a las patatas, sazona con sal y reserva.","Pon el bacalao en una cacerola grande a fuego medio, vierte sobre la leche y deja hervir a fuego lento. Retirar inmediatamente del fuego, tapar y dejar reposar durante 10 minutos para pochar. Levante el pescado con una espumadera, luego retírelo y deseche la piel. Desmenuce la pulpa en la mezcla de papa en trozos grandes, luego incorpórela con la ralladura de limón y el jugo. Con las manos, forme ocho croquetas de pescado con la mezcla.","Coloque la harina, los huevos y el pan rallado en tres tazones poco profundos separados. Sumerja cada pastel de pescado en harina, luego en huevos y luego en pan rallado. Reservar en una bandeja para hornear. Para congelar, cubra y congele en la bandeja hasta que esté sólido, luego transfiéralo a recipientes aptos para el congelador.","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio y calienta el horno a fuego lento. Freír las croquetas de pescado en tandas durante 5-6 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas y crujientes. Mantenlas calientes en el horno mientras las cocinas. Sirva con las hojas de ensalada y la ensalada de repollo a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:06:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15120,5587,'es','Salmón picante con remolacha asada y espinacas','Esta cena de salmón fresca y abundante está repleta de ingredientes saludables para el corazón, es rica en calcio, hierro y vitamina C y constituye 4 de tus 5 al día.','["4 remolachas frescas pequeñas, unos 200 g","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva prensado en frío","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro, ligeramente trituradas","2 filetes de salmón o trucha sin piel","2½ naranjas pequeñas, ralladura de 1 y jugo de la mitad","3 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza","1 diente de ajo","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","4 puñados de hojas tiernas de espinaca","1 aguacate, en rodajas gruesas"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C, ventilador de 160C, gas 4. Cortar los tallos de la remolacha y reservar las hojas tiernas que sean aptas para comer en la ensalada. Corte las remolachas en cuartos, luego mezcle con 1/2 cucharada de aceite, las semillas de cilantro y un poco de condimento, luego apílelas en el centro de una hoja grande de papel de aluminio y envuélvalas como un paquete. Hornee por 45 minutos o hasta que las remolachas estén tiernas, luego cubra con el salmón, esparza la mitad de la ralladura de naranja y regrese al horno por 15 minutos. Si quieres tostar las semillas de calabaza, mételas al horno durante 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, corte la cáscara y la médula de 2 naranjas y luego corte los gajos con un cuchillo afilado trabajando sobre un bol para recoger el jugo. Rallar finamente el ajo y dejar reposar 10 minutos para que se activen las enzimas. Agrega el ajo al jugo de naranja y el resto del aceite de oliva con el condimento para hacer un aderezo.","Retirar el paquete del horno y retirar con cuidado el pescado. Vierta la remolacha en un bol con la cebolla morada, la ralladura de naranja restante, las semillas de calabaza y las hojas de espinaca y revuelva bien. Mezcle suavemente los gajos de naranja y el aguacate con las hojas de remolacha, luego apílelos en platos y cubra con el salmón tibio. Rocíe sobre el aderezo y sirva mientras aún esté caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15121,5589,'es','Tajín de mariscos','Utilice una mezcla congelada de pescado y mariscos para preparar este guiso marroquí, servido sobre un sabroso cuscús de almendras.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, picada","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y picado","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de harissa","2 latas de 400g de tomate picado","400g lata de garbanzos","Bolsa de 350g selección de mariscos congelados","300 g de cuscús","paquete pequeño de cilantro, solo las hojas, picado en trozos grandes","25 g de almendras laminadas tostadas","ralladura y jugo de ½ limón, reservando el otro ½ para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y cocina la cebolla y el pimiento rojo durante unos 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo, la harissa y los tomates picados y cocine durante unos 10 minutos hasta que espese. Agregue los mariscos congelados y cocine bien, unos 10 minutos más.","Coloque el cuscús en un recipiente para servir, viértalo con agua hirviendo hasta cubrirlo y luego cubra con film transparente. Déjelo en remojo mientras se cocina el tajine, luego agregue la mayor parte del cilantro, las almendras, la ralladura y el jugo de limón y el condimento. Sirve el tajine con el cuscús y corta la mitad restante del limón en gajos para exprimirlo. Espolvoree el cilantro restante y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:06:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15122,5591,'es','Pescado al vapor con cítricos y jengibre con verduras salteadas','Ahorre tiempo y sirva una cena saludable entre semana con esta receta rápida de pescado blanco al estilo asiático con ajo, jengibre, pimiento rojo y brotes de soja.','["ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","1 cucharada de salsa de soja reducida en sal","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino blanco o vinagre de arroz","Paquete de 300g de 2 filetes o lomos de pescado blanco","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado muy fino","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","10 cebolletas, partidas por la mitad y cortadas a lo largo","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","140 g de brotes de soja","1-2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo tostadas"]','["Mezclar la ralladura y el jugo de naranja, la soja y el vinagre. Cubra la parte superior de una vaporera con papel para hornear y caliente agua en la base. Cubra el pescado con un poco de jengibre, agréguelo a la vaporera y vierta 2 cucharadas de aderezo. Cubra y cocine al vapor durante 5-6 minutos hasta que el pescado se desmenuce fácilmente.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en un wok antiadherente y sofríe las cebolletas, el ajo, la pimienta y el jengibre restante durante 2 minutos. Agrega los brotes de soja y cocina por 2 minutos más. Vierta el jugo del pescado en las verduras. Revuelva con el aderezo, luego divídalo en tazones, cubra con el pescado y esparza las semillas de sésamo."]','2026-01-11 13:06:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15123,5593,'es','Paquetes de pescado con salsa romesco y verduras','La salsa romesco se elabora con pimientos, almendras, guindilla y ajo. Combínelo con pescado blanco y una mezcla de coliflor y cebolleta.','["2 filetes de pescado blanco firmes (nosotros utilizamos bacalao)","4 rodajas de limón","2 ramitas de tomillo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","½ coliflor, cortada en gajos","10 cebolletas, con las puntas recortadas y las raíces intactas","1 rebanada de pan de masa madre, partida en trozos","1 chile rojo (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante)","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","10 almendras blanqueadas","2 pimientos rojos ya asados, de un frasco","1 tomate, pelado (ver consejo a continuación)","½ cucharadita de vinagre de jerez"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque cada filete de pescado en un trozo grande de papel para hornear y cubra cada uno con unas rodajas de limón y una ramita de tomillo. Rocíe con 1 cucharadita de aceite y sazone. Dobla los bordes superiores de cada trozo de pergamino para formar un sello, luego arruga los extremos como si fuera un envoltorio de dulce. Coloque los paquetes en una bandeja para hornear y hornee en el horno durante 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, cocine la coliflor al vapor durante 4 minutos, luego agregue las cebolletas durante 3 minutos más o hasta que estén tiernas. Seque las verduras, luego mezcle las verduras con 2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva y sazone. En una sartén grande, tuesta los trozos de pan en el aceite restante, luego agrega la guindilla y el ajo y cocina por 1 min. Vierta en un procesador de alimentos con las nueces, los pimientos, el tomate y el vinagre, y presione hasta obtener una pasta rugosa. Salpimentar y reservar.","Limpiar y calentar la sartén. Agregue las rodajas de coliflor y las cebolletas y cocine durante unos minutos por cada lado para que se doren. Servir junto con el pescado y la salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:06:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15124,5595,'es','Pescado al horno con tomate, albahaca y migas crujientes','Una cena horneada en bandeja baja en grasa y llena de sabor. Combine pescado blanco magro con tomates cherry, pesto rallado, judías verdes y brócoli.','["2 latas de 400 g de tomates cherry","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","3 cucharadas de pesto de albahaca","2 cucharadas de pan rallado","4 filetes de pescado blanco, firmes y sin piel (de unos 140 g cada uno)","Paquete de 320 g de judías verdes.","Paquete de 320 g de brócoli de tallo fino"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Coloque los tomates en una fuente para asar y agregue el vinagre y 1 cucharada de pesto. Sazone, mezcle y luego hornee durante 10 minutos.","Mezcle el pesto restante y el pan rallado, luego presione sobre cada filete de pescado. Agregue a la fuente para asar y regrese al horno durante 12 a 15 minutos hasta que el pescado se desmenuce fácilmente y la cobertura esté ligeramente crujiente.","Mientras tanto, hierva las judías verdes y el brócoli y luego escurra. Sirve el horneado espolvoreado con las verduras."]','2026-01-11 13:06:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15125,5597,'es','Pescado al limón y pimienta con verduras asadas','Una cena ligera de pescado blanco con una capa de pan rallado y una mezcla de verduras asadas con pimientos, calabacines y cebollas inspirada en el pisto.','["3 pimientos mixtos, sin semillas y rebanados","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos","3 calabacines, cortados en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","50 g de aceitunas negras","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","4 cucharadas de pan rallado seco","ralladura de ½ limón y gajos para servir","1 cucharadita de pimienta negra triturada","3 filetes de pescado blanco congelado (como bacalao, eglefino o abadejo)","2 cucharadas de harina común","1 huevo mediano, batido"]','["Mezcle las verduras con el ajo, las hierbas, las aceitunas y el aceite. Sazone y vierta sobre una bandeja forrada con papel para hornear. Congele las verduras hasta que estén sólidas, luego transfiéralas a una bolsa grande para congelar y póngalas en el congelador.","Batir el pan rallado hasta que esté fino y luego tostarlo durante unos segundos en una sartén seca, agitando para evitar que se queme. Vierta en un bol y mezcle con la ralladura de limón, la pimienta y una pizca grande de sal. Vierta en una bolsa pequeña para congelador y métala en el congelador. Tanto las verduras como las migajas se pueden congelar hasta por 3 meses.","Para cocinar congeladas, caliente el horno a 200C/220C ventilador/gas 7. Coloque las verduras en una fuente para asar y cocine durante 15 minutos. Mientras tanto, espolvorear el pescado congelado con harina, untarlo ligeramente con huevo y cubrir con pan rallado congelado. Coloca el pescado en una parrilla y colócalo encima de las verduras. Hornea por 25 minutos hasta que el pescado esté cocido. Servir con rodajas de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:06:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15126,5599,'es','Salmón pegajoso sin semillas con ensalada satsuma','Un plato de pescado de múltiples texturas y colores con nutritivas semillas y una vibrante ensalada de berros cítricos','["2 filetes de salmón sin piel, de unos 140 g cada uno","2 cucharaditas de sirope de agave o miel","2-3 cucharadas de semillas mixtas","4 satsumas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","Bolsa de 50 g de berros.","Paquete de 250 g de remolacha cocida (no en vinagre), escurrida y cortada en gajos finos"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Unte cada filete de salmón con la mitad del jarabe de agave o miel, espolvoree un poco de pimienta negra y luego presione las semillas. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante unos 15 minutos, dependiendo del grosor del pescado, hasta que esté bien cocido y las semillas crujientes.","Mientras tanto, corta la piel de las satsumas y córtalas en gajos, reservando todo el jugo que sale para el aderezo. Batir el jugo con el aceite de oliva, el vinagre y un poco de condimento en un bol pequeño.","Mezcle los gajos de berro, remolacha y satsuma con el aderezo y divídalos en platos. Añade un trozo de salmón a cada uno."]','2026-01-11 13:06:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15127,5601,'es','Pescado piri-piri y patatas fritas con guisantes picantes','Dale un toque picante a un alimento básico tradicional con un poco de adobo de chile y guisantes con menta. Use cualquier pescado blanco; nosotros usamos lubina.','["375 g de patatas cortadas en chips","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","jugo ½ limón","2 cucharadas de marinada de piri-piri","300 g de guisantes congelados","1 chile verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","½ diente de ajo machacado","un puñado de hojas de menta, finamente picadas","2 filetes de pescado blanco (nosotros utilizamos lubina)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nMezcle las patatas fritas con la mitad del aceite de oliva.\r\ny la mitad del jugo de limón, disponer en\r\nuna capa en una bandeja para hornear, luego sazone.\r\nCocine por 25 minutos. Revuelva el resto\r\njugo de limón en la marinada.","Mientras tanto, lleve una cacerola con agua a\r\nhervir y cocinar los guisantes durante 2-3 minutos,\r\nluego escurrir. Devolver los guisantes al vacío.\r\nsartén y triturar con la guindilla, el ajo,\r\nmenta y el aceite restante. Temporada\r\ny mantente caliente.","Después de 25 minutos, voltea las patatas.\r\ny muévase hacia los bordes de la bandeja.\r\nAñade el pescado, con la piel hacia arriba, y cuchara.\r\nsobre la marinada. cocinar para otro\r\n10-12 minutos hasta que el pescado esté cocido\r\na través. Servir con los guisantes triturados."]','2026-01-11 13:06:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15128,5603,'es','Pastel de pescado inflado con salmón y espinacas','Agregar verduras a su aderezo de puré de papa aumenta los beneficios para la salud de este clásico horneado reconfortante','["1 kg de patatas Maris Piper, cortadas en trozos grandes","2 huevos grandes, separados","400 g de espinacas de hoja entera congeladas (peso congelado), descongeladas y exprimidas","85 g de queso cheddar maduro bajo en grasa","nuez moscada entera, para rallar","500 g de pescado: una mezcla de blanco y salmón es buena (yo usé 2 filetes de salmón congelados y 2 de bacalao descongelados)","1 cebolla, cortada a la mitad","unos cuantos dientes enteros","1 hoja de laurel fresca o seca","300ml de leche semidesnatada","300 ml de caldo de pescado (en cubitos está bien)","25 g de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","50 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de mostaza integral"]','["Hervir las patatas durante 20 minutos hasta que\r\ntierno. Mientras tanto, poner el pescado en una sartén.\r\nsartén, con la piel hacia abajo. Pinchar la cebolla con\r\nlos clavos y poner en la sartén con el\r\nlaurel, leche y caldo. Llevar a ebullición, luego\r\ntape y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos. Quitar\r\nel bacalao, que debe desmenuzarse fácilmente, luego\r\nVuelva a tapar y cocine por 3 minutos más hasta que\r\nel salmón apenas está bien cocido. ascensor\r\nSacar el pescado y reservar. colar el\r\nlíquido de cocción.","En otra sartén derretir la mantequilla con la\r\naceite, agregue la harina y cocine por 2 minutos hasta que\r\nhuele a tostado. Quitar el fuego y\r\nIncorpora lentamente el líquido de cocción del pescado.\r\nRegresar al fuego, batir hasta que la salsa\r\nhierve y espesa, luego agrega la mostaza.\r\nCalentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Escurrir y triturar las patatas hasta\r\nsuave, luego agregue las yemas de huevo,\r\nespinacas y la mayor parte del queso. Temporada\r\ngenerosamente con sal, pimienta y nuez moscada.\r\nBatir las claras a punto de nieve y luego\r\nincorporar a la papa en 2 tandas.","Desmenuzar el pescado en una fuente para horno grande.\r\nvierta sobre la salsa y cubra con la\r\npatata espinaca. Dispersarse con el resto\r\ndel queso y hornear durante 35-40 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté dorado y levado."]','2026-01-11 13:06:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15129,5605,'es','Trucha al horno con ensalada de hinojo, rábano y rúcula','Una cena de pescado elegante, ligera, fresca y repleta de omega-3, ácido fólico y vitamina C.','["2 truchas enteras, escamadas y evisceradas","½ manojo de tomillo","2 limones, 1 en rodajas, 1 en jugo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","1 bulbo grande de hinojo, finamente cortado","100 g de rábanos, finamente cortados","1 cucharada de alcaparras, picadas","gran puñado de cohetes"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nCorta la piel de la trucha tres veces en ambos\r\nlados y luego mete una rama de tomillo en cada uno\r\ncortar. Coloque el pescado en una bandeja para hornear y rellénelo.\r\nla cavidad con las rodajas de limón y\r\nlas ramitas de tomillo restantes. Sazone el pescado,\r\nrocíe un poco de aceite de oliva y luego hornee por\r\n15-20 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el jugo de limón con la aceituna.\r\naceite, luego verter sobre el hinojo y dejar reposar.\r\nreposar durante 10 minutos. Agregue los rábanos y\r\nalcaparras y sazonar. Mezclar la rúcula\r\nla ensalada de hinojo y rábano justo antes\r\nsirviendo con trozos grandes de trucha desmenuzada."]','2026-01-11 13:06:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15130,5607,'es','Tortitas clásicas de pescado con trozos','Los pasteles de pescado son un excelente alimento básico para congelar, ya que están listos en porciones para que puedas descongelar tantos como necesites.','["1 kg de patatas peladas y picadas","1 kg de mezcla de filetes de salmón y coley","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","manojo de eneldo, cebollino, perejil y cebolletas, picados","4 cucharadas de salsa tártara, más algo extra para servir si lo deseas","3 huevos batidos","100 g de harina común","250 g de pan rallado","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Cubrir las patatas con agua fría y salada.\r\nagua y llevar a ebullición. bajar\r\na fuego lento y cocinar durante 10-12 minutos\r\nhasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir y secar al vapor durante un\r\nunos minutos, luego triture y reserve\r\nenfriar un poco. Mientras tanto, cocina el pescado.\r\nCubrir con agua fría y el jugo de limón.\r\nllevar a fuego lento y luego escalfar\r\n5 minutos (dependiendo del grosor de\r\nel pescado) hasta que esté bien cocido. Quitar\r\ndel agua, deshacerse de la piel y\r\ndesmenuzar en trozos grandes.","Poner la ralladura de limón, las hierbas, la primavera.\r\ncebolla, salsa tártara y algún condimento\r\nen un bol grande con el pescado y el\r\npatatas. Combina todos los ingredientes,\r\nluego divídalo en 12 y forme pasteles.","Poner los huevos, la harina y el pan rallado.\r\nen tres platos. Mojar cada una de las croquetas de pescado\r\nen harina, quitar el exceso y luego sumergir en el\r\nhuevo. Finalmente rebozar con pan rallado y\r\ntransferir a un plato limpio o bandeja para hornear\r\nforrado con papel pergamino. Repita con\r\nlas croquetas de pescado restantes. puedes congelar\r\nlas croquetas de pescado ahora hasta por tres meses, o enfríelas durante 1 o 2 días.","Para cocinar, calienta la parrilla a fuego medio.\r\nPincelar las croquetas de pescado con aceite y asar.\r\ndurante 4-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados y\r\ncaliente a través. Servir con extra de tartar\r\nsalsa y ensalada o verduras verdes. Descongelar\r\nTortitas de pescado congeladas durante la noche en el frigorífico y\r\ncocine como arriba. Alternativamente, cocinar directamente desde\r\ncongelado, caliente la parrilla a fuego medio, engrase los pasteles de pescado según la receta, luego cocine a la parrilla de 12 a 15 minutos por un lado para que se doren, antes de voltear y asar el otro lado durante 5 minutos más."]','2026-01-11 13:06:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15131,5609,'es','Fish & chips crujientes con puré de guisantes','Prepara este clásico para llevar en tu cocina, más saludable que el chippy local e igual de sabroso','["400 g de patatas para asar","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 rebanadas de pan blanco","2 filetes de pescado blanco, como eglefino, hoki, abadejo","1 cucharada de harina común, sazonada","1 huevo batido","140 g de guisantes congelados con menta","2 cucharadas de crema fresca"]','["Calentar el horno a 200 °C/ventilador 180 °C/gas 4. Pelar y picar las patatas en trozos gruesos, luego untar con aceite de oliva y un poco de sal. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear antiadherente grande y ase durante 20 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad.","Tuesta ligeramente el pan y luego púlsalo brevemente en un procesador de alimentos para obtener pan rallado grueso. Espolvoree el pescado con harina, sacudiendo el exceso, luego sumérjalo en el huevo y luego en el pan rallado para cubrirlo bien. Ase el pescado con las patatas fritas durante 20 minutos más, hasta que ambos estén dorados.","Justo antes de que el pescado y las patatas fritas estén listos, hierva los guisantes durante 3-4 minutos, luego escúrralos y tritúrelos. Agregue la crema fresca y sazone."]','2026-01-11 13:06:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15132,5611,'es','Salmón al horno con hinojo y tomates','El hinojo anisado y los jugosos tomates cherry realzan la riqueza de los filetes de salmón','["2 bulbos de hinojo medianos","2 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana picado","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","175 g de tomates cherry","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 filetes de salmón de unos 175 g cada uno","unas aceitunas negras (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 4. Recortar\r\nlas hojas del hinojo y reservar.\r\nCorta los bulbos de hinojo por la mitad y luego córtalos cada uno.\r\nla mitad en 3 gajos. Cocer en ebullición con sal.\r\nAgua durante 10 minutos, luego escurrir bien. picar\r\nlas hojas de hinojo en trozos grandes, luego mezcle con\r\nel perejil y la ralladura de limón.","Extienda el hinojo escurrido sobre una superficie poco profunda.\r\nfuente refractaria y luego agregue los tomates.\r\nRocíe con aceite de oliva y luego hornee por 10 minutos.\r\nColoque el salmón entre las verduras, espolvoree\r\ncon jugo de limón, luego hornear 15 minutos más\r\nhasta que el pescado esté recién cocido. Dispersarse sobre el\r\nperejil y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15133,5613,'es','Sopa de pescado más ligera','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una versión más saludable de la clásica sopa estadounidense que utiliza salmón y abadejo, además de prosciutto sin grasa y crema fresca media grasa.','["1½ cucharada de aceite de colza","3 rebanadas de prosciutto, sin grasa y cortadas en tiras","2-3 puerros, en rodajas finas (aproximadamente 320 g de peso recortado)","2 dientes de ajo regordetes, finamente picados","3 ramitas de tomillo (preferiblemente tomillo limón), más hojas adicionales para decorar","2 hojas de laurel","650 g de patatas harinosas como Desiree o Maris Piper, sin pelar, lavadas y cortadas en rodajas de 5 mm de grosor","600 ml de caldo de verduras caliente en cubos o en polvo de buena calidad (nosotros utilizamos caldo de caléndula)","una buena pizca de hojuelas de chile","250 g de filetes de salmón sin piel","250 g de filetes de abadejo o eglefino sin piel","3 cucharadas de crema fresca media grasa","cebollino picado, para decorar"]','["Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en un salteado grande y profundo.\r\nsartén. Vierta el prosciutto y fríalo durante 2 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté crujiente. Retirar con una espumadera,\r\ndejar que el exceso de aceite se escurra nuevamente al\r\nsartén. Dejar de lado. Añade el resto del aceite y sofríe.\r\nlos puerros, el ajo, el tomillo y el laurel durante 2-3 minutos\r\nhasta que los puerros empiecen a ablandarse pero\r\nmanteniendo su color. Añade las patatas y\r\nFreír durante 2 minutos, volteando de vez en cuando. Vierta\r\nel caldo con 100ml extra de agua hirviendo\r\ny presione suavemente las patatas hacia abajo para que\r\nsimplemente están cubiertos. Llevar a ebullición. hervir\r\nbastante vigorosamente, descubierto, sobre un nivel alto\r\ncalentar durante 10 minutos hasta que las patatas estén\r\ncasi cocido. El líquido debe tener\r\nespesado muy ligeramente. Esparcir el chile\r\nhojuelas, un poco de pimienta y una pizca de sal.","Baja el fuego a medio y coloca la\r\nfiletes de pescado enteros encima de las patatas.\r\nSazone el pescado con pimienta y suavemente\r\npresione hacia abajo en el caldo para que los filetes\r\napenas están sumergidos. Cubra y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante unos 5 minutos o hasta que el pescado esté casi\r\ncocido (el tiempo dependerá del espesor\r\nde los filetes). Retirar del fuego y sentar.\r\ndurante otros 5-10 minutos, para que el pescado pueda\r\nTermine de cocinar suavemente. quitar el tomillo\r\ny hojas de laurel. Aún fuera del fuego, vierta\r\nla crème fraîche y revuelva suavemente\r\nen el caldo hasta que se vea cremoso.","Para servir, recalentar suave y brevemente. dividir\r\nlas patatas y el pescado (dejar que el pescado se rompa en\r\ntrozos grandes a medida que lo levantas de la sartén)\r\nen tazones anchos y poco profundos. Cuchara el caldo\r\nalrededor y espolvorear con cebollino, unas cuantas\r\nhojas de tomillo y el prosciutto crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15134,5615,'es','Wrap de pollo y maíz estilo elote','Haga algo diferente para el almuerzo con un wrap lleno de pollo especiado, arroz y maíz dulce. Con dos de tus cinco al día, carbohidratos y proteínas, alimentarás tu tarde.','["3 pechugas de pollo (unos 550 g), cortadas en rodajas finas","2 cucharaditas de condimento estilo mexicano para tacos o fajitas","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","8 tortillas grandes","200 g de maíz dulce congelado, descongelado","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","1 lima, exprimida","3 cucharadas de mayonesa","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","250 g de bolsa de arroz basmati y salvaje (o lo mismo en peso cocido)","1 tomate maduro grande, finamente picado","un puñado de perejil, finamente picado"]','["Calienta una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto y fríe el maíz dulce hasta que comience a carbonizarse, alrededor de 4-5 minutos. Vierta en un tazón y mezcle las cebolletas, el jugo de lima, la mayonesa y el chile en polvo con una buena pizca de sal y pimienta. Revuelva bien para cubrir el maíz. Dejar de lado.","Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego combínelo con el tomate, el perejil y una buena pizca de sal y un poco de pimienta negra.","Cubra el pollo con el condimento estilo mexicano, luego caliente el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y cocine el pollo hasta que esté bien cocido. Dejar de lado.","Calienta las tortillas, luego agrega el arroz, el maíz dulce y el pollo."]','2026-01-11 13:06:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15135,5617,'es','Pad tailandés saludable','Mezcle el pollo con fideos de arroz y verduras salteadas para crear una cena deliciosamente saludable. También hay una opción vegana que utiliza mantequilla de maní (consulte el consejo a continuación)','["100 g de fideos planos de arroz integral","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 filetes de muslo de pollo sin piel, picados","1 cebolla (160 g), picada en trozos grandes","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","1 zanahoria pequeña (60 g), pelada en tiras gruesas con un pelador de verduras","3 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente rallado","100 g de brotes de soja","15 g de maní tostado sin sal","2 cucharadas de jugo de lima, más 1 cucharadita de ralladura","1 cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal","15 g de cilantro picado","un puñado de albahaca picada"]','["Vierta los fideos en un tazón y déjelos en remojo siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete hasta que estén tiernos pero no blandos; no querrá que se vuelvan blandos. Drenar.","Calienta el aceite a fuego medio-alto y sofríe el pollo durante 5 minutos hasta que esté cocido. Transfiera el pollo a un bol y reserve, manteniendo el aceite en el wok. Sofría la cebolla, el pimiento y la zanahoria durante 5 minutos para que se ablanden, luego agregue el ajo, la guindilla y el jengibre y cocine unos minutos más hasta que estén fragantes.","Agregue los brotes de soja, suba el fuego a alto y revuelva con el maní, el jugo y la ralladura de lima y la salsa de soja. Regrese el pollo a la sartén junto con los fideos y las hierbas, y mezcle todo suavemente hasta que esté completamente caliente. Es mejor servirlo inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15136,5619,'es','Ñoquis horneados en bandeja con ricotta al limón','Prepare esta maravilla de una sola bandeja con ñoquis, ricota, alcachofas, tomates pera y calabacín. Se puede adaptar utilizando cualquier verdura que tengas en la nevera.','["500 g de ñoquis","1 calabacín, cortado por la mitad y luego cortado en trozos grandes","100 g de tomates pera pequeños, cortados por la mitad","100g de alcachofas en aceite, más 2 cucharadas de aceite","2 dientes de ajo, sin pelar, ligeramente machacados","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","85 g de ricota","1 limón, rallado y luego cortado en gajos","10 g de albahaca, picada en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 8. Coloca los ñoquis, el calabacín y los tomates en una bandeja para asar grande. Añade las alcachofas y el aceite, los dientes de ajo machacados y las hojuelas de guindilla y sazona bien con sal y pimienta negra recién molida. Mezcle todos los ingredientes con las manos, luego hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que los ñoquis estén crujientes en los bordes y las verduras suaves.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la ricota y la ralladura de limón en un tazón pequeño, luego sazone con sal y pimienta al gusto. Pon esto sobre los ñoquis y espolvorea sobre la albahaca.","Divida los ñoquis en dos tazones, mezclándolos bien para que la ricota se desintegre y forme una salsa cremosa. Sirva con las rodajas de limón para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15137,5621,'es','Pasta de cebolla morada caramelizada y anchoas con gremolata','¿Después de una cena de lujo para dos? Perfecta para el Día de San Valentín, esta pasta necesita un poco de preparación, pero la preparación es sencilla, para que podáis disfrutar del tiempo juntos.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 cebollas moradas, en rodajas finas","200 g de pappardelle (o cualquier pasta larga)","2 filetes de anchoa en aceite, escurridos","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","15 g de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande de base pesada a fuego medio. Freír las cebollas moradas con una pizca grande de sal. Cocine durante 30-35 minutos a fuego medio-bajo, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que esté caramelizado y dorado.","Mientras tanto, haz la gremolata. Mezclar la ralladura de limón, el jugo, el perejil y el ajo con una pizca de sal y reservar. Cocine los pappardelle siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, reservando 120 ml de agua para la pasta.","Añade los filetes de anchoa a las cebollas cuando estén caramelizadas y deja que se disuelvan. Agregue el puré de tomate junto con 15 vueltas de pimienta negra (alrededor de ½ cucharadita) y cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que la mezcla se oscurezca.","Agrega la pasta cocida a la salsa junto con los 120 ml de agua de la pasta reservada. Revuelva bien para combinar y luego transfiéralo a una fuente para servir. Vierta sobre la gremolata para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15138,5623,'es','Guiso de calabaza vegano','Sirva este guiso vegano abundante y saludable para una reconfortante cena de invierno. Está repleto de vitamina C y contiene las cinco dosis de cinco al día.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","320 g de champiñones castaños grandes, cortados en cuartos","2 hojas de laurel","2 cucharadas de romero fresco","4 cebollas rojas, en cuartos","4 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","320 g de calabaza preparada","600 ml de caldo de verduras, elaborado con 1 cucharada de caldo en polvo","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","4 cucharadas de puré de tomate","brócoli y guisantes, para servir","700 g de colinabo, pelado y cortado en trozos","850 g de patatas cortadas en trozos"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande antiadherente a fuego medio y sofreír los champiñones, el laurel y el romero durante unos 5 minutos. Agregue las cebollas y el ajo y cocine por unos minutos más hasta que se ablanden.","Añade la calabaza, el caldo, los garbanzos, el pimentón ahumado y el puré de tomate. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 40 minutos hasta que el líquido se haya reducido a una salsa espesa.","Unos 25 minutos antes de que finalice el tiempo de cocción, haga el puré. Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua y cocine el nabo durante 5 minutos, luego agregue las patatas y hierva durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Escurrir y triturar con abundante pimienta negra.","Sirva la mitad del guiso y haga puré ahora, luego enfríe el resto para recalentarlo y comerlo otro día. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. Vuelva a calentar el guiso en una sartén hasta que esté bien caliente. El puré se puede recalentar en el microondas. Sirva con brócoli y guisantes, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15139,5625,'es','ensalada de col rizada','Disfrute de esta vibrante ensalada llena de nutritivos col rizada, tubérculos, nueces y queso. Es un almuerzo satisfactorio, pero también se puede servir como acompañamiento.','["200 g de col rizada, sin tallos y hojas cortadas","1 chalota grande, finamente cortada","100 g de remolacha cocida, picada en trozos grandes","30 g de arándanos secos","250 g de zanahorias ralladas","25 g de nueces mixtas, picadas en trozos grandes","125 g de queso de cabra desmenuzado (opcional)","1 limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","1 diente de ajo pequeño, machacado","1 cucharada de jarabe de arce","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Combine todos los ingredientes del aderezo en un tazón grande, sazone bien y luego agregue la col rizada y la chalota. Masajee el aderezo sobre las hojas de col rizada hasta que se ablanden y adquieran un color verde oscuro, aproximadamente de 2 a 3 minutos.","Agrega la remolacha, los arándanos, las zanahorias, las nueces y el queso de cabra, si lo usas. Mezcle hasta que todo esté cubierto uniformemente y sazone. Sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:06:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15140,5627,'es','Ensalada de garbanzos ahumados','Disfrute de las capas de sabor y el contraste de texturas de esta ensalada vegana, con crujientes garbanzos fritos, crujiente brócoli crudo y un aderezo de pimentón ahumado.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","200 g de zanahorias peladas en tiras o ralladas","200 g de espinacas","1 cabeza pequeña de brócoli, picada en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharaditas de ajo granulado","2 cucharaditas de hierbas secas mixtas","4 cucharaditas de jarabe de arce","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja baja en sodio","4 cucharaditas de vinagre de arroz","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio. Vierta los garbanzos y fríalos a fuego lento durante 3-4 minutos hasta que chisporroteen y estén ligeramente crujientes.","Batir los ingredientes del aderezo en un bol, luego verter sobre los garbanzos junto con 4 cucharadas de agua y llevar a ebullición. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que se reduzca ligeramente, retire del fuego, sazone bien y reserve.","Mezcle las zanahorias, las espinacas y el brócoli crudo y divídalos en platos. Esparcir por encima los garbanzos y una cucharada del jugo de la sartén para aliñar."]','2026-01-11 13:06:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15141,5629,'es','Ensalada de cuñas con semillas de soja y pepinos encurtidos','Pruebe el crujido salado y rico en umami de las semillas de soja junto con los pepinos encurtidos para aderezar esta ensalada en cuña: es mejor que una guarnición clásica de tocino cualquier día.','["75 ml de vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de eneldo finamente picado","1 pepino grande, cortado en rodajas finas en rodajas de 1 a 2 mm de grosor","1 lechuga iceberg, partida por la mitad desde el corazón, cada mitad cortada en gajos","75 g de semillas mixtas","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de salsa de soja ligera","100 ml de suero de leche","3 cucharadas de yogur estilo griego","½ tsp Dijon mustard","1 diente de ajo pequeño, finamente rallado","1 cucharada de eneldo finamente picado","2 cucharadas de líquido de los pepinos encurtidos rápidamente (ver arriba)"]','["Combine el vinagre, el azúcar, la cúrcuma, el eneldo y ½ cucharadita de sal marina en un tazón mediano no reactivo, batiendo para disolver el azúcar y la sal. Añade las rodajas de pepino, mezcla bien y deja encurtir durante 10 minutos. Comprobar que las rodajas de pepino aún estén sumergidas, y si no, pesarlas con un plato. Dejar seguir marinando durante 30 minutos más.","Tuesta las semillas en una sartén seca de base pesada a fuego medio durante 4 a 5 minutos, moviendo la sartén con frecuencia hasta que las semillas comiencen a tomar color y a estallar. Agrega el azúcar, luego revuelve, apaga el fuego, vierte la salsa de soja, mezcla bien y vierte en un plato grande para que se enfríe. Rompa los grumos con un tenedor y guárdelos en un recipiente hermético hasta que los necesite. Se conservará hasta por una semana. Combine todos los ingredientes del aderezo en un tazón o jarra y sazone bien.","Coloque las rodajas de lechuga en un tazón para servir y vierta sobre la mitad del aderezo. Distribuya sobre los pepinos encurtidos y luego vierta sobre el resto del aderezo y las semillas."]','2026-01-11 13:06:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15142,5631,'es','ragú saludable','Utilice zanahorias, guisantes y passata para estirar un paquete de carne picada en esta salsa sana y saludable que proporciona tres de sus cinco al día. Disfrútelo con patatas asadas','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cebollas grandes (320 g), cortadas por la mitad o en cuartos y luego cortadas en rodajas","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","500 g de carne picada de 5 % de grasa","500 g de puré de cartón","3 zanahorias (320 g), finamente picadas","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo","1 cucharada de caldo de verduras en polvo","½ cucharadita de pimienta blanca molida","200 g de guisantes congelados","4 patatas asadas, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio-bajo y fríe las cebollas durante 10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que estén doradas. Agregue el ajo, luego agregue la carne picada y cocine, rompiéndola con una cuchara de madera mientras lo hace, durante unos minutos más hasta que se dore.","Agregue la passata, las zanahorias, el tomillo, el caldo en polvo y la pimienta, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 25-30 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que la carne esté cocida y las verduras tiernas. Agregue un chorrito de agua para aflojar, si lo desea, luego agregue los guisantes y cocine durante 5-7 minutos más hasta que estén tiernos. Sirva caliente sobre patatas asadas. Una vez completamente fría, la salsa picada se mantendrá congelada hasta por tres meses. Descongelar en el frigorífico durante la noche y recalentar hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15143,5633,'es','Espaguetis con tomates y nueces','Sirva un plato de espaguetis con berenjena, tomates, alcaparras y nueces para disfrutar de un almuerzo rico en fibra, saludable y saciante que forma parte de nuestro Plan de Dieta Saludable.','["350 g de espaguetis integrales","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 berenjenas (unos 550 g), cada una cortada en 4 a lo largo y luego cortada en cubos","4 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente picados","3 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","250 ml de caldo de verduras, elaborado con 1 cucharada de caldo en polvo (vegano, si es necesario)","330 g de tomates cherry cortados por la mitad","Paquete de 30 g de albahaca picada","1 cucharada de alcaparras","50 g de nueces en trozos, ligeramente tostadas y picadas si son grandes"]','["Cocine los espaguetis siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrralos reservando 150 ml del agua de cocción. Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio. Agrega la berenjena y el ajo, revuelve bien, luego tapa y cocina durante 8-10 minutos, revolviendo unas cuantas veces.","Incorpora el puré de tomate y el vinagre y cocina durante 2-3 minutos más. Vierta el caldo, luego cubra y cocine durante 10-15 minutos más hasta que la berenjena esté tierna al pincharla con un cuchillo.","Agrega los tomates cherry y cocina por unos minutos más hasta que se ablanden pero mantengan su forma. Agregue la albahaca, las alcaparras y las nueces, luego mezcle los espaguetis y agregue un poco del agua de la pasta reservada si es necesario para aflojar. Sirva la mitad inmediatamente. Guarde el resto para otro día. Se mantendrá cubierto y refrigerado hasta por cuatro días. Vuelve a calentar en una sartén a fuego lento con un chorrito de agua hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15144,5635,'es','Koftas de pollo con hummus y ensalada','Disfrute de las koftas de pollo con hummus y ensalada para un almuerzo saludable. El tahini del hummus está elaborado con semillas de sésamo, que se cree que tienen propiedades antiinflamatorias.','["500 g de pollo picado (5% de grasa)","1 huevo","3 cucharadas de avena","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 limón, rallado","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","½ cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharadas de perejil picado (tomado de los 30 g de los ingredientes de la ensalada, a continuación)","½ cucharadita de aceite de colza, para freír","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos (reservar el líquido)","2 cucharadas de tahini","1 limón, en jugo (aproximadamente 3 cucharadas)","1 diente de ajo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cebollas moradas grandes, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 limón, exprimido","30 g de perejil picado","200 g de pepino cortado en trozos","4 tomates, cortados en gajos"]','["Con las manos, combine todos los ingredientes para el kofta, excepto el aceite. Dejar de lado.","Vierta todos los ingredientes del hummus en un tazón, junto con 3 cucharadas del líquido de garbanzos, luego mezcle con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Si prefieres una textura más suelta, añade más líquido de garbanzos y vuelve a licuar.","Para la ensalada, vierte las cebollas en un bol con el jugo de limón y exprímelas con las manos para ayudar a ablandarlas. Agrega el perejil picado y reserva.","Forma 16 bolas con las koftas. Calienta el aceite de colza en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio y fríe las koftas durante 5 minutos por cada lado hasta que se doren y estén bien cocidas. Para terminar en una barbacoa, cocínalos hasta que mantengan su forma y luego ensártalos en brochetas. Cocine durante 4 minutos por cada lado en la barbacoa. Las koftas crudas se mantendrán frías en un recipiente hermético durante un día.","Divida la mitad del hummus en dos platos. Mezcle la mitad de las cebollas encurtidas rápidamente con la mitad de los pepinos y los tomates, luego sirva la ensalada con las koftas y el hummus. Enfríe las porciones restantes para otro día. Se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado hasta por dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:06:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15145,5637,'es','Sopa de frijoles negros con raita en trozos','Prepare esta sopa rica en especias y una abundante raita para un almuerzo sabroso y rápido. También es saludable, ya que proporciona cuatro de tus cinco dosis al día.','["1-1½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","4 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de caldo de verduras en polvo","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","2 aguacates pequeños, picados","200 g de tomates cherry, cortados en cuartos y los más pequeños partidos por la mitad","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","2 botes de yogur bio de 120g","15 g de cilantro picado y un poco más para servir"]','["Tostar brevemente las semillas de comino en una cacerola grande a fuego medio. Agregue el pimentón y el cilantro, luego agregue 2½ latas de frijoles junto con su líquido, los tomates, el puré de tomate, el caldo, el ajo y 500 ml de agua. Tapar y dejar cocer a fuego lento durante 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los ingredientes para la raita en un bol.","Mezcle los frijoles cocidos con una batidora de mano hasta que estén completamente suaves, luego agregue los frijoles restantes y vuelva a hervir. Sirve la mitad y cubre con la mitad de la raita, un aguacate picado y un poco de cilantro extra. Deje enfriar el resto de la sopa y luego enfríe por un día más. Se mantendrá fría durante cuatro días; la raita se conservará durante dos días. Vuelva a calentar la sopa en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15146,5639,'es','Pastel de carne saludable con salsa de espagueti','Logre tres de sus cinco al día con este pastel de carne lleno de verduras en una salsa inspirada en el clásico ragu italiano. Pronto se convertirá en el favorito de la familia.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza, más un poco más para el plato","320 g de zanahorias finamente picadas","2 ramas de apio (unos 135 g), finamente picadas","1 cebolla (unos 125 g), finamente picada","500 g de carne picada de cerdo magra y 5 % de grasa","1 huevo","25 g de gachas de avena","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado, más 1 cucharadita","30 g de albahaca, hojas y tallos separados","1½ cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","500ml en puré","40 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","350 g de espaguetis integrales"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calienta el aceite en una cacerola antiadherente grande a fuego medio y cocina las zanahorias, el apio y la cebolla, tapados, durante 10 minutos hasta que estén suaves y empiecen a caramelizar. Revuelva a mitad de cocción para evitar que se queme.","Mientras tanto, vierta la carne de cerdo en un bol con el huevo, la avena y 1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado. Picar los tallos de albahaca y la mayoría de las hojas, dejando algunas enteras. Agrega los tallos picados y la mitad de las hojas picadas a la mezcla, junto con ½ cucharadita de caldo. Sazone con pimienta negra y luego mezcle con las manos para combinar completamente. Vierta la mitad de las verduras cocidas, déjelas enfriar durante aproximadamente un minuto y luego incorpore las verduras a la mezcla. Forme una hogaza (de aproximadamente 21 x 7 cm), luego levántela y colóquela en una fuente para hornear poco profunda y ligeramente engrasada. Cepille también la parte superior con un poco de aceite. Hornee por 25 minutos hasta que esté firme.","Para la salsa, agregue el ajo a las verduras restantes. Regrese a fuego medio y cocine por 1 min. Agrega el resto del pimentón y el caldo, junto con la passata y 100 ml de agua. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Agregue el resto de la albahaca picada.","Retirar el pan del horno y verter sobre la salsa. Esparce el queso por encima y hornea durante 10 minutos más. Mientras tanto, cocina los espaguetis siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Sirve los espaguetis en tazones, cubre con las rebanadas de pan, unas cucharadas de salsa y las hojas enteras de albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:06:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15147,5641,'es','Pasta con sardina y tomate con gremolata','Disfrute de nuestra deliciosa pasta con sardinas y gremolata. Con nutrientes añadidos gracias a las sardinas, es un plato saludable, bajo en calorías y grasas.','["75 g de espaguetis integrales","1⁄2 lata de 120g de sardinas en aceite","½ cucharada de alcaparras, escurridas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 tomates, picados en trozos grandes","rúcula 30g","½ limón, rallado","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado"]','["Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo con sal. Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite de la lata de sardinas en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y chisporrotea las alcaparras y la mitad del ajo durante 1-2 minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Vierta los tomates y fríalos durante 4-5 minutos más hasta que se ablanden y revienten. Agregue las sardinas y la rúcula, revolviendo varias veces para desmenuzar el pescado y marchitar las hojas. Estación.","Para la gremolata, combine la ralladura de limón, el perejil y el ajo restante en un tazón pequeño y sazone. Escurrir la pasta y cubrir con la salsa de sardinas y la gremolata."]','2026-01-11 13:06:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15148,5643,'es','Ratatouille','Disfrute de esta receta tradicional súper saludable de pisto para el almuerzo o la cena, sabiendo que cuenta como cuatro de sus cinco al día.','["2 berenjenas grandes","4 calabacines pequeños","2 pimientos rojos o amarillos","4 tomates maduros grandes","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","paquete de supermercado o manojo pequeño de albahaca","1 cebolla mediana, pelada y cortada en rodajas finas","3 dientes de ajo, pelados y triturados","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharadita de azúcar (cualquier tipo)"]','["Corta 2 berenjenas grandes por la mitad a lo largo. Colóquelos en la tabla, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, córtelos por la mitad nuevamente a lo largo y luego a lo ancho en trozos de 1,5 cm. Corta los extremos de 4 calabacines pequeños y luego córtalos en rodajas de 1,5 cm.","Pele 2 pimientos rojos o amarillos desde el tallo hasta el fondo. Manténgalo en posición vertical, corte alrededor del tallo y luego córtelo en 3 trozos. Corte cualquier membrana y luego córtela en trozos pequeños.","Haga una pequeña cruz en la base de cada uno de los 4 tomates maduros grandes y luego colóquelos en un recipiente resistente al calor. Vierta agua hirviendo, déjelo durante 20 segundos y luego retírelo. Vierta el agua, reemplace los tomates y cúbralos con agua fría. Deje enfriar y luego retire la piel.","Corta los tomates en cuartos, quita las semillas con una cuchara y luego pica la pulpa en trozos grandes.","Coloque una sartén a fuego medio y cuando esté caliente, vierta 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva. Dorar las berenjenas durante 5 minutos por cada lado hasta que los trozos estén suaves. Déjalos a un lado.","Freír los calabacines en otra cucharada de aceite durante 5 minutos, hasta que estén dorados por ambos lados. Repita con los pimientos. No cocines demasiado las verduras en esta etapa.","Arranque las hojas del manojo de albahaca y reserve. Cocine 1 cebolla mediana en rodajas finas en la sartén durante 5 minutos. Añade 3 dientes de ajo machacados y sofríe un minuto más. Agrega 1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto y 1 cucharadita de azúcar, luego agrega los tomates y la mitad de la albahaca.","Regrese las verduras a la sartén con un poco de sal y pimienta y cocine por 5 minutos. Servir con albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:06:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15149,5645,'es','Ensalada de lentejas y atún','Prepare esta ensalada fácil de lentejas y atún sin cocinar para un almuerzo o cena rápido y saludable. Se prepara en sólo 15 minutos, ideal para días ocupados.','["2 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","1 tsp Dijon mustard","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","50 ml de aceite de oliva","2 bolsas de 250 g de lentejas puy ya cocidas","2 latas de 160 g de filetes de atún en agua de manantial, escurridos y desmenuzados","160 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad (unos 10)","2 pimientos ya asados, picados","un puñado de perejil, finamente picado","½ manojo pequeño de cebollino, finamente picado, y un poco más para decorar"]','["Batir el vinagre, la mostaza y el ajo en un tazón pequeño. Rocíe lentamente el aceite, batiendo a medida que avanza, hasta que esté emulsionado, luego sazone al gusto.","Agregue las lentejas, el atún, los tomates, los pimientos y las hierbas a un tazón grande y mezcle. Vierta sobre el aderezo y revuelva nuevamente. Divida en cuatro tazones y decore con las cebolletas restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:06:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15150,5647,'es','Tazón de grano de salmón ahumado caliente con yogur de eneldo','Disfrute de este plato de salmón ahumado fácil y rápido con remolacha, rábano y pepino. Júntelo en solo 20 minutos y cubra con yogur de eneldo.','["3 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","80 g de pepino, en rodajas finas","4 rábanos, en rodajas finas","2 bolsas de 250 g de quinua preparada","1 limón, exprimido","200 gramos de yogur natural","1 cucharada de eneldo, finamente picado, más un poco más para decorar","4 filetes de salmón ahumado caliente, sin piel","3 remolachas ya cocidas en jugo natural, cortadas en gajos finos"]','["Combina el vinagre y el azúcar con una pizca de sal en un bol. Agregue el pepino y los rábanos, mezcle para combinar y reserve.","Agrega la quinua a otro tazón grande. Reserva 1 cucharadita de jugo de limón y vierte el resto sobre la quinoa. Sazone ligeramente y revuelva para combinar. Agrega el yogur y el eneldo picado a un tazón pequeño junto con 1 cucharadita de jugo de limón y combina. Estación.","Divida la quinua en cuatro tazones poco profundos y cubra con el salmón, la remolacha y las verduras encurtidas. Rocíe sobre el yogur y decore con el eneldo restante."]','2026-01-11 13:06:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15151,5651,'es','tacos de camote','Mejora tus comidas entre semana con estos coloridos tacos vegetarianos. Omita el queso feta y la crema agria para hacerlos veganos o use una alternativa a base de plantas.','["1 cebolla morada, en rodajas","3 limas, en jugo","4 batatas, peladas y cortadas en cubitos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado picante","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","2 aguacates maduros, triturados","2 tomates maduros grandes, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","8 tortillas de harina pequeñas","50 g de queso feta desmenuzado (opcional)","crema agria y cilantro rallado para servir (opcional)"]','["Pon la cebolla en un bol con dos tercios del jugo de lima y una cucharadita de sal. Dejar encurtir durante una hora.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. En una bandeja para hornear grande y plana, mezcla las batatas, el aceite, las especias y un poco de condimento. Ase durante 30-35 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad, hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Una vez cocidos, mezcle con los frijoles negros.","Mezcla el aguacate y los tomates con el jugo de lima restante y una pizca de sal. Calienta las tortillas y apila las batatas y los frijoles. Cubra con el aguacate, los tomates y la cebolla morada en escabeche, y el queso feta desmenuzado, la crema agria y el cilantro, si lo usa."]','2026-01-11 13:06:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15152,5653,'es','Frijoles para pizza sobre tostadas','Combine dos platos queridos, tostadas de frijoles y pizza, en esta delicia híbrida para el almuerzo: toda la familia lo disfrutará.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas","4 rebanadas grandes de pan de masa madre o cualquier pan de tu elección","125 g de bolas de mozzarella, desmenuzadas","pepperoni o jamón en rodajas, para servir (opcional)","un puñado pequeño de hojas de albahaca, trituradas, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola pequeña a fuego lento y sofríe la cebolla con una pizca de sal durante 10 minutos, o hasta que esté blanda. Agrega el ajo y el orégano y sofríe 1 min más. Agrega los tomates, el puré de tomate y ½ cucharadita de azúcar, además de un poco de condimento. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar, sin tapar, durante 10 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia. Después de 10 minutos, mezcle todo con una batidora de mano. Vierta los frijoles y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos más.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Coloque las rebanadas de pan en una sola capa en una bandeja para hornear y cocine a la parrilla por un lado hasta que estén ligeramente tostadas. Voltee y cubra cada tostada con la mezcla de frijoles, trozos de mozzarella y rebanadas de pepperoni o jamón, si se usa. Deslícelo debajo de la parrilla caliente durante 3 minutos, o hasta que el queso se haya derretido y esté ligeramente dorado en algunas partes. Espolvorea con hojas de albahaca antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15153,5657,'es','Sándwich de Panuozzo','Prepare sus propias baguettes y pesto para preparar estos sándwiches inspirados en pizza para toda la familia. Son sorprendentemente rápidos y fáciles de hacer y son excelentes para el almuerzo o una cena ligera.','["300 g de harina de pan blanca fuerte, más un poco más para espolvorear","3 g (aproximadamente medio sobre) de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 tomate, partido por la mitad y en rodajas","4 lonchas de jamón cocido","150 g de bola de mozzarella, cortada en rodajas y sazonada","un puñado pequeño de rúcula (opcional)","6 cucharadas de pesto (ver la receta a continuación)","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva"]','["Coloque la harina en un tazón grande, luego agregue la levadura y una pizca grande de sal. Hacer un hueco en el centro, verter 175 ml de agua tibia y el aceite y mezclar con una cuchara de madera hasta obtener una masa suave y bastante húmeda. Colóquelo sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y amase durante 5-8 minutos hasta que quede suave. Dividir la masa en cuatro bolitas y disponerlas en una bandeja enharinada, bien espaciadas entre sí. Cubrir con un paño de cocina y dejar reposar durante unos 40 minutos a 1 hora hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Calentar el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 8 y poner una bandeja para hornear en el horno para que se caliente. Extienda las bolas de masa sobre una superficie enharinada formando palitos de baguette largos de unos 22-25 cm de largo, colóquelos en la bandeja caliente y hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén inflados y dorados, luego déjelos enfriar. Se puede preparar unas horas antes de hornear.","Para armar, divida el pan por un lado y agregue cuidadosamente el tomate, el jamón, la mozzarella y la rúcula, si los usa. Mezclar el pesto con el aceite de oliva, rociar, cortar por la mitad y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15154,5659,'es','Cuenco de cereales con coles de Bruselas','Utilice las coles de Bruselas sobrantes de la mesa navideña con este sencillo tazón de cereales, con sabores de calabaza, hummus y tahini.','["½ calabaza (unos 300 g), pelada y cortada en cubos de 2 cm","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","170 g de coles de Bruselas, cortadas por la mitad","1 cucharada de tahini","2 cucharaditas de jarabe de arce","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","50 g de semillas de calabaza","Bolsa de 200 g de cereales cocidos (nosotros utilizamos quinoa)","2 cucharadas de hummus","un puñado de hierbas suaves (cilantro, perejil, menta o eneldo, o una mezcla), picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle la calabaza en la mitad del aceite en un extremo de una bandeja para hornear. Estación. Ase durante 20 minutos, revolviendo hasta la mitad. Agrega los brotes al otro extremo de la bandeja, rocía con el resto del aceite, sazona y asa durante 15 minutos más hasta que la calabaza esté tierna y los brotes crujientes.","Mezcle el tahini, el jarabe de arce, el jugo de limón y la ralladura en un tazón pequeño para hacer un aderezo, agregando un chorrito de agua para aflojar si está demasiado espeso. Tostar las semillas de calabaza en una sartén seca a fuego lento hasta que empiecen a reventar.","Calienta los granos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego divídelos en dos tazones. Cubra con las verduras asadas, el hummus, las semillas de calabaza y las hierbas. Rocíe con el aderezo y mezcle todo justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15155,5665,'es','Chorizo ​​y brócoli carbonara de brotes morados','Prepare esta versión de temporada de carbonara en 30 minutos para una comida sencilla entre semana. Esta es la mejor comida reconfortante.','["2 dientes de ajo grandes","200 g de chorizo, picado","3 huevos grandes, más 2 yemas (congela las claras para otra receta)","120 g de parmesano, finamente rallado","400 g de espaguetis","250 g de brócoli germinado morado, cortado en trozos pequeños"]','["Calienta una sartén grande a fuego medio. Pela los dientes de ajo enteros y fríelos junto con el chorizo ​​durante 5-7 minutos, o hasta que el chorizo ​​esté crujiente en los bordes. (No necesitarás aceite ya que el chorizo ​​se soltará solo). Saca el ajo con una espumadera y deséchalo.","Batir los huevos y las yemas en un bol. Añade el parmesano, una pizca de sal y un poco de pimienta negra.","Cocine los espaguetis en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo con sal durante 5 minutos, luego agregue el brócoli y cocine por 2 minutos más. Escurrir reservando un poco del agua de cocción de la pasta. Agrega los espaguetis y el brócoli a la sartén con el chorizo, luego vierte rápidamente sobre la mezcla de huevo y revuelve rápidamente para cubrir. Agregue un chorrito o dos del agua de cocción reservada para aflojar, si es necesario, luego sirva en cuatro tazones poco profundos."]','2026-01-11 13:06:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15156,5675,'es','Sopa cremosa de zanahoria','Prepare un reconfortante entrante o almuerzo en poco tiempo con nuestra cremosa sopa de zanahoria, cubierta con picatostes sin semillas y con ajo. Rápido y fácil, toma 30 minutos hacer','["1½ cucharada de aceite","1 cebolla, rebanada","1 rama de apio, en rodajas","3 dientes de ajo, 2 machacados y 1 dejado entero","1 kg de zanahorias, en rodajas finas","1,5 litros de caldo de pollo o verduras caliente","½ manojo pequeño de tomillo","2 rebanadas gruesas de masa madre","1 cucharada de semillas mixtas","1 cucharada de perejil picado","1½ cucharada de crema doble, más algo extra para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola grande o en una cacerola. Freír la cebolla y el apio durante 5 minutos. Agrega el ajo machacado y cocina por 1 min más. Agregue las zanahorias, el caldo y el tomillo, luego sazone y deje hervir. Baje a fuego lento y cocine, tapado, durante 25 minutos hasta que las zanahorias se ablanden.","Mientras tanto, calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Frotar el diente de ajo entero por ambos lados de la masa madre. Córtelo en trozos grandes y mézclelo con el aceite restante, una buena pizca de sal y las semillas. Extiéndalo en una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente. Mezclar con el perejil picado y reservar.","Retire el tomillo de la sartén y deséchelo. Bate la sopa con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Remueve la nata y sazona al gusto. Para servir, sirva la sopa en cuatro tazones, cubra con los picatostes y rocíe un poco más de crema, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15157,5677,'es','Bollitos de cangrejo y pepino','Adereza los bollos con una cobertura cremosa de cangrejo, pepino y eneldo. Está listo en 15 minutos, lo que lo hace ideal para un entrante navideño o un almuerzo ligero.','["½ pepino, pelado, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y cortado en tiras finas","150-200 g de carne de cangrejo picada (toda carne blanca o una mezcla de blanca y marrón, si lo desea)","1 cucharada de crema fresca","chorrito de jugo de limón","1 cucharadita de eneldo picado","4 bollos"]','["Vierta el pepino en un colador, espolvoréelo con sal y déjelo escurrir durante 10 minutos.","Vierta la carne de cangrejo en un bol con la crema fresca y el jugo de limón. Estación. Exprime las tiras de pepino para eliminar el exceso de agua y luego mezcla con el eneldo. Tuesta los bollos, luego cubre con la mezcla de cangrejo, una pequeña maraña de tiras de pepino y unas cuantas ramitas de eneldo extra."]','2026-01-11 13:06:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15158,5682,'es','Sopa de garbanzos ahumados con hierbas y yogur','Agregue una olla con sabor para darle un toque sutil a esta sopa de garbanzos ahumados. Ya sea para el almuerzo o la cena, es un plato que disfrutará toda la familia.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","½ cebolla, finamente picada","1 zanahoria, finamente picada","½ pimiento rojo, finamente picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 olla de caldo de tomate y chile ahumado Knorr","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","4 cucharadas de yogur","manojo pequeño de cilantro o menta"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola y fríe la cebolla, la zanahoria y el pimiento a fuego lento durante 5 minutos o hasta que se ablanden, pero no se doren. Agrega el ajo y sofríe por 30 segundos más.","Vierta los tomates, luego llene la lata con agua y viértala también en la sartén. Añade la olla Knorr de chile ahumado y tomate y 500 ml más de agua. Llevar a fuego lento y cocinar durante 10 minutos. Si desea una sopa con menos textura, licúela con una licuadora hasta que quede suave.","Agregue los garbanzos, triture algunos con un machacador de papas y luego cocine por otros 10 minutos. Para servir, sirva en cuatro tazones, mezcle un poco de yogur y esparza el cilantro o la menta encima."]','2026-01-11 13:06:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15159,5684,'es','Ensalada de mariscos Bloody Mary','Sirva esta ensalada de mariscos bloody mary como entrante o almuerzo ligero. Puedes variar los mariscos si quieres. Las vieiras y las gambas añaden dulzura, pero puedes utilizar mejillones, calamares o incluso ostras.','["2 cucharadas de aceite","1 diente de ajo, pelado y triturado","180 g de vieiras pequeñas o grandes, cortadas en rodajas","250 g de gambas crudas peladas (ver consejo)","200 ml de jugo de tomate fresco","1-2 cucharadas de salsa de ostras premium Lee Kum Kee","1 cucharadita de salsa de soja ligera premium Lee Kum Kee","1 cucharadita de vinagre de arroz sazonado Lee Kum Kee","½ limón, exprimido","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","1 aguacate pequeño, cortado en cubos","un puñado de cilantro picado"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en un wok, luego sube el fuego y agrega el ajo y las vieiras. Sofría durante 30 segundos a 1 minuto hasta que las vieiras estén recién cocidas. Vierta sobre un plato. Calienta el aceite restante y sofríe las gambas durante 1-2 minutos a fuego alto hasta que adquieran un color rosado, luego sazona con un poco de pimienta negra. Vierta sobre el plato con las vieiras. Deja que los mariscos se enfríen por completo.","Para hacer la salsa bloody mary, mezcle el jugo de tomate con la Salsa de Ostras Premium (use 2 cucharadas para un sabor más fuerte), la Salsa de Soja Light Premium, el Vinagre de Arroz Condimentado y el jugo de limón. Pruebe y ajuste el sabor con más ingredientes si desea un sabor aún más fuerte.","Cuando el marisco esté frío, divídelo en cuatro vasos o tazones pequeños y reserva 4 langostinos para decorar. Agrega el apio y el aguacate a cada vaso y vierte sobre la mezcla de tomate. Deje marinar durante 10 minutos o cubra y enfríe hasta por 4 horas. Adorna cada vaso con las gambas reservadas y un poco de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:06:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15160,5686,'es','Cerdo con cuscús de pepino y albaricoque','Pruebe este sabroso plato de cerdo con cuscús para cenar. Es saludable, está lleno de nutrientes y contiene cuatro de tus 5 al día.','["30 g de cilantro fresco","4 dientes de ajo pequeños, picados","2 cucharaditas de zumaque","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","400 g de filete de cerdo","1½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","gota de aceite de oliva, para asar","2 cebollas moradas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas","1 berenjena, cortada en cubos de 1 cm","200g de cuscús gigante integral","manojo pequeño de cebolletas (unos 100 g), cortadas en rodajas","½ pepino grande (unos 320 g), picado","1 limón rallado más 2 cucharadas de jugo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","15 g de menta, hojas picadas","8 albaricoques frescos (unos 320 g)","25 g de almendras laminadas tostadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Poner el cilantro en un tazón pequeño con el ajo, el zumaque, el aceite y 2 cucharadas de agua, luego mezclar con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Frote una cuarta parte sobre la carne de cerdo, luego coloque la carne en una bandeja para hornear grande y espolvoree sobre el pimentón.","Para el cuscús, unte una gota de aceite sobre las cebollas moradas y la berenjena y luego esparza sobre la carne de cerdo. (Si su bandeja no es lo suficientemente grande, use dos). Ase durante 25 minutos. Revisa la carne de cerdo y si no está cocida pero sí las verduras, saca las verduras del horno y cocina la carne de cerdo durante otros 10-15 minutos hasta que el jugo salga claro.","Mientras tanto, cocine el cuscús siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrralo y viértalo en un tazón con el resto de la mezcla de hierbas con ajo. Agrega las cebolletas, el pepino, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el aceite de oliva virgen extra y la menta. Cortar en cuartos y deshuesar los albaricoques. Si están maduros, agregue los albaricoques a la ensaladera, pero si están un poco firmes, agréguelos primero a la bandeja en el horno para cocinar durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Deja la carne de cerdo a un lado para que repose. Añade las cebollas rojas asadas, la berenjena, los albaricoques y las almendras al cuscús y mezcla todo. Corte la carne de cerdo en rodajas, sirva la mitad con la mitad del cuscús y enfríe el resto durante otro día para comerlo frío. Se mantendrá frío durante dos o tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:06:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15161,4686,'es','Udon yaki vegetariano','Agregue verduras a nuestro yaki udon lleno de sabor de inspiración japonesa. Es saludable, se prepara en solo 25 minutos y es bajo en grasas y calorías.','[]','[]','2026-01-11 13:06:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15162,5690,'es','Estofado de ternera balsámico con puré de verduras','Obtenga los cinco alimentos al día en este sabroso guiso de carne balsámico acompañado de la comida reconfortante ideal: un puré de verduras, perfecto para el clima frío.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva o de colza","2 cebollas grandes (325 g), cortadas por la mitad y en rodajas","600 g de ternera magra para guisar cortada en cubitos","2 dientes de ajo, picados","10 g de champiñones porcini secos","2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","1 cucharadita de mostaza inglesa en polvo","320 g de zanahorias finamente picadas","200 g de champiñones castaños grandes, cortados en cuartos","unas ramitas de tomillo fresco","4 porciones de 80 g de brócoli, cortado en floretes","750 g de colinabo, cortado en trozos","500 g de patatas cortadas en trozos pequeños"]','["Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3. Calentar el aceite en una cacerola resistente al horno de base pesada, luego sofreír las cebollas durante unos 8 minutos, revolviendo, hasta que estén doradas. Agrega la carne y el ajo y sofríe a fuego alto hasta que se dore por completo.","Vierta 500 ml de agua hirviendo sobre los champiñones secos en un bol para que se hidraten brevemente, luego vierta en la cazuela con el líquido y agregue el vinagre balsámico, el puré de tomate, el caldo y la mostaza. Agregue las zanahorias, los champiñones, el tomillo y un poco de condimento. Tapar y luego meter al horno durante 3 horas hasta que la carne esté tierna. Hacia el final de la cocción añadir un chorrito de agua si el guiso se ve seco.","Cuando el guiso esté casi listo, haz el puré. Hervir el colinabo y las patatas juntos durante 12-15 minutos en una sartén a fuego medio. Escurrir bien y luego triturar con una pizca de pimienta negra. Cocine al vapor o hierva la mitad del brócoli durante 5 minutos hasta que esté tierno. 4 Sirve la mitad del guiso con el brócoli cocido. El guiso restante se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días y congelado hasta por un mes. Descongelar bien antes de recalentar. Vuelva a calentar el guiso y tritúrelo en el microondas y cocine al vapor o hierva el brócoli restante durante la noche para ayudar a conservar las vitaminas."]','2026-01-11 13:06:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15163,5692,'es','Espaguetis de atún, alcaparras y guindilla','Mezcle atún, alcaparras y rúcula con ajo, chile y espaguetis para preparar esta cena fácil y saludable. Solo toma 25 minutos prepararlo.','["150 g de espaguetis o linguini","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado, más extra para servir (opcional)","1 cucharada de alcaparras escurridas","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado (tallos incluidos)","145 g de atún en agua de manantial, escurrido","90 g de hojas de rúcula o espinacas tiernas","½ limón, exprimido","150 g de espaguetis o linguini","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado, más extra para servir (opcional)","1 cucharada de alcaparras escurridas","manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado (tallos incluidos)","145 g de atún en agua de manantial, escurrido","90 g de hojas de rúcula o espinacas tiernas","½ limón, exprimido"]','["Cocine los espaguetis durante 9-11 minutos en una cacerola grande con agua bien salada hasta que estén al dente.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén a fuego muy lento y cocinar suavemente el ajo y la guindilla para infundir el aceite. Retirar del fuego si el ajo se está poniendo dorado claro, ya que esto lo amargará.","Escurrir la pasta, reservar una taza del agua de cocción y verter los espaguetis en la sartén. Mezcle la pasta en el aceite a fuego lento, agregando un poco de agua de la pasta para emulsionar en una salsa que cubra la pasta, luego agregue las alcaparras, el perejil, el atún y un poco de condimento. No revuelva demasiado vigorosamente; querrá conservar trozos de atún más grandes. Mezcle la rúcula y el jugo de limón con los espaguetis y sirva con más chile esparcido por encima, si lo desea.","Cocine los espaguetis durante 9-11 minutos en una cacerola grande con agua bien salada hasta que estén al dente.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén a fuego muy lento y cocinar suavemente el ajo y la guindilla para infundir el aceite. Retirar del fuego si el ajo se está poniendo dorado claro, ya que esto lo amargará.","Escurrir la pasta, reservar una taza del agua de cocción y verter los espaguetis en la sartén. Mezcle la pasta en el aceite a fuego lento, agregando un poco de agua de la pasta para emulsionar en una salsa que cubra la pasta, luego agregue las alcaparras, el perejil, el atún y un poco de condimento. No revuelva demasiado vigorosamente; querrá conservar trozos de atún más grandes. Mezcle la rúcula y el jugo de limón con los espaguetis y sirva con más chile esparcido por encima, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15164,5694,'es','Apio nabo asado con trufa entera, salsa de queso y avellanas','Prueba este sensacional apio nabo asado con trufa entera, con salsa cremosa de queso y avellanas. Es una fantástica alternativa vegetariana para el almuerzo navideño o el asado dominical.','["1 apio nabo grande","2 cucharadas de aceite de trufa, más un poco más para rociar","3 dientes de ajo, rebanados","½ manojo pequeño de salvia, con las hojas recogidas","30 g de avellanas tostadas y picadas","40 g de mantequilla","40 g de harina común","350ml de leche entera","100 g de queso duro vegetariano estilo italiano, rallado","50ml de nata doble"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Coloque una capa grande de papel para hornear sobre una hoja grande de papel de aluminio, luego coloque el apio en el centro. Frote todo con aceite de trufa y luego sazone bien. Esparza sobre el ajo y las hojas de salvia, luego junte los bordes del pergamino y cúbralos con papel de aluminio, apretándolos para sellar y formar un paquete. Colóquelo en una fuente para asar y ase durante 2 horas o hasta que esté tierno y dorado. Rocíe a mitad de cocción con un chorrito extra de aceite de trufa, si lo desea.","Mientras tanto, haz la salsa. Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola hasta que forme espuma, luego agregue la harina y revuelva hasta que quede suave. Cocine durante 2 minutos, luego agregue la leche, poco a poco, hasta que esté completamente incorporada y suave y cremosa. Bata el queso y la crema, luego sazone al gusto.","Corta el apio nabo asado en cuatro gajos. Vierta sobre la salsa de queso y espolvoree con las avellanas."]','2026-01-11 13:06:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15165,5698,'es','Ensalada pitta cóctel de gambas y lima','Prepare esta rápida ensalada de cóctel de gambas y lima como un almuerzo abundante y lleno de sabor. Es sabroso, saludable y bajo en calorías.','["½ pita integral","½ cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cucharadita de tabasco","1 cucharadita de ketchup bajo en azúcar y sal","1 cucharada de mayonesa baja en grasa","1 cucharada de yogur natural sin grasa","½ lima, rallada y en jugo, más gajos para servir","60 g de langostinos cocidos","1 lechuga Little Gem, con las hojas separadas","¼ de pepino pequeño, pelado en tiras","4 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cortar el pan pita en triángulos, colocarlo en una bandeja para horno y rociar con aceite. Hornee durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente.","Mezcle el Tabasco, el ketchup, la mayonesa, el yogur, la ralladura y el jugo de lima. Echa los langostinos con el aderezo.","Coloque en capas la lechuga, el pepino, los tomates y los langostinos aliñados en una lonchera o en un frasco. Sazone, cubra con los chips de pita y sirva con rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:06:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15166,5702,'es','pita césar','Prepare un pan pita con pollo, ensalada y aderezo César casero para un almuerzo fácil. Solo toma 10 minutos desde la preparación hasta el plato y además es saludable','["1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","½ diente de ajo pequeño, machacado","1 cucharada de yogur griego sin grasa","1 cucharada de mayonesa más ligera","¼ cucharadita de mostaza en polvo","1 anchoa marrón, enjuagada y finamente picada","½ cucharada de parmesano rallado","1 pechuga de pollo cocida pequeña y sin piel o 80 g de pollo cocido, desmenuzado","¼ de pepino pequeño, en cubos","3 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","4 hojas de lechuga Little Gem, ralladas","1 pan pita integral"]','["Batir el zumo de limón, el ajo, el yogur, la mayonesa, la mostaza en polvo, la anchoa, el parmesano y 2-3 cucharadas de agua junto con un buen molido de pimienta negra. Agregue el pollo, el pepino, los tomates y la lechuga hasta que todo esté bien cubierto. Tuesta el pan pita y divídelo, luego rellénalo con la mezcla de ensalada y pollo."]','2026-01-11 13:06:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15167,5704,'es','Niçoise de verduras carbonizadas y atún con aderezo cremoso de kéfir','Sirva esta abundante ensalada baja en calorías los días en que necesite una comida rápida al mediodía. Es un almuerzo ideal, ya que está repleto de proteínas para que puedas seguir adelante durante la tarde.','["100 g de judías verdes, peladas","6 cebolletas, recortadas","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","100 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","4 cucharaditas de kéfir o yogur natural sin grasa","1 cucharadita de mostaza en polvo","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino tinto","2 lechugas Little Gem, con las hojas separadas","Lata de 160 g de atún en agua de manantial, escurrido","4 aceitunas negras, partidas por la mitad","2 huevos medianos, hervidos y cortados por la mitad"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Ponga a hervir agua en una cacerola pequeña y blanquee las judías verdes y las cebolletas durante 4 minutos. Escurrir y secar bien. Mezcle con 1 cucharadita de aceite y transfiéralo a una bandeja para hornear con los tomates, con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Sazone todo con pimienta negra, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 10 minutos hasta que comience a ablandarse y carbonizarse. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Mientras tanto, bata el kéfir, 1 cucharadita de aceite, la mostaza en polvo, el vinagre y un poco de condimento hasta que quede suave. Coloque las hojas de lechuga, el atún, las aceitunas y los huevos en tazones o platos poco profundos. Apila las cebollas, las judías verdes y los tomates, luego rocía el aderezo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15168,5706,'es','Poke bowls de gambas y cereales','Marina rápidamente los langostinos con un aderezo de chile y lima, luego sírvelos con cereales, mango, rábano, aguacate y cebolletas. Este poke bowl es la ensalada de verano definitiva','["3 limas, en jugo","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 cucharadas de aceite de sésamo","150 g de langostinos cocidos","Bolsa de 250 g de cereales mixtos (o 250 g de cereales mixtos cocidos)","1 aguacate maduro, sin hueso y en cubos","6 rábanos, rebanados","100 g de mango, pelado y cortado en cubitos","3 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","pizca de semillas de sésamo para servir (opcional)"]','["Batir el jugo de lima, la guindilla y el aceite en un bol. Salpimentamos, añadimos las gambas y dejamos macerar 10 min.","Mientras tanto, coloque los granos en un colador y viértalos sobre agua caliente del hervidor para ablandarlos un poco. Escurrir bien.","Divida los granos en dos tazones. Cubra con los langostinos marinados, el aguacate, los rábanos, el mango y las cebolletas. Rocíe sobre la marinada sobrante y sirva los poke bowls con una pizca de semillas de sésamo, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15169,5708,'es','Sopa verde fría con queso feta','Sirva esta sopa verde fría como parte de un menú de verano. No es necesario cocinar: simplemente mezcle los ingredientes para preparar una comida refrescante y llena de nutrientes.','["70 g de queso feta vegetariano, desmenuzado","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro, trituradas","1 chile rojo grande, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","200 g de espinacas tiernas","2 aguacates maduros grandes, sin hueso y en cubos","1 pepino grande, picado","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","250 gramos de yogur natural","manojo pequeño de albahaca","2 cucharadas de semillas mixtas tostadas, para servir"]','["Pon el queso feta en un bol y vierte sobre el aceite de oliva, las semillas de cilantro, la guindilla y la ralladura de limón. Dejar de lado.","Vierta los ingredientes restantes (excepto las semillas) en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Estación. Agregue 50-100 ml de agua fría y vuelva a mezclar para aflojar. Enfríe por hasta 1 hora.","Vierta en cuatro tazones y cubra con el queso feta, el líquido de marinado y las semillas."]','2026-01-11 13:06:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15170,5710,'es','Wraps integrales con hummus de guisantes y remolacha','Esta opción de almuerzo rápido contiene 3 de tus 5 al día y es un excelente combustible para hacer ejercicio. Los wraps caseros son fáciles de hacer y mucho más sabrosos que los comprados en la tienda.','["85 g de harina integral con levadura, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","160 g de guisantes congelados y descongelados","1 limón, ½ exprimido y la otra ½ cortada en gajos (opcional)","4 cucharadas de yogur bio","1 diente de ajo grande","un puñado de hojas de menta","2 puñados de ensalada de hojas tiernas","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente cortada","2 remolachas grandes ya cocidas (160 g), en rodajas","30 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","20 g de nueces picadas"]','["Para los wraps, vierte la harina en un tazón pequeño y frota con aceite. Agrega 60 ml de agua tibia y junta con las manos para formar una masa suave. Córtelo por la mitad, luego extienda cada trozo sobre una superficie enharinada lo más fino que pueda para formar una ronda que cubra la base de una sartén grande. Calienta la sartén y luego cocina los rollitos durante unos 2 minutos por cada lado; no es necesario añadir aceite adicional. Tenga cuidado de no dejarlos crujientes, ya que deben permanecer flexibles.","Para el relleno, mezcle los guisantes, el jugo de limón, 2 cucharadas de yogur, el ajo y la mayor parte de la menta con un procesador de alimentos o una batidora de mano para hacer un puré espeso. Distribuya sobre los wraps y luego amontone las hojas de lechuga, la cebolla y la remolacha. Agregue el yogur restante y esparza sobre el queso feta, las nueces y la menta restante. Sirva con rodajas de limón para exprimir, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15171,5712,'es','Pasta escandinava de remolacha y salmón','Come bien en el trabajo con esta ensalada de fusilli de salmón y remolacha de inspiración escandinava, fácil de preparar. Te mantendrá activo toda la tarde.','["50 g de fusilli integrales","1 remolacha cocida, cortada en gajos","½ aguacate maduro pequeño, en cubos","2 pepinos tiernos, rebanados","2 cucharadas de eneldo picado","1 cucharada de yogur griego sin grasa mezclado con 1 cucharada de agua","1 cucharadita colmada de crema de rábano picante","50 g de salmón escalfado, desmenuzado","rúcula 30g"]','["Cocine los fusilli siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrralos y déjelos enfriar. Mezcle la pasta con la remolacha, el aguacate, el pepino, el eneldo, el yogur y el rábano picante, luego sazone generosamente con pimienta negra.","Mezcle suavemente el salmón y la rúcula con la pasta, luego viértalo en su lonchera o en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 13:06:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15172,5716,'es','Tazón de lentejas con batata y coliflor','Prepare este sabroso tazón vegano con anticipación y guárdelo en el refrigerador para almuerzos rápidos y satisfactorios a pedido. Cada tazón cuenta con cuatro de tus 5 al día.','["1 batata grande, sin piel, lavada y cortada en trozos medianos","1 coliflor, cortada en floretes grandes, con el tallo cortado en cubitos","1 cucharada de garam masala","3 cucharadas de aceite de maní","2 dientes de ajo","200 g de lentejas del Puy","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","1 tsp Dijon mustard","1½ limas, exprimidas","2 zanahorias","¼ de col lombarda","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle la batata y la coliflor con el garam masala, la mitad del aceite y un poco de condimento. Extiéndalo en una bandeja para asar grande. Agregue el ajo y ase durante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté cocido.","Mientras tanto, ponemos las lentejas en un cazo con 400ml de agua fría. Deje hervir, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 20-25 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén cocidas pero aún tengan algo de sabor. Drenar.","Retira los dientes de ajo de la bandeja y aplástalos con la hoja de tu cuchillo. Pon el ajo en un bol grande con el resto del aceite, el jengibre, la mostaza, una pizca de azúcar y un tercio del jugo de lima. Batir, luego agregar las lentejas calientes, revolver y sazonar al gusto. Rallar las zanahorias en trozos grandes, desmenuzar la col y picar el cilantro en trozos grandes. Exprima el jugo de limón restante y sazone al gusto.","Divida la mezcla de lentejas en cuatro tazones (o cuatro recipientes si la guarda y la enfría). Cubra cada porción con una cuarta parte de la ensalada de zanahoria y una cuarta parte de la mezcla de camote y coliflor."]','2026-01-11 13:06:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15173,5718,'es','Linguine con aguacate, tomate y lima','Utilice ingredientes de guacamole para preparar este linguini vegano bajo en calorías que también se puede servir frío como ensalada de pasta. Ofrece sabor y es saludable.','["115 g de linguini integral","1 lima, rallada y en jugo","1 aguacate, sin hueso, pelado y picado","2 tomates maduros grandes, picados","½ paquete de cilantro fresco, picado","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado (opcional)"]','["Cocine la pasta según las instrucciones del paquete, unos 10 minutos. Mientras tanto, ponga el jugo de limón y la ralladura en un tazón mediano con el aguacate, los tomates, el cilantro, la cebolla y el chile, si los usa, y mezcle bien.","Escurrir la pasta, echarla al bol y mezclar bien. Sirva inmediatamente mientras aún esté caliente o frío."]','2026-01-11 13:06:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15174,5720,'es','Arroz de alcachofas y berenjenas','Además de sabrosa, esta berenjena y alcachofa es baja en grasas, baja en calorías y rentable. Haz una tanda grande y cómela fría al día siguiente.','["60 ml de aceite de oliva","2 berenjenas, cortadas en trozos","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","paquete pequeño de perejil, hojas recogidas y tallos finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma","400 gramos de arroz para paella","1½ l de caldo de verduras Kallo","2 paquetes de 175 g de alcachofas a la brasa","2 limones 1 en jugo, 1 cortado en gajos para servir"]','["Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande o en una paellera. Freír las berenjenas hasta que tengan un bonito color por todos lados (agregue otra cucharada de aceite si la berenjena empieza a prenderse demasiado), luego retírelas y reserve. Agrega otra cucharada de aceite a la sartén y sofríe la cebolla durante 2-3 minutos o hasta que se ablande. Agregue los tallos de ajo y perejil, cocine por unos minutos más, luego agregue las especias y el arroz hasta que todo esté bien cubierto. Calentar durante 2 minutos, añadir la mitad del caldo y cocinar, sin tapar, a fuego medio durante 20 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando para evitar que se pegue.","Agrega la berenjena y las alcachofas a la mezcla, vierte sobre el resto del caldo y cocina por 20 minutos más o hasta que el arroz esté bien cocido. Picar las hojas de perejil, mezclarlas con el jugo de limón y sazonar bien. Lleve toda la sartén a la mesa y vierta en tazones, con las rodajas de limón a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:06:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15175,5724,'es','Ensalada de judías cannellini y huevo con migas crujientes','Esta ensalada saludable tiene muchas texturas: frijoles suaves, pan rallado crujiente, huevo cremoso y lechuga crujiente Little Gem.','["2 huevos medianos","8 cebolletas, recortadas (quitar la raíz y la mitad de la parte verde oscura)","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 rebanada de pan integral, partido en pan rallado en trozos","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","jugo ½ limón","1 tsp Dijon mustard","½ cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","un puñado de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","1 lechuga Little Gem, picada en trozos grandes"]','["Cocer los huevos en agua hirviendo.\r\ndurante 6 minutos, o más si lo prefieres\r\nduro. Agregue las cebolletas para\r\nlos últimos 3 minutos de cocción. Quitar y\r\npase ambos bajo agua fría. cuando esté frío\r\nsuficiente para manipular, acariciar las cebolletas\r\nsecar y pelar los huevos.","Mientras tanto, calentar ½ cucharada de aceite en un\r\nsartén antiadherente. Punta en pan rallado\r\ny temporada. Freír durante 3-4 minutos hasta que estén crujientes.\r\ny dorado, luego reservar.","Mezcle las cebolletas con los frijoles.\r\njugo de limón, mostaza, cebolla morada, perejil,\r\naceite restante y lechuga. Temporada y\r\ncoloque encima los huevos duros cortados por la mitad. espolvorear\r\ncon las migas y comer inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15176,5726,'es','Ensalada de pollo Vitality con aderezo de aguacate','Una mezcla súper verde y saludable de soja, pepino, aguacate y lechuga Little Gem, cubierta con pechuga de pollo magra desmenuzada.','["un puñado de habas de soja congeladas","1 pechuga de pollo cocida y sin piel, desmenuzada","¼ de pepino, pelado, sin semillas y picado","½ aguacate, sin pulpa","unas gotas de salsa tabasco","jugo de ½ limón, más una rodajita de limón","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","5-6 hojas de lechuga Little Gem","1 cucharadita de semillas mixtas"]','["Blanquear las semillas de soja durante 3 minutos. Enjuague\r\nen agua fría y escurrir bien. Pon el\r\npollo, frijoles y pepino en un bol.","Blitz el aguacate, Tabasco, limón.\r\njugo y aceite en un procesador de alimentos o\r\ncon una batidora de mano. Sazonar, verter\r\nen el tazón y mezcle bien para cubrir.","Vierta la mezcla en la lechuga.\r\nhojas (o sírvelas junto con ellas)\r\ny espolvorear con las semillas. Enfriar hasta\r\nalmuerzo, luego sírvalo con una rodajita de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:06:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15177,5728,'es','Ensalada de bistec, pimientos asados ​​y cebada perlada','Una vibrante ensalada repleta de pimientos amarillos y rojos, cebolla colorida, carne de res cocinada a tu gusto y cereales saludables.','["85 g de cebada perlada, enjuagada","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en tiras","1 pimiento amarillo, sin semillas y cortado en tiras","1 cebolla morada, cortada en 8 gajos, dejando la raíz intacta","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco extra","1 filete magro grande, de unos 300 g, sin exceso de grasa","½ bolsa de 100 g de berros, picados en trozos grandes","jugo de ½ limón, más gajos para servir (opcional)"]','["Pon la cebada perlada en una cacerola grande.\r\nde agua. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar.\r\nvigorosamente durante 25-30 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos.\r\nEscurrir bien y transferir a un bol.","Mientras tanto, calentar el horno a 200C/\r\nVentilador 180C/gas 6. Poner los pimientos\r\nuna bandeja para horno con los gajos de cebolla,\r\nagregue 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva y ase durante\r\nunos 20 minutos hasta que estén tiernos.","Mientras se asan los pimientos, frote\r\nel filete con un poco de aceite y\r\ntemporada. Cocine en una sartén antiadherente\r\ndurante 3-4 minutos por cada lado, o al gusto.\r\nDejar reposar unos minutos. Mezclar el\r\npimientos y cebollas cocidos en el\r\ncebada. Revuelva los berros, el limón.\r\njugo y un poco de condimento. rebanada fina\r\nlos filetes, colocar encima de la ensalada y\r\nsirva con rodajas de limón, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15178,5730,'es','Bolsillos pitta de calabacín picante','Disfrute de una cena en solitario de verduras asadas, servidas en bolsitas de pan con tahini, hummus, habas y harissa.','["1 calabacín, recortado y cortado en rodajas finas a lo largo","2 cucharaditas de pasta Harissa","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","un puñado pequeño de habas (frescas o congeladas)","2 cucharadas de hummus","1 cebolla tierna, cortada finamente","1 cucharadita de pasta de tahini","diente de ajo pequeño, machacado","exprimir el jugo de limon","1 cucharada de yogur estilo griego","1 pan pita integral grande"]','["Echar las rodajas de calabacín en el\r\nharissa y aceite de oliva, y sazonar.\r\nCocine en una plancha caliente durante 2 minutos.\r\ncada lado o hasta que estén tiernos. Transferir\r\na un plato y reservar.","Cocer las habas a fuego lento.\r\nagua durante 2 minutos, escurrir con agua corriente fría y luego sacarlos del\r\nsus pieles exteriores. Deseche las pieles.\r\nPoner las habas, el hummus y\r\ncebolla tierna en un tazón pequeño y\r\nmezclar para combinar.","En otro bol mezclar el tahini,\r\najo, jugo de limón y yogur.\r\nTuesta el pitta y divídelo para crear\r\n2 bolsillos. Cuchara el hummus\r\nmezclar dentro de cada bolsillo, seguido\r\npor las rodajas de calabacín picantes y\r\nun chorrito de la mezcla de yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:06:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15179,5732,'es','Garbanzos picantes con espinacas y tocino','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. ¿Estás aburrido del mismo sándwich a la hora del almuerzo? Pruebe este refrigerio rápido y fácil bajo en grasas','["1 loncha de tocino inclinado hacia atrás","1 diente de ajo en rodajas finas","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino","2-3 cucharadas de garbanzos enlatados, escurridos y lavados","½ bolsa de espinacas tiernas"]','["Cortar la loncha de tocino en tiras y cocinar en una sartén antiadherente caliente con el diente de ajo. Agrega el vinagre de vino y los garbanzos. Agregue las hojas tiernas de espinacas y revuelva hasta que se ablanden. Sazone si lo desea y luego sirva caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15180,5734,'es','Minestrone en minutos','Prepare un abundante plato de sopa en muy poco tiempo, perfecto para un almuerzo rápido o una cena caliente.','["1 litro de caldo de verduras caliente","400 g de tomates picados en lata","100 g de espaguetis finos, partidos en trozos cortos","350 g de verduras mixtas congeladas","4 cucharadas de pesto","chorrito de aceite de oliva","queso parmesano vegetariano rallado grueso, para servir"]','["Hierva el caldo con los tomates, luego agregue los espaguetis y cocine por 6 minutos o hasta que estén cocidos. Unos minutos antes de que la pasta esté lista, añade las verduras y vuelve a llevar a ebullición. Cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos hasta que todo esté cocido.","Sirva en tazones rociados con pesto y aceite.\r\nespolvoreado con parmesano."]','2026-01-11 13:06:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15181,5736,'es','Ensalada de tomate y frijoles mantecosos y chile','Supersaludable, cuenta como 2 de 5 al día','["Tarro de 540 g de alubias grandes","500 g de tomates pelados y sin corazón","1 chile rojo","manojo de albahaca","1 diente de ajo","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto"]','["Escurrir y enjuagar los frijoles mantecosos y colocarlos en un tazón. Picar los tomates y agregarlos a los frijoles. Coloque el chile, la albahaca (reservando algunas hojas pequeñas), el ajo, el aceite de oliva y el vinagre en el tazón pequeño de un procesador de alimentos y luego bata hasta que quede suave. Agregue a los tomates y los frijoles, sazone y mezcle. Servir esparcidos con unas hojitas pequeñas."]','2026-01-11 13:06:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15182,5738,'es','Minestrone de primavera','Esta sencilla sopa aprovecha al máximo las verduras de primavera y se convertirá en el recurso favorito para un almuerzo o cena rápidos.','["200 g de verduras mixtas (nosotros utilizamos espárragos, habas y cebolletas)","700 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","140 g de pasta cocida (los espaguetis funcionan bien, cortados en trozos pequeños)","Lata de 215 g de alubias, enjuagadas y escurridas","3 cucharadas de pesto verde"]','["Coloque las verduras en una cacerola mediana y luego vierta sobre el caldo. Deje hervir, luego reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento hasta que las verduras estén bien cocidas, aproximadamente 3 minutos. Agrega la pasta cocida, los frijoles y 1 cucharada de pesto. Caliente bien, luego sirva en tazones y cubra cada uno con otro chorrito de pesto."]','2026-01-11 13:06:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15183,5740,'es','Ensalada casera de arroz con atún','Ideal para hogares ocupados, esta abundante ensalada se conserva bien en el refrigerador hasta por tres días, lista para servirse en un tazón cuando tenga hambre.','["aproximadamente 900 g/2 lb de arroz cocido frío (aproximadamente 400 g/14 oz de arroz crudo)","400g de atún en manantial","200 g de petits pois congelados y descongelados bajo el grifo de agua caliente","2 pimientos rojos, pelados con un pelador de patatas, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","3 tomates, picados en trozos pequeños","5 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","manojo de perejil de hoja plana, picado","un puñado grande de aceitunas verdes deshuesadas, picadas en trozos grandes (opcional)","4 cucharadas de mayonesa","jugo 1 limon","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["El arroz cocido probablemente tendrá\r\nagrupados, así que divídalos en una\r\ntazón grande para mezclar. Desmenuzar el atún,\r\nluego mezcle los guisantes, los pimientos, los tomates,\r\ncebolletas, perejil y aceitunas, si eres\r\nusándolos.","Revuelva con la mayonesa, el limón.\r\njugo y aceite de oliva y sazonar al gusto.\r\nCubra el recipiente con film transparente o colóquelo\r\nen un recipiente de plástico grande y deja que tu\r\nel hogar se sirve solo cuando\r\ntienen hambre."]','2026-01-11 13:06:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15184,5742,'es','Sándwich verde','Este saludable sándwich está repleto de bondades que te mantendrán activo hasta la cena.','["3 rebanadas de tostadas integrales o de centeno","3 cucharadas de hummus ya preparado","1 aguacate pequeño (100 g), sin hueso y en rodajas","1 puñado de hojas de rúcula","8-12 tomates cherry, rebanados"]','["Tostar el pan y untar hummus\r\nuniformemente sobre un lado de cada rebanada. encendido\r\nuna rebanada de pan, poner la mitad del aguacate,\r\nrúcula y tomate. Sazone con\r\npimienta, luego cubra con otra rodaja.","Apile el resto del aguacate, la rúcula\r\ny tomate, sazonar nuevamente y cubrir con\r\nla tercera rebanada."]','2026-01-11 13:06:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15185,4741,'es','Platos principales de lonchera','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Rellenos satisfactorios y nutritivos para loncheras que se preparan en unos minutos.','["wrap de pollo y guacamole","ensalada de pasta muy fácil","mini rollitos de jamón","almuerzo del labrador de queso","sopa de camote y garbanzos (todos los ingredientes de la receta a continuación)"]','["pollo\r\nguacamole\r\nenvolverToma 1 tortilla\r\nenvolver y untar 2 cucharadas compradas en la tienda\r\nguacamole por la mitad. Coloque ½\r\npechuga de pollo desmenuzada y ½ rebanada\r\npimiento rojo encima. Espolvorear con 30g\r\nqueso cheddar rallado y enrollar bien. Envolver\r\nen papel para horno y atar con hilo,\r\no enróllelo bien en film transparente (1 porción).","muy facil\r\nensalada de pastaCocinar 85g de pasta\r\nformas, agregando 3 cucharadas cada una congelada\r\nguisantes y maíz dulce congelado para el\r\núltimo minuto Drenar; enjuague con agua fría.\r\nMezclar 1 cucharada de cada yogur natural y\r\naderezo balsámico comprado en la tienda,\r\ncon 1 cucharadita de mayonesa. Vierta sobre el\r\npasta, luego agregue 1 cucharada picada\r\nalbahaca y 3 tomates cherry partidos por la mitad (1 porción).","Mini rollitos de jamónMezclar 1 cucharada de mayonesa\r\ncon 1 cucharadita cada uno\r\ngrano integral\r\nmostaza y miel. Dividir 2 pequeños\r\nrollos integrales por la mitad y untar\r\ncada lado con la mezcla de mayonesa. Cosas\r\ncada rollo con 2-3 rodajas de pepino,\r\n1 hoja de Baby Gem y 1 loncha de jamón (1 persona).","Lonchera de Plowman Corta un trozo de\r\nqueso cheddar y 1 manzana\r\nen gajos (exprima un poco de jugo de limón para evitar que se doren). Coloque 2 hojas de Baby Gem\r\nen un recipiente, luego vierta 2 cucharadas\r\nchutney en una hoja y use la otra\r\nhoja para contener una ensalada hecha de 1 hoja pequeña\r\nzanahoria rallada, 3 tomates cherry y\r\n1 cucharada de berros. Servir con una selección de\r\ngalletas saladas, si quieres (para 1 persona).","batata\r\ny garbanzos\r\nsopaCalienta 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva en una sartén; suavizar\r\n1 cebolla finamente picada durante 3 min. Añadir\r\n2 dientes de ajo rebanados, cocinar por 3 minutos\r\nmás. Agrega 1 cucharadita de cada comino molido.\r\ny cilantro molido, cocinar por 1 min.\r\nAgrega 1 batata, cortada en 1 cm.\r\ncubos. Freír durante 2 minutos y luego verter.\r\n600ml de caldo de verduras caliente. hervir durante\r\n10 minutos hasta que la papa esté tierna. Añadir\r\nLata de 220g de garbanzos escurridos. Calor\r\nantes de batir hasta que quede suave.\r\nAgregue 1 cucharada de crema agria y 50 ml.\r\nleche. Vierta en un termo cuando esté caliente (para 2 personas)."]','2026-01-11 13:06:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15186,5748,'es','Empanadas de puerro, queso y patatas','Los minipaquetes de masa vegetal con queso chorreante son un refrigerio casero reconfortante y de gran valor.','["2 patatas pequeñas (aproximadamente 300 g/11 oz), cortadas en cubos de 1 cm","nuez de mantequilla","2 puerros pequeños, sin las hojas exteriores duras, partidos por la mitad a lo largo y en rodajas finas","3 ramitas de tomillo, hojas picadas","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","2 cucharadas de crema","harina, para espolvorear","500 g de masa quebrada en bloque","140 g/5 oz de queso Welsh Caerphilly, cheddar fuerte o alternativa vegetariana, cortado en trozos pequeños","1 huevo batido"]','["Cocer las patatas en ebullición, saladas.\r\nagua durante 5-8 minutos hasta que esté tierna, pero aún\r\nmanteniendo su forma. Mientras tanto, derrita el\r\nmantequilla en una cacerola grande. Agrega los puerros\r\ny el tomillo y ablande durante 10-12 minutos.\r\nEscurrir las patatas y añadirlas a los puerros con\r\nla mostaza y mucho condimento. Revuelva\r\nen la nata y dejar enfriar un poco.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nSobre una superficie enharinada, extiende la masa.\r\nal grosor de una moneda de £1. usa un lado\r\nplato o un bol como plantilla para cortar\r\nHaga círculos de 6 x 15 cm. mezclar el queso\r\ncon la mezcla de puerros y hacer un montículo\r\nde la mezcla en el centro de cada masa\r\ncírculo. Cepille los bordes con un poco\r\nhuevo, luego junte los bordes y\r\nengarce con los dedos para sellar.","Coloque las empanadas en una bandeja para hornear.\r\nforrado con papel para hornear, pincel\r\ncon el huevo restante y hornear\r\ndurante 40-45 minutos hasta que se doren.\r\nServir caliente o dejar enfriar."]','2026-01-11 13:06:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15187,5750,'es','Sopa de calabacín, patatas y queso cheddar','Esta sopa congelable es una forma deliciosa de aprovechar un exceso de calabacines.','["500 g de patatas, sin pelar y picadas en trozos grandes","2 cubitos de caldo de verduras","1 kg de calabacines, picados en trozos grandes","manojo de cebolleta, en rodajas; guarde 1 para servir, si se come inmediatamente","100 g de queso cheddar extra maduro o alternativa vegetariana, rallado, y un poco más para servir","buena nuez moscada fresca rallada y más para servir"]','["Pon las patatas en una cacerola grande con\r\nsuficiente agua para cubrirlos y\r\ndesmenuzar en los cubitos de caldo. llevar a la\r\nhervir, luego tapar y cocinar durante 5 minutos. Añadir\r\nlos calabacines, tapar y\r\ncocine por 5 minutos más. Lanzar la primavera\r\ncebollas, cubra y cocine por los últimos 5 minutos.","Retire del fuego, luego agregue el\r\nqueso y sazonar con nuez moscada, sal\r\ny pimienta. Batir hasta obtener una sopa espesa, agregando\r\nmás agua caliente hasta conseguir la\r\nconsistencia que te guste. Servir dispersos\r\ncon queso cheddar extra rallado y cebolletas\r\ny nuez moscada o pimienta. O genial y\r\ncongelar en bolsas o recipientes para congelador con\r\nbuenos párpados por hasta 3 meses."]','2026-01-11 13:06:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15188,5752,'es','Ensalada de gambas en capas','Las cenas en solitario aún pueden ser un placer con esta receta rápida pero llena de sabor.','["1 huevo","1 lechuga Baby Gem, rallada","lata de 195g de maíz dulce","1 zanahoria, rallada gruesa","½ pepino pequeño, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","100 g de gambas cocidas","2 cucharadas de mayonesa extra light","1 cucharada de salsa de tomate","chorrito de salsa tabasco","rodajita de limón, para servir (opcional)"]','["Hervir el huevo en una cacerola pequeña.\r\nagua durante 8 minutos, escurrir y dejar pasar\r\nagua fría hasta que se enfríe. Pele y luego corte en rodajas.","Coloque la ensalada en capas en un tazón comenzando con\r\nla lechuga, luego el maíz dulce, la zanahoria,\r\npepino, huevo y terminar con el\r\ngambas. Mezclar la mayonesa y el ketchup.\r\ncon un chorrito de Tabasco, luego verter\r\npor encima. Servir con un limón\r\ncuña, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:06:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15189,4751,'es','Aperitivos para la lonchera','Mantenga a raya el hambre con estos deliciosos y saludables bocadillos para la lonchera','["salsa de frijoles con palitos de verduras","batido de plátano y frambuesa","ciruelas natillas de canela","potes de granola de yogur de albaricoque","muffins de zanahoria y piña (todos los ingredientes para las recetas a continuación)"]','["Salsa de frijoles con\r\npalitos de verduras 5 de 5 al día, bajos en grasa.\r\nWhiz lata de 215g\r\njudías verdes escurridas, exprimir el limón\r\njugo, 1 diente de ajo pequeño machacado,\r\n1 cucharada de perejil picado y menta,\r\n2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva y 1 cucharada de agua. servir\r\ncon cucharones de verduras elaborados con 1\r\nrama de apio, 1 zanahoria y ½ pimiento rojo - envuélvalos en un trozo de papel de cocina húmedo para evitar que se sequen\r\n(para 1 persona).","Batido de plátano y frambuesaWhizz 85g de frambuesas junto con\r\n1 plátano picado y 150ml de naranja\r\njugo hasta que quede suave (1 porción).","canela\r\nchirimoyasPoner 1 cucharada de miel,\r\n1 cucharadita de mantequilla, 2 ciruelas en cuartos, unas pocas\r\ngotas de extracto de vainilla, pizca molida\r\ncanela y 2 cucharaditas de agua en un plato.\r\nCubrir con film transparente, perforar, microondas.\r\ndurante 3 minutos en nivel alto. Una vez enfriado poner\r\nfruta en un recipiente y vierta 2-3 cucharadas de natillas encima. Sellar y refrigerar\r\n(para 1 persona).","yogur de albaricoque\r\nollas de granolaMezcle 200 g de avena, 2 cucharadas de miel y\r\n1 cucharada de aceite de girasol en una bandeja para horno.\r\nExtienda y hornee a 200C/180C ventilador/\r\ngas 6 durante 7 minutos. Revuelva, hornee por 7 minutos.\r\nmás. Fresco. Mezclar con 150g de frutos secos (suficiente para 8 porciones).\r\nPara una ración, mezclar 100ml natural\r\nyogur con 1 cucharada de albaricoque sin azúcar\r\nmermelada en un recipiente. Guarde la granola en un\r\nrecipiente hermético y porcione en un\r\nbolsa pequeña al empacar la lonchera.","zanahoria y\r\nmuffins de piñaTamizar 140g de harina con levadura,\r\n85 g de harina integral (reservando unos\r\n2 cucharadas de salvado), ½ cucharadita de bicarbonato\r\nde refresco, 2 cucharaditas de canela molida y una\r\npizca de sal. En otro bol batir 150ml.\r\naceite de girasol con ricino dorado 100g\r\nazúcar. Añadir 200 g de puré cocido\r\nzanahorias, 3 rodajas de piña enlatada, cortadas\r\nen cubos, 2 cucharadas de jugo de piña de\r\nla lata, 1 huevo y 1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla.\r\nIncorpora 50 g de semillas de girasol. Doblar para secar\r\nmezclar con el húmedo. Recorta una docena\r\nCuadrados de 10 cm de papel para hornear y\r\ncolocar en los agujeros de un molde para muffins. Cuchara\r\nmezclar en lata, espolvorear con salvado y\r\nunas cuantas semillas de girasol. Hornear a 200C/\r\n180C ventilador/gas 6 durante 20-25 minutos o hasta que\r\nla brocheta sale limpia. Dejar enfriar (rinden 12)."]','2026-01-11 13:06:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15190,5756,'es','Sopa de fideos fácil','Esta sopa rápida y fácil es el almuerzo perfecto para los niños: saciante y saludable también.','["500 ml de caldo de verduras bajo en sal (en cubitos está bien)","Un trozo pequeño de raíz de jengibre fresco, rallado.","1 diente de ajo rallado","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja y 2 cucharaditas de azúcar","85 g de pollo cocido sobrante, desmenuzado","un puñado de verduras mixtas (pruebe con brotes de soja, maíz dulce, zanahoria en rodajas y tirabeques)","Paquete de 150 g de fideos directos al wok (o use 85 g/3 oz secos, cocidos según las instrucciones del paquete)","2 cebolletas, en rodajas, para servir","jugo 1 lima"]','["Poner caldo, jengibre, ajo, salsa de soja y\r\nazúcar en una cacerola, luego calentar. cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 5 min. Retirar del fuego, verter en un\r\nen un recipiente apto para microondas y luego dejar enfriar. tirar\r\nen pollo y verduras, tapar y luego enfriar durante\r\nhasta un día.","Cuando esté listo para comer, retírelo de\r\nrefrigerador, luego agregue los fideos cocidos.\r\nCocine en el microondas a potencia alta durante 2 minutos, revuelva,\r\nluego cocine por 1 min más o hasta\r\nmuy caliente. Dividir en dos tazones\r\no tazas, espolvorear con cebolletas\r\ny agrega el jugo de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:06:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15191,5760,'es','Ensaladera de jamón y remolacha','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una excelente ensalada ligera para el almuerzo que utiliza ingredientes cotidianos de una manera nueva e interesante.','["100 g de guisantes congelados","175 g de remolacha","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de yogur griego","2 cucharaditas de salsa de rábano picante","media lechuga iceberg, rallada","100 g de jamón en lonchas finas"]','["Vierta agua hirviendo sobre los guisantes y\r\ndejar reposar 2 minutos y luego escurrir bien. picar\r\nla remolacha en cubos.","Voltear los guisantes, la remolacha y las cebolletas.\r\nen un bol y mezclar bien. Mezclar el yogur y\r\nrábano picante, luego agregue aproximadamente 1 cucharada hirviendo\r\nagua para hacer una salsa para verter.","Apila la lechuga en tazones y luego vierte con una cuchara.\r\nsobre la mezcla de remolacha. Rocíe finamente el\r\naderezo sobre la ensalada y cubra con jamón."]','2026-01-11 13:06:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15192,5762,'es','Sopa de frijoles negros al chipotle con cebollas encurtidas con limón','Utilice legumbres de despensa en esta saludable sopa de inspiración mexicana; refrésquela con cebollas dulces, cilantro y crema agria.','["jugo 2 limones","2 cebollas moradas pequeñas, en rodajas finas","½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","½ cucharada de comino molido","½ cucharada de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharada de pasta de chipotle o Tabasco, al gusto","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","400 ml de caldo de verduras","crema agria media grasa, para servir","hojas de cilantro, para servir","chips de tortilla crujientes, para servir"]','["Para hacer las cebollas encurtidas con lima,\r\ncombine ½ jugo de lima y ½\r\ncebollas en un tazón pequeño y sazone.\r\nDejar encurtir durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite de oliva en un\r\ncacerola a fuego medio-alto.\r\nAgrega el ajo y las cebollas restantes,\r\ny temporada. Cocine por 8 minutos o hasta que\r\nlas cebollas son translúcidas. Agrega las especias\r\ny puré de chipotle, cocinar por 1 min, luego\r\nagregue los frijoles, el caldo y el resto\r\njugo de lima. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, luego\r\nhacer puré en una licuadora.","Vierta la sopa en una cacerola limpia para\r\nrecalentar. Servir con un poco de escurrido\r\ncebollas encurtidas, cubiertas con un pequeño\r\nun chorrito de crema agria y un poco\r\ncilantro y las tortillas al lado."]','2026-01-11 13:06:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15193,5764,'es','Habas con tomate y anchoas','Habas de colores gloriosos con tomates y anchoas, perfectas con cordero lechal','["1,3 kg de habas tiernas con vaina (para obtener unos 350 g/12 oz de judías sin cáscara)","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","450 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","6 cebolletas, finamente picadas","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","4-6 filetes de anchoa, picados","2 cucharadas de mejorana o perejil fresco picado"]','["Blanquear las judías peladas en agua hirviendo durante 1 minuto. Escurrir en un colador y mantener bajo el chorro de agua fría para que se enfríen rápidamente. Escurrir nuevamente y quitar la piel dura exterior; hacer un corte en la parte superior y sacar los frijoles.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente hasta que esté muy caliente, añadir los tomates y sofreír a fuego fuerte hasta que el jugo empiece a correr y caramelizar. Agregue las cebolletas y el ajo y cocine a fuego medio durante 1-2 minutos hasta que las cebollas comiencen a ablandarse y el ajo comience a dorarse. Ahora agregue los frijoles y saltee durante 1-2 minutos hasta que estén completamente calientes. Agrega las anchoas para que se deshagan, sazona al gusto con sal y pimienta negra recién molida, luego agrega la mejorana o el perejil y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:06:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15194,5766,'es','Envoltorios listos para usar','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Perfectas para niños y lo suficientemente fáciles de preparar para ellos mismos, estas prácticas envolturas son excelentes para el viaje en auto.','["4 tortillas enrolladas","8 lonchas pequeñas o 4 grandes de jamón","2 pimientos asados ​​(de un frasco está bien), picados en trozos grandes","un puñado de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Extiende las tortillas sobre una superficie plana. Coloca 1-2 lonchas de jamón en el medio de cada una. Espolvorea por encima un poco de pimiento picado y queso, dejando un borde de 2 cm en un extremo. Comenzando por el otro extremo, enrolle lo más apretado que pueda. Envuelva cada tortilla en papel de cocina y gire los extremos para sellar. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta por 3 días.","Caliente el horno a 180C/ventilador 160C/gas 3. Coloque los rollitos en el horno (directamente sobre la rejilla del horno está bien) y cocine durante 10-15 minutos hasta que el queso comience a derretirse. Desenvuélvalo durante los últimos 5 minutos si desea que el exterior esté crujiente. Retire el papel de aluminio antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 13:06:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15195,5768,'es','Ensalada de cuscús picante','Esto se puede preparar como ensalada de plato principal (ideal para loncheras) o como guarnición para cordero asado.','["100 g de cuscús","Lata de 220 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","100 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","1 pimiento rojo asado, picado","25 g de almendras tostadas en láminas","un puñado de hojas de menta, picadas","2 cucharadas de yogur griego natural","1 cucharadita de harissa"]','["Vierta el cuscús y los garbanzos en\r\nen un bol y verter sobre el caldo. Portada\r\ny dejar actuar durante 5-10 minutos hasta que\r\nel cuscús ha absorbido el caldo. Permitir\r\npara que se enfríe un poco. Pasar por el limón\r\nralladura y jugo, pimienta, almendras y menta.\r\nVierta en un recipiente, luego cubra con\r\nel yogur y un chorrito de harissa."]','2026-01-11 13:06:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15196,5770,'es','Ensalada de verduras a la brasa','Sirva estas verduras a la parrilla con mozzarella de búfala desmenuzada, para un delicioso entrante o una cena ligera.','["2 pimientos rojos","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas, finamente picado","1 berenjena, cortada en rodajas de 1 cm","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en rodajas de aproximadamente 1½ cm de grosor pero conservadas en rodajas enteras","6 tomates regordetes secos en aceite, escurridos y cortados en tiras","un puñado de aceitunas negras","un puñado grande de albahaca, cortada en trozos grandes"]','["Primero, ennegrezca todos los pimientos.\r\nHaga esto directamente sobre una llama, sobre caliente.\r\nbrasas o bajo una parrilla caliente. Cuando estén completamente ennegrecidos, ponerlos en un bol, tapar\r\ncon un plato y dejar enfriar.","Mientras los pimientos se enfrían, mezcle\r\nel aceite, el vinagre, el ajo y la guindilla en una cacerola grande\r\ncuenco. En una parrilla o plancha caliente,\r\nasar la berenjena, el calabacín y\r\ncebollas en tandas hasta que se hayan definido\r\nmarcas de parrilla en ambos lados y están comenzando\r\npara suavizar. El tiempo dependerá de la\r\nintensidad de su parrilla, así que use su\r\njuicio – calabacines y cebollas rojas\r\nestán bien todavía ligeramente crujientes pero quieres\r\nla berenjena cocida por completo.\r\nCuando las verduras estén listas las ponemos\r\ndirectamente en el aderezo para marinar,\r\npartiendo las cebollas en aros.","Cuando los pimientos estén lo suficientemente fríos\r\nmanipular, pelar, quitar el tallo y\r\nraspa las semillas. Cortar en tiras y\r\nmezcle las verduras con el jugo de\r\nel cuenco. Incorpora los tomates, las aceitunas,\r\nalbahaca y condimento. Rocíe con más\r\naceite, si lo desea, y sírvalo solo\r\npropio o con mozzarella o queso feta desmenuzado."]','2026-01-11 13:06:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15197,5772,'es','Ensalada de pasta de despensa','Esta ensalada de pasta es un almuerzo rápido y saludable, o es perfecta para prepararla con anticipación para un picnic o una lonchera.','["2 cucharaditas de cebolla morada finamente picada","1 cucharadita de alcaparra","1 cucharada de pesto","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","Lata de 185 g de atún en agua de manantial escurrido","100 g de formas de pasta sobrantes","3 tomates secos, picados"]','["Mezclar la cebolla, las alcaparras, el pesto y el aceite.\r\nDesmenuzar el atún en un bol con la pasta.\r\ny los tomates, luego agregue la mezcla de pesto."]','2026-01-11 13:06:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15198,5776,'es','Ensalada crujiente de verano','El crujiente de las judías verdes queda especialmente bien en esta ensalada.','["Paquete de 200 g de champiñones pequeños, cortados en rodajas finas","jugo 1 limon","200 g de judías verdes, peladas","un puñado de hierbas verdes suaves, como albahaca, perifollo, perejil y estragón","100 g de tomates cherry cortados en cuartos","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","75 g de parmesano (o una alternativa vegetariana), afeitado en rizos grandes"]','["En un bol, mezcle los champiñones con la mitad  \r\nel jugo de limón y reservar – el limón \r\nEl jugo ablandará los champiñones. blanquear  \r\nlos frijoles en agua hirviendo con sal durante 5-6 minutos \r\nhasta que todavía tengan un crujido, pero no lo estén \r\nchirriante, luego escurrir y enfriar en agua helada.","Mezcle los frijoles y los champiñones. \r\nen un bol con las hierbas y sazonar con \r\nsal y pimienta. Mezcle los tomates, \r\nel jugo de limón restante y el aceite de oliva y \r\nespolvorear con queso parmesano justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15199,5778,'es','Pollo al horno con picatostes de ajo','Combine pollo, tomates, mozzarella y picatostes de ajo caseros para preparar esta receta rápida y fácil en una sola olla. Es ideal para días ocupados en los que tienes poco tiempo.','["4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","200 g de puré","250 g de tomates cherry","125 g de bola de mozzarella baja en grasa, escurrida y cortada en rodajas","3 rebanadas gruesas de masa madre o bombacho, cortadas en cubos de 2 cm","2 dientes de ajo machacados","pizca de orégano seco","½ manojo pequeño de albahaca, con las hojas recogidas","ensalada verde, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cortar las pechugas de pollo por la mitad, sin llegar hasta el final, y abrirlas como un libro. Sazone bien. Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén refractaria o en una cacerola poco profunda (o en una sartén, luego transfiérelo a una fuente para asar) y fríe el pollo durante 3 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté ligeramente dorado.","Coloque la passata sobre el pollo y luego coloque los tomates cherry dentro y alrededor del plato. Coloque las rodajas de mozzarella encima. Vierta los cubos de pan en un bol y mezcle con el aceite restante, el ajo y el orégano. Esparcir sobre el pollo y los tomates. Transfiera al horno y hornee por 15 minutos hasta que el queso se derrita y el pollo esté bien cocido. Esparce sobre la albahaca y sirve con ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 13:06:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15200,5782,'es','Albóndigas picantes con frijoles negros y chile','Dale a tus albóndigas favoritas un cambio de imagen saludable con esta receta baja en grasas, calorías y IG bajo con carne picada de pavo, frijoles negros y aguacate.','["1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 pimiento amarillo grande, cortado en cuartos, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","1 cucharadita de comino molido","2-3 cucharaditas de pasta de chile chipotle","300 ml de caldo de pollo reducido en sal","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry.","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros o rojos, escurridos","1 aguacate, sin hueso, pelado y picado","jugo ½ lima","Paquete de 500 g de pechuga de pavo picada","50 g de gachas de avena","2 cebolletas, finamente picadas","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro","manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado, con los tallos y las hojas separados","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza"]','["Primero haz las albóndigas. Vierta la carne picada en un bol, agregue la avena, las cebolletas, las especias y los tallos de cilantro, luego amase ligeramente los ingredientes hasta que estén bien mezclados. Forme 12 pelotas del tamaño de ping-pong. Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente, añadir las albóndigas y cocinar, dándoles la vuelta con frecuencia, hasta que estén doradas. Retirar de la sartén.","Vierte la cebolla y el ajo en la sartén con el pimiento y sofríe hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el comino y la pasta de chile y luego vierta el caldo. Regrese las albóndigas a la sartén y cocine tapadas a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Agregue los tomates y los frijoles y cocine, sin tapar, durante unos minutos más. Mezcle los trozos de aguacate con el jugo de lima y sirva las albóndigas cubiertas con aguacate y hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:06:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15201,5784,'es','Wraps de cordero de Bombay','Condimente la carne picada de cordero congelada y barata con sabores indios y apílela sobre rollitos de harina o chapatis para una cena saludable y abundante.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla morada grande, picada","3 dientes de ajo gordos, machacados","200 g de carne picada de cordero congelada","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry (nosotros usamos tikka)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 patatas grandes, cortadas en cubos de 2cm/¾","250 g de guisantes congelados","8 wraps de harina o chapatis, calentados","140 gramos de yogur natural"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande, agrega la cebolla y cocina por unos minutos para que se ablande. Agrega el ajo, revuelve durante 1 minuto y luego agrega la carne picada congelada. Cocine hasta que esté descongelado y bien dorado, luego agregue la pasta de curry, los tomates, las patatas y media lata de agua. Sazone bien, luego cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos o hasta que las patatas estén casi cocidas.","Retire la tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos más hasta que el líquido se haya reducido y la salsa se adhiera a las patatas y la carne picada. Agregue los guisantes, revuelva hasta que se descongelan, luego sirva con los wraps calientes y el yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:06:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15202,5786,'es','Pasta cremosa de tomate, calabacín y gambas','Esta rápida salsa para pasta fresca con tomates cherry, gambas y crème fraîche es ideal para una cena entre semana y es baja en grasas.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo gordos, en rodajas finas","2 calabacines pequeños grandes o de 400 g, en rodajas","400 g de pasta orecchiette o cualquier otra forma de pasta pequeña","2 latas de 400 g de tomates cherry","buena pizca de azúcar","200 g de gambas crudas, peladas","100 g de crema fresca semidesnatada","albahaca en paquete pequeño, solo las hojas, rasgadas"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, añadir el ajo y chisporrotear durante unos minutos, luego añadir los calabacines y cocinar unos minutos más hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Agregue los tomates, el azúcar y los condimentos a la sartén, revuelva y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante unos 10 minutos mientras se cocina la pasta.","Agrega los langostinos a la salsa y burbujea hasta que se pongan rosados. Escurre la pasta y agrégala a la salsa con la crème fraîche. Cocine a fuego lento durante 1-2 minutos más, luego agregue la albahaca y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:06:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15203,5788,'es','Paella de pollo primaveral','Dale un nuevo giro al clásico arroz español en una olla agregando habas verdes frescas, eneldo, menta y perejil.','["6 muslos de pollo, con piel","2 cucharadas de harina común","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","400 gramos de arroz para paella","1 cucharadita de pimentón dulce","2 buenas pizcas de azafrán","ralladura y jugo de 2 limones","1½ l de caldo de pollo","200 g de guisantes y habas frescos o congelados (peso después de desvainar y pelar)","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado","½ manojo pequeño de menta, picada","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Sazonar bien los muslos de pollo y luego espolvorearlos con harina. Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una paellera o en una sartén grande y profunda. Freír los muslos hasta que estén dorados por completo, luego transferirlos a una fuente para asar poco profunda y terminar en el horno durante 30-40 minutos.","Agregue el aceite restante, la cebolla y el ajo y fríalos muy suavemente hasta que estén tiernos, aproximadamente de 10 a 15 minutos. Agregue el arroz, el pimentón, el azafrán y la ralladura de limón, luego agregue el caldo y cocine a fuego lento, revolviendo ocasionalmente, durante unos 20 minutos a fuego medio hasta que el arroz esté casi cocido.","Agrega los guisantes, las habas y el jugo de 1 limón hasta que el arroz esté bien cocido, junto con las verduras. Revuelva las hierbas y la mayor cantidad de jugo de limón restante que necesite, junto con un poco de condimento. Vuelva a meter los muslos de pollo y tápelos durante 5 minutos para que todo se asiente antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15204,5790,'es','Tagine de cordero con sabor a fruta','Este suculento y súper saludable plato único seguramente satisfará a una multitud: ahorre tiempo y prepárelo con hasta dos días de anticipación.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","500 g de cordero magro en cubitos","1 cebolla grande, picada en trozos grandes","2 zanahorias grandes, cortadas en cuartos a lo largo y en trozos","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharadas de mezcla de especias ras-el-hanout (ver consejo a continuación)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","200 g de orejones","600 ml de caldo de pollo","Paquete de 120 g de semillas de granada.","2 puñados grandes de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nCalentar el aceite en una cazuela y dorar\r\nel cordero por todos lados. Saque el cordero\r\nen un plato, luego agrega la cebolla\r\ny zanahorias y cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado. Agrega el ajo y cocina por 1 min.\r\nmás. Agregue las especias y los tomates.\r\ny temporada. Vuelva a colocar el cordero con\r\nlos garbanzos y los albaricoques. Vierta sobre el\r\ncaldo, revuelva y deje hervir a fuego lento. Portada\r\nRetirar la fuente y llevar al horno durante 1 h.","Si el cordero aún está un poco duro, darle\r\nDéjelo 20 minutos más hasta que esté tierno. Cuando esté listo,\r\ndéjalo reposar para que no esté bien caliente, luego\r\nservir espolvoreado con granada y\r\nhierbas, con cuscús o arroz al lado."]','2026-01-11 13:06:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15205,5792,'es','Pollo a la mostaza y miel con chirivías','Para una cazuela familiar fácil y cálida con un presupuesto limitado, esta olla cumple todos los requisitos','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","8 muslos de pollo con hueso, sin piel","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","350 g de chirivías cortadas en palitos","300 ml de caldo de verduras","2 cucharadas de mostaza integral","2 cucharadas de miel clara","unas ramitas de tomillo","perejil de hoja plana, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar la mitad del aceite en una sartén grande.\r\no cazuela poco profunda con tapa. marrón\r\nel pollo hasta que esté dorado, luego resérvalo.\r\nCalentar el aceite restante, luego cocinar el\r\ncebollas durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Coloque los muslos hacia atrás entre los\r\ncebollas y agregue las chirivías. Mezclar el caldo con el\r\nmostaza y miel, luego vierta.\r\nsobre el tomillo y luego llevar a fuego lento.\r\nTape y cocine durante 30 minutos (o más,\r\nver consejo) hasta que el pollo esté tierno, luego\r\ntemporada. Sirva con verduras al vapor."]','2026-01-11 13:06:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15206,5794,'es','Sardinas con garbanzos, limón y perejil','Las sardinas cocinadas en la Barbie son un excelente placer para el verano; también puedes cocinarlas en el interior en una sola olla','["50 g de harina común","10 sardinas, escamadas y limpias (8 si son grandes)","ralladura de 2 limones","manojo grande de perejil de hoja plana, solo las hojas, picado en trozos grandes","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","vaso de vino blanco (unos 125ml)","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos o judías verdes, escurridas y enjuagadas","Paquete de 250 g de tomates cherry cortados por la mitad"]','["Sazone la harina y esparza sobre un plato grande.\r\nPasar las sardinas por la harina, una a la vez.\r\nMezclar la ralladura de limón, el perejil y la mitad.\r\ndel ajo picado y reservar.","Poner una sartén muy grande (una paellera es\r\nideal o una bandeja para hornear grande y resistente con\r\nun labio) encima de la barbacoa y calentar\r\nhasta que esté muy caliente. Agrega el aceite, calienta por unos\r\nsegundos, luego poner las sardinas enharinadas\r\nen el aceite en una capa. Freír por 3 minutos\r\nhasta que la parte inferior esté dorada, luego dale la vuelta\r\nVoltee y fría por otros 3 minutos. ascensor\r\nfuera de la sartén y en un plato.","Freír el ajo restante (añadir otro chorrito\r\nde aceite si es necesario) durante 1 min hasta que se ablanden. verter\r\nen el vino blanco, raspa los restos del fondo\r\nde la cacerola con una cuchara de madera y dejar hervir durante\r\n1 min o hasta que se reduzca a la mitad.","Vierta los garbanzos o las habas y\r\ntomates, luego revuelva hasta que estén completamente calientes. Temporada\r\ncon abundante pimienta y sal al gusto, luego\r\nVuelva a colocar el pescado en la sartén. Quítate el\r\ncalentar, espolvorear con la mezcla de perejil y servir con\r\nmucho pan crujiente para absorber los jugos."]','2026-01-11 13:06:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15207,5798,'es','Una olla de calabaza, pollo y cuscús','Utilice las sobras en este súper saludable recipiente lleno de nutrientes vitales','["2 cucharadas de pasta de harissa","1 cucharadita de comino molido y cilantro molido","2 cebollas moradas, partidas por la mitad y cortadas en gajos finos","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos pequeños","1 calabaza pequeña, cortada en trozos de 1 cm (no es necesario pelar)","2 latas de tomates de 400 g","ralladura y jugo de 2 limones","200 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","140 g de cuscús","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar una cazuela grande antiadherente\r\nplato o sartén sobre la encimera. Añade el\r\nharissa, especias y cebolla, revuelva y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave.\r\nAgregue el pollo y dore durante 5 a 10 minutos.\r\nAgregue la calabaza, revolviendo para combinar.\r\ny un chorrito de agua si arranca\r\nquedarse. Cocine por 5 minutos más.","Vierta los tomates enlatados en el\r\ncacerola con ½ lata de agua, tapar\r\ny cocine a fuego lento durante 20-30 minutos. Añadir\r\nla ralladura y el jugo de limón, la cereza\r\ntomates, cuscús y condimentos.\r\nTapar y apagar el fuego. salir\r\nen la encimera durante 10 minutos, luego revuelva\r\npor el cilantro y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15208,5800,'es','Guiso de pollo y verduras con cuscús integral','Comienza la semana de forma súper saludable con este rico y saludable plato único','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos","1 cebolla pequeña, rebanada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","pellizca cada pimentón y azafrán","50 g de maíz dulce, cortado por la mitad","50 g de puntas de espárragos","50 g de guisantes","50 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","150 ml de caldo de pollo","140 g de cuscús integral"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén, cocinar el pollo.\r\ndurante 5-6 minutos, luego retírelo con una ranura\r\ncuchara. Agregue la cebolla y cocine por 2-3 minutos.\r\nantes de añadir el ajo, el pimentón, el azafrán,\r\nmaíz dulce, espárragos, guisantes y tomates.\r\nCocine por 2-3 minutos más. Devolver el\r\npollo a la sartén, vierta el caldo,\r\nluego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos.","Mientras tanto, cocine el cuscús siguiendo\r\ninstrucciones del paquete. Para servir, esponjar el\r\ncuscús con un tenedor y dividir entre\r\n2 tazones antes de echarlos sobre el guiso."]','2026-01-11 13:06:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15209,5802,'es','Pilau de pollo y garbanzos en una olla','Una comida súper rápida y súper saludable: pilau de pollo y garbanzos hecho en una sola olla','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 muslos de pollo, sin piel y sin grasa","2 puerros grandes, en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos en agua, escurridos y enjuagados","ralladura de 1 limón","200 g de arroz integral de fácil cocción","450 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cabeza de brócoli, partida en floretes"]','["Calienta una sartén grande con tapa o una cacerola resistente al fuego y agrega el aceite.\r\nFreír los muslos de pollo durante 2 minutos, volteándolos a mitad de la cocción, hasta que\r\nde color claro, luego levántelo y colóquelo en un plato. Añade los puerros a la sartén y sofríe.\r\ndurante 3 minutos, luego agregue el ajo y agregue los garbanzos, la mayor parte del limón\r\nralladura y arroz. Revuelva hasta que esté bien mezclado.","Coloca el pollo en la mezcla de arroz. Vierta sobre el caldo y sazone ligeramente.\r\nTapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que el pollo esté casi cocido.\r\ncompletamente y el arroz ha absorbido casi todo el líquido. Coloca el brócoli encima.\r\ndel arroz, tapar y continuar cocinando hasta que el arroz y el brócoli estén tiernos\r\ny el pollo cocido. Espolvorea con la ralladura de limón restante para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:06:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15210,5804,'es','Olla de arroz coreana','Un plato de arroz en una sola olla es una forma fabulosa de aprovechar las sobras: este combina verduras saludables y pavo, coronado con huevo frito.','["500 ml / 18 fl oz de caldo de pollo caliente","250 g/ 9 oz de arroz de grano largo","300 g/ 11 oz de pavo cocido, cortado en cubitos","250 g / 9 oz de espinacas tiernas","2 zanahorias, ralladas","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo tostado","1 cucharadita de semillas de sésamo tostadas","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","4 huevos","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile espesa"]','["Vierta el caldo de pollo en una cacerola grande y déjelo hervir. Agregue el arroz y el pavo, vuelva a hervir y cocine a fuego lento durante 12-15 minutos hasta que el caldo se haya absorbido y el arroz esté tierno.","Mientras tanto, ponga las espinacas en un colador y viértalas sobre una tetera con agua caliente hasta que se ablanden un poco. Mantenga las espinacas y las zanahorias separadas, pero aderece ambas con aceite de sésamo y semillas.","Cubra el arroz cocido con una tapa y déjelo reposar un par de minutos. Mientras tanto, caliente el aceite vegetal en una sartén antiadherente a fuego alto. Freír los huevos para que la clara quede bien crocante en los bordes.","Vierta el arroz en tazones grandes y coloque las espinacas y las zanahorias encima. Termine cada uno con un huevo frito y una cucharada de salsa picante. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:06:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15211,5806,'es','Pollo al curry con chile','Un curry saludable y lleno de sabor que cuenta como uno de tus 5 al día y es bajo en grasas.','["1 cebolla mediana, picada en trozos grandes","3 cm de raíz de jengibre, picado en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","¼ cucharadita de chile picante en polvo o ½ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","Lata de 230g de tomates picados","350 g de patatas peladas y cortadas en trozos grandes","500 g de pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en trozos de 3 cm","½ cucharadita de garam masala","2 cucharadas de cilantro fresco picado","yogur natural, para servir"]','["Bate la cebolla, el jengibre y\r\najo en un procesador de alimentos con\r\n1 cucharada de agua hasta que quede suave.","Freír las semillas de comino en aceite.\r\ndurante unos segundos. Añade el\r\npasta de cebolla y dorar\r\na fuego medio. Añade una pizca de\r\nagua si comienza a engancharse.","Espolvorea la cúrcuma y\r\nchile. Añade los tomates y\r\nfreír durante 5 minutos. Agregue el\r\npatatas y 250ml/9fl oz\r\nagua caliente. Cocine tapado por\r\n10 minutos.","Agrega el pollo y el garam masala. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté cocido. Sazone con sal. Vierta en un bol, esparza cilantro y sirva con arroz aromatizado y yogur natural."]','2026-01-11 13:06:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15212,5808,'es','Pollo con lentejas en una olla','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta comida todo en uno es una excelente cena sin culpa y, si tienes mucha hambre, solo agrega papas.','["1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","2 lonchas de tocino magro curado en seco, recortado y picado","2 muslos de pollo grandes con hueso, sin piel","1 cebolla mediana, en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo, en rodajas finas","2 cucharaditas de harina común","2 cucharaditas de puré de tomate","150 ml de vino blanco seco","200 ml de caldo de pollo","50 g de lentejas verdes","½ cucharadita de tomillo seco","85 g de champiñones castaños, cortados por la mitad si son grandes"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente, ancha y poco profunda, agregar el tocino y freír enérgicamente hasta que tenga un color claro, luego colocarlo en un plato. Agrega el pollo y fríe por cada lado hasta que esté ligeramente dorado. Reservar con el tocino. Vierta la cebolla y el ajo en la sartén y cocine por 5 minutos. Agrega la harina y el puré de tomate y luego revuelve a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos. Añade el vino, el caldo, las lentejas y el tomillo. Llevar a ebullición, reducir el fuego, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.","Agrega los champiñones. Agrega el tocino y el pollo, empujándolos debajo del líquido. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 20-25 minutos, o hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas y el pollo cocido. Sazone con sal y pimienta."]','2026-01-11 13:06:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15213,5810,'es','Una olla rápida de carne y brócoli','¡Crea una deliciosa comida de carne y brócoli en una sola olla, rápido! Contiene 2 de tus 5 al día','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","50 g de anacardos sin sal","400 g de filete de ternera para freír, cortado en tiras","1 brócoli de cabeza grande, partido en floretes","4 ramas de apio, en rodajas","150 ml de caldo de carne (en cubitos está bien)","2 cucharadas de salsa de rábano picante","2 cucharadas de queso fresco bajo en grasa"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén, agrega las nueces y revuelve.\r\ndurante unos segundos hasta que esté ligeramente tostado. Dejar de lado.","Sazone las tiras de carne con abundante pimienta y\r\nSaltee a fuego alto durante 1-2 minutos para que se dore. conjunto\r\naparte con las nueces. Vierta el brócoli y el apio\r\nla sartén y sofríe durante 2 minutos. Vierta el caldo,\r\ntape y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos. Mientras tanto, mezcle el\r\nrábano picante y queso fresco juntos.","Regrese el bistec a la sartén y mezcle con el\r\nverduras, luego espolvoree sobre las nueces y sirva con las\r\nrábano picante cremoso. Genial con puré de patatas."]','2026-01-11 13:06:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15214,5812,'es','Penne de espinacas al pesto','Combine pasta con espinacas, pesto y tomates para obtener una comida fácil y saludable. Los tomates contienen vitamina C, que ayudará a tu cuerpo a absorber el hierro de las espinacas.','["400 g de penne integral","5 cucharadas de pesto de albahaca vegetariana","500 g de espinacas tiernas, picadas en trozos grandes","220 g de tomates cherry cortados por la mitad"]','["Cocine el penne siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Mientras tanto, calienta 4 cucharadas de pesto en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio-bajo. Agregue las espinacas y 2 cucharadas de agua, luego cubra hasta que se ablanden.","Escurrir la pasta y mezclar con las espinacas, el resto del pesto y los tomates. Servir la mitad. Deje enfriar y enfríe el resto. Se mantendrá frío durante tres días. Vuelva a calentar con un chorrito de agua."]','2026-01-11 13:06:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15215,5814,'es','Pasta de judías verdes, patatas y pesto en una olla','Para una comida rápida y nutritiva entre semana, combine pesto y verduras con pasta y patatas nuevas: una cena ligera para las largas noches de verano.','["350 g de patatas nuevas","400 g de penne o fusilli","1 litro de caldo de verduras caliente","200 g de pesto fresco (preferiblemente vegetariano, si es necesario)","120 g de judías verdes, peladas","½ limón, rallado","parmesano rallado o alternativa vegetariana, para servir"]','["Vierta las patatas, la pasta y el caldo en una cazuela ignífuga. Llevar a ebullición a fuego medio, luego reducir el fuego a fuego lento y cocinar durante 15 minutos sin tapar y revolviendo ocasionalmente. Agregue el pesto, las judías verdes, la ralladura de limón y un poco de condimento y cocine por 2 minutos más.","Tapar la olla, retirar del fuego y dejar reposar 5 minutos. Sirva la pasta en tazones y cubra con queso rallado."]','2026-01-11 13:06:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15216,5816,'es','Prepara tu propia ensalada de pasta al pesto','Prepare esta sencilla ensalada de pasta al pesto para la familia. Personalízalo agregando las verduras favoritas de tus hijos.','["400 g de pasta farfalle","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","50 g de piñones","5 cucharadas de pesto (ver receta, a la derecha y abajo, si quieres hacer el tuyo propio)","10 hojas grandes de albahaca","½ limón, exprimido y rallado","50 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado","tomates cherry partidos por la mitad, maíz dulce escurrido, guisantes, rúcula"]','["Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrrala y agregue 1 cucharada de aceite. Transfiera a un tazón grande y déjelo enfriar, revolviendo ocasionalmente para que no se pegue.","Tostar los piñones en una sartén seca a fuego lento, moviéndolos constantemente durante 4-5 minutos hasta que se doren. Cuando la pasta se haya enfriado por completo, mezcle el pesto, los piñones tostados, el aceite de oliva restante, la albahaca, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, los tomates, el maíz dulce, los guisantes y la rúcula, si se usan. Sazone, luego esparza el parmesano y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:06:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15217,5818,'es','Orecchiette con frijoles, perejil, chile y limón','Prepara este sencillo plato de pasta con lo que tengas a mano, incluidos diferentes formas de pasta, frijoles o tomates picados. Puedes omitir el chile si lo prefieres.','["400 g de orecchiette","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y finamente picados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","Lata de 400 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry.","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","½ manojo grande de perejil, finamente picado","25 g de parmesano rallado o alternativa vegetariana (opcional)"]','["Cocine las orecchiette siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete hasta que estén al dente, aproximadamente 10 minutos. Escurrir reservando el agua de cocción.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe los chiles y el ajo durante 2 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Incorpora las judías blancas, los tomates, la ralladura de limón y el jugo. Cocine por 5 minutos más, luego esparza el perejil y cocine por otros 2 minutos. Los tomates deberían haberse reducido ligeramente y los frijoles deberían estar bien calientes.","Vierta las orecchiette en la sartén con la mezcla de frijoles mantecosos. Vierta un poco del agua de cocción de la pasta reservada si prefiere una salsa más suelta. Vierta en tazones y espolvoree con queso antes de servir, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15218,5822,'es','Pasta vegana con pesto de col rizada','Batir col rizada, semillas de calabaza, albahaca y ajo para preparar este sencillo pesto de col rizada. Es perfecto mezclado con espaguetis integrales para una comida vegana saludable.','["150 g de col rizada","manojo pequeño de albahaca","1 diente de ajo pequeño","3 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","3 cucharadas de levadura nutricional","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","350 g de espaguetis integrales"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola con agua. Cocine la col rizada durante 30 segundos, escúrrala y transfiérala a un recipiente con agua helada durante 5 minutos. Escurrir nuevamente y secar con papel de cocina.","Coloque la albahaca, el ajo, las semillas, el aceite, la levadura nutricional, el jugo y la ralladura de limón y la col rizada escurrida en un procesador de alimentos. Mezcle hasta que quede suave y luego sazone. Aflojar con un chorrito de agua, si queda demasiado espesa.","Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego mezcle con el pesto y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:06:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15219,5824,'es','Pasta arraya con berenjena','Elija esta cena de pasta saludable después de hacer ejercicio. Aunque es bajo en grasas y calorías, está lleno de sabor y también aporta calcio y fibra.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza prensado en frío","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada (160 g)","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","1 berenjena, picada","150 g de penne o fusilli integrales","un puñado grande de albahaca y más para servir","25 g de queso duro parmesano o vegetariano estilo italiano, finamente rallado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande antiadherente, agrega las cebollas, tapa y cocina por 5 minutos. Retire la tapa y cocine por 5 minutos más, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo, las hojuelas de chile y el pimentón, revuelva brevemente y luego agregue los tomates y una lata de agua. Agregue el caldo y la berenjena, luego cocine a fuego lento, cubra y cocine durante 20 minutos.","Cocine el penne en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 12 minutos hasta que esté al dente. Escurrir reservando 60ml del agua de cocción. Agrega el penne cocido a la salsa y mezcla bien con la albahaca y un poco del agua reservada, si es necesario. Vierta en dos tazones poco profundos y sirva cubierto con queso y un poco más de albahaca, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:06:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15220,5826,'es','Boloñesa de yaca con parmesano vegano','¿Reducir el consumo de carne? Prueba la yaca como alternativa. Esta boloñesa vegana no solo tiene un sabor delicioso, sino que cuenta como cinco de tus cinco al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","320 g de zanahorias (3 medianas), finamente picadas","4 ramas de apio grandes (320 g), finamente picadas","4 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","Lata de 410 g de yaca en agua, escurrida y finamente picada","100 g de lentejas rojas","3 cucharadas de puré de tomate","4 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo (comprobar que sea vegano)","1 cucharada de tomillo picado","325 g de espaguetis integrales","perejil picado, para servir (opcional)","40 g de anacardos","4 cucharaditas de levadura nutricional","1 cucharadita de ajo granulado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande antiadherente y fríe las zanahorias, el apio y el ajo durante 10 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Mientras tanto, prepara el parmesano vegano. Vierta los anacardos, la levadura nutricional y los gránulos de ajo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener migajas finas. Añade un poco de sal, si es necesario, y reserva.","Vierta la yaca en la mezcla de verduras con las lentejas, 700 ml de agua, el puré de tomate, el caldo en polvo y el tomillo, luego cubra y cocine durante 25 minutos. Añade un poco más de agua si es necesario; debe quedar pulposa.","Mientras tanto, cocina los espaguetis siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete hasta que estén al dente. Mezcle con la salsa, divida en tazones y espolvoree con parmesano vegano y perejil, si lo usa. La salsa se mantendrá tapada en el refrigerador hasta por tres días o en el congelador hasta por tres meses."]','2026-01-11 13:06:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15221,5828,'es','Macarrones con queso súper verdes','Renueva los macarrones con queso con brócoli, espinacas y guisantes, además de una cobertura crujiente de nueces y semillas. Tiene todo el sabor del plato clásico, pero con nutrientes añadidos.','["1 litro de leche semidesnatada","75 g de mantequilla","75 g de harina común","2 tsp Dijon mustard","175 g de queso cheddar maduro o extra maduro, rallado","50 g de parmesano rallado","100 g de espinacas, frescas o congeladas","400 g de macarrones","1 brócoli (unos 300 g), partido en floretes","100 g de guisantes congelados","3 rebanadas de pan blanco (unos 125 g)","1 manojo pequeño de hojas de albahaca","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","25 g de frutos secos o semillas, como pipas de calabaza, piñones y almendras, para la cobertura"]','["Caliente el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Vierta la leche, la mantequilla y la harina en una cacerola grande y cocine a fuego lento, batiendo continuamente hasta obtener una salsa suave y espesa, aproximadamente 3-4 minutos. No te preocupes si quedan algunos grumos: la salsa se licuará más tarde. Sazona bien, luego agrega la mostaza, tanto los quesos como las espinacas.","Mientras tanto, cocine la pasta en agua hirviendo con sal durante 5 minutos. Agrega el brócoli y continúa cocinando hasta que la pasta esté bien cocida y el brócoli esté suave. Drenar.","Transfiera la mitad del brócoli cocido a la salsa de queso. Batir la salsa de queso hasta que quede suave, cremosa y de color verde brillante con una batidora de mano (o batidora de pie). Aflojar con un chorrito de leche, si es necesario. Agregue la pasta, el brócoli restante y los guisantes y viértalos en una fuente para hornear grande.","Si prepara la cobertura, coloque el pan, la albahaca, el aceite y la mitad de las nueces o semillas en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener migas verdes y gruesas. Esparce sobre la pasta junto con las nueces o semillas restantes. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos, hasta que la cobertura esté crujiente y la salsa burbujee. Se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético en el congelador hasta por tres meses."]','2026-01-11 13:06:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15222,5830,'es','Espaguetis con salsa de tomate ahumado y marisco','El chile, las semillas de hinojo y el pimentón ahumado añaden calidez y sabor a una rica salsa de tomate, servida con mariscos en este plato de pasta rápido.','["4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","1½ cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","400 g de espaguetis","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","Paquete de 400 g de mariscos cocidos mixtos congelados, descongelados","manojo pequeño de perejil o albahaca, picado"]','["Hervir la tetera y calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y profunda. Agregue el ajo, la guindilla y las semillas de hinojo y cocine a fuego lento durante unos minutos. Vierta el agua hirviendo en una cacerola grande y cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Agregue el pimentón, los tomates, el azúcar y los condimentos a la sartén y cocine a fuego lento durante 8 a 10 minutos mientras se cocina la pasta.","Escurre la pasta 1 minuto antes de que finalice el tiempo de cocción, reservando una taza de agua. Agrega la pasta a la salsa con los mariscos. Cocine a fuego lento durante 1-2 minutos, agregando un chorrito del agua de la pasta reservada si parece demasiado espesa. Mezcle la pasta con la salsa mientras se cocina. Agrega las hierbas y la pimienta negra y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:07:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15223,5832,'es','Fusilli de nueces y tocino','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Este sencillo plato de pasta con panceta, calabaza y espinacas es una cena saludable entre semana; el romero fresco agrega sabor extra.','["½ paquete de 160 g de cubitos de tocino","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","750 g de calabaza, sin semillas y cortada en cubos de 2 cm","2 ramitas de romero, hojas finamente picadas","¼ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","350 g de fusilli con agujeros (o fusilli)","100 g de espinacas tiernas, picadas en trozos grandes","parmesano rallado, para servir"]','["Vierta la panceta en una sartén grande a fuego medio y cocine durante 5-8 minutos hasta que esté bien crujiente. Retirar con una espumadera dejando la grasa en la sartén. Agrega el aceite a la sartén, junto con la calabaza, el romero, la guindilla y el ajo. Tape y cocine durante 25 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que la calabaza esté tierna. Sazone bien y triture suavemente un poco de calabaza con el dorso de una cuchara.","Hierva una cacerola grande con agua con sal 15 minutos antes de que la calabaza esté lista y cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir reservando el agua de cocción. Agrega 1-2 cucharadas de agua para pasta a la calabaza y déjala burbujear durante unos minutos. Vierta la pasta escurrida y mezcle. Agregue las espinacas y luego divídalas en platos. Espolvorear por encima la panceta, un poco de parmesano rallado y un buen molido de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:07:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15224,5834,'es','Linguini de gambas con chile','Un plato de marisco elegante y bajo en grasa, perfecto para entretener a mitad de semana: muy ligero y elegante.','["280 g de pasta linguini","200 g de guisantes dulces, cortados","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente picados","1 chile rojo grande, sin semillas y finamente picado","24 langostinos crudos, pelados","12 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","un puñado de hojas de albahaca fresca","hojas de ensalada mixta y pan blanco crujiente, para servir","2 cucharadas de queso fresco prácticamente sin grasa","ralladura y jugo de 2 limas","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo dorado"]','["Mezclar los ingredientes del aderezo en\r\nun tazón pequeño y sazonar con\r\nsal y pimienta. Dejar de lado.","Cocine la pasta según las\r\ninstrucciones del paquete. Agrega el azúcar\r\nguisantes durante el último minuto más o menos\r\ndel tiempo de cocción.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en un wok o\r\nsartén grande, agregue el ajo\r\ny chile y cocinar a fuego bastante\r\ncalor suave durante unos 30 segundos\r\nsin dejar que se doren los ajos. consejo\r\nen las gambas y cocinar a fuego alto.\r\nCaliente, revolviendo con frecuencia, durante aproximadamente 3\r\nminutos hasta que se pongan rosados.","Agrega los tomates y cocina,\r\nrevolviendo ocasionalmente, durante 3 minutos\r\nhasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Drenar\r\nla pasta y el azúcar cuajan bien,\r\nluego agregue a la mezcla de camarones.\r\nCorte las hojas de albahaca, revuelva y\r\nsazone con sal y pimienta.","Sirva con hojas de ensalada rociadas\r\ncon el aderezo de lima y tibio\r\npan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15225,5836,'es','Tortilla de espaguetis','Esta rápida tortilla de espaguetis es una excelente manera de aprovechar los restos de pasta y seguramente será un éxito entre los niños.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cebolla, picada","2 calabacines rallados","2 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana picado","300 g de salsa de queso fresco en bote","200 g de espaguetis cocidos u otra pasta","2 huevos"]','["Calentar la mitad del aceite en una sartén mediana antiadherente.\r\nsartén y añadir el ajo y la cebolla.\r\nCocine durante 2-3 minutos, hasta que se ablanden. Usando\r\ntus manos, exprime tanto\r\nhumedad de los calabacines como\r\nposible. Agréguelos a la sartén y cocine.\r\ndurante 3-4 minutos más, hasta que estén tiernos. Cuchara\r\nlas verduras en un tazón grande.","Agregue el perejil, la salsa de queso y\r\nespaguetis y sazonar. batir los huevos\r\ny agregue a la mezcla.","Calentar el aceite restante en la sartén y\r\nVierta la mezcla de espaguetis. Nivelarlo con\r\nel dorso de una cuchara y cocine a fuego medio.\r\nCaliente durante 3-5 minutos, hasta que esté casi listo.","Transfiera a una parrilla caliente durante 2-3 minutos, hasta que\r\ndorado. Dejar enfriar en la sartén durante\r\n5 minutos, luego córtelo en gajos y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:07:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15226,5838,'es','Pasta vegetal vitalidad','Pasta vegetal fácil y rápida','["Paquete de 250 g de pasta pappardelle","1 calabaza pequeña, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","un puñado pequeño de piñones","1 diente de ajo gordo, finamente picado","4 champiñones grandes, rebanados","Bolsa de 250 g de espinacas lavadas","queso parmesano rallado y hojuelas de chile para servir, opcional"]','["Vierta agua hirviendo\r\nen una cacerola grande, llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar\r\nla pasta según las instrucciones del paquete. cuando el\r\na la pasta le quedan 5 minutos de cocción, agregue la calabaza\r\ny cocinar con la pasta por el tiempo restante.","Mientras se cocina la pasta,\r\nCalienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén grande. chisporrotear el pino\r\nnueces en el aceite hasta que empiecen a tomar color, agregue el\r\najo y cocine por un momento solo para que se ablande. Añadir\r\naceite restante, subir el fuego, añadir los champiñones\r\ny cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. girar\r\nel fuego al máximo, añadir las espinacas a la sartén y\r\ncocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que se ablanden por completo.","Escurrir la pasta y la calabaza,\r\nluego mezcle con las verduras hasta que todo esté\r\nmuy bien combinado. Llevar la sartén a la mesa y dejar\r\ncada uno se ayuda a sí mismo. También podrías pasar\r\nparmesano rallado y hojuelas de chile si la gente lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15227,5840,'es','Espaguetis picantes con champiñones al ajillo','Un plato de pasta bajo en grasas e infalible que demostrará que es tan fácil preparar una comida como encender el microondas.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","Paquete de 250 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas gruesas","1 diente de ajo, en rodajas finas","perejil en manojo pequeño, solo las hojas","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","1 cebolla, finamente picada","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 o 2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y finamente picados (o use hojuelas de chile seco)","300 g de espaguetis"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén, agregar los champiñones,\r\nluego freír a fuego alto durante 3 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado y ablandado. Añadir el ajo, sofreír\r\n1 minuto más, luego verter en un bol con el\r\nperejil. Agrega la cebolla y el apio a la sartén.\r\ncon el resto del aceite, luego sofreír durante 5 min.\r\nhasta que tenga un color claro.","Agrega los tomates, la guindilla y un poco de sal.\r\nluego llevar a ebullición. Reducir el fuego y\r\ncocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 10 minutos hasta que\r\nengrosado. Mientras tanto, hervir los espaguetis,\r\nluego escurrir. Mezcle con la salsa, cubra con\r\nlos champiñones al ajillo y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:07:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15228,5842,'es','Pasta al limón con gambas y guisantes','Un plato de pasta con gambas de despensa, sencillo y sabroso, que combina sabores frescos con una cocción rápida.','["350 g de linguini u otra pasta larga","140 g de gambas grandes congeladas","100 g de guisantes congelados","1 yema de huevo","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","un puñado de parmesano rallado","crema agria (opcional)"]','["Hervir los linguini durante 8 minutos. Tres minutos antes de que se acabe el tiempo, verter las gambas y los guisantes. Reserva una taza\r\nde agua de cocción, luego escurrir la pasta y devolverla a la cacerola.","Agrega la yema de huevo, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, la mayor parte del parmesano y un poco de crema agria, si lo deseas. Remueve todo, añadiendo un poco del agua de cocción de la pasta para que se suelte la mezcla.","Sirva espolvoreado con parmesano."]','2026-01-11 13:07:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15229,5846,'es','Canelones de tofu y espinacas','El sabroso tofu es el mejor amigo de los vegetarianos y este plato de canelones, repleto de proteínas y hierro, seguramente será uno de los favoritos para congelar.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","50 g de piñones, picados en trozos grandes","400 g de bolsa de espinacas","pizca de nuez moscada rallada","Paquete de 349 g de tofu sedoso","Paquete de 300g en láminas de lasaña fresca","4 cucharadas de pan rallado fresco"]','["Calentar la mitad del aceite en una sartén, agregar la cebolla y 1/3 del ajo y sofreír durante 4 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Vierta los tomates, sazone y deje hervir. Reduzca el fuego y cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que la salsa espese.","Calienta la mitad del aceite restante en una sartén y cocina otro 1/3 del ajo durante 1 min, luego agrega la mitad de los piñones y las espinacas. Deje que las espinacas se marchiten y luego retire el exceso de líquido. Batir el tofu en un procesador de alimentos o con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave, luego mezclar las espinacas con la nuez moscada y un poco de pimienta. Retirar del fuego; dejar enfriar un poco.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta la mitad de la salsa de tomate en un plato de 20 x 30 cm. Divida la mezcla de espinacas entre las láminas de lasaña, enrolle y colóquelas encima de la salsa. Vierta sobre la salsa restante. Hornee por 30 minutos.","Mezcle las migas con el resto del ajo y los piñones. Espolvoree sobre la fuente, rocíe con el aceite restante y hornee durante 10 minutos hasta que las migajas estén doradas."]','2026-01-11 13:07:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15230,5848,'es','Espaguetis A La Genovesa','Este plato de pasta vegetariana es la solución perfecta cuando quieres algo rápido y sabroso, y todo está cocinado en una sola sartén.','["300 g de patatas nuevas, en rodajas","300 g de espaguetis","200 g de judías verdes peladas y cortadas por la mitad","120 g de pesto fresco en tarrina","aceite de oliva, para rociar"]','["Vierta una tetera con agua hirviendo en una cacerola muy grande hasta que esté medio llena. Vuelva a hervir, luego agregue las patatas y los espaguetis, y un poco de sal. Cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que las patatas y la pasta estén casi tiernas. Vierta las judías verdes y cocine por 5 minutos más.","Escurrir bien, reservando 4 cucharadas del líquido de cocción. Regrese las papas, la pasta y los frijoles a la sartén, luego agregue el pesto fresco y el líquido de cocción reservado. Sazone al gusto, divida en cuatro platos para servir y rocíe con un poco de aceite de oliva."]','2026-01-11 13:07:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15231,5850,'es','Sopa de pasta abundante','Haz algo diferente con un paquete de tortellini. Esta sopa abundante está llena de fibra, baja en grasas y llena de verduras. El almuerzo o cena perfecto','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 zanahorias, picadas","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","1 litro de caldo de verduras","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","200 g de guisantes y frijoles congelados","Paquete de 250 g de tortellini rellenos frescos (nosotros usamos espinacas y ricotta)","un puñado de hojas de albahaca (opcional)","parmesano rallado (o alternativa vegetariana), para servir"]','["Calentar aceite en una sartén. Freír las zanahorias y la cebolla durante\r\n5 minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse. agregar el caldo\r\ny los tomates, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos. Añadir\r\nlos guisantes y los frijoles faltando 5 minutos.","Una vez que las verduras estén tiernas, agregue la pasta. Regresar a la\r\nhervir y cocinar a fuego lento durante 2 minutos hasta que la pasta esté\r\nrecién cocinado. Agregue la albahaca, si la usa. temporada,\r\nluego sirva en tazones cubiertos con una pizca\r\nde parmesano y rebanadas de pan de ajo."]','2026-01-11 13:07:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15232,5852,'es','Gratinado de pasta enfadada con atún','Esta pasta horneada, saludable y abundante, es la comida reconfortante perfecta para el invierno sin ningún sentimiento de culpa.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 pimiento rojo y 1 amarillo, sin semillas y en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","una pizca de chiles secos triturados","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","50 g de aceitunas mixtas sin hueso, enteras o picadas (opcional)","pizca de azúcar en polvo","250 g de formas de pasta integral","2 latas de 200 g de filete de atún en agua de manantial, escurrido y desmenuzado","25 g de pan rallado integral fresco","2 cucharadas de parmesano rallado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande y\r\nsofreír los pimientos durante unos 5 minutos hasta que\r\nempezando a caramelizar. Agrega el ajo\r\ny chiles, cocine por 30 segundos, luego vierta\r\nen los tomates y las aceitunas (si se usan).\r\nSazonar, añadir una pizca de azúcar, llevar a la\r\nhierva, luego cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, cocine la pasta según\r\npara empacar las instrucciones. Calienta la parrilla. Drenar\r\nla pasta y mezclar con la salsa de tomate,\r\njunto con el atún. Incline hacia un gran\r\nfuente apta para horno. Mezclar el pan rallado\r\ny parmesano juntos y esparcir\r\npor encima. Ase durante 3-4 minutos o hasta que\r\nla cobertura queda crujiente y dorada. servir\r\ncon ensalada verde, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:07:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15233,5854,'es','Espaguetis con cangrejo, tomates cherry y albahaca','Sabores frescos e intensos en un plato saludable suelen ser lo que necesitas para darle un impulso a mitad de semana. Este plato de pasta lo tiene todo.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 dientes de ajo, picados","pizca de hojuelas de chile","200 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 latas de 170 g de carne de cangrejo blanco, escurrida","200 g de espaguetis","1 cucharadita de alcaparras, escurridas y enjuagadas","un puñado de hojas de albahaca, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["En una sartén grande, calienta el aceite de oliva. Agrega el ajo y las hojuelas de chile. Cocine hasta que esté dorado pálido, luego agregue los tomates. Cocine 3 minutos más a fuego alto hasta que los tomates empiecen a descomponerse un poco. Agrega el jugo de limón y cocina por 1-2 minutos. Retire del fuego y agregue el cangrejo para que se caliente; no demasiado o se romperá.","Hierva la pasta en una cacerola grande con agua con sal siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y luego escúrrala. Mezcle la pasta en la olla caliente con la salsa, la ralladura de limón y las alcaparras, y agregue la albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:07:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15234,5856,'es','Pasta vegetal de verano','Esta es una excelente cena familiar vegetariana, pero se puede reducir fácilmente a la mitad para servir dos','["200 g de moños de pasta","175 g de habas frescas o congeladas (aproximadamente 650 g en sus vainas)","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva de buena calidad","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, picados","2 calabacines grandes, cortados en palitos","6 tomates pera maduros, cortados en gajos","un generoso trago de salsa tabasco","un puñado de albahaca rallada"]','["Cocer la pasta según\r\ninstrucciones del paquete, agregando fresco\r\nHabas durante los últimos 3 minutos.\r\n(congelado durante los últimos 2 minutos).","Mientras se cocina la pasta, calentar\r\nel aceite en una sartén grande, verter en el\r\ncebolla y cocinar a fuego medio\r\ncalentar durante 1-2 minutos. Agregue el\r\najo y calabacines, revuelva sobre un\r\nfuego medio durante 2-3 minutos, luego\r\nagregue los tomates y agite\r\nEl Tabasco. Revuelva durante 2-3 minutos\r\npara ablandar un poco los tomates (no\r\ndemasiado o se pondrán blandas).\r\nEscurrir la pasta y los frijoles.","Mezcle las verduras y la albahaca\r\nla pasta y sazonar con sal\r\ny pimienta. Sirva caliente (o frío como\r\nuna ensalada con un aderezo bajo en grasas)."]','2026-01-11 13:07:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15235,5858,'es','Pasta con tomate y salsa de verduras escondida','Haga que su familia coma más verduras con esta receta de salsa para pasta súper saludable que cuenta como 5 de sus 5 al día. La salsa también se puede congelar.','["1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 ramas de apio, picadas","2 zanahorias, picadas","1 puerro, picado","2 pimientos, sin semillas y picados","2 latas de 400g de tomates picados con ajo","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo y 1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","300 g de formas de pasta seca","parmesano, rallado y rúcula, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande.\r\ncacerola y cocine suavemente la\r\ncebolla, apio, zanahoria y puerro\r\nhasta que esté suave, unos 20 minutos. Añade el\r\npimientos y cocine por 10 minutos\r\nmás, luego agregue los tomates,\r\nazúcar y vinagre. Cocine a fuego lento durante al\r\nAl menos 20 minutos; cuanto más tiempo, mejor.","Cocine la pasta siguiente paquete\r\ninstrucciones. Mientras tanto, bombardea el\r\nsalsa con una batidora de mano hasta\r\nalisar, sazonar y volver a la\r\ncalentar para mantener el calor mientras la pasta\r\ncocineros. Escurre la pasta y revuelve.\r\na través de la salsa. Servir en tazones\r\ncubierto con queso parmesano rallado y\r\nhojas de rúcula, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:07:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15236,5860,'es','Albóndigas de cordero con salsa de tomate al romero','Este abundante plato es una comida sencilla y rápida entre semana, pero también se puede congelar con antelación para una cena de último momento.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 paquete de 12 albóndigas de cordero ya preparadas (aproximadamente 450 g)","4 cebollas, finamente cortadas","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharada de hojas de romero finamente picadas, más un poco más para espolvorear","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","400 g de pasta, cocida, para servir"]','["Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén grande. Añadir\r\nlas albóndigas y cocine, volteándolas con frecuencia,\r\nhasta que se dore. Retirar de la sartén.","Vierta las cebollas en la sartén con la\r\naceite restante y una pizca de sal y cocinar\r\nhasta que esté muy suave, de 10 a 15 minutos. Agrega el ajo\r\ny el romero y cocine por 2 minutos más.","Agrega los tomates y regresa las albóndigas.\r\na la sartén. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que\r\nla salsa se ha espesado y las albóndigas\r\nestán bien cocidos. Sazonar y servir\r\ncon la pasta, espolvorear con romero."]','2026-01-11 13:07:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15237,5862,'es','Espaguetis cremosos de jamón, puerro y champiñones','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. La pasta cremosa no tiene por qué estar fuera del menú cuando estás cuidando tu peso; esta es baja en grasa.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 puerros medianos, en rodajas finas","200 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","300 g de espaguetis","140 g de queso tierno bajo en grasa (nosotros usamos Philadelphia Light)","85 g de jamón ahumado fino como una oblea, rallado","paquete pequeño de albahaca","25 g de parmesano rallado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande. Revuelva\r\nen los puerros, 2 cucharadas de agua y un poco\r\nsazona, tapa y luego cocina durante 5 minutos.\r\na fuego medio hasta que se ablanden. Añadir\r\nlos champiñones y el ajo, luego cocine por\r\n3 minutos más. Mientras tanto, cocine el\r\nespaguetis según las instrucciones del paquete,\r\nluego escurrir reservando un poco de la\r\nlíquido de cocción.","Agrega el queso tierno al puerro y\r\nmezcla de champiñones, agregando suficiente\r\nlíquido de pasta reservado para darle una apariencia de salsa\r\nconsistencia. Agrega el jamón, las hojas de albahaca.\r\ny parmesano, luego agregue los espaguetis."]','2026-01-11 13:07:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15238,5864,'es','Pasta súper vegetal','Obtén dos de tus cinco al día con esta salsa deliciosamente versátil','["2 pimientos rojos, cortados en cuartos y sin semillas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 bulbo de hinojo, picado en trozos grandes","1 cebolla, picada en trozos grandes","1 zanahoria grande, picada en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo machacados","¼ cucharadita de chiles triturados","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","600 ml de caldo de verduras","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","un puñado pequeño de albahaca, sus hojas ralladas","Bolsa de 500 g de pasta fresca al huevo, cocida"]','["Calienta la parrilla y revienta los pimientos.\r\ncon la piel hacia arriba, por debajo durante 10 minutos\r\no hasta que comience a carbonizarse. Transferir a\r\nen un bol, tapar y reservar. cuando esté frío\r\nsuficiente para manipular, pelar la piel y\r\ncortar la pulpa en tiras.","Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande y\r\nCocine el hinojo, la cebolla y la zanahoria por\r\n8-10 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo,\r\nchiles triturados, semillas de hinojo y tomate\r\nhacer puré, cocinar durante 2 minutos, luego agregar el\r\ntomates enlatados, caldo y azúcar.\r\nCocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 15 minutos o hasta que\r\nlas verduras estén completamente blandas.","Saca un par de cucharadas de\r\nsalsa (esto luego agregará textura), luego\r\nlicuar el resto en la cacerola hasta\r\ncasi suave con una batidora de mano.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos para que espese, luego agregue la salsa reservada y la albahaca rallada.\r\ny pimientos. Servir con la pasta."]','2026-01-11 13:07:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15239,5866,'es','Pasta con mariscos de 20 minutos','Prepare un plato saciante y bajo en grasas en minutos: ideal para los viernes por la noche','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 cucharadita de pimentón","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 litro de caldo de pollo (en cubitos está bien)","300 g de espaguetis, partidos aproximadamente","Paquete de 240 g de mezcla de mariscos congelados y descongelados","un puñado de hojas de perejil picado y rodajas de limón para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en un wok o sartén grande, luego cocina la cebolla y el ajo a fuego medio durante 5 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Añade el pimentón, los tomates y el caldo y deja que hierva.","Baje el fuego a fuego lento, agregue la pasta y cocine durante 7 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente para evitar que la pasta se pegue. Agregue los mariscos, cocine por 3 minutos más hasta que esté completamente caliente y la pasta cocida, luego sazone al gusto. Espolvorea con perejil y sirve con rodajas de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:07:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15240,5868,'es','Sopa de pasta picante','Prepare una sopa minestrone al estilo italiano y tartas individuales con ingredientes de su alacena.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y cortado en rodajas finas","Lata de 800g de tomates pera enteros","1 litro de caldo de verduras","100 g de espaguetis partidos","4 cucharadas de aceitunas negras deshuesadas picadas","2 cucharadas de alcaparras picadas, escurridas y enjuagadas","un puñado grande de hojas de albahaca, cortadas en trozos grandes, o 1 cucharada de pesto"]','["Calienta el aceite en una olla grande de base pesada.\r\ncacerola. Agrega la cebolla y el chile,\r\nluego cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden.\r\nAgregue los tomates, partiéndolos con\r\nuna cuchara a medida que avanza, luego vierta el\r\nvalores. Tapar, llevar a ebullición, retirar\r\ntapa y luego cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.","Agregue los espaguetis y cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n6-8 minutos hasta que esté recién cocido. Agregue\r\nlas aceitunas, las alcaparras y la albahaca o pesto,\r\nluego sirva rociado con aceite de oliva."]','2026-01-11 13:07:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15241,5870,'es','Macarrones con queso cremoso y tomate','Pruebe pasta en lugar de patatas como guarnición rápida con pollo o bistec.','["300 g de macarrones u otras formas de pasta pequeñas","25 g de tomates secos en aceite, escurridos y picados","2 cucharadas de crema fresca","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de parmesano rallado"]','["Hervir la pasta. Mientras tanto, en una pequeña comida.\r\nprocesador, mezcle los tomates, la crema\r\nfraîche y puré de tomate en una salsa. (Si\r\nno tienes procesador pequeño, pica finamente\r\nlos tomates, luego mezcle todo junto).","Escurrir la pasta guardando un poco de\r\nagua de cocción, luego regresar a la olla con\r\nla salsa de tomate y la mitad del queso. Mezclar\r\njuntos hasta que toda la pasta esté cubierta, luego\r\nsirva como guarnición, espolvoreado con el queso restante."]','2026-01-11 13:07:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15242,5872,'es','Lasaña de jamón y aceitunas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Cuando lo único que realmente quieres es un plato lleno de reconfortante lasaña, esta versión está en la mesa en 30 minutos.','["250 g de láminas de lasaña fresca","1 cucharada de aceite","1 diente de ajo gordo, machacado","2 latas de 400 g de tomate picado con hierbas","8 lonchas de jamón","un puñado generoso de aceitunas verdes","2 huevos","Bote de 150 g de yogur natural suave (el bio funciona bien)","50 g de queso cheddar rallado, más un puñado extra para la parte superior"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Coloque las láminas de lasaña en un tazón grande y viértalas sobre agua recién hervida. Dejar en remojo durante 5 minutos y luego escurrir. Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén refractaria y sofreír los ajos durante 1 min. Agregue los tomates y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que se reduzcan un poco. Sazone al gusto y luego viértalo en un tazón.","Coloque en capas las láminas de pasta, el jamón (manténgalo en rodajas), la salsa de tomate y las aceitunas en la sartén, asegurándose de tener algunas aceitunas y un poco de salsa encima. No seas demasiado pulcro, arruga el jamón y deja que la pasta se doble alrededor de la salsa y las aceitunas.","Batir los huevos, el yogur y la mayor parte del queso en una jarra, sazonar con sal y pimienta y luego verter sobre la pasta. arriba\r\ncon queso extra y pimienta negra, luego hornee durante unos 15 minutos hasta que el queso esté dorado y la cobertura cuaje. Servir con una ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:07:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15243,5874,'es','Linguini cremoso con jamón, limón y albahaca','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Mantenga contentos a los niños con esta receta fácil y baja en grasa que está lista en menos de media hora.','["400 g de linguini o espagueti","paquete de 90 g de jamón serrano","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","jugo 1 limon","2 yemas de huevo","3 cucharadas de crema fresca","un puñado grande de hojas de albahaca","un puñado grande de parmesano rallado, más algo extra para servir, si lo desea"]','["Cocine los linguini. Mientras tanto, rompa el\r\nJamón en trozos pequeños y sofreír en la aceituna.\r\naceite hasta que esté dorado y crujiente.","Escurrir la pasta reservando un poco de\r\nagua de cocción, luego regresar a la sartén.\r\nVierta el jamón cocido. Mezclar juntos el\r\nzumo de limón, yemas de huevo y nata fresca,\r\nluego agregue esto a la sartén junto con el\r\nalbahaca y parmesano. Mezclar con pinzas,\r\nañadiendo un poco del agua de cocción, si\r\nnecesario, para hacer una salsa cremosa que\r\ncubre la pasta. Servir con extra\r\nParmesano rallado por encima, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15244,5876,'es','Olla para pasta minestrone','Un plato de pasta minestrone favorito vegetariano para menores de 5 años','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","300 g de verduras mixtas congeladas (incluidos guisantes, maíz dulce, zanahorias y brócoli, pero no los guisados ​​en trozos)","700 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","175 g de pasta pequeña, como por ejemplo conchigliette","Lata de 220 g de frijoles cocidos","queso cheddar rallado, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite de oliva en un\r\ncacerola a fuego medio\r\ncalentar y sofreír la cebolla\r\ndurante unos minutos hasta que comience\r\npara suavizar. Agrega el tomate\r\nhaga puré y luego agregue el helado\r\nverduras y verter\r\nla acción.","Llevar a ebullición, añadir el\r\npasta y revuelva. Cubrir y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 12-14 minutos\r\no hasta que la pasta esté cocida.","Agregue los frijoles y caliente.\r\na través, luego pruebe\r\ncondimento. Servir caliente, con\r\nun plato de queso cheddar rallado\r\npara espolvorear por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:07:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15245,5878,'es','Ten-minute pasta','Esta comida se pone en la mesa más rápido que las patatas fritas al horno y está llena de verduras frescas, lo que la hace perfecta para los niños.','["350g pasta","1 zanahoria, picada en trozos grandes","½ cebolla pequeña, picada en trozos grandes","½ rama de apio, picado en trozos grandes","6-8 tomates ciruela maduros, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharadita de pesto rojo","2 cucharadas de vinagre de frambuesa","parmesano rallado y hojas de albahaca, para servir"]','["Cocer la pasta según el paquete.\r\ninstrucciones. Mientras tanto, agrega todo\r\nmás aparte del parmesano y la albahaca\r\na un procesador de alimentos y mezclar\r\nhasta obtener una pasta suave.","Vierta en una cacerola y lleve\r\nhasta que hierva, luego reduzca la\r\ncalentar a fuego lento y\r\ndejar cocer durante 5 min.","Escurrir la pasta, mezclar\r\njunto con el\r\nsalsa de tomate, luego\r\nservir con el\r\nparmesano y\r\nhojas de albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:07:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15246,5880,'es','Minestrone de judías verdes','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. El uso de una selección de vegetales verdes le da a esta sopa una sensación veraniega y texturas contrastantes.','["1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 zanahoria, finamente picada","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","Paquete de 70 g de cubitos de tocino (opcional)","1 hoja de laurel","1½ litro de caldo de verduras o pollo","100 g de pasta pequeña, como stelline u orzo","300 g de habas mixtas, verdes y de vaina","100 g/4 oz de col tierna, rallada","4 cucharadas de pesto","pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Sofreír la cebolla, el ajo, la zanahoria y el apio.\r\nen el aceite de oliva en una cacerola grande hasta\r\ntierno pero no dorado. Saque y\r\ndejar de lado. Fríe la panceta, si la usas,\r\nNo será necesario agregar más aceite, pero manténgalo\r\nel fuego bajo hasta que empiece a desprender grasa.\r\nFreír hasta que estén dorados pero no demasiado crujientes. consejo\r\nen un colador y escurrir el exceso de grasa.\r\nVuelva a poner la mezcla de zanahoria en la sartén.\r\ncon la panceta y añadir la hoja de laurel,\r\nmucho condimento y caldo. traer\r\na fuego lento, agregue la pasta y cocine\r\ndurante 5 min.","Arriba y detrás del green y el corredor.\r\nfrijoles, córtelos en trozos que\r\ncabe fácilmente en una cuchara y agréguelo a la olla\r\ncon las habas. Cocine por 3 minutos,\r\nluego agrega el repollo. traer de vuelta a un\r\ncocine a fuego lento y cocine por 2 minutos. Cuchara el\r\npesto encima de la sopa justo\r\nantes de servir y servir con el pan."]','2026-01-11 13:07:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15247,5882,'es','Pasta con champiñones y hierbas','Una idea rápida y baja en grasas para una cena entre semana: buena si tienes un presupuesto de alrededor de £1,15 por cabeza.','["250 g de champiñones camperos o portobello, en rodajas gruesas","2 cucharaditas de mostaza integral","3 dientes de ajo, rebanados o machacados","150 ml de caldo de verduras (en cubitos está bien)","250 g de pasta penne (u otras formas de tubo)","3 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana, picado","ralladura de 1 limón"]','["Poner los champiñones, la mostaza, el ajo y\r\ncaldo de verduras en una sartén, llevar a\r\nhervir y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos o hasta que\r\ncasi todo el caldo se ha evaporado y el\r\nlos champiñones están suaves.","Mientras tanto, cocine la pasta según\r\npara empacar las instrucciones. Escurrir y mezclar con el\r\nchampiñones, perejil y ralladura de limón. Temporada\r\nal gusto y servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15248,5884,'es','Ensalada rápida de pasta con atún','Una pasta rápida con las sobras de la noche anterior. Hace un excelente almuerzo para llevar','["2 paquetes de 220 g de pasta preparada (nosotros usamos Dolmio Express), o 440 g de penne cocido sobrante (unos 200 g secos)","Lata de 100g de atún en aceite.","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini (también son buenas las judías borlotti o butterbean)","1?2 cebolla morada, finamente picada","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","un puñado grande de perejil"]','["Cocine en el microondas el penne cocido según las instrucciones del paquete. Vierta en un tazón. Mezcle los ingredientes restantes (el\r\nla pasta caliente realmente absorberá los sabores). Si usa pasta sobrante fría, simplemente mezcle todo; aún tendrá sabor.\r\ngenial. Se puede conservar en el frigorífico hasta 3 días."]','2026-01-11 13:07:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15249,5886,'es','lasaña vegetariana','Una lasaña vegetal ligera pero deliciosa para deleitar tu paladar: contiene solo 13 g de grasa en comparación con los 19 g más habituales.','["2 cucharadas de aceite","1 cebolla, rebanada","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","1 berenjena, cortada en trozos","1 pimiento rojo","8 tomates pera, cortados por la mitad","350ml en puré","200 g de láminas de lasaña ya cocidas","6 cucharadas de crema fresca media grasa","2 cucharadas de parmesano rallado (o alternativa vegetariana)"]','["Caliente el horno a 190 ° C/ventilador 170 ° C/gas 5. Mezcle el aceite y las verduras y ase en una fuente grande y poco profunda durante 35 minutos hasta que estén ligeramente carbonizados. Coloque una capa de verduras asadas sobre el fondo de una fuente para hornear de tamaño mediano.","Vierta sobre un poco de passata y cubra con una capa de láminas de lasaña. Repita las capas para utilizar todas las verduras asadas y la passata, terminando con una capa de lasaña. Use una cuchara para verter la crème fraîche y luego espolvoree con el parmesano. Regrese al horno durante 25 minutos, hasta que la lasaña esté completamente caliente y la parte superior esté dorada y burbujeante."]','2026-01-11 13:07:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15250,5888,'es','Ensalada de pasta favorita','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una ensalada picante y baja en grasa, perfecta para una lonchera de verano; varía según tus ingredientes favoritos.','["250 g de formas de pasta","140 g de guisantes congelados","paquete de perejil, picado","cebollino en paquete pequeño, cortado en tiras","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","ingredientes adicionales (ver ideas a continuación)"]','["Cocine la pasta, agregando\r\nlos guisantes durante los últimos 2 minutos\r\ntiempo de cocción. Escurrir, enjuagar\r\ncon agua fría para enfriar,\r\nluego escurrir nuevamente. Inclínate hacia\r\nun bol con lo picado\r\nhierbas, ralladura de limón y\r\nzumo, aceite de oliva y abundante\r\nde condimento y mezclar bien.\r\nCubra y enfríe, sirviendo con una cuchara.\r\nporciones cuando y como y cuando.\r\nSi estás haciendo esto para uno\r\npersona, para los días 3 y 4 podrás\r\nNecesito agregar un poco de aceite de oliva.\r\no algo cremoso para\r\naflojar la pasta."]','2026-01-11 13:07:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15251,5890,'es','Tortellini con ricotta, espinacas y tocino','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta pasta crujiente y cremosa es lo suficientemente especial para el entretenimiento del verano.','["Paquete de 250 g de tortellini rellenos (nosotros usamos ricotta y espinacas)","2 lonchas de tocino inclinado hacia atrás","25 g de nueces en trozos","ralladura de ½ limón, jugo de 1","1 cucharada de parmesano finamente rallado, más un poco más para servir","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más extra para servir","Bolsa de 100 g de espinacas para ensalada","2 cucharadas de ricota"]','["Calienta la parrilla. Hervir la pasta según\r\ninstrucciones del paquete, luego viértalo en un colador\r\ny enfriar con agua corriente suave.\r\nMientras tanto, asa el tocino en una bandeja para horno.\r\nhasta que estén dorados y crujientes en los bordes. cuando\r\nYa casi listo, vierte las nueces en la bandeja.\r\npara brindar un poco. Corta el tocino en tiras.","Mezclar la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el parmesano.\r\ny aceite en un tazón grande. Sazone con pimienta,\r\nluego agregue las espinacas, los tortellini y el tocino.\r\ny nueces. Mezcle bien, agregue la ricotta\r\npequeñas gotas, luego revuelva suavemente. Sazone al gusto,\r\nluego servir con un chorrito más de aceite y más\r\nParmesano, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:07:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15252,5892,'es','Pollo entero asado con raíces y guisantes estofados','Coloque capas de colinabo, patatas y puerros para asar junto con un pollo y disfrutar de una cena saludable. Un pollo entero es económico ya que puede proporcionar sobras para la semana.','["800 g de patatas medianas, en rodajas finas","1 puerro grande (unos 350 g), en rodajas","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo, más los tallos","4 dientes de ajo, picados","500 g de colinabo, en rodajas finas","450 ml de caldo de verduras, elaborado con 2 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1,3 kg de pollo entero","320 g de guisantes congelados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezclar las patatas, los puerros, el tomillo, el ajo y el nabo en una fuente para asar profunda y antiadherente. Agite hasta obtener una capa uniforme. Vierta el caldo y unte las verduras con el aceite. Ase durante 20 minutos.","Coloca los tallos de tomillo dentro de la cavidad del pollo. Después de 20 minutos, coloque el pollo encima de las verduras y ase durante 1 hora hasta que esté bien cocido. Después de 30 minutos, revisa las patatas; añade 150 ml de agua si empiezan a prenderse. Retire el pollo a una tabla para que repose durante 10 minutos. Mientras tanto, cocine la mitad de los guisantes siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.","Corte las piernas de pollo y quíteles la piel, luego sírvalas con la mitad de las verduras asadas y los guisantes. Deje que el pollo y las verduras restantes se enfríen y luego manténgalos fríos por hasta tres días. Para preparar las sobras, retira la piel de una de las pechugas y recaliéntala con las verduras en el microondas hasta que esté bien caliente. Cocine los guisantes restantes siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Cortar la pechuga y servir con las verduras. Utilice la pechuga final para estos wraps de huevo de gallina con especias. Esta receta es parte de nuestro plan de dieta saludable gratuito de 7 días. Para acceder al plan de alimentación completo, haga clic aquí."]','2026-01-11 13:07:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15253,5894,'es','Patatas asadas al aire','Prepare papas asadas en una freidora para obtener asados ​​crujientes con un centro esponjoso con facilidad. Son el acompañamiento perfecto para un asado de domingo.','["1 kg de patatas Maris Piper","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol o de oliva"]','["Corta las patatas en trozos del mismo tamaño, asegurándote de que no sean demasiado grandes. Cocine al vapor durante 5 minutos en una vaporera colocada sobre una olla con agua hirviendo, o cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Escurrir bien.","Coloque las papas escurridas en el fondo de una freidora. Agrega el aceite y mezcla todo para asegurarte de que las patatas queden bien cubiertas. Configure la freidora para cocinar durante 30 minutos usando la paleta. Verifique que las papas estén bien cocidas, luego cocínelas por otros 5 a 10 minutos si no están tiernas o lo suficientemente doradas. Sazone bien."]','2026-01-11 13:07:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15254,5896,'es','Calabaza triturada con avellanas y salvia','Agregue mantequilla dorada a la calabaza triturada para obtener un maravilloso sabor a nuez que combina maravillosamente con las avellanas. Una guarnición vegetariana versátil para cenas asadas','["1 calabaza grande (aproximadamente 1,2 kg), pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos de 3 cm","50 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de salvia finamente picada, más unas cuantas hojas enteras para servir","buen rallado de nuez moscada","50 g de avellanas blanqueadas, picadas en trozos grandes","1 calabaza grande (aproximadamente 1,2 kg), pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos de 3 cm","50 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de salvia finamente picada, más unas cuantas hojas enteras para servir","buen rallado de nuez moscada","50 g de avellanas blanqueadas, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Vierta la calabaza en un recipiente grande apto para microondas con 4 cucharadas de agua y sazone. Cubra con un plato o tapa apto para microondas y cocine en el microondas durante 12 a 15 minutos o hasta que esté muy tierno.","Mientras tanto, vierta la mantequilla en una sartén y derrita a fuego medio. Deje cocinar durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté dorado y con olor a galleta. Agrega las hojas enteras de salvia durante el último minuto para que queden crujientes. Retirar y reservar.","Triture la calabaza cocida con un machacador de patatas y revuelva la mayor parte de la mantequilla dorada, la salvia picada, la nuez moscada y una pizca generosa de sal. Rocíe el resto de la mantequilla y espolvoree con las avellanas y las crujientes hojas de salvia enteras.","Vierta la calabaza en un recipiente grande apto para microondas con 4 cucharadas de agua y sazone. Cubra con un plato o tapa apto para microondas y cocine en el microondas durante 12 a 15 minutos o hasta que esté muy tierno.","Mientras tanto, vierta la mantequilla en una sartén y derrita a fuego medio. Deje cocinar durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté dorado y con olor a galleta. Agrega las hojas enteras de salvia durante el último minuto para que queden crujientes. Retirar y reservar.","Triture la calabaza cocida con un machacador de patatas y revuelva la mayor parte de la mantequilla dorada, la salvia picada, la nuez moscada y una pizca generosa de sal. Rocíe el resto de la mantequilla y espolvoree con las avellanas y las crujientes hojas de salvia enteras."]','2026-01-11 13:07:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15255,5898,'es','Asado de nueces vegano fácil','Disfrute de este sencillo asado de nueces como plato principal vegetariano. Con granada, arándanos y champiñones castaños, está lleno de sabores invernales.','["2 cucharadas de linaza molida","400 g de calabaza pelada, sin semillas y cortada en trozos de 3 cm","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un extra para la lata","2 cucharadas de za''atar","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharadas de cilantro molido","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","250 g de champiñones castaños, finamente picados","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharadas de pasta de miso","200 g de pistachos sin cáscara picados, más un poco más para servir","100 g de castañas cocidas, finamente picadas","100 g de pan rallado fresco","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","200 g de arándanos frescos o congelados","4 cucharadas de azúcar moreno suave","semillas de granada, para servir"]','["Combine las semillas de lino con 4 cucharadas de agua en un tazón pequeño y déjelas espesar. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle la calabaza en una fuente para asar con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, el za''atar, el comino y el cilantro. Cubra el molde con papel de aluminio y ase durante 30-35 minutos, o hasta que la calabaza esté tierna pero aún mantenga su forma. Engrase un molde para pan de 900 g y cúbralo con papel para hornear.","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén y fríe la cebolla, el apio y los champiñones durante 10 a 15 minutos o hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el ajo y la pasta de miso.","Vierta los pistachos, las castañas, el pan rallado y el perejil en un bol, luego agregue la mezcla de linaza, las verduras fritas y la calabaza asada. Sazone bien.","Coloque los arándanos en una sartén con el azúcar y cocine durante 3-4 minutos, o hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto y los arándanos comiencen a ablandarse. Vierta en la base del molde para pan y luego déjelo reposar durante 5 minutos para que cuaje ligeramente. Cubra con la mezcla de nueces asadas, dándole palmaditas firmes y alisando la parte superior con el dorso de una cuchara. Cubra con papel aluminio y hornee por 25 minutos, luego destape y hornee por 25 minutos más. Dejar reposar durante 15 minutos, luego invertir en un plato para servir, quitando el pergamino. Cubra con pistachos extra picados y semillas de granada y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:07:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15256,5900,'es','Lentejas con calabaza y ajo asadas a fuego lento con yogur harissa','Resalte el dulce sabor de la calabaza asándola a fuego lento y sirviéndola con lentejas ligeramente condimentadas para obtener un delicioso plato principal vegetal.','["1 calabaza, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en rodajas de 2 cm","8 dientes de ajo, con piel","4 chalotes pequeños, con piel","3 hojas de laurel","unas ramitas de tomillo","50 ml de aceite de colza","un puñado de cilantro picado","150 g de lentejas verdes o puy","1 hoja de laurel","1 diente de ajo","chorrito de aceite de oliva","6 cucharadas de yogur griego espeso","1 cucharada de tahini","1-2 cucharadas de rosa harissa","2 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de aceite de colza"]','["Primero, prepara las lentejas. Remojar durante al menos 2 horas o toda la noche. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Mezcle la calabaza, el ajo, las chalotas, el laurel, el tomillo, el aceite y una pizca de sal marina en una fuente para asar, cubra con papel de aluminio y ase durante 45 minutos. Retire el papel de aluminio y ase durante 10 minutos más, hasta que las verduras estén tiernas y caramelizadas en los bordes. Retirar del horno y subir el fuego a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle las semillas de calabaza con el comino, el aceite y una pizca de sal, y ase hasta que revienten, aproximadamente 5-6 minutos.","Mientras tanto, ponemos en una sartén las lentejas con el laurel, el ajo y una pizca de sal. Cubrir con agua, llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante 20-25 minutos. Escurrir y retirar el laurel y el ajo. Mezcle con el aceite y la pimienta negra.","Combine el yogur y el tahini. Agregue la harissa al gusto y luego mezcle con las lentejas. Exprima las chalotas asadas y el ajo sin piel y revuelva con las lentejas junto con un chorrito de aceite de la lata.","Sirve la calabaza sobre las lentejas, espolvoreada con cilantro y semillas, y el yogur a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15257,5902,'es','Cómo asar ajo','¿Quieres saber cómo asar ajo? Una vez asado, el ajo se vuelve dulce y suave, perfecto para sopas, salsas y aderezos.','["1 cabeza de ajo","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva"]','["Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Corta la parte superior del bulbo de ajo, dejando al descubierto la parte superior de los dientes de ajo. Coloque un pequeño cuadrado de papel de aluminio y frótelo con aceite de oliva. Sazone con sal y pimienta. Arruga el papel de aluminio para sellar el bulbo.","Ase durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté suave al presionarlo y la cubierta de papel esté ligeramente dorada. Deje enfriar unos minutos antes de exprimir los ajos asados ​​suaves de sus cáscaras. Alternativamente, retire toda la envoltura de papel y retire los dientes individualmente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15258,5904,'es','Patatas nuevas asadas al limón','Una nueva forma de preparar patatas que combina especialmente bien con un plato principal a base de marisco','["450 g de patatas nuevas","ralladura de 1 limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Incline el \r\npatatas en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo, \r\nEspere a que el agua hierva nuevamente y luego cocine por  \r\n5 minutos. Escurrir, volver a colocar en la sartén y agitar. \r\nBueno para raspar un poco los bordes. Consejo sobre  \r\nuna bandeja para horno, mezcle con la ralladura de limón, el aceite y \r\nun poco de sal marina en escamas y luego asar durante 30 minutos \r\nhasta que esté dorado y crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15259,5906,'es','Pollo asado con relleno de cuscús y piñones','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Delicioso frío o caliente y perfecto para un picnic, este pollo relleno será el verdadero favorito de la familia.','["100 g de cuscús","175 ml de caldo de pollo hirviendo","50 g de mantequilla","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","100 g de piñones","140 g de orejones, picados en trozos grandes","un puñado grande de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de hojas de menta, picadas en trozos grandes","1 limon","1 huevo batido","6 pechugas de pollo sin piel","16 lonchas de tocino rayado"]','["Coloque el cuscús en un recipiente grande resistente al calor, vierta sobre el caldo y luego cubra con film transparente durante 5 minutos hasta que se absorba el líquido. Derrita la mitad de la mantequilla en una sartén, luego cocine suavemente la cebolla y el ajo durante 5 a 8 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Dejar de lado. Freír los piñones durante unos minutos hasta que estén dorados. Combine cebollas, piñones, albaricoques y hierbas con cuscús. Añade un buen chorrito de limón.\r\njugo, sazone y luego agregue el huevo. Dejar enfriar.","Usando el dorso de un cuchillo, estire las lonchas hasta 1½ veces su longitud original. Colóquelos, ligeramente superpuestos, sobre una hoja grande de papel de aluminio para formar un rectángulo. Haga algunos cortes en la parte más gruesa de cada pechuga de pollo y colóquelos entre 2 hojas de film transparente. Utilice la base de una sartén pesada para machacar el pollo hasta que tenga aproximadamente 1 cm de espesor. Coloque el pollo sobre el tocino, encajando\r\npara que no queden huecos, pero deja un borde en los lados más largos. (Esto ayuda a enrollar el pollo).","Vierta el relleno sobre el pollo en tiras a lo largo de uno de los lados más largos. Usando papel de aluminio como ayuda, enrolle el tocino y el pollo alrededor del relleno como si fuera un tronco. Envuélvalo bien en papel de aluminio, girando los extremos para asegurarlo, luego enfríe durante 2 horas o hasta 1 día.","Caliente el horno a 180 C/ventilador 160 C/gas 4. Coloque el pollo, con las uniones hacia abajo, en una bandeja para asar. Cocine durante 30 minutos, luego desenvuelva el papel de aluminio y unte el asado con la mantequilla restante. Cocine, sin tapar, durante 20 a 30 minutos más hasta que esté bien cocido y el relleno esté caliente (una brocheta de metal insertada en el centro del pollo debe salir caliente). Deje enfriar y envuélvalo en papel de aluminio nuevo para transportar."]','2026-01-11 13:07:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15260,5908,'es','Pollo asado y verduras todo en uno','¿Te apetece el sabor de un asado, pero no la grasa? Pruebe esta receta sencilla y saludable en una sola sartén','["8 patatas tiernas, cortadas por la mitad","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 zanahorias, en rodajas","1 calabacín, en rodajas","1 puerro, rebanado","1 cucharadita de tomillo y romero picados, más una o dos ramitas","2 pechugas de pollo pequeñas sin piel","150 ml de caldo de pollo bajo en sodio"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. En un\r\nbandeja para asar pequeña mezcle las papas con\r\nel aceite, las zanahorias, el calabacín, el puerro, las hierbas\r\ny condimento. Ase durante 30 minutos hasta que\r\nempezando a dorarse. Quitar del\r\nhorno y revuelva las verduras, colóquelas en\r\nel pollo, luego regresar al horno\r\ndurante 15 min. Vierta sobre el caldo y luego\r\ncocina por 5 minutos más o hasta que el pollo\r\ny las verduras estén bien cocidas."]','2026-01-11 13:07:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15261,5910,'es','Pollo picante con ensalada de mango','Un estímulo picante y súper saludable para el pollo','["4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel","rociar aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de garam masala","1 mango maduro grande","½ pepino","½ cebolla morada pequeña","un puñado de hojas frescas de cilantro","4 cucharadas de crema agria o yogur natural","ralladura y jugo ½ lima","pan naan caliente, para servir"]','["Calienta una plancha o sartén hasta que esté caliente. Frote el pollo con aceite, garam masala y una buena pizca de sal. Cocine durante 6 minutos por cada lado o hasta que esté ligeramente carbonizado y bien cocido.","Pela y corta el mango en gajos finos. Corta el pepino por la mitad a lo largo y córtalo en rodajas gruesas en ángulo. Cortar la cebolla en rodajas finas. Mezcle los ingredientes de la ensalada con el cilantro y apílelos en platos.","Mezcle la crema agria o el yogur con la ralladura de lima y el jugo, sazone y vierta junto a la ensalada. Cortar el pollo por la mitad o en tercios en diagonal, disponer a continuación\r\na la ensalada y sírvala con pan naan."]','2026-01-11 13:07:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15262,5912,'es','Verduras de raíz asadas','Las verduras de raíz son imprescindibles en el almuerzo del domingo y en la cena de Navidad, y esta receta fácil es baja en grasa, súper saludable y rica en fibra.','["5 zanahorias, peladas y cortadas en cuartos","5 chirivías, peladas y cortadas en cuartos","1 apio nabo, pelado y cortado en cubos de 2 cm","½ colinabo, pelado y cortado en cubos de 2 cm","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cabeza de ajo, partida por la mitad","miel clara, para rociar"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle\r\ntodas las verduras con el aceite y el ajo en una cacerola grande\r\nfuente para asar, luego ase durante 40 minutos hasta que\r\ncomenzando a ablandarse y dorarse.\r\nRetirar el molde del horno, rociar\r\nlas verduras con miel y volver a la\r\nHornee por 10-20 minutos más hasta que esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15263,5914,'es','Pescado asado y patatas fritas con raita de naranja','Un capricho saludable para mantener satisfecha a toda la familia','["3 patatas medianas para asar, lavadas","2 batatas medianas, lavadas","2 cucharadas de aceite de chile o aceite de oliva","1 naranja grande","¼ de pepino, finamente picado","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","1 cucharada de menta fresca picada","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","3 cucharadas de yogur natural desnatado","4 filetes de pescado blanco, cada uno con un peso aproximado de 175 g/6 oz","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino"]','["Precalentar el horno a 200C/gas\r\n6/ventilador 180C. Corta cada papa\r\ny boniato a lo largo\r\nen 6 u 8 porciones, no es necesario\r\npelar. Vierta en una fuente para asar\r\ny rociar con el aceite.\r\nSazone, mezcle bien y luego ase\r\ndurante 40-45 minutos hasta que estén tiernos,\r\ndándoles la vuelta a la mitad.","Pelar la naranja con un cuchillo afilado,\r\ncuchillo de sierra para quitar la médula\r\n– haz esto sobre un tazón para atrapar\r\nel jugo, que necesitarás más tarde.\r\nRecortar los gajos, quitando\r\ncualquier membrana, luego picar\r\nellos. Mezclar con el pepino,\r\ncebolla, menta, vinagre y yogur.\r\nAgrega un poco de sal y pimienta, luego\r\nreservar, tapado.","Cepille una bandeja para hornear con aceite.\r\ny poner el pescado encima. temporada,\r\nespolvorear con el jugo de naranja\r\ny el comino. Asar arriba\r\nlas patatas fritas durante 12-15 minutos\r\nhasta que las patatas fritas estén cocidas.\r\nServir con la raita de naranja."]','2026-01-11 13:07:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15264,5916,'es','Salmón escalfado en papel de aluminio con mayonesa de hierbas','Aprende a escalfar un salmón a la perfección con nuestra receta paso a paso y luego sírvelo con mayonesa casera de cebollino, albahaca y eneldo.','["aceite de oliva ligero, para engrasar","3 kg de salmón entero eviscerado y escamado sin cabeza","manojo de eneldo","1 chalota, partida por la mitad y en rodajas muy finas","5 cucharadas de vino blanco seco, como Sauvignon Blanc","2 cucharadas de cebollino picado","2 cucharadas de albahaca picada","500 ml de mayonesa","berros, pepino, hierbas y rodajas de limón, para servir"]','["Caliente el horno a 150C/ventilador de 130C/\r\ngas 2. Coloque un trozo grande de\r\npapel de aluminio de doble ancho encima\r\nuna bandeja para hornear grande y cepillarla\r\ncon aceite, luego poner el salmón en el\r\ncentro. Mete unas cuantas ramitas generosas\r\nde eneldo y chalotes en el cuerpo\r\ncavidad, luego sazone.","Levante con cuidado los lados de\r\nel papel de aluminio para rodear el pescado,\r\nsazone bien por dentro y por fuera,\r\nluego vierta sobre el vino.","Selle el papel de aluminio por todos lados,\r\npero no demasiado apretado sobre el pescado\r\n– hay que darle un poco de\r\nespacio dentro del paquete. Hornear para\r\n1 h 30 min.","Una vez que el salmón esté cocido,\r\ndesenvuelva con cuidado el paquete de aluminio\r\ny tirar de la aleta dorsal en el\r\nespina dorsal del pescado. Si el salmón es\r\nlisto, debería salir muy\r\nfácilmente. Vuelva a sellar el paquete y déjelo\r\nfrío – seguirá cocinándose un poco\r\nmás a medida que se enfría. Si no estas seguro\r\nque el salmón esté suficientemente cocido,\r\nregréselo al horno por 10 minutos más.","Cuando esté frío, despélelo con cuidado.\r\nla piel de un lado del\r\nsalmón. Es posible que necesites usar\r\nun cuchillo para empezar, pero\r\nDespués de eso, debería desprenderse fácilmente.\r\nDejar el eneldo cocido y la chalota\r\nen su lugar, ya que podría dañar el\r\ncarne del salmón si lo intentas\r\neliminarlos.","Utilice un cuchillo para raspar el\r\npulpa grasa de color marrón. sabe\r\ndelicioso pero no se ve\r\ntan atractivo como la carne rosada\r\ndebajo. Gire con cuidado el\r\nsalmón en un plato y\r\nquitar la piel y la pulpa dorada\r\ndesde el otro lado.","Para servir, retire con cuidado el\r\nfiletes de un lado del pescado,\r\ndejando atrás los huesos. tu\r\nVerás que el pez tiene un carácter natural.\r\nDivida 2 filetes largos a cada lado.\r\nInserta tu cuchillo a lo largo del centro y\r\nRetire con cuidado cada filete. Transferir\r\nColoque los filetes en un plato, con el hueso hacia arriba.","Levante el hueso central de\r\nel resto del pescado entero –\r\ndebería salir en uno\r\npieza – y quitar los aromáticos.\r\nSepare los 2 filetes restantes y\r\nretire las espinas. Volver a montar\r\nel salmón en el plato. Revuelva el\r\nhierbas en tu mayonesa y\r\nadornar el salmón con berros,\r\npepino, hierbas y limón."]','2026-01-11 13:07:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15265,5918,'es','Carne asada con salsa de cebolla francesa','El pejerrey y la parte superior son cortes de carne más baratos y magros, adecuados para la cocción lenta. El caldo y los jugos forman una salsa estupenda si se combinan con cebollas caramelizadas.','["1 kg de pejerrey o parte superior de carne de res, sin grasa añadida (ver consejo a continuación)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","8 zanahorias tiernas, sin la parte superior (pero deja un poco, si quieres)","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","200 ml de vino blanco","600 ml de caldo de ternera rico","2 hojas de laurel","500 g de cebollas","unas ramitas de tomillo","1 cucharadita de mantequilla","1 cucharadita de azúcar moreno claro o mascabado claro","2 cucharaditas de harina común"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3.\r\nFrote la carne con 1 cucharadita de aceite.\r\ny mucho condimento. Calentar una gran\r\ncazuela ignífuga y marrón\r\ntoda la carne durante unos 10 minutos.\r\nMientras tanto, añade 2 cucharaditas de aceite a una sartén.\r\nsartén y sofreír las zanahorias y el apio\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que se dore.","Levante la carne a un plato, salpique la\r\nvino en la cazuela caliente y hervir durante\r\n2 minutos. Vierta el caldo, devuelva el\r\ncarne, luego agregue las zanahorias, el apio\r\ny hojas de laurel, procurando no sumergirnos\r\nlas zanahorias demasiado. Cubrir y cocinar\r\nen el horno por 2 hrs. (Me gusta girar el\r\ncarne a la mitad de la cocción.)","Mientras tanto, corte las cebollas en rodajas finas.\r\nCalienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén y agrega la\r\ncebolla, tomillo y algún condimento.\r\nTape y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que\r\nlas cebollas están blandas pero no coloreadas.\r\nRetire la tapa, suba el fuego, agregue\r\nla mantequilla y el azúcar, luego dejar que la cebolla\r\ncaramelizar hasta obtener un color marrón dorado oscuro,\r\nrevolviendo con frecuencia. Retire las ramitas de tomillo,\r\nluego dejar a un lado.","Cuando la carne esté lista, estará tierna.\r\ny fácil de separar en los bordes.\r\nRetíralo de la cazuela y córtalo\r\nfuera de las cuerdas. Vuelva a calentar la sartén con cebolla, revuelva\r\nen la harina y cocinar por 1 min. batir el\r\ncebollas harinosas en los jugos carnosos del\r\ncazuela, para hacer una salsa espesa de cebolla.\r\nGusto por sazonar. Agrega la carne y\r\nDevolver las zanahorias a la cazuela o cortarlas en rodajas.\r\ncarne de res y llevar a la mesa en una fuente,\r\ncon las zanahorias a un lado y el\r\nsalsa vertida por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:07:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15266,5920,'es','Carne asada especiada','El rosbif de Matt Tebbutt combina especias y una carne tierna y derretida. También estará igual de bien frío.','["1 cucharada de bayas de enebro","1 cucharada de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharada de granos de pimienta negra","1 cucharada de bayas de pimienta de Jamaica","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 kg-3 kg (4 lb 8 oz-6 lb 8 oz) de trozo de carne de res, dependiendo de la cantidad de sobras que desee"]','["Combine todas las especias y ½ cucharada de sal en un mortero. Muela bien todo, manteniendo un poco de su tosquedad. Frote el aceite y luego las especias molidas por toda la carne y masajee bien. Cubra y enfríe durante la noche para marinar.","Al día siguiente, caliente el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Pese el porro y ase durante 10 minutos por 450 g para carne poco hecha y 15 minutos por 450 g para carne mediana, más 20 minutos adicionales. Cubra y deje reposar durante 20 minutos mientras termina las ensaladas, luego corte y sirva. Alternativamente, ase la carne por la mañana y sírvala a temperatura ambiente para la cena."]','2026-01-11 13:07:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15267,5922,'es','Ternera braseada con champiñones y balsámico','Un plato principal elegante para dos, inspirado en la región italiana de Emiglia-Romaña','["400 g de filete de ternera","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","hojas de 1 ramita de romero, machacadas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharadas de mantequilla","200 g de champiñones silvestres variados","200ml de buen caldo de ternera","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico, para servir"]','["Frote la carne con 1 cucharada de aceite, romero y\r\najo, luego dejar en el frigorífico al menos 1 hora,\r\no hasta 24 hrs. Asegúrese de que la carne vuelva a\r\ntemperatura ambiente antes de cocinarlo.","Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Calentar\r\nuna sartén antiadherente apta para horno o para asar\r\nestaño hasta que esté muy caliente. Frote la mayor parte del ajo y\r\nromero de la carne, sazonar con negro\r\npimienta y sal en escamas, luego dorar por todos lados\r\nhasta que quede de color marrón oscuro y casi con costra – aproximadamente\r\n5 minutos en total. Transfiera la sartén al horno,\r\nluego ase la carne durante 10 minutos a fuego medio.\r\nDejar reposar unos buenos 15 minutos y\r\nconservar los jugos.","Mientras reposa la carne, salteamos los champiñones.\r\nCalienta 1 cucharada de mantequilla y el aceite restante en\r\nuna sartén grande, luego agregue los champiñones\r\ncon mucho condimento. Freír hasta que esté dorado\r\ny simplemente ablandado, luego viértalo en un tazón.","Agregue el caldo a la fuente para champiñones, luego\r\nreducir en dos tercios. Consejo en los champiñones\r\ny balsámico, luego agregue la mantequilla restante\r\ny dejar que se derrita. Agregue el jugo de la carne y luego\r\nsazone al gusto y mantenga caliente. rebanada gruesa\r\nla carne y vierta sobre la salsa. servir\r\ncon puré y espinacas."]','2026-01-11 13:07:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15268,5924,'es','Patatas asadas crujientes','Las patatas asadas crujientes son una parte esencial del almuerzo asado perfecto. Si te gustan las chirivías, ástalas exactamente de la misma manera.','["20 papas de tamaño uniforme, como King Edwards, peladas y cortadas por la mitad si son grandes","Tarro de 200 g de grasa de ganso.","sal, para servir"]','["Hervir las patatas durante 10 minutos y luego\r\ndrenar. Desbaste sus superficies con\r\ncon un tenedor o agitándolos en la sartén\r\ncon la tapa puesta.","Derretir la grasa de ganso en un recipiente grande de fondo grueso.\r\nfuente para asar encima de la\r\nestufa. Incorporar las patatas con cuidado y\r\ngírelos hasta que estén cubiertos uniformemente\r\nen la grasa. Colóquelo en el estante superior del\r\nhorno (mueva el pavo hacia abajo en un estante si\r\nnecesario) y ase durante 1-1¼ horas,\r\nvolteándolos de vez en cuando hasta que estén crujientes\r\ny dorado. Espolvorea con sal para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15269,5926,'es','Sarnies de bistec con cebolla pegajosa y queso azul','Disfrute de la clásica combinación de bistec y queso azul sobre una deliciosa masa madre para un almuerzo sencillo pero especial.','["2 cucharadas de mantequilla sin sal","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de salsa inglesa","½ cucharada de azúcar moreno blando","40 g de stilton, desmenuzado","2 cucharadas de mayonesa","1 solomillo grande o filete de lomo (unos 350 g)","4 rebanadas de pan de masa madre","un puñado de rúcula, para servir"]','["Derretir la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla con una pizca de sal durante 15 minutos hasta que esté dorada. Agrega la salsa inglesa y el azúcar y sofríe durante 5 minutos más, o hasta que las cebollas estén pegajosas y caramelizadas. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Mezclar el stilton con la mayonesa y sazonar con pimienta negra recién molida. Dejar de lado.","Sazone el bistec por ambos lados. Calienta una sartén a fuego alto y cocina el bistec durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado (2 minutos a fuego lento o 3 minutos a fuego medio). Retirar a una tabla, tapar y dejar reposar 10 min. Cortar el filete en rodajas finas.","Tuesta las rodajas de masa madre y luego unta con la mezcla de queso azul. Cubra con el filete, las cebollas caramelizadas, la rúcula y un poco de pimienta negra, luego sirva dos sándwiches abiertos por persona."]','2026-01-11 13:07:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15270,5930,'es','Adorno para sándwich de pollo y aguacate','El pollo magro es una base excelente para un sándwich. Combine con ingredientes frescos para ensalada y un poco de mayonesa baja en grasa.','["2 cucharaditas de mayonesa baja en grasa","rodajas de pollo cocido","½ aguacate pequeño, cortado en cubitos","chorrito de limon","cebolla morada picada","hojas de cilantro","tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","rebanada de pan integral con semillas o de centeno, o pita integral, para servir"]','["Cubra el pan o rellénelo con mayonesa y pollo, luego agregue aguacate, limón, cebolla morada, cilantro y tomates cherry."]','2026-01-11 13:07:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15271,5932,'es','Topper de sándwich de hummus y aguacate','Adereza el hummus con cilantro, cebolla morada, tomates y limón y rellénalo con pita o sírvelo sobre pan integral o de centeno.','["2 cucharadas grandes de hummus","½ aguacate pequeño, cortado en cubitos","chorrito de limon","un poco de cebolla morada picada","hojas de cilantro","unos tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","rebanada de pan integral con semillas o de centeno, o pita integral, para servir"]','["Cubra el pan o rellénelo con hummus, luego agregue aguacate con limón, cebolla morada, cilantro y tomates cherry."]','2026-01-11 13:07:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15272,5934,'es','Topper de sándwich de cóctel de gambas','Haga que los clásicos langostinos con mayonesa sean más saludables: apílelos sobre pan o rellénelos en una pita y sírvalos con una ensalada verde crujiente y un poco de eneldo para darle más sabor.','["50g de gambas","1 cucharada de mayonesa baja en grasa","puré de tomate en chorritos pequeños","varias hojas de lechuga Little Gem","un poco de cebolleta picada","rodajas de pepino","espolvoreado de eneldo","rebanada de pan integral con semillas o de centeno, o pita integral, para servir"]','["Revuelva los langostinos con la mayonesa y el puré de tomate. Aplíquelos sobre el pan o el pan pita con lechuga, cebolleta, pepino y eneldo."]','2026-01-11 13:07:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15273,5936,'es','Topper de sándwich de mayonesa de huevo al curry','Condimente la tradicional mayonesa de huevo con un poco de pasta de curry. Sirva encima de pan o relleno de pita junto con pepino crujiente, lechuga y cebolleta.','["1 huevo cocido, picado","un poco de pasta de curry","1 cucharada de mayonesa baja en grasa","puré de tomate en chorritos pequeños","varias hojas de lechuga Little Gem","un poco de cebolleta picada","rodajas de pepino","rebanada de pan integral con semillas o de centeno, o pita integral, para servir"]','["Agrega el huevo cocido y la pasta de curry a la mayonesa y al puré de tomate. Aplíquelos sobre pan o pita con lechuga, cebolleta y pepino."]','2026-01-11 13:07:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15274,5938,'es','Wrap de gambas y aguacate','Envuelve algo saludable para tu lonchera. Este sándwich está aromatizado con lima, cebolleta y salsa picante.','["1 aguacate baby muy maduro, sin hueso, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","jugo ½ lima","unos batidos de salsa tabasco","1 tomate, sin semillas y picado","1 cebolla tierna, en rodajas","1 tortilla de harina sin semillas (o alternativa sin gluten)","un puñado de hojas de ensalada mixta","85 g de gambas cocidas y peladas"]','["Pon el aguacate en un bol con el jugo de lima, el Tabasco y un poco de condimento. Triture aproximadamente, luego agregue el tomate, el cilantro (si se usa) y la cebolleta.","Calienta el wrap en el microondas durante unos segundos. Repartir la mezcla de aguacate por la mitad, esparcir sobre las hojas de ensalada y terminar con las gambas. Enrollar y luego comer."]','2026-01-11 13:07:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15275,5940,'es','Perros de pescado con ensalada de hinojo y limón','El humilde sándwich de palitos de pescado se renueva: sírvalo en panecillos para hot dogs con ensalada de col fresca y crujiente.','["6 sándwiches suaves y harinosos o panecillos para hot dog","800-900 g de filetes de pescado blanco, firmes y sin piel (fletán, rubio, dorada o bacalao aprobado por el MSC son todos buenos), cortados en filetes largos y finos","6 cucharadas de harina común","½ cucharadita de pimentón","un poco de aceite vegetal","1 bulbo de hinojo grande","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 cucharadas de crema ligera para ensalada","100 gramos de yogur natural","2 zanahorias, cortadas en palitos o ralladas muy gruesas","un puñado de perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes","1 limón en conserva (encuéntrelos en frascos con los ingredientes marroquíes), cortado por la mitad, quitando las semillas del medio y desechándolos, y la cáscara finamente picada"]','["Para la ensalada, recoja las hojas de\r\nel hinojo y reservar. Desechar cualquier\r\ncapas exteriores sucias, cortar en cuartos el bulbo y\r\nluego córtelo lo más fino que pueda. Mezclar con\r\nel jugo de limón y dejar macerar durante\r\n1 hora, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Escurrir el hinojo. Mezclar la crema de ensalada\r\ny yogur en un tazón grande, luego agregue el\r\nhinojo, los ingredientes restantes de la ensalada,\r\nlas hojas de hinojo (picadas) y\r\nun poco de pimienta y luego mezclar bien.","Cuando esté listo para servir, divida los panecillos y\r\ncalentar en horno bajo. Para el pescado, mezclar el\r\nharina con el pimentón y un poco de sal\r\nun plato. Sumergir en los filetes de pescado y cubrir\r\nbueno. Calentar un chorrito de aceite en una sartén\r\n(antiadherente si tienes) y sofreír el pescado.\r\ndurante un par de minutos por cada lado hasta que\r\nbien cocido y se desmenuza. dividir el\r\npescado entre los panecillos con la ensalada y\r\ncómelo de inmediato. Cualquier repollo sobrante se\r\nEstará bien durante 2-3 días en el refrigerador."]','2026-01-11 13:07:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15276,5942,'es','Rollitos de pollo, zanahoria y aguacate','Wraps de tortilla saludables, rápidos y sencillos con pollo desmenuzado, verduras y ensalada: perfectos para loncheras pequeñas','["75 g de queso tierno bajo en grasa","3 tortillas de harina","1 pechuga de pollo cocida y sin piel, desmenuzada en trozos grandes","1 zanahoria grande, rallada o rallada","1 aguacate grande, sin hueso y en rodajas","un puñado de hojas de rúcula"]','["Unta el queso sobre las tortillas.\r\ny cubra con el pollo, la zanahoria,\r\naguacate y rúcula.","Enrolle bien cada tortilla. Envolver bien\r\nen film transparente, girando los extremos firmemente para\r\nsellar y enfriar hasta que esté listo.","Desenvuelve y corta cada rollo en 4 trozos.\r\npara agregar a tus loncheras."]','2026-01-11 13:07:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15277,5944,'es','Sándwich abierto de requesón y pimientos','Dale un toque saludable a la bruschetta y cubre tu tostada integral con requesón, albahaca y balsámico contrastante.','["140 g de requesón","½ pimiento rojo, en rodajas finas","algunas hojas de albahaca, rotas","2 rebanadas de pan de masa madre o pan integral","rocíe vinagre balsámico (opcional)"]','["Coloque capas de requesón, pimiento rojo\r\ny albahaca con un poco de condimento en un bol\r\no recipiente de plástico. Relájate hasta la hora del almuerzo.","Tostar el pan y dejar enfriar durante 1 min, luego\r\ndale a la mezcla de requesón un rápido\r\nmezcle y vierta con una cuchara. Rocíe con balsámico\r\nVinagre, si lo desea, y cómelo inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15278,5946,'es','Rollitos de zanahoria y hummus','Enrolla, enrolla: prepara algo súper saludable en un instante con estos wraps vegetarianos','["200g de hummus en tarrina","4 wraps sin semillas","4 zanahorias","un puñado pequeño de hojas de rúcula"]','["Extienda el hummus entre envolturas. Ralla las zanahorias en trozos grandes y espárcelas sobre el hummus, terminando cada envoltura con un pequeño puñado de hojas de rúcula y un poco de condimento. Enrollar y comer."]','2026-01-11 13:07:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15279,5948,'es','Rollos de arcoiris','Para obtener una superficie crujiente y un centro suave y pastoso, ideamos bollos híbridos de pan de bollo, que utilizan las verduras sobrantes.','["250 g de harina blanca normal y un poco más para espolvorear","250 g de harina de pan blanco","500 g de harina de pan de semillas y cereales","Sobre de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","100 g de gachas de avena","100 g de semillas mixtas, más un extra para espolvorear","50 g de nueces finamente picadas","2 cucharaditas de bicarbonato de sodio","50 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubitos","2 botes de suero de leche de 284 ml","100 g de calabacines rallados","100 g de zanahorias ralladas","100 g de remolacha cruda rallada - ¡use guantes!","un poco de leche o huevo batido, para glasear"]','["Espolvoree su bandeja o bandeja para hornear más grande\r\ncon harina. Mezclar las harinas, la levadura, la avena,\r\nsemillas, nueces, bicarbonato y 2 cucharaditas de sal\r\nen un bol, luego unte la mantequilla con\r\ntus dedos hasta que casi desaparezca.","Vierta el suero de leche y 150-200 ml.\r\nagua y mezclar rápidamente con un palo de madera.\r\ncuchara, luego tus manos, para formar una masa.\r\nDividir en 3 y amasar una verdura rallada.\r\ncada uno para hacer una masa de calabacín, una zanahoria\r\nmasa y una masa de remolacha. Forme cada uno en\r\n6 rondas con las manos enharinadas. organizar,\r\nespaciados, en la bandeja para hornear, cubra\r\nsin apretar con film transparente engrasado y dejar reposar.\r\nlevar en algún lugar cálido durante 30 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPincelar la parte superior con leche o huevo, esparcir\r\ncon semillas adicionales y hornear durante 30-35 minutos\r\nhasta que las bases estén doradas pálidas y sanas\r\nhueco cuando se golpea. Cubrir con un té\r\ntoalla y dejar enfriar un poco – esto\r\nmantenlos suaves."]','2026-01-11 13:07:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15280,5950,'es','Sándwiches abiertos de trucha ahumada y pepino','Este relleno fresco y saludable para el almuerzo está listo en un instante.','["Paquete de 125 g de filetes de trucha ahumados en caliente sin piel","½ tarrina de Quark de 250g","½-1 cucharadita de salsa de rábano picante","exprimir el jugo de limon","2 rebanadas gruesas de pan granero","¼ de pepino, rebanado","25 g de berros","2 puñados de tomates cherry, para servir"]','["Desmenuza el pescado en un tazón grande y luego\r\nagregue la salsa de quark y rábano picante\r\nal gusto. Sazone con pimienta negra y\r\nun chorrito de jugo de limón.","Tuesta el pan y luego cubre cada pieza.\r\ncon rodajas de pepino y berros.\r\nVierta la mitad del paté de trucha encima de cada uno.\r\ny servir con tomates cherry cortados por la mitad\r\nen el costado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15281,5952,'es','Sándwiches de zanahoria y pasas','Un sándwich vegetariano diferente, este relleno ligero es simple y excelente para el té de la tarde o para loncheras.','["1 zanahoria grande, pelada y rallada","2 cucharadas de pasas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","½ cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharada de menta picada","4-6 rebanadas de pan integral","3 cucharadas de hummus"]','["Mezclar la zanahoria con las pasas, el aceite de oliva y el vinagre. Sazone y agregue la menta.","Unte 2-3 rebanadas de pan con hummus, cubra con la mezcla de zanahoria y haga un sándwich con 2-3 rebanadas más. Corta en las formas que desees."]','2026-01-11 13:07:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15282,5954,'es','Tartines con tomates asados ​​y pesto de menta','Sándwiches franceses tostados de queso y tomate, rociados con pesto ligero de menta y ajo y untados con ricotta','["8 tomates medianos madurados en rama, cortados por la mitad","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","4 rebanadas gruesas de pan integral","1 diente de ajo, dejado entero","25 g de piñones tostados","manojo pequeño de menta","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","100 g de ricota","ensalada verde, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nPon las mitades de tomate en una asadera.\r\nestaño en una sola capa. rociar con\r\n1 cucharada de aceite, sazonar bien y\r\nAse durante 20 minutos. Dejar de lado.","Tostar el pan y frotar con\r\nel ajo – guarda el diente para el\r\npesto. Cepille un poco más de aceite\r\nel pan y poner en 4 platos.","Usando un procesador de alimentos, bata\r\njuntos los piñones, la menta, el ajo,\r\nresto del aceite y el vinagre. espesamente\r\nuntar la ricota sobre el pan,\r\nluego cubra con el asado\r\ntomates y un poco de pesto de menta.\r\nSirva con una ensalada, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15283,5956,'es','Empanadas de pescado de Sri Lanka al estilo empanada con alioli de curry','Prepare estas deliciosas hamburguesas de pescado de Sri Lanka para alimentar a una multitud. Servidos con un alioli de curry rápido para mojar, requieren un poco de esfuerzo pero valen la pena.','["300 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","½ cucharadita de sal fina","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, fría y en cubos","1 yema de huevo batida","80ml de leche de coco","125 g de patatas (1 patata mediana-grande)","500 ml de aceite de colza, para freír, más 1 cucharada","½ cebolla morada, finamente picada","1½ dientes de ajo, finamente picados","½ trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente picado","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","¼ cucharadita de comino","pizca de canela molida","pizca de clavo molido","½ cucharadita de pimienta negra molida","150 g de caballa o atún en lata, escurridos","¼ de manojo pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","½ cucharadita de sal fina","¼ de lima, en jugo","1 clara de huevo batida","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","½ cucharadita de curry en polvo","4 cucharadas de mayonesa"]','["Para la masa, mezcle la harina y la sal en un tazón grande. Agrega la mantequilla y frota con la harina hasta que tenga la textura del pan rallado. Mezclar la yema de huevo batida con la masa. Vierta lentamente la leche de coco, amasando la masa hasta que se una. Agrega un poco de harina o agua si es necesario. Envolver y enfriar durante una hora.¼½","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Ponga a hervir una cacerola con agua, pele la papa y córtela en cubos de 1 cm, luego agréguela a la cacerola y cocine a fuego medio durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté bien cocida. Escurrir y dejar enfriar.","Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola y cocina la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre durante 8 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Agregue las especias y la pimienta negra, revuelva y cocine por 1 minuto, luego agregue el pescado y el eneldo y cocine por otros 2-3 minutos. Agrega la papa y la sal, mezcla bien y cocina por 2 minutos. Retirar la sartén del fuego, añadir el zumo de lima y dejar enfriar.","Parta la masa por la mitad y extienda cada mitad, por turno, sobre una superficie enharinada hasta una profundidad de 3 mm. Si tienes uno, utiliza un cortador de masa de 7 cm para cortar ocho círculos de cada hoja de masa, vuelve a enrollar la masa y corta círculos hasta que se acabe. Serán entre 26 y 28 en total.","Vierta 1 cucharadita de la mezcla de pescado en cada uno de los círculos de masa. Con una brocha de repostería pequeña, unte un poco de clara de huevo a lo largo de los bordes de cada uno de los círculos de masa. Dobla cada uno para formar una empanada. Con un tenedor, presione los lados para asegurarse de que estén completamente sellados.","Vierte 500 ml de aceite en una cacerola asegurándote de que no esté más de dos tercios de su capacidad y caliéntala a 180 °C, o hasta que un pedacito de masa comience a chisporrotear. Fríe con cuidado las hamburguesas en tandas pequeñas durante 2-4 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad hasta que estén doradas. Retirar con una espumadera y colocar sobre papel de cocina para que absorba el exceso de aceite.","Pon todos los ingredientes para el alioli en un bol, revuelve y sirve con las empanadas."]','2026-01-11 13:07:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15284,5958,'es','Mini empanadillas de queso y cebolla','Prepare estas pequeñas empanadillas de queso y cebolla para un picnic familiar. Si no te comes los 12, se congelan bien y se pueden cocinar directamente congelados.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas, rebanadas","4 ramitas de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","150 g de queso cheddar maduro (o una mezcla de quesos duros fuertes), rallado","1 cucharada de mostaza integral","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","125 g de mantequilla fría","una pizca grande de pimienta de cayena","½ cucharadita de mostaza inglesa en polvo","1 huevo grande, batido"]','["Primero, haz la masa. Vierte la harina en un bol. Sosteniendo el bloque de mantequilla en su envoltorio, rallarlo directamente en la harina (es posible que tengas que mojar el extremo de la mantequilla en la harina de vez en cuando si se vuelve pegajosa). Añade la pimienta de cayena, la mostaza en polvo y la mitad del huevo batido y sazona con una pizca de sal. Une todo con las manos hasta que la mezcla empiece a formar grumos. Incline la masa sobre la superficie de trabajo y amase muy brevemente hasta formar una bola suave, agregando hasta 3 cucharadas de agua fría si está demasiado seca. Aplastar la masa formando un disco. Envuelve y deja enfriar mientras haces el relleno.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén y cocina las cebollas y las hojas de tomillo durante 8-10 minutos hasta que las cebollas se ablanden y empiecen a caramelizar. Verter en un bol y dejar enfriar. Una vez frío, agregue el queso rallado, la mostaza y las cebolletas.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Extienda la masa fría sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de £1. Recorta tantos círculos de 10 a 12 cm como puedas (puedes usar una taza como plantilla), luego vuelve a enrollar los recortes y repite. Deberías obtener entre 10 y 12 círculos en total.","Coloque un montón de relleno en el centro de cada círculo de masa, dejando los bordes libres. Trabajando con un círculo a la vez, unte un poco del huevo batido restante alrededor del borde, luego levante los dos lados para que se junten en el medio en forma de media luna. Pellizca la masa, doblando el borde para sellar. Transfiera a la bandeja para hornear y repita con los círculos de masa restantes y el relleno. Pincelar todas las empanadillas con un poco de huevo batido. Se mantendrán congeladas durante dos meses.","Hornee las empanadas durante 20 a 25 minutos (o 40 a 45 minutos congeladas) hasta que estén doradas. Déjelo enfriar durante al menos 10 minutos antes de comerlo caliente, o déjelo enfriar completamente y guárdelo en recipientes para un picnic. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:07:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15285,5960,'es','Albóndigas pelmeni siberianas','Ponte a prueba en la cocina con estas fantásticas albóndigas pelmeni siberianas. Con una mezcla de rellenos de cordero y verduras, disfrútalo con el caldo que lo acompaña.','["350 g de harina ''00'' más un poco más para espolvorear","1 huevo grande","250 g de carne picada de cordero","½ cebolla, finamente picada","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","¼ de chile en polvo","manojo pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","200 g de champiñones variados, finamente picados","½ cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, finamente picado","un chorrito de salsa de soja","75 g de piñones finamente picados","2 hojas de laurel","1 cubito de caldo de verduras","manojo pequeño de eneldo, hojas recogidas","crema agria, para servir","mantequilla, para servir (opcional)"]','["Para hacer la masa, tamiza la harina en un bol. Hacer un hueco en el medio y añadir una pizca de sal, el huevo y 100 ml de agua, mezclando poco a poco la harina con las manos hasta formar una masa firme. Amasar bien durante 5-7 minutos. Cubra y enfríe durante 30 minutos. Mientras tanto prepara tus rellenos.","Mezcle bien los ingredientes del relleno de carne en un tazón grande con una pizca de sal.","Para hacer el relleno de verduras, calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y sofreír los champiñones, la cebolla, el ajo y el perejil con la salsa de soja durante 5 minutos. Apague el fuego y agregue los piñones y un poco de sal y pimienta. Deje que la mezcla se enfríe antes de manipularla.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener láminas de 1,5 mm de espesor. Para obtener mejores resultados, utilice una máquina de pasta.","Corta discos de masa de unos 4-6 cm de diámetro con un vaso de chupito o un cortapastas. Coloque una cucharadita de relleno en el medio de cada disco, luego use un dedo mojado para cepillar ligeramente la masa alrededor del relleno. Dobla cada uno por la mitad para formar una media luna, presionando hacia abajo para sellar. Doble la bola de masa nuevamente para que los bordes puntiagudos de la luna queden pegados. Las bolas de masa se pueden cocinar inmediatamente o congelar en capas planas en bolsas para congelar para cocinarlas más tarde, usando el mismo método que se describe a continuación pero aumentando el tiempo de cocción en un par de minutos.","Para cocinar, poner a hervir unos 3 litros de agua en una cacerola grande, añadiendo las hojas de laurel y la pastilla de caldo. Agregue las bolas de masa al caldo hirviendo en tandas de aproximadamente 10, luego cocine por 5 minutos. Están listos cuando flotan hacia la superficie. Las de carne pueden tardar unos minutos más que las de verdura.","Sirva los pelmeni en tazones de sopa con el caldo de cocción y cúbralos con el eneldo, la crema agria y la pimienta negra. Si prefieres comerlos sin caldo, utiliza una espumadera para pasarlos a un bol, añadiendo una generosa cucharada de mantequilla con el eneldo, la crema agria y la pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:07:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15286,5962,'es','Rodaja de tomate y halloumi','Cubra un hojaldre con tomates cherry, pimientos y halloumi para preparar un almuerzo o cena familiar fácil. Esparcir sobre algunas hojas de albahaca para servir.','["400 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","1 pimiento amarillo, en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","400 g de halloumi, cortado en rodajas de 5 mm","500 g de masa de hojaldre en bloque","harina, para espolvorear","2 cucharadas de queso tierno","3 cucharaditas de leche","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","1 yema de huevo","un puñado de hojas de albahaca, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Colocar los tomates y los pimientos en una bandeja para hornear en una sola capa. Rocíe con la mitad del aceite, sazone con sal y ase durante 25 minutos.","Mientras tanto, caliente una sartén a fuego medio. Unte ligeramente las rodajas de halloumi con el aceite restante y cocine a la plancha durante 6 minutos. Voltee y cocine por 3 minutos más. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Extienda el hojaldre sobre una superficie ligeramente espolvoreada hasta obtener aproximadamente 32 x 22 cm y aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear grande forrada con papel para hornear y marque un borde de 2 cm alrededor de los bordes. Combine el queso tierno, 2 cucharaditas de leche y el ajo y extiéndalo dentro del borde.","Encienda el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4. Retire el líquido de la bandeja de tomates y pimientos, luego coloque las verduras asadas sobre la mezcla de queso tierno. Coloca el halloumi encima. Combine la yema de huevo y la leche restante, luego cepille esto sobre el borde. Hornee durante 25 minutos hasta que la masa esté dorada y leudada. Esparcir sobre la albahaca y servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15287,5968,'es','Bollos de queso con huevo','Cambia tus tostadas o sándwiches habituales a la hora del almuerzo o desayuno por estos deliciosos bollos de queso con huevo. Disfrútalo con tomates cherry y aguacate en rodajas.','["3 huevos","50ml de leche","6 bollos","250 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","chorrito de aceite vegetal","40 g de queso cheddar rallado","2 aguacates maduros pequeños, rebanados"]','["Calienta la parrilla. Batir los huevos y la leche en un plato amplio. Sumerge los bollos en la mezcla de huevo, voltéalos una vez y déjalos reposar durante unos minutos.","Coloque los tomates con el lado cortado hacia arriba en una bandeja para hornear y áselos durante unos minutos, luego cubra la bandeja con papel de aluminio para mantener los tomates calientes.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén y cocina los bollos durante unos minutos por cada lado hasta que el huevo se haya endurecido; es posible que tengas que hacerlo en tandas. Transfiérelos a una bandeja para hornear sobre la marcha. Una vez que todos los bollos estén cocidos, cubra con el queso y cocine a la parrilla durante 1-2 minutos hasta que el queso burbujee y esté dorado. Servir con los tomates y las rodajas de aguacate."]','2026-01-11 13:07:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15288,5970,'es','tofu crujiente','Fríe el tofu con una capa de pimentón ahumado, ajo y condimentos para hacer estos bocados crujientes de tofu. Cómelo como refrigerio o como entrante o guarnición en un festín vegetariano.','["400 g de tofu firme en bloque","3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","½ cucharadita de ajo granulado","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharadita de sal marina fina","½ cucharadita de pimienta negra molida","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal"]','["Escurre el tofu, envuélvelo en 4-5 hojas de papel de cocina, colócalo en un plato y pon algo pesado encima, como una tabla de cortar de madera o una bandeja con algunas latas. Dejar reposar 20 minutos para que escurra el exceso de humedad del tofu.","Mezcle la harina de maíz, el ajo, el pimentón, la sal y la pimienta en un tazón pequeño. Desenreda el tofu del papel, córtalo por la mitad por el centro y luego córtalo en triángulos, cubos o tiras.","Mezcle los trozos de tofu en la harina de maíz con especias para cubrirlos por completo. Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio-alto. Fríe el tofu durante 2-4 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté dorado, crujiente y dorado en los bordes. Los cubos más pequeños tardarán 2 minutos en cada lado, los triángulos más grandes tardarán 4 minutos. Cocine en tandas si es necesario, agregando un poco más de aceite si la sartén se seca.","Escurre el tofu cocido sobre papel de cocina y sazona con una pizca más de sal antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15289,5972,'es','Tartina de judías cannellini trituradas','Una mezcla de ajo, chile, perejil y frijoles cannellini triturados cubren estas tartinas sin cocinar junto con queso feta y tomates. Son rápidos, fáciles y saludables también.','["Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","1 limón grande, rallado y exprimido","1 diente de ajo pequeño, finamente rallado","1 chile rojo pequeño, sin semillas y finamente picado","1⁄2 manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","8 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","2 rebanadas de masa madre","15 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","50g de rúcula"]','["Coloque los frijoles, 1 cucharada de aceite, la ralladura y el jugo de limón y el ajo en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta crear una textura gruesa. Transfiera a un tazón y revuelva con el chile, el perejil y los tomates cherry.","Tuesta ligeramente el pan y apila sobre la masa de frijoles cannellini, esparce sobre el queso feta y rocía con el aceite restante. Servir con la rúcula a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15290,5974,'es','Berenjenas asadas con yogur y harissa','¿Busca una guarnición o un entrante sencillo que tenga buen sabor? No busques más que berenjenas asadas con yogur y harissa. Es vegetariano y sin gluten.','["4 berenjenas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","75 g de mantequilla","1 cucharada de harissa comprada o casera (ver nuestra receta)","6 cucharadas de yogur griego","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","1 cucharada de cilantro picado","1 cucharadita de semillas de sésamo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/190C ventilador/gas 6. Perforar las berenjenas unas cuantas veces con la punta de un cuchillo, luego untar con aceite de oliva y ponerlas en una bandeja para horno. Ase durante unos 40-45 minutos, o hasta que las berenjenas estén completamente tiernas.","Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén, luego revuelva con la harissa (consulte nuestra receta). Corta las berenjenas por la mitad abriéndolas un poco como si fueran patatas asadas. Ponlos en un plato caliente y sazona el interior de cada uno, luego mezcla el yogur con el ajo. Vierta un poco de esto en cada berenjena y luego rocíe sobre la mantequilla especiada. Esparza sobre el cilantro y las semillas de sésamo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:21');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15291,5976,'es','Huevos escoceses más ligeros','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. El clásico picnic recibe un cambio de imagen saludable: dos tercios de la grasa se eliminan usando lentejas y carne magra de cerdo y horneándola en lugar de freírla.','["5 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 chalota, finamente picada","5 huevos medianos","85 g de lentejas verdes (peso escurrido de una lata de 400 g)","225 g de carne picada de cerdo extra magra (menos del 5 % de grasa)","2 cucharaditas de salvia finamente picada","3 cucharaditas de cebollino finamente picado","½ cucharadita de mostaza seca en polvo","una buena pizca de nuez moscada rallada","1 cucharada de harina común","25 g de panko rallado (pan rallado japonés)"]','["Calienta 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente pequeña. Vierta la chalota y fríala durante unos minutos hasta que se ablande. Transfiera a un plato y deje enfriar. (No es necesario lavar la sartén, puedes usarla más tarde).","Mientras tanto, ponga 4 huevos en una cacerola mediana, cubriéndolos bien con agua fría. Llevar a ebullición: cuando el agua comience a burbujear, configure el cronómetro y hierva durante 5 minutos. Cuando estén cocidos, escurra el agua hirviendo y enfríe los huevos con agua fría para evitar que se cocinen más. Triture bien las lentejas en un tazón mediano con el dorso de un tenedor, luego agregue la carne picada de cerdo, la salvia, 2 cucharaditas de cebollino, la mostaza, la nuez moscada, las chalotas enfriadas, una pizca de sal y una pizca generosa de pimienta negra. Pele las cáscaras de los huevos y séquelos con papel de cocina.","Divida la mezcla de carne uniformemente en 4. Vierta la harina en un plato y enrolle cada huevo para cubrir, quitando el exceso. Distribuya una cuarta parte de la mezcla de carne sobre la superficie de trabajo hasta formar un círculo de 12-13 cm, utilizando el resto de la harina para evitar que se pegue. Ahueca el círculo en tu mano y coloca uno de los huevos en el centro. Con ambas manos, golpee, presione y suavice la mezcla de carne alrededor del huevo hasta que esté completamente cubierto de manera uniforme. Sella muy bien para que no quede ninguna unión, luego dale palmaditas y enróllalo hasta darle buena forma sobre la superficie enharinada. Repita con el resto de la mezcla de carne y los huevos cocidos.","Mezcle las migas de panko en un plato grande con las cebolletas restantes. Batir el huevo restante en un plato, untar un poco sobre cada huevo rebozado (no lo usarás todo), luego enrollar los huevos en las migas de panko y darles palmaditas para que se peguen. Coloque los huevos en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel pergamino y déjelos enfriar durante 20-25 minutos (pero no durante la noche). Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.","Calienta 2 cucharaditas del aceite restante en la sartén que usaste para la chalota. Cuando esté bastante caliente (está lo suficientemente caliente cuando algunas migas de panko chisporrotean inmediatamente y comienzan a dorarse), agregue 2 de los huevos escoceses y enrolle en el aceite para cubrirlos bien. Configure el cronómetro durante 2 minutos, luego fría, volteando con frecuencia, para que se dore por completo. En esta etapa simplemente estás dorando, no cocinando completamente los huevos, así que no los cocines demasiado o la capa puede comenzar a romperse. Transfiera a la bandeja para hornear forrada y repita con los huevos restantes, bajando un poco el fuego si la sartén se calienta demasiado.","Hornea los huevos escoceses durante 12 minutos. Retirarlas y colocarlas sobre papel de cocina para que escurran y dejar enfriar un poco. Corta los huevos escoceses por la mitad con un cuchillo afilado y sírvelos ligeramente tibios o fríos. Es mejor consumirlo el mismo día o, cuando esté frío, guardarlo durante la noche en el refrigerador en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 13:07:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15292,5978,'es','Huevo y soldados','Nos encanta esta versión del tradicional uso de espárragos soldados para su huevo dippy: un excelente refrigerio o almuerzo ligero bajo en grasa y sin gluten, con poco más de 100 calorías.','["1 huevo pasado por agua","7 lanzas de espárragos al vapor"]','["Corta el huevo pasado por agua por la mitad y sírvelo con los espárragos al vapor para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:07:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15293,5980,'es','bolsillo pitta','Un refrigerio saludable y bajo en grasas con pollo, tomates y pepino, menos de 150 calorías y que se prepara en solo unos minutos.','["½ pan pita integral","25 g de pechuga de pollo cocida y sin piel","¼ de pepino, cortado en trozos","4 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad"]','["Rellena la mitad del pan pita con la pechuga de pollo, el pepino y los tomates cherry."]','2026-01-11 13:07:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15294,5982,'es','Mini fajitas de pollo','Estos bocados de fiesta de inspiración mexicana están rellenos con pollo picante al chipotle y pimientos: ¡prepárate para un entretenimiento sin complicaciones!','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos de 1½ cm/½","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en trozos de 1½ cm/½","1 pimiento amarillo, sin semillas y cortado en trozos de 1½ cm/½","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","¼ cucharadita de chile picante en polvo","Lata de 227 g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de pasta de chipotle","4 cebolletas, cortadas y en rodajas finas","paquete grande de cilantro, hojas picadas","3 tortillas de harina grandes","75 g de mozzarella ya rallada","1 aguacate maduro, sin hueso y pelado","jugo de 1 lima grande","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharadas colmadas de cilantro finamente picado","36 palitos de cóctel"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande o en un wok y sofríe el pollo y los pimientos durante 2 minutos. Espolvoree las especias y cocine por 30 segundos más, revolviendo. Vierta los tomates en la sartén y agregue la pasta de chipotle. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos o hasta que la salsa esté espesa y brillante, revolviendo regularmente. Agregue las cebolletas y el cilantro, cocine por 1 minuto más, luego retire del fuego y deje enfriar.","Corta las tortillas en cuartos, luego corta cada cuarto en tres pedazos, para tener 36 triángulos. Coloca 1 cucharadita de la mezcla de pollo y un poco de queso en el extremo más ancho de un triángulo. Enrolle el extremo puntiagudo del triángulo alrededor del relleno y asegúrelo con un palillo. Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Rellena y enrolla los otros triángulos. Cubra con film transparente y enfríe por hasta 8 horas hasta que esté listo para recalentar.","Para hacer la salsa, tritura todos los ingredientes en un bol hasta que quede casi suave. Cubra la superficie de la salsa con film transparente y déjela enfriar hasta por 24 horas.","Cuando esté listo para servir, caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Destape las fajitas y hornee durante 6-8 minutos o hasta que estén completamente calientes. Servir con el guacamole."]','2026-01-11 13:07:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15295,5984,'es','chips de horno indio','Condimente los gajos de papa con cúrcuma, jengibre, ajo y semillas de hinojo para obtener una guarnición de inspiración india, perfecta para compartir con amigos.','["1 kg de patatas harinosas como Maris Piper, peladas y cortadas en trozos grandes","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y picado, o finamente rallado hasta formar una pasta","3 dientes de ajo, pelados y picados, o finamente rallados hasta formar una pasta","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","pizca generosa de pimienta de cayena"]','["El día antes de comerlas, vierte las patatas en una cacerola con agua fría y añade la cúrcuma y una pizca de sal. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté cocido. Escurrir, dejar enfriar y luego enfriar durante la noche si es posible.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Rocíe 1 cucharada de aceite en una fuente para asar poco profunda (preferiblemente antiadherente) y colóquela en el horno. Vierta el resto del aceite en un bol grande y agregue el jengibre, el ajo, las semillas de hinojo y la pimienta de cayena. Vierta las patatas fritas frías en el tazón y revuelva suavemente con los dedos hasta que estén cubiertas uniformemente. Retirar la bandeja del horno y esparcir sobre las patatas fritas. Utilice una espátula para cubrir las patatas fritas con aceite caliente, luego colóquelas en una sola capa y ase durante 30 minutos. Use la espátula para voltear y luego regrese al horno durante 15 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15296,5988,'es','Rollitos de guisantes y patatas especiados','Un plato vegetariano súper saludable que aprovecha al máximo los alimentos básicos de tu despensa','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o aceite de girasol","2 cebollas, finamente cortadas","300 g de patatas, cortadas en cubos pequeños","1 cucharada colmada de pasta de curry","140 g de guisantes frescos o congelados","4 hojas grandes de masa filo, cortadas por la mitad","tomates, cebolla y chutney de mango, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nCalentar la mitad del aceite en una sartén antiadherente.\r\nsartén. Vierta las cebollas y cocine hasta que\r\nsuave y dorado, unos 8-10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, hervir los dados de patata durante\r\n5 minutos, hasta que estén tiernos, luego escurrir. consejo\r\nen las cebollas blandas y sofreír durante\r\n2 minutos más. Agregue la pasta de curry y\r\ncocine por 2 minutos. Agregue los guisantes y más\r\n1 cucharada de agua. Cocine por 1 min, déjelo\r\ntodo una buena mezcla y sazón. consejo\r\nen un bol para dejar que se enfríe un poco.","Cepille la mitad de las medias hojas de filo con\r\nun poco del aceite restante, luego coloque el\r\nhojas restantes encima para que tengas\r\n4 capas dobles. Vierta ¼ de\r\nmezcla de papa a lo largo de un borde de cada una,\r\ndejando un poco de espacio en cada extremo. doblar\r\nen los extremos y luego enrollar para sellar. Lugar\r\ncon la costura hacia abajo en una bandeja para hornear,\r\nuntar con el aceite restante y hornear\r\ndurante 20 minutos o hasta que esté crujiente. Servir caliente\r\ncon una cucharada de chutney de mango y un\r\nEnsalada de tomate y cebolla, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:07:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15297,5990,'es','Hummus de limón y cilantro','El hummus es muy fácil de hacer y siempre supera a las variedades compradas en las tiendas. Pruébalo con crudités de verduras en tu comida para llevar','["2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos en agua, escurridos","2 dientes de ajo gordos, picados en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de yogur griego","3 cucharadas de pasta tahini","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más extra","ralladura y jugo de 2 limones","paquete de 20 g de cilantro"]','["Pon todo menos el cilantro en\r\nun procesador de alimentos, luego pase a una velocidad bastante\r\nmezcla suave. Raspe los lados de\r\nel procesador si es necesario.","Sazone generosamente el hummus y luego\r\nagregue el cilantro y presione hasta aproximadamente\r\npicado. Vierta en un tazón para servir,\r\nrocíe con aceite de oliva y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:07:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15298,5994,'es','Salsa ahumada de chile chipotle','Lleva un tarrito de salsa en tu lonchera para disfrutar con crudités de verduras, chips de tortilla o pan pita.','["2 pimientos rojos, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","6 tomates maduros, cortados por la mitad","1 diente de ajo, machacado","jugo 1 lima","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharaditas de pasta de chipotle","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","Paquete de 20 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Ponga los pimientos en un\r\nbandeja para hornear, con la piel hacia arriba, cocine a la parrilla hasta que la piel\r\nestén negros, luego póngalos en un bol y tápelos.\r\nDéjelo hasta que se enfríe y luego quítele la piel.","Saque y deseche las semillas de tomate.\r\nColoque los tomates en un procesador de alimentos con\r\najo, jugo de limón, aceite y pasta de chipotle.\r\nAgregue los pimientos y luego presione hasta que estén gruesos. Revuelva\r\nPicar la cebolla y el cilantro y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15299,5996,'es','Gajos de camote harissa','Los chips de batata son una alternativa saludable y rica en fibra a los chips tradicionales, pero saben igual de bien (¡si no mejor!)','["1 kg de batatas, lavadas y cortadas en gajos","1 cucharada de pasta de harissa","crema agria y cebollino, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. En un\r\nEn un tazón grande, combine los gajos con el\r\nharissa. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear y cocine.\r\ndurante 40-45 minutos hasta que las patatas estén tiernas\r\ny crujiente en los bordes. Servir con\r\ncrema agria mezclada con cebollino picado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15300,6000,'es','Sopa de verduras de hojas verdes con crutones de halloumi con chile y miel','Prepare esta vibrante sopa verde con cualquier verdura de hoja verde o hierba que encuentre con descuento en el supermercado para un almuerzo nutritivo y económico.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla o manojo de cebolletas, finamente picadas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","3 patatas harinosas, de unos 500 g, sin pelar y cortadas en cubos de 2 cm","1 litro de caldo de verduras","100 g de crema fresca","300 g de verduras que ya no estén en su mejor momento (espinacas, hojas de lechuga, col rizada o cavolo nero), cortadas en trozos grandes","200 g de guisantes congelados","un puñado pequeño de hierbas suaves pasadas en su mejor estado, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de pasta de harissa","1 cucharada de miel","250 g de halloumi en bloque, cortado en cubos de 2 cm, escurrido y seco","masa madre tostada con mantequilla, para servir"]','["Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una cacerola grande y profunda a fuego medio-alto. Agregue la cebolla y una pizca de sal y cocine durante 6-8 minutos hasta que se ablanden los bordes. Agregue el ajo y las patatas y cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén fragantes. Vierta sobre el caldo y deje hervir a fuego lento. Déjelo burbujear durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que las patatas estén tiernas y luego vierta la crema fresca, las verduras y los guisantes congelados. Vuelva a hervir a fuego lento y cocine durante 4-5 minutos hasta que todas las verduras se hayan marchitado y la crema fresca se haya disuelto. Agregue las hierbas y, con una batidora de mano, mezcle hasta que quede suave. Estación.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite restante en una sartén. Agrega la harissa y la miel y deja que se derrita. Vierta en un tazón, luego agregue el halloumi a la sartén y dórelo por todos lados, revolviendo la sartén de vez en cuando durante 4-5 minutos. Regrese la mezcla de harissa a la sartén y revuelva rápidamente para cubrir el halloumi. Esparza los picatostes de halloumi encima de la sopa y sirva la masa madre a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15301,6002,'es','Sopa verde calmante','Agregue verduras a esta sopa saludable. Cubra con un chorrito de yogur, unas hojas de menta y pimienta negra. Es excelente recalentado para el almuerzo si te sobran.','["1½ cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas rojas, picadas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","2 calabacines, picados en trozos grandes","1 patata grande, de unos 300 g, pelada y picada en trozos grandes","1,3 litros de caldo de verduras, elaborado con una pastilla de caldo bajo en sal","250 g de guisantes congelados","400 g de espinacas tiernas","20 g de menta, picada en trozos grandes, dejando algunas hojas enteras (para servir)","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural desnatado, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y profunda y cocina las cebollas con una pizca de sal durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que se ablanden pero no se doren. Agregue el ajo, las semillas de comino, los calabacines y las patatas y cocine durante 5-6 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que se ablanden. Cubrir con el caldo y sazonar bien.","Llevar a ebullición, reducir a fuego lento y burbujear durante 15-20 minutos hasta que las patatas estén muy suaves.","Vierta los guisantes y ablande las espinacas en puñados. Espolvoree la menta picada y cocine por 3 minutos más, luego mezcle en una licuadora de alta potencia o con una batidora de mano. Sazone, luego divida en cuatro tazones y cubra con el yogur, las hojas de menta enteras restantes y un poco de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:07:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15302,6004,'es','Sopa de verduras con trozos','Prepara esta sopa de verduras para un almuerzo saludable. El requesón es el ingrediente secreto de las albóndigas sin gluten: una opción más saludable y que aporta calcio.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 puerros (350 g), en rodajas","3 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","300 g de patatas baby, en rodajas","1 litro de caldo de verduras elaborado con 2 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo (sin gluten, si es necesario)","250 g de espárragos, con los tallos cortados en trozos y las puntas separadas","160 g de habas o habas de soja baby congeladas","Lata de 400 g de judías borlotti escurridas","4 tomates, picados","Paquete de 30g de albahaca, tallos y hojas separados y finamente picados","300 g de requesón en tarrina","75 g de harina (de garbanzos) tamizada","1 huevo batido","3 cucharadas de tallos y hojas de albahaca (tomado de los 30 g de los ingredientes de la sopa anteriores)"]','["Primero, haz las albóndigas. Vierta el requesón en un tazón y triture para suavizar un poco. Agrega la harina, el huevo y la albahaca, luego deja reposar durante unos 10 minutos para que la harina absorba la humedad.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe los puerros, el ajo y las patatas durante 10-15 minutos, o hasta que se ablanden. Vierta sobre el caldo, luego agregue los tallos de espárragos, todos los frijoles, los tomates y el resto de los tallos de albahaca. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego a fuego lento, tapar y cocinar a fuego medio durante 10 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas. Agregue las puntas de los espárragos y las hojas de albahaca restantes y cocine unos minutos más. Dejar de lado.","Caliente una sartén profunda llena de agua a fuego lento, luego use una bola de helado para colocar ocho bolas de masa en el agua hirviendo. Cocine durante 5 minutos o hasta que las bolas de masa suban a la superficie.","Para servir, divida dos porciones de sopa en tazones y cubra cada uno con dos bolas de masa. Guarde el resto para otro día. Se mantendrá frío en un recipiente hermético durante cuatro días. Vuelva a calentar en una sartén durante 10 minutos a fuego lento hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15303,6006,'es','Sopa de puerro y brócoli con bollos de queso','Apoye la buena salud intestinal y la digestión con vegetales Brassica, como el brócoli. Sirva un plato de brócoli con bollos de queso usando esta receta','["375 g de puerros cortados en rodajas finas","400 g de patatas peladas y cortadas en trozos medianos","2 dientes de ajo, picados","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","340 g de brócoli, picado en trozos grandes","250ml de leche","165 g de harina integral normal","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","20 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, finamente rallado","1 cucharadita de mostaza en polvo","100ml de leche","½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","65 g de queso de cabra tierno","4 tomates, rebanados, para servir"]','["Coloca los puerros, las patatas y el ajo en una cacerola grande con el caldo. Vierta 800 ml de agua hirviendo, revuelva bien, cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos.","Agrega el brócoli a la sartén, luego tapa y cocina por 5 minutos más hasta que esté tierno. Bate con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave, luego vierte la leche y vuelve a batir. Agregue un poco de caldo si la sopa parece demasiado espesa.","Para hacer los bollos, calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y forra una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Ponga la harina y el polvo de hornear en un bol con todo menos 1 cucharada de parmesano y toda la mostaza en polvo. Añade poco a poco la leche y el aceite, removiendo con un cuchillo hasta que la mezcla se una. Forme un tronco, de unos 16 cm de largo y 6 cm de ancho, y presione el queso parmesano restante encima. Corte por la mitad a lo largo, luego vuelva a dividir por la mitad cada una de esas piezas para crear cuatro bollos en forma de cuña. Coloca los bollos en la bandeja y hornea durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén dorados.","Si sigue el Plan de dieta saludable, reserve dos de los bollos para otro día. Se mantendrán cubiertos hasta por tres días. Corta los dos restantes por la mitad y cubre con la mitad del queso de cabra y la mitad del tomate. Sirva la mitad de la sopa en dos tazones y sírvala con los bollos. El resto de la sopa se mantendrá fría hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:07:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15304,6008,'es','Sopa de tomate y albahaca','Combine tomates afrutados secos con tomates enlatados para hacer esta rica sopa de tomate con pesto de albahaca casera, perfecta para lo más crudo del invierno.','["1 cucharada de mantequilla o aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo machacados","5 tomates suaves secados al sol o SunBlush en aceite, picados en trozos grandes","3 latas de 400 g de tomates pera","500 ml de caldo de pavo o de verduras","1 cucharadita de azúcar, cualquier tipo, o más al gusto","Bote de 142 ml de crema agria","125 g de pesto de albahaca fresca en bote","hojas de albahaca, para servir"]','["Calentar la mantequilla o el aceite en una sartén grande, luego agregar el ajo y sofreír unos minutos a fuego lento. Agregue los tomates secos o SunBlush, los tomates enlatados, el caldo, el azúcar y los condimentos, luego cocine a fuego lento. Deje que la sopa burbujee durante 10 minutos hasta que los tomates se hayan descompuesto un poco.","Batir con una batidora y agregar la mitad de la crema agria a medida que avanza. Pruebe y ajuste la sazón; agregue más azúcar si es necesario. Sirva en tazones con 1 cucharada aproximadamente de pesto encima, un poco más de crema agria y espolvoree con hojas de albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:07:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15305,6010,'es','Sopa de brócoli de brotes morados, suero de leche y queso azul','Aproveche al máximo el brócoli de temporada con esta vibrante sopa, ideal para el almuerzo o una cena ligera servida con pan crujiente caliente. Adorne con una pizca de semillas mixtas y cebollino.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","1 cebolla, picada en trozos grandes","1 rama de apio, picada en trozos grandes","1 patata grande (unos 300 g), cortada en cubos de 2 cm","250 g de brócoli morado (tallos, floretes y hojas), picado en trozos grandes","1,1 litros de caldo de verduras o pollo","100 ml de suero de leche","100 g de queso azul, desmenuzado","3 cucharadas de crema doble","½ limón, exprimido","30 g de semillas mixtas","½ manojo pequeño de cebollino, finamente picado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cazuela o cazo ignífugo a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla y el apio con una pizca de sal durante 10 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Añade las patatas, el brócoli y el caldo y deja hervir a fuego lento. Tape y cocine durante 20-25 minutos, o hasta que los tallos gruesos de brócoli estén lo suficientemente tiernos como para perforarlos con un cuchillo para cubiertos. Retirar del fuego y añadir la mitad del suero de leche y 80 g de queso azul. Mezcle todo con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Sazone al gusto, luego agregue la crema, el resto del suero de leche y el jugo de limón.","Sirva la sopa en los tazones y cubra con el resto del queso, las semillas, el cebollino y un chorrito de aceite de oliva, luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:07:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15306,6012,'es','Sopa picante de calabaza','Aproveche al máximo la calabaza de temporada a principios de otoño y pruebe una sopa de calabaza picante. También puedes tostar las semillas y agregarlas como aderezo.','["1 calabaza, aproximadamente 1,5-2 kg (guarde las semillas; tuéstelas en una sartén seca para servir)","1 cucharada de garam masala","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","½-1 cucharadita de chile en hojuelas o en polvo, más una pizca","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","jengibre, pelado y finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","900 ml de caldo de verduras","100 ml de nata doble o crème fraiche, más un poco más para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Cortar la calabaza por la mitad y quitarle las semillas con una cuchara (ver consejo a continuación). Cortarla en gajos o trozos (mantener la piel puesta) y verter en un bol. Coloque el garam masala y 1 cucharadita de cilantro y comino en un tazón pequeño y mezcle con 2 cucharadas de aceite y sazone. Rocíe sobre la calabaza y revuelva bien para cubrirla con el aceite especiado. Transfiera a una bandeja para hornear, extiéndala uniformemente y ase durante 40-45 minutos, volteándola a la mitad de la cocción, hasta que la calabaza esté muy suave al pincharla con un tenedor. Dejar enfriar en la bandeja unos minutos.","Calentar la cucharada restante de aceite de oliva en una cacerola grande y sofreír la cebolla con una pizca de sal durante 10 minutos hasta que esté blanda. Añade el jengibre, el ajo, las especias restantes y las hojuelas de chile y sofríe unos minutos más hasta que estén fragantes. Vierta el caldo y cocine a fuego lento.","Cuando la calabaza esté lo suficientemente fría como para tocarla, use una cuchara para quitar la pulpa suave de la piel. Agrega la calabaza blanda a la fuente de caldo, desechando la piel. Retirar del fuego y batir la sopa con una batidora de mano hasta que quede cremosa y suave. Sazone al gusto, agregando más chile o garam masala si lo desea. Vuelva a poner a fuego lento y agregue la nata. Llevar a fuego lento y luego servir en tazones con un chorrito más de crema y una pizca de chile para servir. Cubra con semillas de calabaza tostadas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15307,6014,'es','Sopa de salchicha de pavo y pesto','Cocine algunas salchichas de pavo o pollo y combínelas con frijoles cannellini, col rizada y pesto para hacer esta sopa abundante. Sirva con pan crujiente, si lo desea.','["6 salchichas de pavo o pollo","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar (opcional)","1 cebolla, finamente cortada","2 dientes de ajo grandes, en rodajas finas","800 ml de caldo de verduras","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","100 g de hojas de col rizada, sin tallos leñosos","½ limón, exprimido","60 g de pesto verde","pan crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Exprime la carne de la piel de las salchichas y córtala en trozos pequeños. Deseche las pieles. Calienta el aceite en una cacerola amplia a fuego medio-bajo. Una vez caliente, agregue la carne de la salchicha y cocine, aplastándola con una espátula, hasta que esté dorada y ligeramente crujiente, aproximadamente de 6 a 7 minutos. Retirar de la sartén, transferir a un bol y tapar.","Agrega la cebolla a la sartén, con un chorrito extra de aceite si la sartén parece seca, y cocina durante 4-5 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agregue el ajo y cocine por 1 min. Vierta el caldo, raspando para aflojar los trozos pegados en el fondo. Vuelva a agregar la salchicha junto con los frijoles y cocine a fuego lento. Cocine por otros 10 minutos, agregue la col rizada en dos tandas y cocine por 2-3 minutos más hasta que se ablande un poco. Agrega el jugo de limón y sazona ligeramente con sal y una buena cantidad de pimienta negra.","Retire la sopa del fuego, divídala en tazones y cubra con una cucharada de pesto. Rocíe un poco de aceite y sirva con pan crujiente, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15308,6016,'es','Sopa de brócoli y guisantes con ricotta de menta','Prepare esta sopa de brócoli y guisantes para el almuerzo o como entrante, y cúbrala con ricotta con menta y piñones. Un plato saludable que te ofrece tres de tus cinco comidas al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 ramas de apio, picadas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","200 g de brócoli, partido en floretes","150 g de guisantes frescos o congelados","500 ml de caldo de verduras caliente bajo en sal","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","100 g de ricota","1 cucharada de menta finamente picada, más unas cuantas hojas enteras para servir","1 cucharada de piñones tostados","2 rebanadas de pan, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cazuela ignífuga y sofreír la cebolla y el apio durante 10 minutos. Agrega el ajo y sofríe 1 min más.","Agregue el brócoli, los guisantes y el caldo, cocine a fuego lento y cocine tapado durante 10 a 15 minutos, o hasta que el brócoli esté tierno. Vierta la mezcla en una licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave, o use una batidora de mano. Estación. Agrega la mitad de la ralladura de limón y el jugo, luego prueba y agrega el resto, si lo deseas.","Mezclar la ricota con la menta y una pizca de sal. Sirva la sopa en tazones y luego cubra con la ricotta con menta y los piñones. Rocíe con aceite de oliva extra y espolvoree con hojas de menta, luego sirva con pan de molde, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15309,6018,'es','Sopa de pollo en olla de cocción lenta','Coloque los ingredientes para esta sopa de pollo en la olla de cocción lenta por la mañana y estará lista a la hora de la cena. Agrega fideos al final, si quieres.','["1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","2 zanahorias, picadas en trozos de 1½ cm","2 puerros, partidos por la mitad y en rodajas","1 hoja de laurel y 3 ramitas de tomillo, unidas","1 pollo entero mediano (aproximadamente 1,4 kg)","2 litros de caldo de pollo","1 limón, exprimido","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo o perejil, finamente picado","pan crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Pon tu olla de cocción lenta a fuego lento. Agregue la cebolla, el apio, las zanahorias y los puerros y agregue el manojo de hierbas. Coloque el pollo encima de las verduras y vierta sobre el caldo. Cocine durante 6-8 horas.","Retire el pollo de la olla de cocción lenta y transfiéralo a una tabla. Triture la carne de los huesos con dos tenedores, luego devuelva la carne a la olla de cocción lenta, desechando los huesos. Sazone al gusto y revuelva con el jugo de limón.","Retire y deseche el manojo de hierbas. Sirva la sopa en tazones y cubra con eneldo o perejil. Sirva con pan crujiente, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15310,6020,'es','Sopa de puerro, col rizada y patatas cubierta con patatas fritas','Prepare nuestra saludable sopa de puerros, col rizada y patatas para un almuerzo o cena vegetariana fácil. Cubra con papas fritas para darle un toque crujiente.','["4 patatas grandes (unos 500 g), 3 peladas y cortadas en cubos, 1 entera con piel","1 cucharada de aceite de colza prensado en frío","15 g de mantequilla","5 puerros (unos 500 g), lavados y cortados en medias lunas","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1½ l de caldo de verduras (nosotros utilizamos caldo)","Otros 200 g","2 cucharadas de crema fresca media grasa"]','["Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y forra una bandeja para hornear con papel pergamino. Corta la papa entera en palitos con un pelador en juliana, o afeita rodajas finas con un pelador de verduras y luego córtala en palitos. Seque con papel de cocina y luego mezcle con aceite y un poco de condimento. Extiéndalo en la bandeja y ase durante 15-18 minutos.","Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola grande. Añade los puerros, las patatas picadas y una pizca de sal, luego cocina a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que los puerros se ablanden. Agregue el ajo y cocine por 1 minuto más, luego vierta el caldo. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10-12 minutos hasta que las patatas estén suaves, luego agregue la col rizada y cocine durante 2-3 minutos para que se ablanden.","Agregue la crema fresca, luego mezcle con una batidora de mano y sazone al gusto. Divida la sopa en tazones y cubra con las papas fritas."]','2026-01-11 13:07:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15311,6022,'es','Sopa de lentejas, chirivías y manzana al curry','Esta sopa picante combina lentejas rojas, manzanas y chirivías para obtener una sopa suave y cálida: una comida baja en grasas que puedes preparar con anticipación y congelar.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry mediana","2 cebollas medianas, picadas en trozos grandes","500 g de chirivías (unas 5 chirivías medianas), peladas y cortadas en trozos","140 g de lentejas rojas secas","2 manzanas Bramley (unos 400 g), peladas, sin corazón y cortadas en trozos","1½ l de caldo de verduras o de pollo, elaborado con 1 pastilla de caldo","yogur natural, para servir (opcional)","cilantro picado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande. Freír la pasta de curry y la cebolla a fuego medio durante 3 minutos, revolviendo. Añade las chirivías, las lentejas y los trozos de manzana. Vierta sobre el caldo y deje hervir a fuego lento. Reduzca un poco el fuego y cocine durante 30 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que las chirivías estén muy suaves y las lentejas blandas.","Retirar del fuego y batir con una batidora hasta que quede suave. (O déjelo enfriar durante unos minutos y luego mezcle en un procesador de alimentos). Ajuste el condimento al gusto. Calentar suavemente y luego servir en tazones hondos. Sirve con yogurt natural y decora con cilantro fresco, si lo deseas. (Para obtener instrucciones sobre congelación, consulte la parte inferior izquierda)."]','2026-01-11 13:07:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15312,6026,'es','Sopa De Coliflor Y Queso','Dale un nuevo giro a este reconfortante clásico mezclándolo en una sopa suave y cremosa.','["nuez de mantequilla","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","1 coliflor grande (aproximadamente 900 g/2 lb), con las hojas recortadas y cortadas en floretes","1 papa, pelada y cortada en trozos","700 ml de caldo de verduras (en cubitos está bien)","400ml de leche","100 g de queso cheddar maduro, cortado en cubitos"]','["Calienta la mantequilla en una cacerola grande. Agregue la cebolla y cocine hasta que se ablande, aproximadamente 5 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia. Agrega la coliflor, la papa, el caldo, la leche y el condimento. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego y dejar cocinar a fuego lento durante unos 30 minutos hasta que la coliflor esté suave y la papa casi colapsada.","Batir en un procesador de alimentos o triturar con un machacador de papas hasta obtener una sopa espesa y cremosa. Complete con más leche para diluir un poco si sirve en tazas. Puede prepararlo con hasta 2 días de anticipación, enfriar, tapar y dejar en el refrigerador hasta que lo necesite, o congelarlo por hasta 1 mes. Cuando esté listo para servir, caliente, sirva en tazas o tazones, cubra con los trozos de queso y luego revuelva antes de comer."]','2026-01-11 13:07:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15313,6028,'es','Sopa cremosa de pescado y mejillones','Un guiso de pescado saludable que sólo lleva 30 minutos','["Paquete de 500 g de mejillones en salsa cremosa (encuéntrelos en el pasillo de productos refrigerados)","1 litro de caldo de pescado fuerte y caliente (nosotros utilizamos el concentrado Knorr Touch of Taste)","500 g de patatas harinosas, cortadas en trozos del tamaño de un terrón de azúcar","200 g de pescado mixto","manojo pequeño de perejil de hoja plana"]','["Escurrir la salsa de los mejillones en un\r\ncacerola grande y agregue el caldo. Consejo en el\r\npatatas, tapar y llevar a ebullición. una vez\r\nhirviendo, retire la tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante aproximadamente\r\n12 mins o hasta que las patatas estén bien tiernas.","Mientras tanto, corta el pescado en trozos grandes.\r\ny picar el perejil en trozos grandes. revuelve el pescado\r\ny mejillones a la sopa, luego agregue\r\nvolver a hervir a fuego lento durante unos 3 minutos o\r\nhasta que el pescado haya cambiado de color y\r\nse desmenuza fácilmente. Agregue la mayor parte del\r\nperejil, luego sírvalo esparcido\r\ncon el resto del perejil\r\ny comer con pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15314,6030,'es','Sopa de calabaza al jerez','Una buena sopa pronto se convierte en una receta infalible para cualquier ocasión. Siempre puedes perderte el jerez si lo preparas para niños.','["1 cebolla grande, cortada a la mitad","4 cucharadas de jerez seco (fino)","1 kg de calabaza pelada, sin semillas y picada","600 ml de caldo de verduras caliente (a nosotros nos gusta la caléndula)","Crutones de pan de semillas y perejil de hoja plana","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Freír la cebolla en el aceite durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agregue el jerez y la calabaza y cocine a fuego lento durante 1-2 minutos. Vierta el caldo, luego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que la calabaza esté tierna al pincharla con un cuchillo.","Batir en un procesador de alimentos hasta que quede suave. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante 2 días o se congelará durante 6 semanas. Cuando esté listo para comer, vuelva a calentar hasta que burbujee y sirva en porciones pequeñas cubiertas con croûtons de pan de semillas (ver arriba a la derecha) y una ramita de perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:07:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15315,6032,'es','Sopa de tomate','Para preparar la sopa de tomate más sabrosa que jamás haya probado, espere hasta que los tomates estén más maduros y jugosos, alrededor de septiembre.','["1-1¼kg/2lb 4oz-2lb 12oz tomates maduros","1 cebolla mediana","1 zanahoria pequeña","1 rama de apio","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 chorritos de puré de tomate (unas 2 cucharaditas)","una buena pizca de azúcar","2 hojas de laurel","1,2 litros/ 2 pintas de caldo de verduras caliente (elaborado con agua hirviendo y 4 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo o 2 cubitos de caldo)"]','["En primer lugar, prepara tus verduras. Necesita 1-1,25 kg/2 lb 4 oz-2 lb 12 oz de tomates maduros. Si los tomates están en rama, quítelos. Los trozos de tallos verdes deberían desprenderse al mismo tiempo, pero si no lo hacen, simplemente tírelos o gírelos después. Tira las ramas y los trozos verdes y lava los tomates. Ahora corte cada tomate en cuartos y corte los núcleos duros (no se ablandan durante la cocción y al final quedarán trozos duros en la sopa). Pela 1 cebolla mediana y 1 zanahoria pequeña y pícalas en trozos pequeños. Pica 1 rama de apio aproximadamente del mismo tamaño.","Vierta 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva en una sartén grande de base pesada y caliéntela a fuego lento. Mantenga su mano sobre la sartén hasta que pueda sentir el calor que sale del aceite, luego agregue la cebolla, la zanahoria y el apio y mézclelos con una cuchara de madera. Aún con el fuego bajo, cocina las verduras hasta que estén suaves y con un color tenue. Esto debería tomar unos 10 minutos y debes revolverlos dos o tres veces para que se cocinen uniformemente y no se peguen al fondo de la sartén.","Sosteniendo el tubo sobre la sartén, agregue aproximadamente 2 cucharaditas de puré de tomate, luego revuelva para que las verduras se pongan rojas. Retire los tomates de la tabla de cortar, espolvoree una buena pizca de azúcar y muela un poco de pimienta negra. Corte 2 hojas de laurel en unos cuantos trozos y tírelas a la sartén. Remueve para mezclar todo, tapa la sartén y deja que los tomates se cocinen a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que se encojan en la sartén y su jugo fluya bien. De vez en cuando, agite bien la sartén, esto mantendrá todo bien mezclado.","Vierta lentamente los 1,2 litros/2 pintas de caldo caliente (elaborado con agua hirviendo y 4 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo o 2 cubitos de caldo), revolviendo al mismo tiempo para mezclarlo con las verduras. Sube el fuego al máximo y espera hasta que todo esté burbujeando, luego baja el fuego nuevamente y vuelve a tapar la sartén. Cocine a fuego lento durante 25 minutos, revolviendo un par de veces. Al final de la cocción los tomates se habrán descompuesto y tendrán un aspecto muy fangoso.","Retire la sartén del fuego, retire la tapa y retírese unos segundos más o menos mientras se escapa el vapor, luego saque los trozos de laurel y tírelos. Vierta la sopa en la licuadora hasta que esté llena aproximadamente tres cuartas partes, cierre bien la tapa y encienda la máquina al máximo. Mezcle hasta que la sopa esté suave (detenga la máquina y levante la tapa para comprobarlo después de unos 30 segundos), luego vierta la sopa en puré en un tazón grande. Repita con la sopa que queda en la sartén. (La sopa ahora se puede congelar hasta por 3 meses. Descongélela antes de recalentarla).","Vuelve a verter la sopa en puré en la sartén y vuelve a calentarla a fuego medio durante unos minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que veas que las burbujas rompen suavemente en la superficie. Prueba una cucharada y agrega una pizca o dos de sal si crees que la sopa lo necesita, además de más pimienta y azúcar si lo deseas. Si el color no es lo suficientemente rojo para ti, agrega otra cucharadita de puré de tomate y revuelve hasta que se disuelva. Sirva en tazones y sirva. O colar y servir frío con un poco de crema. Para otras sugerencias de presentación, consulte el lado opuesto."]','2026-01-11 13:07:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15316,6034,'es','Sopa de zanahoria con miel','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. A los niños les encanta esta rica y cálida sopa, pero también es lo suficientemente sofisticada para los adultos.','["2 cucharadas de mantequilla","2 puerros pequeños, rebanados","800 g de zanahorias, picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de miel clara","una pizca pequeña de hojuelas de chile seco (opcional)","1 hoja de laurel","2½ l de caldo de verduras","crema agria o yogur, para servir"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola grande a fuego medio. Añade los puerros a la sartén y cocina durante 3 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agregue las zanahorias, la miel, el chile (si lo usa) y la hoja de laurel, luego cocine por 2 minutos.","Vierta el caldo, lleve a ebullición y cocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos. Licue la sopa en tandas, vuelva a colocarla en una cacerola limpia y luego sazone al gusto. Cuando esté listo para servir, vuelva a hervir a fuego lento y luego sirva en tazas. Agregue un remolino de crema agria o yogur y sirva con pan de ajo o tocino."]','2026-01-11 13:07:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15317,9458,'es','Ensalada de atún, espárragos y judías blancas','Una nutritiva ensalada primaveral, lista en minutos','["1 manojo grande de espárragos","2 latas de filetes de atún en agua, escurridos","2 latas de frijoles cannellini en agua, escurridos","1 cebolla morada, muy finamente picada","2 cucharadas de alcaparras","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","2 cucharadas de estragón, finamente picado"]','["Cocine los espárragos en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo durante 4-5 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir bien, enfriar con agua corriente y luego cortar en trozos del tamaño de un dedo. Mezcle el atún, los frijoles, la cebolla, las alcaparras y los espárragos en un tazón grande para servir.","Mezcle el aceite, el vinagre y el estragón y luego viértalo sobre la ensalada. Enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15318,6038,'es','Caja de ensalada de atún y espárragos al limón','Una nueva versión de la clásica ensalada Niçoise. Esta ensalada magra se complementa con frijoles cannellini de la despensa y se condimenta con eneldo y limón.','["2 huevos grandes","200 g de espárragos, sin las puntas leñosas y cortados por la mitad","Lata de 160g de atún en agua de manantial (no es necesario escurrir)","1 cebolla morada pequeña, muy finamente picada","125 g de frijoles cannellini de lata, escurridos","ralladura y jugo de ½ limón","1 cucharada de eneldo fresco picado","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Poner una cacerola con agua a hervir con una vaporera encima. Cuando hierva, sumerja los huevos en el agua y cocine al vapor los espárragos por encima durante 8 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle suavemente todos los demás ingredientes y colóquelos en platos o recipientes rígidos. Sumerge los huevos en agua fría para que se enfríen un poco, luego pélalos y córtalos en cuartos. Agrega los huevos y los espárragos a la ensalada de atún. Se conservará en el frigorífico durante 2 días."]','2026-01-11 13:07:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15319,6040,'es','Ensalada de frijoles, jamón y huevo','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta ensalada satisfactoria, repleta de vegetales verdes, papas nuevas y jamón magro, es baja en calorías y grasas.','["2 huevos, duros","500 g de patatas baby","200 g de judías verdes","200 g de guisantes congelados y descongelados","175 g de jamón magro, rallado","jugo ½ limón","1 cucharada de mostaza integral","1 cucharada de miel","pan crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Pelar y cortar en cuartos los huevos. Cocine el\r\npatatas en una cacerola grande con agua hirviendo durante\r\n8-10 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Consejo en los frijoles\r\ndurante los últimos 3 minutos, luego agregue los guisantes durante\r\nel minuto final. Escurrir todas las verduras, dejar enfriar\r\nagua corriente fría, luego escurrir muy bien.","Para el aderezo, mezcla el jugo, la mostaza\r\ny miel juntos. Sazone, luego vierta\r\nsobre las verduras. Doblar el jamón y cubrir\r\ncon los huevos. Sirva con pan, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15320,6044,'es','Macetas de merengue de ruibarbo y fresa','Una delicia baja en grasas, sabrosa, ligera y esponjosa','["450 g de ruibarbo, cortado en trozos de 4 cm/1½ pulgadas","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura de 1 naranja","1 cucharada de conserva de fresa","2 huevos, separados"]','["Precalentar el horno a 180C/\r\nHorno a gas 4/ventilador 160C. poner\r\nel ruibarbo en un\r\nfuente refractaria, espolvorear\r\nmás de 50 g/2 oz\r\ndel azúcar y la naranja\r\nralladura y revuelva. Portada\r\ny hornear en el horno durante\r\n35-40 minutos hasta\r\ntierno. (Alternativamente, usted\r\npuede\r\ncocinar el ruibarbo con el\r\nazúcar y ralladura en el\r\nmicroondas durante 10 minutos\r\na máxima potencia, revolviendo\r\na mitad de la cocción\r\ntiempo,\r\nhasta que esté apenas tierno.)","Retire el ruibarbo de\r\nal horno y dejar enfriar\r\nligeramente. Agregue el\r\nconservar luego las yemas de huevo.\r\nDividir el ruibarbo\r\nmezcla entre cuatro\r\nMoldes de 175 ml/6 onzas líquidas.\r\nPoner en una bandeja para hornear y\r\ncocinar en\r\nal horno por 10 minutos\r\nhasta que espese ligeramente.","Mientras el ruibarbo es\r\ncocinando, batir el huevo\r\nlas claras hasta que estén firmes. espolvorear\r\nmás de la mitad\r\ndel azúcar restante y\r\nbatir de nuevo. Doblar suavemente\r\nel resto del azúcar. pila\r\nel merengue encima del\r\nruibarbo para cubrirlo\r\ncompletamente y agitar la parte superior. Regrese al horno por 10 minutos hasta que el merengue esté esponjoso y dorado. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15321,6048,'es','Patatas asadas rellenas','Una receta sencilla de patatas al horno para que los niños entren en la cocina: es fácil de seguir y excelente para enseñar','["4 patatas medianas","100 g de queso cheddar fuerte rallado y un poco más para cubrir","100 g de maíz dulce","100 g de pimientos mixtos, cortados en cubitos","un puñado pequeño de hierbas frescas, como orégano, albahaca, cilantro, eneldo o tomillo"]','["Equipo que necesitarás: mediano\r\ntazón para mezclar, tazón pequeño para mezclar,\r\ncuchara de postre, tenedor, bandeja para hornear,\r\nrallador, manoplas para horno.","Haz que un adulto caliente el horno.\r\na 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y hornear el\r\npatatas durante aproximadamente 1 hora hasta que estén cocidas\r\ny la piel queda crujiente. dejar enfriar\r\ncompletamente. Esto se puede hacer hasta\r\n2 días de antelación.","Para rellenar las patatas asadas, calentar la\r\nhorno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Pregunte a un\r\nadulto para cortar las patatas por la mitad. Usando\r\nuna cuchara, saque con cuidado el centro\r\nde la patata, dejando la piel intacta\r\n(como un barco). Colocar la patata cortada\r\nen un tazón para mezclar.","Con el tenedor, triture la papa hasta\r\nno hay grumos. Agrega el queso,\r\nel maíz dulce y los pimientos y mezclar bien.\r\nRecoge con cuidado las hojas de las hierbas.\r\nPuedes cortar las hojas más grandes en más pequeñas.\r\npiezas. Agrega las hierbas al queso.\r\nmezcla de papa.","Con la cuchara, saque con cuidado la\r\nmezcla nuevamente en los botes de papa. hacer\r\nAsegúrate de usar toda la mezcla.\r\nEspolvorear con un poco más de queso rallado.\r\ny colocar en una bandeja para hornear. Usando horno\r\nguantes, introducir la bandeja en el horno y\r\nhornee durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15322,6050,'es','Gachas de manzana y pasas','Un desayuno bajo en grasas con avena caliente y fruta que comienza el día de forma nutritiva y saciante.','["100 g de gachas de avena","500ml de leche desnatada","4 manzanas, sin corazón y cortadas en cubitos","100g de pasas","1 cucharada de azúcar morena, para servir"]','["Pon la avena y la leche en una cacerola pequeña y\r\ncocine, revolviendo, durante 3 minutos hasta que casi\r\ncremoso. Agregue las manzanas y las pasas,\r\nluego cocine por 2 minutos más o hasta que\r\nla papilla es espesa y cremosa y la\r\nlas manzanas simplemente tiernas. Sirva en tazones,\r\nespolvorear con azúcar y comer inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:07:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15323,6052,'es','Pollo marroquí en una olla','Una cazuela de pollo del norte de África baja en grasa, repleta de verduras y aromatizada con harissa','["4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente cortada","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry.","2 cucharadas de pasta de harissa (usamos Belazu Rose Harissa)","1 cucharada de miel clara","2 calabacines medianos, en rodajas gruesas","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados"]','["Sazone las pechugas de pollo por todas partes.\r\ncon el comino y mucho negro molido\r\npimienta. Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande.\r\nsartén y cocinar el pollo con\r\nla cebolla durante 4 min. voltear el pollo\r\nVoltee y cocine por 3 minutos más.\r\nRevuelve las cebollas alrededor del pollo.\r\nregularmente mientras cocinan.","Volcar los tomates y 250ml de agua.\r\nen la sartén y agregue la harissa,\r\nmiel, calabacines y garbanzos.\r\nLlevar a fuego lento y cocinar.\r\ndurante 15 minutos hasta que el pollo esté tierno\r\ny la salsa se ha espesado un poco."]','2026-01-11 13:07:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15324,5052,'es','Ensalada picante de rábanos','Los rábanos picantes añaden un toque crujiente a esta sabrosa ensalada de salmón ahumado','["2 naranjas","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","½ cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en rodajas finas","Bolsa de 200 g de rábanos, en rodajas finas","200 g de salmón ahumado","Bolsa de 75 g de berros.","pan integral, para servir"]','["Segmentar las naranjas sobre una ensalada.\r\ntazón, permitiendo que los gajos y cualquier\r\nque el jugo caiga en el recipiente. Agregue el\r\nvinagre, cebolla y rábanos, agrega un poco\r\nSazone y deje reposar durante 5 minutos.","Divida el salmón ahumado en 4\r\nplatos. Echar los berros por el\r\nmezcla de rábanos, luego ponga un puñado encima\r\nel salmón, asegurándote de tener un\r\nun poco de todo en cada plato. servir\r\ncon el jugo del tazón vertido\r\nencima y un poco de pan integral si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:07:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15325,6056,'es','Pasta con tomates chili y espinacas','Una cena baja en grasas con sabrosa salsa de tomate y penne: derrita una bolsa entera de espinacas para obtener nutrientes adicionales','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile seco","200 g de pasta penne integral","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","100 ml de vino tinto","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","Bolsa de 125 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca.","25 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente.\r\ny sofreír la cebolla, el ajo y la guindilla\r\nhojuelas, revolviendo regularmente, durante 5 minutos (agregue\r\nun poco de agua si empiezan a pegarse).","Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.\r\nAgrega los tomates, el vino y el orégano.\r\na la sartén y revuelva para combinar.\r\nLlevar a fuego lento y cocinar,\r\nrevolviendo ocasionalmente, durante 10 minutos.","Agita las espinacas en la sartén.\r\ny cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que\r\nmarchito. Escurrir la pasta y volcar\r\nen la sartén con la salsa.\r\nMezcle para combinar, espolvoree\r\ncon queso y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15326,6058,'es','Ensalada de trucha ahumada con hinojo, manzana y remolacha','El delicado pescado ahumado en caliente se complementa perfectamente con crujientes sabores de manzana y anís: un excelente bocado ligero.','["½ bulbo de hinojo pequeño, recortado y en rodajas finas","1 manzana de piel verde, sin corazón, en cuartos y en rodajas","4 cebolletas, cortadas en diagonal","100 g de remolacha tierna en vinagre suave, escurrida y cortada en cuartos","140 g de filetes de trucha ahumada en caliente sin piel","manojo pequeño de eneldo, sin hojas","2 cucharadas de yogur natural desnatado","1 cucharadita de salsa de rábano picante"]','["Pon el hinojo en una ración poco profunda.\r\nplato y esparcir sobre la manzana, primavera\r\ncebollas y remolachas. Desmenuzar la trucha\r\nen trozos grandes y colóquelos encima.\r\nEspolvorea con la mitad de las hojas de eneldo. finamente\r\nPica las hojas restantes y reserva.","Mezclar el yogur y el rábano picante con\r\n1 cucharada de agua fría, luego agregue el\r\neneldo reservado. Vierta la mitad del aderezo\r\nla ensalada y revuelva muy ligeramente. Cuchara\r\nsobre el aderezo restante y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15327,6060,'es','Tostada de pavo y aguacate','Combine una capa de aguacate cremoso con pavo bajo en grasa, rico en proteínas, para obtener un excelente refrigerio saludable que aumenta la energía.','["1 aguacate","jugo ½ lima","2-3 rebanadas pequeñas de pan ciabatta","100 g de lonchas de pavo"]','["Corta el aguacate por la mitad y deshuesado, luego raspa la pulpa y colócala en un bol. Exprime la lima, sazona y luego tritúrala con un tenedor. Tuesta la ciabatta, unta con puré de aguacate, cubre con pavo y termina con pimienta negra molida."]','2026-01-11 13:07:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15328,6062,'es','Pastel filo de calabaza y espinacas','Este pastel crujiente cubierto de masa está repleto de verduras, por lo que contiene las 5 cantidades diarias recomendadas.','["1 calabaza (aproximadamente 1 kg), pelada, sin semillas y cortada en dados de 2 cm","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","400 g de bolsa de espinacas","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","4 láminas de masa filo","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","ensalada verde, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nPoner la calabaza, la cebolla y las hojuelas de chile.\r\nen un molde para pastel apto para horno (o 4 individuales\r\nplatos). Sazone y cocine por 20 minutos.\r\nhasta que la calabaza esté tierna y las cebollas\r\nestán empezando a carbonizarse en los bordes.","Mientras tanto, poner las espinacas en un\r\ncolador y verter sobre una tetera de\r\nagua hirviendo. Exprima cualquier exceso\r\nlíquido y agregue la mezcla de calabaza. Punto\r\nsobre el queso feta, arrugar la masa y\r\ncolóquelo encima y luego unte con el aceite.\r\nRegrese al horno y cocine por un tiempo más.\r\n15 minutos hasta que la masa esté dorada y\r\ncrujiente. Sirva con una ensalada verde, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15329,6064,'es','Col rizada salteada con chile y ajo','Una manera rápida y fácil de darle un toque a la col rizada: sírvela con bistec, pollo y comidas orientales.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","Bolsa de 200 g de col rizada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas"]','["Calienta el aceite en un wok grande, luego agrega el\r\ncol rizada y un par de cucharadas de agua. temporada,\r\nluego sofreír durante 5-8 minutos, agregando el ajo\r\ny chile durante los últimos 2 minutos. cuando el\r\nla col rizada es tierna y de un verde vibrante,\r\nretirar del fuego y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15330,6068,'es','Almejas al vapor en caldo de azafrán y verdes tiernos','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Actualice este sencillo entrante a un plato principal de cena con un chorrito de jerez seco y una cama de espaguetis.','["700 ml de caldo de pollo caliente bajo en sal","75 g de chorizo ​​cortado en cubitos","1 diente de ajo, en rodajas finas","pizca de hebras de azafrán","2 cabezas pequeñas de hojas verdes, finamente ralladas","1 kg de almejas o berberechos vivos pequeños, bien lavados","2 cucharadas de perejil fresco, finamente picado","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","rodajas de limón, para servir"]','["Colocar el caldo, el chorizo, el ajo y\r\nazafrán en una cacerola grande y llevar a la\r\nhervir. Agrega las verduras, tapa y cocina.\r\ndurante 2 minutos hasta que se ablanden por completo.","Añade las almejas, tapa y cocina.\r\na fuego alto durante 4-5 minutos hasta que todas las almejas\r\nha abierto. Agrega el perejil picado.","Con una espumadera, divida las verduras.\r\ny almejas en tazones grandes y poco profundos\r\nluego vierta sobre el caldo. Rociar con aceite\r\ny servir con el limón para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15331,6070,'es','Gratinados de pescado y gambas con avena','Lleve a cabo las 5 ingestas recomendadas de frutas y verduras con estos deliciosos y saludables pasteles horneados de pescado y tomate.','["Bolsa de 340 g de espinacas tiernas, picadas en trozos grandes","Lata de 400 g de tomates picados con ajo y hierbas","225 g de filetes de pescado blanco sostenible, picados en trozos grandes","manojo pequeño de albahaca, rallada","100 g de gambas cocidas y peladas","2 cucharadas de parmesano finamente rallado","2 cucharadas de pan rallado","2 cucharadas de avena","170 g de brócoli, hervido o al vapor, para servir"]','["Pon las espinacas en un colador grande.\r\ny verter sobre agua hirviendo. Una vez frío\r\nsuficiente para manipular, exprima cualquier\r\nexceso de agua, luego sazone.","Pon los tomates en una sartén con\r\nun poco de condimento y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.\r\npara espesar. Añade el pescado y calienta durante\r\n1-2 minutos – no es necesario que esté completamente\r\ncocido en este punto. Agrega la albahaca.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nDivida las espinacas, el pescado, los langostinos y\r\nsalsa de tomate entre 2 platos gratinados.\r\nMezclar el parmesano, el pan rallado y\r\navena junto y espolvorear por encima.\r\nHornee por 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y\r\nburbujeante. Sirva con brócoli cocido."]','2026-01-11 13:07:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15332,6072,'es','Ensalada de colinabo rallado con aderezo de jalapeño en escabeche','Realza tus cenas de verano con esta ensalada de colinabo salada, salada y un poco picante. Hermoso en bandeja, se puede ensamblar en minutos.','["100 gramos de yogur natural","35 g de jalapeños en escabeche, finamente picados, más 2 cucharadas de salmuera del frasco","2 colinabos (unos 900 g), finamente afeitados con una mandolina","1 chile rojo, finamente cortado","10 g de eneldo, picado en trozos grandes","30 g de maní salado, triturado grueso","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra (opcional)"]','["Batir el yogur, la salmuera de jalapeño y un poco de condimento en un tazón grande.","Añade el colinabo y revuelve bien con las manos. Colóquelos en una fuente para servir, luego esparza sobre las rodajas de jalapeño y chile, el eneldo y el maní. Rocíe con aceite de oliva, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:07:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15333,6074,'es','Niçoise de salmón fresco','En una cálida tarde de verano, una ensalada tibia es saciante pero ligera. Tradicionalmente, la niçoise se elabora con atún enlatado, pero los ácidos grasos omega-3 del pescado no superan el proceso de enlatado, por lo que hemos utilizado salmón salvaje en su lugar.','["1 cebolla morada (unos 130 g), finamente picada","2 cucharadas de vinagre de manzana","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","12 aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas y cortadas en cuartos","2 cucharadas de eneldo picado","2 cucharaditas de hojas de estragón picadas","400 g de patatas pequeñas","2 huevos","320 g de judías verdes finas, peladas","4 filetes de salmón salvaje (entre 100 y 125 g cada uno), descongelados si están congelados","2 x 160 g de lechugas Little Gem, 1 rallada","4 tomates, cortados en gajos"]','["Combine la cebolla, el vinagre, el aceite, las aceitunas y las hierbas en un tazón mediano.","Hervir las patatas en la base de una olla a vapor durante 10 minutos. Agrega los huevos (rellénalos con agua hirviendo del hervidor si no están sumergidos). Vierta las judías verdes en una sartén y coloque la vaporera encima, luego cocine por 8 minutos más.","Retire las patatas y los huevos de la vaporera, pero no los escurra. Agrega el salmón al agua y cocina por 5 minutos. Agrega las papas calientes al aderezo.","Para servir, divida la mitad de la lechuga en dos platos (o apílela en un plato) junto con la mitad de las judías verdes y los tomates, luego vierta la mitad de las papas aliñadas encima. Retire y deseche la piel del salmón, luego desmenuce la mitad del pescado sobre la ensalada. Pele un huevo, córtelo por la mitad y sirva la mitad sobre cada ensalada. Enfríe los ingredientes restantes para comerlos fríos al día siguiente. Se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado hasta por un día."]','2026-01-11 13:07:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15334,6076,'es','sopa de pepino','La refrescante sopa de pepino se sirve fría, por lo que será muy buena en un día de verano. Sírvelo en tazones para una reunión más pequeña o viértelo en tazas pequeñas para un aperitivo.','["2 pepinos (unos 675 g)","150 g de yogur griego","1 a 2 limas, exprimidas, según el gusto","un puñado pequeño de estragón, picado","3 ramitas de menta, con las hojas recogidas","manojo pequeño de cebollino, picado","aceite de colza, para servir"]','["Pica finamente un tercio de uno de los pepinos y reserva para cuando estés listo para servir más tarde. Pique los pepinos restantes en trozos grandes y colóquelos en una licuadora o procesador de alimentos junto con el yogur y el jugo de una lima. Añade el estragón, la mayor parte de las hojas de menta y la mayor parte del cebollino. Bate hasta que la mezcla esté suave. Pruebe la sopa y agregue parte o todo el jugo de lima de la segunda lima si desea más acidez.","Vierta la sopa en tazones o tazas pequeñas, esparza sobre el pepino finamente picado, las hojas de menta restantes y el resto del cebollino. Rocíe con un poco de aceite de colza justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15335,6078,'es','Nuggets de verduras con ensalada de repollo de verano','Elaborados con quinua rica en proteínas y mantequilla de maní, estos sabrosos nuggets saben muy bien si se sirven con nuestra saludable ensalada de repollo elaborada con yogur biológico que no daña el intestino.','["100g de quinua","2 cebollas (320 g), muy finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco","3½ cucharadas de mantequilla de maní crujiente","3 cucharadas de perejil picado","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 huevos batidos","Yogurt bio bote 90g","1 cucharadita de mostaza inglesa en polvo","1 cucharadita de vinagre de manzana","1 zanahoria (150 g), rallada gruesa","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cebolla muy pequeña, finamente picada","320 g de col blanca, finamente rallada","4 cucharadas de cilantro picado"]','["Hervir la quinua durante 20 minutos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, dejar reposar 5 minutos y luego escurrir bien. Mientras tanto, sofreír las cebollas en 1 cucharada de aceite a fuego medio-bajo durante 5 minutos con la sartén tapada, luego destapar y freír durante 5 minutos más hasta que estén blandas y empiecen a tomar color. Retire del fuego, agregue los frijoles negros, el orégano, la mantequilla de maní, el perejil y el caldo, luego triture todo junto con un machacador de papas para triturar los frijoles. Agrega la quinua y los huevos y mezcla bien.","Calienta la cucharada de aceite restante en una sartén grande antiadherente, usando una cucharada medidora, toma cucharadas redondeadas de la mezcla y agrégala a la sartén, espaciadas. Cocine durante unos 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que las pepitas estén doradas. Cocine la mitad de la mezcla y guarde el resto para otro día. Se mantendrá fría hasta por tres días.","Para hacer la ensalada de col, ponga el yogur, la mostaza en polvo y el vinagre en un bol, mezcle para hacer un aderezo, luego agregue las verduras y el cilantro y revuelva bien. Sirva la mitad de la ensalada de col con dos porciones de nuggets. El resto se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:07:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15336,6080,'es','Brochetas crujientes de patata, pimiento y chorizo','A toda la familia le encantarán estas rápidas y sencillas brochetas en la próxima barbacoa de verano. Si no brilla el sol, te hemos dado instrucciones sobre cómo cocinarlas en el interior','["500 g de patatas nuevas","3 pimientos romanos o rojos, cortados en trozos","250 g de chorizo ​​para cocinar, cortado en trozos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 ramitas de romero, con las hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes","70 g de mayonesa","1 diente de ajo pequeño, finamente rallado","½ limón, exprimido","una pizca pequeña de pimentón ahumado (opcional)","unas ramitas de perejil, hojas recogidas (opcional)","ensalada, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta una barbacoa o parrilla. Ponga a hervir una cacerola con agua ligeramente salada. Agrega las patatas y cocina durante 12 minutos hasta que se pueda insertar fácilmente una brocheta. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor. Mezcle las patatas con los pimientos, el chorizo, el aceite de oliva y el romero en un bol grande. Tome de seis a ocho brochetas de metal grandes y ensarte en ellas alternativamente las patatas, los pimientos y el chorizo. Ase a la parrilla durante 10 a 15 minutos o hasta que esté ligeramente carbonizado por fuera, o ase a la parrilla durante 5 a 6 minutos por cada lado.","Mezcle la mayonesa, el ajo y el jugo de limón en un tazón pequeño. Espolvorea con un poco de pimentón, si quieres. Sirva las brochetas con el perejil esparcido, si lo usa, y la mayonesa de ajo y la ensalada a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15337,6082,'es','Ensalada crujiente picada','Anime a los niños a aprender habilidades culinarias esenciales con esta ensalada crujiente hecha con semillas de granada. La receta es fácil de seguir para niños de siete a 11 años.','["1 limon","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 tsp Dijon mustard","1 cucharadita de miel","10 tomates cherry (utiliza una mezcla de diferentes colores, si quieres)","1⁄2 pepino","2 lechugas Little Gem","1 canastilla de berros","100 g de semillas de granada","25 g de semillas mixtas (nosotros usamos semillas de girasol y de calabaza; consulte el consejo a continuación)","tabla de cortar","paño de cocina o papel de cocina (opcional)","cuchillo afilado","exprimidor de cítricos","cucharada","cucharilla","tarro de mermelada o tazón pequeño","ensaladera grande","tijeras de cocina","escalas de medición"]','["Antes de comenzar, eche un vistazo a nuestra guía de habilidades para cortar y usar cuchillos. Si su tabla de cortar no tiene asas antideslizantes, coloque un paño de cocina humedecido o una hoja de papel de cocina sobre la superficie de trabajo y luego coloque la tabla encima para evitar que se resbale.","Sosteniendo el limón con la mano en posición de puente, córtalo por la mitad. Coloque la mitad en un exprimidor de cítricos, gírelo y exprima para liberar el jugo. Repita con la segunda mitad de limón. Vierta el jugo en un tarro de mermelada o en un tazón pequeño junto con el aceite.","Agrega la mostaza, la miel y una buena pizca de sal y pimienta negra. Selle el frasco y agítelo para combinar, o mezcle los ingredientes. Se mantendrá tapado en el refrigerador hasta por una semana.","Corte los tomates por la mitad pellizcando cada uno entre el pulgar y el dedo y cortándolos con cuidado por la mitad con un cuchillo de sierra pequeño. Vuelva a cortar cada trozo por la mitad para formar cuartos, luego vierta los tomates en un tazón grande.","Limpia la tabla de cortar y luego corta el pepino por la mitad a lo largo. Coloque las dos mitades con el lado cortado hacia abajo sobre la tabla para que no rueden, luego córtelas nuevamente por la mitad a lo largo, de modo que tenga cuatro palitos gruesos de pepino. Ahora corte el pepino para formar pequeños triángulos, manteniendo la mano libre en posición de garra con los dedos alejados de la hoja del cuchillo. Vierta el pepino en el bol con los tomates.","Corta el tallo duro de las lechugas, luego corta cada lechuga por la mitad y otra vez por la mitad para obtener cuatro gajos. Trabajando con una rodaja de lechuga a la vez, sostenga la rodaja con la mano en posición de garra y córtela en tiras pequeñas; cuanto más pequeñas, mejor para esta ensalada. Repita con los gajos restantes e incline la lechuga en el tazón.","Corta los berros directamente en el recipiente con unas tijeras de cocina. Pese las semillas de granada con la balanza y agréguelas al bol. Repita con las semillas mixtas. Rocíe aproximadamente la mitad del aderezo sobre la ensalada (le sobrará un poco) y mezcle todo para cubrir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15338,6086,'es','Arroz jollof al horno','Disfrute de una versión del arroz jollof, un alimento básico de África occidental. Es un excelente compañero para pollo, pescado o ensalada y puedes usar una salsa ya preparada si lo prefieres.','["400 g de arroz basmati","3 pimientos rojos, cortados por la mitad y sin semillas","1 cebolla blanca, cortada a la mitad","2 dientes de ajo","1 cucharada de jengibre rallado o puré de jengibre","1 chile Scotch Bonnet, sin semillas si prefieres menos picante (opcional)","5 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o de girasol","100 g de puré de tomate","2 hojas de laurel","1 cucharada de tomillo seco","2 cucharaditas de curry en polvo (usamos madrás picante)","½ cucharadita de pimienta blanca molida","600 ml de caldo de pollo caliente, elaborado con 2 cubitos de caldo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Verter el arroz en un colador, enjuagar con agua fría, escurrir y reservar. Coloque los pimientos, la cebolla, el ajo, el jengibre y la guindilla, si los usa, en un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que estén picados.","Calentar el aceite en una cazuela apta para horno a fuego medio y sofreír el puré de tomate durante 2-3 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia. Agrega la mezcla de pimientos picados y fríe durante 5 minutos más, luego agrega las hierbas, las especias y 1 cucharadita de sal. Freír durante 1 o 2 minutos más y luego agregar el arroz para cubrir. Vierta el caldo, revuelva, cubra y hornee por 45 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno."]','2026-01-11 13:07:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15339,6088,'es','Tortitas de pescado de Mornay que se derriten','Intente preparar estos deliciosos pasteles de pescado con pan rallado crujiente por fuera y una sorpresa picante y con queso en el centro. Son perfectos para el almuerzo o la cena.','["500 g de patatas harinosas, como Maris Piper o King Edwards, cortadas en trozos pequeños","1 hoja de laurel","300 g de eglefino o bacalao ahumado","140 g de salmón","rallado de nuez moscada","manojo pequeño de perejil picado","1 limón, rallado y luego cortado en gajos para servir","3 cucharadas de harina","2 huevos batidos","100 g de pan rallado fresco","aceite vegetal, para freír, más extra para la lata","ensalada verde mixta, para servir","1 cucharada de harina común","1 cucharada de mantequilla","300ml de leche","50 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","1 tsp Dijon mustard"]','["Primero, prepara la salsa mornay al menos unas horas antes de hacer las croquetas de pescado. Coloque la harina y la mantequilla en una cacerola pequeña a fuego medio-bajo y cocine hasta que la mantequilla se derrita, luego revuelva hasta formar una pasta. Incorpora lentamente la leche hasta obtener una salsa suave. Continúe cocinando hasta que espese, aproximadamente 5 minutos, luego retire del fuego y agregue el queso y la mostaza. Estación. Engrase algunos trozos pequeños de papel para hornear y luego utilícelos para forrar los cuatro agujeros de un molde para muffins. Alternativamente, use moldes para cupcakes de silicona. Divida la salsa entre las cajas y congele por al menos 2 hrs.","Poner las patatas y el laurel en una cacerola grande, cubrir con agua y sazonar con sal. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Retirar las patatas con una espumadera, ponerlas en un colador y dejar secar al vapor.","Añade todo el pescado al agua de la sartén, reduce el fuego al mínimo y escalfa durante 5 minutos. El pescado estará cocido cuando empiece a desmenuzarse. Transfiera con cuidado el pescado a una tabla con una espumadera y déjelo enfriar durante 5 minutos.","Desmenuza el pescado, desechando la piel y las espinas. Vierta las patatas en una sartén limpia, sazone bien y ralle un poco de nuez moscada. Triture hasta que quede suave, luego agregue el pescado, el perejil y la ralladura de limón. Dejar enfriar.","Divida la mezcla de pastel de pescado en cuatro porciones. Trabajando con una porción a la vez, forme una bola. Haga un hueco en el centro y introduzca en él uno de los discos de salsa mornay congelada. Dale forma al pastel de pescado alrededor del centro de la salsa para que tenga una forma suave de disco de hockey. Repita con las porciones restantes y la salsa, luego congele las croquetas de pescado durante al menos 15 minutos.","Ponga la harina en un bol poco profundo, el huevo en un segundo y el pan rallado fresco en un tercero. Sazone el huevo. Rebozar bien las croquetas de pescado con harina, luego con huevo y finalmente con pan rallado. Si al final te queda algo de huevo o pan rallado, sigue sumergiendo y recubriendo hasta que se acabe todo. Congele las croquetas de pescado hasta que estén firmes, aproximadamente 1 hora. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por un mes. Descongelar en el frigorífico durante 2 horas antes de cocinar.","Llene una sartén grande y profunda con aceite hasta no más de dos tercios de su capacidad y caliéntela a 180 ° C. O utilice una freidora. Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Freír las croquetas de pescado durante 7 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad, hasta que estén crujientes. Escurrir en un plato forrado con papel de cocina, luego transferir a una bandeja para hornear y hornear durante 5 minutos (o 15 minutos si están congelados) hasta que el centro esté caliente. Servir con ensalada y rodajas de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:07:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15340,6090,'es','Tarta de cebolla francesa con hojaldre de tomillo y queso','Impresione a sus invitados a almorzar con esta quiche de cebolla francesa con masa de gruyere y tomillo. Las anchoas en el relleno le dan un sabor umami extra especial','["200 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","100 g de mantequilla fría, en cubos, más 25 g","150 g de queso duro gruyère, comté o vegetariano estilo italiano, rallado","un puñado pequeño de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","3 cebollas grandes, finamente cortadas","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco o jerez","1 cucharada de azúcar","2 anchoas marrones, finamente picadas, o use 1 cucharadita de tapenade de aceitunas o pasta umami","2 huevos grandes","300ml de nata doble","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharaditas de vinagre balsámico","2 tomates secos, cortados finamente","6-8 aceitunas negras sin hueso, en rodajas finas","1 cucharadita de alcaparras","unos puñados de rúcula"]','["Poner la harina en el bol de un robot de cocina con los 100g de mantequilla. Mezcle hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino, luego agregue 50 g de queso, 1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo, un poco de pimienta negra recién molida y 1 cucharadita de sal. Blitz nuevamente brevemente para combinar. Agregue 2-3 cucharadas de agua fría y presione nuevamente hasta formar una masa. Si no tiene un procesador de alimentos, haga esto en un tazón: primero frote la harina con la mantequilla y luego agregue los ingredientes restantes con un cuchillo. Envuelva y enfríe durante al menos 40 minutos.","Mientras tanto, caliente los 25 g de mantequilla y el aceite de oliva en una sartén grande a fuego medio-bajo y cocine las cebollas con una pizca de sal durante 40-50 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que estén pegajosas, doradas y muy suaves al presionarlas con el dorso de una cuchara. Si empiezan a prenderse, bajamos más el fuego y añadimos un chorrito de agua. Ten paciencia, porque tardarán un poco en caramelizar, pero mantente atento a la sartén para que no se quemen.","Agrega el vinagre, el azúcar y las anchoas. Sigue revolviendo hasta que el vinagre se haya evaporado y las anchoas se hayan disuelto en las cebollas. Retirar del fuego.","Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5 y extender la masa sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener un grosor de 3 mm. Usa la masa para forrar un molde para tarta de 23 cm (usa el rodillo para ayudarte a hacer esto). Recorta los bordes para que sobresalgan de los lados. Parche la masa con los recortes, si es necesario. Arruga una hoja de papel para hornear, luego ábrela nuevamente para forrar la masa y rellénala con frijoles para hornear. Hornee por 15 minutos, retire el pergamino y los frijoles, luego hornee por 5 a 8 minutos más, o hasta que la masa se vea seca, sin manchas crudas.","Mientras tanto, bata los huevos, la nata, el tomillo restante y el resto del queso junto con una pizca de sal y una pizca de pimienta negra. Agrega las cebollas caramelizadas. Recorta los lados de la masa con un cuchillo de sierra para limpiar los bordes. Vierta el relleno en la masa de repostería y golpee suavemente el molde sobre la superficie de trabajo para liberar las burbujas.","Hornee la quiche durante 25 a 30 minutos en el estante central del horno hasta que esté ligeramente dorada y firme en el medio, con una ligera oscilación. Dejar enfriar en el molde durante al menos 15-20 minutos y luego cortar en rodajas. Para hacer la ensalada, mezcle el aceite de oliva y el vinagre en un tazón y luego agregue el resto de los ingredientes. Apila la ensalada encima del quiche o sírvela junto. Si lo desea, deje que la quiche se enfríe por completo y luego enfríe antes de servir. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:07:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15341,6092,'es','Ensalada de hinojo y rábano rallado con melocotones encurtidos','Celebre la temporada de hinojo a mediados del verano con esta deliciosa ensalada. Está elaborado con rábanos, virutas de queso lancashire, albahaca, menta y melocotones encurtidos.','["50 g de almendras enteras con piel","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","2 bulbos de hinojo","1 limón, exprimido","4 rábanos, cortados en rodajas muy finas (preferiblemente en una mandolina) y sumergidos en agua helada","20 g de queso lancashire, finamente rallado con un pelador de verduras","puñado de albahaca","un puñado de hojas de menta","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 melocotones maduros (los melocotones planos o donut funcionan bien), sin hueso y cortados en rodajas gruesas","50 g de azúcar en polvo","100ml de vino blanco o vinagre de arroz","1 anís estrellado"]','["Primero, haz los melocotones encurtidos. Pon las rodajas de melocotón en un bol y reserva. Vierta el resto de los ingredientes en una cacerola con 50 ml de agua y déjelos hervir, revolviendo hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar durante 10 minutos. Vierta la mezcla sobre los duraznos y déjelos encurtir durante al menos 30 minutos o hasta unas horas.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner las almendras y las semillas de hinojo en una bandeja de horno, rociar con aceite de colza y espolvorear por encima el pimentón ahumado y un poco de sal. Mezcle para cubrir. Hornee durante 8 minutos o hasta que esté tostado y ligeramente crujiente.","Retire las hojas exteriores duras de los bulbos de hinojo (puede conservarlas para usarlas como caldo). Recorte las bases y retire los tallos y las hojas (nuevamente, resérvelos para el caldo, si lo desea). Corta los bulbos por la mitad a lo largo del centro y luego colócalos, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, sobre una tabla de cortar. Cortar muy finamente cada mitad en medias lunas, luego verterlas en un bol y rociar con el jugo de limón. Mientras tanto, escurre las rodajas de melocotón encurtido.","Escurrir los rábanos y combinarlos con el hinojo y una pizca grande de sal. Déjelo reposar unos minutos y luego agregue los duraznos, la mayor parte del queso y la mitad de las hierbas. Rocíe con aceite de oliva y esparza sobre las almendras tostadas y las semillas de hinojo. Adorne con el resto de las hierbas y un poco más de queso."]','2026-01-11 13:07:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15342,6096,'es','Ensalada Nicoise','Haz de la salade niçoise tu ensalada preferida para el verano. Con lechuga crujiente, tomates maduros, patatas, atún y huevos pasados ​​por agua, está lleno de sabor y textura.','["8 patatas nuevas","50 g de judías verdes (o un puñado pequeño), peladas y cortadas por la mitad","3 huevos","2 lechugas Little Gem, cortadas en cuartos","50 g de aceitunas negras deshuesadas","2 tomates medianos (las ciruelas son buenas), cortados en cuartos","Lata de 145 g de atún en aceite de oliva, escurrido y reservado el aceite (ver más abajo)","½ diente de ajo","1 filete de anchoa (opcional)","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva reservado de la lata de atún (rellénelo si es necesario)"]','["Para hacer el aderezo, machaque el ajo y la anchoa, si los usa, con una pizca de sal en una tabla usando la hoja de un cuchillo grande, o en un mortero. Combine la pasta con la mostaza y el vinagre, luego agregue lentamente el aceite de atún. Dejar de lado.","Vierta las patatas nuevas en una cacerola grande con agua fría con sal, asegurándose de que estén bien cubiertas. Llevar a ebullición y luego reducir el fuego a fuego lento. Agregue los frijoles y cocine durante 5 minutos, luego retírelos con una espumadera y sumérjalos inmediatamente en un recipiente con agua helada para que se enfríen. Cocine las patatas durante otros 5 minutos hasta que estén tiernas, luego escúrralas y déjelas enfriar. Cuando estén lo suficientemente fríos para manipularlos, córtelos por la mitad o en cuartos y mezcle en un tazón grande con 1 cucharada de aderezo. Dejar enfriar por completo.","Mientras tanto, cocine los huevos en una segunda olla con agua hirviendo durante 7½ minutos, luego transfiéralo a un recipiente con agua helada para que se enfríen. Escurre los frijoles y los huevos, luego pela y corta los huevos por la mitad.","Vierta los cuartos de lechuga, los frijoles cocidos y las aceitunas en el bol con las patatas. Agregue la mayor parte del aderezo restante y revuelva suavemente. Divida la ensalada en dos tazones y cubra con los tomates y los huevos. Desmenuzar el atún, luego rociar con el resto del aderezo y sazonar."]','2026-01-11 13:07:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15343,6098,'es','Ensalada de tomate y mozzarella con aderezo de tomate','Disfrute de esta ensalada súper rápida de tomate y mozzarella como guarnición, o agregue un poco de aguacate en rodajas para un almuerzo abundante. Cubra con hojas de albahaca y crostini triturados para darle más sabor y textura.','["200 g de tomates mixtos, en rodajas","1 chalota grande, cortada en aros finos","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 gotas de tabasco","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco (el moscatel es bueno)","6 hojas de albahaca, ralladas, más hojas extra pequeñas para servir","4 crostini comprados en la tienda, triturados toscamente","1 bola de mozzarella de búfala, o burrata si la encuentras (unos 150 g), partida por la mitad"]','["Ponga los tomates en un bol con las chalotas y sazone con una pizca grande de sal. Dejar reposar 10 min para que los tomates suelten su jugo.","Saque los tomates y las chalotas del bol con una espumadera y reserve el jugo. Coloque los tomates en dos platos y luego espolvoree sobre las chalotas.","Batir el aceite de oliva, el Tabasco y el vinagre con el jugo de tomate reservado para hacer un aderezo. Rocíe sobre los tomates y las chalotas, luego esparza con la albahaca rallada y los crostini triturados. Coloque la mitad de la mozzarella en el centro de cada plato y sazone con pimienta negra recién molida. Cubra con las hojas de albahaca adicionales y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:07:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15344,6100,'es','Aderezo para ensalada fácil','Prepare esta vinagreta fácil con mostaza de Dijon, aceite de oliva y vinagre de vino blanco. Este sencillo aderezo para ensalada se conserva en un frasco hasta por un mes.','["1 cucharada de mostaza Djion","100 ml de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","una pizca pequeña de azúcar"]','["Vierta la mostaza en un bol y agregue lentamente el aceite con un batidor pequeño. Agregue gradualmente el vinagre y 1 cucharadita de agua para hacer un aderezo cremoso. Sazone con el azúcar y una pizca generosa de sal. Se conservará en un frasco sellado hasta por un mes, pero se debe batir nuevamente antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15345,6102,'es','Ensalada de fruta','Busque frutas maduras y de olor dulce para esta sencilla ensalada de frutas con kiwi, mango, piña, uvas, naranja y bayas. Es un postre de verano delicioso y ligero.','["2 kiwis","1 mango","150 g de piña","100 g de uvas","400 g de frutos rojos variados, nosotros utilizamos fresas, frambuesas y moras.","1 naranja grande","2 cucharaditas de miel (opcional)"]','["Prepara la fruta con un cuchillo de sierra pequeño. Corta la parte superior e inferior del kiwi, colócalo sobre una de sus superficies planas y corta la piel, manteniendo el cuchillo lo más cerca posible de la piel. Cortar por la mitad, siguiendo el corazón hasta el centro, luego cortar cada mitad en rodajas. Poner en un bol y repetir con el otro kiwi.","Corta con cuidado la piel del mango y corta cada mejilla, pasando el cuchillo lo más cerca posible del hueso. Corta cada pieza en rodajas. Retire los restos de fruta del hueso en rodajas largas y finas. Agrega el mango al kiwi.","Cubra y coloque la cola sobre la piña, luego, de manera similar al kiwi, corte la piel. Usa tu cuchillo para rodear la piña, quitando las hendiduras o los ojos, dos o tres a la vez, te quedará un patrón en espiral que se teje alrededor del exterior de la fruta. Tome una rodaja circular, de aproximadamente 150 g, córtela en cuartos, retire el corazón y córtela en trozos. Añadir al bol.","Corta las uvas por la mitad y agrégalas al resto de la fruta junto con las bayas; es posible que quieras cortar en rodajas o reducir a la mitad las fresas si son grandes. Retire la cáscara de la naranja utilizando el mismo método que el kiwi y la piña. Sosteniendo la naranja sobre el plato de fruta, retire los gajos de naranja cortándolos con cuidado entre la membrana y la fruta. Los trozos deben caer en el recipiente junto con el jugo. Exprime la membrana sobre la fruta para extraer el jugo, agrega un chorrito de miel, si quieres. Mezclar todo y dejar macerar en el frigorífico durante 30 min, si tienes tiempo."]','2026-01-11 13:07:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15346,6104,'es','Brochetas de calamares y gambas','Prepara nuestras chisporroteantes brochetas de mariscos en una barbacoa y agrega tu adobo favorito. Tenemos ideas para tres glaseados llenos de sabor','["150 g de langostinos crudos","250 g de calamares limpios","el glaseado elegido (opcional)"]','["Pelar los langostinos y cortar los calamares limpios en trozos de 3 cm y ensartarlos en tres brochetas. Enciende la barbacoa. Cepille las brochetas con el glaseado elegido y luego, cuando las llamas se hayan apagado, cocine durante 2 minutos por cada lado (o cocine en una sartén a fuego alto). Unte con el resto del glaseado y cocine durante 1 minuto más por cada lado hasta que esté carbonizado y pegajoso."]','2026-01-11 13:07:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15347,6106,'es','Ensalada de maíz carbonizado, pollo y tortilla con aderezo de yogur chipotle','Pruebe esta vibrante ensalada con o sin pollo. Si lo vas a servir como acompañamiento de kebabs o salchichas, cámbialo por un poco de queso feta desmenuzado, si lo tienes.','["1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado, más ½ cucharadita","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle, más 1 cucharadita","½ cucharadita de canela","2 dientes de ajo machacados","2 limas, 1 rallada y en jugo, 1 cortada en gajos para servir","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para untar y freír","6 muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","150 gramos de yogur natural","2 cucharaditas de miel","2 mazorcas de maíz, sin cáscara si es necesario","2 lechugas Little Gem, cortadas por la mitad desde el corazón, con las hojas separadas y rotas","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos, enjuagados y nuevamente escurridos","200 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","2 aguacates, deshuesados, pelados, partidos por la mitad y cortados en trozos","2 tortillas de maíz","manojo pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Mezcle 1 cucharada de pimentón, el orégano, 1 cucharada de chipotle, canela, ajo, ralladura de lima y 2 cucharadas de aceite en un bol con un poco de condimento. Vierta sobre los muslos de pollo, volteándolos para cubrirlos, luego cubra y enfríe durante al menos unas horas, o hasta 24 horas.","Enciende la barbacoa y deja que las llamas se apaguen, o calienta una plancha a fuego alto. Mezcla el yogurt, el jugo de limón, el aceite restante, ½ cucharadita de pimentón, 1 cucharadita de chipotle y la miel con una pizca de sal. Dejar de lado. Cepille las mazorcas de maíz con un poco de aceite, luego cocínelas junto con el pollo marinado en la barbacoa o en la plancha durante unos 10 minutos, volteándolas con frecuencia hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido (debe estar carbonizado y firme al tacto; verifique que esté cocido cortándolo en uno de los trozos más gruesos) y el maíz esté de color amarillo brillante y jugoso.","Transfiera el pollo y el maíz a una tabla o plato y tápelo para mantenerlo caliente. Coloque la lechuga, los frijoles, los tomates y el aguacate en un plato grande o en un tazón para servir, pero espere para mezclar hasta justo antes de servir; esto ayuda a evitar que las hojas de lechuga se marchiten.","Corta los wraps en tiras o trozos pequeños. Calentar un chorrito de aceite en una sartén y sofreír las tiras hasta que estén crujientes y doradas, luego escurrir sobre papel de cocina. Espolvorea con sal.","Cortar el pollo cocido en tiras de 1 cm y cortar la mazorca de maíz carbonizado. Agregue a la ensalada, luego rocíe sobre el aderezo y el jugo del pollo y revuelva. Esparza sobre el cilantro y las tiras de tortilla crujientes y sirva con las rodajas de lima a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:07:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15348,6108,'es','Brochetas de carne teriyaki picantes','Si buscas una cena ligera y saludable, estos kebabs son la solución: ricos en folato, fibra, hierro y vitamina C, además de 3 de tus 5 al día.','["1 cucharada de tamari o salsa de soja","3 cucharadas de jugo de naranja recién exprimido","15 g de jengibre en trozos, pelado y rallado muy fino","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de miel (preferiblemente cruda)","¼ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","300 g de solomillo de ternera, sin grasa dura y cortado en tiras largas y finas","100 g de arroz integral de grano largo","? pepino, cortado en cubos pequeños","2 zanahorias medianas, peladas y cortadas en tiras con un pelador","4 cebolletas, cortadas y cortadas en diagonal","100 g de rábanos, recortados y en rodajas","20 g de cilantro, las hojas picadas en trozos grandes y un poco más para decorar","10 g de hojas de menta y un poco más para decorar","1 cucharada de aceite de colza prensado en frío","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","25 g de anacardos sin sal, tostados y picados en trozos grandes"]','["Ponga el tamari, el jugo de naranja, el jengibre, el ajo, la miel y las hojuelas de chile en una cacerola pequeña con 100 ml de agua fría y deje hervir. Cocine durante 3-5 minutos, hirviendo fuerte hasta que esté bien reducido, brillante y ligeramente almibarado. Retirar del fuego, verter en un plato llano y dejar enfriar.","Ensarte la carne en 4 brochetas de madera o metal empapadas. Coloque en la marinada, dé vuelta y cepille hasta que esté bien cubierto. Cubrir con film transparente y dejar marinar durante 30 minutos.","Mientras se marina la carne, prepara la ensalada. Llene una cacerola mediana hasta la mitad con agua y déjela hervir. Cocine el arroz durante unos 20 minutos o siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete hasta que esté tierno. Enjuague en un colador con agua corriente hasta que esté frío y luego escurra bien. Vierta en un tazón grande.","Agregue el pepino, las zanahorias, las cebolletas, los rábanos, el cilantro, la menta, el aceite, la ralladura de lima y el jugo, y mezcle bien. Sazona con un poco de pimienta negra. Divida en dos platos y cubra con una pizca de nueces y hierbas adicionales para decorar.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. (También puede cocinar las brochetas en una plancha antiadherente). Coloque las brochetas en una rejilla sobre una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel de aluminio, reservando el exceso de marinada. Ase las brochetas cerca del fuego durante 3-5 minutos por cada lado o hasta que estén cocidas a su gusto. Unte con más marinada cuando estén volteados. Deben verse pegajosos y brillantes cuando se cocinan. Servir caliente o frío con la ensalada de arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:07:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15349,6110,'es','Cangrejo con chile con ensalada de hinojo rallado y perejil','Esta ensalada sin cocción es ligera, fresca y llena de sabor. Utilice carne de cangrejo fresca; sabe mucho mejor que la enlatada. Esto se puede preparar con anticipación para que puedas prepararlo en el último minuto.','["2 bulbos de hinojo, hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes","ralladura fina y jugo de 1 limón","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un poco más para rociar","300 g de carne de cangrejo blanca fresca","1 chile, sin semillas y cortado finamente","manojo de perejil de hoja plana, con las hojas recogidas y picadas una o dos veces"]','["Recorta el tallo del hinojo y retira la primera capa de cada bulbo si parece cansado o magullado. Corta el hinojo en rodajas lo más finas posible con un cuchillo afilado o, mejor aún, con una mandolina si tienes. Vierta el hinojo en un bol y sazone con una pizca de sal marina. Exprima más de la mitad del jugo de limón y rocíe con 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, luego déjelo marinar brevemente.","Vierta la carne de cangrejo en otro bol, sazone ligeramente, luego agregue el resto del jugo de limón y el aceite de oliva, y la mitad del chile, y mezcle bien. El cangrejo y el hinojo se pueden preparar con hasta 2 horas de anticipación y guardar en el refrigerador, pero saque el hinojo nuevamente 20 minutos antes de servir.","Mezclar el perejil y el resto de la guindilla con el hinojo. Divida en seis platos, luego cubra cada uno con una cucharada grande de carne de cangrejo en el medio. Esparcir por encima las hojas de hinojo, la ralladura de limón y un chorrito de aceite de oliva y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:07:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15350,6112,'es','Cerdo al limón y romero con ensalada de garbanzos','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Mejora la carne de cerdo con limón y romero para disfrutar de una cena que te hará sentir bien y que estará en la mesa en menos de media hora.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de romero finamente picado","4 dientes de ajo machacados","jugo y ralladura de ½ limón","4 filetes de cerdo deshuesados, sin grasa","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","2 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","2 latas de 400 g/14 oz de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","Bolsa de 110 g de hojas de ensalada mixta."]','["Mezcle el aceite de oliva, el romero, el ajo, el jugo de limón y la ralladura en un tazón grande. Agregue la carne de cerdo, dé vuelta para cubrir y sazone bien. Si tienes tiempo marina en el frigorífico durante 30 minutos.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente grande. Saque la carne de cerdo de la marinada, sacuda el exceso y reserve la marinada para más tarde. Cocine la carne de cerdo en la sartén durante 3-4 minutos por cada lado o hasta que esté bien cocida. Reposa en un plato mientras haces la ensalada.","Vierta la marinada reservada en la sartén con la cebolla. Cocine durante 1 minuto a fuego alto antes de agregar el vinagre y 3 cucharadas de agua. Burbujee durante 1 minuto, hasta que la cebolla se ablande un poco y el aderezo se espese un poco. Agregue los garbanzos, un poco de sal, pimienta y el jugo restante de la carne de cerdo. Coloque las hojas de ensalada en un tazón, vierta el contenido de la sartén y revuelva suavemente antes de comerlas inmediatamente con la carne de cerdo."]','2026-01-11 13:07:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15351,6114,'es','Tabulé de coliflor asada','Una comida sencilla, baja en calorías y sin cereales con coliflor asada, queso feta picante y semillas de granada dulces que se puede preparar con antelación; ideal para la cena y el almuerzo para llevar del día siguiente.','["1 coliflor grande (aproximadamente 650 g/1 lb 7 oz de peso recortado)","1 cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica","1 cucharadita de canela molida","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","25 g de almendras laminadas, tostadas","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","Paquete de 200 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","110 g de semillas de granada en tarrina","jugo 1 limon","½ paquete pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","½ paquete pequeño de menta, finamente picada, más unas cuantas hojas para decorar"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Retire las hojas exteriores de la coliflor y el núcleo interior duro, luego pique los floretes en trozos grandes (no se preocupe por su apariencia, se van a bombardear). Coloque la coliflor en el tazón grande de un procesador de alimentos, mezcle durante 30 segundos hasta que parezca granos de cuscús y luego viértala en un tazón grande.","Mezcle las especias y el aceite de oliva con la coliflor y sazone al gusto. Extienda el \"cuscús\" de coliflor en una bandeja para hornear grande en una capa delgada y uniforme. Ase durante 12 minutos, mezclando hasta la mitad para que se tueste uniformemente, luego déjelo a un lado para que se enfríe un poco.","Una vez que esté a temperatura ambiente, revuelva los ingredientes restantes y sazone al gusto, luego espolvoree sobre las hojas de menta."]','2026-01-11 13:07:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15352,6116,'es','Espárragos balsámicos asados ​​y tomates cherry','Esta sencilla guarnición vegetariana se puede servir tanto con carne como con pescado y platos principales vegetarianos.','["350 g de espárragos, desechando las puntas leñosas","Paquete de 330 g de tomates cherry cortados por la mitad","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","50 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner los espárragos y los tomates cherry en una bandeja para hornear. Rocíe sobre el aceite de oliva y el vinagre balsámico. Sazone y luego mezcle todo. Hornee por 15 minutos hasta que los espárragos estén bien cocidos. Sirva cubierto con queso feta."]','2026-01-11 13:07:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15353,6120,'es','Lubina con cítricos','Coloca naranjas en tu barbacoa para evitar que el pescado se pegue; sírvelas con una ensalada de limón con alcaparras, aceitunas verdes y berros.','["2-3 naranjas grandes","ralladura de 1 limón (use el jugo a continuación)","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 x 300 g de lubina pequeña entera, sin escamas, eviscerada y cortada varias veces por cada lado","2 naranjas, segmentadas","jugo 1 limon","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 bolsas de berros","un puñado de alcaparras pequeñas","un puñado de aceitunas verdes sin hueso, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Rallar finamente la ralladura de 1 de las naranjas.\r\ny agregar a la ralladura de limón. Mezclar con el\r\naceite de oliva, luego rociar sobre el pescado y\r\ntemporada. Cortar el resto de las naranjas en\r\nrodajas de unos 5 mm de espesor. cuando las brasas\r\nestán cenizos, disponer las rodajas de naranja\r\nsobre la barbacoa en grupos a lo largo\r\nde cada pez. Char las rodajas de naranja\r\n1 lado, luego dales la vuelta y coloca el\r\npescado encima de ellos – esto detiene el pescado\r\npegado. Asa el pescado durante 5-8 minutos.\r\na cada lado (girándolos con cuidado),\r\no hasta que la carne se desmenuce fácilmente\r\ncuando lo empujan.","Mientras el pescado se asa (o\r\npreviamente), haz la ensalada. Pon el\r\ngajos de naranja en un tazón grande con\r\nel jugo exprimido del resto del\r\nnaranjas y el jugo de limón. Temporada\r\ny agregue el aceite de oliva. cuando el pescado\r\nesté cocido, echar los berros en el\r\naderezo de naranja con las alcaparras y\r\naceitunas. Servir el pescado con la ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:07:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15354,6122,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: ensalada César con pollo','Angela Nilsen ha tenido la misión de hacer que la no tan inocente ensalada César sea más honesta. ¿El resultado? Una versión más sana y sabrosa. Así que acomódate','["1½ cucharada de jugo de limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de hojas frescas de tomillo, más unas ramitas","1 diente de ajo, machacado hasta magullarlo","4 filetes de pechuga de pollo deshuesados, orgánicos o de corral, de aproximadamente 140 g cada uno","100 g de pan rústico de granero","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 tsp Dijon mustard","½ cucharadita de salsa inglesa","1 cucharada de jugo de limón, más extra para exprimir","buena pizca de hojuelas de chile","4 filetes de anchoas, finamente picados","3 cucharadas de mayonesa de buena calidad (nosotros usamos Hellman''s)","4 cucharadas de yogur sin grasa","1 cabeza de lechuga romana o cos, con las hojas separadas, lavadas y secas","Bolsa de 100g de rúcula o berros","25 g de parmesano, rallado con un pelador de patatas"]','["Marina el pollo. Mezcla el jugo de limón, el aceite, el tomillo y el ajo en un plato llano.\r\nAgrega el pollo y voltéalo en el\r\nmarinar para cubrir bien. Sazone con recién\r\npimienta molida y dejar reposar hasta por 2 hrs.","Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.\r\nRebana y luego corta el pan en trozos grandes y ásperos.\r\ncubos para los picatostes. Distribuirlos en un\r\nuna sola capa en una bandeja para hornear, luego cepille\r\ntodo con las 2 cucharadas de aceite. Hornee por aproximadamente\r\n10 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente.","Mientras tanto, ponga el ajo en una mini licuadora con la mostaza inglesa.\r\nsalsa, zumo de limón, guindilla y anchoas.\r\nLicue hasta que quede suave, agregue la mayonesa\r\ny yogur, luego mezcle nuevamente; debería\r\ntener la consistencia de una crema doble. Ajustar\r\nal gusto con jugo de limón y pimienta. si\r\nnecesario, diluir con un par de cucharaditas de agua fría\r\nagua para obtener la consistencia adecuada para que\r\ncubrir las hojas.","Calienta una plancha hasta que esté muy caliente. Coloque el\r\npollo a la plancha, del lado que tenía\r\nla piel puesta. Cocine durante 15-16 minutos, volteando\r\nuna o dos veces, hasta que esté bien cocido.\r\nRetirar y dejar reposar la carne durante 5 minutos.\r\nantes de cortar.","Mantenga las hojas pequeñas de lechuga internas.\r\nentero, corte las hojas exteriores más grandes en 2-3\r\ntrozos, luego póngalos todos en un tazón grande\r\ncon la rúcula o los berros. Vierta solo\r\ndebajo de la mitad del aderezo sobre las hojas y\r\nmezcle con cuidado para cubrir: es más suave de usar\r\ntus manos. Ya sea ensamblar en el tazón,\r\no apilar las hojas en platos individuales,\r\nmetiendo los picatostes, el pollo y\r\nParmesano. Rocíe el resto del aderezo.\r\nuna y otra vez, luego termine con un extra\r\nchorrito de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:07:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15355,6126,'es','Brochetas de gambas harissa con cuscús de zanahoria','Estos vibrantes kebabs de gambas bajos en calorías se sirven con un delicioso cuscús de menta, tahini y yogur de ajo.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","3 zanahorias, ralladas gruesas","200 g de cuscús","400 g de gambas crudas","16 tomates cherry","1 cebolla, cortada en 12 gajos finos, dejando la raíz intacta","1 cucharada de harissa","2 cucharaditas de pasta de tahini","2 cucharadas de yogur natural desnatado","1 diente de ajo pequeño, triturado","jugo de ½ limón, más gajos, para servir","un puñado de hojas de menta, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el aceite de oliva en una sartén con el\r\nsemillas de comino y tostar por unos minutos\r\nhasta que esté aromático. Agregue las zanahorias, sazone,\r\nluego cocine durante 3 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Transferir\r\nen un bol y luego vierte sobre el cuscús.\r\ny 400ml de agua caliente. Cubrir con adhesivo\r\nfilmar y dejar actuar 10 min, o hasta que esté todo\r\nEl agua ha sido absorbida y el\r\nel cuscús está tierno.","Mientras tanto, calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. poner\r\nlas gambas, los tomates cherry y la cebolla\r\ngajos en otro tazón, sazone, luego\r\nagregue la harissa. Enhebre todo\r\nen brochetas (si usa brochetas de madera,\r\nprimero remójelos en agua para evitar\r\nquemando), luego colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear.\r\nAse durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que\r\nPero las gambas están cocidas.","Mezclar el tahini, el yogur, el ajo, el limón.\r\njugo y condimentos para hacer una salsa.\r\nPasa la menta por el cuscús,\r\ntransferir a un plato y colocar el\r\nbrochetas encima. Rocíe sobre cualquier cocción\r\njugos y sirva con una cucharada de salsa.\r\ny rodajas de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:08:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15356,6128,'es','Caballa a la plancha con ensalada de naranja, guindilla y berros','Repleta de omega-3 y vitamina C, esta ensalada no podría ser mucho más saludable ni más sabrosa','["1 cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra","1 cucharadita de semillas de cilantro","4 naranjas","1 chile rojo, sin semillas, finamente picado","8 filetes de caballa frescos","1 cucharadita de mostaza integral","1 cucharada de miel clara","Bolsa de 120g de preparado para ensalada de berros, espinacas y rúcula","1 chalota, en rodajas finas"]','["Triture finamente los granos de pimienta y\r\nsemillas de cilantro juntas usando un mortero\r\ny mortero. Rallar la ralladura de media\r\nnaranja y mezclar con la mezcla de pimientos\r\ncon la mitad del chile picado. Cortar ligeramente\r\nla piel de la caballa y presionar la\r\nmezcla picante y picante sobre el pescado.\r\nCalienta la parrilla.","Para la ensalada, segmentar las naranjas.\r\nPrimero corte la parte superior e inferior de cada\r\nnaranja, luego corte la cáscara y cualquier\r\nmédula blanca con un cuchillo pequeño y afilado.\r\nSosteniendo cada naranja sobre un tazón para atraparla.\r\ntodo el jugo, cortar cada lado de cada uno\r\nsegmento para liberarlo, luego apriete el\r\ncáscaras para liberar el jugo extra. Medida\r\n4 cucharadas de este jugo en un tazón pequeño y mezclar con la mostaza, la miel y\r\nchile restante.","Asa la caballa, con la piel hacia arriba, durante\r\n4 minutos o hasta que estén crujientes y bien cocidos.\r\nMientras tanto, divida las hojas de ensalada\r\nentre 4 platos y esparcir con el\r\ngajos de naranja y chalota en rodajas.\r\nRocíe con el aderezo de chile naranja.\r\ny cubra con la caballa a la parrilla."]','2026-01-11 13:08:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15357,6130,'es','Ensalada de pepino e hinojo','Esta refrescante ensalada es baja en grasa, súper saludable y llena de sabor veraniego.','["1 pepino grande, cortado por la mitad a lo largo, sin semillas y cortado en medias lunas finas","1 cucharadita de azúcar","1 bulbo de hinojo, finamente cortado","Bote de 150 ml de crema agria baja en grasas","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Pon el pepino en un colador. espolvorear con\r\n1 cucharadita de sal y el azúcar, luego dejar reposar\r\n10 minutos. Agrega hinojo.","Mezclar crema agria,\r\njugo de limón, vinagre y eneldo, luego sazonar\r\ncon pimienta negra y agregue a la mezcla de hinojo."]','2026-01-11 13:08:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15358,6132,'es','Bacalao con costra de limón y perejil y verduras de verano','¿Nunca estás seguro de qué hacer con un filete de pescado? Haz que nuestra elegante (y saludable) versión de un palito de pescado','["1 rebanada gruesa de pan duro, sin corteza","perejil en manojo grande","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 filetes de bacalao, de unos 175 g/6 oz cada uno","Paquete de 260 g de verduras preparadas, como guisantes y judías verdes o una mezcla de guisantes, puerros y espinacas","1 cucharadita de mostaza integral"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/ventilador 170C/gas 5. Cortar el pan en trozos y poner en un procesador de alimentos con el perejil y la ralladura de limón.\r\nBlitz para hacer migajas ásperas.","Engrase ligeramente una fuente para horno poco profunda y luego agregue el bacalao en una capa. Unte ligeramente el pescado con aceite y luego presione las migajas. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos. Mientras tanto, cocine las verduras al vapor hasta que estén tiernas, luego agregue el aceite restante, la mostaza y el jugo de limón. Servir junto con el pescado."]','2026-01-11 13:08:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15359,6134,'es','Salmón untado con canela, cuscús y yogur harissa','Una cena de pescado súper saludable que está en la mesa en menos de media hora','["100 g de cuscús","2 cucharadas de pasas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado","1 cucharadita de canela molida, más una pizca grande","200 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","1 cucharada de miel","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 filetes de salmón","1 cucharada colmada de pasta harissa","Tarrina de 170g de yogur griego 0% grasa"]','["Calienta la parrilla. Pon el cuscús,\r\npasas sultanas, la mayor parte del cilantro, 1 cucharadita\r\ncanela y un poco de condimento en un bol.\r\nVierta sobre el caldo de verduras caliente y\r\ndejar reposar durante 5 minutos para que se remoje.","Mezclar la pizca de canela,\r\nmiel y aceite. Colocar el salmón en una bandeja para hornear.\r\nbandeja, esparcir sobre la mezcla de miel y\r\ntemporada. Cocine bajo una parrilla caliente durante aproximadamente\r\n8 minutos hasta que el pescado esté bien cocido.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la harissa.\r\ny yogur. Revuelva el cuscús con\r\nun tenedor y servir con el pescado y el yogur,\r\nespolvoreado con el cilantro restante\r\njunto con algunas judías verdes, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:08:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15360,6135,'es','Eglefino picante con patatas trituradas y guisantes','Tener poco tiempo no significa que tengas que comer de forma poco saludable, como lo demuestra esta cena de pescado rápida y baja en grasas.','["600 g de patatas harinosas, sin pelar y cortadas en trozos","140 g de guisantes congelados","2½ cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","jugo y ralladura de ½ limón","1 cucharada de alcaparras, picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de cebollino picado","4 filetes de eglefino u otro pescado blanco en trozos, de unos 120 g cada uno (o utilice 2 pequeños por persona)","2 cucharadas de harina común","brócoli, para servir"]','["Cubrir las patatas con agua fría, traer\r\nhasta que hierva, luego déjelo hervir a fuego lento. cocinar\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos, agregando los guisantes por\r\nel último minuto de cocción. Escurrir y\r\ntriturar aproximadamente, agregando abundante\r\ncondimento y 1 cucharada de aceite. Manténgase caliente.","Mientras tanto, para el aderezo, mezcle 1 cucharada\r\naceite, el zumo y la ralladura de limón, las alcaparras y\r\ncebollino con un poco de condimento.","Espolvorear el pescado con harina, sacudiendo\r\ncualquier exceso y temporada. Calor restante\r\naceite en una sartén antiadherente. freír el pescado\r\ndurante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté cocido,\r\nluego agregue el aderezo y caliente.\r\nServir con el triturado y el brócoli."]','2026-01-11 13:08:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15361,6137,'es','Hamburguesas de champiñones y garbanzos','Altas en fibra y bajas en grasas, estas hamburguesas vegetales con yogur especiado son la forma saludable de disfrutar la comida rápida','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","250 g de champiñones castaños, finamente picados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 manojo de cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","1 cucharada de curry en polvo mediano","ralladura y jugo de ½ limón","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","85 g de pan rallado integral fresco","6 cucharadas de yogur griego 0%","pizca de comino molido","2 muffins o panecillos de cereales mixtos, tostados y cortados por la mitad","2 tomates pera, rebanados","un puñado de hojas de rúcula"]','["Calentar 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente\r\ny cocer los champiñones, el ajo y\r\ncebolla tierna durante 5 minutos. Mezclar con el curry\r\npolvo, ralladura de limón y jugo y cocinar\r\ndurante 2 minutos o hasta que la mezcla luzca bastante seca.\r\nVierta sobre un plato para que se enfríe un poco.","Utilice un machacador de patatas o un tenedor para hacer puré.\r\nlos garbanzos en un bol, dejando unos cuantos\r\ntrozos gruesos. Agrega la mezcla de champiñones\r\ny las migajas, luego forme 4 hamburguesas.\r\nFreír en el aceite restante durante 3-4 minutos.\r\nde cada lado hasta que estén crujientes y doradas.","Mezclar el yogur con el comino. Lugar\r\nmedio muffin en cada plato, luego esparcir\r\ncon el yogur. Cubra con las hamburguesas,\r\nunas rodajas de tomate y un poco de rúcula."]','2026-01-11 13:08:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15362,6139,'es','Ensalada de quinua, lentejas y queso feta','La quinua, una semilla rica en proteínas, es un excelente sustituto del arroz o el cuscús.','["200 g de quinua","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 chalota o ½ cebolla, finamente picada","2 cucharadas de estragón, picado en trozos grandes","Lata de 400 g de Puy o lentejas verdes enjuagadas y escurridas","¼ de pepino, ligeramente pelado y cortado en cubitos","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","6 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas finas","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto o blanco"]','["Cocine la quinua en una cacerola grande de\r\nagua hirviendo durante 10-15 minutos hasta que esté tierna,\r\nescurrir bien y luego dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén pequeña,\r\nluego cocine la chalota o la cebolla por unos\r\nminutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el estragón,\r\nrevuelva bien y luego retire del fuego.","Revuelva la chalota blanda y el estragón.\r\nen la quinua enfriada junto con la\r\nlentejas, pepino, queso feta, cebolletas,\r\nralladura y jugo de naranja y vinagre. tirar\r\nbien juntos y enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15363,6141,'es','Risotto de calabacín de verano','Esta cena fresca en una sola olla aprovecha al máximo los productos frescos de la temporada y, además, es una excelente manera de hacer que los niños coman sus verduras.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla y 2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","3 tomates maduros, picados en trozos grandes","350 g de carnaroli u otro arroz para risotto","1 cucharadita de romero picado","1½ l de caldo de verduras caliente","3 calabacines, finamente picados","140 g de guisantes, frescos o congelados","un puñado grande de albahaca, ligeramente triturada"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Cocine el\r\ncebolla y ajo durante 5 minutos hasta que la cebolla\r\nse ha suavizado. Añade los tomates y\r\ncocine durante 3-4 minutos hasta que se ablanden y\r\npulposa, luego agregue el arroz y el romero.","Verter la mitad del caldo y dejar reposar.\r\ncocine por 10 minutos o hasta que el líquido haya\r\nse evaporó, revolviendo de vez en cuando.\r\nAñade el resto del caldo y continúa.\r\ncocinar por 5 minutos más.","Agregue los calabacines y los guisantes, luego\r\ncocine por otros 5 minutos más o menos, revolviendo\r\nhasta que el arroz esté tierno, pero la mezcla\r\nTodavía es un poco atrevido. Se puede congelar en este\r\netapa por hasta 1 mes. Sazone con\r\nMucha pimienta negra, luego agrega la albahaca y revuelve hasta que se ablande. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15364,6143,'es','Atta laddoo de nuez','Prepara este delicioso postre indio con harina de chapatti, anacardos y nueces. Decóralos con un poco de pan de oro comestible para hacerlos más especiales, si quieres.','["80 g de nueces","80 g de anacardos","150 g de harina para chapatis","5 cucharadas de ghee","3 cucharadas de sirope de agave","1 cucharadita de cardamomo molido","10 trozos de nuez rota","pan de oro comestible (opcional)"]','["Calienta una sartén pequeña y seca a fuego medio-bajo y tuesta las nueces y los anacardos durante 5 minutos hasta que se doren. Vierta en una licuadora o procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta; las nueces comenzarán a soltar aceite. Vierta en un tazón.","En la misma sartén, tuesta la harina durante 8-10 minutos a fuego lento hasta que esté ligeramente dorada y con olor a tostado, revolviendo frecuentemente para evitar que se queme. Agregue el ghee y mezcle bien hasta que la mezcla se vea desmenuzable. Incorpora la mezcla a la pasta de nueces junto con el jarabe de agave y el cardamomo. Dejar enfriar unos minutos y luego combinar todo bien con las manos.","Trabajando con una porción del tamaño de una nuez a la vez, dale forma de bola a la pieza en la palma de tu mano para formar un laddoo. Repita con la mezcla restante hasta que se haya usado toda (debe obtener aproximadamente 10). Decore cada laddoo con un trozo de nuez mientras aún esté caliente y unte con un poco de pan de oro comestible, si lo usa. Se mantendrá frío hasta por cinco días. Llévelos a temperatura ambiente antes de comerlos."]','2026-01-11 13:08:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15365,6145,'es','bollos de natillas','Hazte inteligente con las natillas y haz estos magníficos bollos de natillas. Sirva con fruta fresca o asada si lo desea para un desayuno dulce o un capricho por la tarde.','["300 g de harina blanca fuerte, más 1 cucharadita y más para espolvorear","175ml de nata doble","45 g de azúcar en polvo, más 1 cucharadita","2 cucharaditas de levadura seca de acción rápida","1 huevo más 3 yemas y 1 clara, a temperatura ambiente (congela las claras sobrantes para usarlas en otra receta)","aceite vegetal, para fermentar","1 cucharada de leche entera","fruta fresca o tostada (como ciruelas o ruibarbo), para servir (opcional)","15 g de harina común","15 g de azúcar glas","15 g de mantequilla fría sin sal","60 g de azúcar en polvo","15 g de harina de maíz","1 huevo","90ml de leche entera","160ml de nata doble","1⁄2 cucharadita de pasta de vainilla"]','["Vierta 35 g de harina y nata en una cacerola y bata a fuego lento durante 1-2 minutos hasta que quede suave. Vierta en un recipiente resistente al calor y deje enfriar. Mientras tanto, mezcle 1 cucharadita de azúcar, 1 cucharadita de harina y la levadura con 1 cucharada de agua tibia. Cubrir. Dejar actuar 15 minutos hasta que burbujee.","Vierta el huevo y las yemas en un tazón grande o en una batidora con los 45 g de azúcar. Batir durante 4-5 minutos hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso. Reduzca la velocidad a baja, agregue 1/4 cucharadita de sal y la mezcla de crema y bata para combinar. Agregue la mezcla de levadura y tamice los 265 g de harina restantes, luego mezcle a velocidad baja durante 10 minutos con el gancho para masa. O amase a mano durante 5 minutos, girando el recipiente mientras lo hace. Tapar y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido durante 20 minutos. Amasar nuevamente durante 3-5 minutos hasta que la masa esté elástica, luego transferir a un bol ligeramente engrasado, tapar y dejar a temperatura ambiente durante otros 20 minutos. Transfiera al refrigerador para que repose durante aproximadamente 8 a 12 horas, o hasta que duplique su tamaño.","Para el streusel, mezcle la harina con el azúcar y una pizca de sal, luego frote con la mantequilla hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado fino. Mantener en el congelador hasta que esté listo para usar.","Para la natilla, mezcle el azúcar, la harina de maíz y ¼ de cucharadita de sal en un tazón pequeño. Agrega el huevo y bate para combinar, luego agrega la leche y reserva. Llevar a ebullición la nata y la vainilla en un cazo. Retirar del fuego y agregar la mezcla de huevo lentamente, batiendo continuamente. Cocine a fuego medio-bajo durante 7-10 minutos, batiendo todo el tiempo, hasta que quede suave y espeso. Retirar del fuego, tapar y dejar enfriar durante 30 minutos.","Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta que tenga 2 cm de espesor. Selle ocho círculos de 6 cm y use una cucharada para presionar en el centro de cada uno. Con las manos, estire cada círculo hasta unos 8 cm, manteniendo un borde elevado. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear grande forrada con papel para hornear y llene cada salsa con 1 cucharada de natillas. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Déjelos reposar en un lugar cálido durante 30 minutos hasta que vuelvan a saltar lentamente al presionarlos suavemente. Mezclar la clara de huevo con 1 cucharada de leche y una pizca de sal y untar con esto los lados de los bollos. Espolvorea con el streusel congelado.","Hornee durante 10 minutos, luego reduzca el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3 y hornee durante otros 8-10 minutos. Déjelo enfriar durante 30 minutos y luego sírvalo con fruta fresca o asada, si lo desea. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días. Servir a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15366,6147,'es','Latte de calabaza y especias','Ponte cómodo con un café con leche con especias de calabaza, perfecto para las frías noches de otoño e invierno. Con sabores de jengibre, canela, nuez moscada y calabaza, es una auténtica delicia.','["2 cucharaditas de puré de calabaza","una pizca de canela molida y un poco más para servir (o use especias de calabaza)","pizca de jengibre molido","pizca de nuez moscada molida","30ml de espresso o café fuerte","250 ml de leche (cualquiera servirá)"]','["Pon el puré de calabaza en un vaso o taza grande resistente al calor. Agregue las especias y el espresso o café fuerte.","Calienta la leche en una cacerola a fuego lento hasta que esté humeante y espumosa. Vierta en el vaso o taza y vierta sobre la espuma. Revuelva para combinar, luego espolvoree con más canela o un poco de especia de calabaza antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15367,6153,'es','Tarta de queso con plátano al horno','Olvídate del pan de plátano, utiliza fruta demasiado madura en esta tarta de queso baja en azúcar con base de chocolate y nueces y cobertura de ricotta y yogur.','["50 g de mantequilla","75 g de galletas de avena, finamente trituradas","50 g de galletas de nata","1 cucharada de cacao, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharada de maní salado, muy finamente picado, más 1 cucharada para esparcir (opcional)","2 plátanos pequeños maduros","jugo 1 limon","2 tarrinas de ricota de 250 g","Tarrina de 200 g de yogur griego","4 huevos grandes","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla sin azúcar","2 cucharadas de harina de maíz","200ml de nata doble"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrasar ligeramente un molde para pastel antiadherente de base suelta de 22 cm. Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén y agregue las galletas de avena, las galletas saladas, el cacao y el maní picado hasta que estén bien cubiertos. Presione en la base del molde para formar una capa firme, luego hornee por 10 minutos. Retirar del horno y subir el fuego a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9.","Para hacer la cobertura, machaca los plátanos con el jugo de limón en un tazón grande, luego agrega la ricota, el yogur, los huevos, la vainilla y la maicena hasta que todo esté muy bien mezclado. Vierta sobre la base de galleta y hornee por 10 minutos, luego baje el horno a 110C/90C ventilador/gas 1/4 y cocine por 25 minutos más. Apagar el horno y dejar enfriar la tarta de queso dentro. Cuando esté frío, dejar enfriar durante 3-4 horas. (Enfriar la tarta de queso de esta manera debería evitar que se agriete).","Para servir, retira la tarta de queso del molde y deslízala sobre un plato. Batir la crema hasta que mantenga su forma, luego extender sobre la parte superior de la tarta de queso, espolvorear ligeramente con cacao y esparcir sobre los cacahuetes."]','2026-01-11 13:08:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15368,6161,'es','Pan de jengibre','Lebkuchen, una galleta alemana similar al pan de jengibre, es fácil de hacer y un excelente regalo navideño.','["250 g de harina común","85 g de almendras molidas","2 cucharaditas de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","200ml de miel clara","1 limón, ralladura fina","85 g de mantequilla","pellizque cada uno de los clavos molidos, la nuez moscada rallada y la pimienta negra.","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","100 g de azúcar glas","1 clara de huevo batida"]','["Vierta los ingredientes secos en un tazón grande. Calienta la miel y la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego lento hasta que la mantequilla se derrita, luego vierte en la mezcla de harina junto con la ralladura de limón. Mezcle bien hasta que la masa esté combinada y bastante sólida. Tapar y dejar enfriar.","Caliente el horno a 180 ° C / ventilador 160 ° C / gas 4. Con las manos, enrolle la masa en aproximadamente 30 bolas, cada una de 3 cm de ancho, luego aplánelas ligeramente hasta formar un disco. Divida las galletas entre dos bandejas para hornear forradas con papel para hornear, dejando espacio para que se expandan. Hornee durante 15 minutos y luego enfríe sobre una rejilla.","Para glasear las galletas, mezcle el azúcar glas, la clara de huevo y 1-2 cucharadas de agua para formar un glaseado suave y líquido. Sumerge la parte superior de cada galleta en el glaseado y unta con el dorso de un cuchillo. Dejar secar en un lugar cálido."]','2026-01-11 13:08:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15369,6163,'es','Tarta de limón sin azúcar','Endulzado con xilitol totalmente natural, este bizcocho tiene una textura densa y almibarada y se conserva bien durante unos días.','["225 g de harina con levadura, tamizada","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","225 g de xilitol (ver consejo a continuación)","2 limones, solo la ralladura","2 huevos grandes, a temperatura ambiente","125 ml de aceite de girasol","1 cucharada de leche","200 g de yogur griego 0% grasa","1 limón, solo jugo","50 g de xilitol"]','["Precaliente el horno a 180 ° C / 160 ° C con ventilador / Gas 4. Engrase y forre un molde para pan de 1,2 litros (22 cm x 13 cm de ancho, 7 cm de profundidad) con papel para hornear. Mezcle la harina, el polvo para hornear, el xilitol y la ralladura de limón en un tazón grande.","Mezcle los huevos, el aceite de girasol, la leche y el yogur en un recipiente o jarra aparte y revuélvalos con la mezcla de harina.","Vierta en una lata y alise la superficie. Transfiera al horno inmediatamente, hornee en el estante central del horno durante 1 hora – 1 hora 10 minutos. Verifique después de 50 minutos, si el pastel se está oscureciendo demasiado, cúbralo sin apretar con papel de aluminio.","Justo antes de finalizar el tiempo de cocción, preparar el chorrito calentando el zumo de limón y el xilitol. Remueve a fuego lento hasta que el xilitol se haya disuelto. Una vez cocido el bizcocho, sácalo del horno y vierte sobre el chorrito.","Dejar enfriar en el molde antes de desmoldar."]','2026-01-11 13:08:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15370,6165,'es','malvaviscos de zarza','La lectora de Good Food, Natasha Lee, le da a los malvaviscos un toque estacional al agregar moras, para un regalo dulce y casero.','["50 g de azúcar glas","50 g de harina de maíz","9 hojas de gelatina","450 g de azúcar granulada","1 cucharada de glucosa líquida (encuéntrala en el pasillo de horneado)","2 claras de huevo grandes","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","140 g de moras"]','["En un bol mezclar el azúcar glas\r\ncon la maicena y reservar.\r\nDisolver la gelatina en 150ml.\r\nagua caliente en una jarra resistente al calor. Línea\r\nun molde de 20cm x 30cm con horneado\r\npergamino y espolvorear con un poco\r\nde la mezcla de azúcar glas. Pon el\r\nazúcar granulada y glucosa líquida\r\nen una cacerola de fondo grueso con\r\n200 ml de agua. Cocine a fuego lento\r\nhasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto\r\ncompletamente, sube el fuego y\r\nhervir hasta que la mezcla esté firme\r\netapa de bola en un termómetro de azúcar\r\n(125C/256F): alrededor de 10 a 15 minutos.\r\nSi no tienes un termómetro,\r\necha un poco de la mezcla en un vaso\r\nde agua muy fría – si se pone en\r\nuna bola blanda, está lista. Mientras que el\r\nEl azúcar está hirviendo, use un electrodoméstico.\r\nbatir para batir las claras hasta\r\nrígido. Cuando el almíbar alcanza el\r\netapa correcta, viértalo en la jarra con\r\nel agua de gelatina; ten cuidado ya que\r\nestará muy caliente y puede burbujear.","Continuar batiendo el huevo.\r\nclaras mientras se vierte el almíbar\r\nen un flujo constante, luego agregando\r\nel extracto de vainilla – la mezcla\r\nSe pondrá brillante y comenzará a espesarse.\r\nContinúe batiendo durante aproximadamente\r\n10 minutos hasta que esté muy rígido. Vierta la mitad\r\nla mezcla de clara de huevo en el molde,\r\nluego esparcir sobre las bayas. arriba\r\ncon la mezcla restante y\r\ndejar en un lugar fresco y seco\r\ndejar reposar durante al menos 2 horas hasta que esté firme.","Coloque una bandeja grande para hornear.\r\npergamino sobre una tabla de cortar\r\ny espolvorear sobre el glaseado restante\r\nmezcla de azúcar. Voltear los malvaviscos\r\nsacar y cortar en cuadritos, enrollarlos\r\nen la mezcla de azúcar. Mantener en un lugar hermético\r\nrecipiente, pero es mejor comerlo ese mismo día."]','2026-01-11 13:08:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15371,6173,'es','Orzo de puerro, guisantes y espinacas','Consiga tres de sus cinco al día con este brillante plato de orzo repleto de fibra prebiótica beneficiosa para el intestino. Puedes cambiar las verduras por cualquier alternativa de temporada.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente picados","320 g de puerros cortados finamente","250 g de cebada","320 g de guisantes congelados","10 g de ramitas de estragón, hojas recogidas","320 g de espinacas","½ limón, rallado y en jugo","2 cucharadas de crema fresca"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe el ajo durante 3-4 minutos hasta que esté suave y dorado. Añade los puerros y una pizca de sal. Cocine durante 6-8 minutos hasta que estén suaves y marchitos.","Mientras tanto, cocina el orzo siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir reservando un poco del agua de cocción.","Agrega los guisantes, el estragón y dos puñados grandes de espinacas a los puerros. Cocine hasta que las espinacas se ablanden antes de agregar más, cocinando en tandas hasta que se hayan incorporado todas las espinacas. Sazone bien y agregue un chorrito del agua reservada para cocinar la pasta. Agregue la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el orzo y la crema fresca, junto con otro chorrito de agua de cocción para ajustar la consistencia según sea necesario. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15372,6177,'es','Sopa de chirivía especiada en olla de cocción lenta','¿Te sobraron algunas chirivías de tu asado del domingo? Les encantará esta sopa de curry vegana y especiada. La receta está hecha en una olla de cocción lenta.','["750 g de chirivías, peladas y picadas","400 g de zanahorias picadas","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados o finamente rallados","1-2 cucharadas de curry en polvo (o al gusto)","1 litro de caldo de verduras"]','["Coloque las chirivías, las zanahorias, las cebollas, el ajo y el curry en polvo en una olla de cocción lenta y mezcle bien para que todas las verduras queden cubiertas con el curry en polvo. Vierta el caldo de verduras, vuelva a mezclar y sazone bien.","Cocine a fuego lento durante 8 horas. Transfiera a la licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Si prefieres la sopa un poco más suelta, puedes agregar unos chorritos de agua hervida del hervidor. Divida en tazones y sazone con pimienta negra molida antes de servir. Una vez completamente fría, la sopa se mantendrá congelada hasta por tres meses. Descongele completamente en el refrigerador durante la noche, luego vuelva a calentar en una sartén hasta que esté bien caliente antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15373,6179,'es','Arroz con cinco especias en una olla','Comience con ½ cucharadita de cinco especias en este arroz especiado, ya que tiene un sabor bastante fuerte, pero es posible que desee agregar más. Es un plato principal vegetal abundante y saludable.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","25 g de jengibre, pelado y finamente rallado","½-1 cucharadita de polvo de cinco especias chinas","1 chile fresco, sin semillas y en rodajas","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en cubitos","200 g de arroz integral de fácil cocción","650 ml de caldo de verduras, elaborado con 2 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo","420 g de judías mixtas congeladas (habas, guisantes y judías verdes)","½ paquete de cebolletas (unas 8), cortadas y cortadas en rodajas","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","75 g de anacardos tostados"]','["Calienta el aceite de colza en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe el ajo y el jengibre durante 5 minutos. Agregue las cinco especias, el chile, los pimientos y el arroz, luego vierta el caldo, cubra bien y cocine por 15 minutos.","Agregue los frijoles congelados y las cebolletas, luego cubra y cocine por 10 minutos. Verifique que el arroz esté tierno; si no, déjalo por 5 minutos más. Apague el fuego, agregue el aceite de sésamo y déjelo reposar tapado durante 5 minutos.","Divida el arroz en dos tazones y esparza sobre la mitad de los anacardos. Deje que el resto se enfríe por completo durante un día más. Se mantendrá frío en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días. Vuelva a calentar en el microondas hasta que esté bien caliente, luego agregue los anacardos."]','2026-01-11 13:08:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15374,6181,'es','Guiso de garbanzos picante','Prepare una comida abundante que fomente las bacterias intestinales saludables con este guiso de garbanzos y coliflor. Los garbanzos, una valiosa proteína de origen vegetal, están llenos de fibra.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cebollas (320 g), picadas en trozos grandes","2 pimientos verdes, sin semillas y cortados en cubos","2 cucharaditas de chile picante en polvo","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de comino molido","Cartón de puré de 500 ml","2 latas de garbanzos de 400 g","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","40 g de pasas flameadas","½ limón, exprimido, sin pulpa y médula blanca, luego ralladura finamente picada (necesitará 2 cucharaditas)","350 g de floretes de coliflor","15 g de perejil picado","140 g de cuscús integral","40 g de almendras laminadas tostadas"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande con tapa a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas durante 10 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia hasta que estén doradas. Agregue los pimientos y cocine por 5 minutos más.","Agrega la guindilla en polvo, el cilantro y el comino, revuelve brevemente y luego agrega la passata y los garbanzos junto con el líquido de las latas.","Agrega el caldo en polvo, las pasas y la ralladura de limón, luego agrega la coliflor. Cubra bien y cocine a fuego medio durante 15-20 minutos hasta que la coliflor esté tierna. Agrega la mitad del perejil.","Mientras tanto, ponga el cuscús en un recipiente resistente al calor y vierta sobre 175 ml de agua hirviendo del hervidor. Agrega el jugo de limón, luego tapa y deja reposar durante unos 10 minutos hasta que el cuscús haya absorbido el líquido y esté tierno. Agregue las almendras tostadas en hojuelas y la mayor parte del perejil restante.","Divida la mitad del cuscús en dos platos y cubra con la mitad del guiso de garbanzos y el resto del perejil. Deje que el resto se enfríe durante un día más. Se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado hasta por tres días. Vuelve a calentar el guiso en una sartén a fuego lento con un chorrito de agua hasta que esté bien caliente. Recalentar el cuscús en el microondas."]','2026-01-11 13:08:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15375,6183,'es','Sopa de maíz, coco y lentejas','Sirva nuestra saludable sopa de maíz, coco y lentejas para el almuerzo. Las lentejas, las cebollas y el maíz dulce aportan a este plato fibra valiosa para un sistema digestivo saludable.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cebollas picadas (320 g)","4 dientes de ajo, picados","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y picados","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo mediano","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma molida","250 g de lentejas rojas","2 l de caldo de verduras, elaborado con 3 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo","600 g de maíz dulce congelado","600 g de patatas, cortadas en cubos pequeños","280 g de yogur de coco","10 g de cilantro picado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas durante 8 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el ajo, los chiles, el curry en polvo, las semillas de comino, la cúrcuma y las lentejas, y cocine por unos minutos más, sin dejar de revolver. Vierta el caldo y el maíz dulce. Llevar a ebullición, luego tapar, reducir el fuego y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos, o hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas.","Retirar del fuego y batir brevemente la sopa con una batidora de mano; no querrás que quede completamente suave. Agrega las patatas, luego tapa y vuelve a llevar a fuego medio durante 10-15 minutos más, o hasta que las patatas estén tiernas. Retirar del fuego y agregar el yogur y el cilantro.","Sirva dos tazones de inmediato. Deje que el resto de la sopa se enfríe por completo y luego manténgala fría por hasta cuatro días. Vuelva a calentar en una sartén a fuego lento hasta que esté bien caliente. Esta receta es parte de nuestro plan de dieta saludable gratuito de 7 días. Para acceder al plan de alimentación completo, haga clic aquí."]','2026-01-11 13:08:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15376,6185,'es','Alu tamatar masala','Prueba este plato vegano de patatas cocidas en tomate masala. Es sencillo de hacer, pero con tomates cocidos con especias y hojas de curry, está lleno de sabor.','["6 patatas medianas (aproximadamente 1 kg), picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza negra","6-8 hojas de curry","1 chile verde, en rodajas finas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2,5 cm de jengibre pelado y finamente picado","5 tomates medianos, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de garam masala","½ cucharadita de chile en polvo","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","un puñado de hojas de cilantro"]','["Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua a fuego medio-alto y cocine las patatas durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que estén tiernas (un cuchillo para cubiertos debería poder cortar). Escurrir y reservar.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego lento y agrega las semillas de mostaza. Cuando empiecen a reventar, añade las hojas de curry, la guindilla, el ajo y el jengibre y cocina durante 1 min hasta que los aromas empiecen a liberarse. Agregue los tomates, luego cubra y cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que estén suaves y blandos.","Agrega el garam masala, el chile en polvo, la cúrcuma y 1 cucharadita de sal. Mezcle bien y cocine por un minuto más antes de agregar las papas cocidas. Vierta 200 ml de agua, tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que las patatas estén completamente tiernas. Triture algunas patatas con un machacador de patatas y mantenga el resto entero. Espolvorea sobre las hojas de cilantro para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15377,6187,'es','Ensalada de tres judías con mozzarella','Esta sustanciosa ensalada presenta una deliciosa mezcla de cannellini, riñones y judías verdes, y es ideal para un picnic de verano.','["320 g de frijoles finos, con las puntas cortadas y cortados por la mitad si son grandes","4 zanahorias (320 g), cortadas en bastones finos","2 cebollas moradas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas","Lata de 400 g de judías rojas, escurridas","320 g de tomates baby de varios colores (los nuestros eran rojos, amarillos y naranjas), cortados por la mitad","15 g de hojas de albahaca, cortadas en trozos grandes","120 g de mozzarella vegetariana, cortada en cubos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1-2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","½-1 cucharadita de orégano seco","1 cucharadita de mostaza inglesa seca en polvo","15 aceitunas Kalamata deshuesadas (unos 45 g), en rodajas","½ cucharadita de ralladura de limón y 2 cucharadas de jugo"]','["Hierva o cocine al vapor las judías verdes y las zanahorias durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Pon las cebollas cortadas en rodajas en un bol y vierte sobre agua hirviendo hasta cubrirlas.","Mientras tanto, haz el aderezo. Mezcle todos los ingredientes en un tazón grande.","Vierta los frijoles y las zanahorias cocidos en el aderezo junto con las cebollas escurridas, los frijoles enlatados y los tomates, revuelva bien, luego agregue la albahaca y revuelva nuevamente. Sirva espolvoreado con mozzarella y un poco de pimienta negra, si lo desea. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:08:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15378,6191,'es','Ensalada de garbanzos, berenjena asada y queso feta','Esta ensalada para compartir contiene dos de tus 5 al día y está llena de sabor. Asegúrese de que el queso feta sea vegetariano si es necesario.','["1 berenjena grande o 2 medianas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1 limón, exprimido","2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos","un puñado pequeño de menta, finamente picada, más algunas hojas enteras para servir","2 cucharadas de piñones tostados","200 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Cortar la berenjena en rodajas finas a lo largo en trozos de 1 cm de grosor y luego cortar cada una en tres tiras. Mezcle con 2 cucharadas de aceite y un poco de sal. Calienta una sartén a fuego alto o hasta que casi humee, luego cocina las tiras durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén tiernas. Transfiera a un tazón grande (también puede asarlos si lo prefiere).","Mezcle las hojuelas de chile, el jugo de limón y el aceite restante junto con un poco de condimento. Vierta los garbanzos en el bol con la berenjena, agregue el aderezo y la menta, luego mezcle todo. Vierta en una fuente para servir, esparza los piñones y el queso feta y esparza algunas hojas de menta para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15379,6193,'es','patatas parmentier','Sirva patatas parmentier en lugar de patatas fritas o asados ​​para un acompañamiento más elegante. Este es un plato clásico condimentado con romero y ajo, y es fácil de preparar.','["1 kg de patatas harinosas, peladas y cortadas en cubos de 2 cm","4 dientes de ajo machacados","2 ramitas de romero, agujas recogidas y finamente picadas","4 cucharadas de aceite vegetal"]','["Vierta las patatas en una cacerola grande con agua fría y sazone con una pizca grande de sal. Llevar a ebullición a fuego alto, luego escurrir inmediatamente y dejar secar al vapor durante unos minutos en un colador.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Coloca las patatas en una bandeja para horno grande junto con los dientes de ajo, el romero y el aceite. Sazone bien, luego mezcle todo bien para que cada cubo de papa quede cubierto con aceite. Agite la bandeja suavemente para esparcir las patatas en una sola capa rugosa. Ase durante 30-35 minutos, dándoles la vuelta a la mitad, hasta que las patatas estén doradas y crujientes por fuera y tiernas al pincharlas con un tenedor. Sirva con cordero asado, pescado o como alternativa a patatas fritas o asadas."]','2026-01-11 13:08:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15380,6195,'es','Patatas al horno freidora','Intente hornear papas en una freidora para lograr una piel crujiente con un centro esponjoso. El proceso es más rápido y más eficiente energéticamente que usar el horno.','["4 patatas asadas (de unos 250 g cada una)","½ cucharada de aceite de girasol","aderezos de su elección, como mantequilla, queso, frijoles horneados o mayonesa de atún"]','["Frote las patatas y luego séquelas con papel de cocina. Transfiera a un plato, rocíe sobre el aceite y frótelo sobre la piel con las manos para que las patatas queden bien cubiertas. Sazone con sal y pimienta; la sal ayudará a que la piel quede crujiente.","Coloque las patatas en una sola capa en una cesta para freír. Configure la freidora a 200 ° C y cocine durante 40 a 50 minutos, o hasta que un cuchillo afilado atraviese las papas fácilmente. Revise las papas después de 20 minutos; si parece que se están dorando demasiado rápido por un lado, déles la vuelta con unas pinzas y luego verifique nuevamente después de otros 20 minutos para asegurarse de que estén bien cocidas.  Cuando esté listo, la piel debe estar crujiente y el interior tierno y esponjoso. Divida y sirva inmediatamente con los aderezos de su elección."]','2026-01-11 13:08:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15381,6197,'es','Empanadas especiadas de espinacas y patatas','Prepare un lote de estos pasteles de verduras al curry para guardarlos en el congelador y disfrutar de un almuerzo fácil con ensalada o un entrante caliente. Comer como una empanada con chutney de mango','["3 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino, más una pizca para espolvorear","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente rallado","6 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo","500 g de patatas cortadas en trozos pequeños","200 g de espinacas, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de garam masala","1 huevo","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma","500 g de masa quebrada en bloque (ver consejo a continuación)","harina común, para espolvorear","chutney de mango o pepinillo de lima, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén honda que tenga tapa o en una cacerola grande a fuego medio. Cocine las semillas de comino en el aceite durante unos segundos hasta que empiecen a crujir, luego agregue el jengibre y el ajo y cocine por un minuto más. Incorpora el curry en polvo y cocina por un minuto más. Revuelva las papas hasta que estén completamente cubiertas con la mezcla de especias y cocine por 4 minutos.","Vierta unos 75 ml de agua sobre las patatas y sazone con sal. Tapa y cocina a fuego medio-alto durante 6-8 minutos, hasta que las patatas estén cocidas y se haya absorbido la mayor parte del agua. Agrega las espinacas, tapa la sartén y cocina por un minuto. Retire la tapa y cocine por otros 5 minutos hasta que las espinacas estén completamente blandas y no quede líquido en la sartén. Apagar el fuego y sazonar con el garam masala. Dejar enfriar. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días.","Para montar las tartas, mezcla en un bol el huevo con la cúrcuma y una pizca de sal y reserva. Extienda la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de una libra y corte cuatro círculos de unos 12 cm de ancho y colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel de hornear. Coloque una cuarta parte de la mezcla de papa en el centro de cada círculo de masa, dejando un borde. Vuelva a enrollar los restos de masa y luego corte cuatro círculos más, de unos 8 cm de ancho. Cepille los bordes de los círculos de masa más grandes con el huevo especiado y luego cubra los círculos más pequeños sobre el relleno de papa. Pellizca los bordes para sellar. Unte las tartas con más huevo especiado y espolvoree sobre una pizca de semillas de comino. Se mantendrá congelado hasta por dos meses. Descongela completamente antes de hornear.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7 y hornea las tartas durante 30-35 minutos hasta que estén bien doradas. Deje enfriar un poco, luego disfrútelo tibio o déjelo enfriar por completo y cómelo como una empanada con chutney de mango o pepinillo de lima. Se mantendrá refrigerado durante dos días en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 13:08:14');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15382,6199,'es','Macarrones con queso con champiñones silvestres','Dale a los macarrones con queso un cambio de imagen con champiñones para una comida familiar congelada. Usar hongos silvestres secos significa que no tienes que esperar hasta que estén en temporada.','["25 g de champiñones secos (los champiñones secos mixtos o los boletus son buenos)","75 g de mantequilla","200 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas","50 g de harina común","500ml de leche entera","1 cucharadita de mostaza inglesa en polvo o mostaza inglesa","350 g de macarrones u otra pasta corta","rallado de nuez moscada","150 g de queso cheddar extra maduro, rallado","50 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado","25 g de pan rallado panko (opcional)"]','["Coloque los champiñones secos en un recipiente resistente al calor, viértalos sobre agua caliente del hervidor hasta que estén cubiertos y luego déjelos en remojo hasta que se enfríen. Mientras tanto, calentar aproximadamente un tercio de la mantequilla en una sartén hasta que chisporrotee y esparcir las setas castañas. Sazone y fría durante 4-5 minutos a fuego alto hasta que estén suaves y bien cocidos. Dejar de lado. Cuando los champiñones secos estén fríos, escúrralos sobre un recipiente para recoger el jugo del remojo, presiónelos para exprimir todo el líquido y luego pique en trozos grandes.","Caliente todo menos ½ cucharadita de la mantequilla restante en una cacerola grande a fuego alto hasta que chisporrotee, luego agregue los champiñones rehidratados y fríalos durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén bien dorados. Esparza la harina y revuelva para hacer una pasta arenosa. Cocine durante 2 minutos, luego vierta gradualmente el líquido de remojo de champiñones reservado, dejando los sedimentos en el fondo del recipiente. Cocine a fuego lento hasta que espese, luego revuelva o bata gradualmente la leche hasta que esté completamente incorporada a la salsa. Añade la mostaza en polvo o mostaza y sazona al gusto con una ralladura de nuez moscada y un poco de sal y pimienta. Deja que la salsa se cocine suavemente a fuego medio-bajo. Mientras tanto, cocine los macarrones en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 2 minutos menos de lo que indica el paquete.","Cuando los macarrones estén listos, escúrralos bien y vuélvalos a colocar en la cacerola. Vierta sobre la salsa de champiñones, agregue los champiñones castaños fritos, todo el queso cheddar y la mitad del parmesano, luego revuelva todo vigorosamente hasta que esté completamente combinado. Use lo que queda de mantequilla para untar la cazuela y luego agregue la mezcla de macarrones y champiñones. Esparza con el queso parmesano restante y el pan rallado, si lo usa. Se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado hasta por dos días o en el congelador hasta por tres meses. Descongelar completamente en el frigorífico antes de hornear.","Cuando esté listo para cocinar, caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Hornee durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante. Dejar reposar unos minutos, luego llevar a la mesa y servir directamente del plato."]','2026-01-11 13:08:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15383,6205,'es','Brotes crujientes de ajo y parmesano','¡Olvídate de las coles de Bruselas empapadas! Arregle un acompañamiento navideño clásico con la ayuda de una cobertura dorada y crujiente de parmesano y pan rallado.','["600 g de coles de Bruselas cortadas por la mitad","50 g de mantequilla, derretida","2 dientes de ajo machacados","50 g de pan rallado panko","25 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, finamente rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta los brotes en un bol, rocíe sobre la mantequilla derretida, agregue el ajo y sazone. Mezcle los brotes hasta que estén bien cubiertos con mantequilla, luego agregue el pan rallado y el parmesano y mezcle nuevamente.","Coloca los brotes en una bandeja para hornear, asegurándote de que estén bien espaciados en una sola capa. (Si están demasiado apretados, se cocinarán al vapor en lugar de asarse). Coloque tantos como sea posible con el lado cortado hacia abajo para que queden crujientes al máximo. Presione el exceso de migajas sobre los brotes para ayudar a que se peguen.","Ase durante 25-30 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:08:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15384,6207,'es','Zanahorias Heritage con granola de avellanas','Pruebe estas zanahorias caramelizadas con nueces como guarnición espectacular. Puedes preparar la granola con hasta dos días de anticipación y guardarla en un recipiente hermético.','["400 g de zanahorias baby, lavadas y cortadas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 ramitas de tomillo","½ cucharada de mantequilla","40 g de miel","50 g de avena","25 g de semillas de girasol","25 g de avellanas","100 g de mantequilla","4 zanahorias grandes, cortadas en rodajas finas","80 g de mimolette o leicester rojo, finamente rallado"]','["Primero, haz la granola. Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Derretir la mantequilla con la miel en el microondas durante 40 segundos. Tuesta la avena, las semillas y las avellanas en una bandeja para horno durante 5 minutos. Retirar del horno, mezclar con la mezcla de mantequilla derretida y regresar al horno por otros 8 minutos. Revuelve bien y luego regresa al horno por otros 8 minutos hasta que la granola esté dorada y tostada. Sazone con sal y déjelo enfriar. Puede prepararse con hasta dos días de anticipación y guardarse en un recipiente hermético.","Subir el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Poner las zanahorias baby en papel de aluminio con un chorrito de aceite de oliva, el tomillo y un poco de condimento. Envolver en un sobre y hornear por 20 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos.","Mientras tanto, hacer el puré calentando 80g de mantequilla en una sartén y sofreír las rodajas de zanahoria con 50ml de agua hasta que empiecen a caramelizar. Manténgalo a fuego lento durante unos 15 minutos hasta que tenga un color intenso y esté completamente tierno. Dejar enfriar un poco y luego poner en la licuadora. Licue con 25 ml de agua hasta que quede suave y luego sazone.","Derrita los 20 g de mantequilla restantes y cocine hasta que se doren con olor a nuez. Para servir, divida el puré en dos platos. Corta las zanahorias baby en dos o tres trozos y colócalas encima del puré. Rociar con un poco de mantequilla dorada, espolvorear cantidades generosas de granola y terminar con un rallamiento de queso y una pizca de sal marina."]','2026-01-11 13:08:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15385,6211,'es','Pastel de queso y cebolla','Haz un esfuerzo extra para hacer este pastel de queso y cebolla y seguro que te gustará. Con repostería casera, tan buena para comer fría como calentita','["250 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","50 g de harina de centeno (o completar el peso con harina común)","una pizca grande de pimienta de cayena","1 cucharadita de semillas de cebolla","25 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, finamente rallado","125 g de mantequilla fría, en cubos","1 huevo batido","40 g de mantequilla","3 cebollas grandes, finamente cortadas","2 hojas de laurel","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo","1 patata mediana (unos 350 g), cortada por la mitad a lo largo y en rodajas","100ml de nata doble","150 g de queso cheddar extra maduro, ½ rallado y ½ picado en trozos pequeños"]','["Primero, haz la masa. Vierta las harinas en un tazón mediano con la cayena, las semillas de cebolla, el parmesano y una pizca generosa de sal. Frote la mantequilla hasta que la mezcla parezca pan rallado, luego vierta la mitad del huevo y 2 cucharadas de agua fría y junte todo con las manos. Amasar un par de veces hasta que quede suave. Aplana un tercio de la masa formando un disco y luego haz lo mismo con el resto de la masa. Envuelva ambos discos de masa y enfríelos en el refrigerador durante al menos 30 minutos. Se mantendrá frío hasta por dos días.","Mientras tanto, haz el relleno. Calentar la mantequilla en una cacerola a fuego medio hasta que chisporrotee, luego esparcir la cebolla, el laurel, el tomillo, una pizca grande de sal y pimienta negra bien molida. Revuelva, luego cocine lentamente durante 10 minutos hasta que las cebollas se cocinen y comiencen a caramelizar. Agregue las papas en rodajas, cubra y cocine durante 8 a 10 minutos más, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que las papas estén suaves y comiencen a desmoronarse. Agrega la nata, retira la cacerola del fuego y deja enfriar. Una vez frío, retire y deseche la bahía, luego agregue el queso.","Extienda el disco de masa más pequeño sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta alcanzar el tamaño de un plato y levántelo sobre una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Extienda el disco de masa restante junto con los restos hasta formar un círculo de unos 5 cm más ancho que el primero. Coloque el relleno en el centro del círculo más pequeño de la bandeja para hornear, dejando un borde de 4 cm. Cepille el borde expuesto con un poco del huevo batido restante y luego cubra el círculo de masa más grande. Meta el borde alrededor del relleno para encerrarlo, como si estuviera haciendo un ravioli gigante. Recorte el borde para que quede limpio y luego engarce con el mango de un cuchillo o un tenedor para sellar. Cepille todo el pastel con la mayor parte del huevo batido restante y use los recortes para hacer decoraciones, si lo desea.","Calienta el horno a 210C/190C ventilador/gas 7. Hornea el pastel durante 35-40 minutos hasta que esté bien dorado, untándolo con el resto del huevo batido a la mitad. Déjelo enfriar en la bandeja para hornear durante al menos 20 minutos antes de cortarlo en gajos, o déjelo enfriar por completo y sirva frío."]','2026-01-11 13:08:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15386,6213,'es','Chocolate caliente chai vegano','No renuncies al sabor ni a la consistencia cremosa con el chocolate caliente vegano; esta bebida especiada hecha con leche de avena es perfecta para calentar el invierno','["350 ml de leche de avena (use estilo barista para obtener una textura cremosa)","1 cucharadita de cacao en polvo orgánico","½ cucharadita de canela molida, más un poco más para servir (opcional)","½ cucharadita de nuez moscada molida, más un poco más para servir (opcional)","1 vaina de cardamomo","½ cucharadita de café molido","1 vaina de vainilla orgánica, partida (o use 1 cucharada de extracto de vainilla)","1 cucharada de néctar de agave","crema batida vegana y chocolate negro vegano semidulce rallado, para servir (opcional)"]','["Vierta dos tercios de la leche de avena en una cacerola. Agrega el cacao, la canela, la nuez moscada, la vaina de cardamomo y el café. Llevar a ebullición a fuego medio-alto. Cocine durante 1-2 minutos.","Reduzca el fuego a medio y agregue la vainilla y el agave. Espuma el resto de la leche de avena con un espumador de leche eléctrico o con el minibatidor de una batidora de mano. Cuela el chocolate caliente en dos tazas, desechando la canela y la vaina de cardamomo, luego vierte suavemente la leche espumosa.","Cubra con crema batida, virutas de chocolate y una pizca de canela y nuez moscada, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:08:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15387,6221,'es','Filete de coliflor con queso y judías cannellini gratinadas con migas de salvia','Disfrute de esta coliflor con queso y frijoles cannellini gratinados como plato central vegetal en un festín familiar, o pruébelo como guarnición para acompañar un plato principal de carne.','["1 coliflor grande o 2 pequeñas (aproximadamente 1 kg)","50 g de mantequilla","50 g de harina común","500ml de leche","2 hojas de laurel","200 g de queso cheddar maduro, rallado","1 cucharadita de mostaza inglesa en polvo","manojo pequeño de salvia, hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","2 latas de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","75 g de mozzarella rallada","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, machacado","50 g de pan rallado seco","1 limón, rallado"]','["Retire las hojas de la coliflor, deseche las que tengan el tallo muy grueso o estén dañadas y reserve las más pequeñas. Corte la coliflor en cuatro a seis filetes o gajos a través del tallo para ayudar a mantener los floretes adheridos. Corta los floretes que se caigan en trozos del mismo tamaño.","Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua con sal y cocine los filetes de coliflor durante 5 a 6 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Agregue las hojas reservadas y los floretes sueltos durante los últimos 2 minutos de cocción. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor mientras se prepara la salsa de queso.","Para hacer la salsa de queso, derrita la mantequilla en la misma sartén a fuego medio, luego espolvoree la harina, bata hasta obtener una pasta espesa, luego agregue gradualmente la leche, poco a poco, batiendo hasta que esté todo incorporado. Agregue las hojas de laurel y cocine por otros 5-6 minutos hasta que espese. Agregue el queso cheddar y la mostaza en polvo y sazone bien.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Vierta la mitad de la salvia y todos los frijoles en la salsa. Revuelva brevemente. Incorpora los floretes y las hojas de coliflor sueltas. Coloque los filetes de coliflor en una fuente para horno, luego vierta sobre la salsa de queso, asegurándose de que cubra bien los filetes. Espolvorea con la mozzarella y hornea por 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el aceite, el ajo, el pan rallado, la ralladura de limón y la salvia restante en un bol.","Retire la fuente del horno y esparza sobre la mezcla de pan rallado. Hornee durante 15 minutos más hasta que un cuchillo de cocina atraviese fácilmente los filetes de coliflor y la parte superior esté dorada y burbujeante. Dejar reposar 5 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15388,6223,'es','Patata, brotes rallados y castañas gratinadas','Disfrute de este gratinado vegetariano con verduras invernales o como guarnición cremosa en un banquete familiar. Con coles y castañas, es un plato maravillosamente festivo.','["3 dientes de ajo","400ml de nata doble","400ml de leche entera","1 cebolla, cortada en cuatro rodajas gruesas","1 hoja de laurel, arrugada","unas cuantas bolas de mantequilla, y más para el plato","1 kg de patatas harinosas, cortadas en rodajas muy finas","250 g de castañas enteras cocidas, picadas en trozos grandes","250 g de coles de Bruselas, ralladas","125 g de queso cheddar rallado","rallado de nuez moscada"]','["Machacar los dientes de ajo pelados con la hoja de un cuchillo y ponerlos en una cacerola grande con la nata, la leche, las rodajas de cebolla, el laurel y 2 cucharaditas de sal marina. Llevar a ebullición a fuego lento. Cuando la mezcla esté burbujeando, retirar del fuego y dejar en infusión durante 1 hora.","Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3 y unte generosamente con mantequilla una fuente para hornear grande y profunda. Tamice la leche infundida sobre un bol y deseche la cebolla, el laurel y el ajo (puede reservarlos para usarlos en una salsa de pan, si lo desea). Colocar una capa de patatas en la fuente y esparcir por encima algunas de las castañas, los brotes, el queso y un poco de nuez moscada. Rocíe un poco de la mezcla de leche infundida. Repita hasta haber usado todos los ingredientes, terminando con una capa de papas, luego cubra con lo último de la mezcla de leche infundida. Ponga encima unos cuantos trozos pequeños de mantequilla.","Hornee el gratinado durante 1 hora y 15 minutos en el estante central del horno hasta que esté dorado y crujiente por encima. Un cuchillo insertado en el medio debe deslizarse fácilmente. Deje reposar el gratinado durante 10 minutos y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:08:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15389,6225,'es','Wellington de champiñones y boniato','Sorprenda a familiares y amigos con este Wellington de champiñones y camote con arándanos. Es un plato central impresionante en una Navidad vegetariana.','["90 g de champiñones porcini secos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","250 g de champiñones castaños, finamente picados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","500 g de batatas (unas 2 grandes), peladas y cortadas en trozos de 2 cm","1 cucharada de romero finamente picado","1 cucharada de salvia finamente picada, más 4 hojas enteras","100 g de pan rallado blanco suave","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada (ver consejo a continuación)","40 g de nueces o pecanas picadas","40 g de arándanos secos","rallado de nuez moscada","2 láminas de hojaldre sin lácteos de 320 g","harina común, para espolvorear","3 cucharadas de leche vegetal","1 cucharada de mostaza inglesa o mostaza de Dijon con una pizca de cúrcuma"]','["Coloque los champiñones secos en un recipiente resistente al calor y vierta 500 ml de agua hirviendo del hervidor. Remuévelos y presiónalos para que queden bien cubiertos, luego déjalos en remojo.","Calentar el aceite de oliva en una sartén amplia a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla y los champiñones hasta que las verduras estén muy suaves y los champiñones parezcan marchitos y reducidos, unos 20 minutos.","Agrega el ajo y las batatas, luego los champiñones rehidratados y el líquido de remojo, dejando los últimos restos del líquido en el bol (esto puede contener arenilla de los champiñones). Tape y cocine durante 15 minutos hasta que las batatas se ablanden y la mayor parte del líquido se haya evaporado. Agrega un chorrito más de agua a la mitad si el líquido se evapora demasiado rápido.","Retire la tapa y agregue las hierbas picadas, el pan rallado, la melaza, las nueces y los arándanos. Sazone bien y espolvoree la nuez moscada. La mezcla debe estar lo suficientemente dura como para parecerse a un relleno, pero no seca; todo el pan rallado debe estar cubierto y haber absorbido parte del líquido. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar en la sartén.","Una vez frío, desenrolle una de las láminas de hojaldre sobre una bandeja para hornear antiadherente ligeramente enharinada o una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear. Batir la leche y la mostaza con una pizca de sal y reservar.","Coloque el relleno enfriado en el centro de la hoja de masa en una línea ordenada, dejando un borde de 5 cm alrededor de los bordes. Use la mezcla de mostaza y leche para cepillar los bordes, luego cubra con la segunda hoja de masa. Presione la masa alrededor del relleno para eliminar las bolsas de aire, luego pliegue para sellar los lados. Recorte el exceso de masa con un cuchillo afilado y use un tenedor o los dedos para hacer un patrón alrededor del borde del Wellington.","Corta un pequeño orificio de vapor en la parte superior del medio y luego cepilla la parte superior con la mezcla de mostaza y leche. Enfríe en la sábana o bandeja durante 30 minutos. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta dos días.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Sacar la Wellington del frigorífico y untar con más mezcla de mostaza y leche. Marque un patrón en la parte superior de la masa con un cuchillo o tenedor para cubiertos, si lo desea, luego hornee durante 35 a 40 minutos hasta que esté dorado, inflado y crujiente; cubra con papel de aluminio si se dora demasiado rápido. Coloca las hojas enteras de salvia encima de la Wellington y pégalas con la mezcla de mostaza y leche, luego regresa al horno por 10 minutos más.","Déjelo reposar sobre una tabla o fuente durante 10 minutos antes de cortarlo en rodajas gruesas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15390,6227,'es','Calabacines rellenos con crema de champiñones y estragón','Deleite a los invitados a la cena con estas calabazas tiernas rellenas, hechas con una mezcla de cereales, champiñones y estragón. Es un centro de mesa vegetariano ideal en Navidad.','["4 cebollas o calabaza bellota","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","50 g de setas silvestres secas","2 chalotes de plátano, pelados y cortados en rodajas","200 g de champiñones castaños, finamente picados","2 dientes de ajo machacados","100 ml de caldo de verduras","250 g de cereales mixtos cocidos","4 cucharadas de crema fresca","½ manojo pequeño de estragón, finamente picado","80 g de queso cheddar maduro, finamente rallado"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Con un cuchillo de sierra, corta un disco pequeño del fondo de cada calabaza para que queden en posición vertical sobre una bandeja para hornear. Corte la parte superior (se usará como tapa), saque y deseche el centro sin semillas. Frote 2 cucharadas de aceite por dentro y por fuera de las calabazas y luego sazone.","Vierta los champiñones secos en un recipiente resistente al calor y cúbralos con 100 ml de agua hirviendo. Tapar y dejar en remojo durante 15 minutos. Mientras tanto, caliente el aceite restante en una sartén antiadherente y cocine las chalotas durante 10 minutos hasta que estén blandas y traslúcidas. Escurre los champiñones rehidratados (reservando el líquido de remojo) y pícalos en trozos grandes, luego agrégalos a la sartén junto con los champiñones castaños. Freír por 10 minutos más. Agregue el ajo y cocine por un minuto más. Agregue el caldo, la mayor parte del líquido de remojo reservado (deje las últimas gotas en el fondo del recipiente, ya que puede contener arenilla) y los granos, y deje hervir. Retire del fuego y agregue la crema fresca, el estragón y el queso. Estación.","Divida el relleno entre las calabazas ahuecadas. Pon las “tapas” encima y hornea durante 1 h-1 h 10 min, dependiendo del tamaño de la calabaza. Cuando esté lista, la piel de la calabaza debe tener ampollas y la pulpa debe estar suave y bien cocida. Dejar reposar 10 minutos antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15391,6229,'es','Pastel de chirivía, queso feta y frijoles con mantequilla','¿Buscas un plato vegetariano espectacular? Lleno de chirivías, queso feta y frijoles mantecosos, este pastel es el centro de mesa navideño perfecto.','["400 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","150 g de harina de centeno","300 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo","2 huevos grandes, más 1 yema de huevo para glasear","pizca de tomillo seco o hierbas mixtas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, rebanada","600 g de chirivías, peladas y cortadas en cubos de 1 cm","2 huevos grandes","200 g de crema fresca","200 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","1/2 manojo pequeño de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","2 latas de 400 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","½ cucharadita de maza molida","1 limón, rallado"]','["Para hacer la masa, pon ambas harinas en el bol de un procesador de alimentos junto con la mantequilla, las hojas de tomillo y ½ cucharadita de sal marina fina. Pulse durante unos segundos hasta que la mezcla parezca arena arenosa, luego agregue los huevos enteros y 2-3 cucharadas de agua fría. Pulse nuevamente hasta que forme una bola, luego transfiérala a una superficie de trabajo ligeramente espolvoreada y amase brevemente hasta que quede suave. Envuelva y enfríe durante 30 minutos.","Para hacer el relleno, calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo y cocina la cebolla durante 30 minutos hasta que esté pegajosa, dorada y caramelizada. Esto llevará algo de tiempo, pero agregará profundidad y dulzura al pastel. Añade un chorrito de agua si las cebollas empiezan a oscurecerse demasiado rápido o a prenderse.","Añade las chirivías y 250 ml de agua. Cocine durante 15 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia hasta que el agua se haya evaporado y las chirivías estén tiernas y empiecen a tomar color. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.","Mezcle los huevos y la crema fresca en un tazón grande hasta que quede suave, luego agregue el queso feta, el tomillo, las judías verdes y la mezcla de verduras. Agrega la macis, la ralladura de limón, ½ cucharadita de pimienta negra y un poco de sal.","Corta dos tercios de la masa y extiéndela sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada hasta obtener un grosor de 3-4 mm. Úselo para forrar un molde para pastel redondo de 23 cm (debe tener unos 7 cm de profundidad), dejando un poco de masa sobresaliendo. Vierta el relleno, nivelando la parte superior.","Extienda el resto de la masa hasta que sea lo suficientemente grande como para cubrir la parte superior del pastel. Cepille un poco de yema de huevo alrededor del borde del pastel, luego levante la tapa de la masa y presione el borde para sellar. Recorta el exceso de masa con un cuchillo afilado. Haga un agujero para el vapor en el medio de la tapa y luego glasee con el resto de la yema de huevo. Espolvoree sobre las hierbas secas y luego enfríe durante 30 minutos. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta 24 horas.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Hornea el pastel durante 50 minutos hasta que la masa esté dorada, crujiente y seca. Dejar reposar 15 minutos antes de cortar y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15392,6231,'es','Tarta de pisto con hojaldre de queso cheddar y tomillo','Hornee hojaldre con queso cubierto con compota de tomate y berenjena ahumada y calabacines asados ​​para obtener esta impresionante tarta. Es ideal para almorzar con amigos.','["5 tomates medianos (una mezcla de diferentes colores queda bien)","1 berenjena","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas, rebanadas","4 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","2 calabacines (nosotros utilizamos 1 verde y 1 amarillo)","20 g de parmesano rallado o alternativa vegetariana","150 g de mantequilla","300 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","4 cucharadas de polenta","50 g de queso cheddar extra maduro, rallado grueso","manojo pequeño de tomillo, hojas recogidas","1 yema de huevo batida (congela la clara para otra receta)"]','["La noche antes de hacer la tarta, envuelve la mantequilla para la masa en papel de aluminio y congélala hasta que esté sólida; esto hará que sea más fácil de rallar. Para hacer la masa, poner en un bol grande la harina y mezclar con la mitad de la polenta, el queso, el tomillo (reservando unas hojas para servir) y una buena pizca de sal. Con un rallador de queso grueso, ralla la mantequilla congelada (trata de manipularla lo menos posible para que no se ablande) y revuélvela con los cuchillos a medida que avanzas. Revuelva la mezcla una última vez para asegurarse de que toda la mantequilla esté cubierta con harina, luego agregue rápidamente 125 ml de agua muy fría. Júntelo suavemente con las manos (salpicando un poco más de agua si parece seco), luego envuélvalo en papel para hornear y enfríelo durante 30 minutos.","Corta los tomates en rodajas aproximadamente del grosor de una moneda de £1 (usa una mandolina, si tienes). Reserve aproximadamente la mitad de las rodajas de tomate para la parte superior de la tarta y luego pique el resto en trozos grandes.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto (o puedes usar la llama de una placa de gas). Perfore la berenjena cuatro o cinco veces con la punta de un cuchillo y cocine a la parrilla (o manténgala sobre la llama del gas con unas pinzas), volteándola con frecuencia, durante 8 a 10 minutos, o hasta que la piel esté carbonizada y la berenjena esté suave y colapsada. Dejar enfriar un poco.","Calienta la mitad del aceite en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo y cocina las cebollas con una pizca de sal durante 10 minutos hasta que empiecen a caramelizarse. Mientras tanto, raspe la piel de la berenjena (no se preocupe si algunos trozos se adhieren a la pulpa, le agregará un sabor ahumado). Picar la pulpa de la berenjena en trozos grandes.","Agrega el ajo y la berenjena a las cebollas y cocina por otros 5 minutos, o hasta que el líquido que suelta la berenjena se haya evaporado. Agregue los tomates picados y el azúcar, sazone y continúe cocinando durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que espese. Deje enfriar y luego enfríe hasta que esté listo para usar. Se puede preparar hasta con un día de anticipación.","Corta los calabacines en rodajas aproximadamente del grosor de una moneda de £1. Poner en un bol y echar con una buena pizca de sal. Dejar actuar 10 min.","Sacar la masa de la nevera. Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 con una bandeja para hornear adentro (o una sartén poco profunda de 30 cm, si tienes una). Extiende la masa sobre una hoja grande de papel para hornear espolvoreada con un poco de harina, hasta formar un círculo de unos 35 cm de ancho. Recorta el borde si quieres un acabado prolijo.","Escurre el líquido de los calabacines y luego viértelos en un plato forrado con papel de cocina. Seque con palmaditas para eliminar la mayor cantidad de humedad posible. Espolvorea el resto de la polenta sobre la masa y luego cubre con la mezcla fría de tomate y berenjena. Extiéndela con el dorso de una cuchara, dejando un borde de 3 cm alrededor del borde.","Coloca las rodajas de tomate reservadas y los calabacines en círculos concéntricos superpuestos encima de la tarta. Unte las verduras con el aceite restante, sazone y espolvoree con el parmesano. Doble ligeramente el borde de la masa sobre las verduras, presionando suavemente para sellar. Pincelar el borde de la masa con la yema batida.","Deslice con cuidado la tarta, todavía sobre el papel para hornear, sobre la bandeja caliente o en la sartén. Hornee durante 45 minutos hasta que esté dorado, luego espolvoree con las hojas de tomillo adicionales, si las usa. Dejar enfriar un poco y servir tibio o a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15393,6233,'es','Zapatero de tomate, maíz, ricota y parmesano','Prepare este pastel de tomate y queso para acompañar con pollo asado o disfrutarlo solo. Es una revelación si nunca antes has preparado un zapatero salado.','["145 g de ricota","235 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","235 g de harina fina de maíz o polenta","1½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","115 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubos pequeños","220 ml de suero de leche (o 120 g de yogur mezclado con 100 ml de leche si no encuentras suero de leche)","1 kg de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","2 mazorcas de maíz, los granos cortados de las mazorcas","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","2½ cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cebollas grandes, picadas en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo rallados","4 ramitas de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","25 g de parmesano rallado o alternativa vegetariana"]','["Poner la ricota en un colador forrado con un trozo de muselina y colocar sobre un bol. Mételo en el frigorífico y déjalo escurrir durante un par de horas; debes escurrir lo suficiente para que ya no esté \"mojado\".","Pon en un bol la harina, la harina de maíz, ½ cucharadita de sal, el polvo para hornear, el bicarbonato y el azúcar. Agrega la mantequilla y frótala con los ingredientes secos, como si estuvieras haciendo masa. Hacer un hueco en el centro, verter el buttermilk y, con un cuchillo, mezclar poco a poco. Deberías terminar con una masa suave. Desmenuza la ricota y mézclala con la masa.","Coloca la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y, con las manos, dale forma de rectángulo, de unos 20 x 15 cm. Dobla el tercio superior hacia el medio y luego haz lo mismo con el tercio inferior. Vuelva a presionar la mezcla hasta formar un rectángulo de 20 x 15 y repita el proceso dos veces más. Deberías terminar con una masa de unos 2,5 cm de grosor. Envuelva y enfríe durante 20 minutos.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner los tomates en una fuente para horno (de unos 20 x 30 cm) con los granos de maíz. Agregue el vinagre, un poco de condimento y 1½ cucharada de aceite y revuelva para cubrir. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén a fuego medio y cocina las cebollas hasta que estén doradas y suaves, aproximadamente 12 minutos. Agrega el ajo y cocina por unos minutos más, luego agrega el tomillo y un poco de condimento. Vierta la mezcla de cebolla sobre los tomates y el maíz.","Coloque la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y córtela en círculos o cuadrados con un cuchillo. Coloca las formas de masa sobre las verduras, dejando algo de espacio entre ellas. Espolvoree con parmesano y hornee durante 45 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante (deberá poder ver los tomates burbujeando debajo de la cobertura de zapatero). Dejar enfriar un poco (los tomates estarán muy calientes cuando salgan del horno) y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15394,6235,'es','Hamburguesas de champiñones bañadas en soja','Haz un cambio de carne con estas maravillosas hamburguesas de champiñones. El dulzor de la cebolla y el calabacín combina a la perfección con la sabrosa salsa de ostras.','["1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","½ cucharadita de aceite para wok de sésamo Lee Kum Kee","½ cucharada de salsa de soja oscura premium Lee Kum Kee","½ cucharada de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de salsa de ostras premium Lee Kum Kee (ver consejo)","4 champiñones, pelados, si lo deseas, y sin tallos","1 calabacín, cortado a lo largo en 4 rodajas","4 panes de hamburguesa","2 cucharadas de mayonesa","1 cucharadita de aceite de chile Lee Kum Kee Chiu Chow (use las hojuelas de chile del fondo del frasco para obtener un mejor sabor)","4 hojas de lechuga"]','["Sofríe las cebollas moradas en aceite de sésamo para wok hasta que estén tiernas y bien cocidas, aproximadamente 8 minutos. Reservar y mantener caliente.","Mientras tanto, ponga la Salsa de Soja Oscura Premium y la mantequilla en una sartén y derrita, luego agregue la Salsa de Ostras Premium y revuelva. Unte la mezcla sobre los champiñones, luego déjela por un minuto para que los champiñones absorban la salsa. Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto.","Asa los champiñones hasta que estén tiernos, unos 10 minutos. Cuando esté listo, deberías poder pasar un cuchillo por las partes más gruesas con bastante facilidad.","Asa las rodajas de calabacín hasta que empiecen a formar ampollas y estén doradas y tiernas. Calentar brevemente los panecillos de hamburguesa bajo la parrilla y mezclar la mayonesa con el aceite de chile Chiu Chow.","Unte la base de cada pan de hamburguesa con un poco de mayonesa fría, luego agregue una rodaja de calabacín, una hoja de lechuga y un champiñón. Cubra con unas cebollas salteadas y las tapas de panecillos."]','2026-01-11 13:08:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15395,6239,'es','Ensalada de orzo con hierbas y limón','Prepare esta ensalada veraniega de orzo repleta de hierbas y limón como acompañamiento de temporada. Las sobras son un excelente almuerzo al día siguiente.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","½ cucharada de azúcar moreno blando","350 g de oro","50ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 limón grande, exprimido","1 manojo pequeño de albahaca, finamente picada","1 manojo pequeño de perejil, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de alcaparras, escurridas y enjuagadas","50 g de almendras laminadas, ligeramente tostadas"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva y la mantequilla en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y sofríe la cebolla durante 10-15 minutos, o hasta que esté dorada y caramelizada. Agrega el ajo y el azúcar y cocina por 3 minutos más. Sazone al gusto.","Cocine el orzo siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir, luego echar con un poco de aceite de oliva virgen extra y dejar enfriar por completo. Batir el aceite restante con el jugo de limón y reservar.","Mezcle el orzo con la cebolla pegajosa y el ajo, el aderezo de limón, las hierbas y las alcaparras, junto con la mitad de las almendras tostadas. Estación. Vierta en un plato para compartir y cubra con el resto de las almendras. Se conservará en el frigorífico hasta tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:08:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15396,6241,'es','Feta crujiente a la parrilla con frijoles picantes','¿Atrapado en una rutina alimentaria? Tome una lata de frijoles, un poco de queso feta y passata para preparar esta cena súper rápida y deliciosa. Lleno de bondad, también es saludable.','["500ml en puré","2 latas de 400 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de orégano seco, más una pizca","200 g de espinacas","2 pimientos rojos asados, rebanados","1⁄2 limón, rallado y en jugo","100 g de bloque de queso feta, cortado en trozos","1⁄2 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","4 pitas pequeñas"]','["Coloque una sartén grande para horno a fuego medio-alto y agregue la passata, los frijoles, el ajo, el orégano, las espinacas y los pimientos. Revuelva y cocine durante 6-8 minutos hasta que la salsa burbujee y las espinacas se ablanden. Sazone, luego agregue el jugo de limón.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Esparza el queso feta sobre la salsa, de modo que quede expuesto, rocíe con aceite de oliva y espolvoree sobre la ralladura de limón más una pizca de orégano, luego muela un poco de pimienta negra. Ase durante 5 a 8 minutos hasta que el queso feta esté dorado y crujiente en los bordes.","Mientras tanto, tuesta las pitas a la parrilla o en la tostadora y luego sírvelas con los frijoles y el queso feta."]','2026-01-11 13:08:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15397,6243,'es','Hinojo asado y pan gratinado','Sirva este hinojo asado y gratinado de masa madre como guarnición junto con pollo asado o con algunas hojas de ensalada con un aderezo de mostaza.','["2 bulbos de hinojo pequeños, con las bases recortadas y los bulbos cortados a lo largo en trozos de 1 cm de grosor","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 ramitas grandes de tomillo, con las hojas recogidas","2 rebanadas gruesas de masa madre","100ml de leche","50 ml de vino blanco","20 g de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, rallado, y extra para servir","150 g de crème fraîche o nata doble","rallado de nuez moscada","un puñado de hierbas suaves mixtas, picadas en trozos grandes (el perejil y el estragón funcionan bien)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezclar el hinojo con el aceite de oliva para cubrirlo en una bandeja de horno o en una fuente para gratinar, añadiendo una pizca de sal marina y las hojas de tomillo. Ase durante 20 minutos, revolviendo a la mitad, hasta que se ablanden y caramelicen.","Mientras tanto, corte la masa madre en trozos, viértala en un bol y vierta sobre la leche y el vino. Dejar de lado. Combinar el parmesano con la crème fraîche y sazonar con sal, pimienta y un poco de nuez moscada rallada.","Una vez asado el hinojo, sacar del horno y dejar enfriar un poco. Agrega el pan remojado al hinojo y mezcla. Vierta sobre la mezcla de crème fraîche y la mitad de las hierbas y revuelva para cubrir el pan y el hinojo. Ralle un poco más de queso y luego hornee por otros 25 a 30 minutos, o hasta que estén dorados, burbujeantes y crujientes en los bordes. Cubra con las hierbas restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:08:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15398,6249,'es','Ensalada de melón y tomate con aderezo de menta y flor de saúco','Aproveche al máximo los mejores productos del verano utilizando melones y tomates en esta vibrante ensalada, rociados con un aderezo de menta y flor de saúco. El secreto de esta ensalada es utilizar los ingredientes más frescos.','["400 g de tomates de una mezcla de colores y tamaños, si es posible","½ Charentais o melón melón","½ melón galia","200 g de sandía en cubos en tarrina","1½ cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","2 cucharadas de aceite de maní","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 manojo pequeño de menta, con las hojas recogidas","¼ tsp Dijon mustard","½ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de cordial de flor de saúco","4 cucharadas de crema doble"]','["Para hacer el aderezo, ponga el vinagre, los aceites, la mitad de la menta, la mostaza, el azúcar y el cordial en una licuadora, luego sazone y mezcle para combinar. Agrega la crema y revisa el condimento; este es un aderezo agridulce, por lo que debes lograr el equilibrio adecuado. Quizás quieras hacerlo un poco más suave agregando un poco más de crema.","Corta los tomates más pequeños por la mitad y los más grandes en gajos. Poner en un tazón poco profundo para servir.","Quitar las semillas de los melones Charentais o melón y Galia, cortarlos en gajos, pelarlos y cortar la pulpa en trozos. Añade al bol de los tomates, junto con la sandía. Rocíe un poco del aderezo (es posible que no lo necesite todo), esparza sobre las hojas de menta restantes y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:08:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15399,6251,'es','Pastelitos veganos de plátano','Prepara estos sencillos cupcakes de plátano para disfrutar de un capricho por la tarde. Sin lácteos ni huevos, son perfectos para cualquiera que siga una dieta vegana.','["2 plátanos grandes (unos 225 g), ennegrecidos y pelados","50ml de aceite vegetal o de girasol","65 g de azúcar moreno claro","150 g de harina común","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","2 cucharaditas de canela","50 g de mezcla de frutos secos y semillas","2 cucharadas de avena","2 cucharadas de semillas mixtas"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Triture los plátanos en un tazón mediano con un tenedor, luego mezcle el aceite y el azúcar hasta que se combinen.","Agrega la harina, el polvo para hornear, la canela y la mezcla de frutos secos y semillas. Mezclar hasta que esté bien combinado.","Forra una bandeja para cupcakes con 10-12 moldes para cupcakes (la cantidad que necesitarás dependerá del tamaño de los plátanos) y llénalas ¾ de la mezcla. Espolvorea con la avena y las semillas mixtas.","Hornee por 25 minutos o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio de un muffin, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 13:08:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15400,6253,'es','hamburguesa vegana','Haz esta fantástica receta base para una hamburguesa vegana y agrega lo que quieras: hojuelas de chile, ralladura de limón u otras hierbas funcionan muy bien.','["1 chalota o ½ cebolla, picada","1 rama de apio o ¼ de pimiento rojo, picado","un puñado de hojas de perejil","Lata de 400g de garbanzos escurridos y dejados secar un poco","1-2 cucharaditas de garam masala","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de harina común","1 cucharada de polenta, cuscús o pan rallado seco","aceite, para freír","panecillos para hamburguesa o pan pita, lechuga, tomate y salsas para servir"]','["Batir la chalota, el apio, el perejil y la mayoría de los garbanzos hasta obtener una pasta gruesa. No exageres, quieres una textura un poco más áspera que la del hummus. Triture los garbanzos restantes y revuélvalos con la pasta con el garam masala, el puré de tomate, la harina y la polenta. Sazone bien.","Forma cuatro hamburguesas con la mezcla. Déjalos reposar durante al menos 30 minutos; si lo deseas, puedes dejarlos toda la noche en el refrigerador. La polenta necesita tiempo para absorber el exceso de líquido.","Calienta un poco de aceite en una sartén antiadherente y cocina las hamburguesas hasta que estén doradas y crujientes por ambos lados. Intenta no manipularlos demasiado ya que estarán bastante blandos cuando estén calientes. Deslízalo en panecillos o pitta con los acompañamientos que desees."]','2026-01-11 13:08:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15401,6255,'es','Brochetas de halloumi','Prepara nuestras brochetas de queso vegetal en una parrilla o plancha y agrega tu adobo favorito. Tenemos ideas para tres glaseados llenos de sabor','["500 g de halloumi","el glaseado elegido (opcional)"]','["Corta el halloumi en trozos grandes y ensártalos en tres brochetas. Enciende la barbacoa. Cepille las brochetas con el glaseado elegido y, cuando las llamas se hayan apagado, cocine durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado (o cocine en una sartén a fuego alto). Unte con el glaseado restante y cocine por 1 minuto más por cada lado."]','2026-01-11 13:08:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15402,6257,'es','Ensalada de patatas vegana','Haz una versión vegana de una ensalada de patatas clásica con mayonesa vegana. Es el acompañamiento perfecto para una barbacoa, un picnic o ensaladas en verano.','["600 g de patatas nuevas, cortar a la mitad las más grandes","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino blanco","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","120 g de mayonesa vegana","1½ tsp Dijon mustard","1 chalota o ½ cebolla morada, finamente picada","2 cucharaditas de alcaparras, picadas si son grandes","un puñado pequeño de perejil picado","un puñado pequeño de cebollino picado"]','["Poner las patatas en una cacerola, sazonar con sal y cubrir con agua fría. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos, hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir y dejar secar al vapor en un colador durante 5 minutos. Si la piel tiene una textura parecida al papel y se está despegando, puedes frotarla si lo deseas.","Vierta las patatas en un bol y agregue el vinagre, el aceite de oliva y un poco de condimento, revuelva bien y déjelas enfriar.","Agregue la mayonesa, la mostaza, la chalota, las alcaparras y las hierbas (guarde un poco para decorar). Comprobar la sazón y añadir un poco más de sal o vinagre, si se desea. Esparza las hierbas restantes y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:08:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15403,6259,'es','puré de camote','Cambie el puré normal por una versión de batata, llena de vitamina C y fibra. Es excelente como aderezo para un pastel de pastor o un pastel de pescado, o como guarnición vegetariana.','["500 g de batatas, peladas y cortadas en cubos","2 cucharadas de mantequilla"]','["Hervir las patatas en agua con sal durante 10 minutos o hasta que estén tiernas, el tiempo que tarden dependerá del tamaño de los cubos. Escurrir muy bien y dejar secar al vapor un par de minutos.","Vuelva a colocar las papas en la sartén y tritúrelas con 1 cucharada de mantequilla con un tenedor o un machacador, luego sazone bien. Sirva con mantequilla extra y más condimento encima."]','2026-01-11 13:08:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15404,6261,'es','Berenjenas asadas con frijoles blancos y salsa verde','Sirva estas berenjenas carbonizadas con frijoles blancos y salsa verde como opción vegetariana en una barbacoa. Las berenjenas se carbonizan y se ampollan maravillosamente.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para frotar y rociar","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 latas de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","2 ramitas de tomillo","200 ml de caldo de verduras","3 cucharadas de crème fraîche o alternativa vegana, si es necesario","limón, rallado y gajos para servir","4 berenjenas medianas","50 g de almendras laminadas, tostadas","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","40 g de avellanas sin piel","½ manojo pequeño de diente de ajo","1 cucharada de alcaparras, escurridas","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","7 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén a fuego lento y sofreír la cebolla con una pizca de sal durante 10 minutos. Agrega el ajo y las hojuelas de chile y sofríe durante 2 minutos más. Agregue los frijoles, el tomillo y el caldo, cocine a fuego lento y cocine durante 15 minutos, o hasta que los frijoles se hayan descompuesto un poco. Agregue la crema fresca y la ralladura de limón. Sazone al gusto.","Para hacer la salsa verde, ponga el perejil, las avellanas, el ajo, las alcaparras, el vinagre y el aceite en un mortero y triture todo junto; esto tomará unos 5 minutos. Alternativamente, mezcle en un procesador de alimentos hasta que esté combinado pero no suave. Transfiera a un bol y sazone al gusto.","Enciende la barbacoa y espera a que se apaguen las llamas. Cortar las berenjenas por la mitad a lo largo y marcar el lado cortado en forma de diamante con la punta de un cuchillo. Frote con un poco de aceite, luego póngalo directamente en la parrilla y cocine durante 7 a 10 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que esté carbonizado y suave. Alternativamente, cocine bajo una parrilla (consulte el consejo a continuación). Cubra las berenjenas cocidas con el ragú de frijoles y la salsa verde, luego esparza sobre las almendras tostadas y sirva con las rodajas de limón a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:08:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15405,6263,'es','Chile vegano de tres frijoles con patatas asadas','Este saludable relleno de papa al horno proporciona cuatro de los cinco alimentos diarios en cada porción, además de hierro, vitamina C y fibra, y mucho sabor gracias a las especias de la despensa.','["2 patatas asadas (de unos 180 g cada una)","1 cucharada de aceite de colza prensado en frío","1 pimiento amarillo o naranja, sin semillas y picado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","Lata de 400 g de ensalada de tres judías (cannellini, flageolet y adzuki), escurridas","un puñado de cilantro picado y hojas adicionales para servir","1 aguacate pequeño, deshuesado, partido por la mitad y picado o en puré","1 lima, cortada en gajos"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y hornea las patatas durante 50 minutos-1 hora, o hasta que estén tiernas.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y sofreír el pimiento y el ajo durante unos minutos. Agregue las semillas de comino, las hojuelas de chile y las especias, luego agregue los tomates, el caldo en polvo y los frijoles. Llevar a fuego lento, tapar y cocinar durante 15 minutos o hasta que se reduzca a una salsa espesa. Agrega el cilantro picado.","Corta una cruz en la parte superior de las papas al horno y presiona suavemente los lados para abrirlas. Vierta sobre el chile, luego cubra con el aguacate y exprima sobre algunas de las rodajas de lima. Esparza algunas hojas de cilantro y sirva con las rodajas de lima restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:08:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15406,6265,'es','Jambalaya vegana','Disfrute de una deliciosa cena a base de plantas con esta olla vegana de arroz y frijoles. Está repleto de los cinco alimentos que necesitas al día, además de hierro, vitamina C y fibra.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza prensado en frío","1 cebolla grande (180 g), finamente picada","4 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","1 pimiento amarillo, picado","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","115 g de arroz basmati integral","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","400 g de judías blancas, escurridas y enjuagadas","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","un puñado grande de perejil picado"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego alto y sofreír la cebolla, el apio y el pimiento, revolviendo ocasionalmente, durante 5 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse y tomar color.","Agregue las especias y el arroz, luego agregue los tomates y una lata de agua. Agregue el ajo, los frijoles y el caldo. Llevar a fuego lento, luego tapar y cocinar durante 25 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno y haya absorbido la mayor parte del líquido. Esté atento a la sartén hacia el final del tiempo de cocción para asegurarse de que no se seque; si comienza a prenderse, agregue un poco más de agua. Agrega el perejil y sirve caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15407,6269,'es','Pan de boletus con verduras de verano','Prepare este pan de champiñones, yaca y castañas para un almuerzo vegetariano de domingo. Es súper saludable y proporciona cinco de tus cinco dosis al día en cada porción.','["450 g de patatas para ensalada, partidas por la mitad","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza prensado en frío, más un poco más para la lata","1 limón, rallado y exprimido (necesitarás 2 cucharadas de jugo de limón)","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 puerros, cortados en aros","350 g de espárragos (paquete de 250 g y paquete de 100 g), con los extremos recortados y cortados transversalmente en cuartos","320 g de guisantes congelados","Bolsa de 260 g de espinacas de hoja tierna","2 cucharadas de yogur griego bio","1 cucharada de hojas de estragón picadas","Lata de 410 g de yaca, escurrida","1 cucharada de hojas de estragón picadas","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","3 huevos","40 g de champiñones porcini secos","Paquete de 200g de puré de castañas","40 g de anacardos tostados sin sal"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5. Engrasar y forrar un molde para pan de 500 g con dos tiras de papel para hornear de modo que quede completamente forrado, con un saliente en la parte superior que se pueda doblar. Mezcle las patatas con el aceite y colóquelas en una fuente para asar pequeña.","Para hacer el pan, pese 125 g de yaca, elija los trozos que tengan la textura más \"abierta\" y luego córtelos en rodajas finas. Vierta en un tazón y agregue el estragón, el ajo y el pimentón.","Vierta el resto de la yaca en un bol con los huevos y los champiñones secos y mezcle con una batidora hasta que quede muy suave. Añade el puré de castañas y vuelve a batir hasta que esté bien mezclado. Mezcle 150 g de la mezcla de champiñones con la yaca en rodajas. Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de champiñones secos restante en la lata, luego agregue la mezcla de champiñones y yaca en rodajas y cubra con el resto de la mezcla de champiñones secos. Presione hacia abajo y esparza sobre los anacardos. Doble el papel para hornear y hornee junto con las papas durante 45 minutos o hasta que esté firme.","Mezcla la ralladura de limón con las patatas. Tapa el pan y déjalo reposar mientras cocinas las verduras.","Vierta 150 ml de agua en una cacerola con el caldo y los puerros. Tapar y cocinar a fuego medio durante 2 minutos. Agrega los espárragos y los guisantes, luego tapa y cocina por 2 minutos más. Finalmente, agregue las espinacas y revuelva hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el jugo de limón y el yogur a la mezcla de verduras y revuelve bien. Si sigues nuestro Plan de dieta saludable, sirve la mitad de las verduras con cuatro rebanadas de pan y reserva las cuatro rebanadas restantes y el resto de las verduras para otra noche. Se conservará hasta tres días, tapado, en el frigorífico. Para servir la segunda noche, recalienta las sobras en el microondas hasta que estén bien calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:08:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15408,6271,'es','Sopa de garbanzos con gremolata en trozos','Si te gusta el hummus, te encantará esta sopa baja en calorías y sin gluten que proporciona cuatro increíbles de tus cinco al día en cada porción.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza prensado en frío","3 cebollas picadas (unos 340 g)","3 latas de garbanzos de 400 g, no escurrir el líquido","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","4 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","1 berenjena, finamente picada (350 g)","2 cucharadas de tahini","Lata de 210 g de garbanzos escurridos","100 g de tomates cherry cortados en cuartos","1 limón, rallado y medio exprimido","15 g de perejil, finamente picado","3 cucharadas de hojas de menta picadas","pimentón ahumado, para espolvorear"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén grande y fríe las cebollas durante 10 minutos para que se ablanden. Vierta las 3 latas de garbanzos en la sartén y agregue 2 de los dientes de ajo rallados, la guindilla, el cilantro y el comino junto con el caldo en polvo, la berenjena y 1½ latas de agua. Tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos hasta que la berenjena esté tierna, luego retirar del fuego, agregar el tahini y batir con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave.","Mientras tanto, haz la gremolata. Vierta la lata pequeña de garbanzos en un bol, agregue los tomates, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el perejil y la menta con el resto del aceite y el ajo.","Si sigue nuestro Plan de dieta saludable, vierta la mitad de la sopa en dos tazones o frascos grandes y cubra con la mitad de la gremolata y una pizca de pimentón. Enfríe y enfríe la sopa restante para otro día del plan. Vuelva a calentar la sopa en una sartén o en el microondas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15409,6273,'es','Crostini de habas y queso feta con hierbas y espárragos','Aproveche al máximo las habas de temporada durante los meses de verano y prepare este vibrante crostini de frijoles y queso feta. Ideal como entrante, simplemente cubra con espárragos.','["160 g de habas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","50 g de queso feta desmenuzado","1 cucharadita de miel","chorrito de jugo de limón","un puñado grande de hojas de eneldo","4 rebanadas de baguette","1 diente de ajo, partido por la mitad","4 lanzas de espárragos blanqueados"]','["Lleve a ebullición una olla grande de agua con sal y cocine las habas durante 5-6 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Sumérgete inmediatamente en un recipiente con agua helada. Exprima las habas de sus vainas y transfiéralas al bol de un procesador de alimentos con el aceite de oliva, el queso feta, la miel, el jugo de limón y las hojas de eneldo. Sazone con pimienta negra y mezcle hasta obtener un puré suave.","Mientras tanto, unte las rebanadas de baguette con un poco de aceite de oliva y tuéstelas o comalas hasta que estén doradas. Frote con el lado cortado de un diente de ajo partido por la mitad. Picar finamente los espárragos blanqueados y echarlos con un poco de aceite de oliva y un chorrito de zumo de limón. Extienda el puré sobre el crostini y cubra con los espárragos en rodajas y un poco más de eneldo. El puré sobrante se conservará en el frigorífico hasta dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:08:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15410,6275,'es','Dip de aguacate y frijoles cannellini','Vence el hambre con esta salsa vegana de aguacate y frijoles cannellini. Sirva con crudités y galletas saladas como refrigerio, almuerzo ligero o como parte de un picnic.','["1 aguacate pequeño","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile, más un poco más para servir","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","3 cucharadas de aceite de aguacate, más un poco más para rociar","semillas mixtas, galletas saladas o crudités, para servir (opcional)"]','["Coloca la pulpa del aguacate en una licuadora o procesador de alimentos pequeño. Agrega los frijoles, el ajo, las especias, la ralladura y el jugo de limón y el aceite. Mezcle hasta que esté completamente suave, aflojando con 50-100 ml de agua, si es necesario. Estación.","Vierta en un tazón y cubra con hojuelas de chile extra y aceite de aguacate. Sirva con las semillas esparcidas y galletas saladas o crudités, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:08:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15411,6277,'es','Espinacas al curry, huevos y garbanzos','Acumule nutrientes con esta cena vegetariana hecha con espinacas, huevos y garbanzos. Es saludable, bajo en calorías, lleno de sabor y proporciona cuatro de tus cinco al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","Jengibre en trozos de 3 cm, pelado y rallado","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharada de comino molido","450 g de tomates picados","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1 cucharadita de azúcar","200 g de espinacas","2 huevos grandes","3 cucharadas de yogur natural","1 chile rojo, finamente cortado","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, triturado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande o en una cacerola ignífuga a fuego medio y sofríe la cebolla durante 10 minutos hasta que esté dorada y pegajosa. Agrega el ajo, el jengibre, la cúrcuma, el cilantro molido, el garam masala, el comino y los tomates y sofríe durante 2 minutos más. Añade los garbanzos, 100 ml de agua y el azúcar y deja hervir a fuego lento. Agregue las espinacas, luego cubra y cocine durante 20-25 minutos. Sazone al gusto.","Cocine los huevos en una cacerola con agua hirviendo durante 7 minutos, luego enjuáguelos con agua corriente fría para que se enfríen. Escurrir, pelar y cortar por la mitad. Agrega el yogur al curry y luego cubre con los huevos, la guindilla y el cilantro. Estación."]','2026-01-11 13:08:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15412,6279,'es','Ensalada de arroz y huevo al curry','Disfrute de esta ensalada de huevo y arroz ligeramente condimentada como guarnición en una barbacoa o picnic de verano. Cubra con almendras tostadas, zanahorias ralladas y pepinos en rodajas.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva o de colza","1 cebolla, picada","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry suave (nosotros usamos pasta korma)","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","300 g de arroz basmati","50 g de pasas","1 cubito de caldo de pollo o verduras","3 huevos","manojo pequeño de cilantro, hojas recogidas","30 g de almendras laminadas, tostadas","2 zanahorias, ralladas o finamente ralladas","½ pepino, rebanado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y cocina la cebolla durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que esté suave y dorada. Hervir la tetera. Agrega la pasta de curry, la cúrcuma molida, el arroz y las pasas a las cebollas. Desmenuza la pastilla de caldo y vierte suficiente agua hervida de la tetera para cubrir el arroz ½ cm (aproximadamente 1 litro). Sazone con un poco de sal. Llevar a fuego lento, luego tapar la sartén, reducir el fuego al mínimo y cocinar durante 2 minutos más. Sin quitar la tapa, retirar del fuego y dejar cocer al vapor durante 15 minutos. Esto te dará un arroz perfecto y esponjoso.","Mientras tanto, ponga a hervir otra cacerola con agua y cocine los huevos durante 7 minutos. Sumergir en un recipiente con agua fría para detener la cocción y una vez fríos, escurrir y cortar por la mitad.","Vierta el arroz en un recipiente y déjelo enfriar durante al menos 1 hora o hasta dos días. Cuando esté listo para servir, esparza el cilantro y las almendras y cubra con la zanahoria rallada, las rodajas de pepino y los huevos."]','2026-01-11 13:08:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15413,6283,'es','Sándwiches de mayonesa sin huevo','Utilice tofu como sustituto del huevo junto con mayonesa sin lácteos para preparar estos sándwiches veganos. Son ideales para una fiesta infantil donde algunos niños pueden tener intolerancia o alergia.','["Bloque de 400 g de tofu medio firme en agua","6 cucharadas de mayonesa vegana","½ tsp Dijon mustard","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharada de levadura nutricional","2 cucharaditas de cebollino finamente picado","1 sándwich blanco grande o pan integral (10-12 rebanadas), o 12 mini panecillos (use pan sin gluten si es necesario)","1 berro en canastilla (opcional)"]','["Retire el tofu del paquete y presione para quitar el exceso de agua, ya sea entre hojas de papel de cocina o con un paño de cocina limpio, cargado con un plato durante unos 30 minutos.","Mezclar la mayonesa, la mostaza, la cúrcuma y la levadura nutricional junto con un poco de sal y pimienta.","Desmenuza el tofu en un bol, dejando trozos grandes para crear una textura de huevo picado. Agrega suavemente las cebolletas. Si lo quieres más suelto puedes agregar más mayonesa.","Unte la mezcla sobre el pan para hacer cuatro o cinco rondas de sándwiches (dependiendo de la cantidad de relleno que desee), luego agregue berros, si lo desea. Utilice un cuchillo afilado para cortar en triángulos."]','2026-01-11 13:08:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15414,6285,'es','pepitas veganas','Prepare una tanda de nuggets veganos, repletos de frijoles cannellini, coliflor y zanahoria. Son una excelente comida para fiestas infantiles que todos pueden disfrutar o servir como refrigerio después de la escuela.','["300 g de floretes de coliflor (o ¾ de coliflor pequeña)","2 zanahorias picadas (unos 165 g)","½ cebolla mediana, picada","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharadas de levadura nutricional","2 cucharaditas de extracto de levadura","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas","50 g de harina (de garbanzos)","aceite de oliva, para la bandeja para hornear","100 gramos de harina y un poco más","100 g de pan rallado (usar sin gluten si es necesario)"]','["Pulse la coliflor, las zanahorias y la cebolla en un procesador de alimentos hasta que estén finamente picadas, como arroz. Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y fríe la mezcla durante 12-15 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agrega el ajo y sofríe durante 1 minuto más, luego retira del fuego y agrega la levadura nutricional y el extracto de levadura. Dejar de lado.","Licue los frijoles hasta obtener un puré blando en un procesador de alimentos, luego agréguelos a la mezcla de verduras y combine bien. Agrega la harina y sazona. Poner en el frigorífico para que endurezca durante 1 hora.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Forrar una bandeja para hornear grande con papel para hornear y cubrir con un poco de aceite de oliva. Para hacer la cobertura, mezcle la harina de garbanzos con 150 ml de agua con un tenedor para que parezca un huevo batido y luego sazone. Esparza la harina de garbanzos sobrante en un plato y llene un segundo con pan rallado.","Enrolle la mezcla de frijoles en trozos del tamaño de una nuez y luego aplánela para formar pepitas. Sumerja los trozos primero en la harina de garbanzos, luego en la masa de garbanzos y finalmente enróllelos en el pan rallado; manipúlelos con cuidado, ya que quedarán un poco blandos. Cuando las pepitas estén completamente cubiertas, colóquelas en la bandeja preparada.","Hornee durante 20 minutos, luego use unas pinzas para darle la vuelta a cada pepita y hornee durante 15 minutos más hasta que estén doradas y crujientes. Déjelo enfriar durante 20 minutos antes de servir con la salsa que elija."]','2026-01-11 13:08:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15415,6287,'es','Espárragos con guisantes, menta y Jersey Royals en mantequilla de ajo silvestre','Cubra los espárragos, los guisantes y los Jersey Royals con mantequilla de menta y ajo silvestre, luego cubra con almendras tostadas: el compañero perfecto para asar carne y tartas saladas.','["300 g de patatas Jersey Royal","un puñado de almendras fileteadas","75 g de mantequilla blanda","un puñado de hojas de ajo silvestre, muy finamente picadas (o 1 diente de ajo machacado)","1 cucharada de hojas de menta","250 g de guisantes recién desvainados","rociar aceite de oliva, para freír","½ limón, rallado y en jugo"]','["Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua y cocine las patatas durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que estén tiernas. Drenar.","Tostar las almendras fileteadas en una sartén seca hasta que estén doradas. Dejar de lado.","Mezcle la mantequilla, las hojas de ajo silvestre y la menta (si lo desea, puede triturarlas en un procesador de alimentos). Dejar de lado.","Cubrir los guisantes con agua hirviendo durante 30 segundos, luego escurrirlos y sumergirlos inmediatamente en agua fría.","Calienta el aceite de oliva en una cacerola grande con tapa a fuego medio. Añade los espárragos y una buena pizca de sal marina y agita para cubrirlos con el aceite. Coloque la tapa y cocine los espárragos a fuego bajo a medio, agitando la sartén para mover los espárragos, aproximadamente 4 minutos. Retire los tallos de la sartén y sumérjalos inmediatamente en agua helada.","Derrita la mantequilla de ajo en la sartén y exprima el jugo de limón. Agrega las patatas, los espárragos y los guisantes a la mantequilla hasta que estén calientes. Vierta todo en una fuente para servir y ralle un poco de ralladura de limón. Cubra con las almendras tostadas."]','2026-01-11 13:08:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15416,6289,'es','Berenjenas asadas con tarator de almendras, queso feta, eneldo y chile verde','Ase un par de berenjenas y cubra con tarator, una salsa de nueces y ajo que combina perfectamente con las berenjenas. Disfrútalo como entrante o guarnición.','["4 berenjenas","100 ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra, más un poco más para untar y rociar","125 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","175 g de yogur griego","1-2 chiles verdes (dependiendo de qué tan picante te guste), cortados por la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas muy finas","manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado en trozos grandes","30 g de pan de campo blanco grueso, desmenuzado","4 cucharadas de leche","50 g de almendras blanqueadas","1 diente de ajo, picado","½ limón, exprimido"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Untar las berenjenas con un poco de aceite y ponerlas en una bandeja de horno. Perfore cada una varias veces con un tenedor, luego ase en el horno durante 45 minutos – 1 hora (depende del tamaño de las berenjenas), hasta que estén completamente tiernas.","Mientras tanto, haz el tarator. Poner el pan en un bol y dejar en remojo en la leche durante unos 30 minutos. Vierta en un procesador de alimentos con las nueces, el ajo y el jugo de limón y triture, agregando gradualmente 85 ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra. Sazona y añade un poco de agua si quieres que la mezcla quede más fina (no debe quedar espesa pero tampoco tan fina como una nata).","Triture el queso feta en trozos grandes con el yogur en un bol. Abrir las berenjenas a lo largo y sazonar el interior. Colóquelos en platos individuales o en un plato para servir más grande y rocíe un poco del aceite restante dentro de cada uno. Vierta sobre la mezcla de queso feta y yogur, luego cubra con el tarator (el tarator puede caer sobre los lados de las berenjenas), los chiles en rodajas y el eneldo.","Rocíe un poco de aceite de oliva virgen extra sobre cada berenjena y sirva con panes planos si es un entrante, o tal cual si es un acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 13:08:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15417,6291,'es','Gratinado de verduras verdes con queso','Mejora el queso de coliflor con brócoli verde y espinacas, y salsa de queso cheddar y cebollino. Asegúrate de usar también las hojas de coliflor para darle más sabor.','["1 coliflor (450 g), partida en floretes, hojas reservadas","200 g de brócoli germinado morado","200 g de espinacas","70 g de mantequilla sin sal","70 g de harina común","900ml de leche entera","2 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa","150 g de queso cheddar maduro","½ manojo de cebollino, finamente picado"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola con agua ligeramente salada y cocine los floretes de coliflor durante 3 minutos. Agrega el brócoli y cocina por 2 minutos más. Escurrir en un colador y dejar secar al vapor.","Vierta las espinacas en una cacerola grande, agregue 2 cucharadas de agua y cocine con la tapa puesta a fuego lento durante 3-4 minutos hasta que se ablanden, luego viértalas en un colador y presione el exceso de humedad con el dorso de una cuchara de madera. Dejar de lado.","Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Derretir la mantequilla en una cacerola a fuego lento hasta que forme espuma, luego agregar la harina para crear una pasta espesa. Cocine durante 2 minutos, retire la sartén del fuego y agregue la leche en varias adiciones hasta que no quede grumos. Regrese al fuego y bata hasta que espese. Agrega la mostaza, la mayor parte del queso y las cebolletas. Sazone al gusto.","Coloca las verduras, incluidas las hojas de coliflor, en una fuente mediana para horno. Vierta sobre la salsa y luego espolvoree con el queso restante. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante."]','2026-01-11 13:08:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15418,6293,'es','Musaka vegana','Prepare esta moussaka saludable y deliciosa con un simple ragu a base de plantas. Es una cena fácil para la familia que incluye los cinco platos de cinco al día.','["Bolsa de 30 g de champiñones porcini secos","8 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 zanahorias, finamente picadas","2 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","4 dientes de ajo, rebanados","unos manantiales de tomillo","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate","100ml de vino tinto vegano (opcional)","250 g de lentejas verdes secas","2 latas de 400 g de tomates pera enteros","Paquete de 250 g de champiñones castaños, picados","Paquete de 250 g de champiñones portobello, en rodajas","1 tsp soy sauce","1 cucharadita de marmita","1 kg de patatas harinosas (como Maris Piper), peladas y picadas","1 ½ cucharadita de orégano seco","3 berenjenas, cortadas a lo largo","150ml de leche de soja"]','["Vierta 800 ml de agua hirviendo sobre los boletus secos y déjelos durante 10 minutos hasta que se hidraten. Mientras tanto, vierte 1½ cucharada de aceite en una cacerola grande. Agrega la cebolla, la zanahoria, el apio y una pizca de sal. Cocine suavemente, revolviendo durante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave. Retire los boletus del líquido, guarde el caldo de champiñones y pique en trozos grandes. Deja ambos a un lado.","Agrega el ajo y el tomillo a la sartén. Cocine por 1 minuto, luego agregue el puré de tomate y cocine por un minuto más. Vierta el vino tinto, si lo usa, cocine hasta que esté casi reducido, luego agregue las lentejas, el caldo de champiñones reservado y los tomates. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego y dejar cocer a fuego lento con la tapa puesta.","Mientras tanto, calienta una sartén grande. Agrega 1½ cucharada de aceite y vierte todos los champiñones en la sartén, incluidos los rehidratados. Freír hasta que toda el agua se haya evaporado y los champiñones estén dorados. Vierta la salsa de soja. Mezcle bien todo y luego coloque los champiñones en la cacerola de lentejas.","Agrega la Marmite, luego continúa cocinando el ragu, revolviendo ocasionalmente, a fuego medio-bajo durante 30-45 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén cocidas y la salsa esté espesa y reducida, agregando más agua si es necesario. Retire las ramitas de tomillo y sazone al gusto.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Poner las patatas en una cacerola con agua fría con sal. Llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar hasta que se haga puré.","Mientras tanto, mezcle las 5 cucharadas de aceite restantes con el orégano, luego unte las rodajas de berenjena con la mayor parte y espolvoree con sal marina. Cocine a la plancha durante 3 minutos por cada lado hasta que esté suave.","Escurrir y triturar las patatas con la leche de soja. Sazone al gusto.","Coloque el ragú en una fuente grande para lasaña (o dos fuentes más pequeñas para horno), coloque la mitad de la berenjena y luego el puré. Unte el puré con el aceite de orégano restante y luego termine cubriendo con las rodajas de berenjena restantes. Hornee en el horno durante 25-35 minutos hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante."]','2026-01-11 13:08:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15419,6295,'es','Sopa superverde con yogur y piñones','Una sopa sencilla y baja en grasas que es una nueva forma de utilizar una bolsa de hojas mixtas: también es rica en vitamina C, fibra, ácido fólico y calcio.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 papa (aproximadamente 250 g), cortada en cubos pequeños","600 ml de caldo de verduras","Bolsa de 120g de ensalada mixta de berros, rúcula y espinacas","150g de yogur natural en bote","20 g de piñones tostados","aceite de chile, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana a fuego medio-bajo. Añade la cebolla y una pizca de sal, luego cocina lentamente, revolviendo ocasionalmente, durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablande pero no tome color. Agrega el ajo y cocina por 1 min más.","Agregue la papa y luego el caldo de verduras. Cocine a fuego lento durante 10-12 minutos hasta que la papa esté lo suficientemente suave como para que un cuchillo se deslice fácilmente. Agrega la bolsa de ensalada y deja que se ablande durante 1 minuto, luego mezcla la sopa en una licuadora hasta que esté completamente suave.","Servir con una cucharada de yogur, unos piñones tostados y un chorrito de aceite de guindilla, si se desea."]','2026-01-11 13:08:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15420,6297,'es','Col picada al vino blanco con semillas de hinojo','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Para una versión rápida de chucrut, pruebe con repollo cocido a fuego lento en vino blanco, con cebolla y hierbas. La acidez de esta guarnición combina a la perfección con la untuosidad del cerdo asado.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","1 cebolla grande, cortada en rodajas","1 repollo puntiagudo grande, sin corazón y rallado","250 ml de vino blanco seco","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["En una cacerola grande, calentar el aceite de oliva, agregar las semillas de hinojo y tostar durante 1 minuto para que suelte el sabor. Agregue la cebolla y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos, luego agregue el repollo para cubrirlo con el aceite y el hinojo.","Vierta el vino blanco y el vinagre, deje que se reduzca aproximadamente a la mitad durante 5 minutos, luego cocine a fuego lento durante otros 5 minutos hasta que el repollo esté cocido y la salsa se haya espesado ligeramente. Agrega el cilantro y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:08:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15421,6299,'es','Coliflor entera asada con vino tinto, chalotas y arándanos','Para los vegetarianos, la coliflor es la realeza de los huertos vegetales. Este plato captura todo lo bueno de la combinación de cereales y verduras.','["1 cabeza grande de coliflor, sin hojas exteriores","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de semillas de mostaza","3 chalotes de plátano grandes, cortados en cuartos","4 champiñones portobello, rebanados","2 cucharaditas de hojas de tomillo","1 diente de ajo, machacado","150 ml de vino tinto","100 g de espinacas tiernas","350 g de trigo","1 litro de caldo de verduras caliente","50 g de avellanas (con piel), picadas en trozos grandes","½ cucharadita de granos de pimienta rosa triturados","50 g de parmesano vegetariano, finamente rallado"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Coloque la cabeza de coliflor boca abajo sobre una tabla de cortar y corte el tallo duro. Deja un poco de la base para que la coliflor quede intacta.","Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego a fuego medio-bajo. Agrega las semillas de mostaza y, una vez que comiencen a \"reventar\", agrega las chalotas. Freír a fuego lento durante 4-5 minutos hasta que empiece a caramelizar, luego añadir los champiñones, el tomillo y el ajo y cocinar durante 4-5 minutos más, revolviendo de vez en cuando. Vierta el vino y reduzca a la mitad. Agregue las espinacas y deje que las hojas se marchiten.","Luego, agregue las bayas de trigo, sazone bien y combine. Hacer un hueco en el centro y poner la coliflor en el medio. Vierta el caldo alrededor de la coliflor, no sobre ella, y luego sazone.","Cubra y transfiera al horno. Cocine durante 50 minutos a 1 hora hasta que la coliflor y las bayas de trigo estén tiernas. Retirar del horno y espolvorear las avellanas, los granos de pimienta y el parmesano sobre la coliflor. Regrese al horno por 5 minutos más y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:08:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15422,6301,'es','Curry verde tailandés ligero','¡Esta versión vegetariana ligera de tu curry verde tailandés favorito es un increíble 5 de tus 5 al día! El chile caliente y las verduras cremosas cubiertas con coco crean una cena satisfactoria','["25 g de copos de avena, remojados en 200 ml/7 fl oz de agua fría durante 20 minutos","1 ½ cucharada de crema de coco, rallado","1 cucharadita de aceite de coco o aceite de girasol","2 zanahorias, en rodajas","1 chirivía, cortada en trozos pequeños","1 batata pequeña, picada en trozos pequeños","¼ cucharadita de marmita","2 hojas de lima kaffir (secas o frescas)","6 lanzas de brócoli morado, cortado por la mitad a lo largo","50 g de guisantes congelados","1 lima, cortada en 6 gajos","1 pimiento verde, picado","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro","1 diente de ajo, pelado","2 cm/¾ en trozo de jengibre, pelado","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","2 cebolletas, picadas en trozos grandes","1 chile verde","arroz integral","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro (opcional)"]','["Primero, haz la pasta. Coloque todos los ingredientes en el tazón pequeño de un procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que estén finamente picados. Transfiera a un tazón pequeño y enfríe.","Coloque la avena y el agua de remojo en el procesador de alimentos (no es necesario limpiarlo primero) y mezcle hasta que quede lo más suave posible. Colarlo por un colador para eliminar los restos de avena, luego agregar la crema de coco y reservar.","Pon una sartén antiadherente grande o un wok a fuego alto. Agrega el aceite de coco seguido de la zanahoria, la chirivía y el boniato. Sofría durante unos 2-3 minutos hasta que las verduras empiecen a tomar color en los bordes, luego agregue la pasta de curry y cocine hasta que el curry ya no parezca aguado. Vierta la mezcla de leche de avena y coco, Marmite, hojas de lima y 300 ml de agua y deje hervir a fuego lento. Tape y cocine por 15 minutos, luego agregue el brócoli junto con 50 ml de agua y cocine por 5 minutos más o hasta que estén tiernos. Finalmente, agrega los guisantes congelados por 1 minuto más o hasta que estén bien calientes. Retire la sartén del fuego y luego exprima el jugo de 2 de las rodajas de lima.","Sirva inmediatamente con arroz integral, las rodajas de lima restantes y un poco de hojas de cilantro, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:08:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15423,6303,'es','Frittata de masala con salsa de aguacate','Un toque picante a una receta sencilla de frittata, con pasta Masala, cilantro y tomates cherry regordetes. Combínalo con nuestra salsa de aguacate para una cena ligera y económica.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","3 cebollas, 2 ½ en rodajas finas, ½ finamente picadas","1 cucharada de pasta de curry madrás","500 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","cilantro en paquetes pequeños, picado en trozos grandes","8 huevos grandes, batidos","1 aguacate, sin hueso, pelado y en cubos","jugo 1 limon"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén mediana antiadherente y apta para horno. Vierta las cebollas en rodajas y cocine a fuego medio durante unos 10 minutos hasta que estén suaves y doradas. Agrega la pasta de Madrás y sofríe durante 1 minuto más, luego agrega la mitad de los tomates y la mitad de la guindilla. Cocine hasta que la mezcla esté espesa y todos los tomates hayan reventado.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Agrega la mitad del cilantro a los huevos y sazona, luego vierte sobre la mezcla de cebolla picante. Revuelva suavemente una o dos veces, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que esté casi listo. Transfiera a la parrilla durante 3-5 minutos hasta que cuaje.","Para hacer la salsa, mezcle el aguacate, el chile y los tomates restantes, la cebolla picada, el cilantro restante y el jugo de limón, luego sazone y sirva con la frittata."]','2026-01-11 13:08:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15424,6305,'es','Berenjena Parmigiana más clara','Horneamos las berenjenas y usamos ricotta cremosa en esta versión saludable de Parmigiana di melanzane, mucho más baja en grasas y calorías que la original.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza, más 1 cucharadita","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","3 berenjenas (750 g/1 lb 10 oz de peso total), con los extremos del tallo recortados y cortadas en rodajas de 1 cm/½ a lo largo","1 cebolla pequeña, picada","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","Lata de 400g de tomates pera","Lata de 225 g de tomates pera","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de orégano fresco picado","100 g de ricota","50 g de mozzarella, cortada en trozos pequeños","un puñado de hojas de albahaca, rasgadas toscamente","2 tomates medianos, rebanados","25 g de parmesano vegetariano rallado"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mida las 2 cucharadas de aceite en un tazón pequeño. Cepille solo un poco en 2 bandejas para hornear grandes antiadherentes (si solo tiene 1 bandeja, hornee las berenjenas en tandas). Mezcle el jugo de limón con el aceite medido. Coloque las rodajas de berenjena cómodamente en una sola capa sobre las bandejas para hornear, unte la parte superior con la mitad del aceite y el limón, sazone con pimienta y hornee durante 20 minutos. Dale la vuelta a las rodajas, revuelve bien el resto de la mezcla de aceite y limón, ya que se habrá separado, y vuelve a cepillarlas. Sazone con pimienta y hornee por 10-15 minutos más o hasta que se ablanden.","Mientras tanto, caliente la cucharadita de aceite restante en una cacerola mediana. Agrega la cebolla y el ajo y sofríe durante 3-4 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que la cebolla se ablande y comience a dorarse. Vierta las latas de tomates, revuelva para desmenuzarlos y luego mezcle el puré, la pimienta y una pizca de sal. Cocine a fuego lento sin tapar durante unos 10 a 12 minutos hasta que espese y esté picante, luego agregue el orégano.","Extiende un poco de salsa de tomate en el fondo de una fuente poco profunda apta para horno (de unos 25 x 20 x 5 cm). Empiece por colocar un tercio de las rodajas de berenjena a lo ancho del plato, extienda sobre un tercio de la salsa restante y ponga encima la mitad de la ricotta en cucharadas pequeñas y luego la mitad de la mozzarella. Esparza la mitad de la albahaca triturada y sazone bien con pimienta. Repita las capas de rodajas de berenjena, salsa de tomate, ricotta, mozzarella y albahaca, y termine con las últimas rodajas de berenjena, los tomates en rodajas y lo último de la salsa. Sazone con pimienta y esparza sobre el parmesano. Hornee durante unos 20 minutos o hasta que el queso esté dorado y los jugos burbujeen."]','2026-01-11 13:08:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15425,6307,'es','Sopa picante de frijoles y chile','Se requiere un tiempo mínimo de preparación para preparar este abundante guiso vegetariano, que funciona tan bien como una cena sencilla o envasado en un frasco para el almuerzo.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","½ cucharadita de comino molido","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","500 ml de caldo de verduras","Lata de 400 g de judías mixtas, escurridas y enjuagadas","1 pimiento rojo, cortado en dados gruesos","chips de tortilla, para servir","4 gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola honda y sofreír la cebolla picada a fuego medio hasta que esté tierna. Agrega el ajo y el puré de tomate, revolviendo durante 1-2 minutos hasta que se combinen. Espolvoree las especias y cocine por 1 minuto más.","Vierta los tomates picados, llene la lata hasta la mitad con agua y agréguelos a la sartén. Vierta el caldo y cocine a fuego medio durante 10-15 minutos, sin tapar. Sazone y luego bata con una batidora de mano hasta que quede suave. Agregue los frijoles y el pimiento rojo y cocine por otros 15 minutos hasta que el pimiento esté tierno.","Sirva en tazones cubiertos con un pequeño montón de chips de tortilla y una rodaja de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:08:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15426,6309,'es','Médula asada con arce sobre ensalada de cavolo nero','Rocíe el tuétano con jarabe de arce y ajo, luego cubra con avellanas crujientes y pan rallado para obtener un plato vegetariano reconfortante pero saludable.','["1 tuétano mediano","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de jarabe de arce","3 cucharadas de avellanas partidas por la mitad","2 rebanadas de pan de masa madre tostado, desmenuzado","200 g de cavolo nero, sin tallos y desmenuzado","10 rábanos, en cuartos","16 virutas de parmesano estilo vegetariano","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 chalota, finamente picada","1 tsp Dijon mustard","una pizca de azúcar en polvo dorado"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cortar el tuétano a lo largo y sacar las semillas. Cortar el tuétano en rodajas y colocar en una bandeja para horno. Mezcle con aceite de oliva, ajo, jarabe de arce y un poco de condimento. Ase durante 20 minutos y luego espolvoree las avellanas y el pan rallado. Ase durante otros 8 minutos y luego retírelo.","Mientras se asa el tuétano, prepara el resto de la ensalada. Triture las hojas de cavolo nero en trozos pequeños. Colóquelo en un plato grande o en un tazón poco profundo y cubra con los rábanos.","Combine los ingredientes del aderezo en un tazón pequeño y agregue un poco de sal. Mezclar bien.","Justo antes de que el tuétano termine de cocinarse, rocíe el aderezo sobre el cavolo nero. Usa tus manos para masajear el cavolo nero durante unos minutos para que se ablande, luego cubre con el tuétano, el pan rallado y las avellanas. Espolvoree las virutas de parmesano y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:08:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15427,6311,'es','Tagine de berenjena ahumado con limón y albaricoques','Un tagine fragante es perfecto para entretener en verano, es más ligero que el guiso pero igual de satisfactorio con berenjenas carnosas y especias aromáticas.','["2 berenjenas, cortadas en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas picadas","2 cucharadas de jengibre recién rallado","1½ cucharadita cucharadita","1½ cucharadita de pimentón dulce ahumado","buena pizca de azafrán","300 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo caliente","2 limones en conserva, la cáscara de ambos en rodajas, la pulpa del centro de 1 cortada en trozos grandes","120 g de orejones cortados por la mitad","200 g de tomates, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de miel clara","ralladura de 1 limón, jugo de ½","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo tostadas","2 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana finamente picado","2 cucharadas de menta finamente picada","yogur griego, para servir (opcional)","trigo bulgar integral, para servir (opcional)"]','["Dorar las berenjenas en 2 cucharadas de aceite para que estén doradas por todos lados, pero no blandas todavía en el medio; es mejor hacerlo en tandas en una sartén antiadherente grande.","Caliente una sartén con tapa poco profunda de base pesada o tajine ignífugo con el aceite restante, luego agregue las cebollas, el jengibre y las especias, y fríalo suavemente hasta que estén tiernos y dorados.","Mientras tanto, añadir el azafrán al caldo para que se remoje. Agrega la cáscara y la pulpa de limón en conserva, los albaricoques, los tomates, la miel y el jugo de limón a las cebollas con el caldo de azafrán. Coloque bien las berenjenas, cubra con una tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos hasta que las berenjenas estén tiernas. Sazone al gusto.","Mezcle la ralladura de limón, las semillas de sésamo y las hierbas picadas y espolvoree sobre el tagine. Sirva con yogur griego y trigo bulgar integral, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:08:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15428,6313,'es','Risotto de cebada perlada, chirivía y salvia','La cebada perlada es una excelente alternativa al arroz en esta receta de risotto vegetariano aromatizado con salvia, ajo y parmesano.','["25 g de mantequilla, más una nuez extra para revolver","1 cebolla, finamente picada","4 chirivías, unos 500 g, peladas y cortadas en trozos","1 diente de ajo, machacado","10 hojas de salvia, ralladas y más para servir","400 g de cebada perlada, enjuagada","1,4 l de caldo de verduras caliente","25 g de parmesano rallado y un poco más para servir"]','["Calienta la mantequilla en una cacerola grande. Añade la cebolla y una pizca de sal y cocina a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Vierta las chirivías, suba el fuego y cocine durante 8-10 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que las chirivías comiencen a dorarse y caramelizarse.","Agrega el ajo y la salvia y mezcla. Vierta la cebada y revuelva para cubrir bien. Vierta el caldo, lleve a ebullición, luego baje a fuego lento y cocine durante 35 a 40 minutos, o hasta que casi todo el líquido se haya absorbido y la cebada perlada esté tierna pero aún tenga un toque. Es posible que tengas que añadir un poco más de agua hirviendo.","Retirar del fuego, cubrir con parmesano y una nuez de mantequilla y dejar que se derrita. Revuelva bien el risotto y luego viértalo en los platos. Cubra con más salvia, parmesano y un poco de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:08:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15429,6315,'es','Feta cocido con salsa de remolacha y puré de frijoles','Prepare esta económica cena vegetariana en minutos: apile rebanadas de queso feta ligero sobre puré de frijoles cannellini y cubra con salsa picante de remolacha.','["unos 100 g de queso feta vegetariano ligero, en rodajas gruesas","un poco de harina, para espolvorear","Paquete de rúcula de 65 g.","250 g de remolacha cocida, cortada en cubitos","½ cebolla morada, finamente picada","ralladura y jugo ½ lima","2 cucharadas de eneldo picado, más un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva, más un poco extra para cocinar","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","400 g de judías cannellini"]','["Mezclar en un bol la remolacha y la cebolla con la ralladura de lima, un buen chorrito de zumo, el condimento y el eneldo.","Caliente la cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente y cocine suavemente el ajo hasta que se ablande, luego agregue los frijoles y un poco del jugo de la lata con el condimento. Triture los frijoles, manteniéndolos bastante gruesos, luego manténgalos calientes.","Mezcle las rodajas de queso feta con un poco de harina. Calienta una sartén antiadherente, límpiala con un poco de aceite y luego cocina el queso feta durante unos minutos por cada lado hasta que esté dorado y caliente, volteándolo para asegurarte de que esté cocido de manera uniforme. Vierta el puré de frijoles en platos, cubra con el queso feta y la mitad de la salsa y luego espolvoree con más eneldo. Servir con la rúcula a un lado y el resto de la salsa en un bol."]','2026-01-11 13:08:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15430,6317,'es','Wraps picantes de aguacate','Fríe trozos vegetarianos estilo pollo con lima, chile y ajo, luego apílelos sobre tortillas sin semillas; déjelos enfriar antes de armarlos si los empaca para el almuerzo.','["Paquete de ½ x 300 g de trozos estilo pollo Quorn (o producto vegetariano similar), cortados en ángulo","jugo generoso exprimido ½ lima","½ cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","1 diente de ajo, picado","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","2 wraps sin semillas","1 aguacate, partido por la mitad y sin hueso","1 pimiento rojo asado, de un frasco","unas ramitas de cilantro picado"]','["Mezcle los trozos de pollo vegetarianos con el jugo de limón, el chile en polvo y el ajo.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y fríe los trozos durante un par de minutos, mientras calientas los wraps siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete o si tienes placa de gas, caliéntalos al fuego para que se quemen un poco. No dejes que se sequen o serán difíciles de enrollar.","Aplasta medio aguacate en cada wrap, agrega los pimientos a la sartén para calentarlos, luego apila los wraps con los trozos estilo pollo y espolvorea sobre el cilantro. Enrollar, cortar por la mitad y comer con los dedos."]','2026-01-11 13:08:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15431,6319,'es','Sopa de calabacín, guisantes y pesto','Disfruta de esta sopa súper saludable cuando quieras un almuerzo reconfortante pero bajo en calorías, rico en fibra, vitamina C y ácido fólico.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","500 g de calabacines cortados en cuartos a lo largo y picados","200 g de guisantes congelados","Lata de 400 g de judías cannellini, escurridas y enjuagadas","1 litro de caldo de verduras caliente","2 cucharadas de pesto de albahaca o alternativa vegetariana"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande. Cocine el ajo durante unos segundos, luego agregue los calabacines y cocine durante 3 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agregue los guisantes y los frijoles cannellini, vierta el caldo caliente y cocine por 3 minutos más.","Agrega el pesto a la sopa con un poco de condimento, luego sírvelo en tazones y sírvelo con pan integral crujiente, si lo deseas. O colóquelo en una petaca para llevarlo al trabajo."]','2026-01-11 13:08:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15432,6321,'es','Pad thai de tofu y espárragos','Una alternativa vegetariana y súper saludable al siempre popular pad thai.','["200 g de fideos de arroz planos","2 limas, 1 en jugo, una cortada en gajos","1 cucharada de pasta de tamarindo o jugo de lima extra","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce, más un extra para servir","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal o aceite de girasol","300 g de tofu firme, escurrido, seco y cortado en cubos","10 espárragos, recortados y cortados en diagonal","6 cebolletas cortadas por la mitad y cortadas en rodajas finas a lo largo","Bolsa de 300 g de brotes de soja.","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","un puñado de hojas de cilantro y maní salado, para servir"]','["Cocine los fideos del siguiente paquete.\r\ninstrucciones. Mezclar el jugo de lima, el tamarindo.\r\ny salsa de chile en un tazón pequeño. Dejar de lado.","Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén antiadherente\r\no wok y freír el tofu durante 5-8 minutos, hasta que\r\ndorado por todas partes. Dejar de lado.","Añade el aceite restante y sofríe el\r\nespárragos hasta que estén tiernos. Consejo en la primavera\r\ncebollas, brotes de soja y ajo. cocinar para\r\n2 minutos más. Agregue los fideos escurridos,\r\nsalsa y un poco de sal. Incorpora el tofu y\r\ncalentar a través. Servir con cilantro,\r\nmaní salado y rodajas de lima."]','2026-01-11 13:08:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15433,6323,'es','Ensalada de berenjena marinada y rúcula','Jugosos trozos de berenjena asada añaden satisfacción a esta ensalada dulce y súper saludable','["2 berenjenas, cortadas en trozos pequeños","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de vinagre balsámico","un pequeño puñado de pasas","rúcula bolsa 50g"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nMezcle la berenjena con 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva.\r\ny sazonar en una fuente grande para asar y\r\nAse durante 30 minutos hasta que esté dorado y suave.","Cuando esté cocido, mezcle con el vinagre,\r\npasas y el aceite restante. dispersarse\r\nla rúcula justo antes de servir. puede ser\r\nservido caliente o a temperatura ambiente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15434,6327,'es','La lenteja vaciló','¿Tiene dificultades para conseguir sus cinco al día? Este ragu súper saludable te acercará cuatro pasos y se puede congelar para mayor comodidad.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, finamente picadas","3 zanahorias, finamente picadas","3 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","3 dientes de ajo machacados","Bolsa de 500g de lentejas rojas secas","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 cucharaditas de orégano seco y tomillo","3 hojas de laurel","1 litro de caldo de verduras","500 g de espaguetis, más queso parmesano o vegetariano, rallado, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande y\r\nagregue las cebollas, las zanahorias, el apio y\r\najo. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos.\r\nhasta que todo esté suave. Agregue el\r\nlentejas, tomates picados, puré de tomate,\r\nhierbas y caldo. Llevar a fuego lento, luego\r\nCocine durante 40-50 minutos hasta que las lentejas estén\r\ntierno y picante – salpique con agua si\r\nnecesitas. Estación.","Si come inmediatamente, mantenga un nivel bajo\r\ncalentar mientras cocinas los espaguetis,\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir bien,\r\ndividir entre tazones o platos de pasta,\r\nvierta la salsa por encima y ralle\r\nun poco de queso. Alternativamente, enfríe el\r\nsalsa y enfríe por hasta 3 días o congélelo por hasta 3 meses. simplemente\r\ndescongelar porciones durante la noche en la habitación\r\ntemperatura, luego recaliéntela suavemente para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15435,6329,'es','Mulligatawny de invierno','Utilice las sobras del pavo asado en esta abundante sopa baja en grasa con sabor a curry. Es rico en vitamina C que apoya el sistema inmunológico, lo que lo hace ideal para los meses de invierno.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas (350 g), picadas","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo mediano","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1½ litros de caldo de verduras caliente, elaborado con 1 cucharada de caldo en polvo","500ml en puré","320 g de zanahorias cortadas en cubitos","2 ramas de apio, picadas","180 g de lentejas rojas secas","100 g de arroz basmati integral","200 g de pavo o pollo cocido, picado","15 g de cilantro picado","½ limón, exprimido"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio y cocina las cebollas durante 10 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que se ablanden y comiencen a dorarse.","Agregue el jengibre, el ajo y la guindilla y cocine por un minuto más. Agregue el curry en polvo y las semillas de comino, revuelva bien, luego vierta el caldo de verduras caliente y la passata y revuelva nuevamente.","Agregue las zanahorias, el apio, las lentejas y el arroz, mezcle bien y deje hervir. Una vez que hierva, reduzca el fuego, tape y cocine por 10 minutos más hasta que las lentejas, las verduras y el arroz estén tiernos.","Retire del fuego, agregue el cilantro y el jugo de limón y sirva en tazones. Las sobras se mantendrán frías hasta por tres días o se congelarán hasta por tres meses. Vuelve a calentar en una sartén con un chorrito de agua hasta que esté bien caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15436,6331,'es','Ensalada de invierno de coles de Bruselas con aderezo de clementina','¡Los brotes no son sólo para Navidad! Combinados con sabores picantes, aportan frescura y un bocado satisfactorio a esta ensalada de verduras de invierno.','["350 g de coles de Bruselas, ralladas","150 g de col rizada rallada","50ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra","3 clementinas, 2 peladas y segmentadas, 1 rallada y exprimida","3 cucharadas de vinagre de manzana","1 cucharada de miel o jarabe de arce","2 tsp Dijon mustard","50 g de piñones","50 g de semillas de granada, para servir (opcional)"]','["Coloque los brotes rallados y la col rizada en un tazón grande con una pizca grande de sal. Vierta el aceite de oliva en un tazón o jarra pequeño y mezcle la ralladura y el jugo de clementina, el vinagre, la miel y la mostaza, luego viértalo sobre las hojas. Exprime con las manos hasta que el aderezo esté bien distribuido y luego deja que se ablande durante 15 minutos.","Doble los piñones y los gajos de clementina y luego vierta la ensalada en un plato o en tazones. Esparza las semillas de granada, si las usa, y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:08:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15437,6333,'es','Ensalada de invierno de calabaza asada y hummus','Las ensaladas no son sólo para el verano: esta magnífica ensalada de invierno está repleta de betacaroteno y vitamina C para ayudar a reforzar las defensas inmunitarias.','["4 patatas pequeñas (unos 320 g), con piel y cortadas en gajos","320 g de calabaza, cortada en rodajas largas y finas","2 pimientos rojos y amarillos o verdes, sin semillas y cortados en trozos grandes","3 cebollas moradas (unos 320 g), cortadas en rodajas gruesas","200 g de zanahorias, cortadas por la mitad a lo largo y en rodajas gruesas","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cucharada de hojas de tomillo fresco","30 g de rúcula, para servir","2 latas de 400 g de alubias","2 dientes de ajo grandes, rebanados","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 limón grande, rallado y exprimido","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","25 g de nueces picadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Hervir las patatas durante 5 minutos, luego escurrirlas y dejarlas secar al vapor. Coloque todas las verduras, incluidas las patatas secadas al vapor, en una fuente grande para asar poco profunda donde quepan en una capa, y mezcle suavemente con el aceite y el tomillo. Ase durante 25 minutos.","Mientras tanto, haz el hummus. Escurrir las judías verdes, reteniendo el agua. Pesar 300 g de judías y ponerlas en un bol con el ajo, el pimentón ahumado, 1 cucharada de aceite de colza, 3 cucharadas de zumo de limón, 1 cucharadita de ralladura de limón y 3 cucharadas de líquido de judías y batir hasta que quede suave. Agregue otras 2 cucharadas de líquido de frijoles para obtener una consistencia más suave, si lo desea. Agrega las nueces. En un tazón pequeño aparte, mezcle 1 cucharada de jugo de limón con el aceite de colza restante.","Una vez que las verduras estén suaves, revuelva con los frijoles reservados y regrese la bandeja al horno durante 5 minutos para que se caliente. Para servir, distribuya la mitad del hummus en dos platos. Cubra con la mitad de las verduras asadas y luego vierta un poco de la mezcla de limón y aceite, guardando un poco para otra comida. Esparcir sobre la rúcula y servir. Se mantendrá frío en un recipiente hermético hasta por tres días. Vuelva a calentar las verduras en el microondas hasta que estén bien calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:08:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15438,6335,'es','Ensalada de invierno','Aprovecha al máximo la coliflor en esta maravillosa ensalada de invierno con pasas, eneldo y nueces, y hummus casero de judías blancas y pimentón ahumado.','["320 g de coliflor, partida en floretes","1 pimiento rojo, cortado en cuartos, sin semillas y en rodajas","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","1 limón grande, rallado y exprimido","15 g de pasas","35 g de nueces, picadas o partidas en trozos","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","15 g de eneldo picado","Lata de 400 g de frijoles con mantequilla","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","½ cucharada de aceite de colza"]','["Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Frota la coliflor y el pimiento con ½ cucharada de aceite y ásalos en una fuente para horno mediana durante 30 minutos hasta que estén tiernos.","Coloque la cebolla y todo menos 1 cucharada de jugo de limón en un recipiente no reactivo y triture con las manos para comenzar a ablandar las cebollas. Agrega las pasas, las nueces y la guindilla y reserva.","Para el hummus, escurrir los frijoles reservando el líquido de la lata. Coloca los frijoles en un procesador de alimentos con el ajo, el pimentón, el aceite y el jugo de limón reservado. Agregue 2 cucharadas del líquido de frijoles reservado y mezcle hasta que quede suave.","Distribuya el hummus en dos platos. Mezcle las verduras asadas con la cebolla, el aceite restante, la mitad de la ralladura de limón y el eneldo. Vierta sobre el hummus y espolvoree con la ralladura restante. Esta receta es parte de nuestro plan de dieta saludable gratuito de 7 días. Para acceder al plan de alimentación completo, haga clic aquí."]','2026-01-11 13:08:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15439,6337,'es','Sopa De Pollo Con Fideos','El aromático caldo de Mary Cadogan te calentará en las noches de invierno: contiene jengibre, que es especialmente bueno para los resfriados.','["900 ml de caldo de pollo o verduras (o mezcla de sopa de miso)","1 pechuga de pollo deshuesada y sin piel (unos 175 g)","1 cucharadita de jengibre fresco picado","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","50 g de fideos de arroz o trigo","2 cucharadas de maíz dulce, enlatado o congelado","2-3 champiñones, en rodajas finas","2 cebolletas, ralladas","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja, más un extra para servir","hojas de menta o albahaca y un poco de chile rallado (opcional), para servir"]','["Vierta el caldo en una sartén y agregue la pechuga de pollo, el jengibre y el ajo. Llevar a ebullición, luego reducir el fuego, tapar parcialmente y cocinar a fuego lento durante 20 minutos, hasta que el pollo esté tierno.","Coloque el pollo a bordo y desmenúcelo en trozos pequeños con un par de tenedores. Regrese el pollo al caldo con los fideos, el maíz dulce, los champiñones, la cebolleta y la salsa de soja. Cocine a fuego lento durante 3-4 minutos hasta que los fideos estén tiernos.","Sirva en dos tazones y esparza sobre el resto de la cebolleta, las hojas de menta o albahaca y el chile, si lo usa. Sirva con salsa de soja extra."]','2026-01-11 13:08:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15440,6341,'es','pepinillo de calabaza','Haga su propia cesta navideña y asegúrese de agregar este pepinillo de calabaza de temporada. Se puede acompañar con embutidos, queso o un trozo de tarta salada caliente.','["850 g de calabaza (600 g de peso preparado), pelada y picada en trozos de 1 cm","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 manzanas para comer, sin corazón, peladas y picadas en trozos de 1 cm","2 cucharaditas de semillas de mostaza negra","2 cucharaditas de semillas de cilantro","2 cucharaditas de semillas de nigella","200 g de azúcar en polvo","450 ml de vinagre de sidra","2 hojas de laurel","1½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","2 cucharadas de harina común","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y cortado en rodajas finas","1 chile verde o rojo, finamente picado"]','["Coloque la calabaza preparada en un bol y espolvoree 2 cucharadas de sal marina. Removemos bien, tapamos y dejamos a temperatura ambiente durante 24 h.","Esterilice sus frascos antes de comenzar (consulte el consejo a continuación). Escurre y enjuaga la calabaza, luego viértela en una cacerola grande. Agrega la cebolla, los trozos de manzana, la mostaza, las semillas de cilantro y nigella, el azúcar, el vinagre y las hojas de laurel. Vierta 200 ml de agua sobre todo, luego ponga a fuego medio y deje hervir a fuego lento. Tapa la sartén, dejando un espacio para que escape el vapor, sube el fuego a medio-alto y cocina por 8 minutos.","Usa una taza para sacar un poco de líquido de la sartén y mezcla 50 ml con la cúrcuma y la harina en un tazón pequeño para hacer una pasta suave. Agrega un poco más de líquido, mezclando bien para eliminar los grumos, hasta que la pasta se vuelva líquida, luego vierte en la sartén y agrega el jengibre y la guindilla. Cocine a fuego lento durante otros 5 minutos, sin tapar, revolviendo hasta que espese y la calabaza se haya ablandado pero aún conserva algo de sabor.","Llene con cuidado los frascos esterilizados con el pepinillo mientras aún esté caliente, presionando los trozos de calabaza en el líquido para expulsar las bolsas de aire, luego coloque la tapa. Se mantendrá en un lugar fresco y oscuro hasta por un año. Una vez abierto conservar en el frigorífico y consumir en el plazo de un mes. Es mejor servirlo después de dejarlo madurar durante un mes o más, pero se puede comer inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15441,6343,'es','Pruébalo','Espere una patada de este chocolate caliente en capas para adultos que incluye un trago de espresso. Este chocolate caliente italiano es tan tradicional como el chocolate caliente.','["125ml de nata doble","250ml de leche entera o nata entera","50 g de chocolate negro (al menos 70 % de cacao), finamente picado","azúcar demerara, al gusto","2 tragos de espresso recién hecho","10 g de avellanas finamente ralladas o picadas","pizca de cacao en polvo"]','["Batir la nata doble en un bol hasta que mantenga su forma pero aún se pueda verter. Dejar de lado.","Vierta la leche o la nata en una cacerola con el chocolate negro. Revuelva continuamente a fuego medio-bajo con un batidor hasta que la mezcla hierva. Reduzca el fuego a bajo y cocine a fuego lento mientras continúa batiendo. Agrega el azúcar demerara al gusto.","Calienta dos vasos resistentes al calor enjuagándolos con agua caliente, luego sécalos y vierte el espresso. Vierta con cuidado sobre la mezcla de chocolate y cubra con la nata montada, las avellanas y una pizca de cacao en polvo."]','2026-01-11 13:08:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15442,6347,'es','Macarrones con queso sin lactosa','Disfruta de una versión sin lactosa de macarrones con queso. La mejor comida reconfortante para las frías noches de invierno; seguramente será un éxito para toda la familia.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de harina común","500ml de leche sin lactosa","125 g de Grana Padano, finamente rallado","2 tsp Dijon mustard","250 g de macarrones con codo o pasta corta","3 cucharadas de pan rallado seco","pizca de pimentón o pimienta de cayena"]','["Batir el aceite de oliva y la harina en una cacerola hasta que quede suave, luego calentar a fuego medio hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y espese un poco. Agrega la leche poco a poco, batiendo continuamente, hasta que se forme una salsa blanca y suave. Cocine por 2 minutos más hasta que esté lo suficientemente espeso como para cubrir el dorso de una cuchara. Agregue 100 g de Grana Padano y la mostaza de Dijon, luego cocine durante 1-2 minutos más hasta que se derrita. Sazone bien.","Mientras tanto, cocina la pasta durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté al dente. Escurrir bien y agregar a la salsa de queso. Vierta en una fuente para horno y caliente la parrilla a fuego medio. Mezcle el pan rallado, el pimentón o la cayena y el Grana Padano restante, luego esparza sobre los macarrones con queso. Ase durante 5-8 minutos hasta que la parte superior esté crujiente y dorada. Sirva con una ensalada verde bien aderezada."]','2026-01-11 13:08:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15443,6349,'es','Guiso ahumado de jamón y lentejas','Aprovecha al máximo las sobras navideñas de jamón y verduras asadas en este guiso ahumado de lentejas y jamón, perfecto para alimentar a la familia durante las fiestas.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza o de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","1 rama de apio, picada","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","2 cubitos de caldo de pollo o verduras bajo en sal o caldo","140 g de sobras de jamón cocido o jamón cortado en trozos","350 g de tubérculos asados ​​sobrantes (como patatas, zanahorias, chirivías, apio nabos o colinabos), cortados en trozos","Bolsa de 200 g de lentejas puy cocidas","manojo pequeño de perejil picado","pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y cocina la cebolla y el apio durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Agrega el pimentón y la mostaza, cocina 30 segundos más, luego desmenuza los cubitos de caldo y agrega el jamón junto con 1 litro de agua. Llevar a fuego lento y luego burbujear suavemente durante 10 minutos.","Agregue los tubérculos y las lentejas, luego sazone al gusto y continúe burbujeando todo durante otros 5 a 10 minutos hasta que el guiso esté bien caliente. Justo antes de servir, agregue el perejil, luego sirva en tazones y sirva con pan crujiente a un lado para limpiar el guiso."]','2026-01-11 13:08:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15444,6351,'es','Sirope de calabaza y especias','Agregue este versátil jarabe de especias de calabaza, elaborado con canela, clavo y jengibre, a cafés con leche y batidos. También puedes rociarlo sobre pasteles y postres.','["200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de azúcar moreno blando","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharadita de canela molida","¼ cucharadita de clavo molido","2 cucharaditas de jengibre molido","rallado de nuez moscada","2 cucharadas de puré de calabaza enlatado"]','["Vierte todos los ingredientes en una cacerola con 125 ml de agua y cocina a fuego medio durante 5-10 minutos hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto y tengas un almíbar fino.","Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar. Transfiera el almíbar a un biberón o frasco esterilizado. Se conservará en el refrigerador hasta por dos semanas."]','2026-01-11 13:08:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15445,6353,'es','Guiso de remolacha y nueces','Esta vibrante receta vegetariana contiene la impresionante cantidad de 4 de tus 5 al día y es una deliciosa cena baja en grasas y calorías.','["250 g de remolacha cruda","350 g de calabaza, sin pelar","1 diente de ajo rallado","1 cebolla pequeña, picada","¼ cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de cilantro molido","4 vainas de cardamomo, sin semillas y trituradas","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","½ cucharadita de canela","100 g de judías verdes, cubiertas y cortadas por la mitad","50 g de acelgas o espinacas, sin tallos y hojas picadas en trozos grandes","paquete pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado en trozos grandes","arroz integral, para servir (opcional)"]','["Pelar la remolacha y picarla en trozos pequeños. Picar la calabaza en trozos pequeños. Colócalos en tazones separados hasta que los necesites.","En una cacerola grande de tapa ancha, sofreír el ajo, la cebolla, las semillas de comino, el cilantro y las vainas de cardamomo en aceite durante 2 minutos a fuego medio. Añade 125 ml de agua junto con la remolacha y deja reposar 5 minutos más hasta que el agua se haya evaporado a fuego lento.","Añadimos 250ml de agua, la calabaza y la canela y dejamos cocer a fuego medio durante 10 minutos. Añade 250 ml de agua y deja cocinar a fuego lento otros 10 minutos.","Agregue 125 ml de agua, las judías verdes y cocine a fuego lento durante otros 5 minutos hasta que el agua se haya evaporado. Retirar del fuego y agregar las acelgas y el perejil. Sirva solo o con arroz integral para una comida más completa."]','2026-01-11 13:08:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15446,6355,'es','Ensalada de espinacas y calabaza con aderezo de coco','La calabaza asada, las cebollas marinadas con lima y las hojas de espinaca aderezadas con crema de coco son la ensalada buffet perfecta para el invierno.','["1 calabaza grande o calabaza, sin semillas pero sin piel","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada grande, cortada en aros finos","2 limas, ralladura de 1, jugo de ambas","½ lata de 160ml de crema de coco","2 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","2 bolsas de 100 g de espinacas tiernas"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Corte la calabaza en trozos pequeños, mezcle con el aceite y el condimento, luego ase durante 30-40 minutos hasta que esté dorada y tierna. Dejar enfriar.","Mezcle los aros de cebolla con el jugo de 1 lima y reserve mientras se asa la calabaza.","Haz el aderezo. Batir el jugo de lima restante, la ralladura, la crema de coco, la salsa de pescado y el azúcar. Tapar y dejar reposar en el frigorífico durante 10-15 minutos, o hasta que esté listo para servir. Cuando esté listo para comer, mezcle la calabaza, las espinacas y la cebolla y sirva con un generoso chorrito de aderezo."]','2026-01-11 13:08:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15447,6357,'es','Cazuela de cebada perlada, tocino y puerros','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Este grano de despensa es una excelente alternativa al arroz o al cuscús. Combine con tocino y verduras en este guiso parecido a un risotto','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 puerros, en rodajas gruesas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","300 g de cebada perlada","4 zanahorias, en cubos","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon, más extra para servir","1 litro de caldo de pollo","300 g de coles de Saboya, ralladas","200 g de tocino magro, cocido y picado en trozos pequeños"]','["Calienta una sartén grande a fuego medio. Agrega el aceite de oliva y cocina los puerros por unos minutos, luego agrega el ajo y cocina por solo 1 minuto más.","Agrega la cebada perlada, las zanahorias y la mostaza, luego vierte sobre el caldo de pollo. Sazone con abundante pimienta negra molida y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Añade el repollo con\r\nel tocino y cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos hasta que el repollo esté blando y tierno. Sirva con más mostaza Dijon a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:08:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15448,6359,'es','Venado estofado especiado con chile y chocolate','Puede comerse como guiso o usarse en pasteles o tartas caseras. El chocolate añade riqueza y brillo extra a la salsa terminada.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1½ kg de venado para guisar cortado en cubitos","3 zanahorias grandes, picadas en trozos grandes","1 cebolla, picada en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de semilla de comino","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","una pizca grande de chile en polvo","pequeña rama de canela","1 chile rojo, entero","1 cucharada colmada de harina común","500 ml de vino tinto","300 ml de caldo de carne","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","ramita grande de tomillo","2 hojas de laurel","50 g de chocolate negro (más del 70% de cacao)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego y dorar la carne en tandas. Agregue las verduras al plato y dórelas ligeramente, luego agregue las especias, el chile y la harina y cocine por unos minutos. Vierta el vino, el caldo y los tomates, luego agregue las hierbas. Llevar a fuego lento.","Cubrir con una tapa y meter en el horno durante 1 h 30 min, luego quitar la tapa y cocinar durante 1 h más hasta que la carne esté muy tierna. Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar un poco, luego agregar el chocolate y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:08:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15449,6361,'es','curry de pavo','Vuélvete clásico con las sobras de pavo y prepara este saludable guiso lleno de especias con pimientos y tomates.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla grande, en rodajas gruesas","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y picado","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry (o alternativa sin gluten)","2 dientes de ajo machacados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","300 g de pavo sobrante, cortado en cubitos","300 g de patatas cocidas sobrantes (hervidas o asadas), cortadas en cubitos","2 cucharadas de chutney de mango","cilantro en paquetes pequeños, picado en trozos grandes","arroz o pan naan, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego bastante alto. Cocine la cebolla y el pimiento durante 3-4 minutos hasta que comiencen a ablandarse y dorarse ligeramente. Agregue la pasta de curry y el ajo, luego cocine por 1 o 2 minutos más. Añade los tomates picados y 150ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición y burbujear durante 5 minutos.","Baje el fuego, agregue el pavo y las papas y cocine por otros 2-3 minutos, luego sazone y agregue el chutney de mango. Espolvorea con cilantro y sirve con arroz o naan."]','2026-01-11 13:08:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15450,6363,'es','Salteado de pollo, col rizada y brotes','Las coles de Bruselas no son sólo para Navidad: agrégalas a una olla de fideos saludable para obtener más nutrición y textura crujiente.','["100 g de fideos soba","100 g de col rizada rallada","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","2 pechugas de pollo magras, sin piel y cortadas en tiras finas","25 g de jengibre fresco, pelado y cortado en palitos","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas finas","un puñado de coles de Bruselas, cortadas en cuartos","1 cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sodio","2 cucharadas de vino de arroz o vinagre de vino blanco","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima"]','["Cocine los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escurra y reserve. Mientras tanto, caliente un wok grande o una sartén y agregue la col rizada junto con un buen chorrito de agua y cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que se ablande, quedando un poco de mordisco, luego enfríe con agua corriente para mantener el color.","Agrega la mitad del aceite y cocina las tiras de pollo hasta que se doren, luego retira y reserva. Calentar el aceite restante y sofreír el jengibre, la pimienta y los brotes hasta que se ablanden un poco. Devuelve el pollo y la col rizada y agrega los fideos.","Agregue la soja, el vino de arroz, la ralladura y el jugo de lima junto con suficiente agua para crear una salsa que se adhiera a los ingredientes. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15451,6365,'es','pastel de pollo masala','Un curry de coco horneado con patatas de Bombay que es saludable y bajo en grasas. Acurrúcate con algo de comida reconfortante y nutritiva','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","2 cebollas picadas","jengibre en trozos, del tamaño de un dedo, rallado","3 dientes de ajo machacados","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo mediano","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de semillas de mostaza negra o marrón","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino blanco o tinto","2 cucharaditas de azúcar (blanca o morena)","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","150 ml de leche de coco light (compra una lata de 400 ml; necesitarás más para la cobertura)","1 pimiento rojo grande, sin semillas y cortado en trozos grandes","1 pimiento verde grande, sin semillas y cortado en trozos grandes","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, las hojas picadas en trozos grandes y los tallos reservados (ver más abajo)","1½ kg de patatas harinosas, cortadas en trozos muy grandes","150ml de leche de coco light","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","jugo 1 limon","1 manojo de cebolletas, finamente picadas","tallos de ½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de semillas de kalonji (también conocidas como nigella o semillas de cebolla)","pan naan, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar una sartén honda o refractaria.\r\ncazuela y añadir 2 cucharaditas de aceite.\r\nDorar las pechugas de pollo rápidamente pero\r\nbien por ambos lados, luego retirar a un\r\nplato. Bajar el fuego y agregar el\r\nel aceite restante, la cebolla, el jengibre y\r\najo. Freír suavemente hasta que estén tiernos. Agrega las especias\r\ny cocine por unos minutos, revolviendo.","Agregue el vinagre, el azúcar, los tomates y\r\nleche de coco. Llevar a fuego lento y\r\nburbujear durante 10 minutos. Picar en trozos grandes\r\npechugas de pollo y revuelva en la sartén con\r\nel jugo de pollo y los pimientos.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante otros 20 minutos hasta que\r\nel pollo esté bien cocido y la salsa\r\nreducido un poco. Retirar del fuego, agregar\r\nlas hojas de cilantro y sazonar al gusto\r\n– necesitará un buen condimento.","Para hacer la cobertura poner las patatas.\r\nen una cacerola grande con agua, llevar a ebullición,\r\nluego hierva hasta que esté cocido, de 10 a 15 minutos, dependiendo del tamaño de los trozos.\r\nEscurrir muy bien y luego volver a colocarlo en el\r\nsartén y secar al vapor durante unos minutos.","Añade la leche de coco y la cúrcuma a\r\nla sartén y triturar muy bien. Temporada\r\ncon el zumo de limón y un poco de sal,\r\nluego agregue las cebolletas y\r\ntallos de cilantro.","Vierta el pollo masala en un\r\nfuente para hornear. Agregue cucharadas de\r\ntriture para cubrir, luego espolvoree sobre\r\nsemillas de kalonji. Se puede cubrir y\r\nrefrigerado por hasta 2 días (o congelado por\r\nhasta un mes).","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6\r\ny hornee durante 25-30 minutos (o 45 minutos\r\ndesde frío) hasta que esté completamente caliente y\r\ncrujiente encima. Servir con naan\r\npan, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:08:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15452,6369,'es','Guiso picante de berenjenas tiernas con cilantro y menta','Súper saludable y rico en fibra, este milagroso plato único del Medio Oriente tiene menos de 150 calorías por porción y cuenta como 5 de tus 5 al día.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas, rebanadas","4 dientes de ajo, machacados","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y en rodajas, o 2-3 chiles rojos secos dejados enteros","2 cucharaditas de semillas de cilantro, tostadas y trituradas","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino, tostadas y trituradas","16 berenjenas tiernas, dejadas enteras y con el tallo intacto","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","manojo de hojas de menta, picadas en trozos grandes","manojo de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","cuscús y yogur para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola de base pesada,\r\nagregue las cebollas y el ajo y cocine\r\nhasta que empiecen a tomar color. Añade el\r\nchiles, cilantro y semillas de comino.\r\nCuando las semillas desprenden una nuez.\r\naroma, agregue todo\r\nberenjenas, rebozándolas\r\nen la cebolla y las especias.","Agregue tomates y azúcar,\r\ntape y cocine suavemente durante 40 minutos,\r\nhasta que las berenjenas estén tiernas.","Sazone la salsa y revuelva por la mitad.\r\nla menta y el cilantro. Cubrir y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos. espolvorear\r\nhierbas restantes y servir con\r\ncuscús y yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:08:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15453,6371,'es','Empanadas de pollo y puerro','La comida reconfortante no tiene por qué significar calorías: este pastel súper saludable utiliza masa filo para mantener su bajo contenido de grasas saturadas.','["1 batata grande, cortada en trozos grandes","4 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","2 pechugas de pollo, picadas en trozos pequeños","1 puerro, finamente cortado","1 zanahoria, picada","225 ml de caldo de pollo bajo en sodio","2 cucharaditas de mostaza integral","85 g de queso tierno y ligero","2 cucharadas de hojas de estragón picadas","2 láminas de masa filo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. En\r\nuna bandeja para asar echa las batatas\r\ncon 2 cucharaditas de aceite y un poco de condimento.\r\nCocine durante 30-40 minutos, hasta que esté dorado y\r\ncrujiente. Calentar 1 cucharadita de aceite en una sartén mediana.\r\nsartén. Freír el pollo hasta que se dore,\r\nRetirar de la sartén y reservar. Añadir\r\nel puerro y un chorrito de agua, y con cuidado\r\nFreír hasta que estén suaves, aproximadamente 7 minutos. Añade el\r\nzanahoria y cocine por 3 minutos más. Vierta\r\nel caldo y hervir hasta que se reduzca a la mitad,\r\nluego agrega la mostaza y el queso tierno,\r\nrevolviendo bien para combinar. Devolver el\r\npollo a la sartén, agregue el estragón y\r\nalgún condimento.","Divida la mezcla entre 2 pequeñas\r\nplatos aptos para horno. Toma las hojas de filo\r\ny arrugarlos. Cubra cada pastel con\r\nuna hoja y unte con la cucharadita de aceite restante.\r\nCocer las tartas al horno con las patatas fritas.\r\ndurante 15 minutos, hasta que la masa esté dorada."]','2026-01-11 13:08:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15454,6373,'es','Pastel de verduras de invierno','Una porción de este delicioso pastel de pastor vegetariano contiene los 5 ingredientes de la ingesta diaria recomendada de 5','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, rebanadas","1 cucharada de harina","300 g (unas 2 grandes) de zanahorias, cortadas en bastones pequeños","½ coliflor, partida en floretes pequeños","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 ramita de romero, hojas finamente picadas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","200 g de guisantes congelados","900 g de patatas cortadas en trozos","hasta 200 ml/7 fl oz de leche"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en un\r\nplato ignífugo sobre un medio\r\ncalor. Agregue las cebollas y cocine por\r\n10 minutos hasta que se ablanden, luego agregue\r\nla harina y cocinar por otro\r\n2 minutos. Agrega las zanahorias, la coliflor,\r\najo y romero, y cocine durante 5 minutos, revolviendo regularmente, hasta que\r\ncomenzar a ablandarse.","Coloca los tomates en el\r\nverduras junto con una lata llena\r\nde agua. Cubrir con una tapa y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos, luego retire\r\ntapa y cocina durante 10-15 minutos.\r\nmás, hasta que la salsa se haya espesado\r\ny se cocinan las verduras.\r\nSazone, agregue los guisantes y cocine.\r\ndurante 1 min más.","Mientras tanto, hervir las patatas.\r\ndurante 10-15 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. drenaje,\r\nluego colóquelo nuevamente en la cacerola\r\ny puré. Revuelva con suficiente leche\r\nhasta alcanzar una consistencia bastante blanda,\r\nluego agregue el aceite de oliva restante\r\ny temporada.","Calienta la parrilla. Cuchara el caliente\r\nmezcla de verduras en un molde para pastel, cubra\r\ncon el puré y arrastrar con un tenedor\r\nligeramente sobre la superficie. Lugar\r\ndebajo de la parrilla durante unos minutos hasta\r\nla parte superior es de un color marrón dorado crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:08:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15455,6375,'es','Patatas asadas con chile y pavo','La carne picada de pavo es barata y magra: condimente al estilo mexicano con comino y pimentón y sírvala con papas crujientes al horno.','["4 patatas grandes para asar","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","300 g de carne picada de pavo","1 cucharada de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharada de vinagre de sidra","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno claro suave","350ml en puré","Red Leicester reducida en grasa, rallada, para servir","4 cebolletas, picadas, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nUtiliza un tenedor para pinchar todas las patatas.\r\nterminado. Frote con un poco de aceite y\r\nhornee por 45 minutos hasta que estén tiernos.","Mientras tanto, haz el chile. Calentar el\r\naceite restante en una sartén grande sobre una\r\nfuego medio. Agrega la cebolla, el ajo y\r\nun poco de condimento y cocine por 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté suave. Agrega la carne picada de pavo y\r\nSazone nuevamente, luego aumente el fuego y\r\nRompe la carne picada con el dorso de tu\r\ncuchara. Cuando esté bien cocido, agregue\r\nlas especias, el vinagre, el azúcar y el passata.\r\nReducir a fuego lento y cocinar durante 10 minutos.\r\no hasta que el líquido se haya reducido.","Corta una cruz en la parte superior de cada papa.\r\ny vierta el chile. Sirve cada papa\r\nespolvoreado con queso y cebolletas."]','2026-01-11 13:09:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15456,6377,'es','Pollo harissa con trigo bulgur','Bulgur es fácil de cocinar y una excelente alternativa a los cereales refinados. Tiene un alto contenido de fibra y nutrientes, por lo que es bueno para el intestino, la digestión y la salud del corazón. Sírvelo con guisos, utilízalo en ensaladas o como alternativa nutritiva al arroz. ¡Esta receta es la favorita de mis hijos!','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","250 g de mini filetes de pollo","2 cucharadas de pasta de harissa de rosas, al gusto","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 pimiento rojo, finamente picado","150 g de trigo bulgur, enjuagado y escurrido","160 g de judías verdes, picadas en trozos grandes","1/2 limón, en jugo","Un puñado pequeño de cilantro, picado o con hojas enteras","80 g de semillas de granada"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio. Freír el ajo durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté dorado, con cuidado de no quemarlo. Añade el pollo y dóralo unos minutos. Agrega la harissa y el puré de tomate.","Agrega el pimiento picado y cocina, revolviendo bien, durante unos minutos.","Agregue el trigo bulgur escurrido, una pizca de sal y 300 ml de agua hirviendo. Llevar a fuego lento, tapar la sartén y cocinar durante 5 minutos.","Levante la tapa y coloque las judías verdes encima, cubra nuevamente y cocine por 5 minutos. Retirar del fuego y dejar tapado otros 5 minutos.","Destapar, exprimir sobre el jugo de limón y mezclar bien. Adorne con el cilantro y las semillas de granada."]','2026-01-11 13:09:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15457,6379,'es','Curry súper verde con arroz de quinua','He usado garbanzos en esto, pero la base de curry es adaptable; simplemente agregue su elección de proteína. Un chorrito de limón agrega vitamina C para ayudar a la absorción de hierro y mezclar quinua con arroz aumenta la ingesta de cereales integrales ricos en fibra y proteínas.','["75g de quinua","75 g de arroz","1 cucharadita de aceite","1/2 cebolla morada, picada","1/2 cucharadita de semillas de comino","50 g de col rizada","150 g de hojas tiernas de espinacas","1/4 cucharadita de cúrcuma","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","exprimir el jugo de limón, para servir","1-2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","5 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","1 chile rojo, en rodajas finas"]','["En un tazón grande apto para microondas, combine la quinua y el arroz. Lavar y enjuagar tres veces. Agregue 320 ml de agua hirviendo, cubra y cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 10 minutos. Dejar reposar durante 5 minutos y luego esponjar con un tenedor.","Mientras se cocina el arroz, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio. Freír la cebolla durante 5-7 minutos hasta que esté suave y ligeramente dorada. Agrega el comino y revuelve durante 1 min para evitar que se queme.","Agrega la col rizada, las espinacas, la cúrcuma y una pizca de sal. Vierta 250 ml de agua hirviendo. Tape y cocine durante 10-15 minutos, revolviendo hasta la mitad.","Transfiera a una licuadora, déjela enfriar por unos minutos y luego licue hasta que quede suave. Regrese la mezcla a la sartén y agregue los garbanzos. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos para que se caliente.","Calienta el aceite para el tadka en una sartén a fuego medio. Freír el ajo y los chiles durante 2-3 minutos. Vierta rápidamente sobre el curry. Servir con arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:09:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15458,6383,'es','Curry de tofu súper verde','¿Dejar de comer carne? Disfruta de este delicioso curry de tofu y espinacas que puedes preparar en minutos. Sirva con arroz salvaje y un poco de cilantro.','["280 g de tofu firme, cortado en triángulos pequeños","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cucharaditas de semillas de cilantro","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","2 vainas de cardamomo, semillas machacadas","10 g de jengibre, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","400 g de espinacas","10 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes, más hojas enteras adicionales para servir","2 bolsas de 250 g de mezcla de arroz integral y salvaje cocido, para servir"]','["Seque el tofu con papel de cocina y luego caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén grande y profunda a fuego medio. Fríe el tofu durante 3-4 minutos o hasta que esté dorado por ambos lados. Retirar de la sartén utilizando una rodaja de pescado y reservar para escurrir sobre papel de cocina.","Vierta el aceite restante en la sartén, luego esparza las semillas de cilantro, las semillas de comino y el cardamomo y cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que reviente.","Agrega el jengibre, la cebolla y el ajo y cocina durante 10-12 minutos más hasta que los bordes estén dorados. Baje el fuego y agregue las espinacas, un puñado a la vez, y revuelva hasta que se ablanden. Retirar del fuego. Vierta la mezcla de espinacas, el cilantro y 300 ml de agua en una licuadora de alta potencia y mezcle hasta que esté completamente suave. Vierte la mezcla nuevamente en la sartén y sazona con sal. Llevar a fuego lento.","Vierta el tofu frito y cocine durante 4-5 minutos, o hasta que el tofu se haya calentado por completo. Sazone, luego vierta sobre el arroz salvaje y esparza sobre las hojas de cilantro para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:09:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15459,6385,'es','Burritos más saludables','Agregue repollo rallado, ensalada de repollo o salsa de maíz dulce para darle una versión más saludable a un favorito mexicano. Nuestro método para hacer chile con carne ofrece los mejores resultados.','["300 g de arroz integral","4-6 tortillas integrales, para servir","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","400-500 g de carne picada","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, machacados","2 cucharaditas de pasta de chipotle","1 cucharada de condimento cajún o fajita","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno","1 cucharada de vinagre de sidra","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos pero sin enjuagar","Lata de 400g de tomate picado","1 tomate, picado","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","½ paquete pequeño de cilantro, picado","1 lima, exprimida","2 aguacates, sin hueso y pelados","yogur natural, mitades de lima para exprimir y queso cheddar rallado (opcional)"]','["Primero haz el chile. Calentar el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio, desmenuzar la carne picada y freír durante 15-20 minutos. Al principio, soltará un poco de líquido, pero una vez que haya burbujeado, la carne picada chisporroteará en su propia grasa y comenzará a dorarse y quedar crujiente. En este punto, córtelo con una cuchara de madera para que se dore y se caramelice por completo, luego agregue la cebolla y cocine por otros 10 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agrega el ajo, la pasta de chipotle, la mezcla de especias, el azúcar y el vinagre y cocina por 1 min. Agregue los frijoles y los tomates, revuelva todo y cocine a fuego lento, sin tapar, durante 20 minutos hasta que espese. Se mantendrá refrigerado durante dos días o congelado durante un mes. Descongelar completamente y recalentar hasta que esté bien caliente.","Mientras tanto, pon el arroz en una cacerola mediana con 600ml de agua fría y una pizca de sal, si quieres. Llevar a ebullición, luego bajar el fuego, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante unos 20 minutos hasta que se haya absorbido toda el agua. Apagar el fuego y dejar reposar otros 10 minutos. Remueve el arroz y deja reposar.","Para el guacamole, mezcle los tomates con la cebolla, el cilantro, el jugo de limón y un poco de condimento, luego tritúrelos para hacer un guacamole con trozos. Para servir, calienta las tortillas, esparce un poco de guacamole, agrega una capa generosa de arroz, luego el chile, el yogur natural, el jugo de limón y el queso cheddar rallado, si lo deseas. Envuelva todo bien, córtelo por la mitad y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:09:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15460,6387,'es','Ensalada tibia de pollo con aderezo de aguacate','Los aguacates de esta ensalada tibia y ahumada son muy nutritivos y contienen vitamina E, hierro, potasio y niacina, además de grasas monoinsaturadas saludables para el corazón.','["3 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en tiras gruesas","2 filetes de pechuga de pollo sin piel, cada uno cortado en unas seis tiras","2 dientes de ajo, ambos pelados, uno finamente rallado y el otro entero","14 cucharaditas de orégano seco, más una pizca","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","15 g de cilantro molido","1 cebolla morada, unos 50 g, en rodajas finas","3 cucharadas de jugo de lima","1 aguacate, partido por la mitad y sin hueso, la mitad sacada y cortada en rodajas","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros escurridos","15 g de cilantro picado","50 g de espinacas tiernas"]','["Calienta 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego lento, agrega los pimientos, tapa y cocina durante 10 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agite la sartén un par de veces para moverlos, pero trate de no levantar la tapa. Retirar de la sartén y reservar.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el pollo en un bol con la 1 cucharadita de aceite restante, el ajo rallado, ¼ de cucharadita de orégano, pimentón y ½ cucharadita de cilantro. Mezcle la cebolla con 1 cucharada de jugo de lima en un recipiente aparte y reserve.","Para hacer el aderezo, coloque el aguacate cortado por la mitad y sin rodajas en un bol con el diente de ajo entero, una pizca de orégano, 2 cucharadas de jugo de lima y 3 cucharadas de agua y mezcle con una batidora de mano hasta que esté completamente suave. Alternativamente, puedes usar un procesador de alimentos.","Regrese la sartén con pimientos al fuego y agregue el pollo, cubra y cocine por 5 minutos hasta que esté tierno y bien cocido. Vierta los frijoles, las cebollas encurtidas rápidamente y el cilantro picado en la sartén y mezcle bien.","Apila las espinacas en dos platos y cubre con la mezcla de pollo. Vierta el aderezo de aguacate y cubra con las rodajas de aguacate. Sirva mientras aún está caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:09:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15461,6389,'es','burritos de pollo saludables','Utilice ingredientes de despensa y sobras para preparar este almuerzo nutritivo y fácil al estilo mexicano. El relleno de los burritos se puede preparar con antelación.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","1 pimiento rojo grande, cortado por la mitad a lo largo, sin semillas y cortado en tiras gruesas","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2-3 cucharaditas de chile suave en polvo, al gusto","Lata de 400g de frijoles negros","Lata de 198 g de maíz dulce, escurrido","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 diente de ajo grande, finamente rallado","Bolsa de 220 g de arroz integral cocido (o arroz integral cocido sobrante)","300 g de pollo cocido, en rodajas o desmenuzado (o una combinación de carne de pierna y pechuga sobrante de un asado)","15 g de cilantro picado","2 aguacates pequeños, deshuesados ​​y cortados en cuartos","1 lima, exprimida","4 tortillas integrales grandes"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande y cocina el pimiento, tapado, durante 10 minutos a fuego lento hasta que esté suave y ligeramente carbonizado.","Mientras tanto, en una sartén seca, tuesta suavemente las especias a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén fragantes, luego vierte los frijoles, junto con su líquido, el maíz dulce, el puré de tomate y el ajo. Mezcle bien y suba el fuego a medio para que la mezcla burbujee, luego agregue el arroz, el pollo y el cilantro. Cocine durante 3-4 minutos hasta que esté bien caliente. Se mantendrá frío hasta por un día. Primero déjelo enfriar por completo. Vuelva a calentar en una sartén o en el microondas hasta que esté bien caliente.","Mezcle el aguacate en un bol con el jugo de lima. Coloque las tortillas sobre una superficie de trabajo y apile el arroz en el centro dejando un espacio a cada lado. Cubra con los pimientos y el aguacate, luego doble las tortillas en cada extremo para encerrar el relleno y enrolle bien la envoltura. Coloque en la sartén en la que cocinó los pimientos, con la costura hacia abajo, y cocine suavemente por cada lado a fuego lento para tostar ligeramente, aproximadamente 2-3 minutos. Es posible que tengas que hacer esto en lotes."]','2026-01-11 13:09:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15462,6391,'es','Lentejas veganas con tofu de soja y jengibre','Combine tofu frito dulce, pegajoso y picante con lentejas puy, cilantro y chile para obtener un plato lleno de fibra.','["160 g de lentejas puy secas o lentejas verdes","2 hojas de laurel","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza, más un chorrito","2 cebollas (350 g), finamente picadas","180 g de apio, en rodajas finas","320 g de zanahorias finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de hojas frescas de tomillo","1 cucharada de mostaza integral, más 1 cucharadita","2 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra de manzana crudo","1 cucharada de perejil de hoja plana picado","260 g de tofu extra firme","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","2 cucharaditas de vinagre balsámico","2 cucharaditas de jengibre finamente rallado","2 cucharaditas de salsa de soja baja en sal","4 cucharaditas de mezcla de tres semillas tostadas","1 cucharada de hojas de cilantro fresco","1 chile rojo, picado"]','["Poner las lentejas en una cacerola con agua con las hojas de laurel y llevar a ebullición. Hervir durante 10 minutos, luego bajar el fuego a medio-bajo y cocinar durante 20 minutos más hasta que las lentejas estén tiernas.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande antiadherente a fuego alto y fríe la cebolla, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que se ablande. Agrega el apio, las zanahorias y el tomillo, cubre con la tapa, baja el fuego a medio y cocina por 10 minutos más, revolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que las verduras estén tiernas.","Escurre las lentejas y agrégalas a las verduras en la sartén junto con 1 cucharada de mostaza y vinagre de sidra de manzana. Mide la mitad de la mezcla de lentejas y reserva; puedes usarlas para almuerzos más adelante en la semana, como en nuestra ensalada de lentejas de Puy con remolacha y nueces. Mezcle el perejil con la mezcla de lentejas restante.","Corta el tofu en dedos gruesos. Combine el ajo, el vinagre balsámico, el jengibre y la salsa de soja, luego unte esto sobre los trozos de tofu.","Calentar un chorrito de aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y sofreír el tofu por todos lados hasta que se dore. Sirva el tofu sobre la mitad de las lentejas, cubierto con la mezcla de semillas, cilantro fresco y chile rojo picado."]','2026-01-11 13:09:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15463,6393,'es','Sopa de orzo y garbanzos','Prepare esta sopa saludable, baja en grasas y calorías con orzo, garbanzos, verduras y una lata de tomates picados. Cubra con parmesano rallado para servir.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","2 zanahorias, picadas","2 ramas de apio, picadas","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","3 dientes de ajo, picados","3 ramitas de romero o tomillo","1 litro de caldo de verduras","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","400g lata de garbanzos","corteza de parmesano o alternativa vegetariana (opcional)","150 g de oro","aceite de oliva virgen extra, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite de oliva en una sartén honda a fuego medio-alto y cocina la cebolla, las zanahorias y el apio, incluidas las hojas, durante 15 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el puré de tomate, los dientes de ajo y las ramitas de romero o tomillo. Cocine unos minutos hasta que el puré esté caramelizado. Vierte el caldo, los tomates picados, los garbanzos (y el líquido de la lata) y la corteza de parmesano, si tienes. Cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos.","Vierta agua hirviendo sobre el orzo en un recipiente resistente al calor y déjelo reposar durante 15 minutos. Escurre el orzo, agrégalo a la sartén y cocina durante 5-8 minutos hasta que el orzo esté tierno. Saque el pescado y deseche los tallos de romero y la corteza del queso, luego sazone bien. Rocíe con aceite de oliva virgen extra y queso rallado para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:09:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15464,6395,'es','Hachís de desayuno de invierno','Muestre las coles de Bruselas en este sabroso hachís. Las verduras crucíferas pueden ayudar a reducir la presión arterial y reducir el riesgo de enfermedades cardíacas y cáncer.','["375 g de patatas cortadas en trozos pequeños","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla (unos 200 g), picada","½ cucharadita de semillas de alcaravea","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","200 g de coles de Bruselas grandes, peladas y cortadas en rodajas","2 huevos"]','["Hervir las patatas durante 15 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una sartén grande antiadherente a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla durante 8 minutos, removiendo frecuentemente hasta que empiece a tomar color. Añade la alcaravea, el ajo, la pimienta y los brotes y cocina durante 5 minutos más con la tapa puesta para que se cocinen al vapor al mismo tiempo.","Escurrir y triturar ligeramente las patatas cocidas con un machacador. Mézclalos con las verduras y cocina durante 5 a 10 minutos, volteándolos de vez en cuando para que la mezcla se dore.","Mientras tanto, escalfa los huevos durante unos minutos para obtener una yema líquida o hasta que estén cocidos a tu gusto. Retirar de la sartén con una espumadera. Sirve cada porción de picadillo cubierta con un huevo."]','2026-01-11 13:09:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15465,6397,'es','Curry de frijoles y mantequilla','Las judías blancas de este curry vegetal crean una textura satisfactoria. Los hemos combinado con berenjena de piel oscura, que está repleta de antioxidantes.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas (320 g), finamente picadas","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente rallado","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente rallados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas","2 latas de 400 g de alubias","2 cucharaditas de caldo vegano en polvo","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo mediano","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 berenjena (320 g), cortada en cubos","15 g de cilantro picado","Bolsa de 250 g de arroz integral cocido","2 plátanos pequeños, pelados y finamente picados","½ lima, en jugo","¼ de pepino, finamente picado","1 cebolla morada pequeña (60 g), finamente picada","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas durante 8 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agrega el jengibre, el ajo y la guindilla y cocina unos minutos más. Mida 300 ml del líquido de las latas de frijoles en una jarra y mezcle con el caldo en polvo para hacer un caldo (no se preocupe si está espeso o con grumos, ya que se disolverá en la sartén mientras se cocina).","Agrega las semillas de comino y el curry en polvo a las cebollas, seguido de los tomates, los frijoles y la berenjena. Agrega el caldo. Llevar a ebullición. Reduzca el fuego a medio-bajo, tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos hasta que las verduras estén tiernas. Agrega la mitad del cilantro. Retirar del fuego.","Para la raita, mezcle los plátanos con el jugo de lima. Agrega el pepino, la cebolla, la guindilla y el cilantro restante. Calienta el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y sírvelo con la mitad del curry y la raita. Deje enfriar el resto del curry y la raita para hacer nuestros rollitos de curry con frijoles y mantequilla. El curry se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días. La raita se mantiene fría durante un día."]','2026-01-11 13:09:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15466,6399,'es','Crespolini de espinacas','Disfrute de estos saludables panqueques de espelta rellenos de espinacas, ricotta y tomate: le brindan todo lo que necesita 5 al día, además las espinacas favorecen la salud de los huesos y los ojos.','["50 g de harina integral de espelta","1 huevo","100ml de leche","½ cucharadita de aceite de colza","250 g de espinacas tiernas","ralladura generosa de nuez moscada","1 diente de ajo grande, finamente rallado","80 g de ricota","2 cucharadas de queso duro vegetariano estilo italiano, finamente rallado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","10 g de albahaca","½ cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharaditas de vinagre balsámico","1 cebolla morada pequeña (unos 80 g), finamente picada","80 g de apio cortado en cubitos","3 puñados de rúcula","160 g de tomates cherry"]','["Batir la harina y el huevo, luego agregar gradualmente la leche para crear una masa suave estilo panqueque. Vierta en una jarra.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente de 19 cm a fuego medio, vierte un cuarto de la masa y revuelve para cubrir la base. Cocine brevemente hasta que esté listo, luego déle la vuelta con una espátula y cocine el otro lado hasta que esté dorado. Levante sobre un plato, luego repita con la masa restante para hacer cuatro panqueques en total.","Mientras tanto, calienta una segunda sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio y cocina las espinacas, la nuez moscada y el ajo durante unos 5 minutos, revolviendo con una cuchara de madera hasta que las espinacas se ablanden por completo. Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco, luego incorporar la ricota. Coloque una cuarta parte del relleno de espinacas en el centro de cada panqueque, luego enróllelo hasta formar una salchicha y colóquelo cómodamente en una fuente refractaria. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Para hacer la salsa, coloque los tomates enlatados, la albahaca, el caldo y el ajo en un tazón y mezcle con una batidora de mano hasta que esté completamente suave (o haga esto en una batidora de vaso). Vierta la salsa sobre los panqueques y esparza sobre el queso. Hornee durante 30 minutos hasta que se dore y burbujee en los bordes. Para la ensalada, combine el vinagre, la cebolla y el apio. Justo antes de servir, mezcle la mezcla de cebolla con la rúcula y los tomates y sirva con los panqueques rellenos."]','2026-01-11 13:09:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15467,6401,'es','Pepinos calientes con hierbas y limón.','¿Sabías que calentar los pepinos realza su sabor fresco? Para terminar, todo lo que necesita esta guarnición de verano es una pizca de eneldo fresco y perejil, además de limón.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","un puñado pequeño de menta, picada","2 pepinos, cortados en tiras finas con un pelador de verduras","un puñado pequeño de eneldo picado","un puñado pequeño de perejil picado","½ limón rallado y en jugo"]','["Caliente el aceite en una cacerola grande y cocine la menta picada durante 1 minuto antes de agregar suavemente las tiras de pepino. Mezcle y cocine durante 2-3 minutos más para calentarlos.","Retirar del fuego y mezclar con el eneldo, el perejil y un chorrito de jugo de limón. Vierta sobre un plato, rocíe con más jugo de limón, si lo desea, y espolvoree con la ralladura de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:09:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15468,6403,'es','Tazón de burrito vegano','Este nutritivo plato de arroz está cubierto con frijoles negros picantes, maíz dulce, aguacate y lima. Está lleno de fibra, cuenta como 4 de tus 5 al día y es bajo en grasas saturadas.','["250 g de arroz integral de fácil cocción","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de chile picante en polvo","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo (sin gluten, si es necesario)","400 g de frijoles negros escurridos","4 tomates, picados","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada, unos 75 g","20 g de cilantro fresco picado","2 limas, exprimidas","2 aguacates","2 latas de maíz dulce de 198 g"]','["Vierta el arroz y 600 ml de agua en una cacerola, luego agregue el puré de tomate, el comino, la guindilla y el caldo en polvo. Tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno y haya absorbido el líquido. Retire del fuego y agregue los frijoles negros.","Mientras tanto, mezcla los tomates con la cebolla morada, el cilantro y el jugo de 1 lima para hacer una salsa. Triture aproximadamente el jugo de lima restante con los aguacates para crear una textura espesa.","Vierta el arroz en cuatro tazones o recipientes rígidos (primero enfríe la mitad que está guardando para otro día). Cubra con la salsa de tomate, el aguacate y el maíz. El arroz se conservará hasta por dos días; simplemente prepare los aderezos frescos ese día."]','2026-01-11 13:09:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15469,6405,'es','Pasta con aceitunas, coliflor y harissa','Harissa agrega color y calidez a este plato de pasta vegano entre semana, con coliflor frita, aceitunas verdes y perejil. Agrega más harissa, si te gusta picante.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 coliflor pequeña, partida en floretes pequeños, tallos y hojas finamente picados","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","200 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","2 dientes de ajo machacados","25 g de aceitunas verdes deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad","2 cucharadas de harissa rosa","150 g de pasta integral sin lácteos de tu elección (como pappardelle; sin gluten si es necesario)","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado"]','["Caliente el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto y agregue los floretes, los tallos y las hojas de coliflor. Sazona, tapa y fríe durante 8-10 minutos, agitando la sartén de vez en cuando, hasta que esté ligeramente dorado y suave. Revuelva el puré de tomate y los tomates, tape y cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que los tomates revienten. Agregue el ajo, las aceitunas y la harissa y cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén fragantes.","Mientras tanto, cocina la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir, reservando una taza de agua. Agrega la pasta y un chorrito de agua a la mezcla de tomate. Sazona, esparce el perejil y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:09:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15470,6407,'es','Cena asada con freidora','Olvídese de encender el horno para cocinar la gran comida del domingo: prepare los elementos principales en una freidora. Utilice un microondas para calentar la salsa en lugar de la placa de cocina.','["2-3 patatas medianas, peladas y cortadas en cuartos","3 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal, de oliva o de colza","1 pechuga de pollo grande o 2 pequeñas, con piel","3 zanahorias medianas, peladas y cortadas en bastones","100 g de guisantes congelados","salsa, para servir"]','["Remojar las patatas en agua durante 30 minutos, luego escurrir y enjuagar. Calienta la freidora durante 2 minutos. Seque bien las patatas, luego póngalas en un bol, rocíe 1 cucharadita de aceite y sazone con sal y pimienta. Con las manos o una cuchara, cubra las papas con aceite y luego colóquelas en la canasta de la freidora, en una capa si es posible. Cocine durante 10 minutos a 190C.","Mientras tanto, cubra el pollo con otra cucharadita de aceite y sazone con sal y pimienta negra recién molida. Una vez que las patatas hayan estado dentro durante 10 minutos, muévalas hacia los lados y coloca el pollo en el centro de la cesta. Cocine por 10 minutos.","Cubra las zanahorias con el aceite restante. Después de que el pollo se haya cocinado durante 10 minutos, retírelo de la canasta y agregue las zanahorias mezcladas con las papas, luego mueva ambos hacia los lados y vuelva a colocar el pollo en el centro. Cocine durante 10-15 minutos, todavía a 190C. En este punto, el pollo debería estar cocido; compruébalo insertando un cuchillo en la parte más gruesa y comprobando que los jugos salgan claros. Alternativamente, un termómetro para carne debe marcar 70°C. Si no está del todo cocido, cocine por 5 minutos más. Retire el pollo y déjelo reposar debajo de un trozo de papel de aluminio.","Coloque los guisantes en una fuente o taza pequeña para horno con 2 cucharadas de agua y cúbralos con papel de aluminio para evitar que se escape la humedad. Colóquelo en la canasta de la freidora donde estaba el pollo y cocine por los últimos 10 minutos a 190C. Las patatas deben estar doradas y crujientes, las zanahorias tiernas y los guisantes bien calientes. Corta la pechuga de pollo en rodajas y sírvela con las verduras y la salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:09:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15471,6411,'es','Pastel de verduras cremosas','Disfrute de este pastel vegetariano saludable y bajo en calorías para una cena familiar fácil. Está relleno de judías verdes, col rizada, puerros y guisantes y cubierto con masa filo.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 puerros, partidos por la mitad y finamente picados","300 g de col rizada o col o una mezcla, rallada","Lata de 400 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","200 g de guisantes congelados","200 ml de caldo de verduras bajo en grasas","3 cucharadas de crema fresca baja en grasa","3 cucharadas de pesto fresco (revise la etiqueta para asegurarse de que sea vegetariano si es necesario)","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","250 g de láminas de masa filo","1 cucharadita de semillas de nigella (opcional)"]','["Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola redonda poco profunda ignífuga o en una fuente para horno (la nuestra era de 23 cm) a fuego medio. Agrega los puerros y cocina durante 5 minutos, revolviendo, hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agregue la col rizada o el repollo y cocine por otros 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C/gas 6. Vierta las judías, los guisantes, el caldo, la crema fresca, el pesto y el jugo y la ralladura de limón. Revuelva para combinar, cocine a fuego lento durante 3 minutos y sazone bien. Arrugue las hojas de filo y colóquelas encima del relleno de la tarta, unte con un pincel el aceite restante y espolvoree con semillas de nigella, si las usa. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén dorados."]','2026-01-11 13:09:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15472,6415,'es','Bocados de achicoria en ensalada Waldorf','Combine estos bocados de achicoria para ensalada Waldorf con un vaso de gaseosa para una fiesta en el jardín. Bocadillos rápidos como estos quedarán bien y son muy sencillos de preparar.','["2 cabezas de achicoria (nosotros usamos roja)","1 manzana verde, sin corazón y finamente picada","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","un puñado pequeño de nueces, picadas en trozos grandes","6 uvas rojas, finamente picadas","2 cucharadas de yogur natural","½ limón, exprimido","1 tsp Dijon mustard","50 g de queso azul desmenuzado o alternativa vegetariana"]','["Recorta la raíz de cada cabeza de achicoria y separa las hojas individuales (debes obtener entre 16 y 20 hojas). Coloque las hojas en una fuente grande para servir (consulte el consejo a continuación).","Combine los trozos de manzana, el apio, las nueces, las uvas, el yogur, el jugo de limón y la mostaza en un bol y sazone bien. Vierta un poco del relleno en cada una de las hojas de achicoria hacia el extremo de la raíz, dejando que el extremo de la hoja actúe como mango. Desmenuza sobre el queso azul y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:09:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15473,6417,'es','Gremolata','Mejora tu cocina con gremolata, una mezcla de hierbas, ralladura de cítricos, ajo y aceite de oliva. Añade frescura y profundidad a platos de carne, pescado y verduras asadas.','["30 g de perejil de hoja plana, hojas y tallos","2 dientes de ajo, pelados","2 limones sin cera, rallados y ½ limón exprimido","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Picar finamente el perejil, rallar el ajo finamente y luego mezclar con la ralladura de limón y el jugo en un tazón pequeño. Agrega el aceite. Se sentirá como una mezcla bastante seca en comparación con un pesto o un aderezo, pero puedes agregar más aceite si prefieres una consistencia más suelta. Para servir, espolvoree la gremolata sobre la carne o las verduras cocidas."]','2026-01-11 13:09:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15474,6419,'es','Tazones de cereales de pavo sobrantes con za''atar, ensalada de col arcoíris y yogur harissa','Aprovecha al máximo las sobras de pavo y prepara estos tazones de cereales con ensalada de repollo arcoíris y aderezo de tahini. Son fáciles y llenos de sabor.','["4 cucharadas de yogur probiótico natural","1 cucharada de harissa rosa","200 g de arroz salvaje cocido","200 g de puy o lentejas negras cocidas","2 cucharadas de hierbas picadas (nosotros usamos una mezcla de menta, perejil y cilantro)","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharada de za''atar","200 g de sobras de pavo asado (puedes utilizar una mezcla de carne blanca y oscura)","1 aguacate, sin hueso, partido por la mitad, pelado y en rodajas","2 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza tostadas","1 cucharadita de jarabe de arce","una pizca grande de pimienta blanca","2 cucharadas de tahini","1⁄2 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 clementina, en jugo","1 limón, exprimido","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo rallado","1 cucharadita de jengibre rallado","1⁄2 cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","1⁄4 col lombarda pequeña, cortada finamente","4 zanahorias, cortadas en juliana o ralladas","100 g de coles de Bruselas, cortadas finamente","1 chirivía, pelada y cortada en juliana o rallada","1 manzana, pelada, sin corazón y cortada en juliana o rallada","1⁄2 cebolla morada, cortada finamente","1 chile verde, finamente picado"]','["Combine el yogur y la harissa y reserve. Para hacer el aderezo, vierta el jarabe de arce, la pimienta blanca, una pizca grande de sal, el tahini, la cúrcuma, el jugo de clementina, la mitad del jugo de limón, el aceite, 2 cucharadas de agua caliente, el ajo, el jengibre y la cayena en un procesador de alimentos pequeño y mezcle hasta que estén combinados y cremosos. Prueba y ajusta la sazón con un poco más de limón o sal, según sea necesario.","Mezcle todos los ingredientes de la ensalada en un tazón grande. Sazone bien, luego rocíe con la mayor parte del aderezo y revuelva nuevamente para cubrir. En otro tazón grande, combine el arroz cocido, las lentejas y las hierbas. Aliña con el jugo de limón restante, el aceite de oliva y un poco de condimento. Esparce el za''atar sobre el pavo sobrante. Divida la mezcla de granos en cuatro tazones para servir y coloque encima el pavo sazonado, el aguacate en rodajas y la ensalada de repollo. Esparcir sobre las semillas de calabaza y terminar con una cucharada de yogur harissa. Sirva el aderezo restante a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:09:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15475,6421,'es','Albóndigas de cordero y tabulé de tahini verde','Combina cereales y remolacha con albóndigas de cordero y un aderezo de tahini para hacer esta cena rápida y fácil, llena de texturas y sabores.','["2 cucharadas de tahini","2 cucharadas de yogur sin grasa","½ manojo pequeño de perejil","1 limón, exprimido","½ diente de ajo pequeño","½ cucharada de aceite de colza","10-12 albóndigas de cordero ya preparadas","2 bolsas de 250 g de cereales mixtos","4 remolachas cocidas, picadas","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","200 g de tomates tiernos, cortados por la mitad","50 g de aceitunas negras deshuesadas, partidas por la mitad","1 pepino, pelado y en cubos","½ cucharada de zaatar"]','["Licue el tahini, el yogur, el perejil, el jugo de limón, el ajo, 2-3 cucharadas de agua y una pizca de sal en un procesador de alimentos hasta que quede suave. Dejar de lado.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y cocina las albóndigas a fuego medio durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén bien cocidas, volteándolas periódicamente.","Calienta los granos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Deje enfriar un poco y luego mezcle con los ingredientes restantes. Estación. Dividir en cuatro platos, cubrir con las albóndigas y rociar sobre el aderezo de tahini."]','2026-01-11 13:09:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15476,6423,'es','Sopa saludable de albóndigas y fideos','Caliéntate en las noches frías con este aromático caldo de una sola sartén con albóndigas de cerdo y fideos. Nos hemos inspirado en los sabores de pho vietnamita.','["1 tanda de albóndigas (ver receta en ''Combina bien''))","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","8 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","anís de 2 estrellas","1 rama de canela","2 palitos de limoncillo, sin las hojas exteriores duras y cortados en rodajas finas","1-2 chiles verdes (sin semillas si prefieres menos picante), cortados finamente","manojo pequeño de cilantro, hojas y tallos separados, ambos finamente picados","1 cucharada de azúcar moreno suave","1¼ litros de caldo de res","1-2 cucharaditas de salsa de pescado","1 cucharadita de salsa de soja, más un poco más para servir","2 puñados de brotes de soja listos para comer","3 nidos de fideos de arroz","1 lima, cortada en gajos"]','["Prepara las albóndigas (ver receta en ''Comida bien''), luego calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio. Fríe las albóndigas en tandas, volteándolas cada 1 o 2 minutos hasta que se doren por completo. Retire la sartén del fuego, transfiera las albóndigas a un plato y reserve.","Ponga en la sartén el jengibre, tres cuartas partes de las cebolletas, el anís estrellado, la canela, la hierba de limón, la mitad de la guindilla verde, los tallos de cilantro, el azúcar y el caldo de carne y deje hervir a fuego medio. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine durante 35 minutos hasta que la hierba de limón esté tierna y los sabores se hayan infundido.","Agrega las albóndigas y cocina a fuego lento durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que estén bien cocidas, luego agrega la salsa de pescado al gusto, junto con la salsa de soja y la pimienta negra recién molida. Agrega los brotes de soja, sube el fuego a medio-alto y cocina por otros 3 minutos.","Mientras tanto, cocina los fideos siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Escurrir bien y dividir en cuatro tazones. Cubra con las albóndigas y el caldo, quitando la canela y el anís estrellado. Esparza sobre las cebolletas restantes, el chile y las hojas de cilantro y sirva con rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:09:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15477,6425,'es','Chiu Chow golpeó el pepino','Disfruta de este pepino picante con filete, si quieres, o como aperitivo. "Malestar" el pepino permite que la pulpa absorba la marinada','["1 pepino","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharada de salsa de soja ligera premium Lee Kum Kee","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de arroz sazonado Lee Kum Kee","1-2 cucharaditas de aceite de chile Lee Kum Kee Chiu Chow, más extra para servir (opcional)"]','["Coloque el pepino en una tabla de cortar y golpéelo ligeramente a lo largo con un rodillo o usando el puño para empujar hacia abajo la hoja plana de un cuchillo de carnicero; desea romper un poco la pulpa pero no convertirla en pulpa. Corta el pepino por la mitad y quítale las semillas, luego corta la pulpa en trozos pequeños. Espolvoree aproximadamente ½ cucharadita de sal marina (puede hacerlo en la tabla de cortar), déjela durante 10 minutos, luego enjuague bien con agua fría y escurra.","Mezcle el ajo, el azúcar, la salsa de soja ligera premium y el vinagre de arroz sazonado con el aceite de chile Chiu Chow en un recipiente para servir. Agrega el pepino y déjalo marinar durante 10 minutos. Sirva con más aceite de chile a un lado, si lo desea, para aquellos que prefieren más especias."]','2026-01-11 13:09:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15478,6427,'es','Udon salteado con sésamo y cebolleta con tofu crujiente','Haz algo diferente para la cena con nuestro salteado vegano de fideos, tofu, judías verdes y cebolleta. Es rápido y saludable, además de económico.','["400 g de tofu firme en bloque","1 cucharada de harina de maíz","½ -1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile, al gusto","¼-½ cucharadita de granos de pimienta de Szechuan, molidos, al gusto","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","manojo de cebolletas, peladas y cortadas en trozos","200 g de judías verdes, peladas y cortadas en trozos","400 g de fideos udon gruesos listos para usar","½ cucharada de aceite de sésamo","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo, más una pizca para servir","1 cucharada de salsa de soja baja en sal, más un poco más para servir","1 cucharada de vinagre de arroz"]','["Escurrir y secar el tofu con papel de cocina. Cortar en cubos, envolver en más papel de cocina y colocar una tabla pesada encima. Dejar escurrir durante 15 min.","Mezcle la harina de maíz, las hojuelas de chile y los granos de pimienta molida en un bol con una pizca de sal, luego agregue el tofu escurrido. Mezcle bien para cubrir.","Calienta la mitad del aceite vegetal en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego alto y fríe los trozos de tofu durante 5-6 minutos hasta que estén dorados por completo. Sacar de la sartén y dejar escurrir sobre papel de cocina.","Añade el aceite restante a la sartén y sofríe las cebolletas y los frijoles durante 3-4 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y ligeramente dorados. Vierta una tetera con agua hirviendo sobre los fideos en un colador para que se suelten. Escurrir bien y luego verter en la sartén. Freír durante unos minutos hasta que esté bien caliente. Agregue el aceite de sésamo y las semillas de sésamo y cocine a fuego lento durante unos segundos. Agregue la salsa de soja, el vinagre de arroz y luego agregue el tofu. Mezcle bien y sirva en tazones con una pizca de semillas de sésamo encima y más salsa de soja a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:09:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15479,6431,'es','Espaguetis con gambas y harissa','Prueba nuestra cena de espaguetis para dos, con langostinos y aderezo de harissa. Solo lleva 20 minutos prepararlo y además es saludable: ideal para una comida entre semana o para una ocasión especial como el Día de San Valentín.','["100 g de brócoli de tallo largo, cortado en tercios","180 g de espaguetis secos","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo grande, ligeramente machacado","150 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","150 g de langostinos crudos","1 cucharada colmada de pasta de harissa de rosas","1 limón, finamente rallado"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola con agua ligeramente salada. Agrega el brócoli y deja hervir durante 1 min 30 segundos o hasta que esté tierno. Escurrir y reservar. Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrrala reservando un cucharón de agua de cocción.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, añadir el diente de ajo y sofreír a fuego lento durante 2 minutos. Retirar con una espumadera y desechar, dejando el aceite aromatizado.","Agrega los tomates a la sartén y fríelos a fuego medio durante 5 minutos, o hasta que comiencen a ablandarse y ponerse jugosos. Revuelva los langostinos y cocine durante 2 minutos o hasta que se pongan rosados. Agrega la harissa y la ralladura de limón, revolviendo para cubrir.","Mezcle los espaguetis cocidos y el agua de la pasta con los langostinos y la harissa, sazone al gusto y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:09:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15480,6433,'es','Cerdo parmesano con espaguetis con tomate y aceitunas','Esta cena saludable y equilibrada está lista en menos de 45 minutos y está repleta de proteínas magras, fibra, calcio, vitamina C, hierro y tres de tus 5 al día.','["300 g de filete de cerdo magro, cortado en 6 lonchas iguales","3 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","3 cucharaditas de salvia fresca finamente picada","4 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","15 g de parmesano rallado muy fino","1 zanahoria grande (215 g), picada","3 ramas de apio (165 g), picadas","6 aceitunas Kalamata, en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1½ cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","150 g de espaguetis integrales","100 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","un puñado grande de perejil picado (unos 10 g)"]','["Poner la carne de cerdo en un bol con 1 cucharadita de aceite, 1 cucharadita de salvia, 1 diente de ajo y mucha pimienta negra. Mezclar bien, poner en una bandeja y espolvorear con el queso.","Calienta las 2 cucharaditas de aceite restantes en una sartén y fríe la zanahoria, el apio, el ajo y la salvia restantes durante 5 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia. Añade las aceitunas, el puré de tomate, el caldo y 200 ml de agua, tapa y cocina durante 5-8 minutos o hasta que las verduras estén tiernas.","Mientras tanto, cocina los espaguetis siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y calienta la parrilla. Asa la carne de cerdo durante 6 minutos y luego déjala reposar. Escurre los espaguetis, reserva un poco de agua y mézclalos con las verduras, los tomates y el perejil. Agrega el agua para aflojar y luego sirve con la carne de cerdo."]','2026-01-11 13:09:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15481,6435,'es','Tortitas de avena staffordshire con champiñones','Cocine panqueques salados para el desayuno con gachas de avena. La receta es vegana y saludable además, ya que proporciona folato, fibra, hierro y dos de tus 5 al día.','["85 g de gachas de avena","85 g de harina integral normal","½ cucharadita de levadura seca","4 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","320 g de champiñones cortados en rodajas","4 tomates, cada uno cortado en 8 gajos","4 cucharadas de semillas molidas con lino y chía","4 cucharadas de tahini","unas ramitas de cilantro picadas"]','["Para los pasteles de avena, vierta la avena y 350 ml de agua en un bol y mezcle con una batidora hasta que quede suave. Agrega la harina y la levadura, tapa y deja en el frigorífico durante la noche, o déjalo a temperatura ambiente durante 2-3 horas hasta que aparezcan burbujas.","Utilice papel de cocina para frotar ½ cucharadita de aceite en una sartén antiadherente y luego caliente. Vierta una cuarta parte de la masa y gire la sartén para cubrir la base. Cocine por 2 minutos, luego dé vuelta y cocine por 2 minutos más hasta que esté dorado. Haz cuatro tortas de avena de la misma forma. Si sigues nuestro Plan de dieta saludable, deja enfriar dos para otro día. Se conserva tapado en el frigorífico durante dos días.","Para preparar la cobertura para dos pasteles de avena, caliente 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén antiadherente, agregue 160 g de champiñones y fríalos durante 2-3 minutos, revolviendo hasta que se ablanden. Agregue 2 tomates, luego agregue 2 cucharadas de semillas molidas y cocine por 2 minutos más. Vuelva a calentar las galletas de avena en una sartén seca o en el microondas si es necesario, luego unte cada una con 1 cucharada de tahini, la mezcla de champiñones y espolvoree con un poco de cilantro antes de servir. El segundo día, repite el paso 3 con los ingredientes restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:09:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15482,6437,'es','hornear caponata','Este saludable y reconfortante horneado de verduras está cubierto con rodajas de papa con queso y contiene 5 de tus 5 al día, junto con calcio, vitamina C, hierro y fibra.','["700 g de patatas medianas (unas 6), en rodajas finas","4 cucharadas de leche","85 g de queso cheddar maduro, finamente rallado","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cebollas (320 g), finamente picadas","4 cucharaditas de vinagre balsámico","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","2 berenjenas, cortadas en trozos","2 pimientos rojos (540 g), sin semillas y picados","Paquete de 30 g de albahaca, hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","3 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","10 aceitunas Kalamata, deshuesadas y partidas por la mitad","2 cucharaditas de alcaparras","⅓ x 30 g de perejil de hoja plana, picado","320 g de floretes de brócoli"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Hervir las rodajas de patata durante 10 minutos, luego escurrirlas, verterlas en un bol (no te preocupes si se rompen un poco) y añadir la leche y la mitad del queso. Mezclar juntos.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y cocina la cebolla hasta que se ablande. Vierta el vinagre balsámico y el caldo en polvo, luego agregue los tomates, la berenjena, los pimientos, la albahaca y el ajo. Tapar y cocinar durante 20 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente y agregando un poco de agua si es necesario, hasta que la berenjena esté tierna al probarla con un cuchillo.","Retire del fuego y agregue las aceitunas, las alcaparras y el perejil. Vierta en dos fuentes para hornear poco profundas. Cubrir con las patatas y espolvorear con el queso restante.","Si estás siguiendo nuestro Plan de Dieta Saludable, asa el que estás comiendo ahora hasta que esté dorado. Mientras se asa, cocine al vapor o hierva la mitad del brócoli para servirlo con el horneado. Para recalentar el segundo día, caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y hornee durante 30-40 minutos hasta que burbujee y esté dorado. Cocine el brócoli restante para acompañarlo."]','2026-01-11 13:09:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15483,6439,'es','Tabule de falafel al horno y coliflor, salsa tahini verde y cebolletas carbonizadas','Olvídese de los sándwiches empapados para el almuerzo y pruebe estos falafels fáciles, servidos con un delicioso tabulé de coliflor, salsa tahini y cebolletas carbonizadas.','["Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos (o 85 g de garbanzos secos remojados en 500 ml de agua fría durante la noche y luego escurridos)","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","¼ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","½ cebolla morada pequeña, picada","2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","½ cucharadita de levadura en polvo (sin gluten si lo deseas)","manojo pequeño de perejil, tallos y hojas separados, hojas picadas","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, más 1 cucharadita","½ coliflor pequeña, cortada en floretes","½ manojo pequeño de menta, las hojas picadas","1 limón, exprimido","6 cebolletas, enteras, cubiertas y con cola","puñado de cohetes","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, tallos y todo","2 cucharadas de tahini"]','["Caliente el horno a 200 C/180 C ventilador/gas 6. Forre una bandeja para hornear con papel para hornear. Vierta los garbanzos, ½ cucharadita de comino molido, ½ cucharadita de cilantro molido, la pimienta de cayena, la cebolla morada, 1 diente de ajo, las semillas de sésamo, el polvo para hornear, los tallos de perejil y ½ cucharada de agua en un procesador de alimentos. Bate hasta que todo esté combinado pero no blando; lo que quieres es que el falafel tenga algo de textura, en lugar de ser como hummus. Sazone al gusto y luego forme 18 bolas del mismo tamaño. Aplana cada bola en forma de disco y colócalas en la bandeja para hornear (cuanto más superficie, más crujientes quedarán). Cepillelos con ½ cucharada de aceite. Hornee durante 20 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad, hasta que estén dorados y crujientes.","Mientras tanto, limpia el procesador de alimentos. Pulse brevemente la coliflor hasta obtener una consistencia de \"cuscús\". Mezcla la coliflor con el resto de las especias molidas, ½ cucharada de aceite de oliva y el condimento. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear y ase durante 10 a 12 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que esté ligeramente tostado. Una vez frío, mezcle el perejil picado, la menta y la mitad del jugo de limón. Sazone al gusto.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto (esto se puede hacer la noche anterior, si lo deseas). Cepille las cebolletas con 1 cucharadita de aceite, sazone y luego cocine a la parrilla hasta que estén suaves y carbonizadas durante unos 5 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la rúcula, el cilantro, el ajo restante, el jugo de limón y 1 cucharada de agua en un procesador de alimentos hasta que estén de color verde brillante. Coloque el tahini en un tazón, luego agregue gradualmente el agua de hierbas hasta que el tahini se suelte y adquiera una consistencia de salsa. Sazone al gusto.","Divida el tahini verde y las cebolletas entre el falafel horneado y el tabulé en tazones."]','2026-01-11 13:09:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15484,6441,'es','Tabule de falafel al horno y coliflor','Prepare una tanda de nuestro falafel horneado fácil para obtener una opción de almuerzo sabrosa y baja en calorías. Esta receta sencilla y saludable es perfecta para acompañar mucha ensalada.','["3 latas de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos (o 250 g de garbanzos secos, remojados en 1 litro de agua fría durante la noche y luego escurridos)","3 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","1 cebolla morada, en cuartos","3 dientes de ajo","2 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo","1 ½ cucharadita de levadura en polvo (sin gluten, si lo deseas)","2 paquetes pequeños de perejil, tallos y hojas separados, hojas picadas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 coliflor, cortada en floretes grandes","1 paquete pequeño de menta, las hojas picadas y los tallos desechados","1 limón, exprimido"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forre dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Vierta los garbanzos, 2 cucharaditas de comino molido, 1 cucharadita de cilantro molido, la pimienta de cayena, la cebolla, el ajo, las semillas de sésamo, la levadura en polvo, los tallos de perejil y 1 cucharada de agua en un procesador de alimentos. Mezcle hasta que esté combinado pero no suave (desea que el falafel tenga algo de textura, en lugar de tener la consistencia del hummus). Sazone al gusto y luego forme 18 bolas del mismo tamaño. Aplana cada bola en forma de disco y colócala en las bandejas para hornear, luego unta la parte superior con 1 cucharada de aceite. Hornee durante 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente, volteándolo a la mitad de la cocción.","Mientras tanto, limpia el procesador de alimentos, luego vierte la coliflor y pulsa brevemente hasta que parezca cuscús. Mezcle el cuscús de coliflor con el resto de las especias molidas y el aceite de oliva, luego agregue un poco de condimento. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear y ase durante 10 a 12 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente tostado, revolviendo ocasionalmente.","Retirar del horno y dejar enfriar, luego mezclar con las hojas de perejil, las hojas de menta y el jugo de limón. Sazone al gusto. Se conservará durante tres días en el frigorífico. Sirve el falafel al horno con el tabulé de coliflor y un poco de ensalada, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:09:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15485,6443,'es','Boloñesa Vegana','Pruebe nuestra abundante boloñesa vegana para disfrutar de una comida rápida y saludable para dos. Nuestro sencillo plato de pasta contiene cuatro de tus cinco platos al día e incluso es bajo en grasas.','["180 g de espaguetis","2 x porciones de ragu vegano (consulte ''Combina bien'' para ver la receta)","un puñado de hojas de albahaca fresca"]','["Cocine los espaguetis en una cacerola grande con agua con sal durante 1 minuto menos de las instrucciones del paquete. Recalentar el ragú. Escurrir la pasta, reservar un cucharón de agua, luego echar los espaguetis en la salsa, utilizando un poco de líquido para aflojar un poco el ragú. Sirva cubierto con albahaca fresca y un poco de pimienta negra."]','2026-01-11 13:09:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15486,6445,'es','Budín de chocolate y chía','Prepare un pudín de chocolate sabroso y saludable en solo cinco minutos. También es bajo en calorías y vegano, y las semillas de chía son una gran fuente de ácidos grasos omega-3.','["60 g de semillas de chía","400 ml de leche de almendras o de avellanas sin azúcar","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo","2 cucharadas de jarabe de arce","½ cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","semillas de cacao, mezcladas","bayas congeladas, para servir"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes en un tazón grande con una pizca generosa de sal marina y bate para combinar. Cubrir con film transparente y dejar espesar en el frigorífico durante al menos 4 horas, o toda la noche.","Vierta el pudín en cuatro vasos y luego cubra con las bayas congeladas y las semillas de cacao."]','2026-01-11 13:09:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15487,6447,'es','Pollo al curry katsu','Este katsu más saludable se recubre con almendras en hojuelas finamente picadas y se hornea en el horno (en lugar de frito) hasta que esté crujiente y dorado. Si sigues la dieta saludable de las plantas, este es un excelente plato para agregar a tu repertorio.','["25 g de almendras laminadas","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza prensado en frío","2 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel (aproximadamente 300 g/11 oz en total)","gajos de lima, para exprimir","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza prensado en frío","1 cebolla mediana, picada en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente picado","2 cucharaditas de curry en polvo mediano","1 anís estrellado","¼ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharada de harina integral normal","100 g de arroz integral de grano largo","2 cebolletas, cortadas finamente (incluye la parte verde)","1 zanahoria mediana, pelada en tiras largas con un pelador de verduras","? pepino, pelado en tiras largas con un pelador de verduras","1 chile rojo pequeño, finamente picado (sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante)","jugo ½ lima","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta","un puñado pequeño de hojas de cilantro"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cocer el arroz integral en abundante agua hirviendo durante 35 minutos o hasta que esté muy tierno.","Triture las almendras con un mortero o muela en un procesador de alimentos hasta que estén finamente picadas y luego espolvoree sobre un plato. Engrasa una bandeja de horno pequeña con un poco de aceite. Unte el pollo por ambos lados con el aceite restante y sazone bien. Cubrir el pollo con las nueces y colocar en la bandeja. Presione las nueces restantes del plato sobre cada pechuga. Hornee por 20 minutos o hasta que esté dorado y bien cocido. Deje reposar durante 4-5 minutos en la bandeja y luego córtelo en rodajas gruesas.","Mientras tanto, haz la salsa. Calienta el aceite en una cacerola mediana antiadherente y agrega la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre. Cubra la sartén sin apretar y fría a fuego lento durante 8 minutos o hasta que se ablanden y se doren ligeramente, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Retire la tapa durante los últimos 2 minutos y no deje que el ajo se queme.","Agregue el curry en polvo, el anís estrellado, la cúrcuma y un buen molido de pimienta negra. Cocine por unos segundos más, revolviendo. Espolvorea sobre la harina y revuelve bien. Añade poco a poco 400 ml de agua a la cacerola, revolviendo constantemente.","Lleve la salsa a fuego lento y cocine durante 10 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Si comienza a chisporrotear, cúbralo sin apretar con una tapa. Retire la sartén del fuego y bata la salsa con una batidora hasta que quede muy suave. Ajusta el condimento al gusto. Manténgase caliente.","Una vez que el arroz esté tierno, agrega las cebolletas y cocina por 1 min más. Escurrir bien y dejar reposar unos minutos mientras se prepara la ensalada. Mezcle la zanahoria y el pepino con el chile, el jugo de lima y las hierbas.","Divida el pollo en rodajas en dos platos, vierta sobre la salsa y sirva con el arroz, la ensalada y las rodajas de lima para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:09:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15488,6449,'es','Saad de betrot, queso feta y espárragos','La colorida ensalada de Tom Kime es una excelente opción vegetariana para el entretenimiento del verano','["un puñado grande de hojas frescas de orégano o mejorana","1 diente de ajo","jugo de 1½ limones","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","250 g de espárragos en manojo, cortados en trozos de 3 cm/1¼ pulgadas","2 paquetes de 250 g de remolacha fresca hervida, cortada en cuartos","ralladura de 1 limón","2 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","Bolsa de 85 g de berros, sin los tallos grandes","10 hojas de albahaca verdes y 10 moradas (o 20 de un color)","400 g de queso feta o de cabra"]','["El día anterior: hacer el aliño. Poner el orégano o mejorana, un\r\npizca de sal y el ajo en un procesador de alimentos y\r\nPulse hasta obtener una pasta. Agrega el jugo de limón y bate hasta\r\nsuave. Agregue el aceite de oliva y sazone; debe quedar\r\npicante y un poco salado. Cubrir y enfriar.","Dos horas antes de servir: poner a hervir agua con sal en una cacerola, añadir el\r\nespárragos y cocine por 3 minutos. Escurrir y enfriar\r\nbajo el grifo de agua fría. Cubrir y mantener fresco.","Ponga la remolacha en un tazón grande y mezcle con dos tercios\r\ndel aderezo. Agrega la ralladura de limón y la primavera.\r\ncebollas, tapar y mantener a temperatura ambiente fresca con\r\nel aderezo restante.","Para servir: agregue los berros a la remolacha y agregue la albahaca.\r\nAgregue los espárragos y sazone con recién molidos.\r\npimienta negra. Probar antes de añadir sal como está el queso.\r\nbastante salado. Mezclar ligeramente, para no teñir todo de rosa.\r\nluego apílelos en una fuente para servir. Desmenuzar sobre el queso\r\ny vierte el resto del aderezo encima."]','2026-01-11 13:09:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15489,6451,'es','El cambio de imagen definitivo: cóctel de gambas','Pruebe una versión más ligera y moderna de este popular entrante retro','["650 g de langostinos con cáscara, cocidos (para obtener 200 g/8 oz de langostinos cocidos y pelados)","2 cucharadas de jugo de lima","100 g/4 oz de pepino","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","1 cucharada de eneldo cortado","1 aguacate maduro pequeño","50 g de berros","una pizca de pimienta de cayena, para espolvorear","2 cucharadas de mayonesa","5 cucharadas de queso fresco","1½ cucharada de salsa de tomate","chorrito de salsa tabasco","un chorrito de salsa inglesa","1 cucharadita de brandy"]','["Pelar las gambas. Enjuáguelos en un\r\ncolador grande bajo un grifo de agua fría, luego toque\r\nsecar con papel de cocina. Colocar las gambas\r\nen un plato poco profundo y exprimir\r\n1 cucharada de jugo de lima, luego agregue\r\nun toque de pimienta. Dejar de lado.","Picar el pepino en dados pequeños\r\ny verter en un plato. Vierta sobre el\r\nvinagre, esparcir sobre el eneldo y un\r\nrallar pimienta y reservar.\r\nCortar por la mitad, deshuesar y pelar el aguacate,\r\nluego córtelo en dados pequeños. Vierta sobre\r\nel resto del jugo de lima y mezclar\r\njunto suavemente con un toque de pimienta.","Para la salsa, mezclar la\r\nmayonesa, queso fresco y ketchup.\r\nAgregue Tabasco, Worcestershire y\r\nbrandy con un toque de pimienta.","Para servir, poner una cucharada pequeña de\r\nsalsa en el fondo de cada cóctel\r\nvidrio. Picar muy grueso la mayor parte del\r\nberros, dejando unas ramitas enteras.\r\nColoque los berros picados encima\r\nla salsa. Escurre bien el pepino y luego\r\nviértalo sobre los berros con la\r\naguacate. Apilar los langostinos y luego\r\nvierta sobre el resto de la salsa. pliegue\r\nen las ramitas de berros y servir\r\ncon una pizca de cayena."]','2026-01-11 13:09:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15490,6453,'es','Guiso de pescado picante','Perfecto con un poco de pan crujiente, este guiso sencillo y saludable pronto se convertirá en uno de tus favoritos; hazlo con pollo si lo prefieres.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de pimentón","Lata de 200g de tomates picados","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas, cortado en trozos","450 g de filetes de pescado blanco cortados en trozos","un puñado de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","1 limón, cortado en gajos"]','["Calentar aceite en una cacerola. Agregue el ajo, el comino y el pimentón y cocine por 1 min. Añade 100ml de agua y los tomates. Llevar a ebullición y luego bajar el fuego. Agregue el pimiento y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Añade el pescado y cocina a fuego lento durante 5 minutos. Servir con cilantro y una rodajita de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:09:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15491,6455,'es','Carne de res salteada con salsa hoisin','Rápido, fácil de hacer y saludable','["1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de jerez seco","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","1 diente de ajo gordo, machacado","1 cucharadita de raíz de jengibre fresco finamente picado (o pasta de jengibre fresco en un frasco)","200 g de solomillo magro, cortado en rodajas finas a lo largo de la fibra","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 zanahoria grande, cortada en palitos","100 g de tirabeques, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","140 g de champiñones en rodajas","3 cucharadas de salsa hoisin","Fideos chinos, para servir."]','["Mezclar la soja\r\nsalsa, jerez, aceite de sésamo,\r\najo\r\ny jengibre en un plato llano.\r\nAñade el filete y déjalo\r\nmarinar durante unos 20\r\nminutos (o más, si\r\ntener tiempo).","Caliente una olla grande de base pesada\r\nsartén o wok, añadir el\r\nsemillas de sésamo y tostadas\r\na fuego alto, revolviendo,\r\ndurante unos minutos hasta\r\ndorado. Vierta sobre un plato.","Cuando esté listo para cocinar,\r\ncalentar el aceite de girasol en un\r\nsartén grande o wok\r\nhasta que esté caliente. Añade el bistec con\r\nla marinada y sofreír\r\ndurante 3-4 minutos a temperatura alta\r\ncalentar hasta que esté ligeramente dorado.\r\nRetire, usando una ranura\r\ncuchara, en un plato, dejando\r\nlos jugos en la sartén.","Echa las zanahorias en la sartén.\r\ny sofreír durante unos\r\nminutos, luego agregue el\r\ntirabeques y cocinar durante un\r\n2 minutos más.","Regrese el bistec a la\r\nsartén, agrega los champiñones\r\ny tirar todo\r\njuntos. Agrega el hoisin\r\nsalsa y sofreír para un final\r\nminuto. Espolvorea con las semillas de sésamo tostadas y sirve inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:09:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15492,6457,'es','Trucha con ensalada cremosa de patatas','Intente servir pescado con una ensalada de patatas de sabor fresco en lugar de patatas hervidas.','["250 g de patatas cerosas, como Charlotte, peladas si quieres y cortadas por la mitad","4 cucharaditas de yogur natural","4 cucharaditas de mayonesa","1 limón, ½ rallado","1 cucharada de alcaparras pequeñas, enjuagadas","4 pepinillos o pepinillos pequeños, rebanados","2 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","¼ de pepino, cortado en cubitos","2 filetes de trucha"]','["Hervir las patatas en agua con sal.\r\ndurante 15 minutos hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir y\r\nenjuague con agua fría para enfriar, luego\r\nescurrir nuevamente. Calienta la parrilla.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el yogur.\r\ny mayonesa, luego sazonar con un\r\nbuen chorrito de limón. Revuelva suavemente en\r\nlas patatas con las alcaparras, los pepinillos,\r\nla mayor parte de la cebolleta y el pepino.","Sazonar la trucha y luego asarla en una\r\nbandeja para hornear, con la piel hacia abajo, para\r\n3-4 minutos dependiendo del espesor,\r\nhasta que esté recién cocido. Espolvorear con limón\r\nralladura y servir con la ensalada de patatas,\r\nespolvoreado con las cebolletas restantes.\r\nCorta la mitad restante del limón en\r\ncuñas para apretar."]','2026-01-11 13:09:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15493,6463,'es','Ensalada isleña griega con pollo y aguacate','La colorida y veraniega ensalada de aguacate de Jill Dupleix es perfecta para un buffet informal','["1,8 kg de pollo asado, a temperatura ambiente","2 corazones de lechuga romana","4 tomates","3 cebolletas","2 ripe avocados","3 cucharadas de jugo de limón, más extra para exprimir","200 g de paquete de queso feta","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","½ cucharadita de menta seca","medio manojo de perejil de hoja plana","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","2 cucharadas de aceitunas kalamata negras","pan pita, para servir (opcional)"]','["Sacar la carne del pollo.\r\ny tritúrelo toscamente. Recortar la base\r\nde cada lechuga, lavar y secar la\r\nhojas, luego tritúrelas en trozos grandes.\r\nCorta los tomates en gajos.\r\nCortar finamente las cebolletas (usando\r\ntanto la parte blanca como la verde). cortar\r\nlos aguacates por la mitad a lo largo,\r\nquitar las piedras y\r\npelar. Cortar transversalmente en rodajas,\r\ny exprimir con jugo de limón.\r\nDesmenuza el queso feta con tu\r\ndedos y mézclelo con los secos.\r\norégano y menta. recoge las hojas\r\nQuitar el perejil y reservar.","Batir las 3 cucharadas de jugo de limón.\r\ncon el aceite de oliva, sal marina y pimienta.\r\nEn un tazón grande, mezcle el pollo,\r\nlechuga, tomates y cebolleta,\r\nluego doble tres cuartos de\r\nel aderezo con los aguacates\r\n(con cuidado, para que los aguacates no\r\nromper). Sazone con sal y\r\npimienta, luego esparcir sobre el queso feta,\r\naceitunas y perejil, y rociar con\r\nel resto del aderezo. apretar\r\njugo de limón adicional encima y servir\r\ncon pan pita si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:09:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15494,6465,'es','Lubina frita con brócoli aderezado con cítricos','Una cena de pescado con calidad de restaurante, lista en sólo media hora','["2 filetes de lubina, de unos 140 g cada uno (consulte los consejos a continuación)","1 cabeza pequeña de brócoli","1 naranja","6 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","4 cucharadas de alcaparras pequeñas","6 anchoas, picadas en trozos grandes","1 limon"]','["Antes de empezar a cocinar, consiga\r\ntodo preparado. Recorta cada mar\r\nfilete de lubina para que queden ambos iguales\r\nforma, luego marque la piel, cortando en el\r\npulpa ligeramente, 5 o 6 veces a aproximadamente 1 cm\r\nintervalos. Dejar de lado.","Segmentar la naranja – cortar la\r\narriba y abajo, luego corte el\r\npiel y médula. Corta cada segmento,\r\nluego exprima el jugo del resto de\r\nla naranja en un bol. Cortar el brócoli en\r\nfloretes de tamaño mediano.","Para preparar la ensalada tibia de brócoli,\r\nCocine los floretes en una cacerola hirviendo.\r\nagua con sal durante 1 min hasta que\r\ncocido. Mientras se cocina el brócoli, ponga un\r\nsartén a calentar. Tan pronto como el brócoli\r\nesté cocido, escúrralo y luego viértalo directamente en el\r\nsartén caliente para \"quemar\" toda la humedad.","Apague el fuego, luego esparza el\r\ngajos de naranja sobre el brócoli.\r\nMezcle por unos momentos solo para calentar.\r\nluego viértalo en un tazón y aliñe con\r\nel jugo de naranja y 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva. Temporada\r\ncon pimienta y un poco de mar\r\nsal y luego reserva.","Limpia la sartén. Sazona el pescado con un poco de sal y\r\npimienta justo antes de cocinar.\r\nCalentar la sartén hasta\r\nmuy caliente, luego agregue 2 cucharadas de aceite. Coloque el\r\nfiletes de pescado en la sartén, con la piel hacia abajo.\r\nTan pronto como entre, presione cada\r\nfiletear con los dedos o con un pescado\r\nCortar para evitar que se enrolle.","Reduzca el fuego a medio, luego\r\ndejar cocer el pescado durante 3-4 minutos,\r\nsin ser molestado, hasta que puedas ver eso\r\nla carne se ha cocinado dos tercios\r\ndel camino hacia arriba y la piel está crujiente\r\ny marrón.","Voltee los filetes y fríalos sobre la\r\nlado de la carne durante unos 2 minutos hasta que\r\nlisto, rociando la piel con el aceite en\r\nla sartén mientras se cocina. Dejar reposar en un lugar tibio\r\nplato, con la piel hacia arriba, y rocíe con el\r\nAceite caliente y jugos de la sartén.","Vierta 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva en la sartén y\r\nVuelva a colocarlo a fuego alto. Dispersión en\r\nlas alcaparras y las anchoas, luego cocinar\r\nhasta que empiecen a dorarse. Rallar sobre el limón\r\nrallar y exprimir el jugo de ½ limón.\r\nSi no hay suficiente jugo en la sartén para\r\nrocíe sobre ambos platos, agregue un chorrito más\r\naceite. Ahora estás listo para emplatar."]','2026-01-11 13:09:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15495,6467,'es','Ensalada de calabacín a la menta','Una ensalada fresca y fragante complementa un antipasti mediterráneo para una comida relajada en verano.','["½ cebolla morada, cortada en rodajas finas","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","2 calabacines","un puñado grande de hojas de menta","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva"]','["Mezclar la cebolla y el jugo de limón.\r\ncon un poco de condimento y reservar para\r\n10 minutos. Cuando esté listo para servir, use un\r\npelador de verduras para cortar los calabacines\r\nen tiras finas. Poner en un bol con el\r\njugo de cebolla y limón, ralladura, menta y aceite.\r\nMezcle con cuidado y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:09:36');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15496,6469,'es','Gachas de proteínas','Aumente la proteína en su desayuno agregando aderezos ricos en proteínas a su papilla. Es ideal después de un entrenamiento.','["80 g de gachas de avena","500ml de leche (cualquier tipo)","30 g de proteína en polvo (vainilla, chocolate o frutos rojos funcionan bien)","4 cucharadas de yogur estilo griego","2 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza, chía, lino o girasol","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de nueces o semillas","100 g de fruta fresca o congelada (como bayas, plátanos o manzanas en rodajas)","miel u otro almíbar, para servir"]','["Cocine la avena y la leche en una sartén a fuego medio-bajo durante 4-6 minutos, revolviendo continuamente hasta que espese y esté cremosa. Retirar del fuego y tamizar la proteína en polvo. Añade un chorrito más de leche o agua para que se suelte, si prefieres una papilla más fina.","Divida en tazones y cubra con los ingredientes de su elección."]','2026-01-11 13:09:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15497,6471,'es','Barras de proteínas','Haz tus propias barras de proteínas caseras para darle un impulso después del entrenamiento. Están elaborados con proteína en polvo, plátanos, mantequilla de nueces y una mezcla de semillas.','["150 g de gachas de avena","2 plátanos pequeños (unos 160 g), pelados y triturados","100 ml de jarabe de arce","200 g de mantequilla de almendras, maní o girasol","90 g de proteína de vainilla en polvo","50 g de semillas mixtas, más 1 cucharada para la cobertura","1 cucharada de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de leche, cualquier tipo (opcional)","50 g de chocolate negro, derretido"]','["Pon la avena en una licuadora y bate hasta que parezca harina. Agrega el puré de plátano, el jarabe de arce, la mantequilla de nueces, la proteína en polvo, las semillas mixtas y el extracto de vainilla. Licue nuevamente para hacer una masa espesa, agregando la leche, si es necesario, para unirla.","Presione la masa en un molde cuadrado de 20 cm forrado con papel para hornear, asegurándose de que quede en una capa uniforme. Rocíe sobre el chocolate derretido y esparza sobre 1 cucharada adicional de semillas mixtas y una pizca de hojuelas de sal marina. Enfríelo durante 1 hora antes de cortarlo en barras. Se mantendrá frío hasta por tres días."]','2026-01-11 13:09:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15498,6473,'es','Bacalao al horno con tomates, alcaparras y albahaca','Disfrute del pescado blanco una vez a la semana como comida baja en grasas y rica en proteínas. También proporciona vitaminas que apoyan el corazón, el cerebro y los huesos.','["200 g de patatas tiernas (unas 12)","3 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","½ cucharadita de orégano seco","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharada de alcaparras","15 g de albahaca picada","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras en polvo","320 g de filetes de bacalao, trozos y sin piel","180 g de judías verdes finas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle las patatas con 1 cucharadita de aceite, el orégano y abundante pimienta negra molida, luego espárgalas en una fuente para horno y hornee durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto calentar el resto del aceite en una sartén y sofreír brevemente los ajos, revolviendo para que no se queme. Agregue los tomates, las alcaparras, la albahaca picada y el caldo y luego déjelos hervir a fuego medio hasta que se convierta en una salsa espesa, aproximadamente 5 minutos.","Retire las patatas del horno y empújelas hacia un extremo del plato. Vierta la salsa en el otro extremo y cubra con el bacalao, luego regrese al horno durante 15 minutos hasta que el bacalao se desmenuce cuando se pruebe, pero aún esté húmedo.","Mientras se hornea el pescado, hierva las judías verdes durante 7 minutos hasta que estén tiernas. Apila los frijoles en 2 platos para formar una pila y luego vierte la salsa y el bacalao encima. Agrega las papas y sirve espolvoreadas con las hojas enteras de albahaca para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:09:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15499,6475,'es','Salteado de tempeh pegajoso','Prepara este salteado vegano que utiliza tempeh, una gran fuente de proteína elaborada a partir de semillas de soja. Rápido y fácil, solo lleva 30 minutos prepararlo.','["2-3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","200 g de tempeh, partido en trozos","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","3 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","1 barra de limoncillo, picada en tercios (opcional)","Trozo de 2 cm de jengibre, pelado y picado en trozos grandes","1 chile rojo, picado en trozos grandes (sin semillas si lo prefieres)","100 g de sarna, cortada en ángulo","100 g de brócoli de tallo largo, picado","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja baja en sodio","1½ cucharada de azúcar moreno","15 g de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes","Bolsa de 200 g de arroz integral cocido"]','["Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén grande awokor a fuego alto. Una vez que esté brillante, fríe el tempeh durante 3-4 minutos hasta que esté dorado y carbonizado en los bordes. Retirar de la sartén y escurrir sobre papel de cocina.","Agrega un chorrito de aceite a la sartén si está seca, luego fríe la cebolla durante 3-4 minutos, revolviendo continuamente. Una vez ablandado, agregue el ajo, la hierba de limón (si se usa), el jengibre y la guindilla. Cocine durante 3 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que esté fragante.","Mezcle la sarna y el brócoli, luego vierta 50 ml de agua en la sartén para crear vapor. Cocine durante 3-4 minutos. Agrega la salsa de soja y el azúcar moreno. Regrese el tempeh a la sartén y revuelva para combinar, cocinando 2-3 minutos más hasta que todo esté tierno y pegajoso. Agrega la mitad del cilantro.","Cocine el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego divídalo en dos tazones. Cubra con el salteado y el cilantro restante."]','2026-01-11 13:09:37');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15500,6477,'es','Verduras harissa con quinua','Combine la quinua rica en proteínas con tubérculos para disfrutar los cinco alimentos al día. El yogur de coco fermentado agregado también tendrá beneficios para las bacterias intestinales','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cebollas moradas (160 g), picadas","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y en cubos","1 batata pequeña (200 g), pelada y cortada en trozos","2 ramas grandes de apio (125 g), cortadas en rodajas gruesas","10 g de jengibre, finamente picado","300 ml de caldo de verduras elaborado con 2 cucharaditas de caldo vegano en polvo","1 cucharada de pasta de harissa","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 albaricoques secos, en cuartos","10 g de cilantro o perejil picado, más unas cuantas hojas extra para servir","Paquete de 250g de quinoa roja y blanca cocida","4 cucharadas de yogur de coco"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y fríe las verduras y el jengibre durante 10 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente, hasta que se ablanden y empiecen a tomar color.","Agregue el caldo, la harissa, el puré de tomate y los albaricoques. Llevar a ebullición, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos. Agrega el cilantro.","Mientras tanto, calienta la quinua siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Sirva con las verduras y el yogur, además de un poco de hojas de cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:09:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15501,6479,'es','Bolas de proteína','Prepare deliciosas bolas de proteínas con avena, proteína en polvo, linaza y canela para disfrutar después del ejercicio y reponer sus reservas de proteínas.','["150 g de gachas de avena","50 g de proteína en polvo de tu elección (nosotros usamos suero de vainilla)","1 cucharada de linaza molida","pizca de canela molida","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","2 cucharadas de jarabe de arce","150 g de mantequilla de nueces de tu elección (nosotros usamos maní)","4 cucharadas de leche vegetal","25 g de chispas de chocolate o pasas (opcional)"]','["Combine la avena, la proteína en polvo, la linaza y la canela en un tazón grande. Agrega el jarabe de arce, el extracto de vainilla, la mantequilla de nueces, la leche y las chispas de chocolate.","Remueve bien para combinar la mezcla y luego, con las manos húmedas, enróllala en 15 bolas (deben pesar unos 30 g cada una). Colóquelos en un plato y déjelos enfriar durante 30 minutos hasta que estén firmes, luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:09:38');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15502,6483,'es','pechuga ahumada','Encienda el ahumador para preparar esta sabrosa pechuga cocida a fuego lento. Sirva en una tabla con verduras carbonizadas y salsa rossa para que todos puedan servirse ellos mismos.','["2,5 kg de pechuga de ternera","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile rojo","1 cucharadita de granos de pimienta negra enteros","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","1 cucharadita de tomillo seco","2 cucharaditas de azúcar demerara","2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","1 cucharadita de pimentón","1 cucharadita de cebolla en polvo","1 cucharadita de ajo en polvo","1 cucharadita de mostaza en polvo","1 cucharadita de sal"]','["Tuesta suavemente el comino, las hojuelas de chile, los granos de pimienta, las semillas de hinojo y el tomillo en una sartén a fuego lento hasta que estén aromáticos. Muela hasta obtener un polvo fino con el azúcar demerara usando una licuadora de especias o un mortero. Vierta en un tazón y mezcle los ingredientes restantes para frotar.","Sazone generosamente la pechuga con la masa y déjela reposar a temperatura ambiente hasta por una hora. Prepare el ahumador para cocción indirecta a 120-130C. Una vez lista, coloque la pechuga sazonada en el ahumador, con la grasa hacia arriba. Dejar actuar durante 10 horas o hasta que el exterior adquiera un color caoba oscuro. Rellene el ahumador según sea necesario.","Retire la pechuga y envuélvala en papel de estraza. Regrese al ahumador y continúe cocinando durante 2-3 horas hasta que la carne alcance 93-94C cuando se sonda con un termómetro. Déjelo reposar durante 40 minutos antes de cortarlo y servirlo con verduras carbonizadas y salsa rossa."]','2026-01-11 13:09:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15503,6485,'es','Desayuno inglés en una sartén','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Combina los mejores ingredientes de un desayuno tradicional inglés en una sartén, sin necesidad de picar nada.','["4 chipolatas de cerdo de buena calidad","4 lonchas de tocino ahumado","140 g de champiñones","6 huevos batidos","8 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","un puñado de queso rallado (opcional)","1 cucharada de cebollino picado"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Calienta una sartén antiadherente mediana, agrega las chipolatas y fríe por 3 min. Agrega el tocino, volteándolo ocasionalmente, hasta que comience a estar crujiente, unos 5 minutos más. Vierta los champiñones y continúe cocinando durante 3-5 minutos más. Escurre el exceso de grasa y mueve los ingredientes para que queden distribuidos uniformemente.","Sazone los huevos, luego agréguelos a la sartén, revolviendo para llenar los espacios. Mueva suavemente con un tenedor durante 2 minutos a fuego medio-bajo hasta que comience a cuajar. Esparza sobre los tomates, el queso, si lo usa, y el cebollino, luego cocine a la parrilla durante 2 minutos hasta que cuaje. Corta en gajos y sirve con tus salsas favoritas."]','2026-01-11 13:09:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15504,6487,'es','Brochetas de pollo con hierbas','Un plato de pollo súper saludable con un condimento "sin cocinar"','["500 g de patatas nuevas pequeñas: busque paquetes de patatas nuevas pequeñas o tiernas, o elija las más pequeñas que pueda encontrar si se venden sueltas.","3 cucharadas de perejil picado, menta y cebollino","6 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de jugo de limón","500 g de pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos de 3 cm","1 cebolla morada, pelada","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en trozos de 3 cm","1 limón, cortado en 8 gajos","8 tomates maduros: los tomates cultivados en rama tienden a tener el mejor sabor","2 chiles verdes, sin semillas y finamente picados","2 dientes de ajo pequeños, finamente picados","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco"]','["Si usa madera o bambú\r\nRemojar ocho brochetas en agua fría.\r\ndurante aproximadamente media hora. Cocine el\r\npatatas en agua hirviendo con sal durante\r\n10-12 minutos, hasta que estén tiernos,\r\nescurrir y dejar enfriar. Mezclar el\r\nhierbas, aceite, jugo de limón, sal y\r\npimienta en un tazón grande y agregue la\r\npollo y patatas. Mezclar bien\r\nhasta que todo esté reluciente. cortar\r\nla cebolla en 6 gajos, luego\r\nseparar las capas en cada una\r\ncuña. Agrega la cebolla y el\r\npimienta a la marinada y mezclar\r\na fondo.","Para hacer la salsa, córtela por la mitad y\r\nquita las semillas a los tomates y luego pica los\r\ncarne finamente. Mezclar los tomates,\r\nguindillas, ajo, aceite, vinagre, sal\r\ny pimienta y verter en un\r\nplato pequeño.","Enhebrar el pollo, las patatas,\r\npimientos y cebolla sobre\r\n8 brochetas, terminando cada una con una\r\nrodajita de limón. Barbacoa directamente\r\na fuego medio alto durante 5-6\r\nminutos por cada lado, hasta que\r\nel pollo está cocido. Servir amontonados\r\nuna fuente para servir con el tomate\r\nsaborear."]','2026-01-11 13:09:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15505,6489,'es','Tortillas miniatura con ricotta','Estas pequeñas tortillas, llamadas frittatine en italiano, son un aperitivo maravilloso','["4 huevos","un puñado pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, finamente picado, más ramitas adicionales para servir","un puñado de cebollino, finamente picado","1 diente de ajo pequeño, finamente picado","50 g de parmesano recién rallado","aceite de oliva, para freír","250 g de ricota en tarrina","un puñado de albahaca fresca, triturada","50 g de parmesano recién rallado"]','["Batir los huevos con 2 cucharadas de agua y luego sazonar si lo desea. Incorpora el perejil, el cebollino, el ajo y el parmesano.","Calentar una sartén de fondo grueso de 23 cm a fuego medio con un poco de aceite. Cuando el aceite esté caliente, agregue un cucharón (aproximadamente un tercio) de la mezcla de huevo e incline la mezcla para que cubra la base. Reduzca el fuego y cocine la tortilla hasta que esté firme, luego déle la vuelta y cocine por el otro lado. Manténgase caliente. Repita para hacer tres tortillas, agregando un poco más de aceite a la sartén cada vez.","Haz el relleno combinando ricota, albahaca, parmesano y un poco de pimienta. Extienda la mezcla sobre cada tortilla, enróllela sin apretar como un cigarro y córtela en rodajas gruesas. Se puede realizar con hasta 5 horas de anticipación. Servir adornado con perejil."]','2026-01-11 13:09:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15506,6491,'es','chile de frijol mexicano','El ingrediente secreto de este chili con carne de res condimentado con chipotle es uno de los favoritos en las tiendas: frijoles horneados.','["1 cebolla, picada","1 pimiento rojo, cortado en cubitos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo","500 g de carne picada","Lata de 415 g de frijoles horneados","150 ml de caldo de carne","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","hojas de cilantro, arroz y yogur, para servir"]','["Sofreír la cebolla y la roja.\r\npimienta en aceite de oliva a fuego medio\r\nCaliente durante 10-15 minutos o hasta que se ablanden.\r\nAumenta el fuego, agrega la guindilla.\r\npolvo y cocine por unos minutos antes\r\nagregando la carne picada. Cocine hasta\r\nSe dora y todo el líquido se ha evaporado.","Agregue los frijoles horneados, el caldo de res y la pasta de chipotle.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos.\r\nSazone, espolvoree con hojas de cilantro.\r\ny servir con arroz y yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:09:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15507,6493,'es','Yogur de frutas y nueces','Un desayuno que aumenta la energía y que es una excelente alternativa al cereal y te mantendrá lleno hasta el almuerzo.','["3 cucharadas de nueces mixtas picadas","1 cucharada de semilla de girasol","1 cucharada de semilla de calabaza","1 plátano en rodajas","1-2 puñados de bayas (congeladas y descongeladas están bien)","200g vanilla yogurt"]','["Mezclar las nueces, las semillas de girasol y las semillas de calabaza. Mezclar el plátano en rodajas y las bayas. Colocar en capas en un bol con yogur y disfrutar."]','2026-01-11 13:09:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15508,6497,'es','Huevos revueltos especiados','Empiece la mañana de forma saludable con cremosos huevos revueltos sobre tostadas, perfectos para aprovechar uno o dos tomates perdidos.','["1 cebolla pequeña picada","1 chile rojo picado","nuez de mantequilla","4 huevos batidos","chorrito de leche","un buen puñado de tomates cortados en cubitos","hojas de cilantro","tostadas, para servir"]','["Ablanda la cebolla y la guindilla en una nuez de mantequilla.\r\nIncorporamos los huevos batidos y un chorrito de\r\nleche. Cuando esté casi revuelto, suavemente\r\nagregue un buen puñado de tomates cortados en cubitos\r\nseguido de unas hojas de cilantro.\r\nSazone y coma sobre una tostada."]','2026-01-11 13:09:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15509,6499,'es','Bandeja horneada de pollo, pimiento rojo y almendras','Una sabrosa cena de pollo asado en una sartén con limón, comino, pimentón, cilantro y otros sabores del norte de África.','["500 g de muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","3 cebollas moradas medianas, cortadas en gajos gruesos","500 g de patatas rojas pequeñas, cortadas en rodajas gruesas","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en rodajas gruesas","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de comino molido, pimentón ahumado y semillas de hinojo, ligeramente trituradas","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","50 g de almendras enteras blanqueadas, picadas en trozos grandes","Tarrina de 170 g de yogur griego 0%, para servir","un puñado pequeño de perejil o cilantro, picado, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Colocar el pollo, las cebollas, las patatas y los pimientos en un bol grande y sazonar. En otro bol, mezcle el ajo, las especias, el aceite, la ralladura y el jugo de limón. Vierta esto sobre todo y extienda la mezcla entre 2 bandejas para hornear.","Ase durante 40 minutos, volteándolo después de 20 minutos, hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Agrega las almendras durante los últimos 8 minutos de cocción. Sirva en tazones con una cucharada grande de yogur griego y un poco de perejil o cilantro picado."]','2026-01-11 13:09:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15510,6501,'es','Brochetas de salmón tailandés con salsa de chile dulce y lima','¿Siempre pones algunos filetes de salmón en tu cesta de la compra? Prueba esta nueva forma de transformarlos...','["4 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","jugo 1 lima","4 x 140 g/5 oz de filete de salmón sin piel, cortado en trozos grandes","aceite, para rociar"]','["Combine la salsa de chile dulce y el jugo de limón en un tazón. Vierta la mitad de la mezcla en un bol para servir. Ensarte el salmón en 4 brochetas y unte con la salsa de chile restante. Marinar durante 20 minutos.","Calienta una plancha hasta que esté muy caliente. Sacuda el exceso de marinada de las brochetas, luego rocíe con aceite, sazone y cocine a la plancha durante 8 minutos, volteándolos ocasionalmente hasta que el salmón esté opaco y se desprenda fácilmente de la sartén. Sirva caliente con la salsa para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:09:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15511,6503,'es','Quinoa picante de pollo cajún','La quinua rica en proteínas hace que esta comida entre semana sea una opción súper saludable','["4 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos pequeños","1 cucharada de condimento cajún","100g de quinua","600 ml de caldo de pollo caliente","100 g de orejones, en rodajas","½ bolsa de 250 g de lentejas Puy listas para usar","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas, cortadas en gajos finos","1 manojo de cebolletas, picadas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nMezcle el pollo con la especia cajún.\r\ny disponer en una sola capa en una asadera.\r\nestaño. Hornee por 20 minutos hasta que el pollo\r\nestá cocido. Dejar de lado.","Mientras tanto, cocine la quinua en el\r\ncaldo de pollo durante 15 minutos hasta que esté tierno,\r\nañadiendo los albaricoques y las lentejas para\r\núltimos 5 minutos. Escurrir y colocar en una fuente grande.\r\nen un tazón con el pollo, mezcle.","Mientras se cocina la quinua, calentar\r\nel aceite en una sartén grande y ablandar el\r\ncebollas durante 10-15 minutos. Echar las cebollas\r\nen la quinua con el cilantro y\r\nun poco de condimento, luego mezcle bien."]','2026-01-11 13:09:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15512,6505,'es','Filetes de pavo cajún con salsa de piña','El pavo es lo último en alimento saludable y para sentirse bien: bajo en grasas pero rico en proteínas. Dale vida con una salsa picante','["1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","200 g de arroz basmati","450 ml de caldo de pollo","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes, enjuagadas y escurridas","4 filetes de pavo","2 cucharaditas de condimento cajún","5 oz 140 g de piñas frescas (o 220 g de aros de piña en lata, escurridos)","½ chile verde, finamente picado","jugo 1 lima"]','["Reserva 2 cucharadas de cebolla para el\r\nsalsa. Calentar el aceite en una cacerola y\r\nCocine la cebolla restante y la mitad de la\r\npimienta durante 4 minutos o hasta que se ablande y\r\ncoloreado. Agregue el arroz, luego vierta el\r\nvalores. Añade las alubias y una pizca\r\nde sal. Llevar a ebullición, revolver una vez, tapar.\r\nla sartén, luego reduzca el fuego a un suave\r\ncocine a fuego lento. Cocine por 15 minutos hasta que el arroz esté\r\ntierno y el líquido absorbido.","Espolvorea los filetes de pavo con el cajún.\r\ncondimentar y planchar o freír en una sartén antiadherente\r\ndurante unos 4-6 minutos por cada lado hasta que\r\nbien cocido. Cortar la piña en\r\ntrozos pequeños y mezclar con el\r\ncebolla morada reservada, pimiento y chile verde\r\ny jugo de lima. Vierta un poco de salsa\r\ncada filete y sírvelo con el arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:09:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15513,6507,'es','Salmón primaveral con verduras a la menta','Una comida saludable y fácil de preparar que representa dos de tus cinco comidas al día.','["750 g de patatas nuevas pequeñas, en rodajas gruesas","750 g de guisantes y judías congelados (nosotros utilizamos la mezcla de guisantes y judías Waitrose, £2,29/1 kg)","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","paquete pequeño de menta, solo hojas","4 filetes de salmón de unos 140 g/5 oz cada uno"]','["Hervir las patatas en una sartén grande durante 4 minutos.\r\nAgregue los guisantes y los frijoles y vuelva a subir.\r\nhasta que hierva, luego continúe cocinando por otro\r\n3 minutos hasta que las patatas y los frijoles estén\r\ntierno. Batir el aceite de oliva, la ralladura de limón y\r\njugo y menta en una licuadora para hacer un aderezo (o pique finamente la menta y mezcle con el\r\naceite y limón).","Pon el salmón en una fuente apta para microondas,\r\nSazone y luego vierta el aderezo. Portada\r\ncon film transparente, perforar y luego calentar en el microondas\r\nAlto durante 4-5 minutos hasta que esté bien cocido.\r\nEscurre las verduras y luego mézclalas con el aderezo caliente.\r\ny cocinar los jugos del pescado. servir el\r\npescado encima de las verduras."]','2026-01-11 13:09:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15514,6509,'es','Estofado de cordero abundante','Una olla clásica es la respuesta fácil a la cocina a mitad de semana: abundante, abundante, cálida y repleta de verduras.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","500 g de cordero para guisar en dados","1 cebolla, en rodajas gruesas","2 zanahorias, en rodajas gruesas","2 puerros, en rodajas gruesas","400 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo caliente","1 cucharadita de romero seco o 1 ramita fresca","400 g de frijoles cannellini, enjuagados y escurridos","pan crujiente o patatas hervidas para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cazuela grande. Vierta el cordero y cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que desaparezca el líquido, luego agregue la cebolla, las zanahorias y los puerros. Cocine por 5 minutos más, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que las verduras comiencen a ablandarse.","Verter sobre el caldo, añadir el romero, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 1 hora. Agregue los frijoles y cocine por 30 minutos más, agregando agua si es necesario, hasta que el cordero esté tierno y bien cocido. Servir con un poco de pan crujiente o patatas, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:09:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15515,6513,'es','Buñuelos de calabacín','Utilice calabacín rallado para preparar un entrante veraniego sencillo pero delicioso o una cena ligera con solo cinco ingredientes principales. Utilice un exceso del jardín','["250 g de calabacines rallados","20 g de harina común","1 huevo batido","25 g de parmesano finamente rallado o una alternativa vegetariana (opcional)","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","170 g de hummus de pimiento rojo asado, para servir"]','["Combine el calabacín rallado, la harina, el huevo y el parmesano en un tazón grande.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente a fuego medio y agrega el aceite. Freír los buñuelos durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados. Sirva inmediatamente con hummus de pimiento rojo."]','2026-01-11 13:09:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15516,6515,'es','Pimiento verde asado y chile con judías rojas','Prepare este chile vegetal fácil para servir con camote al horno y yogur refrescante para un gran almuerzo o una cena ligera.','["3 pimientos verdes, cortados por la mitad","1½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado picante","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 batatas medianas","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","10 g de cilantro, hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes, tallos finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","Lata de 400 g de judías rojas, escurridas","Lata de 400 g de frijoles negros escurridos","Lata de 400g de tomates cherry.","4-6 cucharadas de yogur griego","1 chile verde, finamente cortado"]','["Calienta el horno a 240C/220C ventilador/gas 9. Coloca los pimientos verdes en una bandeja para asar con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Sazone con sal y ½ cucharadita de pimentón, luego esparza algunas rodajas de ajo en cada pimiento con un chorrito de aceite de oliva. Coloque las batatas en la misma bandeja, luego áselas durante 30-35 minutos hasta que los pimientos estén ligeramente carbonizados, pero aún suaves y jugosos, y las papas tiernas. (Dependiendo de su tamaño, es posible que sea necesario devolver las patatas al horno durante 5 a 10 minutos).","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite de oliva restante en una cacerola grande a fuego medio y cocina las cebollas con una pizca de sal durante 4-5 minutos. Agregue el resto del ajo y el pimentón, los tallos de cilantro picados, el comino, la pasta de chipotle y el puré de tomate, y cocine durante 1 o 2 minutos más hasta que esté fragante. Agregue los frijoles, los frijoles negros, los tomates cherry y una lata de agua, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 20-25 minutos hasta que la mezcla se espese y esté brillante. Sazone con sal. También puedes agregar más pasta de chipotle y/o comino al gusto, si es necesario.","Sirve medio boniato y pimiento verde por persona. Vierta sobre el chile, luego cubra con el yogur, las hojas de cilantro y el chile verde en rodajas."]','2026-01-11 13:09:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15517,6517,'es','Hummus sin tahini','Disfrute de nuestra receta de hummus fácil y económica con sus acompañamientos favoritos, como pittas, galletas saladas y crudités. Agrega más líquido de la lata de garbanzos para obtener un hummus más suave, si lo deseas.','["Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos (reservar el líquido)","½ diente de ajo pequeño, machacado o ½ cucharadita de puré de ajo","1 cucharadita de jugo de limón","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un chorrito","pittas o crudités de verduras, para servir"]','["Vierta los garbanzos, el ajo, el jugo de limón y el aceite de oliva en una licuadora o procesador de alimentos pequeño. Salpimentamos y añadimos 1 cucharada del líquido reservado de la lata de garbanzos.","Mezcle hasta que quede suave, agregando más líquido de garbanzos reservado para hacer un hummus más suave, si lo desea. Vierta el hummus en un bol, rocíe con más aceite de oliva y enfríe hasta que esté listo para servir. Sirva con pittas o crudités de verduras."]','2026-01-11 13:09:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15518,6519,'es','Ensalada de hinojo marino y cangrejo','Disfrute de esta ensalada como una cena generosa para dos o como un almuerzo o cena ligero para cuatro. Samphire canta cuando se combina con cangrejo y este aderezo picante','["2 rebanadas de pan de masa madre","1½ cucharada de aceite de colza","180g de hinojo marino","1 limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de crema fresca","1 cangrejo, carne marrón y blanca separadas (unos 60 g de cada una)","1 cucharada de eneldo picado (opcional)","100 g de berros"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Cortar el pan en trozos gruesos y ponerlo en un bol con ½ cucharada de aceite de colza y un poco de condimento. Mezcle bien y luego viértalo sobre una bandeja para hornear. Hornee durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Dejar de lado.","Lleve a ebullición una cacerola grande con agua y cocine el hinojo marino durante 3 minutos antes de escurrirlo y sumergirlo en agua helada. Dejar enfriar unos minutos antes de escurrir.","Para hacer el aderezo, combine el jugo de limón, la crema fresca, la 1 cucharada restante de aceite de colza, la carne de cangrejo integral y el eneldo, si lo usa, en un tazón pequeño. Sazone, mezcle para combinar uniformemente y reserve.","Mezcle los berros y el hinojo marino escurrido en un tazón grande, rocíe sobre el aderezo y revuelva bien para cubrir. Sirva en una fuente o divídalo en platos, luego cubra con la carne de cangrejo blanca y los picatostes."]','2026-01-11 13:09:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15519,6521,'es','Cazuela de salchicha con miel y mostaza','Prepare una reconfortante cazuela de salchichas y espinacas con los clásicos sabores de miel y mostaza. Sirva con puré de papa para una cena de invierno que agradará al público.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","8 salchichas de cerdo o sin carne","1 cebolla grande, cortada en rodajas","2 zanahorias, o cualquier otra verdura de raíz, picada en trozos grandes","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharaditas de hierbas secas mixtas","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 cubito de caldo de verduras","1 cucharada de miel","1 cucharada de mostaza inglesa","1 bolsa de espinacas de 260 g","puré de papas, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande con tapa a fuego medio y fríe las salchichas hasta que se doren. Reduzca el fuego a medio-bajo, agregue las cebollas y las zanahorias y cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que estén suaves.","Agrega el ajo y las hierbas secas, luego cocina por 1 min. Agregue los tomates picados, la pastilla de caldo, la miel y la mostaza. Sube el fuego a medio y deja que hierva. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cocine durante 30-40 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando, hasta que las zanahorias estén tiernas y la salsa se haya reducido un poco.","Unos 5 minutos antes de servir, añade las espinacas, en tandas si es necesario. Tape y cocine durante 5 minutos, hasta que se ablanden. Sazone con sal y pimienta y sirva con puré de papa, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:09:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15520,6523,'es','Sopa de guisantes y menta con varitas','Celebre el Día Mundial del Libro e inspírese con el libro infantil La peor bruja, con platos calientes de sopa de guisantes y menta servidos con salsas de queso','["2 cucharaditas de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, picada en trozos grandes","1 papa grande, picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado o machacado","1 litro de caldo de verduras","Paquete de 350g de hojaldre ya enrollado","75 g de queso cheddar, finamente rallado","750 g de guisantes congelados","un puñado de hojas de menta y más hojas ralladas para decorar"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla durante 6-8 minutos hasta que se ablande. Agregue la papa y el ajo y cocine por un par de minutos más antes de verter el caldo y cocinar a fuego lento durante 12 a 15 minutos hasta que la papa esté tierna.","Mientras tanto, desenrede la masa y corte formas de varita cortando líneas ligeramente diagonales, de modo que un extremo de la tira quede más grueso que el otro. Transfiera las varillas de masa a una bandeja para hornear sobre su papel para hornear, luego esparza sobre el queso y sazone con pimienta negra, si lo desea. Hornee durante 10-12 minutos hasta que esté dorado.","Una vez que la papa esté tierna, vierta los guisantes y la menta en la mezcla de sopa y cocine durante 5 a 8 minutos hasta que los guisantes estén descongelados y tiernos. Retirar del fuego y batir con una batidora de mano. Sirva la sopa en tazones, esparza sobre las hojas de menta ralladas y luego sirva con las varillas de repostería para mojar."]','2026-01-11 13:09:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15521,6527,'es','Sopa verde con chorizo ​​crujiente','Licue espinacas, col rizada y papas para hacer esta vibrante sopa verde, cubierta con chorizo ​​crujiente para darle más sabor.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más extra para servir","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","500 g de patatas peladas y picadas","1½ litros de caldo de verduras","250 g de espinacas","Otros 120g","50 ml de nata doble y un poco más para rociar","½ limón, exprimido","100 g de chorizo, finamente picado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cazuela o cazo a fuego medio. Añade la cebolla y una pizca de sal y sofríe durante 10 minutos hasta que esté blanda y traslúcida. Agrega el ajo y sofríe durante 1 min. Agregue las papas y el caldo, cubra y cocine por 15 minutos. Agregue las espinacas y la col rizada y cocine durante 5 a 10 minutos más o hasta que se ablanden.  Use una batidora de mano para batir todo hasta que quede suave, agregue la crema doble y el jugo de limón y sazone al gusto.","Calienta una sartén pequeña a fuego medio y fríe el chorizo ​​picado hasta que esté crujiente. Sirva la sopa en tazones. Cubrir con el chorizo, un chorrito de aceite de chorizo ​​de la sartén y un buen molido de pimienta negra. Terminar con un chorrito de nata."]','2026-01-11 13:09:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15522,6529,'es','sopa de tuétano','Haga de la médula la estrella del espectáculo en esta abundante sopa. Elaborado con frijoles, leche de coco y curry en polvo, tiene un delicado sabor especiado.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas, picadas en trozos grandes","250 g de patatas, picadas en trozos grandes","1 tuétano (aproximadamente 750 g), pelado, sin semillas y picado en trozos grandes (ver consejo a continuación)","1-2 cucharadas de curry en polvo, al gusto","500 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo","Lata de 400 g de alubias, escurridas","Lata de 400ml de leche de coco light","un puñado pequeño de hojas de cilantro"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas con una pizca de sal durante 6-8 minutos hasta que estén blandas. Agregue las papas y cocine por 2 minutos más, luego agregue el tuétano y el curry en polvo. Cocine por 1 min. Vierta el caldo, los frijoles y la mayor parte de la leche de coco (reserve unas cucharadas). Lleva la mezcla a ebullición, luego reduce el fuego a medio-bajo y cocina a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que todas las verduras estén tiernas.","Retirar del fuego y dejar enfriar un poco, luego transferir la mezcla a la licuadora y batir hasta que quede suave. Regrese la sopa a la sartén y caliéntela a fuego lento, luego vierta en tazones. Rocíe con la leche de coco reservada y espolvoree con el cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:09:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15523,6531,'es','Rosti de remolacha con yogur verde y salmón ahumado','Disfrute de estos coloridos rostis de remolacha con salmón ahumado, huevos escalfados y yogur de hierbas. Hacen un fabuloso brunch, almuerzo o cena de fin de semana.','["600 g de remolacha, cortada, pelada y rallada gruesa","400 g de patatas ralladas gruesas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada, finamente cortada","5 huevos grandes","4 cucharadas de harina","2 cucharadas de mantequilla","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","200 g de salmón ahumado","170 g de yogur griego","½ manojo de eneldo, más extra para servir","½ manojo de perejil","pizca de comino molido","1 cucharada de alcaparras, escurridas y enjuagadas"]','["Mezcle la remolacha y la papa con una pizca grande de sal, vierta en un colador en el fregadero y déjela escurrir durante 30 minutos. Transfiera a un paño de cocina limpio y exprima el exceso de líquido. Calentar la mitad del aceite en una sartén y sofreír la cebolla durante 5 minutos. Agregue las verduras ralladas y fríalas durante 10 minutos más hasta que estén suaves. Retirar del fuego. Dejar enfriar un poco. Combine con 1 huevo y la harina, sazone y forme ocho hamburguesas.","Para el yogur de hierbas, vierta todo en un procesador de alimentos con una pizca de sal marina y mezcle hasta que quede suave.","Calienta la mantequilla y el aceite restante en una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio y fríe los rosti durante 4-5 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén crujientes y bien cocidos. Poner en una bandeja para horno y mantener caliente en horno bajo.","Pon a hervir a fuego lento una cacerola con agua ligeramente salada y el vinagre. Revuelva para crear un remolino. Rompe 1 huevo en una taza, espera hasta que el remolino casi haya disminuido y luego vierte el huevo. Escalfar durante 2-3 minutos, retirar con una espumadera y escurrir sobre papel de cocina. Repita con los otros huevos.","Sirve el rosti con yogur de hierbas, huevos escalfados, salmón ahumado y un poco más de eneldo."]','2026-01-11 13:09:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15524,6537,'es','Una olla de cerdo chino','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una sopa rápida con un toque oriental que conquistará a amigos y familiares.','["400 g de lomo de cerdo cortado en tiras largas y finas","600 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","2 cucharaditas de polvo de cinco especias chinas","trozo grande de jengibre, pelado y cortado en palitos","Paquete 200g baby leaf verde en cuartos","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado o 1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","manojo de cebolletas, claras y verduras en rodajas"]','["Vierta todos los ingredientes, excepto las hojas de cebolleta, en una cacerola grande, tape y cocine a fuego lento. Cocine, sin hervir, durante unos 8 minutos, hasta que la carne de cerdo haya cambiado de color y las verduras estén cocidas, pero aún un poco crujientes. Sirva en tazones, espolvoree con la cebolleta y sirva con arroz hervido o fideos a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:09:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15525,6539,'es','Gumbo de pollo','Un guiso bajo en grasa de okra y pimiento verde de inspiración criolla con cayena, pimentón, comino y tomillo','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","500 g de muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel, cortados en trozos","1 cebolla, picada","1 pimiento verde, sin semillas y picado","3 ramas de apio, finamente picadas","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","¼ cucharadita de pimienta de cayena","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de tomillo seco","1 hoja de laurel","1 cucharada colmada de harina común","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","400 ml de caldo de pollo","100 g de okra, cortada en rodajas de 2 cm","un puñado pequeño de salvia, las hojas picadas","pan crujiente o arroz para microondas, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio.\r\ncalor alto. Agrega el pollo y cocina en tandas.\r\ndurante unos 5 minutos para que se dore por completo. Retire el\r\npollo con una espumadera y reservar.","Añade la cebolla, el pimiento verde y el apio a la\r\nsartén, tapar y cocinar durante 5 minutos, revolviendo\r\nde vez en cuando hasta que se ablanden un poco. Agregue el ajo,\r\nespecias, tomillo y laurel y cocinar durante 1 min.\r\nhasta que esté fragante. Devuelve el pollo y cualquier\r\njugos a la sartén con la harina, revolviendo para cubrir\r\ntodo. Vierta los tomates y el caldo y\r\nllevar a ebullición, cocinar durante 5 minutos, luego agregar el\r\nokra y la mitad de la salvia. Bajar a fuego lento,\r\ntapar y cocinar durante 10 minutos. Luego sazone\r\ny servir, esparciendo el resto de la salvia."]','2026-01-11 13:09:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15526,6541,'es','Ensalada César de albóndigas de pavo','Pruebe una versión fresca y saludable de la ensalada clásica usando carne magra de pavo enrollada en hamburguesas y servida con un aderezo de suero de leche.','["Paquete de 500 g de pavo magro picado (ver consejo a continuación)","1 cebolla, finamente picada","paquete pequeño de cebolletas cortadas","125 ml de suero de leche","1 diente de ajo, machacado","4 cucharadas de queso pecorino o parmesano rallado, más extra para servir (opcional)","2 batidos de salsa tabasco","1 cucharada de salsa inglesa","1 panecillo ciabatta pequeño, picado o partido en trozos","exprimir el jugo de limon","2 lechugas cos"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEn un bol mezclar la carne picada, la cebolla, la mitad\r\nel cebollino, 1 cucharada de suero de leche, el\r\najo, 2 cucharadas de parmesano, la mitad\r\nel Tabasco y la mitad del Worcestershire\r\nsalsa con un poco de condimento. Darle forma\r\nunas 20 albóndigas pequeñas (ligeramente engrasadas)\r\nmanos lo harán más fácil).","Coloca las bolas de pavo en una sola capa.\r\nen una fuente para asar y cocinar durante 10 minutos.\r\nRetirar, voltear las bolas de pavo y disponer\r\nlos trozos de pan en el medio. cocinar para\r\notros 10 minutos.","Mientras tanto, vierta el resto del suero de leche.\r\nen un bol con el parmesano restante,\r\nTabasco, salsa inglesa y el\r\njugo de limón. Sazone y mezcle. Pon el\r\nlechuga encima, mezcle justo antes\r\nservir y dividir en platos. arriba\r\ncon unas albóndigas y picatostes al horno,\r\nluego espolvoree con cebollino. Servir con\r\nparmesano extra, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:09:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15527,6543,'es','Frittata de guisantes, queso feta y hierbas de verano','Utilice sus hierbas suaves favoritas en esta tortilla espesa a la parrilla con guisantes, queso crema y calabacín; a nosotros nos gusta el eneldo, la menta y el perejil.','["300 g de patatas nuevas (como las Jersey Royals), cortadas a la mitad si son grandes","4 huevos y 2 claras","chorrito de leche","1 diente de ajo, machacado","1 cucharada de mostaza integral sin gluten","un puñado de hierbas suaves mezcladas, como eneldo, menta y perejil, picadas en trozos grandes","3 cucharadas de queso crema","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 calabacín, rallado grueso","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","140 g de petits pois (descongelados si están congelados)","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","50 g de tomates secos, escurridos y picados en trozos grandes","Bolsa de 100 g de hojas de ensalada, para servir"]','["Pon las patatas en una cacerola con sal.\r\nagua, llevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante\r\n12-15 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir, dejar\r\ndéjelo enfriar y luego córtelo en rodajas finas. Batir los huevos y\r\nclaras de huevo con la leche, el ajo, la mostaza\r\ny hierbas, y sazone generosamente. Añadir\r\nel queso crema y doblar solo un\r\npoco para que queden algunos grumos. Calor\r\nla parrilla a fuego medio-alto.","Calentar el aceite a fuego medio en\r\nuna sartén antiadherente de 23 cm. Añade el\r\npatatas y freír durante unos 5 minutos,\r\nhasta que empiecen a dorarse. Añadir\r\nlas hojuelas de calabacín y guindilla, y\r\nContinúe friendo por un par de minutos más.\r\nRevuelva con los petit pois.","Vierta la mezcla de huevo en la sartén y\r\nespolvorear con el queso feta y los tomates.\r\nCocine a fuego suave durante 10-12 minutos.\r\nhasta que esté casi cuajado. Coloca la sartén debajo\r\nla parrilla y cocine durante 3-5 minutos hasta que\r\ninflado, dorado y bien cocido.\r\nCortar en gajos y servir con\r\nuna ensalada verde crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:09:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15528,6545,'es','Arroz frito con sardinas','Le damos un nuevo giro a la tradicional olla de arroz de Indonesia: esta versión utiliza pescado azul combinado con arroz con cúrcuma, cilantro y gambas.','["4 sardinas, destripadas","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","2 huevos batidos","6 cebolletas, 4 picadas, 2 ralladas","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de pasta de camarones","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","2 cucharaditas de puré de tomate","2 chiles rojos, rebanados","400 g de arroz cocido (250 g crudo)","85 g de gambas pequeñas","1 cucharada de salsa de soja, más extra para servir (opcional)","un puñado grande de hojas de cilantro","3 cucharadas de hojuelas de chalota crujientes (opcional)","pepino en rodajas finas, para servir"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto y cepilla la\r\nsardinas con un poco de aceite. Ase durante aproximadamente\r\n4 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén ligeramente ampollados\r\ny bien cocido, luego reservar.","Calentar la mitad del aceite restante en un wok y\r\nCocine los huevos hasta obtener una tortilla fina. Consejo sobre\r\nun plato para enfriar. Calentar el resto del aceite en\r\nel mismo wok. Añade la primavera picada\r\ncebolla, ajo, pasta de camarones, cúrcuma,\r\npuré de tomate y la mitad de la guindilla. Chisporroteo\r\ntodo junto para formar una pasta, luego\r\nañade el arroz y las gambas. Sazone con\r\nsalsa de soja y sofreír durante 5 minutos hasta que\r\nTodo está combinado y caliente.","Enrollar la tortilla y desmenuzarla finamente.\r\nDesmenuza el pescado en trozos grandes y deshuesados.\r\nIncorpora las tiras de tortilla y el pescado.\r\nel arroz, luego esparcir sobre el rallado\r\ncebolletas, el resto del chile y cilantro\r\nhojas y hojuelas crujientes de chalota (si se usan).\r\nSirve el arroz con soya extra, si quieres,\r\ny pepino en rodajas finas a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:09:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15529,6549,'es','Pollo asado con chile y semillas de sésamo','Condimente las tiras de pollo asado con salsa de chile tailandesa, jengibre y miel y sírvalas con brócoli para esta comida rápida para dos.','["2 pechugas de pollo sin piel","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1½ cucharada de salsa de chile sriracha (ver el consejo a continuación)","2 cucharaditas de jengibre rallado","2 cucharadas de miel clara","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz","Paquete de 240 g de brócoli de tallo tierno","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo, tostadas"]','["Corta cada pechuga de pollo a lo largo.\r\nen 2 trozos finos. Frote con el aceite y\r\nsazonar por ambos lados. Calentar una sartén grill y\r\ncocine los trozos durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado.","Mientras se cocina el pollo, mezcle la\r\nsalsa de chile, jengibre, miel y vinagre\r\ncon un poco de condimento en un tazón pequeño.\r\nCepille el pollo mientras se cocina – espere\r\nhasta que esté asado primero por un lado antes\r\ncepillarlo o se quemará.","Blanquear el brócoli, dividirlo entre\r\nplatos y verter sobre la salsa restante.\r\nCubra con el pollo y las semillas de sésamo."]','2026-01-11 13:09:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15530,6551,'es','Berenjena asada satay','Brochetas listas: estas brochetas vegetarianas están marinadas en soja y cúrcuma y se sirven con una rica salsa de maní','["1 berenjena grande, pelada y cortada en cubos de 3 cm","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","2 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","3 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní crujiente","2 cucharadas de salsa hoisin","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino de arroz","2 cucharadas de leche de coco","arroz basmati, para servir","1 pepino pequeño, cortado en trozos de 2-3 cm","1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada en medias lunas","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta fresca","un puñado pequeño de hojas de cilantro fresco"]','["Echar la berenjena con la soja.\r\nsalsa, aceite, cúrcuma, 1 cucharada de chile\r\nsalsa y un poco de pimienta negra, luego\r\nenhebrar sobre madera previamente empapada\r\nbrochetas. Calentar una plancha o sartén\r\nsartén hasta que esté medio caliente. Asa el \r\nberenjenas por todos lados volteándose después\r\nAparecen marcas de parrilla. Necesitan tiempo para\r\nablanda, así que mantén el fuego a medio-bajo\r\ny cocine hasta que esté suave y dorado.\r\nPincelar con un poco de aceite si empiezan a\r\npegarse a la sartén.","Para la ensalada, mezclar todos los\r\ningredientes en un tazón pequeño, luego coloque\r\na un lado. En otro bol mezclar la\r\nsalsa de chile restante, mantequilla de maní,\r\nhoisin, vinagre y leche de coco.\r\nServir las brochetas con la ensalada,\r\nsalsa de maní y un poco de arroz basmati."]','2026-01-11 13:09:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15531,6555,'es','Pollo pegajoso al limón','Una receta rápida de hacer','["4 pechugas de pollo parcialmente deshuesadas, con piel","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón grande","1 cucharada de miel clara","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","papa nueva y ensalada verde, para servir"]','["Precalienta el horno a ventilador\r\n170C/convencional 190C/gas 5.\r\nColoque las pechugas de pollo, con la piel\r\narriba, en una capa en un lugar poco profundo\r\nfuente o lata resistente al horno. Pon todos los\r\ningredientes restantes en un tazón\r\ny calentarse en el\r\nmicroondas o una cacerola pequeña para\r\n1 minuto, luego revuelve para mezclar todo.\r\njuntos y verter sobre el pollo.","desliza el plato\r\nen el horno y asar el pollo\r\ndurante 30-40 minutos, rociando cada\r\n10 minutos más o menos. Los jugos\r\nespesar gradualmente y dar la\r\npollo con una capa brillante al final.\r\nDejar reposar el pollo\r\n5 minutos antes de servir con nuevo\r\npatatas y ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 13:09:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15532,6559,'es','Ensalada de melocotón y queso azul','Pruebe esta ensalada cremosa y afrutada, perfecta para el almuerzo o una cena ligera de verano.','["½ pan ciabatta, en rodajas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de miel clara","chorrito de jugo de limón","1 bolsa de hojas de ensalada mixta","un puñado de hojas de menta, rasgadas","4 duraznos, cada uno cortado en 8 trozos","140 g de queso azul o brie, cortado en trozos","100 g de guisantes dulces, cortados por la mitad a lo largo"]','["Tostar las rebanadas de ciabatta y rociar con 1 cucharada\r\naceite. Haga el aderezo mezclando las\r\naceite restante, miel y jugo de limón, luego\r\nsazone al gusto. Mezclar todos los demás ingredientes.\r\njuntos en un tazón grande y mezcle con el\r\naderezo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:09:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15533,6561,'es','Pollo con harissa y tomates','Receta de cena de pollo rápida y fácil entre semana, con solo un toque picante','["4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","2 cucharaditas de harissa (la harissa de rosas de Belazu tiene mucho sabor)","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de orégano seco","Paquete de 250 g de tomates cherry.","un puñado de aceitunas (nosotros usamos kalamata)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Poner el \r\npollo en una bandeja para asar mediana, luego \r\nfrotar con la harissa, el aceite y el orégano.","Cubra con papel aluminio y ase durante 5 minutos, luego retire \r\nel papel de aluminio y añadir los tomates cherry y \r\naceitunas a la bandeja. Ase por 10 minutos más \r\nhasta que la piel del tomate empiece a partirse y el \r\nel pollo esté bien cocido. Servir con hervido \r\npatatas nuevas"]','2026-01-11 13:09:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15534,6563,'es','Linguini al limón con jamón','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Pruebe este sabroso y picante plato de pasta, un perfecto almuerzo o cena ligera de verano.','["400 g de linguini","taza de guisantes congelados","Tarrina de 200ml de crema fresca","ralladura de ½ limón y jugo de 1 limón","3-4 lonchas de jamón cocido, cortado en tiras"]','["Cocine la pasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, agregando\r\nlos guisantes durante los últimos 2 minutos de cocción.","Escurre bien la pasta y regresa a la sartén. Revuelva\r\nen la crème fraîche, la ralladura de limón y el jugo, luego\r\ntemporada. Servir con las tiras de jamón repartidas por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:09:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15535,6569,'es','Trucha picante','Prueba esta receta saludable de trucha para una cena ligera de verano','["4 filetes de trucha","50 g de pan rallado","1 cucharada de mantequilla, ablandada","1 manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón, más rodajas de limón para servir","25 g de piñones, tostados y medio picados","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Coloque los filetes por el lado de la piel.\r\nhacia abajo, sobre una bandeja para hornear engrasada. Mezclar juntos el\r\npan rallado, mantequilla, perejil, ralladura de limón y\r\nzumo y la mitad de los piñones. esparcir la mezcla\r\nen una capa fina sobre los filetes, rociar con el aceite\r\ny colocar debajo del grill durante 5 minutos. espolvorear\r\nsobre los piñones restantes, luego sirva con\r\nlas rodajas de limón y una ensalada de patatas."]','2026-01-11 13:10:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15536,6571,'es','Sopa fresca y ligera','No es necesario comprar sopa comprada en la tienda con esta receta rápida y nutritiva','["100 g de filetes de eglefino ahumado y 100 g sin ahumar, con piel","500ml de leche desnatada","500 ml de caldo de verduras","2 ramitas de tomillo","1 cucharadita de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 puerro, rebanado","1 camote grande, cortado en cubitos","Lata de 200 g de maíz dulce en agua, escurrido","50 g de lentejas rojas","un puñado pequeño de perejil picado","pan crujiente, para servir"]','["Coloque el pescado en una sartén honda y luego\r\nañade la leche, el caldo y el tomillo. traer a\r\ndejar hervir y retirar del fuego; dejar hasta\r\nlo suficientemente frío como para manipularlo. saca el pescado\r\n(reservando el líquido), retirar la piel y\r\nDesmenuza el pescado en un plato para usarlo más tarde.","Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande.\r\ncacerola. Sofreír la cebolla, el ajo.\r\ny el puerro durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté suave y\r\ntranslúcido. Agrega la batata,\r\nmaíz dulce y lentejas, luego vierta\r\nel líquido en el que cocinaste el pescado. Trae\r\nhasta que hierva y cocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos. comprobar\r\nel condimento y semi-blitz con una mano\r\nlicuadora – Me gusta dejarlo bastante áspero.\r\nAgrega el pescado desmenuzado y el perejil picado.\r\nSirva bien caliente con un poco de pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:10:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15537,6573,'es','Garbanzos con tomate y espinacas','Para pasar una gran noche en casa, prepara esta comida caliente, sírvela con un poco de pan naan y ponte cómodo en el sofá.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, picados","½ trozo de raíz de jengibre fresco, del largo de un dedo, rallado","2 chiles rojos suaves, en rodajas finas","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","¾ cucharadita de garam masala","1 cucharadita de comino molido","4 tomates, picados","2 cucharaditas de puré de tomate","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","200 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca","arroz o pan naan, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en un wok y sofreír la cebolla.\r\na fuego lento hasta que se ablanden. Agregue el\r\najo, jengibre y chiles y cocinar por\r\n5 minutos más hasta que las cebollas estén\r\ndorados y los ajos ligeramente tostados.","Añade la cúrcuma, el garam masala y\r\ncomino, removiendo a fuego lento durante unos\r\nsegundos. Vierta los tomates picados y\r\nagregue el puré de tomate y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 5 min.","Añade los garbanzos a la sartén con\r\n300ml de agua (llenar la lata tres cuartos)\r\ncompleto). Cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos antes de revolver.\r\nen las espinacas para que se marchiten. Sazonar y servir\r\ncon arroz o naan."]','2026-01-11 13:10:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15538,6575,'es','Korma de pollo light','Un pollo al curry korma suave y saludable que sigue siendo saciante y lleno de sabor.','["jengibre fresco en trozos pequeños, pelado y cortado finamente","1 diente de ajo","1 cebolla, rebanada","1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos pequeños","1 cucharadita de garam masala","100 ml de caldo de pollo","3 cucharadas de queso fresco bajo en grasa","2 cucharadas de almendras molidas","un puñado de almendras tostadas y rebanadas, para servir","hojas de cilantro, arroz natural, pan naan o chapatis, para servir"]','["Cocine el jengibre, el ajo y la cebolla en una sartén grande.\r\ncon el aceite hasta que se ablanden. Vierta el pollo y\r\ncocine hasta que esté ligeramente dorado, aproximadamente 5 minutos, luego\r\nagregue el garam masala y cocine por 1 minuto más.","Vierta sobre el caldo y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.\r\nhasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. mezclar juntos\r\nel queso fresco y las almendras molidas. Toma el\r\nApague la sartén del fuego y agregue el queso fresco.\r\nmezcla. Espolvorear sobre las almendras rebanadas y decorar.\r\ncon cilantro y servir con arroz hervido, chapatis\r\no pan naan simple."]','2026-01-11 13:10:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15539,6577,'es','Tazón de fideos con tofu japonés','Esta sopa saludable está llena de sabores frescos de primavera y es una comida vegetariana sofisticada para los invitados.','["3 cucharadas de tamari o salsa de soja oscura","2 cucharadas de vinagre de arroz sazonado","1 cucharada de mirin o 2 cucharaditas de azúcar en polvo","200 g de tofu firme, escurrido, seco y cortado en 8 cubos","harina de maíz, para rebozar","aceite de girasol, para freír","1 manojo de espárragos, sin la base de los tallos, cortados diagonalmente en aproximadamente 4 trozos","50 g de frijoles edamame frescos o congelados","50 g de guisantes congelados","jengibre en trozos pequeños, rallado","Paquete de 400 g de fideos udon directos al wok","hojas de cilantro, para decorar","aceite de chile, para servir"]','["Combine el tamari o la salsa de soja,\r\nvinagre y mirin o azúcar en un recipiente poco profundo\r\ntazón y revuelva hasta que se disuelva. Coloque el\r\nel tofu en la marinada y voltearlo para cubrirlo.\r\nDejar absorber los sabores durante aproximadamente\r\n30 minutos o más. (Si marina durante\r\nvarias horas, conservar en el frigorífico.)","Cuando esté listo para cocinar, encienda el horno.\r\na calentar. Esparcir la harina de maíz\r\nun plato. Retire el tofu del\r\nadobo, reservando el adobo, y\r\nenrolle la harina de maíz para cubrir todos los lados. Calor\r\nuna sartén ancha a fuego medio-alto\r\ny agregue suficiente aceite de girasol para cubrir\r\nla base de la sartén. Freír el tofu usando\r\npinzas para voltear, hasta que estén doradas y crujientes.\r\npor todas partes. Escurrir sobre papel de cocina y conservar\r\ncalentar en el horno.","Colocar 1 litro de agua en un medio\r\ncacerola con la marinada reservada\r\ny llevar a ebullición. Agrega los espárragos,\r\nfrijoles edamame, guisantes, jengibre y\r\nfideos y volver a hervir. cocine a fuego lento\r\nhasta que las verduras estén tiernas, aproximadamente\r\n3-4 minutos. Dividir en 4 tazones y\r\ncoloca 2 cubitos de tofu en cada uno. Cubra con\r\nhojas de cilantro y servir rociadas\r\ncon un poco de aceite de guindilla."]','2026-01-11 13:10:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15540,6579,'es','Guiso de pescado español en una sartén','Utilice cualquier pescado blanco o salmón sostenible en este guiso fácil y lleno de sabor, perfecto con pan crujiente.','["un puñado de hojas de perejil de hoja plana, picadas","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más extra para servir","1 cebolla mediana, finamente rebanada","500 g de patatas harinosas, cortadas en trozos pequeños, de no más de 2 cm de tamaño","1 cucharadita de pimentón","pizca de pimienta de cayena","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cubito de caldo de pescado","200 g de langostinos crudos pelados","½ lata de 410 g/14 oz de garbanzos, enjuagados y escurridos","500 g de filetes de pescado sin piel y cortados en trozos muy grandes"]','["En un tazón pequeño, mezcle el perejil con\r\n½ ajo y ralladura de limón, luego cuaja\r\na un lado. Calentar 2 cucharadas de aceite en un salteado grande.\r\nsartén. Echar la cebolla y las patatas,\r\ntapar la sartén, luego sudar todo\r\ndurante unos 5 minutos hasta que la cebolla esté\r\nsuavizado. Agrega el aceite restante, el ajo.\r\ny las especias, luego cocine por 2 minutos más.","Vierta sobre el jugo de limón y chisporrotee.\r\npor un momento. Agrega los tomates, ½ a\r\nlata de agua y desmenuzar en el caldo.\r\nSazone con un poco de sal, luego cubra la\r\nsartén. Cocine todo a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos.\r\nhasta que las patatas estén recién cocidas.","Revuelva las gambas y los garbanzos,\r\nluego coloque los trozos de pescado en la parte superior\r\ndel guiso. Reducir el calor y recuperar\r\nla sartén, luego cocine por aproximadamente 8\r\nminutos, revolviendo muy suavemente una o dos veces.\r\nCuando el pescado esté bien cocido,\r\nRetirar del fuego, espolvorear con el\r\nmezcla de perejil, luego lleva el plato a la\r\nmesa con la botella de aceite de oliva para\r\nrociando y un poco de pan crujiente,\r\nsi quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:10:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15541,6581,'es','Salmón al vapor en el microondas','Pruebe un banquete de Año Nuevo chino con pescado al vapor','["450 g de filetes de salmón o pescado blanco firme, como el bacalao","1½ cucharada de raíz de jengibre fresco finamente rallado","3 cucharadas de cebolletas finamente ralladas","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja ligera","2 tsp dark soy sauce","1 cucharada de aceite de maní","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","un puñado de ramitas de cilantro fresco, para decorar"]','["Secar el pescado con papel de cocina.\r\nluego cortar en trozos muy grandes. poner en\r\nun plato resistente al calor y esparcir uniformemente\r\ncon el jengibre. Envolver bien en film transparente\r\npelícula. Puede estar preparado para aquí hasta\r\n2-3 horas antes, enfriar. poner el plato\r\nde pescado en el microondas y cocinar\r\ndurante 3-5 minutos (dependiendo de su\r\nespesor y como te gusta tu pescado\r\ncocido) a máxima potencia.","Retirar el plato de pescado cocido. Espera un minuto y retira el exceso de líquido que se haya podido acumular en el plato, luego esparce las cebolletas sobre el pescado, junto con las salsas de soja clara y oscura.","Calienta los dos aceites juntos en una cacerola pequeña hasta que estén muy calientes, luego vierte sobre la parte superior del pescado. Espolvorea con un puñado de ramitas de cilantro y sirve de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:10:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15542,6583,'es','Tostada de gambas y huevo','Conoce tu nueva receta de brunch favorita: fácil y rápida mayonesa de gambas y huevo sobre tostada. Espolvorea con cebollino para terminar.','["3 huevos","250 g de gambas peladas y cocidas (descongeladas si están congeladas)","3 cucharadas de mayonesa","1 limón, exprimido","4 rebanadas gruesas de pan blanco","mantequilla, para servir","manojo pequeño de cebollino, finamente picado, para servir"]','["Hierva una cacerola mediana con agua, luego agregue con cuidado los huevos y cocine durante 9 minutos. Retirar a un recipiente con agua helada con una espumadera y dejar reposar durante 10 minutos hasta que esté frío. Pelar y luego picar finamente.","Vierta el huevo picado en un bol junto con las gambas. Agrega la mayonesa y el jugo de limón, luego sazona con sal y pimienta.","Tostar el pan y luego untarlo con mantequilla. Vierta sobre la mayonesa de gambas y huevo, luego espolvoree con un poco de cebollino y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:10:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15543,6585,'es','Hojaldres fáciles de pastel de carne picada y almendras','Haga un alimento básico navideño con algunos pasteles de carne hechos en casa con hojaldre. Sirva para el desayuno o disfrútelo caliente con helado de vainilla como postre.','["320 g de masa de hojaldre ya laminada","harina común, para espolvorear","1 huevo batido","150 g de carne picada (vegetariana, si es necesario)","20 g de almendras laminadas","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Desenrolla la masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada y córtala por la mitad a lo largo. Corta cada mitad en seis, para tener 12 cuadrados. Trabajando con un cuadrado a la vez, dóblelo por la mitad en diagonal para crear un triángulo. Extiende el triángulo con el borde doblado hacia ti. Corta un borde de ½ cm a lo largo de los otros dos bordes, deteniéndote justo antes de que los dos cortes se crucen. Desdobla la masa con cuidado y pincela los bordes con un poco de huevo batido. Levante la esquina izquierda de la masa y dóblela hacia la derecha, presionándola suavemente contra la esquina interior derecha para sellar. Repita desde la esquina derecha de la masa hasta la esquina interior izquierda. Coloque los pasteles en dos bandejas para hornear forradas con papel para hornear y vierta 1 cucharadita de carne picada en el medio de cada una. Cubra cada uno con algunas almendras en hojuelas. Se mantendrán fríos hasta por 24 horas.","Calentar el horno a 210C/190C ventilador/gas 6½. Unte la masa con más huevo y hornee durante 15-20 minutos hasta que esté inflada y dorada. Espolvoree con azúcar glas y disfrútelo tibio, o déjelo enfriar por completo. Una vez enfriado, se mantendrá en un recipiente hermético a temperatura ambiente durante dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:10:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15544,6587,'es','Tortitas de plátano','¡Panqueques de plátano sin gluten que puedes preparar en solo 10 minutos! Espolvoree con nueces y frambuesas para disfrutar de un desayuno bajo en calorías pero delicioso.','["1 plátano grande","2 huevos medianos, batidos","una pizca de levadura en polvo (sin gluten si es celíaco)","chorrito de extracto de vainilla","1 cucharadita de aceite","25 g de nueces pecanas, picadas en trozos grandes","125 g de frambuesas"]','["En un bol, tritura el plátano con un tenedor hasta que parezca un puré espeso. Agrega los huevos, el polvo para hornear y la vainilla.","Calienta una sartén antiadherente grande o un molde para panqueques a fuego medio y unta con la mitad del aceite. Usando la mitad de la masa, coloque dos panqueques en la sartén, cocine durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado y luego viértalos en un plato. Repite el proceso con el aceite restante y la masa. Cubra los panqueques con las nueces y las frambuesas."]','2026-01-11 13:10:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15545,6589,'es','Tostada de kale, tomate y huevo escalfado','No hay forma más sabrosa de comer col rizada que cubierta con una yema líquida y espolvoreada con queso feta. ¡Este desayuno vegetariano bajo en calorías lo tiene todo!','["2 cucharaditas de aceite","100 g de col rizada ya picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 huevos grandes","2 rebanadas de pan multigrano","50 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","15 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Ponga a hervir una cacerola grande con agua. Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y agrega la col rizada, el ajo y las hojuelas de chile. Cocine, revolviendo ocasionalmente, durante 4 minutos hasta que la col rizada comience a estar crujiente y se marchite a la mitad de su tamaño. Dejar de lado.","Ajuste el fuego para que el agua hierva y luego escalfe los huevos durante 2 minutos. Mientras tanto, tuesta el pan.","Retire los huevos escalfados con una espumadera y cubra cada tostada con la mitad de la col rizada, un huevo, los tomates cherry y el queso feta."]','2026-01-11 13:10:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15546,6591,'es','Frittata de jamón, champiñones y espinacas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Pruebe una frittata abundante, baja en calorías y que le garantizará energía hasta el almuerzo. Guarda la mitad en el frigorífico durante la noche si vas a cocinar para uno','["1 cucharadita de aceite","80 g de champiñones castaños, en rodajas","50 g de jamón cortado en cubitos","80g bolsa de espinacas","4 huevos medianos, batidos","1 cucharada de queso cheddar rallado"]','["Calienta la parrilla a su temperatura más alta. Calienta el aceite en una sartén apta para horno a fuego medio-alto. Vierta los champiñones y fríalos durante 2 minutos hasta que estén casi tiernos. Agregue el jamón y las espinacas y cocine por 1 minuto más hasta que las espinacas se ablanden. Sazone bien con pimienta negra y una pizca de sal.","Reducir el fuego y verter sobre los huevos. Cocine sin tocar durante 3 minutos hasta que los huevos estén casi cuajados. Espolvorear sobre el queso y poner bajo el grill durante 2 minutos. Servir caliente o frío."]','2026-01-11 13:10:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15547,6594,'es','Tarritos de yogur de plátano','Ideal como pudín o para el desayuno.','["1 tarrina de yogur espeso de 450 g","3-4 plátanos cortados en trozos","4 cucharadas de azúcar moreno oscuro","25 g de nueces tostadas y picadas"]','["Vierta aproximadamente 1 cucharada de yogur en el fondo de 4 vasos pequeños. Agrega una capa de plátano y luego un poco más de yogur. Repite las capas hasta llenar los vasos. Esparcir sobre el azúcar y las nueces y dejar en el frigorífico 20 minutos hasta que el azúcar se disuelva."]','2026-01-11 13:10:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15548,6596,'es','Muffins raros galeses','Haga que los niños le ayuden a preparar estos deliciosos muffins, perfectos para las loncheras','["225 g de harina con levadura","50 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de polvo para hornear","½ cucharadita rasa de bicarbonato de sodio","¼ cucharadita de sal","½ cucharadita rasa de mostaza en polvo","100 g de queso fuerte, medio rallado y medio en cubos","6 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","150 g de yogur griego","125ml de leche","1 huevo","1 cucharada de salsa inglesa"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6.","Mezcle la harina con levadura y la normal, el polvo para hornear, el bicarbonato de sodio, la sal y la mostaza en polvo en un bol.","En un bol aparte, mezcla el queso, el aceite, el yogur, la leche, el huevo y la salsa inglesa.","Combine todos los ingredientes y divídalos entre los moldes para muffins en el molde para muffins.","Colocar en el horno durante 20-25 minutos hasta que esté dorado. Retirar y enfriar un poco sobre una rejilla.","Lo que necesita: Pídale a los niños que le ayuden a preparar todo: báscula, jarra medidora, tenedor, 2 tazones para mezclar, 12 moldes de papel para muffins, molde para muffins, rallador de queso, cuchillo afilado, cucharada y rejilla para enfriar."]','2026-01-11 13:10:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15549,6598,'es','Patatas fritas con mostaza y salmón ahumado','Este brillante plato de brunch queda especialmente sensacional si se sirve con huevos escalfados.','["1 papa grande (aproximadamente 350 g/12 oz), lavada","1 cucharada de harina común","1 cucharada de mostaza integral o salsa de rábano picante","nuez de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","4 lonchas de salmón ahumado","crema agria o crème fraîche, para servir","cebollino, para servir"]','["Ralla la patata sin pelar sobre un paño de cocina limpio. Levante los bordes de la toalla y luego exprímala sobre el fregadero para eliminar el exceso de agua de las patatas. Vierta en un bol y agregue la harina y la mostaza o rábano picante. Sazone bien y mezcle.","Divide la mezcla en 8 bolas y aplana entre tus manos. Calentar una sartén grande con la mantequilla y el aceite, luego agregar la\r\npatatas a la sartén. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado, a fuego medio, hasta que estén dorados.","Coloque un par de croquetas de patata en cada plato para servir y cubra con una rodaja de salmón ahumado, una cucharada de crema agria o crème fraîche y algunas cebolletas para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:10:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15550,6600,'es','Peras crujientes con miel y nueces','Esta sencilla idea es un regalo rápido a mitad de semana para toda la familia.','["4 peras maduras","nuez de mantequilla","½ cucharadita de mezcla de especias","2 cucharadas de miel clara","50 g de copos de maíz","25 g de almendras laminadas tostadas"]','["Caliente el horno a 200 ° C / ventilador 180 ° C / gas 6. Corte las peras por la mitad a lo largo, retire el corazón (ver consejo a la izquierda) y luego cubra con una pequeña cantidad de mantequilla y una pizca de la mezcla de especias. Coloque las peras en una fuente para hornear poco profunda y luego ase durante 5 minutos hasta que comiencen a ablandarse. Mientras tanto, calienta la miel y otra nuez de mantequilla en un bol grande en el microondas durante 30 segundos. Mezcle con los copos de maíz y las nueces.","Saca las peras del horno y luego cubre con la mezcla de copos de maíz. Cocine por otros 5 minutos o hasta que los copos de maíz adquieran un color dorado intenso. Deje que se enfríe durante unos minutos (los copos de maíz vuelven a quedar crujientes a medida que se enfrían) y luego sírvalos calientes con helado."]','2026-01-11 13:10:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15551,6602,'es','Curry de yogur, garbanzos y espinacas','Sirva este curry de garbanzos ligero y cremoso con una mezcla de mitad quinua y mitad arroz para obtener más fibra y proteínas. Es saludable y bajo en grasas y calorías.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 dientes de ajo grandes, rallados","50 g de jengibre, pelado y rallado","1-2 chiles verdes (opcional; sin semillas para que no pique tanto, si lo desea), finamente picados","300 g de tomates, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","100 gramos de yogur natural","570 g de garbanzos en agua en tarro o 2 latas de 400 g de garbanzos","1 cucharadita de fenogreco seco (opcional)","320 g de hojas tiernas de espinacas","100 g de arroz basmati","100g de quinua"]','["Para hacer el arroz de quinoa, enjuaga bien el arroz y luego ponlo en una cacerola grande con la quinoa y 1,5 litros de agua hirviendo. Cocine durante 12-14 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir y reservar.","Mientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas durante 12 minutos hasta que estén suaves y ligeramente doradas. Agregue las semillas de comino, seguido del ajo, el jengibre y la mitad del chile, si lo usa. Cocine por 1 min, revolviendo continuamente para evitar que se queme el ajo.","Añade los tomates, la cúrcuma, el cilantro y una pizca grande de sal. Cocine durante unos 15 minutos hasta que los tomates se ablanden. Transfiera la mezcla a una licuadora. Agregue el yogur y mezcle hasta que quede suave, luego regrese a la sartén.","Agrega los garbanzos junto con el líquido del tarro o lata (esto ayuda a espesar la salsa y darle un acabado brillante). Llevar a fuego lento, tapar y cocinar a fuego medio durante 5-10 minutos hasta que el aceite comience a separarse en la superficie.","Agregue el fenogreco (si lo usa) y las espinacas y cocine hasta que se ablanden. Agrega un chorrito de agua si es necesario para ajustar la consistencia. Sazone al gusto y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:10:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15552,6604,'es','Jalfrezi de pollo con espinacas, arroz integral y quinoa','Disfrute de una versión saludable, baja en grasas y calorías de un pollo jalfrezi, lleno de coloridos pimientos y espinacas y servido con arroz integral y quinua.','["100 g de arroz integral","100g de quinua","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla morada, cortada en rodajas","500 g de pechuga de pollo cortada en tiras","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 cucharaditas de ajo picado","2 cucharaditas de jengibre picado","120 g de puré de tomate","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de chile de Cachemira en polvo","1 cucharadita de garam masala","3 pimientos (rojo, amarillo y verde), rebanados","200 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca","un puñado de cilantro fresco, para servir"]','["Primero prepara el arroz y la quinoa. Lave y enjuague bien el arroz integral, luego viértalo en una cacerola con agua hirviendo con sal. Reduzca el fuego y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos, luego agregue la quinua y cocine por 10 minutos más.","Mientras se cocina el arroz, calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe la cebolla hasta que se dore. Agrega las tiras de pollo y fríe hasta que se doren, luego agrega las semillas de comino, el ajo y el jengibre. Mezcle durante un minuto, luego agregue el puré de tomate, la cúrcuma, el cilantro, el chile en polvo y una pizca de sal, luego mezcle bien.","Vierta 300 ml de agua hirviendo en la mezcla de pollo con especias y cocine a fuego lento hasta que la salsa adquiera un color rojo intenso, aproximadamente 10 minutos, luego agregue el garam masala, los pimientos y las espinacas. Tape y cocine a fuego medio durante unos minutos hasta que las espinacas se ablanden pero los pimientos todavía tengan un ligero sabor. Agrega un poco de agua para ajustar la consistencia como desees. Escurrir el arroz y la quinua y servir con el pollo y el cilantro espolvoreados."]','2026-01-11 13:10:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15553,6606,'es','Guiso de panceta y judías blancas','Utilice cualquier verdura del frigorífico en este guiso rápido y bajo en calorías, con frijoles blancos y panceta. Limpia los jugos con pan crujiente, si quieres.','["150 g de tocino","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 rama de apio, finamente picada","1 zanahoria, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 latas de 400 g de judías blancas, una escurrida y otra sin escurrir (nosotros usamos cannellini y judías blancas)","500 ml de caldo de pollo","1 corteza de parmesano (opcional)","200 g de cavolo nero, hojas picadas en trozos grandes","½ cucharada de vinagre de jerez","10 g de cebollino"]','["Esparza la panceta en una cacerola honda ignífuga y cocine a fuego medio durante 5-6 minutos hasta que esté crujiente y suelte su grasa. Retirar de la sartén con una espumadera, dejando la grasa. Vierta el aceite, luego agregue la cebolla, el apio y la zanahoria. Cocine durante 12-15 minutos hasta que se dore. Agregue el ajo y cocine por 1 minuto más.","Vierta los frijoles, el caldo de pollo y la ralladura de parmesano (si se usa). Cocine durante 15 minutos a fuego medio, luego agregue el cavolo nero y la panceta cocida durante los últimos 5 minutos. Agrega el vinagre de jerez y sazona.","Divida en cuatro tazones y espolvoree con cebollino para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:10:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15554,6608,'es','Ensalada cajún de gambas y maíz carbonizado','Inspírate en los sabores Tex-Mex con esta ensalada, salpicada de langostinos, maíz dulce y chiles jalapeños. Es ideal para una barbacoa o una cena ligera.','["200 g de granos de maíz dulce frescos","150 g de langostinos crudos, pelados y desvenados","½ cucharada de mezcla de especias cajún","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol","1 lima, exprimida","1 cucharadita de miel","1 jalapeño, finamente picado (opcional)","1 pimiento rojo, finamente picado","1 aguacate, pelado, partido por la mitad, sin hueso y finamente picado","3 cebolletas, finamente picadas","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, finamente picado","1 lechuga romana, picada"]','["Calienta una sartén seca a fuego medio-alto y cocina el maíz dulce por unos minutos sin revolver, luego agita la sartén y continúa cocinando por 5 minutos hasta que los granos se doren. Volcar sobre un plato y dejar enfriar un poco.","Combine los langostinos, la mezcla de especias cajún y una pizca de sal y pimienta en un tazón pequeño. Calienta la mitad del aceite en la misma sartén que usaste para carbonizar el maíz y cocina los langostinos a fuego medio-alto durante 2-4 minutos, revolviendo hasta que estén rosados ​​y bien cocidos. Transfiera al plato con el maíz.","Combine el jugo de lima, la miel, el aceite restante y el jalapeño picado (si lo usa) en un tazón grande y sazone bien. Agrega los pimientos rojos, el aguacate, las cebolletas, el cilantro y la lechuga, luego revuelve bien. Agregue el maíz y los langostinos y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:10:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15555,6610,'es','Tagine de bacalao y aceitunas con arroz integral','Aproveche al máximo el bacalao en este tagine aromático y delicadamente especiado que es bajo en grasas y calorías. Como otros mariscos, el bacalao es una fuente útil de yodo.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de colza","2 cebollas moradas (unos 320 g), picadas","250 g de colinabo, finamente picado","2 zanahorias (unos 200 g), finamente picadas","3 tiras de cáscara de limón, finamente picadas","4 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","300 ml de caldo de verduras, elaborado con 1½ cucharadita de caldo en polvo","12 aceitunas verdes deshuesadas, cortadas por la mitad a lo largo","250 g de arroz integral de fácil cocción","4 filetes de bacalao sin piel congelados (unos 360 g)","⅓ paquete de cilantro picado"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande a fuego medio y fríe las cebollas, el nabo, las zanahorias, la piel de limón y el ajo durante 10 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente. Agrega las especias y revuelve brevemente.","Agrega los tomates, el puré de tomate, el caldo y las aceitunas. Tape y cocine por 25 minutos.","Hervir el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. Revuelva bien la mezcla de tomate y luego agregue los filetes de bacalao congelados. Tapar y cocinar durante 20 minutos hasta que el pescado esté bien cocido. Esparcir con el cilantro. Sirva la mitad con la mitad del arroz cocido. Deje enfriar el resto del tagine y el arroz, luego manténgalos fríos hasta por tres días. Vuelva a calentar el tajín en una sartén a fuego lento hasta que esté bien caliente y vuelva a calentar el arroz en el microondas hasta que esté completamente caliente. Esta receta es parte de nuestro plan de dieta saludable gratuito de 7 días. Para acceder al plan de alimentación completo, haga clic aquí."]','2026-01-11 13:10:13');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15556,6616,'es','Filete de salmón al horno con arándanos encurtidos, perejil y pistachos','Equilibre un pescado azul, como el salmón, con arándanos encurtidos caseros. También añaden un toque divertido y navideño al plato.','["300 ml de vinagre de sidra","300 g de azúcar en polvo","340 g de arándanos frescos","½ cucharadita de clavo entero","½ cucharadita de bayas de enebro","75 g de pan rallado panko","½ cucharada de tomillo seco","2 cucharadas de zumaque","1 limón, rallado","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","1 kg de filete de salmón, deshuesado (puedes pedirle a tu pescadero que lo haga por ti)","60 g de pistachos triturados","½ manojo pequeño de perejil picado, para servir"]','["Prepare los arándanos en escabeche con una o dos semanas de anticipación. Poner el vinagre y el azúcar en una cacerola a fuego medio y llevar a ebullición. Agregue los ingredientes restantes y continúe hirviendo durante 4 minutos. Vierta la mezcla en un frasco esterilizado de 1 litro, o dos más pequeños, ciérrelo bien y déjelo enfriar. Enfriar en el frigorífico durante al menos una semana.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Tostar el pan rallado en una sartén seca durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté dorado y tostado, luego volcarlo en un plato y dejar enfriar.","Combine el pan rallado, el tomillo, el zumaque, la ralladura de limón y un poco de condimento en un tazón. Rocíe con 5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y mezcle bien.","Coloque un trozo de papel para hornear en una bandeja para hornear lo suficientemente grande como para que quepa el filete de salmón. Coloque el filete de salmón con la piel hacia abajo encima y extienda con cuidado la mezcla de la corteza sobre la parte superior del salmón. No presiones demasiado la mezcla. Rocíe con un poco más de aceite de oliva.","Hornee el salmón durante 20-25 minutos, idealmente hasta que esté recién cocido y la corteza haya adquirido un color dorado. Una vez cocido, transfiéralo a una fuente para servir y decore con los pistachos, algunos arándanos encurtidos escurridos y el perejil. Intente servir con verduras untadas con mantequilla y patatas nuevas asadas."]','2026-01-11 13:10:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15557,6618,'es','Alforfón con berenjenas tiernas carbonizadas','Aprovecha al máximo el trigo sarraceno con nuestro saludable almuerzo vegetal bajo en calorías. Berenjenas, lentejas, nueces, cebolletas, cerezas secas y queso de cabra aportan un verdadero sabor.','["350 g de berenjenas tiernas cortadas por la mitad","8 cebolletas enteras, sin la parte superior","250 g de trigo sarraceno","2 cucharadas de aceite de colza prensado en frío","1 lata de 400 g de lentejas verdes, escurridas","30 g de cerezas secas, picadas en trozos grandes","8 mitades de nueces, finamente picadas","1 limón, exprimido","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","manojo pequeño de eneldo, finamente picado","30 g de queso de cabra tierno, desmenuzado"]','["Calienta la parrilla a su temperatura más alta. Extienda las berenjenas en una bandeja para hornear, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, y cocine a la parrilla durante 10 a 15 minutos hasta que comiencen a ablandarse y formar ampollas.","Mientras tanto, calienta una sartén a fuego alto. Agregue las cebolletas y cocine por cada lado durante 5 a 6 minutos hasta que estén tiernas y carbonizadas. Retirar con unas pinzas y reservar.","Ponga a hervir una cacerola mediana con agua. Vierta el trigo sarraceno en una sartén y fríalo a fuego medio durante 3 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente tostado. Añade el trigo sarraceno al agua hirviendo y cocina durante 4-5 minutos. Escurrir y mezclar con el aceite. Dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos.","Mezcle el trigo sarraceno tibio, las lentejas, las cerezas, las nueces, el jugo de limón, la guindilla y la mayor parte del eneldo en un bol. Extiéndalo en un plato para servir y cubra con las berenjenas, las cebolletas carbonizadas, el eneldo restante y el queso de cabra."]','2026-01-11 13:10:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15558,6620,'es','Hamburguesas de cerdo y manzana','Nuestras económicas hamburguesas de cerdo y manzana son perfectas para una cena familiar fácil y deliciosa. Esta sencilla comida entre semana se prepara en solo diez minutos','["300 g de carne de salchicha","4 panes de hamburguesa integrales","4 cucharaditas de mermelada de cebolla","2 manzanas, sin corazón y en rodajas finas","2 puñados de rúcula","2 cucharaditas de mayonesa","un poco de mostaza inglesa (opcional)","gajos de camote, para servir (opcional)"]','["Divida la carne de la salchicha en cuatro porciones y forme hamburguesas. Freír en una sartén antiadherente durante 10-12 minutos, volteando un par de veces, hasta que estén dorados por ambos lados y completamente cocidos.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Corta los panecillos por la mitad y tuéstalos bajo la parrilla, con el lado cortado hacia arriba.","Unte las mitades inferiores de los panecillos tostados con mermelada, luego agregue las hamburguesas, las rodajas de manzana, la rúcula, la mayonesa y la mostaza (si se usa). Cubra con las tapas de los panecillos y sirva junto con gajos de camote, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:10:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15559,6622,'es','Pimientos rellenos de cerdo y bulgur','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Esta colorida cena para sentirse bien aporta el sabor del verano en cualquier época del año.','["4 pimientos, cortados por la mitad y sin corazón","200 g de cerdo picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 cucharadita de pimentón","50 g de trigo bulgar","250 ml de caldo de verduras","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","4 cucharadas de yogur griego 0%, para servir"]','["Coloque los pimientos, con el lado cortado hacia abajo, en un plato y cocínelos en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 4 minutos hasta que estén bien cocidos (pero no tan blandos que se colapsen). Si necesitan más tiempo, cocínelos en el microondas durante 1 minuto más y repita hasta que estén cocidos.","Pon la carne de cerdo en una sartén fría y enciende el fuego. Freír, rompiendo los grumos, hasta que empiece a dorarse. Agregue el ajo y las especias durante 1 minuto, luego agregue el bulghar y el caldo. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que el bulghar esté suave.","Calienta la parrilla. Agrega la mitad del perejil al bulghar y luego rellénalo con los pimientos en una bandeja para hornear. Ase hasta que esté crujiente, espolvoree sobre la mayor parte del perejil y luego sirva con el yogur mezclado con el perejil restante."]','2026-01-11 13:10:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15560,6624,'es','Salmón escalfado con estragón','Escalfa ligeramente los filetes de salmón y sírvelos con judías verdes cremosas y patatas tiernas para una comida ligera.','["1 limon","200 g de crema fresca semidesnatada","estragón en paquete pequeño, solo las hojas, picado","1 diente de ajo, machacado hasta obtener una pasta","400 g de judías verdes, peladas y partidas por la mitad","4 filetes de salmón","patatas tiernas cocidas, para servir"]','["Ralla el limón y córtalo en gajos. Mezclar la crema fresca, el estragón, el ajo, la ralladura de limón y un chorrito de jugo, sazonar al gusto y reservar.","Lleve una cacerola grande y poco profunda con agua con sal al tazón y cocine las judías verdes durante 3 minutos hasta que estén cocidas. Retirar con una espumadera, escurrir y enfriar con agua corriente fría antes de mezclar con la mezcla de crema fresca.","Vuelva a hervir la sartén, luego baje el fuego a fuego lento y deslice los trozos de salmón. Escalfa durante 8-10 minutos o hasta que esté cocido a tu gusto. Retirar de la sartén y poner sobre papel de cocina antes de emplatar. Sirva con las judías verdes y las patatas tiernas."]','2026-01-11 13:10:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15561,6626,'es','Dhansak de coco y calabaza','Este curry vegetariano rápido y fácil es perfecto para una cena saludable entre semana: con calabaza, leche de coco, lentejas y espinacas.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","500 g de calabaza (aproximadamente 1 calabaza pequeña), pelada y picada en trozos pequeños (o compre un paquete ya preparado para ahorrar tiempo), consulte el consejo abajo a la izquierda","100 g de cebolla picada congelada","4 cucharadas colmadas de pasta de curry suave (nosotros usamos korma)","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 400g de leche de coco light","pan mini naan, para servir","Lata de 400 g de lentejas escurridas","Bolsa de 200 g de espinacas tiernas","150 ml de yogur de coco (usamos Rachel''s Organic), más extra para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Pon la calabaza en un bol con un chorrito de agua. Cubra con film transparente y cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 10 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Mientras tanto, agregue las cebollas al aceite caliente y cocine por unos minutos hasta que estén suaves. Agregue la pasta de curry, los tomates y la leche de coco y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que espese y obtenga una salsa rica.","Calentar los panes naan a fuego lento o en la tostadora. Escurre el líquido de la calabaza y luego agrégala a la salsa con las lentejas, las espinacas y un poco de condimento. Cocine a fuego lento durante 2-3 minutos más para que las espinacas se ablanden, luego agregue el yogur de coco. Sirva con el naan tibio y una cucharada de yogur extra."]','2026-01-11 13:10:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15562,6628,'es','Estofado Somerset con puré de queso cheddar y perejil','Este calentador de invierno familiar está lleno de sabor y bondad. Adáptese para los amantes de la carne agregando salchichas.','["1 cucharada de aceite","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 zanahoria grande, finamente picada","1 puerro, picado","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","Lata de 200 g de alubias, escurridas","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes, enjuagadas y escurridas","200ml de sidra seca","250 ml de caldo de verduras","unas ramitas de tomillo, solo las hojas","puré de queso cheddar y perejil (ver consejo a continuación)","2 salchichas","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva por porción"]','["Calentar aceite en una sartén grande y sofreír la cebolla,\r\najo, zanahoria y puerro hasta que estén tiernos pero no\r\ncoloreado. Agrega el puré de tomate picado\r\ntomates, judías verdes, judías verdes,\r\nsidra, caldo y tomillo y cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n15-20 minutos hasta que el guiso se espese\r\ny las verduras quedan tiernas.","Mientras tanto, si agregas salchichas\r\na cualquier porción, corte cada salchicha en\r\n3-4 trozos. Calentar el aceite de oliva en una fritura.\r\nsartén y dorar los trozos durante 5 minutos,\r\nluego agregue porciones apropiadas de la\r\nguise y cocine a fuego lento durante el resto\r\ntiempo de cocción. Servir con el puré."]','2026-01-11 13:10:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15563,6630,'es','Korma de pollo','¿Quieres un curry sin demasiadas calorías? Utilice yogur griego sin grasa en lugar de crema para obtener un korma saludable que le permitirá competir con su comida para llevar local.','["1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, picado en trozos grandes","4 cucharadas de pasta korma","4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel, cortadas en trozos pequeños","50 g de almendras molidas, más algo extra para servir (opcional)","4 cucharadas de pasas","400 ml de caldo de pollo","¼ cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","Bote de 150g de yogur griego 0% grasa","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado"]','["Poner la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta.\r\nColoca la pasta en un recipiente grande de lados altos.\r\nsartén con 3 cucharadas de agua y cocinar durante\r\n5 minutos. Agrega la pasta de korma y cocina.\r\ndurante 2 minutos más hasta que esté aromático.","Agrega el pollo a la salsa y luego\r\nagregue las almendras molidas, las pasas, el caldo\r\ny azúcar. Dale a todo una buena mezcla,\r\nluego cubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos o\r\nhasta que el pollo esté bien cocido.","Retire la sartén del fuego, revuelva\r\nen el yogur y un poco de condimento, luego\r\nesparcir sobre el cilantro y desmenuzarlo\r\nalmendras, si las usa. Servir con marrón\r\no arroz basmati blanco."]','2026-01-11 13:10:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15564,6634,'es','Pescado y patatas fritas al horno','Dale un cambio de imagen saludable a esta combinación clásica cocinando los ingredientes en el horno en lugar de freírlos.','["880 g/ 1 lb 12 oz de papa harinosa, lavada y cortada en chips","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","50 g de pan rallado fresco","ralladura de 1 limón","2 cucharadas de perejil de hoja plana picado","4 filetes de pescado blanco sostenible de 140 g/5 oz de grosor","200g/ 7oz de tomate cherry"]','["Calentar el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7.\r\nSeque las patatas fritas con palmaditas sobre papel de cocina y luego colóquelas\r\nen una sola capa sobre una bandeja para hornear grande.\r\nRociar con la mitad del aceite de oliva y sazonar.\r\ncon sal. Cocine por 40 minutos, volteando\r\ndespués de 20 minutos, para que se cocinen uniformemente.","Mezclar el pan rallado con el limón.\r\nralladura y perejil, luego sazone bien. arriba\r\nel bacalao repartido con el pan rallado\r\nmezcla, luego rocíe con el resto\r\naceite. Poner en una fuente para asar con la cereza.\r\ntomates, luego hornee en el horno por la\r\nLos últimos 10 minutos del tiempo de cocción de las patatas fritas."]','2026-01-11 13:10:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15565,6636,'es','Rico bowl de mariscos al pimentón','Comer sano no se trata sólo de ensalada, este guiso de pescado cuenta como 3 de tus 5 al día y es bajo en grasas','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 tallos de apio, finamente picados","manojo grande de perejil de hoja plana, hojas y tallos separados","2-3 cucharaditas de pimentón","200 g de pimientos rojos asados, peso escurrido y en rodajas gruesas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados con ajo","400 g de filete de pescado blanco cortado en trozos muy grandes","unos mejillones frescos (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén, luego agrega la cebolla,\r\napio y un poco de sal. Cubrir y sofreír suavemente\r\nhasta que esté suave, unos 10 minutos. poner el perejil\r\ntallos, la mitad de las hojas, aceite y condimentos en\r\nun procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta. Añadir\r\nesto y el pimentón a las cebollas blandas,\r\nfreír durante unos minutos. Vierta los pimientos y\r\ntomates con un chorrito de agua, luego cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que la salsa se haya reducido.","Coloque el pescado y los mejillones encima\r\nsalsa, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 5 minutos\r\nhasta que el pescado esté apenas desmenuzado y los mejillones\r\nse han abierto: deseche los que permanezcan cerrados.\r\nIncorpora suavemente los mariscos a la salsa.\r\nsazone y luego sirva en tazones."]','2026-01-11 13:10:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15566,6640,'es','Bacalao con tomate y tomillo','Listo en 20 minutos y bajo en grasas, este plato de pescado es ideal para un lunes por la noche cuando prefieres estar en el sofá que en la cocina.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita colmada de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","unas ramitas de tomillo, sin hojas","1 cucharada de salsa de soja","4 bacalao, filetes (nos gusta No Catch) u otro pescado blanco hojaldrado, como abadejo"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén, añadir la cebolla y freír durante 5-8 minutos hasta que se dore ligeramente. Agregue los tomates, el azúcar, el tomillo y la soja y luego deje hervir.","Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos y luego agregue el bacalao a la salsa. Tape y cocine suavemente durante 8-10 minutos hasta que el bacalao se desmenuce fácilmente.\r\nServir con patatas al horno o al vapor."]','2026-01-11 13:10:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15567,6645,'es','Verduras mediterráneas con cordero','Una olla llena de verduras y cordero tierno que mantendrá satisfecha a toda la familia','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","250 g de filete de cordero magro, sin grasa y en rodajas finas","140 g de chalotes, cortados por la mitad","2 calabacines grandes, cortados en trozos","½ cucharadita de comino molido, pimentón y cilantro molido","1 pimiento rojo, 1 naranja y 1 verde, cortados en trozos","1 diente de ajo, rebanado","150 ml de caldo de verduras","250 g de tomates cherry","un puñado de hojas de cilantro, picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta el aceite en una olla grande de base pesada.\r\nsartén. Cocer el cordero y las chalotas.\r\na fuego alto durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté dorado.\r\nAñade los calabacines y sofríe durante\r\n3-4 minutos hasta que comience a ablandarse.","Agrega las especias y revuelve bien, luego agrega\r\nlos pimientos y el ajo. reducir el calor\r\ny cocinar a fuego moderado durante\r\n4-5 minutos hasta que empiecen a ablandarse.","Vierta el caldo y revuelva para cubrir. Añadir\r\nlos tomates, sazonar y luego cubrir con\r\ntapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos, revolviendo\r\nde vez en cuando hasta que las verduras estén tiernas.\r\nRevuelva el cilantro para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:10:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15568,6647,'es','Strogonoff de hongos','Algunas sustituciones inteligentes pueden hacer que esta cazuela cremosa tradicional sea baja en grasas y calorías.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, finamente picada","1 cucharada de pimentón","2 dientes de ajo machacados","300 g de champiñones variados, picados","150 ml de caldo de ternera o de verduras bajo en sodio","1 cucharada de salsa inglesa o alternativa vegetariana","3 cucharadas de crema agria media grasa","manojo pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","Bolsa de 250 g de arroz salvaje cocido"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande.\r\nsartén y ablandar la cebolla durante aproximadamente\r\n5 minutos. Agrega el ajo y el pimentón, luego\r\ncocine por 1 min más. Agregar champiñones\r\ny cocine a fuego alto, revolviendo con frecuencia,\r\ndurante unos 5 minutos.","Vierta el caldo y Worcestershire.\r\nsalsa. Llevar a ebullición, burbujear durante 5 minutos.\r\nhasta que la salsa espese, luego apague la\r\ncalentar y revolver con la crema agria y\r\nla mayor parte del perejil. Asegúrese de que la sartén esté\r\nno al fuego o la salsa podría partirse.","Caliente el arroz siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete.\r\nluego revuelva con el perejil restante\r\ny servir con el stroganoff."]','2026-01-11 13:10:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15569,6649,'es','Tortitas de salmón y brócoli con ensalada de berros, aguacate y tomate','Aumente el factor bienestar con estos pasteles de salmón llenos de vegetales, servidos con una ensalada fresca','["500 g de patatas cortadas en trozos","85 g de brócoli, cortado en floretes pequeños","paquete de 2 filetes de salmón escalfados","jugo de 1 limón, más gajos para servir","manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cucharada de mostaza Dijon","1 aguacate, pelado, sin hueso y picado en trozos grandes","100 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","Bolsa de 100g de berros"]','["Cubrir las patatas con agua con sal,\r\nllevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento durante\r\n8-10 minutos, hasta que estén tiernos, agregando el\r\nbrócoli 3 minutos antes del final de la cocción\r\ntiempo. Escurrir, dejar secar todo al vapor,\r\nluego triture aproximadamente. Desmenuzar el salmón,\r\nagregue la mitad del jugo de limón y eneldo con un poco\r\nSazone y luego forme 4 pasteles.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén y sofreír los\r\nhornee durante 3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén dorados.\r\nMientras tanto, mezcle el jugo de limón restante.\r\ncon la mostaza y el condimento, luego\r\ndejar de lado. Mezclar el aguacate, los tomates.\r\ny berros y dividir entre\r\nplatos. Sirva un pastel de pescado con cada uno\r\nla ensalada, rociada con aderezo y\r\nrodajas de limón adicionales para exprimir."]','2026-01-11 13:10:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15570,6651,'es','Paquetes de pescado al vapor y pak choi','Simplemente agregue arroz al vapor para disfrutar de una comida llena de sabor y baja en calorías.','["4 filetes de solla, eglefino u otro pescado blanco certificado por el MSC","2 pak choi, en rodajas gruesas","4 cebolletas, ralladas","1 chile rojo, en rodajas finas","3 cm de jengibre cortado en palitos","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja reducida en sal","jugo 1 lima","1 cucharadita de aceite de sésamo"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nColoque cada filete en el centro de una fuente grande.\r\ncuadrado de papel de aluminio. Cubra con el pak choi,\r\ncebolletas, chile y jengibre, luego retire\r\nhasta los bordes del papel de aluminio.","Mezclar la salsa de soja, el jugo de lima.\r\ny 1 cucharada de agua y luego vierta un poco\r\nsobre cada filete. Engarce la parte superior del papel de aluminio.\r\nencerrar el pescado y asegurarse de que\r\nNo hay espacios para que escape el vapor.","Coloca los paquetes en una bandeja para hornear.\r\ny hornear durante 10-15 minutos hasta que el pescado\r\nesté bien cocido (esto dependerá de\r\nel grosor de su pescado). Abre el\r\npaquetes y rociar sobre unas gotas de\r\naceite de sésamo. Servir con arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:10:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15571,6653,'es','Sopa de pimiento rojo asado con picatostes crujientes','Caliéntate en las noches más frías con esta vibrante sopa, condimentada con chile en polvo picante y harissa. Los picatostes crujientes son opcionales pero añaden un toque crujiente satisfactorio.','["2 cebollas moradas, picadas en trozos grandes","2 zanahorias (250 g), picadas en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo, picados en trozos grandes","200 g de pimientos rojos asados ​​en frasco (peso escurrido), escurridos y picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de pasta de harissa de rosas","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo de Cachemira (o cualquier otro chile en polvo)","850 ml de caldo de verduras bajo en sal","4 cucharadas de yogur natural, para servir","100 g de pan crujiente integral ligeramente duro cortado en cubos","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva"]','["Mezcle las cebollas y las zanahorias en un procesador de alimentos hasta que estén finamente picadas, o pique finamente a mano. Si haces los picatostes, calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 6.","Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande a fuego medio y cocina la cebolla y la zanahoria picadas con una pizca de sal durante 5-6 minutos, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que empiecen a ablandarse. Agregue el ajo y los pimientos y cocine por 1 minuto más hasta que estén fragantes.","Agregue la pasta de harissa, las semillas de comino y el chile en polvo y cocine por 1 minuto, revolviendo. Agrega el caldo y sube el fuego a medio-alto, deja que hierva y cocina durante 15-18 minutos hasta que las verduras estén suaves.","Mientras tanto, si prepara los picatostes, mezcle el pan con el aceite y sazone bien. Vierta sobre una bandeja para hornear y hornee durante 8 a 10 minutos hasta que esté muy dorado y crujiente.","Transfiera la mezcla de verduras a una licuadora de alta potencia (o use una batidora de mano) y mezcle hasta que quede suave. Sazone y sirva en tazones. Cubra con el yogur y esparza sobre los picatostes, si los usa."]','2026-01-11 13:10:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15572,6655,'es','Tazones de sushi de sésamo y jengibre','Este almuerzo vegano para llevar está lleno de bondades y utiliza arroz integral rico en fibra y frijoles edamame ricos en proteínas con un picante aderezo de tamari y sésamo.','["25 g de jengibre (elija un trozo recto y bastante fino), pelado","4 cucharadas de vinagre de sidra de manzana crudo, más 1 cucharada","200 g de arroz basmati integral","320 g de frijoles edamame congelados","1½-2 cucharadas de tamari","2 aguacates, deshuesados ​​y rebanados","1 zanahoria grande, rallada en palitos largos o rallada gruesa","50 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","¼ de pepino, rebanado","2 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo","3 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo tostadas"]','["Corta el jengibre lo más fino que puedas para hacer rodajas finas como una oblea o tritúralo finamente. Poner en un bol con las 4 cucharadas de vinagre y 1 cucharada de agua y masajear brevemente para que se ablanden. Dejar de lado.","Pon el arroz en una cacerola mediana y añade 600 ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición, tapar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos. Agregue los frijoles edamame, pero no los revuelva, luego cubra y cocine por 7 minutos más. El arroz debe estar tierno y haber absorbido toda el agua.","Retire los frijoles del arroz y reserve. Vierta 1 cucharada de vinagre y ½ cucharada de tamari en el arroz y revuelva bien. Vierta en un plato y extiéndalo para que se enfríe rápidamente. Una vez frío, vierta en cuatro tazones o loncheras. Cubra con el aguacate, la zanahoria, los frijoles, los tomates y el pepino.","Vierta el jengibre del vinagre y esparza encima. Agrega el tamari restante y el aceite de sésamo al vinagre. Vierta sobre el tazón de sushi y espolvoree con las semillas. Se conservará en el frigorífico dos días."]','2026-01-11 13:10:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15573,6657,'es','Ensalada asiática de gambas y quinoa','Esta ensalada fresca son 3 de tus 5 al día. Con una picante lima y un toque picante de chile, también es una excelente introducción a la quinua si no la has probado antes.','["60g de quinua","150 g de gambas cocidas sin cáscara","1 aguacate pequeño, sin hueso y en rodajas","¼ de pepino, partido por la mitad y en rodajas","50 g de berros","100 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","ralladura fina y jugo de 1 lima grande","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","2 cebolletas, peladas y finamente picadas","1 cucharadita de tamari sin trigo","un puñado de cilantro picado","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","½ cucharadita de jarabe de arce"]','["Hervir la quinua en una cacerola pequeña durante 15 minutos hasta que los granos estén tiernos y parezcan reventados. Escurrir bien y verter en un bol. Mientras tanto, prepara el aderezo: mezcla la ralladura y el jugo de lima y la guindilla en un bol.","Agrega la mitad del aderezo a la quinua con las cebolletas, el tamari y la mitad del cilantro. Agregue todas las verduras para ensalada y luego sirva en dos platos para servir.","Agrega el aceite y el jarabe de arce al aderezo restante y agrega las gambas. Vierta sobre la ensalada de quinua y esparza sobre el cilantro para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:10:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15574,6659,'es','Ensalada Niçoise de huevo','Una ensalada Niçoise vegetariana, repleta de bondades: fibra, ácido fólico, hierro, vitamina C y sin gluten','["2 cucharadas de aceite de colza","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico","1 diente de ajo rallado","? paquete pequeño de albahaca, hojas picadas","3 aceitunas kalamata negras deshuesadas, enjuagadas y picadas","2 huevos","250 g de patatas nuevas, en rodajas gruesas","200 g de judías verdes finas","½ cebolla morada, muy finamente picada","14 tomates cherry, cortados por la mitad","6 hojas de lechuga romana, cortadas en trozos pequeños","6 aceitunas kalamata negras deshuesadas, enjuagadas y partidas por la mitad"]','["Mezcle los ingredientes del aderezo en un tazón pequeño con 1 cucharada de agua.","Mientras tanto, hierva las patatas durante 7 minutos, agregue los frijoles y hierva 5 minutos más o hasta que ambos estén tiernos, luego escurra. Hervir 2 huevos durante 8 minutos, luego pelarlos y cortarlos por la mitad.","Mezcle los frijoles, las papas y el resto de los ingredientes de la ensalada, excepto los huevos, en un tazón grande con la mitad del aderezo. Coloque los huevos encima y rocíe con el aderezo restante."]','2026-01-11 13:10:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15575,6661,'es','Ensalada satay de pollo','Marine las pechugas de pollo y luego rocíelas con una potente salsa satay de maní para disfrutar de una comida sencilla entre semana, rica en proteínas y con mucho sabor.','["1 cucharada de tamari","1 cucharadita de curry en polvo mediano","¼ cucharadita de comino molido","1 diente de ajo, finamente rallado","1 cucharadita de miel clara","2 filetes de pechuga de pollo sin piel (o use pechuga de pavo)","1 cucharada de mantequilla de maní crujiente (elija una versión sin azúcar y sin aceite de palma, si es posible)","1 cucharada de salsa de chile dulce","1 cucharada de jugo de lima","un poco de aceite de girasol, para limpiar la sartén","2 corazones de lechuga Little Gem, cortados en gajos","¼ de pepino, partido por la mitad y en rodajas","1 chalote de plátano, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas","un puñado generoso de cilantro picado","semillas de ½ granada"]','["Vierta el tamari en un plato grande y agregue el curry en polvo, el comino, el ajo y la miel.\r\nMezclar bien. Corta las pechugas de pollo por la mitad horizontalmente para hacer 4 filetes en total, luego agrégalas a la marinada y mezcla bien para cubrirlas. Reserva en el frigorífico durante al menos 1 hora, o toda la noche, para permitir que los sabores penetren en el pollo.","Mientras tanto, mezcle la mantequilla de maní con la salsa de chile, el jugo de limón y 1 cucharada de agua para hacer una salsa que se pueda tomar con una cucharada. Cuando esté listo para cocinar el pollo, limpie una sartén antiadherente grande con un poco de aceite. Agrega el pollo y cocina, tapado, durante 5-6 minutos a fuego medio, volteando los filetes durante el último minuto, hasta que estén cocidos pero aún húmedos. Reservar, tapado, reposar unos minutos.","Mientras el pollo reposa, mezcle los trozos de lechuga con el pepino, la chalota, el cilantro y la granada y apílelos en platos. Vierta un poco de salsa. Corta el pollo en rodajas, apílalo encima de la ensalada y vierte sobre la salsa restante. Cómelo mientras el pollo aún esté caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:10:39');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15576,6663,'es','Bollos de eneldo con salsa de salmón ahumado y pepino','Los bollos salados son una excelente alternativa a los panecillos de hamburguesa o bagels.','["200 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","200 g de harina integral","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","Paquete de 20 g de eneldo, la mitad finamente picado","50g de mantequilla sin sal, muy fría y cortada en cubitos","300 ml de leche tibia y un poco más para el cepillado","1 cucharadita de semillas de amapola","Paquete de 200 g de lonchas de salmón ahumado y paquete de 300 g de queso tierno, para servir","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo","100 ml de vinagre de vino de arroz","1 pepino grande, pelado","media cebolla morada, en rodajas muy finas","1 chile rojo suave, sin semillas y finamente picado (opcional)"]','["Para los bollos, caliente el horno a 230C/210C ventilador/gas 8 y enharine ligeramente una bandeja para hornear. Mezclar las harinas, el bicarbonato, el eneldo picado y 1 cucharadita de sal fina en un bol grande, luego frotar con la mantequilla hasta que desaparezca. Vierta la leche y revuelva brevemente hasta obtener una masa pegajosa.","Raspa la masa sobre una superficie enharinada, espolvorea la masa y tus manos con más harina, luego dobla la masa 2 o 3 veces para suavizar un poco. Forma una ronda de 4 cm de profundidad. Utilice un cortador de 7 cm para cortar los bollos (consulte el consejo a continuación). Presione los recortes juntos y repita. Unte con leche, espolvoree con semillas de amapola y luego hornee durante 15 a 18 minutos o hasta que estén dorados y bien leudados. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla. Como ocurre con todos los bollos, es mejor comerlos ese mismo día.","Para el pepinillo, agregue el azúcar al vinagre hasta que se disuelva. Corte el pepino por la mitad y quítele las semillas, córtelo en rodajas gruesas y luego mezcle con el vinagre, la cebolla y el chile. Dejar reposar al menos 15 minutos en el frigorífico. Se puede realizar con hasta 24 horas de anticipación. Cuando esté listo para servir, corte el eneldo restante sobre la salsa. Divida los bollos, úntelos con queso tierno y cubra con una cinta de salmón y un poco de condimento."]','2026-01-11 13:10:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15577,6665,'es','Frittata de patatas, cebolleta, eneldo y queso','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. El almuerzo de verano perfecto y sin estrés. Para una opción no vegetariana, añade un par de lonchas de jamón.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","400 g de patatas nuevas cocidas sobrantes, en rodajas","4 huevos batidos","4 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","1 manojo de eneldo, picado en trozos grandes","25 g de queso cheddar rallado"]','["En una sartén pequeña antiadherente calentar\r\naceite a fuego medio. Agrega las patatas,\r\nluego freír hasta que empiece a estar crujiente, aproximadamente\r\n8 minutos. En un bol, bata los huevos,\r\ncebolletas, eneldo y algún condimento.\r\nCalienta la parrilla.","Vierta los huevos en una sartén, mezcle rápidamente,\r\nbaje el fuego y luego espolvoree\r\nqueso. Después de unos 8 minutos, una vez que la parte superior\r\nEl lado casi está listo, colóquelo debajo de la parrilla.\r\ndurante 2-3 minutos o hasta que esté firme y dorado.\r\nDeslizar fuera de la sartén. Cómelo de inmediato con mayonesa o salsa de tomate o déjalo enfriar rápidamente."]','2026-01-11 13:10:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15578,6667,'es','Ensalada de salmón ahumado, lentejas y granada','Sin cocinar, sin esfuerzo, pero no te perderás el sabor de esta vibrante cena para dos','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","jugo ½ limón","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de estragón picado en trozos grandes","1 cucharadita de miel clara","1 cebolla morada pequeña, en rodajas finas","Lata de 400 g de lentejas Puy, enjuagadas y escurridas","140 g de salmón ahumado en caliente","Paquete de 20 g de perejil de hoja plana, hojas recogidas","1 granada, sin semillas","pan pita tostado, para servir"]','["Combine el aceite, el jugo de limón, el ajo,\r\nestragón y miel en un tazón grande y\r\ntemporada. Agregue la cebolla morada y las lentejas.\r\ny dejar marinar durante 10 minutos.","Partir el salmón en hojuelas grandes y\r\nincorporar a la ensalada con el perejil y\r\ngranada. Sirva con pita tostada."]','2026-01-11 13:10:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15579,6669,'es','Fresh tuna tortillas','Un ganador completo: vitamina D, omega 3 y 1 de tus 5 al día, incluso es sencillo de preparar.','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","2 filetes de atún grandes","pizca de pimienta de cayena","1 cucharadita de comino molido","4 tortillas suaves","1 aguacate, en rodajas","2 tomates, rebanados","jugo 1 lima","un puñado de cilantro picado","crema agria, para servir (opcional)"]','["Frote aceite sobre cada filete y luego espolvoree con\r\nlas especias. Calienta una sartén hasta que esté caliente, luego\r\nCocine los filetes por un lado durante 2 minutos. girar\r\ny cocine por 1-2 minutos más. Cortar en tiras.","Calienta las tortillas durante 30 segundos en el microondas.\r\nhasta que esté suave. Montón de atún, aguacate y tomates.\r\nencima de cada uno, luego exprime sobre la lima\r\njugo y espolvorear con cilantro. cucharada agria\r\nCrema encima, si quieres, luego enrolla y come."]','2026-01-11 13:10:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15580,6671,'es','Sopa de batata y lentejas','La sopa casera, satisfactoria y sencilla de preparar, es una excelente cena o almuerzo para llevar al trabajo.','["2 cucharaditas de curry en polvo mediano","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas ralladas","1 manzana para comer, pelada, sin corazón y rallada","3 dientes de ajo machacados","Paquete de 20 g de cilantro, tallos picados","Un trozo del tamaño de un pulgar de raíz de jengibre fresco, rallado.","800 g de batatas","1,2 l de caldo de verduras","100 g de lentejas rojas","300ml de leche","jugo 1 lima"]','["Ponga el curry en polvo en una cacerola grande.\r\ncacerola, luego tuesta a fuego medio\r\ncalentar durante 2 minutos. Agrega el aceite de oliva, revolviendo\r\nmientras la especia chisporrotea en la sartén. Consejo en el\r\ncebolla, manzana, ajo, tallos de cilantro y\r\njengibre, sazone y luego cocine suavemente durante\r\n5 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Mientras tanto, pelar y rallar el dulce.\r\npatatas. Vierta en la sartén con el caldo,\r\nlentejas, leche y condimentos, luego cocine a fuego lento,\r\ntapado, durante 20 min. Licue hasta que quede suave\r\nusando una batidora de mano. Agregue el jugo de lima,\r\ncomprobar la sazón y servir, cubierto\r\ncon hojas de cilantro picadas."]','2026-01-11 13:10:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15581,6673,'es','envolturas hoisin','Prepare esta versión deliciosa y saludable de un wrap de pato pekinés para un refrigerio rápido o un almuerzo sabroso.','["200 g de pavo o pollo cocido, cortado en tiras","4 cucharadas de salsa hoisin","2 tortillas de harina","¼ de pepino, sin semillas y rallado","4 cebolletas, cortadas y finamente ralladas","buen puñado de berros"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Mezcle el pavo o el pollo con la mitad de la salsa hoisin para que quede cubierto, luego extiéndalo sobre\r\nuna fuente refractaria y cocine a la parrilla hasta que chisporrotee. Calienta las tortillas debajo de la parrilla o según las instrucciones del paquete.","Unta las tortillas con el resto de la salsa hoisin, luego úsala para envolver el pavo o el pollo con el pepino, la cebolla y los berros. Córtelo por la mitad y disfrútelo mientras aún está caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:10:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15582,6675,'es','Ensalada de fideos con gambas y chile dulce','Esta ensalada baja en grasa es ideal para un picnic, una lonchera o incluso un buffet.','["3 nidos de fideos al huevo medianos","½ pepino grande","manojo de cebolletas, cortadas finamente","100 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","1 chile verde, sin semillas, finamente picado","200 g de langostinos cocidos, descongelados si están congelados","ralladura y jugo de 2 limas","4 cucharadas de salsa de chile dulce","100 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca","25 g de anacardos tostados"]','["Hervir los fideos durante 4 minutos y luego escurrirlos.\r\nEnfriar con agua corriente y luego escurrir.\r\notra vez. Poner en un tazón grande, luego usar\r\ntijeras, cortadas en trozos más cortos.","Cortar el pepino por la mitad a lo largo y luego\r\nsaca las semillas. Cortar en medias lunas\r\ny añadir a los fideos con el\r\ncebollas, tomates, guindilla y gambas.","Mezcle la ralladura de lima, el jugo y la salsa de chile para\r\nhaga un aderezo y doble los fideos.\r\nPon un puñado de espinacas en cada porción.\r\nplato, cubra con los fideos y los anacardos."]','2026-01-11 13:10:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15583,6677,'es','Ensalada de verduras asadas y cuscús','Prepare una abundante y fragante ensalada de cuscús para un almuerzo vegetariano o duplíquela para un buffet.','["1 pimiento rojo y 1 amarillo, cortados por la mitad y sin semillas","½ calabaza","2 calabacines, en rodajas gruesas","4 dientes de ajo, dejar la piel","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 cebolla morada, en rodajas gruesas","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharada de pasta de harissa","50 g de almendras enteras blanqueadas","250 g de cuscús","300 ml de caldo de verduras caliente","ralladura y jugo de 1 limón","Paquete de 20 g de menta, picada en trozos grandes"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Cortar\r\npimientos y calabaza en trozos pequeños\r\n(dejar la piel de la calabaza). Dale propina a todas las verduras\r\nen una bandeja para hornear, agregue el ajo, 2 cucharadas de aceite\r\ny sazonar, luego mezclar y asar durante 20 minutos.\r\nAgrega la cebolla, el comino, la harissa y las almendras.\r\nAse durante otros 20 minutos y luego enfríe.","Ponga el cuscús en un bol grande, vierta\r\nsobre el caldo, tapar y reservar para\r\n10 minutos. Revuelva con un tenedor.","En un bol, mezcle la ralladura, el jugo y el resto.\r\naceite. Exprima la pulpa de ajo de la piel al\r\nen un tazón, triture bien y agregue la menta. verter\r\nsobre las verduras y luego mezcle con el cuscús."]','2026-01-11 13:10:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15584,6679,'es','Estofado de ternera ahumado','Disfrute de este guiso sencillo para la cena y luego empaquételo en cajas para que pueda seguir adelante durante el almuerzo.','["1 kg de ternera para guisar, cortada en trozos grandes","2 cebollas picadas","800 g (2 latas) de tomates picados","2 cucharaditas de pimentón dulce, comino molido y chile suave en polvo","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto o blanco","2 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo","Lata de 400 g de alubias, enjuagadas y escurridas"]','["Precalentar el horno a 160C/\r\nVentilador/gas 140C 3. Mezcle el\r\ncarne de res, cebollas, tomates,\r\nespecias, vinagre y azúcar en\r\nuna cazuela. Cubrir y\r\nhornee por 2½ hrs. Agregue el\r\nfrijoles y hornear por 30 minutos\r\nmás (con la tapa abierta si el\r\nla cazuela está un poco mojada o\r\ntapa puesta si tiene buena consistencia),\r\nhasta que la carne esté tierna.","Dejar enfriar y luego congelar\r\n6-8 porciones en comida pequeña\r\nbolsas o recipientes de plástico.\r\nDescongelar en microondas o\r\ntoda la noche en el frigorífico, luego\r\ncalor por la mañana y\r\ntransferir a un termo\r\nrecipiente o calentar en el\r\nmicroondas a la hora del almuerzo."]','2026-01-11 13:10:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15585,6681,'es','Guiso rápido de albóndigas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Sirva albóndigas de res en una cazuela de tomate con ajo y romero y cómelas con pasta o pan crujiente.','["2 patatas medianas, peladas y cortadas en cubos pequeños","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","250 g de albóndigas magras de ternera pequeñas","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cucharada de romero picado","Tarro de puré de 560ml","200 g de guisantes congelados","unas cuantas virutas de parmesano para servir (opcional)"]','["Hervir las patatas durante 10 minutos hasta que estén tiernas.\r\nMientras tanto, calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande.\r\nSazone las albóndigas y luego dórelas todas.\r\ndurante unos 5 minutos. Retirar de la sartén,\r\nescurrir el exceso de grasa, luego agregar la cebolla,\r\najo y romero. Freír suavemente durante 5 minutos.","Agregue la passata a la sartén, cocine a fuego lento,\r\nluego agrega las albóndigas. Cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos\r\no hasta que todo esté bien cocido. Añadir\r\nlas patatas y los guisantes, luego cocine a fuego lento durante\r\n1 min. Empacar en un matraz o recalentar en el trabajo,\r\nagregue parmesano, si lo usa, y cómelo con buena\r\npan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:10:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15586,6683,'es','Tazón de hamburguesa','Inspírate con la tendencia popular de una hamburguesa deconstruida y baja en carbohidratos sin pan. Siéntete libre de cambiar los ingredientes: los champiñones fritos también funcionan bien','["2 patatas grandes, cortadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cucharadas de mezcla de especias cajún","1 cucharadita de ajo granulado (opcional)","250 g de carne picada magra","25 g de pepinillos encurtidos cortados arrugados, más 1 cucharada de salmuera del frasco","1 lechuga iceberg, rallada","1 cebolla morada, cortada finamente en aros y enjuagada con agua fría, si lo deseas (esto reducirá el fuerte sabor a cebolla cruda)","150 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","50 g de queso cheddar rallado","3 cucharadas de ketchup bajo en azúcar","2 cucharadas de mayonesa ligera","½ cucharada de mostaza americana"]','["Caliente la freidora o el horno a 220C/200C/gas 7. Coloque las patatas en la freidora o el horno, rocíe 1 cucharada de aceite vegetal, 1 cucharada de la mezcla de especias cajún, los gránulos de ajo (si se usa) y sazone. Cocine durante 20 minutos, agitando hasta la mitad, o hasta que estén crujientes y bien cocidos.","Cuando a las patatas les falten unos 10 minutos, calienta la cucharada de aceite restante en una sartén a fuego medio-alto. Una vez que brille, vierte la carne picada en la sartén y usa una espátula para romperla. Espolvoree sobre la cucharada restante de la mezcla de especias cajún y sazone. Cocine durante 7-8 minutos, o hasta que estén crujientes y bien cocidos.","Divida las patatas en cuatro tazones, luego cubra con pepinillos, lechuga, cebolla morada, tomates cherry, carne picada y un poco de queso.","Mezcle el ketchup, la mayonesa, la mostaza y la salmuera de pepinillos en un tazón pequeño, luego rocíe sobre los tazones para hamburguesas y mézclelos."]','2026-01-11 13:10:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15587,6685,'es','Chuletas de cerdo con queso y cebolla','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Disfrute de la carne de cerdo británica con queso Cheshire derretido y un toque de mostaza inglesa.','["4 chuletas de cerdo","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de mostaza inglesa","4 cucharadas de cebolla caramelizada, de un frasco","50 g de queso Cheshire rallado","1 cucharadita de tomillo, picado"]','["Caliente la parrilla a fuego alto, luego coloque las chuletas en una sartén, frótelas con aceite y sazone. Ase durante unos 6 minutos por cada lado, hasta que estén dorados.","Unte un poco de mostaza sobre un lado de cada chuleta y luego cubra con 1 cucharada de cebolla. Mezcle el queso y el tomillo, espolvoree sobre las chuletas y luego cocine a la parrilla hasta que estén doradas y burbujeantes."]','2026-01-11 13:10:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15588,6687,'es','Solomillo de ternera asado y salsa de Oporto','Sirva un espectacular solomillo de ternera este domingo, para una cena asada que no olvidará','["3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharadas de hojas de tomillo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1½ -2 kg/3 lb 5 oz-4 lb 8 oz trozo de solomillo de ternera enrollado","1 diente de ajo","1 hoja de laurel","unas ramitas de tomillo","Puerto de 75 ml","350 ml de vino tinto","200 ml de caldo de carne (si prefieres que tu salsa no contenga alcohol, simplemente duplica la cantidad de caldo)"]','["Para la carne, mezcla el ajo, el tomillo y el aceite de oliva con un poco de pimienta negra. Frote sobre la carne y déjela durante al menos 1 hora, cuanto más tiempo mejor. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6, sazonar la carne con sal y colocar en una fuente para asar. Ase en el horno durante 30 minutos, luego baje el fuego a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y cocine durante 10-15 minutos por 450 g, dependiendo de cómo le guste la carne: 10 minutos por 450 g le dará carne poco hecha y 15 minutos le dará carne bien cocida.","Cuando la carne esté cocida, sácala de la fuente para asar y déjala reposar en algún lugar cálido, envuelta sin apretar en papel de aluminio, durante 30 minutos. Retirar y reservar el jugo restante.","Para hacer la salsa, coloque la fuente para asar a fuego alto con el ajo, el laurel y el tomillo. Vierta el Oporto, raspe con una cuchara de madera para soltar los restos de la lata y burbujee hasta que se reduzca casi por completo. Vierta el vino tinto y reduzca a tres cuartos antes de agregar el caldo. Llevar a ebullición y sazonar al gusto. Vierta los jugos restantes reservados nuevamente en la lata. Finalmente, vierte la salsa a través de un colador en una jarra tibia. Cortar la carne y servir con la salsa."]','2026-01-11 13:10:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15589,6691,'es','Abadejo curado con crema de eneldo y ensalada de rábanos','El elegante entrante de marisco al estilo escandinavo de Tom Kerridge, similar al plato de salmón gravadlax, seguramente impresionará en cualquier cena.','["100 g de sal marina gruesa","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharadas de semillas de hinojo","1 paquete pequeño de eneldo, picado","400 g de filete de abadejo sin piel (ver ''Consejo'')","500 ml de aceite de colza","140 g de crema fresca entera","pimienta de cayena, para sazonar","½ paquete pequeño de eneldo, picado","ralladura fina de 1 limón","300 g de rábanos (nosotros usamos rábanos de desayuno francés)","1 cucharada de tarasalada","jugo ½ limón","½ paquete de cebollino, cortado en tiras","¼ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","pan integral tostado, para servir"]','["Mezcle la sal, el azúcar, las semillas de hinojo y el eneldo en un bol. Forre un plato grande con film transparente y cúbralo con la mitad de la mezcla de sal. Ponga encima el filete de abadejo y cúbralo con el resto de la mezcla de sal. Coloque el film transparente por encima y cubra el pescado por completo. Pon el pescado en el frigorífico y déjalo curar durante al menos 8 horas o toda la noche. Pasado este tiempo, el pescado estará muy firme y con sabor salado. Lavar la sal, poner el pescado en un plato grande, cubrir completamente con agua fría y dejar en remojo durante 30 minutos. Escurrir y secar con papel de cocina.","Calentar el horno a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2. Poner el pescado en una fuente refractaria o en una fuente para asar. Vierta el aceite de colza sobre el pescado y cubra el molde con una hoja de papel de aluminio, ciérrelo por los bordes y cocine en el horno durante 25 minutos. Retirar del horno y dejar cubierto con papel de aluminio hasta que sea necesario para servir. Se puede preparar con varias horas de anticipación y dejar reposar a temperatura ambiente.","Batir la crème fraîche en un bol con una pizca de sal y cayena durante 2-3 minutos hasta que espese como una nata cuajada. Incorpora el eneldo picado y la ralladura de limón. Cubrir con film transparente y reservar en el frigorífico hasta que se necesite.","Lavar los rábanos y cortarlos por la mitad a lo largo. Poner la taramasalata y el jugo de limón en un bol y batir. Retire el abadejo del aceite (consulte el consejo a continuación), escúrralo sobre papel de cocina para eliminar el exceso de aceite y luego desmenuce el pescado en un plato grande para servir. Agregue 3-4 cucharadas de aceite de cocina a la taramasalata y mezcle. Agrega los rábanos, las cebolletas y el pimentón ahumado al aderezo y dóblalo todo junto, asegurándote de que los rábanos queden bien cubiertos. Servir el pescado caliente con el eneldo, la nata y la ensalada de rábanos. El pan integral tostado también combina muy bien con esto."]','2026-01-11 13:10:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15590,6693,'es','Tazas de lechuga cóctel de gambas y cangrejo','Sirva mariscos en una fuente para compartir y deje que todos preparen sus propios bocados de cóctel de gambas para un entrante o canapé perfecto para una cena.','["4 cucharadas de mayonesa","3 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","2 cucharaditas de salsa inglesa","jugo y ralladura de 1 limón","pizca de cayena","4 tomates, sin semillas y finamente picados","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","1½ cucharada de Tabasco","3 lechugas Little Gem, con las hojas separadas","300g de gambas cocidas y peladas (nosotros utilizamos una mezcla de langostinos y langostinos pequeños del Atlántico Norte)","200 g de carne de cangrejo blanco","½ manojo de cebollino, cortado en tiras","rodajas de limón, para servir (opcional)"]','["Mezclar todos los ingredientes para la salsa Marie Rose y reservar en el frigorífico. Haz lo mismo con los ingredientes de la salsa de tomate. Se pueden enfriar hasta por 24 horas.","Coloque las hojas de lechuga, las gambas, el cangrejo y el cebollino en recipientes separados. Pon todo sobre la mesa con un montón de rodajas de limón.","En la mesa, agregue algunas gambas y cangrejo a las hojas de lechuga, vierta un poco de salsa de tomate y salsa Marie Rose y esparza algunas cebolletas. apretar\r\nun poco de jugo de limón, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:10:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15591,6695,'es','Tarta de polenta y champiñones','Este bonito plato principal vegetariano está hecho con polenta con queso de cocción rápida cubierta con champiñones, mozzarella, rúcula y vinagre balsámico.','["25 g de mantequilla, más algo extra para engrasar","850 ml de caldo de verduras","200 g de polenta de cocción rápida","50 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), rallado","2 ramitas de romero, hojas finamente picadas","500 g de champiñones castaños cortados por la mitad","manojo pequeño de tomillo, solo las hojas","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","125 g de mozzarella en bolas, escurrida","gran puñado de cohetes","1 cucharadita de vinagre balsámico"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nEngrase y forre una bandeja para hornear grande con\r\npergamino para hornear. Llevar el stock al\r\nhervir en una cacerola grande, luego verter lentamente\r\nen la polenta, batiendo todo el tiempo. traer\r\nLlevar a ebullición y burbujear durante 8 minutos, batiendo.\r\ncontinuamente. Retirar del fuego y revolver.\r\nen el queso, la mantequilla, el romero y abundante\r\nde condimento. Extender la polenta sobre\r\nbandeja forrada y hornee por 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcla los champiñones con el tomillo y un poco de condimento. Calentar un chorrito de aceite en una sartén grande y sofreír las setas en un par de tandas hasta que estén doradas. Corta la mozzarella en trozos y sécala con papel de cocina. Cubra la polenta horneada con los champiñones y la mozzarella, luego hornee nuevamente durante 10 minutos o hasta que el queso se derrita y burbujee. Esparcir la rúcula sobre la tarta y rociar con vinagre balsámico."]','2026-01-11 13:10:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15592,6697,'es','La berenjena se derrite','Elija una berenjena rellenita y brillante para preparar este cálido plato principal vegetariano.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 berenjenas, partidas por la mitad a lo largo","4 tomates","1 bola de mozzarella de 150 g, escurrida","un puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Rociar el aceite sobre la berenjena y hornear en el horno durante 25 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Mientras tanto, corte los tomates y la mozzarella y colóquelos encima de la berenjena. Regrese al horno por otros 5 minutos o hasta que el queso se derrita. Esparcir por encima unas hojas de albahaca. Servir con cuscús y ensalada verde."]','2026-01-11 13:10:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15593,6699,'es','Caldo tailandés de pollo y champiñones','Una receta ideal para poner en práctica tu paladar tailandés','["1 litro de caldo de pollo caliente","1 cucharada de pasta de curry rojo tailandés","1 cucharada de salsa de pescado tailandesa","2 cucharaditas de azúcar","ralladura y jugo de 2 limas","100 g de champiñones portobello, en rodajas","manojo de cebolletas, en rodajas, las claras y las hojas verdes separadas","200 g de pollo sobrante, desmenuzado"]','["Vierta el caldo en una cacerola y luego revuelva.\r\nen pasta de curry, salsa de pescado, azúcar, lima\r\njugo y la mayor parte de la ralladura. llevar a la\r\nhervir, luego agregar los champiñones y las claras.\r\nde la cebolleta. Cubra y cocine a fuego lento\r\ndurante 2 min.","Agregue el pollo y la mayor parte\r\nde las hojas de cebollino para calentar suavemente\r\nluego servir servido en tazones y\r\nespolvoreado con la ralladura de lima restante. Sirva con jugo de limón adicional, azúcar y salsa de pescado al lado para que todos puedan ajustar sus propios tazones."]','2026-01-11 13:10:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15594,6701,'es','Frittata de gambas y chorizo','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. ¿Nunca has probado mariscos con chorizo ​​picante? Pruébalo en esta sencilla cena para dos','["½ cebolla, finamente picada","50 g de chorizo, en rodajas","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","4 huevos, ligeramente batidos","1 cucharada de leche","85 g de gambas cocidas y peladas","100 g de guisantes congelados y descongelados","ensalada de hojas, para servir"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio. En una fritura de 20cm\r\nsartén, sofreír la cebolla y el chorizo en el aceite\r\na fuego lento. Cocine durante 4-5 minutos,\r\nrevolviendo ocasionalmente hasta que la cebolla esté suave.","Retirar la cacerola del fuego, verter\r\ncualquier exceso de grasa del chorizo, luego revuelva\r\nen los huevos batidos y la leche con un poco\r\ncondimento. Agregue las gambas y los guisantes.\r\ny volver a fuego lento durante 10-12 min.\r\nhasta que todo menos la parte superior de la frittata esté\r\nconjunto. Destella bajo la parrilla hasta que esté dorado.\r\n(mantenga el mango alejado del calor).\r\nSirva en gajos con una ensalada de hojas."]','2026-01-11 13:10:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15595,6703,'es','tortilla de ensalada griega','Una cena rápida y saludable','["10 huevos","un puñado de hojas de perejil picado (opcional)","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla morada grande, cortada en gajos","3 tomates, picados en trozos grandes","un puñado grande de aceitunas negras (las deshuesadas son más fáciles de comer)","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Batir los huevos en un bol grande con el perejil picado, pimienta y sal, si quieres. Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande, luego fríe los gajos de cebolla a fuego alto durante unos 4 minutos hasta que empiecen a dorarse por los bordes. Agregue los tomates y las aceitunas y cocine durante 1-2 minutos hasta que los tomates comiencen a ablandarse.","Baja el fuego a medio y vierte los huevos. Cocine los huevos en la sartén, revolviéndolos a medida que comienzan a cuajar, hasta que estén medio cocidos, pero todavía líquidos en algunos lugares, aproximadamente 2 minutos. Distribuya sobre el queso feta y luego coloque la sartén debajo de la parrilla durante 5 a 6 minutos hasta que la tortilla esté inflada y dorada. Cortar en gajos y servir directamente de la sartén."]','2026-01-11 13:10:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15596,6705,'es','salmón asado','Cocinar lados enteros de salmón como centro de mesa es una forma sociable y especial de comer.','["1 salmón de 2 kg/4 lb 8 oz, fileteado para tener dos lados, con piel","1 limón, en rodajas","un buen puñado de hierbas mixtas como perejil, eneldo, perifollo o estragón","2 hojas de laurel","1-2 chalotes, en rodajas finas","chorrito de vino blanco"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Siéntate\r\nuno de los filetes de salmón, con la piel hacia abajo,\r\nen una hoja grande de papel de aluminio o papel para hornear.\r\nEsparcir con las rodajas de limón, las hierbas,\r\nchalotes y condimentos, luego sentar\r\nsegundo filete encima, con la piel hacia arriba. Atar\r\n2-3 lugares con cuerda para asegurar, salpicar\r\ncon vino y doblar el papel de aluminio o papel para\r\nsello. Se puede enfriar hasta por 3 horas.","Colóquelo en una bandeja para hornear y hornee por\r\n50 minutos-1 hora hasta que el salmón esté cocido\r\na través – verifíquelo metiendo un cuchillo en\r\nlos filetes y asegurándose de que la pulpa\r\nse desmenuza fácilmente. Sirva en papel de aluminio o papel\r\nun plato para servir, o levante con cuidado usando un\r\nun par de rodajas de pescado. Cortar en porciones y\r\nservir con la mayonesa de limón y cebollino y\r\nPatatas nuevas ''Lyonnaise'' (ver recetas ''Marida bien'') y medio cocidas al vapor\r\nbrócoli (ver más abajo)."]','2026-01-11 13:10:50');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15597,6707,'es','Bacalao con tocino, lechuga y guisantes','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una buena fuente de folato y fibra, esta saludable cena de pescado también contiene dos de los cinco al día.','["2 cucharaditas de aceite de girasol","2 lonchas de tocino ahumado rayado sin corteza, cortado en trozos pequeños","1 chalota larga o cebolla pequeña, cortada en rodajas muy finas","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 filetes de bacalao sin piel de 140 g/5 oz de grosor","140 g de guisantes congelados","200ml de caldo de pollo, fresco o elaborado con ½ cubito","2 lechugas Little Gem, finamente ralladas","2 cucharadas de crema fresca media grasa","2 rebanadas gruesas de pan integral crujiente, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite de girasol a fuego medio.\r\nsartén antiadherente. Agrega el tocino,\r\nchalota o cebolla y ajo. Cocine suavemente,\r\nrevolviendo, durante 2 minutos, luego empuje a uno\r\nlado de la sartén.","Sazona el bacalao con negro molido.\r\npimienta. Freír en la sartén durante 2 minutos, luego\r\ndale la vuelta. Añade los guisantes y el caldo y\r\nllevar a fuego lento. Cocine a fuego medio\r\ncalentar durante 2 minutos más, luego agregar el\r\nlechuga y crema fresca. cocinar por un\r\nun par de minutos más, revolviendo las verduras\r\nDe vez en cuando, hasta que el pescado esté recién cocido.\r\ny la lechuga se ha marchitado. Servir con\r\npan para absorber el caldo."]','2026-01-11 13:10:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15598,6709,'es','Abadejo en salsa de tomate y albahaca','Una cena de pescado deliciosamente sencilla y baja en grasas','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","1 berenjena pequeña, de unos 250 g/9 oz, picada en trozos grandes","½ cucharadita de pimentón molido","2 dientes de ajo machacados","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 cucharadita de azúcar mascabado oscuro o claro","8 hojas grandes de albahaca, más algunas extra para espolvorear","4 filetes de pescado blanco firmes y sin piel de 4x175 g/6 oz, como eglefino"]','["Calentar el aceite de oliva en una sartén antiadherente grande y sofreír la cebolla y la berenjena. Después de aproximadamente 4 minutos, las verduras comenzarán a dorarse, pero aún no estarán blandas, así que cúbralas con una tapa y deje que las verduras se frían al vapor en su propio jugo durante 6 minutos; esto ayuda a que se ablanden sin necesidad de agregar aceite adicional.","Agregue el pimentón, el ajo,\r\ntomates y azúcar con 1?2 cucharadita\r\nsal y cocine por otros 8-10\r\nminutos, revolviendo, hasta que la cebolla\r\ny la berenjena quedan tiernas.","Esparcir las hojas de albahaca\r\nluego coloque el pescado en el\r\nsalsa, tapar la sartén y cocinar\r\ndurante 6-8 minutos hasta que el pescado\r\nse desmenuza cuando se prueba con un cuchillo\r\ny la carne es firme pero aún\r\nhúmedo. Desgarro sobre el resto del\r\nalbahaca y servir con ensalada\r\ny pan crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:10:51');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15599,6713,'es','mejillones de goa','Puedes agregar cualquier otro marisco a este rápido y aromático curry verde: las gambas pueden ir con la leche de coco y las almejas con los mejillones.','["1 kg de mejillones frescos","aceite de girasol, para freír","1 cebolla, picada","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, rallado","4 dientes de ajo machacados","2 chiles verdes, picados","1 cucharadita de semilla de mostaza negra","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","400 ml de leche de coco","ramitas de cilantro, para servir","gajos de lima, para servir"]','["Retire las barbas, luego lave la\r\nbien los mejillones en agua fría. Actualizar el\r\nagua y repetir hasta que quede claro. Descartar\r\ncualquier mejillón que esté roto o quede\r\nabierto cuando se toca.","Calentar el aceite en una cazuela resistente al fuego.\r\nFreír la cebolla hasta que esté muy ligeramente dorada,\r\nluego agregue el jengibre, el ajo, los chiles,\r\nespecias, una buena pizca de sal y una pizca\r\nde pimienta. Cocine durante 2-3 minutos hasta que esté fragante.\r\ny tostado. Vierta la leche de coco y\r\nllevar a ebullición y luego cocinar a fuego lento durante unos\r\nminutos para mezclar todo.","Vierta los mejillones en la fuente, tápelos,\r\nSube el fuego al máximo y hierve.\r\ndurante 3-4 minutos hasta que los mejillones hayan\r\nRecién abierto. Esparcir sobre el cilantro\r\nramitas y servir con rodajas de lima\r\npara apretar."]','2026-01-11 13:10:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15600,6715,'es','carne de ajo','Un corte de carne barato transformado en un tierno manjar','["1 cucharada de pimienta negra","6 dientes de ajo","4 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","Pieza de 600 g de falda de ternera bien cortada"]','["En un mortero triturar los granos de pimienta.\r\ny el ajo con una pizca de sal hasta tener\r\nhasta obtener una pasta suave y luego agregue el vinagre.\r\nColoque la carne en un plato no metálico y luego frótela.\r\ntodo con la pasta. dejar en la nevera\r\ndurante unas horas, pero ya no.","Para cocinar, coloque una plancha sobre una superficie muy\r\ncalor caliente. Frote la marinada de la carne,\r\nluego sazona con un poco más de sal. cocinar\r\ncarne hasta que se queme por cada lado – aproximadamente 5\r\nminutos a cada lado para que estén poco hechos; si el corte es muy\r\nde espesor, es posible que desees asarlo en un horno caliente.\r\ndurante 5 minutos después de dorar. Levante sobre una picadora\r\ntabla, luego descanse durante 5 minutos antes de tallar\r\nen rodajas y sirva con patatas fritas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:10:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15601,6717,'es','Salsa de caballero y huevos revueltos','Gentleman''s Relish es una pasta de anchoas salada clásica: es un excelente compañero para huevos revueltos con mantequilla.','["25 g de mantequilla blanda, más un poco más para los huevos","2 cucharaditas de condimento para caballeros","4 huevos","4 rebanadas de pan integral tostado","1 cucharadita de perejil de hoja plana picado"]','["Batir la mantequilla y el Gentleman''s Relish con una cuchara de madera hasta que estén bien mezclados. Batir ligeramente los huevos y sazonar con pimienta, pero sin sal. Derrita una nuez de mantequilla en una sartén y agregue los huevos. Déjalos cocinar por unos segundos, luego revuelve, todavía sobre el fuego, hasta que estén revueltos y cremosos.","Cuando los huevos aún no estén cocidos, retírelos del fuego y agregue otra nuez generosa de mantequilla. (Este es un truco útil si también vas a preparar huevos revueltos para el desayuno: agregar mantequilla extra, o una cucharada de crema, baja la temperatura y significa que los huevos no se cocinarán demasiado en el camino a la mesa). Unte con mantequilla las tostadas con mantequilla con sabor a Gentleman''s Relish y cubra con los huevos. Cortar en dedos, espolvorear un poco de perejil y servir enseguida."]','2026-01-11 13:10:52');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15602,6719,'es','Barras de granola con canela y frutos rojos','Estas barras de granola son ideales para loncheras, desayunos para llevar o simplemente con una taza de café.','["100 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","200 g de gachas de avena","100 g de semillas de girasol","50 g de semillas de sésamo","50 g de nueces picadas","3 cucharadas de miel","100 g de azúcar mascabado light","1 cucharadita de canela molida","100 g de arándanos, cerezas o arándanos secos, o una mezcla"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3. Untar con mantequilla y forrar la base de un molde de 18 x 25 cm. Mezcle la avena, las semillas y las nueces en una fuente para asar, luego póngala en el horno durante 5 a 10 minutos para que se tuesten.","Mientras tanto, calienta la mantequilla, la miel y el azúcar en una sartén, revolviendo hasta que la mantequilla se derrita. Agrega la mezcla de avena, la canela y los frutos secos, luego mezcla hasta que toda la avena esté bien cubierta. Vierta en el molde, presione ligeramente y luego hornee por 30 minutos. Dejar enfriar en lata y luego cortar en 12 barras."]','2026-01-11 13:10:53');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15603,6721,'es','Frittata de queso de cabra, guisantes y judías','Esta receta es excelente para una cena de reserva, ya que probablemente encontrarás todos los ingredientes en tu refrigerador.','["300 g de mezcla de guisantes y frijoles congelados","8 huevos grandes","chorrito de leche","100 g de queso de cabra en troncos, de esos con corteza, o utilizar queso feta","1-2 cucharadas de menta picada","un poco de aceite"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego medio. hervir los guisantes\r\ny los frijoles durante 4 minutos hasta que estén tiernos,\r\nluego escurrir bien. Batir los huevos con un\r\nchorrito de leche y un poco de condimento. rebanada\r\n4 lonchas finas y redondas de queso de cabra (te\r\nuse aproximadamente la mitad del tronco), pique o\r\ndesmenuza el resto en pedazos, luego revuelve esto\r\nen los huevos con las verduras y la menta.","Engrase ligeramente una fuente poco profunda apta para horno y colóquela al fuego. Vierta la mezcla de huevo y cocine suavemente en la placa durante 8-10 minutos hasta que quede un poco de mezcla sin endurecer en la superficie. Cubra con las rebanadas de queso de cabra, luego póngalo debajo de la parrilla y cocine hasta que cuaje, esté dorado y el queso burbujee."]','2026-01-11 13:10:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15604,6723,'es','Gachas de manzana y linaza','Comience el día de la manera correcta con un desayuno con avena repleto de nutrientes, lleno de fibra beneficiosa para el estómago y excelente para la digestión.','["100 g de gachas de avena","2 manzanas para comer, peladas y ralladas","½ cucharadita de canela molida, más un poco más para espolvorear","500ml de leche desnatada","2 cucharadas de linaza molida","Bote de 150ml de yogur probiótico","un chorrito de miel o sirope de agave"]','["En una cacerola mediana, mezcle la avena,\r\nmanzanas, canela y leche. traer a\r\nhervir, revolviendo ocasionalmente, luego voltee\r\nbajar el fuego y cocinar durante 4-5 minutos,\r\nrevolviendo constantemente.","Agregue las semillas de lino molidas, luego\r\ndividir en 4 tazones de desayuno. Cubra cada uno\r\ncon un chorrito de yogur, un chorrito de\r\nmiel o jarabe de agave y una pizca\r\nmás canela."]','2026-01-11 13:10:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15605,6725,'es','Barras de desayuno para llevar','¿No hay tiempo para desayunar? Ahorre tiempo y dinero: haga sus propias barras de desayuno','["100 g de mantequilla","3 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","85 g de azúcar demerara","140 g de avena avena","½ cucharadita de canela molida","50 g de coco rallado","2 cucharadas de semillas de lino, ligeramente trituradas","1 cucharada de semillas de sésamo","100 g de avellanas picadas"]','["Caliente el horno a 160 ° C / ventilador 140 ° C / gas 3. Unte con mantequilla un molde para hornear cuadrado de 22 cm. Derretir la mantequilla, el almíbar y el azúcar en una sartén. Vierta la avena, la canela, el coco, las semillas y las nueces, mezcle y vierta en el molde. Hornee durante 30-35 minutos. Dejar enfriar durante 5 minutos y luego cortar en rodajas. Se conservará durante 1 semana en un recipiente hermético."]','2026-01-11 13:10:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15606,6727,'es','delicia tropical','Empieza el día con un muesli de frutas y frutos secos','["250 g de avena gigante","50 g de coco rallado","25 g de azúcar mascabado oscuro","50 g de semillas de calabaza","100 g de mezcla de nueces de Brasil picadas y anacardos crudos enteros","Paquete de 250 g de frutas tropicales listas para comer","yogur, arándanos frescos, plátano en rodajas y miel para servir (opcional)"]','["Precalentar el horno a 200C/Gas\r\n6/horno ventilado 180C. Ponle avena, coco,\r\nazúcar y semillas de calabaza en una gran\r\nbandeja para hornear con lados, idealmente antiadherente.\r\nIncorporar el azúcar y desmenuzar.\r\nHaga grumos con los dedos y luego agregue las nueces.","Hornee por 15 minutos, revolviendo\r\ncada 5 minutos, hasta que comience el azúcar\r\nhasta que se derrita y las nueces se tuesten ligeramente.\r\nVierta en un bol grande y déjelo enfriar.","Cortar trozos del tamaño de un bocado\r\nfrutas tropicales a la mezcla. servir\r\ncon leche fría, yogur y fruta","Almacenar hasta por 2 meses, herméticamente."]','2026-01-11 13:10:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15607,6729,'es','Barritas de frutas, avena y semillas','Una versión sabrosa de los flapjacks con una deliciosa capa de albaricoques en su interior','["140 g de azúcar mascabado light","3 cucharadas de almíbar dorado","140 g de mantequilla","250 g de copos de avena","85 g de pasas o pasas","85 g de nueces en trozos (o use sus nueces favoritas, picadas en trozos grandes)","50 g de sésamo o semillas mixtas","25 g de arándanos secos","50 g de albaricoques listos para comer, finamente picados"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/ventilador 140C/gas 3.\r\nCalentar suavemente el azúcar, el almíbar dorado.\r\ny mantequilla en una sartén hasta que el azúcar y\r\nLa mantequilla se ha derretido. Revuelve la avena,\r\npasas, nueces, semillas y arándanos\r\nen la sartén hasta que esté cubierto de mantequilla.","Vierta la mitad de la mezcla de avena en una bandeja para hornear.\r\nhojalata (23 x 23 cm o más o menos). dispersión\r\nlos albaricoques por encima, luego cubra con\r\nel resto de la mezcla de avena. Empaca la mezcla\r\nabajo bien y suave con la espalda\r\nde una cuchara de metal. Hornear por 35 minutos\r\no hasta que esté dorado oscuro. dejar enfriar\r\ncompletamente antes de cortar en 16 barras\r\ncon un cuchillo afilado."]','2026-01-11 13:10:56');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15608,6731,'es','Ensalada de bistec a la parrilla con aderezo de rábano picante','Una colorida ensalada de tomate ameniza esta rápida y saludable cena de filete de ternera magro marinado con salsa de mostaza picante.','["250 g/9 oz de bavette o filete de falda","1 cucharadita de semillas de apio, trituradas","1 cucharada de salsa inglesa","un poco de aceite de oliva, para cepillar","6 palitos de apio, en rodajas finas, las hojas reservadas","200 g de tomates mixtos, en rodajas o partidos por la mitad (el filete de ternera, el de ciruela y el de cereza roja y amarilla son buenos)","1 cucharada de salsa inglesa","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cucharadita de salsa de rábano picante","1 cucharadita de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharadita de puré de tomate"]','["Frote el filete por ambos lados con el\r\nsemillas de apio trituradas, un poco de condimento\r\ny la salsa inglesa. cepillo\r\ncon aceite de oliva y dejar macerar mientras\r\ntú preparas la ensalada.","Mezclar los ingredientes del aderezo en un pequeño\r\ncuenco. Divida el apio y los tomates.\r\nentre 2 platos. Calentar una plancha\r\na fuego alto, luego cocinar la carne\r\ndurante 2-3 minutos por cada lado (dependiendo\r\ndependiendo del grosor de los filetes). Quitar\r\nRetirar del fuego y dejar reposar tapado.\r\ncon papel de aluminio, durante 5 min.","Cortar los filetes y colocar encima.\r\nde las ensaladas, vierta el aderezo\r\ny esparcir sobre las hojas de apio."]','2026-01-11 13:10:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15609,6733,'es','Gambas al ajillo con lentejas puy asiáticas','No descartes las lentejas demasiado rápido: son abundantes, saludables y fáciles de combinar con otros sabores, como lo demuestra este plato.','["400 g de langostinos tigre crudos y pelados, descongelados si están congelados","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y finamente picados","ralladura y jugo de 1 lima","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","2 cucharadas de aceite","200 g de lentejas del Puy","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja","1 cucharada de miel clara","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino de arroz","3 cucharadas de semillas de sésamo, tostadas","manojo de cilantro, hojas picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Coloca las gambas en un plato llano. Mezclar\r\njuntos la mitad del chile finamente picado, la lima\r\nralladura y jugo, ajo y aceite, luego verter\r\nlos langostinos. Cubra y enfríe durante 20 minutos para\r\nmarinar.","Mientras tanto, poner las lentejas en una sartén, tapar\r\ncon el doble de su profundidad en el agua, llevar al\r\nhierva, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 15-20 minutos hasta que\r\ntierno. Rellene el agua si es necesario.","Para hacer el aderezo, poner el resto\r\nguindilla picada, la soja, la miel y el vinagre\r\nen un tazón pequeño y revuelva. Escurrir el\r\nlentejas, luego viértalas en un tazón grande. Vierta sobre\r\ncasi todo el aliño mientras las lentejas están\r\ncaliente, agregue las semillas de sésamo y luego mezcle bien.","Calienta una sartén hasta que esté muy caliente. Levante el\r\nSaque los langostinos de la marinada y fríalos durante 1-2\r\nminutos por cada lado hasta que estén rosados y ligeramente dorados.\r\nVierta la marinada y lleve a ebullición.\r\nDoblar el cilantro picado a través del\r\nlentejas, luego vierta en platos para servir. arriba\r\ncon las gambas y el jugo de la sartén."]','2026-01-11 13:10:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15610,6738,'es','Pescado al vapor con jengibre y cebolleta','Adopte un enfoque asiático para cocinar bajo en grasa: cocine pescado al vapor con pak choi, mirin, ajo y soja y sírvalo cubierto con cilantro.','["100 g de pak choi","4 x 150g filetes de pescado blanco firme","5 cm de jengibre finamente rallado","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja baja en sal","1 cucharadita de vino de arroz mirin","1 manojo de cebolletas, finamente ralladas","un puñado de cilantro picado","arroz integral, para servir","1 lima, cortada en gajos, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nCorta un rectángulo grande de papel de aluminio, lo suficientemente grande\r\npara hacer un sobre grande. Coloque el paquete\r\nchoi en el papel de aluminio, seguido del pescado, luego\r\nel jengibre y el ajo. Vierta sobre la soja\r\nsalsa y vino de arroz, luego sazonar.","Doble el papel de aluminio y selle los 3 bordes, luego\r\nponer en una bandeja para hornear. Cocine por 20 minutos,\r\nabrir el paquete y esparcirlo por el\r\ncebolletas y cilantro. Servir con\r\narroz integral y jugo de lima exprimido."]','2026-01-11 13:10:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15611,6740,'es','Estofado de ternera picada y boniato','La carne picada magra económica es una excelente base para una abundante cazuela familiar: sirva esta receta en una sola olla con verduras de temporada','["1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla grande, picada","1 zanahoria grande, picada","1 rama de apio, en rodajas","500 g de carne magra picada","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 cucharada de ketchup de champiñones","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","450 g de batatas, peladas y cortadas en trozos grandes","unas ramitas de tomillo","1 hoja de laurel","un puñado de perejil picado","Repollo de Saboya, para servir"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande, agregar el\r\ncebolla, zanahoria y apio, y sudor\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave. Agrega la carne\r\ny cocine hasta que se dore por completo.","Agrega el puré de tomate y cocina por\r\nunos minutos, luego agregue los champiñones\r\nsalsa de tomate, tomates, batatas,\r\nhierbas y una lata llena de agua. Temporada\r\nbien y llevar a ebullición.","Cocine a fuego lento durante 40-45 minutos.\r\nhasta que los boniatos estén tiernos,\r\nrevolviendo unas cuantas veces durante la cocción\r\npara asegurarse de que se cocinen de manera uniforme.","Una vez cocido retirar la hoja de laurel,\r\nrevuelva con el perejil picado y\r\nservir con repollo."]','2026-01-11 13:10:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15612,6742,'es','Bandeja oriental de salmón y brócoli','Cinco ingredientes es todo lo que necesitas para crear este plato de pescado con sabor asiático, verduras saludables y limón fresco.','["4 filetes de salmón con piel","1 cabeza de brócoli, partida en floretes","jugo de ½ limón, ½ limón cortado en cuartos","manojo pequeño de cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","2 cucharadas de salsa de soja"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nColoque el salmón en una fuente grande para asar,\r\ndejando espacio entre cada filete.","Lavar y escurrir el brócoli y, mientras\r\ntodavía un poco mojado, colocar en la bandeja alrededor\r\nlos filetes. Vierta el jugo de limón\r\ntodo, luego agrega los cuartos de limón.","Cubra con la mitad de las cebolletas, rocíe\r\ncon un poco de aceite de oliva y meter al horno\r\ndurante 14 min. Retirar del horno,\r\nespolvorea todo con la soja, luego\r\nRegrese al horno por 4 minutos más hasta que\r\nel salmón está bien cocido. espolvorear\r\ncon las cebolletas restantes solo\r\nantes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:10:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15613,6744,'es','Puré de camote y chipotle','Como alternativa al reconfortante puré clásico, pruebe asar batatas y triturarlas con pasta de chile ahumado picante.','["4 batatas grandes, aproximadamente 1 kg/2 lb 4 oz","1 cucharada de pasta de chipotle","125 ml de nata agria","25 g de mantequilla"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nPoner las patatas en el horno y asar.\r\ndurante 50 minutos hasta que esté tierno al perforarlo\r\ncon un cuchillo. Quitar la piel, poner la\r\npulpa en un tazón y triture hasta que quede suave.","Agrega la pasta de chipotle, la crema agria.\r\ny mantequilla, y mezclar bien. Sazone al gusto."]','2026-01-11 13:10:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15614,6746,'es','horneado mexicano','Asalta tu despensa y prueba esta nueva idea de frijoles enlatados con especias para fajitas: cubre con tortillas y queso.','["2 latas de 400 g de frijoles negros, escurridos y enjuagados","35 g de condimento para fajitas en sobre de tu elección","2 latas de 400g de tomates picados con guindilla","6 tortillas","140 g de queso Monterey Jack o cheddar rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nCalentar una sartén antiadherente, añadir el negro\r\nmezcla de frijoles y especias para fajitas, revuelva y\r\ncocine por 1-2 minutos. Añade los tomates y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos.","Corta las tortillas por la mitad. Engrase ligeramente un\r\nFuente para horno de 2 litros. Distribuya un tercio de la\r\nmezcla de frijoles sobre la base del plato,\r\nseguido de 3 cucharadas de queso y una\r\ncapa de tortillas. Repita el proceso,\r\nterminando con una capa de tortilla encima.\r\nEspolvorea sobre el queso restante.\r\nHornee por 15 minutos hasta que esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15615,6748,'es','Guiso de pollo, judías mantequilla y pimientos','Utilice legumbres de despensa y sabrosos muslos de pollo en esta saludable cazuela con sabor a pimentón, pimientos y tomate.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 ramas de apio, picadas","1 pimiento amarillo, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","1 pimiento rojo, sin semillas y cortado en cubitos","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharadas de pimentón","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","150 ml de caldo de pollo","2 latas de 400 g de alubias, escurridas y enjuagadas","8 muslos de pollo sin piel"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nCalentar el aceite en una olla grande a prueba de fuego.\r\ncazuela. Agrega la cebolla, el apio\r\ny los pimientos y sofreír durante 5 minutos. Añadir\r\nel ajo y el pimentón y cocinar durante\r\nOtros 3 minutos.","Agregue los tomates, el caldo y la mantequilla.\r\nfrijoles y sazone bien. Llevar a ebullición,\r\nluego coloque los muslos de pollo en el\r\nsalsa. Cubra con una tapa hermética y\r\nmeter al horno durante 45 min."]','2026-01-11 13:11:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15616,6750,'es','Pollo marroquí con puré de boniato','El pollo tierno y fragante y el puré cremoso de batata son una comida reconfortante y baja en grasas entre semana.','["1 kg de batatas, en cubos","2 cucharaditas de ras-el-hanout o una mezcla de canela molida y comino","4 pechugas de pollo deshuesadas y sin piel","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, en rodajas finas","1 diente de ajo gordo, machacado","200 ml de caldo de pollo","2 cucharaditas de miel clara","jugo ½ limón","un puñado de aceitunas verdes, sin hueso o enteras","Paquete de 20 g de cilantro, hojas picadas"]','["Hervir las patatas en agua con sal durante\r\n15 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Mezclar el ras el\r\nhanout con condimento, luego espolvoree todo\r\nsobre el pollo. Calentar 1 cucharada de aceite en grandes\r\nsartén, luego dore el pollo por\r\n3 minutos por cada lado hasta que estén doradas.","Saca el pollo de la sartén. Añade el\r\ncebolla y ajo y cocine por 5 minutos hasta que\r\nsuavizado. Agrega el caldo, la miel, el limón.\r\njugo y aceitunas, regresar el pollo a la\r\nsartén, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que\r\nla salsa esté almibarada y el pollo cocido.","Triturar las patatas con 1 cucharada de aceite y\r\ntemporada. Cortar en rodajas gruesas cada pechuga de pollo.\r\ny revuelva el cilantro con la salsa.\r\nSirve el pollo y la salsa sobre puré."]','2026-01-11 13:11:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15617,6752,'es','Pollo pisto asado','Una receta clásica de pollo que hará que la multitud vuelva por más.','["1 cebolla, cortada en gajos","2 pimientos rojos, sin semillas y cortados en trozos","1 calabacín, cortado en trozos","1 berenjena pequeña, cortada en trozos","4 tomates, partidos por la mitad","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más un poco más para rociar","4 pechugas de pollo, con piel","unas ramitas de romero (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Colocar \r\ntodas las verduras y los tomates en una \r\nfuente para asar poco profunda. Vierta sobre el aceite de oliva \r\ny darle todo una buena mezcla hasta que \r\nbien recubierto (las manos son más fáciles para esto).","Coloque las pechugas de pollo, con la piel hacia arriba, \r\nencima de las verduras y agregue un poco \r\nramitas de romero, si las usa. Sazona todo \r\ncon sal y pimienta negra y rociar un poco \r\naceite sobre el pollo. Ase durante unos 35 minutos. \r\nhasta que las verduras estén suaves y el pollo \r\nes dorado. Rocíe con aceite antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15618,6754,'es','Pasta integral con brócoli y almendras','Los espaguetis marrones te mantienen lleno por más tiempo: combínalos con verduras saludables aromatizadas con ajo, chile y limón.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y en rodajas (agregue chile extra si lo desea)","3 dientes de ajo, en rodajas finas","250 g de espaguetis integrales","300 g de brócoli de tallo fino, cortado en trozos","ralladura de 1 limón","25 g de almendras tostadas en láminas","virutas de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), para servir"]','["Lleve una cacerola grande con agua con sal a la\r\nhervir. Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite de oliva en un\r\nsartén grande. Agrega la guindilla y el ajo,\r\ny cocinar a fuego lento hasta que esté dorado.\r\nRetirar del fuego.","Agrega la pasta al agua y cocina.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete. en la final\r\n4 mins de cocción, agrega el brócoli.\r\nUna vez cocido, escurrir y verter en el ajo.\r\nsartén. Agrega la ralladura de limón y las almendras,\r\ny mezclar bien. Servir en tazones,\r\ncubierto con virutas de parmesano."]','2026-01-11 13:11:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15619,6756,'es','Frijoles griegos con cordero braseado','Cocine frijoles o "gigantes" con tomates, cebolla y ajo y sirva con filete de cordero tierno y queso feta desmenuzado.','["500 g de filete de cordero","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","3 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","manojo pequeño de eneldo, la mayor parte picado","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","500 ml de caldo de pollo","2 latas de 400 g de judías gigantes o mantequilla, escurridas","2 cucharadas de queso feta desmenuzado"]','["Frote el cordero con ½ cucharada de aceite.\r\ny 1 diente de ajo. Sazone bien y cuaje\r\na un lado para marinar mientras preparas el\r\nfrijoles, o hasta por 2 horas si tiene tiempo.","Calienta el aceite restante en una sartén. Añade el\r\nla cebolla y el ajo restante y sazonar.\r\nFreír durante 8 minutos hasta que estén suaves. Agrega el tomate\r\npuré, eneldo picado, vinagre, caldo y\r\nfrijoles, sazonar y cocinar a fuego lento durante 15 minutos.\r\no hasta que la mayor parte del líquido se haya evaporado.","Mientras tanto, calienta una sartén hasta que esté caliente.\r\nDorar el cordero por todos lados durante unos 5 minutos en\r\nTotal. Reposar, cubierto con papel de aluminio, durante 5 minutos,\r\nluego cortar en rodajas gruesas. Servir el cordero con el\r\nfrijoles, esparcidos con queso feta y el\r\nhojas de eneldo restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:11:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15620,6758,'es','Pollo con champiñones','Contiene carne de cerdo; la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una cazuela de pollo saludable y baja en calorías con tocino, guisantes y salsa de perejil; use muslos de pollo para darle más sabor y jugosidad.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","500 g de muslos de pollo deshuesados ​​y sin piel","harina, para espolvorear","50 g de cubitos de tocino","300 g de champiñones pequeños","2 chalotes grandes, picados","250 ml de caldo de pollo","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino blanco","50 g de guisantes congelados","un puñado pequeño de perejil, finamente picado"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén. Temporada\r\ny espolvorear el pollo con harina, dorar\r\ntodos los lados. Eliminar. Freír la panceta y\r\nchampiñones hasta que se ablanden, luego retíralos.","Agregue la última cucharada de aceite y cocine las chalotas.\r\ndurante 5 min. Agrega el caldo y el vinagre,\r\nburbujee durante 1-2 minutos. Devuelve el pollo,\r\npanceta y champiñones y cocinar durante\r\n15 minutos. Añade los guisantes y el perejil y\r\ncocine por 2 minutos más, luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:11:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15621,6760,'es','Risotto de cebada, pollo y champiñones','¿Te encanta el risotto? Pruebe esta versión baja en grasas, que reemplaza el arroz risotto tradicional por cebada perlada.','["1 cucharada de mantequilla","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 chalotes grandes, finamente cortados","1 diente de ajo, picado","3 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos grandes","300 g de cebada perlada","250 ml de vino blanco","400 g de champiñones silvestres y castaños, picados","1 cucharada de hoja de tomillo","1 litro de caldo de pollo caliente","3 cucharadas de parmesano rallado","cebollino picado, para servir (opcional)","virutas de parmesano, para servir (opcional)"]','["En una cacerola grande y pesada, calentar\r\nla mantequilla y el aceite. Saltear las chalotas\r\ny ajo con un poco de condimento para\r\n5 minutos, luego agregue el pollo y\r\ncocine por 2 minutos.","Agrega la cebada y cocina por 1 min.\r\nVierta el vino y revuelva hasta que esté\r\nabsorbido. Añade los champiñones y\r\ntomillo y luego vierta ¾ del caldo.\r\nCocine durante 40 minutos a fuego lento hasta que\r\nla cebada está tierna, revolviendo de vez en cuando\r\ny rellenar con el stock restante si\r\nparece seco. Retirar del fuego y\r\nagregue el parmesano rallado. servir\r\ninmediatamente, con cebollino y parmesano\r\nvirutas esparcidas, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:11:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15622,6762,'es','Hummus de guisantes y habas con queso de cabra y masa madre','Cualquier hummus sobrante de este almuerzo veraniego se mantendrá bien cubierto en el refrigerador hasta por tres días y es un excelente refrigerio con pitas tostadas.','["300 g de guisantes frescos o congelados","300 g de habas frescas, sin vaina (no es necesario quitarles la cubierta verde pálida) o congeladas (descongeladas)","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva o girasol","2 dientes de ajo, pelados","ralladura de 2 limones, jugo de 1","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva virgen extra","8 rebanadas de pan de masa madre, partidas por la mitad","125 g/4½ oz de queso de cabra tierno y untable","Bolsa de 50 g de brotes de guisantes (o utilizar berros)"]','["Coloque los guisantes y los frijoles en una cacerola grande.\r\ncacerola con agua hirviendo con sal, luego cocine\r\ndurante 3 min. Escurrir, enfriar con agua fría,\r\nluego escurrir nuevamente a fondo.","Poner las 4 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén, calentar suavemente,\r\nluego agrega el ajo. Cocine por 3 minutos, muy\r\nmuy suavemente, hasta que el aceite se infunda y el\r\nel ajo se ha ablandado pero no tiene color.\r\nEchar el aceite y el ajo en una jarra y dejar enfriar.","Batir los guisantes, las judías y casi todo.\r\nla ralladura en un procesador de alimentos, luego gotee\r\nen el aceite de ajo. Añade los dientes de ajo,\r\ncasi todo el jugo de limón y 1 cucharada\r\naceite de oliva virgen extra. El humus debería\r\nEstar girando muy bien alrededor del cuenco con esto.\r\npunto, pero que no tenga una textura demasiado fina. raspar\r\nlos lados hacia abajo si es necesario. Temporada\r\nBueno, necesitarás aproximadamente 1 cucharadita de sal marina.\r\ny mucha pimienta negra. Añade el resto de\r\nel jugo de limón al gusto. Vierta en un\r\nplato, revuelva la parte superior y luego rocíe sobre el\r\naceite de oliva virgen extra restante.","Para servir, tuesta el pan y luego extiéndelo.\r\ncon queso de cabra. echa un buen\r\ncucharada de hummus en cada pieza,\r\nrociar con un poco más de aceite de oliva, esparcir\r\ncon la ralladura restante, luego muela\r\nun poco de pimienta negra. Cubra con unos guisantes\r\ndispara y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:11:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15623,6766,'es','mantequilla de almendras','Si crees que no hay nada mejor para untar como la mantequilla de maní, prueba esta versión, endulzada con miel, como refrigerio que aumenta la energía.','["300 g de almendras con piel","buen chorrito de miel","pan de malta o pan integral, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nUntar las almendras\r\nen una bandeja para hornear y asar durante 10 minutos.\r\nRetirar y dejar enfriar.","Poner en un procesador de alimentos y batir.\r\ndurante 12 minutos, deteniéndose de vez en cuando para\r\nraspe los lados hacia abajo y termine con un chorrito de miel. Servir para untar\r\nsobre pan de malta o pan integral. Se conserva en el frigorífico hasta por 3 semanas."]','2026-01-11 13:11:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15624,6768,'es','Dip de guisantes, menta y chile','Un rápido puré estilo guacamole que está listo en minutos y es perfecto para refrigerios o loncheras.','["400 g de guisantes congelados y descongelados","100 g de yogur natural sin grasa","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharadita de comino molido","un puñado pequeño de hojas de menta","1 chile rojo pequeño, picado","4 panes pita integrales","500 g de zanahorias cortadas en bastones"]','["Batir los guisantes, el yogur, el zumo de limón,\r\ncomino, menta y chile juntos en un\r\nprocesador de alimentos hasta obtener la textura que desee.\r\nDividir entre tarrinas de plástico para empacar.\r\nen loncheras o en una porción\r\ncuenco. Tostar ligeramente las pitas y luego\r\ncortar en gajos y servir con el\r\nsalsa y zanahorias."]','2026-01-11 13:11:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15625,6772,'es','Tortillas cajún caseras','Hornee tortillas de harina en el horno hasta convertirlas en crujientes chips aromatizados con especias tradicionales de Luisiana y sírvalas con salsa.','["2 cucharadas de aceite","1 cucharada de mezcla de especias cajún","8 tortillas simples"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Mezclar\r\nel aceite con la especia cajún\r\nmezclar. Unte las tortillas con aceite especiado, apilando las tortillas encima\r\nunos a otros a medida que avanzan. Cortar la pila en\r\n8 cuñas. Separar las cuñas y\r\ndistribuir uniformemente en bandejas para hornear y\r\nhornee durante 6-7 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente."]','2026-01-11 13:11:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15626,6774,'es','Cuadritos de cóctel de gambas','Deshazte de la cristalería y sirve tus cócteles de gambas de un solo bocado y con estilo.','["100 g de mayonesa (usar light, si lo prefieres)","3 cucharadas de salsa de tomate","300 g de gambas cocidas peladas","pimienta negra","4 rebanadas grandes de pan de centeno","¼ de lechuga iceberg","pimienta de cayena"]','["Mezcla la mayonesa con el ketchup de tomate. Añadir\r\ngambas cocidas peladas y unas\r\npimienta negra.","Cortar 4 rodajas grandes de centeno.\r\npan en cuadritos pequeños – deberías estar\r\ncapaz de obtener 6 cuadrados de cada uno.","Disponer en un plato. Triture la lechuga,\r\ndividir entre los cuadrados, cubrir cada uno\r\ncon una cucharada de gambas y luego una\r\nespolvorea pimienta de cayena."]','2026-01-11 13:11:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15627,6776,'es','Batatas con champiñones y romero','¿No estás seguro de qué hacer con las batatas? Aquí está la respuesta perfecta','["2 batatas, de unos 300 g/10 oz cada una","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","200 g de champiñones castaños, cortados por la mitad","1 cucharadita de romero fresco picado o ½ cucharadita seco","2 cucharadas de parmesano recién rallado"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Pinchar\r\nlas patatas varias veces con un tenedor, luego\r\nmicroondas a temperatura alta durante 8 a 10 minutos, volteando\r\nuna vez, hasta que estén tiernos. Mientras tanto, calentar el aceite.\r\nEn una sartén antiadherente añadir los champiñones y\r\nromero y cocinar a fuego bastante alto,\r\nrevolviendo, hasta que los champiñones estén tiernos y\r\nde color claro. Sazone al gusto.","Poner las patatas en el horno y asar durante\r\n15 minutos hasta que la piel empiece a estar crujiente. dividir\r\nábrelo y vierte sobre los champiñones.\r\nEspolvoree con queso parmesano para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15628,6778,'es','El mejor guacamole con trozos','Esta es la mejor versión de este clásico dip. Los ingredientes se reducen al mínimo para que tenga el sabor más fresco posible.','["1 tomate maduro grande","3 aguacates, muy maduros pero no magullados","jugo de 1 lima grande","un puñado de cilantro, hojas y tallos picados, más unas cuantas hojas, picadas en trozos grandes, para servir","1 cebolla morada pequeña, finamente picada","1 chile, rojo o verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","chips de tortilla, para servir"]','["Utiliza un cuchillo grande para pulverizar el tomate.\r\nhasta obtener una pulpa sobre una tabla y luego verterla en un tazón.\r\nCortar por la mitad y deshuesar los aguacates (guardando un\r\npiedra) y use una cuchara para sacar la\r\nla carne en el bol con el tomate.","Vierta todos los demás ingredientes en el bol,\r\nluego sazone con sal y pimienta. Utilice un\r\nbata para triturar todo junto.\r\nSi no sirve de inmediato, coloque una piedra en el\r\nguacamole (esto ayuda a detenerlo)\r\nmarrón), cubrir con film transparente y enfriar hasta que\r\nnecesario. Esparcir con el cilantro, si se usa,\r\nluego sirva con chips de tortilla o gajos picantes\r\ny crema agria."]','2026-01-11 13:11:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15629,6780,'es','Mezcla de semillas picante','Para un refrigerio saludable, mordisquee esta mezcla de girasol, calabaza y semillas de lino, o espolvoree sobre ensaladas y sopas.','["250 g de semillas mixtas (girasol, calabaza, linaza)","1 cucharadita de aceite de colza","1 cucharadita de sp-ellos","¼ cucharadita de sal baja en sodio","1 cucharadita de salsa de soja reducida en sal","1 cucharadita de sirope de agave","pizca de cayena"]','["Precalienta el horno a 160C/ 140 ventilador/ marca de gas 3.","Mezcle todos los ingredientes en un tazón y extiéndalos sobre una bandeja para hornear. Cocine durante 15 a 20 minutos hasta que esté seco y dorado. Revuelva una vez durante la cocción. Deje enfriar y almacene en un recipiente sellado por hasta 3 semanas."]','2026-01-11 13:11:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15630,6782,'es','Tortilla de frijoles con chile mexicano','Colorido y delicioso: un festín vegetal para toda la familia','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 latas de 420 g de frijoles pintos o rojos, escurridos","4 tomates maduros","1 calabacín grande, cortado en cubitos","1 cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharadas de hojas de cilantro picadas en trozos grandes","8 tortillas de harina o maíz","½ lechuga iceberg, rallada","1 mini pepino, cortado a lo largo en rodajas muy finas con un pelador de patatas","Tarrina de 180 ml de crema agria y dip de cebollino"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y cocinar la cebolla.\r\ndurante 2 min. Agregue 1 lata de frijoles y caliente por un\r\n2-3 minutos más, mientras se machaca la cebolla\r\ncon un machacador o un tenedor para hacer una pasta rugosa.","Agrega la lata restante de frijoles, los tomates,\r\ncalabacines, pimentón y 5 cucharadas de agua. Cubrir y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que espese\r\ny pulposa, revolviendo ocasionalmente. Sazone al gusto\r\ncon jugo de limón, sal y pimienta, luego agregue el\r\ncilantro. Calentar las tortillas de harina en una fritura seca.\r\nsartén, luego dispóngalas con los chiles en grano, rallados\r\nlechuga, pepino en rodajas y salsa de crema agria.\r\nPide a todos que se ayuden ellos mismos: ¡llena, enrolla y come!"]','2026-01-11 13:11:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15631,6784,'es','Cerdo a las hierbas con ensalada de manzana y achicoria','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Una ensalada crujiente y saludable servida con un corte bajo en grasa de carne de cerdo con costra de hierbas: una cena rápida que es buena para ti.','["400 g/14 oz de lomo de cerdo, sin grasa ni tendones","1 cucharada de aceite de nuez","2 cucharaditas de mostaza integral","1 cucharada de estragón y perejil picados","jugo 1 limon","1 cucharada de miel","2 manzanas grandes para comer, sin corazón y en rodajas","Paquete de 270 g de achicoria, hojas separadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Frote la carne de cerdo con 1 cucharadita de aceite, 1 cucharadita de mostaza y un poco de condimento. Dorar, transferir a una bandeja para hornear y presionar la mitad de las hierbas. Ase durante 15 minutos hasta que esté cocido.","Para hacer la ensalada, mezcle el jugo de limón, la miel, el resto del aceite de nuez y la mostaza. Sazone y mezcle las manzanas, la achicoria y las hierbas restantes. Sirve el cerdo en rodajas y acompaña la ensalada."]','2026-01-11 13:11:08');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15632,6786,'es','Tilapia tandoori con puré de camote picante y ensalada de tomate','Esta cena de pescado a la parrilla con influencia india incluye todos los cinco platos del día en un plato ligero y ligeramente condimentado.','["4 filetes de tilapia de 140 g","1 cucharada de pasta tandoori","1 kg de batatas, cortadas en trozos pequeños","4 zanahorias, picadas","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","8 tomates, picados","cebolla morada pequeña, en rodajas finas","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Cubra los filetes de tilapia con la pasta tandoori y reserve. Pon las batatas, las zanahorias y el ajo en una cacerola grande con agua con sal. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar durante 10 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos. Escurrir bien y luego dejar secar al vapor durante unos minutos. Agrega el chile a la sartén y tritura todo junto con un poco de condimento. Cubrir y mantener caliente.","Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Ase la tilapia durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que esté bien cocida. Mientras tanto, mezcle los ingredientes de la ensalada y sirva junto con la tilapia y el puré."]','2026-01-11 13:11:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15633,6788,'es','Cocinar con niños: fajitas','Wraps mexicanos para que toda la familia se sume a la cocina: rellene las tortillas de harina con pollo marinado y pimientos','["4 pechugas de pollo, cortadas en trozos","aceite de oliva, para freír","4 limas, solo jugo","2 cucharaditas de condimento para fajitas","4 cebolletas, cortadas finamente","1 diente de ajo gordo, machacado","1 pimiento rojo","½ tarro de pimiento asado (nosotros utilizamos Gaea Red Peppers Flame Roasted 290g)","1 manzana pequeña, pelada","4 tomates maduros","½ lima, solo jugo","cilantro en manojo pequeño, con las hojas recogidas","salsa de chile, al gusto (opcional)","2 aguacates muy maduros, partidos por la mitad y sin hueso","½ lima, solo jugo","queso rallado, para servir","6 - 8 tortillas (ahora puedes conseguir mini tortillas para niños)","crema agria (opcional)"]','["Adultos: Poner el pollo y los ingredientes de la marinada en un bol y tapar. Meter en el frigorífico al menos dos horas.","Niños: Si sus hijos tienen 5 años o más, puede pedirles que piquen en trozos grandes el pimiento, el pimiento asado, la manzana y los tomates para la salsa utilizando un cuchillo de plástico firme de buena calidad o un cuchillo para cubiertos. De lo contrario, hágalo usted mismo.  Los niños más pequeños pueden coger las hojas del cilantro y mezclarlas con la salsa.","Adultos: Vierta los ingredientes de la salsa en un procesador de alimentos, junto con el jugo de limón y un poco de condimento y presione hasta que estén finamente picados. Saque 2 cucharadas grandes de la mezcla para los niños más pequeños, luego agregue la salsa de chile, si la usa, y presione nuevamente para combinar.","Niños: Exprime o coloca el aguacate en un bol y utiliza un machacador de patatas para triturarlo. Agrega el jugo de lima y un poco de pimienta negra con una cuchara. El jugo de lima puede picar, por lo que es posible que los adultos quieran exprimirlo para los niños más pequeños.","Mayores: Calentar un poco de aceite de oliva en una sartén y verter el contenido del bol de pollo en la sartén. Cocine durante 5 a 8 minutos o hasta que los trozos de pollo estén bien cocidos.","Niños: Coloque el queso rallado, la salsa (para mayores y niños), el guacamole y la crema agria en tazones de colores separados para poner sobre la mesa.","Adultos: Calienta las tortillas según las instrucciones del paquete y pon el pollo cocido en un bol. Muestre a los niños cómo llenar y enrollar su tortilla.","Niños: ¡Extiende tu tortilla, elige los ingredientes, enróllalos y cómelos!"]','2026-01-11 13:11:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15634,6790,'es','Pilaf de bulgur especiado con pescado','Utilice pescado blanco sostenible en esta olla de arroz con harissa y albaricoque, inspirada en el norte de África, llena de hierro, fibra y 2 de sus 5 al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas, finamente cortadas","3 zanahorias ralladas","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","2 cucharadas de harissa","200 g de trigo bulgar","6 orejones, picados","700 ml de caldo de pollo débil (nosotros hicimos con 1 pastilla de caldo)","200 g de espinacas tiernas","4 filetes de pescado blanco firmes","4 rodajas finas de limón"]','["Calentar el aceite en un recipiente ignífugo con tapa.\r\ncazuela. Vierta las cebollas y cocine.\r\ndurante 10 minutos hasta que esté suave y dorado. Añade el\r\nzanahorias y comino, y cocine por 2 minutos.\r\nmás. Revuelva la harissa, el bulghar y\r\nalbaricoques, verter sobre el caldo y llevar a\r\nel hervor. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 7 minutos.","Agregue las espinacas y revuelva hasta\r\nsimplemente marchito. Colocar encima los filetes de pescado,\r\npon una rodaja de limón en cada uno y sazona.\r\nVuelva a colocar la tapa y cocine por 8 minutos.\r\nmanteniéndolo a fuego lento.","Baje el fuego a bajo y cocine durante 7-8 minutos.\r\nmás hasta que el pescado esté bien cocido\r\ny el búlgaro está tierno. Sazone con\r\npimienta y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:09');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15635,6792,'es','Ensalada templada de calabaza asada y lentejas del Puy','Esta ensalada fresca y vibrante utiliza lentejas enlatadas, un alimento básico en la alacena. El resultado es abundante, bajo en grasas y contiene todos los cinco alimentos que necesitas al día.','["1 kg de calabaza, cortada en cubitos","1½ cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 diente de ajo, machacado","2 cucharaditas de hojas de tomillo","1 cucharada de vinagre balsámico","1 cucharadita de mostaza integral","2 latas de 400 g de lentejas Puy en agua","½ cebolla morada en rodajas","100g bolsa de espinacas","150 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","40 g de queso cheshire","1-2 cucharadas de semillas de calabaza tostadas"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 4. Mezcle la calabaza con 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, diente de ajo, hojas de tomillo y condimentos. Ase durante 25-30 minutos o hasta que estén tiernos.","Mezcle el vinagre balsámico, ½ cucharada de aceite de oliva, la mostaza integral y 1-2 cucharadas de agua. Escurrir las lentejas Puy en agua y mezclar con el aderezo, la cebolla morada, las espinacas y los tomates cherry.","Divida las lentejas en cuatro platos. Cubra con la calabaza y luego desmenúcela sobre el queso Cheshire y las semillas de calabaza."]','2026-01-11 13:11:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15636,6794,'es','Pollo cremoso con espárragos y estragón','Una cazuela de pollo ligera y baja en calorías con salsa sedosa de hierbas, verduras y patatas tiernas','["500 g de patatas tiernas cortadas por la mitad","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","350 ml de caldo de pollo","estragón en manojo pequeño","175 g de espárragos, recortados","3 cucharadas de crema fresca reducida en grasa"]','["Cocine las patatas en una cacerola grande de\r\nagua hirviendo durante 8-10 minutos hasta que esté tierna,\r\nluego escurrir y mantener caliente en la sartén.\r\nSazone el pollo con negro molido.\r\npimienta. Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande.\r\nsartén. Sofreír el pollo con\r\nla cebolla y el ajo durante 5 minutos hasta que ambos\r\nestán ligeramente dorados. Voltear el\r\npollo una vez y revuelva la cebolla regularmente.","Vierta sobre el caldo, agregue 2 ramitas de\r\nestragón y llevar a fuego lento.\r\nCocine por 5 minutos, luego dé la vuelta al pollo.\r\nagregue los espárragos y cocine por 3 minutos\r\nmás. Picar el estragón restante.","Revuelva la crème fraîche y el estragón.\r\nen la sartén con el pollo y calentar\r\na través, revolviendo, durante unos segundos. servir\r\ncon las patatas nuevas."]','2026-01-11 13:11:10');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15637,6796,'es','Risotto primavera más saludable','Angela Nilsen hace su magia en este plato de arroz italiano favorito, haciéndolo bajo en grasa y nutritivo.','["350 g de espárragos en manojo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 manojo (unas 9) cebolletas, con los extremos recortados y en rodajas","175 g de guisantes frescos o congelados","250 g de habas frescas o congeladas sin cáscara","2 cucharadas de albahaca rallada","2 cucharadas de cebollino picado","1 cucharada de menta finamente picada","ralladura fina de 1 limón","1,7 litros/3 pintas de caldo de verduras (nosotros usamos caléndula)","4 chalotes, finamente picados","3 dientes de ajo regordetes, finamente picados","300 g de arroz carnaroli o arborio","150 ml de vino blanco seco","25 g de parmesano (o alternativa vegetariana), rallado","25 g de hojas de rúcula"]','["Cortar las puntas leñosas de los espárragos,\r\nLuego corte los tallos en diagonal de 5 cm.\r\nlongitudes. Calentar la mitad del aceite en una cacerola grande y ancha.\r\nsartén antiadherente. Punta en los espárragos\r\ny sofreír a fuego medio-alto durante\r\nunos 4 minutos o hasta que todo esté bien dorado\r\nterminado (Paso 1). Agregue las cebolletas y fría\r\ndurante 1-2 minutos con los espárragos hasta que\r\ndorado. Retirar, sazonar con pimienta.\r\ny dejar a un lado. Cocer los guisantes y las judías.\r\npor separado en un poco de agua hirviendo durante\r\n3 minutos cada uno, luego escurrir cada uno por\r\nun tamiz. Cuando las habas estén frías\r\nsuficiente para manejar, sáquelos de su\r\npieles. Pon los guisantes y los frijoles a uno\r\nlado. Mezclar la albahaca, el cebollino, la menta y\r\nralladura de limón junta en un tazón pequeño\r\ny sazone con pimienta (Paso 2). Dejar de lado.","Vierta el caldo en una cacerola y\r\nmantenlo a fuego muy lento. Vierta el\r\naceite restante en un salteado grande y amplio\r\nsartén. Agregue las chalotas y el ajo y\r\nfreír durante 3-4 minutos hasta que estén suaves y solo\r\nligeramente marrón. Agregue el arroz y\r\ncontinúe revolviendo durante 1-2 minutos durante un\r\nfuego medio-alto. Cuando empiece a chisporrotear, vierte el vino y revuelve nuevamente hasta que\r\nel vino ha sido absorbido. Empezar a\r\nagregue el caldo caliente, 1½ cucharón a la vez.\r\ntiempo (Paso 3), para que hierva a fuego lento y se absorba\r\ndespués de cada adición. Para saber cuando es\r\nlisto para tomar el siguiente 1½ cucharón\r\nañadido, arrastre la cuchara por el\r\nfondo de la cacerola y debe salir\r\nuna línea clara. Sigue revolviendo todo\r\ntiempo, para mantener el risotto cremoso.\r\nContinúe agregando el caldo como se indica arriba.\r\ndespués de 20 minutos el arroz debe estar suave y\r\nun poco de masticar en el medio. Si no es así,\r\nagregue más caldo; aún debería tener\r\nAl menos queda un cucharón de caldo en este momento.\r\npunto. Sazona con pimienta, no deberías\r\nEs necesario agregar sal.","Retira la sartén del fuego. Vierta sobre\r\nun cucharón del caldo restante para conservar\r\nel líquido de la mezcla, luego esparcir por todo el\r\nverduras, una pizca de pimienta, la mitad\r\nde la mezcla de hierbas (Paso 4) y la mitad del queso.\r\nCubrir con la tapa de la cacerola y dejar que el risotto\r\nsiéntese durante 3-4 minutos para descansar. Revuelva suavemente\r\ntodo junto, si es necesario añadiendo\r\nuna gota más de stock restante para siempre\r\nconsistencia. Sirva en platos para servir\r\ny sirva cubierto con un pequeño montón de\r\nrúcula y el resto de las hierbas y\r\nqueso esparcido por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:11:11');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15638,6798,'es','pasta española con marisco','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Italia y España se combinan en este plato parecido a una paella de pasta orzo con chorizo, guisantes y el marisco de su elección.','["350 g de pasta corta (nosotros usamos orzo)","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma o una pizca grande de hebras de azafrán","85 g de chorizo ​​cortado en cubitos","Paquete de 200 g de marisco cocido mixto","2 pimientos rojos asados, de un frasco, rebanados","100 g de guisantes congelados","2 cucharadas de perejil picado"]','["Cocer la pasta en mucha agua.\r\nsiguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, con\r\nla pastilla de caldo y la mitad de la cúrcuma\r\no azafrán. unos 7 minutos antes\r\nla pasta esta cocida, volcar el chorizo\r\nen una sartén y cocinar a fuego lento\r\nfuego medio durante 5 minutos hasta que esté ligeramente\r\ncrujiente. Saque un poco de grasa y luego\r\nagregue la cúrcuma restante o\r\nazafrán, mariscos, pimientos y guisantes.","Escurrir la pasta, reservando un poco.\r\nde la acción. Incline la pasta hacia atrás\r\nEn la sartén, agrega el chorizo y\r\nmezcla de marisco y un chorrito de\r\nel caldo reservado y calentar\r\na través. Agrega la mayor parte del perejil.","Servir en tazones calientes, con el\r\nel perejil restante espolvoreado encima."]','2026-01-11 13:11:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15639,6800,'es','Horneado de verduras italiano','Un plato vibrante para ollas de cocción lenta, capas de calabacines, tomates y berenjenas veraniegos con pan y mozzarella: ¡irresistible!','["4 dientes de ajo, 3 machacados, 1 dejado entero","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","manojo de orégano, hojas picadas","una pizca grande de hojuelas de chile","unos 300 g de berenjenas baby o normales, cortadas en rodajas","2 calabacines, rebanados","½ frasco grande de pimientos rojos asados","3 tomates de res, rebanados","manojo de albahaca, desmenuzada (guarde algunas hojas para espolvorear)","baguette pequeña, rebanada y tostada","2 bolitas de 125 g de mozzarella, desmenuzadas","ensalada verde, para servir"]','["Pon la olla de cocción lenta en temperatura alta.\r\no la configuración de dorado e incline la\r\najo machacado, tomates enlatados, la mitad\r\nlas hojas de orégano, la guindilla y un poco\r\ncondimento. Cocine tapado mientras\r\nPicar el resto de las verduras.","Saque la mayor parte de la salsa y comience.\r\ncolocar en capas la mitad de las verduras y\r\nhierbas con condimento – las berenjenas,\r\ncalabacines, pimientos rojos, tomates,\r\nalbahaca y el orégano restante. Capa en\r\nla mitad del pan, untado con el conjunto\r\ndiente de ajo, la mitad de la mozzarella y\r\nla mitad de la salsa de tomate destapada. repetir\r\ncapas de salsa de verduras, hierbas y tomate,\r\nseguido del pan y la mozzarella.\r\nEmpuja todo bien hacia abajo para comprimir,\r\nluego cocine a fuego alto durante 5 a 6 horas.","Dejar cocinar bajo la parrilla antes de servir.\r\nsi quieres (y tu olla de cocción lenta\r\nes adecuado), hasta que esté dorado y burbujeante.\r\nServir con las hojas de albahaca sobrantes.\r\nencima y una gran ensalada al lado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15640,6802,'es','One-pot de calabaza, lentejas y frijoles con raita de higos','Disfrute de sus 5 comidas diarias con este condimento vegetariano al curry, repleto de legumbres y calabaza, servido con una refrescante salsa de yogur','["400 g de trozos de calabaza, pelada, sin semillas y cortada en cubitos","1 cebolla, rebanada","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","½ cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","100 g de lentejas rojas secas","2 cucharaditas de sirope de agave o azúcar moreno","2 cucharaditas de vinagre de vino tinto o blanco","Lata de 400 g de judías verdes, escurridas y enjuagadas","2 higos secos, finamente picados","Bote de 150ml de yogur natural sin grasa","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, picado"]','["Freír la calabaza y la cebolla en el aceite durante\r\n5-8 minutos hasta que la cebolla se ablande. Revuelva\r\nen el comino y la guindilla durante 1 min. Añade el\r\ntomates más una lata de agua de\r\nla lata de tomate, las lentejas, agave o\r\nazúcar y vinagre. Llevar a fuego lento\r\ny cocine por 10 minutos, luego agregue el\r\nfrijoles y cocine por unos minutos más.\r\nhasta que las lentejas estén tiernas y\r\nfrijoles calentados por completo.","Mientras tanto, mezcle los higos, el yogur y\r\nperejil juntos. Sazone el guiso, luego\r\nsirva en tazones con higos raita a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:12');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15641,6808,'es','Sopa picante de pimientos y tomates con yogur de pepino','Sirva esta saludable y vibrante mezcla de vegetales fría como gazpacho al estilo español o caliente como una cena reconfortante.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más extra para servir","2 cebollas, finamente cortadas","1 zanahoria, finamente picada","3 pimientos rojos, picados en trozos grandes","3 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 chile rojo, rebanado","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","850ml-1 litro/1½-1¾pts de caldo de verduras o caldo","4 cucharadas de yogur estilo griego","½ pepino, cortado por la mitad, sin semillas, rallado grueso y exprimido del exceso de agua","unas hojas de menta picadas"]','["Calienta el aceite en una cacerola grande.\r\nAgregue las cebollas, la zanahoria y los pimientos.\r\nCocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos para que se ablande.\r\nAgregue el ajo y la guindilla y cocine por\r\nunos minutos más. Vierta sobre el picado\r\ntomates y 800ml de caldo. traer\r\nhasta que hierva y cocine a fuego lento durante 10-15 minutos\r\nhasta que las verduras estén completamente tiernas.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el yogur, el pepino\r\ny la menta en un bol y sazonar.","Bate la sopa con una batidora de mano hasta que\r\nsuave, usando el caldo extra para diluir si\r\nse ha vuelto demasiado espeso. calentar a través,\r\nsazone y vierta en tazones. servir\r\ncon una cucharada de la mezcla de yogur\r\npor encima y un chorrito de aceite de oliva."]','2026-01-11 13:11:15');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15642,6809,'es','Sopa de calabacín y tomate','Cocine por lotes una sopa de verduras cuando tenga una recompensa de temporada y siempre tendrá una comida saludable en el congelador.','["1 cucharada de mantequilla","2 cebollas picadas","1 kg de calabacines, en rodajas","1 kg de tomates, picados","2 cucharadas de harina común","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","2 l de caldo de pollo o verduras en cubitos","pan crujiente, para servir (opcional)"]','["Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén grande,\r\nañadir las cebollas y los calabacines, y\r\ncocine por 5 minutos a fuego medio,\r\nrevolviendo ocasionalmente.","Agrega los tomates y la harina. cocinar\r\ndurante un par de minutos, revolviendo\r\npara evitar que la harina se vuelva grumos.\r\nAñade la cúrcuma y el caldo, tapa y\r\ncocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos.","Haga puré con una batidora y luego tamice\r\nsi quieres una textura realmente suave.\r\nServir caliente con pan crujiente, si se desea,\r\no enfríelo y luego congélelo por hasta 2 meses."]','2026-01-11 13:11:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15643,6811,'es','Risotto de pollo asado y guisantes','Haga algo especial con el pollo asado sobrante con esta receta rica y cremosa','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal","1 cebolla, picada","1 diente de ajo, machacado","350 g de arroz para risotto","1 vaso pequeño de vino blanco","1 litro de caldo caliente","2 pechugas de pollo asado, picadas","1 cucharada de hoja de tomillo","200 g de guisantes congelados","1 cucharada de crema fresca","2 cucharadas de parmesano rallado, más extra para servir"]','["Calentar aceite en una sartén grande y cocinar el\r\ncebolla y ajo durante 5 minutos. Agrega el arroz\r\ny cocine por 1 min más, hasta que comience a\r\nlucir transparente. Vierta el vino y\r\nsigue revolviendo hasta que se absorba todo el líquido.","Añade el caldo y cocina a fuego lento hasta que\r\nel arroz está tierno. Revuelva a través del\r\npollo, tomillo y guisantes, luego cocine por\r\n2 minutos o hasta que el pollo esté caliente\r\na través. Añade la crème fraîche y\r\nParmesano con un poco de condimento, luego\r\nretirar del fuego. Cubrir con una tapa\r\ny dejar reposar 2 minutos antes\r\nsirviendo con parmesano extra, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:11:16');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15644,6813,'es','Ensalada de berenjena asada, pimiento y bulgur','Condimente los cereales básicos con tomates secos, berenjenas, pimientos rojos y aceitunas como guarnición versátil','["175 g de trigo bulgar","2 cucharadas de pasta de tomate seco","4 berenjenas tiernas, cada una cortada a lo largo en 3","1 pimiento rojo, cortado a lo largo en trozos de 1 cm","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","un puñado de hojas de albahaca"]','["Preparar el siguiente paquete de Bulghar\r\ninstrucciones. Vierta en un tazón grande y\r\nrevuelva con la pasta de tomate. Estación.","Calienta una parrilla o parrilla a fuego alto.\r\nRocíe las berenjenas y el pimiento rojo.\r\ncon el aceite y cocinar durante 5 minutos\r\ncada lado hasta que esté ligeramente carbonizado.","Revolver las berenjenas y el pimiento rojo.\r\nen la mezcla de búlgaro, luego sazone\r\ny revuelva con la albahaca."]','2026-01-11 13:11:17');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15645,6817,'es','Ensalada arcoíris de atún','Rojo, amarillo, morado, verde: no es un arcoíris completo, pero esta vibrante ensalada de pescado y verduras enlatadas se acerca','["1 pimiento rojo, rebanado","1 zanahoria grande, rallada","Lata de 340 g de granos de maíz dulce, escurridos","150 g de guisantes dulces","6 remolachas tiernas cocidas, en cuartos","Lata de 185 g de atún desmenuzado en agua de manantial, escurrido","100 g de mayonesa","1 cucharada de jugo de limón","2 cucharaditas de mostaza integral","1 cucharadita de agua","hojas de lechuga","1 cebolla tierna, en rodajas"]','["En un tazón grande, mezcle el pimiento rojo, la zanahoria, el maíz dulce, los guisantes dulces, la remolacha y el atún.","En un tazón pequeño, mezcle la mayonesa, el jugo de limón, la mostaza integral, el agua y\r\ncondimento, si lo desea, para hacer un aderezo.","Forrar un bol grande con hojas de lechuga, rellenar con la ensalada y\r\nrocíe con el aderezo. Cubra con cebolla tierna y sirva de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:11:18');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15646,6819,'es','Ensalada de pollo al curry y mango','Esta ensalada de frutas, ligeramente condimentada, es una versión moderna del pollo Coronation: un almuerzo bajo en calorías para dos.','["6 mini filetes de pollo","1 cucharadita de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de curry en polvo","4 cucharadas de yogur griego","2 cucharadas de chutney de mango","ralladura de ½ lima y 2 cucharaditas de jugo","1 lechuga Little Gem, con las hojas separadas","1 mango maduro, pelado y rebanado","½ cebolla morada, cortada finamente","2 cucharaditas de semillas de sésamo tostadas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.\r\nMezcle el pollo en el aceite y 1 cucharadita de\r\nel curry en polvo, sazonar y mezclar bien\r\npara cubrir. Coloque el pollo en una bandeja forrada con papel de aluminio.\r\nbandeja para hornear y hornee por 20 minutos hasta que\r\nbien cocido. Dejar enfriar un poco\r\nluego cortar.","Mientras tanto, haz el aderezo. en\r\nEn un tazón, combine el curry restante.\r\npolvo con el yogur, el chutney y\r\nralladura de lima y jugo (agregue 1 cucharada de agua\r\nsi el aderezo queda un poco espeso).","Para servir, disponer las hojas de lechuga.\r\nen 2 platos. Cubra con el mango y\r\npollo cocido, luego rocíe con el\r\nvestirse. Espolvorear con la cebolla morada\r\ny semillas de sésamo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15647,6821,'es','Hígados de pollo sobre tostadas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. No solo para rellenos y patés, los hígados de pollo fritos son un entrante a buen precio o un almuerzo ligero.','["250 g de hígados de pollo","2 chalotes, finamente picados","un puñado grande de perejil de hoja plana, las hojas muy picadas","1 cucharada de alcaparras, enjuagadas y escurridas, picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 cucharadas de vinagre de jerez","4 rebanadas de buen pan, como de masa madre","1 cucharada de harina común","pizca grande de pimienta de cayena"]','["Recoja los hígados, cortando cualquier\r\ntrozos grasos y tendones, luego acariciar los hígados\r\nseco. Colocar la chalota, el perejil y las alcaparras.\r\nen un bol y rociar con la mitad de la aceituna\r\naceite y 1 cucharada de vinagre de Jerez.","Tostar el pan (preferiblemente en una plancha\r\npero una tostadora está bien). Mezcle los hígados\r\nla harina y la pimienta de cayena, y\r\nsazone generosamente con sal y pimienta.\r\nCalentar el resto del aceite en una sartén y\r\nfreír los hígados a fuego muy alto durante\r\n4-5 minutos hasta que se doren y queden crujientes\r\npor fuera y cocido, pero todavía un poco rosado\r\nen el medio. Salpique el vinagre restante\r\nen la sartén y burbujee durante 1 min.","Vierta el contenido de la cacerola con la\r\nchalota y perejil, mezclar todo\r\njuntos, sazone al gusto, luego apile sobre\r\nel pan tostado. Sazone con un poco\r\nsal marina crujiente y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15648,6823,'es','Pasta con tomate cherry, col rizada, ricotta y pesto','La salsa de albahaca fresca y los tomates cherry le dan a este plato saludable un hermoso color; también está lleno de fibra y vitamina C.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile trituradas","2 latas de 400 g de tomates cherry","500 g de penne","200 g de col rizada picada","4 cucharadas de ricota","4 cucharadas de pesto fresco","parmesano o alternativa vegetariana, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande, agregar\r\nel ajo y cocine por 2 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado. Agrega las hojuelas de chile y los tomates.\r\nsazone bien y cocine a fuego lento durante 15 minutos hasta que\r\nla salsa queda espesa y reducida.","Mientras se cocina la salsa, cocine la\r\npasta siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete – agregar\r\nla col rizada durante los últimos 2 minutos de cocción.\r\nEscurrir bien y mezclar con la salsa, luego\r\ndividir en 4 tazones. Cubra cada uno con\r\nuna cucharada de ricotta, un chorrito de pesto y\r\nvirutas de parmesano, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:11:19');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15649,6829,'es','Cerdo a la mostaza y manzanas','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Prepárate una comida británica tradicional y saludable con esta receta.','["4 filetes de cerdo, de aproximadamente 140 g/5 oz cada uno, sin exceso de grasa","1 cucharada de aceite","2 manzanas para comer, sin corazón y cortadas en ocho","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","un puñado pequeño de hojas de salvia, trituradas o 2 cucharaditas secas","100 ml/3½ fl oz de caldo de pollo o jamón (en cubos está bien)","2 cucharaditas de mostaza de Dijon o mostaza integral"]','["Frote los filetes de cerdo con un poco de aceite y sazone con pimienta y sal al gusto. Calienta una sartén grande y fríe los filetes durante 2 minutos por ambos lados hasta que estén dorados. Transfiera a un plato. Agregando un poco más de aceite a la sartén, sofreír las manzanas, las cebollas y la salvia durante 5 minutos o hasta que las manzanas se ablanden.","Vierta el caldo y agregue la mostaza, luego regrese la carne de cerdo a la sartén y cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos hasta que la salsa se haya reducido en aproximadamente un tercio y la carne de cerdo esté bien cocida. Sirva con verduras y puré de patatas."]','2026-01-11 13:11:20');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15650,6833,'es','Guiso de pescado mediterráneo con tostadas de ajo','Alimenta a una multitud como una mamá mediterránea con este gloriosamente veraniego guiso de mariscos','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla grande, cortada en rodajas","2 dientes de ajo, rebanados","1 chile rojo, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","1 kg de tomates, picados en trozos grandes","200 ml de vino blanco","350 ml de caldo de pescado","3 tiras de ralladura de naranja","1 kg de filetes de fletán sin piel, cortados en trozos grandes","500 g de almejas","400 g de gambas crudas grandes","un puñado de perejil de hoja plana, picado","1 pan ciabatta grande, cortado en rodajas de 1 cm","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 dientes de ajo, partidos por la mitad"]','["Para hacer las tostadas de ajo, rociar el\r\npan con aceite, luego plancha o grill hasta\r\ndorado por todas partes. Mientras los brindis todavía están\r\ncalientes, frótelas con ajo y reserve.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén amplia y profunda.\r\nAgrega la cebolla y cocina a fuego suave.\r\ndurante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Revuelva a través del\r\najo y guindilla y cocinar un par de minutos\r\nmás. Agrega el puré de tomate y los tomates.\r\nSube el fuego y cocina durante 10-15 minutos.\r\nrevolviendo hasta que los tomates estén pulposos. verter\r\nsobre el vino y cocinar por 10 minutos más\r\nhasta que la mayor parte se haya evaporado.","Añadimos el caldo de pescado y la ralladura de naranja y\r\ncalentar hasta que hierva a fuego lento. Nestle el\r\ntrozos de fletán en el líquido y cocinar\r\ndurante 5 min. Añade las almejas y las gambas.\r\ny cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que el pescado\r\nesté bien cocida y las almejas tengan\r\nabierto (deseche los que no lo hayan hecho).\r\nEspolvorea el perejil sobre el guiso.\r\ny servir con las tostadas de ajo."]','2026-01-11 13:11:22');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15651,6835,'es','Salmón picante y lentejas','Este plato es fácil de cocinar pero aún está lleno de sabor.','["2 cucharaditas de pasta de curry","Lata de 410 g de lentejas verdes, escurridas y enjuagadas","2 filetes de salmón, de aproximadamente 175 g/6 oz cada uno","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","jugo de 1 limón","2 puñados grandes de espinacas tiernas"]','["Caliente una olla grande con tapa\r\nsartén poco profunda a fuego medio. Consejo en\r\nla pasta de curry y sofreír brevemente, revolviendo\r\nconstantemente, hasta que esté chisporroteante y aromático. Añadir\r\nlas lentejas con aproximadamente un cuarto de lata de\r\nagua y temporada. Calentar hasta que hierva\r\nluego coloque el salmón encima, con la piel hacia arriba. Cubra\r\ny dejar cocer el salmón durante 6-8 minutos\r\nhasta que se sienta firme al pincharlo.","Mientras se cocina el salmón,\r\nhacer el aderezo. Mezclar la aceituna\r\naceite y jugo de limón y sazonar bien.\r\nCuando el salmón esté cocido, sácalo del\r\nsartén con una rodaja de pescado y reservar. girar\r\nel fuego, agregue las espinacas y un tercio\r\ndel aderezo y cocinar hasta que las espinacas\r\nacaba de marchitarse. Vierta las lentejas y\r\nespinacas en dos platos y luego coloque las\r\nsalmón encima. Rocíe sobre el resto\r\naliñar y servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:23');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15652,6841,'es','Zapatero de jamón y puerro','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Utilice un trozo de jamón sobrante en esta cena familiar saludable pero abundante.','["2½ cucharadas de aceite de oliva","450 g de puerros, recortados y en rodajas gruesas","450 ml de caldo de verduras","100 g de harina con levadura, más un poco más para enrollar la masa","75ml de yogur natural sin grasa","1 cucharadita de hojas de tomillo, más un poco para decorar","140 g de guisantes congelados","85 g de jamón rallado","1 manzana pequeña o ½ manzana grande, rallada"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Calentar\r\n½ cucharada de aceite en una sartén grande, luego sofreír los puerros,\r\nrevolviendo durante 5 minutos hasta que comience a ablandarse. Añadir\r\nel caldo, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 5 minutos.","Mientras tanto, vierte la harina en un bol, haz\r\nhacer un hueco en el centro, luego añadir el yogur,\r\nEl aceite restante, las hojas de tomillo y un poco de sal.\r\nCon un cuchillo para cubiertos, mezcle para unir\r\nhasta obtener una masa suave. Dividir en 4 y darles forma.\r\nrondas sobre una superficie enharinada.","Incorpora los guisantes, el jamón y la manzana rallada.\r\nlos puerros, luego dividir en 4 individuales\r\nplatos para tarta o un plato grande. Cubra cada uno con\r\nuna ronda de masa, espolvorear con más tomillo,\r\nluego hornee por 20 minutos hasta que esté dorado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15653,6843,'es','Pollo con crujiente de jamón de Parma','Contiene carne de cerdo: la receta es solo para no musulmanes. Un delicioso plato bajo en grasa en solo 30 minutos, perfecto si vienen amigos a mitad de semana.','["450 g de patatas nuevas, partidas por la mitad si son grandes","225 g de judías verdes, peladas y en rodajas","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","4 lonchas de jamón de Parma","1 diente de ajo, machacado","jugo 1 limon"]','["Cocer las patatas nuevas en agua hirviendo con sal.\r\nagua durante 10-15 minutos, hasta que esté tierna,\r\nagregando las judías verdes para el final\r\n2 minutos. Mientras tanto, ponga cada pollo\r\npechuga entre dos hojas de film transparente\r\ny golpearlas con un rodillo hasta\r\ntienen aproximadamente 1 cm de grosor. Estación.","Calentar una sartén grande y agregar la\r\nJamón de Parma. Cocine por 2 minutos, hasta que esté crujiente.\r\nEscurrir sobre papel de cocina. Añade el aceite a la\r\nsartén y agregue dos de las pechugas de pollo.\r\nCocine durante 3 minutos por cada lado, transfiera a una\r\nplato y mantener caliente. cocinar el otro\r\ndos senos de la misma manera.","Retire la sartén del fuego y agregue\r\nel ajo y el jugo de limón. Agregue el\r\nfrijoles y patatas escurridos y desmenuzados\r\nen el jamón de Parma. Divida el pollo y\r\nverduras entre cuatro platos."]','2026-01-11 13:11:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15654,6845,'es','Pastel de pastor con especias indias','Un pastel de pastor súper saludable y bajo en grasa que se puede guardar en el congelador o disfrutar durante el día.','["Paquete de 500 g de magro de cordero picado","1 cebolla, picada","2 zanahorias, cortadas en cubitos","2 cucharadas de garam masala","200 ml de caldo caliente (cordero, ternera o pollo)","200 g de guisantes congelados","800 g de patatas cortadas en cubitos","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","cilantro en manojo pequeño, picado en trozos grandes","jugo de medio limón, más gajos para servir"]','["En una sartén antiadherente grande, cocine el cordero, la cebolla y las zanahorias, revolviendo con frecuencia, hasta que el cordero se dore y las verduras comiencen a ablandarse, aproximadamente 8 minutos. Agregue el garam masala y un poco de condimento y cocine por 2 minutos más hasta que esté fragante. Vierta el caldo, lleve a ebullición, vierta los guisantes y cocine durante 2 minutos más hasta que los guisantes estén cocidos y la mayor parte del líquido se haya evaporado.","Mientras tanto, cocine las patatas en una cacerola grande con agua con sal hasta que estén tiernas, aproximadamente 8 minutos. Escurrir bien, volver a la sartén y agregar suavemente la cúrcuma y el cilantro; trate de no romper demasiado las patatas.","Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Transfiera la carne picada a una fuente para horno y cubra con las patatas con cúrcuma. Exprima el jugo de limón y hornee durante 30 a 35 minutos hasta que las papas estén doradas. Sirva inmediatamente con rodajas de limón adicionales a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:24');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15655,6847,'es','Salmón con puré de apio nabo y mostaza','Si la belleza está en la piel, entonces el apio nabo es un ejemplo de ello, y es delicioso cuando se sirve como un puré cremoso.','["2 filetes de salmón, de unos 100 g/4 oz cada uno","700 g de apio nabo, pelado para quitar toda la piel nudosa y cortado en trozos como una patata","2 cucharaditas de mostaza integral","2 cucharaditas de jugo de limón","100 g de hojas tiernas de espinaca"]','["Unte ligeramente el salmón con aceite de oliva y sazone con sal y\r\npimienta. Forre una sartén para parrilla con papel de aluminio y\r\nColoca el salmón encima.","Coloque el apio en una cacerola con agua fría para cubrir. sal y\r\nllevar a ebullición. Baja el fuego,\r\ncubra y cocine a fuego lento durante 12-15\r\nminutos hasta que estén tiernos.\r\nPrecalienta la parrilla a fuego medio.\r\nBatir la mostaza, el limón.\r\njugo, una pizca de azúcar, sal, pimienta\r\ny 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva.","Asa el salmón durante cinco minutos.\r\na cada lado. Mientras tanto, escurrir el\r\napio nabo, reservando 1 cucharada para cocinar\r\nagua. Devuelva el apio nabo a la\r\nsartén. Triture hasta que quede bastante suave. Añadir\r\nlas espinacas, revolviendo ocasionalmente\r\na fuego lento, hasta que se ablanden. Agregue\r\n1 cucharada de aderezo de mostaza y el\r\nagua de cocción reservada. Estación.","Vierta el puré en dos platos tibios.\r\nplatos y cubra cada uno con un filete.\r\nRocíe sobre el aderezo sobrante."]','2026-01-11 13:11:25');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15656,6853,'es','Hamantaschen de halva de fresa','Disfruta de estas galletas triangulares hechas con un relleno de tahini, miel y mermelada de fresa. Los hamantaschen se disfrutan a menudo durante la fiesta judía de Purim.','["300 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","165 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda","65 g de azúcar glas","50 g de nata doble","1 yema de huevo","120ml de tahini","2 cucharadas de miel","100 g de mermelada de fresa","1 huevo batido"]','["Para hacer la masa, mezcla todos los ingredientes con las manos hasta formar una masa. Córtalo por la mitad y forma dos discos. Envuelva los discos y déjelos enfriar durante aproximadamente 1 hora.","Para hacer el relleno de halva, mezcla el tahini y la miel en un bol pequeño con una pizca de sal marina. Si está muy espesa, agrega un poco de agua; ten cuidado de no agregar demasiada o se volverá demasiado líquida.","Extienda uno de los trozos de masa sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta que tenga unos 2-3 mm de espesor. Es importante mantenerlo fino o el hamantaschen quedará demasiado grueso una vez doblado. Recorta círculos de masa con un cortador de masa de 6 o 7 cm; cuanto más pequeño sea el cortador, más hamantaschen tendrás.","Unte aproximadamente ½ cucharadita de relleno de halva en cada círculo y cubra con aproximadamente ¼ de cucharadita de mermelada; no querrá más de una cucharadita de los dos combinados, o será difícil doblarlo y el relleno se derramará al hornear.","Para armar el hamantaschen, pinte muy ligeramente el borde exterior de un círculo con huevo batido. Toma el borde inferior izquierdo del círculo (si fuera la esfera de un reloj, sería de las 5 a las 8 en punto) y dóblalo en ángulo hacia el centro para hacer una solapa que cubra el tercio izquierdo del círculo. Luego, toma el lado opuesto del círculo (de 7 a 3 en punto) y dóblalo hacia el centro, superponiendo ligeramente la solapa del lado izquierdo para crear una punta triangular en la parte inferior del círculo. Deberías poder ver el relleno en el medio. Finalmente, dobla la parte superior del círculo hacia abajo para crear una tercera solapa y completar el triángulo; debe verse un pequeño triángulo de relleno en el centro. Presione suavemente las puntas del triángulo para que se peguen realmente. Lo ideal es que los bordes queden sobre el siguiente en un lado y debajo en el otro para crear un efecto de molinete. Coloque el hamantaschen en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel para hornear y déjelo enfriar durante 20-30 minutos para que se endurezca. Repetir con los círculos restantes, luego con el segundo disco de masa y el resto del relleno.","Calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Hornea durante unos 20 minutos hasta que estén dorados; comprueba después de 15 minutos que no se estén oscureciendo demasiado. Transfiera a una rejilla para enfriar."]','2026-01-11 13:11:26');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15657,6859,'es','Canutillos de pistacho','Mejora tus habilidades para hornear con estos celestiales canutillos de pistacho, hechos con masa choux y natillas de pistacho: bien vale la pena el esfuerzo.','["250ml de leche","45 g de pasta de pistacho","4 yemas de huevo","60 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","25 g de harina común","15 g de harina de maíz","25 ml de nata para montar","125ml de leche","65 g de mantequilla sin sal, cortada en cubitos","125 g de harina común","1 cucharada de azúcar en polvo dorada","4 huevos medianos, ligeramente batidos","25 g de azúcar glas","1 bola de jengibre de tallo, finamente picado","25 g de pistachos, tostados y picados en trozos grandes"]','["Empezamos haciendo el relleno de natillas. Calentar la leche con la pasta de pistacho. Batir las yemas de huevo en un bol aparte con el azúcar, la harina y la maicena hasta que quede suave. Cuando la leche esté humeando, justo antes de hervir, viértala poco a poco sobre la mezcla de yemas y bata bien. Regrese la mezcla al fuego y cocine hasta que espese y comience a hervir. Quedará muy grumoso, pero sigue batiendo vigorosamente hasta que quede suave. Vierta en un recipiente limpio. Tapar y dejar enfriar por completo. La natilla de pistacho se puede preparar con hasta dos días de antelación y conservar en un recipiente hermético en el frigorífico.","Mientras tanto, haz los choux. Calentar la leche, 125 ml de agua y la mantequilla en una cacerola grande y llevar a ebullición. Retiramos del fuego y añadimos la harina, el azúcar y una pizca de sal. Mezclar y volver al fuego, revolviendo con una cuchara de madera hasta que la mezcla esté suave y se desprenda de los lados de la sartén. Vierta en una batidora de mesa y mezcle con el accesorio de paleta hasta que la mezcla se haya enfriado (si no tiene batidora, extiéndala en un plato para que se enfríe). Una vez enfriado, comience a batir gradualmente el huevo (ya sea en la batidora de mesa o con un batidor de mano eléctrico) hasta que esté completamente incorporado. Quieres que la mezcla quede brillante y se caiga de la cuchara en 3 a 5 segundos. Poner en una manga pastelera y reservar.","Calienta el horno a 220C/200C ventilador/gas 7. Forra dos bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear. Corta aproximadamente 1 cm del extremo de la manga pastelera y coloca la masa choux hacia abajo en una línea de 10 cm, luego vuelve a colocarla sobre sí misma, dejando espacio entre los canutillos para que los choux se expandan. Es posible que tengas que hacer esto en lotes. Hornee durante 3-4 minutos, luego reduzca el fuego a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Hornee durante 12-15 minutos más hasta que esté completamente dorado y bien cocido. Retirar, perforar el costado de cada uno para que salga el vapor, luego enfriarlos sobre una rejilla. Se puede preparar con un día de anticipación y guardar en un recipiente hermético.","Cuando esté listo para montar, bata la crema hasta que se formen picos suaves y luego reserve. Con batidoras eléctricas, bata la mezcla de natillas hasta que quede suave. Incorporar la nata montada con una espátula y poner las natillas en una manga pastelera.","Para servir, corte la masa choux por la mitad horizontalmente y rellénela con gotas de crema de pistacho. Usando un colador fino, espolvoree abundantemente la parte superior con azúcar glas y espolvoree con jengibre en rama y pistachos picados justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:27');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15658,6873,'es','Pollo al curry con nueces','Rápido y sabroso, este cremoso pollo al curry está listo en menos de 20 minutos.','["1 chile rojo grande, sin semillas","½ trozo de raíz de jengibre fresco, del tamaño de un dedo, picado en trozos grandes","1 diente de ajo gordo","cilantro en manojo pequeño, con los tallos picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos","5 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní","150 ml de caldo de pollo","Tarrina de 200 g de yogur griego"]','["Corta finamente una cuarta parte del chile y luego pon el resto en un procesador de alimentos con el jengibre, el ajo, los tallos de cilantro y un tercio de las hojas. Batir hasta obtener una pasta rugosa con un chorrito de agua si es necesario.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén y luego dora rápidamente los trozos de pollo durante 1 min. Agrega la pasta por un minuto más, luego agrega la mantequilla de maní, el caldo y el yogur. Cuando la salsa burbujee suavemente, cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido y la salsa espese. Agregue la mayor parte del cilantro restante y luego esparza el resto encima con el chile, si lo usa. Comer con arroz o puré de camote."]','2026-01-11 13:11:28');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15659,6875,'es','Macetas de amaretti de naranja y ruibarbo','Un postre fácil que puedes preparar para el almuerzo del domingo. Solo mejoran en el refrigerador, ¡así que adelante y elimina un trabajo!','["400 g de nata doble","360 g de yogur griego desnatado y espeso","150 g de galletas amaretti, partidas en trozos pequeños","500 g de ruibarbo, cortado en trozos de 2½ cm","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más una pizca grande","150ml de zumo de naranja, más ralladura de 1 naranja","4 huevos medianos, más 2 yemas medianas","150 g de mantequilla sin sal"]','["Primero, haz la cuajada. Poner el ruibarbo, una pizca de azúcar y el jugo de naranja en una cacerola a fuego medio y tapar. Cocine durante 10-15 minutos hasta que el ruibarbo esté muy tierno. Retirar del fuego.","Pasar el ruibarbo por un colador fino, empujándolo para exprimir la mayor cantidad de pulpa posible. Mantener la pulpa en el colador para incorporarla más tarde.","Batir los huevos, las yemas y el azúcar hasta que estén pálidos y espumosos. Derrita la mantequilla constantemente en una sartén a fuego lento. Una vez derretido, vierte lentamente la mezcla de huevo y la ralladura de naranja, revolviendo continuamente. Agregue la pulpa de ruibarbo colada y mezcle para combinar, y continúe cocinando suavemente hasta que la cuajada se espese como una natilla. Esto podría tardar entre 10 y 12 minutos, pero ten paciencia y no subas el fuego, ya que podrías revolver los huevos.","Una vez que la cuajada se haya espesado, transfiérala a un bol y bata hasta que quede suave. En este punto, me gusta volver a agregar la pulpa de ruibarbo del colador para darle más cuerpo al postre, pero si quieres una cuajada suave, no hagas esto.","Batir la nata, deteniéndose justo antes de que empiecen a formarse picos suaves. Incorporar el yogur, 300 g de cuajada y la mayor parte de las galletas amaretti.","Vierta la mezcla en ocho vasos y espolvoree sobre los amaretti reservados. Guarde la cuajada restante para usarla en panqueques, granola o para hacer pequeñas tartaletas. Guárdelo en un frasco esterilizado (lave un frasco con agua caliente y jabón, enjuáguelo y luego póngalo en el horno boca abajo a 120C/100C ventilador/gas 1/2 durante 15 minutos para que se seque)."]','2026-01-11 13:11:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15660,6877,'es','Helado vegano de chocolate y plátano','¿Un helado de chocolate bajo en grasas? ¡Realmente existe! Nuestra creación de plátano bombardeado no contiene gluten ni lácteos y está lista en minutos.','["1 plátano congelado","1 cucharadita de cacao en polvo"]','["En una licuadora, mezcle el plátano congelado con el cacao en polvo hasta que quede suave. Come de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:11:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15661,6879,'es','Budín de chocolate, mantequilla de maní y aguacate','El sabor neutro y la textura cremosa del aguacate lo convierten en un maravilloso sustituto de los lácteos en postres o batidos. Estos pequeños botes se conservarán durante unos días en el refrigerador: ¡un excelente postre para preparar con anticipación!','["2 aguacates grandes y maduros, partidos por la mitad y sin hueso","1 plátano grande, picado","5 ciruelas pasas suaves","6 cucharadas de leche de almendras o leche de coco sin azúcar","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de maní suave (sin azúcar, si es posible)","3 cucharadas de cacao en polvo (o cacao en polvo de buena calidad)","100 g de yogur de leche de coco (como el CoYo)","2 cucharaditas de jarabe de arce o miel","chocolate negro (80% cacao, si es posible), para decorar"]','["Coloca la pulpa del aguacate en un procesador de alimentos. Agrega el plátano picado, las ciruelas pasas, la leche de almendras o de coco, la mantequilla de maní suave y el cacao en polvo. Licue hasta que quede suave y agregue un poco más de leche si la cuchilla se atasca. Raspe los lados una o dos veces y mezcle nuevamente.","Divida la mezcla en 4 vasos pequeños. Mezcla el yogur de coco con el jarabe de arce o la miel y cubre cada pudín con una cucharada generosa. Rallar finamente un poco de chocolate amargo por encima y dejar enfriar durante al menos 1 hora."]','2026-01-11 13:11:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15662,6881,'es','Tiramisú fácil y rápido','La leche condensada es el secreto de este postre italiano súper picante. El café y el chocolate son una combinación clásica, simplemente colócalos en capas y disfrútalos.','["3 cucharaditas de café instantáneo en gránulos","3 cucharadas de licor de café (o Camp Chicory & Coffee Essence)","Tarrina de 250 g de mascarpone","85 g de leche condensada","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4-6 dedos de esponja","1 cucharada de cacao en polvo"]','["Mezcle los gránulos de café con 2 cucharadas de agua hirviendo en una jarra grande y revuelva para combinar. Agrega el licor de café y 75ml de agua fría. Vierta en un plato poco profundo y reserve.","Haz la capa de crema batiendo el mascarpone, la leche condensada y el extracto de vainilla con unas varillas eléctricas hasta que quede espeso y suave.","Rompe los dedos de bizcocho en dos o tres trozos y sumérgelos en la mezcla de café durante unos segundos. Coloque unos trozos de bizcocho en el fondo de dos copas de vino o helado y cubra con la crema. Tamizar sobre el cacao y dejar enfriar durante al menos 1 hora antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15663,6883,'es','Tarta de melocotón y almendras','Auténtica tarta italiana de melocotón y almendras','["100 ml de mantequilla fría","200 g de harina común","85 g de azúcar en polvo","3 yemas de huevo","ralladura de limón","50 g de almendras enteras blanqueadas","50 g de azúcar en polvo, más 2 cucharadas","50 g de mantequilla","50 g de harina común","1 huevo grande y 1 yema de huevo","50 g de galletas amaretti, ligeramente trituradas","5-6 melocotones o nectarinas según su tamaño","2 cucharadas de almendras laminadas","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear"]','["Corta la mantequilla en dados lo más pequeños que puedas. si\r\nmojas tu cuchillo en la harina para la masa\r\ny seguir cubriendo la mantequilla con harina como\r\nSi dices, te resultará más fácil.","Poner la mantequilla picada y la harina en la comida.\r\nProcesador y pulso hasta que se vea bien.\r\nmigas de pan. Añade una pizca de sal, la\r\nazúcar, yemas de huevo y ralladura de limón y legumbres\r\nde nuevo – debería casi inmediatamente\r\nadherirse formando una bola. Retirar del\r\nprocesador, colóquelo sobre una hoja de film transparente o\r\npapel de aluminio, presione ligeramente y forme una\r\ntronco compacto (tóquelo lo menos posible).\r\nEnvuelva y enfríe durante al menos 1 hora – el\r\nCuanto más tiempo descanse, menos se encogerá después.","Unte con mantequilla y enharine bien un molde para tarta de 24 cm.\r\nDesenvolver y cortar el rollito de masa en trozos finos.\r\nrebanadas uniformes y úselas para cubrir el fondo\r\ny lados de la lata con solo tocar o\r\nrodajas ligeramente superpuestas. Mantenga un plato de\r\ncubitos de hielo y algunas toallas de papel a mano para\r\nenfríe y séquese las manos mientras trabaja.","Golpee ligeramente la masa con los dedos fríos para que\r\nla base es pareja, y hacer la cáscara un poco\r\nmás grueso alrededor de los lados, asegurándose de que llegue\r\ncompletamente hacia arriba ya que puede encogerse. para igualar\r\nla base, pase rápidamente un cubito de hielo,\r\ndesde el centro hasta los bordes. Relájate de nuevo.","Vierta las almendras y 50 g/2 oz de azúcar.\r\nen el procesador de alimentos y bata hasta\r\nfinamente picado. Cortar la mantequilla y agregar\r\na las almendras con la harina. Proceso\r\nnuevamente hasta que la mezcla parezca fina\r\npan rallado, luego agregar el huevo y ej.\r\nyema y procese brevemente hasta que esté suave y\r\ncremoso. Agrega el amaretti triturado y\r\nzumba brevemente de nuevo. Enfriar.","Precalentar el horno a 180C/gas 4/ventilador\r\n160C. Coloque los melocotones en una cacerola con\r\nagua hirviendo, sacar después de unos segundos\r\nluego enfriar en agua fría. Pelar, cortar por la mitad y\r\ndeshuesar los melocotones, espolvorear con 2 cucharadas\r\nAzúcar y dejar actuar 5 minutos. difundir\r\ncrema amaretti en la base de la masa\r\ncaso. Pon las mitades de melocotón encima.\r\ncon el lado redondeado hacia arriba, cortándolos si es necesario\r\npara llenar el centro. Espolvorear con las almendras","Hornee durante 25-35 minutos hasta que esté dorado.\r\nCompruebe el relleno con un palillo (que\r\ndebería salir apenas moteado) y\r\nasegúrese de que la masa se encoja\r\nla lata. Espolvorear con azúcar glas y servir\r\ntemperatura ambiente, con un vaso de\r\nVino Santo toscano."]','2026-01-11 13:11:29');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15664,6887,'es','Posset de limón con galletas de almendras azucaradas','Hacer tus propios pudines de cítricos individuales es aún más impresionante si los sirves con galletas caseras para sacar la crema.','["600ml de nata doble","200 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","ralladura de 3 limones y 75 ml de zumo","140 g de mantequilla fría, cortada en cubitos","140 g de harina común","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado, más un poco más para espolvorear","50g de arroz molido (o más harina si no la encuentras)","85 g de almendras laminadas"]','["Primero haz el posset. poner la crema\r\nun cazo grande con el azúcar y suavemente\r\nCaliente, revolviendo, hasta que el azúcar se derrita.\r\nLlevar a fuego lento y burbujear durante 1 min.\r\nApagar el fuego y agregar el limón.\r\nralladura y jugo. Dividir en macetas o\r\ntazones, enfriar a temperatura ambiente, luego\r\nCubra con cuidado y enfríe durante al menos 3 horas.\r\no hasta 24 hrs.","Para hacer las galletas de mantequilla, calentar el horno.\r\na 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Batir la mantequilla y la harina en un procesador de alimentos\r\nhasta que no queden grumos de mantequilla (o frote\r\njunto con las yemas de los dedos). Inclínate hacia un\r\ntazón y agregue el azúcar, el arroz molido y\r\nalmendras. Forre la base de aproximadamente 22 cm.\r\nmolde cuadrado con papel para hornear. consejo\r\nen la mezcla y presiónela firmemente,\r\nhaciéndolo lo más plano posible. Dragar con\r\nmás azúcar y hornee por 25-30 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado pálido. Dejar enfriar en la lata.","Cortar las galletas de mantequilla en trozos y\r\nservir con los possets y las cucharitas."]','2026-01-11 13:11:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15665,6889,'es','Fondants de chocolate y maní con tierra de chocolate y cerezas','La tierra de chocolate es una gran tendencia en los restaurantes en este momento: sírvala junto con su pudín medio derretido para lograr un gran factor sorpresa.','["50 g de mantequilla blanda, más mantequilla derretida extra para engrasar","cacao en polvo, para espolvorear","85 g de mantequilla de maní crujiente","175 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","4 huevos grandes","85 g de harina común","300 g de chocolate negro, partido en trozos y derretido","compota de cerezas en tarro grande","6 bolas de helado de vainilla, para servir","6 cerezas con tallo, para servir","1 bizcocho de chocolate comprado (sin hielo), unos 250 g"]','["Primero haz la tierra. Calentar el horno a\r\n180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Cortar en rodajas finas\r\npastel de chocolate y colocar en bandejas para hornear\r\nforrado con papel para hornear. Hornear para\r\n30 minutos, volteando las rebanadas hasta la mitad, hasta que\r\ncrujiente al tacto. Poner en un procesador de alimentos.\r\ny mezcle hasta obtener migajas crujientes. mantendrá\r\nbien por hasta una semana en una lata hermética.","Hacer los fondants con pincel 6\r\nEl dariole se moldea bien con mantequilla derretida.\r\nEnfríe durante 1 minuto y luego cepille nuevamente. Pon un\r\ncucharada de cacao en polvo en una y agitar\r\naproximadamente para que todo el interior quede recubierto, luego\r\nvierte el resto en el siguiente y toca el\r\nparte inferior del dariole para sacar cualquier\r\nexceso. Repetir con todos los darioles.","Batir la mantequilla blanda,\r\nmantequilla de maní, azúcar y vainilla para\r\nbatirlos, luego batir los huevos,\r\nseguido de la harina. Agregue el derretido\r\nchocolate y dividir entre el\r\ndariolas. Enfriar por hasta 24 hrs.","Para servir, caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/\r\ngas 6. Hornea los fondants durante 10-12 minutos –\r\nLa parte superior estará fijada, pero deberías sentir un\r\nmedio suave cuando lo empujas. Añade un pequeño\r\nmontón de tierra a cada plato y cubra con un\r\ncereza – o poner la tierra en un mini cubo\r\no maceta. Añade una cucharada de cereza.\r\ncompota en cada plato y cubra con\r\nuna bola de helado de vainilla. Finalmente,\r\nRetire con cuidado cada fondant de chocolate.\r\nen el plato – deberían salir\r\nfácilmente. Servir inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:11:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15666,6891,'es','Cuencos de globos de chocolate','Estos tazones comestibles convertirán el postre de tu cena en algo realmente impresionante: llénalo con helado o tu pudín favorito.','["300g de chocolate (nosotros usamos negro, pero elige tu favorito)","un postre de tu elección (nosotros usamos helado y panal)","4 globos pequeños"]','["Rompe el chocolate en trozos pequeños.\r\nPoner en un recipiente suspendido sobre una cacerola de\r\nAgua hirviendo y dejar derretir.\r\nRetirar del fuego y dejar enfriar.\r\ndurante 5 min. Mientras tanto, explota tu\r\nglobos: quieres que cada tazón sea\r\nunos 10 cm de ancho, así que intenta elegir pequeños\r\nglobos y no los infles demasiado\r\nmucho. Atar con un nudo.","Forre una bandeja para hornear con pergamino.\r\nSosteniendo el extremo anudado del globo,\r\nsumergirlo en el chocolate derretido para crear\r\nla forma de tu cuenco. Colóquelo en la bandeja y\r\nSostenga el globo durante unos segundos hasta que\r\npiscinas de chocolate alrededor de la base permitiendo\r\nque sueltes el globo. Continuar\r\ncon los globos restantes. Relájate durante al\r\nal menos 30 minutos o hasta que cuaje.","Cuando el chocolate se haya endurecido, revienta\r\nlos globos y pélalos con cuidado\r\nlejos de los cuencos. Llénalo con tu\r\npostre elegido – el helado es bueno\r\nporque mantiene los tazones fríos."]','2026-01-11 13:11:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15667,6893,'es','Tarta de limón con frutos rojos de verano','Una picante tarta de limón del señor Ramsay. La versión de Gordon de la clásica Tarte au citron francesa bien vale la pena.','["5 limones sin cera","6 huevos","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","200ml de nata doble","azúcar glas, para espolvorear y decorar","375 g de masa de postre en bloque","4 cucharadas de azúcar glas","300 g de fresas, peladas, cortadas por la mitad o en cuartos","350 g de frambuesas","150 g de arándanos","1 cucharadita de vinagre de jerez","un puñado de hojas de menta, finamente trituradas"]','["Ralla finamente la ralladura de 3 de los limones en un bol. Corta todos los limones por la mitad, luego usa un tenedor para exprimir todo el jugo y la pulpa en el recipiente con la ralladura; no te preocupes por las semillas. Rompe los huevos en un recipiente aparte y luego agrega el azúcar en polvo hasta que estén completamente combinados. Incorpora la mezcla de crema y jugo de limón y reserva.","Coloque un aro para tarta de 23 cm o un molde para flan de fondo suelto en una bandeja para hornear forrada con papel vegetal. Sobre una superficie espolvoreada con azúcar glas, extienda la masa hasta obtener el grosor de una moneda de £1. Levante sobre un rodillo, luego cubra el aro para tarta o el molde para flan, dejando el exceso colgando sobre el borde. Presione con cuidado la masa hacia los lados con una pequeña bola de masa. Ponga en el frigorífico o congelador durante 20 minutos para permitir que la masa se enfríe.","Mientras la masa se enfría, caliente el horno a 200 ° C / ventilador 180 ° C / gas 6. Pinche la base de la masa, cubra con papel vegetal y frijoles para hornear, luego hornee durante 15 minutos. Retire el papel y los frijoles, luego hornee la caja durante 5 a 10 minutos más hasta que esté dorada y crujiente. Bajar el horno a 150C/ventilador 130C/gas 2.","Utilice un cucharón para pasar la crema de limón a través de un colador y colocarla en un bol, presionando la pulpa para extraer la mayor cantidad de jugo posible. Quite las burbujas de la superficie de las natillas y luego viértalas en una jarra. Saque un poco la tarta del horno y luego vierta la crema hasta que llegue a la superficie. Quizás te sobra algo. Empuje la tarta nuevamente hacia adentro, luego hornee durante 35 a 40 minutos hasta que la parte superior forme una corteza ligera y la crema esté lista. Dejar enfriar y luego enfriar.","Mientras la tarta se enfría, prepara la ensalada de frutos rojos. Coloca una sartén antiadherente grande a fuego medio y esparce el azúcar glas por la base. Calentar hasta que el azúcar se disuelva y caramelice. Agregue las bayas, mezcle con el azúcar y luego agregue el vinagre de jerez. Burbujee durante un minuto hasta que todo empiece a ablandarse, luego viértalo en un plato y déjelo reposar.\r\nenfriar un poco.","Use un cuchillo de sierra para recortar la masa y hacer un borde limpio. Espolvoree ligeramente la tarta con azúcar glas y luego utilice un soplete para caramelizar la parte superior. Deje reposar la parte superior, luego repita el proceso para obtener una capa extra gruesa de caramelo. Agrega la menta a las bayas. Sirva la tarta en rodajas con un plato de ensalada de frutos rojos al lado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:30');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15668,6895,'es','Tonto de cuajada de limón y yogur','Disfrute de un postre familiar deliciosamente fácil, listo en solo cinco minutos.','["Tarro de 300 g de cuajada de limón (usamos cuajada de limón tradicional de Duchy Originals)","Tarrina de 500g yogur griego 0%","200g punnet raspberries","1 cucharada de azúcar glas","galletas de mantequilla, para servir"]','["Pon la cuajada de limón y el yogur en un bol. Doblar para lograr un efecto ondulado. Divida la mezcla en cuatro vasos y enfríe.","Mezcle las frambuesas y el azúcar glas y triture suavemente, luego vierta su jugo sobre la mezcla fría y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:11:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15669,6897,'es','Helado de vainilla de verdad','Prepara helado de vainilla súper cremoso y cómelo tal cual, o añádele diferentes sabores para todos los gustos.','["500 ml de leche entera","Bote de 300ml de nata doble","1 vaina de vainilla","5 yemas de huevo grandes (congela las claras para la próxima vez que quieras hacer merengue)","140 g de azúcar en polvo dorado"]','["Poner la leche y la nata en un cazo.\r\nCorta la vaina de vainilla a lo largo con\r\nun cuchillo pequeño y afilado y sáquelo\r\ntantas de las pequeñas semillas negras que puedas\r\nen la mezcla de leche. Añade la vaina a\r\nla sartén también. Calentar todo sobre un\r\nfuego lento, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que\r\ncasi hierve; verás algunas burbujas en\r\nel borde. Retirar del fuego y reservar\r\ndurante 30 minutos para que la vainilla se infunda.","Mezclar las yemas de huevo y el azúcar en\r\nun cuenco. Vierta poco a poco la leche sobre el\r\nmezcla de huevo, batiendo continuamente\r\nhasta que se combinen. Vierta todo nuevamente en\r\nla sartén limpia, volver a poner a fuego lento y\r\ncocine durante 8-10 minutos, revolviendo todo el tiempo\r\ncon una cuchara de madera, hasta que la natilla\r\nes lo suficientemente grueso como para cubrir la parte posterior del\r\ncuchara. Asegúrese de que no hierva o\r\nterminarás con huevos revueltos.","Pasar las natillas por un colador fino\r\nen un tazón, luego colóquelo en un tazón más grande,\r\nun tercio lleno de hielo y agua, para enfriarlo\r\nhacia abajo – sigue revolviendo de vez en cuando\r\npara detener la formación de piel. Relájate para asegurarte\r\nesta completamente frio, poniendo film transparente\r\ndirectamente sobre la superficie de las natillas\r\npara evitar que se forme piel.","Vierta las natillas en un helado.\r\nmáquina. Rotación siguiendo a los fabricantes\r\ninstrucciones hasta que se congele, luego vierta en\r\nun recipiente de metal o plástico apto para congelador.\r\nCubra y congele hasta que esté sólido. Si no lo haces\r\nSi tienes una máquina para hacer helados, vierte el\r\nnatillas en el recipiente y congelar.\r\nCada 2-3 horas, saque la mezcla del\r\ncongelador y revuelva. Una vez que esté suavemente\r\nlisto, batirlo bien con batidoras eléctricas,\r\nluego congelarlo. Se mantendrá en el\r\ncongelador por 3 meses. Quitar de\r\ncongelador 15 minutos antes de servir\r\ndeje que se ablande lo suficiente como para sacarlo."]','2026-01-11 13:11:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15670,6901,'es','Budines de taza de té de maracuyá','Cocine estos bizcochos al vapor en moldes pequeños y resistentes y sírvalos en tacitas de porcelana cuando tenga invitados.','["250 g de maracuyá o crema de limón","4 maracuyás maduros, sin semillas ni pulpa","3 huevos grandes","100 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","85 g de mantequilla, derretida","100ml de leche","140 g de harina común","½ cucharadita de polvo para hornear","azúcar glas, hasta espolvorear","crema cuajada, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Línea\r\nuna fuente para asar grande y honda con un paño de cocina,\r\nreservar y hervir la tetera. Pon 100 g de\r\nla cuajada en un bol, mezclar la cuajada restante\r\ncon las semillas y pulpa de maracuyá, y\r\ndividir entre 6 tazas de té o moldes\r\n(Los míos rondaban los 200 ml).","Batir los huevos y el azúcar en\r\nun tazón grande hasta que esté pálido y esponjoso; esto\r\ntoma unos 5 minutos. Añadir lo reservado\r\ncuajada, mantequilla, leche, harina y repostería.\r\npolvo. Incorporar la mezcla junto con un\r\nespátula hasta que no queden grumos visibles de\r\nharina, luego dividir entre las tazas de té.","Coloque las tazas de té en la fuente para asar.\r\nLlene con cuidado la lata con agua caliente de\r\nla tetera llegue aproximadamente a la mitad del\r\nlados de las tazas de té, teniendo cuidado de no\r\npara que entre agua en los vasos. Hornear para\r\n50 minutos hasta que suba y esté dorado. una vez\r\ncocidos, puedes enfriar los budines y\r\nenfríe hasta por un día o envuélvalo en film transparente\r\ny congelar por hasta 2 meses. Para recalentar,\r\nllevar a temperatura ambiente, volver a poner en un\r\nbaño maría caliente en el horno y hornear durante\r\n15 minutos a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Antes\r\nservir, espolvorear cada pudín con un poco\r\nazúcar glas y poner una cucharada de cuajada\r\ncrema encima, si quieres."]','2026-01-11 13:11:31');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15671,6903,'es','muffins de pan de maíz','Estos sabrosos refrigerios son excelentes para picnics y loncheras; además, se pueden congelar con anticipación.','["85 g de mantequilla derretida, más un poco para freír","1 maíz dulce grande, con los granos cortados","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","½ chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","140 g de harina común","140 g de polenta o harina de maíz","2 cucharaditas de polvo para hornear","50 g de queso cheddar fuerte rallado","2 huevos","Bote de 284 ml de suero de leche","100ml de leche"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y\r\nunte un molde para muffins de 12 agujeros con un poco de\r\nla mantequilla derretida Poner los granos de elote\r\nen una sartén con la cebolla, la guindilla y un pomo\r\nde mantequilla. Freír suavemente durante 5-10 minutos hasta que\r\ndorado y suave.","Mezclar la harina, la polenta y hornear.\r\npolvo y queso cheddar con 1 cucharadita de sal en un\r\ntazón grande para mezclar. Batir juntos el\r\nhuevos, suero de leche y leche, luego agregue\r\nlos ingredientes secos con el resto\r\nmezcla de mantequilla derretida y maíz. dividir\r\nentre los agujeros para muffins (estarán\r\nbastante lleno) y hornee por 25-30 minutos o hasta\r\ndorado y bien cocido – pinchar\r\nen una brocheta para comprobar. Es mejor comerlo caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:11:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15672,6905,'es','Nectarinas al horno con almendras y Marsala','Crea un delicioso aderezo al estilo italiano para melocotones y nectarinas como postre sencillo de verano.','["6 nectarinas, partidas por la mitad y sin hueso","100 g de galletas amaretti","100 g de mantequilla, ablandada","85 g de almendras molidas","85 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","1 huevo","1-2 cucharadas de almendras tostadas y laminadas","250ml marsala","Yogur griego o crème fraîche, para servir"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nColoque las mitades de nectarina cómodamente en un\r\nfuente para hornear, con el lado cortado hacia arriba. Pon los amaretti\r\ngalletas en un tazón grande y use el extremo\r\nde un rodillo para triturar hasta obtener migajas. Añadir\r\nla mantequilla blanda, las almendras molidas,\r\nel azúcar en polvo y el huevo y revuelva.","Introduzca cucharadas de la mezcla en el\r\ncavidades de las nectarinas, amontonándose más\r\ncubra hasta que la mezcla esté dividida uniformemente\r\nentre ellos. Espolvorear con almendras, luego\r\nvierte con cuidado el Marsala en el plato.\r\na través de un espacio entre la fruta para que\r\nla cobertura no se empapa. Hornear para\r\n40-50 minutos hasta que esté dorado y crujiente, y\r\nla fruta es suave. Comer caliente con los jugos.\r\nservido con una cucharada y una cucharada de griego\r\nyogur o crème fraîche al lado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15673,6907,'es','Pilas de desorden de Eton','Nos encantan los pudines individuales, añaden un cierto ''Je ne sais quoi'' a una ocasión. Y estos pequeños y fabulosos merengues son definitivamente un pudín de ocasión.','["1 clara de huevo","350 g de azúcar glas","1 cucharadita de semillas de cardamomo trituradas","un poco de aceite para engrasar","Bote de 142ml de nata doble","jugo 1?2 limón","250 g de frambuesas en canastilla"]','["Batir ligeramente la clara de huevo y luego incorporar la\r\nazúcar glas y cardamomo para que quede firme\r\nglaseado de fondant. Enrolle el glaseado en 8 pelotas de golf del tamaño de\r\nbolas (probablemente no las necesites todas).\r\nDe dos en dos, coloque las bolas en lados opuestos.\r\nextremos de un trozo de papel de horno engrasado,\r\nluego cocine en el microondas durante 30-40 segundos a temperatura alta hasta que\r\ncuadruplicó su tamaño. Dejar enfriar unos cuantos\r\nminutos, luego levante el papel y repita hasta\r\ntodas las bolitas están cocidas.","Montar la nata con la mitad del zumo de limón.\r\nTriture la mitad de las frambuesas y luego dóblelas.\r\nla crema. Para servir colocar un poco de salpicadura\r\nde crema de frambuesa en cada plato. pila\r\nun merengue con un poco más de nata, luego\r\ncolocar otro merengue encima. Vierta sobre\r\nmás crema, luego cubra con unas cuantas\r\nframbuesas. Espolvorea con azúcar glas y sirve."]','2026-01-11 13:11:32');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15674,8783,'es','aderezo de tahini','Olvídate de comprar en la tienda y haz un aderezo de tahini casero. Cremoso y picante, dará vida a las ensaladas. Se mantendrá frío hasta por cinco días.','["4 dátiles sin hueso, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de tahini","1 limón, exprimido","1 diente de ajo pequeño","½ cucharadita de comino molido","75ml de aceite de sabor neutro, como vegetal"]','["Pon los dátiles sin hueso en un recipiente resistente al calor. Vierta 150 ml de agua hirviendo hasta cubrir. Déjelo en remojo durante 20 minutos hasta que se ablande, luego vierta en una licuadora con el agua del bol, el tahini, el jugo de limón, el diente de ajo, el comino molido y el aceite de sabor neutro. Mezcle hasta que quede suave y agregue más agua si es necesario para que quede lloviznante. Sazone al gusto. Se mantendrá frío en un recipiente hermético hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 13:11:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15675,9368,'es','Tabulé crujiente de cordero y guisantes','Prepara nuestro kebab horneado en bandeja y utiliza las sobras como base para hacer este tabulé de cordero, guisantes, granada y trigo bulgur. Es genial para almuerzos preparados con antelación.','["120 g de bulgur seco","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 limón, exprimido","un puñado pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","un pequeño puñado de ramitas de menta, las hojas recogidas y finamente picadas","200 g de guisantes congelados","150 g de kebab de cordero horneado en bandeja sobrantes, picados en trozos grandes (ver paso 2)","4 cebolletas, finamente cortadas","2 pimientos rojos asados, finamente picados","30 g de semillas de granada, para servir"]','["Cocine el bulgur siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, luego escúrralo y enjuáguelo con agua fría. Dejar enfriar un poco. Mezcle 3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva con el jugo de limón y las hierbas en un tazón grande, luego agregue el bulgur y sazone al gusto.","Rocíe el aceite de oliva restante en una sartén y póngala a fuego medio-alto. Incorpora los guisantes congelados y las sobras del cordero y fríe durante 5 a 6 minutos hasta que estén crujientes y los guisantes revienten. Agregue las cebolletas y los pimientos y cocine por solo 1 minuto y luego retire del fuego. Agregue el tabulé y esparza sobre las semillas de granada para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15676,9369,'es','Aplastante','Disfruta de esta ensalada para acompañar tus platos turcos favoritos. El ezme auténtico se pica a mano muy finamente, o puedes usar un procesador de alimentos, si lo deseas.','["2-3 tomates maduros grandes, cortados en cuartos, unos 400 g","1 pimiento romano rojo mediano, sin semillas y picado en trozos grandes","1 sivri biber mediano o chile verde pequeño, sin semillas y picado en trozos grandes","1 cebolla pequeña, picada en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo grandes, machacados","25 g de perejil fresco de hoja plana","2 cucharadas de pasta de pimiento rojo","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","2 cucharadas de melaza de granada","1 cucharada de pul biber","2 cucharaditas de zumaque","1 cucharada de menta seca","60ml de aceite de oliva virgen extra"]','["Pon los tomates y todos los pimientos en un procesador de alimentos y tritura hasta que estén finamente picados. Pasar por un colador, colocar sobre un bol y dejar colar. Agregue las cebollas, el ajo y el perejil al procesador de alimentos y mezcle hasta que estén finamente picados, luego reserve.","Agregue la pasta de pimiento rojo, el puré de tomate, la melaza de granada, el pul biber, el zumaque, la menta seca y la mayor parte del aceite de oliva virgen extra en un tazón para servir y bata bien para que todo se combine como una salsa. Agregue la mezcla de cebolla picada y la mezcla de pimientos colados junto con 1 cucharadita de sal marina en escamas. Revuelva bien y luego rocíe con el resto del aceite de oliva virgen extra para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:33');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15677,8789,'es','Brochetas de pollo con tortas caseras','Asa brochetas de pollo con especias y envuélvelas en panes planos calientes con una vibrante ensalada: esta es una receta ganadora de Matty','["300 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","1 cucharadita de semillas de nigella","1 cucharadita de chile en polvo","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva, más extra para freír","30 g de mantequilla sin sal, derretida","1 cebolla rallada","1 kg de pollo picado","5 dientes de ajo machacados","1 chile verde, sin semillas y finamente picado","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","1 cucharada de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","1 cucharada de zumaque","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","200 g de col lombarda, cortada finamente","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino blanco","1⁄4 pepino, finamente rebanado","1 pequeña joya, triturada","3 tomates de res","1 cebolla morada, cortada en rodajas","un puñado pequeño de perejil","1 limón, exprimido","250 g de yogur griego","1 limón, exprimido","1 cucharadita de zumaque"]','["Empiece por hacer las brochetas de pollo. Coloca la cebolla rallada en un paño de cocina limpio y exprime tanta agua como puedas sobre un fregadero. Agregue a un bol junto con el resto de los ingredientes excepto el aceite, luego sazone con 1 cucharadita de sal y 1 cucharadita de pimienta negra molida. Mezcle bien hasta que esté pegajoso, luego divídalo en cuatro porciones. Mójese ligeramente las manos y junte cada porción hasta formar un tronco, luego enrósquelo en una brocheta de metal grande. Tapar y reservar en el frigorífico hasta que sea necesario.","Para la ensalada, añade el repollo a un bol pequeño con el vinagre y sazona. En un recipiente para servir, agregue todos los ingredientes restantes y sazone bien. Para el aderezo de yogur, combine todos los ingredientes, sazone y reserve hasta que los necesite.","Para hacer los panes planos, vierta la harina, las semillas de nigella y el chile en polvo en un bol con una pizca grande de sal. Vierta el aceite de oliva y 150 ml de agua tibia y mezcle para combinar. Forme una bola y luego colóquela sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada. Amasar durante 5 minutos, hasta que la masa esté suave y ya no se pegue a los dedos. Dividir en 4 bolas iguales y extender cada una sobre una superficie ligeramente enharinada hasta formar un círculo grande y delgado, de unos 18 cm de ancho.","Calienta una sartén grande a fuego medio-alto. Una vez caliente, añade un pequeño chorrito de aceite de oliva y extiende por toda la sartén. Agregue el primer pan plano a la sartén y cocine durante 2-3 minutos por cada lado, o hasta que quede salpicado de manchas marrones. Una vez cocido, retírelo a una bandeja para hornear, unte un lado con la mantequilla derretida y repita con los panes planos restantes. Mantener caliente en horno bajo.","Cuando esté listo para cocinar el pollo, calienta la parrilla a fuego medio-alto. Forre una bandeja para hornear grande con papel de aluminio y agregue las brochetas. Rocíe con aceite y cocine a la parrilla durante 20-25 minutos, volteándolo regularmente, hasta que el pollo esté bien cocido. Utilice un termómetro para carnes si tiene uno para comprobar que esté bien cocido; debe indicar 70 ° C.","Sirva las brochetas de pollo con los panes planos, la ensalada y el yogur para que las personas preparen sus propios rollitos."]','2026-01-11 13:11:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15678,9371,'es','Dip picante de pimiento rojo y carne picada crujiente de harissa','Esta es mi interpretación de un plato increíble, muhammara, una salsa picante de pimiento rojo y nueces del Medio Oriente. Es muy fácil de preparar, especialmente si usas un frasco de pimientos asados. He cubierto el mío con carne picada de harissa crujiente para una comida más completa, pero si lo omites es perfecto para fiestas, servido con crudités o pan pita, o untado en el interior de sándwiches.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva y más para rociar","1 cebolla, finamente picada","400 g de carne picada vegana","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","2 cucharadas de pasta de harissa","un puñado de hojas de perejil de hoja plana","un puñado de eneldo fresco","sal y pimienta","100 g de nueces","400 g de pimientos rojos asados","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","Jugo de un limón","1 cucharadita de pimentón","1 limón, cortado en gajos","4-8 panes planos"]','["En una sartén grande, tuesta las nueces durante unos 5 minutos a fuego medio, agitando ocasionalmente la sartén, hasta que las nueces estén fragantes y tostadas. Retirar de la sartén y reservar.","En la misma sartén, calentar las 2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva a fuego medio y sofreír la cebolla con una pizca generosa de sal y pimienta negra, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que esté muy suave. Agrega la carne picada y sube un poco el fuego. Cocine durante 5-7 minutos, revolviendo ocasionalmente, hasta que la mezcla esté dorada y crujiente. Agregue el ajo y cocine por un minuto más, luego agregue la harissa y combine. Retirar del fuego y reservar.","Reservando 1 cucharada para decorar, mezcle las nueces tostadas con el resto de los ingredientes muhammara en una licuadora de alta velocidad, hasta que se forme una salsa suave. Pruebe y sazone con sal y pimienta, luego extiéndalo en un plato grande con el dorso de una cuchara.","Cubra la salsa con la carne picada crujiente de harissa, espolvoree con las nueces restantes y píquelas un poco si lo desea. Termine con hierbas frescas, un chorrito extra de aceite de oliva y una pizca de pimienta negra. Sirva con panes planos para recogerlo todo o con arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:11:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15679,9372,'es','Brochetas de pollo tikka con freidora','Usa tu freidora para hacer estos kebabs de pollo tikka. Disfrútelo con naans con sus acompañamientos favoritos, como chutney de mango, raita, pepinillo de lima o bhaji desmenuzado.','["3-4 pechugas de pollo (unos 600 g), cortadas en trozos pequeños","150 g de yogur natural, más extra para servir (opcional)","2 cucharadas de pasta de curry tikka masala","2 dientes de ajo, machacados o finamente rallados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y rallado","2 Nans grandes (usamos nans redondos)","un puñado de cilantro picado","tu elección de chutney de mango, pepinillo de lima, pepino cortado en cubitos o raita y bhaji desmenuzado"]','["Pon el pollo en un bol con el yogur, la pasta de curry, el ajo y el jengibre. Mezcle todo y déjelo marinar durante al menos 20 minutos o enfríelo durante la noche. Se mantendrá tapado y refrigerado durante un día.","Calienta la freidora a 180C. Enhebra el pollo en brochetas; necesitarás entre cuatro y ocho. Si su freidora es lo suficientemente grande como para contener las brochetas más largas, use cuatro; de lo contrario, use ocho más cortas o córtelas por la mitad. (Como alternativa, fría el pollo en trozos durante 15 a 20 minutos, volteándolo hasta la mitad, hasta que esté bien cocido. Es posible que tengas que hacerlo en tandas).","Caliente los naans siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete; el microondas es una buena opción ya que tiende a ablandarlos, lo que resulta útil para envolver el pollo. O salpique los panes con agua y luego tuéstelos.","Sirve los naans cubiertos con pollo, cilantro picado, un chorrito de yogur, si lo deseas, y acompañamientos de tu elección."]','2026-01-11 13:11:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15680,9373,'es','damas completas','Pruebe esta brillante receta egipcia del jefe de cocina del restaurante londinense Ombra. Elaborado con habas, se tritura hasta obtener un puré con trozos junto con ajo, limón y tahini.','["Lata de 400 g de habas (disponibles online) o habas","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","100 ml de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile","2 tomates grandes y maduros, picados (o una lata de 200 g de tomates picados, si los tomates no son de temporada)","½ limón, exprimido","2 cucharadas de tahini"]','["Escurrir los frijoles y enjuagar. Llene la lata vacía y limpia con agua y viértala en una cacerola con los frijoles. Llévalos a ebullición para que se calienten y luego retíralos del fuego.","Mientras tanto, en una sartén mediana aparte, sofreír la cebolla y el ajo en todo menos unas cucharadas de aceite de oliva durante 5 minutos, luego agregar 2 cucharaditas de sal marina en hojuelas, el comino, las hojuelas de chile y los tomates. Escurrir los frijoles, reservando un poco del líquido de cocción. Agregue a la mezcla de cebolla y cocine a fuego lento durante 30 minutos, revolviendo con frecuencia y agregando un poco del líquido de cocción si se ve seco.","Con un machacador de patatas, triture los frijoles con el resto del aceite de oliva, el jugo de limón y el tahini. La consistencia final debe ser la de un puré suave y con trozos. Si se parte un poco, mezclar con una gota de agua fría."]','2026-01-11 13:11:34');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15681,9374,'es','Brochetas kofta de cordero iraquí','Prepara estas brochetas de cordero con berenjenas harissa. El ganador de Celebrity MasterChef UK 2020 comparte la receta que transporta a su papá de regreso a su tierra natal','["3 dientes de ajo, machacados o rallados","trozo de jengibre del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente rallado","2 chalotes, picados en trozos grandes","un puñado pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","2 ramitas de menta, hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","500 g de carne picada de cordero","1 cucharada de cilantro picado","2 cucharadas de semillas de granada","hummus, ensalada fattoush, panes planos y tzatziki, para servir (opcional)","6 berenjenas tiernas","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","75 g de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de harissa"]','["Primero, haz las berenjenas. Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas. 4. Cortar las berenjenas por la mitad a lo largo y marcar la pulpa en forma transversal, con cuidado de no cortarla del todo. Combine el aceite y el comino en un tazón pequeño y sazone bien. Cepille esto sobre las berenjenas. Ase durante 45 minutos o hasta que esté suave. Retirar a un plato.","Derretir la mantequilla en una sartén pequeña y sofreír la harissa con una pizca de sal durante unos minutos. Rocíe esto sobre las berenjenas cocidas.","Mientras tanto, ponga el ajo, el jengibre, las chalotas, el perejil, la mitad de la menta, el comino, el cilantro, la canela, el puré de tomate y 1 cucharadita de sal y pimienta negra recién molida en un procesador de alimentos. Bate hasta que todo esté finamente picado, unos 30 segundos.","Coloca el cordero en un tazón grande y agrega la mezcla de especias, revolviendo hasta que todo esté bien combinado. Si usa brochetas de bambú, déjelas en remojo durante 15 minutos antes de continuar.","Forme albóndigas con puñados de la mezcla de cordero y enróllelas en las brochetas. Enrolle la carne en sus manos para aplanarla y darle forma de huevo. Continúe hasta que se haya utilizado toda la mezcla.","Caliente la parrilla a temperatura alta y ase el kofta durante unos 6 minutos, luego déle la vuelta y cocine durante 6 minutos más, o hasta que la carne esté bien cocida. Coloque el kofta encima de las berenjenas y esparza el resto de las semillas de menta, cilantro y granada. Sirva con hummus, ensalada fattoush, panes planos y tzatziki, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:11:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15682,9375,'es','Pilaf dorado con especias y chalotas crujientes','Combine chalotes crujientes, especias calientes, nueces crujientes y frutos rojos para hacer este impresionante pilaf. Sirva solo con yogur o junto con verduras, carne o pescado.','["250 g de arroz basmati","25 g de mantequilla","2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal, más un poco más para freír","1 cebolla, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 rama pequeña de canela","8 vainas de cardamomo","1 anís estrellado","1 limon","600 ml de caldo de verduras o pollo caliente, o 1 pastilla de caldo mezclada con agua caliente del hervidor","6 chalotes, pelados, cortados por la mitad y en rodajas finas","50g de nueces de tu elección (nosotros usamos una mezcla de anacardos, pistachos y almendras laminadas)","200 gramos de yogur natural","una pizca grande de azafrán","125 g de frutos secos de tu elección, como albaricoques, arándanos o pasas","un puñado de cilantro, hojas recogidas"]','["Vierta el arroz en una cacerola y cúbralo con agua tibia, luego déjelo en remojo durante 30 minutos.","Mientras tanto, derrita la mantequilla en una sartén grande a fuego medio, luego rocíe el aceite y fría la cebolla y el ajo durante 8 a 10 minutos, revolviendo hasta que la cebolla esté transparente.","Agrega la tierra y las especias enteras, chisporrotea en la mantequilla y el aceite durante 1 o 2 minutos, luego escurre el arroz y agrégalo a la sartén. Pele tres tiras largas de ralladura de limón con un pelador de verduras y colóquelas en la sartén. Revuelva todo, vierta sobre el caldo y cocine a fuego lento. Revuelva nuevamente y cubra, luego continúe cocinando a fuego lento durante 2 minutos más. Apagar el fuego y dejar reposar, sin abrir la tapa, durante 15 minutos.","Vierta 2 cm de aceite en una sartén profunda o wok a fuego medio y caliente a 180 ° C o hasta que un cubo de pan se dore en 20 segundos. Freír las chalotas en dos tandas, chisporroteando durante 8 minutos por tanda hasta que estén doradas. Esto llevará un tiempo y se contagian rápidamente, así que esté atento para evitarlo. Vierta con una espumadera en un plato forrado con papel de cocina, luego espolvoree con sal y deje enfriar un poco.","Tuesta las nueces en una sartén seca a fuego medio-bajo durante 2-3 minutos hasta que estén doradas. Mezclar el yogur con el azafrán y una pizca de sal en un bol pequeño y reservar.","Destapa el arroz y comprueba que esté listo: debe estar tierno y haber absorbido todo el líquido. Si no, tapar y dejar reposar otros 5 minutos. Una vez cocidos, esponja los granos con un tenedor y revuelve con las nueces y los frutos secos. Vierta sobre una fuente para servir, quitando las especias enteras y la cáscara de limón mientras lo hace. Distribuya sobre las chalotas crujientes y las hojas de cilantro y sirva con el yogur de azafrán como acompañamiento."]','2026-01-11 13:11:35');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15683,9376,'es','Cordero harissa cocido a fuego lento','Pruebe este cordero harissa cocido a fuego lento como asado alternativo. Nos encanta la textura: está medio asada y medio desmenuzada, tierna con un tenedor pero aún así es fácil de tallar.','["2 kg de pierna entera de cordero con hueso","10 cebollas moradas, cortadas por la mitad","300 ml de caldo de pollo","4 cucharadas de cilantro picado","20 chiles secos","6 dientes de ajo rallados","100 ml de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de semillas de alcaravea","2 cucharaditas de pimentón ahumado","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto"]','["Si estás haciendo la harissa, coloca los chiles secos en un recipiente resistente al calor y vierte suficiente agua hervida de la tetera para cubrirlos. Tapar el bol y dejar enfriar. Una vez que estén lo suficientemente fríos para manipularlos, escurre los chiles y reserva el agua. Retire los tallos y séquelos con papel de cocina. Coloque los chiles en un procesador de alimentos con el ajo, 1 cucharadita de sal, el aceite de oliva, las especias y el vinagre y mezcle hasta obtener un puré. Si es necesario, agregue un poco del agua reservada para aflojar. Se mantendrá frío hasta por un mes.","Hacer 15 cortes, de unos 3-5 cm de largo, por todo el cordero. Reserve 1 cucharada de pasta de harissa, luego frote el resto por todo el cordero y en los cortes. Distribuya las cebollas en una fuente para asar más grande y coloque el cordero encima. Déjelo a temperatura ambiente durante 1 hora o cubra y enfríe durante la noche.","Calentar el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 2. Ase el cordero durante 4-5 horas hasta que la carne esté tierna. Levante el cordero sobre una tabla grande o un plato para servir. Si la lata es resistente al fuego, vierta el caldo; de lo contrario, primero vierte el contenido de la lata en una cacerola. Llevar a ebullición, raspar los trozos dorados con una cuchara de madera y cocinar hasta que el líquido se reduzca en aproximadamente un tercio; debe quedar una salsa de cebolla espesa y rica. Agrega la harissa reservada y el cilantro picado. Sirve el cordero con la salsa de cebolla."]','2026-01-11 13:11:40');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15684,9377,'es','Pudín de chocolate con caramelo pegajoso y salsa propia','Combine el bizcocho de pudín de caramelo pegajoso con una ración generosa de trozos de chocolate y salsa de chocolate para obtener el postre más reconfortante.','["200 g de dátiles medjool deshuesados","100 g de mantequilla sin sal, blanda y un poco más para el plato","75 g de azúcar demerara","75 g de azúcar moreno blando","2 huevos grandes","250 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1 cucharada de polvo para hornear","100 g de chocolate amargo, picado en trozos grandes","helado de vainilla o natillas, para servir","200ml de nata doble","75 g de mantequilla sin sal, en cubos","200 g de azúcar moreno blando","30 g de cacao en polvo"]','["Ponga los dátiles en un bol y vierta 300 ml de agua hirviendo. Dejar en remojo durante 30 minutos. Mientras tanto, prepare la salsa vertiendo todos los ingredientes, una pizca grande de sal y 300 ml de agua hirviendo en una cacerola, luego bata a fuego medio y cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos. Verter en una jarra y dejar enfriar un poco. Una vez que los dátiles estén remojados, use una licuadora de mano para batir los dátiles y el agua hasta obtener una pasta suave. Dejar enfriar un poco. Unte con mantequilla una fuente honda de 35 x 25 cm.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Batir la mantequilla y el azúcar durante 3 minutos hasta que quede suave. Agrega los huevos, uno a la vez, batiendo entre cada adición. Incorpora la harina, el bicarbonato y la levadura en polvo junto con una pizca de sal. Una vez combinado, agregue el puré de dátiles y luego agregue el chocolate amargo. Vierta la masa de bizcocho en el plato preparado y extiéndala uniformemente con el dorso de una cuchara. Vierta la salsa de chocolate de manera uniforme sobre la masa.","Hornee en el horno durante 30-35 minutos hasta que suba, luego déjelo reposar durante 2 minutos. Sirva caliente con una bola grande de helado o natillas calientes."]','2026-01-11 13:11:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15685,9378,'es','Budín vegano de pan y mantequilla con dátiles y chocolate','Usa leche de soja para hacer este delicioso budín de pan vegano. Los dátiles, la canela y la vainilla aportan dulzura, por lo que no es necesario añadir mucha azúcar.','["3 cucharadas de harina de maíz","500ml Alpro Soja Original","½ cucharadita de canela molida","½ limón, rallado","½ cucharada de pasta de vainilla","2 cucharadas de jarabe de arce o de agave","aceite sin sabor (como aceite vegetal), para el plato","6-8 rebanadas de bombachos blancos veganos rancios, cortados por la mitad en triángulos","4 dátiles medjool, deshuesados ​​y finamente cortados","50 g de chispas de chocolate negro vegano","Yogur natural Alpro, para servir (opcional)"]','["Mezcle la harina de maíz, Alpro Soya Original, la canela, la ralladura de limón, la vainilla y el jarabe de arce en una sartén y bata hasta que quede suave. Ponga a fuego lento y cocine, batiendo continuamente, durante 8-10 minutos hasta que la mezcla se haya espesado ligeramente hasta obtener una natilla fina que cubra apenas el dorso de una cuchara.","Engrase ligeramente una fuente para horno de aproximadamente 20 x 25 cm de ancho. Si lo desea, corte la corteza del pan y colóquela en el plato, superponiéndola ligeramente. Agrega la mayoría de los dátiles a la natilla, luego vierte sobre el pan, presionando suavemente el pan en la mezcla con el dorso de una cuchara para ayudar a que absorba el líquido. Dejar en remojo durante 15 minutos.","Calienta el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Esparce las chispas de chocolate y los dátiles en rodajas restantes sobre el budín de pan y hornea durante 20-25 minutos hasta que estén dorados y crujientes en los bordes. Dejar reposar 10 minutos antes de servir con una cucharada de Yogurt Natural Alpro o helado sin lácteos, si lo deseas."]','2026-01-11 13:11:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15686,9379,'es','Cordero al estilo azerbaiyano con albaricoques y castañas','Prepare este guiso de cordero con anticipación y congélelo para los días ocupados o para cuando esté entretenido. Con albaricoques, castañas y especias, es maravillosamente aromático.','["pizca de azafrán","2 cucharadas de aceite de girasol o maní","800 g de cordero para estofar (como la paleta), sin exceso de grasa","2 cebollas grandes, picadas en trozos grandes","4 tomates pera, picados en trozos grandes","2 dientes de ajo, picados","½ cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de pimienta de Jamaica","250 ml de caldo de cordero o pollo","100 g de orejones","125g de castañas cocidas (enlatadas o al vacío)","½ limón, exprimido","½ cucharadita de zumaque","15 g de cilantro, hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes"]','["Poner el azafrán en una taza resistente al calor y verter sobre 75 ml de agua hirviendo. Dejar actuar durante 30 minutos o hasta que el agua adquiera un color amarillo intenso.","Calienta el aceite en una cacerola de fondo grueso y dora el cordero por todas partes; tendrás que hacerlo en tandas. Transfiera el cordero dorado a un bol con una espumadera mientras continúa cocinando el resto.","Freír las cebollas en la grasa residual de la sartén a fuego medio-bajo durante 10-12 minutos hasta que estén doradas y suaves. Añade los tomates y el ajo y continúa sofriendo hasta que los tomates se ablanden. Agrega las especias y cocina por unos minutos, luego regresa el cordero a la sartén con un poco de condimento. Vierta el caldo y el agua de azafrán en infusión. Deje que hierva, luego agregue los albaricoques, las castañas y un poco más de condimento. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento, tape y cocine a fuego muy lento durante 1 h-1 h 15 min hasta que el cordero esté tierno. En esta etapa, el cordero se puede congelar. Primero déjelo enfriar por completo y luego transfiéralo a un recipiente hermético apto para congelador. Se mantendrá en el congelador hasta por tres meses.","Para servir inmediatamente, agregue el jugo de limón, el zumaque y el cilantro. Alternativamente, si ha congelado el cordero, descongélelo en el refrigerador durante la noche, luego transfiéralo a una cacerola y caliéntelo suavemente. Cuando esté bien caliente agrega el jugo de limón, el zumaque y el cilantro. Pruebe para comprobar el condimento y luego sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:11:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15687,9380,'es','Batido de zanahoria y naranja','Comience el día con un vibrante batido de naranja y zanahoria para el desayuno. Con avena y jengibre añadidos, te dará vitamina C y contará para tus 5 al día.','["2 zanahorias medianas, peladas y picadas o ralladas dependiendo de tu licuadora","2 naranjas, peladas","Trozo de 2 cm de jengibre rallado","2 cucharadas de avena","100 g de hielo"]','["Vierta todos los ingredientes en una licuadora o batidora y mezcle hasta que quede suave, agregando 150 ml de agua si está demasiado espesa; modifique la consistencia a su gusto."]','2026-01-11 13:11:41');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15688,9381,'es','Pudín de caramelo pegajoso en olla de cocción lenta','Deje que nuestro pudín pegajoso de cocción lenta se cocine todo el día para que esté listo para servir por la noche con helado. Rico e indulgente, es el postre reconfortante definitivo.','["250 g de dátiles sin hueso, picados","100 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para el cuenco","4 cucharadas de melaza","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","250 g de azúcar moreno blando","300ml de nata doble","2 huevos, ligeramente batidos","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","helado de vainilla, para servir"]','["Ponga los dátiles en un recipiente resistente al calor, cúbralos con 150 ml de agua hirviendo y déjelos en remojo durante 30 minutos. Unte con mantequilla un recipiente para pudín de 1 litro y cubra la base con papel de horno.","En una cacerola puesta a fuego medio, verter la mitad de la mantequilla, la mitad de la melaza, la vainilla, 75 g de azúcar y la nata. Cocine durante 4-5 minutos, revolviendo, hasta que el azúcar se disuelva. Sube el fuego, burbujea durante 3 minutos y luego bate una pizca de sal. Vierta un tercio de la salsa en el recipiente.","Batir el resto de la mantequilla, la melaza, el azúcar y los huevos, luego incorporar la harina, el bicarbonato, ¼ de cucharadita de sal, los dátiles y el líquido de remojo. Vierta en el recipiente y alise la superficie, dejando un espacio de 1 cm desde la parte superior. Cubrir con una doble capa de papel para hornear y papel de aluminio, formando un pliegue en el medio para que el pudín pueda expandirse. Asegúrelo con hilo de cocina.","Pon la olla de cocción lenta a fuego lento. Coloque el recipiente adentro y luego agregue agua hirviendo hasta que llegue a la mitad del recipiente. Tapar y cocinar durante 7-8 horas. Pasa un cuchillo por el borde del pudín y colócalo en un plato. Vuelva a calentar la salsa restante y viértala. Servir con helado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:42');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15689,9382,'es','bolsitas de té chai','Llene bolsitas de té con especias y hojas de té para obtener un magnífico regalo personalizado. Son un bonito regalo en Ramadán.','["18 vainas de cardamomo, partidas","2 cucharadas de jengibre molido","1 cucharada de canela molida","½ cucharada de pimienta negra molida","½ nuez moscada rallada","¼ cucharadita de clavo molido","150 g de hojas de té negro assam"]','["Tuesta las vainas de cardamomo, el jengibre, la canela, la pimienta, la nuez moscada y los clavos en una sartén seca durante 1 minuto.","Mezcla las especias en un bol con las hojas de té, luego llena 18 bolsitas de té vacías con la mezcla y ciérralas. Paquete con instrucciones para servir: Para hacer un chai latte, prepare 1 bolsita de té en 200 ml de leche entera o de coco hervida durante 5 minutos, luego endulce con miel al gusto. O simplemente prepare con agua hirviendo. Se conservará en un frasco cerrado durante seis meses."]','2026-01-11 13:11:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15690,9383,'es','Pollo marroquí con hinojo y aceitunas','Obtenga cuatro de sus 5 al día con nuestro saludable tagine de pollo con hinojo y aceitunas. Servir con cuscús integral.','["½ limón","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla grande, finamente picada","1 bulbo de hinojo, cortado por la mitad y en rodajas finas, reservando las hojas","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, finamente picado","2 dientes de ajo grandes, picados","4 filetes de muslo de pollo sin piel, cortados por la mitad y sin grasa","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","400 ml de caldo de verduras caliente, elaborado con 2 cucharaditas de caldo en polvo","2 tomates, cortados en gajos","6 Kalamata o aceitunas verdes, deshuesadas y partidas por la mitad","un puñado generoso de cilantro picado y un poco más para servir","70 g de cuscús integral","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados"]','["Exprime el limón sobre un bol y reserva el bol. Cortar el limón en dos, quitarle la médula a una mitad y picar la cáscara.","Calentar el aceite en una sartén antiadherente y sofreír la cebolla, el hinojo, el jengibre y el ajo hasta que estén tiernos. Agrega el pollo y sofríe unos minutos más hasta que se dore.","Agrega la ralladura de limón y las especias, luego vierte el caldo. Tape y cocine a fuego lento durante 25 minutos, luego agregue los tomates, las aceitunas, el cilantro y la mitad del jugo de limón. Cocine por 5 minutos más hasta que el hinojo y el pollo estén tiernos y la salsa reducida.","Mientras tanto, cocine el cuscús siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete y agregue los garbanzos. Agregue más jugo de limón al gusto, luego sirva el tajín con cuscús, cilantro extra y hojas de hinojo."]','2026-01-11 13:11:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15691,9384,'es','Halloumi y fattoush de quinua','Con halloumi a la plancha, trozos de pita tostados, cereales, tomates, eneldo y menta, esta ensalada de inspiración del Medio Oriente es un almuerzo rápido y satisfactorio para cuatro','["2 pitas marrones, cortadas en pedazos","5 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 limones, exprimidos","1 diente de ajo, machacado","250 g de halloumi en bloque, en rodajas","250 g de quinua en bolsa para microondas","350 g de tomates medianos, en cuartos","1 pepino grande, partido por la mitad, sin semillas y en rodajas","4 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","½ manojo pequeño de menta, picada","½ manojo pequeño de eneldo, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta la parrilla a fuego alto. Mezcle los trozos de pita con 1 cucharada de aceite y extiéndalos sobre una bandeja para hornear. Ase durante 3-4 minutos, dándoles la vuelta hasta la mitad, hasta que estén dorados y crujientes. Dejar enfriar.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el aceite restante con el jugo de limón y el ajo y luego sazone. Caliente una sartén grande o una sartén antiadherente a fuego alto y cocine el halloumi durante 1-2 minutos por cada lado o hasta que esté ligeramente carbonizado.","Cocine la quinua siguiendo las instrucciones del paquete, déjela enfriar y luego mezcle con los tomates, el pepino, la cebolleta, la mayoría de las hierbas frescas y el aderezo. Sazone al gusto. Vierta sobre un plato para servir y cubra con halloumi, pitta y las hierbas restantes."]','2026-01-11 13:11:43');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15692,9385,'es','Biryani de cordero especial','Clásicamente, el biryani indio se cocina en un "dum", una vasija de barro sellada con masa. Prueba esta versión de cordero con tapa de hojaldre que libera los aromas al abrirla','["500 g de cuello o paleta de cordero, cortado en trozos pequeños","3 cucharadas de mezcla de especias indias, más una pizca (ver más abajo)","100 g de yogur, más algo extra para servir","½ limón, exprimido","3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","2 cebollas grandes, partidas por la mitad y en rodajas","300 g de arroz basmati","4 dientes de ajo machacados","jengibre en trozos del tamaño de un pulgar, pelado y finamente picado","4 tomates pera picados o 200 g de tomates picados en lata","buena pizca de azafrán","100 g de mantequilla","2 ramas de canela","6 vainas de cardamomo","4 hojas de laurel o 6 de curry","anís de 2 estrellas","320 g de masa de hojaldre ya laminada","1 huevo batido","2 cucharaditas de semillas de nigella","un puñado de cilantro picado y menta","1 cebolla morada, partida por la mitad y en rodajas finas","2 cucharadas de semillas de cilantro","2 cucharadas de semillas de comino","1 cucharada de pimentón dulce","2 cucharaditas de chile suave en polvo (chile de Cachemira en polvo si puedes encontrarlo)","2 cucharaditas de semillas de fenogreco","3 dientes enteros","1 cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","10 vainas de cardamomo, sin semillas y desechadas las vainas"]','["Mezclar el cordero con la mezcla de especias, el yogur, el jugo de limón y una pizca de sal. Dejar a temperatura ambiente durante al menos 30 minutos o enfriar durante la noche.","Calienta 2 cucharadas de aceite en una sartén grande y cocina las cebollas a fuego medio bajo durante 15-20 minutos hasta que estén caramelizadas. Mientras tanto, enjuague el arroz tres veces con agua fría. Escurrir, luego cubrir con agua fresca y dejar reposar 30 minutos.","Transfiera las cebollas a un bol, agregue el aceite restante a la sartén y dore el cordero en tandas. Si la marinada comienza a pegarse, sáquela del fondo de la sartén y siga revolviendo; le agregará sabor. Vuelva a colocar la carne en la sartén con el ajo y el jengibre. Cocine durante uno o dos minutos más, luego agregue los tomates y 200 ml de agua (lave el agua alrededor del plato en el que se estaba marinando el cordero para recoger toda la marinada antes de agregarla a la sartén). Sazone con sal y cocine a fuego lento. Tape y cocine durante 45 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando y agregando un chorrito de agua si la salsa se pega. Ahora puedes enfriar el cordero hasta por dos días.","Retirar el agua del arroz, cubrir con agua fresca y sazonar. Llevar a ebullición, burbujear durante 2 minutos, luego escurrir y dejar enfriar. Poner el azafrán en un bol, verter sobre 50 ml de agua hirviendo y dejar reposar 10 minutos.","Unte 50 g de mantequilla en una cazuela. Espolvoree un poco de la mezcla de especias indias y un poco de sal. Para armar el biryani, comience con 1/3 del cordero, cubra con 1/3 del arroz, 1/3 de la cebolla, una rama de canela, un par de vainas de cardamomo, unas hojas de laurel o curry y un anís estrellado. Repita hasta que se hayan agotado todos los ingredientes. Vierta el azafrán y su agua sobre la última capa de arroz, salpique con el resto de la mantequilla y sazone con sal. Ahora puedes enfriarlo hasta por 24 horas.","Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Desenrollar la masa y cortarla en un círculo un poco más grande que el molde. Cepille un poco de huevo alrededor del borde exterior del plato, luego levante la masa encima, presionándola alrededor del borde para sellar. Pincelar con más huevo y espolvorear con semillas de nigella. Hornee durante 45-50 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Mezcle las hierbas y la cebolla y sirva con el biryani y más yogur."]','2026-01-11 13:11:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15693,9386,'es','Tagine de pollo con limones, aceitunas y granada','Cocine un tagine de pollo en una olla que le encantará a toda la familia. De alguna manera dice verano y otoño de un solo bocado usando una suave pero embriagadora mezcla de especias marroquíes.','["2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","8 muslos de pollo","1 cebolla, picada","2 dientes de ajo","2 cucharadas de mezcla de especias marroquíes (ver más abajo)","1 limón grande o 2 pequeños en conserva, solo la piel, finamente picados","2 tomates grandes, picados","1 cubito de caldo de pollo","1 cucharada de miel","1 cucharada de vinagre de vino tinto","un puñado de aceitunas","1 limón pequeño, ½ en rodajas muy finas","½ granada, solo semillas","100 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","manojo pequeño de menta, solo hojas","cuscús, para servir","2 cucharadas de semillas de cilantro","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","1½ cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","½ cucharadita de pimienta negra","¼ cucharadita de jengibre molido","1 cucharadita de canela molida","buena pizca de azafrán"]','["Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola ancha y poco profunda o en una fuente para horno. Sazone el pollo y cocínelo, con la piel hacia abajo, durante 8 a 10 minutos, hasta que esté crujiente. Voltee y cocine por otros 5 minutos. Transfiera a un plato. Calentar el horno a 170C/150C ventilador/gas 3.","Agrega el resto del aceite y la cebolla a la sartén. Revuelva durante unos minutos y luego agregue la mezcla de ajo y especias marroquíes. Revuelva, raspando los trozos de cebolla y pollo del fondo, hasta que las especias huelan fragante. Añade el limón en conserva, los tomates, la pastilla de caldo, la miel, el vinagre y 750 ml de agua. Llevar a ebullición y luego colocar el pollo encima. Cubra con una tapa o papel de aluminio y transfiera al horno durante 1 hora.","Destapar, colocar encima las aceitunas y las rodajas de limón y rociar los limones con un poco de aceite. Regresar al horno durante 20 minutos, o hasta que la salsa se haya reducido un poco (puedes hacerlo en la encimera si tienes poco tiempo). Comprueba la sazón, añadiendo un chorrito de limón, más miel o sal si crees que lo necesita. Esparza sobre las semillas de granada, el queso feta y la menta y sirva con cuscús."]','2026-01-11 13:11:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15694,9387,'es','Hummus con albóndigas de cordero al pistacho','Transforme el sencillo hummus comprado en la tienda con estas fabulosas albóndigas, cubiertas con pistachos y menta. Esto toma solo 15 minutos y tiene un sabor delicioso.','["250 g de carne picada de cordero","½ manojo pequeño de menta, más unas hojas de menta para decorar","30 g de pistachos, más unos cuantos extra para decorar","1 limón, rallado","1 cucharada de aceite","200 g de hummus natural en tarrina","30 g de queso feta, desmenuzado"]','["Pon la carne picada de cordero, la menta y los pistachos en un procesador de alimentos. Pulse aproximadamente para combinar, luego agregue la ralladura de limón y sazone generosamente con sal y pimienta. Forme ocho albóndigas.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande. Freír las albóndigas durante 8-10 minutos, volteándolas para que se doren uniformemente. Extiende el hummus en un plato. Cubra con las albóndigas, unas hojas de menta, el queso feta desmenuzado, unos pistachos picados y un chorrito de jugo de limón."]','2026-01-11 13:11:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15695,9388,'es','Tagine de cordero en olla de cocción lenta','Cocine algo abundante y exótico para la familia cuando hace frío afuera, como nuestro tagine de cordero. Si no puede conseguir cerezas secas, utilice albaricoques o ciruelas pasas.','["900 g de paleta, cuello o pierna de cordero, cortados en trozos","1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","1 cebolla, picada","3 zanahorias, cortadas en trozos","2 cucharaditas de sp-el-hanout","1 cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","1 pastilla de caldo de pollo o cordero o caldo","1 camote, cortado en trozos","30 g de cerezas secas","½ cucharadita de miel","½ manojo de cilantro picado","cuscús, para servir"]','["Freír el cordero en aceite en tandas y colocarlo en la olla de cocción lenta. Fríe la cebolla en la misma sartén durante 5 minutos o hasta que se ablande un poco. Añade las zanahorias y las especias, revuelve todo, añade el puré de tomate, el caldo y 250 ml de agua y revuelve todo en la sartén. Vierta en la olla de cocción lenta. Agrega el boniato, las cerezas secas, la miel y otros 500ml de agua.","Cocine a fuego lento durante 8 horas o a fuego alto durante 4 horas. Agrega el cilantro y sirve con cuscús. Dejar enfriar antes de congelar."]','2026-01-11 13:11:44');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15696,9389,'es','biryani de cordero','Prepare este plato indio clásico y obtenga un cordero deliciosamente jugoso con paneer, arroz y espinacas, todo condimentado a la perfección. Ideal para entretenimiento informal','["400 g de cuello de cordero cortado en cubos pequeños","4 dientes de ajo rallados","1 cucharada de jengibre finamente rallado","1 cucharada de aceite de girasol","1 cebolla grande, picada","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","1 cucharada de semillas de nigella","1 cucharada de pasta de especias Madrás","200 g de arroz basmati, bien enjuagado","8 hojas de curry","400 ml de caldo de cordero o pollo de buena calidad","100 g de paneer, picado","200 g de espinacas, cocidas y exprimidas con agua","cilantro picado","chiles verdes en rodajas","yogur natural"]','["Mezcle el cordero en un bol con el ajo, el jengibre y una pizca grande de sal. Marinar en el frigorífico durante la noche o durante al menos un par de horas.","Calentar el aceite en una cazuela. Freír el cordero durante 5-10 minutos hasta que empiece a dorarse. Agrega la cebolla, las semillas de comino y las semillas de nigella y cocina durante 5 minutos hasta que empiece a ablandarse. Agregue la pasta de curry y cocine por 1 minuto más. Esparcir el arroz y las hojas de curry, luego verter sobre el caldo y llevar a ebullición. Mientras tanto, calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.","Agrega el paneer, las espinacas y un poco de condimento. Cubra el plato con una tapa hermética de papel de aluminio, luego coloque la tapa para asegurarse de que esté bien sellado. Cocine en el horno durante 20 minutos, luego déjelo reposar tapado durante 10 minutos. Lleve el plato a la mesa, retire la tapa y el papel de aluminio, espolvoree con cilantro y chiles y sirva con yogur a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15697,9390,'es','Biryani de nuez con raita de pepino','Cocine nuestro saludable curry de verduras con champiñones secos, especias y calabaza. Contiene tres de tus 5 al día junto con calcio, hierro y fibra.','["20 g de champiñones porcini secos, picados en trozos grandes","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","2 cebollas, en rodajas (160 g)","2 dientes de ajo, rallados","1 cucharada de jengibre fresco picado","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y picado","85 g de arroz basmati integral","160 g de calabaza cortada en cubitos (peso preparado)","1 cucharadita de semillas de comino","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de caldo de verduras","Pepino de 10 cm de largo, rallado y sin corazón","125g de yogur biológico","2 cucharadas de menta picada, más unas cuantas hojas","un tercio de un paquete de cilantro fresco, picado","25 g de almendras laminadas tostadas"]','["Vierta 425 ml de agua hirviendo sobre los champiñones secos y reserve.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén antiadherente. Agrega la cebolla, el ajo, el jengibre y la guindilla y sofríe brevemente a fuego alto para que empiecen a ablandarse. Añade el arroz y la calabaza y revuelve durante unos minutos. Agregue el comino y el cilantro y luego agregue los champiñones y el agua con el caldo.","Tapa la cacerola y cocina a fuego lento durante 20 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno. Mientras tanto mezcla el pepino y el yogur con la menta para hacer una raita. Agrega el cilantro y las almendras al arroz cuando esté listo y sirve con la raita y unas hojas extra de menta o cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:11:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15698,9391,'es','Biryani de cordero y calabaza con raita de pepino','Cocine nuestro saludable cordero al curry con calabaza para obtener una cena sabrosa y abundante. Es bajo en calorías, rico en hierro y aporta tres de tus cinco al día.','["4 filetes magros de cordero (unos 400 g), sin grasa y cortados en trozos","2 dientes de ajo, finamente rallados","8 cucharaditas de jengibre fresco picado","3 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","4 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","4 cebollas, rebanadas","2 chiles rojos, sin semillas y picados","170 g de arroz basmati integral","320 g de calabaza cortada en cubitos","2 cucharaditas de semillas de comino","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","Pepino de 20 cm de largo, rallado","100ml de yogur biológico","4 cucharadas de menta picada, más unas cuantas hojas extra","un puñado de cilantro picado"]','["Mezclar el cordero con el ajo, 2 cucharaditas de jengibre picado y 1 cucharadita de cilantro molido y reservar.","Calienta 2 cucharaditas de aceite en una sartén antiadherente. Añade las cebollas, el resto del jengibre y la guindilla y sofríe brevemente a fuego alto para que empiecen a ablandarse. Agrega el arroz y la calabaza y revuelve al fuego durante unos minutos. Agregue todas las especias restantes, luego agregue 500 ml de agua hirviendo y el caldo. Tape la cacerola y cocine a fuego lento durante 20 minutos.","Mientras tanto, mezcle el pepino, el yogur y la menta en un bol para hacer una raita. Enfríe la mitad para más tarde.","Unos 5 minutos antes de que el arroz esté listo, caliente el aceite restante en una sartén antiadherente, agregue el cordero y revuelva durante unos minutos hasta que se dore pero aún esté bien tierno. Agregue el arroz especiado con el cilantro y sirva con la raita y unas hojas de menta o cilantro encima."]','2026-01-11 13:11:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15699,9392,'es','Ensalada de huevo egipcia','Dale un giro a la ensalada con una receta de inspiración egipcia que combina habas con huevo y los ricos sabores del tahini, el ajo, el limón y el comino.','["2 huevos grandes","1 limón, exprimido","1 cucharada de tahini","1 cucharada de aceite de colza","1 cebolla morada, picada","3 dientes de ajo grandes, finamente picados","1 cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","400 g de lata de borlotti o habas, reservando el jugo","2 lechugas Little Gem cortadas en gajos","2 tomates, cortados en gajos","espolvoreado de hojuelas de chile seco y perejil de hoja plana picado, opcional"]','["Llevar a ebullición una cacerola con agua, añadir los huevos y dejar hervir durante 8 minutos. Escurrirlas y pasarlas bajo el grifo de agua fría para que se enfríen un poco, luego pelarlas y cortarlas por la mitad. Mientras tanto, mezcle 1 cucharada de jugo de limón y 3 cucharadas de agua con el tahini para hacer un aderezo.","Calentar el aceite y sofreír la cebolla y el ajo durante 5 minutos para que se ablanden. Agregue el comino molido y las semillas, revuelva brevemente, luego agregue los frijoles y triture ligeramente algunos mientras los calienta, agregando un poco del jugo de la lata para obtener una consistencia cremosa agradable, pero manteniendo también los frijoles enteros. Pruebe y agregue jugo de limón y un poco de condimento si es necesario.","Coloque los frijoles en platos con la lechuga, luego agregue los huevos y los tomates, con el aderezo de tahini, el chile y el perejil, si se usa."]','2026-01-11 13:11:45');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15700,9393,'es','Tagine de calabaza y garbanzos','Prepara este sabroso tagine vegetariano que a los niños les encantará tanto como a los adultos. Es una excelente manera de servir cuatro de sus cinco porciones al día y se puede congelar.','["1 cucharada de aceite","1 cebolla morada, finamente picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharadita de jengibre rallado","½ cucharadita de comino molido","1 cucharadita de cilantro molido","1 cucharadita de canela","¼ cucharadita de chile suave en polvo","Bolsa de 500 g de trozos de calabaza congelada","2 zanahorias, cortadas en cubos pequeños","1 calabacín, cortado en dados pequeños","2 latas de 400 g de tomates picados","1 lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","cuscús o arroz cocido, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén de base pesada, luego cocina lentamente las cebollas durante unos 10 minutos hasta que empiecen a caramelizarse. Agregue el ajo, el jengibre y las especias y cocine por 2 minutos más. Agregue las verduras y los tomates enlatados y cocine a fuego lento. Coloque la tapa y cocine a fuego lento durante unos 15 minutos o hasta que todas las verduras estén tiernas. Agregue los garbanzos, caliente y sirva con cuscús o arroz."]','2026-01-11 13:11:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15701,9394,'es','Koftas especiadas con miel y garbanzos','Las koftas de cordero especiadas son una excelente opción económica para una comida familiar sencilla. Sirva con un chorrito del aderezo cremoso de yogur y garbanzos al horno.','["1 ½ cucharadita de semillas de hinojo","500 g de carne picada de cordero","1 ½ cucharada de ras el hanout","2 cucharadas de piñones, tostados y picados en trozos grandes","2 latas de 40 g de garbanzos, escurridos y enjuagados","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharadas de miel","80 g de yogur griego","2 cucharadas de tahini","1 limón, ½ jugo, ½ cortado en gajos para servir","25 g de perejil, picado en trozos grandes, para servir"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Con un mortero, triture las semillas de hinojo. En un tazón grande, combine las semillas trituradas, el cordero, el ras el hanout y los piñones, y sazone bien. Divida la mezcla en ocho koftas iguales con forma de huevo.","Coloca los garbanzos en una fuente refractaria, sazona al gusto y mételos al horno mientras fríes las koftas. Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite en una sartén a fuego medio. Añade las koftas y sofríe durante 5 minutos, volteándolas de vez en cuando, hasta que se doren uniformemente. Retirar de la sartén con una espumadera y reservar en un plato.","Retirar los garbanzos del horno, añadir las koftas al plato, luego verter sobre el resto del aceite y la miel y volver al horno durante 15 minutos.","En un bol, combine el yogur, el tahini y el jugo de limón con 70-100 ml de agua y sazone bien. Sirve las koftas y los garbanzos cubiertos con perejil y un buen chorrito del aderezo cremoso, con las rodajas de limón a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15702,9395,'es','Pastel de cordero especiado','Este impresionante pastel de masa filo es una versión del tagine de cordero. Un plato principal abundante que no desentonaría en ninguna mesa de cena.','["3 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","800 g de paleta de cordero, sin grasa y cortada en cubitos","3 cucharadas de harina común","1 cebolla grande, picada","2 dientes de ajo machacados","1 cucharada de ras el hanout","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","2 cucharaditas de comino molido","una buena pizca de clavo molido","una buena pizca de azafrán (opcional)","1 rama de canela","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 limón, rallado y exprimido","1 cucharada de miel","4 cucharadas de melaza de granada","Paquete de 270 g de masa filo (4-6 hojas)","50 g de mantequilla, derretida","50 g de almendras laminadas","50 g de semillas de granada"]','["Calentar el aceite en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego. Pasa el cordero por la harina con un poco de condimento y luego dóralo en el plato. Haga esto en tandas para no abarrotar el plato (lo que hará que la carne se cocine al vapor en lugar de freírse). Tómate tu tiempo para conseguir un color marrón intenso, que añadirá mucho sabor a carne al guiso. Deja la carne a un lado en un plato a medida que avanzas.","Agrega el aceite restante al plato junto con la cebolla y el ajo. Cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden, luego agregue las especias, los tomates, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, la miel y la melaza. Llena la lata de tomate hasta la mitad con agua, revuélvela y añádela también. Sazone bien, lleve a fuego lento y cubra con una tapa. Reduzca el fuego y cocine por 2 hrs 30 min-3 hrs o hasta que la carne esté tierna. Dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Transfiera la carne a un molde para pastel de unos 25 cm de ancho, o déjela en la cacerola si es lo suficientemente ancha como para que quepa la cobertura. Desenvolver el filo y untar una lámina con mantequilla, arrugar y colocar encima del pastel. Continúe con las hojas restantes hasta cubrir el tagine. Rocíe el resto de la mantequilla por encima y esparza sobre las almendras, luego hornee durante 45 minutos o hasta que la masa esté crujiente y dorada. Esparce las semillas de granada justo antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15703,9396,'es','Feta al horno con zumaque y uvas','Un entrante de cena moderno y excelente para un presupuesto limitado: queso feta salado, uvas dulces, zumaque picante y eneldo anisado crean sabores contrastantes pero complementarios.','["1 cebolla morada pequeña, cortada por la mitad y en rodajas","2 cucharadas de vinagre de vino tinto","1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo dorada","350 g de uvas tintas, dejadas en la vid en racimos pequeños","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cucharaditas de zumaque","½ paquete pequeño de eneldo, picado","2 bloques de queso feta de 250 g","pan o panes planos con sésamo, para servir (opcional)"]','["Pon la cebolla morada en un bol y añade el vinagre, el azúcar y una pizca de sal. Masajee todo junto con los dedos durante 1 minuto; esto encurterá ligeramente las cebollas. Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6.","Arruga una hoja de papel para hornear y úsala para forrar una fuente para gratinar. Agregue las uvas, rocíe 1 cucharada de aceite de oliva, 1 cucharadita de zumaque, la mayor parte del eneldo y un poco de condimento, luego revuelva todo para cubrir. Coloque los bloques de queso feta entre las uvas, luego esparza sobre las cebollas y el vinagre para encurtir, el aceite restante y el zumaque. Ahora puedes dejarlo en el frigorífico hasta 24 horas o hornearlo inmediatamente.","Hornee durante 30-35 minutos hasta que el queso feta se dore y las uvas luzcan jugosas. Esparce el eneldo restante y sirve en el centro de la mesa con pan para recoger el queso, las uvas y el jugo."]','2026-01-11 13:11:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15704,9397,'es','Fattoush de raíces asadas','Le hemos dado un cambio de imagen invernal a esta clásica ensalada de pan del Medio Oriente con tubérculos asados ​​a buen precio y un rico aderezo de yogur con mantequilla marrón.','["2 nabos, pelados y cortados en gajos","4 chirivías, peladas y cortadas en cuartos a lo largo","1 colinabo, pelado y cortado en gajos","2 cucharadas de dukkah, más algo extra para espolvorear","4 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","3 panes pita","½ cucharada de zumaque","paquete grande de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","paquete pequeño de menta, hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes","1 chile rojo, en rodajas finas y sin semillas si no te gusta demasiado picante","100 g de semillas de granada","75 g de mantequilla","1 limón, exprimido","200 gramos de yogur natural"]','["Caliente el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Mezcle las raíces en la dukkah y 2 cucharadas de aceite y sazone bien. Divida en dos bandejas para hornear y ase durante 1 hora hasta que esté suave y comience a carbonizarse.","Mientras tanto, corte las pitas en pedazos y cúbralas con zumaque, el aceite restante y un poco de condimento. Colóquelos en una bandeja para hornear, ase durante 15 minutos hasta que estén dorados y crujientes, luego reserve.","Para el aderezo, derrita la mantequilla en una cacerola a fuego lento y cocine lentamente hasta que esté dorada, aproximadamente 8 minutos. Vierta inmediatamente el jugo de limón y déjelo enfriar. Una vez frío, agregue el yogur.","Coloque las verduras asadas en una fuente para compartir con las hierbas y el pan pita, luego esparza sobre el chile y las semillas de granada. Rocíe un poco del aderezo y sirva el resto a un lado."]','2026-01-11 13:11:46');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15705,9398,'es','Tagine de albóndigas picante con bulgur y garbanzos','¿Quién diría que las albóndigas podrían ser 4 de tus 5 al día? Este tagine saludable está lleno de sabor y es bajo en grasas, solo asegúrate de elegir una carne picada magra con un 5 % de grasa.','["2 cebollas, 1 en cuartos, 1 partida por la mitad y en rodajas","2 cucharadas de puré de tomate","2 dientes de ajo","1 huevo","1 cucharada de chile en polvo","Paquete de 500 g de carne picada de ternera extra magra","2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza","4 zanahorias grandes, cortadas en bastones","1 cucharadita de comino molido","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","1 limón, sin ralladura con un pelador de patatas y luego picado","12 aceitunas Kalamata, picadas","1 cucharada de caldo de verduras en polvo","? paquete de cilantro fresco, picado","200 g de trigo bulgar","400g lata de garbanzos","2 cucharaditas de caldo de verduras en polvo","2 cucharaditas de cilantro molido"]','["Pon la cebolla cortada en cuartos en el procesador de alimentos y procesa para picarla finamente. Agregue la carne picada, 1 cucharada de puré de tomate, el ajo, el huevo y el chile en polvo y mezcle hasta obtener una pasta suave. Divida la mezcla en 26 trozos del mismo tamaño y forme bolas.","Calienta el aceite en una sartén grande y cocina las albóndigas durante unos 5 a 10 minutos para que se doren ligeramente. Vierta de la sartén a un plato.","Ahora agregue la cebolla y las zanahorias en rodajas a la sartén y saltee brevemente en el jugo de la sartén para ablandarlas un poco. Agregue las especias y vierta los tomates con 1 ½ lata de agua, luego agregue la ralladura de limón picada, el resto del puré de tomate, las aceitunas y el caldo en polvo. Regrese las albóndigas a la sartén, cubra y cocine durante 15 minutos hasta que las zanahorias estén tiernas. Agrega el cilantro.","Mientras se cocina el tajine, vierte el bulghar en una cacerola con los garbanzos y el agua de la lata. Agrega 2 latas de agua, el caldo y el cilantro. Tape y cocine durante 10 minutos hasta que el bulghar esté tierno y el líquido se haya absorbido. Sirva la mitad con la mitad del tagine y enfríe el resto para otra noche si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:11:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15706,9399,'es','Tagine de pollo con coles de Bruselas especiadas y queso feta','La sabrosa receta de brotes de Joe Wicks equilibra los sabores terrosos, dulces y picantes, utilizando tiernos muslos de pollo, garbanzos y queso para un abundante guiso festivo.','["1 ½ cucharada de aceite de coco","1 cebolla morada grande, cortada en rodajas","1 pimiento rojo, finamente picado","3 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","10 filetes de muslo de pollo (deshuesados ​​y sin piel)","½ cucharadita de canela molida","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","½ cucharadita de pimentón ahumado","1 cucharada de puré de tomate","250 ml de caldo de pollo","6 orejones, cortados por la mitad","175 g de garbanzos enlatados, escurridos y enjuagados","½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","275 g de coles de Bruselas, ralladas","50 g de queso feta","½ manojo pequeño de cilantro, picado en trozos grandes"]','["Calienta 1 cucharada de aceite de coco en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego a fuego medio. Cuando esté derretido y caliente, agrega la cebolla, el pimiento y el ajo. Cocine, revolviendo regularmente, durante 3 a 4 minutos o hasta que comience a ablandarse. Sube el fuego al máximo y agrega los muslos de pollo. Freír todo junto durante unos 3 minutos, revolviendo de vez en cuando.","Espolvorea las especias, exprime el puré de tomate y sofríe, revolviendo casi constantemente, durante 1 min. Verter el caldo y llevar a ebullición. Reduzca el fuego a fuego lento y cubra parcialmente con una tapa. Después de 30 minutos, agregue los orejones y los garbanzos y continúe cocinando a fuego lento durante 10 minutos más.","Mientras el tajine burbujea, caliente la 1/2 cucharada restante de aceite de coco en una sartén a fuego alto. Cuando se derrita, agregue las semillas de comino, tueste durante 10 segundos y luego agregue los brotes rallados. Freír los brotes a fuego alto, revolviendo casi constantemente, durante 5 minutos, momento en el cual deberían haberse ablandado y dorado en algunos lugares.","Sirve el tajine en un bol grande, esparce sobre los brotes fritos, desmenuza sobre el queso feta y termina con el cilantro."]','2026-01-11 13:11:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15707,9400,'es','Tagine de cordero y arándanos','Esta es una olla fragante que le permite al horno hacer todo el trabajo duro. Si tiene invitados navideños, sirva este suculento cordero con cuscús y yogur.','["1½ kg de paleta de cordero, sin exceso de grasa y luego en cubos","1 cucharada de comino molido","1 cucharada de cilantro","1 cucharadita de pimentón dulce","1 cucharadita de pimentón picante","3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 cebollas moradas grandes, cortadas en medias lunas","4 dientes de ajo, finamente picados","2 ramas de canela, partidas por la mitad","6 vainas de cardamomo, ligeramente trituradas","Lata de 400g de tomates picados","2 cucharadas de miel","200 g de arándanos frescos o congelados","50 g de pistachos sin cáscara, tostados y picados en trozos grandes, para servir","yogur natural, un puñado de hojas de menta y cuscús, para servir"]','["Al menos 3 horas antes (o preferiblemente un día), mezcle el cordero con la mitad del comino, el cilantro, el pimentón dulce y picante en un tazón grande. Tapar y dejar en el frigorífico para infusionar.","Caliente el horno a 160C/140C ventilador/gas 3. Caliente 1 cucharada de aceite en una cacerola grande resistente al fuego a fuego alto y sazone bien el cordero con especias. Trabajando en tandas, fríe hasta que esté completamente dorado y luego reserva. Agregue más aceite según lo necesite y obtenga un color intenso en la carne; esto aumentará el sabor del tagine.","Una vez que el cordero esté dorado, vierte el aceite restante en el plato, reduce el fuego a medio y agrega las cebollas, el ajo y las especias molidas restantes. Cocine durante 5 minutos hasta que se ablanden, luego agregue las ramas de canela y las vainas de cardamomo. Regrese el cordero al plato junto con los tomates, más 1/2 lata de agua y la miel. Llevar a ebullición, sazonar, tapar y meter al horno durante 2 h 15 min.","Saque el tajine del horno, revuelva bien y agregue los arándanos. Regresar al horno, sin tapa, durante 15 minutos más hasta que el cordero esté completamente tierno.","Pruebe el tajine para condimentar y retire las ramas de canela y las vainas de cardamomo. Esparcir sobre los pistachos, el yogur y las hojas de menta y servir fuera del plato en la mesa con cuscús."]','2026-01-11 13:11:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15708,9401,'es','Baklava de nuez','Nuestra versión de este pastel empapado en almíbar está ligeramente condimentado con canela y cardamomo, y tiene una mezcla de nueces, pistachos y nueces.','["200 g de mantequilla, más un poco para engrasar","200 g de pistachos","50 g de nueces","50 g de nueces","3 cucharadas de miel","Paquete de 2 x 270 g de masa filo","250 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de miel","2 cucharaditas de agua de azahar","½ cucharadita de canela molida","¼ cucharadita de cardamomo molido (de 3 vainas)"]','["Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y engrasar un molde para pastel cuadrado de 21 cm x 21 cm con mantequilla. Pica las nueces en trozos pequeños con un procesador de alimentos, teniendo cuidado de no convertirlas en una pasta. Ponlos en un bol, agrega la miel y una pizca de sal y reserva.","Derrita la mantequilla en una sartén a fuego lento. Cortar el primer paquete de láminas de masa filo por la mitad (para que quepan en el molde). Ponga una hoja en la lata y unte con la mantequilla derretida. Coloque otra hoja encima y unte con mantequilla nuevamente, siga colocando capas así hasta que se acabe todo el paquete.","Extienda la mezcla de miel y nueces sobre la masa y presione ligeramente con el dorso de una cuchara. Abra el otro paquete de filo, córtelo por la mitad y continúe con el proceso de capas y untado con mantequilla. Cuando llegues a la última hoja, vierte el resto de la mantequilla por encima para terminar. Use un cuchillo afilado para cortar líneas profundas en la masa para crear cuadrados o formas de diamantes y luego hornee en el horno durante 20 minutos.","Reducir el fuego a 150C/130C ventilador/gas 2 y hornear durante 45 minutos más. Mientras se cocina el baklava, ponga todos los ingredientes del almíbar en una cacerola y agregue 200 ml de agua. Caliente suavemente hasta que el azúcar se haya disuelto y luego hierva la mezcla durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que se reduzca a la consistencia de miel líquida.","Cuando el baklava salga del horno, vierte el almíbar tibio por encima, dejando que corra por las líneas que has cortado. Déjalo en remojo y sírvelo cuando esté completamente frío."]','2026-01-11 13:11:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15709,9402,'es','fattoush de pollo','Esta saludable ensalada del Medio Oriente cubierta con pan de pita espolvoreado con zumaque es un almuerzo o cena rápido y fácil.','["jugo 2 limones","2 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","1 lechuga cos, picada","2 tomates, picados en trozos","paquete pequeño de perejil de hoja plana, picado","½ pepino, picado en trozos","Paquete de 200 g de trozos de pollo cocido (o sobras de pollo cocido)","2 cebolletas, cortadas en rodajas","2 panes pita","1-2 cucharaditas de zumaque molido"]','["Vierte el jugo de limón en un tazón grande y bate mientras agregas lentamente el aceite. Cuando se haya añadido todo el aceite y la mezcla empiece a espesar, sazonar.","Agregue la lechuga, los tomates, el perejil, el pepino, los trozos de pollo y las cebolletas y revuelva bien para cubrir la ensalada con el aderezo.","Coloque los panes pita en la tostadora hasta que estén crujientes y dorados, luego córtelos en trozos. Esparza los trozos de pita tostados sobre la ensalada y espolvoree sobre el zumaque. Servir de inmediato."]','2026-01-11 13:11:47');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15710,9403,'es','baklava rosa','Sirva cuadritos dulces y pegajosos de este pastel relleno de canela y almendras como postre ligero para finalizar una cena griega o un asado dominical.','["yogur griego, para servir","300 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","jugo ½ limón","4 cucharadas de agua de rosas (no concentrada, ver consejo)","1 rama de canela grande","75 ml de aceite de oliva","500 g de almendras picadas","75 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","2 cucharadas de canela molida","½ cucharadita de clavo molido","Paquete de 250g-270g de láminas de masa filo","150 ml de agua de rosas (no concentrada, ver consejo)"]','["Ponga todos los ingredientes para el almíbar en una cacerola de base pesada y agregue 400 ml de agua fría. Revuelva a fuego suave para disolver el azúcar, luego cocine a fuego lento durante 10 minutos o hasta que adquiera un tono ligeramente almibarado. Dejar enfriar.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4. Untar ligeramente los lados y la base de una fuente para horno poco profunda de 23 x 33 cm con un poco de aceite.","Para el baklava, mezcle las almendras, el azúcar, la canela, el clavo y el agua de rosas.","Coloque 1 hoja de filo en el fondo del plato y unte generosamente con aceite. (Si las hojas de filo son muy grandes, córtelas todas por la mitad antes de usarlas). Coloque otra encima y cubra nuevamente con aceite. Repita este proceso de colocar capas y cepillar con aceite hasta que se acabe la mitad de las hojas de filo. Ahora extiende sobre el relleno y cubre con las hojas de filo restantes, formando capas y engrasando como antes. Asegúrate de cepillar también la hoja superior con aceite. Marque la parte superior para formar rodajas en forma de diamante.","Hornee en el horno durante unos 30 minutos, aumentando el fuego durante los últimos 5 minutos a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 para darle a la masa un color dorado claro.","Retirar del horno e inmediatamente verter la mitad del almíbar de rosas enfriado sobre la masa caliente. Dejar reposar al menos 30 minutos para que el almíbar se filtre a través de las capas. Sirva con grandes cucharadas de yogur griego y el almíbar restante."]','2026-01-11 13:11:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15711,9404,'es','Macetas de granada y nueces con miel','Crea un baklava tramposo remojando trigo rallado en miel. Cubra con yogur cremoso, pistachos y cítricos.','["85 g de trigo rallado, triturado","200 g de pistachos, picados","100 g de miel","jugo ½ naranja","Bote de 300ml de nata doble","½ bote de 250 g de yogur griego","2 cucharaditas de agua de rosas","110 g de semillas de granada en maceta"]','["En un bol, mezcle el trigo rallado triturado con las nueces, 50 ml de miel y el jugo de naranja, luego divida en 8 vasos pequeños o tazas de té.","Batir la nata hasta que esté muy suave, luego incorporar el yogur, el resto de la miel y el agua de rosas. Divide esto también entre las macetas. Enfríe durante al menos 2 horas o hasta 24 horas. Antes de servir, cubra las macetas con semillas de granada."]','2026-01-11 13:11:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15712,9405,'es','biryani de pollo','Un excelente plato de arroz en una sola olla que aún se puede servir unos días después, perfecto para las sobras.','["300 g de arroz basmati","25 g de mantequilla","1 cebolla grande, finamente cortada","1 hoja de laurel","3 vainas de cardamomo","pequeña rama de canela","1 cucharadita de cúrcuma","4 pechugas de pollo sin piel, cortadas en trozos grandes","4 cucharadas de pasta de curry (usamos pasta balti de Patak))","85 g de pasas","850 ml de caldo de pollo","cilantro picado y almendras laminadas tostadas para servir"]','["Remojar el arroz en agua tibia y luego lavarlo\r\nfría hasta que el agua salga clara. calentar mantequilla\r\nen una cacerola y cocinar la cebolla con la\r\nla hoja de laurel y otras especias enteras durante 10 minutos.\r\nEspolvoree la cúrcuma y luego agregue el pollo.\r\ny pasta de curry y cocine hasta que esté aromático.","Agrega el arroz a la sartén con las pasas,\r\nluego vierta sobre el caldo. Coloque un ajuste apretado\r\ntapar la cacerola y llevar a ebullición, luego\r\nbajar el fuego al mínimo y cocinar el\r\narroz por otros 5 minutos. Apaga el fuego y\r\ndejar actuar 10 min. Revuelva bien, mezclando\r\nla mitad del cilantro. Para servir, esparcir sobre\r\nresto del cilantro y las almendras."]','2026-01-11 13:11:48');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15713,9406,'es','Budín de pan más fácil','Lo último en comida rápida y reconfortante: solo cinco minutos para preparar, perfecto para meter en el horno antes del plato principal.','["150ml de leche entera","140 g de pan blanco","50 g de pasas o cerezas secas","Bote de 568ml de natillas frescas","mantequilla, para engrasar","5-7 cucharadas de azúcar en polvo"]','["Calentar el horno a 140C/ventilador 120C/gas 1. Revolver las natillas con la leche. Quite la corteza del pan, córtela en triángulos y luego colóquela en un tazón grande con las pasas o las cerezas secas. Vierta sobre la mezcla de natillas, luego revuelva todo con cuidado para que todos los trozos de pan queden cubiertos. Engrase ligeramente una fuente pequeña para horno con mantequilla y luego vierta la mezcla.","Cocine durante 30-35 minutos hasta que se tambalee ligeramente el centro de la natilla. Espolvoree el azúcar para cubrir la superficie, luego colóquelo bajo una parrilla caliente durante 1-2 minutos hasta que el azúcar comience a derretirse y caramelizarse."]','2026-01-11 13:11:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15714,9407,'es','Biryani de verduras especiadas','Este curry vegetariano sencillo, lleno de sabores indios frescos, es rápido de preparar y se cocina en una sola olla.','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","1 coliflor pequeña, partida en floretes pequeños","2 batatas grandes, peladas y cortadas en cubitos","1 cebolla grande, cortada en rodajas","1 litro de caldo de verduras caliente","3 cucharadas de pasta de curry picante (el de Madrás es bueno)","1 chile rojo, sin semillas y finamente picado","una pizca grande de hebras de azafrán","2 cucharaditas de semillas de mostaza (blanca o negra)","500 g de arroz basmati","140 g de judías verdes cortadas por la mitad","2 limones, solo jugo","un puñado de hojas de cilantro fresco","Paquete de 50 g de anacardos tostados y salados","poppadoms y raita, para servir"]','["Precalentar el horno a 220C/gas 7/ventilador 200C. Vierta el aceite en una fuente grande para asar o en una fuente para horno y póngalo en el horno durante un par de minutos para que se caliente. Agrega todas las verduras a la lata, excepto los frijoles, revolviendo para cubrirlas con el aceite caliente. Sazona con sal y pimienta y regresa al horno por 15 minutos hasta que comience a dorarse.","Mientras se asan las verduras, mezcle el caldo, la pasta de curry, la guindilla, el azafrán y las semillas de mostaza.","Mezcle el arroz y las judías verdes con las verduras en la lata y luego vierta sobre la mezcla de caldo. Bajar el horno a 190C/gas 5/ventilador 190C. Cubre bien el plato con papel de aluminio y hornea durante 30 minutos hasta que el arroz esté tierno y el líquido se haya absorbido. Agregue el jugo de limón y verifique el condimento, luego esparza el cilantro y los anacardos. Sirva con un montón de poppadums y un plato de raita."]','2026-01-11 13:11:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15715,9408,'es','Pilaú biryani de pollo','Fácil y económico de recrear en casa, ¡los estudiantes no necesitarán pedir comida para llevar nunca más!','["2 cucharadas de aceite vegetal","6 muslos de pollo grandes, con piel","1 cebolla grande, finamente cortada","2 cucharadas de curry en polvo (picante si te gusta picante, suave para curry más suaves)","350 g de arroz de grano largo, fácil de cocinar","700 ml de caldo de pollo o verduras","250 g de guisantes congelados"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/ventilador 180C/gas 6. Calentar el aceite en una sartén grande y freír los muslos de pollo, con la piel hacia abajo, durante 8-10 minutos hasta que la piel esté dorada y crujiente. Vierta la cebolla y continúe cocinando durante 5 minutos hasta que la cebolla se ablande. Espolvoree el curry en polvo y cocine por un minuto más, luego agregue el arroz y vierta sobre el caldo. Llevar el caldo a ebullición.","Tapa la sartén y hornea por 30 minutos hasta que se haya absorbido todo el líquido y el arroz esté cocido. Agrega los guisantes y deja reposar el arroz unos instantes antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:49');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15716,9409,'es','delicias turcas','Haz tu propia delicia turca con nuestra receta fácil. Es un gran regalo para Eid, o simplemente date un capricho con algo dulce.','["aceite sin saborpara la bandeja","500 g de azúcar granulada","½ cucharadita de crémor tártaro","120 g de harina de maíz y un poco más para espolvorear","½ cucharadita de agua de rosas (o 2 cucharadas de jarabe de rosas)","colorante alimentario rosa, si no se utiliza jarabe de rosas","azúcar glas, para espolvorear"]','["Engrase una bandeja para hornear cuadrada poco profunda de metal o silicona, de aproximadamente 18 x 18 cm. Poner en una cacerola el azúcar con el crémor tártaro y 500ml de agua y calentar suavemente al principio, removiendo para que se derrita el azúcar. Luego, sube el fuego y deja hervir durante 10-15 minutos hasta que la mezcla esté un poco más almibarada. Si tienes un termómetro para azúcar, debería alcanzar los 115-118C.","Agrega la harina de maíz a 150 ml de agua y, sin dejar de batir, viértela en el almíbar de azúcar. Sigue batiendo hasta que todo se combine para formar una mezcla suave y espesa. Saca la batidora y empieza a remover con una espátula o cuchara a fuego medio. Continúe revolviendo hasta que la mezcla esté lo suficientemente espesa como para ver una línea clara dibujada a través de ella con la cuchara y comience a salirse de los lados de la sartén. Quedará muy espeso y formará grandes burbujas que estallarán mientras se cocina, así que tenga cuidado. Esto puede tardar hasta una hora. Pruebe la mezcla dejando caer una pequeña cantidad en agua muy fría; Debe formar una bola que se pueda presionar suavemente cuando esté fría y que se sienta un poco elástica.","Agregue el agua de rosas o el jarabe de rosas y el colorante alimentario, si lo usa, luego vierta todo en la bandeja y nivele la parte superior. Dejar enfriar y cuajar por completo. Tamiza un poco de harina de maíz y azúcar glas sobre una tabla y desmolda con cuidado la delicia turca. Cúbrelo con más azúcar glas y maicena y córtalo en cubos con un cuchillo afilado. Espolvorea con aún más mezcla de azúcar glas y separa los trozos para que se sequen. Se puede almacenar abiertamente o en pequeñas cajas o bolsas de cartón."]','2026-01-11 13:11:54');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15717,9410,'es','Galletas de cardamomo y pistacho','A todos les encantarán estas hermosas galletas y son un regalo casero impresionante. Sumérgelos en chocolate y espolvorea para terminar.','["200 g de mantequilla sin sal, a temperatura ambiente","400 g de harina común y un poco más para espolvorear","150 g de azúcar en polvo dorado","50 g de miel líquida","¼ cucharadita de agua de rosas","1 huevo","una pizca de sal","5 vainas de cardamomo, sin cáscara y trituradas","½ cucharadita de crémor tártaro","100 g de chocolate negro, derretido","elección de chispas: usamos pétalos de rosa secos, pistachos picados, coco rallado y ralladura de naranja","rodillo","2 bandejas para hornear","pergamino para hornear"]','["Coloque la mantequilla y la harina en un tazón grande y frótelas con las yemas de los dedos hasta que la mezcla parezca arena granulada.","En otro tazón, mezcle el resto de los ingredientes hasta que quede suave y líquido. Vierta sobre la mezcla de mantequilla y harina y combine con las manos. Cuando la masa esté blanda y esponjosa, le damos forma de bola, la envolvemos en film transparente y la metemos en el frigorífico durante 20-30 minutos para que endurezca un poco.","Justo antes de sacar la masa del frigorífico, calienta el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forra 2 bandejas para hornear con papel para hornear.","Sacar la masa de la nevera. Espolvorea un poco de harina sobre la superficie de trabajo y sobre un rodillo, luego extiende la masa hasta que tenga aproximadamente el grosor de una moneda de £1.","Usa tu regla y un cuchillo para cortar con cuidado la masa de galleta en rectángulos de 10 cm de largo y 3 cm de ancho y colócalos en las bandejas, dejando 2 dedos de espacio entre cada galleta.","Metemos las galletas al horno durante 10-12 minutos. Una vez horneado, déjelo enfriar en las bandejas durante unos minutos y luego transfiéralo con cuidado a una rejilla hasta que esté completamente frío. Repita hasta que se acabe toda la masa.","Para decorar, derretir el chocolate en el microondas, luego mojar el extremo de cada galleta en el chocolate derretido y dejar reposar en un plato o bandeja forrada con papel de horno. Antes de que el chocolate se endurezca, espolvoréalos con una pizca de tus ingredientes favoritos y luego déjalos en un lugar fresco durante 1 o 2 horas. Si lo regala, empáquelo en cajitas una vez que el chocolate esté completamente cuajado (se conserva durante 2 o 3 días)."]','2026-01-11 13:11:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15718,9411,'es','Pudín persa con rosas batidas y mantequilla de miel','Se incorporan sabores de naranja y rosa a este pudín al vapor alternativo. La mantequilla dulce y especiada es el acompañamiento perfecto','["250 g de dátiles sin hueso, picados en trozos grandes","300 g de pasas","100 g de piel mixta","50 g de almendras enteras","50 g de pistachos sin cáscara","175 g de azúcar mascabado light","175 g de pan rallado blanco","1 cucharadita de especias mixtas","½ cucharadita de jengibre molido","125 g de harina con levadura","ralladura de 2 naranjas","1 cucharada de agua de naranja","1 cucharada de agua de rosas","2 huevos grandes, batidos","175 g de mantequilla derretida, más un poco más para engrasar","125 g de mantequilla blanda","2 cucharadas de azúcar glas, más extra para servir","50 g de miel clara","pizca de canela","1 cucharadita de agua de rosas"]','["Vierta los dátiles en un bol con las pasas, cúbralos con 200 ml de agua caliente del hervidor y reserve. Mientras tanto, engrasar un recipiente para budín de 1,5 litros y forrar la base con un disco de papel pergamino. Pon los ingredientes secos y la ralladura de naranja en un bol grande. Agregue los dátiles y las pasas (y el líquido de remojo), el agua de rosas y naranja, con los huevos y la mantequilla. Mezclar hasta que todo esté combinado. Vierta en el recipiente y cubra con un círculo de papel pergamino, luego con papel de aluminio y luego ate el borde con una cuerda.","Coloque el pudín sobre la tapa de un frasco volteado en una cacerola grande y vierta agua caliente del hervidor hasta que llegue a la mitad del recipiente. Cubra la cacerola y cocine al vapor suavemente durante 4 horas, completando con más agua si es necesario. El pudín se puede comer inmediatamente, enfriar y conservar hasta por una semana o congelar durante 1 mes. Para recalentar, descongele completamente o retírelo del refrigerador y cocine el pudín nuevamente al vapor durante 30 minutos hasta que esté bien caliente.","Para hacer la mantequilla, mezcle los ingredientes. Sirva el pudín en gajos con una cucharada de mantequilla derretida por encima."]','2026-01-11 13:11:55');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15719,9416,'es','Batido de desayuno con kéfir','Comience su mañana con este batido de desayuno de kéfir rico en probióticos. Con mango, jugo de naranja, jengibre y cúrcuma, estarás listo para el día siguiente.','["1 mango grande, deshuesado y picado","2 cm de jengibre, finamente rallado","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","200 ml de zumo de naranja fresco","300ml de kéfir","1-2 cucharadas de miel o agave, al gusto"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes en una licuadora y bate hasta que estén completamente suaves. Pruebe y agregue un poco más de jengibre, cúrcuma y miel, si lo desea.","Vierta en dos vasos altos y sirva. Se puede enfriar en una jarra tapada en el frigorífico hasta por 24 horas."]','2026-01-11 13:11:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15720,9417,'es','Batido de diosa verde fresa','Pruebe este sabroso batido de desayuno para comenzar el día, combinando fruta dulce con nutritivas espinacas y aguacate para obtener una dosis de calcio, vitamina C, ácido fólico y fibra.','["160 g de fresas maduras, peladas","160 g de espinacas tiernas","1 aguacate pequeño, partido por la mitad y sin pulpa","Yogurt bio bote 150ml","2 naranjas pequeñas, exprimidas, más ½ cucharadita de ralladura fina"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes en una licuadora y bate hasta que estén completamente suaves. Si está un poco espeso, agrega una gota de agua fría y vuelve a mezclar. Vierta en vasos y beba inmediatamente."]','2026-01-11 13:11:57');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15721,9418,'es','Batido de desayuno de dos minutos','Prepare un batido de desayuno bajo en grasas en poco tiempo. Use plátano con otras frutas blandas, además de miel para darle un poco de dulzura y avena como combustible de liberación lenta.','["1 plátano","1 cucharada de gachas de avena","80 g de frutos rojos (los que tengas: fresas, arándanos y mango funcionan bien)","150ml de leche","1 cucharadita de miel","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla"]','["Pon todos los ingredientes en una licuadora y bate durante 1 minuto hasta que quede suave.","Vierta la mezcla en dos vasos para servir."]','2026-01-11 13:11:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15722,9419,'es','batido de col rizada','Date una dosis de vitamina C por la mañana con este batido verde vegano. Junto con la col rizada y el aguacate, hay un toque de lima y piña picantes.','["2 puñados de col rizada","½ aguacate","½ lima, solo jugo","un puñado grande de trozos de piña congelados","jengibre en trozos medianos","1 cucharada de anacardos","1 plátano, opcional"]','["Coloque todos los ingredientes en una bala o batidora, agregue un chorrito grande de agua y mezcle. Agrega más agua hasta tener la consistencia deseada."]','2026-01-11 13:11:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15723,9420,'es','Superbatido de desayuno','Este batido tiene un alto contenido de grasas naturales y azúcar, ideal si necesitas algo de combustible para hacer ejercicio intenso.','["100 ml de leche entera","2 cucharadas de yogur natural","1 plátano","150g frutos del bosque congelados","50 g de arándanos","1 cucharada de semillas de chía","½ cucharadita de canela","1 cucharada de bayas de goji","1 cucharadita de semillas mixtas","1 cucharadita de miel (idealmente Manuka)"]','["Pon los ingredientes en una licuadora y bate hasta que quede suave. ¡Vierte en un vaso y disfruta!"]','2026-01-11 13:11:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15724,9421,'es','sacudida del sol','Comience el día con un pequeño rayo de sol: un batido bajo en grasa, dos de los cinco que toma al día, ¡y además es delicioso!','["500 ml de jugo de zanahoria, frío","200 g de piña (fresca o enlatada)","2 plátanos, partidos en trozos","jengibre en trozos pequeños, pelado","20 g de anacardos","jugo 1 lima"]','["Pon los ingredientes en una licuadora y bate hasta que quede suave. Beba inmediatamente o viértalo en una botella para beber mientras viaja. Se conservará en el frigorífico un día."]','2026-01-11 13:11:58');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15725,9422,'es','batido de plátano','Rápido y fácil de preparar, este batido de plátano, ciruelas pasas, leche de almendras y mantequilla de nueces es un impulso de energía ideal para llevar.','["500 ml de leche de almendras sin azúcar","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de almendras","6 ciruelas pasas","1 cucharadita de canela","1 plátano pequeño maduro"]','["En una licuadora, bata la leche de almendras con la mantequilla de almendras, las ciruelas pasas, la canela y el plátano. Transfiera a 2 botellas y enfríe hasta que esté listo para beber, o prepárelo para el almuerzo mientras viaja. Se conservarán en la nevera durante 2 días."]','2026-01-11 13:11:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15726,9423,'es','Batido de coco y plátano','Este batido cremoso está repleto de ingredientes nutritivos. El baobab añade un sabor picante a sorbete y es rico en fibra, antioxidantes y vitamina C.','["100 g de yogur de coco","3 cucharadas de leche de tu elección (nosotros usamos leche de almendras sin azúcar)","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma molida","Trozo de 3 cm de jengibre fresco, pelado","2 cucharaditas de baobab en polvo (opcional)","1 plátano pequeño maduro","1 cucharadita de miel","1 cucharada de avena","jugo de ½ limón"]','["Agrega el yogur de coco y la leche a una licuadora de alta velocidad, luego agrega la cúrcuma, el jengibre fresco y el baobab en polvo (si lo usas). Agregue los ingredientes restantes y luego mezcle hasta que quede suave. Agrega hielo y bate nuevamente si prefieres una bebida más fría. Vierta en vasos y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:11:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15727,9424,'es','batido verde','Este dulce batido contiene muchos ingredientes nutritivos, como espinacas, semillas de lino y plátano, con una cucharada opcional de maca en polvo para un impulso de energía natural.','["250ml de leche de tu elección (nosotros utilizamos leche de almendras sin azúcar)","1 cucharada de linaza molida","1 cucharadita de maca en polvo (opcional)","pizca de canela molida","1 dátil Medjool, apedreado","1 plátano pequeño maduro","un puñado de cavolo nero o espinacas","1 cucharada de mantequilla de almendras"]','["Vierta la leche en una licuadora de alta velocidad y luego agregue la linaza molida, la maca en polvo (si la usa) y la canela. Agregue los ingredientes restantes y luego mezcle hasta que quede suave. Vierta en vasos y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:11:59');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15728,9425,'es','Batido de desayuno verde','Combine ingredientes saludables para un desayuno que aumente la energía. Usar leche de arroz integral sin azúcar fortificada con calcio y vitaminas la hace más nutritiva','["1 puñado de espinacas (aproximadamente 50 g/2 oz), picadas en trozos grandes","100 g de floretes de brócoli, picados en trozos grandes","2 palitos de apio","4 cucharadas de coco rallado","1 plátano","300 ml de leche de arroz (ver consejo)","¼ de cucharadita de espirulina o 1 cucharada de verduras en polvo o proteína vegana en polvo (opcional)"]','["Batir 300 ml de agua y los ingredientes en una licuadora hasta que quede suave."]','2026-01-11 13:12:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15729,9426,'es','Batido de almendras, fresa y plátano','Comience el día con este saludable batido de frutas, elaborado con almendras molidas y lácteos ricos en calcio.','["1 plátano pequeño","7 fresas, peladas","3 cucharadas de yogur 0% bio","3 cucharadas de leche desnatada","2 cucharadas de almendras molidas"]','["Corta el plátano en el bol de un procesador de alimentos o en una jarra si usas una batidora de mano. Agrega las fresas, el yogur, la leche y las almendras molidas y mezcla hasta que esté completamente suave. Vierte en un vaso y disfruta."]','2026-01-11 13:12:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15730,9427,'es','batido de acai','El açaí es un ingrediente estrella: tiene fama de ser uno de los mejores antioxidantes y es la base perfecta para un batido de frutas. Combina con piña, fresas y plátano.','["100 g de pulpa de açaí cruda, congelada, sin azúcar y descongelada","50 g de piña congelada","100 g de fresas","1 plátano mediano","250ml de zumo de mango o naranja","1 cucharada de néctar de agave o miel"]','["Coloca todos los ingredientes en la licuadora o en un procesador de alimentos. Licue hasta que quede suave. Si queda muy espeso añade un poco más de zumo de mango o de naranja. Servir en 2 vasos altos."]','2026-01-11 13:12:00');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15731,9428,'es','Wraps de huevo para el desayuno','Disfrute de estos wraps de huevo ricos en proteínas rellenos de champiñones y tomates para un desayuno rápido, abundante y saludable. Aporta hierro, folato y fibra.','["Paquete 500g champiñones vaso cerrado","4 cucharaditas de aceite de colza prensado en frío, más 2 gotas","320 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad u 8 tomates cortados en gajos","2 puñados generosos de perejil, finamente picado","8 cucharadas de gachas de avena (40 g)","10 huevos","4 cucharaditas de mostaza inglesa en polvo preparada con agua"]','["Corta en rodajas gruesas la mitad del paquete de champiñones. Calienta 2 cucharaditas de aceite de colza en una sartén antiadherente. Añade los champiñones, revuelve brevemente y fríelos con la tapa en la sartén durante 6-8 minutos. Agregue la mitad de los tomates y luego cocine 1-2 minutos más sin la tapa hasta que se ablanden.","Batir muy bien los huevos con el perejil y la avena. Calienta una gota de aceite en una sartén antiadherente grande. Vierta ¼ de la mezcla de huevo y fría durante 1 minuto hasta que casi cuaje, voltee como si estuviera haciendo un panqueque. Saque la sartén, unte con una cuarta parte de la mostaza, vierta ¼ del relleno en el centro y enrolle. Ahora haz una segunda envoltura usando otro ¼ de la mezcla de huevo y el relleno. Si estás siguiendo nuestro Plan de Dieta Saludable, guarda el resto para el día siguiente."]','2026-01-11 13:12:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15732,9429,'es','Avena nocturna con chía y almendras','Comienza el día con avena energizante y semillas de chía ricas en omega-3 con este delicioso desayuno. Es vegano, pero puedes utilizar leche de vaca y yogur, si lo prefieres.','["200 g de gachas de avena","50 g de semillas de chía","600 ml de leche de almendras sin azúcar, más 8 cucharadas","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","125g punnet raspberries","100 g de yogur de almendras","250 g de arándanos en canastilla","20 g de almendras laminadas, tostadas"]','["Vierta la avena y las semillas en un bol y vierta sobre la leche y el extracto de vainilla. Dejar reposar de 5 a 10 minutos para que la avena absorba parte del líquido.","Reserva 16 frambuesas, luego agrega el resto a la avena y tritúralas en la mezcla. Vierta en cuatro vasos o platos de helado, luego cubra con el yogur y ambas bayas. Cubra y enfríe durante la noche o hasta que sea necesario. Para servir, vierte 2 cucharadas de leche de almendras sobre cada uno y espolvorea con las almendras."]','2026-01-11 13:12:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15733,9459,'es','Revuelto de tofu','Pruebe nuestro tofu vegano especiado con tomates cherry para obtener una versión de tostada revuelta sin huevo. Perfecto para el desayuno, servido sobre pan de centeno.','["1 cucharada de aceite de colza prensado en frío","1 cebolla pequeña, finamente cortada","1 diente de ajo grande, triturado","½ cucharadita de cúrcuma","1 cucharadita de comino molido","½ cucharadita de pimentón dulce ahumado","280 g de tofu extra firme","100 g de tomates cherry partidos por la mitad","½ manojo pequeño de perejil, picado","pan de centeno, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén a fuego medio y sofríe la cebolla durante 8 a 10 minutos o hasta que esté dorada y pegajosa. Agregue el ajo, la cúrcuma, el comino y el pimentón y cocine por 1 min.","Triture el tofu en un tazón con un tenedor, manteniendo algunos trozos gruesos. Agrega a la sartén y fríe durante 3 minutos. Suba el fuego, luego agregue los tomates y cocine por 5 minutos más o hasta que comiencen a ablandarse. Incorpora el perejil a la mezcla. Sirva solo o con pan de centeno tostado (no sin gluten), si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:12:01');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15734,9430,'es','Mantequilla de dátiles','Prepare esta sencilla mantequilla de dátiles con solo un puñado de ingredientes. No es necesario cocinarlo, es delicioso con tostadas o pan de plátano, y es vegano si lo preparas con aceite de coco.','["150 g de aceite de coco o mantequilla","80 g de dátiles blandos sin hueso","1 cucharada de jarabe de arce","pizca de canela","pizca de sal"]','["En un procesador de alimentos pequeño, mezcle el aceite de coco o la mantequilla, los dátiles (nosotros usamos medjool), el jarabe de arce, la canela y la sal. Enfríelo hasta que lo necesite; se conservará hasta por una semana."]','2026-01-11 13:12:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15735,9412,'es','Bolas energéticas de crumble de manzana','Prepare un lote de nuestras bolas energéticas fáciles de cocinar para obtener el refrigerio perfecto para llevar. Estos bocados veganos rápidos con manzanas y canela tardan solo 10 minutos en prepararse','["50 g de avena","50 g de dátiles sin hueso (unos 3)","50 g de almendras molidas","2 cucharadas de mantequilla de almendras","¼ de cucharadita de canela, más un poco más para espolvorear","30 g de rodajas de manzana seca","½ manzana"]','["Mezcle 30 g de avena con los dátiles, las almendras molidas, la mantequilla de almendras, la canela, las rodajas de manzana secas y una pizca de sal hasta que estén picados en trozos grandes y comiencen a formar grumos. Ralla la manzana, con piel y todo, luego agrega la avena restante y pulsa hasta que se combinen.","Forma 10 bolas y espolvorea con un poco más de canela. Poner en el frigorífico durante 30 minutos para que endurezca. Se conservará en un recipiente hermético en el refrigerador hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 13:12:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15736,9431,'es','Flaps de miel y frambuesa','Prepare estos sencillos flapjacks de miel y frambuesa con solo cinco ingredientes. Sirva con una taza de té para un estimulante perfecto a media mañana o congélelo para más tarde.','["150 g de mantequilla","150 g de azúcar moreno blando","4 cucharadas de miel (nosotros usamos miel de brezo)","300 g de gachas de avena","100 g de frambuesas congeladas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6 y forrar un molde para hornear de 20 x 20 cm con papel pergamino. Derretir en una cacerola la mantequilla, el azúcar, la miel y una pizca de sal. Una vez que la mezcla burbujee y esté combinada, agregue la avena.","Vierta la mezcla de avena en el molde para hornear forrado y presione con los dedos o el dorso de una cuchara. Esparce las frambuesas y luego presiónalas ligeramente en la mezcla de avena. Hornee durante 25-30 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Dejar enfriar y luego cortar en 9 o 12 flapjacks."]','2026-01-11 13:12:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15737,9432,'es','Ollas de mantequilla de maní y avena con dátiles','Pruebe esta avena preparada durante la noche para comenzar el día de manera saludable. Están endulzados naturalmente con dátiles y canela y son una buena fuente de calcio.','["180 g de avena avena","75 g de mantequilla de maní crujiente (nosotros usamos Meridian 100% nueces)","40 g de dátiles medjool deshuesados, picados","2 cucharaditas de extracto de vainilla","5 botes de 120 g de yogur natural bio (o 600 g de un bote grande)","canela molida, para espolvorear"]','["Vierta la avena en un tazón grande y vierta sobre 600 ml de agua hirviendo. Agrega la mantequilla de maní, los dátiles y la vainilla y revuelve bien. Deje enfriar y luego mezcle 240 g de yogur. Diluir con una pequeña cantidad de agua si la consistencia es un poco dura.","Vierta en seis vasos, luego cubra con el yogur restante y espolvoree con canela. Tapa cada vaso y guárdalo en el frigorífico hasta el momento de comer. Se mantendrá bien hasta por cinco días."]','2026-01-11 13:12:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15738,9433,'es','Desayuno naans','Cubra los panes naan con queso crema, chutney, aguacate y huevos para un delicioso desayuno o brunch. Solo tardan 10 minutos en preparar y entregar uno de tus 5 al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite vegetal o de girasol","2 huevos","2 panes naan pequeños","4 cucharadas de queso crema bajo en grasa","2 cucharadas de chutney de mango","1 aguacate, partido por la mitad y en rodajas","½ lima, en jugo","1 chile verde","un puñado pequeño de cilantro, con las hojas recogidas"]','["Calentar el horno a 200C/180C ventilador/gas 6. Calentar el aceite en una sartén y luego freír los huevos. Calienta los panes naan en el horno mientras se cocinan los huevos.","Unte los naans calientes con el queso crema y luego rocíe con el chutney. Agrega un huevo frito a cada naan y cubre con aguacate, jugo de lima, chile y cilantro. Sazone y disfrute."]','2026-01-11 13:12:02');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15739,9434,'es','Muffins especiados de zanahoria y manzana','Estos muffins afrutados son excelentes para desayunar sobre la marcha o como delicia a media mañana. Agregue frutas secas, nueces o semillas para darle textura, si lo desea.','["100 ml de aceite de colza","100ml de yogur natural","50 ml de miel líquida","2 huevos","1 cucharadita de extracto de vainilla","200 g de harina con levadura","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","1½ cucharadita de especias mixtas molidas","1 manzana rallada","1 zanahoria rallada","50g de pasas, pasas, nueces picadas o semillas (opcional)"]','["Caliente el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4 y forre un molde para muffins con nueve cajas (alternativamente, use cuadrados de papel para hornear). Mezclar en una jarra el aceite, el yogur, la miel, los huevos y la vainilla. En un tazón, combine la harina, el bicarbonato, la mezcla de especias y ¼ de cucharadita de sal. Vierte la mezcla de yogur en la mezcla de harina y agrega la manzana y la zanahoria, así como cualquier ingrediente extra que estés usando. Mezcle con una espátula hasta que esté bien combinado, luego vierta la mezcla en los moldes para muffins.","Hornee durante 20-22 minutos, o hasta que al insertar una brocheta en el medio de un muffin, éste salga limpio. Dejar enfriar durante al menos 5 minutos. Se puede conservar en lata durante tres días o congelar durante dos meses; Descongelar durante la noche antes de servir."]','2026-01-11 13:12:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15740,9435,'es','Garbanzos, pimiento rojo, huevo y picadillo de queso feta','Comienza tu día con nuestro picadillo vegetariano de garbanzos, pimiento rojo, huevo y queso feta. Este fantástico desayuno es fácil de preparar y te ofrece dos de tus 5 al día.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva o de colza","1 cebolla, partida por la mitad y en rodajas","Lata de 400 g de garbanzos escurridos","1½ cucharadita de semillas de comino","4 pimientos rojos asados ​​de un frasco, cortados en trozos","2-4 huevos","40 g de queso feta, desmenuzado","½ limón, rallado","un puñado pequeño de menta, las hojas picadas","panes planos, para servir (opcional)"]','["Calentar el aceite en una sartén. Cocine la cebolla durante 12-15 minutos hasta que empiece a caramelizar. Añade los garbanzos, el comino y los pimientos y sazona bien, luego cocina durante unos minutos hasta que esté completamente caliente.","Crea espacios en la sartén para cada uno de los huevos. Rompe los huevos en la sartén, luego tapa y cocina durante 2-3 minutos, o hasta que los huevos estén cocidos a tu gusto. Esparcir sobre el queso feta, la ralladura de limón y la menta. Sirva junto con los panes planos, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:12:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15741,9436,'es','Gachas de avena con compota rápida de frutos rojos, higos y pistachos','Tómate un tiempo para disfrutar de un desayuno nutritivo y saludable que te ayude a empezar el día. Las gachas de avena combinan a la perfección con nuestra rápida compota de frutos rojos, higos y cobertura de pistachos.','["150 g de gachas de avena","100ml de leche","120 g de bayas congeladas","½ naranja, rallada y en jugo","1 higo, rebanado","1 cucharada de pistachos, tostados y picados"]','["Pon en una cacerola la avena, la leche y 450ml de agua con una pizca de sal. Cocine durante unos 5 minutos hasta que esté espeso y cremoso. Mientras tanto, cocine en el microondas las bayas, el jugo de naranja y la ralladura durante 2-3 minutos.","Divida la papilla en tazones y cubra cada uno con la compota de frutos rojos, los higos y los pistachos."]','2026-01-11 13:12:03');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15742,9437,'es','tazón de acaí','Pruebe este tazón de desayuno lleno de frutas para comenzar el día de manera rápida y fácil. Varíe los aderezos según la temporada: las bayas frescas o los melocotones quedan bien en verano.','["2 cucharaditas de açaí en polvo","un puñado de bayas congeladas","½ plátano muy maduro, picado","un puñado de cubitos de hielo","1 cucharadita de hojuelas de coco, 5 trozos de piña, ½ maracuyá, 1 cucharada de avena tostada, encima (opcional)"]','["Pon el açaí en polvo, las bayas congeladas, el plátano y los cubitos de hielo en una batidora potente con 100 ml de agua. Mezcle hasta que quede suave, luego vierta en un tazón y agregue los aderezos que elija."]','2026-01-11 13:12:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15743,8925,'es','Tazón de batido de bayas','Esta deliciosa receta saludable no tiene absolutamente ningún lácteos, soja, gluten ni azúcares añadidos. Fue creado por los expertos en alimentación saludable Nana Bowls.','["3 plátanos congelados, pelados y picados","200 g de arándanos congelados","100 g de fresas congeladas","20ml de agua de rosas","100ml de leche de coco","50ml de agua fría","20 g de proteína de guisante en polvo","30 g de almendras trituradas","30 g de pistachos triturados","20 g de polen de abeja","20 g de semillas de cacao"]','["Agrega los plátanos congelados, los arándanos, las fresas, el agua de rosas, la leche de coco y el agua fría a una licuadora de alta potencia.","Licue bien durante unos 30 segundos. Luego agregue la proteína en polvo y mezcle nuevamente hasta que se forme una textura espesa, suave y cremosa.","Vierta en sus tazones y cubra con las almendras crujientes, los pistachos triturados, el polen de abeja y las semillas de cacao. También puedes agregar algunas hojuelas de coco tostadas, granola casera o un chorrito de mantequilla de nueces para darle un toque extra."]','2026-01-11 13:12:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15744,9439,'es','Sacudido en microondas','Prepara shakshuka, un favorito de Oriente Medio, en solo 10 minutos. Perfecto para el brunch, el almuerzo o la cena, es saludable y una excelente opción para una comida económica.','["1 cucharada de aceite de oliva","200 ml de passata o tomates enlatados, batidos hasta obtener una pasta","1 diente de ajo, finamente picado","1 cucharada colmada de salsa de pimiento rojo (nosotros usamos Gran Luchito) o ¼-½ pimiento rojo, picado","2 huevos medianos","1 cucharada de cilantro picado y pan pita, para servir"]','["Unte un recipiente o plato de microondas con un poco de aceite. Mezcle la passata, el ajo y la salsa y sazone bien. Vierta en el bol y haga un baño en el centro. Rompe el huevo y luego pincha la yema con la punta de un cuchillo afilado.","Cubre el bol con su tapa o film transparente. Cocine en el microondas a temperatura alta durante 1 minuto y luego en ráfagas de 20 segundos hasta que la clara esté firme. Esparza el cilantro y sirva con el pan pita caliente."]','2026-01-11 13:12:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15745,9440,'es','Bocaditos de canela y dátiles','Estos bocados de dátiles y nueces y canela se preparan rápidamente para un refrigerio saludable. También funcionan como capricho después de cenar si tienes amigos cerca.','["3 mitades de nuez","3 dátiles medjool sin hueso","canela molida, al gusto"]','["Corta con cuidado cada mitad de nuez en tres rodajas y luego haz lo mismo con los dátiles. Coloque una rodaja de nuez encima de cada dátil, espolvoree con canela y sirva."]','2026-01-11 13:12:04');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15746,9441,'es','Muesli casero con avena, dátiles y frutos rojos','Lleno de avena, nueces, semillas, dátiles, trigo inflado y bayas, este delicioso muesli para el desayuno te ayudará a comenzar el día de la manera correcta.','["100 g de avena tradicional","12 nueces pecanas, partidas en pedazos","2 cucharadas de semillas de girasol","6 dátiles medjool deshuesados ​​y cortados en trozos","25 g de trigo inflado rico en fibra (nosotros usamos Good Grain)","4 botes de yogur bio de 150ml","300 g de frutos rojos variados, como frambuesas, fresas y arándanos","una pizca generosa de canela molida (opcional)"]','["Vierte la avena en una sartén y caliéntala suavemente, revolviendo frecuentemente hasta que empiece a tostarse. Agregue las nueces y las semillas para que se calienten brevemente, luego viértalas en un tazón grande y revuelva para que se enfríen rápidamente.","Agregue los dátiles y el trigo inflado, mezcle bien hasta que estén bien combinados, luego sirva cubierto con yogur y fruta, y una pizca de canela, si lo desea."]','2026-01-11 13:12:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15747,9442,'es','Shakshuka verde','Regálate un shakshuka diferente. Mezcle sus verduras, huevos y panes planos favoritos para servir con este saludable desayuno de fin de semana.','["3 cucharadas de aceite de oliva","2 puerros, lavados y rebanados","Bolsa de 200 g de espinacas tiernas","250 g de guisantes congelados","2 dientes de ajo gordos, finamente picados","1 cucharada de semillas de comino","paquete pequeño de perejil, picado en trozos grandes","cilantro en paquetes pequeños, picado en trozos grandes","paquete pequeño de menta, hojas recogidas y picadas en trozos grandes, reservando algunas hojas para decorar","8 huevos medianos","150g de yogur natural en bote","1 cucharada de harissa","pan plano, para servir"]','["Calienta el aceite en una sartén amplia y poco profunda a fuego medio. Añade los puerros con una pizca de sal y cocina durante 4 minutos hasta que se ablanden. Agregue puñados de espinacas a la sartén, revolviendo hasta que se ablanden.","Agrega los guisantes, el ajo, el comino, las hierbas y un poco de condimento. Cocine durante unos minutos hasta que huela fragante, luego cree cuatro espacios y rompa dos huevos en cada uno. Tape y cocine por 10 minutos o hasta que las claras estén cuajadas pero las yemas líquidas; seguirán cocinándose un poco a medida que las lleve a la mesa.","Sazone los huevos con sal marina en escamas, eche cucharadas de yogur intercaladas con la harissa y esparza sobre unas hojas de menta. Sirva con un montón de pan plano para sacar."]','2026-01-11 13:12:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15748,9443,'es','Tazón de batido de arcoíris verde','Comience como desea continuar con este tazón de desayuno súper saludable con bayas y aguacate.','["50 g de espinacas","1 aguacate, sin hueso, pelado y cortado a la mitad","1 mango maduro, deshuesado, pelado y cortado en trozos","1 manzana, sin corazón y cortada en trozos","200ml de leche de almendras","1 fruta del dragón, pelada y cortada en trozos iguales","100 g de frutos rojos variados (nosotros utilizamos fresas, frambuesas y arándanos)"]','["Coloque las espinacas, el aguacate, el mango, la manzana y la leche de almendras en una licuadora y mezcle hasta que quede suave y espesa. Divida en dos tazones y cubra con la fruta del dragón y las bayas."]','2026-01-11 13:12:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15749,9413,'es','Impulsores de energía de chocolate y naranja','Solo toma 15 minutos mezclar dátiles, nueces, semillas y avena para preparar este refrigerio lleno de energía, perfecto para llevar en una lonchera.','["100 g de dátiles Medjool deshuesados","100 g de nueces pecanas","50 g de semillas de calabaza","50 g de avena","4 cucharadas de cacao en polvo o cacao sin azúcar","2 cucharadas colmadas de mantequilla de almendras","ralladura y jugo de 1 naranja"]','["Coloca todos los ingredientes y 3 cucharadas de jugo de naranja en un procesador de alimentos. Bate hasta que esté picado y comience a formar grumos. Si está un poco seco, añade una gota más de zumo de naranja. Enrolle la mezcla en bolas del tamaño de una nuez con las manos ligeramente engrasadas. Coloque 2 o 3 en una lonchera como refrigerio. Se conserva en un recipiente cerrado durante 2 semanas en el frigorífico."]','2026-01-11 13:12:05');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15750,9444,'es','Tazón de batido de cúrcuma','Lleno de ingredientes cálidos y nutritivos, este cremoso tazón de desayuno puede estar listo en solo 10 minutos.','["10 cm/4 pulgadas de cúrcuma fresca o 2 cucharaditas de cúrcuma molida","3 cucharadas de yogur de leche de coco (nosotros usamos Co Yo), o la crema desnatada de la parte superior de la leche de coco enlatada","50 g de avena sin gluten","1 cucharada de mantequilla de anacardo (o un puñado de anacardos)","2 plátanos, pelados y picados en trozos grandes","½ cucharadita de canela molida","1 cucharada de semillas de chía o nueces picadas, para servir"]','["Pele la raíz de cúrcuma, si la usa, y ralle. Pon todos los ingredientes en una licuadora con 600 ml de agua y licua hasta que quede suave. Servir en un bol con semillas de chía o unas nueces picadas espolvoreadas."]','2026-01-11 13:12:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15751,9445,'es','Pan de dátiles e higos','Un pan de masa madre repleto de fruta y sabor: se hornea en solo 20 minutos','["400 g de harina integral","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","300ml de agua","175 g de harina integral","400 g de harina blanca fuerte","2 cucharaditas de sal","7 g de levadura de acción rápida en sobre","140 g de mantequilla, derretida","1 cucharada de melaza","225ml de agua","200 g de higos, picados en trozos grandes","100 g de dátiles, picados en trozos grandes"]','["Mezcle los ingredientes iniciales en un bol. Desmoldar y amasar durante 10 minutos. Colocar en un bol ligeramente engrasado y dejar reposar durante la noche en el frigorífico.","Para hacer la segunda masa, mezcle las harinas restantes, la sal y la levadura en un bol grande. Hacer un hueco en el centro, mezclar la mantequilla y la melaza, luego verter los ingredientes secos junto con casi toda el agua. Si la masa parece un poco dura, agrega el resto del agua. Colóquelo sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada. Amasar la masa madre y amasar durante 10 minutos. Poner la masa en un bol ligeramente engrasado y dejar reposar durante 1 hora hasta que doble su tamaño.","Colóquelo sobre una superficie de trabajo ligeramente enharinada. Presione la masa hasta formar un rectángulo de unos 2,5 cm de grosor y espolvoree sobre los higos y los dátiles, luego enrolle como un panecillo suizo y amase para combinar uniformemente. Cortar en 20 trozos y darles forma de rollos. Dejar reposar durante 1 hora hasta que duplique su tamaño. Caliente el horno a 220 C/ventilador 200 C/gas 7. Hornee durante 18-20 minutos, hasta que los panecillos suenen huecos al golpearlos por debajo. Dejar enfriar sobre una rejilla."]','2026-01-11 13:12:06');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15752,9446,'es','Cuadritos de dátil y manzana','Una bandeja masticable de avena horneada con dátiles pegajosos y manzanas que seguramente será un gran éxito.','["225 g de mantequilla, más un poco más para engrasar","140 g de manzanas para cocinar, peladas, sin corazón y picadas","140 g de dátiles deshuesados, picados","280 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","175 g de harina común","1 cucharadita de bicarbonato de sodio","100 g de gachas de avena"]','["Calentar el horno a 190C/170C ventilador/gas 5.\r\nEngrasar un molde cuadrado de 18 cm y forrar\r\ncon papel para hornear.","Coloca las manzanas en una sartén con 2 cucharadas.\r\nagua. Llevar a ebullición y cocinar a fuego lento.\r\na fuego lento durante 5 minutos hasta que estén tiernos y ligeramente pulposos. Añadimos los dátiles y 50g de\r\nel azúcar y cocinar 5 minutos más.\r\nRetirar del fuego y romper las manzanas.\r\nhacia abajo con el dorso de una cuchara hasta\r\nsuave y bien mezclado con el\r\nfechas. Dejar de lado.","Derrita suavemente la mantequilla en un\r\ncacerola. Mezclar la harina, el bicarbonato,\r\navena y el azúcar restante en un\r\ncuenco. Vierta la mantequilla derretida\r\ny revuelva bien hasta que la avena esté cubierta.","Presiona firmemente la mitad de la mezcla.\r\nen la lata, esparcir la manzana\r\nmezclar encima y alisar.\r\nCubrir con la avena restante.\r\nmezcla y presione hacia abajo. hornear\r\ndurante 30-35 minutos hasta que esté dorado y\r\nfirme. Dejar enfriar en la lata antes\r\ncortando en cuadrados."]','2026-01-11 13:12:07');
INSERT INTO recipe_translations VALUES(15753,9447,'es','Bollos de dátiles pegajosos','Cuanto más tiempo permanezca en el frigorífico la masa de este pan de frutas dulces, mejor será su sabor, perfecto con una taza de té.','["1 cucharadita de azúcar en polvo","2 sobres de 7 g de levadura seca de acción rápida","600 g de harina 00, harina bizcocha o harina común, más un extra para espolvorear","400 ml de leche tibia","200 g de mantequilla, 50 g derretida, el resto muy suave","1 huevo grande, batido con un tenedor","200 g de dátiles","250 g de azúcar moreno suave y ligero","azúcar glas, para espolvorear (opcional)"]','["Hasta 3 días antes de que quieras hornear,\r\nmezclar el azúcar en polvo, la levadura, 400 g de\r\nharina y 1 cucharadita de sal en un tazón grande. batir\r\njuntos la leche, la mantequilla derretida y\r\nhuevo, luego verter en los ingredientes secos y\r\nmezclar con una cuchara de madera. Cubrir con\r\nfilm transparente con mantequilla y guardar en el frigorífico.\r\nal menos durante la noche o hasta por 3 días.","Cuando estés listo para hacer los bollos,\r\nponer los dátiles en un bol y verter por encima\r\nsuficiente agua hirviendo para cubrir. salir\r\ndejar en remojo durante 15-20 minutos. Escurrir, secar\r\npiedra y picar.","Mezcle la harina restante con la masa.\r\nUsa tus manos para traer la masa.\r\njuntos, luego inclínelos hacia un\r\nsuperficie enharinada y amasar ligeramente. rodar\r\ncon un poco más de harina hasta obtener una masa grande\r\nrectángulo, de unos 50 x 30 cm, con uno de\r\nlos lados cortos que miran hacia usted. Extender sobre\r\ntres cuartos de la mantequilla blanda, luego\r\nespolvorear sobre las tres cuartas partes del marrón\r\nazúcar. Dobla el tercio inferior de la masa.\r\narriba y por encima del tercio medio, luego el\r\ntercio superior hacia abajo sobre los otros dos.","Calentar el horno a 180C/160C ventilador/gas 4.\r\nGire la masa 90 grados, o un\r\ncuarto de vuelta en una dirección. Extiéndalo nuevamente para\r\nun rectángulo de tamaño similar al anterior, esto\r\nvez con uno de los bordes largos mirando\r\nusted. Distribuya sobre todo menos 1 cucharadita colmada de\r\nla mantequilla restante, esparcirla sobre el\r\nresto del azúcar moreno y espolvorear\r\nlas fechas. Enrollar bien como un panecillo suizo.\r\ndesde uno de los bordes largos. Recortar los extremos\r\nun poquito y cortar en 12 trozos más o menos iguales\r\nporciones. Unte ligeramente con mantequilla los agujeros de un\r\nmolde para muffins con la mantequilla reservada, luego\r\nEmpuje un rollo, con el lado cortado hacia arriba, en cada agujero.","Hornee durante 50 minutos hasta que esté dorado y levado.\r\nRetirar del molde mientras esté caliente, para que\r\nno te quedes. Espolvoree la parte superior con azúcar glas, si\r\nque quieras, o sírvelo con el fondo pegajoso hacia arriba."]','2026-01-11 13:12:07');
